{"item_id": "B00AOD3OVU", "title": "Emperia Women's Boho Bag with Luxury Hardware Rings", "description": "With Realtree, you won't find a more effective, more versatile family of camouflage patterns anywhere. For the busy outdoorsy woman on the go, this bag is a must have. This eye-catching, large sized shoulder bag is masterfully designed to hold all your daily essentials, plus more. The spacious, fully lined main compartment is subdivided into two spaces with the center divider designed as a fabulously large zippered pocket. The left interior wall sports two slip pockets perfect for your cell phone or keys and the right wall contains another large zippered pocket with matching detailed faux leather accents. The sturdy 24\" faux leather strap is enhanced by trendy, fashion forward, nickel hardware. Whether you're running errands in town or trekking through the wilderness, this trendy camouflage boho bag will get you there in style.", "text": "Emperia Women's Boho Bag with Luxury Hardware Rings With Realtree, you won't find a more effective, more versatile family of camouflage patterns anywhere. For the busy outdoorsy woman on the go, this bag is a must have. This eye-catching, large sized shoulder bag is masterfully designed to hold all your daily essentials, plus more. The spacious, fully lined main compartment is subdivided into two spaces with the center divider designed as a fabulously large zippered pocket. The left interior wall sports two slip pockets perfect for your cell phone or keys and the right wall contains another large zippered pocket with matching detailed faux leather accents. The sturdy 24\" faux leather strap is enhanced by trendy, fashion forward, nickel hardware. Whether you're running errands in town or trekking through the wilderness, this trendy camouflage boho bag will get you there in style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416UfryfjIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00AOD3OVU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Handbags & Wallets", "Shoulder Bags"]]}}
