{"item_id": "B00B04V3OC", "title": "Lay-n-Go Cosmo Cosmetic Bag (20\", Silver)", "description": "Lay-n-Go COSMO is a cosmetic bag that converts into an easily transportable handled clutch allowing for quick and effortless clean-up of your cosmetics. Cosmetic collections can be easily spread out on a clean, contained, and dry surface. No more dumping your collection onto a towel or having to worry about your cosmetics rolling off the counter and onto the floor. Once you are done, pull the durable drawstring and the cosmetic bag is converted back into a completely sealed soft clutch.", "text": "Lay-n-Go Cosmo Cosmetic Bag (20\", Silver) Lay-n-Go COSMO is a cosmetic bag that converts into an easily transportable handled clutch allowing for quick and effortless clean-up of your cosmetics. Cosmetic collections can be easily spread out on a clean, contained, and dry surface. No more dumping your collection onto a towel or having to worry about your cosmetics rolling off the counter and onto the floor. Once you are done, pull the durable drawstring and the cosmetic bag is converted back into a completely sealed soft clutch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NmiVrtufL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00B04V3OC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lay-n-Go", "categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Luggage & Travel Gear", "Travel Accessories", "Travel Wallets"]], "price": 31.2}}
