{"item_id": "B00BH3FHWK", "title": "Brinks 161-20471 TSA Approved 22mm Luggage Lock Solid Brass, 4-Pack", "description": "As a global leader in security-related products and services, the Brinks name is synonymous with top quality merchandise designed to keep you and your valuables safe. A credit to this tradition, our line of solid brass luggage locks are TSA and Travel Sentry approved. These 20mm locks are constructed with a solid brass body and are enhanced by a chrome plated steel shackle. Airport security can open, inspect and re-secure your baggage without cutting the lock. This product is ideal for all types of luggage, backpacks and briefcases. For ease of travel, our brass luggage locks can be purchased in either a two or a four pack all keyed alike. Lifetime warranty included.", "text": "Brinks 161-20471 TSA Approved 22mm Luggage Lock Solid Brass, 4-Pack As a global leader in security-related products and services, the Brinks name is synonymous with top quality merchandise designed to keep you and your valuables safe. A credit to this tradition, our line of solid brass luggage locks are TSA and Travel Sentry approved. These 20mm locks are constructed with a solid brass body and are enhanced by a chrome plated steel shackle. Airport security can open, inspect and re-secure your baggage without cutting the lock. This product is ideal for all types of luggage, backpacks and briefcases. For ease of travel, our brass luggage locks can be purchased in either a two or a four pack all keyed alike. Lifetime warranty included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qImhHz5rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00BH3FHWK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Luggage & Travel Gear", "Travel Accessories", "Luggage Locks"]], "price": 14.55}}
