{"item_id": "B00BY2ER5W", "title": "Sofia the First Sofia's Transforming Dress", "description": "Look just like Sofia in this magical 2 in 1 Transforming Dress. The removable skirt allows girls to transform from ball gown to ballerina in one easy step to double the playtime fun. Its ruffled sleeves, satin details and sequin and lace detailed bodice will make your little girl feel like a true princess. Dress comes with a free magical lesson card to use in the Talking Magical Amulet, sold separately. Discover a secret princess lesson on each card and collect them all. Ages 3+.", "text": "Sofia the First Sofia's Transforming Dress Look just like Sofia in this magical 2 in 1 Transforming Dress. The removable skirt allows girls to transform from ball gown to ballerina in one easy step to double the playtime fun. Its ruffled sleeves, satin details and sequin and lace detailed bodice will make your little girl feel like a true princess. Dress comes with a free magical lesson card to use in the Talking Magical Amulet, sold separately. Discover a secret princess lesson on each card and collect them all. Ages 3+.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HH8YSPJgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00BY2ER5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sofia the First", "categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Costumes & Accessories", "Costumes", "Kids & Baby", "Girls"]], "price": 23.95}}
