{"item_id": "B00CHS398I", "title": "HDE Adjustable Watch Band & Bracelet Repair Link Pin Remover Tool", "description": "You just found an old watch, but it doesn't fit your wrist. Adjust your watch band yourself with this small, simple watch band repair tool. Quickly and easily remove or add links to make your watch or bracelet fit your wrist. Jewelers are expensive, and fixing your watch strap is something you can do yourself. Get this repair tool, and give your wrist the well-fitted time it deserves.", "text": "HDE Adjustable Watch Band & Bracelet Repair Link Pin Remover Tool You just found an old watch, but it doesn't fit your wrist. Adjust your watch band yourself with this small, simple watch band repair tool. Quickly and easily remove or add links to make your watch or bracelet fit your wrist. Jewelers are expensive, and fixing your watch strap is something you can do yourself. Get this repair tool, and give your wrist the well-fitted time it deserves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QsZ-5dPHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00CHS398I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Watch Accessories", "Repair Tools & Kits"]], "price": 3.75}}
