{"item_id": "B00DQAFYA2", "title": "Under Armour Men's ColdGear® Infrared Tactical Hood", "description": "ColdGear® Infrared uses a soft, thermo-conductive inner coating to absorb and retain your own body heat. Form-fitting balaclava offers full facial protection in extreme cold. Also can be worn with the chin dropped or as a neck gaiter for greater ventilation. ColdGear® Evo fabric delivers ridiculous warmth and superior comfort. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's ColdGear® Infrared Tactical Hood ColdGear® Infrared uses a soft, thermo-conductive inner coating to absorb and retain your own body heat. Form-fitting balaclava offers full facial protection in extreme cold. Also can be worn with the chin dropped or as a neck gaiter for greater ventilation. ColdGear® Evo fabric delivers ridiculous warmth and superior comfort. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uX-cCHkRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00DQAFYA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", "categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Balaclavas"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DQAKARO", "title": "Under Armour Women's Charged Cotton® Ultimate 28\" Legging Extra Small PINKADELIC", "description": "Unique Charged Cotton® construction delivers soft, quick-dry comfort. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat to keep you dry and light. Lightweight, stretch construction improves mobility and maintains shape. Wide waistband delivers superior coverage and comfort. Rise sits just right on your hips for a more flattering fit and feel. Tonal logo on right leg. 28\" inseam. Cotton/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Women's Charged Cotton® Ultimate 28\" Legging Extra Small PINKADELIC Unique Charged Cotton® construction delivers soft, quick-dry comfort. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat to keep you dry and light. Lightweight, stretch construction improves mobility and maintains shape. Wide waistband delivers superior coverage and comfort. Rise sits just right on your hips for a more flattering fit and feel. Tonal logo on right leg. 28\" inseam. Cotton/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aNNVUhNBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00DQAKARO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Leggings"]]}}
