{"item_id": "B00EIDPF6O", "title": "Yvette Women Exercise Adjustable Racerback Wireless Compression Sports Bra", "description": "Sports bra should be form-fitting for the support you need during workout. Please go up a size if you want it slim fit. DO NOT CHOOSE A SMALLER SIZE, unless you want to make it extremely tight.Style No.: 6016Support Level: LowStyling: Compression StylingUnderwire: Wire free (Soft cup)Cup padding: UnpaddedFeaturesColors: Black, White/Grey, Rose/GreyCup Style: 2-ply, SeamedCup Shape: Full CupStrap Type: Non-adjusted, Non-ConvertibleBack Style: Racerback, Pull-onClosure Type: adjustable side bandHow to choose Yvette sports bra?Choose a sports bra according to the sports intensity level. Generally, the larger cup you are (above C cup), the greater level of support you will need.What's my correct bra size?Please refer to the last alternate photo in the product detail page.Step 1: Find your band sizeMeasure snugly and evenly around or just below your existing band. Add 5\" to that measurement and round up to the next even number. This measurement is your band size. If your under bust measures 30.8\", your band size is 36.Step 2: Recheck your band sizeTo double-check your band size, measure around your torso where the front bra straps begin. If this measurement is close to the band size (36), then your measurements are accurate.Step 3: Find your cup sizePlease measure loosely around the fullest part of your bust. Subtract the under bust measurement (30.8\") from the full bust measurement (suppose it is 38.5\") and get the difference (7.7\"), which is your cup size. (4\" to choose A cup, 5\" B cup, 6\" C, 7\" D, 8\" DD, 9\" DDD). From the list, we know your cup size is D (7\" D), so your bra size is 36D (US size).", "text": "Yvette Women Exercise Adjustable Racerback Wireless Compression Sports Bra Sports bra should be form-fitting for the support you need during workout. Please go up a size if you want it slim fit. DO NOT CHOOSE A SMALLER SIZE, unless you want to make it extremely tight.Style No.: 6016Support Level: LowStyling: Compression StylingUnderwire: Wire free (Soft cup)Cup padding: UnpaddedFeaturesColors: Black, White/Grey, Rose/GreyCup Style: 2-ply, SeamedCup Shape: Full CupStrap Type: Non-adjusted, Non-ConvertibleBack Style: Racerback, Pull-onClosure Type: adjustable side bandHow to choose Yvette sports bra?Choose a sports bra according to the sports intensity level. Generally, the larger cup you are (above C cup), the greater level of support you will need.What's my correct bra size?Please refer to the last alternate photo in the product detail page.Step 1: Find your band sizeMeasure snugly and evenly around or just below your existing band. Add 5\" to that measurement and round up to the next even number. This measurement is your band size. If your under bust measures 30.8\", your band size is 36.Step 2: Recheck your band sizeTo double-check your band size, measure around your torso where the front bra straps begin. If this measurement is close to the band size (36), then your measurements are accurate.Step 3: Find your cup sizePlease measure loosely around the fullest part of your bust. Subtract the under bust measurement (30.8\") from the full bust measurement (suppose it is 38.5\") and get the difference (7.7\"), which is your cup size. (4\" to choose A cup, 5\" B cup, 6\" C, 7\" D, 8\" DD, 9\" DDD). From the list, we know your cup size is D (7\" D), so your bra size is 36D (US size).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EgZZvLQwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00EIDPF6O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Lingerie, Sleep & Lounge", "Intimates", "Bras", "Sports Bras"]], "price": 24.9}}
