RY,CUFF WRIST BAND FOR PAIN RELIEF, GOLF, TENNIS, GARDENING, SPORTS ETC. **Free Magnetic Therapy eBook** EARTH-THERAPYTM ELEGANT, HIGH QUALITY, COPPER MAGNETIC THERAPY BRACELET FOR LADIES OR GENTSHELP TO RELIEVE ARTHRITIS PAIN AND IMPROVE WRIST INJURIES. Great pure copper magnetic bracelet suitable for many different uses eg. golf, tennis, gardening etc.SOLID EARTH-THERAPYTM DESIGNMade to very high standards, this copper magnetic therapy contains 6 high strength magnets, which have been encased within the body of the bracelet for protection and maximum therapeutic effect.Six magnets worn close to the wrist, are believed to help increase blood flood to the joints, bringing healing nutrients such as iron and vitamin C, plus help to balance the bio-energy fields in wrist and surrounding tissues.****INCLUDES FREE MAGNETIC THERAPY \"HEAL YOUR PAIN THROUGH MAGNETIC THERAPY\" BY DR TULSI DABHI****INFO ABOUT MAGNETIC THERAPY AND COPPER BANGLES Magnets have been used in Chinese Medicine for thousands of years and are still used today as a first line treatment for many common complaints by practitioners of Traditional Chinese Medicine.For over 100 years magnets have been used in Europe for therapy and many people claim significant pain relief through the use of magnets for healing.Copper has also been used for many years to help with relief from symptoms of arthritis, bursitis, gout, and many other complaints. So the combination of copper and magnets is consider to be the most effective form of bracelet for arthritis.CURRENTLY AVAILABLE AT A SPECIAL PRICE FOR A LIMITED TIME ONLY - LOW STOCKS ORDER NOW TO AVOID DISAPPOINTMENT", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qz%2B30OOgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/clothing/B00F7N8S3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Novelty"]], "price": 19.95}}
