{"item_id": "B0000AQLKM", "title": "Blastmatch Fire Starter-black", "description": "An innovative design for an all-weather fire starter in a functional, lightweight, compact package. Weighs only 2.7 oz. One handed operation makes it easier to put the spark where you need it. Everytime. Use with natural fire tinder or use the Wet Fire Tinder.", "text": "Blastmatch Fire Starter-black An innovative design for an all-weather fire starter in a functional, lightweight, compact package. Weighs only 2.7 oz. One handed operation makes it easier to put the spark where you need it. Everytime. Use with natural fire tinder or use the Wet Fire Tinder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CmHavNdCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AQLKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 19.44}}
