{"item_id": "B0000AUSL0", "title": "Coleman 1/2 - Gallon Jug", "description": "Coleman 1/2 - Gallon Jug! Have a drink! Whether you're at the camp site, playing sports or on a hike, there has to be a way to quench your thirst. And that's where Coleman comes in with this convenient 1/2-Gallon Jug. Features a wide mouch with easy screw on cap and a flip-top spout for sipping and pouring! Plus, it's easy to clean with a stain and odor-resistant liner, and rugged polyethylene exterior. State Color. Get it today! Coleman 1/2-Gallon Jug", "text": "Coleman 1/2 - Gallon Jug Coleman 1/2 - Gallon Jug! Have a drink! Whether you're at the camp site, playing sports or on a hike, there has to be a way to quench your thirst. And that's where Coleman comes in with this convenient 1/2-Gallon Jug. Features a wide mouch with easy screw on cap and a flip-top spout for sipping and pouring! Plus, it's easy to clean with a stain and odor-resistant liner, and rugged polyethylene exterior. State Color. Get it today! Coleman 1/2-Gallon Jug", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zWYR%2BZ7qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AUSL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000AUSMP", "title": "Coghlan's Tri-Pod Grill and Lantern Hanger", "description": "Quick and easy set up on 4 piece shock-corded, galvanized steel legs. The 17-Inch diameter chromed grill adjusts in height. Compact storage. Box is 18 x 18-Inch.", "text": "Coghlan's Tri-Pod Grill and Lantern Hanger Quick and easy set up on 4 piece shock-corded, galvanized steel legs. The 17-Inch diameter chromed grill adjusts in height. Compact storage. Box is 18 x 18-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5107w%2BeGO%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AUSMP.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 19.25}}
