{"item_id": "B0000AV13K", "title": "Baker Fish Mouth Spreader Fishing Tool, 6-Inch", "description": "This 6\" Mouth Spreader is made of genuine hand-drawn galvanized spring steel. It instantly locks fish mouths wide open and makes it safe and easy to remove hooks and lures from smaller sharp-toothed fish like: Pike, Musky, Walleye, Barracuda, Bluefish and more.", "text": "Baker Fish Mouth Spreader Fishing Tool, 6-Inch This 6\" Mouth Spreader is made of genuine hand-drawn galvanized spring steel. It instantly locks fish mouths wide open and makes it safe and easy to remove hooks and lures from smaller sharp-toothed fish like: Pike, Musky, Walleye, Barracuda, Bluefish and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hDUcWR1HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AV13K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Baker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Pliers & Multi-Tools"]], "price": 4.98}}
{"item_id": "B0000AV1HO", "title": "Berkley Trilene XL Smooth Casting Monofilament 110 Yd Spool", "description": "More anglers trust Trilene than any other Monofilament in the U.S. and Canada!", "text": "Berkley Trilene XL Smooth Casting Monofilament 110 Yd Spool More anglers trust Trilene than any other Monofilament in the U.S. and Canada!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510LgwdVBFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AV1HO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000AV1PT", "title": "Berkley Vanish Fluorocarbon 110 Yd Spool", "description": "Easy casting Berkley Vanish has become the top selling fluorocarbon fishing line in the U.S. and Canada. We have been continuously improving the Vanish formula since it was first introduced 10 years ago! This newest Vanish formula has 20% more shock strength than the previous formula – without sacrificing the handling properties that has made Vanish America’s favorite.", "text": "Berkley Vanish Fluorocarbon 110 Yd Spool Easy casting Berkley Vanish has become the top selling fluorocarbon fishing line in the U.S. and Canada. We have been continuously improving the Vanish formula since it was first introduced 10 years ago! This newest Vanish formula has 20% more shock strength than the previous formula – without sacrificing the handling properties that has made Vanish America’s favorite.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-osWlBn4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AV1PT.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000AV1T0", "title": "Berkley Trilene Big Game Monofilament Custom Spool", "description": "More anglers trust Trilene than any other Monofilament in the U.S. and Canada!", "text": "Berkley Trilene Big Game Monofilament Custom Spool More anglers trust Trilene than any other Monofilament in the U.S. and Canada!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gO-ic4oiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AV1T0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVB9Z", "title": "TITLE Glove Dogs", "description": "Breathable cotton flannel shells filled with refined, long lasting cedar chips. Just insert into gloves after each use to help absorb moisture and deodorize. Absorbs all around glove moisture while deodorizing from the inside out. Leaves a fresh, lasting cedar aroma. Gloves not included.", "text": "TITLE Glove Dogs Breathable cotton flannel shells filled with refined, long lasting cedar chips. Just insert into gloves after each use to help absorb moisture and deodorize. Absorbs all around glove moisture while deodorizing from the inside out. Leaves a fresh, lasting cedar aroma. Gloves not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412LTlxfG%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVB9Z.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Title Boxing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVCWM", "title": "Allen Company Super Comfort Saddlecloth 3 Finger Archery Glove", "description": "The leather rolled tip closed end fingers never constrict the shooters finger tips. The short saddlecloth back, and wide elastic design provide less finger fatigue. The wrist strap is closed with an adjustable Hook and Loop closure. The “discoloration” is simply due to the natural color variations of the leather. The product is 100% functional.", "text": "Allen Company Super Comfort Saddlecloth 3 Finger Archery Glove The leather rolled tip closed end fingers never constrict the shooters finger tips. The short saddlecloth back, and wide elastic design provide less finger fatigue. The wrist strap is closed with an adjustable Hook and Loop closure. The “discoloration” is simply due to the natural color variations of the leather. The product is 100% functional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dGsStwUSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVCWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVDAY", "title": "Allen Company Broadhead Hip Quiver for Aluminum or Carbon Arrows (Holds 6 Arrows, Green)", "description": "7046 Features: -Hip quiver.-Realtree APG camo.-Right or left hand.-Arrow clip holds aluminum or carbon shafts.-Made in the USA. Specifications: -Holds 6 arrows. Dimensions: -2\" H x 2\" W x 2\" D, 1 lb.", "text": "Allen Company Broadhead Hip Quiver for Aluminum or Carbon Arrows (Holds 6 Arrows, Green) 7046 Features: -Hip quiver.-Realtree APG camo.-Right or left hand.-Arrow clip holds aluminum or carbon shafts.-Made in the USA. Specifications: -Holds 6 arrows. Dimensions: -2\" H x 2\" W x 2\" D, 1 lb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-O151JAtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVDAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Quivers"]], "price": 16.99}}
