{"item_id": "B0000AVE2U", "title": "Barnett Outdoors Carbon Crossbow 20-Inch Arrows with Field Points (5 Pack)", "description": "These 20-inch, 8.1-ounce arrows feature strong, lightweight carbon shafts with improved wall thickness for added durability. At 13.78 grains per inch, matched with a 100-grain point, these arrows provide optimal accuracy and target penetration. The five-pack of arrows also includes a 24F field point and moon nocks. The arrows are compatible with the following Barnett crossbow models:Ghost 350PenetratorWildcat C-5JackalWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors Carbon Crossbow 20-Inch Arrows with Field Points (5 Pack) These 20-inch, 8.1-ounce arrows feature strong, lightweight carbon shafts with improved wall thickness for added durability. At 13.78 grains per inch, matched with a 100-grain point, these arrows provide optimal accuracy and target penetration. The five-pack of arrows also includes a 24F field point and moon nocks. The arrows are compatible with the following Barnett crossbow models:Ghost 350PenetratorWildcat C-5JackalWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h18lejH8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVE2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 35.73}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVE3W", "title": "Bohning Pro Class Fletching Jig with Straight Clamp", "description": "The Pro Class jig has a quick-set magnetic clamp with larger grips for easy operation. Features simple off-set adjustment & accurate “snap” indexing.", "text": "Bohning Pro Class Fletching Jig with Straight Clamp The Pro Class jig has a quick-set magnetic clamp with larger grips for easy operation. Features simple off-set adjustment & accurate “snap” indexing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ProQYBvQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVE3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bohning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Rigs & Jigs", "Jigs"]], "price": 40.46}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVEIW", "title": "Neet N - 613 Trim Lite Quiver Right Hand", "description": "Neet N - 613 Trim Lite Quiver: BIG VALUE for all your target - shooting needs Perfect for junior shooters. The N-613 Trim Lite Quiver stores your arrows without breaking the bank. Perfect for school or youth shooting programs. 1 1/2\" vinyl body with 3\" opening; Single belt clip design is left and right-hand compatible; Measures 17 1/2\" long. Order Today! Neet N-613 Trim Lite Quiver, Right Hand", "text": "Neet N - 613 Trim Lite Quiver Right Hand Neet N - 613 Trim Lite Quiver: BIG VALUE for all your target - shooting needs Perfect for junior shooters. The N-613 Trim Lite Quiver stores your arrows without breaking the bank. Perfect for school or youth shooting programs. 1 1/2\" vinyl body with 3\" opening; Single belt clip design is left and right-hand compatible; Measures 17 1/2\" long. Order Today! Neet N-613 Trim Lite Quiver, Right Hand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LzVlkm%2B9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVEIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neet", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Quivers"]], "price": 13.59}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVELM", "title": "Hunters Specialties Limb Lights Trailmarker Reflective Twist Ties", "description": "These fluorescent, reflective twist-tie straps wrap or tie easily around small limbs and twigs to serve as trailmarkers. With the aid of a flashlight, Limb Lights can be seen for approximately 100 yards with a full 360 degree radius of reflection. Ideal for bowhunters and gun hunters who want to find their way in the woods. Package contains 36 Reflective Trail Markers One side Red & One side White", "text": "Hunters Specialties Limb Lights Trailmarker Reflective Twist Ties These fluorescent, reflective twist-tie straps wrap or tie easily around small limbs and twigs to serve as trailmarkers. With the aid of a flashlight, Limb Lights can be seen for approximately 100 yards with a full 360 degree radius of reflection. Ideal for bowhunters and gun hunters who want to find their way in the woods. Package contains 36 Reflective Trail Markers One side Red & One side White", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LodY63w6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVELM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVXRY", "title": "Hunter's Specialties Squirrel Call", "description": "Squirrel Call. Imitates fox squirrel, gray squirrel and baby squirrel distress calls. Works in any weather.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties Squirrel Call Squirrel Call. Imitates fox squirrel, gray squirrel and baby squirrel distress calls. Works in any weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LKV0ESkBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVXRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Predator"]], "price": 12.87}}
{"item_id": "B0000AVXWJ", "title": "Team Fitzgerald Inc Deer Dander Scent 4 Oz Spray", "description": "Team Fitzgerald Inc The 1st of its kind.! This cover scent is formulated to make you smell like a deer so you can get those \"close-up\" shots! Use caution this cover scent simulates the actual dander of deer! 4oz. bottle.", "text": "Team Fitzgerald Inc Deer Dander Scent 4 Oz Spray Team Fitzgerald Inc The 1st of its kind.! This cover scent is formulated to make you smell like a deer so you can get those \"close-up\" shots! Use caution this cover scent simulates the actual dander of deer! 4oz. bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E%2BwOcwK9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AVXWJ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fitzgerald Huntng Ent Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 14.25}}
{"item_id": "B0000AW001", "title": "Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers", "description": "When a buck walks through the woods, the one body part that leads his way is his nose. He trusts it and relies on it for his survival. His nose is truly remarkable. It is estimated that a whitetail has more than 60 times the olfactory range of a human. In the right wind conditions, a deer can smell a hunter a mile away. So where do we start with scent elimination? Simply pin Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers onto your hunting clothing or hang them near your stand to effectively mask human scent with a natural cover scent. Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers have a pure concentrated scent that masks odors. The solid scent can't spill, freeze or wash away. The wafers can be pinned to clothing or hung from hunting site. Available in a variety of cover scents. 3 wafers per resealable container which revitalizes wafers after use.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers When a buck walks through the woods, the one body part that leads his way is his nose. He trusts it and relies on it for his survival. His nose is truly remarkable. It is estimated that a whitetail has more than 60 times the olfactory range of a human. In the right wind conditions, a deer can smell a hunter a mile away. So where do we start with scent elimination? Simply pin Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers onto your hunting clothing or hang them near your stand to effectively mask human scent with a natural cover scent. Hunter's Specialties Fresh Earth Scent Wafers have a pure concentrated scent that masks odors. The solid scent can't spill, freeze or wash away. The wafers can be pinned to clothing or hung from hunting site. Available in a variety of cover scents. 3 wafers per resealable container which revitalizes wafers after use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EHFGo0mhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AW001.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scent Eliminators"]], "price": 9.21}}
{"item_id": "B0000AW09Q", "title": "Hunters Specialties 5 Color Military Woodland Makeup Kit", "description": "Camo-Compac 5 Color Military Woodland Makeup Kit. Compact case with mirror and 5 High Temp Stability Camo Colors: mud brown, flat black, leaf green, forest green, bark gray. Blistered.", "text": "Hunters Specialties 5 Color Military Woodland Makeup Kit Camo-Compac 5 Color Military Woodland Makeup Kit. Compact case with mirror and 5 High Temp Stability Camo Colors: mud brown, flat black, leaf green, forest green, bark gray. Blistered.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413o22AxryL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AW09Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 7.88}}
