{"item_id": "B0000AY1W1", "title": "", "description": "303 Aerospace Protectant was originally engineered for aerospace and aviation applications, it’s a premium surface treatment that instantly beautifies and provides superior protection against harmful UV rays. Great for use on colored gel-coat fiberglass, inflatable boats, vinyl, clear vinyl (isinglass) windows, rubber plastics and leather. Easy to use, spray-on and wipe dry. Treated surfaces repel dirt, soiling, staining, water spots, salt water and mildew.", "text": "303 Aerospace Protectant was originally engineered for aerospace and aviation applications, it’s a premium surface treatment that instantly beautifies and provides superior protection against harmful UV rays. Great for use on colored gel-coat fiberglass, inflatable boats, vinyl, clear vinyl (isinglass) windows, rubber plastics and leather. Easy to use, spray-on and wipe dry. Treated surfaces repel dirt, soiling, staining, water spots, salt water and mildew.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NFWESYqmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AY1W1.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Hardware"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop"]], "price": 39.19}}
{"item_id": "B0000AY1W7", "title": "", "description": "303 High Tech Fabric Guard is a premium patented formula that restores fabrics lost water and stain repellency. Proven bets to protect textiles against soiling, water-based and oil-based stains. On outdoor fabrics the best choice to stop leaks and to create and maintain enduring water repellency. For all indoor and outdoor fabrics; carpeting, upholstery, marine canvas, fabric convertible tops, tents, breathable rainwear, hiking boots, fine garments including wool, silk and suede.", "text": "303 High Tech Fabric Guard is a premium patented formula that restores fabrics lost water and stain repellency. Proven bets to protect textiles against soiling, water-based and oil-based stains. On outdoor fabrics the best choice to stop leaks and to create and maintain enduring water repellency. For all indoor and outdoor fabrics; carpeting, upholstery, marine canvas, fabric convertible tops, tents, breathable rainwear, hiking boots, fine garments including wool, silk and suede.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b70tqYl-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AY1W7.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Hardware"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000AY38R", "title": "Mister Twister 120V Electric Knife (Green/Yellow)", "description": "The Mister Twister Electric Knife 110V Mister Twister-1201 30-Percent has more power. Features 50-Percent more cutting torque and heavy-duty gears and bearings with a relaxed hand design.", "text": "Mister Twister 120V Electric Knife (Green/Yellow) The Mister Twister Electric Knife 110V Mister Twister-1201 30-Percent has more power. Features 50-Percent more cutting torque and heavy-duty gears and bearings with a relaxed hand design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jKrdSzE2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AY38R.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mister Twister", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Knives"]], "price": 25.5}}
