{"item_id": "B0000AY8MI", "title": "Kwik Tek A-1 PWC Sand Anchor", "description": "PWC Sand Anchor & Buoy - A sand anchor is ideal for anchoring PWCs in shallow water to keep the impeller off the beach. Fill this super durable tri-laminate anchor bag with up to 35 pounds of rocks or sand. A buoy marks the anchor’s location. Tie-ups are easy with the 6-foot long rope and the oversized finish-friendly acetyl snap hook.", "text": "Kwik Tek A-1 PWC Sand Anchor PWC Sand Anchor & Buoy - A sand anchor is ideal for anchoring PWCs in shallow water to keep the impeller off the beach. Fill this super durable tri-laminate anchor bag with up to 35 pounds of rocks or sand. A buoy marks the anchor’s location. Tie-ups are easy with the 6-foot long rope and the oversized finish-friendly acetyl snap hook.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F-LRwHRqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AY8MI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Anchors"]], "price": 18.86}}
{"item_id": "B0000AY9W6", "title": "", "description": "Camco's RV Wheel Chock is designed to keep your trailer in place so that you can re-hitch with confidence. It is constructed of durable hard plastic with UV inhibitors and is easy as well as effective to use.", "text": "Camco's RV Wheel Chock is designed to keep your trailer in place so that you can re-hitch with confidence. It is constructed of durable hard plastic with UV inhibitors and is easy as well as effective to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iVmK1QqaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000AY9W6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "RV Parts & Accessories", "Leveling & Stablilization", "Chocks & Blocks"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories"]], "price": 37.66}}
