{"item_id": "B0000BY92W", "title": "Champion Sports Heavy Duty Nylon Lanyard - Bulk Pack of 12", "description": "Securely fasten your whistle or name badge with the Champion Sports Heavy Duty Nylon Lanyard. Great for keeping your items close and secure, these lanyards feature a metal J-hook for quick and easy attachment. Choose from a pack of assorted colors or separate color packs available in black, blue, gold, green, red, or white.", "text": "Champion Sports Heavy Duty Nylon Lanyard - Bulk Pack of 12 Securely fasten your whistle or name badge with the Champion Sports Heavy Duty Nylon Lanyard. Great for keeping your items close and secure, these lanyards feature a metal J-hook for quick and easy attachment. Choose from a pack of assorted colors or separate color packs available in black, blue, gold, green, red, or white.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PB21QHCNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000BY92W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 6.84}}
{"item_id": "B0000BYE9Q", "title": "3M AO Safety/3M Tekk 95190 Woodworker's Respirator", "description": "The AOSafety woodworker's respirator weighs less than five ounces and features a soft rubber face piece with two exhalation valves to make breathing comfortable and easy. Ideal for woodworking projects, this mask is also recommended for protection when working with plastic, metal, fiberglass, or drywall. The N95 filters are easy to clean and disassemble, making filter replacement a snap.", "text": "3M AO Safety/3M Tekk 95190 Woodworker's Respirator The AOSafety woodworker's respirator weighs less than five ounces and features a soft rubber face piece with two exhalation valves to make breathing comfortable and easy. Ideal for woodworking projects, this mask is also recommended for protection when working with plastic, metal, fiberglass, or drywall. The N95 filters are easy to clean and disassemble, making filter replacement a snap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413AXKH7DFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000BYE9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 23.74}}
