{"item_id": "B0000C1CM9", "title": "HKS 10-A Revolver Speedloader for S&W 10,12,13,14,15,19,64,66,67/Taurus 606, 65, 66, 80, 82", "description": "\"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 10, 12, 13, 14, 15, 19, 64, 65, 66, 67; Dan Wesson/Charter Arms/Taurus 606, 65, 66, 80, 82; Rossi 971, 951, 851, 351", "text": "HKS 10-A Revolver Speedloader for S&W 10,12,13,14,15,19,64,66,67/Taurus 606, 65, 66, 80, 82 \"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 10, 12, 13, 14, 15, 19, 64, 65, 66, 67; Dan Wesson/Charter Arms/Taurus 606, 65, 66, 80, 82; Rossi 971, 951, 851, 351", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Kiw2geuzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C1CM9.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 8.52}}
