{"item_id": "B0000C1CMF", "title": "HKS Cordura Double Speedloader Case", "description": "The HKS Black Double Speedloader Case is made of cordura nylon. Perfect for the competitive shooter the HKS Double Speedloader Case can carry the ammunition you need comfortably and conveniently. Lightweight, durable and compact the HKS Double Speedloader Case fits 2 speedloaders of all sizes. The HKS Double Speedloader Case is able to carry your needed rounds while performing in the competitive arena leaving your hands free to concentrate on the task at hand. The HKS Double Speedloader Case has velcro closures to secure your rounds and the HKS Cordura Double Speedloader Case attaches securely to your belt", "text": "HKS Cordura Double Speedloader Case The HKS Black Double Speedloader Case is made of cordura nylon. Perfect for the competitive shooter the HKS Double Speedloader Case can carry the ammunition you need comfortably and conveniently. Lightweight, durable and compact the HKS Double Speedloader Case fits 2 speedloaders of all sizes. The HKS Double Speedloader Case is able to carry your needed rounds while performing in the competitive arena leaving your hands free to concentrate on the task at hand. The HKS Double Speedloader Case has velcro closures to secure your rounds and the HKS Cordura Double Speedloader Case attaches securely to your belt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4153pUV94WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C1CMF.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 11.64}}
