{"item_id": "B0000C1COV", "title": "Tipton 13 Piece Rifle Brass Jag Set", "description": "These 13 solid brass cleainig jags are the fastest way to thoroughly clean, dry, or oil the bore. Each jag is designed to provide a tight fit between the patch and the bore, ensuring optimal performance. Made With industry standard 8/32 threads (5/40 threads on .17 cal) they will fit most brands of cleaning rods and should provide years of service. Kit includes 17, 22, 243/6.5mm, 270/7mm, 30, 338/8mm, 35/9mm, 375, 40, 44, and 45 caliber jags.", "text": "Tipton 13 Piece Rifle Brass Jag Set These 13 solid brass cleainig jags are the fastest way to thoroughly clean, dry, or oil the bore. Each jag is designed to provide a tight fit between the patch and the bore, ensuring optimal performance. Made With industry standard 8/32 threads (5/40 threads on .17 cal) they will fit most brands of cleaning rods and should provide years of service. Kit includes 17, 22, 243/6.5mm, 270/7mm, 30, 338/8mm, 35/9mm, 375, 40, 44, and 45 caliber jags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jcxJpR2DL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C1COV.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Jags"]], "price": 10.51}}
{"item_id": "B0000C1D27", "title": "HKS 943 Adjustable Single Stack Magazine Speedloader", "description": "The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads single stack magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "text": "HKS 943 Adjustable Single Stack Magazine Speedloader The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads single stack magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ri3KQGlFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C1D27.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 11.81}}
{"item_id": "B0000C1DY4", "title": "HKS 22-HR Revolver Speedloader for H&R 9 shot, Taurus 94", "description": "\"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits H&R; 9 shot, Taurus 94", "text": "HKS 22-HR Revolver Speedloader for H&R 9 shot, Taurus 94 \"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits H&R; 9 shot, Taurus 94", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414oW2y3BNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C1DY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 10.29}}
{"item_id": "B0000C4LOU", "title": "Olympic Style Jump Rope, 8'(yellow & white)", "description": "The CSI Cannon Sports Olympic 8 foot jump rope is constructed of diamond braided nylon rope protected with break resistant plastic link sections and handles to increase the life-span of the jumprope. Each of our CSI Olympic jump ropes are color coded for easy identification when pulling them out of gym bags or bags filled with multiple jump ropes. The color codes also are to distinguish the different lengths or the jump ropes. yellow/White, 8'.", "text": "Olympic Style Jump Rope, 8'(yellow & white) The CSI Cannon Sports Olympic 8 foot jump rope is constructed of diamond braided nylon rope protected with break resistant plastic link sections and handles to increase the life-span of the jumprope. Each of our CSI Olympic jump ropes are color coded for easy identification when pulling them out of gym bags or bags filled with multiple jump ropes. The color codes also are to distinguish the different lengths or the jump ropes. yellow/White, 8'.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zECUwcHqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C4LOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Balego USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 6.67}}
{"item_id": "B0000C4LP8", "title": "Mikasa Playground Ball", "description": "(Requires inflation) High quality playground balls for the ultimate in durability and soft feel. Heavy composition rubber cover - latex free - with durable 2-ply bladder. Balanced for better bounce and handling characteristics. Stippled covers with ozone protection. Ideal for four square, dodgeball, kickball and other playground games!", "text": "Mikasa Playground Ball (Requires inflation) High quality playground balls for the ultimate in durability and soft feel. Heavy composition rubber cover - latex free - with durable 2-ply bladder. Balanced for better bounce and handling characteristics. Stippled covers with ozone protection. Ideal for four square, dodgeball, kickball and other playground games!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mDDUD%2BFaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C4LP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Balls", "Dodgeballs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50BR", "title": "Birchwood Casey Super Double Mag .44 Action Spinner", "description": "The Super Mag targets are popular, two-disc spinning targets for the “big bore” pistol shooters. The Super Mag has large circles for an easier-to-hit target from long range, and uses 3/8\" thick steel.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Super Double Mag .44 Action Spinner The Super Mag targets are popular, two-disc spinning targets for the “big bore” pistol shooters. The Super Mag has large circles for an easier-to-hit target from long range, and uses 3/8\" thick steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x0RzrFqFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50BR.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 37.76}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50CS", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care One Piece 33-Inch Cleaning Rod (.22-.45 Caliber)", "description": "33” Saf-T-Clad rod comes with a protective muzzle guard and coated patch holder. This non-segmented, economical rod can be used to clean .22-.45 caliber rifles.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care One Piece 33-Inch Cleaning Rod (.22-.45 Caliber) 33” Saf-T-Clad rod comes with a protective muzzle guard and coated patch holder. This non-segmented, economical rod can be used to clean .22-.45 caliber rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21An1Q1HkKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50CS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 19.35}}
