{"item_id": "B0000C50HL", "title": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Patch for .22 - .270 Caliber , 500 Pack, Poly Bag", "description": "Hoppes Bore Gun Cleaning Patches on sale and available from our online store. OpticsPlanet, Inc is an Authorized US Distributor for Hoppe's 9 Cleaning Accessories and Kits. Available Hoppes Gun Cleaning Patches: Hoppes 1201 - Gun Cleaning Patches No. 1 Small Bore (60 per pack)", "text": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Patch for .22 - .270 Caliber , 500 Pack, Poly Bag Hoppes Bore Gun Cleaning Patches on sale and available from our online store. OpticsPlanet, Inc is an Authorized US Distributor for Hoppe's 9 Cleaning Accessories and Kits. Available Hoppes Gun Cleaning Patches: Hoppes 1201 - Gun Cleaning Patches No. 1 Small Bore (60 per pack)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21rncqrQB-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50HL.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 6.49}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50HM", "title": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Patch for .38 - .45 Caliber 500 Pack, Poly Bag", "description": "Hoppe's 1204S No. 4 Cleaning Patches for .38-.45 Calibers & .410-20 Gauge (500 Pack) Hoppe's 1204S No. 4 Cleaning Patches for .38-.45 Calibers & .410-20 Gauge (500 Pack) Features: Uniformly woven patches Ultra absorbent Pre-cut caliber and gauges", "text": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Patch for .38 - .45 Caliber 500 Pack, Poly Bag Hoppe's 1204S No. 4 Cleaning Patches for .38-.45 Calibers & .410-20 Gauge (500 Pack) Hoppe's 1204S No. 4 Cleaning Patches for .38-.45 Calibers & .410-20 Gauge (500 Pack) Features: Uniformly woven patches Ultra absorbent Pre-cut caliber and gauges", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oCzow%2BopL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50HM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 8.79}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50JY", "title": "Rem Action Cleaner", "description": "Designed to ensure smooth, reliable gun function in all weather conditions, Rem Action Cleaner cleans and degreases firearm actions and fire-control mechanisms without disassembly. Leaving no surface residue behind, Rem Action dissolves used lubricants, including grease and oils, producing a clean, dry surface. Contains no CFC's or Carcinogens. Available in sizes for a variety of applications.SHIPPING RESTRICTIONS:Aerosol items must ship standard ground. Contiguous 48 states only. A physical street address is required for delivery.", "text": "Rem Action Cleaner Designed to ensure smooth, reliable gun function in all weather conditions, Rem Action Cleaner cleans and degreases firearm actions and fire-control mechanisms without disassembly. Leaving no surface residue behind, Rem Action dissolves used lubricants, including grease and oils, producing a clean, dry surface. Contains no CFC's or Carcinogens. Available in sizes for a variety of applications.SHIPPING RESTRICTIONS:Aerosol items must ship standard ground. Contiguous 48 states only. A physical street address is required for delivery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mnnzr23jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50JY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50JZ", "title": "Remington Rem DriLube aerosol (4-Ounce)", "description": "Rem DriLube is a Teflon-based lubricant. This non-staining formula provides superior lubrication keeping your firearms functioning smoothly even in minus 40 degree temperatures. Rem DriLube provides a tough, non-congealing film, which leaves no residue, unlike that of dry graphite lubes. Available in an easy-to-use 4-oz. aerosol can.", "text": "Remington Rem DriLube aerosol (4-Ounce) Rem DriLube is a Teflon-based lubricant. This non-staining formula provides superior lubrication keeping your firearms functioning smoothly even in minus 40 degree temperatures. Rem DriLube provides a tough, non-congealing film, which leaves no residue, unlike that of dry graphite lubes. Available in an easy-to-use 4-oz. aerosol can.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S-XdQyxRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50JZ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 8.81}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50K2", "title": "Rem Oil", "description": "Rem Oil is the most versatile gun oil you can buy. The same great lubricant since 1913, the advanced formula cleans, lubricates and protects your valuable firearms so they'll keep running smoothly and looking like new. Rem Oil penetrates into the smallest metal pores, then leaves a tough, long-lasting film to help reduce metal-to-metal wear. Quickly displaces even microscopic traces of water for advanced moisture resistance and rust protection.Available in sizes for a variety of different applications. Plastic squeeze bottles dispense oil one-drop at a time, especially useful when lubricating small individual parts, aerosol cans help cover larger areas, and wipes are great to pack and carry in the field and can be cut to make handy pore patches.SHIPPING RESTRICTIONS:Aerosol items must ship standard ground. Contiguous 48 states only. A physical street address is required for delivery.", "text": "Rem Oil Rem Oil is the most versatile gun oil you can buy. The same great lubricant since 1913, the advanced formula cleans, lubricates and protects your valuable firearms so they'll keep running smoothly and looking like new. Rem Oil penetrates into the smallest metal pores, then leaves a tough, long-lasting film to help reduce metal-to-metal wear. Quickly displaces even microscopic traces of water for advanced moisture resistance and rust protection.Available in sizes for a variety of different applications. Plastic squeeze bottles dispense oil one-drop at a time, especially useful when lubricating small individual parts, aerosol cans help cover larger areas, and wipes are great to pack and carry in the field and can be cut to make handy pore patches.SHIPPING RESTRICTIONS:Aerosol items must ship standard ground. Contiguous 48 states only. A physical street address is required for delivery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F8crjnrBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50K2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50K3", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Rifle Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber)", "description": "Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your gun is ready for storage.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Rifle Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber) Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your gun is ready for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xc49yiI5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50K3.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50LW", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Remington 870/870 Youth 20-Gauge External Ratchet Cap Set Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Cap Set - QD Remington 870 Black 20 Gauge (External Ratchet)Manufacture ID: 18015Now you can add sling swivels to your favorite pump or auto without altering your shotgun. \"Uncle Mike's\" Magazine Cap Swivel Sets have a factory magazine cap with the swivel base already installed. Just unscrew the factory magazine cap and replace it with the new cap. For the buttstock a 3/4\" wood screw swivel base is included along with two Super Swivels.Includes replacement magazine cap with swivel base 3/4\" wood screw buttstock swivel base and two Super Swivels.Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Remington 870/870 Youth 20-Gauge External Ratchet Cap Set Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Cap Set - QD Remington 870 Black 20 Gauge (External Ratchet)Manufacture ID: 18015Now you can add sling swivels to your favorite pump or auto without altering your shotgun. \"Uncle Mike's\" Magazine Cap Swivel Sets have a factory magazine cap with the swivel base already installed. Just unscrew the factory magazine cap and replace it with the new cap. For the buttstock a 3/4\" wood screw swivel base is included along with two Super Swivels.Includes replacement magazine cap with swivel base 3/4\" wood screw buttstock swivel base and two Super Swivels.Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w6R1og8qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50LW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50M7", "title": "Outdoor Connection Super Sling 2 with Talon Swivels", "description": "The Super-Sling 2+ is 1 1/4\" wide webbing with all the features of the Original Super-Sling. Like the Original 1” version, this one features Rapid One-Hand Adjustment. The innovative Thumb-Loop allows for maximum control of the sling and firearm. The Thumb-Loop also provides comfort by eliminating tight gripping of the sling, which leads to hand and arm fatigue. There is only one sling with the ability to revolutionize the sling market, only one with this unique design, only one Original Super Sling.", "text": "Outdoor Connection Super Sling 2 with Talon Swivels The Super-Sling 2+ is 1 1/4\" wide webbing with all the features of the Original Super-Sling. Like the Original 1” version, this one features Rapid One-Hand Adjustment. The innovative Thumb-Loop allows for maximum control of the sling and firearm. The Thumb-Loop also provides comfort by eliminating tight gripping of the sling, which leads to hand and arm fatigue. There is only one sling with the ability to revolutionize the sling market, only one with this unique design, only one Original Super Sling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GjWVWhgqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50M7.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Creations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 25.04}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50QA", "title": "Butch'S Twill Cleaning Patches (Bag Of 500) (2-1/4-Inch)", "description": "These patches offer superior performance. They hold more liquid and remove fouling faster than ordinary cotton flannel patches. A special fabric used in laboratories and cleanrooms, Triple Twill's special weave has hundreds of tiny \"ridges and drop zones-Inchwhich scrub and capture fouling residues far better than other patches. Butch's Triple Twill patches don't shed lint and have been specially treated for maximum absorbency.", "text": "Butch'S Twill Cleaning Patches (Bag Of 500) (2-1/4-Inch) These patches offer superior performance. They hold more liquid and remove fouling faster than ordinary cotton flannel patches. A special fabric used in laboratories and cleanrooms, Triple Twill's special weave has hundreds of tiny \"ridges and drop zones-Inchwhich scrub and capture fouling residues far better than other patches. Butch's Triple Twill patches don't shed lint and have been specially treated for maximum absorbency.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wKwdjXGCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50QA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butch&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 20.15}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50S8", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Shotgun Bore Cleaner", "description": "Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your shotgun is ready for storage.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Shotgun Bore Cleaner Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your shotgun is ready for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y0TiOvKuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50S8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C50SR", "title": "HKS Plain Double Speedloader Case", "description": "The HKS Speedloader Case is from American Made materials. Perfect for the competitive shooter, the HKS Speedloader Case can carry the ammunition you need comfortably and conveniently. The HKS Speedloader Case is lightweight, durable and compact making it a great companion. The HKS Speedloader Case is able to carry your needed rounds while performing in the competitive arena, leaving your hands free to concentrate on the task at hand. The HKS Double Speedloader Case has velcro fasteners to secure your rounds and the HKS Speedloader Case attaches securely to your belt. You can't go wrong with the HKS Double Speedloader Case", "text": "HKS Plain Double Speedloader Case The HKS Speedloader Case is from American Made materials. Perfect for the competitive shooter, the HKS Speedloader Case can carry the ammunition you need comfortably and conveniently. The HKS Speedloader Case is lightweight, durable and compact making it a great companion. The HKS Speedloader Case is able to carry your needed rounds while performing in the competitive arena, leaving your hands free to concentrate on the task at hand. The HKS Double Speedloader Case has velcro fasteners to secure your rounds and the HKS Speedloader Case attaches securely to your belt. You can't go wrong with the HKS Double Speedloader Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qSS%2BDJs4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C50SR.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]]}}
