{"item_id": "B0000C5154", "title": "Birchwood Casey Complete Gun Finish Kit", "description": "The Deluxe Perma Blue Liquid Gun Blue and Tru-Oil Gun stock Finish Kit is the ultimate kit for making that old favorite look like new again. This complete combination kit includes, 3 ounce Perma Blue Liquid Gun, 3 ounce Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish, 3 ounce Cleaner-Degreaser, 3 Ounce Walnut Stain, 3 Ounce Blue and Rust Remover, 3 Ounce Stock Sheen and Conditioner, Blueing Applicators, Sponge, Service Cloth, Barricade Rust Protection Wipes, and a Complete Instruction guide.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Complete Gun Finish Kit The Deluxe Perma Blue Liquid Gun Blue and Tru-Oil Gun stock Finish Kit is the ultimate kit for making that old favorite look like new again. This complete combination kit includes, 3 ounce Perma Blue Liquid Gun, 3 ounce Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish, 3 ounce Cleaner-Degreaser, 3 Ounce Walnut Stain, 3 Ounce Blue and Rust Remover, 3 Ounce Stock Sheen and Conditioner, Blueing Applicators, Sponge, Service Cloth, Barricade Rust Protection Wipes, and a Complete Instruction guide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a-ck2mB0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C5154.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B0000C515I", "title": "Birchwood Casey Gun Super Blue (3-Ounce)", "description": "Super Blue is a double-strength blueing solution designed for blueing highly polished steel parts and hardened steels containing nickel and chrome alloys (except stainless). Super Blue Extra Strength Gun Blue is the blackest blue. Use caution to confine the solution to the area to be reblued, as it will have an effect on the existing blue.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Gun Super Blue (3-Ounce) Super Blue is a double-strength blueing solution designed for blueing highly polished steel parts and hardened steels containing nickel and chrome alloys (except stainless). Super Blue Extra Strength Gun Blue is the blackest blue. Use caution to confine the solution to the area to be reblued, as it will have an effect on the existing blue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XqWnpnidL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C515I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B0000C517T", "title": "Hoppe's Blister Brass Decorative Hangers", "description": "Hoppe's 9 N1004 Brass Rifle Hangers, 1 pair", "text": "Hoppe's Blister Brass Decorative Hangers Hoppe's 9 N1004 Brass Rifle Hangers, 1 pair", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411PYwkPl5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C517T.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 19.92}}
{"item_id": "B0000C518J", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, 2 Ounce Aerosol", "description": "In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, 2 Ounce Aerosol In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NGmEkGZVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C518J.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 8.17}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51GH", "title": "Birchwood Shoot-N-C Self Adhesive Targets Assorted Bull's Eye Packs", "description": "Birchwood Shoot-N-C Self Adhesive Targets Assorted Bull's Eye Packs are great for close-range shooting with air guns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns. Use the self-adhesive 1, 2 or 3 inch bull's-eye targets to design your own custom target sheet.", "text": "Birchwood Shoot-N-C Self Adhesive Targets Assorted Bull's Eye Packs Birchwood Shoot-N-C Self Adhesive Targets Assorted Bull's Eye Packs are great for close-range shooting with air guns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns. Use the self-adhesive 1, 2 or 3 inch bull's-eye targets to design your own custom target sheet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YL7BwiEvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51GH.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Dog Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51GK", "title": "12\" Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Targets", "description": "Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Stick it! Hit it! See it clearly every time! Revolutionary Targets reveal each bullet hit with a brightly-colored ring! Upon impact, the targets explode in color visible to the naked eye from distance, letting you blast away without having to take a long walk or a long look through a spotting scope after every shot. Simply the easiest way possible of sighting in. They feature 5 targets on each sheet... use the center target for sighting in, and the 4 smaller targets for testing the results. Convenient 1\" numbered grid lines simplify scope adjustments, too. Get yours here and get honed in for the season! Have a blast: Instant feedback no need to walk down range or use spotters to see your shot; Maximum visibility chartreuse on black is easy to see; Perfect for all firearms and calibers; Great for indoor or outdoor use and low-light conditions; Self-adhesive backing lets you set up with ease; Each Target includes pasters that let you patch the Target up, extending its life. Order yours today! 12\" Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Targets", "text": "12\" Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Targets Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Stick it! Hit it! See it clearly every time! Revolutionary Targets reveal each bullet hit with a brightly-colored ring! Upon impact, the targets explode in color visible to the naked eye from distance, letting you blast away without having to take a long walk or a long look through a spotting scope after every shot. Simply the easiest way possible of sighting in. They feature 5 targets on each sheet... use the center target for sighting in, and the 4 smaller targets for testing the results. Convenient 1\" numbered grid lines simplify scope adjustments, too. Get yours here and get honed in for the season! Have a blast: Instant feedback no need to walk down range or use spotters to see your shot; Maximum visibility chartreuse on black is easy to see; Perfect for all firearms and calibers; Great for indoor or outdoor use and low-light conditions; Self-adhesive backing lets you set up with ease; Each Target includes pasters that let you patch the Target up, extending its life. Order yours today! 12\" Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C Self - Adhesive Sight - In Targets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HSQaI5t-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51GK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51K3", "title": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .22 Caliber Rifles", "description": "Tornado BrushRifle - .22 caliber\"The Gunsmith's Brush\" - Special spiral-wound design that is highly effective for cleaning bores - Stainless steel loops eliminate any bristle ends that could leave scratches - Removes fouling without damaging the bore", "text": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .22 Caliber Rifles Tornado BrushRifle - .22 caliber\"The Gunsmith's Brush\" - Special spiral-wound design that is highly effective for cleaning bores - Stainless steel loops eliminate any bristle ends that could leave scratches - Removes fouling without damaging the bore", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419LhEfJgeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51K3.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51OZ", "title": "Blackpowder Products Original Series The Claw Rifle Sling", "description": "The Claw Rifle Sling utilizes the latest in soft touch materials. The durable, non-slip polymer pad is molded directly onto the sling webbing and will allow approximately 1/2\" of stretch.", "text": "Blackpowder Products Original Series The Claw Rifle Sling The Claw Rifle Sling utilizes the latest in soft touch materials. The durable, non-slip polymer pad is molded directly onto the sling webbing and will allow approximately 1/2\" of stretch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oe71dmXqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51OZ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackpowder Products Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 12.83}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51QA", "title": "Champion NRA Paper TQ-3/1 50-yard Single Bullseye Target (Pack of 100)", "description": "Champion offers several official NRA targets on tagboard or paper. They include competition, silhouette, police pistol, training and qualification. Police pistol targets come in 20-50 foot slow fire, timed, and rapid fire. Training targets range from practice to advanced qualification. Champion offers a tremendous array of paper targets to satisfy a wide range of shooting needs. From precision shooting for hunters and competitors to “gee Dad this is fun” plinking with family, these targets breathe new life into this time-honored sport.", "text": "Champion NRA Paper TQ-3/1 50-yard Single Bullseye Target (Pack of 100) Champion offers several official NRA targets on tagboard or paper. They include competition, silhouette, police pistol, training and qualification. Police pistol targets come in 20-50 foot slow fire, timed, and rapid fire. Training targets range from practice to advanced qualification. Champion offers a tremendous array of paper targets to satisfy a wide range of shooting needs. From precision shooting for hunters and competitors to “gee Dad this is fun” plinking with family, these targets breathe new life into this time-honored sport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t0sw14twL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51QA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51QG", "title": "Champion LE B27 Black Police Silhouette Target (Pack of 100)", "description": "When winning or losing comes down to millimeters, be sure to practice with Champion's professional line of targets. Champion's official law enforcement silhouettes and sight-in targets feature a full line of professional grade targets for serious shooters.", "text": "Champion LE B27 Black Police Silhouette Target (Pack of 100) When winning or losing comes down to millimeters, be sure to practice with Champion's professional line of targets. Champion's official law enforcement silhouettes and sight-in targets feature a full line of professional grade targets for serious shooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iFEXPZI7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51QG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51RM", "title": "Lee Precision 9-mm Gauge/Holder", "description": "Lee 9-mm LUGER Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "text": "Lee Precision 9-mm Gauge/Holder Lee 9-mm LUGER Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51druiI5ozL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51RM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 6.23}}
{"item_id": "B0000C51WN", "title": "Kleen-Bore Black Magic 2OZ. (60ML.)", "description": "Kleen-Bore Blk/M Gun Blue 2oz. Premier, High-Performance Cold Bluing Solution, Previously Available Only To Gunsmiths. Produces Deep, Penetrating Action To Restore Worn Or Scratched Gun Metal. Child-Resistant Cap. Easy-To-Follow Instructions.", "text": "Kleen-Bore Black Magic 2OZ. (60ML.) Kleen-Bore Blk/M Gun Blue 2oz. Premier, High-Performance Cold Bluing Solution, Previously Available Only To Gunsmiths. Produces Deep, Penetrating Action To Restore Worn Or Scratched Gun Metal. Child-Resistant Cap. Easy-To-Follow Instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CgT39EL7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C51WN.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B0000C526W", "title": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for 12 Gauge with Aluminum Rod, Box E/F", "description": "Description:Shotgun Cleaning KitsContains Hoppe's No. 9 solvent, lubricating oil, patches, aluminum shotgun rod, slotted end, accessory adapter and brush. In polypropylene storage box or clamshell packaging. *Universal kit does not include brushes.Additional Information:", "text": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for 12 Gauge with Aluminum Rod, Box E/F Description:Shotgun Cleaning KitsContains Hoppe's No. 9 solvent, lubricating oil, patches, aluminum shotgun rod, slotted end, accessory adapter and brush. In polypropylene storage box or clamshell packaging. *Universal kit does not include brushes.Additional Information:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414cwrjnCwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C526W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000C527B", "title": "Classic Handgun Cleaning Kit KB003H", "description": "Kleen-Bore is known worldwide for the highest quality, most innovative gun cleaning products available. We are an authorized Kleen-Bore distributor and offer the complete line of Kleen-Bore products. I've personally selected several of our most popular items. The Classic Handgun Cleaning Kit features some of the best made cleaning components in the industry, neatly nestled into a custom organizer tray and then securely packaged in a rugged, reusable polypropylene storage and carrying case. The Rod in this kit is made of a smooth, high grade steel (for maximum strength) with a black oxide finish and rotating handles. This kit includes a plastic muzzle guard to protect the crown of the barrel during the cleaning process. Also included are 2 oz. Formula 3 Gun Conditioner, double-ended nylon utility gun brush, Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth and 100% cotton patches.", "text": "Classic Handgun Cleaning Kit KB003H Kleen-Bore is known worldwide for the highest quality, most innovative gun cleaning products available. We are an authorized Kleen-Bore distributor and offer the complete line of Kleen-Bore products. I've personally selected several of our most popular items. The Classic Handgun Cleaning Kit features some of the best made cleaning components in the industry, neatly nestled into a custom organizer tray and then securely packaged in a rugged, reusable polypropylene storage and carrying case. The Rod in this kit is made of a smooth, high grade steel (for maximum strength) with a black oxide finish and rotating handles. This kit includes a plastic muzzle guard to protect the crown of the barrel during the cleaning process. Also included are 2 oz. Formula 3 Gun Conditioner, double-ended nylon utility gun brush, Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth and 100% cotton patches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SfxEpYdoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C527B.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C529R", "title": "Shooter's Choice FP-10 LUBRICANT ELITE 4OZ SQZ BTL (FPL04)", "description": "FP-10 Lubricant EliteDramatically increases lubricity between moving parts, with no build-up or changes in tolerance - Used by U.S. Special Forces - Out performs Telfon based products - Protects against metal damage - 4 oz. with applicator spout", "text": "Shooter's Choice FP-10 LUBRICANT ELITE 4OZ SQZ BTL (FPL04) FP-10 Lubricant EliteDramatically increases lubricity between moving parts, with no build-up or changes in tolerance - Used by U.S. Special Forces - Out performs Telfon based products - Protects against metal damage - 4 oz. with applicator spout", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qQUV%2Bn53L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C529R.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooter&#39;s Choice", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.93}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52A5", "title": "Otis Tactical Cleaning System with 6 Brushes", "description": "The Tactical Cleaning System from Otis is engineered to fill the maintenance needs of shooters who use a variety of firearms. This compact system fits in a 4 by 4 by 2.5 inch softcase and is equipped to clean all 0.17 to 0.50 rifles and pistols, shotguns, and in-line muzzleloaders. It has the essential tools to clean rifles 0.17 to 0.50 caliber, handguns 0.17 to 0.50 caliber, 410 to 12/10 gauge shotguns, and all in-line muzzleloaders.Cleaning System Components:Three Memory-Flex cleaning rods with over 750-pound tensile strengthThree forged slotted brass tipsT-handle for added comfort0.5-ounce tube of Otis O85 Ultra Bore cleaner, lubricant, and preservativeAll-caliber cotton cleaning patches for 0.270 caliber and largerSmall caliber patches for 0.17 to 0.223 caliberShotgun brush adapter and rubber Patch Savers to get 360 degree coverage in your shotgun barrelsSix high quality bore brushesBore reflector/flag safety", "text": "Otis Tactical Cleaning System with 6 Brushes The Tactical Cleaning System from Otis is engineered to fill the maintenance needs of shooters who use a variety of firearms. This compact system fits in a 4 by 4 by 2.5 inch softcase and is equipped to clean all 0.17 to 0.50 rifles and pistols, shotguns, and in-line muzzleloaders. It has the essential tools to clean rifles 0.17 to 0.50 caliber, handguns 0.17 to 0.50 caliber, 410 to 12/10 gauge shotguns, and all in-line muzzleloaders.Cleaning System Components:Three Memory-Flex cleaning rods with over 750-pound tensile strengthThree forged slotted brass tipsT-handle for added comfort0.5-ounce tube of Otis O85 Ultra Bore cleaner, lubricant, and preservativeAll-caliber cotton cleaning patches for 0.270 caliber and largerSmall caliber patches for 0.17 to 0.223 caliberShotgun brush adapter and rubber Patch Savers to get 360 degree coverage in your shotgun barrelsSix high quality bore brushesBore reflector/flag safety", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5109tkxw7VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52A5.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 46.9}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52L6", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt HK1BH H&K Compact & USP 9mm/40 & 45, Full Size 9mm/40 / S&W Sigma Series 9/40 VE/E/G / FN49 / Ruger SR9 / Taurus Millenium .40 (Pro models refer to SP11B)", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt HK1BH H&K Compact & USP 9mm/40 & 45, Full Size 9mm/40 / S&W Sigma Series 9/40 VE/E/G / FN49 / Ruger SR9 / Taurus Millenium .40 (Pro models refer to SP11B) Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L9ibTRWSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52L6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52LF", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SW4 Smith & Wesson 4\" L+K Frame / Taurus 660, 431, 65", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SW4 Smith & Wesson 4\" L+K Frame / Taurus 660, 431, 65 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418zZmGqR-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52LF.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.45}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52MN", "title": "DOUBLE MAG POUCH", "description": "Fobus tactical gear, the choice of military and special security services! Custom molded from high-density polymers, these Holsters and Mag Pouches are the ultimate in combat-tested, lightweight (a mere 2 ozs.) comfort, sure retention with easy release, and lifetime-warrantied durability. Low-profile, streamlined, with custom retention. Order yours ONLINE now! State Model. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Roto Paddle Holster or Paddle Holster - word search in our Store for 'Fobus'. Fobus Double Mag Pouch", "text": "DOUBLE MAG POUCH Fobus tactical gear, the choice of military and special security services! Custom molded from high-density polymers, these Holsters and Mag Pouches are the ultimate in combat-tested, lightweight (a mere 2 ozs.) comfort, sure retention with easy release, and lifetime-warrantied durability. Low-profile, streamlined, with custom retention. Order yours ONLINE now! State Model. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Roto Paddle Holster or Paddle Holster - word search in our Store for 'Fobus'. Fobus Double Mag Pouch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412AFPrbxdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52MN.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52MS", "title": "Fobus Paddle 39019 Single Mag Pouch Universal 9mm/40 cal. Double Stack", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, this Fobus mag pouch offers a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. It offers security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, it will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.The term \"double stack\" refers to the way the bullets fit inside the magazine that fits inside the case. In this instance, one double stack magazine fits in this case.", "text": "Fobus Paddle 39019 Single Mag Pouch Universal 9mm/40 cal. Double Stack Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, this Fobus mag pouch offers a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. It offers security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, it will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.The term \"double stack\" refers to the way the bullets fit inside the magazine that fits inside the case. In this instance, one double stack magazine fits in this case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FyEDYoHnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52MS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52P9", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL4 Glock 29/30/39/ 21SF/30SF / S&W 99 / S&W Sigma Series V", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL4 Glock 29/30/39/ 21SF/30SF / S&W 99 / S&W Sigma Series V Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G4CrcSk-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52P9.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.86}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52PI", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster Left Hand Hand Paddle C21LH 1911 Style-All Models / S&W 945", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster Left Hand Hand Paddle C21LH 1911 Style-All Models / S&W 945 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41csuY%2BclTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52PI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.9}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52W8", "title": "Bianchi Tan 5Bh Thumbsnap Holster Fits Ruger Gp100 4In", "description": "This design is a Bianchi classic that is ideal for field and casual concealment of most revolvers. The steel-reinforced thumb snap provides retention while the design of the leading edge protects the adjustable rear sight found on many revolvers. Fits 1.75” belt loop with combination 1.75” and 2.25” loop on 4” and longer barrels. Fits Colt King Cobra, Python 4\", Llama Comanche, Martial 4\", Ruger GP100 4\", S&W; 15, 19, 586, 686 and similar K&L; frame models (4\"), Taurus 66, 80, 82, 83, 669 (4\"), Wesson 15, 715 (4\")", "text": "Bianchi Tan 5Bh Thumbsnap Holster Fits Ruger Gp100 4In This design is a Bianchi classic that is ideal for field and casual concealment of most revolvers. The steel-reinforced thumb snap provides retention while the design of the leading edge protects the adjustable rear sight found on many revolvers. Fits 1.75” belt loop with combination 1.75” and 2.25” loop on 4” and longer barrels. Fits Colt King Cobra, Python 4\", Llama Comanche, Martial 4\", Ruger GP100 4\", S&W; 15, 19, 586, 686 and similar K&L; frame models (4\"), Taurus 66, 80, 82, 83, 669 (4\"), Wesson 15, 715 (4\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41acGn-VlNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52W8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 45.88}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52WG", "title": "Bianchi 5BHL Thumbsnap Holster - Ruger Sp101 3-Inch (Tan)", "description": "This design is a Bianchi classic that is ideal for field and casual concealment of most revolvers. The steel-reinforced thumb snap provides retention while the design of the leading edge protects the adjustable rear sight found on many revolvers. 1.75” belt loop with combination 1.75” and 2.25” loop on 4” and longer barrels.", "text": "Bianchi 5BHL Thumbsnap Holster - Ruger Sp101 3-Inch (Tan) This design is a Bianchi classic that is ideal for field and casual concealment of most revolvers. The steel-reinforced thumb snap provides retention while the design of the leading edge protects the adjustable rear sight found on many revolvers. 1.75” belt loop with combination 1.75” and 2.25” loop on 4” and longer barrels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t4XiTpprL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52WG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi Gun Leather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 62.48}}
{"item_id": "B0000C52YT", "title": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33", "description": "The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O2n-F-k8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C52YT.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.02}}
{"item_id": "B0000C5398", "title": "Birchwood Casey Tru - Oil Gun Stock Finish", "description": "Birchwood Casey Tru - Oil Gun Stock Finish. The professional's choice for more than 30 years... great for furniture, too! Click images to enlarge... 3 ounce 8 ounce 32 ounce Unique blend of linseed and natural oils dries fast and will not cloud, yellow or crack with age and resists water damage. Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish penetrates deeply and forms a tough, clear, hard finish that protects and enhances the beauty of fine woods. For a hand rubbed, satin luster, simply buff with steel wool and rubbing compound. Excellent as a sealer for under butt plates, recoil pads and in inletted actions to prevent stock damage. Use the liquid for fast filling of the pores. 3, 8 or 32-fl. oz. State Size, as available in Shopping Cart below. Order ONLINE Today! Birchwood Casey Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Tru - Oil Gun Stock Finish Birchwood Casey Tru - Oil Gun Stock Finish. The professional's choice for more than 30 years... great for furniture, too! Click images to enlarge... 3 ounce 8 ounce 32 ounce Unique blend of linseed and natural oils dries fast and will not cloud, yellow or crack with age and resists water damage. Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish penetrates deeply and forms a tough, clear, hard finish that protects and enhances the beauty of fine woods. For a hand rubbed, satin luster, simply buff with steel wool and rubbing compound. Excellent as a sealer for under butt plates, recoil pads and in inletted actions to prevent stock damage. Use the liquid for fast filling of the pores. 3, 8 or 32-fl. oz. State Size, as available in Shopping Cart below. Order ONLINE Today! Birchwood Casey Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bsl%2B1DQPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C5398.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53CZ", "title": "Uncle Mike's Black Kodra Nylon Sidekick Vertical Shoulder Holster", "description": "Superior weight distribution, along with ultra-snug firearm retention make Uncle Mike's vertical shoulder holsters ideal for even the most active pursuits.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Black Kodra Nylon Sidekick Vertical Shoulder Holster Superior weight distribution, along with ultra-snug firearm retention make Uncle Mike's vertical shoulder holsters ideal for even the most active pursuits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51T1a2svEZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53CZ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53F6", "title": "Trius One Step Trap", "description": "One easy step cocks & releases target. One person can throw and shoot! The newest member of the TRIUS line, the One Step has become a very popular seller. Whether you enjoy shooting alone or with a group, the TRIUS One Step is almost effortless to use. Arm is set and targets are placed on arm without tension. Step on pedal to put tension on the arm and release targets in one motion. Aluminum arm plus oil impregnated bushings deliver years of trouble-free shooting. Throw regulation singles plus piggyback doubles. High Angle Target Clip Included! Large knobs for adjusting tension and vertical angle make the TRIUS One Step trap fully adjustable without tools", "text": "Trius One Step Trap One easy step cocks & releases target. One person can throw and shoot! The newest member of the TRIUS line, the One Step has become a very popular seller. Whether you enjoy shooting alone or with a group, the TRIUS One Step is almost effortless to use. Arm is set and targets are placed on arm without tension. Step on pedal to put tension on the arm and release targets in one motion. Aluminum arm plus oil impregnated bushings deliver years of trouble-free shooting. Throw regulation singles plus piggyback doubles. High Angle Target Clip Included! Large knobs for adjusting tension and vertical angle make the TRIUS One Step trap fully adjustable without tools", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B2y5UEPdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53F6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trius", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories"]], "price": 88.27}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53FT", "title": "Allen Company Tin Can Scoped Rifle/Gun Case", "description": "“This convenient and durable rifle case features a silkscreen image reminiscent of a bygone era and of backyard plinking. Perfect for smaller rifles and air-rifles, this case features a rugged Endura outer fabric, 7/8” thick padding, smooth Tricot lining, durable and comfortable handles and a strong #5 zipper. The 40-inch case is designed to accommodate rifles with an overall length of 40 inches, and the 43-inch case will accommodate 43-inch rifles. The actual case dimensions are a little longer.”", "text": "Allen Company Tin Can Scoped Rifle/Gun Case “This convenient and durable rifle case features a silkscreen image reminiscent of a bygone era and of backyard plinking. Perfect for smaller rifles and air-rifles, this case features a rugged Endura outer fabric, 7/8” thick padding, smooth Tricot lining, durable and comfortable handles and a strong #5 zipper. The 40-inch case is designed to accommodate rifles with an overall length of 40 inches, and the 43-inch case will accommodate 43-inch rifles. The actual case dimensions are a little longer.”", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jKs2A11xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53FT.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53GH", "title": "Allen Company Shotgun Shell Belt", "description": "The Shotgun Shell Belt from Allen Company keeps up to 25 shotgun shells in easy reach at your waist. The fully adjustable belt provides an ergonomic way to carry heavy shells and fits up to a 52-inch waist size. The belt is designed to accommodate a holster and is easy to open and close with a secure clip.", "text": "Allen Company Shotgun Shell Belt The Shotgun Shell Belt from Allen Company keeps up to 25 shotgun shells in easy reach at your waist. The fully adjustable belt provides an ergonomic way to carry heavy shells and fits up to a 52-inch waist size. The belt is designed to accommodate a holster and is easy to open and close with a secure clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315wrZQfE3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53GH.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 6.56}}
