{"item_id": "B0000C53OJ", "title": "1000-pack Gun Cleaning Patches", "description": "A tale of prison panties and the Green Berets... I'm not kidding! The Green Berets (along with the FBI and many other military and law enforcement groups) swear by these 100% cotton Gun Patches for their $5,000 sniper rifles. They're thicker, more absorbent, more durable, more effective. And many are made from the scraps of Southern Bloomer's \"industrial strength\" women's prison underwear! Talk about recycling! \"Stranger than fiction\"... but truly superior, best-selling quality. State Size. Grab a bunch ONLINE now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: 500-pack Shotgun Cleaning Patches - word search in our Store for 'Cleaning Patches'. 1,000-pack Gun Cleaning Patches", "text": "1000-pack Gun Cleaning Patches A tale of prison panties and the Green Berets... I'm not kidding! The Green Berets (along with the FBI and many other military and law enforcement groups) swear by these 100% cotton Gun Patches for their $5,000 sniper rifles. They're thicker, more absorbent, more durable, more effective. And many are made from the scraps of Southern Bloomer's \"industrial strength\" women's prison underwear! Talk about recycling! \"Stranger than fiction\"... but truly superior, best-selling quality. State Size. Grab a bunch ONLINE now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: 500-pack Shotgun Cleaning Patches - word search in our Store for 'Cleaning Patches'. 1,000-pack Gun Cleaning Patches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b8rStwpFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53OJ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53PM", "title": "Butler Creek Padded Suede Cobra Sling (1-Inch X 36-Inch, Brown)", "description": "Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling. Made with beautifully tanned top - grain cowhide! Chose between a basket weave or plain version... both equally as good-looking and durable! The basketweave model features precise stitching and tooling with a suede, non-slip lining on the upper section. Plain model is unlined. Adjusts up to 36\". Order Now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling, Basketweave - word search in our store for 'Butler Creek'. Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling, Plain", "text": "Butler Creek Padded Suede Cobra Sling (1-Inch X 36-Inch, Brown) Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling. Made with beautifully tanned top - grain cowhide! Chose between a basket weave or plain version... both equally as good-looking and durable! The basketweave model features precise stitching and tooling with a suede, non-slip lining on the upper section. Plain model is unlined. Adjusts up to 36\". Order Now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling, Basketweave - word search in our store for 'Butler Creek'. Butler Creek Cobra Rifle Sling, Plain", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZZkVdVAzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53PM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 31.31}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53QS", "title": "Fobus Roto Holster RH Paddle J357RP Smith & Wesson All 38/357 J Frame, Rossi 88", "description": "Fobus Roto-Holster rotates 360 degrees and adjusts easily for cross-draw, bodyguard/driver, small-of-the-back, and strong-side carries. Our patented locking adjustment allows the firearm either a forward or rearward cant, with our Proven Retention System. The Roto holster is lightweight, with a flexible two-piece design for maximum strength and all-day comfort.", "text": "Fobus Roto Holster RH Paddle J357RP Smith & Wesson All 38/357 J Frame, Rossi 88 Fobus Roto-Holster rotates 360 degrees and adjusts easily for cross-draw, bodyguard/driver, small-of-the-back, and strong-side carries. Our patented locking adjustment allows the firearm either a forward or rearward cant, with our Proven Retention System. The Roto holster is lightweight, with a flexible two-piece design for maximum strength and all-day comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419XYDE3-kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53QS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000C53U9", "title": "Safariland Duty Gear GLOCK 17, 22, 34, 34, Sig P229 Concealment Double Handgun Magazine Pouch (FT Black)", "description": "The Safariland Concealment Double Handgun Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "text": "Safariland Duty Gear GLOCK 17, 22, 34, 34, Sig P229 Concealment Double Handgun Magazine Pouch (FT Black) The Safariland Concealment Double Handgun Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GqGoF92ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C53U9.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland Duty Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000C6BJI", "title": "Champion 24-Inch Bullseye Archery Target (2-pack)", "description": "Refine your archery skills with the Champion Archery Target. Featuring a 24\" bullseye, these targets are perfect for you!", "text": "Champion 24-Inch Bullseye Archery Target (2-pack) Refine your archery skills with the Champion Archery Target. Featuring a 24\" bullseye, these targets are perfect for you!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hdXraM2QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C6BJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.87}}
{"item_id": "B0000C6D7N", "title": "Tiger Claw 7.5 OZ Student Karate Uniform", "description": "This light weight uniform is made of durable 7.5 oz. poly/cotton for a wrinkle free finish. Traditional style wrap around tie top. Pants have an additional double inseam and full gusset and elastic waist with drawstring. White belt is included. WARNING: Get the 7.5 OZ Original Product. The plastic cover has the ORANGE design color. See the product images.", "text": "Tiger Claw 7.5 OZ Student Karate Uniform This light weight uniform is made of durable 7.5 oz. poly/cotton for a wrinkle free finish. Traditional style wrap around tie top. Pants have an additional double inseam and full gusset and elastic waist with drawstring. White belt is included. WARNING: Get the 7.5 OZ Original Product. The plastic cover has the ORANGE design color. See the product images.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pqDdPlPBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C6D7N.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Clothing", "Men"]]}}
