{"item_id": "B0000C83Y4", "title": "Shimano PD-M647 SPD Dual Platform Pedals", "description": "Shimano calls this a racing pedal, and it's easy to see why. The resin cage surrounding the clipless spedal is larger and grippier than the M545/M424 design. The clipless pedal inside the cage is based on the latest Shimano SPD MTB iteration. Making entry easy is the 12. 5-degree angle at which the clipless pedal sticks up from the cage. The result is a pedal that's good at shedding muck and is easy to stand on as well as easy to get in to.", "text": "Shimano PD-M647 SPD Dual Platform Pedals Shimano calls this a racing pedal, and it's easy to see why. The resin cage surrounding the clipless spedal is larger and grippier than the M545/M424 design. The clipless pedal inside the cage is based on the latest Shimano SPD MTB iteration. Making entry easy is the 12. 5-degree angle at which the clipless pedal sticks up from the cage. The result is a pedal that's good at shedding muck and is easy to stand on as well as easy to get in to.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418j7bhs4CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000C83Y4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000CA2QS", "title": "50\" Dragon Bo Staff", "description": "Made out of the finest red oak. Approximately 1 and 1/8\" in diameter and 50\" in length", "text": "50\" Dragon Bo Staff Made out of the finest red oak. Approximately 1 and 1/8\" in diameter and 50\" in length", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H5B2YM83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000CA2QS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tiger Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Bo Staffs"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B0000CA2R6", "title": "Tiger Claw 84\" Waxwood Staff", "description": "Approximately 84'' in length. Our wax wood staff is light and flexible yet strong. The diameter of the staff varies due to the nature of the tree branch and tapered from one end to the other. The thickest bottom has a diameter of approximately 1'' to 1 1/2''. The wax wood staffs are directly imported from China. DISCLAIMER: This is an OVERSIZED item. Due to its size, it can only be shipped by UPS to a physical home or business address. It CANNOT be shipped through the US. Post Office including but not limited to the following addresses: PO Box, APO, FPO.", "text": "Tiger Claw 84\" Waxwood Staff Approximately 84'' in length. Our wax wood staff is light and flexible yet strong. The diameter of the staff varies due to the nature of the tree branch and tapered from one end to the other. The thickest bottom has a diameter of approximately 1'' to 1 1/2''. The wax wood staffs are directly imported from China. DISCLAIMER: This is an OVERSIZED item. Due to its size, it can only be shipped by UPS to a physical home or business address. It CANNOT be shipped through the US. Post Office including but not limited to the following addresses: PO Box, APO, FPO.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/216D7AWW0GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000CA2R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tiger Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Three-Section Staffs"]], "price": 36.95}}
{"item_id": "B0000CA8UW", "title": "Mizuno VS-1 Volleyball Kneepad", "description": "The Mizuno VS-1 Kneepad utilizes VS-1 padding for increased protection, and the DF Cut provides superior fit without the bulk. The VS-1 also features the Mizuno Intercool ventilation system which reduces the heat and humidity build-up inside the kneepad.", "text": "Mizuno VS-1 Volleyball Kneepad The Mizuno VS-1 Kneepad utilizes VS-1 padding for increased protection, and the DF Cut provides superior fit without the bulk. The VS-1 also features the Mizuno Intercool ventilation system which reduces the heat and humidity build-up inside the kneepad.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41INVk%2BzRbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000CA8UW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0000CBIK5", "title": "Custom Accessories 57773 '70 PSI' Deluxe Hand Pump", "description": "The ideal pump for every day use or stowing away in your vehicle. Portable and easy to use. 70 PSI capability with a Cast Iron Base; No Gauge, 1-1/2\" Barrel. Custom Accessories, the leader in Automotive Aftermarket Accessories, is a\"One-Stop-Shop\" for ALL your Automotive needs. From Interior Accessories, Exterior Accessories, Car Care, Steering Wheels Covers, Compasses, Tire Gauges, Air Compressors, Car Organization, Car Comfort, and countless others CUSTOM ACCESSORIES has it all.", "text": "Custom Accessories 57773 '70 PSI' Deluxe Hand Pump The ideal pump for every day use or stowing away in your vehicle. Portable and easy to use. 70 PSI capability with a Cast Iron Base; No Gauge, 1-1/2\" Barrel. Custom Accessories, the leader in Automotive Aftermarket Accessories, is a\"One-Stop-Shop\" for ALL your Automotive needs. From Interior Accessories, Exterior Accessories, Car Care, Steering Wheels Covers, Compasses, Tire Gauges, Air Compressors, Car Organization, Car Comfort, and countless others CUSTOM ACCESSORIES has it all.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t3QUJ9CaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000CBIK5.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Custom Accessories", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 8.79}}
{"item_id": "B0000CDBSJ", "title": "Tiger Claw Feiyue Shoes", "description": "Feiyue Martial Arts shoes have a simple, durable canvas lace-up top and a padded yet light sole. The tread is perfect for all styles, providing maximum traction for ultimate performance. Most of all, you cannot beat the price. You can buy several pairs of Feiyue shoes for the price of a single pair of most other martial arts shoes. And the Feiyue shoes might last just as long, if not longer! Try a pair today. You'll discover why hundreds of thousands of martial artists are choosing to wear Feiyue Martial Arts shoes for their practice! Sizes 31 to 47 (child 1.5 to adult 13)", "text": "Tiger Claw Feiyue Shoes Feiyue Martial Arts shoes have a simple, durable canvas lace-up top and a padded yet light sole. The tread is perfect for all styles, providing maximum traction for ultimate performance. Most of all, you cannot beat the price. You can buy several pairs of Feiyue shoes for the price of a single pair of most other martial arts shoes. And the Feiyue shoes might last just as long, if not longer! Try a pair today. You'll discover why hundreds of thousands of martial artists are choosing to wear Feiyue Martial Arts shoes for their practice! Sizes 31 to 47 (child 1.5 to adult 13)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PpdBr1NDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000CDBSJ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Foot Gear"]]}}
