{"item_id": "B0000E5N4J", "title": "Black Diamond 18mm Nylon Runners (Assorted Colors)", "description": "Black Diamond sewn nylon runners for traditional protection. Get tricky with them. Tie them off on chickenheads, sling trees and chockstones or use them to help reduce rope drag.Weight : [30 cm] 18 g (0.63 oz); [60 cm] 36 g (1.3 oz); [120 cm] 67 g (2.4 oz); Strength : 22 kN (4,946 lbf)", "text": "Black Diamond 18mm Nylon Runners (Assorted Colors) Black Diamond sewn nylon runners for traditional protection. Get tricky with them. Tie them off on chickenheads, sling trees and chockstones or use them to help reduce rope drag.Weight : [30 cm] 18 g (0.63 oz); [60 cm] 36 g (1.3 oz); [120 cm] 67 g (2.4 oz); Strength : 22 kN (4,946 lbf)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-OPQEJ7bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000E5N4J.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
