{"item_id": "B0000WR6W8", "title": "Esbit 1400 Degree Smokeless Solid Fuel Cubes for Backpacking, Camping and Hobby - 20 Pieces Each 4g", "description": "The Esbit 20 x 4 g solid fuel cubes have a burn time of approximately 5 minutes and each box includes 20 cubes. They have a strong heat output, ignite with a match or lighter and lightweight and compact. When stored properly, Esbit solid fuel mantains its full functionality for many years. It works also at temperatures below 32 F and in high altitudes. It is easy to hande and simple technique which cannot fail. It has no visible smoke and leaves almost no ash after burning. It is used by various NATO forces, expeditions, in the afetermath of disasters.", "text": "Esbit 1400 Degree Smokeless Solid Fuel Cubes for Backpacking, Camping and Hobby - 20 Pieces Each 4g The Esbit 20 x 4 g solid fuel cubes have a burn time of approximately 5 minutes and each box includes 20 cubes. They have a strong heat output, ignite with a match or lighter and lightweight and compact. When stored properly, Esbit solid fuel mantains its full functionality for many years. It works also at temperatures below 32 F and in high altitudes. It is easy to hande and simple technique which cannot fail. It has no visible smoke and leaves almost no ash after burning. It is used by various NATO forces, expeditions, in the afetermath of disasters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uUMJ%2BCWIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000WR6W8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Esbit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]], "price": 6.64}}
{"item_id": "B0000WZYF4", "title": "Thule Sidekick Cargo Box", "description": "The Thule Side Kick is the smallest rooftop cargo box that Thule makes. This clamshell style box's shape and size make it perfect for carrying golf clubs and camping gear without monopolizing your roof space. The Side Kick is made of impact resistant polyurethane, and keeps your gear safe and secure with the included locks. The Side Kick will mount to almost any rack system, be it Thule, Yakima, or factory.", "text": "Thule Sidekick Cargo Box The Thule Side Kick is the smallest rooftop cargo box that Thule makes. This clamshell style box's shape and size make it perfect for carrying golf clubs and camping gear without monopolizing your roof space. The Side Kick is made of impact resistant polyurethane, and keeps your gear safe and secure with the included locks. The Side Kick will mount to almost any rack system, be it Thule, Yakima, or factory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311D498CZ5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000WZYF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thule", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Cargo Boxes"]], "price": 299.95}}
