{"item_id": "B0000ZJ510", "title": "Crazy Creek S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3", "description": "If you only get one accessory for your sit-on-top kayak, this is the one to get. The Crazy Creek S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3 is a highbacked, molded seat that clips into your kayak easily with 4 swivel clips and makes your kayak feel more like a lounge than a boat. The adjustable back gets you in the right posture for paddling, and zippered pocket on the back holds a hydration bladder or extra gear. Pimp your sit-on-top out with the S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3.Product FeaturesCountry of origin: Cyprus", "text": "Crazy Creek S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3 If you only get one accessory for your sit-on-top kayak, this is the one to get. The Crazy Creek S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3 is a highbacked, molded seat that clips into your kayak easily with 4 swivel clips and makes your kayak feel more like a lounge than a boat. The adjustable back gets you in the right posture for paddling, and zippered pocket on the back holds a hydration bladder or extra gear. Pimp your sit-on-top out with the S.O.T. Kayak Chair 3.Product FeaturesCountry of origin: Cyprus", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418S3AP81SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0000ZJ510.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crazy Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Cabin Products", "Seating"]], "price": 72.9}}
