{"item_id": "B0001GS19U", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army SwissChamp Pocket Knife", "description": "Sometimes called a toolbox for your pocket, the 3 1/2\" Swiss Champ packs an impressive 33 implements, but is still compact enough to fit in your pocket or purse and can be used anywhere from the great outdoors to anywhere in the home. Note: Some pull out implements have multiple tools or functions 1. large blade 2. small blade 3. corkscrew 4. can opener with 5. small screwdriver 6. cap lifter with- 7. screwdriver 8. wire stipper 9. reamer 10. key ring 11. tweezers 12. scissors 13. toothpick 14. multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier) 15. wood saw 16. fish scaler with 17. hook disgorger 18. ruler (cm + inches) 19. nailfile with 20. metal file 21. nail cleaner 22. metal saw 23. fine screwdriver 24. chisel/scraper 25. pliers with 26. wire crimping tool 27. wire cutters 28. Phillips screwdriver 29. magnifying glass 30. ballpoint pen 31. pin stainless 32. mini-screwdriver 33. sewing eye", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army SwissChamp Pocket Knife Sometimes called a toolbox for your pocket, the 3 1/2\" Swiss Champ packs an impressive 33 implements, but is still compact enough to fit in your pocket or purse and can be used anywhere from the great outdoors to anywhere in the home. Note: Some pull out implements have multiple tools or functions 1. large blade 2. small blade 3. corkscrew 4. can opener with 5. small screwdriver 6. cap lifter with- 7. screwdriver 8. wire stipper 9. reamer 10. key ring 11. tweezers 12. scissors 13. toothpick 14. multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier) 15. wood saw 16. fish scaler with 17. hook disgorger 18. ruler (cm + inches) 19. nailfile with 20. metal file 21. nail cleaner 22. metal saw 23. fine screwdriver 24. chisel/scraper 25. pliers with 26. wire crimping tool 27. wire cutters 28. Phillips screwdriver 29. magnifying glass 30. ballpoint pen 31. pin stainless 32. mini-screwdriver 33. sewing eye", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZjbZIDL%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001GS19U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 71.3}}
{"item_id": "B0001H1ZKG", "title": "Fox 40 Mini Loud Lifeguard Safety Whistle - 9059", "description": "The Fox 40 Mini Lifeguard Safety Whistle - 9059 Black The Fox 40 Mini Lifeguard Safety Whistle is a smaller version of the Fox40 Classic Whistle. The more compact body of the Mini fits into your pocket or purse and is an excellent personal security whistle. Its discreet and yet loud. If you need a compact lighter whistle the Mini is for you. Connect it to a Fox 40 lanyard or a Fox 40 wrist coil for further enhancement and ease of use. There are no moving parts to freeze, jam or deteriorate. A great whistle at a great price that comes into use in many situations. As an example, lifeguards use the Fox 40 Whistle to alert swimmers and sound distress alarms. Coaches in schools use the Fox 40 for many purposes and depend on it working right every time. Connect it to a Fox 40 lanyard or a Fox 40 wrist coil for further enhancement and ease of use. Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - Colors: Black, Red, Yellow, Orange, Royal, Green, White, Purple, Silver, Pink, Neon, Gold. Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - #1 Coaches and Referee whistle on the market. Fox 40 Mini Whistles 9800 - Available with (Breast Cancer Logo!) Please call 1-800-445-8721 to order! Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - Sound Power: 109dB This Fox40 Mini Whistle puts out a loud sound. Click below to hear a sampling.", "text": "Fox 40 Mini Loud Lifeguard Safety Whistle - 9059 The Fox 40 Mini Lifeguard Safety Whistle - 9059 Black The Fox 40 Mini Lifeguard Safety Whistle is a smaller version of the Fox40 Classic Whistle. The more compact body of the Mini fits into your pocket or purse and is an excellent personal security whistle. Its discreet and yet loud. If you need a compact lighter whistle the Mini is for you. Connect it to a Fox 40 lanyard or a Fox 40 wrist coil for further enhancement and ease of use. There are no moving parts to freeze, jam or deteriorate. A great whistle at a great price that comes into use in many situations. As an example, lifeguards use the Fox 40 Whistle to alert swimmers and sound distress alarms. Coaches in schools use the Fox 40 for many purposes and depend on it working right every time. Connect it to a Fox 40 lanyard or a Fox 40 wrist coil for further enhancement and ease of use. Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - Colors: Black, Red, Yellow, Orange, Royal, Green, White, Purple, Silver, Pink, Neon, Gold. Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - #1 Coaches and Referee whistle on the market. Fox 40 Mini Whistles 9800 - Available with (Breast Cancer Logo!) Please call 1-800-445-8721 to order! Fox 40 Mini Whistle 9800 - Sound Power: 109dB This Fox40 Mini Whistle puts out a loud sound. Click below to hear a sampling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TPZCb-JcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001H1ZKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox 40", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 5.71}}
{"item_id": "B0001H2A8W", "title": "Markwort Nickel Plated Whistle and Black Lanyard Combo", "description": "Nickel plated whistle with cork peaPrice shown is for one whistle and lanyard combo", "text": "Markwort Nickel Plated Whistle and Black Lanyard Combo Nickel plated whistle with cork peaPrice shown is for one whistle and lanyard combo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412UqT%2BPNAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001H2A8W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Markwort", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Track & Field", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear"]], "price": 2.88}}
{"item_id": "B0001HABUQ", "title": "Thule 593 Wheel-On Rooftop Bicycle Wheel Carrier", "description": "The Thule 593 Wheel-On Rooftop Bicycle Wheel Carrier is loaded with features to ensure your wheel travels safely to your destination, and is easy to remove when you arrive. The 593 Wheel-On replaces the 545 wheel carrier, and fits all quick-release wheels from 24- to 29-inches in length.The 593 provides you with fast wheel loading and unloading via an easy, drop-in fork design, which also doubles as a wheel security feature. This wheel carrier features a zero-adjustment, anti-spin device, and provides you with maximum versatility with an adjustable carrying angle. The 593 Wheel-On folds down flat when its not in use so it is out of your way, and fits Xsporter, Thule, and Yakima load bars. This unit complements Thule 590 V2, 589 Velo Vise, 591 LT Classic, and 822 Bed Rider fork-mount bike carriers, but user's should note that it does not come with a locking option.What's in the Box?593 wheel carrier assembly, 2 x metal brackets, 4 x knobs, 4 x carriage bolts, and instruction guideManufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "text": "Thule 593 Wheel-On Rooftop Bicycle Wheel Carrier The Thule 593 Wheel-On Rooftop Bicycle Wheel Carrier is loaded with features to ensure your wheel travels safely to your destination, and is easy to remove when you arrive. The 593 Wheel-On replaces the 545 wheel carrier, and fits all quick-release wheels from 24- to 29-inches in length.The 593 provides you with fast wheel loading and unloading via an easy, drop-in fork design, which also doubles as a wheel security feature. This wheel carrier features a zero-adjustment, anti-spin device, and provides you with maximum versatility with an adjustable carrying angle. The 593 Wheel-On folds down flat when its not in use so it is out of your way, and fits Xsporter, Thule, and Yakima load bars. This unit complements Thule 590 V2, 589 Velo Vise, 591 LT Classic, and 822 Bed Rider fork-mount bike carriers, but user's should note that it does not come with a locking option.What's in the Box?593 wheel carrier assembly, 2 x metal brackets, 4 x knobs, 4 x carriage bolts, and instruction guideManufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Kq1gLlp-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001HABUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thule", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 49.49}}
{"item_id": "B0001HACDM", "title": "Thule 599XTR Big Mouth Upright Rooftop Bicycle Carrier", "description": "", "text": "Thule 599XTR Big Mouth Upright Rooftop Bicycle Carrier", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c7lLvhwyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001HACDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thule", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 169.95}}
{"item_id": "B0001IPKRE", "title": "Alpen 20-60x80 Angled Body Waterproof Spotting Scope", "description": "Spotting scope users demand top quality optics that perform flawlessly under all weather conditions. ALPEN Spotting Scopes are nitrogen filled, waterproof, dustproof and shock-resistant. All ALPEN Spotting Scopes feature powerful lenses and come standard with a durable, padded field carrying case (except #788 kit). Most models come with a portable 12'' swivel-head tripod. Alpen Spotting Scope Features: Multi-coated optics Waterproof and nitrogen filled Powerful zoom eyepieces Extendable sun shade Straight and 45-degree models ALPEN's lifetime warranty Nitrogen filled spotting scope. Waterproof and dust proof. Shock-resistant. ALPEN's lifetime warranty.", "text": "Alpen 20-60x80 Angled Body Waterproof Spotting Scope Spotting scope users demand top quality optics that perform flawlessly under all weather conditions. ALPEN Spotting Scopes are nitrogen filled, waterproof, dustproof and shock-resistant. All ALPEN Spotting Scopes feature powerful lenses and come standard with a durable, padded field carrying case (except #788 kit). Most models come with a portable 12'' swivel-head tripod. Alpen Spotting Scope Features: Multi-coated optics Waterproof and nitrogen filled Powerful zoom eyepieces Extendable sun shade Straight and 45-degree models ALPEN's lifetime warranty Nitrogen filled spotting scope. Waterproof and dust proof. Shock-resistant. ALPEN's lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tL54ZhH9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001IPKRE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alpen Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 405.55}}
{"item_id": "B0001M4BRU", "title": "Caldwell Double Spin Center Fire Handgun Swinging Target", "description": "With the Caldwell Plink N' Swing Swinging Target Twin-Spinner, you can see and hear the impact of your bullets. The swingers and frame are made of durable high-carbon steel to provide endless shooting fun. There are no welds in the swinger to break when impacted. Use only lead-nosed bullets and always wear eye and ear protection.", "text": "Caldwell Double Spin Center Fire Handgun Swinging Target With the Caldwell Plink N' Swing Swinging Target Twin-Spinner, you can see and hear the impact of your bullets. The swingers and frame are made of durable high-carbon steel to provide endless shooting fun. There are no welds in the swinger to break when impacted. Use only lead-nosed bullets and always wear eye and ear protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ENdOl%2BFsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001M4BRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 30.16}}
{"item_id": "B0001MQ7EK", "title": "Koolatron P25 26-Quart FunKool Cooler", "description": "The Koolatron P25 Fun Kool is a great solution for the traveller, festive goer or tailgater when they need to keep lots of food and beverages cold for hours. Koolatron P-25 Fun-Kool Thermoelectric Cooler has a 24 litre capacity just plug it into any 12 volt power receptacle. Koolatron Fun Kool cooler plugs right into your 12V car light socket and uses thermoelectric cooling to keep your cans at a temperature up to 40 degrees (Fahrenheit) below ambient levels. This Fun Kool cooler uses absolutely NO ICE or CFCs. This model features a locking flip-up handle for your grab-and-go convenience as well as a storage compartment for the power cord.", "text": "Koolatron P25 26-Quart FunKool Cooler The Koolatron P25 Fun Kool is a great solution for the traveller, festive goer or tailgater when they need to keep lots of food and beverages cold for hours. Koolatron P-25 Fun-Kool Thermoelectric Cooler has a 24 litre capacity just plug it into any 12 volt power receptacle. Koolatron Fun Kool cooler plugs right into your 12V car light socket and uses thermoelectric cooling to keep your cans at a temperature up to 40 degrees (Fahrenheit) below ambient levels. This Fun Kool cooler uses absolutely NO ICE or CFCs. This model features a locking flip-up handle for your grab-and-go convenience as well as a storage compartment for the power cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rVNKHoPLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001MQ7EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Koolatron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 89.95}}
