{"item_id": "B0001P151W", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman Pocket Knife", "description": "Versatile enough to be used around the house as well as in the great outdoors, the Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman Knife is the perfect companion, with its 13 tools and 5-star rating. The 3.5\" Huntsman includes everything the avid outdoorsman and the everyday user needs. Outfitted with blades, scissors and screwdrivers, the Huntsman is a complete pocket tool in a compact design. All Swiss Army Knives carry a lifetime warranty, stainless steel implements and unsurpassed quality and functionality.Corkscrew.Large blade.Small blade.Scissors.Multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier).Can opener with small screwdriver.Key ring.Tweezers.Length: 3.5\"..Width: 1\"..Wt. 3.5 oz..", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman Pocket Knife Versatile enough to be used around the house as well as in the great outdoors, the Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman Knife is the perfect companion, with its 13 tools and 5-star rating. The 3.5\" Huntsman includes everything the avid outdoorsman and the everyday user needs. Outfitted with blades, scissors and screwdrivers, the Huntsman is a complete pocket tool in a compact design. All Swiss Army Knives carry a lifetime warranty, stainless steel implements and unsurpassed quality and functionality.Corkscrew.Large blade.Small blade.Scissors.Multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier).Can opener with small screwdriver.Key ring.Tweezers.Length: 3.5\"..Width: 1\"..Wt. 3.5 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X%2BiTRIeCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001P151W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B0001P158K", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Outrider Multi-Tool", "description": "Features include an ergonomic handle, large locking blade and three screwdrivers making the Outrider the ultimate all-purpose pocket tool. As with all Swiss Army Knives, the Outrider carries a lifetime warranty, stainless steel blades and unsurpassed Swiss-made quality and durability.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Outrider Multi-Tool Features include an ergonomic handle, large locking blade and three screwdrivers making the Outrider the ultimate all-purpose pocket tool. As with all Swiss Army Knives, the Outrider carries a lifetime warranty, stainless steel blades and unsurpassed Swiss-made quality and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419OB8w1ngL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001P158K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B0001P15JY", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Waiter Pocket Knife", "description": "The Victorinox Swiss Army Waiter Knife is designed for waiters, picknicking and wine connoisseurs. Features all the tools needed opening wine and pop-off top bottles or cans.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Waiter Pocket Knife The Victorinox Swiss Army Waiter Knife is designed for waiters, picknicking and wine connoisseurs. Features all the tools needed opening wine and pop-off top bottles or cans.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OPr6g0o6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001P15JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 14.94}}
{"item_id": "B0001UZUW2", "title": "Martin Paul 100-75 Flyshooter The Original Bug Gun, Colors may vary", "description": "Flyshooter The Original Flyshooter Bug Gun \"Take them on the wing or standing still\". Lots of fun and it really works. Convenient use when needed: Camping trips, in the home, or in the car, in fishing boat, and for picnics.", "text": "Martin Paul 100-75 Flyshooter The Original Bug Gun, Colors may vary Flyshooter The Original Flyshooter Bug Gun \"Take them on the wing or standing still\". Lots of fun and it really works. Convenient use when needed: Camping trips, in the home, or in the car, in fishing boat, and for picnics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iD2fPX0KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001UZUW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Martin Paul", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0001VO1YY", "title": "Swagman XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (1/1/4 and 2-Inch Receiver)", "description": "The XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Hitch Mount Rack from Swagman is a versatile hitch-mount rack that can easily accommodate children's and adult bikes, downhill bikes, cruiser bikes, full-suspension bikes, BMX bikes, \"Y\" frame designs, and much more (and without the hassle of removing wheels). The XC slides into a two-inch receiver and carries up to two bikes.Swagman's XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Rack easily adjusts to accommodate a wide variety of bike frames.The XC easily adjusts to different bike frame sizes with the simple movement of the wheel hoops. Its frame grip arms feature a soft, frame-friendly coating to protect your bike's finish. When not in use, the rack folds up for easy storage.Specifications:Capacity: Two bikesMount: 2-inch hitchHitch: Fits Class 3 hitch", "text": "Swagman XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (1/1/4 and 2-Inch Receiver) The XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Hitch Mount Rack from Swagman is a versatile hitch-mount rack that can easily accommodate children's and adult bikes, downhill bikes, cruiser bikes, full-suspension bikes, BMX bikes, \"Y\" frame designs, and much more (and without the hassle of removing wheels). The XC slides into a two-inch receiver and carries up to two bikes.Swagman's XC Cross-Country 2-Bike Rack easily adjusts to accommodate a wide variety of bike frames.The XC easily adjusts to different bike frame sizes with the simple movement of the wheel hoops. Its frame grip arms feature a soft, frame-friendly coating to protect your bike's finish. When not in use, the rack folds up for easy storage.Specifications:Capacity: Two bikesMount: 2-inch hitchHitch: Fits Class 3 hitch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qsokNf%2B2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001VO1YY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swagman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 151.91}}
