{"item_id": "B0001WIU7M", "title": "Protec Adult Helmet", "description": "Pro Tec helmets are a popular choice at the park and on the street. Known for comfort, style, and protection, these classic helmets feature a tough aero-styled ABS shells and CE/CPSC certified EPS foam liners. The helmets come in a variety of sizes for a just right fit and also come with two custom sizing pads for additional adjustments.Pro Tec Helmet Sizing Chart:", "text": "Protec Adult Helmet Pro Tec helmets are a popular choice at the park and on the street. Known for comfort, style, and protection, these classic helmets feature a tough aero-styled ABS shells and CE/CPSC certified EPS foam liners. The helmets come in a variety of sizes for a just right fit and also come with two custom sizing pads for additional adjustments.Pro Tec Helmet Sizing Chart:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QQ9Nd12YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001WIU7M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Helmets"]]}}
