{"item_id": "B0001WP62O", "title": "SureFire 123A Lithium 3V Batteries (2-Pack)", "description": "Almost all SureFire illumination tools are powered by 123A lithium batteries. In fact, we pioneered the use of these compact, lightweight, energy-dense devices in flashlights. We use them instead of standard alkaline batteries because of their many advantages.", "text": "SureFire 123A Lithium 3V Batteries (2-Pack) Almost all SureFire illumination tools are powered by 123A lithium batteries. In fact, we pioneered the use of these compact, lightweight, energy-dense devices in flashlights. We use them instead of standard alkaline batteries because of their many advantages.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HMHKRKq0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0001WP62O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 7.35}}
