{"item_id": "B000214TTU", "title": "Under Armour Men's HeatGear® Compression 7\" Shorts", "description": "Sleek and smooth HeatGear® fabric is lightweight, with a compression fit to keep your game tight. 4-way stretch fabrication improves range of motion, dries faster and maintains shape. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor-causing microbes to keep your gear fresher, longer. 30+ UPF protects your skin from the sun's harmful rays. Smooth flatlock seams prevent chafing. Brushed waistband for a more secure fit. 7\" inseam. Nylon/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's HeatGear® Compression 7\" Shorts Sleek and smooth HeatGear® fabric is lightweight, with a compression fit to keep your game tight. 4-way stretch fabrication improves range of motion, dries faster and maintains shape. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor-causing microbes to keep your gear fresher, longer. 30+ UPF protects your skin from the sun's harmful rays. Smooth flatlock seams prevent chafing. Brushed waistband for a more secure fit. 7\" inseam. Nylon/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417Up5IKweL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000214TTU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
