{"item_id": "B00022KIYY", "title": "Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag", "description": "Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag. Make \"B.O.B.\" your at-home training partner: Lifelike mannequin Body Opponent Bag fits on adjustable Wavemaster base (included); Skin is made of high-strength plastisol; Inner cavity is filled with durable urethane foam; 7 height adjustments from 5' to 6'6\"; Base can be filled with water or sand for stability; Approx. 270 lbs. when filled; Made in the U.S.A. Give \"B.O.B.\" the 1-2 punch for a solid at-home workout! Order Today! Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag", "text": "Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag. Make \"B.O.B.\" your at-home training partner: Lifelike mannequin Body Opponent Bag fits on adjustable Wavemaster base (included); Skin is made of high-strength plastisol; Inner cavity is filled with durable urethane foam; 7 height adjustments from 5' to 6'6\"; Base can be filled with water or sand for stability; Approx. 270 lbs. when filled; Made in the U.S.A. Give \"B.O.B.\" the 1-2 punch for a solid at-home workout! Order Today! Century Fitness \"B.O.B.\" Body Opponent Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uq%2BYdH9fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00022KIYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags"]], "price": 232.95}}
