{"item_id": "B00022O5SO", "title": "Mountain House Freeze Dried Food (1 Pouch)", "description": "Perfect for camping, backpacking, or preparing for an emergency, Mountain House stand up pouches make it a breeze to prepare a meal. Sizes range from the most popular, a double serve entrée to Family Sized options.", "text": "Mountain House Freeze Dried Food (1 Pouch) Perfect for camping, backpacking, or preparing for an emergency, Mountain House stand up pouches make it a breeze to prepare a meal. Sizes range from the most popular, a double serve entrée to Family Sized options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RYOJjoyAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00022O5SO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain House", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 4.6}}
{"item_id": "B00023GZ9A", "title": "BARSKA Blueline 8x22 Waterproof Golf Scope (Yards)", "description": "This Blueline golfscope will give you an extra edge in trimming some strokes off your golf score, and help you keep track of that long drive down the fairway.It helps you estimate the range to the pin with an internal distance reticle so no more guesswork needed! And not only that, the scope is waterproof too so no fears of rain! Backed by Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "BARSKA Blueline 8x22 Waterproof Golf Scope (Yards) This Blueline golfscope will give you an extra edge in trimming some strokes off your golf score, and help you keep track of that long drive down the fairway.It helps you estimate the range to the pin with an internal distance reticle so no more guesswork needed! And not only that, the scope is waterproof too so no fears of rain! Backed by Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SJL6B8poL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00023GZ9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00024DE4S", "title": "Seconds Paintballs - 2000 Rounds", "description": "Draxxus Brown Box/Rainbow Paintballs 2000 Rounds Case The Brown Box/Rainbow paintballs are a mixture of all the Draxxus paintballs. You will have hellfire, inferno, blaze, recsport, etc. and all different colors. You may also have all of one type! The paintballs will vary in size because they are all different brands. They are all .68 caliber.", "text": "Seconds Paintballs - 2000 Rounds Draxxus Brown Box/Rainbow Paintballs 2000 Rounds Case The Brown Box/Rainbow paintballs are a mixture of all the Draxxus paintballs. You will have hellfire, inferno, blaze, recsport, etc. and all different colors. You may also have all of one type! The paintballs will vary in size because they are all different brands. They are all .68 caliber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h3bCpte5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00024DE4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Draxxus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Paintballs"]], "price": 28.14}}
{"item_id": "B00024JMWG", "title": "LaserMax Sight Red T0218", "description": "If you want the advantages of a Laser sight without the extra bulk of a clip on laser, take a closer look at LaserMax, the world's only totally internal laser sight. LaserMax increases accuracy and can improve aiming speeds. Its patented design allows you to drop it into place, Replacing the original recoil spring guide rod. LaserMax installs easily by simply field stripping your handgun and replacing the factory guide rod assembly with the LaserMax. Everything you need is included! The laser beam itself actually pulsates which increases its visibility. This is the state-of-the-art in handgun laser sighting systems. No modifications are necessary to your handgun, it installs in minutes and it fits in all standard holsters. This is the top choice of major law enforcement agencies. The LaserMax Sight is activated by pressing a manual switch located on the replacement take down latch. Simply replace the factory slide lock lever (take down lever) with the supplied lever and it works as an on/off switch by simply pressing it in with your trigger finger. It will stay on until you press it back to the off position once you have finished shooting. LaserMax spring weights are identical to Glock factory standards. Springs are currently not interchangeable for different weights.", "text": "LaserMax Sight Red T0218 If you want the advantages of a Laser sight without the extra bulk of a clip on laser, take a closer look at LaserMax, the world's only totally internal laser sight. LaserMax increases accuracy and can improve aiming speeds. Its patented design allows you to drop it into place, Replacing the original recoil spring guide rod. LaserMax installs easily by simply field stripping your handgun and replacing the factory guide rod assembly with the LaserMax. Everything you need is included! The laser beam itself actually pulsates which increases its visibility. This is the state-of-the-art in handgun laser sighting systems. No modifications are necessary to your handgun, it installs in minutes and it fits in all standard holsters. This is the top choice of major law enforcement agencies. The LaserMax Sight is activated by pressing a manual switch located on the replacement take down latch. Simply replace the factory slide lock lever (take down lever) with the supplied lever and it works as an on/off switch by simply pressing it in with your trigger finger. It will stay on until you press it back to the off position once you have finished shooting. LaserMax spring weights are identical to Glock factory standards. Springs are currently not interchangeable for different weights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FSdYCHS8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00024JMWG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002558CS", "title": "50 - Pk. Anatomy Targets", "description": "Paper Targets. All are 60-lb. paper. 23 x 35\". Each printed with black & white photo of armed assailant in ski mask; overprinted in light gray with vital organ areas and corresponding scoring grid. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Targets. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Targets. 50-Pk. Anatomy Targets", "text": "50 - Pk. Anatomy Targets Paper Targets. All are 60-lb. paper. 23 x 35\". Each printed with black & white photo of armed assailant in ski mask; overprinted in light gray with vital organ areas and corresponding scoring grid. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Targets. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Targets. 50-Pk. Anatomy Targets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211PBZ1H70L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002558CS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00025ZC0G", "title": "S.A. Wetterling Axe 20H S.A. Wetterlings Axes - Large Hunters Axe", "description": "Wetterlings has been hand forging axes in Sweden since 1882, and their tools are of the highest quality available. The large hunting axe is powerful and finely balanced. The low weight head and long handle offers an increase in chopping power. Single or two-handed. Bring this on your hunting trip to be well prepared for surviving in the wild. Use the polished poll to skin your kill. To slowly hand forge an axe takes true craftsmanship and decades to learn the craft to perfection. The process starts with first-rate Swedish carbon steel being slowly forged by skilled Wetterlings blacksmiths. Wetterlings forging hammers have been used every day since 1917 and are still the preferred method to reach the best result. No afterwork is needed to correct mistakes or adjust the shape, and they proudly leave small hammer marks that prove these quality tools are hand forged. Wetterlings axes are free from paint and grinding, carefully hardened, sharpened by hand and polished until they shine. They turn their handles from American Hickory in their own wood workshop, too. 0.7 kg Turpentine Axe Head, Swedish carbon steel 3 inch blade, 6 inch long* Slightly rounded, sloped bevel, knife ground to 24 degree angle* 56-58 RwC 20 inch curved Hickory Handle Total weight 0.95 kg *NOTE: Axes are hand made and eye measured. Therefore minor variations may occur.", "text": "S.A. Wetterling Axe 20H S.A. Wetterlings Axes - Large Hunters Axe Wetterlings has been hand forging axes in Sweden since 1882, and their tools are of the highest quality available. The large hunting axe is powerful and finely balanced. The low weight head and long handle offers an increase in chopping power. Single or two-handed. Bring this on your hunting trip to be well prepared for surviving in the wild. Use the polished poll to skin your kill. To slowly hand forge an axe takes true craftsmanship and decades to learn the craft to perfection. The process starts with first-rate Swedish carbon steel being slowly forged by skilled Wetterlings blacksmiths. Wetterlings forging hammers have been used every day since 1917 and are still the preferred method to reach the best result. No afterwork is needed to correct mistakes or adjust the shape, and they proudly leave small hammer marks that prove these quality tools are hand forged. Wetterlings axes are free from paint and grinding, carefully hardened, sharpened by hand and polished until they shine. They turn their handles from American Hickory in their own wood workshop, too. 0.7 kg Turpentine Axe Head, Swedish carbon steel 3 inch blade, 6 inch long* Slightly rounded, sloped bevel, knife ground to 24 degree angle* 56-58 RwC 20 inch curved Hickory Handle Total weight 0.95 kg *NOTE: Axes are hand made and eye measured. Therefore minor variations may occur.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZPYFS3DKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00025ZC0G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Tack", "Saddles"]], "price": 124.0}}
{"item_id": "B000265SMW", "title": "Allen 153 Adult Caliper Release", "description": "Adult, Black, Caliper Release, Traditional Straight Shaft Caliper Release, Adjustable Hook & Loop Strap Assembly, Head Rotates 360 Degrees, T-Style Pivot Reduces Wrist Torque.", "text": "Allen 153 Adult Caliper Release Adult, Black, Caliper Release, Traditional Straight Shaft Caliper Release, Adjustable Hook & Loop Strap Assembly, Head Rotates 360 Degrees, T-Style Pivot Reduces Wrist Torque.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cLRhCq7mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000265SMW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00026UM5A", "title": "Wigwam Men's Cool-Lite Hiker Pro Crew Socks, Navy, Small", "description": "", "text": "Wigwam Men's Cool-Lite Hiker Pro Crew Socks, Navy, Small", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51D3a2QID6L._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00026UM5A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Petite", "Active", "Athletic Socks"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B0002736M0", "title": "Windmill Delta Stormproof Lighter", "description": "By adding a tough elastomer armor, Windmill's Delta Stormproof lighter has the qualities you would expect plus incredible impact resistance. Delta features a stainless steel wire closure to stay watertight even if dropped. Weight 2 oz - Fuel capacity 1 gram - small & compact size - 2.6\" x 2\" x .9\" .Note:For best results use quadruple refined lighter fluid.", "text": "Windmill Delta Stormproof Lighter By adding a tough elastomer armor, Windmill's Delta Stormproof lighter has the qualities you would expect plus incredible impact resistance. Delta features a stainless steel wire closure to stay watertight even if dropped. Weight 2 oz - Fuel capacity 1 gram - small & compact size - 2.6\" x 2\" x .9\" .Note:For best results use quadruple refined lighter fluid.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mEcMmay4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002736M0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 37.89}}
{"item_id": "B000276CYE", "title": "AIRHEAD AHDL-5 Bungee Dockline 5 Feet", "description": "HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "text": "AIRHEAD AHDL-5 Bungee Dockline 5 Feet HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E3XhJCZBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000276CYE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Dock Lines & Rope"]], "price": 10.35}}
{"item_id": "B000276CZS", "title": "AIRHEAD AHDL-6 Bungee Dockline 6 Feet", "description": "HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "text": "AIRHEAD AHDL-6 Bungee Dockline 6 Feet HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E3XhJCZBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000276CZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Dock Lines & Rope"]], "price": 11.4}}
{"item_id": "B000276D0W", "title": "Harken 4-Point Kayak Hoister System Storage Solution", "description": "Harken 4-Point Hoister System - The Harken Hoister will give you the extra storage you need in your garage or studio space. Now you can store your canoe and kayak up and out of the way without breaking your back. The Harken Hoister also has a patented stainless steel self-locking cleat that automatically locks and prevents accidental release - even if you drop the line. Another wonderful feature is the mechanical advantage system lets you can hoist and lower these large items by yourself. The Harken Hoister works with almost any height ceiling, and come with everything you need for installation.", "text": "Harken 4-Point Kayak Hoister System Storage Solution Harken 4-Point Hoister System - The Harken Hoister will give you the extra storage you need in your garage or studio space. Now you can store your canoe and kayak up and out of the way without breaking your back. The Harken Hoister also has a patented stainless steel self-locking cleat that automatically locks and prevents accidental release - even if you drop the line. Another wonderful feature is the mechanical advantage system lets you can hoist and lower these large items by yourself. The Harken Hoister works with almost any height ceiling, and come with everything you need for installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VVWwnZCtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000276D0W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Indoor Kayak Storage"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002862UW", "title": "Celestron 52252 100mm Ultima Zoom Spotting Scope", "description": "The largest aperture scope in the Ultima line, the 100mm Ultima offers more than 50% brighter images than the 80mm, allowing for better performance in low light conditions. The 100mm refractor features excellent multi-coated optics packed into a portable and durable refractor design and comes standard with a 22-66x zoom eyepiece. This series was designed to perform well in a range of viewing situations, making it a great all-around optical instrument. You’ll love it for observing nature and long distance spotting. The green rubber optical tube allows for subtle observation in any nature environment. Ultima spotters are a great companion for any nature or outdoor enthusiast.", "text": "Celestron 52252 100mm Ultima Zoom Spotting Scope The largest aperture scope in the Ultima line, the 100mm Ultima offers more than 50% brighter images than the 80mm, allowing for better performance in low light conditions. The 100mm refractor features excellent multi-coated optics packed into a portable and durable refractor design and comes standard with a 22-66x zoom eyepiece. This series was designed to perform well in a range of viewing situations, making it a great all-around optical instrument. You’ll love it for observing nature and long distance spotting. The green rubber optical tube allows for subtle observation in any nature environment. Ultima spotters are a great companion for any nature or outdoor enthusiast.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l1AtKQprL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002862UW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Celestron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 264.99}}
{"item_id": "B00028O80I", "title": "Dr. Bronner's Organic Castile Liquid Soap Peppermint 1 gal", "description": "Dr. Bronner's most popular fragrance. The peppermint essential oil tingles the body and clears the mind. Because therapeutically peppermint oil is a mild stimulant it increases vitality and clarity. All oils and essential oils are certified organic to the National Organic Standards Program. Packaged in 100% post-consumer recycled plastic bottles. Peppermint Liquid Soap Our most popular fragrance. The peppermint essential oil tingles the body and clears the mind. Because therapeutically peppermint oil is a mild stimulant it increases vitality and clarity. All oils and essential oils are certified organic to the National Organic Standards Program. Dilute: Enjoy 1 soap for 18 different uses! Guaranteed no synthetic peppermint oils & 100% vegetarian: Super mild castile has outstanding water softening & cleansing powers. Preferable to harsh soap & defatting synthetics. It does not cut dirt, but dissolves it. It is the mildest, most pleasant soap you ever used or your money back! Dr. Bronner passed away peacefully on March 7th of 1997. The business continues to be run by the Bronner family with no break in continuity. Over 1000 acres of Dr. Bronner's beloved Rain Forest was donated by his family to the Boys and Girls Clubs of San Diego County, California. Underprivileged children can now camp under the stars within sight of Mt. Palomar. Packaged in 100% post-consumer recycled plastic bottles. Made in USA", "text": "Dr. Bronner's Organic Castile Liquid Soap Peppermint 1 gal Dr. Bronner's most popular fragrance. The peppermint essential oil tingles the body and clears the mind. Because therapeutically peppermint oil is a mild stimulant it increases vitality and clarity. All oils and essential oils are certified organic to the National Organic Standards Program. Packaged in 100% post-consumer recycled plastic bottles. Peppermint Liquid Soap Our most popular fragrance. The peppermint essential oil tingles the body and clears the mind. Because therapeutically peppermint oil is a mild stimulant it increases vitality and clarity. All oils and essential oils are certified organic to the National Organic Standards Program. Dilute: Enjoy 1 soap for 18 different uses! Guaranteed no synthetic peppermint oils & 100% vegetarian: Super mild castile has outstanding water softening & cleansing powers. Preferable to harsh soap & defatting synthetics. It does not cut dirt, but dissolves it. It is the mildest, most pleasant soap you ever used or your money back! Dr. Bronner passed away peacefully on March 7th of 1997. The business continues to be run by the Bronner family with no break in continuity. Over 1000 acres of Dr. Bronner's beloved Rain Forest was donated by his family to the Boys and Girls Clubs of San Diego County, California. Underprivileged children can now camp under the stars within sight of Mt. Palomar. Packaged in 100% post-consumer recycled plastic bottles. Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x2hWFy4kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00028O80I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dr. Bronner", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Soap & Shampoo"]], "price": 57.59}}
{"item_id": "B00028XQWO", "title": "Open Country 12-Cup Percolator", "description": "When navigating the great outdoors with only a backpack to carry supplies, nothing is more important than lightweight and compact gear. With this in mind, Open Country’s portable 12-cup percolator features lightweight aluminum construction and foldable handles. The coffeemaker’s tall cylindrical body measures 8-1/2 by 6 by 5-3/4 inches when ready for transport, and weighs about 12 ounces. A large bail handle arches over the top when unfolded to provide easy transport while an additional wire handle sits low on the canister’s side to facilitate pouring. The percolator’s opening extends slightly to form a small pouring spout. With its 12-cup capacity, this product brews enough coffee for a large group. Solo campers, pairs, or small groups may prefer the 5-cup percolator also available. Made in the United States, this pot comes complete with use and care instructions.-- Amy Arnold", "text": "Open Country 12-Cup Percolator When navigating the great outdoors with only a backpack to carry supplies, nothing is more important than lightweight and compact gear. With this in mind, Open Country’s portable 12-cup percolator features lightweight aluminum construction and foldable handles. The coffeemaker’s tall cylindrical body measures 8-1/2 by 6 by 5-3/4 inches when ready for transport, and weighs about 12 ounces. A large bail handle arches over the top when unfolded to provide easy transport while an additional wire handle sits low on the canister’s side to facilitate pouring. The percolator’s opening extends slightly to form a small pouring spout. With its 12-cup capacity, this product brews enough coffee for a large group. Solo campers, pairs, or small groups may prefer the 5-cup percolator also available. Made in the United States, this pot comes complete with use and care instructions.-- Amy Arnold", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HJZ878J5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00028XQWO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Open Country", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 22.89}}
{"item_id": "B00028XQWY", "title": "Open Country 5-Cup Percolator", "description": "Create coffee with rich and robust flavor miles away from the nearest espresso shop with this lightweight percolator from Nesco Open Country. This attractive percolator performs admirably, bubbling over a campfire or home stove and brews up to 5 cups of coffee for individuals or a small family. Constructed in durable aluminum, the rust- and dent-resistant percolator transfers warmth from heat source to contents in minutes. The percolator features an innovative, wire handle that folds in for compact storage while staying cool to the touch when hot coffee brews. A removable pump equipped with a tube assembly basket allows users to clean out grinds with ease. For care, clean the percolator with a mild detergent, making sure to regularly wipe soot residue off the exterior. The percolator measures 6-1/2 by 5-1/4 by 5 inches, and weighs 8 ounces.--Jessica Reuling", "text": "Open Country 5-Cup Percolator Create coffee with rich and robust flavor miles away from the nearest espresso shop with this lightweight percolator from Nesco Open Country. This attractive percolator performs admirably, bubbling over a campfire or home stove and brews up to 5 cups of coffee for individuals or a small family. Constructed in durable aluminum, the rust- and dent-resistant percolator transfers warmth from heat source to contents in minutes. The percolator features an innovative, wire handle that folds in for compact storage while staying cool to the touch when hot coffee brews. A removable pump equipped with a tube assembly basket allows users to clean out grinds with ease. For care, clean the percolator with a mild detergent, making sure to regularly wipe soot residue off the exterior. The percolator measures 6-1/2 by 5-1/4 by 5 inches, and weighs 8 ounces.--Jessica Reuling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AT6T8JTVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00028XQWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Open Country", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 21.87}}
{"item_id": "B00029A7C0", "title": "Creative Fitness Door Gym", "description": "The Door Gym stands head and shoulders above the competition. This versatile device can be set up in seconds on almost any door frame and lets you work out in the convenience of your own home or office. It latches on without screws, bolts or fasteners, so you won't leave holes in your door trim. A cantilever design uses your own body weight (up to 300 lbs.) to keep it in place. Door Gym is more than a simple pull-up, chin-up bar. It also has two protruding close-grip handles that let you work out with your palms facing each other, a good position for isolating the muscles in the center of your back that control posture. In addition, you can use Door Gym on the ground as a push-up bar and a sit-up spotter.", "text": "Creative Fitness Door Gym The Door Gym stands head and shoulders above the competition. This versatile device can be set up in seconds on almost any door frame and lets you work out in the convenience of your own home or office. It latches on without screws, bolts or fasteners, so you won't leave holes in your door trim. A cantilever design uses your own body weight (up to 300 lbs.) to keep it in place. Door Gym is more than a simple pull-up, chin-up bar. It also has two protruding close-grip handles that let you work out with your palms facing each other, a good position for isolating the muscles in the center of your back that control posture. In addition, you can use Door Gym on the ground as a push-up bar and a sit-up spotter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b7mtAKHeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029A7C0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B00029CYRG", "title": "Meguiar's M6732 Marine/RV One Step Compound - 32 oz.", "description": "Meguiar's Marine One-Step Compound is an advanced aggressive but safe cutting compound with polish that cleans and restores gloss to gel coat surfaces in one step. It removes moderate to heavy oxidation, scratches, stains, and tough water spots on all fiberglass and painted gel coat marine or RV surfaces. Apply by hand or machine to get incredible results.", "text": "Meguiar's M6732 Marine/RV One Step Compound - 32 oz. Meguiar's Marine One-Step Compound is an advanced aggressive but safe cutting compound with polish that cleans and restores gloss to gel coat surfaces in one step. It removes moderate to heavy oxidation, scratches, stains, and tough water spots on all fiberglass and painted gel coat marine or RV surfaces. Apply by hand or machine to get incredible results.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eGveA3fTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029CYRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meguiar&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 18.52}}
{"item_id": "B00029EWYY", "title": "Four Seasons Survival Tinder-Quik Fire Tab", "description": "Tinder-Quik fire tabs complement your Spark-Lite purchase and make sure you've got plenty of fire-starting ability. Each Tinder-Quik is specially treated to high standards to ensure the cotton is waterproof and provides more than adequate burn times for starting fires.", "text": "Four Seasons Survival Tinder-Quik Fire Tab Tinder-Quik fire tabs complement your Spark-Lite purchase and make sure you've got plenty of fire-starting ability. Each Tinder-Quik is specially treated to high standards to ensure the cotton is waterproof and provides more than adequate burn times for starting fires.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wT6WX6mzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029EWYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Four Seasons Survival", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 2.51}}
{"item_id": "B00029I1BO", "title": "M16-A4 Airsoft Rifle with LED illuminator, laser sight & adjustable gun stock", "description": "This airsoft rifle is great for the beginner. Very close in form and function to the real steel 16-A4, this inexpensive airsoft rifle will provide hours of enjoyment. This version features an extendable stock, LED illuminator and laser sight. With this M-16A4 replica, the admiration continues in the sports realm of AirSoft. Comes complete with safety goggles, rifle strap and 100 bbs.", "text": "M16-A4 Airsoft Rifle with LED illuminator, laser sight & adjustable gun stock This airsoft rifle is great for the beginner. Very close in form and function to the real steel 16-A4, this inexpensive airsoft rifle will provide hours of enjoyment. This version features an extendable stock, LED illuminator and laser sight. With this M-16A4 replica, the admiration continues in the sports realm of AirSoft. Comes complete with safety goggles, rifle strap and 100 bbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E7d18b5cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029I1BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSplat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 22.35}}
{"item_id": "B00029KBF8", "title": "Surco BT300 Spare Tire Rack", "description": "Bike rack attaches to any spare tire using a heavy duty mounting plate. Transports up to 3 bikes with a locking top plate that secures and locks bikes to rack. Bikes are securely gripped in a non-scratch padded channel. Manufactured from a heavy duty steel construction with a durable black powder coat finish. Does not fit 2006 or newer RAV4.", "text": "Surco BT300 Spare Tire Rack Bike rack attaches to any spare tire using a heavy duty mounting plate. Transports up to 3 bikes with a locking top plate that secures and locks bikes to rack. Bikes are securely gripped in a non-scratch padded channel. Manufactured from a heavy duty steel construction with a durable black powder coat finish. Does not fit 2006 or newer RAV4.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jz7vpP8yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029KBF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Surco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 190.65}}
{"item_id": "B00029PB1W", "title": "No Rinse Body Wash (1 bottle)", "description": "Wash your body without water and eliminate odors. Absolutely no rinsing or water required. Just lather and towel dry. This is the body soap NASA uses for all shuttle flights. Good for camping, boating, hunting, angling, and rafting trips.", "text": "No Rinse Body Wash (1 bottle) Wash your body without water and eliminate odors. Absolutely no rinsing or water required. Just lather and towel dry. This is the body soap NASA uses for all shuttle flights. Good for camping, boating, hunting, angling, and rafting trips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21BmDiGPXOL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029PB1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "No Rinse", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Soap & Shampoo"]], "price": 7.67}}
{"item_id": "B00029R80E", "title": "Rothco Camouflage Outdoorsman Rucksack", "description": "The Rothco 2306 Camouflage Outdoorsman Rucksack features adjustable padded canvas shoulder straps, and a two inch waist belt. There is a large main storage compartment, two side pockets and a pocketed lid. Its overall dimensions are 19\"X 13\"X 8\".", "text": "Rothco Camouflage Outdoorsman Rucksack The Rothco 2306 Camouflage Outdoorsman Rucksack features adjustable padded canvas shoulder straps, and a two inch waist belt. There is a large main storage compartment, two side pockets and a pocketed lid. Its overall dimensions are 19\"X 13\"X 8\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510NuxPJSdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029R80E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 22.99}}
