{"item_id": "B00029WY9Y", "title": "", "description": "K&N; Air Filter Oil is the only oil specially formulated to work in combination with the cotton fabric in K&N; Filtercharger elements providing a superior air filtration system. When used as directed, it quickly penetrates the filter pleats, where it remains suspended in the cotton fabric.", "text": "K&N; Air Filter Oil is the only oil specially formulated to work in combination with the cotton fabric in K&N; Filtercharger elements providing a superior air filtration system. When used as directed, it quickly penetrates the filter pleats, where it remains suspended in the cotton fabric.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417AEZTX9HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00029WY9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Replacement Parts", "Filters", "Air Filters & Accessories", "Air Filter Accessories & Cleaning Products"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 5.33}}
{"item_id": "B0002AP1B6", "title": "BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope", "description": "Accuracy improved! BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope is 100% waterproof and 100% shockproof. This reliable 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope by famed BSA puts you in the driver's seat. And thanks to a Close-Out, it's here with significant savings! It's tough, bright and accurate. Waterproof; Shockproof; Chambers are nitrogen purged and sealed to be fogproof; Camera quality glass lens is ground to give a clear, undistorted image; All glass surfaces are fully coated to eliminate reflections and glare; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 37.7' in 3X and 14.1' in 9X; 1-piece, 1\" tube is 12\" long. Weighs 12 ozs. Fire me your order ONLINE today! State Color. BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope", "text": "BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope Accuracy improved! BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope is 100% waterproof and 100% shockproof. This reliable 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope by famed BSA puts you in the driver's seat. And thanks to a Close-Out, it's here with significant savings! It's tough, bright and accurate. Waterproof; Shockproof; Chambers are nitrogen purged and sealed to be fogproof; Camera quality glass lens is ground to give a clear, undistorted image; All glass surfaces are fully coated to eliminate reflections and glare; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 37.7' in 3X and 14.1' in 9X; 1-piece, 1\" tube is 12\" long. Weighs 12 ozs. Fire me your order ONLINE today! State Color. BSA 3-9 x 32 mm .22 Special Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314uRunXVsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002AP1B6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 53.89}}
{"item_id": "B0002BLMIQ", "title": "Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-CP Sparehand Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack for All Frame Types, Chrome Finish", "description": "The Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-CP Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack has a 80-pound maximum capacity and is a convenient storage solution for any style of bicycle and is perfect for apartments, condos, homes and garages. With a durable chrome finish, this rack has a (2) bike capacity and adjusts from 71-114-inches to fit in almost any storage space. The DBR-9161-CP can store and suspend children and adult bicycles off the ground and out of the way with its floor to ceiling design. The DBR-9161-CP is height adjustable for all bike sizes and frame styles and keeps even the heaviest bike frame stored securely. This rack measures 114-inches by 11-inches by 3-inches and weighs 10-pounds. The Sparehand’s unique and accessible design saves space, while making it easy for you to grab or store you bike. This unit is quick to assemble with no drilling into walls or ceilings. The Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-BK Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack comes with a 1-year limited warranty to protect against defects in material and workmanship. Stoneman Sports is dedicated to innovation and simplicity and specializes in high-quality lifestyle and sports products. Their expansive product offering includes bike racks, kayak carriers, grilling accessories and much more. Stoneman Sports provides some of the most durable sports accessories at competitive prices and has great ideas for real-life applications.", "text": "Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-CP Sparehand Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack for All Frame Types, Chrome Finish The Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-CP Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack has a 80-pound maximum capacity and is a convenient storage solution for any style of bicycle and is perfect for apartments, condos, homes and garages. With a durable chrome finish, this rack has a (2) bike capacity and adjusts from 71-114-inches to fit in almost any storage space. The DBR-9161-CP can store and suspend children and adult bicycles off the ground and out of the way with its floor to ceiling design. The DBR-9161-CP is height adjustable for all bike sizes and frame styles and keeps even the heaviest bike frame stored securely. This rack measures 114-inches by 11-inches by 3-inches and weighs 10-pounds. The Sparehand’s unique and accessible design saves space, while making it easy for you to grab or store you bike. This unit is quick to assemble with no drilling into walls or ceilings. The Stoneman Sports DBR-9161-BK Q-Rack Freestanding Adjustable 2-Bike Storage Rack comes with a 1-year limited warranty to protect against defects in material and workmanship. Stoneman Sports is dedicated to innovation and simplicity and specializes in high-quality lifestyle and sports products. Their expansive product offering includes bike racks, kayak carriers, grilling accessories and much more. Stoneman Sports provides some of the most durable sports accessories at competitive prices and has great ideas for real-life applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gKkW8xwnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002BLMIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SpareHand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 61.0}}
