{"item_id": "B0002CHBRG", "title": "Free form Hickory Walking Stick", "description": "Hickory is a strong, durable wood that is able to withstand the most strenuous conditions. Its unparalleled strength has made it a wood of choice for tool handles, bows, and baseball bats. Whether you're trekking through miles of wooded terrain, or walking casually around your neighborhood, the Free Form Hickory Walking Stick is the perfect choice for those seeking timeless, rustic appeal coupled with legendary durability", "text": "Free form Hickory Walking Stick Hickory is a strong, durable wood that is able to withstand the most strenuous conditions. Its unparalleled strength has made it a wood of choice for tool handles, bows, and baseball bats. Whether you're trekking through miles of wooded terrain, or walking casually around your neighborhood, the Free Form Hickory Walking Stick is the perfect choice for those seeking timeless, rustic appeal coupled with legendary durability", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j5ZYdwMUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002CHBRG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]]}}
