{"item_id": "B0002F7MIQ", "title": "Bear Archery Youth Safetyglass Target Arrows (3 per card)", "description": "Bear Archery Safetyglass™ arrows are strong, durable, and safe. Constructed of fiberglass, the arrows offer high flexing qualities and will not splinter. The Safetyglass™ arrows come with nock and points installed and are pre-fletched with vanes.Warning: Arrow spine weight must match or be higher than bow weight.", "text": "Bear Archery Youth Safetyglass Target Arrows (3 per card) Bear Archery Safetyglass™ arrows are strong, durable, and safe. Constructed of fiberglass, the arrows offer high flexing qualities and will not splinter. The Safetyglass™ arrows come with nock and points installed and are pre-fletched with vanes.Warning: Arrow spine weight must match or be higher than bow weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ukq0ZN45L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002F7MIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]]}}
