{"item_id": "B0002IKAK0", "title": "A-Zoom Precision Snap Caps 20 Gauge (2 Pack)", "description": "A-Zoom 20 Gauge Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 2 rounds per package.", "text": "A-Zoom Precision Snap Caps 20 Gauge (2 Pack) A-Zoom 20 Gauge Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 2 rounds per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A72hMD-BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKAK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.37}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKAMI", "title": "A-Zoom Precision Snap Caps (2 Pack) (7.62 X 39-mm)", "description": "A-Zoom 7.62 x 39 Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 2 rounds per package.", "text": "A-Zoom Precision Snap Caps (2 Pack) (7.62 X 39-mm) A-Zoom 7.62 x 39 Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 2 rounds per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NBGECNEjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKAMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.52}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKANW", "title": "A-Zoom 9Mm Luger Precision Snap Caps (5 Pack)", "description": "A-Zoom nine-millimeter Luger Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing, and practice. Featuring hard anodized aluminum construction, they function like real ammunition, and are a useful tool when teaching safe gun handling. Five rounds per package.About A-ZoomIdeal for safety training, function testing, or safe de-cocking without damage to the firing pin, A-Zoom's patented line of precision metal snap caps were introduced in 2000 to meet the growing demand for high-quality training rounds for shooters, hunters, law enforcement professionals, and the military. Unlike traditional plastic snap caps, A-Zoom's are individually CNC-machined to precise cartridge dimensions from solid aluminum, then anodized with a hard coat finish that provides smooth function and long life.", "text": "A-Zoom 9Mm Luger Precision Snap Caps (5 Pack) A-Zoom nine-millimeter Luger Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing, and practice. Featuring hard anodized aluminum construction, they function like real ammunition, and are a useful tool when teaching safe gun handling. Five rounds per package.About A-ZoomIdeal for safety training, function testing, or safe de-cocking without damage to the firing pin, A-Zoom's patented line of precision metal snap caps were introduced in 2000 to meet the growing demand for high-quality training rounds for shooters, hunters, law enforcement professionals, and the military. Unlike traditional plastic snap caps, A-Zoom's are individually CNC-machined to precise cartridge dimensions from solid aluminum, then anodized with a hard coat finish that provides smooth function and long life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MmFZ8tK2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKANW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 13.75}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKAOG", "title": "A-Zoom 5-Pack Precision Snap Caps fits 9mm Makarov", "description": "For safety training, function testing or safely decocking without damaging the firing pin, A-Zoom training rounds are much more than conventional snap-caps. They are precision CNC machined from solid aluminum to precise cartridge dimensions, then hard anodized for ultra-smooth functioning and long life. In addition, each round has A-Zoom's remarkably durable \"Dead Cap\" proven to withstand over three thousand dry fires while protecting the firing pin. A-Zoom Snap Caps last over 30 times longer than conventional plastic examples and are available in over 120 sizes from .22 Hornet to the .50BMG.", "text": "A-Zoom 5-Pack Precision Snap Caps fits 9mm Makarov For safety training, function testing or safely decocking without damaging the firing pin, A-Zoom training rounds are much more than conventional snap-caps. They are precision CNC machined from solid aluminum to precise cartridge dimensions, then hard anodized for ultra-smooth functioning and long life. In addition, each round has A-Zoom's remarkably durable \"Dead Cap\" proven to withstand over three thousand dry fires while protecting the firing pin. A-Zoom Snap Caps last over 30 times longer than conventional plastic examples and are available in over 120 sizes from .22 Hornet to the .50BMG.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MmFZ8tK2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKAOG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-Zoom Snap Caps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKAU0", "title": "Birchwood Casey Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth", "description": "The Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth leaves a lustrous, lasting, protective film on all metal, wood and plastic surfaces. The doublenapped, 100% cotton flannel cloth is impregnated with pure silicone and then packaged in a convenient reclosable poly bag, staying clean and moist after use. Use on firearms, sporting equipment and precision instruments to safely remove dust and corrosive fingerprints.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth The Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth leaves a lustrous, lasting, protective film on all metal, wood and plastic surfaces. The doublenapped, 100% cotton flannel cloth is impregnated with pure silicone and then packaged in a convenient reclosable poly bag, staying clean and moist after use. Use on firearms, sporting equipment and precision instruments to safely remove dust and corrosive fingerprints.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KH3rSkPAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKAU0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 4.2}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKAW8", "title": "Birchwood Casey 360-1-Inch Target Spots", "description": "The Self Adhesive Target Spots are perfect for the avid shooter. These convenient targets create and instant bull's eye for all types of target practice. The high-contrast red color lets you see a sharper sight picture and bullet holes more clearly for better scores and smaller groups.", "text": "Birchwood Casey 360-1-Inch Target Spots The Self Adhesive Target Spots are perfect for the avid shooter. These convenient targets create and instant bull's eye for all types of target practice. The high-contrast red color lets you see a sharper sight picture and bullet holes more clearly for better scores and smaller groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WUpjVKHJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKAW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 5.7}}
