{"item_id": "B0002IKGWM", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Shotgun Soft-Sided Cleaning Kit (Choose Your Gauge)", "description": "Take this complete, super compact BoreSnake Gun Cleaning Kit anywhere. The rugged, soft-sided case attaches easily to a belt and fits compactly into a box or bag. Includes BoreSnake, Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, Hoppe's Weatherguard Cloths and pulling tool.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Shotgun Soft-Sided Cleaning Kit (Choose Your Gauge) Take this complete, super compact BoreSnake Gun Cleaning Kit anywhere. The rugged, soft-sided case attaches easily to a belt and fits compactly into a box or bag. Includes BoreSnake, Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, Hoppe's Weatherguard Cloths and pulling tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SPZk45ACL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKGWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
