{"item_id": "B0002IKUTQ", "title": "Duck Commander Men's Duck Commander Mallard Drake Duck Call", "description": "When late-season waterfowl get wary of other calls, this specialty call delivers a life-like sound that's sure to bring ducks circling. Unlike other calls, it is specifically crafted to produce the trills, shrill whistles and courtship calls that are attractive to a variety of species a call every serious hunter will keep at the ready. Easy-to-blow design is perfect for beginners and experienced callers alike. Sleek, easy-to-hold barrel quickly slips into call pocket after use. Molded from high-impact plastic that will hold up in the wettest and toughest conditions. USA.", "text": "Duck Commander Men's Duck Commander Mallard Drake Duck Call When late-season waterfowl get wary of other calls, this specialty call delivers a life-like sound that's sure to bring ducks circling. Unlike other calls, it is specifically crafted to produce the trills, shrill whistles and courtship calls that are attractive to a variety of species a call every serious hunter will keep at the ready. Easy-to-blow design is perfect for beginners and experienced callers alike. Sleek, easy-to-hold barrel quickly slips into call pocket after use. Molded from high-impact plastic that will hold up in the wettest and toughest conditions. USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BRaM1FglL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKUTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 16.65}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKUV4", "title": "Duck Commander Pintail/Widgeon Call", "description": "The Pintail/Widgeon call is part of our Specialty Series. The Specialty series not only aid in attracting \"off-ducks,\" but also act as a confidence call when late season ducks get wary of regular calling. The Duck Commander Specialty calls are the most life-like calls on the market. Very unique 6 in 1 Call. Teal Drake, Pintail Drake, Mallard Drake, Widgeon Drake, Dove and Quail.", "text": "Duck Commander Pintail/Widgeon Call The Pintail/Widgeon call is part of our Specialty Series. The Specialty series not only aid in attracting \"off-ducks,\" but also act as a confidence call when late season ducks get wary of regular calling. The Duck Commander Specialty calls are the most life-like calls on the market. Very unique 6 in 1 Call. Teal Drake, Pintail Drake, Mallard Drake, Widgeon Drake, Dove and Quail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318E5maurxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKUV4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKUW8", "title": "Duck Commander Wood Duck Call", "description": "Made of high impact plastic, this single reed call is part of our specialty series of calls that is great for flying or sitting sounds and will make the most realistic wood duck call on the market.", "text": "Duck Commander Wood Duck Call Made of high impact plastic, this single reed call is part of our specialty series of calls that is great for flying or sitting sounds and will make the most realistic wood duck call on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mwWDvw-eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKUW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0002IKZWS", "title": "Butler Creek Comfort Stretch Sling Rifle", "description": "Butler Creek Comfort Stretch Sling. Superb \"walk and stalk\" comfort! Comort Stretch design gives this Sling unbeatable shock absorption for greater comfort as well as a snug, solid hold when shooting off-hand. Non-slip Grippers hold your gun comfortably in place during shoulder carry. It's a revolutionary design that makes your gun feel 50% lighter, and 100% more comfortable! Alaskan models feature shell loops. Pick yours and State Color! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Butler Creek Alaskan Mag Rifle Sling; Butler Creek Camo Neoprene Shotgun Sling - word search in our store for 'Butler Creek'. Butler Creek Neoprene Rifle Sling", "text": "Butler Creek Comfort Stretch Sling Rifle Butler Creek Comfort Stretch Sling. Superb \"walk and stalk\" comfort! Comort Stretch design gives this Sling unbeatable shock absorption for greater comfort as well as a snug, solid hold when shooting off-hand. Non-slip Grippers hold your gun comfortably in place during shoulder carry. It's a revolutionary design that makes your gun feel 50% lighter, and 100% more comfortable! Alaskan models feature shell loops. Pick yours and State Color! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Butler Creek Alaskan Mag Rifle Sling; Butler Creek Camo Neoprene Shotgun Sling - word search in our store for 'Butler Creek'. Butler Creek Neoprene Rifle Sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-vU1WwIkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IKZWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 20.48}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL5RC", "title": "Crimson Trace LG-619 Lasergrips", "description": "The award-winning G-Series laser sights offer an even more compact frame application than traditional Lasergrips, maintaining your compact-sized Glock's configuration. Engineered with Crimson Trace's \"instinctive activation\", the Lasergrip is engaged from the rear of the grip with your natural firing grip. Crimson Trace G-Series Lasergrips have been recognized with two Golden Bullseye Awards from the National Rifle Association and a High-Tech Product of the Year Award from the Firearms Industry Academy of Excellence. No other laser sight has won more awards.", "text": "Crimson Trace LG-619 Lasergrips The award-winning G-Series laser sights offer an even more compact frame application than traditional Lasergrips, maintaining your compact-sized Glock's configuration. Engineered with Crimson Trace's \"instinctive activation\", the Lasergrip is engaged from the rear of the grip with your natural firing grip. Crimson Trace G-Series Lasergrips have been recognized with two Golden Bullseye Awards from the National Rifle Association and a High-Tech Product of the Year Award from the Firearms Industry Academy of Excellence. No other laser sight has won more awards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ABupuXoAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL5RC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6M6", "title": "Crosman Pellgunoil® Air Gun Lubricating Oil (1/4 ounces)", "description": "This ¼ ounce tube of specially formulated oil is used with pneumatic or CO2 powered airguns. Pellgun oil prevents your airguns from rusting and the seals from drying out.", "text": "Crosman Pellgunoil® Air Gun Lubricating Oil (1/4 ounces) This ¼ ounce tube of specially formulated oil is used with pneumatic or CO2 powered airguns. Pellgun oil prevents your airguns from rusting and the seals from drying out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VEmzSvR8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6M6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6NA", "title": "Crosman 25 Pack of Official Air Gun Paper Targets", "description": "Each pack contains 25 targets with an air pistol bull's-eye on one side and an air rifle bull's-eye on the other.", "text": "Crosman 25 Pack of Official Air Gun Paper Targets Each pack contains 25 targets with an air pistol bull's-eye on one side and an air rifle bull's-eye on the other.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wgD5ZK-pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6NA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6T4", "title": "Crosman 3576 Semi-Auto CO2 Powered Pellet Revolver with 6-Inch Barrel", "description": "This semi-automatic 10-shot air pistol is unique with revolver styling and finger-molded grip design, perfect for action shooting. Powered by CO2 and available single or double action the 3576 is easy to use, as well as accurate with its six inch rifled steel barrel. The item can be shipped only within the U.S., restricted in NY and CA", "text": "Crosman 3576 Semi-Auto CO2 Powered Pellet Revolver with 6-Inch Barrel This semi-automatic 10-shot air pistol is unique with revolver styling and finger-molded grip design, perfect for action shooting. Powered by CO2 and available single or double action the 3576 is easy to use, as well as accurate with its six inch rifled steel barrel. The item can be shipped only within the U.S., restricted in NY and CA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ioBlkY43L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6T4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 90.7}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6TY", "title": "Crosman Replacement Rotary Magazine (Pack of 3)", "description": "Have you lost or damaged the original pellet clips for your Crosman pellet revolver. Do you wish to have additional clips ready to go, instead of reloading as often. These pellet-clips for the Crosman 3576W Pellet Revolver are the solution. This package of three will keep you shooting longer.", "text": "Crosman Replacement Rotary Magazine (Pack of 3) Have you lost or damaged the original pellet clips for your Crosman pellet revolver. Do you wish to have additional clips ready to go, instead of reloading as often. These pellet-clips for the Crosman 3576W Pellet Revolver are the solution. This package of three will keep you shooting longer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4181qBDji8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6TY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6U8", "title": "Crosman Competition .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 250ct", "description": "Wadcutter pellets are ideal for paper targets. The flat nose punches a crisper, rounder hole in paper targets, for easy scoring. 250 Wadcutter pellets in a tin.", "text": "Crosman Competition .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 250ct Wadcutter pellets are ideal for paper targets. The flat nose punches a crisper, rounder hole in paper targets, for easy scoring. 250 Wadcutter pellets in a tin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gzu7-dUyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6U8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 5.64}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL6WQ", "title": "Remington AirMaster 77 kit with Scope", "description": "The Crosman Remington AirMaster 77 multi-pump pneumatic air rifle shoots pellets at a whopping 725 feet per second (755 fps with BBs), so you can efficiently hit your targets from distance. The air rifle is equipped with a fiber-optic front sight and completely adjustable rear sight that make it easy to acquire your target. You can also vary the power of the air rifle depending on the distance of your target. Capacity-wise, the AirMaster 77 holds 10 pumps maximum at a time, plenty for most applications. Pellets are loaded one at a time, while BBs are loaded into a reservoir that holds 200 at once and then dropped into a 17-capacity magazine. Finally, the AirMaster 77 looks as good as it shoots, with a black matte synthetic stock and forearm, a black metal receiver, and brushed nickel barrel. The grip and forearm have checkering for a sure grasp.The AirMaster 77 air rifle kit comes with a 4x20 scope with rings, 100 BBs and 100 pellets, shooting glasses, pump power source, and paper targets.", "text": "Remington AirMaster 77 kit with Scope The Crosman Remington AirMaster 77 multi-pump pneumatic air rifle shoots pellets at a whopping 725 feet per second (755 fps with BBs), so you can efficiently hit your targets from distance. The air rifle is equipped with a fiber-optic front sight and completely adjustable rear sight that make it easy to acquire your target. You can also vary the power of the air rifle depending on the distance of your target. Capacity-wise, the AirMaster 77 holds 10 pumps maximum at a time, plenty for most applications. Pellets are loaded one at a time, while BBs are loaded into a reservoir that holds 200 at once and then dropped into a 17-capacity magazine. Finally, the AirMaster 77 looks as good as it shoots, with a black matte synthetic stock and forearm, a black metal receiver, and brushed nickel barrel. The grip and forearm have checkering for a sure grasp.The AirMaster 77 air rifle kit comes with a 4x20 scope with rings, 100 BBs and 100 pellets, shooting glasses, pump power source, and paper targets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AaFv0p-GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL6WQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002IL89M", "title": "Crosman .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Pointed, 250ct", "description": "Want your shot to travel further? These are great pellets for hunting and plinking. Super Point .177 caliber pellets get the maximum distance for your airgun. 250 per tin.", "text": "Crosman .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Pointed, 250ct Want your shot to travel further? These are great pellets for hunting and plinking. Super Point .177 caliber pellets get the maximum distance for your airgun. 250 per tin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PZnGvwdCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IL89M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 6.0}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILCXY", "title": "DAC Technologies 17 - 22 Caliber Universal Rifle Cleaning Kit, 7 Piece, Manuf# UGC-172C", "description": "Universal Cleaning Kit Specifications: - 3 Solid brass rods - Custom handle - .17 and .22 brass brushes - .22 cal. slot tip - Polishing cloth - 25 Cleaning patches - .17 cal. Mop", "text": "DAC Technologies 17 - 22 Caliber Universal Rifle Cleaning Kit, 7 Piece, Manuf# UGC-172C Universal Cleaning Kit Specifications: - 3 Solid brass rods - Custom handle - .17 and .22 brass brushes - .22 cal. slot tip - Polishing cloth - 25 Cleaning patches - .17 cal. Mop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DuLP2j5EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILCXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 7.97}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILDA6", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 15XT Pistol (Black, 7.21 Inch)", "description": "Time-tested air gun company Daisy's PowerLine of products is designed for advanced shooters, delivering greater velocities and improved accuracy. The 15XT air pistol model is a CO2-powered semiautomatic, ideal for handgun training. A built-in BB magazine holds 15 rounds, and a 0.375-inch dovetail mount lets you customize with your favorite optics and other accessories.SpecificationsCO2-powered semiautomatic15-shot magazine.177 caliberSmooth bore barrelBlade and ramp front sight, fixed open rear sightManual trigger block safety480 FPS maximum muzzle velocity240-yard maximum range7.2-inch lengthOne-pound weightWarrantyThis Daisy air gun includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About DaisyMore Americans have taken their first shot with a Daisy BB gun than any other brand. The company's roots trace back to the late 1870s in Plymouth, Michigan, the result of a collaboration between the Plymouth Iron Windmill Company and Plymouth Air Rifle Company. Company founder, watchmaker, and inventor Clarence Hamilton developed an all-metal air gun of his own design, which was originally a bonus item sold to every farmer who purchased a windmill. When Hamilton presented his prototype to the company's board of directors for examination, General Manager L.C. Hough test fired the weapon and exclaimed, in a popular colloquialism of the time, \"Boy! That's a daisy!\" So that's what they named the gun.By 1895, sales and popularity of the Daisy had grown so rapidly, the company ceased manufacturing windmills, focused exclusively on producing air guns, and changed its name to Daisy Manufacturing Company. The company has continued to grow over time -- adding models like the renowned Red Ryder, innovative new PowerLine products for advanced shooters, Avanti guns for match competition, and a Winchester-branded line -- and is now based in Rogers, Arkansas.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 15XT Pistol (Black, 7.21 Inch) Time-tested air gun company Daisy's PowerLine of products is designed for advanced shooters, delivering greater velocities and improved accuracy. The 15XT air pistol model is a CO2-powered semiautomatic, ideal for handgun training. A built-in BB magazine holds 15 rounds, and a 0.375-inch dovetail mount lets you customize with your favorite optics and other accessories.SpecificationsCO2-powered semiautomatic15-shot magazine.177 caliberSmooth bore barrelBlade and ramp front sight, fixed open rear sightManual trigger block safety480 FPS maximum muzzle velocity240-yard maximum range7.2-inch lengthOne-pound weightWarrantyThis Daisy air gun includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About DaisyMore Americans have taken their first shot with a Daisy BB gun than any other brand. The company's roots trace back to the late 1870s in Plymouth, Michigan, the result of a collaboration between the Plymouth Iron Windmill Company and Plymouth Air Rifle Company. Company founder, watchmaker, and inventor Clarence Hamilton developed an all-metal air gun of his own design, which was originally a bonus item sold to every farmer who purchased a windmill. When Hamilton presented his prototype to the company's board of directors for examination, General Manager L.C. Hough test fired the weapon and exclaimed, in a popular colloquialism of the time, \"Boy! That's a daisy!\" So that's what they named the gun.By 1895, sales and popularity of the Daisy had grown so rapidly, the company ceased manufacturing windmills, focused exclusively on producing air guns, and changed its name to Daisy Manufacturing Company. The company has continued to grow over time -- adding models like the renowned Red Ryder, innovative new PowerLine products for advanced shooters, Avanti guns for match competition, and a Winchester-branded line -- and is now based in Rogers, Arkansas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412iN0uhUEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILDA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 39.17}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILDKG", "title": "Daisy Shatterblast. 4 target stakes and 8 breakable target disks", "description": "Four eight-inch high-impact target stakes and eight ShatterBlast breakable target disks. ShatterBlast makes shooting even more fun.", "text": "Daisy Shatterblast. 4 target stakes and 8 breakable target disks Four eight-inch high-impact target stakes and eight ShatterBlast breakable target disks. ShatterBlast makes shooting even more fun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pX1h-uClL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILDKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILDKQ", "title": "Daisy Shatterblast Refill Disks (60 pack)", "description": "Introducing an exciting new way to improve target-shooting skills! When you shoot a ShatterBlast target, it breaks up into a million pieces. Made of natural, biodegradable non-toxic clay. Box of 60 2-inch clay targets.", "text": "Daisy Shatterblast Refill Disks (60 pack) Introducing an exciting new way to improve target-shooting skills! When you shoot a ShatterBlast target, it breaks up into a million pieces. Made of natural, biodegradable non-toxic clay. Box of 60 2-inch clay targets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IMC-pMgsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILDKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 9.7}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILHLQ", "title": "Galco Ankle Glove Calf Strap (Black, Ambi)", "description": "To be used with our Ankle Glove Holster. Shown Assembled on Ankle Glove.", "text": "Galco Ankle Glove Calf Strap (Black, Ambi) To be used with our Ankle Glove Holster. Shown Assembled on Ankle Glove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aZpIP7IBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILHLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.55}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILHYS", "title": "Galco Classic Lite Shoulder System for H&K USP Compact 45, Springfield XD, XD Compact, XDM", "description": "Since 1970, Galco has made the most comfortable, versatile and most copied shoulder holster systems in the world. If you want a genuine Galco shoulder holster for part-time carry, the Classic Lite is for you. The Classic Lite gives you all the comfort and versatility of our professional rigs, since we use the same patented and trademarked connectors to achieve the same great fit and function, including our trademarked clover shape Flexalon swivel back plate. Using premium Center Cut Steerhide allows us to offer you a very reasonably priced alternative shoulder system with a proven track record. And you thought an ill-fitting nylon rig was the only affordable choice. This system includes holster, harness, ammo carrier and a set of system screws. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Classic Lite is available in right or left hand draw in natural-color, premium center cut steerhide.", "text": "Galco Classic Lite Shoulder System for H&K USP Compact 45, Springfield XD, XD Compact, XDM Since 1970, Galco has made the most comfortable, versatile and most copied shoulder holster systems in the world. If you want a genuine Galco shoulder holster for part-time carry, the Classic Lite is for you. The Classic Lite gives you all the comfort and versatility of our professional rigs, since we use the same patented and trademarked connectors to achieve the same great fit and function, including our trademarked clover shape Flexalon swivel back plate. Using premium Center Cut Steerhide allows us to offer you a very reasonably priced alternative shoulder system with a proven track record. And you thought an ill-fitting nylon rig was the only affordable choice. This system includes holster, harness, ammo carrier and a set of system screws. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Classic Lite is available in right or left hand draw in natural-color, premium center cut steerhide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fw7Y%2BIJUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILHYS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 79.23}}
