{"item_id": "B0002ILNT2", "title": "Combat Holster for Glocks", "description": "he Glock Sport/Combat Holster is constructed of lightweight polymer and are completely ambidextrous. These holsters are an inexpensive alternative for gun carry. These are considered stock Glock parts, so they are not returnable - Glock warrants these items against defects. Will fit 9mm, .357 Sig, .40 Cal., 10mm and .45 ACP (except Glock 36).", "text": "Combat Holster for Glocks he Glock Sport/Combat Holster is constructed of lightweight polymer and are completely ambidextrous. These holsters are an inexpensive alternative for gun carry. These are considered stock Glock parts, so they are not returnable - Glock warrants these items against defects. Will fit 9mm, .357 Sig, .40 Cal., 10mm and .45 ACP (except Glock 36).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GGgES1aEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILNT2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILPNQ", "title": "HKS 32-J Revolver Speedloader for Ruger SP101/Taurus 73, 74, 731, 741/S&W J-Frame Size 6 Shot", "description": "\"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits Ruger SP101/Taurus 73, 74, 731, 741/S&W; J-Frame Size 6 Shot", "text": "HKS 32-J Revolver Speedloader for Ruger SP101/Taurus 73, 74, 731, 741/S&W J-Frame Size 6 Shot \"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits Ruger SP101/Taurus 73, 74, 731, 741/S&W; J-Frame Size 6 Shot", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jy15Om3jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILPNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILQ76", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P220 American Rubber with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P220 American Rubber with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vvD4gxYoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILQ76.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.4}}
