{"item_id": "B0002ILQI0", "title": "Hogue 82060 Rubber Grip-Ruger", "description": "Hogue Fancy Soft grips are some of the finest grips available. They are precision inletted on modern computerized machinery, then hand finished on actual factory frames to assure proper fit. Grips are constructed of the highest quality. Each grip is unique and will vary in color and figure. Specifications: - Fits: Sig Sauer P239 - Color: Cocoa Bolo", "text": "Hogue 82060 Rubber Grip-Ruger Hogue Fancy Soft grips are some of the finest grips available. They are precision inletted on modern computerized machinery, then hand finished on actual factory frames to assure proper fit. Grips are constructed of the highest quality. Each grip is unique and will vary in color and figure. Specifications: - Fits: Sig Sauer P239 - Color: Cocoa Bolo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314jSFwZeyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILQI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 18.85}}
{"item_id": "B0002ILQJ4", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger Redhawk Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger Redhawk Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h7TR5zqvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ILQJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.98}}
