{"item_id": "B0002IMNXW", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.22 Caliber)", "description": "The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.22 Caliber) The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xbuRAiTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IMNXW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 20.49}}
{"item_id": "B0002IMNYG", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.40/.41/10mm)", "description": "The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.40/.41/10mm) The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xbuRAiTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IMNYG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.19}}
{"item_id": "B0002IMNYQ", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.44/.45 Caliber)", "description": "The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.44/.45 Caliber) The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xbuRAiTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IMNYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 18.55}}
{"item_id": "B0002IMO3G", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Universal 6-1/2-Inch Saf-T-Clad Cleaning Rod Set (.22-.45 Caliber)", "description": "Tailored specifically for handguns, this 6½” Saf-T-Clad rod and accompanying coated patch holder covers .22-.45 pistols and revolvers with barrels up to 8”.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Universal 6-1/2-Inch Saf-T-Clad Cleaning Rod Set (.22-.45 Caliber) Tailored specifically for handguns, this 6½” Saf-T-Clad rod and accompanying coated patch holder covers .22-.45 pistols and revolvers with barrels up to 8”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21An1Q1HkKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IMO3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 12.91}}
{"item_id": "B0002IMOQI", "title": "P-11 Grip Extension", "description": "The Kel-Tec model # P-045 Grip Extension is designed to replace the original flat bottom floor plate of magazines for the KelTec model P11 (9mm) pistol and the discontinued model P40 pistol. The Grip Extension increases the length of the magazine providing extra room to grip the pistol with one additional finger for better shooting control and comfort (does NOT increase the capacity of the magazine). For uniform shooting a Grip Extension should be installed on each magazine, so the hand grip is the same no matter which your magazine is inserted into your pistol.", "text": "P-11 Grip Extension The Kel-Tec model # P-045 Grip Extension is designed to replace the original flat bottom floor plate of magazines for the KelTec model P11 (9mm) pistol and the discontinued model P40 pistol. The Grip Extension increases the length of the magazine providing extra room to grip the pistol with one additional finger for better shooting control and comfort (does NOT increase the capacity of the magazine). For uniform shooting a Grip Extension should be installed on each magazine, so the hand grip is the same no matter which your magazine is inserted into your pistol.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TJG80qAzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002IMOQI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kel Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 12.02}}
