{"item_id": "B0002INN3G", "title": "HiViz Plain Barrel Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight", "description": "The MPB Sight incorporates proven HiViz advantages in a sight for plain barrel shotguns. A uniques snap-on sight base accomodates any one of four LitePipes in green or red in two diameters", "text": "HiViz Plain Barrel Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight The MPB Sight incorporates proven HiViz advantages in a sight for plain barrel shotguns. A uniques snap-on sight base accomodates any one of four LitePipes in green or red in two diameters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41va98wOE-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INN3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 19.1}}
{"item_id": "B0002INN4A", "title": "HiViz Competition Fiber Optic Sight", "description": "This competition sight system is made to replace existing beads. It features eight LitePipes in a variety of colors and diameters, and a quick-access carrying case to allow rapid LitePipe changes to match varying light conditions.", "text": "HiViz Competition Fiber Optic Sight This competition sight system is made to replace existing beads. It features eight LitePipes in a variety of colors and diameters, and a quick-access carrying case to allow rapid LitePipe changes to match varying light conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lkJs1QI2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INN4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 28.69}}
{"item_id": "B0002INNAO", "title": "Champion Score Keeper Fluorescent Orange Bull 100-yard Sight-In Rifle Target (Pack of 12)", "description": "Champion ScoreKeper Targets off bright fluorescent colors make it easier to pick out your mark and know where you hit. A \"built-in\" record-keeping section lets you track vital data to refine your loads and zero-in on tight groups. Available for rifles, pistols, and airguns.", "text": "Champion Score Keeper Fluorescent Orange Bull 100-yard Sight-In Rifle Target (Pack of 12) Champion ScoreKeper Targets off bright fluorescent colors make it easier to pick out your mark and know where you hit. A \"built-in\" record-keeping section lets you track vital data to refine your loads and zero-in on tight groups. Available for rifles, pistols, and airguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ngSw7PcqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INNAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 6.99}}
