{"item_id": "B0002INNYU", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Government Model 1911 Rubber Finger Groove Insert", "description": "This Pearce PG-1911-1 fits under any GM 1911 side panel grip adding rubber finger grooves for comfort and better handling. Because the side portion of these grips are only 1mm thick the overall width is only minimally affected. It allows the user to use any type of side panel grips (wood, simulated ivory, pearlite, etc) and have front finger grooves.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Government Model 1911 Rubber Finger Groove Insert This Pearce PG-1911-1 fits under any GM 1911 side panel grip adding rubber finger grooves for comfort and better handling. Because the side portion of these grips are only 1mm thick the overall width is only minimally affected. It allows the user to use any type of side panel grips (wood, simulated ivory, pearlite, etc) and have front finger grooves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kOXbYLFKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INNYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B0002INO58", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus PT22 And PT25 Wrap-Around Grips", "description": "The Pearce PG-T22 soft rubber wrap around grips add comfort as well as provide a more positive hold for the shooter. This grip will fit the PT22 and PT25 models.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus PT22 And PT25 Wrap-Around Grips The Pearce PG-T22 soft rubber wrap around grips add comfort as well as provide a more positive hold for the shooter. This grip will fit the PT22 and PT25 models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DR2df1C%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INO58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.03}}
{"item_id": "B0002INOE4", "title": "Hoppe's Gun Wipes Gun Oil, Poly Bag E/F", "description": "Hoppe's Field Wipes Cloth Plastic 1631 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Hoppe's Gun Wipes Gun Oil, Poly Bag E/F Hoppe's Field Wipes Cloth Plastic 1631 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RqZAd77UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INOE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 11.04}}
{"item_id": "B0002INOL2", "title": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for Air Rifle and Pistol with Steel Rod and Box", "description": "Hoppe's airgun cleaning kit 3-piece steel rod with looped handle (rod has 5-44 male threads) 2.25-oz. Hoppe's 9 lubricating oil Brass jag .17-cal brass brush* Cleaning patches Gun care guide*The brush is .17 caliber. It will still work on your .177-caliber airguns.• While airguns don't require constant cleaning like firearms, there are times when they need to be cleaned to achieve maximum accuracy. Hoppe's has a reputation for making high-quality gun oil and cleaning accessories.", "text": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for Air Rifle and Pistol with Steel Rod and Box Hoppe's airgun cleaning kit 3-piece steel rod with looped handle (rod has 5-44 male threads) 2.25-oz. Hoppe's 9 lubricating oil Brass jag .17-cal brass brush* Cleaning patches Gun care guide*The brush is .17 caliber. It will still work on your .177-caliber airguns.• While airguns don't require constant cleaning like firearms, there are times when they need to be cleaned to achieve maximum accuracy. Hoppe's has a reputation for making high-quality gun oil and cleaning accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cAW1D599L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INOL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 17.12}}
{"item_id": "B0002INOO4", "title": "Bushnell Performance Optics BRL1 Gun Bore Light, Battery-Operated", "description": "Gun Bore Light, Now You Can Illuminate The Bore Entirely To Expose Nicks, Scratches, Pits & Fouling, Great For Safety Checks & Lighting Hard To Reach Areas, Locking Feature Can Keep Light On For Longer Inspections, Indispensable For Buyers Of Used Firearms, Uses 2 \"AAA\" Batteries, Not Included.", "text": "Bushnell Performance Optics BRL1 Gun Bore Light, Battery-Operated Gun Bore Light, Now You Can Illuminate The Bore Entirely To Expose Nicks, Scratches, Pits & Fouling, Great For Safety Checks & Lighting Hard To Reach Areas, Locking Feature Can Keep Light On For Longer Inspections, Indispensable For Buyers Of Used Firearms, Uses 2 \"AAA\" Batteries, Not Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aIIe8IgEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INOO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 7.18}}
{"item_id": "B0002INOXA", "title": "Hoppe's orange 100 yard Cross-hairs sighting Target (contains 20 targets)", "description": "HOPPE'S 100 yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Targets 14x14 20pk S10B are printed to precise NRA specifications on special target tag board or paper. Hoppes 100yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Target 14x14 comes 20 in a pack unless noted. Package Contents:Hoppes 100 yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Target 14x14 20 Per Park S-10B", "text": "Hoppe's orange 100 yard Cross-hairs sighting Target (contains 20 targets) HOPPE'S 100 yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Targets 14x14 20pk S10B are printed to precise NRA specifications on special target tag board or paper. Hoppes 100yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Target 14x14 comes 20 in a pack unless noted. Package Contents:Hoppes 100 yd. Multiple Crosshair Sighting Target 14x14 20 Per Park S-10B", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JqilQ1rrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INOXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.84}}
