{"item_id": "B0002INPG6", "title": "Pachmayr S and W K and L Frame Square Butt Presentation Grip", "description": "The first grip design developed by Frank Pachmayr. This popular grip has been the mainstay of Pachamyr's line since the beginning and it remains popular. Pachmayr Presentation Grips feature our patented design, classic styling, and a magnificent finish with deep checkering for control and a superb shiny finish. Just look in your closet at your father's revolver and you will notice that the Presentation grips look great for years and are practically indestructible. Features: - Classic styling - Deep checkered finish - Designed to help you point straight #03267 S&W; K&L; Frame Square Butt", "text": "Pachmayr S and W K and L Frame Square Butt Presentation Grip The first grip design developed by Frank Pachmayr. This popular grip has been the mainstay of Pachamyr's line since the beginning and it remains popular. Pachmayr Presentation Grips feature our patented design, classic styling, and a magnificent finish with deep checkering for control and a superb shiny finish. Just look in your closet at your father's revolver and you will notice that the Presentation grips look great for years and are practically indestructible. Features: - Classic styling - Deep checkered finish - Designed to help you point straight #03267 S&W; K&L; Frame Square Butt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oEkuE9m5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002INPG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 25.69}}
