{"item_id": "B0002TMY1C", "title": "POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball, Assorted Colors", "description": "The POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball has a multi-colored soft foam exterior for tons of outside fun in the yard, the pool or indoors. This basketball is molded to simulate the real feeling of a traditional ball and great for playing a fast paced, indoor game or just to help develop your child's shooting and passing skills. POOF foam balls have become the preferred choice by teachers for their students during indoor and outdoor school sport activities. This 4-inch ball is designed for small hands, come in assorted colors, made in the U.S.A. and is perfect for presents, party favors, Easter baskets, grab bags, prizes and stocking stuffers. The 30-year-old POOF brand includes a broad variety of foam sports balls, flying toys, water toys and activity toys for all ages. The POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball is recommended for children 5-years of age and older. POOF-Slinky, Inc. is the maker of POOF, Slinky, Ideal and Scientific Explorer Brands. Our product lines offer new exciting play with the highly successful Sno-Toys line, Fuzzoodles activity kits, as well as timeless classics, such as the original Slinky, Ideal table-top games, wood construction sets and over 400 other products.", "text": "POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball, Assorted Colors The POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball has a multi-colored soft foam exterior for tons of outside fun in the yard, the pool or indoors. This basketball is molded to simulate the real feeling of a traditional ball and great for playing a fast paced, indoor game or just to help develop your child's shooting and passing skills. POOF foam balls have become the preferred choice by teachers for their students during indoor and outdoor school sport activities. This 4-inch ball is designed for small hands, come in assorted colors, made in the U.S.A. and is perfect for presents, party favors, Easter baskets, grab bags, prizes and stocking stuffers. The 30-year-old POOF brand includes a broad variety of foam sports balls, flying toys, water toys and activity toys for all ages. The POOF-Slinky 875 POOF 4-Inch Pro Mini Foam Basketball is recommended for children 5-years of age and older. POOF-Slinky, Inc. is the maker of POOF, Slinky, Ideal and Scientific Explorer Brands. Our product lines offer new exciting play with the highly successful Sno-Toys line, Fuzzoodles activity kits, as well as timeless classics, such as the original Slinky, Ideal table-top games, wood construction sets and over 400 other products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IpA9SN-LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002TMY1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ideal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Basketballs"]], "price": 0.01}}
