{"item_id": "B0002YSK8I", "title": "Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers", "description": "FEATURES of the Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers For stoves, grill boxes and griddles Industrial EZ glide zipper Weather-resistant liner Wrap handles for added support The SPECS of the Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 17 x 8 x 2.25\" Box Weight: 2 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers FEATURES of the Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers For stoves, grill boxes and griddles Industrial EZ glide zipper Weather-resistant liner Wrap handles for added support The SPECS of the Camp Chef Carry Bag for Three Burner Cookers Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 17 x 8 x 2.25\" Box Weight: 2 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414T4XXSR3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002YSK8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B0002YUOH8", "title": "Camp Chef Expedition 3X 3 Burner Stove", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Expedition 3X 3 Burner Stove 16\" x 38 \" cooking area (608 square inches) 3 aluminum burners 90,000 BTU/hr total Matchless ignition Includes True Seasoned steel 16\" x 24\" griddle Includes paper towel holder Includes utensil holder Windscreen included 31\" cooking height The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 43 x 10 x 19\" Box Weight: 70 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Camp Chef Expedition 3X 3 Burner Stove DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Expedition 3X 3 Burner Stove 16\" x 38 \" cooking area (608 square inches) 3 aluminum burners 90,000 BTU/hr total Matchless ignition Includes True Seasoned steel 16\" x 24\" griddle Includes paper towel holder Includes utensil holder Windscreen included 31\" cooking height The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 43 x 10 x 19\" Box Weight: 70 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pa7Gq5wjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002YUOH8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 269.99}}
{"item_id": "B0002ZB5Y8", "title": "Backpackers Cache Bear Resistant Container", "description": "Garcia Machine has pioneered the development of bear resistant food containers. Since 1982 they have worked with wildlife specialists to develop light weight containers that campers can count on to keep their food safe from wild animals. Documented studies have shown that the use of these containers has drastically reduced the seriousness and frequency of camper/bear incidents. Keeping your backpacking food from wild animals is crucial for an enjoyable and safe outdoor experience. Allowing bears access to human food can lead to dangerous conditioned behavior. It is tragic that every year nuisance bears that become a threat to humans must be destroyed. The Model 812 Backpackers' Cache will keep your food and the bears safe. PRODUCT FEATURES: Material: ABS polymer Model 812 Backpackers' Cache: 8.8\" dia. X 12\" long, weight 2.7 lbs. Capacity: 614 cubic inches Holds approximately 6 person-days of food. 812 , Backpackers Cache Bear Resistant Container , bear vault , rear resistant container , backpacking hiking , bear country", "text": "Backpackers Cache Bear Resistant Container Garcia Machine has pioneered the development of bear resistant food containers. Since 1982 they have worked with wildlife specialists to develop light weight containers that campers can count on to keep their food safe from wild animals. Documented studies have shown that the use of these containers has drastically reduced the seriousness and frequency of camper/bear incidents. Keeping your backpacking food from wild animals is crucial for an enjoyable and safe outdoor experience. Allowing bears access to human food can lead to dangerous conditioned behavior. It is tragic that every year nuisance bears that become a threat to humans must be destroyed. The Model 812 Backpackers' Cache will keep your food and the bears safe. PRODUCT FEATURES: Material: ABS polymer Model 812 Backpackers' Cache: 8.8\" dia. X 12\" long, weight 2.7 lbs. Capacity: 614 cubic inches Holds approximately 6 person-days of food. 812 , Backpackers Cache Bear Resistant Container , bear vault , rear resistant container , backpacking hiking , bear country", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bjHPuyEAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0002ZB5Y8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Garcia Machine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B00030A0C0", "title": "Berkley Trilene XL Filler Spools", "description": "The Trilene XL is America's most trusted Monofilament. Allowing for smooth casting anglers are saying it's America's favorite! It has world class quality, technology and innovation to help you catch more fish.", "text": "Berkley Trilene XL Filler Spools The Trilene XL is America's most trusted Monofilament. Allowing for smooth casting anglers are saying it's America's favorite! It has world class quality, technology and innovation to help you catch more fish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WJ3NML-KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00030A0C0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00030BFEM", "title": "DuPont Teflon Multi-Use Lubricant Squeeze Bottle, 4 Oz.", "description": "DuPont Multi-Use with Teflon Fluoropolymer is a high-performance general purpose lubricant with extreme corrosion and wear protection. Water repelling, silicone-free formula protects against heavy moisture and rust. Formulated with Teflon for longer lubricant life, enhanced wear protection, better high and low temperature range and increased resistance to water. Resists extreme temperatures from -30°F to +300°F.", "text": "DuPont Teflon Multi-Use Lubricant Squeeze Bottle, 4 Oz. DuPont Multi-Use with Teflon Fluoropolymer is a high-performance general purpose lubricant with extreme corrosion and wear protection. Water repelling, silicone-free formula protects against heavy moisture and rust. Formulated with Teflon for longer lubricant life, enhanced wear protection, better high and low temperature range and increased resistance to water. Resists extreme temperatures from -30°F to +300°F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4182CtpuCGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00030BFEM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B00030DLEE", "title": "RoadPro 12-Volt Portable Stove, Black", "description": "Heat things up while on the go with this 12-volt portable stove. Hungry? This handy portable stove warms food up to 300 degrees and is easy to bring along. It can be used to heat most kinds of pre-cooked food, and is ideal for stews, beans, chops, rice meals, hot dishes/goulash, and more. It doesn't consume much power but will heat a good-sized portion in approximately one hour. Plugs into most 12V lighter-type sockets.", "text": "RoadPro 12-Volt Portable Stove, Black Heat things up while on the go with this 12-volt portable stove. Hungry? This handy portable stove warms food up to 300 degrees and is easy to bring along. It can be used to heat most kinds of pre-cooked food, and is ideal for stews, beans, chops, rice meals, hot dishes/goulash, and more. It doesn't consume much power but will heat a good-sized portion in approximately one hour. Plugs into most 12V lighter-type sockets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NsAw5dRlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00030DLEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RoadPro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 25.85}}
{"item_id": "B0003I68RS", "title": "Fat Cat 11.5g Texas Hold Em Poker Chip Set - 500 Chips", "description": "Aluminum Case. 11.5 Gram Chips. 50 black chips, 150 red chips, 100 blue chips, 50 green chips, 150 white chips. 2 sets of playing cards. big blind button and small blind button.", "text": "Fat Cat 11.5g Texas Hold Em Poker Chip Set - 500 Chips Aluminum Case. 11.5 Gram Chips. 50 black chips, 150 red chips, 100 blue chips, 50 green chips, 150 white chips. 2 sets of playing cards. big blind button and small blind button.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mf1fvTYHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0003I68RS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fat Cat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Poker Equipment", "Poker Chips"]], "price": 55.5}}
{"item_id": "B0004L7QIY", "title": "Standard Lesche Digging Tool & Sod Cutter (Right Serrated Blade)", "description": "This double-edged digger has a saw tooth edge on one side of the blade to cut through roots and a blade on the other to cut through tuff grass and dirt. The Lesche digging tool has a comfortable rubber grip handle with hand guard plate. Will cut plugs in soil quickly. The digger is 12\" overall and made in the USA out of Chrome-Moly steel. Comes with a Cordura belt sheath.", "text": "Standard Lesche Digging Tool & Sod Cutter (Right Serrated Blade) This double-edged digger has a saw tooth edge on one side of the blade to cut through roots and a blade on the other to cut through tuff grass and dirt. The Lesche digging tool has a comfortable rubber grip handle with hand guard plate. Will cut plugs in soil quickly. The digger is 12\" overall and made in the USA out of Chrome-Moly steel. Comes with a Cordura belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HcVfAHulL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0004L7QIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lesche", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 36.9}}
{"item_id": "B000621XJO", "title": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (10-Function)", "description": "CrankBrothers Multi-10 Tool The Crank Brothers Multi 10 Tool has a design that's simple and functional. It features 10 basic tools for essential tightening and adjustments, with a few welcome extras that the minimalists generally miss, like Phillips head and flathead screwdriver bits, and a T-25 Torx driver for the hard-to-fit mystery bolts on your disc brakes. Of course the Multi 10 also has the ubiquitous Allen wrench set, and Crank Brothers' comforting lifetime warranty should you somehow manage to break it. Specs: Weight - 124 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "text": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (10-Function) CrankBrothers Multi-10 Tool The Crank Brothers Multi 10 Tool has a design that's simple and functional. It features 10 basic tools for essential tightening and adjustments, with a few welcome extras that the minimalists generally miss, like Phillips head and flathead screwdriver bits, and a T-25 Torx driver for the hard-to-fit mystery bolts on your disc brakes. Of course the Multi 10 also has the ubiquitous Allen wrench set, and Crank Brothers' comforting lifetime warranty should you somehow manage to break it. Specs: Weight - 124 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sucEfREDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000621XJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 12.49}}
