{"item_id": "B00063RXM4", "title": "Lodge LCK3 Pre-Seasoned Country Kettle, 1-pint", "description": "This is the way soups, stew and chili should always be served; good and hot out of a real pre-seasoned cast iron country kettle. Wire bail for easy handling. Great for Salsa and other dips. 5\" diameter, 2 1/2\" deep", "text": "Lodge LCK3 Pre-Seasoned Country Kettle, 1-pint This is the way soups, stew and chili should always be served; good and hot out of a real pre-seasoned cast iron country kettle. Wire bail for easy handling. Great for Salsa and other dips. 5\" diameter, 2 1/2\" deep", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419X2QXRGNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00063RXM4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lodge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 10.5}}
{"item_id": "B000646U3Q", "title": "Coleman Stove Pressure Regulator, Pipe + Valve", "description": "Replacement pressure regulator (pipe and valve) is easy to install and works in Coleman stove models 5413, 5423, 5420A, 5425A, 5426, 5430B, 5435B, 5435C, and 5433.", "text": "Coleman Stove Pressure Regulator, Pipe + Valve Replacement pressure regulator (pipe and valve) is easy to install and works in Coleman stove models 5413, 5423, 5420A, 5425A, 5426, 5430B, 5435B, 5435C, and 5433.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-19jOA5RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000646U3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00064KA1Y", "title": "Men's Classic Padded Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking", "description": "A classic padded bike short from Aero Tech Designs. The Classic Short is the ideal short for the cyclist who wants excellent comfort and performance during your ride. Sewn from premium quality, four-way stretch tricot fabric, the Classic Short moves fluidly with the your body while in the cycling motion. This short has a smooth, two-panel construction and a seamless pad that reduces the opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. For your comfort, these shorts do not have leg grippers but they will stay in place because they are made from the highest quality fabric. The Classic Shorts utlize muscle compression to add comfort on longer rides and reward your hard work on the bike while the cross-grain cutting technique used to construct the shorts maximizes the stretch performance of spandex fabric. Our fabric is four-way, 7 1/2 oz, nylon/lycra, tricot knit - THE BEST! Coverstitched and tacked soft elastic is used for the waistband for added durability and comfort and the crotch padding is multi-layered with padding in the places it is needed most - Perfecto. The pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber that is laminated to foam and tricot. It is also antibacterial and stays dry longer to inhibit the growth of bacteria. You want Comfort on the bicycle, and that's what these shorts deliver.", "text": "Men's Classic Padded Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking A classic padded bike short from Aero Tech Designs. The Classic Short is the ideal short for the cyclist who wants excellent comfort and performance during your ride. Sewn from premium quality, four-way stretch tricot fabric, the Classic Short moves fluidly with the your body while in the cycling motion. This short has a smooth, two-panel construction and a seamless pad that reduces the opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. For your comfort, these shorts do not have leg grippers but they will stay in place because they are made from the highest quality fabric. The Classic Shorts utlize muscle compression to add comfort on longer rides and reward your hard work on the bike while the cross-grain cutting technique used to construct the shorts maximizes the stretch performance of spandex fabric. Our fabric is four-way, 7 1/2 oz, nylon/lycra, tricot knit - THE BEST! Coverstitched and tacked soft elastic is used for the waistband for added durability and comfort and the crotch padding is multi-layered with padding in the places it is needed most - Perfecto. The pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber that is laminated to foam and tricot. It is also antibacterial and stays dry longer to inhibit the growth of bacteria. You want Comfort on the bicycle, and that's what these shorts deliver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VM5HYp4lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00064KA1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000650YAU", "title": "Thomson Elite Bicycle Seatpost", "description": "A stupendously high-quality non-setback seatpost that sets the standard for saddle adjustability and overall precision. The post and cradle are machined from one piece of 7000-series aluminum. Uses a 2-bolt design that allows you to nose your saddle up or down through adjustments to the bolts. 41mm seat rail grip. At 180g it rivals the lightness of carbon posts that cost twice as much.", "text": "Thomson Elite Bicycle Seatpost A stupendously high-quality non-setback seatpost that sets the standard for saddle adjustability and overall precision. The post and cradle are machined from one piece of 7000-series aluminum. Uses a 2-bolt design that allows you to nose your saddle up or down through adjustments to the bolts. 41mm seat rail grip. At 180g it rivals the lightness of carbon posts that cost twice as much.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nFt3t7bCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000650YAU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000651134", "title": "Park Tool WAG-4 Professional Wheel Alignment Gauge", "description": "For a wheel to perform properly, it is important for the rim to be centered between the locknuts of the hub, or “dished”. To check this, and to make precision adjustments, a wheel alignment gauge (also called a “dishing tool”) is a must. The WAG-4 allows easy checking of the dish on road, mountain, or BMX wheels from 16” to 29”. It works with any hub width and its innovative design even allows it to be accurately used with the tire still on the wheel. An accurate and truly versatile wheel alignment gauge that belongs along side every truing stand.", "text": "Park Tool WAG-4 Professional Wheel Alignment Gauge For a wheel to perform properly, it is important for the rim to be centered between the locknuts of the hub, or “dished”. To check this, and to make precision adjustments, a wheel alignment gauge (also called a “dishing tool”) is a must. The WAG-4 allows easy checking of the dish on road, mountain, or BMX wheels from 16” to 29”. It works with any hub width and its innovative design even allows it to be accurately used with the tire still on the wheel. An accurate and truly versatile wheel alignment gauge that belongs along side every truing stand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mIQ6BwowL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000651134.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 49.46}}
