{"item_id": "B00065X222", "title": "OPTP Stretch Out Strap with Exercise Booklet", "description": "The patented STRETCH OUT Strap delivers the benefits of assisted stretching without a partner. Multiple loops permit deep, gradual stretching of major muscle groups with greater safety, control and effectiveness than is possible unaided. Strap comes with the STRETCH OUT Strap Guide, which features over 30 stretches emphasizing contract-relax techniques. REVISED EDITION Instructional Guide: New color photos Over 30 stretches featuring contract-relax techniques Anatomical illustrations for quick reference Softcover, 40 page booklet", "text": "OPTP Stretch Out Strap with Exercise Booklet The patented STRETCH OUT Strap delivers the benefits of assisted stretching without a partner. Multiple loops permit deep, gradual stretching of major muscle groups with greater safety, control and effectiveness than is possible unaided. Strap comes with the STRETCH OUT Strap Guide, which features over 30 stretches emphasizing contract-relax techniques. REVISED EDITION Instructional Guide: New color photos Over 30 stretches featuring contract-relax techniques Anatomical illustrations for quick reference Softcover, 40 page booklet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Qr%2BYYX8-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00065X222.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OPTP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 11.89}}
{"item_id": "B0006605US", "title": "Umarex USA Rotary Magazine .177, 8 Round, 3-Pack", "description": "8-shot Rotary Magazine Made for Various Pellet Guns including: - Walther CP Sport - Walther CP99 - Walther CP88 - Walther NightHawk - Walther Lever Action Rifle - Magnum Research Desert Eagle - Colt 1911 A1 - Beretta M92FS - Beretta XX-Treme - H&K; P30", "text": "Umarex USA Rotary Magazine .177, 8 Round, 3-Pack 8-shot Rotary Magazine Made for Various Pellet Guns including: - Walther CP Sport - Walther CP99 - Walther CP88 - Walther NightHawk - Walther Lever Action Rifle - Magnum Research Desert Eagle - Colt 1911 A1 - Beretta M92FS - Beretta XX-Treme - H&K; P30", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314cCpz7HnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006605US.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 16.37}}
