{"item_id": "B00066YTGO", "title": "Yakima Tube Top Frame Adapter", "description": "The Yakima Tube Top adapts bike frames without top tubes so they fit Yakima ROC or GetAway bike mounts. It's a clever little invention! The Tube Top creates a top tube for any bike that doesn't have one (children's, women's or Y-frame style bikes).", "text": "Yakima Tube Top Frame Adapter The Yakima Tube Top adapts bike frames without top tubes so they fit Yakima ROC or GetAway bike mounts. It's a clever little invention! The Tube Top creates a top tube for any bike that doesn't have one (children's, women's or Y-frame style bikes).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21SS3CD1C7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00066YTGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yakima", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 39.0}}
{"item_id": "B00066Z07G", "title": "Yakima Q Clip Set", "description": "The Yakima Q Clips - 1 pair, are essential to mount Q Towers and are designed specifically for your vehicle. If you're not sure which Q clips you need (depends on your vehicle), please call us and we'll be glad to help, 800-409-4502.", "text": "Yakima Q Clip Set The Yakima Q Clips - 1 pair, are essential to mount Q Towers and are designed specifically for your vehicle. If you're not sure which Q clips you need (depends on your vehicle), please call us and we'll be glad to help, 800-409-4502.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TAbwDDCAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00066Z07G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]]}}
