{"item_id": "B0006968YM", "title": "3M Peltor SV Tactical Pro Hearing Protector", "description": "Tactical Pro's unique frequency response amplifies signals and voices with near-perfect sound reproduction, while at the same time, instantaneously suppressing dangerous sounds without clipping. Liquid gel filled ear cushions with a folding steel band that is padded for comfort. Ergonomic 3 button touchpad. Audio jack for radio connections.", "text": "3M Peltor SV Tactical Pro Hearing Protector Tactical Pro's unique frequency response amplifies signals and voices with near-perfect sound reproduction, while at the same time, instantaneously suppressing dangerous sounds without clipping. Liquid gel filled ear cushions with a folding steel band that is padded for comfort. Ergonomic 3 button touchpad. Audio jack for radio connections.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LrJnsTybL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006968YM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 430.0}}
