{"item_id": "B00069PP8M", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 15 ct. CO2 (Silver, 12 gm)", "description": "Daisy CO2 cylinders offer a top-quality, clean, dependable gas source for your airgun shooting that will deliver consistent, reliable shots. Standard 12 gm CO2 cylinders fit most CO2-powered airguns. Pack of (15) 12 gram CO2 cylinders.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 15 ct. CO2 (Silver, 12 gm) Daisy CO2 cylinders offer a top-quality, clean, dependable gas source for your airgun shooting that will deliver consistent, reliable shots. Standard 12 gm CO2 cylinders fit most CO2-powered airguns. Pack of (15) 12 gram CO2 cylinders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61zXuLG3KxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00069PP8M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 15.79}}
