{"item_id": "B00069PPC8", "title": "Crosman Competition .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 500ct", "description": "Wadcutter pellets are ideal for paper targets. The flat nose punches a crisper, rounder hole in paper targets, for easy scoring. 500 Wadcutter pellets in a tin.", "text": "Crosman Competition .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 500ct Wadcutter pellets are ideal for paper targets. The flat nose punches a crisper, rounder hole in paper targets, for easy scoring. 500 Wadcutter pellets in a tin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51giLrJcjPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00069PPC8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 3.93}}
{"item_id": "B00069PPDW", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Lead Free .177 Pellets (Silver, 4.5 mm)", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For target practice, you can't do better than Daisy's flat-nose pellets. They are great for target practice at home on the range. Daisy flat-nose pellets are also available lead-free. The flat head makes an distinguished impact on paper targets that let's you accuracy score shots.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Lead Free .177 Pellets (Silver, 4.5 mm) Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For target practice, you can't do better than Daisy's flat-nose pellets. They are great for target practice at home on the range. Daisy flat-nose pellets are also available lead-free. The flat head makes an distinguished impact on paper targets that let's you accuracy score shots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GlzcgogYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00069PPDW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 8.54}}
{"item_id": "B00069PQ5Y", "title": "Marksman BB .177 Air Pistol", "description": "The Marksman Repeater is a fast loading, easy to use air pistol that fires 18 shots without reloading. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List). Specifications: Velocity: 200fps; Power Source: Spring Piston; Cocking Action: Slide; Ammo: .177 BBs, Pellets, Darts and Bolts; Clamshell Packaging.", "text": "Marksman BB .177 Air Pistol The Marksman Repeater is a fast loading, easy to use air pistol that fires 18 shots without reloading. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List). Specifications: Velocity: 200fps; Power Source: Spring Piston; Cocking Action: Slide; Ammo: .177 BBs, Pellets, Darts and Bolts; Clamshell Packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C2peVAukL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00069PQ5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marksman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 19.99}}
