{"item_id": "B0006A4BEU", "title": "Tasco Rimfire 4x 15mm Crosshair Reticle Riflescope", "description": "Equip your small caliber for big time precision and plinking enjoyment with a Tasco Rimfire series riflescope. An affordable accuracy upgrade, they're specially calibrated for shorter distances and feature coated optics for bright clear images.", "text": "Tasco Rimfire 4x 15mm Crosshair Reticle Riflescope Equip your small caliber for big time precision and plinking enjoyment with a Tasco Rimfire series riflescope. An affordable accuracy upgrade, they're specially calibrated for shorter distances and feature coated optics for bright clear images.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Eg3QyesvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006A4BEU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 7.75}}
