{"item_id": "B0006B6SVI", "title": "Primos Box Cutter", "description": "Go ahead, -InchCut Loose-Inch with the Box Cutter! The Box Cutter-Feets thumb hole groove positions your thumb perfectly so it acts as a spring allowing you to make the sweetest cuts a box call can make. Cuts are critical for getting that boss gobbler to respond. When he gobbles to your cuts, call him all the way in with the irresistible purrs, yelps, cackles, and clucks produced by the Box Cutter. The Box Cutter is crafted with a jatoba lid and a solid mahogany box. Jatoba is commonly found on the slopes of high riverbanks in Central America and it is considered one of the most durable of hardwoods. If you want a box call with the high-quality sound of an expensive custom box call, without the high price, here it is.", "text": "Primos Box Cutter Go ahead, -InchCut Loose-Inch with the Box Cutter! The Box Cutter-Feets thumb hole groove positions your thumb perfectly so it acts as a spring allowing you to make the sweetest cuts a box call can make. Cuts are critical for getting that boss gobbler to respond. When he gobbles to your cuts, call him all the way in with the irresistible purrs, yelps, cackles, and clucks produced by the Box Cutter. The Box Cutter is crafted with a jatoba lid and a solid mahogany box. Jatoba is commonly found on the slopes of high riverbanks in Central America and it is considered one of the most durable of hardwoods. If you want a box call with the high-quality sound of an expensive custom box call, without the high price, here it is.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JNb-y38sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006B6SVI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 15.7}}
