{"item_id": "B0006B7EUW", "title": "GAMO Flat Nose .22 Caliber Match Pellets (Tin of 250)", "description": "This is a precision pellet. A relatively light weight and flat head that cuts targets cleanly makes this pellet tops for shooters wanting tight groups.", "text": "GAMO Flat Nose .22 Caliber Match Pellets (Tin of 250) This is a precision pellet. A relatively light weight and flat head that cuts targets cleanly makes this pellet tops for shooters wanting tight groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zbnIgXMvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006B7EUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B0006FLBSO", "title": "Gripmaster Hand Exerciser", "description": "Use the GRIPMASTER Hand Strengthener, for outstanding hand, wrist, and forearm strength, critical to climbers. The consistent ability to securely grasp & lock onto a crag or burr is essential. No other hand exerciser on the planet can isolate and develop each finger individually like the patented GRIPMASTER.", "text": "Gripmaster Hand Exerciser Use the GRIPMASTER Hand Strengthener, for outstanding hand, wrist, and forearm strength, critical to climbers. The consistent ability to securely grasp & lock onto a crag or burr is essential. No other hand exerciser on the planet can isolate and develop each finger individually like the patented GRIPMASTER.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KpiW25GXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006FLBSO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gripmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 10.25}}
