{"item_id": "B0006M3RCK", "title": "GOGO Thick Solid Color Headband / Sweatband", "description": "Type: Headbands, sweatbands Size: Approximately 7\" x 2\" (approximately 17cm x 5cm), fit most men and women Material: 90% cotton and 10% lycra, extra thick Packaging: One head sweat band per poly bag Color: Solid color, black, white, red, etc. Features: * Double layer is designed to hold sweat effectively, to help you feel good when doing sports. * Comfortable to wear around head and be of durability, it would work for a long term indeed. * Fourteen beautiful colors for your choices. What's more, the color stays bright after times of washing. * Perfect in all kinds of sports activities like basketball, football, tennis, soccer, jogging and so on.", "text": "GOGO Thick Solid Color Headband / Sweatband Type: Headbands, sweatbands Size: Approximately 7\" x 2\" (approximately 17cm x 5cm), fit most men and women Material: 90% cotton and 10% lycra, extra thick Packaging: One head sweat band per poly bag Color: Solid color, black, white, red, etc. Features: * Double layer is designed to hold sweat effectively, to help you feel good when doing sports. * Comfortable to wear around head and be of durability, it would work for a long term indeed. * Fourteen beautiful colors for your choices. What's more, the color stays bright after times of washing. * Perfect in all kinds of sports activities like basketball, football, tennis, soccer, jogging and so on.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kdBk0baGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006M3RCK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 1.99}}
