{"item_id": "B0006MY8M8", "title": "UTG Airsoft UHC 1911 Pistol", "description": "This precision airsoft pistol from UTG features a full magazine, metal trigger and hammer, and a solid, lifelike feel. Powered by a tension spring-operated mechanism, the pistol additionally has a touch pin point atop the inner barrel, creating backspin on BB rounds in order to compensate for bullet drop and boost firing accuracy.SpecificationsSpring-powered air pistolFixed hop-up22-round magazine8.5-inch length1.25-pound weightWarrantyThis Leapers tactical product includes a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About UTGUTG is a brand owned by Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan. Leapers has supplied shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company maintains manufacturing operations in the USA, and continues to focus on emerging market trends and customer feedback in designing its extensive product line.", "text": "UTG Airsoft UHC 1911 Pistol This precision airsoft pistol from UTG features a full magazine, metal trigger and hammer, and a solid, lifelike feel. Powered by a tension spring-operated mechanism, the pistol additionally has a touch pin point atop the inner barrel, creating backspin on BB rounds in order to compensate for bullet drop and boost firing accuracy.SpecificationsSpring-powered air pistolFixed hop-up22-round magazine8.5-inch length1.25-pound weightWarrantyThis Leapers tactical product includes a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About UTGUTG is a brand owned by Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan. Leapers has supplied shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company maintains manufacturing operations in the USA, and continues to focus on emerging market trends and customer feedback in designing its extensive product line.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qFemWAYDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0006MY8M8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 20.59}}
