{"item_id": "B00074H8EK", "title": "Harbinger Basic Hand Grip Strengthening Grip", "description": "Harbinger's Hand Grip is perfect for the intermediate trainer looking to increase hand strength. The Hand Grip features a contoured handle that fits the natural shape of your hand, making it comfortable to use. The heavy-duty resistance mechanism provides consistent tension, and the plasti-grip handle coating provides a no-slip grip.", "text": "Harbinger Basic Hand Grip Strengthening Grip Harbinger's Hand Grip is perfect for the intermediate trainer looking to increase hand strength. The Hand Grip features a contoured handle that fits the natural shape of your hand, making it comfortable to use. The heavy-duty resistance mechanism provides consistent tension, and the plasti-grip handle coating provides a no-slip grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512ePMfuFLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00074H8EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harbinger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 9.79}}
