{"item_id": "B00074T4WE", "title": "Harbinger 1260 Men's Training Grip Gloves", "description": "Specially designed for men, this pair of Harbinger training grip gloves is ideal for frequent lifters and all-around weight trainers. The gloves are distinguished by a set of TechGel comfort pads, which mold comfortably to your hands to protect them from the stresses of active training. The unique Comfort Tech fabrics, meanwhile, remain supple and comfortable even after cleaning. And lifters will love the adjustable wrist closure--which creates a comfortable, customized fit--and the flexible, natural-feeling curved finger design. Other details include extended fingers to maximize hand protection and your choice of black/blue and charcoal/black colors. Note: the gloves should be hand washed to remove salt and oils and preserve the original fit.", "text": "Harbinger 1260 Men's Training Grip Gloves Specially designed for men, this pair of Harbinger training grip gloves is ideal for frequent lifters and all-around weight trainers. The gloves are distinguished by a set of TechGel comfort pads, which mold comfortably to your hands to protect them from the stresses of active training. The unique Comfort Tech fabrics, meanwhile, remain supple and comfortable even after cleaning. And lifters will love the adjustable wrist closure--which creates a comfortable, customized fit--and the flexible, natural-feeling curved finger design. Other details include extended fingers to maximize hand protection and your choice of black/blue and charcoal/black colors. Note: the gloves should be hand washed to remove salt and oils and preserve the original fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FBPtKbn0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00074T4WE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00075FG02", "title": "Serfas Performance RX Bicycle Saddle", "description": "The seat that started the low pressure revolution! Covered by Good Housekeeping, Mens Journal, and other top magazines, this seat has always been known to substancially improve any numbness problem.", "text": "Serfas Performance RX Bicycle Saddle The seat that started the low pressure revolution! Covered by Good Housekeeping, Mens Journal, and other top magazines, this seat has always been known to substancially improve any numbness problem.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zed2HHeHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00075FG02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 69.99}}
