{"item_id": "B00077D7TC", "title": "Handgun Cleaning Pad 16 x 20\"", "description": "Gun Cleaning Pads! Felt-like fabric with Zorb-Tech anti-flow absorbency to stop spills from spreading. Bonded waterproof backing prevents \"soak through.\" Keeps your parts in place. Durable, stain resistant, lightweight and portable. Machine washable / dryable. Order ONLINE Now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Longgun Cleaning Pad, 16 x 54\" - word search in our Store for 'Cleaning Pads'. Handgun Cleaning Pad, 16 x 20\"", "text": "Handgun Cleaning Pad 16 x 20\" Gun Cleaning Pads! Felt-like fabric with Zorb-Tech anti-flow absorbency to stop spills from spreading. Bonded waterproof backing prevents \"soak through.\" Keeps your parts in place. Durable, stain resistant, lightweight and portable. Machine washable / dryable. Order ONLINE Now! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Longgun Cleaning Pad, 16 x 54\" - word search in our Store for 'Cleaning Pads'. Handgun Cleaning Pad, 16 x 20\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WHnV5fnuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00077D7TC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Drymate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 11.52}}
{"item_id": "B00077D7TM", "title": "Drymate Gun Cleaning Pad, 16x54-Inch", "description": "America's #1 selling gun cleaning pad. Protects your table and firearms from scratches and spilled gun cleaning fluids. Perfect for rifles, shotguns, muzzleloaders and handguns. The clear bonded backing prevents \"soak-thru\". Keeps gun parts organized and in place. Durable, stain resistant and long lasting.", "text": "Drymate Gun Cleaning Pad, 16x54-Inch America's #1 selling gun cleaning pad. Protects your table and firearms from scratches and spilled gun cleaning fluids. Perfect for rifles, shotguns, muzzleloaders and handguns. The clear bonded backing prevents \"soak-thru\". Keeps gun parts organized and in place. Durable, stain resistant and long lasting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bBBISejeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00077D7TM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Drymate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 11.82}}
{"item_id": "B00077ZDUS", "title": "Curt Receiver Adapter Sleeve Adapts 2 inch to 1 1/4 inch", "description": "Curt Receiver Adapter. 1-Pc. unit used for converting the size of your vehicle's receiving tube to either 1 1/4\" or 2\". Heavy-duty steel construction, glossy powder coat. Durable, corrosion resistant. State Size. Order Today! Model No. 45770, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 4\"; Model No. 45775, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 9 1/2\"; Model No. 45780, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 15\"; Curt Receiver Adapter Sleeve, Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\"", "text": "Curt Receiver Adapter Sleeve Adapts 2 inch to 1 1/4 inch Curt Receiver Adapter. 1-Pc. unit used for converting the size of your vehicle's receiving tube to either 1 1/4\" or 2\". Heavy-duty steel construction, glossy powder coat. Durable, corrosion resistant. State Size. Order Today! Model No. 45770, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 4\"; Model No. 45775, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 9 1/2\"; Model No. 45780, Capacity 3,500 lbs., Receiver Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\", Extends 15\"; Curt Receiver Adapter Sleeve, Adapts 2\" to 1 1/4\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xt15RNLwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00077ZDUS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories"]]}}
