{"item_id": "B0007917D8", "title": "gearup The Grand Stand Single Bike Floor Stand, Black", "description": "The Grandstand single bike rack offers portable, lightweight storage. Ideal take-along storage for races and rallies. Stable convenient storage at home, at the office, or in the garage. Engineering grade ABS plastic molded construction is rugged and waterproof and adjustable to fit tires up to 2 ¼ \" wide.", "text": "gearup The Grand Stand Single Bike Floor Stand, Black The Grandstand single bike rack offers portable, lightweight storage. Ideal take-along storage for races and rallies. Stable convenient storage at home, at the office, or in the garage. Engineering grade ABS plastic molded construction is rugged and waterproof and adjustable to fit tires up to 2 ¼ \" wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513d%2B48zGEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007917D8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GearUp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 17.99}}
