{"item_id": "B00079YTS8", "title": "Coghlans 9560 Emergency Stove", "description": "Coghlan's 9560 Emergency Stove - Light, strong and compact. Requires no liquids, no priming, no wick and no pressure - the ideal emergency stove. Twenty four Fuel Tablets included. Uses any solid fuel such as Hexamine, Trioxane or Sterno.", "text": "Coghlans 9560 Emergency Stove Coghlan's 9560 Emergency Stove - Light, strong and compact. Requires no liquids, no priming, no wick and no pressure - the ideal emergency stove. Twenty four Fuel Tablets included. Uses any solid fuel such as Hexamine, Trioxane or Sterno.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N0AGbmwkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00079YTS8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 6.99}}
