{"item_id": "B0007L8108", "title": "Coghlan's Folding Stove", "description": "Coghlan's Folding Stove is convienent and easy to use. It burns Coghlan's Camp Heat or any other type of canned fuel. Built for outdoor use with coated steel construction.", "text": "Coghlan's Folding Stove Coghlan's Folding Stove is convienent and easy to use. It burns Coghlan's Camp Heat or any other type of canned fuel. Built for outdoor use with coated steel construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510dQy0J%2BmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007L8108.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 8.55}}
