{"item_id": "B0007VB4NE", "title": "Gaiam Balance Ball Chairs", "description": "The Gaiam Balance Ball Chair, developed under the consultation of chiropractic pioneer Dr. Randy Weinzoff, greatly alleviates the aching back/legs/arms syndrome that comes from working at a desk for hours. Designed for people between 5-feet and 5-feet, 11-inches tall, this unique chair employs the same balance ball used in your workout routine, but with an adjustable support bar, easy-glide casters, an air pump, and a desktop guide to help keep you moving. Designed by leading health and fitness experts, the Gaiam Balance Ball chair helps relieve pain and promote proper spinal alignment, posture, a healthier back, and overall well-being.The Balance Ball Chair is an effective tool for strengthening core muscles and improving spinal alignment.Specifications:The height of the back of the chair is 2.5 feet tallThe base measures 20 inches wide from one side of the wheels to the otherComes with 2 locking back casters and 2 regular front castersSome assembly is requiredDimensions: 21 by 31 by 22 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13 poundsWeight Capacity: 300 poundsWhat's in the Box?Gaiam Balance Ball chair, air pumpSpecial Note:For optimal performance, it may be necessary to re-inflate your new Balance Ball once or twice after the initial inflation. Once your chair is assembled and the Balance Ball is inflated, re-check the ball size the next day. If necessary, add additional air and check once more the following day. Your new Balance Ball may need a day or two to \"stretch\" to its final size (which should then fit perfectly in the base).About GaiamGaiam was created as a lifestyle company with the vision that, given a choice, people would choose a lifestyle that is healthy and life-enhancing, for themselves, their families, and the Earth. The Gaiam lifestyle is a vote for individual health as well as the future sustainability of the Earth's resources. Gaiam strives to provide customers with alternatives to traditional products by offering natural or healthy versions that compare with the style, quality, and price of conventional products.", "text": "Gaiam Balance Ball Chairs The Gaiam Balance Ball Chair, developed under the consultation of chiropractic pioneer Dr. Randy Weinzoff, greatly alleviates the aching back/legs/arms syndrome that comes from working at a desk for hours. Designed for people between 5-feet and 5-feet, 11-inches tall, this unique chair employs the same balance ball used in your workout routine, but with an adjustable support bar, easy-glide casters, an air pump, and a desktop guide to help keep you moving. Designed by leading health and fitness experts, the Gaiam Balance Ball chair helps relieve pain and promote proper spinal alignment, posture, a healthier back, and overall well-being.The Balance Ball Chair is an effective tool for strengthening core muscles and improving spinal alignment.Specifications:The height of the back of the chair is 2.5 feet tallThe base measures 20 inches wide from one side of the wheels to the otherComes with 2 locking back casters and 2 regular front castersSome assembly is requiredDimensions: 21 by 31 by 22 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13 poundsWeight Capacity: 300 poundsWhat's in the Box?Gaiam Balance Ball chair, air pumpSpecial Note:For optimal performance, it may be necessary to re-inflate your new Balance Ball once or twice after the initial inflation. Once your chair is assembled and the Balance Ball is inflated, re-check the ball size the next day. If necessary, add additional air and check once more the following day. Your new Balance Ball may need a day or two to \"stretch\" to its final size (which should then fit perfectly in the base).About GaiamGaiam was created as a lifestyle company with the vision that, given a choice, people would choose a lifestyle that is healthy and life-enhancing, for themselves, their families, and the Earth. The Gaiam lifestyle is a vote for individual health as well as the future sustainability of the Earth's resources. Gaiam strives to provide customers with alternatives to traditional products by offering natural or healthy versions that compare with the style, quality, and price of conventional products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N8j%2B91kHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VB4NE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gaiam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 100.88}}
{"item_id": "B0007VBRUE", "title": "Bounty Hunter BHJS Junior Metal Detector", "description": "Bounty Hunter's Junior Metal Detector gives you professional metal-detecting functions in a compact, lightweight package. Detecting coin-sized objects up to 5\" deep and larger objects to 3 ft., it also has discrimination control eliminating unwanted metals, while the target indicator meter measures signal strength. To determine approximate depth, the volume of the signal increases as targets get closer. Easy to use for youth through adult metal detecting and backed by Bounty Hunter's 1 year warranty.", "text": "Bounty Hunter BHJS Junior Metal Detector Bounty Hunter's Junior Metal Detector gives you professional metal-detecting functions in a compact, lightweight package. Detecting coin-sized objects up to 5\" deep and larger objects to 3 ft., it also has discrimination control eliminating unwanted metals, while the target indicator meter measures signal strength. To determine approximate depth, the volume of the signal increases as targets get closer. Easy to use for youth through adult metal detecting and backed by Bounty Hunter's 1 year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nV7I3FURL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VBRUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bounty Hunter", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Helmets"]], "price": 38.99}}
{"item_id": "B0007VHXLG", "title": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Large Magnum Tactical Spray", "description": "The MAGNUM line is perfect for individuals and private security requiring larger sizes. Weighs 4.36 ounces, 122 grams, 128.9 ml and contains approximately 35 bursts. Has a heavy cone spray pattern and sprays up to 12 feet with the center of face as the point of aim. The MAGNUM line is available in locking-top, flip-top and holster models.", "text": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Large Magnum Tactical Spray The MAGNUM line is perfect for individuals and private security requiring larger sizes. Weighs 4.36 ounces, 122 grams, 128.9 ml and contains approximately 35 bursts. Has a heavy cone spray pattern and sprays up to 12 feet with the center of face as the point of aim. The MAGNUM line is available in locking-top, flip-top and holster models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DApIdDmML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VHXLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SABRE RED", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 7.9}}
{"item_id": "B0007VM8UC", "title": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Compact Size with Clip (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "Don't want to carry with your keys? Our pocket unit with a clip is perfect for you. This compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. SABRE Pepper Spray Pocket Unit with Clip contains CS Tear Gas, Red Pepper and UV Dye. This Item cannot be shipped to Washington DC, Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New York, or Wisconsin. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Compact Size with Clip (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more) Don't want to carry with your keys? Our pocket unit with a clip is perfect for you. This compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. SABRE Pepper Spray Pocket Unit with Clip contains CS Tear Gas, Red Pepper and UV Dye. This Item cannot be shipped to Washington DC, Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New York, or Wisconsin. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3126Or%2BguRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VM8UC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B0007VSLK8", "title": "Water Purification Tablets", "description": "Box of 50 water purification tablets containing perfectly safe chemical treatment for unsafe water. Great for camping, hiking, and emergency preparedness.", "text": "Water Purification Tablets Box of 50 water purification tablets containing perfectly safe chemical treatment for unsafe water. Great for camping, hiking, and emergency preparedness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qsUbhcicL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VSLK8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Chemical Water Treaters"]], "price": 8.51}}
{"item_id": "B0007VSMKW", "title": "Water Preserver Concentrate", "description": "Emergency purification concentrate for treating large amounts of water for emergency storage. Specifically designed to be used in conjunction with 55 gallon water storage barrel to store water at home safely for 5 years.", "text": "Water Preserver Concentrate Emergency purification concentrate for treating large amounts of water for emergency storage. Specifically designed to be used in conjunction with 55 gallon water storage barrel to store water at home safely for 5 years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m2lJeJnLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VSMKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ER Emergency Ready", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 13.4}}
{"item_id": "B0007VVU38", "title": "Texsport Blue Reinforced Rip-Stop Polyethylene 10' X 12' Tarp", "description": "Heavy-gauge polyethylene laminated on both sides. Double stitched. Rust-proof eyelets. PVC bag-insert.", "text": "Texsport Blue Reinforced Rip-Stop Polyethylene 10' X 12' Tarp Heavy-gauge polyethylene laminated on both sides. Double stitched. Rust-proof eyelets. PVC bag-insert.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519Zk0mGT0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VVU38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]], "price": 13.07}}
{"item_id": "B0007VYGDE", "title": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Frypan", "description": "Hit the campsite with confidence with the GSI Bugaboo frypan, a dependable nonstick option for all your outdoor cooking needs. This high-quality aluminum pan is light enough for backpacking, yet heats evenly enough to satisfy even the most demanding camp cook. Plus, the pan is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick material, creating additional scratch resistance. Other details include a spiral-turned base that grips stoves and grills securely, a fixed helper handle, and a removable primary handle. The Bugaboo frypan comes in three sizes--8 inches, 10 inches, and 14 inches--and weighs between 11.4 ounces (small) and 3 pounds 4 ounces (large).", "text": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Frypan Hit the campsite with confidence with the GSI Bugaboo frypan, a dependable nonstick option for all your outdoor cooking needs. This high-quality aluminum pan is light enough for backpacking, yet heats evenly enough to satisfy even the most demanding camp cook. Plus, the pan is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick material, creating additional scratch resistance. Other details include a spiral-turned base that grips stoves and grills securely, a fixed helper handle, and a removable primary handle. The Bugaboo frypan comes in three sizes--8 inches, 10 inches, and 14 inches--and weighs between 11.4 ounces (small) and 3 pounds 4 ounces (large).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S1399ZDZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007VYGDE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2ELY", "title": "Valeo Competition Wrist Wrap Lifting Gloves", "description": "Enjoy better stability while lifting weights with the Valeo Competition wrist-wrap lifting gloves. Made of durable leather with reinforced stitching, the gloves are comfortable and sturdy. The gloves feature double leather padded palms for extra grip and comfort, along with secure wrist wraps to help steady the hands while lifting heavy bars. Other details include three-quarter length fingers, nylon mesh backs with hook-and-loop closure tabs, and your choice of six sizes. The gloves are machine-washable and dryer-safe.Sizes:XS: 6 to 7 inchesS: 7 to 8 inchesM: 8 to 9 inchesL: 9 to 10 inchesXL: 10 to 11 inchesXXL: 11 to 12 inches", "text": "Valeo Competition Wrist Wrap Lifting Gloves Enjoy better stability while lifting weights with the Valeo Competition wrist-wrap lifting gloves. Made of durable leather with reinforced stitching, the gloves are comfortable and sturdy. The gloves feature double leather padded palms for extra grip and comfort, along with secure wrist wraps to help steady the hands while lifting heavy bars. Other details include three-quarter length fingers, nylon mesh backs with hook-and-loop closure tabs, and your choice of six sizes. The gloves are machine-washable and dryer-safe.Sizes:XS: 6 to 7 inchesS: 7 to 8 inchesM: 8 to 9 inchesL: 9 to 10 inchesXL: 10 to 11 inchesXXL: 11 to 12 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qQWt4yCbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2ELY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2EP0", "title": "Valeo 4-Inch Padded Leather Belt", "description": "Features a 4 inch wide top quality 1/4 inch thick cowhide with sturdy double-stitched edges. Suede lining covers a foam lumbar pad for comfort and added support. Double-prong roller buckle closure with double loops to secure belt tab.", "text": "Valeo 4-Inch Padded Leather Belt Features a 4 inch wide top quality 1/4 inch thick cowhide with sturdy double-stitched edges. Suede lining covers a foam lumbar pad for comfort and added support. Double-prong roller buckle closure with double loops to secure belt tab.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516Av2NBL2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2EP0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Straps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2EPK", "title": "Valeo Barbell Pad, Black", "description": "The Valeo Barbell Pad offers a secure and cushioned grip surface so that you can lift weight in greater comfort and with reduced risk of slippage. The pad offers a sturdy foam core for long term resilience and features a hook and loop closure for easy fastening around the bar. The barbell pad fits both Olympic and standard size barbell and is easy to wipe clean by hand.", "text": "Valeo Barbell Pad, Black The Valeo Barbell Pad offers a secure and cushioned grip surface so that you can lift weight in greater comfort and with reduced risk of slippage. The pad offers a sturdy foam core for long term resilience and features a hook and loop closure for easy fastening around the bar. The barbell pad fits both Olympic and standard size barbell and is easy to wipe clean by hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X8B0GZDEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2EPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 10.46}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2ERI", "title": "Valeo Push Up Bars", "description": "Enhance overall development of upper body Improve these muscle groups: pectorals, or chest and triceps, or backs of arms Provides a greater range of motion than traditional push ups Ideal for home use or portable for the gym About Valeo Valeo - which means ''to be well'' in Latin, is a Wisconsin-based company that develops products of uncompromising quality and value to both personal fitness consumers and workplace safety officials. The company was started in 1988, introducing its original Classic Belt, and continues to provide an extensive line of fitness accessories for use at home or the gym. Durable molded plastic bars. Cushioned foam grips. Non-skid removable bases. Clean with warm soapy water, soft cloth. No assembly required. 1-year guarantee.", "text": "Valeo Push Up Bars Enhance overall development of upper body Improve these muscle groups: pectorals, or chest and triceps, or backs of arms Provides a greater range of motion than traditional push ups Ideal for home use or portable for the gym About Valeo Valeo - which means ''to be well'' in Latin, is a Wisconsin-based company that develops products of uncompromising quality and value to both personal fitness consumers and workplace safety officials. The company was started in 1988, introducing its original Classic Belt, and continues to provide an extensive line of fitness accessories for use at home or the gym. Durable molded plastic bars. Cushioned foam grips. Non-skid removable bases. Clean with warm soapy water, soft cloth. No assembly required. 1-year guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CR9Q8YF5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2ERI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2ESW", "title": "Valeo Fitness Ball with Soft Vinyl Covering", "description": "Soft vinyl covering for superior grip, 5 diameter for easy grip, helps develop strength, great for all fitness levels. Includes exercise wall chart.", "text": "Valeo Fitness Ball with Soft Vinyl Covering Soft vinyl covering for superior grip, 5 diameter for easy grip, helps develop strength, great for all fitness levels. Includes exercise wall chart.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X9N5PVRCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2ESW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Medicine Balls"]], "price": 13.25}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2F6I", "title": "Go Fit Ultimate Pro Gym", "description": "The GoFit Ultimate Pro Gym is the go anywhere, train anytime home gym that comes complete with its own personal trainer on DVD. Whether you are building size and strength, or increasing muscle definition, the key to the Pro Gym is the ability to add or subtract resistance. You can obtain 7 levels of resistance by creating different combinations of the tube strengths. Regardless of your fitness level, the GoFit Ultimate Pro Gym will help you attain a healthier you! The Pro Gym contains two handles, three resistance tubes, two ankle straps, one door anchor, a workout manual, and a Core Performance workout on DVD led by Mark Verstegen at his world renowned Athletes' Performance Institute. A nylon carry bag is included for storage or travel. Resistances are as follows: * Red = 5 lb * Blue = 10 lb * Green = 15 lb", "text": "Go Fit Ultimate Pro Gym The GoFit Ultimate Pro Gym is the go anywhere, train anytime home gym that comes complete with its own personal trainer on DVD. Whether you are building size and strength, or increasing muscle definition, the key to the Pro Gym is the ability to add or subtract resistance. You can obtain 7 levels of resistance by creating different combinations of the tube strengths. Regardless of your fitness level, the GoFit Ultimate Pro Gym will help you attain a healthier you! The Pro Gym contains two handles, three resistance tubes, two ankle straps, one door anchor, a workout manual, and a Core Performance workout on DVD led by Mark Verstegen at his world renowned Athletes' Performance Institute. A nylon carry bag is included for storage or travel. Resistances are as follows: * Red = 5 lb * Blue = 10 lb * Green = 15 lb", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yYUjucq4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2F6I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoFit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2FG8", "title": "GoFit Weightlifting Glove", "description": "GoFit Diamond-Tac Weightlifting gloves are the most technologically advanced gloves available today. The exclusive Diamond-Tac gripping pattern increases grip strength and helps fight hand fatigue. The ergonomically cut palm pad provides complete protection without unnecessary bulk and the synthetic leather developed for military applications provides indestructible palm construction suited to be machine washed and dried.Feature Detail:Neoprene knuckle panel for increased flexibilityTerry cloth thumb to mop perspiration from browTwo-way stretch top for superior fitRubber pull tab for better fitReinforced stitching on fingersAnatomically cut double layer palmPull tab fingers for easy removalRubberized reinforced canvas on the thumb and forefinger for more gripping powerFinger loop for easy hand insertion.", "text": "GoFit Weightlifting Glove GoFit Diamond-Tac Weightlifting gloves are the most technologically advanced gloves available today. The exclusive Diamond-Tac gripping pattern increases grip strength and helps fight hand fatigue. The ergonomically cut palm pad provides complete protection without unnecessary bulk and the synthetic leather developed for military applications provides indestructible palm construction suited to be machine washed and dried.Feature Detail:Neoprene knuckle panel for increased flexibilityTerry cloth thumb to mop perspiration from browTwo-way stretch top for superior fitRubber pull tab for better fitReinforced stitching on fingersAnatomically cut double layer palmPull tab fingers for easy removalRubberized reinforced canvas on the thumb and forefinger for more gripping powerFinger loop for easy hand insertion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PZlguT4ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2FG8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2FJA", "title": "GoFit GF-WFB Wrist & Forearm Blaster", "description": "Create power and strength in your wrist and forearms with the Blaster. Perfect for sports like golf, baseball, tennis, wrestling, football, and climbing where wrist and forearm strength are imperative. The Wrist and Forearm Blaster is simple to use and utilizes a time-proven method for developing superior grip strength. It features a solid steel construction, foam grip handles, and works with standard-size weight plates.Features:Builds strength in wrists and forearmsEasy to use designSolid steel constructionFoam grip handlesWorks with standard-size weight plates (not included)", "text": "GoFit GF-WFB Wrist & Forearm Blaster Create power and strength in your wrist and forearms with the Blaster. Perfect for sports like golf, baseball, tennis, wrestling, football, and climbing where wrist and forearm strength are imperative. The Wrist and Forearm Blaster is simple to use and utilizes a time-proven method for developing superior grip strength. It features a solid steel construction, foam grip handles, and works with standard-size weight plates.Features:Builds strength in wrists and forearmsEasy to use designSolid steel constructionFoam grip handlesWorks with standard-size weight plates (not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z5INkAENL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2FJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoFit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Arm Machines"]], "price": 20.08}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2FLI", "title": "Go Fit Chin Up Bar", "description": "The gofit chin up bar is a great addition to your at home training program. It will adjust to fit most standard width door frames. Disclaimer: gofit chin up bar has been designed to fit residential doorways 26` to 32` and support up to 300 lbs. This product has been manufactured and tested to decrease risk of injury. However, risks of injury exist in the use of this product. Therefore, the user assumes all risks of injury in the use of this product. Consult your physician before starting any exercise program. If you experience any discomfort while using this product, discontinue use and consult your physician immediately.", "text": "Go Fit Chin Up Bar The gofit chin up bar is a great addition to your at home training program. It will adjust to fit most standard width door frames. Disclaimer: gofit chin up bar has been designed to fit residential doorways 26` to 32` and support up to 300 lbs. This product has been manufactured and tested to decrease risk of injury. However, risks of injury exist in the use of this product. Therefore, the user assumes all risks of injury in the use of this product. Consult your physician before starting any exercise program. If you experience any discomfort while using this product, discontinue use and consult your physician immediately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jqEQkqyxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2FLI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoFit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 30.99}}
{"item_id": "B0007W2FLS", "title": "GoFit Push-Up Bars", "description": "No other exercise, outside of weight training, builds and tones the pectoral and tricep muscles more efficiently than push-ups. Now you can take your push-ups to the next level with this pair of GoFit push-up stands. By gripping the handles of the stands, you'll enjoy a greater range of motion during push-ups, helping your muscles develop even more efficiently. Plus, the stands are extremely compact, so you can store them easily in a closet or stuff them in a suitcase while traveling. Also great for core fitness, the GoFit push-up stands let you get in a great workout anytime, anywhere.", "text": "GoFit Push-Up Bars No other exercise, outside of weight training, builds and tones the pectoral and tricep muscles more efficiently than push-ups. Now you can take your push-ups to the next level with this pair of GoFit push-up stands. By gripping the handles of the stands, you'll enjoy a greater range of motion during push-ups, helping your muscles develop even more efficiently. Plus, the stands are extremely compact, so you can store them easily in a closet or stuff them in a suitcase while traveling. Also great for core fitness, the GoFit push-up stands let you get in a great workout anytime, anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G3R94EMKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007W2FLS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoFit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]], "price": 14.75}}
