{"item_id": "B0007XHMAG", "title": "AeroBed® All - Terrain Air Bed", "description": "AeroBed All - Terrain Air Bed... rugged sleep spot for your outdoor adventures! If you're heading out into the woods for a camping trip, you'll sacrifice the amenities of city living, but there's no reason to suffer through a restless night! Bring along this heavy-duty Air Bed and catch some \"z's\" in your tent. Puncture-resistant, heavy-gauge PVC construction ensures you won't wake up on a deflated piece of plastic at 3:00 a.m. You'll be extremely comfortable on the pillow-soft velvety surface too... coil construction and built-in pillow are the perfect place to rest. The rest: Rechargeable NiCD pump runs instantly when plugged in to a car lighter... runs cordless after being charged at home, too; Inflates to 9\" thick; Fits standard size sheets; Backed by a 2-year limited express warranty; Rolls up and stores compactly in a durable carry bag; Choose between a twin (74 x 39 x 9\") or queen (78 x 60 x 9\") size.; Pick yours up today! AeroBed All-Terrain Air Bed", "text": "AeroBed® All - Terrain Air Bed AeroBed All - Terrain Air Bed... rugged sleep spot for your outdoor adventures! If you're heading out into the woods for a camping trip, you'll sacrifice the amenities of city living, but there's no reason to suffer through a restless night! Bring along this heavy-duty Air Bed and catch some \"z's\" in your tent. Puncture-resistant, heavy-gauge PVC construction ensures you won't wake up on a deflated piece of plastic at 3:00 a.m. You'll be extremely comfortable on the pillow-soft velvety surface too... coil construction and built-in pillow are the perfect place to rest. The rest: Rechargeable NiCD pump runs instantly when plugged in to a car lighter... runs cordless after being charged at home, too; Inflates to 9\" thick; Fits standard size sheets; Backed by a 2-year limited express warranty; Rolls up and stores compactly in a durable carry bag; Choose between a twin (74 x 39 x 9\") or queen (78 x 60 x 9\") size.; Pick yours up today! AeroBed All-Terrain Air Bed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EVQ6FS19L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007XHMAG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0007XJOAW", "title": "Okuma Magda Pro Line Counter Levelwind Trolling Reel", "description": "Okuma-Feet s Magda Pro MA-30DLX left handed crank line counter series is a lightweight corrosion resistant reel with stainless steel reinforced side plate rings. The mechanical line counter function measures in feet and has a rubber push button reset. Equipped with a carbonate drag system, durable machine cut brass gears and self lubricating gear system this reel is ready for anything. Features include: Lightweight corrosion resistant frame and side plates, corrosion resistant graphite spools, stainless steel reinforcing side plate rings, mechanical line counter function measures in feet, multi disc carbonate drag system, 2 stainless steel ball bearings, self lubricating gear system, stainless steel level wind line guide system and backed by a 1 year warranty.", "text": "Okuma Magda Pro Line Counter Levelwind Trolling Reel Okuma-Feet s Magda Pro MA-30DLX left handed crank line counter series is a lightweight corrosion resistant reel with stainless steel reinforced side plate rings. The mechanical line counter function measures in feet and has a rubber push button reset. Equipped with a carbonate drag system, durable machine cut brass gears and self lubricating gear system this reel is ready for anything. Features include: Lightweight corrosion resistant frame and side plates, corrosion resistant graphite spools, stainless steel reinforcing side plate rings, mechanical line counter function measures in feet, multi disc carbonate drag system, 2 stainless steel ball bearings, self lubricating gear system, stainless steel level wind line guide system and backed by a 1 year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HmwVXGWVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007XJOAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B0007XXFGG", "title": "Ultra Pro Silver Series 100/9 Pocket Page Protectors", "description": "Made in USA. Archival. PVC free. 100 page display box.", "text": "Ultra Pro Silver Series 100/9 Pocket Page Protectors Made in USA. Archival. PVC free. 100 page display box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515QyNCRnwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007XXFGG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultra Pro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Memorabilia Display & Storage", "Display Cases"]], "price": 14.97}}
{"item_id": "B0007XY8TY", "title": "CAP Barbell Standard Plate and Bar Storage Rack", "description": "Keep your personal workout area neat and organized with the CAP Barbell Standard Plate and Bar Storage Rack. This rack provides space for a single weight bar, one set of dumbbell handles, and posts for standard 1-inch plates. Made of heavy-gauge steel with a 300-pound weight capacity. Perfect for home gyms. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Heavy-gauge steel construction. Holds one bar, a set of dumbbell handles, and plates. 300-pound weight capacity. Dimensions: 30L x 21W x 31H inches.", "text": "CAP Barbell Standard Plate and Bar Storage Rack Keep your personal workout area neat and organized with the CAP Barbell Standard Plate and Bar Storage Rack. This rack provides space for a single weight bar, one set of dumbbell handles, and posts for standard 1-inch plates. Made of heavy-gauge steel with a 300-pound weight capacity. Perfect for home gyms. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Heavy-gauge steel construction. Holds one bar, a set of dumbbell handles, and plates. 300-pound weight capacity. Dimensions: 30L x 21W x 31H inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319mwV5l7BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007XY8TY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Dumbbell Racks"]], "price": 49.98}}
{"item_id": "B0007Y8SBW", "title": "Caldwell Rock Jr. Metal Front Rifle Rest", "description": "Many of the same features as The Rock, but in a sleeker and more economical package. For sighting-in, test firing, and informal competition, it's tough to beat a Rock Jr.", "text": "Caldwell Rock Jr. Metal Front Rifle Rest Many of the same features as The Rock, but in a sleeker and more economical package. For sighting-in, test firing, and informal competition, it's tough to beat a Rock Jr.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tJbUDt8xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0007Y8SBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 39.01}}
