{"item_id": "B0008KLAB0", "title": "White Foam Roller 6x36 Round", "description": "Cando Foam Rollers Perfect for positioning, balance, postural and muscle re-education, spinal stabilization, body awareness and coordination, and ranging and strengthening activities Round rollers offer progressive exercise sequences - user can move from easier (smaller diameter) to more difficult (larger diameter) roller Half round roller is a great tool for ankle stretching and knee rehabilitation. Use half roll as rocker board by standing on flat side. Diameter refers to the width of the half-round profile 2.2 lb density", "text": "White Foam Roller 6x36 Round Cando Foam Rollers Perfect for positioning, balance, postural and muscle re-education, spinal stabilization, body awareness and coordination, and ranging and strengthening activities Round rollers offer progressive exercise sequences - user can move from easier (smaller diameter) to more difficult (larger diameter) roller Half round roller is a great tool for ankle stretching and knee rehabilitation. Use half roll as rocker board by standing on flat side. Diameter refers to the width of the half-round profile 2.2 lb density", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11Y3UpyqJAL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0008KLAB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Foam Roller", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 21.0}}
{"item_id": "B00091PQL8", "title": "Mikasa VX20 Beach Classic Volleyball", "description": "The Mikasa VX20 Beach Classic is an affordable relative to Mikasa's FIVB (Federation Internationale de Volleyball) World Tour and Athens Olympic beach ball. Made of super-soft, machine-stitched synthetic leather, it features a three color panel design (blue/yellow/white) that helps identify ball movement and a butyl bladder that guarantees true shape and air retention.Whether on the beach or in the gym, Mikasa Sports USA volleyballs raise the bar and electrify the game. Mikasa volleyballs have been selected to be the official game balls of all FIVB international matches including all the Olympic Games since 1968, and will be used for all indoor competition and the beach games at the Beijing games in 2008.", "text": "Mikasa VX20 Beach Classic Volleyball The Mikasa VX20 Beach Classic is an affordable relative to Mikasa's FIVB (Federation Internationale de Volleyball) World Tour and Athens Olympic beach ball. Made of super-soft, machine-stitched synthetic leather, it features a three color panel design (blue/yellow/white) that helps identify ball movement and a butyl bladder that guarantees true shape and air retention.Whether on the beach or in the gym, Mikasa Sports USA volleyballs raise the bar and electrify the game. Mikasa volleyballs have been selected to be the official game balls of all FIVB international matches including all the Olympic Games since 1968, and will be used for all indoor competition and the beach games at the Beijing games in 2008.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417RBJAS49L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00091PQL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mikasa Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Volleyballs", "Outdoor Volleyballs"]], "price": 9.97}}
{"item_id": "B00091R0JO", "title": "Pelican 1062 Pick N' Pluck Foam Set for 1060 Micro-Case", "description": "This Pelican Replacement Foam Set fits the Pelican 1060 Micro Case. You can customize the fit of this one piece foam set to meet your individual needs, providing extra protection for your valuable equipment.", "text": "Pelican 1062 Pick N' Pluck Foam Set for 1060 Micro-Case This Pelican Replacement Foam Set fits the Pelican 1060 Micro Case. You can customize the fit of this one piece foam set to meet your individual needs, providing extra protection for your valuable equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iQLtZRK9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00091R0JO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pelican", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 8.12}}
{"item_id": "B00091RWN8", "title": "WAKA Official Kickball - Adult 10", "description": "Kickball's making a comeback--and not just with kids. The Mikasa P1000K official-size adult kickball will bring you back to the playground from your childhood. It's the same size as the one you had when you were in elementary school but the competition is on a whole new level. It's the official game ball of WAKA--the World Adult Kickball Association.", "text": "WAKA Official Kickball - Adult 10 Kickball's making a comeback--and not just with kids. The Mikasa P1000K official-size adult kickball will bring you back to the playground from your childhood. It's the same size as the one you had when you were in elementary school but the competition is on a whole new level. It's the official game ball of WAKA--the World Adult Kickball Association.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JCA4SJHCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00091RWN8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WAKA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Balls", "Dodgeballs"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00091RXMS", "title": "EVERLAST Folding Sit Up Bar", "description": "A perfect way to keep your feet in place while doing sit-ups anywhere there is a door. Firm and tone abdominals quickly and strengthen thighs. Easy to assemble. Foam-lined bracket protects door. Foam-covered bar for comfort and traction. Folds up safely and securely. Folds flush against door for safety.", "text": "EVERLAST Folding Sit Up Bar A perfect way to keep your feet in place while doing sit-ups anywhere there is a door. Firm and tone abdominals quickly and strengthen thighs. Easy to assemble. Foam-lined bracket protects door. Foam-covered bar for comfort and traction. Folds up safely and securely. Folds flush against door for safety.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SSfiB6w%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00091RXMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 34.5}}
