{"item_id": "B00091RXVY", "title": "Everlast Leather Weighted Jump Rope", "description": "The classic of all jump ropes is this genuine leather weighted jump rope. Precision ball bearings have been added for extra speed. As well this jump rope has contoured and polished wood handles. Available in 8 or 9.5 feet.", "text": "Everlast Leather Weighted Jump Rope The classic of all jump ropes is this genuine leather weighted jump rope. Precision ball bearings have been added for extra speed. As well this jump rope has contoured and polished wood handles. Available in 8 or 9.5 feet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nWMqFEZIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00091RXVY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]]}}
