{"item_id": "B00092CKN4", "title": "Plexus Plexus Plastic Cleaner, Protectant and Polish (13-Ounce)", "description": "There was no safety recall for this product. It had a \"hazmat recall\" in 2005 from an FC that could not handle this.", "text": "Plexus Plexus Plastic Cleaner, Protectant and Polish (13-Ounce) There was no safety recall for this product. It had a \"hazmat recall\" in 2005 from an FC that could not handle this.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U4SDcqmdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00092CKN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plexus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 22.89}}
{"item_id": "B00092CKNE", "title": "JT Sports C6 Spray Majik", "description": "Fog-resistant cleaning solution cleans the messiest pant and provides superior fog-resistant properties when applied as directed on goggles and glasses. Available in 2oz. And 8oz. Bottles.", "text": "JT Sports C6 Spray Majik Fog-resistant cleaning solution cleans the messiest pant and provides superior fog-resistant properties when applied as directed on goggles and glasses. Available in 2oz. And 8oz. Bottles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412VCC4BXTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00092CKNE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JT Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B00092CLFG", "title": "JT Bodyguard Neck Protector", "description": "The JT Bodyguard Neck Protector is designed to provide a comfortable way to protect your neck during airsoft wars. Constructed out of high-density neoprene, the protector conforms to your anatomy, and attaches securely with a flexible Velcro closure. The Coolmax inner liner wicks moisture away from your skin for comfort on the move.", "text": "JT Bodyguard Neck Protector The JT Bodyguard Neck Protector is designed to provide a comfortable way to protect your neck during airsoft wars. Constructed out of high-density neoprene, the protector conforms to your anatomy, and attaches securely with a flexible Velcro closure. The Coolmax inner liner wicks moisture away from your skin for comfort on the move.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Vzw6zemeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00092CLFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JT Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Neck Protectors"]], "price": 7.7}}
{"item_id": "B0009300QC", "title": "Dead On Tools DO-300 Killer Chiller Mobile Cooler/Lunch box, Black", "description": "The Dead On Killer Chiller is a dual insulated lunch box with a compartment for cold and warm storage. It has an exterior zip mesh accessory pocket. The cooler is 12-inches long by 8.5-inches deep and 10-inches tall. It has a 1020 cubic-inch capacity and is made from waterproof fabric.", "text": "Dead On Tools DO-300 Killer Chiller Mobile Cooler/Lunch box, Black The Dead On Killer Chiller is a dual insulated lunch box with a compartment for cold and warm storage. It has an exterior zip mesh accessory pocket. The cooler is 12-inches long by 8.5-inches deep and 10-inches tall. It has a 1020 cubic-inch capacity and is made from waterproof fabric.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EDDWSATQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009300QC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dead On Tools", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B00094CWA8", "title": "Park Tool CM-5 Cyclone Chain Cleaner", "description": "The CM-5 Cyclone Chain Scrubber uses an extra large solvent reservoir and a series of rotating brushes to get chains really clean. A magnet at the bottom of the Cyclone’s solvent reservoir draws particles scrubbed from the chain, effectively keeping them from being redistributed on the chain during cleaning. Durable sponge material draws solvent from the chain as it exits the Cyclone, reducing drips and mess. To make it easy to control and use, we’ve even added a handle. Works with all multi-speed bikes and some single-speed models.", "text": "Park Tool CM-5 Cyclone Chain Cleaner The CM-5 Cyclone Chain Scrubber uses an extra large solvent reservoir and a series of rotating brushes to get chains really clean. A magnet at the bottom of the Cyclone’s solvent reservoir draws particles scrubbed from the chain, effectively keeping them from being redistributed on the chain during cleaning. Durable sponge material draws solvent from the chain as it exits the Cyclone, reducing drips and mess. To make it easy to control and use, we’ve even added a handle. Works with all multi-speed bikes and some single-speed models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OG4hqSMxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00094CWA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 18.68}}
{"item_id": "B00095M5DQ", "title": "Ultra Pro 9-Pocket Trading Card Pages - Platinum Series (100 Pages)", "description": "The Ultra Pro 9-Pocket Trading Card Pages provide a way for you to display and protect your favorite trading cards in any standard three-ring binder. Coming in a box of 100, each page holds nine 2.5 by 3.5-inch trading cards. The top-loading pages are constructed of polypropylene that is PVC and acid-free and offers UV protection to keep your cards in perfect condition. With strong seam welds, the durable heavy-weight pages are made for long lasting use.", "text": "Ultra Pro 9-Pocket Trading Card Pages - Platinum Series (100 Pages) The Ultra Pro 9-Pocket Trading Card Pages provide a way for you to display and protect your favorite trading cards in any standard three-ring binder. Coming in a box of 100, each page holds nine 2.5 by 3.5-inch trading cards. The top-loading pages are constructed of polypropylene that is PVC and acid-free and offers UV protection to keep your cards in perfect condition. With strong seam welds, the durable heavy-weight pages are made for long lasting use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31691UzRhOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00095M5DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultra Pro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 13.9}}
