{"item_id": "B00097DJH0", "title": "Ruger Mini-14 Vent Handguard", "description": "Ruger Mini-14 vent handguard by Choate Machine(the BMW of accessories mfgr.). Snaps right onto barrel. no fitting required. The perfect match for the Butler Creek folding stock we also sell for the Mini-14(see our other adds).", "text": "Ruger Mini-14 Vent Handguard Ruger Mini-14 vent handguard by Choate Machine(the BMW of accessories mfgr.). Snaps right onto barrel. no fitting required. The perfect match for the Butler Creek folding stock we also sell for the Mini-14(see our other adds).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z5P232C8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00097DJH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B000980JMW", "title": "UCO Grilliput Portable Camping Grill", "description": "Simple and elegant, Grilliput provides maximum experience for minimalists. Form and function are harmonized in our high-quality, German-designed portable grill that can be easily broken down to stow compactly. We use only top quality stainless steel for durability. Grilliput is completely dishwasher-safe and allows backpackers, boaters and other outdoor minimalists to take charcoal grilling with them wherever they go. Weight 19.8 ounces (560g).", "text": "UCO Grilliput Portable Camping Grill Simple and elegant, Grilliput provides maximum experience for minimalists. Form and function are harmonized in our high-quality, German-designed portable grill that can be easily broken down to stow compactly. We use only top quality stainless steel for durability. Grilliput is completely dishwasher-safe and allows backpackers, boaters and other outdoor minimalists to take charcoal grilling with them wherever they go. Weight 19.8 ounces (560g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fOjuqED7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000980JMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00099YIX2", "title": "Tachikara SV5W Gold Competition Premium Leather Volleyball", "description": "The very best is now even better! Our flagship model volleyball has been upgraded to feature Dual Bladder Construction (DBC), Tachikara's latest innovation in patented manufacturing methods and technologies. Our select premium leather cover and dual internal bladders greatly enhances the overall control, performance and responsiveness of this volleyball at the highest levels of competitive play. Serve one up today, and feel the difference!", "text": "Tachikara SV5W Gold Competition Premium Leather Volleyball The very best is now even better! Our flagship model volleyball has been upgraded to feature Dual Bladder Construction (DBC), Tachikara's latest innovation in patented manufacturing methods and technologies. Our select premium leather cover and dual internal bladders greatly enhances the overall control, performance and responsiveness of this volleyball at the highest levels of competitive play. Serve one up today, and feel the difference!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HFWSTM83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00099YIX2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tachikara", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Volleyballs", "Indoor Volleyballs"]], "price": 48.47}}
{"item_id": "B00099YJR2", "title": "Tachikara GAUGE Ball Pressure Gauge", "description": "Tachikara's air pressure gauge insures accurate inflation of all athletic balls manufactured by Tachikara.", "text": "Tachikara GAUGE Ball Pressure Gauge Tachikara's air pressure gauge insures accurate inflation of all athletic balls manufactured by Tachikara.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mdS5UaYLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00099YJR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tachikara", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories", "Inflation Device Accessories"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B00099YJRC", "title": "Tachikara TP20 Dual-Action Inflation Pump", "description": "Keep your sports balls optimally inflated with this eight-inch handheld pump, which includes a hose and needle. Dual action inflation provides faster pumping, as it injects air with both the push and pull of the piston.About TachikaraJapanese company Tachikara, established in 1915, is an innovator in the world of advanced manufacturing methods for athletic balls, having introduced the proprietary Single Unit Construction method of manufacturing seamless athletic balls in 1952. This technology improved balls' spherical shape, air retention, rebound, and overall durability, and is now commonly referred to as \"molded\" or \"laminated.\" Today, the company continues to advance sporting goods manufacturing methods, and offers a diverse product line across sports including volleyball, soccer, basketball, football, and more.", "text": "Tachikara TP20 Dual-Action Inflation Pump Keep your sports balls optimally inflated with this eight-inch handheld pump, which includes a hose and needle. Dual action inflation provides faster pumping, as it injects air with both the push and pull of the piston.About TachikaraJapanese company Tachikara, established in 1915, is an innovator in the world of advanced manufacturing methods for athletic balls, having introduced the proprietary Single Unit Construction method of manufacturing seamless athletic balls in 1952. This technology improved balls' spherical shape, air retention, rebound, and overall durability, and is now commonly referred to as \"molded\" or \"laminated.\" Today, the company continues to advance sporting goods manufacturing methods, and offers a diverse product line across sports including volleyball, soccer, basketball, football, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317J1GDMVKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00099YJRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tachikara", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories"]], "price": 10.55}}
{"item_id": "B00099YJTK", "title": "Tachikara TMC-2 Drill Marker Cone Set", "description": "A set of cones is a simple, versatile training aid for athletic practices of all types, and this set of 24 two-inch tall cones comes complete with a convenient caddy for organized storage and transport to and from practice.About TachikaraJapanese company Tachikara, established in 1915, is an innovator in the world of advanced manufacturing methods for athletic balls, having introduced the proprietary Single Unit Construction method of manufacturing seamless athletic balls in 1952. This technology improved balls' spherical shape, air retention, rebound, and overall durability, and is now commonly referred to as \"molded\" or \"laminated.\" Today, the company continues to advance sporting goods manufacturing methods, and offers a diverse product line across sports including volleyball, soccer, basketball, football, and more.", "text": "Tachikara TMC-2 Drill Marker Cone Set A set of cones is a simple, versatile training aid for athletic practices of all types, and this set of 24 two-inch tall cones comes complete with a convenient caddy for organized storage and transport to and from practice.About TachikaraJapanese company Tachikara, established in 1915, is an innovator in the world of advanced manufacturing methods for athletic balls, having introduced the proprietary Single Unit Construction method of manufacturing seamless athletic balls in 1952. This technology improved balls' spherical shape, air retention, rebound, and overall durability, and is now commonly referred to as \"molded\" or \"laminated.\" Today, the company continues to advance sporting goods manufacturing methods, and offers a diverse product line across sports including volleyball, soccer, basketball, football, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZGWR4CGML.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00099YJTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tachikara", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Playing Field Equipment", "Cones"]], "price": 24.02}}
{"item_id": "B00099ZUL6", "title": "Nalgene Solo Tritan Wide-Mouth Water Bottle 48 oz", "description": "When you need greater capacity the Silo is the ticked. Guaranteed leak proof. Easily slides into standard packs and backpack side pockets. Durable. Standard 63-mm Loop-Top cap. Neck configuration works with most major water purifiers and filters.", "text": "Nalgene Solo Tritan Wide-Mouth Water Bottle 48 oz When you need greater capacity the Silo is the ticked. Guaranteed leak proof. Easily slides into standard packs and backpack side pockets. Durable. Standard 63-mm Loop-Top cap. Neck configuration works with most major water purifiers and filters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DLZWQ8LNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00099ZUL6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 11.98}}
