{"item_id": "B0009PD5GM", "title": "1911 Mat Ext Slide Release", "description": "Extended Slide ReleaseBlue - Glass Bead Finish - .45 ACPAllows the right thumb to actuate the slide release with minimal grip change, which can save valuable time - Minor fitting may be required", "text": "1911 Mat Ext Slide Release Extended Slide ReleaseBlue - Glass Bead Finish - .45 ACPAllows the right thumb to actuate the slide release with minimal grip change, which can save valuable time - Minor fitting may be required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21hmyBG0CbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PD5GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson Combat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B0009PGVG8", "title": "Fury Martial Arts Folding Grappling Hook with Black Cord, Midnight Black", "description": "Used by ninjas to scale walls, climb trees and aid in quick escapes. This grappling hook by Fury has been specially designed to fold flat when not in use. Heavy duty midnight black finished steel hook is compact and easy to carry and comes with a 33 foot nylon rope. Originally a ninja warrior necessity, this grappling hook has many other practical uses as well. The military uses grappling hooks to help remove obstacles from a distance, especially when they are suspected of being rigged with explosives. And as the name suggests, you can throw the grappling hook to an item and drag it back to you. Especially useful for out of reach or dangerous items making this Fury Grappling Hook a necessity for your survival gear bag. Not recommended for children or climbing.", "text": "Fury Martial Arts Folding Grappling Hook with Black Cord, Midnight Black Used by ninjas to scale walls, climb trees and aid in quick escapes. This grappling hook by Fury has been specially designed to fold flat when not in use. Heavy duty midnight black finished steel hook is compact and easy to carry and comes with a 33 foot nylon rope. Originally a ninja warrior necessity, this grappling hook has many other practical uses as well. The military uses grappling hooks to help remove obstacles from a distance, especially when they are suspected of being rigged with explosives. And as the name suggests, you can throw the grappling hook to an item and drag it back to you. Especially useful for out of reach or dangerous items making this Fury Grappling Hook a necessity for your survival gear bag. Not recommended for children or climbing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516gvzMe1XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PGVG8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Martial Arts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Ninja Weapons"]], "price": 14.88}}
{"item_id": "B0009PIUQC", "title": "GCI Outdoor PackSeat Portable Stool", "description": "The PackSeat™ Portable Stool is ultra-lightweight and ultra-small, folding down to 15 inches. Perfect to take with you everywhere: camping, traveling, hiking, fishing, birding, backpacking, tailgating, anywhere - the possibilities are endless. Features:.Folded Dimensions: 15 in. Long x 4 in. Wide..Product Weight: 26 ounces..Seat Height: 21 in..", "text": "GCI Outdoor PackSeat Portable Stool The PackSeat™ Portable Stool is ultra-lightweight and ultra-small, folding down to 15 inches. Perfect to take with you everywhere: camping, traveling, hiking, fishing, birding, backpacking, tailgating, anywhere - the possibilities are endless. Features:.Folded Dimensions: 15 in. Long x 4 in. Wide..Product Weight: 26 ounces..Seat Height: 21 in..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P2mFO0X5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PIUQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GCI Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 22.09}}
