{"item_id": "B0009PUTBG", "title": "Coleman Folding Saw", "description": "The Coleman Folding Saw features a 7-inch blade that cuts on the reverse and forward strokes both, for efficient sawing. Lightweight and compact, the Saw folds up for safe packing and storage.", "text": "Coleman Folding Saw The Coleman Folding Saw features a 7-inch blade that cuts on the reverse and forward strokes both, for efficient sawing. Lightweight and compact, the Saw folds up for safe packing and storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZGTYMJN4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PUTBG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 6.0}}
