{"item_id": "B0009PUTES", "title": "Coleman Hand Shovel", "description": "The Coleman Hand Shovel folds down small for compact camping trips. It's big enough to make a fire pit, strong enough to pick out roots, and sharp enough to cut away small branches. The positive locking collar makes sure the blade doesn't fold over your hands while you're digging, and the included carry pouch protects your car on the ride home.", "text": "Coleman Hand Shovel The Coleman Hand Shovel folds down small for compact camping trips. It's big enough to make a fire pit, strong enough to pick out roots, and sharp enough to cut away small branches. The positive locking collar makes sure the blade doesn't fold over your hands while you're digging, and the included carry pouch protects your car on the ride home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414L%2BR-aOEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PUTES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 11.56}}
{"item_id": "B0009PUTG6", "title": "Coleman 8817A303 All Outdoors 3 In 1 Blanket", "description": "Coleman All Outdoors 3 In 1 Blanket, Oversized Blanket, 58\" x 84\", Water Resistant Poly-Oxford Line With Polyester Fleece, Blanket Converts Into Insulated, Hooded Poncho, Self Stores Into Hood, Creating A Cushioned Stadium Seat, Sturdy Carrying Handle, Ideal For Tailgating, Sporting Events Camping, Picnics, Emergencies Or At Home, Mix Pack: 1 Each Blue, Red & Green.", "text": "Coleman 8817A303 All Outdoors 3 In 1 Blanket Coleman All Outdoors 3 In 1 Blanket, Oversized Blanket, 58\" x 84\", Water Resistant Poly-Oxford Line With Polyester Fleece, Blanket Converts Into Insulated, Hooded Poncho, Self Stores Into Hood, Creating A Cushioned Stadium Seat, Sturdy Carrying Handle, Ideal For Tailgating, Sporting Events Camping, Picnics, Emergencies Or At Home, Mix Pack: 1 Each Blue, Red & Green.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hXUcB602L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009PUTG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 24.97}}
