{"item_id": "B0009SS2A8", "title": "Super 9 bolt action rifle, Black airsoft gun", "description": "A 1:1 scale replica of a bolt-action rifle, the Super 9 airsoft rifle is remarkably authentic. The airsoft rifle fires round pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun by a spring mechanism. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The airsoft rifle looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft rifle is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The rifle includes a hop-up system and two different magazine options: a rotary cartridge magazine that holds five shells (the shell casing ejects after each shot) and a direct feed tube magazine. Spring guns are the toughest, most durable of all airsoft guns because they're made with the fewest breakable pieces.Specifications:Velocity: Approximately 370 fps with 0.2-gram BBs, 420 fps with 0.12-gram BBsEffective range: 117 feetCapacity: 25 rounds for direct feed, or 5 shells", "text": "Super 9 bolt action rifle, Black airsoft gun A 1:1 scale replica of a bolt-action rifle, the Super 9 airsoft rifle is remarkably authentic. The airsoft rifle fires round pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun by a spring mechanism. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The airsoft rifle looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft rifle is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The rifle includes a hop-up system and two different magazine options: a rotary cartridge magazine that holds five shells (the shell casing ejects after each shot) and a direct feed tube magazine. Spring guns are the toughest, most durable of all airsoft guns because they're made with the fewest breakable pieces.Specifications:Velocity: Approximately 370 fps with 0.2-gram BBs, 420 fps with 0.12-gram BBsEffective range: 117 feetCapacity: 25 rounds for direct feed, or 5 shells", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21SCY5H4Q7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009SS2A8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UHC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B0009TNGQC", "title": "Japanese Samurai Katana Sword Maintenance Cleaning Kit", "description": "The complete sword Cleaning Kit. Includes Mini Hammer, Sword Oil, Uchiko, and Cotton Cloth. This kit is A Must Have for all serious sword collectors. Includes instructions for sword.", "text": "Japanese Samurai Katana Sword Maintenance Cleaning Kit The complete sword Cleaning Kit. Includes Mini Hammer, Sword Oil, Uchiko, and Cotton Cloth. This kit is A Must Have for all serious sword collectors. Includes instructions for sword.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ui6cRr4-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TNGQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapon Stands"]], "price": 9.66}}
{"item_id": "B0009TNLGC", "title": "MTM Magnum Broadhead Tackle Box", "description": "If you are the bowhunter who likes to keep all your broadheads in place, this is the box for you! Conforming to the shape of each individual broadhead, you can hold over 20 broadheads securely in place by two special foam inserts. It comes with a translucent box for storing smaller items that you also need to keep in organized, such as blades, nocks and points.", "text": "MTM Magnum Broadhead Tackle Box If you are the bowhunter who likes to keep all your broadheads in place, this is the box for you! Conforming to the shape of each individual broadhead, you can hold over 20 broadheads securely in place by two special foam inserts. It comes with a translucent box for storing smaller items that you also need to keep in organized, such as blades, nocks and points.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HWhnucOOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TNLGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0009TNS24", "title": "Allen Company Calf Hair No Pinch Shooting Tab", "description": "The Calf Hair String Surface Is Sandwiched Between A Layer Of Felt Blanket Fabric And A Layer Of Suede Leather. A Plastic Finger Spacer Keeps Fingers From Pinching Together", "text": "Allen Company Calf Hair No Pinch Shooting Tab The Calf Hair String Surface Is Sandwiched Between A Layer Of Felt Blanket Fabric And A Layer Of Suede Leather. A Plastic Finger Spacer Keeps Fingers From Pinching Together", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wsT-EGFOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TNS24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 0.49}}
