{"item_id": "B0009TNSK6", "title": "Xs 24/7 Big Dot Sig P225-2009/Xd", "description": "XS Sight Systems 24/7 Big Dot Tritium Sight Sig 225,226,228,229,2009,SP2340,All XDs Green/Green 2 Dot SI0002S-5. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Xs 24/7 Big Dot Sig P225-2009/Xd XS Sight Systems 24/7 Big Dot Tritium Sight Sig 225,226,228,229,2009,SP2340,All XDs Green/Green 2 Dot SI0002S-5. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fK23MEUxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TNSK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XS Sight Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 140.06}}
{"item_id": "B0009TO4FE", "title": "Teleflex Marine 18-7845 Fuel Filter", "description": "Sierra International Marine Fuel Water Separator Filter removes over 98.8 percent of emulsified water from your gasoline. Sierra's 10 micron filters are over 90 percent efficient at removing particles as small as 10 microns. All filters flow at 90 GPH to feed even the hungriest motor. Sierra 10 micron filters are recommended to prevent damage to sensitive inboard and outboard fuel injection systems.", "text": "Teleflex Marine 18-7845 Fuel Filter Sierra International Marine Fuel Water Separator Filter removes over 98.8 percent of emulsified water from your gasoline. Sierra's 10 micron filters are over 90 percent efficient at removing particles as small as 10 microns. All filters flow at 90 GPH to feed even the hungriest motor. Sierra 10 micron filters are recommended to prevent damage to sensitive inboard and outboard fuel injection systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XmcbT3zkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TO4FE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teleflex Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Fuel Filters"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B0009TP1OC", "title": "Da Vinci 50 Clay Composite Dice Striped 11.5-Gram Poker Chips", "description": "These 11.5 gram Dice Striped poker chips are made of a High Quality Clay Composite Resin with a metal insert for added weight. Each chip is made to specifications and is perfectly balanced to give the proper effect. This is one of our newest exclusive designs.", "text": "Da Vinci 50 Clay Composite Dice Striped 11.5-Gram Poker Chips These 11.5 gram Dice Striped poker chips are made of a High Quality Clay Composite Resin with a metal insert for added weight. Each chip is made to specifications and is perfectly balanced to give the proper effect. This is one of our newest exclusive designs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YE0KW3dgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TP1OC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Poker Equipment", "Poker Chips"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0009TPAU2", "title": "Brain-Pad LoPro+ Double Laminated Strap/Strapless YOUTH Mouthguard (Blue/Clear)", "description": "LoPro PLUS: Strap/non-Strap Performance mouth guard! Low Profile design is a slimmer version of the Pro+Plus. Favored in sports where hard contact is not the norm. Preferred by soccer, lacrosse and most team sports. Dual thermoplastic design Secures and cushions the jaw creating a safety space at the base of skull and TMJ Reduces impact forces to the base of skull and TMJ . AeroFlowClench enhances breathing and endurance Designed for a slimmer more comfortable fit. Fits over braces Has been tested and proven to reduces forces from lower jaw impacts Protects upper and lower teeth, lips, and tongue Can be worn with or without strap Includes hard shell anti-microbial storage case Aligns jaw to allow muscles to work at Maximum strength (M.O.R.A. Effect) 30 second custom fitting instructions inside Backed by: FREE 8,000 Dollars DENTAL WARRANTY.", "text": "Brain-Pad LoPro+ Double Laminated Strap/Strapless YOUTH Mouthguard (Blue/Clear) LoPro PLUS: Strap/non-Strap Performance mouth guard! Low Profile design is a slimmer version of the Pro+Plus. Favored in sports where hard contact is not the norm. Preferred by soccer, lacrosse and most team sports. Dual thermoplastic design Secures and cushions the jaw creating a safety space at the base of skull and TMJ Reduces impact forces to the base of skull and TMJ . AeroFlowClench enhances breathing and endurance Designed for a slimmer more comfortable fit. Fits over braces Has been tested and proven to reduces forces from lower jaw impacts Protects upper and lower teeth, lips, and tongue Can be worn with or without strap Includes hard shell anti-microbial storage case Aligns jaw to allow muscles to work at Maximum strength (M.O.R.A. Effect) 30 second custom fitting instructions inside Backed by: FREE 8,000 Dollars DENTAL WARRANTY.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fxfgXZYNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TPAU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brain Pad", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]], "price": 14.01}}
{"item_id": "B0009TPLJC", "title": "Big Dot Tritium Sight G17/19/22/23/24/26/27/31-36 G20/21/29/30/37", "description": "DISCLAIMER: \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. and is one of many trademarks owned by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Glockstore.com is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. WE ARE CLOSED WEEKENDS - OPEN WEEKDAYS 9-5 XS 24/7 Express Sights are the finest sights made for fast sight acquisition in all light conditions. Day Light, Half Light, or Low-Light, just \"dot the i\". Fast, simple and effective. This is the ultimate self defense sight system that provide sights you can see around the clock. Features: Enhanced sight acquisition in all light conditions Ultimate \"Flash Sight\" picture Excels in high stress defensive situations Improves Low-Light accuracy Low profile, snag free design", "text": "Big Dot Tritium Sight G17/19/22/23/24/26/27/31-36 G20/21/29/30/37 DISCLAIMER: \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. and is one of many trademarks owned by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Glockstore.com is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. WE ARE CLOSED WEEKENDS - OPEN WEEKDAYS 9-5 XS 24/7 Express Sights are the finest sights made for fast sight acquisition in all light conditions. Day Light, Half Light, or Low-Light, just \"dot the i\". Fast, simple and effective. This is the ultimate self defense sight system that provide sights you can see around the clock. Features: Enhanced sight acquisition in all light conditions Ultimate \"Flash Sight\" picture Excels in high stress defensive situations Improves Low-Light accuracy Low profile, snag free design", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GBx9WnNRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TPLJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XS Sight Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 98.98}}
{"item_id": "B0009TPNBI", "title": "Truglo Rifle/Shotgun Sight Set - Rem, Red/Green", "description": "The TRUGLO Rifle sight set fits most newer model Remingtons, including 700 Series muzzleloaders. Full windage and elevation adjustment. Includes front and rear fiber holders. CNC-machined steel construction. Front diameter is .050\"; rear diameter is .035\".", "text": "Truglo Rifle/Shotgun Sight Set - Rem, Red/Green The TRUGLO Rifle sight set fits most newer model Remingtons, including 700 Series muzzleloaders. Full windage and elevation adjustment. Includes front and rear fiber holders. CNC-machined steel construction. Front diameter is .050\"; rear diameter is .035\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414NNZnF9gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TPNBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0009TRNRK", "title": "Past Field Shield", "description": "Created with the field shooter in mind, the lightweight, foam protection system is designed for quick and easy gun mounting in the field, and provides valuable protection from recoil. It is ambidextrous and attaches with an easily adjustable hook and loop closure for a secure fit. Front and back leather faces secure the gun comfortably in place, eliminating any sliding. The shield's 1/4-Inch thick energy-absorbing pad provides excellent protection for all shotguns", "text": "Past Field Shield Created with the field shooter in mind, the lightweight, foam protection system is designed for quick and easy gun mounting in the field, and provides valuable protection from recoil. It is ambidextrous and attaches with an easily adjustable hook and loop closure for a secure fit. Front and back leather faces secure the gun comfortably in place, eliminating any sliding. The shield's 1/4-Inch thick energy-absorbing pad provides excellent protection for all shotguns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EiP29VmiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TRNRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Past", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 23.58}}
{"item_id": "B0009TROH4", "title": "Bear Arrow Rest/Silent Plate", "description": "A quiet platform for your arrow to ride as you draw it back and a smooth, silent wall against which your arrow slides. Self-adhesive, for use on either right or left hand bows.", "text": "Bear Arrow Rest/Silent Plate A quiet platform for your arrow to ride as you draw it back and a smooth, silent wall against which your arrow slides. Self-adhesive, for use on either right or left hand bows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y5NeET4rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009TROH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bear Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]], "price": 7.12}}
