{"item_id": "B0009UZKNS", "title": "Uncle Mike's Kodra Nylon Universal Single Speedloader Case (Black, One Size)", "description": "Uncle Mike's versatile Universal Speed loader Kodra Case holds most speedloaders from .38 to .45 Colt. Hook and loop closure adds protection. Double case divider keeps speedloaders apart. Fits belts up to 2 1/4-Inch.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Kodra Nylon Universal Single Speedloader Case (Black, One Size) Uncle Mike's versatile Universal Speed loader Kodra Case holds most speedloaders from .38 to .45 Colt. Hook and loop closure adds protection. Double case divider keeps speedloaders apart. Fits belts up to 2 1/4-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pVHambt4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0009UZKNS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.87}}
