{"item_id": "B000AAYBLO", "title": "Bell Gel Relief Bicycle Seat Cover", "description": "Give your tush some cushion on your next ride with this soft, simple-to-use saddle cover from bicycle accessory maker Bell. A cushioned layer of GelFusion gel is concentrated directly under your \"sit bones,\" and a deep center relief zone virtually eliminates pressure points on sensitive parts. A breathable, durable lycra cover holds up to years of heavy use, and an anti-slip gripping material on the underside of the cover and improved drawstring system keep the cover in place during your ride.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell Gel Relief Bicycle Seat Cover Give your tush some cushion on your next ride with this soft, simple-to-use saddle cover from bicycle accessory maker Bell. A cushioned layer of GelFusion gel is concentrated directly under your \"sit bones,\" and a deep center relief zone virtually eliminates pressure points on sensitive parts. A breathable, durable lycra cover holds up to years of heavy use, and an anti-slip gripping material on the underside of the cover and improved drawstring system keep the cover in place during your ride.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415DJtMGx%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBLO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000AAYBQ4", "title": "Bell Key 'N Go Steel Cable Padlock for Bike", "description": "The versatile Key n Go padlock can also be used on school and gym lockers, sheds and more. The 6 foot x 8mm steel cable is designed for low to medium crime areas and quick stop situations.", "text": "Bell Key 'N Go Steel Cable Padlock for Bike The versatile Key n Go padlock can also be used on school and gym lockers, sheds and more. The 6 foot x 8mm steel cable is designed for low to medium crime areas and quick stop situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FKm9zAneL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 14.2}}
{"item_id": "B000AAYBVO", "title": "Bell Ultra-Tool Multi-Function Bike Tool", "description": "No need to worry about bicycle repairs with the Mega Ultra-Tool with thirty-two tools in one. With fifteen different wrenches - hex, box end, and spoke, two screwdrivers, inner tube repair kit with nine patches, two tire levers, and a carrying pouch, you will be covered for any repairs.", "text": "Bell Ultra-Tool Multi-Function Bike Tool No need to worry about bicycle repairs with the Mega Ultra-Tool with thirty-two tools in one. With fifteen different wrenches - hex, box end, and spoke, two screwdrivers, inner tube repair kit with nine patches, two tire levers, and a carrying pouch, you will be covered for any repairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LRftYhwjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 26.89}}
{"item_id": "B000AAYBVY", "title": "Bell Ride 'N Haul Rear Bike Rack", "description": "Bell Ride 'N Haul Rear Rack attaches quickly and easily to your seat post!", "text": "Bell Ride 'N Haul Rear Bike Rack Bell Ride 'N Haul Rear Rack attaches quickly and easily to your seat post!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RH5EYYK9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 17.96}}
{"item_id": "B000AAYBWS", "title": "Bell Motivator Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer", "description": "Whether it's too cold, too wet, or too dark out on the roads, or you simply don't feel like going for an outdoor ride, with the Bell Motivator Indoor Bicycle Trainer, you can stay fit and enjoy bike training in your home. Smooth, quiet magnetic resistance features single-adjustment, progressive resistance which increases along with the speed, and double adjustment centers the bike in the trainer for a steady ride. The 20-pound trainer, which measures 8.5 by 20.6 by 22.1 inches (W x H x D), comes fully assembled.WarrantyThis Bell product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell Motivator Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer Whether it's too cold, too wet, or too dark out on the roads, or you simply don't feel like going for an outdoor ride, with the Bell Motivator Indoor Bicycle Trainer, you can stay fit and enjoy bike training in your home. Smooth, quiet magnetic resistance features single-adjustment, progressive resistance which increases along with the speed, and double adjustment centers the bike in the trainer for a steady ride. The 20-pound trainer, which measures 8.5 by 20.6 by 22.1 inches (W x H x D), comes fully assembled.WarrantyThis Bell product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZHA12QJ9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBWS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000AAYBZ0", "title": "Bell StowAway Bicycle Seat Bag", "description": "Holds the essentials so you don't have to!", "text": "Bell StowAway Bicycle Seat Bag Holds the essentials so you don't have to!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QGijBCUsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AAYBZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000AB609O", "title": "Wald 135 Front Grocery Bicycle Basket (14.5 x 9.5 x 9, Silver)", "description": "We know you love the 133, 3133, and 157 baskets. But what happens when you want to haul something that isn't overly large, but can really weigh you down? We thought you'd probably bust out a welding torch and tack a couple of legs on the 133 basket. So that's exactly what we did. The 135 is the exact same size as our popular 133 and 3133 baskets with shorter handlebar mounts and legs bolted to the bottom of the basket. Perfect for a couple of two liters, or a six-pack with some chips and salsa to go. Give us some Fat Tire Ale, Mission Restaurant Style Tortilla Triangles and Frog Ranch salsa any day!", "text": "Wald 135 Front Grocery Bicycle Basket (14.5 x 9.5 x 9, Silver) We know you love the 133, 3133, and 157 baskets. But what happens when you want to haul something that isn't overly large, but can really weigh you down? We thought you'd probably bust out a welding torch and tack a couple of legs on the 133 basket. So that's exactly what we did. The 135 is the exact same size as our popular 133 and 3133 baskets with shorter handlebar mounts and legs bolted to the bottom of the basket. Perfect for a couple of two liters, or a six-pack with some chips and salsa to go. Give us some Fat Tire Ale, Mission Restaurant Style Tortilla Triangles and Frog Ranch salsa any day!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T0EdcABfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AB609O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wald", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B000AB6DCS", "title": "Wald 535 Rear Twin Bicycle Carrier Basket (18 x 7.5 x 12)", "description": "These timeless rear rack and basket combinations allow transport of longer boxes or heavier items on the rear of the bike where greater load stability can be achieved. Newspapers, large overnight express boxes, or long-stem bouquets sit easily in the deep baskets and can be secured to the wires if necessary. The carriers also offer a wired platform extending over the rear wheel for additional cargo capacity.", "text": "Wald 535 Rear Twin Bicycle Carrier Basket (18 x 7.5 x 12) These timeless rear rack and basket combinations allow transport of longer boxes or heavier items on the rear of the bike where greater load stability can be achieved. Newspapers, large overnight express boxes, or long-stem bouquets sit easily in the deep baskets and can be secured to the wires if necessary. The carriers also offer a wired platform extending over the rear wheel for additional cargo capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BCIb-hhiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AB6DCS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wald", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 52.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ACAM06", "title": "Delta Leonardo Single-Bike Rack, Colors May Vary", "description": "Store your bike easily and with a bit of panache with the stylish, curvy Delta Leonardo wall-mounted single bike rack. Elegantly designed with a silver finish, it's perfect for storing a bike in space-limited apartments or in the back hall. The Leonardo holds the front wheel with a rubber coated arm. It conveniently accommodates any wheel size--from touring to phat, chunky mountain tires--and can hold a maximum load of 40 pounds. It should be mounted to a wall stud. It comes with installation hardware, printed instructions, and a lifetime guarantee against defects.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "text": "Delta Leonardo Single-Bike Rack, Colors May Vary Store your bike easily and with a bit of panache with the stylish, curvy Delta Leonardo wall-mounted single bike rack. Elegantly designed with a silver finish, it's perfect for storing a bike in space-limited apartments or in the back hall. The Leonardo holds the front wheel with a rubber coated arm. It conveniently accommodates any wheel size--from touring to phat, chunky mountain tires--and can hold a maximum load of 40 pounds. It should be mounted to a wall stud. It comes with installation hardware, printed instructions, and a lifetime guarantee against defects.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mFP7pItfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ACAM06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 14.17}}
{"item_id": "B000ACAM6K", "title": "Delta Stableloader 2-Bike Truck Bed Mount Rack", "description": "Get your motor running and head out to your favorite bike trails with the Delta Stableloader rack, which can be used with pick-up truck beds or inside an SUV. The telescoping loading bar system is specially designed for a custom fit from 46.5 to 68 inches wide. It has a fine thread screw adjustment to tightly clamp anywhere you choose against the inside of your pickup bed. Rubber boots on either end help prevent it from slipping. It also features an anti-rotation bracket for SUVs and a stabilizing foot for extra rigidity. Bikes are secured to it much like a roof rack, where the bike's front fork is mounted with a quick-release mechanism. It comes with two lockable fork holders (locking mechanism not included), and extras can easily be added for up to five bikes.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "text": "Delta Stableloader 2-Bike Truck Bed Mount Rack Get your motor running and head out to your favorite bike trails with the Delta Stableloader rack, which can be used with pick-up truck beds or inside an SUV. The telescoping loading bar system is specially designed for a custom fit from 46.5 to 68 inches wide. It has a fine thread screw adjustment to tightly clamp anywhere you choose against the inside of your pickup bed. Rubber boots on either end help prevent it from slipping. It also features an anti-rotation bracket for SUVs and a stabilizing foot for extra rigidity. Bikes are secured to it much like a roof rack, where the bike's front fork is mounted with a quick-release mechanism. It comes with two lockable fork holders (locking mechanism not included), and extras can easily be added for up to five bikes.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vyrQ9dNKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ACAM6K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 86.4}}
