{"item_id": "B000ALAGQC", "title": "Cotton Tactical Short Sleeve Shirt", "description": "Our Organic Jersey Lucy Henley is incredibly lightweight, contemporary, and eco conscious. Flattering for any body type you will feel great in this organic style.", "text": "Cotton Tactical Short Sleeve Shirt Our Organic Jersey Lucy Henley is incredibly lightweight, contemporary, and eco conscious. Flattering for any body type you will feel great in this organic style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ErI2xZKhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALAGQC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ALCDBS", "title": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Kodra Nylon Web Ultra Duty Belt with Hook and Loop Lining", "description": "Uncle Mike's Kodra Black Ultra duty belt is made of tough double-layer 2\" nylon that's edge-padded for comfort. It has an interior polymer stiffener to add support while reducing bulk. The hook & loop lining mates with ultra and loop-back inner duty belts. Both the nylon web and MIRAGE Nytek belts are extremely durable, impervious to moisture and chemicals and remain new looking despite long wear and normal street abuse.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Kodra Nylon Web Ultra Duty Belt with Hook and Loop Lining Uncle Mike's Kodra Black Ultra duty belt is made of tough double-layer 2\" nylon that's edge-padded for comfort. It has an interior polymer stiffener to add support while reducing bulk. The hook & loop lining mates with ultra and loop-back inner duty belts. Both the nylon web and MIRAGE Nytek belts are extremely durable, impervious to moisture and chemicals and remain new looking despite long wear and normal street abuse.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IsNGWnocL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALCDBS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ALDPTC", "title": "Fobus Paddle 6900PS Double Mag Sig 357/.40 & Ruger SR9 / Springfield XDM 9mm, .40", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "text": "Fobus Paddle 6900PS Double Mag Sig 357/.40 & Ruger SR9 / Springfield XDM 9mm, .40 Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qw2ReSXzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALDPTC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.88}}
{"item_id": "B000ALDQI2", "title": "9 mm / .45 cal Belt Slide Holster", "description": "Leather, left or right handed, dual - carry Belt Slide Holsters. PRICED LOW! A universal, fast and easy design... 2 models to fit most semiauto handguns. Genuine, high-grade black leather with belt slots to fit up to 1 3/4\" belt. Includes a removable clip for wearing inside the waistband when preferable. State Color. Order Today! Fits most mid-size 9 mm and .45 ACP handguns, including the 1911 and clones. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: .22-.380 cal Belt Slide Holster - word search in our store for 'Belt Slide Holster'. 9 mm / .45 cal Belt Slide Holster", "text": "9 mm / .45 cal Belt Slide Holster Leather, left or right handed, dual - carry Belt Slide Holsters. PRICED LOW! A universal, fast and easy design... 2 models to fit most semiauto handguns. Genuine, high-grade black leather with belt slots to fit up to 1 3/4\" belt. Includes a removable clip for wearing inside the waistband when preferable. State Color. Order Today! Fits most mid-size 9 mm and .45 ACP handguns, including the 1911 and clones. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: .22-.380 cal Belt Slide Holster - word search in our store for 'Belt Slide Holster'. 9 mm / .45 cal Belt Slide Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mxK%2B%2B0TuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALDQI2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.6}}
