{"item_id": "B000ALGLJS", "title": "Uncle Mike's Off-Duty and Concealment Accessory Kodra Double Snap Close Speedloader Case, Black", "description": "Cordura Double Speedloader Case - Snap - Manufacture ID: 8831-1Cordura single case with snap. Molded insert holds speedloader upright makes it easier to remove speedloader. Outer material laminated to closed-cell foam padding and polyester knit lining. Flaps have nylon stiffener for easier opening; cases fit belts up to 2 1/4\". Reinforced flaps with no-glare no-wear snap closures. Foam spacers provided to prevent rattling and protect bullet tips. Accepts most popular .38 and .357 speedloaders including Safariland and HKS (not for N-frame or Ruger Redhawk)Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Off-Duty and Concealment Accessory Kodra Double Snap Close Speedloader Case, Black Cordura Double Speedloader Case - Snap - Manufacture ID: 8831-1Cordura single case with snap. Molded insert holds speedloader upright makes it easier to remove speedloader. Outer material laminated to closed-cell foam padding and polyester knit lining. Flaps have nylon stiffener for easier opening; cases fit belts up to 2 1/4\". Reinforced flaps with no-glare no-wear snap closures. Foam spacers provided to prevent rattling and protect bullet tips. Accepts most popular .38 and .357 speedloaders including Safariland and HKS (not for N-frame or Ruger Redhawk)Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B9g8KL8rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALGLJS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.8}}
{"item_id": "B000ALGTN6", "title": "TMAS Deluxe Mouth Guard Case", "description": "Keep your mouth guard clean and sanitary! For single and double guards. *** A Mouth Guard Is Not Included, The Picture Is For Demonstration Purposes Only ***", "text": "TMAS Deluxe Mouth Guard Case Keep your mouth guard clean and sanitary! For single and double guards. *** A Mouth Guard Is Not Included, The Picture Is For Demonstration Purposes Only ***", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W75YQCBvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALGTN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]], "price": 1.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ALJB90", "title": "American Fishing Wire Surflon Nylon Coated 1x7 Stainless Steel Leader Wire", "description": "Surflon 1x7 is a great all-around leader wire for toothy fish. This wire is our Surfstrand 1x7 stainless steel with a smooth coating of nylon. A specially selected grade of nylon, tough yet flexible, is used to seal out water, reduce visibility, and improve the life of the line. Compared to old style 1x3 construction, Surflon’s 1x7 construction offers higher break strength and more realistic action. Surflon 1x7 is an effective leader wire for hard-charging, toothy fish such as Bluefish, Muskie and Mackerel.", "text": "American Fishing Wire Surflon Nylon Coated 1x7 Stainless Steel Leader Wire Surflon 1x7 is a great all-around leader wire for toothy fish. This wire is our Surfstrand 1x7 stainless steel with a smooth coating of nylon. A specially selected grade of nylon, tough yet flexible, is used to seal out water, reduce visibility, and improve the life of the line. Compared to old style 1x3 construction, Surflon’s 1x7 construction offers higher break strength and more realistic action. Surflon 1x7 is an effective leader wire for hard-charging, toothy fish such as Bluefish, Muskie and Mackerel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512Y5MJ1sfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALJB90.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Leaders & Leader Rigging", "Leaders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ALL1WA", "title": "Tilley Endurables T3 Traditional Canvas Hat", "description": "Designed with a medium brim that snaps up on both sides, the Tilley Endurables T3 canvas hat is constructed from fabric that's derived from an incredibly durable sailcloth that is still used in boating today. The pre-shrunk 10-ounce, 100 percent cotton duck is both rain and mildew-resistant. The fabric has also been certified to block 98 percent of harmful UVA/UVB radiation and deliver an ultraviolet factor (UPF) of 50+--the maximum rating given. Other features include a dark underbrim for glare protection and floatability. It also ties on in windy conditions.Each Tilley hat is hand-sewn and all seams are lock-stitched so they won't unravel. It also comes with a secret pocket in the crown to safely and securely store items such as a driver's license, room key, or a $20 bill. Machine wash on delicate cycle separately or hand wash in cool water. Do not use bleach. Guaranteed for life not to wear out.", "text": "Tilley Endurables T3 Traditional Canvas Hat Designed with a medium brim that snaps up on both sides, the Tilley Endurables T3 canvas hat is constructed from fabric that's derived from an incredibly durable sailcloth that is still used in boating today. The pre-shrunk 10-ounce, 100 percent cotton duck is both rain and mildew-resistant. The fabric has also been certified to block 98 percent of harmful UVA/UVB radiation and deliver an ultraviolet factor (UPF) of 50+--the maximum rating given. Other features include a dark underbrim for glare protection and floatability. It also ties on in windy conditions.Each Tilley hat is hand-sewn and all seams are lock-stitched so they won't unravel. It also comes with a secret pocket in the crown to safely and securely store items such as a driver's license, room key, or a $20 bill. Machine wash on delicate cycle separately or hand wash in cool water. Do not use bleach. Guaranteed for life not to wear out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MF2uuGuYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ALL1WA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000AM17M8", "title": "Arrows Aluminum for 150lb Crossbow 5 Pack", "description": "Aluminum Arrows for 150lb5 Bolts for the 150 Pound crossbows. These are made of aluminum. These are full size Crossbow bolts (15 inches) You can screw on the broadhead tips.", "text": "Arrows Aluminum for 150lb Crossbow 5 Pack Aluminum Arrows for 150lb5 Bolts for the 150 Pound crossbows. These are made of aluminum. These are full size Crossbow bolts (15 inches) You can screw on the broadhead tips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KXG4VE66L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AM17M8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts"]], "price": 8.49}}
