{"item_id": "B000AM32D0", "title": "Fiber Bow for 80lb Crossbow (Great for self cocking 80 lb Crossbow)", "description": "Fiberglass replacement bow for 80 pound crossbow - Fiberglass replacement bow for 80 pound crossbow. This is just as durable and strong as the original. Works great with 80 lbs self cocking crossbow!!", "text": "Fiber Bow for 80lb Crossbow (Great for self cocking 80 lb Crossbow) Fiberglass replacement bow for 80 pound crossbow - Fiberglass replacement bow for 80 pound crossbow. This is just as durable and strong as the original. Works great with 80 lbs self cocking crossbow!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21E2AB5AWBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AM32D0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B000AM82R6", "title": "Aquis Adventure Microfiber Towel, Blueberry, Large (19 x 39-Inches)", "description": "Aquis towels are made of Aquitex, a super absorbant material woven from ultrafine microfibers. The technology behind our microfiber towel enables water to be drawn from hair and skin more quickly and thoroughly than other towels. And it's especially gentle on hair and skin. Designed to be lightweight, compact and durable, Aquis towels are ideal for everyday use at home, at the gym and while traveling.", "text": "Aquis Adventure Microfiber Towel, Blueberry, Large (19 x 39-Inches) Aquis towels are made of Aquitex, a super absorbant material woven from ultrafine microfibers. The technology behind our microfiber towel enables water to be drawn from hair and skin more quickly and thoroughly than other towels. And it's especially gentle on hair and skin. Designed to be lightweight, compact and durable, Aquis towels are ideal for everyday use at home, at the gym and while traveling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZZTY6X3PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AM82R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aquis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 19.22}}
