{"item_id": "B000AO3H42", "title": "Wald 139 Front Bicycle Basket (18 x 13 x 6, Black)", "description": "The 157's little brothers, these baskets are just as functional. Some people don't need to cart around large pizzas or multiple full size grocery bags, so this basket is for the more streamlined commuters and delivery pros. Sturdy one-piece legs offer all the support you'll ever need when hauling heavier loads.", "text": "Wald 139 Front Bicycle Basket (18 x 13 x 6, Black) The 157's little brothers, these baskets are just as functional. Some people don't need to cart around large pizzas or multiple full size grocery bags, so this basket is for the more streamlined commuters and delivery pros. Sturdy one-piece legs offer all the support you'll ever need when hauling heavier loads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L9VbUvkLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AO3H42.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wald", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 15.93}}
{"item_id": "B000AO3HJ2", "title": "Sunlite Bicycle Welded Spring Rear Rack, (Black)", "description": "This rack fits almost any bike and is one of the best racks out there for the price, 815g with hardware.", "text": "Sunlite Bicycle Welded Spring Rear Rack, (Black) This rack fits almost any bike and is one of the best racks out there for the price, 815g with hardware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L9gCK5QkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AO3HJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 35.99}}
