{"item_id": "B000AO7K0E", "title": "Park Tool Tire & Tube Repair Kit - TR-1C", "description": "Remove stubborn tires and seal punctures with the Park Tool Tire & Tube Repair Kit - TR-1C.Product FeaturesTire Levers: yesSpoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools: patchesWeight: 420 lb 69 ozRecommended Use: fixing flats, broManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Park Tool Tire & Tube Repair Kit - TR-1C Remove stubborn tires and seal punctures with the Park Tool Tire & Tube Repair Kit - TR-1C.Product FeaturesTire Levers: yesSpoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools: patchesWeight: 420 lb 69 ozRecommended Use: fixing flats, broManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B9pKl9xDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AO7K0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 5.69}}
