{"item_id": "B000AOA290", "title": "Park Tool CL-1 Synthetic Blend Chain Lube Bottle (4 oz)", "description": "A new chain lube from Park Tool, the leader in bicycle maintenance products. Using PTFE and a proprietary blend of oils, Park Tool Chain Lube works great in wet or dry conditions. It penetrates, reduces friction, prolongs component life, displaces moisture, and protects parts from rust and corrosion. Also work great on cables, spoke nipples, and derailleur and brake pivots. 4 oz. bottle.", "text": "Park Tool CL-1 Synthetic Blend Chain Lube Bottle (4 oz) A new chain lube from Park Tool, the leader in bicycle maintenance products. Using PTFE and a proprietary blend of oils, Park Tool Chain Lube works great in wet or dry conditions. It penetrates, reduces friction, prolongs component life, displaces moisture, and protects parts from rust and corrosion. Also work great on cables, spoke nipples, and derailleur and brake pivots. 4 oz. bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RbqeO7WPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AOA290.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 7.62}}
{"item_id": "B000AOA2G8", "title": "Park Tool HCW-4 Box End and Pin Spanner Crank Wrench (36mm)", "description": "The HCW-4 is a combination crank wrench and bottom bracket pin spanner.", "text": "Park Tool HCW-4 Box End and Pin Spanner Crank Wrench (36mm) The HCW-4 is a combination crank wrench and bottom bracket pin spanner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21tvwu4ifVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AOA2G8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cranksets"]], "price": 17.06}}
{"item_id": "B000AOA3O4", "title": "Lizard Skins Super Jumbo Bicycle Chainstay", "description": "Designed to fit oversized aluminum frames. Lizard Skins chainstay protectors are made from 2mm Powertex neoprene. Lizard Skins chainstay protectors effectively prevent nicks and scratches to your frame while reducing the noise of chain slap. Chainstay protectors have been sewn with a heavy-duty thread and a tight stitch to add extra strength and durability. US Patent #D445,532 S. 5\" x 9 5/8\" or 128mm x 245mm.", "text": "Lizard Skins Super Jumbo Bicycle Chainstay Designed to fit oversized aluminum frames. Lizard Skins chainstay protectors are made from 2mm Powertex neoprene. Lizard Skins chainstay protectors effectively prevent nicks and scratches to your frame while reducing the noise of chain slap. Chainstay protectors have been sewn with a heavy-duty thread and a tight stitch to add extra strength and durability. US Patent #D445,532 S. 5\" x 9 5/8\" or 128mm x 245mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41px4qtvj8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AOA3O4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lizard Skins", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Guards"]], "price": 9.75}}
