{"item_id": "B000AOA434", "title": "Greenfield Stabilizer Rear Mount Alloy ATB Kickstand, Black, Pouch Packaged", "description": "Stabilizer is great for off-road or mountain bikes. It comes complete with an extra wide rubber foot for superior stability, and won't interfere with pedal action or rear derailleur cables. This is the stand of choice by law enforcement bike patrols throughout the U.S. Fits tube sizes up to 7/8\" in diameter. Stabilizer also features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin,and Calibrated Stem. Weight: 340 grams", "text": "Greenfield Stabilizer Rear Mount Alloy ATB Kickstand, Black, Pouch Packaged Stabilizer is great for off-road or mountain bikes. It comes complete with an extra wide rubber foot for superior stability, and won't interfere with pedal action or rear derailleur cables. This is the stand of choice by law enforcement bike patrols throughout the U.S. Fits tube sizes up to 7/8\" in diameter. Stabilizer also features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin,and Calibrated Stem. Weight: 340 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FhrQTCjgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AOA434.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Greenfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 13.85}}
