{"item_id": "B000AQMBOM", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Combo Muzzle Break/Flash Hider (Blue)", "description": "This stainless finish muzzle break/flash hider will realy dress up your Ruger 10/22, simple to install, just slip over muzzle and tighten one set screw (wrench included), all steel construction.Click this ad for blue finish, see our other ad for stainless finish.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Combo Muzzle Break/Flash Hider (Blue) This stainless finish muzzle break/flash hider will realy dress up your Ruger 10/22, simple to install, just slip over muzzle and tighten one set screw (wrench included), all steel construction.Click this ad for blue finish, see our other ad for stainless finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tmJsVv4OL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AQMBOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000AQQVF2", "title": "Schwalbe 700x18/28 SV15 Tube - 40mm Presta Valve", "description": "Schwalbe Extra Light Bicycle Tubes are designed for outstanding reliability. The base material is sieved at enormous pressure through seven filters before being extruded. All tubes are inserted into a mould and inflated for vulcanization to ensure constant wall thickness and high air pressure retention.All valves are nickel plated and threaded and valve inserts are replaceable. Also Schwalbe tubes with the classic bicycle valve are capable of pressure testing.Each tube is crowned with a transparent polycarbonate dust cap. This is a 700x18/28c 40mm Presta Valve Extra Light Schwalbe Bicycle Tube.", "text": "Schwalbe 700x18/28 SV15 Tube - 40mm Presta Valve Schwalbe Extra Light Bicycle Tubes are designed for outstanding reliability. The base material is sieved at enormous pressure through seven filters before being extruded. All tubes are inserted into a mould and inflated for vulcanization to ensure constant wall thickness and high air pressure retention.All valves are nickel plated and threaded and valve inserts are replaceable. Also Schwalbe tubes with the classic bicycle valve are capable of pressure testing.Each tube is crowned with a transparent polycarbonate dust cap. This is a 700x18/28c 40mm Presta Valve Extra Light Schwalbe Bicycle Tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BaeriS7QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AQQVF2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwalbe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 14.74}}
