{"item_id": "B000AR7970", "title": "Trangia Spirit Burner with Screwcap", "description": "The Trangia Spirit Burner is the most versatile and user friendly alcohol burner on the market. Besides having a track record of reliable service that spans decades it also has a couple of uniquely useful features.", "text": "Trangia Spirit Burner with Screwcap The Trangia Spirit Burner is the most versatile and user friendly alcohol burner on the market. Besides having a track record of reliable service that spans decades it also has a couple of uniquely useful features.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d9tYSe2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AR7970.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trangia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 15.42}}
