{"item_id": "B000ARIRKS", "title": "Reverse Blade Katana Black with Stand", "description": "This sword measures 41 inches in overall length, with a 27 inch blade made of 440 Stainless Steel, and an 11 1/2 inch black nylon cord wrapped handle. Includes free display stand! The tsuba (guard) is a simple black cast metal ring design. The saya (scabbard) is finished with a deep black lacquer and made of wood. The sageo (wrap around scabbard) is a solid black nylon cord. This is a reverse blade sword, meaning the edge of the blade is along what is traditionally the back side of the blade. The purpose of such a design is one in which one has sworn to no longer take a life but must still defend their own life.", "text": "Reverse Blade Katana Black with Stand This sword measures 41 inches in overall length, with a 27 inch blade made of 440 Stainless Steel, and an 11 1/2 inch black nylon cord wrapped handle. Includes free display stand! The tsuba (guard) is a simple black cast metal ring design. The saya (scabbard) is finished with a deep black lacquer and made of wood. The sageo (wrap around scabbard) is a solid black nylon cord. This is a reverse blade sword, meaning the edge of the blade is along what is traditionally the back side of the blade. The purpose of such a design is one in which one has sworn to no longer take a life but must still defend their own life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519xf8wRDHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ARIRKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 22.04}}
{"item_id": "B000ARMBYG", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Dual Mag. Holder", "description": "Dual mag. holder for Ruger 10/22 will securely hold 2 Ruger factory 10 rd. mags, giving the shooter rapid access to 20 rds.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Dual Mag. Holder Dual mag. holder for Ruger 10/22 will securely hold 2 Ruger factory 10 rd. mags, giving the shooter rapid access to 20 rds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411NPMV0VGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ARMBYG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B000AS7SY8", "title": "Rio Beach Wonder Wheeler Plus Beach Cart", "description": "There's nothing better than a trip to the beach, but the fun doesn't extend to carrying your gear, especially if you're lugging a cooler to your destination. Enter the Wonder Wheeler beach cart, which offers 8-inch wheels designed to roll on everything from sand to grass to concrete. The Wonder Wheeler holds a 32-quart cooler in its lower compartment, making it a must for anyone who wants to enjoy cool beverages while lying on the sand. That's just the start, however, as the cart also holds tons of other gear, including up to four beach chairs, towels, blankets, swimsuits, and even a beach umbrella. Just plop your items in the sturdy mesh bag and you're set. When you're not roaming the sands, the Wonder Wheeler doubles as an ideal grocery cart, laundry tote, or firewood carrier, with a weight capacity of 75 pounds. If you live within walking distance of a grocery store but don't want to carry your bags, the Wonder Wheeler is a godsend. And when you return home, the cart folds flat for easy storage.", "text": "Rio Beach Wonder Wheeler Plus Beach Cart There's nothing better than a trip to the beach, but the fun doesn't extend to carrying your gear, especially if you're lugging a cooler to your destination. Enter the Wonder Wheeler beach cart, which offers 8-inch wheels designed to roll on everything from sand to grass to concrete. The Wonder Wheeler holds a 32-quart cooler in its lower compartment, making it a must for anyone who wants to enjoy cool beverages while lying on the sand. That's just the start, however, as the cart also holds tons of other gear, including up to four beach chairs, towels, blankets, swimsuits, and even a beach umbrella. Just plop your items in the sturdy mesh bag and you're set. When you're not roaming the sands, the Wonder Wheeler doubles as an ideal grocery cart, laundry tote, or firewood carrier, with a weight capacity of 75 pounds. If you live within walking distance of a grocery store but don't want to carry your bags, the Wonder Wheeler is a godsend. And when you return home, the cart folds flat for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oGxcULhvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AS7SY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 59.36}}
{"item_id": "B000AS8XB0", "title": "Yonex Mavis 300 Shuttles-6pk", "description": "YONEX draws on its long experience in feather shuttlecocks to design and manufacture nylon shuttlecocks that closely approximate feather shuttlecocks in recovery, peak and drop and flight trajectory.In smash-speed tests of up to 300kmph, a Yonex Nylon Shuttlecock demonstrates recovery in 0. 020 sec. , only 0. 0005 sec. off the 0. 015 sec. recovery performance of a Yonex Feather Shuttlecock. In addition to the ability to recover instantly, Mavis Nylon Shuttlecocks have a consistent peak and drop and highly accurate trajectory for full enjoyment during rallies.Available in Colours: Yellow and WhiteAvailable in speeds:Medium (Blue), Fast (Red)", "text": "Yonex Mavis 300 Shuttles-6pk YONEX draws on its long experience in feather shuttlecocks to design and manufacture nylon shuttlecocks that closely approximate feather shuttlecocks in recovery, peak and drop and flight trajectory.In smash-speed tests of up to 300kmph, a Yonex Nylon Shuttlecock demonstrates recovery in 0. 020 sec. , only 0. 0005 sec. off the 0. 015 sec. recovery performance of a Yonex Feather Shuttlecock. In addition to the ability to recover instantly, Mavis Nylon Shuttlecocks have a consistent peak and drop and highly accurate trajectory for full enjoyment during rallies.Available in Colours: Yellow and WhiteAvailable in speeds:Medium (Blue), Fast (Red)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KNwI0T8KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AS8XB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Badminton", "Shuttlecocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ASB66E", "title": "Marcy Rubber Grip Dumbbell Handles", "description": "The 14-inch Marcy Rubber Grip Dumbbell Handles feature chrome-plated, solid steel construction. The rubber-coated handles provide a sure, comfortable grip, while the threaded collar design provides for safe and easy plate changes. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Accommodates all standard plates with 1-inch hole. Chrome-plated, solid steel construction. Rubber-coated handles provide a sure, comfortable grip. Threaded collar design provides for safe and easy plate changes. Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 14L x 3W x 3H inches.", "text": "Marcy Rubber Grip Dumbbell Handles The 14-inch Marcy Rubber Grip Dumbbell Handles feature chrome-plated, solid steel construction. The rubber-coated handles provide a sure, comfortable grip, while the threaded collar design provides for safe and easy plate changes. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Accommodates all standard plates with 1-inch hole. Chrome-plated, solid steel construction. Rubber-coated handles provide a sure, comfortable grip. Threaded collar design provides for safe and easy plate changes. Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 14L x 3W x 3H inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iOXBq86eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASB66E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 29.1}}
{"item_id": "B000ASB66O", "title": "Apex by Marcy Roman Chair", "description": "The Marcy Roman Chair effectively cushions your back while performing strength exercises. The Roman chair is mainly used for the lower back, but it can also target the gluteal and abdominal muscles. 2 x 2-inch square 14-gauge steel tubing Durable powder-coated finish Boxed construction with high-density foam and vinyl upholstery Extra-large back board Compact design Easy to assemble Assembled dimensions: 43.5L x 28W x 38H inches About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. 14-gauge steel frame. Durable powder-coat finish. High-density foam and vinyl upholstery. Extra-large back board. Assembled dimensions: 43.5L x 28W x 38H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Apex by Marcy Roman Chair The Marcy Roman Chair effectively cushions your back while performing strength exercises. The Roman chair is mainly used for the lower back, but it can also target the gluteal and abdominal muscles. 2 x 2-inch square 14-gauge steel tubing Durable powder-coated finish Boxed construction with high-density foam and vinyl upholstery Extra-large back board Compact design Easy to assemble Assembled dimensions: 43.5L x 28W x 38H inches About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. 14-gauge steel frame. Durable powder-coat finish. High-density foam and vinyl upholstery. Extra-large back board. Assembled dimensions: 43.5L x 28W x 38H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CtTQHQXYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASB66O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 109.0}}
{"item_id": "B000ASDGXK", "title": "Pacific Outdoors Kayak and Canoe Carrier", "description": "The Pacific Outdoors aluminum kayak and canoe carrier allows you to slip your vessel into the water safely and easily. Large, heavy-duty wheels move confidently over rough terrain, and the lightweight yet rugged aluminum construction and adjustable hull supports that contour to the size of your vessel can carry up to 200 pounds of weight. The carrier comes with a kickstand for easy loading and two adjustable tie-down straps to secure your boat. The carrier folds in seconds with quick-release wheels for storage and transport, and the aluminum construction will not rust.Specifications:Lightweight aluminum constructionLarge, heavy-duty wheelsAdjustable hull padsKickstandTwo adjustable strapsQuick-release wheels200-pound weight limit", "text": "Pacific Outdoors Kayak and Canoe Carrier The Pacific Outdoors aluminum kayak and canoe carrier allows you to slip your vessel into the water safely and easily. Large, heavy-duty wheels move confidently over rough terrain, and the lightweight yet rugged aluminum construction and adjustable hull supports that contour to the size of your vessel can carry up to 200 pounds of weight. The carrier comes with a kickstand for easy loading and two adjustable tie-down straps to secure your boat. The carrier folds in seconds with quick-release wheels for storage and transport, and the aluminum construction will not rust.Specifications:Lightweight aluminum constructionLarge, heavy-duty wheelsAdjustable hull padsKickstandTwo adjustable strapsQuick-release wheels200-pound weight limit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317VHFTZQ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASDGXK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ASDXOM", "title": "Apex Standard Hollow Bar Kit", "description": "The Apex Standard Hollow Bar Kit includes one 47-inch hollow chrome steel standard curl bar, two 14-inch hollow chrome standard dumbbell handles, and six standard spring-clip collars. It's compatible with any two-inch weight plates (sold separately) and the dumbbell handles allow you to switch weight levels without having to purchase and store multiple, costly dumbbells. Built to last, the weight bars are constructed of super-sturdy, hollow, chrome steel.About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Hollow chrome steel construction. 47-inch standard curl bar. 14-inch standard dumbbell handles. 6 standard spring-clip collars. Compatible with any 2-inch weight plates (sold separately). Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 47.5L x 1W x 1H inches.", "text": "Apex Standard Hollow Bar Kit The Apex Standard Hollow Bar Kit includes one 47-inch hollow chrome steel standard curl bar, two 14-inch hollow chrome standard dumbbell handles, and six standard spring-clip collars. It's compatible with any two-inch weight plates (sold separately) and the dumbbell handles allow you to switch weight levels without having to purchase and store multiple, costly dumbbells. Built to last, the weight bars are constructed of super-sturdy, hollow, chrome steel.About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Hollow chrome steel construction. 47-inch standard curl bar. 14-inch standard dumbbell handles. 6 standard spring-clip collars. Compatible with any 2-inch weight plates (sold separately). Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 47.5L x 1W x 1H inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WMW3R5VTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASDXOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Arm Machines"]], "price": 24.61}}
{"item_id": "B000ASDXP6", "title": "Apex Standard Plate Tree", "description": "Impex Free Weight Accessories! Plate Tree: Steel with powder-coat finish; Easy-access design; Built-in cup holder. 30 x 30 x 32\", 20 lbs.;", "text": "Apex Standard Plate Tree Impex Free Weight Accessories! Plate Tree: Steel with powder-coat finish; Easy-access design; Built-in cup holder. 30 x 30 x 32\", 20 lbs.;", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FSPGRS8QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASDXP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Plate Storage Racks"]], "price": 47.07}}
{"item_id": "B000ASG0DI", "title": "Pacific Outdoors Disc Golf Goal", "description": "Fun for backyard barbecues and family gatherings in the park, this Disc Golf Goal from Pacific Outdoors is a game everyone can play and enjoy. It features three quick-release pins for easy setup and storage while an adjustable height basket allows multiple uses of varying heights to play. The goal is constructed of galvanized and powder coated steel construction for durability. Three discs are included with the goal (putt and approach, mid-range, and long-range).", "text": "Pacific Outdoors Disc Golf Goal Fun for backyard barbecues and family gatherings in the park, this Disc Golf Goal from Pacific Outdoors is a game everyone can play and enjoy. It features three quick-release pins for easy setup and storage while an adjustable height basket allows multiple uses of varying heights to play. The goal is constructed of galvanized and powder coated steel construction for durability. Three discs are included with the goal (putt and approach, mid-range, and long-range).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412EY9QE8RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASG0DI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Targets & Baskets"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ASG0VU", "title": "Marcy 3-Level Dumbbell Rack", "description": "The Marcy 3-Level Dumbbell Rack gives you gym-quality construction right at home. With three tiers that fit all dumbbell styles and sizes, this dumbbell rack has a heavy-duty steel frame with a powder coat finish. The angled rack design makes for easy access and storage. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Heavy-duty steel frame with powder coat finish. 3-tier rack fits all dumbbell styles and sizes. Angled design for easy access and storage. Assembled dimensions: 36L x 22W x 33H inches. 2-year manufacturer's warranty.", "text": "Marcy 3-Level Dumbbell Rack The Marcy 3-Level Dumbbell Rack gives you gym-quality construction right at home. With three tiers that fit all dumbbell styles and sizes, this dumbbell rack has a heavy-duty steel frame with a powder coat finish. The angled rack design makes for easy access and storage. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Heavy-duty steel frame with powder coat finish. 3-tier rack fits all dumbbell styles and sizes. Angled design for easy access and storage. Assembled dimensions: 36L x 22W x 33H inches. 2-year manufacturer's warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415CQ78XRRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ASG0VU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Dumbbell Racks"]], "price": 97.42}}
