{"item_id": "B000ATX9B8", "title": "Uncle Mike's QD 115 Bolt Action Machine Screw Type Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-1/4-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's QD 115 Bolt Action Machine Screw Type Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-1/4-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L1ku1ng5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ATX9B8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 9.74}}
{"item_id": "B000ATZKLA", "title": "XS 24/7 Big Dot For Glock .45ACP/10MM", "description": "XS Sight Systems 24/7 Big Dot Tritium Sight Glk 20,29,21,30,37,38,39 Green/Green 2 Dot GL-0002S5. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations. The product is manufactured by XS Sight Systems using Trijicon parts.", "text": "XS 24/7 Big Dot For Glock .45ACP/10MM XS Sight Systems 24/7 Big Dot Tritium Sight Glk 20,29,21,30,37,38,39 Green/Green 2 Dot GL-0002S5. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations. The product is manufactured by XS Sight Systems using Trijicon parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eOKTAYKoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ATZKLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XS Sight Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 111.41}}
{"item_id": "B000AU1TK0", "title": "A-Zoom 22 Lr Action Proving Dummy Rounds (12 Pack)", "description": "Precisely dimensioned for function testing and shooter training, these .22 LR rimfire dummy rounds are the same size as factory ammunition. CNC-machined from solid, hard anodized aluminum, they are sold 12 to a pack and can be loaded into a magazine just like real ammo.About A-ZoomIdeal for safety training, function testing, or safe de-cocking without damage to the firing pin, A-Zoom's patented line of precision metal snap caps were introduced in 2000 to meet the growing demand for high-quality training rounds for shooters, hunters, law enforcement professionals, and the military. Unlike traditional plastic snap caps, A-Zoom's are individually CNC-machined to precise cartridge dimensions from solid aluminum, then anodized with a hard coat finish that provides smooth function and long life.", "text": "A-Zoom 22 Lr Action Proving Dummy Rounds (12 Pack) Precisely dimensioned for function testing and shooter training, these .22 LR rimfire dummy rounds are the same size as factory ammunition. CNC-machined from solid, hard anodized aluminum, they are sold 12 to a pack and can be loaded into a magazine just like real ammo.About A-ZoomIdeal for safety training, function testing, or safe de-cocking without damage to the firing pin, A-Zoom's patented line of precision metal snap caps were introduced in 2000 to meet the growing demand for high-quality training rounds for shooters, hunters, law enforcement professionals, and the military. Unlike traditional plastic snap caps, A-Zoom's are individually CNC-machined to precise cartridge dimensions from solid aluminum, then anodized with a hard coat finish that provides smooth function and long life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51whzXMFneL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU1TK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 12.11}}
{"item_id": "B000AU2MGA", "title": "HiViz Spark II Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight (Red)", "description": "The Spark II is a bead-replacement LitePipe that utilizes the proven HiViz red to achieve instant visibility on any shotgun with a removable front bead, whether plain barrel or vent rib. Housed in a steel base and packaged with 5 different sizes of threaded studs allow it to fit nearly all common shotguns with a threaded front bead", "text": "HiViz Spark II Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight (Red) The Spark II is a bead-replacement LitePipe that utilizes the proven HiViz red to achieve instant visibility on any shotgun with a removable front bead, whether plain barrel or vent rib. Housed in a steel base and packaged with 5 different sizes of threaded studs allow it to fit nearly all common shotguns with a threaded front bead", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eGl2dIM4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU2MGA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 10.74}}
{"item_id": "B000AU2VY8", "title": "Chr-16 Chamber Cleaning Combo", "description": "Dewey Mfg AR15/M16 Chamber Combo, Cal. 0.223, Len. 9 1/2\" Rod, Thread 8/32 Female. Includes: 1/4\" diameter rifle/pistol CHR rod and CH-16 chamber brush. Accepts standard brushes, chamber brushes or mops. Excellent for M16/AR15 cleaning. Brass Shaft.", "text": "Chr-16 Chamber Cleaning Combo Dewey Mfg AR15/M16 Chamber Combo, Cal. 0.223, Len. 9 1/2\" Rod, Thread 8/32 Female. Includes: 1/4\" diameter rifle/pistol CHR rod and CH-16 chamber brush. Accepts standard brushes, chamber brushes or mops. Excellent for M16/AR15 cleaning. Brass Shaft.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PmEkc0PFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU2VY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dewey Rods", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 24.52}}
