{"item_id": "B000AU4W4A", "title": "Tink's Scent Bombs (3 Pack)", "description": "The most efficient and convenient way to disperse scent today. Simply remove cap and pull up wick. Reflective strip makes them easy to find after the hunt. Use as yardage markers and also as a trail marker. Hangs in a tree to put more scent in the air and works with all cover scents and lures.", "text": "Tink's Scent Bombs (3 Pack) The most efficient and convenient way to disperse scent today. Simply remove cap and pull up wick. Reflective strip makes them easy to find after the hunt. Use as yardage markers and also as a trail marker. Hangs in a tree to put more scent in the air and works with all cover scents and lures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hfNiQxYBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU4W4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TINK&#39;S", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 4.47}}
