{"item_id": "B000AU7LF2", "title": "Genesis Original Bow", "description": "The Genesis System combined \"zero let-off\" with light draw weights to create a bow that covers all s tandard draw lengths and fits birtually everyone. This bow has just one cam which means no tuning problems, much less recoil, more accurate shooting, and less noise. Ideal for kids, beginners and adults. Kids can’t outgrow it because there is no specific draw length requirement. Simple to buy because there is no need to measure and fit for draw length. It’s easy to shoot because the draw length is always right, the beginning archer won’t deelop bad habits caused by an ill-fitting bow. Great for families because everyone in the family can shoot the same bow.", "text": "Genesis Original Bow The Genesis System combined \"zero let-off\" with light draw weights to create a bow that covers all s tandard draw lengths and fits birtually everyone. This bow has just one cam which means no tuning problems, much less recoil, more accurate shooting, and less noise. Ideal for kids, beginners and adults. Kids can’t outgrow it because there is no specific draw length requirement. Simple to buy because there is no need to measure and fit for draw length. It’s easy to shoot because the draw length is always right, the beginning archer won’t deelop bad habits caused by an ill-fitting bow. Great for families because everyone in the family can shoot the same bow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QtzRy%2BF%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU7LF2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Genesis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 144.13}}
{"item_id": "B000AU8H9Q", "title": "Tipton Deluxe Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod with 22 to 26 Caliber and 8 x 32 Female Thread", "description": "Carbon fiber is well-suited to the tough tasks assigned to cleaning rods. It combines the best features of stainless steel and coated cleaning rods, then adds valuable properties of its own. the carbon fiber can't scratch your bore like stainless steel, and they won't embed like coated rods. Plus, Carbon Fiber rods can be bent to an extreme degree and return to their original straightness. We call these cleaning rods \"deluxe\" because they feature an ergonomically designed handle that spins on two sets of ball bearings - the result is a cleaning rod that smoothly follows the rifling both pushing and pulling, even while under pressure. The \"shank-through\" construction also allows the user to apply \"reasonable\" hammer blows to the end of the cleaning rod to get a tight patch through a bore.", "text": "Tipton Deluxe Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod with 22 to 26 Caliber and 8 x 32 Female Thread Carbon fiber is well-suited to the tough tasks assigned to cleaning rods. It combines the best features of stainless steel and coated cleaning rods, then adds valuable properties of its own. the carbon fiber can't scratch your bore like stainless steel, and they won't embed like coated rods. Plus, Carbon Fiber rods can be bent to an extreme degree and return to their original straightness. We call these cleaning rods \"deluxe\" because they feature an ergonomically designed handle that spins on two sets of ball bearings - the result is a cleaning rod that smoothly follows the rifling both pushing and pulling, even while under pressure. The \"shank-through\" construction also allows the user to apply \"reasonable\" hammer blows to the end of the cleaning rod to get a tight patch through a bore.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21leKQcgJaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AU8H9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
