{"item_id": "B000AY9SB8", "title": "Rio Adventure Military Style Cot", "description": "Sleep comfortably off the ground while camping or at your hunting cabin with the classically styled Rio Adventure Military Cot. It measures 26 by 75 by 16 inches and folds down for easy storage and transport. It features aircraft gauge aluminum legs reinforced with steel hinges and supports. It also offers Rio's exclusive industrial strength Velcro closure on one end for quick and easy assembly. Other features include a washable, durable 600D polyester fabric cover and a carry bag.", "text": "Rio Adventure Military Style Cot Sleep comfortably off the ground while camping or at your hunting cabin with the classically styled Rio Adventure Military Cot. It measures 26 by 75 by 16 inches and folds down for easy storage and transport. It features aircraft gauge aluminum legs reinforced with steel hinges and supports. It also offers Rio's exclusive industrial strength Velcro closure on one end for quick and easy assembly. Other features include a washable, durable 600D polyester fabric cover and a carry bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GbX9NtDFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AY9SB8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
