{"item_id": "B000AYFS6W", "title": "KMC Z610HX DropBuster BMX Bicycle Chain (1-Speed, 1/2 x 3/32-Inch, 112L, Silver)", "description": "The chain that the Pro BMX'ers race on! This chain is designed for raw power, not fancy shifting mechanisms. Flat inner plates.", "text": "KMC Z610HX DropBuster BMX Bicycle Chain (1-Speed, 1/2 x 3/32-Inch, 112L, Silver) The chain that the Pro BMX'ers race on! This chain is designed for raw power, not fancy shifting mechanisms. Flat inner plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UaWxkXt8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AYFS6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 7.97}}
{"item_id": "B000AYG03C", "title": "Grants 100500090 10-Count Ant Bait & Trap Stakes (Discontinued by Manufacturer)", "description": "Use Outdoors around the house and for effective control replace every 6 weeks. Grant's Kills Ants was one of the first ant bait products used to control invading ants. Using a unique bait stake, the bait is contained in the stake and the product is effective in killing ants while protecting the environment. Today, Grant's continues to provide superior ant killing bait products and insect killers to protect your home.", "text": "Grants 100500090 10-Count Ant Bait & Trap Stakes (Discontinued by Manufacturer) Use Outdoors around the house and for effective control replace every 6 weeks. Grant's Kills Ants was one of the first ant bait products used to control invading ants. Using a unique bait stake, the bait is contained in the stake and the product is effective in killing ants while protecting the environment. Today, Grant's continues to provide superior ant killing bait products and insect killers to protect your home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61LLBqyZ6EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AYG03C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grant&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 7.35}}
{"item_id": "B000AYN10C", "title": "Lock Laces", "description": "Elastic shoelace and locking system that feature specially designed elastic laces combined with a spring activated locking device. Lock laces can be worn with all types of athletic shoes for sports or casual use.", "text": "Lock Laces Elastic shoelace and locking system that feature specially designed elastic laces combined with a spring activated locking device. Lock laces can be worn with all types of athletic shoes for sports or casual use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518Et66yCRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000AYN10C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "1000 Mile", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B000B2XR5W", "title": "Razor MX500 Dirt Rocket Electric Motocross Bike", "description": "Essentially a scaled-down motocross bike with an electric motor, the Razor MX500 Dirt Rocket is ideal for teens who want to enjoy the dirt bike experience without breaking the bank. The Dirt Rocket's powerful 500-watt motor carries riders at speeds of up to 17 miles per hour--more than enough for most bumpy dirt trails--and can cruise for up to 10 miles on a single charge. At the same time, the bike's dual suspension and riser handlebars deliver a smooth and comfortable ride regardless of the terrain, so your teen's fun isn't restricted to flat pavement. As a final bonus, the Dirt Rocket's variable-speed, chain-driven motor is extremely quiet, a marked contrast to traditional gas-powered motocross bikes.Other details include large pneumatic knobby tires for a maximum power transfer, authentic dirt bike frame geometry, a retractable kickstand, and a double-crown fork. The MX500, which requires roughly eight hours to fully charge, is recommended for ages 14 and over and offers a maximum weight limit of 175 pounds. It's also backed by a 90-day warranty.", "text": "Razor MX500 Dirt Rocket Electric Motocross Bike Essentially a scaled-down motocross bike with an electric motor, the Razor MX500 Dirt Rocket is ideal for teens who want to enjoy the dirt bike experience without breaking the bank. The Dirt Rocket's powerful 500-watt motor carries riders at speeds of up to 17 miles per hour--more than enough for most bumpy dirt trails--and can cruise for up to 10 miles on a single charge. At the same time, the bike's dual suspension and riser handlebars deliver a smooth and comfortable ride regardless of the terrain, so your teen's fun isn't restricted to flat pavement. As a final bonus, the Dirt Rocket's variable-speed, chain-driven motor is extremely quiet, a marked contrast to traditional gas-powered motocross bikes.Other details include large pneumatic knobby tires for a maximum power transfer, authentic dirt bike frame geometry, a retractable kickstand, and a double-crown fork. The MX500, which requires roughly eight hours to fully charge, is recommended for ages 14 and over and offers a maximum weight limit of 175 pounds. It's also backed by a 90-day warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y66AP08VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B2XR5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]], "price": 407.68}}
{"item_id": "B000B43JZS", "title": "Mainstay Emergency Food Rations. One Pack.", "description": "*Contains 9 pre-measured 400 calorie meals *Enriched with vitamins and minerals exceeding the RDA requirements *Pleasant lemon flavor. Contains no cholesterol or tropical oils. Kosher *5 year shelf life. Withstands Temperatures of -40 F to 300 F (-40 C to 149 C) Exceeds U.S. Coast Guard & SOLAR standards", "text": "Mainstay Emergency Food Rations. One Pack. *Contains 9 pre-measured 400 calorie meals *Enriched with vitamins and minerals exceeding the RDA requirements *Pleasant lemon flavor. Contains no cholesterol or tropical oils. Kosher *5 year shelf life. Withstands Temperatures of -40 F to 300 F (-40 C to 149 C) Exceeds U.S. Coast Guard & SOLAR standards", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410qtQ0fNSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B43JZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 7.8}}
