{"item_id": "B000B5HMUK", "title": "GAMO Flat Nose .177 Caliber Match Pellets (Tin of 500)", "description": "This is a precision pellet. A relatively light weight and flat head that cuts targets cleanly makes this pellet tops for shooters wanting tight groups.", "text": "GAMO Flat Nose .177 Caliber Match Pellets (Tin of 500) This is a precision pellet. A relatively light weight and flat head that cuts targets cleanly makes this pellet tops for shooters wanting tight groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KVTDwEufL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B5HMUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 8.34}}
