{"item_id": "B000B5MIX6", "title": "Wenzel Camp-Away Twin Airbed with Comfort Adjust Pump", "description": "Be ready for guests at a moment's notice with the unique Wenzel Twin-size Airbed. It features the patented Insta-bed built-in pump, which provides customized firmness with dual valve system. It can be easily inflated with a hair dryer, bellows pump, or vacuum cleaner. The flocked-top keeps bedding in place, with flex coil construction for sleeping in stable and firm positions.Key Features:Dimensions: 74\" x 39\" x 9\" (inflated)Built-in Comfort Adjust Pump for customized firmnessFlocked-Top keeps bedding in placeStandard coilsExtra thick 9\" gussetDual valve system", "text": "Wenzel Camp-Away Twin Airbed with Comfort Adjust Pump Be ready for guests at a moment's notice with the unique Wenzel Twin-size Airbed. It features the patented Insta-bed built-in pump, which provides customized firmness with dual valve system. It can be easily inflated with a hair dryer, bellows pump, or vacuum cleaner. The flocked-top keeps bedding in place, with flex coil construction for sleeping in stable and firm positions.Key Features:Dimensions: 74\" x 39\" x 9\" (inflated)Built-in Comfort Adjust Pump for customized firmnessFlocked-Top keeps bedding in placeStandard coilsExtra thick 9\" gussetDual valve system", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zQi1wtkkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B5MIX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wenzel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 47.25}}
