{"item_id": "B000B61OI0", "title": "Advanced Technology International Shotgun Buttstock Pistol Grip, 12/20-Gauge", "description": "Shotgun Pistol Grip Buttstock Give Your Shotgun a Personality of Its Own - Easy Installation - DuPont Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer - Limited Lifetime Warranty - Made in the USA Every Shotgun Pistol Grip Buttstock includes Mounting Hardware and Adapter Kit which allows installation to: - Mossberg 500*/535/590/835, 12/20 Gauge - Remington 870, 12/20 Gauge - Winchester 1200/1300, 12/20 Gauge - Maverick 88, 12/20 Gauge", "text": "Advanced Technology International Shotgun Buttstock Pistol Grip, 12/20-Gauge Shotgun Pistol Grip Buttstock Give Your Shotgun a Personality of Its Own - Easy Installation - DuPont Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer - Limited Lifetime Warranty - Made in the USA Every Shotgun Pistol Grip Buttstock includes Mounting Hardware and Adapter Kit which allows installation to: - Mossberg 500*/535/590/835, 12/20 Gauge - Remington 870, 12/20 Gauge - Winchester 1200/1300, 12/20 Gauge - Maverick 88, 12/20 Gauge", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Gejm1GhNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B61OI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ATI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 48.59}}
