{"item_id": "B000B8IEA4", "title": "Lansky Deluxe 5-Stone Sharpening System", "description": "Sharpen all of your knives with ease with the Lansky Deluxe 5-Hone Sharpening System. Lansky has provided the latest and greatest in cutting edge knife sharpening technology since 1979. The Deluxe 5-Hone Sharpening System is essential to have around the house for sharpening all kinds of blades. The set comes with five sharpening hones of different coarseness and is suitable for any type of kitchen, hobby, hunting, or garden knives. The system comes complete with a knife clamp, honing oil, guide rods, knife clamp screws, a carrying case, and helpful instructions.", "text": "Lansky Deluxe 5-Stone Sharpening System Sharpen all of your knives with ease with the Lansky Deluxe 5-Hone Sharpening System. Lansky has provided the latest and greatest in cutting edge knife sharpening technology since 1979. The Deluxe 5-Hone Sharpening System is essential to have around the house for sharpening all kinds of blades. The set comes with five sharpening hones of different coarseness and is suitable for any type of kitchen, hobby, hunting, or garden knives. The system comes complete with a knife clamp, honing oil, guide rods, knife clamp screws, a carrying case, and helpful instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w1Ufl-%2BUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8IEA4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 36.18}}
{"item_id": "B000B8JDSG", "title": "Lansky Fine Diamond Sharpening Hone", "description": "Fine grit Diamond Hone will put a smooth, finished edge on your knives", "text": "Lansky Fine Diamond Sharpening Hone Fine grit Diamond Hone will put a smooth, finished edge on your knives", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3171JWnKQAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8JDSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 14.94}}
