{"item_id": "B000B8JU20", "title": "Bulldog Right Hand Black Ankle Holster (Fits Most Revolvers with 2 - 2 1/2-Inch Barrels, Ruger Sp 101)", "description": "Black Ankle Holster (RH) Sz 2 Med Revolver 2 - 2 1/2\" Ankle Holster * Elastic and Velcro * Adjustable thumb break Our Customers say \"This is the best ankle holster on the market\" FITS MAKE & MODELS ~ GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST MEDIUM REVOLVERS W/ 2\" - 21/2\" BARRELS * Colt - Revolvers - 2-3\" Barrel Length o Agent o Cobra o Commando o Detevice SPL o Lawman o DSII/38 SPF VI * Army (EAA) - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o Windicator * Harrington & Richardson - Revolvers - 2 1/2\" - 3\" Barrel Length o 504 o 525 o 532 o 622 o 632 o 642 o 732 o 733 o 826 o 829 o 830 o 832 o 833 o 900 o 901 o 922 o 925 o 929 o 939 o 970 * Rossi - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o 68 o 88 o All Double Action ( 2-3\" Barrel Length) * Ruger - Revolver - 2 3/4 - 3\" Barrel Length o Security Six o Service Six o Speed Six o SP101 o SP101 -2\" Barrel - Except spurless hammer * Smith & Wesson - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o J Frames w/ hammer spur o 31 o 34 o 36 o 37 o 60 o 317 o 331 o 337 o 632 o 634 o 637 * Taurus - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o 85", "text": "Bulldog Right Hand Black Ankle Holster (Fits Most Revolvers with 2 - 2 1/2-Inch Barrels, Ruger Sp 101) Black Ankle Holster (RH) Sz 2 Med Revolver 2 - 2 1/2\" Ankle Holster * Elastic and Velcro * Adjustable thumb break Our Customers say \"This is the best ankle holster on the market\" FITS MAKE & MODELS ~ GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST MEDIUM REVOLVERS W/ 2\" - 21/2\" BARRELS * Colt - Revolvers - 2-3\" Barrel Length o Agent o Cobra o Commando o Detevice SPL o Lawman o DSII/38 SPF VI * Army (EAA) - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o Windicator * Harrington & Richardson - Revolvers - 2 1/2\" - 3\" Barrel Length o 504 o 525 o 532 o 622 o 632 o 642 o 732 o 733 o 826 o 829 o 830 o 832 o 833 o 900 o 901 o 922 o 925 o 929 o 939 o 970 * Rossi - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o 68 o 88 o All Double Action ( 2-3\" Barrel Length) * Ruger - Revolver - 2 3/4 - 3\" Barrel Length o Security Six o Service Six o Speed Six o SP101 o SP101 -2\" Barrel - Except spurless hammer * Smith & Wesson - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o J Frames w/ hammer spur o 31 o 34 o 36 o 37 o 60 o 317 o 331 o 337 o 632 o 634 o 637 * Taurus - Revolvers - 2\" Barrel Length o 85", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zrr0xeLtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8JU20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.57}}
{"item_id": "B000B8L6MC", "title": "Lansky Ultra Fine Sharpening Hone with Yellow Holder", "description": "This versatile device, from cutlery sharpening company Lansky, is designed to help you sharpen a variety of household knives. The Ultra Fine Sharpening Hone -- which is intended for use with Lansky Sharpening Systems -- puts a fine, finished edge on your straight-edge blades.WarrantyThis Lansky product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Lansky Ultra Fine Sharpening Hone with Yellow Holder This versatile device, from cutlery sharpening company Lansky, is designed to help you sharpen a variety of household knives. The Ultra Fine Sharpening Hone -- which is intended for use with Lansky Sharpening Systems -- puts a fine, finished edge on your straight-edge blades.WarrantyThis Lansky product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310Il3AVumL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8L6MC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 9.77}}
{"item_id": "B000B8L6N6", "title": "Lansky Medium Hone for Serrated Knives", "description": "Medium Grit hone designed to put a fresh, sharp edge on all your serrated blades", "text": "Lansky Medium Hone for Serrated Knives Medium Grit hone designed to put a fresh, sharp edge on all your serrated blades", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D0y7gLVXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8L6N6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 8.55}}
{"item_id": "B000B8L6NG", "title": "Lansky Universal Mount", "description": "This universal device, from cutlery sharpening company Lansky, is a two-piece mount that optimizes Lansky Sharpening Systems by providing a strong base and increased sharpening leverage. It's made of lightweight yet remarkably strong aluminum with a pre-drilled base. The entire unit stows in the included kit case for easy storage and transport, as well.WarrantyThis Lansky product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Lansky Universal Mount This universal device, from cutlery sharpening company Lansky, is a two-piece mount that optimizes Lansky Sharpening Systems by providing a strong base and increased sharpening leverage. It's made of lightweight yet remarkably strong aluminum with a pre-drilled base. The entire unit stows in the included kit case for easy storage and transport, as well.WarrantyThis Lansky product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415urED81ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8L6NG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 9.75}}
{"item_id": "B000B8WWG6", "title": "SKS Ventilated Handguard (steel)", "description": "This ventilated upper handguard is made of blued steel and provides superior ventilation for rapid fire while dressing up the appearance of the rifle, simple, direct replacement installation.", "text": "SKS Ventilated Handguard (steel) This ventilated upper handguard is made of blued steel and provides superior ventilation for rapid fire while dressing up the appearance of the rifle, simple, direct replacement installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZTSA4YT5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8WWG6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B000B8ZNV2", "title": "SKS 1\" Rubber Buttpad", "description": "Most Americans find the SKS a bit too short for comfort, and this buttpad is the answer. Adds one full inch to the length of pull while softening felt recoil, uses existing screws and doesn't interfere with butt trap for cleaning kit. For Chinese models only.", "text": "SKS 1\" Rubber Buttpad Most Americans find the SKS a bit too short for comfort, and this buttpad is the answer. Adds one full inch to the length of pull while softening felt recoil, uses existing screws and doesn't interfere with butt trap for cleaning kit. For Chinese models only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c9lG0p95L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B8ZNV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B000B9G838", "title": "New Wave Enviro 40oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Strap", "description": "This sleek and sanitary bottle is perfect for any active person who needs their water on-the-go. It stays cool, and its steel construction renders it virtually indestructible to--perfect for those with an active lifestyle. It may not stop bullets, but it will stop bullets of sweat from forming as you stay perfectly hydrated and refreshed. Reach for the New Wave Enviro and stay cool!", "text": "New Wave Enviro 40oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Strap This sleek and sanitary bottle is perfect for any active person who needs their water on-the-go. It stays cool, and its steel construction renders it virtually indestructible to--perfect for those with an active lifestyle. It may not stop bullets, but it will stop bullets of sweat from forming as you stay perfectly hydrated and refreshed. Reach for the New Wave Enviro and stay cool!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GqGoOudtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9G838.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "New Wave Enviro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 17.12}}
{"item_id": "B000B9P6TK", "title": "SKS See-Thru Scope Mount", "description": "This SKS scope mount requires no drilling or tapping or any gunsmith work, just remove present receiver cover and replace with mount,( some minor fitting by filing may be required.) Side mounting allows instant use of iron sights, comes with set of one inch rings. See our other ads for some great scope deals for this mount.", "text": "SKS See-Thru Scope Mount This SKS scope mount requires no drilling or tapping or any gunsmith work, just remove present receiver cover and replace with mount,( some minor fitting by filing may be required.) Side mounting allows instant use of iron sights, comes with set of one inch rings. See our other ads for some great scope deals for this mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QqDUk3HpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9P6TK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B000B9SODA", "title": "SKS recoil buffer", "description": "This recoil buffer by Buffer Technologies will eliminate the violent impact of the bolt carrier with thr receiver thereby reducing felt recoil while saving wear on the moving parts of your rifle. Easy to install, no gunsmithing required.", "text": "SKS recoil buffer This recoil buffer by Buffer Technologies will eliminate the violent impact of the bolt carrier with thr receiver thereby reducing felt recoil while saving wear on the moving parts of your rifle. Easy to install, no gunsmithing required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZTvqD2SpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9SODA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 7.5}}
{"item_id": "B000B9SPN4", "title": "Kenda K837 Dart Tire 26\" x 2.10\" Wire Black Wall", "description": "Looking for a great tire for your bike. Kenda Dart Tire 26\" x 2.10\" Wire Bead . Blackwall. Works great on the front or rear. We have other brands of tires just check our other listings.", "text": "Kenda K837 Dart Tire 26\" x 2.10\" Wire Black Wall Looking for a great tire for your bike. Kenda Dart Tire 26\" x 2.10\" Wire Bead . Blackwall. Works great on the front or rear. We have other brands of tires just check our other listings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VIzBfpykL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9SPN4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000B9V450", "title": "AK/SKS Thread Adaptor", "description": "This adaptor attaches to the muzzle of an AK or SKS by four set screws (make them tight), and will accept any AK type screw-on accessory such as flash hider, muzzle break, fake suppressor, etc. using the Russian 14mm reverse threads (see our other adds for AK accessories). All steel and nicely blued.(Cannot fit muzzles with sleeve welded on).", "text": "AK/SKS Thread Adaptor This adaptor attaches to the muzzle of an AK or SKS by four set screws (make them tight), and will accept any AK type screw-on accessory such as flash hider, muzzle break, fake suppressor, etc. using the Russian 14mm reverse threads (see our other adds for AK accessories). All steel and nicely blued.(Cannot fit muzzles with sleeve welded on).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N8GJZQTVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9V450.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B000B9W328", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK/SKS Front Sight Adjustment Tool", "description": "This durable front sight adjustment tool works on both the AK and SKS weapons (except Yugo SKS). Reinforced with a metal insert, this tool allows for quick and easy elevation adjustments.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK/SKS Front Sight Adjustment Tool This durable front sight adjustment tool works on both the AK and SKS weapons (except Yugo SKS). Reinforced with a metal insert, this tool allows for quick and easy elevation adjustments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JzFTITDtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000B9W328.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 7.98}}
{"item_id": "B000BAUSZ6", "title": "Tapco AK/SKS Colored Front Sight Set-Pack of 5", "description": "These composite front sights for the AK and SKS replace the original with a thicker sight post for better visibility. 3 of the 5 sights are made from a highly visible translucent material while the other 2 sights are a traditional black and a highly visible solid red.", "text": "Tapco AK/SKS Colored Front Sight Set-Pack of 5 These composite front sights for the AK and SKS replace the original with a thicker sight post for better visibility. 3 of the 5 sights are made from a highly visible translucent material while the other 2 sights are a traditional black and a highly visible solid red.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Njus4SqIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BAUSZ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 8.17}}
{"item_id": "B000BB8Y92", "title": "US Weight 100 lb. Traditional Weight Set", "description": "Start building your home gym to make workouts more convenient with the US Weight 100 lb. Traditional Weight Set. This heavy-duty vinyl weight set includes everything you'll need to start a new fitness regimen in the convenience of your own home: (2) 8-pound weights, (4) 10-pound weights, (2) 20-pound weights, a 4-pound two-piece straight bar, and two locking spring clips. The heavy-duty straight bar features textured grips and a patented design to reduce the stress of lifting. An informative user guide is also included. Assembled dimensions: 55L x 12W x 12H inches. About US Weight US Weight offers a variety of products geared toward making your strength and conditioning program as successful and enjoyable as possible. Manufactured to withstand years of wear and tear, US Weight's products will last for as long as your body needs them. Heavy-duty vinyl weight set. Floor-friendly and rust-resistant. 2-piece straight bar with textured grips. Includes 2 spring clips and user guide. Assembled dimensions: 55L x 12W x 12H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "US Weight 100 lb. Traditional Weight Set Start building your home gym to make workouts more convenient with the US Weight 100 lb. Traditional Weight Set. This heavy-duty vinyl weight set includes everything you'll need to start a new fitness regimen in the convenience of your own home: (2) 8-pound weights, (4) 10-pound weights, (2) 20-pound weights, a 4-pound two-piece straight bar, and two locking spring clips. The heavy-duty straight bar features textured grips and a patented design to reduce the stress of lifting. An informative user guide is also included. Assembled dimensions: 55L x 12W x 12H inches. About US Weight US Weight offers a variety of products geared toward making your strength and conditioning program as successful and enjoyable as possible. Manufactured to withstand years of wear and tear, US Weight's products will last for as long as your body needs them. Heavy-duty vinyl weight set. Floor-friendly and rust-resistant. 2-piece straight bar with textured grips. Includes 2 spring clips and user guide. Assembled dimensions: 55L x 12W x 12H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hQwCwBhiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BB8Y92.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US Weight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 74.98}}
{"item_id": "B000BBE4KK", "title": "Trophy Ridge Mohican Arrow Quiver", "description": "", "text": "Trophy Ridge Mohican Arrow Quiver", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41agicIQDzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBE4KK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trophy Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Quivers"]], "price": 13.31}}
{"item_id": "B000BBF2Q0", "title": "Therm-a-Rest ProLite 4 Fast & Light Mattress (Large)", "description": "Our new Fast & Light(R) mattresses offer unrivaled freedom. They weigh less and pack smaller than any mattresses ever before, facilitating the kind of high-speed, low-weight experience that extreme alpinists, adventure racers, and long-distance backpackers have always craved", "text": "Therm-a-Rest ProLite 4 Fast & Light Mattress (Large) Our new Fast & Light(R) mattresses offer unrivaled freedom. They weigh less and pack smaller than any mattresses ever before, facilitating the kind of high-speed, low-weight experience that extreme alpinists, adventure racers, and long-distance backpackers have always craved", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FRDTK7S1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBF2Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BBF2RY", "title": "MSR Miniworks EX Microfilter", "description": "Filter your water year after year with the MSR MiniWorks Ex Water Filter. Clean this lightweight, compact filter back to like-new condition, without any disassembly tools. The MiniWorks ceramic element ensures long-lasting protection against bacteria, protozoa (including crypto and giardia), and particulate, and the carbon core removes yucky tastes. MSR's little wonder (7. 5 x 2. 75in) can filter up to 1 liter per minute. As a bonus, the MiniWorks Ex Water Filter screws onto a standard Nalgene bottle or any MSR dromedary bag. *Kit includes stuff sack, hose float, scrub pad, and instructions.", "text": "MSR Miniworks EX Microfilter Filter your water year after year with the MSR MiniWorks Ex Water Filter. Clean this lightweight, compact filter back to like-new condition, without any disassembly tools. The MiniWorks ceramic element ensures long-lasting protection against bacteria, protozoa (including crypto and giardia), and particulate, and the carbon core removes yucky tastes. MSR's little wonder (7. 5 x 2. 75in) can filter up to 1 liter per minute. As a bonus, the MiniWorks Ex Water Filter screws onto a standard Nalgene bottle or any MSR dromedary bag. *Kit includes stuff sack, hose float, scrub pad, and instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4159rogQXhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBF2RY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 82.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBF2SS", "title": "MSR MSR® Fuel Pumps", "description": "MSR Fuel Pumps are small and lightweight so you can carry one easily in your backpack while on a hiking trip. The liquid-fuel pumps have an adjustable flame to always get the right amount of heat for cooking. MSR Fuel Pumps remove easily; moreover, they won't leak, so your other supplies stay dry and safe in your backpack.", "text": "MSR MSR® Fuel Pumps MSR Fuel Pumps are small and lightweight so you can carry one easily in your backpack while on a hiking trip. The liquid-fuel pumps have an adjustable flame to always get the right amount of heat for cooking. MSR Fuel Pumps remove easily; moreover, they won't leak, so your other supplies stay dry and safe in your backpack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DIzSdvcDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBF2SS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBF2TC", "title": "MSR DragonFly Expedition Service Kit", "description": "An extended trip far away from home is no place to remember you forgot to replace that worn-out O-ring. Be prepared for anything with MSR's DragonFly Expedition Service kit. It provides comprehensive maintenance and repair solutions for your liquid-fuel stove and pump in places where failure is not an option.", "text": "MSR DragonFly Expedition Service Kit An extended trip far away from home is no place to remember you forgot to replace that worn-out O-ring. Be prepared for anything with MSR's DragonFly Expedition Service kit. It provides comprehensive maintenance and repair solutions for your liquid-fuel stove and pump in places where failure is not an option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514%2Bl5Y7ViL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBF2TC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 22.65}}
{"item_id": "B000BBF2UG", "title": "MSR Sweetwater Purifier System", "description": "MSR's SweetWater Purifier System gives you added protection against bacteria, protozoa, and viruses. This backcountry kit includes a SweetWater Microfilter, an 80-micron stainless-steel prefilter, two color-coded silicone hoses, foam float, Universal Bottle Adapter plus cleanside cover, cleaning brush, ViralStop Purifier Solution and stuff sack. Simply pump the water through the SweetWater purifier, then add five drops of the purifier solution per liter and wait five minutes for the purification process to complete. MSR's water Purifier Solution inactivates 99. 99 percent of waterborne viruses, bacteria, and common protozoan parasites, so you can avoid spending your camping or traveling expedition doubled over in your tent.", "text": "MSR Sweetwater Purifier System MSR's SweetWater Purifier System gives you added protection against bacteria, protozoa, and viruses. This backcountry kit includes a SweetWater Microfilter, an 80-micron stainless-steel prefilter, two color-coded silicone hoses, foam float, Universal Bottle Adapter plus cleanside cover, cleaning brush, ViralStop Purifier Solution and stuff sack. Simply pump the water through the SweetWater purifier, then add five drops of the purifier solution per liter and wait five minutes for the purification process to complete. MSR's water Purifier Solution inactivates 99. 99 percent of waterborne viruses, bacteria, and common protozoan parasites, so you can avoid spending your camping or traveling expedition doubled over in your tent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uugSYOrJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBF2UG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBGDHM", "title": "Canari Cyclewear Women's Pro Gel Short Padded Cycling Short", "description": "Made by Canari, this pair of women's cycling shorts is designed to keep you comfortable on long rides. The elastic waist and Soft Touch leg grippers prevent the shorts from shifting as you ride, while the gel pad absorbs shock and reduces skin irritation. Eight form-hugging panels optimize comfort, and the soft, flat-seam construction prevents chafing.Canari's standard base fabric of 82 percent nylon, 18 percent spandex provides a high resistance to damage from perspiration, sunlight, oils and chlorine while giving excellent stretch, support and recovery. Manufactured in China, the shorts are machine-washable and should be hung to dry. They have a 7-inch inseam.All Canari brand products come with a lifetime guarantee.", "text": "Canari Cyclewear Women's Pro Gel Short Padded Cycling Short Made by Canari, this pair of women's cycling shorts is designed to keep you comfortable on long rides. The elastic waist and Soft Touch leg grippers prevent the shorts from shifting as you ride, while the gel pad absorbs shock and reduces skin irritation. Eight form-hugging panels optimize comfort, and the soft, flat-seam construction prevents chafing.Canari's standard base fabric of 82 percent nylon, 18 percent spandex provides a high resistance to damage from perspiration, sunlight, oils and chlorine while giving excellent stretch, support and recovery. Manufactured in China, the shorts are machine-washable and should be hung to dry. They have a 7-inch inseam.All Canari brand products come with a lifetime guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311OHIvaLZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBGDHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BBGQ7O", "title": "MSR Dragonfly Stove", "description": "A versatile and stable stove, the MSR Dragonfly makes backcountry cooking a breeze with its multi-fuel compatibility, simmering option, and flame control. With its compact size and easy maintenance, you'll definitely want to invite this camp stove to dinner.", "text": "MSR Dragonfly Stove A versatile and stable stove, the MSR Dragonfly makes backcountry cooking a breeze with its multi-fuel compatibility, simmering option, and flame control. With its compact size and easy maintenance, you'll definitely want to invite this camp stove to dinner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uqRwRQdRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBGQ7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 129.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBGQ88", "title": "MSR WhisperLite Stove", "description": "Durable and dependable, the MSR WhisperLite stove has been helping outdoor enthusiasts prepare backcountry delicacies for over 20 years. What will you love about it? Its sturdy design, easy use, and the fact that you'll be able to confidently call yourself a dinner whisperer.", "text": "MSR WhisperLite Stove Durable and dependable, the MSR WhisperLite stove has been helping outdoor enthusiasts prepare backcountry delicacies for over 20 years. What will you love about it? Its sturdy design, easy use, and the fact that you'll be able to confidently call yourself a dinner whisperer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ECBMM4NuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBGQ88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBGQ8I", "title": "MSR Heat Reflector With Windscreen", "description": "Used under an MSR liquid-fuel stove, the Solid Heat Reflector adds stability and speeds boil times, while the Windscreen improves performance in gusty conditions. 11812 , ,", "text": "MSR Heat Reflector With Windscreen Used under an MSR liquid-fuel stove, the Solid Heat Reflector adds stability and speeds boil times, while the Windscreen improves performance in gusty conditions. 11812 , ,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cVoNF9rRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBGQ8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B000BBS49C", "title": "MSR Whisperlite International Liquid-Fuel Stove", "description": "Touted as the best-selling liquid-fuel stove, the MSR Whisperlite has been tested and proven to deliver by hikers and backpackers for over 20 years. Combining a flexible and easy-to-use design with the durability and portability necessary for any adventurer, the Whisperlite is MSR's most reliable choice for outdoor cooking. Liquid-fuel has the advantage of being light and portable, weighing this stove in at only 14.5 ounces, while the stainless steel and brass design carry the durability to last in your pack or on the trail. On top of that, it's got the power to perform: boil a liter of water in just under four minutes. With the Whisperlite, it's easy to get the convenience and durability out of a camping stove that your adventures on the trail demand. No wonder it was awarded the 2005 Backpacker Magazine Reader's Choice for best camping stove.", "text": "MSR Whisperlite International Liquid-Fuel Stove Touted as the best-selling liquid-fuel stove, the MSR Whisperlite has been tested and proven to deliver by hikers and backpackers for over 20 years. Combining a flexible and easy-to-use design with the durability and portability necessary for any adventurer, the Whisperlite is MSR's most reliable choice for outdoor cooking. Liquid-fuel has the advantage of being light and portable, weighing this stove in at only 14.5 ounces, while the stainless steel and brass design carry the durability to last in your pack or on the trail. On top of that, it's got the power to perform: boil a liter of water in just under four minutes. With the Whisperlite, it's easy to get the convenience and durability out of a camping stove that your adventures on the trail demand. No wonder it was awarded the 2005 Backpacker Magazine Reader's Choice for best camping stove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415tRjiNPiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBS49C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BBS4B0", "title": "MSR MiniWorks/WaterWorks EX Ceramic Element", "description": "This replacement ceramic filter element works for both MSR MiniWorks and MSR WaterWorks microfilters and provides increased flow rates for older models.Specifications:Cartridge Life: 2000 litersWeight: 3.8 ouncesDiameter: 1.9 inchesLength: 4.6 inchesMaterial: CeramicMade in Seattle, USA", "text": "MSR MiniWorks/WaterWorks EX Ceramic Element This replacement ceramic filter element works for both MSR MiniWorks and MSR WaterWorks microfilters and provides increased flow rates for older models.Specifications:Cartridge Life: 2000 litersWeight: 3.8 ouncesDiameter: 1.9 inchesLength: 4.6 inchesMaterial: CeramicMade in Seattle, USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iQfx7Kn3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BBS4B0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 30.97}}
{"item_id": "B000BD23E2", "title": "AK-47 Recoil Buffer", "description": "This recoil buffer by Buffer Technologies will stop the bolt carrier from impacting the reciever on each shot, and less wear and tear on moving parts.", "text": "AK-47 Recoil Buffer This recoil buffer by Buffer Technologies will stop the bolt carrier from impacting the reciever on each shot, and less wear and tear on moving parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DKSYKHMSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BD23E2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buffertech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BDJP66", "title": "Third Eye Eyeglass Bicycle Mirror", "description": "", "text": "Third Eye Eyeglass Bicycle Mirror", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317yCE7JcvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BDJP66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Third Eye", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 9.54}}
{"item_id": "B000BDLJ5G", "title": "Lifeline Power Wheel", "description": "A strong core not only helps improve power and balance, it can also help decrease the likelihood of injuries. And nothing looks better than a strong, lean mid-section. The Lifeline Power Wheel delivers a series of intense exercises that challenge your abs, obliques, back, hips and glutes. You'll even see (and feel) the effects on your chest, arms, hamstrings and calves. With exercise options that vary from mild to downright wild, this is the perfect piece of equipment for all fitness levels.INCLUDES:-One heavy-duty wheel with adjustable toe/heel fasteners-One instructional downloadFEATURES:- Comfortable soft foam grip- Smooth rolling wheel-Foot pedal provides intense workout versatilityBENEFITS:-Place feet in stirrups for complete body workout versatility-Move in any direction to target all core muscles- Utilize more range of motion than traditional core exercises-Walk or hold positions to develop balance and body control-Hit stabilizer muscles during upper and lower body moves-Exercises for the moderate to very advanced user", "text": "Lifeline Power Wheel A strong core not only helps improve power and balance, it can also help decrease the likelihood of injuries. And nothing looks better than a strong, lean mid-section. The Lifeline Power Wheel delivers a series of intense exercises that challenge your abs, obliques, back, hips and glutes. You'll even see (and feel) the effects on your chest, arms, hamstrings and calves. With exercise options that vary from mild to downright wild, this is the perfect piece of equipment for all fitness levels.INCLUDES:-One heavy-duty wheel with adjustable toe/heel fasteners-One instructional downloadFEATURES:- Comfortable soft foam grip- Smooth rolling wheel-Foot pedal provides intense workout versatilityBENEFITS:-Place feet in stirrups for complete body workout versatility-Move in any direction to target all core muscles- Utilize more range of motion than traditional core exercises-Walk or hold positions to develop balance and body control-Hit stabilizer muscles during upper and lower body moves-Exercises for the moderate to very advanced user", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8GXgbgFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BDLJ5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifeline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 52.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BEQ26G", "title": "Dynaflex Pro Gyro Exerciser", "description": "Dynaflex Regular Pro strengthens your wrists, forearms, etc. Designed with a high performance rotor, which can reach speeds up to 13,000 rpm's and puts out 38 lbs. of torque, it aids in the prevention of repetitive strain injuries and carpel tunnel syndrome. It improves coordination while building strength!?The Pro Plus comes with a removable top cap, which allows the insertion of the optional speed meter. When attached to the Pro Plus, the speed meter gives the user the option to have 3 separate working programs through the digital functions: measures the user's current speed, user's highest rpms, and maximum revolutions of the gyro, speed meter sold separately.", "text": "Dynaflex Pro Gyro Exerciser Dynaflex Regular Pro strengthens your wrists, forearms, etc. Designed with a high performance rotor, which can reach speeds up to 13,000 rpm's and puts out 38 lbs. of torque, it aids in the prevention of repetitive strain injuries and carpel tunnel syndrome. It improves coordination while building strength!?The Pro Plus comes with a removable top cap, which allows the insertion of the optional speed meter. When attached to the Pro Plus, the speed meter gives the user the option to have 3 separate working programs through the digital functions: measures the user's current speed, user's highest rpms, and maximum revolutions of the gyro, speed meter sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t92S9gErL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BEQ26G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NSD Powerball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BEW7XI", "title": "SRAM PG950 Bicycle Cassette (9-Speed)", "description": "Professionally tested, podium-proven SRAM Powerglide II technology is exactly what you need to give your mountain bike high quality level shifting capabilities without shelling out high quality level cash. The PG950 cassette features a steel body for durability on the nastiest of trails. 9-speed. Powerglide II Technology provides precise shifting and excellent wear Lightweight, efficient and stiff design, these cassettes deliver maximum accuracy Durable construction of high-quality steel cogs and lasting heat treatment allow nearly unlimited abuse Compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 9 speed systems Both road and mountain sizes available", "text": "SRAM PG950 Bicycle Cassette (9-Speed) Professionally tested, podium-proven SRAM Powerglide II technology is exactly what you need to give your mountain bike high quality level shifting capabilities without shelling out high quality level cash. The PG950 cassette features a steel body for durability on the nastiest of trails. 9-speed. Powerglide II Technology provides precise shifting and excellent wear Lightweight, efficient and stiff design, these cassettes deliver maximum accuracy Durable construction of high-quality steel cogs and lasting heat treatment allow nearly unlimited abuse Compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 9 speed systems Both road and mountain sizes available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51f-rexhRnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BEW7XI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BEW80U", "title": "SRAM PG970 9-Speed Cassette", "description": "Excellent shifting performance, long lasting steel cogs, and great looking chrome plated finish, SRAM cassettes are a favorite alternative to the other Big S cassettes. Shimano and SRAM compatible. Powerglide II Technology provides precise shifting and excellent wear Lightweight, efficient and stiff design, these cassettes deliver maximum accuracy Durable construction of high-quality steel cogs and lasting heat treatment allow nearly unlimited abuse", "text": "SRAM PG970 9-Speed Cassette Excellent shifting performance, long lasting steel cogs, and great looking chrome plated finish, SRAM cassettes are a favorite alternative to the other Big S cassettes. Shimano and SRAM compatible. Powerglide II Technology provides precise shifting and excellent wear Lightweight, efficient and stiff design, these cassettes deliver maximum accuracy Durable construction of high-quality steel cogs and lasting heat treatment allow nearly unlimited abuse", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dNUfEvtxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BEW80U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components"]]}}
