{"item_id": "B000BITYMG", "title": "Safety Leash for Pedometer, Helps Save Pedometers From Loss", "description": "", "text": "Safety Leash for Pedometer, Helps Save Pedometers From Loss", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314my7Ju2HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BITYMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pedometer Safety Leash", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 1.97}}
{"item_id": "B000BIW0TK", "title": "Princeton Tec Impulse Multi Purpose Light White LED", "description": "IMPULSE The Princeton Tec Impulse LED Light incorporates the best features of its Pulsar line of mini-flashlights and takes it to the next level. Fully waterproof, this tiny light features an electronic switching system with five settings (low, medium, high, slow strobe, fast strobe) for its LED bulb. The switch also has an automatic shut off feature. Buy plenty -- you'll want one for every key ring, ball cap, backpack and book bag in your arsenal!", "text": "Princeton Tec Impulse Multi Purpose Light White LED IMPULSE The Princeton Tec Impulse LED Light incorporates the best features of its Pulsar line of mini-flashlights and takes it to the next level. Fully waterproof, this tiny light features an electronic switching system with five settings (low, medium, high, slow strobe, fast strobe) for its LED bulb. The switch also has an automatic shut off feature. Buy plenty -- you'll want one for every key ring, ball cap, backpack and book bag in your arsenal!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31euuwDj%2B-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BIW0TK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 8.03}}
{"item_id": "B000BJ2LVG", "title": "Seattle Sports Omni Dry Bag", "description": "Don't let your gear get caught in the rain--stuff it all in this heavy-duty waterproof bag from Seattle Sports, perfect for extended adventures or consolidating several smaller loads into one bag. A heavy-duty 3-roll closure system, waterproof nylon make the Omni-Dry Bag a true multi-purpose watersports dry bag.Features:Superior dry pack with a 3-roll top closure systemHeavy-duty 3-roll top closure systemGreat for watersports or kayaking adventuresSpecifications (Small):Height: 15 inches15 by 7.5 inches (W x D)Volume 600 cubic inchesCapacity: 10 litersWeight: 8 ouncesSpecifications (Medium):Height: 18 inches18 by 19.5 inches (W x D):Volume: 1275 cubic inchesCapacity: 21 litersWeight: 13 ouncesSpecifications (Large):24 by 11.5 inches (W x D)Volume Capacity: 2500 cubic inchesCapcity: 41 litersWeight: 1 pound, 2 ouncesSpecifications (Extra Large):28 by 12.5 inches (W x D)Volume: 3500 cubic inchesCapacity: 57 litersWeight: 1 pound, 6 ouncesManufacturer's Note:This bag is not suitable for protecting from submersion.Items such as optical, electrical or photographic equipment can be permanently damaged by submersion. All dry bags are designed to provide enhanced protection from rain and temporary contact with water. Dry bags are superior protection, but are not intended for long-term submersion. The user of this bag understands this warning and acknowledges that any damage to gear resulting from use of this dry bag is not deemed to be the responsibility of the Seattle Sports Company or the retailer selling this dry bag.", "text": "Seattle Sports Omni Dry Bag Don't let your gear get caught in the rain--stuff it all in this heavy-duty waterproof bag from Seattle Sports, perfect for extended adventures or consolidating several smaller loads into one bag. A heavy-duty 3-roll closure system, waterproof nylon make the Omni-Dry Bag a true multi-purpose watersports dry bag.Features:Superior dry pack with a 3-roll top closure systemHeavy-duty 3-roll top closure systemGreat for watersports or kayaking adventuresSpecifications (Small):Height: 15 inches15 by 7.5 inches (W x D)Volume 600 cubic inchesCapacity: 10 litersWeight: 8 ouncesSpecifications (Medium):Height: 18 inches18 by 19.5 inches (W x D):Volume: 1275 cubic inchesCapacity: 21 litersWeight: 13 ouncesSpecifications (Large):24 by 11.5 inches (W x D)Volume Capacity: 2500 cubic inchesCapcity: 41 litersWeight: 1 pound, 2 ouncesSpecifications (Extra Large):28 by 12.5 inches (W x D)Volume: 3500 cubic inchesCapacity: 57 litersWeight: 1 pound, 6 ouncesManufacturer's Note:This bag is not suitable for protecting from submersion.Items such as optical, electrical or photographic equipment can be permanently damaged by submersion. All dry bags are designed to provide enhanced protection from rain and temporary contact with water. Dry bags are superior protection, but are not intended for long-term submersion. The user of this bag understands this warning and acknowledges that any damage to gear resulting from use of this dry bag is not deemed to be the responsibility of the Seattle Sports Company or the retailer selling this dry bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rT8rIWbxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BJ2LVG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BJ41BE", "title": "Dry Pak Belt Pack", "description": "This durable waterproof belt pack keeps your contents secure from water, sand, debris, and prying eyes. The blue nylon hides your valuables while the waist belt keeps them close at hand.", "text": "Dry Pak Belt Pack This durable waterproof belt pack keeps your contents secure from water, sand, debris, and prying eyes. The blue nylon hides your valuables while the waist belt keeps them close at hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bfR9H-BDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BJ41BE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BJ7WHE", "title": "Dry Pak Alligator Wallet", "description": "Looking for something that's not too bulky, but can still keep your money and credit cards dry? Submersible to 15 feet, this waterproof wallet is sure to keep your valuables safe. The alligator skin print pattern lets you see what you have in the wallet, while making it difficult for prying eyes to read your personal information from across the table. The TPU construction of the case means the case material is 10 times stronger than vinyl and has incredible resistance to hot and cold temperatures.", "text": "Dry Pak Alligator Wallet Looking for something that's not too bulky, but can still keep your money and credit cards dry? Submersible to 15 feet, this waterproof wallet is sure to keep your valuables safe. The alligator skin print pattern lets you see what you have in the wallet, while making it difficult for prying eyes to read your personal information from across the table. The TPU construction of the case means the case material is 10 times stronger than vinyl and has incredible resistance to hot and cold temperatures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IDC6gwzQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BJ7WHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Lines"]], "price": 7.79}}
{"item_id": "B000BJKWXK", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Spring Clip Collars, Pair", "description": "Chrome plated and easy grip handles make the spring clip collar easy to fasten and remove from its bar. Accomodates 2\" (diameter) bars. Sold as a pair.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Spring Clip Collars, Pair Chrome plated and easy grip handles make the spring clip collar easy to fasten and remove from its bar. Accomodates 2\" (diameter) bars. Sold as a pair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BjPf3k%2BtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BJKWXK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 11.99}}
