{"item_id": "B000BKTBRC", "title": "Valeo Standard Spring Collars", "description": "The Valeo Standard Spring Collars fit any one-inch standard bar. These collars are chrome-plated and the easy-grip handles makes them easy to get on and off your bar. The Valeo spring collars conveniently come in pairs.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "text": "Valeo Standard Spring Collars The Valeo Standard Spring Collars fit any one-inch standard bar. These collars are chrome-plated and the easy-grip handles makes them easy to get on and off your bar. The Valeo spring collars conveniently come in pairs.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P2QJ7700L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BKTBRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 5.42}}
{"item_id": "B000BKV06M", "title": "Valeo Neoprene Shorts", "description": "High-quality neoprene with 4-way stretch nylon bonded on both sides for comfort and durability. Side zipper closure for easy on and off. Helps retain body heat to help trim and firm waist, hips and thighs and keep muscles warm. Machine washable.", "text": "Valeo Neoprene Shorts High-quality neoprene with 4-way stretch nylon bonded on both sides for comfort and durability. Side zipper closure for easy on and off. Helps retain body heat to help trim and firm waist, hips and thighs and keep muscles warm. Machine washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EEFDQARWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BKV06M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BKV07Q", "title": "LEATHER JUMP ROPE 9.5'", "description": "For an old school workout with a new school flair, try the Valeo Leather Jump Rope. It's made of genuine leather and boasts comfortable molded handles with foam grips. This adjustable 9.5-foot jump rope features sealed ball bearings assuring an even rotation.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "text": "LEATHER JUMP ROPE 9.5' For an old school workout with a new school flair, try the Valeo Leather Jump Rope. It's made of genuine leather and boasts comfortable molded handles with foam grips. This adjustable 9.5-foot jump rope features sealed ball bearings assuring an even rotation.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410SSD78DFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BKV07Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 6.61}}
{"item_id": "B000BKV08U", "title": "SPRING COLLAR 2inch (ONE PAIR)", "description": "The Valeo Olympic Spring Collars fit any two-inch Olympic bar. These collars are chrome-plated and the handles make them easy to get on and off your bar. The Valeo Olympic collars conveniently come in pairs.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "text": "SPRING COLLAR 2inch (ONE PAIR) The Valeo Olympic Spring Collars fit any two-inch Olympic bar. These collars are chrome-plated and the handles make them easy to get on and off your bar. The Valeo Olympic collars conveniently come in pairs.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4113Y0SZR4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BKV08U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 6.43}}
{"item_id": "B000BKXE0C", "title": "Valeo 2-Pound Weighted Jump Rope", "description": "For an old school workout with a new school flair, try the Valeo Two-pound Weighted Jump Rope. This jump rope features weighted handles with removable one-pound weights. The sealed ball bearings assures an even rotation and the cushioned foam handles guarantees a comfortable grip. This adjustable 10-foot jump rope is made of the same durable solid rubber so you know it'll last.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "text": "Valeo 2-Pound Weighted Jump Rope For an old school workout with a new school flair, try the Valeo Two-pound Weighted Jump Rope. This jump rope features weighted handles with removable one-pound weights. The sealed ball bearings assures an even rotation and the cushioned foam handles guarantees a comfortable grip. This adjustable 10-foot jump rope is made of the same durable solid rubber so you know it'll last.About ValeoValeo introduced its very first product--the original Classic Belt--in 1988. Today, the company builds on that solid reputation by continuing to develop and deliver products of uncompromising quality and value. Valeo offers an extensive line of both fitness and workplace safety accessories to help you perform your best. From back supports to jump ropes, Valeo is your source for all of your wellness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4143W9DQ57L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BKXE0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 19.96}}
