{"item_id": "B000BN310C", "title": "Ultrak 360 Stopwatch", "description": "A stopwatch is one of the most essential athletic training devices there is, and this simple, affordable model offers everything you need.Features30 dual split recallable memoryLap and cum splitsRecall times forwards or backwards during or after operationContinuous display of running event timeLarge two-row displayElectro-luminescent backlight displayMeasures to 10 hoursTime, alarm, and calendarWater resistantRuns on lithium batteryIncludes lanyardWarrantyThis Ultrak product includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Ultrak 360 Stopwatch A stopwatch is one of the most essential athletic training devices there is, and this simple, affordable model offers everything you need.Features30 dual split recallable memoryLap and cum splitsRecall times forwards or backwards during or after operationContinuous display of running event timeLarge two-row displayElectro-luminescent backlight displayMeasures to 10 hoursTime, alarm, and calendarWater resistantRuns on lithium batteryIncludes lanyardWarrantyThis Ultrak product includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/618v3%2ByEreL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BN310C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultrak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Stopwatches"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BN87CY", "title": "Lund 601009 Non-folding Bike Carrier Attachment", "description": "Lund's non-folding bike carrier attachment allows you to carry up to three bikes on a hitch mounted carrier. The front tire slips into the loop and is secured with tie downs (not included). This carrier is made of durable, black powder coated steel to prevent rust and stand up against all types of weather and road grime.", "text": "Lund 601009 Non-folding Bike Carrier Attachment Lund's non-folding bike carrier attachment allows you to carry up to three bikes on a hitch mounted carrier. The front tire slips into the loop and is secured with tie downs (not included). This carrier is made of durable, black powder coated steel to prevent rust and stand up against all types of weather and road grime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JQMj5GHGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BN87CY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lund", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 35.37}}
