{"item_id": "B000BOCA44", "title": "Bell Solid Tube NoMorFlat Bicycle Inner Tire Tube 26 x 1.75-1.95", "description": "Guaranteed to never go flat, blow out or lose air! The last tube you will ever buy, the No-Mor Flats inner tube is an innovation in inner tubes. Maintains constant tire pressure.", "text": "Bell Solid Tube NoMorFlat Bicycle Inner Tire Tube 26 x 1.75-1.95 Guaranteed to never go flat, blow out or lose air! The last tube you will ever buy, the No-Mor Flats inner tube is an innovation in inner tubes. Maintains constant tire pressure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yvEBvejjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BOCA44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 26.24}}
