{"item_id": "B000BOLECI", "title": "MSR Snowshoe Bag", "description": "This durable bag offers ventilated protection for all 22- and 25-inch (56- and 64-cm) MSR snowshoes while also protecting packs and cars. It features a shoulder strap and carry handle for easy portability, as well as an internal pocket and exterior pole attachments for added convenience.", "text": "MSR Snowshoe Bag This durable bag offers ventilated protection for all 22- and 25-inch (56- and 64-cm) MSR snowshoes while also protecting packs and cars. It features a shoulder strap and carry handle for easy portability, as well as an internal pocket and exterior pole attachments for added convenience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Pa2PdGYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BOLECI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing"]], "price": 70.08}}
{"item_id": "B000BOLITW", "title": "Bell Slant Bike Helmet", "description": "SLANT Versatile, stylish and affordable, the Slant is an exceptional helmet at an amazing price. Features 21 channeled vents, a Fusion In-Mold Microshell, ErgoDial fit system, easy-adjust Cam-lock strap levers, and a Blade visor. Weight: 12oz o 340 grams Vents: 21 Size: Universal Adult: 54-61cmo 21.25\"-24\" Certification: CPSC Certified Technologies: Fusion In-Mold Microshell Channeled Ventilation ErgoDial Fit System Blade Visor Cam-lock Levers", "text": "Bell Slant Bike Helmet SLANT Versatile, stylish and affordable, the Slant is an exceptional helmet at an amazing price. Features 21 channeled vents, a Fusion In-Mold Microshell, ErgoDial fit system, easy-adjust Cam-lock strap levers, and a Blade visor. Weight: 12oz o 340 grams Vents: 21 Size: Universal Adult: 54-61cmo 21.25\"-24\" Certification: CPSC Certified Technologies: Fusion In-Mold Microshell Channeled Ventilation ErgoDial Fit System Blade Visor Cam-lock Levers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qlt9lk8vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BOLITW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BOLIV0", "title": "Bell 2009 Triton Sport Cycling Helmet (Black)", "description": "Finally a good looking helmet for the extra large of head! The Triton features our ErgoDial fit system, Fusion In-Mold construction, Snap-In visor, Cam-lock levers for easy strap adjustment and 17 big vents for great airflow.", "text": "Bell 2009 Triton Sport Cycling Helmet (Black) Finally a good looking helmet for the extra large of head! The Triton features our ErgoDial fit system, Fusion In-Mold construction, Snap-In visor, Cam-lock levers for easy strap adjustment and 17 big vents for great airflow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qh2ZwOiwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BOLIV0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BOLIVA", "title": "Bell Solar Bike Helmet", "description": "The Bell Solar Bike Helmet is constructed with a fusion in-mold microshell, which utilizes the process of bonding the helmet's microshell to its EPS foam layer, rather than forming the two separately and taping them together later, to provide a sturdier, more solid helmet. This helmet features Bell's ErgoDial fit system to deliver an easy one-hand adjustment with the press of a button and slide of the dial for a firm, snug and comfortable stability.The Solar also features cam-lock levers that make it easy to adjust the straps around your ears. For your comfort, this bicycle helmet includes 23 vents that allow cool, fresh air in and warm air out. The Solar helmet comes in Bell's Universal Adult size (54-61cm), weighs 252 grams, and complies with the U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission's safety standards for bicycle helmets.Helmet Tips--You Should Always...Wear a helmet when you rideWear your helmet low in the front to protect the foreheadFasten your buckle and tighten your chin strapCheck your adjustments every time you wear your helmetInspect your helmet regularly for signs of wear or damageWear a helmet designed for your activityAbout BellMore world champions have worn Bell Helmets than all other helmet brands combined. From Grand Prix racing through the Indy 500 to Olympic cycling, Bell helmets have played a vital role in protecting sportsmen and women for nearly 50 years. Bell began as a small auto parts store in a suburb of Los Angeles. Growing under the leadership of Roy Richter, Bell became a leader in safety equipment for auto racing, motorcycling, and then bicycling. His commitment to creating great product through a close connection with the sport, along with his trust of and care for the people who worked for him, turned Bell from a one-man operation into a multi-million dollar enterprise. His legacy lives on today in Bell's commitment to racing, quality and innovation.", "text": "Bell Solar Bike Helmet The Bell Solar Bike Helmet is constructed with a fusion in-mold microshell, which utilizes the process of bonding the helmet's microshell to its EPS foam layer, rather than forming the two separately and taping them together later, to provide a sturdier, more solid helmet. This helmet features Bell's ErgoDial fit system to deliver an easy one-hand adjustment with the press of a button and slide of the dial for a firm, snug and comfortable stability.The Solar also features cam-lock levers that make it easy to adjust the straps around your ears. For your comfort, this bicycle helmet includes 23 vents that allow cool, fresh air in and warm air out. The Solar helmet comes in Bell's Universal Adult size (54-61cm), weighs 252 grams, and complies with the U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission's safety standards for bicycle helmets.Helmet Tips--You Should Always...Wear a helmet when you rideWear your helmet low in the front to protect the foreheadFasten your buckle and tighten your chin strapCheck your adjustments every time you wear your helmetInspect your helmet regularly for signs of wear or damageWear a helmet designed for your activityAbout BellMore world champions have worn Bell Helmets than all other helmet brands combined. From Grand Prix racing through the Indy 500 to Olympic cycling, Bell helmets have played a vital role in protecting sportsmen and women for nearly 50 years. Bell began as a small auto parts store in a suburb of Los Angeles. Growing under the leadership of Roy Richter, Bell became a leader in safety equipment for auto racing, motorcycling, and then bicycling. His commitment to creating great product through a close connection with the sport, along with his trust of and care for the people who worked for him, turned Bell from a one-man operation into a multi-million dollar enterprise. His legacy lives on today in Bell's commitment to racing, quality and innovation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zheAw8BGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BOLIVA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
