{"item_id": "B000BS02LI", "title": "Finish Line Easy-Pro 5 Piece Brush Set Precision Cleaning Kit", "description": "Chosen by mechanics for safe and efficient cleaning! The Easy Pro Brush Set is a must- have for every cyclist who cares about having a clean bike. The set includes 5 different brushes to tackle all cleaning jobs. Use them to remove mud, dirt and road grime from the frame and components. The package includes a features and benefits guide to explain the multiple uses of each brush. Also included is a 22cm ball chain so that the brushes can be easily hung when not in use.", "text": "Finish Line Easy-Pro 5 Piece Brush Set Precision Cleaning Kit Chosen by mechanics for safe and efficient cleaning! The Easy Pro Brush Set is a must- have for every cyclist who cares about having a clean bike. The set includes 5 different brushes to tackle all cleaning jobs. Use them to remove mud, dirt and road grime from the frame and components. The package includes a features and benefits guide to explain the multiple uses of each brush. Also included is a 22cm ball chain so that the brushes can be easily hung when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41reBi69V3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS02LI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 14.96}}
{"item_id": "B000BS02LS", "title": "Finish Line Grunge Brush Chain: Gear and Chain Cleaning Tool", "description": "", "text": "Finish Line Grunge Brush Chain: Gear and Chain Cleaning Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nVcfyM1rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS02LS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 11.29}}
{"item_id": "B000BS05XS", "title": "UCO Original Collapsible Candle Lantern", "description": "This is the classic, long-burning collapsible candle lantern that has provided warm natural light to thousands of outdoor enthusiasts for decades. It is perfectly suited to backpacking, mountaineering, snow camping and similar outdoor pursuits, as well as providing convenient emergency backup lighting. The Original Candle Lantern utilizes one UCO 9-hour candle, surrounding it in the safest, most efficient lantern housing available anywhere. The spring powered candle tube pushes the candle up as it burns, keeping the flame burning at a constant height. A viewing slot allows the user to monitor the remaining burn time of the slow-burning candle.", "text": "UCO Original Collapsible Candle Lantern This is the classic, long-burning collapsible candle lantern that has provided warm natural light to thousands of outdoor enthusiasts for decades. It is perfectly suited to backpacking, mountaineering, snow camping and similar outdoor pursuits, as well as providing convenient emergency backup lighting. The Original Candle Lantern utilizes one UCO 9-hour candle, surrounding it in the safest, most efficient lantern housing available anywhere. The spring powered candle tube pushes the candle up as it burns, keeping the flame burning at a constant height. A viewing slot allows the user to monitor the remaining burn time of the slow-burning candle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hllq92iPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS05XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 15.28}}
{"item_id": "B000BS05Y2", "title": "UCO 9+ Hour Candles for Candle Lanterns (3.5 Inch)", "description": "UCO candles are custom engineered for use in UCO Candle Lanterns. The candles come in three different configurations – the original 9-hour, dripless white candle, a 9-hour insect-repelling citronella candle, and a 12+ hour natural beeswax candle. All feature high-grade wax formulas that burn clean and free of soot. The candle wicks are specially designed to maintain an even flame height, making them ideal for use in lanterns. UCO candles are equally well suited for to a variety of indoor and outdoor uses, including emergency power outages or simply providing warm, ambient light. Available in economical 3-packs or bulk 20-packs, be sure to keep your emergency kit and/or camping gear stocked with extra UCO 9+ hour candles.", "text": "UCO 9+ Hour Candles for Candle Lanterns (3.5 Inch) UCO candles are custom engineered for use in UCO Candle Lanterns. The candles come in three different configurations – the original 9-hour, dripless white candle, a 9-hour insect-repelling citronella candle, and a 12+ hour natural beeswax candle. All feature high-grade wax formulas that burn clean and free of soot. The candle wicks are specially designed to maintain an even flame height, making them ideal for use in lanterns. UCO candles are equally well suited for to a variety of indoor and outdoor uses, including emergency power outages or simply providing warm, ambient light. Available in economical 3-packs or bulk 20-packs, be sure to keep your emergency kit and/or camping gear stocked with extra UCO 9+ hour candles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jI7cjjaoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS05Y2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0AQU", "title": "Nalgene Wide Mouth Cantene", "description": "This Mouth Wide Canteen is made of multilayered material that offers stiffness and strength for stand-up capability, yet is soft and flexible to be folded or rolled.The wide mouth opening accepts ice cubes and provides easy access for cleaning. Also accommodates all major water filters. Guaranteed leakproof system with loop-top cap. Gusseted bottom stands upright.", "text": "Nalgene Wide Mouth Cantene This Mouth Wide Canteen is made of multilayered material that offers stiffness and strength for stand-up capability, yet is soft and flexible to be folded or rolled.The wide mouth opening accepts ice cubes and provides easy access for cleaning. Also accommodates all major water filters. Guaranteed leakproof system with loop-top cap. Gusseted bottom stands upright.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cj5FOaAEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0AQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 12.12}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0D4Y", "title": "Kryptonite New York Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Bracket ( 4-Inch x 8-Inch)", "description": "Kryptonite New York MC 3000 U-Lock Ultimate security for high theft areasSteel sleeve in a \"crossbar over crossbar\" constructionHigh security, anti-pick disc style cylinder with double dead bolt lockExtra thick 58\" Kryptonium steel shackleIncludes a lighted key4\" x 8\"", "text": "Kryptonite New York Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Bracket ( 4-Inch x 8-Inch) Kryptonite New York MC 3000 U-Lock Ultimate security for high theft areasSteel sleeve in a \"crossbar over crossbar\" constructionHigh security, anti-pick disc style cylinder with double dead bolt lockExtra thick 58\" Kryptonium steel shackleIncludes a lighted key4\" x 8\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lU0sTGsCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0D4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 88.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0D8K", "title": "Kryptonite Kryptoflex 815 Combo Cable Bicycle Lock", "description": "4-digit resettable combination lock with indexed number dials for error-free settingIntegrated, adjustable spline attachment rotates up to 240 degrees for a greater number of possible lock carrying positions", "text": "Kryptonite Kryptoflex 815 Combo Cable Bicycle Lock 4-digit resettable combination lock with indexed number dials for error-free settingIntegrated, adjustable spline attachment rotates up to 240 degrees for a greater number of possible lock carrying positions", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Z3OA3ozrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0D8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 12.85}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0DCQ", "title": "Kelty Redwing 44 Internal Frame Pack (Cobalt, One Size 14.5 - 18.5-Inch Torso)", "description": "The proven Redwing is the most popular pack on the trail. Revered for its roomy main compartment, convenient organizational pockets, sturdy LightBeam™ II stay and suspension system, and comfortable design, it’s no wonder this classic, which just got a facelift, consistently earns top scores.", "text": "Kelty Redwing 44 Internal Frame Pack (Cobalt, One Size 14.5 - 18.5-Inch Torso) The proven Redwing is the most popular pack on the trail. Revered for its roomy main compartment, convenient organizational pockets, sturdy LightBeam™ II stay and suspension system, and comfortable design, it’s no wonder this classic, which just got a facelift, consistently earns top scores.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wH3kxqarL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0DCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0DFI", "title": "Kelty Red Cloud 90 Internal Frame Backpack", "description": "The Red Cloud 90 offers a great deal of packing space to go along with a full feature set and remarkable versatility. A new, easily adjustable Cloudlock II suspension provides solid stability, even with a full load, while a detachable lid doubles as a waist pack for quick expeditions.Bag Features:Top loading420-denier polyester Ball Shadow body fabric420-denier polyester Oxford reinforcement fabricSleeping bag compartmentFront-panel accessZippered side pocketsHydration compatibleReservoir sleeveMesh water bottle pocketsSide compression strapsLoad stabilizer strapsSpindrift collarIce-axe loopsDaisy chainKey fobZippered waist belt pocketsLid converts into lumbar packFront pocketCarry handleInternal dividerSuspension Features:CloudLock II adjustable suspensionLightbeam II dual aluminum staysHDPE frame sheetHDPE reinforced waist beltRemovable dual density foam waist beltPadded shoulder strapsVentilating backpanelLoad-lifter/stabilizer strapsSternum strapPatented Scherer cinchLifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "text": "Kelty Red Cloud 90 Internal Frame Backpack The Red Cloud 90 offers a great deal of packing space to go along with a full feature set and remarkable versatility. A new, easily adjustable Cloudlock II suspension provides solid stability, even with a full load, while a detachable lid doubles as a waist pack for quick expeditions.Bag Features:Top loading420-denier polyester Ball Shadow body fabric420-denier polyester Oxford reinforcement fabricSleeping bag compartmentFront-panel accessZippered side pocketsHydration compatibleReservoir sleeveMesh water bottle pocketsSide compression strapsLoad stabilizer strapsSpindrift collarIce-axe loopsDaisy chainKey fobZippered waist belt pocketsLid converts into lumbar packFront pocketCarry handleInternal dividerSuspension Features:CloudLock II adjustable suspensionLightbeam II dual aluminum staysHDPE frame sheetHDPE reinforced waist beltRemovable dual density foam waist beltPadded shoulder strapsVentilating backpanelLoad-lifter/stabilizer strapsSternum strapPatented Scherer cinchLifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g9GD%2B5drL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0DFI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0I2G", "title": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack Strap-On Seat Mounted Bag for 27.2-34.9mm Seatposts", "description": "Aerodynamic styling with traditional strap mount in the form of a seat mounted wedge bag. A large mouth opening with swallow up all of your gear with ease, while a safety light mount allows attachment of a light on the rear for enhances visibility at night.Fits 27.2-34.9mm seat posts1200 denier super-dense nylon construction for ultimate resistance to wear3M reflective strip and safety light clip allow options for enhanced visibilityMounted using a traditional click-in strap for the underside of the saddle, and a seat post strapQuality Topeak construction", "text": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack Strap-On Seat Mounted Bag for 27.2-34.9mm Seatposts Aerodynamic styling with traditional strap mount in the form of a seat mounted wedge bag. A large mouth opening with swallow up all of your gear with ease, while a safety light mount allows attachment of a light on the rear for enhances visibility at night.Fits 27.2-34.9mm seat posts1200 denier super-dense nylon construction for ultimate resistance to wear3M reflective strip and safety light clip allow options for enhanced visibilityMounted using a traditional click-in strap for the underside of the saddle, and a seat post strapQuality Topeak construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W8R%2BJ5H9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0I2G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BS0LXM", "title": "Hutchinson Fusion 3 Road Tire - Tubeless", "description": "While the Hutchinson Fusion 3 Road Tubeless Tire may look like a regular clincher, its secret is hidden inside the outer layers of the its special casing. What makes it different is a design that's intended to be used without a traditional inner tube. Like other folding clincher tires, the Fusion 3 forgoes a steel bead for something lighter and more flexible. However, the specific needs of Road Tubeless dictate that Hutchinson use a bundle of unidirectional carbon fiber instead of the normal Kevlar found in other folding clinchers. The carbon bead is required to give the Fusion 3 a more stable structure. It's more resistant to stretch, allowing the tires to stay seated on your rims in the absence of a tube.The Fusion 3 is a few grams heavier than their lightest Road Tubeless tire, the Atom, but it has one important property that make it a better tire for many folks. Namely, it has a higher puncture resistance due mostly to the triple rubber compound and the harder rubber in the center section of the tire. In addition to resisting cuts, this also allows it to have excellent rolling characteristics. The 127tpi sidewall is built intentionally to be a little resistant to flex. This gives the tire some structure of its own to help support you and your bike. It allows the Fusion 3 to be ridden at lower operating pressures than traditional clinchers -- typically 80 - 90psi. The lower tire pressure provides a better ride and conforms better to the road, actually absorbing and rebounding from irregularities in the road surface. The idea is that the rebound helps give back the energy that it cost you to run over each bump in the first place. Compare that to riding tube-type clinchers, with a rock hard 120psi \"skipping\" off the bumps and on a tiny scale, releasing that energy up and away from the road. It's an easy assumption that getting some energy payback is a good thing, and if you hit a million little bumps during your next race or long training ride, the Fusion 3 wi...", "text": "Hutchinson Fusion 3 Road Tire - Tubeless While the Hutchinson Fusion 3 Road Tubeless Tire may look like a regular clincher, its secret is hidden inside the outer layers of the its special casing. What makes it different is a design that's intended to be used without a traditional inner tube. Like other folding clincher tires, the Fusion 3 forgoes a steel bead for something lighter and more flexible. However, the specific needs of Road Tubeless dictate that Hutchinson use a bundle of unidirectional carbon fiber instead of the normal Kevlar found in other folding clinchers. The carbon bead is required to give the Fusion 3 a more stable structure. It's more resistant to stretch, allowing the tires to stay seated on your rims in the absence of a tube.The Fusion 3 is a few grams heavier than their lightest Road Tubeless tire, the Atom, but it has one important property that make it a better tire for many folks. Namely, it has a higher puncture resistance due mostly to the triple rubber compound and the harder rubber in the center section of the tire. In addition to resisting cuts, this also allows it to have excellent rolling characteristics. The 127tpi sidewall is built intentionally to be a little resistant to flex. This gives the tire some structure of its own to help support you and your bike. It allows the Fusion 3 to be ridden at lower operating pressures than traditional clinchers -- typically 80 - 90psi. The lower tire pressure provides a better ride and conforms better to the road, actually absorbing and rebounding from irregularities in the road surface. The idea is that the rebound helps give back the energy that it cost you to run over each bump in the first place. Compare that to riding tube-type clinchers, with a rock hard 120psi \"skipping\" off the bumps and on a tiny scale, releasing that energy up and away from the road. It's an easy assumption that getting some energy payback is a good thing, and if you hit a million little bumps during your next race or long training ride, the Fusion 3 wi...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m4Dh4HR4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BS0LXM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWE8C", "title": "Cold Steel Spike Knife - Choose Style", "description": "The Spike knife from Cold Steel, designed by Barry Dawson, has a thick, narrow blade that is distal tapered and flat ground to a zero edge. This creates a unique cross section that facilitates both penetration of the tip and cutting power. The integral handle has been carefully shaped out of solid steel, wrapped with cord and had all its sharp edges \"melted\" so they don't irritate the hand. Includes a Secure-Ex sheath and a steel bead lanyard.", "text": "Cold Steel Spike Knife - Choose Style The Spike knife from Cold Steel, designed by Barry Dawson, has a thick, narrow blade that is distal tapered and flat ground to a zero edge. This creates a unique cross section that facilitates both penetration of the tip and cutting power. The integral handle has been carefully shaped out of solid steel, wrapped with cord and had all its sharp edges \"melted\" so they don't irritate the hand. Includes a Secure-Ex sheath and a steel bead lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m2NFKFDIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWE8C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 22.28}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWE9G", "title": "KA-BAR Full Size US Marine Corp Fighting Knife, Serrated", "description": "The Ka Bar' was designed to serve our troops during WW II and is still doing its job, with honors, more than 50 Years later", "text": "KA-BAR Full Size US Marine Corp Fighting Knife, Serrated The Ka Bar' was designed to serve our troops during WW II and is still doing its job, with honors, more than 50 Years later", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y34dftWBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWE9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 62.73}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWE9Q", "title": "KA-BAR US Army Fighting/Utility Knife Straight Edge", "description": "Marked for Army personnel, this KA-BAR full-size hunting knife sports a leather handle and a 7-inch straight-edge blade made with 1095Chrome Vanadiumsteel. The knife features a U.S. Army stamp and was made in the United States. Also included is a leather sheath made in Mexico.Specifications:Weight: 0.70 poundsBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11 7/8 inchesShape: ClipStamp: U.S. ArmyEdge angle: 20 degreesSteel: 1095Chrome VanadiumGrind: FlatHandle material: LeatherHow KA-BAR Knives Are MadeMaking a quality KA-BAR product requires the talent of experienced craftspeople performing dozens of processes with precision and skill. Each knife undergoes specific manufacturing processes to ensure corrosion resistance, strength, edge-holding ability, and an out-of-the-box, razor-sharp cutting edge. Some of these manufacturing processes are highlighted below.Blanking:Using a 100-ton blanking press, KA-BAR can blank out nearly 9,000 blades in one full day of operation.Tang Stamping:Tang stamping is often used to identify a product's manufacturer, the country in which the product was made, and an item number.Heat Treating:To begin the three-step heat-treat process of stainless-steel blades, KA-BAR first runs the blades through a 70-foot conveyor oven that takes approximately one hour to cycle.Cryogenic Quenching:The second step in a three-phrase heat-treat process, KA-BAR cryogenically freezes its stainless-steel blades to -120 degrees F to optimize blade performance.Tempering:Tempering stainless-steel blades for approximately seven hours in a walk-in oven enhances steel toughness. KA-BAR is well known for its three-phase heat-treat process in which tempering is the last step.Grinding:KA-BAR knives feature flat- or hollow-ground blades. Flat grinds are best for jobs in which there will be great lateral stress. Hollow grinds provide a fine, extremely sharp edge that is perfect for more delicate tasks.Leather Handle Compression:KA-BAR's famous oval-shaped leather handle construction is accomplished by compressing leather washers onto the tang, shaping and coloring them, and then fastening them on with a pinned-on butt cap.Cap/Pin Assembly:The butt cap or pommel is attached to the handle of a knife with a steel pin. The pin is inserted into the butt cap, driven part way through the tang, then ground off and painted.Inspection:Each KA-BAR knife is subject to a multiple-step inspection process before being released for shipping.Manufacturer's WarrantyKA-BAR Knives warrants, to the original purchaser of the knife only, that this knife will be free from defects in material and craftsmanship under normal use and maintenance for the lifetime of the original purchaser. This limited warranty does not apply to any failure of, defect in, or damage to the knife caused by normal wear and tear or by improper use, including throwing the knife or using the blades as a can opener, chisel, pry bar, screwdriver, or digging tool or for any heavy work for which the knife was not designed. If the knife fails to satisfy this limited warranty, the company will repair or replace the knife or substitute a knife of comparable value, at the company's option.", "text": "KA-BAR US Army Fighting/Utility Knife Straight Edge Marked for Army personnel, this KA-BAR full-size hunting knife sports a leather handle and a 7-inch straight-edge blade made with 1095Chrome Vanadiumsteel. The knife features a U.S. Army stamp and was made in the United States. Also included is a leather sheath made in Mexico.Specifications:Weight: 0.70 poundsBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11 7/8 inchesShape: ClipStamp: U.S. ArmyEdge angle: 20 degreesSteel: 1095Chrome VanadiumGrind: FlatHandle material: LeatherHow KA-BAR Knives Are MadeMaking a quality KA-BAR product requires the talent of experienced craftspeople performing dozens of processes with precision and skill. Each knife undergoes specific manufacturing processes to ensure corrosion resistance, strength, edge-holding ability, and an out-of-the-box, razor-sharp cutting edge. Some of these manufacturing processes are highlighted below.Blanking:Using a 100-ton blanking press, KA-BAR can blank out nearly 9,000 blades in one full day of operation.Tang Stamping:Tang stamping is often used to identify a product's manufacturer, the country in which the product was made, and an item number.Heat Treating:To begin the three-step heat-treat process of stainless-steel blades, KA-BAR first runs the blades through a 70-foot conveyor oven that takes approximately one hour to cycle.Cryogenic Quenching:The second step in a three-phrase heat-treat process, KA-BAR cryogenically freezes its stainless-steel blades to -120 degrees F to optimize blade performance.Tempering:Tempering stainless-steel blades for approximately seven hours in a walk-in oven enhances steel toughness. KA-BAR is well known for its three-phase heat-treat process in which tempering is the last step.Grinding:KA-BAR knives feature flat- or hollow-ground blades. Flat grinds are best for jobs in which there will be great lateral stress. Hollow grinds provide a fine, extremely sharp edge that is perfect for more delicate tasks.Leather Handle Compression:KA-BAR's famous oval-shaped leather handle construction is accomplished by compressing leather washers onto the tang, shaping and coloring them, and then fastening them on with a pinned-on butt cap.Cap/Pin Assembly:The butt cap or pommel is attached to the handle of a knife with a steel pin. The pin is inserted into the butt cap, driven part way through the tang, then ground off and painted.Inspection:Each KA-BAR knife is subject to a multiple-step inspection process before being released for shipping.Manufacturer's WarrantyKA-BAR Knives warrants, to the original purchaser of the knife only, that this knife will be free from defects in material and craftsmanship under normal use and maintenance for the lifetime of the original purchaser. This limited warranty does not apply to any failure of, defect in, or damage to the knife caused by normal wear and tear or by improper use, including throwing the knife or using the blades as a can opener, chisel, pry bar, screwdriver, or digging tool or for any heavy work for which the knife was not designed. If the knife fails to satisfy this limited warranty, the company will repair or replace the knife or substitute a knife of comparable value, at the company's option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21h34rSgG8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWE9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 59.52}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEA0", "title": "KA-BAR Next Generation Fightning Knife, Serrated, Hard Sheath", "description": "The KA-BAR Next Generation Fighting Knife, Serrated, Hard Sheath is the newest version of the KA-Bar Original Fighting Knife. Show off your advanced moves with this lightweight knife featuring the 440A stainless steel blade, one of the strongest and most durable materials used in knife making. This knife features the classic clip-point blade shape that made Ka-Bar famous in the industry and a 20-degree blade angle. It's finished with a powdered-coating and a serrated blood groove for that extra competitive edge. The comfortable handle is made from Kraton G, providing a balanced grip, while the powdered metal butt-cap is made to last. The flat blade is seven inches long and the overall length is 12 inches. The knife includes a high performance Kydex sheath that protects the knife from chemicals, weather, and sudden impact. Made in the USA, the Ka-Bar Next Generation Fighting Knife is the ultimate performance tool for any task.", "text": "KA-BAR Next Generation Fightning Knife, Serrated, Hard Sheath The KA-BAR Next Generation Fighting Knife, Serrated, Hard Sheath is the newest version of the KA-Bar Original Fighting Knife. Show off your advanced moves with this lightweight knife featuring the 440A stainless steel blade, one of the strongest and most durable materials used in knife making. This knife features the classic clip-point blade shape that made Ka-Bar famous in the industry and a 20-degree blade angle. It's finished with a powdered-coating and a serrated blood groove for that extra competitive edge. The comfortable handle is made from Kraton G, providing a balanced grip, while the powdered metal butt-cap is made to last. The flat blade is seven inches long and the overall length is 12 inches. The knife includes a high performance Kydex sheath that protects the knife from chemicals, weather, and sudden impact. Made in the USA, the Ka-Bar Next Generation Fighting Knife is the ultimate performance tool for any task.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21AXB1VTBCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEA0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
