{"item_id": "B000BSWEAK", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-1271-0 Black Fighting Knife", "description": "The wide blade of this fighting/utility knife gives it extra strength for performing those heavy duty tasks. Leather/Cordura sheath included.", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-1271-0 Black Fighting Knife The wide blade of this fighting/utility knife gives it extra strength for performing those heavy duty tasks. Leather/Cordura sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X3B5EHHHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 64.66}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEBO", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-3050-9 Mule Field Folder Knife", "description": "This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. Cordura sheath included.", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-3050-9 Mule Field Folder Knife This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. Cordura sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lA0EU8SbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.31}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEBY", "title": "KABAR Doziers Pocket Knife Folders", "description": "The Award winning KABAR Dozier knife designed by Bob Dozier is an affordable, practical all-purpose knife appropriate for daily tasks. The Pocket Knife Folder features an AUS 8A stainless steel blade with a Zytel handle and includes a pocket clip. The closed length measures 4 1/4 inches, open length 7 1/4 inches. This item is available in a variety of styles: A) KABAR Dozier Hunter, B) KABAR Dozier Skinner, C) KABAR Dozier Clip Point, D) KABAR Dozier Thumbstud, E) KABAR Dozier Spear", "text": "KABAR Doziers Pocket Knife Folders The Award winning KABAR Dozier knife designed by Bob Dozier is an affordable, practical all-purpose knife appropriate for daily tasks. The Pocket Knife Folder features an AUS 8A stainless steel blade with a Zytel handle and includes a pocket clip. The closed length measures 4 1/4 inches, open length 7 1/4 inches. This item is available in a variety of styles: A) KABAR Dozier Hunter, B) KABAR Dozier Skinner, C) KABAR Dozier Clip Point, D) KABAR Dozier Thumbstud, E) KABAR Dozier Spear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318cFsY0s2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEBY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 18.55}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWECS", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TWI7-CP Twitch I Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 2-Inch Steel Blade and Anodized Aluminum Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "Looking at the intricate construction of the Twitches reminds us of the workings in a fine chronograph watch; everything right and precisely in its place. These techno wizards feature a pass-through lockbar (patent pending) from which the ¿kick¿ of the blade sticks through. By pressing on the ¿kick¿, one is able to initiate the opening of the blade. S.A.T. (SOG Assisted Technology) then takes over to finish opening and to securely lock the blade open. What makes these space-age little gems even more beautiful is that they are also affordable!", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TWI7-CP Twitch I Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 2-Inch Steel Blade and Anodized Aluminum Handle, Satin Finish Looking at the intricate construction of the Twitches reminds us of the workings in a fine chronograph watch; everything right and precisely in its place. These techno wizards feature a pass-through lockbar (patent pending) from which the ¿kick¿ of the blade sticks through. By pressing on the ¿kick¿, one is able to initiate the opening of the blade. S.A.T. (SOG Assisted Technology) then takes over to finish opening and to securely lock the blade open. What makes these space-age little gems even more beautiful is that they are also affordable!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wXBm19TnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWECS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.57}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEDM", "title": "Spyderco C11SBK Delica Lockback Knife", "description": "In 1990 Spyderco shook things up by introducing two knives, the Delica and Endura. First of their kind on the market, both folders opened up the knife market to lightweight performance, one-hand open pocketknives that just about everyone could afford. They settled as Spyderco’s top two bestsellers and their improvement hasn’t slowed since. Refinement has been so ongoing and continual Spyderco tagged the updating/upgrading process with the term CQI- Constant Quality Improvement. During the Endura and Delica’s CQI journey Spyderco tweaked ergonomics, refined blade steels and fine-tuned their performance countless times. They are an evolutionary work in progress and the next level is here with the new Endura4 and Delica4. Both models now have screw construction making cleaning and adjusting easier. The fiberglass reinforced nylon handles come molded with Bi-Directional Texturing® for preferred traction and improved ergonomics. Inside the handle dual skeletonized stainless steel liners make the knife stronger without adding weight and make an anchor for all external and internal components to attach through adding sturdiness and rigidity. Their VG-10 blades are flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade’s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip.", "text": "Spyderco C11SBK Delica Lockback Knife In 1990 Spyderco shook things up by introducing two knives, the Delica and Endura. First of their kind on the market, both folders opened up the knife market to lightweight performance, one-hand open pocketknives that just about everyone could afford. They settled as Spyderco’s top two bestsellers and their improvement hasn’t slowed since. Refinement has been so ongoing and continual Spyderco tagged the updating/upgrading process with the term CQI- Constant Quality Improvement. During the Endura and Delica’s CQI journey Spyderco tweaked ergonomics, refined blade steels and fine-tuned their performance countless times. They are an evolutionary work in progress and the next level is here with the new Endura4 and Delica4. Both models now have screw construction making cleaning and adjusting easier. The fiberglass reinforced nylon handles come molded with Bi-Directional Texturing® for preferred traction and improved ergonomics. Inside the handle dual skeletonized stainless steel liners make the knife stronger without adding weight and make an anchor for all external and internal components to attach through adding sturdiness and rigidity. Their VG-10 blades are flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade’s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31npc8ps3XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 62.27}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEE6", "title": "Spyderco C29P Cricket SS Lockback Knife", "description": "Thin is in. We've made our long-favored Cricket model even thinner by integrating the handle and lock. Custom knifemaker Chris Reeve invented the idea of making a linerlock's liner out of backside scale of the handle. In doing this, thickness and bulk are shaved off the handle for an ultra-thin folder that locks up confidently with fewer moving lock parts. We've incorporated this design into a rounded handle with a reverse \"S\" shaped blade. The distinctive blade shape curves into a keen precision tip for intricate/detailed cutting. Made of VG-10 stainless steel, the blade is hollow-ground and when folded closed creates a rounded package that rides nearly invisibly in the pocket. The pocket clip carries right-handed tip-down but also attaches to a tie or makes a fashionable money clip. Create your own one of a kind Cricket with engraving, corporate logos or a personal message.", "text": "Spyderco C29P Cricket SS Lockback Knife Thin is in. We've made our long-favored Cricket model even thinner by integrating the handle and lock. Custom knifemaker Chris Reeve invented the idea of making a linerlock's liner out of backside scale of the handle. In doing this, thickness and bulk are shaved off the handle for an ultra-thin folder that locks up confidently with fewer moving lock parts. We've incorporated this design into a rounded handle with a reverse \"S\" shaped blade. The distinctive blade shape curves into a keen precision tip for intricate/detailed cutting. Made of VG-10 stainless steel, the blade is hollow-ground and when folded closed creates a rounded package that rides nearly invisibly in the pocket. The pocket clip carries right-handed tip-down but also attaches to a tie or makes a fashionable money clip. Create your own one of a kind Cricket with engraving, corporate logos or a personal message.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lbHDfX7JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 56.72}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEF0", "title": "Spyderco C88PBK Salt I Lockback Knife", "description": "The Salt I has a more rounded tip that's a bit thicker at the point. It's Spyderco Round Hole is increased in diameter to facilitating easier access. All inside/outside steel components have been treated. The Volcano Grip texturing covers both sides of the FRN handle. David Boye's locking lever dent is a standard feature. A hole running through the hollow clip screw makes a lanyard pipe for stringing cord through when using around water.", "text": "Spyderco C88PBK Salt I Lockback Knife The Salt I has a more rounded tip that's a bit thicker at the point. It's Spyderco Round Hole is increased in diameter to facilitating easier access. All inside/outside steel components have been treated. The Volcano Grip texturing covers both sides of the FRN handle. David Boye's locking lever dent is a standard feature. A hole running through the hollow clip screw makes a lanyard pipe for stringing cord through when using around water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/210Y76MVWBL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEF0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 67.78}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEFK", "title": "Ameristep 814 Tangle Camo Doghouse Blind", "description": "The Ameristep Doghouse Blind continues to set the industry standard, featuring Edge ReLeaf, window tie-downs, shoot-through mesh, and stakes and high-wind tie-downs. Backpack carrying case for easy transport. Constructed of Tangle Camo patterned Durashell with ShadowGuard material. This blind has four windows and three portholes.", "text": "Ameristep 814 Tangle Camo Doghouse Blind The Ameristep Doghouse Blind continues to set the industry standard, featuring Edge ReLeaf, window tie-downs, shoot-through mesh, and stakes and high-wind tie-downs. Backpack carrying case for easy transport. Constructed of Tangle Camo patterned Durashell with ShadowGuard material. This blind has four windows and three portholes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GG4A67Z3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEFK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BSWEFU", "title": "Ameristep Outhouse Blind", "description": "Ameristep's 804 Tangle Camo Outhouse Blind delivers the level of transportability and concealment that you would expect from the original Ameristep outhouse blind. Lightweight and fully-enclosed, this blind features four windows with tie-downs, stakes, and a backpack carrying case. Constructed of Tangle Camo patterned Durashell with ShadowGuard material, this blind measures 68 inches wide by 78 inches tall and weighs 7.3 pounds.", "text": "Ameristep Outhouse Blind Ameristep's 804 Tangle Camo Outhouse Blind delivers the level of transportability and concealment that you would expect from the original Ameristep outhouse blind. Lightweight and fully-enclosed, this blind features four windows with tie-downs, stakes, and a backpack carrying case. Constructed of Tangle Camo patterned Durashell with ShadowGuard material, this blind measures 68 inches wide by 78 inches tall and weighs 7.3 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X0DS154AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSWEFU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]], "price": 65.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY99Y", "title": "Cold Steel Recon Tanto Kraton Handle with Black Blade (Secure-Ex Sheath)", "description": "Cold Steel's popular line of Japanese-style Tantos are well regarded and offer high performance standards, but they are also priced accordingly -- at times out of the reach of many knife enthusiasts. With the Recon Tanto, the company has included many of their more expensive Tantos' features in a more affordably-priced package. Features include a seven-inch blade, classic Tanto styling, AUS 8A stainless steel and a comfortable, western-style Kraton handle.A durable Secure-Ex sheath is also included.SpecificationsSeven-inch AUS 8A stainless steel blade0.1875-inch blade thickness4.75-inch handle11.75-inch overall lengthNine-ounce weightBlack Tuff-Ex finishIncludes Secure-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Recon Tanto Kraton Handle with Black Blade (Secure-Ex Sheath) Cold Steel's popular line of Japanese-style Tantos are well regarded and offer high performance standards, but they are also priced accordingly -- at times out of the reach of many knife enthusiasts. With the Recon Tanto, the company has included many of their more expensive Tantos' features in a more affordably-priced package. Features include a seven-inch blade, classic Tanto styling, AUS 8A stainless steel and a comfortable, western-style Kraton handle.A durable Secure-Ex sheath is also included.SpecificationsSeven-inch AUS 8A stainless steel blade0.1875-inch blade thickness4.75-inch handle11.75-inch overall lengthNine-ounce weightBlack Tuff-Ex finishIncludes Secure-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JE7YMtVSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY99Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 76.36}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9AI", "title": "Cold Steel True Flight Thrower Paracord Wrapped Handle (Sheath)", "description": "Cold Steel designed its True Flight throwing knife to be strong, reliable, and accurate. It's made of 1055 carbon steel with a baked-on black protective coating. This makes for a hard, resilient blade capable of bouncing back from any throw. The knife's versatile utility edge additionally stands up to even the toughest chores.A durable Cor-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications12-inch overall length1055 carbon steel bladeFive-millimeter blade thickness9.7-ounce weightParacord handle wrapDurable Cor-Ex sheath includedWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel True Flight Thrower Paracord Wrapped Handle (Sheath) Cold Steel designed its True Flight throwing knife to be strong, reliable, and accurate. It's made of 1055 carbon steel with a baked-on black protective coating. This makes for a hard, resilient blade capable of bouncing back from any throw. The knife's versatile utility edge additionally stands up to even the toughest chores.A durable Cor-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications12-inch overall length1055 carbon steel bladeFive-millimeter blade thickness9.7-ounce weightParacord handle wrapDurable Cor-Ex sheath includedWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kZp3AfHHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9AI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 25.38}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9AS", "title": "Cold Steel SRK Kraton Handle, Black Blade (Concealex Sheath)", "description": "Survival/rescue operations demand a versatile knife able to withstand the most extreme abuse. Enter the Cold Steel Survival Rescue Knife (SRK), which was designed with tough conditions in mind. The blade is made of AUS 8A stainless steel, with a rich Teflon coat to help protect it from the elements. The blade's tremendously strong clip point, meanwhile, is fine enough for delicate work, yet possesses enough belly for efficient cutting, slashing, and skinning strokes. The knife also offers the sturdiest possible point and edge configuration at 3/16 of an inch thick, yet doesn't sacrifice sharpness. And users will love the SRK's handle, which sports a single quillon finger guard and a deeply checkered Kraton grip.SpecificationsBlade: AUS 8A stainless steelSheath: Secure-ExBlade length: 6 inchesHandle length: 4-3/4 inchesOverall length: 10-3/4 inchesThickness: 3/16 inchesWeight: 8.2 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel SRK Kraton Handle, Black Blade (Concealex Sheath) Survival/rescue operations demand a versatile knife able to withstand the most extreme abuse. Enter the Cold Steel Survival Rescue Knife (SRK), which was designed with tough conditions in mind. The blade is made of AUS 8A stainless steel, with a rich Teflon coat to help protect it from the elements. The blade's tremendously strong clip point, meanwhile, is fine enough for delicate work, yet possesses enough belly for efficient cutting, slashing, and skinning strokes. The knife also offers the sturdiest possible point and edge configuration at 3/16 of an inch thick, yet doesn't sacrifice sharpness. And users will love the SRK's handle, which sports a single quillon finger guard and a deeply checkered Kraton grip.SpecificationsBlade: AUS 8A stainless steelSheath: Secure-ExBlade length: 6 inchesHandle length: 4-3/4 inchesOverall length: 10-3/4 inchesThickness: 3/16 inchesWeight: 8.2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21vMfq5dTwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9AS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 78.17}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9D0", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-1212-3 Black Fighting Knife", "description": "Ideal for camping, nautical, and a host of other uses, the Ka-Bar full-size knife is tough and long lasting. The knife blade measures 7 inches long, with a partially serrated edge that makes it easy to cut looped and synthetic materials. The blade's 1095 carbon-steel material, meanwhile, has proved to be one of the most popular steels used in Ka-Bar knives. Easy to sharpen and built to hold up to heavy use, the blade also offers a 20-degree edge angle for serious cuts. The knife--which includes a 1211 mark on the blade--comes with a leather sheath.Specifications:Blade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11-3/4 inchesShape: ClipStamp: USAEdge angle: 20 degreesSteel: 1095 cro-vanGrind: FlatHandle material: Kraton GHRC: 56-58Butt cap/guard: Powdered metal/1095 carbonWeight: 0.66 pounds", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-1212-3 Black Fighting Knife Ideal for camping, nautical, and a host of other uses, the Ka-Bar full-size knife is tough and long lasting. The knife blade measures 7 inches long, with a partially serrated edge that makes it easy to cut looped and synthetic materials. The blade's 1095 carbon-steel material, meanwhile, has proved to be one of the most popular steels used in Ka-Bar knives. Easy to sharpen and built to hold up to heavy use, the blade also offers a 20-degree edge angle for serious cuts. The knife--which includes a 1211 mark on the blade--comes with a leather sheath.Specifications:Blade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11-3/4 inchesShape: ClipStamp: USAEdge angle: 20 degreesSteel: 1095 cro-vanGrind: FlatHandle material: Kraton GHRC: 56-58Butt cap/guard: Powdered metal/1095 carbonWeight: 0.66 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xxrg7qUOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9D0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 57.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9F8", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools S14-N Pentagon Knife with Dual-Edged Straight and Serrated Fixed 5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Kraton Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools S14-N Pentagon Knife with Dual-Edged Straight and Serrated Fixed 5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Kraton Handle, Satin Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Vbq8%2Bdg7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9F8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 55.49}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9IA", "title": "Spyderco C91SBK Pacific Salt Knife", "description": "A commonly known rule of cutlery is that the less susceptible a blade is to rust, the less likely it is to be able to hold an edge over time. Thanks to a forward-thinking Japanese steel foundry, however, that's no longer the case. Myodo Foundry recently introduced a new steel called H1, a PH (precipitation-hardened) steel utilizing 0.1% nitrogen, rather than carbon, to harden the steel. This approach results in an impressive Rockwell hardness rating of 57-58rc, which is why innovative cutlery company Spyderco uses the steel in its Pacific Salt knife.The knife is similar in size and shape to Spyderco's bestselling Endura knife, but with a slightly more rounded tip. All internal steel components are treated for rust and corrosion resistance, as well, and the blade hole is oversized for easy one-handed opening and closing, even with gloves or wet hands. Lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) material in the handle is inlayed with a grip-enhancing checkerboard pattern, and fitted with a reversible titanium pocket clip that can be positioned for right- or left-handed use.Specifications8.7-inch open length4.875-inch closed length3.8-inch H-1 steel blade3.4-inch cutting edge0.56-inch blade hole0.125-inch blade thicknessThree-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco C91SBK Pacific Salt Knife A commonly known rule of cutlery is that the less susceptible a blade is to rust, the less likely it is to be able to hold an edge over time. Thanks to a forward-thinking Japanese steel foundry, however, that's no longer the case. Myodo Foundry recently introduced a new steel called H1, a PH (precipitation-hardened) steel utilizing 0.1% nitrogen, rather than carbon, to harden the steel. This approach results in an impressive Rockwell hardness rating of 57-58rc, which is why innovative cutlery company Spyderco uses the steel in its Pacific Salt knife.The knife is similar in size and shape to Spyderco's bestselling Endura knife, but with a slightly more rounded tip. All internal steel components are treated for rust and corrosion resistance, as well, and the blade hole is oversized for easy one-handed opening and closing, even with gloves or wet hands. Lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) material in the handle is inlayed with a grip-enhancing checkerboard pattern, and fitted with a reversible titanium pocket clip that can be positioned for right- or left-handed use.Specifications8.7-inch open length4.875-inch closed length3.8-inch H-1 steel blade3.4-inch cutting edge0.56-inch blade hole0.125-inch blade thicknessThree-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fnZ450%2ByL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9IA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 70.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BSY9IK", "title": "Ameristep High Back Chair", "description": "Weighing only two pounds, this high-back folding chair is light and convenient. It includes a gear pouch perfect for all your small hunting needs.", "text": "Ameristep High Back Chair Weighing only two pounds, this high-back folding chair is light and convenient. It includes a gear pouch perfect for all your small hunting needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EK7JV733L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSY9IK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ameristep", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDN0", "title": "Cold Steel Ti-Lite Zytel Handle, 4-Inch", "description": "The Cold Steel Ti-Lite tactical folding knife evokes the sleep speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950s-style switchblade. Unlike most switchblades, however, the Ti-Lite is legal to carry nearly everywhere. The knife is equipped with a Japanese-made AUS 8A stainless-steel blade with a bead-blast finish, razor-sharp edge, and sturdy needle-sharp point. This particular version of the knife features a Zytel handle, an affordable alternative to the Ti-Lites' traditional aluminum handle. The 43-percent glass-filled Zytel handle mimics the look of its aluminum siblings almost exactly, but is significantly less expensive. Cold Steel also added a stainless-steel leaf-spring lock and liner tested to hold up to 130 pounds, so you can rest assured that the knife won't open accidentally. The resulting knife is remarkably strong, sharp, and good looking.The Ti-Lite is easy to carry thanks to the small steel pocket clip. To open, simply use the thumb studs or snag a quillon on the edge of your pocket as you draw your knife out.SpecificationsSteel: Japanese AUS 8A stainlessHandle: Zytel, 4-3/4 inchesBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchOverall length: 8-3/4 inchesWeight: 3.5 ouncesBelt clip: Stainless", "text": "Cold Steel Ti-Lite Zytel Handle, 4-Inch The Cold Steel Ti-Lite tactical folding knife evokes the sleep speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950s-style switchblade. Unlike most switchblades, however, the Ti-Lite is legal to carry nearly everywhere. The knife is equipped with a Japanese-made AUS 8A stainless-steel blade with a bead-blast finish, razor-sharp edge, and sturdy needle-sharp point. This particular version of the knife features a Zytel handle, an affordable alternative to the Ti-Lites' traditional aluminum handle. The 43-percent glass-filled Zytel handle mimics the look of its aluminum siblings almost exactly, but is significantly less expensive. Cold Steel also added a stainless-steel leaf-spring lock and liner tested to hold up to 130 pounds, so you can rest assured that the knife won't open accidentally. The resulting knife is remarkably strong, sharp, and good looking.The Ti-Lite is easy to carry thanks to the small steel pocket clip. To open, simply use the thumb studs or snag a quillon on the edge of your pocket as you draw your knife out.SpecificationsSteel: Japanese AUS 8A stainlessHandle: Zytel, 4-3/4 inchesBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchOverall length: 8-3/4 inchesWeight: 3.5 ouncesBelt clip: Stainless", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GP4dcjAyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 40.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDP8", "title": "KA-BAR Fighting/Utility Serrated Edge Knife with Hard Sheath, Black", "description": "Equipped with a partially serrated edge, the full-size Ka-Bar utility knife makes it easy to cut looped and synthetic materials. The knife blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The manmade Kraton G handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand. Other features include a clip point, a flat grind, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: USAEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: Kraton GBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.65 pounds", "text": "KA-BAR Fighting/Utility Serrated Edge Knife with Hard Sheath, Black Equipped with a partially serrated edge, the full-size Ka-Bar utility knife makes it easy to cut looped and synthetic materials. The knife blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The manmade Kraton G handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand. Other features include a clip point, a flat grind, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: USAEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: Kraton GBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 11-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.65 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21f21oNbY6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 64.59}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDQC", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-3051-6 Mule Field Folder Knife", "description": "This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. Cordura sheath included.", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-3051-6 Mule Field Folder Knife This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. Cordura sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f%2BBCzcVrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 41.83}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDRQ", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TFSA98-CP Flash II Knife with Partially Serrated Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Hardcase Black TiNi Finish", "description": "Sleek, elegant, and easy to operate, the TFSA-98 Half-Serrated Knife from the Flash II Series showcases SOG Specialty Knives' commitment to creating style through craftsmanship. Featuring advanced opening and locking technology combined with a well-balanced body and a strong, dependable blade, this versatile folding knife makes quick work of whatever task is at hand..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } table.callout { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif; margin: 10px; width: 250; } td.callout3-c26 { height: 100 percent; background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q1_2009/c26-callout3.png') repeat-y; border-left: 0px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding: 10px; width: 250px; } ul.callout { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5em; } h5.callout { text-align: center; } img.withlink {border:1px black solid;} a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG Specialty Knives TFSA-98 Flash II Knife offers:A black TiNi coated 1/2 Serrated bladePatented SOG Assisted Technology for fast, easy openingA strong, reliable blade locking systemA contoured, glass-reinforced Zytel™ handleS.A.T. blade-opening technology makes SOG Flash II knives incredibly easy to handle.View Video Demo.The 3.5-inch, heat-treated blade provides you with a versatile, dependable cutting edge.View larger.An ergonomic handle provides increased comfort, and a safety keeps the knife from opening in your pocket.View larger.A reversible clip lets the knife sit securely and discreetly in your pocket.View larger.SOG Assisted Technology for Speed and SafetyFast, safe, one-handed opening makes SOG Flash Series knives incredibly easy to handle in a wide variety of situations. Once you start opening the knife, SOG's Patented SOG Assisted Technology, or S.A.T., takes over. Through the balance of opposing high-tension coil springs in the knife, the force to propel the knife open becomes greater than the closing force, and the blade will open on its own. This unique feature means that if you are using your dominant hand on another task, you can just as easily open the TFSA-98 with your other hand.For security and peace of mind, S.A.T. was developed in conjunction with a superior locking system. The unique design of S.A.T. knives allows them to use locking mechanisms that are stronger, more reliable, and easier to access ambidextrously than conventional liner locks.For Flash Series knives, this means the blade is held in place with a reliable piston lock that can be released quickly with a sliding button. An additional safety lock offers extra security when the blade is closed. For easy reference, the lock switch shows red when the knife is ready to open.Cryogenic Heat Treatment for Sharp, Dependable BladesOf course the workhorse of any knife is the cutting surface, and the TFSA-98 offers a full, 3.5-inch, half-serrated blade finished with an elegant black, hardcased TiNi, which is a durable titanium and nickel compound.SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and involves slowly bringing the blade's temperature down to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then bringing it slowly back to room temperature. The stress created through this process relieves the material on an atomic level and increases overall strength and edge retention.Elegant, Ergonomic Design for Ease of UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make the cuts you want if a knife doesn't sit comfortably in your hand. That's why the handle on this knife features a unique, ergonomic contour. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the handle helps ensure that your knife is both durable and well-balanced. And it is lightly textured to prevent slippage.At just 3.1 ounces, this folding knife is lightweight and easy to carry. A reversible, bayonet-mounted clip extends from the back of the handle, allowing the knife to sit low in your pocket for the most discreet carry possible.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in workmanship and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } .matrix { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; } .matrix_feature { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 9px; } .matrix_header { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }Find the SOG Flash II Knife That Matches Your StyleTFSA-98FSA-98STGFSA-98SGFSA-98CTFSA-98CFSA-8CFSA-98FSA-8FSA-5Blade DetailsBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin Finish1/2 SerratedBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin Finish1/2 SerratedBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin FinishStraight EdgeSatin Finish1/2 SerratedSatin FinishStraight EdgeTiger-Stripe TiNi1/2 SerratedHandle DetailsBlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™Hard-Anodized 6061-T6 AluminumHard-Anodized 6061-T6 AluminumCamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™CamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™CamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™What's in the BoxTFSA-98 Flash II Half-Serrated Knife with a Black TiNi Finish", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TFSA98-CP Flash II Knife with Partially Serrated Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Hardcase Black TiNi Finish Sleek, elegant, and easy to operate, the TFSA-98 Half-Serrated Knife from the Flash II Series showcases SOG Specialty Knives' commitment to creating style through craftsmanship. Featuring advanced opening and locking technology combined with a well-balanced body and a strong, dependable blade, this versatile folding knife makes quick work of whatever task is at hand..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } table.callout { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif; margin: 10px; width: 250; } td.callout3-c26 { height: 100 percent; background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q1_2009/c26-callout3.png') repeat-y; border-left: 0px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding: 10px; width: 250px; } ul.callout { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5em; } h5.callout { text-align: center; } img.withlink {border:1px black solid;} a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG Specialty Knives TFSA-98 Flash II Knife offers:A black TiNi coated 1/2 Serrated bladePatented SOG Assisted Technology for fast, easy openingA strong, reliable blade locking systemA contoured, glass-reinforced Zytel™ handleS.A.T. blade-opening technology makes SOG Flash II knives incredibly easy to handle.View Video Demo.The 3.5-inch, heat-treated blade provides you with a versatile, dependable cutting edge.View larger.An ergonomic handle provides increased comfort, and a safety keeps the knife from opening in your pocket.View larger.A reversible clip lets the knife sit securely and discreetly in your pocket.View larger.SOG Assisted Technology for Speed and SafetyFast, safe, one-handed opening makes SOG Flash Series knives incredibly easy to handle in a wide variety of situations. Once you start opening the knife, SOG's Patented SOG Assisted Technology, or S.A.T., takes over. Through the balance of opposing high-tension coil springs in the knife, the force to propel the knife open becomes greater than the closing force, and the blade will open on its own. This unique feature means that if you are using your dominant hand on another task, you can just as easily open the TFSA-98 with your other hand.For security and peace of mind, S.A.T. was developed in conjunction with a superior locking system. The unique design of S.A.T. knives allows them to use locking mechanisms that are stronger, more reliable, and easier to access ambidextrously than conventional liner locks.For Flash Series knives, this means the blade is held in place with a reliable piston lock that can be released quickly with a sliding button. An additional safety lock offers extra security when the blade is closed. For easy reference, the lock switch shows red when the knife is ready to open.Cryogenic Heat Treatment for Sharp, Dependable BladesOf course the workhorse of any knife is the cutting surface, and the TFSA-98 offers a full, 3.5-inch, half-serrated blade finished with an elegant black, hardcased TiNi, which is a durable titanium and nickel compound.SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and involves slowly bringing the blade's temperature down to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then bringing it slowly back to room temperature. The stress created through this process relieves the material on an atomic level and increases overall strength and edge retention.Elegant, Ergonomic Design for Ease of UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make the cuts you want if a knife doesn't sit comfortably in your hand. That's why the handle on this knife features a unique, ergonomic contour. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the handle helps ensure that your knife is both durable and well-balanced. And it is lightly textured to prevent slippage.At just 3.1 ounces, this folding knife is lightweight and easy to carry. A reversible, bayonet-mounted clip extends from the back of the handle, allowing the knife to sit low in your pocket for the most discreet carry possible.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in workmanship and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } .matrix { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; } .matrix_feature { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 9px; } .matrix_header { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }Find the SOG Flash II Knife That Matches Your StyleTFSA-98FSA-98STGFSA-98SGFSA-98CTFSA-98CFSA-8CFSA-98FSA-8FSA-5Blade DetailsBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin Finish1/2 SerratedBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin Finish1/2 SerratedBlack TiNi Coated1/2 SerratedSatin FinishStraight EdgeSatin Finish1/2 SerratedSatin FinishStraight EdgeTiger-Stripe TiNi1/2 SerratedHandle DetailsBlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™Hard-Anodized 6061-T6 AluminumHard-Anodized 6061-T6 AluminumCamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™CamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™CamouflageGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™BlackGlass-reinforced Zytel™What's in the BoxTFSA-98 Flash II Half-Serrated Knife with a Black TiNi Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319xAVYOgNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 38.85}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDSK", "title": "Spyderco Delica II Folding Knife - Choose Style", "description": "The Spyderco Delica II folding knife offers a lightweight, yet solid design with a smooth metal handle that's ideal for engraving. The hollow-ground, modified skinning-style blade is constructed from AUS-6 steel which is loaded with a carbon level of around 1-precent for advanced edge retention. Two sets of pre-drilled holes allow the clip to be positioned for tip-up or tip-down carrying.", "text": "Spyderco Delica II Folding Knife - Choose Style The Spyderco Delica II folding knife offers a lightweight, yet solid design with a smooth metal handle that's ideal for engraving. The hollow-ground, modified skinning-style blade is constructed from AUS-6 steel which is loaded with a carbon level of around 1-precent for advanced edge retention. Two sets of pre-drilled holes allow the clip to be positioned for tip-up or tip-down carrying.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ETfYH-bDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDSK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BSZDT4", "title": "Spyderco C41PSBK Native Lockback Knife", "description": "The Native is indigenous to the U.S. Start to finish Natives are blueprinted by Spyderco’s engineers in Golden, Colorado. Their CPM-S30V blades, manufactured using powdered steel technology by Crucible Metals in upstate New York. Sheet steel arrives in Golden where its laser cut, ground, heat treated and finished. Native’s left/right, tip-up pocket clips are USA made. An American injection molder shoots FRN handles which are covered in Bi-Directional Texturing and have double finger indents for gripping high on the handle closer to the cutting edge for optimal control. Native components congregate in Golden, where Spyderco craftsmen assemble them and ship them to 53+ countries, where they proudly wear the title American Made Native.", "text": "Spyderco C41PSBK Native Lockback Knife The Native is indigenous to the U.S. Start to finish Natives are blueprinted by Spyderco’s engineers in Golden, Colorado. Their CPM-S30V blades, manufactured using powdered steel technology by Crucible Metals in upstate New York. Sheet steel arrives in Golden where its laser cut, ground, heat treated and finished. Native’s left/right, tip-up pocket clips are USA made. An American injection molder shoots FRN handles which are covered in Bi-Directional Texturing and have double finger indents for gripping high on the handle closer to the cutting edge for optimal control. Native components congregate in Golden, where Spyderco craftsmen assemble them and ship them to 53+ countries, where they proudly wear the title American Made Native.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CWIA6I%2BkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BSZDT4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 71.67}}
{"item_id": "B000BT0Z9Q", "title": "Saris Bike Beam Top Tube Adapter", "description": "By creating a virtual top tube for specialty frames, the Bike Beam lets you bring any bike along for the ride.", "text": "Saris Bike Beam Top Tube Adapter By creating a virtual top tube for specialty frames, the Bike Beam lets you bring any bike along for the ride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3197DRBG6ZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT0Z9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Saris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 33.29}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1G4E", "title": "Cold Steel Delta Dart Zytel Handle (No Sheath)", "description": "The Delta Dart is 8\" long and 1/2\" in diameter yet it weighs only 1/2 an ounce! Its comfortable handle is knurled for a positive grip and the butt is smooth and rounded, so it’s perfect for both thumb and palm reinforced positions. Like the CAT Tanto, the Delta Dart is made from Zytel¨. It is this super tough material that, when combined with the Dart's sharp point and triangular cross section, accounts for its phenomenal piercing power and allowed it to be driven by hand right through a 1/2\" thick piece of leather. Includes a neck sheath with bead chain lanyard.", "text": "Cold Steel Delta Dart Zytel Handle (No Sheath) The Delta Dart is 8\" long and 1/2\" in diameter yet it weighs only 1/2 an ounce! Its comfortable handle is knurled for a positive grip and the butt is smooth and rounded, so it’s perfect for both thumb and palm reinforced positions. Like the CAT Tanto, the Delta Dart is made from Zytel¨. It is this super tough material that, when combined with the Dart's sharp point and triangular cross section, accounts for its phenomenal piercing power and allowed it to be driven by hand right through a 1/2\" thick piece of leather. Includes a neck sheath with bead chain lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CQ7J272QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1G4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1G4O", "title": "Cold Steel Torpedo Cold Rolled 5150 Steel handle with Black Matte Finish", "description": "Heavy and perfectly balanced, the Torpedo is a lot of fun for target throwing because it’s an easy throw from almost any distance. The double tapered points slide effortlessly from the hand for a perfect release and offer twice the sticking potential of a conventional throwing knife. What’s more, the heavy 2 lb. weight lets you stand way back from the target (20 yards or more) and really “lob them in there” with surprising force", "text": "Cold Steel Torpedo Cold Rolled 5150 Steel handle with Black Matte Finish Heavy and perfectly balanced, the Torpedo is a lot of fun for target throwing because it’s an easy throw from almost any distance. The double tapered points slide effortlessly from the hand for a perfect release and offer twice the sticking potential of a conventional throwing knife. What’s more, the heavy 2 lb. weight lets you stand way back from the target (20 yards or more) and really “lob them in there” with surprising force", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21BGKSW5CHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1G4O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1G6C", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-1226-0 Sheath Knife 3-1/2\"", "description": "One of three classically styled leather handled hunters, the Little Finn has been a popular member of the KA-BAR product line since the early 1900's. Leather sheath included.", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-1226-0 Sheath Knife 3-1/2\" One of three classically styled leather handled hunters, the Little Finn has been a popular member of the KA-BAR product line since the early 1900's. Leather sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21cBfKJgTTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1G6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1G6W", "title": "Ka-Bar 2-1245-1 Black Tanto Knife", "description": "Equipped with an Asian-influenced Tanto blade shape, this Ka-Bar combat knife is designed for the toughest of tasks. The Tanto blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, with a thick pointed blade that's great for penetration. The manmade Kraton G handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand. Add in a glass-filled nylon sheath and you have a terrific knife for combat applications.SpecificationsStamp: USAShape: TantoEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: HollowHandle material: Kraton GBlade length: 8 inchesOverall length: 12-7/8 inchesWeight: 0.75 pounds", "text": "Ka-Bar 2-1245-1 Black Tanto Knife Equipped with an Asian-influenced Tanto blade shape, this Ka-Bar combat knife is designed for the toughest of tasks. The Tanto blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, with a thick pointed blade that's great for penetration. The manmade Kraton G handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand. Add in a glass-filled nylon sheath and you have a terrific knife for combat applications.SpecificationsStamp: USAShape: TantoEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: HollowHandle material: Kraton GBlade length: 8 inchesOverall length: 12-7/8 inchesWeight: 0.75 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LJy%2BnhBTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1G6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 65.83}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1G94", "title": "Spyderco C07S Police Model Knife", "description": "“Classic.” The term implies agelessness, perfection and tradition. In the 1980s police officers petitioned Spyderco for a sizeable folder with a stainless handle and an acutely tapered blade. The folder is designed around a four-inch blade and proportionate handle, designed for flat and flush carry on a duty belt, pocket or waistband. With the exception of blade steel upgrades it has remained viturally unchanged for thirty-plus years – a top-ten seller to old-school LEOs and rookies alike. The Police Model has a David Boye dent cut out of the locking lever allowing you to gorilla grip the knife without accidentally releasing the lock. The blade is hollow-ground VG-10 and thick at the tip for added strength with a weight-reducing swedge along the spine. All stainless, the handle is perfect for engraving or embossing. Steel clip positions the knife for tip-down pocket carry.", "text": "Spyderco C07S Police Model Knife “Classic.” The term implies agelessness, perfection and tradition. In the 1980s police officers petitioned Spyderco for a sizeable folder with a stainless handle and an acutely tapered blade. The folder is designed around a four-inch blade and proportionate handle, designed for flat and flush carry on a duty belt, pocket or waistband. With the exception of blade steel upgrades it has remained viturally unchanged for thirty-plus years – a top-ten seller to old-school LEOs and rookies alike. The Police Model has a David Boye dent cut out of the locking lever allowing you to gorilla grip the knife without accidentally releasing the lock. The blade is hollow-ground VG-10 and thick at the tip for added strength with a weight-reducing swedge along the spine. All stainless, the handle is perfect for engraving or embossing. Steel clip positions the knife for tip-down pocket carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IPLbrhcML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1G94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 101.42}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1GAI", "title": "Spyderco C66PBK3 Centofante III Knife", "description": "Frank Centofante is well known in the custom knife industry, a celebrated veteran knifemaker, past president of the Knifemaker's Guild, and respected voice in the cutlery community. Innovative knife company Spyderco has collaborated with Centofante several times, with this model being the latest result.The Centofante 3 offers a sleek profile with lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) handle. Two channels are furrowed into the handle for improved grip, and an eye-catching palladium silver Spyderco bug is inlayed into the handle's surface. For convenience and improved security, the back-lock is positioned at the midpoint of the blade's spine, with a clever David Boye dent cut from the locking lever. The razor sharp VG-10 steel blade has both a hollow grind and Swede grind for versatile use, and -- when it's time to be on the move -- a black steel pocket clip offers a variety of carrying configurations.Specifications7.56-inch open length4.5-inch closed length3.125-inch VG-10 steel bladeThree-inch cutting edge0.5-inch blade hole0.08-inch blade thickness2.5-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco C66PBK3 Centofante III Knife Frank Centofante is well known in the custom knife industry, a celebrated veteran knifemaker, past president of the Knifemaker's Guild, and respected voice in the cutlery community. Innovative knife company Spyderco has collaborated with Centofante several times, with this model being the latest result.The Centofante 3 offers a sleek profile with lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) handle. Two channels are furrowed into the handle for improved grip, and an eye-catching palladium silver Spyderco bug is inlayed into the handle's surface. For convenience and improved security, the back-lock is positioned at the midpoint of the blade's spine, with a clever David Boye dent cut from the locking lever. The razor sharp VG-10 steel blade has both a hollow grind and Swede grind for versatile use, and -- when it's time to be on the move -- a black steel pocket clip offers a variety of carrying configurations.Specifications7.56-inch open length4.5-inch closed length3.125-inch VG-10 steel bladeThree-inch cutting edge0.5-inch blade hole0.08-inch blade thickness2.5-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3111B40CPML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1GAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 61.88}}
{"item_id": "B000BT1GBM", "title": "Ameristep 821 Tangle Camo Tripod Folding Stool", "description": "This folding tripod stool is a lightweight, convenient seat and offers a quick, easy setup.", "text": "Ameristep 821 Tangle Camo Tripod Folding Stool This folding tripod stool is a lightweight, convenient seat and offers a quick, easy setup.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RF72RNRHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT1GBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ameristep", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Seats"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT30RK", "title": "Saris Bones 805 (2-Bike) Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "4-1/2 stars (out of 5), Bicycling Magazine. A Saris Bones rear rack is one of the few things in life that's both hard working and drop-dead gorgeous. Created by renowned italian designer Fabio Pedrini. The Bones rack gives you more than a stylish alternative to roof racks. It's a stable, secure ride. A system that mounts quickly to almost any vehicle make and model, from sedans to mini-vans-even when there's a rear spoiler involved. And that let's you save your energy for the road or trail.", "text": "Saris Bones 805 (2-Bike) Trunk Mount Rack 4-1/2 stars (out of 5), Bicycling Magazine. A Saris Bones rear rack is one of the few things in life that's both hard working and drop-dead gorgeous. Created by renowned italian designer Fabio Pedrini. The Bones rack gives you more than a stylish alternative to roof racks. It's a stable, secure ride. A system that mounts quickly to almost any vehicle make and model, from sedans to mini-vans-even when there's a rear spoiler involved. And that let's you save your energy for the road or trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4189JEZpUCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT30RK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Saris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 125.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT4W2C", "title": "GMC Topkick Dual Suspension Mountain Bike", "description": "The GMC Topkick 21-Speed Mountain Bike features a full-suspension, strong aluminum frame that utilizes a floating beam suspension design that is mated to a Zoom suspension fork with elastomer/spring technology. The Topkick's drivetrain starts with Microshift push shifters. These shifters control Shimano's tried and true TZ-30GS derailleur. The drivetrain finishes up with a strong aluminum wheelset featuring V-shape rim profile and high-flange alloy hubs. Stopping is handled by Promax disk brakes on the front and rear. These brakes are vastly superior to rim brakes, especially under adverse road conditions. True to it's GMC roots, this bicycle is rugged, good looking, and built for the long haul.", "text": "GMC Topkick Dual Suspension Mountain Bike The GMC Topkick 21-Speed Mountain Bike features a full-suspension, strong aluminum frame that utilizes a floating beam suspension design that is mated to a Zoom suspension fork with elastomer/spring technology. The Topkick's drivetrain starts with Microshift push shifters. These shifters control Shimano's tried and true TZ-30GS derailleur. The drivetrain finishes up with a strong aluminum wheelset featuring V-shape rim profile and high-flange alloy hubs. Stopping is handled by Promax disk brakes on the front and rear. These brakes are vastly superior to rim brakes, especially under adverse road conditions. True to it's GMC roots, this bicycle is rugged, good looking, and built for the long haul.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jiXyiYs1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT4W2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Dual Suspension"]], "price": 449.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT4W2W", "title": "Velo WebSpring Dual Density Gel Bicycle Seat", "description": "USA Helmet Velo Web Spring ® dual density gel seat provides a super smooth ride saddle", "text": "Velo WebSpring Dual Density Gel Bicycle Seat USA Helmet Velo Web Spring ® dual density gel seat provides a super smooth ride saddle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41am5lhBBwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT4W2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vitesse", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 26.46}}
{"item_id": "B000BT577G", "title": "CycleOps Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer", "description": "The CycleOps Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer helps keep your legs in shape, even during the winter months. The indoor trainer is designed with magnet brakes and utilizes a unique, internal flywheel that provides a smooth and quiet ride. The resistance lever has five different settings so you can vary your workout from warm-up stage to tough-terrain riding. The sturdy steel frame has leveling feet for stability, while the foldable legs allow you to easily set-up and store the bike. The indoor bicycle trainer comes with an informational DVD.", "text": "CycleOps Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer The CycleOps Mag Indoor Bicycle Trainer helps keep your legs in shape, even during the winter months. The indoor trainer is designed with magnet brakes and utilizes a unique, internal flywheel that provides a smooth and quiet ride. The resistance lever has five different settings so you can vary your workout from warm-up stage to tough-terrain riding. The sturdy steel frame has leveling feet for stability, while the foldable legs allow you to easily set-up and store the bike. The indoor bicycle trainer comes with an informational DVD.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sdV2MBhUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT577G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleOps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 170.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT6Q3K", "title": "Saris Sentinel 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "Got a hatchback? A four-door sedan or a passenger van? Then the Sentinel two-bike trunk rack from Saris is designed with you in mind. Fits atypical body styles and can be mounted over most spoilers or lighting arrays. Carries up to three bikes. Made with adjustable arms that can be mounted securely in multiple positions or can fold flat for storage. The hold-downs wrap around each bike independently so to keep them crashing into one another and to keep then from wobbling while in transit. The hooks that secure the rack to the trunk seam are neoprene coated so they won't scratch your car's finish, and the bottom bar brace has a vinyl covered foam pad to separate the rack from your trunk lid. No assembly required. Just take it out of the box, strap it on and go.", "text": "Saris Sentinel 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack Got a hatchback? A four-door sedan or a passenger van? Then the Sentinel two-bike trunk rack from Saris is designed with you in mind. Fits atypical body styles and can be mounted over most spoilers or lighting arrays. Carries up to three bikes. Made with adjustable arms that can be mounted securely in multiple positions or can fold flat for storage. The hold-downs wrap around each bike independently so to keep them crashing into one another and to keep then from wobbling while in transit. The hooks that secure the rack to the trunk seam are neoprene coated so they won't scratch your car's finish, and the bottom bar brace has a vinyl covered foam pad to separate the rack from your trunk lid. No assembly required. Just take it out of the box, strap it on and go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NB84MDFCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT6Q3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Saris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 62.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT7HWO", "title": "CycleOps Wind Trainer", "description": "The CycleOps Wind Trainer is ideal if you're looking for the simplest, most straightforward means to maintain your riding fitness in wintertime. The Wind is built using the most long-lived trainer technology out there: A weighted metal fan blade generates wind resistance as you pedal. The resistance is variable and it builds at a progressive rate with increased wheel speed. Just like riding on the road, gear down and you can spin on your rest days. If you want to suffer, grab the big ring and mash the pedals. At 30mph wheel speeds, the CycleOps Wind Trainer will generate in excess of 600+ watts of resistance. The Wind Trainer is foldable and stows away easily. The rubber coated base pads are adjustable to level out crooked basement floors. The quick release locking mechanism can be adjusted to accommodate both mountain and road bikes. One practical note: Compared to Cycleops' other trainer models, the Wind Trainer generates more noise when you're riding it. If keeping things quiet when you train indoors is a priority, you should consider Cycleops' other models. It comes with a Race Day Training DVD to help get you started.Product FeaturesMaterial: 2in, 16-gauge steelResistance: windFoldable: yes, folding legsRecommended Use: indoor trainingManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "text": "CycleOps Wind Trainer The CycleOps Wind Trainer is ideal if you're looking for the simplest, most straightforward means to maintain your riding fitness in wintertime. The Wind is built using the most long-lived trainer technology out there: A weighted metal fan blade generates wind resistance as you pedal. The resistance is variable and it builds at a progressive rate with increased wheel speed. Just like riding on the road, gear down and you can spin on your rest days. If you want to suffer, grab the big ring and mash the pedals. At 30mph wheel speeds, the CycleOps Wind Trainer will generate in excess of 600+ watts of resistance. The Wind Trainer is foldable and stows away easily. The rubber coated base pads are adjustable to level out crooked basement floors. The quick release locking mechanism can be adjusted to accommodate both mountain and road bikes. One practical note: Compared to Cycleops' other trainer models, the Wind Trainer generates more noise when you're riding it. If keeping things quiet when you train indoors is a priority, you should consider Cycleops' other models. It comes with a Race Day Training DVD to help get you started.Product FeaturesMaterial: 2in, 16-gauge steelResistance: windFoldable: yes, folding legsRecommended Use: indoor trainingManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zGgXaxREL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT7HWO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleOps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 143.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT7HWY", "title": "CycleOps Fluid 2 Trainer", "description": "The most road-like feel of any CycleOps trainer. In essence, it's a resistance unit encased in hydraulic fluid. Unlike the Mag's external variable resistance, on the Fluid 2 the harder you pedal, the hotter the fluid gets and the more resistance you experience. But there's more going on than just that: the Fluid 2 is designed with Power Band technology that makes the level of resistance also a function of cadence and gearing. The ranges of resistance you can potentially experience is unbelieveable -- it varies from 20 watts to 725 watts, all a function of your gearing and cadence. The Fluid 2 has a cooling mechanism built in to give tons of durability. And, like the Mag, the Fluid 2 easily folds up and comes with the Quick-Lock bike mount, a custom skewer, and a CTS climbing workout video sure to pain you greatly.Product FeaturesMaterial: [body] aluminumResistance: Power BandFoldable: yesRecommended Use: indoor trainingManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "text": "CycleOps Fluid 2 Trainer The most road-like feel of any CycleOps trainer. In essence, it's a resistance unit encased in hydraulic fluid. Unlike the Mag's external variable resistance, on the Fluid 2 the harder you pedal, the hotter the fluid gets and the more resistance you experience. But there's more going on than just that: the Fluid 2 is designed with Power Band technology that makes the level of resistance also a function of cadence and gearing. The ranges of resistance you can potentially experience is unbelieveable -- it varies from 20 watts to 725 watts, all a function of your gearing and cadence. The Fluid 2 has a cooling mechanism built in to give tons of durability. And, like the Mag, the Fluid 2 easily folds up and comes with the Quick-Lock bike mount, a custom skewer, and a CTS climbing workout video sure to pain you greatly.Product FeaturesMaterial: [body] aluminumResistance: Power BandFoldable: yesRecommended Use: indoor trainingManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GueKmnSRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT7HWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleOps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 305.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BT80T8", "title": "ALOKSAK Water / Sand Proof Dry Bags", "description": "ALOSAK bags are used for safe transport and storage by outdoor enthusiasts, all branches of the military and many government agencies worldwide. This easy-to-use bag, with its patented \"hermetic\" seal, is made from super durable materials and is reusable as well as recyclable.", "text": "ALOKSAK Water / Sand Proof Dry Bags ALOSAK bags are used for safe transport and storage by outdoor enthusiasts, all branches of the military and many government agencies worldwide. This easy-to-use bag, with its patented \"hermetic\" seal, is made from super durable materials and is reusable as well as recyclable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V0jD%2ByRcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT80T8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BT8VPQ", "title": "CycleOps Stackable Climbing Block for Indoor Bicycle Trainers", "description": "Enjoy a stable, worry-free ride in any rear-mounted cycling trainer with the CycleOps climbing riser block. The block features a unique three-level design that lets you select the training height, ensuring that your ride is comfortable and productive. You'll train harder and longer because you'll be riding in a more natural position. The riser block is also stackable: add a second block to simulate climbing workouts, with as many as 12 different adjustment levels. And the block is designed to last for years thanks to its virtually indestructible injection-molded construction.About CycleOpsCycleOps believes building energy for positive change starts in the bike world, but it doesn't stop there. The company is passionate about creating space for cyclists in their communities, a process that reduces congestion and pollution while encouraging healthier, more active lifestyles. In addition to in-house local and national efforts, CycleOps supports the work of such organizations as the Bicycle Federation of Wisconsin, Bikes Belong, People for Bikes, and other key advocacy groups.", "text": "CycleOps Stackable Climbing Block for Indoor Bicycle Trainers Enjoy a stable, worry-free ride in any rear-mounted cycling trainer with the CycleOps climbing riser block. The block features a unique three-level design that lets you select the training height, ensuring that your ride is comfortable and productive. You'll train harder and longer because you'll be riding in a more natural position. The riser block is also stackable: add a second block to simulate climbing workouts, with as many as 12 different adjustment levels. And the block is designed to last for years thanks to its virtually indestructible injection-molded construction.About CycleOpsCycleOps believes building energy for positive change starts in the bike world, but it doesn't stop there. The company is passionate about creating space for cyclists in their communities, a process that reduces congestion and pollution while encouraging healthier, more active lifestyles. In addition to in-house local and national efforts, CycleOps supports the work of such organizations as the Bicycle Federation of Wisconsin, Bikes Belong, People for Bikes, and other key advocacy groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eD6y2JyNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT8VPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleOps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 23.25}}
{"item_id": "B000BT9VSC", "title": "GMC Denali Road Bike", "description": "The GMC Denali 700C 21-Speed Road Bike is built around a lightweight aluminum road bike frame for racing or commuting. You'll stop on a dime with the alloy calipers and brake levers, and the high-profile alloy Vitesse racing rims look as good as they perform. The Shimano derailleur and Shimano Revo shifts make it easy to change gears quickly and smoothly, and the high-performance 700c tires are up to the challenge of rigorous street racing. Lastly, this road bike will help you stay hydrated with the included alloy water bottle cage.Specifications:Frame: Aluminum 7005 straight gaugeFork: GMC Series 7000 steelChain: KMC Z 51Crankset: Prowheel Alloy 335P6 28X38X48 170mmFront Derailleur: Shimano FD-TZ 31 IndexRear Derailleur: Shimano RD-TZ30GS 7SPDShifters: Shimano Revo SIS L2/R7Brake levers: Promax BL-250AP AluminumBrakes: Promax 501A Alloy Caliper BrakeRims: Vitesse Alloy black 700CX14GX36HTires: Kenda Black With Grey Band 7X28CStem: Aluminum black EXT:100mm 0D.Handlebar: Maesbend W: 430mm D:22.0mmSaddle: Cionlli BlackSeat post: HL Aluminum Micro Adjust 27.2 X 300mmPedals: VP-990S plastic body with steel cageWeight: 29.0 lbsAmazon.com Bicycle Buying GuideFinding the Right BikeTo really enjoy cycling, it's important to find a bicycle that works for you. Here are some things to keep in mind when you're in the market for a new bike:The Right RideIn general, bikes are broken down into three major categories:Road and Racing Bikes--As a general rule, road and racing are built for speed and longer distances on paved surfaces. Thinner tires, lightweight 29-inch (700c) wheels and drop bars that allow for a more aerodynamic position are the norm. Most road bikes, regardless of price, offer many gears for tackling both hilly and flat terrain.Mountain Bikes--With their larger tires, hill-friendly gearing and upright position,mountain bikesare very popular for all types of riding, both on pavement and off. Mountain bikes that are designed specifically for rugged trail use typically feature a suspension fork. Some may have rear suspension, as well. A quick change of the tires on any mountain bike--even one that you use regularly on trails--adds to its versatility and makes it a worthy street machine.Comfort/Cruiser Bikes--For tooling around on bike paths, light trails, or for cruising a quiet beach-side lane,comfort/cruiser bikesare the ticket. With a super-relaxed riding position, padded seats, and limited or no gearing, these bikes are made for enjoying the scenery and having fun with the family.The Right PriceA bike's price boils down to three essentials: frame materials, bike weight, and component quality and durability.Entry-level--You'll find a wide range of comfort and cruiser bikes in this category, as well as some lower-end mountain bikes and road bikes. Most will have steel frames and components that are designed to last for several years with frequent use.Mid-range--Bikes in this range may feature a lighter aluminum frame with mid-range components that keep performing after miles of use. If you're looking for a quality bike that is relatively lightweight and will stand up to abuse, this is the \"sweet spot.\" Most serious commuter and touring bikes fall into this category, as do mid-range mountain bikes with a decent front suspension.High-end--Racers and serious enthusiasts who expect lightweight, high-performance components will want to stick to this category. For road bikes, exotic frame materials (carbon fiber, titanium) and ultra-lightweight components can add thousands to the price tag. Mountain bikes in this class often feature advanced front and rear suspension technology, as well as components designed to handle lots of rugged trail action.The Right SizeFit is crucial for comfort, control, and proper power and endurance on a bike. Here are some basic bike fit tips:Stand-over Height--To find out if a bike's overall height fits your body, measure your inseam. Next, determine how much clearance you'll need between your crotch and the top tube of the bike. For a mountain bike, you'll want three to five inches of clearance. A road bike should offer between one and two inches of clearance, while a commuter bike should have two to four inches. Compare the stand-over height for a given bike to your measurements (inseam + clearance) to determine the right bike height.Top Tube Length--You can measure your torso to get a good estimate of proper top tube length. First, make a fist and extend your arm. Measure from the center of your fist to the end of your collarbone (the part that intersects your shoulder). Next, measure your torso by placing a book against your crotch with the spine facing up. Measure from the spine to the bottom of your throat (the spot between your collarbones). Finally, add the two measurements (arm length + torso length), divide the number in half and subtract six inches. This is your approximate top tube length. Compare this number to a bike's posted top tube length. You can allow for about two inches longer or shorter, as most bikes can be adjusted via stem length/height and saddle fore/aft position to make fine adjustments to the fit.Bikes for Women--Proportionally, women tend to have a shorter torso and longer legs than men. Bike makers design women's bikes that offer a shorter top tube and many comfort/cruiser bikes built for women may also provide more stand-over clearance.The Right AccessoriesWhen you make a bike purchase, don't forget these crucial add-ons:Helmet (this is a must!)Seat packLockHydration pack, or water bottles and bottle cagesSpare tubesPortable bike pumpGloves", "text": "GMC Denali Road Bike The GMC Denali 700C 21-Speed Road Bike is built around a lightweight aluminum road bike frame for racing or commuting. You'll stop on a dime with the alloy calipers and brake levers, and the high-profile alloy Vitesse racing rims look as good as they perform. The Shimano derailleur and Shimano Revo shifts make it easy to change gears quickly and smoothly, and the high-performance 700c tires are up to the challenge of rigorous street racing. Lastly, this road bike will help you stay hydrated with the included alloy water bottle cage.Specifications:Frame: Aluminum 7005 straight gaugeFork: GMC Series 7000 steelChain: KMC Z 51Crankset: Prowheel Alloy 335P6 28X38X48 170mmFront Derailleur: Shimano FD-TZ 31 IndexRear Derailleur: Shimano RD-TZ30GS 7SPDShifters: Shimano Revo SIS L2/R7Brake levers: Promax BL-250AP AluminumBrakes: Promax 501A Alloy Caliper BrakeRims: Vitesse Alloy black 700CX14GX36HTires: Kenda Black With Grey Band 7X28CStem: Aluminum black EXT:100mm 0D.Handlebar: Maesbend W: 430mm D:22.0mmSaddle: Cionlli BlackSeat post: HL Aluminum Micro Adjust 27.2 X 300mmPedals: VP-990S plastic body with steel cageWeight: 29.0 lbsAmazon.com Bicycle Buying GuideFinding the Right BikeTo really enjoy cycling, it's important to find a bicycle that works for you. Here are some things to keep in mind when you're in the market for a new bike:The Right RideIn general, bikes are broken down into three major categories:Road and Racing Bikes--As a general rule, road and racing are built for speed and longer distances on paved surfaces. Thinner tires, lightweight 29-inch (700c) wheels and drop bars that allow for a more aerodynamic position are the norm. Most road bikes, regardless of price, offer many gears for tackling both hilly and flat terrain.Mountain Bikes--With their larger tires, hill-friendly gearing and upright position,mountain bikesare very popular for all types of riding, both on pavement and off. Mountain bikes that are designed specifically for rugged trail use typically feature a suspension fork. Some may have rear suspension, as well. A quick change of the tires on any mountain bike--even one that you use regularly on trails--adds to its versatility and makes it a worthy street machine.Comfort/Cruiser Bikes--For tooling around on bike paths, light trails, or for cruising a quiet beach-side lane,comfort/cruiser bikesare the ticket. With a super-relaxed riding position, padded seats, and limited or no gearing, these bikes are made for enjoying the scenery and having fun with the family.The Right PriceA bike's price boils down to three essentials: frame materials, bike weight, and component quality and durability.Entry-level--You'll find a wide range of comfort and cruiser bikes in this category, as well as some lower-end mountain bikes and road bikes. Most will have steel frames and components that are designed to last for several years with frequent use.Mid-range--Bikes in this range may feature a lighter aluminum frame with mid-range components that keep performing after miles of use. If you're looking for a quality bike that is relatively lightweight and will stand up to abuse, this is the \"sweet spot.\" Most serious commuter and touring bikes fall into this category, as do mid-range mountain bikes with a decent front suspension.High-end--Racers and serious enthusiasts who expect lightweight, high-performance components will want to stick to this category. For road bikes, exotic frame materials (carbon fiber, titanium) and ultra-lightweight components can add thousands to the price tag. Mountain bikes in this class often feature advanced front and rear suspension technology, as well as components designed to handle lots of rugged trail action.The Right SizeFit is crucial for comfort, control, and proper power and endurance on a bike. Here are some basic bike fit tips:Stand-over Height--To find out if a bike's overall height fits your body, measure your inseam. Next, determine how much clearance you'll need between your crotch and the top tube of the bike. For a mountain bike, you'll want three to five inches of clearance. A road bike should offer between one and two inches of clearance, while a commuter bike should have two to four inches. Compare the stand-over height for a given bike to your measurements (inseam + clearance) to determine the right bike height.Top Tube Length--You can measure your torso to get a good estimate of proper top tube length. First, make a fist and extend your arm. Measure from the center of your fist to the end of your collarbone (the part that intersects your shoulder). Next, measure your torso by placing a book against your crotch with the spine facing up. Measure from the spine to the bottom of your throat (the spot between your collarbones). Finally, add the two measurements (arm length + torso length), divide the number in half and subtract six inches. This is your approximate top tube length. Compare this number to a bike's posted top tube length. You can allow for about two inches longer or shorter, as most bikes can be adjusted via stem length/height and saddle fore/aft position to make fine adjustments to the fit.Bikes for Women--Proportionally, women tend to have a shorter torso and longer legs than men. Bike makers design women's bikes that offer a shorter top tube and many comfort/cruiser bikes built for women may also provide more stand-over clearance.The Right AccessoriesWhen you make a bike purchase, don't forget these crucial add-ons:Helmet (this is a must!)Seat packLockHydration pack, or water bottles and bottle cagesSpare tubesPortable bike pumpGloves", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xgWpcxubL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BT9VSC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Road Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BTA6O0", "title": "CycleOps Bike Thong Sweat Catcher", "description": "The main drawback to training indoors -- other than the terminal boredom it brings on -- is the sweat that pours all over your bike. It's hell on your headset and on the bolts of your stem and bars. The CycleOps Bike Thong is the cure. It's a Y-shaped piece of terry cloth that velcros to your handlebars and seatpost to catch the sweat before it drips onto the vulnerable bits on your bike.Product FeaturesMaterial:Dimensions:Compatibility:Recommended Use: biking, protecting bike frame from sweatManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "text": "CycleOps Bike Thong Sweat Catcher The main drawback to training indoors -- other than the terminal boredom it brings on -- is the sweat that pours all over your bike. It's hell on your headset and on the bolts of your stem and bars. The CycleOps Bike Thong is the cure. It's a Y-shaped piece of terry cloth that velcros to your handlebars and seatpost to catch the sweat before it drips onto the vulnerable bits on your bike.Product FeaturesMaterial:Dimensions:Compatibility:Recommended Use: biking, protecting bike frame from sweatManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R239AK13L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTA6O0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleOps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 21.67}}
{"item_id": "B000BTAPSC", "title": "Planet Bike Comfort GEL Road Bike Handlebar Tape with Reflective Bar Plugs", "description": "Say no to sore hands with this handlebar tape from Planet Bike. Designed for road bikes, the tape boasts a soft, durable gel construction that becomes tacky when wet for a better grip. It's also highly fade- and water-resistant, helping it hold up to heavy use over time. And riders will love the variety of UV-protected colors, which include blue cork, white cork, orange cork, fluorescent green, celeste cork, and black cork. As with all Planet Bike products, the gel tape is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "text": "Planet Bike Comfort GEL Road Bike Handlebar Tape with Reflective Bar Plugs Say no to sore hands with this handlebar tape from Planet Bike. Designed for road bikes, the tape boasts a soft, durable gel construction that becomes tacky when wet for a better grip. It's also highly fade- and water-resistant, helping it hold up to heavy use over time. And riders will love the variety of UV-protected colors, which include blue cork, white cork, orange cork, fluorescent green, celeste cork, and black cork. As with all Planet Bike products, the gel tape is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AO%2B5m4SzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTAPSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 17.1}}
{"item_id": "B000BTATEM", "title": "Cold Steel Laredo Bowie Faux Cocobolo Handle", "description": "10 1/2 in. SK-5 High carbon steel blade with a Faux cocobolo handle. Includes leather sheath. Overall length is 15 11/16 in. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 10.50 Blade Material: SK-5 High Carbon Carry System: Leather Sheath Brown Handle Material: Faux Cocobolo Overall Length (inches): 15.69", "text": "Cold Steel Laredo Bowie Faux Cocobolo Handle 10 1/2 in. SK-5 High carbon steel blade with a Faux cocobolo handle. Includes leather sheath. Overall length is 15 11/16 in. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 10.50 Blade Material: SK-5 High Carbon Carry System: Leather Sheath Brown Handle Material: Faux Cocobolo Overall Length (inches): 15.69", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rVHds%2BW0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTATEM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 147.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BTJUPQ", "title": "Barnett Outdoors Lil Banshee Jr. Compound Archery Set", "description": "The Lil Banshee Jr. compound bow set, from renowned archery company Barnett, offers an ideal, affordable way to introduce young archery enthusiasts to this exciting sport. An 18-pound draw weight, 18-to-22-inch draw length compound bow features a newly redesigned soft touch grip for nonslip use and a versatile ambidextrous handle. Snazzy color options include classic black, Realtree camouflage and the set comes with 2 arrows, finger rollers, adjustable pin sight and packaging that can be used as a carrying case.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors Lil Banshee Jr. Compound Archery Set The Lil Banshee Jr. compound bow set, from renowned archery company Barnett, offers an ideal, affordable way to introduce young archery enthusiasts to this exciting sport. An 18-pound draw weight, 18-to-22-inch draw length compound bow features a newly redesigned soft touch grip for nonslip use and a versatile ambidextrous handle. Snazzy color options include classic black, Realtree camouflage and the set comes with 2 arrows, finger rollers, adjustable pin sight and packaging that can be used as a carrying case.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41inxqAXZdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTJUPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Compound Bows"]], "price": 28.7}}
{"item_id": "B000BTK1UO", "title": "Full90 Performance Soccer Headgear Premier", "description": "The X-Band design of the Premier has a low profile and a high level of protection and comfort. The adjustable lightweight cross-strap construction in addition to the interchangeable occipital padding makes the Premier the most unique and advanced headgear in the game. The inner lining of the Premier is constructed with moisture management fabric to accelerate moisture evaporation, allowing the player to keep his head in the game. It is based upon feedback from professional players and use under real game conditions, and therefore, is ideal for those athletes who play full out at the highest levels of the game.", "text": "Full90 Performance Soccer Headgear Premier The X-Band design of the Premier has a low profile and a high level of protection and comfort. The adjustable lightweight cross-strap construction in addition to the interchangeable occipital padding makes the Premier the most unique and advanced headgear in the game. The inner lining of the Premier is constructed with moisture management fabric to accelerate moisture evaporation, allowing the player to keep his head in the game. It is based upon feedback from professional players and use under real game conditions, and therefore, is ideal for those athletes who play full out at the highest levels of the game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aZwoGkGwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTK1UO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Headgear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BTNLVK", "title": "Crosman Field Hunting .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Pointed, 1250ct", "description": "Want your shot to travel further? Turn to the Crosman 0.177-caliber Super Point field-hunting pellets, which are great for hunting and plinking. Weighing 7.4 grains each, the pellets help you get the maximum distance for your airgun. The carton comes with 1,250 pellets.Warning:Lead airgun ammunition contains a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects (or other reproductive harm). Do not inhale dust or put pellets in mouth. Wash hands after handling.", "text": "Crosman Field Hunting .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Pointed, 1250ct Want your shot to travel further? Turn to the Crosman 0.177-caliber Super Point field-hunting pellets, which are great for hunting and plinking. Weighing 7.4 grains each, the pellets help you get the maximum distance for your airgun. The carton comes with 1,250 pellets.Warning:Lead airgun ammunition contains a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects (or other reproductive harm). Do not inhale dust or put pellets in mouth. Wash hands after handling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xMpwazXtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTNLVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BTNLVU", "title": "Benjamin EB22 air pistol", "description": "This bolt-action air pistol is crafted from traditional, premium grade materials. Plus, it offers power and precision - without pumping! The EB22 has hand finished American Hardwood grips and a precision tuned rifled brass barrel. Power comes from the 12 gram Powerlet and like all Benjamin products it is made in the USA.", "text": "Benjamin EB22 air pistol This bolt-action air pistol is crafted from traditional, premium grade materials. Plus, it offers power and precision - without pumping! The EB22 has hand finished American Hardwood grips and a precision tuned rifled brass barrel. Power comes from the 12 gram Powerlet and like all Benjamin products it is made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3138djHb-EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTNLVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benjamin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 138.59}}
{"item_id": "B000BTNLYC", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Euro Pistol (Black, 7.1 Inch)", "description": "With its ergonomic design, the Model 008 is not only one of the most comfortable guns you’ll ever shoot, it’s one of the sleekest as well. Its 8-shot rotary clip can be loaded with BBs, .177 cal. pellets or a combination of both for hours of target shooting fun. The semi-automatic 008 Pistol operates easily. Simply insert a CO2 cylinder, load the clip and fire off 8 shots as fast as you can pull the trigger. For maximum accuracy, use the white dot system on both the blade front sight and sloping ramp rear sight. And with a powerful muzzle velocity of 480 fps, you can shoot your chosen ammo downrange with authority. The PowerLine Model 008 – the only thing better than the way it looks, is the way it feels.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Euro Pistol (Black, 7.1 Inch) With its ergonomic design, the Model 008 is not only one of the most comfortable guns you’ll ever shoot, it’s one of the sleekest as well. Its 8-shot rotary clip can be loaded with BBs, .177 cal. pellets or a combination of both for hours of target shooting fun. The semi-automatic 008 Pistol operates easily. Simply insert a CO2 cylinder, load the clip and fire off 8 shots as fast as you can pull the trigger. For maximum accuracy, use the white dot system on both the blade front sight and sloping ramp rear sight. And with a powerful muzzle velocity of 480 fps, you can shoot your chosen ammo downrange with authority. The PowerLine Model 008 – the only thing better than the way it looks, is the way it feels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q5rx48G1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTNLYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000BTNX40", "title": "Maxpedition Double Sheath", "description": "Double sheath has two compartments for carrying extra flashlights, cellular phones, multitools, folding knives, handgun magazines, or any combination thereof.", "text": "Maxpedition Double Sheath Double sheath has two compartments for carrying extra flashlights, cellular phones, multitools, folding knives, handgun magazines, or any combination thereof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pyZwy2yRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BTNX40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 24.6}}
{"item_id": "B000BU51G2", "title": "Seirus Innovation Men's Deluxe Thermax Liners", "description": "Seirus Innovation's Deluxe Thermax liners create an extra layer of warmth to boost the performance of your winter gloves. The milled Thermax fabric is specifically designed to enhance both comfort and moisture-wicking performance.", "text": "Seirus Innovation Men's Deluxe Thermax Liners Seirus Innovation's Deluxe Thermax liners create an extra layer of warmth to boost the performance of your winter gloves. The milled Thermax fabric is specifically designed to enhance both comfort and moisture-wicking performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BdlsrOQTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BU51G2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BU53LA", "title": "Rubber Texture Finger Groove Decal Grip", "description": "The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "text": "Rubber Texture Finger Groove Decal Grip The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jws4jDScL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BU53LA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BUAP9K", "title": "Decal XDR Rubber Texture Pistol Grip for Springfield Armory XD Sub Compact, Tactical, Service, Custom (9-mm/.357/.40/.45GAP, Black)", "description": "Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "text": "Decal XDR Rubber Texture Pistol Grip for Springfield Armory XD Sub Compact, Tactical, Service, Custom (9-mm/.357/.40/.45GAP, Black) Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B99-4apFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUAP9K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Decal Grip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 13.23}}
{"item_id": "B000BUBJ9A", "title": "Hanes TAGLESS 6.1 Short Sleeve Tee with Pocket Ash S Hanes TAGLESS 6.1 Short", "description": "", "text": "Hanes TAGLESS 6.1 Short Sleeve Tee with Pocket Ash S Hanes TAGLESS 6.1 Short", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bPIIVVaNL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUBJ9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Petite", "Tops & Tees", "Knits & Tees"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BUC7IM", "title": "South Bend Monofilament Line, 30-Pound", "description": "South Bend Monofilament offers the perfect balance of Strength and size. The small diameter makes it nearly invisible to fish, while the high knot strength lets them know they are not getting off easy once hooked.", "text": "South Bend Monofilament Line, 30-Pound South Bend Monofilament offers the perfect balance of Strength and size. The small diameter makes it nearly invisible to fish, while the high knot strength lets them know they are not getting off easy once hooked.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51331l9NAwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUC7IM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "South Bend", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]], "price": 4.06}}
{"item_id": "B000BUG8SW", "title": "Maurice Sporting Goods KIT-30 Worm Kit, Lunker, 58-Pc.", "description": "58 Piece Lunker Worm Kit, Includes 4\" & 6\" Scented Worms In Popular Colors, Assorted Worm Hooks & Worm Weights, Plus Detailed Booklet On How To Rig & Fish With Artificial Worms, Packaged On Display Card, Items Illegal For Sale In Maine, New Hampshire, New York & Vermont.", "text": "Maurice Sporting Goods KIT-30 Worm Kit, Lunker, 58-Pc. 58 Piece Lunker Worm Kit, Includes 4\" & 6\" Scented Worms In Popular Colors, Assorted Worm Hooks & Worm Weights, Plus Detailed Booklet On How To Rig & Fish With Artificial Worms, Packaged On Display Card, Items Illegal For Sale In Maine, New Hampshire, New York & Vermont.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WKWNJW9RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUG8SW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Baits & Attractants", "Artificial Bait"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000BUPDXS", "title": "Green Gas (x2) Dual Pack 1000 mL", "description": "This is a brand new 2 CANS of 1000ML GREEN GAS / Compressed Air FOR AIRSOFT! Features: 2 Brand New 1000 ML CANS They are used refill airsoft gas guns or pistols Authentic Real Green Gas, wont damage gun. SEALED, BEST PRICE EVER! CAN BE USED ON ANY AIRSOFT GAS, HFC, UHC, KWA, KSC, Tokyo Marui, Western arms, KJW, NON BLOWBACK, Blow Back, Or anything else that uses green gas. EPA APPROVED SAFE It contains Silicon to lubricate your airsoft gun or pistol. BUY FROM THE BEST! PAINTBALL 365! Can Label may vary: All will be the same, the manufacturer has many different can designs", "text": "Green Gas (x2) Dual Pack 1000 mL This is a brand new 2 CANS of 1000ML GREEN GAS / Compressed Air FOR AIRSOFT! Features: 2 Brand New 1000 ML CANS They are used refill airsoft gas guns or pistols Authentic Real Green Gas, wont damage gun. SEALED, BEST PRICE EVER! CAN BE USED ON ANY AIRSOFT GAS, HFC, UHC, KWA, KSC, Tokyo Marui, Western arms, KJW, NON BLOWBACK, Blow Back, Or anything else that uses green gas. EPA APPROVED SAFE It contains Silicon to lubricate your airsoft gun or pistol. BUY FROM THE BEST! PAINTBALL 365! Can Label may vary: All will be the same, the manufacturer has many different can designs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N-k9eW5fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUPDXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fire Power", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B000BUQOGI", "title": "Camco 55185 PowerGrip 30M/50F AMP 18\" Dogbone Electrical Adapter with Handles 3750W/125V", "description": "Camco RV 18\" PowerGrip Dogbone Electrical Adapter with easy grip handle is designed for greater convenience and ease of use. It has 30 AMP male to 50 AMP female ends. 125V/3750 watt.", "text": "Camco 55185 PowerGrip 30M/50F AMP 18\" Dogbone Electrical Adapter with Handles 3750W/125V Camco RV 18\" PowerGrip Dogbone Electrical Adapter with easy grip handle is designed for greater convenience and ease of use. It has 30 AMP male to 50 AMP female ends. 125V/3750 watt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vjgKr-kxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000BUQOGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Shore Power Cords"]], "price": 19.49}}
