{"item_id": "B000C14HL0", "title": "White Lightning Chain Lubricant", "description": "White Lightning's \"Self-Cleaning\" wax-based lubricant is the original, unchanged, and some say the best chain, derailleur, and cable lube around. Pick up a squeeze tube to try out, and then come back for the big Jug-O'Lightning when you find out what's up.", "text": "White Lightning Chain Lubricant White Lightning's \"Self-Cleaning\" wax-based lubricant is the original, unchanged, and some say the best chain, derailleur, and cable lube around. Pick up a squeeze tube to try out, and then come back for the big Jug-O'Lightning when you find out what's up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TahcVTYIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C14HL0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]]}}
