{"item_id": "B000C14MCO", "title": "Kenda Kaliente Road Racing Bike Tire", "description": "Iron cloak protection - Kenda's best puncture resistant material. It is a layer of material under the tread that runs bead to bead. In addition to helping prevent punctures it adds strength to the sidewalls of the tire. Special L3R Pro racing compound - L3R PRO is an upscale version of L3R. Benefits are low rolling resistance, increased tread life and a lighter tire. Kenda's lightest clincher tire Lower rolling resistance Higher tread life expectancy TPI - 120 Bead - Folding PSI - 125 Weight - 17110g (650x23), 19211g (700x23)", "text": "Kenda Kaliente Road Racing Bike Tire Iron cloak protection - Kenda's best puncture resistant material. It is a layer of material under the tread that runs bead to bead. In addition to helping prevent punctures it adds strength to the sidewalls of the tire. Special L3R Pro racing compound - L3R PRO is an upscale version of L3R. Benefits are low rolling resistance, increased tread life and a lighter tire. Kenda's lightest clincher tire Lower rolling resistance Higher tread life expectancy TPI - 120 Bead - Folding PSI - 125 Weight - 17110g (650x23), 19211g (700x23)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GJHXB8HHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C14MCO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000C14P1C", "title": "Park Tool Slotted Bottom Bracket Adjustable Cup Wrench, 16mm", "description": "Freehubs of various brands require an 11mm hex wrench for removal and service", "text": "Park Tool Slotted Bottom Bracket Adjustable Cup Wrench, 16mm Freehubs of various brands require an 11mm hex wrench for removal and service", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rOM6IEiuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C14P1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 14.36}}
{"item_id": "B000C14PC6", "title": "Kenda REDLINE Kross Supreme Tire 700 X 35C Wire Bead / 60TPI Black Skinwall", "description": "A great front or rear cyclocross tire for adverse conditions. It fits all REDLINE 'cross bikes and meets the UCI 35mm width ruling. Available in a dual-compound red/black tire or an economical all black version.", "text": "Kenda REDLINE Kross Supreme Tire 700 X 35C Wire Bead / 60TPI Black Skinwall A great front or rear cyclocross tire for adverse conditions. It fits all REDLINE 'cross bikes and meets the UCI 35mm width ruling. Available in a dual-compound red/black tire or an economical all black version.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xqFjkPHDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C14PC6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 11.0}}
