{"item_id": "B000C15I5E", "title": "Cheng Shin C637 Road Bike Tire (Wire Bead, 27\" x 1-1/4\", Black Wall)", "description": "90 max. psi.", "text": "Cheng Shin C637 Road Bike Tire (Wire Bead, 27\" x 1-1/4\", Black Wall) 90 max. psi.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z32svE1DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C15I5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cheng Shin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 12.94}}
{"item_id": "B000C15J1W", "title": "Kenda John Tomac Signature Series Nevegal Mountain Bike Tire", "description": "John, \"god of all things MTB\" Tomac designed this series of tires and named it after a famed course in Italy where he romped on his competition. The raison d'etre of the tire is to ride well in the loose, the hard, and everything in between. The Kenda Nevegal UST Tire fulfills this mission completely. We find the Nevegal to be the best tire in wet, rooted, and rocky conditions.The 2.35\" version uses Kenda's DTC (Dual Tread Compound). It has their Stick-E compound on the shoulders for excellent steep-lean traction. This is a super soft rubber that yields great grip, and the slow-rebound nature of this famed tree-sap solid acts as a suspension element. A harder, longer-wearing rubber is used down the center. The 2.1 \" tires use the same firmer rubber compound over the entirety of the tread. This gives them a durability that cross-country/trail riders will appreciate. Using a fluid-based sealant product in any Kenda tire will void the warranty.The Kenda Nevegal UST tire is offered in 2.1\" and 2.35\" widths. Both sizes use a Kevlar bead for weight savings. 880g (2.1).Application: XC USTGround: All ConditionsTubeless 101: The Why and the How Explained.Product FeaturesHASH(0x643d1468)", "text": "Kenda John Tomac Signature Series Nevegal Mountain Bike Tire John, \"god of all things MTB\" Tomac designed this series of tires and named it after a famed course in Italy where he romped on his competition. The raison d'etre of the tire is to ride well in the loose, the hard, and everything in between. The Kenda Nevegal UST Tire fulfills this mission completely. We find the Nevegal to be the best tire in wet, rooted, and rocky conditions.The 2.35\" version uses Kenda's DTC (Dual Tread Compound). It has their Stick-E compound on the shoulders for excellent steep-lean traction. This is a super soft rubber that yields great grip, and the slow-rebound nature of this famed tree-sap solid acts as a suspension element. A harder, longer-wearing rubber is used down the center. The 2.1 \" tires use the same firmer rubber compound over the entirety of the tread. This gives them a durability that cross-country/trail riders will appreciate. Using a fluid-based sealant product in any Kenda tire will void the warranty.The Kenda Nevegal UST tire is offered in 2.1\" and 2.35\" widths. Both sizes use a Kevlar bead for weight savings. 880g (2.1).Application: XC USTGround: All ConditionsTubeless 101: The Why and the How Explained.Product FeaturesHASH(0x643d1468)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WDCHx74mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C15J1W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000C15J9Y", "title": "Redline Expanding Bar End Plugs Black", "description": "Plastic plugs that expand to fit most bar I.D.'s. RL-Star logo molded into ends, same plugs that come with the Freaky -X grips.", "text": "Redline Expanding Bar End Plugs Black Plastic plugs that expand to fit most bar I.D.'s. RL-Star logo molded into ends, same plugs that come with the Freaky -X grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Lcg3pDf4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C15J9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 2.11}}
{"item_id": "B000C15M8C", "title": "Finish Line Premium Grease made with Teflon Fluoropolymer", "description": "Synthetic Teflon impregnated multi-purpose bicycle grease. Recommended as a seal/wiper grease for suspension designs. Outlasts petroleum grease up to five times.", "text": "Finish Line Premium Grease made with Teflon Fluoropolymer Synthetic Teflon impregnated multi-purpose bicycle grease. Recommended as a seal/wiper grease for suspension designs. Outlasts petroleum grease up to five times.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417764AoCCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C15M8C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Grease"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000C15MY6", "title": "Park Tool PT-03 Double Ended Cone Wrench", "description": "These cone wrenches are designed for the home mechanic or occasional user. They're made of thin steel and are nickel plated and heat treated for long use. Available in four popular sizes from 13mm to 18mm. Their small size makes them ideal to carry along for quick repairs.", "text": "Park Tool PT-03 Double Ended Cone Wrench These cone wrenches are designed for the home mechanic or occasional user. They're made of thin steel and are nickel plated and heat treated for long use. Available in four popular sizes from 13mm to 18mm. Their small size makes them ideal to carry along for quick repairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c%2Bftf75ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C15MY6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
