{"item_id": "B000C17HKS", "title": "Finish Line DRY Teflon Bicycle Chain Lube, 4-Ounce Drip Squeeze Bottle", "description": "100% synthetic oils set up dry. For use in wet or dry conditions on chains, pivots, cables, etc. Law prohibits ORM-D materials from shipping by air.", "text": "Finish Line DRY Teflon Bicycle Chain Lube, 4-Ounce Drip Squeeze Bottle 100% synthetic oils set up dry. For use in wet or dry conditions on chains, pivots, cables, etc. Law prohibits ORM-D materials from shipping by air.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VM8ahyORL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17HKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Grease"]], "price": 0.01}}
{"item_id": "B000C17I9S", "title": "Mr. Tuffy Tire Liner", "description": "Mr. Tuffy is a bicycle tire liner that inserted between the bike tire and bike tube, which provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube. Thorns or glass that may penetrate the tire are blocked from the inner tube by the Mr Tuffy tire liner. Mr Tuffy is a remarkable tire liner made of durable, lightweight polyurethane. When inserted between the bike tire and the tube. It provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube. Thorns or glass that may penetrate the tire are blocked from the inner tube. Proven tough for over two decades Mr. Tuffy has been the world’s leading flat-tire preventive with Millions upon Millions of satisfied cyclists. Mr Tuffy Tire Liners are available to fit any tire size.", "text": "Mr. Tuffy Tire Liner Mr. Tuffy is a bicycle tire liner that inserted between the bike tire and bike tube, which provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube. Thorns or glass that may penetrate the tire are blocked from the inner tube by the Mr Tuffy tire liner. Mr Tuffy is a remarkable tire liner made of durable, lightweight polyurethane. When inserted between the bike tire and the tube. It provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube. Thorns or glass that may penetrate the tire are blocked from the inner tube. Proven tough for over two decades Mr. Tuffy has been the world’s leading flat-tire preventive with Millions upon Millions of satisfied cyclists. Mr Tuffy Tire Liners are available to fit any tire size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519tVKOlomL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17I9S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000C17IAM", "title": "Park Tool AWS-10 Fold-up Hex Wrench Set (1.5mm to 6mm)", "description": "1.5mm, 2mm, 2.5mm, 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, and 6mm Hex Wrench Set, Park Tool Fold Up Hex Wrench Sets use a multi position composite handle that is comfortable, lightweight, slip-resistant, and 40% stronger than steel handles. Hexes have chamfered tips for a perfect fit and are made from Bondhus Protanium¿ high torque industrial steel for long life.", "text": "Park Tool AWS-10 Fold-up Hex Wrench Set (1.5mm to 6mm) 1.5mm, 2mm, 2.5mm, 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, and 6mm Hex Wrench Set, Park Tool Fold Up Hex Wrench Sets use a multi position composite handle that is comfortable, lightweight, slip-resistant, and 40% stronger than steel handles. Hexes have chamfered tips for a perfect fit and are made from Bondhus Protanium¿ high torque industrial steel for long life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kOFsXUzVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17IAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B000C17KRI", "title": "Park Tool HCW-5 Lock Ring Spanner", "description": "Double sided bottom bracket lockring hook spanner. One side is a single hook, the other is a hook spanner with 3 notches for better engagement in the lock rings. The three-hook end will fit 3-notch lock rings with a maximum outside diameter of 46mm and minor diameter (in the notches) of 40mm.", "text": "Park Tool HCW-5 Lock Ring Spanner Double sided bottom bracket lockring hook spanner. One side is a single hook, the other is a hook spanner with 3 notches for better engagement in the lock rings. The three-hook end will fit 3-notch lock rings with a maximum outside diameter of 46mm and minor diameter (in the notches) of 40mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21FiOgHLdCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17KRI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000C17KZU", "title": "ODI bike grips clamping ring for lock-On system", "description": "Intended use:MTBForm:Sport-GriffWeight:36 gMaterial:Aluminium", "text": "ODI bike grips clamping ring for lock-On system Intended use:MTBForm:Sport-GriffWeight:36 gMaterial:Aluminium", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g7Kh13XPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17KZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Odi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 13.65}}
{"item_id": "B000C17L2W", "title": "Planet Bike Men's A.R.S. Anatomic Relief Bicycle Saddle", "description": "Eliminate numbness and pain with the seriously comfortable Planet Bike Men's A.R.S. Anatomic Relief Bicycle Saddle. The A.R.S. saddle will allow you to stay comfortable for hours of riding and take the bumps of the road or trail with minimal discomfort. While the A.R.S. is not the absolute lightest seat available, it earns its five-star rating in rump-saving comfort--making it a favorite of road riders, weekenders, mountain bikers, and freestylers alike.While sit-bone gel pads provide needed cushioning on pressure points, the full-length center recess keeps pressure away from your most vulnerable areas, providing anatomic relief from painful bumps and/or long rides. SuperSoft padding with a flex base offers maximum comfort and support when seated. The A.R.S. seat is a favorite for any style of biker, whether you're an occasional rider without a high tolerance to the biking saddle, put in many miles and need maximum relief and support, or take frequent bumps.", "text": "Planet Bike Men's A.R.S. Anatomic Relief Bicycle Saddle Eliminate numbness and pain with the seriously comfortable Planet Bike Men's A.R.S. Anatomic Relief Bicycle Saddle. The A.R.S. saddle will allow you to stay comfortable for hours of riding and take the bumps of the road or trail with minimal discomfort. While the A.R.S. is not the absolute lightest seat available, it earns its five-star rating in rump-saving comfort--making it a favorite of road riders, weekenders, mountain bikers, and freestylers alike.While sit-bone gel pads provide needed cushioning on pressure points, the full-length center recess keeps pressure away from your most vulnerable areas, providing anatomic relief from painful bumps and/or long rides. SuperSoft padding with a flex base offers maximum comfort and support when seated. The A.R.S. seat is a favorite for any style of biker, whether you're an occasional rider without a high tolerance to the biking saddle, put in many miles and need maximum relief and support, or take frequent bumps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cj0fnF2pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000C17L2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 28.5}}
