{"item_id": "B000CDKVYA", "title": "Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle", "description": "Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag HandleBlade length: 6.1 in.Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle Features: Handmade by skilled craftsmen True naturally-dropped stag antlers 6.1-inch Hollowground drop blade Custom proofed Rockwell Hardness Leather sheath Lifetime limited manufacturer warranty Class: GermanPuma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle Specifications: Blade Length: 11.4\" Blade Thickness: 0.16\" Total Length: 11\" Weight oz: 7 Scales: Stag Blade Steel: 440C Stainless Rockwell Hardness: 57-60 Full Tang: Yes Edge Type: Fine", "text": "Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag HandleBlade length: 6.1 in.Puma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle Features: Handmade by skilled craftsmen True naturally-dropped stag antlers 6.1-inch Hollowground drop blade Custom proofed Rockwell Hardness Leather sheath Lifetime limited manufacturer warranty Class: GermanPuma 116396 Bowie Plain Knife, Stag Handle Specifications: Blade Length: 11.4\" Blade Thickness: 0.16\" Total Length: 11\" Weight oz: 7 Scales: Stag Blade Steel: 440C Stainless Rockwell Hardness: 57-60 Full Tang: Yes Edge Type: Fine", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2173FFNRMyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000CDKVYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PUMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 115.42}}
{"item_id": "B000CDUDUW", "title": "BladesUSA 1806 Samurai Wooden Training Boken 39-Inch Overall", "description": "The boken is constructed of oak with a dark stained finish. The handle of the boken is wrapped in a black nylon cord, just as a katana would be. The boken has been constructed with a high detail to replicate the look and feel of a katana, with a kissak at the end of the tip and a pentagonal spine and blade.", "text": "BladesUSA 1806 Samurai Wooden Training Boken 39-Inch Overall The boken is constructed of oak with a dark stained finish. The handle of the boken is wrapped in a black nylon cord, just as a katana would be. The boken has been constructed with a high detail to replicate the look and feel of a katana, with a kissak at the end of the tip and a pentagonal spine and blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510WRnvv8zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000CDUDUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BladesUSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Practice Swords"]], "price": 9.17}}
{"item_id": "B000CEAHES", "title": "Equinox Nylon Mesh Stuff Sack", "description": "Strong, nylon mesh stuff bags provide convenient gear bags for wet items like life jackets, helmets, etc. Smaller sizes offer quick access to key items inside other packs or cargo bags. Features: double sewn seams drawstring with cordlock EQUINOX BILBY MESH STUFF SACK - 23X36 , STUFF SACK , MESH BAG , STORAGE , ORGANIZATION", "text": "Equinox Nylon Mesh Stuff Sack Strong, nylon mesh stuff bags provide convenient gear bags for wet items like life jackets, helmets, etc. Smaller sizes offer quick access to key items inside other packs or cargo bags. Features: double sewn seams drawstring with cordlock EQUINOX BILBY MESH STUFF SACK - 23X36 , STUFF SACK , MESH BAG , STORAGE , ORGANIZATION", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Wd6vSjVaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000CEAHES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]]}}
