{"item_id": "B000CML7CG", "title": "Cascade Creek Yakgrips Comfort Kayak Paddle Grips", "description": "Yakgrips are a great paddling accessory. These simple, light weight additions to your favorite paddle will greatly improve your paddling experience. They are available for take apart and solid shaft paddles. These simple but ingenious devices are easy to install or remove. Some paddlers will deny they need them until the day they try them! Other paddlers know on sight that this is the accessory that they must have. Either way you can't go wrong with Yakgrips.", "text": "Cascade Creek Yakgrips Comfort Kayak Paddle Grips Yakgrips are a great paddling accessory. These simple, light weight additions to your favorite paddle will greatly improve your paddling experience. They are available for take apart and solid shaft paddles. These simple but ingenious devices are easy to install or remove. Some paddlers will deny they need them until the day they try them! Other paddlers know on sight that this is the accessory that they must have. Either way you can't go wrong with Yakgrips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419-iNjgm%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000CML7CG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cascade Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 10.95}}
