{"item_id": "B000E39T50", "title": "Plano ProLatch StowAway Utility Boxes", "description": "Plano ProLatch StowAway Utility Boxes are a staple among fishermen; offshore, inshore or freshwater. Virtually every fishing boat will have some or all of their tackle neatly organized in Plano utility boxes and with good reason. They're relatively inexpensive and ensure that your gear is protected, secure and easily accessible on the water.", "text": "Plano ProLatch StowAway Utility Boxes Plano ProLatch StowAway Utility Boxes are a staple among fishermen; offshore, inshore or freshwater. Virtually every fishing boat will have some or all of their tackle neatly organized in Plano utility boxes and with good reason. They're relatively inexpensive and ensure that your gear is protected, secure and easily accessible on the water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KXAVH4HHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E39T50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 7.73}}
