{"item_id": "B000E3E126", "title": "Plano 2-Tray Tackle Box(Blue Metallic/Off White)", "description": "Two-tray box. Brass bailed latch. Two spinnerbait storage racks. Blue Metallic/Off White. 14-1/4\"L x 8-1/2\"W x 7-3/4\"H.", "text": "Plano 2-Tray Tackle Box(Blue Metallic/Off White) Two-tray box. Brass bailed latch. Two spinnerbait storage racks. Blue Metallic/Off White. 14-1/4\"L x 8-1/2\"W x 7-3/4\"H.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414D2F7MQAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E3E126.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 13.99}}
