{"item_id": "B000E575XQ", "title": "Otis .177-22 Rim-Fire Cleaning System", "description": "Small caliber rifles and pistols are becoming increasingly specialized. Fortunately, our cleaning systems are too. Even with a limited breech, you can clean, lubricate and protect your firearm in one easy step, without disassembly. Contains the brushes needed to clean .17 - .22 cal. rimfire, centerfire and air rifles and pistols, and effectively patch cleans up to .25 cal", "text": "Otis .177-22 Rim-Fire Cleaning System Small caliber rifles and pistols are becoming increasingly specialized. Fortunately, our cleaning systems are too. Even with a limited breech, you can clean, lubricate and protect your firearm in one easy step, without disassembly. Contains the brushes needed to clean .17 - .22 cal. rimfire, centerfire and air rifles and pistols, and effectively patch cleans up to .25 cal", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c1wOVXXxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E575XQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 21.94}}
{"item_id": "B000E59A70", "title": "Otis #25 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .25 Caliber for 243, 25-06, 25, 257, 5.56mm, 5.7mm, 6mm, 6.5mm - In Reusable Tube", "description": "These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "text": "Otis #25 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .25 Caliber for 243, 25-06, 25, 257, 5.56mm, 5.7mm, 6mm, 6.5mm - In Reusable Tube These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eX2Dy2ARL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E59A70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B000E59A7U", "title": "Otis #40 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .40 Caliber for 40, 401, 404, 405, 41, 10.75, 10mm - In Reusable Tube", "description": "These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "text": "Otis #40 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .40 Caliber for 40, 401, 404, 405, 41, 10.75, 10mm - In Reusable Tube These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41emcRLo24L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E59A7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 4.57}}
{"item_id": "B000E59A8E", "title": "Otis M-16 Chamber Brush", "description": "The tapered bronze bristles of the Otis chamber brush scrub the chamber, neck and shoulder. The steel bristles at the base scrub the star chamber of the locking lugs. The brass stem is cold welded to the core, and the tip is folded, not cut. The chamber brush has a standard 8-32 thread. It is available in 5.56MM (essential for anyone that shoots an M4/M16/AR15)", "text": "Otis M-16 Chamber Brush The tapered bronze bristles of the Otis chamber brush scrub the chamber, neck and shoulder. The steel bristles at the base scrub the star chamber of the locking lugs. The brass stem is cold welded to the core, and the tip is folded, not cut. The chamber brush has a standard 8-32 thread. It is available in 5.56MM (essential for anyone that shoots an M4/M16/AR15)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PzLHFzZmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E59A8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 4.95}}
