{"item_id": "B000E5BD7K", "title": "Otis M-16/Small Caliber Patches (100)", "description": "The small caliber patches are designed specifically for .17 caliber to .25 caliber rim-fire. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "text": "Otis M-16/Small Caliber Patches (100) The small caliber patches are designed specifically for .17 caliber to .25 caliber rim-fire. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f26NgH18L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5BD7K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.65}}
{"item_id": "B000E5CQUS", "title": "Otis #21 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush 22 Caliber RIM Fire - In Reusable Tube", "description": "This brush is designed specifically for 22 Rim-Fire, Short Action, Limited Breech, 10-22, .204 Limited Breech firearms. It is 1\" in length and has a 5/40 thread size rather than the standard 8/32 thread. These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush.", "text": "Otis #21 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush 22 Caliber RIM Fire - In Reusable Tube This brush is designed specifically for 22 Rim-Fire, Short Action, Limited Breech, 10-22, .204 Limited Breech firearms. It is 1\" in length and has a 5/40 thread size rather than the standard 8/32 thread. These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HAuU%2B7TdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5CQUS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 5.05}}
{"item_id": "B000E5CQV2", "title": "Otis All-Caliber Rifle Cleaning System", "description": "Every hunter or marksman has a go-to rifle – or two or three. It could be the classic lever action your dad used to hunt with, the .270 you take out west, or your first .22. Whatever caliber rifle they may be, treat them as well as they’ve treated you. Contains the brushes needed to clean and maintain .22 and .35 caliber rifles. Patch cleans all rifles from .17 - .45 caliber", "text": "Otis All-Caliber Rifle Cleaning System Every hunter or marksman has a go-to rifle – or two or three. It could be the classic lever action your dad used to hunt with, the .270 you take out west, or your first .22. Whatever caliber rifle they may be, treat them as well as they’ve treated you. Contains the brushes needed to clean and maintain .22 and .35 caliber rifles. Patch cleans all rifles from .17 - .45 caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lh-vWrB4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5CQV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B000E5CQVC", "title": "Otis #22 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush 22 Caliber RIM Fire, 219, 22, 222 - In Reusable Tube", "description": "These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "text": "Otis #22 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush 22 Caliber RIM Fire, 219, 22, 222 - In Reusable Tube These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413Sr0LZ6aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5CQVC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B000E5CQWG", "title": "Otis #30 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .30 Caliber for 30, 30-06, 30-30, 300 Win. Mag., 303, 308, 32, 7.62MM, 8MM - In Reusable Tube", "description": "These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "text": "Otis #30 Rifle & Pistol Bronze Bore Brush .30 Caliber for 30, 30-06, 30-30, 300 Win. Mag., 303, 308, 32, 7.62MM, 8MM - In Reusable Tube These brushes have a Tufcor proprietary core wire that is corrosive resistant, has a tighter twist for better bristle retention, and can be used with all firearm cleaning chemicals. Otis premium bore brushes also have twice the fill as other brushes, the stem is cold welded to the core, and the brushes are filled to the end. Each brush has the specific caliber or gauge stamped on the stem so you will never clean your gun with the wrong brush. This brush is 2\" in length with an 8/32 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PLFm8Y8aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5CQWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 4.57}}
{"item_id": "B000E5R6OE", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Solid Chrome Bar", "description": "5-Feet Olympic Bar is designed for balance and long lasting performance with a compact design small enough to fit in any home or gym. This bar offers a wide range of workouts from easy to complex. Medium depth diamond knurled surface and sleeves that swivel at the most delicate touch. This prohibits the bar from warping and reduces pressure on the wrists.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Solid Chrome Bar 5-Feet Olympic Bar is designed for balance and long lasting performance with a compact design small enough to fit in any home or gym. This bar offers a wide range of workouts from easy to complex. Medium depth diamond knurled surface and sleeves that swivel at the most delicate touch. This prohibits the bar from warping and reduces pressure on the wrists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tIAXondaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E5R6OE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000E6IEQ2", "title": "Rawlings Workhorse Adult Batting Gloves", "description": "The BGP950T gloves are made from the finest Pittards® leather and have been treated with a special Oiltac treatment that allows for an improved grip and added softness. With our Dynamic Fit System™, these gloves stretch and form for the most comfortable fit yet. The stretchable double knit spandex finger gussets along with the reinforced elastic wrist closure allow you to customize the fit to your liking. We’ve also added a Dura-Plus™ pad for additional protection in the palm.", "text": "Rawlings Workhorse Adult Batting Gloves The BGP950T gloves are made from the finest Pittards® leather and have been treated with a special Oiltac treatment that allows for an improved grip and added softness. With our Dynamic Fit System™, these gloves stretch and form for the most comfortable fit yet. The stretchable double knit spandex finger gussets along with the reinforced elastic wrist closure allow you to customize the fit to your liking. We’ve also added a Dura-Plus™ pad for additional protection in the palm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MYMWBSH5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E6IEQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Batting Gloves"]]}}
