{"item_id": "B000E892Z2", "title": "Sentry Solutions TUF-CLOTH Resealable Pouch, 12 x 12-Inch", "description": "Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone rags; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Spill-proof pack; long-lasting, lint-free impregnated cloth. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "text": "Sentry Solutions TUF-CLOTH Resealable Pouch, 12 x 12-Inch Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone rags; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Spill-proof pack; long-lasting, lint-free impregnated cloth. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Pf9B1Ff0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E892Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sentry Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cloths"]], "price": 7.38}}
