{"item_id": "B000E8BJGW", "title": "MinnKota MKP 6 Replacement Prop (Weedless Wedge)", "description": "Weedless Wedge™ Props (MKP-6)The only 100% fully weedless prop.Patented design pushes weeds away to conserve battery power.Easily moves through heavy vegetation or cover, even at slow speeds.Motor Diameter: 3 - 1 / 4\"Prop Nut Kit: \"A\"", "text": "MinnKota MKP 6 Replacement Prop (Weedless Wedge) Weedless Wedge™ Props (MKP-6)The only 100% fully weedless prop.Patented design pushes weeds away to conserve battery power.Easily moves through heavy vegetation or cover, even at slow speeds.Motor Diameter: 3 - 1 / 4\"Prop Nut Kit: \"A\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CbLpN9XmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E8BJGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minn Kota", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Motors", "Outboard Motors"]], "price": 15.67}}
{"item_id": "B000E8EUIQ", "title": "Emergency Mylar Survival Sleeping Bags - Pack of 4 Bags. SSB-4", "description": "Mylar emergency sleeping bags are easy to use, compact and portable. These sleeping bags retain 99% of body heat.", "text": "Emergency Mylar Survival Sleeping Bags - Pack of 4 Bags. SSB-4 Mylar emergency sleeping bags are easy to use, compact and portable. These sleeping bags retain 99% of body heat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zOMWC8GzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E8EUIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 14.42}}
{"item_id": "B000E8OXF6", "title": "Maxxis High Roller Mountain Bike Tire", "description": "The High Roller excels in every discipline in nearly every condition. Just find the size and rubber that meets your needs, pry it on, and ride. The center tread has both rectangular bars for tractor driving and grooved, triangulated lugs for a piercing bite. The side knobs are tall and straight and hold the line where you find it. The UST has 70a rubber and 120 TPI casing and a folding bead. Tubeless 101: The Why and the How Explained.Product FeaturesType:Material: [tread] 70a rubber; [casing] 120 tpiSize: 26 in x 2.1Bead: KEVLARAAFoldable: yesWeight: 625 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: limited", "text": "Maxxis High Roller Mountain Bike Tire The High Roller excels in every discipline in nearly every condition. Just find the size and rubber that meets your needs, pry it on, and ride. The center tread has both rectangular bars for tractor driving and grooved, triangulated lugs for a piercing bite. The side knobs are tall and straight and hold the line where you find it. The UST has 70a rubber and 120 TPI casing and a folding bead. Tubeless 101: The Why and the How Explained.Product FeaturesType:Material: [tread] 70a rubber; [casing] 120 tpiSize: 26 in x 2.1Bead: KEVLARAAFoldable: yesWeight: 625 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: limited", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UGhaMNx3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E8OXF6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
