{"item_id": "B000E96RQI", "title": "Rothco Black 80-mm Locking Carabiner", "description": "Rothco's 294 Black 80mm locking carabiner is designed to hold items or secure gear (not for climbing). It locks with a threaded barrel.", "text": "Rothco Black 80-mm Locking Carabiner Rothco's 294 Black 80mm locking carabiner is designed to hold items or secure gear (not for climbing). It locks with a threaded barrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GJkMZMA4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E96RQI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]], "price": 4.55}}
{"item_id": "B000E9A07U", "title": "Tilley Endurables LTM6 Airflo Hat", "description": "Designed with a medium brim that snaps up Aussie style, the Tilley Endurables LTM6 Airflo Hat features a 3/4-inch polyester mesh in the crown for coolness and comfort during hot days and strenuous activities. It's made from 100 percent supplex Tilley Nylamtium, a form of lightweight nylon that's both lightweight and resistant to water and mildew. The fabric has also been certified to block 98 percent of harmful UVA/UVB radiation and deliver an ultraviolet factor (UPF) of 50+--the maximum rating given. Other features include a dark underbrim for glare protection and floatability. It also ties on in windy conditions.Each Tilley hat is hand-sewn and all seams are lock-stitched so they won't unravel. It also comes with a secret pocket in the crown to safely and securely store items such as a driver's license, room key, or a $20 bill. Machine wash on delicate cycle separately or hand wash in cool water. Do not use bleach. Guaranteed for life not to wear out.", "text": "Tilley Endurables LTM6 Airflo Hat Designed with a medium brim that snaps up Aussie style, the Tilley Endurables LTM6 Airflo Hat features a 3/4-inch polyester mesh in the crown for coolness and comfort during hot days and strenuous activities. It's made from 100 percent supplex Tilley Nylamtium, a form of lightweight nylon that's both lightweight and resistant to water and mildew. The fabric has also been certified to block 98 percent of harmful UVA/UVB radiation and deliver an ultraviolet factor (UPF) of 50+--the maximum rating given. Other features include a dark underbrim for glare protection and floatability. It also ties on in windy conditions.Each Tilley hat is hand-sewn and all seams are lock-stitched so they won't unravel. It also comes with a secret pocket in the crown to safely and securely store items such as a driver's license, room key, or a $20 bill. Machine wash on delicate cycle separately or hand wash in cool water. Do not use bleach. Guaranteed for life not to wear out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419dyoJvJCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E9A07U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000E9FSR2", "title": "Trademark Poker Craps Layout 36-Inch x 72-Inch", "description": "This is a great way to learn the game before you try it in a live casino. Get yourself a practice layout today.", "text": "Trademark Poker Craps Layout 36-Inch x 72-Inch This is a great way to learn the game before you try it in a live casino. Get yourself a practice layout today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fQ8CcUNSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E9FSR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Craps Equipment", "Craps Layouts"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000E9V6CI", "title": "Callaway Warbird Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack)", "description": "Recycled to the highest standards possible, this set of three dozen Callaway Warbird recycled golf balls is in excellent condition. With exceptional playability, these balls feature two-piece construction and are built for distance. The Warbird balls also offer a soft high-energy core and yield astounding ball speed with lower spin for longer distance.", "text": "Callaway Warbird Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack) Recycled to the highest standards possible, this set of three dozen Callaway Warbird recycled golf balls is in excellent condition. With exceptional playability, these balls feature two-piece construction and are built for distance. The Warbird balls also offer a soft high-energy core and yield astounding ball speed with lower spin for longer distance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BQWP3TQXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E9V6CI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Recycled & Used Balls"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B000E9Z63I", "title": "Titleist Pro V1 AAA Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack)", "description": "Recycled to the highest standards possible, this set of three dozen Titleist Pro V1 AAA recycled balls offer exceptional playability. Designed for serious golfers of all levels, these balls provide long, consistent distance with the driver and long irons while maintaining a soft feel and high performance with Drop-and-Stop control.Key Features:Inner Core: New improved high velocity core formulationSoft Urethane Cover: High performance urethane elastomer cover392 Icosahedral Dimple Design: Multi-dimple high coverage icosahedral designOptimized Aerodynamics: Provides for a more penetrating trajectoryA.I.M. (Alignment Integrated Marking) sidestamp: Integrated alignment guide for improved putting alignmentLonger Distance: Lower driver spin for longer distanceConforms with USGA and R&A; rules", "text": "Titleist Pro V1 AAA Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack) Recycled to the highest standards possible, this set of three dozen Titleist Pro V1 AAA recycled balls offer exceptional playability. Designed for serious golfers of all levels, these balls provide long, consistent distance with the driver and long irons while maintaining a soft feel and high performance with Drop-and-Stop control.Key Features:Inner Core: New improved high velocity core formulationSoft Urethane Cover: High performance urethane elastomer cover392 Icosahedral Dimple Design: Multi-dimple high coverage icosahedral designOptimized Aerodynamics: Provides for a more penetrating trajectoryA.I.M. (Alignment Integrated Marking) sidestamp: Integrated alignment guide for improved putting alignmentLonger Distance: Lower driver spin for longer distanceConforms with USGA and R&A; rules", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8PYXQAEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000E9Z63I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Recycled & Used Balls"]], "price": 63.57}}
{"item_id": "B000EA16MC", "title": "Titleist NXT Tour Recycled Golf Balls, 36 pack", "description": "Titleist NXT Tour Recycled Golf Balls in excellent condition, recycled to the highest standards possible. Excellent playability. 3 dozen included in clam shell case.", "text": "Titleist NXT Tour Recycled Golf Balls, 36 pack Titleist NXT Tour Recycled Golf Balls in excellent condition, recycled to the highest standards possible. Excellent playability. 3 dozen included in clam shell case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XYFDQ910L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EA16MC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Recycled & Used Balls"]]}}
