{"item_id": "B000ECUD56", "title": "Coghlan's Bug Jacket", "description": "The ultimate protection against mosquitos and other flying insects! Features a fine No-See-Um Mesh made from 100% polyester. Flame retardant, lightweight and keeps you cool. Elasticized drawstring waist and cuffs. Zippered at the neck for easy access to the face. Jacket is unisex and sizes are measured by weight. Dont let those mosquitos \"bug\" you. Small fits up to 160 lbs.; Medium fits up to 200 lbs.; Large fits up to 240 lbs.; X-Large fits up to 300 lbs.", "text": "Coghlan's Bug Jacket The ultimate protection against mosquitos and other flying insects! Features a fine No-See-Um Mesh made from 100% polyester. Flame retardant, lightweight and keeps you cool. Elasticized drawstring waist and cuffs. Zippered at the neck for easy access to the face. Jacket is unisex and sizes are measured by weight. Dont let those mosquitos \"bug\" you. Small fits up to 160 lbs.; Medium fits up to 200 lbs.; Large fits up to 240 lbs.; X-Large fits up to 300 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tGVP1hbLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ECUD56.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ECUFI6", "title": "Coghlan's Double Mosquito Net", "description": "Double Wide Mosquito Net provides a nice roomy area of protection from those mosquitos' The net suspends with poles or ropes (not included). The fine 156 mesh polyester net has 6 reinforced tie tabs to secure. Now sleep tight with no Moisquito bite.", "text": "Coghlan's Double Mosquito Net Double Wide Mosquito Net provides a nice roomy area of protection from those mosquitos' The net suspends with poles or ropes (not included). The fine 156 mesh polyester net has 6 reinforced tie tabs to secure. Now sleep tight with no Moisquito bite.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gh9k%2B1u0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ECUFI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 18.98}}
{"item_id": "B000ECUQA8", "title": "FuelBelt Trail Runner 4 Bottle Belt, Black", "description": "More than just a 4-bottle belt, the trail runner boasts four separate pockets:two zippered pockets in the body of the belt and two reflective Velcro closure neoprene pockets. Four 8 oz bottles. One size.", "text": "FuelBelt Trail Runner 4 Bottle Belt, Black More than just a 4-bottle belt, the trail runner boasts four separate pockets:two zippered pockets in the body of the belt and two reflective Velcro closure neoprene pockets. Four 8 oz bottles. One size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WnnPmgT4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ECUQA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ANTOnline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 32.39}}
