{"item_id": "B000EHUYNC", "title": "Buck 112FG Ranger with Finger Grooves, Lockback Folding Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 112FG Ranger is a smaller finger grooved version of Buck's Venerable 110 Folding Hunter. It is also a lockback design, featuring a 3\" clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. The Ranger is 4-1/4\" long closed, and weighs 5.6 oz. The Ranger features natural woodgrain handles with polished brass bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. The 112 Ranger, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 112FG Ranger with Finger Grooves, Lockback Folding Knife Buck Knives 112FG Ranger is a smaller finger grooved version of Buck's Venerable 110 Folding Hunter. It is also a lockback design, featuring a 3\" clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. The Ranger is 4-1/4\" long closed, and weighs 5.6 oz. The Ranger features natural woodgrain handles with polished brass bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. The 112 Ranger, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z7F0S5PPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHUYNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 46.36}}
{"item_id": "B000EHUYP0", "title": "Bantam BLW", "description": "The new Bantam BLW from Buck Knives is slightly larger than the BBW but is still lightweight and small enough for you to take it everywhere. With it's mid back lock and textured handle the Bantam BLW is an essential all around utility pocket knife for your everyday needs. PRODUCT FEATURES: Easy handling and lightweight Slightly larger than the BBW, the BLW Has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added gripping and also has a lanyard hole for easy attachment 0285BKS-B , Buck Knives Bantam BLW , buck knives bantam , buck knives blw , bantam buck knives , bantam blw buck knives , buck knives , buck knives warranty , buck folding knives , buck knives for sale , buck knives pocket knives , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , buck survival knives , buck knives review , buck knifes , best pocket knife , where are buck knives made , buck knife , pocket knives for sale , buck knives usa , vintage buck knives , buck knives direct , buck knives made in usa , buckknives , rescue knives , buck knives wiki , buck knives catalog , buck knives hunting knives , personalized buck knives , buck hunting knives , cheap buck knives , custom buck knives , cold steel , buckknives.com , buck knives repair , buck knives website , buck knives hunting knife , buck knives idaho , buck knives sharpening , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , pocket knives for sale , old timer pocket knives , best pocket knives , good pocket knives , classic pocket knives , buck knives , buck knife , fine pocket knives , high end pocket knives , custom made pocket knives , folding pocket knives , cool pocket knives , pocket knifes , small pocket knives , buck , buck knives", "text": "Bantam BLW The new Bantam BLW from Buck Knives is slightly larger than the BBW but is still lightweight and small enough for you to take it everywhere. With it's mid back lock and textured handle the Bantam BLW is an essential all around utility pocket knife f