{"item_id": "B000EHUYQ4", "title": "Buck 692BR Vanguard Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "The Vanguard TM offers is the perfect hunting knife for those looking for an efficient, long lasting hunting knife. With a 4\" Avid, Drop Point, 420HC Stainless Steel Blade and Textured Black Rubber Handle allow for durability in a hunting knife.", "text": "Buck 692BR Vanguard Fixed Blade Knife The Vanguard TM offers is the perfect hunting knife for those looking for an efficient, long lasting hunting knife. With a 4\" Avid, Drop Point, 420HC Stainless Steel Blade and Textured Black Rubber Handle allow for durability in a hunting knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AZCHCEEBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHUYQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 45.97}}
{"item_id": "B000EHUYTQ", "title": "Buck 505RWS Knight 1-7/8\"", "description": "The Buck 505 Knight Lockback Folding Knife is a slim-line pocket knife, perfect to carry with you at all times. The 1-7/8-inch stainless steel blade holds its edge, and the handsome handle inserts are made from treated birchwood. The nickel silver bolsters are made to last, and the knife features the exceptional locking action for easy folding to 2-3/4 inches. Slip it into your pocket or keep it on your key chain and you'll always have a versatile pocket knife on hand. The Knight Lockback Folding Knife comes with Buck's 4-Ever lifetime warranty.", "text": "Buck 505RWS Knight 1-7/8\" The Buck 505 Knight Lockback Folding Knife is a slim-line pocket knife, perfect to carry with you at all times. The 1-7/8-inch stainless steel blade holds its edge, and the handsome handle inserts are made from treated birchwood. The nickel silver bolsters are made to last, and the knife features the exceptional locking action for easy folding to 2-3/4 inches. Slip it into your pocket or keep it on your key chain and you'll always have a versatile pocket knife on hand. The Knight Lockback Folding Knife comes with Buck's 4-Ever lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PA8W0JY8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHUYTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.96}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWIW", "title": "Buck 55 Folding Hunter", "description": "", "text": "Buck 55 Folding Hunter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V9YTM098L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWJG", "title": "Buck 112BRS Ranger Hunting 3\"", "description": "Buck Knives 112 Ranger is a smaller version of Buck's Venerable 110 Folding Hunter. It is also a lockback design, featuring a 3\" clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. The Ranger is 4-1/4\" long closed, and weighs 5.6 oz. The Ranger features natural woodgrain handles with polished brass bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. The 112 Ranger, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 112BRS Ranger Hunting 3\" Buck Knives 112 Ranger is a smaller version of Buck's Venerable 110 Folding Hunter. It is also a lockback design, featuring a 3\" clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. The Ranger is 4-1/4\" long closed, and weighs 5.6 oz. The Ranger features natural woodgrain handles with polished brass bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. The 112 Ranger, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310MB2R6PGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 43.57}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWJQ", "title": "Buck 119BKS Spec Hunting 6\"", "description": "The Buck Special hunting knife has been a top seller going back some 47 years. The fixed-blade knife has a 6-inch stainless-steel clip blade for detail work, such as piercing and cutting in tight places. The knife's phenolic handle and polished aluminum butt, meanwhile, are comfortable in the hand, giving you added control when outdoors. Finally, the Special comes with a fitted black leather sheath for convenient storage and transport. Originally built by hand by Hoyt and Al Buck in their two-man shop, the Special carries the company's 4-Ever unconditional lifetime warranty.The Special knife comes with a black leather sheath for easy carrying.Specifications:Blade length: 6 inchesBlade material: Satin-finish 420HC stainless steelCarrying system: Black leather sheathFixed blade: YesHandle material: PhenolicWeight: 7.5 ouncesWarranty: Lifetime", "text": "Buck 119BKS Spec Hunting 6\" The Buck Special hunting knife has been a top seller going back some 47 years. The fixed-blade knife has a 6-inch stainless-steel clip blade for detail work, such as piercing and cutting in tight places. The knife's phenolic handle and polished aluminum butt, meanwhile, are comfortable in the hand, giving you added control when outdoors. Finally, the Special comes with a fitted black leather sheath for convenient storage and transport. Originally built by hand by Hoyt and Al Buck in their two-man shop, the Special carries the company's 4-Ever unconditional lifetime warranty.The Special knife comes with a black leather sheath for easy carrying.Specifications:Blade length: 6 inchesBlade material: Satin-finish 420HC stainless steelCarrying system: Black leather sheathFixed blade: YesHandle material: PhenolicWeight: 7.5 ouncesWarranty: Lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NQ9V55H4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 49.51}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWLE", "title": "Buck 192BR Vanguard, Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 192BR Vanguard is Buck's all purpose field knife. The Vanguard features a fixed 4-1/8\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade, and is 8-1/2\" in total length. It weighs 6.3 oz and comes with woodgrain handles and polished brass butt and finger guard, and has a fitted brown leather sheath. The Vanguard, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 192BR Vanguard, Fixed Blade Knife Buck Knives 192BR Vanguard is Buck's all purpose field knife. The Vanguard features a fixed 4-1/8\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade, and is 8-1/2\" in total length. It weighs 6.3 oz and comes with woodgrain handles and polished brass butt and finger guard, and has a fitted brown leather sheath. The Vanguard, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3167HJEEAAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWLE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 62.04}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWMI", "title": "Buck 279BKS Fld Alpha Hunter", "description": "Buck Knives 279BK Folding Alpha Hunter TM is the evolution of Buck's venerable 110 Folding Hunter, one of the most copied knives in the knife industry. The Folding Alpha Hunter is solid, smooth and feels like it was made for your hand. It is the companion to the fixed blade Alpha Hunters, offering a liner locking folding version of this popular design. The Alpha Hunter features a 3-1/2\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade, and is 5\" long closed. It weighs 8 oz, and comes with ruberized handles that leave the border of the handle exposed, and sport grip ridges along the top of the rear frame for an extra sure grip. The Folding Alpha Hunter comes with a fitted heavy duty black nylon sheath, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 279BKS Fld Alpha Hunter Buck Knives 279BK Folding Alpha Hunter TM is the evolution of Buck's venerable 110 Folding Hunter, one of the most copied knives in the knife industry. The Folding Alpha Hunter is solid, smooth and feels like it was made for your hand. It is the companion to the fixed blade Alpha Hunters, offering a liner locking folding version of this popular design. The Alpha Hunter features a 3-1/2\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade, and is 5\" long closed. It weighs 8 oz, and comes with ruberized handles that leave the border of the handle exposed, and sport grip ridges along the top of the rear frame for an extra sure grip. The Folding Alpha Hunter comes with a fitted heavy duty black nylon sheath, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319WJ89VKEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 50.43}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWWMS", "title": "Buck Bantam Knife,", "description": "Features a 3 5/8\" 420HC stainless steel blade and a contoured Thermoplastic handle with textured surface. Includes lanyard hole. 8 5/8\" overall.", "text": "Buck Bantam Knife, Features a 3 5/8\" 420HC stainless steel blade and a contoured Thermoplastic handle with textured surface. Includes lanyard hole. 8 5/8\" overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xoEZrRm6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWWMS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000EHWX5E", "title": "Buck 870X Bones TM Camo, Frame Lock Folding Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 870X Bones TM, is a new high tech frame locking tactical folding knife that features a skeletonized handle. The Bones features a tiger stripe camo blade and handle. It has a 3\" modified tanto 420HC partially serrated 420HC stainless steel blade with a tough camo coating. It is 4-1/2\" long closed and weighs 4.4 oz. The Bones features a skeletonized stainless steel handle with tiger strip camo, and comes with a black stainless steel belt clip, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 870X Bones TM Camo, Frame Lock Folding Knife Buck Knives 870X Bones TM, is a new high tech frame locking tactical folding knife that features a skeletonized handle. The Bones features a tiger stripe camo blade and handle. It has a 3\" modified tanto 420HC partially serrated 420HC stainless steel blade with a tough camo coating. It is 4-1/2\" long closed and weighs 4.4 oz. The Bones features a skeletonized stainless steel handle with tiger strip camo, and comes with a black stainless steel belt clip, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TDQAPV6ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHWX5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.32}}
