{"item_id": "B000EHYZO6", "title": "Buck 392BK Omni Hunter 12pt Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Buck 392CM Omni Hunter TM 12pt is a full size heavy duty hunting knife. It has a contoured handle with a finger groove for your index finger, and has grip ridges built into the bottom portion of the handle for an extra secure grip. The Omni Hunter TM 12pt features a 4\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. It is 9-3/4\" in overall length, and weighs 7.3oz. The 12pt has a full length tang with a rubberized Realtree Hardwoods Green HD TM Camo thermoplastic handle and a heavy duty camo nylon sheath, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 392BK Omni Hunter 12pt Fixed Blade Knife Buck 392CM Omni Hunter TM 12pt is a full size heavy duty hunting knife. It has a contoured handle with a finger groove for your index finger, and has grip ridges built into the bottom portion of the handle for an extra secure grip. The Omni Hunter TM 12pt features a 4\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. It is 9-3/4\" in overall length, and weighs 7.3oz. The 12pt has a full length tang with a rubberized Realtree Hardwoods Green HD TM Camo thermoplastic handle and a heavy duty camo nylon sheath, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BB7HVAJ6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHYZO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.66}}
{"item_id": "B000EHYZQ4", "title": "Buck 501 Squire Lockback Folding Knife", "description": "Buck 501 Squire is classically styled gentleman's slim-line everyday knife. It has a 2-3/4\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. The Squire is 3-3/4\" long closed and weighs 3 oz. It is a slim little knife with woodgrain handles and nickel silver bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. the 501 Squire, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 501 Squire Lockback Folding Knife Buck 501 Squire is classically styled gentleman's slim-line everyday knife. It has a 2-3/4\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. The Squire is 3-3/4\" long closed and weighs 3 oz. It is a slim little knife with woodgrain handles and nickel silver bolsters, and comes with a black leather sheath. the 501 Squire, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MXKS13FNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EHYZQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 36.04}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VSY", "title": "Buck 290PLS Rush Assisted Opening Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 290PLS Rush Assisted Opening Knife. This Knife features Buck's patent pending ASAP technology which features an advanced, dual-pivot design to assist blade opening. The safety (for closed blade protection) and the blade release ridge are adjacent for convenient one-hand operation. ASAP Technology TM is a smooth, reliable and safe assisted opening system. The knife features a 420HC Stainless Steel blade, and Skeletonized Platinum Anodized aluminum handle. It also features a stainless steel belt clip that is designed to carry the knife point up in the pocket. As with all Buck Knives, this knife carries a 4-Ever Unconditional Warranty.", "text": "Buck 290PLS Rush Assisted Opening Knife Buck Knives 290PLS Rush Assisted Opening Knife. This Knife features Buck's patent pending ASAP technology which features an advanced, dual-pivot design to assist blade opening. The safety (for closed blade protection) and the blade release ridge are adjacent for convenient one-hand operation. ASAP Technology TM is a smooth, reliable and safe assisted opening system. The knife features a 420HC Stainless Steel blade, and Skeletonized Platinum Anodized aluminum handle. It also features a stainless steel belt clip that is designed to carry the knife point up in the pocket. As with all Buck Knives, this knife carries a 4-Ever Unconditional Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410946FXA0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VSY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 54.78}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VT8", "title": "Buck 105BKS Pathfinder 5\"", "description": "Buck Knives 105 Pathfinder, fixed blade knife, features a 5\" modified clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. It is 9-1/8\" in overall length and weighs 4.5 oz. The Pathfinder features a Phenolic handle with a polished aluminum butt and finger guard, and comes with a fitted black leather sheath. The Pathfinder, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 105BKS Pathfinder 5\" Buck Knives 105 Pathfinder, fixed blade knife, features a 5\" modified clip point 420HC Stainless Steel Blade. It is 9-1/8\" in overall length and weighs 4.5 oz. The Pathfinder features a Phenolic handle with a polished aluminum butt and finger guard, and comes with a fitted black leather sheath. The Pathfinder, as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XM0YN295L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VT8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.55}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VTI", "title": "Buck 119BR Special Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "A super seller going back some 47 years, the Buck 119BR Special fixed-blade knife is the same knife Hoyt and Al Buck used to build by hand in their two-man shop. Today, the Special hunting knife features a large clip blade made of 420HC stainless steel, making it ideal for detail work, piercing, and cutting in tight places. As popular as ever, the knife comes with a brown leather sheath.SpecificationsBlade length: 6 inchesBlade material: 420HC stainless steelFixed blade: YesHandle material: CocobolaCarrying system: Brown leather sheathWeight: 10.5 ounces", "text": "Buck 119BR Special Fixed Blade Knife A super seller going back some 47 years, the Buck 119BR Special fixed-blade knife is the same knife Hoyt and Al Buck used to build by hand in their two-man shop. Today, the Special hunting knife features a large clip blade made of 420HC stainless steel, making it ideal for detail work, piercing, and cutting in tight places. As popular as ever, the knife comes with a brown leather sheath.SpecificationsBlade length: 6 inchesBlade material: 420HC stainless steelFixed blade: YesHandle material: CocobolaCarrying system: Brown leather sheathWeight: 10.5 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A1H9EXKSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 68.24}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VVQ", "title": "Buck 283BK Nano Bantam, Lock Back Folding Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 283BK Nano Bantam TM is a compact lightweight lockback knife, that can be carried as a pocket knife, or on your keychain, or worn on a bead chain around your neck. The Nano Bantam is the smallest of Buck's popular Bantam series and features a 1-7/8\" drop point 420J2 stainless steel blade. It is 3\" long closed and weighs a scant .6 oz. The Nano Bantam features textured thermoplastic handles with a contoured finger groove, and sport a lanyard hole at the back of the scales. The Nano Bantam, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 283BK Nano Bantam, Lock Back Folding Knife Buck Knives 283BK Nano Bantam TM is a compact lightweight lockback knife, that can be carried as a pocket knife, or on your keychain, or worn on a bead chain around your neck. The Nano Bantam is the smallest of Buck's popular Bantam series and features a 1-7/8\" drop point 420J2 stainless steel blade. It is 3\" long closed and weighs a scant .6 oz. The Nano Bantam features textured thermoplastic handles with a contoured finger groove, and sport a lanyard hole at the back of the scales. The Nano Bantam, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3172YS1T6VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 12.85}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VWU", "title": "Buck 326 Scholar Frame Lock Folding Knife", "description": "Buck Knives 326 Scholar TM is a small contemporary slimline frame locking folding knife. It has a 1-7/8\" drop point 440A Mirror Polished stainless steel blade. It is 2-3/4\" long closed and weighs 1.3 oz. The Scholar has Mirror Polished stainless steel handles with faceted edges, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 326 Scholar Frame Lock Folding Knife Buck Knives 326 Scholar TM is a small contemporary slimline frame locking folding knife. It has a 1-7/8\" drop point 440A Mirror Polished stainless steel blade. It is 2-3/4\" long closed and weighs 1.3 oz. The Scholar has Mirror Polished stainless steel handles with faceted edges, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K8771D60L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.61}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VX4", "title": "Buck Nobleman Folding Knives w/ Slimline Frame-Lock Design", "description": "Contemporary, slimline, frame-lock knife. Measurements: 3 3/4 inches closed, 2 5/8 inch blade length. Your choice of stainless steel handle or titanium coated stainless steel handle.", "text": "Buck Nobleman Folding Knives w/ Slimline Frame-Lock Design Contemporary, slimline, frame-lock knife. Measurements: 3 3/4 inches closed, 2 5/8 inch blade length. Your choice of stainless steel handle or titanium coated stainless steel handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BNBFTCNHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 21.03}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VXO", "title": "Buck 375BRS Deuce", "description": "Buck Knives 375BRS Deuce is a small 3-bladed traditional folding pocket knife. It has a 2\" clip point and a 1-3/8\" coping 420HC stainless steel blades. It is 2-5/8\" long closed and weighs .7 oz. The Deuce has classic woodgrain handles with Buck's \"Classic Bolt\" logo and nickel silver bolsters, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 375BRS Deuce Buck Knives 375BRS Deuce is a small 3-bladed traditional folding pocket knife. It has a 2\" clip point and a 1-3/8\" coping 420HC stainless steel blades. It is 2-5/8\" long closed and weighs .7 oz. The Deuce has classic woodgrain handles with Buck's \"Classic Bolt\" logo and nickel silver bolsters, and as with all Buck Knives, comes with Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SMTZE0KZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.45}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0VXY", "title": "Buck 379BRS Solo Folding Pocket Knife", "description": "The Buck Solo pocketknife is ideal for detail work, piercing, and working in tight places. This compact knife features a 420J2 stainless-steel clip blade, along with a traditional wood-grain handle with Buck's \"Classic Bolt\" logo. Also outfitted with nickel silver bolsters, it's a great choice for daily use. As with all Buck knives, the Solo carries Buck's 4-Ever unconditional lifetime warranty.SpecificationsBlade material: 420J2 stainless steelHandle material: Wood grainBlade length: 2-1/4 inchesLength closed: 3 inchesWeight: 0.9 ounces", "text": "Buck 379BRS Solo Folding Pocket Knife The Buck Solo pocketknife is ideal for detail work, piercing, and working in tight places. This compact knife features a 420J2 stainless-steel clip blade, along with a traditional wood-grain handle with Buck's \"Classic Bolt\" logo. Also outfitted with nickel silver bolsters, it's a great choice for daily use. As with all Buck knives, the Solo carries Buck's 4-Ever unconditional lifetime warranty.SpecificationsBlade material: 420J2 stainless steelHandle material: Wood grainBlade length: 2-1/4 inchesLength closed: 3 inchesWeight: 0.9 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3110YGJESKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0VXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.66}}
{"item_id": "B000EI0W06", "title": "Buck 503 Prince Lockback Folding Knife", "description": "Buck 503 Prince is classically styled gentleman's slim-line pocket knife. It has a 2-1/2\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. The Prince is 3-3/8\" long closed and weighs 2 oz. It is a slim little knife with woodgrain handles and nickel silver bolsters, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 503 Prince Lockback Folding Knife Buck 503 Prince is classically styled gentleman's slim-line pocket knife. It has a 2-1/2\" drop point 420HC stainless steel blade. The Prince is 3-3/8\" long closed and weighs 2 oz. It is a slim little knife with woodgrain handles and nickel silver bolsters, and as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310JRQEY1HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EI0W06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 35.56}}
