{"item_id": "B000EIL9F8", "title": "YogaDirect Nylon Yoga Mat Bag", "description": "Nylon zippered yoga mat bag. These bags come in a variety of great colors, and are very comfortable to carry. Made of a lightweight material, including a netted mesh area, these bags allow your mat to breathe and dry. This bag has a zippered closure and a shoulder strap. If you have a sticky mat, you may have difficulty removing it from your bag. A mat bag that zips open will help you avoid any hassles packing and unpacking your mat. This yoga mat bag from yoga accessories and trade offers a loose fit for 1/8-Inch mats and a snug fit for 1/4-Inch mats that are a standard 24-Inch wide. For a slightly larger bag, or a bag that will easily hold a 1/4-Inch mat.", "text": "YogaDirect Nylon Yoga Mat Bag Nylon zippered yoga mat bag. These bags come in a variety of great colors, and are very comfortable to carry. Made of a lightweight material, including a netted mesh area, these bags allow your mat to breathe and dry. This bag has a zippered closure and a shoulder strap. If you have a sticky mat, you may have difficulty removing it from your bag. A mat bag that zips open will help you avoid any hassles packing and unpacking your mat. This yoga mat bag from yoga accessories and trade offers a loose fit for 1/8-Inch mats and a snug fit for 1/4-Inch mats that are a standard 24-Inch wide. For a slightly larger bag, or a bag that will easily hold a 1/4-Inch mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kNuhVVO1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EIL9F8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yoga Direct", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 11.99}}
