{"item_id": "B000ELQNYM", "title": "Allen Sports Deluxe 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "", "text": "Allen Sports Deluxe 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nbOcCMf2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELQNYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 87.05}}
{"item_id": "B000ELSSWW", "title": "Allen Sports Deluxe 3-Bike Spare Tire Mount Rack", "description": "Carry your bicycles as securely as possible and avoid the hassles of piled bikes or high-threshold rooftop mounts with the Allen 303DB deluxe three-bike spare-tire mount rack. Designed to fit nearly all externally mounted spare tires--including those with \"Over the Tire\" third brake lights--the Allen mount rack is both easy to operate and super secure for your bikes. The rack simply hooks over your spare tire, with a patented design that caries your bikes up high, where it's away from the road and the hot exhaust. The rack's patented tie-down system, meanwhile, individually secures and protects up to three bikes at once. As easy to install as it is to use, the rack sets up in seconds.About Allen Bike RacksIn 1967, after a few years of working on the aerospace technology for the Apollo missions, Dick Allen was out of a job. Government cutbacks led Allen, a Harvard-trained physicist, to transform his garage hobby into a new industry. A cycling enthusiast, inventor, and family man, Allen had a personal need for a bike-carrying device. On weekends, he would take his sons and wife to Cape Cod or the White Mountains of New Hampshire. What proved difficult time and again was the transport of his family's bicycles. Rather than fight through inconvenience with twine and a dinged car, Allen sought an answer for himself as well as a market in which he foresaw major growth possibilities.Always a pathfinder, Allen took to work in his Lincoln, Massachusetts garage in search of a more efficient way to transport bikes. Drafting designs during the day and constructing them throughout the night, he put together a model made of electrical conduit, metal strapping, and fire hose casings (for padding). At first, the Allens tested the prototype on weekend excursions. Finding the first trunk-mounted rack to be a success, Dick started Allen Bike Racks shortly afterward. Dealer acceptance came quickly, and by 1971 Allen Bike Racks were sold nationally through a number of major bicycle distributors. Today, the company owns over three dozen patents and offers a versatile product line of bike racks while Dick's son Alex now owns and operates the business. What started out as a small garage-run operation now operates three warehouses nationally, two factories abroad, and sells products in more than a dozen countries around the world.", "text": "Allen Sports Deluxe 3-Bike Spare Tire Mount Rack Carry your bicycles as securely as possible and avoid the hassles of piled bikes or high-threshold rooftop mounts with the Allen 303DB deluxe three-bike spare-tire mount rack. Designed to fit nearly all externally mounted spare tires--including those with \"Over the Tire\" third brake lights--the Allen mount rack is both easy to operate and super secure for your bikes. The rack simply hooks over your spare tire, with a patented design that caries your bikes up high, where it's away from the road and the hot exhaust. The rack's patented tie-down system, meanwhile, individually secures and protects up to three bikes at once. As easy to install as it is to use, the rack sets up in seconds.About Allen Bike RacksIn 1967, after a few years of working on the aerospace technology for the Apollo missions, Dick Allen was out of a job. Government cutbacks led Allen, a Harvard-trained physicist, to transform his garage hobby into a new industry. A cycling enthusiast, inventor, and family man, Allen had a personal need for a bike-carrying device. On weekends, he would take his sons and wife to Cape Cod or the White Mountains of New Hampshire. What proved difficult time and again was the transport of his family's bicycles. Rather than fight through inconvenience with twine and a dinged car, Allen sought an answer for himself as well as a market in which he foresaw major growth possibilities.Always a pathfinder, Allen took to work in his Lincoln, Massachusetts garage in search of a more efficient way to transport bikes. Drafting designs during the day and constructing them throughout the night, he put together a model made of electrical conduit, metal strapping, and fire hose casings (for padding). At first, the Allens tested the prototype on weekend excursions. Finding the first trunk-mounted rack to be a success, Dick started Allen Bike Racks shortly afterward. Dealer acceptance came quickly, and by 1971 Allen Bike Racks were sold nationally through a number of major bicycle distributors. Today, the company owns over three dozen patents and offers a versatile product line of bike racks while Dick's son Alex now owns and operates the business. What started out as a small garage-run operation now operates three warehouses nationally, two factories abroad, and sells products in more than a dozen countries around the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FnhhCa-zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELSSWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 67.31}}
{"item_id": "B000ELSSZE", "title": "Allen Sports Tension Bar Bicycle Cross-Bar Adaptor", "description": "Made by Allen Bike Racks, this adaptor bar adds a top tube to your bicycle frame so that it can be installed properly on a bicycle carrier. It's designed to be used with hard-to-mount bike frames, such as full-suspension bikes, women's bikes, or other non-conventional designs. The bar features an internal spring that maintains constant tension to keep your bike secure. The product is designed to fit bikes that have a distance of 16 inches to 27 inches between the seat post and the stem, and installation is easy. Plastic-coated hooks are there to protect the finish of your bike.Manufacturer's WarrantyAll of Allen's products are backed by a no-nonsense lifetime guarantee. If an Allen Rack fails to function properly due to a defect in workmanship or material over the lifetime of the original purchaser, simply return the product with your original receipt, and Allen will repair or replace the rack free of charge. This warranty does not cover damage or wear which occurs as a result of day-to-day use or general wear and tear.About Allen Sports USAAllen's goal is to design and manufacture the finest bicycle carrying, parking, and storage racks available. Ever since Dick Allen started making rear-mounted bicycle carriers in his garage in Lincoln, Massachusetts, in 1967, the company has been committed to producing the highest-quality, easiest-to-use racks on the market.", "text": "Allen Sports Tension Bar Bicycle Cross-Bar Adaptor Made by Allen Bike Racks, this adaptor bar adds a top tube to your bicycle frame so that it can be installed properly on a bicycle carrier. It's designed to be used with hard-to-mount bike frames, such as full-suspension bikes, women's bikes, or other non-conventional designs. The bar features an internal spring that maintains constant tension to keep your bike secure. The product is designed to fit bikes that have a distance of 16 inches to 27 inches between the seat post and the stem, and installation is easy. Plastic-coated hooks are there to protect the finish of your bike.Manufacturer's WarrantyAll of Allen's products are backed by a no-nonsense lifetime guarantee. If an Allen Rack fails to function properly due to a defect in workmanship or material over the lifetime of the original purchaser, simply return the product with your original receipt, and Allen will repair or replace the rack free of charge. This warranty does not cover damage or wear which occurs as a result of day-to-day use or general wear and tear.About Allen Sports USAAllen's goal is to design and manufacture the finest bicycle carrying, parking, and storage racks available. Ever since Dick Allen started making rear-mounted bicycle carriers in his garage in Lincoln, Massachusetts, in 1967, the company has been committed to producing the highest-quality, easiest-to-use racks on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f8YXpebtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELSSZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B000ELUXFC", "title": "Allen Sports Deluxe 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "No roof rack, no problem with the 102DB Deluxe Two Bike Carrier from Allen Racks. This simple, sturdy bike carrying system fits most sedans, hatchbacks, minivans, and SUVs via a single configuration design that eliminates setup hassles and headaches during installation. The rack comes fully assembled, and mounts to your vehicle in seconds. Twelve-inch long carry arms easily accommodate up to two bikes, and a patented individual tie-down system secures and protects your bicycles. Also includes a manufacturer's lifetime warranty on workmanship and materials.About Allen Bike RacksIn 1967, after a few years of working on the aerospace technology for the Apollo missions, Dick Allen was out of a job. Government cutbacks led Allen, a Harvard-trained physicist, to transform his garage hobby into a new industry. A cycling enthusiast, inventor, and family man, Allen had a personal need for a bike-carrying device. On weekends, he would take his sons and wife to Cape Cod or the White Mountains of New Hampshire. What proved difficult time and again was the transport of his family's bicycles. Rather than fight through inconvenience with twine and a dinged car, Allen sought an answer for himself as well as a market in which he foresaw major growth possibilities.Always a pathfinder, Allen took to work in his Lincoln, Massachusetts, garage in search of a more efficient way to transport bikes. Drafting designs during the day and constructing them throughout the night, he put together a model made of electrical conduit, metal strapping, and fire hose casings (for padding). At first, the Allens tested the prototype on weekend excursions. Finding the first trunk-mounted rack to be a success, Dick started Allen Bike Racks. Dealer acceptance came quickly, and by 1971 Allen Bike Racks were sold nationally through a number of major bicycle distributors. Today, the company owns more than three dozen patents and offers a versatile product line of bike racks while Dick's son Alex now owns and operates the business. What started out as a small garage run operation now operates three warehouses nationally, two factories abroad, and has products sold in more than a dozen countries around the world.", "text": "Allen Sports Deluxe 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack No roof rack, no problem with the 102DB Deluxe Two Bike Carrier from Allen Racks. This simple, sturdy bike carrying system fits most sedans, hatchbacks, minivans, and SUVs via a single configuration design that eliminates setup hassles and headaches during installation. The rack comes fully assembled, and mounts to your vehicle in seconds. Twelve-inch long carry arms easily accommodate up to two bikes, and a patented individual tie-down system secures and protects your bicycles. Also includes a manufacturer's lifetime warranty on workmanship and materials.About Allen Bike RacksIn 1967, after a few years of working on the aerospace technology for the Apollo missions, Dick Allen was out of a job. Government cutbacks led Allen, a Harvard-trained physicist, to transform his garage hobby into a new industry. A cycling enthusiast, inventor, and family man, Allen had a personal need for a bike-carrying device. On weekends, he would take his sons and wife to Cape Cod or the White Mountains of New Hampshire. What proved difficult time and again was the transport of his family's bicycles. Rather than fight through inconvenience with twine and a dinged car, Allen sought an answer for himself as well as a market in which he foresaw major growth possibilities.Always a pathfinder, Allen took to work in his Lincoln, Massachusetts, garage in search of a more efficient way to transport bikes. Drafting designs during the day and constructing them throughout the night, he put together a model made of electrical conduit, metal strapping, and fire hose casings (for padding). At first, the Allens tested the prototype on weekend excursions. Finding the first trunk-mounted rack to be a success, Dick started Allen Bike Racks. Dealer acceptance came quickly, and by 1971 Allen Bike Racks were sold nationally through a number of major bicycle distributors. Today, the company owns more than three dozen patents and offers a versatile product line of bike racks while Dick's son Alex now owns and operates the business. What started out as a small garage run operation now operates three warehouses nationally, two factories abroad, and has products sold in more than a dozen countries around the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XcVSoGZHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELUXFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWG4I", "title": "U.S. Divers Cozumel Seabreeze Dry Proflex II Mask, Fins and Snorkel Set", "description": "The U.S. Divers Adult snorkeling set combines a Cozumel Mask, Seabreeze Dry Snorkel and Proflex II Fins. The mask is a One-size fits all, Two-Window design. The snorkel has a Dry top to keep splashed water out. The fins are a contemporary designed, dual-composite for excellent power and styling.", "text": "U.S. Divers Cozumel Seabreeze Dry Proflex II Mask, Fins and Snorkel Set The U.S. Divers Adult snorkeling set combines a Cozumel Mask, Seabreeze Dry Snorkel and Proflex II Fins. The mask is a One-size fits all, Two-Window design. The snorkel has a Dry top to keep splashed water out. The fins are a contemporary designed, dual-composite for excellent power and styling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WY4MMM0XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWG4I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWG7K", "title": "U.S. Divers Proflex II Diving Fins", "description": "U.S. Divers offers a variety of fin styles to meet the needs of water sports enthusiasts whether they're diving, snorkeling, tube fishing, body surfing, or having fun in the pool, and the Twinflex scuba fin is among the best. The Twinflex is distinguished by its dual blade channels, which optimize the water flow and enhance the thrust of the diver. Users will also appreciate the TPR center flex zones, which cup the water efficiently to provide greater underwater power. The fins fit a variety of foot sizes and shapes with ease. U.S. Divers recommends wearing dive boots with the Twinflex fins, which come in M (6 to 9), L (9 to 11), and XL (11 to 13) sizes. The Twinflex is also backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "text": "U.S. Divers Proflex II Diving Fins U.S. Divers offers a variety of fin styles to meet the needs of water sports enthusiasts whether they're diving, snorkeling, tube fishing, body surfing, or having fun in the pool, and the Twinflex scuba fin is among the best. The Twinflex is distinguished by its dual blade channels, which optimize the water flow and enhance the thrust of the diver. Users will also appreciate the TPR center flex zones, which cup the water efficiently to provide greater underwater power. The fins fit a variety of foot sizes and shapes with ease. U.S. Divers recommends wearing dive boots with the Twinflex fins, which come in M (6 to 9), L (9 to 11), and XL (11 to 13) sizes. The Twinflex is also backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KM6H8VB7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWG7K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWG84", "title": "U.S. Divers Shredder Surf II Body Boarding and Body Surfing Fin", "description": "U.S. Divers offers a variety of fin styles to meet the needs of water sports enthusiasts whether they're diving, snorkeling, tube fishing, body surfing, or having fun in the pool, and the Shredder Surf II body boarding and body surfing fin is among the best. The Shredder Surf II--which is engineered to deliver power and speed while conserving energy--is distinguished by its dual-composite blade, which cups and channels the water efficiently. In addition, the fin is notably compact, making it excellent for not only body surfing and boarding, but also as a travel fin for snorkeling. And thanks to the adjustable foot strap, built-in leash system, and super-soft foot pocket, the fin fits comfortably regardless of your foot shape and won't float away after getting hit by a particularly big wave. The Shredder Surf II, which comes in metallic red, is available in S (4 to 7), M (7 to 10), and L/XL (10 to 13) sizes and is backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "text": "U.S. Divers Shredder Surf II Body Boarding and Body Surfing Fin U.S. Divers offers a variety of fin styles to meet the needs of water sports enthusiasts whether they're diving, snorkeling, tube fishing, body surfing, or having fun in the pool, and the Shredder Surf II body boarding and body surfing fin is among the best. The Shredder Surf II--which is engineered to deliver power and speed while conserving energy--is distinguished by its dual-composite blade, which cups and channels the water efficiently. In addition, the fin is notably compact, making it excellent for not only body surfing and boarding, but also as a travel fin for snorkeling. And thanks to the adjustable foot strap, built-in leash system, and super-soft foot pocket, the fin fits comfortably regardless of your foot shape and won't float away after getting hit by a particularly big wave. The Shredder Surf II, which comes in metallic red, is available in S (4 to 7), M (7 to 10), and L/XL (10 to 13) sizes and is backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XENVC0XXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWG84.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWG8Y", "title": "U.S. Divers Mercury Shorty Adult Wetsuit", "description": "This U.S. Divers' Mercury wetsuit--made of the highest-quality materials available--offers a superior combination of fit, performance, and style. The \"shorty\" suit is distinguished by its short-sleeve arms and legs and its titanium-blend 3 mm chest panels, which reflect heat back to the body to keep divers and surfers warm in cool currents. The suit also features 2 mm side panels and super-stretch panels under the arms, both of which give the wearer added flexibility whether twisting to the side or reaching upward. And thanks to the neoskin seals on the neck, legs, and wrists, the suit seals out water with aplomb. Other details include flat-lock stitching for extra comfort, a heavy-duty corrosion-free #10 YKK zipper on the back, and a pull chord with a double-tap hook and loop tie down to keep the suit fully sealed. Available in a variety of sizes (see table), the Mercury shorty suit is backed by a two-year limited warranty.Adult SizesSmallMediumMed/LargeLargeX-LargeXX-LargeWeight140-155150-165160- 180175-195190-220210-230Height5'6-5'85'8-5'105'9-6'5'11-6'16'-6'36'1- 6'4Chest35-36.536.5-3838.5-4040.5-42.542.5-4443.5-46Waist30-3131-3333-3535-3736-3938-42", "text": "U.S. Divers Mercury Shorty Adult Wetsuit This U.S. Divers' Mercury wetsuit--made of the highest-quality materials available--offers a superior combination of fit, performance, and style. The \"shorty\" suit is distinguished by its short-sleeve arms and legs and its titanium-blend 3 mm chest panels, which reflect heat back to the body to keep divers and surfers warm in cool currents. The suit also features 2 mm side panels and super-stretch panels under the arms, both of which give the wearer added flexibility whether twisting to the side or reaching upward. And thanks to the neoskin seals on the neck, legs, and wrists, the suit seals out water with aplomb. Other details include flat-lock stitching for extra comfort, a heavy-duty corrosion-free #10 YKK zipper on the back, and a pull chord with a double-tap hook and loop tie down to keep the suit fully sealed. Available in a variety of sizes (see table), the Mercury shorty suit is backed by a two-year limited warranty.Adult SizesSmallMediumMed/LargeLargeX-LargeXX-LargeWeight140-155150-165160- 180175-195190-220210-230Height5'6-5'85'8-5'105'9-6'5'11-6'16'-6'36'1- 6'4Chest35-36.536.5-3838.5-4040.5-42.542.5-4443.5-46Waist30-3131-3333-3535-3736-3938-42", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HJQQV364L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWG8Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]], "price": 80.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWGAW", "title": "U.S. Divers 5 mm Comfo High-Cut Snorkeling and Diving Boot", "description": "U.S. Divers pulls from its longtime diving heritage and expertise to produce the Comfo snorkeling and diving boot, a must for water enthusiasts who want to keep their feet feeling fine while wearing fins. Each high-cut boot features a 5 mm neoprene upper that's sturdy and comfortable enough to cushion the feet without feeling bulky. Users will also appreciate the vulcanized rubber sole, which is not only puncture-resistant but sports a rubber foxing around the sides for added durability. And thanks to the noncorrosive #10 zipper, it's easy to put on and remove the boots--no contorting or excessive pulling required. Available in adult sizes 5 to 13, the black Comfo high-cut diving boot carries a two-year limited warranty.", "text": "U.S. Divers 5 mm Comfo High-Cut Snorkeling and Diving Boot U.S. Divers pulls from its longtime diving heritage and expertise to produce the Comfo snorkeling and diving boot, a must for water enthusiasts who want to keep their feet feeling fine while wearing fins. Each high-cut boot features a 5 mm neoprene upper that's sturdy and comfortable enough to cushion the feet without feeling bulky. Users will also appreciate the vulcanized rubber sole, which is not only puncture-resistant but sports a rubber foxing around the sides for added durability. And thanks to the noncorrosive #10 zipper, it's easy to put on and remove the boots--no contorting or excessive pulling required. Available in adult sizes 5 to 13, the black Comfo high-cut diving boot carries a two-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dyJVzLimL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWGAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Surfing Booties"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWGC0", "title": "U.S. Divers Comfo Grip 3 mm Cold-Water Diving Gloves", "description": "U.S. Divers pulls from its longtime diving heritage and expertise to produce the Comfo Grip cold-water diving gloves, a must for divers who want to stay safe while exploring the Pacific and other chilly bodies. The gloves are distinguished by their 3 mm neoprene construction, which provides extra warmth when water temperatures dip. The gloves are also pre-curved to minimize fatigue. And thanks to the rubberized palm closure, wearers will enjoy a secure grip when holding underwater lights, cameras, and other diving accessories. Other details include a secure hook-and-loop closure and a sleek black appearance. Available in S, M, L, and XL sizes, the gloves are backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "text": "U.S. Divers Comfo Grip 3 mm Cold-Water Diving Gloves U.S. Divers pulls from its longtime diving heritage and expertise to produce the Comfo Grip cold-water diving gloves, a must for divers who want to stay safe while exploring the Pacific and other chilly bodies. The gloves are distinguished by their 3 mm neoprene construction, which provides extra warmth when water temperatures dip. The gloves are also pre-curved to minimize fatigue. And thanks to the rubberized palm closure, wearers will enjoy a secure grip when holding underwater lights, cameras, and other diving accessories. Other details include a secure hook-and-loop closure and a sleek black appearance. Available in S, M, L, and XL sizes, the gloves are backed by a two-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H1QS03D2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWGC0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ELWGD4", "title": "U.S. Divers Mariner Diving Gear Bag", "description": "U.S. Divers offers a variety of professional-quality travel bags--from handheld bags to duffels with shoulder straps--to enhance your snorkeling and diving adventures. The Mariner bag, one of the most versatile in the collection, is distinguished by its heavy-duty PVC-coated mesh material that's ventilated to let air in and water out. Users will also dig the inside dry pocket, which protects everything from a change of clothes to important valuables as water sloshes about. And thanks to the D-ring attachment and carrying strap, the Mariner is a breeze to tote from the car to the boat. Measuring 26-1/2 by 13 by 13 inches (W x H x D), the blue and black bag is covered by a two-year limited warranty.", "text": "U.S. Divers Mariner Diving Gear Bag U.S. Divers offers a variety of professional-quality travel bags--from handheld bags to duffels with shoulder straps--to enhance your snorkeling and diving adventures. The Mariner bag, one of the most versatile in the collection, is distinguished by its heavy-duty PVC-coated mesh material that's ventilated to let air in and water out. Users will also dig the inside dry pocket, which protects everything from a change of clothes to important valuables as water sloshes about. And thanks to the D-ring attachment and carrying strap, the Mariner is a breeze to tote from the car to the boat. Measuring 26-1/2 by 13 by 13 inches (W x H x D), the blue and black bag is covered by a two-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AZPSPAJKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELWGD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Divers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Backpacks"]], "price": 25.02}}
{"item_id": "B000ELYHRW", "title": "U.S. Divers Mercury Full Adult Wetsuit (Small)", "description": "3mm chest panels with 2mm side panels, Super stretch panels for greater flexibility", "text": "U.S. Divers Mercury Full Adult Wetsuit (Small) 3mm chest panels with 2mm side panels, Super stretch panels for greater flexibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W11zq9WtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ELYHRW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000EM3CYA", "title": "Planet Bike Hardcore Hybrid Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Stainless Steel Hardware & Mud Flaps (45mm Wide)", "description": "The product is Planet Bike Hardcore Hybrid Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Stainless Steel Hardware & Mud Flaps (45mm Wide)", "text": "Planet Bike Hardcore Hybrid Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Stainless Steel Hardware & Mud Flaps (45mm Wide) The product is Planet Bike Hardcore Hybrid Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Stainless Steel Hardware & Mud Flaps (45mm Wide)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BT08O9ETL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EM3CYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENMLFK", "title": "Slime Smart Tube Schrader Valve Bicycle Tube (26 x 1.75-2.125)", "description": "Slime Smart Tubes come pre-loaded with SLiME Tire Sealant. Once installed the Smart tube will work continuously and instantly seal most punctures in the tread up to 1/8\". SliME sealant is non-flammable, non-toxic and water soluble.", "text": "Slime Smart Tube Schrader Valve Bicycle Tube (26 x 1.75-2.125) Slime Smart Tubes come pre-loaded with SLiME Tire Sealant. Once installed the Smart tube will work continuously and instantly seal most punctures in the tread up to 1/8\". SliME sealant is non-flammable, non-toxic and water soluble.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513pCTgHTsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENMLFK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 6.98}}
{"item_id": "B000ENMN4E", "title": "Aqua Sphere Seal Swim Mask", "description": "The best-fitting swim goggle on the market, the Aqua Sphere Seal swim mask was first celebrated by Ironman triathletes, who praised its comfortable, watertight fit and easy-to-adjust buckles. However, these high-quality features soon became apparent to fitness and recreational swimmers as well, who use the goggles for swimming, jet skiing, surfing, and more. The Seal mask sports a dive-quality silicone skirt that's snug and secure, along with a patented curved lens that provides 180-degree peripheral vision without distortion. In addition, the Plexisol lens is protected by anti-scratch coating on the outside and an anti-fog coating on the inside, so you can easily see other swimmers in the water ahead. Finally, the mask is guaranteed to block 100 percent of the sun's harmful UV rays. Add the features together and you have a mask that lets you concentrate on your workout and not your equipment.The Seal mask is available with two lens types: clear lenses, which are designed to provide the greatest visibility while swimming indoors or in low-light conditions, and tinted lenses, which are better when swimming outdoors or in bright light.About Aqua SphereEstablished in the mid-'90s, Aqua Sphere has done more than any other company to improve the world of eye protection for swimmers. Aqua Sphere has been responsible for such products as Seal, the first swim mask featuring 180-degree vision, and Kaiman, the first panoramic goggle. Based in Vista, California, all Aqua Sphere eyewear is made exclusively at the company's facility in Genoa, Italy.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Seal Swim Mask The best-fitting swim goggle on the market, the Aqua Sphere Seal swim mask was first celebrated by Ironman triathletes, who praised its comfortable, watertight fit and easy-to-adjust buckles. However, these high-quality features soon became apparent to fitness and recreational swimmers as well, who use the goggles for swimming, jet skiing, surfing, and more. The Seal mask sports a dive-quality silicone skirt that's snug and secure, along with a patented curved lens that provides 180-degree peripheral vision without distortion. In addition, the Plexisol lens is protected by anti-scratch coating on the outside and an anti-fog coating on the inside, so you can easily see other swimmers in the water ahead. Finally, the mask is guaranteed to block 100 percent of the sun's harmful UV rays. Add the features together and you have a mask that lets you concentrate on your workout and not your equipment.The Seal mask is available with two lens types: clear lenses, which are designed to provide the greatest visibility while swimming indoors or in low-light conditions, and tinted lenses, which are better when swimming outdoors or in bright light.About Aqua SphereEstablished in the mid-'90s, Aqua Sphere has done more than any other company to improve the world of eye protection for swimmers. Aqua Sphere has been responsible for such products as Seal, the first swim mask featuring 180-degree vision, and Kaiman, the first panoramic goggle. Based in Vista, California, all Aqua Sphere eyewear is made exclusively at the company's facility in Genoa, Italy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VTH0JMZ9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENMN4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 37.98}}
{"item_id": "B000ENMN76", "title": "Aqua Sphere Kaiman Swim Goggle", "description": "The Aqua Sphere Kaiman swim goggle offers 180-degree, wide-angle vision technology in a two-piece competitive-style swimming goggle. Featuring an anatomic profile with a watertight seal, this goggle is constructed of soft, comfortable, and hypoallergenic Softeril material. The strap offers quick and easy adjustment with a split back for more stable support and a firmer seal. The Kaiman also provides 100% UVA and UVB protection and features a scratch-resistant and anti-fog coating. The goggle is available in two sizes: large for adults and small for smaller faces and kids.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Kaiman Swim Goggle The Aqua Sphere Kaiman swim goggle offers 180-degree, wide-angle vision technology in a two-piece competitive-style swimming goggle. Featuring an anatomic profile with a watertight seal, this goggle is constructed of soft, comfortable, and hypoallergenic Softeril material. The strap offers quick and easy adjustment with a split back for more stable support and a firmer seal. The Kaiman also provides 100% UVA and UVB protection and features a scratch-resistant and anti-fog coating. The goggle is available in two sizes: large for adults and small for smaller faces and kids.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XS219JJVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENMN76.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENMNAI", "title": "Aqua Sphere Zip Fitness Swim Fins", "description": "Cutting edge fin technology and split blades increase swimming speeds for a more intense workout.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Zip Fitness Swim Fins Cutting edge fin technology and split blades increase swimming speeds for a more intense workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BKZXN4SZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENMNAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENMNCQ", "title": "Aqua Sphere Aqua Glide Silicone Swim Cap", "description": "You've never tried a swim cap like this before! Specially designed for added comfort and utility, the Aqua Sphere swim cap features ergonomic ear pockets that add comfort and help to prevent the swim cap from slipping off.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Aqua Glide Silicone Swim Cap You've never tried a swim cap like this before! Specially designed for added comfort and utility, the Aqua Sphere swim cap features ergonomic ear pockets that add comfort and help to prevent the swim cap from slipping off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XY55858WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENMNCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENOPO0", "title": "Slime Tube Sealant", "description": "Permanently seals tube punctures up to 1/8 inch. Non toxic formula installs easily through schader valves. Complete with valve core remover and filler tube. Slime keg fills 160 tires at 1/2 the price per ounce of the 16 oz size.", "text": "Slime Tube Sealant Permanently seals tube punctures up to 1/8 inch. Non toxic formula installs easily through schader valves. Complete with valve core remover and filler tube. Slime keg fills 160 tires at 1/2 the price per ounce of the 16 oz size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GNiVJaHhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENOPO0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENOPOA", "title": "Slime Smart Tube", "description": "All Slime Smart Tubes are factory-filled with a precise volume of SLiME Tube Sealant.Ride without worries. Smart Tubes instantly seek out and seal punctures as they occur, preventing flats, repeatedly and continuously for up to two years", "text": "Slime Smart Tube All Slime Smart Tubes are factory-filled with a precise volume of SLiME Tube Sealant.Ride without worries. Smart Tubes instantly seek out and seal punctures as they occur, preventing flats, repeatedly and continuously for up to two years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51prvLd8wgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENOPOA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ENOPOK", "title": "Slime Lite Tube Presta Valve Bicycle Tube (700c x 19-25mm)", "description": "The SLiME Lite Tube combines a lightweight butyl tube with a revolutionary breakthrough in sealant technology that prevents punctures up to 1/8\" (3mm). This feather-weight tube with \"SliME Lite\" sealant weighs the same or less than standard tubes.", "text": "Slime Lite Tube Presta Valve Bicycle Tube (700c x 19-25mm) The SLiME Lite Tube combines a lightweight butyl tube with a revolutionary breakthrough in sealant technology that prevents punctures up to 1/8\" (3mm). This feather-weight tube with \"SliME Lite\" sealant weighs the same or less than standard tubes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nGNZTQpSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENOPOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 4.49}}
{"item_id": "B000ENOPOU", "title": "Slime SKABS Patch Kit w/Tire Levers", "description": "Pffftt. Bummer you just got a flat, but sweet that you packed the Slime SKABS Patch Kit w/Tire Levers into your back pocket. Stop, pull the tire off with the levers, scuff the puncture spot, peel and stick the patch, get the tire on, pump it up, put the wheel back ondone.Product FeaturesMaterial:Recommended Use: Patching your tubesManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Slime SKABS Patch Kit w/Tire Levers Pffftt. Bummer you just got a flat, but sweet that you packed the Slime SKABS Patch Kit w/Tire Levers into your back pocket. Stop, pull the tire off with the levers, scuff the puncture spot, peel and stick the patch, get the tire on, pump it up, put the wheel back ondone.Product FeaturesMaterial:Recommended Use: Patching your tubesManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PPB2VDHXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENOPOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 4.85}}
