{"item_id": "B000ENORIO", "title": "Aqua Sphere Seal XP Swim Mask", "description": "Aqua Sphere's Seal XP is a hybrid goggle that combines superior visibility and exceptional comfort with a low profile design. It has a flexible, one-piece frame and comfortable, watertight skirt that provides for hours of swimming and water sports enjoyment. The low profile, wrap-around design of the Seal XP creates less drag, has greater hydrodynamics, and is ideal for fitness swimming or training. The unique Plexisol lens provides 100% UV protection and is fog and scratch resistant. The innovative easy-adjust buckle system of the Seal XP also allows for quick and easy adjustments, even while wearing the mask. A molded protective case is included.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Seal XP Swim Mask Aqua Sphere's Seal XP is a hybrid goggle that combines superior visibility and exceptional comfort with a low profile design. It has a flexible, one-piece frame and comfortable, watertight skirt that provides for hours of swimming and water sports enjoyment. The low profile, wrap-around design of the Seal XP creates less drag, has greater hydrodynamics, and is ideal for fitness swimming or training. The unique Plexisol lens provides 100% UV protection and is fog and scratch resistant. The innovative easy-adjust buckle system of the Seal XP also allows for quick and easy adjustments, even while wearing the mask. A molded protective case is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411APN620SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENORIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B000ENOROS", "title": "Aqua Sphere Sphera Swim Mask", "description": "Sphera mask is the same great fitting goggle as our Seal mask, but with a nose pocket. Features curve lens & full silicone skirt. A very low profile mask", "text": "Aqua Sphere Sphera Swim Mask Sphera mask is the same great fitting goggle as our Seal mask, but with a nose pocket. Features curve lens & full silicone skirt. A very low profile mask", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PCHP5Q6XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENOROS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 48.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ENQRCI", "title": "Slime 26\" SV Thorn Resistant Thick Smart tube 26 x 1.75-2.125 (Schrader Valve)", "description": "Slime thick smart tubes. Factory-filled with a precise volume of Slime tube sealant. Seals punctures up to 1/8-Inch (3-Millimeter). Environmentally safe, non-toxic, non-hazardous and water soluble.", "text": "Slime 26\" SV Thorn Resistant Thick Smart tube 26 x 1.75-2.125 (Schrader Valve) Slime thick smart tubes. Factory-filled with a precise volume of Slime tube sealant. Seals punctures up to 1/8-Inch (3-Millimeter). Environmentally safe, non-toxic, non-hazardous and water soluble.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Uxhm7HB6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENQRCI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B000ENQRD2", "title": "Slime COMP02 12-Volt Tire Inflator", "description": "Slime is the name brand people know and trust for flat tire prevention and repair. Keep a Slime tire inflator in every vehicle and be prepared to inflate a low tire anytime. There's no need to pull over and find a service station, just reach for a Slime tire inflator, pump up the tire and go.", "text": "Slime COMP02 12-Volt Tire Inflator Slime is the name brand people know and trust for flat tire prevention and repair. Keep a Slime tire inflator in every vehicle and be prepared to inflate a low tire anytime. There's no need to pull over and find a service station, just reach for a Slime tire inflator, pump up the tire and go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8uGv6Q5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ENQRD2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 20.99}}
