{"item_id": "B000EYY41S", "title": "Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment", "description": "Time to get the lead out? Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment... VALUE PRICE! Quality sinkers to keep your lures doing their thing! Easy-on split shot style; Assorted weights for the perfect set up; Handy case keeps everything organized. State Size. Order Today! Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment", "text": "Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment Time to get the lead out? Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment... VALUE PRICE! Quality sinkers to keep your lures doing their thing! Easy-on split shot style; Assorted weights for the perfect set up; Handy case keeps everything organized. State Size. Order Today! Eagle Claw Split Shot Sinker Assortment", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IwzD7uaxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EYY41S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Sinkers & Weights", "Sinkers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000EYYPPI", "title": "Frabill Flow Troll Bait Container, 6-Quart, Yellow/White", "description": "The Frabill Flow Troll 6 quart live bait container features a self-closing lid with locking door and handle. The Hydrodynamic shape allows for easy flow through in water. The original and still America's number one selling minnow bucket. Designed to be pulled behind the boat or used when wading. Hydrodynamic shape features balanced keep to keep bucket floating with bait door facing up. Constantly aerates bait as it is pulled through the water.", "text": "Frabill Flow Troll Bait Container, 6-Quart, Yellow/White The Frabill Flow Troll 6 quart live bait container features a self-closing lid with locking door and handle. The Hydrodynamic shape allows for easy flow through in water. The original and still America's number one selling minnow bucket. Designed to be pulled behind the boat or used when wading. Hydrodynamic shape features balanced keep to keep bucket floating with bait door facing up. Constantly aerates bait as it is pulled through the water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bIrsGMtxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EYYPPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frabill", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing"]], "price": 6.79}}
{"item_id": "B000EZ0ELQ", "title": "Plano 23731-01 Stowaway Deep Open Compartment", "description": "Plano originated the often-copied ProLatch Locking system. The Prolatch is a separate latching system that ensures a tight, secure closure everytime.", "text": "Plano 23731-01 Stowaway Deep Open Compartment Plano originated the often-copied ProLatch Locking system. The Prolatch is a separate latching system that ensures a tight, secure closure everytime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bryz5K6jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EZ0ELQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 12.17}}
{"item_id": "B000EZWPM2", "title": "Century Wavemaster XXL Training Bag", "description": "Century's ultimate training bag, the Wavemaster XXL offers the largest kicking and punching surface on the market. The Wavemaster XXL stands 69 inches tall and measures a full 18 inches in diameter, giving you plenty of space to practice your martial arts technique. The striking surface is also high quality, with a durable vinyl cover sitting atop high-density foam. And thanks the low-profile base and ultra-stable weight distribution, this bag will hold up sturdily to your training routines. Built with an extra-large fill hole that accommodates either sand or water, the Wavemaster XXL weighs roughly 270 pounds when filled and assembles tool-free.About CenturyCentury began producing martial arts products in 1976, and today is recognized as the largest supplier of martial arts gear in the world. Currently located in Midwest City, Oklahoma, has expanded its product lines over the past 30 years to encompass boxing, media, yoga, and fitness products. The company employs a diversified group of professionals--many of whom are martial artists themselves--with the goal of helping every customer learn how martial arts can profoundly change lives.", "text": "Century Wavemaster XXL Training Bag Century's ultimate training bag, the Wavemaster XXL offers the largest kicking and punching surface on the market. The Wavemaster XXL stands 69 inches tall and measures a full 18 inches in diameter, giving you plenty of space to practice your martial arts technique. The striking surface is also high quality, with a durable vinyl cover sitting atop high-density foam. And thanks the low-profile base and ultra-stable weight distribution, this bag will hold up sturdily to your training routines. Built with an extra-large fill hole that accommodates either sand or water, the Wavemaster XXL weighs roughly 270 pounds when filled and assembles tool-free.About CenturyCentury began producing martial arts products in 1976, and today is recognized as the largest supplier of martial arts gear in the world. Currently located in Midwest City, Oklahoma, has expanded its product lines over the past 30 years to encompass boxing, media, yoga, and fitness products. The company employs a diversified group of professionals--many of whom are martial artists themselves--with the goal of helping every customer learn how martial arts can profoundly change lives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-pA%2BE9M5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000EZWPM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Pedestal Bags"]], "price": 234.99}}
