{"item_id": "B000F1RBOW", "title": "MSR Alpine 1-Liter Teapot", "description": "Fill the MSR Alpine Teapot and boil a liter of water for tea, instant oatmeal, or a freeze-dried dinner. This 9-ounce teapot's low-profile spout and fold-down wire handles make for easy packing. The Alpine Teapot's lid stays put so you don't end up with dry oatmeal and an over-cooked crotch, and the wide mouth makes it easy to clean.", "text": "MSR Alpine 1-Liter Teapot Fill the MSR Alpine Teapot and boil a liter of water for tea, instant oatmeal, or a freeze-dried dinner. This 9-ounce teapot's low-profile spout and fold-down wire handles make for easy packing. The Alpine Teapot's lid stays put so you don't end up with dry oatmeal and an over-cooked crotch, and the wide mouth makes it easy to clean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5160ZCIxOqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F1RBOW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 24.98}}
