{"item_id": "B000F4W1XU", "title": "Pachmayr Slip On Recoil Pad", "description": "No Gunsmithing required! Pachmayr’s Decelerator recoil pads provide the ultimate in recoil control and appearance and now you can install them on all your long guns. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting experience, and maybe help you bag more game. Features: - Easy “Do-It-Yourself” installation - Replaces hard factory pads - Custom “pre-ground” fit Size Large fits: Stock dimensions of 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" wide x 5-3/16\" to 5-7/16\" long, or will fit the following: Beretaa: 686, 687 Field models, 302, 303 Semi-Auto Browning: Citori with English Stock", "text": "Pachmayr Slip On Recoil Pad No Gunsmithing required! Pachmayr’s Decelerator recoil pads provide the ultimate in recoil control and appearance and now you can install them on all your long guns. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting experience, and maybe help you bag more game. Features: - Easy “Do-It-Yourself” installation - Replaces hard factory pads - Custom “pre-ground” fit Size Large fits: Stock dimensions of 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" wide x 5-3/16\" to 5-7/16\" long, or will fit the following: Beretaa: 686, 687 Field models, 302, 303 Semi-Auto Browning: Citori with English Stock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nn3X7T%2BcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F4W1XU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000F54G1O", "title": "InTech Shag Bag (Red)", "description": "Reduce the strain on your back while golfing with the InTech shag bag. Rather than requiring you to reach into the cup to pick up your ball, the shag bag does it for you, with a hook that grabs extra balls and a sleeve that holds them. Once you've picked up the balls, you can easily deposit them in your golf bag. Lightweight and durable, the red shag bag carries a one-year warranty.", "text": "InTech Shag Bag (Red) Reduce the strain on your back while golfing with the InTech shag bag. Rather than requiring you to reach into the cup to pick up your ball, the shag bag does it for you, with a hook that grabs extra balls and a sleeve that holds them. Once you've picked up the balls, you can easily deposit them in your golf bag. Lightweight and durable, the red shag bag carries a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318PTE3TMSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F54G1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Ball Retrievers"]], "price": 23.46}}
{"item_id": "B000F5EFOC", "title": "Shimano SL-BS64 Ultegra Bar End Shifter Set (8-Speed)", "description": "Shimano SL-BS64-8 eight speed double/triple bar end shifters. Friction compatible right lever. This shifter is not compatible with 8-speed Dura Ace, packaging calls out Dura Ace but the shifter itself is Ultegra.", "text": "Shimano SL-BS64 Ultegra Bar End Shifter Set (8-Speed) Shimano SL-BS64-8 eight speed double/triple bar end shifters. Friction compatible right lever. This shifter is not compatible with 8-speed Dura Ace, packaging calls out Dura Ace but the shifter itself is Ultegra.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21v4JGOMGiL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5EFOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Shifters"]], "price": 77.99}}
{"item_id": "B000F5EG50", "title": "Shimano PD-M424 SPD Pedal (9/16-Inch, Black/Silver)", "description": "Shimano's recessed cleat and clipless pedal technology, called SPD, revolutionized the cycling shoe/pedal interface. Since then, decades of legendary \"in the dirt\" dependability, reliability, and sheer endurance have made SPD the world's go-to pedal technology. Shimano's PD-M424 clipless pedals continue the SPD tradition. Each pedal is designed for easy clip-in and extra stability, with a spring-loaded platform that automatically position the pedal at the perfect angle for clipping in. All the rider has to do is put a foot on the pedal and push down. The intuitive operation makes this pedal particularly well suited to city riders that need to clip in and out at a moment's notice, along with aggressive mountain bike riders tackling technical terrain. The platform also offers greater stability than other pedals, and can be ridden without special shoes for impromptu jaunts to the grocery store. The pedals come with a single pair of two-bolt SPD cleats.SpecificationsPedal system: SPDSPD cleat surfaces: Both surfacesSpindle material: ChromolySpindle thread: BC 9/16 inches x 20 TPICartridge spindle: YesCleat retention indicator: YesCleat retention adjuster: YesPedal body material: Aluminum/barrel finishCage material: AluminumAverage weight: 1.04 pounds (pair)About ShimanoIn 1961, a three-speed bicycle hub was displayed at the New York Toy Show. The hub--an affordable and reliable version of the multi-speed hubs growing in popularity at the time--caught the attention of the industry. So much so that by 1965, Yoshizo Shimano--the youngest son of the company founder in Japan--opened an office in New York. Shimano's goal was to get quicker product feedback and to provide technical and warranty assistance to retailers selling bikes equipped with Shimano parts. Though Shimano American has grown from that first modest office staffed by only three people to a full distribution center with sales and marketing offices, its goals are the same: listen to customers and meet their needs for both bicycle and fishing products.", "text": "Shimano PD-M424 SPD Pedal (9/16-Inch, Black/Silver) Shimano's recessed cleat and clipless pedal technology, called SPD, revolutionized the cycling shoe/pedal interface. Since then, decades of legendary \"in the dirt\" dependability, reliability, and sheer endurance have made SPD the world's go-to pedal technology. Shimano's PD-M424 clipless pedals continue the SPD tradition. Each pedal is designed for easy clip-in and extra stability, with a spring-loaded platform that automatically position the pedal at the perfect angle for clipping in. All the rider has to do is put a foot on the pedal and push down. The intuitive operation makes this pedal particularly well suited to city riders that need to clip in and out at a moment's notice, along with aggressive mountain bike riders tackling technical terrain. The platform also offers greater stability than other pedals, and can be ridden without special shoes for impromptu jaunts to the grocery store. The pedals come with a single pair of two-bolt SPD cleats.SpecificationsPedal system: SPDSPD cleat surfaces: Both surfacesSpindle material: ChromolySpindle thread: BC 9/16 inches x 20 TPICartridge spindle: YesCleat retention indicator: YesCleat retention adjuster: YesPedal body material: Aluminum/barrel finishCage material: AluminumAverage weight: 1.04 pounds (pair)About ShimanoIn 1961, a three-speed bicycle hub was displayed at the New York Toy Show. The hub--an affordable and reliable version of the multi-speed hubs growing in popularity at the time--caught the attention of the industry. So much so that by 1965, Yoshizo Shimano--the youngest son of the company founder in Japan--opened an office in New York. Shimano's goal was to get quicker product feedback and to provide technical and warranty assistance to retailers selling bikes equipped with Shimano parts. Though Shimano American has grown from that first modest office staffed by only three people to a full distribution center with sales and marketing offices, its goals are the same: listen to customers and meet their needs for both bicycle and fishing products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BbsveNsmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5EG50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 38.79}}
{"item_id": "B000F5EGAA", "title": "Shimano Acera", "description": "Shimano Acera Rear Derallieurs.", "text": "Shimano Acera Shimano Acera Rear Derallieurs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pY8gV7LLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5EGAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Rear Derailleurs"]], "price": 24.89}}
{"item_id": "B000F5HXFA", "title": "Shimano SL-BS77 Dura Ace Double/Triple Bar End Shifters (9-Speed)", "description": "", "text": "Shimano SL-BS77 Dura Ace Double/Triple Bar End Shifters (9-Speed)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EwavQgeRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5HXFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Shifters"]], "price": 92.95}}
{"item_id": "B000F5II4U", "title": "MLB '47 Brand Clean Up Home Style Adjustable Cap", "description": "47 Brand provides the quality all true fans desire in their gear. Known for their vintage look and feel, '47 has managed to also provide a new school spin to this old school craze. Featuring tight, crisp stitching, relaxed fit and adjustable they are available for all of your favorite teams. '47 Brand's present-day success comes from never forgetting its roots. In 1947, twin brothers and Italian immigrants, Arthur and Henry D'Angelo founded Twins Enterprises, now '47 Brand. The D'Angelos sold pennants and other sports memorabilia on the streets around Fenway Park and through a combination of hard work, sound instincts and incredible passion, the brothers were able to grow their business from a single street cart to a premier sports lifestyle brand that uniquely melds sport and style. '47 Brand produces a unique mix of the finest headwear and apparel with an unparalleled attention to detail, which has helped established them as a premium global sports lifestyle brand. '47 Brand is proud to be an officially licensed partner with the four key professional American sports leagues -- MLB, NFL, NBA, NHL -- as well as over 650 colleges.", "text": "MLB '47 Brand Clean Up Home Style Adjustable Cap 47 Brand provides the quality all true fans desire in their gear. Known for their vintage look and feel, '47 has managed to also provide a new school spin to this old school craze. Featuring tight, crisp stitching, relaxed fit and adjustable they are available for all of your favorite teams. '47 Brand's present-day success comes from never forgetting its roots. In 1947, twin brothers and Italian immigrants, Arthur and Henry D'Angelo founded Twins Enterprises, now '47 Brand. The D'Angelos sold pennants and other sports memorabilia on the streets around Fenway Park and through a combination of hard work, sound instincts and incredible passion, the brothers were able to grow their business from a single street cart to a premier sports lifestyle brand that uniquely melds sport and style. '47 Brand produces a unique mix of the finest headwear and apparel with an unparalleled attention to detail, which has helped established them as a premium global sports lifestyle brand. '47 Brand is proud to be an officially licensed partner with the four key professional American sports leagues -- MLB, NFL, NBA, NHL -- as well as over 650 colleges.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yzfJXs5yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5II4U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "&#39;47 Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing Accessories", "Caps & Hats", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B000F5JOPM", "title": "Shimano BB-UN26 Square taper Bottom Bracket", "description": "Shimano UN26 bottom bracket features a plastic left hand cup. Sealed bearings and high quality spindle make it last for years and it's maintenance free.", "text": "Shimano BB-UN26 Square taper Bottom Bracket Shimano UN26 bottom bracket features a plastic left hand cup. Sealed bearings and high quality spindle make it last for years and it's maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fKrno1CAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5JOPM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Bottom Brackets"]]}}
