{"item_id": "B000F5K9M4", "title": "Bowflex 410-Pound Rod Upgrade", "description": "Bowflex 410 lb. Rod Upgrade allows an upgrade select Bowflex Gyms from 310 to 410 lbs. Designed for use on the Bowflex Ultimate/Ultimate 2, Bowflex Motivator, Bowflex Xtreme/Xtreme 2, Bowflex Sport, Bowflex Blaze and Bowflex Power Pro. Prior upgrade from 210 to 310 lbs. is required for Bowflex Motivator, Bowflex Xtreme/Xtreme 2, Bowflex Blaze, and Bowflex Sport models.", "text": "Bowflex 410-Pound Rod Upgrade Bowflex 410 lb. Rod Upgrade allows an upgrade select Bowflex Gyms from 310 to 410 lbs. Designed for use on the Bowflex Ultimate/Ultimate 2, Bowflex Motivator, Bowflex Xtreme/Xtreme 2, Bowflex Sport, Bowflex Blaze and Bowflex Power Pro. Prior upgrade from 210 to 310 lbs. is required for Bowflex Motivator, Bowflex Xtreme/Xtreme 2, Bowflex Blaze, and Bowflex Sport models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412FPW0WRDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5K9M4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 85.1}}
