{"item_id": "B000F5NL0Q", "title": "Bowflex 310-Pound Rod Upgrade", "description": "Have you maxed out the weight on your Bowflex Power Rod home gym? Enter the Bowflex rod upgrade, which includes two 50-pound rod attachments that increase the total resistance to 310 pounds. Precisely manufactured under the strictest quality-control measures, the rod upgrade is compatible with the Bowflex Power Pro, Motivator, Xtreme, Xtreme 2, Sport, and Blaze series models. Note: the upgrade does not support the Ultimate or Motivator 2 models. As with all Bowflex rod upgrades, the 310-pound version carries a lifetime warranty.", "text": "Bowflex 310-Pound Rod Upgrade Have you maxed out the weight on your Bowflex Power Rod home gym? Enter the Bowflex rod upgrade, which includes two 50-pound rod attachments that increase the total resistance to 310 pounds. Precisely manufactured under the strictest quality-control measures, the rod upgrade is compatible with the Bowflex Power Pro, Motivator, Xtreme, Xtreme 2, Sport, and Blaze series models. Note: the upgrade does not support the Ultimate or Motivator 2 models. As with all Bowflex rod upgrades, the 310-pound version carries a lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z72JGCQ2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5NL0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 81.55}}
{"item_id": "B000F5NNAY", "title": "32oz Traveler", "description": "Our 32oz Travelers are made of durable, puncture resistant, odor proof and taste proof clear polyester, they stand up when filled and are flat and can be rolled up and put in your pack when empty (no bulky containers to pack out). The Flasks have positive seal spouts and can be frozen or heated as the circumstances require. They are perfect for any non-carbonated liquid, making them ideal for Hunting, Camping & Hiking.", "text": "32oz Traveler Our 32oz Travelers are made of durable, puncture resistant, odor proof and taste proof clear polyester, they stand up when filled and are flat and can be rolled up and put in your pack when empty (no bulky containers to pack out). The Flasks have positive seal spouts and can be frozen or heated as the circumstances require. They are perfect for any non-carbonated liquid, making them ideal for Hunting, Camping & Hiking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414G8Q2PXHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5NNAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rum Runner", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 4.55}}
{"item_id": "B000F5OCEA", "title": "Rum Runner Flask Kit", "description": "Each kit contains two 8oz and one 16oz reusable, easy filling, heavy duty, collapsible flasks and one funnel. Flasks are made of durable, puncture resistant, odor proof and taste proof clear polyester. The 8oz Flasks are designed to fit right in your pocket. Rum Runner Flasks stand up when filled and are flat and can be rolled up and put in your pocket when empty. The Flasks have positive seal spouts are freezable and perfect for any non-carbonated beverage. The Rum Runner FlasksTM are non-metallic, undetectable and ideal for concerts, stadium events, sports fans, air travelers, golfers, hikers, hunters and skiers.", "text": "Rum Runner Flask Kit Each kit contains two 8oz and one 16oz reusable, easy filling, heavy duty, collapsible flasks and one funnel. Flasks are made of durable, puncture resistant, odor proof and taste proof clear polyester. The 8oz Flasks are designed to fit right in your pocket. Rum Runner Flasks stand up when filled and are flat and can be rolled up and put in your pocket when empty. The Flasks have positive seal spouts are freezable and perfect for any non-carbonated beverage. The Rum Runner FlasksTM are non-metallic, undetectable and ideal for concerts, stadium events, sports fans, air travelers, golfers, hikers, hunters and skiers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TC8C50S5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5OCEA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B000F5UOYW", "title": "MTM Predator Shooting Table", "description": "Standing 30 inches tall and weighing less than 15 pounds, the Predator Shooting Table was designed by shooters. Modeled after a traditional bench rest, the wedge shaped tabletop design provides a comfortable shooting position for either left or right-handed shooters. Once your rifle is set up, you can rest it in one of the three barrel grooves molded into the sides of the table. Doubling as a maintenance bench or muzzle loader table at the range, the MTM Predator Shooting Table is ideal for sighting-in and testing firearm performance. It is also ideally suited to the back-forty shooter or the prairie dog hunter on the go.", "text": "MTM Predator Shooting Table Standing 30 inches tall and weighing less than 15 pounds, the Predator Shooting Table was designed by shooters. Modeled after a traditional bench rest, the wedge shaped tabletop design provides a comfortable shooting position for either left or right-handed shooters. Once your rifle is set up, you can rest it in one of the three barrel grooves molded into the sides of the table. Doubling as a maintenance bench or muzzle loader table at the range, the MTM Predator Shooting Table is ideal for sighting-in and testing firearm performance. It is also ideally suited to the back-forty shooter or the prairie dog hunter on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bx68vXWEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F5UOYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 73.5}}
{"item_id": "B000F61ZT4", "title": "Sportube Series 1 Single Travel Ski Case", "description": "All Sportube cases are blow molded from high density polyethylene, which while being strong & durable is very ightweight. Each case is designed to protect valuable winter sports equipment from the abuses of airline check-in or shipping by UPS or fedex. The hard palstic shell offers superior protection over a soft bag and creates a shield around the equipment protecting its contents better than a nylon bag. The hard shell plastic doesn't tear and is resilient to dings and bangs. There are no buckles, zips or permanently attached straps to get ripped, torn or broken. Therefore, it will hold up better and last much longer than a soft bag. Some airlines will only take liability for skis and boards packed in a hard case, soft bags may require a signed liability release. All Sportube cases are fitted with heavy duty rubber wheels making for an easy jouney from the car to check-in or car to hotel. Sportube cases are now bigger than ever. Our design and size has changed to meet recent changes in ski design and the Sportube now fits all ski/binding systems. Pulling the sportube through the airport or parking lot is now easier than ever thanks to the addition of the Easy Pull attachment point and the Easy pull Handle. Sportube case are supplied with a non locking TSA compliant wire case pin, however they can be locked for overseas travel or when shipping to the resort. Sportube can easily be strapped to any roof rack, protecting your equipment form road salt, dirt and grime. All Sportube ski & snowobard cases come with a 5 year limited manufacturers warranty.", "text": "Sportube Series 1 Single Travel Ski Case All Sportube cases are blow molded from high density polyethylene, which while being strong & durable is very ightweight. Each case is designed to protect valuable winter sports equipment from the abuses of airline check-in or shipping by UPS or fedex. The hard palstic shell offers superior protection over a soft bag and creates a shield around the equipment protecting its contents better than a nylon bag. The hard shell plastic doesn't tear and is resilient to dings and bangs. There are no buckles, zips or permanently attached straps to get ripped, torn or broken. Therefore, it will hold up better and last much longer than a soft bag. Some airlines will only take liability for skis and boards packed in a hard case, soft bags may require a signed liability release. All Sportube cases are fitted with heavy duty rubber wheels making for an easy jouney from the car to check-in or car to hotel. Sportube cases are now bigger than ever. Our design and size has changed to meet recent changes in ski design and the Sportube now fits all ski/binding systems. Pulling the sportube through the airport or parking lot is now easier than ever thanks to the addition of the Easy Pull attachment point and the Easy pull Handle. Sportube case are supplied with a non locking TSA compliant wire case pin, however they can be locked for overseas travel or when shipping to the resort. Sportube can easily be strapped to any roof rack, protecting your equipment form road salt, dirt and grime. All Sportube ski & snowobard cases come with a 5 year limited manufacturers warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f71PBgj2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F61ZT4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Ski Bags"]], "price": 85.14}}
{"item_id": "B000F630II", "title": "Rome's #1805 Round Pie Iron with Steel and Wood Handles", "description": "The round cast iron pie iron from Rome is perfect for cooking desserts & pies over a campfire or firepit. The round design is made to trim off the edges of sandwich bread to form a sealed round sandwich. 425\" diameter cast iron cooking surface with an overall length of 28\". Recipes included. Made by family camping cookware specialists, Rome Industries.", "text": "Rome's #1805 Round Pie Iron with Steel and Wood Handles The round cast iron pie iron from Rome is perfect for cooking desserts & pies over a campfire or firepit. The round design is made to trim off the edges of sandwich bread to form a sealed round sandwich. 425\" diameter cast iron cooking surface with an overall length of 28\". Recipes included. Made by family camping cookware specialists, Rome Industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s7hISUTZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F630II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rome Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 24.39}}
{"item_id": "B000F64VFO", "title": "Maxpedition Mega Rollypoly Folding Dump Pouch", "description": "The Mega Rollypoly (#0209) is our super-sized folding dump pouch for collecting small game, carrying stuff you buy at the local gun show, or hampering dirty laundry during travel.", "text": "Maxpedition Mega Rollypoly Folding Dump Pouch The Mega Rollypoly (#0209) is our super-sized folding dump pouch for collecting small game, carrying stuff you buy at the local gun show, or hampering dirty laundry during travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516I4kVWRUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F64VFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 25.94}}
