{"item_id": "B000F6A98C", "title": "Speedo Silicone Long Hair Swim Cap", "description": "Lightweight and durable cap that is designed to fit swimmers with longer hair. The silicone allows the head to breath for a more comfortable fit and can be stretched to over double its original size. Quick and easy to take on and off while not snagging hair.", "text": "Speedo Silicone Long Hair Swim Cap Lightweight and durable cap that is designed to fit swimmers with longer hair. The silicone allows the head to breath for a more comfortable fit and can be stretched to over double its original size. Quick and easy to take on and off while not snagging hair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313kjb0PpiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F6A98C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000F6A9BY", "title": "Speedo Sports Towel", "description": "If you are active in water related activities and are tired of always having a wet towel, the Speedo Chamois Towel is the answer. Just dry yourself off, then wring it out and it is ready to use again.", "text": "Speedo Sports Towel If you are active in water related activities and are tired of always having a wet towel, the Speedo Chamois Towel is the answer. Just dry yourself off, then wring it out and it is ready to use again.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T82G31BCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F6A9BY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 13.19}}
{"item_id": "B000F6C6N8", "title": "Speedo Baja Swim Goggle", "description": "Great fitting oversized goggle for the recreational swimmer. It's soft comfortable one piece frame features curved lens technology for increased field of vision. Great choice for someone who does not like the tight fit of a smaller goggle.", "text": "Speedo Baja Swim Goggle Great fitting oversized goggle for the recreational swimmer. It's soft comfortable one piece frame features curved lens technology for increased field of vision. Great choice for someone who does not like the tight fit of a smaller goggle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U6J1iWihL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F6C6N8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 12.04}}
