{"item_id": "B000F6NNP8", "title": "UCO Original Candle Lantern Value Pack with 3 Candles and Storage Bag", "description": "The classic UCO Original Candle Lantern in a convenient value pack that also includes a 3-pack of UCO 9-hour candles and a soft, fleece bag for storage. The UCO Original Candle Lantern is equally suited to camping and outdoor activities as it is to providing lighting at home in emergency situations. The lantern is collapsible to minimize space and features an easy-sliding glass chimney that creates a windproof environment for the candle. The spring-powered candle tube pushes the candle up as it burns, keeping the flame burning at a constant height. A viewing slot allows the user to monitor the remaining time of the slow-burning candle. Includes carrying handle and hanging hook. Two Inch in diameter, the lantern stands 6.5 Inch when opened and collapses to 4.25 Inch when closed. Weight (with candle) is 6.4 ounces (181 g). Brass lantern 8.8 ounces (249 g). Made in the USA.", "text": "UCO Original Candle Lantern Value Pack with 3 Candles and Storage Bag The classic UCO Original Candle Lantern in a convenient value pack that also includes a 3-pack of UCO 9-hour candles and a soft, fleece bag for storage. The UCO Original Candle Lantern is equally suited to camping and outdoor activities as it is to providing lighting at home in emergency situations. The lantern is collapsible to minimize space and features an easy-sliding glass chimney that creates a windproof environment for the candle. The spring-powered candle tube pushes the candle up as it burns, keeping the flame burning at a constant height. A viewing slot allows the user to monitor the remaining time of the slow-burning candle. Includes carrying handle and hanging hook. Two Inch in diameter, the lantern stands 6.5 Inch when opened and collapses to 4.25 Inch when closed. Weight (with candle) is 6.4 ounces (181 g). Brass lantern 8.8 ounces (249 g). Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QsjpuVILL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F6NNP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B000F6UJ5K", "title": "Igloo 1257458 Ice Cube Max Cold 70 Roller", "description": "Holds 2-liter bottle upright. Quick-access hatch to inside contents. Snap-lock, child-safety lid latch. UV inhibitors. Manufacturer provides 1-year warranty.", "text": "Igloo 1257458 Ice Cube Max Cold 70 Roller Holds 2-liter bottle upright. Quick-access hatch to inside contents. Snap-lock, child-safety lid latch. UV inhibitors. Manufacturer provides 1-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HpoU8stfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F6UJ5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Igloo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 38.12}}
{"item_id": "B000F782Y4", "title": "Airsoft M16-A4 Spring Rifle W/Laser, LED ILLUMINATOR NEW SR-5207", "description": "This full-scale replica M16 M4 spring rifle fires 0.2-gram rounds at an impressive 300-feet-per-second velocity, making it a fun and entertaining target shooter. Constructed of durable and lifelike ABS plastic, this spring rifle has a lifelike feel, and features an LED blue illuminator for nighttime use, laser sight, adjustable stock, sling, and RIS fore grip.Not for sale in some specific zip codes. Also includes safety glasses and 100 free BB rounds.", "text": "Airsoft M16-A4 Spring Rifle W/Laser, LED ILLUMINATOR NEW SR-5207 This full-scale replica M16 M4 spring rifle fires 0.2-gram rounds at an impressive 300-feet-per-second velocity, making it a fun and entertaining target shooter. Constructed of durable and lifelike ABS plastic, this spring rifle has a lifelike feel, and features an LED blue illuminator for nighttime use, laser sight, adjustable stock, sling, and RIS fore grip.Not for sale in some specific zip codes. Also includes safety glasses and 100 free BB rounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZLM7wtAsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F782Y4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Well", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 31.95}}
{"item_id": "B000F7B2AU", "title": "UCO Candlelier Deluxe Candle Lantern", "description": "The UCO Chandelier Candle Lantern takes the warmth, ease of use, safety, and convenience of the UCO Original Candle Lantern and increases the brightness. Three UCO 9-hour candles make the Chandelier perfect for larger groups of campers and an excellent choice for home and emergency use. The Chandelier employs many of the same proven features as the Original Candle Lantern - spring loaded candle tubes, twist-lock base, aluminum body, and glass chimney. The Chandelier generates enough light for a family picnic and enough warmth to heat small amounts of water or food - just place your cooking pot on the heat shield. In an enclosed area such as a tent, snow cave, or small room the warmth the Chandelier can generate is remarkable. For family camping trips, canoe and kayak camping, home or cabin use - or lighting the way in a power outage - Chandelier is unsurpassed in providing inexpensive and appealing light and warmth. Made in the USA.", "text": "UCO Candlelier Deluxe Candle Lantern The UCO Chandelier Candle Lantern takes the warmth, ease of use, safety, and convenience of the UCO Original Candle Lantern and increases the brightness. Three UCO 9-hour candles make the Chandelier perfect for larger groups of campers and an excellent choice for home and emergency use. The Chandelier employs many of the same proven features as the Original Candle Lantern - spring loaded candle tubes, twist-lock base, aluminum body, and glass chimney. The Chandelier generates enough light for a family picnic and enough warmth to heat small amounts of water or food - just place your cooking pot on the heat shield. In an enclosed area such as a tent, snow cave, or small room the warmth the Chandelier can generate is remarkable. For family camping trips, canoe and kayak camping, home or cabin use - or lighting the way in a power outage - Chandelier is unsurpassed in providing inexpensive and appealing light and warmth. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-b3Jvwm9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7B2AU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 25.79}}
{"item_id": "B000F7P1ZM", "title": "Radians Snug Plugs Reusable Corded Earplugs", "description": "Radians® super soft Snug Plugs� are washable and reusable. Patented material conforms to the ear comfortably. With a Noise Reduction Rating of 28dB the Snug Plugs� offers the maximum level of hearing protection for a reusable plug. It has a durable cord", "text": "Radians Snug Plugs Reusable Corded Earplugs Radians® super soft Snug Plugs� are washable and reusable. Patented material conforms to the ear comfortably. With a Noise Reduction Rating of 28dB the Snug Plugs� offers the maximum level of hearing protection for a reusable plug. It has a durable cord", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417VW7QYTXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7P1ZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 4.49}}
{"item_id": "B000F7P20G", "title": "Remington M-31 Premium Earmuff", "description": "Remington® M31¿ Premium ear muff has a Noise Reduction Rating of 30 and is extremely lightweight, only 10 oz. The soft foam ear cups pivot independently on the wide, padded headband for a comfortable fit and tight, protective seal.", "text": "Remington M-31 Premium Earmuff Remington® M31¿ Premium ear muff has a Noise Reduction Rating of 30 and is extremely lightweight, only 10 oz. The soft foam ear cups pivot independently on the wide, padded headband for a comfortable fit and tight, protective seal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VPRTFA2YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7P20G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B000F7P292", "title": "Radians Revelation Protective Shooting Glasses", "description": "Radians Revelation superior fit means long-term wearing comfort for workers. Four-position telescoping temples with five-position ratchet adjustment provide a perfect fit for nearly every head size.", "text": "Radians Revelation Protective Shooting Glasses Radians Revelation superior fit means long-term wearing comfort for workers. Four-position telescoping temples with five-position ratchet adjustment provide a perfect fit for nearly every head size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3160N9ZQ4SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7P292.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B000F7PPFS", "title": "Remington T-71 Dual Mold Shooting Glasses (Clear Anti-Fog Lens/Black Frame)", "description": "Remington® T71¿ Dual Mold frame provides a comfortable fit. The Dual injected rubber frame and temples provide a durable frame and soft, cushioned brow protection. The vented frame allows air to flow to prevent fogging. The adjustable, soft nose piece", "text": "Remington T-71 Dual Mold Shooting Glasses (Clear Anti-Fog Lens/Black Frame) Remington® T71¿ Dual Mold frame provides a comfortable fit. The Dual injected rubber frame and temples provide a durable frame and soft, cushioned brow protection. The vented frame allows air to flow to prevent fogging. The adjustable, soft nose piece", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T1K7A3TVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7PPFS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 5.79}}
{"item_id": "B000F7PPL2", "title": "Remington True Jr. Ear Muffs", "description": "Remington True JR.¿ Ear Muff has a true reduced head band construction for the smaller of stature. The full size ear muffs ensures coverage and secure fit. It is styled to complement the T-10 True JR. safety glass. Noise Reduction Rating of 21.", "text": "Remington True Jr. Ear Muffs Remington True JR.¿ Ear Muff has a true reduced head band construction for the smaller of stature. The full size ear muffs ensures coverage and secure fit. It is styled to complement the T-10 True JR. safety glass. Noise Reduction Rating of 21.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4Q3HC7EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7PPL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 13.9}}
{"item_id": "B000F7RSFI", "title": "Remington T-72 Shooting Glasses", "description": "Remington® T72¿ Sporty bayonet temples and full wraparound lens make this glass perfect for the range. The non-slip temple pads and the adjustable, soft rubber nosepiece provides a comfortable fit. Tough, polycarbonate lens provides an unobstructed vie", "text": "Remington T-72 Shooting Glasses Remington® T72¿ Sporty bayonet temples and full wraparound lens make this glass perfect for the range. The non-slip temple pads and the adjustable, soft rubber nosepiece provides a comfortable fit. Tough, polycarbonate lens provides an unobstructed vie", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311nWu8quJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000F7RSFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 4.73}}
