{"item_id": "B000FB7TDK", "title": "MSR Hydromedary Bag Hydration Bag", "description": "214798 Features: Save space by ditching the water bottles and filling this water reservoir instead; a range of sizes accommodate most packs, and tough material withstands jostling Cold temperatures do not damage the BPA-free, food grade lining that can handle freezing Get hydrated on the go with the 90-degree bite valve that increases flow rate, and has a shut-off valve so you don't lose valuable water Fill it up easily through the wide-mouth opening Specifications: Weight: 65 ounces (2 liter); 67 ounces (25 liter); 71 ounces (3 liter) Volume: 70 fl oz (2 liter); 875 fl oz (25 liter); 100 fl oz (3 liter) Dimensions: 17 x 65 inches (2 liter); 145 x 75 inches (25 liter); 18 x 75 inches (3 liter) Material: nylon (bag); polyurethane (spout, drink tube, hose port); plastic (cap); silicone (bite valve);", "text": "MSR Hydromedary Bag Hydration Bag 214798 Features: Save space by ditching the water bottles and filling this water reservoir instead; a range of sizes accommodate most packs, and tough material withstands jostling Cold temperatures do not damage the BPA-free, food grade lining that can handle freezing Get hydrated on the go with the 90-degree bite valve that increases flow rate, and has a shut-off valve so you don't lose valuable water Fill it up easily through the wide-mouth opening Specifications: Weight: 65 ounces (2 liter); 67 ounces (25 liter); 71 ounces (3 liter) Volume: 70 fl oz (2 liter); 875 fl oz (25 liter); 100 fl oz (3 liter) Dimensions: 17 x 65 inches (2 liter); 145 x 75 inches (25 liter); 18 x 75 inches (3 liter) Material: nylon (bag); polyurethane (spout, drink tube, hose port); plastic (cap); silicone (bite valve);", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RNZdebx4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FB7TDK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
