{"item_id": "B000FBSZF6", "title": "MSR Titan Kettle", "description": "Use the MSR Titan Kettle as a pot, mug or bowl on your bare-minimum camping treks, or add this . 85-liter kettle to your Titan Cookset. With a tight-fitting lid and a drip-free spout, you can heat and pour water for tea or instant soup without spilling. MSR fortified the 28 fluid ounce Titan Kettle with lightweight, strong titanium material, so this cookware stands up to seasons of camping and only adds 4. 2 ounces to your pack.", "text": "MSR Titan Kettle Use the MSR Titan Kettle as a pot, mug or bowl on your bare-minimum camping treks, or add this . 85-liter kettle to your Titan Cookset. With a tight-fitting lid and a drip-free spout, you can heat and pour water for tea or instant soup without spilling. MSR fortified the 28 fluid ounce Titan Kettle with lightweight, strong titanium material, so this cookware stands up to seasons of camping and only adds 4. 2 ounces to your pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GX6rJi-1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FBSZF6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 59.95}}
