{"item_id": "B000FBYNI4", "title": "MSR Titan Cup", "description": "FEATURES of the MSR Titan Cup Compact: Nests inside Titan Kettle Versatile: Eat/drink cup for beverages or soups SPECIFICATIONS of the MSR Titan Cup Volume: 13.5 cubic inches / 0.4 liter Weight: 1.9 oz / 54 g", "text": "MSR Titan Cup FEATURES of the MSR Titan Cup Compact: Nests inside Titan Kettle Versatile: Eat/drink cup for beverages or soups SPECIFICATIONS of the MSR Titan Cup Volume: 13.5 cubic inches / 0.4 liter Weight: 1.9 oz / 54 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NstNBA3KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FBYNI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FBYNIE", "title": "MSR Blacklite Fry Pan", "description": "Every trip demands a different cache of cookware, that's why we offer the BlackLite nonstick aluminum fry pan separately. It's up to you whether you want to bring this lightweight fryer along as part of a set or by itself.", "text": "MSR Blacklite Fry Pan Every trip demands a different cache of cookware, that's why we offer the BlackLite nonstick aluminum fry pan separately. It's up to you whether you want to bring this lightweight fryer along as part of a set or by itself.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4156EDEDA2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FBYNIE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]]}}
