{"item_id": "B000FDRQ1S", "title": "Bones Bearings Reds Bearings", "description": "The standard by which all other bearings are measured. High speed. Set of 8 Bearings. This bearing is not 'ABEC' rated. Imported.", "text": "Bones Bearings Reds Bearings The standard by which all other bearings are measured. High speed. Set of 8 Bearings. This bearing is not 'ABEC' rated. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jje5DDtwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDRQ1S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Skateboard Parts", "Bearings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FDSUGS", "title": "Do-All Outdoors Pellet Trap", "description": "AccuAir Pellet Trap (Model #AS8177) by Do-All Traps will afford anyone who likes to shoot, hours of fun. This all-steel construction pellet trap will handle 800 FPS max air guns. The Air Strike Pellet Trap includes two interchangeable spinning target silhouettes (one set of spinning ducks and one set of spinning bulls eyes). You can also use paper targets with this trap, so the variety of fun never ceases.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors Pellet Trap AccuAir Pellet Trap (Model #AS8177) by Do-All Traps will afford anyone who likes to shoot, hours of fun. This all-steel construction pellet trap will handle 800 FPS max air guns. The Air Strike Pellet Trap includes two interchangeable spinning target silhouettes (one set of spinning ducks and one set of spinning bulls eyes). You can also use paper targets with this trap, so the variety of fun never ceases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QNZV8P6NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDSUGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FDSUH2", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Steel Round Up Target", "description": "The .22 Steel Round Up has eight targets that are a hefty 8mm thick. These meaty targets combined with our new adjustable spring technology provide many variables to the avid marksman. Depending on the spring setting and distance you can shoot .22 short, .22 long, .22 mags' and even the hot new .17's. This unit assembles quickly and easily and is great fun and perfect for the range or the hunting lease.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Steel Round Up Target The .22 Steel Round Up has eight targets that are a hefty 8mm thick. These meaty targets combined with our new adjustable spring technology provide many variables to the avid marksman. Depending on the spring setting and distance you can shoot .22 short, .22 long, .22 mags' and even the hot new .17's. This unit assembles quickly and easily and is great fun and perfect for the range or the hunting lease.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NMW1FY2CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDSUH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 57.39}}
{"item_id": "B000FDSUHC", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .22/.17 Bullet Box", "description": "The Do-All Outdoors .17/.22 Bullet Box is a portable shooting range for .22 & .17 rim fire that gives any shooter the convenience of a quick and safe set up. The heavy-duty construction will withstand the punishment from any avid shooter. This unit only weighs 20 lbs and comes with an instructional DVD.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .22/.17 Bullet Box The Do-All Outdoors .17/.22 Bullet Box is a portable shooting range for .22 & .17 rim fire that gives any shooter the convenience of a quick and safe set up. The heavy-duty construction will withstand the punishment from any avid shooter. This unit only weighs 20 lbs and comes with an instructional DVD.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418DM114BJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDSUHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 65.67}}
{"item_id": "B000FDTQFC", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Auto Reset Target", "description": "Made specifically for soft-nosed .22-caliber pistol and rifle shooters, the Do-All Outdoors auto-reset target lets you practice your shooting without heading to the range. The auto system is a breeze to use. In its starting position, all four of the individual high-visibility targets are arranged in the lower position. As a bullet strikes a target, however, the force spins the target upright and locks it into a vertical position. And when all four targets are vertical, you can either shoot each target again or simply shoot the reset target, which drops all four at once for another round of practice or competition. The auto reset target--which is forward leaning to deflect the bullets downward for increased safety--comes with stabilizing ground spikes.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Auto Reset Target Made specifically for soft-nosed .22-caliber pistol and rifle shooters, the Do-All Outdoors auto-reset target lets you practice your shooting without heading to the range. The auto system is a breeze to use. In its starting position, all four of the individual high-visibility targets are arranged in the lower position. As a bullet strikes a target, however, the force spins the target upright and locks it into a vertical position. And when all four targets are vertical, you can either shoot each target again or simply shoot the reset target, which drops all four at once for another round of practice or competition. The auto reset target--which is forward leaning to deflect the bullets downward for increased safety--comes with stabilizing ground spikes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y0QZ9Y5BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDTQFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 32.81}}
{"item_id": "B000FDTQFW", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Spinner Target", "description": "The Do-All Traps Spinner (.22) model (Model # SS7022), which is made specifically for soft nosed .22 pistol and rifle shooters. This unit is a hands free spinning target. As the bullet strikes each target, the force spins the target over the attachment bar and back to the set position. The Do-All Traps Spinner (.22) model has four stabilizing legs so you won't have to set it up more than once.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .22 Spinner Target The Do-All Traps Spinner (.22) model (Model # SS7022), which is made specifically for soft nosed .22 pistol and rifle shooters. This unit is a hands free spinning target. As the bullet strikes each target, the force spins the target over the attachment bar and back to the set position. The Do-All Traps Spinner (.22) model has four stabilizing legs so you won't have to set it up more than once.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BMZG4M01L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDTQFW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.77}}
{"item_id": "B000FDTQGQ", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .9mm-30.06 Steel Round Up Target", "description": "The .9mm-.30-.06 Steel Round Up has six targets ready to take on all of your favorite pistols, varmint and trophy buck calibers. These heavy-duty targets are carefully heat treated to an impressive rockwell hardness to give you unmatched shooting options. The adjustable spring loaded technology really comes in handy here, giving you the ability to go side by side with your pistol-toting challenger, or zeroing in on the real life pop-up, known as the prairie dog.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .9mm-30.06 Steel Round Up Target The .9mm-.30-.06 Steel Round Up has six targets ready to take on all of your favorite pistols, varmint and trophy buck calibers. These heavy-duty targets are carefully heat treated to an impressive rockwell hardness to give you unmatched shooting options. The adjustable spring loaded technology really comes in handy here, giving you the ability to go side by side with your pistol-toting challenger, or zeroing in on the real life pop-up, known as the prairie dog.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TNNAFGEGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDTQGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 91.65}}
{"item_id": "B000FDVMSQ", "title": "Do-All Outdoors .38-.44 Auto Reset Target", "description": "The Do-All Traps (.38-.44) model (Model #SS6038) is made specifically for soft nosed .38-.44 caliber pistols. This unit has the same hands free resetting system as the Do-All Traps (.22) model, but is ready for a full range of gunslinger pistol action, with huge visible targets. The Do-All Traps (.38-.44) model is a must for every cowboy action shooter.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors .38-.44 Auto Reset Target The Do-All Traps (.38-.44) model (Model #SS6038) is made specifically for soft nosed .38-.44 caliber pistols. This unit has the same hands free resetting system as the Do-All Traps (.22) model, but is ready for a full range of gunslinger pistol action, with huge visible targets. The Do-All Traps (.38-.44) model is a must for every cowboy action shooter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DDEV8E69L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDVMSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 61.77}}
{"item_id": "B000FDVUHY", "title": "MetalTac Protection Vest for Airsoft Players", "description": "High Quality Protection Vest for airsoft player", "text": "MetalTac Protection Vest for Airsoft Players High Quality Protection Vest for airsoft player", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QKLZQIVYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FDVUHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MetalTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FE5P88", "title": "AIRHEAD AHAO-1 Aqua Oasis Insulated Nylon Cooler with Removable Floating Base", "description": "You don't have to interrupt the party to restock the cooler with AIRHEAD's AQUA OASIS. The insulated leak-proof nylon cooler lifts up from the inflatable vinyl base and has an adjustable shoulder strap. It keeps 24 cans ice cold for hours. The 6 drink holders in the floating base are marked with numbers to help you and your friends keep track of your drinks. The sundry holder is a convenient place to store suntan lotion. A molded plastic rope connector is welded to the side for tethering to an AIRHEAD lounge, swim platform, boat or dock.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHAO-1 Aqua Oasis Insulated Nylon Cooler with Removable Floating Base You don't have to interrupt the party to restock the cooler with AIRHEAD's AQUA OASIS. The insulated leak-proof nylon cooler lifts up from the inflatable vinyl base and has an adjustable shoulder strap. It keeps 24 cans ice cold for hours. The 6 drink holders in the floating base are marked with numbers to help you and your friends keep track of your drinks. The sundry holder is a convenient place to store suntan lotion. A molded plastic rope connector is welded to the side for tethering to an AIRHEAD lounge, swim platform, boat or dock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nXoy3uhcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE5P88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airhead", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 29.18}}
{"item_id": "B000FE5PBA", "title": "AIRHEAD AHP-12H Hi Output Air Pump (12-Volt)", "description": "AIRHEAD® Air Pump, 12V - This high-volume (290 liters / minute) 12 volt portable air pump inflates and deflates towables, boats, pools, mattresses and beach toys quickly and effectively. Most pumps on the market don’t put out this kind of air volume and pressure (380 liters/min., .8 psi). The universal valve fittings fit all popular valves. For added convenience, the cigarette lighter plug is equipped with a 5 ft. long power cord. We recommend topping off towables inflated with 12 volt pumps with a few strokes of AIRHEAD’s Double Action Hand Pump or Foot Bellows Pump.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHP-12H Hi Output Air Pump (12-Volt) AIRHEAD® Air Pump, 12V - This high-volume (290 liters / minute) 12 volt portable air pump inflates and deflates towables, boats, pools, mattresses and beach toys quickly and effectively. Most pumps on the market don’t put out this kind of air volume and pressure (380 liters/min., .8 psi). The universal valve fittings fit all popular valves. For added convenience, the cigarette lighter plug is equipped with a 5 ft. long power cord. We recommend topping off towables inflated with 12 volt pumps with a few strokes of AIRHEAD’s Double Action Hand Pump or Foot Bellows Pump.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OIzYDguvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE5PBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 12.2}}
{"item_id": "B000FE5PBU", "title": "Dry Pak Camera Case", "description": "", "text": "Dry Pak Camera Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sc15FLbML._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE5PBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Lines"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FE5PE2", "title": "AIRHEAD AHP-120HP Hi Pressure Air Pump with Pressure Release", "description": "AIRHEAD® Hi-Pressure Air Pump - This is simply the best performing 120 volt air pump available, inflating and deflating at unprecedented speed. Peak pressure is 2.5 psi, plenty of pressure to get high end inflatable boats, rafts and reinforced backyard items nice and firm. You’ll immediately notice how they perform better when properly inflated. A Pressure Release Valve is included to limit pressure to 1.5 psi for preventing over-inflating towables, pool toys and other vinyl and nylon covered inflatable items. The accordion-style hose locks onto the pump, eliminating annoying disconnections. Four universal valve fittings fit all popular valves and lock onto the hose. You’ll love the screw-on Boston Valve adapter, an AIRHEAD exclusive. For added convenience, there’s a carry handle and a 10 ft. long power cord. Draws 6.3 amps. Volume: 460 liters/min.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHP-120HP Hi Pressure Air Pump with Pressure Release AIRHEAD® Hi-Pressure Air Pump - This is simply the best performing 120 volt air pump available, inflating and deflating at unprecedented speed. Peak pressure is 2.5 psi, plenty of pressure to get high end inflatable boats, rafts and reinforced backyard items nice and firm. You’ll immediately notice how they perform better when properly inflated. A Pressure Release Valve is included to limit pressure to 1.5 psi for preventing over-inflating towables, pool toys and other vinyl and nylon covered inflatable items. The accordion-style hose locks onto the pump, eliminating annoying disconnections. Four universal valve fittings fit all popular valves and lock onto the hose. You’ll love the screw-on Boston Valve adapter, an AIRHEAD exclusive. For added convenience, there’s a carry handle and a 10 ft. long power cord. Draws 6.3 amps. Volume: 460 liters/min.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZOS5vytFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE5PE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Plumbing", "Water Pressure Pumps"]], "price": 41.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FE5PEC", "title": "Kwik-Tek AHP-1 Airhead Hand Pump", "description": "This double action pump inflates and deflates towables, kayaks, boats, airbeds, and other inflatables. It delivers a continuous stream of air on both the up and down strokes. Simply turn the release valve counter-clockwise and you are pumping air only on the down-stroke. This is a great option when your inflatable is almost full and there is back pressure. Four universal valve fittings are included to fit Boston valves and stem valves. The accordion style hose stretches to 5 ft. long and interlocks to the pump, so that it does not fall off while you are pumping. Volume is 2 liters / stroke. Very effective for topping off large towables in the boat, since peak pressure is an impressive 14 psi.", "text": "Kwik-Tek AHP-1 Airhead Hand Pump This double action pump inflates and deflates towables, kayaks, boats, airbeds, and other inflatables. It delivers a continuous stream of air on both the up and down strokes. Simply turn the release valve counter-clockwise and you are pumping air only on the down-stroke. This is a great option when your inflatable is almost full and there is back pressure. Four universal valve fittings are included to fit Boston valves and stem valves. The accordion style hose stretches to 5 ft. long and interlocks to the pump, so that it does not fall off while you are pumping. Volume is 2 liters / stroke. Very effective for topping off large towables in the boat, since peak pressure is an impressive 14 psi.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HC45FqS-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE5PEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FE7J0A", "title": "AIRHEAD AHP-120 Air Pump 120 volt", "description": "Perfect for quick inflation and deflation of towables, pools, air mattresses and beach toys, the 120 volt Kwik Tek Airhead air pump canister features an accordion-style hose that locks onto the pump and valve fittings, eliminating annoying disconnections. It includes three universal valve fittings to fit a wide variety of inflatables, and it will quickly fill your inflatable with a 300 liter-per-minute airfill rate. Other features include a carry handle and 10-foot power cord. For use with in-home AC power.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHP-120 Air Pump 120 volt Perfect for quick inflation and deflation of towables, pools, air mattresses and beach toys, the 120 volt Kwik Tek Airhead air pump canister features an accordion-style hose that locks onto the pump and valve fittings, eliminating annoying disconnections. It includes three universal valve fittings to fit a wide variety of inflatables, and it will quickly fill your inflatable with a 300 liter-per-minute airfill rate. Other features include a carry handle and 10-foot power cord. For use with in-home AC power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K0dKj7cDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE7J0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FE7J5A", "title": "AIRHEAD AHTK-P2 Deluxe Kayak Paddle 2 sect Alum 84\" Curved Blade", "description": "Need a good kayak paddle but don't have a ton of storage space? Turn to the 7-foot KwikTek AHTK-P2 paddle, which breaks into two sections for easy transport and storage. The paddle offers an adjustable blade angle to accommodate both standard and offset paddling, along with large ABS blades with curved surfaces to promote greater paddling efficiency. And should you run into rough rapids and accidentally drop the paddle, the lightweight, durable aluminum shaft, drip rings, and foam hand grips will keep the paddle afloat until you can retrieve it. Each paddle section measures 49.5 inches long, with an 8.5-inch-wide paddle and a 2-inch diameter. The paddle sections weigh 3 pounds each.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHTK-P2 Deluxe Kayak Paddle 2 sect Alum 84\" Curved Blade Need a good kayak paddle but don't have a ton of storage space? Turn to the 7-foot KwikTek AHTK-P2 paddle, which breaks into two sections for easy transport and storage. The paddle offers an adjustable blade angle to accommodate both standard and offset paddling, along with large ABS blades with curved surfaces to promote greater paddling efficiency. And should you run into rough rapids and accidentally drop the paddle, the lightweight, durable aluminum shaft, drip rings, and foam hand grips will keep the paddle afloat until you can retrieve it. Each paddle section measures 49.5 inches long, with an 8.5-inch-wide paddle and a 2-inch diameter. The paddle sections weigh 3 pounds each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wuLfe6WCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE7J5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airhead", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]], "price": 35.87}}
{"item_id": "B000FE7J5U", "title": "AIRHEAD AHBL-1 Blast Towable", "description": "Enjoy a fast, safe glide across the water with the Airhead Blast 54-inch round inflatable towable, which accommodates a single rider. It's equipped four neoprene knuckle guards and deluxe nylon-covered handles for optimal comfort and safety. It also features a double-stitched nylon cover, electronically welded seams, Boston valve for quick inflating and deflating, reinforced internal tow harness, and a self-draining floor vent. Backed by a 90-day limited warranty.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHBL-1 Blast Towable Enjoy a fast, safe glide across the water with the Airhead Blast 54-inch round inflatable towable, which accommodates a single rider. It's equipped four neoprene knuckle guards and deluxe nylon-covered handles for optimal comfort and safety. It also features a double-stitched nylon cover, electronically welded seams, Boston valve for quick inflating and deflating, reinforced internal tow harness, and a self-draining floor vent. Backed by a 90-day limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51awv7Cd%2B6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE7J5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airhead", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 47.61}}
{"item_id": "B000FE9C14", "title": "AIRHEAD AHTR-22 Tube Rope 2 Section with Float, 2 Rider", "description": "AIRHEAD® 2 Rider 2 Section Tube Rope - This tube tow rope has 2 sections, giving you the option to be either 50 or 60 feet behind the boat depending on wake and water conditions. The pre-stretched UV-resistant 7/16 inch diameter 16-strand rope exceeds the 2,375 pound break strength required by the WSIA for 2-rider tubes. A Rope Keeper is included for convenient storage.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHTR-22 Tube Rope 2 Section with Float, 2 Rider AIRHEAD® 2 Rider 2 Section Tube Rope - This tube tow rope has 2 sections, giving you the option to be either 50 or 60 feet behind the boat depending on wake and water conditions. The pre-stretched UV-resistant 7/16 inch diameter 16-strand rope exceeds the 2,375 pound break strength required by the WSIA for 2-rider tubes. A Rope Keeper is included for convenient storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/613vNvUlSjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE9C14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Lines"]], "price": 14.26}}
{"item_id": "B000FE9C2I", "title": "AIRHEAD AHTH-2 Heavy Duty Tow Harness", "description": "AIRHEAD® Heavy Duty Tow Harness - This heavy duty tow harness is perfect for pulling skiers, wake boarders and up to 4 rider towables. Simply clip it onto your boat with the 5,000-pound tensile strength hooks, and attach your ski or tube rope to the heavy duty Kwik-Connect. A 6” float keeps the Kwik-Connect floating on top, away from your propeller. 12 feet long to fit larger boats and pontoons. Yellow / Red.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHTH-2 Heavy Duty Tow Harness AIRHEAD® Heavy Duty Tow Harness - This heavy duty tow harness is perfect for pulling skiers, wake boarders and up to 4 rider towables. Simply clip it onto your boat with the 5,000-pound tensile strength hooks, and attach your ski or tube rope to the heavy duty Kwik-Connect. A 6” float keeps the Kwik-Connect floating on top, away from your propeller. 12 feet long to fit larger boats and pontoons. Yellow / Red.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jIC4xBecL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE9C2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Lines"]], "price": 9.35}}
{"item_id": "B000FE9CIM", "title": "AIRHEAD AHGF-3 G-Force Inflatable Towable", "description": "G-FORCE is a wild ride for up to 3 thrill-seekers! Defy centrifugal force with G-FORCE’s topside stabilizer fins. The 6 deluxe nylon-wrapped handles with neoprene knuckle guards provide a sure and comfortable grip. G-FORCE has a tough 30-gauge virgin PVC bladder, fully covered with an 840-denier double-stitched nylon cover. It measures 72” x 62” (deflated) and is equipped with a heavy-duty Kwik-Connect for easy and secure hook-ups. A Speed Safety Valve provides the ultimate in inflation and deflation convenience.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHGF-3 G-Force Inflatable Towable G-FORCE is a wild ride for up to 3 thrill-seekers! Defy centrifugal force with G-FORCE’s topside stabilizer fins. The 6 deluxe nylon-wrapped handles with neoprene knuckle guards provide a sure and comfortable grip. G-FORCE has a tough 30-gauge virgin PVC bladder, fully covered with an 840-denier double-stitched nylon cover. It measures 72” x 62” (deflated) and is equipped with a heavy-duty Kwik-Connect for easy and secure hook-ups. A Speed Safety Valve provides the ultimate in inflation and deflation convenience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61WyqYOBsiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FE9CIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airhead", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 169.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FECD2Y", "title": "Kwik-Tek AHTH-3 Tow Harness", "description": "AIRHEAD® Self-Centering Tow Harness - This 3,000-pound tensile strength tow harness is perfect for pulling skiers, wake boarders and up to 2 rider towables. A stainless steel pulley glides along the length of the rope to provide the optimum pull at all times. Simply clip it onto your boat with the 5,000-pound tensile strength hooks provided, and attach your ski or tube rope to the heavy duty Kwik-Connect. The 6¿ float ensures that the Kwik-Connect floats, away from your propeller. It¿s 12 feet long to fit pontoon and larger boats. Yellow / Black.", "text": "Kwik-Tek AHTH-3 Tow Harness AIRHEAD® Self-Centering Tow Harness - This 3,000-pound tensile strength tow harness is perfect for pulling skiers, wake boarders and up to 2 rider towables. A stainless steel pulley glides along the length of the rope to provide the optimum pull at all times. Simply clip it onto your boat with the 5,000-pound tensile strength hooks provided, and attach your ski or tube rope to the heavy duty Kwik-Connect. The 6¿ float ensures that the Kwik-Connect floats, away from your propeller. It¿s 12 feet long to fit pontoon and larger boats. Yellow / Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HBBzWHzSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FECD2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 17.79}}
