{"item_id": "B000FETBBA", "title": "Suunto Clipper L Micro Compass (Luminous Bezel)", "description": "Hailing from Suunto's Micro series, the Clipper L micro compass attaches conveniently to a watch band or hand strap, making it an invaluable navigational tool for on-the-go users. More importantly, the Clipper's liquid-filled capsule, jewel bearing, and rotating dial are accurate and precise whether you're navigating on city streets or country roads. The compass even comes with a luminous bezel for low-light conditions. Plus, the compass--which measures a mere 1.2 by 0.94 inches (W x L)--takes up virtually no space in your pocket. So go small without sacrificing accuracy with the Clipper L.", "text": "Suunto Clipper L Micro Compass (Luminous Bezel) Hailing from Suunto's Micro series, the Clipper L micro compass attaches conveniently to a watch band or hand strap, making it an invaluable navigational tool for on-the-go users. More importantly, the Clipper's liquid-filled capsule, jewel bearing, and rotating dial are accurate and precise whether you're navigating on city streets or country roads. The compass even comes with a luminous bezel for low-light conditions. Plus, the compass--which measures a mere 1.2 by 0.94 inches (W x L)--takes up virtually no space in your pocket. So go small without sacrificing accuracy with the Clipper L.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nvYG5i4TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FETBBA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FETSDQ", "title": "Emergency Thermal Blankets 52\" X 84\", 10xPack", "description": "This compact blanket provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Emergency thermal blanket to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "text": "Emergency Thermal Blankets 52\" X 84\", 10xPack This compact blanket provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Emergency thermal blanket to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316HJg7PmKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FETSDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SIS E-Store", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 7.1}}
{"item_id": "B000FEUCRW", "title": "Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010", "description": "THE SIGHTING COMPASS FOR GLOBAL MOUNTAINEERS Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010 The advanced navigation compass. When venturing out into new territory, these sighting compasses offer precision navigation with a variety of carefully engineered and dependable features for challenging conditions. PRODUCT HIGHLIGHTS Sighting tools for accurate direction taking Rugged construction Global Balancing System Clinometer Large mirror Jewel bearing cm and inch scales Adjustable declination correction scale Additional sighting hole for superior accuracy Baseplate with magnifying lens and anti-slip rubber pads Luminous two-color bezel ring Detachable snap-lock in lanyard. Easy to detach for working with the map Wristlock in the lanyard Metric scales cm, inch, 1:20 000 km Roamer, 1:25 000 km Roamer What's in the box? Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010 lanyard with wristlock, declination adjustment key, quick release, manual Measurements 65 x 101 x 18 mm Weight 75 g Measurements 2.56 x 3.98 x 0.71 \" Weight 2.65 oz", "text": "Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010 THE SIGHTING COMPASS FOR GLOBAL MOUNTAINEERS Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010 The advanced navigation compass. When venturing out into new territory, these sighting compasses offer precision navigation with a variety of carefully engineered and dependable features for challenging conditions. PRODUCT HIGHLIGHTS Sighting tools for accurate direction taking Rugged construction Global Balancing System Clinometer Large mirror Jewel bearing cm and inch scales Adjustable declination correction scale Additional sighting hole for superior accuracy Baseplate with magnifying lens and anti-slip rubber pads Luminous two-color bezel ring Detachable snap-lock in lanyard. Easy to detach for working with the map Wristlock in the lanyard Metric scales cm, inch, 1:20 000 km Roamer, 1:25 000 km Roamer What's in the box? Suunto MC-2/360/G/D/L Compass SS004252010 lanyard with wristlock, declination adjustment key, quick release, manual Measurements 65 x 101 x 18 mm Weight 75 g Measurements 2.56 x 3.98 x 0.71 \" Weight 2.65 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XyvA5HUiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FEUCRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Suunto", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 55.13}}
{"item_id": "B000FEUCSG", "title": "Suunto Clipper Micro Compass", "description": "Hailing from Suunto's Micro series, the Clipper micro compass attaches conveniently to a watch band or hand strap, making it an invaluable navigational tool for on-the-go users. More importantly, the Clipper's liquid-filled capsule, jewel bearing, and rotating dial are accurate and precise whether you're navigating on city streets or country roads. Plus, the compass--which measures a mere 1.2 by 0.94 inches (W x L)--takes up virtually no space in your pocket. So go small without sacrificing accuracy with the Clipper.", "text": "Suunto Clipper Micro Compass Hailing from Suunto's Micro series, the Clipper micro compass attaches conveniently to a watch band or hand strap, making it an invaluable navigational tool for on-the-go users. More importantly, the Clipper's liquid-filled capsule, jewel bearing, and rotating dial are accurate and precise whether you're navigating on city streets or country roads. Plus, the compass--which measures a mere 1.2 by 0.94 inches (W x L)--takes up virtually no space in your pocket. So go small without sacrificing accuracy with the Clipper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Hs2P9kabL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FEUCSG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FEUUB0", "title": "DAISY 617X Clips", "description": "For Powerline model 617X pistol. Holds flat and pointed 4.5mm pellets. 5 clips per pack.", "text": "DAISY 617X Clips For Powerline model 617X pistol. Holds flat and pointed 4.5mm pellets. 5 clips per pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vj7l3j9KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FEUUB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FEUUBA", "title": "Crosman Premier Ultra Magnum .177 Cal, 10.5 Grains, Round Nose, 500ct", "description": ".177 caliber 10.5 grains Round nose 500 pellets", "text": "Crosman Premier Ultra Magnum .177 Cal, 10.5 Grains, Round Nose, 500ct .177 caliber 10.5 grains Round nose 500 pellets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51p4iye2T6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FEUUBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 7.69}}
{"item_id": "B000FEUUCY", "title": "Crosman 459MT 2-Pc Intermount, 3/8 Dovetail", "description": "Provides 3/8\" dovetail fitting for the 2250B, 2260, 2240, 1377C, 1322C and PC77. The intermount provides the ability to mount optics with dovetail rings.", "text": "Crosman 459MT 2-Pc Intermount, 3/8 Dovetail Provides 3/8\" dovetail fitting for the 2250B, 2260, 2240, 1377C, 1322C and PC77. The intermount provides the ability to mount optics with dovetail rings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mj90ONj3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FEUUCY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 12.48}}
