{"item_id": "B000FGE86G", "title": "JT Sports Elite Alpha Camo Thermal Mask", "description": "The Elite Alpha Camo Thermal Mask from JT provides maximum coverage of the face, temple, forehead and ears to keep you protected during airsoft and paintball wars. The Elite 180 degree lens, meanwhile, provides the range of vision you need to stay in the game. The features a tactical camo design and is fully ventilated for comfort.", "text": "JT Sports Elite Alpha Camo Thermal Mask The Elite Alpha Camo Thermal Mask from JT provides maximum coverage of the face, temple, forehead and ears to keep you protected during airsoft and paintball wars. The Elite 180 degree lens, meanwhile, provides the range of vision you need to stay in the game. The features a tactical camo design and is fully ventilated for comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CrVXcJiBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FGE86G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FGTPTG", "title": "GG LASER BORESIGHTER", "description": "Sightmark Laser Boresighter. Laser dot size at 100 yds. is 2\". Includes LR41 button-style batteries, for approx. 1 hour of continuous run time. State Caliber. Get yours today! Please Note: May take 2 or 3 batteries according to model of boresighter. Batteries included. WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. Sightmark Laser Boresighter", "text": "GG LASER BORESIGHTER Sightmark Laser Boresighter. Laser dot size at 100 yds. is 2\". Includes LR41 button-style batteries, for approx. 1 hour of continuous run time. State Caliber. Get yours today! Please Note: May take 2 or 3 batteries according to model of boresighter. Batteries included. WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. Sightmark Laser Boresighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kF7aYKT1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FGTPTG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FGTTEW", "title": "Delta Leonardo Single Bicycle Rack with Da Vinci Tire Tray( Colors may vary)", "description": "Store your bike easily and with a bit of panache with the stylish, curvy Delta Leonardo wall-mounted single bike rack. Elegantly designed with a silver finish, it's perfect for storing a bike in space-limited apartments or in the back hall. The Leonardo holds the front wheel with a rubber coated arm. It conveniently accommodates any wheel size--from touring to phat, chunky mountain tires--and can hold a maximum load of 40 pounds. It should be mounted to a wall stud. It comes with installation hardware, printed instructions, and a lifetime guarantee against defects.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "text": "Delta Leonardo Single Bicycle Rack with Da Vinci Tire Tray( Colors may vary) Store your bike easily and with a bit of panache with the stylish, curvy Delta Leonardo wall-mounted single bike rack. Elegantly designed with a silver finish, it's perfect for storing a bike in space-limited apartments or in the back hall. The Leonardo holds the front wheel with a rubber coated arm. It conveniently accommodates any wheel size--from touring to phat, chunky mountain tires--and can hold a maximum load of 40 pounds. It should be mounted to a wall stud. It comes with installation hardware, printed instructions, and a lifetime guarantee against defects.About Delta CycleFor more than 20 years, Delta Cycle has created useful cycling products with a mission to make an innovative difference. The company works hard to make their products better and deliver superior value. Delta Cycle offers only a small, concentrated product line that represents the best there is in each category.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jCGgeun1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FGTTEW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 16.93}}
