{"item_id": "B000FHGFWU", "title": "NcStar 1x42 B-Style Red Dot Sight/Weaver Base (DBB142)", "description": "1x42 B-Style Red Dot Sight w/Base Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1X - Objective Diameter(mm): 42.00 - Reticle: Red Dot - Dot Size: 3 MOA - Click Value: 1 MOA - Exterior Finish: Black Aluminum - Lens Coating: Ruby - Net Weight (oz.): 6.80 - Lenth (in): 3.15 - Mount: Integrated Weaver style", "text": "NcStar 1x42 B-Style Red Dot Sight/Weaver Base (DBB142) 1x42 B-Style Red Dot Sight w/Base Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1X - Objective Diameter(mm): 42.00 - Reticle: Red Dot - Dot Size: 3 MOA - Click Value: 1 MOA - Exterior Finish: Black Aluminum - Lens Coating: Ruby - Net Weight (oz.): 6.80 - Lenth (in): 3.15 - Mount: Integrated Weaver style", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TGivZwTCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FHGFWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 31.0}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6SGM", "title": "Reliance Fold-A-Carrier II 5 Gallon Water Container", "description": "The Fold-A-Carrier II is a collapsible water container with an integrated handle. Made from a single mold, this feature maximizes the containers reliability. The new design is a modern look to its tried and true predecessor.Generously sized molded-in handle and bottom finger grips for simple pouring and carrying - even with gloves on..Durable and easy-to-use when filled... Portable and packable when empty..", "text": "Reliance Fold-A-Carrier II 5 Gallon Water Container The Fold-A-Carrier II is a collapsible water container with an integrated handle. Made from a single mold, this feature maximizes the containers reliability. The new design is a modern look to its tried and true predecessor.Generously sized molded-in handle and bottom finger grips for simple pouring and carrying - even with gloves on..Durable and easy-to-use when filled... Portable and packable when empty..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pHECxlL8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6SGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6WSG", "title": "Topeak QR Beam Rack EX Bicycle Rack", "description": "A lighter duty version of the Rack EX for mountain bike and commuter use. Improved QR mechanism is more secure and easier to use and the rack is compatible with all MTX Trunk Bags with a 15-pound carrying capacity. Includes hidden storage tray, rubber bungee and safety reflector.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Aluminum beamPlastic Cargo Deck BagBag-compatibile with MTX QuickTrack SystemStorage TraySafety ReflectorRedLite MountTail Light MountSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 15 poundsSize 20 by 5 by 3 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.49 pounds", "text": "Topeak QR Beam Rack EX Bicycle Rack A lighter duty version of the Rack EX for mountain bike and commuter use. Improved QR mechanism is more secure and easier to use and the rack is compatible with all MTX Trunk Bags with a 15-pound carrying capacity. Includes hidden storage tray, rubber bungee and safety reflector.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Aluminum beamPlastic Cargo Deck BagBag-compatibile with MTX QuickTrack SystemStorage TraySafety ReflectorRedLite MountTail Light MountSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 15 poundsSize 20 by 5 by 3 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.49 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310WJ8VGGXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6WSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6WXQ", "title": "Topeak MTX Rear Bicycle Basket", "description": "", "text": "Topeak MTX Rear Bicycle Basket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CK1APRVBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6WXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6X4Y", "title": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Small", "description": "Sleek, aero-shaped wedge pack can carry tools, food, wallets, keys, maps and anything else you need for your adventures. Unique, positive locking two-piece rail fixer securely attaches bag to seat and allows you to remove it in a snap. Features a built-in pump holder for convenient storage, 3M reflective trim for increased safety. The tail-light attachment accommodates a flashing safety light (sold separately).Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Dupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 40 cubic inchesSize: 6.7 by 3.1 by 4.7 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 3.7 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "text": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Small Sleek, aero-shaped wedge pack can carry tools, food, wallets, keys, maps and anything else you need for your adventures. Unique, positive locking two-piece rail fixer securely attaches bag to seat and allows you to remove it in a snap. Features a built-in pump holder for convenient storage, 3M reflective trim for increased safety. The tail-light attachment accommodates a flashing safety light (sold separately).Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Dupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 40 cubic inchesSize: 6.7 by 3.1 by 4.7 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 3.7 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X116CAZXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6X4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 27.95}}
