{"item_id": "B000FI6XF8", "title": "Topeak Twinhead Bicycle Floor Pump Upgrade Kit", "description": "", "text": "Topeak Twinhead Bicycle Floor Pump Upgrade Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318CEWPPCNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6XF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6XGC", "title": "Topeak Pocket Rocket Master Blaster Bike Pump", "description": "The Pocket Rocket Master Blaster from Topeak is a lightweight mini pump designed for road use, with an efficient design that pumps to 160 psi. Weighing in at just 4.05 ounces, the Pocket Rocket features alloy barrel construction with a soft Kraton head and plastic handle for a secure grip as you pump. Road-ready, the Pocket Rocket has an integrated dust cap that keeps the head clean and ready. The Pocket Rocket mounts easily to your bike frame with a mounting bracket and is both Schrader and Presta compatible.Specifications:Capacity: 160 psi / 11 barSize: 8.7 by 1.7 by 1.0 inches / 22.2 x 4.2 x 2.5 centimeter (LxWxH)Weight: 115 grams / 4.05 ouncesHead: Presta/Schrader/Dunlop with Integrated Dust CapBarrel: Butted AluminumThumb Lock: AluminumHandle: PlasticAdded Features: Kraton HeadMounting Bracket", "text": "Topeak Pocket Rocket Master Blaster Bike Pump The Pocket Rocket Master Blaster from Topeak is a lightweight mini pump designed for road use, with an efficient design that pumps to 160 psi. Weighing in at just 4.05 ounces, the Pocket Rocket features alloy barrel construction with a soft Kraton head and plastic handle for a secure grip as you pump. Road-ready, the Pocket Rocket has an integrated dust cap that keeps the head clean and ready. The Pocket Rocket mounts easily to your bike frame with a mounting bracket and is both Schrader and Presta compatible.Specifications:Capacity: 160 psi / 11 barSize: 8.7 by 1.7 by 1.0 inches / 22.2 x 4.2 x 2.5 centimeter (LxWxH)Weight: 115 grams / 4.05 ouncesHead: Presta/Schrader/Dunlop with Integrated Dust CapBarrel: Butted AluminumThumb Lock: AluminumHandle: PlasticAdded Features: Kraton HeadMounting Bracket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ZJlm6XAsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6XGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6XGW", "title": "Topeak Speed Master Blaster Bike Pump", "description": "Slightly longer than the Topeak Pocket Master Blaster, this pump allows you to pump more air per stroke for efficient pumping. Machine-cut aluminum barrel ensures a smooth stroke for maximum output. Integrated seal and dust cap keep out the road grime, so you always have a clean pump. Padded pump head provides an easy grip; internal bayonet handle lock holds pump shut. Aluminum thumb lock is durable and easy to use.", "text": "Topeak Speed Master Blaster Bike Pump Slightly longer than the Topeak Pocket Master Blaster, this pump allows you to pump more air per stroke for efficient pumping. Machine-cut aluminum barrel ensures a smooth stroke for maximum output. Integrated seal and dust cap keep out the road grime, so you always have a clean pump. Padded pump head provides an easy grip; internal bayonet handle lock holds pump shut. Aluminum thumb lock is durable and easy to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bw4630PZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6XGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 23.28}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6XJE", "title": "Topeak Mountain Morph Bike Pump", "description": "", "text": "Topeak Mountain Morph Bike Pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312MTS3MGPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6XJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6YJS", "title": "Topeak Explorer Bicycle Rack with Disc Brake Mounts and Spring", "description": "The Explorer is a classic loaded touring rack designed for compatibility with disc brakes that's built to carry larger, heavier loads. 6061-T6 aluminum construction with 6061-T6 aluminum bracket, hollow aluminum tubes, and stainless steel hardware makes it strong and lightweight while the integrated top fender offers splash protection. The QuickTrack mounting system is compatible with Topeak MTX trunk bags and the rack fits all frames with disc brakes. Includes all mounting hardware.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Fits all frames with disc brakesBraze-on type attachmentsMTX QuickTrack system compatibleSolid fender topRedLite mountTail light mountMade of strong and lightweight hollow 6061 T-6 aluminumSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 55 poundsSize 13.6 by 9.3 by 16.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.76 pounds", "text": "Topeak Explorer Bicycle Rack with Disc Brake Mounts and Spring The Explorer is a classic loaded touring rack designed for compatibility with disc brakes that's built to carry larger, heavier loads. 6061-T6 aluminum construction with 6061-T6 aluminum bracket, hollow aluminum tubes, and stainless steel hardware makes it strong and lightweight while the integrated top fender offers splash protection. The QuickTrack mounting system is compatible with Topeak MTX trunk bags and the rack fits all frames with disc brakes. Includes all mounting hardware.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Fits all frames with disc brakesBraze-on type attachmentsMTX QuickTrack system compatibleSolid fender topRedLite mountTail light mountMade of strong and lightweight hollow 6061 T-6 aluminumSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 55 poundsSize 13.6 by 9.3 by 16.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.76 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E63eG6cIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6YJS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6YN4", "title": "Topeak Rain Cover for MTX Trunk Bag EXP and DXP", "description": "", "text": "Topeak Rain Cover for MTX Trunk Bag EXP and DXP", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SSW03BQ8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6YN4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6YOS", "title": "Topeak Road Morph G Bike Pump with Gauge", "description": "Every dedicated cyclist needs a good portable pump for his or her training rides. However, many on-the-go pumps are somewhat clunky and not all that easy to use. Enter the Topeak Road Morph G, which packs floor pump efficiency and ease of use into a compact, portable design you can bring along for the ride. The Road Morph G boasts a clever foldout footpad that stabilizes the pump against the ground rather than your hand, creating a comfortable, efficient pumping motion. Plus, the pump's flexible air hose makes it easy to work with awkward or tight valve placements while also helping prevent valve stem damage. Other features include an extra-long barrel, an inline gauge, a secure mounting bracket, a Presta/Schrader head, and a plastic thumb lock. The Road Morph G measures 2.2 by 13.8 by 1.1 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 0.49 pounds.", "text": "Topeak Road Morph G Bike Pump with Gauge Every dedicated cyclist needs a good portable pump for his or her training rides. However, many on-the-go pumps are somewhat clunky and not all that easy to use. Enter the Topeak Road Morph G, which packs floor pump efficiency and ease of use into a compact, portable design you can bring along for the ride. The Road Morph G boasts a clever foldout footpad that stabilizes the pump against the ground rather than your hand, creating a comfortable, efficient pumping motion. Plus, the pump's flexible air hose makes it easy to work with awkward or tight valve placements while also helping prevent valve stem damage. Other features include an extra-long barrel, an inline gauge, a secure mounting bracket, a Presta/Schrader head, and a plastic thumb lock. The Road Morph G measures 2.2 by 13.8 by 1.1 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 0.49 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YZKT5X06L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6YOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 35.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6YQG", "title": "Topeak F55 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount", "description": "The product is Topeak F55 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount", "text": "Topeak F55 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount The product is Topeak F55 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N05X7H29L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6YQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FI6YR0", "title": "Topeak F66 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount", "description": "The F-66 Stem Cap Fixer is a stem cap mount for Topeak tool and battery packs. Simply replace your current stem cap with this mount and you'll be able to clip you favorite Topeak items on top of your stem.", "text": "Topeak F66 Fixer for Phone Pack, Tool Bags & Moonshine 3H/HID Battery Mount The F-66 Stem Cap Fixer is a stem cap mount for Topeak tool and battery packs. Simply replace your current stem cap with this mount and you'll be able to clip you favorite Topeak items on top of your stem.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4188ZXE656L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FI6YR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FIAPXO", "title": "Reliance Products Luggable Loo Portable 5 Gallon Toilet", "description": "Affordably priced, the 5-gallon Luggable Loo portable toilet from Reliance Products offers a simple bucket style design and traditional snap-on lid. Rugged enough for any outdoor adventure--such as hunting, fishing and camping--it's compatible with standard Double Doodie bag from Reliance Products, which means virtually no clean-up and waste disposal is a snap when used together.", "text": "Reliance Products Luggable Loo Portable 5 Gallon Toilet Affordably priced, the 5-gallon Luggable Loo portable toilet from Reliance Products offers a simple bucket style design and traditional snap-on lid. Rugged enough for any outdoor adventure--such as hunting, fishing and camping--it's compatible with standard Double Doodie bag from Reliance Products, which means virtually no clean-up and waste disposal is a snap when used together.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O9UaiOc2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIAPXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 28.65}}
{"item_id": "B000FIATP8", "title": "Topeak Red Lite 4-LED Ultra-Bright Rear Bicycle Light", "description": "A ultra-bright 3 LED tail light with wide angle lens. Features a steady and blinking function. 3 ultra bright L.E.D. tail light, with on/off, blinking and steady selection. Wide angle (220 degree) reflective lens. Mounts to seat post, Topeak seat bags, or seat stay. Bulb: 3 L.E.D. / 10000 hrs (life time). Battery: Lithium Battery. Burn Time: 60 hrs (constant hour). Weight: 16 grams (without battery).", "text": "Topeak Red Lite 4-LED Ultra-Bright Rear Bicycle Light A ultra-bright 3 LED tail light with wide angle lens. Features a steady and blinking function. 3 ultra bright L.E.D. tail light, with on/off, blinking and steady selection. Wide angle (220 degree) reflective lens. Mounts to seat post, Topeak seat bags, or seat stay. Bulb: 3 L.E.D. / 10000 hrs (life time). Battery: Lithium Battery. Burn Time: 60 hrs (constant hour). Weight: 16 grams (without battery).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MTDRWSQRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIATP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FIATYY", "title": "Topeak MTX DeFender Bicycle Fender", "description": "", "text": "Topeak MTX DeFender Bicycle Fender", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CPHQdxdXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIATYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B000FIATZ8", "title": "Topeak Explorer Rack", "description": "Topeak Explorer Rear Mount Rack features an integrated top plate for quick-mount Topeak MTX and RX Quick Track trunk bags. Features: Size (LxWxH): 13.4\" x 5.6\" x 16.3\" One size fits all frames Tough 6061 T6 aluminum construction with 6061 T6 aluminum fitting bracket Hollow tube O/D 10.2mm Integrated top plate for quick-mount Topeak MTX and RX Quick Track trunk bags Integrated fender top", "text": "Topeak Explorer Rack Topeak Explorer Rear Mount Rack features an integrated top plate for quick-mount Topeak MTX and RX Quick Track trunk bags. Features: Size (LxWxH): 13.4\" x 5.6\" x 16.3\" One size fits all frames Tough 6061 T6 aluminum construction with 6061 T6 aluminum fitting bracket Hollow tube O/D 10.2mm Integrated top plate for quick-mount Topeak MTX and RX Quick Track trunk bags Integrated fender top", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V3XMTMMGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIATZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 41.0}}
{"item_id": "B000FIAU0W", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP with Side Panniers", "description": "Tired of carrying your clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX trunk bag EXP, which boasts 1,010 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike. The MTX trunk bag offers plenty of storage options, with a divided main compartment and an expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers.The trunk bag features a top carrying handle and elastic top bungees.As a result, you can fit several smaller items in the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible, water-repellent 420-denier nylon construction. And once you arrive at your destination, you can carry the MTX trunk bag EXP just like a messenger bag thanks to the included shoulder strap. Other features include a carrying handle, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, molded EVA foam insulation, elastic top bungees, and an optional rain cover (sold separately). The bag--which is compatible with the MTX QuickTrack rack--measures 9.8 by 14.1 by 8.5 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.36 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP with Side Panniers Tired of carrying your clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX trunk bag EXP, which boasts 1,010 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike. The MTX trunk bag offers plenty of storage options, with a divided main compartment and an expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers.The trunk bag features a top carrying handle and elastic top bungees.As a result, you can fit several smaller items in the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible, water-repellent 420-denier nylon construction. And once you arrive at your destination, you can carry the MTX trunk bag EXP just like a messenger bag thanks to the included shoulder strap. Other features include a carrying handle, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, molded EVA foam insulation, elastic top bungees, and an optional rain cover (sold separately). The bag--which is compatible with the MTX QuickTrack rack--measures 9.8 by 14.1 by 8.5 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.36 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414B5JQFHKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIAU0W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIAU2U", "title": "RX Trunk Bag EX", "description": "The compact design of the RX TrunkBag EX for road bikes expands with two side compartments for extra capacity. Rigid foam insulates and holds shape and is aerodynamic for road and fitness bikes. Fits RX QuickTrack system with a top-mounted carry handle for off-bike use, protective and water-repellent molded panels, a Dupont Teflon coating for water resistance, an elastic top bungees.QuickTrack is an ingeniously simple attachment system which allows our TrunkBags to interface securely to a RX rack. Simply slide your TrunkBag forward in the track until it locks in place. Push the release button and your TrunkBag slides off the track and goes with you.Features:Top mounted carry handle for off-bike use3M reflective strip for increased nighttime visibilityMolded panels are protective and water repellentOptional rain cover provides additional protectionIncludes shoulder strap for off-bike useDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistanceCarry handle3M reflective stripRedLite clipElastic top bungeesOptional rain coverRX QuickTrack System compatibleSpecifications:Capacity: 170 cubic inchesMax. Load Limited to Rack Maximum Load RatingMaterial 600 Denier PolyesterDimensions: 12.2 by 7.5 by 5.9 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.25 pounds", "text": "RX Trunk Bag EX The compact design of the RX TrunkBag EX for road bikes expands with two side compartments for extra capacity. Rigid foam insulates and holds shape and is aerodynamic for road and fitness bikes. Fits RX QuickTrack system with a top-mounted carry handle for off-bike use, protective and water-repellent molded panels, a Dupont Teflon coating for water resistance, an elastic top bungees.QuickTrack is an ingeniously simple attachment system which allows our TrunkBags to interface securely to a RX rack. Simply slide your TrunkBag forward in the track until it locks in place. Push the release button and your TrunkBag slides off the track and goes with you.Features:Top mounted carry handle for off-bike use3M reflective strip for increased nighttime visibilityMolded panels are protective and water repellentOptional rain cover provides additional protectionIncludes shoulder strap for off-bike useDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistanceCarry handle3M reflective stripRedLite clipElastic top bungeesOptional rain coverRX QuickTrack System compatibleSpecifications:Capacity: 170 cubic inchesMax. Load Limited to Rack Maximum Load RatingMaterial 600 Denier PolyesterDimensions: 12.2 by 7.5 by 5.9 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.25 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gKxYfxuIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIAU2U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIAU8O", "title": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack with Buckle (Medium)", "description": "Expanding compartments can boost your storage space in seconds.The Topeak Aero Wedge Pack is a convenient gear-toting solution that clips instantly to the back of your bike's saddle and seat post. Constructed of rugged 1,200-denier Cordura material with DuPont Teflon coating for weather resistance, the pack attaches with a Velcro strap mount and snap-on buckles. The expandable bag's large main opening offers room for all of your essential road gear, and a 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment offer safety-minded touches.Specifications130-gram (0.29-pound) weight60-to-80-cubic-inch capacityMeasures 4.1-by-4.7-by-7.9 inches (W x H x D)", "text": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack with Buckle (Medium) Expanding compartments can boost your storage space in seconds.The Topeak Aero Wedge Pack is a convenient gear-toting solution that clips instantly to the back of your bike's saddle and seat post. Constructed of rugged 1,200-denier Cordura material with DuPont Teflon coating for weather resistance, the pack attaches with a Velcro strap mount and snap-on buckles. The expandable bag's large main opening offers room for all of your essential road gear, and a 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment offer safety-minded touches.Specifications130-gram (0.29-pound) weight60-to-80-cubic-inch capacityMeasures 4.1-by-4.7-by-7.9 inches (W x H x D)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LykY0D%2B8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIAU8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FIAUAC", "title": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Medium", "description": "Sleek, aero-shaped wedge pack can carry tools, food, wallets, keys, maps and anything else you need for your adventures. Unique, positive locking two-piece rail fixer securely attaches bag to seat and allows you to remove it in a snap. Features a built-in pump holder for convenient storage, 3M reflective trim for increased safety. The b ag expands to accommodate extra gear and the tail-light attachment accommodates a flashing safety light (sold separately).Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 60 - 80 cubic inchesSize: 7.9 by 4.1 by 4.7 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 4.75 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "text": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Medium Sleek, aero-shaped wedge pack can carry tools, food, wallets, keys, maps and anything else you need for your adventures. Unique, positive locking two-piece rail fixer securely attaches bag to seat and allows you to remove it in a snap. Features a built-in pump holder for convenient storage, 3M reflective trim for increased safety. The b ag expands to accommodate extra gear and the tail-light attachment accommodates a flashing safety light (sold separately).Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 60 - 80 cubic inchesSize: 7.9 by 4.1 by 4.7 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 4.75 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412JNJ8HY5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIAUAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 27.0}}
