{"item_id": "B000FIDZLI", "title": "Reliance Products Hassock Portable Lightweight Self-Contained Toilet (colors may vary)", "description": "Hassock Portable Toilet features a lightweight design and is self-contained. It has a contoured seat for \"at-home\" comfort. There is a removable inner bucket for quick and easy waste disposal. It also has a an inner splash cover/toilet paper holder. It is ideal for for hunters, campers and boaters.", "text": "Reliance Products Hassock Portable Lightweight Self-Contained Toilet (colors may vary) Hassock Portable Toilet features a lightweight design and is self-contained. It has a contoured seat for \"at-home\" comfort. There is a removable inner bucket for quick and easy waste disposal. It also has a an inner splash cover/toilet paper holder. It is ideal for for hunters, campers and boaters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h39dwv7xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIDZLI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 46.75}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE3WI", "title": "Topeak Explorer Bike Rack", "description": "All critical support points are precision welded for optimal strength.The Topeak Explorer Rear Rack is a durable, versatile bike cargo rack for long distance touring. The integrated top plate accepts all Topeak MTX QuickTrack-compatible bags. 6061 hollow aluminum construction is tough yet lightweight, and red/taillight mounts offer safety-minded touches.QuickTrack SystemTopeak's proprietary QuickTrack system makes it easy to mount compatible bags or baskets to a rear rack�simply slide, and click. Line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack, and slide forward until it clicks into place. Without tools or straps, your bag's now securely in place and ready to ride. To remove, you push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket free.Specifications620-gram (1.38-pound) weight55-pound maximum weight capacityMeasures 9.3-by-16.1-by-13.6 inches (W x H x D)", "text": "Topeak Explorer Bike Rack All critical support points are precision welded for optimal strength.The Topeak Explorer Rear Rack is a durable, versatile bike cargo rack for long distance touring. The integrated top plate accepts all Topeak MTX QuickTrack-compatible bags. 6061 hollow aluminum construction is tough yet lightweight, and red/taillight mounts offer safety-minded touches.QuickTrack SystemTopeak's proprietary QuickTrack system makes it easy to mount compatible bags or baskets to a rear rack�simply slide, and click. Line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack, and slide forward until it clicks into place. Without tools or straps, your bag's now securely in place and ready to ride. To remove, you push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket free.Specifications620-gram (1.38-pound) weight55-pound maximum weight capacityMeasures 9.3-by-16.1-by-13.6 inches (W x H x D)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S7AFQ3QJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE3WI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE44U", "title": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ strap mount, Micro", "description": "The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. It's a traditional triple nylon/Velcro strap mount with snap-buckles and is made from 1200 denier Cordura with PTFE coating. A 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment location adds to the features of this small seat pack.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 25 cubic inchesSize: 5.9 by 2.9 by 3.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 3.06 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "text": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ strap mount, Micro The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. It's a traditional triple nylon/Velcro strap mount with snap-buckles and is made from 1200 denier Cordura with PTFE coating. A 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment location adds to the features of this small seat pack.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 25 cubic inchesSize: 5.9 by 2.9 by 3.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 3.06 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DQ4GYEYVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE44U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE45O", "title": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack with Strap mount (Large)", "description": "The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. The Large Wedge is the perfect size for a mountain bike tube and essential tools for off-road riders.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 90 - 120 cubic inchesSize: 8.3 by 4.9 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 6.2 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "text": "Topeak Aero Wedge Pack with Strap mount (Large) The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. The Large Wedge is the perfect size for a mountain bike tube and essential tools for off-road riders.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 90 - 120 cubic inchesSize: 8.3 by 4.9 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 6.2 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zMh9NtwmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE45O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 22.36}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE47C", "title": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Large", "description": "The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. The Large Wedge is the perfect size for a mountain bike tube and essential tools for off-road riders.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 90 - 120 cubic inchesSize: 8.3 by 4.9 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 6.2 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "text": "Aero Wedge Pack, w/ Fixer F25, Large The aerodynamic wedge shape of this seat pack lets it slip easily through the wind while the internal pockets keep tools away from inner tubes and other delicate items. The Large Wedge is the perfect size for a mountain bike tube and essential tools for off-road riders.Features:1000 denier nylonQuickClick with seatpost strap (F11)Expanding compartment adds extra spaceDupont Teflon coating for water and stain resistance3M reflective stripRedLite clipSpecifications:Capacity: 90 - 120 cubic inchesSize: 8.3 by 4.9 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 6.2 ouncesWhat's QuickClick?Topeak's QuickClick system is built into every bag they make. Convenience and secure, QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick-release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories. A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515XJBFG3SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE47C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 37.95}}
