{"item_id": "B000FIE4AE", "title": "Topeak Alien II 26-Function Bicycle Tool", "description": "Often copied but never duplicated, the award-winning Alien II multifunction bicycle tool is still the best. The Alien II--which is designed for cyclists who need a high-quality tool while on the road--is housed in a clever break-apart body that makes it a breeze to find the right gadget. And with 26 high-quality, hardened-steel tools at your fingertips, you'll rarely find yourself without exactly what you need. The tools include 14g and 15g spoke wrenches, two integrated tire levers, a T25 Torx wrench, Phillips and flat-head screwdrivers, a mini pedal wrench for field repairs, eight sizes of Allen wrenches (2 through 10mm), six box wrenches (two 8, 9, and 10mm sizes), a steel wire chain hook, a stainless-steel knife, a cast Cromoly steel chain tool, and compartments for two chain pins. There's even a bottle opener for post-ride celebrations. The Alien II measures 3.4 by 1.7 by 1.6 inches (W x H x D) and comes with a ND nylon storage bag with a belt clip.", "text": "Topeak Alien II 26-Function Bicycle Tool Often copied but never duplicated, the award-winning Alien II multifunction bicycle tool is still the best. The Alien II--which is designed for cyclists who need a high-quality tool while on the road--is housed in a clever break-apart body that makes it a breeze to find the right gadget. And with 26 high-quality, hardened-steel tools at your fingertips, you'll rarely find yourself without exactly what you need. The tools include 14g and 15g spoke wrenches, two integrated tire levers, a T25 Torx wrench, Phillips and flat-head screwdrivers, a mini pedal wrench for field repairs, eight sizes of Allen wrenches (2 through 10mm), six box wrenches (two 8, 9, and 10mm sizes), a steel wire chain hook, a stainless-steel knife, a cast Cromoly steel chain tool, and compartments for two chain pins. There's even a bottle opener for post-ride celebrations. The Alien II measures 3.4 by 1.7 by 1.6 inches (W x H x D) and comes with a ND nylon storage bag with a belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JSSCR9M7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE4AE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 30.77}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE4EK", "title": "Topeak Super Bicycle Chain Tool", "description": "", "text": "Topeak Super Bicycle Chain Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A9W4T267L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE4EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE4GI", "title": "Topeak JoeBlow Pro Floor Bike Pump", "description": "Topeak's JoeBlow Pro Floor Pump offers outstanding performance and super durability. It features a top-mounted gauge with a pressure release button for perfect inflation. A padded ergonomic elastomer handle adds ease and comfort to your task. Smarthead technology means you never have to swap parts, as the head knows whether you have a Presta or Schrader valve. This pump includes ball and air bladder needles.", "text": "Topeak JoeBlow Pro Floor Bike Pump Topeak's JoeBlow Pro Floor Pump offers outstanding performance and super durability. It features a top-mounted gauge with a pressure release button for perfect inflation. A padded ergonomic elastomer handle adds ease and comfort to your task. Smarthead technology means you never have to swap parts, as the head knows whether you have a Presta or Schrader valve. This pump includes ball and air bladder needles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M5PPCVQBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE4GI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 84.96}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE4J0", "title": "Topeak JoeBlow Max II Floor Bike Pump", "description": "", "text": "Topeak JoeBlow Max II Floor Bike Pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3116C5BERAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE4J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FIE4JK", "title": "Topeak SmartHead Bicycle Floor Pump Upgrade Kit", "description": "Upgrade any existing bicycle pump by adding this SmartHead kit, which replaces your old or worn-out pump hose and head. SmartHead technology ensures that the adapter will work on both Presta and Schrader valves without requiring you to change any parts or buy two separate adapters. Plus, it's easy to install, with an aluminum thumb-lock lever that creates an airtight seal over the valve. The SmartHead measures 41.7 by 1.1 by 1.9 inches and 0.3 pounds.", "text": "Topeak SmartHead Bicycle Floor Pump Upgrade Kit Upgrade any existing bicycle pump by adding this SmartHead kit, which replaces your old or worn-out pump hose and head. SmartHead technology ensures that the adapter will work on both Presta and Schrader valves without requiring you to change any parts or buy two separate adapters. Plus, it's easy to install, with an aluminum thumb-lock lever that creates an airtight seal over the valve. The SmartHead measures 41.7 by 1.1 by 1.9 inches and 0.3 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oS3OsIxmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE4JK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 27.95}}
