{"item_id": "B000FIE5SU", "title": "Topeak Presta Valve Extension", "description": "Solution for deep section rims which obstruct mounting pump to valve . Threads onto opened Presta valve, has own seal/valve.", "text": "Topeak Presta Valve Extension Solution for deep section rims which obstruct mounting pump to valve . Threads onto opened Presta valve, has own seal/valve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21H6CF67G6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIE5SU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIF7O6", "title": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Velo Gel Padded Cycling Short", "description": "The Canari Men's Velo Gel Cycling Shorts are great fitting functional cycling short with the Canari gel chamois. The Pro weight Nylon and Lycra fabric is heavy, durable and supportive. The stretch and fit is firmer, providing support to the quad muscle groups while maintaining its highly breathable and quick drying properties. The unique Canari gel chamois pad spreads road shock throughout the saddle region rather than concentrating in one specific area for a more comfortable ride. The eight panel anatomical design along with the flat seam stitch construction offer you a great fitting short that performs. Other features include a soft touch leg gripper and an 8\" inseam. Material: (Body) Pro-Weight Nylon, Lycra Fabric. Size Chart (Waist Measurement); SM 28-30, MD 30-32, LG 32-34, XL 36-38, XXL 40-42.", "text": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Velo Gel Padded Cycling Short The Canari Men's Velo Gel Cycling Shorts are great fitting functional cycling short with the Canari gel chamois. The Pro weight Nylon and Lycra fabric is heavy, durable and supportive. The stretch and fit is firmer, providing support to the quad muscle groups while maintaining its highly breathable and quick drying properties. The unique Canari gel chamois pad spreads road shock throughout the saddle region rather than concentrating in one specific area for a more comfortable ride. The eight panel anatomical design along with the flat seam stitch construction offer you a great fitting short that performs. Other features include a soft touch leg gripper and an 8\" inseam. Material: (Body) Pro-Weight Nylon, Lycra Fabric. Size Chart (Waist Measurement); SM 28-30, MD 30-32, LG 32-34, XL 36-38, XXL 40-42.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41csanjpHFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIF7O6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIISSS", "title": "Shimano FXC 2 Piece Casting Rod", "description": "", "text": "Shimano FXC 2 Piece Casting Rod", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21P302YLu9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIISSS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Baitcasting Rods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIN3VU", "title": "CamelBak Omega HydroTanium Replacement Reservoir", "description": "The CamelBak Omega HydroTanium Replacement Reservoir is the heart and soul of the best trail hydration systems. Always durable and leak proof, the advanced design is now stronger, tougher, and more reliable. The HydroGuard anti-microbial technology eliminates up to 99.99% of common bacteria and fungus. Featuring an extra-large opening for easy filling and cleaning, it comes with the CamelBak patented Big Bite Valve for drinking without spillage. And it's easy to use--just grip the ergonomic handle, fill to the brim, screw down the secure cap, and you're ready to go. CamelBak will back up this reservoir with a lifetime warranty.", "text": "CamelBak Omega HydroTanium Replacement Reservoir The CamelBak Omega HydroTanium Replacement Reservoir is the heart and soul of the best trail hydration systems. Always durable and leak proof, the advanced design is now stronger, tougher, and more reliable. The HydroGuard anti-microbial technology eliminates up to 99.99% of common bacteria and fungus. Featuring an extra-large opening for easy filling and cleaning, it comes with the CamelBak patented Big Bite Valve for drinking without spillage. And it's easy to use--just grip the ergonomic handle, fill to the brim, screw down the secure cap, and you're ready to go. CamelBak will back up this reservoir with a lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EEWcgt1YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIN3VU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FIWADW", "title": "Shimano FXS 2 Piece Spinning Rod", "description": "Designed for anglers of all ages and skill levels, FX two-piece rods are built from durable aeroglass fiberglass and feature comfortable EVA handles. With solid locking graphite reel seats and reinforced aluminum oxide guides, the FX Series offers quality you can count on for all kinds of freshwater and light saltwater applications.SpecificationsModelLengthPowerActionLine RatingLure RatingPiecesForegrip LengthReargrip LengthGuide NumberHandle StylesFXS60MB26 feetMediumFast6-141/8-1/222.5 inches6.5 inchesTip+4BFXS66MB26 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-141/4-5/822.5 inches7.5 inchesTip+4CFXS70MB27 feetMediumFast6-141/4-5/823 inches8 inchesTip+5D", "text": "Shimano FXS 2 Piece Spinning Rod Designed for anglers of all ages and skill levels, FX two-piece rods are built from durable aeroglass fiberglass and feature comfortable EVA handles. With solid locking graphite reel seats and reinforced aluminum oxide guides, the FX Series offers quality you can count on for all kinds of freshwater and light saltwater applications.SpecificationsModelLengthPowerActionLine RatingLure RatingPiecesForegrip LengthReargrip LengthGuide NumberHandle StylesFXS60MB26 feetMediumFast6-141/8-1/222.5 inches6.5 inchesTip+4BFXS66MB26 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-141/4-5/822.5 inches7.5 inchesTip+4CFXS70MB27 feetMediumFast6-141/4-5/823 inches8 inchesTip+5D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vOxechTVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FIWADW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Spinning Rods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FJ60LY", "title": "CamelBak BPA-Free Better Bottle with Bite Valve", "description": "The CamelBak Better Bottle represents a new standard of performance and convenience in re-usable water bottles. Available in multiple colors and in three sizes--1 liter, 0.75 liter, and 0.5 liter--this innovative bottle is also BPA- and Phthalate-free. The bottle's integrated handle makes it easy to carry with the crook of a finger or clip to a backpack with a carabiner. CamelBak's Big Bite Valve offers a proven design that contains no moving parts--just bite and sip for easy hydration. The cap fits most other bottles and the Better Bottle attaches to most water filters and fits in most cup holders. It's dishwasher safe.The Better Bottle with Big Bite Valve makes it easy to hydrate on the go.What is BPA?Bisphenol-A is an ingredient used to make polycarbonate. In recent months, there has been increasing consumer demand for a bottle that is not made with Bisphenol-A (BPA), and CamelBak is proud to introduce BPA-free bottles with the same great properties customers have come to expect from polycarbonate: vibrant color, clarity, durability, dishwasher-safe, and with no residual taste. As of the end of April 2008, the entire CamelBak bottle line will be available in BPA-Free materials in North America.What are phthalates?Phthalates (pronounced thal-ates) are a component added to some plastics to make them soft and pliable. None of CamelBak's bottles have ever contained phthalates.What is the BPA-free Better Bottle made from?The CamelBak Better Bottle line is made from a new copolyester polymer called Tritan, made by Eastman. It offers the same great qualities that we have come to expect from polycarbonate bottles and is 100 percent BPA-Free. The Big Bite Valve is made of medical-grade silicone for long life and taste-free performance.About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "text": "CamelBak BPA-Free Better Bottle with Bite Valve The CamelBak Better Bottle represents a new standard of performance and convenience in re-usable water bottles. Available in multiple colors and in three sizes--1 liter, 0.75 liter, and 0.5 liter--this innovative bottle is also BPA- and Phthalate-free. The bottle's integrated handle makes it easy to carry with the crook of a finger or clip to a backpack with a carabiner. CamelBak's Big Bite Valve offers a proven design that contains no moving parts--just bite and sip for easy hydration. The cap fits most other bottles and the Better Bottle attaches to most water filters and fits in most cup holders. It's dishwasher safe.The Better Bottle with Big Bite Valve makes it easy to hydrate on the go.What is BPA?Bisphenol-A is an ingredient used to make polycarbonate. In recent months, there has been increasing consumer demand for a bottle that is not made with Bisphenol-A (BPA), and CamelBak is proud to introduce BPA-free bottles with the same great properties customers have come to expect from polycarbonate: vibrant color, clarity, durability, dishwasher-safe, and with no residual taste. As of the end of April 2008, the entire CamelBak bottle line will be available in BPA-Free materials in North America.What are phthalates?Phthalates (pronounced thal-ates) are a component added to some plastics to make them soft and pliable. None of CamelBak's bottles have ever contained phthalates.What is the BPA-free Better Bottle made from?The CamelBak Better Bottle line is made from a new copolyester polymer called Tritan, made by Eastman. It offers the same great qualities that we have come to expect from polycarbonate bottles and is 100 percent BPA-Free. The Big Bite Valve is made of medical-grade silicone for long life and taste-free performance.About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PNh0UK%2BRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJ60LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 13.13}}
{"item_id": "B000FJ6LGS", "title": "FuelBelt Wachusett Belt", "description": "Named after one of New England's local mountain peaks, the Wachusett Belt is the FuelBelt workhorse. One size fits all design is perfect for those who go through several layers of clothing, depending on the season.Bottle cord locks.20 oz total capacity.One size fits most.", "text": "FuelBelt Wachusett Belt Named after one of New England's local mountain peaks, the Wachusett Belt is the FuelBelt workhorse. One size fits all design is perfect for those who go through several layers of clothing, depending on the season.Bottle cord locks.20 oz total capacity.One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cAnZoEikL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJ6LGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FuelBelt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 22.05}}
{"item_id": "B000FJEZAC", "title": "Soft Rubber Ammo", "description": "Ammunition, Soft Rubber Ammo, 20 Extra Shots", "text": "Soft Rubber Ammo Ammunition, Soft Rubber Ammo, 20 Extra Shots", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41657SII3yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJEZAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Parris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.75}}
{"item_id": "B000FJH4D2", "title": "Princeton Tec Apex 200 Lumen Headlamp", "description": "The biggest and brightest headlamp in our professional series, the Apex has been a favorite of extreme outdoorsmen and cavers for years. Truly the pinnacle of waterproof LED headlamp design, the Apex combines the qualities of both the EOS and the Quad. With a single Regulated Maxbright LED partnered with Four Regulated Ultrabright LEDs, the Apex provides either a powerful spot beam or a bright flood, and switching between the two is incredibly easy. The four Ultrabright LEDs come in red, green or white in order to suit your personal preference. Proprietary heatsink technology allows the LEDs to burn brighter and longer. The Apex is compatible with alkaline, lithium and rechargeable batteries.", "text": "Princeton Tec Apex 200 Lumen Headlamp The biggest and brightest headlamp in our professional series, the Apex has been a favorite of extreme outdoorsmen and cavers for years. Truly the pinnacle of waterproof LED headlamp design, the Apex combines the qualities of both the EOS and the Quad. With a single Regulated Maxbright LED partnered with Four Regulated Ultrabright LEDs, the Apex provides either a powerful spot beam or a bright flood, and switching between the two is incredibly easy. The four Ultrabright LEDs come in red, green or white in order to suit your personal preference. Proprietary heatsink technology allows the LEDs to burn brighter and longer. The Apex is compatible with alkaline, lithium and rechargeable batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GBax-Kw6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJH4D2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 76.98}}
{"item_id": "B000FJNBGG", "title": "Black Diamond Vario Speed Harness", "description": "The Black Diamond Vario Speed Harness' one-size-fits-all design allows your entire family or a whole climbing class to use it. A favorite of guides and climbing instructors, this Black Diamond harness includes fully adjustable waist and leg loops equipped with speed buckles for minimal hassle and increased safety. The pre-threaded buckles on the Vario Speed Harness eliminate the need to double back, so a beginning climber will never be in danger of forgetting. Black Diamond designed this harness with a single, durable tie-in point so you never look down to see your friend tied in incorrectly.", "text": "Black Diamond Vario Speed Harness The Black Diamond Vario Speed Harness' one-size-fits-all design allows your entire family or a whole climbing class to use it. A favorite of guides and climbing instructors, this Black Diamond harness includes fully adjustable waist and leg loops equipped with speed buckles for minimal hassle and increased safety. The pre-threaded buckles on the Vario Speed Harness eliminate the need to double back, so a beginning climber will never be in danger of forgetting. Black Diamond designed this harness with a single, durable tie-in point so you never look down to see your friend tied in incorrectly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51smq38XjvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJNBGG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Harnesses"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FJOTB2", "title": "Benchmade Mchenry and Williams Design Knife", "description": "The 710D2 features a slight reverse-curve grind for improved cutting efficiencies. Textured G10 covers the handle sides to provide for secure grip, and the double liners have finger treads positioned near the handle front for added control. Comes with movable steel carry-clip. Plain edge/satin finish coating, highly compressed epoxy and woven glass composite handle", "text": "Benchmade Mchenry and Williams Design Knife The 710D2 features a slight reverse-curve grind for improved cutting efficiencies. Textured G10 covers the handle sides to provide for secure grip, and the double liners have finger treads positioned near the handle front for added control. Comes with movable steel carry-clip. Plain edge/satin finish coating, highly compressed epoxy and woven glass composite handle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gYurlsYJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJOTB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 153.0}}
{"item_id": "B000FJQQIG", "title": "Ready America 3000 The Survival Box", "description": "Get the basic life supplies in a convenient, easy to store box. Provides enough food and water to sustain 1 person for 3 days. Each kit contains 6 individually sealed water pouches, 1-2400 calorie food bar and 1 lightweight, compact blanket which retains 90% body heat and can double as a rain poncho or shelter. 5 year shelf life, from date of manufacture, US Coast Guard approved food and water. Box is bilingual in Spanish and English. Keep one handy wherever you spend the most time.", "text": "Ready America 3000 The Survival Box Get the basic life supplies in a convenient, easy to store box. Provides enough food and water to sustain 1 person for 3 days. Each kit contains 6 individually sealed water pouches, 1-2400 calorie food bar and 1 lightweight, compact blanket which retains 90% body heat and can double as a rain poncho or shelter. 5 year shelf life, from date of manufacture, US Coast Guard approved food and water. Box is bilingual in Spanish and English. Keep one handy wherever you spend the most time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fu6dfIjRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJQQIG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 13.96}}
{"item_id": "B000FJR0MM", "title": "Bell Bike Stop Caliper Brake Set (colors may vary)", "description": "Universal caliper side pull brake set. Fits 20'' to 24'' bikes. For front and rear brakes. Includes brake caliper, brake lever, cable, and housing. Easy to install. Brake set comes in assorted colors; black, chrome, and white.", "text": "Bell Bike Stop Caliper Brake Set (colors may vary) Universal caliper side pull brake set. Fits 20'' to 24'' bikes. For front and rear brakes. Includes brake caliper, brake lever, cable, and housing. Easy to install. Brake set comes in assorted colors; black, chrome, and white.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fL55SMnmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJR0MM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes", "Rim Brake Sets"]], "price": 16.86}}
{"item_id": "B000FJR10S", "title": "8ft Fiberglass Beach Umbrella UPF 100+ - Heavy Duty", "description": "Our 8 foot wide canopy beach umbrella with heavy duty construction says goodbye forever to the frustrations of wimpy beach umbrellas. This wind-resistant double canopy design preserves its protective shape as it vents damaging wind with its flexible fiberglass ribs that will not kink or bend out of shape!Rapid Thumb release snap button as locking function to prevent upper and bottom pole splitting during wind gust. (more secure than lever type)Optional Sand Anchor device (sold separately) is recommended. copy and paste OR Type B00EZ7R6C4 in search box to purchase recommended sand anchor. It's built to hold your umbrellas pole firmly in the sand for maximum stability. It screws into the sand or turf and makes your umbrella much more secure.The 2014 Model has Silver coating under the canopy fabric provide much more uv sun protection and keeps it cooler under the umbrella compared to those without it.", "text": "8ft Fiberglass Beach Umbrella UPF 100+ - Heavy Duty Our 8 foot wide canopy beach umbrella with heavy duty construction says goodbye forever to the frustrations of wimpy beach umbrellas. This wind-resistant double canopy design preserves its protective shape as it vents damaging wind with its flexible fiberglass ribs that will not kink or bend out of shape!Rapid Thumb release snap button as locking function to prevent upper and bottom pole splitting during wind gust. (more secure than lever type)Optional Sand Anchor device (sold separately) is recommended. copy and paste OR Type B00EZ7R6C4 in search box to purchase recommended sand anchor. It's built to hold your umbrellas pole firmly in the sand for maximum stability. It screws into the sand or turf and makes your umbrella much more secure.The 2014 Model has Silver coating under the canopy fabric provide much more uv sun protection and keeps it cooler under the umbrella compared to those without it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q56jCFXHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FJR10S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shadezilla", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]], "price": 68.75}}
{"item_id": "B000FK5PWI", "title": "Razor A3 Kick Scooter", "description": "The original kick scooter just got a whole lot better, making it even more fun for kids and teens alike. Though it'll never replace the internal combustion engine, the Razor A3 will get your child from point A to point B much quicker than on foot alone, and requires just a few scoots of one's shoes in the process. Plus, it's a blast to use, as your progeny will likely attest.The Razor A3 is made of aircraft-grade aluminum, a sturdy material that holds up to use and abuse through the years. Razor combined the traditional aluminum construction, however, with a number of recent innovations, including a springless shock-absorbing system that makes bumpy pavement feel smoother than ever and an all-new wheelie bar that guarantees an extra dollop of fun. Add in such details as 125 mm urethane wheels, ABEC-5 high-speed bearings, a patented rear fender brake, and a patented folding mechanism and you have a great kick scooter for virtually any situation.This version of the Razor A3, which supports up to 143 pounds and is recommended for ages 6 and older. It's also backed by a six-month warranty. For the next step up, try theRazor Pro.Key Features:For riders ages 6 and olderSturdy aluminum constructionSpringless shock-absorbing systemRear fender brakeABEC-5 high-speed bearingsPatented folding mechanism143-pound user weight capacitySix-month warrantyThe buyer and rider of the Razor A3 scooter are responsible for knowing and obeying all local, state, and federal regulations regarding the riding and use of scooters.", "text": "Razor A3 Kick Scooter The original kick scooter just got a whole lot better, making it even more fun for kids and teens alike. Though it'll never replace the internal combustion engine, the Razor A3 will get your child from point A to point B much quicker than on foot alone, and requires just a few scoots of one's shoes in the process. Plus, it's a blast to use, as your progeny will likely attest.The Razor A3 is made of aircraft-grade aluminum, a sturdy material that holds up to use and abuse through the years. Razor combined the traditional aluminum construction, however, with a number of recent innovations, including a springless shock-absorbing system that makes bumpy pavement feel smoother than ever and an all-new wheelie bar that guarantees an extra dollop of fun. Add in such details as 125 mm urethane wheels, ABEC-5 high-speed bearings, a patented rear fender brake, and a patented folding mechanism and you have a great kick scooter for virtually any situation.This version of the Razor A3, which supports up to 143 pounds and is recommended for ages 6 and older. It's also backed by a six-month warranty. For the next step up, try theRazor Pro.Key Features:For riders ages 6 and olderSturdy aluminum constructionSpringless shock-absorbing systemRear fender brakeABEC-5 high-speed bearingsPatented folding mechanism143-pound user weight capacitySix-month warrantyThe buyer and rider of the Razor A3 scooter are responsible for knowing and obeying all local, state, and federal regulations regarding the riding and use of scooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3177%2B8tOa5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FK5PWI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters", "Kick Scooters"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FK7C56", "title": "Razor Pro Model Scooter", "description": "This is not your little brother's scooter.The Pro Model scooter comes with Razor's official Pro Rider-tested designation.Designed and tested by Team Razor professional freestyle riders, the Razor Pro Model scooter is built for rugged durability and pro-grade performance. Put through the paces by some of the best stunt riders in the world during a rigorous design and testing process, the Pro Model features a double-stacked head clamp for added head tube strength and a lightweight yet rigid body frame constructed of 100 percent aircraft-grade aluminum. Quite simply, there's no trick the Pro Model Scooter won't stand up to time and again.The scooter measures four by 25.5 by 7.25 inches (W x H x D) when fully assembled, weighs eight pounds, and additionally features extra-thick foam handles for an optimal balance of comfort and non-slip grip, a must for serious tricksters. Riders will appreciate the Pro Model's full-deck grip tape, which is specially designed by Team Razor pro rider Ricky Wernicke, and provides maximum traction both on the ground and in the air.Scooter Features:Designed and tested by Team Razor Pro Riders for durability and performanceFull deck grip tape designed by Team Razor Pro Rider Rickey Wernicke98-millimeter urethane wheels equipped with ABEC-5 high-speed bearingsDouble stacked head clamp for extra head tube strengthExtra thick foam grips for additional palm protectionPatented folding mechanism (US patent number 6,431,567 and 7,063,341)Patented rear fender brake (US patent number 6,139,035)Aircraft-grade aluminum for lightweight durabilityEasy to fold and carryBuilt with durability and professional-grade performance in mind, there's no trick the Pro Model can't handle in style.About RazorFounded in June 2000, Razor USA, LLC is a privately held company based in Cerritos, California. Creators of the wildly popular Razor kick scooter, Razor additionally offers the E100, E200, and E300 electric scooters, as well as Dirt Rocket, Pocket Mod, Pocket Rocket, and Ground Force electrically-powered ride-on toys and junior scooters. Razor has received numerous industry awards, including the Toy Industry Association's \"Toy of the Year\" and \"Toy of the Year\" honors fromTime Magazine,Parents,Parenting,Sports Illustrated for Kids,Nick Jr., andU.S. News & World Report.", "text": "Razor Pro Model Scooter This is not your little brother's scooter.The Pro Model scooter comes with Razor's official Pro Rider-tested designation.Designed and tested by Team Razor professional freestyle riders, the Razor Pro Model scooter is built for rugged durability and pro-grade performance. Put through the paces by some of the best stunt riders in the world during a rigorous design and testing process, the Pro Model features a double-stacked head clamp for added head tube strength and a lightweight yet rigid body frame constructed of 100 percent aircraft-grade aluminum. Quite simply, there's no trick the Pro Model Scooter won't stand up to time and again.The scooter measures four by 25.5 by 7.25 inches (W x H x D) when fully assembled, weighs eight pounds, and additionally features extra-thick foam handles for an optimal balance of comfort and non-slip grip, a must for serious tricksters. Riders will appreciate the Pro Model's full-deck grip tape, which is specially designed by Team Razor pro rider Ricky Wernicke, and provides maximum traction both on the ground and in the air.Scooter Features:Designed and tested by Team Razor Pro Riders for durability and performanceFull deck grip tape designed by Team Razor Pro Rider Rickey Wernicke98-millimeter urethane wheels equipped with ABEC-5 high-speed bearingsDouble stacked head clamp for extra head tube strengthExtra thick foam grips for additional palm protectionPatented folding mechanism (US patent number 6,431,567 and 7,063,341)Patented rear fender brake (US patent number 6,139,035)Aircraft-grade aluminum for lightweight durabilityEasy to fold and carryBuilt with durability and professional-grade performance in mind, there's no trick the Pro Model can't handle in style.About RazorFounded in June 2000, Razor USA, LLC is a privately held company based in Cerritos, California. Creators of the wildly popular Razor kick scooter, Razor additionally offers the E100, E200, and E300 electric scooters, as well as Dirt Rocket, Pocket Mod, Pocket Rocket, and Ground Force electrically-powered ride-on toys and junior scooters. Razor has received numerous industry awards, including the Toy Industry Association's \"Toy of the Year\" and \"Toy of the Year\" honors fromTime Magazine,Parents,Parenting,Sports Illustrated for Kids,Nick Jr., andU.S. News & World Report.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316FynN7bxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FK7C56.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters", "Kick Scooters"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FK8IIG", "title": "Razor E300 Electric Scooter (Blue)", "description": "Get around with power and style on this cool electric scooter by Razor. Featuring a super-size deck and frame for riders ages 12 and older, the E300 can reach speeds of up to 15 miles per hour thanks to its high-performance, ultra-quiet chain-drive motor. The scooter also includes a pair of extra-wide 10-inch pneumatic tires to ensure a smooth ride while you zip around the neighborhood.Other details include variable speed acceleration, a twist-grip throttle, and a rechargeable battery that delivers up to 45 minutes of continuous use per charge (the battery requires roughly eight hours of charge time). The charger and tools are included with the E300, though riders should note that some assembly is required.The buyer and rider of the E300 scooter are responsible for knowing and obeying all local, state, and federal regulations regarding the riding and use of this scooter (a helmet, elbow pads, and kneepads are recommended). The E300 offers a weight maximum of 220 pounds and weighs 52 pounds.Key Features:Super-sized deck and frame for riders ages 12 and olderHigh-performance, variable-speed, quiet chain-drive motor for speeds up to 15 miles per hourTwist-grip acceleration controlHand-operated rear brakeExtra-wide 10-inch pneumatic front and rear tires for smooth rideIncludes two 12-volt sealed lead acid batteries, battery charger and toolsUp to 45 minutes of continuous riding per chargeBattery charge time of 8 hoursMaximum rider weight: 220 poundsSafety equipment such as helmet, elbow pads and knee pads are recommendedMeasures 41 inches long by 17 inches wide by 42 inches tall", "text": "Razor E300 Electric Scooter (Blue) Get around with power and style on this cool electric scooter by Razor. Featuring a super-size deck and frame for riders ages 12 and older, the E300 can reach speeds of up to 15 miles per hour thanks to its high-performance, ultra-quiet chain-drive motor. The scooter also includes a pair of extra-wide 10-inch pneumatic tires to ensure a smooth ride while you zip around the neighborhood.Other details include variable speed acceleration, a twist-grip throttle, and a rechargeable battery that delivers up to 45 minutes of continuous use per charge (the battery requires roughly eight hours of charge time). The charger and tools are included with the E300, though riders should note that some assembly is required.The buyer and rider of the E300 scooter are responsible for knowing and obeying all local, state, and federal regulations regarding the riding and use of this scooter (a helmet, elbow pads, and kneepads are recommended). The E300 offers a weight maximum of 220 pounds and weighs 52 pounds.Key Features:Super-sized deck and frame for riders ages 12 and olderHigh-performance, variable-speed, quiet chain-drive motor for speeds up to 15 miles per hourTwist-grip acceleration controlHand-operated rear brakeExtra-wide 10-inch pneumatic front and rear tires for smooth rideIncludes two 12-volt sealed lead acid batteries, battery charger and toolsUp to 45 minutes of continuous riding per chargeBattery charge time of 8 hoursMaximum rider weight: 220 poundsSafety equipment such as helmet, elbow pads and knee pads are recommendedMeasures 41 inches long by 17 inches wide by 42 inches tall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C8LlXq0%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FK8IIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]], "price": 299.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FKFUL4", "title": "Gerber 22-41614 Ripstop-I 5-3/4-Inch Length Fine Edge Knife, Stainless Steel", "description": "We built these knives for the non-conformist in you. The Ripstop I has a super-lightweight frame lock concept that delivers bold strength and high functionality. The weight of the all stainless steel construction knife is made lighter by the intriguing handle and blade design. There's no bulk in the thin, streamlined handle. Dual thumb studs make opening the blade a snap. Closing it is a simple one-handed step.", "text": "Gerber 22-41614 Ripstop-I 5-3/4-Inch Length Fine Edge Knife, Stainless Steel We built these knives for the non-conformist in you. The Ripstop I has a super-lightweight frame lock concept that delivers bold strength and high functionality. The weight of the all stainless steel construction knife is made lighter by the intriguing handle and blade design. There's no bulk in the thin, streamlined handle. Dual thumb studs make opening the blade a snap. Closing it is a simple one-handed step.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3104I8wtwcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKFUL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 12.46}}
{"item_id": "B000FKJ4J8", "title": "Brunton Canstand For Butane Canisters", "description": "Tired of your butane fuel canister wavering unsteadily while your Brunton lantern or stove pumps away? Turn to the CanStand, which locks underneath a standard canister to give it a rock-steady base. The CanStand sports three splaying legs with rubber grips, helping it stick to large rocks, stumps, and any other relatively flat camping surface. And at 4.6 by 0.9 by 0.8 inches (W x H x D) when folded, the unit takes up minimal space in your pack. The CanStand is compatible with most 4- or 8-ounce isobutane or propane canisters and weighs 0.7 ounces.", "text": "Brunton Canstand For Butane Canisters Tired of your butane fuel canister wavering unsteadily while your Brunton lantern or stove pumps away? Turn to the CanStand, which locks underneath a standard canister to give it a rock-steady base. The CanStand sports three splaying legs with rubber grips, helping it stick to large rocks, stumps, and any other relatively flat camping surface. And at 4.6 by 0.9 by 0.8 inches (W x H x D) when folded, the unit takes up minimal space in your pack. The CanStand is compatible with most 4- or 8-ounce isobutane or propane canisters and weighs 0.7 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R0985RZPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKJ4J8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FKM41S", "title": "DMT ADELUXE Aligner Deluxe Knife Sharpening Kit", "description": "For professional sharpening results, regardless of skill, depend on DMT Aligner Kits and Accessories. Deluxe Aligner Kit includes three 4-Inch Diamond Whetstone in Coarse diamond (45 micron / 325 mesh) to quickly restore a neglected edge, Fine diamond (25 micron / 600 mesh) for a razor sharp edge and Extra-Fine diamond (9 micron / 1200 mesh) to polish and refine a razor edge after sharpening with a coarser diamond stone; a Serrated Knife Sharpening Accessory Fine diamond to hone serrated edges; and fabric storage pouch in which to carry the Aligner components. Easy-to-follow instructions included. Sharpening with diamonds is fast and easy. No messy oils needed-sharpen dry or with water. Durable construction will provide years of consistent performance and reliable service. For proper tool maintenance, Woodworkers, chefs and other professionals rely on the superior quality and versatility of DMT products. Made in USA.", "text": "DMT ADELUXE Aligner Deluxe Knife Sharpening Kit For professional sharpening results, regardless of skill, depend on DMT Aligner Kits and Accessories. Deluxe Aligner Kit includes three 4-Inch Diamond Whetstone in Coarse diamond (45 micron / 325 mesh) to quickly restore a neglected edge, Fine diamond (25 micron / 600 mesh) for a razor sharp edge and Extra-Fine diamond (9 micron / 1200 mesh) to polish and refine a razor edge after sharpening with a coarser diamond stone; a Serrated Knife Sharpening Accessory Fine diamond to hone serrated edges; and fabric storage pouch in which to carry the Aligner components. Easy-to-follow instructions included. Sharpening with diamonds is fast and easy. No messy oils needed-sharpen dry or with water. Durable construction will provide years of consistent performance and reliable service. For proper tool maintenance, Woodworkers, chefs and other professionals rely on the superior quality and versatility of DMT products. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vjzI%2BN%2BPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKM41S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DMT (Diamond Machining Technology)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 45.97}}
{"item_id": "B000FKMEJU", "title": "SportCount Combination 90010 Lap Counter/Timer, Blue", "description": "The SportCount Lap Counter and Timer combines lap counting and timing functionality. It's a great all-purpose training and exercise device, perfect for swimmers and runners. During your workout it provides your running time along with lap count and split time. It also reports summary statistics at the end of the session including: total, fastest, slowest, and average lap times and numbers. Simple, one hand operation makes counting easy and leaves your hands free to do other things.", "text": "SportCount Combination 90010 Lap Counter/Timer, Blue The SportCount Lap Counter and Timer combines lap counting and timing functionality. It's a great all-purpose training and exercise device, perfect for swimmers and runners. During your workout it provides your running time along with lap count and split time. It also reports summary statistics at the end of the session including: total, fastest, slowest, and average lap times and numbers. Simple, one hand operation makes counting easy and leaves your hands free to do other things.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41znt7KupLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKMEJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SportCount, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Stopwatches"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B000FKMTBS", "title": "Brunton Echo 7x18 Pocket Scope", "description": "Small but mighty, the Brunton Echo 7x18 Pocket Scope offers a great combination of magnification, field of view, and brightness, in a small and inexpensive scope. Perfect for use in the field and for close-up high-focus viewing, the Echo has a near focus of 13 inches allowing you to view the tiny details of any object, and a 181-foot field of view at 1,000 yards, ideal for bird watching, concerts, or any other long-range use.Built with BaK-4 prism glass, the multi-coated Pocket Scope offers excellent clarity and a smooth focus that is easy to operate with one hand. Quality optics have never been so small. About the size of a film canister, the Echo comes with a carry case that fits on your belt. You can keep the Echo in your pocket, a small bag, or your car's glove box. The Brunton Echo Pocket Scope is the perfect \"with-you-at-all-times\" monocular, offering exceptional optics at an affordable price.Specifications:Color: BlackDimensions: 1.3 x 3.3 inchesWeight: 1.8 ounces1.1-foot close focus2.6-millimeter exit pupil12-millimeter eye relief181 foot field of view at 1,000 yardsBaK-4 prism glassMulti-coatedIncludes lanyard and caseOne-year warrantyWhat's in the Box?Brunton Echo Pocket Scope, lanyard, carry case, lint cleaning cloth", "text": "Brunton Echo 7x18 Pocket Scope Small but mighty, the Brunton Echo 7x18 Pocket Scope offers a great combination of magnification, field of view, and brightness, in a small and inexpensive scope. Perfect for use in the field and for close-up high-focus viewing, the Echo has a near focus of 13 inches allowing you to view the tiny details of any object, and a 181-foot field of view at 1,000 yards, ideal for bird watching, concerts, or any other long-range use.Built with BaK-4 prism glass, the multi-coated Pocket Scope offers excellent clarity and a smooth focus that is easy to operate with one hand. Quality optics have never been so small. About the size of a film canister, the Echo comes with a carry case that fits on your belt. You can keep the Echo in your pocket, a small bag, or your car's glove box. The Brunton Echo Pocket Scope is the perfect \"with-you-at-all-times\" monocular, offering exceptional optics at an affordable price.Specifications:Color: BlackDimensions: 1.3 x 3.3 inchesWeight: 1.8 ounces1.1-foot close focus2.6-millimeter exit pupil12-millimeter eye relief181 foot field of view at 1,000 yardsBaK-4 prism glassMulti-coatedIncludes lanyard and caseOne-year warrantyWhat's in the Box?Brunton Echo Pocket Scope, lanyard, carry case, lint cleaning cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41icpXeFWyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKMTBS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brunton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 18.28}}
{"item_id": "B000FKRQ8O", "title": "Brunton 58-Kayak Marine Compass", "description": "Waterproof and built to last, the 58 straps securely to your sea kayak with elastic cords, and is easily removed to throw your boat on the rack.", "text": "Brunton 58-Kayak Marine Compass Waterproof and built to last, the 58 straps securely to your sea kayak with elastic cords, and is easily removed to throw your boat on the rack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PYdWZG1HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FKRQ8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brunton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 42.65}}
{"item_id": "B000FL1BB6", "title": "On Guard PitBull U-Lock", "description": "Quattro Bolt Locking mechanism provides unequalled strength by locking the crossbar to the shackle on four sides. Features 13mm ultra hardened steel shackles for maximum cut resistance. Dust covers and vinyl coating protects the crossbar, shackle and cylinder from damage Includes multi-size/multi-position mounting bracket, (5) keys (1 with micro-light and 4 regular keys), plus OnGuard's anti-theft protection plan. LS: long shackle model for added convenience ATB: slightly wider shackle to fit around extra-fat tires STD: sized to fit most any bike on the market DT: includes four foot cable with lock loops on each end Mini: small shackle model fits in a back pocket", "text": "On Guard PitBull U-Lock Quattro Bolt Locking mechanism provides unequalled strength by locking the crossbar to the shackle on four sides. Features 13mm ultra hardened steel shackles for maximum cut resistance. Dust covers and vinyl coating protects the crossbar, shackle and cylinder from damage Includes multi-size/multi-position mounting bracket, (5) keys (1 with micro-light and 4 regular keys), plus OnGuard's anti-theft protection plan. LS: long shackle model for added convenience ATB: slightly wider shackle to fit around extra-fat tires STD: sized to fit most any bike on the market DT: includes four foot cable with lock loops on each end Mini: small shackle model fits in a back pocket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RFY0GPXWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL1BB6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FL1BRK", "title": "OnGuard Terrier Combo 4 5061 Combination Cable Lock", "description": "TERRIER COMBO-4 4'X 6MM RESETTABLE FOR KIDS", "text": "OnGuard Terrier Combo 4 5061 Combination Cable Lock TERRIER COMBO-4 4'X 6MM RESETTABLE FOR KIDS", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X4dZpcioL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL1BRK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FL3E48", "title": "OnGuard Brute LS 5000 Bike U-Lock", "description": "16mm massive hardened ultra steel shackle is the biggest,toughest shackleLS is 4.2 x 10.25, 5.2 lbs.Includes 5 laser cut keys and 1 light key.Five Star plus security level rating make these locks the ultimate theft resistant locks for high crime areas", "text": "OnGuard Brute LS 5000 Bike U-Lock 16mm massive hardened ultra steel shackle is the biggest,toughest shackleLS is 4.2 x 10.25, 5.2 lbs.Includes 5 laser cut keys and 1 light key.Five Star plus security level rating make these locks the ultimate theft resistant locks for high crime areas", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E%2BQhsRSnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL3E48.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FL3E8E", "title": "OnGuard Bulldog DT 5012 Bicycle U-Lock and Extra Security Cable", "description": "Keep your bike safe while visiting theft-heavy neighborhoods with the OnGuard Bulldog DT U-lock, which comes with an extra security cable. The Bulldog DT offers a 13mm hardened steel shackle that provides maximum cut resistance, along with an X2 double-bolt locking mechanism that locks to two sides of the bar, providing added strength and high pull resistance. The pick-, pull-, and drill-resistant M-Cylinder delivers even more protection, with a BumpBlok mechanism that renders bump keys useless. Similar to the tumbler systems found on high-end European autos, the M-Cylinder has more than 100,000 possible key combinations. These tumblers won't turn unless the key is properly inserted, protecting both the key and tumbler from damage due to misuse. The lock mechanism is also completely encased in ultra-hardened steel to resist drilling, picking, or pulling, while an integrated dust cover protects the internals from moisture and debris.As a bonus, the Bulldog DT includes a heavy-duty, extra-flexible 10mm steel cable, letting you double your protection or lock up another bike on the same rack. Other features include an all-tube, quick-release, multi-position mounting bracket, protective coatings on the cross bar and shackle, and a tough vinyl cable cover. The Bulldog DT comes with five laser-cut keys, one of which has an LED micro-light to help you open the lock after dark. OnGuard believes so strongly in the Bulldog DT that it offers an anti-theft protection offer of $1,501 for bikes and $501 for power sport vehicles.", "text": "OnGuard Bulldog DT 5012 Bicycle U-Lock and Extra Security Cable Keep your bike safe while visiting theft-heavy neighborhoods with the OnGuard Bulldog DT U-lock, which comes with an extra security cable. The Bulldog DT offers a 13mm hardened steel shackle that provides maximum cut resistance, along with an X2 double-bolt locking mechanism that locks to two sides of the bar, providing added strength and high pull resistance. The pick-, pull-, and drill-resistant M-Cylinder delivers even more protection, with a BumpBlok mechanism that renders bump keys useless. Similar to the tumbler systems found on high-end European autos, the M-Cylinder has more than 100,000 possible key combinations. These tumblers won't turn unless the key is properly inserted, protecting both the key and tumbler from damage due to misuse. The lock mechanism is also completely encased in ultra-hardened steel to resist drilling, picking, or pulling, while an integrated dust cover protects the internals from moisture and debris.As a bonus, the Bulldog DT includes a heavy-duty, extra-flexible 10mm steel cable, letting you double your protection or lock up another bike on the same rack. Other features include an all-tube, quick-release, multi-position mounting bracket, protective coatings on the cross bar and shackle, and a tough vinyl cable cover. The Bulldog DT comes with five laser-cut keys, one of which has an LED micro-light to help you open the lock after dark. OnGuard believes so strongly in the Bulldog DT that it offers an anti-theft protection offer of $1,501 for bikes and $501 for power sport vehicles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s8-t6BKnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL3E8E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FL3E8O", "title": "OnGuard Bulldog MINI TC 5013TC Bicycle U-Lock", "description": "The On Guard bulldog U-locks are constructed of 13-Millimeter hardened ultra steel shackle with reinforced sleeve over crossbar and cylinder for added security. Available in key or combo lock; keyed locks include 5 laser cut keys (1 lighted) and all tube quick-release mounting bracket. 4.6 Tons pull strength with anti-drill and pick resistance. 13-Millimeter hardened ultra steel shackle with reinforced sleeve over crossbar and cylinder for added security. Bulldog includes free 1-year 1251 dollars anti-theft guarantee.", "text": "OnGuard Bulldog MINI TC 5013TC Bicycle U-Lock The On Guard bulldog U-locks are constructed of 13-Millimeter hardened ultra steel shackle with reinforced sleeve over crossbar and cylinder for added security. Available in key or combo lock; keyed locks include 5 laser cut keys (1 lighted) and all tube quick-release mounting bracket. 4.6 Tons pull strength with anti-drill and pick resistance. 13-Millimeter hardened ultra steel shackle with reinforced sleeve over crossbar and cylinder for added security. Bulldog includes free 1-year 1251 dollars anti-theft guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PE4HS3B1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL3E8O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FL3E9I", "title": "OnGuard Bulldog MINI DT 5015TC Bicycle U-Lock and Extra Security Cable", "description": "Dual bolt locking mechanism with Dual Lockdown Protection drives 2 hardened pins into the 13mm ultra hardened steel shackle at both ends creating a double lock that can withstand 6 tons of pull forceImproved M-Cylinder lock mechanismRotating dust cover protects cylinderProtective vinyl coating on shackleDouble rubber coating on crossbar13mm U-lock 3.5in. x 5.5in. with 10mm 4ft. cable", "text": "OnGuard Bulldog MINI DT 5015TC Bicycle U-Lock and Extra Security Cable Dual bolt locking mechanism with Dual Lockdown Protection drives 2 hardened pins into the 13mm ultra hardened steel shackle at both ends creating a double lock that can withstand 6 tons of pull forceImproved M-Cylinder lock mechanismRotating dust cover protects cylinderProtective vinyl coating on shackleDouble rubber coating on crossbar13mm U-lock 3.5in. x 5.5in. with 10mm 4ft. cable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411jaQ%2BhMYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FL3E9I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
