{"item_id": "B000FPYHC2", "title": "Faster Blaster Pump", "description": "Our Faster Blaster air pumps rapidly inflate fitness, exercise, and toys by pumping air during both the push and pull strokes with two different designs to choose from. The smooth ergonomic handled design is best suited for use with larger air volume sized products like exercise balls, riding horses, rafts, and air mattresses. Or choose from the non-slip ribbed design, ideal for inflating smaller gym balls, beach toys, balloons, and floating toys. Please note, this pump does not inflate needle valve style fitness products like basketballs, footballs, soccer balls.", "text": "Faster Blaster Pump Our Faster Blaster air pumps rapidly inflate fitness, exercise, and toys by pumping air during both the push and pull strokes with two different designs to choose from. The smooth ergonomic handled design is best suited for use with larger air volume sized products like exercise balls, riding horses, rafts, and air mattresses. Or choose from the non-slip ribbed design, ideal for inflating smaller gym balls, beach toys, balloons, and floating toys. Please note, this pump does not inflate needle valve style fitness products like basketballs, footballs, soccer balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215CZo1f5WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FPYHC2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
