{"item_id": "B000FSQQMS", "title": "Delta Bicycle Strapless Toe Clips", "description": "Bike securely with the Delta strapless toe clips. Molded from unbreakable nylon, the clips quickly release your foot when you need to stop. One size only, the clips include mounting hardware.", "text": "Delta Bicycle Strapless Toe Clips Bike securely with the Delta strapless toe clips. Molded from unbreakable nylon, the clips quickly release your foot when you need to stop. One size only, the clips include mounting hardware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JMTVDWX7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FSQQMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 11.75}}
