{"item_id": "B000FSSQRG", "title": "Trademark Poker Blackjack Dealing Shoe 6-Deck", "description": "Bring a little Vegas-style professionalism into your game room with this Trademark deluxe six-deck dealing shoe. Boasting a heavy-duty steel roller that encourages a smooth dealing action, the shoe dispenses cards just like the professionals. The shoe--which also includes smooth rounded edges--is ideal for blackjack, poker, and other table card games. The shoe holds up to six decks.", "text": "Trademark Poker Blackjack Dealing Shoe 6-Deck Bring a little Vegas-style professionalism into your game room with this Trademark deluxe six-deck dealing shoe. Boasting a heavy-duty steel roller that encourages a smooth dealing action, the shoe dispenses cards just like the professionals. The shoe--which also includes smooth rounded edges--is ideal for blackjack, poker, and other table card games. The shoe holds up to six decks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419jCIejYeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FSSQRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark Poker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Cards & Equipment"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FTHEG4", "title": "Yoga Direct Extra Long Yoga Mat", "description": "The Yoga Direct Extra Long Mat is ideal for taller practitioners for home or gym use. Made of durable latex-free foam with a textured, non-slip, high-tack surface, the extra thick mat provides ideal support for yoga, Pilates, and other floor-based exercise. The mat measures 1/4-inch thick by 84 inches long and 24 inches wide, is machine washable, and can be easily rolled and stored after use.", "text": "Yoga Direct Extra Long Yoga Mat The Yoga Direct Extra Long Mat is ideal for taller practitioners for home or gym use. Made of durable latex-free foam with a textured, non-slip, high-tack surface, the extra thick mat provides ideal support for yoga, Pilates, and other floor-based exercise. The mat measures 1/4-inch thick by 84 inches long and 24 inches wide, is machine washable, and can be easily rolled and stored after use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DqmOOAicL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FTHEG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "YogaAccessories (TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000FTZEIE", "title": "Kershaw D.W.O Classic-Black-Lockback Folder Knife", "description": "The DWO Classic work knife features a black, resilient co-polymer handle. Lock back feature ensures that the 2 3/8\" AUS6A stainless steel blade locks safely into position. 3 1/4\" closed.", "text": "Kershaw D.W.O Classic-Black-Lockback Folder Knife The DWO Classic work knife features a black, resilient co-polymer handle. Lock back feature ensures that the 2 3/8\" AUS6A stainless steel blade locks safely into position. 3 1/4\" closed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AYQNCWY8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FTZEIE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000FU4HOA", "title": "Kershaw Amphibian - Kydex Sheath Knife", "description": "Kershaw's Amphibian Kydex Sheath Knife is a water sports knife that features a multi-function sheath with leg straps. The stainless steel blade measures 3.75 inches and is supported by a stainless steel handle with co-polymer insert. The overall knife length measures 7.75 inches and weighs 3.2 ounces.About Kershaw KnivesSince the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality that has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge.\" Today, Kershaw is a wholly owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation--for over 90 years. Japan's premier blade producer. Kai's innovative approach to product development has resulted in over 10,000 superior products.Manufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "text": "Kershaw Amphibian - Kydex Sheath Knife Kershaw's Amphibian Kydex Sheath Knife is a water sports knife that features a multi-function sheath with leg straps. The stainless steel blade measures 3.75 inches and is supported by a stainless steel handle with co-polymer insert. The overall knife length measures 7.75 inches and weighs 3.2 ounces.About Kershaw KnivesSince the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality that has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge.\" Today, Kershaw is a wholly owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation--for over 90 years. Japan's premier blade producer. Kai's innovative approach to product development has resulted in over 10,000 superior products.Manufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GTQ4GNZ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000FU4HOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.53}}
