{"item_id": "B000G0OOAG", "title": "Gerber 22-41457 Gator Exchange-a-Blade Saw", "description": "We had the big idea some time ago: Craft a handsaw with interchangeable blades and a handle wrapped in our famous Gator texturing. But now we've upgraded the concept to be stronger than ever. With beefier construction and an improved blade exchange mechanism. Our saw blades are made of premium stainless steel, as is the blade channel. Whether you're using the coarse blade for normal wood cutting or the fine blade for hardwood and big game bones, you're doing 1/3 less work when compared to other saws. The soft rubber overmolded Gator grip is a case study in how to make a saw easy to hold and effortless to use.", "text": "Gerber 22-41457 Gator Exchange-a-Blade Saw We had the big idea some time ago: Craft a handsaw with interchangeable blades and a handle wrapped in our famous Gator texturing. But now we've upgraded the concept to be stronger than ever. With beefier construction and an improved blade exchange mechanism. Our saw blades are made of premium stainless steel, as is the blade channel. Whether you're using the coarse blade for normal wood cutting or the fine blade for hardwood and big game bones, you're doing 1/3 less work when compared to other saws. The soft rubber overmolded Gator grip is a case study in how to make a saw easy to hold and effortless to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DL40O34lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G0OOAG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 21.48}}
{"item_id": "B000G17FZ6", "title": "Chicago Girls Adjustable Quad Skate ,SM(J10-J13)", "description": "Chicago Skates Girls Adjustable Quad SkateChicago Skates Boys Adjustable Quad Skate have construction, design and function suitable for toddlers. The skate features adjustable micro-ratchet buckles to provide a precise closure. This pair fits each size snugly and comfortably. It has oversized composition wheels and semi-precision bearings to provide a smooth, stable ride.Why You'll Love It:Allow kids to discover fun and fitness.Age:3 years and upFeaturesAdjustable roller skate for toddlersConstructed of soft yet durable vinyl2 micro-ratchet adjustable bucklesPush button easy adjustmentInner boot offers the utmost comfortSmooth, stable rideMade in the USA", "text": "Chicago Girls Adjustable Quad Skate ,SM(J10-J13) Chicago Skates Girls Adjustable Quad SkateChicago Skates Boys Adjustable Quad Skate have construction, design and function suitable for toddlers. The skate features adjustable micro-ratchet buckles to provide a precise closure. This pair fits each size snugly and comfortably. It has oversized composition wheels and semi-precision bearings to provide a smooth, stable ride.Why You'll Love It:Allow kids to discover fun and fitness.Age:3 years and upFeaturesAdjustable roller skate for toddlersConstructed of soft yet durable vinyl2 micro-ratchet adjustable bucklesPush button easy adjustmentInner boot offers the utmost comfortSmooth, stable rideMade in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B4EJDKG1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G17FZ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Inline & Roller Skating", "Roller Skates", "Children's Roller Skates"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000G17UUQ", "title": "Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest Black", "description": "The Firepower Tactical Gear... prepare yourself for battle with the Deluxe Tactical Vest! Deluxe Tactical Vest: This Tactical Vest wears like a mobile battle station! A must-have piece of equipment for all your paintball and Airsoft battles! Fully adjustable to fit most adults. Includes: Adjustable quick-draw holster; 2 pistol magazine belt pouches, 2 chest pouches; 4 rifle magazine pockets; Reinforced shoulder with sniper stabilizer; Fully adjustable pistol belt; Shoulder mounted radio pouch; Durable hardware; Large ID pouch with hook 'n' loop exterior; Order ONLINE Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest, Camo; Firepower Plastic Helmet, Black; Firepower Plastic Helmet, Olive Drab - word search in our Store for 'Firepower'. Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest, Black", "text": "Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest Black The Firepower Tactical Gear... prepare yourself for battle with the Deluxe Tactical Vest! Deluxe Tactical Vest: This Tactical Vest wears like a mobile battle station! A must-have piece of equipment for all your paintball and Airsoft battles! Fully adjustable to fit most adults. Includes: Adjustable quick-draw holster; 2 pistol magazine belt pouches, 2 chest pouches; 4 rifle magazine pockets; Reinforced shoulder with sniper stabilizer; Fully adjustable pistol belt; Shoulder mounted radio pouch; Durable hardware; Large ID pouch with hook 'n' loop exterior; Order ONLINE Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest, Camo; Firepower Plastic Helmet, Black; Firepower Plastic Helmet, Olive Drab - word search in our Store for 'Firepower'. Firepower Deluxe Tactical Vest, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BeM7HDpbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G17UUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fire Power", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000G1KCMY", "title": "Mountainsmith Carbonlite Pro Trekking Poles (Pair)", "description": "The Carbonlite Trekking Poles by Mountainsmith are designed for all day trekking. Cork handles are a great combo of comfort and grip, while the carbon wrapped aluminum poles are extremely lightweight.", "text": "Mountainsmith Carbonlite Pro Trekking Poles (Pair) The Carbonlite Trekking Poles by Mountainsmith are designed for all day trekking. Cork handles are a great combo of comfort and grip, while the carbon wrapped aluminum poles are extremely lightweight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z2L018K8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G1KCMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountainsmith", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 59.93}}
{"item_id": "B000G2TOMM", "title": "Mountain House 72-Hour Emergency Meal Kit", "description": "Ideal for keeping on hand in the event of emergencies, power failures, hurricanes, floods, and other unexpected events, this 72-hour Emergency Meal Kit from Mountain House provides hearty meals that are easy to prepare under challenging circumstances. The kit includes three breakfasts, three side vegetables, and six 10-ounce packets of lunch or dinner entrees. Featuring a seven-year shelf life, all of the meals can be easily prepared by adding water.Kit Contents:1 - 53449 Granola with Blueberries and Milk2 - 53447 Scrambled Eggs with Bacon2 - 53119 Beef Stroganoff with Noodles2 - 53124 Chicken Teriyaki with Rice2 - 53124 Chicken Teriyaki with Rice1 - 53105 Rice and Chicken1 - 53137 Pasta PrimaveraAbout Mountain House Freeze-Dried FoodsMountain House creates their line of freeze dried foods by cooking fresh or frozen foods and then freeze drying them. All the goodness, flavor, and taste are locked in just if you had hand-made them yourself from scratch. Mountain House foods taste as close to fresh, frozen, or better, as you can get. Backpackers consistently rate Mountain House as one of the best tasting freeze dried food brands and praise their ease of preparation.", "text": "Mountain House 72-Hour Emergency Meal Kit Ideal for keeping on hand in the event of emergencies, power failures, hurricanes, floods, and other unexpected events, this 72-hour Emergency Meal Kit from Mountain House provides hearty meals that are easy to prepare under challenging circumstances. The kit includes three breakfasts, three side vegetables, and six 10-ounce packets of lunch or dinner entrees. Featuring a seven-year shelf life, all of the meals can be easily prepared by adding water.Kit Contents:1 - 53449 Granola with Blueberries and Milk2 - 53447 Scrambled Eggs with Bacon2 - 53119 Beef Stroganoff with Noodles2 - 53124 Chicken Teriyaki with Rice2 - 53124 Chicken Teriyaki with Rice1 - 53105 Rice and Chicken1 - 53137 Pasta PrimaveraAbout Mountain House Freeze-Dried FoodsMountain House creates their line of freeze dried foods by cooking fresh or frozen foods and then freeze drying them. All the goodness, flavor, and taste are locked in just if you had hand-made them yourself from scratch. Mountain House foods taste as close to fresh, frozen, or better, as you can get. Backpackers consistently rate Mountain House as one of the best tasting freeze dried food brands and praise their ease of preparation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P2DHWA98L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G2TOMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain House", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 56.4}}
{"item_id": "B000G2Z4W6", "title": "Coghlans Waterproof Matches 10 Pack", "description": "\"A sure light every time - rain or shine\". Waterproof striker.Wooden matches with waterproof heads in a 10 pack box.", "text": "Coghlans Waterproof Matches 10 Pack \"A sure light every time - rain or shine\". Waterproof striker.Wooden matches with waterproof heads in a 10 pack box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FL7OyO5zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G2Z4W6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 4.5}}
{"item_id": "B000G34VV0", "title": "Pro-Tec Athletics IT Band Compression Wrap", "description": "How It Works: This IT Band Wrap provides targeted compression, stabilizing the Iliotibial tract. In addition, it absorbs stress to the area and reduces friction and rubbing of the femoral condyle.Design Theory: The Iliotibial Band Wrap includes a compression pad which provides effective, targeted compression. It is 2-Inch wide and is made from UBL neoprene which is Velcro compatible and very comfortable on the skin. It is adjustable and stays in place.Sizing:Small through large (Up to 19”)X-Large (19” +)*(Circumference measured 3” above top of knee cap)", "text": "Pro-Tec Athletics IT Band Compression Wrap How It Works: This IT Band Wrap provides targeted compression, stabilizing the Iliotibial tract. In addition, it absorbs stress to the area and reduces friction and rubbing of the femoral condyle.Design Theory: The Iliotibial Band Wrap includes a compression pad which provides effective, targeted compression. It is 2-Inch wide and is made from UBL neoprene which is Velcro compatible and very comfortable on the skin. It is adjustable and stays in place.Sizing:Small through large (Up to 19”)X-Large (19” +)*(Circumference measured 3” above top of knee cap)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416P7QpXOXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G34VV0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000G399OY", "title": "Uncle Mikes - 5225 Rectangular Pistol Rug (Black)", "description": "Padded case with wrap-around nylon web carry handlesHandy for transporting handguns to range or storingWeb-reinforced spine strengthens caseCase opens flat for use as shooting restTwo sizes fit most guns", "text": "Uncle Mikes - 5225 Rectangular Pistol Rug (Black) Padded case with wrap-around nylon web carry handlesHandy for transporting handguns to range or storingWeb-reinforced spine strengthens caseCase opens flat for use as shooting restTwo sizes fit most guns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Y-7u68qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G399OY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000G399Q2", "title": "Stoney Point Standard Rear Shooting Bag", "description": "Stoney Point Shooting bags give you the extra support you need to make those long shots. New this year, these bags are constructed of durable 600 denier nylon and feature a non skid bottom and semi-smooth cradle that allows for gun recoil. All bags are filled with polypropylene pellets to retard moisture buildup and molding.", "text": "Stoney Point Standard Rear Shooting Bag Stoney Point Shooting bags give you the extra support you need to make those long shots. New this year, these bags are constructed of durable 600 denier nylon and feature a non skid bottom and semi-smooth cradle that allows for gun recoil. All bags are filled with polypropylene pellets to retard moisture buildup and molding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KKRGXE8EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G399Q2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 19.89}}
