{"item_id": "B000G3BB9A", "title": "Stoney Point Steady Stix II Shooting Stick with Belt Sheath", "description": "Experience single-shot confidence and clean kills with rock-steady, feather-light folding Steady Stix II. Shooting from a steep hillside out of a ravine, on a rugged ground, over high cover and tall grass? Then rest assured Steady Stix II are your best bets. You just won't find more convenient portable or versatile stix than these, and they won't change your point of impact! Tubing diameter-.354in, # of sections-3, height folded 14\", height extended-39\", weight 6oz.", "text": "Stoney Point Steady Stix II Shooting Stick with Belt Sheath Experience single-shot confidence and clean kills with rock-steady, feather-light folding Steady Stix II. Shooting from a steep hillside out of a ravine, on a rugged ground, over high cover and tall grass? Then rest assured Steady Stix II are your best bets. You just won't find more convenient portable or versatile stix than these, and they won't change your point of impact! Tubing diameter-.354in, # of sections-3, height folded 14\", height extended-39\", weight 6oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211SPHAQ0YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G3BB9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 15.99}}
