{"item_id": "B000G3D7R4", "title": "Stoney Point Standard Front Shooting Bag", "description": "Stoney Point Shooting bags give you the extra support you need to make those long shots. New this year, these bags are constructed of durable 600 denier nylon and feature a non skid bottom and semi-smooth cradle that allows for gun recoil. All bags are filled with polypropylene pellets to retard moisture buildup and molding.", "text": "Stoney Point Standard Front Shooting Bag Stoney Point Shooting bags give you the extra support you need to make those long shots. New this year, these bags are constructed of durable 600 denier nylon and feature a non skid bottom and semi-smooth cradle that allows for gun recoil. All bags are filled with polypropylene pellets to retard moisture buildup and molding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51D3MXYY6WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G3D7R4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B000G3G3HA", "title": "SPRI Exercise Mats (48\"x 20\"x 1/2-Inch)", "description": "A versatile sock that accommodates to a casual and active lifestyle. It features spandex throughout the entire sock preventing bagging of the sock and slipping of the sock on the foot. It adorns the Y-heel knit that creates a more anatomical fit to the heel. Also features extra spandex at mid foot for increased arch support.", "text": "SPRI Exercise Mats (48\"x 20\"x 1/2-Inch) A versatile sock that accommodates to a casual and active lifestyle. It features spandex throughout the entire sock preventing bagging of the sock and slipping of the sock on the foot. It adorns the Y-heel knit that creates a more anatomical fit to the heel. Also features extra spandex at mid foot for increased arch support.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YgHZ3ZOrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G3G3HA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SPRI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B000G3HCQQ", "title": "Boyi M4 M16 Grenade Electric Airsoft Rifle LPEG", "description": "Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 220 FPS. 500 rounds per min. 50 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Folding stock. Includes battery & charger, adjustable electric red cross sight, adjustable laser unit, tactical light, mock silencer, safety glasses, sling, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system.", "text": "Boyi M4 M16 Grenade Electric Airsoft Rifle LPEG Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 220 FPS. 500 rounds per min. 50 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Folding stock. Includes battery & charger, adjustable electric red cross sight, adjustable laser unit, tactical light, mock silencer, safety glasses, sling, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Snds91XSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G3HCQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Boyi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 72.13}}
