{"item_id": "B000G8MF4U", "title": "Vittoria Ultralite Tube", "description": "Lightweight, high-quality butyl rubber means you get the performance and pinch-flat resistance of latex with superior air retention to latex. The valve cores are removable. Available in your choice of valve length: 42mm or 51mm. 84g.", "text": "Vittoria Ultralite Tube Lightweight, high-quality butyl rubber means you get the performance and pinch-flat resistance of latex with superior air retention to latex. The valve cores are removable. Available in your choice of valve length: 42mm or 51mm. 84g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YXxe8X7nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G8MF4U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
