{"item_id": "B000G95ZEG", "title": "VISM by NcStar 3-Piece Drop Leg Gun Holster and Magazine Holder (CV2908)", "description": "Offering a stable for your handgun and several clips of ammunition, the NcStar Drop Leg Gun Holster system offers a tough PVC construction. Your pistol hangs at about mid-thigh for easy access, and the universal holster fits most standard sized handguns. Other features include three magazine pouches on the left side and an adjustable belt and leg straps to accommodate wearers of different heights. It fits waists measuring 30 to 42 inches.", "text": "VISM by NcStar 3-Piece Drop Leg Gun Holster and Magazine Holder (CV2908) Offering a stable for your handgun and several clips of ammunition, the NcStar Drop Leg Gun Holster system offers a tough PVC construction. Your pistol hangs at about mid-thigh for easy access, and the universal holster fits most standard sized handguns. Other features include three magazine pouches on the left side and an adjustable belt and leg straps to accommodate wearers of different heights. It fits waists measuring 30 to 42 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X9vmxNaSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G95ZEG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.1}}
{"item_id": "B000G9BI6A", "title": "VISM by NcStar Gun Case", "description": "You asked for it, and now you have it, Green and Tan Rifle cases to go with the rest of your gear.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Gun Case You asked for it, and now you have it, Green and Tan Rifle cases to go with the rest of your gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WdfVDuRuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000G9BI6A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
