{"item_id": "B000GAYNXO", "title": "Hertel \"Super Hot Sauce\" All Temperature Ski and Snowboard Wax, 3/4 lb Brick", "description": "All Temperature Super HotSauce Ski WaxOne wax. All conditions. Out-performs waxing with colors. GUARANTEED. Other waxes try to match paraffin hardness to temperature and moisture. Super HotSauce Ski Wax is made like no other wax available today. Our research department has developed a new and totally unique wax formula that delivers unmatched riding.Super Hotsauce Ski Wax has a unique microencapsulation formula with patented surfactants that work in all temperatures and weather conditions. No other wax has it and no other wax works like it. Super HotSauce all temperature wax since 1974. Give it a try, you won't regret it!HotSauce Ski Wax can be applied either hot or cold.Since you are essentially riding on water, Super HotSauce Ski Wax changes the structure of that water you have created, giving you added control and added safety.Try it today - AND GO HAVE FUN!See you on the slopes!", "text": "Hertel \"Super Hot Sauce\" All Temperature Ski and Snowboard Wax, 3/4 lb Brick All Temperature Super HotSauce Ski WaxOne wax. All conditions. Out-performs waxing with colors. GUARANTEED. Other waxes try to match paraffin hardness to temperature and moisture. Super HotSauce Ski Wax is made like no other wax available today. Our research department has developed a new and totally unique wax formula that delivers unmatched riding.Super Hotsauce Ski Wax has a unique microencapsulation formula with patented surfactants that work in all temperatures and weather conditions. No other wax has it and no other wax works like it. Super HotSauce all temperature wax since 1974. Give it a try, you won't regret it!HotSauce Ski Wax can be applied either hot or cold.Since you are essentially riding on water, Super HotSauce Ski Wax changes the structure of that water you have created, giving you added control and added safety.Try it today - AND GO HAVE FUN!See you on the slopes!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ILUXiDGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GAYNXO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Ski Wax"]], "price": 20.95}}
