{"item_id": "B000GAYUR8", "title": "First Alert 2092DF Waterproof 1-Hour Fire Safe with Digital Lock, 1.3 Cubic Feet, Gray", "description": "Protect valuables with this fire- and water-proof safe. The safe protects valuables from temperatures up to 1,700 degrees F for one hour. A waterproof seal keeps contents dry should emergency sprinklers activate to extinguish the flames. A waterproof protective cover protects the digital key pad. A manual-override key is included and stores inconspicuously on the safe's exterior for easy access should you forget the combination. Pry resistant, concealed hinges thwart crooks. Great for business documents, this unit stores three-ring binders. A fully adjustable shelving system and key rack (all removable) ensure quick and easy access stored items. Honeywell backs this safe with a limited five-year warranty (no receipt necessary) and a lifetime fire- replacement guarantee.--Brian D. Olson", "text": "First Alert 2092DF Waterproof 1-Hour Fire Safe with Digital Lock, 1.3 Cubic Feet, Gray Protect valuables with this fire- and water-proof safe. The safe protects valuables from temperatures up to 1,700 degrees F for one hour. A waterproof seal keeps contents dry should emergency sprinklers activate to extinguish the flames. A waterproof protective cover protects the digital key pad. A manual-override key is included and stores inconspicuously on the safe's exterior for easy access should you forget the combination. Pry resistant, concealed hinges thwart crooks. Great for business documents, this unit stores three-ring binders. A fully adjustable shelving system and key rack (all removable) ensure quick and easy access stored items. Honeywell backs this safe with a limited five-year warranty (no receipt necessary) and a lifetime fire- replacement guarantee.--Brian D. Olson", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UpxJjBl3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GAYUR8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "First Alert", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 266.99}}
