{"item_id": "B000GBDGZ4", "title": "Profile Design Cork Wrap", "description": "Intended use:Road", "text": "Profile Design Cork Wrap Intended use:Road", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qWukDSUZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBDGZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B000GBGMSW", "title": "Deda Elementi Padded Foam Bar Tape", "description": "Cinelli Cork tape was the standard for ages until Deda came along and built a better mousetrap. We love what Deda does with their Foam handlebar tape because it has just a kiss more cush than cork, without being as cloying chunky as Fizik bar gel. For almost all rides and almost all circumstances, Deda Foam's thickness is perfect. You'll be glad you have it on long rides and on lousy roads. Features a micro-cellular structure on a rubber surface for a nicely tacky grip. Comes with an adhesive backing. Available in numerous colors. The actual weight of the Deda Elementi Padded Foam Handlebar Tape is 53g.", "text": "Deda Elementi Padded Foam Bar Tape Cinelli Cork tape was the standard for ages until Deda came along and built a better mousetrap. We love what Deda does with their Foam handlebar tape because it has just a kiss more cush than cork, without being as cloying chunky as Fizik bar gel. For almost all rides and almost all circumstances, Deda Foam's thickness is perfect. You'll be glad you have it on long rides and on lousy roads. Features a micro-cellular structure on a rubber surface for a nicely tacky grip. Comes with an adhesive backing. Available in numerous colors. The actual weight of the Deda Elementi Padded Foam Handlebar Tape is 53g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21bbTBUBZcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBGMSW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000GBK4YA", "title": "UCO Side Reflector for the Original Candle Lantern", "description": "The parabolic UCO Side Reflector clips to the top edge of the Original Candle Lantern and Mini Lantern to direct light to one side. Weighs 0.5 ounces.", "text": "UCO Side Reflector for the Original Candle Lantern The parabolic UCO Side Reflector clips to the top edge of the Original Candle Lantern and Mini Lantern to direct light to one side. Weighs 0.5 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415nz1TtU6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBK4YA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 4.65}}
{"item_id": "B000GBK4Z4", "title": "Hobson Easyseat Ergonomical Dual Pad Bicycle Saddle", "description": "The Original Easyseat has adjustable (width) pads that move independently while pedaling for superior comfort. Since 1982 - over 800 thousand sold and counting. Although this is our oldest model, the medical benefits it provides you, the rider, is just the same as any one of our higher end products. Simply put, this seat will eliminate all pressure and cycling related pains by placing the riders weight only on his/her sit bones. This is a true unisex bike seat. NOTE: The best position for the seat is sitting upright with handle bars positioned High. Some Bikes may require a 7/8″ diameter seat clamp for installation (available off our website). This seat has been stress tested up to 450 lbs.", "text": "Hobson Easyseat Ergonomical Dual Pad Bicycle Saddle The Original Easyseat has adjustable (width) pads that move independently while pedaling for superior comfort. Since 1982 - over 800 thousand sold and counting. Although this is our oldest model, the medical benefits it provides you, the rider, is just the same as any one of our higher end products. Simply put, this seat will eliminate all pressure and cycling related pains by placing the riders weight only on his/her sit bones. This is a true unisex bike seat. NOTE: The best position for the seat is sitting upright with handle bars positioned High. Some Bikes may require a 7/8″ diameter seat clamp for installation (available off our website). This seat has been stress tested up to 450 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K3Y2DZ9DL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBK4Z4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hobson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 29.72}}
{"item_id": "B000GBLPDE", "title": "UCO Pac-Flat Reflector for the Original Candle Lantern", "description": "The patented Pac-Flat Reflector™ fits like a lampshade on the Original and Mini lanterns to direct light downward – useful when the lantern is hanging above you, as in a tent. As its name implies, the Pac-Flat separates into two pieces for easy transport. Weighs 1 ounce.", "text": "UCO Pac-Flat Reflector for the Original Candle Lantern The patented Pac-Flat Reflector™ fits like a lampshade on the Original and Mini lanterns to direct light downward – useful when the lantern is hanging above you, as in a tent. As its name implies, the Pac-Flat separates into two pieces for easy transport. Weighs 1 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qTpBMLm0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBLPDE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 14.89}}
{"item_id": "B000GBQTVW", "title": "Brooks Saddles Perforated Leather Tape with Cork Plugs", "description": "In the Brooks tradition, this bar tape is made of natural leather to make it the perfect complement to your Brooks saddle. The bar tape comes in a kit including: 2 strips of light, perforated leather bar tape, 2 natural cork and wood bar-end plugs, 2 adhesive cloth strips.", "text": "Brooks Saddles Perforated Leather Tape with Cork Plugs In the Brooks tradition, this bar tape is made of natural leather to make it the perfect complement to your Brooks saddle. The bar tape comes in a kit including: 2 strips of light, perforated leather bar tape, 2 natural cork and wood bar-end plugs, 2 adhesive cloth strips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3154052BeKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBQTVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brooks Saddles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 58.05}}
{"item_id": "B000GBSI9I", "title": "Allen Company Nocking Pliers", "description": "Allen Nocking Pliers. These Allen Nocking Pliers are made with steel and have polymer coated handles. Attach all sizes of strong nocking points and retainer clips with your Nocking Pliers. Get yours today! Allen Nocking Pliers", "text": "Allen Company Nocking Pliers Allen Nocking Pliers. These Allen Nocking Pliers are made with steel and have polymer coated handles. Attach all sizes of strong nocking points and retainer clips with your Nocking Pliers. Get yours today! Allen Nocking Pliers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SizZAdWPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GBSI9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 9.92}}
