{"item_id": "B000GD5FMY", "title": "Motorcycle Riding Glasses - 2 Pair Smoke & Clear Biker", "description": "These 2 pairs of motorcycle or bicycle riding sunglasses have mirror coated UV400 lenses which provide the ultimate in protection against the sun's harmful rays. The lenses are hard coated polycarbonate, and are shatterproof. Each of the lenses measures 3 inches across, and are 1 1/4 inches high in the center. The glasses have rubber padding around the lenses to give you excellent comfort, with vents to prevent fogging. Each arm is 5 inches long, with a rubberized tip for added comfort. You'll recieve one pair with dark smoke lenses, and one pair with clear lenses for riding at night.These glasses are BRAND NEW, never used, and still have their original labels. These are the most comfortable glasses I've ever worn while riding, and are great for those who wear contact lenses. Don't miss out on this great deal. Get yours now!", "text": "Motorcycle Riding Glasses - 2 Pair Smoke & Clear Biker These 2 pairs of motorcycle or bicycle riding sunglasses have mirror coated UV400 lenses which provide the ultimate in protection against the sun's harmful rays. The lenses are hard coated polycarbonate, and are shatterproof. Each of the lenses measures 3 inches across, and are 1 1/4 inches high in the center. The glasses have rubber padding around the lenses to give you excellent comfort, with vents to prevent fogging. Each arm is 5 inches long, with a rubberized tip for added comfort. You'll recieve one pair with dark smoke lenses, and one pair with clear lenses for riding at night.These glasses are BRAND NEW, never used, and still have their original labels. These are the most comfortable glasses I've ever worn while riding, and are great for those who wear contact lenses. Don't miss out on this great deal. Get yours now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SQ8np8kvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GD5FMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Private Label", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Sunglasses"]], "price": 9.99}}
