{"item_id": "B000GE5QRM", "title": "Ironmaster 75 lb Quick-Lock Adjustable Dumbbell System with Stand", "description": "Ironmaster Quick-Lock Dumbell system is the latest generation of our adjustable dumbbells. You can quickly adjust each dumbbell from 5-75 lbs with our patented quick lock design in under 15 seconds! The set includes the Stand at no extra charge. Now you can have a complete set of free weight dumbbells at home that feel just like traditional dumbbells with no restrictions, rattling or safety concerns! Set includes two handles with four locking screws, 24 ea. 5 lb plates and 4 ea. 2.5 lb plates and dumbbell stand. Handles weigh 5 lbs empty and each locking screw weighs 2.5 lbs so the starting weight is 10 lbs each dumbbell before plates are added. 65 lbs of plates can be put loaded on each handle. Add-on kit available to go up to 120 lbs each dumbbell. Dimensions are just 6.5\" x 6.5\" x 14.5\" at the 75lb size. Heavy Duty - go ahead and drop them. No plastic or fragile parts!", "text": "Ironmaster 75 lb Quick-Lock Adjustable Dumbbell System with Stand Ironmaster Quick-Lock Dumbell system is the latest generation of our adjustable dumbbells. You can quickly adjust each dumbbell from 5-75 lbs with our patented quick lock design in under 15 seconds! The set includes the Stand at no extra charge. Now you can have a complete set of free weight dumbbells at home that feel just like traditional dumbbells with no restrictions, rattling or safety concerns! Set includes two handles with four locking screws, 24 ea. 5 lb plates and 4 ea. 2.5 lb plates and dumbbell stand. Handles weigh 5 lbs empty and each locking screw weighs 2.5 lbs so the starting weight is 10 lbs each dumbbell before plates are added. 65 lbs of plates can be put loaded on each handle. Add-on kit available to go up to 120 lbs each dumbbell. Dimensions are just 6.5\" x 6.5\" x 14.5\" at the 75lb size. Heavy Duty - go ahead and drop them. No plastic or fragile parts!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ueUuvy2LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GE5QRM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 529.0}}
{"item_id": "B000GE6TOQ", "title": "26\" Tang Ninja Sword w/ Shoulder Sheath", "description": "One solid piece of black anodized, 420 stainless steel stretches 26 inch overall with a 17 inch cutting edge. The nylon cord wrapped handle offers a no slip-grip for precision accuracy.", "text": "26\" Tang Ninja Sword w/ Shoulder Sheath One solid piece of black anodized, 420 stainless steel stretches 26 inch overall with a 17 inch cutting edge. The nylon cord wrapped handle offers a no slip-grip for precision accuracy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IA33UXVML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GE6TOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B000GEDUDY", "title": "Bluewave Water Jug - DAILY 8® 1.9 Liter (64 oz) BPA Free Reusable Bottle", "description": "The BPA Free Bluewave Water Jug comes in an assortment of colors and its convenient handle design makes it easy to carry or to drink from. Its portable size makes it great for school, office and any outdoor activities. Safe to use and no leeching of chemicals. It's environmentally friendly due to its capabilities to be reused over and over again. So don't hesitate! Be healthy and drink 8 glasses of water a day with just 1 bottle! Don't get the imitations - Get the ORIGINAL Bluewave Water Jug! NOT microwave-safe or dishwasher-safe. No hot beverages. To clean, please rinse with water before and after each use. NOTE: Replacement caps measure 38mm. NOTE: BPA Free bottles are not as durable as polycarbonate bottles due to the lack of BPA as a strengthener. About Bluewave: Bluewave is a young and trusted brand with a long history in the industry. In order to ensure the quality and safety of the products, we have manufactured water bottles and water accessories over twenty years. We built our reputation for promoting a healthier living by drinking clean water. Over the years, our 'Bluewave DAILY 8 Water Jug' has also become a national sensation because it reminds people to drink at least eight 8-ounce glasses of fluid a day! We will continue to strive for improvement, so our customers can enjoy fresh, clean water. Many celebrities, athletes, companies, retailers, and government agencies now come to us for their water bottle needs. We highly value corporate social responsibility. Our multiuse bottles help reduce plastic waste for the planet and keep it greener. We are also committed to doing our part in helping others in need. We help non-profit organizations, charity groups, schools and government agencies around the world by donating thousands of our bottles for disaster relief efforts, clean water programs, health educations and local communities. We believe that we can work together to make the world cleaner, greener and more sustainable.", "text": "Bluewave Water Jug - DAILY 8® 1.9 Liter (64 oz) BPA Free Reusable Bottle The BPA Free Bluewave Water Jug comes in an assortment of colors and its convenient handle design makes it easy to carry or to drink from. Its portable size makes it great for school, office and any outdoor activities. Safe to use and no leeching of chemicals. It's environmentally friendly due to its capabilities to be reused over and over again. So don't hesitate! Be healthy and drink 8 glasses of water a day with just 1 bottle! Don't get the imitations - Get the ORIGINAL Bluewave Water Jug! NOT microwave-safe or dishwasher-safe. No hot beverages. To clean, please rinse with water before and after each use. NOTE: Replacement caps measure 38mm. NOTE: BPA Free bottles are not as durable as polycarbonate bottles due to the lack of BPA as a strengthener. About Bluewave: Bluewave is a young and trusted brand with a long history in the industry. In order to ensure the quality and safety of the products, we have manufactured water bottles and water accessories over twenty years. We built our reputation for promoting a healthier living by drinking clean water. Over the years, our 'Bluewave DAILY 8 Water Jug' has also become a national sensation because it reminds people to drink at least eight 8-ounce glasses of fluid a day! We will continue to strive for improvement, so our customers can enjoy fresh, clean water. Many celebrities, athletes, companies, retailers, and government agencies now come to us for their water bottle needs. We highly value corporate social responsibility. Our multiuse bottles help reduce plastic waste for the planet and keep it greener. We are also committed to doing our part in helping others in need. We help non-profit organizations, charity groups, schools and government agencies around the world by donating thousands of our bottles for disaster relief efforts, clean water programs, health educations and local communities. We believe that we can work together to make the world cleaner, greener and more sustainable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cu-qWm3UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GEDUDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bluewave Lifestyle&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000GEFH4Y", "title": "Wildkin Princess Sleeping Bag", "description": "Features: 30in. W x 66in. L Includes a matching travel pillow Includes storage bag and elastic storage straps Cotton/polyester exterior Lined with 100% cozy cotton flannel interior Naturally flame-resistant Never treated with chemicals Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements Suitable for children up to 5 feet tall Opens flat to top a bed Machine washable: front loader, gentle, cold Embroidery friendly Not intended for outdoor use Recommended Ages 3+ Product Description: Snuggle up inside of a cozy Wildkin Sleeping Bag. Great for sleepovers and living room camp-sites, these sleeping bags keep kids warm, happy, and safe from boogie-monsters. Naturally flame-resistant; our bags are never treated with flame-retardant chemicals. Warranty and Safety Info: One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-free, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Information Act. Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements for sleeping bags as set forth in CPAI-75.", "text": "Wildkin Princess Sleeping Bag Features: 30in. W x 66in. L Includes a matching travel pillow Includes storage bag and elastic storage straps Cotton/polyester exterior Lined with 100% cozy cotton flannel interior Naturally flame-resistant Never treated with chemicals Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements Suitable for children up to 5 feet tall Opens flat to top a bed Machine washable: front loader, gentle, cold Embroidery friendly Not intended for outdoor use Recommended Ages 3+ Product Description: Snuggle up inside of a cozy Wildkin Sleeping Bag. Great for sleepovers and living room camp-sites, these sleeping bags keep kids warm, happy, and safe from boogie-monsters. Naturally flame-resistant; our bags are never treated with flame-retardant chemicals. Warranty and Safety Info: One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-free, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Information Act. Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements for sleeping bags as set forth in CPAI-75.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Wju-6tRDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GEFH4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wildkin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 39.94}}
{"item_id": "B000GEWB4S", "title": "Bushnell Trophy Multi Red/Green Dot Reticle Riflescope, 1x28", "description": "Part of the Bushnell Trophy riflescope series, this 1x28 scope (model 73-0135) is a great choice for hunting in all conditions. The multi-coated, high-contrast Amber-Bright optics provide increased brightness for low-light hunting at dawn or dusk and can help quickly distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter. It displays a green dot for low light and red dot for bright light. Other features include four dial-in reticles, 100 percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction, and dry nitrogen fill.Specifications:Finish: MattePower/objective lens: 1 x 28mmReticle: 4 dial-in; red/green electronicField-of-view at 100 yards: 68 feetWeight: 6 ouncesLength: 5.5 inchesEye relief: UnlimitedExit pupil: 28mmClick value: 0.5 inches at 100 yardsAdjusted range at 100 yards: 50 inches at 100 yardsMounting length: 4.1 inches", "text": "Bushnell Trophy Multi Red/Green Dot Reticle Riflescope, 1x28 Part of the Bushnell Trophy riflescope series, this 1x28 scope (model 73-0135) is a great choice for hunting in all conditions. The multi-coated, high-contrast Amber-Bright optics provide increased brightness for low-light hunting at dawn or dusk and can help quickly distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter. It displays a green dot for low light and red dot for bright light. Other features include four dial-in reticles, 100 percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction, and dry nitrogen fill.Specifications:Finish: MattePower/objective lens: 1 x 28mmReticle: 4 dial-in; red/green electronicField-of-view at 100 yards: 68 feetWeight: 6 ouncesLength: 5.5 inchesEye relief: UnlimitedExit pupil: 28mmClick value: 0.5 inches at 100 yardsAdjusted range at 100 yards: 50 inches at 100 yardsMounting length: 4.1 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NnP3x2dJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GEWB4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 94.25}}
{"item_id": "B000GEWB52", "title": "Bushnell Banner Mil-Dot Reticle Riflescope, 6-24x40", "description": "Part of the Bushnell Banner riflescope series, this 6-24x40 scope (model 71-6244) is a great choice for hunting in the morning's first light and late in the evening. It features Bushnell's Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multi-coated lens and a fast-focus eyepiece. It also offers a Mill Dot reticle, 100 percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction, and dry nitrogen fill.Specifications:Finish: MattePower/objective lens: 6-24 x 40mmReticle: Mil DotField-of-view at 100 yards: 17 feet at 6x; 5 feet at 24xWeight: 19.6 ouncesLength: 16.1 inchesEye relief: 3.4 inchesExit pupil: 6.7mm at 6x; 1.7mm at 24xClick value: 0.25 inches at 100 yardsAdjusted range at 100 yards: 36 inches at 100 yardsMounting length: 7.25 inches", "text": "Bushnell Banner Mil-Dot Reticle Riflescope, 6-24x40 Part of the Bushnell Banner riflescope series, this 6-24x40 scope (model 71-6244) is a great choice for hunting in the morning's first light and late in the evening. It features Bushnell's Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multi-coated lens and a fast-focus eyepiece. It also offers a Mill Dot reticle, 100 percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction, and dry nitrogen fill.Specifications:Finish: MattePower/objective lens: 6-24 x 40mmReticle: Mil DotField-of-view at 100 yards: 17 feet at 6x; 5 feet at 24xWeight: 19.6 ouncesLength: 16.1 inchesEye relief: 3.4 inchesExit pupil: 6.7mm at 6x; 1.7mm at 24xClick value: 0.25 inches at 100 yardsAdjusted range at 100 yards: 36 inches at 100 yardsMounting length: 7.25 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ITZrl2FoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GEWB52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 174.72}}
{"item_id": "B000GEY6L4", "title": "Tasco Target/Varmint 6-24x42mm Rifle Scope Mil Dot Reticle", "description": "At home on the range, in the woods, or on the prairie, the Tasco 6-24x42mm Target and Varmint riflescope delivers the ultra-bright, clear imagery hunters demand for locating and annihilating the smallest targets. The scope is equipped with high-quality multicoated optics that produces colorful, high-resolution imagery, so you can easily pick out your target from a distance. The scope's 1/4 MOA windage and elevation adjustments, meanwhile, makes fine-tuning accuracy not only possible but simple. And the riflescope is engineered to last, with a rugged waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof construction.SpecificationsMagnification: 6-24xObjective lens: 42mmField of view: 13 to 3.7 feet @ 100 yardsLens coating: SC/MLParallax setting: 15 yards to infinityReticle type: True Mil-DotTube diameter: 1 inchExit pupil: 7mm @ 6x; 1.75mm @ 24xFocus type: EyebellEye relief: 3 inchesWindage/elevation: 1/4 MOA Glove-Grip turretsFinish: MatteLength: 16 inchesWeight: 19.6 ounces", "text": "Tasco Target/Varmint 6-24x42mm Rifle Scope Mil Dot Reticle At home on the range, in the woods, or on the prairie, the Tasco 6-24x42mm Target and Varmint riflescope delivers the ultra-bright, clear imagery hunters demand for locating and annihilating the smallest targets. The scope is equipped with high-quality multicoated optics that produces colorful, high-resolution imagery, so you can easily pick out your target from a distance. The scope's 1/4 MOA windage and elevation adjustments, meanwhile, makes fine-tuning accuracy not only possible but simple. And the riflescope is engineered to last, with a rugged waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof construction.SpecificationsMagnification: 6-24xObjective lens: 42mmField of view: 13 to 3.7 feet @ 100 yardsLens coating: SC/MLParallax setting: 15 yards to infinityReticle type: True Mil-DotTube diameter: 1 inchExit pupil: 7mm @ 6x; 1.75mm @ 24xFocus type: EyebellEye relief: 3 inchesWindage/elevation: 1/4 MOA Glove-Grip turretsFinish: MatteLength: 16 inchesWeight: 19.6 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3106VT8PXXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GEY6L4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 84.98}}
