{"item_id": "B000GF1HKQ", "title": "Tasco Red Dot 1 x 30mm Rifle Scope 5 MOA Dot Reticle", "description": "The Tasco BKRD30 Solar Red Dot rifle scope offers a large field of view and bright, 11-position rheostat-controlled, five-MOA red dot that helps get you on target fast. Designed for use with shotguns, rifles, and bows, the BKRD30 fits most standard centerfire weaver-style bases, for shotguns up to three-inch shells and handguns up to .357 magnum.Specifications1X magnification57-foot field of view at 100 yardsRubicon multi-layered, fully-coated lensFixed focus50-yard parallax setting30-millimeter objective lens diameterUnlimited eye reliefIlluminated five-MOA red dot, 11-position rheostat reticle0.5 at 50 yards windage/elevation38-millimeter tube diameterWeighs six ounces3.75-inch lengthBlack matte all-weather finish", "text": "Tasco Red Dot 1 x 30mm Rifle Scope 5 MOA Dot Reticle The Tasco BKRD30 Solar Red Dot rifle scope offers a large field of view and bright, 11-position rheostat-controlled, five-MOA red dot that helps get you on target fast. Designed for use with shotguns, rifles, and bows, the BKRD30 fits most standard centerfire weaver-style bases, for shotguns up to three-inch shells and handguns up to .357 magnum.Specifications1X magnification57-foot field of view at 100 yardsRubicon multi-layered, fully-coated lensFixed focus50-yard parallax setting30-millimeter objective lens diameterUnlimited eye reliefIlluminated five-MOA red dot, 11-position rheostat reticle0.5 at 50 yards windage/elevation38-millimeter tube diameterWeighs six ounces3.75-inch lengthBlack matte all-weather finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GC38RZNSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GF1HKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 37.04}}
{"item_id": "B000GF625G", "title": "Russell Outdoors Men's Explorer Midweight Cargo Pant", "description": "The Explorer Midweight Cargo Pant has 2 large button-flap bellow-style pockets on the side, two deep hand pockets and two rear pockets with button flap closures. The waist is adjustable for a better fit and a drawstring hem allows for snug fit over boots.", "text": "Russell Outdoors Men's Explorer Midweight Cargo Pant The Explorer Midweight Cargo Pant has 2 large button-flap bellow-style pockets on the side, two deep hand pockets and two rear pockets with button flap closures. The waist is adjustable for a better fit and a drawstring hem allows for snug fit over boots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SWevaoSbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GF625G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000GFHX5E", "title": "Ektelon O3 Racquetball Glove", "description": "Most innovative design for ultimate performance, perfect with O3 racquets. Dry Zone cooling and wicking material actively wicks moisture away from hand. Superior gripping with digitied palm design and patented Graphite/Titanium leather for more racquet feel and lasting wear. Ultimate hand protection with Neoprene used along the side of the glove and leather across the knuckles. Absorbent terry wristband and tab closure design.", "text": "Ektelon O3 Racquetball Glove Most innovative design for ultimate performance, perfect with O3 racquets. Dry Zone cooling and wicking material actively wicks moisture away from hand. Superior gripping with digitied palm design and patented Graphite/Titanium leather for more racquet feel and lasting wear. Ultimate hand protection with Neoprene used along the side of the glove and leather across the knuckles. Absorbent terry wristband and tab closure design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mtEPQyjBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GFHX5E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Racquetball", "Gloves"]]}}
