{"item_id": "B000GHQBUA", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products .177 Cal. Flathead Pellets (500) (Silver Color, 4.5 mm)", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For target practice, you can't do better than Daisy's flat-nose pellets. They are great for target practice at home on the range. Daisy flat-nose pellets are also available lead-free. The flat head makes an distinguished impact on paper targets that let's you accuracy score shots.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products .177 Cal. Flathead Pellets (500) (Silver Color, 4.5 mm) Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For target practice, you can't do better than Daisy's flat-nose pellets. They are great for target practice at home on the range. Daisy flat-nose pellets are also available lead-free. The flat head makes an distinguished impact on paper targets that let's you accuracy score shots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ueg1WOAFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GHQBUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 1.72}}
{"item_id": "B000GHUS0E", "title": "MTM 100 Round 12 Gauge Shotshell Dry Box", "description": "Popular with waterfowl hunters during the hunting season and a dry box to use in the off season, the Shotshell Dry Box holds up to 100 shotshells and has two removable trays. The lid has an O-Ring design for water resistant sealing for those wet days and is removable for less space used in the hunting blind. It has a generously proportioned fold down handle and large latch for easy opening and can be locked.", "text": "MTM 100 Round 12 Gauge Shotshell Dry Box Popular with waterfowl hunters during the hunting season and a dry box to use in the off season, the Shotshell Dry Box holds up to 100 shotshells and has two removable trays. The lid has an O-Ring design for water resistant sealing for those wet days and is removable for less space used in the hunting blind. It has a generously proportioned fold down handle and large latch for easy opening and can be locked.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BbJV9f56L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GHUS0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes"]], "price": 25.99}}
