{"item_id": "B000GK2XUY", "title": "Everlast MMA Headgear", "description": "When you're sparring you need to be focused on your opponent, not worrying about how your headgear is holding up. Everlast has become the number one name in boxing and wrestling by producing the finest gear available, and they've put their experience to work creating this Advanced Headguard. With a snug yet comfortable fit and premium Closed Cell padding, this headgear will keep your dome safe and protected, while the EverFresh antimicrobial treatment blocks odors and keeps you smelling awesome. Features: Level II - Advanced technology and high-end materials Engineered for sparring Closed Cell Technology for head safety EverFresh antimicrobial treatment keeps headgear fresh and prevents offensive odors Includes instructional boxing workout Brand: Everlast Model: Advanced Headgear 7420XL Size: One Size Fits Most Color: Black Condition: New", "text": "Everlast MMA Headgear When you're sparring you need to be focused on your opponent, not worrying about how your headgear is holding up. Everlast has become the number one name in boxing and wrestling by producing the finest gear available, and they've put their experience to work creating this Advanced Headguard. With a snug yet comfortable fit and premium Closed Cell padding, this headgear will keep your dome safe and protected, while the EverFresh antimicrobial treatment blocks odors and keeps you smelling awesome. Features: Level II - Advanced technology and high-end materials Engineered for sparring Closed Cell Technology for head safety EverFresh antimicrobial treatment keeps headgear fresh and prevents offensive odors Includes instructional boxing workout Brand: Everlast Model: Advanced Headgear 7420XL Size: One Size Fits Most Color: Black Condition: New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414BXF18F6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GK2XUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Headgear"]], "price": 29.06}}
