{"item_id": "B000GKBEJA", "title": "McNett Zip Tech Semi-Solid Zipper Lubricant, 1/2-Ounce", "description": "Zip Tech Zipper Lubricant is designed and formulated to protect and lubricate all types of watertight and airtight zippers. Zip Tech lubricates and protects the zippers and zipper skirts on dry suits, survival suits, environmental suits, dry bags and more. Special ingredients inhibit rust, resist corrosion, and repel dirt, sand and organic residue and helps protect against exposure to harmful chlorine, salt and pollutants. Zip Tech will not flake or jam in extreme temperatures.", "text": "McNett Zip Tech Semi-Solid Zipper Lubricant, 1/2-Ounce Zip Tech Zipper Lubricant is designed and formulated to protect and lubricate all types of watertight and airtight zippers. Zip Tech lubricates and protects the zippers and zipper skirts on dry suits, survival suits, environmental suits, dry bags and more. Special ingredients inhibit rust, resist corrosion, and repel dirt, sand and organic residue and helps protect against exposure to harmful chlorine, salt and pollutants. Zip Tech will not flake or jam in extreme temperatures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d1u6azhwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GKBEJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]], "price": 6.45}}
{"item_id": "B000GKD41G", "title": "KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife is a practically sized fixed blade knife that can be used for just about anything. The Short Black Plain Edge Knife is constructed with a 5 1/4 inch straight edge and 1095 Carbon steel blade with a Kraton G handle. The butt cap and guard and made from 1095 Powdered Carbon steel. The KABAR Knife measures 9 1/4 inches overall. This item is available in a variety of styles: A) KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife w/ Leather Sheath, B) KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife w/ Nylon Sheath", "text": "KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife The KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife is a practically sized fixed blade knife that can be used for just about anything. The Short Black Plain Edge Knife is constructed with a 5 1/4 inch straight edge and 1095 Carbon steel blade with a Kraton G handle. The butt cap and guard and made from 1095 Powdered Carbon steel. The KABAR Knife measures 9 1/4 inches overall. This item is available in a variety of styles: A) KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife w/ Leather Sheath, B) KABAR Short Black Plain Edge Knife w/ Nylon Sheath", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KoiOhFVAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GKD41G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 43.97}}
