{"item_id": "B000GKKSTM", "title": "Uncle Mike's Kodra Nylon Inside-The-Pant Holster with Retention Strap", "description": "Inside-The-Pant Retention Strap Holster Black - Right HandManufacture ID: 76001Efficient fold-over Velcro retention strap keeps gun in place releases quickly with thumb; meets retention requirements of some jurisdictions. Unique ultra-thin four-layer laminate no thicker than conventional suede leather holsters. Internal moisture barrier won't transmit perspiration to gun. Suede-like exterior helps anchor holster inside pants or skirt. Belt clip slips over pant top and belt to hold gun securely and anchor gun for positive draw.Size Chart0 - 2-3\" Barrel Small/Medium Double Action Revolver (except 2\" 5-shot)Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Kodra Nylon Inside-The-Pant Holster with Retention Strap Inside-The-Pant Retention Strap Holster Black - Right HandManufacture ID: 76001Efficient fold-over Velcro retention strap keeps gun in place releases quickly with thumb; meets retention requirements of some jurisdictions. Unique ultra-thin four-layer laminate no thicker than conventional suede leather holsters. Internal moisture barrier won't transmit perspiration to gun. Suede-like exterior helps anchor holster inside pants or skirt. Belt clip slips over pant top and belt to hold gun securely and anchor gun for positive draw.Size Chart0 - 2-3\" Barrel Small/Medium Double Action Revolver (except 2\" 5-shot)Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j5bc10b9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GKKSTM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000GKMVO2", "title": "Bianchi 111 Cyclone Holster Fits S&W N 6-6 1/2In Rev", "description": "A versatile belt holster design that is hand molded for a custom-like fit. The unique belt loop allows the pistol or revolver to be carried in either a cross draw or strongside carry. It is ideally suited for hunters who carry long barreled revolvers. 1.75” belt loop. Fits Colt Anaconda (6\"), S&W; 27, 28, 29, 610 Classic Hunter (6\"-6.5\")", "text": "Bianchi 111 Cyclone Holster Fits S&W N 6-6 1/2In Rev A versatile belt holster design that is hand molded for a custom-like fit. The unique belt loop allows the pistol or revolver to be carried in either a cross draw or strongside carry. It is ideally suited for hunters who carry long barreled revolvers. 1.75” belt loop. Fits Colt Anaconda (6\"), S&W; 27, 28, 29, 610 Classic Hunter (6\"-6.5\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a5qdooLHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GKMVO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 56.58}}
{"item_id": "B000GKN45C", "title": "Swagman XTC-4 Cross-Country 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver Hitch)", "description": "Transport up to four bikes at once whether driving across country or to the campsite with the Swagman XTC-4 cross-country bike rack. Designed to fit a two-inch receiver hitch, the bike rack makes it easy to load and unload your bikes from ground level. The rack includes a set of fast-adjustable, quick-release tire hoops and a ratcheting top arm, helping it fit a wide range of bike frames. In addition, the rack's center arm folds down when not in use, making it easy to access the rear of the vehicle without removing the rack. And to ensure that your rack doesn't rust over time, the XC-4 is powder coated. Built to provide more ground clearance than other racks, the cross-country rack comes with new and improved wheel straps for bicycle security.", "text": "Swagman XTC-4 Cross-Country 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver Hitch) Transport up to four bikes at once whether driving across country or to the campsite with the Swagman XTC-4 cross-country bike rack. Designed to fit a two-inch receiver hitch, the bike rack makes it easy to load and unload your bikes from ground level. The rack includes a set of fast-adjustable, quick-release tire hoops and a ratcheting top arm, helping it fit a wide range of bike frames. In addition, the rack's center arm folds down when not in use, making it easy to access the rear of the vehicle without removing the rack. And to ensure that your rack doesn't rust over time, the XC-4 is powder coated. Built to provide more ground clearance than other racks, the cross-country rack comes with new and improved wheel straps for bicycle security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vniX0gWIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GKN45C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swagman Bicycle Carriers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 349.99}}
{"item_id": "B000GL19TY", "title": "DuPont Teflon Multi-Use Lubricant Aerosol Spray, 11 Oz.", "description": "DuPont Multi-Use with Teflon Fluoropolymer is a high-performance general purpose lubricant with extreme corrosion and wear protection. Water repelling, silicone-free formula protects against heavy moisture and rust. Formulated with Teflon for longer lubricant life, enhanced wear protection, better high and low temperature range and increased resistance to water. Resists extreme temperatures from -30°F to +300°F.", "text": "DuPont Teflon Multi-Use Lubricant Aerosol Spray, 11 Oz. DuPont Multi-Use with Teflon Fluoropolymer is a high-performance general purpose lubricant with extreme corrosion and wear protection. Water repelling, silicone-free formula protects against heavy moisture and rust. Formulated with Teflon for longer lubricant life, enhanced wear protection, better high and low temperature range and increased resistance to water. Resists extreme temperatures from -30°F to +300°F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vNZWWs7AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GL19TY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DuPont", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B000GL232G", "title": "Bones Skate Bearings Cleaning Unit", "description": "Make skate-bearing clean-up as fast as your ride with the Bones Skate Bearings Cleaning Unit. Made by Bones Bearings, the same acclaimed manufacturer that produces high-quality bearings, the cleaner is designed to make cleaning bearings quick and painless. Simply snap your bearings into the polyurethane cleaning unit and apply the solvents to get rid of grit and grime. No more hassling with your own homemade contraption or losing the ball bearings while trying to take them apart--the Bones Bearings Cleaner does all the work for you and has your bearings smooth and ready to ride in no time.", "text": "Bones Skate Bearings Cleaning Unit Make skate-bearing clean-up as fast as your ride with the Bones Skate Bearings Cleaning Unit. Made by Bones Bearings, the same acclaimed manufacturer that produces high-quality bearings, the cleaner is designed to make cleaning bearings quick and painless. Simply snap your bearings into the polyurethane cleaning unit and apply the solvents to get rid of grit and grime. No more hassling with your own homemade contraption or losing the ball bearings while trying to take them apart--the Bones Bearings Cleaner does all the work for you and has your bearings smooth and ready to ride in no time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414JAXDT3TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000GL232G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bones Bearings", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Skateboard Parts", "Bearings"]], "price": 13.0}}
