{"item_id": "B000H1K2XW", "title": "Stearns Adult Classic Life Vest", "description": "Adult General Purpose Vest - Two encircling body belts and one chest strap provide a comfortable and secure fit. One-size-fits-most universal sizing fits a wide range of adults.", "text": "Stearns Adult Classic Life Vest Adult General Purpose Vest - Two encircling body belts and one chest strap provide a comfortable and secure fit. One-size-fits-most universal sizing fits a wide range of adults.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z4GXdotKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H1K2XW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B000H1M0LY", "title": "Bohning Hunter String Nocks (Pack of 6), Black", "description": "Bohning Hunter (Black)String Nocks provide a consistent arrow placement and a positive nocking point to help you make the best shot every time. Made with brass rolled edges and a plastic liner.", "text": "Bohning Hunter String Nocks (Pack of 6), Black Bohning Hunter (Black)String Nocks provide a consistent arrow placement and a positive nocking point to help you make the best shot every time. Made with brass rolled edges and a plastic liner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dPEnVe7RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H1M0LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bohning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Nocks"]], "price": 7.94}}
{"item_id": "B000H1M118", "title": "Allen Company Braided Bow Sling", "description": "Allen Braided Bow Sling This Allen Bow Sling is made of full grain leather and has a braided polyester cord. Order yours today! Allen Braided Bow Sling", "text": "Allen Company Braided Bow Sling Allen Braided Bow Sling This Allen Bow Sling is made of full grain leather and has a braided polyester cord. Order yours today! Allen Braided Bow Sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41blOHeb-6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H1M118.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Slings"]], "price": 8.33}}
{"item_id": "B000H1NW9I", "title": "LimbSaver S-Coil Stabilizer, Camouflage, 4.5-Inch", "description": "The most effective lightweight stabilizer ever built. The unique continuous spiral design of the S-Coil stabilizer independently isolates and dampens vibration at an increased rate. The performance characteristics support support a smoother feel, reduce bow jump, and provide a quieter shooting experience. 4.5\" long and weighs 4.73 oz.", "text": "LimbSaver S-Coil Stabilizer, Camouflage, 4.5-Inch The most effective lightweight stabilizer ever built. The unique continuous spiral design of the S-Coil stabilizer independently isolates and dampens vibration at an increased rate. The performance characteristics support support a smoother feel, reduce bow jump, and provide a quieter shooting experience. 4.5\" long and weighs 4.73 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PgNiv0ghL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H1NW9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Limbsaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Stabilizers"]], "price": 17.88}}
{"item_id": "B000H2B6YA", "title": "Butler Creek Blizzard See Thru Scope Cover, Size #4 (1.50 to 1.59-Inch)", "description": "Dependable flip-up covers work on either ocular (eye) or objective (muzzle) end of your scope. The covers have spring-loaded tabs on both sides of the lid that allow the scope covers to silently flip open out of the way. Blizzard lenses are made from optical grade polymers that allow the most complete light transmittance. See-thru scope covers give you the ability to make fast, offhand shots at fleeing game.", "text": "Butler Creek Blizzard See Thru Scope Cover, Size #4 (1.50 to 1.59-Inch) Dependable flip-up covers work on either ocular (eye) or objective (muzzle) end of your scope. The covers have spring-loaded tabs on both sides of the lid that allow the scope covers to silently flip open out of the way. Blizzard lenses are made from optical grade polymers that allow the most complete light transmittance. See-thru scope covers give you the ability to make fast, offhand shots at fleeing game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PVyCsyPsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H2B6YA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 3.9}}
{"item_id": "B000H2SLJ8", "title": "MTM Ultra Compact Arrow Case", "description": "This Ultra Compact arrow case holds and protects up to 12 arrows (up to 32.2\" in total length). It is it ideal for soft bow case pockets and also fits in some hard cases. They are stackable and the clear smoke version has large windows at both ends which presents an unobstructed view of points or fletching inside. Arrows are separated and kept secure with notched foam padding. Snap over latches and double padlock tabs offer the utmost in security.", "text": "MTM Ultra Compact Arrow Case This Ultra Compact arrow case holds and protects up to 12 arrows (up to 32.2\" in total length). It is it ideal for soft bow case pockets and also fits in some hard cases. They are stackable and the clear smoke version has large windows at both ends which presents an unobstructed view of points or fletching inside. Arrows are separated and kept secure with notched foam padding. Snap over latches and double padlock tabs offer the utmost in security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yCfRRwXzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H2SLJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 20.87}}
