{"item_id": "B000H38GGK", "title": "Smith's 3001 Diamond Sharpening Steel", "description": "Smith's 3001 10\" diamond sharpening steel is the world's first interrupted surface diamond sharpening steel. The unique patented interruptions speed sharpening by collecting the micro bits of metal that come off the knife edge during sharpening and allow the higher diamond abrasive surface to remain clear and efficient. A fine grade real monocrystalline diamond is bonded in a nickel plate over the oval shape of the stee to produce a long-lasting surface that will produce a razor sharp edge on the toughest of stainless steels. A comfortable soft-grip handle and oversized safety hand guard are features not seen on any other sharpening steel. A convenient hang-up ring is added for easy storage. For more than 100 years Smith's has been in the knife and tool sharpening business. We pride ourselves on our industry reputation as The Edge Experts and today offer a full line of easy-to-use sharpeners from all five major sharpening categories: 100% Natural Arkansas Stones, Diamonds, Ceramics, Bonded Abrasives and Carbides. Smith's offers its customers the best performing sharpeners in the category at the best price.", "text": "Smith's 3001 Diamond Sharpening Steel Smith's 3001 10\" diamond sharpening steel is the world's first interrupted surface diamond sharpening steel. The unique patented interruptions speed sharpening by collecting the micro bits of metal that come off the knife edge during sharpening and allow the higher diamond abrasive surface to remain clear and efficient. A fine grade real monocrystalline diamond is bonded in a nickel plate over the oval shape of the stee to produce a long-lasting surface that will produce a razor sharp edge on the toughest of stainless steels. A comfortable soft-grip handle and oversized safety hand guard are features not seen on any other sharpening steel. A convenient hang-up ring is added for easy storage. For more than 100 years Smith's has been in the knife and tool sharpening business. We pride ourselves on our industry reputation as The Edge Experts and today offer a full line of easy-to-use sharpeners from all five major sharpening categories: 100% Natural Arkansas Stones, Diamonds, Ceramics, Bonded Abrasives and Carbides. Smith's offers its customers the best performing sharpeners in the category at the best price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21bWSG2z68L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H38GGK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 26.25}}
{"item_id": "B000H38LLU", "title": "Spalding All-Weather Basketball Net (White)", "description": "The All-Weather Basketball Net from Spalding is designed to replace any standard-sized basketball net. The net is built for all-weather, outdoors use.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "text": "Spalding All-Weather Basketball Net (White) The All-Weather Basketball Net from Spalding is designed to replace any standard-sized basketball net. The net is built for all-weather, outdoors use.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i4I0LXf5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H38LLU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Backboard Components", "Nets"]], "price": 3.61}}
{"item_id": "B000H3ACEE", "title": "Spalding 8279S All-Weather Basketball Net (Red/White/Blue)", "description": "The All-Weather Basketball Net in red, white, and blue from Spalding is designed to replace any standard-sized basketball net. The net is built for all-weather, outdoors use and features a patriotic design.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "text": "Spalding 8279S All-Weather Basketball Net (Red/White/Blue) The All-Weather Basketball Net in red, white, and blue from Spalding is designed to replace any standard-sized basketball net. The net is built for all-weather, outdoors use and features a patriotic design.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PtbI8H6yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3ACEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Backboard Components", "Nets"]], "price": 4.88}}
{"item_id": "B000H3ACGW", "title": "Spalding Inflating Needles", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding Inflating Needles A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-3TV4NtRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3ACGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories", "Inflation Device Accessories"]], "price": 2.35}}
{"item_id": "B000H3BLBM", "title": "", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army knife a century ago comes the Swiss Army Trekker pocketknife, a compact multi-tool for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring 4.38 inches long, the Trekker is stylishly cased in a sleek black housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. More importantly, the unit contains several handy multi-tools, including a large locking blade, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and a wire stripper, a wood saw, a sturdy reamer, a Phillips screwdriver, a toothpick, tweezers, and a key ring for easy transport.The Trekker is sheathed in a sleek black housing.As with all Victorinox items, the Trekker is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The Trekker weighs 3.2 ounces and carries a lifetime warranty.Trekker ToolsLarge locking blade (liner lock)Can opener with a small screwdriverBottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripperWood sawSturdy reamerPhillips screwdriverToothpickTweezersKey ringAbout VictorinoxIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army knife a century ago comes the Swiss Army Trekker pocketknife, a compact multi-tool for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring 4.38 inches long, the Trekker is stylishly cased in a sleek black housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. More importantly, the unit contains several handy multi-tools, including a large locking blade, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and a wire stripper, a wood saw, a sturdy reamer, a Phillips screwdriver, a toothpick, tweezers, and a key ring for easy transport.The Trekker is sheathed in a sleek black housing.As with all Victorinox items, the Trekker is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The Trekker weighs 3.2 ounces and carries a lifetime warranty.Trekker ToolsLarge locking blade (liner lock)Can opener with a small screwdriverBottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripperWood sawSturdy reamerPhillips screwdriverToothpickTweezersKey ringAbout VictorinoxIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bmYD5KTHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3BLBM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 59.5}}
{"item_id": "B000H3DNF4", "title": "Katadyn Micropur MP1 Purification Tablets", "description": "Ultralight tablets provide fresh drinking water anywhere you go. Effective against viruses, bacteria, giardia and cryptosporidium. Fresh tasting water-no unpleasant taste. These easy-to-use tablets meet EPA purification guidelines. Purification method: Chlorine Dioxide tablets. 1 tablet treats 1 qt. of water. *note, this is a seasonal item and not available all year round please call for availability", "text": "Katadyn Micropur MP1 Purification Tablets Ultralight tablets provide fresh drinking water anywhere you go. Effective against viruses, bacteria, giardia and cryptosporidium. Fresh tasting water-no unpleasant taste. These easy-to-use tablets meet EPA purification guidelines. Purification method: Chlorine Dioxide tablets. 1 tablet treats 1 qt. of water. *note, this is a seasonal item and not available all year round please call for availability", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DM8JCP1AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3DNF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000H3FJD8", "title": "Set of 2 47\" Kendo Shinai Bamboo Practice Sword Katana", "description": "This is a set of 2 47 \"long premium quality bamboo shinai. This sword is perfect for light to hard practice use. The shinai comes brand new still wrapped in plastic. The shinai includes a thick plastic guard and securing ring.", "text": "Set of 2 47\" Kendo Shinai Bamboo Practice Sword Katana This is a set of 2 47 \"long premium quality bamboo shinai. This sword is perfect for light to hard practice use. The shinai comes brand new still wrapped in plastic. The shinai includes a thick plastic guard and securing ring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11DsBIZLZ7L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3FJD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Etrading", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Practice Swords"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B000H3YCX6", "title": "Multi - Purpose 5-in-One Survival Shovel", "description": "Multi - Purpose 5-in-One Survival Shovel: made Of Heavy Duty Forged Steel. Comes With nylon Carry Pouch. Contents nestle together Compactly For Easy Storage And Transport.", "text": "Multi - Purpose 5-in-One Survival Shovel Multi - Purpose 5-in-One Survival Shovel: made Of Heavy Duty Forged Steel. Comes With nylon Carry Pouch. Contents nestle together Compactly For Easy Storage And Transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WACbhNSoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H3YCX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B000H4E7EO", "title": "iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Child Bicycle Seat", "description": "Created by parents who were disappointed with the family bicycling options available, the iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Child Bicycle seat was made to offer families the best biking experience possible in safety and comfort. This front mounted seat offers both parent and child excellent range of vision, with the opportunity to interact as they bike together. Noted for its ease of use, the seat takes just a few minutes to install and remove, and it is equally easy and safe to load and unload the child from the seat. Providing plenty of clearance for the knees so that the adult can bike with ease, the seat is positioned so that it is easy to maintain the center of gravity. This adaptable seat fits any adult bike with a minimum of 3/4 inches of clearance on the handlebar stem.The iBert Safe-T seat was developed after its creators became frustrated with the available bike seat options for children. They found that bike trailers kept their kids uncomfortably far away from them, got too hot in the sun, and only provided a limited view out to the children. The rear-mounted seats presented similar problems. The kids had a limited view and it was difficult to interact with them. Additionally, the balance of the bike was off and it was not easy to load and unload the kids. Other front mounted seats were complicated to hook onto the bike and difficult to remove. These seats also did not allow knee clearance for biking, and as a result were not comfortable.The iBert Safe-T seat offers a variety of safety and comfort advantages compared to other child bike seat options. The iBert Safe-T seat allows you to maintain control of the bike when loading and unloading your child. To load and unload the child, you simply straddle the bike and lift the child into or out of the seat. When using the iBert seat you can always see what your child is doing and you can make sure that your child is safe and comfortable at all times. The center of gravity in the iBert seat is closer to the center of the bike making it easier to control the bike as you ride. The seat sits higher on the bike and is smooth on the bottom so that even tall riders rarely brush the bottom of the seat with their knees and if they do they just glide along the smooth edges on the bottom.The iBert Safe-T seat is easy to install. The patented stinger assembly attaches to any bike with a minimum of 3/4 inches on the handle bar stem. The stinger system attaches to the bike in just two minutes and the seat can then be attached and detached from the stinger in 15 seconds. If you buy additional stinger assemblies the seat can be attached to multiple bikes.The iBert Safe-T seat is made in the U.S.A. with safety and quality as the main objectives. While the iBert Safe-T seat is designed to meet all 1625-00 standards, at this time ASTM 1625-00 is written for rear child carriers not front mounted seats.Specifications:Allows interaction with your childChild has a clear viewNo dirt, dust, rocks, or water thrown in child's faceSmall and easy to attachEasy and safe loading and unloading of childMaintains center of gravitySimilar construction to rear-mounted seatsOne adult can take multiple children for bike ridesEasy assemblyFull clearance for kneesMade in the USARecommended for children one to four years oldMaximum recommended height is 42 inchesMaximum recommended weight is 38 poundsWhat's in the Box?iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Bike Seat, Stinger AssemblyManufacturer's WarrantyTwo year limited warranty for manufacturer's defects", "text": "iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Child Bicycle Seat Created by parents who were disappointed with the family bicycling options available, the iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Child Bicycle seat was made to offer families the best biking experience possible in safety and comfort. This front mounted seat offers both parent and child excellent range of vision, with the opportunity to interact as they bike together. Noted for its ease of use, the seat takes just a few minutes to install and remove, and it is equally easy and safe to load and unload the child from the seat. Providing plenty of clearance for the knees so that the adult can bike with ease, the seat is positioned so that it is easy to maintain the center of gravity. This adaptable seat fits any adult bike with a minimum of 3/4 inches of clearance on the handlebar stem.The iBert Safe-T seat was developed after its creators became frustrated with the available bike seat options for children. They found that bike trailers kept their kids uncomfortably far away from them, got too hot in the sun, and only provided a limited view out to the children. The rear-mounted seats presented similar problems. The kids had a limited view and it was difficult to interact with them. Additionally, the balance of the bike was off and it was not easy to load and unload the kids. Other front mounted seats were complicated to hook onto the bike and difficult to remove. These seats also did not allow knee clearance for biking, and as a result were not comfortable.The iBert Safe-T seat offers a variety of safety and comfort advantages compared to other child bike seat options. The iBert Safe-T seat allows you to maintain control of the bike when loading and unloading your child. To load and unload the child, you simply straddle the bike and lift the child into or out of the seat. When using the iBert seat you can always see what your child is doing and you can make sure that your child is safe and comfortable at all times. The center of gravity in the iBert seat is closer to the center of the bike making it easier to control the bike as you ride. The seat sits higher on the bike and is smooth on the bottom so that even tall riders rarely brush the bottom of the seat with their knees and if they do they just glide along the smooth edges on the bottom.The iBert Safe-T seat is easy to install. The patented stinger assembly attaches to any bike with a minimum of 3/4 inches on the handle bar stem. The stinger system attaches to the bike in just two minutes and the seat can then be attached and detached from the stinger in 15 seconds. If you buy additional stinger assemblies the seat can be attached to multiple bikes.The iBert Safe-T seat is made in the U.S.A. with safety and quality as the main objectives. While the iBert Safe-T seat is designed to meet all 1625-00 standards, at this time ASTM 1625-00 is written for rear child carriers not front mounted seats.Specifications:Allows interaction with your childChild has a clear viewNo dirt, dust, rocks, or water thrown in child's faceSmall and easy to attachEasy and safe loading and unloading of childMaintains center of gravitySimilar construction to rear-mounted seatsOne adult can take multiple children for bike ridesEasy assemblyFull clearance for kneesMade in the USARecommended for children one to four years oldMaximum recommended height is 42 inchesMaximum recommended weight is 38 poundsWhat's in the Box?iBert Safe-T Front Mounted Bike Seat, Stinger AssemblyManufacturer's WarrantyTwo year limited warranty for manufacturer's defects", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V18d0JaQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4E7EO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "iBert", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Child Seats"]], "price": 99.97}}
{"item_id": "B000H4PKF4", "title": "Primos Hyper Lip Single with Tone Converter Call", "description": "The Hyper LIP Single with Tone Converter makes calling in elk easy. The open single-reed reproduces the high pitches of cows and calves. Removing the Tone Converter allows louder calling when locating or calling bulls from longer distances. The Hyper LIP Single with Tone Converter takes all the guesswork out of calling bulls up close.", "text": "Primos Hyper Lip Single with Tone Converter Call The Hyper LIP Single with Tone Converter makes calling in elk easy. The open single-reed reproduces the high pitches of cows and calves. Removing the Tone Converter allows louder calling when locating or calling bulls from longer distances. The Hyper LIP Single with Tone Converter takes all the guesswork out of calling bulls up close.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NttJ0jvfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4PKF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Elk"]], "price": 14.69}}
{"item_id": "B000H4PKW2", "title": "Knight and Hale Tom Coffin Turkey Call (Push/Pull Call)", "description": "", "text": "Knight and Hale Tom Coffin Turkey Call (Push/Pull Call)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BEptogCxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4PKW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Knight &amp; Hale", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B000H4PL3K", "title": "Gamo Rocker Pellet Trap Resets with center shot!", "description": "Keep your skills in shape with this Great all-steel target! Hit the plates on either side of the center plate and they will be held in place out of view till the center plate is hit which will reset the five plates. For lead pellets up to 1000fps ONLY! DO NOT USE BB OR PBA.", "text": "Gamo Rocker Pellet Trap Resets with center shot! Keep your skills in shape with this Great all-steel target! Hit the plates on either side of the center plate and they will be held in place out of view till the center plate is hit which will reset the five plates. For lead pellets up to 1000fps ONLY! DO NOT USE BB OR PBA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ARE0BjT9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4PL3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 24.98}}
{"item_id": "B000H4PLLM", "title": "Pine Ridge Archery Archer's Allen Wrench Set", "description": "\"The last wrench you'll ever have to buy. Features a heavy duty, one piece construction with a slip resistant finish and custom bolt and nut assembly - no more loose tools. This Allen wrench set is Made in the U.S.A. and has top notch quality with 8650 industrial strength chrome vanadium tool steel.00Limited Lifetime Warranty not to strip out or round off the corners.", "text": "Pine Ridge Archery Archer's Allen Wrench Set \"The last wrench you'll ever have to buy. Features a heavy duty, one piece construction with a slip resistant finish and custom bolt and nut assembly - no more loose tools. This Allen wrench set is Made in the U.S.A. and has top notch quality with 8650 industrial strength chrome vanadium tool steel.00Limited Lifetime Warranty not to strip out or round off the corners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313fB3XlsiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4PLLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pine Ridge Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 11.97}}
{"item_id": "B000H4ROIU", "title": "Tink's #69 Doe-in-Rut Buck Lure (1-Ounce)", "description": "Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure is 100% natural doe estrous urine collected from live whitetail does during their estrous cycle. Tink's quality controlled formula keeps Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure at the peak level of performance. Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure, the standard on which all deer lures are measured, produces great results during the pre-rut and rut. Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure America's #1 Buck Lure!", "text": "Tink's #69 Doe-in-Rut Buck Lure (1-Ounce) Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure is 100% natural doe estrous urine collected from live whitetail does during their estrous cycle. Tink's quality controlled formula keeps Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure at the peak level of performance. Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure, the standard on which all deer lures are measured, produces great results during the pre-rut and rut. Tink's #69 Doe-In-Rut Buck Lure America's #1 Buck Lure!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415j%2BXRTLpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4ROIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TINK&#39;S", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 6.57}}
{"item_id": "B000H4RP5W", "title": "TRUGLO Brite-Site Xtreme 5 Pin Sight With Light", "description": "The TRUGLO Brite-Site has Large circular field of view. Aperture has a 2\" inner diameter. Lightweight composite pin guard. Glow-in-the-dark shooter’s ring helps align peep sight. Level with two vertical bars. CNC machined. Adjustable for left and right handed shooters.", "text": "TRUGLO Brite-Site Xtreme 5 Pin Sight With Light The TRUGLO Brite-Site has Large circular field of view. Aperture has a 2\" inner diameter. Lightweight composite pin guard. Glow-in-the-dark shooter’s ring helps align peep sight. Level with two vertical bars. CNC machined. Adjustable for left and right handed shooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4136Fd9FPyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H4RP5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 29.48}}
{"item_id": "B000H50B6Q", "title": "PADDLE HOLSTER", "description": "Fobus tactical gear, the choice of military and special security services! Custom molded from high-density polymers, these Holsters and Mag Pouches are the ultimate in combat-tested, lightweight (a mere 2 ozs.) comfort, sure retention with easy release, and lifetime-warrantied durability. Choose yours ONLINE now! State Model. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Roto Paddle Holster or Double Mag Pouch - word search in our Store for 'Fobus'. (Ordering Notes: For Sig 220 Series with or without rails, order \"Sig w/ rails\". For Sig 229 without rails, order \"Sig 220\". The Sig 220 option does NOT fit the Sig 220 series.) Fobus Paddle Holster", "text": "PADDLE HOLSTER Fobus tactical gear, the choice of military and special security services! Custom molded from high-density polymers, these Holsters and Mag Pouches are the ultimate in combat-tested, lightweight (a mere 2 ozs.) comfort, sure retention with easy release, and lifetime-warrantied durability. Choose yours ONLINE now! State Model. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Roto Paddle Holster or Double Mag Pouch - word search in our Store for 'Fobus'. (Ordering Notes: For Sig 220 Series with or without rails, order \"Sig w/ rails\". For Sig 229 without rails, order \"Sig 220\". The Sig 220 option does NOT fit the Sig 220 series.) Fobus Paddle Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41csuY%2BclTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H50B6Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000H52CI6", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle C21 1911 Style-All Models / S&W 945", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle C21 1911 Style-All Models / S&W 945 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BkPjRcc0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H52CI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.47}}
