{"item_id": "B000H6NJ78", "title": "Uncle Mike's Centerfire Lever Action Magnum Band Sling Swivels for .630-.675-Inch Magazine Tube Diameters (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Centerfire Lever Action Magnum Band Sling Swivels for .630-.675-Inch Magazine Tube Diameters (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412ovWpBlOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6NJ78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 13.95}}
