{"item_id": "B000H6NMM0", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Marlin .357 Magnum / 1894C Carbine Split Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Tri-Lock assures silent operation and zero finish wear by completely eliminating swivel contact with your gun. Other swivels can mar your finish and make noise against your stock. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Marlin .357 Magnum / 1894C Carbine Split Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Tri-Lock assures silent operation and zero finish wear by completely eliminating swivel contact with your gun. Other swivels can mar your finish and make noise against your stock. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412ovWpBlOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6NMM0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 15.86}}
{"item_id": "B000H6P5FM", "title": "Allen Company Ruger 10/22 Scoped Rifle Case (40-Inch)", "description": "Allen Ruger 40\" Embroidered 10 / 22 Rifle Case. Next time you're loading up your rifle for a trip to the shooting range or deer stand, slip your rifle into this Ruger 10 / 22 Rifle Case. Your gun will be protected by a durable Endura fabric shell and 7/8\" foam padding. Zippered closure keeps your gun securely inside while providing easy access. Grab ahold of the comfortable carry straps and you're on your way to getting another impressive trophy! Get yours today! Allen Ruger Embroidered 10 / 22 Rifle Case", "text": "Allen Company Ruger 10/22 Scoped Rifle Case (40-Inch) Allen Ruger 40\" Embroidered 10 / 22 Rifle Case. Next time you're loading up your rifle for a trip to the shooting range or deer stand, slip your rifle into this Ruger 10 / 22 Rifle Case. Your gun will be protected by a durable Endura fabric shell and 7/8\" foam padding. Zippered closure keeps your gun securely inside while providing easy access. Grab ahold of the comfortable carry straps and you're on your way to getting another impressive trophy! Get yours today! Allen Ruger Embroidered 10 / 22 Rifle Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pYErcqdCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6P5FM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 26.36}}
{"item_id": "B000H6P5IE", "title": "Allen Company Assault Rifle Case with Six Pockets", "description": "Heavy Endura shell, three fourths inch foam padding, snap closure on handle and six pockets. Tactical gun case (37-Inch). Six external pockets and built in sling. Seven/eight-Inch foam. Five zipper.", "text": "Allen Company Assault Rifle Case with Six Pockets Heavy Endura shell, three fourths inch foam padding, snap closure on handle and six pockets. Tactical gun case (37-Inch). Six external pockets and built in sling. Seven/eight-Inch foam. Five zipper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u2AwUNDnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6P5IE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000H6P5NY", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W K or L Square Butt Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W K or L Square Butt Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Pg1uvCvmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6P5NY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.24}}
{"item_id": "B000H6P6B0", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Taurus Pt-99 Rubber Grip Panels", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Taurus Pt-99 Rubber Grip Panels Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YRtq1FuqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6P6B0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B000H6P6BU", "title": "Hogue Rubber Over Molded Stock for Ruger, 10-22 Standard", "description": "Hogue's revolutionary O.M. series stocks (Pat. Pending) are made similar to their popular rubber grips. Constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced stock that precisely fits the rifle action. This small \"stock\" or \"skeleton\", is then completely OverMolded with the same rubber compound used on Hogue grips. The skeleton or insert, as it is called, chemically as well as mechanically adheres to the rubber resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong insert not only gives the stocks their strength but the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop in fit of your rifle action. OverMolding with rubber is superior in every way and provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non slip, super smooth attractive finish, that is durable and extremely quiet. All the following custom features come at prices comparable or below any other standard synthetic stock on the market. Hogue stocks incorporate every desirable feature a fine rifle stock should have and by adding unique Hogue touches they have created a much superior and unique stock compared with anything on the market today. Features:- Sleek Straight Comb- Palm Swells- Varminter Style Forend- Cobblestone TextureSpecifications:Type: Rubber OverMolded Stock Frame: Fiberglass with Strucural ReinforcmentFits: Ruger 10/22 with Standard Barrel", "text": "Hogue Rubber Over Molded Stock for Ruger, 10-22 Standard Hogue's revolutionary O.M. series stocks (Pat. Pending) are made similar to their popular rubber grips. Constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced stock that precisely fits the rifle action. This small \"stock\" or \"skeleton\", is then completely OverMolded with the same rubber compound used on Hogue grips. The skeleton or insert, as it is called, chemically as well as mechanically adheres to the rubber resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong insert not only gives the stocks their strength but the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop in fit of your rifle action. OverMolding with rubber is superior in every way and provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non slip, super smooth attractive finish, that is durable and extremely quiet. All the following custom features come at prices comparable or below any other standard synthetic stock on the market. Hogue stocks incorporate every desirable feature a fine rifle stock should have and by adding unique Hogue touches they have created a much superior and unique stock compared with anything on the market today. Features:- Sleek Straight Comb- Palm Swells- Varminter Style Forend- Cobblestone TextureSpecifications:Type: Rubber OverMolded Stock Frame: Fiberglass with Strucural ReinforcmentFits: Ruger 10/22 with Standard Barrel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21cyYnKBFZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6P6BU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 68.99}}
{"item_id": "B000H6QNGM", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Pistol and Revolver Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber)", "description": "Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your gun is ready for storage.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Pistol and Revolver Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber) Hoppe's BoreSnake is the fastest bore cleaner on the planet. One pass loosens large particles, scrubs out the remaining residue with a bronze brush, then swabs it all spotless with a cleaning area 160 times larger than a standard patch. Add a few drops of Hoppe's No 9 Lubricating Oil or Hoppe's Elite and your gun is ready for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YfoeBZsuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6QNGM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000H6QPJW", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Soft-Sided Pistol and Revolver Cleaning Kit (Choose Your Caliber)", "description": "Take this complete, super compact BoreSnake Gun Cleaning Kit anywhere. The rugged, soft-sided case attaches easily to a belt and fits compactly into a box or bag. Includes BoreSnake, Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, Hoppe's Weatherguard Cloths and pulling tool.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Soft-Sided Pistol and Revolver Cleaning Kit (Choose Your Caliber) Take this complete, super compact BoreSnake Gun Cleaning Kit anywhere. The rugged, soft-sided case attaches easily to a belt and fits compactly into a box or bag. Includes BoreSnake, Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, Hoppe's Weatherguard Cloths and pulling tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SPZk45ACL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6QPJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000H6QXCQ", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W N Square Butt Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W N Square Butt Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LPlxm0l2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H6QXCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 20.54}}
