{"item_id": "B000H729BO", "title": "Hoppe?s Shotgun Cleaning Kit for All Gauges with Aluminum Rod (No Brushes)", "description": "More than 100 years in the gun care business has taught us a thing or two about what makes a good kit. Precisely why hunters, shooters and those in search of the perfect gift continually turn to Hoppe’s. Our kits aren’t just convenient, they’re extremely well thought out.", "text": "Hoppe?s Shotgun Cleaning Kit for All Gauges with Aluminum Rod (No Brushes) More than 100 years in the gun care business has taught us a thing or two about what makes a good kit. Precisely why hunters, shooters and those in search of the perfect gift continually turn to Hoppe’s. Our kits aren’t just convenient, they’re extremely well thought out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O2YeEMrdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H729BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.18}}
{"item_id": "B000H7CKAY", "title": "", "description": "Gold Eagle STA- BIL Fogging Oil is an aerosol propelled oil treatment to protect internal engine components during storage. This fogging oil can be sprayed to coat internal engine components and prevent corrosion. Formulated to displace moisture from metal to protect engine, this product also lubricates the cylinder's walls, pistons and rings to prevent damage (scuffing) during start-up after prolonged engine storage. It is used in all two and four cycle gasoline engines. The STA-BIL Fogging Oil comes in a convenient 12 ounce aerosol can with nozzle straw to direct oil in tight passages or through spark plug holes in head and cylinder.", "text": "Gold Eagle STA- BIL Fogging Oil is an aerosol propelled oil treatment to protect internal engine components during storage. This fogging oil can be sprayed to coat internal engine components and prevent corrosion. Formulated to displace moisture from metal to protect engine, this product also lubricates the cylinder's walls, pistons and rings to prevent damage (scuffing) during start-up after prolonged engine storage. It is used in all two and four cycle gasoline engines. The STA-BIL Fogging Oil comes in a convenient 12 ounce aerosol can with nozzle straw to direct oil in tight passages or through spark plug holes in head and cylinder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PM5QvzQXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H7CKAY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Oils & Fluids", "Oils", "Motor Oils"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating"]], "price": 43.05}}
