{"item_id": "B000H7N26A", "title": "SABRE FRONTIERSMAN Bear Attack Deterrent with Hip Holster - Maximum Strength & Maximum Range - 35 Feet (9.2 oz)", "description": "The strongest bear attack deterrent permitted by the EPA, FRONTIERSMAN's 9. 2 oz canister is equipped with a hip holster for immediate accessibility. The glow-in-the-dark safety provides immediate location at night and its impressive thirty (35) foot range allows deployment from a distance to increase your safety when in bear country. Please note that this item is not available to ship to some states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE FRONTIERSMAN Bear Attack Deterrent with Hip Holster - Maximum Strength & Maximum Range - 35 Feet (9.2 oz) The strongest bear attack deterrent permitted by the EPA, FRONTIERSMAN's 9. 2 oz canister is equipped with a hip holster for immediate accessibility. The glow-in-the-dark safety provides immediate location at night and its impressive thirty (35) foot range allows deployment from a distance to increase your safety when in bear country. Please note that this item is not available to ship to some states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dPkdRBpTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H7N26A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 30.18}}
{"item_id": "B000H7URV8", "title": "Primos Bow Sling", "description": "If you-Feetve had many long walks into the woods with your bow in hand, I know you-Feetve thought -Feetthere-Feets got to be a better way-Feet. Well, here it is. The Bow Sling makes covering a lot of ground or the long walk to your stand as comfortable as a stroll in the park. The Bow Sling is a must when the terrain gets rough. Your hands are free to climb hills or range the terrain with your binoculars. Your bow cams and string are also protected, so your bow will be ready when the shot opportunity arrives. Once you-Feetve tried it, you won-Feett be without it.", "text": "Primos Bow Sling If you-Feetve had many long walks into the woods with your bow in hand, I know you-Feetve thought -Feetthere-Feets got to be a better way-Feet. Well, here it is. The Bow Sling makes covering a lot of ground or the long walk to your stand as comfortable as a stroll in the park. The Bow Sling is a must when the terrain gets rough. Your hands are free to climb hills or range the terrain with your binoculars. Your bow cams and string are also protected, so your bow will be ready when the shot opportunity arrives. Once you-Feetve tried it, you won-Feett be without it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r5C5P7jdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H7URV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 29.33}}
{"item_id": "B000H82NFA", "title": "High Sierra 26\" Drop Bottom Wheeled Duffle", "description": "This 26-inch High Sierra Drop-Bottom Wheeled Duffrite carry-on bag is actually three bags in one--use it as a wheeled upright, a duffel or as a backpack. Its smart organizing features and cargo-friendly expandability will keep you going and geared-up no matter where you are. The molded foot allows duffel to stand upright and also acts as a handle for easy lifting. It features a large main compartment, with front-load access, expands 2 inches for additional packing capacity, as well as a drop-bottom lower compartment with hold-down straps, two zippered mesh pockets and a moveable divider to help organize your belongings. The zippered divider panel between the upper and lower compartments can be rolled up and secured with two hold-down straps, creating one large compartment. It travels easily using the corner-mounted, inline skate-style wheels and recessed, telescoping handle with exclusive Soft-Grip, and it offers hidden padded backpack straps stored behind the zippered padded back panel for quick airport trekking.Material: Duralite Tech, 900-denier Duralite, 1200 x 1800-denier DuraliteOverall measurement: 26 by 14.5 by 15 inchesCapacity: 5655 cubic inchesAbout High SierraFor over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).Founded in 1979 as H. Bernbaum Import & Export Company by Harry Bernbaum and Hank Bernbaum, High Sierra Sport Company has grown to become one of the largest outdoor companies in the United States. Today, High Sierra Sport Company employs 40 people and distributes and sells to more than 1,500 retailers and 2,250 corporate accounts worldwide.", "text": "High Sierra 26\" Drop Bottom Wheeled Duffle This 26-inch High Sierra Drop-Bottom Wheeled Duffrite carry-on bag is actually three bags in one--use it as a wheeled upright, a duffel or as a backpack. Its smart organizing features and cargo-friendly expandability will keep you going and geared-up no matter where you are. The molded foot allows duffel to stand upright and also acts as a handle for easy lifting. It features a large main compartment, with front-load access, expands 2 inches for additional packing capacity, as well as a drop-bottom lower compartment with hold-down straps, two zippered mesh pockets and a moveable divider to help organize your belongings. The zippered divider panel between the upper and lower compartments can be rolled up and secured with two hold-down straps, creating one large compartment. It travels easily using the corner-mounted, inline skate-style wheels and recessed, telescoping handle with exclusive Soft-Grip, and it offers hidden padded backpack straps stored behind the zippered padded back panel for quick airport trekking.Material: Duralite Tech, 900-denier Duralite, 1200 x 1800-denier DuraliteOverall measurement: 26 by 14.5 by 15 inchesCapacity: 5655 cubic inchesAbout High SierraFor over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).Founded in 1979 as H. Bernbaum Import & Export Company by Harry Bernbaum and Hank Bernbaum, High Sierra Sport Company has grown to become one of the largest outdoor companies in the United States. Today, High Sierra Sport Company employs 40 people and distributes and sells to more than 1,500 retailers and 2,250 corporate accounts worldwide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZSD6SEN3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H82NFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "High Sierra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 139.9}}
{"item_id": "B000H84D62", "title": "M-16 Tactical Bayonet Knife", "description": "An exact replica of the M-16 bayonet issued by the military during the Vietnam war. This fully functional piece is equipped with a 9\" stainless steel blade with heavy blood groove. The black-checkered handle is heavy-duty construction and provides a superb grip. Solid stainless steel guard and butt. Includes leather sheath. 14 1/8\" overall", "text": "M-16 Tactical Bayonet Knife An exact replica of the M-16 bayonet issued by the military during the Vietnam war. This fully functional piece is equipped with a 9\" stainless steel blade with heavy blood groove. The black-checkered handle is heavy-duty construction and provides a superb grip. Solid stainless steel guard and butt. Includes leather sheath. 14 1/8\" overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wEQbOarfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H84D62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.87}}
{"item_id": "B000H87PUI", "title": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Suspension Cruiser Saddle, Cruiser Gel, Tri-color Black", "description": "Gel/foam comfort relief. Coil spring suspension. Weatherproof Lycra cover. 10.5\" x 10.5\"", "text": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Suspension Cruiser Saddle, Cruiser Gel, Tri-color Black Gel/foam comfort relief. Coil spring suspension. Weatherproof Lycra cover. 10.5\" x 10.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ucBB%2BdtGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H87PUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 25.25}}
{"item_id": "B000H8Y510", "title": "Hammers HP5 Anti-Shock Hiking Pole with Compass & Thermometer", "description": "HP5 is a perfect companion for your weekend hiking trips. It has a comfortable cork handle with nylon strap and a small EVA grip for use when the stick is folded. The telescopic stick is made of 3 strong aluminum alloy sections and can be adjusted to a desired height between 55\" and 27 1/2\". It also has spring-loaded antishock mechanism inside which can be turned on/off with a twist between the two sections. Functional graphic on the stick includes a US/Metric Ruler. At the bottom end of the stick, there is a carbide tip hiden inside the rubber endcap. It is very helpful when walking on rocky hard surface. A snow disc is included for use on loose top soil or muddy road. Other convenient accessories include a liquid filled mini compass and a thermometer. Both could be worn on watch band if prefered.", "text": "Hammers HP5 Anti-Shock Hiking Pole with Compass & Thermometer HP5 is a perfect companion for your weekend hiking trips. It has a comfortable cork handle with nylon strap and a small EVA grip for use when the stick is folded. The telescopic stick is made of 3 strong aluminum alloy sections and can be adjusted to a desired height between 55\" and 27 1/2\". It also has spring-loaded antishock mechanism inside which can be turned on/off with a twist between the two sections. Functional graphic on the stick includes a US/Metric Ruler. At the bottom end of the stick, there is a carbide tip hiden inside the rubber endcap. It is very helpful when walking on rocky hard surface. A snow disc is included for use on loose top soil or muddy road. Other convenient accessories include a liquid filled mini compass and a thermometer. Both could be worn on watch band if prefered.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21dWVeCRMQL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H8Y510.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 20.25}}
{"item_id": "B000H8ZO1U", "title": "MTM 380/9MM Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "text": "MTM 380/9MM Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-wHaQMXvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H8ZO1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.9}}
{"item_id": "B000H8ZWYE", "title": "MTM Single Handgun Case for up to 6-Inch Revolver (Black)", "description": "This roomier pistol case is for automatics and scoped revolvers with barrels up to 6\". There is also room for a trigger lock (not included) and the case is pad lockable.", "text": "MTM Single Handgun Case for up to 6-Inch Revolver (Black) This roomier pistol case is for automatics and scoped revolvers with barrels up to 6\". There is also room for a trigger lock (not included) and the case is pad lockable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iOkSpsm9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000H8ZWYE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 7.35}}
