{"item_id": "B000HBB15U", "title": "SECURE-IT HANDGUN STORAGE SAFE", "description": "Protect your carry weapon from falling into unauthorized hands. Use the Secure-It Handgun Storage Safe. PRICED LOW! Keep your revolver or full-size semiauto handgun close by, but still out of harm's way. The Secure-It Storage Safe can be mounted under the seat in any car or truck, or at home in any similarly compact space. It also can be hidden in a purse or briefcase. And wherever it goes, the only one who's getting inside is the one with the key! Meets TSA airline firearm guidelines. Like a mobile bank vault: Fits J and K-frame revolvers (up to 4\" barrel) and full-size semiauto handguns, including 1911s; Heavy-duty 21-gauge steel construction; Attaches to any fixed object with included 1,500-lb. test security cable; 1\" thick memory-fitting foam provides a snug, customized fit; Quarter-turn lock comes with 2 keys; Measures 9 1/2 x 6 1/2 x 1 3/4\"; Weighs 2 lbs. Be safe and secure. Order yours today! Secure-It Handgun Storage Safe", "text": "SECURE-IT HANDGUN STORAGE SAFE Protect your carry weapon from falling into unauthorized hands. Use the Secure-It Handgun Storage Safe. PRICED LOW! Keep your revolver or full-size semiauto handgun close by, but still out of harm's way. The Secure-It Storage Safe can be mounted under the seat in any car or truck, or at home in any similarly compact space. It also can be hidden in a purse or briefcase. And wherever it goes, the only one who's getting inside is the one with the key! Meets TSA airline firearm guidelines. Like a mobile bank vault: Fits J and K-frame revolvers (up to 4\" barrel) and full-size semiauto handguns, including 1911s; Heavy-duty 21-gauge steel construction; Attaches to any fixed object with included 1,500-lb. test security cable; 1\" thick memory-fitting foam provides a snug, customized fit; Quarter-turn lock comes with 2 keys; Measures 9 1/2 x 6 1/2 x 1 3/4\"; Weighs 2 lbs. Be safe and secure. Order yours today! Secure-It Handgun Storage Safe", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31z42lBIsnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBB15U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000HBEMZG", "title": "Outers Ruger 10/22 Aluminum Rod Cleaning Kit", "description": "Outers offers a wide selection of sturdy, long-lasting and easy-to-use aluminum rod kits shotguns rifles, shotguns or pistols in several versions. This kit is made specifically for the Ruger 10/22 and includes a sturdy box for secure storage and transport, lightweight cleaning rod, phosphor bronze bore brush, spear pointed jag, slotted patch loop, micro-fiber absorbent patches, Outers Nitro Solvent Gun Cleaner (2 oz), Outers Gun Oil (2 oz), muzzle guard, and patch catcher to keep fouling out of chamber.", "text": "Outers Ruger 10/22 Aluminum Rod Cleaning Kit Outers offers a wide selection of sturdy, long-lasting and easy-to-use aluminum rod kits shotguns rifles, shotguns or pistols in several versions. This kit is made specifically for the Ruger 10/22 and includes a sturdy box for secure storage and transport, lightweight cleaning rod, phosphor bronze bore brush, spear pointed jag, slotted patch loop, micro-fiber absorbent patches, Outers Nitro Solvent Gun Cleaner (2 oz), Outers Gun Oil (2 oz), muzzle guard, and patch catcher to keep fouling out of chamber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41738Bz5WEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBEMZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 22.5}}
{"item_id": "B000HBGSMQ", "title": "Intex Queen Prestige Downy Airbed with Hand Held Battery Pump", "description": "Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Queen-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6 C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 60 by 8.75 by 80 inches (WxHxD) is an official Queen-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "text": "Intex Queen Prestige Downy Airbed with Hand Held Battery Pump Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Queen-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6 C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 60 by 8.75 by 80 inches (WxHxD) is an official Queen-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Yir07CYtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBGSMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 42.88}}
{"item_id": "B000HBGSP8", "title": "Intex Classic Downy Full Airbed", "description": "Combine the comforts of a bed with the convenience of a blow-up mattress with the Intex Classic Downy full-size inflatable airbed. The Classic Downy is equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and a 15-gauge bottom. The resulting surface is luxurious and durable, with a unique wave beam construction that eliminates uncomfortable surface bumps and provides a flat, uniform sleeping surface throughout the night. The flocked surface also helps keep bedding from slipping off the side while cleaning easily. No more rummaging through your camping gear for your faulty 15-year-old pump.Finally, the Classic Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, insulating you from the cold ground surface far better than a camping mat. Other features include a folding design for easy transport; a two-in-one valve with extra-wide openings for fast inflation and deflation; and a 600-pound weight capacity. The Classic Downy--which is ideal for camping or as a spare bed--carries a 90-day warranty.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "text": "Intex Classic Downy Full Airbed Combine the comforts of a bed with the convenience of a blow-up mattress with the Intex Classic Downy full-size inflatable airbed. The Classic Downy is equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and a 15-gauge bottom. The resulting surface is luxurious and durable, with a unique wave beam construction that eliminates uncomfortable surface bumps and provides a flat, uniform sleeping surface throughout the night. The flocked surface also helps keep bedding from slipping off the side while cleaning easily. No more rummaging through your camping gear for your faulty 15-year-old pump.Finally, the Classic Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, insulating you from the cold ground surface far better than a camping mat. Other features include a folding design for easy transport; a two-in-one valve with extra-wide openings for fast inflation and deflation; and a 600-pound weight capacity. The Classic Downy--which is ideal for camping or as a spare bed--carries a 90-day warranty.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nRQTk9vCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBGSP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 23.56}}
{"item_id": "B000HBH2P8", "title": "The Outdoor Connection Oxide Finish Talon Q/R Sling Swivels", "description": "The all steel TALON swivel features a one-piece body with the Quick-Release feature. The one-piece body gives the swivel extra strength and integrity. The Quick-Release feature allows the swivel to be installed or removed with just one hand and is quiet in the field. A stainless steel spring locks the swivel securely to any standard U.S. swivel base.", "text": "The Outdoor Connection Oxide Finish Talon Q/R Sling Swivels The all steel TALON swivel features a one-piece body with the Quick-Release feature. The one-piece body gives the swivel extra strength and integrity. The Quick-Release feature allows the swivel to be installed or removed with just one hand and is quiet in the field. A stainless steel spring locks the swivel securely to any standard U.S. swivel base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bSakxSjNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBH2P8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000HBIL7G", "title": "Intex Prestige Downy Twin Airbed Kit", "description": "Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Twin-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 39 by 8.75 by 75 inches (WxHxD) is an official Twin-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 300-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "text": "Intex Prestige Downy Twin Airbed Kit Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Twin-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 39 by 8.75 by 75 inches (WxHxD) is an official Twin-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 300-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w-Lk1ANbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBIL7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000HBIL9O", "title": "Intex Classic Downy Queen Airbed with 2 Pillows and Double Quick Hand Pump", "description": "With plush flocking on the top, this Queen-sized Intex Classic Downy airbed provides a more luxurious sleeping surface and helps keep bedding from slipping. And this package includes two inflatable pillows and a hand pump. Crafted with durable heavy gauge vinyl, the cozy flocked top cleans easily and is waterproofed for camping use. It's equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom. And its 2-in-1 valve has an extra wide opening to make quick work of either inflation or deflation.The Classic Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 60 by 8.75 by 80 inches (WxHxD) is an official Queen-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "text": "Intex Classic Downy Queen Airbed with 2 Pillows and Double Quick Hand Pump With plush flocking on the top, this Queen-sized Intex Classic Downy airbed provides a more luxurious sleeping surface and helps keep bedding from slipping. And this package includes two inflatable pillows and a hand pump. Crafted with durable heavy gauge vinyl, the cozy flocked top cleans easily and is waterproofed for camping use. It's equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom. And its 2-in-1 valve has an extra wide opening to make quick work of either inflation or deflation.The Classic Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 60 by 8.75 by 80 inches (WxHxD) is an official Queen-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n7K0Km5TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBIL9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 29.65}}
{"item_id": "B000HBMFU0", "title": "Intex 12 Volt D/C Electric Pump", "description": "The Quick-Fill Electric pump, from popular inflatables company Intex, has a sleek, compact design that fits perfectly in the palm of your hand, yet still inflates rafts, air mattresses, and more in just minutes. The car-powered electric device includes a 12-volt DC plug compatible with your car's power outlets, and the pump additionally includes three interconnecting nozzles and an accordion hose for maximum versatility.About Intex RecreationIntex Recreation makes above-ground swimming pools, air beds, inflatable toys, pool and lake boats, and the proprietary Intex Saltwater Pool System. The company has been in business for over 40 years, and is a global leader in designing and producing innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation.Intex products meet the most stringent safety standards, undergoing intensive testing to ensure years of safety and satisfaction. During the manufacturing process, trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, including quality of raw materials, calibration of the machines, manufacture and assembly of each product, product testing, and careful packaging of every item.", "text": "Intex 12 Volt D/C Electric Pump The Quick-Fill Electric pump, from popular inflatables company Intex, has a sleek, compact design that fits perfectly in the palm of your hand, yet still inflates rafts, air mattresses, and more in just minutes. The car-powered electric device includes a 12-volt DC plug compatible with your car's power outlets, and the pump additionally includes three interconnecting nozzles and an accordion hose for maximum versatility.About Intex RecreationIntex Recreation makes above-ground swimming pools, air beds, inflatable toys, pool and lake boats, and the proprietary Intex Saltwater Pool System. The company has been in business for over 40 years, and is a global leader in designing and producing innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation.Intex products meet the most stringent safety standards, undergoing intensive testing to ensure years of safety and satisfaction. During the manufacturing process, trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, including quality of raw materials, calibration of the machines, manufacture and assembly of each product, product testing, and careful packaging of every item.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h8I6XTuRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBMFU0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000HBO4M2", "title": "Intex Downy Twin Bed", "description": "The Downy twin mattress offers a unique wave beam construction for maximum comfort.The Intex Downy twin inflatable airbed is ideal for travelers who want the comforts of a bed but the convenience of a blow-up mattress. The Down is equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and a 15-gauge bottom. The resulting surface is luxurious and durable, with a unique wave beam construction that eliminates uncomfortable surface bumps and provides a flat, uniform sleeping surface throughout the night. In addition, the Downy is remarkably easy to inflate thanks to the built-in bellows foot pump. No more rummaging through your camping gear for your faulty 15-year-old pump. And thanks to the two-in-one valve, you can also inflate the mattress with an optional electrical pump (sold separately).Finally, the Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, insulating you from the cold ground surface far better than a camping mat. The Downy--which is ideal for camping or as a spare bed--offers a 300-pound capacity. This item has no warranty.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "text": "Intex Downy Twin Bed The Downy twin mattress offers a unique wave beam construction for maximum comfort.The Intex Downy twin inflatable airbed is ideal for travelers who want the comforts of a bed but the convenience of a blow-up mattress. The Down is equipped with a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 14-gauge vinyl beams and a 15-gauge bottom. The resulting surface is luxurious and durable, with a unique wave beam construction that eliminates uncomfortable surface bumps and provides a flat, uniform sleeping surface throughout the night. In addition, the Downy is remarkably easy to inflate thanks to the built-in bellows foot pump. No more rummaging through your camping gear for your faulty 15-year-old pump. And thanks to the two-in-one valve, you can also inflate the mattress with an optional electrical pump (sold separately).Finally, the Downy is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, insulating you from the cold ground surface far better than a camping mat. The Downy--which is ideal for camping or as a spare bed--offers a 300-pound capacity. This item has no warranty.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31loURfWe2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBO4M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000HBPQLU", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Mid and Full Size Model Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-19 Grip Extensions replace the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2 inch of gripping surface. An optional filler piece is provided for Glock models with a semi-circular cut-out in the lower front area of the grip body. This filler piece allows for installation of the PG-19 on all Mid and Full Size Glocks. Fits Models 17,18,19,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35,37,38 - Full Metal Lined Magazines Only.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Mid and Full Size Model Grip Extension The Pearce PG-19 Grip Extensions replace the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2 inch of gripping surface. An optional filler piece is provided for Glock models with a semi-circular cut-out in the lower front area of the grip body. This filler piece allows for installation of the PG-19 on all Mid and Full Size Glocks. Fits Models 17,18,19,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35,37,38 - Full Metal Lined Magazines Only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-FeXtLEOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HBPQLU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.73}}
{"item_id": "B000HCCWX4", "title": "Allen Company Low Profile Folding Muffs, NRR26", "description": "Allen Low-profile Folding Shooting Muffs. PRICED LOW! Compact Shooting Muffs with a big 26 NRR (noise reduction rating)! Comfort-adjustable. Fold to about 4 3/4\"l. Weigh just 6 ozs. Order Today! Allen Low-profile Folding Shooting Muffs", "text": "Allen Company Low Profile Folding Muffs, NRR26 Allen Low-profile Folding Shooting Muffs. PRICED LOW! Compact Shooting Muffs with a big 26 NRR (noise reduction rating)! Comfort-adjustable. Fold to about 4 3/4\"l. Weigh just 6 ozs. Order Today! Allen Low-profile Folding Shooting Muffs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C8GmK0nmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HCCWX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 13.35}}
{"item_id": "B000HCEMZK", "title": "Allen Company Fit-Over Shooting Safety Glasses", "description": "Do you wear prescription glasses, but need safety glasses as well? These oversize glasses fit-over most corrective lenses glasses to offer full frontal and side coverage of eye area.", "text": "Allen Company Fit-Over Shooting Safety Glasses Do you wear prescription glasses, but need safety glasses as well? These oversize glasses fit-over most corrective lenses glasses to offer full frontal and side coverage of eye area.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HwV65Cp3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HCEMZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B000HCNDIW", "title": "Swiss Army 33212 X-Large Zermatt Pouch, Leather, Brown w/Steel", "description": "Extra large brown leather Zermatt pouch, with sharpening steel. Fits models: Craftsman, SwissChamp, and Cybertool.", "text": "Swiss Army 33212 X-Large Zermatt Pouch, Leather, Brown w/Steel Extra large brown leather Zermatt pouch, with sharpening steel. Fits models: Craftsman, SwissChamp, and Cybertool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tVV9FwVZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HCNDIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swiss Army", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 18.84}}
