{"item_id": "B000HDJ6AK", "title": "Wind 'N Go Mini LED Lantern", "description": "Made by Wind 'N Go, this personal-sized wind-up lantern is ideal for providing ambient light inside a tent, RV, car, or home or on a patio. It can also serve as a nightlight for kids. The lantern features two settings--low (2 LEDs) and high (4 LEDs)--and one minute of winding provides up to one hour of light. Since the lantern requires no fuel and no batteries, it's safe and inexpensive .A 12-volt DC input enables you to charge the lantern using a 120-volt wall charger or 12-volt DC car charger (sold separately). The lantern includes a carabineer that allows you to hang it from a tree or string line or inside a tent. Use several of these lanterns around a campsite for better visibility or on a patio as decorative lighting. This product weighs 0.83 pounds.FeaturesTwo settings: low (2 LEDs) and high (4 LEDs)Wind-up handle that yields up to one hour of light after one minute of winding12-volt DC input (charger sold separately)CarabineerSpecificationsColor: Silver/greenRechargeable battery: Lithium ion LIR14250/300 mAH 3.6VBattery capacity: 120 cycles/minute equals 80 percent capacityBattery life: More than 10 yearsPower duration: Two LEDs ? 60 minutes; four LEDs ? 45 minutesWeight: 8 ouncesDimensions: 2.4 inches long by 2.4 inches wide by 6.5 inches highManufacturer WarrantyAervoe Industries warrants to the original purchaser that this product shall be free from all defects in material and workmanship for one year from the date of purchase. This warranty does not apply to products that have been subject to abuse, misuse, negligence, or tampering or have been modified in any way. Broken latches and handles will not be accepted for return.About Wind 'N GoWind 'N Go is a line of dynamo-powered flashlights, lanterns, and radios.", "text": "Wind 'N Go Mini LED Lantern Made by Wind 'N Go, this personal-sized wind-up lantern is ideal for providing ambient light inside a tent, RV, car, or home or on a patio. It can also serve as a nightlight for kids. The lantern features two settings--low (2 LEDs) and high (4 LEDs)--and one minute of winding provides up to one hour of light. Since the lantern requires no fuel and no batteries, it's safe and inexpensive .A 12-volt DC input enables you to charge the lantern using a 120-volt wall charger or 12-volt DC car charger (sold separately). The lantern includes a carabineer that allows you to hang it from a tree or string line or inside a tent. Use several of these lanterns around a campsite for better visibility or on a patio as decorative lighting. This product weighs 0.83 pounds.FeaturesTwo settings: low (2 LEDs) and high (4 LEDs)Wind-up handle that yields up to one hour of light after one minute of winding12-volt DC input (charger sold separately)CarabineerSpecificationsColor: Silver/greenRechargeable battery: Lithium ion LIR14250/300 mAH 3.6VBattery capacity: 120 cycles/minute equals 80 percent capacityBattery life: More than 10 yearsPower duration: Two LEDs ? 60 minutes; four LEDs ? 45 minutesWeight: 8 ouncesDimensions: 2.4 inches long by 2.4 inches wide by 6.5 inches highManufacturer WarrantyAervoe Industries warrants to the original purchaser that this product shall be free from all defects in material and workmanship for one year from the date of purchase. This warranty does not apply to products that have been subject to abuse, misuse, negligence, or tampering or have been modified in any way. Broken latches and handles will not be accepted for return.About Wind 'N GoWind 'N Go is a line of dynamo-powered flashlights, lanterns, and radios.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AVv7CRihL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HDJ6AK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wind &#39;N Go", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 16.75}}
{"item_id": "B000HDK8H0", "title": "Wind 'N Go Portable Lantern/Radio", "description": "Ideal for the campsite or your emergency kit, this self-powered lantern sports a wind-up handle along with a built-in AM/FM radio and telescoping antenna. Three minutes of winding the handle provides up to 75 minutes of use. The lantern offers a low setting (three LEDs) and a high setting (six LEDs) as well as an emergency setting with six red blinking LEDs. Since the lantern requires no fuel, it's safe and inexpensive. When fully charged through the 12-volt DC charger, the lantern can provide up to 15 hours of use. It can also operate on three AAA batteries (not included).Other highlights include a nightlight, a compass, a hanging loop, and a 120-decibel siren that you can sound in emergency situations. The lantern comes with an audio input cord, which you can use to connect and play your iPod or other MP3 player, as well as a universal Nokia adapter for charging your Nokia cell phone. (An adapter for other cell-phone models is sold separately.) The lantern weighs 1.75 pounds.FeaturesThree settings: low (three LEDs), high (six LEDs), and emergency (six red blinking LEDs)Built-in AM/FM radio and telescoping antennaWind-up handle that yields up to 75 minutes of use after three minutes of winding12-volt DC charger120-decibel sirenNightlightCompassHanging loopAudio input cord for your MP3 playerUniversal Nokia cell-phone adapter/chargerSpecificationsColor: Yellow/blackPower source: Dynamo hand crank, 12-v DC 500mA car charger, or three AAA batteriesRechargeable battery: 3.6V 300maH 2/3 AAA Ni-MHBattery capacity: 120 cycles/minute for three minutes equals 80 percent capacityBattery life: More than 10 yearsRadio bands: AM 525-1710 KHz; FM 88-108 MHzWeight: 1.15 poundsDimensions: 3 inches long by 3 inches wide by 11 inches highManufacturer WarrantyAervoe Industries warrants to the original purchaser that this product shall be free from all defects in material and workmanship for one year from the date of purchase. This warranty does not apply to products that have been subject to abuse, misuse, negligence, or tampering or have been modified in any way. Broken latches and handles will not be accepted for return.About Wind 'N GoWind 'N Go is a line of dynamo-powered flashlights, lanterns, and radios.What's in the BoxLantern, audio input cord, and universal Nokia adapter.", "text": "Wind 'N Go Portable Lantern/Radio Ideal for the campsite or your emergency kit, this self-powered lantern sports a wind-up handle along with a built-in AM/FM radio and telescoping antenna. Three minutes of winding the handle provides up to 75 minutes of use. The lantern offers a low setting (three LEDs) and a high setting (six LEDs) as well as an emergency setting with six red blinking LEDs. Since the lantern requires no fuel, it's safe and inexpensive. When fully charged through the 12-volt DC charger, the lantern can provide up to 15 hours of use. It can also operate on three AAA batteries (not included).Other highlights include a nightlight, a compass, a hanging loop, and a 120-decibel siren that you can sound in emergency situations. The lantern comes with an audio input cord, which you can use to connect and play your iPod or other MP3 player, as well as a universal Nokia adapter for charging your Nokia cell phone. (An adapter for other cell-phone models is sold separately.) The lantern weighs 1.75 pounds.FeaturesThree settings: low (three LEDs), high (six LEDs), and emergency (six red blinking LEDs)Built-in AM/FM radio and telescoping antennaWind-up handle that yields up to 75 minutes of use after three minutes of winding12-volt DC charger120-decibel sirenNightlightCompassHanging loopAudio input cord for your MP3 playerUniversal Nokia cell-phone adapter/chargerSpecificationsColor: Yellow/blackPower source: Dynamo hand crank, 12-v DC 500mA car charger, or three AAA batteriesRechargeable battery: 3.6V 300maH 2/3 AAA Ni-MHBattery capacity: 120 cycles/minute for three minutes equals 80 percent capacityBattery life: More than 10 yearsRadio bands: AM 525-1710 KHz; FM 88-108 MHzWeight: 1.15 poundsDimensions: 3 inches long by 3 inches wide by 11 inches highManufacturer WarrantyAervoe Industries warrants to the original purchaser that this product shall be free from all defects in material and workmanship for one year from the date of purchase. This warranty does not apply to products that have been subject to abuse, misuse, negligence, or tampering or have been modified in any way. Broken latches and handles will not be accepted for return.About Wind 'N GoWind 'N Go is a line of dynamo-powered flashlights, lanterns, and radios.What's in the BoxLantern, audio input cord, and universal Nokia adapter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WJFRAZ5BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HDK8H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wind &#39;N Go", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 31.93}}
{"item_id": "B000HDKOHY", "title": "Pocket Fisherman Spin Casting Outfit", "description": "The Ronco Spincasting rod and reel combination is the famous fishing pal that has thrilled generations! Double-flex rod is hinged into closed position when stored away. Simply unfold from this position until it snaps into fully extended position. Automatic Anti-Reverse prevents the handle from turning backwards. It's always ready for the fish to strike.", "text": "Pocket Fisherman Spin Casting Outfit The Ronco Spincasting rod and reel combination is the famous fishing pal that has thrilled generations! Double-flex rod is hinged into closed position when stored away. Simply unfold from this position until it snaps into fully extended position. Automatic Anti-Reverse prevents the handle from turning backwards. It's always ready for the fish to strike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41raP2rE4ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HDKOHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ronco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Baitcasting Combos"]], "price": 19.59}}
{"item_id": "B000HDNCHI", "title": "Vittoria Rubino Pro III Fold Tire", "description": "", "text": "Vittoria Rubino Pro III Fold Tire", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uwNDmruFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HDNCHI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000HDP3UM", "title": "Vittoria Zaffiro Pro II Fold Tire", "description": "The Vittoria Zaffiro Pro II Clincher Tire fulfills a wide variety of needs to an equally wide variety of riders. Constructed with Vittoria's durable Aramid Endura compound, the Zaffiro Pro II is built to roll fast, far, and without incident. The nylon Puncture Resistant Belt (PRB) found in Vittoria's higher-tier rubber, like the Open Corsa and the Rubino, is also used here. The Zaffiro Pro II accomplishes all this without adding an exceptional amount of rotating weight. Its newly developed tread, with deeper grooves in the middle and shallower shoulders, means you'll get excellent cornering in both wet and dry conditions. Since it's a 60 TPI tire, the overall cost is reasonably low for the high-quality performance. Black tread with black sidewalls only, leaving you to choose from 700C x 23mm or 25mm widths.", "text": "Vittoria Zaffiro Pro II Fold Tire The Vittoria Zaffiro Pro II Clincher Tire fulfills a wide variety of needs to an equally wide variety of riders. Constructed with Vittoria's durable Aramid Endura compound, the Zaffiro Pro II is built to roll fast, far, and without incident. The nylon Puncture Resistant Belt (PRB) found in Vittoria's higher-tier rubber, like the Open Corsa and the Rubino, is also used here. The Zaffiro Pro II accomplishes all this without adding an exceptional amount of rotating weight. Its newly developed tread, with deeper grooves in the middle and shallower shoulders, means you'll get excellent cornering in both wet and dry conditions. Since it's a 60 TPI tire, the overall cost is reasonably low for the high-quality performance. Black tread with black sidewalls only, leaving you to choose from 700C x 23mm or 25mm widths.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YeFBiXI1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HDP3UM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000HE8NK8", "title": "Barnett Diablo Slingshot", "description": "The Barnett Diablo Slingshot offers a sleek design with a fully detachable wrist brand. Tranditionalist will love this design offering comfort and power alike.", "text": "Barnett Diablo Slingshot The Barnett Diablo Slingshot offers a sleek design with a fully detachable wrist brand. Tranditionalist will love this design offering comfort and power alike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y2qq5cbXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HE8NK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows"]], "price": 17.09}}
{"item_id": "B000HE8NL2", "title": "Barnett Outdoors Cobra Slingshot with Stabilizer and Brace", "description": "The Cobra slingshot boasts a state of the art design, front stabilizer, sighting system, and soft touch contoured grip with detachable wrist brace. This powerful weapon is remarkably accurate and fun to use, and comes complete with extra Magnum power bands and a full shooting guide.About BarnettBarnett manufactures gear \"by hunters, for hunters,\" and has sold more than one million crossbows to date. From its inception over a half century ago, every Barnett crossbow has been built to improve upon prior designs. Numerous innovations and pioneering patents have combined to make Barnett the world's number one manufacturer of crossbows. Barnett is additionally the leading international producer of youth archery and slingshot products.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors Cobra Slingshot with Stabilizer and Brace The Cobra slingshot boasts a state of the art design, front stabilizer, sighting system, and soft touch contoured grip with detachable wrist brace. This powerful weapon is remarkably accurate and fun to use, and comes complete with extra Magnum power bands and a full shooting guide.About BarnettBarnett manufactures gear \"by hunters, for hunters,\" and has sold more than one million crossbows to date. From its inception over a half century ago, every Barnett crossbow has been built to improve upon prior designs. Numerous innovations and pioneering patents have combined to make Barnett the world's number one manufacturer of crossbows. Barnett is additionally the leading international producer of youth archery and slingshot products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ib9QDrw5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HE8NL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 18.9}}
