{"item_id": "B000HGIJQ4", "title": "Speedy Stitcher Sewing Awl", "description": "Speedy Stitcher Sewing Awl. Use the Stitcher to sew any heavy material quickly and easily. Great for use at home; camp; farm; or on the boat. This package contains one sewing awl (4-1/2-inch by 1- 1/2-inch); one straight needle; one curved needle; and 30-yard of waxed polyester thread. Features a wood handle and metal sewing components. Made in USA.", "text": "Speedy Stitcher Sewing Awl Speedy Stitcher Sewing Awl. Use the Stitcher to sew any heavy material quickly and easily. Great for use at home; camp; farm; or on the boat. This package contains one sewing awl (4-1/2-inch by 1- 1/2-inch); one straight needle; one curved needle; and 30-yard of waxed polyester thread. Features a wood handle and metal sewing components. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U0KCJBFTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HGIJQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedy Stitcher", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories", "Trailer Lights"]], "price": 12.73}}
{"item_id": "B000HHM4LY", "title": "Hog Wild, Wild Beast Attractant", "description": "The number one hog attractant in the world! A granular beast attractant that smells and tastes like crushed berries and molasses. Use it to attract wild boar, deer or bear. Use it to bait hog traps or just pour it into hog wallows where they will root for hours to consume every morsel. Hog Wild can be added to corn and used in feeders to attract deer.", "text": "Hog Wild, Wild Beast Attractant The number one hog attractant in the world! A granular beast attractant that smells and tastes like crushed berries and molasses. Use it to attract wild boar, deer or bear. Use it to bait hog traps or just pour it into hog wallows where they will root for hours to consume every morsel. Hog Wild can be added to corn and used in feeders to attract deer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TKstNC9TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HHM4LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Evolved Habitat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Feeders"]], "price": 15.47}}
{"item_id": "B000HHNZGM", "title": "Mosquito Repellent Coil 10", "description": "The release of the insecticide when Mosquito Coils are burned is a potent compound that repels mosquitoes and other insects. Lasts for hours, and is a pleasant approach to prevent annoyance, bites, and disease.", "text": "Mosquito Repellent Coil 10 The release of the insecticide when Mosquito Coils are burned is a potent compound that repels mosquitoes and other insects. Lasts for hours, and is a pleasant approach to prevent annoyance, bites, and disease.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61gk-B7mqxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HHNZGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 5.24}}
