{"item_id": "B000HLLREA", "title": "PB Elite Molded Foam Roller 3' Long, 6\" Round (Most Popular Size)", "description": "Description A molded foam roller that does not contain cells making them last three times longer than traditional celled white foam rollers. Features Unlike traditional celled foam rollers that break down and flatten out, these molded rollers do not have cells and therefore will last much longer. Available in 3 feet long by 6 inches around Benefits/Uses Use round rollers for stability exercises and myofascial release and alignment and half round rollers for balance and stabilization Improves alignment and hip mobility while increasing core flexibility. Also can be used for Pilates, Yoga, Massage Therapy, and Physical Therapy", "text": "PB Elite Molded Foam Roller 3' Long, 6\" Round (Most Popular Size) Description A molded foam roller that does not contain cells making them last three times longer than traditional celled white foam rollers. Features Unlike traditional celled foam rollers that break down and flatten out, these molded rollers do not have cells and therefore will last much longer. Available in 3 feet long by 6 inches around Benefits/Uses Use round rollers for stability exercises and myofascial release and alignment and half round rollers for balance and stabilization Improves alignment and hip mobility while increasing core flexibility. Also can be used for Pilates, Yoga, Massage Therapy, and Physical Therapy", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jBo6EzEqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HLLREA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perform Better", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 26.0}}
{"item_id": "B000HLW1HC", "title": "Danskin Weighted Toning Ball", "description": "The Danskin Weighted Toning Ball is a unique strength-training tool offering a soft, comfortable, alternative to conventional dumbbells. Exercising with a toning ball improves core strength, functional movement, balance, coordination and flexibility. A Danskin Weighted Toning ball is an excellent way to tone and tighten muscles, making everyday tasks easier and more enjoyable.", "text": "Danskin Weighted Toning Ball The Danskin Weighted Toning Ball is a unique strength-training tool offering a soft, comfortable, alternative to conventional dumbbells. Exercising with a toning ball improves core strength, functional movement, balance, coordination and flexibility. A Danskin Weighted Toning ball is an excellent way to tone and tighten muscles, making everyday tasks easier and more enjoyable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P7ENA5QHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HLW1HC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]]}}
