{"item_id": "B000HOOTO2", "title": "ATI Marlin Semi-Auto Fiberforce Gun Stock", "description": "The Marlin Fiberforce gun stock, from firearm accessory maker ATI, is extremely lightweight, with a classic tactical design. Weighing just 26 ounces, it fits ATI Marline Models 60, 75, 990, and up, as well as tube or detachable mag models .22LR (does not fit the Marlin 795). Some minor modification may be required.The synthetic stock is extremely lightweight, yet also offers a classic tactical feel.FeaturesVentilated forearm and hand guardBuilt-in cheek restSure-Grip textured pad and 3M Soft Touch cheek pad for improved firing grip and comfortTwo sling swivel studs and a dowel sling mountEasy installationScratch resistantExtreme temperature, glass-reinforced polymer stockDuPointWeighs only 26 ouncesLifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "text": "ATI Marlin Semi-Auto Fiberforce Gun Stock The Marlin Fiberforce gun stock, from firearm accessory maker ATI, is extremely lightweight, with a classic tactical design. Weighing just 26 ounces, it fits ATI Marline Models 60, 75, 990, and up, as well as tube or detachable mag models .22LR (does not fit the Marlin 795). Some minor modification may be required.The synthetic stock is extremely lightweight, yet also offers a classic tactical feel.FeaturesVentilated forearm and hand guardBuilt-in cheek restSure-Grip textured pad and 3M Soft Touch cheek pad for improved firing grip and comfortTwo sling swivel studs and a dowel sling mountEasy installationScratch resistantExtreme temperature, glass-reinforced polymer stockDuPointWeighs only 26 ouncesLifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T5BCqcnkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HOOTO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 49.02}}
{"item_id": "B000HOT2SK", "title": "ATI Mosin Nagant 7.62x54R Monte Carlo Stock", "description": "With this Monte Carlo gun stock from ATI, you can easily convert your Mosin Nagant into a modern-looking hunting rifle. The stock fits most 91/30 rifles, as well as M-38 and M-44 carbines, and Mosin Nagant variants 7.62x54R.This gun stock quickly transforms your rifle into a sleek, modern weapon.FeaturesScorpion recoil pad:Recoil impact is absorbed, regardless of load size, for pain-free shootingImproves target reacquisition by minimizing muzzle liftChemical-resistantRemains flexible, even in extreme conditionsRemoves limitations from spring and pistol type recoil suppression systemsDuPont Extreme Temperature Glass-reinforced PolymerRaised 3M Soft Touch cheek rest pad for improved shooting comfortTwo sling swivel studsCheckered forearm and gripEasy, drop-in installationLifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "text": "ATI Mosin Nagant 7.62x54R Monte Carlo Stock With this Monte Carlo gun stock from ATI, you can easily convert your Mosin Nagant into a modern-looking hunting rifle. The stock fits most 91/30 rifles, as well as M-38 and M-44 carbines, and Mosin Nagant variants 7.62x54R.This gun stock quickly transforms your rifle into a sleek, modern weapon.FeaturesScorpion recoil pad:Recoil impact is absorbed, regardless of load size, for pain-free shootingImproves target reacquisition by minimizing muzzle liftChemical-resistantRemains flexible, even in extreme conditionsRemoves limitations from spring and pistol type recoil suppression systemsDuPont Extreme Temperature Glass-reinforced PolymerRaised 3M Soft Touch cheek rest pad for improved shooting comfortTwo sling swivel studsCheckered forearm and gripEasy, drop-in installationLifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21QLP3JSBxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HOT2SK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 73.98}}
