{"item_id": "B000HOV7BA", "title": "ATI .303 Enfield #4 Mk 1 2 MK5 Monte Carlo Stock", "description": "Update your Enfield with a classic design. Features 2 sling swivel studs, raised cheekrest, checkered grip and forearm, and Dupont extreme temperature glass reinforced polymer. It fits most .303/.308 Number 4, Mk 1, Mk2, Mk5.", "text": "ATI .303 Enfield #4 Mk 1 2 MK5 Monte Carlo Stock Update your Enfield with a classic design. Features 2 sling swivel studs, raised cheekrest, checkered grip and forearm, and Dupont extreme temperature glass reinforced polymer. It fits most .303/.308 Number 4, Mk 1, Mk2, Mk5.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aXfBrKubL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000HOV7BA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 65.89}}
