{"item_id": "B000I0V0JM", "title": "Brooks Saddles B67 Bicycle Saddle (Men's)", "description": "Brooks Saddles B67 is the modern version of the B66 model, first featured in the 1927 catalogue. Classically sprung for supreme comfort, the B67 features single rails for attachment to modern micro-adjust seat pillars. The honey leather saddle features tubular steel rivets, and weighs 850 grams.", "text": "Brooks Saddles B67 Bicycle Saddle (Men's) Brooks Saddles B67 is the modern version of the B66 model, first featured in the 1927 catalogue. Classically sprung for supreme comfort, the B67 features single rails for attachment to modern micro-adjust seat pillars. The honey leather saddle features tubular steel rivets, and weighs 850 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c1ek15eTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I0V0JM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brooks Saddles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 109.97}}
{"item_id": "B000I1BQKO", "title": "Valeo AW20 Adjustable Ankle / Wrist Weights (10-Pounds Each, 20-Pound Total)", "description": "Add intensity to your workout with the Valeo AW20 Adjustable Ankle and Wrist Weights. An ideal way to build strength while walking, stepping, or during other low-impact aerobic exercises, the Valeo ankle and wrist weights allow you to incorporate weight-resistance training into everyday activities. Wearing the weights on your wrists can develop upper body strength as you walk, jog, or aerobicize. Wearing the weights on your ankles helps develop overall leg strength and toning during any low-impact aerobic activity or during calisthenics.The Valeo weights are designed to adjust to your exact fitness needs. With removable weight packs, each Valeo weight can adjust from two to 10 pounds in two-pound increments for a total of 20 pounds of weight. The weight sleeves have self-gripping closures so it is easy to add and remove weights as needed. The Valeo weights are padded for comfort and have adjustable metal D-ring double-strap closure systems so they can be adjusted for a perfect fit on your wrists or ankles.What's in the Box?Two 10-pound ankle/wrist weights", "text": "Valeo AW20 Adjustable Ankle / Wrist Weights (10-Pounds Each, 20-Pound Total) Add intensity to your workout with the Valeo AW20 Adjustable Ankle and Wrist Weights. An ideal way to build strength while walking, stepping, or during other low-impact aerobic exercises, the Valeo ankle and wrist weights allow you to incorporate weight-resistance training into everyday activities. Wearing the weights on your wrists can develop upper body strength as you walk, jog, or aerobicize. Wearing the weights on your ankles helps develop overall leg strength and toning during any low-impact aerobic activity or during calisthenics.The Valeo weights are designed to adjust to your exact fitness needs. With removable weight packs, each Valeo weight can adjust from two to 10 pounds in two-pound increments for a total of 20 pounds of weight. The weight sleeves have self-gripping closures so it is easy to add and remove weights as needed. The Valeo weights are padded for comfort and have adjustable metal D-ring double-strap closure systems so they can be adjusted for a perfect fit on your wrists or ankles.What's in the Box?Two 10-pound ankle/wrist weights", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RM859RNXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1BQKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 38.57}}
{"item_id": "B000I1BR6M", "title": "Valeo Neoprene Hand Weight", "description": "Neoprene coating provides a comfortable non-slip grip. Helps improve muscle tone and core strength. Enhances all aerobic exercise and fitness training. Available in 2; 3; 5; 8 and 10 lb. weights. Includes exercise wall chart. Sold in pairs.", "text": "Valeo Neoprene Hand Weight Neoprene coating provides a comfortable non-slip grip. Helps improve muscle tone and core strength. Enhances all aerobic exercise and fitness training. Available in 2; 3; 5; 8 and 10 lb. weights. Includes exercise wall chart. Sold in pairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416F66RTE0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1BR6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 13.85}}
{"item_id": "B000I1BR7Q", "title": "Valeo HW10 10-Pound Neoprene Hand Weights", "description": "Valeo's neoprene coated hand weights come in a pair of two with an exercise wall chart to guide your training. The neoprene coating provides a comfortable non-slip grip and also won't damage floors or other surfaces. The 10-pound weights are ideal for targeting upper body and arm muscles and can also be used to add heft to aerobic training.", "text": "Valeo HW10 10-Pound Neoprene Hand Weights Valeo's neoprene coated hand weights come in a pair of two with an exercise wall chart to guide your training. The neoprene coating provides a comfortable non-slip grip and also won't damage floors or other surfaces. The 10-pound weights are ideal for targeting upper body and arm muscles and can also be used to add heft to aerobic training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NMAZ7Y19L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1BR7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 21.18}}
{"item_id": "B000I1DD64", "title": "Valeo WW2 2-Pound Wrist Weights", "description": "Slip-on wrist weights are soft and comfortable and enhance all aerobic exercises. Each weight weighs 1 lb.", "text": "Valeo WW2 2-Pound Wrist Weights Slip-on wrist weights are soft and comfortable and enhance all aerobic exercises. Each weight weighs 1 lb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414HXCQEQYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1DD64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Wrist Weights"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B000I1FB64", "title": "Valeo Neoprene Hand Weights", "description": "Rubber-coated hand weights provide comfortable, non-slip grip Enhance upper body strength, improve muscle tone, overall fitness, cardio Perform curls, tricep extensions, flies, other exercises Ideal for home use or portable for the gym About Valeo Valeo - which means ''to be well'' in Latin, is a Wisconsin-based company that develops products of uncompromising quality and value to both personal fitness consumers and workplace safety officials. The company was started in 1988, introducing its original Classic Belt, and continues to provide an extensive line of fitness accessories for use at home or the gym. Coated with colorful neoprene. Includes wall chart demonstrating proper form. No assembly required. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Valeo Neoprene Hand Weights Rubber-coated hand weights provide comfortable, non-slip grip Enhance upper body strength, improve muscle tone, overall fitness, cardio Perform curls, tricep extensions, flies, other exercises Ideal for home use or portable for the gym About Valeo Valeo - which means ''to be well'' in Latin, is a Wisconsin-based company that develops products of uncompromising quality and value to both personal fitness consumers and workplace safety officials. The company was started in 1988, introducing its original Classic Belt, and continues to provide an extensive line of fitness accessories for use at home or the gym. Coated with colorful neoprene. Includes wall chart demonstrating proper form. No assembly required. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ECBSK4VNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1FB64.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000I1GPDW", "title": "Valeo HGR Hand Grips", "description": "Hand Grips feature double coiled chromed steel springs with durable molded plastic handles. One pair.", "text": "Valeo HGR Hand Grips Hand Grips feature double coiled chromed steel springs with durable molded plastic handles. One pair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R1TK1B0JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1GPDW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 2.4}}
{"item_id": "B000I1NJW2", "title": "Theragear Pilates Mini Ball, Purple, 9 Inch", "description": "The Pilates Mini Ball is a sure way to tone your abs and inner thighs as well as increase your flexibility, strength and endurance! The Pilates Mini Ball is also a wonderful tool for adding focus & energy to your workouts. It is also suitable for relaxation and deep relaxation, for abdominal muscle training and neck massages. It can also be used as supporting cushion, when it is partially inflated. The Pilates Mini Ball is easy to inflate by gently blowing into the inflation straw (included). Please note color not exactly as shown.", "text": "Theragear Pilates Mini Ball, Purple, 9 Inch The Pilates Mini Ball is a sure way to tone your abs and inner thighs as well as increase your flexibility, strength and endurance! The Pilates Mini Ball is also a wonderful tool for adding focus & energy to your workouts. It is also suitable for relaxation and deep relaxation, for abdominal muscle training and neck massages. It can also be used as supporting cushion, when it is partially inflated. The Pilates Mini Ball is easy to inflate by gently blowing into the inflation straw (included). Please note color not exactly as shown.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21U1s3C-HXL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I1NJW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Theragear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I28E12", "title": "Mega-Sound Megaphone", "description": "Be heard in any crowd! Lightweight, compact megaphone projects voice up to 165 yards. Ideal for sporting events, picnics, boating and calling the kids. Color: White, Battery Included: No, Includes: Volume control, Product Style: Megaphone, Range (ft.): 495, Weather Resistant: Yes, Battery Type: Requires 4 C batteries", "text": "Mega-Sound Megaphone Be heard in any crowd! Lightweight, compact megaphone projects voice up to 165 yards. Ideal for sporting events, picnics, boating and calling the kids. Color: White, Battery Included: No, Includes: Volume control, Product Style: Megaphone, Range (ft.): 495, Weather Resistant: Yes, Battery Type: Requires 4 C batteries", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gwmW9Xv9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I28E12.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Northern Tool &amp; Equipment", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Megaphones"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I2RNEQ", "title": "Wireless Indoor/Outdoor Thermometer w/ Self Setting Clock", "description": "Monitors the indoor and outdoor temperature from up to three remote locations and automatically sets itself to the US Atomic Clock signal. Features: Monitors the indoor and outdoor temperature using wireless sensor Automatically sets itself to the U.S. Atomic Clock and adjusts for Daylight Saving Time Displays three levels of temperature trends: rising, falling and steady Features a crescendo alarm clock with 8-minute snooze function Displays the day and month for easy reference Displays the minimum and maximum temperatures Customizable temperature alarm alerts user to high or low temperatures Ice alert activated when outdoor temperature is between 29 and 37 degrees Fahrenheit (-2 to 3 degrees Celsius) Wirelessly transmits weather data from 100 feet away Temperature Range: -30F to 140F", "text": "Wireless Indoor/Outdoor Thermometer w/ Self Setting Clock Monitors the indoor and outdoor temperature from up to three remote locations and automatically sets itself to the US Atomic Clock signal. Features: Monitors the indoor and outdoor temperature using wireless sensor Automatically sets itself to the U.S. Atomic Clock and adjusts for Daylight Saving Time Displays three levels of temperature trends: rising, falling and steady Features a crescendo alarm clock with 8-minute snooze function Displays the day and month for easy reference Displays the minimum and maximum temperatures Customizable temperature alarm alerts user to high or low temperatures Ice alert activated when outdoor temperature is between 29 and 37 degrees Fahrenheit (-2 to 3 degrees Celsius) Wirelessly transmits weather data from 100 feet away Temperature Range: -30F to 140F", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R3CSVEQ0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I2RNEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Cabin Products", "Clocks & Barometers"]], "price": 22.17}}
{"item_id": "B000I3WXV8", "title": "KEEN Men's Austin Sneaker", "description": "", "text": "KEEN Men's Austin Sneaker", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PdvNnjeNL._SY395_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I3WXV8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Shoes", "Athletic", "Walking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000I44PAO", "title": "Ripstik Caster Board", "description": "Best described as a cross between a skateboard and a snowboard, the Ripstik caster board is the perfect ride for kids looking for the next big thrill. The board is distinguished by its pivoting deck and 360-degree inclined caster trucks, which offer a snowboard-like carving ability. A simple weight transfer lets you turn or accelerate without pushing, just like when you're carving down the slopes.The Ripstik's unique twisting motion moves you forward with out ever pushing off the ground.The board offers such features as spiked traction pads, a kick tail and nose, and a concave deck design, which combine to improve your foot control--a must for tricks. And thanks to the 76mm polyurethane wheels and precision ABEC-5 bearing casters, skaters will enjoy a smooth ride on almost any type of pavement. Designed for children 8 years and up, the Ripstik's plastic end platforms and metal torsion beam support up to 220 pounds.Key Features:Inclined caster trucksConcave deck platformsTraction platesKick noseKick tailRubber-padded handleTorsion bar76-millimeter polyurethane wheelsHigh-performance ABEC-5 bearingsFor ages 8 years and older220-pound rider weight capacity", "text": "Ripstik Caster Board Best described as a cross between a skateboard and a snowboard, the Ripstik caster board is the perfect ride for kids looking for the next big thrill. The board is distinguished by its pivoting deck and 360-degree inclined caster trucks, which offer a snowboard-like carving ability. A simple weight transfer lets you turn or accelerate without pushing, just like when you're carving down the slopes.The Ripstik's unique twisting motion moves you forward with out ever pushing off the ground.The board offers such features as spiked traction pads, a kick tail and nose, and a concave deck design, which combine to improve your foot control--a must for tricks. And thanks to the 76mm polyurethane wheels and precision ABEC-5 bearing casters, skaters will enjoy a smooth ride on almost any type of pavement. Designed for children 8 years and up, the Ripstik's plastic end platforms and metal torsion beam support up to 220 pounds.Key Features:Inclined caster trucksConcave deck platformsTraction platesKick noseKick tailRubber-padded handleTorsion bar76-millimeter polyurethane wheelsHigh-performance ABEC-5 bearingsFor ages 8 years and older220-pound rider weight capacity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bL1g-WckL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I44PAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RipStik", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Caster Boards"]], "price": 58.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I45XCI", "title": "TSG 3-Piece Pad Pack", "description": "1 Set of Knee Pads, 1 set of Elbow Pads, and 1 Set of Wrist Guards", "text": "TSG 3-Piece Pad Pack 1 Set of Knee Pads, 1 set of Elbow Pads, and 1 Set of Wrist Guards", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418JWY7SDAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I45XCI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000I4TXNS", "title": "Oury MTN Grip", "description": "Sometimes the things we appreciate most, remind us of our youth. This is true of Oury Mountain Grips. They have a long history of use for Motocross and BMX. If you grew up torn between mashing pedals or twisting a throttle grip, then having them on your mountain bike is akin to warping back in time to the days of old when you had fewer worries and nothing to do but have two-wheeled fun all day long. Oury Mountain Grips have a blocked design that's as comfy as it gets in a round grip. Known for being durable, we think the basic design adds to their ability to last for years. The wide range of color choices is great for those who like to add some flair to their rides. Just try to remember to get home in time for dinner.", "text": "Oury MTN Grip Sometimes the things we appreciate most, remind us of our youth. This is true of Oury Mountain Grips. They have a long history of use for Motocross and BMX. If you grew up torn between mashing pedals or twisting a throttle grip, then having them on your mountain bike is akin to warping back in time to the days of old when you had fewer worries and nothing to do but have two-wheeled fun all day long. Oury Mountain Grips have a blocked design that's as comfy as it gets in a round grip. Known for being durable, we think the basic design adds to their ability to last for years. The wide range of color choices is great for those who like to add some flair to their rides. Just try to remember to get home in time for dinner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313CMjgCzuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I4TXNS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000I52BSG", "title": "Razor V-17 Youth Multi-Sport Helmet", "description": "The Razor V-17 multi sport helmet unites superior quality with a cutting edge design .. Your perfect choice for biking, skating or any other sport that requires protective headgear. On the street or in the half pipe the Razor V-17 provides you with superior security and protection. The ergonomic designed padding and an additional sizing pad set for the perfect individual fit guarantee ultimate comfort. The 17 vents keep your head cool at all times and the side release buckles make it a breeze to adjust and fasten your chin strap. Factory contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com.", "text": "Razor V-17 Youth Multi-Sport Helmet The Razor V-17 multi sport helmet unites superior quality with a cutting edge design .. Your perfect choice for biking, skating or any other sport that requires protective headgear. On the street or in the half pipe the Razor V-17 provides you with superior security and protection. The ergonomic designed padding and an additional sizing pad set for the perfect individual fit guarantee ultimate comfort. The 17 vents keep your head cool at all times and the side release buckles make it a breeze to adjust and fasten your chin strap. Factory contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eKl874REL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I52BSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I52BUE", "title": "Razor V-17 Adult Multi-Sport Helmet (Black)", "description": "Uniting superior quality with a cutting-edge design, the black Razor V-17 adult multi-sport helmet is ideal for biking, skating, or any other sport that requires protective headgear. The helmet is equipped with ergonomic padding to keep the rider comfortable, along with 17 vents along the top and sides to guarantee a cool head. The side release buckles, meanwhile, make it a breeze to adjust and fasten the helmet. Designed to fit head sizes between 23 and 25 inches, the V-17 includes extra pads for even more comfort and complies with all CPSC standards.", "text": "Razor V-17 Adult Multi-Sport Helmet (Black) Uniting superior quality with a cutting-edge design, the black Razor V-17 adult multi-sport helmet is ideal for biking, skating, or any other sport that requires protective headgear. The helmet is equipped with ergonomic padding to keep the rider comfortable, along with 17 vents along the top and sides to guarantee a cool head. The side release buckles, meanwhile, make it a breeze to adjust and fasten the helmet. Designed to fit head sizes between 23 and 25 inches, the V-17 includes extra pads for even more comfort and complies with all CPSC standards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O1dIHfn-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I52BUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I55OL2", "title": "Razor V-17 Child Multi-sport Helmet", "description": "The Razor V-17 multi sport helmet unites superior quality with a cutting edge design .. Your perfect choice for biking, skating or any other sport that requires protective headgear. On the street or in the half pipe the Razor V-17 provides you with superior security and protection. The ergonomic designed padding and an additional sizing pad set for the perfect individual fit guarantee ultimate comfort. The 17 vents keep your head cool at all times and the side release buckles make it a breeze to adjust and fasten your chin strap. Factory contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com.Helmet SizeAgeHead SizeToddler5 & under19-21.5 inchesChild5-821.5-22.5 inchesYouth8-1422-23.5 inchesAdult14+23-25 inches", "text": "Razor V-17 Child Multi-sport Helmet The Razor V-17 multi sport helmet unites superior quality with a cutting edge design .. Your perfect choice for biking, skating or any other sport that requires protective headgear. On the street or in the half pipe the Razor V-17 provides you with superior security and protection. The ergonomic designed padding and an additional sizing pad set for the perfect individual fit guarantee ultimate comfort. The 17 vents keep your head cool at all times and the side release buckles make it a breeze to adjust and fasten your chin strap. Factory contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com.Helmet SizeAgeHead SizeToddler5 & under19-21.5 inchesChild5-821.5-22.5 inchesYouth8-1422-23.5 inchesAdult14+23-25 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eKl874REL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I55OL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B000I641UQ", "title": "Kamp-Rite Oversize Tent Cot", "description": "If you've done a fair amount of camping, you know that sleeping on a cot inside a roomy tent is far more comfortable than sleeping on the ground. Now you can combine both luxuries with the oversize Kamp-Rite tent cot, a fully framed and enclosed cot with nylon sides and tie-up no-see-um mesh doors and windows--just like a personal tent. The legs of the cot are suspended a full 11 inches off the ground, keeping you away from moisture, snakes, and rodents, so you needn't worry about waking up with a mouse inside your sleeping bag. More significantly, the cot is roomy and comfortable, with plenty of space to stretch out and sleep in style. (The oversize version offers 12 inches of additional headroom compared to the original tent cot, with extra elbow room on the sides as well.) Simply situate the tent cot on any piece of level ground, toss in your favorite sleeping bag or blanket, and you're ready for a great night of sleep. As a bonus, you can also collapse the tent cot into a flat cot orientation, letting you take full advantage of the sun's rays on a warm afternoon, or you can convert the cot into a lounge chair by tilting one end upward.The tent cot's frame is made of lightweight yet durable aluminum, with anti-vibration aluminum nuts and bolts that won't loosen over time or rust. The \"tent\" portion of the product features durable 420-denier nylon fabric with no-see-um doors and windows that open on all four sides. When the outer nylon doors are zipped open and the interior no-see-um mesh doors are zipped closed, the tent cot is 100-percent insect-proof yet still encourages 360-degree airflow--a must for warmer climates. The durable one-piece Cordura nylon-fabric sleeping surface, meanwhile, is firm and level, helping you sleep soundly throughout the night. And should you encounter severe stormy weather, simply set up the \"total encapsulation\" rain fly.Easy to set up and transport thanks to the heavy-duty carrying bag, the oversize tent cot measures 90 by 40 by 32 inches (W x H x D) when set up and 34 by 7 by 34 inches when folded. The cot also comes in alternate original and double sizes and is backed by a one-year warranty against defects.", "text": "Kamp-Rite Oversize Tent Cot If you've done a fair amount of camping, you know that sleeping on a cot inside a roomy tent is far more comfortable than sleeping on the ground. Now you can combine both luxuries with the oversize Kamp-Rite tent cot, a fully framed and enclosed cot with nylon sides and tie-up no-see-um mesh doors and windows--just like a personal tent. The legs of the cot are suspended a full 11 inches off the ground, keeping you away from moisture, snakes, and rodents, so you needn't worry about waking up with a mouse inside your sleeping bag. More significantly, the cot is roomy and comfortable, with plenty of space to stretch out and sleep in style. (The oversize version offers 12 inches of additional headroom compared to the original tent cot, with extra elbow room on the sides as well.) Simply situate the tent cot on any piece of level ground, toss in your favorite sleeping bag or blanket, and you're ready for a great night of sleep. As a bonus, you can also collapse the tent cot into a flat cot orientation, letting you take full advantage of the sun's rays on a warm afternoon, or you can convert the cot into a lounge chair by tilting one end upward.The tent cot's frame is made of lightweight yet durable aluminum, with anti-vibration aluminum nuts and bolts that won't loosen over time or rust. The \"tent\" portion of the product features durable 420-denier nylon fabric with no-see-um doors and windows that open on all four sides. When the outer nylon doors are zipped open and the interior no-see-um mesh doors are zipped closed, the tent cot is 100-percent insect-proof yet still encourages 360-degree airflow--a must for warmer climates. The durable one-piece Cordura nylon-fabric sleeping surface, meanwhile, is firm and level, helping you sleep soundly throughout the night. And should you encounter severe stormy weather, simply set up the \"total encapsulation\" rain fly.Easy to set up and transport thanks to the heavy-duty carrying bag, the oversize tent cot measures 90 by 40 by 32 inches (W x H x D) when set up and 34 by 7 by 34 inches when folded. The cot also comes in alternate original and double sizes and is backed by a one-year warranty against defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B1OTAd2zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I641UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kamp-Rite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 188.49}}
