{"item_id": "B000I7NWXC", "title": "UCO Grilliput Firebowl", "description": "The Compact Firebowl for the Grilliput is a portable solution for creating a small contained fire for use with your grill. The firebowl folds up into a small space and can also be used to store your charcoal or wood. It is very durable and makes an excellent companion for your Grilliput or other camping grill.", "text": "UCO Grilliput Firebowl The Compact Firebowl for the Grilliput is a portable solution for creating a small contained fire for use with your grill. The firebowl folds up into a small space and can also be used to store your charcoal or wood. It is very durable and makes an excellent companion for your Grilliput or other camping grill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mK1DRInYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000I7NWXC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Bowls"]]}}
