{"item_id": "B000IAR5N2", "title": "Vanguard Supreme 37F Heavy Duty Waterproof and Dustproof Professional Hard Case with Pick nPluck Foam Interior", "description": "Vanguard SUPREME-37F Pelican style Supreme Series hard camera case features interior foam for customizing and \"O\" ring for watertight and airtight storage. Also features a shortcut fastener for convenient and secure close and key lockable latches for security.", "text": "Vanguard Supreme 37F Heavy Duty Waterproof and Dustproof Professional Hard Case with Pick nPluck Foam Interior Vanguard SUPREME-37F Pelican style Supreme Series hard camera case features interior foam for customizing and \"O\" ring for watertight and airtight storage. Also features a shortcut fastener for convenient and secure close and key lockable latches for security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AE9j7ndLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IAR5N2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 129.99}}
{"item_id": "B000IBEBB0", "title": "Neiko 53849A Flip-Up Style, ANSI Approved Comfort-Fit Welding and Torch Safety Goggles", "description": "Protect your eyes with these convenient and comfortable Welding and Torch Safety Goggles. The soft PVC frame along with adjustable strap ensure a secure and comfortable fit, while the 4-vent ventilation provides additional comfort. Flip-up lenses style lets you switch easily between tasks without taking off the goggles. These goggles meet and exceeds the ANSI Z87.1 standards.", "text": "Neiko 53849A Flip-Up Style, ANSI Approved Comfort-Fit Welding and Torch Safety Goggles Protect your eyes with these convenient and comfortable Welding and Torch Safety Goggles. The soft PVC frame along with adjustable strap ensure a secure and comfortable fit, while the 4-vent ventilation provides additional comfort. Flip-up lenses style lets you switch easily between tasks without taking off the goggles. These goggles meet and exceeds the ANSI Z87.1 standards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G03Hw5mrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IBEBB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neiko", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 6.99}}
