{"item_id": "B000IE7R22", "title": "Schrade X-Timer Camp Knife 11 3/4\" Fixed Blade", "description": "X-Timer Camp Knife with Sure Grip handle, and a heavy-duty belt sheath. 11 3/4\" overall length Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Schrade X-Timer Camp Knife 11 3/4\" Fixed Blade X-Timer Camp Knife with Sure Grip handle, and a heavy-duty belt sheath. 11 3/4\" overall length Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V68CQ9R0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IE7R22.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IE9LRG", "title": "Schrade 153UH Uncle Henry Golden Spike Knife Fixed Blade", "description": "Schrade's Golden Spike Fixed Blade Knife is a serious and practical outdoor knife with a comfortable and positive grip. It includes a leather sheath and a sharpening stone for touching up the edge while on the hunt. This knife features a 5-inch clip blade with a staglon, brass guard, and butt handle. Measures 9-1/4 inches overall.Specifications:Weight: 0.74 lb.Knife Specs: Overall Length is 9.25 inchesType: Fixed BladeHandle Material: Staglon HandleBlade Edge: Plain EdgeBlade Type: Drop PointBlade Material: 440C High Carbon Stainless Steel", "text": "Schrade 153UH Uncle Henry Golden Spike Knife Fixed Blade Schrade's Golden Spike Fixed Blade Knife is a serious and practical outdoor knife with a comfortable and positive grip. It includes a leather sheath and a sharpening stone for touching up the edge while on the hunt. This knife features a 5-inch clip blade with a staglon, brass guard, and butt handle. Measures 9-1/4 inches overall.Specifications:Weight: 0.74 lb.Knife Specs: Overall Length is 9.25 inchesType: Fixed BladeHandle Material: Staglon HandleBlade Edge: Plain EdgeBlade Type: Drop PointBlade Material: 440C High Carbon Stainless Steel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31apD3Jv4NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IE9LRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B000IEFLRK", "title": "UCO Mini Ultralight Lantern for Tealight Candles", "description": "The worldwide popularity of the tealight tub candle inspired us to create a lantern to make its use safe and convenient. The design of the UCO Mini Lantern does a superb job of utilizing a readily available candle and expanding its capabilities to include outdoor recreation and wider use around the home. Made to the same high standards as the UCO Original Candle Lantern, the patented UCO Mini Lantern features aluminum construction, a glass chimney, and a unique candle holder that keeps the tealight candle stable. A specially-designed vent in the base of the lantern provides cool air to supply the flame with needed oxygen. The UCO Mini Lantern is ideal for ultra light hiking, bike touring, world travel, and makes home use of the ubiquitous tealight candle much more appealing. Made in USA.", "text": "UCO Mini Ultralight Lantern for Tealight Candles The worldwide popularity of the tealight tub candle inspired us to create a lantern to make its use safe and convenient. The design of the UCO Mini Lantern does a superb job of utilizing a readily available candle and expanding its capabilities to include outdoor recreation and wider use around the home. Made to the same high standards as the UCO Original Candle Lantern, the patented UCO Mini Lantern features aluminum construction, a glass chimney, and a unique candle holder that keeps the tealight candle stable. A specially-designed vent in the base of the lantern provides cool air to supply the flame with needed oxygen. The UCO Mini Lantern is ideal for ultra light hiking, bike touring, world travel, and makes home use of the ubiquitous tealight candle much more appealing. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BubuocfdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IEFLRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B000IENPWS", "title": "G 5 Outdoors Montec 100 Grain 1-1/16\" Cut Broadheads (3 Pack)", "description": "Solid One Piece Head To Thread Construction With A Cut-On Contact Tip. 100% Steel Tough. Re-Sharpenable And Re-Useable With Beefy 60 Degree Angle Tapered Blade. Has A Cutting Diameter Of: 100 Grain-1-1/8\". 3 Per Pack.", "text": "G 5 Outdoors Montec 100 Grain 1-1/16\" Cut Broadheads (3 Pack) Solid One Piece Head To Thread Construction With A Cut-On Contact Tip. 100% Steel Tough. Re-Sharpenable And Re-Useable With Beefy 60 Degree Angle Tapered Blade. Has A Cutting Diameter Of: 100 Grain-1-1/8\". 3 Per Pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lNyy725kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IENPWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "G 5 Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 31.01}}
{"item_id": "B000IEQ42Q", "title": "Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove", "description": "FEATURES of the Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove 14\" x 32\" cooking area 2 durable burners 90,000 BTU/hr 29\" cooking height Detachable legs Available in high/low Windscreen included The SPECS of the Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 34 x 8.5 x 16\" Box Weight: 40 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove FEATURES of the Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove 14\" x 32\" cooking area 2 durable burners 90,000 BTU/hr 29\" cooking height Detachable legs Available in high/low Windscreen included The SPECS of the Camp Chef Outdoorsman High / Low 2 Burner Stove Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 34 x 8.5 x 16\" Box Weight: 40 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vtlitq01L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IEQ42Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 129.33}}
{"item_id": "B000IES5PK", "title": "TRU-FIRE Patriot Jr PT-JR release Power Strap", "description": "Velcro closure system, less than 5 seconds and its on. Fits both right and left hand. Fits the smallest of hands, including a child's. Economical and comfortable nylon power strap. Fast and simple.", "text": "TRU-FIRE Patriot Jr PT-JR release Power Strap Velcro closure system, less than 5 seconds and its on. Fits both right and left hand. Fits the smallest of hands, including a child's. Economical and comfortable nylon power strap. Fast and simple.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31boesInEWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IES5PK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tru-Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B000IES5RI", "title": "TRU-FIRE Hurricane HC-EX-BW Extreme Buckle Web Release", "description": "Camo nylon evolution buckle with a 1/2\" web connection system. Infinite length adjustment possibilities without the use of tools and the webbing won't stretch or move.", "text": "TRU-FIRE Hurricane HC-EX-BW Extreme Buckle Web Release Camo nylon evolution buckle with a 1/2\" web connection system. Infinite length adjustment possibilities without the use of tools and the webbing won't stretch or move.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QGdzrVGSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IES5RI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tru-Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 31.21}}
{"item_id": "B000IF43LO", "title": "Camelbak Rogue 70 Oz Hydration Pack, Black/Charcoal", "description": "Delivering three bottles worth of hydration, the Rogue hydration pack is a great choice for cyclists, mountain bikers, and hikers. The pack is built around a 2.1-liter Omega reservoir with an easily accessible drinking tube, so you can grab a quick sip whenever you're parched or need a water boost. The reservoir is also externally accessible, making it easy to refill at a water fountain, from a hose, or virtually anywhere else. And thanks to the secure storage pocket, the pack offers plenty of room for your bike pump, extra tire tube, repair tools, and energy bars.Other details include a channeled back panel design that's cool and breathable on hot days, a Slider SternumStrap that distributes the weight evenly across your hips, and reflective striping that helps increase your visibility in low-light conditions. So whether you're taking a leisurely ride across town or hitting the trails for a day's worth of hard riding, the Rogue steps up to the plate. As with all Camelbak hydration packs, the Rogue is backed by a two-year warranty (with a lifetime warranty on the Omega reservoir).About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "text": "Camelbak Rogue 70 Oz Hydration Pack, Black/Charcoal Delivering three bottles worth of hydration, the Rogue hydration pack is a great choice for cyclists, mountain bikers, and hikers. The pack is built around a 2.1-liter Omega reservoir with an easily accessible drinking tube, so you can grab a quick sip whenever you're parched or need a water boost. The reservoir is also externally accessible, making it easy to refill at a water fountain, from a hose, or virtually anywhere else. And thanks to the secure storage pocket, the pack offers plenty of room for your bike pump, extra tire tube, repair tools, and energy bars.Other details include a channeled back panel design that's cool and breathable on hot days, a Slider SternumStrap that distributes the weight evenly across your hips, and reflective striping that helps increase your visibility in low-light conditions. So whether you're taking a leisurely ride across town or hitting the trails for a day's worth of hard riding, the Rogue steps up to the plate. As with all Camelbak hydration packs, the Rogue is backed by a two-year warranty (with a lifetime warranty on the Omega reservoir).About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414%2BWkXuOlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IF43LO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IF43QE", "title": "CamelBak M.U.L.E. 100 oz Hydration Pack (Burnt Orange/Charcoal)", "description": "THE PREMIER mountain bike hydration system", "text": "CamelBak M.U.L.E. 100 oz Hydration Pack (Burnt Orange/Charcoal) THE PREMIER mountain bike hydration system", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VeordOYBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IF43QE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IF7YL0", "title": "Camelbak UnBottle 100 Oz Hydration Pack, True Blue/Graphite", "description": "Want the convenience of a hydration system while still using your trusted daypack? Check out the 3-liter UnBottle, a leak-proof water bladder that converts any traditional pack into a personal hydration system. The UnBottle is easy to install--simply attach the UnBottle to the exterior of your pack using the included Slick Clips and you're set. Once attached, the bottle delivers roughly two to three hours of hydration through its drinking tube--enough for most day hikes and casual expeditions. If you need more water, the UnBottle is easy to fill thanks to the removable plug on the front. Best of all, the UnBottle holds up to heavy use thanks to the lightweight, abrasion-resistant fabric, which offers an expandable articulated pattern that fits easily on the back panel of almost any pack. Fully insulated to keep liquids cool for hours, the UnBottle is backed by a two-year warranty (with a lifetime warranty on the Omega reservoir).About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "text": "Camelbak UnBottle 100 Oz Hydration Pack, True Blue/Graphite Want the convenience of a hydration system while still using your trusted daypack? Check out the 3-liter UnBottle, a leak-proof water bladder that converts any traditional pack into a personal hydration system. The UnBottle is easy to install--simply attach the UnBottle to the exterior of your pack using the included Slick Clips and you're set. Once attached, the bottle delivers roughly two to three hours of hydration through its drinking tube--enough for most day hikes and casual expeditions. If you need more water, the UnBottle is easy to fill thanks to the removable plug on the front. Best of all, the UnBottle holds up to heavy use thanks to the lightweight, abrasion-resistant fabric, which offers an expandable articulated pattern that fits easily on the back panel of almost any pack. Fully insulated to keep liquids cool for hours, the UnBottle is backed by a two-year warranty (with a lifetime warranty on the Omega reservoir).About CamelBakCamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved to be very popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off of the handlebars in technical terrain. The product began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits.In addition to cycling, CamelBak has Hands-Free Hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding and skiing. CamelBak’s state-of-the-art packs and hydration systems have benefited athletes, outdoorsmen, and soldiers around the world. While CamelBak has grown tremendously since the early days, one thing hasn't changed: CamelBak still believes in the performance advantage that proper hydration delivers for just about any activity. The privately-held company is headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X5j7UAv9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IF7YL0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IG47XM", "title": "Ensign Peak Deluxe Insulated Lunch Cooler ((Red))", "description": "Bring the cool with you wherever you go with this insulated handy soft cooler. Made with 100% 600 Denier Poly Ripstop Nylon with PVC backing for waterproof protection. It's durable and waterproof outside and inside with a center that's insulated to keep food and beverages cold. Features 2 main compartments ? one on top and one on the bottom; large front zippered pocket; smaller center pocket ; and adjustable shoulder strap. Dimensions: 9.5\" W x 10\" H x 6\" D", "text": "Ensign Peak Deluxe Insulated Lunch Cooler ((Red)) Bring the cool with you wherever you go with this insulated handy soft cooler. Made with 100% 600 Denier Poly Ripstop Nylon with PVC backing for waterproof protection. It's durable and waterproof outside and inside with a center that's insulated to keep food and beverages cold. Features 2 main compartments ? one on top and one on the bottom; large front zippered pocket; smaller center pocket ; and adjustable shoulder strap. Dimensions: 9.5\" W x 10\" H x 6\" D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SSCY9B6WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IG47XM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IG70OA", "title": "G.I. Type Fingerless Gloves", "description": "These fingerless gloves are great when you need complete mobility of you fingers. Made of 70% wool and 30% nylon these gloves provide plenty of warms and great durability. Choice of black or olive. Made in the USA.", "text": "G.I. Type Fingerless Gloves These fingerless gloves are great when you need complete mobility of you fingers. Made of 70% wool and 30% nylon these gloves provide plenty of warms and great durability. Choice of black or olive. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q8SG6t3BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IG70OA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]], "price": 7.04}}
{"item_id": "B000IH9YMA", "title": "Spyderco Endura Serrated Edge Knife", "description": "One of Spyderco's best selling knives is the Endura Serrated Knife. It features screw construction making cleaning and adjusting easier. The fiberglass reinforced nylon handles come molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for preferred traction and improved ergonomics. Inside the handle dual skeletonized stainless steel liners make the knife stronger without adding weight and make an anchor for all external and internal components to attach through adding sturdiness and rigidity. The VG-10 blades are flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade?s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip.Hole diameter 1/2\" (13 mm.Blade steel VG-10.Handle material FRN.Weight 3.6 oz. (103 g).", "text": "Spyderco Endura Serrated Edge Knife One of Spyderco's best selling knives is the Endura Serrated Knife. It features screw construction making cleaning and adjusting easier. The fiberglass reinforced nylon handles come molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for preferred traction and improved ergonomics. Inside the handle dual skeletonized stainless steel liners make the knife stronger without adding weight and make an anchor for all external and internal components to attach through adding sturdiness and rigidity. The VG-10 blades are flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade?s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip.Hole diameter 1/2\" (13 mm.Blade steel VG-10.Handle material FRN.Weight 3.6 oz. (103 g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AlTOVszcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IH9YMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 63.61}}
{"item_id": "B000IHBA0O", "title": "Ka-Bar Original TDI Law Enforcement Serrated Knife", "description": "", "text": "Ka-Bar Original TDI Law Enforcement Serrated Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZwS8UTPnL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IHBA0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.14}}
{"item_id": "B000IHBA2W", "title": "Cold Steel Brave Heart Kraton Handle (SecureEx Sheath)", "description": "Cold Steel’s latest version of this romantic and historically significant knife is called The Brave Heart.™ Designed by Lynn C. Thompson, it is a small, compact, multi-purpose knife, that will serve admirably as an hunting or utility knife or as an alternative to a double edge boot knife. The thin, needle sharp tip is ideally suited for piercing, and the precision taper ground blade has been honed by hand to razor sharpness. The traditional jimping on the blade spine is both ornamental and functional, providing an aggressive non-slip platform for the thumb or forefinger to bear downward as needed for maximum control.The compact Kraton handle is designed to accommodate a wide variety of comfortable and secure grip positions, and its slim, flat cross section insures that it will resist turning or twisting in the hand. Kraton, is a superior handle material that Cold Steel has employed for decades because its robust traction and resiliency allows it to withstand the shock of even the hardest blows.", "text": "Cold Steel Brave Heart Kraton Handle (SecureEx Sheath) Cold Steel’s latest version of this romantic and historically significant knife is called The Brave Heart.™ Designed by Lynn C. Thompson, it is a small, compact, multi-purpose knife, that will serve admirably as an hunting or utility knife or as an alternative to a double edge boot knife. The thin, needle sharp tip is ideally suited for piercing, and the precision taper ground blade has been honed by hand to razor sharpness. The traditional jimping on the blade spine is both ornamental and functional, providing an aggressive non-slip platform for the thumb or forefinger to bear downward as needed for maximum control.The compact Kraton handle is designed to accommodate a wide variety of comfortable and secure grip positions, and its slim, flat cross section insures that it will resist turning or twisting in the hand. Kraton, is a superior handle material that Cold Steel has employed for decades because its robust traction and resiliency allows it to withstand the shock of even the hardest blows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y2eNZ1EFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IHBA2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 58.0}}
{"item_id": "B000IHBA40", "title": "Cold Steel Counter TAC II Knife with Kraton Handle (SecureEx Sheath)", "description": "Our new Counter TAC™ boot knives were designed with this simple philosophy in mind. The full tang blades are made from beautifully polished AUS 8A Stainless steel that’s vacuum heat treated, and sub zero quenched for strength. They are hollow ground and end in a sturdy but needle sharp point that’s ideal for effortless penetration, and of course the edge is razor sharp. The ergonomic design of the Kraton grip is comfortable and adaptable to any fighting style, and the deeply textured surface and double guard will insure that the knife is not likely to slip from your hand under any circumstances. Finally, each Counter TAC™ is shipped with a state of the art Secure-Ex sheath, complete with a removable boot/belt clip and lashing slots so you can carry or conceal it just about anywhere.", "text": "Cold Steel Counter TAC II Knife with Kraton Handle (SecureEx Sheath) Our new Counter TAC™ boot knives were designed with this simple philosophy in mind. The full tang blades are made from beautifully polished AUS 8A Stainless steel that’s vacuum heat treated, and sub zero quenched for strength. They are hollow ground and end in a sturdy but needle sharp point that’s ideal for effortless penetration, and of course the edge is razor sharp. The ergonomic design of the Kraton grip is comfortable and adaptable to any fighting style, and the deeply textured surface and double guard will insure that the knife is not likely to slip from your hand under any circumstances. Finally, each Counter TAC™ is shipped with a state of the art Secure-Ex sheath, complete with a removable boot/belt clip and lashing slots so you can carry or conceal it just about anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zt2L3-88L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IHBA40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 56.42}}
{"item_id": "B000IHFNI4", "title": "Spyderco Tasman Salt Rust Free Serrated Edge Knife, Black", "description": "Spyderco's Tasman Salt folder combines our exclusive H-1 steel with a Hawkbill blade design to yield an exceptional mariner's knife. H1 is an extraordinary Japanese steel that uses nitrogen instead of carbon to create its steel matrix. The result is an austenitic steel that does not require heat treatment, gets harder and tougher with use and is completely impervious to rust! The distinctive curved shape of a hawkbill blade gathers and holds the material being cut, making it perfect for cutting materials like rope, line and netting. cutting against the sharpened edge keeping it from slipping off the tip. The hollow-ground H-1 blade of the Tasman is mated to a black molded fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle with a Volcano Grip texture pattern for a positive grip in all conditions. A titanium pocket clip positions the folder tip-up in the pocket and is reversible for left or right-side carry. The clip attachment screw is also hollow, providing a handy lanyard hole for attachment of a thong or cord when using the knife around water.", "text": "Spyderco Tasman Salt Rust Free Serrated Edge Knife, Black Spyderco's Tasman Salt folder combines our exclusive H-1 steel with a Hawkbill blade design to yield an exceptional mariner's knife. H1 is an extraordinary Japanese steel that uses nitrogen instead of carbon to create its steel matrix. The result is an austenitic steel that does not require heat treatment, gets harder and tougher with use and is completely impervious to rust! The distinctive curved shape of a hawkbill blade gathers and holds the material being cut, making it perfect for cutting materials like rope, line and netting. cutting against the sharpened edge keeping it from slipping off the tip. The hollow-ground H-1 blade of the Tasman is mated to a black molded fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle with a Volcano Grip texture pattern for a positive grip in all conditions. A titanium pocket clip positions the folder tip-up in the pocket and is reversible for left or right-side carry. The clip attachment screw is also hollow, providing a handy lanyard hole for attachment of a thong or cord when using the knife around water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rs0ShnaVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IHFNI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 68.6}}
{"item_id": "B000ILDDSM", "title": "PING PONG BALLS / TABLE TENNIS BALLS - 144/pk (1 gross)", "description": "Plastic Table Tennis Balls. 1 1/2\" (38mm) 12 dozen per box=144 balls NEW LOT not professional grade, great practice balls", "text": "PING PONG BALLS / TABLE TENNIS BALLS - 144/pk (1 gross) Plastic Table Tennis Balls. 1 1/2\" (38mm) 12 dozen per box=144 balls NEW LOT not professional grade, great practice balls", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YmdPB2cFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ILDDSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SyncMarket", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Balls"]], "price": 7.5}}
