{"item_id": "B000INAEWS", "title": "Simmons .22 Mag 3-9x32mm Adjustable Objective Riflescopes", "description": "How do you improve America’s most popular rimfire scope? By adding some of the innovative features that distinguish Simmons from all the rest. Like our QTA™ (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepiece with plenty of eye relief to make acquiring targets a snap. And our SureGrip™ adjustments for easy adjustment, even while wearing gloves. Add our fully coated optics and complete set of mounting rings, and you’ve got one of the finest, most reliable rimfire riflescopes available anywhere – at any price. For big-game optics in a rimfire riflescope Simmons .22 MAG is in a class all its own. One-piece tube construction for lighter handling, greater strength and durability Fully coated high-quality optical glass for bright, sharp images and high contrast Waterproof, fogproof and shockproof Adjustable Objective. Fully coated high-quality optical glass. Waterproof/Fogproof/Shockproof. Truplex Reticle. Rings Included.", "text": "Simmons .22 Mag 3-9x32mm Adjustable Objective Riflescopes How do you improve America’s most popular rimfire scope? By adding some of the innovative features that distinguish Simmons from all the rest. Like our QTA™ (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepiece with plenty of eye relief to make acquiring targets a snap. And our SureGrip™ adjustments for easy adjustment, even while wearing gloves. Add our fully coated optics and complete set of mounting rings, and you’ve got one of the finest, most reliable rimfire riflescopes available anywhere – at any price. For big-game optics in a rimfire riflescope Simmons .22 MAG is in a class all its own. One-piece tube construction for lighter handling, greater strength and durability Fully coated high-quality optical glass for bright, sharp images and high contrast Waterproof, fogproof and shockproof Adjustable Objective. Fully coated high-quality optical glass. Waterproof/Fogproof/Shockproof. Truplex Reticle. Rings Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313OfFAdV3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000INAEWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 66.99}}
{"item_id": "B000INQTDG", "title": "Gunslick Match-Grade Gun Maintenance Center", "description": "Clean, repair and mount scopes on your gun with the Gunslick Match-Grade Gun Maintenance Center. Now you have a place to securely hold your firearm, making it easier for routine up-keep. With its built-in cam-lock vises and convenient drawers and solvent/parts holders, you can do a little bit of everything quickly and easily. From plinking to competitive shooting, big game hunting to waterfowling, budget-minded cleaning to top-of-the-line care, Gunslick has the right cleaning kit for the job.", "text": "Gunslick Match-Grade Gun Maintenance Center Clean, repair and mount scopes on your gun with the Gunslick Match-Grade Gun Maintenance Center. Now you have a place to securely hold your firearm, making it easier for routine up-keep. With its built-in cam-lock vises and convenient drawers and solvent/parts holders, you can do a little bit of everything quickly and easily. From plinking to competitive shooting, big game hunting to waterfowling, budget-minded cleaning to top-of-the-line care, Gunslick has the right cleaning kit for the job.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415BbyvLxDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000INQTDG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 72.59}}
{"item_id": "B000IORU06", "title": "Schwinn Meridian Single Speed Adult Tricycle", "description": "Cruise around in comfort and style with this easy-to-use, single-speed three-wheeled Schwinn Meridian bicycle. The bike features a low step-through frame, an upright handlebar, padded cruiser saddle, and front and rear brakes. Perfect for rides around town or through the park on a warm, sunny day, the bike features a folding rear basket to stash your picnic lunch or extra jacket. The Meridian also offers a lightweight aluminum frame for a comfortable and stable ride.", "text": "Schwinn Meridian Single Speed Adult Tricycle Cruise around in comfort and style with this easy-to-use, single-speed three-wheeled Schwinn Meridian bicycle. The bike features a low step-through frame, an upright handlebar, padded cruiser saddle, and front and rear brakes. Perfect for rides around town or through the park on a warm, sunny day, the bike features a folding rear basket to stash your picnic lunch or extra jacket. The Meridian also offers a lightweight aluminum frame for a comfortable and stable ride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KcxB%2BO-wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IORU06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 339.99}}
{"item_id": "B000IQ9OJE", "title": "Maxxis Ignitor Mountain Bike Tire", "description": "The Ignitor tread pattern was designed for the most discerning professional racers and already has laid claim to multiple World Cup victories. The well-spaced tread pattern fills in nicely to provide low rolling resistance in the straights, while the ramped pentagonal knobs provide excellent traction in the corners and in medium soil.", "text": "Maxxis Ignitor Mountain Bike Tire The Ignitor tread pattern was designed for the most discerning professional racers and already has laid claim to multiple World Cup victories. The well-spaced tread pattern fills in nicely to provide low rolling resistance in the straights, while the ramped pentagonal knobs provide excellent traction in the corners and in medium soil.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aGoeactuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IQ9OJE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000IQ9P6G", "title": "Panaracer Fire XC Pro Kevlar Mountain Bicycle Tire - 26 x 2.1", "description": "The Fire XC design offers excellent traction and cornering in just about any terrain without the penalty of high rolling resistance or soft fast wearing tread compounds.", "text": "Panaracer Fire XC Pro Kevlar Mountain Bicycle Tire - 26 x 2.1 The Fire XC design offers excellent traction and cornering in just about any terrain without the penalty of high rolling resistance or soft fast wearing tread compounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GIbD0mWuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IQ9P6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "panaracer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 40.99}}
