{"item_id": "B000IQEAK2", "title": "Planet Bike Tail Light Rack Bracket", "description": "The Rear Rack Tail Light Bracket serves most Planet Bike tail lights, including Blinky 3,5,7 and SuperFlash. It attaches to most rear racks in place of the reflector.", "text": "Planet Bike Tail Light Rack Bracket The Rear Rack Tail Light Bracket serves most Planet Bike tail lights, including Blinky 3,5,7 and SuperFlash. It attaches to most rear racks in place of the reflector.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411sN7bb0FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IQEAK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 5.79}}
{"item_id": "B000IQLR2Q", "title": "4 - Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set", "description": "JUST IN: 4 - Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set. Feeling a little punchy? Here you go! Just the \"drive\" tools you need. Great for reaching tight spots. Ideal for removing hollow, split roll pins. Special round-nose design allows proper alignment of Punch in roll pin to prevent damage to fine mechanisms, such as trigger parts. 4 Punch sizes: 1/16\", 3/32\", 1/8\" and 5/32\". Weighs 10 ozs. Act Now! 4-Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set", "text": "4 - Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set JUST IN: 4 - Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set. Feeling a little punchy? Here you go! Just the \"drive\" tools you need. Great for reaching tight spots. Ideal for removing hollow, split roll pins. Special round-nose design allows proper alignment of Punch in roll pin to prevent damage to fine mechanisms, such as trigger parts. 4 Punch sizes: 1/16\", 3/32\", 1/8\" and 5/32\". Weighs 10 ozs. Act Now! 4-Pc. Roll Pin Punch Set", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H8lz%2Bmr1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IQLR2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000IQY50M", "title": "Rothco Acrylic Commando Sweater", "description": "", "text": "Rothco Acrylic Commando Sweater", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iOHtJRPnL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IQY50M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Sweaters"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Big & Tall"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Work Wear & Uniforms", "Clothing", "Military"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ITA0QM", "title": "Primos Buck Roar Call", "description": "The Buck ROAR reproduces a deep, resonating aggressive grunt that is made by bucks during the rut. Bucks make this aggressive grunt when they are trying to get an Estrus doe to stop or to warn other bucks to get away from the hot doe they are trailing. Now you can reproduce that aggressive grunt sound bucks make when their testosterone levels are through the roof.", "text": "Primos Buck Roar Call The Buck ROAR reproduces a deep, resonating aggressive grunt that is made by bucks during the rut. Bucks make this aggressive grunt when they are trying to get an Estrus doe to stop or to warn other bucks to get away from the hot doe they are trailing. Now you can reproduce that aggressive grunt sound bucks make when their testosterone levels are through the roof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Rokypr4gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ITA0QM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 8.49}}
{"item_id": "B000ITVSSQ", "title": "TexSport - Deluxe Camp Shower Shelter", "description": "The TexSport Deluxe Camp Shower Shelter is a very useful camp accessory. What could be better than a nice shower in camp? OK, well maybe a few things, but this is one useful and handy shelter. Set up is quick and easy rust resistant chain corded steel poles and Speed clips. It has lots of mesh for great ventilation and to keep bugs out. The heavy duty ripstop polyethylene floor is removable. It even comes with a rainfly with 2 skylights. The door is huge and make going in or out very easy. There is even a removable hanging towel bar (to hang towels or clothes). And in the corner is a mesh shelf or rack to keep your bathing items easily accessible. Includes a 5 gallon capacity camp shower.Large 'D' Style door.Lots of mesh for ventilation and light.Skylights in the rainfly.Removable hanging towel rack.Mesh shower rack included.Includes a 5 gallon capacity camp shower.Center Height = 7'4\".Pack Size = 32\"x7\".Size = 4'6\" x 4'6\" x 7'3\".Weight = 21 lbs.All carry bags and stakes included.Fire retardant.Import..", "text": "TexSport - Deluxe Camp Shower Shelter The TexSport Deluxe Camp Shower Shelter is a very useful camp accessory. What could be better than a nice shower in camp? OK, well maybe a few things, but this is one useful and handy shelter. Set up is quick and easy rust resistant chain corded steel poles and Speed clips. It has lots of mesh for great ventilation and to keep bugs out. The heavy duty ripstop polyethylene floor is removable. It even comes with a rainfly with 2 skylights. The door is huge and make going in or out very easy. There is even a removable hanging towel bar (to hang towels or clothes). And in the corner is a mesh shelf or rack to keep your bathing items easily accessible. Includes a 5 gallon capacity camp shower.Large 'D' Style door.Lots of mesh for ventilation and light.Skylights in the rainfly.Removable hanging towel rack.Mesh shower rack included.Includes a 5 gallon capacity camp shower.Center Height = 7'4\".Pack Size = 32\"x7\".Size = 4'6\" x 4'6\" x 7'3\".Weight = 21 lbs.All carry bags and stakes included.Fire retardant.Import..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ADe7pEFvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ITVSSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 95.93}}
{"item_id": "B000ITVU8Y", "title": "Texsport Headquarters Camouflage 4 Person Square Dome - Tent", "description": "The TexSport 4-5 person Headquarters Camo Square Dome has 1 door, 4 windows and a kick butt Camo pattern that will blend into any woodland camp with nary a trace. The heavy duty RipStop polyethylene floor is tough and durable. The Fly has Factory taped seams. The screening is a No-See-Um mesh that will keep the smallest fly bugs out but let the air flow. Comes complete with instructions sewn into the Carry Bag so they are hard for even YOU to lose. The Carry Bag is a Full Length, Zippered, Polyester material. Roomy, 2 pole, shockcorded fiberglass design is easy and quick to set up or take down.4 No-see-um mesh Roof Panels - improves ventilation - can reduce condensation.Camo pattern blends into most campsites.Instructions sewn inside the Carry Bag - very hard to lose.2 pole design - combination sleeve and clip set up.PU coated Polyester fabric - little or no sag in rain - good UV resistance.6' Center Height.4 Windows - all have Storm Flaps.No-See-Um mesh - keeps bugs out.Includes zippered Carry Bag and stakes.Windows can remain open (hooded) even in rain for better ventilation.Import..", "text": "Texsport Headquarters Camouflage 4 Person Square Dome - Tent The TexSport 4-5 person Headquarters Camo Square Dome has 1 door, 4 windows and a kick butt Camo pattern that will blend into any woodland camp with nary a trace. The heavy duty RipStop polyethylene floor is tough and durable. The Fly has Factory taped seams. The screening is a No-See-Um mesh that will keep the smallest fly bugs out but let the air flow. Comes complete with instructions sewn into the Carry Bag so they are hard for even YOU to lose. The Carry Bag is a Full Length, Zippered, Polyester material. Roomy, 2 pole, shockcorded fiberglass design is easy and quick to set up or take down.4 No-see-um mesh Roof Panels - improves ventilation - can reduce condensation.Camo pattern blends into most campsites.Instructions sewn inside the Carry Bag - very hard to lose.2 pole design - combination sleeve and clip set up.PU coated Polyester fabric - little or no sag in rain - good UV resistance.6' Center Height.4 Windows - all have Storm Flaps.No-See-Um mesh - keeps bugs out.Includes zippered Carry Bag and stakes.Windows can remain open (hooded) even in rain for better ventilation.Import..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W%2BTdSycAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ITVU8Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ITX474", "title": "Texsport Hexagon Tent", "description": "A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this spacious model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for three campers, at a great value.The Camouflage Hexagon tent measures 80-by-48-by-92 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down thanks to a three-pole, pin-and-ring frame system with shock-corded fiberglass poles. Ruggedly durable taffeta material has a water-resistant polyurethane coating and is flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications.An arch-style front door provides easy in-and-out, and its \"no-see-um\" mesh material, mesh window with zippered storm flap, and six mesh roof panels let you keep the elements at bay while enjoying sufficient airflow. A ripstop polyethylene floor is water- and boot-proof, and the tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.WarrantyThis Texsport tent includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Texsport Hexagon Tent A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this spacious model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for three campers, at a great value.The Camouflage Hexagon tent measures 80-by-48-by-92 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down thanks to a three-pole, pin-and-ring frame system with shock-corded fiberglass poles. Ruggedly durable taffeta material has a water-resistant polyurethane coating and is flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications.An arch-style front door provides easy in-and-out, and its \"no-see-um\" mesh material, mesh window with zippered storm flap, and six mesh roof panels let you keep the elements at bay while enjoying sufficient airflow. A ripstop polyethylene floor is water- and boot-proof, and the tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.WarrantyThis Texsport tent includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LLiaF8UaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ITX474.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 36.43}}
{"item_id": "B000IU11MS", "title": "Texsport Saguaro Bivy Shelter Tent", "description": "A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this compact model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for two campers, at a great value.The Saguaro Bivy Shelter Tent measures 44-by-51-by-92 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down thanks to a unique two-pole internal frame system with shock-corded fiberglass poles. Heavy-duty taffeta walls and floor have a water-resistant polyurethane coating and are flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications. Ideal for backpacking, it weighs only four pounds.An arch-style front door provides easy in-and-out, and its built-in \"no-see-um\" mesh window with zippered storm flap, a mesh roof panel, and full-coverage rainfly with silver coating for UV protection let you keep the elements at bay while enjoying sufficient airflow. A ripstop polyethylene floor is water- and boot-proof, and the tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.WarrantyThis Texsport tent includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Texsport Saguaro Bivy Shelter Tent A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this compact model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for two campers, at a great value.The Saguaro Bivy Shelter Tent measures 44-by-51-by-92 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down thanks to a unique two-pole internal frame system with shock-corded fiberglass poles. Heavy-duty taffeta walls and floor have a water-resistant polyurethane coating and are flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications. Ideal for backpacking, it weighs only four pounds.An arch-style front door provides easy in-and-out, and its built-in \"no-see-um\" mesh window with zippered storm flap, a mesh roof panel, and full-coverage rainfly with silver coating for UV protection let you keep the elements at bay while enjoying sufficient airflow. A ripstop polyethylene floor is water- and boot-proof, and the tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.WarrantyThis Texsport tent includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Fk8yTyZcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IU11MS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 39.99}}
