{"item_id": "B000IVDXAU", "title": "Wilson Sporting Goods Adult Elastic Baseball Belt", "description": "You're the first player to arrive and the last to leave. You leave everything you have on the field and you need a uniform that can handle it. At Wilson we get that. That's why we designed a line of uniforms that are ready to work just as hard as you. When you wear Wilson you get a flawless fit, serious comfort and hardcore durability.", "text": "Wilson Sporting Goods Adult Elastic Baseball Belt You're the first player to arrive and the last to leave. You leave everything you have on the field and you need a uniform that can handle it. At Wilson we get that. That's why we designed a line of uniforms that are ready to work just as hard as you. When you wear Wilson you get a flawless fit, serious comfort and hardcore durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OIOZ9H-xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IVDXAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]], "price": 7.68}}
