{"item_id": "B000IVU0IS", "title": "NFL - NCAA BallQube Football Holder Sports Memorabilia Display Case", "description": "NFL - NCAA BallQube Football Holder Sports Memorabilia Display Case .... Dimensions - Exterior 7 1/2 X 11 3/4 X 7 3/8 - Interior 7 X 11 3/8 x 7 .. .The BallQube Football Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene and features a 2 piece design. Made by BallQube for BCW", "text": "NFL - NCAA BallQube Football Holder Sports Memorabilia Display Case NFL - NCAA BallQube Football Holder Sports Memorabilia Display Case .... Dimensions - Exterior 7 1/2 X 11 3/4 X 7 3/8 - Interior 7 X 11 3/8 x 7 .. .The BallQube Football Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene and features a 2 piece design. Made by BallQube for BCW", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M6ZXK3GML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IVU0IS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BallQube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 26.45}}
