{"item_id": "B000IZYVWA", "title": "Fox River Men's Polypropylene Glove Liner", "description": "Ultra lightweight liner glove. This glove is excellent in cold to mild temperatures . Fox river is a leader in the outdoor industry and all of the products are of the highest quality.", "text": "Fox River Men's Polypropylene Glove Liner Ultra lightweight liner glove. This glove is excellent in cold to mild temperatures . Fox river is a leader in the outdoor industry and all of the products are of the highest quality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UFiuaKQIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000IZYVWA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000J004VQ", "title": "Innova Starter Disc Golf Bag", "description": "The Innova starter golf bag is NEW and IMPROVED holds 10-12 golf discs. It's water resistant, includes a water bottle holder and towel ring as well as an outer zipper compartment and an inner divider. This is the perfect bag to get you started. Includes a front mesh putter pocket.", "text": "Innova Starter Disc Golf Bag The Innova starter golf bag is NEW and IMPROVED holds 10-12 golf discs. It's water resistant, includes a water bottle holder and towel ring as well as an outer zipper compartment and an inner divider. This is the perfect bag to get you started. Includes a front mesh putter pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SqnYF6bXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J004VQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innova", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Bags & Accessories"]], "price": 16.5}}
{"item_id": "B000J032CE", "title": "Coleman Liquid-Fuel Lantern Hard-Shell Carry Case (colors may vary)", "description": "Protect your Coleman liquid-fuel lantern during storage and transport with this hard-shell carry case. The Case fits Coleman lantern models 220, 290, 295, and other liquid-fuel lanterns. The rugged, durable housing helps keep your lantern safe.", "text": "Coleman Liquid-Fuel Lantern Hard-Shell Carry Case (colors may vary) Protect your Coleman liquid-fuel lantern during storage and transport with this hard-shell carry case. The Case fits Coleman lantern models 220, 290, 295, and other liquid-fuel lanterns. The rugged, durable housing helps keep your lantern safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417UkKu1yDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J032CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 22.14}}
