{"item_id": "B000J2KX88", "title": "Advanced Elements 2.5 Gallon Summer Shower / Solar Shower", "description": "Enjoy a hot shower in the great outdoors with this convenient camping shower from Advanced Elements. Designed to heat water fast in the warm sun, the shower is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking, or trips to the beach. The durable, four-layer construction includes a reflector panel, an insulator panel, a solar panel, and a water reservoir along with diamond rip-stop fabric and a water temperature gauge. The shower head is simple to operate and can be turned on and off to save water. The extra-large filling valve features a twist-off cap, and the wide, rubber handle make the shower easy to carry. Velcro straps hold your soap, shampoo, wash cloth, and other toiletries. When you're done with the shower, simple roll it up for storage. The shower has a capacity of 2 1/2 gallons and weighs 12 ounces when empty.FeaturesDurable, four-layer construction2 1/2-gallon capacityOn/off shower headExtra-large filling valve with twist-off capWide, rubber carrying handleVelcro straps for toiletriesWater temperature gaugeManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "text": "Advanced Elements 2.5 Gallon Summer Shower / Solar Shower Enjoy a hot shower in the great outdoors with this convenient camping shower from Advanced Elements. Designed to heat water fast in the warm sun, the shower is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking, or trips to the beach. The durable, four-layer construction includes a reflector panel, an insulator panel, a solar panel, and a water reservoir along with diamond rip-stop fabric and a water temperature gauge. The shower head is simple to operate and can be turned on and off to save water. The extra-large filling valve features a twist-off cap, and the wide, rubber handle make the shower easy to carry. Velcro straps hold your soap, shampoo, wash cloth, and other toiletries. When you're done with the shower, simple roll it up for storage. The shower has a capacity of 2 1/2 gallons and weighs 12 ounces when empty.FeaturesDurable, four-layer construction2 1/2-gallon capacityOn/off shower headExtra-large filling valve with twist-off capWide, rubber carrying handleVelcro straps for toiletriesWater temperature gaugeManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bLx%2Br8lzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J2KX88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 21.37}}
{"item_id": "B000J2O5VE", "title": "Advanced Elements Advancedframe Convertible Kayak", "description": "The Advanced Elements AdvancedFrame™ covertible kayak is a 15-ft kayak that can be paddled solo or tandem. It features 2, adjustable padded back supports for comfortable seating durable, double-coated fabric. A dry storage compartment and bungee deck lacing allow you to take along important gear.", "text": "Advanced Elements Advancedframe Convertible Kayak The Advanced Elements AdvancedFrame™ covertible kayak is a 15-ft kayak that can be paddled solo or tandem. It features 2, adjustable padded back supports for comfortable seating durable, double-coated fabric. A dry storage compartment and bungee deck lacing allow you to take along important gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d5VhiF5CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J2O5VE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]], "price": 725.0}}
{"item_id": "B000J2Q0IA", "title": "Advanced Elements Double Action Pump with Pressure Guage", "description": "The Double Action Hand Pump is a durable, high flow pump with the addition of a low pressure guage.", "text": "Advanced Elements Double Action Pump with Pressure Guage The Double Action Hand Pump is a durable, high flow pump with the addition of a low pressure guage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XzudtPNhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J2Q0IA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 39.16}}
{"item_id": "B000J2Q0SU", "title": "Advanced Elements 3 Gallon Summer Shower / Solar Shower", "description": "Enjoy a hot shower in the great outdoors with this convenient camping shower from Advanced Elements. Designed to heat water fast in the warm sun, the shower is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking, or trips to the beach. The durable, four-layer construction includes a reflector panel, an insulator panel, a solar panel, and a water reservoir along with diamond rip-stop fabric and a water temperature gauge. The shower head is simple to operate and can be turned on and off to save water. The extra-large filling valve features a twist-off cap, and the wide, rubber handle make the shower easy to carry. A pocket holds your soap, shampoo, and other items. When you're done with the shower, simple roll it up for storage. The shower has a capacity of 3 gallons and weighs 12 ounces when empty.FeaturesDurable, four-layer construction3-gallon capacityOn/off shower headExtra-large filling valve with twist-off capWide, rubber carrying handlePocket for toiletriesWater temperature gaugeManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "text": "Advanced Elements 3 Gallon Summer Shower / Solar Shower Enjoy a hot shower in the great outdoors with this convenient camping shower from Advanced Elements. Designed to heat water fast in the warm sun, the shower is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking, or trips to the beach. The durable, four-layer construction includes a reflector panel, an insulator panel, a solar panel, and a water reservoir along with diamond rip-stop fabric and a water temperature gauge. The shower head is simple to operate and can be turned on and off to save water. The extra-large filling valve features a twist-off cap, and the wide, rubber handle make the shower easy to carry. A pocket holds your soap, shampoo, and other items. When you're done with the shower, simple roll it up for storage. The shower has a capacity of 3 gallons and weighs 12 ounces when empty.FeaturesDurable, four-layer construction3-gallon capacityOn/off shower headExtra-large filling valve with twist-off capWide, rubber carrying handlePocket for toiletriesWater temperature gaugeManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BiQ4UW20L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J2Q0SU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 26.69}}
{"item_id": "B000J2Q0T4", "title": "Advanced Elements 5 gal. Summer Shower", "description": "The Advanced Elements Summer Shower 5 Gallon has thick Reinforced front & back panels for added durability.", "text": "Advanced Elements 5 gal. Summer Shower The Advanced Elements Summer Shower 5 Gallon has thick Reinforced front & back panels for added durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V1R86ZSPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J2Q0T4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B000J36HZU", "title": "Men's ColdGear® Longsleeve Compression Mock Tops by Under Armour", "description": "This Under Armour ColdGear Mock Shirt helps improve mobility and it's Flatlock Seams feel smooth against your skin to prevent chafing. Product Features: Built for layering Fits close to the body without compression Warmth without the weight Advanced knit fabric traps in heat for warmth Anti-odor technology prevents odor ArmourStretch improves mobility and dry time Lightweight fabrics with a built in 4-way stretch Superior moisture transport system keeps you dry Ideal for temperatures under 55 degrees F Flatlock Seams feel smooth against skin, while preventing chafing 89% Polyester, 11% Elastane 7.09 oz", "text": "Men's ColdGear® Longsleeve Compression Mock Tops by Under Armour This Under Armour ColdGear Mock Shirt helps improve mobility and it's Flatlock Seams feel smooth against your skin to prevent chafing. Product Features: Built for layering Fits close to the body without compression Warmth without the weight Advanced knit fabric traps in heat for warmth Anti-odor technology prevents odor ArmourStretch improves mobility and dry time Lightweight fabrics with a built in 4-way stretch Superior moisture transport system keeps you dry Ideal for temperatures under 55 degrees F Flatlock Seams feel smooth against skin, while preventing chafing 89% Polyester, 11% Elastane 7.09 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31czDNFEK1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J36HZU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000J3JDI8", "title": "Marcy SB-410 Crunch Board", "description": "The compact Marcy SB-410 Crunch Board is a great choice for free weight workouts or doing crunches in tight spaces. It offers a seat pad that adjusts to flat and decline positions and oversized foam roller pads. It also provides a storage area underneath for your dumbbells. Other features include a comfortable 2-inch upholstery, large front and rear non-skid rubber stabilizers, and a durable 2-inch rectangular tube steel frame.", "text": "Marcy SB-410 Crunch Board The compact Marcy SB-410 Crunch Board is a great choice for free weight workouts or doing crunches in tight spaces. It offers a seat pad that adjusts to flat and decline positions and oversized foam roller pads. It also provides a storage area underneath for your dumbbells. Other features include a comfortable 2-inch upholstery, large front and rear non-skid rubber stabilizers, and a durable 2-inch rectangular tube steel frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S%2BCJr8NDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J3JDI8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 70.71}}
{"item_id": "B000J3JDIS", "title": "Apex JD-1.2 Slant Board", "description": "Maximize your home fitness routines with the adjustable Apex JD 1.2 Slant Board, which will help you strengthen your abs and core muscles or work out your upper body. Suitable for a wide range of exercises, it offers an extra-long backboard and comfortable, adjustable foam pads that secure your legs and ankles. Other features include a high-density foam backpad with boxed upholstered construction for added durability, heavy duty 14 gauge steel tubing, and a powder-coated finish. It measures 52 x 12.5 x 22.5 inches when fully assembled. It's backed by a 2-year limited warranty.", "text": "Apex JD-1.2 Slant Board Maximize your home fitness routines with the adjustable Apex JD 1.2 Slant Board, which will help you strengthen your abs and core muscles or work out your upper body. Suitable for a wide range of exercises, it offers an extra-long backboard and comfortable, adjustable foam pads that secure your legs and ankles. Other features include a high-density foam backpad with boxed upholstered construction for added durability, heavy duty 14 gauge steel tubing, and a powder-coated finish. It measures 52 x 12.5 x 22.5 inches when fully assembled. It's backed by a 2-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kJ4j7vG3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J3JDIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 49.98}}
{"item_id": "B000J3MK3S", "title": "Apex JD2.2 Flat Bench", "description": "Maximize your home fitness routines with the Apex JD 2.2 Flat Bench, which can be used during back and ab exercises as well as with free weights. Nicely compact, it offers a high-density foam backpad with boxed upholstered construction for added durability, heavy duty 14 gauge steel tubing, and a powder-coated finish. It measures 43.25 x 14.25 x 18.25 inches when fully assembled. It's backed by a 2-year limited warranty.", "text": "Apex JD2.2 Flat Bench Maximize your home fitness routines with the Apex JD 2.2 Flat Bench, which can be used during back and ab exercises as well as with free weights. Nicely compact, it offers a high-density foam backpad with boxed upholstered construction for added durability, heavy duty 14 gauge steel tubing, and a powder-coated finish. It measures 43.25 x 14.25 x 18.25 inches when fully assembled. It's backed by a 2-year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YPos%2BTo1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J3MK3S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000J4HN9I", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 26/27/33/39 Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-26 grip extension replaces the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on Glock models 26/27/33/39. The PG-26 forms the next logical finger positioning feature to provide control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. These units will add 5/8\" additional length for better control and comfort, yet blend with the contours and texture of the handgun giving a factory appearance. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 26/27/33/39 Grip Extension The Pearce PG-26 grip extension replaces the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on Glock models 26/27/33/39. The PG-26 forms the next logical finger positioning feature to provide control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. These units will add 5/8\" additional length for better control and comfort, yet blend with the contours and texture of the handgun giving a factory appearance. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eWTIVWmvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J4HN9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.67}}
{"item_id": "B000J4HXUC", "title": "Military Surplus .50 Caliber Ammo Can", "description": "Steel constructed ammo cans with pressure lock lids and adjusting handles.", "text": "Military Surplus .50 Caliber Ammo Can Steel constructed ammo cans with pressure lock lids and adjusting handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-kVUFUORL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J4HXUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.45}}
{"item_id": "B000J4JI14", "title": "Pearce Grips PG-XD Springfield Armory XD Series Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-XD provides control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort by adding approximately 5/8 inch of gripping surface.", "text": "Pearce Grips PG-XD Springfield Armory XD Series Grip Extension The Pearce PG-XD provides control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort by adding approximately 5/8 inch of gripping surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dOYq9FC5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J4JI14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.61}}
{"item_id": "B000J5XPJY", "title": "Cliff Keen Twister Headgear", "description": "CLIFF KEEN TWISTER WRESTLING HEADGEAR 2 Strap: Double wide, no slide Ultralight with low profile 2 strap design ensures comfort and security, even in the roughest conditions ts cool, light and protective It lets sound come in and sweat go out Just strap it on and hold on tight Available in 18 stock color combinations", "text": "Cliff Keen Twister Headgear CLIFF KEEN TWISTER WRESTLING HEADGEAR 2 Strap: Double wide, no slide Ultralight with low profile 2 strap design ensures comfort and security, even in the roughest conditions ts cool, light and protective It lets sound come in and sweat go out Just strap it on and hold on tight Available in 18 stock color combinations", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F%2BqxL0SqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000J5XPJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cliff Keen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Wrestling", "Protective Gear", "Headgear"]], "price": 26.39}}
