{"item_id": "B000JFTDPE", "title": "Coleman Toilet Paper Campers, 3-Pack", "description": "Three rolls with convenient dispenser Safe for septic systems Premium grade 2-ply tissue Tissue stays clean neat and dry Contains 3 rolls 2-ply toilet tissue (260 x 4.5 per roll) and reusable dispenser", "text": "Coleman Toilet Paper Campers, 3-Pack Three rolls with convenient dispenser Safe for septic systems Premium grade 2-ply tissue Tissue stays clean neat and dry Contains 3 rolls 2-ply toilet tissue (260 x 4.5 per roll) and reusable dispenser", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HWd3zxN%2BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JFTDPE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 5.59}}
{"item_id": "B000JHNF6K", "title": "Valeo GMLF Women's Meshback Lifting Gloves", "description": "Meshback lifting gloves are made of genuine leather with padded palms and cotton mesh backs. Soft terry lining for comfort and durability. Gloves are die-cut to ensure consistent quality and fit. Designed to fit a woman's hand. Hook and loop closure tabs. Sizes SM-LG", "text": "Valeo GMLF Women's Meshback Lifting Gloves Meshback lifting gloves are made of genuine leather with padded palms and cotton mesh backs. Soft terry lining for comfort and durability. Gloves are die-cut to ensure consistent quality and fit. Designed to fit a woman's hand. Hook and loop closure tabs. Sizes SM-LG", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410Z0%2BCo5FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JHNF6K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
