{"item_id": "B000JIH7SQ", "title": "Colt 25 Black Airsoft airsoft gun", "description": "Compact model gun with a length of only 4.7 inches and weight of .26 lbs. Calibre 6mm, firing standard lightweight 0.12g BB's from a 15 shot magazine. Strong ABS construction and although the power is low - 0.12 joule max - it's an ideal fun gun as it feels quite snappy... ... Orange muzzle Black Finish. Spring with Hop Up 15 BB magazine capacity Safety catch 1:1 scale, 4.7 inches (120 mm) in size Works with: 0.12g BBsMaterial: Anti-shock ABS and Metal Mode: Single shot - Spring action pistolThis Super Soft model is perfect for young playersOfficial Licensed ProductsDistributed by: Cybergun the authorized importer for the USA...", "text": "Colt 25 Black Airsoft airsoft gun Compact model gun with a length of only 4.7 inches and weight of .26 lbs. Calibre 6mm, firing standard lightweight 0.12g BB's from a 15 shot magazine. Strong ABS construction and although the power is low - 0.12 joule max - it's an ideal fun gun as it feels quite snappy... ... Orange muzzle Black Finish. Spring with Hop Up 15 BB magazine capacity Safety catch 1:1 scale, 4.7 inches (120 mm) in size Works with: 0.12g BBsMaterial: Anti-shock ABS and Metal Mode: Single shot - Spring action pistolThis Super Soft model is perfect for young playersOfficial Licensed ProductsDistributed by: Cybergun the authorized importer for the USA...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EoPesLyUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIH7SQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cybergun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]], "price": 12.77}}
{"item_id": "B000JIHHL8", "title": "Birchwood Casey, Pack of 90, 2-inch Target Spots", "description": "The Self Adhesive Target Spots are perfect for the avid shooter. These convenient targets create and instant bull's eye for all types of target practice. The high-contrast red color lets you see a sharper sight picture and bullet holes more clearly for better scores and smaller groups.", "text": "Birchwood Casey, Pack of 90, 2-inch Target Spots The Self Adhesive Target Spots are perfect for the avid shooter. These convenient targets create and instant bull's eye for all types of target practice. The high-contrast red color lets you see a sharper sight picture and bullet holes more clearly for better scores and smaller groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H7xSTRj6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIHHL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B000JIHHVS", "title": "Birchwood Casey Gallery Resetting Airgun Target", "description": "Get the hottest new targets for plinking enthusiasts! Birchwood Casey’s World of Targets offers everything you need for hours of shooting fun without even having to walk down range or pull cords to reset. Birchwood Casey’s Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round!", "text": "Birchwood Casey Gallery Resetting Airgun Target Get the hottest new targets for plinking enthusiasts! Birchwood Casey’s World of Targets offers everything you need for hours of shooting fun without even having to walk down range or pull cords to reset. Birchwood Casey’s Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WkGZADxSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIHHVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 17.56}}
{"item_id": "B000JIJ6Y4", "title": "UTG Deluxe Multi-Functional tactical rifle sling", "description": "The Deluxe Multi-Functional tactical rifle sling from UTG is perfect for close encounter and battlefield operations as well as any field-carry needs. With a non-slip grip and multi-purpose adapters, the sling allows for quick and easy adjustments between your carrying and shooting positions. The sling offers easy length adjustments that accommodate various shooting positions with separate adaptable strap loops that offer 360-degrees of non-interfering ways to carry your weapon. Whether you're stalking game or engaged in tactical maneuvers, the Multi-Functional Tactical Sling provides the versatility you need to keep your weapon at the ready.Features:Fully adjustableNon-slip gripHigh quality metal snap hookVersatile straps with separate adaptable strap loops360-degrees of non-interfering ways to carry weaponAdjusts for front chest, shoulder ready, and backside carry", "text": "UTG Deluxe Multi-Functional tactical rifle sling The Deluxe Multi-Functional tactical rifle sling from UTG is perfect for close encounter and battlefield operations as well as any field-carry needs. With a non-slip grip and multi-purpose adapters, the sling allows for quick and easy adjustments between your carrying and shooting positions. The sling offers easy length adjustments that accommodate various shooting positions with separate adaptable strap loops that offer 360-degrees of non-interfering ways to carry your weapon. Whether you're stalking game or engaged in tactical maneuvers, the Multi-Functional Tactical Sling provides the versatility you need to keep your weapon at the ready.Features:Fully adjustableNon-slip gripHigh quality metal snap hookVersatile straps with separate adaptable strap loops360-degrees of non-interfering ways to carry weaponAdjusts for front chest, shoulder ready, and backside carry", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F3vVIQ9nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIJ6Y4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 12.97}}
{"item_id": "B000JIJ6Z8", "title": "UTG Low-Profile Deluxe Universal Picatinny & Swivel-Stud Bipod", "description": "The Dragon Claw Clamp-On Barrel Bipod features high-tech, durable aluminum construction, a steel combat stand, and a clever Picatinny and swivel stud mounting system for versatility. It's user-friendly design sports a unique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tipping, extendable legs that can be adjusted for best shooting position, and arms that fold up for easy carry and storage.Features:High-tech durable aluminum constructionSwivel stud kit mounting adaptor to mount the bipod to a swivel studPicatinny mounting deck designed to mount on a Picatinny railUser-friendly clamp-on featuresUnique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tippingFoldable with fully adjustable center height from 9 to 11 inchesRubberized comfort standPosi-lock guarantees the position of the folding arm is fully lockedExtendable Legs can be adjusted for best shooting position.Foldable Arms can be folded up for easy carry and storageSteel Stand designed for forward titling during shooting; can also be reversed in installationSpecifications:Panning: YesPosi-lock: YesExtendable Legs: YesFoldable Arms: YesSwivel Stud Mount: YesPicatinny Mount: YesReversible Arms-Folding: NoStand: SteelMaterial: AluminumWeight: 10.9 ouncesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Low-Profile Deluxe Universal Picatinny & Swivel-Stud Bipod The Dragon Claw Clamp-On Barrel Bipod features high-tech, durable aluminum construction, a steel combat stand, and a clever Picatinny and swivel stud mounting system for versatility. It's user-friendly design sports a unique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tipping, extendable legs that can be adjusted for best shooting position, and arms that fold up for easy carry and storage.Features:High-tech durable aluminum constructionSwivel stud kit mounting adaptor to mount the bipod to a swivel studPicatinny mounting deck designed to mount on a Picatinny railUser-friendly clamp-on featuresUnique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tippingFoldable with fully adjustable center height from 9 to 11 inchesRubberized comfort standPosi-lock guarantees the position of the folding arm is fully lockedExtendable Legs can be adjusted for best shooting position.Foldable Arms can be folded up for easy carry and storageSteel Stand designed for forward titling during shooting; can also be reversed in installationSpecifications:Panning: YesPosi-lock: YesExtendable Legs: YesFoldable Arms: YesSwivel Stud Mount: YesPicatinny Mount: YesReversible Arms-Folding: NoStand: SteelMaterial: AluminumWeight: 10.9 ouncesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lc0Qurd-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIJ6Z8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B000JIJHZC", "title": "Birchwood Casey® Shoot - N - C® 12x18\" Self - Adhesive Silhouette Targets", "description": "5 - Pk. or 100 - Pk. Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C 12x18\" Self - Adhesive Silhouette Targets. Stick it! Hit it! See it clearly every time! Revolutionary Targets reveal each bullet hit with a brightly-colored ring! Upon impact, the targets explode in color visible to the naked eye from distance, letting you blast away without having to take a long walk or a long look through a spotting scope after every shot. Perfect on any backboard, ideal for handgun silhouette target shooting! Have a blast: Instant feedback no need to walk down range or use spotters to see your shot; Maximum visibility chartreuse on black is easy to see; Perfect for all firearms and calibers; Great for indoor or outdoor use and low-light conditions; Self-adhesive backing lets you set up with ease; Order yours today! Birchwood Casey Shoot-N-C 12x18\" Self-Adhesive Silhouette Targets", "text": "Birchwood Casey® Shoot - N - C® 12x18\" Self - Adhesive Silhouette Targets 5 - Pk. or 100 - Pk. Birchwood Casey Shoot - N - C 12x18\" Self - Adhesive Silhouette Targets. Stick it! Hit it! See it clearly every time! Revolutionary Targets reveal each bullet hit with a brightly-colored ring! Upon impact, the targets explode in color visible to the naked eye from distance, letting you blast away without having to take a long walk or a long look through a spotting scope after every shot. Perfect on any backboard, ideal for handgun silhouette target shooting! Have a blast: Instant feedback no need to walk down range or use spotters to see your shot; Maximum visibility chartreuse on black is easy to see; Perfect for all firearms and calibers; Great for indoor or outdoor use and low-light conditions; Self-adhesive backing lets you set up with ease; Order yours today! Birchwood Casey Shoot-N-C 12x18\" Self-Adhesive Silhouette Targets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gRYBW2yOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIJHZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.45}}
{"item_id": "B000JIJI9M", "title": "Aerosol Gun Scrubber Firearms Cleaner Size: 10\" H x 3\" W x 10\" D", "description": "33344 Size: 10\" H x 3\" W x 10\" D Features: -Type: Splattering target.-Gun scrubber cleaner cleans and evaporates fast. Dimensions: -13 oz: 10'' H x 3'' W x 3'' D: 1 lbs.-15 oz: 10'' H x 4'' W x 4'' D: 2 lb.", "text": "Aerosol Gun Scrubber Firearms Cleaner Size: 10\" H x 3\" W x 10\" D 33344 Size: 10\" H x 3\" W x 10\" D Features: -Type: Splattering target.-Gun scrubber cleaner cleans and evaporates fast. Dimensions: -13 oz: 10'' H x 3'' W x 3'' D: 1 lbs.-15 oz: 10'' H x 4'' W x 4'' D: 2 lb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WwKq%2BTqoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIJI9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 10.88}}
{"item_id": "B000JIKKXU", "title": "Airsoft ABS MICH Tactical Helmet Black", "description": "Replica Mich 2000 Helmet in Black made of high quality ABS plastic. It weighs just over 2 pounds. Highly adjustable and chin strap. We are very impressed with this replica. Does not provide any (ballistic) protection, except from a hail of bbs. Paddings are not included.", "text": "Airsoft ABS MICH Tactical Helmet Black Replica Mich 2000 Helmet in Black made of high quality ABS plastic. It weighs just over 2 pounds. Highly adjustable and chin strap. We are very impressed with this replica. Does not provide any (ballistic) protection, except from a hail of bbs. Paddings are not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ShqUyrugL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JIKKXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BBTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Helmets"]], "price": 17.26}}
{"item_id": "B000JILVQU", "title": "Giro Flume Youth Bike Helmet", "description": "The Giro Flume Youth Bike Helmet is constructed of a foam layer which has been bonded to a microshell using an inmold process, making the helmet both sturdy and solid. It is equipped with an easily adjustable Acu Dial fit system, 20 air vents, and a detachable snap-fit visor. The colorful Flume is a universal youth size, fitting heads from 19.75 to 22.5-inches (50 to 57-centimeters).Helmet Tips--You Should Always...Wear a helmet when you rideWear your helmet low in the front to protect the foreheadFasten your buckle and tighten your chin strapCheck your adjustments every time you wear your helmetInspect your helmet regularly for signs of wear or damageWear a helmet designed for your activityAbout GiroWorking late nights in his garage, designer/bike racer Jim Gentes created the first lightweight adult cycling helmet in 1985. Friends at NASA helped tune the final helmet shape and vent placement, and the result was the Giro Prolight, a helmet that was better looking than traditional designs while offering a superior fit and still met the industry's toughest safety standards. Plus, it was half the weight of traditional helmets. Since then, Giro has advanced its helmets, many of which have set the standards for styling, function, and innovation for progressive, performance-oriented riders on dirt, pavement, and snow. Giro helmets are worn by millions of riders, cyclists, skiers, and snowboarders around the world. Young-bloods and old-timers; hard-cores, heshers, and hipsters; rookies, experts, and a few regular Joes too--in fact, pretty much anyone that appreciates superior fit and function, cutting edge styling, and the very best ideas you get in a helmet.", "text": "Giro Flume Youth Bike Helmet The Giro Flume Youth Bike Helmet is constructed of a foam layer which has been bonded to a microshell using an inmold process, making the helmet both sturdy and solid. It is equipped with an easily adjustable Acu Dial fit system, 20 air vents, and a detachable snap-fit visor. The colorful Flume is a universal youth size, fitting heads from 19.75 to 22.5-inches (50 to 57-centimeters).Helmet Tips--You Should Always...Wear a helmet when you rideWear your helmet low in the front to protect the foreheadFasten your buckle and tighten your chin strapCheck your adjustments every time you wear your helmetInspect your helmet regularly for signs of wear or damageWear a helmet designed for your activityAbout GiroWorking late nights in his garage, designer/bike racer Jim Gentes created the first lightweight adult cycling helmet in 1985. Friends at NASA helped tune the final helmet shape and vent placement, and the result was the Giro Prolight, a helmet that was better looking than traditional designs while offering a superior fit and still met the industry's toughest safety standards. Plus, it was half the weight of traditional helmets. Since then, Giro has advanced its helmets, many of which have set the standards for styling, function, and innovation for progressive, performance-oriented riders on dirt, pavement, and snow. Giro helmets are worn by millions of riders, cyclists, skiers, and snowboarders around the world. Young-bloods and old-timers; hard-cores, heshers, and hipsters; rookies, experts, and a few regular Joes too--in fact, pretty much anyone that appreciates superior fit and function, cutting edge styling, and the very best ideas you get in a helmet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TB2QQbBYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JILVQU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 35.99}}
