{"item_id": "B000JLFBJU", "title": "Coleman Liquid Fuel Lantern Hard-Shell Carry Case", "description": "Protect your Coleman gas lantern during storage and transport with this hard-shell carry case. The Case fits Coleman lantern models 282, 285, 286, 288, 214 and several other older liquid-fuel lanterns. The rugged, durable housing helps keep your lantern safe.", "text": "Coleman Liquid Fuel Lantern Hard-Shell Carry Case Protect your Coleman gas lantern during storage and transport with this hard-shell carry case. The Case fits Coleman lantern models 282, 285, 286, 288, 214 and several other older liquid-fuel lanterns. The rugged, durable housing helps keep your lantern safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41URu1uBtOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JLFBJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 16.69}}
{"item_id": "B000JM0B76", "title": "CamelBak - M.U.L.E. Hydration Pack - 100 oz (3 L)", "description": "The M.U.L.E hydration pack is the most efficient way to carry your water and gear, and can now be attached directly to the back of your body armor by using the Open Gate Keeper Clips of the Direct Armor Attachment System (D.A.A.S.). Includes the 100 oz (3 L) OMEGA® Water Beast™ Reservoir with HydroLink Exit Port. In addition to the reservoir area, it also has a 488.2 cu in (8 L) cargo area. Easy-to-fill and clean wide-mouth OMEGA® opening, rugged and durable Water Beast™ material, leak-proof screw-cap, insulated PureFlow™ tube, patented Big Bite™ Valve, HydroLink™ Exit Port and Drink Port, HydroLock™ one-handed flow control", "text": "CamelBak - M.U.L.E. Hydration Pack - 100 oz (3 L) The M.U.L.E hydration pack is the most efficient way to carry your water and gear, and can now be attached directly to the back of your body armor by using the Open Gate Keeper Clips of the Direct Armor Attachment System (D.A.A.S.). Includes the 100 oz (3 L) OMEGA® Water Beast™ Reservoir with HydroLink Exit Port. In addition to the reservoir area, it also has a 488.2 cu in (8 L) cargo area. Easy-to-fill and clean wide-mouth OMEGA® opening, rugged and durable Water Beast™ material, leak-proof screw-cap, insulated PureFlow™ tube, patented Big Bite™ Valve, HydroLink™ Exit Port and Drink Port, HydroLock™ one-handed flow control", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515-IJ3gZFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JM0B76.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 109.95}}
