{"item_id": "B000JMIV50", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M16-14D Desert Big Dog Combo Edge Blade Knife", "description": "M16-14D Desert Big Dog made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 3.875-Inch combo edge knife. This knife which has an AUS 8 stainless steel blade was designed for military use in desert settings. It features easy one hand opening, aluminum frame, Desert Tan aluminum handles, Desert Tan AUS8 stainless steel blade and AutoLawks system.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M16-14D Desert Big Dog Combo Edge Blade Knife M16-14D Desert Big Dog made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 3.875-Inch combo edge knife. This knife which has an AUS 8 stainless steel blade was designed for military use in desert settings. It features easy one hand opening, aluminum frame, Desert Tan aluminum handles, Desert Tan AUS8 stainless steel blade and AutoLawks system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BLizerSZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JMIV50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 51.95}}
{"item_id": "B000JMLUC6", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 1-Pint Bottle", "description": "In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 1-Pint Bottle In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q09ejrRhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JMLUC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 14.47}}
{"item_id": "B000JO5PRK", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Vertex 2 Tent", "description": "The Vertex is a one continuous pole design, free standing tent that is enhanced with 2 doors for easy entry and 2 vestibules for gear storage and extra weather protection. Extra large #8 zippers make opening and closing the doors and vestibules a breeze. The Vertex has aircraft alloy aluminum poles that are strong and lightweight. Assembly is really easy with the tent clips that just snap in place over the poles. The poles are all shock corded together as one continuous system. The top of the tent has a spreader section for increased head room. With a factory sealed fly and floor seams, you're sure to stay dry in rainy weather. The polyester fly and floor are urethane coated, factory sealed seams for maximum weatherproofness. The fly buckles to the tent, offering a much more secure attachment when compared to elastic cord. The mesh roof vents increase ventilation and improves star gazing.The Vertex 2 has a waterproof coating and factory sealed seams for maximum weatherproofness.Features:Free-standing pole system with 7000 series aluminum polesEasy assembly with pole clips that quickly snap over the tent poles75D 185T Polyester Fly resists UV damage and stays tautFactory Sealed fly and floor seams give best weather protection75D 185T Taffeta Floor with 2000mm coatingExtra large #8 zippers on doors and vestibulesEasy entry and great ventilation with 2 doors (both with zippered mesh windows)2 Vestibules for gear storage and extra weather protectionWeatherproof fly buckles on for maximum adjustability and protectionMesh roof vents increase ventilation and improve star gazingSpecifications:Base Size: 5 feet x 7 feet, 6 inchesCenter Height: 3 feet, 10 inchesVestibule Depth: 32 inchesTent Area: 37 square feetVestibule Area: 25 square feetTent and Fly Weight: 5 pounds, 15 ouncesTotal Weight: 6 pounds, 13 ouncesPacked Size: 6 by 22 inchesPole Diameter: 8.5 mmStyle: Two-pole rectangular domeUse Rating: 3 seasonSleeps: Two", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Vertex 2 Tent The Vertex is a one continuous pole design, free standing tent that is enhanced with 2 doors for easy entry and 2 vestibules for gear storage and extra weather protection. Extra large #8 zippers make opening and closing the doors and vestibules a breeze. The Vertex has aircraft alloy aluminum poles that are strong and lightweight. Assembly is really easy with the tent clips that just snap in place over the poles. The poles are all shock corded together as one continuous system. The top of the tent has a spreader section for increased head room. With a factory sealed fly and floor seams, you're sure to stay dry in rainy weather. The polyester fly and floor are urethane coated, factory sealed seams for maximum weatherproofness. The fly buckles to the tent, offering a much more secure attachment when compared to elastic cord. The mesh roof vents increase ventilation and improves star gazing.The Vertex 2 has a waterproof coating and factory sealed seams for maximum weatherproofness.Features:Free-standing pole system with 7000 series aluminum polesEasy assembly with pole clips that quickly snap over the tent poles75D 185T Polyester Fly resists UV damage and stays tautFactory Sealed fly and floor seams give best weather protection75D 185T Taffeta Floor with 2000mm coatingExtra large #8 zippers on doors and vestibulesEasy entry and great ventilation with 2 doors (both with zippered mesh windows)2 Vestibules for gear storage and extra weather protectionWeatherproof fly buckles on for maximum adjustability and protectionMesh roof vents increase ventilation and improve star gazingSpecifications:Base Size: 5 feet x 7 feet, 6 inchesCenter Height: 3 feet, 10 inchesVestibule Depth: 32 inchesTent Area: 37 square feetVestibule Area: 25 square feetTent and Fly Weight: 5 pounds, 15 ouncesTotal Weight: 6 pounds, 13 ouncesPacked Size: 6 by 22 inchesPole Diameter: 8.5 mmStyle: Two-pole rectangular domeUse Rating: 3 seasonSleeps: Two", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lgXGLkVIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JO5PRK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000JORB2M", "title": "Gasone Butane Fuel Canister (4pack)", "description": "FOR 4 CAN OF 8oz OF FUEL. LAST UP TO 2 HOUR", "text": "Gasone Butane Fuel Canister (4pack) FOR 4 CAN OF 8oz OF FUEL. LAST UP TO 2 HOUR", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ta1EO-EOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JORB2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GasOne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]], "price": 6.51}}
{"item_id": "B000JPGOPG", "title": "Suunto Wrist-Top Computer Watch Replacement Battery Kit (X6HR, Observer, G6 Pro, M3, X6, S6, G3, and t6) Part# SS0S4721000", "description": "Battery kit includes a CR 2032 battery, a battery lid with O-ring and a battery lid opener. This kit fits to Suunto X6HR, Observer, G6 Pro, M3, X6, S6, G3 as well as t6. This battery replacement kit is Suunto Part# SS0S4721000", "text": "Suunto Wrist-Top Computer Watch Replacement Battery Kit (X6HR, Observer, G6 Pro, M3, X6, S6, G3, and t6) Part# SS0S4721000 Battery kit includes a CR 2032 battery, a battery lid with O-ring and a battery lid opener. This kit fits to Suunto X6HR, Observer, G6 Pro, M3, X6, S6, G3 as well as t6. This battery replacement kit is Suunto Part# SS0S4721000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RaTwMkzYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JPGOPG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Suunto", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Altimeters"]], "price": 13.89}}
