{"item_id": "B000JUTUI4", "title": "Rubber Grip-Colt Officer's Model", "description": "Fits: Colt Officer's Model single stack only. (Wraparound with finger grooves). Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without effecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material used does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of the materials and molding process has allowed Hogue to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Rubber Grip-Colt Officer's Model Fits: Colt Officer's Model single stack only. (Wraparound with finger grooves). Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without effecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material used does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of the materials and molding process has allowed Hogue to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KUkWzjalL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JUTUI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 23.37}}
{"item_id": "B000JUZUOC", "title": "Fobus Roto Holster RH Paddle HK1RP H&K Compact & USP 9mm/40 & 45, Full Size 9mm/40 / S&W Sigma Series 9/40 VE/E/G / FN49 / Ruger SR9 / Taurus Millenium .40 (Pro models refer to SP11B)", "description": "", "text": "Fobus Roto Holster RH Paddle HK1RP H&K Compact & USP 9mm/40 & 45, Full Size 9mm/40 / S&W Sigma Series 9/40 VE/E/G / FN49 / Ruger SR9 / Taurus Millenium .40 (Pro models refer to SP11B)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wEe82gemL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JUZUOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.49}}
{"item_id": "B000JV085W", "title": "Uncle Mike's Nylon Open-Top Inside-The-Pocket Holster", "description": "A Better Means of Concealment; Better Protection for Gun and Clothing. Lessens print-through and recognition of gun carried inside pants or jacket pocket. Open-top holster prevents movement of gun levers, buttons or catches common to loose pocket carry.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Nylon Open-Top Inside-The-Pocket Holster A Better Means of Concealment; Better Protection for Gun and Clothing. Lessens print-through and recognition of gun carried inside pants or jacket pocket. Open-top holster prevents movement of gun levers, buttons or catches common to loose pocket carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A5EZlD54L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JV085W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000JVKLTU", "title": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strip Pair Fits .38/.357 Caliber", "description": "Developed by John Bianchi over 50 years ago, Bianchi Speed Strips are just as useful today as they were then. A compact and handy device for loading revolvers, Speed Strips fit in most single mag/knife pouches and trouser or shirt pockets. They are a perfect, slim back up to speedloaders. Injection molded from a flexible urethane material, Speed Strips hold 6 rounds of either .38/.357 or .44/.45 ammo and load two at a time. Sold in a two-pack. Fits .38/.357 Caliber", "text": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strip Pair Fits .38/.357 Caliber Developed by John Bianchi over 50 years ago, Bianchi Speed Strips are just as useful today as they were then. A compact and handy device for loading revolvers, Speed Strips fit in most single mag/knife pouches and trouser or shirt pockets. They are a perfect, slim back up to speedloaders. Injection molded from a flexible urethane material, Speed Strips hold 6 rounds of either .38/.357 or .44/.45 ammo and load two at a time. Sold in a two-pack. Fits .38/.357 Caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413STkydTdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVKLTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 7.19}}
{"item_id": "B000JVMRYC", "title": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Large-With Finger Grooves Slip-On Grip", "description": "Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 2 Also for large pistols, is richly textured and has a finger groove front. Fits: Action Arms: AT-88SS AMT: Auto Mag II .22, Automatic III, IV, V Bernadelli: PO18S Browning: BDM, Buckmark, Challenger II Colt: 2000, Double Edge EAA: Witness Excam: TA90, FIE TZ75, Targa GT21 Glock: 17, 18, 20, 21, 22, 24 High Standard: .22 Auto H&K;: P-9S Intratec: TEC-9, TEC-22 Jericho: Baby Eagle Michell Arms: .22 Auto Sphinx: AT-2000 Standard Springfield: P-9 Steyr: GB Tangfolio: TZ/75", "text": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Large-With Finger Grooves Slip-On Grip Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 2 Also for large pistols, is richly textured and has a finger groove front. Fits: Action Arms: AT-88SS AMT: Auto Mag II .22, Automatic III, IV, V Bernadelli: PO18S Browning: BDM, Buckmark, Challenger II Colt: 2000, Double Edge EAA: Witness Excam: TA90, FIE TZ75, Targa GT21 Glock: 17, 18, 20, 21, 22, 24 High Standard: .22 Auto H&K;: P-9S Intratec: TEC-9, TEC-22 Jericho: Baby Eagle Michell Arms: .22 Auto Sphinx: AT-2000 Standard Springfield: P-9 Steyr: GB Tangfolio: TZ/75", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oAb0BGMvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVMRYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000JVOOPW", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SP11 Springfield Armory XD/XDM / HS 2000 9/357/40 5\" 4\" / Sig 2022 / H&K P2000", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SP11 Springfield Armory XD/XDM / HS 2000 9/357/40 5\" 4\" / Sig 2022 / H&K P2000 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U4IANUNVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVOOPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B000JVOWRW", "title": "Hunter's Specialties JS Attractor with Remote", "description": "The Attractor has plenty of features built into a lightweight, compact digital caller. Each handheld caller comes with five pre-programmed 16-bit sounds. The base unit has an 8-ohm, .5-watt speaker that pivots 180 degrees for directional calling. The 30-second sounds can be played in a loop for continuous action. The handheld remote has a range of 50 yards, allowing hunters to set the base unit far enough away to draw attention from themselves. The remote operates on a 12-volt, 23-amp battery and the base unit on four AA batteries, which are all included. The Attractor comes with a holster for the remote and a belt clip for the base unit. The base unit also has a loop for hanging it from a tree or bush. Five different models are available that include two predator versions, turkey, deer, and crow models. Each one uses the famous high-quality Johnny Stewart sounds.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties JS Attractor with Remote The Attractor has plenty of features built into a lightweight, compact digital caller. Each handheld caller comes with five pre-programmed 16-bit sounds. The base unit has an 8-ohm, .5-watt speaker that pivots 180 degrees for directional calling. The 30-second sounds can be played in a loop for continuous action. The handheld remote has a range of 50 yards, allowing hunters to set the base unit far enough away to draw attention from themselves. The remote operates on a 12-volt, 23-amp battery and the base unit on four AA batteries, which are all included. The Attractor comes with a holster for the remote and a belt clip for the base unit. The base unit also has a loop for hanging it from a tree or bush. Five different models are available that include two predator versions, turkey, deer, and crow models. Each one uses the famous high-quality Johnny Stewart sounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b9cBYj2LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVOWRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Big Game Calls"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000JVQPBI", "title": "Hogue Ruger GP100/Super Redhawk Rubber Tamer Grip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Ruger GP100/Super Redhawk Rubber Tamer Grip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41czziXOXqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVQPBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 22.39}}
{"item_id": "B000JVQT3M", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SB1T-L Super SOG Bowie Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 7.5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Leather Washer Handle, Black TiNi", "description": "How appropriate that for our 20th anniversary we launch a new adaptation of the original SOG Bowie that founded the company. This new large format 7-1/2” blade will stun you with its exacting construction and precise grind lines. Unlike the originals, all parts are protected with our Hardcased Black TiNi coating that is the very best for appearance and performance. The stacked leather washer handle is completely traditional.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SB1T-L Super SOG Bowie Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 7.5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Leather Washer Handle, Black TiNi How appropriate that for our 20th anniversary we launch a new adaptation of the original SOG Bowie that founded the company. This new large format 7-1/2” blade will stun you with its exacting construction and precise grind lines. Unlike the originals, all parts are protected with our Hardcased Black TiNi coating that is the very best for appearance and performance. The stacked leather washer handle is completely traditional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PSfLbU88L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JVQT3M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 161.09}}
{"item_id": "B000JWBFVM", "title": "AK Flash Hider (AR-15 Style)", "description": "If you like the M-16/AR-15 style flash hider and wish you had one on your AK type rifle, here it is! Just like the well proven AR-15 flash hider but threaded 14x1 left hand with detent notches to fit all AK muzzle threads. Nice blue finish. Note: will not fit on AR-15.", "text": "AK Flash Hider (AR-15 Style) If you like the M-16/AR-15 style flash hider and wish you had one on your AK type rifle, here it is! Just like the well proven AR-15 flash hider but threaded 14x1 left hand with detent notches to fit all AK muzzle threads. Nice blue finish. Note: will not fit on AR-15.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VuNzaeXNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWBFVM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B000JWF266", "title": "Hogue 82000 Rubber Grip-Ruger", "description": "Rubber Grip for Ruger - Ruger MK II w/ Finger GroovesManufacture ID: 82000Fits: Ruger MK II. (Wraparound with finger grooves). Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel without effecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material used does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of the materials and molding process has allowed Hogue to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.Warranty: Hogue promises to do their utmost to provide you with the finest handgun stock made and guarantee to take care of problems A.S.A.P.", "text": "Hogue 82000 Rubber Grip-Ruger Rubber Grip for Ruger - Ruger MK II w/ Finger GroovesManufacture ID: 82000Fits: Ruger MK II. (Wraparound with finger grooves). Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel without effecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material used does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of the materials and molding process has allowed Hogue to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.Warranty: Hogue promises to do their utmost to provide you with the finest handgun stock made and guarantee to take care of problems A.S.A.P.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BH9ZlBPLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWF266.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 17.47}}
{"item_id": "B000JWK8CO", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Govt. Model Rubber Panels with Palm Swells", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Govt. Model Rubber Panels with Palm Swells Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B7hjA5ZrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWK8CO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 14.26}}
{"item_id": "B000JWMA02", "title": "5.11 #73285 Men's Cotton Tactical Shorts", "description": "Law enforcement, military and fire professionals worldwide consistently choose the 5.11 Tactical Shorts for both on and off-duty warm weather wear. Known for its signature rear slash pockets and strap, the sturdy, seven-pocket 5.11 Tactical Shorts are so comfortable and functional, they have become an industry standard. Made of tough, 8.5-oz. 100% cotton canvas that becomes increasingly more comfortable over time, these shorts stand up to the rigors of daily work, play and travel. Known for superior comfort, functionality and fit, the shorts feature a self-adjusting comfort waistband that helps you bend and stretch with ease. Double and triple-needle construction is utilized throughout, plus 48 bartacks in high-stress areas. For added durability we use a proprietary weave that binds in on itself to prevent raveling. We use only genuine, locking-flange YKK zippers and quality Prym snaps, both of which are top-of-the-line in the industry. Additional quality hardware is found in the front, where a convenient D-ring holds your keys, or ID. The front pockets are strong and roomy and the inverted pleats on the cargo pockets remain flat until needed for a neat, professional appearance. A narrow thigh pocket accommodates a magazine, cell phone or utility knife. The extra deep rear pockets can hold extended mags, a baton or a 15” flashlight. The legendary fit of the 5.11 Tactical Shorts is a closely guarded secret based on a tried-and-true formula created 30 years ago from its mountaineering roots. The 5.11 Tactical Shorts are designed for active movement in changing conditions, the shorts perform and look great on individuals of all shapes and sizes. The authentic 5.11 Tactical Shorts are the only shorts on the market with a 30-year history of delivering quality, functionality, comfort and value. It has consistently stood the test of time worldwide. Accept no imitations or look-alikes; the authentic 5.11 Tactical Shorts are the genuine article.", "text": "5.11 #73285 Men's Cotton Tactical Shorts Law enforcement, military and fire professionals worldwide consistently choose the 5.11 Tactical Shorts for both on and off-duty warm weather wear. Known for its signature rear slash pockets and strap, the sturdy, seven-pocket 5.11 Tactical Shorts are so comfortable and functional, they have become an industry standard. Made of tough, 8.5-oz. 100% cotton canvas that becomes increasingly more comfortable over time, these shorts stand up to the rigors of daily work, play and travel. Known for superior comfort, functionality and fit, the shorts feature a self-adjusting comfort waistband that helps you bend and stretch with ease. Double and triple-needle construction is utilized throughout, plus 48 bartacks in high-stress areas. For added durability we use a proprietary weave that binds in on itself to prevent raveling. We use only genuine, locking-flange YKK zippers and quality Prym snaps, both of which are top-of-the-line in the industry. Additional quality hardware is found in the front, where a convenient D-ring holds your keys, or ID. The front pockets are strong and roomy and the inverted pleats on the cargo pockets remain flat until needed for a neat, professional appearance. A narrow thigh pocket accommodates a magazine, cell phone or utility knife. The extra deep rear pockets can hold extended mags, a baton or a 15” flashlight. The legendary fit of the 5.11 Tactical Shorts is a closely guarded secret based on a tried-and-true formula created 30 years ago from its mountaineering roots. The 5.11 Tactical Shorts are designed for active movement in changing conditions, the shorts perform and look great on individuals of all shapes and sizes. The authentic 5.11 Tactical Shorts are the only shorts on the market with a 30-year history of delivering quality, functionality, comfort and value. It has consistently stood the test of time worldwide. Accept no imitations or look-alikes; the authentic 5.11 Tactical Shorts are the genuine article.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eLNbNb2iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWMA02.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000JWMDI6", "title": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Medium With Finger Grooves Slip-On Grip", "description": "Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 3 For medium pistols, is richly textured and has a finger groove front. Fits: - Beretta: 84, 85, 92 series, 96, Cougar - Browning: BDA, and Hi-Power - CZ: 75, 85, and copies - Glock: 17, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23 - Heckler and Koch: model 4 and USP - Ruger: P85, 89, 90, 91, 93, 94, 95 - Sigarms: P220, 225, 226, 228, 229, 239 - Smith and Wesson: 3900, 4500, 5900, and 6900 series standard and compact, Sigma - Star: PD and model 30 - Taurus: PT92/99, and 100 AF and DC models - Walther: P-5, P-38, P-88 - Other pistols of similar size", "text": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Medium With Finger Grooves Slip-On Grip Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 3 For medium pistols, is richly textured and has a finger groove front. Fits: - Beretta: 84, 85, 92 series, 96, Cougar - Browning: BDA, and Hi-Power - CZ: 75, 85, and copies - Glock: 17, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23 - Heckler and Koch: model 4 and USP - Ruger: P85, 89, 90, 91, 93, 94, 95 - Sigarms: P220, 225, 226, 228, 229, 239 - Smith and Wesson: 3900, 4500, 5900, and 6900 series standard and compact, Sigma - Star: PD and model 30 - Taurus: PT92/99, and 100 AF and DC models - Walther: P-5, P-38, P-88 - Other pistols of similar size", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416ItnHalZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWMDI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B000JWO4J2", "title": "Fobus Compact Holster Paddle SP11B Springfield Armory XD / HS 2000 9/357/40 5\" 4\" / Sig 2022, P250 / H&K P2000 P2000SK /Taurus Millenium .45, Millenium Pro (ALL Pro models)", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Compact Holster Paddle SP11B Springfield Armory XD / HS 2000 9/357/40 5\" 4\" / Sig 2022, P250 / H&K P2000 P2000SK /Taurus Millenium .45, Millenium Pro (ALL Pro models) Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TRxSA-qEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWO4J2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.47}}
{"item_id": "B000JWO4UQ", "title": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Winchester 1200 and 1300 FN TPS", "description": "The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun. Note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend. Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "text": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Winchester 1200 and 1300 FN TPS The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun. Note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend. Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MS6HW-lzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWO4UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000JWOBKE", "title": "Fobus Standard Paddle Right Hand Holster - Taurus 85 TA85", "description": "Fobus Standard Paddle Right Hand Holster - Taurus 85 TA85", "text": "Fobus Standard Paddle Right Hand Holster - Taurus 85 TA85 Fobus Standard Paddle Right Hand Holster - Taurus 85 TA85", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KwF62DGvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JWOBKE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B000JZ1366", "title": "Shooting Chrony 7000020 Alpha Chronograph, Red", "description": "A Shooting Chrony Alpha Chrony chronograph can measure velocities for air guns and firearms, including powerful firearms. Now you can test your air gun's velocity yourself! All Chrony models are powered by a single 9V battery and can be easily attached to a 1/4-20 tpi camera tripod for fast, easy set up. The Chrony is simple to use, just unfold the box, set the sky screens in place with the diffusers, turn on the switch and start shooting. The Velocity stays on display until you shoot again. One String, from 2 to 32 shot memory (Numbered) Measures High, Low and Average Velocities, Extreme Spread and Standard Deviations.", "text": "Shooting Chrony 7000020 Alpha Chronograph, Red A Shooting Chrony Alpha Chrony chronograph can measure velocities for air guns and firearms, including powerful firearms. Now you can test your air gun's velocity yourself! All Chrony models are powered by a single 9V battery and can be easily attached to a 1/4-20 tpi camera tripod for fast, easy set up. The Chrony is simple to use, just unfold the box, set the sky screens in place with the diffusers, turn on the switch and start shooting. The Velocity stays on display until you shoot again. One String, from 2 to 32 shot memory (Numbered) Measures High, Low and Average Velocities, Extreme Spread and Standard Deviations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jz2rxxn-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JZ1366.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooting Chrony", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 106.95}}
{"item_id": "B000JZ13O8", "title": "Burris 420084 Zee Rings (1-Inch, Medium, Matte Black)", "description": "The Burris Zee Solid Steel Rings is machined from a solid block of steel to exacting tolerances. The top and bottom are performance-matched.", "text": "Burris 420084 Zee Rings (1-Inch, Medium, Matte Black) The Burris Zee Solid Steel Rings is machined from a solid block of steel to exacting tolerances. The top and bottom are performance-matched.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x4Tf1aa8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JZ13O8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 27.49}}
{"item_id": "B000JZ3RWO", "title": "Bianchi 111 Cyclone Holster Fits Colt Python 6In Rev", "description": "A versatile belt holster design that is hand molded for a custom-like fit. The unique belt loop allows the pistol or revolver to be carried in either a cross draw or strongside carry. It is ideally suited for hunters who carry long barreled revolvers. 1.75” belt loop. Fits Ruger GP100 6\", S&W; 586, 686 and similar L frame models (6\"), Taurus 669, 689 (6\"), Wesson 15, 715 (6\")", "text": "Bianchi 111 Cyclone Holster Fits Colt Python 6In Rev A versatile belt holster design that is hand molded for a custom-like fit. The unique belt loop allows the pistol or revolver to be carried in either a cross draw or strongside carry. It is ideally suited for hunters who carry long barreled revolvers. 1.75” belt loop. Fits Ruger GP100 6\", S&W; 586, 686 and similar L frame models (6\"), Taurus 669, 689 (6\"), Wesson 15, 715 (6\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a5qdooLHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JZ3RWO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 60.99}}
{"item_id": "B000JZ7JM8", "title": "Hogue Handall Full Size Grip Sleeve", "description": "Known to properly fit the following guns: Glock Models w/ or w/out Finger Grooves 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32, 33, 34; S&W; Models 39, 41, 59, 422, 622, 645, 669, 745, 909, 2206, 3906, 6906 and 3rd gen. Series 1000, 4000, 45000, 5900, 6900 w/ or w/out frame mounted decockers - Sigma 9mm and .40; SIG Sauer Models P220, 225, 226, 228, 229, 230, 232, 239 and 245; Ruger Models P85, 89, 90, 91, 93, 94, 95, 97 and 22/45; Colt Double Eagle; Beretta 84, 85, 92, 92C, 96 and Couger; Browning Buckmark, Challenger II, BDA, Hi-power and clones; Taurus 92, 92C, 99, 100 and 101; EEA Witness 83 and 85; Springfield P9, Tanfoglio, CZ75 and clones; Astra A-100 and Constable II; Interarms Firestar; Walther P-38, P-88; Llama Omni; Makarov; Steyr GB; KBI BK and Compact GKK-92c; Bernadelli P018S; Daewoo DP51; Heckler & Koch USP, full size and compact, and 70-Z; Intratec TECDC9 and TEC22; Automag III; Zastava 99; High Standard Victor; Jericho 9mm; Star Fire; etc . Hogue HANDALL grip sleeves are scientifically designed with a special contoured shape that hugs the contours of your gun. This exclusive shape gives a secure fit with no loose spots, giving HANDALL the tightest and most secure fit to your gun possible. The special shape is far superior to any simple \"tube\" sleeve. Hogue HANDALL features include: proportioned finger grooves, a unique cobblestone texture and ambidextrous palm swells for the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip surface. Molded from a modern soft but durable rubber, HANDALL grip sleeves are easy to install with no lubrication required. These comfortable grips are tough and impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, giving years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Handall Full Size Grip Sleeve Known to properly fit the following guns: Glock Models w/ or w/out Finger Grooves 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 29, 30, 31, 32, 33, 34; S&W; Models 39, 41, 59, 422, 622, 645, 669, 745, 909, 2206, 3906, 6906 and 3rd gen. Series 1000, 4000, 45000, 5900, 6900 w/ or w/out frame mounted decockers - Sigma 9mm and .40; SIG Sauer Models P220, 225, 226, 228, 229, 230, 232, 239 and 245; Ruger Models P85, 89, 90, 91, 93, 94, 95, 97 and 22/45; Colt Double Eagle; Beretta 84, 85, 92, 92C, 96 and Couger; Browning Buckmark, Challenger II, BDA, Hi-power and clones; Taurus 92, 92C, 99, 100 and 101; EEA Witness 83 and 85; Springfield P9, Tanfoglio, CZ75 and clones; Astra A-100 and Constable II; Interarms Firestar; Walther P-38, P-88; Llama Omni; Makarov; Steyr GB; KBI BK and Compact GKK-92c; Bernadelli P018S; Daewoo DP51; Heckler & Koch USP, full size and compact, and 70-Z; Intratec TECDC9 and TEC22; Automag III; Zastava 99; High Standard Victor; Jericho 9mm; Star Fire; etc . Hogue HANDALL grip sleeves are scientifically designed with a special contoured shape that hugs the contours of your gun. This exclusive shape gives a secure fit with no loose spots, giving HANDALL the tightest and most secure fit to your gun possible. The special shape is far superior to any simple \"tube\" sleeve. Hogue HANDALL features include: proportioned finger grooves, a unique cobblestone texture and ambidextrous palm swells for the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip surface. Molded from a modern soft but durable rubber, HANDALL grip sleeves are easy to install with no lubrication required. These comfortable grips are tough and impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, giving years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yBHArbjqL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000JZ7JM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.3}}
{"item_id": "B000K17SVS", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL36 Glock 36", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL36 Glock 36 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bvawzSCSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K17SVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.79}}
{"item_id": "B000K19EWY", "title": "Barnett Outdoors Diablo Slingshot with Stabilizers", "description": "The Pro Diablo II, from renowned archery company Barnett, is a high-performance, professional-grade slingshot. Surprisingly accurate and powerful, it features a sleek and efficient three-piece stabilizer for steady firing, an adjustable sight, and a totally redesigned soft touch grip for nonslip assurance. A wrist brace and weighted stabilizers keep your hand steady while you're drawing a bead on your target, and Magnum power bands deliver devastating velocity. A full shooting guide and educational manual is also included.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors Diablo Slingshot with Stabilizers The Pro Diablo II, from renowned archery company Barnett, is a high-performance, professional-grade slingshot. Surprisingly accurate and powerful, it features a sleek and efficient three-piece stabilizer for steady firing, an adjustable sight, and a totally redesigned soft touch grip for nonslip assurance. A wrist brace and weighted stabilizers keep your hand steady while you're drawing a bead on your target, and Magnum power bands deliver devastating velocity. A full shooting guide and educational manual is also included.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-j8Cj4AXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K19EWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 24.29}}
