{"item_id": "B000K2MCR2", "title": "Blue Sea Systems 9001e e-Series Battery Switch Selector", "description": "9001ee-Series Battery Switch SelectorMake-before-break contact design allows switching between battery banks without power interruptionCE MarkedIgnition protected - Safe for installation aboard gasoline powered boatsCase design allows surface or rear panel mountingMeets American Boat and Yacht Council (ABYC) requirements for battery switches3/8\"-16 tin-plated copper studs for maximum conductivity and corrosion resistance, accepts 3/8\" and M10 ring terminals7/8\" (22.22mm) stud length to accept multiple cable terminalsTactile textures indicate knob position by feel only", "text": "Blue Sea Systems 9001e e-Series Battery Switch Selector 9001ee-Series Battery Switch SelectorMake-before-break contact design allows switching between battery banks without power interruptionCE MarkedIgnition protected - Safe for installation aboard gasoline powered boatsCase design allows surface or rear panel mountingMeets American Boat and Yacht Council (ABYC) requirements for battery switches3/8\"-16 tin-plated copper studs for maximum conductivity and corrosion resistance, accepts 3/8\" and M10 ring terminals7/8\" (22.22mm) stud length to accept multiple cable terminalsTactile textures indicate knob position by feel only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518waMaP5EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K2MCR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blue Sea Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Battery Switches"]], "price": 38.95}}
