{"item_id": "B000K2OWDY", "title": "GREY 50% WOOL RESCUE BLANKET", "description": "50%/50% wool/other blended natural fibers. Dry clean only. Very warm and comfortable blanket. Low heat release. Grey blanket with red stitching around outer border. Can be used for both indoor and outdoor use. Wool has low rate of flame spread, low heat release, and low heat of combustion. Wool is static resistant as the retention of moisture within the fabric prevents a build up of static electricity. Wool garments are much less likely to spark or cling to the body. Grey 55% wool rescue blanket. Dimensions 60\" x 80\" (inches).", "text": "GREY 50% WOOL RESCUE BLANKET 50%/50% wool/other blended natural fibers. Dry clean only. Very warm and comfortable blanket. Low heat release. Grey blanket with red stitching around outer border. Can be used for both indoor and outdoor use. Wool has low rate of flame spread, low heat release, and low heat of combustion. Wool is static resistant as the retention of moisture within the fabric prevents a build up of static electricity. Wool garments are much less likely to spark or cling to the body. Grey 55% wool rescue blanket. Dimensions 60\" x 80\" (inches).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61g3cxhwAML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K2OWDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B000K2S9FQ", "title": "Coleman Cable 02308 16/3 Vinyl Outdoor Extension Cord, Orange, 50-Feet", "description": "Coleman Cable 02308 50-Feet 16/3-Wire Gauge vinyl outdoor extension cord orange These all-purpose cords resist moisture, abrasion and prolonged exposure to sunlight for durability. They have molded, water resistant connectors with reinforced blades to make these cords suitable for outdoor use. Rated at 13-AMP 125-Volt", "text": "Coleman Cable 02308 16/3 Vinyl Outdoor Extension Cord, Orange, 50-Feet Coleman Cable 02308 50-Feet 16/3-Wire Gauge vinyl outdoor extension cord orange These all-purpose cords resist moisture, abrasion and prolonged exposure to sunlight for durability. They have molded, water resistant connectors with reinforced blades to make these cords suitable for outdoor use. Rated at 13-AMP 125-Volt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YwUbSEfjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K2S9FQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman Cable", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000K2ZL5M", "title": "McDavid Compression Arm Sleeve", "description": "McDavid Inc. is the country's highest quality producer of sports medicine braces and performance apparel. Braces are constructed of 100% latex free neoprene, providing thermal therapy, compression, and soft tissue support. The vast majority of the products are produced in the USA. All compression apparel material contain either HydraVent Moisture Management Technology that keeps the athlete cool and dry or ThermaVent Moisture Management Technology that keeps the athlete warm and dry. McDavid's patented HexPad Technology provides a durable, breathable, and lightweight padding system in compression apparel. Hexpad is designed to move and conform to the athlete's body, providing maximum protection. HexPad is the choice of the majority of professional basketball players and D1 college football players.", "text": "McDavid Compression Arm Sleeve McDavid Inc. is the country's highest quality producer of sports medicine braces and performance apparel. Braces are constructed of 100% latex free neoprene, providing thermal therapy, compression, and soft tissue support. The vast majority of the products are produced in the USA. All compression apparel material contain either HydraVent Moisture Management Technology that keeps the athlete cool and dry or ThermaVent Moisture Management Technology that keeps the athlete warm and dry. McDavid's patented HexPad Technology provides a durable, breathable, and lightweight padding system in compression apparel. Hexpad is designed to move and conform to the athlete's body, providing maximum protection. HexPad is the choice of the majority of professional basketball players and D1 college football players.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tyg7Eq8XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K2ZL5M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Accessories", "Shooter Sleeves"]]}}
