{"item_id": "B000K6C91M", "title": "S&W 300 Hinged Handcuffs", "description": "Hinged design in a blue gray color further restricts movements for specialty applications. Folds flat to fit most standard pouches uses a standard key and features double lock slot configuration. Available in both nickel and blue. Weight: 11 ounces. Has double lock slot configuration for increased security. The term \"blue\" when referring to the finish/color of a steel item is a description for the finish of the product. The process being described is called blueing which produces a deep blue color Push pin available.ATTRIBUTESColor:BlueFinish:BluedLock Style:Two Sided Material:Carbon SteelSpecial Features:Comes With Two KeysStyle:Hinged", "text": "S&W 300 Hinged Handcuffs Hinged design in a blue gray color further restricts movements for specialty applications. Folds flat to fit most standard pouches uses a standard key and features double lock slot configuration. Available in both nickel and blue. Weight: 11 ounces. Has double lock slot configuration for increased security. The term \"blue\" when referring to the finish/color of a steel item is a description for the finish of the product. The process being described is called blueing which produces a deep blue color Push pin available.ATTRIBUTESColor:BlueFinish:BluedLock Style:Two Sided Material:Carbon SteelSpecial Features:Comes With Two KeysStyle:Hinged", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Sw9ZYDpAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K6C91M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Handcuffs & Restraints", "Handcuffs"]], "price": 43.46}}
{"item_id": "B000K6FI7E", "title": "Stansport Hurricane High Oil Lantern (Red, 12-Inch)", "description": "Keep your campsite illuminated after the sun sets with this classic kerosene lantern from outdoor outfitter Stansport. The 12-inch metal lantern has an attractive metal wiring design that protects the glass globe, and an adjustable wick to control brightness.About Stansport:Stansport has produced quality camping gear for more than 50 years, from tents to backpacks and rafts to cookware.", "text": "Stansport Hurricane High Oil Lantern (Red, 12-Inch) Keep your campsite illuminated after the sun sets with this classic kerosene lantern from outdoor outfitter Stansport. The 12-inch metal lantern has an attractive metal wiring design that protects the glass globe, and an adjustable wick to control brightness.About Stansport:Stansport has produced quality camping gear for more than 50 years, from tents to backpacks and rafts to cookware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eesrf8etL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K6FI7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 11.59}}
{"item_id": "B000K6HCKK", "title": "Gerber Gator Saw I", "description": "Gerber's Gator I Saw is a strong, collapsible,10\" blade Saw with Ballistic Nylon sheath. Made of stainless steel, each component snaps together for an updated design from traditional outdoor saws. The wing nut with end clip eliminates loss in the field. Gator textured handle ensures maximum grip and hand guard protects knuckles.", "text": "Gerber Gator Saw I Gerber's Gator I Saw is a strong, collapsible,10\" blade Saw with Ballistic Nylon sheath. Made of stainless steel, each component snaps together for an updated design from traditional outdoor saws. The wing nut with end clip eliminates loss in the field. Gator textured handle ensures maximum grip and hand guard protects knuckles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ddCsoei5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K6HCKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 24.34}}
{"item_id": "B000K6HN22", "title": "Stansport Portable Toilet", "description": "This portable toilet from Stansport is designed to provide a sturdy and easy to clean toilet for use in the outdoors, camping, or boating. The portable toilet features a white plastic molded seat with heavy-duty tubular steel legs for stability. Containment bags are held in place with a removable plastic ring. The toilet folds up compactly for storage and transport and comes with six plastic bags.", "text": "Stansport Portable Toilet This portable toilet from Stansport is designed to provide a sturdy and easy to clean toilet for use in the outdoors, camping, or boating. The portable toilet features a white plastic molded seat with heavy-duty tubular steel legs for stability. Containment bags are held in place with a removable plastic ring. The toilet folds up compactly for storage and transport and comes with six plastic bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AzN%2B2G8iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000K6HN22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 17.61}}
