{"item_id": "B000KB2DJU", "title": "SKS Shockboard Front Bicycle Fender (Black)", "description": "The lightweight SKS Shockboard mountain bike dirtboard protects you and your legs from the trail's debris, and is compatible with almost any suspension fork. Made of a virtually unbreakable polycarbonate material, the Shockboard weighs just 110 grams, and can also be used in conjunction with an adapter (sold separately) for Headshock and rigid forks.The snap-on mudguard is compatible with almost any suspension fork.About SKSIn 1921, German bicycle accessory company SKS was founded by Karl Scheffer-Klute in Sundern, Germany (SKS = Scheffer-Klute Sundern). The company, which originally just produced high quality bike pumps, today manufactures floor pumps, mini pumps, mudguards, bike fenders, chain guards, and other accessories.", "text": "SKS Shockboard Front Bicycle Fender (Black) The lightweight SKS Shockboard mountain bike dirtboard protects you and your legs from the trail's debris, and is compatible with almost any suspension fork. Made of a virtually unbreakable polycarbonate material, the Shockboard weighs just 110 grams, and can also be used in conjunction with an adapter (sold separately) for Headshock and rigid forks.The snap-on mudguard is compatible with almost any suspension fork.About SKSIn 1921, German bicycle accessory company SKS was founded by Karl Scheffer-Klute in Sundern, Germany (SKS = Scheffer-Klute Sundern). The company, which originally just produced high quality bike pumps, today manufactures floor pumps, mini pumps, mudguards, bike fenders, chain guards, and other accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iCroBFGZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KB2DJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 22.49}}
