{"item_id": "B000KB94OM", "title": "Nathan Trek 22-Ounce Angled Holster Hydration Waist Pack", "description": "The perfect pack for runners and walkers alike, the Triangle makes carrying hydration and other essentials easy, comfortable, and is ideal for activities lasting up to an hour. The limited stretch elasticized waistbelt features a slanted holster and zippered pocket, a shock cord with bottle security, a dimensional zippered pocket with headphone port, key clip, moisture-wicking backing, reflective detail and an incorporated waterproof I.D./medical emergency card.Features:Limted-stretch elasticized waistbelt70/30 bottle positioning for stability22 ounce Hydration Bottle with Clipless CapFully insulated, angled bottle holsterBottle security Shock CordDimensional zippered pocket with headphone portKey ClipIncorporated, waterproof I.D./medical emergency cardAirmesh moisture-wicking backingReflective detailWeighs 8 ouncesAdjustable fit; one size fits all", "text": "Nathan Trek 22-Ounce Angled Holster Hydration Waist Pack The perfect pack for runners and walkers alike, the Triangle makes carrying hydration and other essentials easy, comfortable, and is ideal for activities lasting up to an hour. The limited stretch elasticized waistbelt features a slanted holster and zippered pocket, a shock cord with bottle security, a dimensional zippered pocket with headphone port, key clip, moisture-wicking backing, reflective detail and an incorporated waterproof I.D./medical emergency card.Features:Limted-stretch elasticized waistbelt70/30 bottle positioning for stability22 ounce Hydration Bottle with Clipless CapFully insulated, angled bottle holsterBottle security Shock CordDimensional zippered pocket with headphone portKey ClipIncorporated, waterproof I.D./medical emergency cardAirmesh moisture-wicking backingReflective detailWeighs 8 ouncesAdjustable fit; one size fits all", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o5A2eXtqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KB94OM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nathan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 24.88}}
