{"item_id": "B000KBH8AY", "title": "Primus EasyLight Lantern", "description": "FEATURES of the Primus EasyLight Lantern Silent Easy ignition Available with Duo valve SPECIFICATIONS of the Primus EasyLight Lantern Weight: 6.6 oz / 187 g Dimension: 3.1 x 2.9 x 4.8\" / 79 x 73 x 122 mm Burn Time: 4-36 h Brightness: 490 lumens Output: h1100 BTU/h Ignition: Piezoelectric", "text": "Primus EasyLight Lantern FEATURES of the Primus EasyLight Lantern Silent Easy ignition Available with Duo valve SPECIFICATIONS of the Primus EasyLight Lantern Weight: 6.6 oz / 187 g Dimension: 3.1 x 2.9 x 4.8\" / 79 x 73 x 122 mm Burn Time: 4-36 h Brightness: 490 lumens Output: h1100 BTU/h Ignition: Piezoelectric", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xj0gDGMlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KBH8AY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 58.8}}
