{"item_id": "B000KBH8LS", "title": "Coghlans Emergency Tube Tent", "description": "The Coughlan's Tube Tent is designed for emergency situations in which a shelter must be erected quickly, and search and rescue personnel must be signaled. This rugged 2.5 mil polyethylene shelter is fire retardant and lightweight. Shelter sets up in minutes and provides enough room for 2 people. Cord included. Directions: 1. Feed the cord through the Tube and tie to available trees, post, car door, etc.", "text": "Coghlans Emergency Tube Tent The Coughlan's Tube Tent is designed for emergency situations in which a shelter must be erected quickly, and search and rescue personnel must be signaled. This rugged 2.5 mil polyethylene shelter is fire retardant and lightweight. Shelter sets up in minutes and provides enough room for 2 people. Cord included. Directions: 1. Feed the cord through the Tube and tie to available trees, post, car door, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xgFMMYpuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KBH8LS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 6.84}}
{"item_id": "B000KBH9RQ", "title": "McNett ReviveX Spray-On", "description": "The industry standard for restoring water repellency to all types of outerwear including all waterproof-breathable fabrics, Ideal for GORE-TEX garments, GORE-TEX fabric waders, WINDSTOPPER garments, soft shells and quiet rainwear. Water beads and rolls off these garments when new, but with normal wear fabrics start to \"wet out\". ReviveX restores water repellency without affecting breathability. Just wash, spray and tumble dry - for waders just apply and iron in! Contains no optical brighteners. McNett customer care @ 1-800-221-7325 (or) www.mcnett.com", "text": "McNett ReviveX Spray-On The industry standard for restoring water repellency to all types of outerwear including all waterproof-breathable fabrics, Ideal for GORE-TEX garments, GORE-TEX fabric waders, WINDSTOPPER garments, soft shells and quiet rainwear. Water beads and rolls off these garments when new, but with normal wear fabrics start to \"wet out\". ReviveX restores water repellency without affecting breathability. Just wash, spray and tumble dry - for waders just apply and iron in! Contains no optical brighteners. McNett customer care @ 1-800-221-7325 (or) www.mcnett.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pHpMuUI7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KBH9RQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000KBLCXS", "title": "Pocket Sierra Saw", "description": "The Sierra Pocket Saw from Coghlan's is the perfect companion for camping, backpacking, hunting, fishing, garden pruning, and trimming. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade locks open Blade folds into the handle Slip resistant handles Never needs sharpening 159067 , Coghlan's Pocket Sierra Saw , bow saw , pocket saw , trail saw , portable saw , wood saw , brush saw , trail maintenance , tools , saws", "text": "Pocket Sierra Saw The Sierra Pocket Saw from Coghlan's is the perfect companion for camping, backpacking, hunting, fishing, garden pruning, and trimming. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade locks open Blade folds into the handle Slip resistant handles Never needs sharpening 159067 , Coghlan's Pocket Sierra Saw , bow saw , pocket saw , trail saw , portable saw , wood saw , brush saw , trail maintenance , tools , saws", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MUGn9TzEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KBLCXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 7.49}}
