{"item_id": "B000KCLTAI", "title": "Ergon GP1 Bicycle Handlebar Grip for Nexus/Rohloff", "description": "Ergon’s original and ground breaking GP1 continues to set standards. Offering optimal pressure distribution and available in two sizes, it features a forged aluminum clamp for fast and secure installation. Adjustment of the support platform is achieved by simply loosening the clamp bolt and positioning the grip to the desired neutral position", "text": "Ergon GP1 Bicycle Handlebar Grip for Nexus/Rohloff Ergon’s original and ground breaking GP1 continues to set standards. Offering optimal pressure distribution and available in two sizes, it features a forged aluminum clamp for fast and secure installation. Adjustment of the support platform is achieved by simply loosening the clamp bolt and positioning the grip to the desired neutral position", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517cJu9QCzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KCLTAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
