{"item_id": "B000KEFWUE", "title": "Cliff Keen F5 Tornado Headgear", "description": "Keep you head in the match with the Tornado headgear.? A revolutionary design based on NASA research, created by the most trusted name in wrestling and tested by some of the best on the planet.? It's 43% lighter, remarkably cooler and includes a greater audible sound technology.? Incorporates our Power Tab strapping system for a better, faster fit.? Combats bacterial build-up.? Made of our strongest components yet for incredible durability.", "text": "Cliff Keen F5 Tornado Headgear Keep you head in the match with the Tornado headgear.? A revolutionary design based on NASA research, created by the most trusted name in wrestling and tested by some of the best on the planet.? It's 43% lighter, remarkably cooler and includes a greater audible sound technology.? Incorporates our Power Tab strapping system for a better, faster fit.? Combats bacterial build-up.? Made of our strongest components yet for incredible durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dlpE3zktL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KEFWUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cliff Keen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Wrestling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 26.39}}
{"item_id": "B000KEJX7M", "title": "Open Country Backpacker II Two Person Cook Set", "description": "The Open Country Backpacker - 2 Person Cookset is a sturdy, lightweight aluminum all-in-one cookset that nests easily and neatly into a single compact unit", "text": "Open Country Backpacker II Two Person Cook Set The Open Country Backpacker - 2 Person Cookset is a sturdy, lightweight aluminum all-in-one cookset that nests easily and neatly into a single compact unit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wjx0vmyPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KEJX7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Open Country", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 14.6}}
{"item_id": "B000KELQQS", "title": "Scope Rail Mount for MP5 MK5 M5 style guns NCStar", "description": "Scope Rail Mount for MP5 MK5 M5 style guns NCStarFits most MP5, MK5, and M5 Real Steel and Airsoft Guns. Instantly add a top rail mount to your close quarters weapon. No drilling required. (Gun and Scope not included).Mil Spec:Metal ConstructionMatte BlackWeaver style rail clamps directly to top of receiverWeight: 2.53 ozLength: 4.96\"NCSTAR LIFETIME WARRANTY!", "text": "Scope Rail Mount for MP5 MK5 M5 style guns NCStar Scope Rail Mount for MP5 MK5 M5 style guns NCStarFits most MP5, MK5, and M5 Real Steel and Airsoft Guns. Instantly add a top rail mount to your close quarters weapon. No drilling required. (Gun and Scope not included).Mil Spec:Metal ConstructionMatte BlackWeaver style rail clamps directly to top of receiverWeight: 2.53 ozLength: 4.96\"NCSTAR LIFETIME WARRANTY!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qvqYRBT%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KELQQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 10.75}}
{"item_id": "B000KEN22Y", "title": "Nikon M-223 XR Mount", "description": "Developed specifically for the M-223 series of scopes, this special mount fits Picatinny rails found atop most flattop ARs. Lightweight alloy construction with built-in 20-MOA incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.", "text": "Nikon M-223 XR Mount Developed specifically for the M-223 series of scopes, this special mount fits Picatinny rails found atop most flattop ARs. Lightweight alloy construction with built-in 20-MOA incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DRm7T-s9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KEN22Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 59.85}}
{"item_id": "B000KENA9O", "title": "Mizuno T10 Volleyball Kneepads", "description": "Keep your knees safe during your next game of volleyball with these comfortable protective kneepads from Mizuno. The one size fits all pair features a slim profile with five separate contoured padded sections for maximum protections and freedom of movement. A nine-inch sleeve is made of moisture-wicking polyester, cotton, and spandex blended material.About MizunoMizuno, founded in 1906, is a global leader in sportswear and equipment in golf, baseball, softball, running, and volleyball. The company strives to create products that enhance athletic performance at all skill levels, reflected in its support of numerous worldwide sporting events.", "text": "Mizuno T10 Volleyball Kneepads Keep your knees safe during your next game of volleyball with these comfortable protective kneepads from Mizuno. The one size fits all pair features a slim profile with five separate contoured padded sections for maximum protections and freedom of movement. A nine-inch sleeve is made of moisture-wicking polyester, cotton, and spandex blended material.About MizunoMizuno, founded in 1906, is a global leader in sportswear and equipment in golf, baseball, softball, running, and volleyball. The company strives to create products that enhance athletic performance at all skill levels, reflected in its support of numerous worldwide sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41prqpfZCkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KENA9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mizuno", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]], "price": 13.47}}
{"item_id": "B000KENTPO", "title": "BSA Laser Sight With MTS", "description": "Red dot 11.3mm dot size at 10 yds 650nm laser beam 5mW (maximum legal power) Visible at 50yds (indoors, lit) & 100yds (outdoors, night) fits both Weaver & 11mm dovetail bases Two switches* *One switch is located on top of the body and the other, a momentary pressure sensitive switch and wire, can be mounted on the gun wherever you want to put it.", "text": "BSA Laser Sight With MTS Red dot 11.3mm dot size at 10 yds 650nm laser beam 5mW (maximum legal power) Visible at 50yds (indoors, lit) & 100yds (outdoors, night) fits both Weaver & 11mm dovetail bases Two switches* *One switch is located on top of the body and the other, a momentary pressure sensitive switch and wire, can be mounted on the gun wherever you want to put it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N0nJefd5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KENTPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 19.25}}
