{"item_id": "B000KGRSZO", "title": "Zebco Spincast Fishing Combo with TacklePak", "description": "The 202 spincast combo from Zebco includes the 202 reel, a 5 foot, 6 inch rod, and a tackle wallet. The 202 reel features stainless steel pickup pins, a star-adjustable drag, ABS housing, and comes pre-spooled with 10-pound monofilament line. The medium action, Z-glass rod has an EVA grip for comfort.202 Reel:All-metal gears2.8:1 gear ratioStainless steel pickup pinStar-adjustable dragABS housingBuilt-in Hook KeeperPre-spooled with 10-pound lineWhat's in the Box?Zebco 202 reel pre-spooled with 10-pound line, 5-foot, 6-inch medium action Z-glass rod, tackle wallet", "text": "Zebco Spincast Fishing Combo with TacklePak The 202 spincast combo from Zebco includes the 202 reel, a 5 foot, 6 inch rod, and a tackle wallet. The 202 reel features stainless steel pickup pins, a star-adjustable drag, ABS housing, and comes pre-spooled with 10-pound monofilament line. The medium action, Z-glass rod has an EVA grip for comfort.202 Reel:All-metal gears2.8:1 gear ratioStainless steel pickup pinStar-adjustable dragABS housingBuilt-in Hook KeeperPre-spooled with 10-pound lineWhat's in the Box?Zebco 202 reel pre-spooled with 10-pound line, 5-foot, 6-inch medium action Z-glass rod, tackle wallet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N3D9HXHXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KGRSZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zebco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spincasting Combos"]], "price": 14.83}}
