{"item_id": "B000KIMTCY", "title": "Bodyglide Original Anti-Chafe Balm", "description": "Stops Trouble Before It Starts. #1 because it’s uniquely dry, dependable, reliable, and comfortable, and not the least bit wet or messy. BodyGlide Anti-Chafe balm is the most talked about, most effective skin lubricant. Great for daily use, sports and fitness, and at work. It’s the one anti-friction product used head to toe. Gentle to the skin, yet it’s “most trusted” for protecting feet, thighs and the upper body by marathon and ultra runners, and for more than a decade, the official skin lubricant of USA Triathlon. It's made with plant-derived ingredients. No petroleum, lanolin or other oils. To protect against rubbing that causes irritation, blisters and chafing, it creates an invisible, non-greasy barrier. Used by everyone - from pro teams in all sports, from kids to grandparents, to workers in hot, humid climates who depend on it every day. And it's unsurpassed for helping to relieve dryness, cracking and rash. It’s safe on skin and neoprene (it’s recommended by wetsuit makers), and it helps make it easier and more comfortable to use compression garments. Use it everywhere – hands, feet, upper body, inner thighs, under arms, shoulders and chest (nipples). Prevention is Better Than a Cure", "text": "Bodyglide Original Anti-Chafe Balm Stops Trouble Before It Starts. #1 because it’s uniquely dry, dependable, reliable, and comfortable, and not the least bit wet or messy. BodyGlide Anti-Chafe balm is the most talked about, most effective skin lubricant. Great for daily use, sports and fitness, and at work. It’s the one anti-friction product used head to toe. Gentle to the skin, yet it’s “most trusted” for protecting feet, thighs and the upper body by marathon and ultra runners, and for more than a decade, the official skin lubricant of USA Triathlon. It's made with plant-derived ingredients. No petroleum, lanolin or other oils. To protect against rubbing that causes irritation, blisters and chafing, it creates an invisible, non-greasy barrier. Used by everyone - from pro teams in all sports, from kids to grandparents, to workers in hot, humid climates who depend on it every day. And it's unsurpassed for helping to relieve dryness, cracking and rash. It’s safe on skin and neoprene (it’s recommended by wetsuit makers), and it helps make it easier and more comfortable to use compression garments. Use it everywhere – hands, feet, upper body, inner thighs, under arms, shoulders and chest (nipples). Prevention is Better Than a Cure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B9kozewAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KIMTCY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000KIV21S", "title": "Coghlans Nylon Tent Repair Kit", "description": "Coghlan's 0205 Nylon Tent Repair Kit - Everything you need for repairs to your Nylon Tent. Contains: 2 adhesive-backed nylon patches, 2 mesh screen patches, 2 spools nylon thread, 1-#4 needle, 3 ferrules (1 each: 8.5 mm, 9.5 mm and 11 mm), 45\" (114 cm) shock cord, 1/2 fl. oz. (14.8 mL) Seam seal and a resealable bag for storage.", "text": "Coghlans Nylon Tent Repair Kit Coghlan's 0205 Nylon Tent Repair Kit - Everything you need for repairs to your Nylon Tent. Contains: 2 adhesive-backed nylon patches, 2 mesh screen patches, 2 spools nylon thread, 1-#4 needle, 3 ferrules (1 each: 8.5 mm, 9.5 mm and 11 mm), 45\" (114 cm) shock cord, 1/2 fl. oz. (14.8 mL) Seam seal and a resealable bag for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UOI5qSXAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KIV21S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 5.33}}
