{"item_id": "B000KK3X4A", "title": "Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter, Black Finish", "description": "The Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter fits almost any bicycle without a top bar, including women and children bikes. In a matter of seconds, use this adapter to add a top bar to your existing bicycle so you can store it with a standard bike rack or suspended hook. This adapter bar adjusts from 22-inches to 32-inche so it can attach to almost any sized bike. You can keep a clean, organized garage by storing bikes that won't normally store on traditional racks using this adapter. The QSP-610 features hangers which are coated in soft vinyl to prevent scuffs and other damage. The Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter comes with a 1-year limited warranty that protects against defects in material and workmanship. Stoneman Sports is dedicated to innovation and simplicity and specializes in high-quality lifestyle and sports products. Their expansive product offering includes bike racks, kayak carriers, grilling accessories and much more. Stoneman Sports provides some of the most durable sports accessories at competitive prices and has great ideas for real-life applications.", "text": "Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter, Black Finish The Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter fits almost any bicycle without a top bar, including women and children bikes. In a matter of seconds, use this adapter to add a top bar to your existing bicycle so you can store it with a standard bike rack or suspended hook. This adapter bar adjusts from 22-inches to 32-inche so it can attach to almost any sized bike. You can keep a clean, organized garage by storing bikes that won't normally store on traditional racks using this adapter. The QSP-610 features hangers which are coated in soft vinyl to prevent scuffs and other damage. The Stoneman Sports QSP-610 Sparehand Adjustable Bike Bar Adapter comes with a 1-year limited warranty that protects against defects in material and workmanship. Stoneman Sports is dedicated to innovation and simplicity and specializes in high-quality lifestyle and sports products. Their expansive product offering includes bike racks, kayak carriers, grilling accessories and much more. Stoneman Sports provides some of the most durable sports accessories at competitive prices and has great ideas for real-life applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BLR3QUjGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK3X4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SpareHand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 32.13}}
{"item_id": "B000KK8ZRU", "title": "Allen Company Adult Blade 4 Lens Style Combo Case (Clear, Red, Yellow, Smoke)", "description": "You'll always have the optimal lense handy when you own this Allen Company safety and shooting glass set.", "text": "Allen Company Adult Blade 4 Lens Style Combo Case (Clear, Red, Yellow, Smoke) You'll always have the optimal lense handy when you own this Allen Company safety and shooting glass set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-9PKdi5RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK8ZRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 10.58}}
{"item_id": "B000KK93DA", "title": "Lee Precision Classic Cast Press (Red)", "description": "The largest opening in the industry and the longest stroke, yet handle is adjustable to provide the least travel of any press. Supported by over 12 square inches of ram bearing surface. Threaded die adapter accepts standard 7/8-14 dies", "text": "Lee Precision Classic Cast Press (Red) The largest opening in the industry and the longest stroke, yet handle is adjustable to provide the least travel of any press. Supported by over 12 square inches of ram bearing surface. Threaded die adapter accepts standard 7/8-14 dies", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NkMVnxwsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK93DA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 95.49}}
{"item_id": "B000KK93Y4", "title": "MTM Gunsmith Maintenance Center (Red)", "description": "An amazing value, the Gunsmith's Maintenance Center provides excellent, solid support for gun cleaning and maintenance. Adjustable forks feature non-marring, rubber padding that grips and protects firearm for a solid hold. Gun forks offer various placement positions to accommodate nearly any size rifle or shotgun. Loads of space available for tools, cleaning rods and supplies. When finished with the job, just pile supplies back inside and store.", "text": "MTM Gunsmith Maintenance Center (Red) An amazing value, the Gunsmith's Maintenance Center provides excellent, solid support for gun cleaning and maintenance. Adjustable forks feature non-marring, rubber padding that grips and protects firearm for a solid hold. Gun forks offer various placement positions to accommodate nearly any size rifle or shotgun. Loads of space available for tools, cleaning rods and supplies. When finished with the job, just pile supplies back inside and store.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xfCH-78AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK93Y4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B000KK949I", "title": "Uncle Mike's Mil-Spec MIM Quick Detach Sling Swivels (1-1/4-Inch)", "description": "Quick detachable sling Mil-spec swivel set. Designed to meet the strength and surface treatment standards of the US Military. Set of two 1.25 in swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Mil-Spec MIM Quick Detach Sling Swivels (1-1/4-Inch) Quick detachable sling Mil-spec swivel set. Designed to meet the strength and surface treatment standards of the US Military. Set of two 1.25 in swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BzcCgsriL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK949I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 19.84}}
{"item_id": "B000KK95YC", "title": "ProMag PM108 Harris Bipod Adapter (Sling Swivel Stud to Picatinny Rail) Quick Disconnect", "description": "The ProMag PM108 Harris Bipod Adapter allows the mounting of a Harris or ATK folding bipod to rifles equipped with Picatinny or quad rails. Constructed of hard anodized aircraft grade aluminum.", "text": "ProMag PM108 Harris Bipod Adapter (Sling Swivel Stud to Picatinny Rail) Quick Disconnect The ProMag PM108 Harris Bipod Adapter allows the mounting of a Harris or ATK folding bipod to rifles equipped with Picatinny or quad rails. Constructed of hard anodized aircraft grade aluminum.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31D8A3N9itL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KK95YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 19.48}}
