{"item_id": "B000KKB1U8", "title": "Birchwood Casey Gallery .22 Rimfire Resetting Target", "description": "Gallery Resetting Targets offers hours of shooting fun with your .22 rimfire. Birchwood Casey's Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Gallery .22 Rimfire Resetting Target Gallery Resetting Targets offers hours of shooting fun with your .22 rimfire. Birchwood Casey's Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WkGZADxSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKB1U8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 36.27}}
{"item_id": "B000KKB28Y", "title": "BSA Varmint Hunter Precision Laser Sight & Light", "description": "Fast and very simple way to mount both a bright target illuminating light plus a fast aiming red laser to almost any scope with a 1 diameter body tube. Now you can illuminate your target under low light or zero light conditions while simultaneously directing a laser beam that will denote point of pellet strike. Easily mounts onto any 1 rifle scope with up to a 50mm diameter objective lens. Works for all small caliber rifles and all air rifles up to 1000 fps. Kit includes mounting bracket; instruction manual; hex wrench set, 3V. battery for flashlight & (3) 1.5V LR44 batteries for laser sight; remote pressure- sensitive switch and manual push button switch for both laser and flash light. Aluminum mounting bracket, laser and light bodies, black anodized finish.", "text": "BSA Varmint Hunter Precision Laser Sight & Light Fast and very simple way to mount both a bright target illuminating light plus a fast aiming red laser to almost any scope with a 1 diameter body tube. Now you can illuminate your target under low light or zero light conditions while simultaneously directing a laser beam that will denote point of pellet strike. Easily mounts onto any 1 rifle scope with up to a 50mm diameter objective lens. Works for all small caliber rifles and all air rifles up to 1000 fps. Kit includes mounting bracket; instruction manual; hex wrench set, 3V. battery for flashlight & (3) 1.5V LR44 batteries for laser sight; remote pressure- sensitive switch and manual push button switch for both laser and flash light. Aluminum mounting bracket, laser and light bodies, black anodized finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316W3hJeAaL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKB28Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000KKB2OS", "title": "Coghlans Mosquito Net Single, White", "description": "Rectangular Mosquito Net", "text": "Coghlans Mosquito Net Single, White Rectangular Mosquito Net", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zEVgSxMBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKB2OS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 10.7}}
{"item_id": "B000KKB5PE", "title": "Lee Precision Auto Disk Powder Measure", "description": "Lee Auto Disk Powder Measure designed primarily to reload handgun cases. Used with the Powder Through Expanding Die or Rifle Charging Die. Includes 4 disks to adjust your charges with: Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc. Note: If you are using the Auto-Disk Powder Measure on the Classic Turret Press, remember to also order the Auto-Disk Riser. The riser raises the Auto Disk powder measure higher above the mounting location on the Turret Press to provide clearance for use of the Safety Prime.", "text": "Lee Precision Auto Disk Powder Measure Lee Auto Disk Powder Measure designed primarily to reload handgun cases. Used with the Powder Through Expanding Die or Rifle Charging Die. Includes 4 disks to adjust your charges with: Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc. Note: If you are using the Auto-Disk Powder Measure on the Classic Turret Press, remember to also order the Auto-Disk Riser. The riser raises the Auto Disk powder measure higher above the mounting location on the Turret Press to provide clearance for use of the Safety Prime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jkVLEPnLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKB5PE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.6}}
{"item_id": "B000KKB86A", "title": "RCBS Universal Hand Priming Tool", "description": "The RCBS Universal Hand Priming tool combines features found on our other two hand priming tools into one convenient package. We took the universal shell holder from the APS tool and combined it with the primer tray from the standard tool to offer unmatched performance. The universal shell holder will accept cases from .32 ACP to .45-70 Government. The patented safety gate isolates the primer seating operation from the primer supply virtually eliminating the possibility of tray detonation. The removable primer tray orients your primers for use and will fit any manufacturers’ primer packaging. Includes accessories to seat large and small rifle or pistol primers.", "text": "RCBS Universal Hand Priming Tool The RCBS Universal Hand Priming tool combines features found on our other two hand priming tools into one convenient package. We took the universal shell holder from the APS tool and combined it with the primer tray from the standard tool to offer unmatched performance. The universal shell holder will accept cases from .32 ACP to .45-70 Government. The patented safety gate isolates the primer seating operation from the primer supply virtually eliminating the possibility of tray detonation. The removable primer tray orients your primers for use and will fit any manufacturers’ primer packaging. Includes accessories to seat large and small rifle or pistol primers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ViNb%2Bjz4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKB86A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 70.99}}
