{"item_id": "B000KKD0L6", "title": "Neet Recurve Bow Stringer", "description": "The Neet Recurve Bow Stringer is adjustable length recurve bow stringer that has leather end cups. It has a 380 lb test nylon cord.", "text": "Neet Recurve Bow Stringer The Neet Recurve Bow Stringer is adjustable length recurve bow stringer that has leather end cups. It has a 380 lb test nylon cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415oO5Pr3WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKD0L6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neet", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 18.25}}
{"item_id": "B000KKD1TW", "title": "RCBS Case/Media Separator", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Case/Media Separator RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MnuMIA%2B3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKD1TW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 43.13}}
{"item_id": "B000KKD3G8", "title": "Tru-Fire Patriot Adult Black Release", "description": "The very best American Made economical release on the market. This can be a great starter release or a price friendly backup release. Limited Lifetime Guarantee", "text": "Tru-Fire Patriot Adult Black Release The very best American Made economical release on the market. This can be a great starter release or a price friendly backup release. Limited Lifetime Guarantee", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LEABkaNZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKD3G8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tru-Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 19.75}}
{"item_id": "B000KKELM8", "title": "Birchwood Casey Liquid Gun Blue Kit", "description": "Easy to use, all-inclusive kits are the proven way to touch up or completely reblue most guns. Everything you need for a professional-looking, first-class job is included. The liquid kit includes 3 ounce Perma Blue Liquid Gun Blue, Blueing Applicators, Sponge, Service Cloth, 3 ounce Cleaner-Degreaser, Barricade Rust Protection Gun Wipes, 3 ounce Blue and Rust Remover, Complete Instruction Guide, and 00 Steel Wool Pads.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Liquid Gun Blue Kit Easy to use, all-inclusive kits are the proven way to touch up or completely reblue most guns. Everything you need for a professional-looking, first-class job is included. The liquid kit includes 3 ounce Perma Blue Liquid Gun Blue, Blueing Applicators, Sponge, Service Cloth, 3 ounce Cleaner-Degreaser, Barricade Rust Protection Gun Wipes, 3 ounce Blue and Rust Remover, Complete Instruction Guide, and 00 Steel Wool Pads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413HBngrwsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKELM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000KKEMOA", "title": "Norway Zip Strip", "description": "Norway Zip Strip. Remove vanes with no more damaged arrows! The Zip-Strip has a razor-sharp edge which removes any vane from any shaft, as well as any residual adhesive! Order Today! Norway Zip Strip", "text": "Norway Zip Strip Norway Zip Strip. Remove vanes with no more damaged arrows! The Zip-Strip has a razor-sharp edge which removes any vane from any shaft, as well as any residual adhesive! Order Today! Norway Zip Strip", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317cAXwz2ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKEMOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Norway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 35.04}}
{"item_id": "B000KKENMQ", "title": "Gamo Cone Pellet Trap", "description": "Recommended for use with lead airgun pellet and lead shot only. Do not use BB's. BB's can rebound and ricochet and can cause permanent injury, particularly to the eyes. Use appropriate ear and eye protection and make sure your range has a secure and reliable backstop. Size 5.5 x 5.75 x 7.5-Inch, weight 1.9-Pounds, 1 unit/box. Lifetime warranty.", "text": "Gamo Cone Pellet Trap Recommended for use with lead airgun pellet and lead shot only. Do not use BB's. BB's can rebound and ricochet and can cause permanent injury, particularly to the eyes. Use appropriate ear and eye protection and make sure your range has a secure and reliable backstop. Size 5.5 x 5.75 x 7.5-Inch, weight 1.9-Pounds, 1 unit/box. Lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51v4OkDo6xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKENMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B000KKEOWA", "title": "Kent Type II Adult Life Jackets with Clear Storage Bag, 4 Each (Orange)", "description": "Stay safe on the water with this set of four adult-sized orange life jackets from Absolute Outdoor. The jackets come in a clear storage bag to keep them neatly organized and accessible. A strap across the top of the bag makes it easy to carry. Approved by the U.S. Coast Guard, the life jackets are designed to offer reduced bulk and greater comfort, and are ideal in calm, inland areas.These life jackets come neatly organized in a clear storage bag.About Kent Sporting Goods CompanyOver 50 years ago, the Kent Sporting Goods Company was founded as a subsidiary of Eagle Rubber Company, a manufacturer of football gear, helmets, and uniforms, based in Batesville, Mississippi. In 1959, the company moved to New London, Ohio. Some of the first products to come off the manufacturing line were U.S. Coast Guard-approved life jackets, golf bags, bowling bags, and outdoor lawn games and accessories.In 1981, under new ownership, the Kent brand became a major factor in the Type I kapok commercial vest market and Type II commodity market. About a year later, a small company in Celina, Ohio, with a brand niche in water skis, ropes, and vests, approached Kent and asked them to manufacture their ski vests. This was the beginning of Kent's quest to be a major player in the water sports, marine, and PFD (personal flotation device) industry.Starting in 2001, the shareholders of Kent started several corporations that acquired the assets of other popular water sports corporations and their respective brands. Some of these include Connelly, CWB, HO, Hyperlite, O'Brien, Liquid Force, Straight Line, and Wakekite, all specializing in a full line of high-action recreational water sports products including wakeboards, kneeboards, kiteboards, towable tubes, skis, ropes, and life jackets. These products can be found at most specialty shops, pro shops, and big box retailers.In 2009, Kent introduced two other innovative brands to the marketplace under the Absolute Outdoor corporation marketed as Full Throttle and Onyx. Full Throttle is a premium water sports brand featuring life jackets, tubes, wakeboards, and kneeboards for today's active lifestyles. Onyx is an outdoor recreation brand consisting of rainwear, paddling vests, and inflatable PFDs for fishing and hunting, all designed to keep you outdoors longer.Today, Kent and its controlled group of companies offer a multi-brand portfolio of water sports and marine products. These companies and brands provide innovative, well-designed, functional gear for the water sports and outdoor enthusiasts looking to satisfy their active lifestyle and water or outdoor activities.Kent Sporting Goods Company is located in New London, Ohio.", "text": "Kent Type II Adult Life Jackets with Clear Storage Bag, 4 Each (Orange) Stay safe on the water with this set of four adult-sized orange life jackets from Absolute Outdoor. The jackets come in a clear storage bag to keep them neatly organized and accessible. A strap across the top of the bag makes it easy to carry. Approved by the U.S. Coast Guard, the life jackets are designed to offer reduced bulk and greater comfort, and are ideal in calm, inland areas.These life jackets come neatly organized in a clear storage bag.About Kent Sporting Goods CompanyOver 50 years ago, the Kent Sporting Goods Company was founded as a subsidiary of Eagle Rubber Company, a manufacturer of football gear, helmets, and uniforms, based in Batesville, Mississippi. In 1959, the company moved to New London, Ohio. Some of the first products to come off the manufacturing line were U.S. Coast Guard-approved life jackets, golf bags, bowling bags, and outdoor lawn games and accessories.In 1981, under new ownership, the Kent brand became a major factor in the Type I kapok commercial vest market and Type II commodity market. About a year later, a small company in Celina, Ohio, with a brand niche in water skis, ropes, and vests, approached Kent and asked them to manufacture their ski vests. This was the beginning of Kent's quest to be a major player in the water sports, marine, and PFD (personal flotation device) industry.Starting in 2001, the shareholders of Kent started several corporations that acquired the assets of other popular water sports corporations and their respective brands. Some of these include Connelly, CWB, HO, Hyperlite, O'Brien, Liquid Force, Straight Line, and Wakekite, all specializing in a full line of high-action recreational water sports products including wakeboards, kneeboards, kiteboards, towable tubes, skis, ropes, and life jackets. These products can be found at most specialty shops, pro shops, and big box retailers.In 2009, Kent introduced two other innovative brands to the marketplace under the Absolute Outdoor corporation marketed as Full Throttle and Onyx. Full Throttle is a premium water sports brand featuring life jackets, tubes, wakeboards, and kneeboards for today's active lifestyles. Onyx is an outdoor recreation brand consisting of rainwear, paddling vests, and inflatable PFDs for fishing and hunting, all designed to keep you outdoors longer.Today, Kent and its controlled group of companies offer a multi-brand portfolio of water sports and marine products. These companies and brands provide innovative, well-designed, functional gear for the water sports and outdoor enthusiasts looking to satisfy their active lifestyle and water or outdoor activities.Kent Sporting Goods Company is located in New London, Ohio.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415XCyiO-xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKEOWA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Absolute Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B000KKEPJ2", "title": "Lyman Reloading Press T-Mag Turret Press", "description": "America's favorite high-speed turret press has been reengineered and upgraded to offer unmatched versatility, power and precision. The T-Mag II has a new Hi-Tech iron frame with state of the art silver hammertone powder coat finish for guaranteed durability. Lyman's improved Turret Retention System allows smooth indexing while maintaining rock solid turret support. The new turret handle makes indexing easier than ever. The T-Mag II's six station turret head lets the reloader mount up to six different reloading dies at one time. Like more expensive progressive presses the turret head detaches to easily change calibers while retaining precise set-up. The turret handle doubles as a turret-removing wrench. No tools required. Obtain extra turret heads and have all your favorite calibers set up to reload. The T-Mag II features a \"flat machined\" base that mounts easily to a wood or metal bench. Compound leverage assures a powerful and smooth operation. The handle mounts for either right or left hand use. The T-Mag II uses standard 7/8\" x 14 dies and can be used for reloading rifle or pistol cases. It comes with universal priming arm, primer catcher, and turret handle.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Press T-Mag Turret Press America's favorite high-speed turret press has been reengineered and upgraded to offer unmatched versatility, power and precision. The T-Mag II has a new Hi-Tech iron frame with state of the art silver hammertone powder coat finish for guaranteed durability. Lyman's improved Turret Retention System allows smooth indexing while maintaining rock solid turret support. The new turret handle makes indexing easier than ever. The T-Mag II's six station turret head lets the reloader mount up to six different reloading dies at one time. Like more expensive progressive presses the turret head detaches to easily change calibers while retaining precise set-up. The turret handle doubles as a turret-removing wrench. No tools required. Obtain extra turret heads and have all your favorite calibers set up to reload. The T-Mag II features a \"flat machined\" base that mounts easily to a wood or metal bench. Compound leverage assures a powerful and smooth operation. The handle mounts for either right or left hand use. The T-Mag II uses standard 7/8\" x 14 dies and can be used for reloading rifle or pistol cases. It comes with universal priming arm, primer catcher, and turret handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UpBlPqGoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKEPJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 234.94}}
{"item_id": "B000KKEPOW", "title": "Lyman Pro Sifter (115-Volt)", "description": "The 1200 Pro features the same capacity as our standard 1200 model at a very affordable price. The \"built-in-Inchsifter lid for quick and easy media separation saves you the cost of a separate media sifter. This economic 1200 Pro holds 2 lbs. of media and will clean up to 350 cases per cycle.", "text": "Lyman Pro Sifter (115-Volt) The 1200 Pro features the same capacity as our standard 1200 model at a very affordable price. The \"built-in-Inchsifter lid for quick and easy media separation saves you the cost of a separate media sifter. This economic 1200 Pro holds 2 lbs. of media and will clean up to 350 cases per cycle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OoxVj-iAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKEPOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 55.89}}
{"item_id": "B000KKER0Y", "title": "Champion Redfield Style Precision Sight-In Target (Pack of 100)", "description": "Confirm sight-in groups with this Precision Sight-In Target. Use the small diamond targets in the four corners to test results of various ballistic loads.", "text": "Champion Redfield Style Precision Sight-In Target (Pack of 100) Confirm sight-in groups with this Precision Sight-In Target. Use the small diamond targets in the four corners to test results of various ballistic loads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sUBnVZV2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKER0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 24.14}}
{"item_id": "B000KKESL2", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Galil Style Hand Guard, Black", "description": "Giving the user more control over their rifle is a common theme with our products. Our AK Galil Style Hand guard continues this by having a wider grip area compared to the original for more consistent shot placement. We've also designed this hand guard to allow for better ventilation to reduce barrel heat. If you're looking for an upgrade in style and functionality, there is no better answer than the easy to install Intrafuse Galil Style Hand guard.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Galil Style Hand Guard, Black Giving the user more control over their rifle is a common theme with our products. Our AK Galil Style Hand guard continues this by having a wider grip area compared to the original for more consistent shot placement. We've also designed this hand guard to allow for better ventilation to reduce barrel heat. If you're looking for an upgrade in style and functionality, there is no better answer than the easy to install Intrafuse Galil Style Hand guard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-VKsCapRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKESL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 24.58}}
{"item_id": "B000KKETHA", "title": "Truglo Rib Mounting Adapter 3/8 To Weaver, Black", "description": "Crossbow Red-Dot Sight Mounting Adapter", "text": "Truglo Rib Mounting Adapter 3/8 To Weaver, Black Crossbow Red-Dot Sight Mounting Adapter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P830HZ2EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKETHA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 22.04}}
{"item_id": "B000KKFVRC", "title": "EOTech 512.A65 Tactical HOLOgraphic AA Batteries Weapon Sight", "description": "EOTech's most popular holographic weapons sight, the Model 512 is perfect for people who want the best in close-quarters-combat speed and versatility but don't need night vision. The Model 512 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The Model 512 is built to last, with a rugged aluminum hood assembly and knobbed, tool-free mounting bolt. Other features include a 65 MOA circle reticle with a 1 MOA aiming dot; support for two 1.5-volt AA batteries (lithium or alkaline); unlimited eye relief; and 20 brightness settings. The Model 512 is compatible with 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver rails.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 10 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 1 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 110,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: NoPower source: Two 1.5-volt AA batteries (supports lithium, alkaline, or rechargeables)Battery life: 1,000 continuous hours (lithium) at nominal setting; 600 continuous hours (alkaline)Brightness settings: 20 with scrolling featureAuto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 5.4 by 2.25 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 10.9 ounces", "text": "EOTech 512.A65 Tactical HOLOgraphic AA Batteries Weapon Sight EOTech's most popular holographic weapons sight, the Model 512 is perfect for people who want the best in close-quarters-combat speed and versatility but don't need night vision. The Model 512 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The Model 512 is built to last, with a rugged aluminum hood assembly and knobbed, tool-free mounting bolt. Other features include a 65 MOA circle reticle with a 1 MOA aiming dot; support for two 1.5-volt AA batteries (lithium or alkaline); unlimited eye relief; and 20 brightness settings. The Model 512 is compatible with 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver rails.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 10 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 1 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 110,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: NoPower source: Two 1.5-volt AA batteries (supports lithium, alkaline, or rechargeables)Battery life: 1,000 continuous hours (lithium) at nominal setting; 600 continuous hours (alkaline)Brightness settings: 20 with scrolling featureAuto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 5.4 by 2.25 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 10.9 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NkQtGGf6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKFVRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 393.49}}
{"item_id": "B000KKGQ62", "title": "MTM Gun Vise", "description": "The MTM Gun Vise features a fast, single adjustment clamp down and a secure non-marring hold. The gun forks are positioned high and low giving the option of a level clamp up for maintenance, or a sloped clamp up for drainage. Shotgun barrels are held securely for easy cleaning. Organize your cleaning supplies with the 14 separate compartments, including a small divided tray that slides to uncover more compartments in the base for smaller, easy to lose items. Eleven screw driver bit holders, molded to the unit, are as easily suited for jags and brushes as they are bits. If you pay close attention to the details, there is a place provided (low and out of the way) for holding two cleaning rods. No more trying to figure out where to rest your rod while making adjustments. Made of rugged, chemical and solvent resistant polypropylene plastic, the MTM Gun Vise is made to last!", "text": "MTM Gun Vise The MTM Gun Vise features a fast, single adjustment clamp down and a secure non-marring hold. The gun forks are positioned high and low giving the option of a level clamp up for maintenance, or a sloped clamp up for drainage. Shotgun barrels are held securely for easy cleaning. Organize your cleaning supplies with the 14 separate compartments, including a small divided tray that slides to uncover more compartments in the base for smaller, easy to lose items. Eleven screw driver bit holders, molded to the unit, are as easily suited for jags and brushes as they are bits. If you pay close attention to the details, there is a place provided (low and out of the way) for holding two cleaning rods. No more trying to figure out where to rest your rod while making adjustments. Made of rugged, chemical and solvent resistant polypropylene plastic, the MTM Gun Vise is made to last!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aVRT7o8dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKGQ62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 40.41}}
{"item_id": "B000KKQQN0", "title": "Eagle Claw Snap Swivel Assortment, 20 Piece", "description": "Eagle Claw 20-Pc. Assorted Snap Swivel Kit Strong Swivel Connectors in an assortment of sizes to make changing lures easy. Swivels come in a hard plastic dial case. Your choice of color. State Color. Quality fishing tackle at an unbeatable low price... order yours today! Eagle Claw 20-Pc. Assorted Snap Swivel Kit", "text": "Eagle Claw Snap Swivel Assortment, 20 Piece Eagle Claw 20-Pc. Assorted Snap Swivel Kit Strong Swivel Connectors in an assortment of sizes to make changing lures easy. Swivels come in a hard plastic dial case. Your choice of color. State Color. Quality fishing tackle at an unbeatable low price... order yours today! Eagle Claw 20-Pc. Assorted Snap Swivel Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417l4Rsn6ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KKQQN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Swivels & Snaps"]], "price": 6.25}}
{"item_id": "B000KLZ4QY", "title": "Dive Knife ll, All Stainless with Line Cutter, Razor Edge and Leg Strap Sheath", "description": "Features one solid piece of 420 stainless steel with razor back serrations. The impact resistant sheath attaches to your ankle for superb diving action. A high performance dive knife built for superb action. 8 5/8\" overall", "text": "Dive Knife ll, All Stainless with Line Cutter, Razor Edge and Leg Strap Sheath Features one solid piece of 420 stainless steel with razor back serrations. The impact resistant sheath attaches to your ankle for superb diving action. A high performance dive knife built for superb action. 8 5/8\" overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x5P3ytKTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KLZ4QY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 3.25}}
{"item_id": "B000KOOP98", "title": "Glock Team Cap Low Crown Blk", "description": "Glock Apparel Black Cap TG30004 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Glock Team Cap Low Crown Blk Glock Apparel Black Cap TG30004 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ugn%2B42O2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOOP98.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000KOP5X8", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W K or L Round Butt Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W K or L Round Butt Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310BjNgb3uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOP5X8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 18.85}}
