{"item_id": "B000KOTKFM", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W N Round Butt Conversion Style Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W N Round Butt Conversion Style Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lZQDrA54L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTKFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.49}}
{"item_id": "B000KOTKK2", "title": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves Ruger MKII", "description": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves give you more control and accuracy with your Ruger MKII. Serious shootes agree, Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips give you the real control you need for fast, accurate shooting. The proportioned finger grooves and non-slip rubber of this Wrap-Around Grip give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits any Ruger MKII... will not fit MKI; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves, Ruger MKII", "text": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves Ruger MKII Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves give you more control and accuracy with your Ruger MKII. Serious shootes agree, Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips give you the real control you need for fast, accurate shooting. The proportioned finger grooves and non-slip rubber of this Wrap-Around Grip give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits any Ruger MKII... will not fit MKI; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves, Ruger MKII", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jvvNYgF4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTKK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 24.64}}
{"item_id": "B000KOTN9U", "title": "MTM Pistol Rest", "description": "Because every box of ammo is slightly different, MTM has developed this pistol rest to take the mystery out of each box. The MTM pistol rest is so versatile that it will accommodate a Derringer to a 14\" Contender. The base locks into the fork at 20 different positions. Rubber padding is molded to the fork to protect your handgun. The rest was designed to be used without a sandbag, but they can be used with it. When not in use the fork has been designed to clip into the bottom of the base for compact storage. Made of tough polypropylene to last.", "text": "MTM Pistol Rest Because every box of ammo is slightly different, MTM has developed this pistol rest to take the mystery out of each box. The MTM pistol rest is so versatile that it will accommodate a Derringer to a 14\" Contender. The base locks into the fork at 20 different positions. Rubber padding is molded to the fork to protect your handgun. The rest was designed to be used without a sandbag, but they can be used with it. When not in use the fork has been designed to clip into the bottom of the base for compact storage. Made of tough polypropylene to last.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Iw9rty%2BiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTN9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B000KOTVO2", "title": "Allen Company Burlap Camo Blind Fabric (Break-Up, 54-Inch X 12-Feet)", "description": "Allen Durable Weather Resistant Mossy Oak Break Up Burlap 2563", "text": "Allen Company Burlap Camo Blind Fabric (Break-Up, 54-Inch X 12-Feet) Allen Durable Weather Resistant Mossy Oak Break Up Burlap 2563", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wkwko-r%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTVO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Blinds"]], "price": 19.79}}
{"item_id": "B000KOTZAW", "title": "MTM Sportsmen's Plus Utility Dry Box", "description": "MTM's SPUD1 is a Sportsmen's Plus Utility Dry box that features an 80% usable, top access lid compartment, taking full advantage of what would normally be considered \"dead space\". Using this five-sectioned area, small items are kept organized and available, not buried or crushed at the bottom of the box.", "text": "MTM Sportsmen's Plus Utility Dry Box MTM's SPUD1 is a Sportsmen's Plus Utility Dry box that features an 80% usable, top access lid compartment, taking full advantage of what would normally be considered \"dead space\". Using this five-sectioned area, small items are kept organized and available, not buried or crushed at the bottom of the box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41em5iuFlSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTZAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000KOTZPW", "title": "Lee Cast Aluminum Pro 1000 Reloading Kit For 9MM Luger Md: 90640", "description": "Lee Pro 1000 progressive 3-hole reloading kit for 9mm Luger. Lee Pro 1000 Includes press, dies (full length size, powder through expanding and bullet seating dies), turret, #19 shell plate, Pro Auto-Disk powder measure, and a small case feeder", "text": "Lee Cast Aluminum Pro 1000 Reloading Kit For 9MM Luger Md: 90640 Lee Pro 1000 progressive 3-hole reloading kit for 9mm Luger. Lee Pro 1000 Includes press, dies (full length size, powder through expanding and bullet seating dies), turret, #19 shell plate, Pro Auto-Disk powder measure, and a small case feeder", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418wV48PBfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOTZPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 185.78}}
{"item_id": "B000KOUDQC", "title": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Glock-G-Series 26", "description": "For a demonstration of why Crimson Trace laser sights make you a better shooter, look no further than y our favorite semi-auto. Because it’s here that our precision engineering and repeatable accuracy have really earned their reputation. And if concealed carry is your thing, the seamless integration of lasergrips won’t inhibit holster fit. Or anything else except a criminal’s confidence.", "text": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Glock-G-Series 26 For a demonstration of why Crimson Trace laser sights make you a better shooter, look no further than y our favorite semi-auto. Because it’s here that our precision engineering and repeatable accuracy have really earned their reputation. And if concealed carry is your thing, the seamless integration of lasergrips won’t inhibit holster fit. Or anything else except a criminal’s confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W6a2wHQqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOUDQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 182.93}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVCFI", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W J Frame Round Butt Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W J Frame Round Butt Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WFqUSU1rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVCFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.78}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVE2E", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Dan Wesson Small Frame Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Dan Wesson Small Frame Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LyzWjdeJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVE2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVLKE", "title": "Fobus Paddle FO6936P Double Mag Pouch Universal 9mm/.40 Dbl. Stack, SWMP .45 cal", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "text": "Fobus Paddle FO6936P Double Mag Pouch Universal 9mm/.40 Dbl. Stack, SWMP .45 cal Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UxlBegWWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVLKE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.65}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVN4S", "title": "MTM 4 Pistol Handgun Case Up to 8.5-Inch Revolver Barrel", "description": "MTM's Snap Latch, Four Pistol Handgun Case offers durable construction, reliable snapping latches and a large comfortable handle. Made of rugged polypropylene with a handsome textured finish. Thick foam padding and double padlock tabs are provided for the utmost in protective security. Offers two layers of storage for up to four handguns with barrel lengths up to 8\" long. Firearms are securely held in place with three layers of high-quality, protective foam padding.", "text": "MTM 4 Pistol Handgun Case Up to 8.5-Inch Revolver Barrel MTM's Snap Latch, Four Pistol Handgun Case offers durable construction, reliable snapping latches and a large comfortable handle. Made of rugged polypropylene with a handsome textured finish. Thick foam padding and double padlock tabs are provided for the utmost in protective security. Offers two layers of storage for up to four handguns with barrel lengths up to 8\" long. Firearms are securely held in place with three layers of high-quality, protective foam padding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-3k9ocP5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVN4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.37}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVND4", "title": "Pachmayr Grips For Colt 1911 and Copies (with Deluxe Pacwood)", "description": "GM-ALS Pachmayr's American Legend Series offers you the best of both worlds, by combining the feel and appearance of wood with the performance, handling, and control of rubber. The American Legend Series grips feature rich walnut, finished to an attractive varnish shine coupled with our Pachmayr Decelerator® rubber for a soft controlled feel. We did this by combining the innovative genius of Pachmayr, the creator of the rubber grip and the craftsmanship of American stockmakers. Together we have created the new American Legend Series. Enhance the look and feel of your grip by adding the American Legend to your Colt 1911 today.", "text": "Pachmayr Grips For Colt 1911 and Copies (with Deluxe Pacwood) GM-ALS Pachmayr's American Legend Series offers you the best of both worlds, by combining the feel and appearance of wood with the performance, handling, and control of rubber. The American Legend Series grips feature rich walnut, finished to an attractive varnish shine coupled with our Pachmayr Decelerator® rubber for a soft controlled feel. We did this by combining the innovative genius of Pachmayr, the creator of the rubber grip and the craftsmanship of American stockmakers. Together we have created the new American Legend Series. Enhance the look and feel of your grip by adding the American Legend to your Colt 1911 today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PxvHBcuyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVND4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 38.97}}
{"item_id": "B000KOVNQ6", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger P94 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger P94 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416hH%2BoOUxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOVNQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.35}}
{"item_id": "B000KOW3KG", "title": "Glock OEM Folding Knife Olive", "description": "Glock Field Knife Fixed Blade Knife OD Green Plain 6.5 Polymer KO17378 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Glock OEM Folding Knife Olive Glock Field Knife Fixed Blade Knife OD Green Plain 6.5 Polymer KO17378 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OzoR%2Bw3tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOW3KG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.5}}
{"item_id": "B000KOWDZG", "title": "Simmons Spotting Scope (20-60x60mm, Black)", "description": "Featuring fully coated optics and a rugged waterproof housing, the Simmons 20-60x60 spotting scope delivers targeting results in full brilliance almost as fast as you can punch holes. The powerful, lightweight scope is equipped with high-quality BK7 prisms that work in tandem with the fully coated optics to produce bright, sharp images in full detail. The scope's rubber armor, meanwhile, not only protects the body but also helps you grip the scope in nasty weather. Finally, the scope is nitrogen-purged and O-ring sealed, creating a fully fogproof and waterproof performance whether you're in the field, at the shooting range, or on a hillside viewing wildlife. The scope comes with a hard-shell aluminum case, soft case, and tripod.Specifications:Finish: Rubber armor, matteMagnification: 20 to 60xObjective lens: 60mmField of view: 99 feet @ 1,000 yardsEye relief: 17mmExit pupil: 3mmShort focus: 26 feetPrisms: BK7Length: 14 inchesWeight: 27.8 ouncesAbout SimmonsHunters and sportsmen have looked to Simmons for more than 25 years for extraordinary optical innovation and rugged durability. Simmons' line of riflescopes not only deliver spot-on accuracy, innovative features, and enviable performance, but they're also built to last an untold number of hunts, helping them outperform all other scopes in their class. Simmons is headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "text": "Simmons Spotting Scope (20-60x60mm, Black) Featuring fully coated optics and a rugged waterproof housing, the Simmons 20-60x60 spotting scope delivers targeting results in full brilliance almost as fast as you can punch holes. The powerful, lightweight scope is equipped with high-quality BK7 prisms that work in tandem with the fully coated optics to produce bright, sharp images in full detail. The scope's rubber armor, meanwhile, not only protects the body but also helps you grip the scope in nasty weather. Finally, the scope is nitrogen-purged and O-ring sealed, creating a fully fogproof and waterproof performance whether you're in the field, at the shooting range, or on a hillside viewing wildlife. The scope comes with a hard-shell aluminum case, soft case, and tripod.Specifications:Finish: Rubber armor, matteMagnification: 20 to 60xObjective lens: 60mmField of view: 99 feet @ 1,000 yardsEye relief: 17mmExit pupil: 3mmShort focus: 26 feetPrisms: BK7Length: 14 inchesWeight: 27.8 ouncesAbout SimmonsHunters and sportsmen have looked to Simmons for more than 25 years for extraordinary optical innovation and rugged durability. Simmons' line of riflescopes not only deliver spot-on accuracy, innovative features, and enviable performance, but they're also built to last an untold number of hunts, helping them outperform all other scopes in their class. Simmons is headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FV0BuF0jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOWDZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 113.55}}
{"item_id": "B000KOWE82", "title": "LimbSaver Bull X-Ring De-Resonator, Black", "description": "LIMBSAVER SIMS VIB. Barrel De-Resonator 12052", "text": "LimbSaver Bull X-Ring De-Resonator, Black LIMBSAVER SIMS VIB. Barrel De-Resonator 12052", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PGy9JI0jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KOWE82.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Limbsaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 10.79}}
{"item_id": "B000KPR5TE", "title": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Kydex Open Top Hip Holster with Paddle and Belt Loop Accessories, Black", "description": "Featuring an ultra-adjustable design, this paddle holster is soft, pliable and features air vents for the utmost in wearing ease. Drawing is easier because the body’s lead edge is cut down. Adjusts for rake and height to match your torso height and body type. An excellent choice for both men and women. Includes paddle and belt loop accessories. It rides close to the body at a mid-level height. Near vertical rake for conventional behind-the-hip carry. Can be used as an appendix carry.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Kydex Open Top Hip Holster with Paddle and Belt Loop Accessories, Black Featuring an ultra-adjustable design, this paddle holster is soft, pliable and features air vents for the utmost in wearing ease. Drawing is easier because the body’s lead edge is cut down. Adjusts for rake and height to match your torso height and body type. An excellent choice for both men and women. Includes paddle and belt loop accessories. It rides close to the body at a mid-level height. Near vertical rake for conventional behind-the-hip carry. Can be used as an appendix carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412-g9YbzgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KPR5TE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
