{"item_id": "B000KYOX4K", "title": "Champion Sports Leather Medicine Ball", "description": "Champion Sports Leather Medicine Ball The Champion Sports newlydesigned leather medicine ball boasts a durable construction for maximum grip and control. Made with a thick leather cover, this ball will last a long time and stand up to extreme exercises. A great crosstrainer for any sport, the ball combines strength training, cardio, flexibility and dynamic muscle training all in one. Colors: Blue,Green,Orange,Red,Yellow.", "text": "Champion Sports Leather Medicine Ball Champion Sports Leather Medicine Ball The Champion Sports newlydesigned leather medicine ball boasts a durable construction for maximum grip and control. Made with a thick leather cover, this ball will last a long time and stand up to extreme exercises. A great crosstrainer for any sport, the ball combines strength training, cardio, flexibility and dynamic muscle training all in one. Colors: Blue,Green,Orange,Red,Yellow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PLbDFLZhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KYOX4K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Medicine Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000KZ1GHQ", "title": "Schwinn Prelude Men's Road Bike (700c Wheels)", "description": "The Schwinn Prelude Men's Road Bike offers Schwinn quality and performance at an affordable price. With comfortable and responsive 700c wheels, a lightweight and durable Schwinn men's aluminum road bike frame, and Schwinn road bend bar and stem, the Prelude handles well and is fun to ride. The Prelude has seven-speed Shimano A050 shifters for adjustability so you can maintain your speed as you ride up and down hills. The Promax dual-pivot caliper brakes offer sure stopping power. Aero 36-spoke alloy wheels maintain balance and alignment, and radial-laced front toe clips and straps keep you comfortable and moving on the road.Specifications:Aluminum road frame and forkSchwinn road bend bar and stemShimano A050 seven-speed shiftersPromax dual-pivot caliper brakesAlloy road crankAero 36 spoke alloy wheelsRadial-laced front toe clips and strapsAssembly required", "text": "Schwinn Prelude Men's Road Bike (700c Wheels) The Schwinn Prelude Men's Road Bike offers Schwinn quality and performance at an affordable price. With comfortable and responsive 700c wheels, a lightweight and durable Schwinn men's aluminum road bike frame, and Schwinn road bend bar and stem, the Prelude handles well and is fun to ride. The Prelude has seven-speed Shimano A050 shifters for adjustability so you can maintain your speed as you ride up and down hills. The Promax dual-pivot caliper brakes offer sure stopping power. Aero 36-spoke alloy wheels maintain balance and alignment, and radial-laced front toe clips and straps keep you comfortable and moving on the road.Specifications:Aluminum road frame and forkSchwinn road bend bar and stemShimano A050 seven-speed shiftersPromax dual-pivot caliper brakesAlloy road crankAero 36 spoke alloy wheelsRadial-laced front toe clips and strapsAssembly required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aMCD2LviL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000KZ1GHQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Road Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000L15UB2", "title": "Promate Scuba Dive Snorkel Titanium Knife (4 3/8\" Blade) with straps and sheath", "description": "It is designed by scuba diver's and used by scuba divers, and made of Titanium, more durable, stronger, and also lighter in weights than stainless steel. The ergonomic handle is specially injected onto the tang of the knife (disassembl?e). The corrosion protection on this knife will really impress you, all it requires is a simple rinse and air dry. The butt can be used for underwater signaling.There are two (2) different design for different use: SHARP TIP and BLUNT TIP, available color in Blue/Black, Gray/Black, Yellow/Black.", "text": "Promate Scuba Dive Snorkel Titanium Knife (4 3/8\" Blade) with straps and sheath It is designed by scuba diver's and used by scuba divers, and made of Titanium, more durable, stronger, and also lighter in weights than stainless steel. The ergonomic handle is specially injected onto the tang of the knife (disassembl?e). The corrosion protection on this knife will really impress you, all it requires is a simple rinse and air dry. The butt can be used for underwater signaling.There are two (2) different design for different use: SHARP TIP and BLUNT TIP, available color in Blue/Black, Gray/Black, Yellow/Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417-xIB8L8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000L15UB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Divers' Knives & Shears"]]}}
