{"item_id": "B000L9U4CE", "title": "The Club motorcycle club # MC 305", "description": "The number of personal property items stolen each year is staggering, with the annual property theft rate in the United States at roughly $12 billion, and auto theft accounting for a little more than half of that figure. Thieves are targeting more and more valuable items, such as tools, trailers, ladders, recreational vehicles, bicycles and Motorcycles. Prevent Motorcycle theft with the Motorcycle Club", "text": "The Club motorcycle club # MC 305 The number of personal property items stolen each year is staggering, with the annual property theft rate in the United States at roughly $12 billion, and auto theft accounting for a little more than half of that figure. Thieves are targeting more and more valuable items, such as tools, trailers, ladders, recreational vehicles, bicycles and Motorcycles. Prevent Motorcycle theft with the Motorcycle Club", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MFO918lcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000L9U4CE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
