{"item_id": "B000LC5RB4", "title": "Birchwood Casey Brass Cartridge Case Cleaner Concentrate", "description": "Super concentrate - this one bottle makes over two gallons of reusable cleaning solution and will clean 8,000 medium sized cases. Easily removes resizing lubricant, oils, grime and stains from brass cartridge cases. Restores them to original finish for reliable operation. Helps remove powder residue. Brass Cartridge Case Cleaner is a safe, non-fuming, non-etching solution that won't weaken cases. Reusable - store solution in a plastic or glass container (not metal) and use when needed. Cannot ship to California", "text": "Birchwood Casey Brass Cartridge Case Cleaner Concentrate Super concentrate - this one bottle makes over two gallons of reusable cleaning solution and will clean 8,000 medium sized cases. Easily removes resizing lubricant, oils, grime and stains from brass cartridge cases. Restores them to original finish for reliable operation. Helps remove powder residue. Brass Cartridge Case Cleaner is a safe, non-fuming, non-etching solution that won't weaken cases. Reusable - store solution in a plastic or glass container (not metal) and use when needed. Cannot ship to California", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iS3o01T-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC5RB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B000LC5S18", "title": "Lee Precision Rifle Charging Die", "description": "Lee Rifle Charging Die charges small capacity rifle cases when used with the Auto Disk Powder Measure or Pro Auto Disk Powder Measure. It works the same as the pistol powder through expanding die, except it doesn`t expand the case mouth. Rifle case expansion is done in the sizing die. Can be used on 22 cal. cartridges and up to and including the .308 Win.", "text": "Lee Precision Rifle Charging Die Lee Rifle Charging Die charges small capacity rifle cases when used with the Auto Disk Powder Measure or Pro Auto Disk Powder Measure. It works the same as the pistol powder through expanding die, except it doesn`t expand the case mouth. Rifle case expansion is done in the sizing die. Can be used on 22 cal. cartridges and up to and including the .308 Win.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RJ7SxMxHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC5S18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.51}}
{"item_id": "B000LC5W3C", "title": "Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite Resealable Adhesive, 6-ml Tube", "description": "Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite Removable Thread locker keeps your scope mount secure, tightens loose or worn screws or anchor swivel bases. Specially formulated to adhere to your firearm, this Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite stays secure until you decide to remove the item with the use of some hand tools. Easy to apply. Comes in a resealable tube.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite Resealable Adhesive, 6-ml Tube Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite Removable Thread locker keeps your scope mount secure, tightens loose or worn screws or anchor swivel bases. Specially formulated to adhere to your firearm, this Uncle Mike's Gun-Tite stays secure until you decide to remove the item with the use of some hand tools. Easy to apply. Comes in a resealable tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oKlMNkSZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC5W3C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.93}}
{"item_id": "B000LC601K", "title": "Birchwood Casey Perma Gun Blue Paste Tube (2-Ounce)", "description": "Birchwood Casey offers you the best ways to touch up scratches and worn spots or even completely reblue most guns. It will give a non-streaky, even blue-black finish to steel (except stainless). Perma Blue® Paste Gun Blue provides great blueing to metal that has already been thoroughly cleaned and is free of rust. Perma Blue Paste is slower to darken than Liquid Gun Blue, but will build up a denser finish.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Perma Gun Blue Paste Tube (2-Ounce) Birchwood Casey offers you the best ways to touch up scratches and worn spots or even completely reblue most guns. It will give a non-streaky, even blue-black finish to steel (except stainless). Perma Blue® Paste Gun Blue provides great blueing to metal that has already been thoroughly cleaned and is free of rust. Perma Blue Paste is slower to darken than Liquid Gun Blue, but will build up a denser finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31voHrz03GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC601K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 6.8}}
{"item_id": "B000LC6290", "title": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .40 Caliber Pistols", "description": "Hoppe's 1258 No. 9 Tornado Brush .40 Calibers Known as the \"Gunsmith's Brush\", it has a special spiral-wound design that's highly effective at removing fouling, yet won't damage your rifling, Stainless Steel loops eliminate any bristle ends that could leave scratches.", "text": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .40 Caliber Pistols Hoppe's 1258 No. 9 Tornado Brush .40 Calibers Known as the \"Gunsmith's Brush\", it has a special spiral-wound design that's highly effective at removing fouling, yet won't damage your rifling, Stainless Steel loops eliminate any bristle ends that could leave scratches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419LhEfJgeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC6290.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B000LC64MU", "title": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .270 Win. to 30-06", "description": "", "text": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .270 Win. to 30-06", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510GDHkPscL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC64MU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B000LC655Q", "title": "Allen Company Buttstock Rifle Cartridge Holder", "description": "The clever, convenient Allen Company Rifle Buttstock Shell Holder attaches firmly to the butt of any rifle, and holds nine shells in an easy-access position. Elastic ammunition loops keep each shell reliably in place, while durable black endura material will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use.The sturdy synthetic shell holder slips conveniently over your rifle's buttstock.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.", "text": "Allen Company Buttstock Rifle Cartridge Holder The clever, convenient Allen Company Rifle Buttstock Shell Holder attaches firmly to the butt of any rifle, and holds nine shells in an easy-access position. Elastic ammunition loops keep each shell reliably in place, while durable black endura material will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use.The sturdy synthetic shell holder slips conveniently over your rifle's buttstock.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UkJmKNUjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC655Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 6.18}}
