{"item_id": "B000LC7L3G", "title": "Frankford Arsenal 887335 Arsenal Brass Polish", "description": "Premium citrus scented brass polish that is specifically engineered for cartridge cases. This unique formulation is ammonia free to protect your brass from becoming brittle and won't leave a residue like some other polishes.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal 887335 Arsenal Brass Polish Premium citrus scented brass polish that is specifically engineered for cartridge cases. This unique formulation is ammonia free to protect your brass from becoming brittle and won't leave a residue like some other polishes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OyLme2W8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC7L3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 14.76}}
{"item_id": "B000LC7TA6", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Lead Away Patches", "description": "Lead Away Patches wipe away stubborn carbon and lead build-up. 25 1¼ inch square patches in a resealable clamshell package with hanger hole.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Lead Away Patches Lead Away Patches wipe away stubborn carbon and lead build-up. 25 1¼ inch square patches in a resealable clamshell package with hanger hole.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zsV2sEJCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC7TA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.17}}
{"item_id": "B000LC7WTO", "title": "MTM Multi Gauge 25 Round Shotshell Box", "description": "The S25D-11 is a dual gauge shotshell case that holds 25 shotshells in the down position. The adaptor grid tray is for 20 gauge shells and can be removed to hold 12 and 16 gauge shells, up to 3\". Fired shells, 2 ¾\", fit back in the box, this is important, if you are reloading. The latch has been designed to be opened easily, even with gloves. Color is Forest Green and has a mechanical hinge. Can also be used to organize some brands of 28, 20, and 12 gauge Choke Tubes with a maximum length of 2.7\".", "text": "MTM Multi Gauge 25 Round Shotshell Box The S25D-11 is a dual gauge shotshell case that holds 25 shotshells in the down position. The adaptor grid tray is for 20 gauge shells and can be removed to hold 12 and 16 gauge shells, up to 3\". Fired shells, 2 ¾\", fit back in the box, this is important, if you are reloading. The latch has been designed to be opened easily, even with gloves. Color is Forest Green and has a mechanical hinge. Can also be used to organize some brands of 28, 20, and 12 gauge Choke Tubes with a maximum length of 2.7\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LeiMv73BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC7WTO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.8}}
{"item_id": "B000LC7X66", "title": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Target 12-Pack (12-Inch Sight-In)", "description": "Dirty Bird Targets allow the shooter to immediately spot each shot they've taken, with a splatter of white that appears upon bullet impact. The Sight-In target is uses a large 12 inch-by-12 inch sheet for sighting-in up to 400 yards away. Five bull's-eye targets come with aiming points for open or scoped sights making it easy to check different ballistic loads for more shooting fun. The 1 inch grip pattern and stadia lines make sighting-in easy.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Target 12-Pack (12-Inch Sight-In) Dirty Bird Targets allow the shooter to immediately spot each shot they've taken, with a splatter of white that appears upon bullet impact. The Sight-In target is uses a large 12 inch-by-12 inch sheet for sighting-in up to 400 yards away. Five bull's-eye targets come with aiming points for open or scoped sights making it easy to check different ballistic loads for more shooting fun. The 1 inch grip pattern and stadia lines make sighting-in easy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KoJwKId5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC7X66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 13.07}}
{"item_id": "B000LC84PK", "title": "Coghlan's 511A Camper Egg Carrier", "description": "Coghlan's Camper Egg Carrier is constructed of unbreakable plastic that won’t crush. It has molded handles that make it easy to carry.", "text": "Coghlan's 511A Camper Egg Carrier Coghlan's Camper Egg Carrier is constructed of unbreakable plastic that won’t crush. It has molded handles that make it easy to carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bBXGZ08WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC84PK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 5.87}}
{"item_id": "B000LC9SNM", "title": "Remington Trigger Block Gun Lock", "description": "Inexpensive investment, but invaluable for safety, Remington Trigger Block Gun Locks provide additional security for your firearms. Featuring a hardened steel center locking post and rubber insert pads to prevent scratching, these locks are designed for durability. Fit most rifles, pistols and shotguns. Includes two keys (keyed-alike). Available in single pack and three pack.", "text": "Remington Trigger Block Gun Lock Inexpensive investment, but invaluable for safety, Remington Trigger Block Gun Locks provide additional security for your firearms. Featuring a hardened steel center locking post and rubber insert pads to prevent scratching, these locks are designed for durability. Fit most rifles, pistols and shotguns. Includes two keys (keyed-alike). Available in single pack and three pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W0m4M3%2BfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC9SNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Locks"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B000LC9SVO", "title": "Pearce Black Grip Extension For Glock 36 Md: PG36 .", "description": "Pearce Black Grip Extension For Glock 36 Md: PG36, Glock Model 26/27/33 grip extension. Replaces the magazine floor plate Model 29 fits M30 nine round mags also replaces the magazine floor plate as with the model 36 plus one extension, replaces the magazine floor plate converting the factory magazines to seven round capacity. External locking feature doubles as a contour blending feature completing the lower rear of grip. Glock 27/33 unit adds one round to the Model 27(40 Smith & Wesson) or 33(357Sig) converting the factory 9 round magazines to ten rounds. (legal limit)Grip Extensions are available in red,green,blue and black., Caliber: 45 ACP Capacity: + 1 Grip Extension Finish: Black Model: PG 36, Manufacturer: PEARCE GRIP INC, Model: PG36", "text": "Pearce Black Grip Extension For Glock 36 Md: PG36 . Pearce Black Grip Extension For Glock 36 Md: PG36, Glock Model 26/27/33 grip extension. Replaces the magazine floor plate Model 29 fits M30 nine round mags also replaces the magazine floor plate as with the model 36 plus one extension, replaces the magazine floor plate converting the factory magazines to seven round capacity. External locking feature doubles as a contour blending feature completing the lower rear of grip. Glock 27/33 unit adds one round to the Model 27(40 Smith & Wesson) or 33(357Sig) converting the factory 9 round magazines to ten rounds. (legal limit)Grip Extensions are available in red,green,blue and black., Caliber: 45 ACP Capacity: + 1 Grip Extension Finish: Black Model: PG 36, Manufacturer: PEARCE GRIP INC, Model: PG36", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LoKUiTXAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC9SVO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LC9YM2", "title": "Hornady One Shot Gun Cleaner with DynaGlide Plus (7fl Oz Aerosol)", "description": "Hornady One Shot with DynaGlide Plus is a revolutionary formula developed to rid firearms of malfunctions caused by a buildup of lubricants and grime. The unique DynaGlide Plus formula cleans the actions of firearms and leaves a micro-thin layer of dry lubricant. Because One Shot is a dry, non-tacky lube, it smoothes actions and eliminates mechanical fouling due to powder and dirt adhering to the lubricant", "text": "Hornady One Shot Gun Cleaner with DynaGlide Plus (7fl Oz Aerosol) Hornady One Shot with DynaGlide Plus is a revolutionary formula developed to rid firearms of malfunctions caused by a buildup of lubricants and grime. The unique DynaGlide Plus formula cleans the actions of firearms and leaves a micro-thin layer of dry lubricant. Because One Shot is a dry, non-tacky lube, it smoothes actions and eliminates mechanical fouling due to powder and dirt adhering to the lubricant", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4107v5TTASL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LC9YM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.55}}
{"item_id": "B000LCA6PG", "title": "Allen Company Molded Rubber Arrow Puller", "description": "Allen Arrow Puller. These Arrow Pullers have soft rubber molded handle that grips any shaft, eliminating blisters. Snap cup can attach the Puller to a belt loop or \"D\" ring so you always have it on you. This deal is right on target... order today! Allen Arrow Puller", "text": "Allen Company Molded Rubber Arrow Puller Allen Arrow Puller. These Arrow Pullers have soft rubber molded handle that grips any shaft, eliminating blisters. Snap cup can attach the Puller to a belt loop or \"D\" ring so you always have it on you. This deal is right on target... order today! Allen Arrow Puller", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sReqPI1zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LCA6PG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 7.56}}
