{"item_id": "B000LCGISA", "title": "Mountainsmith Strapettes", "description": "FEATURES of the Mountainsmith Strapettes Detachable and adjustable shoulder strap system (shown with Travel Trunk) Keep heavier loads in your lumbar pack secure against your back for ergonomic carry Strapettes are compatible with the Day, Tour, Tour FX and Travel Trunks Bar tack reinforcements Stainless steel tri-bar for lower attachment Side release buckle for upper attachment SPECIFICATIONS of the Mountainsmith Strapettes Weight: 6 oz / .17 kg Dimension: (L x H x D): 0.5 x 17.25 x 2.25\" 420d Nylon Mini RipStop Nylon Webbing", "text": "Mountainsmith Strapettes FEATURES of the Mountainsmith Strapettes Detachable and adjustable shoulder strap system (shown with Travel Trunk) Keep heavier loads in your lumbar pack secure against your back for ergonomic carry Strapettes are compatible with the Day, Tour, Tour FX and Travel Trunks Bar tack reinforcements Stainless steel tri-bar for lower attachment Side release buckle for upper attachment SPECIFICATIONS of the Mountainsmith Strapettes Weight: 6 oz / .17 kg Dimension: (L x H x D): 0.5 x 17.25 x 2.25\" 420d Nylon Mini RipStop Nylon Webbing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41502ZWp0%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LCGISA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountainsmith", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 20.21}}
