{"item_id": "B000LH38CO", "title": "Pflueger President Spinning Reel, 115-Yards/6-Pound", "description": "Pflueger President Spinning Reel Before you feast your eyes on your next big catch, feast your eyes on all the Pflueger President Spinning Reel has to offer: 9 stainless steel ball bearings; Double-shielded ball bearings in key locations; Instant anti-reverse 1-way clutch bearing; Anodized aluminum spool with a distinctive hole pattern for lighter weight; Titanium spool lip for added line protection; Large diameter titanium ball bearing line roller; Smooth front drag systems with stainless steel and oiled felt washers and audible drag adjustments; Sure-Click bail; Corrosion-resistant stainless steel main shaft and components; Machined aluminum handle with rosewood knob; Spare aluminum spool included; Protective drawstring storage bag.; State Model. Order Today! Model - 6725; Capacity - 115 yds. / 4#; Gear Ratio - 5.2:1; Weight - 7 7/10 ozs.; Class - Ultralight Freshwater. Model - 6730; Capacity - 115 yds. / 6#; Gear Ratio - 5.2:1; Weight -9 1/10 ozs.; Class - Light Freshwater. Pflueger President Spinning Reel", "text": "Pflueger President Spinning Reel, 115-Yards/6-Pound Pflueger President Spinning Reel Before you feast your eyes on your next big catch, feast your eyes on all the Pflueger President Spinning Reel has to offer: 9 stainless steel ball bearings; Double-shielded ball bearings in key locations; Instant anti-reverse 1-way clutch bearing; Anodized aluminum spool with a distinctive hole pattern for lighter weight; Titanium spool lip for added line protection; Large diameter titanium ball bearing line roller; Smooth front drag systems with stainless steel and oiled felt washers and audible drag adjustments; Sure-Click bail; Corrosion-resistant stainless steel main shaft and components; Machined aluminum handle with rosewood knob; Spare aluminum spool included; Protective drawstring storage bag.; State Model. Order Today! Model - 6725; Capacity - 115 yds. / 4#; Gear Ratio - 5.2:1; Weight - 7 7/10 ozs.; Class - Ultralight Freshwater. Model - 6730; Capacity - 115 yds. / 6#; Gear Ratio - 5.2:1; Weight -9 1/10 ozs.; Class - Light Freshwater. Pflueger President Spinning Reel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YTplvZ8oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LH38CO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LH4VDO", "title": "Phoenix 99608 Magnetic Recumbent Exercise Bike", "description": "Enjoy a vigorous cardiovascular workout in your basement or rec room with this recumbent exercise bike from Phoenix Health & Fitness. Boasting a smooth, ultra-quiet magnetic resistance system and a tough tubular steel frame that holds up to use and abuse, the bike is a great choice for beginners and intermediate riders who want to work themselves into shape. The bike also offers eight resistance levels that are manually controlled using a straightforward hand dial, along with secure foot straps attached to the pedals for stability. And thanks to the large, easy-to-read electronic monitor--which gauges your workout time, speed, distance, and calories burned--it's a breeze to design a custom workout for your fitness level. Other details include an adjustable frame for users with different heights, a comfortable step-through recumbent design, and a maximum weight limit of 250 pounds. The bike, which requires limited assembly, measures 58 by 38 by 24 inches (W x H x D) and carries a 90-day warranty on parts and a one-year warranty on the frame.Specifications:Smooth, quiet magnetic resistance for quiet operationHand dial for easy resistance changesElectronics monitors speed, distance, time, estimated calories burned, and scan functionsFrame is 2\" round stabilizers and 3\" rectangular tubingFrame adjust to different lengths for users of differing heightsDimensions: 58\" x 24\" x 38\"About Phoenix Health & FitnessEstablished in 1998 as a wholesale distributor of fitness equipment, Phoenix Health & Fitness offers a complete line of high-quality exercise equipment to the in-home and light commercial markets. Working with a state-of-the-art computer system, the company can offer \"just in time\" delivery and other critical services while living up to its standards of reliability, consistency, honesty, and urgency. Phoenix Health & Fitness develops many of its new concepts and products in conjunction with its sister company, Reflex Design, and enjoys a reputation for delivering quality products in a timely manner.About Recumbent Exercise BikesDespite the competition from trendy new fitness inventions, exercise bikes continue to be popular options for home exercise. They offer the same aerobic benefits of riding a bicycle at any time, in any weather, without leaving the comfort and safety of home. Exercise bikes don't take up much space, require little or no balance or coordination, and can provide an effective workout for all levels of users, from beginners to serious competitors. While the same could be said for a number of other types of home fitness equipment, the exercise bike is one of the few that allows you to watch television or read a magazine while you work out.The term recumbent literally means \"lying down.\" Exercising in a recumbent or reclining position allows the user to have full ergonomic back support, without causing strain on the arms, neck and shoulders, all of which can be common effects of using an upright bicycle. For many people, having convenient access to quality exercise equipment is critical to sticking with a long-term exercise program.", "text": "Phoenix 99608 Magnetic Recumbent Exercise Bike Enjoy a vigorous cardiovascular workout in your basement or rec room with this recumbent exercise bike from Phoenix Health & Fitness. Boasting a smooth, ultra-quiet magnetic resistance system and a tough tubular steel frame that holds up to use and abuse, the bike is a great choice for beginners and intermediate riders who want to work themselves into shape. The bike also offers eight resistance levels that are manually controlled using a straightforward hand dial, along with secure foot straps attached to the pedals for stability. And thanks to the large, easy-to-read electronic monitor--which gauges your workout time, speed, distance, and calories burned--it's a breeze to design a custom workout for your fitness level. Other details include an adjustable frame for users with different heights, a comfortable step-through recumbent design, and a maximum weight limit of 250 pounds. The bike, which requires limited assembly, measures 58 by 38 by 24 inches (W x H x D) and carries a 90-day warranty on parts and a one-year warranty on the frame.Specifications:Smooth, quiet magnetic resistance for quiet operationHand dial for easy resistance changesElectronics monitors speed, distance, time, estimated calories burned, and scan functionsFrame is 2\" round stabilizers and 3\" rectangular tubingFrame adjust to different lengths for users of differing heightsDimensions: 58\" x 24\" x 38\"About Phoenix Health & FitnessEstablished in 1998 as a wholesale distributor of fitness equipment, Phoenix Health & Fitness offers a complete line of high-quality exercise equipment to the in-home and light commercial markets. Working with a state-of-the-art computer system, the company can offer \"just in time\" delivery and other critical services while living up to its standards of reliability, consistency, honesty, and urgency. Phoenix Health & Fitness develops many of its new concepts and products in conjunction with its sister company, Reflex Design, and enjoys a reputation for delivering quality products in a timely manner.About Recumbent Exercise BikesDespite the competition from trendy new fitness inventions, exercise bikes continue to be popular options for home exercise. They offer the same aerobic benefits of riding a bicycle at any time, in any weather, without leaving the comfort and safety of home. Exercise bikes don't take up much space, require little or no balance or coordination, and can provide an effective workout for all levels of users, from beginners to serious competitors. While the same could be said for a number of other types of home fitness equipment, the exercise bike is one of the few that allows you to watch television or read a magazine while you work out.The term recumbent literally means \"lying down.\" Exercising in a recumbent or reclining position allows the user to have full ergonomic back support, without causing strain on the arms, neck and shoulders, all of which can be common effects of using an upright bicycle. For many people, having convenient access to quality exercise equipment is critical to sticking with a long-term exercise program.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4123GDP5HGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LH4VDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Phoenix", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 215.39}}
{"item_id": "B000LH857M", "title": "Under Armour Men's Performance Jockstrap with Cup Pocket", "description": "The Under Armour® athletic supporter is a versatile must-have protection piece underneath any athlete's gear. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Double-darted cup pocket for a secure fit. Cup not included. 4.8 oz. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's Performance Jockstrap with Cup Pocket The Under Armour® athletic supporter is a versatile must-have protection piece underneath any athlete's gear. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Double-darted cup pocket for a secure fit. Cup not included. 4.8 oz. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31w6m4aM%2B1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LH857M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Football", "Clothing", "Men"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000LHQZYC", "title": "Thule Fairings", "description": "The Thule Fairing cuts down on the drag and wind noise that your Thule bars make when you're blasting down the highway on your way to parts unknown with a roof full of gear. Thule Fairings are cake to install, and use rubber bumpers and anti-scuff film to protect your vehicle's finish. Editors Note: Please call if you aren't certain what parts you need to install your rack.", "text": "Thule Fairings The Thule Fairing cuts down on the drag and wind noise that your Thule bars make when you're blasting down the highway on your way to parts unknown with a roof full of gear. Thule Fairings are cake to install, and use rubber bumpers and anti-scuff film to protect your vehicle's finish. Editors Note: Please call if you aren't certain what parts you need to install your rack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-dmaOImrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LHQZYC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LHW5VY", "title": "Schiek 425 Power Lifting Gloves with Wristwrap", "description": "The Schiek 425 power lifting gloves with wristwraps are constructed with durable Amara synthetic leather and feature the innovative FINS system on the fingers to facilitate easy removal. They offer a 1/2 finger length and include padded thumbs and palms.", "text": "Schiek 425 Power Lifting Gloves with Wristwrap The Schiek 425 power lifting gloves with wristwraps are constructed with durable Amara synthetic leather and feature the innovative FINS system on the fingers to facilitate easy removal. They offer a 1/2 finger length and include padded thumbs and palms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z3tgLN04L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LHW5VY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LHWPJQ", "title": "Champion Sports Rubber Horseshoe Set", "description": "The Champion Sports Rubber Horseshoe Set is a lighter alternative to steel horseshoe sets. A great test of aim and accuracy, this lawn game is a fun addition to you backyard or P.E. equipment closet. Each set includes 2 rubber mats with stakes and 2 plastic stakes, so you can choose to play indoors or out. The 4 rubber horseshoes come in two different colors for two-player contests.", "text": "Champion Sports Rubber Horseshoe Set The Champion Sports Rubber Horseshoe Set is a lighter alternative to steel horseshoe sets. A great test of aim and accuracy, this lawn game is a fun addition to you backyard or P.E. equipment closet. Each set includes 2 rubber mats with stakes and 2 plastic stakes, so you can choose to play indoors or out. The 4 rubber horseshoes come in two different colors for two-player contests.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416TiqmTtqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LHWPJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Horseshoes"]], "price": 17.91}}
