{"item_id": "B000LIKL5K", "title": "Otis Professional Pistol Cleaning System", "description": "It doesn’t matter if you’re carrying it to fill your tag, for quick-access protection around camp or to compete at the local gun club, you need your pistol to operate flawlessly when it counts. Thoroughly clean and maintain your investment with this system. Contains the brushes needed to clean 9MM, .38 and .45 caliber pistols. Patch cleans from 9MM - .45 caliber", "text": "Otis Professional Pistol Cleaning System It doesn’t matter if you’re carrying it to fill your tag, for quick-access protection around camp or to compete at the local gun club, you need your pistol to operate flawlessly when it counts. Thoroughly clean and maintain your investment with this system. Contains the brushes needed to clean 9MM, .38 and .45 caliber pistols. Patch cleans from 9MM - .45 caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410xcBN404L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LIKL5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 38.95}}
{"item_id": "B000LIOQ9W", "title": "Grabber Toe Warmers 8-Pack 2014", "description": "Grabber Toe Warmers 8-Pack 2015 - Grabber Adhesive Toe Warmers are the perfect everyday solution for cold toes. Thin with a unique rounded toe and adhesive backing, they are designed to function in the low oxygen environment of boots and shoes. Simply stick the Warmers to the outside of your sock, under or over your toes, and enjoy more than 6 hours of warmth. Warmers are standard equipment for skiers, snowboarders, hunters, campers, hikers, birdwatchers or anyone who enjoys outdoor activities when the weather is cold. Warmers are widely used for portable, long-lasting heat therapy. If you suffer from cold, sore feet and toes as a result of Arthritis, Raynaud's, Lupus, Scleroderma, Sjgren's, Myalgia or just poor circulation, Heat Treat provides soothing warmth. . GTIN: 0031626056157, Model Number: TWES8, Product ID: 146583, Model Year: 2015", "text": "Grabber Toe Warmers 8-Pack 2014 Grabber Toe Warmers 8-Pack 2015 - Grabber Adhesive Toe Warmers are the perfect everyday solution for cold toes. Thin with a unique rounded toe and adhesive backing, they are designed to function in the low oxygen environment of boots and shoes. Simply stick the Warmers to the outside of your sock, under or over your toes, and enjoy more than 6 hours of warmth. Warmers are standard equipment for skiers, snowboarders, hunters, campers, hikers, birdwatchers or anyone who enjoys outdoor activities when the weather is cold. Warmers are widely used for portable, long-lasting heat therapy. If you suffer from cold, sore feet and toes as a result of Arthritis, Raynaud's, Lupus, Scleroderma, Sjgren's, Myalgia or just poor circulation, Heat Treat provides soothing warmth. . GTIN: 0031626056157, Model Number: TWES8, Product ID: 146583, Model Year: 2015", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DcXOqK6zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LIOQ9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grabber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 9.35}}
{"item_id": "B000LJT8AI", "title": "Simmons ProHunter ProDiamond Reticle Shotgun Scope, 4x32mm (Matte)", "description": "Simmons ProHunter riflescopes deliver bright, crystal-clear images on everything from rifles to handguns to shotguns, helping meet the demands of serious hunters everywhere. This particular 4x32 scope is designed for shotguns, with a limited 4x magnification and a 32mm objective lens. The scope is made using multi-coated optics and high-quality optical glass, creating the sharpest image in its class. The scope's premium TrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system, meanwhile, stays locked tight to zero through even the most strenuous hunts. And hunters will love the Quick Target Acquisition (QTA) eyepiece, which offers a constant 4 inches of eye relief to encourage fast, easy target locking. No matter the hunt, the Simmons ProHunter scope is ready for the challenge.Other details include a ProDiamond reticle; a raised tab on the power change ring that provides an easier grip and surer adjustment; a nitrogen-purged housing to prevent fog; and an O-ring-sealed, 100-percent waterproof housing. The ProHunter's recoil-proof construction can resist 1,000 rounds from a .375 H&H; magnum rifle or 12-gauge slug gun firing a 3.5-inch shell.The ProHunter shotgun riflescope includes a precision ProDiamond reticle.Specifications:Finish: MatteMagnification: 4xObjective lens: 32mmField of view: 23.6 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: 4 inchesExit pupil: 8mmClick value: 0.5Adjustment range: 70 inches @ 100 yardsReticle: ProDiamondWeight: 8.6 ouncesAbout SimmonsHunters and sportsmen have looked to Simmons for more than 25 years for extraordinary optical innovation and rugged durability. Simmons' line of riflescopes not only deliver spot-on accuracy, innovative features, and enviable performance, but they're also built to last an untold number of hunts, helping them outperform all other scopes in their class. Simmons is headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "text": "Simmons ProHunter ProDiamond Reticle Shotgun Scope, 4x32mm (Matte) Simmons ProHunter riflescopes deliver bright, crystal-clear images on everything from rifles to handguns to shotguns, helping meet the demands of serious hunters everywhere. This particular 4x32 scope is designed for shotguns, with a limited 4x magnification and a 32mm objective lens. The scope is made using multi-coated optics and high-quality optical glass, creating the sharpest image in its class. The scope's premium TrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system, meanwhile, stays locked tight to zero through even the most strenuous hunts. And hunters will love the Quick Target Acquisition (QTA) eyepiece, which offers a constant 4 inches of eye relief to encourage fast, easy target locking. No matter the hunt, the Simmons ProHunter scope is ready for the challenge.Other details include a ProDiamond reticle; a raised tab on the power change ring that provides an easier grip and surer adjustment; a nitrogen-purged housing to prevent fog; and an O-ring-sealed, 100-percent waterproof housing. The ProHunter's recoil-proof construction can resist 1,000 rounds from a .375 H&H; magnum rifle or 12-gauge slug gun firing a 3.5-inch shell.The ProHunter shotgun riflescope includes a precision ProDiamond reticle.Specifications:Finish: MatteMagnification: 4xObjective lens: 32mmField of view: 23.6 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: 4 inchesExit pupil: 8mmClick value: 0.5Adjustment range: 70 inches @ 100 yardsReticle: ProDiamondWeight: 8.6 ouncesAbout SimmonsHunters and sportsmen have looked to Simmons for more than 25 years for extraordinary optical innovation and rugged durability. Simmons' line of riflescopes not only deliver spot-on accuracy, innovative features, and enviable performance, but they're also built to last an untold number of hunts, helping them outperform all other scopes in their class. Simmons is headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NGg33nrCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LJT8AI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B000LJUS4I", "title": "Trijicon NS 3Dot Set (GR/GR) T0963", "description": "Trijicon produces military tested products that are proven to be tough, reliable and best in class. These Bright & Tough Night Sights feature all steel body construction with silicon rubber cushions that provide shock protection for the tritium-filled glass vials that are encased in an aluminum housing. That's what keeps them glowing at night even after thousands of rounds fired. Guaranteed to glow for 12 years from the date of manufacture. Notice the white rings around the glowing dots that provide superior daylight visibility and the extra large front dot for quick target acquisition. Equally impressive, they allow faster speeds as instinctive shooting - and without the need for batteries. You can't go wrong with Trijicon....available for all Glock models and most other combat handguns.", "text": "Trijicon NS 3Dot Set (GR/GR) T0963 Trijicon produces military tested products that are proven to be tough, reliable and best in class. These Bright & Tough Night Sights feature all steel body construction with silicon rubber cushions that provide shock protection for the tritium-filled glass vials that are encased in an aluminum housing. That's what keeps them glowing at night even after thousands of rounds fired. Guaranteed to glow for 12 years from the date of manufacture. Notice the white rings around the glowing dots that provide superior daylight visibility and the extra large front dot for quick target acquisition. Equally impressive, they allow faster speeds as instinctive shooting - and without the need for batteries. You can't go wrong with Trijicon....available for all Glock models and most other combat handguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319KmssxVdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LJUS4I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LK1O72", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 3mm Low Top Pull On Boot", "description": "These easy-on boots are warm and super streamlined, thanks to the absence of a bulky zipper. A wrap-around guard reinforces the toe section and an extended heel is perfect for catching onto fin straps. Though these boots are great for diving, they are also excellent all-around water shoes for navigating rocky beaches or river bottoms and work well in and out of the kayak. Made of comfortable neoprene material to keep your toes warm with glued and sewn seams to keep water out. A hardened insert sole offers puncture-resistant protection so you can keep a sure footing in the rockiest river.Features:3mm neoprene material is comfortable and keeps feet warm and drySeams are both stitched and gluedDurable traction sole; perfect for all water activitiesHardened insert sole for puncture-resistant protectionEasy on/easy off design", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 3mm Low Top Pull On Boot These easy-on boots are warm and super streamlined, thanks to the absence of a bulky zipper. A wrap-around guard reinforces the toe section and an extended heel is perfect for catching onto fin straps. Though these boots are great for diving, they are also excellent all-around water shoes for navigating rocky beaches or river bottoms and work well in and out of the kayak. Made of comfortable neoprene material to keep your toes warm with glued and sewn seams to keep water out. A hardened insert sole offers puncture-resistant protection so you can keep a sure footing in the rockiest river.Features:3mm neoprene material is comfortable and keeps feet warm and drySeams are both stitched and gluedDurable traction sole; perfect for all water activitiesHardened insert sole for puncture-resistant protectionEasy on/easy off design", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412x124ajML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LK1O72.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LLI9G0", "title": "Heavy Grip Hand Grippers 6 Grip Set 100-350 lb. Resistance", "description": "The Heavy GripsTM hand gripper series similar to training any other bodypart-- was developed for athletes who want to take the training of their grip strength to the next level. These high quality aluminum-handled handgrippers are crafted with 50 inch-force-lb torque increments from 100lbs to 350lbs so that you can train your grip by increasing resistance. This will finally allow you to build the huge forearms and crushing grip you have been unable to achieve by doing endless reps with plastic-handled hand-grippers. If you want to develop serious hand strength for a sport, or just want to impress your friends, than the Heavy GripsTM hand grippers are the perfect choice for you! If you're worried about working hard, getting sore hands and possibly some calluses on your fingers, than this product is not for you! This complete set includes ALL 6 LEVELS OF HEAVY GRIPSTM HAND GRIPPERS", "text": "Heavy Grip Hand Grippers 6 Grip Set 100-350 lb. Resistance The Heavy GripsTM hand gripper series similar to training any other bodypart-- was developed for athletes who want to take the training of their grip strength to the next level. These high quality aluminum-handled handgrippers are crafted with 50 inch-force-lb torque increments from 100lbs to 350lbs so that you can train your grip by increasing resistance. This will finally allow you to build the huge forearms and crushing grip you have been unable to achieve by doing endless reps with plastic-handled hand-grippers. If you want to develop serious hand strength for a sport, or just want to impress your friends, than the Heavy GripsTM hand grippers are the perfect choice for you! If you're worried about working hard, getting sore hands and possibly some calluses on your fingers, than this product is not for you! This complete set includes ALL 6 LEVELS OF HEAVY GRIPSTM HAND GRIPPERS", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kSOHJnLRL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LLI9G0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heavy Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 58.95}}
