{"item_id": "B000LNKDEE", "title": "3M TEKK Protection Band Style Hearing Protector", "description": "3M TEKK Protection Banded Style Hearing Protector, used to help protect ears against noises at or exceeding 85-Decibel, provides not only lightweight hearing protection but have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 28-Decibel. Simply store around your neck with hearing protection is not needed. Featuring washable, detachable and replaceable pods, 3M TEKK Protection Banded Style Hearing Protector is a great choice in hearing protection for both the pro and Dyer.", "text": "3M TEKK Protection Band Style Hearing Protector 3M TEKK Protection Banded Style Hearing Protector, used to help protect ears against noises at or exceeding 85-Decibel, provides not only lightweight hearing protection but have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 28-Decibel. Simply store around your neck with hearing protection is not needed. Featuring washable, detachable and replaceable pods, 3M TEKK Protection Banded Style Hearing Protector is a great choice in hearing protection for both the pro and Dyer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vBMBTXTZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LNKDEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 7.96}}
