{"item_id": "B000LNW2OS", "title": "Park Tool TS-8 Home Mechanic Wheel Truing Stand", "description": "Designed especially for the home mechanic, the TS-8 allows accurate wheel truing at an economical price. Accepts wheels from 16” to 29”, with or without the tire mounted. Innovative sliding dropout allows quick wheel installation, no matter what the hub width (up to 170mm). Dishing (centering) is performed by simply flipping the wheel in the stand. Constructed from heavy gauge steel to resist flexing, the TS-8 can be used freestanding or bolted to a bench for extra stability.", "text": "Park Tool TS-8 Home Mechanic Wheel Truing Stand Designed especially for the home mechanic, the TS-8 allows accurate wheel truing at an economical price. Accepts wheels from 16” to 29”, with or without the tire mounted. Innovative sliding dropout allows quick wheel installation, no matter what the hub width (up to 170mm). Dishing (centering) is performed by simply flipping the wheel in the stand. Constructed from heavy gauge steel to resist flexing, the TS-8 can be used freestanding or bolted to a bench for extra stability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Q4RWfigL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LNW2OS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 98.96}}
{"item_id": "B000LOBPYK", "title": "CAP Barbell Regular Solid Chromed Bar", "description": "The overall benefit of a regular bar with its extra deep center knurling is that it allows you to enjoy a safe and satisfying workout. This bar has a capacity of 250 lbs.", "text": "CAP Barbell Regular Solid Chromed Bar The overall benefit of a regular bar with its extra deep center knurling is that it allows you to enjoy a safe and satisfying workout. This bar has a capacity of 250 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21qmFz43zkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LOBPYK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LOEANS", "title": "Triple 8 Brainsaver Rubber Helmet with Sweatsaver Liner", "description": "Our renowned Brainsaver rubber helmet is one of the best multi-impact helmets available. This helmet can be used as necessary protective gear for skateboarding, in-line skating (\"rollerblading\"), roller derby, and scooters. This helmet is not for bicycle use. As well, at Triple Eight we know that sweating while skateboarding sucks, so our techies here listened to our top riders, went back to the drawing board and developed the patented Sweatsaver liner that helps eliminate the smells, the stinging and the eye blurring that occurs from sweat. Our revolutionary liner has moisture-wicking layers that limit sweat drippage, an anti-bacterial treatment to make it virtually stink proof, and a 360° wrap around design so that there is absolutely no liner separation. With our terry cloth construction, you can kiss that itchy head feeling goodbye. Our Sweatsaver liner is standard in all rubberized helmets and pro helmets, and is also sold individually in sizes XS – XL.Brainsaver Rubber Helmet Sizing Chart:To ensure a perfect fit, measure the circumference of your head starting in the middle of your forehead and match it with the sizes below.XS 20.10 in – 20.50 in (51-52cm)S 20.60 in – 21.30 in (52-54cm)M 21.40 in – 22.00 in (54-56cm)L 22.10 in – 22.90 in (56-58cm)XL 23.00 in – 24.00 in (58-60cm)", "text": "Triple 8 Brainsaver Rubber Helmet with Sweatsaver Liner Our renowned Brainsaver rubber helmet is one of the best multi-impact helmets available. This helmet can be used as necessary protective gear for skateboarding, in-line skating (\"rollerblading\"), roller derby, and scooters. This helmet is not for bicycle use. As well, at Triple Eight we know that sweating while skateboarding sucks, so our techies here listened to our top riders, went back to the drawing board and developed the patented Sweatsaver liner that helps eliminate the smells, the stinging and the eye blurring that occurs from sweat. Our revolutionary liner has moisture-wicking layers that limit sweat drippage, an anti-bacterial treatment to make it virtually stink proof, and a 360° wrap around design so that there is absolutely no liner separation. With our terry cloth construction, you can kiss that itchy head feeling goodbye. Our Sweatsaver liner is standard in all rubberized helmets and pro helmets, and is also sold individually in sizes XS – XL.Brainsaver Rubber Helmet Sizing Chart:To ensure a perfect fit, measure the circumference of your head starting in the middle of your forehead and match it with the sizes below.XS 20.10 in – 20.50 in (51-52cm)S 20.60 in – 21.30 in (52-54cm)M 21.40 in – 22.00 in (54-56cm)L 22.10 in – 22.90 in (56-58cm)XL 23.00 in – 24.00 in (58-60cm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NOxtCOPTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LOEANS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000LOFL8Q", "title": "Gold Tip Grip Arrow Adhesive (10 Grams)", "description": "Vanes will cling to your arrow in tatters before they ever come unglued and inserts won't budge.", "text": "Gold Tip Grip Arrow Adhesive (10 Grams) Vanes will cling to your arrow in tatters before they ever come unglued and inserts won't budge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vR3%2BVXXjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LOFL8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gold Tip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]], "price": 7.36}}
{"item_id": "B000LOGYFA", "title": "BallQube Baseball Display Case", "description": "Save And remember that special ball forever! These acrylic holders display and protect. Perfect for autographed balls and a multitude of other collectibles. Holders can be stacked. Baseball not included.Baseball Display Cases", "text": "BallQube Baseball Display Case Save And remember that special ball forever! These acrylic holders display and protect. Perfect for autographed balls and a multitude of other collectibles. Holders can be stacked. Baseball not included.Baseball Display Cases", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FRSWXD4HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LOGYFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BallQube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Memorabilia Display & Storage", "Display Cases"]], "price": 3.85}}
