{"item_id": "B000LVJ2TS", "title": "Pyramex Ducks Unlimited Boxed Shooting Eyewear Kit With 5 Anti-Fog Lens Options", "description": "Clear, Amber, Sun Block Bronze, Orange, and Infinity Blue anti-fog lenses. Also includes Realtree Advantage MAX-4HD neoprene case with Duck's Unlimited logo, microfiber cleaning bag with DU logo and camo breakaway cords in a box.", "text": "Pyramex Ducks Unlimited Boxed Shooting Eyewear Kit With 5 Anti-Fog Lens Options Clear, Amber, Sun Block Bronze, Orange, and Infinity Blue anti-fog lenses. Also includes Realtree Advantage MAX-4HD neoprene case with Duck's Unlimited logo, microfiber cleaning bag with DU logo and camo breakaway cords in a box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IlfbgafcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LVJ2TS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramex Safety", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 16.7}}
{"item_id": "B000LVL5Z2", "title": "Century Men's Century Matchless One-Burner Propane Stove", "description": "This compact stove screws directly onto a 16.4-oz. propane cylinder for quick and convenient cooking. It's a great choice for camping, picnics and summer backpacking trips. The large burner cranks out 10,000 Btus of heat. Handy plastic base snaps onto the bottom of the propane cylinder to help keep the stove stable. Matchless piezo ignition provides reliable lighting. Sensitive pressure regulation lets you adjust the flame to your cooking needs. Carry bag included. Imported. Dimensions 6.5\" x 6.5\". Weight 1 lb. 8 oz.", "text": "Century Men's Century Matchless One-Burner Propane Stove This compact stove screws directly onto a 16.4-oz. propane cylinder for quick and convenient cooking. It's a great choice for camping, picnics and summer backpacking trips. The large burner cranks out 10,000 Btus of heat. Handy plastic base snaps onto the bottom of the propane cylinder to help keep the stove stable. Matchless piezo ignition provides reliable lighting. Sensitive pressure regulation lets you adjust the flame to your cooking needs. Carry bag included. Imported. Dimensions 6.5\" x 6.5\". Weight 1 lb. 8 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416DM0RVZML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LVL5Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 28.96}}
{"item_id": "B000LVN1F4", "title": "Century 14,000 BTU Infrared Heater", "description": "Pressure regulated for efficient fuel flow in cold temperatures or at high altitude, this infra-red heater attaches to the top of a bulk propane cylinder with a P.O.L.-type connection and can be adjusted to give off 10,000 to 14,000 BTUs. Its design makes the heater windproof. A safety shutoff valve automatically cuts off gas flow if the flame is extinguished. The heater is 7.1 inches in diameter and weighs 2.75 pounds.", "text": "Century 14,000 BTU Infrared Heater Pressure regulated for efficient fuel flow in cold temperatures or at high altitude, this infra-red heater attaches to the top of a bulk propane cylinder with a P.O.L.-type connection and can be adjusted to give off 10,000 to 14,000 BTUs. Its design makes the heater windproof. A safety shutoff valve automatically cuts off gas flow if the flame is extinguished. The heater is 7.1 inches in diameter and weighs 2.75 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BHTGZV9XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LVN1F4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Warmers"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B000LVXRNK", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M16-13T Titanium Combo Edge Knife", "description": "", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M16-13T Titanium Combo Edge Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xd6soJzjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LVXRNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 61.42}}
{"item_id": "B000LW1TRU", "title": "", "description": "Neoprene full face mask features coverage of your face and ears. Solid black neoprene full face mask has been lined with black stretch nylon trim. Stretchy neoprene material is warm and water resistant. Patterns are reversible to solid black material. Velcro closure ensures great fit with goggles, with or without a helmet.", "text": "Neoprene full face mask features coverage of your face and ears. Solid black neoprene full face mask has been lined with black stretch nylon trim. Stretchy neoprene material is warm and water resistant. Patterns are reversible to solid black material. Velcro closure ensures great fit with goggles, with or without a helmet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HbTC3ppuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LW1TRU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Motorcycle & Powersports", "Protective Gear", "Riding Headwear", "Balaclavas"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Balaclavas"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 12.98}}
