{"item_id": "B000LXYKNO", "title": "Champion Sports Rhino Skin Dodgeball Set", "description": "When you want the best you want Rhino Skin. Rhino Skin balls feature a tough coating over a durable foam core. The ORIGINAL, non-sting coating is designed and made in Sweden and is so durable, it is virtually tear-proof. The Rhino Skin patented coating provides better performance than traditionally constructed balls, offering ease of play that is excellent for all age groups. Why settle for a substitute when you can have Rhino Skin - the best brand on the market. For top performance, choose our specially designed foam balls that offer a tear-proof and safe play experience for a multitude of games. Our Dodge Ball 6.3\" low bounce ball features our high tech Rhino Skin non-sting coating that is perfect for indoor and outdoor activities.", "text": "Champion Sports Rhino Skin Dodgeball Set When you want the best you want Rhino Skin. Rhino Skin balls feature a tough coating over a durable foam core. The ORIGINAL, non-sting coating is designed and made in Sweden and is so durable, it is virtually tear-proof. The Rhino Skin patented coating provides better performance than traditionally constructed balls, offering ease of play that is excellent for all age groups. Why settle for a substitute when you can have Rhino Skin - the best brand on the market. For top performance, choose our specially designed foam balls that offer a tear-proof and safe play experience for a multitude of games. Our Dodge Ball 6.3\" low bounce ball features our high tech Rhino Skin non-sting coating that is perfect for indoor and outdoor activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d5bNMaNyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LXYKNO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Balls", "Kickballs"]], "price": 55.74}}
{"item_id": "B000LYGKTU", "title": "Kick Shield", "description": "Extra lightweight yet thick enough to withstand full contact kicks and punches. This foam shield is made of extra strong vinyl and high density foam and a great training tool to develop power offering the opportunity to blast away at full strength. Dimensions are 30x15\"x4.5\". Sold Individually\"", "text": "Kick Shield Extra lightweight yet thick enough to withstand full contact kicks and punches. This foam shield is made of extra strong vinyl and high density foam and a great training tool to develop power offering the opportunity to blast away at full strength. Dimensions are 30x15\"x4.5\". Sold Individually\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21iz6-HaeAL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LYGKTU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B000LZNS26", "title": "Caddis Men's Green Neoprene Stocking Foot Wader", "description": "The Caddis brand has stood for quality for many years. All of our products are on the cutting edge of available technology and every wader is water tested before the brand ever goes on the product. All Caddis waders, wading shoes, Jackets, vests and accessory products come with a one year manufacturers warranty.", "text": "Caddis Men's Green Neoprene Stocking Foot Wader The Caddis brand has stood for quality for many years. All of our products are on the cutting edge of available technology and every wader is water tested before the brand ever goes on the product. All Caddis waders, wading shoes, Jackets, vests and accessory products come with a one year manufacturers warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r3FlqBTnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000LZNS26.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Boots Waders"]]}}
