{"item_id": "B000M3YG8M", "title": "Nite Ize F9S-03-BT09 Small Figure 9 with Cord, Four-Pack", "description": "With the Nite Ize F9S-03-BT09 Small Figure 9 rope tightener, you can eliminate the frustration of tying, adjusting and untying knots. Easily achieve maximum tension for securing loads, bundling, hauling. No more stretch cords or cam tensioning devices. Use loop or fixed end systems, easy tightening; easy release. Load rated - Not for climbing. Come in 4 pack with cord.", "text": "Nite Ize F9S-03-BT09 Small Figure 9 with Cord, Four-Pack With the Nite Ize F9S-03-BT09 Small Figure 9 rope tightener, you can eliminate the frustration of tying, adjusting and untying knots. Easily achieve maximum tension for securing loads, bundling, hauling. No more stretch cords or cam tensioning devices. Use loop or fixed end systems, easy tightening; easy release. Load rated - Not for climbing. Come in 4 pack with cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-4mqHsfoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000M3YG8M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000M4D6D2", "title": "Sunlite Bicycle Steel Frame Mount Pump Chrome 16 in", "description": "PUMP SUNLT FRAME STEEL CHROME 16in", "text": "Sunlite Bicycle Steel Frame Mount Pump Chrome 16 in PUMP SUNLT FRAME STEEL CHROME 16in", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21dTlEbC8QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000M4D6D2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 3.76}}
{"item_id": "B000M5W2BS", "title": "Oceanic Ultradry Snorkel", "description": "The Ultradry snorkel by Oceanic remains practically desert-dry, even when at depth. Oceanic`s patented dry snorkel technology eliminates water from entering the barrel while still allowing easy airflow and comfortable breathing. The Oceanic Ultradry boasts of an ergonomic design and drop-away mouthpiece offer increased comfort and reduced jaw strain. Features: Dry Snorkel Technology eliminates water entry without sacrificing performance Oversized purge valve for easy clearing Snorkel retainer included Smooth bore silicone flex tube Comfortable curved mouthpiece Low profile Ergonomically designed for comfort and function Replaceable Silicone mouthpiece/Standard size Snorkel Gear", "text": "Oceanic Ultradry Snorkel The Ultradry snorkel by Oceanic remains practically desert-dry, even when at depth. Oceanic`s patented dry snorkel technology eliminates water from entering the barrel while still allowing easy airflow and comfortable breathing. The Oceanic Ultradry boasts of an ergonomic design and drop-away mouthpiece offer increased comfort and reduced jaw strain. Features: Dry Snorkel Technology eliminates water entry without sacrificing performance Oversized purge valve for easy clearing Snorkel retainer included Smooth bore silicone flex tube Comfortable curved mouthpiece Low profile Ergonomically designed for comfort and function Replaceable Silicone mouthpiece/Standard size Snorkel Gear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V6z5-4F0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000M5W2BS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Oceanic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkels"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B000M7SY0Y", "title": "Mountain House #10 Can", "description": "Mountain House #10 Cans are the \"Gold Standard\" in emergency food storage, with the best taste and the longest proven shelf life in the industry. Whether your camping with friends and family or preparing for an emergency, our freeze dried meals, meats, vegetables, desserts and snacks will keep you fueled.", "text": "Mountain House #10 Can Mountain House #10 Cans are the \"Gold Standard\" in emergency food storage, with the best taste and the longest proven shelf life in the industry. Whether your camping with friends and family or preparing for an emergency, our freeze dried meals, meats, vegetables, desserts and snacks will keep you fueled.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ns7QfTFzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000M7SY0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain House", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 20.95}}
{"item_id": "B000M83J5I", "title": "Teeter Hang Ups EZ-Up Inversion System", "description": "Quick-disconnect locking brackets: Secure the rack to the doorframe, but allow easy removal Do not interfere with the normal use of the door Fit any standard wooden doorframe Standard Gravity boots: One size fits most A Note About Boot Sizing: The Standard Gravity boots are included in this system. Standard gravity boots fit most sizes. The Gravity Boots XL (sold separately) were designed primarily for people with larger ankles/calves, not necessarily larger feet. The diameter of these XL boots is 1 inch larger and the height of the shell is 1 to 1.5 inches taller than the standard boots. Both boot sizes are designed to provide an ankle-conforming fit through two ''fine-tuning'' buckles with micro-adjusting ratchets that fit the exact size and taper of your ankle. The fit accommodates a wide range of sizes, making it possible for multiple users to share one pair of boots. Double-bar system: Easy mounting and dismounting. High-quality finish: Scratch-resistant coating. Door-saver: Protects doorframe from damage while in use. Foam hand grips: comfortable and secure grip. Gravity boots: soft foam liners and flexible shell. Instructional DVD and 90-page book Better Back, Better Body. 5-Year Warranty . 30-day money-back guarantee. Meets all UL safety requirements.", "text": "Teeter Hang Ups EZ-Up Inversion System Quick-disconnect locking brackets: Secure the rack to the doorframe, but allow easy removal Do not interfere with the normal use of the door Fit any standard wooden doorframe Standard Gravity boots: One size fits most A Note About Boot Sizing: The Standard Gravity boots are included in this system. Standard gravity boots fit most sizes. The Gravity Boots XL (sold separately) were designed primarily for people with larger ankles/calves, not necessarily larger feet. The diameter of these XL boots is 1 inch larger and the height of the shell is 1 to 1.5 inches taller than the standard boots. Both boot sizes are designed to provide an ankle-conforming fit through two ''fine-tuning'' buckles with micro-adjusting ratchets that fit the exact size and taper of your ankle. The fit accommodates a wide range of sizes, making it possible for multiple users to share one pair of boots. Double-bar system: Easy mounting and dismounting. High-quality finish: Scratch-resistant coating. Door-saver: Protects doorframe from damage while in use. Foam hand grips: comfortable and secure grip. Gravity boots: soft foam liners and flexible shell. Instructional DVD and 90-page book Better Back, Better Body. 5-Year Warranty . 30-day money-back guarantee. Meets all UL safety requirements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417yef8ZIQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000M83J5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teeter Hang Ups", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 159.0}}
