{"item_id": "B000MD69WS", "title": "Ontario SP24 USN-1 Survival Knife (Black)", "description": "The SP24 USN-1 Survival Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 50-55 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP24 USN-1 Survival Knife (Black) The SP24 USN-1 Survival Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 50-55 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g8X4tfF%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MD69WS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Climbing Gloves"]], "price": 50.0}}
{"item_id": "B000MD7MAQ", "title": "Ontario SP2 Air Force Survival Knife (Black)", "description": "The SP2 Airforce Survival Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP2 Air Force Survival Knife (Black) The SP2 Airforce Survival Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31U9GXbtP1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MD7MAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 35.34}}
{"item_id": "B000MD7VGQ", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Super Swivel with Tri-Lock (Blued, 1-Inch Loops)", "description": "QD Detachable super swivel, sling swivel. 1 in. blue loops.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Super Swivel with Tri-Lock (Blued, 1-Inch Loops) QD Detachable super swivel, sling swivel. 1 in. blue loops.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RYnUCMB7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MD7VGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 11.61}}
{"item_id": "B000MDB4C8", "title": "Spyderco Ultra Fine Benchstone with Box, 2 X 8 -Inch", "description": "Spyderco's bench stones are flat and broad and ideal for honing wide tools like plane irons, chisels, large blades, woodworking equipment, even ski edges. Each 2 -Inch x8 -Inch stone comes packaged in a rigid polymer storage case complete with non-skid rubber feet for tabletop use. The Ultra-Fine bench stone polishes the cutting edge and is ideal for those who demand extreme sharpness of their tools. As with all of Spyderco's ceramic stones, use our bench stones dry without lubricants or oils. To clean: wash with fresh water and scrub metal particles from the stones with a plastic scouring pad and abrasive powered cleanser.", "text": "Spyderco Ultra Fine Benchstone with Box, 2 X 8 -Inch Spyderco's bench stones are flat and broad and ideal for honing wide tools like plane irons, chisels, large blades, woodworking equipment, even ski edges. Each 2 -Inch x8 -Inch stone comes packaged in a rigid polymer storage case complete with non-skid rubber feet for tabletop use. The Ultra-Fine bench stone polishes the cutting edge and is ideal for those who demand extreme sharpness of their tools. As with all of Spyderco's ceramic stones, use our bench stones dry without lubricants or oils. To clean: wash with fresh water and scrub metal particles from the stones with a plastic scouring pad and abrasive powered cleanser.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZPYHIJD0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MDB4C8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 53.29}}
{"item_id": "B000MDB84W", "title": "Bianchi 100 Professional Hip Holster - Size:10A-Glock 26 27 (Tan)", "description": "This inside the waistband holster meets the requirements for deep concealment applications. Constructed of premium full grain cowhide, this design features a high back that provides a shield between the body and the sharp edges of the pistol for comfort and to protect clothing. It is designed to ride at the optimum angle inside the waistband to allow for a proper firing grip. The heavy duty spring steel belt clip provides easy on/off convenience, and securely anchors the holster to the belt. Fits up to 1.75 in. (45 mm) belt widths.", "text": "Bianchi 100 Professional Hip Holster - Size:10A-Glock 26 27 (Tan) This inside the waistband holster meets the requirements for deep concealment applications. Constructed of premium full grain cowhide, this design features a high back that provides a shield between the body and the sharp edges of the pistol for comfort and to protect clothing. It is designed to ride at the optimum angle inside the waistband to allow for a proper firing grip. The heavy duty spring steel belt clip provides easy on/off convenience, and securely anchors the holster to the belt. Fits up to 1.75 in. (45 mm) belt widths.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416tpFGOYwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MDB84W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi Gun Leather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.99}}
