{"item_id": "B000MF2W0E", "title": "Bianchi 7202 Black Nylon 1 3/4 Gun Belt", "description": "Features four part construction, comprised of a ballistic weave fabric exterior, a high-density, closed-cell foam center, a polyethylene center stay and smooth nylon lining. Sturdy, quick-release polymer buckle.", "text": "Bianchi 7202 Black Nylon 1 3/4 Gun Belt Features four part construction, comprised of a ballistic weave fabric exterior, a high-density, closed-cell foam center, a polyethylene center stay and smooth nylon lining. Sturdy, quick-release polymer buckle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HlmdeT3JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF2W0E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MF2XS0", "title": "Case Cutlery 80035 Medium Stockman Pocket Knife with Stainless Steel Blades Yellow Synthetic", "description": "The 80035 Case Medium Stockman (3318 SS) features Yellow Synthetic handles and Tru-SharpTM surgical steel Clip, Sheep foot and Spey blades. Case yellow handle knives are an old Case tradition and Case has been making these just about as long as they have been in business. There is no sign of their popularity letting up. Drop this knife in tall grass or heavy brush and the bright yellow color shines through.SpecificationsPattern: 3318 SS Handle Material: Yellow Synthetic Blade(s): Clip, Sheep foot and SpeyBlade Material: Tru-SharpTM surgical steel Length Closed: 3-5/8-Inch9.21 cmWeight: 2.5-Ounce About W.R. Case and Sons Cutlery Co.W.R. Case and Sons Cutlery Company has been a leading American manufacturer of premium, hand-crafted knives for more than a century. Still manufactured in Bradford, Pennsylvania by skilled artisans using the finest materials and time-honored techniques-this rich heritage makes Case knives the brand of choice for sportsmen and knife enthusiasts, as well as the most collected knives in the world. From hunting and pocket knives to the V-42 Stiletto carried by U.S. Army soldiers in World War II, to the M-1 Astronauts knife carried on the Gemini and Apollo missions, Case knives have been a trusted companion, as well as a tool, for generations.", "text": "Case Cutlery 80035 Medium Stockman Pocket Knife with Stainless Steel Blades Yellow Synthetic The 80035 Case Medium Stockman (3318 SS) features Yellow Synthetic handles and Tru-SharpTM surgical steel Clip, Sheep foot and Spey blades. Case yellow handle knives are an old Case tradition and Case has been making these just about as long as they have been in business. There is no sign of their popularity letting up. Drop this knife in tall grass or heavy brush and the bright yellow color shines through.SpecificationsPattern: 3318 SS Handle Material: Yellow Synthetic Blade(s): Clip, Sheep foot and SpeyBlade Material: Tru-SharpTM surgical steel Length Closed: 3-5/8-Inch9.21 cmWeight: 2.5-Ounce About W.R. Case and Sons Cutlery Co.W.R. Case and Sons Cutlery Company has been a leading American manufacturer of premium, hand-crafted knives for more than a century. Still manufactured in Bradford, Pennsylvania by skilled artisans using the finest materials and time-honored techniques-this rich heritage makes Case knives the brand of choice for sportsmen and knife enthusiasts, as well as the most collected knives in the world. From hunting and pocket knives to the V-42 Stiletto carried by U.S. Army soldiers in World War II, to the M-1 Astronauts knife carried on the Gemini and Apollo missions, Case knives have been a trusted companion, as well as a tool, for generations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TdBlIMJML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF2XS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Case", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MF2YVQ", "title": "Safariland HK-10 Flat Stainless Steel Handcuff Key", "description": "Safariland's HK-10 Handcuff Key has a flat body and is made of stainless steel for resistance to corrosion and maximum durablity under extreme conditions", "text": "Safariland HK-10 Flat Stainless Steel Handcuff Key Safariland's HK-10 Handcuff Key has a flat body and is made of stainless steel for resistance to corrosion and maximum durablity under extreme conditions", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VBLWAm8XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF2YVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 3.49}}
{"item_id": "B000MF2ZLU", "title": "Nite Ize NPO-03-01 Headband/Hands-Free Flashlight Holder, Black", "description": "The Nite Ize Headband allows you to turn your AA, or AAA battery powered, mini flashlight into a versatile head lamp. Never hold a flashlight in your mouth, under your chin or have someone else direct the light for you. The holder is designed to illuminate the area in your direct line of sight. The Nite Ize Headband makes any nighttime task easier.", "text": "Nite Ize NPO-03-01 Headband/Hands-Free Flashlight Holder, Black The Nite Ize Headband allows you to turn your AA, or AAA battery powered, mini flashlight into a versatile head lamp. Never hold a flashlight in your mouth, under your chin or have someone else direct the light for you. The holder is designed to illuminate the area in your direct line of sight. The Nite Ize Headband makes any nighttime task easier.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BnLrMZwgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF2ZLU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 6.11}}
{"item_id": "B000MF49MI", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Single Stack Mag Case Matte Finish for 9 mm, 10mm, .40 Cal, and .45 Cal", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s carbon-fiber composite line, offers single magazine cases for 9mm/40 cal/.45 cal/10mm single-stack mags and 9mm/40 cal double-stack mags. Built-in tension springs keep your magazine secure but allow rapid removal when you need it.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Single Stack Mag Case Matte Finish for 9 mm, 10mm, .40 Cal, and .45 Cal BLACKHAWK!'s carbon-fiber composite line, offers single magazine cases for 9mm/40 cal/.45 cal/10mm single-stack mags and 9mm/40 cal double-stack mags. Built-in tension springs keep your magazine secure but allow rapid removal when you need it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bb1cU7aML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF49MI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.94}}
{"item_id": "B000MF63DG", "title": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Utility Speed Clip Nalgene Bottle Pocket with Speed Clips", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Utility Speed Clip Nalgene Bottle Pocket holds a 32 oz. Nalgene, and similar water bottles (Nalgene bottle not included). The lid secures with a side release buckle and hook and loop. It also can double as an excellent utility pouch! S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing on the outside allows for attachment of additional pouches. Includes (2) #9 Speed Clips. Is available in ARPAT, Black, Coyote Tan, and Olive Drab. The Speed Clip system is the fastest, lightest, and strongest method for mounting tactical gear to S.T.R.I.K.E. platforms. Constructed of a durable yet flexible carbon-fiber polymer blend, BLACKHAWK!'s innovative Speed Clips are the most versatile S.T.R.I.K.E. hardware available. BLACKHAWK! designed these clips in order to eliminate tedious weaving of bulky straps associated with more traditional means of modular attachment. Quickly mount and disconnect gear and rearrange your kit without hesitation.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Utility Speed Clip Nalgene Bottle Pocket with Speed Clips The BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Utility Speed Clip Nalgene Bottle Pocket holds a 32 oz. Nalgene, and similar water bottles (Nalgene bottle not included). The lid secures with a side release buckle and hook and loop. It also can double as an excellent utility pouch! S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing on the outside allows for attachment of additional pouches. Includes (2) #9 Speed Clips. Is available in ARPAT, Black, Coyote Tan, and Olive Drab. The Speed Clip system is the fastest, lightest, and strongest method for mounting tactical gear to S.T.R.I.K.E. platforms. Constructed of a durable yet flexible carbon-fiber polymer blend, BLACKHAWK!'s innovative Speed Clips are the most versatile S.T.R.I.K.E. hardware available. BLACKHAWK! designed these clips in order to eliminate tedious weaving of bulky straps associated with more traditional means of modular attachment. Quickly mount and disconnect gear and rearrange your kit without hesitation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SW%2ByjsKTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF63DG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 23.91}}
{"item_id": "B000MF6426", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Tactical Rifle Ammo Cheek Pad", "description": "Combining the comfort of non-slip HawkTex with the durability reload and instant visual of ammo status. The BLACKHAWK! Rifle Ammo Cheek Pad also features a zippered utility pouch for external ammunition storage.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Tactical Rifle Ammo Cheek Pad Combining the comfort of non-slip HawkTex with the durability reload and instant visual of ammo status. The BLACKHAWK! Rifle Ammo Cheek Pad also features a zippered utility pouch for external ammunition storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aVg4X-lkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF6426.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 27.39}}
