{"item_id": "B000MF7H7W", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Padded Patrol Belt and Pad - Coyote Tan", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Padded Patrol Belt and Pad is a padded belt with S.T.R.I.K.E./MOLLE webbing. It accommodates any S.T.R.I.K.E./MOLLE pouches and is secured by 2.25\" side release buckle with adjustment pull tabs. The belt also features closed cell foam that does not allow water to be absorbed.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Padded Patrol Belt and Pad - Coyote Tan The BLACKHAWK! Padded Patrol Belt and Pad is a padded belt with S.T.R.I.K.E./MOLLE webbing. It accommodates any S.T.R.I.K.E./MOLLE pouches and is secured by 2.25\" side release buckle with adjustment pull tabs. The belt also features closed cell foam that does not allow water to be absorbed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417lHhYjr7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF7H7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
