{"item_id": "B000MF7IGW", "title": "Bianchi Accumold Elite 7928 Flat Glove Pouch", "description": "Bianchi's done it again! Using our patented AccuMold technology, we’ve developed a new line of synthetic duty gear that leaves the competition in the dust! AccuMold Elite revolutionizes the concept of duty gear, crossing the boundaries between leather and nylon holsters and accessories. Even the experts are fooled, not knowing that what they are looking at is not premium leather! AccuMold Elite- it’s nothing short of spectacular! Lightweight - Up to 50% lighter than leather in most applications. Same beautiful look as leather- the crisp, professional appearance of premium leather without the weight, maintenance and cost. Easily cleaned with only mild soap and water . Bio-Safety - Washing with disinfectant soap or bleach solution will handle contamination problems . . . Great for correctional institution duty.", "text": "Bianchi Accumold Elite 7928 Flat Glove Pouch Bianchi's done it again! Using our patented AccuMold technology, we’ve developed a new line of synthetic duty gear that leaves the competition in the dust! AccuMold Elite revolutionizes the concept of duty gear, crossing the boundaries between leather and nylon holsters and accessories. Even the experts are fooled, not knowing that what they are looking at is not premium leather! AccuMold Elite- it’s nothing short of spectacular! Lightweight - Up to 50% lighter than leather in most applications. Same beautiful look as leather- the crisp, professional appearance of premium leather without the weight, maintenance and cost. Easily cleaned with only mild soap and water . Bio-Safety - Washing with disinfectant soap or bleach solution will handle contamination problems . . . Great for correctional institution duty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ENBVSI-QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF7IGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi AccuMold Elite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.59}}
{"item_id": "B000MF7O2A", "title": "Uncle Mikes Quick Detachable Push Button 1-Inch Sling Swivels, Pair", "description": "Now easier to install, more versatile. Special flush-mount front and rear bases for stud-free profile when sling & swivels removed. Bases glue in place, no screws required. Set No. 1011-2 (1) .", "text": "Uncle Mikes Quick Detachable Push Button 1-Inch Sling Swivels, Pair Now easier to install, more versatile. Special flush-mount front and rear bases for stud-free profile when sling & swivels removed. Bases glue in place, no screws required. Set No. 1011-2 (1) .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k5PnMWznL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MF7O2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 17.06}}
{"item_id": "B000MFCZOC", "title": "Speedo Junior Vanquisher Optical Swim Goggle", "description": "This goggle has the same comfortable fit as the other Vanquisher models with the added advantage of a corrective lens goggle. If you are having a tough time reading the start clock during your swims these goggles will help. Think of them as reading glasses for swimming. The hypoallergenic soft silicone seals combined with a double headstrap make this goggle both comfortable and secure. The Polycarbonate lens will give you UV protection from the dangerous suns rays while the anti-fog coating ensures clear fog-free vision.", "text": "Speedo Junior Vanquisher Optical Swim Goggle This goggle has the same comfortable fit as the other Vanquisher models with the added advantage of a corrective lens goggle. If you are having a tough time reading the start clock during your swims these goggles will help. Think of them as reading glasses for swimming. The hypoallergenic soft silicone seals combined with a double headstrap make this goggle both comfortable and secure. The Polycarbonate lens will give you UV protection from the dangerous suns rays while the anti-fog coating ensures clear fog-free vision.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DNX7O8xxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MFCZOC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MFD1B8", "title": "Speedo Neo Fin Socks", "description": "The Speedo Neo Fin Sock is the answer to sore feet due to extensive fin use. The neoprene construction is soft and will prevent blistering and chafing while also supplying warmth.", "text": "Speedo Neo Fin Socks The Speedo Neo Fin Sock is the answer to sore feet due to extensive fin use. The neoprene construction is soft and will prevent blistering and chafing while also supplying warmth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41REZvEsC7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MFD1B8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Surfing Booties"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MFD1ZE", "title": "Speedo Lycra Swim Cap", "description": "The Speedo lycra cap is a great choice for the swimmer with long hair. It has an elastic band at the base that ensures a secure fit during any workout. It is made of the same high quality fast-drying lycra used in racing suits to ensure durability.", "text": "Speedo Lycra Swim Cap The Speedo lycra cap is a great choice for the swimmer with long hair. It has an elastic band at the base that ensures a secure fit during any workout. It is made of the same high quality fast-drying lycra used in racing suits to ensure durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uNW7iDEEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MFD1ZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 10.2}}
{"item_id": "B000MFF008", "title": "Speedo Junior Silicone Swim Cap", "description": "This Speedo silicone cap is designed specifically to fit the smaller swimmer. Because it is made of silicone, it is very lightweight and durable. It is also very quick and easy to take on and off without snagging hair", "text": "Speedo Junior Silicone Swim Cap This Speedo silicone cap is designed specifically to fit the smaller swimmer. Because it is made of silicone, it is very lightweight and durable. It is also very quick and easy to take on and off without snagging hair", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NC8%2BWmtYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MFF008.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 7.95}}
