{"item_id": "B000MGGT66", "title": "Energizer 6 LED Headlight", "description": "The lights modes on the Energizer Industrial 6-LED Headlight allow you to tackle different projects with ease. White flood covers a larger, wider space with strong bright light. White area covers more space with a softer bright light. Spot and red night vision modes help with specific tasks. This headlight pivots and locks into place up to 90 degrees to focus light where you need it most.", "text": "Energizer 6 LED Headlight The lights modes on the Energizer Industrial 6-LED Headlight allow you to tackle different projects with ease. White flood covers a larger, wider space with strong bright light. White area covers more space with a softer bright light. Spot and red night vision modes help with specific tasks. This headlight pivots and locks into place up to 90 degrees to focus light where you need it most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YtDcGo2UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MGGT66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Industrial", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 17.31}}
{"item_id": "B000MGWARS", "title": "ATI SKS Fiberforce Gun Stock", "description": "The SKS Fiberforce Gun Stock is the ultimate in military styling with the exclusive Fiberforce Dragunov Design. Features included, ventilated forearm, dowel sling mount, thumbhole grip, adjustable cheeckrest with room to store cleaning kit, Dupont extreme temperature Glass reinforced polymer and can be used both right or left hand. Fits all SKS Rifles. Please note that the SKS scope mounts are sold separately.", "text": "ATI SKS Fiberforce Gun Stock The SKS Fiberforce Gun Stock is the ultimate in military styling with the exclusive Fiberforce Dragunov Design. Features included, ventilated forearm, dowel sling mount, thumbhole grip, adjustable cheeckrest with room to store cleaning kit, Dupont extreme temperature Glass reinforced polymer and can be used both right or left hand. Fits all SKS Rifles. Please note that the SKS scope mounts are sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jMf9CSGJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MGWARS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 61.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MH4CN2", "title": "HiMart Flashlight and Laser Sight Mount with Barrel Adapter", "description": "Designed to install a Flashlight or Laser Sight onto the Rifle BarrelSuitable for 25mm Flashlight & Laser Sight Tube mounting needFlashlight Mount can also be installed on standard weaver rail aloneFully adjustable with nuts & screws includedGreat look for attaching onto rifle scope with extra accessories installedComplete solution for Mounting Flashlight & Laser Sight on rifleConstructed of Full Metal Material, extra Strong Shock Absorption abilityMatte Black Finish look so COOL on any rifleWeight: 84.5gRing Diameter: 25mmRail Type: 20mm Weaver Standard RailBuilt Material: Aluminum AlloyColor: Matte BlackIncludes1 x Flashlight Laser Mount Surefire for Gun/Rifle/Shotgun1 x Allen Key1 x HiMart Logo Random Color Ribbon", "text": "HiMart Flashlight and Laser Sight Mount with Barrel Adapter Designed to install a Flashlight or Laser Sight onto the Rifle BarrelSuitable for 25mm Flashlight & Laser Sight Tube mounting needFlashlight Mount can also be installed on standard weaver rail aloneFully adjustable with nuts & screws includedGreat look for attaching onto rifle scope with extra accessories installedComplete solution for Mounting Flashlight & Laser Sight on rifleConstructed of Full Metal Material, extra Strong Shock Absorption abilityMatte Black Finish look so COOL on any rifleWeight: 84.5gRing Diameter: 25mmRail Type: 20mm Weaver Standard RailBuilt Material: Aluminum AlloyColor: Matte BlackIncludes1 x Flashlight Laser Mount Surefire for Gun/Rifle/Shotgun1 x Allen Key1 x HiMart Logo Random Color Ribbon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ewi9Zs8FL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MH4CN2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunclear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 4.18}}
{"item_id": "B000MI5BA4", "title": "27\" Full Tang Black Blade Fantasy Ninja Sword w/ Sheath", "description": "Full Tang Black Blade Ninja Warrior Sword Serrated W/ Sheath. The blade is painted black to blend into the shadows, and is light weight for fast accurate swings. The sword comes already sharpened and also features three blood grooves. The construction of the blade is unique with its aggressive false edge at the top of the blade and serrated points a the base of the blade.", "text": "27\" Full Tang Black Blade Fantasy Ninja Sword w/ Sheath Full Tang Black Blade Ninja Warrior Sword Serrated W/ Sheath. The blade is painted black to blend into the shadows, and is light weight for fast accurate swings. The sword comes already sharpened and also features three blood grooves. The construction of the blade is unique with its aggressive false edge at the top of the blade and serrated points a the base of the blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F7kMYCE8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MI5BA4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Acemas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 15.87}}
{"item_id": "B000MIH5MQ", "title": "Allen Company Endura Locking Handgun Case", "description": "This rug has a unique locking mechanism. The zipper has a lock (two keys included) built into it. When locked, the zipper cannot be opened. This is a minimum security feature, designed to keep the curious out. It is not California DOJ approved. Fits handguns having an overall length of 11-Inch or less. Padded, Endura nylon on the outside, with Tyvek lining on the inside. The zipper runs along the length of the top two sides. Made in USA by Allen Case Co.", "text": "Allen Company Endura Locking Handgun Case This rug has a unique locking mechanism. The zipper has a lock (two keys included) built into it. When locked, the zipper cannot be opened. This is a minimum security feature, designed to keep the curious out. It is not California DOJ approved. Fits handguns having an overall length of 11-Inch or less. Padded, Endura nylon on the outside, with Tyvek lining on the inside. The zipper runs along the length of the top two sides. Made in USA by Allen Case Co.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RWohyGowL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MIH5MQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]]}}
