{"item_id": "B000MJ11TI", "title": "Delta El Greco Ceiling Hoist", "description": "Easily store your bike, kayak, or ladder in an out-of-the-way location with the Delta El Greco ceiling host. Engineered for long and durable performance, the El Greco features a proven pulley system that helps you lift and lower heavier objects. As a result, it's a breeze to store your obstructive objects off the floor, where you'll never worry about them until needed. The El Greco also includes a clever auto-locking mechanism that prevents accidental release. The ceiling hoist holds up to 50 pounds, fits on ceilings up to 14 feet, and carries a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Delta El Greco Ceiling Hoist Easily store your bike, kayak, or ladder in an out-of-the-way location with the Delta El Greco ceiling host. Engineered for long and durable performance, the El Greco features a proven pulley system that helps you lift and lower heavier objects. As a result, it's a breeze to store your obstructive objects off the floor, where you'll never worry about them until needed. The El Greco also includes a clever auto-locking mechanism that prevents accidental release. The ceiling hoist holds up to 50 pounds, fits on ceilings up to 14 feet, and carries a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211EItfRYPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MJ11TI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 30.16}}
{"item_id": "B000MJKKKO", "title": "Taylor Made Products Pontoon Boat Rail Fender Pack of 4 Adjuster", "description": "A fender adjuster designed specifically for the 1 square tube rails of pontoon boats. The mounting structure clamps securely to square tubing yet can be repositioned quickly and easily. Made from quality marine grade components - simple height adjustment for lines up to 5/8.", "text": "Taylor Made Products Pontoon Boat Rail Fender Pack of 4 Adjuster A fender adjuster designed specifically for the 1 square tube rails of pontoon boats. The mounting structure clamps securely to square tubing yet can be repositioned quickly and easily. Made from quality marine grade components - simple height adjustment for lines up to 5/8.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ETwv2CJWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MJKKKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taylor Made Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Boat Fenders"]], "price": 16.89}}
