{"item_id": "B000ML7TYW", "title": "Coghlan's Folding Shovel", "description": "The Folding Shovel is ony 10\" folded up so it fits into any pack. Its 23\" open which makes it easy to use. The blade is a tempered forged steel pointed for easy digging. Another must for the camping list.", "text": "Coghlan's Folding Shovel The Folding Shovel is ony 10\" folded up so it fits into any pack. Its 23\" open which makes it easy to use. The blade is a tempered forged steel pointed for easy digging. Another must for the camping list.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MUbNeREZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ML7TYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 12.71}}
{"item_id": "B000ML90T4", "title": "Allen Company Yukon Neoprene Shotgun Sling (Break-Up)", "description": "Allen Yukon Neoprene Sling. Comfortable, breathable Neoprene Sling shoulders the load! Features thumb ring loop, and shotshell loops. Order Today! Allen Yukon Neoprene Sling with Shotshell / Thumb Loops, Mossy Oak Break-up", "text": "Allen Company Yukon Neoprene Shotgun Sling (Break-Up) Allen Yukon Neoprene Sling. Comfortable, breathable Neoprene Sling shoulders the load! Features thumb ring loop, and shotshell loops. Order Today! Allen Yukon Neoprene Sling with Shotshell / Thumb Loops, Mossy Oak Break-up", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3129sg4sS3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ML90T4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 13.96}}
{"item_id": "B000ML9J86", "title": "RCBS Rangemaster 750 Scale 9v-dc / 110V-AC", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Rangemaster 750 Scale 9v-dc / 110V-AC RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414yqVhvEJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ML9J86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 138.8}}
{"item_id": "B000MLU8PE", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Super Tinker Pocket Knife", "description": "In 1884, Master Cutler Karl Elsener started his cutlery factory in the small village of Ibach, Switzerland. In 1897, he crafted the Victorinox Original Swiss Army Knife. Since that time, the Elsener family has continued to craft tools in the Victorinox tradition of in genius design, durability, and quality. This is why all Victorinox multi-tools, made of first class stainless steel, are guaranteed a lifetime against defects in material and workmanship. REMEMBER, If it doesn't say Victorinox, it's not the Original Swiss Army Knife.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Super Tinker Pocket Knife In 1884, Master Cutler Karl Elsener started his cutlery factory in the small village of Ibach, Switzerland. In 1897, he crafted the Victorinox Original Swiss Army Knife. Since that time, the Elsener family has continued to craft tools in the Victorinox tradition of in genius design, durability, and quality. This is why all Victorinox multi-tools, made of first class stainless steel, are guaranteed a lifetime against defects in material and workmanship. REMEMBER, If it doesn't say Victorinox, it's not the Original Swiss Army Knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LtMXH0T8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MLU8PE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 29.95}}
