{"item_id": "B000MNJC4A", "title": "MicroNet Suede Ultra-Compact Microfiber Towel", "description": "MicroNet's high density microfiber weave is an aggressive yet soft cleaner, gently removing oil, dirt and perspiration from hands, face and body. An ideal medical towel, blanket, bandana, cleaning cloth, sling or wrap. Includes deluxe wet/dry bag with 2 zippered compartments. 20 x 40-Inch", "text": "MicroNet Suede Ultra-Compact Microfiber Towel MicroNet's high density microfiber weave is an aggressive yet soft cleaner, gently removing oil, dirt and perspiration from hands, face and body. An ideal medical towel, blanket, bandana, cleaning cloth, sling or wrap. Includes deluxe wet/dry bag with 2 zippered compartments. 20 x 40-Inch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q-boI7QVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MNJC4A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
