{"item_id": "B000MNN8DG", "title": "HOMAK HS10036683 Electronic Access Pistol Box, 10 X 3.5 X 7.5 Inch", "description": "Whether you're a law-enforcement professional, an avid gun collector, a parent of a young child, or all of the above, the Homak HS10036683 Small Pistol Box is a smart, safe choice that protects your gun and your family. Built tough, with an electronic locking system, the HS10036683 gives you true peace of mind.The Homak Small Pistol Box can be mounted inside a closet or a drawer.HS10036683 Small Pistol BoxAt a Glance:Prevents unauthorized access to your handgunPatented design resists pryingElectronic key padMade of heavy-duty powder-coated steelIncludes rubber mat to protect gunOne-year warrantySteel Construction and Coded Entry for Optimum ProtectionBoasting Homak's patented design that offers optimum durability and security, the HS10036683 features heavy-duty powdered steel construction that resists wear and tear. This tough pistol box will prevent unauthorized access to your valuables, yet is easily accessible via a keyless quick-access code. Simply type in your personalized digits and the box will open.Protects Young ChildrenThe HS10036683 is ideal for homes with young children. It allows adults quick and easy access to a handgun, yet it resists any attempts by curious children to open it. In fact, the unit will go into a timed lockout mode if the password is entered incorrectly too many times in a row.Theft-Proof, Patented DesignTo help prevent thieves from prying open the unit, the HS10036683's door has rounded corners and it closes flush. Also, its small size allows for multiple mounting options, and the included rubber mat fits the interior to help prevent scuffs and scratches on the gun.And because the HS10036683 is battery powered, with battery terminals conveniently located on the front, you won't have to worry about a power outage cutting off access to your handgun.Dimensions and Warranty InformationThe HS10036683 measures 10.0 x 3.5 x 7.5 inches (WxHxD), weighs 10 pounds, and is backed by a one-year warranty against manufacturing defects.What's in the BoxHS10036683 Small Pistol Box and rubber mat.", "text": "HOMAK HS10036683 Electronic Access Pistol Box, 10 X 3.5 X 7.5 Inch Whether you're a law-enforcement professional, an avid gun collector, a parent of a young child, or all of the above, the Homak HS10036683 Small Pistol Box is a smart, safe choice that protects your gun and your family. Built tough, with an electronic locking system, the HS10036683 gives you true peace of mind.The Homak Small Pistol Box can be mounted inside a closet or a drawer.HS10036683 Small Pistol BoxAt a Glance:Prevents unauthorized access to your handgunPatented design resists pryingElectronic key padMade of heavy-duty powder-coated steelIncludes rubber mat to protect gunOne-year warrantySteel Construction and Coded Entry for Optimum ProtectionBoasting Homak's patented design that offers optimum durability and security, the HS10036683 features heavy-duty powdered steel construction that resists wear and tear. This tough pistol box will prevent unauthorized access to your valuables, yet is easily accessible via a keyless quick-access code. Simply type in your personalized digits and the box will open.Protects Young ChildrenThe HS10036683 is ideal for homes with young children. It allows adults quick and easy access to a handgun, yet it resists any attempts by curious children to open it. In fact, the unit will go into a timed lockout mode if the password is entered incorrectly too many times in a row.Theft-Proof, Patented DesignTo help prevent thieves from prying open the unit, the HS10036683's door has rounded corners and it closes flush. Also, its small size allows for multiple mounting options, and the included rubber mat fits the interior to help prevent scuffs and scratches on the gun.And because the HS10036683 is battery powered, with battery terminals conveniently located on the front, you won't have to worry about a power outage cutting off access to your handgun.Dimensions and Warranty InformationThe HS10036683 measures 10.0 x 3.5 x 7.5 inches (WxHxD), weighs 10 pounds, and is backed by a one-year warranty against manufacturing defects.What's in the BoxHS10036683 Small Pistol Box and rubber mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FikBUlAQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MNN8DG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 45.79}}
{"item_id": "B000MOGSUK", "title": "RCBS 20515 Carbide Die Set, 9MMLUGER/9x21/9x23", "description": "Carbide Die Sets consist of a Carbide Sizer Die with Decapping Unit, Expander Die for expanding and belling the case mouth, plus a Seater Die with Roll or Taper Crimp and Bullet Seater Plug. RCBS has over 60 years of precision die making under their belt. And the industry’s most experienced die craftsmen working under their roof. These craftsmen, following rigid RCBS specifications developed over many years, produce more reloading dies in more calibers (over 3,300!) than any other reloading die manufacturer. RCBS Precisioneered Reloading Dies are for shooters who demand reloads equal to the quality of their guns. Each RCBS Die is made from case hardened steel. The inside surfaces of all RCBS Precisioneered Dies are precision-drilled and reamed to the same exacting standards as the finest gun mechanisms. Full-Length Sizer Dies for bottleneck cases have vents to prevent case damage caused by trapped air and for excessive lubricant. Headspace is held to minimum tolerances to avoid changing the case body length during full length sizing. Each RCBS Die is properly hardened and hand polished. This special RCBS finishing produces a die that will withstand years and years of the abrasive type of wear caused by case sizing. All RCBS Seater Dies have a built-in roll or taper crimper as appropriate for the particular caliber. To seat bullets without crimping, simply unscrew the die until the crimp ring no longer engages the case mouth. Large, easy-to-adjust hex lock rings utilize hex head setscrews. Unless otherwise noted, all RCBS Precisioneered Dies have the standard 7/8”-14 thread. Dies are packaged in stackable, plastic storage boxes specially designed to protect the dies in shipping. Includes loading data label.", "text": "RCBS 20515 Carbide Die Set, 9MMLUGER/9x21/9x23 Carbide Die Sets consist of a Carbide Sizer Die with Decapping Unit, Expander Die for expanding and belling the case mouth, plus a Seater Die with Roll or Taper Crimp and Bullet Seater Plug. RCBS has over 60 years of precision die making under their belt. And the industry’s most experienced die craftsmen working under their roof. These craftsmen, following rigid RCBS specifications developed over many years, produce more reloading dies in more calibers (over 3,300!) than any other reloading die manufacturer. RCBS Precisioneered Reloading Dies are for shooters who demand reloads equal to the quality of their guns. Each RCBS Die is made from case hardened steel. The inside surfaces of all RCBS Precisioneered Dies are precision-drilled and reamed to the same exacting standards as the finest gun mechanisms. Full-Length Sizer Dies for bottleneck cases have vents to prevent case damage caused by trapped air and for excessive lubricant. Headspace is held to minimum tolerances to avoid changing the case body length during full length sizing. Each RCBS Die is properly hardened and hand polished. This special RCBS finishing produces a die that will withstand years and years of the abrasive type of wear caused by case sizing. All RCBS Seater Dies have a built-in roll or taper crimper as appropriate for the particular caliber. To seat bullets without crimping, simply unscrew the die until the crimp ring no longer engages the case mouth. Large, easy-to-adjust hex lock rings utilize hex head setscrews. Unless otherwise noted, all RCBS Precisioneered Dies have the standard 7/8”-14 thread. Dies are packaged in stackable, plastic storage boxes specially designed to protect the dies in shipping. Includes loading data label.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GzknnaFSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MOGSUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 52.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MONFQK", "title": "MEN's Pro Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking", "description": "The Men's Pro Cycling Short is a padded bicycle short with an eight-panel anatomical design. There are no seams between the legs, so the smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. Bike Shorts add comfort on longer bike rides because the compression the spandex against your muscles supports your hard work on the bike. Cross Grain Cutting maximizes stretch performance of spandex fabric. Eight panel construction is designed with curves for cycling position Smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. Fabric is four way, 7 1/2 oz, nylon/lycra, tricot knit - THE BEST! You want Comfort on the bicycle. The men's cycling short has an eight panel anatomical design with a padded crotch for comfort on the bicycle. Waist is a soft elastic that is coverstitched and tacked for durability. leg grippers are smooth and comfortable with high quality five thread surged edges. Bike Shorts are very comfortable and properly sized for men who ride their bicycle seriously and do not want to be bothered by shorts that ride up. These shorts will not ride up. Crotch padding is multiple layers with padding in the places it is needed - Perfecto. Pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber, that is laminated to foam and tricot, it is antibacterial and stays dry and inhibits the growth of bacteria.", "text": "MEN's Pro Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking The Men's Pro Cycling Short is a padded bicycle short with an eight-panel anatomical design. There are no seams between the legs, so the smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. Bike Shorts add comfort on longer bike rides because the compression the spandex against your muscles supports your hard work on the bike. Cross Grain Cutting maximizes stretch performance of spandex fabric. Eight panel construction is designed with curves for cycling position Smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. Fabric is four way, 7 1/2 oz, nylon/lycra, tricot knit - THE BEST! You want Comfort on the bicycle. The men's cycling short has an eight panel anatomical design with a padded crotch for comfort on the bicycle. Waist is a soft elastic that is coverstitched and tacked for durability. leg grippers are smooth and comfortable with high quality five thread surged edges. Bike Shorts are very comfortable and properly sized for men who ride their bicycle seriously and do not want to be bothered by shorts that ride up. These shorts will not ride up. Crotch padding is multiple layers with padding in the places it is needed - Perfecto. Pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber, that is laminated to foam and tricot, it is antibacterial and stays dry and inhibits the growth of bacteria.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ep8FroKfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MONFQK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MPC5WY", "title": "YogaAccessories (TM) Yoga Mat Harness Strap", "description": "Carry your yoga mat easily and comfortably with a yoga mat harness strap. This clever, lightweight harness fits both our YogaAccessories™ Classic 1/8'' and Extra Thick Deluxe 1/4'' mats, plus many others. It can also be used to carry a yoga mat rug or blanket. The sling has two quick release buckles, each on an adjustable loop that wraps around your mat. The harness strap is solid, durable, and reinforced for long life and comfort. Each sling is beautifully patterned on a solid black.YogaAccessories™ also now has alarger yoga mat harness strapfor those extra long mats.", "text": "YogaAccessories (TM) Yoga Mat Harness Strap Carry your yoga mat easily and comfortably with a yoga mat harness strap. This clever, lightweight harness fits both our YogaAccessories™ Classic 1/8'' and Extra Thick Deluxe 1/4'' mats, plus many others. It can also be used to carry a yoga mat rug or blanket. The sling has two quick release buckles, each on an adjustable loop that wraps around your mat. The harness strap is solid, durable, and reinforced for long life and comfort. Each sling is beautifully patterned on a solid black.YogaAccessories™ also now has alarger yoga mat harness strapfor those extra long mats.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EN1RLHfXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MPC5WY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "YogaAccessories (TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mat Bags"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B000MQ639E", "title": "Coleman PerfectFlow InstaStart 2-Burner Stove", "description": "Cook up a full meal without running out of cooking space with the Coleman EvenTemp InstaStart two-burner stove. Designed to accommodate a pair of pots or skillets at once, the stove offers two fully adjustable, 10,000 BTU burners, each equipped with Coleman's matchless InstaStart pushbutton ignition. The result is an easy-to-use stove that delivers an elite cooking performance time and again. Outdoor chefs will also appreciate the stove's PerfectFlow propane pressure control, which produces a steady fuel stream even in cold weather, high altitudes, or when fuel is low. The stove's PerfectHeat technology, meanwhile, employs recessed cook tops and lowered burner positions to generate efficient cooking heat. And thanks to the WindBlock side panels, the burners can stave off the elements while you cook. (The side panels also fold down to form side shelves for condiments or utensils.) So give yourself the gift of convenience and serious cooking power with this durable camping stove from Coleman.About ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "text": "Coleman PerfectFlow InstaStart 2-Burner Stove Cook up a full meal without running out of cooking space with the Coleman EvenTemp InstaStart two-burner stove. Designed to accommodate a pair of pots or skillets at once, the stove offers two fully adjustable, 10,000 BTU burners, each equipped with Coleman's matchless InstaStart pushbutton ignition. The result is an easy-to-use stove that delivers an elite cooking performance time and again. Outdoor chefs will also appreciate the stove's PerfectFlow propane pressure control, which produces a steady fuel stream even in cold weather, high altitudes, or when fuel is low. The stove's PerfectHeat technology, meanwhile, employs recessed cook tops and lowered burner positions to generate efficient cooking heat. And thanks to the WindBlock side panels, the burners can stave off the elements while you cook. (The side panels also fold down to form side shelves for condiments or utensils.) So give yourself the gift of convenience and serious cooking power with this durable camping stove from Coleman.About ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ko7do5d8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MQ639E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]]}}
