{"item_id": "B000MQXDO2", "title": "Optimus Fuel Bottle with Child Safe Cap", "description": "Optimus fuel bottles are suitable for transporting and pressurizing all kinds of liquid fuel. An interior epoxy coating ensures that methylated alcohol and contaminated fuels can be kept safely in the bottles. Thanks to a unique hardening process, these bottles are strong and durable, yet surprisingly light weight.", "text": "Optimus Fuel Bottle with Child Safe Cap Optimus fuel bottles are suitable for transporting and pressurizing all kinds of liquid fuel. An interior epoxy coating ensures that methylated alcohol and contaminated fuels can be kept safely in the bottles. Thanks to a unique hardening process, these bottles are strong and durable, yet surprisingly light weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314X-OaRXjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MQXDO2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Empty Fuel Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MRCIPG", "title": "Thule 915XT Roadway 5 Bike Hitch Carrier", "description": "The Thule 915 Roadway 5-Bike Hitch Mount Rack sets the new standard for performance and ease of use. The Thule Roadway has a five bicycle carrying capacity, and provides you with the perfect combination of security and convenience.The Thule Roadway utilizes Thule's Stinger Swinger hitch that converts quickly from a two-inch receiver right out of the box. This bicycle rack features Thule's Hitch Switch dual quick-release levers for rapid, rear vehicle access and folding arms for storage, and Thule's T3 Cradles that lock down bikes and cradles while still allowing complete adjustment along the bike arm. The Roadway weighs 33 pounds, has a maximum carrying capacity of 150 pounds, and is compatible with Thule's STL2 hitch lock, and 538 Cable (both sold separately) for a complete security solution.What's in the Box?915 Roadway hitch mount bike rack, all necessary mounting hardware and securing straps, and instruction guideManufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "text": "Thule 915XT Roadway 5 Bike Hitch Carrier The Thule 915 Roadway 5-Bike Hitch Mount Rack sets the new standard for performance and ease of use. The Thule Roadway has a five bicycle carrying capacity, and provides you with the perfect combination of security and convenience.The Thule Roadway utilizes Thule's Stinger Swinger hitch that converts quickly from a two-inch receiver right out of the box. This bicycle rack features Thule's Hitch Switch dual quick-release levers for rapid, rear vehicle access and folding arms for storage, and Thule's T3 Cradles that lock down bikes and cradles while still allowing complete adjustment along the bike arm. The Roadway weighs 33 pounds, has a maximum carrying capacity of 150 pounds, and is compatible with Thule's STL2 hitch lock, and 538 Cable (both sold separately) for a complete security solution.What's in the Box?915 Roadway hitch mount bike rack, all necessary mounting hardware and securing straps, and instruction guideManufacturer's WarrantyLimited lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xMzGklo%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MRCIPG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]]}}
