{"item_id": "B000MS9E20", "title": "TYR Streamline Swim Training Board - Men's", "description": "Triathletes tend to rely on wetsuits for buoyancy and correct body position, and often that means that their kick technique is, well, less than developed. But, with summers seeming to get warmer and water levels lower, many racers find out the day before that their A race is, in fact, non-wetsuit legal. To better prepare to swim without being wrapped in neoprene, train with TYR's Streamline Swim Training Board. The TYR board is different from your standard issue boards for three reasons. First, it features molded hand grips so that you stay in proper swim position without your hand sliding every few laps. Second, it has been specifically designed to reduce shoulder stress with a narrower, shaped width. Finally, its more compact size allows for quick turns so that you won't hold up the swimmer behind you. It's constructed from durable foam. The TYR Streamline Swim Training Board comes in one size and in the color Blue.", "text": "TYR Streamline Swim Training Board - Men's Triathletes tend to rely on wetsuits for buoyancy and correct body position, and often that means that their kick technique is, well, less than developed. But, with summers seeming to get warmer and water levels lower, many racers find out the day before that their A race is, in fact, non-wetsuit legal. To better prepare to swim without being wrapped in neoprene, train with TYR's Streamline Swim Training Board. The TYR board is different from your standard issue boards for three reasons. First, it features molded hand grips so that you stay in proper swim position without your hand sliding every few laps. Second, it has been specifically designed to reduce shoulder stress with a narrower, shaped width. Finally, its more compact size allows for quick turns so that you won't hold up the swimmer behind you. It's constructed from durable foam. The TYR Streamline Swim Training Board comes in one size and in the color Blue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vBmxUEx1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MS9E20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Kickboards"]], "price": 17.63}}
