{"item_id": "B000MT95RI", "title": "Moeller Flushrite Boat Motor Flusher (Dual Water Feed, Universal, Rectangular Cup)", "description": "Flush contaminates from your lower unit cooling system. Quickly removes salt and mineral build-up with a simple flush that slips over side water inlets on most inboard and outboard lower units.", "text": "Moeller Flushrite Boat Motor Flusher (Dual Water Feed, Universal, Rectangular Cup) Flush contaminates from your lower unit cooling system. Quickly removes salt and mineral build-up with a simple flush that slips over side water inlets on most inboard and outboard lower units.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wfjr5zlYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MT95RI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moeller Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Motor Flushers"]], "price": 21.75}}
{"item_id": "B000MTB7X8", "title": "Moeller Injection-Molded Marine Battery Box (One 27, 30 or 31-Series Battery, 13.44\" x 7.75\" x 10.5\")", "description": "Polyethylene construction. Chemical and rust resistant, will not corrode. Constructed to meet CFR 177.150 standards. When properly installed, they conform to USCG regulations. USCG regulations require all battery boxes to be securely fastened to the deck and the vent opening must not be obstructed.", "text": "Moeller Injection-Molded Marine Battery Box (One 27, 30 or 31-Series Battery, 13.44\" x 7.75\" x 10.5\") Polyethylene construction. Chemical and rust resistant, will not corrode. Constructed to meet CFR 177.150 standards. When properly installed, they conform to USCG regulations. USCG regulations require all battery boxes to be securely fastened to the deck and the vent opening must not be obstructed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tfgeo5cXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MTB7X8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moeller Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment"]], "price": 11.48}}
{"item_id": "B000MTCQNI", "title": "Moeller Scepter Vented Gas Can (5-Gallon, Military Style)", "description": "Moeller 5 - gallon Jerry Jug. Rustproof, crush - resistant... virtually indestructible! Fill 'er up: Features a reversible self-venting spout - no need to worry about separate vent closures; Unbreakable, corrosion-resistant polyethylene construction. Order Now! Please Note: Once items have contained gas, kerosene, butane, lighter fluid, diesel, or oil they cannot be returned to us. Moeller 5-gallon Jerry Jug", "text": "Moeller Scepter Vented Gas Can (5-Gallon, Military Style) Moeller 5 - gallon Jerry Jug. Rustproof, crush - resistant... virtually indestructible! Fill 'er up: Features a reversible self-venting spout - no need to worry about separate vent closures; Unbreakable, corrosion-resistant polyethylene construction. Order Now! Please Note: Once items have contained gas, kerosene, butane, lighter fluid, diesel, or oil they cannot be returned to us. Moeller 5-gallon Jerry Jug", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ChoyjeVqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MTCQNI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Fuel Tanks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000MTCRAA", "title": "Moeller Marine Electric Universal Fuel Tank Sending Unit (4\" to 27\" Deep Tanks, 35 to 240 Ohm's)", "description": "Moeller Electric Fuel Sending Unit! SAVE BIG! Moeller makes it easy to monitor your fuel level! Electric Sending Units monitor fuel the same way as old mechanical units, but without the need for a conversion capsule. These do-it-yourself Sending Units have internal components that will not corrode or rust, and allow you to measure your own fuel tank depth and adjust the swing arm according. The float rotates easily in 90 increments, letting you further customize your setup. Available in a variety of sizes for standard tanks, plus a diesel model with return line for diesel and fuel-injection motors. Or, really go all out and get the complete kit, which includes a dash-mounted gauge and hardware (for non-diesel and non-fuel injection motors only). Sending Unit calibrated to 35-240 Ohms. Fuel monitoring the easy way... FOR LESS! Order Yours Today! Moeller Electric Fuel Sending Unit, 4 - 27\"", "text": "Moeller Marine Electric Universal Fuel Tank Sending Unit (4\" to 27\" Deep Tanks, 35 to 240 Ohm's) Moeller Electric Fuel Sending Unit! SAVE BIG! Moeller makes it easy to monitor your fuel level! Electric Sending Units monitor fuel the same way as old mechanical units, but without the need for a conversion capsule. These do-it-yourself Sending Units have internal components that will not corrode or rust, and allow you to measure your own fuel tank depth and adjust the swing arm according. The float rotates easily in 90 increments, letting you further customize your setup. Available in a variety of sizes for standard tanks, plus a diesel model with return line for diesel and fuel-injection motors. Or, really go all out and get the complete kit, which includes a dash-mounted gauge and hardware (for non-diesel and non-fuel injection motors only). Sending Unit calibrated to 35-240 Ohms. Fuel monitoring the easy way... FOR LESS! Order Yours Today! Moeller Electric Fuel Sending Unit, 4 - 27\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oqPxVAlGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MTCRAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moeller Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Fuel Tanks"]], "price": 24.28}}
