{"item_id": "B000MTXZME", "title": "Taylor Made Products Eco Blast Rechargeable Boat Air Horn", "description": "Taylor Eco Blast Rechargeable Air Horn. This Taylor rechargeable air horn features a refill valve to permit recharging using any bicycle pump, service station air pump or air compressor in seconds. This air horn can be operates in all weather. Pump sold separately.", "text": "Taylor Made Products Eco Blast Rechargeable Boat Air Horn Taylor Eco Blast Rechargeable Air Horn. This Taylor rechargeable air horn features a refill valve to permit recharging using any bicycle pump, service station air pump or air compressor in seconds. This air horn can be operates in all weather. Pump sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kWeOYDxaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MTXZME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taylor Made Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Horns"]], "price": 27.88}}
