its unique slide adjustment system. Experience the power and exhilaration of weight training with Bayou, built up to a standard not down to a price.Included is one 50 lb. Bayou adjustable dumbbell.Specifications:- Weight Range: 5 to 50 lbs. for each dumbbell- Exercises Available: 30+- Weight Settings: 9- Weight Settings in pounds: 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, and 50 pounds- Dumbbell Dimensions: 15.75 inches long by 8 inches wide by 9 inches tall- Weight: 50 poundsManufacturer's Warranty:- One-year limited warranty on all parts", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oShwHZ6tL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MVKU98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bayou Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]], "price": 136.99}}
