{"item_id": "B000MVUCC8", "title": "Under Armour Men's Ventilated 7\" Compression Shorts", "description": "Smooth, lightweight fabric built with UA's signature compression fit. 4-Way Stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Anti-Odor technology prevents the growth of odor-causing microbes. 30+ UPF protects your skin from the sun's harmful rays. Smooth Flatlock Seams allow a full range of motion without chafing. 7\" inseam. Nylon/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's Ventilated 7\" Compression Shorts Smooth, lightweight fabric built with UA's signature compression fit. 4-Way Stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Anti-Odor technology prevents the growth of odor-causing microbes. 30+ UPF protects your skin from the sun's harmful rays. Smooth Flatlock Seams allow a full range of motion without chafing. 7\" inseam. Nylon/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417sA30YLZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MVUCC8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MW2B08", "title": "1-1/2\" Thick - 12\" Wide - Bicycle Seat Cover / Gel Pad-Wide", "description": "The number one reason so many individuals give up bicycle riding is SEAT PAIN! This gel bicycle seat cover fits the large size bicycle seats and exercise bikes. Slips over existing seat in seconds! Add that extra comfort you need. Deluxe Gel cushion, Non slip bottom for stability, Locking Drawstring for snug fit and easy removal. Other sizes available. ***Special Note for sizing: This pad will fit seats 12\" wide and 12\" front to back, and up to 3 inches high. Customizable Seat Pad (you can cut to size and shape if desired.) For larger seats up to 18\" wide, purchase this item thru Amazon and contact us at DerriairBikeSeats with your seat width. **Note on Wider Seats - Some custom sizing is available. Please contact us for size questions. Made in USA!", "text": "1-1/2\" Thick - 12\" Wide - Bicycle Seat Cover / Gel Pad-Wide The number one reason so many individuals give up bicycle riding is SEAT PAIN! This gel bicycle seat cover fits the large size bicycle seats and exercise bikes. Slips over existing seat in seconds! Add that extra comfort you need. Deluxe Gel cushion, Non slip bottom for stability, Locking Drawstring for snug fit and easy removal. Other sizes available. ***Special Note for sizing: This pad will fit seats 12\" wide and 12\" front to back, and up to 3 inches high. Customizable Seat Pad (you can cut to size and shape if desired.) For larger seats up to 18\" wide, purchase this item thru Amazon and contact us at DerriairBikeSeats with your seat width. **Note on Wider Seats - Some custom sizing is available. Please contact us for size questions. Made in USA!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uiu9eaYJL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MW2B08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 49.94}}
{"item_id": "B000MWC0M2", "title": "Profile Design Jammer GT Aerobar", "description": "The Profile Design Jammer GT allows athletes to use aerobars without altering their position on a conventional road bike.", "text": "Profile Design Jammer GT Aerobar The Profile Design Jammer GT allows athletes to use aerobars without altering their position on a conventional road bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M3LS2yzVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MWC0M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 139.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MWC7LQ", "title": "Guyot Designs 5 in 1 Utensil Set", "description": "The Guyot Designs Utensils are designed to be your \"go to\" utensils either on the trail or cooking at home. These innovative Utensils are designed for slurping hot soup on a cold trail or cutting the toughest of food. Their long handles make eating out of food pouches or cooking in a Jetboil easy on the knuckles. The Utensils are made of reclaimable nylon and 2% of their sales go to support environmental action charities. Finally another reason to feel great about chow time!", "text": "Guyot Designs 5 in 1 Utensil Set The Guyot Designs Utensils are designed to be your \"go to\" utensils either on the trail or cooking at home. These innovative Utensils are designed for slurping hot soup on a cold trail or cutting the toughest of food. Their long handles make eating out of food pouches or cooking in a Jetboil easy on the knuckles. The Utensils are made of reclaimable nylon and 2% of their sales go to support environmental action charities. Finally another reason to feel great about chow time!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PSmYzOt8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MWC7LQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guyot Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B000MWFL6E", "title": "Black Diamond Wiz Headlamp", "description": "Teach your child the joys of night exploring with the Wiz Headlamp from Black Diamond. It's compact enough to fit a child's head and CPSIA certified with a child-safe screw closure and breakaway elastic safety strap. The Wiz is a simple headlamp, with an easy on/off switch and dimming capability to handle brightness levels. Because Black Diamond knows a few kids, the company installed an automatic shut-off detector that powers the headlamp down after two hours if it gets left lying around with the power on. You know, just in case.The Wiz is powered by two AAA batteries and two SinglePower LEDs. It's also protected against splashing or sprayed water from any angle. Black Diamond thought of everything in this kid's headlamp.About Black DiamondAt Black Diamond, it's all about climbing and skiing. The company shares the same experiences that you do on rock, ice, and snow and these experiences push them to make the best gear possible for a worldwide family of climbers and skiers.What began with a backyard anvil and a hammer has grown into a global company with offices on three continents that's not just for rock climbers, but one that stands for the spirit of the sports we live and the value of their place in society. Since 1957, Black Diamond's innovative gear designs have set the standards in numerous areas. This is partly the result of dedication, desire and diligence on the part of an incredible team of people--and the fact that they are all climbers and skiers themselves.", "text": "Black Diamond Wiz Headlamp Teach your child the joys of night exploring with the Wiz Headlamp from Black Diamond. It's compact enough to fit a child's head and CPSIA certified with a child-safe screw closure and breakaway elastic safety strap. The Wiz is a simple headlamp, with an easy on/off switch and dimming capability to handle brightness levels. Because Black Diamond knows a few kids, the company installed an automatic shut-off detector that powers the headlamp down after two hours if it gets left lying around with the power on. You know, just in case.The Wiz is powered by two AAA batteries and two SinglePower LEDs. It's also protected against splashing or sprayed water from any angle. Black Diamond thought of everything in this kid's headlamp.About Black DiamondAt Black Diamond, it's all about climbing and skiing. The company shares the same experiences that you do on rock, ice, and snow and these experiences push them to make the best gear possible for a worldwide family of climbers and skiers.What began with a backyard anvil and a hammer has grown into a global company with offices on three continents that's not just for rock climbers, but one that stands for the spirit of the sports we live and the value of their place in society. Since 1957, Black Diamond's innovative gear designs have set the standards in numerous areas. This is partly the result of dedication, desire and diligence on the part of an incredible team of people--and the fact that they are all climbers and skiers themselves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UGg07RG6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MWFL6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B000MWRJR8", "title": "Planet Bike Beamer 5 LED Bicycle Light with Quick Cam Bracket Mount", "description": "Whether you're a 24-hour racer or a super commuter, the Beamer 5 LED bike light from Planet Bike gives you the power to light up the night. The light includes five white Nichia eXtreme v2.0 LED lights that help you see clearly at night while alerting drivers and other cyclists to your presence. The lights not only illuminate your path, but they're also four times brighter than many earlier LED incarnations, ensuring that you don't miss certain landscape features because the lights are too dim. Plus, the Beamer 5 is a breeze to install, with an easy-to-use Quick Cam bracket that mounts, adjusts, or comes off in seconds without tools. The Beamer 5, which runs for up to 100 hours on two AA batteries (included), offers both flashing and steady modes and carries a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "text": "Planet Bike Beamer 5 LED Bicycle Light with Quick Cam Bracket Mount Whether you're a 24-hour racer or a super commuter, the Beamer 5 LED bike light from Planet Bike gives you the power to light up the night. The light includes five white Nichia eXtreme v2.0 LED lights that help you see clearly at night while alerting drivers and other cyclists to your presence. The lights not only illuminate your path, but they're also four times brighter than many earlier LED incarnations, ensuring that you don't miss certain landscape features because the lights are too dim. Plus, the Beamer 5 is a breeze to install, with an easy-to-use Quick Cam bracket that mounts, adjusts, or comes off in seconds without tools. The Beamer 5, which runs for up to 100 hours on two AA batteries (included), offers both flashing and steady modes and carries a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oNm3PrAuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MWRJR8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 27.98}}
{"item_id": "B000MWXTY0", "title": "Petzl Tikka Plus 4-LED Headlamp", "description": "With its four LED bulbs and three lighting levels, the Petzl Tikka Plus is a multi-dimensional headlamp, suitable for hiking, climbing, caving, sailing or any number of activities that demand the need for additional lighting. In addition to being feature-laden, the Tikka Plus is lightweight, compact and easy to use. A large toggle switch makes the Tikka Plus ultra-easy to operate. The four LED bulbs produce a maximum brightness of 35 Lumens, sufficient to cast light up to 105 feet. Two additional settings allow you to regulate the length of the beam, increasing efficiency and burn time in the process. The lowest, most economical setting on the Tikka Plus throws a beam of 49.2 feet and increases burn time to 150 hours. A fourth setting produces a strobe light for emergency signaling. A hinge on the housing of the lamp enables you to aim the beam where you need it most. The Tikka Plus is powered by three Alkaline AAA batteries (included). With batteries, the Tikka Plus weighs a mere 2.75 ounces. A comfortable, elastic headband allows the Tikka Plus to adjust to fit varied head sizes. The Petzl Tikka Plus is water-resistant and suitable for all-weather use.", "text": "Petzl Tikka Plus 4-LED Headlamp With its four LED bulbs and three lighting levels, the Petzl Tikka Plus is a multi-dimensional headlamp, suitable for hiking, climbing, caving, sailing or any number of activities that demand the need for additional lighting. In addition to being feature-laden, the Tikka Plus is lightweight, compact and easy to use. A large toggle switch makes the Tikka Plus ultra-easy to operate. The four LED bulbs produce a maximum brightness of 35 Lumens, sufficient to cast light up to 105 feet. Two additional settings allow you to regulate the length of the beam, increasing efficiency and burn time in the process. The lowest, most economical setting on the Tikka Plus throws a beam of 49.2 feet and increases burn time to 150 hours. A fourth setting produces a strobe light for emergency signaling. A hinge on the housing of the lamp enables you to aim the beam where you need it most. The Tikka Plus is powered by three Alkaline AAA batteries (included). With batteries, the Tikka Plus weighs a mere 2.75 ounces. A comfortable, elastic headband allows the Tikka Plus to adjust to fit varied head sizes. The Petzl Tikka Plus is water-resistant and suitable for all-weather use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dcj8gIvZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MWXTY0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 55.32}}
{"item_id": "B000MX3RVO", "title": "Hogue Ruger Sp101 Pau Ferro Premium Wood Grips", "description": "Fits: Ruger SP101 Hogue fancy hardwood grips are in a class of their own, and are acclaimed by many as the finest handgun stocks available. All Hogue hardwood grips are precision inlet on modern computerized machinery (CNC), then hand finished on actual factory frames, assuring a proper fit. Finally, they are hand polished to a non-slippery sheen using natural Carnauba wax which will not crack and peel like cheap, sprayed-on finishes. Hogue wood grips are made from Pau Ferro wood. Looks like dark walnut.", "text": "Hogue Ruger Sp101 Pau Ferro Premium Wood Grips Fits: Ruger SP101 Hogue fancy hardwood grips are in a class of their own, and are acclaimed by many as the finest handgun stocks available. All Hogue hardwood grips are precision inlet on modern computerized machinery (CNC), then hand finished on actual factory frames, assuring a proper fit. Finally, they are hand polished to a non-slippery sheen using natural Carnauba wax which will not crack and peel like cheap, sprayed-on finishes. Hogue wood grips are made from Pau Ferro wood. Looks like dark walnut.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l%2BQM2TKkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MX3RVO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 57.99}}
{"item_id": "B000MX3SOK", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P226 Rubber Panels", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P226 Rubber Panels Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZcEy2wtVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MX3SOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 18.85}}
{"item_id": "B000MX5ZCI", "title": "Hoppe's Bench Rest Stainless Steel 1-Piece Universal Rifle/Shotgun Cleaning Rod (All Calibers and Gauges)", "description": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Rods have a ball bearing swivel handle to follow the bore's rifling. Fits all calibers and gauges of rifles and shotguns. High-grade stainless steel construction is strong and offers incredible resistance to weather and chemicals. Come with ball bearing swivel handles. Rod Length: 33 7/8\", overall length (including handle): 35 3/4\" '", "text": "Hoppe's Bench Rest Stainless Steel 1-Piece Universal Rifle/Shotgun Cleaning Rod (All Calibers and Gauges) Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Rods have a ball bearing swivel handle to follow the bore's rifling. Fits all calibers and gauges of rifles and shotguns. High-grade stainless steel construction is strong and offers incredible resistance to weather and chemicals. Come with ball bearing swivel handles. Rod Length: 33 7/8\", overall length (including handle): 35 3/4\" '", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Sblx9DtpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MX5ZCI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 9.27}}
{"item_id": "B000MX6G8U", "title": "Buck 0860BKS-B Hartsook Fixed Blade Neck Knife", "description": "Buck Knife 860BK Hartsook Neck Knife is an ultra-slim, compact, fixed blade knife for wearing primarily around the neck. It is made in the U.S.A. of high quality, black oxide coated, S30V stainless steel and comes with a slimline sheath. Small, light-weight and convenient, this type of knife is popular with the Tactical market, but it's a great cross-over product that appeals to a variety of people for many uses: fly-fishing, hunting, hiking, backpacking as well as personal carry. It's skeletal shape and talon blade are specifically designed for nimble cutting and quick access, making it well-suited for Law Enforcement, Military, and other activities. Designed by Doug Hartsook, quality material and manufacturing by Buck. The Hartsook Neck Knife, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty..", "text": "Buck 0860BKS-B Hartsook Fixed Blade Neck Knife Buck Knife 860BK Hartsook Neck Knife is an ultra-slim, compact, fixed blade knife for wearing primarily around the neck. It is made in the U.S.A. of high quality, black oxide coated, S30V stainless steel and comes with a slimline sheath. Small, light-weight and convenient, this type of knife is popular with the Tactical market, but it's a great cross-over product that appeals to a variety of people for many uses: fly-fishing, hunting, hiking, backpacking as well as personal carry. It's skeletal shape and talon blade are specifically designed for nimble cutting and quick access, making it well-suited for Law Enforcement, Military, and other activities. Designed by Doug Hartsook, quality material and manufacturing by Buck. The Hartsook Neck Knife, as with all Buck Knives, features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21E9iYtRO-L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000MX6G8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 26.09}}
