{"item_id": "B000N26HEI", "title": "Gamma Leather Replacement Grip", "description": "GAMMA’s leather grip is made to exact standards using natural cowhide. Tacky, firm, and durable to maintain optimum performance and comfortable feel throughout the extreme conditions created by hard play. Available with adhesive backing for easier wrapping and hold on your racquet.", "text": "Gamma Leather Replacement Grip GAMMA’s leather grip is made to exact standards using natural cowhide. Tacky, firm, and durable to maintain optimum performance and comfortable feel throughout the extreme conditions created by hard play. Available with adhesive backing for easier wrapping and hold on your racquet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516h5Zhl9lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N26HEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamma", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Racquet Grips"]], "price": 7.75}}
