{"item_id": "B000N6261C", "title": "M14 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle", "description": "A 1:1 scale replica of an M14 rifle, this airsoft gun is remarkably authentic. The rifle fires round 6mm plastic pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun via a spring mechanism. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M14 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft gun is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The rifle includes an adjustable hop-up, a barrel cleaning rod, and a speedloader.Specifications:Velocity: 280 to 300 fpsRange: 120 feetMagazine: 37 roundsSpring single shotAdjustable hop-upBarrel cleaning rodSpeedloader", "text": "M14 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle A 1:1 scale replica of an M14 rifle, this airsoft gun is remarkably authentic. The rifle fires round 6mm plastic pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun via a spring mechanism. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M14 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft gun is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The rifle includes an adjustable hop-up, a barrel cleaning rod, and a speedloader.Specifications:Velocity: 280 to 300 fpsRange: 120 feetMagazine: 37 roundsSpring single shotAdjustable hop-upBarrel cleaning rodSpeedloader", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ITvpWevxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N6261C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airsoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 63.99}}
