{"item_id": "B000N7MD7S", "title": "Byrd Crossbill Stainless Steel Folding Knife", "description": "The Crossbill model has a hollow-ground blade manufactured using 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, which is similar to Aus-8 in its properties, performance and function. 8Cr13MoV steel contains both molybdenum and vanadium. Molybdenum enhances the strength and hardness of the steel, vanadium its wear resistance and toughness. Carbon augments the steel's tensile strength and increases its resistance to wear and abrasion. Resulting from this recipe is blade steel that retains a sharp cutting edge over time and use. The \"comet\" shaped opening hole is a trademark of the byrd line and is synonymous with the stringent quality requirements, high performance materials and manufacturing, which go into every knife. fully stainless handles have a sequence of ergonomic curves that fit into the palm for comfort and fatigue-free control while cutting. For additional safty, a portion of the lock release is ground away. This is a design add-on conceived by custom knifemaker David Boye and eliminates the chance of gripping the knife tightly enough to unintentionally release the lock. All byrds feature a pocket clip that clips the knife inside a pocket and it attaches to either end of the folder for tip-up or tip-down right-hand carry.", "text": "Byrd Crossbill Stainless Steel Folding Knife The Crossbill model has a hollow-ground blade manufactured using 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, which is similar to Aus-8 in its properties, performance and function. 8Cr13MoV steel contains both molybdenum and vanadium. Molybdenum enhances the strength and hardness of the steel, vanadium its wear resistance and toughness. Carbon augments the steel's tensile strength and increases its resistance to wear and abrasion. Resulting from this recipe is blade steel that retains a sharp cutting edge over time and use. The \"comet\" shaped opening hole is a trademark of the byrd line and is synonymous with the stringent quality requirements, high performance materials and manufacturing, which go into every knife. fully stainless handles have a sequence of ergonomic curves that fit into the palm for comfort and fatigue-free control while cutting. For additional safty, a portion of the lock release is ground away. This is a design add-on conceived by custom knifemaker David Boye and eliminates the chance of gripping the knife tightly enough to unintentionally release the lock. All byrds feature a pocket clip that clips the knife inside a pocket and it attaches to either end of the folder for tip-up or tip-down right-hand carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21xoEgNX85L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N7MD7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BYRD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.66}}
{"item_id": "B000N8EY9W", "title": "Recoil Buffer for Ruger 10/22", "description": "Reduces recoil impulse, eliminates the metal to metal contact of bolt to bolt stop pin, decreases lock time.", "text": "Recoil Buffer for Ruger 10/22 Reduces recoil impulse, eliminates the metal to metal contact of bolt to bolt stop pin, decreases lock time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wc9zZxVxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8EY9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buffertech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B000N8FJSW", "title": "Daisy Shatterblast Six Shooter Target System", "description": "Extra fun for ShatterBlast target shooters! Shoot one target in the SixShooter and another drops into place for fast shooting action! Holds six target disks. Set includes 12 ShatterBlast target disks.", "text": "Daisy Shatterblast Six Shooter Target System Extra fun for ShatterBlast target shooters! Shoot one target in the SixShooter and another drops into place for fast shooting action! Holds six target disks. Set includes 12 ShatterBlast target disks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uPZNm72AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8FJSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B000N8HUT8", "title": "Bianchi 7000 Black Sporting Holster Fits S&W K Frame 6", "description": "A well designed holster that is ideal for field, hunting, and casual carry. The AccuMold construction protects the pistol even under the harshest conditions. The 7000 has a forward cant of 10 degrees that adds in both comfort and ease of presentation. 1.75” injection molded belt loop. Fits Fits Colt King Cobra, Pyhton (6\"), Llama Comanche, Martial (6\"), Ruger GP100 (6\"), S&W; 19, 586 and similar K/L frame models (6\")", "text": "Bianchi 7000 Black Sporting Holster Fits S&W K Frame 6 A well designed holster that is ideal for field, hunting, and casual carry. The AccuMold construction protects the pistol even under the harshest conditions. The 7000 has a forward cant of 10 degrees that adds in both comfort and ease of presentation. 1.75” injection molded belt loop. Fits Fits Colt King Cobra, Pyhton (6\"), Llama Comanche, Martial (6\"), Ruger GP100 (6\"), S&W; 19, 586 and similar K/L frame models (6\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UhV-sC7CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8HUT8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.69}}
{"item_id": "B000N8HVNI", "title": "Lyman Cast Bullet H and I Sizing Die", "description": "Lyman improved sizing dies now have 90° hole spacing for easier bullet lubrication, even with today's hard lubricants. Lyman sizing dies also feature a tapered mouth and hardened interior insuring alignment for perfect cylindrical shape. Interior dimensions correspond to suggested diameters for all popular rifle and pistol calibers. Refer to the chart below for proper size. (These are interchangeable with RCBS)", "text": "Lyman Cast Bullet H and I Sizing Die Lyman improved sizing dies now have 90° hole spacing for easier bullet lubrication, even with today's hard lubricants. Lyman sizing dies also feature a tapered mouth and hardened interior insuring alignment for perfect cylindrical shape. Interior dimensions correspond to suggested diameters for all popular rifle and pistol calibers. Refer to the chart below for proper size. (These are interchangeable with RCBS)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t69xGd31L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8HVNI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000N8HW3M", "title": "RCBS Primer Tray-2", "description": "The RCBS Primer Tray—2 handles today’s larger primer package quantities. The square shape makes it easier to handle. Grooved tray surface quickly positions primers anvil-side up.", "text": "RCBS Primer Tray-2 The RCBS Primer Tray—2 handles today’s larger primer package quantities. The square shape makes it easier to handle. Grooved tray surface quickly positions primers anvil-side up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LYG%2BWetcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8HW3M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.67}}
{"item_id": "B000N8HW46", "title": "RCBS Ingot Mould", "description": "With the RCBS Ingot Mould you can mould up to four ingots at once and cool them quickly with this handy accessory. Its perfect for melting down scrap lead and preparing alloys for future use.", "text": "RCBS Ingot Mould With the RCBS Ingot Mould you can mould up to four ingots at once and cool them quickly with this handy accessory. Its perfect for melting down scrap lead and preparing alloys for future use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S-FJa6ezL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8HW46.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.19}}
{"item_id": "B000N8HXCM", "title": "Lyman Powder Measure Stand", "description": "Position your Powder Measure for maximum convenience. Features the standard 7/8” x 14 thread and will raise any measure high enough to easily position cases beneath the powder drop tube. Bolts firmly to the loading bench.", "text": "Lyman Powder Measure Stand Position your Powder Measure for maximum convenience. Features the standard 7/8” x 14 thread and will raise any measure high enough to easily position cases beneath the powder drop tube. Bolts firmly to the loading bench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BKBhaKnbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8HXCM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 33.71}}
{"item_id": "B000N8J0EQ", "title": "Daisy 1/2\" Glass Slingshot Ammunition", "description": "This highly visible glass ammunition allows the shooter to easily track and retrieve arrant shots. This ammo makes for a fun day in the field or on the range.", "text": "Daisy 1/2\" Glass Slingshot Ammunition This highly visible glass ammunition allows the shooter to easily track and retrieve arrant shots. This ammo makes for a fun day in the field or on the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PHlrb-iZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8J0EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 4.03}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JUV4", "title": "RCBS #10 Shell Holder", "description": "The RCBS Shell Holder is ideal for nearly any single stage press. The shell holder keeps cases securely in place and in perfect alignment for your reloading needs. Nearly every RCBS Shell Holder can be used for multiple calibers .", "text": "RCBS #10 Shell Holder The RCBS Shell Holder is ideal for nearly any single stage press. The shell holder keeps cases securely in place and in perfect alignment for your reloading needs. Nearly every RCBS Shell Holder can be used for multiple calibers .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217vT2pU0%2BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JUV4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 0.5}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JV9A", "title": "Weaver 1-Inch Steel Lock Mounts for Ruger 10/22", "description": "Weaver Steel Lock Mounts allow you to adjust the eye relief on your favorite scope. These solid, all-steel rings allow you to move your scope forward or back for optimum placement. Two straps and four screws provide added gripping power for these lightweight, all-aluminum rings. Thumbscrews allow for quick detach. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "text": "Weaver 1-Inch Steel Lock Mounts for Ruger 10/22 Weaver Steel Lock Mounts allow you to adjust the eye relief on your favorite scope. These solid, all-steel rings allow you to move your scope forward or back for optimum placement. Two straps and four screws provide added gripping power for these lightweight, all-aluminum rings. Thumbscrews allow for quick detach. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Drun5VoiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JV9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 15.55}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JVM2", "title": "Lee Precision Ingot Mold", "description": "Lee Ingot Mold, mold casts 1/2 and 1 Pounds. ingots (2 of each). Perfect for re-melting and alloying.", "text": "Lee Precision Ingot Mold Lee Ingot Mold, mold casts 1/2 and 1 Pounds. ingots (2 of each). Perfect for re-melting and alloying.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ek8uMb9JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JVM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.14}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JWE4", "title": "Lee Precision 40SW10-mm Carbide Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 40 S&W;/10MM Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "text": "Lee Precision 40SW10-mm Carbide Factory Crimp Die Lee 40 S&W;/10MM Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413SoN0lpNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JWE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.97}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JYLK", "title": "RCBS Trim Pro Manual Case Trimmer Kit", "description": "With its spring-loaded lever the Shell Holder keeps cases securely locked in place and aligned with the RCBS Trim Pro Manual Case Trimmer Kit cutter. It is designed for .001” accuracy even with a spent primer in the case. Works with standard pilots and features a micrometer fine-adjustment bushing calibrated for setting exact trim length. Includes: Shell Holders 2, 3, 4 and 10. Pilot calibers: .22, .24, .25, .27, .28, .30, .35, .44 and .45.", "text": "RCBS Trim Pro Manual Case Trimmer Kit With its spring-loaded lever the Shell Holder keeps cases securely locked in place and aligned with the RCBS Trim Pro Manual Case Trimmer Kit cutter. It is designed for .001” accuracy even with a spent primer in the case. Works with standard pilots and features a micrometer fine-adjustment bushing calibrated for setting exact trim length. Includes: Shell Holders 2, 3, 4 and 10. Pilot calibers: .22, .24, .25, .27, .28, .30, .35, .44 and .45.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f1Empf-vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JYLK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JYQA", "title": "Lyman Turbo Tumbler 1200 Classic (115-Volt) with Media", "description": "The Classic 1200 model features the original Roto Molded bowl design for many years of use. All 1200 Classic models feature a large 1 gallon capacity and will easily tumble 350 cases at a time. The standard 1200 also comes equipped with an in-line on/off power switch and includes free media.", "text": "Lyman Turbo Tumbler 1200 Classic (115-Volt) with Media The Classic 1200 model features the original Roto Molded bowl design for many years of use. All 1200 Classic models feature a large 1 gallon capacity and will easily tumble 350 cases at a time. The standard 1200 also comes equipped with an in-line on/off power switch and includes free media.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41khHcENg3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JYQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 75.0}}
{"item_id": "B000N8JZL4", "title": "Lyman Universal Trimmer with 9 Pilot Multi-Pack", "description": "Lyman's Universal Trimmer features the patented Universal Chuckhead which handles any case from .17 caliber to .458. No costly collets required! Features coarse and fine adjustments. Adjusting ring lets you \"dial in to an approximate setting for quick repeatability\". Includes 9 of the most popular pilots. Additional pilots add even greater range of calibers. Optional power adapter lets you upgrade to power in seconds.", "text": "Lyman Universal Trimmer with 9 Pilot Multi-Pack Lyman's Universal Trimmer features the patented Universal Chuckhead which handles any case from .17 caliber to .458. No costly collets required! Features coarse and fine adjustments. Adjusting ring lets you \"dial in to an approximate setting for quick repeatability\". Includes 9 of the most popular pilots. Additional pilots add even greater range of calibers. Optional power adapter lets you upgrade to power in seconds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419QmiCiuvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8JZL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 79.79}}
{"item_id": "B000N8K2O8", "title": "Lee Precision 3 Hole Turret (Black)", "description": "The Lee Precision 3 Hole Turret is locked into a solid steel ring with big rifle bolt type lugs. Patented design puts the lugs on the circumference so there can be no tipping. The linkage is so powerful that the largest magnum cases are sized with ease. Effort required is so small that the usual heavy bench is not essential.", "text": "Lee Precision 3 Hole Turret (Black) The Lee Precision 3 Hole Turret is locked into a solid steel ring with big rifle bolt type lugs. Patented design puts the lugs on the circumference so there can be no tipping. The linkage is so powerful that the largest magnum cases are sized with ease. Effort required is so small that the usual heavy bench is not essential.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iubYRVNGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8K2O8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.82}}
{"item_id": "B000N8KHQG", "title": "Daisy Electric Airsoft Point Sight", "description": "Adjustable for windage and elevation. A lighted red dot aiming point Mounts on any rifle with standard 3/8\" dovetail.", "text": "Daisy Electric Airsoft Point Sight Adjustable for windage and elevation. A lighted red dot aiming point Mounts on any rifle with standard 3/8\" dovetail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vI%2BZJlnRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8KHQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LCDS", "title": "Lee Precision Auto-Prime XR", "description": "Lee Auto Prime XR hand priming tool is a fast, safe, and effective way of priming cases. Lee Auto Prime XR uses inexpensive Lee Hand Prime shell holders only. Accepts primers from all manufacturers.", "text": "Lee Precision Auto-Prime XR Lee Auto Prime XR hand priming tool is a fast, safe, and effective way of priming cases. Lee Auto Prime XR uses inexpensive Lee Hand Prime shell holders only. Accepts primers from all manufacturers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fkSlEbLaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LCDS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LCHE", "title": "Lee Precision .38 Special Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .38 Special set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .38 Special ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision .38 Special Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .38 Special set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .38 Special ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KA%2B8TDR%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LCHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.09}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LFPI", "title": "Lee Precision 223 Rem Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 22/250 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "text": "Lee Precision 223 Rem Factory Crimp Die Lee 22/250 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LgMTjtKjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LFPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LHD8", "title": "Lyman Powder Measure", "description": "This powder measure dispenses charge after charge of powder with consistent accuracy to a fraction of a grain. The key to unfailing precision is the 55's unique three slide adjustable cavity. Extra fine adjustments of width and depth provide consistent charges with almost any powder. A 2400 grain reservoir resists chemical action and protects your powder from harmful light rays. An attached knocker assures a complete charge every time. Mount the 55 on your bench or any turret press. No funnel is required. Includes a 7/8-Inchx 14 thread adapter for press or stand mounting.", "text": "Lyman Powder Measure This powder measure dispenses charge after charge of powder with consistent accuracy to a fraction of a grain. The key to unfailing precision is the 55's unique three slide adjustable cavity. Extra fine adjustments of width and depth provide consistent charges with almost any powder. A 2400 grain reservoir resists chemical action and protects your powder from harmful light rays. An attached knocker assures a complete charge every time. Mount the 55 on your bench or any turret press. No funnel is required. Includes a 7/8-Inchx 14 thread adapter for press or stand mounting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MaxMDrx8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LHD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 64.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LJOA", "title": "Lee Precision 30/06 Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 30/06 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "text": "Lee Precision 30/06 Factory Crimp Die Lee 30/06 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qRRodv03L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LJOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LMWY", "title": "Lee Hand Priming Tool Shell Holder Set", "description": "The Lee Precision Auto Prime Shell Holder Set uses standard shell holders and will fit any brand of loading press with a vertical ram. Primes are on upstroke for most sensitive feel. Includes primer feeders and punches for both large and small primers. Primer tray detaches for filling. Primers are flipped right side up by shaking the tray. The Lee Precision Auto Prime Shell Holder Set comes with a red storage box and 11 shellholders for the Lee Auto-Prime.", "text": "Lee Hand Priming Tool Shell Holder Set The Lee Precision Auto Prime Shell Holder Set uses standard shell holders and will fit any brand of loading press with a vertical ram. Primes are on upstroke for most sensitive feel. Includes primer feeders and punches for both large and small primers. Primer tray detaches for filling. Primers are flipped right side up by shaking the tray. The Lee Precision Auto Prime Shell Holder Set comes with a red storage box and 11 shellholders for the Lee Auto-Prime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FmPOey5cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LMWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.8}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LMX8", "title": "Lee Precision .38 Special Carbide 4-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 4 Die Set for .38 Special set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, a carbide full length sizing die, and a carbide factory crimp die. This 4 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .38 Special ammunition. It can also be used to load the .357 Magnum which makes it a versatile set. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision .38 Special Carbide 4-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 4 Die Set for .38 Special set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, a carbide full length sizing die, and a carbide factory crimp die. This 4 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .38 Special ammunition. It can also be used to load the .357 Magnum which makes it a versatile set. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zPSI7mPAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LMX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.35}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LNYG", "title": "RCBS Partner Press", "description": "Just starting out? The Partner Press is easy to use and incredibly durable. Our least expensive press offers big performance in a compact package. Its also perfect as a second press for different operations or a portable press for use at the range.", "text": "RCBS Partner Press Just starting out? The Partner Press is easy to use and incredibly durable. Our least expensive press offers big performance in a compact package. Its also perfect as a second press for different operations or a portable press for use at the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f9eJuVcVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LNYG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LTHC", "title": "Lyman Power Adapter For Lyman Trimmers", "description": "Economical power trimming for reloaders who already own Lyman's original Universal Trimmer. Quickly convert to power trimming. Replace the existing trimmer shaft with the power adapter shaft and attach your drill. You're ready to power trim over 250 cases an hour. The adapter shaft comes with its own cutter and stop collars so you can convert back and forth from power to hand operation. The power adapter only fits the Lyman Universal Trimmer.", "text": "Lyman Power Adapter For Lyman Trimmers Economical power trimming for reloaders who already own Lyman's original Universal Trimmer. Quickly convert to power trimming. Replace the existing trimmer shaft with the power adapter shaft and attach your drill. You're ready to power trim over 250 cases an hour. The adapter shaft comes with its own cutter and stop collars so you can convert back and forth from power to hand operation. The power adapter only fits the Lyman Universal Trimmer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t-qtk8EcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LTHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 28.56}}
{"item_id": "B000N8LU26", "title": "Bulldog Universal Speed Loader with Belt Loop", "description": "Universal Speed Loader (With Belt Loop)", "text": "Bulldog Universal Speed Loader with Belt Loop Universal Speed Loader (With Belt Loop)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21tZZy24JlL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8LU26.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 25.38}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MU66", "title": "Crosman 0410 Targetfinder Rifle Scope", "description": "The Targetfinder is a four-power scope with focusing eyepiece, precision-coated optics, and turret adjustments for windage and elevation. The scope easily mounts on all current Crosman air rifles with 0.375-inch dovetail grooved receiver, but is not recommended for spring air rifles.About CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "text": "Crosman 0410 Targetfinder Rifle Scope The Targetfinder is a four-power scope with focusing eyepiece, precision-coated optics, and turret adjustments for windage and elevation. The scope easily mounts on all current Crosman air rifles with 0.375-inch dovetail grooved receiver, but is not recommended for spring air rifles.About CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xB%2BPe9TpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MU66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MUM0", "title": "RCBS Uniflow Powder Baffle", "description": "Uniform loads require consistent powder charges, and many handloaders find a baffle helps them throw more consistent charges. The RCBS Uniform Powder Baffle is specifically designed for the RCBS Powder Measures and provides handloaders a uniform powder flow by controlling the gravity feed pressure of the powder column on the metering unit.", "text": "RCBS Uniflow Powder Baffle Uniform loads require consistent powder charges, and many handloaders find a baffle helps them throw more consistent charges. The RCBS Uniform Powder Baffle is specifically designed for the RCBS Powder Measures and provides handloaders a uniform powder flow by controlling the gravity feed pressure of the powder column on the metering unit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21vNy2bCLtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MUM0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 10.79}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MUUM", "title": "Lee Precision .380 Magnum Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .380 Magnum set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .380 Magnum ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision .380 Magnum Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .380 Magnum set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .380 Magnum ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KA%2B8TDR%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MUUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.13}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MUX4", "title": "Lee Precision 30/30 Win Gauge/Holder", "description": "Lee 30/30 WIN Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "text": "Lee Precision 30/30 Win Gauge/Holder Lee 30/30 WIN Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mHbVfi0aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MUX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 6.23}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MWBE", "title": "Lyman Deburring Tool", "description": "Bevels and removes burrs from both inside and outside of case mouth. Precision machined and hardened, it fits all cases from .17 to .45 caliber.", "text": "Lyman Deburring Tool Bevels and removes burrs from both inside and outside of case mouth. Precision machined and hardened, it fits all cases from .17 to .45 caliber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hV2izJlLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MWBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MWHS", "title": "Lee Precision 380 Carbide Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 380 Auto Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "text": "Lee Precision 380 Carbide Factory Crimp Die Lee 380 Auto Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QHM23XgeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MWHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.9}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MX90", "title": "RCBS Primer Catcher Assy-Rock Chucker", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Primer Catcher Assy-Rock Chucker RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41epMm9DxfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MX90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.83}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MYO4", "title": "Weaver Base Top Mount", "description": "Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Base Top Mount Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31shf5TySPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MYO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B000N8MZOI", "title": "BSA 30mm Red Dot Scope with 5 MOA", "description": "The BSA Multi-Purpose sighting systems are a wonderful lightweight sight for close quarter and medium range targets. Light enough for small calibers, plinking on the range, yet durable enough for larger calibers used by hunters and law enforcement departments. The 5/8-3/8 adjustable mounting system is perfect for shotguns, rifles, pistols, bows and crossbows. You can adjust the brightness of the dot, depending on the brightness of your surroundingsNOTE:1) Move the sight back and forth until the correct eye relief distance is achieved2)If the dot appears to have a halo or be out of focus the brightness setting should be reduced until it is clear and sharp.", "text": "BSA 30mm Red Dot Scope with 5 MOA The BSA Multi-Purpose sighting systems are a wonderful lightweight sight for close quarter and medium range targets. Light enough for small calibers, plinking on the range, yet durable enough for larger calibers used by hunters and law enforcement departments. The 5/8-3/8 adjustable mounting system is perfect for shotguns, rifles, pistols, bows and crossbows. You can adjust the brightness of the dot, depending on the brightness of your surroundingsNOTE:1) Move the sight back and forth until the correct eye relief distance is achieved2)If the dot appears to have a halo or be out of focus the brightness setting should be reduced until it is clear and sharp.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nWTBjB36L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8MZOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 25.69}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N1YQ", "title": "RCBS Bullet Puller without Collet", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Bullet Puller without Collet RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31M3wf1rw9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N1YQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.82}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N2JK", "title": "RCBS Primer Pocket Brush", "description": "A build-up of residue in primer pockets can cause misfires. A couple of twists with the RCBS Primer Pocket Brush and residue is easily cleaned out. Brushes have stainless bristles and interchangeable mounts for large and small primer pockets. Comes with a no-roll accessory handle.", "text": "RCBS Primer Pocket Brush A build-up of residue in primer pockets can cause misfires. A couple of twists with the RCBS Primer Pocket Brush and residue is easily cleaned out. Brushes have stainless bristles and interchangeable mounts for large and small primer pockets. Comes with a no-roll accessory handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fho1WXQ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N2JK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N344", "title": "Lyman E-Zee Case Gauge", "description": "This improved version measures the case length of over 70 popular rifle and pistol cases. Many new cartridges are included like the Winchester Short Mags, 204 Ruger, 500 S&W; and others. Precisely made, this rugged metal gauge makes sorting cases quick, easy and accurate.", "text": "Lyman E-Zee Case Gauge This improved version measures the case length of over 70 popular rifle and pistol cases. Many new cartridges are included like the Winchester Short Mags, 204 Ruger, 500 S&W; and others. Precisely made, this rugged metal gauge makes sorting cases quick, easy and accurate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X1iuQvhuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N344.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.11}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N4BQ", "title": "RCBS 30/7.35 Bullet Puller Collet", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS 30/7.35 Bullet Puller Collet RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RGeHglzTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N4BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.76}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N538", "title": "Lee Precision Universal Flaring Die", "description": "Lee Universal Flaring Die gently flares the case mouth to accept cast bullets without shaving. Includes neck plugs for .22 cal through .45 cal", "text": "Lee Precision Universal Flaring Die Lee Universal Flaring Die gently flares the case mouth to accept cast bullets without shaving. Includes neck plugs for .22 cal through .45 cal", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41txktwtfPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N538.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.59}}
{"item_id": "B000N8N64Q", "title": "Lyman Stainless Caliper", "description": "This precision tool will deliver unfailing .001-Inchaccuracy long after the best reloading dies have worn out. Comes with storage case.", "text": "Lyman Stainless Caliper This precision tool will deliver unfailing .001-Inchaccuracy long after the best reloading dies have worn out. Comes with storage case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LGLysq5gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8N64Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 23.65}}
