{"item_id": "B000N8OF3W", "title": "Bianchi 5 Black Widow Hip Holster - Ruger Gp100 2-4-Inch", "description": "The Bianchi Model 5Black Widow Belt Slide Holster is worn on the hip and offers an ultra hi-ride carry and thumb snap closure. The dual belt slots provide superior stability and its open muzzle design offers pistols of the same model with different barrel lengths. Its compact profile offers and widely spaced belt slots allow the pistol to ride close to the body for both comfort and concealability.", "text": "Bianchi 5 Black Widow Hip Holster - Ruger Gp100 2-4-Inch The Bianchi Model 5Black Widow Belt Slide Holster is worn on the hip and offers an ultra hi-ride carry and thumb snap closure. The dual belt slots provide superior stability and its open muzzle design offers pistols of the same model with different barrel lengths. Its compact profile offers and widely spaced belt slots allow the pistol to ride close to the body for both comfort and concealability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H1Li1dozL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OF3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi Gun Leather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 56.42}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OG90", "title": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Corncob (10-Pounds)", "description": "Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Specially Treated Corncob.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Corncob (10-Pounds) Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Specially Treated Corncob.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Lsh3814gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OG90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.08}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OGKO", "title": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32", "description": "The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32 The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ebU1gn2ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OGKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 25.56}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OID4", "title": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield", "description": "The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O2n-F-k8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OID4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OIE8", "title": "Lee Precision Powder Measure Kit", "description": "Lee Powder Measure Dipper Kit includes 15 graduated powder dippers from .3cc to 4.3cc. Slide card included has powder dispensing chart. Dipper data revised April of 2012.", "text": "Lee Precision Powder Measure Kit Lee Powder Measure Dipper Kit includes 15 graduated powder dippers from .3cc to 4.3cc. Slide card included has powder dispensing chart. Dipper data revised April of 2012.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T-weQ9X5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OIE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.46}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OKGE", "title": "Lyman Flash Hole Uniformer", "description": "This handy tool removes internal flash hole burrs. Features a tool steel cutter which is inserted into the flash hole through the case neck. Adjustable stop collar allows use with any size case. Burrs are removed with a clockwise turn. Fits .22 to .45 Calibers.", "text": "Lyman Flash Hole Uniformer This handy tool removes internal flash hole burrs. Features a tool steel cutter which is inserted into the flash hole through the case neck. Adjustable stop collar allows use with any size case. Burrs are removed with a clockwise turn. Fits .22 to .45 Calibers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/214xCE3hNFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OKGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 20.02}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OKK0", "title": "Lee Precision Deluxe .223 3-Die Rifle Set (Grey)", "description": "The Lee Precision 223 3-Die Deluxe Set includes Full Length Sizing Die which need lubrication. Also includes Collet Die which sizes the neck, Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, and Universal Shell Holder. Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data", "text": "Lee Precision Deluxe .223 3-Die Rifle Set (Grey) The Lee Precision 223 3-Die Deluxe Set includes Full Length Sizing Die which need lubrication. Also includes Collet Die which sizes the neck, Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, and Universal Shell Holder. Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KWOzBQ1dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OKK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 31.67}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OLCM", "title": "Lee Precision 45 ACP Carbide 4-Die Set (Grey)", "description": "The Lee Precision 45 ACP Pistol 4-Die Set Comes With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Comes With Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision 45 ACP Carbide 4-Die Set (Grey) The Lee Precision 45 ACP Pistol 4-Die Set Comes With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Comes With Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zPSI7mPAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OLCM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8OOCO", "title": "Galco Ankle Glove / Ankle Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33", "description": "Serious gun carriers who need deep concealment and prefer an ankle holster almost universally praise Galco’s Ankle Glove. Those who need concealment 80 hours a week, year in and year out, find the Ankle Glove so comfortable to wear that they forget it’s there – until they need it. The Ankle Glove’s wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure offer extended wearing comfort and unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle. It also features a reinforced thumb break for speed of draw and detailed molding for firearm retention. The Ankle Glove may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately). Constructed of premium saddle leather stitched to a neoprene band, the Ankle Glove accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Glove is available in right or left hand draw in black finish. Ankle Gloves for small revolvers: Models AG158/AG159 are an open top design, meaning they do not have a safety strap and thumbreak. Instead, they have a tension unit, and work with both hammered and hammerless guns. Models AG160/AG161 have a retention strap (thumb break) that runs behind the grip frame (not behind the hammer). They work with both hammered and hammerless guns, but some guns with factory supplied custom or oversized rubber grips will not fit because the retention strap is not long enough to wrap around them. Works best with slim wood or \"boot\" grips.", "text": "Galco Ankle Glove / Ankle Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 Serious gun carriers who need deep concealment and prefer an ankle holster almost universally praise Galco’s Ankle Glove. Those who need concealment 80 hours a week, year in and year out, find the Ankle Glove so comfortable to wear that they forget it’s there – until they need it. The Ankle Glove’s wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure offer extended wearing comfort and unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle. It also features a reinforced thumb break for speed of draw and detailed molding for firearm retention. The Ankle Glove may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately). Constructed of premium saddle leather stitched to a neoprene band, the Ankle Glove accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Glove is available in right or left hand draw in black finish. Ankle Gloves for small revolvers: Models AG158/AG159 are an open top design, meaning they do not have a safety strap and thumbreak. Instead, they have a tension unit, and work with both hammered and hammerless guns. Models AG160/AG161 have a retention strap (thumb break) that runs behind the grip frame (not behind the hammer). They work with both hammered and hammerless guns, but some guns with factory supplied custom or oversized rubber grips will not fit because the retention strap is not long enough to wrap around them. Works best with slim wood or \"boot\" grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VJGx5tgtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8OOCO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 79.16}}
{"item_id": "B000N8QIIM", "title": "Uncle Mike's Sidekick Holster Belt, Up to 50-Inch Waist (One Size, Black)", "description": "With Uncle Mike's Sidekick Holster Belt you can load it up. This 2\" black nylon web belt is durable enough to carry all your accessories. Perfect companion for Uncle Mike's hip holsters and most other accessories. Includes convenient flip-open buckle and keeper.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Sidekick Holster Belt, Up to 50-Inch Waist (One Size, Black) With Uncle Mike's Sidekick Holster Belt you can load it up. This 2\" black nylon web belt is durable enough to carry all your accessories. Perfect companion for Uncle Mike's hip holsters and most other accessories. Includes convenient flip-open buckle and keeper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413clOpr2QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8QIIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8QISC", "title": "Ksa Crickett Stationary Mount Base", "description": "Davey Crickett Scope Mount Base Specifically for .22 Caliber Single Shot Bolt Action Black", "text": "Ksa Crickett Stationary Mount Base Davey Crickett Scope Mount Base Specifically for .22 Caliber Single Shot Bolt Action Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BOfmymD4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8QISC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Keystone Sporting Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 13.49}}
{"item_id": "B000N8QKUI", "title": "Lyman Powder Pal Electronic Scale Funnel Pan", "description": "A new innovative product for the reloader. The New One Piece Combination Powder Pal Funnel Pan. This unique Funnel Pan saves time by saving one step during reloading. It is no longer necessary to put the funnel on the cartridge case and pour the powder in. Just pour it directly from the Funnel Pan into the case. Every reloader with an electronic scale will want to replace the powder pan with a New Time Saving Powder Pal Funnel Pan. New innovations from Lyman. For use with electronic scales only.", "text": "Lyman Powder Pal Electronic Scale Funnel Pan A new innovative product for the reloader. The New One Piece Combination Powder Pal Funnel Pan. This unique Funnel Pan saves time by saving one step during reloading. It is no longer necessary to put the funnel on the cartridge case and pour the powder in. Just pour it directly from the Funnel Pan into the case. Every reloader with an electronic scale will want to replace the powder pan with a New Time Saving Powder Pal Funnel Pan. New innovations from Lyman. For use with electronic scales only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gVJ9xEgHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8QKUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B000N8QM8S", "title": "Lee Precision 45ACP Carbide Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 45 ACP/45 AUTO RIM/45 SCHOFIELD/45 WIN MAG/45 GAP Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "text": "Lee Precision 45ACP Carbide Factory Crimp Die Lee 45 ACP/45 AUTO RIM/45 SCHOFIELD/45 WIN MAG/45 GAP Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412qau2AL2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N8QM8S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.7}}
{"item_id": "B000N9PU3K", "title": "AQUA ZOOKA Quick Fill Water Bazooka", "description": "", "text": "AQUA ZOOKA Quick Fill Water Bazooka", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DlQzg8ImL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N9PU3K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000N9XMZS", "title": "MotorGuide Breaker KIT-50AMP-Manual", "description": "Protect your trolling motor from shorts and wiring damage with the 50-amp manual reset breaker from MotorGuide. Designed for use with high-thrust, high-performance motors, this Breaker Kit includes a heavy-duty 6-gauge battery terminal that also allows you to add a second or third battery in a 24- or 36-volt installation.", "text": "MotorGuide Breaker KIT-50AMP-Manual Protect your trolling motor from shorts and wiring damage with the 50-amp manual reset breaker from MotorGuide. Designed for use with high-thrust, high-performance motors, this Breaker Kit includes a heavy-duty 6-gauge battery terminal that also allows you to add a second or third battery in a 24- or 36-volt installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516FaNcSR3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000N9XMZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Motorguide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Motors", "Trolling Motors"]], "price": 16.17}}
{"item_id": "B000NADHIO", "title": "Buffer Technologies Beretta 92/96 Recoil Buffer", "description": "Our buffer for the Beretta 92/96 is a departure from our original line of buffers. It was not possible to place a cushioning buffer between the slide and frame, as with our other recoil buffers, without making our own guide rod. This new design includes a stainless steel guide rod with a slide bushing and, of course, a recoil buffer. The guide rod and slide bushing are made from a high carbon stainless steel which has a hardness of 48-52 Rockwell. During our testing, we fired in excess of 1,000 rounds through a Langdon Tactical Technologies 92 Vertec. Not a single malfunction was experienced! By installing the new guide rod and buffer you too will reduce felt recoil, enhance muzzle control, and lengthen service life. The guide rod and buffer will fit both the 92 and 96 series of Beretta handguns. Installation is a simple: slide the bushing into the guide rod hole in the slide and swap your old guide rod for our new one, complete with buffer. When you pull the slide to the rear, the slide contacts the buffer before it impacts the frame. Note: This buffer will only work in the full size variants of the Models 92 and 96. Also works in Taurus 92/96.", "text": "Buffer Technologies Beretta 92/96 Recoil Buffer Our buffer for the Beretta 92/96 is a departure from our original line of buffers. It was not possible to place a cushioning buffer between the slide and frame, as with our other recoil buffers, without making our own guide rod. This new design includes a stainless steel guide rod with a slide bushing and, of course, a recoil buffer. The guide rod and slide bushing are made from a high carbon stainless steel which has a hardness of 48-52 Rockwell. During our testing, we fired in excess of 1,000 rounds through a Langdon Tactical Technologies 92 Vertec. Not a single malfunction was experienced! By installing the new guide rod and buffer you too will reduce felt recoil, enhance muzzle control, and lengthen service life. The guide rod and buffer will fit both the 92 and 96 series of Beretta handguns. Installation is a simple: slide the bushing into the guide rod hole in the slide and swap your old guide rod for our new one, complete with buffer. When you pull the slide to the rear, the slide contacts the buffer before it impacts the frame. Note: This buffer will only work in the full size variants of the Models 92 and 96. Also works in Taurus 92/96.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51m0efR7kEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NADHIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buffer Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B000NAY7BU", "title": "Outdoor Research Radar Pocket Cap", "description": "Function lies at the heart of this street-styled Radar Pocket Cap. It shields you from the sun with UPF 30 protection, keeps you dry with the TransAction headband, and stores away in your pocket with the help of the folding bill. It's a good thing this comes in many colors-you'll want more than one.", "text": "Outdoor Research Radar Pocket Cap Function lies at the heart of this street-styled Radar Pocket Cap. It shields you from the sun with UPF 30 protection, keeps you dry with the TransAction headband, and stores away in your pocket with the help of the folding bill. It's a good thing this comes in many colors-you'll want more than one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SvflIZMNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NAY7BU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NB3W7O", "title": "Boric Acid Powder - 12 Oz", "description": "INDICATIONS: Boric Acid (100%) Powder is odorless and nonstaining. Boric Acid Powder kills roaches, water bugs, ants, fleas and silverfish. Boric Acid Powder insects walk through the dust, ingest it, and die within hours. DIRECTIONS: Apply lightly to crac", "text": "Boric Acid Powder - 12 Oz INDICATIONS: Boric Acid (100%) Powder is odorless and nonstaining. Boric Acid Powder kills roaches, water bugs, ants, fleas and silverfish. Boric Acid Powder insects walk through the dust, ingest it, and die within hours. DIRECTIONS: Apply lightly to crac", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zjzibFeKL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NB3W7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HUMCO HOLDING GROUP, INC. ***", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 14.17}}
{"item_id": "B000NBED7W", "title": "Picnic Time Portable Folding Sports Chair, Black", "description": "This lightweight, portable folding chair with a sturdy aluminum frame is ideal for those who enjoy spectator sports, RV-ing, camping, or simple backyard barbecuing. Boasting a wide variety of features, the chair is the perfect traveling companion. An accessories panel on the side includes a variety of pockets to hold cell phones, sunglasses, magazines, or a scorekeeper's pad. It also includes an insulated bottled beverage pouch and a zippered security pocket to keep valuables out of plain view. A convenient side table folds out and will hold up to 10 pounds of weight, making it perfect for holding food or drinks.The extra-wide seat is 19-1/2 inches and is made of durable 600D polyester with padding for extra comfort. Padded armrests add to the comfort. With a weight capacity of 300 pounds, the sturdy chair also has an adjustable shoulder strap for easy carrying. Two sturdy webbing handles come into view when the chair is folded and make for an additional way of transporting the chair.", "text": "Picnic Time Portable Folding Sports Chair, Black This lightweight, portable folding chair with a sturdy aluminum frame is ideal for those who enjoy spectator sports, RV-ing, camping, or simple backyard barbecuing. Boasting a wide variety of features, the chair is the perfect traveling companion. An accessories panel on the side includes a variety of pockets to hold cell phones, sunglasses, magazines, or a scorekeeper's pad. It also includes an insulated bottled beverage pouch and a zippered security pocket to keep valuables out of plain view. A convenient side table folds out and will hold up to 10 pounds of weight, making it perfect for holding food or drinks.The extra-wide seat is 19-1/2 inches and is made of durable 600D polyester with padding for extra comfort. Padded armrests add to the comfort. With a weight capacity of 300 pounds, the sturdy chair also has an adjustable shoulder strap for easy carrying. Two sturdy webbing handles come into view when the chair is folded and make for an additional way of transporting the chair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X-dmtxi-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NBED7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Picnic Time", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 86.67}}
{"item_id": "B000NCL5SG", "title": "Primos Ninja Cotton Full-Hood Face Mask - Mossy Oak New Break-Up", "description": "The ultimate mask for both comfort and concealment, our cotton masks feature form-fitted eye, nose, and mouth opening, as well as an elastic band to hold the mask in place without slipping. Glasses can be worn over or under the masks with no loss of peripheral vision. The specially-designed openings help prevent glasses from fogging up.", "text": "Primos Ninja Cotton Full-Hood Face Mask - Mossy Oak New Break-Up The ultimate mask for both comfort and concealment, our cotton masks feature form-fitted eye, nose, and mouth opening, as well as an elastic band to hold the mask in place without slipping. Glasses can be worn over or under the masks with no loss of peripheral vision. The specially-designed openings help prevent glasses from fogging up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ECQsWBVbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NCL5SG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 9.26}}
{"item_id": "B000NCO7PE", "title": "Feather Flex Men's Feather Flex Decoy, Three-Position Hen", "description": "This ultralight, flexible decoy rolls up in seconds and is easy to carry to your favorite hunting spot. Specifically designed with multiple positions, allowing you to match the mating habits of turkeys in your area. Foam fabric flutters with the slightest breeze for a realistic effect. Detailed feather patterns and true-to-life colors. Two-piece stake. Imported.", "text": "Feather Flex Men's Feather Flex Decoy, Three-Position Hen This ultralight, flexible decoy rolls up in seconds and is easy to carry to your favorite hunting spot. Specifically designed with multiple positions, allowing you to match the mating habits of turkeys in your area. Foam fabric flutters with the slightest breeze for a realistic effect. Detailed feather patterns and true-to-life colors. Two-piece stake. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411twNFOTIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NCO7PE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flambeau Turkey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]], "price": 26.26}}
{"item_id": "B000NCO7SG", "title": "Primos The Gobbler Shaker Call", "description": "Built for ease of use, the Gobbler Shaker Call from Primos allows you to create jake gobbling with one hand and adult gobbling with two hands. The loud shaker provides sounds that will both challenge and locate gobblers. A patented silencer cap eliminates unintended sounds.", "text": "Primos The Gobbler Shaker Call Built for ease of use, the Gobbler Shaker Call from Primos allows you to create jake gobbling with one hand and adult gobbling with two hands. The loud shaker provides sounds that will both challenge and locate gobblers. A patented silencer cap eliminates unintended sounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3126HPTuVKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NCO7SG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 13.35}}
