{"item_id": "B000NE2HPE", "title": "Unbreakable Golf Tees - 2.7/8\"", "description": "We, and 1,000's of our happy customers, believe that these are The Best Golf Tees in the World!! Try for yourself and decide. Our UNBREAKABLE GOLF TEES are made from a proprietary blend of synthetics, re-creating every aspect of real wood (except breaking). Made in Germany, these UNBREAKABLE GOLF TEES are the ideal combination of strength, durability and forgiveness...We don't claim more distance or control, but we do guarantee that each tee will last for 100+ shots. That they wont damage the grass mowers on the golf course or scratch your clubface (plus they're recyclable!). Enjoy a game with NO more broken tees, NO more polluting the tee box and NO more cutting down trees! It's a win-win for everyone...Available in 3 sizes and 2 colors: X-Long 4.0\", Long 2.7/8\" and Standard 2.1/4\" in White or Orange.", "text": "Unbreakable Golf Tees - 2.7/8\" We, and 1,000's of our happy customers, believe that these are The Best Golf Tees in the World!! Try for yourself and decide. Our UNBREAKABLE GOLF TEES are made from a proprietary blend of synthetics, re-creating every aspect of real wood (except breaking). Made in Germany, these UNBREAKABLE GOLF TEES are the ideal combination of strength, durability and forgiveness...We don't claim more distance or control, but we do guarantee that each tee will last for 100+ shots. That they wont damage the grass mowers on the golf course or scratch your clubface (plus they're recyclable!). Enjoy a game with NO more broken tees, NO more polluting the tee box and NO more cutting down trees! It's a win-win for everyone...Available in 3 sizes and 2 colors: X-Long 4.0\", Long 2.7/8\" and Standard 2.1/4\" in White or Orange.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510MHG9XFSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NE2HPE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]]}}
