{"item_id": "B000NFV9L6", "title": "BLACKHAWK! 100oz AntiMicrobial Replacement Reservoir", "description": "It is available with Black, Coyote Tan, or Foliage Green screw tops and lanyard. Bite Me bite valve with on/off lever is also included.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! 100oz AntiMicrobial Replacement Reservoir It is available with Black, Coyote Tan, or Foliage Green screw tops and lanyard. Bite Me bite valve with on/off lever is also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JavAGhFCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NFV9L6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 31.12}}
{"item_id": "B000NGRNC4", "title": "Continental Ultra Sport Bicycle Tire", "description": "Continental 0118529 Ultra Sport-700 x 25 Black Tire allows you to work out like the pros. The new dynamically patterned tread, which can be matched to the bike’s frame thanks to four color options, improves the value of any racing bike. An attractive tread design and a choice of colored treads can turn any race bike into a superb visual masterpiece. Ultra Sport tires make a stunning impact on every training ride and is ideal for newcomers to road racing. In addition to the Ultra Sport color versions, the Ultra Sport with SafetySystem offers extra puncture protection – the right tire for all who want to safeguard against a troublesome flat when they are underway. The Safety System technology is puncture protection made of tightly-woven nylon fabric, combined with Kevlar to provide supreme resistance to pinches and cuts. Safety System is also highly effective against debris, thorns and broken glass. It is positioned between the thread and the casing for a lightweight, superior protection without affecting the quality of the tire. Specs: Color - black/black skinwall; Black Chili - no; Weight - 330; Recommended PSI - 95; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "text": "Continental Ultra Sport Bicycle Tire Continental 0118529 Ultra Sport-700 x 25 Black Tire allows you to work out like the pros. The new dynamically patterned tread, which can be matched to the bike’s frame thanks to four color options, improves the value of any racing bike. An attractive tread design and a choice of colored treads can turn any race bike into a superb visual masterpiece. Ultra Sport tires make a stunning impact on every training ride and is ideal for newcomers to road racing. In addition to the Ultra Sport color versions, the Ultra Sport with SafetySystem offers extra puncture protection – the right tire for all who want to safeguard against a troublesome flat when they are underway. The Safety System technology is puncture protection made of tightly-woven nylon fabric, combined with Kevlar to provide supreme resistance to pinches and cuts. Safety System is also highly effective against debris, thorns and broken glass. It is positioned between the thread and the casing for a lightweight, superior protection without affecting the quality of the tire. Specs: Color - black/black skinwall; Black Chili - no; Weight - 330; Recommended PSI - 95; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TMOB08epL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NGRNC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NGT2VY", "title": "Continental Gatorskin Wire Bead Road Bike Tire", "description": "Designed as a high mileage tire with excellent flat protection. Many refer to the Gatorskin as \"Bullet Proof\". A layer of Duraskin and an extra layer of Kevlar under the tread keeps flat protection to a maximum. Low rolling resistance tread design excells in both wet and dry. 280 grams - 23mm Wire bead, 300 grams - 25mm Wire bead, 320 grams - 28mm Wire bead, 350 grams - 26\", 340 grams - 27\"", "text": "Continental Gatorskin Wire Bead Road Bike Tire Designed as a high mileage tire with excellent flat protection. Many refer to the Gatorskin as \"Bullet Proof\". A layer of Duraskin and an extra layer of Kevlar under the tread keeps flat protection to a maximum. Low rolling resistance tread design excells in both wet and dry. 280 grams - 23mm Wire bead, 300 grams - 25mm Wire bead, 320 grams - 28mm Wire bead, 350 grams - 26\", 340 grams - 27\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lgIW4ufrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NGT2VY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NHLRTS", "title": "Hyperflex Wetsuits Men's Access 3/2mm Full Suit", "description": "The Hyperflex Access Series is an exceptionally valued priced line of wetsuits catering to the needs of the entry level surfer. These suits offer flatlock seams for maximum durability and strength, anatomically cut pattern, adjustable collar, and beefy YKK Zipper. Well suited for use in various watersports the suit offers nearly limitless thermal protection possibilities. Great style, superior value! on the lake or in the ocean! The Hyperflex Access line is also available in Women's styles as well as Children's and Junior's sizes in a host of designs and thickness for all water conditions and sporting activities.", "text": "Hyperflex Wetsuits Men's Access 3/2mm Full Suit The Hyperflex Access Series is an exceptionally valued priced line of wetsuits catering to the needs of the entry level surfer. These suits offer flatlock seams for maximum durability and strength, anatomically cut pattern, adjustable collar, and beefy YKK Zipper. Well suited for use in various watersports the suit offers nearly limitless thermal protection possibilities. Great style, superior value! on the lake or in the ocean! The Hyperflex Access line is also available in Women's styles as well as Children's and Junior's sizes in a host of designs and thickness for all water conditions and sporting activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rZ5Q0YkZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NHLRTS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NHWMGU", "title": "Drinkwell Pet Fountain Cleaning Kit", "description": "", "text": "Drinkwell Pet Fountain Cleaning Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415aU49nDYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NHWMGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Drinkwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.93}}
{"item_id": "B000NHZV1S", "title": "Guest 2611A Charge Pro Series Marine Battery Charger (12/24-Volt, 10-Amps 5/5, Double Output)", "description": "Keep your boat battery fully charged with the Guest 2611A Charge Pro marine battery charger. Designed to meet all Guest harsh environment guidelines, the double-output charger is equipped with a three-stage switching electronic circuit, with protections against short-circuiting, ignition, and reverse polarity. The battery is also self-protecting under extreme ambient conditions, including moisture, vibration, and shock. Best of all, the 2611A charges both 12- and 24-volt output Flooded, Gel, and AGM batteries, so you won't run out of juice at the worst possible moment. Other features include support for the ConnectCharge permanent mounting system, a maintenance mode that protects the batteries during storage, and a lifetime warranty against water damage.Specifications:Total amps: 10Number of outputs: 2Amps per output: 5/5Battery system: 2, 12-volt or 24-volt outputOutput voltage: 12-voltDC output: Two 4-foot cables with ring terminalsInput voltage: 100 to 130-volt DC/50 to 60 HzAC input: 6-foot cord with ConnectCharge plugDimensions: 7.75 by 5.5 by 2.42 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.6 poundsWarranty: 2 years, limited", "text": "Guest 2611A Charge Pro Series Marine Battery Charger (12/24-Volt, 10-Amps 5/5, Double Output) Keep your boat battery fully charged with the Guest 2611A Charge Pro marine battery charger. Designed to meet all Guest harsh environment guidelines, the double-output charger is equipped with a three-stage switching electronic circuit, with protections against short-circuiting, ignition, and reverse polarity. The battery is also self-protecting under extreme ambient conditions, including moisture, vibration, and shock. Best of all, the 2611A charges both 12- and 24-volt output Flooded, Gel, and AGM batteries, so you won't run out of juice at the worst possible moment. Other features include support for the ConnectCharge permanent mounting system, a maintenance mode that protects the batteries during storage, and a lifetime warranty against water damage.Specifications:Total amps: 10Number of outputs: 2Amps per output: 5/5Battery system: 2, 12-volt or 24-volt outputOutput voltage: 12-voltDC output: Two 4-foot cables with ring terminalsInput voltage: 100 to 130-volt DC/50 to 60 HzAC input: 6-foot cord with ConnectCharge plugDimensions: 7.75 by 5.5 by 2.42 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.6 poundsWarranty: 2 years, limited", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zof96WTlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NHZV1S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Battery Chargers"]], "price": 114.84}}
{"item_id": "B000NI06LM", "title": "Ancor Marine Grade Electrical Heat Activated Adhesive Lined Shrink Tubing", "description": "Ancor 304506 Marine grade electrical adhesive lined heat shrink tubing kit(3/8-Inch diameter, 6-inches long, assorted colors, 5-Pack)", "text": "Ancor Marine Grade Electrical Heat Activated Adhesive Lined Shrink Tubing Ancor 304506 Marine grade electrical adhesive lined heat shrink tubing kit(3/8-Inch diameter, 6-inches long, assorted colors, 5-Pack)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bw9dXjIqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NI06LM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Wire Terminals"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NI38MG", "title": "Marinco 150BBI Marine On-Board Charger Inlet (15-Amp, 125-Volt, Black)", "description": "CHARGER INLET makes battery charging through an on-board battery charger safer and more convenient. Inlet mounts on boat exterior and is hard-wired directly to charger. To use, just open the flip lid cover and plug an extension cord into the inlet. All hatches remain closed and locked throughout the charging cycle, adding security. 15 amp, 125 volt straight blade inlet. Can be mounted anywhere, fiberglass and aluminum. UV resistant housing and cap. Color coded wire entrance holes for easy wiring.", "text": "Marinco 150BBI Marine On-Board Charger Inlet (15-Amp, 125-Volt, Black) CHARGER INLET makes battery charging through an on-board battery charger safer and more convenient. Inlet mounts on boat exterior and is hard-wired directly to charger. To use, just open the flip lid cover and plug an extension cord into the inlet. All hatches remain closed and locked throughout the charging cycle, adding security. 15 amp, 125 volt straight blade inlet. Can be mounted anywhere, fiberglass and aluminum. UV resistant housing and cap. Color coded wire entrance holes for easy wiring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WWrm0R7fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NI38MG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marinco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Battery Chargers"]], "price": 23.11}}
{"item_id": "B000NIB32S", "title": "M Essentials Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo", "description": "You know the smell: wetsuit funk. It’s not pretty, but it is preventable-and so is the chorine and salt damage that shortens the life of your expensive neoprene gear.Just use Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo by M Essentials on booties, gloves, fishing waders, LYCRA body wear, and of course, wetsuits and drysuits. Our Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo works fast to remove organic residues like algae and bacteria, plus chlorine and salt deposits-so your neoprene gear smells fresher, stays supple and lasts much longer.Preventing your own premature aging isn’t easy, but for your favorite watersports gear, M Essentials makes it a snap-with our Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo. Remember, cleaning wetsuits means less funk and more fun.", "text": "M Essentials Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo You know the smell: wetsuit funk. It’s not pretty, but it is preventable-and so is the chorine and salt damage that shortens the life of your expensive neoprene gear.Just use Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo by M Essentials on booties, gloves, fishing waders, LYCRA body wear, and of course, wetsuits and drysuits. Our Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo works fast to remove organic residues like algae and bacteria, plus chlorine and salt deposits-so your neoprene gear smells fresher, stays supple and lasts much longer.Preventing your own premature aging isn’t easy, but for your favorite watersports gear, M Essentials makes it a snap-with our Wetsuit and Drysuit Shampoo. Remember, cleaning wetsuits means less funk and more fun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fV058ztiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NIB32S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 5.98}}
{"item_id": "B000NIFAZ4", "title": "Omega Men's 2221.80.00 Seamaster 300M Quartz \"James Bond\" Blue Dial Watch", "description": "", "text": "Omega Men's 2221.80.00 Seamaster 300M Quartz \"James Bond\" Blue Dial Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MATydlBDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NIFAZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Jewelry: International Shipping Available"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Luxury Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Available for International Shipping"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Omega Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women's Luxury Brands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NJHD1W", "title": "Grip Pro Trainer Hand Grip Forearm Strength Gripper 30, 40 & 50 lbs FULL SET of all 3 weights", "description": "Grip Pro trainer is an extremely effective finger-hand-forearm strength and endurance trainer. It comes in 3 different levels of difficulty: Green-30lb max resistance (easier)-for lighter weight people and warming up, Black-40lb max resistance (medium) for average weight men to train with and Red 50lb max resistance (difficult) for big guys or lower rep strength training. Can be used anywhere and anytime. Try 3 sets of 30-100 reps a couple times a week for best results over time. Its also great for stress relief. This is a set of three grips that comes with one of each size: 30 lb, 40 lb, and 50 lb.", "text": "Grip Pro Trainer Hand Grip Forearm Strength Gripper 30, 40 & 50 lbs FULL SET of all 3 weights Grip Pro trainer is an extremely effective finger-hand-forearm strength and endurance trainer. It comes in 3 different levels of difficulty: Green-30lb max resistance (easier)-for lighter weight people and warming up, Black-40lb max resistance (medium) for average weight men to train with and Red 50lb max resistance (difficult) for big guys or lower rep strength training. Can be used anywhere and anytime. Try 3 sets of 30-100 reps a couple times a week for best results over time. Its also great for stress relief. This is a set of three grips that comes with one of each size: 30 lb, 40 lb, and 50 lb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Svbl5IOsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJHD1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grip Pro Trainer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 21.03}}
{"item_id": "B000NJSYH4", "title": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Target 12-Inch Bull's Eye (12Pack)", "description": "Dirty Bird Bull's-eye targets are great for longer range shooting. Each target comes with an aiming point for open or scoped sights. Great for short or long range shooting.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Target 12-Inch Bull's Eye (12Pack) Dirty Bird Bull's-eye targets are great for longer range shooting. Each target comes with an aiming point for open or scoped sights. Great for short or long range shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W7-IoynbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJSYH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 10.49}}
{"item_id": "B000NJUPAS", "title": "BSA Sweet .22 3 - 9x40 mm Scope Matte Black", "description": "Upgrade your plinker with crystal - clear precision! BSA Sweet .22 3 - 9x40 mm Scope, SAVE BIG! A shot to remember! The BSA Sweet .22 grants serious optical power to any garden-variety .22, turning your plinker into a varmint killer. There's no guesswork, thanks to the .22-specific trajectory compensation and adjustable objective. With separate swappable turrets for all the common .22 loads! We saw a deal rear its head... and didn't hesitate to pull the trigger. Gear up here for BIG BUCKS OFF the original retail! A better look, made affordable: Specifically calibrated for the .22 LR round, with quick-change turrets for 36-gr., 38-gr. and 40-gr. bullets!; 3-9X magnification fully-coated optics; 40 mm objective; 10.8-3.6 mm exit pupil; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 36.6' at 3X, 15.7' at 9X; 3\" eye relief; 100% waterproof / fogproof / shockproof; Adjustable objective; Hand-adjustable windage and elevation.; 1\" tube.; Includes lens covers.; 13\"l. Weighs 20 ozs.; Buy rings separately.; Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Sweet .22 3-9x40 mm Scope, Matte Black", "text": "BSA Sweet .22 3 - 9x40 mm Scope Matte Black Upgrade your plinker with crystal - clear precision! BSA Sweet .22 3 - 9x40 mm Scope, SAVE BIG! A shot to remember! The BSA Sweet .22 grants serious optical power to any garden-variety .22, turning your plinker into a varmint killer. There's no guesswork, thanks to the .22-specific trajectory compensation and adjustable objective. With separate swappable turrets for all the common .22 loads! We saw a deal rear its head... and didn't hesitate to pull the trigger. Gear up here for BIG BUCKS OFF the original retail! A better look, made affordable: Specifically calibrated for the .22 LR round, with quick-change turrets for 36-gr., 38-gr. and 40-gr. bullets!; 3-9X magnification fully-coated optics; 40 mm objective; 10.8-3.6 mm exit pupil; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 36.6' at 3X, 15.7' at 9X; 3\" eye relief; 100% waterproof / fogproof / shockproof; Adjustable objective; Hand-adjustable windage and elevation.; 1\" tube.; Includes lens covers.; 13\"l. Weighs 20 ozs.; Buy rings separately.; Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Sweet .22 3-9x40 mm Scope, Matte Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tZjxos%2BoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJUPAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B000NJUUKS", "title": "Glock OEM Field Knife, Fixed Blade w/ Root Saw, Olive", "description": "Glock Field Knife Fixed Blade Knife OD Green Plain Root Saw 6.5\" Polymer", "text": "Glock OEM Field Knife, Fixed Blade w/ Root Saw, Olive Glock Field Knife Fixed Blade Knife OD Green Plain Root Saw 6.5\" Polymer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cyrll5oqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJUUKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.5}}
{"item_id": "B000NJXUUK", "title": "Allen Company Suede Leather Handgun Case", "description": "It is Padded, plush, suede leather on the outside, with synthetic fleece on the inside. The zipper runs along the length of the top two sides. Various colors: black, navy blue, forest green, cinnamon red, etc. Note: No choice of color. Excellent quality. Deluxe case great for presentation or gift-giving. Made in USA by Allen Case Co.", "text": "Allen Company Suede Leather Handgun Case It is Padded, plush, suede leather on the outside, with synthetic fleece on the inside. The zipper runs along the length of the top two sides. Various colors: black, navy blue, forest green, cinnamon red, etc. Note: No choice of color. Excellent quality. Deluxe case great for presentation or gift-giving. Made in USA by Allen Case Co.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318SClVNPmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJXUUK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]]}}
