{"item_id": "B000NJY8HE", "title": "Otis 308 Rifle Cleaning Systems", "description": "As a hunter, you know that a 600 yard shot across a wooded valley is inherently more difficult than 280 yards across an open field. But even 280 yards is not a given if conditions aren’t optimal. Don’t let an incorrect cleaning add an unexpected variable into the equation. Specifically designed for .30 cal. variants, including .308, 30/30, 30-06, 7.62 and 7MM rifles.", "text": "Otis 308 Rifle Cleaning Systems As a hunter, you know that a 600 yard shot across a wooded valley is inherently more difficult than 280 yards across an open field. But even 280 yards is not a given if conditions aren’t optimal. Don’t let an incorrect cleaning add an unexpected variable into the equation. Specifically designed for .30 cal. variants, including .308, 30/30, 30-06, 7.62 and 7MM rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vudUlBJ%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJY8HE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B000NJZ8JQ", "title": "Glock SLIDE COVER PLATE - ALL", "description": "Glock Part Slide Cover Plate SP00133Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Glock SLIDE COVER PLATE - ALL Glock Part Slide Cover Plate SP00133Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tBPB8ED3L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJZ8JQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 2.92}}
{"item_id": "B000NJZ9FO", "title": "Acog 4 X 32 Scope Dual Illuminated Chevron .223 Ballistic Reticle", "description": "This Trijicon ACOG riflescope offers magnification of 4x with a 32-millimeter objective. The scope is equipped with a day/night dual-illumination Chevron Bindon Aiming Concept (BAC) Reticle that provides battery-free operation by illuminating with fiber optics during daylight and a tritium phosphor lamp at night. The ranging reticle is calibrated for 5.56 (0.223 cal) flattop rifles out to 800 meters. The Chevron Reticle is designed to be zeroed using the tip at 100 meters. The width of the Chevron at the base is 5.53 MOA, which is set at 19 at 300 meters, allowing for range estimation for silhouette targets. The scope comes with a Picatinny flat top rail adapter for mounting, a fitted neoprene Scopecoat that protects the scope when it is mounted on the rifle, and a large storage case.Trijicon ACOG Riflescopes:Trijicon ACOGs are internally-adjustable, compact telescopic sights with tritium illuminated reticle patterns for use in low light or at night. The Bindon Aiming Concept (BAC) scopes feature bright daytime reticles that use fiber optics to collect ambient light and automatically adjust the brightness to meet available light conditions. The ACOGs combine traditional, precise distance marksmanship with close-in aiming speed. Every feature of each scope's mechanical and optical design was chosen for a single purpose: to provide increased hit potential in all lighting conditions--without failure-prone batteries. Key features include:ACOG riflescopes feature military grade aluminum housing for a nearly indestructible sighting system.Totally Battery-Free Trijicon Tritium-Phosphor Lamp:Trijicon ACOG delivers increased hit potential in all lighting conditions--without the use of batteries--thanks to a combination of world class optics and tritium illuminated reticles that glow day and night. The fiber optics automatically adjust the brightness level and contrast of the reticle to available light conditions. The tritium-phosphor lamp glows in low-light conditions for quick target acquisition. The lamp is guaranteed to illuminate for 15 years.Trijicon Fiber Optics:Automatically adjust the brightness level and contrast of the Trijicon reticle to available light conditions.Broad Band Anti-Reflective Coated Lenses:Multi-coated lenses provide superior clarity and light gathering capabilities with zero distortion.BAC--Bindon Aiming Concept:The BAC allows the shooter to track and engage targets faster by utilizing an illuminated aiming point instead of traditional black cross-hairs. When making dynamic movements with both eyes open, vision naturally focuses on the unmagnified view while still perceiving the illuminated aiming point. As soon as the weapon begins to steady in the target area, the brain switches to the magnified view along with the aiming point.BDC--Bullet Drop Compensation:BDC is designed to compensate for the effect of gravity on the trajectory of the bullet without requiring mechanical adjustments to the sight (distance depends on model). Trijicon BDC reticles are calibrated for specific bullet rounds. When zeroed properly, the sight is ready for aim at a multitude of distances without further adjustments.Large Eye Volume:Allows you to quickly acquire targets, even if you're not positioned perfectly behind the scope.Waterproof to 500 feet/150 metersand dry-nitrogen filled to eliminate fogging.Military Grade Aluminum Housing:Forged 7075-T6 aircraft-aluminum-alloy housing provides for a nearly indestructible sighting system.The Chevron Reticle is illuminated with fiber optics and a tritium phosphor lamp for use in any light conditions.Specifications:Magnification: 4xObjective Size: 32 millimetersBullet Drop Compensator (BDC): YesLength: 5.8 inchesWeight: 9.9 ounces without mountIllumination Source: Fiber Optics and TritiumReticle Pattern: ChevronDay Reticle Color: Red, Green, or Amber (depending on model)Night Reticle Color: Red, Green, or Amber (depending on model)Calibration: 0.223Eye Relief: 1.5Exit Pupil: 8Field of View: 7 degreesField of View at 100 yards: 36.8 feetAdjustment at 100 yards: 2 clicks per inchHousing Material: Forged AluminumWhat's in the Box?TA31F: Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Scope, Flattop TA51 Mount, 4x32 Scopecoat (TA64), Lenspen (TA56), Trijicon Logo Sticker (PR15), ACOG BAC Manual, Warranty Card", "text": "Acog 4 X 32 Scope Dual Illuminated Chevron .223 Ballistic Reticle This Trijicon ACOG riflescope offers magnification of 4x with a 32-millimeter objective. The scope is equipped with a day/night dual-illumination Chevron Bindon Aiming Concept (BAC) Reticle that provides battery-free operation by illuminating with fiber optics during daylight and a tritium phosphor lamp at night. The ranging reticle is calibrated for 5.56 (0.223 cal) flattop rifles out to 800 meters. The Chevron Reticle is designed to be zeroed using the tip at 100 meters. The width of the Chevron at the base is 5.53 MOA, which is set at 19 at 300 meters, allowing for range estimation for silhouette targets. The scope comes with a Picatinny flat top rail adapter for mounting, a fitted neoprene Scopecoat that protects the scope when it is mounted on the rifle, and a large storage case.Trijicon ACOG Riflescopes:Trijicon ACOGs are internally-adjustable, compact telescopic sights with tritium illuminated reticle patterns for use in low light or at night. The Bindon Aiming Concept (BAC) scopes feature bright daytime reticles that use fiber optics to collect ambient light and automatically adjust the brightness to meet available light conditions. The ACOGs combine traditional, precise distance marksmanship with close-in aiming speed. Every feature of each scope's mechanical and optical design was chosen for a single purpose: to provide increased hit potential in all lighting conditions--without failure-prone batteries. Key features include:ACOG riflescopes feature military grade aluminum housing for a nearly indestructible sighting system.Totally Battery-Free Trijicon Tritium-Phosphor Lamp:Trijicon ACOG delivers increased hit potential in all lighting conditions--without the use of batteries--thanks to a combination of world class optics and tritium illuminated reticles that glow day and night. The fiber optics automatically adjust the brightness level and contrast of the reticle to available light conditions. The tritium-phosphor lamp glows in low-light conditions for quick target acquisition. The lamp is guaranteed to illuminate for 15 years.Trijicon Fiber Optics:Automatically adjust the brightness level and contrast of the Trijicon reticle to available light conditions.Broad Band Anti-Reflective Coated Lenses:Multi-coated lenses provide superior clarity and light gathering capabilities with zero distortion.BAC--Bindon Aiming Concept:The BAC allows the shooter to track and engage targets faster by utilizing an illuminated aiming point instead of traditional black cross-hairs. When making dynamic movements with both eyes open, vision naturally focuses on the unmagnified view while still perceiving the illuminated aiming point. As soon as the weapon begins to steady in the target area, the brain switches to the magnified view along with the aiming point.BDC--Bullet Drop Compensation:BDC is designed to compensate for the effect of gravity on the trajectory of the bullet without requiring mechanical adjustments to the sight (distance depends on model). Trijicon BDC reticles are calibrated for specific bullet rounds. When zeroed properly, the sight is ready for aim at a multitude of distances without further adjustments.Large Eye Volume:Allows you to quickly acquire targets, even if you're not positioned perfectly behind the scope.Waterproof to 500 feet/150 metersand dry-nitrogen filled to eliminate fogging.Military Grade Aluminum Housing:Forged 7075-T6 aircraft-aluminum-alloy housing provides for a nearly indestructible sighting system.The Chevron Reticle is illuminated with fiber optics and a tritium phosphor lamp for use in any light conditions.Specifications:Magnification: 4xObjective Size: 32 millimetersBullet Drop Compensator (BDC): YesLength: 5.8 inchesWeight: 9.9 ounces without mountIllumination Source: Fiber Optics and TritiumReticle Pattern: ChevronDay Reticle Color: Red, Green, or Amber (depending on model)Night Reticle Color: Red, Green, or Amber (depending on model)Calibration: 0.223Eye Relief: 1.5Exit Pupil: 8Field of View: 7 degreesField of View at 100 yards: 36.8 feetAdjustment at 100 yards: 2 clicks per inchHousing Material: Forged AluminumWhat's in the Box?TA31F: Trijicon ACOG 4x32 Scope, Flattop TA51 Mount, 4x32 Scopecoat (TA64), Lenspen (TA56), Trijicon Logo Sticker (PR15), ACOG BAC Manual, Warranty Card", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lJVmY068L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NJZ9FO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ACOG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NK0624", "title": "Gamo Squirrel Field Target w/4 Kill-Zone Reducers", "description": "Knock'em down! Add more fun to your airgun target shooting with the GAMO Interchangeable Field Target System. Now it includes 4 bullseye rings to increase the level of difficulty. When you hit the yellow bullseye the target falls down, just pull the supplied string to reset the target. Includes string and ground steaks. Use lead pellets ONLY.", "text": "Gamo Squirrel Field Target w/4 Kill-Zone Reducers Knock'em down! Add more fun to your airgun target shooting with the GAMO Interchangeable Field Target System. Now it includes 4 bullseye rings to increase the level of difficulty. When you hit the yellow bullseye the target falls down, just pull the supplied string to reset the target. Includes string and ground steaks. Use lead pellets ONLY.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TRzQor1bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK0624.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NK0DJA", "title": "Otis All Caliber Cleaning Patches (100)", "description": "The all-caliber cleaning patches are unique in that one patch cleans all firearms from .22 caliber to 12/10 gauge. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "text": "Otis All Caliber Cleaning Patches (100) The all-caliber cleaning patches are unique in that one patch cleans all firearms from .22 caliber to 12/10 gauge. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fze1Z3RUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK0DJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.56}}
{"item_id": "B000NK0EGW", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Replacement Grips for Makarov 8 shot", "description": "The Pearce MAK-8's are soft rubber replacement grips will fit the (8 shot) East German, Russian, Bulgarian and Chinese models dramatically improving the appearance, control and comfort of these popular imports. These grips are about 10% wider that the stock Makarov grips. High Capacity (10/12 shot) grips for the Russian models are also available. Note: These grips will not fit the Hungarian PA63 pistol", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Replacement Grips for Makarov 8 shot The Pearce MAK-8's are soft rubber replacement grips will fit the (8 shot) East German, Russian, Bulgarian and Chinese models dramatically improving the appearance, control and comfort of these popular imports. These grips are about 10% wider that the stock Makarov grips. High Capacity (10/12 shot) grips for the Russian models are also available. Note: These grips will not fit the Hungarian PA63 pistol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WUieqq2iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK0EGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 15.8}}
{"item_id": "B000NK0GH4", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits 1911 Compact Model Rubber Finger Groove Insert", "description": "The Pearce OM1 1911 Compact Model Rubber Finger Groove Insert fits under any compact GM 1911 side panel grip adding rubber finger grooves for comfort and better handling. Use these finger grooves with the Springfield V10 single stack, Colt Officer Model/CCO/Defender, Kimber Compact, Para Ordnance C7.45 and equivalent frame models", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits 1911 Compact Model Rubber Finger Groove Insert The Pearce OM1 1911 Compact Model Rubber Finger Groove Insert fits under any compact GM 1911 side panel grip adding rubber finger grooves for comfort and better handling. Use these finger grooves with the Springfield V10 single stack, Colt Officer Model/CCO/Defender, Kimber Compact, Para Ordnance C7.45 and equivalent frame models", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jEY3znbQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK0GH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 9.87}}
{"item_id": "B000NK1SSA", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Accu-Wedge Cleaning accessory", "description": "Buffers AR-15/M-16 cycling system to reduce wear and provide a more solid feel by eliminating play in the receiver. Easy to install, requires no weapons modifications.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Accu-Wedge Cleaning accessory Buffers AR-15/M-16 cycling system to reduce wear and provide a more solid feel by eliminating play in the receiver. Easy to install, requires no weapons modifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jZIxiZ2sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK1SSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 9.7}}
{"item_id": "B000NK1TLG", "title": "Sims Limbsaver Sharp Shooter X Ring Black", "description": "Slip-On barrel de-resonator was designed to dampen unwanted vibration by shortening the overall settling time of the barrel, resulting in accuracy and sub-minute angle groups with over-the-counter factory ammunition. Designed for scoped rifles it will fit multiple barrel sizes and works on all calibers", "text": "Sims Limbsaver Sharp Shooter X Ring Black Slip-On barrel de-resonator was designed to dampen unwanted vibration by shortening the overall settling time of the barrel, resulting in accuracy and sub-minute angle groups with over-the-counter factory ammunition. Designed for scoped rifles it will fit multiple barrel sizes and works on all calibers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A6qZ7OFbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK1TLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sims Vibration", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.06}}
{"item_id": "B000NK2VX6", "title": "New Generation KP5 CM023 Heavy Airsoft Gun Full Size Electric Power Fully Loaded", "description": "Full Auto KP5 Heavy Airsoft Gun Full Size KP5 A5 LOADED Sub Machine Gun. U.S. Army, Navy, Seal Commando, Counter Strike, Battlefield 2 GUN. This is the next best gun to Tokyo Marui Brand which costs you at least $300 a gun. With a fraction of price, you get this comparable quality automatic electric gun with the state of the art adjustable Hop Up technology which helps shoot more accurate and harder. It is enhanced with hinged magazine and Detachable Electric AIM sight. Has selectors for full auto, semi-auto, or safety mode. Comes equipped with Detachable electronic scope and the new \"chain\" style clip. The \"chain\" clip allows you to reload and shoot at the same time! No need to order extra magazine because two magazines are included!!! *****Details*****(1)Magazine Capacity: 24 BBs; (2)Chain Magazine Capacity: 110+ BBs!; (3)Velocity: Approx. 200 FPS; (4) Power Type: Fully and Semi Auto Electric *****INCLUDES*****(1) the Gun body;(2) Chain Magazine (Reloads in Seconds!); (3)Back-up Magazine; (3)Electronic Scope (batteries included); (4)6mm Plastic Bullets; (5)Speed Loader; (6)Protective goggle; (7)Gun Sling; (8) Retractable Stock; (9)Barrel Cleaner; (10) Rechargeable Battery And Charger; A fully loaded STYLISH MP5 gun at LOW price*****", "text": "New Generation KP5 CM023 Heavy Airsoft Gun Full Size Electric Power Fully Loaded Full Auto KP5 Heavy Airsoft Gun Full Size KP5 A5 LOADED Sub Machine Gun. U.S. Army, Navy, Seal Commando, Counter Strike, Battlefield 2 GUN. This is the next best gun to Tokyo Marui Brand which costs you at least $300 a gun. With a fraction of price, you get this comparable quality automatic electric gun with the state of the art adjustable Hop Up technology which helps shoot more accurate and harder. It is enhanced with hinged magazine and Detachable Electric AIM sight. Has selectors for full auto, semi-auto, or safety mode. Comes equipped with Detachable electronic scope and the new \"chain\" style clip. The \"chain\" clip allows you to reload and shoot at the same time! No need to order extra magazine because two magazines are included!!! *****Details*****(1)Magazine Capacity: 24 BBs; (2)Chain Magazine Capacity: 110+ BBs!; (3)Velocity: Approx. 200 FPS; (4) Power Type: Fully and Semi Auto Electric *****INCLUDES*****(1) the Gun body;(2) Chain Magazine (Reloads in Seconds!); (3)Back-up Magazine; (3)Electronic Scope (batteries included); (4)6mm Plastic Bullets; (5)Speed Loader; (6)Protective goggle; (7)Gun Sling; (8) Retractable Stock; (9)Barrel Cleaner; (10) Rechargeable Battery And Charger; A fully loaded STYLISH MP5 gun at LOW price*****", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ua0H0Qt3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK2VX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 39.0}}
{"item_id": "B000NK4JBI", "title": "Warne 1 Inch Maxima TPA Scope Rings", "description": "Warne 1 Inch Maxima TPA Scope Rings have two socket head cap screws. Positively clamp these steel rings to any Weaver-style base. These rings give a nicely finished look to your rifle. The steel recoil pin controls recoil in both directions. Features: Vertically split rings Matte blue Low: .250 inches (6.35mm) Medium: .375 inches (9.5mm) High: .525 inches (13.3mm)", "text": "Warne 1 Inch Maxima TPA Scope Rings Warne 1 Inch Maxima TPA Scope Rings have two socket head cap screws. Positively clamp these steel rings to any Weaver-style base. These rings give a nicely finished look to your rifle. The steel recoil pin controls recoil in both directions. Features: Vertically split rings Matte blue Low: .250 inches (6.35mm) Medium: .375 inches (9.5mm) High: .525 inches (13.3mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xypaZemkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK4JBI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NK4JC2", "title": "Warne Scope Mounts Medium Matte Permanent Attach Rings (1-Inch)", "description": "Maxima Fixed Rings are designed to be the strongest, most durable fixed mounting systems available. They utilize 4T-15 Torx style cross slot bases and incorporate a Warne square stainless steel recoil control key in both the front and rear rings. The square recoil key also protects against swaging or peening of the bases. The Maxima Fixed Ring band is also substantially wider for additional clamping surface around the scope to hold the optics firmly in place.", "text": "Warne Scope Mounts Medium Matte Permanent Attach Rings (1-Inch) Maxima Fixed Rings are designed to be the strongest, most durable fixed mounting systems available. They utilize 4T-15 Torx style cross slot bases and incorporate a Warne square stainless steel recoil control key in both the front and rear rings. The square recoil key also protects against swaging or peening of the bases. The Maxima Fixed Ring band is also substantially wider for additional clamping surface around the scope to hold the optics firmly in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EvQJcKWgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK4JC2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Warne Scope Mounts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 27.47}}
{"item_id": "B000NK4LN4", "title": "BSA S4X32WR Rifle Scope with Rings and 50-Yard Parallax", "description": "BSA Special Series 4x32 mm Rimfire Rifle Scope puts affordable precision within reach! Surprisingly clear fully-coated optics, 3 1/2 inches of eye relief and a rugged design in a Rimfire Scope with everything you need, nothing you don't: 4X magnification, compact 32 mm objective size; Fully-coated optics for solid contrast and clarity; 100% waterproof / fogproof / shockproof; Comfortable 3 1/2\" eye relief; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 34'; 1/4\" MOA windage and elevation adjustment; 50-yd. fixed parallax; Weighs 9 ozs. Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Special Series 4x32 mm Rimfire Rifle Scope", "text": "BSA S4X32WR Rifle Scope with Rings and 50-Yard Parallax BSA Special Series 4x32 mm Rimfire Rifle Scope puts affordable precision within reach! Surprisingly clear fully-coated optics, 3 1/2 inches of eye relief and a rugged design in a Rimfire Scope with everything you need, nothing you don't: 4X magnification, compact 32 mm objective size; Fully-coated optics for solid contrast and clarity; 100% waterproof / fogproof / shockproof; Comfortable 3 1/2\" eye relief; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 34'; 1/4\" MOA windage and elevation adjustment; 50-yd. fixed parallax; Weighs 9 ozs. Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Special Series 4x32 mm Rimfire Rifle Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZxESfcjdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NK4LN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 38.19}}
{"item_id": "B000NKPX5E", "title": "Rothco Reversed US Flag Velcro Patch Red White and Blue", "description": "This is a reverse American flag patch with a Velcro backing. Worn on the A.C.U. and is a great display of American pride! Reverse Flag with gold border and red white and blue USA colors.", "text": "Rothco Reversed US Flag Velcro Patch Red White and Blue This is a reverse American flag patch with a Velcro backing. Worn on the A.C.U. and is a great display of American pride! Reverse Flag with gold border and red white and blue USA colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qxzZyztZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NKPX5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 4.0}}
{"item_id": "B000NKWJ4M", "title": "Tacstar 4-Shot Shell Carrier Mossberg 500, 590 & 600 Side Saddle (12 Gauge)", "description": "The 4-pack SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4-pack SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. For 12 Gauge Shotshells", "text": "Tacstar 4-Shot Shell Carrier Mossberg 500, 590 & 600 Side Saddle (12 Gauge) The 4-pack SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4-pack SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. For 12 Gauge Shotshells", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31M5buKEn7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NKWJ4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tacstar Tactical Accessories", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Tack", "Saddles"]], "price": 25.49}}
{"item_id": "B000NL0PTM", "title": "Gunslick Universal Bore Guide", "description": "Precision machined from #6061 T6 anodized aluminum. Gunslick's Universal Bore Guide has longer tube lengths than standard. Solvent port allows cleaners to be added to patch directly. Includes additional tips to fit .17 to .416 calibers. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "text": "Gunslick Universal Bore Guide Precision machined from #6061 T6 anodized aluminum. Gunslick's Universal Bore Guide has longer tube lengths than standard. Solvent port allows cleaners to be added to patch directly. Includes additional tips to fit .17 to .416 calibers. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418EB7ok%2ByL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NL0PTM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B000NLA4O8", "title": "Nalgene Translucent Wide Mouth Bottle With Blue Lid", "description": "Convenient wide-mouth design in a handy 16 oz size. Easily add ice or clean up after transporting juice or sports drinks. Made from Tritan copolyester so it's super tough and nice looking too.", "text": "Nalgene Translucent Wide Mouth Bottle With Blue Lid Convenient wide-mouth design in a handy 16 oz size. Easily add ice or clean up after transporting juice or sports drinks. Made from Tritan copolyester so it's super tough and nice looking too.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HBqh9dacL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NLA4O8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NLA4PM", "title": "Nalgene Tritan Wide Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle, 1-Quart", "description": "This is the bottle that established Nalgene as a household name, and remains the company's bestseller. Hikers and other outdoor types have used Nalgene bottles for over 20 years, which is why most backpacks have a side pocket designed to accommodate a Nalgene. Its design, though simple, boasts more than 50 years of manufacturing fine-tuning that's resulted in a remarkably durable, leakproof bottle that's guaranteed for life.Measurement markers printed on the side of the bottle help you track your fluid intake, and are also handy when mixing beverages in the bottle. Available in a variety of colors, the bottle has a large opening which easily accommodates ice cubes, fits most water purifiers and filters, and makes hand washing easy. An attached loop-top never gets lost and screws on and off easily, while offering a handy finger hold when on the move.FeaturesMade of BPA-free Eastman Tritan co-polyesterDishwasher safe on the top rackSuperior impact resistanceSuitable for both warm and cold beverages (-40 to 212 degrees Fahrenheit)Convenient loop-top design means you'll never lose the lidWide mouth makes cleaning and adding ice cubes easyOpening accommodates most water filtersMarked with milliliters and ounces for easy measurementMade in USAAnatomy of a Nalgene BottleThreads:Nalgene bottles and caps feature continuous, straight shouldered semi-buttress threads for increased contact area on the surface. This allows for greater tightening force without stripping threads.Cap:Durable caps are designed and built to perfectly mate with their respective containers. There's no separate liner to wear, crease, fall out, or leak, and the seal ring is molded directly into each cap.FDA Compliant, BPA-free Materials:Nalgene bottles are molded from 100% virgin resin with nothing but FDA compliant colors added. Finished products are tested according to the requirements of the USFDA for food and beverage contact.Heavy-duty Walls:Uniformly durable walls are thicker and more resistant to failure than many similar looking, but lower quality bottles.Bottom:Inner corners of each bottle's bottom are curved for easy cleaning, and a plastic resin code is molded into the bottle for eventual recycling after years of sturdy service.About NalgeneNalgene is one of those brands many consider synonymous with its product category, much like Rollerblades or Q-Tips. The company creates ubiquitous BPA-free colored water bottles, geared toward providing a simple personal hydration solution that respects the environment. Nalgene offers a full product line of reusable containers of all kinds, made from a wide range of materials.", "text": "Nalgene Tritan Wide Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle, 1-Quart This is the bottle that established Nalgene as a household name, and remains the company's bestseller. Hikers and other outdoor types have used Nalgene bottles for over 20 years, which is why most backpacks have a side pocket designed to accommodate a Nalgene. Its design, though simple, boasts more than 50 years of manufacturing fine-tuning that's resulted in a remarkably durable, leakproof bottle that's guaranteed for life.Measurement markers printed on the side of the bottle help you track your fluid intake, and are also handy when mixing beverages in the bottle. Available in a variety of colors, the bottle has a large opening which easily accommodates ice cubes, fits most water purifiers and filters, and makes hand washing easy. An attached loop-top never gets lost and screws on and off easily, while offering a handy finger hold when on the move.FeaturesMade of BPA-free Eastman Tritan co-polyesterDishwasher safe on the top rackSuperior impact resistanceSuitable for both warm and cold beverages (-40 to 212 degrees Fahrenheit)Convenient loop-top design means you'll never lose the lidWide mouth makes cleaning and adding ice cubes easyOpening accommodates most water filtersMarked with milliliters and ounces for easy measurementMade in USAAnatomy of a Nalgene BottleThreads:Nalgene bottles and caps feature continuous, straight shouldered semi-buttress threads for increased contact area on the surface. This allows for greater tightening force without stripping threads.Cap:Durable caps are designed and built to perfectly mate with their respective containers. There's no separate liner to wear, crease, fall out, or leak, and the seal ring is molded directly into each cap.FDA Compliant, BPA-free Materials:Nalgene bottles are molded from 100% virgin resin with nothing but FDA compliant colors added. Finished products are tested according to the requirements of the USFDA for food and beverage contact.Heavy-duty Walls:Uniformly durable walls are thicker and more resistant to failure than many similar looking, but lower quality bottles.Bottom:Inner corners of each bottle's bottom are curved for easy cleaning, and a plastic resin code is molded into the bottle for eventual recycling after years of sturdy service.About NalgeneNalgene is one of those brands many consider synonymous with its product category, much like Rollerblades or Q-Tips. The company creates ubiquitous BPA-free colored water bottles, geared toward providing a simple personal hydration solution that respects the environment. Nalgene offers a full product line of reusable containers of all kinds, made from a wide range of materials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417dSXbYHaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NLA4PM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NMALJU", "title": "Jetboil Butane Micro-Canister Stove Personal Cooking System", "description": "FEATURES of the Personal Cooking System by Jetboil 1.0 Liter FluxRing cooking cup with insulating Cargo Cozy Adjustable burner with push-button igniter Insulating drink-through lid Insulating measuring cup bottom Fuel sold separately SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 15 oz (425 g) Volume: 32 oz (1 Liter) Efficiency: 75 - 80% Boil Time: 16 oz (1/2 Liter) = 2 minutes Water Boiled: 12 Liters per 100g Jetpower canister Dimensions: 4.1\" x 7.1\" (104mm x 180mm)", "text": "Jetboil Butane Micro-Canister Stove Personal Cooking System FEATURES of the Personal Cooking System by Jetboil 1.0 Liter FluxRing cooking cup with insulating Cargo Cozy Adjustable burner with push-button igniter Insulating drink-through lid Insulating measuring cup bottom Fuel sold separately SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 15 oz (425 g) Volume: 32 oz (1 Liter) Efficiency: 75 - 80% Boil Time: 16 oz (1/2 Liter) = 2 minutes Water Boiled: 12 Liters per 100g Jetpower canister Dimensions: 4.1\" x 7.1\" (104mm x 180mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W0OSTvCML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NMALJU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 98.94}}
{"item_id": "B000NMAMOO", "title": "Jetboil Jetpower Fuel", "description": "For maximum efficiency and minimum consumption, use our high-performance propane / isobutane four-season blend. Propane provides higher vapor pressure for better performance in cold weather. Isobutane provides more constant pressure as the fuel level gets low.The 100g fuel canister will pack inside of any model Personal Cooking System. 230g and 450g canisters will pack inside of the Sumo Companion cups and the Sumo systems.Empty fuel cans are recyclable with our CrunchIt Tool. Check local facilities for recycling info.", "text": "Jetboil Jetpower Fuel For maximum efficiency and minimum consumption, use our high-performance propane / isobutane four-season blend. Propane provides higher vapor pressure for better performance in cold weather. Isobutane provides more constant pressure as the fuel level gets low.The 100g fuel canister will pack inside of any model Personal Cooking System. 230g and 450g canisters will pack inside of the Sumo Companion cups and the Sumo systems.Empty fuel cans are recyclable with our CrunchIt Tool. Check local facilities for recycling info.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51shAIwbXnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NMAMOO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NMBLDU", "title": "Jetboil Locking Pot Support and Stabilizer", "description": "The SPECS for Pot Support Weight: 1.2 oz / 35 g The SPECS for Stabilizer Weight: 0.9 oz / 27 g", "text": "Jetboil Locking Pot Support and Stabilizer The SPECS for Pot Support Weight: 1.2 oz / 35 g The SPECS for Stabilizer Weight: 0.9 oz / 27 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4197MiSfshL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NMBLDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jetboil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000NMFF3W", "title": "Sewing Kit - Canvas, Olive Drab by Rothco", "description": "This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "text": "Sewing Kit - Canvas, Olive Drab by Rothco This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zaezEOMxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NMFF3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 5.09}}
{"item_id": "B000NMLXBA", "title": "3.39 G.I. Style Sewing Kit", "description": "Military style sewing kit that includes scissors, thread, thimble, buttons and snaps. Kit comes in Olive Drab and also contains a compass pouch. The pouch is designed for use with military web pistol belts and includes a metal belt clip.", "text": "3.39 G.I. Style Sewing Kit Military style sewing kit that includes scissors, thread, thimble, buttons and snaps. Kit comes in Olive Drab and also contains a compass pouch. The pouch is designed for use with military web pistol belts and includes a metal belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61KZmVVqMRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NMLXBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.44}}
{"item_id": "B000NN9SDO", "title": "Slim Guide Skinfold Caliper", "description": "Only low-cost caliper which meets all of the requirements for jaw pressure and accuracyIt meets or exceeds specs of the Harpenden and Skyndex units for a fraction of the costInstruction book included.", "text": "Slim Guide Skinfold Caliper Only low-cost caliper which meets all of the requirements for jaw pressure and accuracyIt meets or exceeds specs of the Harpenden and Skyndex units for a fraction of the costInstruction book included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l6bynJ7CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NN9SDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Creative Health", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 14.2}}
{"item_id": "B000NNHYCG", "title": "Optimus Crux Stove", "description": "FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Stove Only stove that nests in unused space under fuel canister Unique foldable burner provides ultimate compact ability Powerful and stable 3000W burner (precise simmering and fast boiling) The lightweight that boils water fast, but won't spot burn while simmering SPECIFICATIONS of the Optimus Crux Stove Fuel: LP-gas 75/25 butane/propane Weight: 2.9 oz / 83 g Measurements Folded: 84 x 57 x 31 mm / 3.3 x 2.2 x 1.2\" Rating: 3000 W / 10200 of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove BTU Burn Time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Boil Time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Optimus Crux Stove FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Stove Only stove that nests in unused space under fuel canister Unique foldable burner provides ultimate compact ability Powerful and stable 3000W burner (precise simmering and fast boiling) The lightweight that boils water fast, but won't spot burn while simmering SPECIFICATIONS of the Optimus Crux Stove Fuel: LP-gas 75/25 butane/propane Weight: 2.9 oz / 83 g Measurements Folded: 84 x 57 x 31 mm / 3.3 x 2.2 x 1.2\" Rating: 3000 W / 10200 of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove BTU Burn Time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Boil Time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nYqf2o3KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNHYCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 42.8}}
{"item_id": "B000NNKBGC", "title": "Tactical Airsoft Vest w/ Pistol Holster", "description": "Tactical Vest w/ Pistol Holster", "text": "Tactical Airsoft Vest w/ Pistol Holster Tactical Vest w/ Pistol Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413kvhEaj0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNKBGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSplat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 42.89}}
{"item_id": "B000NNLSMS", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger P85 - P91 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger P85 - P91 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gJnMQvRbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNLSMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 20.08}}
{"item_id": "B000NNPAPE", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Omega VI Ultra Universal Modular Light Holster", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Omega VI Ultra Universal Modular Light Holster offers left- or right-hand configuration and a fully adjustable drop-leg thigh holster with quick-release belt mount. Remove from drop-leg harness for wear on belt or any S.T.R.I.K.E. platform such as a vest (includes Speed Clips). The elastic, rubberized leg straps add stability and comfort. Holster features three side-release buckles for three-point breakaway (one on top and two on leg straps), adjustable thumb break with extra hook and loop retention, and a front-mounted pouch for extra magazine, knife, or light. Available in Black, ARPAT, Coyote Tan, and Olive Drab.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Omega VI Ultra Universal Modular Light Holster The BLACKHAWK! Omega VI Ultra Universal Modular Light Holster offers left- or right-hand configuration and a fully adjustable drop-leg thigh holster with quick-release belt mount. Remove from drop-leg harness for wear on belt or any S.T.R.I.K.E. platform such as a vest (includes Speed Clips). The elastic, rubberized leg straps add stability and comfort. Holster features three side-release buckles for three-point breakaway (one on top and two on leg straps), adjustable thumb break with extra hook and loop retention, and a front-mounted pouch for extra magazine, knife, or light. Available in Black, ARPAT, Coyote Tan, and Olive Drab.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PK7BKRV9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNPAPE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 72.72}}
{"item_id": "B000NNQFU8", "title": "Look KEO Bi Material Cleat", "description": "Look 6007190200 KEO Bi Material Cleat - Grey was made by Look engineers optimizing all of the characteristics of the cleat, and especially the bearing surface. Even though the KEO cleat is smaller, it has a greater platform surface than the Delta cleat. This new cleat format had been developed for the purposes of losing weight on the pedal - cleat assembly while remaining compatible with all shoes on the market. The cleat size therefore was reduced while retaining the three attachment points of the old Delta standard along with the operating kinematic (pivot point located in the front of the cleat). With KEO standard, engagement and disengagement are even easier and more efficient. The memory clip memorizes the exact position of the cleat during cleat replacement.", "text": "Look KEO Bi Material Cleat Look 6007190200 KEO Bi Material Cleat - Grey was made by Look engineers optimizing all of the characteristics of the cleat, and especially the bearing surface. Even though the KEO cleat is smaller, it has a greater platform surface than the Delta cleat. This new cleat format had been developed for the purposes of losing weight on the pedal - cleat assembly while remaining compatible with all shoes on the market. The cleat size therefore was reduced while retaining the three attachment points of the old Delta standard along with the operating kinematic (pivot point located in the front of the cleat). With KEO standard, engagement and disengagement are even easier and more efficient. The memory clip memorizes the exact position of the cleat during cleat replacement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AtIMhRsML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNQFU8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Replacement Cleats"]]}}
