{"item_id": "B000NNX2UE", "title": "SRAM 3.0 Comp Twister Front Only", "description": "Get ahead right from the start with SRAM 3.0 components. A great value for beginners or light adventurers, they deliver the superior technology and materials typically found only at much higher price points.SRAM: Tweak. Refine. Tweak. Refine. Leap Ahead. Founded in 1987 in Chicago, SRAM has continued to grow and evolve into the leading bicycle company it is today.SRAM: Tweak. Refine. Tweak. Refine. Leap Ahead. Founded in 1987 in Chicago, SRAM has continued to grow and evolve into the leading bicycle company it is today.", "text": "SRAM 3.0 Comp Twister Front Only Get ahead right from the start with SRAM 3.0 components. A great value for beginners or light adventurers, they deliver the superior technology and materials typically found only at much higher price points.SRAM: Tweak. Refine. Tweak. Refine. Leap Ahead. Founded in 1987 in Chicago, SRAM has continued to grow and evolve into the leading bicycle company it is today.SRAM: Tweak. Refine. Tweak. Refine. Leap Ahead. Founded in 1987 in Chicago, SRAM has continued to grow and evolve into the leading bicycle company it is today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kAaiZ1dTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNX2UE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Levers"]], "price": 10.0}}
