{"item_id": "B000NNX47U", "title": "Avid Juicy/BB7 Disc Brake Pads", "description": "This rectangular pad set, enough for one brake, works with all of the Juicy hydraulic brakes and the cable-operated BB7. Since you never want to ride metal on metal, it's always good to have two sets of pads around, so you don't need to hustle to find pads when you suddenly realize you need to replace your old pads the Friday night before a big weekend of riding. Included in the kit are two pads and a spreader spring for one brake. Choose organic or metallic compound.Product FeaturesMaterial: organic, metallic compoundAttachment Type:Diameter:Compatibility: Juicy hydraulic, BB7Weight: 24 gRecommended Use: mountain bikingManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Avid Juicy/BB7 Disc Brake Pads This rectangular pad set, enough for one brake, works with all of the Juicy hydraulic brakes and the cable-operated BB7. Since you never want to ride metal on metal, it's always good to have two sets of pads around, so you don't need to hustle to find pads when you suddenly realize you need to replace your old pads the Friday night before a big weekend of riding. Included in the kit are two pads and a spreader spring for one brake. Choose organic or metallic compound.Product FeaturesMaterial: organic, metallic compoundAttachment Type:Diameter:Compatibility: Juicy hydraulic, BB7Weight: 24 gRecommended Use: mountain bikingManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XMZd9%2BIaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNX47U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 17.99}}
