{"item_id": "B000NNXQ5A", "title": "Guardian Real Shake, Forever Flashlight", "description": "These shake flashlights contain no batteries. Many new \"\"fake shake\"\" flashlights claim to be rechargeable when actually they use generic lithium batteries. These are the real deal. The waterproof case floats in water and the light is visible up to one mile.", "text": "Guardian Real Shake, Forever Flashlight These shake flashlights contain no batteries. Many new \"\"fake shake\"\" flashlights claim to be rechargeable when actually they use generic lithium batteries. These are the real deal. The waterproof case floats in water and the light is visible up to one mile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IYpkV-39L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NNXQ5A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000NO08VO", "title": "5 in 1 Survival Whistle, Emergency Zone® Brand", "description": "Emergency Zone Brand. This handy little survival tool comes with a shrill signal whistle, signal mirror, compass, waterproof match container and flint. It has an attached lanyard or is small enough to fit easily in your pocket.", "text": "5 in 1 Survival Whistle, Emergency Zone® Brand Emergency Zone Brand. This handy little survival tool comes with a shrill signal whistle, signal mirror, compass, waterproof match container and flint. It has an attached lanyard or is small enough to fit easily in your pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oaK28jZML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NO08VO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NO0ZYE", "title": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Glove, Black, Large", "description": "A high performing glove without the high price tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "text": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Glove, Black, Large A high performing glove without the high price tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yGVmUsn0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NO0ZYE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
