{"item_id": "B000NOOQC6", "title": "Lyman Universal Decapping Die", "description": "The ideal die for decapping primers prior to case cleaning. It has a unique one piece hardened steel decapping rod. Perfect for military crimped in primers. Works on all calibers .22 thru .45 except .378 and 460 Weatherby.", "text": "Lyman Universal Decapping Die The ideal die for decapping primers prior to case cleaning. It has a unique one piece hardened steel decapping rod. Perfect for military crimped in primers. Works on all calibers .22 thru .45 except .378 and 460 Weatherby.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qkuasUZ6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOOQC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.79}}
{"item_id": "B000NOORLQ", "title": "Lee Precision 9-mm Luger Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for 9MM set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your 9MM Luger ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision 9-mm Luger Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for 9MM set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your 9MM Luger ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KA%2B8TDR%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOORLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.15}}
{"item_id": "B000NOORWK", "title": "Truglo Fiber Optic Handgun Sight Set - Glock High, Red/Green", "description": "The TRUGLO Fiber Optic handgun sights use our traditional fiber optic technology. CNC-machined steel construction. Contrasting red front and green rear. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "text": "Truglo Fiber Optic Handgun Sight Set - Glock High, Red/Green The TRUGLO Fiber Optic handgun sights use our traditional fiber optic technology. CNC-machined steel construction. Contrasting red front and green rear. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c3WYw4akL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOORWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 43.02}}
{"item_id": "B000NOORXE", "title": "RCBS Auto Priming Tool", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Auto Priming Tool RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YvTjbVfcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOORXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 88.39}}
{"item_id": "B000NOORXY", "title": "Lee Precision Production Pot IV (Grey)", "description": "The Average melt time is less than 20 minutes. . It uses only 500 watts of power during heat-up and a lot less to maintain temperature. 4\" of clearance under the spout is high enough to accept all brands of bullet molds and most sinker molds.", "text": "Lee Precision Production Pot IV (Grey) The Average melt time is less than 20 minutes. . It uses only 500 watts of power during heat-up and a lot less to maintain temperature. 4\" of clearance under the spout is high enough to accept all brands of bullet molds and most sinker molds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iL177CikL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOORXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 59.11}}
{"item_id": "B000NOOSII", "title": "Lee Precision .45 ACP Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .45 ACP set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .45 ACP ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision .45 ACP Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for .45 ACP set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your .45 ACP ammunition. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KA%2B8TDR%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOOSII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.14}}
