{"item_id": "B000NOQIFO", "title": "Lee Precision Cast Iron Reloading Hand Press Only (Red)", "description": "The Lee Precision Breech Lock Hand Press. More convenient than ever, now includes the Breech Lock Quick-Change Die Feature, so you can instantly change dies with just a twist of the wrist. One Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing included.", "text": "Lee Precision Cast Iron Reloading Hand Press Only (Red) The Lee Precision Breech Lock Hand Press. More convenient than ever, now includes the Breech Lock Quick-Change Die Feature, so you can instantly change dies with just a twist of the wrist. One Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FgqTTwGqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOQIFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 37.0}}
{"item_id": "B000NOQING", "title": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Tufnut (2.75-Pounds)", "description": "Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Rogue Bearing Nutshell.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Tufnut (2.75-Pounds) Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Rogue Bearing Nutshell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rSwOmsWQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOQING.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.26}}
{"item_id": "B000NOQIOU", "title": "Lee Precision Cutter and Lock Stud", "description": "Use the Lee Cutter and Lock Stud with the Case Length Gauge and Shell Holder to trim cases. Can be used by hand or with an electric drill. Works on all brass less than .475 base diameter. If you are looking for tri-mming cases with a base diameter larger than .475, order the large cutter and lock stud.", "text": "Lee Precision Cutter and Lock Stud Use the Lee Cutter and Lock Stud with the Case Length Gauge and Shell Holder to trim cases. Can be used by hand or with an electric drill. Works on all brass less than .475 base diameter. If you are looking for tri-mming cases with a base diameter larger than .475, order the large cutter and lock stud.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514unBaZpQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOQIOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 6.83}}
{"item_id": "B000NOQIQI", "title": "Stack-On GCG-900 Steel Pistol/Ammo Cabinet, Green", "description": "Stack-On's Gun Cabinets feature welded, steel box construction and superior all steel 3 point locking system with double butted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Also features Stack-On's patented, contoured non-marring barrel rest and barrel standoffs for scoped guns. Durable baked epoxy finish in hunter green. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening and finishing hardware included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On's Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. Stack-On's superior all steel 3-point locking system provides greater security. The locking plate passes behind the steel cabinet frame at the top and bottom of each unit. In addition, a large steel locking plate is secured behind the steel door frame in the center section of the door panel. Item Dimensions : 21-Inch W x 10-Inch D x 18-Inch H (53cm x 25cm x 46cm)", "text": "Stack-On GCG-900 Steel Pistol/Ammo Cabinet, Green Stack-On's Gun Cabinets feature welded, steel box construction and superior all steel 3 point locking system with double butted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Also features Stack-On's patented, contoured non-marring barrel rest and barrel standoffs for scoped guns. Durable baked epoxy finish in hunter green. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening and finishing hardware included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On's Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. Stack-On's superior all steel 3-point locking system provides greater security. The locking plate passes behind the steel cabinet frame at the top and bottom of each unit. In addition, a large steel locking plate is secured behind the steel door frame in the center section of the door panel. Item Dimensions : 21-Inch W x 10-Inch D x 18-Inch H (53cm x 25cm x 46cm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310ExQX0LzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOQIQI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stack-On", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 85.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NOQIVS", "title": "Lee Precision Pacesetter Dies .270 Win (Red)", "description": "Lee Precision 270 Win Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision Pacesetter Dies .270 Win (Red) Lee Precision 270 Win Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P52ElTemL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOQIVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 31.48}}
