{"item_id": "B000NORVHI", "title": "Park Tool PolyLube 1000 Grease", "description": "Poly-urea based lubricant grease. Extremely high shear strength . Repels moisture and is compatible with other greases.", "text": "Park Tool PolyLube 1000 Grease Poly-urea based lubricant grease. Extremely high shear strength . Repels moisture and is compatible with other greases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BO-Tcf4UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NORVHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Grease"]], "price": 5.8}}
{"item_id": "B000NOSGOU", "title": "Lee Precision 308 Win Gauge/Holder", "description": "Lee 308 WIN Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "text": "Lee Precision 308 Win Gauge/Holder Lee 308 WIN Case Length Gauge is a precise, easy way to trim to length and square the case mouth. Used with the Cutter and Lock Stud or Zip Trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u5LNIPBlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOSGOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.0}}
{"item_id": "B000NOSHQW", "title": "Lee Precision 308 Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 308 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "text": "Lee Precision 308 Factory Crimp Die Lee 308 Factory Crimp Die crimps the bullet in place more firmly than any other tool. Tests demonstrate that even bullets which have no crimp groove will shoot more accurately. A firm crimp improves accuracy because pressure must build to a higher level before the bullet begins to move. This higher start pressure insures a more uniform pressure curve and less velocity variation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qRRodv03L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOSHQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.85}}
{"item_id": "B000NOSISO", "title": "Lee Precision 4 Hole Turret (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision 4 Hole Turret is locked into a solid steel ring with big rifle bolt type lugs. Patented design puts the lugs on the circumference so there can be no tipping. The linkage is so powerful that the largest magnum cases are sized with ease. Effort required is so small that the usual heavy bench is not essential.", "text": "Lee Precision 4 Hole Turret (Silver) The Lee Precision 4 Hole Turret is locked into a solid steel ring with big rifle bolt type lugs. Patented design puts the lugs on the circumference so there can be no tipping. The linkage is so powerful that the largest magnum cases are sized with ease. Effort required is so small that the usual heavy bench is not essential.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419cA8PUfNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOSISO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 10.26}}
{"item_id": "B000NOUEKY", "title": "Lee Precision Double Disk Kit", "description": "Lee Double Disk Kit raises powder hopper permitting two disks to be stacked in powder measure. Doubles the capacity, also able to make very fine adjustments. Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc.", "text": "Lee Precision Double Disk Kit Lee Double Disk Kit raises powder hopper permitting two disks to be stacked in powder measure. Doubles the capacity, also able to make very fine adjustments. Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qZIu11WDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NOUEKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.65}}
