{"item_id": "B000NSZ3WY", "title": "Sea to Summit Mosquito Head Nets", "description": "When the bugs are thick, wearing a head net is the answer. available in an Insect Shield Permethrin treated model. Weight 1.3 oz.", "text": "Sea to Summit Mosquito Head Nets When the bugs are thick, wearing a head net is the answer. available in an Insect Shield Permethrin treated model. Weight 1.3 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Gx2t1sHaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NSZ3WY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NTIFNM", "title": "Lyman Turbo Tumbler 2200 Auto-Flo (115-Volt)", "description": "The ultimate in case cleaning convenience, Lyman's Auto-Flo Enhanced Tumblers automatically separate clean cases from media using the unit's normal vibrating motion. When cases are clean, the user simply pulls the drain plug and the media drains from the exit port into the media drain pan (included). The 2200 features a high strength \"Ultra-Thick\" Roto Molded bowl which will last as long as you own your tumbler. The 1.5 gallon capacity is ideal for the large volume user and can clean 750 38 Special cases in one cycle. The 2200 also features a clear see-thru lid for inspecting cases during cleaning. A media drain pan is also included.", "text": "Lyman Turbo Tumbler 2200 Auto-Flo (115-Volt) The ultimate in case cleaning convenience, Lyman's Auto-Flo Enhanced Tumblers automatically separate clean cases from media using the unit's normal vibrating motion. When cases are clean, the user simply pulls the drain plug and the media drains from the exit port into the media drain pan (included). The 2200 features a high strength \"Ultra-Thick\" Roto Molded bowl which will last as long as you own your tumbler. The 1.5 gallon capacity is ideal for the large volume user and can clean 750 38 Special cases in one cycle. The 2200 also features a clear see-thru lid for inspecting cases during cleaning. A media drain pan is also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rQzODzS%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTIFNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 134.23}}
{"item_id": "B000NTIG18", "title": "Lee Precision Pacesetter .308 Dies (Red)", "description": "Lee Precision 308 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision Pacesetter .308 Dies (Red) Lee Precision 308 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P52ElTemL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTIG18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.04}}
{"item_id": "B000NTKCJW", "title": "Lee Precision Safety Scale (Red)", "description": "Lee Precision Safety Scale is reliable, and very accurate, beam is made from a tough Phenolic. Sensitive and readable to 1/20 grain", "text": "Lee Precision Safety Scale (Red) Lee Precision Safety Scale is reliable, and very accurate, beam is made from a tough Phenolic. Sensitive and readable to 1/20 grain", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3117BjQvWjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTKCJW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.06}}
{"item_id": "B000NTKD28", "title": "Lee Precision II Shotshell Reloading Press 12 GA Load All (Multi)", "description": "Lee Precision complete reloading tool is used for 12 gauge with 24 shot and powder bushings. Loads 2 3/4 and 3 inch shells. Nothing else is required.", "text": "Lee Precision II Shotshell Reloading Press 12 GA Load All (Multi) Lee Precision complete reloading tool is used for 12 gauge with 24 shot and powder bushings. Loads 2 3/4 and 3 inch shells. Nothing else is required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bx8QmwqWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTKD28.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 48.77}}
{"item_id": "B000NTKDFU", "title": "Outdoor Edge SS-10 Steel Stick Pivoting Steel Bar To Spread Brisket Completely Open for Easy Cleaning Complete with Nylon Belt Sheath", "description": "The Steel Stick is a must have item for every big game hunter for proper field dressing. The Steel Stick is a pivoting steel bar to spread the brisket for easy field dressing. Spreading the brisket improves access to the abdomen for removing viscera and enables quicker cooling of fresh game meat. The Steel Stick comes complete with a nylon belt sheath. Closed Length: 7-Inch. Extended Length 11-Inch. Weight 7.5-Ounce", "text": "Outdoor Edge SS-10 Steel Stick Pivoting Steel Bar To Spread Brisket Completely Open for Easy Cleaning Complete with Nylon Belt Sheath The Steel Stick is a must have item for every big game hunter for proper field dressing. The Steel Stick is a pivoting steel bar to spread the brisket for easy field dressing. Spreading the brisket improves access to the abdomen for removing viscera and enables quicker cooling of fresh game meat. The Steel Stick comes complete with a nylon belt sheath. Closed Length: 7-Inch. Extended Length 11-Inch. Weight 7.5-Ounce", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pQAnxn95L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTKDFU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 12.11}}
{"item_id": "B000NTMJK2", "title": "Lee Precision Universal Press Shell Holder Set (Clear)", "description": "Lee Precision Set of Universal shell holders. It includes 11 of the most popular for more than 115 different cartridges. Includes #1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7. 8. 9, 10, 11 and 19.", "text": "Lee Precision Universal Press Shell Holder Set (Clear) Lee Precision Set of Universal shell holders. It includes 11 of the most popular for more than 115 different cartridges. Includes #1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7. 8. 9, 10, 11 and 19.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5162IOyUugL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTMJK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NTMJLG", "title": "Lee Precision 90058 Perfect Powder Measurer (Red)", "description": "Lee Precision Perfect Powder Measure is best for reloading rifle cases. It can also be used for pistol cases. It can be used on the included bench mounted stand, or used in conjunction with the Universal Charging Die on the Load Master.", "text": "Lee Precision 90058 Perfect Powder Measurer (Red) Lee Precision Perfect Powder Measure is best for reloading rifle cases. It can also be used for pistol cases. It can be used on the included bench mounted stand, or used in conjunction with the Universal Charging Die on the Load Master.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Sv3nlZ6ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NTMJLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.79}}
