{"item_id": "B000NVCI0Q", "title": "Park Tool PPL-2 Polylube 1000 Grease Tub (1 Lb)", "description": "Park Tool's poly-urea lubricant was developed specifically for bicycle maintenance and repair. PolyLube 1000 has an extremely high shear strength to protect vital parts under extreme conditions. PolyLube 1000 also repels moisture and is compatible with conventional greases.", "text": "Park Tool PPL-2 Polylube 1000 Grease Tub (1 Lb) Park Tool's poly-urea lubricant was developed specifically for bicycle maintenance and repair. PolyLube 1000 has an extremely high shear strength to protect vital parts under extreme conditions. PolyLube 1000 also repels moisture and is compatible with conventional greases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51D8Om5ugNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NVCI0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Grease"]], "price": 16.92}}
{"item_id": "B000NVCI1U", "title": "Park Tool TW-1 Torque Wrench (1/4- Inch Drive, 0-60 inch Lbs)", "description": "Because torque specifications are now given for most parts and accessories, Park Tool offers two tough, accurate torque wrenches.", "text": "Park Tool TW-1 Torque Wrench (1/4- Inch Drive, 0-60 inch Lbs) Because torque specifications are now given for most parts and accessories, Park Tool offers two tough, accurate torque wrenches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PStB-3l2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NVCI1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 40.46}}
{"item_id": "B000NVDCQ0", "title": "TravelJohn Foldable Commode /Chair (Olive Drab)", "description": "Stable, steel-frame folding chair for use with TravelJohn Solid Waste Collection Kit (not included), it has a padded seat with top flap, plastic feet, and folds to 6''x6''x24''. Can be used as an ordinary chair or commode and is ideal for outdoor use. As comfortable as being in your own home!", "text": "TravelJohn Foldable Commode /Chair (Olive Drab) Stable, steel-frame folding chair for use with TravelJohn Solid Waste Collection Kit (not included), it has a padded seat with top flap, plastic feet, and folds to 6''x6''x24''. Can be used as an ordinary chair or commode and is ideal for outdoor use. As comfortable as being in your own home!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CmbZaCQZL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NVDCQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Travel John", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000NVDFOO", "title": "Stearns SunShower 4.0 with 3-4 showers (Capacity- 4 gallons)", "description": "Capacity: 4.0 Gallons (3-4 Showers), 13.8 oz. Reinforced pipe handle and microcell foam insulator. Tie down grommets.", "text": "Stearns SunShower 4.0 with 3-4 showers (Capacity- 4 gallons) Capacity: 4.0 Gallons (3-4 Showers), 13.8 oz. Reinforced pipe handle and microcell foam insulator. Tie down grommets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411wtuK58-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NVDFOO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stearns", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 24.49}}
{"item_id": "B000NVI2RY", "title": "Topeak Aero Wedge DX Pack", "description": "Features separated compartments with side and rear zippered entries . Medium is perfect for MTB tube/tools, small is great for Road tube/tools. Quick Release mount attaches to saddle rails, hardware included . Made from 1000 denier nylon with PTFE coating. 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment location. Features: 1000-denier Cordura Plus Fitting for taillight DX bag has an internal packet to keep tools away from delicate items DX bags have an internal pocket to keep tools away from delicate items", "text": "Topeak Aero Wedge DX Pack Features separated compartments with side and rear zippered entries . Medium is perfect for MTB tube/tools, small is great for Road tube/tools. Quick Release mount attaches to saddle rails, hardware included . Made from 1000 denier nylon with PTFE coating. 3M reflective strip and rear light attachment location. Features: 1000-denier Cordura Plus Fitting for taillight DX bag has an internal packet to keep tools away from delicate items DX bags have an internal pocket to keep tools away from delicate items", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n7yNQurBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000NVI2RY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]]}}
