{"item_id": "B000O15GSG", "title": "Franklin Sports NHL Mini Hockey Goal Set of 2", "description": "The Franklin Insta-Set 2-Goal, Stick & Ball Set features everything you need to play mini hockey, including two mini hockey goals, two goalie sticks, four player sticks (2 right shot & 2 left shot), 4 soft EVA foam 2-inch mini balls, and a polyester carry bag for storage and transport. The pre-assembled, fully collapsible goals set up and fold away in seconds, and are constructed of rugged high-impact 1-inch plastic tubing, and a durable 900D polyester all-weather pre-fit net. Just add players.", "text": "Franklin Sports NHL Mini Hockey Goal Set of 2 The Franklin Insta-Set 2-Goal, Stick & Ball Set features everything you need to play mini hockey, including two mini hockey goals, two goalie sticks, four player sticks (2 right shot & 2 left shot), 4 soft EVA foam 2-inch mini balls, and a polyester carry bag for storage and transport. The pre-assembled, fully collapsible goals set up and fold away in seconds, and are constructed of rugged high-impact 1-inch plastic tubing, and a durable 900D polyester all-weather pre-fit net. Just add players.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VF8THbJGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O15GSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Franklin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Ice Hockey", "Rink Equipment", "Nets"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B000O1PKG4", "title": "SnugPak Jungle Bag", "description": "• Length: 220cm, Width (Chest): 150cm • Zip Style: Left or Right Handed, Shape: Square, Temp Rating: Comfort: 7c, Temp Rating: Extreme: 2c, Weight: 850g (inc. compression stuff sack), Packsize (Fully Compressed): 12x14cm • Made for tropical conditions and packs smaller than a coconut • Comes complete with a concealed roll away mosquito net", "text": "SnugPak Jungle Bag • Length: 220cm, Width (Chest): 150cm • Zip Style: Left or Right Handed, Shape: Square, Temp Rating: Comfort: 7c, Temp Rating: Extreme: 2c, Weight: 850g (inc. compression stuff sack), Packsize (Fully Compressed): 12x14cm • Made for tropical conditions and packs smaller than a coconut • Comes complete with a concealed roll away mosquito net", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dlgvvJe4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O1PKG4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000O26134", "title": "Whistle Creek Survival Kit in a Sardine Can", "description": "This lightweight waterproof tin puts an entire survival kit in your pocket. We still can't believe all it holds: a compass, whistle, matches, first aid instructions, razor blade, pencil, non-aspirin pain reliever, fire starter cube, adhesive bandage, energy nugget, reflective signal surface, fish hook & line, duct tape, wire clip, note paper, tea, sugar, salt, gum, watertight bag, safety pin, antibiotic ointment and alcohol prep pad. With all this gear stashed in the smallest possible space to keep bikers, hikers, campers, boaters and adventurers of all kinds prepared, it even floats. Fits in your pocket. Great for bikers, hikers, campers, boaters and adventurers; it even floats. 3\" x 41/4\" x 7/8\". USA.", "text": "Whistle Creek Survival Kit in a Sardine Can This lightweight waterproof tin puts an entire survival kit in your pocket. We still can't believe all it holds: a compass, whistle, matches, first aid instructions, razor blade, pencil, non-aspirin pain reliever, fire starter cube, adhesive bandage, energy nugget, reflective signal surface, fish hook & line, duct tape, wire clip, note paper, tea, sugar, salt, gum, watertight bag, safety pin, antibiotic ointment and alcohol prep pad. With all this gear stashed in the smallest possible space to keep bikers, hikers, campers, boaters and adventurers of all kinds prepared, it even floats. Fits in your pocket. Great for bikers, hikers, campers, boaters and adventurers; it even floats. 3\" x 41/4\" x 7/8\". USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61ceNJGavkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O26134.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gaiam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 13.36}}
{"item_id": "B000O3AVNY", "title": "Advanced Elements AdvancedFrame Expedition Kayak", "description": "The AdvancedFrame Expedition is a thirteen foor hybrid of a folding frame kayak and an inflatable kayak. As with all AdvancedFrame models, the Expedition incorporates our proven aluminum rib-frame technology in the bow and stern providing increased paddling performance. Its increased length adds to the tracking performance and hull speed. There is plenty of on-board storage room for extended trips. It sets up in just a few minutes and is compact enough to take along on a weekend or week-long adventure.", "text": "Advanced Elements AdvancedFrame Expedition Kayak The AdvancedFrame Expedition is a thirteen foor hybrid of a folding frame kayak and an inflatable kayak. As with all AdvancedFrame models, the Expedition incorporates our proven aluminum rib-frame technology in the bow and stern providing increased paddling performance. Its increased length adds to the tracking performance and hull speed. There is plenty of on-board storage room for extended trips. It sets up in just a few minutes and is compact enough to take along on a weekend or week-long adventure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CrwrBscNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O3AVNY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]], "price": 599.99}}
{"item_id": "B000O3SDRK", "title": "Stansport All Purpose Utility Bucket (Yellow)", "description": "The Stansport All Purpose Utility Bucket is made of reinforced heavy duty vinyl with electronically welded seams and a sturdy carry handle. Folds compactly for easy storage and portability. Capacity of 2-1/2 -Gallons.", "text": "Stansport All Purpose Utility Bucket (Yellow) The Stansport All Purpose Utility Bucket is made of reinforced heavy duty vinyl with electronically welded seams and a sturdy carry handle. Folds compactly for easy storage and portability. Capacity of 2-1/2 -Gallons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NelnbfQZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O3SDRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 8.86}}
