{"item_id": "B000O57MPW", "title": "Caldwell 546889 Zero Max", "description": "This sturdy steel rest is constructed of strong square tubing for a lifetime of use. The rife or shotgun is cradled in a nylon web at the rear while the forend rests on a Caldwell Front Rest Bag. Easily adjustable for wind and elevation, this design offers a rock solid base for precision shooting.", "text": "Caldwell 546889 Zero Max This sturdy steel rest is constructed of strong square tubing for a lifetime of use. The rife or shotgun is cradled in a nylon web at the rear while the forend rests on a Caldwell Front Rest Bag. Easily adjustable for wind and elevation, this design offers a rock solid base for precision shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y3pTuJydL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O57MPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 42.72}}
{"item_id": "B000O5EW9G", "title": "Camco 42993 Collapsible Bucket", "description": "Camco RV Collapsible Bucket is the perfect size for Rving, camping, fishing, boating and more. Has a 3 gallon capacity. Opens easily to 9.25\" tall and folds to less than 2\" for compact storage. Zippered storage bag included.", "text": "Camco 42993 Collapsible Bucket Camco RV Collapsible Bucket is the perfect size for Rving, camping, fishing, boating and more. Has a 3 gallon capacity. Opens easily to 9.25\" tall and folds to less than 2\" for compact storage. Zippered storage bag included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k%2BbC-moIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O5EW9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 10.06}}
{"item_id": "B000O5MYIC", "title": "FitBall Mini Exercise Ball FBMINI 9\" Dark Blue", "description": "The FitBALL Mini Exercise Ball brings a whole new dimension to core and muscle training. This 9in ball adds a level of instability and can be used in Pilates, Yoga and fitness training. Place the FitBALL Mini under your lower back when performing crunches for a challenging workout. The soft rubber surface provides comfort and requires inflation. Deflate the FitBALL Mini and use as a prop under your head, neck, feet, etc.", "text": "FitBall Mini Exercise Ball FBMINI 9\" Dark Blue The FitBALL Mini Exercise Ball brings a whole new dimension to core and muscle training. This 9in ball adds a level of instability and can be used in Pilates, Yoga and fitness training. Place the FitBALL Mini under your lower back when performing crunches for a challenging workout. The soft rubber surface provides comfort and requires inflation. Deflate the FitBALL Mini and use as a prop under your head, neck, feet, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cgmc4O-2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O5MYIC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fitball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 9.23}}
{"item_id": "B000O5WQXA", "title": "Seirus Innovation Neosock", "description": "The Neosock is ultra warm, comfortable, breathable and durable without excessive bulk. Patented technology offers the comfort of 4 -way stretch and warmth of neoprene. Breathable Macro-porous technology seals in the heat and provides dryer warmth without a damp, clammy feeling. This sock is constructed with seams, so it is not fully waterproof. Size Chart: SM: Mens 4 - 5, Womens 4 - 6.5 MD: Mens 46 - 8.5, Womens 7 - 9 LG: Mens 9 - 11.5, Womens 9.5 - 12 XL: Mens 11.5 - 13", "text": "Seirus Innovation Neosock The Neosock is ultra warm, comfortable, breathable and durable without excessive bulk. Patented technology offers the comfort of 4 -way stretch and warmth of neoprene. Breathable Macro-porous technology seals in the heat and provides dryer warmth without a damp, clammy feeling. This sock is constructed with seams, so it is not fully waterproof. Size Chart: SM: Mens 4 - 5, Womens 4 - 6.5 MD: Mens 46 - 8.5, Womens 7 - 9 LG: Mens 9 - 11.5, Womens 9.5 - 12 XL: Mens 11.5 - 13", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Bnanw684L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O5WQXA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000O5YT7G", "title": "Outdoor Research Helios Sun Hat", "description": "This broad sun hat has a 50+ UPF rating. The headband moves moisture away from your brow, while the brim offers an oasis of shade. The drawcord adjustment keeps it snug on long trails.", "text": "Outdoor Research Helios Sun Hat This broad sun hat has a 50+ UPF rating. The headband moves moisture away from your brow, while the brim offers an oasis of shade. The drawcord adjustment keeps it snug on long trails.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Sp1MlfwaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000O5YT7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps"]]}}
