{"item_id": "B000OE9L0W", "title": "NcStar 1X30 B-Style Red Dot Sight / Weaver Base (DBB130)", "description": "1x30 B-Style Red-Dot Sight, Weaver Style Mount Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 30.00 - Reticle: Red dot - Dot size: 3 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Black aluminum - Lens coating: Ruby - Net weight (oz.): 6.80 - Length (in): 3.15 - Mount: Integrated weaver style", "text": "NcStar 1X30 B-Style Red Dot Sight / Weaver Base (DBB130) 1x30 B-Style Red-Dot Sight, Weaver Style Mount Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 30.00 - Reticle: Red dot - Dot size: 3 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Black aluminum - Lens coating: Ruby - Net weight (oz.): 6.80 - Length (in): 3.15 - Mount: Integrated weaver style", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jwk-AsdKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OE9L0W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 30.03}}
{"item_id": "B000OE9L66", "title": "NcStar 1X25 Red and Green Dot Reflex Sight / Weaver and 3/8\" Dovetail Base/Silver (DAS)", "description": "1x25 Red/Green Dot Reflex Sight, Silver Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 25.00 - Reticle: red dot/green dot - Dot size: 5 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Silver aluminum - Lens coating: Clear - Net weight (oz.): 4.50 - Length (in): 4.06 - Mount: Interchangeable (Weaver style/ 3/8” dovetail)", "text": "NcStar 1X25 Red and Green Dot Reflex Sight / Weaver and 3/8\" Dovetail Base/Silver (DAS) 1x25 Red/Green Dot Reflex Sight, Silver Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 25.00 - Reticle: red dot/green dot - Dot size: 5 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Silver aluminum - Lens coating: Clear - Net weight (oz.): 4.50 - Length (in): 4.06 - Mount: Interchangeable (Weaver style/ 3/8” dovetail)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E6JzHAFIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OE9L66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 22.5}}
{"item_id": "B000OE9L98", "title": "NcStar 1x25 Red & Green Dot Reflex Sight Black", "description": "Features: LED (Light Emitting Diode) 100% safe for the eyes Unlimited eye relief and field of view Multi position rheostat knob for Red or Green illumination PLUS interchangeable weaver and dovetail mount Integrated mount Includes extra battery and mounting tool Specifications: Magnification:1x Objective Dia(Mm):25.00 Reticle: Red Dot/Green Dot Dot Size: 5 Moa Click Val: 1 Moa Exterior Finish: Black Aluminum Lens Coating: Clear N.W. (Oz.): 4.50 Length (In): 4.06 Mount: Interchangeable (Weaver Stlye / 3/8\" Dovetail)", "text": "NcStar 1x25 Red & Green Dot Reflex Sight Black Features: LED (Light Emitting Diode) 100% safe for the eyes Unlimited eye relief and field of view Multi position rheostat knob for Red or Green illumination PLUS interchangeable weaver and dovetail mount Integrated mount Includes extra battery and mounting tool Specifications: Magnification:1x Objective Dia(Mm):25.00 Reticle: Red Dot/Green Dot Dot Size: 5 Moa Click Val: 1 Moa Exterior Finish: Black Aluminum Lens Coating: Clear N.W. (Oz.): 4.50 Length (In): 4.06 Mount: Interchangeable (Weaver Stlye / 3/8\" Dovetail)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VbZ0OB8RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OE9L98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OEBFX8", "title": "NcStar 15-40X50 Spotting Scope/Green Lens/with Tripod (NG154050G)", "description": "NcSTAR 15 - 40x50 mm Zoom Compact Spotting Scope, PRICED LESS! Hunters, hikers, birders, boaters, shooters... anyone who wants long-range optics in remote areas will appreciate this lightweight, easy-carry variable power Spotting Scope! The camera-quality optics deliver the clarity and brightness of larger, more expensive models. Variable power with fine precision focusing; Waterproof and fogproof; Big 50 mm objective lens gathers in loads of light. Fully multi-coated optics for a sharp, clear view; Built-in sunshade; Tabletop-style folding tripod, small but stable; Spotter is a compact 9 1/2\"l. Weighs just 13 1/2 ozs. F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 3' in 15X, 1 1/2' in 40X; Carry / storage case included. You're not going to beat this deal! Get it now! NcSTAR 15-40x50 mm Zoom Compact Spotting Scope", "text": "NcStar 15-40X50 Spotting Scope/Green Lens/with Tripod (NG154050G) NcSTAR 15 - 40x50 mm Zoom Compact Spotting Scope, PRICED LESS! Hunters, hikers, birders, boaters, shooters... anyone who wants long-range optics in remote areas will appreciate this lightweight, easy-carry variable power Spotting Scope! The camera-quality optics deliver the clarity and brightness of larger, more expensive models. Variable power with fine precision focusing; Waterproof and fogproof; Big 50 mm objective lens gathers in loads of light. Fully multi-coated optics for a sharp, clear view; Built-in sunshade; Tabletop-style folding tripod, small but stable; Spotter is a compact 9 1/2\"l. Weighs just 13 1/2 ozs. F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 3' in 15X, 1 1/2' in 40X; Carry / storage case included. You're not going to beat this deal! Get it now! NcSTAR 15-40x50 mm Zoom Compact Spotting Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xF2uNYX6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OEBFX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OEDJVE", "title": "One Dozen Blue Master Pool Cue Chalk", "description": "This hard pool cue chalk is designed to grip the cue tip for more accurate shooting. It's reliability is one of the reasons it is one of the world's favorite cue chalk.", "text": "One Dozen Blue Master Pool Cue Chalk This hard pool cue chalk is designed to grip the cue tip for more accurate shooting. It's reliability is one of the reasons it is one of the world's favorite cue chalk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jU9%2B66XRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OEDJVE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Master", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Cue Chalk"]], "price": 5.59}}
