{"item_id": "B000OF5L5A", "title": "Kwik Tek F-48 Deluxe Water Ski Flag with Aluminum Pole 48-Inches", "description": "Deluxe Water Sports Flags - Water sports flags are required by law in AZ, CA, CO, ID, MO, NE, NM, OR, TX, UT and WA. AIRHEAD’s new deluxe water sports flag is truly the “Cadillac” option. It’s 4 feet long, that’s twice as long as required by law in most states. The black shaft is manufactured from durable anodized aluminum. An EVA foam grip ensures a comfortable and secure hold. The oversized 420 denier nylon flag resists fading from the sun. Designed to fit perfectly inside AIRHEAD’s new Wakeboard Tower and Bimini Top Flag Holders. It floats!", "text": "Kwik Tek F-48 Deluxe Water Ski Flag with Aluminum Pole 48-Inches Deluxe Water Sports Flags - Water sports flags are required by law in AZ, CA, CO, ID, MO, NE, NM, OR, TX, UT and WA. AIRHEAD’s new deluxe water sports flag is truly the “Cadillac” option. It’s 4 feet long, that’s twice as long as required by law in most states. The black shaft is manufactured from durable anodized aluminum. An EVA foam grip ensures a comfortable and secure hold. The oversized 420 denier nylon flag resists fading from the sun. Designed to fit perfectly inside AIRHEAD’s new Wakeboard Tower and Bimini Top Flag Holders. It floats!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21XuKz48ROL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OF5L5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Cabin Products", "Flags"]], "price": 22.43}}
{"item_id": "B000OF5LWS", "title": "AIRHEAD AHKC-1 KWIK-CONNECT Tube Rope Connector", "description": "AIRHEAD® KWIK-CONNECT - Conveniently attach and detach tube tow ropes to towables with AIRHEAD’s Kwik-Connect. There’s no need to thread 60 feet of rope through the tow strap each time you connect or disconnect a tow rope. The high impact Kwik-Connect has a 1 inch diameter hole to accept up to 6,000 lb. break strength tube ropes. Recommended for 1 to 4 rider towables that are not equipped with Kwik-Connects.", "text": "AIRHEAD AHKC-1 KWIK-CONNECT Tube Rope Connector AIRHEAD® KWIK-CONNECT - Conveniently attach and detach tube tow ropes to towables with AIRHEAD’s Kwik-Connect. There’s no need to thread 60 feet of rope through the tow strap each time you connect or disconnect a tow rope. The high impact Kwik-Connect has a 1 inch diameter hole to accept up to 6,000 lb. break strength tube ropes. Recommended for 1 to 4 rider towables that are not equipped with Kwik-Connects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XZZcIIrvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OF5LWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Airhead", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Lines"]], "price": 9.97}}
