{"item_id": "B000OFKFWE", "title": "Advanced Technology International .303 Enfield MK1, 2 and 5 #4 Scope Mount", "description": "Enfield Scope Mount No. 4, MK 1, MK 2 & MK 5 Update your Enfield with a classic design! - DuPont Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer - Easy Installation - Designed for Rifles using Weaver-Type Rings - All Required Hardware Included -", "text": "Advanced Technology International .303 Enfield MK1, 2 and 5 #4 Scope Mount Enfield Scope Mount No. 4, MK 1, MK 2 & MK 5 Update your Enfield with a classic design! - DuPont Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer - Easy Installation - Designed for Rifles using Weaver-Type Rings - All Required Hardware Included -", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31n2zQ44PlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OFKFWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 36.13}}
{"item_id": "B000OGG9FU", "title": "ATI Fiberforce Buttpad", "description": "The ATI fiberforce buttpad is not affected by chemicals or extreme temperatures. Fetures, non-slip removable rubber buttpad. Simply slip-on, absorbs recoil, adds 1\" length. Fits ATI's fiberforce stocks for AK-47 and SKS.", "text": "ATI Fiberforce Buttpad The ATI fiberforce buttpad is not affected by chemicals or extreme temperatures. Fetures, non-slip removable rubber buttpad. Simply slip-on, absorbs recoil, adds 1\" length. Fits ATI's fiberforce stocks for AK-47 and SKS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xcEN6xfnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OGG9FU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ATI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 9.42}}
{"item_id": "B000OICEUM", "title": "Truglo Red-Dot 42Mmx2 Sight, Black", "description": "The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has a 5 MOA reticle designed for quick acquisition. Shock resistant to 1000g. Waterproof / fog-proof. Unlimited eye relief. Wide field of view. BONUS! See-thru / flip-up lens caps, optical-quality / all-weather. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / easy to mount. Multi-coated lenses produce more than 95 percent light transmittance. Special anti-reflective interior eliminates stray light from appearing inside the sight. Click windage and elevation adjustments. BONUS! Integrated lanyard system prevents loss of screw-down W/E caps. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Ideal for shotguns, handguns, rifles, muzzleloaders, paintball and crossbows. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "text": "Truglo Red-Dot 42Mmx2 Sight, Black The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has a 5 MOA reticle designed for quick acquisition. Shock resistant to 1000g. Waterproof / fog-proof. Unlimited eye relief. Wide field of view. BONUS! See-thru / flip-up lens caps, optical-quality / all-weather. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / easy to mount. Multi-coated lenses produce more than 95 percent light transmittance. Special anti-reflective interior eliminates stray light from appearing inside the sight. Click windage and elevation adjustments. BONUS! Integrated lanyard system prevents loss of screw-down W/E caps. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Ideal for shotguns, handguns, rifles, muzzleloaders, paintball and crossbows. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qm9mUxN5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OICEUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 68.85}}
