{"item_id": "B000OWL0X0", "title": "Wham-o Mini Frisbee Golf Set (Colors Vary)", "description": "Designed for ages 5 and up, this game features six Mini Frisbee Discs and one Frisbee Golf target, and can be played indoors or outdoors. Metal chains are designed to catch the Frisbee Discs. The product measures 12.5 inches by 12.5 inches by 4 inches and weighs 2.2 pounds.About Wham-OWham-O Inc. has been a facet of American popular culture for more than half a century. With its roots in Southern California, Wham-O has popularized some of the most iconic toy fads in history, including the Hula Hoop, Slip 'N Slide, Frisbee Disc, Superball, and much more.", "text": "Wham-o Mini Frisbee Golf Set (Colors Vary) Designed for ages 5 and up, this game features six Mini Frisbee Discs and one Frisbee Golf target, and can be played indoors or outdoors. Metal chains are designed to catch the Frisbee Discs. The product measures 12.5 inches by 12.5 inches by 4 inches and weighs 2.2 pounds.About Wham-OWham-O Inc. has been a facet of American popular culture for more than half a century. With its roots in Southern California, Wham-O has popularized some of the most iconic toy fads in history, including the Hula Hoop, Slip 'N Slide, Frisbee Disc, Superball, and much more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mLGyMR6iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OWL0X0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wham-O", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Flying Discs"]], "price": 21.28}}
{"item_id": "B000OWNPA6", "title": "Eagle Claw Pack-It Spin Combo Telescopic Rod (1 Piece)", "description": "EXCELLENT TRAVELING ROD FOR THE AVID FISHERMAN! Be ready to go fishing at any time with the Pack-It telescoping fishing pole from Eagle Claw. The go anywhere combo pioneered by Eagle Claw is perfect for storing behind your seat or in the trunk for those unplanned, spur of the moment fishing trips. This 5 section spinning rod extends to 5ft.-6in. and features an ultra light Eagle Claw Ball Bearing Reel with an aluminum spool. The rod is made from lightweight but durable fiberglass with wired framed ceramic guides and a cork/EVA handle. The reversible 10 reel is pre-loaded with line and is equipped with a quick fold handle for easy storage. One of the most innovative fishing products of all time, this Eagle Claw portable fishing system is perfect for your impulsive fishing trips! Features: 5 ft.-6 in. spinning rod Gear Ratio 5:1 Line Capacity (lbs-ft) 3-150 / 4-125 / 6-90 / 8-70 Fiberglass construction Wired framed ceramic guides Cork/EVA handle Multi disc drag Aluminum spool Pre-loaded with line 1 Ball bearing", "text": "Eagle Claw Pack-It Spin Combo Telescopic Rod (1 Piece) EXCELLENT TRAVELING ROD FOR THE AVID FISHERMAN! Be ready to go fishing at any time with the Pack-It telescoping fishing pole from Eagle Claw. The go anywhere combo pioneered by Eagle Claw is perfect for storing behind your seat or in the trunk for those unplanned, spur of the moment fishing trips. This 5 section spinning rod extends to 5ft.-6in. and features an ultra light Eagle Claw Ball Bearing Reel with an aluminum spool. The rod is made from lightweight but durable fiberglass with wired framed ceramic guides and a cork/EVA handle. The reversible 10 reel is pre-loaded with line and is equipped with a quick fold handle for easy storage. One of the most innovative fishing products of all time, this Eagle Claw portable fishing system is perfect for your impulsive fishing trips! Features: 5 ft.-6 in. spinning rod Gear Ratio 5:1 Line Capacity (lbs-ft) 3-150 / 4-125 / 6-90 / 8-70 Fiberglass construction Wired framed ceramic guides Cork/EVA handle Multi disc drag Aluminum spool Pre-loaded with line 1 Ball bearing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qj4wZ-zVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OWNPA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spinning Combos"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OWT3VG", "title": "Maxam® \"The Rock\" Extra Heavy-Duty Lockback Knife with Leymar™ Handle", "description": "This knife features 420 surgical stainless steel blade that is 1/8\" thick, nearly twice as thick as many ordinary pocket knives, which provides for a more secure lock. The Rock is perfect for skinning an animal and sturdy enough for the daily use of an electrician or carpenter. Comes with a heavy-duty Kelvlon™ pouch. Measures 4-5/8\" closed, 8-1/2\" open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.", "text": "Maxam® \"The Rock\" Extra Heavy-Duty Lockback Knife with Leymar™ Handle This knife features 420 surgical stainless steel blade that is 1/8\" thick, nearly twice as thick as many ordinary pocket knives, which provides for a more secure lock. The Rock is perfect for skinning an animal and sturdy enough for the daily use of an electrician or carpenter. Comes with a heavy-duty Kelvlon™ pouch. Measures 4-5/8\" closed, 8-1/2\" open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JAv2iJ8VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OWT3VG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BNF", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 7.3}}
{"item_id": "B000OWTSTI", "title": "Thule Crossroad 45050 Set", "description": "If you've ever wondered what to do with those goofy bars running front to back on your car, then the Thule Complete CrossRoad System will help turn those raised factory side rails into a multi-purpose gear-carrying machine. Four adjustable feet conform to your current side rails, and two square 50-inch load bars are rubberized for weather resistance and to keep your gear from getting scratched. Four locks are included with the feet to secure the CrossRoad System to your side rails.", "text": "Thule Crossroad 45050 Set If you've ever wondered what to do with those goofy bars running front to back on your car, then the Thule Complete CrossRoad System will help turn those raised factory side rails into a multi-purpose gear-carrying machine. Four adjustable feet conform to your current side rails, and two square 50-inch load bars are rubberized for weather resistance and to keep your gear from getting scratched. Four locks are included with the feet to secure the CrossRoad System to your side rails.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21kejyIrjJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OWTSTI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000OXN33Y", "title": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Stuff Sack", "description": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Stuff Sacks are super strong and lightweight. Made of 30D Diamond Siliconized Cordura. Fabric is impregnated with silicone to make it waterproof to a pressure of 2.8 psi / hydrostatic head 2000mm", "text": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Stuff Sack Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Stuff Sacks are super strong and lightweight. Made of 30D Diamond Siliconized Cordura. Fabric is impregnated with silicone to make it waterproof to a pressure of 2.8 psi / hydrostatic head 2000mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51J5jvS4VBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OXN33Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000OYFF2K", "title": "Park Tool Chainring Nut Wrench - CNW-2C", "description": "One of the quickest, easiest ways to destroy a set of chainring nuts is to try jamming a flathead in the slot to hold them in place. Do yourself a huge favor and pick up the Park Tool CNW-2C Chainring Nut Wrench. You'll be glad you did when you get your rings off without a hacksaw and a shredded crankarm spider.", "text": "Park Tool Chainring Nut Wrench - CNW-2C One of the quickest, easiest ways to destroy a set of chainring nuts is to try jamming a flathead in the slot to hold them in place. Do yourself a huge favor and pick up the Park Tool CNW-2C Chainring Nut Wrench. You'll be glad you did when you get your rings off without a hacksaw and a shredded crankarm spider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P950UgffL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OYFF2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 5.69}}
{"item_id": "B000OYFSIG", "title": "GT-85 Bicycle Chain & Cable Lube 14oz Aerosol", "description": "", "text": "GT-85 Bicycle Chain & Cable Lube 14oz Aerosol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D%2BbetficL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OYFSIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GT-85", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 12.44}}
{"item_id": "B000OYFUDY", "title": "Techno Anti-Pollution Mask", "description": "The TechnoTM mask combines the Sportsta mask's Hepa-Type filtration for sub-micron pollutants with the City mask's Dynamic ACC (Activated Charcoal Cloth) filter. This combination provides increased performance ability covering a broader spectrum of dusts and odours than either filter on its own. Working in combination with the Techno filter, are two new Techno valves specifically designed to improve airflow performance on exhalation. With these new features, the TechnoTM mask is at the top of the range.", "text": "Techno Anti-Pollution Mask The TechnoTM mask combines the Sportsta mask's Hepa-Type filtration for sub-micron pollutants with the City mask's Dynamic ACC (Activated Charcoal Cloth) filter. This combination provides increased performance ability covering a broader spectrum of dusts and odours than either filter on its own. Working in combination with the Techno filter, are two new Techno valves specifically designed to improve airflow performance on exhalation. With these new features, the TechnoTM mask is at the top of the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dnckm9AwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OYFUDY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
