{"item_id": "B000OYTM1A", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Black (Blued) 4x30 Rifle Scope w/ Free Mount & Rings", "description": "This affordable Ruger 10/22 Rifle scope combo include 4x30 scope, standard scope ring, and 1022 scope mount. You don't need to shop anywhere and this kit if everythings you need.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Black (Blued) 4x30 Rifle Scope w/ Free Mount & Rings This affordable Ruger 10/22 Rifle scope combo include 4x30 scope, standard scope ring, and 1022 scope mount. You don't need to shop anywhere and this kit if everythings you need.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DV8XSpxVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OYTM1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat Optical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 42.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZ9V5G", "title": "Cold Steel Sharkie #91SP", "description": "As the saying goes, \"the pen is mightier than the sword.\" Indeed, Cold Steel makes some mighty strong swords, but this little pen makes for some clever competition. It's the biggest, baddest, permanent marker around! Superficially, it shares many features common to most markers, but appearances can be deceptive. For starters, it's made from high impact plastic and features walls that are 4 times thicker than similar markers. This means it's built for impact and, in a self-defense emergency it can become an efficient Yawara stick for driving off an attacker. Plus, the screw-top cap will stay in place and won't pop off like a regular marker's cap would when you strike a percussion blow, or when obtaining joint locks or submission holds.", "text": "Cold Steel Sharkie #91SP As the saying goes, \"the pen is mightier than the sword.\" Indeed, Cold Steel makes some mighty strong swords, but this little pen makes for some clever competition. It's the biggest, baddest, permanent marker around! Superficially, it shares many features common to most markers, but appearances can be deceptive. For starters, it's made from high impact plastic and features walls that are 4 times thicker than similar markers. This means it's built for impact and, in a self-defense emergency it can become an efficient Yawara stick for driving off an attacker. Plus, the screw-top cap will stay in place and won't pop off like a regular marker's cap would when you strike a percussion blow, or when obtaining joint locks or submission holds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LtzY64%2BlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZ9V5G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000OZ9VLU", "title": "Kryptonite 997986 Black 18mm New York Fahgettaboudit U-Lock", "description": "Big city cyclists need big city protection, as would-be thieves aren't intimidated by just any bicycle lock. Enter the Kryptonite New York Fahgettaboutit U-lock, which features an 18mm hardened Max-Performance steel shackle designed to resist bolt cutters and leverage attacks. Ideal for anyone who lives in moderately high crime areas, the New York Fahgettaboutit boasts a maximum 12 ranking on the Kryptonite 1-12 lock comparison system, which ranks the varying levels of security offered by the company's product range. A lock that ranks 1 on the Kryptonite scale might work if you live in the burbs and have a Rottweiler parked next to your bike or motorcycle. However, city dwellers demand extreme protection, which is why the New York Fahgettaboutit is built for serious deterrent security. The U-lock also offers such security-enhancing features as a high-security disc-style cylinder; an oversized, hardened steel sleeve over the crossbar for double security; double deadbolt locking for extensive holding power; and a center keyway that defends against leverage attacks. And as a bonus, the lock comes with three keys, one of which is lighted with a high-intensity bulb that makes it easy to unlock the Fahgettaboutit after dark. Other features include a protective vinyl coating, a sliding dust cover that protects and extends the cylinder life, and dimensions of 3.25 by 6 inches.The Legendary Durability of Kryptonite LocksThe first big test for Kryptonite locks came in 1972, when Kryptonite founder Michael Zane directed the Second Avenue Bicycle Shop in New York City to lock a three-speed bicycle to a signpost in Greenwich Village. Although thieves immediately stripped all of the bicycle's removable parts, the bicycle itself remained for 30 days and 30 nights. The Kryptonite lock and the bike frame were still in place, even though the lock had been attacked numerous times. The publicity gave Kryptonite the boost it needed and forever changed the face of bicycle security. Twenty-two years later, Kryptonite returned to the streets of the Big Apple to test its latest innovation, the New York lock. In April 1994, theNew York Postlaid down the ultimate challenge: Could Kryptonite's New York lock last 48 hours on the toughest streets of New York? In a city where more than 100,000 bikes are stolen each year, Kryptonite and thePostlocked a brand new, bright green Univega road bike worth $600 to a parking meter in the East Village--the Bermuda Triangle of New York bicycle thievery. For a full 48 hours, the bike remained locked on the corner of Avenue A and 11th Street. Zane and Neil McDaid, director of product development and design for Kryptonite, watched from around the corner as the bike came under every possible means of assault, stumping thieves at every turn. After 48 hours the bike remained intact except for the gear derailleur, which had been stripped off. The lock showed definite signs of abuse, but it had not failed. The New York lock had met thePost's challenge.Not satisfied with the length of the test, Zane moved the bike to SoHo for another six days and, finally, uptown near the Lincoln Center. Even in these high-theft areas the properly locked bike lasted another three weeks before being pulled off the streets by Zane and McDaid. ThePostalso ran the New York lock through a battery of street tests using common bike theft tools: a 4-foot bolt cutter, a crowbar, and a hammer. The non-Kryptonite locks cracked in seconds, but all methods failed on the New York lock, even the monstrous bolt cutter, which was rendered useless with large dents in its jaws.About KryptoniteIn the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include power sports, hardware, and snow sports security. Through innovative product designs, cutting-edge marketing savvy, legendary customer service, and pure fanaticism for security, Kryptonite grew with a cult-like following. In 2001, the company that was started in a VW van was purchased by industry giant Ingersoll Rand and became a flagship brand in the company's Security Technologies sector. Publications such asBicycling,Fortune,The Wall Street Journal,US News & World Report, and a host of others continued to tout Kryptonite products as the best on the market. The company's dedication to its customers is best represented by its actions during the fall of 2004, when it was discovered that the industry-standard tubular cylinder could be compromised, at times, with a household item. Kryptonite flew into action, created a voluntary lock exchange program, and replaced more than 400,000 locks in 21 countries for free. In essence, the company redesigned the equivalent of nine years worth of new products in just 10 short months. Kryptonite is the only company in the world that offered such a comprehensive plan to customers, taking its \"legendary customer service\" pledge to new heights.", "text": "Kryptonite 997986 Black 18mm New York Fahgettaboudit U-Lock Big city cyclists need big city protection, as would-be thieves aren't intimidated by just any bicycle lock. Enter the Kryptonite New York Fahgettaboutit U-lock, which features an 18mm hardened Max-Performance steel shackle designed to resist bolt cutters and leverage attacks. Ideal for anyone who lives in moderately high crime areas, the New York Fahgettaboutit boasts a maximum 12 ranking on the Kryptonite 1-12 lock comparison system, which ranks the varying levels of security offered by the company's product range. A lock that ranks 1 on the Kryptonite scale might work if you live in the burbs and have a Rottweiler parked next to your bike or motorcycle. However, city dwellers demand extreme protection, which is why the New York Fahgettaboutit is built for serious deterrent security. The U-lock also offers such security-enhancing features as a high-security disc-style cylinder; an oversized, hardened steel sleeve over the crossbar for double security; double deadbolt locking for extensive holding power; and a center keyway that defends against leverage attacks. And as a bonus, the lock comes with three keys, one of which is lighted with a high-intensity bulb that makes it easy to unlock the Fahgettaboutit after dark. Other features include a protective vinyl coating, a sliding dust cover that protects and extends the cylinder life, and dimensions of 3.25 by 6 inches.The Legendary Durability of Kryptonite LocksThe first big test for Kryptonite locks came in 1972, when Kryptonite founder Michael Zane directed the Second Avenue Bicycle Shop in New York City to lock a three-speed bicycle to a signpost in Greenwich Village. Although thieves immediately stripped all of the bicycle's removable parts, the bicycle itself remained for 30 days and 30 nights. The Kryptonite lock and the bike frame were still in place, even though the lock had been attacked numerous times. The publicity gave Kryptonite the boost it needed and forever changed the face of bicycle security. Twenty-two years later, Kryptonite returned to the streets of the Big Apple to test its latest innovation, the New York lock. In April 1994, theNew York Postlaid down the ultimate challenge: Could Kryptonite's New York lock last 48 hours on the toughest streets of New York? In a city where more than 100,000 bikes are stolen each year, Kryptonite and thePostlocked a brand new, bright green Univega road bike worth $600 to a parking meter in the East Village--the Bermuda Triangle of New York bicycle thievery. For a full 48 hours, the bike remained locked on the corner of Avenue A and 11th Street. Zane and Neil McDaid, director of product development and design for Kryptonite, watched from around the corner as the bike came under every possible means of assault, stumping thieves at every turn. After 48 hours the bike remained intact except for the gear derailleur, which had been stripped off. The lock showed definite signs of abuse, but it had not failed. The New York lock had met thePost's challenge.Not satisfied with the length of the test, Zane moved the bike to SoHo for another six days and, finally, uptown near the Lincoln Center. Even in these high-theft areas the properly locked bike lasted another three weeks before being pulled off the streets by Zane and McDaid. ThePostalso ran the New York lock through a battery of street tests using common bike theft tools: a 4-foot bolt cutter, a crowbar, and a hammer. The non-Kryptonite locks cracked in seconds, but all methods failed on the New York lock, even the monstrous bolt cutter, which was rendered useless with large dents in its jaws.About KryptoniteIn the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include power sports, hardware, and snow sports security. Through innovative product designs, cutting-edge marketing savvy, legendary customer service, and pure fanaticism for security, Kryptonite grew with a cult-like following. In 2001, the company that was started in a VW van was purchased by industry giant Ingersoll Rand and became a flagship brand in the company's Security Technologies sector. Publications such asBicycling,Fortune,The Wall Street Journal,US News & World Report, and a host of others continued to tout Kryptonite products as the best on the market. The company's dedication to its customers is best represented by its actions during the fall of 2004, when it was discovered that the industry-standard tubular cylinder could be compromised, at times, with a household item. Kryptonite flew into action, created a voluntary lock exchange program, and replaced more than 400,000 locks in 21 countries for free. In essence, the company redesigned the equivalent of nine years worth of new products in just 10 short months. Kryptonite is the only company in the world that offered such a comprehensive plan to customers, taking its \"legendary customer service\" pledge to new heights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jjbtrm9XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZ9VLU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 98.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZ9WTQ", "title": "Park MT-1 Multi-Tool", "description": "A high quality multi tool that is uncomplicated, easy to use, and effective. . Each of the nine tools is carefully positioned so the MT-1 can be effectively used on those tough-to-get-to nuts, bolts, and screws", "text": "Park MT-1 Multi-Tool A high quality multi tool that is uncomplicated, easy to use, and effective. . Each of the nine tools is carefully positioned so the MT-1 can be effectively used on those tough-to-get-to nuts, bolts, and screws", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lVaYT3gGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZ9WTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OZAODY", "title": "High Sierra Long Trail 90 Suspension Pack", "description": "", "text": "High Sierra Long Trail 90 Suspension Pack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aKi7B4QQL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZAODY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "High Sierra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Lunchboxes"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZAPMO", "title": "High Sierra Ridgeline Lumbar Pack", "description": "Large, top-load main compartment has CDMP3 player pocket with PVC headphone port.; Zippered front accessory pocket, with key fob, is great for change, I.D. and other small items; Dual-side mesh water bottle pockets.; Equipped with one 500ml GE LEXAN shatter-resistant bottle..", "text": "High Sierra Ridgeline Lumbar Pack Large, top-load main compartment has CDMP3 player pocket with PVC headphone port.; Zippered front accessory pocket, with key fob, is great for change, I.D. and other small items; Dual-side mesh water bottle pockets.; Equipped with one 500ml GE LEXAN shatter-resistant bottle..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z-n5p7xkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZAPMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000OZASLW", "title": "High Sierra Wave 50 Hydration Pack (Flash Red, Graphite)", "description": "Great for biking, hiking, skiing any other way you spend the day, our Wave 50 pack holds a 1.5-liter water reservoir for easy, hands-free hydration when you're on the move. With intelligent extras like an easily accessible reservoir cap, accessory pocket, and an insulated tube cover, Wave 50 keeps you rolling along.", "text": "High Sierra Wave 50 Hydration Pack (Flash Red, Graphite) Great for biking, hiking, skiing any other way you spend the day, our Wave 50 pack holds a 1.5-liter water reservoir for easy, hands-free hydration when you're on the move. With intelligent extras like an easily accessible reservoir cap, accessory pocket, and an insulated tube cover, Wave 50 keeps you rolling along.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QiSeRvAEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZASLW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 23.73}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBIDO", "title": "Park BT-2 Cable Stretcher", "description": "Commonly referred to as a \"4th Hand\", the Park Tool Cable Stretcher pulls cables tight for adjustment of derailleurs and brakes. It features one-hand operation with a thumb lock to hold the cable tight while your hand is freed up to tighten pull-up bolts and nuts. A must for any shop, home or professional.", "text": "Park BT-2 Cable Stretcher Commonly referred to as a \"4th Hand\", the Park Tool Cable Stretcher pulls cables tight for adjustment of derailleurs and brakes. It features one-hand operation with a thumb lock to hold the cable tight while your hand is freed up to tighten pull-up bolts and nuts. A must for any shop, home or professional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419AuTUqKtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBIDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 43.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBINY", "title": "Park Tool Professional Cable & Housing Cutter - CN-10", "description": "The Park Tool CN-10 Professional Cable Cutter has a rubberized grip so it won't slip, and super-sharp jaws that make quick work of both cable and housing.", "text": "Park Tool Professional Cable & Housing Cutter - CN-10 The Park Tool CN-10 Professional Cable Cutter has a rubberized grip so it won't slip, and super-sharp jaws that make quick work of both cable and housing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-yeGydKbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBINY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 34.16}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBIPW", "title": "Park Tool USA Professional Chain Tool CT-3, 10-Speed Compatible", "description": "", "text": "Park Tool USA Professional Chain Tool CT-3, 10-Speed Compatible", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r6w56AmTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBIPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBJ9C", "title": "Park I-Beam Mini (IB-3) Fold-Up Bike Tool with Chain Tool", "description": "Whether you have to tune your derailleur, change a flat, or fix a chain, the Park Tool I-Beam Mini Fold-Up Tool includes what you need to get the job done right. A selection of hex wrenches, a T25 star drive, and a flathead screw driver helps you adjust, tighten, or loosen just about anything on your bike. Park Tool integrated a chain tool for those nasty on-trial chain breaks, and a tire-lever helps you get peel off the rubber to replace a flat. The I-Beam Mini Tool even includes two sizes of spoke wrenches to help you straighten a bent wheel.", "text": "Park I-Beam Mini (IB-3) Fold-Up Bike Tool with Chain Tool Whether you have to tune your derailleur, change a flat, or fix a chain, the Park Tool I-Beam Mini Fold-Up Tool includes what you need to get the job done right. A selection of hex wrenches, a T25 star drive, and a flathead screw driver helps you adjust, tighten, or loosen just about anything on your bike. Park Tool integrated a chain tool for those nasty on-trial chain breaks, and a tire-lever helps you get peel off the rubber to replace a flat. The I-Beam Mini Tool even includes two sizes of spoke wrenches to help you straighten a bent wheel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sKkm6Y3ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBJ9C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 24.26}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBK32", "title": "Park Tool PW-3 Pedal Wrench (15mm and 9/16 - Inch)", "description": "Made from Cro-Moly steel for a shop quality pedal wrench made to last. 15mm and 9/16¿ precision openings and a long, round, vinyl dipped handle that won¿t dig into your hand like flat pedal wrenches.", "text": "Park Tool PW-3 Pedal Wrench (15mm and 9/16 - Inch) Made from Cro-Moly steel for a shop quality pedal wrench made to last. 15mm and 9/16¿ precision openings and a long, round, vinyl dipped handle that won¿t dig into your hand like flat pedal wrenches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21O28TmIlnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBK32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBK82", "title": "Park Tool Spoke, Bearing, and Cotter Gauge - SBC-1", "description": "Top your workshop off with the Park Tool SBC-1 Spoke, Bearing, and Cotter Gauge. This gauge sizes ball bearings, crank cotters, and spokes, and thanks to its anodized aluminum finish, it will look dope for a long time.Product FeaturesTire Levers:Spoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools:Weight:Recommended Use: measuringManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Park Tool Spoke, Bearing, and Cotter Gauge - SBC-1 Top your workshop off with the Park Tool SBC-1 Spoke, Bearing, and Cotter Gauge. This gauge sizes ball bearings, crank cotters, and spokes, and thanks to its anodized aluminum finish, it will look dope for a long time.Product FeaturesTire Levers:Spoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools:Weight:Recommended Use: measuringManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S028vb83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBK82.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 8.06}}
{"item_id": "B000OZBKGE", "title": "Park Tool SR-1 Sprocket Remover/Chain whip with Header", "description": "This combination chain whip and freewheel/lockring remover wrench is heat treated to prevent bending and flexing. It also features hardened pins to keep the chain in place and a comfortable handle. Hex opening is one-inch fits Park Tool freewheel removers.", "text": "Park Tool SR-1 Sprocket Remover/Chain whip with Header This combination chain whip and freewheel/lockring remover wrench is heat treated to prevent bending and flexing. It also features hardened pins to keep the chain in place and a comfortable handle. Hex opening is one-inch fits Park Tool freewheel removers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WwGas4REL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZBKGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 21.56}}
{"item_id": "B000OZDGRK", "title": "Park Tool GearClean Brush GSC-1C 11 Speed Drivetrain Cleaning", "description": "Park Tool's patented GearClean? Brush has a unique design. A large comfortable handle with a curved, toothed-end reaches dirt deep between the gears, and tough nylon bristles clean the derailleur and chain. Saves wear and tear on your chain and freewheel. Works great on brakes or other places where dirt collects.", "text": "Park Tool GearClean Brush GSC-1C 11 Speed Drivetrain Cleaning Park Tool's patented GearClean? Brush has a unique design. A large comfortable handle with a curved, toothed-end reaches dirt deep between the gears, and tough nylon bristles clean the derailleur and chain. Saves wear and tear on your chain and freewheel. Works great on brakes or other places where dirt collects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ikzbN3jPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZDGRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 5.44}}
{"item_id": "B000OZDGWA", "title": "Park Tool HCW-16 Chain Whip/15mm Pedal Wrench", "description": "The HCW-16 is a combination pedal wrench in 15mm, and a chainwhip.", "text": "Park Tool HCW-16 Chain Whip/15mm Pedal Wrench The HCW-16 is a combination pedal wrench in 15mm, and a chainwhip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313SsSA1PiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZDGWA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B000OZDIGY", "title": "Park Tool TM-1 Spoke Tension Meter", "description": "The key to wheels that are strong and reliable is having spokes that are properly and uniformly tensioned. The TM-1 Tension Meter accurately and reliably measures the absolute tension of each of the spokes in a wheel, as well as the relative tension between all the spokes in a wheel. Easy to use and priced affordably, the TM-1 works on nearly any bicycle spoke¿no matter what the diameter, material, or shape. Not just for the experienced mechanic, the TM-1 is for anyone building or truing wheels, diagnosing wheel problems, or assembling new bikes. It¿s a tool that belongs on every workbench.", "text": "Park Tool TM-1 Spoke Tension Meter The key to wheels that are strong and reliable is having spokes that are properly and uniformly tensioned. The TM-1 Tension Meter accurately and reliably measures the absolute tension of each of the spokes in a wheel, as well as the relative tension between all the spokes in a wheel. Easy to use and priced affordably, the TM-1 works on nearly any bicycle spoke¿no matter what the diameter, material, or shape. Not just for the experienced mechanic, the TM-1 is for anyone building or truing wheels, diagnosing wheel problems, or assembling new bikes. It¿s a tool that belongs on every workbench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FV2x0yUJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZDIGY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 71.59}}
{"item_id": "B000OZE4YE", "title": "High Sierra Envoy Lumbar Pack", "description": "Stay out longer and go farther whether hiking on the trail or strolling through the city with the High Sierra Envoy lumbar pack. The Envoy, which offers 275 cubic inches of interior space, delivers hands-free, lightweight storage for all the little extras you don't want to leave behind. The bulk of the pack's storage is divided among a dual top-loading compartment for larger items, a pair of zippered side accessory pockets for smaller items, and a zippered front accessory pocket for your keys or ID. However, the bag also includes a CD/MP3 player pocket with a PVC headphone port, so you can easily listen to your favorite tunes while hiking. And to help you fit even more gear than a bag of this size should allow, the Envoy is equipped with quick-release compression straps.The Envoy's CD/MP3 player pocket includes a PVC headphone port for private listening.The Envoy is also built to keep you comfortable on the trail, with a durable waist belt with webbing keepers that adjusts to fit waist sizes between 21 and 55 inches, and a Vapel mesh padded back panel that wicks away body moisture. Other details include a contoured webbing daisy chain that lets you attach a carabiner or other gear, impact- and freeze-resistant hardware that performs well in adverse conditions, and reflective accent piping that provides added safety at night. A versatile travel companion for all your adventures, the Envoy measures 10.5 by 6.5 by 4 inches (W x H x D).About High SierraA family owned organization for more than 30 years, the High Sierra Sport Company is committed to producing thoughtfully innovative bags and luggage that appeal to the intelligence and esteem of the active lifestyle and outdoor consumer. The company specializes in adventure travel, with a dedication to function, design, and quality in each of its products. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit almost everyone's needs.Founded in 1978 as H. Bernbaum Import & Export Company by Harry Bernbaum and Hank Bernbaum, High Sierra has grown into the 10th largest outdoor company in the U.S. Today, High Sierra Sport Company employs 40 people and distributes and sells to more than 1,500 retailers and 2,250 corporate accounts worldwide. High Sierra is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association (OIA), SnowSports Industries America (SIA), and the Travel Goods Association (TGA).", "text": "High Sierra Envoy Lumbar Pack Stay out longer and go farther whether hiking on the trail or strolling through the city with the High Sierra Envoy lumbar pack. The Envoy, which offers 275 cubic inches of interior space, delivers hands-free, lightweight storage for all the little extras you don't want to leave behind. The bulk of the pack's storage is divided among a dual top-loading compartment for larger items, a pair of zippered side accessory pockets for smaller items, and a zippered front accessory pocket for your keys or ID. However, the bag also includes a CD/MP3 player pocket with a PVC headphone port, so you can easily listen to your favorite tunes while hiking. And to help you fit even more gear than a bag of this size should allow, the Envoy is equipped with quick-release compression straps.The Envoy's CD/MP3 player pocket includes a PVC headphone port for private listening.The Envoy is also built to keep you comfortable on the trail, with a durable waist belt with webbing keepers that adjusts to fit waist sizes between 21 and 55 inches, and a Vapel mesh padded back panel that wicks away body moisture. Other details include a contoured webbing daisy chain that lets you attach a carabiner or other gear, impact- and freeze-resistant hardware that performs well in adverse conditions, and reflective accent piping that provides added safety at night. A versatile travel companion for all your adventures, the Envoy measures 10.5 by 6.5 by 4 inches (W x H x D).About High SierraA family owned organization for more than 30 years, the High Sierra Sport Company is committed to producing thoughtfully innovative bags and luggage that appeal to the intelligence and esteem of the active lifestyle and outdoor consumer. The company specializes in adventure travel, with a dedication to function, design, and quality in each of its products. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit almost everyone's needs.Founded in 1978 as H. Bernbaum Import & Export Company by Harry Bernbaum and Hank Bernbaum, High Sierra has grown into the 10th largest outdoor company in the U.S. Today, High Sierra Sport Company employs 40 people and distributes and sells to more than 1,500 retailers and 2,250 corporate accounts worldwide. High Sierra is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association (OIA), SnowSports Industries America (SIA), and the Travel Goods Association (TGA).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4186TLmOF5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZE4YE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OZE5C0", "title": "High Sierra Express Lumbar Pack (Amazon,Tungsten, Charcoal)", "description": "Perfect for those all-day adventures, our Express lumbar pack holds a lot and keeps you hydrated with one side-mounted 500ml GE Lexan® shatter-resistant water bottle and space for another. Express also brings you a large, top-load compartment with plenty of room for an MP3 player, a zippered front accessory pocket for keys, IDs and more, and lots of other extras to keep you going.", "text": "High Sierra Express Lumbar Pack (Amazon,Tungsten, Charcoal) Perfect for those all-day adventures, our Express lumbar pack holds a lot and keeps you hydrated with one side-mounted 500ml GE Lexan® shatter-resistant water bottle and space for another. Express also brings you a large, top-load compartment with plenty of room for an MP3 player, a zippered front accessory pocket for keys, IDs and more, and lots of other extras to keep you going.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B5Og4P1wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZE5C0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 23.73}}
{"item_id": "B000OZE8NQ", "title": "High Sierra Solo Hydration Pack", "description": "Low-profile main compartment has a key fob and CDMP3 player pocket with; PVC headphone grommet.; Equipped with one 500ml GE LEXAN shatter-resistant bottle.; Adjustable side compression straps secure contents of pack..", "text": "High Sierra Solo Hydration Pack Low-profile main compartment has a key fob and CDMP3 player pocket with; PVC headphone grommet.; Equipped with one 500ml GE LEXAN shatter-resistant bottle.; Adjustable side compression straps secure contents of pack..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m1y7%2BR3-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZE8NQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OZFIKI", "title": "Park Tool Citrus ChainBrite Cleaner - CB-2", "description": "Park Tool Chain Brite removes the toughest grease and grime buildup from chains and components and leaves a light, protective silicone shield. Although Chain Brite is a powerful cleaner, it will not harm alloy, plastic, or painted parts. Regular use of Chain Brite (along with regular use of a quality chain lubricant) will reduce gear system wear and friction and promote smoother, quicker shifting. A handy flip-top lid on the 16 oz. (474ml) bottle makes spill free pouring easy.Product FeaturesMaterial:Volume:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Park Tool Citrus ChainBrite Cleaner - CB-2 Park Tool Chain Brite removes the toughest grease and grime buildup from chains and components and leaves a light, protective silicone shield. Although Chain Brite is a powerful cleaner, it will not harm alloy, plastic, or painted parts. Regular use of Chain Brite (along with regular use of a quality chain lubricant) will reduce gear system wear and friction and promote smoother, quicker shifting. A handy flip-top lid on the 16 oz. (474ml) bottle makes spill free pouring easy.Product FeaturesMaterial:Volume:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T2QdEQE2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZFIKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaners"]], "price": 15.36}}
{"item_id": "B000OZFILW", "title": "Park Tool Chain Checker", "description": "", "text": "Park Tool Chain Checker", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BPznqGg5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZFILW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 26.54}}
{"item_id": "B000OZFIMQ", "title": "Park Tool Chain Wear Indicator CC-3.2", "description": "A worn chain shifts poorly and wears sprockets at an accelerated rate. The CC-3.2 is a go-no go gauge designed to accurately indicate when a chain reaches .5% and .75%, the points at which most chain manufacturers suggest replacement. The updated CC-3.2 is longer, more accurate and features permanent measurement markings.", "text": "Park Tool Chain Wear Indicator CC-3.2 A worn chain shifts poorly and wears sprockets at an accelerated rate. The CC-3.2 is a go-no go gauge designed to accurately indicate when a chain reaches .5% and .75%, the points at which most chain manufacturers suggest replacement. The updated CC-3.2 is longer, more accurate and features permanent measurement markings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-2vxPT9XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZFIMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 10.69}}
{"item_id": "B000OZFJS4", "title": "Park Tool PCS-10 Home Mechanic Repair Stand", "description": "The PCS-10 has all the features of our popular PCS-9 Home Mechanic Repair Stand but with special upgrades to make set up, take down, and use faster and easier. The PCS-10 works well with many recumbents and bikes with odd shaped tubing.", "text": "Park Tool PCS-10 Home Mechanic Repair Stand The PCS-10 has all the features of our popular PCS-9 Home Mechanic Repair Stand but with special upgrades to make set up, take down, and use faster and easier. The PCS-10 works well with many recumbents and bikes with odd shaped tubing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PK-7u-TIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZFJS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 179.96}}
{"item_id": "B000OZFJTI", "title": "Park Tool Home PCS-9 Mechanic Repair Stand", "description": "The new PCS-9 offers Park Tool quality in an entry level repair stand for the home mechanic. The PCS-9 works well for many recumbents and bikes with odd shaped tubing.", "text": "Park Tool Home PCS-9 Mechanic Repair Stand The new PCS-9 offers Park Tool quality in an entry level repair stand for the home mechanic. The PCS-9 works well for many recumbents and bikes with odd shaped tubing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mgvo0tP7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZFJTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 134.96}}
{"item_id": "B000OZGR8A", "title": "Profile Design Aerodrink", "description": "Breaking your aerodynamic position won't help you break any records. That's why Profile Design created the Aerodrink. With it, you're able to store your hydration between your aero extensions. So, you'll be able to rehydrate without deviating from your sweet spot. Even better, the bottle's aerodynamic shape means that you're able to achieve the aforementioned without paying a heavy aerodynamic penalty. The Profile Design Aerodrink features a 32oz (946ml) capacity, and it weighs in around 171 grams. Please note that this bottle does not include the required mounting bracket. To mount the bottle to standard aerobars, Profile recommends its Universal Aerodrink Bracket. However, for narrower aerobars and base bar affixing, you'll need Profile's Aerodrink Base Bar Bracket.", "text": "Profile Design Aerodrink Breaking your aerodynamic position won't help you break any records. That's why Profile Design created the Aerodrink. With it, you're able to store your hydration between your aero extensions. So, you'll be able to rehydrate without deviating from your sweet spot. Even better, the bottle's aerodynamic shape means that you're able to achieve the aforementioned without paying a heavy aerodynamic penalty. The Profile Design Aerodrink features a 32oz (946ml) capacity, and it weighs in around 171 grams. Please note that this bottle does not include the required mounting bracket. To mount the bottle to standard aerobars, Profile recommends its Universal Aerodrink Bracket. However, for narrower aerobars and base bar affixing, you'll need Profile's Aerodrink Base Bar Bracket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41InK3MnVtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZGR8A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000OZI256", "title": "Swingyde Golf Swing Training Aid", "description": "Tired of practicing your swing for weeks on end with nothing to show for it? Turn to the Swingyde golf training aid, which helps you achieve greater distance and accuracy each time you step on the course. The Swingyde works intuitively, with a clip that attaches to the shaft of your club on one end, and a built-in rest that touches your left forearm on the other. The rest encourages your wrist to cock properly during the swing, helping improve your swing plane, swing tempo, clubface alignment, impact position, and follow through. Now you can know what it feels like to swing like a pro. The Swingyde is lightweight and easy to attach, and works for both right- and left-handed golfers.", "text": "Swingyde Golf Swing Training Aid Tired of practicing your swing for weeks on end with nothing to show for it? Turn to the Swingyde golf training aid, which helps you achieve greater distance and accuracy each time you step on the course. The Swingyde works intuitively, with a clip that attaches to the shaft of your club on one end, and a built-in rest that touches your left forearm on the other. The rest encourages your wrist to cock properly during the swing, helping improve your swing plane, swing tempo, clubface alignment, impact position, and follow through. Now you can know what it feels like to swing like a pro. The Swingyde is lightweight and easy to attach, and works for both right- and left-handed golfers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NIRbS4lbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZI256.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swingyde", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B000OZU94I", "title": "Monarch Riflescope 5-20x44SF Matte BDC", "description": "The Monarch 5-20x44SF riflescope combines a flexible magnification range with a high-resolution 44mm objective lens, helping set the standard for scope performance. The riflescope offers such features as a one-piece, 1-inch main body tube; a creative Eyebox design with a huge ocular that provides a 4x magnification range and 4 inches of constant eye relief without sacrificing the field of view; an ultra ClearCoat system for 95 percent light transmission; and fully multicoated, super-high-performance lenses. After the lenses are cut and polished, Nikon coats them with multiple layers of anti-reflective compounds. The compounds serve to boost light transmission, improve contrast (to pull game out of its surroundings), deliver true color rendition and flare-free viewing, and enhance the overall image quality. The scope's BDC reticle, meanwhile, is perhaps the most compelling feature, as its trajectory-compensating system is designed and calibrated to provide fast, simple aiming points for various shot distances. The unique system integrates a series of small \"ballistic circles\" to produce an unobstructed view of the target.In addition, the riflescope is prepared for years of reliable service thanks to its 100-percent waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof housing. The scope is O-ring sealed, oxygen purged, and nitrogen filled to prevent fogging, while the waterproof performance is guaranteed, even with the windage and elevation caps off. Other details include a quick focus eyepiece; a locking side-focus parallax adjustment; interchangeable turret technology with target-style windage and elevation adjustment knobs and caps; enhanced ring spacing that allows you to mount the scope on virtually any rifle; and a unique zoom control with rearward facing numbers. The riflescope carries Nikon's full lifetime warranty.Specifications:Finish: Matte blackReticle: Bullet drop compensating (BDC)Actual magnification: 5x to 20xObjective diameter: 44mmExit pupil: 2.2mmEye relief: 4 to 3.6 inchesField of view: 20.1 to 5.0 feet @ 100 yardsTube diameter: 1 inch (25.4mm)Objective O.D.: 2.05 inches/52.0 mmEyepiece O.D.: 1.73 inches/44mmAdjustment graduation (1 click): 1/8 MOAMax internal adjustment: 40 MOAParallax setting: 50 yards to infinityLength: 14.1 inchesWeight: 18.2 ouncesWarranty: Nikon lifetime warranty", "text": "Monarch Riflescope 5-20x44SF Matte BDC The Monarch 5-20x44SF riflescope combines a flexible magnification range with a high-resolution 44mm objective lens, helping set the standard for scope performance. The riflescope offers such features as a one-piece, 1-inch main body tube; a creative Eyebox design with a huge ocular that provides a 4x magnification range and 4 inches of constant eye relief without sacrificing the field of view; an ultra ClearCoat system for 95 percent light transmission; and fully multicoated, super-high-performance lenses. After the lenses are cut and polished, Nikon coats them with multiple layers of anti-reflective compounds. The compounds serve to boost light transmission, improve contrast (to pull game out of its surroundings), deliver true color rendition and flare-free viewing, and enhance the overall image quality. The scope's BDC reticle, meanwhile, is perhaps the most compelling feature, as its trajectory-compensating system is designed and calibrated to provide fast, simple aiming points for various shot distances. The unique system integrates a series of small \"ballistic circles\" to produce an unobstructed view of the target.In addition, the riflescope is prepared for years of reliable service thanks to its 100-percent waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof housing. The scope is O-ring sealed, oxygen purged, and nitrogen filled to prevent fogging, while the waterproof performance is guaranteed, even with the windage and elevation caps off. Other details include a quick focus eyepiece; a locking side-focus parallax adjustment; interchangeable turret technology with target-style windage and elevation adjustment knobs and caps; enhanced ring spacing that allows you to mount the scope on virtually any rifle; and a unique zoom control with rearward facing numbers. The riflescope carries Nikon's full lifetime warranty.Specifications:Finish: Matte blackReticle: Bullet drop compensating (BDC)Actual magnification: 5x to 20xObjective diameter: 44mmExit pupil: 2.2mmEye relief: 4 to 3.6 inchesField of view: 20.1 to 5.0 feet @ 100 yardsTube diameter: 1 inch (25.4mm)Objective O.D.: 2.05 inches/52.0 mmEyepiece O.D.: 1.73 inches/44mmAdjustment graduation (1 click): 1/8 MOAMax internal adjustment: 40 MOAParallax setting: 50 yards to infinityLength: 14.1 inchesWeight: 18.2 ouncesWarranty: Nikon lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BDx886JdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000OZU94I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 527.45}}
{"item_id": "B000P0BARW", "title": "Pure Fitness Multi Purpose Workout Bar", "description": "This heavy duty workout bar is the ultimate home strengthening and toning workout for any fitness level. The bar fits in most doorways and has six foam padded grips for performing multiple exercises to sculpt and trip your entire body. Perfect for pull-ups, push-ups, sit-ups, hanging crunches, tricep dips, and more. The sturdy bar holds up to 250 lbs and easily installs in seconds without damage to doorways or walls. Includes instructional workout poster.", "text": "Pure Fitness Multi Purpose Workout Bar This heavy duty workout bar is the ultimate home strengthening and toning workout for any fitness level. The bar fits in most doorways and has six foam padded grips for performing multiple exercises to sculpt and trip your entire body. Perfect for pull-ups, push-ups, sit-ups, hanging crunches, tricep dips, and more. The sturdy bar holds up to 250 lbs and easily installs in seconds without damage to doorways or walls. Includes instructional workout poster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uqwXDo2yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P0BARW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P0GI74", "title": "Flexible Flyer Ground Anchor Kit for Metal Frame Swing Sets", "description": "This Ground Anchor Kit allows you to safely anchor your metal frame play set into the ground--without concrete for greater stability and durability. Compatible with any four-legged Flexible Flyer steel swing set and many others, the anchors both prevent your play set from tipping when kids swing and prevent play sets from being shifted during strong winds.The Ground Anchor Kit secures any Flexible Flyer swing set to the ground.", "text": "Flexible Flyer Ground Anchor Kit for Metal Frame Swing Sets This Ground Anchor Kit allows you to safely anchor your metal frame play set into the ground--without concrete for greater stability and durability. Compatible with any four-legged Flexible Flyer steel swing set and many others, the anchors both prevent your play set from tipping when kids swing and prevent play sets from being shifted during strong winds.The Ground Anchor Kit secures any Flexible Flyer swing set to the ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h%2BTnrvDzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P0GI74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flexible Flyer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Sledding", "Snow Sleds"]], "price": 13.0}}
