{"item_id": "B000P116FM", "title": "Zebco Medium Heavy Spincast Fishing Rod and Reel Combo", "description": "Stay on your toes and never let an opportunity pass you by again--the Zebco 808 Spincast Combo includes the Auto Bait Alert which makes a clicking sound when the line is grabbed. Coming ready to fish right out of the box with the Zebco 808 spincast reel pre-spooled with 20-pound monofilament, a 7-foot heavy action rod, this combo is ready to reel in the big ones. With a 2.6:1 gear ratio, the Zebco 808 reel boasts a ball bearing drive with a multi-stop anti-reverse for confidence hook sets, dial-adjustable drag, changeable right or left hand retrieve, and a Built-in Hook Keeper. Thanks to tough ABS housing and dual ceramic pickup pins, the reel is ready for years of use. The Zebco rod boasts 2-piece construction with a powerful Z-Glass blank and a comfortable EVA grip. Get out and have fun--this combo is ready to go.808 Reel Features and Specifications:Ball-bearing driveDial-adjustable dragABS housingBuilt-in Hook KeeperMulti-stop anti-reverseDual ceramic pickup pinsChangeable right- or left-hand retrievePre-spooled with 20-pound monofilamentFishing Type: HeavyLine Weight: 20 poundLine Capacity: 90 yardsGear Ratio: 2.6:1Rod Specifications:Blank Material: Z-GlassLength: 7 feetAction: HeavyHandle: EVAWhat's in the Box?Zebco 808 Reel pre-spooled with 20-pound monofilament, heavy action 7-foot rod,", "text": "Zebco Medium Heavy Spincast Fishing Rod and Reel Combo Stay on your toes and never let an opportunity pass you by again--the Zebco 808 Spincast Combo includes the Auto Bait Alert which makes a clicking sound when the line is grabbed. Coming ready to fish right out of the box with the Zebco 808 spincast reel pre-spooled with 20-pound monofilament, a 7-foot heavy action rod, this combo is ready to reel in the big ones. With a 2.6:1 gear ratio, the Zebco 808 reel boasts a ball bearing drive with a multi-stop anti-reverse for confidence hook sets, dial-adjustable drag, changeable right or left hand retrieve, and a Built-in Hook Keeper. Thanks to tough ABS housing and dual ceramic pickup pins, the reel is ready for years of use. The Zebco rod boasts 2-piece construction with a powerful Z-Glass blank and a comfortable EVA grip. Get out and have fun--this combo is ready to go.808 Reel Features and Specifications:Ball-bearing driveDial-adjustable dragABS housingBuilt-in Hook KeeperMulti-stop anti-reverseDual ceramic pickup pinsChangeable right- or left-hand retrievePre-spooled with 20-pound monofilamentFishing Type: HeavyLine Weight: 20 poundLine Capacity: 90 yardsGear Ratio: 2.6:1Rod Specifications:Blank Material: Z-GlassLength: 7 feetAction: HeavyHandle: EVAWhat's in the Box?Zebco 808 Reel pre-spooled with 20-pound monofilament, heavy action 7-foot rod,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ScDwp8N3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P116FM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zebco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spincasting Combos"]], "price": 35.04}}
