{"item_id": "B000P1IHVS", "title": "Men's Top Shelf Bike Shorts Cycling Short Long Distance Chamois Pad *Made in USA*", "description": "Top Shelf Pro Bike Shorts for Men has flatseamed construction. This short is an eight-panel, anatomically designed bicycle short that hugs the muscles for support and reduction of muscle fatigue. Shorts prevent chafing by eliminating seams between the legs. The smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. These shorts keep you comfortable and dry with high quality fabric that absorbs perspiration. Fabric is very durable at 7.6 ounce, with nylon and lycra spandex. The tricot knit fabric has four way stretch and is cut cross grain for maximum stretch and support. The waist is a soft, non-roll elastic. The leg grippers prevent bunching up at the crotch area and are very smooth and comfortable. Our top shelf biking shorts have a M.L.P. Multi-Level Pad with 3D molded construction to eliminate friction and add extra padding to the pressure areas in the seat. The cycling crotch pad has smooth edges and wraps the body curves between the legs. It is hygienic antibacterial Coolmax that stays dry and inhibits the growth of bacteria. Machine Wash.", "text": "Men's Top Shelf Bike Shorts Cycling Short Long Distance Chamois Pad *Made in USA* Top Shelf Pro Bike Shorts for Men has flatseamed construction. This short is an eight-panel, anatomically designed bicycle short that hugs the muscles for support and reduction of muscle fatigue. Shorts prevent chafing by eliminating seams between the legs. The smooth inner leg reduces opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. These shorts keep you comfortable and dry with high quality fabric that absorbs perspiration. Fabric is very durable at 7.6 ounce, with nylon and lycra spandex. The tricot knit fabric has four way stretch and is cut cross grain for maximum stretch and support. The waist is a soft, non-roll elastic. The leg grippers prevent bunching up at the crotch area and are very smooth and comfortable. Our top shelf biking shorts have a M.L.P. Multi-Level Pad with 3D molded construction to eliminate friction and add extra padding to the pressure areas in the seat. The cycling crotch pad has smooth edges and wraps the body curves between the legs. It is hygienic antibacterial Coolmax that stays dry and inhibits the growth of bacteria. Machine Wash.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fa805R1uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P1IHVS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
