{"item_id": "B000P3GAZQ", "title": "Smartwool Women's Hiking Medium Crew Sock", "description": "Designed specifically for a woman's foot. Arch brace holds the sock in place and adds additional support. Flat-knit toe seam keeps you comfortable throughout the day. Made in the USA of New Zealand ZqueTM Merino wool.", "text": "Smartwool Women's Hiking Medium Crew Sock Designed specifically for a woman's foot. Arch brace holds the sock in place and adds additional support. Flat-knit toe seam keeps you comfortable throughout the day. Made in the USA of New Zealand ZqueTM Merino wool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nuEjCoFVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3GAZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P3IZO0", "title": "Brunton, My-Ti Spork, silver", "description": "The 0.6 ounce My-Ti Spork packs away handily and offers a compact alternative to the fork and spoon. The light, but strong My-Ti Spork has a polished, smooth eating surface for pleasurable eating. One Year Warranty. Contact us for Customer Service at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "text": "Brunton, My-Ti Spork, silver The 0.6 ounce My-Ti Spork packs away handily and offers a compact alternative to the fork and spoon. The light, but strong My-Ti Spork has a polished, smooth eating surface for pleasurable eating. One Year Warranty. Contact us for Customer Service at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vj4%2BNi9ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3IZO0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]]}}
