{"item_id": "B000P3KHLE", "title": "Brunton Vapor AF All Fuel (liquid and butane) Expedition Stove", "description": "After winning about every major award, from Outside’s “Gear of the Year,” to Backpacker’s “Editor’s Choice,” and Popular Science’s “Best of What’s New,” we decided it was time again for Brunton to unleash the next icon generation of liquid fuel stoves. Ladies and gentlemen, we bring you the ultimate stove, Vapor™ AF. Not only does it burn butane, but every liquid fuel too - white gas, kerosene, diesel #1, auto fuel, jet fuel and others. With a simple turn of the burner cup, you can adjust for any fuel you want to use without replacing jets or fiddling with loose parts. The new revolutionary design makes older-style liquid fuel stoves a thing of the past. It’s convenience from a device that, until now, was never designed to be convenient. We’ve cleared off the next shelf in our trophy case for this one. Overall dimensions:4.1”x5.2”x2.3” folded, Weight: 16oz, Aprox. BTU rating: 10,000 , Burn time: Up to 2.5 hours-high output, Boil time (1 L of water): Down to 3.5 minutes, Warranty: Limited Lifetime", "text": "Brunton Vapor AF All Fuel (liquid and butane) Expedition Stove After winning about every major award, from Outside’s “Gear of the Year,” to Backpacker’s “Editor’s Choice,” and Popular Science’s “Best of What’s New,” we decided it was time again for Brunton to unleash the next icon generation of liquid fuel stoves. Ladies and gentlemen, we bring you the ultimate stove, Vapor™ AF. Not only does it burn butane, but every liquid fuel too - white gas, kerosene, diesel #1, auto fuel, jet fuel and others. With a simple turn of the burner cup, you can adjust for any fuel you want to use without replacing jets or fiddling with loose parts. The new revolutionary design makes older-style liquid fuel stoves a thing of the past. It’s convenience from a device that, until now, was never designed to be convenient. We’ve cleared off the next shelf in our trophy case for this one. Overall dimensions:4.1”x5.2”x2.3” folded, Weight: 16oz, Aprox. BTU rating: 10,000 , Burn time: Up to 2.5 hours-high output, Boil time (1 L of water): Down to 3.5 minutes, Warranty: Limited Lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A4c9LX0lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3KHLE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P3L2TK", "title": "Brunton Lensatic Military Style Sighting Compass", "description": "The 9077 Compass from Brunton is a classic military-style lensatic sighting compass with two-degree gradations. The compass offers heavy-duty construction for field use and a long-straight side that allows for ease of use with a map. The liquid dampened compass features luminous points and a hinge that works with your thumb to steady your sighting and hold the lid tightly closed. Built to last, the compass carries a limited lifetime warranty from Brunton.Features:Two graduationsMetal bodyLensatic sightingStraight edge for use with mapLiquid dampenedLuminous pointsPainted metal bodyOverall dimensions: 3 by 2.2 by 1.2 inchesWeight: 3 ouncesLimited lifetime warranty", "text": "Brunton Lensatic Military Style Sighting Compass The 9077 Compass from Brunton is a classic military-style lensatic sighting compass with two-degree gradations. The compass offers heavy-duty construction for field use and a long-straight side that allows for ease of use with a map. The liquid dampened compass features luminous points and a hinge that works with your thumb to steady your sighting and hold the lid tightly closed. Built to last, the compass carries a limited lifetime warranty from Brunton.Features:Two graduationsMetal bodyLensatic sightingStraight edge for use with mapLiquid dampenedLuminous pointsPainted metal bodyOverall dimensions: 3 by 2.2 by 1.2 inchesWeight: 3 ouncesLimited lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dNTxTP9YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3L2TK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brunton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P3L34O", "title": "Brunton Glow Mate; Key Ring Compass", "description": "An entirely luminous key ring compass, the 9041 points magnetic north at any hour of the day or night with that classic glow-in-the-dark base. Brass split key ring for easy access. 5? graduations offer a quick and easy glance. Limited Lifetime Warranty. Contact us for Customer Service at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "text": "Brunton Glow Mate; Key Ring Compass An entirely luminous key ring compass, the 9041 points magnetic north at any hour of the day or night with that classic glow-in-the-dark base. Brass split key ring for easy access. 5? graduations offer a quick and easy glance. Limited Lifetime Warranty. Contact us for Customer Service at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419PQF0AOLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3L34O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WPHI", "title": "Plano Protector Single Pistol Case", "description": "The Protector Single Pistol Case from Plano protects your pistol during storage and transport with thick wall construction and inner walls of high-density foam that hug the firearm to prevent movement. The case carries a pistol as well as accessories and is equipped with secure, lockable latches, and a large molded-in handle.", "text": "Plano Protector Single Pistol Case The Protector Single Pistol Case from Plano protects your pistol during storage and transport with thick wall construction and inner walls of high-density foam that hug the firearm to prevent movement. The case carries a pistol as well as accessories and is equipped with secure, lockable latches, and a large molded-in handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ne1ZnAM4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WPHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 11.09}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WPKK", "title": "Plano Protector Four Pistol Case", "description": "The Plano Protector Four Pistol Case stores your firearms away safely when not in use. The three layer, high-density foam inserts protects up to four guns. Designed with thick wall construction, the case features heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. The large, molded handle is easy-to-grip and maneuver. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Plano Protector Four Pistol Case The Plano Protector Four Pistol Case stores your firearms away safely when not in use. The three layer, high-density foam inserts protects up to four guns. Designed with thick wall construction, the case features heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. The large, molded handle is easy-to-grip and maneuver. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fi25NlEkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WPKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WPXM", "title": "Plano Vertical Rifle Case - Single Scoped", "description": "The Plano AirGlide Scoped Rifle/Shotgun Case stores your gun away safely when not in use. The two layer, high-density foam inserts and security straps protect up to a 50-inch rifle or shotgun. It features heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Plano Vertical Rifle Case - Single Scoped The Plano AirGlide Scoped Rifle/Shotgun Case stores your gun away safely when not in use. The two layer, high-density foam inserts and security straps protect up to a 50-inch rifle or shotgun. It features heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iEmDkDPuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WPXM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Cases"]], "price": 42.95}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WQ0Y", "title": "Plano Protector Single Rifle/Shotgun Case", "description": "The Protector Single Rifle/Shotgun Case from Plano offers thick wall construction to keep your firearm secure and protected for storage and transport. The case carries a rifle or a shotgun and is equipped with secure, user-friendly latches, and a large molded-in handle.", "text": "Plano Protector Single Rifle/Shotgun Case The Protector Single Rifle/Shotgun Case from Plano offers thick wall construction to keep your firearm secure and protected for storage and transport. The case carries a rifle or a shotgun and is equipped with secure, user-friendly latches, and a large molded-in handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aJ9ujSWqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WQ0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 29.02}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WQ86", "title": "Plano Pillared Single Scoped Gun Case", "description": "The case is less than four inches thick, and an interlocking eggshell liner keeps your weapon secure.The Plano Pillared Single-Scoped Gun Case, ideal for a trip to the range or a hunting trip to Alaska, keeps your weapon and riflescope secure on the go. The 13-by-3.75-by-53.6-inch (W x H x D) case features the patented PillarLock system and thick wall construction to protect your firearm when traveling.Features:Patented PillarLock system protects firearmHolds rifle with large objective lensThick wall constructionComfortable molded-in handleLockable/airline approved", "text": "Plano Pillared Single Scoped Gun Case The case is less than four inches thick, and an interlocking eggshell liner keeps your weapon secure.The Plano Pillared Single-Scoped Gun Case, ideal for a trip to the range or a hunting trip to Alaska, keeps your weapon and riflescope secure on the go. The 13-by-3.75-by-53.6-inch (W x H x D) case features the patented PillarLock system and thick wall construction to protect your firearm when traveling.Features:Patented PillarLock system protects firearmHolds rifle with large objective lensThick wall constructionComfortable molded-in handleLockable/airline approved", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mgb-yK9oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WQ86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WRIK", "title": "Plano Bow-Max XT Single Bow Case", "description": "The Bow-Max XT Single Bow Case from Plano is designed to allow you to carry your bow with the quiver attached in an airline-approved, secure case. With ample capacity for accessories, the Bow-Max case features a full-length storage area in addition to the bow storage, holds up to 12 carbon or aluminum arrows in the lid, and comes complete with a 2-3715 ProLatch storage box that also tucks neatly into the case. Built for worry-free storage and transit, the case boasts thick wall construction and crush-resistant security with the patented, airline approved PillarLock System.The Bow-Max XT holds bow, quiver, and 12 carbon or aluminum bows as well as the included 2-3715 clear ProLatch storage box seen in the picture.Bow-Max Bow Case Features and Specifications:Patented PillarLock systemAllows quiver to remain attached to most bowsSeparate full-length storage areaSur-Lok arrow storage holds up to 12 carbon or aluminum arrowsDimensions: 43 by 23 by 9 inchesProLatch StowAway Box Features and Specifications:One open compartmentClear constructionDimensions: 9 by 7 by 2 inches", "text": "Plano Bow-Max XT Single Bow Case The Bow-Max XT Single Bow Case from Plano is designed to allow you to carry your bow with the quiver attached in an airline-approved, secure case. With ample capacity for accessories, the Bow-Max case features a full-length storage area in addition to the bow storage, holds up to 12 carbon or aluminum arrows in the lid, and comes complete with a 2-3715 ProLatch storage box that also tucks neatly into the case. Built for worry-free storage and transit, the case boasts thick wall construction and crush-resistant security with the patented, airline approved PillarLock System.The Bow-Max XT holds bow, quiver, and 12 carbon or aluminum bows as well as the included 2-3715 clear ProLatch storage box seen in the picture.Bow-Max Bow Case Features and Specifications:Patented PillarLock systemAllows quiver to remain attached to most bowsSeparate full-length storage areaSur-Lok arrow storage holds up to 12 carbon or aluminum arrowsDimensions: 43 by 23 by 9 inchesProLatch StowAway Box Features and Specifications:One open compartmentClear constructionDimensions: 9 by 7 by 2 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hImgFO4pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WRIK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WS02", "title": "Plano 1612 Deep Water Resistant Field Box with Lift Out Tray", "description": "Top access lid with water-resistant O-ring seal opens to reveal deep storage and a large lift-out tray making this box a great choice for in the field or at the range. A large, comfortable handle makes it convenient to haul from the range, hunting blind, and back home to re-stock. Product dimensions: 15\" long x 8\" wide x 10\" high", "text": "Plano 1612 Deep Water Resistant Field Box with Lift Out Tray Top access lid with water-resistant O-ring seal opens to reveal deep storage and a large lift-out tray making this box a great choice for in the field or at the range. A large, comfortable handle makes it convenient to haul from the range, hunting blind, and back home to re-stock. Product dimensions: 15\" long x 8\" wide x 10\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FNiP%2BHASL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WS02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 27.57}}
{"item_id": "B000P3WS7U", "title": "Plano Shooters Case With Gun Rests (X-Large)", "description": "The Plano Shooters Case offers all-in-one convenience and sturdy construction for rifle maintenance at home and in the field. Big enough to hold all your cleaning supplies, the Shooters Case is additionally equipped with a staggered yoke system that holds your rifle securely for cleaning. The hard-bodied case features a lift-out tray with a handle to keep smaller items accessible and the deep chamber below offers the capacity for bulkier items.The staggered yoke system provides a convenient platform for cleaning your rifle.", "text": "Plano Shooters Case With Gun Rests (X-Large) The Plano Shooters Case offers all-in-one convenience and sturdy construction for rifle maintenance at home and in the field. Big enough to hold all your cleaning supplies, the Shooters Case is additionally equipped with a staggered yoke system that holds your rifle securely for cleaning. The hard-bodied case features a lift-out tray with a handle to keep smaller items accessible and the deep chamber below offers the capacity for bulkier items.The staggered yoke system provides a convenient platform for cleaning your rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pUdDGePeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3WS7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YRYM", "title": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Small)", "description": "The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges and lockable, airline approved, crush-resistant PillarLock system latches.", "text": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Small) The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges and lockable, airline approved, crush-resistant PillarLock system latches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411c5RVif2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YRYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 8.52}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YSLO", "title": "Plano Pillared Double Gun Case", "description": "The 1512 PRO-Max side-by-side rifle case holds two scoped rifles. It uses Plano's patented PillarLock system and heavy-duty latches to protect your firearms while traveling. It is also lockable and airline approved.", "text": "Plano Pillared Double Gun Case The 1512 PRO-Max side-by-side rifle case holds two scoped rifles. It uses Plano's patented PillarLock system and heavy-duty latches to protect your firearms while traveling. It is also lockable and airline approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKnBh0H9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YSLO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 61.94}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YSO6", "title": "Plano Pillared Take Down Gun Case", "description": "This case is perfect for traveling with your over-under or side-by-side shotgun. It features the patented PillarLock system and is lockable and airline approved.", "text": "Plano Pillared Take Down Gun Case This case is perfect for traveling with your over-under or side-by-side shotgun. It features the patented PillarLock system and is lockable and airline approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R5qDe912L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YSO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 41.15}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YTMC", "title": "Plano Bow Max Crossbow Case, Black", "description": "The Bow-Max Crossbow Case from Plano is designed to allow you to carry your bow with the quiver and scope attached in an airline-approved, secure case. High-density foam in combination with poly tie down straps ensure security for your bow and the lid holds bolts securely. Built for worry-free storage and transit, the case boasts thick wall construction and crush-resistant security with the patented, airline approved PillarLock System.The Bow-Max Case holds the bow and quiver, and offers bolt storage in the lid.Features and Specifications:Patented PillarLock protects crossbowFits most of today's largest crossbows with scopes attachedHigh-density foamPoly tie down strapsBolt storage in lidQuiver can stay attached to most bows", "text": "Plano Bow Max Crossbow Case, Black The Bow-Max Crossbow Case from Plano is designed to allow you to carry your bow with the quiver and scope attached in an airline-approved, secure case. High-density foam in combination with poly tie down straps ensure security for your bow and the lid holds bolts securely. Built for worry-free storage and transit, the case boasts thick wall construction and crush-resistant security with the patented, airline approved PillarLock System.The Bow-Max Case holds the bow and quiver, and offers bolt storage in the lid.Features and Specifications:Patented PillarLock protects crossbowFits most of today's largest crossbows with scopes attachedHigh-density foamPoly tie down strapsBolt storage in lidQuiver can stay attached to most bows", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DkAnQWsSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YTMC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 80.78}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YVD4", "title": "Plano Shot Shell Box, 12 & 16 gauge", "description": "This shotgun shell case will store 25 rounds of 12 or 16 gauge shells. It is a great way to transport your ammo to the field, or organize it on the reloading bench.", "text": "Plano Shot Shell Box, 12 & 16 gauge This shotgun shell case will store 25 rounds of 12 or 16 gauge shells. It is a great way to transport your ammo to the field, or organize it on the reloading bench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EYJgAZqaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YVD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 8.35}}
{"item_id": "B000P3YVFW", "title": "Plano Shot Shell Box, 3.5\" 12 gauge", "description": "This Plano shotshell box, with a deeper design, will hold your 3.5\" 12 and 16 gauge rounds. It is perfect for stowing in your gear for that trip to the duck blind.", "text": "Plano Shot Shell Box, 3.5\" 12 gauge This Plano shotshell box, with a deeper design, will hold your 3.5\" 12 and 16 gauge rounds. It is perfect for stowing in your gear for that trip to the duck blind.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411fCl6LDLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P3YVFW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 4.3}}
{"item_id": "B000P40UJC", "title": "Plano Protector Compact Bow Case (Black)", "description": "This compact bow case fits most parallel limb bows. It features the patented PillarLock System that adds extra protection to your valuable archery equipment. It features arrow storage in the lid and is lockable and airline approved", "text": "Plano Protector Compact Bow Case (Black) This compact bow case fits most parallel limb bows. It features the patented PillarLock System that adds extra protection to your valuable archery equipment. It features arrow storage in the lid and is lockable and airline approved", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QC-29fgpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P40UJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P40URE", "title": "Plano Compact Bow Case - Camo", "description": "Designed to fit parallel limb bows, the Protector Compact Bow Case from Plano features thick wall construction and the patented, crush-resistant, airline approved PillarLock System for security. The case is well padded with high density foam and keeps arrows securely stowed under the lid. Equipped with a molded in handle, the case is easy to carry wherever you need to go.The Protector Bow Case offers thick wall construction and the PillarLock system.Features and Specifications:Holds parallel limb bowsCompact designArrow storage under lidThick wall constructionPatented PillarLock SystemLockable/airline approvedMolded handleHigh density foamDimensions: 43.25 by 19 by 6.75 inches", "text": "Plano Compact Bow Case - Camo Designed to fit parallel limb bows, the Protector Compact Bow Case from Plano features thick wall construction and the patented, crush-resistant, airline approved PillarLock System for security. The case is well padded with high density foam and keeps arrows securely stowed under the lid. Equipped with a molded in handle, the case is easy to carry wherever you need to go.The Protector Bow Case offers thick wall construction and the PillarLock system.Features and Specifications:Holds parallel limb bowsCompact designArrow storage under lidThick wall constructionPatented PillarLock SystemLockable/airline approvedMolded handleHigh density foamDimensions: 43.25 by 19 by 6.75 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H1gQqLc4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P40URE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 53.82}}
{"item_id": "B000P40VPU", "title": "Plano Protector Pro Max Pillared Double Pistol Case", "description": "The Pro Max Pillared Double Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction to keep your firearms secure and protected--even during airplane travel. The case offers the capacity to carry two pistols and is equipped with lockable, airline approved, and crush-resistant PillarLock system latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security. A large, molded-in handle rounds out the features on this travel-friendly case.", "text": "Plano Protector Pro Max Pillared Double Pistol Case The Pro Max Pillared Double Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction to keep your firearms secure and protected--even during airplane travel. The case offers the capacity to carry two pistols and is equipped with lockable, airline approved, and crush-resistant PillarLock system latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security. A large, molded-in handle rounds out the features on this travel-friendly case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Aio8uI16L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P40VPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 17.98}}
{"item_id": "B000P40Y48", "title": "Plano 1412 Shallow Water Resistant Field Box", "description": "Water-resistant seals make this box a great choice for ammo storage while a large, comfortable handle makes it equally convenient to haul from the range, hunting blind, home to re-stock and back out for more action. Product dimensions: 15\" long x 8\" wide x 6.25\" high", "text": "Plano 1412 Shallow Water Resistant Field Box Water-resistant seals make this box a great choice for ammo storage while a large, comfortable handle makes it equally convenient to haul from the range, hunting blind, home to re-stock and back out for more action. Product dimensions: 15\" long x 8\" wide x 6.25\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OQp0VMLEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P40Y48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 17.18}}
{"item_id": "B000P4310M", "title": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Medium)", "description": "The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges, lockable, user-friendly latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security.", "text": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Medium) The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges, lockable, user-friendly latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hP39JtblL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P4310M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 9.69}}
{"item_id": "B000P43134", "title": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Large)", "description": "The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges, lockable, user-friendly latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security.", "text": "Plano Shaped Pistol Case (Large) The Shaped Pistol Case from Plano offers thick wall construction surrounded by two layers of high-density foam to keep your firearm secure and protected. The case is equipped with strong piano style hinges, lockable, user-friendly latches, and padlock tabs for even greater security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4167yFSghAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P43134.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 6.24}}
{"item_id": "B000P431BG", "title": "Plano Single Scoped or Double Non-Scoped Rifle Case", "description": "The Plano Protector Series Double Gun Case stores your guns away safely when they are not in use. The thick wall construction protects two rifles or shotguns up to 50 inches long. It features heavy-duty, durable latches and a comfortable, molded-in handle. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.Key Features:Comfortable molded-in handleThick wall constructionHigh density foam insertsHeavy-duty latchesLockable functionAirline approvedMeasures 51.5 inches long by 4 inches wide by 15 inches tall", "text": "Plano Single Scoped or Double Non-Scoped Rifle Case The Plano Protector Series Double Gun Case stores your guns away safely when they are not in use. The thick wall construction protects two rifles or shotguns up to 50 inches long. It features heavy-duty, durable latches and a comfortable, molded-in handle. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.Key Features:Comfortable molded-in handleThick wall constructionHigh density foam insertsHeavy-duty latchesLockable functionAirline approvedMeasures 51.5 inches long by 4 inches wide by 15 inches tall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kX4ADfa3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P431BG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 50.96}}
{"item_id": "B000P432OW", "title": "Plano Bow Max Pillar Lock Series 18 Arrow Case, Black", "description": "The Bow-Max arrow case features Plano's patented PillarLock system to make sure your arrows arrive the same way you packed them. It utilize the Sur-Lok arrow holders so you can store either carbon or aluminum arrows.", "text": "Plano Bow Max Pillar Lock Series 18 Arrow Case, Black The Bow-Max arrow case features Plano's patented PillarLock system to make sure your arrows arrive the same way you packed them. It utilize the Sur-Lok arrow holders so you can store either carbon or aluminum arrows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q1OEhnRxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P432OW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Cases"]], "price": 25.89}}
{"item_id": "B000P433TG", "title": "Plano Shooters Case", "description": "The Plano Shooters Case offers all-in-one convenience and sturdy construction for rifle maintenance at home or in the field. Big enough to hold all your cleaning supplies, the Shooters Case is also equipped with a staggered yoke system that holds your rifle securely for cleaning. The hard-bodied case features two lift-out trays with handles to keep smaller items accessible and the deep chamber below offers the capacity for bulkier items. Durable latches, a large over-molded carry handle, and two removable dividers for greater interior organization round out the Plano Shooter's Case.The staggered yoke system provides a convenient platform for cleaning your rifle.", "text": "Plano Shooters Case The Plano Shooters Case offers all-in-one convenience and sturdy construction for rifle maintenance at home or in the field. Big enough to hold all your cleaning supplies, the Shooters Case is also equipped with a staggered yoke system that holds your rifle securely for cleaning. The hard-bodied case features two lift-out trays with handles to keep smaller items accessible and the deep chamber below offers the capacity for bulkier items. Durable latches, a large over-molded carry handle, and two removable dividers for greater interior organization round out the Plano Shooter's Case.The staggered yoke system provides a convenient platform for cleaning your rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qt5gmVowL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P433TG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P433Y6", "title": "Plano 7810 Extra Large Shooters Case", "description": "Designed for field use, the Shooters Case from Plano offers room for all of your cleaning supplies and is equipped with a lift-out handle tray for organization. The box measures 22 by 14.25 by 11.5 inches and features a sturdy handle and durable latches.", "text": "Plano 7810 Extra Large Shooters Case Designed for field use, the Shooters Case from Plano offers room for all of your cleaning supplies and is equipped with a lift-out handle tray for organization. The box measures 22 by 14.25 by 11.5 inches and features a sturdy handle and durable latches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416J-cjL2oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P433Y6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 23.3}}
{"item_id": "B000P4ID8C", "title": "Fox Head Men's Bomber Glove", "description": "A rugged, molded ballistic guard keeps your knuckles well protected.Ride motocross for long enough, and your hands are bound to get a little beat up unless you take steps to protect them, and the Fox Bomber glove offers something like a coat of armor for your hands. A full-coverage, individually molded polycarbonate ballistic plate keeps your knuckles protected, and rugged yet well-ventilated Pittards leather construction helps handle the rest. Additional features include a double-layer clarino palm, silicone lever grip, and hook-and-loop closure.WarrantyFox Head products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Fox HeadFox Head, headquartered in Morgan Hill, CA, is the bestselling and likely most recognized brand of motocross apparel in the world. The company built its business from the ground up over the last 30 years, developing clothing for intense, physically demanding motorsport events. By working closely with riders such as Ricky Carmichael, James Stewart, Damon Bradshaw, Rick Johnson, Mark Barnett, Doug Henry, Jeremy McGrath, and Steve Lamson, Fox has researched and developed race clothing that provides riders with maximum protection and performance, along with freedom of movement.", "text": "Fox Head Men's Bomber Glove A rugged, molded ballistic guard keeps your knuckles well protected.Ride motocross for long enough, and your hands are bound to get a little beat up unless you take steps to protect them, and the Fox Bomber glove offers something like a coat of armor for your hands. A full-coverage, individually molded polycarbonate ballistic plate keeps your knuckles protected, and rugged yet well-ventilated Pittards leather construction helps handle the rest. Additional features include a double-layer clarino palm, silicone lever grip, and hook-and-loop closure.WarrantyFox Head products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Fox HeadFox Head, headquartered in Morgan Hill, CA, is the bestselling and likely most recognized brand of motocross apparel in the world. The company built its business from the ground up over the last 30 years, developing clothing for intense, physically demanding motorsport events. By working closely with riders such as Ricky Carmichael, James Stewart, Damon Bradshaw, Rick Johnson, Mark Barnett, Doug Henry, Jeremy McGrath, and Steve Lamson, Fox has researched and developed race clothing that provides riders with maximum protection and performance, along with freedom of movement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GtQho2TeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P4ID8C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P4NL52", "title": "Edge Innovative Hunting Quiver Critter Hunting Decoy", "description": "Edge Innovative hunting products have been on the market for 17 years. Our goal is to offer new innovative decoys and accessories to the maket year after year. Sound, motion and sight is incorporated into our Edge prodcuts. Waterfowl, Predator, Game Birds,Big Game,Pigeons- Come Hunt with Edge!", "text": "Edge Innovative Hunting Quiver Critter Hunting Decoy Edge Innovative hunting products have been on the market for 17 years. Our goal is to offer new innovative decoys and accessories to the maket year after year. Sound, motion and sight is incorporated into our Edge prodcuts. Waterfowl, Predator, Game Birds,Big Game,Pigeons- Come Hunt with Edge!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YSEGvaxIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P4NL52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Edge Innovative Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]], "price": 30.19}}
{"item_id": "B000P4YJC6", "title": "Tipton Gun Vise", "description": "Secure your rifle or shotgun for just about any work you want to perform on it. The Tipton Gun Vise is an ideal \"third hand\" for cleaning and gunsmithing. It features a rubberized cradle and jaws to protect and grip your gun, a quick release cam action for easy access, molded-in compartments for solvents and small parts, and is made of tough, solvent-resistant polymers.", "text": "Tipton Gun Vise Secure your rifle or shotgun for just about any work you want to perform on it. The Tipton Gun Vise is an ideal \"third hand\" for cleaning and gunsmithing. It features a rubberized cradle and jaws to protect and grip your gun, a quick release cam action for easy access, molded-in compartments for solvents and small parts, and is made of tough, solvent-resistant polymers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H2beGGbZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P4YJC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 47.33}}
{"item_id": "B000P583SQ", "title": "Plano Pro Max Double Scoped Rifle Case", "description": "The Plano Protector Pro Max Pillared Double Rifle Case stores your gun away safely when not in use. The patented pillar-lock system and poly tie-down security straps protect up to two scoped rifles with large objective lens. It features six heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Plano Pro Max Double Scoped Rifle Case The Plano Protector Pro Max Pillared Double Rifle Case stores your gun away safely when not in use. The patented pillar-lock system and poly tie-down security straps protect up to two scoped rifles with large objective lens. It features six heavy-duty, durable latches and hinges that will last. And because it's airline approved, you can lock the case and take it with you on flights. The case also comes with a nameplate order form for personalization and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yBpLGeKzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P583SQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P5JAYC", "title": "Mens Hanes Over the Calf Tube Socks White 10-13 - 180/10", "description": "", "text": "Mens Hanes Over the Calf Tube Socks White 10-13 - 180/10", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LbPVQj2QL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P5JAYC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Athletic Socks"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B000P6BGYI", "title": "TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Cot (85\"x 40\")", "description": "Do away with self-inflating mats and other uncomfortable camping beds, and enjoy a good night's sleep time and again with the Outfitter XXL cot. Every bit as rugged as it is large, the 85-by-40-inch Outfitter offers a patented steel leg frame that supports up to 600 pounds, making it an ideal accessory for larger campers. Even better, setup and breakdown is quick and hassle-free so you needn't spend several minutes fussing with the cot each evening (Teton included detailed setup instructions with photos, however, just in case). And to enjoy an even better evening on the lakeside, consider purchasing an Outfitter XXL foam pad (sold separately), which is designed to custom fit the Outfitter cot. Comfortable enough to function as a guest bed for visitors, the Outfitter XXL folds down to a 42-by-12-by-7-inch footprint and comes with a handy carrying bag.Specifications:Patented steel leg frameSupports up to 600 poundsHeavy-duty rubber bushingsCompatible with custom XXL foam pad (sold separately)Measures 85 x 40 inches when openFolds up to 42 x 12 x 7 inchesIncludes carrying bag", "text": "TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Cot (85\"x 40\") Do away with self-inflating mats and other uncomfortable camping beds, and enjoy a good night's sleep time and again with the Outfitter XXL cot. Every bit as rugged as it is large, the 85-by-40-inch Outfitter offers a patented steel leg frame that supports up to 600 pounds, making it an ideal accessory for larger campers. Even better, setup and breakdown is quick and hassle-free so you needn't spend several minutes fussing with the cot each evening (Teton included detailed setup instructions with photos, however, just in case). And to enjoy an even better evening on the lakeside, consider purchasing an Outfitter XXL foam pad (sold separately), which is designed to custom fit the Outfitter cot. Comfortable enough to function as a guest bed for visitors, the Outfitter XXL folds down to a 42-by-12-by-7-inch footprint and comes with a handy carrying bag.Specifications:Patented steel leg frameSupports up to 600 poundsHeavy-duty rubber bushingsCompatible with custom XXL foam pad (sold separately)Measures 85 x 40 inches when openFolds up to 42 x 12 x 7 inchesIncludes carrying bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318IBUMVLRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P6BGYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 179.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P6DJ8O", "title": "TETON Sports Camp Cot Pad", "description": "", "text": "TETON Sports Camp Cot Pad", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tXnjhKNZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P6DJ8O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P6VMEC", "title": "Master Lock 8295DPS Quantum Cuff Cable Lock", "description": "The Masterlock 8205DPS quantum cable lock is a perfect solution for protecting your bicycle, ATV, or other valuables against theft. And conveniently, it comes in one handy solution, with both a cable and a lock. The braided steel cable is 9/16-inch thick and has a polymer coating, making it highly resistant to cutting and sawing; the lock has a heat-treated core and is virtually impossible to pick for doubled security. The integrated cuff-lock is three-inches in diameter, large enough to lock around bicycle frames, sign posts, and parking meters, and the lock secures without a key for quick and easy locking convenience. The set is covered with a limited lifetime warranty.--Jeffrey Dalto", "text": "Master Lock 8295DPS Quantum Cuff Cable Lock The Masterlock 8205DPS quantum cable lock is a perfect solution for protecting your bicycle, ATV, or other valuables against theft. And conveniently, it comes in one handy solution, with both a cable and a lock. The braided steel cable is 9/16-inch thick and has a polymer coating, making it highly resistant to cutting and sawing; the lock has a heat-treated core and is virtually impossible to pick for doubled security. The integrated cuff-lock is three-inches in diameter, large enough to lock around bicycle frames, sign posts, and parking meters, and the lock secures without a key for quick and easy locking convenience. The set is covered with a limited lifetime warranty.--Jeffrey Dalto", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bf0LSVqlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P6VMEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Master Lock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 32.9}}
{"item_id": "B000P7ANRI", "title": "Powertec Fitness P-HC10 45-Degree Dual Hyperextension / Roman Chair", "description": "Strengthen your lower back, glutes, and abs in a comfortable and precise position with this dual hyperextension/Roman chair. The only hyperextension chair of its kind that provides several variations, the P-HC lets you lock in at a 45-degree angle for slanted hyperextensions, or use the adjustable foot roller system and adjustable seat to perform traditional hyperextensions. Even better, the multiple adjustments--which include a variable footplate--accommodates all body types and sizes. The P-HC, which also lets you perform Roman chair sit-ups, measures 24 by 30 by 50 inches (W x H x D) and carries the following warranties: lifetime on the frame, two years on component parts (such as bearings and spring pins), and one year on pads, grips, and unspecified parts.", "text": "Powertec Fitness P-HC10 45-Degree Dual Hyperextension / Roman Chair Strengthen your lower back, glutes, and abs in a comfortable and precise position with this dual hyperextension/Roman chair. The only hyperextension chair of its kind that provides several variations, the P-HC lets you lock in at a 45-degree angle for slanted hyperextensions, or use the adjustable foot roller system and adjustable seat to perform traditional hyperextensions. Even better, the multiple adjustments--which include a variable footplate--accommodates all body types and sizes. The P-HC, which also lets you perform Roman chair sit-ups, measures 24 by 30 by 50 inches (W x H x D) and carries the following warranties: lifetime on the frame, two years on component parts (such as bearings and spring pins), and one year on pads, grips, and unspecified parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Hpijka7yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P7ANRI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 364.99}}
