{"item_id": "B000P8UR50", "title": "Remington 7400 Monte Carlo Stock and Fore-end Synthetic Rifle (Black)", "description": "This Monte Carlo replacement stock and fore-end is designed to specifically fit Remington Models 7400 rifles. Constructed of incredibly strong all weather, fiberglass reinforced synthetic material and complete with all hardware for conversion.", "text": "Remington 7400 Monte Carlo Stock and Fore-end Synthetic Rifle (Black) This Monte Carlo replacement stock and fore-end is designed to specifically fit Remington Models 7400 rifles. Constructed of incredibly strong all weather, fiberglass reinforced synthetic material and complete with all hardware for conversion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21epx5tw76L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P8UR50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 61.99}}
