{"item_id": "B000P9D062", "title": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp Large Grill", "description": "Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 36-by-18-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "text": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp Large Grill Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 36-by-18-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g2pccO2yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9D062.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 46.84}}
{"item_id": "B000P9EZNO", "title": "Texsport Knollwood Bivy Shelter Tent", "description": "Super light easy to pack and setup.Flame retardant, meets C.P.A.I.-84 specifications", "text": "Texsport Knollwood Bivy Shelter Tent Super light easy to pack and setup.Flame retardant, meets C.P.A.I.-84 specifications", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LlvXAKA9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9EZNO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000P9EZY8", "title": "Texsport Stainless Steel Coffee Percolator", "description": "The Texsport Stainless Steel Coffee Percolator is ideal for camping, picnics and home use. Seamless construction protects from bursting, withstands greater impact and works with the heavy-gauge stainless steel to reduce corrosion. 3-piece percolator system creates your perfect cup of coffee, at home or in camp. Precision fitted parts. Choose from 9, 14 or 28 cup capacity.14 Cup: 8\"h x 6\"d.28 Cup: 9\"h x 8\"d..", "text": "Texsport Stainless Steel Coffee Percolator The Texsport Stainless Steel Coffee Percolator is ideal for camping, picnics and home use. Seamless construction protects from bursting, withstands greater impact and works with the heavy-gauge stainless steel to reduce corrosion. 3-piece percolator system creates your perfect cup of coffee, at home or in camp. Precision fitted parts. Choose from 9, 14 or 28 cup capacity.14 Cup: 8\"h x 6\"d.28 Cup: 9\"h x 8\"d..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G499k0zAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9EZY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]]}}
