{"item_id": "B000P9F02Y", "title": "Texsport Deluxe Propane Heater", "description": "Texsport Deluxe 10,000-BTU Propane Heater. Warm up to no-fuss heat! Portable hot stuff! From one of the biggest names in the industry comes this value-priced Heater that's as compact as it is powerful. You provide the propane, Texsport delivers the chill-chasing warmth you need! More: Durable ceramic burner for even heating and increased heat radiation; On / off control knob adjusts burner up to 10,000 BTU; Rugged steel reflector with safety grill can take the occasional bump; Auto shut-off valve shuts off fuel if flame goes out; POL adapter mounts directly to most bulk tanks. Bulk propane tank not included. Order Yours Today! Texsport Deluxe 10,000-BTU Propane Heater", "text": "Texsport Deluxe Propane Heater Texsport Deluxe 10,000-BTU Propane Heater. Warm up to no-fuss heat! Portable hot stuff! From one of the biggest names in the industry comes this value-priced Heater that's as compact as it is powerful. You provide the propane, Texsport delivers the chill-chasing warmth you need! More: Durable ceramic burner for even heating and increased heat radiation; On / off control knob adjusts burner up to 10,000 BTU; Rugged steel reflector with safety grill can take the occasional bump; Auto shut-off valve shuts off fuel if flame goes out; POL adapter mounts directly to most bulk tanks. Bulk propane tank not included. Order Yours Today! Texsport Deluxe 10,000-BTU Propane Heater", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41p-ZGklCRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9F02Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P9F092", "title": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp 24\" X 16\" Grill", "description": "Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 24-by-16-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "text": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp 24\" X 16\" Grill Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 24-by-16-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3184ie0NajL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9F092.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 29.99}}
