{"item_id": "B000P9GZGE", "title": "Texsport Camouflage Trail Tent", "description": "A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this compact model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for two campers, at a great value.The Camouflage Trail Tent measures 54-by-38-by-84 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down. Ruggedly durable taffeta material has a water-resistant polyurethane coating and is flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications. Its classic pup tent design is accented by a tub-style polyethylene floor constructed of water- and boot-proof ripstop material, and a zippered mesh rear window with storm flap for optimal airflow. The tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.", "text": "Texsport Camouflage Trail Tent A proper collection of camping gear begins with your tent, and this compact model from Texsport offers a comfortable night's sleep for two campers, at a great value.The Camouflage Trail Tent measures 54-by-38-by-84 inches (W x H x D) and features easy set-up and take-down. Ruggedly durable taffeta material has a water-resistant polyurethane coating and is flame retardant to C.P.A.I.-84 specifications. Its classic pup tent design is accented by a tub-style polyethylene floor constructed of water- and boot-proof ripstop material, and a zippered mesh rear window with storm flap for optimal airflow. The tent comes complete with stakes and a convenient carrying and storage bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51328Y%2BMywL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9GZGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 29.27}}
{"item_id": "B000P9GZU0", "title": "Texsport Propane Double Heater", "description": "Texsport Propane, Double Heater 14221TEX", "text": "Texsport Propane Double Heater Texsport Propane, Double Heater 14221TEX", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Imcx3x6ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9GZU0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Warmers"]], "price": 72.79}}
{"item_id": "B000P9H04K", "title": "Texsport Olympia Sleeping Bag", "description": "Nothing is as crucial to a successful camping trip as a good night's sleep, and the Texsport Olympia Sleeping Bag helps provide just that. This mummy-style bag is comfort rated down to 15 degrees Fahrenheit, and measures 33-by-24-by-84 inches (W x H x D), fitting campers of almost any size.Its navy blue exterior and interior are made of ripstop polyester material with double-layer offset scroll construction for maximum durability. The bag is insulated with three pounds of 100% Insulblok siliconized hollow fiber insulation to keep you toasty throughout the night.The machine washable bag includes a polyester stuff sack, and a hang tag for airing out once you're off the trail and back home.", "text": "Texsport Olympia Sleeping Bag Nothing is as crucial to a successful camping trip as a good night's sleep, and the Texsport Olympia Sleeping Bag helps provide just that. This mummy-style bag is comfort rated down to 15 degrees Fahrenheit, and measures 33-by-24-by-84 inches (W x H x D), fitting campers of almost any size.Its navy blue exterior and interior are made of ripstop polyester material with double-layer offset scroll construction for maximum durability. The bag is insulated with three pounds of 100% Insulblok siliconized hollow fiber insulation to keep you toasty throughout the night.The machine washable bag includes a polyester stuff sack, and a hang tag for airing out once you're off the trail and back home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417yfNAnt0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9H04K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 35.22}}
{"item_id": "B000P9H0BI", "title": "Texsport Lensatic Compass", "description": "COMPASS, MARCHING", "text": "Texsport Lensatic Compass COMPASS, MARCHING", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sTXLNFJeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9H0BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P9H0CC", "title": "Texsport Folding Survival w/Saw Shovel", "description": "Packing the right tools can make or break your camping trip, and this handy two-in-one device from Texsport is good for trench-digging, stake-pounding, wood-sawing, and more.The extended shovel measures a full 24 inches, yet folds to a compact, easily stowed 12.25-inch length, and a snap lock adjustment keeps the shovel head secure. The handle unscrews to reveal a 5.5-inch blade saw, and heavy-duty steel construction will hold up to years of heavy use.", "text": "Texsport Folding Survival w/Saw Shovel Packing the right tools can make or break your camping trip, and this handy two-in-one device from Texsport is good for trench-digging, stake-pounding, wood-sawing, and more.The extended shovel measures a full 24 inches, yet folds to a compact, easily stowed 12.25-inch length, and a snap lock adjustment keeps the shovel head secure. The handle unscrews to reveal a 5.5-inch blade saw, and heavy-duty steel construction will hold up to years of heavy use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VceotOb5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9H0CC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 19.0}}
