{"item_id": "B000P9IRKQ", "title": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp 16\" x 12\" Grill", "description": "Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 16-by-12-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "text": "Texsport Heavy Duty Camp 16\" x 12\" Grill Food just tastes better outside especially grilled food. To ensure you're outfitted appropriately to show your culinary prowess in the great outdoors, try the Texsport Camp Grill. The sturdy 16-by-12-inch (W x D) grilling surface is made of heavy-duty welded steel, designed for cooking over an open fire. When it's time to strike camp, the legs fold up for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312p4SwJCzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9IRKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000P9IRLA", "title": "Texsport Rotisserie & Spit Grill", "description": "Take your campfire culinary skills to another level with this handy grilling accessory from Texsport. Easy to set-up, it features a height-adjustable 24-by-16-inch (W x D) grill surface and similarly height-adjustable stainless steel rotisserie spit that turns and locks in four positions for delicious, slow-roasted flavor. Twin steel side arms can swing into position to keep potted food warm.", "text": "Texsport Rotisserie & Spit Grill Take your campfire culinary skills to another level with this handy grilling accessory from Texsport. Easy to set-up, it features a height-adjustable 24-by-16-inch (W x D) grill surface and similarly height-adjustable stainless steel rotisserie spit that turns and locks in four positions for delicious, slow-roasted flavor. Twin steel side arms can swing into position to keep potted food warm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61PLClowtpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9IRLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 59.98}}
