{"item_id": "B000P9WELO", "title": "Neet Suede Shooting Glove", "description": "Neet Suede Shooting Glove. For those archers who prefer a finger release to a mechanical trigger, Neet's Suede Shooting Glove is a perfect fit. It's ultimate protection, sensitivity, and a smooth release, all rolled up into one for top consistency! Made from soft suede, with smooth-grain leather tips, and a hook-and-loop wrist strap. Fits both right and left hand. State Size. Order yours today! Neet Suede Shooting Glove", "text": "Neet Suede Shooting Glove Neet Suede Shooting Glove. For those archers who prefer a finger release to a mechanical trigger, Neet's Suede Shooting Glove is a perfect fit. It's ultimate protection, sensitivity, and a smooth release, all rolled up into one for top consistency! Made from soft suede, with smooth-grain leather tips, and a hook-and-loop wrist strap. Fits both right and left hand. State Size. Order yours today! Neet Suede Shooting Glove", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t2feccsWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000P9WELO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear"]]}}
