{"item_id": "B000PCZZO4", "title": "Hornady Cam-Lock Bullet Puller", "description": "The fastest, easiest way yet to pull bullets with your press. Just clamp down and the bullet is out. Uses standard collets(sold separately)", "text": "Hornady Cam-Lock Bullet Puller The fastest, easiest way yet to pull bullets with your press. Just clamp down and the bullet is out. Uses standard collets(sold separately)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kq-y6aDzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PCZZO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.26}}
{"item_id": "B000PCZZU8", "title": "Hornady Case Activated Powder Drop", "description": "Hornady's new and improved case activated powder drop has been re-engineered with quick change-over in mind. The retainer spring has been re-engineered for smoother function that previous models and the powder drop only dispenses a powder charge when a case is present. Works with the Lock-N-Load AP or other progressive presses that use 7/8\"X14 threads.", "text": "Hornady Case Activated Powder Drop Hornady's new and improved case activated powder drop has been re-engineered with quick change-over in mind. The retainer spring has been re-engineered for smoother function that previous models and the powder drop only dispenses a powder charge when a case is present. Works with the Lock-N-Load AP or other progressive presses that use 7/8\"X14 threads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CgAnn2X8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PCZZU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 63.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PD004S", "title": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate (17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto)", "description": "The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold separately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with; 17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto.", "text": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate (17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto) The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold separately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with; 17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oXpI1pNcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD004S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.38}}
{"item_id": "B000PD01NS", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Auto-Progressive Reloading Press", "description": "Stay loaded with the Hornady Lock-N-Load auto-progressive reloading press. This professional-grade, auto-indexing, five-station progressive press features quick tool change technology, allowing you to switch rifle and pistol dies, powder dies, check dies, bullet seaters, and crimp dies without having to change the whole die head. The Lock-N-Load is ultra-reliable and easy to use. The press's EZject system, for example, reliably ejects every cartridge, every time, without any adjustments. The system loads at a rate of up to 500 rounds per hour, and features the quickest changeover of any progressive press thanks to the five-station quick-change bushing system. The bushing system lets you change from 223 to 45 in less than five minutes--faster than most other progressive presses on the market.The Lock-N-Load also offers quick-change metering inserts, allowing you to switch from one powder to another with the push of a button. Add one to each die set for the ultimate in quick changeovers. The reloader's universal case retainer spring, meanwhile, allows you to quickly and easily remove and replace a case at any point in the loading process. To help the reloader function extra smooth, the Lock-N-Load comes with an automatic indexing system. Each station moves 1/2 stage on the upstroke and 1/2 stage on the down stroke, a contrast from other presses that do all their indexing on the down stroke. Other features include a priming system for easy changing from large to small primers; a case-activated powder drop; and a large-capacity hopper.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Auto-Progressive Reloading Press Stay loaded with the Hornady Lock-N-Load auto-progressive reloading press. This professional-grade, auto-indexing, five-station progressive press features quick tool change technology, allowing you to switch rifle and pistol dies, powder dies, check dies, bullet seaters, and crimp dies without having to change the whole die head. The Lock-N-Load is ultra-reliable and easy to use. The press's EZject system, for example, reliably ejects every cartridge, every time, without any adjustments. The system loads at a rate of up to 500 rounds per hour, and features the quickest changeover of any progressive press thanks to the five-station quick-change bushing system. The bushing system lets you change from 223 to 45 in less than five minutes--faster than most other progressive presses on the market.The Lock-N-Load also offers quick-change metering inserts, allowing you to switch from one powder to another with the push of a button. Add one to each die set for the ultimate in quick changeovers. The reloader's universal case retainer spring, meanwhile, allows you to quickly and easily remove and replace a case at any point in the loading process. To help the reloader function extra smooth, the Lock-N-Load comes with an automatic indexing system. Each station moves 1/2 stage on the upstroke and 1/2 stage on the down stroke, a contrast from other presses that do all their indexing on the down stroke. Other features include a priming system for easy changing from large to small primers; a case-activated powder drop; and a large-capacity hopper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bw996dYAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD01NS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 422.29}}
{"item_id": "B000PD01SI", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Overall Length Gauge (straight)", "description": "One of the best kept secrets in accurate reloading is precise bullet seating depth. Regulating seating depth and the resulting \"jump\" to the rifling is widely regarded as fundamental to improved accuracy. A few thousandths of an inch change between the bullet and the rifling can make the difference between just so-so accuracy and real tack-driver performance. The Lock N Load Gauge is universally acclaimed as the most accurate, easy-to-use and reliable method of obtaining that critical relationship. Hornady's straight Overall Length Gauge is for all bolt action and single-shot rifles. Uses Hornady's modified cases(sold separately)", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Overall Length Gauge (straight) One of the best kept secrets in accurate reloading is precise bullet seating depth. Regulating seating depth and the resulting \"jump\" to the rifling is widely regarded as fundamental to improved accuracy. A few thousandths of an inch change between the bullet and the rifling can make the difference between just so-so accuracy and real tack-driver performance. The Lock N Load Gauge is universally acclaimed as the most accurate, easy-to-use and reliable method of obtaining that critical relationship. Hornady's straight Overall Length Gauge is for all bolt action and single-shot rifles. Uses Hornady's modified cases(sold separately)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-dhg5E8UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD01SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 37.89}}
{"item_id": "B000PD021O", "title": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder (16 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto)", "description": "Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto.", "text": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder (16 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto) Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 17 Remington, 17/222, 17/223, 220VT., 20 Tactical, 204 Ruger, 221 Remington, 222 Remington, 222 Remington Mag., 5.6X50 Mag., 223 Remington, 6mm/223, 6X47 Remington, 6mm TCU., 6.5mm TCU., 7mm TCU., 7mm/223 Ingram, 7X47 Helm, 380 Auto.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jBUynO75L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD021O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.8}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1UQK", "title": "Hornady 308 Winchester Custom Grade Reloading Dies(Series I Two-Die Set)", "description": "Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "text": "Hornady 308 Winchester Custom Grade Reloading Dies(Series I Two-Die Set) Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-LUI80xfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1UQK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 44.04}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1X8A", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Automatic Case Feeder(110 VT)", "description": "With this high volume Lock-N-Load 110 Volt Automatic Case Feeder, the Lock-N-Load AP just got faster. It has the highest torque motor in the incustry and an extra large case bowl that will hold over 750-.223 Remington cases with ease. The Automatic Case Feeder makes it possible for the LNL AP to load at a rate of over 750 rounds of high quality ammunition per hour. The Lock-N-Load Automatic Case Feeder comes complete with everything you need except the case feeder plates.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Automatic Case Feeder(110 VT) With this high volume Lock-N-Load 110 Volt Automatic Case Feeder, the Lock-N-Load AP just got faster. It has the highest torque motor in the incustry and an extra large case bowl that will hold over 750-.223 Remington cases with ease. The Automatic Case Feeder makes it possible for the LNL AP to load at a rate of over 750 rounds of high quality ammunition per hour. The Lock-N-Load Automatic Case Feeder comes complete with everything you need except the case feeder plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XQHp3gpvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1X8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 305.5}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1XAI", "title": "Hornady 44099 Lock N Load Conversion Kit", "description": "Simply thread a Hornady Lock-N-Load conversion kit into any press using a 1 1/4\"-12 thread, and your ready to start using the Lock-N Load system. It's the easiest way to get the most out of your reloading press. These bushings let you take advantage of Hornady's Lock-N-Load technology even if you own a competitive reloading press. The Lock-N-Load Conversion kit includes three dies bushings and one conversion bushing.", "text": "Hornady 44099 Lock N Load Conversion Kit Simply thread a Hornady Lock-N-Load conversion kit into any press using a 1 1/4\"-12 thread, and your ready to start using the Lock-N Load system. It's the easiest way to get the most out of your reloading press. These bushings let you take advantage of Hornady's Lock-N-Load technology even if you own a competitive reloading press. The Lock-N-Load Conversion kit includes three dies bushings and one conversion bushing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hvUtn3i3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1XAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.37}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1XDA", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Powder Measure", "description": "The Lock-N-Load powder measure offers the most flexible operation and the widest range of any measure on the market today. Not only can you switch powders and settings with a single button push, but add the proper accessories and the Lock-N-Load Powder Measure lets you meter charges from .5 to 265 grains of powder!", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Powder Measure The Lock-N-Load powder measure offers the most flexible operation and the widest range of any measure on the market today. Not only can you switch powders and settings with a single button push, but add the proper accessories and the Lock-N-Load Powder Measure lets you meter charges from .5 to 265 grains of powder!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rFtYNnrkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1XDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 70.47}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1XE4", "title": "Hornady M2 Case Tumbler 110 Volt", "description": "Dirty brass contains abrasive foreign particles that can scratch the inside of your dies. Our case tumblers clean and polish brass to a brilliant finish before loading. Press and dies will operate smoother and finished reloads will look like new", "text": "Hornady M2 Case Tumbler 110 Volt Dirty brass contains abrasive foreign particles that can scratch the inside of your dies. Our case tumblers clean and polish brass to a brilliant finish before loading. Press and dies will operate smoother and finished reloads will look like new", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-WOSa13eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1XE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 80.51}}
{"item_id": "B000PD1XI0", "title": "Hornady Powder Funnel (22-45 Caliber)", "description": "Hornady's powder funnel is a must have for filling cases with scaled charges, checking weights and returning powder to the case.", "text": "Hornady Powder Funnel (22-45 Caliber) Hornady's powder funnel is a must have for filling cases with scaled charges, checking weights and returning powder to the case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S1DkBkUbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD1XI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.32}}
{"item_id": "B000PD5SUE", "title": "Hornady .45 ACP/AR/Winchester Mag Pistol Dies(Series II Three-Die Set)", "description": "Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "text": "Hornady .45 ACP/AR/Winchester Mag Pistol Dies(Series II Three-Die Set) Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TGpXDwEML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD5SUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 53.01}}
{"item_id": "B000PD5VLA", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Comparator Set Body & 6 Inserts", "description": "Measuring cartridge lengths across the bullet tips is not a reliable (or repeatable) method for measuring you loaded rounds. It's common for variations of up to .025\" to exist from one round to the next. Hornady's bullet comparator solves that problem by measuring rounds from a reliable surface on the bullet, the ogive, to provide consistent, precise measurements of your rounds. Hornady's Bullet Comparator attaches to the blade of your caliper with a thumbscrew and uses interchangeable insert bushings to measure from the bullet ogive. These bushings are available in fourteen sizes from .17 caliber to .45 caliber. This set comes with inserts for following bullet diameters, .224\"(5.56mm), .243\"(6mm), .257\", .277\", .284\"(7mm), .308\"(7.62 & 8mm)", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Comparator Set Body & 6 Inserts Measuring cartridge lengths across the bullet tips is not a reliable (or repeatable) method for measuring you loaded rounds. It's common for variations of up to .025\" to exist from one round to the next. Hornady's bullet comparator solves that problem by measuring rounds from a reliable surface on the bullet, the ogive, to provide consistent, precise measurements of your rounds. Hornady's Bullet Comparator attaches to the blade of your caliper with a thumbscrew and uses interchangeable insert bushings to measure from the bullet ogive. These bushings are available in fourteen sizes from .17 caliber to .45 caliber. This set comes with inserts for following bullet diameters, .224\"(5.56mm), .243\"(6mm), .257\", .277\", .284\"(7mm), .308\"(7.62 & 8mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PAlPsJXFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD5VLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.08}}
{"item_id": "B000PD5VM4", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Die Bushings (3 Pack)", "description": "These Hornady die bushings allow you to take advantage of the fastest die-change over system in the industry. You are in business as long as your press is equipped with the Hornady press bushing.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Die Bushings (3 Pack) These Hornady die bushings allow you to take advantage of the fastest die-change over system in the industry. You are in business as long as your press is equipped with the Hornady press bushing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TxnDsd3OL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD5VM4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.85}}
{"item_id": "B000PD5VN8", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Headspace Gauge Kit", "description": "The Lock N Load headspace gauge is the best method we've found to extend brass life, improve accuracy and enhance safety. The gauge measures variations in your brass before and after firing or resizing. It allows for comparison between fire-formed brass from your gun and your re-sized brass. Any of five interchangeable bushing are attached to your caliper using the same body as found on our Comparator. This kit comes with five bushings that allow the user to check most bottleneck cases, from .17Remington through the belted magnums. Ackley improved chambers use the same bushing as the parent case.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Headspace Gauge Kit The Lock N Load headspace gauge is the best method we've found to extend brass life, improve accuracy and enhance safety. The gauge measures variations in your brass before and after firing or resizing. It allows for comparison between fire-formed brass from your gun and your re-sized brass. Any of five interchangeable bushing are attached to your caliper using the same body as found on our Comparator. This kit comes with five bushings that allow the user to check most bottleneck cases, from .17Remington through the belted magnums. Ackley improved chambers use the same bushing as the parent case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bsWRmt3rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD5VN8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 39.89}}
{"item_id": "B000PD682Q", "title": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate (See Detail List)", "description": "The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold seperately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with ;5.6X57, 22/250 Remington, 22-250 Ackerley Improved, 240 Weatherby Mag., 243 Winchester, 244/6MM Remington, 6mm Int., 6mm 284, 6mm Remington BR., 250 Savage, 25/06 Remington, 257 Roberts, 25/284, 260 Remington, 6.5 Remington Mag., 6.5/06, 6.5X57 6.5/284, 270 Winchester, 7X57(7mm Mauser), 7mm/08, 7mm Remington BR, 7X64, 7mm Express/280, 280 Remington, 280 Remington Ackerley Improved, 284 Winchester, 300 Savage, 308 Winchester, 30/06 Springfield, 7.7 Japanese, 8mm Mauser, 8mm/06, 8X60S, 338-06, 35 Whelen, 358 Winchester, 9.3X57, 9.3X62, 400 Cor-bon, 44 Auto Mag., 45 ACP/WM, 458 SOCOM.", "text": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate (See Detail List) The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold seperately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with ;5.6X57, 22/250 Remington, 22-250 Ackerley Improved, 240 Weatherby Mag., 243 Winchester, 244/6MM Remington, 6mm Int., 6mm 284, 6mm Remington BR., 250 Savage, 25/06 Remington, 257 Roberts, 25/284, 260 Remington, 6.5 Remington Mag., 6.5/06, 6.5X57 6.5/284, 270 Winchester, 7X57(7mm Mauser), 7mm/08, 7mm Remington BR, 7X64, 7mm Express/280, 280 Remington, 280 Remington Ackerley Improved, 284 Winchester, 300 Savage, 308 Winchester, 30/06 Springfield, 7.7 Japanese, 8mm Mauser, 8mm/06, 8X60S, 338-06, 35 Whelen, 358 Winchester, 9.3X57, 9.3X62, 400 Cor-bon, 44 Auto Mag., 45 ACP/WM, 458 SOCOM.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YTF-HwgwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD682Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 35.25}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6PO2", "title": "Hornady 223 Remington Custom Grade Reloading Dies(Series I Two-Die Set)", "description": "Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "text": "Hornady 223 Remington Custom Grade Reloading Dies(Series I Two-Die Set) Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P0ffWOhnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6PO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6QJ6", "title": "Hornady 50140 Camlock Case Trimmer", "description": "No other case trimmer in this price range features a micro-adjustable cutting head. Based on the proven design of our earlier case trimmer, this new model is packed with many features that Hornady customers have been asking for. Hornady's case trimmer comes with all the most popular pilots; .22cal., 6mm, 270cal., 7mm, .30cal., .38cal. and .45cal. Note:shell holders not included", "text": "Hornady 50140 Camlock Case Trimmer No other case trimmer in this price range features a micro-adjustable cutting head. Based on the proven design of our earlier case trimmer, this new model is packed with many features that Hornady customers have been asking for. Hornady's case trimmer comes with all the most popular pilots; .22cal., 6mm, 270cal., 7mm, .30cal., .38cal. and .45cal. Note:shell holders not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4154oTYLZhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6QJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 70.05}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6R7C", "title": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate ( 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max)", "description": "The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold separately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with; 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max.", "text": "Hornady Improve Shell Plate ( 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max) The addition of a smooth radius to the mouth of each shell holder around the shell plate ensures smooth functioning-especially when the shell plate is used with the Lock N Load Case Feeder(sold separately). In addition, the bevel on the retainer spring groove helps keep the spring in place when inserting cases into the shell plate. These shell plates will also work with the older model Hornady Pro-Jector press. This shell plate works with; 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oXpI1pNcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6R7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.79}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6S9Y", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Classic Reloading Press", "description": "The Lock-N-Load Classic is the perfect press if you reload more that one caliber. The Lock-N-Load bushings make changing calibers with a single-stage press faster and easier that ever before. With just a quick twist, Hornady's Lock-N-Load technology lets you switch from one die to another...no screwing and unscrewing dies or die adjustments are needed. With the Lock-N_Load Classic, you'll load more shells in less time that ever before. Uses Hornady shell holders.(sold separately)", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Classic Reloading Press The Lock-N-Load Classic is the perfect press if you reload more that one caliber. The Lock-N-Load bushings make changing calibers with a single-stage press faster and easier that ever before. With just a quick twist, Hornady's Lock-N-Load technology lets you switch from one die to another...no screwing and unscrewing dies or die adjustments are needed. With the Lock-N_Load Classic, you'll load more shells in less time that ever before. Uses Hornady shell holders.(sold separately)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NpG3t1I9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6S9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 119.85}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6T5C", "title": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder (22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max)", "description": "Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max.", "text": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder (22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max) Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 22PPC, 22 RCFM-Jet, 256 Winchester, 6mm PPC, 7.62X39, 38/357/357Max.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jBUynO75L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6T5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.98}}
{"item_id": "B000PD6T5W", "title": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder ( 30 Luger, 9mm Luger, 9X21, 9X18 Makarov, 38 Super Auto, 9X23)", "description": "Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 30 Luger, 9mm Luger, 9X21, 9X18 Makarov, 38 Super Auto, 9X23.", "text": "Hornady Universal Shell Holder ( 30 Luger, 9mm Luger, 9X21, 9X18 Makarov, 38 Super Auto, 9X23) Hornady's universal shell holders are precision machined from solid steel then heat treated to perform flawlessly for the life of the press. Improvements include a wider mouth and a rounded edge at the opening to allow smoother case insertion. They fit all other Hornady accessories including the Case Trimmer and Hand-Held Priming tool. Hornady shell holders also fit most other brands of reloading presses. This shell holder works with; 30 Luger, 9mm Luger, 9X21, 9X18 Makarov, 38 Super Auto, 9X23.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jBUynO75L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD6T5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PD9YTU", "title": "Hornady 85003 Lock N Load Classic Reloading Press Kit", "description": "The Hornady Lock-N-Load Classic Reloading Kit comes with everything you need to turn out high-quality, accurate hand loads. Built for speed, the Lock-N-Load Classic press allows you to switch dies to a new caliber and begin reloading again in seconds. The unit's automatic priming is hands-off and trouble free. The angled frame provides easier access to your cartridges. The Lock-N-Load Bushings allow you adjust your dies once, then lock the setting into place--for consistent reloads every time. The CNC machined die and ram openings create near perfect alignment of the ram and die, so cases are lined up properly with the dies at all times. This precision translates into greater accuracy. The strong, rigid frame also provides the stability necessary for precision reloading. With Lock-N-Load, one press can handle multiple calibers with ease. There is no need to purchase multiple presses so you can leave your dies in place. Your dies will remain exactly as you set them, within their Lock-N-Load Die Bushings.The Lock-N-Load Reloading Press Kit comes with everything you need for high-quality, accurate hand loads.What's in the Box?Lock-N-Load Classic single-stage pressLock-N-Load Powder MeasureElectronic ScaleHornady Handbook of Cartridge ReloadingThree Lock-N-Load Die BushingsPrimer CatcherPositive Priming SystemHand-Held Priming ToolUniversal Reloading BlockChamfering and De-burring ToolPrimer Turning PlateOne Shot Case Lube", "text": "Hornady 85003 Lock N Load Classic Reloading Press Kit The Hornady Lock-N-Load Classic Reloading Kit comes with everything you need to turn out high-quality, accurate hand loads. Built for speed, the Lock-N-Load Classic press allows you to switch dies to a new caliber and begin reloading again in seconds. The unit's automatic priming is hands-off and trouble free. The angled frame provides easier access to your cartridges. The Lock-N-Load Bushings allow you adjust your dies once, then lock the setting into place--for consistent reloads every time. The CNC machined die and ram openings create near perfect alignment of the ram and die, so cases are lined up properly with the dies at all times. This precision translates into greater accuracy. The strong, rigid frame also provides the stability necessary for precision reloading. With Lock-N-Load, one press can handle multiple calibers with ease. There is no need to purchase multiple presses so you can leave your dies in place. Your dies will remain exactly as you set them, within their Lock-N-Load Die Bushings.The Lock-N-Load Reloading Press Kit comes with everything you need for high-quality, accurate hand loads.What's in the Box?Lock-N-Load Classic single-stage pressLock-N-Load Powder MeasureElectronic ScaleHornady Handbook of Cartridge ReloadingThree Lock-N-Load Die BushingsPrimer CatcherPositive Priming SystemHand-Held Priming ToolUniversal Reloading BlockChamfering and De-burring ToolPrimer Turning PlateOne Shot Case Lube", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jGccJxK9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PD9YTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 259.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PDCS5W", "title": "Storm All Weather Safety Whistle", "description": "World's loudest whistle, Works underwater up to 50', Navy Seals and Coast Guard Approved, U.S. Made", "text": "Storm All Weather Safety Whistle World's loudest whistle, Works underwater up to 50', Navy Seals and Coast Guard Approved, U.S. Made", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4148Lv5yjML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PDCS5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apparel Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 8.49}}
{"item_id": "B000PDIBF8", "title": "Plews/Edelmann 55-005 Marine Lower Unit Quart Pump, 4CC", "description": "Marine Lower Unit QT Pump, 4 cc, Ideal For Adding Oil & Other Fluids To Small Engines & Marine Lower Units, Flexible Hose For Hard To Reach Fill Plugs, QT Sized, 4 cc Pump & 3/8\" 16 Swivel Metal Marine Filler Fitting, Adapter Included With Pump Fits Mercruiser, Mercury, OMC, Evinrude, Johnson, Volvo, Force, Gamefisher, & Honda, 70 HP& Up Models.", "text": "Plews/Edelmann 55-005 Marine Lower Unit Quart Pump, 4CC Marine Lower Unit QT Pump, 4 cc, Ideal For Adding Oil & Other Fluids To Small Engines & Marine Lower Units, Flexible Hose For Hard To Reach Fill Plugs, QT Sized, 4 cc Pump & 3/8\" 16 Swivel Metal Marine Filler Fitting, Adapter Included With Pump Fits Mercruiser, Mercury, OMC, Evinrude, Johnson, Volvo, Force, Gamefisher, & Honda, 70 HP& Up Models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C9vPROm7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PDIBF8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Plumbing", "Water Pressure Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000PE2QGW", "title": "20\" CUSCUS Single Strap Sling Daypack Backpack", "description": "This CUSCUS backpack has total 5 pockets. 1 zipped pocket on one side and 1 webbed one on the other. 1 cell phone pouch on the shoulder strap. Padded back keeps your back cool and dry. Handing/carrying loop. Great for travel, business or school. BRAND NEW.", "text": "20\" CUSCUS Single Strap Sling Daypack Backpack This CUSCUS backpack has total 5 pockets. 1 zipped pocket on one side and 1 webbed one on the other. 1 cell phone pouch on the shoulder strap. Padded back keeps your back cool and dry. Handing/carrying loop. Great for travel, business or school. BRAND NEW.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q53X5FNkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PE2QGW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PEL6S6", "title": "Axiom Adirondack Handlebar Bag", "description": "The Adirondack is a waterproof handlebar bag that can convert into a shoulder bag. Zippered main compartment. Hook and loop closure combined with velcro allow user to attach this bag to the handle bar. The high level fabric used in all Axiom bags has exceptionally low off-gassing characteristics that exceed even European standards. Includes carrying strap. 8.25 x 10.5 x 3.25-Inch. Water-resistant 600d nylon with reflective trim.", "text": "Axiom Adirondack Handlebar Bag The Adirondack is a waterproof handlebar bag that can convert into a shoulder bag. Zippered main compartment. Hook and loop closure combined with velcro allow user to attach this bag to the handle bar. The high level fabric used in all Axiom bags has exceptionally low off-gassing characteristics that exceed even European standards. Includes carrying strap. 8.25 x 10.5 x 3.25-Inch. Water-resistant 600d nylon with reflective trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oyPmfvqCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PEL6S6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Axiom", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 18.8}}
{"item_id": "B000PEM63K", "title": "Stamina 15-0120 InStride Cycle XL", "description": "Cycling improves your cardiovascular health, boosts the functioning of the heart and blood vessels, and decreases your risk of heart disease. Now you can enjoy all the benefits of cycling without spending a ton of money with the affordable InStride XL cycle from Stamina Products. Unlike most exercise bikes, the InStride XL cycle doesn't come with a seat. Instead, you sit in a standard dining room chair or lie on the floor, then insert your feet into the sturdy rubber straps. Once you're in, you can pedal in forward or reverse motion, with an adjustable tension knob that lets you vary your intensity and an electronic monitor that times your workouts. As an alternative, you can even rest the InStride XL on a table and pedal with your hands to experience a full-range upper body workout.Improving your cardiovascular health isn't the only benefit of cycling, of course. It also increases HDL (good cholesterol), reduces the amount of triglycerides in the blood, and helps lower blood pressure. And thanks to the dual-use pedals, you can improve your muscle strength in your legs, arms, shoulders, and back, depending on the configuration you choose. Other cycling benefits include increased flexibility without stressing the joints, improved digestion, better lung function, and a higher metabolism.The InStride XL cycle, which includes non-slip rubber feet, measures 19 by 12.25 by 15.25 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 9 pounds.", "text": "Stamina 15-0120 InStride Cycle XL Cycling improves your cardiovascular health, boosts the functioning of the heart and blood vessels, and decreases your risk of heart disease. Now you can enjoy all the benefits of cycling without spending a ton of money with the affordable InStride XL cycle from Stamina Products. Unlike most exercise bikes, the InStride XL cycle doesn't come with a seat. Instead, you sit in a standard dining room chair or lie on the floor, then insert your feet into the sturdy rubber straps. Once you're in, you can pedal in forward or reverse motion, with an adjustable tension knob that lets you vary your intensity and an electronic monitor that times your workouts. As an alternative, you can even rest the InStride XL on a table and pedal with your hands to experience a full-range upper body workout.Improving your cardiovascular health isn't the only benefit of cycling, of course. It also increases HDL (good cholesterol), reduces the amount of triglycerides in the blood, and helps lower blood pressure. And thanks to the dual-use pedals, you can improve your muscle strength in your legs, arms, shoulders, and back, depending on the configuration you choose. Other cycling benefits include increased flexibility without stressing the joints, improved digestion, better lung function, and a higher metabolism.The InStride XL cycle, which includes non-slip rubber feet, measures 19 by 12.25 by 15.25 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 9 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ouyui7c1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PEM63K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stamina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PGG5BW", "title": "Camp Chef Flame Tamer", "description": "Camp Chef FT-10 Camp Chef Flame Tamer", "text": "Camp Chef Flame Tamer Camp Chef FT-10 Camp Chef Flame Tamer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WxBZ7VAFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGG5BW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 20.28}}
{"item_id": "B000PGKVW6", "title": "Bianchi Patroltek 8105 Black Hook Inner Liner Belt", "description": "Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "text": "Bianchi Patroltek 8105 Black Hook Inner Liner Belt Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yZSUxDp8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGKVW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 34.83}}
{"item_id": "B000PGOOIS", "title": "Nikwax Hardshell Care Kit", "description": "The Hardshell Care Kit by Nikwax will not only provide two great products, they are both easy to use. The Nikwax Hardshell Care Kit contains a 300ml bottle of Tech Wash and a 300ml bottle of TX Direct Wash In. Tech Wash is a non-detergent, biodegradable liquid soap which removes dirt and detergent residues while leaving the water-repellent finish on waterproof clothing, equipment and sleeping bags intact. Nikwax TX Direct Wash-in adds water-repellency and revives breathability to your waterproof/breathable garments.", "text": "Nikwax Hardshell Care Kit The Hardshell Care Kit by Nikwax will not only provide two great products, they are both easy to use. The Nikwax Hardshell Care Kit contains a 300ml bottle of Tech Wash and a 300ml bottle of TX Direct Wash In. Tech Wash is a non-detergent, biodegradable liquid soap which removes dirt and detergent residues while leaving the water-repellent finish on waterproof clothing, equipment and sleeping bags intact. Nikwax TX Direct Wash-in adds water-repellency and revives breathability to your waterproof/breathable garments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512bRe-RcHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGOOIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikwax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 18.36}}
{"item_id": "B000PGPGQC", "title": "GSI Outdoors H2JO! Percolator", "description": "Now your customers can just say no to crappy camp coffee! By simply filling a water bottle with hot water, screwing on the handy filter, adding grounds and closing the lid, making a delicious, no-fuss morning brew is as easy as can be.", "text": "GSI Outdoors H2JO! Percolator Now your customers can just say no to crappy camp coffee! By simply filling a water bottle with hot water, screwing on the handy filter, adding grounds and closing the lid, making a delicious, no-fuss morning brew is as easy as can be.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mimPQovlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGPGQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 12.95}}
