{"item_id": "B000PGYDT8", "title": "Classic", "description": "The SteriPEN purifier is the only portable water purifier that uses ultraviolet (UV) light to destroy waterborne microbes. Whether your source is a woodland brook or an overseas hotel tap, SteriPEN sterilizes clear water by destroying viruses, bacteria and protozoa—including Giardia and Cryptosporidium—in seconds. Carry a SteriPEN to disinfect water wherever you travel, hike, camp or trek. It’s the fastest route to pure, safe drinking water anywhere.", "text": "Classic The SteriPEN purifier is the only portable water purifier that uses ultraviolet (UV) light to destroy waterborne microbes. Whether your source is a woodland brook or an overseas hotel tap, SteriPEN sterilizes clear water by destroying viruses, bacteria and protozoa—including Giardia and Cryptosporidium—in seconds. Carry a SteriPEN to disinfect water wherever you travel, hike, camp or trek. It’s the fastest route to pure, safe drinking water anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K%2BBsLaKLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGYDT8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PGYDU2", "title": "SteriPen Water Bottle Pre-Filter", "description": "When clear water is not available, use the Water Bottle Pre-Filter by SteriPen. The Pre-Filter filters out particulates and debris. Fits on Nalgene & wide-mouth water bottles. SPECIFICATIONS of the Water Bottle Pre-Filter by SteriPen Product Dimensions: 2.7 W x 2.5 H in. Product Weight: W/O Batteries: 1.5 oz Package Dimensions: 3.0 L x 3.0 W x 4.25 H in. Pkg. Wt.: 2.3 oz Units/Case: 6 Case Dimensions: 12.5 L x 4.75 W x 9.5 H in. Case Wt.: 1.4 lbs Harmonized Code: 8421.21.0000", "text": "SteriPen Water Bottle Pre-Filter When clear water is not available, use the Water Bottle Pre-Filter by SteriPen. The Pre-Filter filters out particulates and debris. Fits on Nalgene & wide-mouth water bottles. SPECIFICATIONS of the Water Bottle Pre-Filter by SteriPen Product Dimensions: 2.7 W x 2.5 H in. Product Weight: W/O Batteries: 1.5 oz Package Dimensions: 3.0 L x 3.0 W x 4.25 H in. Pkg. Wt.: 2.3 oz Units/Case: 6 Case Dimensions: 12.5 L x 4.75 W x 9.5 H in. Case Wt.: 1.4 lbs Harmonized Code: 8421.21.0000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5139jb7YSOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PGYDU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PH013E", "title": "SteriPEN Classic Safe Water System", "description": "The Classic Safe Water System System ,is all that is needed when camping, hiking, backpacking or traveling. Use the 40x40 micron screen Pre-Filter to remove particulates from the water. The Pre-Filter is designed to be stored directly on the wide mouth bottle.", "text": "SteriPEN Classic Safe Water System The Classic Safe Water System System ,is all that is needed when camping, hiking, backpacking or traveling. Use the 40x40 micron screen Pre-Filter to remove particulates from the water. The Pre-Filter is designed to be stored directly on the wide mouth bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ePDvIDU6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PH013E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PH5QC0", "title": "Nathan Gel Waist Pack", "description": "Designed specifically to hold GU Energy Gel gel packs, the Nathan Gel Pak is comfortable, lightweight, and breathable. GU gel packs are easy-to-digest carbohydrate packs that give runners or other athletes long-lasting energy. The Nathan Gel Pak contributes to your workout by making it easy to carry several GU packs at once, so you don't need to carry them in your pockets or stuff them in a sock. The Gel Pack includes several storage pockets, including an expanding outer pocket, an internal valuables pocket with a key clip, and an external mesh trash pocket, which gives you a place to store the sticky, empty wrappers. The Gel Pack is also comfortable to wear, with a breathable mesh back panel and waist belt and a 1-inch, limited-stretch elastic belt with a featherweight buckle.", "text": "Nathan Gel Waist Pack Designed specifically to hold GU Energy Gel gel packs, the Nathan Gel Pak is comfortable, lightweight, and breathable. GU gel packs are easy-to-digest carbohydrate packs that give runners or other athletes long-lasting energy. The Nathan Gel Pak contributes to your workout by making it easy to carry several GU packs at once, so you don't need to carry them in your pockets or stuff them in a sock. The Gel Pack includes several storage pockets, including an expanding outer pocket, an internal valuables pocket with a key clip, and an external mesh trash pocket, which gives you a place to store the sticky, empty wrappers. The Gel Pack is also comfortable to wear, with a breathable mesh back panel and waist belt and a 1-inch, limited-stretch elastic belt with a featherweight buckle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Efi5Tg8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PH5QC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nathan Performance Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 24.09}}
{"item_id": "B000PH8B7W", "title": "Spalding Never Flat Outdoor Official Size Basketball", "description": "The first ever basketball to employ Spalding's Pressure Retention Technologies, the Spalding Never Flat outdoor basketball is the only ball guaranteed to stay fully inflated for at least one year--10 times longer than traditional basketballs. The Never Flat ball is equipped with a new membrane technology that tightens the natural pores in the bladder. The exclusive technology relies on proprietary Nitroflate molecules that are injected into the ball. The molecules form a protective barrier against air seepage, in effect repelling air molecules that might otherwise escape.The ball further prevents leakage with its specially designed valve, which includes a cap that eliminates leaks and keeps dirt out. The Never Flat basketball measures 29.5 inches in diameter, although a 28.5-inch version is available.", "text": "Spalding Never Flat Outdoor Official Size Basketball The first ever basketball to employ Spalding's Pressure Retention Technologies, the Spalding Never Flat outdoor basketball is the only ball guaranteed to stay fully inflated for at least one year--10 times longer than traditional basketballs. The Never Flat ball is equipped with a new membrane technology that tightens the natural pores in the bladder. The exclusive technology relies on proprietary Nitroflate molecules that are injected into the ball. The molecules form a protective barrier against air seepage, in effect repelling air molecules that might otherwise escape.The ball further prevents leakage with its specially designed valve, which includes a cap that eliminates leaks and keeps dirt out. The Never Flat basketball measures 29.5 inches in diameter, although a 28.5-inch version is available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61yabWP6TEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PH8B7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Basketballs"]], "price": 34.98}}
