{"item_id": "B000PVV5RG", "title": "Military Style 5-In-1 Multi Purpose Tool", "description": "Great survival kit, it is lightweight and has a nice variety of tools needed by someone who goes camping or backpacking.", "text": "Military Style 5-In-1 Multi Purpose Tool Great survival kit, it is lightweight and has a nice variety of tools needed by someone who goes camping or backpacking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ap4vR%2B6ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PVV5RG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.85}}
{"item_id": "B000PW20XS", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Black Powder Solvent and Patch Lubricant, 8-Ounce Bottle", "description": "Hoppe's No. 9 Black Powder Solvent and Patch Lubricant is specially formulated for black powder shooters. It lubricates as it cleans fouling from the bore and protects against rust and corrosion. Equally effective for deep or shallow grooved barrels.", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Black Powder Solvent and Patch Lubricant, 8-Ounce Bottle Hoppe's No. 9 Black Powder Solvent and Patch Lubricant is specially formulated for black powder shooters. It lubricates as it cleans fouling from the bore and protects against rust and corrosion. Equally effective for deep or shallow grooved barrels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s8re1kMNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW20XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.4}}
{"item_id": "B000PW21SW", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger MK II Rubber Grip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger MK II Rubber Grip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i6PJYY05L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW21SW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.98}}
{"item_id": "B000PW3ROO", "title": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .243 to .308 Win", "description": "", "text": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .243 to .308 Win", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AiT5ZUn0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW3ROO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.38}}
{"item_id": "B000PW3YAG", "title": "Primos Ol' Betsy Slate Call", "description": "The Ol-Feet Betsy is built with select Pennsylvania Slate. This slate combined with the acoustical cup and internal sounding board gives you a slate call that can do it all. The Hardwood Striker only adds to the versatility of this call giving you yelps and cuts that reach way out or finishing calls for close calling. Congratulations on selecting a slate call you will be proud to hunt with.", "text": "Primos Ol' Betsy Slate Call The Ol-Feet Betsy is built with select Pennsylvania Slate. This slate combined with the acoustical cup and internal sounding board gives you a slate call that can do it all. The Hardwood Striker only adds to the versatility of this call giving you yelps and cuts that reach way out or finishing calls for close calling. Congratulations on selecting a slate call you will be proud to hunt with.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NI72We8uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW3YAG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 13.67}}
{"item_id": "B000PW3YFQ", "title": "Primos Hoot Flute Call", "description": "The Hoot Flute is easy to use. In the spring, sounding like an owl can very often entice a gobbler to give away his location by gobbling back at you. You can then move closer and, using turkey talk, lure the gobbler into range.", "text": "Primos Hoot Flute Call The Hoot Flute is easy to use. In the spring, sounding like an owl can very often entice a gobbler to give away his location by gobbling back at you. You can then move closer and, using turkey talk, lure the gobbler into range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4173EzMJSDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW3YFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 9.03}}
