{"item_id": "B000PW45GS", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Loading Stand for Black Powder Revolver Cylinder - .44 caliber", "description": "Allows for easy loading of chambers of a cylinder when removed from the gun. Fits Pietta model 1851, 1860, 1873 and 1858 models. Will not fit .31 caliber cylinders.", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Loading Stand for Black Powder Revolver Cylinder - .44 caliber Allows for easy loading of chambers of a cylinder when removed from the gun. Fits Pietta model 1851, 1860, 1873 and 1858 models. Will not fit .31 caliber cylinders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/212shKw32mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW45GS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000PW45X6", "title": "Birchwood Casey Shoot-N-C 1-Inch Round Target (Pack of 12)", "description": "Stick it! Hit it! See it! Every time. With Shoot-N-C Targets, bullet holes are revealed with bright chartreuse rings – providing you with instant feedback and eliminating the need to walk down range or use binoculars or spotting scopes.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Shoot-N-C 1-Inch Round Target (Pack of 12) Stick it! Hit it! See it! Every time. With Shoot-N-C Targets, bullet holes are revealed with bright chartreuse rings – providing you with instant feedback and eliminating the need to walk down range or use binoculars or spotting scopes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZfWiFzFGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW45X6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PW58QY", "title": "Bushnell Performance Optics 1324 Cotton Swab, .40 - .45-Caliber", "description": "Cleaning Swab, For Gun Cleaning Rod, .40 -.45 Caliber, 100% Cotton, Soft & Washable.", "text": "Bushnell Performance Optics 1324 Cotton Swab, .40 - .45-Caliber Cleaning Swab, For Gun Cleaning Rod, .40 -.45 Caliber, 100% Cotton, Soft & Washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318AyVjVv1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW58QY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 1.55}}
{"item_id": "B000PW5AT4", "title": "MTM Site-in-Clean Rest(Red)", "description": "MTM's SNCR-30 is great for sighting in rifles and shotguns. The rear fork of the Site-In-Clean Rest can be removed for fast shooting. Varmint hunters like having this option. Rubber over-molded, padded forks are adjusted and held in place by using two of four slots located in the base of rest. Rear adjustment knob allows for precise horizontal positioning. Guns are gripped for quick and easy shooting or cleaning. Rest size: 11\" x 20\".", "text": "MTM Site-in-Clean Rest(Red) MTM's SNCR-30 is great for sighting in rifles and shotguns. The rear fork of the Site-In-Clean Rest can be removed for fast shooting. Varmint hunters like having this option. Rubber over-molded, padded forks are adjusted and held in place by using two of four slots located in the base of rest. Rear adjustment knob allows for precise horizontal positioning. Guns are gripped for quick and easy shooting or cleaning. Rest size: 11\" x 20\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g-OvUVAzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW5AT4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 41.49}}
{"item_id": "B000PW5GN4", "title": "HKS 22-B Caliber 22 Long Rifle Magazine Speedloader for Buck Mark, Challenger II, Colt, Ruger 2245, Mitchell Arms", "description": "The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads .22 caliber long rifle magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "text": "HKS 22-B Caliber 22 Long Rifle Magazine Speedloader for Buck Mark, Challenger II, Colt, Ruger 2245, Mitchell Arms The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads .22 caliber long rifle magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413anLrNRlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW5GN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 0.18}}
{"item_id": "B000PW5HF6", "title": "MTM 100 Round Deluxe Handled Magnum Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Case .22-250 to 58 Win Mag", "description": "Specially designed for shooters who require a 100 round supply of very accurate ammunition (such as big bore, varmint hunters, etc.) The R-100 provides excellent protection for reloads and when the rounds are in the down position, they are protected by four special fingers which keep your bullets from hitting the bottom of the box and causing tip damage (which can change flight characteristics). It comes with adjustable inner trays which offer two height positions for different cartridge lengths. For cartridge sizes: 219 Zipper, 223 / 243 / 25 / 270 WSSM, 25 / 270 / 300 / 325 / 338 / 7mm WSM, 257 Wby. Mag., 264 / 300 / 330 / 338 / 458 Win. Mag., 280 Rem., 300 / 7mm Rem SAUM, 300 / 338 RCM, 300 Sav., 303 Brit., 348 / 356 / 375 / 405 / 44-40 Win., 358 Norma Mag., 375 Ruger, 38-72 Win., 40-65 / 40-70 Sharps(Straight), 444 / 450 Marlin, 458 SOCOM, 460 / 500 S&W; Mag., 6.5 Rem. Mag., 6.71 Phantom, 7x61 Sharpe 7 Hart, 7.5 Scdmidt Rubin Swiss, 7mm Rigby, 7.82 Lazzeroni Patroit, 8x56 Rimmed Hungarian, 8.59 Galaxy, 9.3x62, 9.5x57, 10.75x65 Rimmed", "text": "MTM 100 Round Deluxe Handled Magnum Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Case .22-250 to 58 Win Mag Specially designed for shooters who require a 100 round supply of very accurate ammunition (such as big bore, varmint hunters, etc.) The R-100 provides excellent protection for reloads and when the rounds are in the down position, they are protected by four special fingers which keep your bullets from hitting the bottom of the box and causing tip damage (which can change flight characteristics). It comes with adjustable inner trays which offer two height positions for different cartridge lengths. For cartridge sizes: 219 Zipper, 223 / 243 / 25 / 270 WSSM, 25 / 270 / 300 / 325 / 338 / 7mm WSM, 257 Wby. Mag., 264 / 300 / 330 / 338 / 458 Win. Mag., 280 Rem., 300 / 7mm Rem SAUM, 300 / 338 RCM, 300 Sav., 303 Brit., 348 / 356 / 375 / 405 / 44-40 Win., 358 Norma Mag., 375 Ruger, 38-72 Win., 40-65 / 40-70 Sharps(Straight), 444 / 450 Marlin, 458 SOCOM, 460 / 500 S&W; Mag., 6.5 Rem. Mag., 6.71 Phantom, 7x61 Sharpe 7 Hart, 7.5 Scdmidt Rubin Swiss, 7mm Rigby, 7.82 Lazzeroni Patroit, 8x56 Rimmed Hungarian, 8.59 Galaxy, 9.3x62, 9.5x57, 10.75x65 Rimmed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l6Rhh3o6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW5HF6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.61}}
{"item_id": "B000PW5NAA", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37N-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "The E37-N SEAL Pup Elite Straight-Edge Knife with satin finish is SOG's high-performance addition to the SEAL family of products. Sleek, attractive, and easy to operate, the E37-N showcases SOG's sophisticated style and quality construction. Designed for use by Navy SEALs, the E37-N features a thick steel stock (.185 inches), an AUS8 stainless steel heat-treated blade, a long ergonomic handle, deep finger grooves, and more..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q2_2009/sog-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;color: cccccc;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;color: white;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG E37-N SEAL Pup Elite Straight-Edge Knife Offers:A 4.85-inch straight blade with a satin finishCryogenic heat-treated blade constructionA contoured, textured, glass-reinforced Zytel handleA tactical nylon sheath with accessory pouchThe E37 was designed for use by Navy SEALs.View larger.The durable nylon sheath offers secure, convenient storage.View larger.Cryogenic Heat Treatment Guarantees a Sharp, Dependable BladeThe E37 offers a full, 4.85-inch, satin-finished, AUS8 stainless steel blade that has undergone SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process, which ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and requires slowly reducing the blade's temperature to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then slowly heating the blade to room temperature. The stress created by this process strengthens the steel on an atomic level and increases the blade's overall durability and edge retention.Ergonomic, Lightweight Design Ensures Years of Effortless UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make precise cuts if your knife doesn't fit comfortably in your hand. That's why this knife's handle is ergonomically contoured. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the textured handle is also slip-free and well-balanced. Other ergonomic features include deep finger grooves and a blade spine rasp for easy notching, filing, and thumb placement. Also, at just 5.4 ounces, this knife is lightweight. A tactical nylon sheath with accessory pouch is included for convenient portability.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxE37-N Fixed blade knife and nylon sheath with accessory pouch.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37N-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish The E37-N SEAL Pup Elite Straight-Edge Knife with satin finish is SOG's high-performance addition to the SEAL family of products. Sleek, attractive, and easy to operate, the E37-N showcases SOG's sophisticated style and quality construction. Designed for use by Navy SEALs, the E37-N features a thick steel stock (.185 inches), an AUS8 stainless steel heat-treated blade, a long ergonomic handle, deep finger grooves, and more..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q2_2009/sog-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;color: cccccc;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;color: white;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG E37-N SEAL Pup Elite Straight-Edge Knife Offers:A 4.85-inch straight blade with a satin finishCryogenic heat-treated blade constructionA contoured, textured, glass-reinforced Zytel handleA tactical nylon sheath with accessory pouchThe E37 was designed for use by Navy SEALs.View larger.The durable nylon sheath offers secure, convenient storage.View larger.Cryogenic Heat Treatment Guarantees a Sharp, Dependable BladeThe E37 offers a full, 4.85-inch, satin-finished, AUS8 stainless steel blade that has undergone SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process, which ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and requires slowly reducing the blade's temperature to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then slowly heating the blade to room temperature. The stress created by this process strengthens the steel on an atomic level and increases the blade's overall durability and edge retention.Ergonomic, Lightweight Design Ensures Years of Effortless UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make precise cuts if your knife doesn't fit comfortably in your hand. That's why this knife's handle is ergonomically contoured. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the textured handle is also slip-free and well-balanced. Other ergonomic features include deep finger grooves and a blade spine rasp for easy notching, filing, and thumb placement. Also, at just 5.4 ounces, this knife is lightweight. A tactical nylon sheath with accessory pouch is included for convenient portability.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxE37-N Fixed blade knife and nylon sheath with accessory pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qBr8jgZ9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW5NAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 56.65}}
