{"item_id": "B000PW64JY", "title": "Hoppe's Lubricating Oil Bottle, 2.25 Ounce Bottle E/F", "description": "High-viscosity oil refined to perfection for use in firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. Does not harden, gum, or become rancid. 2-1/4 oz.", "text": "Hoppe's Lubricating Oil Bottle, 2.25 Ounce Bottle E/F High-viscosity oil refined to perfection for use in firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. Does not harden, gum, or become rancid. 2-1/4 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JjIgIxl1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW64JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 3.49}}
{"item_id": "B000PW68YK", "title": "HARRIS ENGINEERING Adapter - No. 14 Mini-14", "description": "Harris Engineering Number 14 Adapter Rug Mini 14-30", "text": "HARRIS ENGINEERING Adapter - No. 14 Mini-14 Harris Engineering Number 14 Adapter Rug Mini 14-30", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316EiJqAK5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW68YK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B000PW6BME", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 953 TargetPro Kit (Black, 39.75 Inch)", "description": "The PowerLine TargetPro is perfectly engineered for the beginning competitive shooter, though it's also a great small-game rifle, and lots of fun for recreational shooting. With just one pump, a shooter gets loads of power, for accurate shooting at the target range, or in the field. With its 5-shot clip, follow up shots are fast, too. The single pump cocking lever, straight-pull bolt action and the fiber-optic sights are easy for beginning or intermediate shooters to use. Plus, the outstanding balance and superior accuracy of the TargetPro gives shooters exactly what they need to hone their skills and earn their stripes in both the woods and in competition.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 953 TargetPro Kit (Black, 39.75 Inch) The PowerLine TargetPro is perfectly engineered for the beginning competitive shooter, though it's also a great small-game rifle, and lots of fun for recreational shooting. With just one pump, a shooter gets loads of power, for accurate shooting at the target range, or in the field. With its 5-shot clip, follow up shots are fast, too. The single pump cocking lever, straight-pull bolt action and the fiber-optic sights are easy for beginning or intermediate shooters to use. Plus, the outstanding balance and superior accuracy of the TargetPro gives shooters exactly what they need to hone their skills and earn their stripes in both the woods and in competition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/210FP2YZWYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW6BME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 94.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PW6WVY", "title": "T.Z. Case International Pro-Tech Duelly Fifteen Pistol Case, Silver, 15-Inch", "description": "This duelly fifteen pistol case in our popular Pro-Tech series feature aluminum frames and alumitech side panels in an eye-catching silver finish. TZ Case gun case is designed to keep dust and dirt away and have a weather resistant seal to keep moisture out. All cases from TZ Case meet airline requirements for firearm transport.", "text": "T.Z. Case International Pro-Tech Duelly Fifteen Pistol Case, Silver, 15-Inch This duelly fifteen pistol case in our popular Pro-Tech series feature aluminum frames and alumitech side panels in an eye-catching silver finish. TZ Case gun case is designed to keep dust and dirt away and have a weather resistant seal to keep moisture out. All cases from TZ Case meet airline requirements for firearm transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TJNPDcHUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW6WVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "T.Z. Case International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 90.74}}
{"item_id": "B000PW6XSQ", "title": "MTM 380/9MM Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "text": "MTM 380/9MM Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BsrM-Q8yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW6XSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PW6Z84", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle RUGP Ruger GP100", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle RUGP Ruger GP100 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31udGAsrOWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW6Z84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PW71LO", "title": "RCBS Hand Priming Tool", "description": "The RCBS Hand Priming Tool not only seats primers quickly, it’s also the safest. A patented safety mechanism separates the seating operation from the primer supply, virtually eliminating the possibility of tray detonation. Fits in your hand for portable primer seating. Primer tray installation requires no contact with the primers. Uses the same RCBS shell holders (post-1980) as RCBS presses. Made of durable cast metal. Includes large and small primer plugs.", "text": "RCBS Hand Priming Tool The RCBS Hand Priming Tool not only seats primers quickly, it’s also the safest. A patented safety mechanism separates the seating operation from the primer supply, virtually eliminating the possibility of tray detonation. Fits in your hand for portable primer seating. Primer tray installation requires no contact with the primers. Uses the same RCBS shell holders (post-1980) as RCBS presses. Made of durable cast metal. Includes large and small primer plugs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GTsh90%2BeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW71LO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PW742K", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F04T Throwing Knives, Black Hardcased", "description": "These stylized knives are not only fun to sail through the air, they are practical as well. Completely protected by SOG’s hardcased black coating, they are extremely scratch resistant. Their balance, aerodynamics, and proportions make them great throwing knives. For the same reasons, they also make great backup field knives. Wrap the handles with paracord or use as is, and you have three knives for the price of one! Includes a nylon sheath that safely carries all three knives. This SOG knife is backed by a lifetime warranty.About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F04T Throwing Knives, Black Hardcased These stylized knives are not only fun to sail through the air, they are practical as well. Completely protected by SOG’s hardcased black coating, they are extremely scratch resistant. Their balance, aerodynamics, and proportions make them great throwing knives. For the same reasons, they also make great backup field knives. Wrap the handles with paracord or use as is, and you have three knives for the price of one! Includes a nylon sheath that safely carries all three knives. This SOG knife is backed by a lifetime warranty.About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-hDYrn3NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW742K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 38.87}}
{"item_id": "B000PW7KWY", "title": "Bushnell Performance Optics 1321 Cotton Swab, .22 - .270-Caliber", "description": "Cleaning Swab, For Gun Cleaning Rod, .22 - .270 Caliber, 100% Cotton, Soft & Washable.", "text": "Bushnell Performance Optics 1321 Cotton Swab, .22 - .270-Caliber Cleaning Swab, For Gun Cleaning Rod, .22 - .270 Caliber, 100% Cotton, Soft & Washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318AyVjVv1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW7KWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 4.77}}
{"item_id": "B000PW7Q4G", "title": "Butler Creek Slip On Recoil Pad (Brown, Medium)", "description": "Butler Creek offers the Uncle Mike's line of quality recoil pads. All of the pads offer a leather textured facing and smooth transition to your stock with a black base plate. Factory pads are normally very thin and really hard. These recoil pads absorb the sharp spike of recoil and dramatically improve your comfort during extended shooting. A special elastomer material is used that reduces the felt recoil of heavy magnum rifles and shotguns. This will improve your accuracy by reducing fatigue and flinching associated with recoil sensitivities. Dimensions: Medium: Butt length - 5.10\"; Butt width - 1.60\"; Cushion between Butt & Firearm - .75\". Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Butler Creek Slip On Recoil Pad (Brown, Medium) Butler Creek offers the Uncle Mike's line of quality recoil pads. All of the pads offer a leather textured facing and smooth transition to your stock with a black base plate. Factory pads are normally very thin and really hard. These recoil pads absorb the sharp spike of recoil and dramatically improve your comfort during extended shooting. A special elastomer material is used that reduces the felt recoil of heavy magnum rifles and shotguns. This will improve your accuracy by reducing fatigue and flinching associated with recoil sensitivities. Dimensions: Medium: Butt length - 5.10\"; Butt width - 1.60\"; Cushion between Butt & Firearm - .75\". Warranty: Limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515UpEXf-cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW7Q4G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 18.35}}
{"item_id": "B000PW7TZC", "title": "Cold Steel Paring Knife Kraton Handle with 3.00-Inch Blade", "description": "These blades are ice tempered and then precision flat ground for maximum cutting power. All models in the series come with a razor sharp edge that lasts and lasts, and some have serrated edges uniquely appropriate to the tasks they were designed to do. The handles are, in a word, terrific! Carefully designed to ensure a strong, secure, yet comfortable grip, they feature a stiff Zytel core on the inside, with a softer, deeply checkered Kraton exterior for a the kind of non-slip grip that must be felt to be appreciated!", "text": "Cold Steel Paring Knife Kraton Handle with 3.00-Inch Blade These blades are ice tempered and then precision flat ground for maximum cutting power. All models in the series come with a razor sharp edge that lasts and lasts, and some have serrated edges uniquely appropriate to the tasks they were designed to do. The handles are, in a word, terrific! Carefully designed to ensure a strong, secure, yet comfortable grip, they feature a stiff Zytel core on the inside, with a softer, deeply checkered Kraton exterior for a the kind of non-slip grip that must be felt to be appreciated!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ilUKORPDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW7TZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PW7ZD8", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Wooden Loading and Display Stand for Black Powder Revolvers", "description": "Good looking and convenient way to display and load your cap and ball revolver. Pistol grip rests securely in wooden base while felt-lined wooded upright support engages back strap securely. Positions cylinder to rotate and face upward for easy loading. Loading stand collapses for easy storage. Fits 1851, 1860 and 1858 revolvers.", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Wooden Loading and Display Stand for Black Powder Revolvers Good looking and convenient way to display and load your cap and ball revolver. Pistol grip rests securely in wooden base while felt-lined wooded upright support engages back strap securely. Positions cylinder to rotate and face upward for easy loading. Loading stand collapses for easy storage. Fits 1851, 1860 and 1858 revolvers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QzcmjXlFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW7ZD8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8CS0", "title": "MTM 38/357 Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "text": "MTM 38/357 Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tTL2FF81L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8CS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.94}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8HN0", "title": "LaserMax Uni-Max Red Rail Mount Laser with Integral Rail", "description": "This compact and rugged rail mount laser fits Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (with minimum rail length of 1.75-Inch) Battery Type: 357 (2) Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage and elevation. Laser Operating Temperature: 5°F - 150°F. Wavelength: 635nm (red/orange) Power Output: 5mW. Spot Size: 5/16-Inch @ 7 Yds; 3/4-Inch @ 25 Yds.", "text": "LaserMax Uni-Max Red Rail Mount Laser with Integral Rail This compact and rugged rail mount laser fits Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (with minimum rail length of 1.75-Inch) Battery Type: 357 (2) Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage and elevation. Laser Operating Temperature: 5°F - 150°F. Wavelength: 635nm (red/orange) Power Output: 5mW. Spot Size: 5/16-Inch @ 7 Yds; 3/4-Inch @ 25 Yds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bSEm1kPhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8HN0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 178.83}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8KSM", "title": "Caldwell DeadShot Boxed Front and Rear Bag Combo-Unfilled", "description": "Every hunter and shooter is looking for a versatile and steady shooting system that can be set up almost anywhere, and at any time. Whether you have minutes or seconds to set up for your next shot, the DeadShot Shooting Bags are the answer.", "text": "Caldwell DeadShot Boxed Front and Rear Bag Combo-Unfilled Every hunter and shooter is looking for a versatile and steady shooting system that can be set up almost anywhere, and at any time. Whether you have minutes or seconds to set up for your next shot, the DeadShot Shooting Bags are the answer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XyFzh%2BERL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8KSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 17.54}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8NKC", "title": "Fobus Roto Evolution Series RH Paddle GL2E2RP Glock 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 32, 34, 35, Walther PK380", "description": "The Evolution series is the next step in the advancement of holster development. A tension adjustment screw is incorporated to allow the user to customize the ease of presentation and the security of retention, functioning with the proven FOBUS passive retention design.The new E2 series features one-piece holster body construction, and like all FOBUS Holsters, the Evolution, is lightweight and includes steel reinforced rivet attachment and a protective sight channel. The paddle also includes a rubberized insert to provide both comfort and stability. FEATURES: Tension adjustment screw, Steel reinforced rivet attachment system, Protective sight channel", "text": "Fobus Roto Evolution Series RH Paddle GL2E2RP Glock 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 32, 34, 35, Walther PK380 The Evolution series is the next step in the advancement of holster development. A tension adjustment screw is incorporated to allow the user to customize the ease of presentation and the security of retention, functioning with the proven FOBUS passive retention design.The new E2 series features one-piece holster body construction, and like all FOBUS Holsters, the Evolution, is lightweight and includes steel reinforced rivet attachment and a protective sight channel. The paddle also includes a rubberized insert to provide both comfort and stability. FEATURES: Tension adjustment screw, Steel reinforced rivet attachment system, Protective sight channel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41poO-L9JpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8NKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8O6A", "title": "Uncle Mike's Hammer Extension for Marlin Lever Actions (1957-1982)", "description": "Uncle Mike's Hammer Extension slip over hard-to-reach or hard-to-cock hammers for extra leverage. A must for scoped guns with external hammers. Blued steel, knurled surface for easy gripping. Fits most hammer-type guns, either right or left side (Allen wrench included). For Marlin lever actions 1957-1982.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Hammer Extension for Marlin Lever Actions (1957-1982) Uncle Mike's Hammer Extension slip over hard-to-reach or hard-to-cock hammers for extra leverage. A must for scoped guns with external hammers. Blued steel, knurled surface for easy gripping. Fits most hammer-type guns, either right or left side (Allen wrench included). For Marlin lever actions 1957-1982.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411ZrviN7jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8O6A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 10.41}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8V4K", "title": "Benjamin Sheridan B272 4-Piece 3/8\" Dovetail Inter-mount for Benjamin Sheridan Airguns", "description": "This 4-Piece intermount readies your Benjamin and Sheridan air rifles and air pistols (current production) for sighting devices.", "text": "Benjamin Sheridan B272 4-Piece 3/8\" Dovetail Inter-mount for Benjamin Sheridan Airguns This 4-Piece intermount readies your Benjamin and Sheridan air rifles and air pistols (current production) for sighting devices.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PEd6n37lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8V4K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 12.6}}
{"item_id": "B000PW8ZVO", "title": "Birchwood Casey Double Magnum .44 Action Spinner Target", "description": "The Double Mag targets are popular, two-disc spinning targets for the \"big bore\" pistol shooters. You choose between the challenging 3inch and easier 4 ¼ inch circle for action you can see and hear when hit.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Double Magnum .44 Action Spinner Target The Double Mag targets are popular, two-disc spinning targets for the \"big bore\" pistol shooters. You choose between the challenging 3inch and easier 4 ¼ inch circle for action you can see and hear when hit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TlBs9PkUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PW8ZVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 25.62}}
