{"item_id": "B000PWA7I8", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle PX4 Beretta PX4 Storm (compact & full size), Browning Pro 9, 40, FN/FNX P9/P40", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle PX4 Beretta PX4 Storm (compact & full size), Browning Pro 9, 40, FN/FNX P9/P40 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RkL4K9xSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWA7I8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.4}}
{"item_id": "B000PWAY3G", "title": "Barnett Revolution/Quad 400 4 Arrow Quiver with 4 - 22-Inch Arrows", "description": "This four-pack of 22-inch arrows, neatly stored in a Revolution quick-detach quiver with four-bolt design, is compatible with Barnett's Revolution and Quad 400 crossbows.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Revolution/Quad 400 4 Arrow Quiver with 4 - 22-Inch Arrows This four-pack of 22-inch arrows, neatly stored in a Revolution quick-detach quiver with four-bolt design, is compatible with Barnett's Revolution and Quad 400 crossbows.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-C9SnSWKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWAY3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWB2K0", "title": "MTM Muzzle Loader Dry Box", "description": "As all Muzzleloaders know, black powder and powder substitutes must be stored in a controlled environment to protect them from moisture. That is why MTM designed the new MuzzleLoader Dry Box - it is the ideal possible bag - box for active muzzle loading black powder enthusiasts. No matter what the weather, the ML-1's roomy base interior shuts out moisture problems with a tight, weather resistant, O-ring seal. A large lift out tray helps to organize gear keeping smaller items on top, not crushed or buried at the bottom. The 80% usable top access lid compartment divides specialty tools into five sections for quick retrieval at the range. Thick side-wall construction, a heavy-duty latch and padlock tabs assure a secure barrier against uninvited guests. Just the ticket for the active muzzle loader.", "text": "MTM Muzzle Loader Dry Box As all Muzzleloaders know, black powder and powder substitutes must be stored in a controlled environment to protect them from moisture. That is why MTM designed the new MuzzleLoader Dry Box - it is the ideal possible bag - box for active muzzle loading black powder enthusiasts. No matter what the weather, the ML-1's roomy base interior shuts out moisture problems with a tight, weather resistant, O-ring seal. A large lift out tray helps to organize gear keeping smaller items on top, not crushed or buried at the bottom. The 80% usable top access lid compartment divides specialty tools into five sections for quick retrieval at the range. Thick side-wall construction, a heavy-duty latch and padlock tabs assure a secure barrier against uninvited guests. Just the ticket for the active muzzle loader.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iNfoevDKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWB2K0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWB5D4", "title": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .45 Caliber Pistols", "description": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush 44/45Cal Pistol Blister Card 1257 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for .45 Caliber Pistols Hoppe's Tornado Brush 44/45Cal Pistol Blister Card 1257 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419LhEfJgeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWB5D4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 5.84}}
{"item_id": "B000PWB674", "title": "Tacstar 4-Shot Mossberg 500 (20 Gauge)", "description": "TacStars new 4 round SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4 round SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the new Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. The most popular pattern has been selected from RealTree® to perfectly match your Remington 870, 1100, 11-87. 20 Gauge only.", "text": "Tacstar 4-Shot Mossberg 500 (20 Gauge) TacStars new 4 round SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4 round SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the new Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. The most popular pattern has been selected from RealTree® to perfectly match your Remington 870, 1100, 11-87. 20 Gauge only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nV3uUVvEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWB674.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 26.29}}
{"item_id": "B000PWB6TW", "title": "MTM 41/44 Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "text": "MTM 41/44 Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sWnuzYsEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWB6TW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.9}}
{"item_id": "B000PWB7QY", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Hunter Flask and Powder Measure, 5 to 120 grains (brass)", "description": "Valve-type flask for black powder or Pyrodex. Adjustable measure slips into spout for 5-120 grain charges. Brass", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Hunter Flask and Powder Measure, 5 to 120 grains (brass) Valve-type flask for black powder or Pyrodex. Adjustable measure slips into spout for 5-120 grain charges. Brass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418PhIYSzQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWB7QY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWBAA2", "title": "HKS 451 Adjustable Large Caliber Single Stack Magazine Speedloader", "description": "The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads single stack magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "text": "HKS 451 Adjustable Large Caliber Single Stack Magazine Speedloader The HKS Magazine Speedloader is capable of loading 15 rounds in 18 seconds. Faster and easier than ever before, our magazine speed loader quickly loads single stack magazines. Its simple: magazine slips into loader and is held in by hand. Depress thumb lever and load. That's it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ri3KQGlFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWBAA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWBF3O", "title": "RCBS #3 Shell Holder", "description": "The RCBS Shell Holder is ideal for nearly any single stage press. The shell holder keeps cases securely in place and in perfect alignment for your reloading needs. Nearly every RCBS Shell Holder can be used for multiple calibers .", "text": "RCBS #3 Shell Holder The RCBS Shell Holder is ideal for nearly any single stage press. The shell holder keeps cases securely in place and in perfect alignment for your reloading needs. Nearly every RCBS Shell Holder can be used for multiple calibers .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217vT2pU0%2BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWBF3O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.02}}
