{"item_id": "B000PWBS54", "title": "Birchwood Casey SHOOT-N-C 2\" Bull's-Eye Targets - 108 Targets", "description": "The SHOOT;N;C Bull's-eye Target Packs are an amazing value Each pack contains numerous small round targets for a shooter's delight They can be used for close-range shooting with airguns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns.", "text": "Birchwood Casey SHOOT-N-C 2\" Bull's-Eye Targets - 108 Targets The SHOOT;N;C Bull's-eye Target Packs are an amazing value Each pack contains numerous small round targets for a shooter's delight They can be used for close-range shooting with airguns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51C4tvWPh8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWBS54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 4.9}}
