{"item_id": "B000PWDF32", "title": "RCBS Case Lube-2", "description": "RCBS Case Lube-2 is an excellent lubricant that’s water soluble and convenient to wipe off easily with no sticky residue. The Case Lube is non-toxic. Be sure to use Case Lube—2 with RCBS Lube Dies or Case Lube Pad.", "text": "RCBS Case Lube-2 RCBS Case Lube-2 is an excellent lubricant that’s water soluble and convenient to wipe off easily with no sticky residue. The Case Lube is non-toxic. Be sure to use Case Lube—2 with RCBS Lube Dies or Case Lube Pad.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bO7AVu4qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWDF32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.28}}
{"item_id": "B000PWDGM2", "title": "Barnett Slingshot Power Bands (Magnum with Leather Pouch)", "description": "This replacement Magnum Power Band is designed for use with renowned archery company Barnett's slingshots. The powerful rubber tube features a durable leather ammunition shot pouch.Lifetime WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Slingshot Power Bands (Magnum with Leather Pouch) This replacement Magnum Power Band is designed for use with renowned archery company Barnett's slingshots. The powerful rubber tube features a durable leather ammunition shot pouch.Lifetime WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u5WSCl9AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWDGM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWF0GM", "title": "5.11 Tactical.59048 Men's Level I 9-in Sock", "description": "", "text": "5.11 Tactical.59048 Men's Level I 9-in Sock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oV4WJzL3L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWF0GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Athletic Socks"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PWF1HU", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt RU101BH Ruger LCR / SP101", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt RU101BH Ruger LCR / SP101 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QMPyZZJ7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWF1HU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.79}}
{"item_id": "B000PWLNHM", "title": "Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup", "description": "FEATURES of the Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup This Titanium Double Wall Cup with folding handles holds 14 oz of liquid and weighs only 2.4 oz Perfect for backpacking or camping These mugs are colored with an electric ionization process which chemically bonds to the titanium The result is a safely coated and vibrant mug SPECIFICATIONS of the Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup Weight: 4.2 oz Capacity: 14 fl oz Titanium", "text": "Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup FEATURES of the Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup This Titanium Double Wall Cup with folding handles holds 14 oz of liquid and weighs only 2.4 oz Perfect for backpacking or camping These mugs are colored with an electric ionization process which chemically bonds to the titanium The result is a safely coated and vibrant mug SPECIFICATIONS of the Snow Peak Titanium Double Wall Cup Weight: 4.2 oz Capacity: 14 fl oz Titanium", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EEj3gnUbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWLNHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000PWLNJK", "title": "Snow Peak Trek Titanium Plate", "description": "Titanium is a lightweight and strong metal that will not rust or melt. More corrosion resistant than stainless steel and more heat resistant than aluminum. Will not emit metallic odors or aggravate metallic allergies. Size: 7.5\" diameter. Wt. 2oz.", "text": "Snow Peak Trek Titanium Plate Titanium is a lightweight and strong metal that will not rust or melt. More corrosion resistant than stainless steel and more heat resistant than aluminum. Will not emit metallic odors or aggravate metallic allergies. Size: 7.5\" diameter. Wt. 2oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313X%2BW3-3EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PWLNJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Snow Peak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B000PX0LKG", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Knife Rescue Tool", "description": "The Victorinox Swiss Army Knife Rescue Tool is a highly functional multi-tool for any situation. Developed in collaboration with fire and rescue workers, the Rescue Tool is a true helper in an emergency.Bottle opener..Wire stripper..Reamer, punch..Seat belt cutter..Key ring..Tweezers..Toothpick..Disc saw for shatterproof glass..Luminescent handles..Nylon cord..Nylon pouch..Size: 4.3 in..Weight: 13 oz..", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Knife Rescue Tool The Victorinox Swiss Army Knife Rescue Tool is a highly functional multi-tool for any situation. Developed in collaboration with fire and rescue workers, the Rescue Tool is a true helper in an emergency.Bottle opener..Wire stripper..Reamer, punch..Seat belt cutter..Key ring..Tweezers..Toothpick..Disc saw for shatterproof glass..Luminescent handles..Nylon cord..Nylon pouch..Size: 4.3 in..Weight: 13 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417Fyhl5zPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PX0LKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 78.99}}
