{"item_id": "B000PY9T0S", "title": "Coleman Butane / Propane Mix Fuel (Mix Fuel 7.75 oz.) - 7.75 oz.", "description": "Butane/Propane mix canisters are lightweight, resealable, and easily connect to stoves and lanterns. Most canister appliances are lightweight and simple to use, so if you are a backpacker who counts ounces and appreciates convenience this fuel is for you. Downsides are that canisters can't be recycled, and in subfreezing temperatures, the fuel does not perform well. Or at all. Cold temperatures affect the pressure in the canister, so performance is best in mild to moderate conditions, Main advantages: convenience and light weight.", "text": "Coleman Butane / Propane Mix Fuel (Mix Fuel 7.75 oz.) - 7.75 oz. Butane/Propane mix canisters are lightweight, resealable, and easily connect to stoves and lanterns. Most canister appliances are lightweight and simple to use, so if you are a backpacker who counts ounces and appreciates convenience this fuel is for you. Downsides are that canisters can't be recycled, and in subfreezing temperatures, the fuel does not perform well. Or at all. Cold temperatures affect the pressure in the canister, so performance is best in mild to moderate conditions, Main advantages: convenience and light weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ItKV6y-WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PY9T0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B000PZRUC6", "title": "Gel-filled Paddle Saddle", "description": "This gel-filled seat cushion allows you to stay on the waterlonger in comfort. YakPads proprietary comfort gel paddingis soft enough to provide dramatic improvements in comfort,yet thin enough that it doesn't raise your center of gravity.", "text": "Gel-filled Paddle Saddle This gel-filled seat cushion allows you to stay on the waterlonger in comfort. YakPads proprietary comfort gel paddingis soft enough to provide dramatic improvements in comfort,yet thin enough that it doesn't raise your center of gravity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MSvkGgvyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000PZRUC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yakpads", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Canoeing"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B000Q019UY", "title": "MTM 41/44 Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "text": "MTM 41/44 Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BsrM-Q8yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q019UY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.95}}
