{"item_id": "B000Q04NKW", "title": "MTM 40/45/10MM Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "text": "MTM 40/45/10MM Cal 100 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-100 Series offers Case-Gard protection in a 100 round flip top box. P-100s prove to be quite popular with law enforcement, competitive shooters, varmint hunters, weekend plinkers and anyone needing large amounts of ammo for several hours of shooting. Ideal for storing reloads, the P-100 series features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, along with an unheard of, 25 year guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zVYXdQdNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q04NKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.9}}
