{"item_id": "B000Q06LI4", "title": "SE MT908 11 Function Credit Card Size Survival Pocket Tool", "description": "This credit card-size multi-function survival tool includes a can opener, knife edge, screwdriver, ruler, cap opener, 4-position wrench, butterfly screw wrench, saw blade, direction ancillary wrench, 2-position wrench, and a keychain hole. Comes with a pouch.", "text": "SE MT908 11 Function Credit Card Size Survival Pocket Tool This credit card-size multi-function survival tool includes a can opener, knife edge, screwdriver, ruler, cap opener, 4-position wrench, butterfly screw wrench, saw blade, direction ancillary wrench, 2-position wrench, and a keychain hole. Comes with a pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gzgNkFnzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q06LI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 1.65}}
{"item_id": "B000Q1QJBC", "title": "Vedante Super Reflective Pop Bands (Pair), Unpackaged", "description": "Be Cool, be Safe be Seen! Set (2 bands) of Super Reflective arm/leg bands for 360 degree visibility in low light conditions. Use for: biking, walking, jogging, dog walking, in night clubs or just for fun. We recommend wearing at least 2-4 Pop Bands to create 360 degree visibility. Can be worn on arms, ankles, wrists, bike handles, baby carriages, back packs, over non-slick jackets and more. Available in size Medium (30cm/11.75 inch) or Large (38cm/14.75 inch). Colors: Blue, Green, Tangerine, White, Yellow, Pink. Vedante makes a donation to sustainability and safety charities with each purchase of unpackaged products.", "text": "Vedante Super Reflective Pop Bands (Pair), Unpackaged Be Cool, be Safe be Seen! Set (2 bands) of Super Reflective arm/leg bands for 360 degree visibility in low light conditions. Use for: biking, walking, jogging, dog walking, in night clubs or just for fun. We recommend wearing at least 2-4 Pop Bands to create 360 degree visibility. Can be worn on arms, ankles, wrists, bike handles, baby carriages, back packs, over non-slick jackets and more. Available in size Medium (30cm/11.75 inch) or Large (38cm/14.75 inch). Colors: Blue, Green, Tangerine, White, Yellow, Pink. Vedante makes a donation to sustainability and safety charities with each purchase of unpackaged products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412-fBxxJJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q1QJBC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000Q28AFO", "title": "Birchwood Casey Spinner Target Qualifier", "description": "The Qualifier Spinner Target is a popular three disc spinning target for members of the .22 rimfire club. The three different size circles will challenge the marksman, sharpshooter, or expert in all of us, and will help to improve your shooting skills.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Spinner Target Qualifier The Qualifier Spinner Target is a popular three disc spinning target for members of the .22 rimfire club. The three different size circles will challenge the marksman, sharpshooter, or expert in all of us, and will help to improve your shooting skills.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yDoYsF3rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q28AFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 20.19}}
{"item_id": "B000Q28HBQ", "title": "Hogue Stock Tamer Shotgun Pistol Grip for Remington 870", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Tamer Shotgun Pistol Grip for Remington 870 OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FmZnV4N5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q28HBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 25.51}}
{"item_id": "B000Q28JOQ", "title": "KA-BAR KNIVES, INC. KA-BAR Warthog Folder 3072 Poc Knives", "description": "G10 handles give these knives a tactical look and sure grip, Teflon coated AUS 8A stainless steel blades are corrosion resistant and non-reflective, All knives feature pocket clips", "text": "KA-BAR KNIVES, INC. KA-BAR Warthog Folder 3072 Poc Knives G10 handles give these knives a tactical look and sure grip, Teflon coated AUS 8A stainless steel blades are corrosion resistant and non-reflective, All knives feature pocket clips", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dOdFIm%2BfL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q28JOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 14.68}}
{"item_id": "B000Q2CQ3G", "title": "Umarex CP99 Compact Airgun Laser Sight", "description": "Walther Laser Sights for airgun pistols increase shooting enjoyment while adding accuracy. Made to fit and provides for windage and elevation adjustments. Suitable for Walther CP99 compact. With Snap-mount for Weaver rail, LED indicators on both sides. (These scopes and sights are designed for airgun use and are not intended for standard firearms.)", "text": "Umarex CP99 Compact Airgun Laser Sight Walther Laser Sights for airgun pistols increase shooting enjoyment while adding accuracy. Made to fit and provides for windage and elevation adjustments. Suitable for Walther CP99 compact. With Snap-mount for Weaver rail, LED indicators on both sides. (These scopes and sights are designed for airgun use and are not intended for standard firearms.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ozYqSR1ZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q2CQ3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 28.1}}
{"item_id": "B000Q2DUIG", "title": "Hoppe's Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush, Card", "description": "Hoppe's 1380P No. 9 Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush Hoppe's 1380P No. 9 Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush Features: Two bristle ends one for large areas, the other for tight spots Intense scrubbing without scratching Extremely rugged design Ideal for breeches and a myriad of other uses", "text": "Hoppe's Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush, Card Hoppe's 1380P No. 9 Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush Hoppe's 1380P No. 9 Phosphor Bronze Utility Brush Features: Two bristle ends one for large areas, the other for tight spots Intense scrubbing without scratching Extremely rugged design Ideal for breeches and a myriad of other uses", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314%2BjGhXtdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q2DUIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 6.19}}
{"item_id": "B000Q2FHA0", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Deluxe Nipple Wrench with Nipple Pick (For side-lock rifles and pistols)", "description": "Hardened steel tool installs and removes nipples easily. Brass end cap houses nipple pick for cleaning inside of nipple.", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Deluxe Nipple Wrench with Nipple Pick (For side-lock rifles and pistols) Hardened steel tool installs and removes nipples easily. Brass end cap houses nipple pick for cleaning inside of nipple.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wp0Mz6prL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q2FHA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.45}}
{"item_id": "B000Q5G83W", "title": "Yakima Mako Saddles Rooftop Kayak Carrier with Straps with Tie-Downs", "description": "Tired of pain-in-the-rear kayak carriers that take up a ton of space while functioning poorly? Turn to the Yakima Mako Saddles rooftop kayak carrier, which employs a scoop-shaped cradle design that fits virtually any hull shape. Suitable for sea kayaks, recreational kayaks, and whitewater boats, the carrier includes a set of Dynaflex pads that grip the boat hull securely, along with a tightening strap that gives you complete control over the grip. The padded buckle, meanwhile, protects both your boat and your vehicle from unsightly scratches.Thanks to the bundled bow/stern tie-down straps, your kayak will stay incredibly stable whether you're cruising down a country road or a busy highway. An ideal companion for Yakima's HullyRollers or Multimount accessories, the carrier works with round, square, and most factory crossbars (the latter requires the Multimounts) and carries a one-year warranty.", "text": "Yakima Mako Saddles Rooftop Kayak Carrier with Straps with Tie-Downs Tired of pain-in-the-rear kayak carriers that take up a ton of space while functioning poorly? Turn to the Yakima Mako Saddles rooftop kayak carrier, which employs a scoop-shaped cradle design that fits virtually any hull shape. Suitable for sea kayaks, recreational kayaks, and whitewater boats, the carrier includes a set of Dynaflex pads that grip the boat hull securely, along with a tightening strap that gives you complete control over the grip. The padded buckle, meanwhile, protects both your boat and your vehicle from unsightly scratches.Thanks to the bundled bow/stern tie-down straps, your kayak will stay incredibly stable whether you're cruising down a country road or a busy highway. An ideal companion for Yakima's HullyRollers or Multimount accessories, the carrier works with round, square, and most factory crossbars (the latter requires the Multimounts) and carries a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KYWUj88yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q5G83W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yakima", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 89.0}}
