pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q5UHMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Level III", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 52.99}}
