{"item_id": "B000Q659W2", "title": "Bluewave Insulated Sport Sac Water Bottle Holder, Yellow, 2L", "description": "Have you ever placed an ice cold water bottle in your backpack hoping it would stay cold but only to find out that its not so cold anymore and had leaked all over your bag? Fear no longer, you can now use a Bluewave Insulated Sports Sac to hold your chilled drinks without destroying your other belongings. Customize your look with the selection of colors available. It comes with a zipper pouch for your keys and coins, as well as a shoulder strap to carry with you on the go. The sports sac will fit other water bottles depending on the shape design and size. Please refer to the sport sac dimensions to find out if it will fit your water bottle. Not all water bottles will fit into the sac perfectly or even fit at all. Water bottle NOT included.", "text": "Bluewave Insulated Sport Sac Water Bottle Holder, Yellow, 2L Have you ever placed an ice cold water bottle in your backpack hoping it would stay cold but only to find out that its not so cold anymore and had leaked all over your bag? Fear no longer, you can now use a Bluewave Insulated Sports Sac to hold your chilled drinks without destroying your other belongings. Customize your look with the selection of colors available. It comes with a zipper pouch for your keys and coins, as well as a shoulder strap to carry with you on the go. The sports sac will fit other water bottles depending on the shape design and size. Please refer to the sport sac dimensions to find out if it will fit your water bottle. Not all water bottles will fit into the sac perfectly or even fit at all. Water bottle NOT included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k%2BLbSzSEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q659W2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blue Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Q6D5XW", "title": "Jogalite Slimbands Reflective Leg Bands (Pair)", "description": "Slim leg bands from Jogalite provide nighttime visibility to keep you safe.", "text": "Jogalite Slimbands Reflective Leg Bands (Pair) Slim leg bands from Jogalite provide nighttime visibility to keep you safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l2TUr0baL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q6D5XW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jog A Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]], "price": 7.69}}
{"item_id": "B000Q6JO0U", "title": "Urban Rebounder Trampoline with Workout DVD & Stabilizing Bar", "description": "Created by J.B. Berns--a practicing martial artist for more than 20 years--the urban rebounding workout has its lineage in martial arts and core abdominal postures, resulting in a nonstop abdominal workout that melts away the fat and inches, strengthens your core, and improves your balance and coordination like no other exercise. Now, with the Urban Rebounder folding trampoline workout system, you can perform the urban rebounding workout in the comfort of your own home in just 20 minutes a day, three times per week. Not only is it the first exercise you'll actually look forward to, but it brings the fun without causing pain or stress on your joints. That makes it especially ideal for athletes, seniors, and anyone else who wants a low-impact, high-efficiency workout.The Urban Rebounding system comes with a commercial-quality mini trampoline, a stabilizing bar for particularly vigorous exercises, and six motivational workouts on DVD. And users can rest assured that the workout is effective, as it's the same routine that's used in nearly 5,000 health clubs worldwide, including Bally's, Crunch, Equinox, Gold's, and the YMCA, to name a few. The Urban Rebounding system--which offers a weight capacity of 300 pounds and folds up for easy storage--carries a one-year warranty.", "text": "Urban Rebounder Trampoline with Workout DVD & Stabilizing Bar Created by J.B. Berns--a practicing martial artist for more than 20 years--the urban rebounding workout has its lineage in martial arts and core abdominal postures, resulting in a nonstop abdominal workout that melts away the fat and inches, strengthens your core, and improves your balance and coordination like no other exercise. Now, with the Urban Rebounder folding trampoline workout system, you can perform the urban rebounding workout in the comfort of your own home in just 20 minutes a day, three times per week. Not only is it the first exercise you'll actually look forward to, but it brings the fun without causing pain or stress on your joints. That makes it especially ideal for athletes, seniors, and anyone else who wants a low-impact, high-efficiency workout.The Urban Rebounding system comes with a commercial-quality mini trampoline, a stabilizing bar for particularly vigorous exercises, and six motivational workouts on DVD. And users can rest assured that the workout is effective, as it's the same routine that's used in nearly 5,000 health clubs worldwide, including Bally's, Crunch, Equinox, Gold's, and the YMCA, to name a few. The Urban Rebounding system--which offers a weight capacity of 300 pounds and folds up for easy storage--carries a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sug%2Bj9b7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q6JO0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Urban Rebounder", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 121.46}}
