{"item_id": "B000Q7E698", "title": "G.I. Type Heavyweight Canvas Mini Alice Pack", "description": "Our heavyweight canvas mini Alice Pack is ideal for long or short hiking trips. Features include a large main compartment with a drawstring top & flap with quick release closures, three large outside pockets with flaps, and adjustable padded shoulder straps. Constructed of our best heavy grade canvas.", "text": "G.I. Type Heavyweight Canvas Mini Alice Pack Our heavyweight canvas mini Alice Pack is ideal for long or short hiking trips. Features include a large main compartment with a drawstring top & flap with quick release closures, three large outside pockets with flaps, and adjustable padded shoulder straps. Constructed of our best heavy grade canvas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515ED7fLp-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q7E698.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 21.49}}
{"item_id": "B000Q82HSY", "title": "Sentry Solutions TUF-GLIDE Needle Applicator, 1/2-Ounce", "description": "Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "text": "Sentry Solutions TUF-GLIDE Needle Applicator, 1/2-Ounce Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ugt-zmTjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q82HSY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sentry Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 8.09}}
{"item_id": "B000Q838XW", "title": "Innova Dx Disc Golf Set-3", "description": "Dx disc golf set description the innova dx disc golf set is a great way to get started or to expand your throwing options. This 3 disc set includes a fairway driver, a mid-range, and a putter. The discs are generally in the 135g - 160g range. Weights and colors are assorted. Each set comes in an attractive display/gift box. About dx disc golf set plastic innova`s dx line is produced with our deluxe plastic. The dx line offers the widest selection of models and weights. These discs are affordably priced and provide an excellent grip in a variety of weather situations. Dx discs wear in with usage and over time will eventually take on new and varied flight characteristics. Many top pros carry several dx discs of their favorite models to provide different flight patterns for different situations.", "text": "Innova Dx Disc Golf Set-3 Dx disc golf set description the innova dx disc golf set is a great way to get started or to expand your throwing options. This 3 disc set includes a fairway driver, a mid-range, and a putter. The discs are generally in the 135g - 160g range. Weights and colors are assorted. Each set comes in an attractive display/gift box. About dx disc golf set plastic innova`s dx line is produced with our deluxe plastic. The dx line offers the widest selection of models and weights. These discs are affordably priced and provide an excellent grip in a variety of weather situations. Dx discs wear in with usage and over time will eventually take on new and varied flight characteristics. Many top pros carry several dx discs of their favorite models to provide different flight patterns for different situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51seTHgV9dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q838XW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innova", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Starter Sets"]], "price": 24.95}}
