{"item_id": "B000Q94LIW", "title": "Gerber 05803 Guardian Back-Up Knife", "description": "A Bob Loveless design, the award winning Guardian Back-Up is a sleek, comfortable, and lightweight boot knife. The patented sheath allows the user to adjust the amount of pressure required to insert and remove the blade. It can be worn on a belt, strap or as a lightweight boot knife. SPECIFICATIONS: - Sheath: Belt/boot with adjustable knife withdraw retention", "text": "Gerber 05803 Guardian Back-Up Knife A Bob Loveless design, the award winning Guardian Back-Up is a sleek, comfortable, and lightweight boot knife. The patented sheath allows the user to adjust the amount of pressure required to insert and remove the blade. It can be worn on a belt, strap or as a lightweight boot knife. SPECIFICATIONS: - Sheath: Belt/boot with adjustable knife withdraw retention", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z6gzQwJqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q94LIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 38.96}}
{"item_id": "B000Q99RXG", "title": "Cold Steel Finn Bear Polypropylene Handle (Cordura Sheath)", "description": "Reflecting the best of its Finnish heritage, the Finn Bear is an extremely affordable version of our popular Sisu™. It’s ideal for hunting, fishing or camping trips, and makes an efficient utility knife as well!", "text": "Cold Steel Finn Bear Polypropylene Handle (Cordura Sheath) Reflecting the best of its Finnish heritage, the Finn Bear is an extremely affordable version of our popular Sisu™. It’s ideal for hunting, fishing or camping trips, and makes an efficient utility knife as well!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RzD0Yw0VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q99RXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.61}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9API2", "title": "Coleman Company Pocket Compass with Plastic Case, Black/White", "description": "Quicker accuracy with liquid-filled design Easy-turn needle sits on jeweled bearing Made of tough, impact-resistant materials Eight directional reference points: N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW Glow-in-the-dark pointer is easy to see in the dark Snap lid protects the face in transport Hang tab to keep it close on a belt loop, backpack or keychain.", "text": "Coleman Company Pocket Compass with Plastic Case, Black/White Quicker accuracy with liquid-filled design Easy-turn needle sits on jeweled bearing Made of tough, impact-resistant materials Eight directional reference points: N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW Glow-in-the-dark pointer is easy to see in the dark Snap lid protects the face in transport Hang tab to keep it close on a belt loop, backpack or keychain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JIlpFuUWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9API2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 3.74}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9BFZO", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SE37-N Seal Team Elite Knife Partially Serrated Fixed Heat Treated 7-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SE37-N Seal Team Elite Knife Partially Serrated Fixed Heat Treated 7-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319OMO-CP3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9BFZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9BOF0", "title": "Benchmade Knife 550HG Griptilian Pardue Plain Edge Folding Knife with Hole Opener and Black Handle\".", "description": "The unmatched function of AXIS combined with the simplicity of a molded handle design- get a grip! It's a new species of knife. Safe. Reliable. Smooth. Affordable. Grip in two blade styles and two knife sizes. Griptilian performance is keenly unleashed with a simple thumb rotation, wither right or left handed, you choose. The hand settles naturally over the palm swelled shape and it's textured skin", "text": "Benchmade Knife 550HG Griptilian Pardue Plain Edge Folding Knife with Hole Opener and Black Handle\". The unmatched function of AXIS combined with the simplicity of a molded handle design- get a grip! It's a new species of knife. Safe. Reliable. Smooth. Affordable. Grip in two blade styles and two knife sizes. Griptilian performance is keenly unleashed with a simple thumb rotation, wither right or left handed, you choose. The hand settles naturally over the palm swelled shape and it's textured skin", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lVLltDx4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9BOF0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 72.95}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9BPM2", "title": "Marksman 3/8 Steel Shot, 75ct", "description": "Slingshot Hunting Shot", "text": "Marksman 3/8 Steel Shot, 75ct Slingshot Hunting Shot", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x8xOz8MmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9BPM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marksman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9C4AE", "title": "Tri-Angle Sharpmaker", "description": "The Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker includes two sets of high alumina ceramic stones: A pair of medium-grit (brown) 7\" x .5\" (178mm x 13mm) stones for aggressive sharpening and a set of fine (white) 7\" x .5\" (178mm x 13mm) stones for professional grade finishing. The stones are triangular for sharpening Plainedges on the flat sides and SpyderEdges (serrations) on the corners. A furrow running the length of each stone lets you sharpen pointed items like fishhooks, darts and awls. Included is a set of brass safety rods protecting the users hands while sharpening. All components snap into the self-contained ABS plastic base and lid -- ready to travel with you. Die-cut into the base are keyed slots and holes fitted for the stones. They accurately set the stone's sharpening angle at a 30 (15 each side) or 40 (20 each side) for knives and a 12.5 scissor setting. Turn the base over, a channel lets you lay two stones side-by-side (flat-side up) for use as a benchstone. The lid snaps halfway over the base creating a handhold for stability while you're sharpening. Included is a set of brass safety rods to protect the users hands while sharpening. Ceramic stones, like glass, will break if dropped -- handle carefully. Use them dry, without oil, water or lubricants. To clean: scrub stones with a plastic scouring pad and powered abrasive cleaner, let air-dry. Also autoclave safe. System comes with instruction book and DVD. 376544 , Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker , Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker , knife sharpener , whetstone", "text": "Tri-Angle Sharpmaker The Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker includes two sets of high alumina ceramic stones: A pair of medium-grit (brown) 7\" x .5\" (178mm x 13mm) stones for aggressive sharpening and a set of fine (white) 7\" x .5\" (178mm x 13mm) stones for professional grade finishing. The stones are triangular for sharpening Plainedges on the flat sides and SpyderEdges (serrations) on the corners. A furrow running the length of each stone lets you sharpen pointed items like fishhooks, darts and awls. Included is a set of brass safety rods protecting the users hands while sharpening. All components snap into the self-contained ABS plastic base and lid -- ready to travel with you. Die-cut into the base are keyed slots and holes fitted for the stones. They accurately set the stone's sharpening angle at a 30 (15 each side) or 40 (20 each side) for knives and a 12.5 scissor setting. Turn the base over, a channel lets you lay two stones side-by-side (flat-side up) for use as a benchstone. The lid snaps halfway over the base creating a handhold for stability while you're sharpening. Included is a set of brass safety rods to protect the users hands while sharpening. Ceramic stones, like glass, will break if dropped -- handle carefully. Use them dry, without oil, water or lubricants. To clean: scrub stones with a plastic scouring pad and powered abrasive cleaner, let air-dry. Also autoclave safe. System comes with instruction book and DVD. 376544 , Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker , Spyderco Tri-Angle Sharpmaker , knife sharpener , whetstone", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LEgBohLNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9C4AE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 56.68}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9C9B8", "title": "KA-BAR #1216 Hard Knife Sheath", "description": "Kydex Sheath Black", "text": "KA-BAR #1216 Hard Knife Sheath Kydex Sheath Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T-eCikaHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9C9B8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.64}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9CGUM", "title": "Bianchi Accumold 7406 Black Belt Keeper with Snap Closure (4 Pack)", "description": "Slim, compact; saves room on duty belt; Dual snap closure1\" web belt keeper with polymer key holder attached* Product can not be shipped outside of the United States", "text": "Bianchi Accumold 7406 Black Belt Keeper with Snap Closure (4 Pack) Slim, compact; saves room on duty belt; Dual snap closure1\" web belt keeper with polymer key holder attached* Product can not be shipped outside of the United States", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z7rgx9ZvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9CGUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi Accumold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.36}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9EN80", "title": "Cold Steel War Hammer Hickory Wood Handle", "description": "Weighing a little over 2 1/2\" lbs., our War Hammer is highly maneuverable and can be easily wielded with one or both hands. The head is drop forged out of 5150 steel and differentially heat treated . This means the point of the spike and enormous hammer face (11/2\" x 11/2\") are fully hardened so they can pierce and crush tough materials without failing while the rest of the hammer is left soft to absorb the shock of heavy blows. The handle of our War Hammer has been designed to be equally tough. Made of straight grain American Hickory and measuring 30\" long it provides tremendous leverage so enormously powerful blows may be struck. To protect the handle from assault by an opponent armed with an edged weapon we have included a pair of sturdy steel langets which can be attached below the head with the screws provided. (Some assembly is required. Instructions are included).", "text": "Cold Steel War Hammer Hickory Wood Handle Weighing a little over 2 1/2\" lbs., our War Hammer is highly maneuverable and can be easily wielded with one or both hands. The head is drop forged out of 5150 steel and differentially heat treated . This means the point of the spike and enormous hammer face (11/2\" x 11/2\") are fully hardened so they can pierce and crush tough materials without failing while the rest of the hammer is left soft to absorb the shock of heavy blows. The handle of our War Hammer has been designed to be equally tough. Made of straight grain American Hickory and measuring 30\" long it provides tremendous leverage so enormously powerful blows may be struck. To protect the handle from assault by an opponent armed with an edged weapon we have included a pair of sturdy steel langets which can be attached below the head with the screws provided. (Some assembly is required. Instructions are included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tFcJeNeDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9EN80.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 61.95}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9F2U8", "title": "Marksman 1/4 Steel Shot, 250ct", "description": "Slingshot Ammo Highest quality round steel shot flies best in all types of slingshots. Carded packages feature an cut off tip that makes a convenient, easy to pour spout.", "text": "Marksman 1/4 Steel Shot, 250ct Slingshot Ammo Highest quality round steel shot flies best in all types of slingshots. Carded packages feature an cut off tip that makes a convenient, easy to pour spout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418xx908p%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9F2U8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marksman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 5.58}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9F2US", "title": "Marksman 3330 Slingshot Band Replacement Kit", "description": "For Marksman 30.06, 3027, 3040, 3047, and 3061• Fits most tubular band slingshots with 1/4 (6.35mm)diameter yokes• Package includes one band with two vinyl yoke retainers.", "text": "Marksman 3330 Slingshot Band Replacement Kit For Marksman 30.06, 3027, 3040, 3047, and 3061• Fits most tubular band slingshots with 1/4 (6.35mm)diameter yokes• Package includes one band with two vinyl yoke retainers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xsjyqaXoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9F2US.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marksman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Slingshots"]], "price": 5.04}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9F7LM", "title": "Ontario 490 M9 Bayonet System (Green)", "description": "The Ontario Knife 490 M9 Bayonet and Scabbard in olive drab green is current issue to the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Textured thermoplastic nylon handle. Fits M16, M4 and AR-15. Includes M9 scabbard with quick release holster made of thermoplastic nylon that includes wire cutter and screwdriver.", "text": "Ontario 490 M9 Bayonet System (Green) The Ontario Knife 490 M9 Bayonet and Scabbard in olive drab green is current issue to the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Textured thermoplastic nylon handle. Fits M16, M4 and AR-15. Includes M9 scabbard with quick release holster made of thermoplastic nylon that includes wire cutter and screwdriver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cqT7TN1WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9F7LM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 90.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9GCTI", "title": "Cold Steel Katana, Ray Skin Handle, Wood Scabbard", "description": "The intricate, Japanese warrior-inspired detail work is impressive.Creative cutlery company Cold Steel's ever-popular Warrior Series swords are delicately-designed, durably-crafted blades with the same steel, heat treatment, and remarkably keened blades as the company's more expensive Emperor Series. Like the Emperor swords, they boast Samé-covered, cord-wrapped handles and quality fittings, and additionally come complete with a black lacquered scabbard and soft blue cover bag.Specifications29.25-inch 1055 carbon steel blade0.3125-inch blade thickness11.25-inch samé (ray skin) black braid cord handle with brass Menuki40.5-inch overall length41.4-ounce weightIncludes black lacquered wood scabbardWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.An ornate, black lacquered wood scabbard is also included.", "text": "Cold Steel Katana, Ray Skin Handle, Wood Scabbard The intricate, Japanese warrior-inspired detail work is impressive.Creative cutlery company Cold Steel's ever-popular Warrior Series swords are delicately-designed, durably-crafted blades with the same steel, heat treatment, and remarkably keened blades as the company's more expensive Emperor Series. Like the Emperor swords, they boast Samé-covered, cord-wrapped handles and quality fittings, and additionally come complete with a black lacquered scabbard and soft blue cover bag.Specifications29.25-inch 1055 carbon steel blade0.3125-inch blade thickness11.25-inch samé (ray skin) black braid cord handle with brass Menuki40.5-inch overall length41.4-ounce weightIncludes black lacquered wood scabbardWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.An ornate, black lacquered wood scabbard is also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3137EEIzYhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9GCTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 283.64}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9GD10", "title": "Cold Steel Scottish Dirk Sword", "description": "The Scottish Dirk that most knife enthusiasts are familiar with these days is, more or less, a piece of rubbish— a prop—a costume accessory for stage and screen. It’s declined into a “knife like object” that people hang above their mantles or on the walls of dimly lit, wood-paneled dens. Our version is a modern replica that harkens back to an earlier form, when the dirk was a functioning tool and weapon. The 13-Inch blade is forged to a hard spring temper from 1055 Carbon steel. It's 1 1/2-Inch wide and comes fully sharpened and battle-ready, prepared to hew down any foe.", "text": "Cold Steel Scottish Dirk Sword The Scottish Dirk that most knife enthusiasts are familiar with these days is, more or less, a piece of rubbish— a prop—a costume accessory for stage and screen. It’s declined into a “knife like object” that people hang above their mantles or on the walls of dimly lit, wood-paneled dens. Our version is a modern replica that harkens back to an earlier form, when the dirk was a functioning tool and weapon. The 13-Inch blade is forged to a hard spring temper from 1055 Carbon steel. It's 1 1/2-Inch wide and comes fully sharpened and battle-ready, prepared to hew down any foe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31620qfmVPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9GD10.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 107.35}}
{"item_id": "B000Q9GLLW", "title": "BLACKHAWK! 3", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! 3-Day Assault Back Pack is mid-sized, frameless backpack that features a detachable sternum strap and padded, removable waist belt for extreme versatility. The inside features a main compartment, small cargo pouch, and cargo pocket pouch to fit an optional 100 oz. BLACKHAWK! Hydration System. Features: Constructed of heavy-duty 1000 denier nylon; compatible with BLACKHAWK! Hydration System; sleeping bag straps and padded shoulder straps with D-rings for equipment attachment; detachable, elasticized sternum strap with silent release buckle; compartments are closed by durable YKK zipper and sliders with silent pulls; ventilating back panel and silent zipper pulls; dual side-detachable, padded waist belt; and a reinforced drag/carry handle. Main compartment: 20”L x 13”W x 6”D Front Compartment: 14.5”L x 12.5”W x 2.5”D Cubes: 2000 cu. in. / 37 L", "text": "BLACKHAWK! 3 The BLACKHAWK! 3-Day Assault Back Pack is mid-sized, frameless backpack that features a detachable sternum strap and padded, removable waist belt for extreme versatility. The inside features a main compartment, small cargo pouch, and cargo pocket pouch to fit an optional 100 oz. BLACKHAWK! Hydration System. Features: Constructed of heavy-duty 1000 denier nylon; compatible with BLACKHAWK! Hydration System; sleeping bag straps and padded shoulder straps with D-rings for equipment attachment; detachable, elasticized sternum strap with silent release buckle; compartments are closed by durable YKK zipper and sliders with silent pulls; ventilating back panel and silent zipper pulls; dual side-detachable, padded waist belt; and a reinforced drag/carry handle. Main compartment: 20”L x 13”W x 6”D Front Compartment: 14.5”L x 12.5”W x 2.5”D Cubes: 2000 cu. in. / 37 L", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513npMGxXCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Q9GLLW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 106.9}}
{"item_id": "B000QA9G2W", "title": "Benchmade 940 Osborne Design Knife", "description": "Whether in your pocket or your hand, the slender curvature and contouring of the 940 Osborne knife make it a perfect everyday carry. The 940 Osborne is equipped with a S30V premium stainless-steel blade with a modified reverse Tanto design. The green anodized aluminum handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand, with a stainless-steel liner and color-anodized titanium back spacer for longevity. Finally, the blade is a breeze to open thanks to the ambidextrous dual thumb stud opener. Other features include an Axis locking mechanism and a reversible steel pocket clip.SpecificationsBlade length: 3.4 inchesBlade thickness: 0.115 inchesHandle thickness: 0.410 inchesBlade material: S30V premium steelBlade hardness: 58-60 HRCBlade style: Modified reverse Tanto, ambidextrous dual thumb studsPocket clip: Black, reversible tip-upLock mechanism: AxisOverall length: 7.87 inchesClosed length: 4.47 inchesWeight: 2.9 ounces", "text": "Benchmade 940 Osborne Design Knife Whether in your pocket or your hand, the slender curvature and contouring of the 940 Osborne knife make it a perfect everyday carry. The 940 Osborne is equipped with a S30V premium stainless-steel blade with a modified reverse Tanto design. The green anodized aluminum handle, meanwhile, is comfortable in the hand, with a stainless-steel liner and color-anodized titanium back spacer for longevity. Finally, the blade is a breeze to open thanks to the ambidextrous dual thumb stud opener. Other features include an Axis locking mechanism and a reversible steel pocket clip.SpecificationsBlade length: 3.4 inchesBlade thickness: 0.115 inchesHandle thickness: 0.410 inchesBlade material: S30V premium steelBlade hardness: 58-60 HRCBlade style: Modified reverse Tanto, ambidextrous dual thumb studsPocket clip: Black, reversible tip-upLock mechanism: AxisOverall length: 7.87 inchesClosed length: 4.47 inchesWeight: 2.9 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R2lISQlJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QA9G2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 178.0}}
{"item_id": "B000QCJS0U", "title": "Extreme Condition Sun Hat STONE", "description": "ZIPPER POCKET FOR ICE OR KEY OR MONEYSTONE IN COLOR, THE MOST REQUESTED Extreme Condition Hat - UPF 45+ This ultimate outdoor activity hat features 4 panel low profile crown and UV protective fabric. Mesh panels and large screen metal eyelets promote air flow and moisture release. 3-1/2\" foam covered visor ensures floatation while 8-1/2\" veil protects neck and ears. Veil includes patented hidden zipper. Additional outdoor friendly features include terry sweatband, elastic cord with metal clip, Cool-Crown white mesh lining. Why the clip-- great for clipping to shirt in high winds, on boat, on a run, fishing etc. One size fits most adults. UPF 45+.", "text": "Extreme Condition Sun Hat STONE ZIPPER POCKET FOR ICE OR KEY OR MONEYSTONE IN COLOR, THE MOST REQUESTED Extreme Condition Hat - UPF 45+ This ultimate outdoor activity hat features 4 panel low profile crown and UV protective fabric. Mesh panels and large screen metal eyelets promote air flow and moisture release. 3-1/2\" foam covered visor ensures floatation while 8-1/2\" veil protects neck and ears. Veil includes patented hidden zipper. Additional outdoor friendly features include terry sweatband, elastic cord with metal clip, Cool-Crown white mesh lining. Why the clip-- great for clipping to shirt in high winds, on boat, on a run, fishing etc. One size fits most adults. UPF 45+.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x2P5yeHBL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QCJS0U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 15.25}}
{"item_id": "B000QCLY8E", "title": "Sheath - Molle Universal Blk Nyl", "description": "This black, nylon MOLLE universal sheath from Leatherman (model LP250) features snap webbing strap for attachment on backside. It features a hook-and-loop front closure and an internal panel to store bits. It's compatible with 4.5-inch tools, including Super Tool 300, Skeletool, Skeletool CX, Charge AL, Charge ALX, Charge TTi, Crunch, Surge, Wave, Blast, Fuse, Kick, Wave, Charge Ti, Charge XTi, and Super Tool 200.", "text": "Sheath - Molle Universal Blk Nyl This black, nylon MOLLE universal sheath from Leatherman (model LP250) features snap webbing strap for attachment on backside. It features a hook-and-loop front closure and an internal panel to store bits. It's compatible with 4.5-inch tools, including Super Tool 300, Skeletool, Skeletool CX, Charge AL, Charge ALX, Charge TTi, Crunch, Surge, Wave, Blast, Fuse, Kick, Wave, Charge Ti, Charge XTi, and Super Tool 200.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o5RfaFCLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QCLY8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 11.41}}
{"item_id": "B000QDD66Q", "title": "Tenn Mens Bib Front Cycling Shorts with Pad - Black", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Manufactured in heavy duty Spandex/Nylon these bib shorts for men have been technically designed for serious cyclists. The professional construction allows the shorts plenty of curvature, for better performance and comfort. Anatomically designed with a flat foam pad for comfort at an affordable price. A perfect blend of high density fibres ensures that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. The high performance, high density, low-sheen finish fabric supports you in all the right places. Flat stitched seams to avoid chafing and a special mesh back construction for optimum air circulation. Leg grippers prevent garment ride-up whilst exercising. These bib shorts are available in 5 colours/styles and various sizes.", "text": "Tenn Mens Bib Front Cycling Shorts with Pad - Black Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Manufactured in heavy duty Spandex/Nylon these bib shorts for men have been technically designed for serious cyclists. The professional construction allows the shorts plenty of curvature, for better performance and comfort. Anatomically designed with a flat foam pad for comfort at an affordable price. A perfect blend of high density fibres ensures that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. The high performance, high density, low-sheen finish fabric supports you in all the right places. Flat stitched seams to avoid chafing and a special mesh back construction for optimum air circulation. Leg grippers prevent garment ride-up whilst exercising. These bib shorts are available in 5 colours/styles and various sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m%2B9rJ2xLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QDD66Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QDD6D4", "title": "Tenn Coolflo High-Wicking Mens Short Sleeve Cycle Cycling Jersey", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our short sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from a high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a non-slip Vislon zip and rubber waist grippers. Three elasticated rear pockets including a mobile phone holder, provide the wearer with ample storage options.These are not ‘second skin’ jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and a selection of colours.", "text": "Tenn Coolflo High-Wicking Mens Short Sleeve Cycle Cycling Jersey Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our short sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from a high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a non-slip Vislon zip and rubber waist grippers. Three elasticated rear pockets including a mobile phone holder, provide the wearer with ample storage options.These are not ‘second skin’ jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and a selection of colours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AdcpX3kOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QDD6D4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B000QDF9O8", "title": "Mens Coolflo Breathable Cycling Jersey Long Sleeve", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our Long sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from a superior quality high-wicking and technically advanced fabric yarn to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a non-slip Vislon zip and superior silicone waist grippers. Three elasticated rear pockets including a mobile phone holder, provide the wearer with ample storage options. These are not second skin jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.", "text": "Mens Coolflo Breathable Cycling Jersey Long Sleeve Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our Long sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from a superior quality high-wicking and technically advanced fabric yarn to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a non-slip Vislon zip and superior silicone waist grippers. Three elasticated rear pockets including a mobile phone holder, provide the wearer with ample storage options. These are not second skin jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kJpjiQ-fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QDF9O8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
