{"item_id": "B000QFMX7M", "title": "SealLine Storm Sack 10-Liter Dry Bag", "description": "Our lightest, most versatile dry bag is now available in three new larger sizes: The 25L and 35L sizes are designed to accommodate a mattress or tent, while the oval-bottom 60L size is ideal for organizing and protecting gear inside a backpack. Regardless of size, all Storm Sacks feature a roll-top closure and sewn and taped construction to ensure watertightness, as well as PVC-free 210D PU-coated nylon that is long-lasting and .", "text": "SealLine Storm Sack 10-Liter Dry Bag Our lightest, most versatile dry bag is now available in three new larger sizes: The 25L and 35L sizes are designed to accommodate a mattress or tent, while the oval-bottom 60L size is ideal for organizing and protecting gear inside a backpack. Regardless of size, all Storm Sacks feature a roll-top closure and sewn and taped construction to ensure watertightness, as well as PVC-free 210D PU-coated nylon that is long-lasting and .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xiVag5uhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QFMX7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SealLine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]], "price": 17.95}}
