{"item_id": "B000QFMYCQ", "title": "Nirve Super Age Hanger Cruiser Bicycle Handlebar (Chrome, 26-Inch Frames)", "description": "Nirve Super Age Hanger Cruiser Bicycle Handlebar (Chrome, 26-Inch Frames) features straight Apehanger Cruiser handlebar. Includes a black cruiser bicycle handlebar. Straight upright sections for heads up riding position.", "text": "Nirve Super Age Hanger Cruiser Bicycle Handlebar (Chrome, 26-Inch Frames) Nirve Super Age Hanger Cruiser Bicycle Handlebar (Chrome, 26-Inch Frames) features straight Apehanger Cruiser handlebar. Includes a black cruiser bicycle handlebar. Straight upright sections for heads up riding position.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T2b9A-pmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QFMYCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]]}}
