{"item_id": "B000QGKHA6", "title": "Bohning Platinum Fletch Tite 3/4oz", "description": "Bonds feathers and vanes to all type of shafts. Wood, Carbon and Fiberglass. 3/4 oz. size.", "text": "Bohning Platinum Fletch Tite 3/4oz Bonds feathers and vanes to all type of shafts. Wood, Carbon and Fiberglass. 3/4 oz. size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416-dRI5iXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QGKHA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bohning Co Ltd", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 3.38}}
{"item_id": "B000QGMMWM", "title": "Outdoor Research Accessory Straps (Dark Grey, 48-Inch)", "description": "These straps allow you to cinch extra gear to the outside of your pack with ease. They are made of three-quarter inch nylon webbing with a durable tension lock. The straps are sold in pairs.", "text": "Outdoor Research Accessory Straps (Dark Grey, 48-Inch) These straps allow you to cinch extra gear to the outside of your pack with ease. They are made of three-quarter inch nylon webbing with a durable tension lock. The straps are sold in pairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zsu8qBZ3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QGMMWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QHFDEA", "title": "Deuter ACT Lite 65+10 Backpack", "description": "These athletic, sleek packs remain true to their lightweight credentials: with their minimal weight and purist, technical look, the ACT Lite models are good-looking, light, yet reliable companions on any tour. Twin lid buckles and a stretch front compartment provide more options to store all your kit. Front gear loops also mean you can easily attach a sleeping mat to the outside. The slimline body of the pack and the compact hip belt allow plenty of freedom of movement when trekking or mountaineering", "text": "Deuter ACT Lite 65+10 Backpack These athletic, sleek packs remain true to their lightweight credentials: with their minimal weight and purist, technical look, the ACT Lite models are good-looking, light, yet reliable companions on any tour. Twin lid buckles and a stretch front compartment provide more options to store all your kit. Front gear loops also mean you can easily attach a sleeping mat to the outside. The slimline body of the pack and the compact hip belt allow plenty of freedom of movement when trekking or mountaineering", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4148%2B8Y0EwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QHFDEA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QI2VOY", "title": "Tenn Cycling Gloves Mitts", "description": "Designed to help keep you on the bike for longer, our mitts feature a padded palm made from a combination of gel and foam.The back of the hand is constructed with a 2 way stretch fabric for ultimate flexibility and features a cotton towelling thumb for when things get a little sweaty!A velcro closure and finger loops allow you to slip them on and off with ease, whilst a Neoprene wrist ensures comfort and increased strength for the glove.Available in a wide range of colours allowing you to coordinate with your bike and kit, or to give you a good excuse to increase the size of your cycling wardrobe. Ideally suited for road cycling, triathlon training, XC or even weights session at the gym!Available in a wide range of sizes in men's and women's specific cuts.", "text": "Tenn Cycling Gloves Mitts Designed to help keep you on the bike for longer, our mitts feature a padded palm made from a combination of gel and foam.The back of the hand is constructed with a 2 way stretch fabric for ultimate flexibility and features a cotton towelling thumb for when things get a little sweaty!A velcro closure and finger loops allow you to slip them on and off with ease, whilst a Neoprene wrist ensures comfort and increased strength for the glove.Available in a wide range of colours allowing you to coordinate with your bike and kit, or to give you a good excuse to increase the size of your cycling wardrobe. Ideally suited for road cycling, triathlon training, XC or even weights session at the gym!Available in a wide range of sizes in men's and women's specific cuts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XqjGslxUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QI2VOY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QIOJ58", "title": "Stretch Out Strap with Instructional Poster", "description": "72\" long strap with 10 loops to grab or use for foot placement. Stretches included are: Hamstring x 4 Hamstring & Lower Back Calf & Hamstring Calf, Hamstring & Lower Back Quadriceps Quadriceps & Hip Flexors Outer Thigh Outer Thigh, Side & Triceps Calf Inner Thigh x 3 Inner Thigh & Low Back Triceps Front of Shoulder Triceps & Side Triceps & Biceps . Shipping is each.", "text": "Stretch Out Strap with Instructional Poster 72\" long strap with 10 loops to grab or use for foot placement. Stretches included are: Hamstring x 4 Hamstring & Lower Back Calf & Hamstring Calf, Hamstring & Lower Back Quadriceps Quadriceps & Hip Flexors Outer Thigh Outer Thigh, Side & Triceps Calf Inner Thigh x 3 Inner Thigh & Low Back Triceps Front of Shoulder Triceps & Side Triceps & Biceps . Shipping is each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z4k1J3S-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QIOJ58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OPTP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Straps"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B000QJ8BV0", "title": "Hollywood Racks E3 Express 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "Featuring a user-friendly hub adjustment system for a perfect fit on nearly any type of vehicle, the E3 Express Trunk Mount Rack is ideal for transporting up to three bikes for weekend biking adventures. Bike separators with rubber straps allow for easy mounting while also keeping the bikes secures on the rack. The E3 comes fully assembled and folds flat for easy storage when not in use.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "text": "Hollywood Racks E3 Express 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack Featuring a user-friendly hub adjustment system for a perfect fit on nearly any type of vehicle, the E3 Express Trunk Mount Rack is ideal for transporting up to three bikes for weekend biking adventures. Bike separators with rubber straps allow for easy mounting while also keeping the bikes secures on the rack. The E3 comes fully assembled and folds flat for easy storage when not in use.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419xjcdlmQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJ8BV0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 69.29}}
{"item_id": "B000QJ8BW4", "title": "Hollywood Racks F1B The Original 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "REVIEW:Designed in 1973, The F1B 3-Bike Rack from Hollywood Racks is the original fully pre-assembled and foldable trunk rack that works on most sedans, vans, and SUVs. Featuring multi-position hinges, this classic design offers a versatile fit for most vehicles with a high-quality build backed by a lifetime warranty. Equipped with an integrated tie-down strap for extra security, the F1B Rack holds up to three bikes with generous 14.5-inch spacing in between to prevent bike-on-bike damage. The economically priced rack folds flat for storage.Specifications:Carries up to three bikesFits most vehiclesEasy to use multi-position hingesComes fully pre-assembledFolds flat for easy storageIntegrated tie-down strap for extra securityDistance between bike support arms: 14.5 inches", "text": "Hollywood Racks F1B The Original 3-Bike Trunk Mount Rack REVIEW:Designed in 1973, The F1B 3-Bike Rack from Hollywood Racks is the original fully pre-assembled and foldable trunk rack that works on most sedans, vans, and SUVs. Featuring multi-position hinges, this classic design offers a versatile fit for most vehicles with a high-quality build backed by a lifetime warranty. Equipped with an integrated tie-down strap for extra security, the F1B Rack holds up to three bikes with generous 14.5-inch spacing in between to prevent bike-on-bike damage. The economically priced rack folds flat for storage.Specifications:Carries up to three bikesFits most vehiclesEasy to use multi-position hingesComes fully pre-assembledFolds flat for easy storageIntegrated tie-down strap for extra securityDistance between bike support arms: 14.5 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412HUwpB8rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJ8BW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 76.49}}
{"item_id": "B000QJ8C3W", "title": "Hollywood Racks HR1000 Sport Rider 2-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (1.25 and 2-Inch Receiver)", "description": "Hollywood Racks HR1000 Sport Rider 2-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (1.25 and 2-Inch Receiver).", "text": "Hollywood Racks HR1000 Sport Rider 2-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (1.25 and 2-Inch Receiver) Hollywood Racks HR1000 Sport Rider 2-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (1.25 and 2-Inch Receiver).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416Jm3uDllL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJ8C3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 238.49}}
{"item_id": "B000QJ8CW8", "title": "Hollywood Racks HR8000 Traveler 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver)", "description": "Designed for two-inch hitches, the HR8000 Traveler Hitch Mount Rack from Hollywood Racks allows you to carry up to four bikes securely on your vehicle--at a reasonable price-point. The HR8000 offers heavy-duty construction with a weight capacity of up to 35 pounds per bike. The rack's \"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin prevents rack sway even with heavy loads. Meanwhile, the four bikes are held securely in rubber cradles with integrated anti-sway stabilizers and an integrated tie-down strap for additional security. A welded \"lock-point\" allows you to attach a security cable to the bikes and lock them on the rack (cable sold separately). Built for ease of use, both with and without bikes loaded, the rack tilts down for easy cargo access, and the arms fold down when the rack is not in use. Made to last, the HR8000 Traveler Rack carries a limited lifetime warranty from Hollywood Racks.Specifications:Durable rubber bike cradles with integrated anti-sway stabilizersHeavy duty construction\"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin (1/2-13) prevents rack swayRack tilts for cargo accessArms fold when the rack is not in use,Integrated tie-down strap for extra bike tie down securityWelded \"lock-point\" for optional anti-theft security cableMax weight capacity: 35 pounds per bikeLimited lifetime warranty", "text": "Hollywood Racks HR8000 Traveler 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver) Designed for two-inch hitches, the HR8000 Traveler Hitch Mount Rack from Hollywood Racks allows you to carry up to four bikes securely on your vehicle--at a reasonable price-point. The HR8000 offers heavy-duty construction with a weight capacity of up to 35 pounds per bike. The rack's \"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin prevents rack sway even with heavy loads. Meanwhile, the four bikes are held securely in rubber cradles with integrated anti-sway stabilizers and an integrated tie-down strap for additional security. A welded \"lock-point\" allows you to attach a security cable to the bikes and lock them on the rack (cable sold separately). Built for ease of use, both with and without bikes loaded, the rack tilts down for easy cargo access, and the arms fold down when the rack is not in use. Made to last, the HR8000 Traveler Rack carries a limited lifetime warranty from Hollywood Racks.Specifications:Durable rubber bike cradles with integrated anti-sway stabilizersHeavy duty construction\"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin (1/2-13) prevents rack swayRack tilts for cargo accessArms fold when the rack is not in use,Integrated tie-down strap for extra bike tie down securityWelded \"lock-point\" for optional anti-theft security cableMax weight capacity: 35 pounds per bikeLimited lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N7THOdXwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJ8CW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 179.96}}
{"item_id": "B000QJ8D8G", "title": "Hollywood Racks Boomer Bar Womens or Dual Suspension Bike Rack Frame Adapter", "description": "Designed to adapt women's and non-traditional bike frames to be carried on hitch racks, the Boomer Bar from Hollywood racks creates a stable top tube that can be held by the hitch rack cradles. The Boomer Bar attaches to the handlebar stem and seat post with padded attachment loops that won't damage your bike's frame. Thanks to an adjustable length, the Boomer Bar will fit most bikes, and thanks to a sturdy, smart design you can carry all your bikes easily and worry free.", "text": "Hollywood Racks Boomer Bar Womens or Dual Suspension Bike Rack Frame Adapter Designed to adapt women's and non-traditional bike frames to be carried on hitch racks, the Boomer Bar from Hollywood racks creates a stable top tube that can be held by the hitch rack cradles. The Boomer Bar attaches to the handlebar stem and seat post with padded attachment loops that won't damage your bike's frame. Thanks to an adjustable length, the Boomer Bar will fit most bikes, and thanks to a sturdy, smart design you can carry all your bikes easily and worry free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wfIK0tS4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJ8D8G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QJAFIM", "title": "Hollywood Racks B2 Baja 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack", "description": "Features quick release adjustment hubs and six attachment straps", "text": "Hollywood Racks B2 Baja 2-Bike Trunk Mount Rack Features quick release adjustment hubs and six attachment straps", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uasRL4vzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJAFIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 89.96}}
{"item_id": "B000QJC4AY", "title": "Hollywood Racks HR1400 Sport Rider SE 4-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver)", "description": "This heavy-duty platform-style rack is designed as a 2 + 2 system so it can be easily converted to hold either two bicycles or four bicycles. It mounts on a 2-inch hitch and folds flat against the back of a vehicle when not in use. The rack uses padded universal top clamps and adjustable wheel holders. Bikes need simply to be dropped into the wheel holders and clamps slid down onto the frames. Velcro wheel straps add security. To prevent rack sway, the hitch system is \"no-wobble/no-tools\" and includes a locking pin and 9-foot security cable. The rack carries a limited warranty against defects.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "text": "Hollywood Racks HR1400 Sport Rider SE 4-Bike Platform Style Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver) This heavy-duty platform-style rack is designed as a 2 + 2 system so it can be easily converted to hold either two bicycles or four bicycles. It mounts on a 2-inch hitch and folds flat against the back of a vehicle when not in use. The rack uses padded universal top clamps and adjustable wheel holders. Bikes need simply to be dropped into the wheel holders and clamps slid down onto the frames. Velcro wheel straps add security. To prevent rack sway, the hitch system is \"no-wobble/no-tools\" and includes a locking pin and 9-foot security cable. The rack carries a limited warranty against defects.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w6OMGvaLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJC4AY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 399.59}}
{"item_id": "B000QJC5F8", "title": "Hollywood Racks T970 Fork Block 1 Bicycle Fork Mount", "description": "This one-bicycle fork block allows a bicyclist to securely transport a bike in a van or in a truck or to securely store a bike just about anywhere, including on a wall. It has a 9-mm skewer that firmly grips a bike's fork and a heavy-duty base that bolts to any solid surface.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "text": "Hollywood Racks T970 Fork Block 1 Bicycle Fork Mount This one-bicycle fork block allows a bicyclist to securely transport a bike in a van or in a truck or to securely store a bike just about anywhere, including on a wall. It has a 9-mm skewer that firmly grips a bike's fork and a heavy-duty base that bolts to any solid surface.About Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when they began making trunk racks in the back of our bike shop in Hollywood, CA. As a retailer, the company knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. They earned a great reputation fast and began selling racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, Hollywood Racks builds racks the only way they know how: simple, strong, and secure.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials including high-strength steel, aircraft-quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of their products are fully covered with a limited warranty. The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jGfT-kP7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJC5F8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 22.09}}
{"item_id": "B000QJDFMK", "title": "Hollywood Racks SR1 Spare Tire Rack 2-Bike Spare Tire Mount Rack", "description": "Installs securely over the vehicle's spare tire", "text": "Hollywood Racks SR1 Spare Tire Rack 2-Bike Spare Tire Mount Rack Installs securely over the vehicle's spare tire", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OywVgoVAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJDFMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 134.99}}
{"item_id": "B000QJFKIM", "title": "Coghlans 8607 Fire Paste", "description": "Coghlan's Fire Paste for quick fire-starting without flareup or splashing. Useful for starting campfires, fireplaces, barbecues, and for priming stoves in cold weather. Odorless and tasteless the fire paste is not affected by heat or cold.", "text": "Coghlans 8607 Fire Paste Coghlan's Fire Paste for quick fire-starting without flareup or splashing. Useful for starting campfires, fireplaces, barbecues, and for priming stoves in cold weather. Odorless and tasteless the fire paste is not affected by heat or cold.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eUYOYNhyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QJFKIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 5.94}}
{"item_id": "B000QRAXSG", "title": "Combat Source Kill Max Roach Killing Gel, 60 Grams", "description": "Combat Source Kill max roach gel formula contains both water and food that roaches need. This product works on both small and large roaches and starts killing in hours! This gel can be applied behind appliances and in cracks and crevices, near the places where roaches make their nests or enter your home. Combat Source Kill max gel allows you to place bait in many locations in your home, making it easier for more roaches to find and eat the bait, resulting in a quicker and more thorough kill.", "text": "Combat Source Kill Max Roach Killing Gel, 60 Grams Combat Source Kill max roach gel formula contains both water and food that roaches need. This product works on both small and large roaches and starts killing in hours! This gel can be applied behind appliances and in cracks and crevices, near the places where roaches make their nests or enter your home. Combat Source Kill max gel allows you to place bait in many locations in your home, making it easier for more roaches to find and eat the bait, resulting in a quicker and more thorough kill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q8kzwTrjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QRAXSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 8.85}}
{"item_id": "B000QRMR1M", "title": "Wiley X SG-1 Goggles, Smoke Grey/Clear, V Cut/Matte Black", "description": "The SG-1 Goggles fit head sizes: Medium-X Large. This model comes with Smoke Grey/Clear lenses. Smoke Grey lenses provide maximum glare reduction without distorting colors. They are excellent in bright/glare conditions. Light transmission: 15%. Clear lenses provide maximum light transmission in hazy or overcast, dusk/dawn conditions. Light transmission: 90%. The Wiley-X SG-1 Goggles include 2 lens package (Smoke Grey/Clear), zipper top nylon case, temples (arms), elastic strap and leash cord.", "text": "Wiley X SG-1 Goggles, Smoke Grey/Clear, V Cut/Matte Black The SG-1 Goggles fit head sizes: Medium-X Large. This model comes with Smoke Grey/Clear lenses. Smoke Grey lenses provide maximum glare reduction without distorting colors. They are excellent in bright/glare conditions. Light transmission: 15%. Clear lenses provide maximum light transmission in hazy or overcast, dusk/dawn conditions. Light transmission: 90%. The Wiley-X SG-1 Goggles include 2 lens package (Smoke Grey/Clear), zipper top nylon case, temples (arms), elastic strap and leash cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414VFhIfmhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QRMR1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wiley X", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 82.99}}
{"item_id": "B000QRMUHI", "title": "Sunlite F-2 Trainer", "description": "Bring your bike inside on the long winter days, hot summer days and those washout rainy days. The Forza trainer gives you the ability to ride your personal bike in a climate controlled environment in the exact same riding position you would be in out on the road or trail!", "text": "Sunlite F-2 Trainer Bring your bike inside on the long winter days, hot summer days and those washout rainy days. The Forza trainer gives you the ability to ride your personal bike in a climate controlled environment in the exact same riding position you would be in out on the road or trail!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hiGstwmML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QRMUHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Forza", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 91.75}}
{"item_id": "B000QSUVIC", "title": "Shimano UN54 Bottom Bracket", "description": "A good quality bottom bracket for traditional chainsets. Super-accurate bearings for smooth operation and improved durability. Durable, hard-wearing sealed cartridge bottom bracket with square tapered spindle fitting. Lightweight hollow spindle. Maintenance-free sealed cartridge bearing assembly keeps out dirt, mud, and water for long bearing life. Fast and easy installation without adjustment. Narrow body allows clearance for cable routing under the bottom bracket.", "text": "Shimano UN54 Bottom Bracket A good quality bottom bracket for traditional chainsets. Super-accurate bearings for smooth operation and improved durability. Durable, hard-wearing sealed cartridge bottom bracket with square tapered spindle fitting. Lightweight hollow spindle. Maintenance-free sealed cartridge bearing assembly keeps out dirt, mud, and water for long bearing life. Fast and easy installation without adjustment. Narrow body allows clearance for cable routing under the bottom bracket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cpuiWShSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSUVIC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Bottom Brackets"]], "price": 26.98}}
{"item_id": "B000QSUWBI", "title": "Rock' N' Roll Absolute Dry Chain Lube, 16oz. Bottle", "description": "The formulation goes deep down into the chain and traps any dirt. Then, with the energy of the chain freewheeling backwards, the dirt and grit floats to the surface so you can wipe it all off, leaving a new and clean application of lube inside the chain where it's needed. The lube inside the chain creates a protective membrane to seal out dirt and moisture from the moving parts of the chain.", "text": "Rock' N' Roll Absolute Dry Chain Lube, 16oz. Bottle The formulation goes deep down into the chain and traps any dirt. Then, with the energy of the chain freewheeling backwards, the dirt and grit floats to the surface so you can wipe it all off, leaving a new and clean application of lube inside the chain where it's needed. The lube inside the chain creates a protective membrane to seal out dirt and moisture from the moving parts of the chain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JBcwVquzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSUWBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rock N Roll", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B000QSVK1E", "title": "Universal Pistol Mount Red Laser Sight 3 Lithium Batteries Included", "description": "Aim feature most affordable universal pistol laser sight for any kind pistol. 500 yds. max. LASER dot POWER, with a universal trigger guardpistol mount! And it's as affordable as all get-out. Has a sturdy aluminum body, and on / off switch operation. Ready to go, with Allen wrenches and 3 lithium batteries included. Adjustable trigger mount with shims to fit it to just about any gun. 2 1/4\" long, weighs 4 ozs.", "text": "Universal Pistol Mount Red Laser Sight 3 Lithium Batteries Included Aim feature most affordable universal pistol laser sight for any kind pistol. 500 yds. max. LASER dot POWER, with a universal trigger guardpistol mount! And it's as affordable as all get-out. Has a sturdy aluminum body, and on / off switch operation. Ready to go, with Allen wrenches and 3 lithium batteries included. Adjustable trigger mount with shims to fit it to just about any gun. 2 1/4\" long, weighs 4 ozs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P9NbcVHHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSVK1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 16.25}}
{"item_id": "B000QSWAUO", "title": "Ritchey Snap-On Bicycle Rim Tape - Pair", "description": "New design offers secure, snug fit to rim. New coating resist \"creeping\" on the rim. Will not dimple into spoke holes, even at high pressure.", "text": "Ritchey Snap-On Bicycle Rim Tape - Pair New design offers secure, snug fit to rim. New coating resist \"creeping\" on the rim. Will not dimple into spoke holes, even at high pressure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ynMRSzDiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSWAUO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000QSXMME", "title": "Planet Bike Blinky Safety 1-Led Bicycle Light Set", "description": "Notify drivers and other cyclists of your presence from up to 1 mile away with the Planet Bike Blinky safety set. Equipped with one super-bright white LED for the front and a red LED for the back, the safety set provides 220 degrees of visibility in both flashing and steady modes, depending on your preference. Even better, the Blinky lights clip to just about anything--from handlebars to panniers--with handlebar brackets, a seat post mount, and a seat stay mount to get you started. As a result, you have no excuse to go unseen while riding. Each Blinky light, which comes with an ultra-compact weatherproof case, runs for up to 100 hours on a single CR2032 watch battery (included). The set is also backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "text": "Planet Bike Blinky Safety 1-Led Bicycle Light Set Notify drivers and other cyclists of your presence from up to 1 mile away with the Planet Bike Blinky safety set. Equipped with one super-bright white LED for the front and a red LED for the back, the safety set provides 220 degrees of visibility in both flashing and steady modes, depending on your preference. Even better, the Blinky lights clip to just about anything--from handlebars to panniers--with handlebar brackets, a seat post mount, and a seat stay mount to get you started. As a result, you have no excuse to go unseen while riding. Each Blinky light, which comes with an ultra-compact weatherproof case, runs for up to 100 hours on a single CR2032 watch battery (included). The set is also backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kBGFPtVEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSXMME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 14.25}}
{"item_id": "B000QSXO9U", "title": "Planet Bike Protege 9.0 Wireless 9-Function Bike Computer with 4-Line Display and Temperature", "description": "Ideal for training, touring, or keeping track of your car-free miles, the Planet Bike Protege 9.0 wireless bike computer gives you all the information you need while cycling. The Protege 9.0 tracks such details as current speed, comparative speed, ride time, trip distance, average speed, and maximum speed, while also offering a dual odometer (for two wheel sizes), a clock, and a thermometer. Riders can easily switch follow all the data points thanks to the four-line MacroMonitor LCD display, which shows up to five pieces of data at a glance. Finally, the computer is remarkably lightweight at 0.12 pounds, so it won't slow you down on the track or the trail. Other details include a magnet that fits up to 4 mm bladed spokes, an 82 cm wire mounting kit for the front wheel, and a 1.57-by-1.85-inch case. The nine-function bike computer, which fits 25 to 31.8 mm handlebars, is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "text": "Planet Bike Protege 9.0 Wireless 9-Function Bike Computer with 4-Line Display and Temperature Ideal for training, touring, or keeping track of your car-free miles, the Planet Bike Protege 9.0 wireless bike computer gives you all the information you need while cycling. The Protege 9.0 tracks such details as current speed, comparative speed, ride time, trip distance, average speed, and maximum speed, while also offering a dual odometer (for two wheel sizes), a clock, and a thermometer. Riders can easily switch follow all the data points thanks to the four-line MacroMonitor LCD display, which shows up to five pieces of data at a glance. Finally, the computer is remarkably lightweight at 0.12 pounds, so it won't slow you down on the track or the trail. Other details include a magnet that fits up to 4 mm bladed spokes, an 82 cm wire mounting kit for the front wheel, and a 1.57-by-1.85-inch case. The nine-function bike computer, which fits 25 to 31.8 mm handlebars, is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.About Planet BikeIn November of 1996, Planet Bike was founded in Madison, Wisconsin. In many ways, Planet Bike began as a social experiment that dedicated itself to doing business in a different way. Instead of being just another company that develops and sells products with profit as its end goal, Planet Bike wanted to help bring about positive change for people, their communities, and the environment.Despite being a simple machine, the people at Planet Bike have always believed that the bicycle has great potential to help improve the world and the lives of the people in it. From the start, they have embraced an alternative corporate purpose which seeks to help get more people on bicycles by making communities friendlier places for the self-propelled. By donating 25% of company profits to causes that promote and facilitate bicycle usage, Planet Bike hopes to make an impact.Social experiments aside, Planet Bike was born from the heart of a cyclist with a goal of making innovative, high quality, and practical bicycle accessories. Simply put, they strive to design and develop the best bicycle products in the world. In the company's short ten year history, they have made important product innovations within the bicycle industry. Advancements include the 4-line computer which is now a standard in the industry and the world's first self-contained HID light. Not bad for a company that ten years ago started as a one man operation. Today, while still a small company, Planet Bike continues to evolve and improve their product line with the goal of always striving to build accessories that make it easier for people to ride their bikes. Since 1996, Planet Bike's financial support of the grassroots bicycle movement has totaled $500,000. By 2010, they have made a goal to donate $1 million to organizations that are dedicated to making America a friendlier place for cyclists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aeJG%2BpZIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSXO9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 52.24}}
{"item_id": "B000QSXPL2", "title": "Park Tool HBH-2 Handle Bar Holder", "description": "The Handlebar Holder is designed to prevent the handlebars and front wheel from rotating when a bike is mounted in a Park Tool Repair Stand. Updated to fit handlebars up to 32mm and oversized top tubes up to 50mm, the HBH-2 works on almost any road or mountain bike.", "text": "Park Tool HBH-2 Handle Bar Holder The Handlebar Holder is designed to prevent the handlebars and front wheel from rotating when a bike is mounted in a Park Tool Repair Stand. Updated to fit handlebars up to 32mm and oversized top tubes up to 50mm, the HBH-2 works on almost any road or mountain bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NqfFEbsRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QSXPL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 17.54}}
{"item_id": "B000QT1KR2", "title": "Planet Bike Cascadia Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Mud Flaps", "description": "Commuting on your road bike is a blast youre faster, more agile, and, well, prettier. Just one problem when it rains, you end up looking like a drowned skunk. Bolt on the Planet Bike Cascadia Road Fender and say goodbye to rodent-comparisons.Product FeaturesMaterial: [Fender] polished aluminum bonded to weatherproof polycarbonate; [Hardware] stainless steelCompatibility: Road tires up to 700c x 28mmWeight:Recommended Use: Commuting, road biking in wet weatherManufacturer Warranty: Lifetime", "text": "Planet Bike Cascadia Front and Rear Bicycle Fender Set with Mud Flaps Commuting on your road bike is a blast youre faster, more agile, and, well, prettier. Just one problem when it rains, you end up looking like a drowned skunk. Bolt on the Planet Bike Cascadia Road Fender and say goodbye to rodent-comparisons.Product FeaturesMaterial: [Fender] polished aluminum bonded to weatherproof polycarbonate; [Hardware] stainless steelCompatibility: Road tires up to 700c x 28mmWeight:Recommended Use: Commuting, road biking in wet weatherManufacturer Warranty: Lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Pc069Lp3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QT1KR2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 52.25}}
{"item_id": "B000QU377W", "title": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Non-Suspension Comfort Saddle, Comfort Select, Tri-color", "description": "Sunlite Cloud 9 Comfort Select seat. Multi-stage select gel foam. Vented anatomic relief system. Heavy-duty tri-color emerald top. Steel wire rail system. Pillar style clamp included. Seat is approx. 10-1/2\" long x 8\" wide.", "text": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Non-Suspension Comfort Saddle, Comfort Select, Tri-color Sunlite Cloud 9 Comfort Select seat. Multi-stage select gel foam. Vented anatomic relief system. Heavy-duty tri-color emerald top. Steel wire rail system. Pillar style clamp included. Seat is approx. 10-1/2\" long x 8\" wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OrxCiucbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000QU377W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 23.25}}
