{"item_id": "B000R11G2I", "title": "Body-Solid Powerline Flat/Incline/Decline Folding Bench", "description": "Multi-purpose incline and decline bench perfect for barbell and dumbbell training Comes fully assembled and ready for immediate use; simply take it out of the box to get started 7 easy-to-adjust positions offer flexibility, comfort, and a workout that's tailored to your needs Transport wheels let you easily move the bench from location to location Compact design easily fits in smaller spaces Easy to mount and dismount Folds for easy storage In use dimensions: 57L x 16W x 18 inches Folded dimensions: 57L x 16W x 9 inches Weight: 57 pounds Manufacturer's warranty included: see complete details in the Product Guarantee area About Body-Solid Body-Solid has been making high quality strength training and exercise equipment for over 20 years. Designed for today's workouts, Body-Solid machines feature innovative technology and distinctive styling that suits your home. Body-Solid equipment meets the challenges of today's busy lifestyle while providing you with the utmost in advanced home exercise. From space-saving designs that suit any room, to full-sized gym systems with every available station, Body-Solid gives you the features you want at a price you can afford. All components of all machines are covered by a lifetime manufacturer's warranty; something you won't find from any other manufacturer in the industry. Ideal for barbell and dumbbell training. 7 positions for a tailored and comfortable workout/li>Portable, foldable, and compact. Incline and decline positions. Assembled dimensions: 57L x 16W x 18 inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Body-Solid Powerline Flat/Incline/Decline Folding Bench Multi-purpose incline and decline bench perfect for barbell and dumbbell training Comes fully assembled and ready for immediate use; simply take it out of the box to get started 7 easy-to-adjust positions offer flexibility, comfort, and a workout that's tailored to your needs Transport wheels let you easily move the bench from location to location Compact design easily fits in smaller spaces Easy to mount and dismount Folds for easy storage In use dimensions: 57L x 16W x 18 inches Folded dimensions: 57L x 16W x 9 inches Weight: 57 pounds Manufacturer's warranty included: see complete details in the Product Guarantee area About Body-Solid Body-Solid has been making high quality strength training and exercise equipment for over 20 years. Designed for today's workouts, Body-Solid machines feature innovative technology and distinctive styling that suits your home. Body-Solid equipment meets the challenges of today's busy lifestyle while providing you with the utmost in advanced home exercise. From space-saving designs that suit any room, to full-sized gym systems with every available station, Body-Solid gives you the features you want at a price you can afford. All components of all machines are covered by a lifetime manufacturer's warranty; something you won't find from any other manufacturer in the industry. Ideal for barbell and dumbbell training. 7 positions for a tailored and comfortable workout/li>Portable, foldable, and compact. Incline and decline positions. Assembled dimensions: 57L x 16W x 18 inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hIUGpKuUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R11G2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches", "Adjustable Benches"]], "price": 189.0}}
