{"item_id": "B000R2MYB4", "title": "Shimano SPD Cleats", "description": "The standard off road cleat that fits most Shimano MTB pedals. SH-51 cleat is standard single release SH-55/SH-56 cleat is multi release Pedal model PD-M858 requires SH-52 cleat and will not function with SH-51/55/56 cleats Approx. 85g depending on hardware. 4 degrees float", "text": "Shimano SPD Cleats The standard off road cleat that fits most Shimano MTB pedals. SH-51 cleat is standard single release SH-55/SH-56 cleat is multi release Pedal model PD-M858 requires SH-52 cleat and will not function with SH-51/55/56 cleats Approx. 85g depending on hardware. 4 degrees float", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eUdiEPSSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R2MYB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Replacement Cleats"]], "price": 16.19}}
{"item_id": "B000R2OBME", "title": "Park Tool DT-2 Rotor Truing Fork", "description": "Specially designed, and precisely manufactured to gently adjust bent or damaged brake rotors. Each DT-2 features two different slot depths laser cut from high quality steel. Centered handle is vinyl dipped for comfort.", "text": "Park Tool DT-2 Rotor Truing Fork Specially designed, and precisely manufactured to gently adjust bent or damaged brake rotors. Each DT-2 features two different slot depths laser cut from high quality steel. Centered handle is vinyl dipped for comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31drjRKyVFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R2OBME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 17.06}}
{"item_id": "B000R2YR5K", "title": "Unisex Bolle Recoil 8 Base Polarized Sporty Sunglasses", "description": "Recoil's arched arms and contoured profile give it and you an aggressive look that's sure to turn heads. It provides a comfortable fit for medium to large faces and features grippy Thermogrip technology to keep your sunglasses firmly planted in place.", "text": "Unisex Bolle Recoil 8 Base Polarized Sporty Sunglasses Recoil's arched arms and contoured profile give it and you an aggressive look that's sure to turn heads. It provides a comfortable fit for medium to large faces and features grippy Thermogrip technology to keep your sunglasses firmly planted in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ElCY2KaRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R2YR5K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]]}}
