{"item_id": "B000R30XAC", "title": "Ontario 8627 RAT-5 Knife (Brown)", "description": "The Ontario Knife RAT Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 1095 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 55-57 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales with skull crusher. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "text": "Ontario 8627 RAT-5 Knife (Brown) The Ontario Knife RAT Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 1095 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 55-57 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales with skull crusher. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YpvwtgXpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R30XAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 82.0}}
{"item_id": "B000R31P0E", "title": "Aim Sports Ar Handguard Rail Bipod-Short", "description": "This bipod from aptly named AIM Sports helps stabilize your weapon for improved firing accuracy. The device clamps directly to your hand rail guard, and features telescoping legs to adjust height from 6.8 to 9.4 inches, as well as a retractable collapse button. The 16-ounce bipod's finish is matte black over airsoft grade aluminum.Lifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports Ar Handguard Rail Bipod-Short This bipod from aptly named AIM Sports helps stabilize your weapon for improved firing accuracy. The device clamps directly to your hand rail guard, and features telescoping legs to adjust height from 6.8 to 9.4 inches, as well as a retractable collapse button. The 16-ounce bipod's finish is matte black over airsoft grade aluminum.Lifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iLk46t2jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R31P0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat Optical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 18.44}}
{"item_id": "B000R37Q02", "title": "Face Saver Plus 2-SW Black Iron Cover (10-piece)", "description": "The ultimate iron cover with a hosel lock to prevent loss. Comes with a lanyard per 2 covers to resist tangling. Fits regular and oversized irons. 10 piece set, 2-SW.", "text": "Face Saver Plus 2-SW Black Iron Cover (10-piece) The ultimate iron cover with a hosel lock to prevent loss. Comes with a lanyard per 2 covers to resist tangling. Fits regular and oversized irons. 10 piece set, 2-SW.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dxOTCHXIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R37Q02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Head Covers"]], "price": 17.8}}
{"item_id": "B000R3CJJK", "title": "Ultra - Rest Quad Hunter", "description": "Ultra - Rest Quad Hunter: Exclusive Velocity Drop - Away technology at a GREAT PRICE! The best value in drop-away rest technology and built for serious performance. Unlike other drop-aways that use inertia or vibration, the Ultra-Rest uses the velocity of the forward movement transmitted by the timing cord attached to the downward buss cable. This Velocity Drop-Away Technology (VDT) is an Ultra-Rest exclusive. Stays cocked even on slow letdowns and will only drop away if the bow is fired; Totally captures the arrow for easy use while stalking; Super quiet operation thanks to rubber bumpers and laser-cut felt; Adjusts to shoot shorter arrows... works with arrows up to 4\" shorter than competing designs; Get the shot off without shooting a hole in your budget. State Size. Order Today! Ultra-Rest Quad Hunter", "text": "Ultra - Rest Quad Hunter Ultra - Rest Quad Hunter: Exclusive Velocity Drop - Away technology at a GREAT PRICE! The best value in drop-away rest technology and built for serious performance. Unlike other drop-aways that use inertia or vibration, the Ultra-Rest uses the velocity of the forward movement transmitted by the timing cord attached to the downward buss cable. This Velocity Drop-Away Technology (VDT) is an Ultra-Rest exclusive. Stays cocked even on slow letdowns and will only drop away if the bow is fired; Totally captures the arrow for easy use while stalking; Super quiet operation thanks to rubber bumpers and laser-cut felt; Adjusts to shoot shorter arrows... works with arrows up to 4\" shorter than competing designs; Get the shot off without shooting a hole in your budget. State Size. Order Today! Ultra-Rest Quad Hunter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q7y3TjlqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R3CJJK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]]}}
