{"item_id": "B000R7JMQO", "title": "Sigg Screw Top for Sigg Water Bottles", "description": "The SIGG Screw bottle cap provides a leak-proof closure and can be looped to your belt or backpack with a carabiner or similar attachment. Custom fitted to accommodate any SIGG bottle. Available in multiple colors. Fits all sizes of SIGG reusable bottles Leak-proof Easy to use with loop for easy carrying or clipping to your backpack or belt Made from 100% food safe polypropylene Made with Swiss attention to quality Screw cap with integrated seal is guaranteed leak-proof even in the mo...", "text": "Sigg Screw Top for Sigg Water Bottles The SIGG Screw bottle cap provides a leak-proof closure and can be looped to your belt or backpack with a carabiner or similar attachment. Custom fitted to accommodate any SIGG bottle. Available in multiple colors. Fits all sizes of SIGG reusable bottles Leak-proof Easy to use with loop for easy carrying or clipping to your backpack or belt Made from 100% food safe polypropylene Made with Swiss attention to quality Screw cap with integrated seal is guaranteed leak-proof even in the mo...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o%2B%2BZwrcNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R7JMQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigg", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 4.95}}
