{"item_id": "B000R845C4", "title": "Mosin Nagant M44 M91/30 5 per pouch Stripper clip", "description": "Mosin Nagant Stripper Clip. Clip hold five 5 rounds 7.62 x 54R Ammo (Ammo in the image is NOT included). Load your rifle quickly without having to load one at a time. Can be used in the 9130, M38 and M44 rifles and carbines.", "text": "Mosin Nagant M44 M91/30 5 per pouch Stripper clip Mosin Nagant Stripper Clip. Clip hold five 5 rounds 7.62 x 54R Ammo (Ammo in the image is NOT included). Load your rifle quickly without having to load one at a time. Can be used in the 9130, M38 and M44 rifles and carbines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KvO%2BiUigL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R845C4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat Optical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.35}}
{"item_id": "B000R8S0YS", "title": "Maxam® Falcon IV Lockback Knife on a Key Chain", "description": "This handy knife on a key chain features an extra sharp 1-7/8\", 420 surgical stainless steel half-serrated blade to cut cord or twine easier and lightweight Leymar™ handle. The thumb hole allows one-handed opening with either the left or right hand. Measures 2-1/2\" closed, 4-1/2\" open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.", "text": "Maxam® Falcon IV Lockback Knife on a Key Chain This handy knife on a key chain features an extra sharp 1-7/8\", 420 surgical stainless steel half-serrated blade to cut cord or twine easier and lightweight Leymar™ handle. The thumb hole allows one-handed opening with either the left or right hand. Measures 2-1/2\" closed, 4-1/2\" open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eyZaEpwHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R8S0YS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BNF", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 3.91}}
{"item_id": "B000R9ACZC", "title": "Park Tool Cassette/Rotor Lockring Removal Tool - FR-5/FR-5G", "description": "Remove and install Shimano and SRAM Cassettes, and CenterLock Rotors with the Park Tool FR-5/FR-5G Lockring Removal Tool.", "text": "Park Tool Cassette/Rotor Lockring Removal Tool - FR-5/FR-5G Remove and install Shimano and SRAM Cassettes, and CenterLock Rotors with the Park Tool FR-5/FR-5G Lockring Removal Tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x3xCfuekL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9ACZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000R9E8GG", "title": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (5-Function)", "description": "CrankBrothers Multi-5 Tool has an aluminum frame with the five most common tools needed for road and trail repairs: a Phillips screwdriver and 3, 4, 5 and 6mm Allen wrenches. It's made of high-tensile steel, and tips the scales at a spartan 85 grams. Specs: Weight - 85 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "text": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (5-Function) CrankBrothers Multi-5 Tool has an aluminum frame with the five most common tools needed for road and trail repairs: a Phillips screwdriver and 3, 4, 5 and 6mm Allen wrenches. It's made of high-tensile steel, and tips the scales at a spartan 85 grams. Specs: Weight - 85 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F1kxtyE%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9E8GG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 10.15}}
{"item_id": "B000R9G7MO", "title": "Park Tool BBT-18 Bottom Bracket Tool for removing 8-notch bottom bracket cups", "description": "The BBT-18 is a heavy duty, investment cast tool for installing and removing all Shimano, ISIS Drive, and ISIS Overdrive eight-notch bottom bracket cups. The BBT-18 is an updated version of the current BBT-8. The outside diameter of the tool has been changed so it provides a universal fit on all Shimano and ISIS Drive eight-notch cups.", "text": "Park Tool BBT-18 Bottom Bracket Tool for removing 8-notch bottom bracket cups The BBT-18 is a heavy duty, investment cast tool for installing and removing all Shimano, ISIS Drive, and ISIS Overdrive eight-notch bottom bracket cups. The BBT-18 is an updated version of the current BBT-8. The outside diameter of the tool has been changed so it provides a universal fit on all Shimano and ISIS Drive eight-notch cups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x9P%2BPMw5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9G7MO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 14.36}}
{"item_id": "B000R9GG1G", "title": "Park Tool Heavy Duty Steel Tire Lever Set - TL-5", "description": "Anyone who has dealt with a heavy, wire-bead DH or freeride tire knows how tough it can be to change it. The Park Tool TL-5 Heavy Duty Tire Lever Set (two levers) has what it takes to deal with this problem. Tight, stiff-bead tires that would snap plastic levers like twigs are no match for steel TL-5 Levers. Not only are they strong, but these heavy-duty tire levers are a full eight inches long for added leverage when you need it most.", "text": "Park Tool Heavy Duty Steel Tire Lever Set - TL-5 Anyone who has dealt with a heavy, wire-bead DH or freeride tire knows how tough it can be to change it. The Park Tool TL-5 Heavy Duty Tire Lever Set (two levers) has what it takes to deal with this problem. Tight, stiff-bead tires that would snap plastic levers like twigs are no match for steel TL-5 Levers. Not only are they strong, but these heavy-duty tire levers are a full eight inches long for added leverage when you need it most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IayjpcexL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9GG1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 23.36}}
{"item_id": "B000R9P1NA", "title": "NcStar 3-9X42 Compact Scope/Blue Lens (SC3942B)", "description": "3-9x42 Compact Scope/Blue Lens Features: Specifications: - Magnification: 3x-9x - Tube dia.: 1” - Objective dia. (mm): 42.00 - FOV (feet at 100 yards): 18.2 - Eye relief (in): 2-2.2 - Exit pupil(mm): 14-14.7 - Reticle: P4 sniper - Net weight(oz.): 11.3 - Length (in): 7.9 - Click value: 1/4 m.o.a - Exterior finish: Matte black - Lens coating: Blue - Mount: None", "text": "NcStar 3-9X42 Compact Scope/Blue Lens (SC3942B) 3-9x42 Compact Scope/Blue Lens Features: Specifications: - Magnification: 3x-9x - Tube dia.: 1” - Objective dia. (mm): 42.00 - FOV (feet at 100 yards): 18.2 - Eye relief (in): 2-2.2 - Exit pupil(mm): 14-14.7 - Reticle: P4 sniper - Net weight(oz.): 11.3 - Length (in): 7.9 - Click value: 1/4 m.o.a - Exterior finish: Matte black - Lens coating: Blue - Mount: None", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317PbVXWd1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9P1NA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000R9QTFY", "title": "Barnett Sportflight Recurve Archery Set", "description": "The Barnett Sportflight set comes with everything you need to get aspiring archers started with this exciting sport, including a Sportflight bow, two arrows, and protective finger tab.Specifications:25-pound draw weight24-to-28-inch draw lengthAmbidextrous riserSoft touch reinforced gripAdjustable pin sightWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited 90-day warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Sportflight Recurve Archery Set The Barnett Sportflight set comes with everything you need to get aspiring archers started with this exciting sport, including a Sportflight bow, two arrows, and protective finger tab.Specifications:25-pound draw weight24-to-28-inch draw lengthAmbidextrous riserSoft touch reinforced gripAdjustable pin sightWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited 90-day warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zUrkmrXwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9QTFY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Basic Bows"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B000R9T7GM", "title": "Yukon Nvrs Titanium 2.5X50 Varmint Hunter Night Vision Riflescope", "description": "Hunt with confidence even after the sun starts to set with the Yukon Varmint Hunter 2.5x50 night vision riflescope. Equipped with enhanced optics, a durable titanium body, and a sleek ergonomic shape, the Varmint Hunter stands out from the crowd in the riflescope category. The Varmint Hunter incorporates a long mount into its ergonomic housing, helping the scope accommodate a wide range of rifles--including bolt-action styles--while also keeping you comfortable. The scope's powerful 50mm lens and multicoated optics, meanwhile, deliver brighter, higher-resolution images, so you can clearly see your prey from a distance. The scope's most glaring feature, however, is its powerful Pulse infrared illuminator, which enhances image brightness and range in total darkness. The IR illuminator lets you track a deer or rabbit in the black of night, or get an early start on your hunting without waiting for the sun to rise.The Varmint Hunter also includes a number of riflescope essentials, including precision windage and elevation adjustments; an adjustable lit red-on-green reticle; a remote control with \"on/off\" and \"IR on/off\" settings; a flip-up objective lens cover; and a standard Weaver rail mount system. Digital camera adaptable with the use of a digital camera accessory (sold separately), the Varmint Hunter comes with an on-rifle carrying case and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsImage intensifier tube: Gen1Magnification: 2.5xLens diameter: 50mmField of view: 15 degreesResolution: 32 to 36 lp/mmFocus range: 7 yards to infinityEye relief: 45mmDiopter adjustment: +/-4Detection range: Up to 220 yardsRecognition range: Up to 120 yardsIR illuminator effective distance: 100 yardsReticle type: Illuminated red-on-green duplexWindage/elevation adjustment: 1/2 MOA per clickPower supply: 2 AA batteries (3 volt)Estimated battery life (without IR): Up to 50 hoursDimensions: 10 by 3.1 by 3.3 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 31 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetime", "text": "Yukon Nvrs Titanium 2.5X50 Varmint Hunter Night Vision Riflescope Hunt with confidence even after the sun starts to set with the Yukon Varmint Hunter 2.5x50 night vision riflescope. Equipped with enhanced optics, a durable titanium body, and a sleek ergonomic shape, the Varmint Hunter stands out from the crowd in the riflescope category. The Varmint Hunter incorporates a long mount into its ergonomic housing, helping the scope accommodate a wide range of rifles--including bolt-action styles--while also keeping you comfortable. The scope's powerful 50mm lens and multicoated optics, meanwhile, deliver brighter, higher-resolution images, so you can clearly see your prey from a distance. The scope's most glaring feature, however, is its powerful Pulse infrared illuminator, which enhances image brightness and range in total darkness. The IR illuminator lets you track a deer or rabbit in the black of night, or get an early start on your hunting without waiting for the sun to rise.The Varmint Hunter also includes a number of riflescope essentials, including precision windage and elevation adjustments; an adjustable lit red-on-green reticle; a remote control with \"on/off\" and \"IR on/off\" settings; a flip-up objective lens cover; and a standard Weaver rail mount system. Digital camera adaptable with the use of a digital camera accessory (sold separately), the Varmint Hunter comes with an on-rifle carrying case and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsImage intensifier tube: Gen1Magnification: 2.5xLens diameter: 50mmField of view: 15 degreesResolution: 32 to 36 lp/mmFocus range: 7 yards to infinityEye relief: 45mmDiopter adjustment: +/-4Detection range: Up to 220 yardsRecognition range: Up to 120 yardsIR illuminator effective distance: 100 yardsReticle type: Illuminated red-on-green duplexWindage/elevation adjustment: 1/2 MOA per clickPower supply: 2 AA batteries (3 volt)Estimated battery life (without IR): Up to 50 hoursDimensions: 10 by 3.1 by 3.3 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 31 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t%2Be2UWFyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000R9T7GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yukon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 499.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RA24IO", "title": "Planet Bike Red Zeppelin CO2 Bike Tire Inflator", "description": "Insulated cartridge sleeve to prevent frozen fingers. Works with Presta or Schrader valves. Precision-machined body and head with airflation control knob for 100% reliability.", "text": "Planet Bike Red Zeppelin CO2 Bike Tire Inflator Insulated cartridge sleeve to prevent frozen fingers. Works with Presta or Schrader valves. Precision-machined body and head with airflation control knob for 100% reliability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hLACXWy1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RA24IO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RA3Z0K", "title": "Granite Ware 6006-1 3-Quart Coffee Boiler", "description": "Casual Friday's aren't just an office concept. More and more families are cooking outdoors whenever weather permits and what's better than a cup of Joe on the grill or the camp fire. 3 qt capacity Black", "text": "Granite Ware 6006-1 3-Quart Coffee Boiler Casual Friday's aren't just an office concept. More and more families are cooking outdoors whenever weather permits and what's better than a cup of Joe on the grill or the camp fire. 3 qt capacity Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-BiyilrkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RA3Z0K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Granite Ware", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RB2BGS", "title": "SE - Whistle with Compass, Thermometer & Lanyard", "description": "SE CCH3-1 Compass 8-in-1 Tool Kit for Camping, Hiking, Fishing, Hunting Need more than one? We offer great discounts on quantity orders and FREE SHIPPING offers available. Great for camping, hiking, fishing, boating, outdoor activities, sporting events, and more! Would you like to purchase more than one? We offer great discounts on quantity orders. Specifications: Compass diameter 3/4\" Thermometer Comes with lanyard Warning: Compasses are filled with mineral oil. Do not consume the liquid. If the compass is leaking liquid, discard the compass immediately. If the liquid gets into eyes or on skin wash with lukewarm water. If discomfort persists please contact a physician immediately. SpecificationsBrand: SE Color: Olive Diameter: 3/4\"", "text": "SE - Whistle with Compass, Thermometer & Lanyard SE CCH3-1 Compass 8-in-1 Tool Kit for Camping, Hiking, Fishing, Hunting Need more than one? We offer great discounts on quantity orders and FREE SHIPPING offers available. Great for camping, hiking, fishing, boating, outdoor activities, sporting events, and more! Would you like to purchase more than one? We offer great discounts on quantity orders. Specifications: Compass diameter 3/4\" Thermometer Comes with lanyard Warning: Compasses are filled with mineral oil. Do not consume the liquid. If the compass is leaking liquid, discard the compass immediately. If the liquid gets into eyes or on skin wash with lukewarm water. If discomfort persists please contact a physician immediately. SpecificationsBrand: SE Color: Olive Diameter: 3/4\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gXufwtBLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RB2BGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.28}}
