{"item_id": "B000RF5XIW", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Cyclone Sleeping Bag Stuff Sack", "description": "Whether you need a stuff sack for your sleeping bag or for storing other items in your pack, the high quality ALPS Mountaineering Cyclone Sleeping Bag Stuff Sack will perform to the highest standards, time and time again, on all your treks. There is a strap that connects the bottom and top lid so you can cinch down the top as much, or as little as you need to adjust the length depending on what you are carrying on each trip. In addition, there are three straps that compress the diameter. Features: Three straps compress diameter, additional strap compresses length. Double stitched seams. Bartacked stress points. Fabric: Nylon Ripstop. Three sizes: Medium (#7261003), Large (#7361003), XL (#7461003).", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Cyclone Sleeping Bag Stuff Sack Whether you need a stuff sack for your sleeping bag or for storing other items in your pack, the high quality ALPS Mountaineering Cyclone Sleeping Bag Stuff Sack will perform to the highest standards, time and time again, on all your treks. There is a strap that connects the bottom and top lid so you can cinch down the top as much, or as little as you need to adjust the length depending on what you are carrying on each trip. In addition, there are three straps that compress the diameter. Features: Three straps compress diameter, additional strap compresses length. Double stitched seams. Bartacked stress points. Fabric: Nylon Ripstop. Three sizes: Medium (#7261003), Large (#7361003), XL (#7461003).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vs5ugEM-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RF5XIW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000RF95RM", "title": "Casemaster Supreme Q-Vault Billiard Cue Case, Black", "description": "Carry your cue in style with the Viper Q Vault billiard carrying case. The case is made of imitation leather, with a hard exterior that protects your cue from bumps and knocks and a fully lined interior to cushion against accidental drops. The adjustable shoulder strap, meanwhile, makes this case easy to tote from the pool hall to the car. Finally, the case includes a removable accessory pouch for players who want to bring along chalk holders, gloves, bridges, joint protectors, or extra tips. The Q Vault case--which holds one butt and one shaft (cue not included)--is backed by a 90-day warranty.", "text": "Casemaster Supreme Q-Vault Billiard Cue Case, Black Carry your cue in style with the Viper Q Vault billiard carrying case. The case is made of imitation leather, with a hard exterior that protects your cue from bumps and knocks and a fully lined interior to cushion against accidental drops. The adjustable shoulder strap, meanwhile, makes this case easy to tote from the pool hall to the car. Finally, the case includes a removable accessory pouch for players who want to bring along chalk holders, gloves, bridges, joint protectors, or extra tips. The Q Vault case--which holds one butt and one shaft (cue not included)--is backed by a 90-day warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qrE1Y75qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RF95RM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casemaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Cue Sticks & Accessories", "Cases"]], "price": 19.17}}
{"item_id": "B000RFAMJM", "title": "Soft Air M9 US Army Helmet", "description": "This is a high quality Replica U.S. Army M9 Helmet in OD Green is both rugged and durable and made to take punishment in any situation. Made of high quality ABS plastic, it is extremely comfortable and protects the entire head/skull.", "text": "Soft Air M9 US Army Helmet This is a high quality Replica U.S. Army M9 Helmet in OD Green is both rugged and durable and made to take punishment in any situation. Made of high quality ABS plastic, it is extremely comfortable and protects the entire head/skull.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4106EjW0HsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RFAMJM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Palco Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Helmets"]], "price": 5.28}}
