{"item_id": "B000RYQDRS", "title": "Powerline PCH24X Roman Chair Back Hyperextension", "description": "The PowerLine Roman Chair Back Hyperextension allows you to build critical core abdominal and lower back strength as well as work your glutes and hamstrings. Built for stability and safety, the chair boasts a two by two-inch thick, heavy-gauge steel construction with a wide base to eliminate rocking. The machine has an electrostatically applied powder coat finish to keep the surface unmarred and measures 36 by 46 by 25 inches when assembled. Built to last, the Roman Chair Hyperextension carries a 10-year frame warranty from Powerline.", "text": "Powerline PCH24X Roman Chair Back Hyperextension The PowerLine Roman Chair Back Hyperextension allows you to build critical core abdominal and lower back strength as well as work your glutes and hamstrings. Built for stability and safety, the chair boasts a two by two-inch thick, heavy-gauge steel construction with a wide base to eliminate rocking. The machine has an electrostatically applied powder coat finish to keep the surface unmarred and measures 36 by 46 by 25 inches when assembled. Built to last, the Roman Chair Hyperextension carries a 10-year frame warranty from Powerline.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tUB7CWqRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RYQDRS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Powerline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 152.1}}
{"item_id": "B000RYU20C", "title": "Pachmayr Decelerator Grips for S and W, J Frame Round Butt", "description": "SJ-G/D Gripper Decelerator Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with Round Butt.", "text": "Pachmayr Decelerator Grips for S and W, J Frame Round Butt SJ-G/D Gripper Decelerator Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with Round Butt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KcVWA39GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RYU20C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RYWQP6", "title": "ZODI Outback Gear Extreme SC Hot Shower", "description": "Nothing feels quite as refreshing after a 10-mile hike as a hot shower, but good luck finding a YMCA in the backcountry. Enter the Zodi Extreme, the hot shower of choice for backcountry use. Ideal for logging road campers and hunters, the Extreme is extra-durable, with a rustproof stainless-steel water tank and a powerful 10,000 BTU burner. To use, simply fill the tank with water and place on the rugged stove, which doubles as a cooking stove. Within five minutes, the water will heat to 100-plus degrees F, giving you plenty of hot, invigorating water for your morning or evening shower. The system also includes a one-piece hand pump that pressurizes the flow without batteries, along with a 6-foot shower hose with a showerhead and on/off control valve. And the system is a breeze to set up, requiring less than a minute.The Extreme, which also sports a handy thermometer that displays the water temperature, collapses for transport and comes with a gear bag.About ZodiZodi's first products heated water in only 20 minutes, but that wasn't good enough. The company soon cut it to 10 minutes, but waiting 10 minutes for a shower? Now, Zodi's hot water showers give you hot water anytime, anywhere in less than 10 seconds. Today, the Zodi brand is synonymous with innovation, quality, and performance, and is sold in more than 75 countries. Zodi's systems can even be found on Mt. Everest. In addition to selling on-demand water heaters and showers for the outdoor industry, Zodi makes similar products for military and industrial needs, including lifesaving hot decon showers for soldiers, firefighters, and EMS teams. Zodi is headquartered in Midvale, Utah.", "text": "ZODI Outback Gear Extreme SC Hot Shower Nothing feels quite as refreshing after a 10-mile hike as a hot shower, but good luck finding a YMCA in the backcountry. Enter the Zodi Extreme, the hot shower of choice for backcountry use. Ideal for logging road campers and hunters, the Extreme is extra-durable, with a rustproof stainless-steel water tank and a powerful 10,000 BTU burner. To use, simply fill the tank with water and place on the rugged stove, which doubles as a cooking stove. Within five minutes, the water will heat to 100-plus degrees F, giving you plenty of hot, invigorating water for your morning or evening shower. The system also includes a one-piece hand pump that pressurizes the flow without batteries, along with a 6-foot shower hose with a showerhead and on/off control valve. And the system is a breeze to set up, requiring less than a minute.The Extreme, which also sports a handy thermometer that displays the water temperature, collapses for transport and comes with a gear bag.About ZodiZodi's first products heated water in only 20 minutes, but that wasn't good enough. The company soon cut it to 10 minutes, but waiting 10 minutes for a shower? Now, Zodi's hot water showers give you hot water anytime, anywhere in less than 10 seconds. Today, the Zodi brand is synonymous with innovation, quality, and performance, and is sold in more than 75 countries. Zodi's systems can even be found on Mt. Everest. In addition to selling on-demand water heaters and showers for the outdoor industry, Zodi makes similar products for military and industrial needs, including lifesaving hot decon showers for soldiers, firefighters, and EMS teams. Zodi is headquartered in Midvale, Utah.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EQKq4aTvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RYWQP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zodi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 174.13}}
{"item_id": "B000RYWUO8", "title": "Pachmayr Grips for S and W, J Frame Square Butt", "description": "SJ-GS Gripper Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with a Square Butt.", "text": "Pachmayr Grips for S and W, J Frame Square Butt SJ-GS Gripper Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with a Square Butt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qqkhbp6VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RYWUO8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 26.71}}
{"item_id": "B000RZ1WJQ", "title": "Allen Company Ruger Web Standard Grade Rifle Case", "description": "Allen Company Ruger Web Standard Grade Rifle Case comes with a 40-Inch Ruger Standard Rifle Case. It is embroidered, includes webbed handles with external pocket. Made with Endura material. Foam measures 1.25-Inch and includes 8 Zipper", "text": "Allen Company Ruger Web Standard Grade Rifle Case Allen Company Ruger Web Standard Grade Rifle Case comes with a 40-Inch Ruger Standard Rifle Case. It is embroidered, includes webbed handles with external pocket. Made with Endura material. Foam measures 1.25-Inch and includes 8 Zipper", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BbWRawzDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZ1WJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000RZ2IR6", "title": "Pachmayr Marlin 336 Decelerator Pre Fit Recoil Pad", "description": "The Pre-Fit Pad concept was originated by the experts at Pachmayr combining their decades of experience providing the world's leading gunmakers with factory recoil pads and the remarkable recoil-softening Decelerator material. These unique Pachmayr Decelerator® recoil pads provide superior recoil control and great looks and, best of all, you can install them yourself. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting performance to help you shoot tighter groups, bag more game or break more clay", "text": "Pachmayr Marlin 336 Decelerator Pre Fit Recoil Pad The Pre-Fit Pad concept was originated by the experts at Pachmayr combining their decades of experience providing the world's leading gunmakers with factory recoil pads and the remarkable recoil-softening Decelerator material. These unique Pachmayr Decelerator® recoil pads provide superior recoil control and great looks and, best of all, you can install them yourself. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting performance to help you shoot tighter groups, bag more game or break more clay", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KGQcA4W-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZ2IR6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RZ2RN6", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P230 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P230 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41imdPvtkUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZ2RN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RZ7NJY", "title": "Hogue Govt. Model Scrimshaw Ivory Polymer Ambi Safety Cut", "description": "Select Ivory Polymer grips are available with engraved scrimshaw designs. Several standard designs are available for Colt Government style pistols as well as for Ruger and Colt Single action revolvers.All grips are made of an ivory polymer and are crafted for an exacting fit. Features: - Grim Reaper Design - Two Piece Design Specifications: - Government Model - Scrimshaw Grip - Ivory Polymer", "text": "Hogue Govt. Model Scrimshaw Ivory Polymer Ambi Safety Cut Select Ivory Polymer grips are available with engraved scrimshaw designs. Several standard designs are available for Colt Government style pistols as well as for Ruger and Colt Single action revolvers.All grips are made of an ivory polymer and are crafted for an exacting fit. Features: - Grim Reaper Design - Two Piece Design Specifications: - Government Model - Scrimshaw Grip - Ivory Polymer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411xvOC-yKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZ7NJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 47.96}}
{"item_id": "B000RZG5NY", "title": "Wheeler Space Saver Screwdriver Set", "description": "The Wheeler Space Saver Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set takes up very little space on your bench, but contains a durable and comprehensive set of 26 bits chosen to meet most of your gunsmithing needs. It's also the perfect size to include on your trips to the range and the field. Included with the standard, Phillips, hex, and torx bits, is a 2\" long #2 Phillips bit which is ideal for recoil pad installation, and a hex-to-square conversion bit which allows you to use 1/4\" square drive sockets and other attachments. The magnetic handle is perfectly sized for gunsmithing needs.", "text": "Wheeler Space Saver Screwdriver Set The Wheeler Space Saver Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set takes up very little space on your bench, but contains a durable and comprehensive set of 26 bits chosen to meet most of your gunsmithing needs. It's also the perfect size to include on your trips to the range and the field. Included with the standard, Phillips, hex, and torx bits, is a 2\" long #2 Phillips bit which is ideal for recoil pad installation, and a hex-to-square conversion bit which allows you to use 1/4\" square drive sockets and other attachments. The magnetic handle is perfectly sized for gunsmithing needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NRPvlIl-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZG5NY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000RZMWE0", "title": "Park Tool CT-5 Mini Chain Brute Chain Tool", "description": "This small chain tool goes anywhere and actually performs like a shop quality tool. The fine thread, special \"V\"- shaped handle, and super strong replaceable pin make chain removal and installation a breeze.", "text": "Park Tool CT-5 Mini Chain Brute Chain Tool This small chain tool goes anywhere and actually performs like a shop quality tool. The fine thread, special \"V\"- shaped handle, and super strong replaceable pin make chain removal and installation a breeze.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FUpRdp9JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZMWE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 15.26}}
{"item_id": "B000RZTNSI", "title": "Softspikes Golf Cleat Kaddy", "description": "The Softspikes CleatKaddy is the perfect tool to remove and install all plastic golf cleats. Its fast-ratcheting action makes quick work of any installation. The tool also provides the torque needed to remove even the most worn cleats. Includes two power bits, which can be stored in the handle of the wrench. Just put any of the bits on the end of the ratchet and you’re just seconds away from replacing your cleats.", "text": "Softspikes Golf Cleat Kaddy The Softspikes CleatKaddy is the perfect tool to remove and install all plastic golf cleats. Its fast-ratcheting action makes quick work of any installation. The tool also provides the torque needed to remove even the most worn cleats. Includes two power bits, which can be stored in the handle of the wrench. Just put any of the bits on the end of the ratchet and you’re just seconds away from replacing your cleats.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sDWvCKr1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000RZTNSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Soft Spikes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Spike Wrenches"]], "price": 8.65}}
{"item_id": "B000S2TTLQ", "title": "Schwalbe Marathon Supreme HD Cross/Hybrid Bicycle Tire - Folding", "description": "Exceptional. Outstanding. The best. A touring tire that can do everything. That was the goalof our development team. For 2009 we have completely revised our : HD Ceramic Guard, TripleNano Compound, LiteSkin side wall. The Marathon Supreme is now even lighter and faster.Puncture resistance has also been improved and its grip on wet roads remains outstanding! HD Ceramic Guard particles that help blunt the edges of glass that are embedded in a tire preventing them from continually pushing into the tire. Triple Nano Compound construction offers great grip on the shoulders, and exceptional tread wear in the middle..", "text": "Schwalbe Marathon Supreme HD Cross/Hybrid Bicycle Tire - Folding Exceptional. Outstanding. The best. A touring tire that can do everything. That was the goalof our development team. For 2009 we have completely revised our : HD Ceramic Guard, TripleNano Compound, LiteSkin side wall. The Marathon Supreme is now even lighter and faster.Puncture resistance has also been improved and its grip on wet roads remains outstanding! HD Ceramic Guard particles that help blunt the edges of glass that are embedded in a tire preventing them from continually pushing into the tire. Triple Nano Compound construction offers great grip on the shoulders, and exceptional tread wear in the middle..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kXt%2BC%2BiZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S2TTLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwalbe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 54.19}}
{"item_id": "B000S5BFGU", "title": "Belkin Neoprene Notebook Sleeve for 15.4-Inch Laptop (F8N048-DK)", "description": "Belkin Neoprene Notebook Sleeve for 15.4-Inch Laptop", "text": "Belkin Neoprene Notebook Sleeve for 15.4-Inch Laptop (F8N048-DK) Belkin Neoprene Notebook Sleeve for 15.4-Inch Laptop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wRItVSS-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5BFGU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Bags, Packs & Accessories", "Laptop & Messenger Bags", "Laptop Bags"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000S5BFS8", "title": "Belkin F8N336 Pace Toploader Bag for 16\" Laptop (Black)", "description": "Belkin Pace Toploader 16\"-Black", "text": "Belkin F8N336 Pace Toploader Bag for 16\" Laptop (Black) Belkin Pace Toploader 16\"-Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fLp-fy1-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5BFS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Bags, Packs & Accessories", "Laptop & Messenger Bags", "Laptop Bags"]], "price": 40.99}}
{"item_id": "B000S5CY92", "title": "Belkin Laptop Sling Bag (Chocolate/Tourmaline)", "description": ".caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } table.callout { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif; margin: 10px; width: 250; } td.callout { height: 100 percent; background: #9DC4D8 url(http://images.amazon.com/images/G/01/electronics/detail-page/callout-bg.png) repeat-x; border-left: 1px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding: 10px; width: 250px; } ul.callout { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5em; } h5.callout { text-align: center; }The Belkin Laptop Sling Bag offers:a small, light, and hip design that still has plenty of room for your laptop and essentials.a fully padded compartment for your laptop., and a cell phone compartment on the strap.a separate, removable pouch for power adapters and cables.Slide your laptop into the padded interior. There's still plenty of room leftover!View larger.With a unique design, the Belkin Laptop Sling Bag (jet/cabernet) protects your computer and offers a large storage capacity in a small and light bag. The Sling Bag is a traditional-style backpack for exceptional comfort but has extra features that make it geared for the mobile professional. A fully padded compartment can hold up to a 15.4-inch computer and keeps it isolated and safe from bumps and scratches. A separate, removable pouch holds power adapters and cables.Belkin's Made-for-You organization provides a place for all of your essentials, including MP3 players, cell phones, pens, and business cards, as well as other accessories. The bag is made of a high-quality 100-percent polyester fabric that is durable and weatherproof, and features contrasting colors for an elegant look, and the strap and back panel use a breathable fabric that maintains comfort even when it gets hot.The bag features a Quick Release shoulder strap, making it quick and easy to take off the bag. For added convenience, the shoulder strap features a built-in phone compartment. Attention to detail can be seen in the headphone cord grommet and the zippers that have molded, easy-to-grip pulls that match the color of the bag. The Belkin Laptop Sling Bag is backed by Belkin's Lifetime Warranty. The bag is available in two colors:jet/cabernetandchocolate/tourmaline.Take your fun and work with you wherever you go. A smaller pouch for essentials also is included, and the back panel is made of breathable fabric.", "text": "Belkin Laptop Sling Bag (Chocolate/Tourmaline) .caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: 20px; } table.callout { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif; margin: 10px; width: 250; } td.callout { height: 100 percent; background: #9DC4D8 url(http://images.amazon.com/images/G/01/electronics/detail-page/callout-bg.png) repeat-x; border-left: 1px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding: 10px; width: 250px; } ul.callout { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -12px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5em; } h5.callout { text-align: center; }The Belkin Laptop Sling Bag offers:a small, light, and hip design that still has plenty of room for your laptop and essentials.a fully padded compartment for your laptop., and a cell phone compartment on the strap.a separate, removable pouch for power adapters and cables.Slide your laptop into the padded interior. There's still plenty of room leftover!View larger.With a unique design, the Belkin Laptop Sling Bag (jet/cabernet) protects your computer and offers a large storage capacity in a small and light bag. The Sling Bag is a traditional-style backpack for exceptional comfort but has extra features that make it geared for the mobile professional. A fully padded compartment can hold up to a 15.4-inch computer and keeps it isolated and safe from bumps and scratches. A separate, removable pouch holds power adapters and cables.Belkin's Made-for-You organization provides a place for all of your essentials, including MP3 players, cell phones, pens, and business cards, as well as other accessories. The bag is made of a high-quality 100-percent polyester fabric that is durable and weatherproof, and features contrasting colors for an elegant look, and the strap and back panel use a breathable fabric that maintains comfort even when it gets hot.The bag features a Quick Release shoulder strap, making it quick and easy to take off the bag. For added convenience, the shoulder strap features a built-in phone compartment. Attention to detail can be seen in the headphone cord grommet and the zippers that have molded, easy-to-grip pulls that match the color of the bag. The Belkin Laptop Sling Bag is backed by Belkin's Lifetime Warranty. The bag is available in two colors:jet/cabernetandchocolate/tourmaline.Take your fun and work with you wherever you go. A smaller pouch for essentials also is included, and the back panel is made of breathable fabric.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WBE88IWVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5CY92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Bags, Packs & Accessories", "Laptop & Messenger Bags", "Laptop Bags"]], "price": 40.99}}
{"item_id": "B000S5H11I", "title": "Underwater Kinetics Buoyancy Compensator Hanger", "description": "Underwater Kinetics Super BC HangerUnderwater Kinetics Super BC Hanger Features:This unique hanger is built specifically for hanging your expensive BC and regulator. Raised hooks are added to the tips of the hanger shoulders to prevent the BC from sliding off. A T-hook extends from the bottom of the hanger for draping hoses from your regulator. With this hanger your equipment will dry quickly and safely off of the floor.One piece I-beam construction for strengthNon-corroding plastic resin will not rustSupports up to 20 poundsOriginal UK BC Hanger Redesigned for Easier UseUnderwater Kinetics was the first dive company to provide divers with a series of hangers designed specifically for diving equipment. The hangers had to be non-corroding, non-staining, sunlight resistant and strong enough to support the weight of wet dive equipment while remaining reasonably priced. The inspiration for the unusual shapes of these hangers came from divers who wanted to get their equipment off the floor, out of the sand and up the air for drying after a rinse in fresh water. The hangers turned out to be so rugged that most diving retailers used them to display equipment in their stores.The hanger designed for holding a BC and regulator has been redesinged for versatility and ease of use. The original design required the diver to remove the dust cap of the regulator and screw the first stage onto the hanger. The purpose of this was to make sure that the regulator did not fall off. In the new design of the BC hanger an inverted T-hook is provided for draping the regulator hoses from the hanger while still providing resistance to slipping off onto the floor. The \"shoulder tips\" of the hanger are hooked upward to prevent the BC from sliding off as it would on a conventional hanger. In addition the hanger utilizes strong I- beam construction and is non-corroding as well as non-stai", "text": "Underwater Kinetics Buoyancy Compensator Hanger Underwater Kinetics Super BC HangerUnderwater Kinetics Super BC Hanger Features:This unique hanger is built specifically for hanging your expensive BC and regulator. Raised hooks are added to the tips of the hanger shoulders to prevent the BC from sliding off. A T-hook extends from the bottom of the hanger for draping hoses from your regulator. With this hanger your equipment will dry quickly and safely off of the floor.One piece I-beam construction for strengthNon-corroding plastic resin will not rustSupports up to 20 poundsOriginal UK BC Hanger Redesigned for Easier UseUnderwater Kinetics was the first dive company to provide divers with a series of hangers designed specifically for diving equipment. The hangers had to be non-corroding, non-staining, sunlight resistant and strong enough to support the weight of wet dive equipment while remaining reasonably priced. The inspiration for the unusual shapes of these hangers came from divers who wanted to get their equipment off the floor, out of the sand and up the air for drying after a rinse in fresh water. The hangers turned out to be so rugged that most diving retailers used them to display equipment in their stores.The hanger designed for holding a BC and regulator has been redesinged for versatility and ease of use. The original design required the diver to remove the dust cap of the regulator and screw the first stage onto the hanger. The purpose of this was to make sure that the regulator did not fall off. In the new design of the BC hanger an inverted T-hook is provided for draping the regulator hoses from the hanger while still providing resistance to slipping off onto the floor. The \"shoulder tips\" of the hanger are hooked upward to prevent the BC from sliding off as it would on a conventional hanger. In addition the hanger utilizes strong I- beam construction and is non-corroding as well as non-stai", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TY3FgIOpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5H11I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Underwater Kinetics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Buoyancy Compensators"]], "price": 9.5}}
{"item_id": "B000S5HWQC", "title": "Cap Barbell Medicine Ball", "description": "CAP Barbell's Rubber Medicine Ball is a classic fitness tool that has been used for decades to develop strength, coordination and endurance. This new Medicine Ball is designed to bounce for partner or wall exercises, and the tacky feel assures the user a safe and secure grip. Medicine Balls are great for sport specific core training, and help increase strength and stamina. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "text": "Cap Barbell Medicine Ball CAP Barbell's Rubber Medicine Ball is a classic fitness tool that has been used for decades to develop strength, coordination and endurance. This new Medicine Ball is designed to bounce for partner or wall exercises, and the tacky feel assures the user a safe and secure grip. Medicine Balls are great for sport specific core training, and help increase strength and stamina. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418LrH6YXDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5HWQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Medicine Balls"]], "price": 37.11}}
