{"item_id": "B000S5N1RQ", "title": "Cap Barbell Puzzle Mat (24-Inch x 24-Inch x 3/4-Inch)", "description": "Cap's high density floor mats are a great way to protect your floor and equipment from abuse. These puzzle mats include 4 pieces covering 24 square feet with finishing strips for the edges. These mats are durable and easy to clean. Buy multiple packs to cover your entire workout area. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "text": "Cap Barbell Puzzle Mat (24-Inch x 24-Inch x 3/4-Inch) Cap's high density floor mats are a great way to protect your floor and equipment from abuse. These puzzle mats include 4 pieces covering 24 square feet with finishing strips for the edges. These mats are durable and easy to clean. Buy multiple packs to cover your entire workout area. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31snMUs0o3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5N1RQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 69.18}}
{"item_id": "B000S5ODN2", "title": "Rothco 550lb. Type III Nylon Paracord", "description": "An ideal all-around utility cord in the field, the Rothco Type III commercial paracord is tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550-pound test nylon and features a seven-strand core for maximum strength. Measuring 5/32 inches in diameter, the paracord is manufactured in the United States by a certified US Government contractor. The paracord is available in several lengths and colors.", "text": "Rothco 550lb. Type III Nylon Paracord An ideal all-around utility cord in the field, the Rothco Type III commercial paracord is tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550-pound test nylon and features a seven-strand core for maximum strength. Measuring 5/32 inches in diameter, the paracord is manufactured in the United States by a certified US Government contractor. The paracord is available in several lengths and colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ANU4HF1mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5ODN2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000S5ODOG", "title": "Rothco Type III 550-Pound Commercial Paracord", "description": "Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "Rothco Type III 550-Pound Commercial Paracord Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MF5Vhnf2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5ODOG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000S5QFCO", "title": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for .38, .357 Caliber 9mm Pistol, with Aluminum Rod, Clam", "description": "Hoppe's PCO38B No. 9 Pistol Cleaning Kit with Steel Rods for 38, 357, 9mm Caliber Pistols (Clamshell) Hoppe's PCO38B No. 9 Pistol Cleaning Kit with Steel Rods for 38, 357, 9mm Caliber Pistols (Clamshell) Features: Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, 2oz. Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, 2.25oz. Patches, round Die-cut cotton Patches for an absorbent surface with deep cleaning Slotted ends and adapters, where appropriate Steel Cleaning Rods Brushes not included", "text": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for .38, .357 Caliber 9mm Pistol, with Aluminum Rod, Clam Hoppe's PCO38B No. 9 Pistol Cleaning Kit with Steel Rods for 38, 357, 9mm Caliber Pistols (Clamshell) Hoppe's PCO38B No. 9 Pistol Cleaning Kit with Steel Rods for 38, 357, 9mm Caliber Pistols (Clamshell) Features: Hoppe's No. 9 Solvent, 2oz. Hoppe's Lubricating Oil, 2.25oz. Patches, round Die-cut cotton Patches for an absorbent surface with deep cleaning Slotted ends and adapters, where appropriate Steel Cleaning Rods Brushes not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qK-O6CLUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5QFCO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 11.28}}
{"item_id": "B000S5SCPM", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip CZ-75, TZ-75 P-9 Rubber Wraparound with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip CZ-75, TZ-75 P-9 Rubber Wraparound with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xJZqc%2ByoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5SCPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.78}}
{"item_id": "B000S5SHUC", "title": "Birchwood Casey Barricade Tag Alongs (25 Pack)", "description": "Barricade Rust Protection rapidly drives out moisture from metal pores and deposits a transparent protective coating which seals the surface. Its the best way to protect your firearms from rust. Barricade Rust Protection is also an excellent penetrant for loosening rusty or frozen parts, as well as a good lubricant and an effective bore cleaner.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Barricade Tag Alongs (25 Pack) Barricade Rust Protection rapidly drives out moisture from metal pores and deposits a transparent protective coating which seals the surface. Its the best way to protect your firearms from rust. Barricade Rust Protection is also an excellent penetrant for loosening rusty or frozen parts, as well as a good lubricant and an effective bore cleaner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41odLdbUNjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5SHUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000S5VWIG", "title": "Aimshot 30 Carbine Laser Boresight", "description": "The Aimshot Laser boresight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately boresight your weapon. Just slide the aimshot laser boresight cartridge into the caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot is projected down the exact centerline of your barrel. Cartridge sleeves are meticulously engineered with precision for a flawlessly centered dot every time. An invaluable tool for any gun enthusiast, this boresighting unit will save time and ammunition while allowing you to sight your weapon in areas where discharging a firearm may not be possible and takes up no more space in your pocket than a rifle cartridge. A durable nylon case is included with bore sights. It is specifically designed to hold your bore sight along with all the arbors you need. Arbors are sold separately.", "text": "Aimshot 30 Carbine Laser Boresight The Aimshot Laser boresight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately boresight your weapon. Just slide the aimshot laser boresight cartridge into the caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot is projected down the exact centerline of your barrel. Cartridge sleeves are meticulously engineered with precision for a flawlessly centered dot every time. An invaluable tool for any gun enthusiast, this boresighting unit will save time and ammunition while allowing you to sight your weapon in areas where discharging a firearm may not be possible and takes up no more space in your pocket than a rifle cartridge. A durable nylon case is included with bore sights. It is specifically designed to hold your bore sight along with all the arbors you need. Arbors are sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314%2BnwnKoxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5VWIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 23.98}}
{"item_id": "B000S5W78A", "title": "Caldwell Rock BR Rest", "description": "The Rock BR will help you discover the true potential of your rifle and ammunition. This high quality rest is designed for the most accuracy-minded shooters around, bench rest competitors. Now everyone who wants the best from their rifle can benefit from the advanced design, precision machining, and finely engineered features of the Rock BR.", "text": "Caldwell Rock BR Rest The Rock BR will help you discover the true potential of your rifle and ammunition. This high quality rest is designed for the most accuracy-minded shooters around, bench rest competitors. Now everyone who wants the best from their rifle can benefit from the advanced design, precision machining, and finely engineered features of the Rock BR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EOxb4GUkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S5W78A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 168.19}}
{"item_id": "B000S6CYFK", "title": "NcStar Tippmann Red Dot Reflex Sight/ Weaver Base (DP)", "description": "Red Dot Reflex Sight/Weaver Base Specifications: - Magnification: 1X - Objective Diameter(mm): 22x33 - Reticle: Red Dot - Dot Size: 5 MOA - Exterior Finish: Black Plastic - Lens Coating: Clear - Net Weight (oz.): 3 - Lenth (in): 4.73 - Mount: Integrated Weaver style", "text": "NcStar Tippmann Red Dot Reflex Sight/ Weaver Base (DP) Red Dot Reflex Sight/Weaver Base Specifications: - Magnification: 1X - Objective Diameter(mm): 22x33 - Reticle: Red Dot - Dot Size: 5 MOA - Exterior Finish: Black Plastic - Lens Coating: Clear - Net Weight (oz.): 3 - Lenth (in): 4.73 - Mount: Integrated Weaver style", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XAe52TZxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S6CYFK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Sights"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000S6G85M", "title": "Park Tool Rescue Tool Kit", "description": "An outstanding value, the quality MTB-7 Rescue Tool is packed with 21 useful tools for emergency repairs on the road or trail. Includes nylon carrying case with embroidered Park Tool logo. Tools included.", "text": "Park Tool Rescue Tool Kit An outstanding value, the quality MTB-7 Rescue Tool is packed with 21 useful tools for emergency repairs on the road or trail. Includes nylon carrying case with embroidered Park Tool logo. Tools included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pDLe2hFIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S6G85M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 12.8}}
{"item_id": "B000S6HZBI", "title": "Park Tool MTB-3 Rescue Tool - 22 function", "description": "The MTB-3 Rescue Tool is a premium quality multi-tool with the design and innovative features you’d expect from the top name in bicycle tools. Small and light enough to slip into a pocket or seat pack, the MTB-3 contains 22 tools, each carefully selected for nearly any repair on the road or trail. Manufactured to the highest standards, all tools are finely polished stainless steel or nickel plated steel. Unique three-piece design (patent # 6,622,329) makes each tool easy to access and easy to use. Super tough nylon handles provide excellent grip when using tools. Includes nylon carrying case with embroidered Park Tool logo. Tools included: Chain tool, Tire levers (2), Phillips head screwdriver, Straight blade screwdriver, T25 star-shaped driver, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6, & 8mm hex wrenches, 8, 9, and 10mm box end wrenches, Bottle opener, 0.127\", 0.130\", & 0.136\" spoke wrenches, Pedal wrench, Serrated knife.", "text": "Park Tool MTB-3 Rescue Tool - 22 function The MTB-3 Rescue Tool is a premium quality multi-tool with the design and innovative features you’d expect from the top name in bicycle tools. Small and light enough to slip into a pocket or seat pack, the MTB-3 contains 22 tools, each carefully selected for nearly any repair on the road or trail. Manufactured to the highest standards, all tools are finely polished stainless steel or nickel plated steel. Unique three-piece design (patent # 6,622,329) makes each tool easy to access and easy to use. Super tough nylon handles provide excellent grip when using tools. Includes nylon carrying case with embroidered Park Tool logo. Tools included: Chain tool, Tire levers (2), Phillips head screwdriver, Straight blade screwdriver, T25 star-shaped driver, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6, & 8mm hex wrenches, 8, 9, and 10mm box end wrenches, Bottle opener, 0.127\", 0.130\", & 0.136\" spoke wrenches, Pedal wrench, Serrated knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hB%2BkmExwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S6HZBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 28.76}}
{"item_id": "B000S6HZCC", "title": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (17-Function)", "description": "CrankBrothers Multi-17 Tool features both a chain tool and a disc-brake-rotor-friendly Torx T-25 wrench alongside the usual package. The Crank Brothers Multi 17 Tool has mountain bikers first in mind. Nothing besides a flat or a broken bone will stop your ride as quickly as a busted chain, and if you ride hard you're bound to snap a link sometime. The Multi 17 might not be the absolute lightest tool or smallest on the market, but the extra grams are well worth it because if you don't have the right tool when the chips are down, you're dead weight anyway. This tool features four spoke wrench sizes, seven hex wrench sizes, an 8mm and 10mm open wrench, and both a phillips and flathead screwdriver. Specs: Weight: 168 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "text": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (17-Function) CrankBrothers Multi-17 Tool features both a chain tool and a disc-brake-rotor-friendly Torx T-25 wrench alongside the usual package. The Crank Brothers Multi 17 Tool has mountain bikers first in mind. Nothing besides a flat or a broken bone will stop your ride as quickly as a busted chain, and if you ride hard you're bound to snap a link sometime. The Multi 17 might not be the absolute lightest tool or smallest on the market, but the extra grams are well worth it because if you don't have the right tool when the chips are down, you're dead weight anyway. This tool features four spoke wrench sizes, seven hex wrench sizes, an 8mm and 10mm open wrench, and both a phillips and flathead screwdriver. Specs: Weight: 168 grams; Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pFh00El1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000S6HZCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 21.92}}
