{"item_id": "B000SKWF82", "title": "Light Weight Motorcycle cover (L). Fits up to 84\" length sport bike, dirt bike, small cruiser.", "description": "Factory Direct! StreetStar 300 L Color:Black top/Silver bottom A high-quality, lightweight and water-resistant cover. The perfect travel cover whether you want to cover your bike at work or a cross country trip. This cover folds small and light yet gives big time protection against the elements. Our best selling model, we have sold tens of thousands of these around the globe and they really get the job done -Constructed of water repellent, breathable \"Weather guard\" Polyester. -Double-top stitched for durability. -Lower panel is heat resistant \"Thermo guard\". -Clam shell vents prevent condensation and lofting. -A chamois panel is stitched in where cover would touch windscreen and fuel tank areas to prevent scratches. -Reinforced Poly grommets are at center and at front wheel area for security and a snug fit and will accept a cable lock. -Storage bag included. -ONE year warranty from manufacture defects. 300 series (L) fits most sport bikes under 1000cc's and small cruisers under 750cc's without wind shields (i.e. Yamaha R1-R6, Yamaha FZ1-FZ, bmw boneville, bmw f800s, ducati 996, honda CBR 600, honda 919, honda 599, honda CBR F4i, honda 1000RR, honda VFR, honda VLX, honda VTR, kawasaki ninja500, kawasaki ninja600, kawasaki ninja650, kawa ninja-1000, kawasaki z 1000, kawasaki zx6, kawasaki zzr 600, kawasaki ZX 10, Suzuki GSX-R600, Suzuki GSX-R1000, Suzuki GSX-R750, Suzuki Bandit1200, Suzuki GS 500, Suzuki sv 650, Suzuki SV1000, Suzuki S 40, Suzuki V Strom, triumph Daytona, triumph scrambler, triumph speed, triumph thruxton, triumph bonneville, yamaha FZ1, yamaha FZ6, yamaha R1, yamaha R6, yamaha virago without windshields and saddlebags) Go up to XL if the case. Dimension: 94\"Lx37\"Wx49\"H", "text": "Light Weight Motorcycle cover (L). Fits up to 84\" length sport bike, dirt bike, small cruiser. Factory Direct! StreetStar 300 L Color:Black top/Silver bottom A high-quality, lightweight and water-resistant cover. The perfect travel cover whether you want to cover your bike at work or a cross country trip. This cover folds small and light yet gives big time protection against the elements. Our best selling model, we have sold tens of thousands of these around the globe and they really get the job done -Constructed of water repellent, breathable \"Weather guard\" Polyester. -Double-top stitched for durability. -Lower panel is heat resistant \"Thermo guard\". -Clam shell vents prevent condensation and lofting. -A chamois panel is stitched in where cover would touch windscreen and fuel tank areas to prevent scratches. -Reinforced Poly grommets are at center and at front wheel area for security and a snug fit and will accept a cable lock. -Storage bag included. -ONE year warranty from manufacture defects. 300 series (L) fits most sport bikes under 1000cc's and small cruisers under 750cc's without wind shields (i.e. Yamaha R1-R6, Yamaha FZ1-FZ, bmw boneville, bmw f800s, ducati 996, honda CBR 600, honda 919, honda 599, honda CBR F4i, honda 1000RR, honda VFR, honda VLX, honda VTR, kawasaki ninja500, kawasaki ninja600, kawasaki ninja650, kawa ninja-1000, kawasaki z 1000, kawasaki zx6, kawasaki zzr 600, kawasaki ZX 10, Suzuki GSX-R600, Suzuki GSX-R1000, Suzuki GSX-R750, Suzuki Bandit1200, Suzuki GS 500, Suzuki sv 650, Suzuki SV1000, Suzuki S 40, Suzuki V Strom, triumph Daytona, triumph scrambler, triumph speed, triumph thruxton, triumph bonneville, yamaha FZ1, yamaha FZ6, yamaha R1, yamaha R6, yamaha virago without windshields and saddlebags) Go up to XL if the case. Dimension: 94\"Lx37\"Wx49\"H", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rpMMvRgNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SKWF82.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Covers"]]}}
