{"item_id": "B000SMVYTG", "title": "Yogitoes Skidless Premium Mat-Size Yoga Towel", "description": "Our famed SKIDLESS towel is so unique, that it's an absolute yoga necessity. Not only does it prevent slipping on your yoga mat, it stabilizes your practice, it puts a hygienic layer between you and the yoga mat, easy to care for, is quick drying and is perfect for the traveling fitness enthusiast. There is no other product on the market like it.", "text": "Yogitoes Skidless Premium Mat-Size Yoga Towel Our famed SKIDLESS towel is so unique, that it's an absolute yoga necessity. Not only does it prevent slipping on your yoga mat, it stabilizes your practice, it puts a hygienic layer between you and the yoga mat, easy to care for, is quick drying and is perfect for the traveling fitness enthusiast. There is no other product on the market like it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uHYWB26-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SMVYTG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yogitoes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 54.0}}
