{"item_id": "B000SORRSQ", "title": "Heat Factory Large Hand and Body Warmer", "description": "", "text": "Heat Factory Large Hand and Body Warmer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mdc%2BSXnML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SORRSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000SOTJPU", "title": "Heat Factory Toe and Foot Warmer with Adhesive", "description": "Heat Factory toe warmers are designed for use in the restricted air environment of a shoe or boot. The half moon-shaped toe warmer adheres to the bottom of your sock for comfortable warmth. Ideal for daily use in shoes, ski boots, or whenever toes are cold. Provides soothing, gentle heat for up to 6 hours. Not intended for use in open air. The Heat Factory warmer is a soft, lightweight pouch containing a biodegradable mixture of iron powder, charcoal, salt, sawdust and vermiculite. When exposed to the air, an oxidation process takes place that generates heat. Heat Factory warmers are specially engineered to provide heat that is long-lasting, comfortable and even. Heat Factory continually tests its products to ensure that you receive only the highest quality warmers that will consistently deliver warmth as advertised. Once activated, Heat Factory warmers can even be saved for later use (preferably within a week) if placed in an airtight container. Unopened, the Heat Factory warmer has a shelf life of three years or more.", "text": "Heat Factory Toe and Foot Warmer with Adhesive Heat Factory toe warmers are designed for use in the restricted air environment of a shoe or boot. The half moon-shaped toe warmer adheres to the bottom of your sock for comfortable warmth. Ideal for daily use in shoes, ski boots, or whenever toes are cold. Provides soothing, gentle heat for up to 6 hours. Not intended for use in open air. The Heat Factory warmer is a soft, lightweight pouch containing a biodegradable mixture of iron powder, charcoal, salt, sawdust and vermiculite. When exposed to the air, an oxidation process takes place that generates heat. Heat Factory warmers are specially engineered to provide heat that is long-lasting, comfortable and even. Heat Factory continually tests its products to ensure that you receive only the highest quality warmers that will consistently deliver warmth as advertised. Once activated, Heat Factory warmers can even be saved for later use (preferably within a week) if placed in an airtight container. Unopened, the Heat Factory warmer has a shelf life of three years or more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F0CSNVm%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SOTJPU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000SPDS9C", "title": "Well D93 Airsoft Full Size Uzi Style Auto Electric Pistol", "description": "Full Auto Airsoft Uzi, features include: Large 200 round gravity fed magazine, full-automatic fire, rechargeable battery pack, battery charger, small supply of BBs, shoots 100-125 FPS.", "text": "Well D93 Airsoft Full Size Uzi Style Auto Electric Pistol Full Auto Airsoft Uzi, features include: Large 200 round gravity fed magazine, full-automatic fire, rechargeable battery pack, battery charger, small supply of BBs, shoots 100-125 FPS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413D9MIu38L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SPDS9C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Well", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 21.0}}
{"item_id": "B000SPJAQW", "title": "Well P-90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric", "description": "Very simliar to Mini Electric Airsoft guns, however full size version. Hold the trigger down and they keep firing! It shoots 6mm soft air pellets. Battery requied Each gun comes packed with 100 pellets in a beautiful color box. Don't forget to order extra ammo. These shoot farther and faster than most full auto airsoft guns. You will not be disappointed with the quality or the durability. This gun is made of ABS plastic. You can fire this gun as a semi auto if you push the trigger for one second. This is a fully automatic machine gun.", "text": "Well P-90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric Very simliar to Mini Electric Airsoft guns, however full size version. Hold the trigger down and they keep firing! It shoots 6mm soft air pellets. Battery requied Each gun comes packed with 100 pellets in a beautiful color box. Don't forget to order extra ammo. These shoot farther and faster than most full auto airsoft guns. You will not be disappointed with the quality or the durability. This gun is made of ABS plastic. You can fire this gun as a semi auto if you push the trigger for one second. This is a fully automatic machine gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312nCDFIg4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SPJAQW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000SPJNB4", "title": "3M General Purpose Vinyl Tape 764 White, 2 in x 36 yd 5.0 mil (Pack of 1)", "description": "3M General Purpose Vinyl Tape 764 Black, 5.0 mil (0.125 mm) vinyl backing with a rubber adhesive, conformability, good instant adhesion.", "text": "3M General Purpose Vinyl Tape 764 White, 2 in x 36 yd 5.0 mil (Pack of 1) 3M General Purpose Vinyl Tape 764 Black, 5.0 mil (0.125 mm) vinyl backing with a rubber adhesive, conformability, good instant adhesion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NeKIVOnNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SPJNB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Ice Hockey", "Accessories", "Grips & Tapes"]], "price": 5.2}}
{"item_id": "B000STDIEI", "title": "Hogue Browning Hi-Power Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Browning Hi-Power Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E8xjeTIZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000STDIEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.92}}
{"item_id": "B000STIMO4", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus Model PT111 / Keltec Model P11 Grip Extension", "description": "The PG-11 grip extension replaces the magazine base plate. It provides better comfort by adding approximately 1/2 inch of gripping surface. The PG-11 does not alter the capacity of the magazine.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus Model PT111 / Keltec Model P11 Grip Extension The PG-11 grip extension replaces the magazine base plate. It provides better comfort by adding approximately 1/2 inch of gripping surface. The PG-11 does not alter the capacity of the magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LZb6e8SNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000STIMO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 4.65}}
{"item_id": "B000STIPXC", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W J Frame Round Butt Rubber Bantam Style Grip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip S&W J Frame Round Butt Rubber Bantam Style Grip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EnGSsMSLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000STIPXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 14.95}}
