{"item_id": "B000SULCTA", "title": "Mueller APV AO Rifle Scope, Black, 4.5-14 x 40mm", "description": "Designed for the Shooter by the Shooter. The Mueller APV (All-Purpose Variable) fills the gap left by other brands for the need of an inexpensive all-purpose scope. The Mueller APV has an extremely wide angle field of view, combined with edge-to-edge clarity that out performs anything in its class and at a price that is second to none.", "text": "Mueller APV AO Rifle Scope, Black, 4.5-14 x 40mm Designed for the Shooter by the Shooter. The Mueller APV (All-Purpose Variable) fills the gap left by other brands for the need of an inexpensive all-purpose scope. The Mueller APV has an extremely wide angle field of view, combined with edge-to-edge clarity that out performs anything in its class and at a price that is second to none.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310m46-2mXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SULCTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mueller", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 134.95}}
{"item_id": "B000SULCUE", "title": "Mueller Quick Shot Rifle Scope", "description": "The Mueller Quick Shot sight has 2 built in sensors in the front that detects the surrounding lighting conditions and automatically adjusts the brightness of the dot to the these conditions, unlike all other Red Dot Scopes, which require manual adjustment. This new, innovative concept so important as lighting conditions change the user no longer needs to worry about manually adjusting the brightness of the dot, checking to see if it is adequate for the existing lighting conditions and continually making manual adjustments like all other Red Dot Sights. In rare cases there may be instances where the user could be in an area that is darker or brighter than the target area so we have also provided 10 manual brightness adjustment settings, which over-ride the auto setting, making this sight optimum for any situation. No other Reflex Style scope offers this many features. Select from 4 different Reticle styles with the flip of a switch. The Quick Shot is one of the most versatile illuminated sights ever produced.", "text": "Mueller Quick Shot Rifle Scope The Mueller Quick Shot sight has 2 built in sensors in the front that detects the surrounding lighting conditions and automatically adjusts the brightness of the dot to the these conditions, unlike all other Red Dot Scopes, which require manual adjustment. This new, innovative concept so important as lighting conditions change the user no longer needs to worry about manually adjusting the brightness of the dot, checking to see if it is adequate for the existing lighting conditions and continually making manual adjustments like all other Red Dot Sights. In rare cases there may be instances where the user could be in an area that is darker or brighter than the target area so we have also provided 10 manual brightness adjustment settings, which over-ride the auto setting, making this sight optimum for any situation. No other Reflex Style scope offers this many features. Select from 4 different Reticle styles with the flip of a switch. The Quick Shot is one of the most versatile illuminated sights ever produced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TKTTwrjML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SULCUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mueller", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B000SXN90C", "title": "Malone Standard Foam Block Universal Car Top Canoe Carrier Kit", "description": "An ideal budget option for canoeists, the Malone standard canoe kit includes everything you need to haul a single canoe on short trips. The canoe kit comes with four 6-inch non-skid universal foam blocks to hold the canoe in place, along with two 15-foot tie-down cords, a 15-foot heavy-duty strap, a set of bow and stern safety tie-downs, and four S-hooks. The blocks are made of high-quality EVA closed-cell foam, ensuring a soft ride for your canoe. The tie-downs, meanwhile, fit to the front, rear, and sides of your vehicle for maximum safety. (The kit also fits round, square, or factory oval cross rails.) Finally, the kit comes with a re-usable storage container and carrying case.About Malone Auto RacksMalone is the fastest-growing rack accessory company in North America, with a track record of more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in more than 1,500 outdoor online and retail stores throughout the U.S., Canada, Australia, and Europe. Malone operates from the coast of Maine, helping the company stay true to its mission and values. Everything Malone sells must be \"simple to sell, simple to install, and simple to use.\" The company is built to enhance its customers' enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans while minimizing their carbon footprint through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling.", "text": "Malone Standard Foam Block Universal Car Top Canoe Carrier Kit An ideal budget option for canoeists, the Malone standard canoe kit includes everything you need to haul a single canoe on short trips. The canoe kit comes with four 6-inch non-skid universal foam blocks to hold the canoe in place, along with two 15-foot tie-down cords, a 15-foot heavy-duty strap, a set of bow and stern safety tie-downs, and four S-hooks. The blocks are made of high-quality EVA closed-cell foam, ensuring a soft ride for your canoe. The tie-downs, meanwhile, fit to the front, rear, and sides of your vehicle for maximum safety. (The kit also fits round, square, or factory oval cross rails.) Finally, the kit comes with a re-usable storage container and carrying case.About Malone Auto RacksMalone is the fastest-growing rack accessory company in North America, with a track record of more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in more than 1,500 outdoor online and retail stores throughout the U.S., Canada, Australia, and Europe. Malone operates from the coast of Maine, helping the company stay true to its mission and values. Everything Malone sells must be \"simple to sell, simple to install, and simple to use.\" The company is built to enhance its customers' enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans while minimizing their carbon footprint through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q9de99jVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SXN90C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 41.95}}
{"item_id": "B000SXN90M", "title": "Malone J-Dock Hybrid Kayak and Gear Garage Storage Racks", "description": "Safely store all your gear up and out of the way with the Malone JDock hybrid kayak/gear storage racks. Equipped with two oversized cradles, the easy-to-install JDock safely holds everything from a pair of kayaks (with paddles) to skis and snowboards to bikes.The JDock racks store everything from kayaks to snowboards to bikes.The JDock also comes with two 12-foot cam buckle straps, two 30-inch gear loops, and two 2-1/2-inch mounting bolts. And users don't have to keep the JDock inside, as the corrosion-resistant cradles install on outside walls, too. The JDock hybrid racks--which support up to 150 pounds--measure 16 by 10 by 5 inches (W x H x D) each and weigh 9 pounds.About Malone Auto RacksMalone is the fastest-growing rack accessory company in North America, with a track record of more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in more than 1,500 outdoor online and retail stores throughout the U.S., Canada, Australia, and Europe. Malone operates from the coast of Maine, helping the company stay true to its mission and values. Everything Malone sells must be \"simple to sell, simple to install, and simple to use.\" The company is built to enhance its customers' enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans while minimizing their carbon footprint through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling.", "text": "Malone J-Dock Hybrid Kayak and Gear Garage Storage Racks Safely store all your gear up and out of the way with the Malone JDock hybrid kayak/gear storage racks. Equipped with two oversized cradles, the easy-to-install JDock safely holds everything from a pair of kayaks (with paddles) to skis and snowboards to bikes.The JDock racks store everything from kayaks to snowboards to bikes.The JDock also comes with two 12-foot cam buckle straps, two 30-inch gear loops, and two 2-1/2-inch mounting bolts. And users don't have to keep the JDock inside, as the corrosion-resistant cradles install on outside walls, too. The JDock hybrid racks--which support up to 150 pounds--measure 16 by 10 by 5 inches (W x H x D) each and weigh 9 pounds.About Malone Auto RacksMalone is the fastest-growing rack accessory company in North America, with a track record of more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in more than 1,500 outdoor online and retail stores throughout the U.S., Canada, Australia, and Europe. Malone operates from the coast of Maine, helping the company stay true to its mission and values. Everything Malone sells must be \"simple to sell, simple to install, and simple to use.\" The company is built to enhance its customers' enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans while minimizing their carbon footprint through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Lv2lM3%2BvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000SXN90M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Covers"]], "price": 67.95}}
