{"item_id": "B000T97S6G", "title": "Trophy Ridge Slik Tip Carbon Field Points", "description": "Practice and perfect your accuracy with the Trophy Ridge Slik Tip Carbon Field Points! Great for practice or tournament use, these carbon arrow points come in a pack of 6 and are available in 100 or 125 grain weights.", "text": "Trophy Ridge Slik Tip Carbon Field Points Practice and perfect your accuracy with the Trophy Ridge Slik Tip Carbon Field Points! Great for practice or tournament use, these carbon arrow points come in a pack of 6 and are available in 100 or 125 grain weights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wpcZyjBBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000T97S6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trophy Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Points"]], "price": 12.82}}
