{"item_id": "B000TG9RCC", "title": "Gunvault MV500-STD Microvault Pistol Gun Safe", "description": "Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. We know that security and reliability are prevailing priorities when you need our products, and that's why Gunvault pistol safes have the features you want. The MV500-STD comes with our patented No-Eyes Keypad that provides lighting-quick access, even in the dark. The improved high strength lock mechanism and precise fittings make it virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes are available. The audio feedback feature instantly confirms correct keypad entries and can also be disabled to allow \"stealth\" mode operation. The safe is battery powered for maximum security and easy portability. A tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts and a built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries.", "text": "Gunvault MV500-STD Microvault Pistol Gun Safe Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. We know that security and reliability are prevailing priorities when you need our products, and that's why Gunvault pistol safes have the features you want. The MV500-STD comes with our patented No-Eyes Keypad that provides lighting-quick access, even in the dark. The improved high strength lock mechanism and precise fittings make it virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes are available. The audio feedback feature instantly confirms correct keypad entries and can also be disabled to allow \"stealth\" mode operation. The safe is battery powered for maximum security and easy portability. A tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts and a built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bhl9smW6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000TG9RCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GunVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 90.14}}
{"item_id": "B000TH4MMG", "title": "Kool Stop Replacement Bicycle Disc Brake Pads", "description": "Kool-Stop sintered metal disc brake pads are designed to give your bike performance braking in extreme conditions, e.g. XC, downhill, trials and dual slalom riding. Our pads have a quick break-in period so you get maximum performance during those demanding rides when stopping power, durability and long pad life are required. Sintered metal compounds have a higher resistance to brake fluid contamination and should not be used on Ceradure® ceramic rotors or in closed hydraulic systems.", "text": "Kool Stop Replacement Bicycle Disc Brake Pads Kool-Stop sintered metal disc brake pads are designed to give your bike performance braking in extreme conditions, e.g. XC, downhill, trials and dual slalom riding. Our pads have a quick break-in period so you get maximum performance during those demanding rides when stopping power, durability and long pad life are required. Sintered metal compounds have a higher resistance to brake fluid contamination and should not be used on Ceradure® ceramic rotors or in closed hydraulic systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519af5rmOxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000TH4MMG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]]}}
