{"item_id": "B000TN1QVU", "title": "NcStar AK/SKS Front Sight Ajustment Tool (TAK)", "description": "Unique tool solves the problems involved with sighting in your SKS or AK-style rifle or carbine. Solid machined steel construction for years of dependable service. Works for windage as well as elevation. Technical Information Material: Steel Finish: Black Features: Adjusts windage and elevation Notes: This tool is designed to adjust the front sight for elevation and windage.", "text": "NcStar AK/SKS Front Sight Ajustment Tool (TAK) Unique tool solves the problems involved with sighting in your SKS or AK-style rifle or carbine. Solid machined steel construction for years of dependable service. Works for windage as well as elevation. Technical Information Material: Steel Finish: Black Features: Adjusts windage and elevation Notes: This tool is designed to adjust the front sight for elevation and windage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SyBvRSkdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000TN1QVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 6.97}}
{"item_id": "B000TQB7VG", "title": "Cascade Creek YAKCLIP Kayak Paddle Holder", "description": "These Yakclips allow boaters to clip-on paddles to boats, and with no holes to drill, they only take two seconds to install! The Yakclips are adjustable and removable without any tools and come with two accessory clips built in for holding fishing poles, dry bags and more.", "text": "Cascade Creek YAKCLIP Kayak Paddle Holder These Yakclips allow boaters to clip-on paddles to boats, and with no holes to drill, they only take two seconds to install! The Yakclips are adjustable and removable without any tools and come with two accessory clips built in for holding fishing poles, dry bags and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4144%2BY2ygjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000TQB7VG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cascade Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 8.5}}
