{"item_id": "B000U416EK", "title": "Otis Deluxe Rifle/Pistol Cleaning System", "description": "There are those who collect guns with the aim of putting them on display—and there are those who show off their collections by putting them to work at the range or in the field. Keep every one of those firearms performing flawlessly. Contains the brushes needed to clean and maintain .22 - .40 caliber rifles and pistols. Patch cleans up to .45 caliber.", "text": "Otis Deluxe Rifle/Pistol Cleaning System There are those who collect guns with the aim of putting them on display—and there are those who show off their collections by putting them to work at the range or in the field. Keep every one of those firearms performing flawlessly. Contains the brushes needed to clean and maintain .22 - .40 caliber rifles and pistols. Patch cleans up to .45 caliber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qppgfYsFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U416EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 44.19}}
{"item_id": "B000U416T0", "title": "Outers 28 - Piece Universal Wood Gun Cleaning Box (.22 Caliber and up)", "description": "Outers is excited to offer a full line of attractive, wooden specialty kits to perform cleanings quickly and effectively. Each kit is specifically created to work on all different calibers and gauges, as well as for all gun types, and boast an attractive full wood grain appearance for years of enjoyment. This attractive aged oak finished box stores 28 pieces of gun cleaning gear. With premium brass rods and all the necessary mops and brushes to clean 22-caliber gun and large, this box is perfect for keeping all you gun cleaning tools organized. This kit includes a latched wooden storage box, custom parts organizer, 3 solid brass rods (rifle, pistol and shotgun), 8 bronze brushes (22-cal, 270-cal/7mm, 30-cal/8mm, 9mm/.38/.357, .40-45 cal/10mm, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 mops (.22-25-cal, .38-357-cal, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 spear pointed jags (.22-cal, 270-cal/7mm, .30-32-cal, 35-cal/9mm, 45-cal), 2 slotted patch loops (rifle/pistol and shotgun), double-ended nylon brush, double-ended nylon cleaning pick, 50 cleaning patches, and shotgun accessory adaptor.", "text": "Outers 28 - Piece Universal Wood Gun Cleaning Box (.22 Caliber and up) Outers is excited to offer a full line of attractive, wooden specialty kits to perform cleanings quickly and effectively. Each kit is specifically created to work on all different calibers and gauges, as well as for all gun types, and boast an attractive full wood grain appearance for years of enjoyment. This attractive aged oak finished box stores 28 pieces of gun cleaning gear. With premium brass rods and all the necessary mops and brushes to clean 22-caliber gun and large, this box is perfect for keeping all you gun cleaning tools organized. This kit includes a latched wooden storage box, custom parts organizer, 3 solid brass rods (rifle, pistol and shotgun), 8 bronze brushes (22-cal, 270-cal/7mm, 30-cal/8mm, 9mm/.38/.357, .40-45 cal/10mm, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 mops (.22-25-cal, .38-357-cal, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 spear pointed jags (.22-cal, 270-cal/7mm, .30-32-cal, 35-cal/9mm, 45-cal), 2 slotted patch loops (rifle/pistol and shotgun), double-ended nylon brush, double-ended nylon cleaning pick, 50 cleaning patches, and shotgun accessory adaptor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GesGYtKML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U416T0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 19.99}}
