{"item_id": "B000U43C1U", "title": "Safariland Glock 20, 21 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Glock 20, 21 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VPy-HcTNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U43C1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000U51S0G", "title": "Tipton Ultra Jag Set", "description": "Conveniently packaged 12-piece caliber-specific set of Ultra Jags means you always have the right jag at hand. Contained in a durable, hinged box with marked cavities, it's easy to select the correct Ultra Jag for your particular application. Because they are caliber-specific, you can be assured of an optimum fit to your firearm's bore for efficient and thorough cleaning. 17 to 45 caliber (does not include 20 caliber). All jags have 8-32 threads (17caliber has 5-40 threads).", "text": "Tipton Ultra Jag Set Conveniently packaged 12-piece caliber-specific set of Ultra Jags means you always have the right jag at hand. Contained in a durable, hinged box with marked cavities, it's easy to select the correct Ultra Jag for your particular application. Because they are caliber-specific, you can be assured of an optimum fit to your firearm's bore for efficient and thorough cleaning. 17 to 45 caliber (does not include 20 caliber). All jags have 8-32 threads (17caliber has 5-40 threads).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fVdEOGVXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U51S0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Jags"]], "price": 14.54}}
{"item_id": "B000U53TBM", "title": "Laserlyte Smith and Wesson Sigma Rail Adapter", "description": "LaserLyte reintroduces its most popular and best selling rail adapter ever. The Smith and Wesston Sigma mount now allows all Picatinny accessories to be mounted on the rail adapter. The mount clamps onto the frame using steel hardware and the glass-filled composite polymer rails will endure the toughest of duties. This works great for lights and especially for LaserLyte lasers.", "text": "Laserlyte Smith and Wesson Sigma Rail Adapter LaserLyte reintroduces its most popular and best selling rail adapter ever. The Smith and Wesston Sigma mount now allows all Picatinny accessories to be mounted on the rail adapter. The mount clamps onto the frame using steel hardware and the glass-filled composite polymer rails will endure the toughest of duties. This works great for lights and especially for LaserLyte lasers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aLG08B9jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U53TBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 6.14}}
