{"item_id": "B000U5P0DW", "title": "JBL Speargun 19 inch Mini Carbine JBL Spearguns (D5)", "description": "Dont let the price tag fool you, the Carbine series delivers more bang for your buck than anything in its class. Just like its bigger brother, Carbines are constructed of aerospace grade aluminum and feature high-strength stainless shafts and triggers. The Mini is powered by one Hi-Mod band and a low-profile, pistol grip handle that makes for easy target acquisition.So, if you want a speargun that will bring home plenty of fish without breaking the bank, the Carbine fits the bill.", "text": "JBL Speargun 19 inch Mini Carbine JBL Spearguns (D5) Dont let the price tag fool you, the Carbine series delivers more bang for your buck than anything in its class. Just like its bigger brother, Carbines are constructed of aerospace grade aluminum and feature high-strength stainless shafts and triggers. The Mini is powered by one Hi-Mod band and a low-profile, pistol grip handle that makes for easy target acquisition.So, if you want a speargun that will bring home plenty of fish without breaking the bank, the Carbine fits the bill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gUNI6sCBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U5P0DW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JBL", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Ice Fishing Accessories", "Ice Spearing Equipment"]], "price": 86.4}}
