{"item_id": "B000U6FZGI", "title": "NcStar Pistol and Rifle Led Flashlight / Weaver Mount (APTF)", "description": "A convenient weapon accessory for serious shooters, this LED light attaches quickly and easily to a pistol or rifle with the included Weaver mount, providing ample downrange illumination.FeaturesUltra-bright one-watt LED lightLightweight aluminum bodyBlack matte finishStandard on/off cap switchIncludes Weaver mountSpecifications35-lumen peak illuminationUses CR123A lithium ion battery (included)Measures 1.1 by 1.3 by 3.3 inches (W x H x D)Three-ounce weightAbout NcSTARFounded in 1997, NcSTAR produces reasonably priced, quality optics with innovative designs. NcSTAR products are built to high quality control standards, and are designed to last for the lifetime of the product. NcSTAR optics are the preferred choice of many professional users, armed forces, and consumers ranging from airsoft to wildlife observation uses.", "text": "NcStar Pistol and Rifle Led Flashlight / Weaver Mount (APTF) A convenient weapon accessory for serious shooters, this LED light attaches quickly and easily to a pistol or rifle with the included Weaver mount, providing ample downrange illumination.FeaturesUltra-bright one-watt LED lightLightweight aluminum bodyBlack matte finishStandard on/off cap switchIncludes Weaver mountSpecifications35-lumen peak illuminationUses CR123A lithium ion battery (included)Measures 1.1 by 1.3 by 3.3 inches (W x H x D)Three-ounce weightAbout NcSTARFounded in 1997, NcSTAR produces reasonably priced, quality optics with innovative designs. NcSTAR products are built to high quality control standards, and are designed to last for the lifetime of the product. NcSTAR optics are the preferred choice of many professional users, armed forces, and consumers ranging from airsoft to wildlife observation uses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4193EouUYKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U6FZGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 21.99}}
