{"item_id": "B000U9BY0Q", "title": "Opinel No 12 Carbon Steel Knive", "description": "Carbon has a low resistance to corrosion caused by moisture, which means that certain precautionary measures are necessary when using and storing the knives: we recommend that you avoid damp environments and that you dry and grease the blade after use.", "text": "Opinel No 12 Carbon Steel Knive Carbon has a low resistance to corrosion caused by moisture, which means that certain precautionary measures are necessary when using and storing the knives: we recommend that you avoid damp environments and that you dry and grease the blade after use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Dgeu1hb4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000U9BY0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Opinel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B000UCC1VE", "title": "Tell Bell - (white)", "description": "Tell Bell makes \"gotta go\" clear as a bell! Tell Bell is a specialized dog training device that permits a dog to \"tell\" his owner when he needs to go outside to potty! When your dog presses down on the paw print of the Tell Bell, it rings, telling you that your dog needs to go outside. Tell Bell is the fast, easy and fun way to house-train your dog. Each box has a step by step training DVD, manual and TWO Tell Bells, so you have an extra one for traveling or larger homes.", "text": "Tell Bell - (white) Tell Bell makes \"gotta go\" clear as a bell! Tell Bell is a specialized dog training device that permits a dog to \"tell\" his owner when he needs to go outside to potty! When your dog presses down on the paw print of the Tell Bell, it rings, telling you that your dog needs to go outside. Tell Bell is the fast, easy and fun way to house-train your dog. Each box has a step by step training DVD, manual and TWO Tell Bells, so you have an extra one for traveling or larger homes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Uqz5Q7heL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UCC1VE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Bells"]], "price": 24.97}}
{"item_id": "B000UD6BN2", "title": "Do Wrap/Wickie Wear Genuine Do Wrap Sweatvac Ventilator Cap - Black , Distinct Name: Black, Size: OSFM, Primary Color: Black, Gender: Mens/Unisex 65201833031", "description": "Distinct Name: BlackSize: OSFMPrimary Color: BlackGender: Mens/UnisexRated for temperatures and heat indexes from warm to hotCombines the seamless contour superb sweat management of the Skull Cap with a 4-way stretch mesh top3 wide DriSmart shell with Transpor liner keeps the sweat from pouring into your eyes while the mesh top provides excellent ventilationGreat under helmets in extreme heatMade in USA", "text": "Do Wrap/Wickie Wear Genuine Do Wrap Sweatvac Ventilator Cap - Black , Distinct Name: Black, Size: OSFM, Primary Color: Black, Gender: Mens/Unisex 65201833031 Distinct Name: BlackSize: OSFMPrimary Color: BlackGender: Mens/UnisexRated for temperatures and heat indexes from warm to hotCombines the seamless contour superb sweat management of the Skull Cap with a 4-way stretch mesh top3 wide DriSmart shell with Transpor liner keeps the sweat from pouring into your eyes while the mesh top provides excellent ventilationGreat under helmets in extreme heatMade in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kQu59pGIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UD6BN2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do Wrap Performance Headwear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 15.52}}
{"item_id": "B000UECKH2", "title": "Serfas Seca Wire Bead Tire with FPS", "description": "Lightweight and fast, the Seca Tire from Serfas is the ultimate endurance tire for road and trainer use. Featuring a tread pattern optimized for longevity and handling, the Seca features a 60-durometer center ridge for long life and a 56-durometer sides for enhanced cornering capability. The wire bead design offers a secure fit and the integrated Flat Protection System provides superior puncture resistance. Delivering the quality you want at a reasonable price point, the Seca is an excellent choice for road riders of all stripes.Specifications:Weight = 295 Grams,Bead: WirePressure: 125 PSI", "text": "Serfas Seca Wire Bead Tire with FPS Lightweight and fast, the Seca Tire from Serfas is the ultimate endurance tire for road and trainer use. Featuring a tread pattern optimized for longevity and handling, the Seca features a 60-durometer center ridge for long life and a 56-durometer sides for enhanced cornering capability. The wire bead design offers a secure fit and the integrated Flat Protection System provides superior puncture resistance. Delivering the quality you want at a reasonable price point, the Seca is an excellent choice for road riders of all stripes.Specifications:Weight = 295 Grams,Bead: WirePressure: 125 PSI", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217TbcTqoTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UECKH2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UEP0NI", "title": "FitDeck Bodyweight", "description": "FitDeck is a unique deck of Exercise Playing Cards that makes exercise more simple, convenient, and fun. FitDecks are available in 56-card and 26-card Booster decks. 56-card FitDecks specialize in bodyweight-only exercises. 26-card Boosters may require certain equipment (i.e. Exercise Ball, Pull Up bar, Dumbbell, Balance Dome, Kettlebell, etc.). Boosters can be used as a standalone workout or they can be combined with other FitDecks to create an even more challenging routine. Each card has three fitness levels to accommodate different abilities (beginner, intermediate, advanced). Cards are held in a plastic cardholder making it easy to carry and draw cards while on the go.", "text": "FitDeck Bodyweight FitDeck is a unique deck of Exercise Playing Cards that makes exercise more simple, convenient, and fun. FitDecks are available in 56-card and 26-card Booster decks. 56-card FitDecks specialize in bodyweight-only exercises. 26-card Boosters may require certain equipment (i.e. Exercise Ball, Pull Up bar, Dumbbell, Balance Dome, Kettlebell, etc.). Boosters can be used as a standalone workout or they can be combined with other FitDecks to create an even more challenging routine. Each card has three fitness levels to accommodate different abilities (beginner, intermediate, advanced). Cards are held in a plastic cardholder making it easy to carry and draw cards while on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I7Brvd16L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UEP0NI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B000UG67RY", "title": "Windstorm Safety Whistle", "description": "The Storm Alert Whistle is one of the loudest whistles on the market. Its dual-chamber construction means it can be heard over the roar of wind and even or even under water. Attach one to your backpack, whenever you venture into the backcountry. It's a survival basic.", "text": "Windstorm Safety Whistle The Storm Alert Whistle is one of the loudest whistles on the market. Its dual-chamber construction means it can be heard over the roar of wind and even or even under water. Attach one to your backpack, whenever you venture into the backcountry. It's a survival basic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fu4VWrViL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UG67RY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wind Storm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 6.77}}
{"item_id": "B000UGVI4G", "title": "Lightload Towels Three Pack(12x24\"), the Only Towels That Are Survival Tools", "description": "The lightest towel around and the only towel that is a survival tool as well. It can be used as insulation, wind/winter scarf, first aid supplement, fire starter, mask, diaper & beauty wrap. Superabsorbent (up to 10 times it's weight), fast drying, reusable, 100% viscose material. Hand washable. Waterproof packaging ensures a dry towel when you need it. 12\" x 24\" and weighs .6 oz. - about the size of a wooden nickel.", "text": "Lightload Towels Three Pack(12x24\"), the Only Towels That Are Survival Tools The lightest towel around and the only towel that is a survival tool as well. It can be used as insulation, wind/winter scarf, first aid supplement, fire starter, mask, diaper & beauty wrap. Superabsorbent (up to 10 times it's weight), fast drying, reusable, 100% viscose material. Hand washable. Waterproof packaging ensures a dry towel when you need it. 12\" x 24\" and weighs .6 oz. - about the size of a wooden nickel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F7y7t1a3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UGVI4G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lightload", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 5.95}}
