{"item_id": "B000UH2MFO", "title": "Opinel Traditional No 9 Carbon Steel Knife", "description": "Opinel. 4 3/4 closed. Beechwood handle and tempered high carbon steel blade with crowned hand hallmark etching. All feature safety ring for locking the blade.\"", "text": "Opinel Traditional No 9 Carbon Steel Knife Opinel. 4 3/4 closed. Beechwood handle and tempered high carbon steel blade with crowned hand hallmark etching. All feature safety ring for locking the blade.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SSgSwoS5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UH2MFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Opinel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B000UI0VE2", "title": "Tasco .22 Rimfire 1x30mm 5 MOA Red Dot Riflescope", "description": "Rugged, reliable Tasco Red Dot Scopes deliver pinpoint precision in all lighting conditions thanks to an illuminated reticle with an 11-position brightness control. Unlimited eye relief and an ultra-wide field of view get you on target with lightning speed no matter the game.", "text": "Tasco .22 Rimfire 1x30mm 5 MOA Red Dot Riflescope Rugged, reliable Tasco Red Dot Scopes deliver pinpoint precision in all lighting conditions thanks to an illuminated reticle with an 11-position brightness control. Unlimited eye relief and an ultra-wide field of view get you on target with lightning speed no matter the game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519cLrnKYuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UI0VE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 39.63}}
{"item_id": "B000UI0VOC", "title": "Tasco World Class 1.5-4.5x32mm, Matte PS Reticle Riflescope", "description": "Ask any taxidermist or trophy hunter and they'll tell you more tags are filled in the low-light hours than any other time. That said, it's wise to have a scope designed to excel in early morning and late evening light. Featuring Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multi-coated lenses for clarity and brightness in low light, you'll add precious minutes to every hunting day with the Banner Dusk and Dawn series. A fast-focus eyepiece and wide-angle field-of-view let you acquire and follow game easily - even in low light. The one-piece tube design ensures reliable performance and the fully waterproof construction protects your investment. The Banner Dusk and Dawn line includes a full assortment of specialty scopes for big game, varmint, .22 rimfire, slug, black powder and turkey hunting.", "text": "Tasco World Class 1.5-4.5x32mm, Matte PS Reticle Riflescope Ask any taxidermist or trophy hunter and they'll tell you more tags are filled in the low-light hours than any other time. That said, it's wise to have a scope designed to excel in early morning and late evening light. Featuring Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multi-coated lenses for clarity and brightness in low light, you'll add precious minutes to every hunting day with the Banner Dusk and Dawn series. A fast-focus eyepiece and wide-angle field-of-view let you acquire and follow game easily - even in low light. The one-piece tube design ensures reliable performance and the fully waterproof construction protects your investment. The Banner Dusk and Dawn line includes a full assortment of specialty scopes for big game, varmint, .22 rimfire, slug, black powder and turkey hunting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413ryJCKM0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UI0VOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 40.39}}
{"item_id": "B000UJ41Q0", "title": "Schwalbe High Pressure Fabric Bicycle Rim Tape - 1 Roll", "description": "Self-adhesive High Pressure Fabric Rim Tape is practical for the workshop use. The high quality polyester fabric tape is extremely resistant to pressure. Special adhesive prevents slippage under high load and temperature. Note: For racing cycle rims (13C, 14C) use 19 mm wide tape only!", "text": "Schwalbe High Pressure Fabric Bicycle Rim Tape - 1 Roll Self-adhesive High Pressure Fabric Rim Tape is practical for the workshop use. The high quality polyester fabric tape is extremely resistant to pressure. Special adhesive prevents slippage under high load and temperature. Note: For racing cycle rims (13C, 14C) use 19 mm wide tape only!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41whWhi6LvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UJ41Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
