{"item_id": "B000ULPVPI", "title": "Head Super Comp Overgrip", "description": "Offering a soft and comfortable feel, HEAD's super comp overgrip makes a great choice for all player types. Engineered to provide enhanced sweat absorption, this overgrip provides a nice balance between absorption and tack.", "text": "Head Super Comp Overgrip Offering a soft and comfortable feel, HEAD's super comp overgrip makes a great choice for all player types. Engineered to provide enhanced sweat absorption, this overgrip provides a nice balance between absorption and tack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4195TS-vNdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ULPVPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HEAD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Racquet Grips"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ULU7SY", "title": "Serfas Drifter Tire with FPS", "description": "Designed to handle the pavement or loose fire roads, the Drifter is an excellent choice for riders who want a fast ride on the road but don't want to lose traction on loose gravel roads or well-packed trails. Ideal for mountain bikes and hybrid comfort bikes, the Drifter offers exceptional puncture resistance, a secure fit, amazing durability, and a great feel.Specifications:Pressure: 45 to 65 (max) PSIWeight: 630 gramsTread type: invertedBead: Wire", "text": "Serfas Drifter Tire with FPS Designed to handle the pavement or loose fire roads, the Drifter is an excellent choice for riders who want a fast ride on the road but don't want to lose traction on loose gravel roads or well-packed trails. Ideal for mountain bikes and hybrid comfort bikes, the Drifter offers exceptional puncture resistance, a secure fit, amazing durability, and a great feel.Specifications:Pressure: 45 to 65 (max) PSIWeight: 630 gramsTread type: invertedBead: Wire", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Gal5fCfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ULU7SY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UMFT22", "title": "Gripmaster Pro Edition", "description": "The PRO is the most advanced Gripmaster hand exerciser. It's ideal for professional athletes and motivated individuals seeking maximum performance. The PRO expands on the ingenious design of the Gripmaster providing serious athletes with the most advanced technical hand exerciser in the world.", "text": "Gripmaster Pro Edition The PRO is the most advanced Gripmaster hand exerciser. It's ideal for professional athletes and motivated individuals seeking maximum performance. The PRO expands on the ingenious design of the Gripmaster providing serious athletes with the most advanced technical hand exerciser in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W46rzovIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UMFT22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gripmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 11.95}}
