{"item_id": "B000UNKQ7Y", "title": "Guide Gear Deer Cart", "description": "Save your back! Roll - about Guide Gear Deer Cart hauls up to 250 lbs. in the boonies. PRICED RIGHT! Roll your tree stand and gear in! Roll your downed deer out. All so effortlessly! Save! Shucks, this balanced (zero weight on the handle), welded steel Cart is Herculean strong. Silent, puncture-proof, 16\" solid rubber spoked wheels easily roll over the roughest terrain, dead falls, small streams and just about anything else in the way. A lot of my pals used to drag downed deer out of the deep backcountry with rope, back-breaking oomph and plenty of muscle. But then they wised up and now \"drive\" this roll-about Cart. It hauls up to 250 lbs. of gear and supplies. Takes that big trophy out of the deep woods with little effort. Folds flat like a pancake in seconds to fit in your vehicle or for compact storage. Cargo area is 19 x 64\", weighs 33 1/2 lbs. Anti-reflective finish. What a drag it would be if you missed this golden opportunity to bag a Deer, er, Cart. Order this dependable transporter today! Guide Gear Deer Cart", "text": "Guide Gear Deer Cart Save your back! Roll - about Guide Gear Deer Cart hauls up to 250 lbs. in the boonies. PRICED RIGHT! Roll your tree stand and gear in! Roll your downed deer out. All so effortlessly! Save! Shucks, this balanced (zero weight on the handle), welded steel Cart is Herculean strong. Silent, puncture-proof, 16\" solid rubber spoked wheels easily roll over the roughest terrain, dead falls, small streams and just about anything else in the way. A lot of my pals used to drag downed deer out of the deep backcountry with rope, back-breaking oomph and plenty of muscle. But then they wised up and now \"drive\" this roll-about Cart. It hauls up to 250 lbs. of gear and supplies. Takes that big trophy out of the deep woods with little effort. Folds flat like a pancake in seconds to fit in your vehicle or for compact storage. Cargo area is 19 x 64\", weighs 33 1/2 lbs. Anti-reflective finish. What a drag it would be if you missed this golden opportunity to bag a Deer, er, Cart. Order this dependable transporter today! Guide Gear Deer Cart", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UJFLBH72L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UNKQ7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Carts"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UNKSBI", "title": "Spalding NBA Game Ball Mini", "description": "Teach your kids to dribble and shoot hoops from an early age with this Spalding mini NBA game ball. The ball feels just like a full-size NBA game ball, with a premium outdoor cover that provides a superior grip with every dribble. The ball also bounces better thanks to the Cross Traxxion two-panel construction. The panels result in 1/3 fewer channels, decreasing the surface undulation and helping the ball bounce truer and more consistent. And kids will love the official NBA game ball series graphics, which make the mini ball look just like the real thing.About SpaldingAs a Division of Russell Corporation, the Spalding Group consists of three business units: Spalding in Springfield, MA; American Athletic, Inc. (AAI) in Jefferson, IA; and Huffy Sports, in Sussex, WI. The three companies, collectively combined, are now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball supplier of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of the Arena Football League (AFL) and Pop Warner.", "text": "Spalding NBA Game Ball Mini Teach your kids to dribble and shoot hoops from an early age with this Spalding mini NBA game ball. The ball feels just like a full-size NBA game ball, with a premium outdoor cover that provides a superior grip with every dribble. The ball also bounces better thanks to the Cross Traxxion two-panel construction. The panels result in 1/3 fewer channels, decreasing the surface undulation and helping the ball bounce truer and more consistent. And kids will love the official NBA game ball series graphics, which make the mini ball look just like the real thing.About SpaldingAs a Division of Russell Corporation, the Spalding Group consists of three business units: Spalding in Springfield, MA; American Athletic, Inc. (AAI) in Jefferson, IA; and Huffy Sports, in Sussex, WI. The three companies, collectively combined, are now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball supplier of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of the Arena Football League (AFL) and Pop Warner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61NcaTYwoiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UNKSBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Basketballs"]], "price": 12.03}}
{"item_id": "B000UOL5Q4", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Holster", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Holster offers an ultra-thin, three-layer nylon laminate that provides comfortable next-to-skin wear and a smooth nylon for easy draw. The belt clip slips over pant top or belt to retain holster.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Holster The BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Holster offers an ultra-thin, three-layer nylon laminate that provides comfortable next-to-skin wear and a smooth nylon for easy draw. The belt clip slips over pant top or belt to retain holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/616OW-0EmwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UOL5Q4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UPFH4E", "title": "RWS .22 Pellet Model 34 Combo Rifle (Wood, Large)", "description": "The RWS Model 34 rifle will keep you shooting accurately and powerfully. While it doesn't have some of the fancy features that more expensive guns have, it is the most popular RWS rifle. The well-balanced Monte Carlo stock is made of hardwood which makes it easy to hold and shoot while the ambidextrous cheekpiece provides extra comfort as you zero in on your target. Made by German craftsmen, the Model 34 has a two-stage adjustable trigger, an adjustable rear sight and a rifled barrel. At just 33 pounds, there is no need to worry about cocking difficulty. Both the .177 and .22 calibers are ideal for plinking, paper and spinning air gun targets. If you like to hunt the .22 cal is a good choice for small game and pests. If you expect value and quality in one airgun, the RWS 34 is for you!", "text": "RWS .22 Pellet Model 34 Combo Rifle (Wood, Large) The RWS Model 34 rifle will keep you shooting accurately and powerfully. While it doesn't have some of the fancy features that more expensive guns have, it is the most popular RWS rifle. The well-balanced Monte Carlo stock is made of hardwood which makes it easy to hold and shoot while the ambidextrous cheekpiece provides extra comfort as you zero in on your target. Made by German craftsmen, the Model 34 has a two-stage adjustable trigger, an adjustable rear sight and a rifled barrel. At just 33 pounds, there is no need to worry about cocking difficulty. Both the .177 and .22 calibers are ideal for plinking, paper and spinning air gun targets. If you like to hunt the .22 cal is a good choice for small game and pests. If you expect value and quality in one airgun, the RWS 34 is for you!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21BEO2Br-bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UPFH4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 358.27}}
{"item_id": "B000UPGMXY", "title": "Plano Molding 1819 XXL Storage Box", "description": "This XXL storage trunk from Plano provides weather resistant storage for bulky and oversized gear wherever you need it--from the garage to the back of your truck and from the porch to the basement. Equipped with integrated wheels and recessed handles, it easy to move the box around, even when loaded. Meanwhile, heavy-duty, impact resistant plastic construction makes the box durable and lightweight. The box is additionally equipped with four heavy-duty latches, three padlock tabs, molded grooves for stacking, and tie down brackets on each end. The box measures 37.75 by 18.25 by 14 inches (LxWxH).Features and Specifications:Heavy-duty impact resistant plastic constructionIntegrated wheels for easy transportFour heavy-duty latchesThree padlock tabs for added securityMolded grooves for stackingTie-down brackets on each endRecessed handlesDimensions: 37.75 by 18.25 by 14 inches (LxWxH)", "text": "Plano Molding 1819 XXL Storage Box This XXL storage trunk from Plano provides weather resistant storage for bulky and oversized gear wherever you need it--from the garage to the back of your truck and from the porch to the basement. Equipped with integrated wheels and recessed handles, it easy to move the box around, even when loaded. Meanwhile, heavy-duty, impact resistant plastic construction makes the box durable and lightweight. The box is additionally equipped with four heavy-duty latches, three padlock tabs, molded grooves for stacking, and tie down brackets on each end. The box measures 37.75 by 18.25 by 14 inches (LxWxH).Features and Specifications:Heavy-duty impact resistant plastic constructionIntegrated wheels for easy transportFour heavy-duty latchesThree padlock tabs for added securityMolded grooves for stackingTie-down brackets on each endRecessed handlesDimensions: 37.75 by 18.25 by 14 inches (LxWxH)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CwFb%2BdJ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UPGMXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano Molding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 47.95}}
{"item_id": "B000UPNHT6", "title": "NFL Men's Victory Gear VI Short Sleeve T-Shirt", "description": "The perfect game day tee for when you want to keep comfortable and Root hard for your favorite NFL team. The Victory Gear soft hand and Weathered screen-print decoration proudly shows your love for the Game.", "text": "NFL Men's Victory Gear VI Short Sleeve T-Shirt The perfect game day tee for when you want to keep comfortable and Root hard for your favorite NFL team. The Victory Gear soft hand and Weathered screen-print decoration proudly shows your love for the Game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510RjJliWUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UPNHT6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing", "T-Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UPOG28", "title": "Full Tang Hunting Camping Knife, Flint Fire Starter, Sheath", "description": "This 11 inch military tanto style field knife features a full tang matte finished stainless steel blade with deep saw back serrations. The thick green cord wrapped handle allows for a secure and comfortable grip while the pommel lanyard insures that your blade is always handy. The durable green nylon belt sheath features a Velcro securing strap and has eyelets for a leg tie cord. This versatile and practical field knife also comes with a magnesium alloy fire starter.", "text": "Full Tang Hunting Camping Knife, Flint Fire Starter, Sheath This 11 inch military tanto style field knife features a full tang matte finished stainless steel blade with deep saw back serrations. The thick green cord wrapped handle allows for a secure and comfortable grip while the pommel lanyard insures that your blade is always handy. The durable green nylon belt sheath features a Velcro securing strap and has eyelets for a leg tie cord. This versatile and practical field knife also comes with a magnesium alloy fire starter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k999NZqVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UPOG28.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
