{"item_id": "B000UTNHUG", "title": "Mil-Comm MC 2500 Oil 0.4 oz Reclosable Syringe", "description": "MC2500 oil is Mil-Comm Products' synthetic blend that is based on the same technology and delivers the same exceptional performance as TW25B grease. The lower viscosity of MC2500 oil allows for easy migration to hard to reach weapon parts while its liquidity allows the user the ability to pour or pump the lubricant easily. These special characteristics of MC2500 oil make it outstanding for lubricating close-fitted, high-speed, extreme pressure precision parts. MC2500 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The 0.4 fluid ounce refillable syringe is ideal for treating hard to reach surfaces, such as trigger assemblies, and for dispensing drops or beads of oil into parts where a full disassembly is neither desirable nor practical.", "text": "Mil-Comm MC 2500 Oil 0.4 oz Reclosable Syringe MC2500 oil is Mil-Comm Products' synthetic blend that is based on the same technology and delivers the same exceptional performance as TW25B grease. The lower viscosity of MC2500 oil allows for easy migration to hard to reach weapon parts while its liquidity allows the user the ability to pour or pump the lubricant easily. These special characteristics of MC2500 oil make it outstanding for lubricating close-fitted, high-speed, extreme pressure precision parts. MC2500 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The 0.4 fluid ounce refillable syringe is ideal for treating hard to reach surfaces, such as trigger assemblies, and for dispensing drops or beads of oil into parts where a full disassembly is neither desirable nor practical.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21XYzjPszjL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UTNHUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mil-Comm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.75}}
{"item_id": "B000UTOVX8", "title": "Mil-Comm TW25B Grease 0.5 oz Reclosable Syringe", "description": "TW25B Light Synthetic Grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made it the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B grease is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The plastic, tapered tip reclosable 0.5 oz. syringe is handy for applying a drop or bead to small or hard to reach areas. The tip head rotates to open or close flow.", "text": "Mil-Comm TW25B Grease 0.5 oz Reclosable Syringe TW25B Light Synthetic Grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made it the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B grease is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The plastic, tapered tip reclosable 0.5 oz. syringe is handy for applying a drop or bead to small or hard to reach areas. The tip head rotates to open or close flow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e0UKFmHLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UTOVX8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.84}}
{"item_id": "B000UTPLGO", "title": "Mil-comm Mc25 Firearm Cleaner/degreaser", "description": "MC25 Firearm Cleaner Degreaser is Mil-Comm Products' environmentally safe, water based, pH balanced, non-toxic formula that emulsifies organic substances on contact including gun lubricants, powder residue and other debris. This non-toxic cleaner properly prepares all kinds of firearms for application of one of Mil-Comm Products' extreme performance lubricants. MC25 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A.", "text": "Mil-comm Mc25 Firearm Cleaner/degreaser MC25 Firearm Cleaner Degreaser is Mil-Comm Products' environmentally safe, water based, pH balanced, non-toxic formula that emulsifies organic substances on contact including gun lubricants, powder residue and other debris. This non-toxic cleaner properly prepares all kinds of firearms for application of one of Mil-Comm Products' extreme performance lubricants. MC25 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rVDesSXCL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UTPLGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mil-Comm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B000UU4EU2", "title": "Mountain House® Best Sellers Kit", "description": "Camp food can be both delicious and easy with this Mountain House Best Sellers Kit! The food is lightweight and easy to pack and carry. Add boiling water to the meals for instant, hot food. Freeze dried, instant meals include beef stew, beef stroganoff, chicken teriyaki, lasagna with meat, scrambled eggs with ham and raspberry crumble. Simply add boiling water for a delicious meal. Order ONLINE Today! !!! Limited Quantities !!! Mountain House Best Sellers Kit.", "text": "Mountain House® Best Sellers Kit Camp food can be both delicious and easy with this Mountain House Best Sellers Kit! The food is lightweight and easy to pack and carry. Add boiling water to the meals for instant, hot food. Freeze dried, instant meals include beef stew, beef stroganoff, chicken teriyaki, lasagna with meat, scrambled eggs with ham and raspberry crumble. Simply add boiling water for a delicious meal. Order ONLINE Today! !!! Limited Quantities !!! Mountain House Best Sellers Kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XQdCrymvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UU4EU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain House", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 40.97}}
{"item_id": "B000UU5K1E", "title": "BudK Exclusive Folding Entrenching Survival Shovel E Tool", "description": "This versatile camping companion is quality tempered steel construction with a rubber grip. The versatility of a shovel and a dibble pick--this piece also folds into a compact size and includes nylon carrying pouch for lightweight transport.", "text": "BudK Exclusive Folding Entrenching Survival Shovel E Tool This versatile camping companion is quality tempered steel construction with a rubber grip. The versatility of a shovel and a dibble pick--this piece also folds into a compact size and includes nylon carrying pouch for lightweight transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vgOMYry9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UU5K1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 11.75}}
