{"item_id": "B000UUBFZY", "title": "Redneck Toothpick Bowie Knife", "description": "Redneck Toothpick Bowie Knife The perfect gift for the redneck in your clan. A classic fixed blade knife with a 6 1/2\"\" blade constructed from 440 stainless steel with laser etch. The impact resistant handle features cast metal tang guard and pommel and provides a tight grip. Includes classic leather sheath. 11\"\" overall", "text": "Redneck Toothpick Bowie Knife Redneck Toothpick Bowie Knife The perfect gift for the redneck in your clan. A classic fixed blade knife with a 6 1/2\"\" blade constructed from 440 stainless steel with laser etch. The impact resistant handle features cast metal tang guard and pommel and provides a tight grip. Includes classic leather sheath. 11\"\" overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CuqAmt09L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUBFZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Exclusive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UUEDCQ", "title": "SportRack A26395 Aero 1300 Roof Box", "description": "Too much gear to carry and not enough room in your vehicle? The SportRack ABS Aero 1300 Ski roof box offers additional cargo space for skis and gear. Also an ideal means to transport sports equipment, luggage, and other vacation necessities, this roof box will mount to any crossbar. With a passenger-side opening and locking mechanism for added convenience and safety, this box can carry up to 110 pounds of cargo and is perfectly compatible with minivans, SUVs, and small to mid-sized cars. Measuring 16 x 23-1/2 x 75 inches (HxWxL), this box sports a carrying capacity of 13 cubic feet (360 liters) and comes complete with a U-bolt mounting bracket kit.", "text": "SportRack A26395 Aero 1300 Roof Box Too much gear to carry and not enough room in your vehicle? The SportRack ABS Aero 1300 Ski roof box offers additional cargo space for skis and gear. Also an ideal means to transport sports equipment, luggage, and other vacation necessities, this roof box will mount to any crossbar. With a passenger-side opening and locking mechanism for added convenience and safety, this box can carry up to 110 pounds of cargo and is perfectly compatible with minivans, SUVs, and small to mid-sized cars. Measuring 16 x 23-1/2 x 75 inches (HxWxL), this box sports a carrying capacity of 13 cubic feet (360 liters) and comes complete with a U-bolt mounting bracket kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eVrZ0psFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUEDCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Ski & Snowboard Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UUEF7E", "title": "SportRack BSR12 Universal 2 Bike Stacker", "description": "This space-saving, self-supporting bike rack from SportRack can store two bikes vertically. One-by-two-inch (W x D) steel construction won't bend or bow, no matter how heavy your bikes. Offering simple, balanced mounting for every style of bike, the hangers are highly adjustable, and V-shaped rubber bike holders won't damage paint or cables.About SportRackLocated in Granby, Quebec SportRack started manufacturing automotive ski racks in 1980. The company's early focus on \"easy-on/easy-off\" products has led to a product line featuring an array of multi-sport roof rack systems and accessories, hitch-mounted products, cargo boxes, and trunk-mounted racks.", "text": "SportRack BSR12 Universal 2 Bike Stacker This space-saving, self-supporting bike rack from SportRack can store two bikes vertically. One-by-two-inch (W x D) steel construction won't bend or bow, no matter how heavy your bikes. Offering simple, balanced mounting for every style of bike, the hangers are highly adjustable, and V-shaped rubber bike holders won't damage paint or cables.About SportRackLocated in Granby, Quebec SportRack started manufacturing automotive ski racks in 1980. The company's early focus on \"easy-on/easy-off\" products has led to a product line featuring an array of multi-sport roof rack systems and accessories, hitch-mounted products, cargo boxes, and trunk-mounted racks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OiwpDGpVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUEF7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SportRack", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UUK276", "title": "SportRack A30901 2EZ Hitch Platform 2 Bike Rack", "description": "A hitch-mounted carrier that holds two bikes, this rack is ideal for outdoor-loving families.This hitch-mounting bike rack system can carry two bikes totaling no more than 90 pounds via rubberized hooks that protect bikes' finish. Its hooks and wheel trays adjust to fit all bike frames and sizes, and a center post folds down when you need to access the rear of your vehicle. The rack fits 1.25- and two-inch receivers, and your hitch must have a minimum Class II rating.In all, the rack offers an impressive combination of design, durability, and affordability when you need to safely transport your bikes from point A to point B.About SportRackLocated in Granby, Quebec SportRack started manufacturing automotive ski racks in 1980. The company's early focus on \"easy-on/easy-off\" products has led to a product line featuring an array of multi-sport roof rack systems and accessories, hitch-mounted products, cargo boxes, and trunk-mounted racks.", "text": "SportRack A30901 2EZ Hitch Platform 2 Bike Rack A hitch-mounted carrier that holds two bikes, this rack is ideal for outdoor-loving families.This hitch-mounting bike rack system can carry two bikes totaling no more than 90 pounds via rubberized hooks that protect bikes' finish. Its hooks and wheel trays adjust to fit all bike frames and sizes, and a center post folds down when you need to access the rear of your vehicle. The rack fits 1.25- and two-inch receivers, and your hitch must have a minimum Class II rating.In all, the rack offers an impressive combination of design, durability, and affordability when you need to safely transport your bikes from point A to point B.About SportRackLocated in Granby, Quebec SportRack started manufacturing automotive ski racks in 1980. The company's early focus on \"easy-on/easy-off\" products has led to a product line featuring an array of multi-sport roof rack systems and accessories, hitch-mounted products, cargo boxes, and trunk-mounted racks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AK8f5I47L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUK276.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 163.61}}
{"item_id": "B000UULZO0", "title": "SportRack A90275 Aero XL Roof Box", "description": "Tired of taking up space in your car with camping gear, sports equipment, and other items when driving to your destination? Turn to this SportRack A90275 rooftop cargo carrier, which offers 18 cubic feet of space--plenty of room for luggage, tents, golf bags, boots, and other gear. The rear-opening cargo carrier mounts to any rooftop crossbar, and includes a U-bolt mounting bracket for easy attachment. The ABS single-shell construction, meanwhile, is durable and long lasting, helping it hold up to bumps in the road, swipes from branches, and general tough handling. The A90275 carrier--which includes a single lock mechanism in the rear--measures 38 by 19 by 63 inches (W x H x D) and offers a maximum load of 110 pounds.", "text": "SportRack A90275 Aero XL Roof Box Tired of taking up space in your car with camping gear, sports equipment, and other items when driving to your destination? Turn to this SportRack A90275 rooftop cargo carrier, which offers 18 cubic feet of space--plenty of room for luggage, tents, golf bags, boots, and other gear. The rear-opening cargo carrier mounts to any rooftop crossbar, and includes a U-bolt mounting bracket for easy attachment. The ABS single-shell construction, meanwhile, is durable and long lasting, helping it hold up to bumps in the road, swipes from branches, and general tough handling. The A90275 carrier--which includes a single lock mechanism in the rear--measures 38 by 19 by 63 inches (W x H x D) and offers a maximum load of 110 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pZ9cc4NaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UULZO0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Cargo Boxes"]], "price": 217.46}}
{"item_id": "B000UUMX0K", "title": "Pachmayr Grips for S and W, J Frame Round Butt", "description": "SJ-G Gripper Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with a Round Butt.", "text": "Pachmayr Grips for S and W, J Frame Round Butt SJ-G Gripper Grip fits Smith & Wesson \"J\" Frame Revolvers with a Round Butt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415gx3oLUBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUMX0K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 26.31}}
{"item_id": "B000UUR6OI", "title": "Smith & Wesson CKSUR1 Bullseye Search and Rescue Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Heavy-duty nylon sheath has synthetic liner, metal reinforcements and lashing slots\" and \"The heavy duty nylon sheath is constructed with a hard synthetic liner and metal reinforcements. The sheath also includes a D ring, lashing slots, and a front mounted nylon storage pouch with Velcro closure.\" to \"Heavy Duty Nylon Sheath\"Lifetime WarrantySmith & Wesson knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Smith & Wesson CKSUR1 Bullseye Search and Rescue Fixed Blade Knife Heavy-duty nylon sheath has synthetic liner, metal reinforcements and lashing slots\" and \"The heavy duty nylon sheath is constructed with a hard synthetic liner and metal reinforcements. The sheath also includes a D ring, lashing slots, and a front mounted nylon storage pouch with Velcro closure.\" to \"Heavy Duty Nylon Sheath\"Lifetime WarrantySmith & Wesson knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Jp1TsgfPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUR6OI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.94}}
{"item_id": "B000UUR6QG", "title": "Smith & Wesson CKSUR6 Bullseye Search and Rescue", "description": "The Smith and Wesson Model CKSUR6 Search and Rescue Fixed Blade Knife features an 8.75\" clip point bowie blade made of 440 stainless steel. The blade has a non reflective black coat, and the Smith & Wesson Search and Rescue logo. The rubberized aluminum handle has finger grooves for secure grip, thick metal cross guard and a lanyard hole. The heavy duty nylon sheath is constructed with a hard synthetic liner and metal reinforcements. The sheath also includes a D ring, lashing slots, and a front mounted nylon storage pouch with Velcro closure. The Smith and Wesson Model CKSUR6 Knife is 14\" overall and weighs 14.9 ounces.", "text": "Smith & Wesson CKSUR6 Bullseye Search and Rescue The Smith and Wesson Model CKSUR6 Search and Rescue Fixed Blade Knife features an 8.75\" clip point bowie blade made of 440 stainless steel. The blade has a non reflective black coat, and the Smith & Wesson Search and Rescue logo. The rubberized aluminum handle has finger grooves for secure grip, thick metal cross guard and a lanyard hole. The heavy duty nylon sheath is constructed with a hard synthetic liner and metal reinforcements. The sheath also includes a D ring, lashing slots, and a front mounted nylon storage pouch with Velcro closure. The Smith and Wesson Model CKSUR6 Knife is 14\" overall and weighs 14.9 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413qqV1rIbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUR6QG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 41.91}}
{"item_id": "B000UUTAOM", "title": "S&W CK5TBSD", "description": "The blade has a thumb rest and dual thumb studs for ambidextrous one hand opening. The stainless steel handle with black G10 inset, 4.32\" closed, has a liner lock and lanyard hole. A removable stainless steel pocket clip is included.", "text": "S&W CK5TBSD The blade has a thumb rest and dual thumb studs for ambidextrous one hand opening. The stainless steel handle with black G10 inset, 4.32\" closed, has a liner lock and lanyard hole. A removable stainless steel pocket clip is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yQFOCE8zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUTAOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 12.89}}
{"item_id": "B000UUTAZQ", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWBH Bush Hog Kukri 17.5\" Blade with Sheath", "description": "Do you need to move through thick brush? This is the tool for you. This Kukri blade is designed with the weight and balance needed to blaze a trail.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWBH Bush Hog Kukri 17.5\" Blade with Sheath Do you need to move through thick brush? This is the tool for you. This Kukri blade is designed with the weight and balance needed to blaze a trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uglfYDbKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUTAZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.45}}
{"item_id": "B000UUV1EY", "title": "S&W CK5TBS", "description": "The Smith & Wesson CK5TBS Extreme Ops serrated knife is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, and a host of other applications. The folding knife offers a comfortable black aircraft aluminum handle that measures 4.06 inches long, along with a 3.22-inch partially serrated stainless tanto blade that cuts through everything from vegetables to fishing line. The blade also secures tightly via the liner lock, but opens quickly with either hand thanks to the thumb rest and dual thumb studs. Other features include a stainless pocket clip and a lanyard hole. The knife weighs 2.8 ounces and carries a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "S&W CK5TBS The Smith & Wesson CK5TBS Extreme Ops serrated knife is ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, and a host of other applications. The folding knife offers a comfortable black aircraft aluminum handle that measures 4.06 inches long, along with a 3.22-inch partially serrated stainless tanto blade that cuts through everything from vegetables to fishing line. The blade also secures tightly via the liner lock, but opens quickly with either hand thanks to the thumb rest and dual thumb studs. Other features include a stainless pocket clip and a lanyard hole. The knife weighs 2.8 ounces and carries a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316Ge4zeA-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUV1EY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.1}}
{"item_id": "B000UUVL7Q", "title": "Powerline PLM180X Lat Machine", "description": "A new you is within reach with the Powerline PLM180X lat machine. The PLM180X was developed to target a variety of upper body muscles in ways that promote more efficient movements and a larger range of motion than typical machines or basic exercises. And by making the exercises more efficient, you'll dramatically accelerate your strength, endurance, and muscle mass gains. The lat machine--which uses weight plates (not included) for resistance--supports such exercises as lat pull downs, tricep press downs, seated rows, upright rows, and more. Specific features include dual-position 8-inch foam rollers to hold you in position, a wide-grip bar, and patented nylon bushings for a super-smooth operation.", "text": "Powerline PLM180X Lat Machine A new you is within reach with the Powerline PLM180X lat machine. The PLM180X was developed to target a variety of upper body muscles in ways that promote more efficient movements and a larger range of motion than typical machines or basic exercises. And by making the exercises more efficient, you'll dramatically accelerate your strength, endurance, and muscle mass gains. The lat machine--which uses weight plates (not included) for resistance--supports such exercises as lat pull downs, tricep press downs, seated rows, upright rows, and more. Specific features include dual-position 8-inch foam rollers to hold you in position, a wide-grip bar, and patented nylon bushings for a super-smooth operation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fgjkGzX2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UUVL7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Powerline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Arm Machines"]], "price": 299.0}}
