{"item_id": "B000UV1VW0", "title": "Solingen K55 Cat Folding Knife", "description": "This knife has been around for over 75 years! Features a 4 3/8\" razor sharp, spear point blade. The black metal handle is sleek and smooth with a famous etch. Has good, easy to use backlocking blade. Very thin and compact.", "text": "Solingen K55 Cat Folding Knife This knife has been around for over 75 years! Features a 4 3/8\" razor sharp, spear point blade. The black metal handle is sleek and smooth with a famous etch. Has good, easy to use backlocking blade. Very thin and compact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310N9072MGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV1VW0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.95}}
