{"item_id": "B000UV5798", "title": "Viper Sure Grip Soft-Tip Darts", "description": "This high-tech dart is a colorful addition to any darter's collection. Barrel sleeves feature a unique non-slip, sure grip surface. Grips are interchangeable.", "text": "Viper Sure Grip Soft-Tip Darts This high-tech dart is a colorful addition to any darter's collection. Barrel sleeves feature a unique non-slip, sure grip surface. Grips are interchangeable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tza9YWR6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV5798.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000UV57B6", "title": "Viper Black Mariah Steel Tip Darts (22-Gram)", "description": "Black Mariah steel-tipped darts, from Viper, offer the sleek, slick look of professional-grade darts at an affordable price. Made in the USA, these darts fly straight and true, and feature black-coated brass barrels, aluminum shafts, and weigh 22 grams each. The set comes complete with an attractive travel and storage case.", "text": "Viper Black Mariah Steel Tip Darts (22-Gram) Black Mariah steel-tipped darts, from Viper, offer the sleek, slick look of professional-grade darts at an affordable price. Made in the USA, these darts fly straight and true, and feature black-coated brass barrels, aluminum shafts, and weigh 22 grams each. The set comes complete with an attractive travel and storage case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mj3QXzXUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV57B6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Viper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 14.53}}
{"item_id": "B000UV5MUM", "title": "Light My Fire MealKit Harness - Grey", "description": "Make sure your food is safe with this Harness! It is designed for the Outdoor Meal Kit (sold separately). The harness is made of strong, reflective, webbing elastic cord and includes a buckle for easy hanging!", "text": "Light My Fire MealKit Harness - Grey Make sure your food is safe with this Harness! It is designed for the Outdoor Meal Kit (sold separately). The harness is made of strong, reflective, webbing elastic cord and includes a buckle for easy hanging!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TIAohdvtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV5MUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 7.99}}
