{"item_id": "B000UV7M28", "title": "New AK47 Electric Auto Airsoft Gun Automatic Rifle w BB - CM022", "description": "New AK47 Electric Auto Airsoft Gun Automatic Rifle w BB - CM022 Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 230 FPS. 350 rounds per min. 45 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Includes battery, charger, safety glasses, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system. All airsoft guns are required to have the tip (1/4 inch) of the barrel permanently colored in blaze orange. Features Semi and full auto, heavy weight New realistic mock wood panelling! Same size as a real AK-47 Rechargable Battery and Charger included Does not come with a loader rod and straw", "text": "New AK47 Electric Auto Airsoft Gun Automatic Rifle w BB - CM022 New AK47 Electric Auto Airsoft Gun Automatic Rifle w BB - CM022 Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 230 FPS. 350 rounds per min. 45 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Includes battery, charger, safety glasses, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system. All airsoft guns are required to have the tip (1/4 inch) of the barrel permanently colored in blaze orange. Features Semi and full auto, heavy weight New realistic mock wood panelling! Same size as a real AK-47 Rechargable Battery and Charger included Does not come with a loader rod and straw", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rs7ysEQFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV7M28.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CYMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 48.75}}
{"item_id": "B000UV8IIA", "title": "Allen Company Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling with Sling Swivels Installed", "description": "Allen Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling. Features 4 elastic rifle cartridge loops and a thumb ring loop. Heavy-duty web construction is ready for everything, while the comfy neoprene shoulder pad with soft \"sharkskin\" gripping surface lets you comfortably shoulder the load. Sling swivels installed. Dressed up in Mossy Oak Break-up camo. Order ONLINE Today! Allen Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling w/ Swivels, Mossy Oak Break-up", "text": "Allen Company Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling with Sling Swivels Installed Allen Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling. Features 4 elastic rifle cartridge loops and a thumb ring loop. Heavy-duty web construction is ready for everything, while the comfy neoprene shoulder pad with soft \"sharkskin\" gripping surface lets you comfortably shoulder the load. Sling swivels installed. Dressed up in Mossy Oak Break-up camo. Order ONLINE Today! Allen Yukon Neoprene Rifle Sling w/ Swivels, Mossy Oak Break-up", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RKp7Q2P3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV8IIA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 20.76}}
{"item_id": "B000UV8L32", "title": "Hornady Unprimed 308 Winchester Match Cartridge Case", "description": "With Hornady brass you'll get more reloads, greater consistency, predictable performance with accuracy that commodity brass simply cannot deliver. Hornady builds cases with the same precision, attention to detail and focus on perfection that has made us a world-leader in bullets and ammunition. We measure for consistent walls concentricity and we run our cases through pressure calibration tests to ensure uniform case expansion. And, taking quality control to the extreme, each and every case is hand inspected. Thanks to this kind of manufacturing care, Hornady brass will ensure proper seating of the bullet, both in the case and in the chamber. It means consistent pressures, and ultimately yields optimal velocity and repeatable accuracy.", "text": "Hornady Unprimed 308 Winchester Match Cartridge Case With Hornady brass you'll get more reloads, greater consistency, predictable performance with accuracy that commodity brass simply cannot deliver. Hornady builds cases with the same precision, attention to detail and focus on perfection that has made us a world-leader in bullets and ammunition. We measure for consistent walls concentricity and we run our cases through pressure calibration tests to ensure uniform case expansion. And, taking quality control to the extreme, each and every case is hand inspected. Thanks to this kind of manufacturing care, Hornady brass will ensure proper seating of the bullet, both in the case and in the chamber. It means consistent pressures, and ultimately yields optimal velocity and repeatable accuracy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ocpGoMgDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UV8L32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 47.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UVCP52", "title": "Cycleaware Heads Up Eyewear Mounted Mirror", "description": "Keep an eye on the traffic behind you with the Heads Up Eyewear Mounted Mirror from Cycle Aware. Weighing in at a scant 0.1-ounces, this eyeglass mounted mirror allows you to remain aware of anything coming up behind you while you focus on the road ahead. The mirror is constructed of strong, lightweight, safe-to-wear polycarbonate composite and Kraton. Designed for easy mounting, removal, and adjustment, the mirror will not vibrate as you ride and will not damage your glasses. If you need to adjust it, simply bend it slightly to maximize the field of vision from the oval mirror. When you're ready to get off your ride, simply un-clip the mirror from your glasses.The Eyewear mounted mirror is lightweight and easy to use.", "text": "Cycleaware Heads Up Eyewear Mounted Mirror Keep an eye on the traffic behind you with the Heads Up Eyewear Mounted Mirror from Cycle Aware. Weighing in at a scant 0.1-ounces, this eyeglass mounted mirror allows you to remain aware of anything coming up behind you while you focus on the road ahead. The mirror is constructed of strong, lightweight, safe-to-wear polycarbonate composite and Kraton. Designed for easy mounting, removal, and adjustment, the mirror will not vibrate as you ride and will not damage your glasses. If you need to adjust it, simply bend it slightly to maximize the field of vision from the oval mirror. When you're ready to get off your ride, simply un-clip the mirror from your glasses.The Eyewear mounted mirror is lightweight and easy to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UUlUaBawL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVCP52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleAware", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 12.3}}
