{"item_id": "B000UVLZSU", "title": "Mil. - style Para Cord O.D.", "description": "100 yards of Military-style Para Cord. Each individual inner strand has a tensile strength of 30 lbs.; Minimum tensile strength of all 7 strands together is 550 lbs.; 100 yds. per spool; Ideal for camping, fishing... everything under the sun! Order ONLINE Today! Para Cord, Olive Drab", "text": "Mil. - style Para Cord O.D. 100 yards of Military-style Para Cord. Each individual inner strand has a tensile strength of 30 lbs.; Minimum tensile strength of all 7 strands together is 550 lbs.; 100 yds. per spool; Ideal for camping, fishing... everything under the sun! Order ONLINE Today! Para Cord, Olive Drab", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bi3mbhg8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVLZSU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UVQ0H6", "title": "Survival Matches - Flip Top - 2 Pack", "description": "Survival Matches are windproof and waterproof and will burn even when wet! They are the very best NATO approved matches available. Designed to light in all extreme types of weather, they can withstand immersion in water and cannot be extinguished by wind. Match head burns for 12 seconds. Approximately 25 matches in each sealed flip top tube. Supplied with cotton wool tinder and striker. Easy open Flip Top Lid.Flip Top Lid is simple to use and watertight.Weight: 1.9oz / 53.9g.Import.", "text": "Survival Matches - Flip Top - 2 Pack Survival Matches are windproof and waterproof and will burn even when wet! They are the very best NATO approved matches available. Designed to light in all extreme types of weather, they can withstand immersion in water and cannot be extinguished by wind. Match head burns for 12 seconds. Approximately 25 matches in each sealed flip top tube. Supplied with cotton wool tinder and striker. Easy open Flip Top Lid.Flip Top Lid is simple to use and watertight.Weight: 1.9oz / 53.9g.Import.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AEdrN%2BPFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVQ0H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B000UVTDLG", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact, Black Case & Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "The Compact Pepper Spray with Quick Release Key Ring provides SABRE RED's most powerful self-defense spray in an easy to access and deploy canister. The 0.54-ounce canister offers a range of ten feet to provide protection at a safe distance and its ballistic stream delivery reduces the chance of wind blow-back. With up to 25 shots, you can protect yourself against multiple threats. Sabre's Red Spray formulation is up to 86 percent hotter than other sprays and its quick-release key chain allows you immediate access and the ensures that the spray is where you need it--when you need it. Sabre products are used by the New York Police Department, U.S. Marshalls, and thousands of police departments worldwide.Specifications:Canister Contents: 0.54 ounces Sabre Red SprayContains Approximately 25 ShotsRange: 10 FeetImmediately Accessible – Free Quick Release Key Ring Included!Sabre Red Spray:Maximum Strength Pepper Spray - Up to 86 percent hotter than other spraysFour year expiration dateHPLC Laboratory ensures guaranteed heatPlease Note:This item is not for sale in certain states.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact, Black Case & Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more) The Compact Pepper Spray with Quick Release Key Ring provides SABRE RED's most powerful self-defense spray in an easy to access and deploy canister. The 0.54-ounce canister offers a range of ten feet to provide protection at a safe distance and its ballistic stream delivery reduces the chance of wind blow-back. With up to 25 shots, you can protect yourself against multiple threats. Sabre's Red Spray formulation is up to 86 percent hotter than other sprays and its quick-release key chain allows you immediate access and the ensures that the spray is where you need it--when you need it. Sabre products are used by the New York Police Department, U.S. Marshalls, and thousands of police departments worldwide.Specifications:Canister Contents: 0.54 ounces Sabre Red SprayContains Approximately 25 ShotsRange: 10 FeetImmediately Accessible – Free Quick Release Key Ring Included!Sabre Red Spray:Maximum Strength Pepper Spray - Up to 86 percent hotter than other spraysFour year expiration dateHPLC Laboratory ensures guaranteed heatPlease Note:This item is not for sale in certain states.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310ItBA6sgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVTDLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000UVY1PE", "title": "Knog Beetle 2-LED Bicycle Light", "description": "Light Front:Type: 2 LEDPower Source:BatteryAdditional Information:2 options: Constant or Blinking35 Hour (Constant), 160 Hour (Blinking)dirt and water proof silicon housingwith quick release clampEnergy Saving:Battery Size Individual: 2 x CR2032Bracket:Bracket Included: yesAssembly Tool-less: yes", "text": "Knog Beetle 2-LED Bicycle Light Light Front:Type: 2 LEDPower Source:BatteryAdditional Information:2 options: Constant or Blinking35 Hour (Constant), 160 Hour (Blinking)dirt and water proof silicon housingwith quick release clampEnergy Saving:Battery Size Individual: 2 x CR2032Bracket:Bracket Included: yesAssembly Tool-less: yes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IOKQKjQYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVY1PE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KNOG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 10.36}}
{"item_id": "B000UVZO1E", "title": "BudK Medieval Spiked Flails", "description": "This ancient weapon was once used by foot soldiers as a deadly weapon. After the 16th Century, flails were used only as historical decoration. Each fine replica is hand crafted from top quality materials. The 1 lb spiked steel ball is supported by a studded chain attached to a 15 1/2' rivited hardwood handle. Also available in a double ball.", "text": "BudK Medieval Spiked Flails This ancient weapon was once used by foot soldiers as a deadly weapon. After the 16th Century, flails were used only as historical decoration. Each fine replica is hand crafted from top quality materials. The 1 lb spiked steel ball is supported by a studded chain attached to a 15 1/2' rivited hardwood handle. Also available in a double ball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/212s7GM4G1L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UVZO1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B000UW1J26", "title": "McDavid 207 Thermal Shoulder Wrap with Gel Pack", "description": "The McDavid thermal shoulder wrap is designed to provide safe, effective, hands-free treatment for injuries with maximum comfort and convenience. The shoulder wrap works with both soothing hot or icy cold therapy, with an insulating neoprene material that helps maintain the desired temperature. Cold is generally applied to acute injuries immediately after trauma, as cold therapy constricts blood vessels to reduce the swelling, block pain, and promote healing. Compression and elevation are also important in the immediate treatment of acute injuries. By contrast, users should apply heat to chronic injuries (ongoing conditions). Heat therapy increases the blood flow to the injured area, helping the body remove and reabsorb cellular byproducts. Heat is also soothing, and can reduce pain and stiffness. Note, however, that heat should never be applied to an acute injury unless under the direction of a sports medicine professional.", "text": "McDavid 207 Thermal Shoulder Wrap with Gel Pack The McDavid thermal shoulder wrap is designed to provide safe, effective, hands-free treatment for injuries with maximum comfort and convenience. The shoulder wrap works with both soothing hot or icy cold therapy, with an insulating neoprene material that helps maintain the desired temperature. Cold is generally applied to acute injuries immediately after trauma, as cold therapy constricts blood vessels to reduce the swelling, block pain, and promote healing. Compression and elevation are also important in the immediate treatment of acute injuries. By contrast, users should apply heat to chronic injuries (ongoing conditions). Heat therapy increases the blood flow to the injured area, helping the body remove and reabsorb cellular byproducts. Heat is also soothing, and can reduce pain and stiffness. Note, however, that heat should never be applied to an acute injury unless under the direction of a sports medicine professional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uvk4xK3cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000UW1J26.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]], "price": 29.99}}
