{"item_id": "B000V63NOS", "title": "Bally Arm Slimmers (Set of 2)", "description": "Arm Slimmer Sleeves. Get more effective workouts when you wear these comfortable Arm Slimmer Sleeves during your regular upper arm exercises. Trims and tones your biceps and triceps more efficiently during your regular workout. Alleviates strain and tear during exercise by absorbing stress and keeping the muscles warm.", "text": "Bally Arm Slimmers (Set of 2) Arm Slimmer Sleeves. Get more effective workouts when you wear these comfortable Arm Slimmer Sleeves during your regular upper arm exercises. Trims and tones your biceps and triceps more efficiently during your regular workout. Alleviates strain and tear during exercise by absorbing stress and keeping the muscles warm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ydEQ4t5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000V63NOS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Arm Machines"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000V63NQQ", "title": "Everlast for Her All-in-One Body Slimmer", "description": "The Body Slimmer helps you slim and trim you waist, hips, and thighs more effectively. By keeping your body warm, you'll shed excess water working out or doing everyday household chores.", "text": "Everlast for Her All-in-One Body Slimmer The Body Slimmer helps you slim and trim you waist, hips, and thighs more effectively. By keeping your body warm, you'll shed excess water working out or doing everyday household chores.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I8kQANGuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000V63NQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Sauna Suits"]]}}
