{"item_id": "B000VB1JA8", "title": "1911 Ss Ext Slide Release", "description": "Extended Slide ReleaseStainless - Glass Bead Finish - .45 ACPAllows the right thumb to actuate the slide release with minimal grip change, which can save valuable time - Minor fitting may be required", "text": "1911 Ss Ext Slide Release Extended Slide ReleaseStainless - Glass Bead Finish - .45 ACPAllows the right thumb to actuate the slide release with minimal grip change, which can save valuable time - Minor fitting may be required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A%2Bqn0-SAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VB1JA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson Combat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 38.89}}
{"item_id": "B000VB2DZS", "title": "Round Mirror Cruiser Bike Bicycle Chrome", "description": "3\" round chrome mirror. The arm length is about 7\" long. The mirror part is actual glass mirror. Fantastic quality. All metal and made to last! These mirrors are universal and can be mounted on the right or left hand side of the handlebars.", "text": "Round Mirror Cruiser Bike Bicycle Chrome 3\" round chrome mirror. The arm length is about 7\" long. The mirror part is actual glass mirror. Fantastic quality. All metal and made to last! These mirrors are universal and can be mounted on the right or left hand side of the handlebars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h97Ky-gIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VB2DZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B000VB5GIO", "title": "Glock Recoil Spring 19,23,32", "description": "New Glock Factory OEM Guide Rod and Recoil Spring Assembly (RSA) with captured spring and polymer guide rod - Glock part # SP 02457 For use with Gen 2 & Gen 3 Glock Model 19, 23, 23P, 32, 38 Pistols. Marked 5593-1 on end of guide rod - this is the latest version. This replacement part is a factory original from Glock. Factory replacement parts are manufactured to the exact same specifications and tolerances and use the same manufacturing materials as the original parts which guarantees excellent fit and reliable operation. Glock recommends replacing the guide rod & spring assembly every 2800-3100 rounds. This will help keep your Glock functioning like new.", "text": "Glock Recoil Spring 19,23,32 New Glock Factory OEM Guide Rod and Recoil Spring Assembly (RSA) with captured spring and polymer guide rod - Glock part # SP 02457 For use with Gen 2 & Gen 3 Glock Model 19, 23, 23P, 32, 38 Pistols. Marked 5593-1 on end of guide rod - this is the latest version. This replacement part is a factory original from Glock. Factory replacement parts are manufactured to the exact same specifications and tolerances and use the same manufacturing materials as the original parts which guarantees excellent fit and reliable operation. Glock recommends replacing the guide rod & spring assembly every 2800-3100 rounds. This will help keep your Glock functioning like new.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21M6bSXuyvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VB5GIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VBKCNS", "title": "ASICS Men's Core Lycra Running Short,Black,X-Large", "description": "Nylon and spandex fabric provides support, compression and comfort. Fold-over stay-put hem provides flattering fit.", "text": "ASICS Men's Core Lycra Running Short,Black,X-Large Nylon and spandex fabric provides support, compression and comfort. Fold-over stay-put hem provides flattering fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ee422WAlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VBKCNS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VCDXNS", "title": "CAP Barbell 40-pound Adjustable Dumbbell Set with Case", "description": "Enjoy the versatility of gym equipment from the comfort of your own home with the Cap Barbell 40 Pound Dumbbell Set. Equipped with four 2.5-pound plates, four 5-pound plates, and two handles and collars, the set allows you to work with a variety of interchangeable weights in one easy-to-use and store set. The sturdy plastic carry case keeps the weights organized and accessible when not in use and also makes it possible to carry your weights with you so you never have to leave your training regimen behind.Designed for high-performance comfort, the Cap Barbells feature ergonomic grips, comfort handles, and rubber trim collars. The durable cast iron plates have a semi-gloss finish for long-term rust- and maintenance-free use, and the collars are threaded for a safe and secure fit to the handles. The carry case is not bulky, measuring just 20 inches long by 9 inches wide, and weighs 41.15 pounds in total.Specifications:Durable cast iron platesTwo 5-pound handlesFour 2.5-pound platesFour 5-pound platesSemi-gloss finishThreaded collarsRack storage systemDimensions: 20 x 9 x 8 inches (LxWxH)Overall weight: 41.15 pounds", "text": "CAP Barbell 40-pound Adjustable Dumbbell Set with Case Enjoy the versatility of gym equipment from the comfort of your own home with the Cap Barbell 40 Pound Dumbbell Set. Equipped with four 2.5-pound plates, four 5-pound plates, and two handles and collars, the set allows you to work with a variety of interchangeable weights in one easy-to-use and store set. The sturdy plastic carry case keeps the weights organized and accessible when not in use and also makes it possible to carry your weights with you so you never have to leave your training regimen behind.Designed for high-performance comfort, the Cap Barbells feature ergonomic grips, comfort handles, and rubber trim collars. The durable cast iron plates have a semi-gloss finish for long-term rust- and maintenance-free use, and the collars are threaded for a safe and secure fit to the handles. The carry case is not bulky, measuring just 20 inches long by 9 inches wide, and weighs 41.15 pounds in total.Specifications:Durable cast iron platesTwo 5-pound handlesFour 2.5-pound platesFour 5-pound platesSemi-gloss finishThreaded collarsRack storage systemDimensions: 20 x 9 x 8 inches (LxWxH)Overall weight: 41.15 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gDHFch6EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VCDXNS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 69.18}}
{"item_id": "B000VCHDSY", "title": "Powerline PCCO90X Cable Crossover", "description": "The Cable Crossover Machine from Powerline offers smooth and friction-free 180-degree motion that allows you to exercise virtually every major muscle group in your body. The system features a wide and tall mainframe with a sturdy build, that provides access to a variety of high and low pulley exercises. The professional carriage system utilizes patented nylon bushing technology and eight sealed ball bearing with large-diameter high resin pulleys to guarantee smooth operation. The top and bottom pulleys swivel with over 180 degrees of movement for frictionless guidance in all directions. The system includes the mainframe as well as two cable handles and one ankle strap. Chin-up handles, standard and Olympic weight plates, and collars can be used with this system but are sold separately.Features and Specifications:Professional carriage systemPatented nylon bushing technologyEight sealed ball bearingHigh resin pulleysTop and bottom pulleys offer over 180 degrees of movementAccepts both Olympic and standard platesChin-up handles, weight plates, and collars optional (sold separately)Assembled dimensions: 82 by 112 by 39 inches (H x L x W)", "text": "Powerline PCCO90X Cable Crossover The Cable Crossover Machine from Powerline offers smooth and friction-free 180-degree motion that allows you to exercise virtually every major muscle group in your body. The system features a wide and tall mainframe with a sturdy build, that provides access to a variety of high and low pulley exercises. The professional carriage system utilizes patented nylon bushing technology and eight sealed ball bearing with large-diameter high resin pulleys to guarantee smooth operation. The top and bottom pulleys swivel with over 180 degrees of movement for frictionless guidance in all directions. The system includes the mainframe as well as two cable handles and one ankle strap. Chin-up handles, standard and Olympic weight plates, and collars can be used with this system but are sold separately.Features and Specifications:Professional carriage systemPatented nylon bushing technologyEight sealed ball bearingHigh resin pulleysTop and bottom pulleys offer over 180 degrees of movementAccepts both Olympic and standard platesChin-up handles, weight plates, and collars optional (sold separately)Assembled dimensions: 82 by 112 by 39 inches (H x L x W)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nIeIprNKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VCHDSY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Powerline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 399.0}}
{"item_id": "B000VCOR9M", "title": "Big Game MLS01-V Magnum Lift System", "description": "This innovative self-locking system makes cleaning, draining and cooling any game easy. Supports deer, bear and antelope by hind legs and has a 500 pound weight capacity. With its twist-free, high-strength rope and heavy-duty carabiner clips, this 4:1 weight reducing system makes any task easier. Very lightweight & compact system can be packed & carried to and from the field with ease.", "text": "Big Game MLS01-V Magnum Lift System This innovative self-locking system makes cleaning, draining and cooling any game easy. Supports deer, bear and antelope by hind legs and has a 500 pound weight capacity. With its twist-free, high-strength rope and heavy-duty carabiner clips, this 4:1 weight reducing system makes any task easier. Very lightweight & compact system can be packed & carried to and from the field with ease.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HhEfHEDYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VCOR9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BIG GAME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Hoists & Gambrels"]], "price": 22.97}}
{"item_id": "B000VCVQKK", "title": "Travel John Disposable Resealable Urinals", "description": "The Travel John is a resealable, disposable personal urinal for men, women and children for times when a restroom isn't available. Patented LIQSORB technology absorbs liquid waste quickly and completely, converting it into an odorless, spill-proof gel that is non-toxic and waste disposal safe. The unisex adapter allows anyone to use it, sitting or standing. This safe and effective urinal is ideal for sportsmen, travelers, boaters, campers, backpackers or trekkers. Carry one in your glove compartment it's great for “emergency\" situations. It's functional and practical, compact and easy to carry and stow. Package contains three bags, each with an antiseptic wipe included. Features: Leakproof--gels instantly Resealable and reusable until full Impact resistant/industrial strength materials Hygienic Odorless Designed for men, women and kids Non-toxic Biodegradable and waste disposal safe Compact and lightweight Easy to use while sitting or standing Can be used as a vomit bag for motion sickness Item Specifications: Capacity: 28 oz. (800 ml)", "text": "Travel John Disposable Resealable Urinals The Travel John is a resealable, disposable personal urinal for men, women and children for times when a restroom isn't available. Patented LIQSORB technology absorbs liquid waste quickly and completely, converting it into an odorless, spill-proof gel that is non-toxic and waste disposal safe. The unisex adapter allows anyone to use it, sitting or standing. This safe and effective urinal is ideal for sportsmen, travelers, boaters, campers, backpackers or trekkers. Carry one in your glove compartment it's great for “emergency\" situations. It's functional and practical, compact and easy to carry and stow. Package contains three bags, each with an antiseptic wipe included. Features: Leakproof--gels instantly Resealable and reusable until full Impact resistant/industrial strength materials Hygienic Odorless Designed for men, women and kids Non-toxic Biodegradable and waste disposal safe Compact and lightweight Easy to use while sitting or standing Can be used as a vomit bag for motion sickness Item Specifications: Capacity: 28 oz. (800 ml)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WlqFAmQWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VCVQKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Travel John", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000VDFQAA", "title": "SRAM PC 850 P-Link Bicycle Chain (8-Speed, Grey)", "description": "The top-quality SRAM PC 850 bicycle chain offers accurate shifting and durable wear resistance, and features step-riveted pins for strong side plate retention.Detail view: The 3/32-inch chain has step-riveted pins for strong side plate retention.DetailsSix-, seven-, and eight-speed114 links7.1-millimeter width318-gram weightRecommended for the 3.0, 4.0, and 5.0 drivetrainPowerlink silver connector includedWarrantySRAM products include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About SRAMBicycle component maker SRAM makes high-quality, technically advanced parts and accessories, based on a philosophy of perpetual, incremental enhancements that collectively add up to superior performance. Casual riders will note SRAM components' reliability, dependability, and standard qualities one would expect. But it's the passionate cyclists -- those who spends hours in the saddle -- who tend to truly appreciate the company's quality and craftsmanship.SRAM Corporation began with the goal of creating the best possible shifting system, and ultimately innovated cycling with the advent of the Grip Shift. To sustain the resulting growth, SRAM invested in Sachs Bicycle Company and built a state of the art manufacturing facility in Schweinfurt Germany. The company then joined forces with RockShox suspension, and expanded its line into brakes, bottom brackets, and cranksets by partnering with Avid and Truvativ. Having created an end-to-end bicycle drive train company, SRAM's mission today is to keep working to create what they term \"the ultimate ride.\"", "text": "SRAM PC 850 P-Link Bicycle Chain (8-Speed, Grey) The top-quality SRAM PC 850 bicycle chain offers accurate shifting and durable wear resistance, and features step-riveted pins for strong side plate retention.Detail view: The 3/32-inch chain has step-riveted pins for strong side plate retention.DetailsSix-, seven-, and eight-speed114 links7.1-millimeter width318-gram weightRecommended for the 3.0, 4.0, and 5.0 drivetrainPowerlink silver connector includedWarrantySRAM products include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About SRAMBicycle component maker SRAM makes high-quality, technically advanced parts and accessories, based on a philosophy of perpetual, incremental enhancements that collectively add up to superior performance. Casual riders will note SRAM components' reliability, dependability, and standard qualities one would expect. But it's the passionate cyclists -- those who spends hours in the saddle -- who tend to truly appreciate the company's quality and craftsmanship.SRAM Corporation began with the goal of creating the best possible shifting system, and ultimately innovated cycling with the advent of the Grip Shift. To sustain the resulting growth, SRAM invested in Sachs Bicycle Company and built a state of the art manufacturing facility in Schweinfurt Germany. The company then joined forces with RockShox suspension, and expanded its line into brakes, bottom brackets, and cranksets by partnering with Avid and Truvativ. Having created an end-to-end bicycle drive train company, SRAM's mission today is to keep working to create what they term \"the ultimate ride.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sdkJb%2BmnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VDFQAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 15.73}}
