{"item_id": "B000VU3790", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Speed Clips (6-Pack #5)", "description": "Speed Clips are made of a modern carbon-fiber polymer material that is strong, flexible and durable. These are the most versatile new pieces of MOLLE hardware available. Developed by BLACKHAWK!'s RandD staff, these clips quickly mount or disconnect pouches and other gear quickly and efficiently - no more tedious weaving of bulky straps or hesitation at rearranging your kit for better ergonomics. These clips make that task easy. Tested in combat, they have proven to be both reliable and secure. Speed clips DO NOT RUST! These clips contain an accessory lanyard hole, free floating for use with other accessories, unlike attached MOLLE straps , and can be color matched to your gear. Speed Clips come in 3\", 5\", 7\" and 9\" lengths to accommodate any size pouches and can be used with all of BLACKHAWK! 38-series pouches, Existing MOLLE pouches (simply cut the strap off or tuck it behind the Speed Clip) , or can be used in other innovative ways to enhance your personal setup. How the Speed Clip works: Place the pouch so its webbing aligns with spaces between the webbing on the platform, insert the Speed Clip under the webbing of the platform, alternately weaving it between the platform and the pouch, and finally, secure the end of the Speed Clip by hooking its tab onto the last section of webbing. Do you have an existing MOLLE Strap? If you have a pouch that has a MOLLE strap, you can either cut the strap off or tuck it behind the Speed Clip.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Speed Clips (6-Pack #5) Speed Clips are made of a modern carbon-fiber polymer material that is strong, flexible and durable. These are the most versatile new pieces of MOLLE hardware available. Developed by BLACKHAWK!'s RandD staff, these clips quickly mount or disconnect pouches and other gear quickly and efficiently - no more tedious weaving of bulky straps or hesitation at rearranging your kit for better ergonomics. These clips make that task easy. Tested in combat, they have proven to be both reliable and secure. Speed clips DO NOT RUST! These clips contain an accessory lanyard hole, free floating for use with other accessories, unlike attached MOLLE straps , and can be color matched to your gear. Speed Clips come in 3\", 5\", 7\" and 9\" lengths to accommodate any size pouches and can be used with all of BLACKHAWK! 38-series pouches, Existing MOLLE pouches (simply cut the strap off or tuck it behind the Speed Clip) , or can be used in other innovative ways to enhance your personal setup. How the Speed Clip works: Place the pouch so its webbing aligns with spaces between the webbing on the platform, insert the Speed Clip under the webbing of the platform, alternately weaving it between the platform and the pouch, and finally, secure the end of the Speed Clip by hooking its tab onto the last section of webbing. Do you have an existing MOLLE Strap? If you have a pouch that has a MOLLE strap, you can either cut the strap off or tuck it behind the Speed Clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yvlpBeBUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VU3790.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 12.68}}
{"item_id": "B000VU7DYK", "title": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. CQC Platform with Serpa Holster for Beretta", "description": "This is the kit that combines the CQC SERPA Beretta M-9/92F holster on the unique injection molded S.T.R.I.K.E adapter platform. It is constructed of high density carbon-fiber polymer material. It allows you to mount your pistol on any S.T.R.I.K.E. or MOLLE gear. Holster adjusts to any angle.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. CQC Platform with Serpa Holster for Beretta This is the kit that combines the CQC SERPA Beretta M-9/92F holster on the unique injection molded S.T.R.I.K.E adapter platform. It is constructed of high density carbon-fiber polymer material. It allows you to mount your pistol on any S.T.R.I.K.E. or MOLLE gear. Holster adjusts to any angle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-QvTLFbbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VU7DYK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 40.49}}
{"item_id": "B000VU8Q1Y", "title": "Manduka MatSak Yoga Bag", "description": "A perfect fit for Manduka's eKO and black yoga mats, the large Manduka Mat Sak will last every bit as long as your yoga mat itself. The bag is designed with two compartments: a large, breathable main compartment that accommodates mats as big as 26 inches wide, and a side zippered compartment with organizer pockets for other yoga accessories, such as straps, towels, and personal belongings. Users will also appreciate the durable, lightweight ballistic nylon material--the same kind used by premium luggage brands--along with the unique ventilation system, which lets the mat breathe while stored inside the Mat Sak. Also available in a smaller size that's ideal for Manduka's PurpleLite mat, the large Mat Sak measures 31.7 by 7.1 by 7.1 inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Manduka MatSak Yoga Bag A perfect fit for Manduka's eKO and black yoga mats, the large Manduka Mat Sak will last every bit as long as your yoga mat itself. The bag is designed with two compartments: a large, breathable main compartment that accommodates mats as big as 26 inches wide, and a side zippered compartment with organizer pockets for other yoga accessories, such as straps, towels, and personal belongings. Users will also appreciate the durable, lightweight ballistic nylon material--the same kind used by premium luggage brands--along with the unique ventilation system, which lets the mat breathe while stored inside the Mat Sak. Also available in a smaller size that's ideal for Manduka's PurpleLite mat, the large Mat Sak measures 31.7 by 7.1 by 7.1 inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SdMmSp5KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VU8Q1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mat Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VUAGAS", "title": "Manduka Cork Block", "description": "Setting the standard for high-performance yoga props, this Manduka block is made of 100 percent cork--a natural material harvested under tight regulations. Cork oak trees are not allowed to be stripped of cork bark until they are 25 years old and then are allowed to regrow undisturbed for another seven to nine years after strippingCork offers a firmness not found in foam competitors. Yoga blocks are ideal for yoga students of all levels, as they help beginners perform postures that would otherwise be too difficult, while more advanced practitioners can use them to improve strength, balance, and alignment. In addition, the block's easy-to-grip textured surface and comfortable contoured edges make it feel secure and accommodating during tough stretches. Produced without the use of any toxic chemicals during harvesting and manufacturing, the cork yoga block measures 9 by 4 by 6 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2 pounds.", "text": "Manduka Cork Block Setting the standard for high-performance yoga props, this Manduka block is made of 100 percent cork--a natural material harvested under tight regulations. Cork oak trees are not allowed to be stripped of cork bark until they are 25 years old and then are allowed to regrow undisturbed for another seven to nine years after strippingCork offers a firmness not found in foam competitors. Yoga blocks are ideal for yoga students of all levels, as they help beginners perform postures that would otherwise be too difficult, while more advanced practitioners can use them to improve strength, balance, and alignment. In addition, the block's easy-to-grip textured surface and comfortable contoured edges make it feel secure and accommodating during tough stretches. Produced without the use of any toxic chemicals during harvesting and manufacturing, the cork yoga block measures 9 by 4 by 6 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qt2dT80mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUAGAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Manduka", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Blocks"]], "price": 18.0}}
{"item_id": "B000VUAXMY", "title": "Blackhawk Emergency Medic Roll Bag", "description": "Designed with 15 various sized, quick-view, clear pouches. Rolls up into a compact rig and it secures by hook & loop with side release buckles. Full wrap around heavy-duty handles..", "text": "Blackhawk Emergency Medic Roll Bag Designed with 15 various sized, quick-view, clear pouches. Rolls up into a compact rig and it secures by hook & loop with side release buckles. Full wrap around heavy-duty handles..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a1fIuuAoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUAXMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 36.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VUE2MG", "title": "Pachmayr Grips For Colt \"D-Inchframe, Post 1971 Revolvers", "description": "CD-G Gripper Grip fits Colt square butt \"D-InchFrame (Post 1971 Revolvers): Detective Special, Police Special, Cobra, Agent, Diamondback.", "text": "Pachmayr Grips For Colt \"D-Inchframe, Post 1971 Revolvers CD-G Gripper Grip fits Colt square butt \"D-InchFrame (Post 1971 Revolvers): Detective Special, Police Special, Cobra, Agent, Diamondback.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QfjcgV1AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUE2MG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 30.13}}
