{"item_id": "B000VUFQM6", "title": "Pistol Metal Snap Caps 380Auto 5pk", "description": "A-Zoom .380 Auto Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 5 rounds per package.", "text": "Pistol Metal Snap Caps 380Auto 5pk A-Zoom .380 Auto Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 5 rounds per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WsOwK7anL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUFQM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.19}}
{"item_id": "B000VUHIF4", "title": "Champion .22 Auto Reset Target", "description": "With four targets to choose from and a large reset target, this Champion metal target is perfect for friendly competition or extended trigger time. Reset ability eliminates need to walk downrange and ensures non-stop shooting action.", "text": "Champion .22 Auto Reset Target With four targets to choose from and a large reset target, this Champion metal target is perfect for friendly competition or extended trigger time. Reset ability eliminates need to walk downrange and ensures non-stop shooting action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gwJA7Z8sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUHIF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 42.12}}
{"item_id": "B000VUJ8VG", "title": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Slip-On Grip, Glock 26,27,29,& 30 Beretta Mini-Cougar", "description": "Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 5 A specialized, hollow finger grooved Slip-On designed for the Glock 26/27/33. Also works on the Beretta Mini-Cougar and other compact semi-autos. Same proven design as Pachmayr's other Slip-On grips for the easiest installation available. Comfortable ergonomic positioning of the finger groove. Fits: Glock: 26, 27, 28, 29, 30, 33 Beretta: Mini Cougar H&K;: USP Compact Kel-Tec: P-11 Sig Sauer: P239", "text": "Pachmayr Slip on Grips for Auto Pistols Slip-On Grip, Glock 26,27,29,& 30 Beretta Mini-Cougar Made from a special rubber formula that gives superior stretch yet maintains tight fit on almost all gun frames. Designed for easy installation and available in five sizes to eliminate the need to cut the grip to fit. Five models cover the range of semi-auto pistol frame sizes. Four sizes come with finger grooves. Features: - Easiest to install - 5 sizes - Soft rubber Unique Pachmayr Design has True Ergonomic Feel. Installs in Seconds. Model 5 A specialized, hollow finger grooved Slip-On designed for the Glock 26/27/33. Also works on the Beretta Mini-Cougar and other compact semi-autos. Same proven design as Pachmayr's other Slip-On grips for the easiest installation available. Comfortable ergonomic positioning of the finger groove. Fits: Glock: 26, 27, 28, 29, 30, 33 Beretta: Mini Cougar H&K;: USP Compact Kel-Tec: P-11 Sig Sauer: P239", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DN466tgaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUJ8VG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.98}}
{"item_id": "B000VUL40E", "title": "Hogue Soft Rubber Grip Attaching Lug Smith & Wesson Full Size 9 mm and .40", "description": "Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wraps give more comfort and ergonomics to your Smith & Wesson Full Zize 9 mm or .40. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Rubber Grips are the absolute best choice for boosting your weapon's comfort. The ergonomic shape of the non-slip rubber give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; 2-piece grips simply attach using Houge's patented attaching lug; Fits Smith & Wesson models 5903, 5904, 5906, 5944, 5946, 5943, 4006, 4096, 410, 411, 910, 915 etc... because of the many different model numbers S&W; has made over the years it may fit others; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Soft Rubber Grip, Attaching Lug Smith & Wesson Full Size 9 mm and .40", "text": "Hogue Soft Rubber Grip Attaching Lug Smith & Wesson Full Size 9 mm and .40 Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wraps give more comfort and ergonomics to your Smith & Wesson Full Zize 9 mm or .40. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Rubber Grips are the absolute best choice for boosting your weapon's comfort. The ergonomic shape of the non-slip rubber give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; 2-piece grips simply attach using Houge's patented attaching lug; Fits Smith & Wesson models 5903, 5904, 5906, 5944, 5946, 5943, 4006, 4096, 410, 411, 910, 915 etc... because of the many different model numbers S&W; has made over the years it may fit others; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Soft Rubber Grip, Attaching Lug Smith & Wesson Full Size 9 mm and .40", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NHTXBT4GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUL40E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.66}}
{"item_id": "B000VUWAJS", "title": "Coghlan's Mosquito Netting", "description": "Create your own insect protection, repair screens, make a baby carriage net. The fine mesh polyester is washable. Useful indoors or out. Size: 48 x 72 in.", "text": "Coghlan's Mosquito Netting Create your own insect protection, repair screens, make a baby carriage net. The fine mesh polyester is washable. Useful indoors or out. Size: 48 x 72 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tRKsg0-SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VUWAJS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 5.32}}
{"item_id": "B000VW6920", "title": "Versa Gripps® PRO Glove Weight Lifting Straps Hooks", "description": "TRAIN BETTER with Versa Gripps. Our Original, Patented Self-Supporting Versa Gripps PRO style is the Top-of-the-Line Grip Assist. Proven as the Best Grip in the World. Versa Gripps eliminate grip fatigue & enhances muscle isolation in pulling & pushing exercises for maximum muscle gains. ALL IN ONE - outperforms gloves, hooks & lifting straps. Designed for superior strength, durability & double reinforced tough. Designed with a unique extended grip-length, our Versa Gripps PRO style allows more of the grip to be wrapped around the bar for a stronger hold & added security; resulting in optimum performance. Unique \"No-Slip\" Custom Engineered Material is made exclusively for Power Gripps USA, INC. The grip material remains durable while maintaining the superior grip throughout the life of the product. Scientifically designed without bulk specifically to allow the athlete to feel a connection with the weight. New Built-in Arch Support offers carpal tunnel protection. 1 1/2 inch Wide Wrist Strap sewn with high-density foam with a hook & loop closure for excellent wrist support. Adjustable wrist support keeps the wrist in the correct position while training. Ergonomically developed to promote circulation to the hand while eliminating nerve damage. Extra-Heavy Duty Steel Buckle on the wrist strap for Superior Strength. Maximum Hand Protection from calluses. Quick Release Feature makes it safe & easy to release the weight bar during your fitness regimen. Hypo-allergenic, Anti-bacterial & Anti-microbial patent#5813950 MADE IN THE USA* Excellent Choice for the Serious Lifter * For Men and WomenPRO STYLE Sizing Chart: Measure Wrist Circumference in inches.X-SMALL: 5 to 6 inch wristSMALL: 6 to 7 inch wristREG/LARGE: 7 1/8 to 8 inch wristX-LARGE: 8 + inch wristVersa Gripps #1 MOST ADVANCED TRAINING ACCESSORY IN THE WORLD", "text": "Versa Gripps® PRO Glove Weight Lifting Straps Hooks TRAIN BETTER with Versa Gripps. Our Original, Patented Self-Supporting Versa Gripps PRO style is the Top-of-the-Line Grip Assist. Proven as the Best Grip in the World. Versa Gripps eliminate grip fatigue & enhances muscle isolation in pulling & pushing exercises for maximum muscle gains. ALL IN ONE - outperforms gloves, hooks & lifting straps. Designed for superior strength, durability & double reinforced tough. Designed with a unique extended grip-length, our Versa Gripps PRO style allows more of the grip to be wrapped around the bar for a stronger hold & added security; resulting in optimum performance. Unique \"No-Slip\" Custom Engineered Material is made exclusively for Power Gripps USA, INC. The grip material remains durable while maintaining the superior grip throughout the life of the product. Scientifically designed without bulk specifically to allow the athlete to feel a connection with the weight. New Built-in Arch Support offers carpal tunnel protection. 1 1/2 inch Wide Wrist Strap sewn with high-density foam with a hook & loop closure for excellent wrist support. Adjustable wrist support keeps the wrist in the correct position while training. Ergonomically developed to promote circulation to the hand while eliminating nerve damage. Extra-Heavy Duty Steel Buckle on the wrist strap for Superior Strength. Maximum Hand Protection from calluses. Quick Release Feature makes it safe & easy to release the weight bar during your fitness regimen. Hypo-allergenic, Anti-bacterial & Anti-microbial patent#5813950 MADE IN THE USA* Excellent Choice for the Serious Lifter * For Men and WomenPRO STYLE Sizing Chart: Measure Wrist Circumference in inches.X-SMALL: 5 to 6 inch wristSMALL: 6 to 7 inch wristREG/LARGE: 7 1/8 to 8 inch wristX-LARGE: 8 + inch wristVersa Gripps #1 MOST ADVANCED TRAINING ACCESSORY IN THE WORLD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MkDNbnbKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VW6920.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VW7E4M", "title": "Gerber Paraframe 1 Fine Edge Knife", "description": "This general-purpose knife, made with Gerber's legendary quality, is offered at an outstanding price. Its innovative frame-lock mechanism is not only a nice safety feature, it also keeps the knife's construction simple. Open-handled design makes cleaning easy. Smooth open and close action (left or right). Pocket clip keeps the knife readily available and is easily removed. Entire knife made of high-quality surgical stainless steel. Imported. Dimensions Closed: 4\"L, Open: 7\"L, Blade: 3\"L. Weight 2.7 oz.", "text": "Gerber Paraframe 1 Fine Edge Knife This general-purpose knife, made with Gerber's legendary quality, is offered at an outstanding price. Its innovative frame-lock mechanism is not only a nice safety feature, it also keeps the knife's construction simple. Open-handled design makes cleaning easy. Smooth open and close action (left or right). Pocket clip keeps the knife readily available and is easily removed. Entire knife made of high-quality surgical stainless steel. Imported. Dimensions Closed: 4\"L, Open: 7\"L, Blade: 3\"L. Weight 2.7 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SoKQbZ60L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VW7E4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 22.29}}
{"item_id": "B000VWKOBM", "title": "Manduka Cotton Yoga Strap", "description": "Based on the original yoga strap first developed in Pune, India, by yoga master B.K.S. Iyengar, Manduka's version is a must for serious yoga enthusiasts. Straps are ideal for yoga students of all levels, as they help practitioners deepen certain stretches and hold poses for longer periods of time. Beginners will find them useful for performing hamstring stretches--a must for improving flexibility--while more advanced students can use the straps to step into and hold more challenging poses. The strap is made of 100-percent natural cotton, with a strong, user-friendly buckle that holds the strap securely in place during use. The strap is available in 8- and 10-foot versions.", "text": "Manduka Cotton Yoga Strap Based on the original yoga strap first developed in Pune, India, by yoga master B.K.S. Iyengar, Manduka's version is a must for serious yoga enthusiasts. Straps are ideal for yoga students of all levels, as they help practitioners deepen certain stretches and hold poses for longer periods of time. Beginners will find them useful for performing hamstring stretches--a must for improving flexibility--while more advanced students can use the straps to step into and hold more challenging poses. The strap is made of 100-percent natural cotton, with a strong, user-friendly buckle that holds the strap securely in place during use. The strap is available in 8- and 10-foot versions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-i4ZF6anL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VWKOBM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Triathlon"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VWRJUQ", "title": "Heavy Duty 9\" Arm Mirror", "description": "This is a Pyramid chrome heavy duty mirror. This is the best mirror I have found for a fantastic price. With a 9\" arm! The mirror measures over 4-3/4 x 3-1/2\".", "text": "Heavy Duty 9\" Arm Mirror This is a Pyramid chrome heavy duty mirror. This is the best mirror I have found for a fantastic price. With a 9\" arm! The mirror measures over 4-3/4 x 3-1/2\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11BknjpbEOL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VWRJUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 12.77}}
{"item_id": "B000VWXXNI", "title": "Impex Apex Solid Olympic Curl Bar", "description": "This Olympic Curl Bar from Impex Fitness is chrome plated and is made with solid steel construction and holds all 2 Inch Olympic weight plates. The specially deigned curl bar isolates and intensifies development of the biceps, triceps and forearm muscles. Includes two weight plate collars. Backed by a manufacturer's 2 year limited warranty.", "text": "Impex Apex Solid Olympic Curl Bar This Olympic Curl Bar from Impex Fitness is chrome plated and is made with solid steel construction and holds all 2 Inch Olympic weight plates. The specially deigned curl bar isolates and intensifies development of the biceps, triceps and forearm muscles. Includes two weight plate collars. Backed by a manufacturer's 2 year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vCkBsEv3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VWXXNI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Impex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 35.99}}
{"item_id": "B000VX06ZA", "title": "Gerber 22-41120 Steadfast Knife, Fine Edge", "description": "", "text": "Gerber 22-41120 Steadfast Knife, Fine Edge", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RP%2Bsbde6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VX06ZA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 43.91}}
{"item_id": "B000VX5FJ2", "title": "Park Tool Bottom Bracket Tool - BBT-19", "description": "The BBT-19 is a heavy duty, shop quality tool for installing and removing Shimano, Truvativ GXP, Race Face, FSA and Campagnolo 16-notch external bearing bottom bracket cups. Made from investment cast steel, the BBT-19 can be used with either a 3/8\" drive torque wrench, 3/8\" ratchet driver, FRW-1 Freewheel Remover Wrench, or 1\" wrench.", "text": "Park Tool Bottom Bracket Tool - BBT-19 The BBT-19 is a heavy duty, shop quality tool for installing and removing Shimano, Truvativ GXP, Race Face, FSA and Campagnolo 16-notch external bearing bottom bracket cups. Made from investment cast steel, the BBT-19 can be used with either a 3/8\" drive torque wrench, 3/8\" ratchet driver, FRW-1 Freewheel Remover Wrench, or 1\" wrench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NTJdOmesL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VX5FJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 20.24}}
{"item_id": "B000VX7H0C", "title": "Park Tool Advanced Mechanic Tool Kit", "description": "This is ParkAAAs big kahuna for home mechanics. All you need is a truing stand and work stand and youAAAre just as ready to do serious maintenance to your bike as most local bike shops. 37 heavy duty, shop-strength tools including TL-1, CT-3, SW-0/1/3, TB-1, GP-2, AWS-1, AWS-3, HR-8, CBW-1, CBW-4, BBT-2, CCP-2, CCW- 14R, HCW-15 (2), CM-3, CC-2, CNW-1, PPL-1, SR-1, FR-5, PW-3, SCW-20, SBC-1, CN-4, and GSC-1.Product FeaturesHex Wrench: 2 mm, 2.5 mm, 3 mm, 4 mm, 5 mm, 6 mm, 8 mmBox End Wrench: 8 mm, 9 mmOpen End Wrench: 8 mm, 9 mm, 10 mm, 11 mmSpoke Wrench: 3Screwdrivers: 3 philips, 1 flatheadChain Tool: yesCrank Puller:Headset Tool:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Tire Levers: yesCable Cutters: yesBB Tool:Other Tools: Bottom Bracket & Freehub Lockring, Bottom Bracket for 16 notch external crankset system cups, Cartridge Bottom Bracket Tool, Chain Checker Chain Wear Indicator, Crank Puller for Splined Octalink & ISIS Drive, Crank Wrench with 14mm Socket / 8mm Hex, Synthetic Blend Clain Lube, Cyclone Chain Cleaner, Cable Cutter, Chainring Nut Wrench, Cassette Lockring Tool, Pre-Glued Patch Kit, GearClean Brush, PolyLube 1000 Grease, Professional Pedal Wrench, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19mm Professional Shop Cone Wrench, Chain Whip & Freewheel / Lockring WrenchWeight:Recommended Use: bike repairManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "text": "Park Tool Advanced Mechanic Tool Kit This is ParkAAAs big kahuna for home mechanics. All you need is a truing stand and work stand and youAAAre just as ready to do serious maintenance to your bike as most local bike shops. 37 heavy duty, shop-strength tools including TL-1, CT-3, SW-0/1/3, TB-1, GP-2, AWS-1, AWS-3, HR-8, CBW-1, CBW-4, BBT-2, CCP-2, CCW- 14R, HCW-15 (2), CM-3, CC-2, CNW-1, PPL-1, SR-1, FR-5, PW-3, SCW-20, SBC-1, CN-4, and GSC-1.Product FeaturesHex Wrench: 2 mm, 2.5 mm, 3 mm, 4 mm, 5 mm, 6 mm, 8 mmBox End Wrench: 8 mm, 9 mmOpen End Wrench: 8 mm, 9 mm, 10 mm, 11 mmSpoke Wrench: 3Screwdrivers: 3 philips, 1 flatheadChain Tool: yesCrank Puller:Headset Tool:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Tire Levers: yesCable Cutters: yesBB Tool:Other Tools: Bottom Bracket & Freehub Lockring, Bottom Bracket for 16 notch external crankset system cups, Cartridge Bottom Bracket Tool, Chain Checker Chain Wear Indicator, Crank Puller for Splined Octalink & ISIS Drive, Crank Wrench with 14mm Socket / 8mm Hex, Synthetic Blend Clain Lube, Cyclone Chain Cleaner, Cable Cutter, Chainring Nut Wrench, Cassette Lockring Tool, Pre-Glued Patch Kit, GearClean Brush, PolyLube 1000 Grease, Professional Pedal Wrench, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19mm Professional Shop Cone Wrench, Chain Whip & Freewheel / Lockring WrenchWeight:Recommended Use: bike repairManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OOdCDbD0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VX7H0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 249.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VXHCXY", "title": "3M Peltor 97088 Tactical PTL Earmuff", "description": "These Peltor PTL earmuffs are designed to just push the button and speech outside the muff can be heard inside very clearly and safely with distortion free amplification. Limits impulse noise to 87dB. Perfect for the shooting range or other loud-noise activities.", "text": "3M Peltor 97088 Tactical PTL Earmuff These Peltor PTL earmuffs are designed to just push the button and speech outside the muff can be heard inside very clearly and safely with distortion free amplification. Limits impulse noise to 87dB. Perfect for the shooting range or other loud-noise activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410n7QnXpYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VXHCXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 40.82}}
{"item_id": "B000VXPR5O", "title": "ProActive Stealth Putter Boote", "description": "The Stealth features a sleek design that provides 50% more space by allowing the clubs to sit compactly within the bag for easier access. Stealth has a superior fit, quality workmanship, high-grade materials provide durability and ease of use. Guaranteed to fit regardless of club size or manufacture.", "text": "ProActive Stealth Putter Boote The Stealth features a sleek design that provides 50% more space by allowing the clubs to sit compactly within the bag for easier access. Stealth has a superior fit, quality workmanship, high-grade materials provide durability and ease of use. Guaranteed to fit regardless of club size or manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VqNtn8JsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VXPR5O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Head Covers"]], "price": 3.25}}
{"item_id": "B000VXS6XO", "title": "SABRE Red Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact Size with Clip (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "Don't want to carry with your keys? Our pocket unit with a clip is perfect for you. This compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE Red Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact Size with Clip (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more) Don't want to carry with your keys? Our pocket unit with a clip is perfect for you. This compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EFWdcpqHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VXS6XO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 11.46}}
{"item_id": "B000VY2Y7M", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Tinker Classic SD Combo Knife Set", "description": "The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD Pocket Tool, is paired with the largest Tinker Pocket Tool, creating a combo that can't be beat! The Tinker / Classic SD Combo Set provides the best of both worlds: a 58mm Swiss Army Knife with 7 implements for daily use and a 91mm knife with 12 tools, including 2 blades, can and bottle openers and a Phillips screwdriver. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The Tinker Victorinox Swiss Army Knife is designed to be slim and lightweight measuring in at only 3 -inches. This compact Swiss Army Knife easily slips into a pocket to be called upon when any number of appropriate tasks present itself. With the Classic Swiss Army Knife on your key chain and the Tinker in your pocket, in the garage or glove box, you'll be well prepared for whatever comes your way!.Toothpick.Blade.Blade Type: Multi tool.Handle Material: Cellidor polished.Length: 58 mm.Width: 0.7\".Height: 0.4\".Weight: 0.8 oz..Tinker Pocket Knife Includes:.Bottle opener.Wire stripper.Large blade.Key ring.Small blade.Phillips screwdriver.Toothpick.Large screwdriver.Reamer.Can opener with -small screwdriver.Tweezers.Blade Type: Multi tool.Handle Material: Cellidor polished.Length: 91 mm.Width: 1\".Height: 0.5\".Weight: 2.2 oz.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Tinker Classic SD Combo Knife Set The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD Pocket Tool, is paired with the largest Tinker Pocket Tool, creating a combo that can't be beat! The Tinker / Classic SD Combo Set provides the best of both worlds: a 58mm Swiss Army Knife with 7 implements for daily use and a 91mm knife with 12 tools, including 2 blades, can and bottle openers and a Phillips screwdriver. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The Tinker Victorinox Swiss Army Knife is designed to be slim and lightweight measuring in at only 3 -inches. This compact Swiss Army Knife easily slips into a pocket to be called upon when any number of appropriate tasks present itself. With the Classic Swiss Army Knife on your key chain and the Tinker in your pocket, in the garage or glove box, you'll be well prepared for whatever comes your way!.Toothpick.Blade.Blade Type: Multi tool.Handle Material: Cellidor polished.Length: 58 mm.Width: 0.7\".Height: 0.4\".Weight: 0.8 oz..Tinker Pocket Knife Includes:.Bottle opener.Wire stripper.Large blade.Key ring.Small blade.Phillips screwdriver.Toothpick.Large screwdriver.Reamer.Can opener with -small screwdriver.Tweezers.Blade Type: Multi tool.Handle Material: Cellidor polished.Length: 91 mm.Width: 1\".Height: 0.5\".Weight: 2.2 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bC28qYR5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VY2Y7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B000VY4OJS", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army One Hand Trekker with Free Classic Knife", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife more than a century ago comes the Trekker, a complete one-handed multitool that's ideal for campers, hikers, and just about any other outdoor enthusiast. Bundled with a free Classic Swiss Army Knife, the Trekker measures just 4-3/8 inches long, with a stylish black housing that provides a nice contrast to the standard red Victorinox body. More significantly, the Trekker contains 12 stainless-steel tools appropriate for just about any occasion, including a one-handed serrated locking blade--one of only three Swiss Army multitools so equipped. The Trekker also includes such items as a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripper, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a Phillips screwdriver, a wood saw, a reamer, a toothpick, tweezers, and a key ring.The bonus Classic knife, meanwhile, contains six tools to put your life in order again. Measuring just 2-1/4 inches long--less than a pack of gum--and sheathed in the quintessential Swiss Army red casing, the Classic includes a knife blade, scissors, a nail file with a screwdriver tip, a removable plastic toothpick, and removable tweezers. The Classic makes a great portable toolbox and manicure kit, and is small enough to fit in just about any pocket.As with all Victorinox items, the Trekker and Classic are made to exacting standards, with dozens of individual parts and hundreds of steps going into their construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. Outfitted with a plastic housing, the Trekker carries a lifetime warranty.About Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army One Hand Trekker with Free Classic Knife From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife more than a century ago comes the Trekker, a complete one-handed multitool that's ideal for campers, hikers, and just about any other outdoor enthusiast. Bundled with a free Classic Swiss Army Knife, the Trekker measures just 4-3/8 inches long, with a stylish black housing that provides a nice contrast to the standard red Victorinox body. More significantly, the Trekker contains 12 stainless-steel tools appropriate for just about any occasion, including a one-handed serrated locking blade--one of only three Swiss Army multitools so equipped. The Trekker also includes such items as a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripper, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a Phillips screwdriver, a wood saw, a reamer, a toothpick, tweezers, and a key ring.The bonus Classic knife, meanwhile, contains six tools to put your life in order again. Measuring just 2-1/4 inches long--less than a pack of gum--and sheathed in the quintessential Swiss Army red casing, the Classic includes a knife blade, scissors, a nail file with a screwdriver tip, a removable plastic toothpick, and removable tweezers. The Classic makes a great portable toolbox and manicure kit, and is small enough to fit in just about any pocket.As with all Victorinox items, the Trekker and Classic are made to exacting standards, with dozens of individual parts and hundreds of steps going into their construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. Outfitted with a plastic housing, the Trekker carries a lifetime warranty.About Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4137yrapdOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VY4OJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VY6E5U", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Explorer with Collectible Gift Box", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Explorer knife/multi-tool in a gift box that is perfect for any camping or hiking enthusiast. This very useful, 16-function multi-tool knife has been included in the Design Collection at the Museum of Modern Art in New York City. The Explorer contains 16 stainless-steel tools that will be there when you need them, but not burden you with its size when you don't. The standard tools include a large blade, small blade, corkscrew, can opener, small screwdriver for Phillips screws, bottle opener with large screwdriver, wire stripper, reamer, key ring, tweezers, toothpick, scissors, multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier), Phillips screwdriver and magnifying glass.The Explorer comes incased in a red and silver box crafted to look like the Original Swiss Army shield/logo. The attractive gift box makes this knife the perfect present during the holidays. The box can then be re-used to store special items. As with all Victorinox items, the Explorer is made to exacting standards of construction in Ibach, Switzerland at the same factory that has made Swiss Army knives for the last century. Victorinox focuses on every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. Outfitted with a nylon handle and aluminum housing, the Explorer carries a lifetime warranty.The Explorer measures just 3-1/2 inches long when closed and contains 16 stainless steel tools.Explorer Features:Large bladeSmall bladeCorkscrewCan openerSmall screw driver for Phillips screwsBottle openerLarge screwdriverWire stripperReamerKey ringTweezersToothpickScissorsMulti-purpose hookPhillips screwdriverMagnifying glassAbout Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Explorer with Collectible Gift Box From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Explorer knife/multi-tool in a gift box that is perfect for any camping or hiking enthusiast. This very useful, 16-function multi-tool knife has been included in the Design Collection at the Museum of Modern Art in New York City. The Explorer contains 16 stainless-steel tools that will be there when you need them, but not burden you with its size when you don't. The standard tools include a large blade, small blade, corkscrew, can opener, small screwdriver for Phillips screws, bottle opener with large screwdriver, wire stripper, reamer, key ring, tweezers, toothpick, scissors, multi-purpose hook (parcel carrier), Phillips screwdriver and magnifying glass.The Explorer comes incased in a red and silver box crafted to look like the Original Swiss Army shield/logo. The attractive gift box makes this knife the perfect present during the holidays. The box can then be re-used to store special items. As with all Victorinox items, the Explorer is made to exacting standards of construction in Ibach, Switzerland at the same factory that has made Swiss Army knives for the last century. Victorinox focuses on every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. Outfitted with a nylon handle and aluminum housing, the Explorer carries a lifetime warranty.The Explorer measures just 3-1/2 inches long when closed and contains 16 stainless steel tools.Explorer Features:Large bladeSmall bladeCorkscrewCan openerSmall screw driver for Phillips screwsBottle openerLarge screwdriverWire stripperReamerKey ringTweezersToothpickScissorsMulti-purpose hookPhillips screwdriverMagnifying glassAbout Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515-bNqOfZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VY6E5U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 40.26}}
{"item_id": "B000VY94R0", "title": "Holster with Mag Pouch fits S&W Sigma, SW9VE, SW40VE, SW9GVE, SW40GVE", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The Cordura nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking holster.", "text": "Holster with Mag Pouch fits S&W Sigma, SW9VE, SW40VE, SW9GVE, SW40GVE This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The Cordura nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LlY9kMD5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VY94R0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
