{"item_id": "B000VYL3T2", "title": "ProMag Picatinny Rail 11 Rib Cover Panel-Pack of 4, Black", "description": "The polymer panel covers 1913 Picatinny rails, protecting the rail when not in use. The panel cover provides a secure and comfortable gripping surface. The panels are constructed of a Mil-Spec glass filled black polymer. The panels may be custom fit shortened to cover specific lengths of exposed rails. Package includes (4) rail panel covers.", "text": "ProMag Picatinny Rail 11 Rib Cover Panel-Pack of 4, Black The polymer panel covers 1913 Picatinny rails, protecting the rail when not in use. The panel cover provides a secure and comfortable gripping surface. The panels are constructed of a Mil-Spec glass filled black polymer. The panels may be custom fit shortened to cover specific lengths of exposed rails. Package includes (4) rail panel covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416%2BrbPCosL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYL3T2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 22.28}}
{"item_id": "B000VYNCGY", "title": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Level 2 Auto Lock Duty Holster", "description": "Based on BLACKHAWK!'s popular SERPA Tactical Holster, this jacket-slot belt-loop version gives both the tactical operative and patrol officer the option of SERPA’s retention and speed in a duty-style holster. Whether worn as part of your duty rig or as a belt-mounted holster for tactical use, you get the same great SERPA technology with this Level 2 duty holster. The patented SERPA concealment holsters offer state-of-the art retention technology for concealed carry holsters. Choose from a carbon fiber or matte finish holster, or from BLACKHAWK!'s Sportster series designed specifically with the outdoorsman in mind. BLACKHAWK! concealment holsters feature belt loop and/or paddle platforms for your concealment carry preference and comfort. Features: Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for security; full-length holster body protects rear sights; reduced gun profile supports community-friendly look; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops also available.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Level 2 Auto Lock Duty Holster Based on BLACKHAWK!'s popular SERPA Tactical Holster, this jacket-slot belt-loop version gives both the tactical operative and patrol officer the option of SERPA’s retention and speed in a duty-style holster. Whether worn as part of your duty rig or as a belt-mounted holster for tactical use, you get the same great SERPA technology with this Level 2 duty holster. The patented SERPA concealment holsters offer state-of-the art retention technology for concealed carry holsters. Choose from a carbon fiber or matte finish holster, or from BLACKHAWK!'s Sportster series designed specifically with the outdoorsman in mind. BLACKHAWK! concealment holsters feature belt loop and/or paddle platforms for your concealment carry preference and comfort. Features: Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for security; full-length holster body protects rear sights; reduced gun profile supports community-friendly look; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops also available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pshIg5lgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYNCGY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
