{"item_id": "B000VYPDHU", "title": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish Beretta 92 / 96, BLACK", "description": "BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96", "text": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish Beretta 92 / 96, BLACK BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ByI3517aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYPDHU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VYPDLQ", "title": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Shoulder Harness", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! SERPA Shoulder Harness SERPA holster mounts on the underarm platform in a horizontal position. Made for both medium- and large-frame torsos.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Shoulder Harness The BLACKHAWK! SERPA Shoulder Harness SERPA holster mounts on the underarm platform in a horizontal position. Made for both medium- and large-frame torsos.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A8JDPF7jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYPDLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000VYQAZE", "title": "Allen Company Sling Swivel Set for 1-Inch Slings with Hardware for Bolt Action Rifles", "description": "This swivel set, from firearm supplier Allen Company, is made for bolt action rifles without hardware installed, and contains all the necessary components for installation. Designed to work with both wood and synthetic stocks, the one-inch hardware has an additional threaded screw and nut, for a secure connection in stocks with thin wood wals or hollow synthetic stocks.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.", "text": "Allen Company Sling Swivel Set for 1-Inch Slings with Hardware for Bolt Action Rifles This swivel set, from firearm supplier Allen Company, is made for bolt action rifles without hardware installed, and contains all the necessary components for installation. Designed to work with both wood and synthetic stocks, the one-inch hardware has an additional threaded screw and nut, for a secure connection in stocks with thin wood wals or hollow synthetic stocks.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K5R4DAKjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYQAZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B000VYQBSU", "title": "Midwest Industries Flip-Up Front Sight Gas Block Height, Black", "description": "This flip-up front sight from Midwest Industries uses a super smooth ball bearing pivot detent that automatically locks in the raised position with a locking detent. This model is to be used with gas block height rails and folds to the front.", "text": "Midwest Industries Flip-Up Front Sight Gas Block Height, Black This flip-up front sight from Midwest Industries uses a super smooth ball bearing pivot detent that automatically locks in the raised position with a locking detent. This model is to be used with gas block height rails and folds to the front.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lvL4ox2dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYQBSU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Midwest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 78.91}}
{"item_id": "B000VYR0H6", "title": "Harris Engineering 1A2-LM Solid Base 9 - 13-Inch BiPod", "description": "An Improved Version Of The Original Leg Notch Bipod. The Legs Eject By Spring Action. Seven Height Settings From 9 To 13 Inches.", "text": "Harris Engineering 1A2-LM Solid Base 9 - 13-Inch BiPod An Improved Version Of The Original Leg Notch Bipod. The Legs Eject By Spring Action. Seven Height Settings From 9 To 13 Inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JGbzfvN4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYR0H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harris Engineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 73.71}}
