{"item_id": "B000VYT0U6", "title": "Magpul Ladder Rail Protectors- DARK EARTH", "description": "Ladder Panels offer very low-profile 1913 Picatinny rail coverage. The Santoprene material provide a rubbery surface for improved weapon control and rail protection. Easily cut for custom lengths, each panel fits one side of a carbine-length rail (18 slots). One panel per package. Manufactured by Falcon Industries, Inc.", "text": "Magpul Ladder Rail Protectors- DARK EARTH Ladder Panels offer very low-profile 1913 Picatinny rail coverage. The Santoprene material provide a rubbery surface for improved weapon control and rail protection. Easily cut for custom lengths, each panel fits one side of a carbine-length rail (18 slots). One panel per package. Manufactured by Falcon Industries, Inc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21txFkS0A2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYT0U6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Rails"]], "price": 9.85}}
