{"item_id": "B000VYW1XY", "title": "Meprolight Glock Tru-Dot Night Sight fits G17,19,20,21,22,23. Adjustable set with green rear and front sight", "description": "The ML20224 Glock Tru-Dot Night Sight fits G17,19,20,21,22,23. This is an adjustable set with green rear and front sight. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights. The item cannot be shipped to CA.", "text": "Meprolight Glock Tru-Dot Night Sight fits G17,19,20,21,22,23. Adjustable set with green rear and front sight The ML20224 Glock Tru-Dot Night Sight fits G17,19,20,21,22,23. This is an adjustable set with green rear and front sight. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights. The item cannot be shipped to CA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CS3Jd2CRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYW1XY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meprolight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 140.97}}
{"item_id": "B000VYZ2G2", "title": "Markwort Patented Stadium Chair", "description": "The Markwort Stadium Chair is crafted of quality Cordova canvas and has a steel frame for comfort and durability. It fits virtually any type of wood or metal bleacher and features a removable back that allows easy screening or embroidery.Specifications:Cordova canvas stadium chairSteel frameSeat Dimensions: 17 by 13.5 inches (W x D)Back Dimensions: 17.5 by 11.25 inches (W x H)Imprintable area on front and back of seat", "text": "Markwort Patented Stadium Chair The Markwort Stadium Chair is crafted of quality Cordova canvas and has a steel frame for comfort and durability. It fits virtually any type of wood or metal bleacher and features a removable back that allows easy screening or embroidery.Specifications:Cordova canvas stadium chairSteel frameSeat Dimensions: 17 by 13.5 inches (W x D)Back Dimensions: 17.5 by 11.25 inches (W x H)Imprintable area on front and back of seat", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wWJe3C1bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VYZ2G2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Markwort", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Playing Field Equipment", "Stadium Seats & Cushions"]], "price": 48.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VZ1IJG", "title": "Caldwell Steady NXT Rifle and Pistol rest", "description": "Three-piece design can be used as a single rifle bench rest, adjust to fit any length long gun by removing the middle connector, or use the front rest alone for handguns. Features an adjustable elevation platform and non-marring material that is gentle to the firearms finish.", "text": "Caldwell Steady NXT Rifle and Pistol rest Three-piece design can be used as a single rifle bench rest, adjust to fit any length long gun by removing the middle connector, or use the front rest alone for handguns. Features an adjustable elevation platform and non-marring material that is gentle to the firearms finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-VX0iViIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZ1IJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 29.98}}
{"item_id": "B000VZ1R4M", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Ambidextrous Flat Belt Holster", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Ambidextrous Flat Belt Holster fits any belt up to 2” wide and holds most small to medium frame and medium to large frame autos and revolvers. Holster is offers an adjustable, ambidextrous thumb break.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Ambidextrous Flat Belt Holster The BLACKHAWK! Ambidextrous Flat Belt Holster fits any belt up to 2” wide and holds most small to medium frame and medium to large frame autos and revolvers. Holster is offers an adjustable, ambidextrous thumb break.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wiB-jL1mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZ1R4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.7}}
{"item_id": "B000VZ1S32", "title": "Caldwell Airgun Resetting Target", "description": "The Caldwell airgun resetting targets offer a portable, interactive shooting experience at a low price. The lower targets spin up and lock out of the way when shot, then can be re-set by shooting the upper circle. Fun for shooters of all ages!", "text": "Caldwell Airgun Resetting Target The Caldwell airgun resetting targets offer a portable, interactive shooting experience at a low price. The lower targets spin up and lock out of the way when shot, then can be re-set by shooting the upper circle. Fun for shooters of all ages!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IY5xUdD7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZ1S32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B000VZ2Q5G", "title": "Louisville Slugger UPM 45 Blue Flame Pitching Machine", "description": "The UPM is sturdy, portable, and requires no electricity.Named the official Pony Baseball and Softball League pitching machine, the Ultimate Pitching Machine (UPM) 45 helps batters and coaches enjoy a more successful batting practice or coach-pitch game. It's sturdy, portable, and requires no electricity, which makes it great for practices and games, home or away. Plus it saves the coach's arm. Because the lever action flicks baseballs with consistent speed and location, it's often used as an alternative in coach-pitch leagues to help overcome the fear factor of live pitching. Young hitters will know where and when the ball will be pitched. For all ages, the UPM model 45 allows hitters to work on specific locations and sharpen muscle memory without turning the coach's arm to jelly.The Louisville Slugger UPM45 is the ultimate training aid that pitches reliably and consistently for batter after batter allowing the hitter to concentrate on developing a proper level swing path to the ball. The UPM45 is more than just a pitching machine, though--it also throws accurate fly-balls and hard ground balls consistently to incorporate into your drills and eliminate the need for hitting the ball during drills.The Louisville Slugger UPM 45 Blue Flame Pitching Machine throws real baseballs and softballs between 18 and 45 miles per hour and soft, lightweight balls up to 60 miles per hour. This machine has been authorized for use by teams in the majority of youth leagues in America including Babe Ruth Baseball and Softball, the Cal Ripken Division of Babe Ruth Baseball,The UPM allows hitters to work on specific locations and sharpen muscle memory without turning the coach's arm to jelly.Pony League Baseball and Softball, and many more.For coaches and team managers, the UPM solves any number of problems. There's no need to use special pitching machine balls - it won't rip or tear leather or synthetic ball covers.Features:Portable and lightweight at only 25 poundsMechanical pitching machine perfect for throwing accurate pitches, infield drills, and outfield drillsNo batteries or electricity requiredThrows regulation baseballs and fastpitch softballs up to 45 miles per hourThrows lightweight practice baseballs and softballs up to 60 miles per hourThrows slowpitch softballs with up to a 12-foot archThrows accurate fly balls and hard ground balls", "text": "Louisville Slugger UPM 45 Blue Flame Pitching Machine The UPM is sturdy, portable, and requires no electricity.Named the official Pony Baseball and Softball League pitching machine, the Ultimate Pitching Machine (UPM) 45 helps batters and coaches enjoy a more successful batting practice or coach-pitch game. It's sturdy, portable, and requires no electricity, which makes it great for practices and games, home or away. Plus it saves the coach's arm. Because the lever action flicks baseballs with consistent speed and location, it's often used as an alternative in coach-pitch leagues to help overcome the fear factor of live pitching. Young hitters will know where and when the ball will be pitched. For all ages, the UPM model 45 allows hitters to work on specific locations and sharpen muscle memory without turning the coach's arm to jelly.The Louisville Slugger UPM45 is the ultimate training aid that pitches reliably and consistently for batter after batter allowing the hitter to concentrate on developing a proper level swing path to the ball. The UPM45 is more than just a pitching machine, though--it also throws accurate fly-balls and hard ground balls consistently to incorporate into your drills and eliminate the need for hitting the ball during drills.The Louisville Slugger UPM 45 Blue Flame Pitching Machine throws real baseballs and softballs between 18 and 45 miles per hour and soft, lightweight balls up to 60 miles per hour. This machine has been authorized for use by teams in the majority of youth leagues in America including Babe Ruth Baseball and Softball, the Cal Ripken Division of Babe Ruth Baseball,The UPM allows hitters to work on specific locations and sharpen muscle memory without turning the coach's arm to jelly.Pony League Baseball and Softball, and many more.For coaches and team managers, the UPM solves any number of problems. There's no need to use special pitching machine balls - it won't rip or tear leather or synthetic ball covers.Features:Portable and lightweight at only 25 poundsMechanical pitching machine perfect for throwing accurate pitches, infield drills, and outfield drillsNo batteries or electricity requiredThrows regulation baseballs and fastpitch softballs up to 45 miles per hourThrows lightweight practice baseballs and softballs up to 60 miles per hourThrows slowpitch softballs with up to a 12-foot archThrows accurate fly balls and hard ground balls", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kl4X0Ja2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZ2Q5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Louisville Slugger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Pitching Machines"]], "price": 191.49}}
{"item_id": "B000VZKEWS", "title": "New- PELICAN 1470-000-110 1470 CASE - 1470-000-110", "description": "Double-safety locking latches with keys. Open cell core with solid wall design - strong and light weight. Pick N Pluck foam allows customized protection for electronics. Automatic Pressure Equalization Valve. O-ring seal. Comfortable rubber over-molded handle. Stainless steel hardware. Watertight, crushproof, and dust proof. Interior: 15 5/8\" W x 10 7/16\" H x 3 3/4\" D. Exterior: 16 11/16\" W x 13 1/8\" H x 4 5/16\" D. Lifetime warranty", "text": "New- PELICAN 1470-000-110 1470 CASE - 1470-000-110 Double-safety locking latches with keys. Open cell core with solid wall design - strong and light weight. Pick N Pluck foam allows customized protection for electronics. Automatic Pressure Equalization Valve. O-ring seal. Comfortable rubber over-molded handle. Stainless steel hardware. Watertight, crushproof, and dust proof. Interior: 15 5/8\" W x 10 7/16\" H x 3 3/4\" D. Exterior: 16 11/16\" W x 13 1/8\" H x 4 5/16\" D. Lifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gczz2o%2BjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZKEWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pelican", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 110.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VZLCWY", "title": "Lube-N-Walk Treadmill Lubrication Kit", "description": "Recommended for treadmills that need lubricating. Comes with lubricant and applicator wand. 6 month supply of Silicone Lube", "text": "Lube-N-Walk Treadmill Lubrication Kit Recommended for treadmills that need lubricating. Comes with lubricant and applicator wand. 6 month supply of Silicone Lube", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U-E-jgP9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZLCWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lube-N-Walk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Machine Accessories", "Treadmill Lubricants"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B000VZQ04Y", "title": "Holster for Walther PPK & PPK/S with built-in Magazine Pouch", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking holster.", "text": "Holster for Walther PPK & PPK/S with built-in Magazine Pouch This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vJKYqmrRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZQ04Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B000VZQ27Y", "title": "Inside the Pants Holster For Walther PPK", "description": "This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a hardened steel spring clip and an adjustable, removable thumb break.", "text": "Inside the Pants Holster For Walther PPK This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a hardened steel spring clip and an adjustable, removable thumb break.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516Q-KDd1KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000VZQ27Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B000W09NYM", "title": "Stamina Pilates Magic Circle", "description": "The Pilates Magic Circle was created by Joseph Pilates to be a versatile exercise accessory that you could use anywhere. The soft rubber ring provides resistance for faster, more targeted toning to improve muscle strength throughout the body--and especially in problem areas including the inner and outer thighs, upper arms, chest, and the pelvic muscles. This Magic Circle boasts professional grade, nonporous molded padding with form-molded grips to fit comfortably against your body, over a steel core ring. The ring can be used alone or added to a Pilates reformer workout.The Magic Ring features foam molded padded grips for a secure hold.", "text": "Stamina Pilates Magic Circle The Pilates Magic Circle was created by Joseph Pilates to be a versatile exercise accessory that you could use anywhere. The soft rubber ring provides resistance for faster, more targeted toning to improve muscle strength throughout the body--and especially in problem areas including the inner and outer thighs, upper arms, chest, and the pelvic muscles. This Magic Circle boasts professional grade, nonporous molded padding with form-molded grips to fit comfortably against your body, over a steel core ring. The ring can be used alone or added to a Pilates reformer workout.The Magic Ring features foam molded padded grips for a secure hold.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315a2z%2BJx6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W09NYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stamina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Pilates", "Fitness Circles"]], "price": 22.87}}
{"item_id": "B000W16JX4", "title": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Ball Air Pump - High Volume - Heavy Duty - Pumps on Up and Down Strokes - Multiple Nozzles to Work on All Inflatables - 2 Color Choices", "description": "For a video demo, search YouTube for \"isokinetics inc\". Our biggest, sturdiest model. Good for exercise balls and other inflatables requiring large volumes of air. Has a well anchored hose to handle higher pressure situations and 4 nozzles to fit almost anything. Built for heavy use. Notes: You need your feet to anchor it but because of its larger size you don't need to bend over as much as other models. You can tell by using it it is built for heavy duty use. Our test only took 75 up and down strokes and less than 1.5 minutes to fill a 65mm exercise ball. One feature on this model that may be handy is the way the air hoses lock in place. If you have higher pressure inflatables or you want to put all your weight into pumping it, this will keep the hose in place and not pop out under pressure. It also deflates, which is great for shrinking items down as far as possible for storage.", "text": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Ball Air Pump - High Volume - Heavy Duty - Pumps on Up and Down Strokes - Multiple Nozzles to Work on All Inflatables - 2 Color Choices For a video demo, search YouTube for \"isokinetics inc\". Our biggest, sturdiest model. Good for exercise balls and other inflatables requiring large volumes of air. Has a well anchored hose to handle higher pressure situations and 4 nozzles to fit almost anything. Built for heavy use. Notes: You need your feet to anchor it but because of its larger size you don't need to bend over as much as other models. You can tell by using it it is built for heavy duty use. Our test only took 75 up and down strokes and less than 1.5 minutes to fill a 65mm exercise ball. One feature on this model that may be handy is the way the air hoses lock in place. If you have higher pressure inflatables or you want to put all your weight into pumping it, this will keep the hose in place and not pop out under pressure. It also deflates, which is great for shrinking items down as far as possible for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PzllOR6XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W16JX4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B000W1A83G", "title": "DFX Sports and Fitness Powerball Gyro Exercizer with Docking Station", "description": "FEATURES of DFX Sports and Fitness Powerball Gyro Exercizer with Docking Station A great workout toll for any age Once the gyro is activated, the gyro luminates a blue color light Has LED light built into the rotor Perfect for rehab, toning, and strengthening Includes a docking station to help activate your gyro and serve as a stand when not in use This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "DFX Sports and Fitness Powerball Gyro Exercizer with Docking Station FEATURES of DFX Sports and Fitness Powerball Gyro Exercizer with Docking Station A great workout toll for any age Once the gyro is activated, the gyro luminates a blue color light Has LED light built into the rotor Perfect for rehab, toning, and strengthening Includes a docking station to help activate your gyro and serve as a stand when not in use This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r3LuuE3ZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W1A83G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dynaflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 41.38}}
{"item_id": "B000W1OMRO", "title": "Dynaflex SM-01 Speedometer for Dynaflex Power Balls", "description": "Designed to work with the DynaFlex Pro Plus and Powerball gyros, this digital speed meter upgrades the performance of both machines. The speed meter offers three important functions: it measures the user's current speed, remembers the user's highest rpm, and calculates the maximum revolutions of the gyro. As a result, it's possible to keep precise track of your rehabilitation progress, or you can challenge yourself or your friends to see who can achieve the highest speeds. Plus, it's a breeze to install the speed meter--just remove the cap of the gyro and snap the meter into place.", "text": "Dynaflex SM-01 Speedometer for Dynaflex Power Balls Designed to work with the DynaFlex Pro Plus and Powerball gyros, this digital speed meter upgrades the performance of both machines. The speed meter offers three important functions: it measures the user's current speed, remembers the user's highest rpm, and calculates the maximum revolutions of the gyro. As a result, it's possible to keep precise track of your rehabilitation progress, or you can challenge yourself or your friends to see who can achieve the highest speeds. Plus, it's a breeze to install the speed meter--just remove the cap of the gyro and snap the meter into place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GcB9NDzAL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W1OMRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dynaflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 17.2}}
{"item_id": "B000W1QKUG", "title": "Stack - On® 8 - gun Security Cabinet", "description": "Protect your valuable guns from theft with this Stack - On 8 - gun Security Cabinet! Peace of mind... how much is it worth to you? For topnotch storage and protection for your firearms, you just can't beat this large-capacity Gun Safe from Stack-On. Details: Cabinet holds 8 rifles or shotguns up to 52\" tall; Standard 3-point locking system with double-bitted, key-coded lock provides added security; Steel top shelf provides additional storage or is removable; Foam padded bottom and barrel rests reduce scratches; Easy to assemble with integrated, form-fitting parts that are fastened together. Fasteners are tamper proof from the outside of the cabinet; Pre-drilled mounting holes in the bottom and back of the cabinet allow for easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware is included; Measures 17\"w. x 11\"d. x 53\"h., 55 lbs. Order Today! Stack-On 8-gun Security Cabinet", "text": "Stack - On® 8 - gun Security Cabinet Protect your valuable guns from theft with this Stack - On 8 - gun Security Cabinet! Peace of mind... how much is it worth to you? For topnotch storage and protection for your firearms, you just can't beat this large-capacity Gun Safe from Stack-On. Details: Cabinet holds 8 rifles or shotguns up to 52\" tall; Standard 3-point locking system with double-bitted, key-coded lock provides added security; Steel top shelf provides additional storage or is removable; Foam padded bottom and barrel rests reduce scratches; Easy to assemble with integrated, form-fitting parts that are fastened together. Fasteners are tamper proof from the outside of the cabinet; Pre-drilled mounting holes in the bottom and back of the cabinet allow for easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware is included; Measures 17\"w. x 11\"d. x 53\"h., 55 lbs. Order Today! Stack-On 8-gun Security Cabinet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KDTG80kUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W1QKUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 114.0}}
{"item_id": "B000W1YN5K", "title": "GAMO Big Cat 1200 w/4x32 Scope Pellet Gun", "description": "The GAMO(r) Big Cat pellet rifle with a 4x32 scope is designed to go the distance for 1000's of rounds at hunting and target shooting in any weather. It features a power plant able to yield a sizzling 1200 fps and match-grade accuracy with PBA ammunition.", "text": "GAMO Big Cat 1200 w/4x32 Scope Pellet Gun The GAMO(r) Big Cat pellet rifle with a 4x32 scope is designed to go the distance for 1000's of rounds at hunting and target shooting in any weather. It features a power plant able to yield a sizzling 1200 fps and match-grade accuracy with PBA ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21N7x%2B24HwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W1YN5K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W2115Y", "title": "Gamo Recon Air Rifle", "description": "Suitable for small pest control, the Recon 0.177 Caliber Air Rifle from Gamo features a weather resistant fluted barrel, a thumb hole stock, and twin cheek pads for right or left-sided comfort. The single shot rifle produces 525 feet per second (FPS) with lead and comes complete with a 4x magnification, 20-millimeter objective rifle scope for precise target acquisition. The Recon carries a one year limited warranty from Gamo.The Recon Air Rifle comes with a 4x30 Rifle Scope with a TV reticle.Mechanism:Velocity: 525 feet per second (FPS) with leadSingle shotBreak Barrel: single cocking systemAutomatic cocking safety systemCocking Effort: 19 poundsBarrel: precision rifled steelManual safetyStock:Stock: tough all weather molded syntheticButt Plate: ventilated rubber pad for recoil absorptionCheekpiece: twin cheek pads (comfortable for ambidextrous shooting)Optics:Scope Ramp: grooved receiverMagnification: 4xObjective Diameter: 20 millimetersTV ReticleSpecifications:Weight: 4.63 poundsLength: 37.2 inchesAmmunition: any 0.177 pelletCaliber: 0.177Trigger Pull: 3.3 poundsBarrel Length: 16 inchesPlease Note:Gamo airguns are not toys and are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision is required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "text": "Gamo Recon Air Rifle Suitable for small pest control, the Recon 0.177 Caliber Air Rifle from Gamo features a weather resistant fluted barrel, a thumb hole stock, and twin cheek pads for right or left-sided comfort. The single shot rifle produces 525 feet per second (FPS) with lead and comes complete with a 4x magnification, 20-millimeter objective rifle scope for precise target acquisition. The Recon carries a one year limited warranty from Gamo.The Recon Air Rifle comes with a 4x30 Rifle Scope with a TV reticle.Mechanism:Velocity: 525 feet per second (FPS) with leadSingle shotBreak Barrel: single cocking systemAutomatic cocking safety systemCocking Effort: 19 poundsBarrel: precision rifled steelManual safetyStock:Stock: tough all weather molded syntheticButt Plate: ventilated rubber pad for recoil absorptionCheekpiece: twin cheek pads (comfortable for ambidextrous shooting)Optics:Scope Ramp: grooved receiverMagnification: 4xObjective Diameter: 20 millimetersTV ReticleSpecifications:Weight: 4.63 poundsLength: 37.2 inchesAmmunition: any 0.177 pelletCaliber: 0.177Trigger Pull: 3.3 poundsBarrel Length: 16 inchesPlease Note:Gamo airguns are not toys and are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision is required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21X84tSYSZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W2115Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W21OJM", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 2 Tactical Black Holster", "description": "Made specifically to meet the demands of tactical operations, the Level 2 Tactical Holster gives you the benefits of a drop-leg configuration for ideal holster location. It also comes equipped with a flexible thigh platform that conforms to leg size, a Y-harness suspension system for even weight distribution, and quick-disconnect swivel buckles on belt mounts for superior maneuverability. Features: Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size; Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket; quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting; accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc.; rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding; passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; and a hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 2 Tactical Black Holster Made specifically to meet the demands of tactical operations, the Level 2 Tactical Holster gives you the benefits of a drop-leg configuration for ideal holster location. It also comes equipped with a flexible thigh platform that conforms to leg size, a Y-harness suspension system for even weight distribution, and quick-disconnect swivel buckles on belt mounts for superior maneuverability. Features: Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size; Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket; quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting; accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc.; rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding; passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; and a hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wClmX954L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W21OJM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W23DSW", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Inside-the-Pants Black Holster", "description": "The inconspicuous design of the BLACKHAWK! Leather Inside-the-Pants Holster makes it the perfect choice for a secondary weapon or deep concealment while undercover or off duty. Features: Angle-adjustable belt loop is mounted to reinforced upper body for stability; adjustable tension-screw gives you the choice on level of retention; shirt shield protects clothing, keeps holster opening unobstructed, and increases comfort ; allows for middle-of-the-back, strong-side, appendix, or cross-draw carry; less bulk than most leather inside-the-pants holsters; and molded sight track for smooth draw and re-holster.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Inside-the-Pants Black Holster The inconspicuous design of the BLACKHAWK! Leather Inside-the-Pants Holster makes it the perfect choice for a secondary weapon or deep concealment while undercover or off duty. Features: Angle-adjustable belt loop is mounted to reinforced upper body for stability; adjustable tension-screw gives you the choice on level of retention; shirt shield protects clothing, keeps holster opening unobstructed, and increases comfort ; allows for middle-of-the-back, strong-side, appendix, or cross-draw carry; less bulk than most leather inside-the-pants holsters; and molded sight track for smooth draw and re-holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jih0cBSNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W23DSW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W277OS", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Speed Classic Holster (J-Frame, Taurus 85 and Ruger SP101)", "description": "Simply put, this adaptation of the famous Berns-Martin design is a small holster for a small handgun. With its discreet design and heavy-duty construction, the BLACKHAWK! Leather Speed Classic assures that you’ll never have to worry about clumsy draws or unreliable retention again. The holster is handmade of premium, wet-molded leather for durability and heavy-duty elastic for a secure fit. It also comes complete with a trailing belt loop to pull the grip in tight to the body.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Speed Classic Holster (J-Frame, Taurus 85 and Ruger SP101) Simply put, this adaptation of the famous Berns-Martin design is a small holster for a small handgun. With its discreet design and heavy-duty construction, the BLACKHAWK! Leather Speed Classic assures that you’ll never have to worry about clumsy draws or unreliable retention again. The holster is handmade of premium, wet-molded leather for durability and heavy-duty elastic for a secure fit. It also comes complete with a trailing belt loop to pull the grip in tight to the body.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uFqxPtffL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W277OS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 54.68}}
{"item_id": "B000W29GHY", "title": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Smith and Wesson M and P, Black, Full Size", "description": "For a demonstration of why Crimson Trace laser sights make you a better shooter, look no further than y our favorite semi-auto. Because it’s here that our precision engineering and repeatable accuracy have really earned their reputation. And if concealed carry is your thing, the seamless integration of lasergrips won’t inhibit holster fit. Or anything else except a criminal’s confidence.", "text": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Smith and Wesson M and P, Black, Full Size For a demonstration of why Crimson Trace laser sights make you a better shooter, look no further than y our favorite semi-auto. Because it’s here that our precision engineering and repeatable accuracy have really earned their reputation. And if concealed carry is your thing, the seamless integration of lasergrips won’t inhibit holster fit. Or anything else except a criminal’s confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3181uVJ382L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W29GHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 284.49}}
