{"item_id": "B000W30TMY", "title": "Glock Apparel Long Sleeve T-Shirt AP61404", "description": "Extend T-shirt-wearing season with this long-sleeve version of the GLOCK GEAR T-shirt. Made of max-weight, 100% pre-shrunk cotton fabric. Available in White w/Black GLOCK Shooting Sports logo and Black w/White GLOCK Shooting Sports logo. Austria on the right sleeve and USA on the left sleeve.", "text": "Glock Apparel Long Sleeve T-Shirt AP61404 Extend T-shirt-wearing season with this long-sleeve version of the GLOCK GEAR T-shirt. Made of max-weight, 100% pre-shrunk cotton fabric. Available in White w/Black GLOCK Shooting Sports logo and Black w/White GLOCK Shooting Sports logo. Austria on the right sleeve and USA on the left sleeve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WNTcoPktL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W30TMY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing", "T-Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W30UAA", "title": "Beeman Sportsman Series Deluxe Air Pistol - Model 2004", "description": "Beeman 2004 Deluxe Pellet Pistol Outstanding accuracy and velocity with a single pump. German engineered and designed single stroke pneumatic over-cocking design produces up to 410 fps velocity that's totally recoilless and no CO2 is required.Target-style trigger provides crisp let-off and minimum take up. Custom shaped, finger groove grip helps improve shooting comfort and aids with accuracy. Polymer frame is durable and lightweight, cast aluminum slide and rifled steel barrel provide long life and repeatable accuracy. Includes manual safety and rear sights are adjustable for wind age and elevation. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List). Specifications: Caliber: .177 Pellet Velocity: 410 fps; Weight: 1.7 lbs.; Overall Length: 9.5\"; Barrel Length: 4.5\"; Pumps: Single Pump (Recoiless); Action: Single Stroke Pneumatic; Single Shot; Barrel: Rifled. Finish: Polymer Frame; Sights: Front- Post, Rear- Adjustable for Wind age and Elevation; Scope Rail: 11 mm Requires Medium Rings; Trigger Pull: 4 lbs. Trigger: Target Style; Safety: Manual. Grips: Custom Shaped, Finger Grooved.", "text": "Beeman Sportsman Series Deluxe Air Pistol - Model 2004 Beeman 2004 Deluxe Pellet Pistol Outstanding accuracy and velocity with a single pump. German engineered and designed single stroke pneumatic over-cocking design produces up to 410 fps velocity that's totally recoilless and no CO2 is required.Target-style trigger provides crisp let-off and minimum take up. Custom shaped, finger groove grip helps improve shooting comfort and aids with accuracy. Polymer frame is durable and lightweight, cast aluminum slide and rifled steel barrel provide long life and repeatable accuracy. Includes manual safety and rear sights are adjustable for wind age and elevation. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List). Specifications: Caliber: .177 Pellet Velocity: 410 fps; Weight: 1.7 lbs.; Overall Length: 9.5\"; Barrel Length: 4.5\"; Pumps: Single Pump (Recoiless); Action: Single Stroke Pneumatic; Single Shot; Barrel: Rifled. Finish: Polymer Frame; Sights: Front- Post, Rear- Adjustable for Wind age and Elevation; Scope Rail: 11 mm Requires Medium Rings; Trigger Pull: 4 lbs. Trigger: Target Style; Safety: Manual. Grips: Custom Shaped, Finger Grooved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pdbPbrDOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W30UAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Beeman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B000W32PIK", "title": "Glock KB17281 81 Field Knife", "description": "The Survival Knife is a field knife with a plain edge on one side and a saw edge on the other. Used as a weapon, opening bottles and ammunition boxes too, this Survival Knife is coated to prevent corrosion to give you the endurance and dependability you can rely on from Glock. Specifications: - Edge Type: Serrated - Blade Type: Clip Point - Blade Length: 6 1/2 Inch - Overall Length: 11.4 Inch - Blade Material: Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate Treated - Handle Material: Black Polymer - Includes: Black Polymer Sheath.", "text": "Glock KB17281 81 Field Knife The Survival Knife is a field knife with a plain edge on one side and a saw edge on the other. Used as a weapon, opening bottles and ammunition boxes too, this Survival Knife is coated to prevent corrosion to give you the endurance and dependability you can rely on from Glock. Specifications: - Edge Type: Serrated - Blade Type: Clip Point - Blade Length: 6 1/2 Inch - Overall Length: 11.4 Inch - Blade Material: Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate Treated - Handle Material: Black Polymer - Includes: Black Polymer Sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gPRvCzG%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W32PIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B000W32TN6", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Buck Gun (Brown/Black, 29.8 Inch)", "description": "The lever-action, Buck Gun spring rifle from Daisy is perfect for plinking, shooting paper targets, and for training new shooters. The 0.177 caliber BB rifle is lightweight, easy to cock, and durable with an engraved solid wood stock that is just the right length for young shooters. The BBs can reach velocities of up to 275 feet per second from the steel barrel, and the rifle holds up to 400 BBs for continuous shooting. The Buck comes equipped with a TruGlo fiber optic front sight and a fixed rear sight to help shooters acquire their target. This rifle is recommended for children aged 10 years old and up with adult supervision.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5 millimeters) BBAction: Lever Cocking, Spring AirSights: TruGlo Fiber Optic Sight, Open Fixed RearSafety: Crossbolt Trigger BlockMaximum Muzzle Velocity: 275 feet per secondMaximum Shooting Distance: 193 yardsCapacity: 400 shotsStock/Forearm/Grip: Stained Solid WoodBarrel: Smooth Bore SteelWeight: 1.60 poundsOverall Length: 29.8 inches", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Buck Gun (Brown/Black, 29.8 Inch) The lever-action, Buck Gun spring rifle from Daisy is perfect for plinking, shooting paper targets, and for training new shooters. The 0.177 caliber BB rifle is lightweight, easy to cock, and durable with an engraved solid wood stock that is just the right length for young shooters. The BBs can reach velocities of up to 275 feet per second from the steel barrel, and the rifle holds up to 400 BBs for continuous shooting. The Buck comes equipped with a TruGlo fiber optic front sight and a fixed rear sight to help shooters acquire their target. This rifle is recommended for children aged 10 years old and up with adult supervision.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5 millimeters) BBAction: Lever Cocking, Spring AirSights: TruGlo Fiber Optic Sight, Open Fixed RearSafety: Crossbolt Trigger BlockMaximum Muzzle Velocity: 275 feet per secondMaximum Shooting Distance: 193 yardsCapacity: 400 shotsStock/Forearm/Grip: Stained Solid WoodBarrel: Smooth Bore SteelWeight: 1.60 poundsOverall Length: 29.8 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/216ZxEP7mYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W32TN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 32.97}}
{"item_id": "B000W34M5E", "title": "BSA Deer Hunter 2.5x20 Rifle Scope DH25X20", "description": "Get that elusive deer with a BSA Deer Hunter Scope. Tired of heading home with no deer to show for the trip! A hard working producing Scope for the serious deer hunter. Camera quality glass lenses are ground to give you an undistorted and clear image. The easy focus eyepiece keeps the reticle sharp for your eyesight. It's bright, tough and priced right here! Features and specifications: Long eye relief; Fingertip adjustable windage and elevation turret ; Nitrogen filled; Magnification 2.5X ; Objective lens diameter 20 mm ; Exit pupil range 8.1 mm ; Field of view at 100 yards: 24.'; Optimum eye relief 4\" ; Parallax setting 100 yds. ; Click adjustment value 1/4\"; Adjustment range 40-40; Weight 8 ozs. ; A super idea! Order your BSA Scope now! BSA Deer Hunter Scope", "text": "BSA Deer Hunter 2.5x20 Rifle Scope DH25X20 Get that elusive deer with a BSA Deer Hunter Scope. Tired of heading home with no deer to show for the trip! A hard working producing Scope for the serious deer hunter. Camera quality glass lenses are ground to give you an undistorted and clear image. The easy focus eyepiece keeps the reticle sharp for your eyesight. It's bright, tough and priced right here! Features and specifications: Long eye relief; Fingertip adjustable windage and elevation turret ; Nitrogen filled; Magnification 2.5X ; Objective lens diameter 20 mm ; Exit pupil range 8.1 mm ; Field of view at 100 yards: 24.'; Optimum eye relief 4\" ; Parallax setting 100 yds. ; Click adjustment value 1/4\"; Adjustment range 40-40; Weight 8 ozs. ; A super idea! Order your BSA Scope now! BSA Deer Hunter Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Rbl7ubTPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W34M5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 45.41}}
{"item_id": "B000W34MJK", "title": "Stansport Sof-Fleece Sleeping Bag", "description": "Stansport Sof-Fleece Sleeping Bag is constructed of brushed 100% polyester fleece. It's size is 29\"X72\" and two bags can zip together to double the size. This bag is ideal for home, summer camping, sporting events or travel. It's also machine washable. A great value!", "text": "Stansport Sof-Fleece Sleeping Bag Stansport Sof-Fleece Sleeping Bag is constructed of brushed 100% polyester fleece. It's size is 29\"X72\" and two bags can zip together to double the size. This bag is ideal for home, summer camping, sporting events or travel. It's also machine washable. A great value!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MmkmZVd5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W34MJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 23.36}}
{"item_id": "B000W34PDI", "title": "Cold Steel Super Edge Kraton Handle, (Serrated Secure-Ex Sheath)", "description": "The Super Edge is a hard working, sheath knife in the very smallest package available. This rugged little workhorse can cut through the tough materials that would make a bigger knife \"choke\". It's diminutive overall length and feather light Secure-Ex sheath make it a natural for attachment to a key ring, zipper pull, \"D\" ring or belt loop. It's so light and comfortable to carry you'll never notice it when it's casually looped around your neck, conveniently laced to your shoe or cunningly pinned inside the crown of your hat.", "text": "Cold Steel Super Edge Kraton Handle, (Serrated Secure-Ex Sheath) The Super Edge is a hard working, sheath knife in the very smallest package available. This rugged little workhorse can cut through the tough materials that would make a bigger knife \"choke\". It's diminutive overall length and feather light Secure-Ex sheath make it a natural for attachment to a key ring, zipper pull, \"D\" ring or belt loop. It's so light and comfortable to carry you'll never notice it when it's casually looped around your neck, conveniently laced to your shoe or cunningly pinned inside the crown of your hat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lzoli-qHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W34PDI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W41AIK", "title": "Soffe Juniors Football Capri", "description": "", "text": "Soffe Juniors Football Capri", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ChJDwqMZL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W41AIK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Football"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Pants"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Petite", "Active", "Active Pants"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B000W42W8M", "title": "TacStar WIN 1200/1300 12GA BLK 6RD SIDESADDLE", "description": "SideSaddle Shotshell CarrierWinchester 1200 & 1300 - 12 ga - 6-shotHytrel polymer shell carrier attached to an aluminum mounting plate - Installs directly on the shotgun receiver - All mounting screws are included - No gunsmithing required", "text": "TacStar WIN 1200/1300 12GA BLK 6RD SIDESADDLE SideSaddle Shotshell CarrierWinchester 1200 & 1300 - 12 ga - 6-shotHytrel polymer shell carrier attached to an aluminum mounting plate - Installs directly on the shotgun receiver - All mounting screws are included - No gunsmithing required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eJZ6pFxgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W42W8M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 31.5}}
{"item_id": "B000W472WS", "title": "Cold Steel Two Handed Machete with Polypropylene Handle", "description": "Some big cutting jobs are often best handled by using both hands and that’s where our two handed machete comes into its own. Its long polypropylene handle and tough 1055 Carbon steel blade give you the leverage to cut down small trees as well as thick brush and tangled vines. Weighing just under two pounds and measuring 32\" in overall length, it’s light and compact enough to lash to your pack and is a natural to stash in your vehicle, boat, or airplane. In a self defense emergency, the Two Handed Machete will also double as a highly effective sword. It’s light enough to be swung with either one or both hands.", "text": "Cold Steel Two Handed Machete with Polypropylene Handle Some big cutting jobs are often best handled by using both hands and that’s where our two handed machete comes into its own. Its long polypropylene handle and tough 1055 Carbon steel blade give you the leverage to cut down small trees as well as thick brush and tangled vines. Weighing just under two pounds and measuring 32\" in overall length, it’s light and compact enough to lash to your pack and is a natural to stash in your vehicle, boat, or airplane. In a self defense emergency, the Two Handed Machete will also double as a highly effective sword. It’s light enough to be swung with either one or both hands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZxPDXM36L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W472WS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 16.81}}
{"item_id": "B000W4TFX2", "title": "Coleman 28-Quart Cooler with Molded-Handle", "description": "The Coleman Molded-Handle 28-Quart Cooler holds 36 cans, and is tall enough to store 2-liter bottles upright. Sturdy and durable, the cooler's built-in molded handles are comfortable for lifting and carrying. The removable lid offers full access to the interior. The 28-Quart Cooler is made with ThermoZone insulation, which uses no ozone-depleting materials. Made in the USA. Exterior dimensions: 18.25\" x 13.5\" x 10.5\".", "text": "Coleman 28-Quart Cooler with Molded-Handle The Coleman Molded-Handle 28-Quart Cooler holds 36 cans, and is tall enough to store 2-liter bottles upright. Sturdy and durable, the cooler's built-in molded handles are comfortable for lifting and carrying. The removable lid offers full access to the interior. The 28-Quart Cooler is made with ThermoZone insulation, which uses no ozone-depleting materials. Made in the USA. Exterior dimensions: 18.25\" x 13.5\" x 10.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Nt4jj3wZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W4TFX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000W55O2C", "title": "Nylon Quick-Detach Flashlight Holster", "description": "SureFire V91 Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster, featuring an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure. Quick-detach belt loop allows user to attach or remove holster without having to remove belt.", "text": "Nylon Quick-Detach Flashlight Holster SureFire V91 Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster, featuring an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure. Quick-detach belt loop allows user to attach or remove holster without having to remove belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nkSkTykJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W55O2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.06}}
{"item_id": "B000W75L32", "title": "CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise", "description": "The CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise is perfect for firearm maintenance and cleaning. Hold your guns steady and straight. The CTK Ultimate Gun Vise is great for holding your firearm steady while bore sighting. It will also dramatically improve your ability to do firearm maintenance and cleaning. It holds any style of stock configuration. Plus, it's constructed of heavy duty steel for durability. Horizontally telescoping rear vise adjusts to all length firearms; Telescoping front forearm rest; Protective rubber feet help reduce slipping; Solvent-safe padding on all points that come in contact with your firearms; Wide \"V\" front rest fits all firearms; Extra durable inside and out E-coat finish. Take aim at this super deal! Order Today! CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise", "text": "CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise The CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise is perfect for firearm maintenance and cleaning. Hold your guns steady and straight. The CTK Ultimate Gun Vise is great for holding your firearm steady while bore sighting. It will also dramatically improve your ability to do firearm maintenance and cleaning. It holds any style of stock configuration. Plus, it's constructed of heavy duty steel for durability. Horizontally telescoping rear vise adjusts to all length firearms; Telescoping front forearm rest; Protective rubber feet help reduce slipping; Solvent-safe padding on all points that come in contact with your firearms; Wide \"V\" front rest fits all firearms; Extra durable inside and out E-coat finish. Take aim at this super deal! Order Today! CTK P3 Ultimate Gun Vise", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x63%2BaeOPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W75L32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CTK", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 139.95}}
{"item_id": "B000W78V8E", "title": "Park Tool PW-4 Professional Pedal Wrench", "description": "The PW-4 Professional Pedal Wrench is designed for heavy shop use. An oversized, asymmetrical head is made from Cro-Moly steel for superior strength and durability. While strong, the PW-4 is thin enough to access all wrench flats.", "text": "Park Tool PW-4 Professional Pedal Wrench The PW-4 Professional Pedal Wrench is designed for heavy shop use. An oversized, asymmetrical head is made from Cro-Moly steel for superior strength and durability. While strong, the PW-4 is thin enough to access all wrench flats.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Vdemu6rjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W78V8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 32.34}}
{"item_id": "B000W7BEQU", "title": "SE Collapsible Walking Stick Colors May Vary", "description": "Collapsible walking stick. This ultra-durable walking stick has a comfortable grip and a shock-absorbing pole. The walking stick is illuminated with 5 bright LEDs, which can rotate 40 degress.", "text": "SE Collapsible Walking Stick Colors May Vary Collapsible walking stick. This ultra-durable walking stick has a comfortable grip and a shock-absorbing pole. The walking stick is illuminated with 5 bright LEDs, which can rotate 40 degress.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310%2BvDkeE8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W7BEQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vine Branch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 15.25}}
{"item_id": "B000W7BHJY", "title": "Coleman Red Canyon 17-Foot by 10-Foot 8-Person Modified Dome Tent", "description": "Measuring 17- by 10-feet, Coleman's Red Canyon tent is spacious enough to comfortably sleep eight campers. Ideal for weekend camping trips with family and friends, the Red Canyon features removable privacy walls, allowing you to create up to three separate rooms.", "text": "Coleman Red Canyon 17-Foot by 10-Foot 8-Person Modified Dome Tent Measuring 17- by 10-feet, Coleman's Red Canyon tent is spacious enough to comfortably sleep eight campers. Ideal for weekend camping trips with family and friends, the Red Canyon features removable privacy walls, allowing you to create up to three separate rooms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s31VcMcZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W7BHJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 139.9}}
