{"item_id": "B000W8J75E", "title": "SentrySafe 500 FIRE-SAFE Box, 0.15 Cubic Feet, Black", "description": "The SentrySafe FIRE-SAFE box is a great item to secure your belongings in your house or office. The 0500 model is UL classified with 1/2-hour proven fire protection and ETL verified 1/2 hour fire protection for CD's, DVD's, USB drives and memory sticks up to 1550ºF. The box comes with a privacy key lock. The box has a lifetime after-fire replacement guarantee and a manufacturer's limited warranty.", "text": "SentrySafe 500 FIRE-SAFE Box, 0.15 Cubic Feet, Black The SentrySafe FIRE-SAFE box is a great item to secure your belongings in your house or office. The 0500 model is UL classified with 1/2-hour proven fire protection and ETL verified 1/2 hour fire protection for CD's, DVD's, USB drives and memory sticks up to 1550ºF. The box comes with a privacy key lock. The box has a lifetime after-fire replacement guarantee and a manufacturer's limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BWML0yk9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000W8J75E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SentrySafe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 28.2}}
