{"item_id": "B000WADUNW", "title": "Cold Steel Pendleton Mini Hunter Kraton Handle (Secure-Ex Sheath)", "description": "Both the Pendleton Hunter's hollow ground blade and the Mini Hunter's flat ground blade are honed to perfection. The handle's cross sections and contours match Lloyd's handmade knives exactly. For safety and durability, we have dispensed with leather in favor of Secure-Ex for the sheaths. This material won't rot or mildew and is far more resistant to cuts or punctures than leather.", "text": "Cold Steel Pendleton Mini Hunter Kraton Handle (Secure-Ex Sheath) Both the Pendleton Hunter's hollow ground blade and the Mini Hunter's flat ground blade are honed to perfection. The handle's cross sections and contours match Lloyd's handmade knives exactly. For safety and durability, we have dispensed with leather in favor of Secure-Ex for the sheaths. This material won't rot or mildew and is far more resistant to cuts or punctures than leather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317CUMGgiWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WADUNW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 40.54}}
{"item_id": "B000WAJ9NM", "title": "Cold Steel Wakazashi Handle", "description": "The Warrior Series swords are very handsome in their own right and share the same steel, heat treatment, and sharpness as their more expensive Emperor counterparts. Like the Emperor swords, they have Samé covered, cord wrapped handles and quality fittings. If you’re in the market for a strong, good looking, reasonably priced Japanese sword we know you’ll be happy to own one of these.", "text": "Cold Steel Wakazashi Handle The Warrior Series swords are very handsome in their own right and share the same steel, heat treatment, and sharpness as their more expensive Emperor counterparts. Like the Emperor swords, they have Samé covered, cord wrapped handles and quality fittings. If you’re in the market for a strong, good looking, reasonably priced Japanese sword we know you’ll be happy to own one of these.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qNTRsNI6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WAJ9NM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 255.64}}
