{"item_id": "B000WDPGW2", "title": "Rothco Commando Wire Saw", "description": "The Strongest (over 100 lbs breaking strain) and most effective wire saw available. Cuts through wood plastic bone and even soft metals. Constructed using 8 strands of interwoven stainless steel wire will easily reach inaccessible places. Attach rope to split ring on each end to cut higher branches 24\" sawing edge. Many uses for the outdoor and home. Blister packed .", "text": "Rothco Commando Wire Saw The Strongest (over 100 lbs breaking strain) and most effective wire saw available. Cuts through wood plastic bone and even soft metals. Constructed using 8 strands of interwoven stainless steel wire will easily reach inaccessible places. Attach rope to split ring on each end to cut higher branches 24\" sawing edge. Many uses for the outdoor and home. Blister packed .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s6zZwEknL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WDPGW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 8.58}}
{"item_id": "B000WDWZWG", "title": "Finish Line 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant", "description": "Finish Lines 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant is engineered for commuters and recreational cyclists who seek a quick one-step clean and lube formulation. As 1-Step loosens and removes surface grime, it delivers a clean low friction film of lubricant. 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant prevents premature component wear while reducing pedaling friction and drive-train noise. 1-Step is also formulated to provide maximum rust protection. 1-Step is an extremely effective performance-enhancing bicycle maintenance product.", "text": "Finish Line 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant Finish Lines 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant is engineered for commuters and recreational cyclists who seek a quick one-step clean and lube formulation. As 1-Step loosens and removes surface grime, it delivers a clean low friction film of lubricant. 1-Step Cleaner & Lubricant prevents premature component wear while reducing pedaling friction and drive-train noise. 1-Step is also formulated to provide maximum rust protection. 1-Step is an extremely effective performance-enhancing bicycle maintenance product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RNO9jV6TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WDWZWG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WEMGL0", "title": "South Bend 25-Pack of Assorted Flies in Box", "description": "Packed in a reusable box these 25 flies ensure you have the fly you need for whatever the fishing situation.", "text": "South Bend 25-Pack of Assorted Flies in Box Packed in a reusable box these 25 flies ensure you have the fly you need for whatever the fishing situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YoNxmyONL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WEMGL0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Flies", "Dry Flies"]], "price": 13.95}}
