{"item_id": "B000WENHF4", "title": "Finish Line Showroom Polish & Protectant 11oz Aerosol Spray", "description": "Showroom Polish & Detailer (Pro Detailer) is Finish Line's most advanced Bike Polish made with Teflon® fluoropolymer uses DuPont™ Teflon® Surface Protector technology. Provides a brilliant shine plus long term protection on all surfaces of a bicycle including steel, aluminum, carbon fiber, titanium, chrome and clear coat. Contains NO abrasives. 100% safe for all plastics, rubbers and carbon fiber parts. • The only bike polish formulated with DuPont Teflon® Surface Protector • Restores and polishes all types of surfaces including clear coat and chrome • New high gloss Teflon® fluoropolymers repel dirt and grime for easier post-ride clean-ups • Helps prevent rust and minimize UV damage", "text": "Finish Line Showroom Polish & Protectant 11oz Aerosol Spray Showroom Polish & Detailer (Pro Detailer) is Finish Line's most advanced Bike Polish made with Teflon® fluoropolymer uses DuPont™ Teflon® Surface Protector technology. Provides a brilliant shine plus long term protection on all surfaces of a bicycle including steel, aluminum, carbon fiber, titanium, chrome and clear coat. Contains NO abrasives. 100% safe for all plastics, rubbers and carbon fiber parts. • The only bike polish formulated with DuPont Teflon® Surface Protector • Restores and polishes all types of surfaces including clear coat and chrome • New high gloss Teflon® fluoropolymers repel dirt and grime for easier post-ride clean-ups • Helps prevent rust and minimize UV damage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4134W--2J%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WENHF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 5.66}}
{"item_id": "B000WER6MY", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Powerline 201 Pistol (Black, 9.25 Inch)", "description": "Just load the Model 201 with 35 BBs in the magazine, pull back on the slide and get ready for shooting fun. Single load pellets are also an option in the spring-air pistol with a maximum muzzle velocity of 350 feet per second. Optics are an option with the convenient dove tail mount.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Powerline 201 Pistol (Black, 9.25 Inch) Just load the Model 201 with 35 BBs in the magazine, pull back on the slide and get ready for shooting fun. Single load pellets are also an option in the spring-air pistol with a maximum muzzle velocity of 350 feet per second. Optics are an option with the convenient dove tail mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iC8-FsooL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WER6MY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 25.58}}
{"item_id": "B000WFE3VU", "title": "Brunswick Microfiber See Saw (Black/Navy)", "description": "Giant size microfiber construction absorbs upto 7 times its weight. Unique fiber construction locks in dirt and moisture. Provides great protection for your bowling ball whether you keep it in your bowling bag or your locker. Washable, do not use fabric softener. Available in black or navy.", "text": "Brunswick Microfiber See Saw (Black/Navy) Giant size microfiber construction absorbs upto 7 times its weight. Unique fiber construction locks in dirt and moisture. Provides great protection for your bowling ball whether you keep it in your bowling bag or your locker. Washable, do not use fabric softener. Available in black or navy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z4VKCf7IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WFE3VU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brunswick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Bowling", "Ball Polishers"]], "price": 14.29}}
