{"item_id": "B000WG0L74", "title": "j/fit Ultra Foam Roller", "description": "j/fit Foam Roller Comparisonj/fit Foam Roller ComparisonBasicHalf RoundSuper High DensityHigh Density Half RoundHigh Density EVATextured High Density EVADeluxe Myo Body RollerTypeBasic low density extruded foam. 100% medical grade foam made in the USABasic low density extruded foamBlack High Density injection molded foam beads. 100% medical grade foamBlack High Density injection molded foam beadsBlue closed cell heat molded EVA foamGreen closed cell heat molded EVA foam with honeycomb texturedDark Grey closed cell heat molded EVA foam with massaging bumpsFeelMedium density and feelMedium density and feelVery FirmVery FirmFirm Core with slightly softer exteriorFirm core with a slighly softer exterior. Best overall feel for all body typesFirm feel with finger size bumps for deeper massageUser TypeBest for beginner or lightweight, single user. Produces less pressure and less painElderly or persons with limited strength or muscle toneModerate to heavier weight user with some rolling experience or users with desire for very firm feelModerate to heavier weight persons with limited strength and balance issues and elderly users with little muscle toneAll user types that prefer more pressure than the Basic but less firmness than the Super High Density. Will withstand the heaviest weight individual and multiple users in a professional settingSame user as the High Density EVA, but better for individuals that wish to have a slight texture to the roller. Honeycomb texture adds a little traction for a slower roll and a slight massaging effectThe myo roller will help assist in a deeper myofascial release. Small knobs on the roller will get deeper into the tissue and help work out stubborn knots and tightnessDurabilityMediumMediumHighHighCommercial-GradeHighHighUsed ForLimit soreness and tightness by increasing blood flow and flexibility. When used often and correctly, the foam roller can help athletes avoid many sport-related injuries. Increase flexibility or range of motion, relieve muscle and joint pain.Helps increase balance and stabilization while standing on roller. Lying on the foam will help relieve tension in tight areas. Will not roll out from underneath.Very firm roller should be used by individuals already using rolling techniques. Works well for larger or heavily muscled athletes Firmness puts more pressure on tight areas.Helps proprioception after knee and ankle injury. Helps increase balance and stabilization while standing on roller. Will not roll out from underneath. Lying on foam will help relieve tension in tight areas.36\"- Great for pilates practice, and placing roller parallel to spine to help create proper alignment and opening up tense shoulders and upper body. 24\"- Best used for rolling the back and easier to manipulate than the longer rollers. 18\"- Often used by runners to help alleviate tightness in the IT band, calf muscles,and hamstrings. 12\"- Perfect for travel. Allows you to work smaller regions or isolate certain muscle groups.The slight texture on this roller allows for better traction and will not slip as easily as other foam rollers. The honeycomb texture also gives a slight massaging effect for better overall feel. Foam roller gives temporary relief of the appearance of cellulite.Applies more direct pressure to knotty areas to give a more intense stretch. The combination of the finger nodules and firm surface provide a great deep tissue massage. It also allows a better surface for applying targeted pressure on specific knotted areas which helps facilitate a myofascial release.", "text": "j/fit Ultra Foam Roller j/fit Foam Roller Comparisonj/fit Foam Roller ComparisonBasicHalf RoundSuper High DensityHigh Density Half RoundHigh Density EVATextured High Density EVADeluxe Myo Body RollerTypeBasic low density extruded foam. 100% medical grade foam made in the USABasic low density extruded foamBlack High Density injection molded foam beads. 100% medical grade foamBlack High Density injection molded foam beadsBlue closed cell heat molded EVA foamGreen closed cell heat molded EVA foam with honeycomb texturedDark Grey closed cell heat molded EVA foam with massaging bumpsFeelMedium density and feelMedium density and feelVery FirmVery FirmFirm Core with slightly softer exteriorFirm core with a slighly softer exterior. Best overall feel for all body typesFirm feel with finger size bumps for deeper massageUser TypeBest for beginner or lightweight, single user. Produces less pressure and less painElderly or persons with limited strength or muscle toneModerate to heavier weight user with some rolling experience or users with desire for very firm feelModerate to heavier weight persons with limited strength and balance issues and elderly users with little muscle toneAll user types that prefer more pressure than the Basic but less firmness than the Super High Density. Will withstand the heaviest weight individual and multiple users in a professional settingSame user as the High Density EVA, but better for individuals that wish to have a slight texture to the roller. Honeycomb texture adds a little traction for a slower roll and a slight massaging effectThe myo roller will help assist in a deeper myofascial release. Small knobs on the roller will get deeper into the tissue and help work out stubborn knots and tightnessDurabilityMediumMediumHighHighCommercial-GradeHighHighUsed ForLimit soreness and tightness by increasing blood flow and flexibility. When used often and correctly, the foam roller can help athletes avoid many sport-related injuries. Increase flexibility or range of motion, relieve muscle and joint pain.Helps increase balance and stabilization while standing on roller. Lying on the foam will help relieve tension in tight areas. Will not roll out from underneath.Very firm roller should be used by individuals already using rolling techniques. Works well for larger or heavily muscled athletes Firmness puts more pressure on tight areas.Helps proprioception after knee and ankle injury. Helps increase balance and stabilization while standing on roller. Will not roll out from underneath. Lying on foam will help relieve tension in tight areas.36\"- Great for pilates practice, and placing roller parallel to spine to help create proper alignment and opening up tense shoulders and upper body. 24\"- Best used for rolling the back and easier to manipulate than the longer rollers. 18\"- Often used by runners to help alleviate tightness in the IT band, calf muscles,and hamstrings. 12\"- Perfect for travel. Allows you to work smaller regions or isolate certain muscle groups.The slight texture on this roller allows for better traction and will not slip as easily as other foam rollers. The honeycomb texture also gives a slight massaging effect for better overall feel. Foam roller gives temporary relief of the appearance of cellulite.Applies more direct pressure to knotty areas to give a more intense stretch. The combination of the finger nodules and firm surface provide a great deep tissue massage. It also allows a better surface for applying targeted pressure on specific knotted areas which helps facilitate a myofascial release.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EfwJBkYyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WG0L74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JFIT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 21.37}}
{"item_id": "B000WG40ZS", "title": "Aquamira Frontier Pro Ultralight Water Filter", "description": "The Aquamira Frontier Pro portable water filter system provides all the benefits of a larger bottle filter in an ultralight, compact size. The Frontier Pro is a straw-style filter, with a design that attaches directly to water bottles or bladders and an attached cap that keeps mouthpieces clean. Once attached, the Frontier Pro will remove 99.9 percent of Giardia, Cryptosporidium, and other contaminants down to 3 microns. The filter's activated carbon--made using only the finest-quality coconut shell carbon--absorbs chemicals and odors and improves the taste of the filtered water. And thanks to the filter's Miraguard antimicrobial technology, the filter media resist the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold, and mildew. Use the Frontier Pro filter to drink from any water bottle, cup, hydration system, or straight from the water source.The Frontier Pro comes with a universal connectivity adapter system, which connects directly to any water bottle with a 28mm opening, such as a Platypus or a standard-size bottle. You can also use the tube connection feature to connect directly to your hydration system or drink tube, or drink directly from any open container or water source. And should you want to filter water in advance and drink later, you can flip the Frontier Pro into \"gravity flow\" mode. The filter measures 1.25 inches in diameter and 5.5 inches long and weighs 2 ounces dry.The Frontier Pro filters up to 50 gallons. To lengthen filter life, use replacement pre-filters.Note:Miraguard does not protect users against foodborne or disease-causing bacteria, viruses, or germs. If viruses or smaller bacteria are suspected, use in conjunction with Aquamira water purifier tablets.", "text": "Aquamira Frontier Pro Ultralight Water Filter The Aquamira Frontier Pro portable water filter system provides all the benefits of a larger bottle filter in an ultralight, compact size. The Frontier Pro is a straw-style filter, with a design that attaches directly to water bottles or bladders and an attached cap that keeps mouthpieces clean. Once attached, the Frontier Pro will remove 99.9 percent of Giardia, Cryptosporidium, and other contaminants down to 3 microns. The filter's activated carbon--made using only the finest-quality coconut shell carbon--absorbs chemicals and odors and improves the taste of the filtered water. And thanks to the filter's Miraguard antimicrobial technology, the filter media resist the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold, and mildew. Use the Frontier Pro filter to drink from any water bottle, cup, hydration system, or straight from the water source.The Frontier Pro comes with a universal connectivity adapter system, which connects directly to any water bottle with a 28mm opening, such as a Platypus or a standard-size bottle. You can also use the tube connection feature to connect directly to your hydration system or drink tube, or drink directly from any open container or water source. And should you want to filter water in advance and drink later, you can flip the Frontier Pro into \"gravity flow\" mode. The filter measures 1.25 inches in diameter and 5.5 inches long and weighs 2 ounces dry.The Frontier Pro filters up to 50 gallons. To lengthen filter life, use replacement pre-filters.Note:Miraguard does not protect users against foodborne or disease-causing bacteria, viruses, or germs. If viruses or smaller bacteria are suspected, use in conjunction with Aquamira water purifier tablets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mJzZAAm1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WG40ZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 15.62}}
{"item_id": "B000WG663W", "title": "The Original MuckBoots Adult Muckmaster Hi-Cut Boot", "description": "", "text": "The Original MuckBoots Adult Muckmaster Hi-Cut Boot", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vjb8N7A6L._SY395_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WG663W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Riding Boots"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Winter Promo"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Shoes", "Athletic"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Shoes", "Athletic"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WG6RVS", "title": "Park Tool Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System - CG-2", "description": "Sometimes your drivetrain desperately needs cleaning, but you're simply not in the mood to break your chain. The CG-2 does a superb job making your chain, cogs, and chainrings spic-and-span while leaving everything on the bike. You get a CM-5 cleaning tool, GSC-1 brush, and eight ounces of Chain Brite. Simply pour some Chain Brite into the CM-5 and spin your crankset. The chain gets cleaned as it squeezes through the rotating brushes. Ground shipping only (you can't air freight Chain Brite).Product FeaturesVolume:Recommended Use: keeping your drivetrain spic 'n spanManufacturer Warranty: limited lifetime", "text": "Park Tool Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System - CG-2 Sometimes your drivetrain desperately needs cleaning, but you're simply not in the mood to break your chain. The CG-2 does a superb job making your chain, cogs, and chainrings spic-and-span while leaving everything on the bike. You get a CM-5 cleaning tool, GSC-1 brush, and eight ounces of Chain Brite. Simply pour some Chain Brite into the CM-5 and spin your crankset. The chain gets cleaned as it squeezes through the rotating brushes. Ground shipping only (you can't air freight Chain Brite).Product FeaturesVolume:Recommended Use: keeping your drivetrain spic 'n spanManufacturer Warranty: limited lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MmpIJ9kzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WG6RVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 31.46}}
{"item_id": "B000WGVH04", "title": "Mini-Hatchet", "description": "Perfect for the avid hunter or camperIf you are an outdoor enthusiast and are searching for the perfect tool, the Mini Hatchet is the ideal wilderness companion. Small enough to carry on your hip yet sharp enough to split small logs, this hatchet is hand-forged by the elite smiths at Gransfors Bruks. Precise, light-weight, and portable, take this hatchet on your next hunting or camping trip and see how many tasks you can accomplish with it. Use it to clear brush, pitch a tent, slice food, and chop kindling.Grnsfors axes are forged by very professional smiths. The proof of this professionalism is that they are able to forge axes with such precision that no supplementary work, to hide mistakes in the forging, is needed.At Grnsfors Bruks, the forging craft is allowed to take its time. The smiths do not work by the piece. They take care and do the right forging from the beginning. There is no need to stone or grind or smooth or paint the axes in order to hide or eliminate imperfections in the forging. Mini Hatchet Specifications: 10.25\" Hickory Handle. 2.5\" Face. Head weighs 11oz. Comes with a grain-leather sheath. \"The Axe Book\" is also included. Includes 20 Year Product Warranty .", "text": "Mini-Hatchet Perfect for the avid hunter or camperIf you are an outdoor enthusiast and are searching for the perfect tool, the Mini Hatchet is the ideal wilderness companion. Small enough to carry on your hip yet sharp enough to split small logs, this hatchet is hand-forged by the elite smiths at Gransfors Bruks. Precise, light-weight, and portable, take this hatchet on your next hunting or camping trip and see how many tasks you can accomplish with it. Use it to clear brush, pitch a tent, slice food, and chop kindling.Grnsfors axes are forged by very professional smiths. The proof of this professionalism is that they are able to forge axes with such precision that no supplementary work, to hide mistakes in the forging, is needed.At Grnsfors Bruks, the forging craft is allowed to take its time. The smiths do not work by the piece. They take care and do the right forging from the beginning. There is no need to stone or grind or smooth or paint the axes in order to hide or eliminate imperfections in the forging. Mini Hatchet Specifications: 10.25\" Hickory Handle. 2.5\" Face. Head weighs 11oz. Comes with a grain-leather sheath. \"The Axe Book\" is also included. Includes 20 Year Product Warranty .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JF-Qd5fvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WGVH04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gransfors Bruks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 175.0}}
{"item_id": "B000WHL0B4", "title": "Okuma Avenger Spinning Reel Clam Pack", "description": "The Avenger \"A\" Series Graphite Spinning Reels are built for a smooth and capable performance on the bank or boat--at a budget friendly price point. The reels in this series feature a multi-disc drag system with Japanese oiled felt drag washers and a six bearing drive system for smoothness. Avenger \"A\" Reels offer Okuma's advanced, patented EOS elliptical oscillation system and their with quick-set, anti-reverse roller bearing. Built to last, the Avenger \"A\" Series features a machine-cut brass pinion gear and a rigid die-cast aluminum handle design. Designed to offer a \"serious\" performance, at an affordable price, the Avenger \"A\" Series is offered in sizes 15 through 80.Avenger \"A\" Reels feature sturdy graphite construction and a rigid die-cast aluminum handle design.Key FeaturesMulti-disk Japanese oiled felt drag washersSix ball bearings for smoothnessOne Quick-Set Anti-Reverse roller bearingPrecision machine-cut brass pinion gearSpare graphite spoolRigid die-cast aluminum handle designPatented EOS Elliptical Oscillation SystemSpecificationsModelBearingsCapacityGear RatioLine RetrieveMaximum DragWeightAV-15a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing240/2, 130/4, 80/65.0:120 inches8 pounds7.3 ouncesAV-20a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing190/4, 110/6, 90/85.0:122 inches8 pounds7.8 ouncesAV-30a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing200/6, 160/8, 110/105.0:125 inches13 pounds9.7 ouncesAV-40a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing270/8, 190/10, 170/124.5:128 inches13 pounds10.3 ouncesAV-55a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing380/10, 340/12, 240/154.5:130 inches18 pounds14.5 ouncesAV-65a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing430/12, 310/15, 260/204.8:134 inches22 pounds20.9 ouncesAV-80a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing420/15, 350/20, 260/254.8:138 inches22 pounds21.4 ounces", "text": "Okuma Avenger Spinning Reel Clam Pack The Avenger \"A\" Series Graphite Spinning Reels are built for a smooth and capable performance on the bank or boat--at a budget friendly price point. The reels in this series feature a multi-disc drag system with Japanese oiled felt drag washers and a six bearing drive system for smoothness. Avenger \"A\" Reels offer Okuma's advanced, patented EOS elliptical oscillation system and their with quick-set, anti-reverse roller bearing. Built to last, the Avenger \"A\" Series features a machine-cut brass pinion gear and a rigid die-cast aluminum handle design. Designed to offer a \"serious\" performance, at an affordable price, the Avenger \"A\" Series is offered in sizes 15 through 80.Avenger \"A\" Reels feature sturdy graphite construction and a rigid die-cast aluminum handle design.Key FeaturesMulti-disk Japanese oiled felt drag washersSix ball bearings for smoothnessOne Quick-Set Anti-Reverse roller bearingPrecision machine-cut brass pinion gearSpare graphite spoolRigid die-cast aluminum handle designPatented EOS Elliptical Oscillation SystemSpecificationsModelBearingsCapacityGear RatioLine RetrieveMaximum DragWeightAV-15a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing240/2, 130/4, 80/65.0:120 inches8 pounds7.3 ouncesAV-20a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing190/4, 110/6, 90/85.0:122 inches8 pounds7.8 ouncesAV-30a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing200/6, 160/8, 110/105.0:125 inches13 pounds9.7 ouncesAV-40a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing270/8, 190/10, 170/124.5:128 inches13 pounds10.3 ouncesAV-55a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing380/10, 340/12, 240/154.5:130 inches18 pounds14.5 ouncesAV-65a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing430/12, 310/15, 260/204.8:134 inches22 pounds20.9 ouncesAV-80a6 ball bearings + 1 roller bearing420/15, 350/20, 260/254.8:138 inches22 pounds21.4 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q73OMLSVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WHL0B4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B000WIOE7A", "title": "Gransfors Bruks Splitting Maul", "description": "A hefty 51/2 lb head and 31\" handle makes this maul an incredible wood splitting tool. The poll is designed for pounding on a splitting wedge.", "text": "Gransfors Bruks Splitting Maul A hefty 51/2 lb head and 31\" handle makes this maul an incredible wood splitting tool. The poll is designed for pounding on a splitting wedge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316bOtzzw8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WIOE7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gransfors Bruks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 176.0}}
{"item_id": "B000WIROX6", "title": "Gransfors Bruks, Small Forest Axe", "description": "These are premium quality axes, hand-forged at Grnsfors Bruks, a family owned forge in a small town in Sweden. As a matter of pride, when the smith is finished and satisfied with his work he marks the head with his initials beside the companys crown label. Each axe is sharp and ready to cut, has a hickory handle and leather sheath. Small Forest Axe has a handle long enough to allow powerful chopping but short enough to fit in a rucksack for your next camping trip.", "text": "Gransfors Bruks, Small Forest Axe These are premium quality axes, hand-forged at Grnsfors Bruks, a family owned forge in a small town in Sweden. As a matter of pride, when the smith is finished and satisfied with his work he marks the head with his initials beside the companys crown label. Each axe is sharp and ready to cut, has a hickory handle and leather sheath. Small Forest Axe has a handle long enough to allow powerful chopping but short enough to fit in a rucksack for your next camping trip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eiYFX9kYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WIROX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B000WIX6YC", "title": "Wildlife Hatchet", "description": "The Gransfors Bruks Wildlife Hatchet is a general-use small axe that is sized right for backpacking or attaching to a belt. It is the most popular Hatchet from Gransfors. Either the Wildlife Hatchet or the Small Forest Axe are the most popular blades made by Gransfors. The Wildlife Hatchet is a general camping hatchet that can chop, split and cut. The Wildlife Hatchet is popular as a gift. For example, a gentleman in Tennessee who was getting together with some old friends gave one to each of them. Another customer told us he loves the Hatchet, and said it is so sharp he was able to easily slice and dice the tomato he needed for some tacos. The oil finish on the Gransfors Axes is not \"food service\", but this tale gives you an idea of the sharpness and versatility of this general camp tool. The 13.5 inch (34 cm) hickory handle attaches to a 1 pound (454 gm) head with a 3 inch (76 mm) bit. Leather sheath included. All Gransfors Axes come with the AXE BOOK and a 20 year guarantee. -SwedishAx.com", "text": "Wildlife Hatchet The Gransfors Bruks Wildlife Hatchet is a general-use small axe that is sized right for backpacking or attaching to a belt. It is the most popular Hatchet from Gransfors. Either the Wildlife Hatchet or the Small Forest Axe are the most popular blades made by Gransfors. The Wildlife Hatchet is a general camping hatchet that can chop, split and cut. The Wildlife Hatchet is popular as a gift. For example, a gentleman in Tennessee who was getting together with some old friends gave one to each of them. Another customer told us he loves the Hatchet, and said it is so sharp he was able to easily slice and dice the tomato he needed for some tacos. The oil finish on the Gransfors Axes is not \"food service\", but this tale gives you an idea of the sharpness and versatility of this general camp tool. The 13.5 inch (34 cm) hickory handle attaches to a 1 pound (454 gm) head with a 3 inch (76 mm) bit. Leather sheath included. All Gransfors Axes come with the AXE BOOK and a 20 year guarantee. -SwedishAx.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YTxcBZj1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WIX6YC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WLRYHO", "title": "Black Aluminum Flight Protectors - 3 sets (9 total)", "description": "These aluminum flight protectors will protect your flights from incoming darts. This will reduce the wear and tear on the flights and extend their useful life.", "text": "Black Aluminum Flight Protectors - 3 sets (9 total) These aluminum flight protectors will protect your flights from incoming darts. This will reduce the wear and tear on the flights and extend their useful life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/114N9N3EJ4L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WLRYHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US Darts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room"]], "price": 3.87}}
{"item_id": "B000WNJC0O", "title": "Blackburn Mars 1.0 Flasher Rear Bicycle Light", "description": "The Mars 1.0 offers a lot of light and visibility at an entry-level price. Four super-bright red LED's paired with a visibility-boosting reflector and lens provide 240 hours of darkness-scalding light. Water-resistant and tool free, the Mars 1.0 comes standard with belt clip, seatpost mount and rack mounting hardware.", "text": "Blackburn Mars 1.0 Flasher Rear Bicycle Light The Mars 1.0 offers a lot of light and visibility at an entry-level price. Four super-bright red LED's paired with a visibility-boosting reflector and lens provide 240 hours of darkness-scalding light. Water-resistant and tool free, the Mars 1.0 comes standard with belt clip, seatpost mount and rack mounting hardware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ST9OGKZ4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WNJC0O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WNREYA", "title": "Micro Fleece Neck Warmer-Black W11S28D", "description": "", "text": "Micro Fleece Neck Warmer-Black W11S28D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UfC4fziYL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WNREYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Balboa/Zan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Accessories", "Neck Gaiters"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men"]], "price": 14.49}}
{"item_id": "B000WPGMFU", "title": "Giro Rift Bike Helmet", "description": "The Giro Rift bike helmet is an ideal choice for riders who want cool comfort and rugged good looks without breaking the bank. The helmet is made using Giro's in-mold construction, which fuses the helmet's outer shell with an impact-absorbing EPS liner. Not only does this reinforce both layers, but the \"exoskeleton\" also allows Giro to engineer helmets that are lighter, more durable, and better ventilated. The helmet also employs Giro's patented Acu Dial fit system, which hugs the back of your head and reduces the tendency of your helmet to shift forwards or backwards. Unlike most system, the Acu Dial's design provides adjustable tension independent of the helmet straps. This means you don't have to overtighten the straps to enjoy a snug, comfortable fit. The bike's premium features conclude with a whopping 24 cooling events, keeping you well ventilated on both short and long rides.About GiroWorking late nights in his garage, designer/bike racer Jim Gentes created the first lightweight adult cycling helmet in 1985. Friends at NASA helped tune the final helmet shape and vent placement, and the result was the Giro Prolight, a helmet that was better looking than traditional designs while offering a superior fit and still met the industry's toughest safety standards. Plus, it was half the weight of traditional helmets. Since then, Giro has advanced its helmets, many of which have set the standards for styling, function, and innovation for progressive, performance-oriented riders on dirt, pavement, and snow. Giro helmets are worn by millions of riders, cyclists, skiers, and snowboarders around the world. Young-bloods and old-timers; hard-cores, heshers, and hipsters; rookies, experts, and a few regular Joes too--in fact, pretty much anyone that appreciates superior fit and function, cutting edge styling, and the very best ideas you get in a helmet.", "text": "Giro Rift Bike Helmet The Giro Rift bike helmet is an ideal choice for riders who want cool comfort and rugged good looks without breaking the bank. The helmet is made using Giro's in-mold construction, which fuses the helmet's outer shell with an impact-absorbing EPS liner. Not only does this reinforce both layers, but the \"exoskeleton\" also allows Giro to engineer helmets that are lighter, more durable, and better ventilated. The helmet also employs Giro's patented Acu Dial fit system, which hugs the back of your head and reduces the tendency of your helmet to shift forwards or backwards. Unlike most system, the Acu Dial's design provides adjustable tension independent of the helmet straps. This means you don't have to overtighten the straps to enjoy a snug, comfortable fit. The bike's premium features conclude with a whopping 24 cooling events, keeping you well ventilated on both short and long rides.About GiroWorking late nights in his garage, designer/bike racer Jim Gentes created the first lightweight adult cycling helmet in 1985. Friends at NASA helped tune the final helmet shape and vent placement, and the result was the Giro Prolight, a helmet that was better looking than traditional designs while offering a superior fit and still met the industry's toughest safety standards. Plus, it was half the weight of traditional helmets. Since then, Giro has advanced its helmets, many of which have set the standards for styling, function, and innovation for progressive, performance-oriented riders on dirt, pavement, and snow. Giro helmets are worn by millions of riders, cyclists, skiers, and snowboarders around the world. Young-bloods and old-timers; hard-cores, heshers, and hipsters; rookies, experts, and a few regular Joes too--in fact, pretty much anyone that appreciates superior fit and function, cutting edge styling, and the very best ideas you get in a helmet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hafCcTzsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WPGMFU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Giro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000WPZWW4", "title": "Sterling Deluxe Moosehead Bridge Head", "description": "This bridge head, in the shape of a moose's head, slips over any pool cue, turning it into a bridge. Pick the 'antler' that works best for your shot -- you have 9 different positions to choose from. Throw this convenient bridge in your case, and you will never be at the mercy of an unfamiliar, or MISSING, one. These are a best-seller.", "text": "Sterling Deluxe Moosehead Bridge Head This bridge head, in the shape of a moose's head, slips over any pool cue, turning it into a bridge. Pick the 'antler' that works best for your shot -- you have 9 different positions to choose from. Throw this convenient bridge in your case, and you will never be at the mercy of an unfamiliar, or MISSING, one. These are a best-seller.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IQUuFQGgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WPZWW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sterling Gaming", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Bridges & Bridge Heads"]], "price": 3.5}}
{"item_id": "B000WQ080E", "title": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Disc / Balance Cushion - 14\" Diameter - Many Colors to Choose From", "description": "Isokinetics Inc. brand Exercise Disc/Balance Cushions are high quality products without the high price. No middleman means you save! And, we provide all Isokinetics Inc. brand Discs with a 1 year guarantee directly from Isokinetics Inc. Exercise and balance discs have a dual use. They can be used for sitting to give you the same benefits as sitting on an exercise ball, like better sitting posture, or they can be used in exercise to provide an unstable surface, forcing you to use more muscles to remain balanced, thus getting a more complete workout. **They are also popularly used by parents and teachers as \"wiggle seats\" that help active children sit still.** NOTE: Comes inflated to a level suitable for most uses. If you need a needle nose pump, we offer a low cost one separately (search Amazon for \"isopump\" if you don't see it as an accessory).", "text": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Disc / Balance Cushion - 14\" Diameter - Many Colors to Choose From Isokinetics Inc. brand Exercise Disc/Balance Cushions are high quality products without the high price. No middleman means you save! And, we provide all Isokinetics Inc. brand Discs with a 1 year guarantee directly from Isokinetics Inc. Exercise and balance discs have a dual use. They can be used for sitting to give you the same benefits as sitting on an exercise ball, like better sitting posture, or they can be used in exercise to provide an unstable surface, forcing you to use more muscles to remain balanced, thus getting a more complete workout. **They are also popularly used by parents and teachers as \"wiggle seats\" that help active children sit still.** NOTE: Comes inflated to a level suitable for most uses. If you need a needle nose pump, we offer a low cost one separately (search Amazon for \"isopump\" if you don't see it as an accessory).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HVbPM2hqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WQ080E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B000WQ74ME", "title": "Urban Boundaries NFL Fleece Dallas Cowboy Blanket", "description": "Our super soft fleece blankets make a perfect gift for that person you know that loves to be warm in bed or watching their favorite show or game. Our fleece blankets measure approximately 50\" x 60\" and are machine washable.", "text": "Urban Boundaries NFL Fleece Dallas Cowboy Blanket Our super soft fleece blankets make a perfect gift for that person you know that loves to be warm in bed or watching their favorite show or game. Our fleece blankets measure approximately 50\" x 60\" and are machine washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51c-GnG%2Bc4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WQ74ME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Northwest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Bedding", "Throw Blankets"]], "price": 11.44}}
{"item_id": "B000WQHRRG", "title": "CoiTAC 3W LED Tactical Strobe Flashlight with pressure switch and Tactical Ring", "description": "Brand Name: CoiTAC Anodized aluminum . 3 Watt LED CREE XR-E P4. 110 lumens of light power. Run time is 2.5 hours on 2 CR123 lithium batteries that are included, pressure wire switch and 1 tactical flashlight ring included. Special strobe mode feature.", "text": "CoiTAC 3W LED Tactical Strobe Flashlight with pressure switch and Tactical Ring Brand Name: CoiTAC Anodized aluminum . 3 Watt LED CREE XR-E P4. 110 lumens of light power. Run time is 2.5 hours on 2 CR123 lithium batteries that are included, pressure wire switch and 1 tactical flashlight ring included. Special strobe mode feature.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zALU7PvvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WQHRRG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B000WS8J9E", "title": "Crank Brothers Premium Bike Cleats", "description": "Let's say you need a replacement pair of cleats, or perhaps you have more than one pair of shoes that you'd like to use with your Crankbrothers pedals. These Premium Cleats have 6 degrees of float and they can be installed to give you a release angle of 15 or 20 degrees. They'll work with all Crankbrothers pedals -- Eggbeater, Candy, or Mallet. They're designed for shoes with a two-hole mounting pattern and weigh around 38g per pair.", "text": "Crank Brothers Premium Bike Cleats Let's say you need a replacement pair of cleats, or perhaps you have more than one pair of shoes that you'd like to use with your Crankbrothers pedals. These Premium Cleats have 6 degrees of float and they can be installed to give you a release angle of 15 or 20 degrees. They'll work with all Crankbrothers pedals -- Eggbeater, Candy, or Mallet. They're designed for shoes with a two-hole mounting pattern and weigh around 38g per pair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fh00ot-3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WS8J9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Replacement Cleats"]], "price": 14.83}}
{"item_id": "B000WSCDHI", "title": "Lucky Bums Ski Trainer Harness 2014", "description": "Lucky Bums Ski Trainer Harness - Leashes attach to the Lucky Bums Ski Trainer harness for parents to gently guide kids to turn and control speed. Leashes clips off easily and fit in backpack for chairlift rides. The Grip 'n Guide handle on the harness makes lifting your young one onto a chairlift or lending a helping hand during a fall in the snow convenient. Plus there is room for snacks or accessories (hand warmers and dry gear) in the pack. . GTIN: 0858567001004, Model Number: 1010, Product ID: 95320, Model Year: 2014", "text": "Lucky Bums Ski Trainer Harness 2014 Lucky Bums Ski Trainer Harness - Leashes attach to the Lucky Bums Ski Trainer harness for parents to gently guide kids to turn and control speed. Leashes clips off easily and fit in backpack for chairlift rides. The Grip 'n Guide handle on the harness makes lifting your young one onto a chairlift or lending a helping hand during a fall in the snow convenient. Plus there is room for snacks or accessories (hand warmers and dry gear) in the pack. . GTIN: 0858567001004, Model Number: 1010, Product ID: 95320, Model Year: 2014", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ob3IiH1vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WSCDHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lucky Bums", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 28.77}}
{"item_id": "B000WSUZ50", "title": "Pachmayr Decelerator Slip On Recoil Pad", "description": "No Gunsmithing required! Pachmayr’s Decelerator recoil pads provide the ultimate in recoil control and appearance and now you can install them on all your long guns. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting experience, and maybe help you bag more game. Features: - Easy “Do-It-Yourself” installation - Replaces hard factory pads - Custom “pre-ground” fit Size Large fits: Stock dimensions of 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" wide x 5-3/16\" to 5-7/16\" long, or will fit the following: Beretaa: 686, 687 Field models, 302, 303 Semi-Auto Browning: Citori with English Stock", "text": "Pachmayr Decelerator Slip On Recoil Pad No Gunsmithing required! Pachmayr’s Decelerator recoil pads provide the ultimate in recoil control and appearance and now you can install them on all your long guns. Designed to fit within .050 inch tolerance on factory stocks, these pads will enhance the look and feel of the gun, improve your shooting experience, and maybe help you bag more game. Features: - Easy “Do-It-Yourself” installation - Replaces hard factory pads - Custom “pre-ground” fit Size Large fits: Stock dimensions of 1-3/4\" to 1-7/8\" wide x 5-3/16\" to 5-7/16\" long, or will fit the following: Beretaa: 686, 687 Field models, 302, 303 Semi-Auto Browning: Citori with English Stock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AusR0XxlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WSUZ50.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WTYYFG", "title": "Plano Small Waterproof Boxes Quantity of Three", "description": "This package of three boxes is perfect for organizing all your small terminal tackle", "text": "Plano Small Waterproof Boxes Quantity of Three This package of three boxes is perfect for organizing all your small terminal tackle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eACKUqS%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WTYYFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano Molding Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 7.94}}
{"item_id": "B000WU9LCQ", "title": "MagnoGrip 311-090 Magnetic Wristband", "description": "MagnoGrip is a manufacturer of professional duty magnetic work gear. All our products are built to satisfy the requirements of the pro. We reinforce our products with rivets at the key stress points for increased durability. We use double-layered ballistic nylon to achieve a rugged lightweight construction that puts less strain on your back and more muscle into the gear so that it handles the most demanding jobs. The magnet features built into the products enable you to keep screws and tools close at hand. Use the MagnoGrip magnetic wristband to keep tools on your wrist while you work. Ideal for holding nails, screws, fasteners, wrenches and small tools. Finish jobs in less time and with less frustration. Breathable lightweight design allows you to wear the magnetic wristband all day. Super strong magnets also provides therapeutic relief to the wrist.", "text": "MagnoGrip 311-090 Magnetic Wristband MagnoGrip is a manufacturer of professional duty magnetic work gear. All our products are built to satisfy the requirements of the pro. We reinforce our products with rivets at the key stress points for increased durability. We use double-layered ballistic nylon to achieve a rugged lightweight construction that puts less strain on your back and more muscle into the gear so that it handles the most demanding jobs. The magnet features built into the products enable you to keep screws and tools close at hand. Use the MagnoGrip magnetic wristband to keep tools on your wrist while you work. Ideal for holding nails, screws, fasteners, wrenches and small tools. Finish jobs in less time and with less frustration. Breathable lightweight design allows you to wear the magnetic wristband all day. Super strong magnets also provides therapeutic relief to the wrist.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51shSRxl5gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WU9LCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagnoGrip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Sweat Headbands & Wristbands", "Sweat Wristbands"]], "price": 10.8}}
{"item_id": "B000WUDOXS", "title": "Ironman Elite Model Cycling Gloves", "description": "The Ironman� Elite cycling gloves provide maximum support and protection for hard-core cyclists. The unique 5-pad gel system on the palm incorporates The Groove, a patented channel that reduces hand numbness and fatigue while helping to prevent the pressure of vibration from reaching the median nerve. Breathable nylon/spandex mesh with polyester mesh knuckle covers offers comfortable wear. Features Fabric Content: 50% leather, 20% nylon, 15% cotton, 12% rubber gel, 3% rubber TPR hook-and-loop closure allows for custom fit adjustment at the wrist Terry cloth thumb for sweat absorption Thumb Crotch: Additional layer of leather for reinforcement and longer wear Palm: Perforated Pittards� leather for ventilation, with second layer to enclose gel padding for greater durability and wear life Cuff: Elastic knit for more secure fit Top Cover: Thick, yet breathable nylon/spandex mesh Knuckle Cover: Polyester mesh for stretchability and ventilation Fourchettes: Heavy duty stretch Lycra� spandex for durability Overlock Stitching: Extra step to prevent unraveling Palm Padding: Heavy-duty 6mm gel Unique 5-pad system for shock absorption and palm protection in case of impact The Groove: Patented channel between pads over the median nerve helps reduce hand numbness and fatigue, helps prevent the pressure of vibration from reaching the median nerve Imported", "text": "Ironman Elite Model Cycling Gloves The Ironman� Elite cycling gloves provide maximum support and protection for hard-core cyclists. The unique 5-pad gel system on the palm incorporates The Groove, a patented channel that reduces hand numbness and fatigue while helping to prevent the pressure of vibration from reaching the median nerve. Breathable nylon/spandex mesh with polyester mesh knuckle covers offers comfortable wear. Features Fabric Content: 50% leather, 20% nylon, 15% cotton, 12% rubber gel, 3% rubber TPR hook-and-loop closure allows for custom fit adjustment at the wrist Terry cloth thumb for sweat absorption Thumb Crotch: Additional layer of leather for reinforcement and longer wear Palm: Perforated Pittards� leather for ventilation, with second layer to enclose gel padding for greater durability and wear life Cuff: Elastic knit for more secure fit Top Cover: Thick, yet breathable nylon/spandex mesh Knuckle Cover: Polyester mesh for stretchability and ventilation Fourchettes: Heavy duty stretch Lycra� spandex for durability Overlock Stitching: Extra step to prevent unraveling Palm Padding: Heavy-duty 6mm gel Unique 5-pad system for shock absorption and palm protection in case of impact The Groove: Patented channel between pads over the median nerve helps reduce hand numbness and fatigue, helps prevent the pressure of vibration from reaching the median nerve Imported", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510%2BJhzBDnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WUDOXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IronMan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B000WUKFBM", "title": "Spyderco Diamond Triangle Pair", "description": "These are steel triangles blanketed in a bonding agent then covered in diamond particles. Diamond hard abrasives are recommended when you wish to remove stock, for restoration purposes and to aggressively re-shape, re-bevel and re-profile a cutting edge.", "text": "Spyderco Diamond Triangle Pair These are steel triangles blanketed in a bonding agent then covered in diamond particles. Diamond hard abrasives are recommended when you wish to remove stock, for restoration purposes and to aggressively re-shape, re-bevel and re-profile a cutting edge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZzDmeHy9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WUKFBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 43.95}}
{"item_id": "B000WV87UC", "title": "BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel Set, Ruger 1-Inch", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel Set offers a forend adapter that fits the barrel band on Ruger 10/22, .44 Magnum Carbine, Model 44 Carbine and No. 3 carbines. It also has an optional wood screw forend base for guns with no bands and a wood screw rear base.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel Set, Ruger 1-Inch The BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel Set offers a forend adapter that fits the barrel band on Ruger 10/22, .44 Magnum Carbine, Model 44 Carbine and No. 3 carbines. It also has an optional wood screw forend base for guns with no bands and a wood screw rear base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uZnZeWXpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WV87UC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 13.97}}
