{"item_id": "B000WVZA20", "title": "Galco Concealable Belt Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield", "description": "The Concealable holster is one of Galco’s most recognizable and innovative belt holsters. Its unique two-piece construction is contoured on the body side to the natural curve of the hip, keeping all the molding on the front of the holster, allowing for significantly more comfortable carry and a narrower profile than an ordinary pancake type holster. Hand-molded to fit specific handguns, the Concealable features a deeply hand-molded exterior for excellent retention properties and superior appearance, combat grip accessibility for speed, double-stitched seams for durability, and covered trigger guard for safety. The Concealable is constructed of premium saddle leather and made to fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for both semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Concealable is available in right or left hand designs in black or havana brown finish.", "text": "Galco Concealable Belt Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield The Concealable holster is one of Galco’s most recognizable and innovative belt holsters. Its unique two-piece construction is contoured on the body side to the natural curve of the hip, keeping all the molding on the front of the holster, allowing for significantly more comfortable carry and a narrower profile than an ordinary pancake type holster. Hand-molded to fit specific handguns, the Concealable features a deeply hand-molded exterior for excellent retention properties and superior appearance, combat grip accessibility for speed, double-stitched seams for durability, and covered trigger guard for safety. The Concealable is constructed of premium saddle leather and made to fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for both semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Concealable is available in right or left hand designs in black or havana brown finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412ZsNC7FzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WVZA20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 87.96}}
{"item_id": "B000WWZSBM", "title": "Kenda Small Block 8 XC Mountain Bike Tire", "description": "Brand:KendaIntended use:BMX & DirtWheel Size:26 InchTyre:Build: foldable tyreFoldable: yesthicker woven carcass: 120", "text": "Kenda Small Block 8 XC Mountain Bike Tire Brand:KendaIntended use:BMX & DirtWheel Size:26 InchTyre:Build: foldable tyreFoldable: yesthicker woven carcass: 120", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E2AQZZakL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WWZSBM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WXPTBA", "title": "Plano Double - sided StowAway Tackle Box", "description": "Plano Double - sided StowAway Tackle Box. Just the thing to keep small tackle separated, secure and ready for action! See-through design, constructed with tough molded plastic. Adjustable dividers and secure latching system. Another winner from Plano! Available here in 3 different sizes. State Model Number. Model: 3449, Size (in.): 6 1/2 x 4 x 2 1/8\", Compartments: 10-20. Model: 3450, Size (in.): 8 1/4 x 4 1/2 x 2 3/8\", Compartments: 12-18. Model: 3500, Size (in.): 9 1/8 x 5 x 2 1/2\", Compartments: 9-23. Order Today! Plano Double-sided StowAway Tackle Box", "text": "Plano Double - sided StowAway Tackle Box Plano Double - sided StowAway Tackle Box. Just the thing to keep small tackle separated, secure and ready for action! See-through design, constructed with tough molded plastic. Adjustable dividers and secure latching system. Another winner from Plano! Available here in 3 different sizes. State Model Number. Model: 3449, Size (in.): 6 1/2 x 4 x 2 1/8\", Compartments: 10-20. Model: 3450, Size (in.): 8 1/4 x 4 1/2 x 2 3/8\", Compartments: 12-18. Model: 3500, Size (in.): 9 1/8 x 5 x 2 1/2\", Compartments: 9-23. Order Today! Plano Double-sided StowAway Tackle Box", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O0yMx43yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WXPTBA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000WY2962", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Thermal Bivvy", "description": "FEATURES of the S.O.L. Thermal Bivvy by Adventure Medical Roll-Down Closure Dry Bag Mini-Rescue Flash Mirror Heatsheets Survival Blanket Mini Rescue Howler Whistle Waterproof Matches Tinder-Quik Waterproof Tinder SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 5.4 oz Dimensions: 3.75\" x 6\" x 1\"", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Thermal Bivvy FEATURES of the S.O.L. Thermal Bivvy by Adventure Medical Roll-Down Closure Dry Bag Mini-Rescue Flash Mirror Heatsheets Survival Blanket Mini Rescue Howler Whistle Waterproof Matches Tinder-Quik Waterproof Tinder SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 5.4 oz Dimensions: 3.75\" x 6\" x 1\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s9B55ZJaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY2962.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Bivy Sacks"]], "price": 15.13}}
{"item_id": "B000WY49RO", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Heatsheets Survival Blanket, Two Person", "description": "This is not your father's reflective blanket! 20% larger than competitive products! Survival and first-aid instructions are printed directly on the blanket ¿ you will have them when you need them! Features BRIGHT ORANGE STRIPE...an easy to spot universal distress color for rescue! Reflects up to 90% of radiated body heat. Easy to open and fold. Quiet. Tear resistant.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Heatsheets Survival Blanket, Two Person This is not your father's reflective blanket! 20% larger than competitive products! Survival and first-aid instructions are printed directly on the blanket ¿ you will have them when you need them! Features BRIGHT ORANGE STRIPE...an easy to spot universal distress color for rescue! Reflects up to 90% of radiated body heat. Easy to open and fold. Quiet. Tear resistant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510V1Tj4IoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY49RO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B000WY5SL0", "title": "Wald 8069 Hi-Rise Chopper Bike Handlebar (24.5-Inches Wide, Chrome, 13-Inch Rise)", "description": "Ever want to pick up your dry cleaning while riding home from work? The Wald 8069 handlebar provides an industry-unique feature: clothes hanging compatability. With a meager rise of 13 inches, you could hang a half dozen shirts on the handles easily (provided you remember to stow the bags so they don't get caught in your spokes). This bar features the proven 1-inch clamp (25.4 mm), rises 13 inches to the handles, and measures 24.5 inches across. There are endzone uprights with shorter reaches than these pillars of chrome.", "text": "Wald 8069 Hi-Rise Chopper Bike Handlebar (24.5-Inches Wide, Chrome, 13-Inch Rise) Ever want to pick up your dry cleaning while riding home from work? The Wald 8069 handlebar provides an industry-unique feature: clothes hanging compatability. With a meager rise of 13 inches, you could hang a half dozen shirts on the handles easily (provided you remember to stow the bags so they don't get caught in your spokes). This bar features the proven 1-inch clamp (25.4 mm), rises 13 inches to the handles, and measures 24.5 inches across. There are endzone uprights with shorter reaches than these pillars of chrome.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZaR8zWkoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY5SL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wald", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B000WY6ZXA", "title": "Pyramid Bicycle Bungie Cargo Net, Black", "description": "This Pyramid Bungie cargo net will fit any standard bicycle rack and most oversized racks. It is perfect for carrying odd shaped items that won't fit on your rack normally.", "text": "Pyramid Bicycle Bungie Cargo Net, Black This Pyramid Bungie cargo net will fit any standard bicycle rack and most oversized racks. It is perfect for carrying odd shaped items that won't fit on your rack normally.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3149K3EPAXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY6ZXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 3.9}}
{"item_id": "B000WY730O", "title": "Park Tool GP-2 Super Patch Kit", "description": "One of our most successful products ever! We worked with 3M to produce a self adhesive tube patch that stretches, flexes, twists, and turns right along with the tube. No messy glue, no bulky packaging. Lightly roughen tube with the included sandpaper, clean, apply patch, and you’re ready to go. Six patches with sandpaper in a neat little carry along box. Available individually carded (GP- 2C) or in a handy 50 kit countertop display.", "text": "Park Tool GP-2 Super Patch Kit One of our most successful products ever! We worked with 3M to produce a self adhesive tube patch that stretches, flexes, twists, and turns right along with the tube. No messy glue, no bulky packaging. Lightly roughen tube with the included sandpaper, clean, apply patch, and you’re ready to go. Six patches with sandpaper in a neat little carry along box. Available individually carded (GP- 2C) or in a handy 50 kit countertop display.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411zptHg1TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY730O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 3.74}}
{"item_id": "B000WY8JYI", "title": "Sunlite Cloud-9, Bicycle Non-suspension Sport Saddle, Sport Select Mens, Black", "description": "11\" Long x 6-1/2\" Wide. Gel foam material. Vented anatomic relief system. Front and rear bumpers.", "text": "Sunlite Cloud-9, Bicycle Non-suspension Sport Saddle, Sport Select Mens, Black 11\" Long x 6-1/2\" Wide. Gel foam material. Vented anatomic relief system. Front and rear bumpers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oGGRsGLBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY8JYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 22.32}}
{"item_id": "B000WY8LSM", "title": "Park Tool SW-7 Triple Spoke Wrench for Nipple Sizes of 0.127 , 0.130, and 0.136- Inch", "description": "The precision sized SW-7 fits the three most popular spoke nipple sizes on the market. Sizes equal to SW-0, 1, 2. The SW-7 is nickel plated for years of service. Designed for the home mechanic.", "text": "Park Tool SW-7 Triple Spoke Wrench for Nipple Sizes of 0.127 , 0.130, and 0.136- Inch The precision sized SW-7 fits the three most popular spoke nipple sizes on the market. Sizes equal to SW-0, 1, 2. The SW-7 is nickel plated for years of service. Designed for the home mechanic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PxHl4ZlyL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WY8LSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.54}}
