{"item_id": "B000WYCGB0", "title": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Suspension Comfort Saddle, Cruiser Select", "description": "Tired of riding your bicycle on a uncomfortable hard skinny seat? You're problems are over. This seat is 11\" long by 9\" wide!. Its like riding on a cloud. This seat has an easy universal installation with any standard seat post. This saddle is built by Cloud 9, so you know you are getting an incredibly designed comfort seat.", "text": "Sunlite Cloud-9 Bicycle Suspension Comfort Saddle, Cruiser Select Tired of riding your bicycle on a uncomfortable hard skinny seat? You're problems are over. This seat is 11\" long by 9\" wide!. Its like riding on a cloud. This seat has an easy universal installation with any standard seat post. This saddle is built by Cloud 9, so you know you are getting an incredibly designed comfort seat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q9ZA5aM1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000WYCGB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 22.51}}
