{"item_id": "B000X1SHG0", "title": "Easton Easton Tote Bag, Gray", "description": "This Easton bat bag has a separate bat compartment that will securely hold two baseball or softball bats. With a metal hanging fence clip and interior valuables pocket this is one of Easton's most popular bat bags.", "text": "Easton Easton Tote Bag, Gray This Easton bat bag has a separate bat compartment that will securely hold two baseball or softball bats. With a metal hanging fence clip and interior valuables pocket this is one of Easton's most popular bat bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21nN8XgXJmL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X1SHG0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags", "Bat Bags"]], "price": 14.99}}
