{"item_id": "B000X23DL8", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37TN-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Part-Serrated Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "description": "The SEAL Pup Elite is our high performance new edition to the existing SEAL family of products. Sometimes, we just 'have to have' more horsepower, the racing suspension, and every available option including sunroof. All kidding aside the SEAL Pup Elite is serious business and carries on the tradition of supplying the worlds elite military forces.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37TN-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Part-Serrated Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish The SEAL Pup Elite is our high performance new edition to the existing SEAL family of products. Sometimes, we just 'have to have' more horsepower, the racing suspension, and every available option including sunroof. All kidding aside the SEAL Pup Elite is serious business and carries on the tradition of supplying the worlds elite military forces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZmYezVLbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X23DL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 67.46}}
