{"item_id": "B000X4LR78", "title": "Ontario SP15 LSA Knife (Black)", "description": "The SP15 LSA (Land, Sea, Air) Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang Bowie style blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP15 LSA Knife (Black) The SP15 LSA (Land, Sea, Air) Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang Bowie style blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x77fByq4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X4LR78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 45.77}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YIDC", "title": "SKS Adventure Bicycle Fender Set (26 and 28-Inch Bikes)", "description": "The Adventure mudguard set for front and rear 26\"-28\" tires includes universal fastening and frame clip. This fender is V-brake compatible and was designed for trekking and mountainbiking.", "text": "SKS Adventure Bicycle Fender Set (26 and 28-Inch Bikes) The Adventure mudguard set for front and rear 26\"-28\" tires includes universal fastening and frame clip. This fender is V-brake compatible and was designed for trekking and mountainbiking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415znwqB-sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YIDC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YIFU", "title": "SKS Shockblade Front Bicycle Fender (26-Inch)", "description": "This MTB fender is the dirtboard of choice for the cross country elite. The Shockblade is made of virtually unbreakable high-quality dual compound plastic. This fender features easy quick-release fastening. The hidden chuck cone adapter is fitted only once, during the first assembly. The Shockblade fits almost all suspension forks.", "text": "SKS Shockblade Front Bicycle Fender (26-Inch) This MTB fender is the dirtboard of choice for the cross country elite. The Shockblade is made of virtually unbreakable high-quality dual compound plastic. This fender features easy quick-release fastening. The hidden chuck cone adapter is fitted only once, during the first assembly. The Shockblade fits almost all suspension forks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31USHI2orOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YIFU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YIJG", "title": "SKS Raceblade XL Fender Set", "description": "Anyone who lives in a area that touts \"rain\" as a season is probably used to slogging home soaking wet after a long ride. And even though rainfall inevitably leaves us wet, nothing is worse than being soaked to the bone from road spray. SKS's Raceblade XL Fender Set is designed with the same attention to detail and ease of use as its regular Raceblade, but it fits bikes with wider tires. Americans have an aversion to fenders, it seems, but in Europe, even the pros train with them. After all, they don't just keep you dry, they keep your wheel splash out of your teammates' eyes. And not only do you want happy teammates, you want them to see you when you signal for debris or to stop. The Raceblades are quick to install for those rides when the clouds roll in just as you arrive at the start. They use a rubber grommet system to attach to your bike. Think of it as working like a quick release system. It takes 10 seconds of tool-free time to put them on and take them off. They stay firmly in place, without having to screw in bolts and nuts, and they won't mar your frame. The Raceblade fits 700c wheels equipped with tires ranging in size from 25-32mm, meaning they are compatible with the wider, treaded tires on your cyclocross bike. They're available in Black.", "text": "SKS Raceblade XL Fender Set Anyone who lives in a area that touts \"rain\" as a season is probably used to slogging home soaking wet after a long ride. And even though rainfall inevitably leaves us wet, nothing is worse than being soaked to the bone from road spray. SKS's Raceblade XL Fender Set is designed with the same attention to detail and ease of use as its regular Raceblade, but it fits bikes with wider tires. Americans have an aversion to fenders, it seems, but in Europe, even the pros train with them. After all, they don't just keep you dry, they keep your wheel splash out of your teammates' eyes. And not only do you want happy teammates, you want them to see you when you signal for debris or to stop. The Raceblades are quick to install for those rides when the clouds roll in just as you arrive at the start. They use a rubber grommet system to attach to your bike. Think of it as working like a quick release system. It takes 10 seconds of tool-free time to put them on and take them off. They stay firmly in place, without having to screw in bolts and nuts, and they won't mar your frame. The Raceblade fits 700c wheels equipped with tires ranging in size from 25-32mm, meaning they are compatible with the wider, treaded tires on your cyclocross bike. They're available in Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mt1qQfqjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YIJG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YIKA", "title": "SKS Raceblade Bicycle Fender Set", "description": "The perfect addition to your road bike to help you \"stay dry\"! The Raceblade is the world's first quick-release fender for racing bikes. This fender fits tires 700 x 18-23 and is extremely light and aerodynamic. The raceblade offers optimal spray protection and can be mounted in seconds--tool free.", "text": "SKS Raceblade Bicycle Fender Set The perfect addition to your road bike to help you \"stay dry\"! The Raceblade is the world's first quick-release fender for racing bikes. This fender fits tires 700 x 18-23 and is extremely light and aerodynamic. The raceblade offers optimal spray protection and can be mounted in seconds--tool free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WSyFAEkbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YIKA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YIP0", "title": "SKS CT-Worx 20-Function Bicycle Tool", "description": "2.5,3,4,5,6,8 allen keys, straight and phillips screwdriver, 6/11/12 ring spanner, 14/15G spoke wrench, 2 tire levers, 8,10,13,15 mm open wrenches, 1 chain tool. This tool is extremely functional and compact.", "text": "SKS CT-Worx 20-Function Bicycle Tool 2.5,3,4,5,6,8 allen keys, straight and phillips screwdriver, 6/11/12 ring spanner, 14/15G spoke wrench, 2 tire levers, 8,10,13,15 mm open wrenches, 1 chain tool. This tool is extremely functional and compact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kVAfIrIfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YIP0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YJJK", "title": "SKS Commuter Bicycle Fender Set (45mm/Trekking Bike, Silver)", "description": "The Commuter fender set is SKS's economical mudguard system. The Commuter is easily mounted by the consumer and features mudflaps for extra protection.", "text": "SKS Commuter Bicycle Fender Set (45mm/Trekking Bike, Silver) The Commuter fender set is SKS's economical mudguard system. The Commuter is easily mounted by the consumer and features mudflaps for extra protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418wZblqK4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YJJK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X5YONQ", "title": "Cold Steel 5 Foot .625 Blowgun Big Bore Hunting Weapon", "description": "The Cold Steel big bore blows guns feature a .625 Big bore and are the most effective blow guns on the market. 5 Foot model. Includes .625 Magnum Blow Gun, 1 dart quiver, 12 stun darts, 12 mini broadhead darts, 6 bamboo darts, 6 broadhead darts, rubber ferrule, and a mouthpiece.", "text": "Cold Steel 5 Foot .625 Blowgun Big Bore Hunting Weapon The Cold Steel big bore blows guns feature a .625 Big bore and are the most effective blow guns on the market. 5 Foot model. Includes .625 Magnum Blow Gun, 1 dart quiver, 12 stun darts, 12 mini broadhead darts, 6 bamboo darts, 6 broadhead darts, rubber ferrule, and a mouthpiece.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tjJm3mmBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5YONQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 35.48}}
{"item_id": "B000X5Z8J0", "title": "Crystal River Fly Fishing Combo Kit", "description": "Kit includes 8'0\" 3-piece fly rod, graphite fly reel, fly line, tapered leader and two flies.", "text": "Crystal River Fly Fishing Combo Kit Kit includes 8'0\" 3-piece fly rod, graphite fly reel, fly line, tapered leader and two flies.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dr6vPQxEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5Z8J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crystal River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Fly Fishing Combos"]], "price": 31.61}}
{"item_id": "B000X5ZK66", "title": "SKS Beavertail Bicycle Fender Set (26 and 28-Inch Bikes)", "description": "This sport mudguard set was designed for trekking and mountainbiking. These snap-on fenders offer optimized dirt protection and are also suitable for suspension forks. The Beavertail mounts with strong steel brackets.", "text": "SKS Beavertail Bicycle Fender Set (26 and 28-Inch Bikes) This sport mudguard set was designed for trekking and mountainbiking. These snap-on fenders offer optimized dirt protection and are also suitable for suspension forks. The Beavertail mounts with strong steel brackets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GmlnkzG1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5ZK66.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X5ZK6Q", "title": "SKS Mud-X Downtube Fender", "description": "The SKS Mud-X Downtube Fender is a simple, old-skool fender that is as simple as it is effective. It's curved plastic, with a channel on the back for a bike's down tube, two rubber ties, and a foam pad. The plastic keeps the mud at bay, the channel makes the fender easy to fit to the downtube, the ties hold it in place and the foam pad both prevents scratching the frame and twisting the fender. Color is Black. Weight is 90g.Product FeaturesHASH(0x730fc928)", "text": "SKS Mud-X Downtube Fender The SKS Mud-X Downtube Fender is a simple, old-skool fender that is as simple as it is effective. It's curved plastic, with a channel on the back for a bike's down tube, two rubber ties, and a foam pad. The plastic keeps the mud at bay, the channel makes the fender easy to fit to the downtube, the ties hold it in place and the foam pad both prevents scratching the frame and twisting the fender. Color is Black. Weight is 90g.Product FeaturesHASH(0x730fc928)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31njMr0DSBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X5ZK6Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 9.28}}
{"item_id": "B000X61N2A", "title": "SKS rear mudguard Xtra-Dry 26 inch", "description": "Operating Range:MTBType:mudguard rearWheel Size:26 Inch28 InchMaterial:plasticAdditional Information:simple quick release through Powerstrapextremely lighthigh quality impact resistant plasticMudguards:Build: mudguard", "text": "SKS rear mudguard Xtra-Dry 26 inch Operating Range:MTBType:mudguard rearWheel Size:26 Inch28 InchMaterial:plasticAdditional Information:simple quick release through Powerstrapextremely lighthigh quality impact resistant plasticMudguards:Build: mudguard", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nxJSHpigL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X61N2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 14.39}}
{"item_id": "B000X65O84", "title": "SKS Hightrek Bicycle Fender Set (26-Inch Wheels)", "description": "The Hightrek 26\" fender set is designed for trekking and mountainbiking. This snap-on mudguard set is for 26\" tires and includes a universal fastening and frame clip. The hightrek is cantilever and V-brake compatible.", "text": "SKS Hightrek Bicycle Fender Set (26-Inch Wheels) The Hightrek 26\" fender set is designed for trekking and mountainbiking. This snap-on mudguard set is for 26\" tires and includes a universal fastening and frame clip. The hightrek is cantilever and V-brake compatible.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410MDj97X0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X65O84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 6.29}}
{"item_id": "B000X65O9S", "title": "SKS X-Board Downtube Mounted Fender", "description": "The X-Board plays the same role for your front wheel as the X-Blade does for the rear -- it's a nicely basic fender to protect you from water spray off of moist (but not water-logged) roads. It mounts in a matter of seconds to the underside of your frame's downtube with a tool-free grommet system, making it ideal for riding in areas where the roads are wet in the morning, but it's not actually rainy out. Weight with hardware is 99g, and the fender comes in Black only. For comprehensive protection from the elements, we recommend pairing the X-Board with the X-Blade.Dual compound-softspoiler material and longevity to the X-Board Robust rubber fastening straps attach securely to nearly any size downtube For all frames 24-28inProduct FeaturesMaterial:Mount Type: strapCompatibility: nearly any bikeWeight: 99 gRecommended Use: commutingManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "SKS X-Board Downtube Mounted Fender The X-Board plays the same role for your front wheel as the X-Blade does for the rear -- it's a nicely basic fender to protect you from water spray off of moist (but not water-logged) roads. It mounts in a matter of seconds to the underside of your frame's downtube with a tool-free grommet system, making it ideal for riding in areas where the roads are wet in the morning, but it's not actually rainy out. Weight with hardware is 99g, and the fender comes in Black only. For comprehensive protection from the elements, we recommend pairing the X-Board with the X-Blade.Dual compound-softspoiler material and longevity to the X-Board Robust rubber fastening straps attach securely to nearly any size downtube For all frames 24-28inProduct FeaturesMaterial:Mount Type: strapCompatibility: nearly any bikeWeight: 99 gRecommended Use: commutingManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IUyDBHwuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X65O9S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 11.69}}
{"item_id": "B000X65OKW", "title": "SKS T-Knox 8-Function Bicycle Tool", "description": "2,2.5,3,4,5,6, alley keys, straight and phillips screwdriver. This tool is extremely light and compact with an ergonomic design. Allen wrench/phillips head combinations make the most important adjustments on the trail.", "text": "SKS T-Knox 8-Function Bicycle Tool 2,2.5,3,4,5,6, alley keys, straight and phillips screwdriver. This tool is extremely light and compact with an ergonomic design. Allen wrench/phillips head combinations make the most important adjustments on the trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-XjJh3NJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X65OKW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 9.54}}
{"item_id": "B000X7AJP6", "title": "Caldwell Lead Sled DFT", "description": "The Lead Sled DFT (Dual-Frame Technology) provides shooters with the industry's best recoil reduction system and the versatility to fit virtually any shotgun or rifle, all built around a precision shooting platform. Whether you are trying to shoot the very tightest possible groups with your rifle or patterning your favorite shotgun, the Lead Sled DFT provides an optimal platform for shooting without nasty recoil.", "text": "Caldwell Lead Sled DFT The Lead Sled DFT (Dual-Frame Technology) provides shooters with the industry's best recoil reduction system and the versatility to fit virtually any shotgun or rifle, all built around a precision shooting platform. Whether you are trying to shoot the very tightest possible groups with your rifle or patterning your favorite shotgun, the Lead Sled DFT provides an optimal platform for shooting without nasty recoil.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JUHZyv85L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X7AJP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 171.93}}
{"item_id": "B000X8EGDQ", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Long Sleeve Jersey", "description": "The classic Pearl Izumi Quest three-pocket men's long sleeve jersey offers a comfortable semi-form fit, making it a perfect cool weather piece. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a 15-inch zipper for venting, elasticized hem, three elasticized rear pockets, and reflective piping for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Long Sleeve Jersey The classic Pearl Izumi Quest three-pocket men's long sleeve jersey offers a comfortable semi-form fit, making it a perfect cool weather piece. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a 15-inch zipper for venting, elasticized hem, three elasticized rear pockets, and reflective piping for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g7hJtSedL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X8EGDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000X8ME2G", "title": "Energizer Tactical Metal Handheld LED Flashlight", "description": "Energizer LED Tactical Metal 1-Watt Light includes a precision machined high-strength aluminum casing that withstands harsh treatment, making it an ideal light for tough working conditions. The compact size and ability to operate it with only one hand, make this an easy to carry, easy to use light. The one-watt white luxeon LED projects 37 lumens of light. And, the handle has a textured grip and comes with a lanyard for easy handling.", "text": "Energizer Tactical Metal Handheld LED Flashlight Energizer LED Tactical Metal 1-Watt Light includes a precision machined high-strength aluminum casing that withstands harsh treatment, making it an ideal light for tough working conditions. The compact size and ability to operate it with only one hand, make this an easy to carry, easy to use light. The one-watt white luxeon LED projects 37 lumens of light. And, the handle has a textured grip and comes with a lanyard for easy handling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eOSm9p-aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X8ME2G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Energizer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000X9RM1I", "title": "Nathan Nike+ IPod Sensor Pocket", "description": "The new Nathan Nike+ iPod Sensor Pocket is a remake of Nathan's most popular product; the sensor pocket. The Nathan Nike+ iPod Sensor Pocket allows you to store and use the Nike+ iPod with any pair of shoes, and the best thing of all... you won't even notice it's there!", "text": "Nathan Nike+ IPod Sensor Pocket The new Nathan Nike+ iPod Sensor Pocket is a remake of Nathan's most popular product; the sensor pocket. The Nathan Nike+ iPod Sensor Pocket allows you to store and use the Nike+ iPod with any pair of shoes, and the best thing of all... you won't even notice it's there!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410oztTP8zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000X9RM1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nathan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B000XADLN0", "title": "Stansport Single Burner 10,000 BTU Propane Stove, Black", "description": "The Single Burner 10,000 BTU Propane Stove from Stansport is designed for stable and efficient outdoors use on backpacking and camping trips. The stove features a 7.5-inch diameter grid for stability with a DuraBase and tip-resistant feet that hold a 16.4-ounce propane gas cylinder (sold separately). The heat output is easy to control with a regulator control knob and the chrome-plated, anti-clog burner grid is designed for easy maintenance.Specifications:Chrome plated, Anti-Clog burner grid7.5-inch grid diameterBurner output: 10,000 BTUsRegulator on/off control knob\"Dura Base\" with tip-resistant feetFeet hold a 16.4-ounce propane gas cylinder (gas cylinder sold separately)Weight: 1 pound, 14 ounces", "text": "Stansport Single Burner 10,000 BTU Propane Stove, Black The Single Burner 10,000 BTU Propane Stove from Stansport is designed for stable and efficient outdoors use on backpacking and camping trips. The stove features a 7.5-inch diameter grid for stability with a DuraBase and tip-resistant feet that hold a 16.4-ounce propane gas cylinder (sold separately). The heat output is easy to control with a regulator control knob and the chrome-plated, anti-clog burner grid is designed for easy maintenance.Specifications:Chrome plated, Anti-Clog burner grid7.5-inch grid diameterBurner output: 10,000 BTUsRegulator on/off control knob\"Dura Base\" with tip-resistant feetFeet hold a 16.4-ounce propane gas cylinder (gas cylinder sold separately)Weight: 1 pound, 14 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bBoTCXilL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XADLN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 22.78}}
{"item_id": "B000XAT8DC", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 2125KV Ultima 5-Inch Razor Edge Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Ultima made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 5-Inch tactical razor edge blade that resembles the bronze age daggers of 4000 years ago. This unique handle has over 70-triangle grips segments giving ultimate control. The 1.4116-stainless steel black Ti-nitride serrated blade has a black finish giving it the tactical look. This unique knife comes with black Cordura Zytel sheath that has an injection molded liner. Dual belt loops are Velcro adjustable", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 2125KV Ultima 5-Inch Razor Edge Fixed Blade Knife Ultima made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 5-Inch tactical razor edge blade that resembles the bronze age daggers of 4000 years ago. This unique handle has over 70-triangle grips segments giving ultimate control. The 1.4116-stainless steel black Ti-nitride serrated blade has a black finish giving it the tactical look. This unique knife comes with black Cordura Zytel sheath that has an injection molded liner. Dual belt loops are Velcro adjustable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417BpwYHC1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XAT8DC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 67.95}}
{"item_id": "B000XB7UA4", "title": "Paricon Winter Lightning Sled (3-Pack)", "description": "Fly down the sled hill at lightning speed--or watch your kids have a great time doing so--in these heavy-duty sleds made of highly durable and slick-coated plastic. The molded nose ensures a fast ride every time and the sled bodies are cold-crack treated to withstand years of use in even the chilliest winter wonderland. All you need to add is snow.Specifications:Ages three and upWidth: 7 by 4 by 51 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 3 poundsAbout PariconParicon has had a long and colorful history in the sled-making business, starting in 1861 with the founding of a family business, Paris Manufacturing, in South Paris, Maine, by the great grandfather of current CEO, Hank Morton. From then through today, and into the future, the story unfolds.It all started, in 1861, when Henry Morton married Lucilla Forbes and the young couple started making sleds in their home. Henry constructed the sleds by hand and his wife decorated them. Their son, Will, an accomplished artist, distinguished himself as a sled painter, specializing in water scenes and scrolls. Hand-decorated sleds today are much sought after by collectors, but the originals were probably meant to ensure that each sled would be a child's prized possession.During the early 1900s, when each sled was made by hand, the company employed close to 300 workers. It continued in operation as a family business, still employing 200 workers, until the family gave up ownership in 1970s and sold to Gladding Corporation. In 1978, Hank Morton, great-grandson of the founder, headed a group of investors that purchased the company back from Gladding.Today, Hank and his sons, Ted and Tom, are continuing the family tradition in the sled business with Paricon. The sled line has evolved to include a wide assortment of products for winter use sleds, including steel runner and plastic models at various price points; snowboards; foam sliders; inflatable tubes; wooden toboggans and snow toys. Paricon serves customers throughout the U.S. from its distribution center in South Paris with high-quality products and on-time delivery.", "text": "Paricon Winter Lightning Sled (3-Pack) Fly down the sled hill at lightning speed--or watch your kids have a great time doing so--in these heavy-duty sleds made of highly durable and slick-coated plastic. The molded nose ensures a fast ride every time and the sled bodies are cold-crack treated to withstand years of use in even the chilliest winter wonderland. All you need to add is snow.Specifications:Ages three and upWidth: 7 by 4 by 51 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 3 poundsAbout PariconParicon has had a long and colorful history in the sled-making business, starting in 1861 with the founding of a family business, Paris Manufacturing, in South Paris, Maine, by the great grandfather of current CEO, Hank Morton. From then through today, and into the future, the story unfolds.It all started, in 1861, when Henry Morton married Lucilla Forbes and the young couple started making sleds in their home. Henry constructed the sleds by hand and his wife decorated them. Their son, Will, an accomplished artist, distinguished himself as a sled painter, specializing in water scenes and scrolls. Hand-decorated sleds today are much sought after by collectors, but the originals were probably meant to ensure that each sled would be a child's prized possession.During the early 1900s, when each sled was made by hand, the company employed close to 300 workers. It continued in operation as a family business, still employing 200 workers, until the family gave up ownership in 1970s and sold to Gladding Corporation. In 1978, Hank Morton, great-grandson of the founder, headed a group of investors that purchased the company back from Gladding.Today, Hank and his sons, Ted and Tom, are continuing the family tradition in the sled business with Paricon. The sled line has evolved to include a wide assortment of products for winter use sleds, including steel runner and plastic models at various price points; snowboards; foam sliders; inflatable tubes; wooden toboggans and snow toys. Paricon serves customers throughout the U.S. from its distribution center in South Paris with high-quality products and on-time delivery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L3I0nGIFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XB7UA4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Paricon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Sledding", "Snow Sleds"]], "price": 30.25}}
