{"item_id": "B000XFW6O0", "title": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's Merino Wool Micro Crew Cushion Hiking Socks", "description": "Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "text": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's Merino Wool Micro Crew Cushion Hiking Socks Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513p2dN3G%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XFW6O0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
