{"item_id": "B000XQ02R2", "title": "Yoga Block 1 or 2 pack 4 in. x 6 in. x 9 in. Larger Size High Quality 4 colors by Bean Products™", "description": "Authentic Bean Products™high density studio quality 1 or 2 pack of Yoga Blocks will aid your practice by bringing the floor closer to you to improve your asana and avoid overstretching and injury and help you achieve proper alignment.Our Bean Yoga3 inch and 4 inch Yoga Blocks allow you to modify and deepen poses, improve alignment and accommodate your level of flexibility which can be important for beginners and inflexible people as well as help advanced practitioners achieve higher quality form.Strong, firm, stable,light-weight EVA foam with beveled edges are easy to grip, to travel with, to store and are very stable and durable for a lifetime of benefit. Two blocks are suggested for more positioning options and better price. Choose 3x6x9 inch for travel or smaller person, or 4x6x9 inch for home and studio use. Available in Blue, Purple, Green and Black - CHOOSE either single block or 2 block pack.For the highest qualityauthenticBean Products™please beware of imitators or counterfeit unauthorized sellers by purchasing only fromBean Products™IngredientsEach block: 9\"L x 6\"W x 4\"HDirectionsSpot clean with mild detergent. Towel or air dry.", "text": "Yoga Block 1 or 2 pack 4 in. x 6 in. x 9 in. Larger Size High Quality 4 colors by Bean Products™ Authentic Bean Products™high density studio quality 1 or 2 pack of Yoga Blocks will aid your practice by bringing the floor closer to you to improve your asana and avoid overstretching and injury and help you achieve proper alignment.Our Bean Yoga3 inch and 4 inch Yoga Blocks allow you to modify and deepen poses, improve alignment and accommodate your level of flexibility which can be important for beginners and inflexible people as well as help advanced practitioners achieve higher quality form.Strong, firm, stable,light-weight EVA foam with beveled edges are easy to grip, to travel with, to store and are very stable and durable for a lifetime of benefit. Two blocks are suggested for more positioning options and better price. Choose 3x6x9 inch for travel or smaller person, or 4x6x9 inch for home and studio use. Available in Blue, Purple, Green and Black - CHOOSE either single block or 2 block pack.For the highest qualityauthenticBean Products™please beware of imitators or counterfeit unauthorized sellers by purchasing only fromBean Products™IngredientsEach block: 9\"L x 6\"W x 4\"HDirectionsSpot clean with mild detergent. Towel or air dry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LGiZJSUJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XQ02R2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Blocks"]], "price": 10.95}}
