{"item_id": "B000XQ7AHC", "title": "WTB Speed V Comp Saddle", "description": "The WTB Speed V Comp Saddle is an excellent choice for recreational road and mountain biking. High-set padding with a contoured shape and a love channel recess provide ride comfort. Synthetic cover and Satin Steel rails", "text": "WTB Speed V Comp Saddle The WTB Speed V Comp Saddle is an excellent choice for recreational road and mountain biking. High-set padding with a contoured shape and a love channel recess provide ride comfort. Synthetic cover and Satin Steel rails", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mc5AHlyZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XQ7AHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WTB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B000XQ7I06", "title": "Sheffield 12855 Absaroka Folding Pocket Knife", "description": "Founded in 1919, Great Neck Saw Manufacturer has been manufacturing and marketing hand tools for over 80 years to professionals and DIY-ers worldwide. Great Neck is committed to providing the finest quality products at a competitive price. Sheffield Absaroka Folding Pocket Knife Thumb and Forefinger Ambidextrous One Hand Release 4-Inch Multi Color Titanium Handle 2-3/4-Inch Partially Serrated 2-1/2-mm Titanium Blade Frame Lock Pocket Clip 3.1-Ounce, 6-3/4-Inch Overall.", "text": "Sheffield 12855 Absaroka Folding Pocket Knife Founded in 1919, Great Neck Saw Manufacturer has been manufacturing and marketing hand tools for over 80 years to professionals and DIY-ers worldwide. Great Neck is committed to providing the finest quality products at a competitive price. Sheffield Absaroka Folding Pocket Knife Thumb and Forefinger Ambidextrous One Hand Release 4-Inch Multi Color Titanium Handle 2-3/4-Inch Partially Serrated 2-1/2-mm Titanium Blade Frame Lock Pocket Clip 3.1-Ounce, 6-3/4-Inch Overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xHPgLZZDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XQ7I06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Great Neck Saw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 13.24}}
{"item_id": "B000XQH8FQ", "title": "Champion Sports Multi-Sport Net Pitch Back Screen", "description": "Practice kicking and passing soccer balls, catch pop flies or grounders, work on passing and catching a basketball, or train in any other sport with the Champion Sports Multi-Sport Pitch Back Training Screen. This unique training aid rotates to different angles for multi-sport use. The 1 1/4in powder coated steel frame features heavyweight nylon netting and a square target to help with aim and accuracy practice. Multi-sport athletes can use it all year long!", "text": "Champion Sports Multi-Sport Net Pitch Back Screen Practice kicking and passing soccer balls, catch pop flies or grounders, work on passing and catching a basketball, or train in any other sport with the Champion Sports Multi-Sport Pitch Back Training Screen. This unique training aid rotates to different angles for multi-sport use. The 1 1/4in powder coated steel frame features heavyweight nylon netting and a square target to help with aim and accuracy practice. Multi-sport athletes can use it all year long!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dydtjDX4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XQH8FQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Field Equipment", "Protective Screens"]], "price": 68.89}}
{"item_id": "B000XQK2MW", "title": "Intex 110 - 120 Volt AC Quick-fill Electric Pump", "description": "110 - 120 Volt AC Quick-fill Electric Pump", "text": "Intex 110 - 120 Volt AC Quick-fill Electric Pump 110 - 120 Volt AC Quick-fill Electric Pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WifO9%2BluL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XQK2MW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B000XRFAR8", "title": "Gear Aid ReviveX Down Cleaner, 12-Ounce", "description": "Not sure how to clean down comforters, jackets and sleeping bags. Wonder no more! Just use ReviveX Down Cleaner by Gear Aid and you can clean your favorite down like a pro without the expensive bill. This gentle formula preserves natural oils to restore the loft and warmth you thought was gone forever.Perfect for all down, including DownTek and other water repellent down products, just one wash per season will keep your down lofty and warm. It will also gently clean waterproof breathable shell fabrics, making it a necessary step before treating with ReviveX Durable Waterproofing.With ReviveX it's easy to take great care of your down sleeping bag, coat and mittens. Keep it clean and stay warm, naturally.", "text": "Gear Aid ReviveX Down Cleaner, 12-Ounce Not sure how to clean down comforters, jackets and sleeping bags. Wonder no more! Just use ReviveX Down Cleaner by Gear Aid and you can clean your favorite down like a pro without the expensive bill. This gentle formula preserves natural oils to restore the loft and warmth you thought was gone forever.Perfect for all down, including DownTek and other water repellent down products, just one wash per season will keep your down lofty and warm. It will also gently clean waterproof breathable shell fabrics, making it a necessary step before treating with ReviveX Durable Waterproofing.With ReviveX it's easy to take great care of your down sleeping bag, coat and mittens. Keep it clean and stay warm, naturally.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SUxl7iCAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XRFAR8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B000XSGL48", "title": "Stan's Tire Sealant 2oz. Bottle", "description": "Stan's No Tubes Tire Sealant 2oz. BottleCondition: NewConvenient, pre-filled plastic bottle contains enough Stan's No Tubes sealant for one bicycle tire application.Compact, single-application bottle easily fits in a backpack or saddle bagA must-have for the repair kit and perfect for any tubeless tire installation", "text": "Stan's Tire Sealant 2oz. Bottle Stan's No Tubes Tire Sealant 2oz. BottleCondition: NewConvenient, pre-filled plastic bottle contains enough Stan's No Tubes sealant for one bicycle tire application.Compact, single-application bottle easily fits in a backpack or saddle bagA must-have for the repair kit and perfect for any tubeless tire installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XSthVaYfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XSGL48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stan&#39;s NoTubes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]], "price": 4.9}}
{"item_id": "B000XSJIMA", "title": "NoTubes Tire Sealant", "description": "Stan's Tire Sealant will stay liquid in a mountain bike tire with a thin casing for two to seven months on average. Riding in arid climates or storing the bike in a hot area will require more frequent monitoring of sealant levels. Special anti-freeze agent.", "text": "NoTubes Tire Sealant Stan's Tire Sealant will stay liquid in a mountain bike tire with a thin casing for two to seven months on average. Riding in arid climates or storing the bike in a hot area will require more frequent monitoring of sealant levels. Special anti-freeze agent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41araC4GfhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XSJIMA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XTI15Y", "title": "Trademark Poker Craps Diamond Pyramid Bumper Rubber", "description": "Used on Las Vegas crap tables to ensure a random roll of the dice, this dark green diamond bumper rubber measures 4 feet long by 11 inches high.", "text": "Trademark Poker Craps Diamond Pyramid Bumper Rubber Used on Las Vegas crap tables to ensure a random roll of the dice, this dark green diamond bumper rubber measures 4 feet long by 11 inches high.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QgG7%2Bj5LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XTI15Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Game Table Accessories"]], "price": 64.99}}
