{"item_id": "B000XTPO2M", "title": "", "description": "The Master Lock 8291DPS Tuff Links keyed 3 foot chain lock offers you strong, reliable performance with a tough, square-linked, hardened steel chain that resists cutting. A nylon cover protects equipment and a disc key providing anti-picking resistance. A keyway cover keeps the lock core clean and dry from the elements. Tough enough to make any thief turn and run.", "text": "The Master Lock 8291DPS Tuff Links keyed 3 foot chain lock offers you strong, reliable performance with a tough, square-linked, hardened steel chain that resists cutting. A nylon cover protects equipment and a disc key providing anti-picking resistance. A keyway cover keeps the lock core clean and dry from the elements. Tough enough to make any thief turn and run.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PiW28AKCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XTPO2M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Exterior Accessories", "Towing Products & Winches", "Hitch Accessories", "Hitch Locks"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks"]], "price": 38.25}}
