{"item_id": "B000XU0NB8", "title": "Berkley Twist Lok Rod Rack", "description": "Keep your fishing rods safely and securely stowed with this rack from quality fishing tackle producer Berkley. The durable, lightweight device holds four rods in place with easy, simple twist rings and foam grip pads.WarrantyThis Berkley product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Berkley Twist Lok Rod Rack Keep your fishing rods safely and securely stowed with this rack from quality fishing tackle producer Berkley. The durable, lightweight device holds four rods in place with easy, simple twist rings and foam grip pads.WarrantyThis Berkley product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UhkxRGR%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XU0NB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Berkley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 15.15}}
{"item_id": "B000XUC11I", "title": "Lockjaw Olympic Barbell Collar", "description": "LOCK-JAW OLYMPIC LJC-OLY // 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar USE : Powerlifting, workouts where bar is not dropped* The Lock-Jaw Olympic Barbell Collar features a solid nylon resin frame and injection molded pressure pads, making it nearly unbreakable. The single- action cam lock securely clamps the collar once positioned on the bar. The original Lock-Jaw is the hands-down favorite collar of coaches, universities, and commercial gyms around the world. Designed to withstand the toughest workout environments, Innovative design, superior durability, and exceptional performance make the Lock-Jaw collar an excellent choice for any Olympic style bar *For use with rubber bumper plates, Olympic lifting, or CrossFit, we recommend the Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar for maximum performance. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT : 13.0 Ounces (0.80 lb. per set) DIMENSIONS : 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL : Proprietary Nylon Resin COLORS : Black, Red, Blue U.S. PATENT : #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY : 1-Year MASTER CARTON : 50 Sets", "text": "Lockjaw Olympic Barbell Collar LOCK-JAW OLYMPIC LJC-OLY // 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar USE : Powerlifting, workouts where bar is not dropped* The Lock-Jaw Olympic Barbell Collar features a solid nylon resin frame and injection molded pressure pads, making it nearly unbreakable. The single- action cam lock securely clamps the collar once positioned on the bar. The original Lock-Jaw is the hands-down favorite collar of coaches, universities, and commercial gyms around the world. Designed to withstand the toughest workout environments, Innovative design, superior durability, and exceptional performance make the Lock-Jaw collar an excellent choice for any Olympic style bar *For use with rubber bumper plates, Olympic lifting, or CrossFit, we recommend the Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar for maximum performance. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT : 13.0 Ounces (0.80 lb. per set) DIMENSIONS : 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL : Proprietary Nylon Resin COLORS : Black, Red, Blue U.S. PATENT : #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY : 1-Year MASTER CARTON : 50 Sets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rA79IkaKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XUC11I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lock-Jaw Collar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B000XUHKX2", "title": "Round Compression Stuff Sack by Granite Gear", "description": "A Granite Gear Classic. We designed these stuff sacks to easily compress lofty items such as sleeping bags and clothing to a nearly rock solid state. The unique design evenly distributes the stress of compression and prevents bulging. The original—often copied but never equaled. Accept no imitations! Colors: Assorted", "text": "Round Compression Stuff Sack by Granite Gear A Granite Gear Classic. We designed these stuff sacks to easily compress lofty items such as sleeping bags and clothing to a nearly rock solid state. The unique design evenly distributes the stress of compression and prevents bulging. The original—often copied but never equaled. Accept no imitations! Colors: Assorted", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wst9SI51L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XUHKX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Compression Sacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XUHNHA", "title": "Granite Gear Toughsack, Assorted", "description": "Our toughsacks are built with a tough 70 denier rip-stop with a white pigmented coating, so you can see into them more easily (this is the same proven fabric used in our Dry Sacks and Drylite compression sacks). They also feature Hypalon grommets which are lighter and hold up better than brass grommets.", "text": "Granite Gear Toughsack, Assorted Our toughsacks are built with a tough 70 denier rip-stop with a white pigmented coating, so you can see into them more easily (this is the same proven fabric used in our Dry Sacks and Drylite compression sacks). They also feature Hypalon grommets which are lighter and hold up better than brass grommets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-48pc3YWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XUHNHA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XXWVTW", "title": "Plastic 2-Piece Square Hockey Puck Holder", "description": "The BCW Puck Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene and features a 2 piece snap design. Use this puck holder to protect, store and display your collectibles.", "text": "Plastic 2-Piece Square Hockey Puck Holder The BCW Puck Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene and features a 2 piece snap design. Use this puck holder to protect, store and display your collectibles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318WW8Z1K2L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XXWVTW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BCW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Hockey Equipment", "Hockey Pucks"]], "price": 4.25}}
{"item_id": "B000XYN39I", "title": "Primus LiTech Coffee/Tea", "description": "Primus LiTech Coffee/Tea Kettle is extremely lightweight made of hard anodized aluminum. Folding handle for convenient pouring and storage. Comes in a handy net stuff sack and is ready to go.", "text": "Primus LiTech Coffee/Tea Primus LiTech Coffee/Tea Kettle is extremely lightweight made of hard anodized aluminum. Folding handle for convenient pouring and storage. Comes in a handy net stuff sack and is ready to go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wUsXdgHRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYN39I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XYQVBU", "title": "Nalgene ATB All-Terrain Bottle 22 Oz with Black Lid", "description": "The only guaranteed leak proof bike/fitness/sports bottle on the market. A Lexan mud cap keeps the drinking spout clean and the bottle neck is the same size as standard Nalgene wide mouth bottles so you can screw on water purifiers or use a standard Nalgene lid.", "text": "Nalgene ATB All-Terrain Bottle 22 Oz with Black Lid The only guaranteed leak proof bike/fitness/sports bottle on the market. A Lexan mud cap keeps the drinking spout clean and the bottle neck is the same size as standard Nalgene wide mouth bottles so you can screw on water purifiers or use a standard Nalgene lid.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qqBoxU3aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYQVBU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XYR02O", "title": "Primus Filling Adapter for Use with Butane Canisters", "description": "Primus filling adapter can easily be connected to the Primus Power single use LP gas cartridges. The filling adapter can be used to fill Primus PowerLighter and other refillable lighters.", "text": "Primus Filling Adapter for Use with Butane Canisters Primus filling adapter can easily be connected to the Primus Power single use LP gas cartridges. The filling adapter can be used to fill Primus PowerLighter and other refillable lighters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UYJQdekJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYR02O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 13.45}}
{"item_id": "B000XYUP1W", "title": "Primus Litech Ceramic Non-Stick Surface Frying Pan with Silicone Handles", "description": "Lightweight frying pan made from hard anodized aluminum with durable, non-stick, scratch resistant ceramic coating.", "text": "Primus Litech Ceramic Non-Stick Surface Frying Pan with Silicone Handles Lightweight frying pan made from hard anodized aluminum with durable, non-stick, scratch resistant ceramic coating.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-jqk2bSLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYUP1W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XYWLE6", "title": "Gear Aid ReviveX Nubuck, Suede & Fabric Water Repellent, 4-Ounce", "description": "When you need to waterproof hiking boots, protect suede shoes or weatherproof GORE-TEX footwear, only one water repellent will do. ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent by Gear Aid is the high-tech treatment for your high-tech footwear. It will safely waterproof nubuck, suede and waterproof-breathable boots and shoes to keep your feet looking good and feeling dry.When you’re enjoying the great outdoors, prevent your favorite hiking shoes and boots from getting wet, stained or haggard-looking. Just apply ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent and allow to dry overnight. They’ll be shedding water in no time flat.Keep your kicks dry with Gear Aid’s ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent.", "text": "Gear Aid ReviveX Nubuck, Suede & Fabric Water Repellent, 4-Ounce When you need to waterproof hiking boots, protect suede shoes or weatherproof GORE-TEX footwear, only one water repellent will do. ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent by Gear Aid is the high-tech treatment for your high-tech footwear. It will safely waterproof nubuck, suede and waterproof-breathable boots and shoes to keep your feet looking good and feeling dry.When you’re enjoying the great outdoors, prevent your favorite hiking shoes and boots from getting wet, stained or haggard-looking. Just apply ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent and allow to dry overnight. They’ll be shedding water in no time flat.Keep your kicks dry with Gear Aid’s ReviveX Nubuck, Suede and Fabric Water Repellent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q%2BPrbA-7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYWLE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 8.2}}
{"item_id": "B000XYWZYW", "title": "Neiko 53875B ANSI Z87.1 Anti-Fog Approved Wide-Vision Extra-Soft Lab Safety Goggle", "description": "Neiko Pro Extra Soft Wide Vision Safety Goggle, Wrap-around soft PVC frame offers maximum comfort without sacrificing safety. High-impact polycarbonate lens protects against flying debris. Anti-Dust and Anti-Splash indirect vents, Extra-Wide adjustable headband provides secure and comfortable fit while preventing slippage. Extra Wide Angle Vision Design, Conforms to ANSI Z87.1.", "text": "Neiko 53875B ANSI Z87.1 Anti-Fog Approved Wide-Vision Extra-Soft Lab Safety Goggle Neiko Pro Extra Soft Wide Vision Safety Goggle, Wrap-around soft PVC frame offers maximum comfort without sacrificing safety. High-impact polycarbonate lens protects against flying debris. Anti-Dust and Anti-Splash indirect vents, Extra-Wide adjustable headband provides secure and comfortable fit while preventing slippage. Extra Wide Angle Vision Design, Conforms to ANSI Z87.1.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51L-EfKLPvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XYWZYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neiko", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000XZ13UI", "title": "Nathan Streak Reflective Vest", "description": "Created for runners who find most vests uncomfortable or performance debilitating, the Nathan Streak reflective vest is ultra lightweight and incredibly comfortable. The vest is made of a soft, lightweight, breathable mesh that's designed to allow a full range of motion and is guaranteed not to ride up. It's almost like wearing nothing at all. At the same time, the 400-candlepower vest offers 360-degree visibility at distances of up to 1,200 feet, so drivers, cyclists, and other runners can see you clearly after the sun sets. The adjustable-fit vest also includes large reflective patches on the chest and waist and reflective strips on the shoulders.", "text": "Nathan Streak Reflective Vest Created for runners who find most vests uncomfortable or performance debilitating, the Nathan Streak reflective vest is ultra lightweight and incredibly comfortable. The vest is made of a soft, lightweight, breathable mesh that's designed to allow a full range of motion and is guaranteed not to ride up. It's almost like wearing nothing at all. At the same time, the 400-candlepower vest offers 360-degree visibility at distances of up to 1,200 feet, so drivers, cyclists, and other runners can see you clearly after the sun sets. The adjustable-fit vest also includes large reflective patches on the chest and waist and reflective strips on the shoulders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51l3umfzVOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XZ13UI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000XZ5FDY", "title": "Optimus Svea Stove", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Optimus Svea Stove Ideal for single users and high altitude cooking Burns white gas for maximum efficiency at higher altitudes and cold temperatures Lid duals as a small cooking pot No pump priming necessary The SPECS of the Optimus Svea Stove Fuel: White gasoline Weight: 19 oz / 550 g Measurements: 10 x 10 x 13 mm / 3.9 x 3.9 x 5.1\" Rating: 1400 W / 4780 BTU Burn Time: Up to 50 minutes on one filling (.12 L / 4 fl. oz) at maximum output Boil Time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Approximately 7 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Optimus Svea Stove DECENT FEATURES of the Optimus Svea Stove Ideal for single users and high altitude cooking Burns white gas for maximum efficiency at higher altitudes and cold temperatures Lid duals as a small cooking pot No pump priming necessary The SPECS of the Optimus Svea Stove Fuel: White gasoline Weight: 19 oz / 550 g Measurements: 10 x 10 x 13 mm / 3.9 x 3.9 x 5.1\" Rating: 1400 W / 4780 BTU Burn Time: Up to 50 minutes on one filling (.12 L / 4 fl. oz) at maximum output Boil Time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Approximately 7 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B9dD0KDlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000XZ5FDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 89.97}}
{"item_id": "B000Y09TVW", "title": "Tasco Rimfire 3-7x 20mm 30/30 Reticle Riflescope", "description": "Equip your small caliber for big time precision and plinking enjoyment with a Tasco Rimfire series riflescope. An affordable accuracy upgrade, they're specially calibrated for shorter distances and feature coated optics for bright clear images.", "text": "Tasco Rimfire 3-7x 20mm 30/30 Reticle Riflescope Equip your small caliber for big time precision and plinking enjoyment with a Tasco Rimfire series riflescope. An affordable accuracy upgrade, they're specially calibrated for shorter distances and feature coated optics for bright clear images.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DDeNDIQDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y09TVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 23.87}}
{"item_id": "B000Y09Y0S", "title": "12 Childrens Mesh Sports Practice Team Jerseys - Pinnies", "description": "MESH SCRIMMAGE JERSEYS - low price! 12 - Nylon Mesh Scrimmage Jerseys 6 Red and 6 blue jerseys Youth / CHILD size. (up to age 12 approximately) 42\" chest Great for school gym or practice! Brand new in package! Lightweight breathable mesh is perfect for summer sports!", "text": "12 Childrens Mesh Sports Practice Team Jerseys - Pinnies MESH SCRIMMAGE JERSEYS - low price! 12 - Nylon Mesh Scrimmage Jerseys 6 Red and 6 blue jerseys Youth / CHILD size. (up to age 12 approximately) 42\" chest Great for school gym or practice! Brand new in package! Lightweight breathable mesh is perfect for summer sports!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DFLiXJhHL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y09Y0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fun Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball"]], "price": 14.33}}
{"item_id": "B000Y0A8VC", "title": "Women's Padded Classic Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking", "description": "", "text": "Women's Padded Classic Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qTmsXRUzL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y0A8VC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Petite"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B000Y0ZBSM", "title": "Blongo Ball Complete Game Set", "description": "Liven up your camping trips and family reunions with this full BlongoBall set. Appropriate for use both outdoors and indoors, BlongoBall combines elements from bocce, horseshoes, croquet, and other lawn sports, but adds a unique twist: rather than throwing a ball or a shoe, you throw a BlongoBall, which is technically two small spheres connected by a thin stretch of rope. The goal is to wrap your BlongoBall around one of the horizontal bars of the BlonGoal, which stands 25 feet away (or less if kids are playing). Players score one, two, or three points with a successful throw, depending on which bar the BlongoBall grabs. And the game ends when one person or team reaches 21 points exactly. You can even add a bit of defensive strategy to the game by trying to knock your opponent's BlongoBalls off the bars.BlongoBall is fun for kids and families, but it's also great for physical education classes, teambuilding games, or even as a rehab tool in a therapy setting. The BlongoBall set comes with two BlonGoals and two sets of BlongoBalls. Players can also purchase such accessories as extra BlongoBalls, a carrying bag, and a portable score tower.About BlongoBallMike Long and his wife, Roberta, were early retirees who spent much of their time fishing, hunting, rafting, boating, and RVing. When Mike was introduced to the rudimentary concept of BlongoBall, he decided that the game merited serious development and investigation. Mike built the prototype game and used all of his friends as test subjects. BlongoBall was tested on the beaches of Lake Powell, on raft trips on the Salmon River, on the beaches of San Diego, and in parks and campgrounds form the southwest to the northwest. In every location, passersby would stop and interrupt the games to find out where they could buy BlongoBall. The enthusiastic response encouraged Mike to continue to refine the rules and goal configurations.After months of design, research and testing, Mike applied for and received a patent for BlongoBall, which has been enthusiastically received by kids and adults of all ages since its release. Founded in 2004, BlongoBall is located in Spokane, Washington.", "text": "Blongo Ball Complete Game Set Liven up your camping trips and family reunions with this full BlongoBall set. Appropriate for use both outdoors and indoors, BlongoBall combines elements from bocce, horseshoes, croquet, and other lawn sports, but adds a unique twist: rather than throwing a ball or a shoe, you throw a BlongoBall, which is technically two small spheres connected by a thin stretch of rope. The goal is to wrap your BlongoBall around one of the horizontal bars of the BlonGoal, which stands 25 feet away (or less if kids are playing). Players score one, two, or three points with a successful throw, depending on which bar the BlongoBall grabs. And the game ends when one person or team reaches 21 points exactly. You can even add a bit of defensive strategy to the game by trying to knock your opponent's BlongoBalls off the bars.BlongoBall is fun for kids and families, but it's also great for physical education classes, teambuilding games, or even as a rehab tool in a therapy setting. The BlongoBall set comes with two BlonGoals and two sets of BlongoBalls. Players can also purchase such accessories as extra BlongoBalls, a carrying bag, and a portable score tower.About BlongoBallMike Long and his wife, Roberta, were early retirees who spent much of their time fishing, hunting, rafting, boating, and RVing. When Mike was introduced to the rudimentary concept of BlongoBall, he decided that the game merited serious development and investigation. Mike built the prototype game and used all of his friends as test subjects. BlongoBall was tested on the beaches of Lake Powell, on raft trips on the Salmon River, on the beaches of San Diego, and in parks and campgrounds form the southwest to the northwest. In every location, passersby would stop and interrupt the games to find out where they could buy BlongoBall. The enthusiastic response encouraged Mike to continue to refine the rules and goal configurations.After months of design, research and testing, Mike applied for and received a patent for BlongoBall, which has been enthusiastically received by kids and adults of all ages since its release. Founded in 2004, BlongoBall is located in Spokane, Washington.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419E0SqOI6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y0ZBSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blongo Family Fun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Sets"]], "price": 69.95}}
