{"item_id": "B000Y9BRCM", "title": "Emergency Shelter Tent, Reflective Tube Tent, Cold Weather Emergency Shelter, Emergency Zone Brand", "description": "Emergency Zone? Brand. The Emergency Tent is a lightweight and compact emergency shelter. It is wind and waterproof and easy to set up. It is 8 feet long and roomy enough for two people.", "text": "Emergency Shelter Tent, Reflective Tube Tent, Cold Weather Emergency Shelter, Emergency Zone Brand Emergency Zone? Brand. The Emergency Tent is a lightweight and compact emergency shelter. It is wind and waterproof and easy to set up. It is 8 feet long and roomy enough for two people.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511FuhQRwZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9BRCM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9EZMQ", "title": "Folding Camping Stove (with 24 Fuel Tablets), Emergency Stove, Emergency Heat", "description": "This pocket sized stove is perfect for hikers looking for compact and light weight option for cooking outdoors. The 24 hexamine tablets are made into small pieces, so you can use just enough to cook your food. With the entire stove and fuel folding down to a 4.75\" x 3.75\" x 1.25\" it literally fits your back pocket. Perfect for hiking, backpacking, emergency kits, etc.", "text": "Folding Camping Stove (with 24 Fuel Tablets), Emergency Stove, Emergency Heat This pocket sized stove is perfect for hikers looking for compact and light weight option for cooking outdoors. The 24 hexamine tablets are made into small pieces, so you can use just enough to cook your food. With the entire stove and fuel folding down to a 4.75\" x 3.75\" x 1.25\" it literally fits your back pocket. Perfect for hiking, backpacking, emergency kits, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51in%2BOwBEML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9EZMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 5.22}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9EZNA", "title": "Stainless Steel Sierra Cup", "description": "Emergency Zone Brand, This stainless steel Sierra Cup is lightweight and durable. It can be used with the Mini Folding Stove to heat water. It is perfect for camping or as part of an emergency kit. The handle folds for compact storage.", "text": "Stainless Steel Sierra Cup Emergency Zone Brand, This stainless steel Sierra Cup is lightweight and durable. It can be used with the Mini Folding Stove to heat water. It is perfect for camping or as part of an emergency kit. The handle folds for compact storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OFCfEFvNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9EZNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 9.38}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9H09Q", "title": "Emergency Sleeping Bag, Survival Bag, Emergency Zone Brand, Reflective Blanket", "description": "Emergency Zone Brand. The Emergency Sleeping Bag is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a sleeping bag to prevent heat loss even more efficiently. The bag retains 80 percent of body heat and is wind and waterproof. The bag measures 36 x 84 inches.", "text": "Emergency Sleeping Bag, Survival Bag, Emergency Zone Brand, Reflective Blanket Emergency Zone Brand. The Emergency Sleeping Bag is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a sleeping bag to prevent heat loss even more efficiently. The bag retains 80 percent of body heat and is wind and waterproof. The bag measures 36 x 84 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51caRXqKasL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9H09Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9H0BO", "title": "Children's Emergency Poncho, Weather Protection, Rain Gear, Emergency Zone? Brand", "description": "Emergency Zone Brand. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This is a smaller size for children measuring 40 x 33 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "text": "Children's Emergency Poncho, Weather Protection, Rain Gear, Emergency Zone? Brand Emergency Zone Brand. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This is a smaller size for children measuring 40 x 33 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41071Q9o9ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9H0BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9IUXG", "title": "Emergency Poncho, Emergency Rain Gear, Weather Protection, Emergency Zone® Brand", "description": "Emergency Zone Brand. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This adult sized poncho measures 50 x 80 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "text": "Emergency Poncho, Emergency Rain Gear, Weather Protection, Emergency Zone® Brand Emergency Zone Brand. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This adult sized poncho measures 50 x 80 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512gdMGr0GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9IUXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Y9IV3A", "title": "Lexan 3pc Camping Utensil Set", "description": "The Lexan 3pc camping utensil set is not simply plastic, they are made of Lexan, which is lightweight and virtually indestructible. It has smooth edges that give it a more comfortable feel and includes a locking ring to keep the utensils together, so you're less likely to lose them.", "text": "Lexan 3pc Camping Utensil Set The Lexan 3pc camping utensil set is not simply plastic, they are made of Lexan, which is lightweight and virtually indestructible. It has smooth edges that give it a more comfortable feel and includes a locking ring to keep the utensils together, so you're less likely to lose them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414AwSTSHAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Y9IV3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YA1DS4", "title": "Lowepro Flipside 200 Backpack-Black", "description": "Flipside 200Manufacturer Description:The compact, lightweight design of the Flipside 200 backpack lets you carry your digital SLR without worry. The unique back compartment entry gives you safe, easy access to camera gear when you're setting up plus extra security when you're on the move. Outer storage panels keep digital accessories and personal items close at hand.Hardware Capacity:1 DSLR with 80-200mm f/2.8 lens attached plus 1-3 additional lenses or flash units, 1 tripod, multiple cables, memory cards, manuals and other digital accessories.Flipside 200 Highlights:1. Back Entry CompartmentProvides easy access to equipment as well as extra security when pack is being worn2. Outer Storage PanelsCentralizes digital accessories and personal gear for handy access3. Hideaway Tripod HolderCarries a compact tripod or monopod when you need it and easily concealed when you don't4. Removable Accessory PouchAllows you to take cables, chargers, manuals and other key accessories with you when you need them or easily left behind when you don't5. Detachable Waist Belt and Adjustable Sternum StrapHelps to stabilize pack, distribute weight evenly and ensure carrying comfort when you need it6. Mesh Side PocketKeeps a water bottle or other personal items readily accessible7. SlipLock Accessory LoopsExpand carrying capability via SlipLock compatible pouches8. Tough, Water Resistant Outer FabricProtects against moisture and abrasion", "text": "Lowepro Flipside 200 Backpack-Black Flipside 200Manufacturer Description:The compact, lightweight design of the Flipside 200 backpack lets you carry your digital SLR without worry. The unique back compartment entry gives you safe, easy access to camera gear when you're setting up plus extra security when you're on the move. Outer storage panels keep digital accessories and personal items close at hand.Hardware Capacity:1 DSLR with 80-200mm f/2.8 lens attached plus 1-3 additional lenses or flash units, 1 tripod, multiple cables, memory cards, manuals and other digital accessories.Flipside 200 Highlights:1. Back Entry CompartmentProvides easy access to equipment as well as extra security when pack is being worn2. Outer Storage PanelsCentralizes digital accessories and personal gear for handy access3. Hideaway Tripod HolderCarries a compact tripod or monopod when you need it and easily concealed when you don't4. Removable Accessory PouchAllows you to take cables, chargers, manuals and other key accessories with you when you need them or easily left behind when you don't5. Detachable Waist Belt and Adjustable Sternum StrapHelps to stabilize pack, distribute weight evenly and ensure carrying comfort when you need it6. Mesh Side PocketKeeps a water bottle or other personal items readily accessible7. SlipLock Accessory LoopsExpand carrying capability via SlipLock compatible pouches8. Tough, Water Resistant Outer FabricProtects against moisture and abrasion", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eDuObfhOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YA1DS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lowepro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YA33DC", "title": "Lowepro Flipside 300 Backpack (Black)", "description": "Flipside 300Manufacturer Description:The compact, lightweight design of the Flipside 300 backpack lets you carry your pro digital SLR without worry. The unique back compartment entry gives you safe, easy access to camera gear when you're setting up plus extra security when you're on the move. Outer storage panels keep digital accessories and personal items close at hand.Hardware Capacity:1 Pro DSLR with 300mm f/2.8 lens attached plus 1-3 additional lenses or flash units, 1 tripod, multiple cables, memory cards, manuals and other digital accessories.Flipside 300 Highlights:1. Back Entry CompartmentProvides easy access to equipment as well as extra security when pack is being worn2. Outer Storage PanelsCentralizes digital accessories and personal gear for handy access3. Hideaway Tripod HolderCarries a compact tripod or monopod when you need it and easily concealed when you don't4. Removable Accessory PouchAllows you to take cables, chargers, manuals and other key accessories with you when you need them or easily left behind when you don't5. Detachable Waist Belt and Adjustable Sternum StrapHelps to stabilize pack, distribute weight evenly and ensure carrying comfort when you need it6. Mesh Side PocketKeeps a water bottle or other personal items readily accessible7. SlipLock Accessory LoopsExpand carrying capability via SlipLock compatible pouches8. Tough, Water Resistant Outer FabricProtects against moisture and abrasion", "text": "Lowepro Flipside 300 Backpack (Black) Flipside 300Manufacturer Description:The compact, lightweight design of the Flipside 300 backpack lets you carry your pro digital SLR without worry. The unique back compartment entry gives you safe, easy access to camera gear when you're setting up plus extra security when you're on the move. Outer storage panels keep digital accessories and personal items close at hand.Hardware Capacity:1 Pro DSLR with 300mm f/2.8 lens attached plus 1-3 additional lenses or flash units, 1 tripod, multiple cables, memory cards, manuals and other digital accessories.Flipside 300 Highlights:1. Back Entry CompartmentProvides easy access to equipment as well as extra security when pack is being worn2. Outer Storage PanelsCentralizes digital accessories and personal gear for handy access3. Hideaway Tripod HolderCarries a compact tripod or monopod when you need it and easily concealed when you don't4. Removable Accessory PouchAllows you to take cables, chargers, manuals and other key accessories with you when you need them or easily left behind when you don't5. Detachable Waist Belt and Adjustable Sternum StrapHelps to stabilize pack, distribute weight evenly and ensure carrying comfort when you need it6. Mesh Side PocketKeeps a water bottle or other personal items readily accessible7. SlipLock Accessory LoopsExpand carrying capability via SlipLock compatible pouches8. Tough, Water Resistant Outer FabricProtects against moisture and abrasion", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xXwAJXdZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YA33DC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lowepro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 72.0}}
