{"item_id": "B000YA8X7S", "title": "US NAVY 6\" indoor/outdoor brass bell with wall mount", "description": "This is a solid brass ship's bell, 6\" wide across the mouth. The bell itself stands another 6\" tall, with a total height of 8\" from additional height from the wall mount when mounted. It is of a heavy enough gauge of brass to be able to be used both indoor or out. The clapper is also made of solid brass with a beautifully knotted rope bell pull attached to it.The bell has a nice, sharp edge to the top of the bell and decorative pinstripes along the lower edge that contrasts well with the clean curve of the rest of the bell. 'U.S. Navy' is deeply engraved into the side of the bell.This beautiful bell is new, with no problems.", "text": "US NAVY 6\" indoor/outdoor brass bell with wall mount This is a solid brass ship's bell, 6\" wide across the mouth. The bell itself stands another 6\" tall, with a total height of 8\" from additional height from the wall mount when mounted. It is of a heavy enough gauge of brass to be able to be used both indoor or out. The clapper is also made of solid brass with a beautifully knotted rope bell pull attached to it.The bell has a nice, sharp edge to the top of the bell and decorative pinstripes along the lower edge that contrasts well with the clean curve of the rest of the bell. 'U.S. Navy' is deeply engraved into the side of the bell.This beautiful bell is new, with no problems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p4XAFOOuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YA8X7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ITDC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Bells"]], "price": 26.89}}
{"item_id": "B000YADEOK", "title": "Moultrie Game Spy I-40 Infrared Flash Game Camera", "description": "Made by Moultrie, this camouflaged, rapid-trigger game camera can take 4-megapixel color pictures by day and video clips at any hour. The camera's rapid response time effectively captures moving game, and its 50-foot infrared flash produces clear pictures, without white spots. The camera operates on six D batteries and boasts a battery life of 150 days. Its airtight, weather-resistant construction includes a mounting strap and an external power port for an optional 12-volt battery. The camera is also equipped with an easy-to-operate LCD display that shows the remaining battery life, the number of pictures taken and remaining, and other information.The camera has 32 MB of internal memory and the capacity to add up to 4 GB more using an SD card (sold separately). Photos and videos are date- and time-stamped. The product weighs 2.5 pounds and comes with a camera activator and six D batteries.Manufacturer's WarrantyMoultrie products are covered under a limited one-year warranty. This warranty includes one-year repair or replacement service on the product from the date of purchase. It does not cover items that have been abused or previously repaired by someone other than Moultrie Feeders.About MoultrieMoultrie Feeders has been bringing you innovative game management products for more than 25 years. Every product that bears the Moultrie name has been thoughtfully designed and engineered, from its popular deer feeders to its ATV sprayers and game cameras. Whether you're looking for new solutions for land management or a digital trail camera to help you scout your hunting area, Moultrie has what you need to meet your goals.What's in the Box?Infrared flash game camera and 6 D batteries", "text": "Moultrie Game Spy I-40 Infrared Flash Game Camera Made by Moultrie, this camouflaged, rapid-trigger game camera can take 4-megapixel color pictures by day and video clips at any hour. The camera's rapid response time effectively captures moving game, and its 50-foot infrared flash produces clear pictures, without white spots. The camera operates on six D batteries and boasts a battery life of 150 days. Its airtight, weather-resistant construction includes a mounting strap and an external power port for an optional 12-volt battery. The camera is also equipped with an easy-to-operate LCD display that shows the remaining battery life, the number of pictures taken and remaining, and other information.The camera has 32 MB of internal memory and the capacity to add up to 4 GB more using an SD card (sold separately). Photos and videos are date- and time-stamped. The product weighs 2.5 pounds and comes with a camera activator and six D batteries.Manufacturer's WarrantyMoultrie products are covered under a limited one-year warranty. This warranty includes one-year repair or replacement service on the product from the date of purchase. It does not cover items that have been abused or previously repaired by someone other than Moultrie Feeders.About MoultrieMoultrie Feeders has been bringing you innovative game management products for more than 25 years. Every product that bears the Moultrie name has been thoughtfully designed and engineered, from its popular deer feeders to its ATV sprayers and game cameras. Whether you're looking for new solutions for land management or a digital trail camera to help you scout your hunting area, Moultrie has what you need to meet your goals.What's in the Box?Infrared flash game camera and 6 D batteries", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xwJrYYL5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YADEOK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000YAXRJC", "title": "880 Powerline Kit, Dark Brown/Black, 37.6 Inch", "description": "The 880 Shadow Plus kit from Daisy comes with everything you need to begin target practice right out of the box. The multi-pump, pneumatic 880 air rifle shoots BBs at an impressive 750 feet per second and pellets at 715 feet per second. Power and velocity are easy to adjust by the number of pumps you put into the rifle. The 880 boasts classic looks and comfort with a synthetic molded wood-grain Monte Carlo stock with a raised cheekpiece and deep checkering on the grip and forearm. The set comes ready to go with paper targets, safety glasses, a 4x15-millimeter scope with rings (unmounted), 500 Daisy pellets, and 1,050 BBs.What's in the Box?880 air rifle, paper targets, safety glasses, 4x15-millimeter scope with rings, 500 Daisy pellets, 1,050 BBs", "text": "880 Powerline Kit, Dark Brown/Black, 37.6 Inch The 880 Shadow Plus kit from Daisy comes with everything you need to begin target practice right out of the box. The multi-pump, pneumatic 880 air rifle shoots BBs at an impressive 750 feet per second and pellets at 715 feet per second. Power and velocity are easy to adjust by the number of pumps you put into the rifle. The 880 boasts classic looks and comfort with a synthetic molded wood-grain Monte Carlo stock with a raised cheekpiece and deep checkering on the grip and forearm. The set comes ready to go with paper targets, safety glasses, a 4x15-millimeter scope with rings (unmounted), 500 Daisy pellets, and 1,050 BBs.What's in the Box?880 air rifle, paper targets, safety glasses, 4x15-millimeter scope with rings, 500 Daisy pellets, 1,050 BBs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hKFPZENDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YAXRJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B000YB31II", "title": "Shimano PD-A520 Sport SPD Pedal", "description": "The Shimano PD-A520 SPD is a lightweight, single-entry pedal that works with SPD and recessed SPD shoes. Entry and release tensions settings are totally adjustable based on your riding style, and the sealed cartridge axle unit means maintenance is practically nonexistent.FeaturesChromoly spindleRecessed SPD cleat for efficient cyclingAdjustable entry and releaseLow maintenance sealed cartridge axle unitNo floatWarrantyThis Shimano product includes a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Shimano PD-A520 Sport SPD Pedal The Shimano PD-A520 SPD is a lightweight, single-entry pedal that works with SPD and recessed SPD shoes. Entry and release tensions settings are totally adjustable based on your riding style, and the sealed cartridge axle unit means maintenance is practically nonexistent.FeaturesChromoly spindleRecessed SPD cleat for efficient cyclingAdjustable entry and releaseLow maintenance sealed cartridge axle unitNo floatWarrantyThis Shimano product includes a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NfyjXoo5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YB31II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 52.49}}
{"item_id": "B000YB6QK8", "title": "Polar Bear Coolers 48 Pack Soft Cooler", "description": "Nothing keeps cool like a Polar Bear. Built for the outdoor enthusiast, our quality product will be there for you when you need it. We stand behind our product with a one-year warranty against manufacture defects. We are confident you will enjoy years of performance from your Polar Bear.", "text": "Polar Bear Coolers 48 Pack Soft Cooler Nothing keeps cool like a Polar Bear. Built for the outdoor enthusiast, our quality product will be there for you when you need it. We stand behind our product with a one-year warranty against manufacture defects. We are confident you will enjoy years of performance from your Polar Bear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aZanh80fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YB6QK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Polar Bear Coolers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 92.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YBAKUU", "title": "Bike Tool - Park Tool - Park 4 Sided Spoke Wrench", "description": "Unique four-sided design provides extra strength and support and helps prevent slipping and deformation of aluminum nipples. Uses the same world famous design and high quality materials as our three-sided spoke wrenches.Four-sided design for strength and supportVinyl-dipped handle for excellent gripHigh strength design and materials like Park Tool's 3-sided spoke wrenchesSturd, reliable Park Tool qualityColor coded a unique color differing from the SW-42", "text": "Bike Tool - Park Tool - Park 4 Sided Spoke Wrench Unique four-sided design provides extra strength and support and helps prevent slipping and deformation of aluminum nipples. Uses the same world famous design and high quality materials as our three-sided spoke wrenches.Four-sided design for strength and supportVinyl-dipped handle for excellent gripHigh strength design and materials like Park Tool's 3-sided spoke wrenchesSturd, reliable Park Tool qualityColor coded a unique color differing from the SW-42", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418oY-%2BARaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBAKUU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000YBCNAA", "title": "Shimano SGS Top normal Shadow Rear Derailleur", "description": "", "text": "Shimano SGS Top normal Shadow Rear Derailleur", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rG7aJ7fDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBCNAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Rear Derailleurs"]], "price": 87.98}}
{"item_id": "B000YBCODG", "title": "Schwalbe Marathon Winter HS 396 Studded Mountain Bicycle Tire - Wire Bead", "description": "For a safer journey. You have full control on icy roads with the Marathon Winter. Even in tight bends and under violent braking everything remains under control. The spikes work best on ice when running at minimum pressure, while at maximum pressure the tires can be ridden on ice-free roads with minimal road noise. Tires need to be run-in for 25 miles / 40 km on hard-top road to ensure spikes are permanently fixed. Avoid rapid acceleration and braking during this period. Tungsten carbide core spikes have a wear life of several thousand kilometers.", "text": "Schwalbe Marathon Winter HS 396 Studded Mountain Bicycle Tire - Wire Bead For a safer journey. You have full control on icy roads with the Marathon Winter. Even in tight bends and under violent braking everything remains under control. The spikes work best on ice when running at minimum pressure, while at maximum pressure the tires can be ridden on ice-free roads with minimal road noise. Tires need to be run-in for 25 miles / 40 km on hard-top road to ensure spikes are permanently fixed. Avoid rapid acceleration and braking during this period. Tungsten carbide core spikes have a wear life of several thousand kilometers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HQSVzUVYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBCODG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
