{"item_id": "B000YBEID0", "title": "Park Tool PW-5 Home Mechanic Pedal Wrench", "description": "The PW-5 is perfect for the home workshop or event tool box. Although economically priced, this 15mm pedal wrench, like all Park Tool products, is built to last. Made from heat-treated spring steel and vinyl dipped for comfort. 11 1/2” (29 cm) long.", "text": "Park Tool PW-5 Home Mechanic Pedal Wrench The PW-5 is perfect for the home workshop or event tool box. Although economically priced, this 15mm pedal wrench, like all Park Tool products, is built to last. Made from heat-treated spring steel and vinyl dipped for comfort. 11 1/2” (29 cm) long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uGk6ICHrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBEID0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 10.76}}
