{"item_id": "B000YBHONG", "title": "Sunlite Mesh Bottom Bicycle Lift Off Basket, Black", "description": "Powder coated steel construction. Removable quick release bracket. Mesh bottom. Handlebar mount. 13-1/2\" x 9-7/8\" x 9.5\".", "text": "Sunlite Mesh Bottom Bicycle Lift Off Basket, Black Powder coated steel construction. Removable quick release bracket. Mesh bottom. Handlebar mount. 13-1/2\" x 9-7/8\" x 9.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rGtaCVrhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBHONG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YBHOOA", "title": "Park Tool Spoke Wrench for Mavic Wheel Systems - SW-13", "description": "Take control of those pesky Mavic spoke nipple systems with the Park Tool SW-13 Spoke Wrench. The small end accommodates integrated nipples with the 5.65mm OD splines and 7mm threaded nipples. The large end fits the 9mm spline OD eyelets of 'FORE drilled rim adapters' used on the XM819, EX823, and Speedcity wheels.Product FeaturesTire Levers:Spoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools: Mavic specialty spoke toolWeight:Recommended Use: wheel building, truing, maintenanceManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Park Tool Spoke Wrench for Mavic Wheel Systems - SW-13 Take control of those pesky Mavic spoke nipple systems with the Park Tool SW-13 Spoke Wrench. The small end accommodates integrated nipples with the 5.65mm OD splines and 7mm threaded nipples. The large end fits the 9mm spline OD eyelets of 'FORE drilled rim adapters' used on the XM819, EX823, and Speedcity wheels.Product FeaturesTire Levers:Spoke Wrench:Hub Tool:Cassette Tool:Chain Tool:Headset Tool:Crank Puller:BB Tool:Cable Cutters:Box End Wrench:Hex Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools: Mavic specialty spoke toolWeight:Recommended Use: wheel building, truing, maintenanceManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/214whK8J2KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YBHOOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 11.24}}
{"item_id": "B000YCJQP4", "title": "United Cutlery UC1480 Deluxe Japanese Sword Care Kit", "description": "The major purpose for sword care is to make sure the blade does not oxide or rust. Kit includes brass awl/hammer to easily dismantle the sword, rice papers for cleaning oil from the blade, extra large uchiko powder ball, bottle of chojil oil to prevent rusting, plastic container to store an oiled cloth, and a parchment certificate/care sheet.", "text": "United Cutlery UC1480 Deluxe Japanese Sword Care Kit The major purpose for sword care is to make sure the blade does not oxide or rust. Kit includes brass awl/hammer to easily dismantle the sword, rice papers for cleaning oil from the blade, extra large uchiko powder ball, bottle of chojil oil to prevent rusting, plastic container to store an oiled cloth, and a parchment certificate/care sheet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gL2HfC7dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YCJQP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YD6GQU", "title": "Columbia River Knife And Tool M16-01Z EDC (Every Day Carry) 3-inch Zytel Grey Folding Knife with Autolawk and Spear Point Razor Edge Blade, 7.125-inch Total Length", "description": "Here is Kit Carson's M16® Every Day Carry (EDC) with our Zytel® InterFrame build. Our knife users told us, \"We want an affordable work knife that we can give hard use without feeling guilty, and one that won't break us up if we leave it on a job site or drop it in the river.\" We heard you. So we set about to make the Zytel EDC the best value in the work and sport knife world. That starts with textured Zytel® scales and a dual 2CR13 stainless steel liner InterFrame. Assembled with Zytel back spacers and Torx® fasteners, the result is amazingly rigid. Zytel is a fiberglass-filled nylon that offers excellent toughness and resistance to solvents. Lubrous washers at the blade pivot and an adjustable pivot screw allow for perfect blade action. The blade is 8CR15MoV high-carbon stainless steel which gives an ideal combination of toughness and edge-holding ability in a work knife, and also allows easy field-sharpening. Standard models have a bead-blast finish. The M16®-01Z uses our popular spear point slim profile blade with a Razor-Sharp edge. It is ideal for fine cutting and carving tasks. Of course, it features the Carson Flipper, which speeds opening of the blade and acts as a blade guard when the blade is open. The real breakthrough was our ability to engineer our patented* AutoLAWKS™ knife safety into all models, which automatically actuates when the blades are open, making these folders into virtual fixed blades when locked. Add to these features the standard removable stainless steel clothing/gear clip plus the CRKT limited lifetime warranty, and you have one of the truly great knife values of our time. *U.S. Patent Nos. 5,596,808 and 7,437,822", "text": "Columbia River Knife And Tool M16-01Z EDC (Every Day Carry) 3-inch Zytel Grey Folding Knife with Autolawk and Spear Point Razor Edge Blade, 7.125-inch Total Length Here is Kit Carson's M16® Every Day Carry (EDC) with our Zytel® InterFrame build. Our knife users told us, \"We want an affordable work knife that we can give hard use without feeling guilty, and one that won't break us up if we leave it on a job site or drop it in the river.\" We heard you. So we set about to make the Zytel EDC the best value in the work and sport knife world. That starts with textured Zytel® scales and a dual 2CR13 stainless steel liner InterFrame. Assembled with Zytel back spacers and Torx® fasteners, the result is amazingly rigid. Zytel is a fiberglass-filled nylon that offers excellent toughness and resistance to solvents. Lubrous washers at the blade pivot and an adjustable pivot screw allow for perfect blade action. The blade is 8CR15MoV high-carbon stainless steel which gives an ideal combination of toughness and edge-holding ability in a work knife, and also allows easy field-sharpening. Standard models have a bead-blast finish. The M16®-01Z uses our popular spear point slim profile blade with a Razor-Sharp edge. It is ideal for fine cutting and carving tasks. Of course, it features the Carson Flipper, which speeds opening of the blade and acts as a blade guard when the blade is open. The real breakthrough was our ability to engineer our patented* AutoLAWKS™ knife safety into all models, which automatically actuates when the blades are open, making these folders into virtual fixed blades when locked. Add to these features the standard removable stainless steel clothing/gear clip plus the CRKT limited lifetime warranty, and you have one of the truly great knife values of our time. *U.S. Patent Nos. 5,596,808 and 7,437,822", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AUOks%2BkfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YD6GQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 25.3}}
{"item_id": "B000YDK968", "title": "Sweat GUTR Sweatband", "description": "", "text": "Sweat GUTR Sweatband", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21HsWDz0EQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YDK968.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sweat GUTR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YDMPQA", "title": "White Lightning Wash & Shine Biodegradable Bike Wash & Cleaner, 32-Ounce Spray Bottle", "description": "Wash & Shine quickly loosens, lifts and removes dirt, grime, mud, and dust form your bike, and is intended for use as a \"maintenance cleaner,\" sprayed onto your bike after dirty rides or as needed. Simply let it soak in for a few moments and then rag wipe or rinse off with a hose. The product is an advanced, 100% biodegradable, solvent-free formulation, safe for all parts of your bike. Carnauba wax in the mix also leaves a protective film and sharp-looking shine. In addition to keeping your bike looking new, Wash & Shine can also be used to clean dirt bikes, ATVs, snowmobiles, boats, lawn and garden equipment, camping gear, kitchen appliances, counter tops, and more.About White LightningIn 1994, retired research chemist Paul Maples was determined to find a way to end the messy inconvenience and performance inefficiencies caused by the dirt, grease, and grime build up on his bike chain. He set out to develop the first and only chain lube that would \"self-clean,\" which he dubbed Clean Ride. The product actually repels and sheds dirt and grime from your chain and parts while you ride, and was so unique it was awarded four U.S. patents. In 2000, Paul sold White Lightning to Hank Krause, who had been developing performance bicycle lubricants since the mid 1980s. Krausse and his team took over, and -- with continued collaboration from Maples -- the result has been a steadily growing line of bike maintenance products.", "text": "White Lightning Wash & Shine Biodegradable Bike Wash & Cleaner, 32-Ounce Spray Bottle Wash & Shine quickly loosens, lifts and removes dirt, grime, mud, and dust form your bike, and is intended for use as a \"maintenance cleaner,\" sprayed onto your bike after dirty rides or as needed. Simply let it soak in for a few moments and then rag wipe or rinse off with a hose. The product is an advanced, 100% biodegradable, solvent-free formulation, safe for all parts of your bike. Carnauba wax in the mix also leaves a protective film and sharp-looking shine. In addition to keeping your bike looking new, Wash & Shine can also be used to clean dirt bikes, ATVs, snowmobiles, boats, lawn and garden equipment, camping gear, kitchen appliances, counter tops, and more.About White LightningIn 1994, retired research chemist Paul Maples was determined to find a way to end the messy inconvenience and performance inefficiencies caused by the dirt, grease, and grime build up on his bike chain. He set out to develop the first and only chain lube that would \"self-clean,\" which he dubbed Clean Ride. The product actually repels and sheds dirt and grime from your chain and parts while you ride, and was so unique it was awarded four U.S. patents. In 2000, Paul sold White Lightning to Hank Krause, who had been developing performance bicycle lubricants since the mid 1980s. Krausse and his team took over, and -- with continued collaboration from Maples -- the result has been a steadily growing line of bike maintenance products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iLa4GX2cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YDMPQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "White Lightning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaners"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B000YFDJMM", "title": "Spyderco ParaMilitary G-10 Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Para Military provides the performance and reliability of Spyderco's acclaimed Military model in a more compact package. Two-thirds the size of the original Military, it boasts a flat-ground CPM-S30V blade with an easily indexed 14mm Spyderco Round Hole for gloved or large hands. Its handle is constructed of stainless steel liners nested into textured black G-10 scales. The Para Military's black DLC-coated blade locks open by means of Spyderco's proprietary Compression Lock--one of the strongest folding knife locks ever produced. Ergonomic curves in the handle profile lock the user's hand securely in place, providing superior control and preventing slippage. A black steel pocket clip supports convenient carry and immediate accessibility, positioning the knife for right-hand, tip-down carry.", "text": "Spyderco ParaMilitary G-10 Plain Edge Knife The Para Military provides the performance and reliability of Spyderco's acclaimed Military model in a more compact package. Two-thirds the size of the original Military, it boasts a flat-ground CPM-S30V blade with an easily indexed 14mm Spyderco Round Hole for gloved or large hands. Its handle is constructed of stainless steel liners nested into textured black G-10 scales. The Para Military's black DLC-coated blade locks open by means of Spyderco's proprietary Compression Lock--one of the strongest folding knife locks ever produced. Ergonomic curves in the handle profile lock the user's hand securely in place, providing superior control and preventing slippage. A black steel pocket clip supports convenient carry and immediate accessibility, positioning the knife for right-hand, tip-down carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C1GOHrxBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YFDJMM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 174.95}}
{"item_id": "B000YH2WGO", "title": "White Sierra D9717M Men's Insulated Bib Snow Pant", "description": "", "text": "White Sierra D9717M Men's Insulated Bib Snow Pant", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mgXn%2BQZzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YH2WGO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000YHP8HY", "title": "Back Magic Multi-Level Back Stretching Device", "description": "The Back Magic is a small lightwieght multi-level back stetching devise that helps you relax and immediately relieves back pain due to tight muscles, excessive flexion, and poor spinal alignment. Just lie down and relax for five minutes twice a day. The Back Magic is recommended and used by Physicians, Chiropractors, and Professional Athletes.", "text": "Back Magic Multi-Level Back Stretching Device The Back Magic is a small lightwieght multi-level back stetching devise that helps you relax and immediately relieves back pain due to tight muscles, excessive flexion, and poor spinal alignment. Just lie down and relax for five minutes twice a day. The Back Magic is recommended and used by Physicians, Chiropractors, and Professional Athletes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410NbdR13TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YHP8HY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Back Magic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 14.5}}
{"item_id": "B000YIDE1K", "title": "Soft Air Taurus PT24/7 Spring Powered Pistol, Black", "description": "Taurus PT24/7 offers the BAX shooting system for better accuracy. With the lower tactical rail allows you to add any tactical gear you need to bring to the fight. The PT24/7 shoots 315 feet per second with .12g ammo. NOTE: BB Loader is not included.IMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS:1. Jamming: A few potential causes for this issue:a. The most likely cause is the user not pulling the slide all the way back.We encourage the end user to grab the slide at the front of the slide and pull back. It’s a solidly built item, so grabbing the slide at the back end of it and attempting to fully engage the slide is challenging at best.b. If this pistol is fired with the safety on it will sometimes jam the pistol once the safety is taken off. This is not a defect as much as it is user error.c. If the user is using a bb that is too heavy (recommend a .12g with this item) it will increase the likelihood of a jam occurring.2. Mag falling out: As mentioned before, I tested several pistols and never experienced the mag falling out. The user may be hitting the mag release button unintentionally and/or, very unlikely, but possible, putting the mag in backwards.", "text": "Soft Air Taurus PT24/7 Spring Powered Pistol, Black Taurus PT24/7 offers the BAX shooting system for better accuracy. With the lower tactical rail allows you to add any tactical gear you need to bring to the fight. The PT24/7 shoots 315 feet per second with .12g ammo. NOTE: BB Loader is not included.IMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS:1. Jamming: A few potential causes for this issue:a. The most likely cause is the user not pulling the slide all the way back.We encourage the end user to grab the slide at the front of the slide and pull back. It’s a solidly built item, so grabbing the slide at the back end of it and attempting to fully engage the slide is challenging at best.b. If this pistol is fired with the safety on it will sometimes jam the pistol once the safety is taken off. This is not a defect as much as it is user error.c. If the user is using a bb that is too heavy (recommend a .12g with this item) it will increase the likelihood of a jam occurring.2. Mag falling out: As mentioned before, I tested several pistols and never experienced the mag falling out. The user may be hitting the mag release button unintentionally and/or, very unlikely, but possible, putting the mag in backwards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413T7ePlK8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YIDE1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taurus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 22.19}}
{"item_id": "B000YJJTDQ", "title": "Razor RipStik Ripster", "description": "Carve up the street and skate park and do more tricks than ever, with the lightweight version of the original RipStik Ripster. Thanks to its inclined caster trucks and pivoting deck, the RipStik Ripster carves like a snowboard. Its unique, articulated design allows the rider to accelerate and turn without pushing--unlike a traditional skateboard. The RipStik Ripster features a concave deck for increased foot control and is equipped with urethane wheels and ABEC-5 bearings for a smooth ride.Manufacturer Warranty:6 monthsAbout Razor USA:Founded in 2000 with the introduction of its now legendary kick scooter which quickly became an essential ride for anyone on the go, the Razor brand embodies the spirit of fun and freedom. Today, Razor offers a full line of products that inspire and excite riders everywhere. From day one, Razor has focused on providing the very best riding experience. Based in Cerritos, Calif., the company's award-winning products are influenced by its Southern California home. The company combines cutting-edge technology, high-quality materials, and strict safety standards to deliver a product that is designed to suit riders' evolving lifestyle. Cool products and great value have distinguished Razor as a trusted brand and industry leader--from motocross and BMX, to snowboarding, skateboarding, and surfing, Razor products are rooted in popular action sports. It's not how you ride, but how the ride makes you feel.", "text": "Razor RipStik Ripster Carve up the street and skate park and do more tricks than ever, with the lightweight version of the original RipStik Ripster. Thanks to its inclined caster trucks and pivoting deck, the RipStik Ripster carves like a snowboard. Its unique, articulated design allows the rider to accelerate and turn without pushing--unlike a traditional skateboard. The RipStik Ripster features a concave deck for increased foot control and is equipped with urethane wheels and ABEC-5 bearings for a smooth ride.Manufacturer Warranty:6 monthsAbout Razor USA:Founded in 2000 with the introduction of its now legendary kick scooter which quickly became an essential ride for anyone on the go, the Razor brand embodies the spirit of fun and freedom. Today, Razor offers a full line of products that inspire and excite riders everywhere. From day one, Razor has focused on providing the very best riding experience. Based in Cerritos, Calif., the company's award-winning products are influenced by its Southern California home. The company combines cutting-edge technology, high-quality materials, and strict safety standards to deliver a product that is designed to suit riders' evolving lifestyle. Cool products and great value have distinguished Razor as a trusted brand and industry leader--from motocross and BMX, to snowboarding, skateboarding, and surfing, Razor products are rooted in popular action sports. It's not how you ride, but how the ride makes you feel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lmF-iUGUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YJJTDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Caster Boards"]], "price": 55.99}}
{"item_id": "B000YJMAYQ", "title": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Ball Base - 19\" x 2\"", "description": "The Isokinetics Inc. Brand Ball Base is designed to hold a therapy (aka exercise, balance, yoga) ball in place while the user performs therapy or exercise routines. Many customers also use it to keep their exercise ball in place when used as a seat. It can also be used for storage purposes. Our ball base is a single, sturdy, molded plastic design. No assembly is required. And our direct from the manufacturer pricing saves you money. ***NOTE: While we are amazed by some of our customers' ingenuity, we have to point out that our ball base was not designed to be used with wheels. We can't guarantee it will hold up under the stress placed on just 4 pressure points.", "text": "Isokinetics Inc. Brand Exercise Ball Base - 19\" x 2\" The Isokinetics Inc. Brand Ball Base is designed to hold a therapy (aka exercise, balance, yoga) ball in place while the user performs therapy or exercise routines. Many customers also use it to keep their exercise ball in place when used as a seat. It can also be used for storage purposes. Our ball base is a single, sturdy, molded plastic design. No assembly is required. And our direct from the manufacturer pricing saves you money. ***NOTE: While we are amazed by some of our customers' ingenuity, we have to point out that our ball base was not designed to be used with wheels. We can't guarantee it will hold up under the stress placed on just 4 pressure points.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hX0i3q6rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YJMAYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B000YJPCLO", "title": "Razor RipStik Ripster", "description": "Carve up the street and skate park and do more tricks than ever, with the lightweight version of the original RipStik Ripster. Thanks to its inclined caster trucks and pivoting deck, the RipStik Ripster carves like a snowboard. Its unique, articulated design allows the rider to accelerate and turn without pushing--unlike a traditional skateboard. The RipStik Ripster features a concave deck for increased foot control and is equipped with urethane wheels and ABEC-5 bearings for a smooth ride.Manufacturer Warranty:6 monthsAbout Razor USA:Founded in 2000 with the introduction of its now legendary kick scooter which quickly became an essential ride for anyone on the go, the Razor brand embodies the spirit of fun and freedom. Today, Razor offers a full line of products that inspire and excite riders everywhere. From day one, Razor has focused on providing the very best riding experience. Based in Cerritos, Calif., the company's award-winning products are influenced by its Southern California home. The company combines cutting-edge technology, high-quality materials, and strict safety standards to deliver a product that is designed to suit riders' evolving lifestyle. Cool products and great value have distinguished Razor as a trusted brand and industry leader--from motocross and BMX, to snowboarding, skateboarding, and surfing, Razor products are rooted in popular action sports. It's not how you ride, but how the ride makes you feel.", "text": "Razor RipStik Ripster Carve up the street and skate park and do more tricks than ever, with the lightweight version of the original RipStik Ripster. Thanks to its inclined caster trucks and pivoting deck, the RipStik Ripster carves like a snowboard. Its unique, articulated design allows the rider to accelerate and turn without pushing--unlike a traditional skateboard. The RipStik Ripster features a concave deck for increased foot control and is equipped with urethane wheels and ABEC-5 bearings for a smooth ride.Manufacturer Warranty:6 monthsAbout Razor USA:Founded in 2000 with the introduction of its now legendary kick scooter which quickly became an essential ride for anyone on the go, the Razor brand embodies the spirit of fun and freedom. Today, Razor offers a full line of products that inspire and excite riders everywhere. From day one, Razor has focused on providing the very best riding experience. Based in Cerritos, Calif., the company's award-winning products are influenced by its Southern California home. The company combines cutting-edge technology, high-quality materials, and strict safety standards to deliver a product that is designed to suit riders' evolving lifestyle. Cool products and great value have distinguished Razor as a trusted brand and industry leader--from motocross and BMX, to snowboarding, skateboarding, and surfing, Razor products are rooted in popular action sports. It's not how you ride, but how the ride makes you feel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410zwbc86ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YJPCLO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Caster Boards"]], "price": 63.49}}
