{"item_id": "B000YUMCU2", "title": "Seattle Sports Paddling Half Skirt", "description": "Mount this dual-pocket half skirt by itself or over your full-enclosure skirt for easy-access cockpit pocket and splash protection. An implosion bar helps shed water and the shock cord allows quick and easy installation.", "text": "Seattle Sports Paddling Half Skirt Mount this dual-pocket half skirt by itself or over your full-enclosure skirt for easy-access cockpit pocket and splash protection. An implosion bar helps shed water and the shock cord allows quick and easy installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IgdIVpW-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YUMCU2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Spray Skirts"]]}}
