{"item_id": "B000YXOUNQ", "title": "Gunmaster Universal Select 22 Caliber Aluminum Case Gun Cleaning Kit (30-Piece), Large", "description": "Keep your piece in prime condition with this DAC Gunmaster Universal Cleaning Kit! PRICED RIGHT! Better looks, longer life and most importantly, top accuracy! This Kit gives you all the tools you need, organized in one handy place. Included Carry Case for easy transport out to the range or up to the cabin. Specifications: - Sure shot: 3 solid brass rods - Gunmaster PSH handle - 9 brushes handle all calibers from .22 to .45, including .410/20/12 gauge; .22, .38/.357/9 mm, .410, 20 and 12 gauge mops - 1 brass brush adapter - 3 slot tips for cleaning patches - 5 jags - Double-ended utility / breech cleaning brush - Double-ended cleaning pick - 50-Pk. cleaning patches - All store neatly in included Aluminum Presentation Case; Measures 11 x 7 3/4 x 2\"h - Weight: 1 lb. 9 ozs", "text": "Gunmaster Universal Select 22 Caliber Aluminum Case Gun Cleaning Kit (30-Piece), Large Keep your piece in prime condition with this DAC Gunmaster Universal Cleaning Kit! PRICED RIGHT! Better looks, longer life and most importantly, top accuracy! This Kit gives you all the tools you need, organized in one handy place. Included Carry Case for easy transport out to the range or up to the cabin. Specifications: - Sure shot: 3 solid brass rods - Gunmaster PSH handle - 9 brushes handle all calibers from .22 to .45, including .410/20/12 gauge; .22, .38/.357/9 mm, .410, 20 and 12 gauge mops - 1 brass brush adapter - 3 slot tips for cleaning patches - 5 jags - Double-ended utility / breech cleaning brush - Double-ended cleaning pick - 50-Pk. cleaning patches - All store neatly in included Aluminum Presentation Case; Measures 11 x 7 3/4 x 2\"h - Weight: 1 lb. 9 ozs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bNmbqlQ6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YXOUNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 23.86}}
{"item_id": "B000YYFIB8", "title": "Weaver Top Mount Matte Black Base Pair - Remington 700", "description": "There's no longer a need to search for front and rear bases for your most popular firearms. Weaver Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept all Weaver top mount cross lock rings. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Top Mount Matte Black Base Pair - Remington 700 There's no longer a need to search for front and rear bases for your most popular firearms. Weaver Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept all Weaver top mount cross lock rings. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I6AEVZfFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YYFIB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 9.69}}
{"item_id": "B000YZ4CPU", "title": "Mirrycle Incredibell Brass Duet Bicycle Bell", "description": "The beautifully resonant ring of solid brass. Available in solid brass and chrome-plated solid brass. The Duet is a traditional ding-dong bell.", "text": "Mirrycle Incredibell Brass Duet Bicycle Bell The beautifully resonant ring of solid brass. Available in solid brass and chrome-plated solid brass. The Duet is a traditional ding-dong bell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R-pD6kNmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000YZ4CPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Accessories"]], "price": 8.32}}
