{"item_id": "B000Z3S8II", "title": "Bluewave \"DAILY 8\" Water Jug - Color 1.9 Liter (64 oz) BPA Free Water Bottle", "description": "The BPA Free Bluewave Water Jug comes in an assortment of colors and its convenient handle design makes it easy to carry or to drink from. Its portable size makes it great for school, office and any outdoor activities. Safe to use and no leeching of chemicals. It's environmentally friendly due to its capabilities to be reused over and over again. So don't hesitate! Be healthy and drink 8 glasses of water a day with just 1 bottle! Don't get the imitations - Get the ORIGINAL Bluewave Water Jug! NOT microwave-safe or dishwasher-safe. No hot beverages. To clean, please rinse with water before and after each use. NOTE: Replacement caps measure 38mm.", "text": "Bluewave \"DAILY 8\" Water Jug - Color 1.9 Liter (64 oz) BPA Free Water Bottle The BPA Free Bluewave Water Jug comes in an assortment of colors and its convenient handle design makes it easy to carry or to drink from. Its portable size makes it great for school, office and any outdoor activities. Safe to use and no leeching of chemicals. It's environmentally friendly due to its capabilities to be reused over and over again. So don't hesitate! Be healthy and drink 8 glasses of water a day with just 1 bottle! Don't get the imitations - Get the ORIGINAL Bluewave Water Jug! NOT microwave-safe or dishwasher-safe. No hot beverages. To clean, please rinse with water before and after each use. NOTE: Replacement caps measure 38mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zn7kdT2TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Z3S8II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bluewave Lifestyle&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B000Z7WVZK", "title": "Fisher Space Pen Black Fine Point Pressurized Refill", "description": "Fisher Space Pen Pressurized Refills (PR series) Fits the Following Space Pen product categories: Bullet, Astronaut, Shuttle, X-750, Space-Tec, Military, Zero Gravity, Futura, Cap-O-Matic Adapters Available to Fit Parker Style Pens. Blister Carded for Peg Board Display.", "text": "Fisher Space Pen Black Fine Point Pressurized Refill Fisher Space Pen Pressurized Refills (PR series) Fits the Following Space Pen product categories: Bullet, Astronaut, Shuttle, X-750, Space-Tec, Military, Zero Gravity, Futura, Cap-O-Matic Adapters Available to Fit Parker Style Pens. Blister Carded for Peg Board Display.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CKOTBLu6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Z7WVZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fisher Space Pen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 2.05}}
{"item_id": "B000Z8P1J2", "title": "SentrySafe G0135 Black Safe 5 Long Gun Maximum Capacity Safe, 3.5 Cubic Feet, Black", "description": "With a capacity for five large firearms, The SentrySafe G0135 Black Five Long Gun Safe protects your rifles and shotguns and keeps them safely out of unwanted hands. This affordable no-nonsense gun safe has several features that provide safe and practical firearm storage, including concealed hinges, live-locking bolts, and a carpeted interior..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The G0135 offers a capacity of 3.5 cubic feet.View larger.Secure Protection for Peace of MindWith the SentrySafe G0135, you'll be able to rest easy knowing your firearms are secure. Thanks to its eight-lever security key with double-bit key, solid steel door with concealed hinges, and two live-locking steel bolts, the safe will give you peace of mind knowing that no one else will have easy access to your firearms and that your guns and your family members are safe.Smart Features for Your ConvenienceThe SentrySafe G0135 has several innovative features to help keep your guns protected and organized. The gun rack neatly holds up to five long guns such as hunting rifles and shotguns. A fixed shelf above the rack allows you to store and organize smaller items such as handguns, ammunition, cleaning supplies, and other gear.To protect your valuable firearms against scratches and other damage, the gun safe is carpeted on the interior up to the gun holders. A durable black powder-coat finish on the safe's exterior offers a handsome look and many years of maintenance-free use.Dependable Construction for Safe Gun StorageFeaturing an eight-lever security key with double-bit key, two live-locking steel bolts, and a solid steel door with concealed hinges for added security, the SentrySafe G0135 is crafted to provide years of safety and dependable service. Designed with the ability to be bolted easily to the floor using the included mounting hardware, this safe comes with instructions for simple do-it-yourself installation.This SentrySafe G0135 measures 53.5 x 11.8 x 9.5 inches (HxWxD) inside to deliver a capacity of 3.5 cubic feet. It measures 55 x 12 x 11.5 inches outside and weighs 72 pounds. The safe is backed by a one-year limited manufacturer warranty and meets the California Department of Justice standards for firearm safety.About SentrySafeWith family ownership spanning three generations and 79 years, SentrySafe is an award-winning security leader, producing more security containers than any other company in the world. SentrySafe is dedicated to providing quality, affordable, innovative products that meet rigorous UL and ETL testing standards to ensure that valuables are protected from theft, fire, and water. SentrySafe manufactures many of its products in the U.S.A.What's in the BoxSentrySafe G0135 Black Five Long Gun Maximum Capacity Safe, two double-bit keys, and mounting hardware.", "text": "SentrySafe G0135 Black Safe 5 Long Gun Maximum Capacity Safe, 3.5 Cubic Feet, Black With a capacity for five large firearms, The SentrySafe G0135 Black Five Long Gun Safe protects your rifles and shotguns and keeps them safely out of unwanted hands. This affordable no-nonsense gun safe has several features that provide safe and practical firearm storage, including concealed hinges, live-locking bolts, and a carpeted interior..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The G0135 offers a capacity of 3.5 cubic feet.View larger.Secure Protection for Peace of MindWith the SentrySafe G0135, you'll be able to rest easy knowing your firearms are secure. Thanks to its eight-lever security key with double-bit key, solid steel door with concealed hinges, and two live-locking steel bolts, the safe will give you peace of mind knowing that no one else will have easy access to your firearms and that your guns and your family members are safe.Smart Features for Your ConvenienceThe SentrySafe G0135 has several innovative features to help keep your guns protected and organized. The gun rack neatly holds up to five long guns such as hunting rifles and shotguns. A fixed shelf above the rack allows you to store and organize smaller items such as handguns, ammunition, cleaning supplies, and other gear.To protect your valuable firearms against scratches and other damage, the gun safe is carpeted on the interior up to the gun holders. A durable black powder-coat finish on the safe's exterior offers a handsome look and many years of maintenance-free use.Dependable Construction for Safe Gun StorageFeaturing an eight-lever security key with double-bit key, two live-locking steel bolts, and a solid steel door with concealed hinges for added security, the SentrySafe G0135 is crafted to provide years of safety and dependable service. Designed with the ability to be bolted easily to the floor using the included mounting hardware, this safe comes with instructions for simple do-it-yourself installation.This SentrySafe G0135 measures 53.5 x 11.8 x 9.5 inches (HxWxD) inside to deliver a capacity of 3.5 cubic feet. It measures 55 x 12 x 11.5 inches outside and weighs 72 pounds. The safe is backed by a one-year limited manufacturer warranty and meets the California Department of Justice standards for firearm safety.About SentrySafeWith family ownership spanning three generations and 79 years, SentrySafe is an award-winning security leader, producing more security containers than any other company in the world. SentrySafe is dedicated to providing quality, affordable, innovative products that meet rigorous UL and ETL testing standards to ensure that valuables are protected from theft, fire, and water. SentrySafe manufactures many of its products in the U.S.A.What's in the BoxSentrySafe G0135 Black Five Long Gun Maximum Capacity Safe, two double-bit keys, and mounting hardware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YsQOaUVjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Z8P1J2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000Z9OACA", "title": "Okuma Expandable ABS Rod Rack", "description": "The Okuma expandable ABS Rod Rack can hold up to 16 rods in two different configurations. Either assemble the rod holder flat and mount it to the wall for single-sided storage--or--assemble the rod holder with both sides joined together, as pictured, for freestanding, double-sided storage. Made of durable ABS plastic the rod holder is easy to assemble and designed for years of use.", "text": "Okuma Expandable ABS Rod Rack The Okuma expandable ABS Rod Rack can hold up to 16 rods in two different configurations. Either assemble the rod holder flat and mount it to the wall for single-sided storage--or--assemble the rod holder with both sides joined together, as pictured, for freestanding, double-sided storage. Made of durable ABS plastic the rod holder is easy to assemble and designed for years of use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z5ojVbcUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000Z9OACA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 34.05}}
{"item_id": "B000ZB9474", "title": "Morrell Yellow Jacket F/P Bag Target", "description": "Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Target: Portable, ultra - durable AND American - made! One of the longest lasting target bags on the market! Morrel's exclusive IFS (Internal Frame System) construction creates consistent depth for ultimate arrow stopping ability all the way to the outer edges of the target... lets see a standard pillow target pull that off! And this Target is rated for use with all field points - let 'er fly! More: Perfectly sized for easy transport; IFS construction maintains shape for unbelievable target life; 100% waterproof; Approx. 22\" x 23\" x 12\", 23 lbs. Perfect for use at home or up at camp! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Replacement Cover - word search in our store for 'Morrell'. Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Target", "text": "Morrell Yellow Jacket F/P Bag Target Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Target: Portable, ultra - durable AND American - made! One of the longest lasting target bags on the market! Morrel's exclusive IFS (Internal Frame System) construction creates consistent depth for ultimate arrow stopping ability all the way to the outer edges of the target... lets see a standard pillow target pull that off! And this Target is rated for use with all field points - let 'er fly! More: Perfectly sized for easy transport; IFS construction maintains shape for unbelievable target life; 100% waterproof; Approx. 22\" x 23\" x 12\", 23 lbs. Perfect for use at home or up at camp! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Replacement Cover - word search in our store for 'Morrell'. Morrell Yellow Jacket Field Point Target", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-QfWthspL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZB9474.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morrell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 57.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZB953W", "title": "MTM Ultra Compact Arrow Case (12 Arrows, Black)", "description": "This Ultra Compact Arrow Case holds and protects up to 12 arrows (up to 32.2\" in total length). It is ideal for soft bow case pockets and also fits inside some hard cases. It is stackable and excellent for organizing your arrow inventory. Outer case is made from rugged polypropylene while inside, your arrows are separated and kept secure with notched foam padding. Pin-free mechanical hinge, two snapping latches and double padlock tabs offer the utmost in security.", "text": "MTM Ultra Compact Arrow Case (12 Arrows, Black) This Ultra Compact Arrow Case holds and protects up to 12 arrows (up to 32.2\" in total length). It is ideal for soft bow case pockets and also fits inside some hard cases. It is stackable and excellent for organizing your arrow inventory. Outer case is made from rugged polypropylene while inside, your arrows are separated and kept secure with notched foam padding. Pin-free mechanical hinge, two snapping latches and double padlock tabs offer the utmost in security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BoxIajncL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZB953W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 16.41}}
{"item_id": "B000ZDKUQQ", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Ankle Holster", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s Ankle Holster is constructed of comfortable, soft knit fabric and the closed-cell foam provides moisture barrier and padded comfort. Offered with molded thumb break and non-stretch retention strap.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Ankle Holster BLACKHAWK!'s Ankle Holster is constructed of comfortable, soft knit fabric and the closed-cell foam provides moisture barrier and padded comfort. Offered with molded thumb break and non-stretch retention strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41no4EZxsVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZDKUQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ZDKUTI", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Black Inside-the-Pants Holster with Retention Strap", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Black Inside-the-Pants Holster with Retention Strap offers an ultra-thin, three-layer nylon laminate that provides comfortable next-to-skin wear and smooth nylon lining for easy draw. The holster features a fold-over hook and loop retention strap and the belt clip slips over top of pants or belt to retain holster.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Black Inside-the-Pants Holster with Retention Strap The BLACKHAWK! Black Inside-the-Pants Holster with Retention Strap offers an ultra-thin, three-layer nylon laminate that provides comfortable next-to-skin wear and smooth nylon lining for easy draw. The holster features a fold-over hook and loop retention strap and the belt clip slips over top of pants or belt to retain holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DkM1oKYSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZDKUTI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ZDKUXE", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pocket Holster", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pocket Holster offers low-profile laminate construction that protects wearer’s skin from weapon’s sharp edges and provides moisture barrier. It is an open-top holster that provides grip-up positioning and protects weapon in pocket. Non-slip band keeps holster in pocket when firearm is drawn.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pocket Holster The BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pocket Holster offers low-profile laminate construction that protects wearer’s skin from weapon’s sharp edges and provides moisture barrier. It is an open-top holster that provides grip-up positioning and protects weapon in pocket. Non-slip band keeps holster in pocket when firearm is drawn.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51060LEQTEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZDKUXE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B000ZFJSO4", "title": "MTECH USA MT-343S Tactical Folding Knife 4-Inch Closed", "description": "The thin line design offers superb performance without the risk of roughing up your palms! The 2 7/8\", 420 stainless steel blade is equipped with a thumb stub for easy one hand opening. The custom pearl handle adds masculine appeal. 7 1/4\" overall. Folding knife - not automatic, not spring loaded.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-343S Tactical Folding Knife 4-Inch Closed The thin line design offers superb performance without the risk of roughing up your palms! The 2 7/8\", 420 stainless steel blade is equipped with a thumb stub for easy one hand opening. The custom pearl handle adds masculine appeal. 7 1/4\" overall. Folding knife - not automatic, not spring loaded.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VVTmM%2Bu3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZFJSO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 7.1}}
{"item_id": "B000ZGYSMK", "title": "Gunslick 500-Count Bulk Cotton Patches (.243-.270 Caliber)", "description": "Gunslick Cotton Patches effectively remove copper, lead and plastic. They also boast greater absorbency to aid in the transfer of solvents from bottle to barrel. These patches won't scratch metal surfaces. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "text": "Gunslick 500-Count Bulk Cotton Patches (.243-.270 Caliber) Gunslick Cotton Patches effectively remove copper, lead and plastic. They also boast greater absorbency to aid in the transfer of solvents from bottle to barrel. These patches won't scratch metal surfaces. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NIDME6NpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZGYSMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 6.75}}
