ategories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 3.15}}
{"item_id": "B000ZH6RQ4", "title": "TETON Sports Celsius XL -18 Degree C / 0 Degree F Flannel Lined Sleeping Bag (90\"x 36\")", "description": "Tired of squeezing into confining mummy bags? Turn to the Teton Sports Celsius XL oversized sleeping bag, an extra-large bag that's ideal for campers of any size. The Celsius XL--which offers a temperature rating of 32 degrees F (or 0 degrees C)--is filled with SuperLoft elite four-channel hollow fiber insulation, which helps keep the chill out on fall, spring, and summer evenings. The bag also offers zippers on both the left and the right side, so you can zip two Teton bags together and create a double bag for couples. Best of all, the bag comes with all the bells and whistles of more expensive bags: shoulder and zipper baffles, an adjustable mummy hood, an interior storage pocket for keys and valuables, and an oxford nylon compression sack for easy packing. The Celsius XL bag comes in black, blue, and olive green colors.", "text": "TETON Sports Celsius XL -18 Degree C / 0 Degree F Flannel Lined Sleeping Bag (90\"x 36\") Tired of squeezing into confining mummy bags? Turn to the Teton Sports Celsius XL oversized sleeping bag, an extra-large bag that's ideal for campers of any size. The Celsius XL--which offers a temperature rating of 32 degrees F (or 0 degrees C)--is filled with SuperLoft elite four-channel hollow fiber insulation, which helps keep the chill out on fall, spring, and summer evenings. The bag also offers zippers on both the left and the right side, so you can zip two Teton bags together and create a double bag for couples. Best of all, the bag comes with all the bells and whistles of more expensive bags: shoulder and zipper baffles, an adjustable mummy hood, an interior storage pocket for keys and valuables, and an oxford nylon compression sack for easy packing. The Celsius XL bag comes in black, blue, and olive green colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ClD31dqKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZH6RQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 74.65}}
{"item_id": "B000ZHCH0O", "title": "Surefire Nylon Fixed Loop Holster", "description": "Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster with a fixed-size belt loop. Features an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure.", "text": "Surefire Nylon Fixed Loop Holster Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster with a fixed-size belt loop. Features an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418tqbCHRSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZHCH0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZHHEB6", "title": "Bluewave 5 Gallon BPA Free Water Bottle with 120mm Big-Mouth & Dispensing Valve", "description": "Store water in this safe plastic bottle. Perfect for daily use at home or at the office; or even storage for emergency preparation. Comes with 120mm screw cap and each bottle has a handle for convenient carrying. Can be used as a large water cooler. Not recommended to be used with standard water coolers due to the large mouth. NOTE: BPA-free bottles are not as durable as polycarbonate bottles due to the lack of BPA as a strengthener.", "text": "Bluewave 5 Gallon BPA Free Water Bottle with 120mm Big-Mouth & Dispensing Valve Store water in this safe plastic bottle. Perfect for daily use at home or at the office; or even storage for emergency preparation. Comes with 120mm screw cap and each bottle has a handle for convenient carrying. Can be used as a large water cooler. Not recommended to be used with standard water coolers due to the large mouth. NOTE: BPA-free bottles are not as durable as polycarbonate bottles due to the lack of BPA as a strengthener.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LcmfmhfsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZHHEB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bluewave Lifestyle&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZHMVM8", "title": "Bluewave 5 Gallon BPA Free Water Bottle with 48mm Cap (Gen2)", "description": "BPA free bottle", "text": "Bluewave 5 Gallon BPA Free Water Bottle with 48mm Cap (Gen2) BPA free bottle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-RXx07W1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZHMVM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bluewave Lifestyle&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZIZXMW", "title": "RAD Cycle Products Pro Mechanic Bicycle Repair Stand", "description": "This pro-quality, \"Pro Mechanic\" bike repair stand by RAD cycle is perfect for repairing your bicycle. From simple routine maintenance to complete overhauls, anyone can benefit from a stable work platform. When deciding on which product to carry we analyzed many factors, cost, stability, quality, etc.. In our opinion these are much more robust and versatile than the inferior designs you regularly see on the market.", "text": "RAD Cycle Products Pro Mechanic Bicycle Repair Stand This pro-quality, \"Pro Mechanic\" bike repair stand by RAD cycle is perfect for repairing your bicycle. From simple routine maintenance to complete overhauls, anyone can benefit from a stable work platform. When deciding on which product to carry we analyzed many factors, cost, stability, quality, etc.. In our opinion these are much more robust and versatile than the inferior designs you regularly see on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318fyYRlvfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZIZXMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RAD Cycle Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 36.32}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKATYW", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag DX Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels", "description": "Insulated main compartment with molded EVA foam sides, top and bottom3M reflective trimElastic top bungeesIncludes shoulder strap and carrying handleDimensions: 14.1\" x 9.8\" x 8.5 - 11.4\"1020 gramsThe MTX TrunkBag DX features an insulated main compartment and a Multi-expanding top for more cargo capacity on the go.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag DX Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels Insulated main compartment with molded EVA foam sides, top and bottom3M reflective trimElastic top bungeesIncludes shoulder strap and carrying handleDimensions: 14.1\" x 9.8\" x 8.5 - 11.4\"1020 gramsThe MTX TrunkBag DX features an insulated main compartment and a Multi-expanding top for more cargo capacity on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YZ4eGncRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKATYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKATZG", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels", "description": "Tired of carrying your spare clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX trunk bag EXP, which boasts 1,010 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike. The MTX trunk bag offers ample storage space, with a divided main compartment and an expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers.Cyclists can use the optional rain cover (sold separately) to keep gear dry.As a result, you can fit several smaller items in the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible, water-repellent 420-denier nylon construction. And once you arrive at your destination, you can carry the MTX trunk bag EXP just like a messenger bag thanks to the included shoulder strap. Other features include a carrying handle, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, molded EVA foam insulation, elastic top bungees, and an optional rain cover (sold separately). The bag--which is compatible with the MTX QuickTrack rack--measures 9.8 by 14.1 by 8.5 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.36 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels Tired of carrying your spare clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX trunk bag EXP, which boasts 1,010 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike. The MTX trunk bag offers ample storage space, with a divided main compartment and an expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers.Cyclists can use the optional rain cover (sold separately) to keep gear dry.As a result, you can fit several smaller items in the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible, water-repellent 420-denier nylon construction. And once you arrive at your destination, you can carry the MTX trunk bag EXP just like a messenger bag thanks to the included shoulder strap. Other features include a carrying handle, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, molded EVA foam insulation, elastic top bungees, and an optional rain cover (sold separately). The bag--which is compatible with the MTX QuickTrack rack--measures 9.8 by 14.1 by 8.5 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.36 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4135Dy7DkFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKATZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKAU0A", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP & DXP Bicycle Trunk Bag Rain Cover", "description": "Optional rain covers provide additional protection from the elements to keep your MTX bag and its contents clean and dry. Two versions available for MTX bags with or without fold out panniers.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EXP & DXP Bicycle Trunk Bag Rain Cover Optional rain covers provide additional protection from the elements to keep your MTX bag and its contents clean and dry. Two versions available for MTX bags with or without fold out panniers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w4L9pcfKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKAU0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKCLCK", "title": "Topeak DeFender M1 Mountain Bike Fender (Front)", "description": "* Stylish 2pc wide profile front fender offers maximum dirt protection. * Quick release front mount easily attaches to suspension forks in seconds. * Dual compound two tone injected nylon for durability. * Size: 60cm x 10cm x 12cm (23.6\" x 3.9\" x 4.7\"). * Weight: 190 grams.", "text": "Topeak DeFender M1 Mountain Bike Fender (Front) * Stylish 2pc wide profile front fender offers maximum dirt protection. * Quick release front mount easily attaches to suspension forks in seconds. * Dual compound two tone injected nylon for durability. * Size: 60cm x 10cm x 12cm (23.6\" x 3.9\" x 4.7\"). * Weight: 190 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aJ%2BuUGJVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKCLCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 15.28}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKCLEI", "title": "Topeak Modula EX Bicycle Water Bottle Cage", "description": "Adjustable to fit different bottle diameters, newshape holds bottles securely.", "text": "Topeak Modula EX Bicycle Water Bottle Cage Adjustable to fit different bottle diameters, newshape holds bottles securely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DUlA5D5eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKCLEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 6.75}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKCLIO", "title": "Topeak One Up Wall Mount Bike Hanger", "description": "Elegant and functional, the One Up Wall Mount Bike Hanger is the perfect bicycle storage solution for apartments and other small spaces. It features a molded rubber bar that keeps the front wheel stationary to prevent the bike from twisting, two extra hooks for hanging clothing, helmets, and other accessories, and rubber pads to prevent tires from marking the walls. Includes all mounting hardware.Features:Elegant wall-mounted single bike storage solutionMolded rubber bar keeps bike from twisting2 extra hooks for hanging clothing, helmets or other accessoriesRubber pads prevent tires from marking walls1 bike mountMaterial: Aluminum/plasticMaximum Tire Width: 2.35 inchesMaximum Weight Capacity: 35 poundsSize: 12.6 by 9.8 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.54 pounds", "text": "Topeak One Up Wall Mount Bike Hanger Elegant and functional, the One Up Wall Mount Bike Hanger is the perfect bicycle storage solution for apartments and other small spaces. It features a molded rubber bar that keeps the front wheel stationary to prevent the bike from twisting, two extra hooks for hanging clothing, helmets, and other accessories, and rubber pads to prevent tires from marking the walls. Includes all mounting hardware.Features:Elegant wall-mounted single bike storage solutionMolded rubber bar keeps bike from twisting2 extra hooks for hanging clothing, helmets or other accessoriesRubber pads prevent tires from marking walls1 bike mountMaterial: Aluminum/plasticMaximum Tire Width: 2.35 inchesMaximum Weight Capacity: 35 poundsSize: 12.6 by 9.8 by 5.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.54 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xY%2BNpCotL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKCLIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKCWGA", "title": "WELL MB03 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle", "description": "WELL MB03 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle Scope and Scope Rings Included BIPOD NOT INCLUDED.", "text": "WELL MB03 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle WELL MB03 Spring Airsoft Sniper Rifle Scope and Scope Rings Included BIPOD NOT INCLUDED.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31glcEdQ4SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKCWGA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Well", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 129.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKES0S", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag DXP Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels", "description": "Tired of carrying your spare clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX DXP trunk bag, which boasts 1,380 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike.Cyclists can secure items within easy reach using the elastic top bungees.Topeak's largest trunk bag, the MTX DXP offers ample storage space, with a divided main compartment and a two-stage expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers. As a result, you can fit several smaller items into the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible 600-denier polyester construction with a Dupont Teflon coating. And it's a breeze to attach the bag to your bike thanks to the MTX QuickTrack system, which is compatible with Topeak's MTX side frame (sold separately). You can even carry the trunk bag like a messenger bag using the included removable shoulder strap.Other features include molded EVA foam insulation, a water bottle holder, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, and elastic top bungees. The MTX DXP bag, which is compatible with an optional Topeak rain cover, measures 14.5 by 8.5 by 9.8 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.53 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag DXP Bicycle Trunk Bag with Rigid Molded Panels Tired of carrying your spare clothes, bike tools, and groceries in a cumbersome backpack while you ride? Turn to the Topeak MTX DXP trunk bag, which boasts 1,380 cubic inches of storage space in a framework that attaches securely to the rear of your bike.Cyclists can secure items within easy reach using the elastic top bungees.Topeak's largest trunk bag, the MTX DXP offers ample storage space, with a divided main compartment and a two-stage expandable top, along with two side panels with expandable panniers. As a result, you can fit several smaller items into the main bag, or you can enlarge it to store additional gear, clothes, or snacks. The bag is also tough and long lasting, with rigid molded side panels and a flexible 600-denier polyester construction with a Dupont Teflon coating. And it's a breeze to attach the bag to your bike thanks to the MTX QuickTrack system, which is compatible with Topeak's MTX side frame (sold separately). You can even carry the trunk bag like a messenger bag using the included removable shoulder strap.Other features include molded EVA foam insulation, a water bottle holder, a 3M reflective strip, a RedLite clip, and elastic top bungees. The MTX DXP bag, which is compatible with an optional Topeak rain cover, measures 14.5 by 8.5 by 9.8 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 2.53 pounds.About TopeakTopeak has received an avalanche of awards and accolades since its founding in 1991. The company has developed such innovations as the JowBlow floor pumps with SmartHead technology, which sense and automatically adapt to Schrader and Presta valves without swapping out parts; the award-winning Morph series of mini pumps; the ALiEN multitools, which separate into different parts so cyclists can bring only the tools they need; and the Hexus mini tool and Bikamper personal shelter, which received the prestigious Red Dot award for outstanding design. The most important part of the Topeak story, however, is the passion of the founders and employees, who are cyclists, too. The company is dedicated to making the ride better, and focuses on creating products and accessories to help facilitate an escape from the traffic jams, cubicles, and mind-numbing meetings of everyday life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mPjZvhyHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKES0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 82.97}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKESCG", "title": "Topeak Flash Stand Slim", "description": "Just as sacrilegious as leaning a bicycle against an automobile is putting a kickstand on said bicycle. One solution is Topeak's Flash Stand Slim -- a small fold-out stand that securely holds a bicycle without marring the finish. This allows you to gear up while the bicycle awaits, and it also props the rear tire off the ground for quick drivetrain adjustments and lubing. The Topeak Flash Stand Slim is constructed from aluminum and durable plastic and weighs just over one pound.", "text": "Topeak Flash Stand Slim Just as sacrilegious as leaning a bicycle against an automobile is putting a kickstand on said bicycle. One solution is Topeak's Flash Stand Slim -- a small fold-out stand that securely holds a bicycle without marring the finish. This allows you to gear up while the bicycle awaits, and it also props the rear tire off the ground for quick drivetrain adjustments and lubing. The Topeak Flash Stand Slim is constructed from aluminum and durable plastic and weighs just over one pound.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416M-vdaHpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKESCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 38.21}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKFXOS", "title": "Topeak DeFender M2 Mountain Bike Fender (Rear)", "description": "* Stylish wide profile rear fender offers maximum dirt protection. * Quick release clamp system for easy set up. * Unique Slip Joint Clamp adjusts to fit 25.4mm - 34.9mm seat posts in seconds. * 2 adjusting points allow multiple angles and height adjustments for a custom fit on most bikes. * Dual compound two tone injected nylon for durability. * Size: 40cm x 10cm x 12cm (15.8\" x 3.9\" x 4.7\"). * Weight: 230 grams.", "text": "Topeak DeFender M2 Mountain Bike Fender (Rear) * Stylish wide profile rear fender offers maximum dirt protection. * Quick release clamp system for easy set up. * Unique Slip Joint Clamp adjusts to fit 25.4mm - 34.9mm seat posts in seconds. * 2 adjusting points allow multiple angles and height adjustments for a custom fit on most bikes. * Dual compound two tone injected nylon for durability. * Size: 40cm x 10cm x 12cm (15.8\" x 3.9\" x 4.7\"). * Weight: 230 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318IkceOc2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKFXOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKFXX4", "title": "Topeak Two Up TuneUp Bike Stand", "description": "This multi-bike storage system is solid enough to serve as a light-duty portable work stand. Constructed of aluminum tubing, the center pillar extends to almost seven feet while the tripod base provides a stable base. It can store up to four bikes with optional additional bike mounts (two included). The mounts adjust to fit road, mountain bike, and sloping-up tube designs and a handlebar stabilizer to keep the front wheel from turning. The freestanding design offers a stable tripod base and folds up for easy storage.Features:Mounts for two bikes and one handlebar stabilizer includedCan hold up to 4 bikes with additional mounts (only 2 mounts included)Bike mounts adjust to fit road, MTB and sloping top tube designsBike holders adjust from 0-30 degrees to accommodate bikes with sloping top tubesLower hook for storage or bike maintenanceHandle bar stabilizer keeps front wheel from turningFreestanding design with stable tripod base, folds up for easy storageQuick-release featureSpecifications:Base: HD Folding 6061 T6 TubesMaterial: 6061 T6 TubesWeight Capacity Per Hook: 39.7 pounds per hookWeight Capacity Per Stand: 158.7 poundsDimensions: 17.3 by 13.4 by 84.3 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 12.13 pounds", "text": "Topeak Two Up TuneUp Bike Stand This multi-bike storage system is solid enough to serve as a light-duty portable work stand. Constructed of aluminum tubing, the center pillar extends to almost seven feet while the tripod base provides a stable base. It can store up to four bikes with optional additional bike mounts (two included). The mounts adjust to fit road, mountain bike, and sloping-up tube designs and a handlebar stabilizer to keep the front wheel from turning. The freestanding design offers a stable tripod base and folds up for easy storage.Features:Mounts for two bikes and one handlebar stabilizer includedCan hold up to 4 bikes with additional mounts (only 2 mounts included)Bike mounts adjust to fit road, MTB and sloping top tube designsBike holders adjust from 0-30 degrees to accommodate bikes with sloping top tubesLower hook for storage or bike maintenanceHandle bar stabilizer keeps front wheel from turningFreestanding design with stable tripod base, folds up for easy storageQuick-release featureSpecifications:Base: HD Folding 6061 T6 TubesMaterial: 6061 T6 TubesWeight Capacity Per Hook: 39.7 pounds per hookWeight Capacity Per Stand: 158.7 poundsDimensions: 17.3 by 13.4 by 84.3 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 12.13 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YRuHNRxiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKFXX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 249.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKGLTY", "title": "Well MP5 Super HiCap 500 Airsoft Magazine", "description": "Well Super Hi Capacity MP5 AEG Airsoft Rifle Magazine Capacity: 500 Rounds! Highest Capacity MP5 Magazine on Market Compatible with Tokyo Marui, Classic Army, ICS, AE, JG, GB MP5 AEG", "text": "Well MP5 Super HiCap 500 Airsoft Magazine Well Super Hi Capacity MP5 AEG Airsoft Rifle Magazine Capacity: 500 Rounds! Highest Capacity MP5 Magazine on Market Compatible with Tokyo Marui, Classic Army, ICS, AE, JG, GB MP5 AEG", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tA8t8c6YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKGLTY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKHN0U", "title": "Topeak Ratchet Rocket", "description": "You don't have to be a bike packer to appreciate a stem or H2O-bottle-boss-mountable hex set, tire levers, and chain tool in a compact, self-contained package -- with the bonus of a ratchet. Usually reserved for home or shop locations, this gives you the ability to use a ratchet on the road or trail and means quick rotation and control in tight spots. The Ratchet Rocket comes with 2 through 6mm hex bits, one Torx T25, a #2 Phillips, and two tire levers. All this is stashed in an engineering-grade, polymer/thermoplastic storage box that's weather resistant. The Ratchet Rocket comes with a band clamp for remote mounting and a water bottle braze-on mount, with an available-separately stem cap mount for added versatility. The chain tool is compatible with singlespeed multi-speed chains up to 10-speed. Topeak's Ratchet Rocket weighs 192 grams and measures 4. 3 x 2. 2 x 1. 3 inches.", "text": "Topeak Ratchet Rocket You don't have to be a bike packer to appreciate a stem or H2O-bottle-boss-mountable hex set, tire levers, and chain tool in a compact, self-contained package -- with the bonus of a ratchet. Usually reserved for home or shop locations, this gives you the ability to use a ratchet on the road or trail and means quick rotation and control in tight spots. The Ratchet Rocket comes with 2 through 6mm hex bits, one Torx T25, a #2 Phillips, and two tire levers. All this is stashed in an engineering-grade, polymer/thermoplastic storage box that's weather resistant. The Ratchet Rocket comes with a band clamp for remote mounting and a water bottle braze-on mount, with an available-separately stem cap mount for added versatility. The chain tool is compatible with singlespeed multi-speed chains up to 10-speed. Topeak's Ratchet Rocket weighs 192 grams and measures 4. 3 x 2. 2 x 1. 3 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tg7ylgDmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKHN0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKHN50", "title": "MTX Trunk Bag EX with rigid molded panels", "description": "Topeak's QuickTrack compatible MTX Trunkbag EX features a divided main compartment constructed with a new process that combines rigid molded panels with flexible 600 denier fabric for rigidity and water repellency. Additional features include two mesh side compartments for extra capacity, a divided main compartment, elastic top bungees to help secure items within easy reach, 3M reflective strip and RedLite mount for increased low-light visibility, a shoulder strap for off-bike use, and a carry handle.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Elastic top bungee helps secure items within easy reach3M reflective strip for increased nighttime visibilityRedLite mount for increased visibility after darkMolded panels are protective and water repellentOptional rain cover provides additional protectionIncludes shoulder strap for off-bike use1 divided main compartment for stowing gearCoating for water and stain resistanceTwo mesh side compartments add extra carrying capacityShoulder strapCarrying handleElastic top bungeesBag Attachment: MTX QuickTrackSpecifications:Capacity: 480 cubic inchesMaximum Load: Limited to rack maximum load ratingInsulation: Molded EVA foamMaterial: 600 denier polyesterSize: 13.8 by 8.3 by 7.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.54 pounds", "text": "MTX Trunk Bag EX with rigid molded panels Topeak's QuickTrack compatible MTX Trunkbag EX features a divided main compartment constructed with a new process that combines rigid molded panels with flexible 600 denier fabric for rigidity and water repellency. Additional features include two mesh side compartments for extra capacity, a divided main compartment, elastic top bungees to help secure items within easy reach, 3M reflective strip and RedLite mount for increased low-light visibility, a shoulder strap for off-bike use, and a carry handle.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Elastic top bungee helps secure items within easy reach3M reflective strip for increased nighttime visibilityRedLite mount for increased visibility after darkMolded panels are protective and water repellentOptional rain cover provides additional protectionIncludes shoulder strap for off-bike use1 divided main compartment for stowing gearCoating for water and stain resistanceTwo mesh side compartments add extra carrying capacityShoulder strapCarrying handleElastic top bungeesBag Attachment: MTX QuickTrackSpecifications:Capacity: 480 cubic inchesMaximum Load: Limited to rack maximum load ratingInsulation: Molded EVA foamMaterial: 600 denier polyesterSize: 13.8 by 8.3 by 7.5 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.54 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O21rcf1mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKHN50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 43.35}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKHN5K", "title": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EX & DX Bicycle Trunk Bag Rain Cover", "description": "Optional rain covers provide additional protection from the elements to keep your MTX bag and its contents clean and dry. Two versions available for MTX bags with or without fold out panniers.", "text": "Topeak MTX Trunk Bag EX & DX Bicycle Trunk Bag Rain Cover Optional rain covers provide additional protection from the elements to keep your MTX bag and its contents clean and dry. Two versions available for MTX bags with or without fold out panniers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W9yYsmKGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKHN5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKHN6E", "title": "Topeak Super Tourist Tubular Bicycle Trunk Rack DX with Side Bar", "description": "Our toughest tubular aluminum rear rack designed for heavy-duty, long distance touring. Integrated side bar provides a lower pannier attachment point- allowing more space for cargo on the rack top. QuickTrackTM compatible for use with any MTX TrunkBag, rear basket and pannier bag.", "text": "Topeak Super Tourist Tubular Bicycle Trunk Rack DX with Side Bar Our toughest tubular aluminum rear rack designed for heavy-duty, long distance touring. Integrated side bar provides a lower pannier attachment point- allowing more space for cargo on the rack top. QuickTrackTM compatible for use with any MTX TrunkBag, rear basket and pannier bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q20-F3jML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKHN6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKHN6Y", "title": "Topeak Super Tourist Tubular Bicycle Trunk Rack DX with Side Bar for Disc Brake Bikes", "description": "The Super Tourist is a classic loaded touring rack for road bikes designed for compatibility with disc brakes. 6061-T6 aluminum construction with 6061-T6 aluminum bracket, hollow aluminum tubes, and stainless steel hardware makes it strong and lightweight while the integrated top fender offers splash protection. The QuickTrack mounting system is compatible with Topeak MTX trunk bags and MTX rear baskets and the rack fits all frames with disc brakes. Includes all mounting hardware.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Fits all frames with disc brakesBraze-on type attachmentsRX QuickTrack system compatibleIncludes all mounting hardwarePrecision welding at all critical support pointsSolid fender topRedLite mountTail light mountMade of strong and lightweight hollow 6061 T-6 aluminumSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 55 poundsSize 13.4 by 9.3 by 16.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.63 pounds", "text": "Topeak Super Tourist Tubular Bicycle Trunk Rack DX with Side Bar for Disc Brake Bikes The Super Tourist is a classic loaded touring rack for road bikes designed for compatibility with disc brakes. 6061-T6 aluminum construction with 6061-T6 aluminum bracket, hollow aluminum tubes, and stainless steel hardware makes it strong and lightweight while the integrated top fender offers splash protection. The QuickTrack mounting system is compatible with Topeak MTX trunk bags and MTX rear baskets and the rack fits all frames with disc brakes. Includes all mounting hardware.Topeak's QuickTrack system makes mounting any QuickTrack equipped bag or basket to a Topeak rear rack incredibly easy. Simply line up the composite QuickTrack base with the channels on any Topeak rear rack and slide forward until it clicks into place--there are no tools, no straps, and no hassles. To remove, simply push the yellow release button and slide the bag or basket rearward until completely disengaged.Features:Fits all frames with disc brakesBraze-on type attachmentsRX QuickTrack system compatibleIncludes all mounting hardwarePrecision welding at all critical support pointsSolid fender topRedLite mountTail light mountMade of strong and lightweight hollow 6061 T-6 aluminumSpecifications:Weight Capacity: 55 poundsSize 13.4 by 9.3 by 16.1 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 1.63 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nmh8cQh5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKHN6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 54.95}}
