{"item_id": "B000ZKNFXY", "title": "Crystal River Live Release Net", "description": "Unique bow shape, shallow bag design, minimizes the risk of injury to fish prior to release. High quality laminated hardwood bow measures 14\" x 7\" and includes removable elastic lanyard.", "text": "Crystal River Live Release Net Unique bow shape, shallow bag design, minimizes the risk of injury to fish prior to release. High quality laminated hardwood bow measures 14\" x 7\" and includes removable elastic lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4122ObN4VPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKNFXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crystal River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Nets"]], "price": 19.43}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKNHAA", "title": "Crystal River C/R Fly Fishing Vest", "description": "Lightweight khaki cotton/polyester blend fly vest features loads of storage pouches for the avid fly fisherman. Featuring shearling fly patch, hook and loop-flapped pouches, zippered compartments, D-rings, inside pouches, and nylon front zipper. Washable.", "text": "Crystal River C/R Fly Fishing Vest Lightweight khaki cotton/polyester blend fly vest features loads of storage pouches for the avid fly fisherman. Featuring shearling fly patch, hook and loop-flapped pouches, zippered compartments, D-rings, inside pouches, and nylon front zipper. Washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416QbbX9U8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKNHAA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Jackets & Vests", "Vests"]]}}
