{"item_id": "B000ZKSUJI", "title": "Unique Sports Products Ball Doctor", "description": "Ball Doctor seals leaks and punctures in all valve inflateable balls without a bladder. Simply insert the syringe tip into the ball valve and depress the plunger. Then pump up the air pressure, bounce the ball vigorously for several minutes, and its ready to play! Available in single 1oz packs, Quart size with syringe, and Gallon size with syringe.", "text": "Unique Sports Products Ball Doctor Ball Doctor seals leaks and punctures in all valve inflateable balls without a bladder. Simply insert the syringe tip into the ball valve and depress the plunger. Then pump up the air pressure, bounce the ball vigorously for several minutes, and its ready to play! Available in single 1oz packs, Quart size with syringe, and Gallon size with syringe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fGN5BvTXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZKSUJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unique Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories", "Inflation Device Accessories"]], "price": 5.56}}
{"item_id": "B000ZKSXOK", "title": "Shimano Solora 2 Piece Spinning Rod", "description": "Designed to be ideal tools for new and learning anglers to perfect the art, Solora rods are built from durable aeroglass fiberglass and feature comfortable cork fore- and reargrip handles. With solid locking graphite reel seats and reinforced aluminum oxide guides, the Solora Series offers quality you can count on.The Solora Spinning Rods are equipped with comfortable cork handles, solid locking graphite reel seats, and aluminum oxide guides.SpecificationsModelLengthPowerActionLine RatingPowerPro Line RatingLure RatingPiecesForegrip LengthReargrip LengthGuide NumberHandle StylesSLS56M25 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/8-1/2 ounces22.5 inches6 inchesTip+4BSLS60M26 feetMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces22.5 inches6.5 inchesTip+4CSLS66M26 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces22.5 inches7.5 inchesTip+5DSLS70M27 feetMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces23 inches8 inchesTip+5E", "text": "Shimano Solora 2 Piece Spinning Rod Designed to be ideal tools for new and learning anglers to perfect the art, Solora rods are built from durable aeroglass fiberglass and feature comfortable cork fore- and reargrip handles. With solid locking graphite reel seats and reinforced aluminum oxide guides, the Solora Series offers quality you can count on.The Solora Spinning Rods are equipped with comfortable cork handles, solid locking graphite reel seats, and aluminum oxide guides.SpecificationsModelLengthPowerActionLine RatingPowerPro Line RatingLure RatingPiecesForegrip LengthReargrip LengthGuide NumberHandle StylesSLS56M25 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/8-1/2 ounces22.5 inches6 inchesTip+4BSLS60M26 feetMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces22.5 inches6.5 inchesTip+4CSLS66M26 feet, 6 inchesMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces22.5 inches7.5 inchesTip+5DSLS70M27 feetMediumFast6-14 pounds10-201/4-5/8 ounces23 inches8 inchesTip+5E", "image_url": "http://