{"item_id": "B000ZPJHJA", "title": "Standard Bags Color: Red and Royal Blue", "description": "8012 Color: Red and Royal Blue Features: -Made of quality duck cloth material.-Double stitched.-Filled with whole corn kernels.-Weighs between 15-16 ounces as prescribed by the ACA.-Made in the USA.-12 Ounce duck cloth. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 6\" H x 6\" W x 1.5\" D.", "text": "Standard Bags Color: Red and Royal Blue 8012 Color: Red and Royal Blue Features: -Made of quality duck cloth material.-Double stitched.-Filled with whole corn kernels.-Weighs between 15-16 ounces as prescribed by the ACA.-Made in the USA.-12 Ounce duck cloth. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 6\" H x 6\" W x 1.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61yUcu2pGyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B000ZPJHJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victory Tailgate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Bags"]], "price": 24.99}}
