{"item_id": "B00102DR70", "title": "Camelbak Water Bottle (0.5 Liter)", "description": "An ideal size for the treadmill, around campus, or to quench a child's thirst, the Camelbak Water Bottle 0.5 Liter offers just enough volume for around town use with the added benefit of a drip and spill proof, self-sealing Big Bite Valve. This innovative valve makes drinking on-the-go easy. There's no need to unscrew a lid, just sip from the valve until refreshed. And with a built-in straw, there's no need to tip your head back when sipping. The bottle is made of super tough Lexan polycarbonate, a virtually indestructible material that accepts boiling water and is top rack dishwasher safe. A ring handle provides a clipping point for carabiners to attach the bottle to backpacks, belts, strollers, and athletic bags.", "text": "Camelbak Water Bottle (0.5 Liter) An ideal size for the treadmill, around campus, or to quench a child's thirst, the Camelbak Water Bottle 0.5 Liter offers just enough volume for around town use with the added benefit of a drip and spill proof, self-sealing Big Bite Valve. This innovative valve makes drinking on-the-go easy. There's no need to unscrew a lid, just sip from the valve until refreshed. And with a built-in straw, there's no need to tip your head back when sipping. The bottle is made of super tough Lexan polycarbonate, a virtually indestructible material that accepts boiling water and is top rack dishwasher safe. A ring handle provides a clipping point for carabiners to attach the bottle to backpacks, belts, strollers, and athletic bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BGGRMYcjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00102DR70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0010345W0", "title": "Mirrycle Incredibell Big Bicycle Bell", "description": "Made of solid brass, this bell's melodic sound is full and old-fashioned. Big and brassy, the perfect accompaniment for cruisers, comfort, and town bikes. Available in brass or chrome.", "text": "Mirrycle Incredibell Big Bicycle Bell Made of solid brass, this bell's melodic sound is full and old-fashioned. Big and brassy, the perfect accompaniment for cruisers, comfort, and town bikes. Available in brass or chrome.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419F%2Be3r3LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010345W0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Accessories"]], "price": 9.31}}
{"item_id": "B001035E2U", "title": "Knoxx SpecOps Stock™ Black, MOSSBERG", "description": "Knoxx SpecOps Stock fits any shooter. Over 4\" of adjustment Adjsuts from 11 1/4\" to 15 1/4\" length-of-pull to fit all shooters; Perfect fit with all tactical or hunting attire; Dual recoil compensation eliminates harsh recoil of even the most potent loads up to 95%; Designed to cut muzzle rise and keep you on target; Lightweight alloy and polymer construction; Weighs 2 lbs., 10 ozs. State Style. Take stock by making an investment today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Knoxx SpecOps Stock, Black", "text": "Knoxx SpecOps Stock™ Black, MOSSBERG Knoxx SpecOps Stock fits any shooter. Over 4\" of adjustment Adjsuts from 11 1/4\" to 15 1/4\" length-of-pull to fit all shooters; Perfect fit with all tactical or hunting attire; Dual recoil compensation eliminates harsh recoil of even the most potent loads up to 95%; Designed to cut muzzle rise and keep you on target; Lightweight alloy and polymer construction; Weighs 2 lbs., 10 ozs. State Style. Take stock by making an investment today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Knoxx SpecOps Stock, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yEVXB10hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001035E2U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00104UMZS", "title": "US Military Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest", "description": "This is a Current U.S. Government issue Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest. It has two main pouches on each side that will hold two M16 magazines each, below that is a pouch designed to hold one grenade. The padded shoulder straps are adjustable and there are two adjustable buckles on the front. The webbing on each side is also adjustable. At the bottom there are loops to secure this to your belt. These have been stored for a while but do not appear to have been issued to troops, so they are in great shape.", "text": "US Military Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest This is a Current U.S. Government issue Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest. It has two main pouches on each side that will hold two M16 magazines each, below that is a pouch designed to hold one grenade. The padded shoulder straps are adjustable and there are two adjustable buckles on the front. The webbing on each side is also adjustable. At the bottom there are loops to secure this to your belt. These have been stored for a while but do not appear to have been issued to troops, so they are in great shape.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GzntsmT3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00104UMZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reyes Industries, inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B00106GVLA", "title": "Mares Puck Wrist Dive Computer", "description": "The new Puck series computer from Mares is perfect for those in need of pure ease. A full function RGBM dive computer with larger digits for easy reading and backlight on demand. The Mares Puck Dive Computer has a single button with easy access to smoothly scroll through the menu options.Also available in 2 gauge (style 414420) and 3 gauge (style 414421) consoles.Features:RGBM (Reduced Gradient Bubble Model)-algorithmFull Function Air/Nitrox Dive ComputerPrecautionary Program SettingsNitrox Programmable (21-50%)Ascent rate indicatorDiver-replaceable batteriesFresh and salt waterPowerful backlightAir/Nitrox/Bottom timer modesNitrogen bar graphAudible alarmsTemperature DisplayAutomatic Altitude AdjustableDEPTH: 492 feetComputer user changeable Imperial/MetricDive Log: 38 hours/50 divesView our full selection ofDive Computers", "text": "Mares Puck Wrist Dive Computer The new Puck series computer from Mares is perfect for those in need of pure ease. A full function RGBM dive computer with larger digits for easy reading and backlight on demand. The Mares Puck Dive Computer has a single button with easy access to smoothly scroll through the menu options.Also available in 2 gauge (style 414420) and 3 gauge (style 414421) consoles.Features:RGBM (Reduced Gradient Bubble Model)-algorithmFull Function Air/Nitrox Dive ComputerPrecautionary Program SettingsNitrox Programmable (21-50%)Ascent rate indicatorDiver-replaceable batteriesFresh and salt waterPowerful backlightAir/Nitrox/Bottom timer modesNitrogen bar graphAudible alarmsTemperature DisplayAutomatic Altitude AdjustableDEPTH: 492 feetComputer user changeable Imperial/MetricDive Log: 38 hours/50 divesView our full selection ofDive Computers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jNHTwUTML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00106GVLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mares", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling"]], "price": 188.95}}
{"item_id": "B001094H8G", "title": "Decal G20FGR Rubber Texture Pistol Grip for Glock 3rd Generation Models 20/21 (Not for Short Frame), Black", "description": "Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "text": "Decal G20FGR Rubber Texture Pistol Grip for Glock 3rd Generation Models 20/21 (Not for Short Frame), Black Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419lejyiYqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001094H8G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Decal Grip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.28}}
{"item_id": "B001099MVS", "title": "New Advanced Technology Black w/Ghost Ring Sights Heat Shield Universal SBS4600 High Quality", "description": "Advanced Technology Black w/Ghost Ring Sights Heat Shield Universal SBS4600Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "New Advanced Technology Black w/Ghost Ring Sights Heat Shield Universal SBS4600 High Quality Advanced Technology Black w/Ghost Ring Sights Heat Shield Universal SBS4600Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21%2BA95MRWrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001099MVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001099PLK", "title": "Rubber Texture Decal Grips for Glock pistols", "description": "The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "text": "Rubber Texture Decal Grips for Glock pistols The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nn7OD4zEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001099PLK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001099RQS", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 29 Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-29 replaces the magazine base plate and retains all other factory components on a Glock 29 magazine. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides about 1/2\" additional length for better control and comfort. Will NOT fit the Glock 30 magazine", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 29 Grip Extension The Pearce PG-29 replaces the magazine base plate and retains all other factory components on a Glock 29 magazine. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides about 1/2\" additional length for better control and comfort. Will NOT fit the Glock 30 magazine", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KVtBnfMIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001099RQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.38}}
{"item_id": "B00109AAN2", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 1-Quart Bottle", "description": "In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 1-Quart Bottle In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s0y2KKx2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00109AAN2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 14.89}}
{"item_id": "B0010AHVH4", "title": "Brooks Heritage Saddles B17 Standard Aged Saddle - Men's", "description": "Get used to idiots making lame comments about grundle-suffering when you bolt a Brooks B17 Aged Standard Saddle to your two-wheeled partner. To those not in the know, cracking jokes about a hard-looking torture device of a saddle is hee-larious. Just grin and bear it, and make a comment about your tougher-than-average nether region. Keep to yourself the fact that this supple, handmade leather saddle has conformed to your posterior and provides more comfort than the boobtube-addicted, comedy-genius' worn-out couch.", "text": "Brooks Heritage Saddles B17 Standard Aged Saddle - Men's Get used to idiots making lame comments about grundle-suffering when you bolt a Brooks B17 Aged Standard Saddle to your two-wheeled partner. To those not in the know, cracking jokes about a hard-looking torture device of a saddle is hee-larious. Just grin and bear it, and make a comment about your tougher-than-average nether region. Keep to yourself the fact that this supple, handmade leather saddle has conformed to your posterior and provides more comfort than the boobtube-addicted, comedy-genius' worn-out couch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vKEpJ7A1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010AHVH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brooks Saddles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 103.95}}
