{"item_id": "B0010VXEB0", "title": "Cycle Cycling Shorts 8 Panel Black/Yellow - MENS", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. These high performance breathable shorts are technically designed for serious cyclists. Incorporating an 8 panel professional construction with flat stitched seams, which allow the shorts more curvature whilst minimising chafing and therefore offering the cyclist better performance and comfort.Anatomically designed and shaped; constructed with our single layer professional moulded pad, for greater comfort, at an affordable price. Superior leg grippers, prevent the garment riding-up. A perfect blend of high density nylon & spandex fibres, ensure that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. Available in various waist sizes and 5 colours/styles.", "text": "Cycle Cycling Shorts 8 Panel Black/Yellow - MENS Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. These high performance breathable shorts are technically designed for serious cyclists. Incorporating an 8 panel professional construction with flat stitched seams, which allow the shorts more curvature whilst minimising chafing and therefore offering the cyclist better performance and comfort.Anatomically designed and shaped; constructed with our single layer professional moulded pad, for greater comfort, at an affordable price. Superior leg grippers, prevent the garment riding-up. A perfect blend of high density nylon & spandex fibres, ensure that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. Available in various waist sizes and 5 colours/styles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sL3JnTpQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010VXEB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0010VXQ90", "title": "Kool Stop Eagle Claw 2 Cantilever Bicycle Brake Shoes", "description": "Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Eagle 2 Canti Threaded Brake Pads are a revolutionary pad that first utilized the hardened reinforced steel internal backbone. This larger pad has been used in all areas of cycling and is a good choice when frame, wheel and fork design allow. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-E2TB) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-E2TSA) Hardened and Plated reinforced steel backbone Patented Angled tip plow Water grooves Pad-Lock washer system Threaded Post Weight per pair: 54.7 grams Overall length: 64.1 mm Pad contact width: 10.3 mm", "text": "Kool Stop Eagle Claw 2 Cantilever Bicycle Brake Shoes Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Eagle 2 Canti Threaded Brake Pads are a revolutionary pad that first utilized the hardened reinforced steel internal backbone. This larger pad has been used in all areas of cycling and is a good choice when frame, wheel and fork design allow. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-E2TB) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-E2TSA) Hardened and Plated reinforced steel backbone Patented Angled tip plow Water grooves Pad-Lock washer system Threaded Post Weight per pair: 54.7 grams Overall length: 64.1 mm Pad contact width: 10.3 mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qJQnqGgQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010VXQ90.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0010VXQIQ", "title": "Lizard Skins Head Seal", "description": "The Lizard Skins Head Seal is an inexpensive way to protect any bikes most valuable bearing set: the bottom headset race. This neoprene Lizard Skin Headseal provides protection from dirt and grime getting in as well as some water protection Easily attaches without tools", "text": "Lizard Skins Head Seal The Lizard Skins Head Seal is an inexpensive way to protect any bikes most valuable bearing set: the bottom headset race. This neoprene Lizard Skin Headseal provides protection from dirt and grime getting in as well as some water protection Easily attaches without tools", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HRO33WZFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010VXQIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lizard Skins", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Headsets"]], "price": 4.49}}
