{"item_id": "B0010XAUGU", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 3 Tactical Black Holster", "description": "The SERPA Level 3 Tactical Holster is BLACKHAWK!'s highest level of function, retention, and security! Featuring a flexible thigh platform designed for breathability, comfort, and stability, this full-length holster includes a thumb-activated Pivot Guard and SERPA Auto Lock release. The Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly while quick-disconnect swivel buckles on the belt mounts deliver maximum mobility. • Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size • Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket • Quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting • Accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc. • Rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding • Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release • Thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security • No thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw • Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique • Immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety • No snaps or hoods to accidentally open • Full-length holster body protects rear sights • Same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty • Hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 3 Tactical Black Holster The SERPA Level 3 Tactical Holster is BLACKHAWK!'s highest level of function, retention, and security! Featuring a flexible thigh platform designed for breathability, comfort, and stability, this full-length holster includes a thumb-activated Pivot Guard and SERPA Auto Lock release. The Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly while quick-disconnect swivel buckles on the belt mounts deliver maximum mobility. • Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size • Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket • Quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting • Accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc. • Rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding • Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release • Thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security • No thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw • Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique • Immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety • No snaps or hoods to accidentally open • Full-length holster body protects rear sights • Same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty • Hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ro-U--bgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XAUGU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0010XAV32", "title": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Smith and Wesson J-Frame Round Butt, Black, Rubber Overmold Grip with Front Activation", "description": "If you ever need to defend yourself with your revolver, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have lasergrips’ dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "text": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Smith and Wesson J-Frame Round Butt, Black, Rubber Overmold Grip with Front Activation If you ever need to defend yourself with your revolver, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have lasergrips’ dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eTh9Ton1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XAV32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 259.99}}
{"item_id": "B0010XCNIS", "title": "Break-Free BCF-3-12 Bore Cleaning", "description": "Break Free BF-BCF3 Bore Cleaning Foam 3oz Break Free BF-BCF3 Bore Cleaning Foam 3oz Features: Non-toxic and odorless, Bore Cleaning Foam chemically removes copper and brass compounds from the barrel in 15 minutes, and leaves a protective film behind to impede the accumulation of residue. Bore Cleaning Foam has a pH value of 12 and can be used between the temperatures of -22 and 122F. Packaged in an aerosol can, Bore Cleaning Foam is easier to use than other ammonia-based products. In addition, this cleaner also removes normal combustion waste from your gun's barrel, eliminating the need for a second cleaner. 3oz", "text": "Break-Free BCF-3-12 Bore Cleaning Break Free BF-BCF3 Bore Cleaning Foam 3oz Break Free BF-BCF3 Bore Cleaning Foam 3oz Features: Non-toxic and odorless, Bore Cleaning Foam chemically removes copper and brass compounds from the barrel in 15 minutes, and leaves a protective film behind to impede the accumulation of residue. Bore Cleaning Foam has a pH value of 12 and can be used between the temperatures of -22 and 122F. Packaged in an aerosol can, Bore Cleaning Foam is easier to use than other ammonia-based products. In addition, this cleaner also removes normal combustion waste from your gun's barrel, eliminating the need for a second cleaner. 3oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31v6MuMiReL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XCNIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BreakFree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B0010XCOH8", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P239 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P239 Rubber Grip with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ebRbzUDUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XCOH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.63}}
{"item_id": "B0010XCT78", "title": "BSA 6 - 24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope Matte Black", "description": "Long - reaching BSA 6 - 24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope, SAVE BIG! The glass you need for hunting success at a distance! BSA's crown jewel, this tactical driver offers amazing versatility. Survey the terrain at a moderate 6X, or crank out to an impressive 24X magnification. Ready for action: 6-24X multi-coated optics for extreme long-range accuracy. Climate Xtreme Protection for wide-ranging clarity.; 40 mm objective ; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 14.7' at 6X, 4.7' at 24X; Mil Dot reticle; 1/8\" M.O.A. at 100 yds.; Adjustable objective; Parallax setting, 15 yds. to infinity; Hand-adjustable windage / elevation turrets; 100% waterproof, fogproof and shockproof; 3 to 3 1/4\" eye relief; Screw-on lens cover. 1\" tube. 16\" long with 4\" sunshade.; Weighs 20 ozs. Buy rings separately; Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA 6-24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope, Matte Black", "text": "BSA 6 - 24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope Matte Black Long - reaching BSA 6 - 24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope, SAVE BIG! The glass you need for hunting success at a distance! BSA's crown jewel, this tactical driver offers amazing versatility. Survey the terrain at a moderate 6X, or crank out to an impressive 24X magnification. Ready for action: 6-24X multi-coated optics for extreme long-range accuracy. Climate Xtreme Protection for wide-ranging clarity.; 40 mm objective ; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 14.7' at 6X, 4.7' at 24X; Mil Dot reticle; 1/8\" M.O.A. at 100 yds.; Adjustable objective; Parallax setting, 15 yds. to infinity; Hand-adjustable windage / elevation turrets; 100% waterproof, fogproof and shockproof; 3 to 3 1/4\" eye relief; Screw-on lens cover. 1\" tube. 16\" long with 4\" sunshade.; Weighs 20 ozs. Buy rings separately; Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA 6-24x40 mm Mil Dot Tactical Scope, Matte Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MN0TYozeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XCT78.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0010XDQDY", "title": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Ruger Gp100 and Ruger Super Redhawk, Black", "description": "If you ever need to defend yourself with your revolver, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have lasergrips’ dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "text": "Crimson Trace Lasergrip for Ruger Gp100 and Ruger Super Redhawk, Black If you ever need to defend yourself with your revolver, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have lasergrips’ dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XtL%2BM7gwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010XDQDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 295.06}}
