{"item_id": "B0010Y4UXI", "title": "Wildgame Innovations Digital Directional Power Control Unit", "description": "The TH-DT digital directional power control unit features a battery-type auto detect feature that tells you what voltage battery is connected to timer (6V or 12V), 1-6 available feed times (1-30 seconds per), adjustable motor speed control (low, medium, high) and a large, easy-to-view LCD. Large, silicone rubber buttons are weather resistant and easy to use. 4 year warranty. 6V or 12V battery not included.", "text": "Wildgame Innovations Digital Directional Power Control Unit The TH-DT digital directional power control unit features a battery-type auto detect feature that tells you what voltage battery is connected to timer (6V or 12V), 1-6 available feed times (1-30 seconds per), adjustable motor speed control (low, medium, high) and a large, easy-to-view LCD. Large, silicone rubber buttons are weather resistant and easy to use. 4 year warranty. 6V or 12V battery not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qyn5RInmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010Y4UXI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Feeders"]], "price": 37.24}}
{"item_id": "B0010YFO6U", "title": "CUSCUS 6200ci Internal Frame Backpack Hiking Camp Travel Bag Navy", "description": "Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "text": "CUSCUS 6200ci Internal Frame Backpack Hiking Camp Travel Bag Navy Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jDv9Hy4kL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010YFO6U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0010YM9YK", "title": "Cap Barbell Solid Curl Bar with Collars", "description": "Olympic Curl Bar develops upper arm mass, strength and definition. This bar isolates and intensifies development of the bicep and forearm muscles while decreasing discomfort to the elbows and wrists. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "text": "Cap Barbell Solid Curl Bar with Collars Olympic Curl Bar develops upper arm mass, strength and definition. This bar isolates and intensifies development of the bicep and forearm muscles while decreasing discomfort to the elbows and wrists. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NZLpA1VBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010YM9YK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 62.85}}
{"item_id": "B0010YMZ94", "title": "CUSCUS Internal Frame Hiking Travel Backpack 88L 6200ci Camping Journey Red", "description": "Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "text": "CUSCUS Internal Frame Hiking Travel Backpack 88L 6200ci Camping Journey Red Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zP-Cd%2BX0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010YMZ94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B0010YOBB4", "title": "Cap Barbell Olympic Solid 20-Inch Dumbbell Handle", "description": "Olympic Dumbbell Handles are the most durable in its class. Perfect for heavy-duty workouts and are an important addition to any strength-conditioning program that requires a variety of exercises. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm.", "text": "Cap Barbell Olympic Solid 20-Inch Dumbbell Handle Olympic Dumbbell Handles are the most durable in its class. Perfect for heavy-duty workouts and are an important addition to any strength-conditioning program that requires a variety of exercises. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31087KRg5QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010YOBB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0010Z2KFM", "title": "Power Web Finger, Hand, Wrist, And Forearm Exerciser", "description": "For training or rehabilitation, this tool is excellent for strengthening and conditioning the wrist and forearm. Rubber webbing offers different levels of resistance and elasticity; use with 1 finger or all 10. Lightweight and portable. Includes exercise", "text": "Power Web Finger, Hand, Wrist, And Forearm Exerciser For training or rehabilitation, this tool is excellent for strengthening and conditioning the wrist and forearm. Rubber webbing offers different levels of resistance and elasticity; use with 1 finger or all 10. Lightweight and portable. Includes exercise", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417UH7B%2B7rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0010Z2KFM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001123ATE", "title": "Reliance Products Double Doodie Plus Large Toilet Waste Bags (6-Pack)", "description": "Double Doodie Plus large toilet waste bags are designed for easy, no mess waste disposal. Each bag consists of an inner bag containing our Bio-Gel waste gelation and an outer bag that is sealable and leak proof. This bag can be used with our Reliance Flushable Loo or with standard household toilets when plumbing is unavailable.", "text": "Reliance Products Double Doodie Plus Large Toilet Waste Bags (6-Pack) Double Doodie Plus large toilet waste bags are designed for easy, no mess waste disposal. Each bag consists of an inner bag containing our Bio-Gel waste gelation and an outer bag that is sealable and leak proof. This bag can be used with our Reliance Flushable Loo or with standard household toilets when plumbing is unavailable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KUI3CuX-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001123ATE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00112BI0M", "title": "Inflatable Palm Tree Beer/Soda Cooler", "description": "Super cool new inflatable Palm tree and cooler, all in one! This 24\" tropical fish print cooler has a 4 foot palm tree in the center. This cooler will hold ice and many cans or bottles to serve your guests in Cool Luau style by the pool or any where you want to create a tropical look!", "text": "Inflatable Palm Tree Beer/Soda Cooler Super cool new inflatable Palm tree and cooler, all in one! This 24\" tropical fish print cooler has a 4 foot palm tree in the center. This cooler will hold ice and many cans or bottles to serve your guests in Cool Luau style by the pool or any where you want to create a tropical look!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CyqUN9W6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00112BI0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fun Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 19.99}}
