{"item_id": "B00114T938", "title": "Mizuno LR6 Volleyball Kneepad", "description": "The Mizuno LR6 Kneepad features VS-1 padding for complete protection, and the DF Cut pad which provides greater freedom of movement.", "text": "Mizuno LR6 Volleyball Kneepad The Mizuno LR6 Kneepad features VS-1 padding for complete protection, and the DF Cut pad which provides greater freedom of movement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NBWn%2BbVEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00114T938.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00114TRP8", "title": "TITLE Double End Bags", "description": "Top-grade, all-leather construction for extra long usage. Equipped with tough rubber cords so you get lightening quick rebounds and action. Triple nylon stitched with extra reinforced seams to last round after round. Choose from 6\", 7\" or classic 9 inch diameter - any size to meet your needs. A must for all boxing workouts.", "text": "TITLE Double End Bags Top-grade, all-leather construction for extra long usage. Equipped with tough rubber cords so you get lightening quick rebounds and action. Triple nylon stitched with extra reinforced seams to last round after round. Choose from 6\", 7\" or classic 9 inch diameter - any size to meet your needs. A must for all boxing workouts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UgehimwjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00114TRP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Double-End Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00114WE5S", "title": "Title Boxing Traditional Double-Double End Bag Package", "description": "Now get twice the action with all the speed. Practice upstairs and downstairs techniques. Genuine leather construction. Comes complete with tough rubber bungee cord, reinforced nylon cord, and ceiling and floor mounts.", "text": "Title Boxing Traditional Double-Double End Bag Package Now get twice the action with all the speed. Practice upstairs and downstairs techniques. Genuine leather construction. Comes complete with tough rubber bungee cord, reinforced nylon cord, and ceiling and floor mounts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l6fQL8PYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00114WE5S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Double-End Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00114XJF2", "title": "TITLE MEDICINE BALL", "description": "What is a Medicine Ball? Medicine Balls are weighted balls that come in a variety of sizes and weights. There are balls that bounce (gel or water filled) and balls that don't bounce, called dead balls (often sand filled). They range from the size of a baseball to larger than a basketball. The surface can be smooth or textured. Balls have been used for training since the time of the ancient Greeks and the first Olympics: the concept is not new! They are versatile conditioning tools and can be used in many different situations, from rehabilitation to performance enhancement. Some advantages Medicine Balls have over dumbbells include an ability to be easily gripped in one hand. Plus they can be thrown, caught and bounced off a rebounder, the floor or a wall. Why train with a Medicine Ball? 1. Great for explosive training or endurance training 2. Allows you to perform exercises in more than one plane of motion, unlike most machines 3. Medicine Ball exercises allow you to closely simulate the patterns and speed of movement that occur in sports and different work environments 4. Medicine Ball exercises also develop the central nervous system. They improve stabilizer and neutralizer strength by increasing demand on a neuromuscular level 5. There is a high functional carry-over into athletic performance and every day life. TMB 10 - 10\" diameter TMB 13 - 10.5\" diameter TMB 15 - 11.5\" diameter TMB 20 - 12.5\" diamete", "text": "TITLE MEDICINE BALL What is a Medicine Ball? Medicine Balls are weighted balls that come in a variety of sizes and weights. There are balls that bounce (gel or water filled) and balls that don't bounce, called dead balls (often sand filled). They range from the size of a baseball to larger than a basketball. The surface can be smooth or textured. Balls have been used for training since the time of the ancient Greeks and the first Olympics: the concept is not new! They are versatile conditioning tools and can be used in many different situations, from rehabilitation to performance enhancement. Some advantages Medicine Balls have over dumbbells include an ability to be easily gripped in one hand. Plus they can be thrown, caught and bounced off a rebounder, the floor or a wall. Why train with a Medicine Ball? 1. Great for explosive training or endurance training 2. Allows you to perform exercises in more than one plane of motion, unlike most machines 3. Medicine Ball exercises allow you to closely simulate the patterns and speed of movement that occur in sports and different work environments 4. Medicine Ball exercises also develop the central nervous system. They improve stabilizer and neutralizer strength by increasing demand on a neuromuscular level 5. There is a high functional carry-over into athletic performance and every day life. TMB 10 - 10\" diameter TMB 13 - 10.5\" diameter TMB 15 - 11.5\" diameter TMB 20 - 12.5\" diamete", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tXmYiGTIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00114XJF2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Medicine Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001152MD6", "title": "Title Boxing Strong Hands Weighted Gloves", "description": "Awesome design and innovation make for superior cross-training workout. Ideal for shadow boxing, roadwork, cross-training and much more. Neoprene conforming material with all leather mix for snug and secure fit. So practical and comfortable you won't want to take them off.", "text": "Title Boxing Strong Hands Weighted Gloves Awesome design and innovation make for superior cross-training workout. Ideal for shadow boxing, roadwork, cross-training and much more. Neoprene conforming material with all leather mix for snug and secure fit. So practical and comfortable you won't want to take them off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QOu5rmzdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001152MD6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Title Boxing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00115HFME", "title": "TITLE Platinum Punch Mitts Pair", "description": "Ideal for taking in jabs, straight shots, hooks, uppercuts, angled shots, overhands and more. Awesome curved design is more anatomically correct for user and coach. New hook-and-loop wrist attachment with D-ring secures snug to wrist and hands. Now with almost 3\" of special contoured shock-absorbing padding, back finger cover, wrist padding on front and back and moisture wicking lining for cool and comfortable wear. Black leather design with Platinum accents and target circle.", "text": "TITLE Platinum Punch Mitts Pair Ideal for taking in jabs, straight shots, hooks, uppercuts, angled shots, overhands and more. Awesome curved design is more anatomically correct for user and coach. New hook-and-loop wrist attachment with D-ring secures snug to wrist and hands. Now with almost 3\" of special contoured shock-absorbing padding, back finger cover, wrist padding on front and back and moisture wicking lining for cool and comfortable wear. Black leather design with Platinum accents and target circle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wtK1glGwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00115HFME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Title Boxing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B00115J1VC", "title": "Ringside 150 -Poundheavy Duty Heavy Bag Spring", "description": "Lessens shock so bag mounts last longer. Manufactured for use with bags as heavy as 150 lbs.", "text": "Ringside 150 -Poundheavy Duty Heavy Bag Spring Lessens shock so bag mounts last longer. Manufactured for use with bags as heavy as 150 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PbdOD9nZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00115J1VC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ringside", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Pads"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00115KZE4", "title": "TITLE Boxing Mexican Style Hand Wraps (Single Pair)", "description": "Super tough, slightly elastic material offers one-of-a-kind form fit and protection. A full 180 inches in length. Hook-and-loop closure for self attachment.", "text": "TITLE Boxing Mexican Style Hand Wraps (Single Pair) Super tough, slightly elastic material offers one-of-a-kind form fit and protection. A full 180 inches in length. Hook-and-loop closure for self attachment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61lAY5f8Q8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00115KZE4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Headgear"]], "price": 12.7}}
{"item_id": "B00115PE7W", "title": "Shimano PD-M770 Deore XT SPD Mountain Bike Pedals", "description": "Dual-sided clipless engagement bindings with XT logo and graphics. Revised cleat interface for increased stability and solid engagement . Adjustable cleat tension with indicator (uses SH51/SH56 cleats). Flourine coated binding/clips for long lasting entry/release precision . Open design clears mud/debris for consistent clip-in action. 8mm broach for installation/removal. Sealed, ball-bearing design.", "text": "Shimano PD-M770 Deore XT SPD Mountain Bike Pedals Dual-sided clipless engagement bindings with XT logo and graphics. Revised cleat interface for increased stability and solid engagement . Adjustable cleat tension with indicator (uses SH51/SH56 cleats). Flourine coated binding/clips for long lasting entry/release precision . Open design clears mud/debris for consistent clip-in action. 8mm broach for installation/removal. Sealed, ball-bearing design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41URH1FSK2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00115PE7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 108.81}}
{"item_id": "B001167V9U", "title": "SE Small Pill/ID Holder Keychain (Set of 6)", "description": "ID Holder Comes with key chain Assorted Colors (Red, Blue, Green, Black, Purple & Silver) Includes Plastic Tube Inside Each ID Holder (Not For Medical Use) Size: 1 7/16 in. X 33/64 in.", "text": "SE Small Pill/ID Holder Keychain (Set of 6) ID Holder Comes with key chain Assorted Colors (Red, Blue, Green, Black, Purple & Silver) Includes Plastic Tube Inside Each ID Holder (Not For Medical Use) Size: 1 7/16 in. X 33/64 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ip1ttY1uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001167V9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 5.93}}
{"item_id": "B00116RYOC", "title": "Outers 1-Piece Universal Coated Steel Cleaning Rod - .22 Caliber and larger (33-Inch)", "description": "Outers offers several options of cleaning rods from durable, one-piece coated steel rods to compact, economical three-piece aluminum sets. All rods and accessories have industry standard threads that can easily interchange with our brushes, mops, and tips, or accessories from another manufacturer. This rod provides a sturdy, strong option that won't mar or scratch your barrel.", "text": "Outers 1-Piece Universal Coated Steel Cleaning Rod - .22 Caliber and larger (33-Inch) Outers offers several options of cleaning rods from durable, one-piece coated steel rods to compact, economical three-piece aluminum sets. All rods and accessories have industry standard threads that can easily interchange with our brushes, mops, and tips, or accessories from another manufacturer. This rod provides a sturdy, strong option that won't mar or scratch your barrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21SpOr2osmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00116RYOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00116ZOAI", "title": "Cold Steel Ti-Lite Knife", "description": "Ti-Litetactical folders evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950’s-styled switchblade. Unlike most switchblades however, they are legal to carry nearly everywhere. They feature Japanese made AUS 8A stainless steel blades with a bead blast finish, razor sharp edges and sturdy, needle sharp points. The CNC milled handles are forged from super tough 7075 Aluminum billets and are given an attractive bead blast surface and finished with a protective EDP (Electric Discharge Plating) coating. And for maximum strength and safety, we have equipped our Ti-Liteswith our patent pending, stainless steel leaf spring locks (proven, in our tests, to hold 130 lbs). For ease of carry, the Ti-Litescome equipped with a small, but unobtrusive steel pocket clip, and can be opened rapidly by using the thumb studs or by snagging a quillion on the edge of your pocket as you draw your knife out.", "text": "Cold Steel Ti-Lite Knife Ti-Litetactical folders evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950’s-styled switchblade. Unlike most switchblades however, they are legal to carry nearly everywhere. They feature Japanese made AUS 8A stainless steel blades with a bead blast finish, razor sharp edges and sturdy, needle sharp points. The CNC milled handles are forged from super tough 7075 Aluminum billets and are given an attractive bead blast surface and finished with a protective EDP (Electric Discharge Plating) coating. And for maximum strength and safety, we have equipped our Ti-Liteswith our patent pending, stainless steel leaf spring locks (proven, in our tests, to hold 130 lbs). For ease of carry, the Ti-Litescome equipped with a small, but unobtrusive steel pocket clip, and can be opened rapidly by using the thumb studs or by snagging a quillion on the edge of your pocket as you draw your knife out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ijREOJUpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00116ZOAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
