{"item_id": "B0011FUXHI", "title": "Park Tool Bike Cleaning Brush Set - BCB-4", "description": "The Park BCB-4 Brush Set includes 4 unique brushes, each designed for a specific purpose in keeping your bike super-clean. A double-ended gear brush helps free packed dirt in between cogs, chains, and rings. For frame tubes and wheels, Park supplies a soft bristle three-quarter circle brush.Every bicycle has plenty of hard to reach nooks and crannies; around derailleurs, brakes, or stays, just to name a few. For those challenging spots, there's a tapered detail brush. Completing the set is a sponge brush for delicate finishes.Double-ended gear brush Tire and frame tube cleaning brush Tapered detail brush Frame-cleaning sponge brushProduct FeaturesMaterial: plastic, rubber, steelVolume:Recommended Use: plastic, rubber, steelManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "text": "Park Tool Bike Cleaning Brush Set - BCB-4 The Park BCB-4 Brush Set includes 4 unique brushes, each designed for a specific purpose in keeping your bike super-clean. A double-ended gear brush helps free packed dirt in between cogs, chains, and rings. For frame tubes and wheels, Park supplies a soft bristle three-quarter circle brush.Every bicycle has plenty of hard to reach nooks and crannies; around derailleurs, brakes, or stays, just to name a few. For those challenging spots, there's a tapered detail brush. Completing the set is a sponge brush for delicate finishes.Double-ended gear brush Tire and frame tube cleaning brush Tapered detail brush Frame-cleaning sponge brushProduct FeaturesMaterial: plastic, rubber, steelVolume:Recommended Use: plastic, rubber, steelManufacturer Warranty: lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fbG5hmvyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011FUXHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 18.86}}
{"item_id": "B0011FWLFU", "title": "Delta Cycle Substitute Cross Bar", "description": "The Crossbar Substitute works as a top tube for easier rack mounting. For use with \"hang-on\" type car racks. Quick release clamps instantly adjusts to correct size for carrying \"Y\" frames or other unusual frames on common car racs. Sturdy construction with thick rubber coating to protect bike's finish. Distance between hooks maximum 21.25-Inch and minimum 12.25-Inch. Distance from seat post to stem maximum 25.25-Inch and minimum 14.25-Inch.", "text": "Delta Cycle Substitute Cross Bar The Crossbar Substitute works as a top tube for easier rack mounting. For use with \"hang-on\" type car racks. Quick release clamps instantly adjusts to correct size for carrying \"Y\" frames or other unusual frames on common car racs. Sturdy construction with thick rubber coating to protect bike's finish. Distance between hooks maximum 21.25-Inch and minimum 12.25-Inch. Distance from seat post to stem maximum 25.25-Inch and minimum 14.25-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211J9RIrLZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011FWLFU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 23.4}}
{"item_id": "B0011FYH1G", "title": "Wald 135 Front Grocery Bicycle Basket (14.5 x 9.5 x 9, Black)", "description": "We know you love the 133, 3133, and 157 baskets. But what happens when you want to haul something that isn't overly large, but can really weigh you down? We thought you'd probably bust out a welding torch and tack a couple of legs on the 133 basket. So that's exactly what we did. The 135 is the exact same size as our popular 133 and 3133 baskets with shorter handlebar mounts and legs bolted to the bottom of the basket. Perfect for a couple of two liters, or a six-pack with some chips and salsa to go. Give us some Fat Tire Ale, Mission Restaurant Style Tortilla Triangles and Frog Ranch salsa any day!", "text": "Wald 135 Front Grocery Bicycle Basket (14.5 x 9.5 x 9, Black) We know you love the 133, 3133, and 157 baskets. But what happens when you want to haul something that isn't overly large, but can really weigh you down? We thought you'd probably bust out a welding torch and tack a couple of legs on the 133 basket. So that's exactly what we did. The 135 is the exact same size as our popular 133 and 3133 baskets with shorter handlebar mounts and legs bolted to the bottom of the basket. Perfect for a couple of two liters, or a six-pack with some chips and salsa to go. Give us some Fat Tire Ale, Mission Restaurant Style Tortilla Triangles and Frog Ranch salsa any day!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DUfNdSc3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011FYH1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wald", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 19.36}}
{"item_id": "B0011HVW4E", "title": "Slime Skabs Glueless Patch Kit: 6-Pack", "description": "", "text": "Slime Skabs Glueless Patch Kit: 6-Pack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W8KyT3dBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011HVW4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 3.97}}
{"item_id": "B0011HZKI8", "title": "Trail Gator Bicycle Tow Bar in Black, Red, or Blue", "description": "The Trail-Gator Bicycle Tow Bar converts an ordinary child's bike into a safe, towable trailer bike, whenever desired. To ride attached, simply unclip the tow bar from the stored position on the adult bike, extend it, and connect it to the receiver, which is mounted on the child's bike. When the child's bike is connected, the front wheel is lifted off the ground and a stabilizing bar prevents the handlebars from turning, leaving the adult in control of steering. Children can choose to coast or pedal while they are being towed, making the ride much easier for them. Fits 12\" (30.5cm) - 20\" (50.8cm) tire diameter size child bikes. Adult bike minimum size tire diameter 25\" (63.5cm). Tow bar receiver fits child bikes with head tubes up to 45mm (1.77\") wide in diameter and expands for bolting distance of 105mm (4.1\") for top and bottom U-bolt spacing. Fits adult bike seat post diameter 1\" (25.4mm) - 1.25\" (31.8mm). For use with children up to 70 pounds (32kg). Adult rider must weigh at least twice that of the child rider. Child bike must have rear free wheel capability. (Bike capable of coasting with out pedaling)", "text": "Trail Gator Bicycle Tow Bar in Black, Red, or Blue The Trail-Gator Bicycle Tow Bar converts an ordinary child's bike into a safe, towable trailer bike, whenever desired. To ride attached, simply unclip the tow bar from the stored position on the adult bike, extend it, and connect it to the receiver, which is mounted on the child's bike. When the child's bike is connected, the front wheel is lifted off the ground and a stabilizing bar prevents the handlebars from turning, leaving the adult in control of steering. Children can choose to coast or pedal while they are being towed, making the ride much easier for them. Fits 12\" (30.5cm) - 20\" (50.8cm) tire diameter size child bikes. Adult bike minimum size tire diameter 25\" (63.5cm). Tow bar receiver fits child bikes with head tubes up to 45mm (1.77\") wide in diameter and expands for bolting distance of 105mm (4.1\") for top and bottom U-bolt spacing. Fits adult bike seat post diameter 1\" (25.4mm) - 1.25\" (31.8mm). For use with children up to 70 pounds (32kg). Adult rider must weigh at least twice that of the child rider. Child bike must have rear free wheel capability. (Bike capable of coasting with out pedaling)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ys87kVi8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011HZKI8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers"]], "price": 85.77}}
{"item_id": "B0011KZREC", "title": "Hennesy Hammock Expedition Asym Hammock", "description": "Kick back and relax, take a nap, on those warm days when you want to be outside with the Hennessy Expedition Asym Hammock. It can be anything you want - chair, tent, hammock or lounger. It's very lightweight at just 2.5 pounds and compact. If you're in the woods camping you can set it up to make your comfortable over rocky or wet terrain. There's a self-closing system so you can stay protected from the sun, wind or bad weather even stay safe from flies and mosquitoes. And since we want you to leave the environment the same way you found it, the tree hugger straps prevent damage to tree bark. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253089, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 371890, GTIN: 0832667111115", "text": "Hennesy Hammock Expedition Asym Hammock Kick back and relax, take a nap, on those warm days when you want to be outside with the Hennessy Expedition Asym Hammock. It can be anything you want - chair, tent, hammock or lounger. It's very lightweight at just 2.5 pounds and compact. If you're in the woods camping you can set it up to make your comfortable over rocky or wet terrain. There's a self-closing system so you can stay protected from the sun, wind or bad weather even stay safe from flies and mosquitoes. And since we want you to leave the environment the same way you found it, the tree hugger straps prevent damage to tree bark. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253089, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 371890, GTIN: 0832667111115", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514oXK26kmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011KZREC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hennessy Hammock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 143.96}}
{"item_id": "B0011MXVD4", "title": "Reliance Products Bio-Blue Toilet Deodorant Packaged (12-Pack)", "description": "Bio-Blue toilet deodorant neutralizes and destroys odors. It comes in a soluble, no-mess, pre-meausured pouch. Each box of Bio-Blue contains 12 pouches. Great for camping.", "text": "Reliance Products Bio-Blue Toilet Deodorant Packaged (12-Pack) Bio-Blue toilet deodorant neutralizes and destroys odors. It comes in a soluble, no-mess, pre-meausured pouch. Each box of Bio-Blue contains 12 pouches. Great for camping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d9Vcm71GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011MXVD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0011MYRN2", "title": "Cold Steel Master Hunter Kraton Handle with Stainless (Concealex)", "description": "The spine of the blade is a full 3/16\" thick to allow for the necessary strength and stiffness to field dress and skin the biggest animals like elk, moose, brown bear, and the African Dangerous Seven. The grip is specially designed to promote long use without fatigue. Made of the shock absorbent, slightly tacky feeling Kraton, and featuring our deeply checkered surface, it positively won’t slip no matter how wet or bloody your hands get. Plus, Kraton has specially enduring advantages in that it will never rot, shrink, crack, splinter, or mildew, and is completely impervious to even the harshest weather. For safety, the Master Hunter comes in a thick, heavy Conceal-Ex™ sheath", "text": "Cold Steel Master Hunter Kraton Handle with Stainless (Concealex) The spine of the blade is a full 3/16\" thick to allow for the necessary strength and stiffness to field dress and skin the biggest animals like elk, moose, brown bear, and the African Dangerous Seven. The grip is specially designed to promote long use without fatigue. Made of the shock absorbent, slightly tacky feeling Kraton, and featuring our deeply checkered surface, it positively won’t slip no matter how wet or bloody your hands get. Plus, Kraton has specially enduring advantages in that it will never rot, shrink, crack, splinter, or mildew, and is completely impervious to even the harshest weather. For safety, the Master Hunter comes in a thick, heavy Conceal-Ex™ sheath", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wnz%2B4iSBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011MYRN2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 89.58}}
{"item_id": "B0011N665I", "title": "Polymer Forend with Picatinny Rail for Kel-Tec PLR-16 Pistol", "description": "Description:PLR ForendAdds a polymer forend to the PLR-16 pistol with one Mil-Spec 1913 picatinny rail at the six o'clock position for mounting many types of accessories.Additional Information:", "text": "Polymer Forend with Picatinny Rail for Kel-Tec PLR-16 Pistol Description:PLR ForendAdds a polymer forend to the PLR-16 pistol with one Mil-Spec 1913 picatinny rail at the six o'clock position for mounting many types of accessories.Additional Information:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XpfpkscGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011N665I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0011N6I7O", "title": "Okuma Tundra Surf Spinning Combo", "description": "Okuma-Feet s Tundra combo TU-1002-80 is a 10 foot combo with a sized 80 spinning reel. Has a one ball bearing reel and durable glass fiber rod blank construction. This highly durable spinning combo has aluminum oxide guides, EVA foam grips and reinforced double footed guides.", "text": "Okuma Tundra Surf Spinning Combo Okuma-Feet s Tundra combo TU-1002-80 is a 10 foot combo with a sized 80 spinning reel. Has a one ball bearing reel and durable glass fiber rod blank construction. This highly durable spinning combo has aluminum oxide guides, EVA foam grips and reinforced double footed guides.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ZpGIM-GwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011N6I7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spinning Combos"]], "price": 50.48}}
{"item_id": "B0011N6KQ8", "title": "3pc 6^ Ninja Throwing Quills Spikes Throwers Knife Darts", "description": "3 quill darts with nylon sheath as pictured. Very lightweight design, can attach to forearm or lower ankle area. Practice your ninja cat-like reflexes, place your order today!", "text": "3pc 6^ Ninja Throwing Quills Spikes Throwers Knife Darts 3 quill darts with nylon sheath as pictured. Very lightweight design, can attach to forearm or lower ankle area. Practice your ninja cat-like reflexes, place your order today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kCEFoRscL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011N6KQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Acemas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Ninja Weapons"]], "price": 6.82}}
{"item_id": "B0011NACWG", "title": "Shooters Ridge Compact Field and Range Bag", "description": "Always want to bring a couple of handguns to the range, but don't usually have room? Use the Shooters Ridge Compact Field and Range Bag that allows you to conveniently and legally transport your handgun in either of the lockable padded pistol pouches located on both sides of the bag.Keep track of your gear with professional shooting bags from Shooters Ridge. Designed to hold all the necessary shooting items, these rugged bags keep equipment in good condition—and where you can find it fast. And that's the difference between hunting…and hunting for gear.", "text": "Shooters Ridge Compact Field and Range Bag Always want to bring a couple of handguns to the range, but don't usually have room? Use the Shooters Ridge Compact Field and Range Bag that allows you to conveniently and legally transport your handgun in either of the lockable padded pistol pouches located on both sides of the bag.Keep track of your gear with professional shooting bags from Shooters Ridge. Designed to hold all the necessary shooting items, these rugged bags keep equipment in good condition—and where you can find it fast. And that's the difference between hunting…and hunting for gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414yS4aRPJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011NACWG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0011NGAK4", "title": "Aimpoint M4 2 Minute of Angle ACET CompM4 Sight", "description": "This professional-grade sight is frequently used by law enforcement officers, soldiers, and those who demand the most from their weaponry.The Aimpoint CompM4 sight is part of the company's highest-end series of sights, and features improved energy efficiency, a high battery compartment, and an internal voltage regulator that allows the sight to operate on any AA size battery. Ideal for use with Aimpoint's 3X magnifier scope module, the CompM4 is optimized for use with all generations of night vision devices. The sight boasts a rugged, easy-to-use 16-position manual switch with seven night vision compatible settings and nine daylight settings. Its body is designed to protect both the optics and adjustment components against hard use, and is waterproof to 150 feet. An improved QRP2 Picatinny rail mount eliminates the need for a separate mounting ring.Next Generation Design ImprovementsReady-to-mount:The CompM4 sight is shipped complete with a QRP2 mount and standard AR15 spacer, as well as a killFlash anti-reflection device and MILSPEC rubber lens covers.Integral Mount:An integral mount eliminates the need for a separate ring, and can be customized with vertical and forward spacers to fit a variety of weapon systems.Designed for Third-generation Night Vision:The CompM4 sight can be used with all generations of night vision devices (NVDs), but is optimized for third generation night vision technology.Clear, Bright Image:Unique coating on the front lens reflects the dot's selected frequency of red light at near 100% efficiency to give the highest possible dot brightness with the least amount of energy while other wavelengths in the visible and near-infrared part of the spectrum pass with a minimum of reduction.FeaturesParallax-free with unlimited field of view and eye reliefRugged, durable construction, unaffected by extreme conditionsNo harmful laser emissionsMechanical switch for speed and reliabilityCompatible with every generation of Aimpoint night vision deviceInternal voltage regulator allows unit to be used with any AA size batteryQRP2 mount has twice the clamping force of original QRP, and wider, shorter mounting knob to improve operation and lower risk of snaggingMount base is keyed into body of the sight to absorb recoil, and screws directly into sight; no separate sight ring requiredFront lens opening is threaded for addition of killFlash anti-reflective deviceVertical spacer includedType classified as the U.S. Army's new M68CCOImproved adjustment caps are easier to remove and protected against impactCan be used with a carry handle adapter for use on all M16 riflesOptical Data:LED light source650nm red lightNight vision compatibleAnti-reflex coating on all surfaces and multi-layer coating objective lens1X magnificationElectronic Data:Runs on one AA battery (type CR2032)Approximately 80,000 hours of battery life, or eight years of continuous use500,000 hours of use on NVD settingManual rotary switch dot intensity adjustmentNine DL daylight settingsSeven night vision settingsMechanical Data:High strength extruded aluminum housingHard anodized matte finishOne-click adjustment; 0.5-inch at 80 yardsIntegrated QRP2 quick release mountingEnvironmental Data:-50 to 160 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperature rangeSubmersible to 150 feetDimensions:Sight measures 2.1 by 2.4 by 4.7 inches (W x H x D)Measures 2.8 by 2.8 by 4.7 inches (W x H x D) with mountSight weighs 9.3 ouncesWeighs 11.8 ounces with integrated mountWarrantyAimpoint products include limited manufacturer's warranties of two years for professional or competitive use, and ten years for personal or recreational use.About AimpointIn 1974, a small group of Swedish entrepreneurs started exploring ways to improve shooting accuracy, with the deceptively simple goal of creating a sighting technology that would allow shooters to acquire their target quickly, and hit moving targets in all weather and lighting conditions consistently and accurately. The result of their efforts, the now ubiquitous red dot sight, would eventually revolutionize the shooting and hunting industry.The company's first commercial sight product, the Aimpoint Electronic, was introduced in 1975, and quickly developed a reputation as one of the fastest way to aim a firearm. The Aimpoint red dot sight has continued to evolve over the past 35 years by working closely with experienced hunters, marksmen and military weapon experts, and there are more than one million Aimpoint red dot sights in use worldwide today.", "text": "Aimpoint M4 2 Minute of Angle ACET CompM4 Sight This professional-grade sight is frequently used by law enforcement officers, soldiers, and those who demand the most from their weaponry.The Aimpoint CompM4 sight is part of the company's highest-end series of sights, and features improved energy efficiency, a high battery compartment, and an internal voltage regulator that allows the sight to operate on any AA size battery. Ideal for use with Aimpoint's 3X magnifier scope module, the CompM4 is optimized for use with all generations of night vision devices. The sight boasts a rugged, easy-to-use 16-position manual switch with seven night vision compatible settings and nine daylight settings. Its body is designed to protect both the optics and adjustment components against hard use, and is waterproof to 150 feet. An improved QRP2 Picatinny rail mount eliminates the need for a separate mounting ring.Next Generation Design ImprovementsReady-to-mount:The CompM4 sight is shipped complete with a QRP2 mount and standard AR15 spacer, as well as a killFlash anti-reflection device and MILSPEC rubber lens covers.Integral Mount:An integral mount eliminates the need for a separate ring, and can be customized with vertical and forward spacers to fit a variety of weapon systems.Designed for Third-generation Night Vision:The CompM4 sight can be used with all generations of night vision devices (NVDs), but is optimized for third generation night vision technology.Clear, Bright Image:Unique coating on the front lens reflects the dot's selected frequency of red light at near 100% efficiency to give the highest possible dot brightness with the least amount of energy while other wavelengths in the visible and near-infrared part of the spectrum pass with a minimum of reduction.FeaturesParallax-free with unlimited field of view and eye reliefRugged, durable construction, unaffected by extreme conditionsNo harmful laser emissionsMechanical switch for speed and reliabilityCompatible with every generation of Aimpoint night vision deviceInternal voltage regulator allows unit to be used with any AA size batteryQRP2 mount has twice the clamping force of original QRP, and wider, shorter mounting knob to improve operation and lower risk of snaggingMount base is keyed into body of the sight to absorb recoil, and screws directly into sight; no separate sight ring requiredFront lens opening is threaded for addition of killFlash anti-reflective deviceVertical spacer includedType classified as the U.S. Army's new M68CCOImproved adjustment caps are easier to remove and protected against impactCan be used with a carry handle adapter for use on all M16 riflesOptical Data:LED light source650nm red lightNight vision compatibleAnti-reflex coating on all surfaces and multi-layer coating objective lens1X magnificationElectronic Data:Runs on one AA battery (type CR2032)Approximately 80,000 hours of battery life, or eight years of continuous use500,000 hours of use on NVD settingManual rotary switch dot intensity adjustmentNine DL daylight settingsSeven night vision settingsMechanical Data:High strength extruded aluminum housingHard anodized matte finishOne-click adjustment; 0.5-inch at 80 yardsIntegrated QRP2 quick release mountingEnvironmental Data:-50 to 160 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperature rangeSubmersible to 150 feetDimensions:Sight measures 2.1 by 2.4 by 4.7 inches (W x H x D)Measures 2.8 by 2.8 by 4.7 inches (W x H x D) with mountSight weighs 9.3 ouncesWeighs 11.8 ounces with integrated mountWarrantyAimpoint products include limited manufacturer's warranties of two years for professional or competitive use, and ten years for personal or recreational use.About AimpointIn 1974, a small group of Swedish entrepreneurs started exploring ways to improve shooting accuracy, with the deceptively simple goal of creating a sighting technology that would allow shooters to acquire their target quickly, and hit moving targets in all weather and lighting conditions consistently and accurately. The result of their efforts, the now ubiquitous red dot sight, would eventually revolutionize the shooting and hunting industry.The company's first commercial sight product, the Aimpoint Electronic, was introduced in 1975, and quickly developed a reputation as one of the fastest way to aim a firearm. The Aimpoint red dot sight has continued to evolve over the past 35 years by working closely with experienced hunters, marksmen and military weapon experts, and there are more than one million Aimpoint red dot sights in use worldwide today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OTJwOXPeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011NGAK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimPoint", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 749.99}}
{"item_id": "B0011UZQ2A", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Slant Muzzle Brake", "description": "Reducing muzzle climb, this brake allows the collector to maintain the classic look of the AK while adding a low-cost compliant part. We threw in an enhancement of our own while we were at it; the ambidexterous design makes this brake perfect for left and right handed shooters. Manufactured with the standard AK thread pitch of 14 x 1 LH. Stamped \"TAPCO USA\" and finished in manganese phosphate.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Slant Muzzle Brake Reducing muzzle climb, this brake allows the collector to maintain the classic look of the AK while adding a low-cost compliant part. We threw in an enhancement of our own while we were at it; the ambidexterous design makes this brake perfect for left and right handed shooters. Manufactured with the standard AK thread pitch of 14 x 1 LH. Stamped \"TAPCO USA\" and finished in manganese phosphate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XESYlHwLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011UZQ2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.81}}
{"item_id": "B0011UZQ2U", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Stock System, Blade Bayonet Cut, Dark Earth", "description": "Antiques are made to be hung up on the wall or shoved into a display case, not to be taken out to the range and used on a daily basis. Its time to bring your antique SKS into the modern day with the Intrafuse SKS Stock System. This system gives you a 6 position adjustable T6 stock, so it will accommodate any sized shooter, a SAW Style Pistol Grip for greater comfort and control, and an upper hand guard rail for adding accessories. This version also comes with a cut in the body that will accept a blade bayonet. Our stock system works on most SKS models and is made of the highest strength composite. So, if your ready to leave your original wooden stock in a museum somewhere and transform your SKS into a 21st century tactical weapon, purchase the Intrafuse SKS Stock System today. Counts as 3 U.S. 922r Compliant Parts.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Stock System, Blade Bayonet Cut, Dark Earth Antiques are made to be hung up on the wall or shoved into a display case, not to be taken out to the range and used on a daily basis. Its time to bring your antique SKS into the modern day with the Intrafuse SKS Stock System. This system gives you a 6 position adjustable T6 stock, so it will accommodate any sized shooter, a SAW Style Pistol Grip for greater comfort and control, and an upper hand guard rail for adding accessories. This version also comes with a cut in the body that will accept a blade bayonet. Our stock system works on most SKS models and is made of the highest strength composite. So, if your ready to leave your original wooden stock in a museum somewhere and transform your SKS into a 21st century tactical weapon, purchase the Intrafuse SKS Stock System today. Counts as 3 U.S. 922r Compliant Parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ASms-3LkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011UZQ2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 78.4}}
{"item_id": "B0011VNDD8", "title": "Feedback Sports Truing Station", "description": "Amassing all of the specialty tools needed for your home shop is often a lifelong pursuit. Between the cost of such dedicated tools and ever-changing industry standards, your tool chest is almost always short one tool or another. The lowly truing stand is a tool that often gets overlooked, perhaps for some because tweaking the near-magical balance of a good wheel gives them night sweats, or because of the other tools needed to get the most from a stand. The Feedback Sports Wheel Truing Station's simple, easy-to-use design makes it the ideal choice for home mechanics, and the fact that you won't have to remove the tire to do the job (even massive 29er meats) makes it all the more accessible. The one-armed design makes easy work of wheel maintenance and repairs. The stand can be placed on top of any Feedback Work Stand, or it can stand alone on its sturdy plastic 8 x 10in (203mm X 254mm) base which features organizing slots for wheel tools like spoke wrenches and tire levers.The unique 20in (508mm)long, one-arm design uses your wheels' standard quick releases to secure the wheel in place. As convenient as this is, it does not allow for the truing of any wheel with a thru-axle hub, so early-adopting mountain bikers may want to look elsewhere. It provides easy access to spokes while offering ample clearance for large wheels with tires installed. The run-out indicator can slide all the way up the arm to allow truing of disc brake rotors, taking care of annoying rubbing. The Feedback Sports Wheel Truing Station is made of durable anodized aluminum and weighs in at 7.8lbs (3.5kg) for a nice balance of stability and portability.Product FeaturesMaterial:Clamp Opening:Clamp Height:Base Diameter:Load Capacity:Folded Dimensions:Weight: 7.8 lbRecommended Use: bike maintenanceManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Feedback Sports Truing Station Amassing all of the specialty tools needed for your home shop is often a lifelong pursuit. Between the cost of such dedicated tools and ever-changing industry standards, your tool chest is almost always short one tool or another. The lowly truing stand is a tool that often gets overlooked, perhaps for some because tweaking the near-magical balance of a good wheel gives them night sweats, or because of the other tools needed to get the most from a stand. The Feedback Sports Wheel Truing Station's simple, easy-to-use design makes it the ideal choice for home mechanics, and the fact that you won't have to remove the tire to do the job (even massive 29er meats) makes it all the more accessible. The one-armed design makes easy work of wheel maintenance and repairs. The stand can be placed on top of any Feedback Work Stand, or it can stand alone on its sturdy plastic 8 x 10in (203mm X 254mm) base which features organizing slots for wheel tools like spoke wrenches and tire levers.The unique 20in (508mm)long, one-arm design uses your wheels' standard quick releases to secure the wheel in place. As convenient as this is, it does not allow for the truing of any wheel with a thru-axle hub, so early-adopting mountain bikers may want to look elsewhere. It provides easy access to spokes while offering ample clearance for large wheels with tires installed. The run-out indicator can slide all the way up the arm to allow truing of disc brake rotors, taking care of annoying rubbing. The Feedback Sports Wheel Truing Station is made of durable anodized aluminum and weighs in at 7.8lbs (3.5kg) for a nice balance of stability and portability.Product FeaturesMaterial:Clamp Opening:Clamp Height:Base Diameter:Load Capacity:Folded Dimensions:Weight: 7.8 lbRecommended Use: bike maintenanceManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RENfUUBJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011VNDD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Feedback Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 47.99}}
