{"item_id": "B0011W9Q06", "title": "Zefal Twin Bicycle Tire Gauge", "description": "Versatile tire pressure gauge with graph that shows both bar or psi. Fits either schrader or presta valves. Accurate up to 160psi.", "text": "Zefal Twin Bicycle Tire Gauge Versatile tire pressure gauge with graph that shows both bar or psi. Fits either schrader or presta valves. Accurate up to 160psi.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F%2BHP7uHBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011W9Q06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B0011X2GOI", "title": "Carson Optical MagniFlip 3x Flip-Open Pocket Magnifier with Built-In Case (GN-33)", "description": "The GN-33 MagniFlip from Carson Optical is a compact, 3x power flip-open Magnifier with a built-in folding case. It's perfect for carrying in your pocket or purse... to use every day! The MagniFlip Magnifier can be used for reading labels at the grocery store to reading a map on the road. At Carson, we strive to make sure our customers are 100% satisfied with the quality of our magnifiers. We are so confident in our magnifiers that we back them with a Lifetime Limited Warranty! Carson will repair or replace your magnifier if it is found to have manufacturing defects in materials or workmanship. Please contact Carson for additional warranty details.", "text": "Carson Optical MagniFlip 3x Flip-Open Pocket Magnifier with Built-In Case (GN-33) The GN-33 MagniFlip from Carson Optical is a compact, 3x power flip-open Magnifier with a built-in folding case. It's perfect for carrying in your pocket or purse... to use every day! The MagniFlip Magnifier can be used for reading labels at the grocery store to reading a map on the road. At Carson, we strive to make sure our customers are 100% satisfied with the quality of our magnifiers. We are so confident in our magnifiers that we back them with a Lifetime Limited Warranty! Carson will repair or replace your magnifier if it is found to have manufacturing defects in materials or workmanship. Please contact Carson for additional warranty details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317vwKgWreL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011X2GOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 2.49}}
{"item_id": "B0011YEAZ0", "title": "Shimano Single Speed Bicycle Freewheel - SF-MX30", "description": "Use with 1/8\" or 3/32\" chains. Chromoly sprocket. Chrome finish.", "text": "Shimano Single Speed Bicycle Freewheel - SF-MX30 Use with 1/8\" or 3/32\" chains. Chromoly sprocket. Chrome finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ua9rMpb2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011YEAZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0011YFAF4", "title": "Vittoria Zaffiro II Wire", "description": "Don't be scared off by the low price -- these are some hard-working road bike tires. These road tires also have Nashbar has loads of colors to choose from, so you can pimp your ride whatever way you like. Mixing hard rubber in the center with a softer compound on the sides delivers that magical blend of longevity and handling in the corners Reinforced tread with Intrepid PRB material offers puncture protection without adding rolling resistance.", "text": "Vittoria Zaffiro II Wire Don't be scared off by the low price -- these are some hard-working road bike tires. These road tires also have Nashbar has loads of colors to choose from, so you can pimp your ride whatever way you like. Mixing hard rubber in the center with a softer compound on the sides delivers that magical blend of longevity and handling in the corners Reinforced tread with Intrepid PRB material offers puncture protection without adding rolling resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ce0x8YwOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011YFAF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
