{"item_id": "B0011ZEJ32", "title": "Lizard Skins Carbon Leather Chainstay Protector", "description": "Protect your carbon frame with the Lizard Skins Carbon Leather Chainstay Protector. The Lizard Skins' simple and durable design sticks securely to your ride's chainstay, effectively preventing your chain from chipping away at your investment.", "text": "Lizard Skins Carbon Leather Chainstay Protector Protect your carbon frame with the Lizard Skins Carbon Leather Chainstay Protector. The Lizard Skins' simple and durable design sticks securely to your ride's chainstay, effectively preventing your chain from chipping away at your investment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Nd6gX0v1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0011ZEJ32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lizard Skins", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Guards"]], "price": 9.0}}
