{"item_id": "B00124P7SI", "title": "Sports Sensors Swing Speed Radar", "description": "Sports Sensors is committed to customer satisfaction and provides free technical support. Review the detailedUser Manualfor more information. For direct customer support, contact Sports Sensors by calling, toll-free, 1-888-542-9246 or emailing adilz@cinci.rr.com.", "text": "Sports Sensors Swing Speed Radar Sports Sensors is committed to customer satisfaction and provides free technical support. Review the detailedUser Manualfor more information. For direct customer support, contact Sports Sensors by calling, toll-free, 1-888-542-9246 or emailing adilz@cinci.rr.com.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QLvqmSnQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00124P7SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sports Sensors, Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 99.0}}
{"item_id": "B00125KOAS", "title": "Deluxe Chow Set", "description": "This chow set is ideal for camping or any place you need utensils. Comes complete with stainless steel knife, fork, spoon and large size can opener.", "text": "Deluxe Chow Set This chow set is ideal for camping or any place you need utensils. Comes complete with stainless steel knife, fork, spoon and large size can opener.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-PbzT3QLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00125KOAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 6.68}}
{"item_id": "B00125M48I", "title": "G.I. Type Stainless Steel Canteen Cup", "description": "Designed to fit 1 quart canteen, this canteen cup is made of heavy gauge stainless steel and features a butterfly handle.", "text": "G.I. Type Stainless Steel Canteen Cup Designed to fit 1 quart canteen, this canteen cup is made of heavy gauge stainless steel and features a butterfly handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p4F5il1sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00125M48I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B00125W7SA", "title": "Travelchair Easy Rider Chair", "description": "All the right fabrics, lines and finishes, the easy rider is our feature rich work horse and continues to be one of the best selling and most revered chairs we hand craft. Carry case included.", "text": "Travelchair Easy Rider Chair All the right fabrics, lines and finishes, the easy rider is our feature rich work horse and continues to be one of the best selling and most revered chairs we hand craft. Carry case included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412bL6gyy1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00125W7SA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TravelChair", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B001260X94", "title": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Mountain Trail Baggy Padded Cycling Short", "description": "Ride for miles in comfort with Canari's Mountain Trail baggy shorts. The loose outershort is made using a soft, yet tough nylon talsan fabric that resists abrasion and fading. An 10-inch inseam offers just above the knee coverage. The integrated cycle liner is made with a lightweight, wicking polyester flatback mesh fabric that keeps you cool and dry as you sweat. Soft touch gripper elastic keeps the liner in place.The cycle pad features seamless construction with just enough padding for comfort and protection. The MicroSuede pad surface offers wicking capabilities. The outershort features two side seam hand pockets and a zippered back pocket. The elastic waistband is complemented by a flat drawcord for security and comfort. Made from 100 percent polyester. Machine wash warm and tumble dry low for easy care.", "text": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Mountain Trail Baggy Padded Cycling Short Ride for miles in comfort with Canari's Mountain Trail baggy shorts. The loose outershort is made using a soft, yet tough nylon talsan fabric that resists abrasion and fading. An 10-inch inseam offers just above the knee coverage. The integrated cycle liner is made with a lightweight, wicking polyester flatback mesh fabric that keeps you cool and dry as you sweat. Soft touch gripper elastic keeps the liner in place.The cycle pad features seamless construction with just enough padding for comfort and protection. The MicroSuede pad surface offers wicking capabilities. The outershort features two side seam hand pockets and a zippered back pocket. The elastic waistband is complemented by a flat drawcord for security and comfort. Made from 100 percent polyester. Machine wash warm and tumble dry low for easy care.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EBKBv9lzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001260X94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001261Q8G", "title": "Marmot Limelight Tent", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Marmot Limelight 3P - 3 Person Tent Gear Loft and Footprint Included DAC Press-Fit Poles Full Coverage Fly Two Doors / Two Vestibules Window Weld Bare Bones Setup Centenary Cut Floor Jingle-Free Nylon Zipper Pulls Light-Reflective Points Multiple Pockets Snag-Free Zipper Flap Velcro Weld The SPECS Capacity: 3 Person Minimum Weight: 5 lbs 15 oz / 2.69 kg Maximum Weight: 6 lbs 11 oz / 3.03 kg Dimensions: 93\" x 66\" x 46\" / 236 x 168 x 117 cm Floor Area: 42.6 square feet / 4.0 square meter Vestibule Area: 10 square feet / 0.9 square meter Packed Size: 22 x 8\" / 56 x 20 cm Number of Pole Type: 3 / DAC Press-Fit 9.0mm Materials: Fly: 68d 100% Polyester Ripstop 1800mm, W/R, F/R, Canopy: 68d 100% Polyester Ripstop, F/R, Floor: 70d 100% Nylon PU 3000mm W/R, F/R OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean.", "text": "Marmot Limelight Tent DECENT FEATURES of the Marmot Limelight 3P - 3 Person Tent Gear Loft and Footprint Included DAC Press-Fit Poles Full Coverage Fly Two Doors / Two Vestibules Window Weld Bare Bones Setup Centenary Cut Floor Jingle-Free Nylon Zipper Pulls Light-Reflective Points Multiple Pockets Snag-Free Zipper Flap Velcro Weld The SPECS Capacity: 3 Person Minimum Weight: 5 lbs 15 oz / 2.69 kg Maximum Weight: 6 lbs 11 oz / 3.03 kg Dimensions: 93\" x 66\" x 46\" / 236 x 168 x 117 cm Floor Area: 42.6 square feet / 4.0 square meter Vestibule Area: 10 square feet / 0.9 square meter Packed Size: 22 x 8\" / 56 x 20 cm Number of Pole Type: 3 / DAC Press-Fit 9.0mm Materials: Fly: 68d 100% Polyester Ripstop 1800mm, W/R, F/R, Canopy: 68d 100% Polyester Ripstop, F/R, Floor: 70d 100% Nylon PU 3000mm W/R, F/R OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OAwz6r9SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001261Q8G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00126HZZ4", "title": "Harbinger 149 Women's Pro Wash & Dry Weight Lifting Gloves", "description": "Specially designed for women, this pair of Harbinger Pro gloves is ideal for all-purpose training. The gloves are distinguished by their stretch \"ventilator mesh\" construction, which lets the hand and fingers bend naturally while staying cool, along with the abrasion-resistant leather on the palm, which maximizes glove wear. The gloves come on and off easily, meanwhile, thanks to their slip-on design. And lifters will love the short finger length, which reduces unwanted bulk. Perhaps the best feature, however, is the easy-to-clean fabric, which is 100-percent machine washable and dryable.", "text": "Harbinger 149 Women's Pro Wash & Dry Weight Lifting Gloves Specially designed for women, this pair of Harbinger Pro gloves is ideal for all-purpose training. The gloves are distinguished by their stretch \"ventilator mesh\" construction, which lets the hand and fingers bend naturally while staying cool, along with the abrasion-resistant leather on the palm, which maximizes glove wear. The gloves come on and off easily, meanwhile, thanks to their slip-on design. And lifters will love the short finger length, which reduces unwanted bulk. Perhaps the best feature, however, is the easy-to-clean fabric, which is 100-percent machine washable and dryable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j3ls3YduL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00126HZZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00127PZCS", "title": "", "description": "MLB 08 THE SHOW is set to provide fans with the most realistic baseball experience to date with innovations such as a more immersive Road to The Show mode, enabling gamers to play both offense and defense from the created player's perspective. Providing players with some additional performance incentives, the MLB franchise introduces the Progressive Batting Performance feature, which will both reward players for superior performance and penalize them for hitting slumps. Specific to each individual batter, players will be rewarded with slight contact bonuses, or punished with slight decreases in contact, based on how that batter performs beyond his \"natural ability.\" MLB 08 THE SHOW introduces SCOUT (SportsConnect Online User Tracking), which allows you to set and store your game preferences on the MLB server, and enables the system to look for a Quick Match with opponents that fits similar competitive criteria. Exhibition Mode/Quick Game - Gamers can select their favorite team and compete against the AI for a quick game on the go Historical Greats - Offers Historical Greats, giving them the opportunity to go against the legends of the past Release Point Pitching with Confidence Meter - The ultimate pitcher/batter interface returns Playmaker Fielding- The fielding interface brings the player attributes together with the user's skill level Multi-Branch Fielding - Branch Point Technology goes to a new level as gamers can now take full control of fielders and break out of any animation in the process User Controlled Slides - Players can now control base runners in attempts to advance and/or score MLB Authenticity - Presents fans with finer details and nuances that make the game America's past", "text": "MLB 08 THE SHOW is set to provide fans with the most realistic baseball experience to date with innovations such as a more immersive Road to The Show mode, enabling gamers to play both offense and defense from the created player's perspective. Providing players with some additional performance incentives, the MLB franchise introduces the Progressive Batting Performance feature, which will both reward players for superior performance and penalize them for hitting slumps. Specific to each individual batter, players will be rewarded with slight contact bonuses, or punished with slight decreases in contact, based on how that batter performs beyond his \"natural ability.\" MLB 08 THE SHOW introduces SCOUT (SportsConnect Online User Tracking), which allows you to set and store your game preferences on the MLB server, and enables the system to look for a Quick Match with opponents that fits similar competitive criteria. Exhibition Mode/Quick Game - Gamers can select their favorite team and compete against the AI for a quick game on the go Historical Greats - Offers Historical Greats, giving them the opportunity to go against the legends of the past Release Point Pitching with Confidence Meter - The ultimate pitcher/batter interface returns Playmaker Fielding- The fielding interface brings the player attributes together with the user's skill level Multi-Branch Fielding - Branch Point Technology goes to a new level as gamers can now take full control of fielders and break out of any animation in the process User Controlled Slides - Players can now control base runners in attempts to advance and/or score MLB Authenticity - Presents fans with finer details and nuances that make the game America's past", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517DV9%2BVceL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00127PZCS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Video Games & Accessories"], ["Video Games", "Kids & Family", "PlayStation 3", "Games"], ["Video Games", "PlayStation 3", "Games"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B001287JIA", "title": "BSN Heavy-Duty Mesh Equipment Bag", "description": "The Heavy Duty 24in x 36in mesh equipment bag holds 10-12 balls and loads of other equipment. This bag includes clipping drawstring for easy closure.", "text": "BSN Heavy-Duty Mesh Equipment Bag The Heavy Duty 24in x 36in mesh equipment bag holds 10-12 balls and loads of other equipment. This bag includes clipping drawstring for easy closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61I2J4EOeiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001287JIA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00128UD5Q", "title": "Spyderco Tenacious G-10 Handle Folding Serrated Edge Knife", "description": "The Tenacious from Spyderco is a mid-sized folding knife that is designed and built for a persistent, cohesive, and tireless performance that lives up to its name. The Tenacious features a black G-10 laminate handle, milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The leaf-shaped 8Cr13Mov stainless blade offers SpyderEdge serration, enabling you to dig in and cut through tough materials with greater ease. The blade's shape coupled with an over-sized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with a jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Built to last, the Tenacious carries a limited lifetime warranty to be free of defects in materials and workmanship.SpyderEdge SerrationSpyderco's signature SpyderEdge incorporates a repeated pattern of one large and two small serrations. The tips of the serrations provide single point penetration at the same time that the center of effort rotates around each serration for an infinite number of cutting angles, increasing the cutting edge length by up to 24%. The serrations improve edge retention because the points actually protect the sharp inside curves that continue the cut, thus the curves have less wear over time.Spyderco Round Holeone-hand openingKey Features:4-way clip: Tip up/down left/right handScrew together constructionPhosphor bronze washers--act like a liquid lubricant for fast, smooth open/close actionSkeletonized steel liners--internal steel handle liners have been hollowed out to reduce bulk and weight while maintaining strength and rigiditySpine and choil jimping--small texturing on the spine of the blade and choil create tactile resistance for purchase, traction, and slip-resistanceEnlarged opening holeFlat-ground bladeSerrated EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 7.76 inchesLength closed: 4.45 inchesBlade length: 3.39 inchesCutting edge: 3.39 inchesBlade thickness: 0.118 inchesHole diameter: 0.51 inchesBlade steel: 8Cr13MoVHandle material: G-10Weight: 4.1 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Tenacious G-10 Handle Folding Serrated Edge Knife The Tenacious from Spyderco is a mid-sized folding knife that is designed and built for a persistent, cohesive, and tireless performance that lives up to its name. The Tenacious features a black G-10 laminate handle, milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The leaf-shaped 8Cr13Mov stainless blade offers SpyderEdge serration, enabling you to dig in and cut through tough materials with greater ease. The blade's shape coupled with an over-sized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with a jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Built to last, the Tenacious carries a limited lifetime warranty to be free of defects in materials and workmanship.SpyderEdge SerrationSpyderco's signature SpyderEdge incorporates a repeated pattern of one large and two small serrations. The tips of the serrations provide single point penetration at the same time that the center of effort rotates around each serration for an infinite number of cutting angles, increasing the cutting edge length by up to 24%. The serrations improve edge retention because the points actually protect the sharp inside curves that continue the cut, thus the curves have less wear over time.Spyderco Round Holeone-hand openingKey Features:4-way clip: Tip up/down left/right handScrew together constructionPhosphor bronze washers--act like a liquid lubricant for fast, smooth open/close actionSkeletonized steel liners--internal steel handle liners have been hollowed out to reduce bulk and weight while maintaining strength and rigiditySpine and choil jimping--small texturing on the spine of the blade and choil create tactile resistance for purchase, traction, and slip-resistanceEnlarged opening holeFlat-ground bladeSerrated EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 7.76 inchesLength closed: 4.45 inchesBlade length: 3.39 inchesCutting edge: 3.39 inchesBlade thickness: 0.118 inchesHole diameter: 0.51 inchesBlade steel: 8Cr13MoVHandle material: G-10Weight: 4.1 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XabmZ5iXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00128UD5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.92}}
