{"item_id": "B001298H1M", "title": "Sunlite Bicycle Tube, 700 x 35-40 (27 x 1-3/8) SCHRADER Valve", "description": "TUBES SUNLT 700x35-40 (27x1-3/8) SV", "text": "Sunlite Bicycle Tube, 700 x 35-40 (27 x 1-3/8) SCHRADER Valve TUBES SUNLT 700x35-40 (27x1-3/8) SV", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w3AUBkDCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001298H1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 5.59}}
{"item_id": "B001298HEE", "title": "White Lightning Clean Streak No Residue Dry Bicycle Degreaser, 23-Ounce Aerosol Spray", "description": "Clean Streak is new cleaning-agent technology that lifts, strips and dissolves the nastiest of contaminants. Evaporates fast and leaves no residue. Clean Streak Metal Prep is a \"no-scrub\" cleaner that cleans to the base and prepares surfaces for application of high performance lubricants. New lube application, penetration and film adhesion is 100% maximized. From end of the season wax lube buildup, to thick greasy carbonized grit, to new chain transit coatings..., Clean Streak will cut through it all! Fast action and thorough evaporation. Features a 360 degree swivel precision applicator. Spray Clean Streak directly onto drivetrain components, and allow the grease, grime and grit to run-off the bike. No water rinsing is required, and Clean Streak leaves no residue. For stubborn contaminates, use a rag or a brush to loosen the encrusted soils, and then spray with Clean Streak. Clean Streak’s No-Rinse, No-Residue formula is perfect for use on disc brake rotors (Clean Streak should be used to clean the rotors ONLY. Do not use Clean Streak to clean the calipers or pads, and it is recommended to remove the wheel before cleaning the rotors), and although Clean Streak is safe for use on all a bikes components, its intended use is for the removal of contaminates on the drivetrain (it is not intended to clean the frame, handlebars, seat and/or tires).", "text": "White Lightning Clean Streak No Residue Dry Bicycle Degreaser, 23-Ounce Aerosol Spray Clean Streak is new cleaning-agent technology that lifts, strips and dissolves the nastiest of contaminants. Evaporates fast and leaves no residue. Clean Streak Metal Prep is a \"no-scrub\" cleaner that cleans to the base and prepares surfaces for application of high performance lubricants. New lube application, penetration and film adhesion is 100% maximized. From end of the season wax lube buildup, to thick greasy carbonized grit, to new chain transit coatings..., Clean Streak will cut through it all! Fast action and thorough evaporation. Features a 360 degree swivel precision applicator. Spray Clean Streak directly onto drivetrain components, and allow the grease, grime and grit to run-off the bike. No water rinsing is required, and Clean Streak leaves no residue. For stubborn contaminates, use a rag or a brush to loosen the encrusted soils, and then spray with Clean Streak. Clean Streak’s No-Rinse, No-Residue formula is perfect for use on disc brake rotors (Clean Streak should be used to clean the rotors ONLY. Do not use Clean Streak to clean the calipers or pads, and it is recommended to remove the wheel before cleaning the rotors), and although Clean Streak is safe for use on all a bikes components, its intended use is for the removal of contaminates on the drivetrain (it is not intended to clean the frame, handlebars, seat and/or tires).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TDomEHoUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001298HEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "White Lightning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Grease"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B00129ACNI", "title": "Sunlite Thorn Resistant Bicycle Tube 700 x 25-28 (27 x 1-1/8-1-1/4) 32mm PRESTA", "description": "Thorn resistant bicycle innertube, 700x25-28 (27x1-1/8x1-1/4)", "text": "Sunlite Thorn Resistant Bicycle Tube 700 x 25-28 (27 x 1-1/8-1-1/4) 32mm PRESTA Thorn resistant bicycle innertube, 700x25-28 (27x1-1/8x1-1/4)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nGBGJeFAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00129ACNI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B00129G2P0", "title": "5/3/2mm NeoSport Unisex Triathlon Sprint Full Suit Tri Suit Wetsuit Wet Suit Fullsuit John Gear New Authorized Dealer Full Warranty", "description": "This Tri Suit covers fit, flexibility, buoyancy and price. Features of this wonderful suit include: Speed skin neoprene material - Glued and Sewn Seams - Heavy duty back zip Maximum thickness allowed by triathlon?s world governing body - Maximum buoyancy and performance - Maximum Buoyancy and Flexibility: 5mm Speed Skin neoprene at the chest panel means maximum floatation where you need it most. Elsewhere NeoSport uses a blend of 3mm and 2mm neoprene to maintain lightweight flexibility in critical areas. 3mm back panel permits efficient stroke performance, with range of motion further enhanced by the strategic placement of 2mm Super Four-Way Stretch neoprene along the arms, shoulders and underarms maximizing unrestricted reach. Wide Arm Openings that promote unrestricted range of motion. The arm rotation area is constructed with durable nylon laminated neoprene trimmed in soft Lycra, which provides a comfortable and secure seal that minimizes unwanted water entry. Quick-Exit EZ Out Zipper Pull, making speedy transitions a snap. Our zipper pull stays out of your way during the swim but is easy to find when every second counts. NeoSport?s adjustable collar locks out water and provides a perfect personal fit for no unwanted scooping. The smooth and narrow design cuts down on chafe and increases hydrodynamics. Mid-Calf Leg Opening: Swim and transition times are reduced with flexible mid-calf leg openings. Raised placement means improved kick with less water resistance. Wider openings reduce heel snag and speed up suit removal. AUTHORIZED DEALER, FULL WARRANTY!!! Finding fit, flexibility, buoyancy and price is critical to confidence and competitive success, and that?s why Triathlete Magazine called the NeoSport Sprint Full a suit with \"rock-solid construction... that offers everything yo