Magazine called the NeoSport Sprint Full a suit with \"rock-solid construction... that offers everything you need at a pretty untouchable price.? Indeed, when it comes to multi-sport?s most intimidating discipline, NeoSport? full line of wetsuits are No. 1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31536xJJCPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00129G2P0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Triathlon", "Skinsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00129N2BC", "title": "Valeo Burst Resistant 65cm Body Ball (Pink)", "description": "The Valeo burst-resistant 65-centimeter body ball helps improve your core strength, flexibility, balance, coordination, and muscle tone, making it an ideal addition to your exercise arsenal. Sitting on the body ball forces your body to stay balanced, thereby strengthening your stabilizing muscles and core. As a result, the exercise ball makes a terrific desk chair. As an alternative, you can design an extremely effective workout routine using the ball as a bench for dumbbell flies, shoulder presses, or ab crunches. Packaged with a workout DVD, a dual-action air pump, a wall chart with a step-by-step exercise program, plugs, and a measuring tape, the ball is a terrific choice for users of all exercise levels. This ball comes in pink, but Valeo body balls area available in several other colors.", "text": "Valeo Burst Resistant 65cm Body Ball (Pink) The Valeo burst-resistant 65-centimeter body ball helps improve your core strength, flexibility, balance, coordination, and muscle tone, making it an ideal addition to your exercise arsenal. Sitting on the body ball forces your body to stay balanced, thereby strengthening your stabilizing muscles and core. As a result, the exercise ball makes a terrific desk chair. As an alternative, you can design an extremely effective workout routine using the ball as a bench for dumbbell flies, shoulder presses, or ab crunches. Packaged with a workout DVD, a dual-action air pump, a wall chart with a step-by-step exercise program, plugs, and a measuring tape, the ball is a terrific choice for users of all exercise levels. This ball comes in pink, but Valeo body balls area available in several other colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zerCrH6zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00129N2BC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]]}}
