{"item_id": "B0012AXR4S", "title": "Wheeler Firearms Accurizing Torque Wrench", "description": "Wheeler's FAT Wrench brings perfect consistency to every screw on your rifle! This amazing handheld torque wrench lets you apply repeatable, accurate torque settings to scope rings, guard screws and other screws, which aids in accuracy and decreases the opportunity for problems in the field. The FAT Wrench is a perfect complement to the Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Sets. Together, they can ensure accurate tightening of most every screw on any gun in your collection.", "text": "Wheeler Firearms Accurizing Torque Wrench Wheeler's FAT Wrench brings perfect consistency to every screw on your rifle! This amazing handheld torque wrench lets you apply repeatable, accurate torque settings to scope rings, guard screws and other screws, which aids in accuracy and decreases the opportunity for problems in the field. The FAT Wrench is a perfect complement to the Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Sets. Together, they can ensure accurate tightening of most every screw on any gun in your collection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xn-6UMP9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012AXR4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 54.0}}
