{"item_id": "B0012FYIG4", "title": "ASP S&W M&P 9mm/.40 Red Gun Training Series", "description": "All too frequently, law enforcement officers have been killed in a training environment with “unloaded” firearms. Red handled weapons can be confused with live firearms when held in the hand. Aluminum castings are heavy and cannot be distinguished from stainless weapons at a distance. The ASP Red Gun Series is lightweight and readily identified as a training weapon. In addition, the extreme detail and precision manufacture of these training devices allows their use in weapon retention and holster security drills. The red polymer and the manner in which they are reinforced allows them to withstand the daily abuses of the training environment. The Red Gun Series is ideal for all types of scenario training. The precision fit allows their use with duty holsters. Red Radios and Flashlights are valuable additions to sudden assault training on the firing line. The flexible Red Knife allows officers to rehearse responses to edged weapon attacks. The Red Gun Series can also be specially produced to the exact weight of a loaded duty firearm.", "text": "ASP S&W M&P 9mm/.40 Red Gun Training Series All too frequently, law enforcement officers have been killed in a training environment with “unloaded” firearms. Red handled weapons can be confused with live firearms when held in the hand. Aluminum castings are heavy and cannot be distinguished from stainless weapons at a distance. The ASP Red Gun Series is lightweight and readily identified as a training weapon. In addition, the extreme detail and precision manufacture of these training devices allows their use in weapon retention and holster security drills. The red polymer and the manner in which they are reinforced allows them to withstand the daily abuses of the training environment. The Red Gun Series is ideal for all types of scenario training. The precision fit allows their use with duty holsters. Red Radios and Flashlights are valuable additions to sudden assault training on the firing line. The flexible Red Knife allows officers to rehearse responses to edged weapon attacks. The Red Gun Series can also be specially produced to the exact weight of a loaded duty firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Dwkouf7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012FYIG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Asp Law Enforcement", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 52.51}}
