{"item_id": "B0012IQ57G", "title": "Zebco 33 Lady Fishing Rod and 33JL/ZALC602M Reel Combo", "description": "This Combo features a 6' 2-Pc. medium Z-Glass rod and the classic Zebco 33 spincast reel that's a favorite with rookies and seasoned anglers! Ball bearing drive system for smooth reeling; Right or left retrieve; Front adjustable drag control; Selective anti-reverse for confident hooksets; Medium action.", "text": "Zebco 33 Lady Fishing Rod and 33JL/ZALC602M Reel Combo This Combo features a 6' 2-Pc. medium Z-Glass rod and the classic Zebco 33 spincast reel that's a favorite with rookies and seasoned anglers! Ball bearing drive system for smooth reeling; Right or left retrieve; Front adjustable drag control; Selective anti-reverse for confident hooksets; Medium action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21F82BPD2CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012IQ57G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos"]], "price": 24.94}}
{"item_id": "B0012J33OS", "title": "P90X Plus: The Next Level for P90X Grads-5 New Extreme Workouts on 4 DVDs", "description": "If you love P90X and you're saying, \"Give me more,\" or, \"I need a challenge\"-then here it is, the P90X Plus Series. Beachbody trainer Tony Horton amps up the Muscle Confusion with brand-new moves and never-before-seen workouts all set to hot music created exclusively for P90X Plus by Jason Scheff, lead singer of the band Chicago!P90X Plus will break through plateaus with intense new cardio, muscle chiseling, and ab/core-ripping moves to ramp up your results. Adding these new advanced workouts into your P90X rotation will literally take your workout to the next level and create workout combinations beyond your imagination. Trust us, it doesn't get better than this.", "text": "P90X Plus: The Next Level for P90X Grads-5 New Extreme Workouts on 4 DVDs If you love P90X and you're saying, \"Give me more,\" or, \"I need a challenge\"-then here it is, the P90X Plus Series. Beachbody trainer Tony Horton amps up the Muscle Confusion with brand-new moves and never-before-seen workouts all set to hot music created exclusively for P90X Plus by Jason Scheff, lead singer of the band Chicago!P90X Plus will break through plateaus with intense new cardio, muscle chiseling, and ab/core-ripping moves to ramp up your results. Adding these new advanced workouts into your P90X rotation will literally take your workout to the next level and create workout combinations beyond your imagination. Trust us, it doesn't get better than this.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519nbQn%2BqWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012J33OS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 69.85}}
{"item_id": "B0012K9RFQ", "title": "Ak887 9mm Silver Airsoft Pellet Gun", "description": "Full scale replica of a 9mm Pistol. Silver and Black AK-887. Uses 6mm plastic BB's (included) and 6mm Paintballs (not included). Great for target practice, with the same look and feel of a real pistol. Complete with spring activated 10 round magazine and starter pack of BB's.", "text": "Ak887 9mm Silver Airsoft Pellet Gun Full scale replica of a 9mm Pistol. Silver and Black AK-887. Uses 6mm plastic BB's (included) and 6mm Paintballs (not included). Great for target practice, with the same look and feel of a real pistol. Complete with spring activated 10 round magazine and starter pack of BB's.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OkeOPxLpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012K9RFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
