{"item_id": "B0012N381M", "title": "Park Tool DS-1 Digital Scale", "description": "A versatile digital scale built to accurately weigh bikes, frames, and components, the Park Tool DS-1 is designed to be clamped solidly into a repair stand or hung from a hook or branch. The scale measures in both kilograms to the hundredth and pounds to the ounce.The simple, accurate scale quickly weighs your bicycle and components.SpecificationsIncludes a dual position, silicone-coated hanging hookMeasures kilograms and displays to 0.01kg (0.01 kg = 10 grams)Measures pounds and displays to ounces (one ounce = 28.35g)55-pound weight limitRequires three AAA batteries (sold separately)WarrantyPark Tool products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Park ToolPark Tool has been manufacturing bicycle-specific tools since 1963. Based out of St. Paul, Minnesota, it's the world's largest bicycle tool manufacturer, and a top choice of professional and home bicycle mechanics. The first Park Tool product was a repair stand so unique it was granted a U.S. patent. Park Tool's nearly 300 products -- the majority of which are manufactured in the American midwest -- now hold many patents. Park Tool continues to develop and refine bicycle repair tools and equipment to improve service and efficiency of all bicycle mechanics, professional or hobbyist, and will continue to be an active part in the advancement of the sport of bicycling.", "text": "Park Tool DS-1 Digital Scale A versatile digital scale built to accurately weigh bikes, frames, and components, the Park Tool DS-1 is designed to be clamped solidly into a repair stand or hung from a hook or branch. The scale measures in both kilograms to the hundredth and pounds to the ounce.The simple, accurate scale quickly weighs your bicycle and components.SpecificationsIncludes a dual position, silicone-coated hanging hookMeasures kilograms and displays to 0.01kg (0.01 kg = 10 grams)Measures pounds and displays to ounces (one ounce = 28.35g)55-pound weight limitRequires three AAA batteries (sold separately)WarrantyPark Tool products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Park ToolPark Tool has been manufacturing bicycle-specific tools since 1963. Based out of St. Paul, Minnesota, it's the world's largest bicycle tool manufacturer, and a top choice of professional and home bicycle mechanics. The first Park Tool product was a repair stand so unique it was granted a U.S. patent. Park Tool's nearly 300 products -- the majority of which are manufactured in the American midwest -- now hold many patents. Park Tool continues to develop and refine bicycle repair tools and equipment to improve service and efficiency of all bicycle mechanics, professional or hobbyist, and will continue to be an active part in the advancement of the sport of bicycling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IsHNFO9BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012N381M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 62.95}}
