{"item_id": "B0012NF9LY", "title": "NcStar AR15 Bipod With Bayonet Lug Quick Release Mount", "description": "The ABAB AR-15 Quick Detach Bayo Lug Bipod is the Newest Edition to the NcSTAR line of Bipods. This Solid Anodized Aluminum Bipod snaps into place on your AR-15/M16 bayo lug with ease. Removing the ABAB is just as easy with a simple push of a button it slides right off. The ABAB also has extendable legs so you can adjust them to the height that is perfect for you.", "text": "NcStar AR15 Bipod With Bayonet Lug Quick Release Mount The ABAB AR-15 Quick Detach Bayo Lug Bipod is the Newest Edition to the NcSTAR line of Bipods. This Solid Anodized Aluminum Bipod snaps into place on your AR-15/M16 bayo lug with ease. Removing the ABAB is just as easy with a simple push of a button it slides right off. The ABAB also has extendable legs so you can adjust them to the height that is perfect for you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i7vCdWW9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012NF9LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 29.99}}
