{"item_id": "B0012OS4M4", "title": "HOMAK HS30103660 8-Gun Security Cabinet, Gloss Black", "description": "The 8 Gun Security Cabinet is manufactured using the highest grade of raw materials available. With a 0.047\" (1.2 mm) steel thickness, this unit provides maximum organization using shelves and removable plastic bins. A four point tubular locking system includes two individually coded keys. Compatible with the Upper Add-On Gun Cabinet. Available in Silver Vein or Textured Gloss Black.", "text": "HOMAK HS30103660 8-Gun Security Cabinet, Gloss Black The 8 Gun Security Cabinet is manufactured using the highest grade of raw materials available. With a 0.047\" (1.2 mm) steel thickness, this unit provides maximum organization using shelves and removable plastic bins. A four point tubular locking system includes two individually coded keys. Compatible with the Upper Add-On Gun Cabinet. Available in Silver Vein or Textured Gloss Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xphismFPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012OS4M4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 111.94}}
{"item_id": "B0012Q2S4W", "title": "Jaws Quick Spit Antifog Spray, 1-Ounce", "description": "Now the worlds most recognized antifog comes in a spray. Quick spit spray works on anything that fogs, including dive masks, swim goggles, paintball masks, sport goggles, safety goggles, ski goggles, eye wear, windows, binoculars, scopes and more. Apply wet or dry - Quick spit is made with the same ingredients as spit gel, giving the high performance of a gel in a convenient spray formula. Over 200 pumps per bottle. Quick spit... the most recognized name in antifog... the spray that works.", "text": "Jaws Quick Spit Antifog Spray, 1-Ounce Now the worlds most recognized antifog comes in a spray. Quick spit spray works on anything that fogs, including dive masks, swim goggles, paintball masks, sport goggles, safety goggles, ski goggles, eye wear, windows, binoculars, scopes and more. Apply wet or dry - Quick spit is made with the same ingredients as spit gel, giving the high performance of a gel in a convenient spray formula. Over 200 pumps per bottle. Quick spit... the most recognized name in antifog... the spray that works.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BABlEzZyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012Q2S4W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Just Add Water", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 5.23}}
{"item_id": "B0012Q41HY", "title": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (19-Function)", "description": "CrankBrothers Multi-19 Tool comes complete with 19 tools for common road and trail-side repairs. The Multi 19 has seven hex wrenches, four spoke wrench sizes, small and large Phillips and flathead screwdrivers, a t-25 Torx driver for disc brakes, and a universal chain tool to tackle any task short of building a bike from loose parts. Lest we forget, there are also 8 and 10mm open wrenches, and to top it off, the whole deal comes packed in a neat, lightweight, durable aluminum hard case that slips inside your pack or toolbox with ease. Specs: Weight - 175 grams (w/o tool flask); Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel; Carrying Case - Stainless and polymer.", "text": "Crank Brothers Multi Bicycle Tool (19-Function) CrankBrothers Multi-19 Tool comes complete with 19 tools for common road and trail-side repairs. The Multi 19 has seven hex wrenches, four spoke wrench sizes, small and large Phillips and flathead screwdrivers, a t-25 Torx driver for disc brakes, and a universal chain tool to tackle any task short of building a bike from loose parts. Lest we forget, there are also 8 and 10mm open wrenches, and to top it off, the whole deal comes packed in a neat, lightweight, durable aluminum hard case that slips inside your pack or toolbox with ease. Specs: Weight - 175 grams (w/o tool flask); Length - 3.5 inches; Frame - 6061-T6 aluminum; Tools - 6051 high tensile steel; Carrying Case - Stainless and polymer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ocX4ds1BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012Q41HY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 26.11}}
{"item_id": "B0012Q8I6E", "title": "12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 10 Pack", "description": "Air power for your paintball gun or airsoft pistol. You can never have enough of these for a days play Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Thesecan only be shipped in the continental US and Canada.", "text": "12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 10 Pack Air power for your paintball gun or airsoft pistol. You can never have enough of these for a days play Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Thesecan only be shipped in the continental US and Canada.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415NPm43YPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012Q8I6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SDN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 5.15}}
{"item_id": "B0012QJW6E", "title": "JOOLA 1-Star 40mm Training Table Tennis Balls - 12 Pack", "description": "The Joola 1-Star Training Table Tennis Balls are great for one-on-one practice matches! These 1-star quality ping pong balls are 40mm in size and come packaged in a pack of 12. Available in orange or white.", "text": "JOOLA 1-Star 40mm Training Table Tennis Balls - 12 Pack The Joola 1-Star Training Table Tennis Balls are great for one-on-one practice matches! These 1-star quality ping pong balls are 40mm in size and come packaged in a pack of 12. Available in orange or white.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tzK7XrGLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012QJW6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Joola", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Balls"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B0012QS986", "title": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Peace Keeper", "description": "Now you can practice with some of our most popular knife designs, in relative safety, with our new rubber training knives. We have rubber training versions of our Peace Keeper™ I, the R1 Military Classic, Recon Tanto, and the Black Bear Classic. Each has been carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible so they can be effectively used in solo practice, training drills, disarm drills, and demonstrations and any other activity where you want a reasonably close approximation of realism but not the extreme danger and risk associated with an actual knife. The Santoprene rubber blades are soft enough to prevent the likelihood of most bodily injury. They do however, have a level of firmness that might cause injury to the face or the eyes, so it is recommended that appropriate eye protection or a fencing mask is utilized at all times when using a Cold Steel rubber training knife.", "text": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Peace Keeper Now you can practice with some of our most popular knife designs, in relative safety, with our new rubber training knives. We have rubber training versions of our Peace Keeper™ I, the R1 Military Classic, Recon Tanto, and the Black Bear Classic. Each has been carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible so they can be effectively used in solo practice, training drills, disarm drills, and demonstrations and any other activity where you want a reasonably close approximation of realism but not the extreme danger and risk associated with an actual knife. The Santoprene rubber blades are soft enough to prevent the likelihood of most bodily injury. They do however, have a level of firmness that might cause injury to the face or the eyes, so it is recommended that appropriate eye protection or a fencing mask is utilized at all times when using a Cold Steel rubber training knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RZxTSZZ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012QS986.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.01}}
{"item_id": "B0012QY5DO", "title": "Ontario SP1 Marine Combat Knife (Black)", "description": "The SP1 Marine Combat Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP1 Marine Combat Knife (Black) The SP1 Marine Combat Knife made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 57-59 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H0hLgsjlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012QY5DO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 38.0}}
{"item_id": "B0012R2WD8", "title": "Redpoint by Buck Knives", "description": "115025 Features: Durable and effective thanks to the stainless steel, partially serrated drop point blade Open and close the knife without ever touching the blade with the reliable one-hand SafeSpin deployment Keep a firm grip, even in inclement weather thanks to the textured rubber All-Weather Grip handle Clip it to a keychain or pack clip-in point from the oversized Utility Arch that also functions as a bottle opener, or secure it with the belt clip Specifications: Weight: 29 ounces Blade material: stainless steel Handle material: rubber Blade length: 2 3-4 inches Closed length: 4 3-8 inches", "text": "Redpoint by Buck Knives 115025 Features: Durable and effective thanks to the stainless steel, partially serrated drop point blade Open and close the knife without ever touching the blade with the reliable one-hand SafeSpin deployment Keep a firm grip, even in inclement weather thanks to the textured rubber All-Weather Grip handle Clip it to a keychain or pack clip-in point from the oversized Utility Arch that also functions as a bottle opener, or secure it with the belt clip Specifications: Weight: 29 ounces Blade material: stainless steel Handle material: rubber Blade length: 2 3-4 inches Closed length: 4 3-8 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dBmeGoEcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012R2WD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.38}}
{"item_id": "B0012R4Z42", "title": "Redpoint Knife - Black", "description": "The Redpoint from Buck is a safe, easy and reliable locking blade knife. This knife features a SafeSpin one-handed opening with a secure all weather grip that provides good handling in any condition. The over sized Utility Arch and metal belt clip also give you several options to carry this great knife with you everyday. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade Length: 2 3/4\"(7 cm) Blade Material: 420HC Stainless Steel Serrated blade Carry System: Utility Arch and Stainless Steel belt clip Handle Material: Thermoplastic with Rubber Overmold, Black Length Closed: 4 3/8\"(11.1 cm) Locking blade One hand opening Weight: 2.9 oz.(82.6 g) 0750BKX-B , buck knives redpoint knife , redpoint knife buck knives , red point knife , buck knifes redpoint knife , camping , knifes , knives , one handed , assisted opening , locking blade , serrated , hunting , backpacking , cutlery , cutting", "text": "Redpoint Knife - Black The Redpoint from Buck is a safe, easy and reliable locking blade knife. This knife features a SafeSpin one-handed opening with a secure all weather grip that provides good handling in any condition. The over sized Utility Arch and metal belt clip also give you several options to carry this great knife with you everyday. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade Length: 2 3/4\"(7 cm) Blade Material: 420HC Stainless Steel Serrated blade Carry System: Utility Arch and Stainless Steel belt clip Handle Material: Thermoplastic with Rubber Overmold, Black Length Closed: 4 3/8\"(11.1 cm) Locking blade One hand opening Weight: 2.9 oz.(82.6 g) 0750BKX-B , buck knives redpoint knife , redpoint knife buck knives , red point knife , buck knifes redpoint knife , camping , knifes , knives , one handed , assisted opening , locking blade , serrated , hunting , backpacking , cutlery , cutting", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FnaX0v27L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012R4Z42.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 23.1}}
{"item_id": "B0012REBLY", "title": "Bell Mountain Bike Tire with KEVLAR", "description": "The Bell Mountain Bike Tire features a rugged carbon steel bead and layer of DuPont Kevlar, providing extra protection against flats. Tire folds and unfolds without damage.", "text": "Bell Mountain Bike Tire with KEVLAR The Bell Mountain Bike Tire features a rugged carbon steel bead and layer of DuPont Kevlar, providing extra protection against flats. Tire folds and unfolds without damage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vuIlYySjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012REBLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
