{"item_id": "B0012RJSXK", "title": "Bell GLIDE Tire 26-Inch Comfort Black", "description": "\"BELL SPORTS\" BIKE TIRE * 26\". * Comfort tread. * Carbon steel bead with Kevlar. * Platinum series. * Replaces Ace no. 81152. * Boxed.", "text": "Bell GLIDE Tire 26-Inch Comfort Black \"BELL SPORTS\" BIKE TIRE * 26\". * Comfort tread. * Carbon steel bead with Kevlar. * Platinum series. * Replaces Ace no. 81152. * Boxed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x3v3RA-SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012RJSXK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 13.87}}
{"item_id": "B0012RJTUW", "title": "AIRHEAD AHDL-4 Bungee Dockline 4 Feet", "description": "HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "text": "AIRHEAD AHDL-4 Bungee Dockline 4 Feet HEAD Bungee Dock Lines absorb shock to boats, cleats, docks, pylons and other hardware. The bungee cord is hidden inside the rope and acts as a built-in snubber. Two foam floats protect the boat from chafing. There's a sliding adjustment at both ends for quick docking. Recommended for docking boats and PWC's up to 4,000 pounds. Tensile strength is 2,150 pounds. Black/Blue/Red", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rtG70-N3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012RJTUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwik Tek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Dock Lines & Rope"]], "price": 10.96}}
{"item_id": "B0012RK0KU", "title": "OPSAK Odor Proof Barrier Bags (3 Size Options)", "description": "Designed for hazardous materials and biological waste, these bags have been proven in bear country to be odor proof,,,making them great for preventing animal instrusions at the campsite. They are also waterproof, humidity proof and dust proof. It's fine to pour boiling water into the bag to cook or rehydrate foods. Use as freezer bags to prevent freezer burn. The manufacturer reccommends using a Clip-N-Seal if you are planning to stuff the OPSAKs into backpacks or duffel bags. This will give you the extra security to abuse the bags.", "text": "OPSAK Odor Proof Barrier Bags (3 Size Options) Designed for hazardous materials and biological waste, these bags have been proven in bear country to be odor proof,,,making them great for preventing animal instrusions at the campsite. They are also waterproof, humidity proof and dust proof. It's fine to pour boiling water into the bag to cook or rehydrate foods. Use as freezer bags to prevent freezer burn. The manufacturer reccommends using a Clip-N-Seal if you are planning to stuff the OPSAKs into backpacks or duffel bags. This will give you the extra security to abuse the bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UWwFzpBIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012RK0KU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]]}}
