{"item_id": "B0012SDZZG", "title": "Yakima WindJammer Airfoil", "description": "FEATURES of the Yakima WindJammer Airfoil Snaps on front crossbar in seconds Creates smooth flow of air to reduce wind noise The SPECS of the Yakima WindJammer Airfoil Weight: 1 lb Dimension: 1 1/4 x 3 3/4 x 8\" This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Yakima WindJammer Airfoil FEATURES of the Yakima WindJammer Airfoil Snaps on front crossbar in seconds Creates smooth flow of air to reduce wind noise The SPECS of the Yakima WindJammer Airfoil Weight: 1 lb Dimension: 1 1/4 x 3 3/4 x 8\" This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y3e9RCQ1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012SDZZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yakima", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 25.0}}
