{"item_id": "B0012SNQVY", "title": "NcStar Green Laser with Weaver Base/Pressure Switch (APRLSG)", "description": "Product Description High visibility, even in daylight! Tactical Green Laser Sight priced LESS! 1-mile visibility at night AND up to 100 yds. in broad daylight! A powerful 532 nM 5mW Green Laser provides easy-to-see contrast in all lighting conditions. Pressure pad activates the beam in an instant with only two fingers. More: Rugged, aircraft-grade 6061 anodized aluminum housing. With reinforced internals so it resists recoil \"rattling\" off target; Tactical on / off pressure switch with approx. 14\" cable; Uses long-life 3V CR123A lithium battery (included); Adjustable windage and elevation position can be locked in with set screws.; Measures 4 1/2\"l., weighs 7 1/2 ozs.; Order yours today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. NcSTAR Green Laser with 1\" Scope Mount", "text": "NcStar Green Laser with Weaver Base/Pressure Switch (APRLSG) Product Description High visibility, even in daylight! Tactical Green Laser Sight priced LESS! 1-mile visibility at night AND up to 100 yds. in broad daylight! A powerful 532 nM 5mW Green Laser provides easy-to-see contrast in all lighting conditions. Pressure pad activates the beam in an instant with only two fingers. More: Rugged, aircraft-grade 6061 anodized aluminum housing. With reinforced internals so it resists recoil \"rattling\" off target; Tactical on / off pressure switch with approx. 14\" cable; Uses long-life 3V CR123A lithium battery (included); Adjustable windage and elevation position can be locked in with set screws.; Measures 4 1/2\"l., weighs 7 1/2 ozs.; Order yours today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. NcSTAR Green Laser with 1\" Scope Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R-iznMDHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012SNQVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 38.0}}
{"item_id": "B0012SXXK8", "title": "Mace Brand Pepper Spray Pepper Gun", "description": "The Mace Pepper Gun is one of the most accurate defense sprays available. The OC pepper spray formula is contained in a replaceable cartridge. The cartridge utilizes advanced bag-in-a-can technology that allows you to spray a constant stream,reaching up to 20 feet, from any angle.The trigger-activated LED light disorients an attackers vision and helps to accurately aim the Mace Pepper Gun in low-light situations. Each Pepper Gun includes a 28 gram OC cartridge, a water practice cartridge, and batteries for LED light opperation.", "text": "Mace Brand Pepper Spray Pepper Gun The Mace Pepper Gun is one of the most accurate defense sprays available. The OC pepper spray formula is contained in a replaceable cartridge. The cartridge utilizes advanced bag-in-a-can technology that allows you to spray a constant stream,reaching up to 20 feet, from any angle.The trigger-activated LED light disorients an attackers vision and helps to accurately aim the Mace Pepper Gun in low-light situations. Each Pepper Gun includes a 28 gram OC cartridge, a water practice cartridge, and batteries for LED light opperation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j4iIe7c6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012SXXK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mace Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 37.45}}
{"item_id": "B0012TIUU0", "title": "Sunlite Forza Riser Block Gray", "description": "Forza Riser Block Gray. This is a GREAT riser block for the money !! • Sturdy riser block levels out bicycle when ridden on a trainer. • Fits 24\", 26\", 27\" and 700c wheels. • Accepts tire widths from 18mm to 2.5\".", "text": "Sunlite Forza Riser Block Gray Forza Riser Block Gray. This is a GREAT riser block for the money !! • Sturdy riser block levels out bicycle when ridden on a trainer. • Fits 24\", 26\", 27\" and 700c wheels. • Accepts tire widths from 18mm to 2.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g6-x8NsGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012TIUU0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Forza", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B0012TNXKC", "title": "ACR Electronics ACR WW-3 Survival Res-Q Whistle", "description": "Product No. 2228 Carded. Gets attention! Loud, shrill, dual tone audible from great distance Unique flat design prevents holding water Required by SOLAS 83 Meets USCG/SOLAS requirements Aids in land or sea rescues Use on life jackets, vests, foul weather gear, ring buoys, rafts, key chains, etc. Developed for the U.S. Navy; used by NASA, major airlines and shipping companies Complete with 18 (45.5 cm) of lanyard.", "text": "ACR Electronics ACR WW-3 Survival Res-Q Whistle Product No. 2228 Carded. Gets attention! Loud, shrill, dual tone audible from great distance Unique flat design prevents holding water Required by SOLAS 83 Meets USCG/SOLAS requirements Aids in land or sea rescues Use on life jackets, vests, foul weather gear, ring buoys, rafts, key chains, etc. Developed for the U.S. Navy; used by NASA, major airlines and shipping companies Complete with 18 (45.5 cm) of lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aXJ4NFuwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012TNXKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ACR Electronics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 4.94}}
