{"item_id": "B0012XIUP6", "title": "Iron Kettlebells 5-100 lbs. Singles by Body Solid", "description": "A legendary Russian exercise device, the kettlebell has long been a favorite for those seeking a special edge in strength and endurance. Kettlebell training develops strength, power, endurance and balance.", "text": "Iron Kettlebells 5-100 lbs. Singles by Body Solid A legendary Russian exercise device, the kettlebell has long been a favorite for those seeking a special edge in strength and endurance. Kettlebell training develops strength, power, endurance and balance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OZJ2VtvZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012XIUP6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0012XTS34", "title": "Galco Ankle Lite / Ankle Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33", "description": "After two decades of universal praise for the Ankle Glove, Galco has added the Ankle Lite to the Concealed Carry Lite family of holsters. Using the same wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure as the Ankle Glove with Center Cut Steerhide for the holster, the Ankle Lite combines extended wearing comfort with unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle, while speed of draw is enhanced with a reinforced thumb break retention strap. The Ankle Lite may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately), and accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Lite is available in right or left hand draw in black or khaki finish.", "text": "Galco Ankle Lite / Ankle Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 After two decades of universal praise for the Ankle Glove, Galco has added the Ankle Lite to the Concealed Carry Lite family of holsters. Using the same wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure as the Ankle Glove with Center Cut Steerhide for the holster, the Ankle Lite combines extended wearing comfort with unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle, while speed of draw is enhanced with a reinforced thumb break retention strap. The Ankle Lite may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately), and accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Lite is available in right or left hand draw in black or khaki finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nYB1nG1XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012XTS34.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 62.32}}
{"item_id": "B0012YEKAE", "title": "Nature's Wisdom Orange Oil Concentrate", "description": "PRODUCT INFORMATION Nature's Wisdom Orange Oil contains the raw oil collected from the citrus peel during juice extraction. No heat is applied during this \"cold pressed\" process thereby preserving the integrity of the oil. Orange Oil has been discovered to be an important ingredient in a variety of household and gardening applications. Orange Oil degrades the waxy coating on the ectoskeleton of insects, causing dehydration and asphxiation. INGREDIENTS: Cold pressed orange peel extract, emulsifier. DIRECTIONS FOR MIXING: SHAKE WELL BEFORE MIXING! Foliar Solution: Mix 2 ounces per gallon of water. Soil Drench: Mix 4 ounces per gallon of water. Cleaning Solution: Mix 2 ounces per gallon of water. DIRECTIONS FOR USE: SHAKE WELL BEFORE USE. Diluted Solutions can be used as a natural adjuvant to assist other sprays and soil applications.", "text": "Nature's Wisdom Orange Oil Concentrate PRODUCT INFORMATION Nature's Wisdom Orange Oil contains the raw oil collected from the citrus peel during juice extraction. No heat is applied during this \"cold pressed\" process thereby preserving the integrity of the oil. Orange Oil has been discovered to be an important ingredient in a variety of household and gardening applications. Orange Oil degrades the waxy coating on the ectoskeleton of insects, causing dehydration and asphxiation. INGREDIENTS: Cold pressed orange peel extract, emulsifier. DIRECTIONS FOR MIXING: SHAKE WELL BEFORE MIXING! Foliar Solution: Mix 2 ounces per gallon of water. Soil Drench: Mix 4 ounces per gallon of water. Cleaning Solution: Mix 2 ounces per gallon of water. DIRECTIONS FOR USE: SHAKE WELL BEFORE USE. Diluted Solutions can be used as a natural adjuvant to assist other sprays and soil applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YDdFSUFcL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012YEKAE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B0012YUPS0", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle KTP11 Kel-Tec P11 - 9mm & .40 cal / SKYY CPX-1 / Ruger LC9", "description": "Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle KTP11 Kel-Tec P11 - 9mm & .40 cal / SKYY CPX-1 / Ruger LC9 Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418e8ikKuKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012YUPS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.69}}
{"item_id": "B0012Z60CE", "title": "Meprolight AK-47 Tru-Dot Night Sight. Set (AKM pattern)", "description": "The ML33115 set fits the AKM pattern rifles in 7.62 x 39 caliber. This applies to the Soviet, Polish, Hungarian, Romanian and Egyptian AKM’s (graduated to 1000 meters) MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "text": "Meprolight AK-47 Tru-Dot Night Sight. Set (AKM pattern) The ML33115 set fits the AKM pattern rifles in 7.62 x 39 caliber. This applies to the Soviet, Polish, Hungarian, Romanian and Egyptian AKM’s (graduated to 1000 meters) MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y4hjz0X1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0012Z60CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meprolight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 124.49}}
