{"item_id": "B00130AJCU", "title": "Cold Steel Recon Scout Black Kraton Handle with Black Blade", "description": "In almost every respect, the Recon Scout is simply a 7 1/2 inch Trail Master Bowie. It offers the same steel, heat treatment, blade thickness, blade shape, and handle. Unlike other combat knives, the Recon Scout's broad clip point is highly resistant to bending or breaking. It's ideal for long range cutting and slashing. Additionally, the blade is equipped with a slightly concave false edge that measures approximately 3 1/2\" long.", "text": "Cold Steel Recon Scout Black Kraton Handle with Black Blade In almost every respect, the Recon Scout is simply a 7 1/2 inch Trail Master Bowie. It offers the same steel, heat treatment, blade thickness, blade shape, and handle. Unlike other combat knives, the Recon Scout's broad clip point is highly resistant to bending or breaking. It's ideal for long range cutting and slashing. Additionally, the blade is equipped with a slightly concave false edge that measures approximately 3 1/2\" long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sQaUBGpbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00130AJCU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 103.64}}
{"item_id": "B00130E81I", "title": "Outers .30 - .50 Caliber Bulk Bagged Cotton Patches (225 Count)", "description": "Outers time-tested cleaning patches accurately apply and spread our cleaners, degreasers, lubricants and protectants, helping these chemicals more effectively do their jobs. And after that work is done, they wipe away leftover solvent, oil, debris or other moisture to protect the bore of your favorite shotgun, rifle or handgun.", "text": "Outers .30 - .50 Caliber Bulk Bagged Cotton Patches (225 Count) Outers time-tested cleaning patches accurately apply and spread our cleaners, degreasers, lubricants and protectants, helping these chemicals more effectively do their jobs. And after that work is done, they wipe away leftover solvent, oil, debris or other moisture to protect the bore of your favorite shotgun, rifle or handgun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vc9OaO3BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00130E81I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 2.52}}
