{"item_id": "B00131Z56O", "title": "Smith's CSCS 4-in-1 Knife and Scissors Sharpener", "description": "Smith’s new 4-in-1 Knife and Scissors Sharpener features pre-set crossed carbide blades, sharpening steels, ceramic stones, and a scissors sharpener. Carbide blades provide quick edge setting capabilities, and the sharpening steels offer the perfect edge alignment. Specially shaped ceramic stones provide a razor sharp edge on serrated or standard blades.", "text": "Smith's CSCS 4-in-1 Knife and Scissors Sharpener Smith’s new 4-in-1 Knife and Scissors Sharpener features pre-set crossed carbide blades, sharpening steels, ceramic stones, and a scissors sharpener. Carbide blades provide quick edge setting capabilities, and the sharpening steels offer the perfect edge alignment. Specially shaped ceramic stones provide a razor sharp edge on serrated or standard blades.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RjtGVGOjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00131Z56O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00132NR9A", "title": "Chinning Triangle- Double D Low Row Handle", "description": "Solid steel, all welded, rubber molded grips.", "text": "Chinning Triangle- Double D Low Row Handle Solid steel, all welded, rubber molded grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ffr8Gr%2B%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00132NR9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ader Sporting Goods", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B001344WP6", "title": "Excalibur Boltcutter 150 Grain 3-Blade Broadhead (Pack of 3)", "description": "This 150 grain, 1-1/16\" broadhead has proven itself to be the accurate hunting head on today's high speed hunting crossbows, delivering amazing accuracy even at extreme range when teamed with an appropriately designed arrow. The Boltcutter is made entirely from high strength stainless steel to withstand the hardest hit and still deliver devastating terminal performance. Model 6670.", "text": "Excalibur Boltcutter 150 Grain 3-Blade Broadhead (Pack of 3) This 150 grain, 1-1/16\" broadhead has proven itself to be the accurate hunting head on today's high speed hunting crossbows, delivering amazing accuracy even at extreme range when teamed with an appropriately designed arrow. The Boltcutter is made entirely from high strength stainless steel to withstand the hardest hit and still deliver devastating terminal performance. Model 6670.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QMNf67xzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001344WP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Excalibur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 29.64}}
{"item_id": "B0013480Z4", "title": "Gerber 22-41795 Profile Fixed Blade Knife, Drop Point", "description": "", "text": "Gerber 22-41795 Profile Fixed Blade Knife, Drop Point", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s8YlG2O5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013480Z4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 25.89}}
{"item_id": "B001348108", "title": "Gerber 22-41131 Profile Guthook Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "This year, we bring you the Profile Knife Series, knives built for comfort and durability for heavy usage. Each knife is designed with non slip rubber handles to ensure you have a good grip even in wet environments. Every Profile has titanium coated 4\" blades and comes with a sturdy nylon sheath.", "text": "Gerber 22-41131 Profile Guthook Fixed Blade Knife This year, we bring you the Profile Knife Series, knives built for comfort and durability for heavy usage. Each knife is designed with non slip rubber handles to ensure you have a good grip even in wet environments. Every Profile has titanium coated 4\" blades and comes with a sturdy nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IYlfUlLfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001348108.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 21.56}}
{"item_id": "B001349LF2", "title": "Gerber 22-41052 Stag Lock-Back Double Bolster Fine Edge Pocket Knife", "description": "The meaty 2.5 double bolster Stockman has a safe, locking blade and features genuine stag handles and filigree etched bolsters. Comes with a velveteen gift bag", "text": "Gerber 22-41052 Stag Lock-Back Double Bolster Fine Edge Pocket Knife The meaty 2.5 double bolster Stockman has a safe, locking blade and features genuine stag handles and filigree etched bolsters. Comes with a velveteen gift bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TB9KH8jTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001349LF2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.41}}
{"item_id": "B001349MD8", "title": "Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool", "description": "The Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool is a pocket-sized companion, offering plenty of functionality in a minimalist package. With a #11 hobby blade, flat and Phillips drivers, wire stripper, pry bar, and more, the Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool helps you be prepared for almost anything, everywhere you go..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q1_2009/c26-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool includes:EAB #11 hobby bladeCross driverSmall flat driverMedium flat driverBottle openerWire stripperPry barLanyardA portable frame with a titanium nitride coating provides years of use.View Larger.Small Device Holds Eight ToolsThe most useful tool is the one you have when you need it--and with the Artifact, all you have to do is reach for your keychain to find what you need. At just 3.5 inches closed, the Artifact is barely larger than a cigarette lighter, but Gerber still managed to pack eight different functions into its compact, easily portable form.The Artifact includes a Phillips screwdriver, two flat-head screwdrivers, a bottle opener, pry bar, wire stripper, a knife that uses standard #11 blades, and a lanyard.Durable ConstructionAlthough it features a small profile, the Artifact is built for durability. It features stainless steel construction and has a titanium nitride coating for long-lasting durability.What's in the BoxGerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool", "text": "Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool The Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool is a pocket-sized companion, offering plenty of functionality in a minimalist package. With a #11 hobby blade, flat and Phillips drivers, wire stripper, pry bar, and more, the Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool helps you be prepared for almost anything, everywhere you go..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q1_2009/c26-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The Gerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool includes:EAB #11 hobby bladeCross driverSmall flat driverMedium flat driverBottle openerWire stripperPry barLanyardA portable frame with a titanium nitride coating provides years of use.View Larger.Small Device Holds Eight ToolsThe most useful tool is the one you have when you need it--and with the Artifact, all you have to do is reach for your keychain to find what you need. At just 3.5 inches closed, the Artifact is barely larger than a cigarette lighter, but Gerber still managed to pack eight different functions into its compact, easily portable form.The Artifact includes a Phillips screwdriver, two flat-head screwdrivers, a bottle opener, pry bar, wire stripper, a knife that uses standard #11 blades, and a lanyard.Durable ConstructionAlthough it features a small profile, the Artifact is built for durability. It features stainless steel construction and has a titanium nitride coating for long-lasting durability.What's in the BoxGerber 22-41770 Artifact Pocket Keychain Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xGjCa39XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001349MD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 8.84}}
