most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxAE-02 Aegis Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315pdzTR1RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00137HJPS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 61.18}}
{"item_id": "B00139COYM", "title": "Shimano CP-FH53 Spoke Guard For 36H, Freehub Clear", "description": "Item SpecificsFits a 32 or 36 tooth cog", "text": "Shimano CP-FH53 Spoke Guard For 36H, Freehub Clear Item SpecificsFits a 32 or 36 tooth cog", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eOny5E3ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00139COYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Guards"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B00139NDE2", "title": "Peter Janda Fin Fixed Blade Tactical Knife, Tanto", "description": "Designed by tactical trainer, Petr Janda for hard use and superior durability. Everything you need and nothing you don’t. The Fin fixed blades are able to withstand the rigors of every environment.", "text": "Peter Janda Fin Fixed Blade Tactical Knife, Tanto Designed by tactical trainer, Petr Janda for hard use and superior durability. Everything you need and nothing you don’t. The Fin fixed blades are able to withstand the rigors of every environment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310MgXr1EaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00139NDE2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00139P6OC", "title": "Victorinox One-Hand Trekker Camo NS", "description": "", "text": "Victorinox One-Hand Trekker Camo NS", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qDnAiIQNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00139P6OC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B00139UC6O", "title": "RCBS Combo 110V-AC Chargemaster", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Combo 110V-AC Chargemaster RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418finhjR6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00139UC6O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 373.49}}
{"item_id": "B00139WWU8", "title": "Kinetic Training Mat", "description": "When we're riding indoors the noise, the vibrations, and the pool of sweat on the floor are all signs of a good ride. The more the better, right? Of course, not everyone appreciates it like we do. Well-liked neighbors, landlords, and loved ones certainly deserve deference. It is for these people that the Kinetic by Kurt Trainer Mat is made. The mat is made from half-inch thick closed-cell foam. It's thick enough to indent but thin enough not to feel mushy. It's also a good thickness for masking floor imperfections. The finish is textured on top, smooth on the bottom. The bottom is better for sticking to floors while the top helps prevent that pooling sweat from rolling off. The top is also slightly absorbent, so dripped chain lube won't slide off. The Trainer Mat is also fairly big at 72in long by 36in wide. That's longer than your bike, plus the trainer. It rolls up to an 8in diameter to make storage easy. The Kinetic by Kurt Trainer Mat weighs eight pounds. It comes in Black with the Kinetic logo in Green.", "text": "Kinetic Training Mat When we're riding indoors the noise, the vibrations, and the pool of sweat on the floor are all signs of a good ride. The more the better, right? Of course, not everyone appreciates it like we do. Well-liked neighbors, landlords, and loved ones certainly deserve deference. It is for these people that the Kinetic by Kurt Trainer Mat is made. The mat is made from half-inch thick closed-cell foam. It's thick enough to indent but thin enough not to feel mushy. It's also a good thickness for masking floor imperfections. The finish is textured on top, smooth on the bottom. The bottom is better for sticking to floors while the top helps prevent that pooling sweat from rolling off. The top is also slightly absorbent, so dripped chain lube won't slide off. The Trainer Mat is also fairly big at 72in long by 36in wide. That's longer than your bike, plus the trainer. It rolls up to an 8in diameter to make storage easy. The Kinetic by Kurt Trainer Mat weighs eight pounds. It comes in Black with the Kinetic logo in Green.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z%2B7OCjAZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00139WWU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kinetic by Kurt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013A2AL8", "title": "Lyman Twin Tumbler (115-Volt)", "description": "Lyman's Turbo Twin has become one of the most popular tumbler choices. It features our Lyman 1200 Pro Tumbler with an extra 600 bowl system so reloaders can interchange bowls for small or large capacity loads. 600 Bowl is also ideal for rock polishing or small polishing or deburring operations. This model also features Lyman advanced drive system for faster, more consistent tumbling action.", "text": "Lyman Twin Tumbler (115-Volt) Lyman's Turbo Twin has become one of the most popular tumbler choices. It features our Lyman 1200 Pro Tumbler with an extra 600 bowl system so reloaders can interchange bowls for small or large capacity loads. 600 Bowl is also ideal for rock polishing or small polishing or deburring operations. This model also features Lyman advanced drive system for faster, more consistent tumbling action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l3043rVqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013A2AL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 81.57}}
{"item_id": "B0013AD5G2", "title": "Primos Men's Primos She-Mobile Turkey Decoy", "description": "A hen always makes a set-up more attractive to a tom. Use this decoy on the stake to represent a contented female or on the ground for a submissive pose. This decoy gets its name because, though it's full size and mounted, it's very easy to carry. It's made of a lightweight plastic that can be folded and carried in your vest. Includes Mobile Series Ground Breaker decoy stake. Imported.", "text": "Primos Men's Primos She-Mobile Turkey Decoy A hen always makes a set-up more attractive to a tom. Use this decoy on the stake to represent a contented female or on the ground for a submissive pose. This decoy gets its name because, though it's full size and mounted, it's very easy to carry. It's made of a lightweight plastic that can be folded and carried in your vest. Includes Mobile Series Ground Breaker decoy stake. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ewxVMr9JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013AD5G2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B0013AMPLS", "title": "Serfas FP-200 Floor Pump", "description": "This pump has it all: 160 PSI capabilities, Mid mounted gauge, and simple valve. With a lifetime warranty, this will be the last pump you ever buy.", "text": "Serfas FP-200 Floor Pump This pump has it all: 160 PSI capabilities, Mid mounted gauge, and simple valve. With a lifetime warranty, this will be the last pump you ever buy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zMaB8A6cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013AMPLS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013AQN7U", "title": "Cold Steel 53SS Scimitar Spike, Cord Wrapped Handle, Secure-Ex Sheath", "description": "4 in. blade with a solid steel handle wrapped in black cord. Comes with a Secure-Ex sheath and steel bead lanyard for neck carry. Overall length is 8 in. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 4.38 Blade Material: 420 Carry System: SecureEx Sheath Handle Material: Cord Wrapped Overall Length (inches): 8.13", "text": "Cold Steel 53SS Scimitar Spike, Cord Wrapped Handle, Secure-Ex Sheath 4 in. blade with a solid steel handle wrapped in black cord. Comes with a Secure-Ex sheath and steel bead lanyard for neck carry. Overall length is 8 in. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 4.38 Blade Material: 420 Carry System: SecureEx Sheath Handle Material: Cord Wrapped Overall Length (inches): 8.13", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Pt5pzZ5LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013AQN7U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013ASG3E", "title": "Ontario 8848 RAT Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Satin finished, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8848 RAT Folding Knife (Black) The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Satin finished, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L9DN8%2BbLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013ASG3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 28.64}}
