{"item_id": "B0013AUCFO", "title": "Ka-Bar Short Kraton-G Handled Fighting/Utility Knife", "description": "The Kabar Short Serrated Kraton G Handled Fighting/Utility Knife measures 9 1/4\" overall. This knife is a practically sized fixed blade knife that features a non-slip handle and hard plastic glass-filled Nylon sheath. Note, this item is also available exclusively for government NSN orders. Includes MOLLE attachment locks.", "text": "Ka-Bar Short Kraton-G Handled Fighting/Utility Knife The Kabar Short Serrated Kraton G Handled Fighting/Utility Knife measures 9 1/4\" overall. This knife is a practically sized fixed blade knife that features a non-slip handle and hard plastic glass-filled Nylon sheath. Note, this item is also available exclusively for government NSN orders. Includes MOLLE attachment locks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ff7XAOfTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013AUCFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 49.98}}
