{"item_id": "B0013BV540", "title": "KMC X8.99 Chain", "description": "KMC's chains provide world-class professional racers top-of-the-line products to help them win on the latest equipment. If you are a 6,7,or 8-speed rider, who still loves your set-up, KMC makes the X9. 99 with the same high quality as its 10 and 11-speed compatible versions just for you. This nickel-plated chain measures 1/2in x 3/32inch. It has 116 links to fit a variety of gear ratios. Pin length is 7. 3mm. The KMC X8. 99 comes in One size and in Silver.", "text": "KMC X8.99 Chain KMC's chains provide world-class professional racers top-of-the-line products to help them win on the latest equipment. If you are a 6,7,or 8-speed rider, who still loves your set-up, KMC makes the X9. 99 with the same high quality as its 10 and 11-speed compatible versions just for you. This nickel-plated chain measures 1/2in x 3/32inch. It has 116 links to fit a variety of gear ratios. Pin length is 7. 3mm. The KMC X8. 99 comes in One size and in Silver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mZlAsW3VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013BV540.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 14.99}}
