{"item_id": "B0013CGE9A", "title": "Champ Sprt Indoor/Outdoor Flexible Cone Set, Vinyl, Assorted Colors, 6/Set", "description": "This 6-cone set features brightly colored, flexible cones made of durable vinyl. A bright alternative to the typical field and gym maker, these cones stand 9-in in height.WARNING: This Product Contains Chemicals Known To the State of California To Cause Cancer and Birth Defects or Other Reproductive Harm.", "text": "Champ Sprt Indoor/Outdoor Flexible Cone Set, Vinyl, Assorted Colors, 6/Set This 6-cone set features brightly colored, flexible cones made of durable vinyl. A bright alternative to the typical field and gym maker, these cones stand 9-in in height.WARNING: This Product Contains Chemicals Known To the State of California To Cause Cancer and Birth Defects or Other Reproductive Harm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t749wMCrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013CGE9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Training Equipment", "Training Cones"]], "price": 9.02}}
{"item_id": "B0013CJLRW", "title": "Soft Air Swiss Arms Tactical Airsoft Vest", "description": "Train like a pro with the SoftAir Swiss Arms tactical vest. Equipped with multiple pockets to store all your SoftAir shooting essentials, the vest will keep you on top of your game at all times. The vest is extremely durable, with adjustable straps that deliver a secure, comfortable fit.", "text": "Soft Air Swiss Arms Tactical Airsoft Vest Train like a pro with the SoftAir Swiss Arms tactical vest. Equipped with multiple pockets to store all your SoftAir shooting essentials, the vest will keep you on top of your game at all times. The vest is extremely durable, with adjustable straps that deliver a secure, comfortable fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5132VJ3Za3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013CJLRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swiss Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 28.97}}
{"item_id": "B0013CLBLQ", "title": "Powell Golden Dragon Flying Dragon Complete Skateboard", "description": "Providing a high quality ride at an entry-level price, this Flying Dragon complete skateboard from Powell Golden Dragon is a great choice for both beginners and price-conscious advanced skaters. Manufactured in China using Powell Golden Dragon's AirLam presses, maple veneer source, and glue supplier, this PGD deck is one of the best produced in Asia. In addition, each component has been designed and built to demanding specifications and then tested during production to ensure consistently high quality.Deck Specifications:Shape: 126Concave: K12Length: 31.625 inchesWidth: 7.625 inchesWheelbase: 13.75 inchesNose: 7 inchesTail: 6.625 inchesBottom: ScreenedWheel Specifications:Diameter: 54mmWidth: 37mmHardness: 99aFormula: PGD Super High ReboundColor: NaturalCore: NoSurface: TreadedTruck Specifications:Width: 7.625 inchesMake: Golden Dragon", "text": "Powell Golden Dragon Flying Dragon Complete Skateboard Providing a high quality ride at an entry-level price, this Flying Dragon complete skateboard from Powell Golden Dragon is a great choice for both beginners and price-conscious advanced skaters. Manufactured in China using Powell Golden Dragon's AirLam presses, maple veneer source, and glue supplier, this PGD deck is one of the best produced in Asia. In addition, each component has been designed and built to demanding specifications and then tested during production to ensure consistently high quality.Deck Specifications:Shape: 126Concave: K12Length: 31.625 inchesWidth: 7.625 inchesWheelbase: 13.75 inchesNose: 7 inchesTail: 6.625 inchesBottom: ScreenedWheel Specifications:Diameter: 54mmWidth: 37mmHardness: 99aFormula: PGD Super High ReboundColor: NaturalCore: NoSurface: TreadedTruck Specifications:Width: 7.625 inchesMake: Golden Dragon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VJ107Z8YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013CLBLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Standard Skateboards & Longboards", "Standard Skateboards"]], "price": 75.95}}
