{"item_id": "B0013E23OS", "title": "Wildkin Princess Nap Mat", "description": "Features: 20in. W x 50in. L Cotton/polyester exterior Attached blanket lined with 100% cozy cotton flannel interior Easy roll-up with fastening straps Handy carrying strap Includes matching, removable pillow Naturally flame-resistant Never treated with chemicals Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements Machine washable: gentle cycle, cold water Embroidery friendly Recommended Ages 3+ Product Description: Sail off to dream-land in style with a Nap Mat by Wildkin. Sail off to dream-land in style with a Nap Mat by Wildkin. Wildkin Nap Mats can be used for school or home - rolls up for easy storage and travel. Wildkin Nap Mats can be used for school or home - rolls up for easy storage and travel. A favorite with preschools, daycares, and as a starter sleeping bag for little ones. Warranty and Safety Info: One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-free, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Information Act. Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements for sleeping bags as set forth in CPAI-75.", "text": "Wildkin Princess Nap Mat Features: 20in. W x 50in. L Cotton/polyester exterior Attached blanket lined with 100% cozy cotton flannel interior Easy roll-up with fastening straps Handy carrying strap Includes matching, removable pillow Naturally flame-resistant Never treated with chemicals Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements Machine washable: gentle cycle, cold water Embroidery friendly Recommended Ages 3+ Product Description: Sail off to dream-land in style with a Nap Mat by Wildkin. Sail off to dream-land in style with a Nap Mat by Wildkin. Wildkin Nap Mats can be used for school or home - rolls up for easy storage and travel. Wildkin Nap Mats can be used for school or home - rolls up for easy storage and travel. A favorite with preschools, daycares, and as a starter sleeping bag for little ones. Warranty and Safety Info: One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-free, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Information Act. Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements for sleeping bags as set forth in CPAI-75.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a-e3duSsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013E23OS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wildkin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 47.16}}
