nd travel. A favorite with preschools, daycares, and as a starter sleeping bag for little ones. Warranty and Safety Info: One-year manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-free, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Information Act. Conforms to U.S. flammability test requirements for sleeping bags as set forth in CPAI-75.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YgYakTK3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013E23PM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wildkin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 49.0}}
