{"item_id": "B0013FR09U", "title": "Fantasy Master FMT-016 Series Fantasy Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed", "description": "The Cobalt Scorpion Hunter features a REAL scorpion in the handle inlay. Each blade inlay contains a unique scorpion captured from the wilds of Asia.", "text": "Fantasy Master FMT-016 Series Fantasy Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed The Cobalt Scorpion Hunter features a REAL scorpion in the handle inlay. Each blade inlay contains a unique scorpion captured from the wilds of Asia.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VxpRpzGOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013FR09U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Master Cutlery, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B0013G1734", "title": "Petzl Attache Locking Carabiner", "description": "Lightweight, compact, pear-shaped screw-lock carabinerThanks to its compact shape and SCREW-LOCK locking system, the ATTACHE is designed for multiple uses related to belaying: connecting a belay system to a harness, belaying with a Munter hitch... It has an H cross section to reduce weight, as well as the Keylock system to avoid the carabiner snagging during maneuvers.Carabiner optimized for lightness and durability:Very compact shape is ideal for belay stationsH-shaped cross section offers an improved strength/weight ratiowider contact surfaces for better rope glide and reduced wear on the carabinerEasy to use, for efficient handling:SCREW-LOCK locking sleeve for good handling and effective lockingvisual indicator facilitates checking that the carabiner is lockednose and Keylock system helps avoid the carabiner snagging during maneuverscarabiner designed for better rope glide and to ensure good positioning of the belay deviceshape adapted for easy tying or untying of a clove hitchCertification(s): CE EN 362, CE EN 12275 type H, UIAA 121", "text": "Petzl Attache Locking Carabiner Lightweight, compact, pear-shaped screw-lock carabinerThanks to its compact shape and SCREW-LOCK locking system, the ATTACHE is designed for multiple uses related to belaying: connecting a belay system to a harness, belaying with a Munter hitch... It has an H cross section to reduce weight, as well as the Keylock system to avoid the carabiner snagging during maneuvers.Carabiner optimized for lightness and durability:Very compact shape is ideal for belay stationsH-shaped cross section offers an improved strength/weight ratiowider contact surfaces for better rope glide and reduced wear on the carabinerEasy to use, for efficient handling:SCREW-LOCK locking sleeve for good handling and effective lockingvisual indicator facilitates checking that the carabiner is lockednose and Keylock system helps avoid the carabiner snagging during maneuverscarabiner designed for better rope glide and to ensure good positioning of the belay deviceshape adapted for easy tying or untying of a clove hitchCertification(s): CE EN 362, CE EN 12275 type H, UIAA 121", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sMY6qOFHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013G1734.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013G2K30", "title": "Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley", "description": "FEATURES of the Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley Stainless steel sheaves for excellent durability Sheave mounted on sealed ball bearings for excellent efficiency Accepts up to three carabiners to facilitate use SPECIFICATIONS of the Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley Weight: 270 g Case Quantity: 10 Rope Diameter: Maximum: 13 mm Cable Diameter: Maximum: 12 mm Sheave Type: Sealed ball bearings Sheave Diameter: 27.5 mm Efficiency: 91% Working Load: 10 kN Breaking Strength: 24 kN Certification(s): CE EN 12278, UIAA ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley FEATURES of the Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley Stainless steel sheaves for excellent durability Sheave mounted on sealed ball bearings for excellent efficiency Accepts up to three carabiners to facilitate use SPECIFICATIONS of the Petzl Tandem Speed Pulley Weight: 270 g Case Quantity: 10 Rope Diameter: Maximum: 13 mm Cable Diameter: Maximum: 12 mm Sheave Type: Sealed ball bearings Sheave Diameter: 27.5 mm Efficiency: 91% Working Load: 10 kN Breaking Strength: 24 kN Certification(s): CE EN 12278, UIAA ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DDNp34HaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013G2K30.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Petzl", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Hardware", "Pulleys"]], "price": 89.95}}
