{"item_id": "B0013H1IO6", "title": "Enhanced Voodoo Tactical 42\" MOLLE Soft Rifle Case, Padded Weapon Bag", "description": "Whether you are carrying your rifle to the range or need to pack it in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry two long guns, two pistols and a great deal of related gear.The 42-inch (40.5-inches inside) padded case from Voodoo Tactical safely holds just about any compact rifle or carbine. If you are unsure if your firearm will fit, please contact us via email.Inside are adjustable tie downs so that you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The attention to detail and heavy thick foam on all six sides is a welcome change from the standard nylon case. It even features additional padding to protect your muzzle and the zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement.Behind the pouches, there's a second compartment with two padded pouches built in. Each is designed to hold a pistol, but you could also use these for optics or other accessories.This case comes with the three external pouches you see here, giving you plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits, your log book and other accessories. The three exterior pouches have gussets, making them hold far more than you would think. The two outside pouches can hold five or six magazines and the center pouch is even larger.This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.This listing is for the 42-inch padded rifle case.", "text": "Enhanced Voodoo Tactical 42\" MOLLE Soft Rifle Case, Padded Weapon Bag Whether you are carrying your rifle to the range or need to pack it in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry two long guns, two pistols and a great deal of related gear.The 42-inch (40.5-inches inside) padded case from Voodoo Tactical safely holds just about any compact rifle or carbine. If you are unsure if your firearm will fit, please contact us via email.Inside are adjustable tie downs so that you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The attention to detail and heavy thick foam on all six sides is a welcome change from the standard nylon case. It even features additional padding to protect your muzzle and the zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement.Behind the pouches, there's a second compartment with two padded pouches built in. Each is designed to hold a pistol, but you could also use these for optics or other accessories.This case comes with the three external pouches you see here, giving you plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits, your log book and other accessories. The three exterior pouches have gussets, making them hold far more than you would think. The two outside pouches can hold five or six magazines and the center pouch is even larger.This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.This listing is for the 42-inch padded rifle case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yjVMQaW0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013H1IO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 91.7}}
{"item_id": "B0013H5OA0", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 15-7613 Enhanced 36-inch MOLLE Compatible Soft Rifle Case", "description": "Whether you are carrying your carbines to the range or need to pack them in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry one or two long guns and a great deal of related gear. This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 15-7613 Enhanced 36-inch MOLLE Compatible Soft Rifle Case Whether you are carrying your carbines to the range or need to pack them in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry one or two long guns and a great deal of related gear. This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yjD5SyHXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013H5OA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 82.7}}
{"item_id": "B0013IU2YW", "title": "Zefal HPX Classic Bicycle Frame Pump", "description": "A durable, all-aluminium construction pump, available in 4 sizes The HPX spring locking system to fit any frame, without the need for straps or secondary fixings, ensures its capable of pumping up.", "text": "Zefal HPX Classic Bicycle Frame Pump A durable, all-aluminium construction pump, available in 4 sizes The HPX spring locking system to fit any frame, without the need for straps or secondary fixings, ensures its capable of pumping up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H%2B2U-6YGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013IU2YW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013J9U9Y", "title": "Wilson Pro Overgrip (3-Pack)", "description": "Preferred by tennis superstar Roger Federer, the Wilson Pro overgrip offers a terrific feel when applied to any racquet. The overgrip is made of super-thin, high-stretch felt, with a tapered starting end for easy application. In addition, the grip is available in a variety of colors, including white, orange, pink, yellow, green rose red, and silver, making it easy to accessorize. The overgrip comes in a roll that measures 0.6 mm thick, 25 mm wide, and 1,100 mm long.About WilsonAt the heart of sports history for almost a century, Wilson has been influential and intimately involved in shaping the games of tennis, golf, baseball, and American football. As the originator of breakthrough technologies, Wilson has produced legendary classics and earned world-wide legitimacy in each sport it participates in. The world's leading manufacturer of ball sports equipment, Wilson's core sports include tennis, baseball, American football, golf, basketball, softball, badminton, and squash. A division of Helsinki-based Amer Sports, Wilson is headquartered in Chicago.", "text": "Wilson Pro Overgrip (3-Pack) Preferred by tennis superstar Roger Federer, the Wilson Pro overgrip offers a terrific feel when applied to any racquet. The overgrip is made of super-thin, high-stretch felt, with a tapered starting end for easy application. In addition, the grip is available in a variety of colors, including white, orange, pink, yellow, green rose red, and silver, making it easy to accessorize. The overgrip comes in a roll that measures 0.6 mm thick, 25 mm wide, and 1,100 mm long.About WilsonAt the heart of sports history for almost a century, Wilson has been influential and intimately involved in shaping the games of tennis, golf, baseball, and American football. As the originator of breakthrough technologies, Wilson has produced legendary classics and earned world-wide legitimacy in each sport it participates in. The world's leading manufacturer of ball sports equipment, Wilson's core sports include tennis, baseball, American football, golf, basketball, softball, badminton, and squash. A division of Helsinki-based Amer Sports, Wilson is headquartered in Chicago.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RNp95qEiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013J9U9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Racquet Grips"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B0013KG2GC", "title": "Coleman 58-Quart Ultimate Extreme Marine Cooler", "description": "The Coleman 58-Quart Ultimate Extreme Marine Cooler was specially designed for boating and fishing, and made to stand up to extended outings and rugged use. The Marine Cooler holds 75 cans and sports a white exterior with UVGuard sun protection to impede yellowing and cracking from prolonged sun exposure. The cooler offers a full 6 days of ice retention, and features an antimicrobial liner to resist bacteria growth, and a secure locking lid latch to keep your contents sealed securely. This cooler is built for a long life of heavy use, with stainless-steel hardware, and swing handles for easy lifting and carrying. A rustproof, leak-resistant drain makes it easy to clean and empty the cooler. The lid is built with four convenient can holders to keep your beverage handy. A tray and cutting board are included.", "text": "Coleman 58-Quart Ultimate Extreme Marine Cooler The Coleman 58-Quart Ultimate Extreme Marine Cooler was specially designed for boating and fishing, and made to stand up to extended outings and rugged use. The Marine Cooler holds 75 cans and sports a white exterior with UVGuard sun protection to impede yellowing and cracking from prolonged sun exposure. The cooler offers a full 6 days of ice retention, and features an antimicrobial liner to resist bacteria growth, and a secure locking lid latch to keep your contents sealed securely. This cooler is built for a long life of heavy use, with stainless-steel hardware, and swing handles for easy lifting and carrying. A rustproof, leak-resistant drain makes it easy to clean and empty the cooler. The lid is built with four convenient can holders to keep your beverage handy. A tray and cutting board are included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C%2Bj7PZP6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013KG2GC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 94.98}}
{"item_id": "B0013KH8X8", "title": "Zefal Bicycle Rim Tape (17mm)", "description": "Reinforced woven cotton rim strips. Superior adhesive qualities keeps rim strip in place on rim. Can be used on most rims depending on width up to 700c/29\".", "text": "Zefal Bicycle Rim Tape (17mm) Reinforced woven cotton rim strips. Superior adhesive qualities keeps rim strip in place on rim. Can be used on most rims depending on width up to 700c/29\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bynIaaxEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013KH8X8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Wheels & Accessories", "Rims"]], "price": 8.49}}
