{"item_id": "B0013ON04U", "title": "Lightload Beach Towels (36x60\"full Size) The Only Beach Towels That Fit in Your Pocket (styles and colors may vary)", "description": "The lightest around, the super-absorbent (up to nine times its weight) towel is perfect for any backpacking or hiking trips. Fast drying, and reusable, Lightload Towels are made of 100% viscose material and are incredible space savers, fitting easily in your pocket when packaged, and unfolding to full size when opened. Waterproof packaging ensures a dry towel when you need it. Features: More absorbent than cotton beach towels The only beach towels that fit easily in a pocket The only travel towel suitable for any indoor or outdoor activity Considered one of the essential accessories for survival kit packing Uses include a ground cloth for sitting, flag for signaling, blanket for covering Ultra-light for backpacking and hiking Reusable and fast drying Machine washable Item Specifications: Dimensions: 60\" x 36\"", "text": "Lightload Beach Towels (36x60\"full Size) The Only Beach Towels That Fit in Your Pocket (styles and colors may vary) The lightest around, the super-absorbent (up to nine times its weight) towel is perfect for any backpacking or hiking trips. Fast drying, and reusable, Lightload Towels are made of 100% viscose material and are incredible space savers, fitting easily in your pocket when packaged, and unfolding to full size when opened. Waterproof packaging ensures a dry towel when you need it. Features: More absorbent than cotton beach towels The only beach towels that fit easily in a pocket The only travel towel suitable for any indoor or outdoor activity Considered one of the essential accessories for survival kit packing Uses include a ground cloth for sitting, flag for signaling, blanket for covering Ultra-light for backpacking and hiking Reusable and fast drying Machine washable Item Specifications: Dimensions: 60\" x 36\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515KxgcnrfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013ON04U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lightload", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 9.4}}
{"item_id": "B0013PQVTA", "title": "Cold Steel FGX Jungle Dart", "description": "Our Nightshade™ knives are light enough to be tied, tucked, or taped just about anywhere on one’s person. And, since they are impervious to heat, cold, moisture and extreme weather they are a natural to hide both inside and outside your house. They can be hidden virtually everywhere from the hedges and flowerpots in your yard, to the refrigerator, bookshelves, and closets in your house. Keep one in every room of the house, from the laundry room to the bathroom shower! With violent home invasions on the rise a strategically placed Nightshade™ could save the day, and even your life.", "text": "Cold Steel FGX Jungle Dart Our Nightshade™ knives are light enough to be tied, tucked, or taped just about anywhere on one’s person. And, since they are impervious to heat, cold, moisture and extreme weather they are a natural to hide both inside and outside your house. They can be hidden virtually everywhere from the hedges and flowerpots in your yard, to the refrigerator, bookshelves, and closets in your house. Keep one in every room of the house, from the laundry room to the bathroom shower! With violent home invasions on the rise a strategically placed Nightshade™ could save the day, and even your life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PRMlTR3GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013PQVTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Cases & Wallets"]], "price": 8.3}}
{"item_id": "B0013QT1TQ", "title": "Magnesium Firestarter", "description": "This is a compact and lightweight firestarter. Perfect for emergencies.", "text": "Magnesium Firestarter This is a compact and lightweight firestarter. Perfect for emergencies.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ss-IP2P-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013QT1TQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 10.28}}
{"item_id": "B0013QVC1Q", "title": "Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter", "description": "FEATURES of the Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter 440C premium stainless steel (58-60HRC) Sheath color options are black, coyote and foliage green Blade Opening: 0.50\" / 12.67 mm SPECIFICATIONS of the Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter Overall Length: 4.30\" / 10.92 cm Weight: 1.50 oz / 42.97 g", "text": "Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter FEATURES of the Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter 440C premium stainless steel (58-60HRC) Sheath color options are black, coyote and foliage green Blade Opening: 0.50\" / 12.67 mm SPECIFICATIONS of the Benchmade 7 Safety Cutter Overall Length: 4.30\" / 10.92 cm Weight: 1.50 oz / 42.97 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tlgcmSENL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013QVC1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 34.0}}
