{"item_id": "B0013R4AVY", "title": "Primos The Original Can Call", "description": "Estrus bleats tell bucks that a doe is ready to breed. Whitetail, blacktail, and mule deer may all respond quickly and dramatically to the doe estrus bleat produced by The Original Can Call. A very effective call during the pre-rut, rut, and post-rut hunting seasons, the Can Call attracts bucks and allows you a distinct advantage while hunting.Features:Reproduces the estrus bleat of a doe to attract bucksEstrus fleats are effective for pre-rut, rut, and post-rut huntingEffective at attracting whitetail, blacktail, and mule deer", "text": "Primos The Original Can Call Estrus bleats tell bucks that a doe is ready to breed. Whitetail, blacktail, and mule deer may all respond quickly and dramatically to the doe estrus bleat produced by The Original Can Call. A very effective call during the pre-rut, rut, and post-rut hunting seasons, the Can Call attracts bucks and allows you a distinct advantage while hunting.Features:Reproduces the estrus bleat of a doe to attract bucksEstrus fleats are effective for pre-rut, rut, and post-rut huntingEffective at attracting whitetail, blacktail, and mule deer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lfX45EyRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R4AVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 12.85}}
{"item_id": "B0013R4DBQ", "title": "Champion .22 Bullet Trap (Rimfire Only)", "description": "Champion's .22 Bullet Trap is a go-anywhere bullet trap created specifically for .22 rimfire shooters. The heavy-duty steel construction comes with a 10\" x 11\" target area and a \"bulldog\" target clip.", "text": "Champion .22 Bullet Trap (Rimfire Only) Champion's .22 Bullet Trap is a go-anywhere bullet trap created specifically for .22 rimfire shooters. The heavy-duty steel construction comes with a 10\" x 11\" target area and a \"bulldog\" target clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rqdlwoguL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R4DBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 68.64}}
{"item_id": "B0013R4DRU", "title": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for 12 Gauge Shotguns", "description": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush 12Ga Shotgun Blister Card 1260 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Hoppe's Tornado Brush for 12 Gauge Shotguns Hoppe's Tornado Brush 12Ga Shotgun Blister Card 1260 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419LhEfJgeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R4DRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.13}}
