{"item_id": "B0013R67A6", "title": "Hoppe's Precision Lubricating Oil, 14.9ml Bottle E/F", "description": "Keep your equipment working its best with Hoppe's precision lubricating oil. Refined to perfection, this high-viscosity oil is ideal for firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. This 14.9 ml bottle features a precision applicator, making it easy to access hard-to-reach areas. The oil is extra-long lasting and will not harden, gum, or expire.", "text": "Hoppe's Precision Lubricating Oil, 14.9ml Bottle E/F Keep your equipment working its best with Hoppe's precision lubricating oil. Refined to perfection, this high-viscosity oil is ideal for firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. This 14.9 ml bottle features a precision applicator, making it easy to access hard-to-reach areas. The oil is extra-long lasting and will not harden, gum, or expire.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nB4aoydBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R67A6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.99}}
