{"item_id": "B0013R6GPM", "title": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Round Splattering Target", "description": "Dirty Bird Rapid Fire Targets contain multiple target facings on one sheet to make for more shooting time and less target changing time. Each dirtybird target comes with an aiming point for open or scoped sights.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Round Splattering Target Dirty Bird Rapid Fire Targets contain multiple target facings on one sheet to make for more shooting time and less target changing time. Each dirtybird target comes with an aiming point for open or scoped sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HamIXdZQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R6GPM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013R6IAK", "title": "Champion Shooting Vise", "description": "Whether you are shooting or cleaning, Shooters Ridge offers a line of vises that hold your firearm tight for pinpoint accuracy and no-shake maintenance. Each item is designed for years of rugged service and meets the strict standards of Shooters Ridge.This unshakable vise gives you the kind of stability you need to get a handle on your prized rifle to give a proper cleansing. Use as a great tool to sight-in your rifle as well-the rugged construction will keep it together as long as you own your gun.", "text": "Champion Shooting Vise Whether you are shooting or cleaning, Shooters Ridge offers a line of vises that hold your firearm tight for pinpoint accuracy and no-shake maintenance. Each item is designed for years of rugged service and meets the strict standards of Shooters Ridge.This unshakable vise gives you the kind of stability you need to get a handle on your prized rifle to give a proper cleansing. Use as a great tool to sight-in your rifle as well-the rugged construction will keep it together as long as you own your gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sLDDFZNlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R6IAK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013R6IH8", "title": "Champion Target Holder with Case", "description": "Our Field Target Holder with 8 target clips provides a convenient place to hang targets or cans. The portable target holder keeps all your targets a full 28 inches off the ground. It is made of solid steel and equipped with a wind-resisting anchor plate. And now our Field Target Holder and clips comes in a convenient nylon carrying case with a drawstring closure and shoulder strap for easy portability.", "text": "Champion Target Holder with Case Our Field Target Holder with 8 target clips provides a convenient place to hang targets or cans. The portable target holder keeps all your targets a full 28 inches off the ground. It is made of solid steel and equipped with a wind-resisting anchor plate. And now our Field Target Holder and clips comes in a convenient nylon carrying case with a drawstring closure and shoulder strap for easy portability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XFsFFpdxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R6IH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 24.49}}
{"item_id": "B0013R6JJ0", "title": "MTM 30 Round 22 Caliber Ammo Wallet (Clear Smoke)", "description": "The W30-22-41 is a 22 Rimfire Ammo Wallet that looks and feels like a wallet and fits into most pockets. The handgun ammo wallets are great for backup rounds with no rattle noise. Each bullet is held securely and is well-protected. Comes in a see-thru Clear Smoke tint. Holds 20 rounds and fits: .22CB, .22 LR, .22 Mag and .17HMR", "text": "MTM 30 Round 22 Caliber Ammo Wallet (Clear Smoke) The W30-22-41 is a 22 Rimfire Ammo Wallet that looks and feels like a wallet and fits into most pockets. The handgun ammo wallets are great for backup rounds with no rattle noise. Each bullet is held securely and is well-protected. Comes in a see-thru Clear Smoke tint. Holds 20 rounds and fits: .22CB, .22 LR, .22 Mag and .17HMR", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z9HYq%2BQVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R6JJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0013R89DO", "title": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for 12 Gauge with Aluminum Rod, Clam", "description": "Shotgun Cleaning Kit - Clamshell12 gaugeContains: 2 oz No. 9 Solvent, 2.25 oz Lubricating Oil, patches, aluminum cleaning rod, & brush", "text": "Hoppe's Cleaning Kit for 12 Gauge with Aluminum Rod, Clam Shotgun Cleaning Kit - Clamshell12 gaugeContains: 2 oz No. 9 Solvent, 2.25 oz Lubricating Oil, patches, aluminum cleaning rod, & brush", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gq%2BL5f3wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R89DO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 12.85}}
