{"item_id": "B0013R8DCG", "title": "MTM 40/45/10MM Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "text": "MTM 40/45/10MM Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BsrM-Q8yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013R8DCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.28}}
