{"item_id": "B0013RA5DQ", "title": "RCBS Universal Case Loading Block", "description": "The RCBS Universal Case Loading Block has been designed to fit most any standard rifle or pistol case including the WSM, WSSM and Ultra Mag family of cartridges. The two-sided design offers three different case fits per side and will hold 50 cases. Short pistol cases fit in the raised upper portion of the block for easy access. The stepped holes accommodate large pistol and rifle cases.", "text": "RCBS Universal Case Loading Block The RCBS Universal Case Loading Block has been designed to fit most any standard rifle or pistol case including the WSM, WSSM and Ultra Mag family of cartridges. The two-sided design offers three different case fits per side and will hold 50 cases. Short pistol cases fit in the raised upper portion of the block for easy access. The stepped holes accommodate large pistol and rifle cases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410q6DkQkZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RA5DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.09}}
{"item_id": "B0013RB5CQ", "title": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Rod Slotted End, .22 Caliber Card", "description": "Hoppe's Tynex Slotted End .22 Cal 1422 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Hoppe's Gun Cleaning Rod Slotted End, .22 Caliber Card Hoppe's Tynex Slotted End .22 Cal 1422 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UJ9obsoeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RB5CQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 3.19}}
{"item_id": "B0013RB8Z0", "title": "RCBS 87088 Vibratory Case Cleaner-2", "description": "The RCBS Vibratory Case Cleaner offers a fast, dry-media case cleaning. The Case Cleaner holds up to 400 .38 Special or 180 .30-06 cases. It features a removable lid that allows you check cases during cleaning. The optional Media Sifter separates clean cases from dry media in seconds. The quiet, powerful motor is thermally protected and durable ¼” thick bowl. Two year limited warranty.", "text": "RCBS 87088 Vibratory Case Cleaner-2 The RCBS Vibratory Case Cleaner offers a fast, dry-media case cleaning. The Case Cleaner holds up to 400 .38 Special or 180 .30-06 cases. It features a removable lid that allows you check cases during cleaning. The optional Media Sifter separates clean cases from dry media in seconds. The quiet, powerful motor is thermally protected and durable ¼” thick bowl. Two year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zpcx2t-RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RB8Z0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 80.0}}
{"item_id": "B0013RBCOW", "title": "MTM 9 Round Rifle Ammo Wallet (Brown)", "description": "Hunters, as well as police snipers, will appreciate being able to remove bullets quickly and quietly from their jacket or shirt pocket using these 9 round ammo wallets. These boxes hold your ammo securely and also provide tip protection. They come with a textured finish and a MTM 10 year guarantee. Holds 9 Rounds and fits: 220 Swift, 243 / 270 / 308 / 348 Win., 250 / 300 Sav., 257 Roberts, 257 / 300 / 340 / 7mm Wby. Mag., 264 / 300 / 330 / 338 Win. Mag., 25-06 / 280 / 284 / 35 / 6mm / 7mm-08 Rem., 300 / 375 H&H; Mag., 30-06 Spr., 303 Brit., 30-40 Krag., 308 Marlin Exp., 308 Norma Mag., 333 Jeffery, 35 Whelen, 40-60 Marlin, 40-70 Sharps (Straight), 410 Shotshells, 44-40 Win., 445 Super Mag, 45-70 Govt and WCF, 6.5 / 7mm Rem. Mag., 6.5 Creedmoor, 6.5x50 Jap. Arisaka, 6.5x52 Italian, 6.5x54mm Mann-Schone, 6.5x55mm Swedish, 7x57 Mauser, 7x61 Sharpe 7 Hart, 7.5x55 Swiss, 7.65x53 Mauser, 7mm BR, 8mm-06", "text": "MTM 9 Round Rifle Ammo Wallet (Brown) Hunters, as well as police snipers, will appreciate being able to remove bullets quickly and quietly from their jacket or shirt pocket using these 9 round ammo wallets. These boxes hold your ammo securely and also provide tip protection. They come with a textured finish and a MTM 10 year guarantee. Holds 9 Rounds and fits: 220 Swift, 243 / 270 / 308 / 348 Win., 250 / 300 Sav., 257 Roberts, 257 / 300 / 340 / 7mm Wby. Mag., 264 / 300 / 330 / 338 Win. Mag., 25-06 / 280 / 284 / 35 / 6mm / 7mm-08 Rem., 300 / 375 H&H; Mag., 30-06 Spr., 303 Brit., 30-40 Krag., 308 Marlin Exp., 308 Norma Mag., 333 Jeffery, 35 Whelen, 40-60 Marlin, 40-70 Sharps (Straight), 410 Shotshells, 44-40 Win., 445 Super Mag, 45-70 Govt and WCF, 6.5 / 7mm Rem. Mag., 6.5 Creedmoor, 6.5x50 Jap. Arisaka, 6.5x52 Italian, 6.5x54mm Mann-Schone, 6.5x55mm Swedish, 7x57 Mauser, 7x61 Sharpe 7 Hart, 7.5x55 Swiss, 7.65x53 Mauser, 7mm BR, 8mm-06", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417qwt8tiGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RBCOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 5.79}}
{"item_id": "B0013RBCZG", "title": "Barnett Rope Cocking Device", "description": "This universal crossbow accessory fits all Barnett models, letting you manually cock your weapon while reducing draw weight by 50% and ensuring the bow is evenly cocked for maximum accuracy.WarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett crossbows are designed by hunters, for hunters. From its inception over 50 years ago, the company has created a range of crossbows based on the changing needs of hunters. Lightweight, adjustable, and powerful, Barnett products have helped crossbow technology evolve.", "text": "Barnett Rope Cocking Device This universal crossbow accessory fits all Barnett models, letting you manually cock your weapon while reducing draw weight by 50% and ensuring the bow is evenly cocked for maximum accuracy.WarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett crossbows are designed by hunters, for hunters. From its inception over 50 years ago, the company has created a range of crossbows based on the changing needs of hunters. Lightweight, adjustable, and powerful, Barnett products have helped crossbow technology evolve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B7b3NK6ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RBCZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Cocking Devices"]], "price": 11.97}}
{"item_id": "B0013RBD5K", "title": "Browning Safes Everdry Electric Dehumidifier 164128", "description": "Browning Safes Everdry Electric Dehumidifier 164128", "text": "Browning Safes Everdry Electric Dehumidifier 164128 Browning Safes Everdry Electric Dehumidifier 164128", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L%2Beq5DV7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RBD5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning Safes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013RD4FC", "title": "MTM Predator Shooting Rest", "description": "The MTM Predator Shooting Rest, with its exclusive solid four-legged stance, provides the stable, rock-solid gun rest that shooters demand of expensive heavy metal rifle rests, only at a fraction of the weight (3.5 pounds). Equally suited for rifle and handgun enthusiasts, the PSR-30 is lightweight and fully adjustable. The PSR's butt stock support not only levels the rest to uneven surfaces but also adjusts to fit any size long gun. Remove the support completely and PSR-30 becomes a stand-alone handgun rest or front rifle rest. A precision dialed height adjuster allows the shooter to zero in for pinpoint accuracy. The advanced design of the Predator's front rubber shooting pad offers solid contact with just about any shaped stock or barrel.", "text": "MTM Predator Shooting Rest The MTM Predator Shooting Rest, with its exclusive solid four-legged stance, provides the stable, rock-solid gun rest that shooters demand of expensive heavy metal rifle rests, only at a fraction of the weight (3.5 pounds). Equally suited for rifle and handgun enthusiasts, the PSR-30 is lightweight and fully adjustable. The PSR's butt stock support not only levels the rest to uneven surfaces but also adjusts to fit any size long gun. Remove the support completely and PSR-30 becomes a stand-alone handgun rest or front rifle rest. A precision dialed height adjuster allows the shooter to zero in for pinpoint accuracy. The advanced design of the Predator's front rubber shooting pad offers solid contact with just about any shaped stock or barrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31brOMYaTyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RD4FC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 45.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013RD6OG", "title": "MTM 2 Pistol Handgun Case Up to 8.5-Inch Revolver Barrel", "description": "MTM's Snap Latch Handgun Case offers durable construction, reliable snapping latches and a large comfortable handle. It is made of rugged polypropylene with a handsome textured finish. Thick foam padding and double padlock tabs are provided for the utmost in protective security. Holds two handguns with barrel lengths up to 8\" long. Firearms are securely held in place with two pieces of high-quality, convoluted foam padding.", "text": "MTM 2 Pistol Handgun Case Up to 8.5-Inch Revolver Barrel MTM's Snap Latch Handgun Case offers durable construction, reliable snapping latches and a large comfortable handle. It is made of rugged polypropylene with a handsome textured finish. Thick foam padding and double padlock tabs are provided for the utmost in protective security. Holds two handguns with barrel lengths up to 8\" long. Firearms are securely held in place with two pieces of high-quality, convoluted foam padding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uHxe0leaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RD6OG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013RD6OQ", "title": "MTM Universal Ammo Loading Tray Red (includes one tray)", "description": "The LT150M-30 Universal Loading Tray has been retooled and replaces the LT-150, which has served reloaders for many years. While it still holds almost all rifle cartridges .17 through .458 Winchester and handgun calibers for 9MM, .38 and .45 pistol caliber, it also now fits new rounds, such as the WSM, WSSM, Rem, Ultra Mags and the 500 S&W; Mag.", "text": "MTM Universal Ammo Loading Tray Red (includes one tray) The LT150M-30 Universal Loading Tray has been retooled and replaces the LT-150, which has served reloaders for many years. While it still holds almost all rifle cartridges .17 through .458 Winchester and handgun calibers for 9MM, .38 and .45 pistol caliber, it also now fits new rounds, such as the WSM, WSSM, Rem, Ultra Mags and the 500 S&W; Mag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KQDGTqyxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RD6OQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.11}}
{"item_id": "B0013RD79U", "title": "MTM 200 Round Small Bore Ammo Box .22 Long Rifle", "description": "The SB-200 was not only designed for 22 rifle small bore competitors, but also for varmint hunters and plinkers. It will easily hold 100 rounds in the down position for easy access during competition. Space in the center is available which can hold two full 50 round boxes. Recently retooled and now fits 17 HMR. Holds Up To: 250 rounds of: 22 Long Rifle, 22 Long, 17 Mach 2, 22 LR 150 rounds of: 17 HMR", "text": "MTM 200 Round Small Bore Ammo Box .22 Long Rifle The SB-200 was not only designed for 22 rifle small bore competitors, but also for varmint hunters and plinkers. It will easily hold 100 rounds in the down position for easy access during competition. Space in the center is available which can hold two full 50 round boxes. Recently retooled and now fits 17 HMR. Holds Up To: 250 rounds of: 22 Long Rifle, 22 Long, 17 Mach 2, 22 LR 150 rounds of: 17 HMR", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514vgTdi39L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RD79U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B0013RF6HG", "title": "MTM Single Handgun Case for up to 4-Inch Revolver (Black)", "description": "For semi-automatics (such as the 1911 up to N-Frame size S & W's) and revolvers with up to 4\" barrels, this case is a very popular size. There is room in the case for a trigger lock (not included) and it is pad lockable.", "text": "MTM Single Handgun Case for up to 4-Inch Revolver (Black) For semi-automatics (such as the 1911 up to N-Frame size S & W's) and revolvers with up to 4\" barrels, this case is a very popular size. There is room in the case for a trigger lock (not included) and it is pad lockable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iZXYGH3cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013RF6HG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.17}}
