{"item_id": "B0013SZ9K4", "title": "Avid Single Digit 7 Linear Pull Mountain Bicycle V-Brake Set - Graphite Grey", "description": "Back before Avid dominated the disc brake scene, we dominated the rim brake scene. Its no mistake that there are still Avid riders all over who ask themselves, Why would I need a disc brake? And dont forget: A light set of rim brakes is still lighter than the lightest disc brakes systems.", "text": "Avid Single Digit 7 Linear Pull Mountain Bicycle V-Brake Set - Graphite Grey Back before Avid dominated the disc brake scene, we dominated the rim brake scene. Its no mistake that there are still Avid riders all over who ask themselves, Why would I need a disc brake? And dont forget: A light set of rim brakes is still lighter than the lightest disc brakes systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-zx1gDGuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013SZ9K4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0013SZC8S", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Plate Rack", "description": "Cap Barbell's Olympic plate rack is made of durable steel contruction. The \"A\" frame style provides easy and convenient storage for all your standard 2\" weight plates. Protect your floors and fitness equipment with this economical plate rack. Ideal for home use. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Plate Rack Cap Barbell's Olympic plate rack is made of durable steel contruction. The \"A\" frame style provides easy and convenient storage for all your standard 2\" weight plates. Protect your floors and fitness equipment with this economical plate rack. Ideal for home use. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HY-2NkshL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013SZC8S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Plate Trees"]], "price": 49.98}}
{"item_id": "B0013T1NZS", "title": "Black Diamond Longboard Grip tape Sheet Black 10 x 48", "description": "You are looking at One 10\" x 48\" sheet of black grip tape. This grip is long enough to cover most longboards.", "text": "Black Diamond Longboard Grip tape Sheet Black 10 x 48 You are looking at One 10\" x 48\" sheet of black grip tape. This grip is long enough to cover most longboards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SlTlrgoGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013T1NZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Skateboard Parts", "Grip Tape"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B0013TR66I", "title": "Coupler Attachment - InStep & Schwinn Bike Trailers", "description": "InStep creates award-winning strollers and trailers that let you bring the little ones along for family bonding time during your workouts, while demonstrating how fun a fit lifestyle can be.The Bicycle Trailer Coupler attaches an Instep or Schwinn Trailer to almost any bike. It's made for use with all Schwinn and Instep trailer models that accommodate two children, and purchasing an additional coupler attachment means both Mom and Dad's bikes can be outfitted to tow the kids at a moment's notice.", "text": "Coupler Attachment - InStep & Schwinn Bike Trailers InStep creates award-winning strollers and trailers that let you bring the little ones along for family bonding time during your workouts, while demonstrating how fun a fit lifestyle can be.The Bicycle Trailer Coupler attaches an Instep or Schwinn Trailer to almost any bike. It's made for use with all Schwinn and Instep trailer models that accommodate two children, and purchasing an additional coupler attachment means both Mom and Dad's bikes can be outfitted to tow the kids at a moment's notice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c4imMJhOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013TR66I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "InStep", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers"]], "price": 11.95}}
