{"item_id": "B0013W6EJU", "title": "VIA Hand and Finger Exerciser for Musicians, Light Resistance (4-Pounds per Finger)", "description": "Stronger, faster fingers for musical excellence -- no matter what instrument you play, VIA Handgrip will greatly improve your strength, speed and dexterity while maintaining the health and well-being of your hands.", "text": "VIA Hand and Finger Exerciser for Musicians, Light Resistance (4-Pounds per Finger) Stronger, faster fingers for musical excellence -- no matter what instrument you play, VIA Handgrip will greatly improve your strength, speed and dexterity while maintaining the health and well-being of your hands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QOti6zzIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013W6EJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gripmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 9.1}}
