{"item_id": "B0013XXKO6", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Coil Style Tactical Pistol Lanyard", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s Tactical Pistol lanyard features a Streamlined Modified BTS modular belt loop attachment system. The micro coiled lanyard is covered with heavy duty rubber and will recoil time and tie again. Unique design allows you to remove your weapon and place it in a safe area you can do so quickly and easily. Tactical lanyards are available in Coiled and Coiled - Single Swivel versions.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Coil Style Tactical Pistol Lanyard BLACKHAWK!'s Tactical Pistol lanyard features a Streamlined Modified BTS modular belt loop attachment system. The micro coiled lanyard is covered with heavy duty rubber and will recoil time and tie again. Unique design allows you to remove your weapon and place it in a safe area you can do so quickly and easily. Tactical lanyards are available in Coiled and Coiled - Single Swivel versions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31imWgLOgiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013XXKO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 19.63}}
{"item_id": "B0013Z7Q7Q", "title": "Body Solid 16-Inch Bar Pad, Black", "description": "Beef Up Your Body. This bar pad was designed for function, fit and comfort. High-density foam padding with super-heavy nylon cover takes the burden off your shoulders and allows you to work with heavier weights. Fits all standard and Olympic bars for doing squats, lunges and calf exercises. Features easy-on, easy-off full length Velcro closure.", "text": "Body Solid 16-Inch Bar Pad, Black Beef Up Your Body. This bar pad was designed for function, fit and comfort. High-density foam padding with super-heavy nylon cover takes the burden off your shoulders and allows you to work with heavier weights. Fits all standard and Olympic bars for doing squats, lunges and calf exercises. Features easy-on, easy-off full length Velcro closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31v4a7XqZnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013Z7Q7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B0013Z7S6K", "title": "Lee Precision Resizing Lube 1 Tube", "description": "Lee Resizing Lube eliminates stuck and dented cases, makes sizing less work. Non-sticky, non-allergenic, and can be thinned with water.", "text": "Lee Precision Resizing Lube 1 Tube Lee Resizing Lube eliminates stuck and dented cases, makes sizing less work. Non-sticky, non-allergenic, and can be thinned with water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IMBfNME-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013Z7S6K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.03}}
{"item_id": "B0013ZGL0E", "title": "Body-Solid OAS14 14\" Olympic Adapter Sleeve", "description": "Converts 1\" standard plate posts to 2\"Olympic posts- 8\" or 14\" long.Heavy-duty nylon with hex bolt lock-down for long lasting performance.Sold Individually", "text": "Body-Solid OAS14 14\" Olympic Adapter Sleeve Converts 1\" standard plate posts to 2\"Olympic posts- 8\" or 14\" long.Heavy-duty nylon with hex bolt lock-down for long lasting performance.Sold Individually", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uGBAw2suL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0013ZGL0E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00140GGM6", "title": "Headsweats Women's Race Performance Running/Outdoor Sports Hat (One Size)", "description": "Standing and watching the runners go by at the crowded Chicago Marathon, in downtown Boston, or at Iron Man Kona, you'll see a hundred of these hats go by in an hour. This original Headsweats technical hat style can be seen almost everywhere, from the supermarket, charity walk, golf course, tennis court, construction site or favorite fishing hole. CoolMax Fabric shell provides moisture management and maximum air flow. CoolMax terry headband for comfortable moisture transfer performance. 100% Machine washable.", "text": "Headsweats Women's Race Performance Running/Outdoor Sports Hat (One Size) Standing and watching the runners go by at the crowded Chicago Marathon, in downtown Boston, or at Iron Man Kona, you'll see a hundred of these hats go by in an hour. This original Headsweats technical hat style can be seen almost everywhere, from the supermarket, charity walk, golf course, tennis court, construction site or favorite fishing hole. CoolMax Fabric shell provides moisture management and maximum air flow. CoolMax terry headband for comfortable moisture transfer performance. 100% Machine washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z6x8EFwaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00140GGM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Headsweats", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 15.46}}
{"item_id": "B00140KTRO", "title": "Cold Steel - Koga SD1, Nylon", "description": "The KOGA SD1 is a highly effective self defense tool made of virtually unbreakable plastic. It was designed by the world renowned martial artist and law enforcement trainer, Bob Koga. With proper training, it will function as a fantastic aid in obtaining joint locks and submission holds. It can also be used to target pressure points or act as an impact tool.Black, Silent and UndetectableMade of Virtually Unbreakable PlasticOnly Weighs 4.1 oz.", "text": "Cold Steel - Koga SD1, Nylon The KOGA SD1 is a highly effective self defense tool made of virtually unbreakable plastic. It was designed by the world renowned martial artist and law enforcement trainer, Bob Koga. With proper training, it will function as a fantastic aid in obtaining joint locks and submission holds. It can also be used to target pressure points or act as an impact tool.Black, Silent and UndetectableMade of Virtually Unbreakable PlasticOnly Weighs 4.1 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bI%2B03P0zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00140KTRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00140QD38", "title": "Tool Logic SLP2 Tactical Folding 1/2 Serrated Knife With LED Flashlight, Magnesium Fire Starter and Signal Whistle, Silver", "description": "The Tool Logic SLP2 gives you professional grade multi functional folding knife and solid steel construction. It features a tough Zytel frame with a liner style lock for smooth one handed operation, a 3-inch razor sharp 50/50 serrated blade made from 420 J2 stainless steel, a built-in loud signal whistle, black stainless steel pocket-belt clip, lanyard hole and magnesium alloy fire starter. Tool Logic's SLP2 offers a solid steel folder with a detachable brilliant white LED flashlight powered by four 1.5 Volt button cell batteries and is waterproof for shallow immersion or for use in wet environments. The Tool Logic SLP2 also brings you a magnesium alloy fire starter rated for 1,000 strikes with the capacity to throw off a shower of sparks at over 2,500 degrees even when wet. The SLP2 weighs 4.3 oz. and has a silver bead blast finish. The wrap-around Zytel sleeve and batteries are included. TOOL LOGIC, THE COMPANY - Tool Logic, a leading manufacturer of credit card-sized multipurpose tools and accessories, began in 1994 with an inspired dream of a credit card-sized case filled with tools by creator Steve Padden. Within a year, Tool Logic introduced its revolutionary Credit Card Companion to the marketplace, offering users the benefits of traditional multifunctional pocket knives and tools with the beneficial size of a credit card. Tool Logic has continued to innovate by expanding its product line to include multi-function folding knives, flashlights and key ring accessories. Our philosophy is to maximize function in minimal space.", "text": "Tool Logic SLP2 Tactical Folding 1/2 Serrated Knife With LED Flashlight, Magnesium Fire Starter and Signal Whistle, Silver The Tool Logic SLP2 gives you professional grade multi functional folding knife and solid steel construction. It features a tough Zytel frame with a liner style lock for smooth one handed operation, a 3-inch razor sharp 50/50 serrated blade made from 420 J2 stainless steel, a built-in loud signal whistle, black stainless steel pocket-belt clip, lanyard hole and magnesium alloy fire starter. Tool Logic's SLP2 offers a solid steel folder with a detachable brilliant white LED flashlight powered by four 1.5 Volt button cell batteries and is waterproof for shallow immersion or for use in wet environments. The Tool Logic SLP2 also brings you a magnesium alloy fire starter rated for 1,000 strikes with the capacity to throw off a shower of sparks at over 2,500 degrees even when wet. The SLP2 weighs 4.3 oz. and has a silver bead blast finish. The wrap-around Zytel sleeve and batteries are included. TOOL LOGIC, THE COMPANY - Tool Logic, a leading manufacturer of credit card-sized multipurpose tools and accessories, began in 1994 with an inspired dream of a credit card-sized case filled with tools by creator Steve Padden. Within a year, Tool Logic introduced its revolutionary Credit Card Companion to the marketplace, offering users the benefits of traditional multifunctional pocket knives and tools with the beneficial size of a credit card. Tool Logic has continued to innovate by expanding its product line to include multi-function folding knives, flashlights and key ring accessories. Our philosophy is to maximize function in minimal space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i9pa5s7XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00140QD38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tool Logic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B00140Y4JS", "title": "GCI Outdoor Quik-E-Seat", "description": "The Quik-E-Seat stool features a padded backrest and seat and patented Auto-Fold Technology shoulder strap allowing for easy opening, closing and carrying. The Quik-E-Seat is constructed of sturdy powder-coated steel and 600 denier polyester, making it the ideal choice for camping, picnicking, sports events and fishing. The Quik-E-Seat includes an extra-wide 18” backrest and beverage holder. Weighs 4 lbs and supports up to 250 lbs. Measures 27” x 18.2” x 14” when open and folds to 27” x 5” x 6”.", "text": "GCI Outdoor Quik-E-Seat The Quik-E-Seat stool features a padded backrest and seat and patented Auto-Fold Technology shoulder strap allowing for easy opening, closing and carrying. The Quik-E-Seat is constructed of sturdy powder-coated steel and 600 denier polyester, making it the ideal choice for camping, picnicking, sports events and fishing. The Quik-E-Seat includes an extra-wide 18” backrest and beverage holder. Weighs 4 lbs and supports up to 250 lbs. Measures 27” x 18.2” x 14” when open and folds to 27” x 5” x 6”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gdg1TBAqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00140Y4JS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B0014136PA", "title": "Lee Precision Chamfer Tool", "description": "Lee Chamfer tool chamfers and deburs inside and outside of case necks. Also used to remove the Crimping from primer pockets.", "text": "Lee Precision Chamfer Tool Lee Chamfer tool chamfers and deburs inside and outside of case necks. Also used to remove the Crimping from primer pockets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xc52YrYjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014136PA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.03}}
