{"item_id": "B00144EOLC", "title": "Salt-Away Concentrate- 32oz.", "description": "Salt-Away is a Motor Flush for inboard, outboard, I/O and personal watercraft motors and an exterior salt removing treatment. Salt-Away is water based, non-hazardous, biodegradable, and contains properties that attack and remove salt from any surface. Repeated use with Salt-Away will break down and remove old salt and rust deposits. Safe for use on any metal, aluminum, fiberglass, paint, rubber, plastic, chrome, glass, or any surface exposed to salt. Salt-Away will not strip away waxes, but will wash away salt and leave a protective film on the surface to protect against rusting.", "text": "Salt-Away Concentrate- 32oz. Salt-Away is a Motor Flush for inboard, outboard, I/O and personal watercraft motors and an exterior salt removing treatment. Salt-Away is water based, non-hazardous, biodegradable, and contains properties that attack and remove salt from any surface. Repeated use with Salt-Away will break down and remove old salt and rust deposits. Safe for use on any metal, aluminum, fiberglass, paint, rubber, plastic, chrome, glass, or any surface exposed to salt. Salt-Away will not strip away waxes, but will wash away salt and leave a protective film on the surface to protect against rusting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fT7NSld3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00144EOLC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Salt-Away Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 14.69}}
{"item_id": "B00144GL5Y", "title": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent, 6-Ounce Spray (SRA-6)", "description": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent 8oz. Clothing & Gear is for treatment of Clothing, Gear, Bed Nets, Tents, Sleeping Bags and Backpacks. Repels Mosquites and Ticks. Lasts for 6 weeks even through 6 laundering cycles. Keeps insects from biting through fabric. Oderless after application. Will not stain or damage clothing, fabrics, plastices, finished surfaces, or outdoor gear. Contains 0.50% Permethrin. Do not spray on skin.", "text": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent, 6-Ounce Spray (SRA-6) 3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent 8oz. Clothing & Gear is for treatment of Clothing, Gear, Bed Nets, Tents, Sleeping Bags and Backpacks. Repels Mosquites and Ticks. Lasts for 6 weeks even through 6 laundering cycles. Keeps insects from biting through fabric. Oderless after application. Will not stain or damage clothing, fabrics, plastices, finished surfaces, or outdoor gear. Contains 0.50% Permethrin. Do not spray on skin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rjwSz69gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00144GL5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 10.99}}
