{"item_id": "B00149TPJ8", "title": "Primos Dove Call", "description": "The Dove call is easy to use. For morning or afternoon hunts, the call can be used to entice doves closer for that perfect show. To recreate sounds of the different species of doves, vary the rhythm according to the species of dove you are trying to call.", "text": "Primos Dove Call The Dove call is easy to use. For morning or afternoon hunts, the call can be used to entice doves closer for that perfect show. To recreate sounds of the different species of doves, vary the rhythm according to the species of dove you are trying to call.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z9X3GEQYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00149TPJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 10.7}}
{"item_id": "B0014BD3DK", "title": "Platypus Hoser Hydration System", "description": "FEATURES of the Platypus Hoser Hydration System Hang/Carry loop Taste-and BPA-free Tough, dual-layer construction Slime Guard antimicrobial treatment Threaded outlet accepts Platy drink/ closure caps and more Two-piece, easy-clean HyperFlow bite valve The SPECS for 1 liter Weight: 34 oz / 1 liter Dimension: 5.25 x 11.5\" / 13.5 x 29 cm The SPECS for 1.8 liter Weight: 60 oz / 1.8 liter Dimension: 6.75 x 11.5\" / 17 x 29 cm The SPECS for 2 liter Weight: 70 oz / 2 liter Dimension: 6 x 16\" / 15 x 40.5 cm The SPECS for 3 liter Weight: 100 oz / 3 liter Dimension: 7 x 16.5\" / 18 x 42 cm", "text": "Platypus Hoser Hydration System FEATURES of the Platypus Hoser Hydration System Hang/Carry loop Taste-and BPA-free Tough, dual-layer construction Slime Guard antimicrobial treatment Threaded outlet accepts Platy drink/ closure caps and more Two-piece, easy-clean HyperFlow bite valve The SPECS for 1 liter Weight: 34 oz / 1 liter Dimension: 5.25 x 11.5\" / 13.5 x 29 cm The SPECS for 1.8 liter Weight: 60 oz / 1.8 liter Dimension: 6.75 x 11.5\" / 17 x 29 cm The SPECS for 2 liter Weight: 70 oz / 2 liter Dimension: 6 x 16\" / 15 x 40.5 cm The SPECS for 3 liter Weight: 100 oz / 3 liter Dimension: 7 x 16.5\" / 18 x 42 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MP4QIC5WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014BD3DK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
