{"item_id": "B0014BMBA6", "title": "Cold Steel Trail Hawk American Hickory Handle", "description": "Modeled after an early frontier pattern, our Trail Hawk can do it all. It's an excellent chopper and has a functional hammer poll with a hardened face so you can drives nails, hammer in stakes, and smash or crush just about anything. Best of all it's extremely lightweight and compact so it's a cinch to tuck it under your belt or lash it to a pack or shooting bag.", "text": "Cold Steel Trail Hawk American Hickory Handle Modeled after an early frontier pattern, our Trail Hawk can do it all. It's an excellent chopper and has a functional hammer poll with a hardened face so you can drives nails, hammer in stakes, and smash or crush just about anything. Best of all it's extremely lightweight and compact so it's a cinch to tuck it under your belt or lash it to a pack or shooting bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uVFsv0WfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014BMBA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 26.49}}
{"item_id": "B0014BMFXY", "title": "Lezyne Pressure Drive Bicycle Frame Pump - DUPLICATE", "description": "The Pressure Drive is a sleek, compact pump that delivers up to 120psi. A feather-weight, CNC machined aluminum structure features an oversized piston that houses a reversible Presta/Schrader hose.", "text": "Lezyne Pressure Drive Bicycle Frame Pump - DUPLICATE The Pressure Drive is a sleek, compact pump that delivers up to 120psi. A feather-weight, CNC machined aluminum structure features an oversized piston that houses a reversible Presta/Schrader hose.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21UylQwO1hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014BMFXY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]]}}
