{"item_id": "B0014BRW6E", "title": "Kool Stop Bicycle Brake Pads with X Pad (Dura-Ace/Ultegra)", "description": "Aluminum pad holders w/dual compound pads. Allen head screw attachment w/conical washer for toe-in. Includes one pair of salmon replacement pads", "text": "Kool Stop Bicycle Brake Pads with X Pad (Dura-Ace/Ultegra) Aluminum pad holders w/dual compound pads. Allen head screw attachment w/conical washer for toe-in. Includes one pair of salmon replacement pads", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zLxxpzQAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014BRW6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kool Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 17.75}}
{"item_id": "B0014BRWSM", "title": "Kool Stop Dura-Type Brake Pad Inserts - Black and Salmon", "description": "Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop The Dura-Type Brake insert pad was originally developed as an aftermarket upgrade for high end Shimano brake systems. It's perfect for dry conditions, but when the weather gets tough, they feature a special tip that removes water and mud from your rim. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-DURAB) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-DURASA) Patented Plow Tip Water Grooves Rim Friendly Compounds", "text": "Kool Stop Dura-Type Brake Pad Inserts - Black and Salmon Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop The Dura-Type Brake insert pad was originally developed as an aftermarket upgrade for high end Shimano brake systems. It's perfect for dry conditions, but when the weather gets tough, they feature a special tip that removes water and mud from your rim. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-DURAB) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-DURASA) Patented Plow Tip Water Grooves Rim Friendly Compounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xi4US%2BIAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014BRWSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kool Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014D2EHY", "title": "Whetstone Military Machete with Rubber Grip handle, Black, 19-Inch", "description": "This Military Machete is 19\" in overall length. It has a black composite handle with attached lanyard. The blade is made of stainless steel. This machete comes with a sheath.", "text": "Whetstone Military Machete with Rubber Grip handle, Black, 19-Inch This Military Machete is 19\" in overall length. It has a black composite handle with attached lanyard. The blade is made of stainless steel. This machete comes with a sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IlWq8Vj2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014D2EHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SZCO Supplies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 23.64}}
{"item_id": "B0014D49FO", "title": "View Swim Cap Silicone Rubber", "description": "SWIM CAP SILICONE RUBBER - BLACK", "text": "View Swim Cap Silicone Rubber SWIM CAP SILICONE RUBBER - BLACK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NuaXhTB4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014D49FO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "View Swimming Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B0014DXZT0", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0100 Military All Black Fixed Blade", "description": "This fixed-blade military knife features an innovative recurve blade designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. This blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. The blade is built of CPM3V tool steel with black Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) non-reflective coating. CPM3V tool steel provides maximum resistance to breaking and chipping and is highly wear resistant. It's built for impact toughness and to perform under the harshest field conditions. Includes nylon sheath with MOLLE compatible, multi-carry configuration webbing and universal pouch.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0100 Military All Black Fixed Blade This fixed-blade military knife features an innovative recurve blade designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. This blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. The blade is built of CPM3V tool steel with black Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) non-reflective coating. CPM3V tool steel provides maximum resistance to breaking and chipping and is highly wear resistant. It's built for impact toughness and to perform under the harshest field conditions. Includes nylon sheath with MOLLE compatible, multi-carry configuration webbing and universal pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KKgzYDAkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014DXZT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 249.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014DYKN0", "title": "Zero Tolerance Fixed Blade", "description": "This fixed-blade military knife was designed in cooperation with the military knife experts at Strider. For exceptional strength and wear resistance, the laser-machined blade is S30V stainless steel with Tungsten DLC high-performance coating. The full-tang blade is even sturdy enough for prying and punching tasks. The Ranger Green G-10 handles are 3-D machined for a superior grip in all weather conditions. Plus, the aggressive arc at the front of the handle and notched thump ramp provide an even more secure grip. A cord cutter is built into the choil of the blade and the handle is drilled to accept a lanyard. Includes Kydex® sheath with MOLLE compatible, multi-carry configuration.", "text": "Zero Tolerance Fixed Blade This fixed-blade military knife was designed in cooperation with the military knife experts at Strider. For exceptional strength and wear resistance, the laser-machined blade is S30V stainless steel with Tungsten DLC high-performance coating. The full-tang blade is even sturdy enough for prying and punching tasks. The Ranger Green G-10 handles are 3-D machined for a superior grip in all weather conditions. Plus, the aggressive arc at the front of the handle and notched thump ramp provide an even more secure grip. A cord cutter is built into the choil of the blade and the handle is drilled to accept a lanyard. Includes Kydex® sheath with MOLLE compatible, multi-carry configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31k6rioxrfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014DYKN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 214.99}}
{"item_id": "B0014DZQZQ", "title": "Lee Precision Pro Auto Disk", "description": "Best for reloading handgun cases. May also be used to charge rifle cases with use of Double Disk Kit. Commercial reloaders or competitive shooters first choice! Elastomer wiper and teflon coated metal casting make this the smoothest operating measure. Will not cut powder and almost totally eliminates leakage. Large hopper with shut-off valve is attached with brass thumb nuts for the ultimate in disk changing convenience. Increased safety with positive pull-back lever. Includes swivel adapter and spring return lever with spring and all four disks. Many prefer the Pro Auto-Disk for mass production reloading. The hopper holds 1/2 pound of powder. Lee Pro Auto Disk is designed for use with Pro 1000 and Load-Master presses. Used with the Powder Thru Expanding Die or Rifle Charging Die. Includes swivel adapter and spring return lever with spring. Includes 4 disks to adjust your charges with: Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc.", "text": "Lee Precision Pro Auto Disk Best for reloading handgun cases. May also be used to charge rifle cases with use of Double Disk Kit. Commercial reloaders or competitive shooters first choice! Elastomer wiper and teflon coated metal casting make this the smoothest operating measure. Will not cut powder and almost totally eliminates leakage. Large hopper with shut-off valve is attached with brass thumb nuts for the ultimate in disk changing convenience. Increased safety with positive pull-back lever. Includes swivel adapter and spring return lever with spring and all four disks. Many prefer the Pro Auto-Disk for mass production reloading. The hopper holds 1/2 pound of powder. Lee Pro Auto Disk is designed for use with Pro 1000 and Load-Master presses. Used with the Powder Thru Expanding Die or Rifle Charging Die. Includes swivel adapter and spring return lever with spring. Includes 4 disks to adjust your charges with: Disk A = .30 to .43 cc; Disk B = .46 to .66 cc; Disk C = .71 to 1.02 cc; Disk D = 1.09 to 1.57 cc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-h1HRElZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014DZQZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 51.99}}
{"item_id": "B0014E0VTG", "title": "Intex Comfort Frame Airbed Kit, Queen", "description": "Proving that inflatable beds aren't just for sleepovers anymore, the Intex Comfort Frame airbed is so comfortable, you can actually use it as a permanent alternative to a traditional mattress and box spring. The Comfort Frame is actually two beds in one, with an inner mattress that sits within a soft inflatable frame. When you have guests, you can separate the unit into two separate beds, with one person sleeping on the inner mattress and the other inside the frame. The remainder of the time, the Comfort Frame functions as a single luxuriously comfortable bed, with a unique pillowed headboard for added snugness and tubular chambers on the sides for firmness and support.The Comfort Frame airbed is made using a quality-tested 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 15-gauge vinyl I-beams and 16-gauge sides and bottom. The resulting surface is soft and uniform, and also keeps bedding from slipping off to the side. When used as a single bed, the Comfort Frame also makes it easy to tuck bedding inside the bed frame for a tidier look. And the Comfort Frame is easy to inflate thanks to the high-powered handheld electric pump. The Comfort Frame bed, which is raised 15.5 inches from the floor, supports up to 600 pounds and includes a duffel bag for easy storage and transport.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "text": "Intex Comfort Frame Airbed Kit, Queen Proving that inflatable beds aren't just for sleepovers anymore, the Intex Comfort Frame airbed is so comfortable, you can actually use it as a permanent alternative to a traditional mattress and box spring. The Comfort Frame is actually two beds in one, with an inner mattress that sits within a soft inflatable frame. When you have guests, you can separate the unit into two separate beds, with one person sleeping on the inner mattress and the other inside the frame. The remainder of the time, the Comfort Frame functions as a single luxuriously comfortable bed, with a unique pillowed headboard for added snugness and tubular chambers on the sides for firmness and support.The Comfort Frame airbed is made using a quality-tested 20.8-gauge waterproof flocked top, along with 15-gauge vinyl I-beams and 16-gauge sides and bottom. The resulting surface is soft and uniform, and also keeps bedding from slipping off to the side. When used as a single bed, the Comfort Frame also makes it easy to tuck bedding inside the bed frame for a tidier look. And the Comfort Frame is easy to inflate thanks to the high-powered handheld electric pump. The Comfort Frame bed, which is raised 15.5 inches from the floor, supports up to 600 pounds and includes a duffel bag for easy storage and transport.About IntexHelping people have fun for more than 40 years, Intex is the world leader in designing and producing high-quality, innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation. Every Intex product--which includes such items as above-ground pools, pool accessories, pool toys, airbeds, and boats--undergoes an intensive quality control process before it's released to the public. During the manufacturing process, highly trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, from the quality of the raw materials and the calibration of the machines to the making and assembly of each product. The goal is to produce the best possible product at the best possible price. Intex offices are located in such cities as Long Beach, California; WanChai, Hong Kong; Roosendaal, Netherlands; Beaufort, France; and Praha, Czech Republic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B1XK95mmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E0VTG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 145.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014E0XXA", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0200ST Response Serrated Folding Knife", "description": "The 0200ST is the serrated version of the 0200. It features an innovative recurve blade, with partial serration, designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. The blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. Open the knife one-handed using the ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. 3-D machined scales in G-10 provide a secure grip and top mechanical strength. Handle is drilled to accept a lanyard and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip-carry.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0200ST Response Serrated Folding Knife The 0200ST is the serrated version of the 0200. It features an innovative recurve blade, with partial serration, designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. The blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. Open the knife one-handed using the ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. 3-D machined scales in G-10 provide a secure grip and top mechanical strength. Handle is drilled to accept a lanyard and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip-carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RzYWC950L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E0XXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 130.89}}
{"item_id": "B0014E2BO4", "title": "Intex Prestige Downy Full Airbed Kit", "description": "Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Full-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 54 by 8.75 by 75 inches (WxHxD) is an official Full-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "text": "Intex Prestige Downy Full Airbed Kit Great for the rugged outdoors but also handy around the house, the Full-sized Intex Prestige Downy Airbed is waterproof for camping use and its soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleeping surface. The mattress is constructed of a quality-tested, 20.8-gauge waterproof top with 14-gauge vinyl beams and 15-gauge sides and bottom for stability. The bed inflates in minutes thanks to the 3-in-1 valve with extra-wide opening and the portable, battery-powered pump (powered by 6C-size batteries; not included).The Prestige Downy Airbed is raised 8.75 inches from the floor, and at 54 by 8.75 by 75 inches (WxHxD) is an official Full-sized bed--ensuring a tight fit for fitted sheets. This bed has a 600-pound weight capacity. It folds compactly for storage, and it comes with a shelf box with carry handle for transport. Spot clean with mild soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xCW0mf3BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E2BO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 37.64}}
{"item_id": "B0014E2GNK", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0301 Ranger Green Folder Knife with Speed Safe", "description": "ZT and Strider joined forces to design this top-quality combat folder equipped with SpeedSafe manual assisted opening. The ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion enables you to deploy the blade one-handed. In addition to SpeedSafe, the 0301 features a tough S30V stainless-steel blade with Tiger Stripe Tungsten DLC (Diamond Like Carbon) coating, which enhances hardness and reduces friction drag—as well as providing a non-reflective camo surface. The blade is matched with Ranger Green G-10 scales, 3-D machined to provide a secure grip. A 3/8-inch hex head pivot shaft nut makes field adjustments possible with minimal tools. Includes a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip carry.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0301 Ranger Green Folder Knife with Speed Safe ZT and Strider joined forces to design this top-quality combat folder equipped with SpeedSafe manual assisted opening. The ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion enables you to deploy the blade one-handed. In addition to SpeedSafe, the 0301 features a tough S30V stainless-steel blade with Tiger Stripe Tungsten DLC (Diamond Like Carbon) coating, which enhances hardness and reduces friction drag—as well as providing a non-reflective camo surface. The blade is matched with Ranger Green G-10 scales, 3-D machined to provide a secure grip. A 3/8-inch hex head pivot shaft nut makes field adjustments possible with minimal tools. Includes a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left- or right-handed clip carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AId4K%2BUqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E2GNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 223.5}}
{"item_id": "B0014E2S2O", "title": "Zero Tolerance Folder w/Speed Safe Tanto Serrated Blade", "description": "The 0400st has all the features of the 0400, plus a partially serrated blade for additional cutting versatility. The Tanto-style military folding knife features SpeedSafe® manual assisted opening for one-handed blade deployment. The modified Tanto blade with partial serration is built of S30V stainless steel for strength and is coated with Tungsten DLC (Diamond Like Carbon) for a non-reflective matte-black finish. The 0400st is thinner than most of the ZT folding knives, making it ideal for compact carry. While the front scale features friction tape inserts for a secure grip, the back scale does not have the tape, enabling an easier draw and storage in the pocket. A 5/16-inch pivot shaft adjustment enables tighter or looser blade deployment. Includes a dual mounting system for tip-up or tip-down, right-handed clip carry.", "text": "Zero Tolerance Folder w/Speed Safe Tanto Serrated Blade The 0400st has all the features of the 0400, plus a partially serrated blade for additional cutting versatility. The Tanto-style military folding knife features SpeedSafe® manual assisted opening for one-handed blade deployment. The modified Tanto blade with partial serration is built of S30V stainless steel for strength and is coated with Tungsten DLC (Diamond Like Carbon) for a non-reflective matte-black finish. The 0400st is thinner than most of the ZT folding knives, making it ideal for compact carry. While the front scale features friction tape inserts for a secure grip, the back scale does not have the tape, enabling an easier draw and storage in the pocket. A 5/16-inch pivot shaft adjustment enables tighter or looser blade deployment. Includes a dual mounting system for tip-up or tip-down, right-handed clip carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UtIAzzpcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E2S2O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0014E3MSS", "title": "", "description": "Camco's 12\" Pigtail Propane Hose Connector is designed to connect a propane cylinder to an RV or trailer propane regulator. It has a ACME nut x 1/4\" inverted male flare. It is rated for 200,000 BTUs per hour. Safety features include thermal protection in case of fire and excess flow protection in case of broken gas line. You can use the pigtail hose with a 20 lb or 30 lb refillable propane tank and connect it to a regulator or 4-Port Brass Tee. It can also be used to connect to an installed 4-Port Tee as an auxiliary propane supply.", "text": "Camco's 12\" Pigtail Propane Hose Connector is designed to connect a propane cylinder to an RV or trailer propane regulator. It has a ACME nut x 1/4\" inverted male flare. It is rated for 200,000 BTUs per hour. Safety features include thermal protection in case of fire and excess flow protection in case of broken gas line. You can use the pigtail hose with a 20 lb or 30 lb refillable propane tank and connect it to a regulator or 4-Port Brass Tee. It can also be used to connect to an installed 4-Port Tee as an auxiliary propane supply.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Wi0JyBCxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E3MSS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "RV Parts & Accessories", "Appliances, Heating, A/C, & Ventilation", "Appliances"], ["Patio, Lawn & Garden", "Grills & Outdoor Cooking", "Grill & Smoker Parts & Accessories", "Grill Replacement Parts", "Grill Connectors & Hoses"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 15.34}}
{"item_id": "B0014E47I2", "title": "Zero Tolerance Tactical Response Knife", "description": "Sometimes, you just need a folding knife. The 0200 is a professional-grade, folding combat knife built to survive harsh, real-world conditions. It features an innovative recurve blade designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. The blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. The blade is 154CM stainless steel with Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) non-reflective coating. Open the knife one-handed using the ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. 3-D machined scales in G-10 provide a secure grip and top mechanical strength. Handle is drilled to accept a lanyard and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip-carry.", "text": "Zero Tolerance Tactical Response Knife Sometimes, you just need a folding knife. The 0200 is a professional-grade, folding combat knife built to survive harsh, real-world conditions. It features an innovative recurve blade designed for multi-tasking versatility, minimal mass, and maximum performance. The blade design provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations and a precisely centered point to handle piercing tasks with ease. The blade is 154CM stainless steel with Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) non-reflective coating. Open the knife one-handed using the ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. 3-D machined scales in G-10 provide a secure grip and top mechanical strength. Handle is drilled to accept a lanyard and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip-carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GLN5x2omL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014E47I2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 130.89}}
{"item_id": "B0014EAYUM", "title": "Water Filter Straw, Frontier Emergency Water Filter System for Emergency Disaster Preparedness, Survival Kits, Survival Packs, Survival Gear, Camping,", "description": "Frontier Emergency Water Filter System The ideal \"just in case\" filter straw for emergency use when traveling, hiking and fishing. Ideal as a backup filter for multi-day backpacking trips. The Frontier Filter can be used to drink from any bottle or cup, or directly from water sources. Removes contaminates down to 2 Microns in size including wide spread pathogens such as giardia, cryptosporidium and large bacteria. Frontier's ultra lightweight and compact package size fits in the smallest day pack, waist pack or pocket. Filters up to 20 gallons of water! The Frontier Emergency Water Filter System is ideal for hiking, travel, and emergency preparedness. It is the perfect addition to your 72 hour emergency kit. One unit will filter up to 20 gallons (75L) of water. Tests indicate that the Frontier Filter will remove 99.9% of Cryptosporidium and Giardia. The Frontier Emergency Water Filter System is also easy to operate, just attach and expand the straw, submerge the filter end into the water source, and drink through the straw. Ultra light and compact, the Aquamira Frontier Emergency Filter System weighs less than one ounce and easily slips into a day pack, shirt pocket or travel luggage and is always ready when you need it. The Frontier Filter is the ideal alternative to heavy, bulky and expensive pump filtration units when space and weight are primary factors. Activated carbon helps reduce waterborne chemicals and improves water taste. Use the Frontier Emergency Water Filter System to drink from any bottle, cup or directly from water sources. To remove viruses or bacteria smaller than 3 Microns in conjunction with Aquamira Water Treatment Drops or Aqumira Water Purifier Tablets before filtering.* *Sold separately", "text": "Water Filter Straw, Frontier Emergency Water Filter System for Emergency Disaster Preparedness, Survival Kits, Survival Packs, Survival Gear, Camping, Frontier Emergency Water Filter System The ideal \"just in case\" filter straw for emergency use when traveling, hiking and fishing. Ideal as a backup filter for multi-day backpacking trips. The Frontier Filter can be used to drink from any bottle or cup, or directly from water sources. Removes contaminates down to 2 Microns in size including wide spread pathogens such as giardia, cryptosporidium and large bacteria. Frontier's ultra lightweight and compact package size fits in the smallest day pack, waist pack or pocket. Filters up to 20 gallons of water! The Frontier Emergency Water Filter System is ideal for hiking, travel, and emergency preparedness. It is the perfect addition to your 72 hour emergency kit. One unit will filter up to 20 gallons (75L) of water. Tests indicate that the Frontier Filter will remove 99.9% of Cryptosporidium and Giardia. The Frontier Emergency Water Filter System is also easy to operate, just attach and expand the straw, submerge the filter end into the water source, and drink through the straw. Ultra light and compact, the Aquamira Frontier Emergency Filter System weighs less than one ounce and easily slips into a day pack, shirt pocket or travel luggage and is always ready when you need it. The Frontier Filter is the ideal alternative to heavy, bulky and expensive pump filtration units when space and weight are primary factors. Activated carbon helps reduce waterborne chemicals and improves water taste. Use the Frontier Emergency Water Filter System to drink from any bottle, cup or directly from water sources. To remove viruses or bacteria smaller than 3 Microns in conjunction with Aquamira Water Treatment Drops or Aqumira Water Purifier Tablets before filtering.* *Sold separately", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j5VXPqn%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EAYUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Liberty Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 9.25}}
{"item_id": "B0014EKSN0", "title": "Suncloud Optics Aviator Sunglasses", "description": "", "text": "Suncloud Optics Aviator Sunglasses", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ueDskibxL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EKSN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Suncloud", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Sunglasses"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Sunglasses"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Sunglasses & Eyewear Accessories", "Sunglasses"]], "price": 59.94}}
{"item_id": "B0014EL48S", "title": "Datrex 3600 Calorie Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits, Disaster Preparedness, Survival Gear, Survival Supplies, Schools Supplies, Disaster Kit (Pack of 2)", "description": "Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Food rations from Datrex are made from all natural ingredients, have high energy value and are tabletized and sub packaged for easy rationing. They have a five year shelf life and are also USCG approved so you know you can count on them when you need them.200 calories per bar/2 packs of 18 bars.", "text": "Datrex 3600 Calorie Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits, Disaster Preparedness, Survival Gear, Survival Supplies, Schools Supplies, Disaster Kit (Pack of 2) Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Food rations from Datrex are made from all natural ingredients, have high energy value and are tabletized and sub packaged for easy rationing. They have a five year shelf life and are also USCG approved so you know you can count on them when you need them.200 calories per bar/2 packs of 18 bars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dshRGeEbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EL48S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Datrex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014EV24Y", "title": "Olive Drab US 70% Virgin Wool Blanket", "description": "This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "text": "Olive Drab US 70% Virgin Wool Blanket This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lO%2BjKzEjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EV24Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014EVJ06", "title": "Cressi DF 200189 Swimming Nose Clips", "description": "The Cressi Kit nose clips are designed to stay firmly in place while swimming. There unique design will keep water out, while the pads maintain a comfortable fit with no over pinching. The clips are also adjustable so you can fit them to your nose without the possibility of compromising the integrity of the clips themselves. A handy carrying case is also included.", "text": "Cressi DF 200189 Swimming Nose Clips The Cressi Kit nose clips are designed to stay firmly in place while swimming. There unique design will keep water out, while the pads maintain a comfortable fit with no over pinching. The clips are also adjustable so you can fit them to your nose without the possibility of compromising the integrity of the clips themselves. A handy carrying case is also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IJOeYBgOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EVJ06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cressi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Nose Clips"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B0014EXRC4", "title": "Cressi Light Fin Pool and Training Short Blade Closed Foot Fins", "description": "New Cressi fins designed specifically for the pool and for training.The short blade is made from highly reactive and light materials to guarantee agile and not very tiring, but still effective kicking.The length of the blade and the materials used have been studied to enable perfect muscle training, without ever causing painful cramps.The side of the blade is protected by a soft elastomer profile to prevent possible damage to other swimmers.EuropeanEuropeanUSA Sizes38395 - 5 1/239406- 6 1/240417- 7 1/241428- 8 1/242439- 9 1/2434410- 10 1/2444511- 11 1/2454612- 12 1/2464713- 13 1/2", "text": "Cressi Light Fin Pool and Training Short Blade Closed Foot Fins New Cressi fins designed specifically for the pool and for training.The short blade is made from highly reactive and light materials to guarantee agile and not very tiring, but still effective kicking.The length of the blade and the materials used have been studied to enable perfect muscle training, without ever causing painful cramps.The side of the blade is protected by a soft elastomer profile to prevent possible damage to other swimmers.EuropeanEuropeanUSA Sizes38395 - 5 1/239406- 6 1/240417- 7 1/241428- 8 1/242439- 9 1/2434410- 10 1/2444511- 11 1/2454612- 12 1/2464713- 13 1/2", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2ByPL5XViL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014EXRC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0014F5WIA", "title": "GoPro Handlebar Seatpost Mount", "description": "Part of the beauty of the GoPro HD Hero Camera is its go-anywhere versatility. And to make the most of it, you may want to be able to mount the camera securely to your bike. With the GoPro Mounting Clamp, you can attach your camera to any round or semi-round tube from 19 - 35mm in diameter. So you can have your camera on the chainstays, seatpost, handlebars, or even on the fork legs. Whatever view you choose, you can capture it.The GoPro Handlebar Mounting Clamp includes the tool-free handlebar clamp and a three-way adjustable pivot arm so you can position the camera housing at any angle relative to the clamp.Product FeaturesMaterial: polycarbonate, stainless steelDimensions:Zoom Length:Effective Focal Length:Field of View:Aperature:Resolution:Megapixels:Memory Card Type:Video Size:Video Formats:Video Processor:Sensor:Photo Formats:Frame Rates:Battery Type:ISO Range:LCD Size:Manual Exposure:Manual Focus:Flash:Mic Type:Operating System:PC Connection:Attachment Type:Weight:Recommended Use: filming bike rides, kiteboarding, windsurfingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "GoPro Handlebar Seatpost Mount Part of the beauty of the GoPro HD Hero Camera is its go-anywhere versatility. And to make the most of it, you may want to be able to mount the camera securely to your bike. With the GoPro Mounting Clamp, you can attach your camera to any round or semi-round tube from 19 - 35mm in diameter. So you can have your camera on the chainstays, seatpost, handlebars, or even on the fork legs. Whatever view you choose, you can capture it.The GoPro Handlebar Mounting Clamp includes the tool-free handlebar clamp and a three-way adjustable pivot arm so you can position the camera housing at any angle relative to the clamp.Product FeaturesMaterial: polycarbonate, stainless steelDimensions:Zoom Length:Effective Focal Length:Field of View:Aperature:Resolution:Megapixels:Memory Card Type:Video Size:Video Formats:Video Processor:Sensor:Photo Formats:Frame Rates:Battery Type:ISO Range:LCD Size:Manual Exposure:Manual Focus:Flash:Mic Type:Operating System:PC Connection:Attachment Type:Weight:Recommended Use: filming bike rides, kiteboarding, windsurfingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416okRwdWiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014F5WIA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoPro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Steering Equipment", "Steering Wheels"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B0014FKRXU", "title": "Coleman 70-Quart Xtreme Marine Cooler", "description": "The Coleman 70-Quart Xtreme Marine Cooler was specially designed for boating and fishing trips. It holds 98 cans, and keeps its contents cold for a full five days. The Marine Cooler sports a white exterior with UVGuard sun protection to impede yellowing and cracking from prolonged sun exposure. It features a rustproof, leak-resistant drain for convenient no-tilt emptying and cleaning. Four convenient cupholders are built into the lid, to hold your beverage at the ready. Exterior measures 30.75-Inch x 15.75-Inch x 17.625-Inch.", "text": "Coleman 70-Quart Xtreme Marine Cooler The Coleman 70-Quart Xtreme Marine Cooler was specially designed for boating and fishing trips. It holds 98 cans, and keeps its contents cold for a full five days. The Marine Cooler sports a white exterior with UVGuard sun protection to impede yellowing and cracking from prolonged sun exposure. It features a rustproof, leak-resistant drain for convenient no-tilt emptying and cleaning. Four convenient cupholders are built into the lid, to hold your beverage at the ready. Exterior measures 30.75-Inch x 15.75-Inch x 17.625-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kQLzHdq3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014FKRXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 53.0}}
