{"item_id": "B0014H8E9C", "title": "Thermarest Tech Blanket", "description": "214770 Features: Use it as a stand-alone blanket, or use the built-in snaps to attach it to your Therm-a-Rest sleeping pad and Fitted Sheet Carry it easily to stows in own stuff pocket Stay warm with the high-loft synthetic fill insulation Stuff pocket Specifications: Weight: 1 lb 5 oz (Regular); 1 lb 11 oz (Long) Dimensions: 76 x 48 inches (Regular); 80 x 58 inches (Long) Material: nylon (shell); polyester (interior) Fill material: synthetic", "text": "Thermarest Tech Blanket 214770 Features: Use it as a stand-alone blanket, or use the built-in snaps to attach it to your Therm-a-Rest sleeping pad and Fitted Sheet Carry it easily to stows in own stuff pocket Stay warm with the high-loft synthetic fill insulation Stuff pocket Specifications: Weight: 1 lb 5 oz (Regular); 1 lb 11 oz (Long) Dimensions: 76 x 48 inches (Regular); 80 x 58 inches (Long) Material: nylon (shell); polyester (interior) Fill material: synthetic", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EMaOezupL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014H8E9C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014HLEIA", "title": "Protec Classic Helmet", "description": "Pro Tec Classic helmets are a popular choice at the park and on the street. Known for comfort, style, and protection, these helmets feature a tough yet lightweight ABS shells and two-stage liners for protection. The helmets come in a variety of sizes for a just right fit.Pro Tec Helmet Sizing Chart:", "text": "Protec Classic Helmet Pro Tec Classic helmets are a popular choice at the park and on the street. Known for comfort, style, and protection, these helmets feature a tough yet lightweight ABS shells and two-stage liners for protection. The helmets come in a variety of sizes for a just right fit.Pro Tec Helmet Sizing Chart:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B6q9o%2BKPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014HLEIA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0014JKQRI", "title": "Pearce Grips Frame Insert for Glock Gen Frames", "description": "The Pearce Grips Frame Insert installs in the bottom rear cavity of the Glock frame. It provides a cleaner appearance and keeps debris out of the frame cavity. Make sure to order the the correct size for your Glock", "text": "Pearce Grips Frame Insert for Glock Gen Frames The Pearce Grips Frame Insert installs in the bottom rear cavity of the Glock frame. It provides a cleaner appearance and keeps debris out of the frame cavity. Make sure to order the the correct size for your Glock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jxbWxUDdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014JKQRI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0014JM3W4", "title": "Pearce Grips PG-XD45 Springfield Armory XD Series Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-XD45 grip extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. These units blend with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. Made from High Impact Polymer; they withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. This extension will not alter the capacity of the magazine. They will add approximately 5/8 inch additional gripping surface. Not for XDM frame.", "text": "Pearce Grips PG-XD45 Springfield Armory XD Series Grip Extension The Pearce PG-XD45 grip extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing concealability. These units blend with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. Made from High Impact Polymer; they withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. This extension will not alter the capacity of the magazine. They will add approximately 5/8 inch additional gripping surface. Not for XDM frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211EfQXcsNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014JM3W4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.25}}
