{"item_id": "B0014UMU7Q", "title": "Avenir Cling-On Seatpost Racks (Black, Cling-On/4 Bolt)", "description": "The Avenir cling-on seatpost rack is a quick and easy way to add storage to your bicycle. It features a quick-release mount and an oversized alloy beam support.", "text": "Avenir Cling-On Seatpost Racks (Black, Cling-On/4 Bolt) The Avenir cling-on seatpost rack is a quick and easy way to add storage to your bicycle. It features a quick-release mount and an oversized alloy beam support.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S9Wzy5QXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014UMU7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 17.83}}
{"item_id": "B0014UQ93W", "title": "Avenir Excursion Rack-Top Bag (830 Cubic Inches)", "description": "Haul along your bike gear without wearing a cumbersome backpack with the Avenir Excursion rack-top bag. The Excursion is made of tough 600-denier polyester, with an easy Velcro mounting system that attaches securely to your rear bike rack. The large main compartment, meanwhile, is fully insulated, letting you haul along cool drinks or food on long bike rides. Other details include 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, reflective piping along the top, and a rear light clip for extra safety. The Excursion rack-top bag offers 830 cubic inches of storage space.", "text": "Avenir Excursion Rack-Top Bag (830 Cubic Inches) Haul along your bike gear without wearing a cumbersome backpack with the Avenir Excursion rack-top bag. The Excursion is made of tough 600-denier polyester, with an easy Velcro mounting system that attaches securely to your rear bike rack. The large main compartment, meanwhile, is fully insulated, letting you haul along cool drinks or food on long bike rides. Other details include 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, reflective piping along the top, and a rear light clip for extra safety. The Excursion rack-top bag offers 830 cubic inches of storage space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R20JN4qtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014UQ93W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0014UQ9RI", "title": "Avenir Universal XL Rear Rack (Black, Universal)", "description": "Avenir universal XL rear rack is full alloy construction with stainless hardware. Classic top-plate styling with plenty of space. It is designed to fit most bikes. Disc brake rack fits all Raleigh disc brake bikes and most other disc brake bikes with included mounting clips.", "text": "Avenir Universal XL Rear Rack (Black, Universal) Avenir universal XL rear rack is full alloy construction with stainless hardware. Classic top-plate styling with plenty of space. It is designed to fit most bikes. Disc brake rack fits all Raleigh disc brake bikes and most other disc brake bikes with included mounting clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41msIufGzjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014UQ9RI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0014UWJJ0", "title": "Empire Paintball X-Ray Single Lens Goggle, Black", "description": "The X-Ray paintball Goggle System comes complete with visor, hypo-allergenic foam and a high quality adjustable strap. Great protection for Beginners.", "text": "Empire Paintball X-Ray Single Lens Goggle, Black The X-Ray paintball Goggle System comes complete with visor, hypo-allergenic foam and a high quality adjustable strap. Great protection for Beginners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51f3N2tA%2BgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014UWJJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Empire Paintball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0014VIOLQ", "title": "Smith & Wesson 8 inch Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife", "description": "Smith & Wesson 8\" Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife is the fighting classic with Smith & Wesson quality to get you home! The perfect pairing! Since 1852 Smith Durable ABS handle with contoured ergonomic shape and all-weather grip; Heavy-duty nylon sheath; 12 3/4\" l, 14 1/2 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Smith & Wesson 8\" Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife", "text": "Smith & Wesson 8 inch Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife Smith & Wesson 8\" Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife is the fighting classic with Smith & Wesson quality to get you home! The perfect pairing! Since 1852 Smith Durable ABS handle with contoured ergonomic shape and all-weather grip; Heavy-duty nylon sheath; 12 3/4\" l, 14 1/2 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Smith & Wesson 8\" Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Special Forces Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gINN92h0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VIOLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 66.5}}
