{"item_id": "B0014VQ0RG", "title": "Harris Engineering Bipod Rotating Black Leg Notch 9\"-13\" SLM", "description": "Series S Bipod Model LM 913\" (Leg Notch)Manufacture ID: SLMThe Series S Harris Bipod rotates to either side for instant leveling on uneven ground. The hinged base has tension adjustment and buff springs to eliminate tremor or looseness in crotch area of the Bipod.This is an improved version of the original leg notch Bipod. The legs eject by spring action. Seven height settings from 9 to 13 inches. Weight is 14 ounces.Warranty: Guaranteed for one year from date of purchase against defects in material and workmanship.", "text": "Harris Engineering Bipod Rotating Black Leg Notch 9\"-13\" SLM Series S Bipod Model LM 913\" (Leg Notch)Manufacture ID: SLMThe Series S Harris Bipod rotates to either side for instant leveling on uneven ground. The hinged base has tension adjustment and buff springs to eliminate tremor or looseness in crotch area of the Bipod.This is an improved version of the original leg notch Bipod. The legs eject by spring action. Seven height settings from 9 to 13 inches. Weight is 14 ounces.Warranty: Guaranteed for one year from date of purchase against defects in material and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-XVPKTiLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VQ0RG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harris Engineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 93.65}}
{"item_id": "B0014VQ1N4", "title": "HKS 22-K Revolver Speedloader for S&W 17, 18, K22/Colt Diamondback/Dan Wesson 22", "description": "\"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 17, 18, K22/Colt Diamondback/Dan Wesson 22", "text": "HKS 22-K Revolver Speedloader for S&W 17, 18, K22/Colt Diamondback/Dan Wesson 22 \"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 17, 18, K22/Colt Diamondback/Dan Wesson 22", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419pYOUQ2fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VQ1N4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 13.18}}
{"item_id": "B0014VQ4FO", "title": "Bulldog Tactical Case Black", "description": "Your choice: AK - 47 or AR - 15 die - cut Bulldog 40x14\" Tactical Case. SAVE BIG! Protect your prized firearm... with this made-to-fit die-cast Gun Case. Padded foam is custom cut for your rifle, leaving no room for wiggle or wobble. Herculean-strong, reinforced, water-resistant composite for lasting endurance; Soft, luxurious fur padding on top lid; Die-cast foam for an exact custom fit; Full-length, double-locking zipper. Measures 40 x 14\", weighs 10 lbs., 14 ozs. ; State Style. Order Now! Bulldog Tactical Case, Black", "text": "Bulldog Tactical Case Black Your choice: AK - 47 or AR - 15 die - cut Bulldog 40x14\" Tactical Case. SAVE BIG! Protect your prized firearm... with this made-to-fit die-cast Gun Case. Padded foam is custom cut for your rifle, leaving no room for wiggle or wobble. Herculean-strong, reinforced, water-resistant composite for lasting endurance; Soft, luxurious fur padding on top lid; Die-cast foam for an exact custom fit; Full-length, double-locking zipper. Measures 40 x 14\", weighs 10 lbs., 14 ozs. ; State Style. Order Now! Bulldog Tactical Case, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X543HaBOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VQ4FO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 77.37}}
{"item_id": "B0014VQ50I", "title": "Bulldog Right Hand Black Ankle Holster (Fits Most Mini Semi Auto's, Beretta Bobcat)", "description": "Black Ankle Holster (RH) Sz 1 Mini Semi Auto 2 1/2\" Ankle Holster * Elastic and Velcro * Adjustable thumb break FITS MAKE & MODELS ~GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST MINI SEMI AUTOS * Beretta - Auto - 2 1/2 \" Barrel o 20 o 21 o 950 series o TOMCAT * Fits most small .380 style pistols o Taurus TCP o Ruger LCP o Keltec .380 o S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate o Taurus PT 738", "text": "Bulldog Right Hand Black Ankle Holster (Fits Most Mini Semi Auto's, Beretta Bobcat) Black Ankle Holster (RH) Sz 1 Mini Semi Auto 2 1/2\" Ankle Holster * Elastic and Velcro * Adjustable thumb break FITS MAKE & MODELS ~GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST MINI SEMI AUTOS * Beretta - Auto - 2 1/2 \" Barrel o 20 o 21 o 950 series o TOMCAT * Fits most small .380 style pistols o Taurus TCP o Ruger LCP o Keltec .380 o S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate o Taurus PT 738", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zrr0xeLtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VQ50I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.4}}
{"item_id": "B0014VQ72E", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Accessories Included Cleaning Kit (12 Gauge)", "description": "The Kleen-Bore 12 gauge kit is packaged in a reusable carrying/storage case. Each kit includes: 3-piece aluminum rod, adapter to accept 10, 12, 16, 20, 28 and 410-gauge accessories, phosphor bronze brush and mop, slotted patch holder, 3 oz. Formula 3 Gun Conditioner, cotton cleaning patches, silicone gun and reel cloth.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Accessories Included Cleaning Kit (12 Gauge) The Kleen-Bore 12 gauge kit is packaged in a reusable carrying/storage case. Each kit includes: 3-piece aluminum rod, adapter to accept 10, 12, 16, 20, 28 and 410-gauge accessories, phosphor bronze brush and mop, slotted patch holder, 3 oz. Formula 3 Gun Conditioner, cotton cleaning patches, silicone gun and reel cloth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414KB55YnOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VQ72E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 27.05}}
