{"item_id": "B0014VROMQ", "title": "Birchwood Casey Tru-Oil Stock Finish Kit", "description": "The Complete Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish Kit is the complete kit that gives you everything you need to finish a new stock or to refinish an old stock. Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish brings out the richness and beauty of fine woods and gives you a tough, long lasting finish. This easy to use kit includes: 3 ounce Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish, 3 Ounce Walnut Stain, 3 Ounce Stock Sheen and Conditioner, Fine, Medium, and course papers, 00 steel wool pads, service cloths, polish cloths, and a complete instruction guide.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Tru-Oil Stock Finish Kit The Complete Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish Kit is the complete kit that gives you everything you need to finish a new stock or to refinish an old stock. Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish brings out the richness and beauty of fine woods and gives you a tough, long lasting finish. This easy to use kit includes: 3 ounce Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish, 3 Ounce Walnut Stain, 3 Ounce Stock Sheen and Conditioner, Fine, Medium, and course papers, 00 steel wool pads, service cloths, polish cloths, and a complete instruction guide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DjIfio8CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VROMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 21.88}}
{"item_id": "B0014VRQII", "title": "Harris Engineering S25C Hinged Base 13.5 - 25-Inch BiPod", "description": "The Tallest Of The Bipods, Useful In Snow. It May Be Better Suited For Unusually Tall Or Heavy Men. Three Piece Leg Construction. Extends From Approximately 13-1/2 To 27 Inches Bareel Hieght. Hinged Base.", "text": "Harris Engineering S25C Hinged Base 13.5 - 25-Inch BiPod The Tallest Of The Bipods, Useful In Snow. It May Be Better Suited For Unusually Tall Or Heavy Men. Three Piece Leg Construction. Extends From Approximately 13-1/2 To 27 Inches Bareel Hieght. Hinged Base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FRbj6wawL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VRQII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harris Engineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 99.97}}
{"item_id": "B0014VRYYY", "title": "Bulldog Hybrid Assault Black Rifle Case", "description": "Black with Black Trim 35\" Assault Rifle Case New \"Hybrid Technology\" combines the proven performance of a soft case with the added protection of fiber reinforced sidewalls INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 33\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Deluxe soft Tricot inner lining * Thick Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Heavy-duty metal hardware and zippers * Deluxe padded shoulder strap * External pockets for storage and extra magazines * It Floats !!!", "text": "Bulldog Hybrid Assault Black Rifle Case Black with Black Trim 35\" Assault Rifle Case New \"Hybrid Technology\" combines the proven performance of a soft case with the added protection of fiber reinforced sidewalls INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 33\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Deluxe soft Tricot inner lining * Thick Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Heavy-duty metal hardware and zippers * Deluxe padded shoulder strap * External pockets for storage and extra magazines * It Floats !!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T%2B%2Be-blCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VRYYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
