{"item_id": "B0014VTREO", "title": "Blackhawk Hawktek Tactical Cheek Pad", "description": "Made of our HawkTex non-slip material for absolute positive cheek weld. Unique height adjustable inserts allow you to set the exact height you need.. Pad stays firmly in place with 3 adjustable straps and an end retaining strap to prevent forward slip. Weight: 4 oz.", "text": "Blackhawk Hawktek Tactical Cheek Pad Made of our HawkTex non-slip material for absolute positive cheek weld. Unique height adjustable inserts allow you to set the exact height you need.. Pad stays firmly in place with 3 adjustable straps and an end retaining strap to prevent forward slip. Weight: 4 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ELS7QLsRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VTREO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 25.62}}
{"item_id": "B0014VTRF8", "title": "Blackhawk Black Shotgun Sling", "description": "The Blackhawk Black Shotgun Sling makes it easy to carry your shotgun and shells comfortably through the field. The sling holds 15 extra shells and attaches to standard sling swivels with durable steel spring hooks. Constructed of high-quality, elastic nylon webbing, the sling is fully adjustable and has a non-slip backing that keeps it in place as you walk.", "text": "Blackhawk Black Shotgun Sling The Blackhawk Black Shotgun Sling makes it easy to carry your shotgun and shells comfortably through the field. The sling holds 15 extra shells and attaches to standard sling swivels with durable steel spring hooks. Constructed of high-quality, elastic nylon webbing, the sling is fully adjustable and has a non-slip backing that keeps it in place as you walk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tOeTrZvhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VTRF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 16.79}}
