{"item_id": "B0014VU07M", "title": "Butler Creek Bikini Rifle Scope Cover", "description": "Bikini Scope Cover... One size fits all standard rifle scopes! Millions of shooters appreciate the simplicity, effectiveness and affordable price of this great lens protector. The Bikini was designed for the economy-minded hunter/shooter who prefers a one-piece, quick clearing scope cover. Two pliable rubber-like cups joined by stretch retainers create a tight moisture and dust-proof seal to protect your valuable optics while in storage, transit or in the field. Fits rifle scopes with objective bells up to 62 mm outside diameter. Order Now! Butler Creek Bikini Scope Cover", "text": "Butler Creek Bikini Rifle Scope Cover Bikini Scope Cover... One size fits all standard rifle scopes! Millions of shooters appreciate the simplicity, effectiveness and affordable price of this great lens protector. The Bikini was designed for the economy-minded hunter/shooter who prefers a one-piece, quick clearing scope cover. Two pliable rubber-like cups joined by stretch retainers create a tight moisture and dust-proof seal to protect your valuable optics while in storage, transit or in the field. Fits rifle scopes with objective bells up to 62 mm outside diameter. Order Now! Butler Creek Bikini Scope Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YtE8hCaeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VU07M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 6.68}}
{"item_id": "B0014VU83I", "title": "Galco M7X Matrix for Glock 17, 22, 31, 19, 23, 32, 26.27, 33, 36", "description": "The M7X Matrix model features the same fine qualities as the other Matrix holsters. It is a durable thermoplastic holster that is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free. The M7X is also fast, very concealable, and easy on the budget. Setting it apart from other thermoplastic belt holsters, the patent-pending snap-on belt loops of the M7X – similar to those found on our deluxe Side Snap Scabbard – make it fast and easy to attach and remove from the belt. The M7X is a strong side belt holster that uses a butt-forward cant to enhance concealability. The open top makes the draw quick and easy, while the lateral tension when worn does an amazing job of retaining the pistol securely. Unlike so many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M7X features easy on/off belt loops that fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols, the M7X is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco M7X Matrix for Glock 17, 22, 31, 19, 23, 32, 26.27, 33, 36 The M7X Matrix model features the same fine qualities as the other Matrix holsters. It is a durable thermoplastic holster that is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free. The M7X is also fast, very concealable, and easy on the budget. Setting it apart from other thermoplastic belt holsters, the patent-pending snap-on belt loops of the M7X – similar to those found on our deluxe Side Snap Scabbard – make it fast and easy to attach and remove from the belt. The M7X is a strong side belt holster that uses a butt-forward cant to enhance concealability. The open top makes the draw quick and easy, while the lateral tension when worn does an amazing job of retaining the pistol securely. Unlike so many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M7X features easy on/off belt loops that fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols, the M7X is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41swYOyy7NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VU83I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.76}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVHT2", "title": "A-Zoom 6-Pack Precision Dummy Rounds fits 22 LR Action Proving", "description": "Precisely dimensioned for function testing and shooter training. These .22 LR Rimfire dummy rounds are not snap caps, but rather precisely dimensioned, functional dummies. 6 rounds per package.", "text": "A-Zoom 6-Pack Precision Dummy Rounds fits 22 LR Action Proving Precisely dimensioned for function testing and shooter training. These .22 LR Rimfire dummy rounds are not snap caps, but rather precisely dimensioned, functional dummies. 6 rounds per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BX%2Bd-7z7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVHT2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-Zoom Snap Caps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 12.01}}
