{"item_id": "B0014VVLCA", "title": "HKS 587-A Revolver Speedloader for S&W 66-7 Shot, 686-7 Shot, Taurus 617, 817, 827,66 (7 Shot)", "description": "\"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 686 (7 shot)/Taurus 617, 817, 827, 66 (7 shot)", "text": "HKS 587-A Revolver Speedloader for S&W 66-7 Shot, 686-7 Shot, Taurus 617, 817, 827,66 (7 Shot) \"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 686 (7 shot)/Taurus 617, 817, 827, 66 (7 shot)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410sSfIAmxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVLCA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 9.97}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVNZU", "title": "Tetra Gun Grease", "description": "Tetra Gun grease is a fluoropolymer penetrating heavy-duty grease lubricant that is great for use on rifles, pistols and shotguns. Can alos be used on bolts, rails, lugs and triggers.", "text": "Tetra Gun Grease Tetra Gun grease is a fluoropolymer penetrating heavy-duty grease lubricant that is great for use on rifles, pistols and shotguns. Can alos be used on bolts, rails, lugs and triggers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sy-gewTfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVNZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tetra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 8.24}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVOTK", "title": "Bulldog Extra Large Deluxe Black Police & Shooters Range Bag with Strap", "description": "Nothing protects your gun like a bulldog, as evidenced by the Bulldog deluxe police and shooters range bag. Made of durable, heavy-duty nylon with a water-resistant shell, the bag holds up to whatever Mother Nature can throw its way, including rain, wind, and snow. The bag also offers rigid sides for extra protection, along with heavy-duty, lockable hardware to keep other people out. Storage-wise, the bag features a large main compartment with two removable dividers, five external pockets, and even a couple of pockets inside the lid for smaller items. Other features include a padded, adjustable shoulder strap and Velcro strips on the top lid and back for attaching \"Police\"-style badges.The Bulldog deluxe range bag measures 22 by 12 by 9 inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Bulldog Extra Large Deluxe Black Police & Shooters Range Bag with Strap Nothing protects your gun like a bulldog, as evidenced by the Bulldog deluxe police and shooters range bag. Made of durable, heavy-duty nylon with a water-resistant shell, the bag holds up to whatever Mother Nature can throw its way, including rain, wind, and snow. The bag also offers rigid sides for extra protection, along with heavy-duty, lockable hardware to keep other people out. Storage-wise, the bag features a large main compartment with two removable dividers, five external pockets, and even a couple of pockets inside the lid for smaller items. Other features include a padded, adjustable shoulder strap and Velcro strips on the top lid and back for attaching \"Police\"-style badges.The Bulldog deluxe range bag measures 22 by 12 by 9 inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ChL4z0zEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVOTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 54.0}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVS9Q", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.38/.357/9mm)", "description": "The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care PocKit Handgun Cleaning Set (.38/.357/9mm) The unique design of PocKit handgun cleaning sets allows you to pack a two-section rod in a patented storage handle that also holds a phosphor bronze brush, mop and jag for easy, convenient storing and carrying. The first rod section with muzzle guard, cleans 2” to 5” barrels including most semi-automatics. Add a second section for barrels up to 83/8”. PocKit cleaning sets are offered in a variety of popular handgun calibers and the rod sections accept all Kleen-Bore handgun accessories (#8-32).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xbuRAiTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVS9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 18.25}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVTBS", "title": "CRKT Hissatsu Designed by James Williams", "description": "CRKT Hissatsu Designed By James Williams is a modern close-quarters knife with the heart of a Samurai! From martial arts instructor and knife designer James Williams comes the ultimate close-quarters knife! James' inspiration for this knife's unique blade springs from the heritage of the legendary samurai warlord Takeda Shingen. It's shaped for enormous penetrating power and superior slashing capability in one blade that works with the natural motion of the body. Intended as a backup weapon for close-quarters combat, this is a focused single-purpose knife to draw on when the tactical situation gets deadly serious. Take a stab at these details: 7 1/8\" dual grind Tanto blade is 440A stainless steel for serious edge-holding power and durability; Traditional Japanese pattern handle is updated with Twin-Fused technology... double injection-molded with a high-impact polypropylene core, butt and hilt, and a non-slip soft textured rubber grip handle surface; Oyatsubo, the emperor node on the omote (outside / public side) of the tuska (handle), allows you to know which direction the blade is facing, even in complete darkness, by touch; Custom injection-molded glass filled nylon sheath grips the knife firmly, and has a removable belt clip which can be attached high or low, vertical or horizontal with the included black two-piece screws... there are also holes and slots for carry on belts, webbing or equipment; 12 1/4\", total length.; Choose Color. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Cutlery. Cutlery cannot be shipped to Marin, Napa, Ventura and Yolo counties, CA; CO; CT; TN; D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Cutlery. CRKT Hissatsu Designed by James Williams", "text": "CRKT Hissatsu Designed by James Williams CRKT Hissatsu Designed By James Williams is a modern close-quarters knife with the heart of a Samurai! From martial arts instructor and knife designer James Williams comes the ultimate close-quarters knife! James' inspiration for this knife's unique blade springs from the heritage of the legendary samurai warlord Takeda Shingen. It's shaped for enormous penetrating power and superior slashing capability in one blade that works with the natural motion of the body. Intended as a backup weapon for close-quarters combat, this is a focused single-purpose knife to draw on when the tactical situation gets deadly serious. Take a stab at these details: 7 1/8\" dual grind Tanto blade is 440A stainless steel for serious edge-holding power and durability; Traditional Japanese pattern handle is updated with Twin-Fused technology... double injection-molded with a high-impact polypropylene core, butt and hilt, and a non-slip soft textured rubber grip handle surface; Oyatsubo, the emperor node on the omote (outside / public side) of the tuska (handle), allows you to know which direction the blade is facing, even in complete darkness, by touch; Custom injection-molded glass filled nylon sheath grips the knife firmly, and has a removable belt clip which can be attached high or low, vertical or horizontal with the included black two-piece screws... there are also holes and slots for carry on belts, webbing or equipment; 12 1/4\", total length.; Choose Color. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Cutlery. Cutlery cannot be shipped to Marin, Napa, Ventura and Yolo counties, CA; CO; CT; TN; D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Cutlery. CRKT Hissatsu Designed by James Williams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fwvS7BrhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVTBS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 55.7}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVXLY", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle HPP Ruger P94 ,95,97 with or without rails / Hi Point .45", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle HPP Ruger P94 ,95,97 with or without rails / Hi Point .45 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418MG6jrhJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVXLY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B0014VVY86", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL2 Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32/34/35", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.Note: Molded plastic holsters fit more tightly than leather holsters and require more force to remove. Removing a handgun from a molded holster requires a quick deliberate action, which is considered a safety feature in the event that someone is trying to take the user's gun away from him", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL2 Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32/34/35 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.Note: Molded plastic holsters fit more tightly than leather holsters and require more force to remove. Removing a handgun from a molded holster requires a quick deliberate action, which is considered a safety feature in the event that someone is trying to take the user's gun away from him", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PKO-PIyuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VVY86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.47}}
{"item_id": "B0014VX0I8", "title": "ATI Shotforce Shotshell Holder", "description": "Give your shotgun a personality of its own. The AI Shotshell Holder holds 5 additional 12 gauge shotshells.", "text": "ATI Shotforce Shotshell Holder Give your shotgun a personality of its own. The AI Shotshell Holder holds 5 additional 12 gauge shotshells.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418kMDCkJLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VX0I8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 15.56}}
{"item_id": "B0014VX0II", "title": "ATI Shotshell Holder", "description": "Constructed of military-grade DuPoint extreme temperature, glass-reinforced polymer, this shell holder keeps five 12-gauge shotgun rounds in an easy-access position on your weapon. Mounting hardware is included for easy installation to any ATI top-folding or full-length wood or synthetic stock.The quick-mounting accessory places five extra shotgun shells in an easy-access position.Lifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "text": "ATI Shotshell Holder Constructed of military-grade DuPoint extreme temperature, glass-reinforced polymer, this shell holder keeps five 12-gauge shotgun rounds in an easy-access position on your weapon. Mounting hardware is included for easy installation to any ATI top-folding or full-length wood or synthetic stock.The quick-mounting accessory places five extra shotgun shells in an easy-access position.Lifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DJi51NERL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VX0II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 14.94}}
{"item_id": "B0014VX0L0", "title": "ATI Hi-Point 9mm Carbine Stock w/Buttpad", "description": "This replacement stock for ATI's Hi-Point nine-millimeter carbine includes a textured grip, drop-in installation, weatherproof durability, and a scratch-resistant, DuPont extreme temperature glass-reinforced polymer material. The stock fits most Hi-Point nine-millimeter carbines, with minor modification sometimes required.Lifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "text": "ATI Hi-Point 9mm Carbine Stock w/Buttpad This replacement stock for ATI's Hi-Point nine-millimeter carbine includes a textured grip, drop-in installation, weatherproof durability, and a scratch-resistant, DuPont extreme temperature glass-reinforced polymer material. The stock fits most Hi-Point nine-millimeter carbines, with minor modification sometimes required.Lifetime WarrantyThis ATI product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About ATIPopular with collectors, hunting enthusiasts, and members of military and law enforcement communities, Advanced Technology International (ATI) is a leading manufacturer of innovative rifle stocks, shotgun stocks, and accessories for a wide variety of firearms. All of the company's products are manufactured in the USA at an ISO Certified Facility in Milwaukee, WI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ksVCDVlBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VX0L0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]]}}
