{"item_id": "B0014VX3LM", "title": "Blackhawk Cheek Pad for Rifles", "description": "Designed to aid eye relief efficiency, prevent slipping, and reduce recoil to the neck and cheek.. Made of 1000 denier nylon and closed cell foam.. Pad is secured firmly to the buttstock by a tie-down system ensuring a proper fit to all rifle stocks.. Padding is 1\" high and 1\" across.", "text": "Blackhawk Cheek Pad for Rifles Designed to aid eye relief efficiency, prevent slipping, and reduce recoil to the neck and cheek.. Made of 1000 denier nylon and closed cell foam.. Pad is secured firmly to the buttstock by a tie-down system ensuring a proper fit to all rifle stocks.. Padding is 1\" high and 1\" across.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PIPSJyrTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VX3LM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BlackHawk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 21.5}}
