{"item_id": "B0014VXC2W", "title": "Butler Creek Tini-Bikini Pistol Scope Cover", "description": "19001 Features: -Scope cover. -For shorter pistol, shotgun and red dot scopes. -Tight, moisture and dust proof seal. -One piece quick clearing scope cover. -Two pliable rubber like cups joined by a stretch retainer. -Overall dimensions: 5.5\" H x 1.6\" W x 3.6\" D.", "text": "Butler Creek Tini-Bikini Pistol Scope Cover 19001 Features: -Scope cover. -For shorter pistol, shotgun and red dot scopes. -Tight, moisture and dust proof seal. -One piece quick clearing scope cover. -Two pliable rubber like cups joined by a stretch retainer. -Overall dimensions: 5.5\" H x 1.6\" W x 3.6\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319WQtNTMbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VXC2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 6.68}}
{"item_id": "B0014VXGO6", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 36 Plus Zero Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-360 replaces the magazine base plate and retains all other factory components. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides extra length for better control and comfort", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 36 Plus Zero Extension The Pearce PG-360 replaces the magazine base plate and retains all other factory components. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides extra length for better control and comfort", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vEOthDwEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VXGO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.96}}
{"item_id": "B0014VXJY8", "title": "Plano 10137 Gun Guard SE Single Scoped Pistol Case", "description": "This Gun Guard single scoped pistol case has a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman. This case accommodates a longer barreled pistol with scope. This case can also be used to store two small pistols. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 13.5\" long x 10.13\" wide x 3\" high", "text": "Plano 10137 Gun Guard SE Single Scoped Pistol Case This Gun Guard single scoped pistol case has a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman. This case accommodates a longer barreled pistol with scope. This case can also be used to store two small pistols. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 13.5\" long x 10.13\" wide x 3\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FG64rfvdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VXJY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 11.49}}
{"item_id": "B0014VYT74", "title": "Bulldog Deluxe Range Bag with Strap", "description": "Black Range Bag with Strap * Heavy-duty, durable Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Large main compartment with removable divider * Outer pockets for extra storage * Adjustable shoulder strap * Deluxe padding and quality * 13\" x 7\" x 7\"", "text": "Bulldog Deluxe Range Bag with Strap Black Range Bag with Strap * Heavy-duty, durable Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Large main compartment with removable divider * Outer pockets for extra storage * Adjustable shoulder strap * Deluxe padding and quality * 13\" x 7\" x 7\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CXY2Iv9DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VYT74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 34.19}}
{"item_id": "B0014VYT7O", "title": "Kleen-Bore GC-220S 100-Square Inch Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth", "description": "The Kleen-Bore GC-220S 100-Square Inch Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth is ideal for restoring and protecting the luster of your firearms with top quality silicone impregnated cotton flannel. This 100-square Inch cloth returns a brilliant sheen to your gun's surface, while removing handling marks and offering a layer of rust protection.", "text": "Kleen-Bore GC-220S 100-Square Inch Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth The Kleen-Bore GC-220S 100-Square Inch Silicone Gun and Reel Cloth is ideal for restoring and protecting the luster of your firearms with top quality silicone impregnated cotton flannel. This 100-square Inch cloth returns a brilliant sheen to your gun's surface, while removing handling marks and offering a layer of rust protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vIImxH%2BUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VYT7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KleenBore", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 2.89}}
{"item_id": "B0014VYU2S", "title": "HiViz Wide Magnetic Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight with Green Light Pipe", "description": "The S-Series magnetic shotgun sights include one high-intensity LitePipe. They are not compatible with fiber or aluminum ribbed shotguns", "text": "HiViz Wide Magnetic Fiber Optic Shotgun Sight with Green Light Pipe The S-Series magnetic shotgun sights include one high-intensity LitePipe. They are not compatible with fiber or aluminum ribbed shotguns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3152lPRM1zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0014VYU2S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 18.42}}
