{"item_id": "B001539962", "title": "Aerobed Guest Choice Inflatable Bed, Queen", "description": "Create almost instantaneous extra sleeping space with this Guest Choice inflatable bed from the designers at AeroBed. A great tool for overnight guests, slumber parties, and travel, the bed features an integrated, easy-to-use AC pump that inflates it in under a minute. Interior coil construction makes for consistent support and comfort, and a velvety surface keeps sheets from sliding around. Constructed from puncture-resistant, heavy-duty PVC, the bed also comes with a patented release valve, so deflation takes just 15 seconds. It fits queen-size sheets, weighs 14-1/2 pounds, and holds a maximum of 750 pounds. For storage, the unit collapses tidily and stashes in the included carry bag. A twin-size version of the Guest Choice is also available, and AeroBed includes a one-year warranty.", "text": "Aerobed Guest Choice Inflatable Bed, Queen Create almost instantaneous extra sleeping space with this Guest Choice inflatable bed from the designers at AeroBed. A great tool for overnight guests, slumber parties, and travel, the bed features an integrated, easy-to-use AC pump that inflates it in under a minute. Interior coil construction makes for consistent support and comfort, and a velvety surface keeps sheets from sliding around. Constructed from puncture-resistant, heavy-duty PVC, the bed also comes with a patented release valve, so deflation takes just 15 seconds. It fits queen-size sheets, weighs 14-1/2 pounds, and holds a maximum of 750 pounds. For storage, the unit collapses tidily and stashes in the included carry bag. A twin-size version of the Guest Choice is also available, and AeroBed includes a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415jvDKqUNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001539962.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 152.45}}
{"item_id": "B00153CWCU", "title": "Peter Janda Fin Fixed Blade Drop Point Tactical Knife", "description": "Designed by tactical trainer, Petr Janda for hard use and superior durability. Everything you need and nothing you don’t. The Fin fixed blades are able to withstand the rigors of every environment.", "text": "Peter Janda Fin Fixed Blade Drop Point Tactical Knife Designed by tactical trainer, Petr Janda for hard use and superior durability. Everything you need and nothing you don’t. The Fin fixed blades are able to withstand the rigors of every environment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3106gsL0JvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00153CWCU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
