{"item_id": "B00153KF7Y", "title": "Rothco Venturer Travel Portfolio Bag - OLIVE", "description": "Rothco Venturer Travel Portfolio Bag - The ultimate traveling companion. Heavy Canvas Construction. Nylon lined. Holds credit cards, travel documents, maps etc. Small and large outside zippered pockets. Large 8.5\" x 5.5\" main compartment. Quick release front strap for extra security. Adjustable quick release shoulder strap. Hidden map/document holders. Jumbo canvas belt loop. Pencil pouch. Credit card and ID holders. Zippered waterproof inner pocket. Jumbo pencil sleeve. Great for both business, travel, camping, hiking, everyday use and leisure. Venturer Military Travel portfolio bag. Dimensions: 8.5\" x 5.5\" (inches).", "text": "Rothco Venturer Travel Portfolio Bag - OLIVE Rothco Venturer Travel Portfolio Bag - The ultimate traveling companion. Heavy Canvas Construction. Nylon lined. Holds credit cards, travel documents, maps etc. Small and large outside zippered pockets. Large 8.5\" x 5.5\" main compartment. Quick release front strap for extra security. Adjustable quick release shoulder strap. Hidden map/document holders. Jumbo canvas belt loop. Pencil pouch. Credit card and ID holders. Zippered waterproof inner pocket. Jumbo pencil sleeve. Great for both business, travel, camping, hiking, everyday use and leisure. Venturer Military Travel portfolio bag. Dimensions: 8.5\" x 5.5\" (inches).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5124sXUzx5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00153KF7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 11.15}}
{"item_id": "B00154DHIM", "title": "Unicorn GT215 Tungsten Steel Tip Dart Set with Eclipse Max Case", "description": "This set of three \"Level 6\" steel tip darts from Unicorn are made of 90 percent tungsten steel. They feature aluminum XL shafts and a sleek barrel with fingertip grooves for greater control. Included in this set are three flights, six aluminum shafts, eight flight protectors, and eight ozone locking rings, along with a compact plastic storage case. The darts weigh 24 grams each.About Unicorn DartsUnicorn Darts has been at the forefront of darts innovation, development, and sponsorship for over 70 years.", "text": "Unicorn GT215 Tungsten Steel Tip Dart Set with Eclipse Max Case This set of three \"Level 6\" steel tip darts from Unicorn are made of 90 percent tungsten steel. They feature aluminum XL shafts and a sleek barrel with fingertip grooves for greater control. Included in this set are three flights, six aluminum shafts, eight flight protectors, and eight ozone locking rings, along with a compact plastic storage case. The darts weigh 24 grams each.About Unicorn DartsUnicorn Darts has been at the forefront of darts innovation, development, and sponsorship for over 70 years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410yc0k5ToL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00154DHIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]]}}
