{"item_id": "B00158AGMS", "title": "Maxpedition Doppelduffel Adventure Bag", "description": "The DOPPELDUFFEL Adventure Bag is a unique large travel bag that may be carried by hand, shoulder strap in 2 orientations, or with hide-away integral backpack straps. Two (2) internal padded divider can split main compartment into smaller sections.", "text": "Maxpedition Doppelduffel Adventure Bag The DOPPELDUFFEL Adventure Bag is a unique large travel bag that may be carried by hand, shoulder strap in 2 orientations, or with hide-away integral backpack straps. Two (2) internal padded divider can split main compartment into smaller sections.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SRmhD51zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00158AGMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 190.99}}
{"item_id": "B00158OOBC", "title": "Deluxe Black Nylon Swat Belt", "description": "Oxford nylon web belt. Adjustable waist. Removable HW heavy weight cordura nylon hook and loop pouches on belt. Great for small game hunting, and much much more. Very durable and lightweight. Black deluxe nylon SWAT belt. Size: 49\" (inches) long.", "text": "Deluxe Black Nylon Swat Belt Oxford nylon web belt. Adjustable waist. Removable HW heavy weight cordura nylon hook and loop pouches on belt. Great for small game hunting, and much much more. Very durable and lightweight. Black deluxe nylon SWAT belt. Size: 49\" (inches) long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310l7DOVZgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00158OOBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B00158S3Z0", "title": "Shimano Disc Brake Bleed Kit", "description": "All you need to bleed, and revivify your Shimano disc brake system. 50ml bottle of Genuine Shimano Mineral Oil and tube. Install the hose to the bleed screw and to the squeeze bottle to flush your system.Product FeaturesMaterial:Attachment Type:Compatibility:Diameter:Weight:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Shimano Disc Brake Bleed Kit All you need to bleed, and revivify your Shimano disc brake system. 50ml bottle of Genuine Shimano Mineral Oil and tube. Install the hose to the bleed screw and to the squeeze bottle to flush your system.Product FeaturesMaterial:Attachment Type:Compatibility:Diameter:Weight:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zWKg3sfCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00158S3Z0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 14.19}}
