{"item_id": "B0015A5C70", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWFRS First Response Serrated Knife", "description": "The ComboEdge blade measures 3.3 inches in length; the overall length is 8 inches. The blade material is 440 carry while the handle is made of stainless steel and G10. It has a liner lock, a pocket clip, and is ideal for use as a glass breaker and seatbelt cutter in accident and other emergency situations.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWFRS First Response Serrated Knife The ComboEdge blade measures 3.3 inches in length; the overall length is 8 inches. The blade material is 440 carry while the handle is made of stainless steel and G10. It has a liner lock, a pocket clip, and is ideal for use as a glass breaker and seatbelt cutter in accident and other emergency situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21UVDTU6iEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015A5C70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0015ABIEQ", "title": "Bridgestone Precept Laddie X 2-Dozen Golf Balls", "description": "The Precept Laddie X provides extreme distance with exceptional feel and features the following: Generates tremendous distance off the driver with a high launch and low spin 372 wind cheating dimple design Core made of enhanced velocity muscle-fiber Cover made of touch and control ionomer Core and cover combination provides soft feel and control from tee to green", "text": "Bridgestone Precept Laddie X 2-Dozen Golf Balls The Precept Laddie X provides extreme distance with exceptional feel and features the following: Generates tremendous distance off the driver with a high launch and low spin 372 wind cheating dimple design Core made of enhanced velocity muscle-fiber Cover made of touch and control ionomer Core and cover combination provides soft feel and control from tee to green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YW%2BmIPPWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ABIEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Precept", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Standard Balls"]], "price": 18.55}}
{"item_id": "B0015ABVJS", "title": "Uncle Mike's Deluxe Range Bag", "description": "Simply the ultimate range bag – developed by shooters for shooters. Easy entry, a roll-up double-zippered flap with hook-and-loop fastener closes main compartment, Easy carry – Shoulder strap with quick-release buckles and two web handles, Protective – Padded pistol rug included with two lockable side compartments, plus a thickly padded compartment. The main compartment is 15\" wide x 9\" high x 7\" deep (381 x 229 x 178 mm)", "text": "Uncle Mike's Deluxe Range Bag Simply the ultimate range bag – developed by shooters for shooters. Easy entry, a roll-up double-zippered flap with hook-and-loop fastener closes main compartment, Easy carry – Shoulder strap with quick-release buckles and two web handles, Protective – Padded pistol rug included with two lockable side compartments, plus a thickly padded compartment. The main compartment is 15\" wide x 9\" high x 7\" deep (381 x 229 x 178 mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KWNWJFCSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ABVJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 51.99}}
