{"item_id": "B0015CFUZW", "title": "Rawlings Bucket with 2 Dozen ROLB3 Baseballs", "description": "These 2 dozen Rawlings practice baseballs come packaged in a bucket for your convenience. The balls feature synthetic leather covers, Major League seams, and solid cork and rubber centers.", "text": "Rawlings Bucket with 2 Dozen ROLB3 Baseballs These 2 dozen Rawlings practice baseballs come packaged in a bucket for your convenience. The balls feature synthetic leather covers, Major League seams, and solid cork and rubber centers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mXpZWOdgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015CFUZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rawlings", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Baseballs"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B0015DGBX6", "title": "Maxpedition Janus Extension Pocket", "description": "The JANUS is a two-faced pocket, one side features loop fields for ID patches while the other side has PALS webbing to accept modular accessories.", "text": "Maxpedition Janus Extension Pocket The JANUS is a two-faced pocket, one side features loop fields for ID patches while the other side has PALS webbing to accept modular accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VvIsRhYbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015DGBX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 34.8}}
{"item_id": "B0015DIRUQ", "title": "SteriPEN Classic Bundle Pack with Pre-Filter", "description": "For those who already own a wide-mouth water bottle, SteriPEN offers the Classic with Pre-Filter Pack. Like the Safe Water System Pack (but without the bottle), the Classic with Pre-Filter pack is all that is needed when camping, hiking, backpacking or traveling. Use the 40x40 micron screen Pre-Filter to remove particulates from the water. The Pre-Filter is designed to be stored directly on the wide mouth bottle. Ships with neoprene carry case and User Guide", "text": "SteriPEN Classic Bundle Pack with Pre-Filter For those who already own a wide-mouth water bottle, SteriPEN offers the Classic with Pre-Filter Pack. Like the Safe Water System Pack (but without the bottle), the Classic with Pre-Filter pack is all that is needed when camping, hiking, backpacking or traveling. Use the 40x40 micron screen Pre-Filter to remove particulates from the water. The Pre-Filter is designed to be stored directly on the wide mouth bottle. Ships with neoprene carry case and User Guide", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pvare94zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015DIRUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 59.39}}
{"item_id": "B0015DW2LQ", "title": "Rothco General Purpose Utility Rope", "description": "Rothco's 3/8\" general purpose rope is constructed with a 100% polypropylene sleeve and a 100% nylon core. It's a high quality rope that is made in the USA and has a tensile strength of 1200 lbs and a working load of 120 lbs.", "text": "Rothco General Purpose Utility Rope Rothco's 3/8\" general purpose rope is constructed with a 100% polypropylene sleeve and a 100% nylon core. It's a high quality rope that is made in the USA and has a tensile strength of 1200 lbs and a working load of 120 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41glTl9CZgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015DW2LQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Ropes, Cords & Webbing", "Ropes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0015DZD2Q", "title": "Rothco 550-Pound Desert Type III Commercial (Camo)", "description": "Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "Rothco 550-Pound Desert Type III Commercial (Camo) Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PrpM5HkeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015DZD2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0015E7L2U", "title": "Slendertone Replacement Gel Pads for All Slendertone Abdominal Belts, 3 Sets (9 Gel Pads)", "description": "Compatible with Slendertone's Flex Abdominal, Gymbody, and System Abs toning belts, this set of replacement gel pads will help you get the most of your Slendertone product. The length of time gel pads last depends on a number of factors, including your skin type, frequency of use, and how the pads are stored (Slendertone recommends that you replace your pads after 20 to 30 sessions). Fortunately, these replacement pads are a breeze to use, with a latex-free, no-mess design that helps conduct electrical pulses to targeted nerves and muscles. All Slendertone replacement pads and accessories are manufactured to medical-grade and FDA-approved standards and are suitable for both men and women. The set comes in three groups of three pads each, for a total of nine pads.", "text": "Slendertone Replacement Gel Pads for All Slendertone Abdominal Belts, 3 Sets (9 Gel Pads) Compatible with Slendertone's Flex Abdominal, Gymbody, and System Abs toning belts, this set of replacement gel pads will help you get the most of your Slendertone product. The length of time gel pads last depends on a number of factors, including your skin type, frequency of use, and how the pads are stored (Slendertone recommends that you replace your pads after 20 to 30 sessions). Fortunately, these replacement pads are a breeze to use, with a latex-free, no-mess design that helps conduct electrical pulses to targeted nerves and muscles. All Slendertone replacement pads and accessories are manufactured to medical-grade and FDA-approved standards and are suitable for both men and women. The set comes in three groups of three pads each, for a total of nine pads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51D1b3UHNyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015E7L2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slendertone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 20.95}}
{"item_id": "B0015FI0MY", "title": "Wilson Pro Overgrip (12 Pack)", "description": "Pro Overgrip has the perfect feel and preferred by top players like Roger Federer and Justine Henin. Available in pink or white.", "text": "Wilson Pro Overgrip (12 Pack) Pro Overgrip has the perfect feel and preferred by top players like Roger Federer and Justine Henin. Available in pink or white.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514N5I70JAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015FI0MY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Racquet Grips"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0015FI8AS", "title": "Progold Prolink 16-Ounce Spray Chain Lube", "description": "ProLink Chain Lube will not let dirt and grit stick to your chain – in wet or dry conditions. It greatly reduces friction and wear, allowing smoother operation of your chain and cables, and it will keep your chain and drive train area clean and seemingly drag free.", "text": "Progold Prolink 16-Ounce Spray Chain Lube ProLink Chain Lube will not let dirt and grit stick to your chain – in wet or dry conditions. It greatly reduces friction and wear, allowing smoother operation of your chain and cables, and it will keep your chain and drive train area clean and seemingly drag free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L-h8EGPNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015FI8AS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProGold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 13.67}}
{"item_id": "B0015HH6AE", "title": "Tektro RL720 Cross Brake Lever Set", "description": "Top mount lever with ergonomic design. For use with caliper or cantilever style brakes. Forged aluminum lever and bracket. Hinged clamp. Reach adjustment and return spring.", "text": "Tektro RL720 Cross Brake Lever Set Top mount lever with ergonomic design. For use with caliper or cantilever style brakes. Forged aluminum lever and bracket. Hinged clamp. Reach adjustment and return spring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VsubN6PvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015HH6AE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Levers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0015HV75O", "title": "MSR Fuel Bottle", "description": "MSR fuel bottles are designed specifically to accept the threads on MSR fuel pumps and to easily handle the pressurization needed to efficiently operate our liquid fuel stoves. Fuel bottles come in three different sizes; 11 ounces, 20 ounces, 30 ounces. Made in Seattle, USA.", "text": "MSR Fuel Bottle MSR fuel bottles are designed specifically to accept the threads on MSR fuel pumps and to easily handle the pressurization needed to efficiently operate our liquid fuel stoves. Fuel bottles come in three different sizes; 11 ounces, 20 ounces, 30 ounces. Made in Seattle, USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HIM8EVvVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015HV75O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Empty Fuel Bottles"]]}}
