{"item_id": "B0015M06V0", "title": "Gerber 22-01626 LMF II Green Infantry Knife and Nylon Sheath", "description": "Down behind enemy lines? Left to fend for yourself? These are the scenarios that inspired the LMF II. Former military man, Jeff Freeman led the charge to engineer this fearless new 10\" survival knife. And we field-tested with the troops. This knife is as adaptable as the personnel who carry it. Use it to cut through the skin of a fuselage. Or sever a seat belt. Or egress through the Plexiglas of a chopper. Plus, the LMF II does a slick job cutting firewood and building shelter. The over-molded handle successfully limits blistering. There is complete separation between the tang and butt cap, so the knife absorbs the shocks from hammering and prevents the shocks of electricity. Smartly situated grooves and lashing holes let the LMF II convert to a spear. The low-profile sheath facilitates movement, limits noise, works for parachuting, and attaches to a belt or MOLLE vest. The patented, integrated sharpener means edge retention in the field.", "text": "Gerber 22-01626 LMF II Green Infantry Knife and Nylon Sheath Down behind enemy lines? Left to fend for yourself? These are the scenarios that inspired the LMF II. Former military man, Jeff Freeman led the charge to engineer this fearless new 10\" survival knife. And we field-tested with the troops. This knife is as adaptable as the personnel who carry it. Use it to cut through the skin of a fuselage. Or sever a seat belt. Or egress through the Plexiglas of a chopper. Plus, the LMF II does a slick job cutting firewood and building shelter. The over-molded handle successfully limits blistering. There is complete separation between the tang and butt cap, so the knife absorbs the shocks from hammering and prevents the shocks of electricity. Smartly situated grooves and lashing holes let the LMF II convert to a spear. The low-profile sheath facilitates movement, limits noise, works for parachuting, and attaches to a belt or MOLLE vest. The patented, integrated sharpener means edge retention in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31D6dE8490L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015M06V0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 64.89}}
{"item_id": "B0015N6GGI", "title": "Gamo Air Gun Oil", "description": "Your GAMO air rifle or air pistol will deliver its maximum shooting potential and remain trouble-free for an unusually long period of time if properly lubricated and cleaned. Always make sure your airgun is unloaded before cleaning or oiling.", "text": "Gamo Air Gun Oil Your GAMO air rifle or air pistol will deliver its maximum shooting potential and remain trouble-free for an unusually long period of time if properly lubricated and cleaned. Always make sure your airgun is unloaded before cleaning or oiling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mvKFqPl4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015N6GGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 3.75}}
{"item_id": "B0015N6I70", "title": "Gamo Tomahawk .177 Cal, 7.8 Grains, Pointed, 750ct", "description": "Gamo is the leading producer of precision lead ammunition for air rifles. The New Pointed Hollow Point has been specifically designed to give maximum shock and expansion while having the accuracy of a Match pellet. The PHP forms a perfect “mushroom” shape that will flatten out on impact, distributing all of it’s energy into the target at short range.", "text": "Gamo Tomahawk .177 Cal, 7.8 Grains, Pointed, 750ct Gamo is the leading producer of precision lead ammunition for air rifles. The New Pointed Hollow Point has been specifically designed to give maximum shock and expansion while having the accuracy of a Match pellet. The PHP forms a perfect “mushroom” shape that will flatten out on impact, distributing all of it’s energy into the target at short range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41le2BM7JsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015N6I70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B0015N7XG0", "title": "Trumark Powerband Slingshot Heavy Repacement Band", "description": "Trumark Powerband Heavy Pull. Easily installed without tools. Trumark?s powerband fits all slingshots powered by tubular type bands. 225 yd range.", "text": "Trumark Powerband Slingshot Heavy Repacement Band Trumark Powerband Heavy Pull. Easily installed without tools. Trumark?s powerband fits all slingshots powered by tubular type bands. 225 yd range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sUAxhOZ8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015N7XG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trumark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Slings"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0015NA32Q", "title": "Remington Bore Light with attachments and 3 batteries", "description": "Compact and easy to carry, the Remington LED Bore Light is ideal for inspecting used firearms, cleaning firearms and inspecting bore for obstructions. Including both curved and straight light tubes, the LED light eliminates intense glare allowing better visibility while inspecting barrels for copper jacket fouling, obstructions such as plastic shotgun wad build-up, rust and pitting.", "text": "Remington Bore Light with attachments and 3 batteries Compact and easy to carry, the Remington LED Bore Light is ideal for inspecting used firearms, cleaning firearms and inspecting bore for obstructions. Including both curved and straight light tubes, the LED light eliminates intense glare allowing better visibility while inspecting barrels for copper jacket fouling, obstructions such as plastic shotgun wad build-up, rust and pitting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Vkpw1weUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015NA32Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.5}}
