{"item_id": "B0015NBAE6", "title": "Trumark Slingshot with Fiber-Optic Sights", "description": "Trumark Slingshot With Fiber Optic Sights. Features Fiber-optic sights with rotating prongs. Optic sensors capture light and make the red and green sights glow to help increase accuracy. The prongs extend band life by pivoting 180 degrees. Handle holds SA30 ammo. Aluminum frame and leather pouch. 225 Yard Range! Trumark's Fiber-Optic slingshots are the ONLY slingshots that feature SIGHTS with ROTATING PRONGS! Range-finding optical-sight pins optimize accuracy. Plus, the rotating prongs also work as powerband savers by pivoting 180 degrees around the fork!", "text": "Trumark Slingshot with Fiber-Optic Sights Trumark Slingshot With Fiber Optic Sights. Features Fiber-optic sights with rotating prongs. Optic sensors capture light and make the red and green sights glow to help increase accuracy. The prongs extend band life by pivoting 180 degrees. Handle holds SA30 ammo. Aluminum frame and leather pouch. 225 Yard Range! Trumark's Fiber-Optic slingshots are the ONLY slingshots that feature SIGHTS with ROTATING PRONGS! Range-finding optical-sight pins optimize accuracy. Plus, the rotating prongs also work as powerband savers by pivoting 180 degrees around the fork!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B7UgE7J7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015NBAE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trumark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 16.29}}
{"item_id": "B0015ND78S", "title": "Crosman 8-Shot Rotary Clips, Fits T4 & 1088 Pistols, 3/Pack", "description": "3 spare clips for the 1088, 1008, and T4 series of pistols. Holds BBs or Pellets.", "text": "Crosman 8-Shot Rotary Clips, Fits T4 & 1088 Pistols, 3/Pack 3 spare clips for the 1088, 1008, and T4 series of pistols. Holds BBs or Pellets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iupWAVa3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ND78S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B0015NDQ70", "title": "GunMate Rugged Padded Nylon Pistol Rug", "description": "Gunmate Pistol Rugs. Rugged, durable protection for your prized handgun. Next time you're loading up your pistol for a trip to the shooting range, slip it into one of these Gunmate Pistol Rugs. Your pistol will be protected with the padded interior and the durable exterior won't let dust, dirt or grime in. Full-length zipper keeps your pistol securely inside and provides easy access. It's also lockable to keep your pistol under wraps. And with 3 size choices you won't have a problem finding one to fit your pistol perfectly! Features: Padded nylon interior protects your pistol from scratches and dings during travel; Full-length zipper provides easy access and opens up flat; Lockable zipper keeps your firearm safe; Small size fits revolvers and small / medium automatics with 2-3\" barrels; Medium size fits revolvers with 3-5\" barrels and large automatics with 4-5\" barrels; Large size fits revolvers with 6-7 1/2\" barrels. State Size. Order yours today! Gunmate Pistol Rugs, Black", "text": "GunMate Rugged Padded Nylon Pistol Rug Gunmate Pistol Rugs. Rugged, durable protection for your prized handgun. Next time you're loading up your pistol for a trip to the shooting range, slip it into one of these Gunmate Pistol Rugs. Your pistol will be protected with the padded interior and the durable exterior won't let dust, dirt or grime in. Full-length zipper keeps your pistol securely inside and provides easy access. It's also lockable to keep your pistol under wraps. And with 3 size choices you won't have a problem finding one to fit your pistol perfectly! Features: Padded nylon interior protects your pistol from scratches and dings during travel; Full-length zipper provides easy access and opens up flat; Lockable zipper keeps your firearm safe; Small size fits revolvers and small / medium automatics with 2-3\" barrels; Medium size fits revolvers with 3-5\" barrels and large automatics with 4-5\" barrels; Large size fits revolvers with 6-7 1/2\" barrels. State Size. Order yours today! Gunmate Pistol Rugs, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fuVqoiloL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015NDQ70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]]}}
