{"item_id": "B0015RGWHW", "title": "United Cutlery GH5007 Gil Hibben IV Forged Machete", "description": "This is the knife everyone has been talking about all year! Designed by Gil Hibben for Sylvester Stallone to be used in the hit motion picture and the Blade Magazine cover story. The knife offers one solid piece of hand forged 1090 carbon steel with a black fabric wrapped grip. Includes a custom black blade sheath and a certificate of authenticity.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5007 Gil Hibben IV Forged Machete This is the knife everyone has been talking about all year! Designed by Gil Hibben for Sylvester Stallone to be used in the hit motion picture and the Blade Magazine cover story. The knife offers one solid piece of hand forged 1090 carbon steel with a black fabric wrapped grip. Includes a custom black blade sheath and a certificate of authenticity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xRNURiAcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RGWHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 39.98}}
