{"item_id": "B0015RM3I4", "title": "United Cutlery GH5005 Gil Hibben III Fighter", "description": "The Gil Hibben III Fighter Bowie Fixed Blade Knife with Wood Handles has a 13-1/2-Inch overall length, and an 8-1/4-Inch stainless steel bowie blade. It has a dark brown laminated hardwood handle, a heavy stainless guard and pommel. It comes with a lanyard, and a brown leather belt sheath.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5005 Gil Hibben III Fighter The Gil Hibben III Fighter Bowie Fixed Blade Knife with Wood Handles has a 13-1/2-Inch overall length, and an 8-1/4-Inch stainless steel bowie blade. It has a dark brown laminated hardwood handle, a heavy stainless guard and pommel. It comes with a lanyard, and a brown leather belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P6WSZWqDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RM3I4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 47.27}}
{"item_id": "B0015RM3KC", "title": "Gil Hibben Tanto Thrower Triple Knife Set", "description": "United Cutlery GH5003 Warrior Throwoing Knvies, Large Triple Set, Leather Sheath - Constructed from one solid piece of 420 stainless steel and expertly designed by the master, Gil Hibben. The extra cuts and holes add a fantasy flare.", "text": "Gil Hibben Tanto Thrower Triple Knife Set United Cutlery GH5003 Warrior Throwoing Knvies, Large Triple Set, Leather Sheath - Constructed from one solid piece of 420 stainless steel and expertly designed by the master, Gil Hibben. The extra cuts and holes add a fantasy flare.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vD1hgNJeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RM3KC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0015RPTRG", "title": "Smith & Wesson SW2B Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Fixed Blade Knife, Black", "description": "7.7\" Blade, 12.8\" 14.5oz. Scabbard w/ Removable Map Pouch, Screwdriver, Sharpening Stone, Belt Clip(blade & scabbard lock together to become an awesome wire cutter)", "text": "Smith & Wesson SW2B Special Ops M-9 Bayonet Fixed Blade Knife, Black 7.7\" Blade, 12.8\" 14.5oz. Scabbard w/ Removable Map Pouch, Screwdriver, Sharpening Stone, Belt Clip(blade & scabbard lock together to become an awesome wire cutter)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-3fX-UOlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RPTRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 59.98}}
{"item_id": "B0015RQI7Q", "title": "Cold Steel Bushman Black SK-5 Steel Cordura Survival Sheath", "description": "For the money, the Bushman knives might be the strongest survival/outdoor knives in the world! Unlike most hollow handled survival knives, there is no joint or seam between the blades and handles that requires a mechanical fastener. Instead, the Bushman’s blades and integral handles are each expertly cold forged out of a single piece of 2.5mm thick SK-5 high carbon steel. The resulting knives are expertly heat-treated and tempered to RC54 and, when subjected to our tests, have withstood over two tons of pressure on their blade/handle transition!", "text": "Cold Steel Bushman Black SK-5 Steel Cordura Survival Sheath For the money, the Bushman knives might be the strongest survival/outdoor knives in the world! Unlike most hollow handled survival knives, there is no joint or seam between the blades and handles that requires a mechanical fastener. Instead, the Bushman’s blades and integral handles are each expertly cold forged out of a single piece of 2.5mm thick SK-5 high carbon steel. The resulting knives are expertly heat-treated and tempered to RC54 and, when subjected to our tests, have withstood over two tons of pressure on their blade/handle transition!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oZq3hCtyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RQI7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 24.45}}
{"item_id": "B0015RS8CE", "title": "Kershaw 1029 Bear Hunter II Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "The Bear Hunter II is big, bold, and incredibly practical. The blade is constructed of tough AUS8A stainless steel rated 56-58 on the Rockwell scale. The co-polymer handle is designed for a sure grip, even in wet, outdoor conditions. It fits nicely into its genuine leather belt sheath to protect the blade and your gear.", "text": "Kershaw 1029 Bear Hunter II Fixed Blade Knife The Bear Hunter II is big, bold, and incredibly practical. The blade is constructed of tough AUS8A stainless steel rated 56-58 on the Rockwell scale. The co-polymer handle is designed for a sure grip, even in wet, outdoor conditions. It fits nicely into its genuine leather belt sheath to protect the blade and your gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318mxCv%2BF0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RS8CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 31.32}}
