{"item_id": "B0015RY5RG", "title": "Club Glove Burst Proof With Wheels 2", "description": "The best collegiate travel bag just keeps getting better. The Club Glove Burst Proof wheeled travel bag--an upgrade from the company's original college bags--offers such enhanced features as a split-top zipper, 2-inch webbing, a riveted lifting handle on the bottom, and a layer of ballistic nylon on the base. The improvements help the bag hold up to heavy use whether you're flying across the country or driving across the state. The single-piece burst-proof construction, meanwhile, combines with the Cordura exterior fabric to protect your clubs in all circumstances. And users will love the high-impact plastic wheel base and inline skate wheels, which are built for easy transport. Other features include two interior shoe pockets, extra-thick foam padding with a club-head security strap, and YKK zippers. Large enough to accommodate golf clubs as long as 47 inches, the bag is available in such colors as black, navy, hunter green, khaki burgundy, red, charcoal, yellow, and more. It's also backed by a lifetime limited warranty and a five-year unconditional warranty.", "text": "Club Glove Burst Proof With Wheels 2 The best collegiate travel bag just keeps getting better. The Club Glove Burst Proof wheeled travel bag--an upgrade from the company's original college bags--offers such enhanced features as a split-top zipper, 2-inch webbing, a riveted lifting handle on the bottom, and a layer of ballistic nylon on the base. The improvements help the bag hold up to heavy use whether you're flying across the country or driving across the state. The single-piece burst-proof construction, meanwhile, combines with the Cordura exterior fabric to protect your clubs in all circumstances. And users will love the high-impact plastic wheel base and inline skate wheels, which are built for easy transport. Other features include two interior shoe pockets, extra-thick foam padding with a club-head security strap, and YKK zippers. Large enough to accommodate golf clubs as long as 47 inches, the bag is available in such colors as black, navy, hunter green, khaki burgundy, red, charcoal, yellow, and more. It's also backed by a lifetime limited warranty and a five-year unconditional warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3194QGyIPyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RY5RG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Club Glove", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Travel Covers"]], "price": 199.99}}
{"item_id": "B0015RZCZK", "title": "Club Glove Stiff Arm Travel Bag Crutch", "description": "When properly packed, it is nearly impossible to break a golf club in a Club Glove. With nearly every touring professional carrying their clubs in a Club Glove travel bag 25 to 35 weeks a year, we experience a total of one or two incidents of club breakage. This generally happens when the bag is dropped directly on the club heads from a height of six feet or more. The Stiff Arm® is an adjustable crutch that is designed to prevent this from happening. It adds vertical strength to what is already the most durable soft sided bag in the world.", "text": "Club Glove Stiff Arm Travel Bag Crutch When properly packed, it is nearly impossible to break a golf club in a Club Glove. With nearly every touring professional carrying their clubs in a Club Glove travel bag 25 to 35 weeks a year, we experience a total of one or two incidents of club breakage. This generally happens when the bag is dropped directly on the club heads from a height of six feet or more. The Stiff Arm® is an adjustable crutch that is designed to prevent this from happening. It adds vertical strength to what is already the most durable soft sided bag in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ZbsJcJq-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015RZCZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Club Glove", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bag Accessories"]], "price": 26.95}}
