{"item_id": "B0015TSW5U", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWATLBS Large Serrated Assisted Opening Knife, Black", "description": "This knife feautres S&W;'s MAGIC Assisted-Opening System, with a 3.7 inch 4034 stainless steel blade and 4.8 inch aluminum handle. Thumb knob finger actuator liner and safety lock. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: ComboEdge Blade Length (inches): 3.70 Blade Material: Stainless Black Carry System: Pocket Clip Handle Material: T6-6061 Anodized Aluminum Black Lock Style: Liner Lock Overall Length (inches): 8.50", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWATLBS Large Serrated Assisted Opening Knife, Black This knife feautres S&W;'s MAGIC Assisted-Opening System, with a 3.7 inch 4034 stainless steel blade and 4.8 inch aluminum handle. Thumb knob finger actuator liner and safety lock. ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: ComboEdge Blade Length (inches): 3.70 Blade Material: Stainless Black Carry System: Pocket Clip Handle Material: T6-6061 Anodized Aluminum Black Lock Style: Liner Lock Overall Length (inches): 8.50", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FzBBlblCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015TSW5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.96}}
{"item_id": "B0015TT3V2", "title": "Finish Line Stanchion Lube / Pure Fluoro Oil 15gr Squeeze Bottle", "description": "Stanchion Lube is made with 100% pure DuPont fluorinated ingredients. Recommended for suspension systen stanchions and seals, dust wipers, etc. Perfect for those seeking a significant drop in fork and shock stanchion friction and maximum protection and life of suspension seals and dust wipersa. Also works great on cable wires, derailleur pivots, and pedal springs.", "text": "Finish Line Stanchion Lube / Pure Fluoro Oil 15gr Squeeze Bottle Stanchion Lube is made with 100% pure DuPont fluorinated ingredients. Recommended for suspension systen stanchions and seals, dust wipers, etc. Perfect for those seeking a significant drop in fork and shock stanchion friction and maximum protection and life of suspension seals and dust wipersa. Also works great on cable wires, derailleur pivots, and pedal springs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aR67qjARL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015TT3V2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 9.57}}
{"item_id": "B0015U73I6", "title": "Cold Steel American Lawman G-10 Handle with Black Blade", "description": "The drop point blade is “civilian friendly” in appearance yet big, wide and most importantly, pointed enough for any cutting or piercing task. made from japanese aus 8a stainless steel and hollow ground to a thin, hand-polished edge, it’s as sharp as a serpent’s tooth and will easily sever the toughest, most fibrous materials. to further protect it from rust and the constant exposure to inclement weather, it comes with a black, non-reflective teflon finish.", "text": "Cold Steel American Lawman G-10 Handle with Black Blade The drop point blade is “civilian friendly” in appearance yet big, wide and most importantly, pointed enough for any cutting or piercing task. made from japanese aus 8a stainless steel and hollow ground to a thin, hand-polished edge, it’s as sharp as a serpent’s tooth and will easily sever the toughest, most fibrous materials. to further protect it from rust and the constant exposure to inclement weather, it comes with a black, non-reflective teflon finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KsZ0-vCLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015U73I6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 52.15}}
{"item_id": "B0015U789A", "title": "Maxpedition Thermite Versipack", "description": "This revolutionary new multi-functional bag, designed either to be worn on the waist with a supporting leg strap or shoulder slung, made way for a new genre in tactical nylon: everyday hard-use gear.", "text": "Maxpedition Thermite Versipack This revolutionary new multi-functional bag, designed either to be worn on the waist with a supporting leg strap or shoulder slung, made way for a new genre in tactical nylon: everyday hard-use gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bWG-SjSJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015U789A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 48.99}}
