{"item_id": "B0015V45F4", "title": "Mosa 16 Gram Threaded Co2 Cartridges (Pack of 30)", "description": "3/8\" thread with24 threads per inch. Guaranteed compatible with any bike inflater that accepts threaded cartridges. Food grade for beverage use as well.", "text": "Mosa 16 Gram Threaded Co2 Cartridges (Pack of 30) 3/8\" thread with24 threads per inch. Guaranteed compatible with any bike inflater that accepts threaded cartridges. Food grade for beverage use as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Z0zf%2BSHUL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015V45F4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MOSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 32.5}}
{"item_id": "B0015VDM76", "title": "Balega Hidden Comfort Tab Running Sock", "description": "The Balega Hidden Comfort Tab Running Sock has elastane throughout for a more structured hold providing a second skin fit. A seamless toe, under sole cushioning, and mesh ventilation panels will keep your feet dry and comfortable while you run.Medium volume construction - not too little, not too much, just right.White, Charcoal: 84% Drynamix polyester, 14% nylon, 2% elastane.Candy Pink, Zesty Lemon, Cranberry: 84% Drynamix polyester, 11% nylon, 3% Neofil, 2% elastane.8025.", "text": "Balega Hidden Comfort Tab Running Sock The Balega Hidden Comfort Tab Running Sock has elastane throughout for a more structured hold providing a second skin fit. A seamless toe, under sole cushioning, and mesh ventilation panels will keep your feet dry and comfortable while you run.Medium volume construction - not too little, not too much, just right.White, Charcoal: 84% Drynamix polyester, 14% nylon, 2% elastane.Candy Pink, Zesty Lemon, Cranberry: 84% Drynamix polyester, 11% nylon, 3% Neofil, 2% elastane.8025.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fhyvLUS1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015VDM76.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
