{"item_id": "B0015ZJLJK", "title": "Platypus Big Zip SL (1.8L) - - No Color", "description": "Platypus's premium hydration system, The Big Zip SL, is loaded with improved features like our new and easy-to-clean wide-mouth SlideLock closure with secondary reinforcement that ensures an easy and solid closure every time. Platypus also added a quick-disconnect fitting so you can remove, clean and refill your Big Zip without re-routing your hose.", "text": "Platypus Big Zip SL (1.8L) - - No Color Platypus's premium hydration system, The Big Zip SL, is loaded with improved features like our new and easy-to-clean wide-mouth SlideLock closure with secondary reinforcement that ensures an easy and solid closure every time. Platypus also added a quick-disconnect fitting so you can remove, clean and refill your Big Zip without re-routing your hose.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s3G87lUlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ZJLJK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0015ZQHQK", "title": "Spalding Portable Basketball System - 50\" Polycarbonate Backboard", "description": "Designed to sit in a driveway, backyard, or any other open space, the Spalding 50-inch portable basketball system will turn your paved landscape into a jump-shooting haven. The system starts with a 50-inch polycarbonate backboard with a heavy-duty steel frame. The board offers the same action as glass backboards, helping you shoot layups and bank shots with confidence. The Pro Slam rim, meanwhile, holds up well against intense play -- a must for modern hoops. And hops-challenged players will love the hoop's ExactaHeight lift system, which lets you adjust the height from 7.5 to 10 feet in 6-inch increments. Other features include a two-wheel, 34-gallon base that fills with sand or water for maximum stability and safety; a front cover that acts as a rebounder during play; and a three-piece, 3.5-inch round pole set at a 20-degree angle from the base.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC..", "text": "Spalding Portable Basketball System - 50\" Polycarbonate Backboard Designed to sit in a driveway, backyard, or any other open space, the Spalding 50-inch portable basketball system will turn your paved landscape into a jump-shooting haven. The system starts with a 50-inch polycarbonate backboard with a heavy-duty steel frame. The board offers the same action as glass backboards, helping you shoot layups and bank shots with confidence. The Pro Slam rim, meanwhile, holds up well against intense play -- a must for modern hoops. And hops-challenged players will love the hoop's ExactaHeight lift system, which lets you adjust the height from 7.5 to 10 feet in 6-inch increments. Other features include a two-wheel, 34-gallon base that fills with sand or water for maximum stability and safety; a front cover that acts as a rebounder during play; and a three-piece, 3.5-inch round pole set at a 20-degree angle from the base.About SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318mmuclAVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ZQHQK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Basketball Hoops & Goals", "Portable"]], "price": 321.99}}
{"item_id": "B0015ZSU8I", "title": "Cold Steel 20CBL Canadian Belt Knife, Polypropylene Handle, Cordura Sheath", "description": "ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 4.00 Blade Material: 4116 Krupp Carry System: Cordura Nylon Sheath Handle Material: Polypropylene Overall Length (inches): 8.50", "text": "Cold Steel 20CBL Canadian Belt Knife, Polypropylene Handle, Cordura Sheath ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Edge Blade Length (inches): 4.00 Blade Material: 4116 Krupp Carry System: Cordura Nylon Sheath Handle Material: Polypropylene Overall Length (inches): 8.50", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313cRA9hBRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ZSU8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.25}}
{"item_id": "B0015ZVPUI", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classic Knife, 58mm, Stayglow", "description": "The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD is our best seller. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The perfect sidekick. Available in several colors, you can't have just one.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classic Knife, 58mm, Stayglow The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD is our best seller. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The perfect sidekick. Available in several colors, you can't have just one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L2jZVUzSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0015ZVPUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 17.26}}
