{"item_id": "B001603LUO", "title": "Buck 389 Canoe 2 Bladed Traditional Folding Pocket Knife (Wood)", "description": "Buck Knives 389 Canoe is a classic, convenient and multi-purpose pocket knife. A dual purpose knife with a spear blade, featuring a strong tip for piercing, and a pen blade perfect for an all purpose blade. The Canoe also features woodgrain handles with nickel silver bolsters and Buck's classic Bolt logo.", "text": "Buck 389 Canoe 2 Bladed Traditional Folding Pocket Knife (Wood) Buck Knives 389 Canoe is a classic, convenient and multi-purpose pocket knife. A dual purpose knife with a spear blade, featuring a strong tip for piercing, and a pen blade perfect for an all purpose blade. The Canoe also features woodgrain handles with nickel silver bolsters and Buck's classic Bolt logo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31b6BqAg89L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001603LUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.84}}
{"item_id": "B001603N66", "title": "BirdieBall- 12 Balls", "description": "Birdie Ball is a limited flight practice golf ball without limited feel. True feel with a long hang time, golf ball-like, trajectory! But it only flies 40 yards, so you have your own backyard driving range. Take a full swing. Draw it Fade it. Birdie Balls won’t break like perforated practice balls or wiffleballs. Improve your ability to control a real golf ball.", "text": "BirdieBall- 12 Balls Birdie Ball is a limited flight practice golf ball without limited feel. True feel with a long hang time, golf ball-like, trajectory! But it only flies 40 yards, so you have your own backyard driving range. Take a full swing. Draw it Fade it. Birdie Balls won’t break like perforated practice balls or wiffleballs. Improve your ability to control a real golf ball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YbJXiAtuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001603N66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BirdieBall", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Practice Balls"]], "price": 29.99}}
