{"item_id": "B00160CG4G", "title": "Maxpedition Remora Gearslinger", "description": "The REMORA is the newest and smallest member of the Gearslinger line, designed to be light weight and comfortable yet, like all MAXPEDITION products, loaded with features and attachment points. Both the main and rear compartments have loop fields for attaching internal CCW accessories. Shoulder strap is ambidextrous and concealable. The REMORA can be piggy-backed onto larger packs using SlikClips.", "text": "Maxpedition Remora Gearslinger The REMORA is the newest and smallest member of the Gearslinger line, designed to be light weight and comfortable yet, like all MAXPEDITION products, loaded with features and attachment points. Both the main and rear compartments have loop fields for attaching internal CCW accessories. Shoulder strap is ambidextrous and concealable. The REMORA can be piggy-backed onto larger packs using SlikClips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wL5EKEs1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00160CG4G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 83.99}}
