{"item_id": "B00161ZI4A", "title": "Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular", "description": "Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular. Compact, lightweight and easy - to - handle unit delivers clear, bright images! Courtesy of a premium roof prism and fully multi-coated glass surfaces! Built to be carried as a standard piece of equipment, close-at-hand, the Solo Monocular gives you a closer look when you need it. And with the integral carry clip, the Solo attaches securely to any belt, strap or webbing. The details: Fully multi-coated lenses increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces; Rubber Armor Provides a secure, non-slip grip, and durable external protection; Adjustable Eyecup Twists up and down for comfortable viewing with or without eyeglasses; Waterproof Optics are sealed with O-rings to prevent; moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the binocular Fogproof Barrels are filled with nitrogen gas to inhibit internal fogging; Specs: Eye relief: 15 mm; Exit pupil: 3.6 mm; Linear F.O.V: 325 feet @ 1,000 yards; Angular F.O.V.: 6.2 degrees; Close focus: 16.4'; Length: 4.9\"; Weight: 9.7 ozs.; Always at hand to enhance your view! Order! Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular", "text": "Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular. Compact, lightweight and easy - to - handle unit delivers clear, bright images! Courtesy of a premium roof prism and fully multi-coated glass surfaces! Built to be carried as a standard piece of equipment, close-at-hand, the Solo Monocular gives you a closer look when you need it. And with the integral carry clip, the Solo attaches securely to any belt, strap or webbing. The details: Fully multi-coated lenses increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces; Rubber Armor Provides a secure, non-slip grip, and durable external protection; Adjustable Eyecup Twists up and down for comfortable viewing with or without eyeglasses; Waterproof Optics are sealed with O-rings to prevent; moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the binocular Fogproof Barrels are filled with nitrogen gas to inhibit internal fogging; Specs: Eye relief: 15 mm; Exit pupil: 3.6 mm; Linear F.O.V: 325 feet @ 1,000 yards; Angular F.O.V.: 6.2 degrees; Close focus: 16.4'; Length: 4.9\"; Weight: 9.7 ozs.; Always at hand to enhance your view! Order! Vortex Solo 10x36 mm Monocular", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X56YOsWPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00161ZI4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 109.0}}
{"item_id": "B001629MHS", "title": "SE Lightweight Natural Wooden Walking Stick/Hiking Pole", "description": "Add ease and a sense of adventure to all of your walks, with this classic walking stick - hiking pole. Hand-made from natural Asian hardwood, it is durable as well as beautiful. Has a 7\" braided rope wrist lanyard. With a tough reinforced rubber end-tip that is removable. To expose a heavy-duty metal tip for traction. Be aware that each stick does vary slightly in color tone and crooks and bends etc. But to note that these varying qualities are what will make your walking stick unique, beautiful and different from any other walking stick. 55\" in length and approximately 1.25\" in diameter.", "text": "SE Lightweight Natural Wooden Walking Stick/Hiking Pole Add ease and a sense of adventure to all of your walks, with this classic walking stick - hiking pole. Hand-made from natural Asian hardwood, it is durable as well as beautiful. Has a 7\" braided rope wrist lanyard. With a tough reinforced rubber end-tip that is removable. To expose a heavy-duty metal tip for traction. Be aware that each stick does vary slightly in color tone and crooks and bends etc. But to note that these varying qualities are what will make your walking stick unique, beautiful and different from any other walking stick. 55\" in length and approximately 1.25\" in diameter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C-x5ClS7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001629MHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 11.55}}
{"item_id": "B00162JHHS", "title": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Eyepiece Scope Cover, Size 13-14", "description": "Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "text": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Eyepiece Scope Cover, Size 13-14 Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41izW8VDrML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JHHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 9.37}}
