{"item_id": "B00162JKH0", "title": "Allen Company Buttstock Shell Holder and Pouch", "description": "The clever, convenient Allen Company Rifle Buttstock Shell Holder and Pouch attaches firmly to the butt of any rifle with an adjustable Velcro strap, and holds five cartridges in an easy-access position. A zippered pocket allows you to stow small essentials such as clips or hearing protection. Elastic ammunition loops keep each shell reliably in place, while durable black endura material will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use.The inside-facing panel features a padded surface and soft material to keep your face protected and comfortable.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.Please Note: This pouch attaches to the buttstock of most rifles with an adjustable hook and loop strap system. This item may not fit some large or oversize stocks", "text": "Allen Company Buttstock Shell Holder and Pouch The clever, convenient Allen Company Rifle Buttstock Shell Holder and Pouch attaches firmly to the butt of any rifle with an adjustable Velcro strap, and holds five cartridges in an easy-access position. A zippered pocket allows you to stow small essentials such as clips or hearing protection. Elastic ammunition loops keep each shell reliably in place, while durable black endura material will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use.The inside-facing panel features a padded surface and soft material to keep your face protected and comfortable.About Allen CompanyHeadquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, The Allen Company was founded in 1972 and is a leading supplier of gun cases, hunting accessories, and outdoor products.Please Note: This pouch attaches to the buttstock of most rifles with an adjustable hook and loop strap system. This item may not fit some large or oversize stocks", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b-1NF4Q%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JKH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.41}}
