{"item_id": "B00162JKNY", "title": "Hunters Specialties Head Net", "description": "Net head net with adjustable nose bridge and eyehole opening conform comfortably to face or glasses for 100% peripheral vision. One size fits all. Advantage Max-1", "text": "Hunters Specialties Head Net Net head net with adjustable nose bridge and eyehole opening conform comfortably to face or glasses for 100% peripheral vision. One size fits all. Advantage Max-1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515migtNSVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JKNY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B00162JLG0", "title": "Uncle Mike Non Tri-Lock Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike Non Tri-Lock Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gS3pS0McL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JLG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 7.54}}
{"item_id": "B00162JLGA", "title": "Uncle Mike's Super-Premium Lifetime Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-1/4-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Super-Premium Lifetime Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-1/4-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qusqXIL%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JLGA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 20.14}}
{"item_id": "B00162JMH8", "title": "MTM Jammit Target System & All Weather Bird Board", "description": "Three great target shooting products are now available in one complete package, making it fast and simple to create a personal shooting range. System includes the original Jammit Target Stand, 18 Easy-Load Bird Board Clips and a full size All-Weather Target Backer. Quick set-up - Just step into ground, slide backer in place and it's ready for targets. Stands straight on level or hilly ground. Weighs less than two pounds. Holds nine full size clay targets. Stands up to THOUSANDS of rounds. Backer made from extruded plastic and will not tear, wilt or soften in wet or humid conditions. Great for paper targets, too - Targets may be taped, tacked or stapled on this target holder.", "text": "MTM Jammit Target System & All Weather Bird Board Three great target shooting products are now available in one complete package, making it fast and simple to create a personal shooting range. System includes the original Jammit Target Stand, 18 Easy-Load Bird Board Clips and a full size All-Weather Target Backer. Quick set-up - Just step into ground, slide backer in place and it's ready for targets. Stands straight on level or hilly ground. Weighs less than two pounds. Holds nine full size clay targets. Stands up to THOUSANDS of rounds. Backer made from extruded plastic and will not tear, wilt or soften in wet or humid conditions. Great for paper targets, too - Targets may be taped, tacked or stapled on this target holder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ufIg6RKqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JMH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 28.79}}
{"item_id": "B00162JNZO", "title": "Hornady 393299 Unique Case Lube", "description": "Hornady Unique Case Lube Tub. All-Natural Lube. Easy-To-Use. Use Directly From Tub. No Pad Needed. Quick Swipe As Cases Are Picked Up Is All That's Needed.", "text": "Hornady 393299 Unique Case Lube Hornady Unique Case Lube Tub. All-Natural Lube. Easy-To-Use. Use Directly From Tub. No Pad Needed. Quick Swipe As Cases Are Picked Up Is All That's Needed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Zj%2Bzfb8SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162JNZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.12}}
{"item_id": "B00162KJ7A", "title": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Objective Scope Cover, Size 20-21", "description": "Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "text": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Objective Scope Cover, Size 20-21 Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419ahIwbLHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KJ7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 18.27}}
{"item_id": "B00162KJNE", "title": "Past Women's Recoil Shield", "description": "The PAST Hidden Comfort Recoil Shield for Women™ is designed to give the female shooter a customized, competitive edge. Worn under clothing, this patented recoil protection has a comfortable cotton blend cover that easily attaches to a bra strap without removing the blouse or shirt, and stays in place with its hook and loop closure system. The result is an unseen protective layer of the PAST recoil absorbing foam for the female shooter. Weighs only 2 ounces. Ambidextrous. Bra not included.", "text": "Past Women's Recoil Shield The PAST Hidden Comfort Recoil Shield for Women™ is designed to give the female shooter a customized, competitive edge. Worn under clothing, this patented recoil protection has a comfortable cotton blend cover that easily attaches to a bra strap without removing the blouse or shirt, and stays in place with its hook and loop closure system. The result is an unseen protective layer of the PAST recoil absorbing foam for the female shooter. Weighs only 2 ounces. Ambidextrous. Bra not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-umM2maLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KJNE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Past", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 14.45}}
{"item_id": "B00162KLIW", "title": "Hunter's Specialties Field Dressing Gloves", "description": "These heavy-duty gloves protect against mess, stains and infectious disease. The shoulder-length gloves are made of poly to protect jacket sleeves. The wrist length gloves are made of surgical rubber to provide the best dexterity and sense of touch when dressing game.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties Field Dressing Gloves These heavy-duty gloves protect against mess, stains and infectious disease. The shoulder-length gloves are made of poly to protect jacket sleeves. The wrist length gloves are made of surgical rubber to provide the best dexterity and sense of touch when dressing game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t2HGlaLoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KLIW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scent Eliminators"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162KLQY", "title": "Pachmayr Grips For Ruger Mark Iii and Mark Ii", "description": "MK III Signature grip with backstrap features full wrap around design and built in steel inserts to maintain its shape. Fits Ruger Mark III and Mark II.", "text": "Pachmayr Grips For Ruger Mark Iii and Mark Ii MK III Signature grip with backstrap features full wrap around design and built in steel inserts to maintain its shape. Fits Ruger Mark III and Mark II.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WKqAiPzEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KLQY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 29.72}}
{"item_id": "B00162KMAE", "title": "Allen Company Remington Quick Adjusting Sling with Swivels Installed", "description": "Allen Gun Slings 18461", "text": "Allen Company Remington Quick Adjusting Sling with Swivels Installed Allen Gun Slings 18461", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21mBZjUULtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KMAE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 12.86}}
{"item_id": "B00162KN62", "title": "Lyman Pro Magnum Tumbler (115-Volt)", "description": "Lyman's new Pro Magnum Tumbler is designed for the high volume reloader, and high volume reloaders are always looking for value. The two gallon capacity bowl is engineered to deliver powerful cleaning action even at full capacity. Handling up to 1000 .38 Special cases at a time, the heavy-duty motor and advanced drive system deliver fast cleaning and long life.", "text": "Lyman Pro Magnum Tumbler (115-Volt) Lyman's new Pro Magnum Tumbler is designed for the high volume reloader, and high volume reloaders are always looking for value. The two gallon capacity bowl is engineered to deliver powerful cleaning action even at full capacity. Handling up to 1000 .38 Special cases at a time, the heavy-duty motor and advanced drive system deliver fast cleaning and long life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BsYdCeU9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KN62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 81.59}}
{"item_id": "B00162KNAI", "title": "Smith & Wesson SW015 Premium Lubricant & Protectant with Cerflon - 4 fl. Oz.", "description": "Smith & Wesson Premium Lubricant & Protectant with Cerflon cleans powder residues and lubricates all mechanism. It protects against all corrosion is safe for all finishes.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SW015 Premium Lubricant & Protectant with Cerflon - 4 fl. Oz. Smith & Wesson Premium Lubricant & Protectant with Cerflon cleans powder residues and lubricates all mechanism. It protects against all corrosion is safe for all finishes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PME6LU50L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KNAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162KNDA", "title": "MTM Universal Powder Funnel Kit", "description": "For serious reloaders, the Universal Powder Funnel set is designed for those who load multiple calibers. Once you purchase our Universal Funnel Set, you will never need another funnel. Kept all together in a high-quality, see-thru storage case.", "text": "MTM Universal Powder Funnel Kit For serious reloaders, the Universal Powder Funnel set is designed for those who load multiple calibers. Once you purchase our Universal Funnel Set, you will never need another funnel. Kept all together in a high-quality, see-thru storage case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XZcm970xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KNDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B00162KNWG", "title": "3M Peltor Eyeglass Protector Shooting Eyewear, Clear", "description": "Peltor eyeglass protector shooting eyewear which you wear over most personal and prescription eyewear. Impact resistant lens. Contoured nose bridge for universal fit. Built-in side shields for added protection. Meets ANSI Z87.1 standards. Comes with 10 pieces per case. Available in clear color.", "text": "3M Peltor Eyeglass Protector Shooting Eyewear, Clear Peltor eyeglass protector shooting eyewear which you wear over most personal and prescription eyewear. Impact resistant lens. Contoured nose bridge for universal fit. Built-in side shields for added protection. Meets ANSI Z87.1 standards. Comes with 10 pieces per case. Available in clear color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GzkwrDOHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KNWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Peltor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 6.03}}
{"item_id": "B00162KNXA", "title": "Otis Technology 400 Micro Kit Shotgun Cleaning Kit .410 - 12/10 Gauge - OTS400", "description": "Keep all of your firearms performing as they should with these convenient, lightweight cleaning kits. Soft pack case is not included with the Otis Micro Kits", "text": "Otis Technology 400 Micro Kit Shotgun Cleaning Kit .410 - 12/10 Gauge - OTS400 Keep all of your firearms performing as they should with these convenient, lightweight cleaning kits. Soft pack case is not included with the Otis Micro Kits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Oid2MOeiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KNXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 13.59}}
{"item_id": "B00162KRUY", "title": "Weaver Grand Slam 1-Inch High Steel Top Mount Rings", "description": "The proven strength of Grand Slam features steel construction for the ultimate hold. Solid steel construction means that Weaver Grand Slam™ Rings perform time after time when the pressure is on. The time tested Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your favorite rifle. Also available in silver, there is a Grand Slam ring designed to fit all of your shooting needs. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "text": "Weaver Grand Slam 1-Inch High Steel Top Mount Rings The proven strength of Grand Slam features steel construction for the ultimate hold. Solid steel construction means that Weaver Grand Slam™ Rings perform time after time when the pressure is on. The time tested Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your favorite rifle. Also available in silver, there is a Grand Slam ring designed to fit all of your shooting needs. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aY4Y21F%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KRUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 29.33}}
{"item_id": "B00162KS0S", "title": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 430T for Ruger 10/22", "description": "These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 430T for Ruger 10/22 These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HAGLYxD2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KS0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.94}}
{"item_id": "B00162KSCQ", "title": "Gunslick 1-Piece 36-Inch Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod (.22 Caliber)", "description": "All one-piece Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rods from Gunslick Pro are extremely strong, straight and 36\" in length. Carbon fiber rod eliminates particle pickup and possible damage to your barrel. Soft grip handles designed for comfort and efficient cleaning. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "text": "Gunslick 1-Piece 36-Inch Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod (.22 Caliber) All one-piece Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rods from Gunslick Pro are extremely strong, straight and 36\" in length. Carbon fiber rod eliminates particle pickup and possible damage to your barrel. Soft grip handles designed for comfort and efficient cleaning. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21B65oYY2SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KSCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 32.93}}
{"item_id": "B00162KUII", "title": "Set 3 Ninja Stealth Black Throwing Knives with Nylon Case", "description": "For sale are the 3 full tang Ninja Kunai throwing knives, like those seen in Naruto. Made of 440 stainless steel, the handle and blade are of one piece. The blade is slightly sharpened, and with 4\", the item is made to puncture. The handle is wrapped nylon. Included is the nylon sheath, which holds 3 ninja kunais. This is a favorite of ninja fans.", "text": "Set 3 Ninja Stealth Black Throwing Knives with Nylon Case For sale are the 3 full tang Ninja Kunai throwing knives, like those seen in Naruto. Made of 440 stainless steel, the handle and blade are of one piece. The blade is slightly sharpened, and with 4\", the item is made to puncture. The handle is wrapped nylon. Included is the nylon sheath, which holds 3 ninja kunais. This is a favorite of ninja fans.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ylJmMIgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162KUII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B00162LR6W", "title": "Lee Precision Auto Disk Riser", "description": "Lee Auto Disk Riser raises the Auto Disk powder measure higher above the mounting location on the Turret Press to provide clearance for use of the Safety Prime.", "text": "Lee Precision Auto Disk Riser Lee Auto Disk Riser raises the Auto Disk powder measure higher above the mounting location on the Turret Press to provide clearance for use of the Safety Prime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417hq0RCWJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162LR6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B00162LT5Q", "title": "M-Pro 7 Bore Cleaning Gel, 4 Ounce Bottle", "description": "The M-Pro 7 Military Grade Weapons Cleaning System contains effective tools for the military, law enforcement and other professional weapon experts that aid in mission readiness, combat operations and support pollution prevention initiatives. This revolutionary gun cleaning system was developed for use on all rifles, handguns, shotguns, machine guns, grenade launchers, mortars, crew served weaponry and more. M-Pro 7 exceeds gun cleaner and lubricant MILSPEC requirements, is commercially transportable worldwide and reduces maintenance time by up to 80%", "text": "M-Pro 7 Bore Cleaning Gel, 4 Ounce Bottle The M-Pro 7 Military Grade Weapons Cleaning System contains effective tools for the military, law enforcement and other professional weapon experts that aid in mission readiness, combat operations and support pollution prevention initiatives. This revolutionary gun cleaning system was developed for use on all rifles, handguns, shotguns, machine guns, grenade launchers, mortars, crew served weaponry and more. M-Pro 7 exceeds gun cleaner and lubricant MILSPEC requirements, is commercially transportable worldwide and reduces maintenance time by up to 80%", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vZO9Qv3bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162LT5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Pro 7", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162LUBY", "title": "Truglo Tritium/Fiber Optic Sights", "description": "TFO gun sights use the same proven technology as our TFO archery pins. These sights are the most revolutionary innovation since TRUGLO, Inc. introduced fiber optics. TFO refers to our patented combination of Tritium and Fiber Optic technologies. The tritium maintains the brightness level of the sight in low light (or NO light) conditions. That means you can see your sight even in complete darkness-with perfect transition through all light conditions. Tritium does not need batteries and does not need to be charged with light-it simply glows! TRITIUM/FIBER OPTIC Brite-Site Handgun Series Does not fit Glock 36 Models The ultimate handgun sight Uses our patented TFO technology Unbelievable transition through all light conditions Glows in the dark Uses the brightest tritium available CNC machined steel construction Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target Fits standard holsters Snag-resistant design Available in green only", "text": "Truglo Tritium/Fiber Optic Sights TFO gun sights use the same proven technology as our TFO archery pins. These sights are the most revolutionary innovation since TRUGLO, Inc. introduced fiber optics. TFO refers to our patented combination of Tritium and Fiber Optic technologies. The tritium maintains the brightness level of the sight in low light (or NO light) conditions. That means you can see your sight even in complete darkness-with perfect transition through all light conditions. Tritium does not need batteries and does not need to be charged with light-it simply glows! TRITIUM/FIBER OPTIC Brite-Site Handgun Series Does not fit Glock 36 Models The ultimate handgun sight Uses our patented TFO technology Unbelievable transition through all light conditions Glows in the dark Uses the brightest tritium available CNC machined steel construction Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target Fits standard holsters Snag-resistant design Available in green only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311CoqKE7kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162LUBY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
