{"item_id": "B00162MI3I", "title": "Hoppe's Deluxe Gun Cleaning Accessory Kit", "description": "More than 100 years in the gun care business has taught us a thing or two about what makes a good kit. Precisely why hunters, shooters and those in search of the perfect gift continually turn to Hoppe's. Our kits aren't just convenient, they're extremely well thought out. The Hoppes Deluxe Gun Cleaning accessory kit includes a three piece universal brass cleaning rod, eight phosphor bronze brushes to fit .22, .270/7mm, .30, .357/9mm, .40/10mm and .44/.45 calibers, along with 12 ga. and 20 ga., Six swabs for 12 ga. and 20 ga., plus .35/38, .22/.270, .280/.32,and .40/45 calibers, Four slotted ends to fit .410 bore to 20 ga., 16 and 12 ga.,.30 caliber and .22 caliber, Four knob ends for .22, .30, .38 and .44/.45 calibers, Shotgun and pistol adaptable. Solvents and pad not included in picture.", "text": "Hoppe's Deluxe Gun Cleaning Accessory Kit More than 100 years in the gun care business has taught us a thing or two about what makes a good kit. Precisely why hunters, shooters and those in search of the perfect gift continually turn to Hoppe's. Our kits aren't just convenient, they're extremely well thought out. The Hoppes Deluxe Gun Cleaning accessory kit includes a three piece universal brass cleaning rod, eight phosphor bronze brushes to fit .22, .270/7mm, .30, .357/9mm, .40/10mm and .44/.45 calibers, along with 12 ga. and 20 ga., Six swabs for 12 ga. and 20 ga., plus .35/38, .22/.270, .280/.32,and .40/45 calibers, Four slotted ends to fit .410 bore to 20 ga., 16 and 12 ga.,.30 caliber and .22 caliber, Four knob ends for .22, .30, .38 and .44/.45 calibers, Shotgun and pistol adaptable. Solvents and pad not included in picture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TGBoNasKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MI3I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162MILA", "title": "MTM 18 Rounds 9MM Cal Case-Gard Ammo Wallet (Clear Smoke)", "description": "Looks and feels like a wallet and fits into most pockets. MTM's Handgun Ammo Wallets are great for backup rounds with no rattle noise. Each bullet is held securely and is well-protected. They now come in a See-Thru Smoke Tint. Holds 18 Rounds .380 and 9mm", "text": "MTM 18 Rounds 9MM Cal Case-Gard Ammo Wallet (Clear Smoke) Looks and feels like a wallet and fits into most pockets. MTM's Handgun Ammo Wallets are great for backup rounds with no rattle noise. Each bullet is held securely and is well-protected. They now come in a See-Thru Smoke Tint. Holds 18 Rounds .380 and 9mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Lo4kBW-4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MILA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B00162MIZQ", "title": "Remington SuperCell Recoil Pads", "description": "The result of 10 years of rigorous R&D; by the top recoil-suppression experts in the industry, the Remington SuperCell Recoil Pad is the world's most efficient inhibitor of kickback energy. So potent, in fact, it single-handedly helped our Model 870 generate up to 54% less recoil than our leading competitors' autoloading shotguns with factory pads.Using a complex matrix of millions of SuperCells, the advanced polymer construction harnesses and releases energy over a much longer time period. Rearward force of your gun is reduced from a kick to a gentle push and muzzle travel is diminished, resulting in the softest shooting experience possible. All from a pad that's extremely lightweight, durable and enhanced with a smooth surface for rapid gun mounting.Synthetic Stock Shotguns: Fits Models 870, 1100, and 11-87 (1997 or newer), including Super Magnum models from 1999 to present. Designed for 12 Gauge only.Wood Stock Shotguns: Fits Models 870, 1100, and 11-87 (2004 or newer), including Super Magnum models that came with the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment. Will not be a \"perfect fit\" for models that did not have the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment. Designed for 12 Gauge only.Synthetic Stock Rifles: Fits Model 700 (1997 or newer).Wood Stock Rifles: Fits Model 700 (2004 or newer) that came with the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original equipment. Will not be a \"perfect fit\" for models that did not have the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment.", "text": "Remington SuperCell Recoil Pads The result of 10 years of rigorous R&D; by the top recoil-suppression experts in the industry, the Remington SuperCell Recoil Pad is the world's most efficient inhibitor of kickback energy. So potent, in fact, it single-handedly helped our Model 870 generate up to 54% less recoil than our leading competitors' autoloading shotguns with factory pads.Using a complex matrix of millions of SuperCells, the advanced polymer construction harnesses and releases energy over a much longer time period. Rearward force of your gun is reduced from a kick to a gentle push and muzzle travel is diminished, resulting in the softest shooting experience possible. All from a pad that's extremely lightweight, durable and enhanced with a smooth surface for rapid gun mounting.Synthetic Stock Shotguns: Fits Models 870, 1100, and 11-87 (1997 or newer), including Super Magnum models from 1999 to present. Designed for 12 Gauge only.Wood Stock Shotguns: Fits Models 870, 1100, and 11-87 (2004 or newer), including Super Magnum models that came with the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment. Will not be a \"perfect fit\" for models that did not have the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment. Designed for 12 Gauge only.Synthetic Stock Rifles: Fits Model 700 (1997 or newer).Wood Stock Rifles: Fits Model 700 (2004 or newer) that came with the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original equipment. Will not be a \"perfect fit\" for models that did not have the R3 or SuperCell Pad as original factory equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SxEi6UfdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MIZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162MK2M", "title": "Lyman Shotshell Handbook 5Th Edition", "description": "Comprehensive loading manual forshotgun shells - 5th Edition in popular series.", "text": "Lyman Shotshell Handbook 5Th Edition Comprehensive loading manual forshotgun shells - 5th Edition in popular series.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61SykI9XOvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MK2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 18.19}}
{"item_id": "B00162MKI6", "title": "Allen Company Remington Yukon Scoped Rifle Case (50-Inch)", "description": "The Remington Oversized Heavy Foam Case by Allen is made to accommodate more than just your gun! Sure, A+ protection is the TOP priority of this Rifle Case from Allen. That much is obvious by scoping out the tough Endura shell and the super-cushy 3\"-thick foam to absorb punishment and rough handling. But it's also made with easy transport in mind, too. Extra wide construction accommodates your scope and bi-pod, while 3 handy pockets carry any extra accessories. Case measures 50\" rifleand features a heavy-duty zip closure. Order Now! Allen Oversized Heavy Foam Case", "text": "Allen Company Remington Yukon Scoped Rifle Case (50-Inch) The Remington Oversized Heavy Foam Case by Allen is made to accommodate more than just your gun! Sure, A+ protection is the TOP priority of this Rifle Case from Allen. That much is obvious by scoping out the tough Endura shell and the super-cushy 3\"-thick foam to absorb punishment and rough handling. But it's also made with easy transport in mind, too. Extra wide construction accommodates your scope and bi-pod, while 3 handy pockets carry any extra accessories. Case measures 50\" rifleand features a heavy-duty zip closure. Order Now! Allen Oversized Heavy Foam Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311zfCDEo5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MKI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 50.05}}
{"item_id": "B00162MMJI", "title": "MTM Shoulder-Gard Rifle Rest", "description": "The Shoulder-Gard Rifle Rest (SGR-30) is MTM's first recoil reduction rest. With the growing popularity of magnum caliber rifles, heavy recoil can be a real pain. To address this issue, MTM has made a 4-point, flexible base, shooting rest designed to ease the shoulder punishment of sighting-in powerful magnum rifles. By utilizing the integrated recoil-reduction sling, shooters are able to relax and shoot more comfortably, knowing that less recoil from the gun is going to be felt. The recoil reduction sling does not have to be used with lighter caliber rifles.", "text": "MTM Shoulder-Gard Rifle Rest The Shoulder-Gard Rifle Rest (SGR-30) is MTM's first recoil reduction rest. With the growing popularity of magnum caliber rifles, heavy recoil can be a real pain. To address this issue, MTM has made a 4-point, flexible base, shooting rest designed to ease the shoulder punishment of sighting-in powerful magnum rifles. By utilizing the integrated recoil-reduction sling, shooters are able to relax and shoot more comfortably, knowing that less recoil from the gun is going to be felt. The recoil reduction sling does not have to be used with lighter caliber rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wvpbrAtYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MMJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162MQEE", "title": "Butch'S Twill Cleaning Patches Bag Of 1000 (1-1/8-Inch)", "description": "These patches offer superior performance. They hold more liquid and remove fouling faster than ordinary cotton flannel patches. A special fabric used in laboratories and cleanrooms, Triple Twill's special weave has hundreds of tiny \"ridges and drop zones-Inchwhich scrub and capture fouling residues far better than other patches. Butch's Triple Twill patches don't shed lint and have been specially treated for maximum absorbency.", "text": "Butch'S Twill Cleaning Patches Bag Of 1000 (1-1/8-Inch) These patches offer superior performance. They hold more liquid and remove fouling faster than ordinary cotton flannel patches. A special fabric used in laboratories and cleanrooms, Triple Twill's special weave has hundreds of tiny \"ridges and drop zones-Inchwhich scrub and capture fouling residues far better than other patches. Butch's Triple Twill patches don't shed lint and have been specially treated for maximum absorbency.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MXmO18%2BqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MQEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butch&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162MQJO", "title": "Weaver Grand Slam Lever Lok Top 1-Inch Medium Mount Rings", "description": "Weaver Grand Slam Lever Lok Top Mount Rings offer the quick detach feature makes this ring an ideal choice for the serious hunter on the go. This durable, reliable ring easily detaches and re-mounts without tools so you can protect your optics while traveling to your next hunt. The reliable Weaver cross lock design allows for secure, tight fit on your favorite rifle. With solid steel construction, you can rest assured that this ring will perform in the heat of the hunt. Our rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "text": "Weaver Grand Slam Lever Lok Top 1-Inch Medium Mount Rings Weaver Grand Slam Lever Lok Top Mount Rings offer the quick detach feature makes this ring an ideal choice for the serious hunter on the go. This durable, reliable ring easily detaches and re-mounts without tools so you can protect your optics while traveling to your next hunt. The reliable Weaver cross lock design allows for secure, tight fit on your favorite rifle. With solid steel construction, you can rest assured that this ring will perform in the heat of the hunt. Our rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31th1JRx4dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MQJO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.89}}
{"item_id": "B00162MQLW", "title": "Weaver Grand Slam 1-Inch Extra High Steel Top Mount Rings", "description": "The proven strength of Grand Slam features steel construction for the ultimate hold. Solid steel construction means that Weaver Grand Slam™ Rings perform time after time when the pressure is on. The time tested Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your favorite rifle. Also available in silver, there is a Grand Slam ring designed to fit all of your shooting needs. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "text": "Weaver Grand Slam 1-Inch Extra High Steel Top Mount Rings The proven strength of Grand Slam features steel construction for the ultimate hold. Solid steel construction means that Weaver Grand Slam™ Rings perform time after time when the pressure is on. The time tested Weaver cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your favorite rifle. Also available in silver, there is a Grand Slam ring designed to fit all of your shooting needs. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wo0LabSKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162MQLW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.56}}
{"item_id": "B00162NQT8", "title": "Limbsaver 10200 Speed Mount Recoil Pad", "description": "The Speed Mount Recoil Pad is designed with Anti Muzzle Jump Technology and provides a smooth, snag-free mount. This innovative pad drastically reduces muzzle jump and its new sloped toe and heel design helps the shooter saddle their firearm to their shoulder faster, more consistently every shot. The LIMBSAVER Recoil Pad is an incredible product that has been shown to reduce shotgun recoil shock up to 50% over standard manufacturer stock pads. Whether you are an avid target shooter, hardcore hunter, or firearm enthusiast make sure you have the best of the best with the new Limbsaver Speed Mount Precision Fit recoil pad. This model #10200 is a screw-in and fits these stocks (information is listed in Manufacturer, Gun Model, Stock Material, SVL Product #, and Special Notes order): (Mossberg, All 5 3/16\" stocks 500 / 500A / 835 / 930 / 935 non tactical, Synthetic, 10200). **Firearm manufacturers often change stock specifications without notice, and some consumers have adjusted their stock to affect the length of pull, thereby changing the dimensions of the butt of the stock. Please check the dimensions in the product features against your particular gun model and request a template from the seller if there is still a question.", "text": "Limbsaver 10200 Speed Mount Recoil Pad The Speed Mount Recoil Pad is designed with Anti Muzzle Jump Technology and provides a smooth, snag-free mount. This innovative pad drastically reduces muzzle jump and its new sloped toe and heel design helps the shooter saddle their firearm to their shoulder faster, more consistently every shot. The LIMBSAVER Recoil Pad is an incredible product that has been shown to reduce shotgun recoil shock up to 50% over standard manufacturer stock pads. Whether you are an avid target shooter, hardcore hunter, or firearm enthusiast make sure you have the best of the best with the new Limbsaver Speed Mount Precision Fit recoil pad. This model #10200 is a screw-in and fits these stocks (information is listed in Manufacturer, Gun Model, Stock Material, SVL Product #, and Special Notes order): (Mossberg, All 5 3/16\" stocks 500 / 500A / 835 / 930 / 935 non tactical, Synthetic, 10200). **Firearm manufacturers often change stock specifications without notice, and some consumers have adjusted their stock to affect the length of pull, thereby changing the dimensions of the butt of the stock. Please check the dimensions in the product features against your particular gun model and request a template from the seller if there is still a question.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aylKy4cyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NQT8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162NSBO", "title": "TRUGLO Kimber Tritium Handgun Sight", "description": "The TRUGLO Tritium handgun sights use the brightest tritium available. CNC-machined steel construction. Green front and rear. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "text": "TRUGLO Kimber Tritium Handgun Sight The TRUGLO Tritium handgun sights use the brightest tritium available. CNC-machined steel construction. Green front and rear. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416pf2q4ZML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NSBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 65.04}}
{"item_id": "B00162NTCW", "title": "Frankford Arsenal 881538 Arsenal Brass Cleaning Walnut Media", "description": "Frankford Arsenal Walnut Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal 881538 Arsenal Brass Cleaning Walnut Media Frankford Arsenal Walnut Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4165bQPY47L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NTCW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 21.13}}
{"item_id": "B00162NTZ4", "title": "Galco M5X Matrix for Hi-Point C9 9MM (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "The M5X paddle holster is a versatile addition to Galco’s line of Matrix thermoplastic holsters. The durable, injection-molded Matrix line is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free – while remaining fast in action, concealable, and easy on the budget. Like all Galco paddle holsters, the M5X locks solidly on the belt while still remaining easy to attach and remove. The M5X securely positions the handgun at the beltline with a moderate butt-forward angle, enhancing concealability yet maintaining ease and speed of draw. Twin tension units allow the user to micro-adjust the feel of the draw while retaining a proper level of firearm retention. Unlike many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M5X paddle fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the M5X is available in right and left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco M5X Matrix for Hi-Point C9 9MM (Black, Right-hand) The M5X paddle holster is a versatile addition to Galco’s line of Matrix thermoplastic holsters. The durable, injection-molded Matrix line is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free – while remaining fast in action, concealable, and easy on the budget. Like all Galco paddle holsters, the M5X locks solidly on the belt while still remaining easy to attach and remove. The M5X securely positions the handgun at the beltline with a moderate butt-forward angle, enhancing concealability yet maintaining ease and speed of draw. Twin tension units allow the user to micro-adjust the feel of the draw while retaining a proper level of firearm retention. Unlike many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M5X paddle fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the M5X is available in right and left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J-PBka3UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NTZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.76}}
