{"item_id": "B00162NUTE", "title": "Bulldog Economy Black Rifle Case with Black Trim (52-Inch)", "description": "Black with Black Trim 52\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 50\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 7\" * 1 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Durable Nylon water-resistant outer shell * Brushed Tricot soft scratch-resistant inner lining * It Floats!!!", "text": "Bulldog Economy Black Rifle Case with Black Trim (52-Inch) Black with Black Trim 52\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 50\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 7\" * 1 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Durable Nylon water-resistant outer shell * Brushed Tricot soft scratch-resistant inner lining * It Floats!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xKuG5TpEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NUTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 11.1}}
{"item_id": "B00162NV48", "title": "Lee Precision Zip Trim", "description": "Lee Zip Trim rotates the case like a lathe. The case can be quickly trimmed, chamfered and polished. Used with the Case Length Gauge and Shell Holder, Cutter with Ball Grip, Deburring Tools, and 3-Jaw Chuck", "text": "Lee Precision Zip Trim Lee Zip Trim rotates the case like a lathe. The case can be quickly trimmed, chamfered and polished. Used with the Case Length Gauge and Shell Holder, Cutter with Ball Grip, Deburring Tools, and 3-Jaw Chuck", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pQKeKX0jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NV48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B00162NVAM", "title": "Lee Precision 38/357 Carbide Factory Crimp Die", "description": "Lee 38 Special/357 Magnum Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "text": "Lee Precision 38/357 Carbide Factory Crimp Die Lee 38 Special/357 Magnum Carbide Factory Crimp Die sizes the cartridge while being crimped so every round will positively chamber freely with factory like dependability The adjusting screw quickly and easily sets the desired amount of crimp. Trim Length is not critical so this extra operation takes less time than it would if cases were trimmed and chamfered. A firm crimp is essential for dependable and accurate ammunition, as it eliminates the problems of poor ignition of slow burning magnum powders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gM0EafiIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NVAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.6}}
{"item_id": "B00162NVIE", "title": "Lee Precision Carbide 4-Die Set Colt (Grey)", "description": "The Lee Precision 45 Colt Pistol 4-Die Set Comes With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision Carbide 4-Die Set Colt (Grey) The Lee Precision 45 Colt Pistol 4-Die Set Comes With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zPSI7mPAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162NVIE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 39.74}}
{"item_id": "B00162OGYW", "title": "MTM 38/357 Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box", "description": "The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "text": "MTM 38/357 Cal 50 Round Flip-Top Ammo Box The P-50 Series is for those who prefer to keep their ammo boxed in 50s. These living-hinged boxes offer many of the same features of the P-100s only in a 50 round container.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X6c3l7OAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OGYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.4}}
{"item_id": "B00162OHT6", "title": "Trius 2 Birdshooter Trap", "description": "The TRIUS Birdshooter has many of the fine features of our original trap but priced for the occasional shooter. Don't let the low price fool you; this trap has TRIUS quality and performance. A bit lighter weight than the \"original TRIUS Trap,-Inchthis trap will out perform other traps in its price range. Regulation singles and piggyback doubles make this an excellent choice for the beginner and/or experienced shooter. Can be held with foot or tire mount (bolt furnished). Aluminum arm plus oil impregnated bushings give years of trouble-free shooting. A High Angle Target Retainer is included for adding variety to your shooting. Fully adjustable without tools.", "text": "Trius 2 Birdshooter Trap The TRIUS Birdshooter has many of the fine features of our original trap but priced for the occasional shooter. Don't let the low price fool you; this trap has TRIUS quality and performance. A bit lighter weight than the \"original TRIUS Trap,-Inchthis trap will out perform other traps in its price range. Regulation singles and piggyback doubles make this an excellent choice for the beginner and/or experienced shooter. Can be held with foot or tire mount (bolt furnished). Aluminum arm plus oil impregnated bushings give years of trouble-free shooting. A High Angle Target Retainer is included for adding variety to your shooting. Fully adjustable without tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410I44RHIPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OHT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trius", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 58.6}}
{"item_id": "B00162OK16", "title": "Hunters Specialties Spandex Head Net (Realtree AP HD)", "description": "Spandex Head Net with adjustable nose bridge and eyehole opening conform comfortably to face or glasses for 100% peripheral vision. Ones size fits all. Realtree AP HD", "text": "Hunters Specialties Spandex Head Net (Realtree AP HD) Spandex Head Net with adjustable nose bridge and eyehole opening conform comfortably to face or glasses for 100% peripheral vision. Ones size fits all. Realtree AP HD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nosb4QmiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OK16.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162OKDY", "title": "Otis 316-3-NBBZ Variety Pack All Purpose Receiver Brushes (1 Each, Total 3)", "description": "One Each Nylon, Blue Nylon and Bronze. Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a slightly more aggressive blue nylon bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the bronze bristled brush.", "text": "Otis 316-3-NBBZ Variety Pack All Purpose Receiver Brushes (1 Each, Total 3) One Each Nylon, Blue Nylon and Bronze. Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a slightly more aggressive blue nylon bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the bronze bristled brush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Ib6zW5xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OKDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B00162OKWK", "title": "Lyman E-Zee Powder Funnel", "description": "Redesigned with all of the latest cartridges in mind, the specially designed powder nozzle of this new funnel handles everything from the smallest .22 up to the big .50 calibers. Including the new Super Short Magnums.", "text": "Lyman E-Zee Powder Funnel Redesigned with all of the latest cartridges in mind, the specially designed powder nozzle of this new funnel handles everything from the smallest .22 up to the big .50 calibers. Including the new Super Short Magnums.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EKn9iqW5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OKWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162OKWU", "title": "Pachmayr Master Gunsmith Firearm Screw Kit (277 Piece)", "description": "The ideal companion to the Master Gunsmith Screw Driver Set. This new 277 piece kit is for the firearms owner and gunsmith. This set contains 12 each of 23 different \"hard to find-Inchscrews that fit common applications in many guns. Screws are contained in handy storage kit and include tweezers.", "text": "Pachmayr Master Gunsmith Firearm Screw Kit (277 Piece) The ideal companion to the Master Gunsmith Screw Driver Set. This new 277 piece kit is for the firearms owner and gunsmith. This set contains 12 each of 23 different \"hard to find-Inchscrews that fit common applications in many guns. Screws are contained in handy storage kit and include tweezers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51x1FMZi3JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OKWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.81}}
{"item_id": "B00162OLTW", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Die Bushing 10 Pack", "description": "These Hornady die bushings allow you to take advantage of the fastest die-change over system in the industry. You are in business as long as your press is equipped with the Hornady press bushing.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Die Bushing 10 Pack These Hornady die bushings allow you to take advantage of the fastest die-change over system in the industry. You are in business as long as your press is equipped with the Hornady press bushing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CTc-7tm4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OLTW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.8}}
{"item_id": "B00162OP98", "title": "Lyman Deluxe Hammer and Punch Set", "description": "Each set features our complete selection of quality Gunsmith Punches plus the popular Brass Tapper Hammer. This unique set comes in a custom hardwood storage case which separates each punch by size for quick access. Includes 1/16\", 3/32\", 1/8\", 5/32\", 3/16\", 1/8-Inchcenter and a brass drift punch along with Brass Tapper Hammer.", "text": "Lyman Deluxe Hammer and Punch Set Each set features our complete selection of quality Gunsmith Punches plus the popular Brass Tapper Hammer. This unique set comes in a custom hardwood storage case which separates each punch by size for quick access. Includes 1/16\", 3/32\", 1/8\", 5/32\", 3/16\", 1/8-Inchcenter and a brass drift punch along with Brass Tapper Hammer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F5ueKNGbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162OP98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162POP2", "title": "Lee Precision Safety Primer Feed Large and Small", "description": "Lee Safety Prime is a new priming system for small and large primers, never touch the primers from box to shell. Used with 2006 and newer Turret Presses, Classic Turret Press, Breech Lock Classic Cast, and the Classic Cast Press. Note: Depending on die configuration on the Turret Press, the Auto Disk Riser may need to be purchased to provide adequate clearance for the Lee Safety Prime.", "text": "Lee Precision Safety Primer Feed Large and Small Lee Safety Prime is a new priming system for small and large primers, never touch the primers from box to shell. Used with 2006 and newer Turret Presses, Classic Turret Press, Breech Lock Classic Cast, and the Classic Cast Press. Note: Depending on die configuration on the Turret Press, the Auto Disk Riser may need to be purchased to provide adequate clearance for the Lee Safety Prime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pHspmvbJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162POP2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B00162PPQK", "title": "Bulldog Belt and Clip Ambi Holster (Fits Most Standard 2 - 5-Inch Barrel Auto's with Laser Or Tac Light", "description": "Black/Black Trim Size 19 - Standard Auto 2-5\" w/ laser or light Custom Fit Holsters Assurance of Quality * Four wall construction * Outer wall fabric is heavy-duty, 1200 Denier water-resistant Nylon * Inner wall has a vinyl vapor barrier, deluxe padding and a soft, scratch-resistant fabric * Ambidextrous clip and belt loop FITS MAKE & MODELS ~GENERIC FIT - Fits most standard 2 - 5\" barrel autos w/ laser or tactical light", "text": "Bulldog Belt and Clip Ambi Holster (Fits Most Standard 2 - 5-Inch Barrel Auto's with Laser Or Tac Light Black/Black Trim Size 19 - Standard Auto 2-5\" w/ laser or light Custom Fit Holsters Assurance of Quality * Four wall construction * Outer wall fabric is heavy-duty, 1200 Denier water-resistant Nylon * Inner wall has a vinyl vapor barrier, deluxe padding and a soft, scratch-resistant fabric * Ambidextrous clip and belt loop FITS MAKE & MODELS ~GENERIC FIT - Fits most standard 2 - 5\" barrel autos w/ laser or tactical light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H9dDs59AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PPQK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B00162PQSW", "title": "M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner, 4 Ounce Spray Bottle", "description": "M-Pro 7 Weapons Maintenance System... Gun cleaners and lubricants for military, law enforcement and other professionalshooters. M-Pro 7's complete weapon maintenance system is designed to preserve weapon integrity enhancing reliability, performance, service life and operator safety. Gun cleaning time is reduced up to 80% as the M-Pro 7 lubricant repels dirt, sand, carbon and other contaminants while the M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner conditions thebore to reduce future fouling. M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner uses aerospace technology to break up and separate carbon particles on a molecular level from the bore steel allowing the carbon and embedded fouling to be easily brushed out. Superior M-Pro 7 lubrication decreases friction and wear providing long lasting corrosion protection. All M-Pro 7 gun cleaning products are odorless, non-toxic, non-hazardous, biodegradable, non-flammable and can be commercially transported world-wide. For professionals who want to spend more time shooting and less time cleaning.", "text": "M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner, 4 Ounce Spray Bottle M-Pro 7 Weapons Maintenance System... Gun cleaners and lubricants for military, law enforcement and other professionalshooters. M-Pro 7's complete weapon maintenance system is designed to preserve weapon integrity enhancing reliability, performance, service life and operator safety. Gun cleaning time is reduced up to 80% as the M-Pro 7 lubricant repels dirt, sand, carbon and other contaminants while the M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner conditions thebore to reduce future fouling. M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner uses aerospace technology to break up and separate carbon particles on a molecular level from the bore steel allowing the carbon and embedded fouling to be easily brushed out. Superior M-Pro 7 lubrication decreases friction and wear providing long lasting corrosion protection. All M-Pro 7 gun cleaning products are odorless, non-toxic, non-hazardous, biodegradable, non-flammable and can be commercially transported world-wide. For professionals who want to spend more time shooting and less time cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416%2Bd3GD8EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PQSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Pro 7", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162PQTG", "title": "M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner, 8 Ounce Spray Bottle", "description": "M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner Spray - 1 Bottle, 8 oz - 1005", "text": "M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner, 8 Ounce Spray Bottle M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner Spray - 1 Bottle, 8 oz - 1005", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lWP2YXcQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PQTG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Pro 7", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 19.94}}
{"item_id": "B00162PR7C", "title": "Sig-Sauer Paddle Holster SIG104", "description": "Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature- Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm- Features:- - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at The Ready- - Fully adjustable for cant- - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc-)- - Adjusts with simple Allen key- - Protective sight channel- - Right hand models only", "text": "Sig-Sauer Paddle Holster SIG104 Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature- Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm- Features:- - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at The Ready- - Fully adjustable for cant- - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc-)- - Adjusts with simple Allen key- - Protective sight channel- - Right hand models only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213hK1SCChL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PR7C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162PRPY", "title": "Caldwell Stable Table", "description": "The Caldwell Stable Table Portable Shooting Bench is designed from the ground up. This bench features a tri-pod base, robust steel frame and perfectly sized table top. Tri-pod features fewer joints and tighter connections to minimize wobble and the recessed table top will hold ammo boxes, binoculars and other accessories without fear of them rolling off onto the ground. Padded seat is adjustable in height and the entire package weighs less than 50 lbs.", "text": "Caldwell Stable Table The Caldwell Stable Table Portable Shooting Bench is designed from the ground up. This bench features a tri-pod base, robust steel frame and perfectly sized table top. Tri-pod features fewer joints and tighter connections to minimize wobble and the recessed table top will hold ammo boxes, binoculars and other accessories without fear of them rolling off onto the ground. Padded seat is adjustable in height and the entire package weighs less than 50 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318j0CwTjoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PRPY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 151.45}}
{"item_id": "B00162PSBC", "title": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 (Natural, Ambi)", "description": "While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "text": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 (Natural, Ambi) While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510Le37ABBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PSBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.36}}
{"item_id": "B00162PVJQ", "title": "Lee Precision Cutter with Ball Grip", "description": "Lee Cutter and Ball Grip makes case prep easier and more comfortable. Used with the Zip Trim.", "text": "Lee Precision Cutter with Ball Grip Lee Cutter and Ball Grip makes case prep easier and more comfortable. Used with the Zip Trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PlUb2-IkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PVJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.75}}
{"item_id": "B00162PWI6", "title": "Lee Precision 308 Win Loader", "description": "Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 308 Win. except a rubber mallet. Please note: the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "text": "Lee Precision 308 Win Loader Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 308 Win. except a rubber mallet. Please note: the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U4be3r1tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162PWI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 35.5}}
{"item_id": "B00162Q17W", "title": "Lee Precision 1oz Slug Mold", "description": "Lee 1oz Slug Mold features the exclusive drive key which positively rotates the slug in rifled shotgun barrels. Includes sprue plate, handles and instruction with suggested loads.", "text": "Lee Precision 1oz Slug Mold Lee 1oz Slug Mold features the exclusive drive key which positively rotates the slug in rifled shotgun barrels. Includes sprue plate, handles and instruction with suggested loads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Al6Na830L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162Q17W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.72}}
{"item_id": "B00162QD34", "title": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Objective Scope Cover, Size 25-26-27", "description": "Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "text": "Butler Creek Multiflex Flip-Open Objective Scope Cover, Size 25-26-27 Simply the ultimate scope lens protection for hunters and shooters with additional flex in the collars to fit a wider range of scopes. They're create a watertight, airtight seal, and open with a touch of your thumb, so you can put your shot through the narrow window of opportunity in the most extreme conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419ahIwbLHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QD34.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 16.88}}
