{"item_id": "B00162QEMO", "title": "Birchwood Casey Gallery Expert .22 Rimfire Resetting Target", "description": "Get the hottest new targets for plinking enthusiasts! Birchwood Casey’s World of Targets offers everything you need for hours of shooting fun without even having to walk down range or pull cords to reset. Birchwood Casey’s Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round!", "text": "Birchwood Casey Gallery Expert .22 Rimfire Resetting Target Get the hottest new targets for plinking enthusiasts! Birchwood Casey’s World of Targets offers everything you need for hours of shooting fun without even having to walk down range or pull cords to reset. Birchwood Casey’s Gallery Resetting Targets allow you to knock down all the hanging paddles, and then shoot the upper paddle to reset the others for another round!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MNkuxRVeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QEMO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 37.52}}
{"item_id": "B00162QF6E", "title": "Pachmayr Grips For Walther Ppk/S (New Generation S&W)", "description": "PPK/SW Signature grip with backstrap features full wrap around design and built in steel inserts to maintain its shape. Fits New Generation Walther PPK/S (Smith & Wesson).", "text": "Pachmayr Grips For Walther Ppk/S (New Generation S&W) PPK/SW Signature grip with backstrap features full wrap around design and built in steel inserts to maintain its shape. Fits New Generation Walther PPK/S (Smith & Wesson).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ECLe4LKML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QF6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162QGCW", "title": "Outdoor Connection Leather Unfilled Bench Bag (3-Piece Set), Canvas", "description": "The TOC BenchBags are made with made with premium quality materials and are GUARANTEED FOREVER. The design creates a steady platform and grips the rifle forend like a soft vice for stability. The bags are designed to be heavy enough for support of large caliber rifles, yet light enough for transport. Your expensive rifle is carefully held in place and no metal that could mar the finish comes in contact with the firearm. Use your BenchBags at the range, in the deer stand or on any surface to hold your gun steady.", "text": "Outdoor Connection Leather Unfilled Bench Bag (3-Piece Set), Canvas The TOC BenchBags are made with made with premium quality materials and are GUARANTEED FOREVER. The design creates a steady platform and grips the rifle forend like a soft vice for stability. The bags are designed to be heavy enough for support of large caliber rifles, yet light enough for transport. Your expensive rifle is carefully held in place and no metal that could mar the finish comes in contact with the firearm. Use your BenchBags at the range, in the deer stand or on any surface to hold your gun steady.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LiB6zrjiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QGCW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162QGLS", "title": "Lyman Electronic Digital Trigger Pull Gauge", "description": "State of the art strain gauge technology allows for accuracy to 1/10 ounce over a working range of 0 to 12 pounds. The Digital Trigger Pull Gauge is equipped with a large, easy to read LCD display and is push button operated for zero, clear and averaging functions. It can also can be converted to read in kilograms. Unlike other gauges, there are no weights or sliding pointers to worry about. Simply place the gauge on the trigger and pull! Lyman's Digital Trigger Pull Gauge accurately records the results. You can also take multiple readings and the Digital Trigger Pull Gauge will tell you the average weight for the string. This is the perfect tool for target shooters, silhouette shooters, gunsmiths, hunters or anyone who wants to adjust their trigger pull weights accurately and easily.", "text": "Lyman Electronic Digital Trigger Pull Gauge State of the art strain gauge technology allows for accuracy to 1/10 ounce over a working range of 0 to 12 pounds. The Digital Trigger Pull Gauge is equipped with a large, easy to read LCD display and is push button operated for zero, clear and averaging functions. It can also can be converted to read in kilograms. Unlike other gauges, there are no weights or sliding pointers to worry about. Simply place the gauge on the trigger and pull! Lyman's Digital Trigger Pull Gauge accurately records the results. You can also take multiple readings and the Digital Trigger Pull Gauge will tell you the average weight for the string. This is the perfect tool for target shooters, silhouette shooters, gunsmiths, hunters or anyone who wants to adjust their trigger pull weights accurately and easily.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oPyuU90WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QGLS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 57.39}}
{"item_id": "B00162QGPO", "title": "Lyman E-Zee Flow Universal Powder Trickler", "description": "Now the first powder Trickler that works with any reloading scale. Lyman's E-ZEE-FLO accessory powder Trickler features an adjustable base that adapts to even that highest scale platform. Powder Trickler tube has an extension that allows use with electronic scales that have larger platform bases. The combination of the two adjustments allows use with any scale, mechanical or electronic.", "text": "Lyman E-Zee Flow Universal Powder Trickler Now the first powder Trickler that works with any reloading scale. Lyman's E-ZEE-FLO accessory powder Trickler features an adjustable base that adapts to even that highest scale platform. Powder Trickler tube has an extension that allows use with electronic scales that have larger platform bases. The combination of the two adjustments allows use with any scale, mechanical or electronic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZzkGBZ8mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QGPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 17.9}}
{"item_id": "B00162QKT6", "title": "Weaver No-Gunsmith Converta Shotgun Mount - Mossberg 500, 835 (12 Gauge Only) Gloss Black", "description": "Mount your favorite sight device with ease using Weaver No Gunsmith Mounts. The multi-slot bases allow you to mount a variety of optics including scopes, red dots and laser sights while obtaining the optimum eye relief. The low profile, form fitting design allows you to shoot in your natural position without \"peeking.\" Strong and lightweight, made of tough polymer composite material, these mounts will operate in temperatures of -40°F to 150°F. These complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "text": "Weaver No-Gunsmith Converta Shotgun Mount - Mossberg 500, 835 (12 Gauge Only) Gloss Black Mount your favorite sight device with ease using Weaver No Gunsmith Mounts. The multi-slot bases allow you to mount a variety of optics including scopes, red dots and laser sights while obtaining the optimum eye relief. The low profile, form fitting design allows you to shoot in your natural position without \"peeking.\" Strong and lightweight, made of tough polymer composite material, these mounts will operate in temperatures of -40°F to 150°F. These complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rvuJ3EEPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QKT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 25.38}}
{"item_id": "B00162QL1S", "title": "RCBS Deburring Tool (.17-.60 Cal)", "description": "This larger RCBS Deburring Tool allows the inside and outside chamfering and deburring of cases from 17-caliber up to 60-caliber. Larger than our standard deburring tool, this tool is perfect for handloading cases over 45-caliber. But if you want one deburring tool to do it all, this is it. Made of hardened steel to last a lifetime.", "text": "RCBS Deburring Tool (.17-.60 Cal) This larger RCBS Deburring Tool allows the inside and outside chamfering and deburring of cases from 17-caliber up to 60-caliber. Larger than our standard deburring tool, this tool is perfect for handloading cases over 45-caliber. But if you want one deburring tool to do it all, this is it. Made of hardened steel to last a lifetime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312EhAe4BUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162QL1S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.49}}
{"item_id": "B00162RKBS", "title": "Bulldog Belt and Clip Ambi Holster (Fits Most Large Frame Auto's with 4 - 4 1/2-Inch Barrels, High Point Standard)", "description": "Black/Black Trim Size 31 - Large Frame Autos 4-4 1/2\" Barrel Custom Fit Holsters Assurance of Quality * Four wall construction * Outer wall fabric is heavy-duty, 1200 Denier water-resistant Nylon * Inner wall has a vinyl vapor barrier, deluxe padding and a soft, scratch-resistant fabric * Ambidextrous clip and belt loop FITS MAKE & MODEL ~GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST LARGE FRAME AUTOS W/ 4\" - 4 1/2\" BARRELS * HI-POINT - AUTO - 4 1/2\" BARREL LENGTH o 9mm o .40 o .45", "text": "Bulldog Belt and Clip Ambi Holster (Fits Most Large Frame Auto's with 4 - 4 1/2-Inch Barrels, High Point Standard) Black/Black Trim Size 31 - Large Frame Autos 4-4 1/2\" Barrel Custom Fit Holsters Assurance of Quality * Four wall construction * Outer wall fabric is heavy-duty, 1200 Denier water-resistant Nylon * Inner wall has a vinyl vapor barrier, deluxe padding and a soft, scratch-resistant fabric * Ambidextrous clip and belt loop FITS MAKE & MODEL ~GENERIC FIT - FITS MOST LARGE FRAME AUTOS W/ 4\" - 4 1/2\" BARRELS * HI-POINT - AUTO - 4 1/2\" BARREL LENGTH o 9mm o .40 o .45", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KI6s41JjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RKBS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.34}}
{"item_id": "B00162RKFY", "title": "ArmaLaser P11/P40 Kel-Tec Small Block Laser Sight, Black", "description": "SB3 - Touch-activated laser system for the Kel-Tec P11/P40.", "text": "ArmaLaser P11/P40 Kel-Tec Small Block Laser Sight, Black SB3 - Touch-activated laser system for the Kel-Tec P11/P40.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wmLC5REyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RKFY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 75.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162RLXA", "title": "Hogue Cowboy Grips (Fits: New Blackhawk / Vaquero Black Pearl Cowboy Panels)", "description": "Cowboy Grips add individuality and a custom look to any Cowboy Action revolver. This grip is oversized and will require fitting to the gun's grip frame. This grip will only fit pre-2006 models without the internal lock. This grip will not fit older or newer XR3 frames. Grips include grip screw for mounting. Fits: New Blackhawk/Vaquero Black Pearl Cowboy Panels.", "text": "Hogue Cowboy Grips (Fits: New Blackhawk / Vaquero Black Pearl Cowboy Panels) Cowboy Grips add individuality and a custom look to any Cowboy Action revolver. This grip is oversized and will require fitting to the gun's grip frame. This grip will only fit pre-2006 models without the internal lock. This grip will not fit older or newer XR3 frames. Grips include grip screw for mounting. Fits: New Blackhawk/Vaquero Black Pearl Cowboy Panels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qmPogkYcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RLXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 40.68}}
{"item_id": "B00162RM3E", "title": "Lee Precision 50th Anniversary Reloading Kit", "description": "At the heart of the Lee Precision Anniversary Challenger II Kit is the Challenger Press, a strong O-frame press with a larger-than-average opening angled at 30° for maximum hand clearance. Compound leverage easily performs full-length sizing on even the largest magnum cases. There’s a built-in, easy-to-empty primer catcher. Complete powder-handling system, including the precise Perfect Powder Measure. Case preparation tools include a cutter and lock stud to trim cases, an inside/outside case mouth chamber tool, primer pocket cleaner, and a tube of premium sizing lube. You also get one Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing. This bushing makes changing dies a snap and accomplish the task in seconds. Once mounted on your die, you'll never have to adjust the die again unless you want to. It saves time, eliminates guesswork and ensures the consistency of your reloaded product. You spend less time fiddling and more time cranking out rounds. To use the case cutter and lock stud a specific shell holder and case length gauge is needed for each caliber to be trimmed.", "text": "Lee Precision 50th Anniversary Reloading Kit At the heart of the Lee Precision Anniversary Challenger II Kit is the Challenger Press, a strong O-frame press with a larger-than-average opening angled at 30° for maximum hand clearance. Compound leverage easily performs full-length sizing on even the largest magnum cases. There’s a built-in, easy-to-empty primer catcher. Complete powder-handling system, including the precise Perfect Powder Measure. Case preparation tools include a cutter and lock stud to trim cases, an inside/outside case mouth chamber tool, primer pocket cleaner, and a tube of premium sizing lube. You also get one Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing. This bushing makes changing dies a snap and accomplish the task in seconds. Once mounted on your die, you'll never have to adjust the die again unless you want to. It saves time, eliminates guesswork and ensures the consistency of your reloaded product. You spend less time fiddling and more time cranking out rounds. To use the case cutter and lock stud a specific shell holder and case length gauge is needed for each caliber to be trimmed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CC5xpzeLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RM3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 124.51}}
{"item_id": "B00162RMA2", "title": "Glock Knife w/Olive Polymer Handle", "description": "GLOCK INC Field Knives Glock Knife w/Olive Polymer Handle Field knives are best known for their outstanding ruggedness which offer a large range of applications starting from a \"first aid\" knife inside the car to a bone crushing knife for hunters. The cross bar protects the hand against injuries and can be used as thumb rest and as bottle opener. Glock knives are sturdy enough to break windows or ammunition boxes, requirements by Armed Forces among many others. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: KO17678 Category: KNIVES & ACCESSORIES Type :Field Knife Blade Type :Clip Point Blade Length :6 1/2\" Length :11.4\" Steel :Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate treated Handle Material :Olive Polymer Weight :7.27 oz Sheath :Olive Polymer Edge Type :Plain Closed Length :", "text": "Glock Knife w/Olive Polymer Handle GLOCK INC Field Knives Glock Knife w/Olive Polymer Handle Field knives are best known for their outstanding ruggedness which offer a large range of applications starting from a \"first aid\" knife inside the car to a bone crushing knife for hunters. The cross bar protects the hand against injuries and can be used as thumb rest and as bottle opener. Glock knives are sturdy enough to break windows or ammunition boxes, requirements by Armed Forces among many others. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: KO17678 Category: KNIVES & ACCESSORIES Type :Field Knife Blade Type :Clip Point Blade Length :6 1/2\" Length :11.4\" Steel :Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate treated Handle Material :Olive Polymer Weight :7.27 oz Sheath :Olive Polymer Edge Type :Plain Closed Length :", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213ShMkqJaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RMA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 36.27}}
{"item_id": "B00162RMAM", "title": "Glock Serrated Edge Knife w/Black Handle", "description": "GLOCK INC Field Knife/Saw Glock Serrated Edge Knife w/Black Handle Glock outdoor equipment was specially developed and tested according to army requirements and is used by military units throughout the world. Material know how guarantees durability and reliability. The Field Knife 81 is equipped with a sturdy saw at the back of the blade and comes with a safety sheath. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: KB17581 Category: KNIVES & ACCESSORIES Type :Field Knife W/Saw Blade Type :Clip Point Blade Length :6 1/2\" Length :11.4\" Steel :Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate treated Handle Material :Black Polymer Weight :7.13 oz Sheath :Black Polymer Edge Type :Serrated Closed Length :", "text": "Glock Serrated Edge Knife w/Black Handle GLOCK INC Field Knife/Saw Glock Serrated Edge Knife w/Black Handle Glock outdoor equipment was specially developed and tested according to army requirements and is used by military units throughout the world. Material know how guarantees durability and reliability. The Field Knife 81 is equipped with a sturdy saw at the back of the blade and comes with a safety sheath. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: KB17581 Category: KNIVES & ACCESSORIES Type :Field Knife W/Saw Blade Type :Clip Point Blade Length :6 1/2\" Length :11.4\" Steel :Spring Steel HRC55 Phosphate treated Handle Material :Black Polymer Weight :7.13 oz Sheath :Black Polymer Edge Type :Serrated Closed Length :", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2B8IHhTcLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RMAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.0}}
{"item_id": "B00162RMXE", "title": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for S&W J Frame 640 Cent 2 1/8-Inch .357 (Natural, Ambi)", "description": "While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "text": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for S&W J Frame 640 Cent 2 1/8-Inch .357 (Natural, Ambi) While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510Le37ABBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RMXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 22.36}}
{"item_id": "B00162RMXY", "title": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for KAHR MK40, MK9, PM40, PM9 (Natural, Ambi)", "description": "While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "text": "Galco Pocket Protector Holster for KAHR MK40, MK9, PM40, PM9 (Natural, Ambi) While limiting the carrier to a relatively small handgun, pocket carry offers some unique advantages. Not only is the handgun completely covered and concealed, but the gun carrier can casually place a hand on the holstered/pocketed pistol if a nonspecific threat materializes – and the fastest draw is to have the gun already in hand. The Pocket Protector holster is designed for front pocket carry in pants or a jacket. The Pocket Protector keeps the firearm in the same general position so you can quickly locate the grip when you need to draw, conceals the shape of the gun so that its outline is not printed through the pants, and allows one-handed release of gun from both pocket and holster. Reinforcements at the holster mouth and beneath the trigger guard keep the holster stiff enough to allow a smooth draw and easy return to the holster, while also maintaining enough rigidity to prevent “printing” and shifting of the handgun. The holster’s hooked shape – at the base of the handgun’s trigger guard – is designed to catch on the pocket so that, with practice (using an unloaded firearm) and while using the proper pants, you can draw the firearm while the holster remains in your pocket or falls away. The Pocket Protector is ambidextrous and constructed of premium Center Cut Steerhide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kLEsJPSwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RMXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 24.19}}
{"item_id": "B00162RN2O", "title": "Kel-Tec P3At/P32 Grip Ext Blk", "description": "The Kel-Tec model #P32/P3AT-309 Magazine Grip Extension is designed to replace the original flat bottom floor plate of magazines for the KelTec model P-32 (.32 Auto) and P-3AT (.380 Auto) pistols. The Grip Extension increases the length of the magazine providing extra room to grip the pistol with one additional finger for better shooting control and comfort (does NOT increase the capacity of the magazine). For uniform shooting a Grip Extension should be installed on each magazine, so the grip is the same no matter which of your magazines is inserted in the pistol. Order yours today!", "text": "Kel-Tec P3At/P32 Grip Ext Blk The Kel-Tec model #P32/P3AT-309 Magazine Grip Extension is designed to replace the original flat bottom floor plate of magazines for the KelTec model P-32 (.32 Auto) and P-3AT (.380 Auto) pistols. The Grip Extension increases the length of the magazine providing extra room to grip the pistol with one additional finger for better shooting control and comfort (does NOT increase the capacity of the magazine). For uniform shooting a Grip Extension should be installed on each magazine, so the grip is the same no matter which of your magazines is inserted in the pistol. Order yours today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yffZwoVZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RN2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kel Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 6.8}}
{"item_id": "B00162RN38", "title": "Mako 1-Inch Tactical Light/Laser Adapter", "description": "Efficient and easy to attach with quick release mechanism. Special angle-lip design for easy light insertion. Special shape for easy activation of the mounted device. MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer composite. Light not included . See also PLA 3/4 - for 3/4\" lights See also PLA 1 1/8 - for 1 1/8\" lights", "text": "Mako 1-Inch Tactical Light/Laser Adapter Efficient and easy to attach with quick release mechanism. Special angle-lip design for easy light insertion. Special shape for easy activation of the mounted device. MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer composite. Light not included . See also PLA 3/4 - for 3/4\" lights See also PLA 1 1/8 - for 1 1/8\" lights", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t37b9nztL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RN38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B00162ROO6", "title": "Lee Precision Case Collator", "description": "Lee Case Collator fits on top of the Case Feeder, makes filling the tubes faster on the Pro 1000 and Load-Master Presses. Does not include the case feed tubes.", "text": "Lee Precision Case Collator Lee Case Collator fits on top of the Case Feeder, makes filling the tubes faster on the Pro 1000 and Load-Master Presses. Does not include the case feed tubes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KV98xKYhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162ROO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.23}}
{"item_id": "B00162RP40", "title": "HiViz Remington ETA Fiber Optic Sight", "description": "The ETA is a specially designed magnetic base sight configured and optimized for use with Remington shotguns.", "text": "HiViz Remington ETA Fiber Optic Sight The ETA is a specially designed magnetic base sight configured and optimized for use with Remington shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aMbWG5R5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RP40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.18}}
{"item_id": "B00162RP5E", "title": "HiViz Glock Sight Tool", "description": "Installation of HiViz front sights on Glock pistols is made easy with our new Glock tool. Simply remove the pistol's slide and push the factory sight out from its press-fit mount. Using our Glock tool and the screw supplied with our Glock sights, replace the sight. The entire operation takes minutes.", "text": "HiViz Glock Sight Tool Installation of HiViz front sights on Glock pistols is made easy with our new Glock tool. Simply remove the pistol's slide and push the factory sight out from its press-fit mount. Using our Glock tool and the screw supplied with our Glock sights, replace the sight. The entire operation takes minutes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31itFfkk2GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RP5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.46}}
{"item_id": "B00162RPDG", "title": "Lee Precision Adjustable Charge Bar", "description": "Lee Adjustable Charge Bar is used in place of the Charge Disk on the Auto Disk and Pro Auto Disk Powder Measures. Adjustable between .28 cc and 1.6 cc", "text": "Lee Precision Adjustable Charge Bar Lee Adjustable Charge Bar is used in place of the Charge Disk on the Auto Disk and Pro Auto Disk Powder Measures. Adjustable between .28 cc and 1.6 cc", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yhKUFmW3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RPDG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.65}}
{"item_id": "B00162RPFE", "title": "Lee Precision LA II Primer Feed", "description": "Lee Primer Feed for the Load-All II, for an even faster, more convenient way to reload. The primer feed is not automatic, you need to lift the trough where it fits into the press each time you want to dispense a new primer. Federal primers work the best through this primer feed. Note: this primer feed will not work on the original Load All with the metal base.", "text": "Lee Precision LA II Primer Feed Lee Primer Feed for the Load-All II, for an even faster, more convenient way to reload. The primer feed is not automatic, you need to lift the trough where it fits into the press each time you want to dispense a new primer. Federal primers work the best through this primer feed. Note: this primer feed will not work on the original Load All with the metal base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31noneo2m9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RPFE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 0.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162RPV8", "title": "Lee Precision 0.452 New Lube and Size Kit", "description": "Lee .452 Lube and Size Kit lubricates and sizes cast bullets, also seats and crimps gas checks. Fits any standard 7/8x14 thread reloading press.", "text": "Lee Precision 0.452 New Lube and Size Kit Lee .452 Lube and Size Kit lubricates and sizes cast bullets, also seats and crimps gas checks. Fits any standard 7/8x14 thread reloading press.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aLhtU9WNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RPV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.49}}
{"item_id": "B00162RW4I", "title": "Lee Precision Commercial Mold Handles", "description": "Lee Commercial Mold Handles fits Lee 6-Cavity Molds, also most other brands of single and double cavity molds.", "text": "Lee Precision Commercial Mold Handles Lee Commercial Mold Handles fits Lee 6-Cavity Molds, also most other brands of single and double cavity molds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qlV9Q4mRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RW4I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.29}}
{"item_id": "B00162RW66", "title": "Lee Precision Reloading Stand", "description": "Introducing the Lee Reloading Stand; Perfect for the reloader with limited working space or an overwhelmed workbench. The sturdy powder coated steel stand places your press at the perfect counter stool or standing height. Three-leg design assures absolute stability regardless of the floor condition. Rubber tipped legs suitable for any surface even carpeting. The thick steel top is fitted with the patented, quick change Lee Bench Plate System with pre-drilled steel base block to fit all Lee metallic presses. There’s more, the stand includes a sturdy steel shelf with two bench plate receivers that will neatly and securely store your extra presses or mountable accessories. Included with the stand is one storage bin for component or tool storage, which clips on to the steel bin bracket provided with the stand. Each leg has eight mounting holes that allow you to accessorize your stand with a multitude of bins, shelves or accessory racks. Includes drawing to customize and make your own extended work surface. Dimensions: 39\" high x 26\" wide x 24\" deep.", "text": "Lee Precision Reloading Stand Introducing the Lee Reloading Stand; Perfect for the reloader with limited working space or an overwhelmed workbench. The sturdy powder coated steel stand places your press at the perfect counter stool or standing height. Three-leg design assures absolute stability regardless of the floor condition. Rubber tipped legs suitable for any surface even carpeting. The thick steel top is fitted with the patented, quick change Lee Bench Plate System with pre-drilled steel base block to fit all Lee metallic presses. There’s more, the stand includes a sturdy steel shelf with two bench plate receivers that will neatly and securely store your extra presses or mountable accessories. Included with the stand is one storage bin for component or tool storage, which clips on to the steel bin bracket provided with the stand. Each leg has eight mounting holes that allow you to accessorize your stand with a multitude of bins, shelves or accessory racks. Includes drawing to customize and make your own extended work surface. Dimensions: 39\" high x 26\" wide x 24\" deep.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LDYb7q2RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162RW66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162S44A", "title": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves Ruger P85 P89 P90 P91", "description": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves give you more control and accuracy with your Ruger P85, P89, P90 or P91. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips give you the real control you need for fast, accurate shooting. The proportioned finger grooves and non-slip rubber of this Wrap-Around Grip give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits any Ruger P85, P89, P90 or P91; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves, Ruger P85, P89, P90, P91", "text": "Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves Ruger P85 P89 P90 P91 Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves give you more control and accuracy with your Ruger P85, P89, P90 or P91. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips give you the real control you need for fast, accurate shooting. The proportioned finger grooves and non-slip rubber of this Wrap-Around Grip give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits any Ruger P85, P89, P90 or P91; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber Wraparound Grips With Finger Grooves, Ruger P85, P89, P90, P91", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410ysuci8PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162S44A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.66}}
{"item_id": "B00162SAQ2", "title": "Lyman Brass Tapper Hammer", "description": "For gunsmithing and other delicate jobs, this hammer has three interchangeable heads including nylon, brass and steel. For delicate tapping, a knurled brass drift pin stores inside the handle.", "text": "Lyman Brass Tapper Hammer For gunsmithing and other delicate jobs, this hammer has three interchangeable heads including nylon, brass and steel. For delicate tapping, a knurled brass drift pin stores inside the handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DIeYrGdNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162SAQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.57}}
{"item_id": "B00162SAR6", "title": "Lyman Reloading Turbo Brite Brass Polish (20-Ounce)", "description": "Turbo Brite Brass Polish is ideal for use as an additive when using untreated Corncob or Nutshell. Also works with treated media to bring brass to a high luster shine.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Turbo Brite Brass Polish (20-Ounce) Turbo Brite Brass Polish is ideal for use as an additive when using untreated Corncob or Nutshell. Also works with treated media to bring brass to a high luster shine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mjQWJ3d5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162SAR6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.59}}
{"item_id": "B00162SB3E", "title": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 417T for Mossberg 500", "description": "These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 417T for Mossberg 500 These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313yx1EsvBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162SB3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B00162SBBQ", "title": "Gunslick 1-Piece 36-Inch Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod (.270 and Larger Calibers)", "description": "All one-piece Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rods from Gunslick Pro are extremely strong, straight and 36\" in length. Carbon fiber rod eliminates particle pickup and possible damage to your barrel. Soft grip handles designed for comfort and efficient cleaning. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "text": "Gunslick 1-Piece 36-Inch Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod (.270 and Larger Calibers) All one-piece Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rods from Gunslick Pro are extremely strong, straight and 36\" in length. Carbon fiber rod eliminates particle pickup and possible damage to your barrel. Soft grip handles designed for comfort and efficient cleaning. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11%2BkrjpCwoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162SBBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00162TC5U", "title": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service. No hardware included.", "text": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service. No hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318kz7gMPsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TC5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 50.19}}
{"item_id": "B00162TC6O", "title": "Hogue Stock Forend Adapter Nut For Mossberg 835 Model & 6.75-Inch Forend Tubes", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Forend Adapter Nut For Mossberg 835 Model & 6.75-Inch Forend Tubes OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S-lhLmeAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TC6O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 11.4}}
{"item_id": "B00162TCBO", "title": "SigTac Magazine Pouch fits SIGP226 and P229, 9mm", "description": "Manufactured using the same durable, black polymer as our holsters, these Double Magazine Pouches feature a paddle back and give you a comfortable, contoured fit. Features: Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.). Fully adjustable for magazine tension and cant, Adjusts with simple Allen key. Fits: Sig Sauer P226 9mm, .40, .357, Sig Sauer P229 9mm", "text": "SigTac Magazine Pouch fits SIGP226 and P229, 9mm Manufactured using the same durable, black polymer as our holsters, these Double Magazine Pouches feature a paddle back and give you a comfortable, contoured fit. Features: Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.). Fully adjustable for magazine tension and cant, Adjusts with simple Allen key. Fits: Sig Sauer P226 9mm, .40, .357, Sig Sauer P229 9mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XOZ6kNz%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TCBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.3}}
{"item_id": "B00162TDHM", "title": "Galco M7X Matrix for KAHR K40, K9 (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "The M7X Matrix model features the same fine qualities as the other Matrix holsters. It is a durable thermoplastic holster that is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free. The M7X is also fast, very concealable, and easy on the budget. Setting it apart from other thermoplastic belt holsters, the patent-pending snap-on belt loops of the M7X – similar to those found on our deluxe Side Snap Scabbard – make it fast and easy to attach and remove from the belt. The M7X is a strong side belt holster that uses a butt-forward cant to enhance concealability. The open top makes the draw quick and easy, while the lateral tension when worn does an amazing job of retaining the pistol securely. Unlike so many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M7X features easy on/off belt loops that fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols, the M7X is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco M7X Matrix for KAHR K40, K9 (Black, Right-hand) The M7X Matrix model features the same fine qualities as the other Matrix holsters. It is a durable thermoplastic holster that is lightweight, comfortable, and nearly maintenance free. The M7X is also fast, very concealable, and easy on the budget. Setting it apart from other thermoplastic belt holsters, the patent-pending snap-on belt loops of the M7X – similar to those found on our deluxe Side Snap Scabbard – make it fast and easy to attach and remove from the belt. The M7X is a strong side belt holster that uses a butt-forward cant to enhance concealability. The open top makes the draw quick and easy, while the lateral tension when worn does an amazing job of retaining the pistol securely. Unlike so many other harsh, mechanical-looking plastic holsters, the Matrix resembles a hand-molded Galco leather holster. The M7X features easy on/off belt loops that fit belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols, the M7X is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B1pv9y5FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TDHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 31.28}}
{"item_id": "B00162TEGC", "title": "Tapco Pack of 20 AR Cleaning Stars", "description": "The AR requires clean chamber lugs to function properly. Attached to your standard bore brush, they quickly clean this often neglected area.", "text": "Tapco Pack of 20 AR Cleaning Stars The AR requires clean chamber lugs to function properly. Attached to your standard bore brush, they quickly clean this often neglected area.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KIQDu3%2BeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TEGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B00162TEOE", "title": "Lee Precision Deluxe .308 3-Die Rifle Set (Grey)", "description": "The Lee Precision 308 3-Die Deluxe Set includes Full Length Sizing Die which need lubrication. Also includes Collet Die which sizes the neck, Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, and Universal Shell Holder. Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data", "text": "Lee Precision Deluxe .308 3-Die Rifle Set (Grey) The Lee Precision 308 3-Die Deluxe Set includes Full Length Sizing Die which need lubrication. Also includes Collet Die which sizes the neck, Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, and Universal Shell Holder. Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KWOzBQ1dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TEOE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 31.81}}
{"item_id": "B00162TEWG", "title": "Lee Precision 9-mm Carbide 4-Die Set Luger (Grey)", "description": "The Lee Precision 9MM Luger Pistol 4-Die Set Come With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision 9-mm Carbide 4-Die Set Luger (Grey) The Lee Precision 9MM Luger Pistol 4-Die Set Come With Four Dies. This Includes Carbide Full Length Die, Bullet Seating Die, Powder Thru Expanding Die, and Universal Shell Holder. This Product also Includes Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zPSI7mPAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TEWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.35}}
{"item_id": "B00162TIXG", "title": "Lee Precision 9-mm Luger Loader", "description": "Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 9-mm Luger except a rubber mallet. The rubber mallet would need to be purchased seperately. Please note, the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "text": "Lee Precision 9-mm Luger Loader Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 9-mm Luger except a rubber mallet. The rubber mallet would need to be purchased seperately. Please note, the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51US6S6-peL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TIXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.26}}
{"item_id": "B00162TJBC", "title": "Lee Precision 7.62 X 54 R Loader", "description": "Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 7.62x54R Russian, except a rubber mallet. Please note: the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "text": "Lee Precision 7.62 X 54 R Loader Lee Loader is a complete reloading system, kit includes everything needed to reload 7.62x54R Russian, except a rubber mallet. Please note: the Classic Lee Loader neck sizes only. This is not recommended for semi, pump and lever action guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gEcfR4reL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TJBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 30.26}}
{"item_id": "B00162TJF8", "title": "Lee Precision Red Die Box Round", "description": "Lee Red Round Die Box, the perfect storage for your dies. Round box made of durable red plastic, holds four dies. Invert the bottom part of the box, and store your three or four hole turret with dies installed.", "text": "Lee Precision Red Die Box Round Lee Red Round Die Box, the perfect storage for your dies. Round box made of durable red plastic, holds four dies. Invert the bottom part of the box, and store your three or four hole turret with dies installed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fNvVMJ%2BHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TJF8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 4.29}}
{"item_id": "B00162TJNK", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Enhanced Colored Front Sight Set", "description": "Manufactured from composite material, the front sights are dimensionally identical to the originals and easily installed. The set includes five highly visible colors to allow faster target acquisition. Fits the AR15, M16 and M4.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Enhanced Colored Front Sight Set Manufactured from composite material, the front sights are dimensionally identical to the originals and easily installed. The set includes five highly visible colors to allow faster target acquisition. Fits the AR15, M16 and M4.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lJT6bLM4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162TJNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 6.52}}
{"item_id": "B00162UGUK", "title": "Lee Precision 7.62X54R Pacesetter Dies", "description": "Lee 7.62X54 Russian Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data. This die set includes a .308 expander. The 7.62 x 54 Russian load data has been developed around the .308 diameter. If your rifle has a .311 groove dimension, order the .311 expander here (part # LP90882", "text": "Lee Precision 7.62X54R Pacesetter Dies Lee 7.62X54 Russian Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data. This die set includes a .308 expander. The 7.62 x 54 Russian load data has been developed around the .308 diameter. If your rifle has a .311 groove dimension, order the .311 expander here (part # LP90882", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Vv0mgTc8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162UGUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B00162UHKO", "title": "Lee Precision 7.62X39R Pacesetter Dies", "description": "Lee 7.62X39 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data. Includes expander for both the .308 and .311.", "text": "Lee Precision 7.62X39R Pacesetter Dies Lee 7.62X39 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data. Includes expander for both the .308 and .311.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VXGGblXaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162UHKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 37.0}}
