{"item_id": "B00162UM04", "title": "Tapco SKS Gas Piston", "description": "When the gas system fails to cycle, your SKS will only function as a bolt action rifle. Replacing your original gas piston with this high quality model will ensure years of successful performance. Exceeding original specifications, TAPCO's gas piston is machined from high strength stainless steel. This item is marked as “TAPCO USA” and counts as 1 U.S. Sec 922r compliant part. Features & Benefits: -Manufactured in the US by TAPCO -Dependable Functionality-Counts as 1 Sec 922r Compliant Part-Lifetime Guarantee.", "text": "Tapco SKS Gas Piston When the gas system fails to cycle, your SKS will only function as a bolt action rifle. Replacing your original gas piston with this high quality model will ensure years of successful performance. Exceeding original specifications, TAPCO's gas piston is machined from high strength stainless steel. This item is marked as “TAPCO USA” and counts as 1 U.S. Sec 922r compliant part. Features & Benefits: -Manufactured in the US by TAPCO -Dependable Functionality-Counts as 1 Sec 922r Compliant Part-Lifetime Guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2130A3ro0tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00162UM04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 35.0}}
