{"item_id": "B00165P4WC", "title": "Avenir Bigmouth Velcro Seat Bag (Medium- 55/73 Cubic Inches)", "description": "The Avenir Big Mouth Velcro seat bag offers ample room to tote all of those small essentials on your next ride. A wide, full-zip mouth opening enables easy access, while Velcro seat post attachment and over-the-rail straps let you affix it to your bike in moments. Rugged, 1682-denier nylon material stands up to the elements, and a rubberized bottom further boosts overall durability. A reflective light-mounting tab enhances safety, while the zippered compartment expands for added storage -- 55 cubic inches in standard configuration, and 73 cubic inches when expanded.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Bigmouth Velcro Seat Bag (Medium- 55/73 Cubic Inches) The Avenir Big Mouth Velcro seat bag offers ample room to tote all of those small essentials on your next ride. A wide, full-zip mouth opening enables easy access, while Velcro seat post attachment and over-the-rail straps let you affix it to your bike in moments. Rugged, 1682-denier nylon material stands up to the elements, and a rubberized bottom further boosts overall durability. A reflective light-mounting tab enhances safety, while the zippered compartment expands for added storage -- 55 cubic inches in standard configuration, and 73 cubic inches when expanded.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UaaJGpbyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165P4WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]], "price": 12.39}}
