{"item_id": "B00165P52Q", "title": "Avenir Comfy Soft Grips (Black/Grey, 137mm)", "description": "Minimize fatigue in your hands, wrists, and elbows on long rides with these comfortable, soft-grip handlebar grips from bicycle accessory maker Avenir. Soft foam, a firm inner core, cushioned Krayton outer surface, and ergonomic shaping combine to optimize comfort and absorb shock. Each grip is 138 millimeters long.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Comfy Soft Grips (Black/Grey, 137mm) Minimize fatigue in your hands, wrists, and elbows on long rides with these comfortable, soft-grip handlebar grips from bicycle accessory maker Avenir. Soft foam, a firm inner core, cushioned Krayton outer surface, and ergonomic shaping combine to optimize comfort and absorb shock. Each grip is 138 millimeters long.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rHdaZZb9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165P52Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 4.49}}
