{"item_id": "B00165P5GM", "title": "Avenir Home Mechanic's Tool Kit", "description": "Fix your bike at home with the comprehensive Home Mechanic's Tool Kit from Avenir. Coming neatly organized and contained in a sturdy and compact carry case, this tool kit provides every tool you need for most bike repairs, revamps, and builds.Tool Kit Contents:Hex wrenches: 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, and 6-millimeterOpen ended wrench: 9 and 10-millimeter ends6-inch adjustable wrenchHeadset wrench: 30/32 and 36/40-millimeter endsCone wrenches: 13/15 and 14/16-millimeter endsChain whipCassette lockring removerBottom bracket removal toolCrank bolt/pedal combo wrenchCrank extractorChain toolUniversal spoke wrenchScrewdriver with two sizes of standard and Phillips bitsUniversal pin spannerThree tire leversPatch kit", "text": "Avenir Home Mechanic's Tool Kit Fix your bike at home with the comprehensive Home Mechanic's Tool Kit from Avenir. Coming neatly organized and contained in a sturdy and compact carry case, this tool kit provides every tool you need for most bike repairs, revamps, and builds.Tool Kit Contents:Hex wrenches: 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, and 6-millimeterOpen ended wrench: 9 and 10-millimeter ends6-inch adjustable wrenchHeadset wrench: 30/32 and 36/40-millimeter endsCone wrenches: 13/15 and 14/16-millimeter endsChain whipCassette lockring removerBottom bracket removal toolCrank bolt/pedal combo wrenchCrank extractorChain toolUniversal spoke wrenchScrewdriver with two sizes of standard and Phillips bitsUniversal pin spannerThree tire leversPatch kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51L-vYb9knL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165P5GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 67.98}}
