{"item_id": "B00165PA08", "title": "Avenir Rear Road Bike Rack (Black, 700c)", "description": "The Avenir Rear Road Bike Rack fits most ATB, road, and hybrid bikes of various sizes. Durable cromoly aluminum construction with vinyl-coated handles, along with stainless-steel hardware, accommodate loads up to 25 pounds, and the top rails accept most panniers (sold separately).About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Rear Road Bike Rack (Black, 700c) The Avenir Rear Road Bike Rack fits most ATB, road, and hybrid bikes of various sizes. Durable cromoly aluminum construction with vinyl-coated handles, along with stainless-steel hardware, accommodate loads up to 25 pounds, and the top rails accept most panniers (sold separately).About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uim2wQNYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165PA08.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 16.98}}
