{"item_id": "B00165Q4QM", "title": "Avenir Excursion Large Panniers (1, 700 Cubic Inches total)", "description": "Equipped with 1,700 cubic inches of storage space, these Avenir Excursion panniers hold everything from groceries to books to bicycle equipment. The panniers are made of tough 600-denier nylon, with an adjustable nylon strap mounting system that keeps them securely fastened to the rear of your bike. The two main compartments, meanwhile, are large enough for water bottles, clothes, food, and a host of other items. Other details include six 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, integrated ripstop nylon rain covers with drawstring tops and fully taped seams, generous reflective stripes for dimly lit days, and a rear light attachment clip on each bag. Avenir Excursion panniers are also available in a smaller version with 1,464 cubic inches of storage space.", "text": "Avenir Excursion Large Panniers (1, 700 Cubic Inches total) Equipped with 1,700 cubic inches of storage space, these Avenir Excursion panniers hold everything from groceries to books to bicycle equipment. The panniers are made of tough 600-denier nylon, with an adjustable nylon strap mounting system that keeps them securely fastened to the rear of your bike. The two main compartments, meanwhile, are large enough for water bottles, clothes, food, and a host of other items. Other details include six 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, integrated ripstop nylon rain covers with drawstring tops and fully taped seams, generous reflective stripes for dimly lit days, and a rear light attachment clip on each bag. Avenir Excursion panniers are also available in a smaller version with 1,464 cubic inches of storage space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511apERJA9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q4QM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 64.99}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q4QW", "title": "Avenir Excursion QR Handlebar Bag (484 cubic inches of storage)", "description": "Haul along your bike gear without wearing a cumbersome backpack with the Avenir Excursion QR handlebar bag. The Excursion is made of tough 600-denier cordura, with a sturdy mounting system that attaches securely to your bike's handlebar. The large main compartment, meanwhile, holds everything from a bike pump to a picnic lunch. Other details include a 420-denier ripstop outer pocket, a top-mounted map pocket, front reflective piping, and reflective zipper pulls. The Excursion QR offers 484 cubic inches of storage space.", "text": "Avenir Excursion QR Handlebar Bag (484 cubic inches of storage) Haul along your bike gear without wearing a cumbersome backpack with the Avenir Excursion QR handlebar bag. The Excursion is made of tough 600-denier cordura, with a sturdy mounting system that attaches securely to your bike's handlebar. The large main compartment, meanwhile, holds everything from a bike pump to a picnic lunch. Other details include a 420-denier ripstop outer pocket, a top-mounted map pocket, front reflective piping, and reflective zipper pulls. The Excursion QR offers 484 cubic inches of storage space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bt8Lpm-xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q4QW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 29.39}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q4RG", "title": "Avenir Excursion Small Panniers (1, 464 Cubic Inches total)", "description": "Equipped with 1,464 cubic inches of storage space, these Avenir Excursion panniers hold everything from picnic lunches to bicycle gear. The panniers are made of tough 600-denier nylon, with an adjustable nylon strap mounting system that keeps them securely fastened to the rear of your bike. The two main compartments, meanwhile, are spacious and secure, so you can bring along several items without wearing a backpack. Other details include six 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, integrated ripstop nylon rain covers with drawstring tops and fully taped seams, generous reflective stripes for dimly lit days, and a rear light attachment clip on each bag. Avenir Excursion panniers are also available in a larger version with 1,700 cubic inches of storage space.", "text": "Avenir Excursion Small Panniers (1, 464 Cubic Inches total) Equipped with 1,464 cubic inches of storage space, these Avenir Excursion panniers hold everything from picnic lunches to bicycle gear. The panniers are made of tough 600-denier nylon, with an adjustable nylon strap mounting system that keeps them securely fastened to the rear of your bike. The two main compartments, meanwhile, are spacious and secure, so you can bring along several items without wearing a backpack. Other details include six 420-denier ripstop nylon outer pockets, integrated ripstop nylon rain covers with drawstring tops and fully taped seams, generous reflective stripes for dimly lit days, and a rear light attachment clip on each bag. Avenir Excursion panniers are also available in a larger version with 1,700 cubic inches of storage space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dteM-yFcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q4RG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q4SU", "title": "Avenir Flo Dual Mini Pumps (Black)", "description": "Keep your bike tires fully inflated regardless of your valve type with the Avenir Flo dual mini bike pump. The pump boasts a two-way auto head that's compatible with both Schrader and Presta valves, making it an ideal choice for people who own more than one bike. Other features include a T-handle mounting bracket that attaches securely to your bike frame, a 6036-T6 alloy body with a CNC alloy locking lever, a co-molded Krayton-covered handle for comfort, and a silver/black color.", "text": "Avenir Flo Dual Mini Pumps (Black) Keep your bike tires fully inflated regardless of your valve type with the Avenir Flo dual mini bike pump. The pump boasts a two-way auto head that's compatible with both Schrader and Presta valves, making it an ideal choice for people who own more than one bike. Other features include a T-handle mounting bracket that attaches securely to your bike frame, a 6036-T6 alloy body with a CNC alloy locking lever, a co-molded Krayton-covered handle for comfort, and a silver/black color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gpsLayEvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q4SU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q8ZO", "title": "Avenir Metro 2.0 Shopping Pannier (1, 100 - Cubic Inches)", "description": "The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro 2.0 pannier is perfect for urban riders who want to carry a single shopping bag home from the grocery store. This single pannier has an 1144 cubic inch capacity, and it features a solid bottom to protect your groceries, a stripe of reflective tape around the pannier, and a durable nylon mesh midsection. It fastens easily to your bike rack with a standard hook and strap mounting system. The lightweight, aluminum frame conveniently folds flat when not in use. Other features include a removable shoulder strap and a zippered pocket for wallet, keys, and other valuables.", "text": "Avenir Metro 2.0 Shopping Pannier (1, 100 - Cubic Inches) The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro 2.0 pannier is perfect for urban riders who want to carry a single shopping bag home from the grocery store. This single pannier has an 1144 cubic inch capacity, and it features a solid bottom to protect your groceries, a stripe of reflective tape around the pannier, and a durable nylon mesh midsection. It fastens easily to your bike rack with a standard hook and strap mounting system. The lightweight, aluminum frame conveniently folds flat when not in use. Other features include a removable shoulder strap and a zippered pocket for wallet, keys, and other valuables.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zDVLSzRIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q8ZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q908", "title": "Avenir Metro III Panniers (2, 165 Cubic Inches Total)", "description": "The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro III Panniers are spacious and can hold up to 2,165 cubic inches. Perfect for urban riders who need some extra storage space when on-the-move, each pannier is conveniently sized to fit a standard grocery bag. The panniers are made of strong, 420 denier nylon construction for durability and the ripstop dual outside pouches are ideal for securely storing items such as keys and cameras. The Metro III comes with an additional, large top pocket for more versatility and space. The denier nylon is lined with extensive reflective piping for increased visibility at night. The Avenir Metro III Panniers fasten easily to your bike rack with a standard hook and strap mounting system. The lightweight, aluminum frame conveniently folds flat when not in use.", "text": "Avenir Metro III Panniers (2, 165 Cubic Inches Total) The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro III Panniers are spacious and can hold up to 2,165 cubic inches. Perfect for urban riders who need some extra storage space when on-the-move, each pannier is conveniently sized to fit a standard grocery bag. The panniers are made of strong, 420 denier nylon construction for durability and the ripstop dual outside pouches are ideal for securely storing items such as keys and cameras. The Metro III comes with an additional, large top pocket for more versatility and space. The denier nylon is lined with extensive reflective piping for increased visibility at night. The Avenir Metro III Panniers fasten easily to your bike rack with a standard hook and strap mounting system. The lightweight, aluminum frame conveniently folds flat when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xTOhYLt-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q908.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 35.23}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q90I", "title": "Avenir Metro Panniers (1,380 Cubic-Inch Capacity)", "description": "The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro Panniers are spacious and can hold up to 1,380 cubic inches. Perfect for urban riders who need some convenient storage space when on-the-move, each pannier is conveniently sized to fit your necessities. The panniers are made of strong nylon construction for durability and features on large main compartment with internal pockets and a shoulder strap. Lined with reflective piping for increased visibility at night, the panniers attaches to your rack with two wide Velcro straps.", "text": "Avenir Metro Panniers (1,380 Cubic-Inch Capacity) The durable, well-constructed Avenir Metro Panniers are spacious and can hold up to 1,380 cubic inches. Perfect for urban riders who need some convenient storage space when on-the-move, each pannier is conveniently sized to fit your necessities. The panniers are made of strong nylon construction for durability and features on large main compartment with internal pockets and a shoulder strap. Lined with reflective piping for increased visibility at night, the panniers attaches to your rack with two wide Velcro straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XwbD6tvfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q90I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 33.98}}
