{"item_id": "B00165Q944", "title": "Avenir Premium Tube Presta Valve 700c Tube (700x20-25 27x1-1/8)", "description": "Home bike maintenance enthusiasts know that fixing the dreaded F-word -- a flat -- requires only the how-to knowledge, and keeping the right supplies on hand. Start with an Avenir Premium Tube with Presta valve.Specifications700c tubeFor 27-inch wheels20-25c1.125-inch width36-millimeter Presta valve0.9-millimeter thicknessAbout AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Premium Tube Presta Valve 700c Tube (700x20-25 27x1-1/8) Home bike maintenance enthusiasts know that fixing the dreaded F-word -- a flat -- requires only the how-to knowledge, and keeping the right supplies on hand. Start with an Avenir Premium Tube with Presta valve.Specifications700c tubeFor 27-inch wheels20-25c1.125-inch width36-millimeter Presta valve0.9-millimeter thicknessAbout AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51flvkV4YGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q944.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 3.04}}
