{"item_id": "B00165Q99Y", "title": "Avenir Thorn-Resistant Schrader valve MTB tube (26 x 1.95-2.125)", "description": "Nothing ruins a great trail ride like getting stranded on the side of the hill because your mountain bike has a flat. Be prepared to get moving again with this premium tube from bicycle accessory maker Avenir. Designed for use with standard 26-inch wheels, it has thorn-resistant durability for longer, safer rides, and includes a Schraeder valve.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Thorn-Resistant Schrader valve MTB tube (26 x 1.95-2.125) Nothing ruins a great trail ride like getting stranded on the side of the hill because your mountain bike has a flat. Be prepared to get moving again with this premium tube from bicycle accessory maker Avenir. Designed for use with standard 26-inch wheels, it has thorn-resistant durability for longer, safer rides, and includes a Schraeder valve.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413tuyh9x9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q99Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q9C6", "title": "Avenir Tightrope Cables (12mm / 7 feet)", "description": "Avenir tightrope cables covered, flexible straight cables ideal to secure both wheels and frame with any style padlock. Diameter 12-Millimeter, length 7-Feet. Padlock not included.", "text": "Avenir Tightrope Cables (12mm / 7 feet) Avenir tightrope cables covered, flexible straight cables ideal to secure both wheels and frame with any style padlock. Diameter 12-Millimeter, length 7-Feet. Padlock not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413THW--1HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q9C6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00165Q9F8", "title": "Avenir Deluxe Unicycle (20-Inch Wheel)", "description": "Improve your balance while enjoying a whole new form of exercise with the Raleigh deluxe 20-inch unicycle. The device offers such features as an oversized, chrome-plated steel frame, new and improved wheel mounts, and a cushioned seat with scuff-guard protection. More significantly, the unicycle is adjustable both up and down in addition to forward and backwards, letting you customize the saddle position for maximum comfort and riding ease. Other details include cotterless crank arms, full-sized nylon pedals with chromoly spindles, and oversized and sealed bearings that withstand heavy loads. The unicycle also comes in 16- and 24-inch sizes.", "text": "Avenir Deluxe Unicycle (20-Inch Wheel) Improve your balance while enjoying a whole new form of exercise with the Raleigh deluxe 20-inch unicycle. The device offers such features as an oversized, chrome-plated steel frame, new and improved wheel mounts, and a cushioned seat with scuff-guard protection. More significantly, the unicycle is adjustable both up and down in addition to forward and backwards, letting you customize the saddle position for maximum comfort and riding ease. Other details include cotterless crank arms, full-sized nylon pedals with chromoly spindles, and oversized and sealed bearings that withstand heavy loads. The unicycle also comes in 16- and 24-inch sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b3TNb3uCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00165Q9F8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 85.11}}
