{"item_id": "B00168NK9S", "title": "Coleman PowerChill Thermoelectric Cooler with Power Supply (40-Quart)", "description": "With a 40-quart interior that holds up to 44 cans of soda or beer in addition to snacks, the Coleman portable PowerChill thermoelectric cooler is ideal for the office, dorm, RV, truck, or car. The cooler is compatible with any vehicle's cigarette lighter. As a result, you can bring the PowerChill pretty much anywhere, from the campsite to the tailgater to your backyard BBQ. The PowerChill is equipped with a redesigned motor that provides quiet, long-lasting performance. The motor cools contents down to 40 degrees Fbelowthe surrounding temperature, so you don't have to fret once the ice starts melting in your standard cooler.The PowerChill includes several handy features, including a patented adjustable door that can open on both the right and left side, an adjustable shelf divider to keep things organized, and molded handles that make the cooler easy to lift and carry. The PowerChill even functions in two positions: upright or chest style. The PowerChill measures 15 by 21.75 by 17.125 inches (W x H x D).About ColemanMore than 100 years ago, a young man with an entrepreneurial spirit and a better idea began manufacturing lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. His name was W.C. Coleman, and the company he founded would change life in America. A man plagued with such poor vision he sometimes had to ask classmates to read aloud to him, Coleman saw a brilliant light in 1900 in a drugstore window that stopped him in his tracks. He inquired about the light inside and discovered he was able to read even the small print on a medicine bottle by the illumination. The lamps had mantles, not wicks, and were fueled by gasoline under pressure instead of coal oil. Soon afterward, Coleman started a lighting service that offered a \"no light, no pay\" clause--a big step forward for merchants who were burned by inferior products that rarely worked--and drew substantial interest from businesses that wanted to keep their lights on after dark.In the ensuing years, Coleman expanded its product line well beyond lanterns. The company's current catalog is thick with products that make spending time outdoors a pleasure. There are coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days on end, comfortable airbeds that won't deflate during the night, a complete line of LED lights that last for years, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and much, much more. Coleman has truly fashioned much of our outdoor camping experience, and expects to do so for generations to come.", "text": "Coleman PowerChill Thermoelectric Cooler with Power Supply (40-Quart) With a 40-quart interior that holds up to 44 cans of soda or beer in addition to snacks, the Coleman portable PowerChill thermoelectric cooler is ideal for the office, dorm, RV, truck, or car. The cooler is compatible with any vehicle's cigarette lighter. As a result, you can bring the PowerChill pretty much anywhere, from the campsite to the tailgater to your backyard BBQ. The PowerChill is equipped with a redesigned motor that provides quiet, long-lasting performance. The motor cools contents down to 40 degrees Fbelowthe surrounding temperature, so you don't have to fret once the ice starts melting in your standard cooler.The PowerChill includes several handy features, including a patented adjustable door that can open on both the right and left side, an adjustable shelf divider to keep things organized, and molded handles that make the cooler easy to lift and carry. The PowerChill even functions in two positions: upright or chest style. The PowerChill measures 15 by 21.75 by 17.125 inches (W x H x D).About ColemanMore than 100 years ago, a young man with an entrepreneurial spirit and a better idea began manufacturing lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. His name was W.C. Coleman, and the company he founded would change life in America. A man plagued with such poor vision he sometimes had to ask classmates to read aloud to him, Coleman saw a brilliant light in 1900 in a drugstore window that stopped him in his tracks. He inquired about the light inside and discovered he was able to read even the small print on a medicine bottle by the illumination. The lamps had mantles, not wicks, and were fueled by gasoline under pressure instead of coal oil. Soon afterward, Coleman started a lighting service that offered a \"no light, no pay\" clause--a big step forward for merchants who were burned by inferior products that rarely worked--and drew substantial interest from businesses that wanted to keep their lights on after dark.In the ensuing years, Coleman expanded its product line well beyond lanterns. The company's current catalog is thick with products that make spending time outdoors a pleasure. There are coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days on end, comfortable airbeds that won't deflate during the night, a complete line of LED lights that last for years, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and much, much more. Coleman has truly fashioned much of our outdoor camping experience, and expects to do so for generations to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PL7KwqMWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168NK9S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 122.11}}
{"item_id": "B00168NKR0", "title": "2 - Mantle Propane Lantern withcase", "description": "Porcelainized ventilator won't rust, lights with matches. The Coleman 2 - Mantle Propane Lantern withcase Has a stable base with retractable feet for compact storage.", "text": "2 - Mantle Propane Lantern withcase Porcelainized ventilator won't rust, lights with matches. The Coleman 2 - Mantle Propane Lantern withcase Has a stable base with retractable feet for compact storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KRwmtSDXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168NKR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 41.41}}
{"item_id": "B00168OD62", "title": "Coleman 4D Pack-Away LED Lantern", "description": "After dinner, when you head to the tent, light the way with the Coleman Pack-Away LED Lantern. Take the weather-resistant, protective collapsible lamp anywhere you need extra light. Choose from three settings: high, low, nightlight and off. With a runtime of up to 18 hours on high and 40 hours on low, your weekend trip will be over long before you need fresh batteries. The large handle makes it easy to carry anywhere, and the reduced-glare, cool-touch Cree LED lasts a lifetime, so it never needs to be replaced.", "text": "Coleman 4D Pack-Away LED Lantern After dinner, when you head to the tent, light the way with the Coleman Pack-Away LED Lantern. Take the weather-resistant, protective collapsible lamp anywhere you need extra light. Choose from three settings: high, low, nightlight and off. With a runtime of up to 18 hours on high and 40 hours on low, your weekend trip will be over long before you need fresh batteries. The large handle makes it easy to carry anywhere, and the reduced-glare, cool-touch Cree LED lasts a lifetime, so it never needs to be replaced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HIcvcVqWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168OD62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 35.28}}
{"item_id": "B00168PI4S", "title": "Coleman 5620B718G 5GAL BLU Water Carrier", "description": "Coleman, 5 Gallon, Blue, Polylite Water Carrier, Molded In Handle & Hand Grip, Fast Flow Spigot Stores On The Handle When Not In Use, Non-Insulated, Polyethylene Case Resists Scratches & Dents.", "text": "Coleman 5620B718G 5GAL BLU Water Carrier Coleman, 5 Gallon, Blue, Polylite Water Carrier, Molded In Handle & Hand Grip, Fast Flow Spigot Stores On The Handle When Not In Use, Non-Insulated, Polyethylene Case Resists Scratches & Dents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o89IV63%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168PI4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 11.54}}
{"item_id": "B00168QAGS", "title": "Coleman 4345-701 8D Family Size or Sized Lantern", "description": "8D Family Size Lantern, 3 Settings: High, Low & Nightlight, Runs 66 Hours On Low & 32 Hours On High, Cool Touch Led Keeps Lantern Cool, Weather Resistant, Durable Chrome Plated Rhino Guard, Uses 8 \"D\" Batteries, Not Included.", "text": "Coleman 4345-701 8D Family Size or Sized Lantern 8D Family Size Lantern, 3 Settings: High, Low & Nightlight, Runs 66 Hours On Low & 32 Hours On High, Cool Touch Led Keeps Lantern Cool, Weather Resistant, Durable Chrome Plated Rhino Guard, Uses 8 \"D\" Batteries, Not Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t9nv3dZrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168QAGS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 26.34}}
{"item_id": "B00168QW3Y", "title": "Coleman Jug 1-Gallon Insulated Jug", "description": "Great for sporting events, tailgating, picnics, BBQs and more, the Coleman 1-Gallon Jug features a flip-top spout for easy, no-leak sipping and pouring. The Jug's wide-mouth, twist-on cap makes it convenient to fill and clean, while the sturdy bail handle allows for comfortable carrying. The Jug liner was designed with the strongest and safest materials allowed by the FDA, and the rugged outside resists dents, scratches and fading. Color: Red.", "text": "Coleman Jug 1-Gallon Insulated Jug Great for sporting events, tailgating, picnics, BBQs and more, the Coleman 1-Gallon Jug features a flip-top spout for easy, no-leak sipping and pouring. The Jug's wide-mouth, twist-on cap makes it convenient to fill and clean, while the sturdy bail handle allows for comfortable carrying. The Jug liner was designed with the strongest and safest materials allowed by the FDA, and the rugged outside resists dents, scratches and fading. Color: Red.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wh3lhEzkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168QW3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 23.36}}
{"item_id": "B00168R85U", "title": "Valeo WV40 40-Pound Weighted Vest", "description": "Vest distributes weight evenly around torso to help improve cardiovascular conditioning and strength during workout. Made of durable breathable mesh with four adjustable front clip belts and removable 1 lb. weight packs for adjustment from 1-40 lbs. Reinforced shoulder padding and adjustable shoulder and side straps make for a more comfortable fit. Accented with reflective binding for improved visibility. One size fits most.", "text": "Valeo WV40 40-Pound Weighted Vest Vest distributes weight evenly around torso to help improve cardiovascular conditioning and strength during workout. Made of durable breathable mesh with four adjustable front clip belts and removable 1 lb. weight packs for adjustment from 1-40 lbs. Reinforced shoulder padding and adjustable shoulder and side straps make for a more comfortable fit. Accented with reflective binding for improved visibility. One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XRVXZsbyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168R85U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valeo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Vests"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00168SD5Y", "title": "Coleman Aluminum Tent Stakes", "description": "The Coleman Aluminum Tent Stakes are heavy-duty, so they'll keep your tent securely in place. They measure 9in long and are constructed of durable anodized aluminum. Long lasting materials in The Coleman Tent Stakes will keep them around for season after season. . Product ID: 270616, GTIN: 0076501926064, Model Number: 2000002075, Model Year: 2011", "text": "Coleman Aluminum Tent Stakes The Coleman Aluminum Tent Stakes are heavy-duty, so they'll keep your tent securely in place. They measure 9in long and are constructed of durable anodized aluminum. Long lasting materials in The Coleman Tent Stakes will keep them around for season after season. . Product ID: 270616, GTIN: 0076501926064, Model Number: 2000002075, Model Year: 2011", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OyxaXLT1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168SD5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B00168WR06", "title": "Coleman Fold and Go Camp Pillow (Small, Colors May Vary)", "description": "Combine the comfort of a traditional pillow with the compact size of a mini-pillow with the Coleman Fold and Go camping pillow. The Fold and Go measures 12 by 20 inches when open, but folds in half for compact packing and transport. As a result, it fits easily in your pack or suitcase, making it a great choice for camping and traveling. Most importantly, the pillow is soft and comfortable, with a poly/cotton construction.", "text": "Coleman Fold and Go Camp Pillow (Small, Colors May Vary) Combine the comfort of a traditional pillow with the compact size of a mini-pillow with the Coleman Fold and Go camping pillow. The Fold and Go measures 12 by 20 inches when open, but folds in half for compact packing and transport. As a result, it fits easily in your pack or suitcase, making it a great choice for camping and traveling. Most importantly, the pillow is soft and comfortable, with a poly/cotton construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41okxHzK-BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168WR06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 12.26}}
{"item_id": "B00168XMB4", "title": "Coleman 16-Piece Polycarbonate Cutlery Set", "description": "The Coleman Polycarbonate Cutlery Set is a great choice for camping, picnicking and tailgating. The set includes four each of knives, forks, tablespoons and teaspoons, Constructed of durable polycarbonate, they resist stains and odors and are dishwasher-safe.", "text": "Coleman 16-Piece Polycarbonate Cutlery Set The Coleman Polycarbonate Cutlery Set is a great choice for camping, picnicking and tailgating. The set includes four each of knives, forks, tablespoons and teaspoons, Constructed of durable polycarbonate, they resist stains and odors and are dishwasher-safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xHjZvE5hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168XMB4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 9.88}}
