{"item_id": "B00168YEK2", "title": "Coleman Stove Carry Case", "description": "Safely and easily transport your Coleman camp stove with the Coleman Stove Carry Case. Made of strong vinyl, with a comfortable web handle and durable zipper, the Carry Case will stand up to repeated use, keeping your stove secure for easy packing and transport. Two convenient built-in drawstring pouches provide a handy place to store propane cylinders (propane sold separately). This Carry Case fits the following Coleman stove models: 5430, 5435, 5433, 5466, 5469, 2000000492 and 2000000487.", "text": "Coleman Stove Carry Case Safely and easily transport your Coleman camp stove with the Coleman Stove Carry Case. Made of strong vinyl, with a comfortable web handle and durable zipper, the Carry Case will stand up to repeated use, keeping your stove secure for easy packing and transport. Two convenient built-in drawstring pouches provide a handy place to store propane cylinders (propane sold separately). This Carry Case fits the following Coleman stove models: 5430, 5435, 5433, 5466, 5469, 2000000492 and 2000000487.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fd9EzU46L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168YEK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 27.49}}
{"item_id": "B00168YEKC", "title": "Coleman Grill And Stove Carry Case", "description": "", "text": "Coleman Grill And Stove Carry Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zU5j9AD1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168YEKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 37.34}}
{"item_id": "B00168YEQ6", "title": "Coleman 9-Cup Aluminum Coffee Pot", "description": "The Coleman 9-Cup Aluminum Coffee Pot is great for the campsite, the picnic, or at home. Made of lightweight, durable aluminum, the coffee pot is rust-resistant and easy to clean. The pot has a bail handle for easy pouring, and the replaceable glass knob lets you see the coffee as it percolates. Coffee Pot has a 9-cup capacity.", "text": "Coleman 9-Cup Aluminum Coffee Pot The Coleman 9-Cup Aluminum Coffee Pot is great for the campsite, the picnic, or at home. Made of lightweight, durable aluminum, the coffee pot is rust-resistant and easy to clean. The pot has a bail handle for easy pouring, and the replaceable glass knob lets you see the coffee as it percolates. Coffee Pot has a 9-cup capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4146o%2BQIaPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00168YEQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 16.76}}
{"item_id": "B001691QYI", "title": "Coleman Fold N Go Grill Carry Case", "description": "Store, carry, and protect your Coleman Fold N Go Grill with this Carry Case. The Carry Case fits Coleman Fold N Go 5442 series stoves and Fold N Go models 2000001493, 2000001494, and 2000002027. It-Inchs durably constructed for a long life, with strong web handles for easy, comfortable carrying. Two convenient inside pockets provide a place to store utensils and other gear, while two exterior pouches are a handy place to store propane cylinders.", "text": "Coleman Fold N Go Grill Carry Case Store, carry, and protect your Coleman Fold N Go Grill with this Carry Case. The Carry Case fits Coleman Fold N Go 5442 series stoves and Fold N Go models 2000001493, 2000001494, and 2000002027. It-Inchs durably constructed for a long life, with strong web handles for easy, comfortable carrying. Two convenient inside pockets provide a place to store utensils and other gear, while two exterior pouches are a handy place to store propane cylinders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mHgf5bG%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001691QYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 30.61}}
{"item_id": "B00169962W", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits GlacierGel Blister and Burn Dressing, 6-Count Package", "description": "The next generation in blister dressings - Glacier Gelis easy to apply and stays in place up to four days. The waterproog, breathable adhesive gels are highly cusioning, cooling and absorbent which provides instant and complete pain relief. Includes alcohol wipes for skin preparation.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits GlacierGel Blister and Burn Dressing, 6-Count Package The next generation in blister dressings - Glacier Gelis easy to apply and stays in place up to four days. The waterproog, breathable adhesive gels are highly cusioning, cooling and absorbent which provides instant and complete pain relief. Includes alcohol wipes for skin preparation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bs5gTcuqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00169962W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 8.25}}
{"item_id": "B00169CU66", "title": "Total Gym XLS Trainer", "description": "Want to tone your entire body without buying a space-hogging fitness machine? Turn to the Total Gym XLS, a top-of-the-line device that helps you strengthen and sculpt every major muscle group in your body using a single glide board and a few handy attachments. The Total Gym XLS works by making you lift a percentage of your body weight against gravity, creating a smooth and fluid resistance. As your strength and conditioning improve, you increase the total resistance by boosting the incline, thus increasing the body weight lifted in the exercise. The Total Gym XLS not only works your upper body, but also your lower body, abdominals, and even your cardiovascular system. And by reducing body fat and increasing the proportion of lean muscle mass in your body, the strength training effectively turns up the thermostat so that your body burns calories constantly.The Total Gym XLS offers several upgrades over previous models, helping it set the standard for fitness excellence. The upgrades include a new pulley and cable system, an improved squat stand, and more comfortable padding on the glide board. The device also comes with several handy accessories that add a new dimension to your workout: leg pull accessory that works your quads, hamstrings, and other muscles; flexible nylon strap handles; and a wing attachment for toning various back and arm muscles. Combined, the accessories and glide board support up to 400 pounds, letting users with a variety of body types work on strength and stability.The Total Gym XLS also comes with a complete line of workouts and workout tools, taking the guesswork out of getting into shape. The workouts and tools include:The Total Gym XLS, which comes with a leg pull accessory, folds up compactly for storage.Start It Up: An introductory Total Gym XLS workout6-8 Minute Workout: 12 work-along workouts for men and women pressed for timeSmart Training Workout: An efficient workout employing slow, precise movements to target specific musclesBody Makeover for Total Gym: High-energy, high-powered workoutSimple at-a-glance exercise wall chart with 35 exercisesTotal Gym training deckDan Isaacson's nutritional program and meal planAbout Total GymTotal Gym made its initial mark in rehabilitation centers, where its main focus was aiding people recovering from physical injuries and obstacles. The device is the perfect rehabilitation tool for several reasons: the smooth, gliding motion is easy on the joints; the various height levels accommodate every fitness level; and the padded glide board provides excellent support for the back. After years of success in the rehabilitation field, the product's inventors introduced the product to Chuck Norris 30 years ago. Norris--who calls it his \"lean, mean exercise machine\"--still uses the Total Gym today as his primary home fitness device. Christie Brinkley has also been a devoted user for more than 10 years, and uses it to stay lean and fit even through two children and a hectic schedule.", "text": "Total Gym XLS Trainer Want to tone your entire body without buying a space-hogging fitness machine? Turn to the Total Gym XLS, a top-of-the-line device that helps you strengthen and sculpt every major muscle group in your body using a single glide board and a few handy attachments. The Total Gym XLS works by making you lift a percentage of your body weight against gravity, creating a smooth and fluid resistance. As your strength and conditioning improve, you increase the total resistance by boosting the incline, thus increasing the body weight lifted in the exercise. The Total Gym XLS not only works your upper body, but also your lower body, abdominals, and even your cardiovascular system. And by reducing body fat and increasing the proportion of lean muscle mass in your body, the strength training effectively turns up the thermostat so that your body burns calories constantly.The Total Gym XLS offers several upgrades over previous models, helping it set the standard for fitness excellence. The upgrades include a new pulley and cable system, an improved squat stand, and more comfortable padding on the glide board. The device also comes with several handy accessories that add a new dimension to your workout: leg pull accessory that works your quads, hamstrings, and other muscles; flexible nylon strap handles; and a wing attachment for toning various back and arm muscles. Combined, the accessories and glide board support up to 400 pounds, letting users with a variety of body types work on strength and stability.The Total Gym XLS also comes with a complete line of workouts and workout tools, taking the guesswork out of getting into shape. The workouts and tools include:The Total Gym XLS, which comes with a leg pull accessory, folds up compactly for storage.Start It Up: An introductory Total Gym XLS workout6-8 Minute Workout: 12 work-along workouts for men and women pressed for timeSmart Training Workout: An efficient workout employing slow, precise movements to target specific musclesBody Makeover for Total Gym: High-energy, high-powered workoutSimple at-a-glance exercise wall chart with 35 exercisesTotal Gym training deckDan Isaacson's nutritional program and meal planAbout Total GymTotal Gym made its initial mark in rehabilitation centers, where its main focus was aiding people recovering from physical injuries and obstacles. The device is the perfect rehabilitation tool for several reasons: the smooth, gliding motion is easy on the joints; the various height levels accommodate every fitness level; and the padded glide board provides excellent support for the back. After years of success in the rehabilitation field, the product's inventors introduced the product to Chuck Norris 30 years ago. Norris--who calls it his \"lean, mean exercise machine\"--still uses the Total Gym today as his primary home fitness device. Christie Brinkley has also been a devoted user for more than 10 years, and uses it to stay lean and fit even through two children and a hectic schedule.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4190KIb0ZnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00169CU66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Total Gym", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 675.0}}
{"item_id": "B00169OGX6", "title": "Cold Steel 4 Foot .625 Blowgun Big Bore Hunting Weapon", "description": "Cold Steel's blowguns are a lot of fun to shoot. They come with a target-style mouthpiece and three-millimeter-thick barrel -- almost twice as thick, and half again as heavy, as the company's standard models. This added weight and rigidity dramatically increases accuracy, not to mention durability, and the gun comes complete with a wide variety of darts for different shooting situations.A convenient quiver holds darts in an easy-access position.What's in the box?Four-foot blowgunMouthpieceRubber ferruleDart quiverQuiver guard36 darts:12 stun12 mini broadheadSix broadheadSix bambooWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel 4 Foot .625 Blowgun Big Bore Hunting Weapon Cold Steel's blowguns are a lot of fun to shoot. They come with a target-style mouthpiece and three-millimeter-thick barrel -- almost twice as thick, and half again as heavy, as the company's standard models. This added weight and rigidity dramatically increases accuracy, not to mention durability, and the gun comes complete with a wide variety of darts for different shooting situations.A convenient quiver holds darts in an easy-access position.What's in the box?Four-foot blowgunMouthpieceRubber ferruleDart quiverQuiver guard36 darts:12 stun12 mini broadheadSix broadheadSix bambooWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311bEJQEB1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00169OGX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 30.19}}
{"item_id": "B00169X7AO", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle BRV Beretta Vertec, Taurus 92, 99 w rail", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle BRV Beretta Vertec, Taurus 92, 99 w rail Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wq-81b-tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00169X7AO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.9}}
{"item_id": "B0016A283A", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle J357 Smith & Wesson All 38/357 J Frame / Rossi 88 / Charter Arms U.C. Lite .38", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle J357 Smith & Wesson All 38/357 J Frame / Rossi 88 / Charter Arms U.C. Lite .38 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GluCmhKyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016A283A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.62}}
{"item_id": "B0016AQ746", "title": "Ledge Sports FeatherLite +20 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20)", "description": "Built for size and weight restrictions on extended journeys. The Featherlite is regular size with premium fill. Temperature rating is a guage for experienced users who understand proper equipment use. Unlike other Ledge classic and oversize bags it is not a comfort rating but a guide for use.", "text": "Ledge Sports FeatherLite +20 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20) Built for size and weight restrictions on extended journeys. The Featherlite is regular size with premium fill. Temperature rating is a guage for experienced users who understand proper equipment use. Unlike other Ledge classic and oversize bags it is not a comfort rating but a guide for use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JYmGa2G0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016AQ746.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 79.37}}
{"item_id": "B0016B18US", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Traditional Black CORDURA 2-1/4 -Inch Nylon Belt Keeper - Set of 4", "description": "BLACKHAWK! is determined to givetheir customers choices where other companies give you limits. To further expand their selection of nylon duty gear, they are offering a more traditional, non-molded line of CORDURA nylon products, featuring the abrasion resistance and easy care that CORDURA is noted for. Their exclusive four-layer laminate CORDURA(R) nylon, waterproof closed-cell foam padding, flexile polymer-reinforced layer, and 150 denier knit lining will give you years of service at a price that fits any budget.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Traditional Black CORDURA 2-1/4 -Inch Nylon Belt Keeper - Set of 4 BLACKHAWK! is determined to givetheir customers choices where other companies give you limits. To further expand their selection of nylon duty gear, they are offering a more traditional, non-molded line of CORDURA nylon products, featuring the abrasion resistance and easy care that CORDURA is noted for. Their exclusive four-layer laminate CORDURA(R) nylon, waterproof closed-cell foam padding, flexile polymer-reinforced layer, and 150 denier knit lining will give you years of service at a price that fits any budget.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MNayYaBeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016B18US.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0016BH04Q", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness 40-in. Foldable Trampoline with Bar", "description": "Excellent low-impact aerobic workout Bar adjusts to 3 heights: 40, 45, and 50 inches Heavy-duty steel frame with 32 metal springs provides safe, strong jumping surface Legs are 1-inch diameter steel for superior strength Polypropylene jumping surface Folds into quarters; bag included for convenient storage and carrying Weight capacity: 250 lbs. Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee area for complete details About Sunny Health & Fitness Sunny Health & Fitness has been importing and distributing high-quality health and fitness products for over ten years. From their headquarters in Los Angeles, California, they import equipment from direct sources in Taiwan and China to provide more competitive pricing than the average health and fitness equipment distributor. Because they are committed to excellence and stand behind the quality of every one of their products, Sunny Health & Fitness has become one of the fastest-growing companies in the market. Folds into quarters for easy storage. Heavy-duty steel frame with 32 metal springs. Height-adjustable bar included. Weight capacity 250 lbs.. Dimensions: 41.5 diam. x 55H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness 40-in. Foldable Trampoline with Bar Excellent low-impact aerobic workout Bar adjusts to 3 heights: 40, 45, and 50 inches Heavy-duty steel frame with 32 metal springs provides safe, strong jumping surface Legs are 1-inch diameter steel for superior strength Polypropylene jumping surface Folds into quarters; bag included for convenient storage and carrying Weight capacity: 250 lbs. Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee area for complete details About Sunny Health & Fitness Sunny Health & Fitness has been importing and distributing high-quality health and fitness products for over ten years. From their headquarters in Los Angeles, California, they import equipment from direct sources in Taiwan and China to provide more competitive pricing than the average health and fitness equipment distributor. Because they are committed to excellence and stand behind the quality of every one of their products, Sunny Health & Fitness has become one of the fastest-growing companies in the market. Folds into quarters for easy storage. Heavy-duty steel frame with 32 metal springs. Height-adjustable bar included. Weight capacity 250 lbs.. Dimensions: 41.5 diam. x 55H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i%2BNzLRTKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BH04Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 65.78}}
{"item_id": "B0016BNDUQ", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Roller Slide", "description": "002 Features: -Roller slide.-Material: Plastic, steel.-Slim, tone, and firm your abdominal muscles with a compact roller slide.-Allows you to exercise your arms, shoulders, and back.-Small size makes it easy to store and transport.-Allows the abdominal to be isolated, causing an effective extension and contraction of the abs muscles.-Easy to use simply put your knees on the floor, grab a hold of the handle-bars and push forward.-Lightweight and portable. Includes: -Includes a mat for knees and instructions with various exercises. Assembly Instructions: -Assembly required.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Roller Slide 002 Features: -Roller slide.-Material: Plastic, steel.-Slim, tone, and firm your abdominal muscles with a compact roller slide.-Allows you to exercise your arms, shoulders, and back.-Small size makes it easy to store and transport.-Allows the abdominal to be isolated, causing an effective extension and contraction of the abs muscles.-Easy to use simply put your knees on the floor, grab a hold of the handle-bars and push forward.-Lightweight and portable. Includes: -Includes a mat for knees and instructions with various exercises. Assembly Instructions: -Assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lytjJWW%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BNDUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 21.09}}
{"item_id": "B0016BNDXI", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Door Way Chin Up", "description": "Door Way Chin Up Bar Set up in seconds on almost any door frame. For sit ups, press ups and others.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Door Way Chin Up Door Way Chin Up Bar Set up in seconds on almost any door frame. For sit ups, press ups and others.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21lvbocOz8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BNDXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 17.51}}
{"item_id": "B0016BQFSS", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Mini Stepper with Resistance Bands", "description": "012S Features: -Fitness device gives you low-impact aerobic workout.-LCD computer function: Scan, time, count, total count, calories.-Full body workout.-Resistance bands work the upper body while the steps work the lower body.-With speed, timer, steps, calorie counter.-Weight capacity: 220 lbs. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 8'' H x 12.25'' W x 16.5'' D, 16 lbs.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Mini Stepper with Resistance Bands 012S Features: -Fitness device gives you low-impact aerobic workout.-LCD computer function: Scan, time, count, total count, calories.-Full body workout.-Resistance bands work the upper body while the steps work the lower body.-With speed, timer, steps, calorie counter.-Weight capacity: 220 lbs. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 8'' H x 12.25'' W x 16.5'' D, 16 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41avMSlqeCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BQFSS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Step Machines"]], "price": 49.99}}
