{"item_id": "B0016BUR7I", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Twister Stepper", "description": "A compact, surprisingly versatile home fitness device, the Sunny Health & Fitness Twister Stepper is essentially a portable elliptical machine, with built-in resistance training. The twist action the device creates helps you tone thighs and buttocks, while achieving a challenging cardiovascular workout. Moving up and down and side to side, you'll work deep muscles in hard-to-reach places without putting undue stress on joints.Resistance is adjustable, and the exercise bands work the arms, chest, back, and shoulders for a total body workout. Heavy-duty steel construction will provide years of reliable use, and oversized, slip-resistant foot plates keep you firmly planted during your workout. An onboard computer with LCD display shows total count, time, calories burned, and rep count. The stepper can be used for 15 minutes each time, because the hydraulics may get over heat if they use it for over 15 minutes each time. The hydraulics will make noises if they are over heat, and the hydraulics can be damaged too. The Maintenance and Care Instructions in the manual, and this item is not made for commercial use.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Twister Stepper A compact, surprisingly versatile home fitness device, the Sunny Health & Fitness Twister Stepper is essentially a portable elliptical machine, with built-in resistance training. The twist action the device creates helps you tone thighs and buttocks, while achieving a challenging cardiovascular workout. Moving up and down and side to side, you'll work deep muscles in hard-to-reach places without putting undue stress on joints.Resistance is adjustable, and the exercise bands work the arms, chest, back, and shoulders for a total body workout. Heavy-duty steel construction will provide years of reliable use, and oversized, slip-resistant foot plates keep you firmly planted during your workout. An onboard computer with LCD display shows total count, time, calories burned, and rep count. The stepper can be used for 15 minutes each time, because the hydraulics may get over heat if they use it for over 15 minutes each time. The hydraulics will make noises if they are over heat, and the hydraulics can be damaged too. The Maintenance and Care Instructions in the manual, and this item is not made for commercial use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yZ8l8kdvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BUR7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Step Machines"]], "price": 63.66}}
{"item_id": "B0016BUR9G", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Tri-Fold Exercise Mat", "description": "Tri-folded for easy storage and travelSewn on handles for easy transportFolded dimensions: 23.5 x 23.5 x 5.5 inchesExtended dimensions: 24 x 72 x 2 inchesCase Pack: 4pcs/case (Sold INDIVIDUALLY - if you would like the CASE you will need to put a qty of 4 when adding to your cart)The inside is foam and the outside is nylon based.This item is made in China.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Tri-Fold Exercise Mat Tri-folded for easy storage and travelSewn on handles for easy transportFolded dimensions: 23.5 x 23.5 x 5.5 inchesExtended dimensions: 24 x 72 x 2 inchesCase Pack: 4pcs/case (Sold INDIVIDUALLY - if you would like the CASE you will need to put a qty of 4 when adding to your cart)The inside is foam and the outside is nylon based.This item is made in China.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wCY29A3WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016BUR9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0016CPE66", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2907D Hissatsu Knife, Desert Tan", "description": "2907D Hissatsu Law Enforcement, Military tactical Knife and Sheath System by Columbia River Knife and Tool was built for the professional. This model is the same as the 2907 except it has a blade and handle in Desert Tan. It features a 440A stainless steel 7.125-Inch Tanto blade with a desert tan titanium nitride coating. The desert tan handle is double injection-molded with a high-impact core, butt and hilt and a non-slip surface in a traditional Japanese pattern. The emperor node on one side of the handle allows you to know which way the blade is facing even in low light conditions. A custom injection-molded desert tan Zytel sheath is included with this knife.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2907D Hissatsu Knife, Desert Tan 2907D Hissatsu Law Enforcement, Military tactical Knife and Sheath System by Columbia River Knife and Tool was built for the professional. This model is the same as the 2907 except it has a blade and handle in Desert Tan. It features a 440A stainless steel 7.125-Inch Tanto blade with a desert tan titanium nitride coating. The desert tan handle is double injection-molded with a high-impact core, butt and hilt and a non-slip surface in a traditional Japanese pattern. The emperor node on one side of the handle allows you to know which way the blade is facing even in low light conditions. A custom injection-molded desert tan Zytel sheath is included with this knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411LMKMT9LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016CPE66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 59.2}}
{"item_id": "B0016CPJ0W", "title": "COLD STL TI-LITE ZYTEL 6\" STS/BLK", "description": "Ti-Lite tactical folders evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950’s-styled switchblade. Unlike most switchblades however, they are legal to carry nearly everywhere. They feature Japanese made AUS 8A stainless steel blades with a bead blast finish, razor sharp edges and sturdy, needle sharp points. The CNC milled handles are forged from super tough 7075 Aluminum billets and are given an attractive bead blast surface and finished with a protective EDP (Electric Discharge Plating) coating. And for maximum strength and safety, we have equipped our Ti-Lites with our patent pending, stainless steel leaf spring locks (proven, in our tests, to hold 130 lbs).", "text": "COLD STL TI-LITE ZYTEL 6\" STS/BLK Ti-Lite tactical folders evoke the sleek speed and rebellious lines of the classic 1950’s-styled switchblade. Unlike most switchblades however, they are legal to carry nearly everywhere. They feature Japanese made AUS 8A stainless steel blades with a bead blast finish, razor sharp edges and sturdy, needle sharp points. The CNC milled handles are forged from super tough 7075 Aluminum billets and are given an attractive bead blast surface and finished with a protective EDP (Electric Discharge Plating) coating. And for maximum strength and safety, we have equipped our Ti-Lites with our patent pending, stainless steel leaf spring locks (proven, in our tests, to hold 130 lbs).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ShvocmXJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016CPJ0W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 58.51}}
{"item_id": "B0016CT8HM", "title": "Boker Subcom F Folding Pocket Knife", "description": "Boker's Subcom F Folding Knife has a municipal-friendly blade, at 1 7/8\" long and 1/16\" thick. The black coated, partially serrated blade is made of AUS-8 stainless steel and boasts an ambidextrous thumb stud. The reversible pocket clip and compact size of this framelock knife make for an ideal money clip. Both thumb and palm index ramps provide for a secure grip. Handle is fiberglass reinforced nylon. Lightweight, only 2.5 oz.Weight: 2.5 oz..", "text": "Boker Subcom F Folding Pocket Knife Boker's Subcom F Folding Knife has a municipal-friendly blade, at 1 7/8\" long and 1/16\" thick. The black coated, partially serrated blade is made of AUS-8 stainless steel and boasts an ambidextrous thumb stud. The reversible pocket clip and compact size of this framelock knife make for an ideal money clip. Both thumb and palm index ramps provide for a secure grip. Handle is fiberglass reinforced nylon. Lightweight, only 2.5 oz.Weight: 2.5 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X6WUfHHtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016CT8HM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 27.65}}
{"item_id": "B0016CV10O", "title": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Military Classic", "description": "Many of innovative cutlery company Cold Steel's most popular knives, including this Military Classic, are now available in safe, rubberized trainer editions. Carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible during solo practice, training drills, and demonstrations, these plastic knives are made of durable Santoprene material that will hold up to years of heavy use.SpecificationsMade of durable Santoprene6.75-inch blade length11.5-inch overall length3.2-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Military Classic Many of innovative cutlery company Cold Steel's most popular knives, including this Military Classic, are now available in safe, rubberized trainer editions. Carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible during solo practice, training drills, and demonstrations, these plastic knives are made of durable Santoprene material that will hold up to years of heavy use.SpecificationsMade of durable Santoprene6.75-inch blade length11.5-inch overall length3.2-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31huEfcBixL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016CV10O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
