{"item_id": "B0016KCK1A", "title": "Smith & Wesson CK5 Swat II Knife", "description": "The Smith and Wesson line of SWAT Knives offer a sturdy and light weight design. The SWAT series was developed for use by SWAT and military teams to be eremely durable as well as able to handle any job. 3\" Blade, 4.7\" Closed, 6.4oz.", "text": "Smith & Wesson CK5 Swat II Knife The Smith and Wesson line of SWAT Knives offer a sturdy and light weight design. The SWAT series was developed for use by SWAT and military teams to be eremely durable as well as able to handle any job. 3\" Blade, 4.7\" Closed, 6.4oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DpDoukA8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016KCK1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.0}}
