{"item_id": "B0016KY5UE", "title": "Topeak Mini 6 Folding Tool (2.6x 1.1x0.7-Inch)", "description": "Mini series ultra-light folding tool. Increased tool length adds working leverage while its 6 tools fold into an anodized, extruded one-piece alloy body. Perfect for the roadie who like to travel light.", "text": "Topeak Mini 6 Folding Tool (2.6x 1.1x0.7-Inch) Mini series ultra-light folding tool. Increased tool length adds working leverage while its 6 tools fold into an anodized, extruded one-piece alloy body. Perfect for the roadie who like to travel light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f92ro0XqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016KY5UE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0016LEVQG", "title": "Truglo Red-Dot Open 4-Reticle Sight", "description": "The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has 2 choices of reticle color for contrast against any target / background. 4 reticle choices for accurate targeting in any shooting condition. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / compact design. Unlimited eye relief. Water and shock resistant. Click windage and elevation adjustments. Wide field of view. 24x34mm window for ultra fast target acquisition. Anti-reflection coating on target side. Parallax free from 30 yards. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "text": "Truglo Red-Dot Open 4-Reticle Sight The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has 2 choices of reticle color for contrast against any target / background. 4 reticle choices for accurate targeting in any shooting condition. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / compact design. Unlimited eye relief. Water and shock resistant. Click windage and elevation adjustments. Wide field of view. 24x34mm window for ultra fast target acquisition. Anti-reflection coating on target side. Parallax free from 30 yards. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Di3sjOqEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016LEVQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 80.13}}
{"item_id": "B0016LJWEW", "title": "Weaver 1-Inch Six Hole Tactical High Rings (Matte Black)", "description": "In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "text": "Weaver 1-Inch Six Hole Tactical High Rings (Matte Black) In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zXzO5%2BlQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016LJWEW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 29.48}}
{"item_id": "B0016NCQCA", "title": "Scope Claw Mount for H&K G3, GSG, G3 & MP5 Variants", "description": "New Gen. H&K; Claw Mount with Double Picatinny Rails and STANAG Dimension Creative one-piece integral Picatinny double rails. Accepts all varieties of scope, tactical flashlight and laser. Additional STANAG dimension for most versatile applications. Great new gen look at the most affordable price. Works with: MP5 Variants H&K; G3 Variants GSG", "text": "Scope Claw Mount for H&K G3, GSG, G3 & MP5 Variants New Gen. H&K; Claw Mount with Double Picatinny Rails and STANAG Dimension Creative one-piece integral Picatinny double rails. Accepts all varieties of scope, tactical flashlight and laser. Additional STANAG dimension for most versatile applications. Great new gen look at the most affordable price. Works with: MP5 Variants H&K; G3 Variants GSG", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BTksIwMHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016NCQCA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TGS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 16.95}}
