{"item_id": "B0016PM67I", "title": "Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wrap Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357 9 mm .40", "description": "Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wraps give more comfort and ergonomics to your Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357, 9 mm, .40. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Rubber Grips are the absolute best choice for boosting your weapon's comfort. The ergonomic shape of the non-slip rubber give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits Sig Sauer models P228 and P229 in .357, 9 mm, .40; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wrap, Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357, 9 mm, .40", "text": "Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wrap Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357 9 mm .40 Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wraps give more comfort and ergonomics to your Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357, 9 mm, .40. Serious shooters agree, Hogue Rubber Grips are the absolute best choice for boosting your weapon's comfort. The ergonomic shape of the non-slip rubber give you more control of the handgun and enhance accuracy by helping you acquire the target faster and more consistently, shot after shot. Details: Non-slip rubber outer for greater control of your weapon; Comfortable, soft recoil absorbing feel; Made by OverMolding soft rubber over a hard inner skeleton for soft grip comfort, hard grip performance; Rubber exterior chemically bonds to the insert so the smooth hard surface can remain on the inside of the grip for a precise stock grip configuration and exacting tolerance; Two-piece grip simply installs using your stock screws; Fits Sig Sauer models P228 and P229 in .357, 9 mm, .40; Made in USA. More comfort means better shooting! Order Today! Hogue Rubber 2-piece Grip Wrap, Sig Sauer P228 and P229 .357, 9 mm, .40", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TqhRjUYbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016PM67I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 25.0}}
