{"item_id": "B0016RCZGS", "title": "CUSCUS 6200ci 88L Internal Frame Hiking Camp Travel Backpack Gray", "description": "Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "text": "CUSCUS 6200ci 88L Internal Frame Hiking Camp Travel Backpack Gray Made of polyester with total 5 pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. One large front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. A separate sleeping bag compartment with detachable divider from main compartment with easy access. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. Many tightening straps with buckles for securing the backpack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Fits torso: 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hip: 30 - 59 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tGpe7YO3L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016RCZGS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 42.95}}
{"item_id": "B0016SAJ8I", "title": "BSA 2-7X32 Edge Series Pistol Scope", "description": "Pistol scope 2-7x magnification 32mm objective lens 1 tube 1/4 MOA (1/4 click value @ 100 yds) Duplex reticle 50 yds parallax setting 60 ft to 16 ft field of view @ 100 yds 12 to 20 eye relief 15.07mm to 5.23mm exit pupil 10.50 oz. 12 long Includes lens caps • If you find it hard to get the maximum accuracy from your pistols, then mount a scope and watch your groups shrink! Mount this scope on air pistols, airsoft pistols, rimfire pistols and centerfire pistols. Sometimes, simple scopes without all the extra knobs and fancy extras let you home in on your target and just do some fine shootin'!", "text": "BSA 2-7X32 Edge Series Pistol Scope Pistol scope 2-7x magnification 32mm objective lens 1 tube 1/4 MOA (1/4 click value @ 100 yds) Duplex reticle 50 yds parallax setting 60 ft to 16 ft field of view @ 100 yds 12 to 20 eye relief 15.07mm to 5.23mm exit pupil 10.50 oz. 12 long Includes lens caps • If you find it hard to get the maximum accuracy from your pistols, then mount a scope and watch your groups shrink! Mount this scope on air pistols, airsoft pistols, rimfire pistols and centerfire pistols. Sometimes, simple scopes without all the extra knobs and fancy extras let you home in on your target and just do some fine shootin'!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pHjX0frtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SAJ8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 77.3}}
