{"item_id": "B0016SENYY", "title": "Crickett Keystone KSA054 Mil Dot Quick Focus Scope, 4x32-Millimeter, Black Matte Finish", "description": "The Crickett Keystone KSA054 Mil Dot Quick Focus Scope is designed for the Davey Crickett youth rifle. It is a quick focus scope for young shooters.", "text": "Crickett Keystone KSA054 Mil Dot Quick Focus Scope, 4x32-Millimeter, Black Matte Finish The Crickett Keystone KSA054 Mil Dot Quick Focus Scope is designed for the Davey Crickett youth rifle. It is a quick focus scope for young shooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/218nyAA3VgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SENYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Keystone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 35.58}}
{"item_id": "B0016SIGE2", "title": "Tink's Power Pig Dominant Boar Attractant (4-Ounce)", "description": "Dominant Boar Urine sends the signal that there is a new boar in the area which will provoke every boar close to your hunting area to come defend his breeding rights. Dominant Boar Urine is especially effective on those old trophy boars that become very aggressive when they are being challenged for their food and their sows.", "text": "Tink's Power Pig Dominant Boar Attractant (4-Ounce) Dominant Boar Urine sends the signal that there is a new boar in the area which will provoke every boar close to your hunting area to come defend his breeding rights. Dominant Boar Urine is especially effective on those old trophy boars that become very aggressive when they are being challenged for their food and their sows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q9L6GDg1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SIGE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TINK&#39;S", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 10.41}}
{"item_id": "B0016SKF4G", "title": "Primos Trigger Stick Tall Mono Pod", "description": "The Trigger Stick Tall Mono Pod from Primos is a lightweight, height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount designed for hunters. Suitable for sitting, kneeling, or standing, the Trigger Stick offers one-handed, trigger-pull height adjustment from 31 to 64.5 inches tall so that you can stay focused on the task at hand. The Trigger Stick comes with a detachable V yoke for resting your rifle and holds any optical gear with a 1/4-20 or 3/8-16 threaded socket. Compatible with most cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable device, the Trigger Stick Mono Pod provides a base you can count on in the field.Features:Three-piece constructionOne-handed, trigger-pull height adjustmentDesigned for kneeling, sitting, or standingUse with cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable deviceFits 1/4-20 and 3/8-16 threaded socket mountsHeight adjusts from 31 to 64.5 inches", "text": "Primos Trigger Stick Tall Mono Pod The Trigger Stick Tall Mono Pod from Primos is a lightweight, height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount designed for hunters. Suitable for sitting, kneeling, or standing, the Trigger Stick offers one-handed, trigger-pull height adjustment from 31 to 64.5 inches tall so that you can stay focused on the task at hand. The Trigger Stick comes with a detachable V yoke for resting your rifle and holds any optical gear with a 1/4-20 or 3/8-16 threaded socket. Compatible with most cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable device, the Trigger Stick Mono Pod provides a base you can count on in the field.Features:Three-piece constructionOne-handed, trigger-pull height adjustmentDesigned for kneeling, sitting, or standingUse with cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable deviceFits 1/4-20 and 3/8-16 threaded socket mountsHeight adjusts from 31 to 64.5 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iubqjFNDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SKF4G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 51.99}}
{"item_id": "B0016SOA88", "title": "MTM Jammit Target Stand", "description": "Shooting practice and sighting in has never been easier! The Jammit Target Stand is easy to setup and can be moved to different yardages, offering unlimited possibilities for various shooting courses of fire. Designed for rifle and handgun shooters. Ideal for unleveled ground, like the side of a hill. Holds target backer 24\" off the ground and uses two stakes for mounting into the ground. Breaks down fast for compact storage and weighs less than 2lb. Includes cardboard target holder. Dimensions: 17.5\"x 2\"x47\" planted with target backer. Made of engineering grade plastic. All Jammit Target Stands can take a few hits, 22 to 45 ACP, and still be used. We have a stand that has been hit 22 times with 223 and is still working fine. Although a few hits in the vital area will take it out. So never let anyone shoot the stand itself. Due to the nature of these products MTM's normal Guarantee will not apply to target stands and target backer. We guarantee that it will be free of manufacture defect when you receive it, only. Do not use for shotgun patterning. Works on non-rocky ground.", "text": "MTM Jammit Target Stand Shooting practice and sighting in has never been easier! The Jammit Target Stand is easy to setup and can be moved to different yardages, offering unlimited possibilities for various shooting courses of fire. Designed for rifle and handgun shooters. Ideal for unleveled ground, like the side of a hill. Holds target backer 24\" off the ground and uses two stakes for mounting into the ground. Breaks down fast for compact storage and weighs less than 2lb. Includes cardboard target holder. Dimensions: 17.5\"x 2\"x47\" planted with target backer. Made of engineering grade plastic. All Jammit Target Stands can take a few hits, 22 to 45 ACP, and still be used. We have a stand that has been hit 22 times with 223 and is still working fine. Although a few hits in the vital area will take it out. So never let anyone shoot the stand itself. Due to the nature of these products MTM's normal Guarantee will not apply to target stands and target backer. We guarantee that it will be free of manufacture defect when you receive it, only. Do not use for shotgun patterning. Works on non-rocky ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fyduZoo2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SOA88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 20.89}}
{"item_id": "B0016SR6LQ", "title": "Men's Black Pearl Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking", "description": "The Black Pearl Bike short is made from tricot knit fabric that is highly aerodynamic and hydrodynamic. The microfiber nylon is micro denier Nylon and Spandex. It is beefy weight and offers supreme compression for enhanced blood flow. The compression supports muscles and muscle movement. This reduces muscle fatigue and lactic acid buildup. This blend of nylon fibers allows for a very soft feel that dries instantly and sweats well during your workout. The slick surface reduces wind drag and promotes aerodynamics for speed and energy efficiency. The Black Pearl Crotch pad will be the most comfortable pad you have ever worn. It is made of long lasting Poron for anti shock and comfort. This shock absorbing cellular urethane is designed to absorb shock for the life of the short. It is breathable in that it lets water vapor and perspiration move away from the body. This pad resists abrasion, is smooth and wrinkle free. The black pearl will not change its properties with usage and will not harden or soften with use. The Poron cells are open cell structure which allow water transportation while maintaining its ability to absorb shock without bottoming out.", "text": "Men's Black Pearl Bike Shorts Cycling Bicycle Biking The Black Pearl Bike short is made from tricot knit fabric that is highly aerodynamic and hydrodynamic. The microfiber nylon is micro denier Nylon and Spandex. It is beefy weight and offers supreme compression for enhanced blood flow. The compression supports muscles and muscle movement. This reduces muscle fatigue and lactic acid buildup. This blend of nylon fibers allows for a very soft feel that dries instantly and sweats well during your workout. The slick surface reduces wind drag and promotes aerodynamics for speed and energy efficiency. The Black Pearl Crotch pad will be the most comfortable pad you have ever worn. It is made of long lasting Poron for anti shock and comfort. This shock absorbing cellular urethane is designed to absorb shock for the life of the short. It is breathable in that it lets water vapor and perspiration move away from the body. This pad resists abrasion, is smooth and wrinkle free. The black pearl will not change its properties with usage and will not harden or soften with use. The Poron cells are open cell structure which allow water transportation while maintaining its ability to absorb shock without bottoming out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CLtuGmoOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SR6LQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0016SRA4Y", "title": "Cammenga Model 27CS Olive Drab Lensatic Compass", "description": "The phosphorescent lensatic compass has been used as an economical alternative to the tritium model for decades. It is the same compass CAMMENGA has been supplying to the US military except that the self-luminous tritium has been replaced with phosphoresc", "text": "Cammenga Model 27CS Olive Drab Lensatic Compass The phosphorescent lensatic compass has been used as an economical alternative to the tritium model for decades. It is the same compass CAMMENGA has been supplying to the US military except that the self-luminous tritium has been replaced with phosphoresc", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TPhuBS2QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SRA4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cammenga", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 46.13}}
