{"item_id": "B0016SRAEO", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits 1911 Compact Model Rubber Side Panel Grips With Palm Swells", "description": "The Pearce PG-OM2 rubber side panel grips are the same width as the factory grips. The double diamond checkering pattern gives the user a more secure hold while maintaining the classic look of the compact GM 1911's.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits 1911 Compact Model Rubber Side Panel Grips With Palm Swells The Pearce PG-OM2 rubber side panel grips are the same width as the factory grips. The double diamond checkering pattern gives the user a more secure hold while maintaining the classic look of the compact GM 1911's.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IB3hgXBBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016SRAEO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 20.09}}
{"item_id": "B0016WJMYQ", "title": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Level 3 Auto Lock Duty Plain Finish Holster", "description": "Level 3 retention holsters have long been the standard for law enforcement duty use. Now, thanks to the proven SERPA Auto Lock technology, you can draw your weapon rapidly under stress, using your natural drawing motion with no unnatural maneuvers or complicated sequences to remember. Just grab and draw! Available in Plain Finish, Matte Finish, or Basketweave. Features: Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security; no thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; no snaps or hoods to accidentally open; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops also available.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Level 3 Auto Lock Duty Plain Finish Holster Level 3 retention holsters have long been the standard for law enforcement duty use. Now, thanks to the proven SERPA Auto Lock technology, you can draw your weapon rapidly under stress, using your natural drawing motion with no unnatural maneuvers or complicated sequences to remember. Just grab and draw! Available in Plain Finish, Matte Finish, or Basketweave. Features: Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security; no thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; no snaps or hoods to accidentally open; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops also available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lfhL4KobL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0016WJMYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
