{"item_id": "B001711Q2C", "title": "NcStar 1X45 T-Style Red Dot Sight / Weaver Base (DTB145)", "description": "1x45 T-Style Red Dot, Weaver Base Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 45.00 - Reticle: Red dot - Dot size: 3 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Black aluminum - Lens coating: Ruby - Net weight (oz.): 8.40 - Length (in): 5.12 - Mount: Integrated weaver style", "text": "NcStar 1X45 T-Style Red Dot Sight / Weaver Base (DTB145) 1x45 T-Style Red Dot, Weaver Base Features: - Integrated weaver style mount - Powered by three volt lithium battery (CR2032) - Includes extra battery, lens covers, mounting tool Specifications: - Magnification: 1x - Objective dia(mm): 45.00 - Reticle: Red dot - Dot size: 3 moa - Click val: 1 moa - Exterior finish: Black aluminum - Lens coating: Ruby - Net weight (oz.): 8.40 - Length (in): 5.12 - Mount: Integrated weaver style", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RfOqaPtVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001711Q2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Sights"]], "price": 34.05}}
{"item_id": "B001713EJK", "title": "NcStar Pressure Switch for Red Lasers (ALWS)", "description": "Here is a pressure switch used in combination with the Laser Sight with Tactical Rail Mount or the Paintball and Airsoft Rifle Barrel Laser Sight (sold seperately). It provides a convenient pressure pad switch to activate the laser only when you need it.", "text": "NcStar Pressure Switch for Red Lasers (ALWS) Here is a pressure switch used in combination with the Laser Sight with Tactical Rail Mount or the Paintball and Airsoft Rifle Barrel Laser Sight (sold seperately). It provides a convenient pressure pad switch to activate the laser only when you need it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O%2BrkUEhvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001713EJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B001718J36", "title": "Cuetec Bowtie Billiard Cue Stick Tip Tool", "description": "Cuetec Bowtie Billiard Cue Stick Tip Tool. The best tip tool on the market today. This compact and easy to use 3 in 1 tip tool will scuff, shape, and aerate the tip quickly and efficiently to your exact specifications.", "text": "Cuetec Bowtie Billiard Cue Stick Tip Tool Cuetec Bowtie Billiard Cue Stick Tip Tool. The best tip tool on the market today. This compact and easy to use 3 in 1 tip tool will scuff, shape, and aerate the tip quickly and efficiently to your exact specifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VbpSMy2xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001718J36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cuetec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool"]], "price": 13.44}}
{"item_id": "B00171JNZO", "title": "Wilson Official AVP Game Volleyball", "description": "The Wilson Official AVP game volleyball is a top of the line composite leather game ball designed for the highest level of competitive outdoor play. It features a unique Herringbone weave lining that surrounds the bladder to help provide extra layers of softness and maintain the shape of the ball.", "text": "Wilson Official AVP Game Volleyball The Wilson Official AVP game volleyball is a top of the line composite leather game ball designed for the highest level of competitive outdoor play. It features a unique Herringbone weave lining that surrounds the bladder to help provide extra layers of softness and maintain the shape of the ball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x9pM9Qt2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00171JNZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Volleyballs", "Outdoor Volleyballs"]], "price": 34.19}}
