{"item_id": "B00172UJ6A", "title": "Smith & Wesson CKTACBSD Tactical Serrated Drop Point Knife, Black", "description": "3.5-Inch blade, 4.6-Inch closed, 3.5-Ounce.", "text": "Smith & Wesson CKTACBSD Tactical Serrated Drop Point Knife, Black 3.5-Inch blade, 4.6-Inch closed, 3.5-Ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319TwNS0woL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00172UJ6A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 11.18}}
{"item_id": "B001731O36", "title": "Schwinn Midmoor Men's Hybrid Bike (700c Wheels)", "description": "The Schwinn Midmoor 26-inch men's comfort bicycle is crafted around an aluminum hybrid frame with a suspension fork and a suspension seat post for a comfortable ride. It features front and rear Promax alloy linear pull brakes and 21 speeds with Shimano components. Other highlights include a swept-back handlebar and smooth-riding 700c wheels.Manufacturer's WarrantyWarranty coverage on the bicycle frame extends for the life of the bicycle while owned by the original retail purchaser. Warranty coverage on Schwinn proprietary bicycle components (excluding tires, tubes, and cables) extends for one year while owned by the original retail purchaser. Warranty coverage of non-proprietary components will be covered by the warranty stated by their original manufacturers. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear; any damage, failure, or loss caused by accident, misuse, neglect, abuse, theft, or failure to follow instructions or warnings in the owner's manual.About Dorel IndustriesDorel Industries is a world-class juvenile products and bicycle company. Established in 1962, Dorel creates style and excitement in equal measure to safety, quality, and value. The company's lifestyle leadership position is pronounced in both its Juvenile and Bicycle categories with an array of trendsetting products. Dorel's powerfully branded products include Cannondale, Schwinn, GT, Mongoose, and SUGOI. Dorel is a $2.2 billion company with 4,700 employees, facilities in 18 countries, and sales worldwide.", "text": "Schwinn Midmoor Men's Hybrid Bike (700c Wheels) The Schwinn Midmoor 26-inch men's comfort bicycle is crafted around an aluminum hybrid frame with a suspension fork and a suspension seat post for a comfortable ride. It features front and rear Promax alloy linear pull brakes and 21 speeds with Shimano components. Other highlights include a swept-back handlebar and smooth-riding 700c wheels.Manufacturer's WarrantyWarranty coverage on the bicycle frame extends for the life of the bicycle while owned by the original retail purchaser. Warranty coverage on Schwinn proprietary bicycle components (excluding tires, tubes, and cables) extends for one year while owned by the original retail purchaser. Warranty coverage of non-proprietary components will be covered by the warranty stated by their original manufacturers. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear; any damage, failure, or loss caused by accident, misuse, neglect, abuse, theft, or failure to follow instructions or warnings in the owner's manual.About Dorel IndustriesDorel Industries is a world-class juvenile products and bicycle company. Established in 1962, Dorel creates style and excitement in equal measure to safety, quality, and value. The company's lifestyle leadership position is pronounced in both its Juvenile and Bicycle categories with an array of trendsetting products. Dorel's powerfully branded products include Cannondale, Schwinn, GT, Mongoose, and SUGOI. Dorel is a $2.2 billion company with 4,700 employees, facilities in 18 countries, and sales worldwide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nvmSMH4cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001731O36.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Hybrid Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017323FE", "title": "Terry Fly Tri Gel Vanox mens saddle, black", "description": "Terry Precision Fly men's saddles feature a textured leather cover and a center cutaway to reduce pressure. Features: Center cutaway to reduce pressure Flat across top High-density support foam in rear", "text": "Terry Fly Tri Gel Vanox mens saddle, black Terry Precision Fly men's saddles feature a textured leather cover and a center cutaway to reduce pressure. Features: Center cutaway to reduce pressure Flat across top High-density support foam in rear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FOKy2ZX7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017323FE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001733BOQ", "title": "Bianchi 19 Tan Holster Fits 45 Auto Thumbsnap", "description": "The Bianchi Model 19 Thumbsnap Holster is a hi-ride, full grain leather holster that is worn on the hip close to the body for concealability. Made for semi-automatics it features a traditional thumb break design and carries the pistol at a slight forward cant. It features a wide belt loop for stability, a low-cut leading edge and Bianchi's Sight Channel™ to protect the front sites and for a smooth presentation. 1.75 inch (45 mm) belt loop. Fits Browning Hi-Power, Colt Delta Elite, Gold Cup, Government, Kimber Custom II, Custom Target II, Llama IXA, Para-Ordinance P14, P16, Springfield 1911-A1", "text": "Bianchi 19 Tan Holster Fits 45 Auto Thumbsnap The Bianchi Model 19 Thumbsnap Holster is a hi-ride, full grain leather holster that is worn on the hip close to the body for concealability. Made for semi-automatics it features a traditional thumb break design and carries the pistol at a slight forward cant. It features a wide belt loop for stability, a low-cut leading edge and Bianchi's Sight Channel™ to protect the front sites and for a smooth presentation. 1.75 inch (45 mm) belt loop. Fits Browning Hi-Power, Colt Delta Elite, Gold Cup, Government, Kimber Custom II, Custom Target II, Llama IXA, Para-Ordinance P14, P16, Springfield 1911-A1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C9w3SJMuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001733BOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 48.77}}
{"item_id": "B001739ZQE", "title": "TYR Nest Pro Goggle", "description": "", "text": "TYR Nest Pro Goggle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pZnTor3ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001739ZQE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00173B2G0", "title": "Klean Kanteen Caps", "description": "Klean Kanteen Caps - Klean Kanteen Classic bottles have three different cap styles: Sport 3.0, Loop and Flat. The revolutionary Sport Cap 3.0 effortlessly delivers a high flow rate that makes it easy to drink from your bottle without removing the cap. The Loop Cap is totally leakproof and has a durable attachment point so you can clip it on to just about anything. And the Flat Cap is low-profile, unobtrusive and leakproof.Klean Kanteen Wide caps are designed to fit the universal thread design of our wide-mouth bottles. They have stainless steel on the inside of the cap, creating a 100% stainless interior and are available in three styles: Loop, Flip D-Ring and Caf. The Loop Cap comes standard on all wide bottles and has a strong, easy attachment point. The functional, space-saving Flip D-Ring transforms instantly from a flat cap to a loop cap, while the Caf Cap allows you to convert a Kanteen Wide Insulated bottle (or a regular Wide bottle) into a splashproof to-go mug with a quick twist.All Klean Kanteen caps are made from polypropylene, a safe plastic that's free of BPA, phthalates and other toxins. But if you want to be sure your drink never touches anything other than stainless steel, the Flat and Loop caps are available in a stainless steel version for Klean Kanteen Classic bottles. Order the Stainless Flat Cap or the Stainless Loop Cap.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Caps Klean Kanteen Caps - Klean Kanteen Classic bottles have three different cap styles: Sport 3.0, Loop and Flat. The revolutionary Sport Cap 3.0 effortlessly delivers a high flow rate that makes it easy to drink from your bottle without removing the cap. The Loop Cap is totally leakproof and has a durable attachment point so you can clip it on to just about anything. And the Flat Cap is low-profile, unobtrusive and leakproof.Klean Kanteen Wide caps are designed to fit the universal thread design of our wide-mouth bottles. They have stainless steel on the inside of the cap, creating a 100% stainless interior and are available in three styles: Loop, Flip D-Ring and Caf. The Loop Cap comes standard on all wide bottles and has a strong, easy attachment point. The functional, space-saving Flip D-Ring transforms instantly from a flat cap to a loop cap, while the Caf Cap allows you to convert a Kanteen Wide Insulated bottle (or a regular Wide bottle) into a splashproof to-go mug with a quick twist.All Klean Kanteen caps are made from polypropylene, a safe plastic that's free of BPA, phthalates and other toxins. But if you want to be sure your drink never touches anything other than stainless steel, the Flat and Loop caps are available in a stainless steel version for Klean Kanteen Classic bottles. Order the Stainless Flat Cap or the Stainless Loop Cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t6OJsAseL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00173B2G0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Travel Mugs"]], "price": 5.71}}
{"item_id": "B00173F8OC", "title": "45 CAL ACP RELOADING BRASS 300 CASINGS LOT # 22713", "description": "THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 45 CAL ACP, 300 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE ARE APPROXIMATELY 77 CASINGS PER POUND. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. THIS ITEM CONTAINS BOTH LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS. PLEASE DO NOT PURCHASE IF YOU DO NOT WANT BOTH LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS. WE CANNOT DETERMINE THE RATIO BETWEEN LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS BECAUSE IT VARIES FROM SHIPMENT TO SHIPMENT. YOU COULD GET ALL LARGE OR ALL SMALL OR A MIXTURE IN BETWEEN. WE SORT BY CALIBER AND NOT BY PRIMERS. BE CAREFUL BEFORE PURCHASING. NO PROBLEM RETURNING THE ITEM AND FULL CREDIT WILL BE ISSUED EXCEPT FOR ALL RELATED SHIPPING CHARGES. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "text": "45 CAL ACP RELOADING BRASS 300 CASINGS LOT # 22713 THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 45 CAL ACP, 300 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE ARE APPROXIMATELY 77 CASINGS PER POUND. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. THIS ITEM CONTAINS BOTH LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS. PLEASE DO NOT PURCHASE IF YOU DO NOT WANT BOTH LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS. WE CANNOT DETERMINE THE RATIO BETWEEN LARGE AND SMALL PISTOL PRIMERS BECAUSE IT VARIES FROM SHIPMENT TO SHIPMENT. YOU COULD GET ALL LARGE OR ALL SMALL OR A MIXTURE IN BETWEEN. WE SORT BY CALIBER AND NOT BY PRIMERS. BE CAREFUL BEFORE PURCHASING. NO PROBLEM RETURNING THE ITEM AND FULL CREDIT WILL BE ISSUED EXCEPT FOR ALL RELATED SHIPPING CHARGES. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51x8m7DjyoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00173F8OC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00173HG9M", "title": "Glock Recoil Spring 17,22,24,31,34,35", "description": "New Glock Factory OEM Guide Rod and Recoil Spring Assembly (RSA) with captured spring and polymer guide rod - model# SP01533. For use with Gen1, Gen 2 & Gen 3 Glock Model 17, 18, 22, 24, 31, 34, 35, 37 Pistols. Marked 5579-1 on end of guide rod - this is the latest version. This replacement part is a factory original from Glock. Factory replacement parts are manufactured to the exact same specifications and tolerances and use the same manufacturing materials as the original parts which guarantees excellent fit and reliable operation. Glock recommends replacing the guide rod & spring assembly every 2800-3100 rounds. This will help keep your Glock functioning like new.", "text": "Glock Recoil Spring 17,22,24,31,34,35 New Glock Factory OEM Guide Rod and Recoil Spring Assembly (RSA) with captured spring and polymer guide rod - model# SP01533. For use with Gen1, Gen 2 & Gen 3 Glock Model 17, 18, 22, 24, 31, 34, 35, 37 Pistols. Marked 5579-1 on end of guide rod - this is the latest version. This replacement part is a factory original from Glock. Factory replacement parts are manufactured to the exact same specifications and tolerances and use the same manufacturing materials as the original parts which guarantees excellent fit and reliable operation. Glock recommends replacing the guide rod & spring assembly every 2800-3100 rounds. This will help keep your Glock functioning like new.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318GYFkYuXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00173HG9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B00173IZ74", "title": "HiViz Ruger P-Series Fiber Optic Sight (Green)", "description": "HiViz handgun sights have been redesigned. With an all-new square profile, sight picture acquisition time is reduced. Serrations on the rear of the sight base combine with a slightly recessed LitePipe to eliminate the \"halo effect\" common to many sights and increase the durability of the toughest LitePipes available. This new design is also more holster friendly.", "text": "HiViz Ruger P-Series Fiber Optic Sight (Green) HiViz handgun sights have been redesigned. With an all-new square profile, sight picture acquisition time is reduced. Serrations on the rear of the sight base combine with a slightly recessed LitePipe to eliminate the \"halo effect\" common to many sights and increase the durability of the toughest LitePipes available. This new design is also more holster friendly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Kg84X4JOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00173IZ74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B00174ZHGU", "title": "Swagman RV 2\" Bumper Adaptor", "description": "The RV Bumper Adapter is made of solid steel construction. Anti-rattle included. It is built for 4 to 4.5\" continuous welded steel bumper. Easy installation and is made to carry bike racks.", "text": "Swagman RV 2\" Bumper Adaptor The RV Bumper Adapter is made of solid steel construction. Anti-rattle included. It is built for 4 to 4.5\" continuous welded steel bumper. Easy installation and is made to carry bike racks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AIOE7Md4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00174ZHGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swagman Bicycle Carriers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 36.15}}
{"item_id": "B00175YK9O", "title": "TITLE Classic Speed Bags", "description": "Tough, super fast and lightweight leather build. All-leather welted seams, triple stitched and precision balanced for true rebounds. Loop is extra-reinforced for long wear. Complete with extended-life rubber bladder.", "text": "TITLE Classic Speed Bags Tough, super fast and lightweight leather build. All-leather welted seams, triple stitched and precision balanced for true rebounds. Loop is extra-reinforced for long wear. Complete with extended-life rubber bladder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410jZtd6rKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00175YK9O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Speed Bags"]]}}
