{"item_id": "B0017GA09W", "title": "Reelight SL100 Flashing Compact Generator Bicycle Headlight and Tail Light Set", "description": "The Reelight SL100 Compact uses high power ultra bright LED bulbs. Fits on most bicycles without roller and disc brakes. The front and rear lights are flashing when the wheel is in motion.", "text": "Reelight SL100 Flashing Compact Generator Bicycle Headlight and Tail Light Set The Reelight SL100 Compact uses high power ultra bright LED bulbs. Fits on most bicycles without roller and disc brakes. The front and rear lights are flashing when the wheel is in motion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z-yaluyBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GA09W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reelight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 35.99}}
{"item_id": "B0017GUB8M", "title": "10350 Genuine GI Sun Wind & Dust Goggles", "description": "# WITH GREY & CLEAR LENS IN GOV'T. BOX # REPLACEMENT LENSES SOLD SEPERATELY: CLEAR OR GREY #10354", "text": "10350 Genuine GI Sun Wind & Dust Goggles # WITH GREY & CLEAR LENS IN GOV'T. BOX # REPLACEMENT LENSES SOLD SEPERATELY: CLEAR OR GREY #10354", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tgpaioTAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GUB8M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uvex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 20.5}}
{"item_id": "B0017GVQ5Y", "title": "American Recreation Products 50000 Stainless Steel Chow Set", "description": "Stainless Steel Chow Set, Includes Knife, Fork & Spoon, Lock Nested When Stored, Includes Vinyl Carrying Case.", "text": "American Recreation Products 50000 Stainless Steel Chow Set Stainless Steel Chow Set, Includes Knife, Fork & Spoon, Lock Nested When Stored, Includes Vinyl Carrying Case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IwLdsDm3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GVQ5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017GVQKY", "title": "Spalding Standard Rim", "description": "Designed to replace existing rim systems, the Spalding 7811SR standard rim offers solid steel construction with steel rams. The rim comes complete with an all-weather standard white net and has a mounting pattern of 2 7/8 by 2 1/2 inches. The rim measures 5/8 inch in diameter and features a durable, powder coated finish.What's in the Box?Steel rim, standard white netAbout SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "text": "Spalding Standard Rim Designed to replace existing rim systems, the Spalding 7811SR standard rim offers solid steel construction with steel rams. The rim comes complete with an all-weather standard white net and has a mounting pattern of 2 7/8 by 2 1/2 inches. The rim measures 5/8 inch in diameter and features a durable, powder coated finish.What's in the Box?Steel rim, standard white netAbout SpaldingA Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is now the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being the leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-1sRtRA7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GVQKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Backboard Components", "Rims"]], "price": 32.51}}
{"item_id": "B0017GZ934", "title": "Wenzel Camp Coffee Pot with 9 Cup Capacity", "description": "Wenzel Camp coffee pot makes up to 9 cups of fresh brewed percolator coffee. The sturdy construction has a easy pour spout and a wire handle for hanging over the fire and not burning yourself. A lightweight aluminum percolator basket holds the coffee grounds to start your day off right!", "text": "Wenzel Camp Coffee Pot with 9 Cup Capacity Wenzel Camp coffee pot makes up to 9 cups of fresh brewed percolator coffee. The sturdy construction has a easy pour spout and a wire handle for hanging over the fire and not burning yourself. A lightweight aluminum percolator basket holds the coffee grounds to start your day off right!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lEcQoPXNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GZ934.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wenzel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B0017GZ93O", "title": "Wenzel Deluxe Mess Kit", "description": "Go gourmet even when cooking and dining outdoors with the Wenzel deluxe mess kit. Featuring a lightweight, stackable design, the mess kit includes all the tools you need to eat a hearty meal yet packs up and stores in a compact vinyl carrying case for easy transport. The kit includes a fry pan, cook pot, and lid for cooking, each made of heavy-gauge aluminum. When you're done cooking, you can turn to the aluminum plate, which includes raised sides to keep your food in, and the plastic cup. Finally, the kit comes with a detachable handle for the fry pan and cook pot. The detachable handle not only makes the cookware easier to hold, but it also locks the set together for secure storage.About WenzelWhen the sun rose on the first American family campers more than 120 years ago, Wenzel was there, helping families escape, recharge, and reconnect. Today, the company still gives families the opportunity to break free from modernity and enjoy the rustling leaves and babbling brooks of the great outdoors. Wenzel's mission is to make it as easy as possible to hit the campsite, with compact, easy-to-pitch tents and sleeping bags that unroll into roomy, warm cocoons. Wenzel also makes camp pads that smooth out the rough forest floor, making outdoor experiences more comfortable than ever. Most importantly, the company is an ambassador to the outdoors, beckoning families to return to the place where memories are made and souls are fueled.", "text": "Wenzel Deluxe Mess Kit Go gourmet even when cooking and dining outdoors with the Wenzel deluxe mess kit. Featuring a lightweight, stackable design, the mess kit includes all the tools you need to eat a hearty meal yet packs up and stores in a compact vinyl carrying case for easy transport. The kit includes a fry pan, cook pot, and lid for cooking, each made of heavy-gauge aluminum. When you're done cooking, you can turn to the aluminum plate, which includes raised sides to keep your food in, and the plastic cup. Finally, the kit comes with a detachable handle for the fry pan and cook pot. The detachable handle not only makes the cookware easier to hold, but it also locks the set together for secure storage.About WenzelWhen the sun rose on the first American family campers more than 120 years ago, Wenzel was there, helping families escape, recharge, and reconnect. Today, the company still gives families the opportunity to break free from modernity and enjoy the rustling leaves and babbling brooks of the great outdoors. Wenzel's mission is to make it as easy as possible to hit the campsite, with compact, easy-to-pitch tents and sleeping bags that unroll into roomy, warm cocoons. Wenzel also makes camp pads that smooth out the rough forest floor, making outdoor experiences more comfortable than ever. Most importantly, the company is an ambassador to the outdoors, beckoning families to return to the place where memories are made and souls are fueled.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41edBg66oDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017GZ93O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wenzel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 10.15}}
{"item_id": "B0017H9SXK", "title": "Travelchair Ultimate Slacker Chair", "description": "The portability of a folding stool meets the comfort of a chair. Designed to provide portable seating with minimum weight and maximum portability, the Ultimate Slacker is at home everywhere from kayak expeditions to shoreline picnics. Like all TravelChairs, it features high-quality, thickwalled frame tubing, abrasion- and fade-resistant materials and sturdy connection systems that won't flex, sway, or wobble.Specifications:Dimensions Open: 15 by 15 by 29 inchesDimensions Closed: 5 by 7 by 34 inchesSeat Height: 16.5 inchesWeight: 2.66 poundsWeight Capacity: 275 poundsTravelchair FeaturesWebbingSeat belt webbing is good enough to save your life and it is good enough to reinforce our chairs. Travelchair goes beyond the industry standard to use the toughest webbing in the business.FeetFeet hold the chair together and keep you out of the dirt. Travelchair feet are designed, like our molded grommets, to be at peace when loaded. The nylon insures that the feet in your chair will be flexible and strong.GrommetsTravelchair molds grommets to conform to optimal angles when the chair is loaded. High strength nylon and double stitching means no compromise in durability.RivetsNot all rivets are the same--Travelchair rivets are oversized to maintain frame integrity. Instead of drilling a large hole to drop the rivet into and then mashing down the ends for a tight fit, Travelchair drills to exacting tolerances, which means more manufacturing time spent creating products, and much longer product life.FramesTravelchair steels and aluminums are a grade higher than what is on the market and a tick or two thicker than the average chair, resulting in stronger, longer lasting frames.FabricThe common thread throughout the Travelchair line is that each fabric is the ultimate in durability for its intended use. Take the 600 denier nylon, for example. Travelchair uses a double layer instead of a single layer like discounted store chairs. The ballistic nylon and polyester meshes have been put through rigorous product testing in the Desert Southwest, in Chilean Patagonia, and in the Travelchair warehouse in Gig Harbor, Washington.DetailsTravelchair finishes products with details such as bar tacking, doubling of fabrics, and reinforcement fabrics made of seat belt material because they believe the bottom line is superior design.", "text": "Travelchair Ultimate Slacker Chair The portability of a folding stool meets the comfort of a chair. Designed to provide portable seating with minimum weight and maximum portability, the Ultimate Slacker is at home everywhere from kayak expeditions to shoreline picnics. Like all TravelChairs, it features high-quality, thickwalled frame tubing, abrasion- and fade-resistant materials and sturdy connection systems that won't flex, sway, or wobble.Specifications:Dimensions Open: 15 by 15 by 29 inchesDimensions Closed: 5 by 7 by 34 inchesSeat Height: 16.5 inchesWeight: 2.66 poundsWeight Capacity: 275 poundsTravelchair FeaturesWebbingSeat belt webbing is good enough to save your life and it is good enough to reinforce our chairs. Travelchair goes beyond the industry standard to use the toughest webbing in the business.FeetFeet hold the chair together and keep you out of the dirt. Travelchair feet are designed, like our molded grommets, to be at peace when loaded. The nylon insures that the feet in your chair will be flexible and strong.GrommetsTravelchair molds grommets to conform to optimal angles when the chair is loaded. High strength nylon and double stitching means no compromise in durability.RivetsNot all rivets are the same--Travelchair rivets are oversized to maintain frame integrity. Instead of drilling a large hole to drop the rivet into and then mashing down the ends for a tight fit, Travelchair drills to exacting tolerances, which means more manufacturing time spent creating products, and much longer product life.FramesTravelchair steels and aluminums are a grade higher than what is on the market and a tick or two thicker than the average chair, resulting in stronger, longer lasting frames.FabricThe common thread throughout the Travelchair line is that each fabric is the ultimate in durability for its intended use. Take the 600 denier nylon, for example. Travelchair uses a double layer instead of a single layer like discounted store chairs. The ballistic nylon and polyester meshes have been put through rigorous product testing in the Desert Southwest, in Chilean Patagonia, and in the Travelchair warehouse in Gig Harbor, Washington.DetailsTravelchair finishes products with details such as bar tacking, doubling of fabrics, and reinforcement fabrics made of seat belt material because they believe the bottom line is superior design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aLFzYOBIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017H9SXK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017HZ0O6", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37T-K Seal Pup Elite Knife with Part-Serrated Fixed 4.85-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Kydex Sheath, Black TiNi", "description": "The E37T-K SEAL Pup Elite partially-serrated knife with black TiNi finish and Kydex sheath is SOG's new high-performance addition to the SEAL family of products. Sleek, attractive, and easy to operate, the E37T-K showcases SOG's sophisticated style and quality construction. Designed for use by Navy SEALs, the E37T-K features a thick steel stock (.185 inches), an AUS8 stainless steel heat-treated blade, a long ergonomic handle, deep finger grooves, and more.The E37 was designed for use by Navy SEALs.View larger..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q2_2009/sog-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;color: cccccc;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;color: white;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG E37T-K SEAL Pup Elite Partially-Serrated Knife Offers:A 4.85-inch partially-serrated blade with black TiNi coatingCryogenic heat-treated blade constructionA contoured and textured glass-reinforced Zytel handleA tactical Kydex sheathThe E37T-K's Kydex sheath is designed to endure practically any situation. Military belt and jump rated, the Kydex sheath can be mounted upside down, sideways on a belt, or strapped to your ankle. Additionally, the self-draining scabbard has a friction fit and a back-up nylon strap for extra security.Cryogenic Heat Treatment and TiNi Coating Guarantee a Sharp, Durable BladeThe E37T-K offers a full, 4.85-inch, partially-serrated, AUS8 stainless steel blade that has undergone SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process, which ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and involves slowly reducing the blade's temperature to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then slowly heating the blade to room temperature. The stress created by this process strengthens the steel on an atomic level and increases the blade's overall durability and edge retention.In addition to having undergone the Cryogenic Heat Treatment Process, this knife is coated in proprietary titanium nitride (TiNi), of the toughest coatings that can be applied to steel. TiNi boasts extreme hardness, is exceptionally scratch and peel resistant, and helps increase steel's longevity.Ergonomic, Lightweight Design Ensures Comfortable UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make precise cuts if your knife doesn't fit comfortably in your hand. That's why this knife's handle is ergonomically contoured. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the textured handle is also slip-free and well-balanced. Other ergonomic features include deep finger grooves and a blade spine rasp for easy notching, filing, and thumb placement. Also, at just 5.4 ounces, this knife is lightweight and easy to carry. A tactical Kydex sheath is included for convenient portability.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxE37T-K Fixed blade knife and tactical Kydex sheath.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37T-K Seal Pup Elite Knife with Part-Serrated Fixed 4.85-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Kydex Sheath, Black TiNi The E37T-K SEAL Pup Elite partially-serrated knife with black TiNi finish and Kydex sheath is SOG's new high-performance addition to the SEAL family of products. Sleek, attractive, and easy to operate, the E37T-K showcases SOG's sophisticated style and quality construction. Designed for use by Navy SEALs, the E37T-K features a thick steel stock (.185 inches), an AUS8 stainless steel heat-treated blade, a long ergonomic handle, deep finger grooves, and more.The E37 was designed for use by Navy SEALs.View larger..caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout3-c26 {height: 100 percent;background: url('http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/th/content_26/Q2_2009/sog-callout3.png') repeat-y;border-left: 0px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;color: cccccc;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;color: white;}img.withlink {border:1px black solid;}a.nodecoration {text-decoration: none}The SOG E37T-K SEAL Pup Elite Partially-Serrated Knife Offers:A 4.85-inch partially-serrated blade with black TiNi coatingCryogenic heat-treated blade constructionA contoured and textured glass-reinforced Zytel handleA tactical Kydex sheathThe E37T-K's Kydex sheath is designed to endure practically any situation. Military belt and jump rated, the Kydex sheath can be mounted upside down, sideways on a belt, or strapped to your ankle. Additionally, the self-draining scabbard has a friction fit and a back-up nylon strap for extra security.Cryogenic Heat Treatment and TiNi Coating Guarantee a Sharp, Durable BladeThe E37T-K offers a full, 4.85-inch, partially-serrated, AUS8 stainless steel blade that has undergone SOG's proprietary Cryogenic Heat Treatment process, which ensures that this blade will stay sharp over the long haul. This intensive process takes more than 48 hours and involves slowly reducing the blade's temperature to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit, then slowly heating the blade to room temperature. The stress created by this process strengthens the steel on an atomic level and increases the blade's overall durability and edge retention.In addition to having undergone the Cryogenic Heat Treatment Process, this knife is coated in proprietary titanium nitride (TiNi), of the toughest coatings that can be applied to steel. TiNi boasts extreme hardness, is exceptionally scratch and peel resistant, and helps increase steel's longevity.Ergonomic, Lightweight Design Ensures Comfortable UseEven if your blade is sharp, it's hard to make precise cuts if your knife doesn't fit comfortably in your hand. That's why this knife's handle is ergonomically contoured. Crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel, the textured handle is also slip-free and well-balanced. Other ergonomic features include deep finger grooves and a blade spine rasp for easy notching, filing, and thumb placement. Also, at just 5.4 ounces, this knife is lightweight and easy to carry. A tactical Kydex sheath is included for convenient portability.This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxE37T-K Fixed blade knife and tactical Kydex sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vWOXEcQ3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017HZ0O6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 70.27}}
{"item_id": "B0017I532E", "title": "TRISLIDE Anti-Chafe Continuous Spray Skin Lubricant", "description": "TRISLIDE is the ONLY anti chafing, anti-friction, anti-blistering product found in a convenient environmental friendly aerosol spray. Gone are the days of goopy messy hands and contaminated sticks, the continuous spray application of TRISLIDE is easy to use and safe to share. TRISLIDE is becoming the preferred ‘chamois anti chafing' treatment for cyclists to eliminate saddle sores. For cyclists, one application of TRISLIDE goes on silky smooth and stays on without a squishy, wet chamois feeling. It stays on for hours but doesn't leave a greasy lube residue. Compared to others that may wash off, it is waterproof which means sweat proof. Not only is TRISLIDE great for eliminating chamois chafing, but it successfully combats blistering and hotspots on runner's feet and all general skin chafing (inner thigh, underarm, sports bra, chest and neck). TRISLIDE also helps ease entries and causes wicked fast exits from triathlon wetsuits. For triathletes, surfers and divers, TRISLIDE is completely safe to use on all neoprene compared to petroleum or vegetable based products that will disintegrate the wetsuits. TRISLIDE is a liquid silicone based product that can simply be removed with soap and water, will not stain clothes, and is the most innovative product to prevent chafing, blistering, irritation and hot spots found in swimming, biking and running. Available in a 4 oz. can.", "text": "TRISLIDE Anti-Chafe Continuous Spray Skin Lubricant TRISLIDE is the ONLY anti chafing, anti-friction, anti-blistering product found in a convenient environmental friendly aerosol spray. Gone are the days of goopy messy hands and contaminated sticks, the continuous spray application of TRISLIDE is easy to use and safe to share. TRISLIDE is becoming the preferred ‘chamois anti chafing' treatment for cyclists to eliminate saddle sores. For cyclists, one application of TRISLIDE goes on silky smooth and stays on without a squishy, wet chamois feeling. It stays on for hours but doesn't leave a greasy lube residue. Compared to others that may wash off, it is waterproof which means sweat proof. Not only is TRISLIDE great for eliminating chamois chafing, but it successfully combats blistering and hotspots on runner's feet and all general skin chafing (inner thigh, underarm, sports bra, chest and neck). TRISLIDE also helps ease entries and causes wicked fast exits from triathlon wetsuits. For triathletes, surfers and divers, TRISLIDE is completely safe to use on all neoprene compared to petroleum or vegetable based products that will disintegrate the wetsuits. TRISLIDE is a liquid silicone based product that can simply be removed with soap and water, will not stain clothes, and is the most innovative product to prevent chafing, blistering, irritation and hot spots found in swimming, biking and running. Available in a 4 oz. can.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BM3-CNaRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017I532E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TRISLIDE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Hardware"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B0017IADWE", "title": "Fobus PPS Right-Handed Holster Fits: Walther PPS/CZ 97B/Taurus 709 Slim, 708, 740, Black", "description": "Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "text": "Fobus PPS Right-Handed Holster Fits: Walther PPS/CZ 97B/Taurus 709 Slim, 708, 740, Black Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VjF0PquoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017IADWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.41}}
{"item_id": "B0017IAE1E", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle RU101 Ruger LCR / SP101", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle RU101 Ruger LCR / SP101 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ryEKYlzxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017IAE1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B0017IEZRS", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster Left Hand Hand Paddle SWMPLH S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40 Left Hand Hand", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster Left Hand Hand Paddle SWMPLH S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40 Left Hand Hand Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313ijojZ5KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017IEZRS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B0017K10YC", "title": "Currie Technologies eZip 500 Electric Scooter", "description": "The E-500 electric scooter is Currie's most popular and versatile model, and is ideal for speedy neighborhood transportation, or simply having some fun cruising around the block.A comfortable on/off seat kit helps boost comfort on long trips.SpecificationsMotor:DC earth magnet with 500 watts of powerBattery:EV-rated SLA type, plug-and-play design in nylon handled pack; 24V10Ah 240Wh pack, consisting of two 12V10Ah valve-regulated, rechargeable cellsCharge System:UL-listed Currie smart charger with LED status displayController:Exclusive Currie PWM smart power microprocessor; 24-volt, fully-potted with relay protection and battery gaugeTop Speed:Up to 15 MPH, depending on rider weight and terrainRange:Up to eight miles, depending on rider weight and terrainDrive:Patented Currie Electro-Drive chain drive systemBrakes:Rear band with alloy motor inhibit leverWheels:Currie exclusive five-spoke alloy wide mag wheelsTires:12.5-inch Currie street slick tires with Tuff-Tire Technology; elastomer sub-tread reduces chances of flattingHandlebars:Exclusive Currie folding designForks:Unicrown design with oversteering limitUser Controls:Power on/off switch, easy access charger port in frame console; throttle with battery gaugeDeck:Nonslip ABS resin with in-mold graphics and brand logo badgeFrame:High-tensile steel, heavy-duty with one-piece steel tooled battery box and oversized head tubeSeat:Easy on/off kit includedWeight:56 poundsRider Age/Weight Limit:Recommended for ages 13 and up, rider not to exceed 180 poundsBattery Life:200 cyclesCharge Time:Six to eight hoursWarrantyCurrie Technologies eZip powered bicycles and scooters include a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship in the frame and components, with the exception of tires, inner tubes, and batteries.About Currie TechnologiesCurrie Technologies makes hybrid and electric powered bicycles and scooters with patented Electro-Drive Technology, under the iZip and eZip brands. The company builds products that offer cost effective, emissions-free alternatives to other forms of transportation for commuting, sport, and recreation.", "text": "Currie Technologies eZip 500 Electric Scooter The E-500 electric scooter is Currie's most popular and versatile model, and is ideal for speedy neighborhood transportation, or simply having some fun cruising around the block.A comfortable on/off seat kit helps boost comfort on long trips.SpecificationsMotor:DC earth magnet with 500 watts of powerBattery:EV-rated SLA type, plug-and-play design in nylon handled pack; 24V10Ah 240Wh pack, consisting of two 12V10Ah valve-regulated, rechargeable cellsCharge System:UL-listed Currie smart charger with LED status displayController:Exclusive Currie PWM smart power microprocessor; 24-volt, fully-potted with relay protection and battery gaugeTop Speed:Up to 15 MPH, depending on rider weight and terrainRange:Up to eight miles, depending on rider weight and terrainDrive:Patented Currie Electro-Drive chain drive systemBrakes:Rear band with alloy motor inhibit leverWheels:Currie exclusive five-spoke alloy wide mag wheelsTires:12.5-inch Currie street slick tires with Tuff-Tire Technology; elastomer sub-tread reduces chances of flattingHandlebars:Exclusive Currie folding designForks:Unicrown design with oversteering limitUser Controls:Power on/off switch, easy access charger port in frame console; throttle with battery gaugeDeck:Nonslip ABS resin with in-mold graphics and brand logo badgeFrame:High-tensile steel, heavy-duty with one-piece steel tooled battery box and oversized head tubeSeat:Easy on/off kit includedWeight:56 poundsRider Age/Weight Limit:Recommended for ages 13 and up, rider not to exceed 180 poundsBattery Life:200 cyclesCharge Time:Six to eight hoursWarrantyCurrie Technologies eZip powered bicycles and scooters include a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship in the frame and components, with the exception of tires, inner tubes, and batteries.About Currie TechnologiesCurrie Technologies makes hybrid and electric powered bicycles and scooters with patented Electro-Drive Technology, under the iZip and eZip brands. The company builds products that offer cost effective, emissions-free alternatives to other forms of transportation for commuting, sport, and recreation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PNEJsWkDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017K10YC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]]}}
