{"item_id": "B0017KTOV8", "title": "Magnum Bulldog Knife", "description": "Put the Boker Magnum Bulldog in your hand and you know you are carrying a real knife! 440 stainless steel blade and sturdy G-10 handle scales. Easy one-hand open and close. This massive blade guarantees effective field work! Includes pocket clip. Weighs 6.3 ounce.", "text": "Magnum Bulldog Knife Put the Boker Magnum Bulldog in your hand and you know you are carrying a real knife! 440 stainless steel blade and sturdy G-10 handle scales. Easy one-hand open and close. This massive blade guarantees effective field work! Includes pocket clip. Weighs 6.3 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cZaU836vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KTOV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 16.47}}
{"item_id": "B0017KUSCC", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools VL-04 Vulcan Mini Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3-Inch VG10 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools VL-04 Vulcan Mini Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3-Inch VG10 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r54pwjtSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KUSCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 97.42}}
{"item_id": "B0017KV05Q", "title": "Cold Steel Shanghai Shadow Knife", "description": "The signature ring on our Shanghai Shadow gives this blade an assortment of advantages. This simple device allows tremendous versatility in handling the knife. It provides a totally secure grip when the index finger is locked in place through the hole. It can be pivoted around the index finger for a quick change from a forward to a reverse grip. And it can be a means of extending your arm's reach by up to 4-Inch when gripping the ring alone.", "text": "Cold Steel Shanghai Shadow Knife The signature ring on our Shanghai Shadow gives this blade an assortment of advantages. This simple device allows tremendous versatility in handling the knife. It provides a totally secure grip when the index finger is locked in place through the hole. It can be pivoted around the index finger for a quick change from a forward to a reverse grip. And it can be a means of extending your arm's reach by up to 4-Inch when gripping the ring alone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z0bagIsXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KV05Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.48}}
{"item_id": "B0017KV6ZU", "title": "Boker Plus Tek-Lok Adapter (Large)", "description": "The locking system allows the knife to be carried in the vertical or horizontal position on your belt or web gear. Attaches directly to a Kydex or plastic sheath. Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Inner dimensions are 1.5-Inch x 1.5-Inch. Hardware included.", "text": "Boker Plus Tek-Lok Adapter (Large) The locking system allows the knife to be carried in the vertical or horizontal position on your belt or web gear. Attaches directly to a Kydex or plastic sheath. Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Inner dimensions are 1.5-Inch x 1.5-Inch. Hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FZu%2BeA53L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KV6ZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.2}}
