{"item_id": "B0017KYWOW", "title": "Cold Steel FGX Battle Ring with Grivory Handle", "description": "Black as a moonless night and silent as the grave…these are the qualities that make up our new lightweight Nightshade™ series. Most are detailed reproductions of existing Cold Steel favorites and some are new designs representing the newest trends in high-tech, covert construction. Made from Grivory™- the latest in fiberglass reinforced plastic, and stronger than even the super tough Zytel® we have used in earlier models- they are UV and heat stabilized, making them impervious to the elements. One of the most unique features of these knives is their handles. They are made from deeply checkered Kraton that has been molded directly to the blade tangs. The use of Kraton in knife handles is a Cold Steel innovation that dates back to the early 1980's. It has been readily copied by most of our competitors because it offers a superior, slightly tacky gripping surface that is unaffected by heat, cold, or moisture. It never rusts, warps, cracks or splits even in the most extreme environments. Our FGX Battle Ring is distinguished by a short, broad, blade with a ferociously efficient point that resembles a shark's tooth. Yet, it's the handle and ring that are perhaps its most appealing features. They've been precisely shaped and contoured to comfortable accommodate most hands, providing a perch to facilitate different grip options.", "text": "Cold Steel FGX Battle Ring with Grivory Handle Black as a moonless night and silent as the grave…these are the qualities that make up our new lightweight Nightshade™ series. Most are detailed reproductions of existing Cold Steel favorites and some are new designs representing the newest trends in high-tech, covert construction. Made from Grivory™- the latest in fiberglass reinforced plastic, and stronger than even the super tough Zytel® we have used in earlier models- they are UV and heat stabilized, making them impervious to the elements. One of the most unique features of these knives is their handles. They are made from deeply checkered Kraton that has been molded directly to the blade tangs. The use of Kraton in knife handles is a Cold Steel innovation that dates back to the early 1980's. It has been readily copied by most of our competitors because it offers a superior, slightly tacky gripping surface that is unaffected by heat, cold, or moisture. It never rusts, warps, cracks or splits even in the most extreme environments. Our FGX Battle Ring is distinguished by a short, broad, blade with a ferociously efficient point that resembles a shark's tooth. Yet, it's the handle and ring that are perhaps its most appealing features. They've been precisely shaped and contoured to comfortable accommodate most hands, providing a perch to facilitate different grip options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3138FeKF0BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KYWOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 9.01}}
{"item_id": "B0017KZ5Z2", "title": "Boker Plus Tek-Lok Adapter (Small)", "description": "The locking system allows the knife to be carried in the vertical or horizontal position on your belt or web gear. Attaches directly to a Kydex or plastic sheath. Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Inner dimensions are 1.5-Inch x 1.5-Inch. Hardware included.", "text": "Boker Plus Tek-Lok Adapter (Small) The locking system allows the knife to be carried in the vertical or horizontal position on your belt or web gear. Attaches directly to a Kydex or plastic sheath. Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Inner dimensions are 1.5-Inch x 1.5-Inch. Hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BoIJPHCmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KZ5Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Video Games & Accessories"]], "price": 10.89}}
{"item_id": "B0017KZ8VI", "title": "Kershaw Zipit Gut Hook", "description": "This little 1/2\" sized tool is a must-have tool for any hunting trip. The Gut Hook's 420J2 stainless-steel construction delivers a high-quality cutting edge while the rubber-lined finger hole offers comfort during use.", "text": "Kershaw Zipit Gut Hook This little 1/2\" sized tool is a must-have tool for any hunting trip. The Gut Hook's 420J2 stainless-steel construction delivers a high-quality cutting edge while the rubber-lined finger hole offers comfort during use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lKk8AF42L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017KZ8VI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B0017L138E", "title": "Spyderco Tenacious Combo Edge Knife", "description": "Being tenacious means one holds fast. It means being tough and tireless until achieving your goal: all knife-worthy definitions for a worthy knife. This mid-sized Tenacious Combo Edge Knife by Spyderco has a partially serrated and plain edge. A black G-10 laminate handle was added with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The 8Cr13Mov stainless blade is leaf-shaped and ground flat from spine to cutting edge for cutting performance. The blade's shape coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Screw together construction.Weight 4oz (115g).", "text": "Spyderco Tenacious Combo Edge Knife Being tenacious means one holds fast. It means being tough and tireless until achieving your goal: all knife-worthy definitions for a worthy knife. This mid-sized Tenacious Combo Edge Knife by Spyderco has a partially serrated and plain edge. A black G-10 laminate handle was added with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The 8Cr13Mov stainless blade is leaf-shaped and ground flat from spine to cutting edge for cutting performance. The blade's shape coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Screw together construction.Weight 4oz (115g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2136CMArPxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017L138E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.0}}
{"item_id": "B0017LAORK", "title": "Teeter Hang Ups EP-550 Inversion Therapy Table", "description": "Whether you want to enjoy better posture, reduce back pain, or simply minimize your daily stress load, the Teeter Hang Ups EP-550 inversion therapy table makes a terrific choice. Inversion therapy works by placing your body in line with the downward force of gravity. In the process, inversion elongates the spine, increases the space between the vertebrae, and relieves the pressure on discs, ligaments, and nerve roots. And less pressure means less back pain, as well as fewer headaches and neck problems. Inversion is an ideal therapy for people with persistent spine and muscle problems, in addition to athletes who frequently push their body out of whack through repetitive muscle motions, such as runners, weightlifters, skiers, bikers, and golfers. Studies suggest that inverting yourself a mere 25 degrees for even a few minutes per day can have tremendously positive effects.The EP-550 is outfitted with such features as Flex Technology, which allows the backrest to bend accommodate your stretches for greater mobility and range of motion; an adjustable foot platform with two settings, allowing you to find the optimum position for ankle comfort and security; and an EZ Angle tether strap, which offers preset angles at 20, 40, and 60 degrees, along with custom angles depending on your preferred position. Other details include an adjustable head pillow for maximum comfort, an instructional DVD, and a 300-pound user capacity. The EP-550, which accommodates people as tall as 6 feet 6 inches, carries a five-year warranty.About Teeter Hang UpsRoger and Jennifer Teeter founded Hang Ups Inversion Products in 1981 and have been dedicated to manufacturing quality inversion products ever since. Roger and Jenny truly believe in the benefits of this simple, natural form of therapy that has been around since 400 BC. In the late 1970’s, Roger tried many forms of therapy to help manage his pain. He finally discovered that by inverting, he was able to relieve his back pain and begin the road to recovery. He credits inversion for keeping him pain free, healthy, and active. Inversion has changed Roger's life, and now he is dedicated to sharing his knowledge of inversion and quality products.STL International, creator of Teeter Hang Ups brand inversion equipment, has pioneered standards for quality and performance in the inversion market. All Teeter Hang Ups F-series inversion tables are classified in accordance with UL 2601-1 (medical equipment in a clinical setting), a rigid specification that tests the structural integrity of the equipment.", "text": "Teeter Hang Ups EP-550 Inversion Therapy Table Whether you want to enjoy better posture, reduce back pain, or simply minimize your daily stress load, the Teeter Hang Ups EP-550 inversion therapy table makes a terrific choice. Inversion therapy works by placing your body in line with the downward force of gravity. In the process, inversion elongates the spine, increases the space between the vertebrae, and relieves the pressure on discs, ligaments, and nerve roots. And less pressure means less back pain, as well as fewer headaches and neck problems. Inversion is an ideal therapy for people with persistent spine and muscle problems, in addition to athletes who frequently push their body out of whack through repetitive muscle motions, such as runners, weightlifters, skiers, bikers, and golfers. Studies suggest that inverting yourself a mere 25 degrees for even a few minutes per day can have tremendously positive effects.The EP-550 is outfitted with such features as Flex Technology, which allows the backrest to bend accommodate your stretches for greater mobility and range of motion; an adjustable foot platform with two settings, allowing you to find the optimum position for ankle comfort and security; and an EZ Angle tether strap, which offers preset angles at 20, 40, and 60 degrees, along with custom angles depending on your preferred position. Other details include an adjustable head pillow for maximum comfort, an instructional DVD, and a 300-pound user capacity. The EP-550, which accommodates people as tall as 6 feet 6 inches, carries a five-year warranty.About Teeter Hang UpsRoger and Jennifer Teeter founded Hang Ups Inversion Products in 1981 and have been dedicated to manufacturing quality inversion products ever since. Roger and Jenny truly believe in the benefits of this simple, natural form of therapy that has been around since 400 BC. In the late 1970’s, Roger tried many forms of therapy to help manage his pain. He finally discovered that by inverting, he was able to relieve his back pain and begin the road to recovery. He credits inversion for keeping him pain free, healthy, and active. Inversion has changed Roger's life, and now he is dedicated to sharing his knowledge of inversion and quality products.STL International, creator of Teeter Hang Ups brand inversion equipment, has pioneered standards for quality and performance in the inversion market. All Teeter Hang Ups F-series inversion tables are classified in accordance with UL 2601-1 (medical equipment in a clinical setting), a rigid specification that tests the structural integrity of the equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a6Y07Q7JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017LAORK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teeter Hang Ups", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 329.0}}
{"item_id": "B0017N5KB8", "title": "Umarex Hyper Velocity Pellets, .177 Caliber, 200 CT", "description": "RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets produce ultra high velocities in all medium powered air rifles. RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets sit inside a plastic sabot that provides a snug barrel fit for optimum velocity and accuracy. These lead free pellets will not produce lead particles in the air, in your barrel, or leave lead residue on your fingers. Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - 200 ct.", "text": "Umarex Hyper Velocity Pellets, .177 Caliber, 200 CT RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets produce ultra high velocities in all medium powered air rifles. RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets sit inside a plastic sabot that provides a snug barrel fit for optimum velocity and accuracy. These lead free pellets will not produce lead particles in the air, in your barrel, or leave lead residue on your fingers. Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - 200 ct.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-x78VO%2BnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017N5KB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0017OD3IO", "title": "Tacstar 4-Shot Remington 870, 1100 And 11-87 (20 Gauge)", "description": "TacStars new 4 round SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4 round SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the new Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. 20 Gauge only.", "text": "Tacstar 4-Shot Remington 870, 1100 And 11-87 (20 Gauge) TacStars new 4 round SideSaddle Shotshell Carrier is the perfect accessory for all your hunting shotguns. The 4 round SideSaddle mounts easily to the side of the receiver and requires no modifications to the shotgun. Each SideSaddle is designed to provide clearance for long forends, such as the new Benelli Nova model, and come with all mounting hardware. SideSaddles keep extra shells securely in place and in the perfect location for reloading. No more digging in the pockets for extra shells. 20 Gauge only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A%2BvOpeHWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017OD3IO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 26.06}}
{"item_id": "B0017OF5EE", "title": "Field & Stream Men's F503GWSTMT-LC Sport Watchand 12 Function Multi-Tool Set", "description": "", "text": "Field & Stream Men's F503GWSTMT-LC Sport Watchand 12 Function Multi-Tool Set", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511LoShdaEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017OF5EE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Jewelry: International Shipping Available"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Available for International Shipping"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017OSE1A", "title": "Hand Gripper Grip grips Forearm Strength 100, 150 & 200 SET", "description": "100, 150, & 200 LB in this set Hand grippers. Heavy Grips Aluminum HAND GRIPS. Super quality with machined aluminum and super grip at the handles. These sharp hand grippers are rated at 100, 150, 200 lbs at the spring Hand grippers are a must for strengthening your grip on all of your pulling movements. Deadlifts, rows, shrugs, pully work etc etc. These grippers are for your average lifter to your strongest lifter, 350 lb grippers are pretty tough. Add grippers to your lifting and you will pump out more reps as your hand and forearm strength will increase. Hand grippers are not to replace lifting straps totally, but to add to your grip regardless of if you use straps or not. Train like a pro and do it right. You can use these anywhere and anytime. (great when driving in traffic or watching TV)", "text": "Hand Gripper Grip grips Forearm Strength 100, 150 & 200 SET 100, 150, & 200 LB in this set Hand grippers. Heavy Grips Aluminum HAND GRIPS. Super quality with machined aluminum and super grip at the handles. These sharp hand grippers are rated at 100, 150, 200 lbs at the spring Hand grippers are a must for strengthening your grip on all of your pulling movements. Deadlifts, rows, shrugs, pully work etc etc. These grippers are for your average lifter to your strongest lifter, 350 lb grippers are pretty tough. Add grippers to your lifting and you will pump out more reps as your hand and forearm strength will increase. Hand grippers are not to replace lifting straps totally, but to add to your grip regardless of if you use straps or not. Train like a pro and do it right. You can use these anywhere and anytime. (great when driving in traffic or watching TV)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21PgE254AJL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017OSE1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heavy Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B0017OXYUG", "title": "ProMag Pistol Magazine Loader 9mm/40S&W", "description": "Pistol Magazine Loader: 9mm & .40 S&W; (blue steel) Fits: Magazines with top dimensions of 1 3/8: x 7/8\" and smaller. Fits Glock only. Increases the speed in which you can load a magazine and saves your thumb. Fits all Pro Mag 9mm Luger and 40 S&W; magazines.", "text": "ProMag Pistol Magazine Loader 9mm/40S&W Pistol Magazine Loader: 9mm & .40 S&W; (blue steel) Fits: Magazines with top dimensions of 1 3/8: x 7/8\" and smaller. Fits Glock only. Increases the speed in which you can load a magazine and saves your thumb. Fits all Pro Mag 9mm Luger and 40 S&W; magazines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3110YOaxa7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017OXYUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.68}}
{"item_id": "B0017RAMCQ", "title": "V-Share Adult Ajustable Bike helmet", "description": "Stay safe while cycling with adjustable bike helmet. The Thrasher is comfortable in any weather, with integrated flow vents and moisture-wicking pads to keep you dry. To ensure a secure fit, the helmet includes a Dual Fit adjustable design and easy-to-adjust webbing. And riders will love the built-in visor, which provides increased shade while riding.", "text": "V-Share Adult Ajustable Bike helmet Stay safe while cycling with adjustable bike helmet. The Thrasher is comfortable in any weather, with integrated flow vents and moisture-wicking pads to keep you dry. To ensure a secure fit, the helmet includes a Dual Fit adjustable design and easy-to-adjust webbing. And riders will love the built-in visor, which provides increased shade while riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WJ-y5B6gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017RAMCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 19.07}}
