{"item_id": "B0017RYO7K", "title": "Park Tool Self-Adhesive Patch Kit", "description": "3M-designed, self-adhesive tube patch system. Patch material stretches and flexes with tube. Includes: (6) self-adhesive patches, and sandpaper. Comes in small plastic storage box (carded blister-pack).", "text": "Park Tool Self-Adhesive Patch Kit 3M-designed, self-adhesive tube patch system. Patch material stretches and flexes with tube. Includes: (6) self-adhesive patches, and sandpaper. Comes in small plastic storage box (carded blister-pack).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VBYMxf-sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017RYO7K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017S37VI", "title": "Grizzly 2 Person +0 Degree Rip Stop Sleeping Bag (Olive)", "description": "Grizzly bags offer the most durable comfortable and warm bags on the market with all the features that you would expect from Black Pine Sports our bags are wider and longer than the competition with the choice of either a canvas shell or rip-stop shell an", "text": "Grizzly 2 Person +0 Degree Rip Stop Sleeping Bag (Olive) Grizzly bags offer the most durable comfortable and warm bags on the market with all the features that you would expect from Black Pine Sports our bags are wider and longer than the competition with the choice of either a canvas shell or rip-stop shell an", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GOrObphWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017S37VI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grizzly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 139.06}}
{"item_id": "B0017SC15G", "title": "Lizard Skins Peaty Lock-On Cheers Grip Graphite, S", "description": "Install the comfy Lizard Skins Peaty Lock-On Cheers Grip and roll with a non-slip, dampening, and secure grip.", "text": "Lizard Skins Peaty Lock-On Cheers Grip Graphite, S Install the comfy Lizard Skins Peaty Lock-On Cheers Grip and roll with a non-slip, dampening, and secure grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dnma7236L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017SC15G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017SC9H6", "title": "Zero Tolerance Combat Folding Knife", "description": "Designed by ZT and Strider, this combat folder is equipped with SpeedSafe® manual assisted opening for easy, one-handed blade deployment. Just push on the ambidextrous thumb stud or pull back on the blade protrusion and the knife is good to go. An S30V stainless steel blade with matte-black Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating provides extreme durability and wear and corrosion resistance. The Tungsten DLC coating enhances hardness and reduces friction drag. 3-D machined, G-10 scales provide a secure, all-weather grip. A 3/8-inch hex head pivot shaft nut makes field adjustments possible with minimal tools. Includes a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip carry.", "text": "Zero Tolerance Combat Folding Knife Designed by ZT and Strider, this combat folder is equipped with SpeedSafe® manual assisted opening for easy, one-handed blade deployment. Just push on the ambidextrous thumb stud or pull back on the blade protrusion and the knife is good to go. An S30V stainless steel blade with matte-black Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating provides extreme durability and wear and corrosion resistance. The Tungsten DLC coating enhances hardness and reduces friction drag. 3-D machined, G-10 scales provide a secure, all-weather grip. A 3/8-inch hex head pivot shaft nut makes field adjustments possible with minimal tools. Includes a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left or right-handed clip carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TSY5lNTXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017SC9H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 199.0}}
