{"item_id": "B0017T1HEG", "title": "Nathan Trail Mix Hydration Belt", "description": "The only bounce-free, easy-access, fully-adjustable, two bottle belt out there.", "text": "Nathan Trail Mix Hydration Belt The only bounce-free, easy-access, fully-adjustable, two bottle belt out there.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HczDYXndL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017T1HEG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017TDL18", "title": "Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack", "description": "FEATURES of the Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack High-strength aluminum Long tapered point makes staking easy SPECIFICATIONS of the Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack Weight: 0.6 oz / 0.02 kg Length: 7\" / 17.9 cm Material: 7001 Aluminum", "text": "Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack FEATURES of the Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack High-strength aluminum Long tapered point makes staking easy SPECIFICATIONS of the Sierra Designs Hex Peg Tent Stake - 6 Pack Weight: 0.6 oz / 0.02 kg Length: 7\" / 17.9 cm Material: 7001 Aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21tzvcvGKFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017TDL18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sierra Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B0017TFPV2", "title": "Sierra Designs Y Peg Stakes - 6 PK", "description": "The Sierra Designs Y Peg Stakes comes 6 to a pack. They are extremely light and durable. They are a 3 sided 'Y' shape which provides superior surface area on the stake to hold the ground. Made of 7075-T6 anodized aluminum. They are not impossible to bend but you really have to work at it.3 sided 'Y' stake.Notched to hold guy line.Imported.", "text": "Sierra Designs Y Peg Stakes - 6 PK The Sierra Designs Y Peg Stakes comes 6 to a pack. They are extremely light and durable. They are a 3 sided 'Y' shape which provides superior surface area on the stake to hold the ground. Made of 7075-T6 anodized aluminum. They are not impossible to bend but you really have to work at it.3 sided 'Y' stake.Notched to hold guy line.Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/218QBpNow1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017TFPV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sierra Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 10.16}}
{"item_id": "B0017TG8F4", "title": "ALPS OutdoorZ Tri-Leg Stool (Realtree Xtra HD)", "description": "ALPS OutdoorZ Tri-Leg Stool is perfect to bring along when space is limited and weight is a factor. The Tri-Leg folds up and fits compactly into a carry bag. The two pound stool is made of a powder coated steel frame and has a reinforcing extra center support system to hold up to 250 pounds. The fabric is made of durable 600D polyester. There is also a carry strap attached to the Tri-Leg in case you don’t want to bring the carry bag along.", "text": "ALPS OutdoorZ Tri-Leg Stool (Realtree Xtra HD) ALPS OutdoorZ Tri-Leg Stool is perfect to bring along when space is limited and weight is a factor. The Tri-Leg folds up and fits compactly into a carry bag. The two pound stool is made of a powder coated steel frame and has a reinforcing extra center support system to hold up to 250 pounds. The fabric is made of durable 600D polyester. There is also a carry strap attached to the Tri-Leg in case you don’t want to bring the carry bag along.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zrxQJvUpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017TG8F4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Stools"]], "price": 13.49}}
