{"item_id": "B0017UG3FI", "title": "Airsoft Shotgun Pump w/ Shells - Flashlight - Red Dot", "description": "DescriptionRealistic pump action shotgun with retractable stock. Includes realistic shells that can hold 14 bb's each. Each gun comes complete with 4 shells, adjustable hop-up, long metal barrel (23cm, super accuracy and range), and shell holster. Shells included are compatible with shotguns from Tokyo Marui! Shoots 280 FPS with 0.2g bb's, estimated 40 yard range, about 4 lbs, and is a spring pump action shotgun with pistol grip. FeaturesFull SizeAdjustable StockIncludes Red Dot, Flashlight and bbs.4 Shells Included - compatible with Tokyo Marui Shotguns", "text": "Airsoft Shotgun Pump w/ Shells - Flashlight - Red Dot DescriptionRealistic pump action shotgun with retractable stock. Includes realistic shells that can hold 14 bb's each. Each gun comes complete with 4 shells, adjustable hop-up, long metal barrel (23cm, super accuracy and range), and shell holster. Shells included are compatible with shotguns from Tokyo Marui! Shoots 280 FPS with 0.2g bb's, estimated 40 yard range, about 4 lbs, and is a spring pump action shotgun with pistol grip. FeaturesFull SizeAdjustable StockIncludes Red Dot, Flashlight and bbs.4 Shells Included - compatible with Tokyo Marui Shotguns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LU-K%2BHeRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UG3FI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Shotguns"]], "price": 25.45}}
{"item_id": "B0017UU07U", "title": "PROPPER F550238 Adult's Boonie Battle Rip(R) 65P/35C Ripstop", "description": "", "text": "PROPPER F550238 Adult's Boonie Battle Rip(R) 65P/35C Ripstop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RJSE8lxoL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UU07U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Propper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Work Wear & Uniforms", "Clothing", "Military", "Men", "Accessories"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Band & Music Fan", "Accessories"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B0017UU5ZW", "title": "Cold Steel Wakazashi Bokken with Polypropylene", "description": "The Bokkens are made with slightly longer handles to accommodate your training equipment. Here, the O Tanto trainer is shown being griped in a Hockey Glove. Hundreds of years ago, the Japanese discovered a simple truth; that to become a good swordsman you'll have to practice, a great deal. To become a great swordsman you'll have to practice with a \"live blade\". And during the period between \"good\" and \"great\", you should spend your time building your skills and confidence enough to wield a razor sharp Katana safely and effectively. To accomplish this, the Japanese relied on a simple wooden sword called a \"bokken\" for much of their training. It was made from the super tough wood of the Japanese White Oak, a wood they called Kashi. The swords produced from this wood had the advantage of replicating the size, weight and feel of a steel sword, while minimizing the possibility of causing grievous or permanent injury to those who used it. Authentic Kashi wood Bokkens are still used today, but are becoming quite costly. They also have the disadvantages, being made of wood, that they may rot, crack split or splinter. Cold Steel's solution to these dilemmas was to design a synthetic substitute, low in price and impervious to the elements. Our Bokken is made of the heaviest grade polypropylene available. While they're not quite as rigid as wood, they have the advantages of being virtually unbreakable and remarkably stiff and cut resistant.", "text": "Cold Steel Wakazashi Bokken with Polypropylene The Bokkens are made with slightly longer handles to accommodate your training equipment. Here, the O Tanto trainer is shown being griped in a Hockey Glove. Hundreds of years ago, the Japanese discovered a simple truth; that to become a good swordsman you'll have to practice, a great deal. To become a great swordsman you'll have to practice with a \"live blade\". And during the period between \"good\" and \"great\", you should spend your time building your skills and confidence enough to wield a razor sharp Katana safely and effectively. To accomplish this, the Japanese relied on a simple wooden sword called a \"bokken\" for much of their training. It was made from the super tough wood of the Japanese White Oak, a wood they called Kashi. The swords produced from this wood had the advantage of replicating the size, weight and feel of a steel sword, while minimizing the possibility of causing grievous or permanent injury to those who used it. Authentic Kashi wood Bokkens are still used today, but are becoming quite costly. They also have the disadvantages, being made of wood, that they may rot, crack split or splinter. Cold Steel's solution to these dilemmas was to design a synthetic substitute, low in price and impervious to the elements. Our Bokken is made of the heaviest grade polypropylene available. While they're not quite as rigid as wood, they have the advantages of being virtually unbreakable and remarkably stiff and cut resistant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316r9dSwKfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UU5ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.69}}
{"item_id": "B0017UUHDW", "title": "Magnum Damascus Lady Knife", "description": "With this exclusive high class Magnum Lady pocket knife, we bring you an extraordinary collection of Damascus and exotic woods. This knife features genuine forged Damascus blades with 37 layers. No etching or fake patterns - this is the real deal! Charm, character and quality at a very reasonable price. The Lady pocketknife is a classic double bolster knife with dress plates made of polished stainless steel. Carefully selected burl wood is used for the handle, which gives the knife its high class look. Back lock mechanism. Does not have pocket clip. Weighs 2.5 ounce.", "text": "Magnum Damascus Lady Knife With this exclusive high class Magnum Lady pocket knife, we bring you an extraordinary collection of Damascus and exotic woods. This knife features genuine forged Damascus blades with 37 layers. No etching or fake patterns - this is the real deal! Charm, character and quality at a very reasonable price. The Lady pocketknife is a classic double bolster knife with dress plates made of polished stainless steel. Carefully selected burl wood is used for the handle, which gives the knife its high class look. Back lock mechanism. Does not have pocket clip. Weighs 2.5 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zpQ9xraVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UUHDW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.08}}
{"item_id": "B0017UV9W0", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M16-10KZ 3-Inch Black Folding Knife", "description": "Carson M16-10KZ made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a scaled down version of the M16. This black Zytel handled everyday knife has the AutoLAWKS system which automatically converts them into virtual fixed blades when opened. The 3-inch AUS 4 black stainless steel tanto blade has a razor sharp edge that allows easy resharpening and holds a great edge. The easy one handed opening and closing is as velvet smooth as the larger models the result of Teflon bearings at the blade pivot.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M16-10KZ 3-Inch Black Folding Knife Carson M16-10KZ made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a scaled down version of the M16. This black Zytel handled everyday knife has the AutoLAWKS system which automatically converts them into virtual fixed blades when opened. The 3-inch AUS 4 black stainless steel tanto blade has a razor sharp edge that allows easy resharpening and holds a great edge. The easy one handed opening and closing is as velvet smooth as the larger models the result of Teflon bearings at the blade pivot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bs-%2BSaRhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UV9W0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.94}}
{"item_id": "B0017UVI94", "title": "Spyderco Lady Bug Knife", "description": "This loose change knife is ideal for a woman's hand bag. High carbon, stainless steel blade features a 50/50 plain edge/serrated edge. Locking blade can be closed with one hand. Zytel handle has non-slip grip. 1.75 in. blade. 2.5 in. closed length. Wt. .6oz.", "text": "Spyderco Lady Bug Knife This loose change knife is ideal for a woman's hand bag. High carbon, stainless steel blade features a 50/50 plain edge/serrated edge. Locking blade can be closed with one hand. Zytel handle has non-slip grip. 1.75 in. blade. 2.5 in. closed length. Wt. .6oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MBSwsIBkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UVI94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.07}}
{"item_id": "B0017UZJ9Y", "title": "Spyderco Salt I Plain Edge Yellow H-1 Steel Knife", "description": "H1 is a PH steel meaning it is precipitation-processed alloy, that's rolled hard without heat treating and has .1% nitrogen which acts like carbon in the steel matrix, but does not react to chlorine making rust. Surprisingly, it holds a sharpened cutting edge comparable to the premium knife steels being used in the industry by most knife manufacturers.", "text": "Spyderco Salt I Plain Edge Yellow H-1 Steel Knife H1 is a PH steel meaning it is precipitation-processed alloy, that's rolled hard without heat treating and has .1% nitrogen which acts like carbon in the steel matrix, but does not react to chlorine making rust. Surprisingly, it holds a sharpened cutting edge comparable to the premium knife steels being used in the industry by most knife manufacturers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y%2BV5KR02L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017UZJ9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 60.47}}
{"item_id": "B0017V19VK", "title": "Cold Steel 97MKM Magnum Kukri", "description": "A reliable workhorse machete, the Magnum Kukri can out-chop and out-cut knives with far larger price tags. The Kukri's 17-inch blade features the same distinctive weight-forward balance as Cold Steel's top-of-the-line models, helping it handle the toughest chores life can dish out. The blade edge is also presented on an angle, so it's guaranteed to \"bite\" deep with every stroke. As a result, the machete is ideal for clearing fields, chopping tall weeds, and cutting through dense branches. Also outfitted with a sturdy polypropylene handle, the Magnum Kukri comes with a sturdy Cordura sheath.SpecificationsBlade length: 17 inchesBlade thickness: 2.75mmHandle: PolypropyleneOverall length: 22 inchesWeight: 18.2 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel 97MKM Magnum Kukri A reliable workhorse machete, the Magnum Kukri can out-chop and out-cut knives with far larger price tags. The Kukri's 17-inch blade features the same distinctive weight-forward balance as Cold Steel's top-of-the-line models, helping it handle the toughest chores life can dish out. The blade edge is also presented on an angle, so it's guaranteed to \"bite\" deep with every stroke. As a result, the machete is ideal for clearing fields, chopping tall weeds, and cutting through dense branches. Also outfitted with a sturdy polypropylene handle, the Magnum Kukri comes with a sturdy Cordura sheath.SpecificationsBlade length: 17 inchesBlade thickness: 2.75mmHandle: PolypropyleneOverall length: 22 inchesWeight: 18.2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21wMW7JfACL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017V19VK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 22.49}}
{"item_id": "B0017V1BFO", "title": "Cold Steel FGX Skean Dhu with Kraton Handle", "description": "Our Nightshade™ knives are light enough to be tied, tucked, or taped just about anywhere on one’s person. And, since they are impervious to heat, cold, moisture and extreme weather they are a natural to hide both inside and outside your house. They can be hidden virtually everywhere from the hedges and flowerpots in your yard, to the refrigerator, bookshelves, and closets in your house. Keep one in every room of the house, from the laundry room to the bathroom shower! With violent home invasions on the rise a strategically placed Nightshade™ could save the day, and even your life.", "text": "Cold Steel FGX Skean Dhu with Kraton Handle Our Nightshade™ knives are light enough to be tied, tucked, or taped just about anywhere on one’s person. And, since they are impervious to heat, cold, moisture and extreme weather they are a natural to hide both inside and outside your house. They can be hidden virtually everywhere from the hedges and flowerpots in your yard, to the refrigerator, bookshelves, and closets in your house. Keep one in every room of the house, from the laundry room to the bathroom shower! With violent home invasions on the rise a strategically placed Nightshade™ could save the day, and even your life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SSNzOVF0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017V1BFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 9.3}}
{"item_id": "B0017V1I70", "title": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Knife with Straight Edge, Black, Large", "description": "Benner has trained thousands of law enforcement personnel since founding TDI in 1986. Prior to that time he served as Lieutenant of the Village of Fairfax Police Department, Coordinator of the Drug Abuse Reduction Task Force, and Tactical Field Commander of the Hamilton County Police Association Special Weapons and Tactics Team (S.W.A.T.). John has developed courses for raid tactics, tactical weapons instructor schools, defensive tactics and knife programs that are currently taught to law enforcement, military and civilian groups.", "text": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Knife with Straight Edge, Black, Large Benner has trained thousands of law enforcement personnel since founding TDI in 1986. Prior to that time he served as Lieutenant of the Village of Fairfax Police Department, Coordinator of the Drug Abuse Reduction Task Force, and Tactical Field Commander of the Hamilton County Police Association Special Weapons and Tactics Team (S.W.A.T.). John has developed courses for raid tactics, tactical weapons instructor schools, defensive tactics and knife programs that are currently taught to law enforcement, military and civilian groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ObfvaSesL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017V1I70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 41.97}}
