{"item_id": "B0017W2CCE", "title": "Valeo Burst Resistant Ball", "description": "Exercise several muscle groups at once Improve your balance, coordination and flexibility Develop a healthier posture For individuals 5'0\" - 5'3\" in heightIncludes exercise DVD and a dual action air pump", "text": "Valeo Burst Resistant Ball Exercise several muscle groups at once Improve your balance, coordination and flexibility Develop a healthier posture For individuals 5'0\" - 5'3\" in heightIncludes exercise DVD and a dual action air pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315WHEJNb1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017W2CCE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0017WJR9U", "title": "AmericanThawk American Tomahawk VTAC Lagana", "description": "Often, we find military items, designed for combat, that transition perfectly into the realm of wilderness survival. The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk (VTAC) is a prime example of this. We highly recommend a survival axe of some sort and this durable hand axe, or survival tomahawk, fits the bill.A survival tomahawk, like the LaGana Tactical Tomahawk or VTAC, can be used for emergency aircraft extraction, building shelters, cutting firewood, self defense and numerous other life saving uses. Because it is EXTREMELY durable and very sharp, there is practically no cutting task that it cannot accomplish. Durability and utility are two of the most important traits we look for when evaluating survival equipment. The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk is overflowing with both.The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk (a.k.a. \"VTAC\") is the standard by which all other tactical axes are judged. Battle proven for over 40 years, Peter LaGana's axe-head design has served the United States in every major conflict since the Vietnam War. Modernized with 21st century materials and workmanship, the new LaGana Tactical Tomahawk sets the bar for ease of carry, toughness, and versatility. No axe in the War on Terror has seen and done more.The military approved VTAC comes fully equipped with a heavy duty nylon sheath. This is the REAL VTAC, not a cheap knockoff version.Made in the USA", "text": "AmericanThawk American Tomahawk VTAC Lagana Often, we find military items, designed for combat, that transition perfectly into the realm of wilderness survival. The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk (VTAC) is a prime example of this. We highly recommend a survival axe of some sort and this durable hand axe, or survival tomahawk, fits the bill.A survival tomahawk, like the LaGana Tactical Tomahawk or VTAC, can be used for emergency aircraft extraction, building shelters, cutting firewood, self defense and numerous other life saving uses. Because it is EXTREMELY durable and very sharp, there is practically no cutting task that it cannot accomplish. Durability and utility are two of the most important traits we look for when evaluating survival equipment. The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk is overflowing with both.The LaGana Tactical Tomahawk (a.k.a. \"VTAC\") is the standard by which all other tactical axes are judged. Battle proven for over 40 years, Peter LaGana's axe-head design has served the United States in every major conflict since the Vietnam War. Modernized with 21st century materials and workmanship, the new LaGana Tactical Tomahawk sets the bar for ease of carry, toughness, and versatility. No axe in the War on Terror has seen and done more.The military approved VTAC comes fully equipped with a heavy duty nylon sheath. This is the REAL VTAC, not a cheap knockoff version.Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XcaTvEY2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017WJR9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AmericanThawk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 107.0}}
{"item_id": "B0017WZQ7C", "title": "Picatinny Mounted Pistol Laser", "description": "This Crosman under-barrel laser sight is designed to fit 1-inch Weaver-style rails. Once mounted, the sight projects an adjustable red beam for easier aiming. The sight comes with three LR44X3 4.5-volt batteries.", "text": "Picatinny Mounted Pistol Laser This Crosman under-barrel laser sight is designed to fit 1-inch Weaver-style rails. Once mounted, the sight projects an adjustable red beam for easier aiming. The sight comes with three LR44X3 4.5-volt batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YtaBjtDhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017WZQ7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 15.45}}
{"item_id": "B0017WZQDQ", "title": "Crosman 2 Pack Spare Clips for the Model SM2C11", "description": "Don't forget to stock up on ammo before you head out for the firing range. This two-pack of ammunition clips is compatible with the Crosman SM2C11 CO2 pistol. Each easy-loading clip holds 15 rounds.About CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "text": "Crosman 2 Pack Spare Clips for the Model SM2C11 Don't forget to stock up on ammo before you head out for the firing range. This two-pack of ammunition clips is compatible with the Crosman SM2C11 CO2 pistol. Each easy-loading clip holds 15 rounds.About CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iqCWc7IpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017WZQDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 13.9}}
{"item_id": "B0017X3EKM", "title": "Crosman Airgun Ammo Pouch, Holds 500 Pellets", "description": "Soft Interior lining, Velcro closure, Velcro attachable and fully adjustable belt keeper. Layered composite materials to maintain great shape during any field operations. Holds up to 500 pellets.", "text": "Crosman Airgun Ammo Pouch, Holds 500 Pellets Soft Interior lining, Velcro closure, Velcro attachable and fully adjustable belt keeper. Layered composite materials to maintain great shape during any field operations. Holds up to 500 pellets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21eXS6tFnqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017X3EKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 6.95}}
