{"item_id": "B0017X6JTA", "title": "Crosman R71 airsoft gun", "description": "It features semi- and full-auto modes, a high-cap/gravity-fed hopper (looks like a scope). Includes rechargeable NiMH battery, UL charger, adjustable stock, removable compensator, tri-rail mounting system and 600-rd hopper. Generates muzzle velocities up to 200 fps.... Click on the AMMO link for a list of recommended BBs. Find safety glasses and other necessities by clicking on our ACCESSORIES link.... Semi and full-auto electric assault airsoft rifle!...", "text": "Crosman R71 airsoft gun It features semi- and full-auto modes, a high-cap/gravity-fed hopper (looks like a scope). Includes rechargeable NiMH battery, UL charger, adjustable stock, removable compensator, tri-rail mounting system and 600-rd hopper. Generates muzzle velocities up to 200 fps.... Click on the AMMO link for a list of recommended BBs. Find safety glasses and other necessities by clicking on our ACCESSORIES link.... Semi and full-auto electric assault airsoft rifle!...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K-qmlwbyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017X6JTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 43.29}}
{"item_id": "B0017YEMPM", "title": "3M Peltor Optime 105 Behind-the-Head Earmuff with Neckband (H10B)", "description": "The Peltor Optime 105 earmuff is recommended for very high noise level environments. Safe, comfortable, and economical for all-day protection. Note, this is the behind-the-head model.", "text": "3M Peltor Optime 105 Behind-the-Head Earmuff with Neckband (H10B) The Peltor Optime 105 earmuff is recommended for very high noise level environments. Safe, comfortable, and economical for all-day protection. Note, this is the behind-the-head model.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TIOGS3a%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0017YEMPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 20.0}}
