{"item_id": "B00181B8LK", "title": "Shock Doctor Adult Pro Strapless Mouthguard (Smoke)", "description": "Proven Dual Composite Construction with internal shock-absorbing frame offers protection and fit that outperforms conventional mouthguards. Shock Absorbing Jaw Pads help protect against concussions and create a channel for improved breathing. Shock Absorbing Bumper absorbs and deflects impact away from front teeth. Works well with braces.", "text": "Shock Doctor Adult Pro Strapless Mouthguard (Smoke) Proven Dual Composite Construction with internal shock-absorbing frame offers protection and fit that outperforms conventional mouthguards. Shock Absorbing Jaw Pads help protect against concussions and create a channel for improved breathing. Shock Absorbing Bumper absorbs and deflects impact away from front teeth. Works well with braces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412UcPrnIiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00181B8LK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shock Doctor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]], "price": 6.6}}
{"item_id": "B00182PA5E", "title": "Beeman BB Speed Loader .177 Caliber Pellets with 1000 BBs", "description": "BB Speed loader - Refillable speed loader for quick, easy loading. - Prevents spilling and loss of BB's - Includes 1000 premium grade .177 caliber steel BB's", "text": "Beeman BB Speed Loader .177 Caliber Pellets with 1000 BBs BB Speed loader - Refillable speed loader for quick, easy loading. - Prevents spilling and loss of BB's - Includes 1000 premium grade .177 caliber steel BB's", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZxCce4O4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00182PA5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marksman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 3.95}}
{"item_id": "B00183IO24", "title": "BlueWater Tubular Climb-Spec Webbing - 1\" x 30 ft", "description": "Favored by Professional climbers for its uncompromising construction, this webbing out performs normal mil-spec webbing in strength, flexibility, knotability and durability.", "text": "BlueWater Tubular Climb-Spec Webbing - 1\" x 30 ft Favored by Professional climbers for its uncompromising construction, this webbing out performs normal mil-spec webbing in strength, flexibility, knotability and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516umz2xuUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00183IO24.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Ropes, Cords & Webbing", "Webbing"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00183TNTM", "title": "Energy by Optimus Gas", "description": "Optimus Gas Canisters contain a premium blend of butane and propane to ensure stove performance even when the conditions are a bit brisk. The canister is protected from damages with a smart seal that indicates if the canister is unused or not.", "text": "Energy by Optimus Gas Optimus Gas Canisters contain a premium blend of butane and propane to ensure stove performance even when the conditions are a bit brisk. The canister is protected from damages with a smart seal that indicates if the canister is unused or not.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZayqFIDuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00183TNTM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00186MOPO", "title": "Body Solid Super Mat RF36T Treadmill Mat", "description": "Protect your floor from scratches and dents with this Body Solid treadmill and equipment mat. Perfect for treadmills, ski exercisers, and even as a general aerobics mat, the covering is made of a super-tough PVC material that measures 36 by 78 inches. Once down, it helps protect your floors and carpets from the damaging effects of heavy exercise equipment and debris, prolongs the life of your equipment by keeping floor and carpet dust from entering belts and mechanical parts, and dampens the vibrations that cause wear and tear on your equipment. As a bonus, the mat also muffles noises so that family and neighbors aren't disturbed while you exercise. The mat carries a one-year warranty.", "text": "Body Solid Super Mat RF36T Treadmill Mat Protect your floor from scratches and dents with this Body Solid treadmill and equipment mat. Perfect for treadmills, ski exercisers, and even as a general aerobics mat, the covering is made of a super-tough PVC material that measures 36 by 78 inches. Once down, it helps protect your floors and carpets from the damaging effects of heavy exercise equipment and debris, prolongs the life of your equipment by keeping floor and carpet dust from entering belts and mechanical parts, and dampens the vibrations that cause wear and tear on your equipment. As a bonus, the mat also muffles noises so that family and neighbors aren't disturbed while you exercise. The mat carries a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VvjSGsp4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00186MOPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Protective Flooring"]], "price": 29.22}}
{"item_id": "B00186NOK8", "title": "Body Solid Super Mat RF34B Bike and Step Mat", "description": "Protect your floor from scratches and dents with this Body Solid bike and equipment mat. Perfect for exercise bikes, ski exercisers, and even as a general aerobics mat, the covering is made of a super-tough PVC material that measures 36 by 48 inches. Once down, it helps protect your floors and carpets from the damaging effects of heavy exercise equipment and debris, prolongs the life of your equipment by keeping floor and carpet dust from entering belts and mechanical parts, and dampens the vibrations that cause wear and tear on your equipment. As a bonus, the mat also muffles noises so that family and neighbors aren't disturbed while you exercise. The mat carries a one-year warranty.", "text": "Body Solid Super Mat RF34B Bike and Step Mat Protect your floor from scratches and dents with this Body Solid bike and equipment mat. Perfect for exercise bikes, ski exercisers, and even as a general aerobics mat, the covering is made of a super-tough PVC material that measures 36 by 48 inches. Once down, it helps protect your floors and carpets from the damaging effects of heavy exercise equipment and debris, prolongs the life of your equipment by keeping floor and carpet dust from entering belts and mechanical parts, and dampens the vibrations that cause wear and tear on your equipment. As a bonus, the mat also muffles noises so that family and neighbors aren't disturbed while you exercise. The mat carries a one-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vLAzRBVBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00186NOK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 55.0}}
