{"item_id": "B001876XYG", "title": "ZFOsports® - 60LBS ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST", "description": "This 60lbs weighted vest is designed to contour and stay tight to your body even under the most intense workouts. This adjustable weighted vest is designed for both men and women, and is a great starter for people who wants a reliabe vest at a great price. It fits snuggly to your body, and allows you to move and breathe easy when you workout. Adjust the weight by adding or removing individual weighted bags to achieve desired weight. Fasten tight to the torso, molded, custom fit eliminates weight shifting during activities like power walking, polymeric, hill bounding, running, lateral drills and vertical jumps.(Its comes with a Velcro belt that keeps the vest tight to the body) Weighted vests are also used in the gym when performing squats, lunges, dips, pull-ups, push-ups, etc. Add resistance to training routine without compromising biomechanics. Increase Strength and Speed, Accelerate Weight Loss, Improve Respiration, Build muscle, Gain speedand power. Achieve your goals twice as fast and with Z Fitness vest, double the results. Note: Buyer must purchase through MiR Weighted Vest on Amazon for warranty to be valid. Trademark & Copyright 2010 Z Fitness Inc.", "text": "ZFOsports® - 60LBS ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST This 60lbs weighted vest is designed to contour and stay tight to your body even under the most intense workouts. This adjustable weighted vest is designed for both men and women, and is a great starter for people who wants a reliabe vest at a great price. It fits snuggly to your body, and allows you to move and breathe easy when you workout. Adjust the weight by adding or removing individual weighted bags to achieve desired weight. Fasten tight to the torso, molded, custom fit eliminates weight shifting during activities like power walking, polymeric, hill bounding, running, lateral drills and vertical jumps.(Its comes with a Velcro belt that keeps the vest tight to the body) Weighted vests are also used in the gym when performing squats, lunges, dips, pull-ups, push-ups, etc. Add resistance to training routine without compromising biomechanics. Increase Strength and Speed, Accelerate Weight Loss, Improve Respiration, Build muscle, Gain speedand power. Achieve your goals twice as fast and with Z Fitness vest, double the results. Note: Buyer must purchase through MiR Weighted Vest on Amazon for warranty to be valid. Trademark & Copyright 2010 Z Fitness Inc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BxBEYZawL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001876XYG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Vests"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B00187AU2M", "title": "MSR Autoflow Gravity Filter", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the MSR Autoflow Gravity Filter No Pumping: Lets gravity do the work, so you don't have to Fast: Filters more than 1.75 liters per minute Field Maintainable: Can be cleaned repeatedly for flow recovery; no tools required for complete disassembly The SPECS Protozoa Bacteria Particulate Weight: 10.5 oz / 299 g Dimension: 4\" x 6\" / 10 x 15 cm Filter Matrix: Hollow Fiber Filter Pore Size: 0.2 Micron Flow: 1.75 Liters per minute Cartridge Life: 1500 Liters Field Cleanable Field Maintainable Water Bottle Adapter This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "MSR Autoflow Gravity Filter DECENT FEATURES of the MSR Autoflow Gravity Filter No Pumping: Lets gravity do the work, so you don't have to Fast: Filters more than 1.75 liters per minute Field Maintainable: Can be cleaned repeatedly for flow recovery; no tools required for complete disassembly The SPECS Protozoa Bacteria Particulate Weight: 10.5 oz / 299 g Dimension: 4\" x 6\" / 10 x 15 cm Filter Matrix: Hollow Fiber Filter Pore Size: 0.2 Micron Flow: 1.75 Liters per minute Cartridge Life: 1500 Liters Field Cleanable Field Maintainable Water Bottle Adapter This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416hXT0PptL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00187AU2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 109.95}}
{"item_id": "B00187CZ0W", "title": "MSR Hyperflow Microfilter", "description": "Why did MSR's Hyperflow Microfilter win the 08 Backpacker Editor's Choice Award' It's super small (7 x 3. 5in), super light (7. 4oz), and it pumps three liters per minute. That means you can pack quick-filtering power without sacrificing weight or space on your fast-pace backpacking trips. The Hyperflow Microfilter's float end stays face-down in the lake or stream and won't clog up as you pump, and an included Quick Connect Bottle Adapter connects to MSR, Nalgene, and other bottles with 63mm threaded openings. No tools are needed to disassemble the Hyperflow Microfileter for on-the-go cleaning.", "text": "MSR Hyperflow Microfilter Why did MSR's Hyperflow Microfilter win the 08 Backpacker Editor's Choice Award' It's super small (7 x 3. 5in), super light (7. 4oz), and it pumps three liters per minute. That means you can pack quick-filtering power without sacrificing weight or space on your fast-pace backpacking trips. The Hyperflow Microfilter's float end stays face-down in the lake or stream and won't clog up as you pump, and an included Quick Connect Bottle Adapter connects to MSR, Nalgene, and other bottles with 63mm threaded openings. No tools are needed to disassemble the Hyperflow Microfileter for on-the-go cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ex7CRIQjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00187CZ0W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 85.84}}
{"item_id": "B00187XPBU", "title": "Park Tool Shimano/ISIS Bottom Bracket Tool", "description": "Use the trusty Shimano/ISIS Bottom Bracket Tool to service or replace your ISIS bottom brackets without screaming or needing the assistance of your local mechanic.", "text": "Park Tool Shimano/ISIS Bottom Bracket Tool Use the trusty Shimano/ISIS Bottom Bracket Tool to service or replace your ISIS bottom brackets without screaming or needing the assistance of your local mechanic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hDLsK4evL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00187XPBU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00188KX1E", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Attack Cycling Glove,Black,X-Large", "description": "Designed in dense, U-bridge padding and Coolmax mesh, the Pearl Izumi Men's Attack Glove offers comfort for short or long rides.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Attack Cycling Glove,Black,X-Large Designed in dense, U-bridge padding and Coolmax mesh, the Pearl Izumi Men's Attack Glove offers comfort for short or long rides.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YFFMzrrvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00188KX1E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00188L39K", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Cyclone Toe Cover", "description": "Defeat the elements and keep your feet warm, dry and bulk free with the Pearl Izumi Cyclone Toe Cover. Designed for use with road shoes with internal cleats, these toe covers protect against biting wind and rain so that you can stay on your bike even in cool weather. Designed for moderate temperatures when it isn't quite cold enough for shoe covers but you still need protection, toe covers are easy to slip on and off and provide protection where you need it the most.Pearl Izumi utilizes the experience and needs of world-class athletes when creating its products and the Cyclone Toe Cover is no exception. With sleek design, superior construction, and ease of use features this cover allows you to bike through biting winds and rain in comfort. The Cover has a AmFIB water resistant, breathable insulating layer to keep your feet dry, while still allowing them to breathe. The soft Microfleece lining provides a layer of warm insulation and wicks moisture away from your feet so that they remain dry from within. Bottom finger loop makes it easy to pull the cover on and off quickly, while the durable rubber sole with cleat cutaway offers a perfect fit with external cleat road shoes. Reflective element on the cover adds to visibility during lowlight and nighttime riding.Like all Pearl Izumi products the Cyclone Toe Covers have a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, that excludes failures from accidents, misuse, improper care, or normal wear. Pearl Izumi recommends reading the product care label carefully, and washing the covers with additive free detergents that don't have fabric softeners, perfumes, or any other additive type product as detergents with additives leave \"surfactants\" behind on a fabric's fibers that inhibit the technical performance. Hang dry the covers or dry them on a low or warm setting. Never use a hot setting or a commercial dryer as this will damage the fabric's performance.Specifications:65 percent polyester, 30 percent nylon, and 5 percent spandexAmFIB stretch and block laminateMicrofleece liningRubber soleCleat cutawayReflective element for visibilityFinger loopSmall: men's shoe sizes smaller than 7, women's shoe sizes smaller than 8, Euro sizes 36 to 40Medium: men's shoe sizes 7 to 8.5, women's shoe sizes 8 to 9.5, Euro sizes 40 to 42Large: men's shoe sizes 8.5 to 10, women's shoe sizes 9.5 to 11, Euro sizes 42-44X-Large: men's shoe sizes 10-13, women's shoe sizes larger than 11, Euro sizes 44 to 47XX-Large: men's shoe sizes larger than 13, Euro sizes larger than 47Wash with additive free detergentsHang dry or use low/warm heat settingManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime warranty", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Cyclone Toe Cover Defeat the elements and keep your feet warm, dry and bulk free with the Pearl Izumi Cyclone Toe Cover. Designed for use with road shoes with internal cleats, these toe covers protect against biting wind and rain so that you can stay on your bike even in cool weather. Designed for moderate temperatures when it isn't quite cold enough for shoe covers but you still need protection, toe covers are easy to slip on and off and provide protection where you need it the most.Pearl Izumi utilizes the experience and needs of world-class athletes when creating its products and the Cyclone Toe Cover is no exception. With sleek design, superior construction, and ease of use features this cover allows you to bike through biting winds and rain in comfort. The Cover has a AmFIB water resistant, breathable insulating layer to keep your feet dry, while still allowing them to breathe. The soft Microfleece lining provides a layer of warm insulation and wicks moisture away from your feet so that they remain dry from within. Bottom finger loop makes it easy to pull the cover on and off quickly, while the durable rubber sole with cleat cutaway offers a perfect fit with external cleat road shoes. Reflective element on the cover adds to visibility during lowlight and nighttime riding.Like all Pearl Izumi products the Cyclone Toe Covers have a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, that excludes failures from accidents, misuse, improper care, or normal wear. Pearl Izumi recommends reading the product care label carefully, and washing the covers with additive free detergents that don't have fabric softeners, perfumes, or any other additive type product as detergents with additives leave \"surfactants\" behind on a fabric's fibers that inhibit the technical performance. Hang dry the covers or dry them on a low or warm setting. Never use a hot setting or a commercial dryer as this will damage the fabric's performance.Specifications:65 percent polyester, 30 percent nylon, and 5 percent spandexAmFIB stretch and block laminateMicrofleece liningRubber soleCleat cutawayReflective element for visibilityFinger loopSmall: men's shoe sizes smaller than 7, women's shoe sizes smaller than 8, Euro sizes 36 to 40Medium: men's shoe sizes 7 to 8.5, women's shoe sizes 8 to 9.5, Euro sizes 40 to 42Large: men's shoe sizes 8.5 to 10, women's shoe sizes 9.5 to 11, Euro sizes 42-44X-Large: men's shoe sizes 10-13, women's shoe sizes larger than 11, Euro sizes 44 to 47XX-Large: men's shoe sizes larger than 13, Euro sizes larger than 47Wash with additive free detergentsHang dry or use low/warm heat settingManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515LoSueenL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00188L39K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B00188NK4G", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Triathalon Tri Cycling Short", "description": "", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Triathalon Tri Cycling Short", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HtksOqU2L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00188NK4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00188NM4Y", "title": "Park Tool PMP-4 Half-Pint Mini Pump", "description": "Just small enough to carry or clip on to the bike and just big enough to pump efficiently the PMP-4 dual head mini pump is built like all our tools - solid! All aluminum barrel construction ensures long life and smooth operation. Soft touch grips and a flip-out handle make it easy on the hands. The PMP-4 is Presta and Schrader valve compatible and includes mounting hardware to securely attach to water bottle bosses. (Max. pressure: 90 psi / 6 bars)", "text": "Park Tool PMP-4 Half-Pint Mini Pump Just small enough to carry or clip on to the bike and just big enough to pump efficiently the PMP-4 dual head mini pump is built like all our tools - solid! All aluminum barrel construction ensures long life and smooth operation. Soft touch grips and a flip-out handle make it easy on the hands. The PMP-4 is Presta and Schrader valve compatible and includes mounting hardware to securely attach to water bottle bosses. (Max. pressure: 90 psi / 6 bars)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CbnCgpKDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00188NM4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 17.06}}
{"item_id": "B00188YYC8", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Women's Sugar Knicker", "description": "Need the perfect cycling knickers to get you through the change in season? The 15-inch inseam, Pearl Izumi Women's Sugar Knickers will offer coverage from your knees up letting your calves breathe, and are held in place with spandex leg grippers. With an anatomic, 6-panel design, and flatlock stitched seams, the knickers will protect your hard working muscles and eliminate pressure points for zero chafing, no matter how far or hard you ride.Made of signature Pearl Izumi Sensor fabric, this high-quality blend of polyester and spandex provides stretch comfort and quickly wicks moisture away from the body for easy evaporation. The women's specific, seamless, four-way stretch 08' 3-D Tour Chamois reduces pressure points with 13-millimeters of fusion bonded dual-density padding for long-term comfort. The high-performance chamois features natural silver fibers that reduce bacteria and help regulate temperature for a comfortable, long-lasting knicker. With 13 millimeters of moisture wicking, plush microfiber padding, the chamois provides all the protection you will need for long, grueling rides.Like all Pearl Izumi products the Women's Sugar Knicker has a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, that excludes failures from accidents, misuse, improper care, or normal wear. For best results Pearl Izumi recommends washing its products with detergents free of additives, such as fabric softeners and perfumes, because detergents with additives leave \\surfactants\\\" behind on a fabric's fibers that inhibit the technical performance. Hang dry the product or dry it on a low or warm dryer setting. Never use a hot dryer setting or use a commercial dryer as this will damage the fabric's performance.Specifications:Sensor fabric content: 90 percent polyester, 10 percent spandexSeamless, four-way stretch 3D Tour ChamoisChamois has 13 millimeters of plush microfiber paddingChamois features natural silver antimicrobial fibersAnatomic 6-panel constructionSpandex leg grippers15-inch inseamX-Small: 24-inch waist, 34-inch hipSmall: 25 to 27-inch waist, 35 to 37-inch hipMedium: 27 to 29-inch waist, 37 to 39-inch hipLarge: 29.5 to 31.5-inch waist, 39.5 to 42-inch hipX-Large: 32.5 to 44.5-inch waist, 42.5 to 45-inch hipWash with additive free detergentsHang dry or use low/warm heat settingManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime warranty\"", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Women's Sugar Knicker Need the perfect cycling knickers to get you through the change in season? The 15-inch inseam, Pearl Izumi Women's Sugar Knickers will offer coverage from your knees up letting your calves breathe, and are held in place with spandex leg grippers. With an anatomic, 6-panel design, and flatlock stitched seams, the knickers will protect your hard working muscles and eliminate pressure points for zero chafing, no matter how far or hard you ride.Made of signature Pearl Izumi Sensor fabric, this high-quality blend of polyester and spandex provides stretch comfort and quickly wicks moisture away from the body for easy evaporation. The women's specific, seamless, four-way stretch 08' 3-D Tour Chamois reduces pressure points with 13-millimeters of fusion bonded dual-density padding for long-term comfort. The high-performance chamois features natural silver fibers that reduce bacteria and help regulate temperature for a comfortable, long-lasting knicker. With 13 millimeters of moisture wicking, plush microfiber padding, the chamois provides all the protection you will need for long, grueling rides.Like all Pearl Izumi products the Women's Sugar Knicker has a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, that excludes failures from accidents, misuse, improper care, or normal wear. For best results Pearl Izumi recommends washing its products with detergents free of additives, such as fabric softeners and perfumes, because detergents with additives leave \\surfactants\\\" behind on a fabric's fibers that inhibit the technical performance. Hang dry the product or dry it on a low or warm dryer setting. Never use a hot dryer setting or use a commercial dryer as this will damage the fabric's performance.Specifications:Sensor fabric content: 90 percent polyester, 10 percent spandexSeamless, four-way stretch 3D Tour ChamoisChamois has 13 millimeters of plush microfiber paddingChamois features natural silver antimicrobial fibersAnatomic 6-panel constructionSpandex leg grippers15-inch inseamX-Small: 24-inch waist, 34-inch hipSmall: 25 to 27-inch waist, 35 to 37-inch hipMedium: 27 to 29-inch waist, 37 to 39-inch hipLarge: 29.5 to 31.5-inch waist, 39.5 to 42-inch hipX-Large: 32.5 to 44.5-inch waist, 42.5 to 45-inch hipWash with additive free detergentsHang dry or use low/warm heat settingManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime warranty\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31045A5vyeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00188YYC8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 48.99}}
{"item_id": "B00189YZMG", "title": "Fobus Belt 6900BHMP Double Mag S&W M&P 9mm/.40 cal", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "text": "Fobus Belt 6900BHMP Double Mag S&W M&P 9mm/.40 cal Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41naEyMRAbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00189YZMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 23.66}}
