{"item_id": "B0018AFZXI", "title": "Fobus Paddle 6900PMP Double Mag S&W M&P 9mm/.40 cal", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "text": "Fobus Paddle 6900PMP Double Mag S&W M&P 9mm/.40 cal Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41krvmZsniL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018AFZXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 21.69}}
{"item_id": "B0018BCANA", "title": "Seirus Innovation Men's Hyperlite All Weather Glove", "description": "The Seirus HyperLite All Weather Glove can be worn as a glove liner or as an ultra-light glove by itself. The glove offers a comfortable, moisture wicking fleece inner lining with a windproof, water resistant, breathable WeatherShield Tri-laminate membrane. Made with durable four-way stretch outer fabric, the HyperLite Glove is engineered to keep your fingers agile in cold weather.", "text": "Seirus Innovation Men's Hyperlite All Weather Glove The Seirus HyperLite All Weather Glove can be worn as a glove liner or as an ultra-light glove by itself. The glove offers a comfortable, moisture wicking fleece inner lining with a windproof, water resistant, breathable WeatherShield Tri-laminate membrane. Made with durable four-way stretch outer fabric, the HyperLite Glove is engineered to keep your fingers agile in cold weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EEGmJQxhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BCANA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018BCYOA", "title": "Brunton Striker Fire Starter (Silver/Black)", "description": "Bruntons New Striker provides you with ignition steel and is a fool-proof way to make sure you always have fire. Keep it handy, you never know… Our non-slip molded handle assists in the fire hold and stability. This tool can be used thousands of times and weighs less than 2 ounces. Contact us for Customer Service, Technical and any other question at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "text": "Brunton Striker Fire Starter (Silver/Black) Bruntons New Striker provides you with ignition steel and is a fool-proof way to make sure you always have fire. Keep it handy, you never know… Our non-slip molded handle assists in the fire hold and stability. This tool can be used thousands of times and weighs less than 2 ounces. Contact us for Customer Service, Technical and any other question at 1-800-443-4871 (or) support@brunton.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gaxm1T9BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BCYOA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018BGGHG", "title": "Seirus Innovation Extreme Masque", "description": "Seirus Neofleece Extreme Masque. The original, patented thermal face protection", "text": "Seirus Innovation Extreme Masque Seirus Neofleece Extreme Masque. The original, patented thermal face protection", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311Kax%2BRBQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BGGHG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018BGHUM", "title": "Seirus Innovation Super Padded Shorts, Black, Small/Medium", "description": "The Seirus Super Padded Protective Shorts provide super protection for your butt, tail-bone and hips. They are made mostly of 4-way stretch Lycra which unlike a tailored garment fits snuggly all over. The padding provides protection for the bum, tail bone, & hips. The padding is both breathable and removable and insulates against snow when sitting. There is no padding on the front and the shorts are about 1/2\" to 5/8\" thick and fit comfortably under pants. This bum protector has removable breathable pads. The shorts do double duty in that they also insulate against snow when sitting. Padding is less than an inch thick so they should not be noticeable under loose fitting clothes. They have a comfortable waist band with draw cord. Color is black. These pants are Unisex and stretch to accommodate different shapes.", "text": "Seirus Innovation Super Padded Shorts, Black, Small/Medium The Seirus Super Padded Protective Shorts provide super protection for your butt, tail-bone and hips. They are made mostly of 4-way stretch Lycra which unlike a tailored garment fits snuggly all over. The padding provides protection for the bum, tail bone, & hips. The padding is both breathable and removable and insulates against snow when sitting. There is no padding on the front and the shorts are about 1/2\" to 5/8\" thick and fit comfortably under pants. This bum protector has removable breathable pads. The shorts do double duty in that they also insulate against snow when sitting. Padding is less than an inch thick so they should not be noticeable under loose fitting clothes. They have a comfortable waist band with draw cord. Color is black. These pants are Unisex and stretch to accommodate different shapes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yq7sdMXxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BGHUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear", "Padded Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018BK7VC", "title": "GSI Sports Products 65006 Stainless Coffee Perk Cup", "description": "Sure, it's easier to open your eyes and drag yourself out of bed when you're facing a day of backcountry skiing instead of a long commute. But if a cup of hot coffee can make the workday bearable, just think of what it can do for a day on the slopes. Enter the Glacier stainless percolator, an ultra-rugged camp-style coffeemaker that will keep you caffeinated for years to come. Built to take a beating and keep on cooking, the Glacier is made of corrosion-resistant, marine-grade 18/8 stainless steel, with a virtually unbreakable PercView top made of Lexan resin. When you're ready to start your day, just add the proper amount of coffee--2 tablespoons for every 6 ounces of water is the ideal ratio--and you're set.The Glacier comes in several sizes, depending on the severity of your coffee cravings and the number of people in your group. The smallest size makes three cups of coffee, whereas the largest produces a generous 28 cups, with several sizes in between. Other details include a flame-resistant Permawood handle that stays cool to the touch (available on the smaller models) and a convenient hinged lid. Dishwasher-safe, Glacier percolators make an ideal camping companion, and can be used on both the campfire and the camp stove.", "text": "GSI Sports Products 65006 Stainless Coffee Perk Cup Sure, it's easier to open your eyes and drag yourself out of bed when you're facing a day of backcountry skiing instead of a long commute. But if a cup of hot coffee can make the workday bearable, just think of what it can do for a day on the slopes. Enter the Glacier stainless percolator, an ultra-rugged camp-style coffeemaker that will keep you caffeinated for years to come. Built to take a beating and keep on cooking, the Glacier is made of corrosion-resistant, marine-grade 18/8 stainless steel, with a virtually unbreakable PercView top made of Lexan resin. When you're ready to start your day, just add the proper amount of coffee--2 tablespoons for every 6 ounces of water is the ideal ratio--and you're set.The Glacier comes in several sizes, depending on the severity of your coffee cravings and the number of people in your group. The smallest size makes three cups of coffee, whereas the largest produces a generous 28 cups, with several sizes in between. Other details include a flame-resistant Permawood handle that stays cool to the touch (available on the smaller models) and a convenient hinged lid. Dishwasher-safe, Glacier percolators make an ideal camping companion, and can be used on both the campfire and the camp stove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Iv98Hj2aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BK7VC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018BKAUA", "title": "GSI Outdoors Macro Table", "description": "The Macro Table is a collapsible, lightweight, technical platform.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Macro Table The Macro Table is a collapsible, lightweight, technical platform.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310ihEVkjIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BKAUA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 47.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018BKAUK", "title": "Glacier Stainless Mess Kit", "description": "You provide the food, and the Gsi Outdoors Glacier Stainless Mess Kit will provide the equipment you need to eat like a rugged king. The Glacier Stainless Mess Kit is lightweight enough to easily add to the pack without bogging you down, and the non-reactive stainless steel surface ensures no off flavors latch on to your food. PRODUCT FEATURES: Lightweight, nesting design with a dual-use frypan/lid and a polypropylene Cascadian cup and bowl packs small, travels easily and withstands any abuse. Exclusive DiamondBack Gripper attaches securely to exterior brackets while preserving both interior and exterior pot finishes. Double-rolled rims for increased stiffness and durability 68120 , gsi outdoors Glacier Stainless Mess Kit , gsi Glacier Stainless Mess Kit , Glacier Stainless Mess Kit gsi outdoors , gsi cookware glacier stainless mess kit , gsi outdoors cookware glacier stainless mess kit , gsi cookware stainless steel mess kit , camping , hiking , cooking , cookware , pots , pans , cups , sinks , frying pans , mess kits", "text": "Glacier Stainless Mess Kit You provide the food, and the Gsi Outdoors Glacier Stainless Mess Kit will provide the equipment you need to eat like a rugged king. The Glacier Stainless Mess Kit is lightweight enough to easily add to the pack without bogging you down, and the non-reactive stainless steel surface ensures no off flavors latch on to your food. PRODUCT FEATURES: Lightweight, nesting design with a dual-use frypan/lid and a polypropylene Cascadian cup and bowl packs small, travels easily and withstands any abuse. Exclusive DiamondBack Gripper attaches securely to exterior brackets while preserving both interior and exterior pot finishes. Double-rolled rims for increased stiffness and durability 68120 , gsi outdoors Glacier Stainless Mess Kit , gsi Glacier Stainless Mess Kit , Glacier Stainless Mess Kit gsi outdoors , gsi cookware glacier stainless mess kit , gsi outdoors cookware glacier stainless mess kit , gsi cookware stainless steel mess kit , camping , hiking , cooking , cookware , pots , pans , cups , sinks , frying pans , mess kits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bm1qZOPrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BKAUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018BLKOU", "title": "GSI Outdoors Halulite Tea Kettle,32 Ounce", "description": "Heat water for tea and coffee quickly and efficiently at the campsite with the Halulite 32-ounce teakettle.The kettle's coated bail handle folds down for easy packing.Halulite is a proprietary aluminum alloy that's as light as titanium, yet conducts heat better and more evenly, so you can heat more water with less fuel. In addition, every Halulite item is hard anodized to create a surface that withstands scratches and abrasions like nothing else. No matter how many times you knock the kettle off the grill and onto the ground, it comes up ready for more.The teakettle includes a coated bail handle for safety and easy handling, along with a fitted lid with its own coated lifter. The seamless design is also leakproof, so you won't lose any water during the heating process. Best of all for backpackers, the kettle is sized to hold ultralight stoves and fit optimally in backpacks. Lightweight, easy to handle, and fast heating, the Halulite teakettle is a must for backcountry tea and coffee drinkers.SpecificationsCapacity: 1 quart (32 ounces)Product use: Ultralight backpacking, gourmet backpackingMaterial: Proprietary hard-anodized alloyDimensions: 6.3 by 3.2 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.8 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Halulite Tea Kettle,32 Ounce Heat water for tea and coffee quickly and efficiently at the campsite with the Halulite 32-ounce teakettle.The kettle's coated bail handle folds down for easy packing.Halulite is a proprietary aluminum alloy that's as light as titanium, yet conducts heat better and more evenly, so you can heat more water with less fuel. In addition, every Halulite item is hard anodized to create a surface that withstands scratches and abrasions like nothing else. No matter how many times you knock the kettle off the grill and onto the ground, it comes up ready for more.The teakettle includes a coated bail handle for safety and easy handling, along with a fitted lid with its own coated lifter. The seamless design is also leakproof, so you won't lose any water during the heating process. Best of all for backpackers, the kettle is sized to hold ultralight stoves and fit optimally in backpacks. Lightweight, easy to handle, and fast heating, the Halulite teakettle is a must for backcountry tea and coffee drinkers.SpecificationsCapacity: 1 quart (32 ounces)Product use: Ultralight backpacking, gourmet backpackingMaterial: Proprietary hard-anodized alloyDimensions: 6.3 by 3.2 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.8 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dbm6zPl-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BLKOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018BLYSM", "title": "Fobus Double Mag Pouch, Single Stack .22 cal 6922P", "description": "Fobus Double Mag Pouch, Single Stack .22 cal 6922P", "text": "Fobus Double Mag Pouch, Single Stack .22 cal 6922P Fobus Double Mag Pouch, Single Stack .22 cal 6922P", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ml%2BC4yI-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BLYSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B0018BNI9U", "title": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Mess Kit", "description": "Enjoy a gourmet cooking experience even when it's just you and the great outdoors with the GSI Outdoors Bugaboo mess kit. The kit starts with a 1-quart cooking pot and a 7.5-inch frypan that doubles as a lid for the pot.The items nest together for easy packing and carrying.Both cookware items are made of high-quality aluminum, with a dependable nonstick interior coating that's easy to clean. Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The mess kit also includes a 6-inch polypropylene bowl and a 12-ounce polypropylene cup, giving you dishware for your one-person meal. And to make it easier to lift your cookware, the kit comes with an exclusive DiamondBack Gripper handle that attaches securely to exterior brackets on the pot and frypan. The brackets preserve both the interior and exterior pot finishes while still letting you detach the handle for easy storage.All the items in the Bugaboo mess kit nest together and fit inside the included mesh storage bag. The items pack small, travel light, and withstand a ton of abuse.SpecificationsMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminumProduct use: Gourmet backpackingNested dimensions: 8 by 3.2 by 8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 16.7 ouncesIn the box: 7.5-inch dual-use frypan/lid, 1-quart pot, 6-inch bowl, 12-ounce cup, gripper handle, mesh bagAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Mess Kit Enjoy a gourmet cooking experience even when it's just you and the great outdoors with the GSI Outdoors Bugaboo mess kit. The kit starts with a 1-quart cooking pot and a 7.5-inch frypan that doubles as a lid for the pot.The items nest together for easy packing and carrying.Both cookware items are made of high-quality aluminum, with a dependable nonstick interior coating that's easy to clean. Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The mess kit also includes a 6-inch polypropylene bowl and a 12-ounce polypropylene cup, giving you dishware for your one-person meal. And to make it easier to lift your cookware, the kit comes with an exclusive DiamondBack Gripper handle that attaches securely to exterior brackets on the pot and frypan. The brackets preserve both the interior and exterior pot finishes while still letting you detach the handle for easy storage.All the items in the Bugaboo mess kit nest together and fit inside the included mesh storage bag. The items pack small, travel light, and withstand a ton of abuse.SpecificationsMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminumProduct use: Gourmet backpackingNested dimensions: 8 by 3.2 by 8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 16.7 ouncesIn the box: 7.5-inch dual-use frypan/lid, 1-quart pot, 6-inch bowl, 12-ounce cup, gripper handle, mesh bagAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416xE-rHpdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BNI9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 26.13}}
{"item_id": "B0018BPKXC", "title": "GSI Outdoors Extreme Mess Kit", "description": "The GSI Outdoors Extreme Mess Kit is the premium mess kit for the backpack gourmet. Hard Anodized Extreme cookware provides the gourmet performance you demand while retaining the light weight that you need. Easy-packing, nesting design thanks to a dual-use frypan/lid, a polypropylene Cascadian™ cup and bowl and mesh stuff sack. Perfect for backpacking!.Exclusive DiamondBack Gripper™ attaches securely to exterior brackets while preserving both interior and exterior pot finishes..Double-rolled rims for increased stiffness and durability..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Extreme Mess Kit The GSI Outdoors Extreme Mess Kit is the premium mess kit for the backpack gourmet. Hard Anodized Extreme cookware provides the gourmet performance you demand while retaining the light weight that you need. Easy-packing, nesting design thanks to a dual-use frypan/lid, a polypropylene Cascadian™ cup and bowl and mesh stuff sack. Perfect for backpacking!.Exclusive DiamondBack Gripper™ attaches securely to exterior brackets while preserving both interior and exterior pot finishes..Double-rolled rims for increased stiffness and durability..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410K5ZVMiBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BPKXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018BPKZU", "title": "GSI Outdoors Micro Table", "description": "A full-size picnic table is nice, but sometimes your car camping spot is far away from such amenities. Enter the GSI Outdoors micro table, a lightweight, collapsible table with a compact 15.5-by-11.25-inch top surface.The compact tabletop measures 15.5 by 11.25 inches.With dual-height legs that stand at either 4.1 inches or 6.1 inches, the micro table rests on a variety of surfaces, from your SUV tailgate to a wide stump to a spot next to your camp stove. The table is made of anodized aluminum, a flame- and heat-resistant material that holds up to the elements. Just as importantly, the table rolls up and fits into its own carrying bag, with a packed footprint of 15.5 by 3.25 by 2.375 inches. Easy to clean, the table supports up to 20 pounds and weighs only 1 pound 8 ounces by itself.SpecificationsTabletop dimensions: 15.5 by 11.25 inchesWeight capacity: 20 poundsMaterial: AluminumProduct use: Car campingLeg height: Dual, 4.125 inches or 6.125 inchesPacked dimensions: 15.5 by 3.25 by 2.375 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 1 pound 8 ouncesIn the box: Table and nylon toteAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Micro Table A full-size picnic table is nice, but sometimes your car camping spot is far away from such amenities. Enter the GSI Outdoors micro table, a lightweight, collapsible table with a compact 15.5-by-11.25-inch top surface.The compact tabletop measures 15.5 by 11.25 inches.With dual-height legs that stand at either 4.1 inches or 6.1 inches, the micro table rests on a variety of surfaces, from your SUV tailgate to a wide stump to a spot next to your camp stove. The table is made of anodized aluminum, a flame- and heat-resistant material that holds up to the elements. Just as importantly, the table rolls up and fits into its own carrying bag, with a packed footprint of 15.5 by 3.25 by 2.375 inches. Easy to clean, the table supports up to 20 pounds and weighs only 1 pound 8 ounces by itself.SpecificationsTabletop dimensions: 15.5 by 11.25 inchesWeight capacity: 20 poundsMaterial: AluminumProduct use: Car campingLeg height: Dual, 4.125 inches or 6.125 inchesPacked dimensions: 15.5 by 3.25 by 2.375 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 1 pound 8 ouncesIn the box: Table and nylon toteAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Gn85ld9XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018BPKZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018CQKW6", "title": "Kelsyus Original Canopy Chair (Blue)", "description": "Protect yourself from the elements with the Kelsyus Original Canopy Chair. This ingenious product converts from a familiar quad-style outdoor chair into your own personal oasis. In it's default position the chair looks like any other outdoor chair, with folding legs, padded canvas armrests, and a built-in cup holder.The Kelsyus Original Canopy chair is the perfect companion for your camping trip, tailgating, or watching sporting events from the sidelines. When folded, the waterproof canopy becomes the carry case, secured by two durable snap-lock buckles, the padded backpack straps allow for hands-free portability.", "text": "Kelsyus Original Canopy Chair (Blue) Protect yourself from the elements with the Kelsyus Original Canopy Chair. This ingenious product converts from a familiar quad-style outdoor chair into your own personal oasis. In it's default position the chair looks like any other outdoor chair, with folding legs, padded canvas armrests, and a built-in cup holder.The Kelsyus Original Canopy chair is the perfect companion for your camping trip, tailgating, or watching sporting events from the sidelines. When folded, the waterproof canopy becomes the carry case, secured by two durable snap-lock buckles, the padded backpack straps allow for hands-free portability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ahQqh6w9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018CQKW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Patio, Lawn & Garden", "Canopies"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018CX1AA", "title": "Schwinn Deluxe Child Carrier", "description": "The PTI Schwinn Deluxe Child Carrier provides a lightweight, yet sturdy design that mounts directly onto your bicycle's frame so that you and your child can enjoy biking together. With the PTI Carrier, the child is positioned behind the rider and over the rear tire, providing a steadier riding experience than with a front-mounted child seat. Your little one can enjoy the view of the road, with a little more protection from the wind than he or she would have on the front of the bike.Unlike bike seats that require the purchase of a rear rack, the PTI Carrier comes with a mounting system that mounts directly to the frame of the bike. The seat itself removes from the base without tools when you want to ride without it on the bike, and you can even load other cargo on the mount.Built for safety, the PTI Carrier is suitable for older babies with good head and neck control and toddlers weighing up to 40 pounds. The carrier's lightweight, yet sturdy polypropylene frame is designed to surround the child for protection in case of impacts. The child is secure with a quick-release harness as well as a padded cross bar that also provides a comfortable resting point for their hands. Little feet and legs are surrounded by the molded frame and secured with Velcro leg restraints. For additional safety, the seat comes with a spring and spoke guard included.Key Features:Direct frame mount with included baseSeat can be taken on and off without tools once installedQuick release safety harnessVelcro leg restraintsPadded cross barMolded design to surround childIncluded seat spring guard and spoke guardSpecifications:Weight capacity: up to 40 poundsConstruction: polypropyleneCompatible with most adult bicycles", "text": "Schwinn Deluxe Child Carrier The PTI Schwinn Deluxe Child Carrier provides a lightweight, yet sturdy design that mounts directly onto your bicycle's frame so that you and your child can enjoy biking together. With the PTI Carrier, the child is positioned behind the rider and over the rear tire, providing a steadier riding experience than with a front-mounted child seat. Your little one can enjoy the view of the road, with a little more protection from the wind than he or she would have on the front of the bike.Unlike bike seats that require the purchase of a rear rack, the PTI Carrier comes with a mounting system that mounts directly to the frame of the bike. The seat itself removes from the base without tools when you want to ride without it on the bike, and you can even load other cargo on the mount.Built for safety, the PTI Carrier is suitable for older babies with good head and neck control and toddlers weighing up to 40 pounds. The carrier's lightweight, yet sturdy polypropylene frame is designed to surround the child for protection in case of impacts. The child is secure with a quick-release harness as well as a padded cross bar that also provides a comfortable resting point for their hands. Little feet and legs are surrounded by the molded frame and secured with Velcro leg restraints. For additional safety, the seat comes with a spring and spoke guard included.Key Features:Direct frame mount with included baseSeat can be taken on and off without tools once installedQuick release safety harnessVelcro leg restraintsPadded cross barMolded design to surround childIncluded seat spring guard and spoke guardSpecifications:Weight capacity: up to 40 poundsConstruction: polypropyleneCompatible with most adult bicycles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vd11-K%2BqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018CX1AA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Child Seats"]], "price": 56.13}}
{"item_id": "B0018CX1E6", "title": "Schwinn Aluminum Frame Pump", "description": "Lightweight, efficient, and affordable, the Schwinn Aluminum Frame pump keeps you inflated on the road and at home. With a 100-psi capacity, the pump is perfect for inflating bicycle tires, stroller tires, and any other small pneumatic wheels you may use. Thanks to its dual nozzle design, the pump accommodates Presta and Schrader valves easily. The streamlined pump can be attached to a bike tube with the included mounting bracket--or can be attached to most frames with the included Velcro strap. Finally, when you're ready to inflate, the ergonomic \"T\" handle folds down for a secure grip with plenty of leverage for easy pumping.", "text": "Schwinn Aluminum Frame Pump Lightweight, efficient, and affordable, the Schwinn Aluminum Frame pump keeps you inflated on the road and at home. With a 100-psi capacity, the pump is perfect for inflating bicycle tires, stroller tires, and any other small pneumatic wheels you may use. Thanks to its dual nozzle design, the pump accommodates Presta and Schrader valves easily. The streamlined pump can be attached to a bike tube with the included mounting bracket--or can be attached to most frames with the included Velcro strap. Finally, when you're ready to inflate, the ergonomic \"T\" handle folds down for a secure grip with plenty of leverage for easy pumping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bYQ4Zk3tL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018CX1E6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018CX1EG", "title": "Schwinn Steel Floor Pump with Gauge", "description": "Featuring the Schwinn brand Americans have trusted for over one hundred years this pump is large enough to output the needed air pressure quicker and easier. Bicycle tires and tubes require a fixed pressure per square inch (PSI) to function safely and at best performance. Home bicycle pumps allow riders to maintain this conveniently without costly or lengthy trips to the nearest service station. With steel construction and a gauge to test pressure, this pump makes perfecting the ride as simple and convenient as having a full pit crew living in the garage. PTI Sports products are designed with safety as the first and foremost concern and are constructed of high quality parts and materials to prevent degradation over time. Thoroughly tested, our products last through years of use before they are recommended for replacement, ensuring safe cycling for years to come.", "text": "Schwinn Steel Floor Pump with Gauge Featuring the Schwinn brand Americans have trusted for over one hundred years this pump is large enough to output the needed air pressure quicker and easier. Bicycle tires and tubes require a fixed pressure per square inch (PSI) to function safely and at best performance. Home bicycle pumps allow riders to maintain this conveniently without costly or lengthy trips to the nearest service station. With steel construction and a gauge to test pressure, this pump makes perfecting the ride as simple and convenient as having a full pit crew living in the garage. PTI Sports products are designed with safety as the first and foremost concern and are constructed of high quality parts and materials to prevent degradation over time. Thoroughly tested, our products last through years of use before they are recommended for replacement, ensuring safe cycling for years to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-RIwmzJ5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018CX1EG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 15.49}}
{"item_id": "B0018CX4IO", "title": "Schwinn 15-Function Wireless Bike Computer", "description": "The Schwinn 13-Function Wireless Computer provides speed, time, distance, and training functions without difficult to install wires--or--wheel interference. The computer's friction-free sensor measures the turns of the wheel without contact the rim or tire. The large LCD screen, meanwhile, provides the rider with a clear view of all speed and distance measurements. The computer sensor, transmitter, and receptor mount directly onto the bicycle frame with the included straps.", "text": "Schwinn 15-Function Wireless Bike Computer The Schwinn 13-Function Wireless Computer provides speed, time, distance, and training functions without difficult to install wires--or--wheel interference. The computer's friction-free sensor measures the turns of the wheel without contact the rim or tire. The large LCD screen, meanwhile, provides the rider with a clear view of all speed and distance measurements. The computer sensor, transmitter, and receptor mount directly onto the bicycle frame with the included straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yBj8KMl1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018CX4IO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 19.48}}
{"item_id": "B0018D3OC4", "title": "Sea to Summit X-Bowl", "description": "The Sea to Summit X-Bowl is an exceptionally lightweight and packable new innovation for dining in the outdoors. Comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and collapsible walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, the X-Bowl folds down flat for easy packing and its flattened shape nests seamlessly with its cousins the X-Mug and X-Plate (sold separately). Tough enough to handle chopping with its sturdy base, withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces of up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit, and dishwasher/microwave safe, the X-Bowl is arguably the most versatile and useful item in your outdoor cooking arsenal. Boasting 100 percent BPA free construction and weighing in at just 2.8 ounces, the X-Bowl is the perfect companion for your next adventure.The X-Bowl folds down flat for easy, lightweight packing.Specifications:Weight: 2.8 ounces / 80 gramsCapacity: 22 fluid ounces / 650 millilitersDiameter: 6 inches / 15 centimetersDepth: 2.25 inches / 5.5 centimeters100 percent BPA freeDishwasher and microwave safe", "text": "Sea to Summit X-Bowl The Sea to Summit X-Bowl is an exceptionally lightweight and packable new innovation for dining in the outdoors. Comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and collapsible walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, the X-Bowl folds down flat for easy packing and its flattened shape nests seamlessly with its cousins the X-Mug and X-Plate (sold separately). Tough enough to handle chopping with its sturdy base, withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces of up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit, and dishwasher/microwave safe, the X-Bowl is arguably the most versatile and useful item in your outdoor cooking arsenal. Boasting 100 percent BPA free construction and weighing in at just 2.8 ounces, the X-Bowl is the perfect companion for your next adventure.The X-Bowl folds down flat for easy, lightweight packing.Specifications:Weight: 2.8 ounces / 80 gramsCapacity: 22 fluid ounces / 650 millilitersDiameter: 6 inches / 15 centimetersDepth: 2.25 inches / 5.5 centimeters100 percent BPA freeDishwasher and microwave safe", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-5kxOFE9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018D3OC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Bowls"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018DG5D4", "title": "Sports Hoop® - Acu Hoop® 4M - 4lb (Dia.40\") Medium, Weighted Hula Hoop for Workout with 50 minutes Workout Lesson DVD", "description": "The Acu Hoop® 4M is a medium-sized Acu Hoop® specifically designed for exercise purposes and is a perfect hoop for beginners looking to start a new healthy lifestyle or stay in shape. Adults 100-140lb (45-64kg) can use the Acu Hoop® 4M for an effective weight loss and toning regime. The foam padding and high-quality, durable plastic make it both easy and comfortable to hoop for a longer time.Benefits:• Great for adults to efficiently trim waistlines and tone core muscles• Enhances cardio workouts• Improves posture and circulation• Targeted workout for core musclesThe Acu Hoop® series is one of our signature hoops with advanced patented wavy-ridged design. The wavy ridges provide concentrated force that work to stimulate your core muscles and tone your stomach, back, gluteus and hip muscles. The muscle stimulation scales with the hoop movement; the more powerful Acu Hoop® spin around your waist, the greater result.Sports Hoop® series offers a variety of weighted sports hula hoops specially designed and optimized to trim waistlines and lose weight. With over 30 models— each with unique features customized to fit all ages, sizes, and body types—.• Want to trim faster and lose more weight? Try our Power Hoop®• Want to hoop longer? Try our Trim Hoop®®2014 Sports Hoop, INC. All rights reserved. All Sports Hoop® products are U.S. registered trademarks or trademarks of of Sports Hoop, Inc.Bonus DVDSports Hoop Workout - Rosemary 46minsGet the best workout from weighted hula hoop. Class A:-Instructions,-Upper body,-Lower Body,-AbsClass B:-Front kick & Jab,-Back Kick & Jab,-Plis roundhouse,-Elbows,-Ab workout", "text": "Sports Hoop® - Acu Hoop® 4M - 4lb (Dia.40\") Medium, Weighted Hula Hoop for Workout with 50 minutes Workout Lesson DVD The Acu Hoop® 4M is a medium-sized Acu Hoop® specifically designed for exercise purposes and is a perfect hoop for beginners looking to start a new healthy lifestyle or stay in shape. Adults 100-140lb (45-64kg) can use the Acu Hoop® 4M for an effective weight loss and toning regime. The foam padding and high-quality, durable plastic make it both easy and comfortable to hoop for a longer time.Benefits:• Great for adults to efficiently trim waistlines and tone core muscles• Enhances cardio workouts• Improves posture and circulation• Targeted workout for core musclesThe Acu Hoop® series is one of our signature hoops with advanced patented wavy-ridged design. The wavy ridges provide concentrated force that work to stimulate your core muscles and tone your stomach, back, gluteus and hip muscles. The muscle stimulation scales with the hoop movement; the more powerful Acu Hoop® spin around your waist, the greater result.Sports Hoop® series offers a variety of weighted sports hula hoops specially designed and optimized to trim waistlines and lose weight. With over 30 models— each with unique features customized to fit all ages, sizes, and body types—.• Want to trim faster and lose more weight? Try our Power Hoop®• Want to hoop longer? Try our Trim Hoop®®2014 Sports Hoop, INC. All rights reserved. All Sports Hoop® products are U.S. registered trademarks or trademarks of of Sports Hoop, Inc.Bonus DVDSports Hoop Workout - Rosemary 46minsGet the best workout from weighted hula hoop. Class A:-Instructions,-Upper body,-Lower Body,-AbsClass B:-Front kick & Jab,-Back Kick & Jab,-Plis roundhouse,-Elbows,-Ab workout", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K7amqfXnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018DG5D4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories"]], "price": 42.25}}
{"item_id": "B0018DLRVO", "title": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Compression Sack", "description": "When the gear needs to become lighter and smaller, pack it into Sn240 Siliconized Cordura Compression Sacks.", "text": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Compression Sack When the gear needs to become lighter and smaller, pack it into Sn240 Siliconized Cordura Compression Sacks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-O0eftcCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018DLRVO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
