{"item_id": "B0018E9FVC", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Electronic Dial Calipers", "description": "Reloading ammunition requires attention to many critical cartridge dimensions, including case length, neck and base diameters, overall length, primer pocket depth, etc. Verifying these dimensions is quick and convenient with the Frankford Arsenal Calipers. The calipers are accurate to within .001-Inch. The calipers allow you to measure inside and outside diameters, plus depths. You will find them useful for many measuring tasks on and off the reloading bench. Packaged in a convenient, protective case.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Electronic Dial Calipers Reloading ammunition requires attention to many critical cartridge dimensions, including case length, neck and base diameters, overall length, primer pocket depth, etc. Verifying these dimensions is quick and convenient with the Frankford Arsenal Calipers. The calipers are accurate to within .001-Inch. The calipers allow you to measure inside and outside diameters, plus depths. You will find them useful for many measuring tasks on and off the reloading bench. Packaged in a convenient, protective case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OzbBh9y2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018E9FVC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018EC2IU", "title": "j/fit Balance Pods (Pair)", "description": "Use these balance pods in your next agility training session to create more instability and difficulty. The 6\" diameter dome can be used flat side up or pebble side up, depending on skill level or application. Textured surface for use in rehabilitation and massage therapy. Air pump sold separately. Color: Blue. Dimensions: 6\" diameter x 3\" H. Wt. 3 lbs.", "text": "j/fit Balance Pods (Pair) Use these balance pods in your next agility training session to create more instability and difficulty. The 6\" diameter dome can be used flat side up or pebble side up, depending on skill level or application. Textured surface for use in rehabilitation and massage therapy. Air pump sold separately. Color: Blue. Dimensions: 6\" diameter x 3\" H. Wt. 3 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VoWTElq7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018EC2IU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JFIT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018EQIGM", "title": "Stansport Black Granite Steel Mess Kit", "description": "Stansport's Black Granite Mess Kit is made of rugged steel construction, it's granite finish will withstand temperatures up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The kit includes a fry pan, boiling pot and plate. The durable non-stick finish makes cooking and cleanup fast and easy. Hand wash in mild soapy water.", "text": "Stansport Black Granite Steel Mess Kit Stansport's Black Granite Mess Kit is made of rugged steel construction, it's granite finish will withstand temperatures up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The kit includes a fry pan, boiling pot and plate. The durable non-stick finish makes cooking and cleanup fast and easy. Hand wash in mild soapy water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F3BBAKYhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018EQIGM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018EW8Q6", "title": "Primos Old Crow Call", "description": "The Old Crow has been designed to replicate the exact volume, pitch, and cadence of crows. Whether you’re trying to call up a bunch of murderous crows or locate a turkey, the Old Crow does it best. By getting the crows stirred up, you can pull a gobble out of a weary tom. For a call, that’s easy-to-blow, use the Old Crow. The Old Crow barrel is crafted from a single piece of laminated hardwood.", "text": "Primos Old Crow Call The Old Crow has been designed to replicate the exact volume, pitch, and cadence of crows. Whether you’re trying to call up a bunch of murderous crows or locate a turkey, the Old Crow does it best. By getting the crows stirred up, you can pull a gobble out of a weary tom. For a call, that’s easy-to-blow, use the Old Crow. The Old Crow barrel is crafted from a single piece of laminated hardwood.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rI-8q-RkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018EW8Q6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B0018F3E2W", "title": "Kershaw Black Shallot Knife with Tungsten DLC Black coating on Blade & Handle and Partially Serrated Blade", "description": "For this one, we've peeled away the layers, leaving nothing but superb form, keen function, and pure stainless steel. The Shallot features a Sandvik 14C28N recurve blade. The unique recurve blade design provides for low mass and high performance, while the 14C28N steel offers excellent hardness, corrosion, and wear resistance. This high-carbon chromium steel provides for a high quality blade ideal for a wide range of both everyday and extraordinary tasks. The Shallot is available with a smooth blade and a partially serrated blade. This exceptional blade is partnered with a sleek stainless-steel handle designed for a sure, ergonomic grip. The handle is built of 410 stainless steel, hardened and tempered to provide maximum strength. For safety, there's a convenient frame lock to secure the blade in position until you choose to release it. Both blade and handle are polished to a steely matte-gray finish. Or, if you prefer the dark, choose the Black Shallot, with a smooth or partially serrated blade featuring a Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating. All Shallots feature our SpeedSafe ambidextrous manually assisted opening. Just pull back on the blade protrusion with the index finger of either the left or right hand. The SpeedSafe system then moves the blade out of the handle and smoothly and easily into position, ready for use. The Shallot is a pocket-perfect 4-3/8 inches closed and weighs just 4.2 ounces. It is made in the USA and built to uphold Kershaw's high standards of quality and performance. Like the tasty shallot it's named for, the new Kershaw Shallot is sure to make your mouth water for more.", "text": "Kershaw Black Shallot Knife with Tungsten DLC Black coating on Blade & Handle and Partially Serrated Blade For this one, we've peeled away the layers, leaving nothing but superb form, keen function, and pure stainless steel. The Shallot features a Sandvik 14C28N recurve blade. The unique recurve blade design provides for low mass and high performance, while the 14C28N steel offers excellent hardness, corrosion, and wear resistance. This high-carbon chromium steel provides for a high quality blade ideal for a wide range of both everyday and extraordinary tasks. The Shallot is available with a smooth blade and a partially serrated blade. This exceptional blade is partnered with a sleek stainless-steel handle designed for a sure, ergonomic grip. The handle is built of 410 stainless steel, hardened and tempered to provide maximum strength. For safety, there's a convenient frame lock to secure the blade in position until you choose to release it. Both blade and handle are polished to a steely matte-gray finish. Or, if you prefer the dark, choose the Black Shallot, with a smooth or partially serrated blade featuring a Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating. All Shallots feature our SpeedSafe ambidextrous manually assisted opening. Just pull back on the blade protrusion with the index finger of either the left or right hand. The SpeedSafe system then moves the blade out of the handle and smoothly and easily into position, ready for use. The Shallot is a pocket-perfect 4-3/8 inches closed and weighs just 4.2 ounces. It is made in the USA and built to uphold Kershaw's high standards of quality and performance. Like the tasty shallot it's named for, the new Kershaw Shallot is sure to make your mouth water for more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uKrTxdwmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018F3E2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 60.45}}
{"item_id": "B0018FNTGI", "title": "Snugpak Sleeper Lite Mummy Style Sleeping Bag, Olive Green", "description": "The Snugpak Sleep Lite Mummy Style sleeping bag is a robust sleeping bag that provides plenty of warmth in a realistic pack size. It has highly siliconized synthetic fibers that give it a soft touch and prolong lifespan.", "text": "Snugpak Sleeper Lite Mummy Style Sleeping Bag, Olive Green The Snugpak Sleep Lite Mummy Style sleeping bag is a robust sleeping bag that provides plenty of warmth in a realistic pack size. It has highly siliconized synthetic fibers that give it a soft touch and prolong lifespan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KJhqOG3IL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018FNTGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SnugPak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 56.1}}
{"item_id": "B0018GWO7M", "title": "ALTA ATA50413 AltaLok - AltaFlex Tactical Knee Pads Knee Pads Fastener Closure Neoprene/Nylon Rubber 1 Pair, Black", "description": "Tactical Superflex Knee Pads 50413 by Alta Industries have a long, soft rubber caps that resist marring and skidding and offer maximum surface coverage. The super-thick foam padding makes kneeling for long periods more comfortable. These knee pads help provide you proper traction and feature a durable liner for longer use. The Alta Superflex Black Tactical Knee Pads contain the AltaLok, Hook & Loop Fastening System.", "text": "ALTA ATA50413 AltaLok - AltaFlex Tactical Knee Pads Knee Pads Fastener Closure Neoprene/Nylon Rubber 1 Pair, Black Tactical Superflex Knee Pads 50413 by Alta Industries have a long, soft rubber caps that resist marring and skidding and offer maximum surface coverage. The super-thick foam padding makes kneeling for long periods more comfortable. These knee pads help provide you proper traction and feature a durable liner for longer use. The Alta Superflex Black Tactical Knee Pads contain the AltaLok, Hook & Loop Fastening System.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZS-79VgoL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018GWO7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alta Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B0018J76VS", "title": "Black Diamond Apollo Lantern", "description": "A bright, non-glaring, soup can sized backcountry lantern. Foldable legs and hanging loop provide endless placement opportunities", "text": "Black Diamond Apollo Lantern A bright, non-glaring, soup can sized backcountry lantern. Foldable legs and hanging loop provide endless placement opportunities", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WR2pb0zOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018J76VS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 49.95}}
