{"item_id": "B0018KUBEQ", "title": "Black Diamond Freewire Quickdraw", "description": "Perfect for the sport climber on a budget, the Black Diamond Freewire Quickdraw gives full wiregate performance without emptying your wallet.", "text": "Black Diamond Freewire Quickdraw Perfect for the sport climber on a budget, the Black Diamond Freewire Quickdraw gives full wiregate performance without emptying your wallet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318-qFkDWaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018KUBEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Quickdraw"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9L1O", "title": "IZH 61 air rifle", "description": "Good things come in small packages, and the Russian-made IZH 61 is no exception! This repeating air rifle is so much fun to shoot, you'll definitely have a tough time putting it down. A spring-powered gun, the IZH 61 is easy to cock and can be used by adults and youngsters (with adult supervision). The trigger is adjustable for length of pull. The synthetic stock has a raised cheekpiece and the length of the stock is adjustable (31 to 33). The rear sight is a fully adjustable notch. The front sight is hooded. Load five pellets into the removable clip (2 clips included), insert it, cock the sidelever and start having fun! You can add a red dot sight on the 11mm dovetails to get even more accuracy from this rifle. Speaking of accuracy...you won't outgrow the potential of this gun! The accuracy of the hammer-forged steel barrel is pretty close to what you'll get on a super-expensive Olympic target rifle. Yeah, it's THAT good! Includes owner's manual.... Don't forget to click on the AMMO link for a list of recommended pellets. Check the ACCESSORIES link for red dots and appropriate mounts, fun targets and safety gear you'll need.... The MOST fun you can have with an airgun! Includes cleaning rod....", "text": "IZH 61 air rifle Good things come in small packages, and the Russian-made IZH 61 is no exception! This repeating air rifle is so much fun to shoot, you'll definitely have a tough time putting it down. A spring-powered gun, the IZH 61 is easy to cock and can be used by adults and youngsters (with adult supervision). The trigger is adjustable for length of pull. The synthetic stock has a raised cheekpiece and the length of the stock is adjustable (31 to 33). The rear sight is a fully adjustable notch. The front sight is hooded. Load five pellets into the removable clip (2 clips included), insert it, cock the sidelever and start having fun! You can add a red dot sight on the 11mm dovetails to get even more accuracy from this rifle. Speaking of accuracy...you won't outgrow the potential of this gun! The accuracy of the hammer-forged steel barrel is pretty close to what you'll get on a super-expensive Olympic target rifle. Yeah, it's THAT good! Includes owner's manual.... Don't forget to click on the AMMO link for a list of recommended pellets. Check the ACCESSORIES link for red dots and appropriate mounts, fun targets and safety gear you'll need.... The MOST fun you can have with an airgun! Includes cleaning rod....", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21gzro-Fo3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9L1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IZH-Baikal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 129.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9NJE", "title": "Diana RWS 34 Meisterschutze Pro Compact air rifle", "description": "The RWS 34 Meisterschütze Pro (Master Shooter, pronounced \"my-stir-shoots\") is built from the same reliable RWS air gun as the Model 34 rifle. It operates from the same proven break barrel system but is professionally finished with a straight hardwood stock made for both right- and left-hand shooters. The 34 Meisterschütze Pro Compact also has an ambidextrous automatic safety, rifled barrel and two-stage adjustable trigger. This RWS 34 is time-proven power with a sleek design. The 34 Pro's receiver and barrel have a matte black finish that provides a rich look. At the front of this 34 Pro rifle is a large muzzlebrake that adds heft and a gripping point for cocking the spring piston. To top off this German made air rifle is an included airgun scope and 1-piece mount. This air rifle scope is a 3-9x40 air gun scope with an adjustable objective. Whether you already own an RWS or this will be your first, you won't be disappointed in the fine German rifle craftsmanship and sleek look. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) - Optic Compatible: 11 mm groove - Safety Type: Automatic - Length of Pull: 14 - Recoil Pad Type: Rubber - Solid - Barrel Type: Rifled - Barrel Finish: Black Matte - Cocking Effort in lbs.: 33 - Trigger Type: 2-Stage; adjustable - Trigger Pull in lbs.: 3.3 - Energy in Joules: 15.5 - Ammo Type: Pellet - Velocity- FPS: 1000 - Ambidextrous", "text": "Diana RWS 34 Meisterschutze Pro Compact air rifle The RWS 34 Meisterschütze Pro (Master Shooter, pronounced \"my-stir-shoots\") is built from the same reliable RWS air gun as the Model 34 rifle. It operates from the same proven break barrel system but is professionally finished with a straight hardwood stock made for both right- and left-hand shooters. The 34 Meisterschütze Pro Compact also has an ambidextrous automatic safety, rifled barrel and two-stage adjustable trigger. This RWS 34 is time-proven power with a sleek design. The 34 Pro's receiver and barrel have a matte black finish that provides a rich look. At the front of this 34 Pro rifle is a large muzzlebrake that adds heft and a gripping point for cocking the spring piston. To top off this German made air rifle is an included airgun scope and 1-piece mount. This air rifle scope is a 3-9x40 air gun scope with an adjustable objective. Whether you already own an RWS or this will be your first, you won't be disappointed in the fine German rifle craftsmanship and sleek look. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) - Optic Compatible: 11 mm groove - Safety Type: Automatic - Length of Pull: 14 - Recoil Pad Type: Rubber - Solid - Barrel Type: Rifled - Barrel Finish: Black Matte - Cocking Effort in lbs.: 33 - Trigger Type: 2-Stage; adjustable - Trigger Pull in lbs.: 3.3 - Energy in Joules: 15.5 - Ammo Type: Pellet - Velocity- FPS: 1000 - Ambidextrous", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21bUxepdToL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9NJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 289.61}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9O9I", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Champion (Brown/Black, 36.25 Inch)", "description": "The Avanti Champion has been dubbed \"the most accurate BB gun in the world\" time and again. The spring air rifle offers such features as a stained solid wood stock, a smooth bore steel barrel, and a muzzle velocity of 240 feet per second. Emblazoned with an \"Official Shooting Education BB Gun by Daisy\" medallion, the single-shot, muzzle-loading BB gun looks as great as it performs.SpecificationsAction: Lever cocking, spring airSights: Hooded front with aperture inserts, adjustable rear peepSafety: ManualMuzzle velocity: 240 fpsMuzzle energy: 0.7 ft. lbs.Caliber: 0.177Stock: Monte Carlo stained hardwoodForearm: Stained hardwood with internal compartments for additional weightMagazine: Single-shot, muzzle loading with BB retainerBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 177 yardsLength: 36.25 inchesWeight: 3.1 pounds", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Champion (Brown/Black, 36.25 Inch) The Avanti Champion has been dubbed \"the most accurate BB gun in the world\" time and again. The spring air rifle offers such features as a stained solid wood stock, a smooth bore steel barrel, and a muzzle velocity of 240 feet per second. Emblazoned with an \"Official Shooting Education BB Gun by Daisy\" medallion, the single-shot, muzzle-loading BB gun looks as great as it performs.SpecificationsAction: Lever cocking, spring airSights: Hooded front with aperture inserts, adjustable rear peepSafety: ManualMuzzle velocity: 240 fpsMuzzle energy: 0.7 ft. lbs.Caliber: 0.177Stock: Monte Carlo stained hardwoodForearm: Stained hardwood with internal compartments for additional weightMagazine: Single-shot, muzzle loading with BB retainerBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 177 yardsLength: 36.25 inchesWeight: 3.1 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21HDLitCU2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9O9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 129.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9P2O", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Triumph Pistol (Brown/Black, 13.5 Inch)", "description": "The Triumph Pistol from Daisy offers high-level accuracy at a bargain price. The pistol features molded woodgrain checkered grips with a contoured thumb rest for feel. The single-pump pneumatic power offers velocities of up to 360 feet per second.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5-millimeter) pelletAction: Single-pump pneumaticSafety: manual trigger blockGrips: Molded checkered woodgrain and contoured thumb rest (right hand)Barrel: Rifled solid steelMagazine: Single shotMaximum Muzzle Velocity: 360 feet per secondMaximum Shooting Distance: 209 yardsWeight: 2.25 poundsOverall Length: 13.5 inches", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Triumph Pistol (Brown/Black, 13.5 Inch) The Triumph Pistol from Daisy offers high-level accuracy at a bargain price. The pistol features molded woodgrain checkered grips with a contoured thumb rest for feel. The single-pump pneumatic power offers velocities of up to 360 feet per second.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5-millimeter) pelletAction: Single-pump pneumaticSafety: manual trigger blockGrips: Molded checkered woodgrain and contoured thumb rest (right hand)Barrel: Rifled solid steelMagazine: Single shotMaximum Muzzle Velocity: 360 feet per secondMaximum Shooting Distance: 209 yardsWeight: 2.25 poundsOverall Length: 13.5 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31o2f3ML2XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9P2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avanti", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 219.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9UOW", "title": "J-B Non-Embedding Bore Cleaning Compound", "description": "Paste cleaner gets bores sparkling clean without caustic liquids. Removes lead residue in just three passes. Cushioned abrasive action actually polishes your bore clean without damage. Used and trusted by precision shooters for over 40 years to clean their finest rifle bores. 2 oz. jar", "text": "J-B Non-Embedding Bore Cleaning Compound Paste cleaner gets bores sparkling clean without caustic liquids. Removes lead residue in just three passes. Cushioned abrasive action actually polishes your bore clean without damage. Used and trusted by precision shooters for over 40 years to clean their finest rifle bores. 2 oz. jar", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F561KY42L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9UOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brownells", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.59}}
{"item_id": "B0018L9Y7U", "title": "Air Venturi Intermount, Fits Benjamin Sheridan Multi-Pump Rifles", "description": "If you mounted a pistol scope on your Benjamin multi-pump but wanted to mount a rifle scope, now you can! Get this kit & mount a rifle scope in minutes! Custom-machined intermount & Picatinny rail Fits Benjamin Sheridan multi-pump rifles Easily slips on the receiver, spanning the pellet-loading area Mounts back far enough to accommodate a rifle scope 2-piece intermount mounts on receiver & included Picatinny rail attaches to the intermount Attach scope rings to the Picatinny rail Includes 2-piece aluminum intermount, 2 steel screws and Picatinny rail Scope & rings not includedFits Benjamin Sheridan multi-pumps with rounded receivers measuring .540 to .565 in diameter.", "text": "Air Venturi Intermount, Fits Benjamin Sheridan Multi-Pump Rifles If you mounted a pistol scope on your Benjamin multi-pump but wanted to mount a rifle scope, now you can! Get this kit & mount a rifle scope in minutes! Custom-machined intermount & Picatinny rail Fits Benjamin Sheridan multi-pump rifles Easily slips on the receiver, spanning the pellet-loading area Mounts back far enough to accommodate a rifle scope 2-piece intermount mounts on receiver & included Picatinny rail attaches to the intermount Attach scope rings to the Picatinny rail Includes 2-piece aluminum intermount, 2 steel screws and Picatinny rail Scope & rings not includedFits Benjamin Sheridan multi-pumps with rounded receivers measuring .540 to .565 in diameter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NKRMg1L8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018L9Y7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Air Venturi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 26.64}}
{"item_id": "B0018LA0UK", "title": "UTG Deluxe Commando Belt Holster", "description": "Designed to fit most medium pistols, the UTG Deluxe Commando Belt Holster features high-quality and durable polyester material, a premium quality quick-release buckle, snap-on and Velcro straps, a fully adjustable belt keeper, and is law-enforcement quality at only 0.3 pounds.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Commando Belt Holster Designed to fit most medium pistols, the UTG Deluxe Commando Belt Holster features high-quality and durable polyester material, a premium quality quick-release buckle, snap-on and Velcro straps, a fully adjustable belt keeper, and is law-enforcement quality at only 0.3 pounds.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51icyNw3MIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LA0UK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 0.01}}
{"item_id": "B0018LA18G", "title": "Crosman Pellets Hollow Pt .22cal 14.3grain Tin 5", "description": "Lead airgun ammunition contains a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects (or other reproductive harm). Do not inhale dust or put pellets in mouth. Wash hands after handling.Specifications Overview: Weight: 14.3 grainCaliber: .22Quantity: 500 count", "text": "Crosman Pellets Hollow Pt .22cal 14.3grain Tin 5 Lead airgun ammunition contains a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects (or other reproductive harm). Do not inhale dust or put pellets in mouth. Wash hands after handling.Specifications Overview: Weight: 14.3 grainCaliber: .22Quantity: 500 count", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jwveahmDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LA18G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 16.66}}
{"item_id": "B0018LB3SI", "title": "Shotgun and Pistol Black Airsoft Package airsoft gun", "description": "1/1 Scale Assembled Plastic Model Gun This spring-powered repeating M3 SWAT team airsoft paintball shotgun comes with pack of bbs. Shotgun holds up to 100 bbs. Included in this kit is the P618 pistol which holds about 9 rounds and shoots approx 160 FPS. A very nice collector and practice gun. This is a detailed 1:1 scale replica airsoft gun selling at a very affordable. It is not as durable and consistent in performance as our other high grade airsoft guns. This airsoft gun is intended for beginner level shooting. Please note that because this airsoft gun is meant for beginners and entertainment, We offer one week warranty on this item. If you are looking for a gun that will provide long-term performance, we recommend looking at our other high grade guns.", "text": "Shotgun and Pistol Black Airsoft Package airsoft gun 1/1 Scale Assembled Plastic Model Gun This spring-powered repeating M3 SWAT team airsoft paintball shotgun comes with pack of bbs. Shotgun holds up to 100 bbs. Included in this kit is the P618 pistol which holds about 9 rounds and shoots approx 160 FPS. A very nice collector and practice gun. This is a detailed 1:1 scale replica airsoft gun selling at a very affordable. It is not as durable and consistent in performance as our other high grade airsoft guns. This airsoft gun is intended for beginner level shooting. Please note that because this airsoft gun is meant for beginners and entertainment, We offer one week warranty on this item. If you are looking for a gun that will provide long-term performance, we recommend looking at our other high grade guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VWWL0dXUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LB3SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CYMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 18.14}}
{"item_id": "B0018LB9A0", "title": "Crosman American Classic Pump Air Pistol (.177)", "description": "Single-bolt design for easier cocking and loading. Variable pump power for velocity control.Crosman 1377 American Classic .177-caliber air pistolSingle-bolt designVariable pump powerRifled barrelShoots up to 600 fpsFixed front and adjustable rear sightAdult supervision required", "text": "Crosman American Classic Pump Air Pistol (.177) Single-bolt design for easier cocking and loading. Variable pump power for velocity control.Crosman 1377 American Classic .177-caliber air pistolSingle-bolt designVariable pump powerRifled barrelShoots up to 600 fpsFixed front and adjustable rear sightAdult supervision required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NMboC%2Bw4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LB9A0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 52.2}}
{"item_id": "B0018LBJPK", "title": "UTG P28 Red Laser Xenon Flashlight Combo", "description": "UTG 2-in-1 Integral Tactial Xenon Flashlight/TS Rated Precision Red Laser System with 4-Stage Functional Switch and Ambi Finger Adjustable Toggle/Permanent On/Off Switch, Complete w/Universal Integral Picatinny/Weaver Mounting Deck and 2 Lithium Batteries", "text": "UTG P28 Red Laser Xenon Flashlight Combo UTG 2-in-1 Integral Tactial Xenon Flashlight/TS Rated Precision Red Laser System with 4-Stage Functional Switch and Ambi Finger Adjustable Toggle/Permanent On/Off Switch, Complete w/Universal Integral Picatinny/Weaver Mounting Deck and 2 Lithium Batteries", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B7WPkQ2%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LBJPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 64.97}}
{"item_id": "B0018LBKUO", "title": "UTG Dual Pistol Mag Pouch, Velcro Close", "description": "The Dual Pistol Magazine Pouch from UTG makes it easy to carry even the large, large Desert Eagle 357 9rd mag on your belt. The pouch features Velcro closures that keep your mags secure while also enabling quick access. The pouch is equipped with vertical ALICE clips and a horizontal Velcro belt loop for easy attachment on your person.The Mag Pouch is equipped with ALICE clips and Velcro for easy attachment.", "text": "UTG Dual Pistol Mag Pouch, Velcro Close The Dual Pistol Magazine Pouch from UTG makes it easy to carry even the large, large Desert Eagle 357 9rd mag on your belt. The pouch features Velcro closures that keep your mags secure while also enabling quick access. The pouch is equipped with vertical ALICE clips and a horizontal Velcro belt loop for easy attachment on your person.The Mag Pouch is equipped with ALICE clips and Velcro for easy attachment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512rfgf%2Bc3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LBKUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 9.35}}
{"item_id": "B0018LD61A", "title": "Tactical Force F11 Air Soft Plastic Lightweight Pistol", "description": "The Tactical Force TF11 is powered by a single 12-gram CO2 cylinder and fires airsoft BBs at an incredible 1,000 rpm! It doesn't take long to send a barrage of BBs. Can be fired in either full- or semi-auto modes at 350 fps. To add to the realism, it has blowback action! Plastic exterior, internals are a combination of metal & plastic. Metal parts include the trigger, switch selector, barrel, safety, charging handle & front sight.", "text": "Tactical Force F11 Air Soft Plastic Lightweight Pistol The Tactical Force TF11 is powered by a single 12-gram CO2 cylinder and fires airsoft BBs at an incredible 1,000 rpm! It doesn't take long to send a barrage of BBs. Can be fired in either full- or semi-auto modes at 350 fps. To add to the realism, it has blowback action! Plastic exterior, internals are a combination of metal & plastic. Metal parts include the trigger, switch selector, barrel, safety, charging handle & front sight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yYqGjtu%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LD61A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tactical Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 84.96}}
{"item_id": "B0018LD6Q0", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Red Ryder Gun, Brown/Black, 35.4-Inch", "description": "From the pages of comic books to the big screen, the Daisy Red Ryder is an all-time classic. With its solid wood stock and forearm and lariat ring with a leather thong, the most popular BB gun in the world remains faithful to its original design. This 650 shot carbine is the spitting image of the one you cherished growing up and its legendary status continues to grow.About Daisy Outdoor Products:Remember your first airgun? The excitement. The pride. The fun. For millions of today's shooters the name on that first gun was Daisy. Today, we're still the first choice when it comes to introducing a young shooter to airgunning. Simple, easy-to-use designs. Safety features built-in. Ideal for developing shooting and marksmanship skills--Daisy covers the beginner airgun market like no other. For 125 years, Daisy Outdoor Products has been teaching America to shoot safely. Our brand is woven through generations of the fabric that makes up this great nation we all call home. From the most recognizable of all our products, the Daisy Red Ryder and the Model 25 Pump, to our line of quality affordable adult PowerLine Rifles, such as the Model 880, our brand evokes memories of responsibility granted, lessons learned, fun times shared with parents and grandparents and most of all the beginning of a lifelong enjoyment of the shooting sports. Daisy Outdoor Products is the world's oldest and largest manufacturer of air guns. Daisy’s brands include Daisy, PowerLine, Winchester Air Rifles and AVANTI training and match competitive airguns and Precision Max ammunition and accessories. It all starts here, with a Daisy. Take Pride. It’s a Daisy.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Red Ryder Gun, Brown/Black, 35.4-Inch From the pages of comic books to the big screen, the Daisy Red Ryder is an all-time classic. With its solid wood stock and forearm and lariat ring with a leather thong, the most popular BB gun in the world remains faithful to its original design. This 650 shot carbine is the spitting image of the one you cherished growing up and its legendary status continues to grow.About Daisy Outdoor Products:Remember your first airgun? The excitement. The pride. The fun. For millions of today's shooters the name on that first gun was Daisy. Today, we're still the first choice when it comes to introducing a young shooter to airgunning. Simple, easy-to-use designs. Safety features built-in. Ideal for developing shooting and marksmanship skills--Daisy covers the beginner airgun market like no other. For 125 years, Daisy Outdoor Products has been teaching America to shoot safely. Our brand is woven through generations of the fabric that makes up this great nation we all call home. From the most recognizable of all our products, the Daisy Red Ryder and the Model 25 Pump, to our line of quality affordable adult PowerLine Rifles, such as the Model 880, our brand evokes memories of responsibility granted, lessons learned, fun times shared with parents and grandparents and most of all the beginning of a lifelong enjoyment of the shooting sports. Daisy Outdoor Products is the world's oldest and largest manufacturer of air guns. Daisy’s brands include Daisy, PowerLine, Winchester Air Rifles and AVANTI training and match competitive airguns and Precision Max ammunition and accessories. It all starts here, with a Daisy. Take Pride. It’s a Daisy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wJ4prvJYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LD6Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018LD6QK", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Black Grizzly Air Rifle (Black, 36.8 Inch)", "description": "When young shooters are ready to elevate their shooting skills, the single-pump Model 840B is the ideal choice. Use as a single-shot pellet rifle or a 350-shot BB repeater.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Black Grizzly Air Rifle (Black, 36.8 Inch) When young shooters are ready to elevate their shooting skills, the single-pump Model 840B is the ideal choice. Use as a single-shot pellet rifle or a 350-shot BB repeater.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21trj%2BNa14L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LD6QK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018LDCCI", "title": "UTG Dual Pack Sniper Magazines for Type 96 spring airsoft rifle", "description": "Double Pack Spare Magazine for UTG S368 Shadow Ops Sniper Rifle, Blister Packaging", "text": "UTG Dual Pack Sniper Magazines for Type 96 spring airsoft rifle Double Pack Spare Magazine for UTG S368 Shadow Ops Sniper Rifle, Blister Packaging", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nMKTb8qHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LDCCI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 19.94}}
{"item_id": "B0018LER90", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 880 Rifle (Dark Brown/Black, 37.6 Inch)", "description": "The 880 Rifle from Daisy features classic looks with a woodgrained, Monte Carlo stock, forearm, and grip as well as a rifled steel barrel. The 0.177-caliber rifle can shoot both BBs and pellets with multi-pump pneumatic action. With velocities of 800 feet per second using BBs and 665 feet per second using pellets, it is no wonder that this is one of Daisy's most popular rifles.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5-millimeter) BB or pelletAction: Multi-pump pneumaticSafety: Crossbolt trigger blockStock, Forearm, Grip: Monte Carlo-styled, molded woodgrainBarrel: Rifled steelReceiver: Engineering resin with dovetail mount for scopeMaximum Muzzle Velocity with BBs: 800 feet per secondMaximum Muzzle Velocity with Pellets: 665 feet per secondCapacity: 50 shots with BBs; single shot with pelletsMaximum Shooting Distance: 291 yardsWeight: 3.10 poundsOverall Length: 37.6 inches", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 880 Rifle (Dark Brown/Black, 37.6 Inch) The 880 Rifle from Daisy features classic looks with a woodgrained, Monte Carlo stock, forearm, and grip as well as a rifled steel barrel. The 0.177-caliber rifle can shoot both BBs and pellets with multi-pump pneumatic action. With velocities of 800 feet per second using BBs and 665 feet per second using pellets, it is no wonder that this is one of Daisy's most popular rifles.Specifications:Caliber: 0.177 (4.5-millimeter) BB or pelletAction: Multi-pump pneumaticSafety: Crossbolt trigger blockStock, Forearm, Grip: Monte Carlo-styled, molded woodgrainBarrel: Rifled steelReceiver: Engineering resin with dovetail mount for scopeMaximum Muzzle Velocity with BBs: 800 feet per secondMaximum Muzzle Velocity with Pellets: 665 feet per secondCapacity: 50 shots with BBs; single shot with pelletsMaximum Shooting Distance: 291 yardsWeight: 3.10 poundsOverall Length: 37.6 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21wV22wRCAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LER90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 46.65}}
{"item_id": "B0018LESAI", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 901 Gun (Black, 37.5 Inch)", "description": "The PowerLine Model 901 features a black advanced-composite stock and forearm. This sleek, multi-pump air rifle shoots either BBs or pellets. Target shooters will be in the black with the adjustable rear sight, the TruGlo fiber optic front sight and the rifled steel barrel. With a maximum muzzle velocity of 750 fps and a dovetail feature for mounting optics, this gun also fits the bill for small game hunting.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 901 Gun (Black, 37.5 Inch) The PowerLine Model 901 features a black advanced-composite stock and forearm. This sleek, multi-pump air rifle shoots either BBs or pellets. Target shooters will be in the black with the adjustable rear sight, the TruGlo fiber optic front sight and the rifled steel barrel. With a maximum muzzle velocity of 750 fps and a dovetail feature for mounting optics, this gun also fits the bill for small game hunting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CbOPqqmEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LESAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 70.28}}
{"item_id": "B0018LETH0", "title": "Crosman Benjamin Discovery Pre-Charged Pneumatic PCP Dual Fuel .22 Air Rifle and Pump", "description": "Trouble-free, highly accurate. Once it is filled, there is no pumping and no worry about the outdoor temperature. Just shoot until the gun needs to be refilled. The Discovery's 2000 psi fill level means almost anyone old enough to shoot this rifle will also be able to fill it from the hand pump that comes in the package. Dual Fuel - An inexpensive CO2 adapter (not included) converts this rifle from compressed air to CO2 operation which makes it easy to fill from a standard paintball tank, offering more shots from a single fill. CO2 is excellent for indoor use or for outdoor casual plinking.", "text": "Crosman Benjamin Discovery Pre-Charged Pneumatic PCP Dual Fuel .22 Air Rifle and Pump Trouble-free, highly accurate. Once it is filled, there is no pumping and no worry about the outdoor temperature. Just shoot until the gun needs to be refilled. The Discovery's 2000 psi fill level means almost anyone old enough to shoot this rifle will also be able to fill it from the hand pump that comes in the package. Dual Fuel - An inexpensive CO2 adapter (not included) converts this rifle from compressed air to CO2 operation which makes it easy to fill from a standard paintball tank, offering more shots from a single fill. CO2 is excellent for indoor use or for outdoor casual plinking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315jsD8gmdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LETH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 399.98}}
{"item_id": "B0018LGT5K", "title": "Crosman 760 Pump Master Variable Pump BB Repeater/Single Shot Pellet Rifle", "description": "", "text": "Crosman 760 Pump Master Variable Pump BB Repeater/Single Shot Pellet Rifle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A-Jm2twcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LGT5K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0018LH2QA", "title": "Yukon Nvrs Tactical 2.5X50 with Internal Focusing Night Vision Riflescope", "description": "Advanced optics are capable of providing 2.5X night vision magnification in low light conditions, at up to 220 yards of detection distance.The Yukon NVRS Tactical Internal Focus 2.5x50 scope features enhanced optics, a durable titanium body, and sleek lines. Internal focusing ability and an ergonomic design create a comfortable shooting experience, while the powerful 50-millimeter lens provides high resolution and light gathering capabilities.Flip-up lens covers open to reveal quality multicoated optics and an illuminated reticle. An exclusive Pulse built-in infrared illuminator expands viewing range while minimizing battery drainage. It provides the maximum possible infrared output, but allows the illuminator diode to pulse, protecting the IR from burning out. This pulsing is invisible to the human eye, but means the illuminator can penetrate longer distances.The scope is digital camera adaptable with the digital camera accessory, and additional accessories--sold separately--include a laser pointer, AK adapter, IR flashlight, and doubler lens.FeaturesLightweight, durable titanium bodyFocusing objective lens and multi-coated opticsAdjustable lit red-on-green reticleStandard weaver MIL-STD-1913 rail mount systemPrecision windage and elevation adjustment (1cl = 20mm / 100m)On/off remount controlBuilt-in powerful Pulse IR system infrared illuminatorFlip-up objective lens coverLong mount for bolt action riflesOptional accessories provide high fidelity photo and video recordingWater intrusion meets IPX5 ratingIncluded AccessoriesCarrying caseRemote on/off switchFlip-up lens coversSpecifications2.5X magnification50-millimeter lens diameter15-degree field of view32-36 lp/mm resolutionOne yard to infinity focus range45-millimeter eye relief+/-4 diopter adjustmentUp to 220-yard detection distance100-yard infrared illuminator distance1/2 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustmentRuns on two AA batteries for up to 50 hours-22-to-122-degree operating temperatureMeasures 3.1 by 3.3 by ten inches (W x H x D)33.5-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyThis Yukon optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Yukon Nvrs Tactical 2.5X50 with Internal Focusing Night Vision Riflescope Advanced optics are capable of providing 2.5X night vision magnification in low light conditions, at up to 220 yards of detection distance.The Yukon NVRS Tactical Internal Focus 2.5x50 scope features enhanced optics, a durable titanium body, and sleek lines. Internal focusing ability and an ergonomic design create a comfortable shooting experience, while the powerful 50-millimeter lens provides high resolution and light gathering capabilities.Flip-up lens covers open to reveal quality multicoated optics and an illuminated reticle. An exclusive Pulse built-in infrared illuminator expands viewing range while minimizing battery drainage. It provides the maximum possible infrared output, but allows the illuminator diode to pulse, protecting the IR from burning out. This pulsing is invisible to the human eye, but means the illuminator can penetrate longer distances.The scope is digital camera adaptable with the digital camera accessory, and additional accessories--sold separately--include a laser pointer, AK adapter, IR flashlight, and doubler lens.FeaturesLightweight, durable titanium bodyFocusing objective lens and multi-coated opticsAdjustable lit red-on-green reticleStandard weaver MIL-STD-1913 rail mount systemPrecision windage and elevation adjustment (1cl = 20mm / 100m)On/off remount controlBuilt-in powerful Pulse IR system infrared illuminatorFlip-up objective lens coverLong mount for bolt action riflesOptional accessories provide high fidelity photo and video recordingWater intrusion meets IPX5 ratingIncluded AccessoriesCarrying caseRemote on/off switchFlip-up lens coversSpecifications2.5X magnification50-millimeter lens diameter15-degree field of view32-36 lp/mm resolutionOne yard to infinity focus range45-millimeter eye relief+/-4 diopter adjustmentUp to 220-yard detection distance100-yard infrared illuminator distance1/2 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustmentRuns on two AA batteries for up to 50 hours-22-to-122-degree operating temperatureMeasures 3.1 by 3.3 by ten inches (W x H x D)33.5-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyThis Yukon optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tBRYsL03L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018LH2QA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yukon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 599.0}}
