{"item_id": "B0018MU2EI", "title": "MSA Safety Works 10087625 Foam Ear Plugs, Orange and Green, 80-Pairs", "description": "Soft low ear pressure plugs are comfortable for a variety of activities. Easy to roll foam easily inserts into ear and expands for a comfortable custom fit. These Foam Ear Plugs come in an easy to dispense large bullet shaped reusable container. There are 40 green and 40 orange so it is easy to keep the right separate from the left. Super comfortable foam allows hours of comfortable noise and sound protection. The plugs offer 31dB noise reduction.", "text": "MSA Safety Works 10087625 Foam Ear Plugs, Orange and Green, 80-Pairs Soft low ear pressure plugs are comfortable for a variety of activities. Easy to roll foam easily inserts into ear and expands for a comfortable custom fit. These Foam Ear Plugs come in an easy to dispense large bullet shaped reusable container. There are 40 green and 40 orange so it is easy to keep the right separate from the left. Super comfortable foam allows hours of comfortable noise and sound protection. The plugs offer 31dB noise reduction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jrDKG5ljL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018MU2EI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSA Safety Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B0018O035O", "title": "Peli Desiccant Silica Gel", "description": "Peli Desiccant Silica Gel drinks dampness, prevents condensation from trapped air when cases are opened in damp, high humidity climates. Fits all cases. Size: 2 x 4", "text": "Peli Desiccant Silica Gel Peli Desiccant Silica Gel drinks dampness, prevents condensation from trapped air when cases are opened in damp, high humidity climates. Fits all cases. Size: 2 x 4", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aOksYCOOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018O035O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018PG10E", "title": "Ontario Spec Plus Gen II SP43 Knife (Black)", "description": "The Ontario Knife Spec Plus Gen II series of outdoor survival knives was designed strictly for function. These full-tang historically based knives are water jet cut from tough 5160 steel to deliver a durable, easy to sharpen edge. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black textured and powder coated steel blades prevent rusting or scratching. Full tang blades are hardened to 53-55 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "text": "Ontario Spec Plus Gen II SP43 Knife (Black) The Ontario Knife Spec Plus Gen II series of outdoor survival knives was designed strictly for function. These full-tang historically based knives are water jet cut from tough 5160 steel to deliver a durable, easy to sharpen edge. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black textured and powder coated steel blades prevent rusting or scratching. Full tang blades are hardened to 53-55 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3194a9noJEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018PG10E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 60.29}}
{"item_id": "B0018PJXTU", "title": "Profile Design Kage", "description": "Material:plasticAttachment Possibilities:FrameWeight:52 gAdditional Information:reinforced holes in more areasintegrated rubber for optimum holdNylon Fibreglass", "text": "Profile Design Kage Material:plasticAttachment Possibilities:FrameWeight:52 gAdditional Information:reinforced holes in more areasintegrated rubber for optimum holdNylon Fibreglass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wGxyXpWwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018PJXTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 8.83}}
{"item_id": "B0018PPWV8", "title": "Brooks Bicycle Saddle Rain Cover", "description": "Broooks Rain Cover protects your Leather Saddle from moisture. If a wet saddle is ridden not only the colour may stain your clothing, but the leather top may easily deform. MEDIUM: for all road, mtb, trekking and touring saddles (Team Pro, B17,..). LARGE: for all city, transport and heavy duty saddles (B66, B33,..)", "text": "Brooks Bicycle Saddle Rain Cover Broooks Rain Cover protects your Leather Saddle from moisture. If a wet saddle is ridden not only the colour may stain your clothing, but the leather top may easily deform. MEDIUM: for all road, mtb, trekking and touring saddles (Team Pro, B17,..). LARGE: for all city, transport and heavy duty saddles (B66, B33,..)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oqWVvOiDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018PPWV8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018Q2QZM", "title": "Holster with Magazine Pouch Fits Bersa Thunder 380 & Concealed Carry", "description": "This is a brand new holster that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster with Magazine Pouch Fits Bersa Thunder 380 & Concealed Carry This is a brand new holster that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vJKYqmrRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018Q2QZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018QUG3G", "title": "9362 Special Forces Tactical Hat Khaki", "description": "Cotton/Polyester. Baseball style. With 6 reinforced air vent holes. With color matching polyester adjustment strap. Unisex. One size fits most. Plastic buckle. With loop patch on front (3.5\" wide x 2\" height). With loop patch on top of cap (1.125\" wide x 1\" height). Army style. Military style.", "text": "9362 Special Forces Tactical Hat Khaki Cotton/Polyester. Baseball style. With 6 reinforced air vent holes. With color matching polyester adjustment strap. Unisex. One size fits most. Plastic buckle. With loop patch on front (3.5\" wide x 2\" height). With loop patch on top of cap (1.125\" wide x 1\" height). Army style. Military style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oxSszDEqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018QUG3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B0018RMB8I", "title": "Spyderco Pacific Salt Plain Edge H1-Steel Knife", "description": "H1 is a PH steel meaning it is precipitation-processed alloy, that's rolled hard without heat treating and has .1% nitrogen which acts like carbon in the steel matrix, but does not react to chlorine making rust. Surprisingly, it holds a sharpened cutting edge comparable to the premium knife steels being used in the industry by most knife manufacturers.", "text": "Spyderco Pacific Salt Plain Edge H1-Steel Knife H1 is a PH steel meaning it is precipitation-processed alloy, that's rolled hard without heat treating and has .1% nitrogen which acts like carbon in the steel matrix, but does not react to chlorine making rust. Surprisingly, it holds a sharpened cutting edge comparable to the premium knife steels being used in the industry by most knife manufacturers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Hknui5tAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018RMB8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 70.72}}
{"item_id": "B0018S0R38", "title": "GCI Outdoor SitBacker Canoe Seat", "description": "The SitBacker canoe seat is designed to fasten to canoe benches by simply clicking the sturdy dual buckle strap system. Patented single buckle BackComfort Technology adjusts the backrest position for customized reclining while a lumbar cushion provides maximum comfort. Patented Auto-Fold Technology with Portage Lock shoulder strap allows for easy opening, closing and carrying. The split contour seat is ideal for both molded and flat canoe benches. The SitBacker canoe seat is constructed of sturdy, powder-coated steel and 600 denier polyester. It features a cushiony 16” x 16” pad and storage pocket. The SitBacker canoe seat weighs only 3 lbs yet supports up to 250 lbs. Measures 11” x 16.5” x 18” when open. Folds to 16.5” x 16.5” x 5.5”. The SitBacker canoe seat is ideal for canoeing but can also be used for watching sports, camping and picnicking.", "text": "GCI Outdoor SitBacker Canoe Seat The SitBacker canoe seat is designed to fasten to canoe benches by simply clicking the sturdy dual buckle strap system. Patented single buckle BackComfort Technology adjusts the backrest position for customized reclining while a lumbar cushion provides maximum comfort. Patented Auto-Fold Technology with Portage Lock shoulder strap allows for easy opening, closing and carrying. The split contour seat is ideal for both molded and flat canoe benches. The SitBacker canoe seat is constructed of sturdy, powder-coated steel and 600 denier polyester. It features a cushiony 16” x 16” pad and storage pocket. The SitBacker canoe seat weighs only 3 lbs yet supports up to 250 lbs. Measures 11” x 16.5” x 18” when open. Folds to 16.5” x 16.5” x 5.5”. The SitBacker canoe seat is ideal for canoeing but can also be used for watching sports, camping and picnicking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hyUXJzCDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018S0R38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GCI Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 34.99}}
