{"item_id": "B0018S88HU", "title": "3Skull Paintball Tippmann A-5/X7 450 Rd Cyclone Offset Hopper - Black", "description": "3Skull Paintball Tippmann A5/X7 450 Rd Cyclone Offset Hopper Offset Hopper holds 450 paintballs, it completely tilt to one side and allows the gun to mount virtually anything on the sight rail.Features 450 round capacity Lightweight Design Snap fit wide mouth lid Heavy Duty Construction Improved Deflection over Standard Cyclone Hopper Fits Tippmann X7, A-5 and 98's with cyclone feed", "text": "3Skull Paintball Tippmann A-5/X7 450 Rd Cyclone Offset Hopper - Black 3Skull Paintball Tippmann A5/X7 450 Rd Cyclone Offset Hopper Offset Hopper holds 450 paintballs, it completely tilt to one side and allows the gun to mount virtually anything on the sight rail.Features 450 round capacity Lightweight Design Snap fit wide mouth lid Heavy Duty Construction Improved Deflection over Standard Cyclone Hopper Fits Tippmann X7, A-5 and 98's with cyclone feed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uGKd1v7sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018S88HU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rap4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Loaders & Accessories", "Loaders"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B0018SF6E8", "title": "11 1/2\" Maxam Military Bowie Knife with Case", "description": "11 1/2\" Military Commemorative Knife by Maxam. Whether you are a veteran, your uncle or grandpa is a veteran, your best friend is currently enlisted or you're simply proud to be an American... this is a Knife you'll cherish. This Maxam Commemorative Knife comes protected in an aluminum case. Quality construction and an attractive design you'll be proud to display: 440 stainless steel 6 3/8\" blade is engraved with the above quotation; Stainless steel finger guard; Wood handle; Full-tang construction for balance; Knife measures 11 1/2\"l. overall; Aluminum case measures 12 3/4 x 4 3/8 x 1 1/2\", 2 lbs. China. Order this collectible today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Bowie Knives. Bowie Knives cannot be shipped to CA; CO; CT; AL; FL; ID; Peoria, IL; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Bowie Knives cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Bowie Knives. 11 1/2\" Maxam Military Bowie Knife with Case. Engraving on Knife is an Example Only.", "text": "11 1/2\" Maxam Military Bowie Knife with Case 11 1/2\" Military Commemorative Knife by Maxam. Whether you are a veteran, your uncle or grandpa is a veteran, your best friend is currently enlisted or you're simply proud to be an American... this is a Knife you'll cherish. This Maxam Commemorative Knife comes protected in an aluminum case. Quality construction and an attractive design you'll be proud to display: 440 stainless steel 6 3/8\" blade is engraved with the above quotation; Stainless steel finger guard; Wood handle; Full-tang construction for balance; Knife measures 11 1/2\"l. overall; Aluminum case measures 12 3/4 x 4 3/8 x 1 1/2\", 2 lbs. China. Order this collectible today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Bowie Knives. Bowie Knives cannot be shipped to CA; CO; CT; AL; FL; ID; Peoria, IL; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Bowie Knives cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Bowie Knives. 11 1/2\" Maxam Military Bowie Knife with Case. Engraving on Knife is an Example Only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q5Hnghu-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018SF6E8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.49}}
{"item_id": "B0018T5XUY", "title": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Multi-Color 8-Inch Bull's-Eye Targets, 20 Sheet Pack", "description": "Why shoot at ordinary paper targets when you can see your shots better with DIRTY BIRD! When you hit a DIRTY BIRD target, the bullet hole explodes in a “multi-color” splatter that makes the hole highly visible, even at a distance. You don’t need to strain your eyes to spot each shot. The “splatter” makes shooting more fun because you know instantly where your bullet hit!", "text": "Birchwood Casey Dirty Bird Multi-Color 8-Inch Bull's-Eye Targets, 20 Sheet Pack Why shoot at ordinary paper targets when you can see your shots better with DIRTY BIRD! When you hit a DIRTY BIRD target, the bullet hole explodes in a “multi-color” splatter that makes the hole highly visible, even at a distance. You don’t need to strain your eyes to spot each shot. The “splatter” makes shooting more fun because you know instantly where your bullet hit!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41htFLlvGbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018T5XUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 12.86}}
