{"item_id": "B0018VDL2O", "title": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Knife, Coyote Brown", "description": "In extreme close quarters encounters where a suspect is attempting to take an officer's handgun, or an officer cannot access his handgun, the TDI knife is available as a \"last option\" knife. When worn on the pant belt the entire unit - knife and sheath - is well concealed. Designed by John Benner, founder and owner of Tactical Defense Institute. Partially serrated blade, foliage green handle and sheath, and black metal belt clip.", "text": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Knife, Coyote Brown In extreme close quarters encounters where a suspect is attempting to take an officer's handgun, or an officer cannot access his handgun, the TDI knife is available as a \"last option\" knife. When worn on the pant belt the entire unit - knife and sheath - is well concealed. Designed by John Benner, founder and owner of Tactical Defense Institute. Partially serrated blade, foliage green handle and sheath, and black metal belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ey6PlhBdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018VDL2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 38.63}}
{"item_id": "B0018VH8SW", "title": "Winchester® Bowie Knife", "description": "14 1/4\" worth of ferocious cutting power, ON SALE! That's BIG BUCKS OFF Winchester's tough and ornery Bowie Knife! The blade is 8 3/4\" surgical stainless steel and is a sturdy 1/8\" thick. The finger-grooved, 5 1/2\"l., wood-grain handle is securely held by twin brass rivets. Full-tang construction for strength. Brass finger guard. Includes ballistic nylon belt sheath. Weighs 9 ozs. China. Cut yourself in on this bargain now! Winchester Bowie Knife", "text": "Winchester® Bowie Knife 14 1/4\" worth of ferocious cutting power, ON SALE! That's BIG BUCKS OFF Winchester's tough and ornery Bowie Knife! The blade is 8 3/4\" surgical stainless steel and is a sturdy 1/8\" thick. The finger-grooved, 5 1/2\"l., wood-grain handle is securely held by twin brass rivets. Full-tang construction for strength. Brass finger guard. Includes ballistic nylon belt sheath. Weighs 9 ozs. China. Cut yourself in on this bargain now! Winchester Bowie Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21-gjzXv-RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018VH8SW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Winchester", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.36}}
{"item_id": "B0018VJAQU", "title": "Schrade SCHF2 Extreme Survival Steel Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife with Nylon Sheath", "description": "The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "text": "Schrade SCHF2 Extreme Survival Steel Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife with Nylon Sheath The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g9KhKXcjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018VJAQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 55.37}}
{"item_id": "B0018VL3JW", "title": "Smith's JIFF-S 10-Second Knife and Scissors Sharpener", "description": "Smith’s “10 Second” Knife Sharpener features a specially designed “V” shaped sharpening slot with two crossed carbide blades that allow you to put a quick edge on your knife with just three or four strokes. The carbide blades are pre-set so that you get the correct sharpening angle every time. They are also reversible for extended life and are replaceable.", "text": "Smith's JIFF-S 10-Second Knife and Scissors Sharpener Smith’s “10 Second” Knife Sharpener features a specially designed “V” shaped sharpening slot with two crossed carbide blades that allow you to put a quick edge on your knife with just three or four strokes. The carbide blades are pre-set so that you get the correct sharpening angle every time. They are also reversible for extended life and are replaceable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DGg4OlTvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018VL3JW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 7.38}}
{"item_id": "B0018XTIX8", "title": "Guard Alaska™ Bear Defense Spray", "description": "You're facing down Mr. Grizzly... make sure YOU \"bite\" first! An invincible, ultra-hot-pepper Bear Defense Spray... the most powerful and the only one EPA certified to repel all species of bear. It can literally be your life-saver. Field-proven in the wilds of Alaska, it has a superior chemical base that actually opens skin pores for sure stopping-power. Effective range is approx. 15-20 ft. You get a 9-oz. super-size spray can, 8 3/4 x 2\" diam. Hunters, campers and hikers should Order ONLINE Now to invest in this Defense Spray. Note: as with any such compound, this should be kept out of reach of curious children. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Spray Holster - word search in our Store for 'Defense Spray Holster'. Guard Alaska Bear Defense Spray", "text": "Guard Alaska™ Bear Defense Spray You're facing down Mr. Grizzly... make sure YOU \"bite\" first! An invincible, ultra-hot-pepper Bear Defense Spray... the most powerful and the only one EPA certified to repel all species of bear. It can literally be your life-saver. Field-proven in the wilds of Alaska, it has a superior chemical base that actually opens skin pores for sure stopping-power. Effective range is approx. 15-20 ft. You get a 9-oz. super-size spray can, 8 3/4 x 2\" diam. Hunters, campers and hikers should Order ONLINE Now to invest in this Defense Spray. Note: as with any such compound, this should be kept out of reach of curious children. AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Spray Holster - word search in our Store for 'Defense Spray Holster'. Guard Alaska Bear Defense Spray", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S1%2B7-QgFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018XTIX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GUARD ALASKA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 30.29}}
{"item_id": "B0018YZ6FG", "title": "Holster with Magazine Pouch fits Ruger SR9 & SR40", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster with Magazine Pouch fits Ruger SR9 & SR40 This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LlY9kMD5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018YZ6FG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018YZ7GO", "title": "Holster with Magazine Pouch for S&W M&P 9mm, 40 & 357", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster with Magazine Pouch for S&W M&P 9mm, 40 & 357 This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dxNF7%2BdAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018YZ7GO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZE53Y", "title": "Pro Performance Sports Hit-Away Softball", "description": "Hit-a-way derek jeter series is the hottest softball training aid on the market. Improve hand-eye coordination and swing mechanics without chasing balls. Features: solo trainer simulates real pitches for improved hitting and confidence get up to 500 swings per hour without ever chasing a ball great for right and left handed batters and switch-hitting practice hit-a-way is your own personal batting trainer and ideal development tool for playersages 7 + up adjust ?pitch height quickly to practice hitting pitches of virtually any height develop better swing mechanics, hand-eye coordination and confidence for more hits and power", "text": "Pro Performance Sports Hit-Away Softball Hit-a-way derek jeter series is the hottest softball training aid on the market. Improve hand-eye coordination and swing mechanics without chasing balls. Features: solo trainer simulates real pitches for improved hitting and confidence get up to 500 swings per hour without ever chasing a ball great for right and left handed batters and switch-hitting practice hit-a-way is your own personal batting trainer and ideal development tool for playersages 7 + up adjust ?pitch height quickly to practice hitting pitches of virtually any height develop better swing mechanics, hand-eye coordination and confidence for more hits and power", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nzx87-NsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZE53Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Trainers"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZFEFM", "title": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S Bicycle Tire with Black Chili (700x23, Black)", "description": "Continental 0100000 Grand Prix 4000S 700 x 23 Black Tire with Black Chili boasts global appeal as the best all round race bike tire on the market. The all black Grand Prix 4000 S catches the eye with its big silver labels. Aggressive and posh alike, it matches every high-end race bike perfectly. With the reduction to black and silver the Grand Prix 4000S does not clash with the frames color or rim stickers. S stands for sport, special and “Schwarz“ – the German term for black. But the Grand Prix 4000 S can do more than just look good. Not only is it fast and super grippy, thanks to its state-of-the-art Black Chili rubber compound, but it is also tough with a healthy tread layer and of course our Vectran anti puncture breaker layer underneath. So for reliability, longevity and all out performance for your race machine, the Grand Prix 4000s is the only choice. Specs: Color - black/black skin foldable; Black Chili - yes; Weight - 205 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "text": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S Bicycle Tire with Black Chili (700x23, Black) Continental 0100000 Grand Prix 4000S 700 x 23 Black Tire with Black Chili boasts global appeal as the best all round race bike tire on the market. The all black Grand Prix 4000 S catches the eye with its big silver labels. Aggressive and posh alike, it matches every high-end race bike perfectly. With the reduction to black and silver the Grand Prix 4000S does not clash with the frames color or rim stickers. S stands for sport, special and “Schwarz“ – the German term for black. But the Grand Prix 4000 S can do more than just look good. Not only is it fast and super grippy, thanks to its state-of-the-art Black Chili rubber compound, but it is also tough with a healthy tread layer and of course our Vectran anti puncture breaker layer underneath. So for reliability, longevity and all out performance for your race machine, the Grand Prix 4000s is the only choice. Specs: Color - black/black skin foldable; Black Chili - yes; Weight - 205 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41By74MbNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZFEFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 58.95}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZFEPW", "title": "Look Cycle Keo Grip Road Cleat", "description": "Look's Keo Grip Cleats function the same as the older Keo cleats once they're engaged in a Look Keo or Keo 2 pedal. It's what they do the rest of the time that is so different. Look has done a great job at re-imagining their cleat, seeing what others have done, seeing what they could do better, and executing that vision. The two things everyone will point to are the non-skid rubber pads underneath the \"toe\" and \"heel\" portions of the cleats. While those pads are pretty nice, and they do a good job of making walking easier and adding durability to the cleats. It's the center pad and what's underneath it that we're excited about. The center pad is no big deal on its own; it sits atop the center of the pedal and should reduce lateral slop on the cleat/pedal interface. It is the memory clip underneath that we groove on. The memory clip makes it easy to replace cleats. This clip sits hidden underneath the cleat but it is locked into place in that fourth groove that many new shoes come with. You can find it on at least the following shoes: Bontrager, Sidi, high end Cannondale, and carbon soled Chain, Diadora, DMT, Gaerne, Northwave shoes. There are three float options for the cleats, fixed aka zero float (Black) cleats, 4. 5-degrees float (Grey) cleats, and 9-degrees of float (Red) cleats. Look pedals come standard with the Grey cleats. All three cleats come with 4mm of lateral adjustment and 9mm of longitudinal adjustment. The Keo Grip Cleat replacement kit comes with two cleats, six 5x11mm screws, and six rectangular washers. The memory clip is in the cleat. The claimed weight on a pair of Look Keo Grip Cleats is 68g including screws and washers.", "text": "Look Cycle Keo Grip Road Cleat Look's Keo Grip Cleats function the same as the older Keo cleats once they're engaged in a Look Keo or Keo 2 pedal. It's what they do the rest of the time that is so different. Look has done a great job at re-imagining their cleat, seeing what others have done, seeing what they could do better, and executing that vision. The two things everyone will point to are the non-skid rubber pads underneath the \"toe\" and \"heel\" portions of the cleats. While those pads are pretty nice, and they do a good job of making walking easier and adding durability to the cleats. It's the center pad and what's underneath it that we're excited about. The center pad is no big deal on its own; it sits atop the center of the pedal and should reduce lateral slop on the cleat/pedal interface. It is the memory clip underneath that we groove on. The memory clip makes it easy to replace cleats. This clip sits hidden underneath the cleat but it is locked into place in that fourth groove that many new shoes come with. You can find it on at least the following shoes: Bontrager, Sidi, high end Cannondale, and carbon soled Chain, Diadora, DMT, Gaerne, Northwave shoes. There are three float options for the cleats, fixed aka zero float (Black) cleats, 4. 5-degrees float (Grey) cleats, and 9-degrees of float (Red) cleats. Look pedals come standard with the Grey cleats. All three cleats come with 4mm of lateral adjustment and 9mm of longitudinal adjustment. The Keo Grip Cleat replacement kit comes with two cleats, six 5x11mm screws, and six rectangular washers. The memory clip is in the cleat. The claimed weight on a pair of Look Keo Grip Cleats is 68g including screws and washers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416g1n4cndL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZFEPW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Replacement Cleats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZMGBM", "title": "Champion Rotating Straight Bar (20-Inch)", "description": "Solid steel bar. High polished chrome finish. Made for lat machine.", "text": "Champion Rotating Straight Bar (20-Inch) Solid steel bar. High polished chrome finish. Made for lat machine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bCP9iiCnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZMGBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 21.98}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZMH34", "title": "Bionic Women's Fitness Gloves", "description": "The women's fitness gloves from Bionic are designed by an orthopedic hand surgeon to provide performance enhancing support for weight lifting and other gym workouts. Constructed with high-grade, washable sheepskin leather and Coolmax Lycra for breathability, the gloves are built for comfort and durability. The gloves feature an anatomical pad system that is designed to help strengthen your grip so that you can push further up the weight scale. Meanwhile, the strategic padding enables you to operate free weights and weight stacks without blisters and callus build-up. Motion Zones over the knuckles and Web Zones between the fingers promote natural hand movement and help circulate air, preventing hand fatigue.The Bionic Fitness Gloves are designed to enhance your comfort and grip strength at the gym.Exclusive Glove Technology--Developed by an Orthopedic Hand Surgeon to:Reduce Hand Fatigue--Increase Grip Strength--and--Support the Hand's Natural DexterityAnatomical Relief Pad System:The hand has natural peaks and valleys determined by the placement of the bones. Typically the high points of the bone rub against tools and equipment, causing blisters, calluses, and fatigue. Bionic gloves are designed to solve this problem with strategically placed pads in the glove, that eliminate the peaks and valleys--evening the surface of the hand--to result in improved grip strength, reduced hand fatigue, and reduced friction--to virtually eliminate calluses and blisters.Web and Motion Zones:The hands combine 14 phalanx bones as well as large number of tendons and muscles to allow for an intricate range of motion and dexterity. Bionic gloves offer Motion Zones over the knuckles, and Web Zones between the fingers, made of stretchable and breathable Lycra to provide greater flexibility, support the hand's natural dexterity, and keep the hands cool and dry.The Bionic Custom Fit--A guideline to sizing your gloveWomen's SizingSmall:6 1/4 to 7 inchesMedium:7 1/4 to 7 3/4 inchesLarge:7 3/4 to 8 inchesX Large:8 to 8 1/4 inchesTo find out your glove size, measure (in inches) around your dominant hand (when ordering pairs) with a tape measure at the place indicated on the diagram shown at right. Use the tape measurements below to determine your proper glove size.If you need additional assistance on sizing or fit of the gloves, please contact Bionic at 877-524-6642 or e-mailbionic@slugger.com.", "text": "Bionic Women's Fitness Gloves The women's fitness gloves from Bionic are designed by an orthopedic hand surgeon to provide performance enhancing support for weight lifting and other gym workouts. Constructed with high-grade, washable sheepskin leather and Coolmax Lycra for breathability, the gloves are built for comfort and durability. The gloves feature an anatomical pad system that is designed to help strengthen your grip so that you can push further up the weight scale. Meanwhile, the strategic padding enables you to operate free weights and weight stacks without blisters and callus build-up. Motion Zones over the knuckles and Web Zones between the fingers promote natural hand movement and help circulate air, preventing hand fatigue.The Bionic Fitness Gloves are designed to enhance your comfort and grip strength at the gym.Exclusive Glove Technology--Developed by an Orthopedic Hand Surgeon to:Reduce Hand Fatigue--Increase Grip Strength--and--Support the Hand's Natural DexterityAnatomical Relief Pad System:The hand has natural peaks and valleys determined by the placement of the bones. Typically the high points of the bone rub against tools and equipment, causing blisters, calluses, and fatigue. Bionic gloves are designed to solve this problem with strategically placed pads in the glove, that eliminate the peaks and valleys--evening the surface of the hand--to result in improved grip strength, reduced hand fatigue, and reduced friction--to virtually eliminate calluses and blisters.Web and Motion Zones:The hands combine 14 phalanx bones as well as large number of tendons and muscles to allow for an intricate range of motion and dexterity. Bionic gloves offer Motion Zones over the knuckles, and Web Zones between the fingers, made of stretchable and breathable Lycra to provide greater flexibility, support the hand's natural dexterity, and keep the hands cool and dry.The Bionic Custom Fit--A guideline to sizing your gloveWomen's SizingSmall:6 1/4 to 7 inchesMedium:7 1/4 to 7 3/4 inchesLarge:7 3/4 to 8 inchesX Large:8 to 8 1/4 inchesTo find out your glove size, measure (in inches) around your dominant hand (when ordering pairs) with a tape measure at the place indicated on the diagram shown at right. Use the tape measurements below to determine your proper glove size.If you need additional assistance on sizing or fit of the gloves, please contact Bionic at 877-524-6642 or e-mailbionic@slugger.com.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NfxX-fnvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZMH34.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0018ZWKMW", "title": "TYR Silicone Molded Ear Plugs", "description": "Shaped to fit left and right earsrespectively. Features a hollow stem toensure minimal hearing disruption whileswimming. Includes storage case.", "text": "TYR Silicone Molded Ear Plugs Shaped to fit left and right earsrespectively. Features a hollow stem toensure minimal hearing disruption whileswimming. Includes storage case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QPIsDR7TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0018ZWKMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Earplugs"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B00190VMFM", "title": "Spyderco Endura 4 Wave Plain Edge Folding Knife", "description": "Combining the functional, performance-based design of classic Spyderco knives with the patented Emerson blade-opening feature, the Endura 4 plain-edge folding knife is ideal for a host of applications. The Emerson opener is the Endura's most distinctive feature, with a hook that curves out of the top of the knife blade. Each time you remove the Endura 4 from a front pocket, the hook will catch the pocket's edge, quickly opening the knife blade so it's ready to use. The Emerson opener makes this a terrific knife for fishing, hunting, and other sports where one-handed use is crucial. You can also take the knife out of your pocket without engaging the Emerson hook by pulling it straight up and out, with your fingers placed on top of the closed blade.Functionally, the Endura 4's VG-10 steel blade is flat saber-ground with a strong tip and a large 13mm opening hole. Users will also love the gray fiberglass reinforced nylon handle, which is molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for traction and improved ergonomics. And inside the handle are dual skeletonized stainless-steel liners, which strengthen the knife without adding additional weight. This also creates an anchor for attaching external and internal components. Other features include screw construction for easy cleaning and adjustment; slip-resistant jimping on the blade's spine; and phosphor bronze washers that smooth out the open/close action.Specifications:Blade material: VG-10 steelHandle material: Fiberglass reinforced nylonBlade length: 3-13/16 inchesHole diameter: 1/2 inchBlade thickness: 1/8 inchesClosed length: 5 inchesOverall length: 8-13/16 inchesWeight: 3.6 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Endura 4 Wave Plain Edge Folding Knife Combining the functional, performance-based design of classic Spyderco knives with the patented Emerson blade-opening feature, the Endura 4 plain-edge folding knife is ideal for a host of applications. The Emerson opener is the Endura's most distinctive feature, with a hook that curves out of the top of the knife blade. Each time you remove the Endura 4 from a front pocket, the hook will catch the pocket's edge, quickly opening the knife blade so it's ready to use. The Emerson opener makes this a terrific knife for fishing, hunting, and other sports where one-handed use is crucial. You can also take the knife out of your pocket without engaging the Emerson hook by pulling it straight up and out, with your fingers placed on top of the closed blade.Functionally, the Endura 4's VG-10 steel blade is flat saber-ground with a strong tip and a large 13mm opening hole. Users will also love the gray fiberglass reinforced nylon handle, which is molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for traction and improved ergonomics. And inside the handle are dual skeletonized stainless-steel liners, which strengthen the knife without adding additional weight. This also creates an anchor for attaching external and internal components. Other features include screw construction for easy cleaning and adjustment; slip-resistant jimping on the blade's spine; and phosphor bronze washers that smooth out the open/close action.Specifications:Blade material: VG-10 steelHandle material: Fiberglass reinforced nylonBlade length: 3-13/16 inchesHole diameter: 1/2 inchBlade thickness: 1/8 inchesClosed length: 5 inchesOverall length: 8-13/16 inchesWeight: 3.6 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413MebzNIaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00190VMFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 70.45}}
{"item_id": "B00190XOW6", "title": "Ontario SP16 Spax Tool (Black)", "description": "The SP16 SPAX made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. The SPAX is a knife, a hatchet, or a pick axe, whatever the situation dictates. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 52-54 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP16 Spax Tool (Black) The SP16 SPAX made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. The SPAX is a knife, a hatchet, or a pick axe, whatever the situation dictates. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 52-54 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317OfnFKx6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00190XOW6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 67.95}}
{"item_id": "B00190Z118", "title": "Spyderco Ladybug 3 Stainless Steel Plain Edge Knife", "description": "It attaches to your keychain and is nearly as small as your car keys, Spyderco's smallest lightweight is the Ladybug. This modified clip-point blade style is matched up with a stainless steel handle perfect for engraving or embellishing.", "text": "Spyderco Ladybug 3 Stainless Steel Plain Edge Knife It attaches to your keychain and is nearly as small as your car keys, Spyderco's smallest lightweight is the Ladybug. This modified clip-point blade style is matched up with a stainless steel handle perfect for engraving or embellishing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RlV8xIKML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00190Z118.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.76}}
{"item_id": "B001910INI", "title": "Black Ronin Tomahawk w/ Black Nylon Sheath", "description": "Features a 3.50 in. 420 stainless steel, full tang, black non-glare finish axe head and a 11.63 in. black nylon cord-wrapped handle. Comes complete with a black nylon sheath.", "text": "Black Ronin Tomahawk w/ Black Nylon Sheath Features a 3.50 in. 420 stainless steel, full tang, black non-glare finish axe head and a 11.63 in. black nylon cord-wrapped handle. Comes complete with a black nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41350Row2cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001910INI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 21.28}}
{"item_id": "B001910KGS", "title": "Buck QuickFire TM Knife", "description": "Buck's newest entry has a high-tech design that combines a traditional lockback folder with an assisted opening blade. Dual springs provide easy, safe blade release, and the quick-firing blade has convenient one hand ambidextrous deployment. The strong mid-lock system provides durable locking strength.", "text": "Buck QuickFire TM Knife Buck's newest entry has a high-tech design that combines a traditional lockback folder with an assisted opening blade. Dual springs provide easy, safe blade release, and the quick-firing blade has convenient one hand ambidextrous deployment. The strong mid-lock system provides durable locking strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314xqtZaPqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001910KGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 28.89}}
{"item_id": "B001916XG4", "title": "Texsport Fleece Sleeping Bag - Colors may vary", "description": "This Texsport(r) fleece sleeping bag brings you warmth and durability with an all-around zipper and comfortable fleece fabric. It can easily be used for the home, summer camping, or travel.", "text": "Texsport Fleece Sleeping Bag - Colors may vary This Texsport(r) fleece sleeping bag brings you warmth and durability with an all-around zipper and comfortable fleece fabric. It can easily be used for the home, summer camping, or travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312wvJvN%2BxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001916XG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 12.37}}
{"item_id": "B001920UG2", "title": "Maxxis CrossMark Mountain Bike Tire", "description": "As one of the first 29er tires that was specific for hardpack, the Crossmark's nearly continuous center ridge and low-profile knobs gave big wheeled riders an edge on buff trails. Sure, there are plenty of options now, but Maxxis' casing, rubber compounds, and tread patterns continue to keep elite riders at the top of their game. Maxxis gave the Crossmark a fast-rolling center ridge with a tread pattern that favors high-speed hardpack, yet it still holds its own on wet and loose sections of trail. This is possible due to spacing between the center lugs and raised side knobs. The Maxxis Crossmark 29-inch Tire is available in the color Black and with a 2. 1-inch width.", "text": "Maxxis CrossMark Mountain Bike Tire As one of the first 29er tires that was specific for hardpack, the Crossmark's nearly continuous center ridge and low-profile knobs gave big wheeled riders an edge on buff trails. Sure, there are plenty of options now, but Maxxis' casing, rubber compounds, and tread patterns continue to keep elite riders at the top of their game. Maxxis gave the Crossmark a fast-rolling center ridge with a tread pattern that favors high-speed hardpack, yet it still holds its own on wet and loose sections of trail. This is possible due to spacing between the center lugs and raised side knobs. The Maxxis Crossmark 29-inch Tire is available in the color Black and with a 2. 1-inch width.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OdRVQNeuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001920UG2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00192CNG2", "title": "Bayer 701710A 2-in-1 Insect Protection with Fertilizer Plant Spikes", "description": "The spikes that protect and feed for up to 8 weeks. Free applicator easily inserts spikes right at plant roots. For potted plants - indoors or outdoors. Kills: Aphids, Leafhoppers, Mealybugs, Plant bugs, Scales, Thrips and Whiteflies. Where to Use: Potted roses, palms, ficus, houseplants, hibiscus, flowers, vines, and containerized shrubs and trees. Active Ingredients: Imidacloprid 2.5%", "text": "Bayer 701710A 2-in-1 Insect Protection with Fertilizer Plant Spikes The spikes that protect and feed for up to 8 weeks. Free applicator easily inserts spikes right at plant roots. For potted plants - indoors or outdoors. Kills: Aphids, Leafhoppers, Mealybugs, Plant bugs, Scales, Thrips and Whiteflies. Where to Use: Potted roses, palms, ficus, houseplants, hibiscus, flowers, vines, and containerized shrubs and trees. Active Ingredients: Imidacloprid 2.5%", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511C8NSDh3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00192CNG2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bayer Advanced", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 7.47}}
{"item_id": "B00192JGDU", "title": "Camco 57293 Deluxe Grilling Table", "description": "", "text": "Camco 57293 Deluxe Grilling Table", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MEaJAcAKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00192JGDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 87.55}}
{"item_id": "B00192K7JM", "title": "Tasco Red Dot 1 x 42 Matte Red/Green 5 MOA dot", "description": "Do you Prefer turkey or Slug? Hunting, that is. Or maybe your thing is competitive pistol and revolvers? If any of the three get your adrenaline up even a little then perhaps you'd be interested in one of our Propoint illuminated Red Dot scopes. Low light? No problem. Bad weather? No problem. The flawless tracking andgreen and red reticles deliver a high degree of contrast even in the bleakest of conditions.", "text": "Tasco Red Dot 1 x 42 Matte Red/Green 5 MOA dot Do you Prefer turkey or Slug? Hunting, that is. Or maybe your thing is competitive pistol and revolvers? If any of the three get your adrenaline up even a little then perhaps you'd be interested in one of our Propoint illuminated Red Dot scopes. Low light? No problem. Bad weather? No problem. The flawless tracking andgreen and red reticles deliver a high degree of contrast even in the bleakest of conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fZIj9JjrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00192K7JM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 42.95}}
{"item_id": "B00192M1TQ", "title": "Bushnell Yardage Pro Sport with Realtree AP Camo Laser Rangefinder", "description": "The shot of a lifetime is no time for uncertainty. Enter the Yardage Pro Sport 450, a laser rangefinder that's confident to the last yard. The weather-resistant rangefinder--which comes in a Realtree AP Camo finish--is easy to use and versatile, with magnification of 4x and a range of 5 to 999 yards. The slim device also includes a textured grip, helping you hold tight even when the weather is dreadful. And the Yardage Pro Sport 450 couldn't be easier to bring along, as the compact device fits easily in a pocket or pack. The rangefinder comes with a carrying case and strap.Specifications:Magnification: 4xRange: 5 to 999 yardsBattery type: 9 voltRain targeting mode: YesReflector targeting mode: YesReflective ranging performance: 999 yardsTree ranging performance: 450 yardsDeer ranging performance: 200 yardsFlag ranging performance: 200 yardsAccuracy: +/-1Dimensions: 3-15/16 by 3-1/8 by 1-11/16 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 7.4 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "text": "Bushnell Yardage Pro Sport with Realtree AP Camo Laser Rangefinder The shot of a lifetime is no time for uncertainty. Enter the Yardage Pro Sport 450, a laser rangefinder that's confident to the last yard. The weather-resistant rangefinder--which comes in a Realtree AP Camo finish--is easy to use and versatile, with magnification of 4x and a range of 5 to 999 yards. The slim device also includes a textured grip, helping you hold tight even when the weather is dreadful. And the Yardage Pro Sport 450 couldn't be easier to bring along, as the compact device fits easily in a pocket or pack. The rangefinder comes with a carrying case and strap.Specifications:Magnification: 4xRange: 5 to 999 yardsBattery type: 9 voltRain targeting mode: YesReflector targeting mode: YesReflective ranging performance: 999 yardsTree ranging performance: 450 yardsDeer ranging performance: 200 yardsFlag ranging performance: 200 yardsAccuracy: +/-1Dimensions: 3-15/16 by 3-1/8 by 1-11/16 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 7.4 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WzUAxyQFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00192M1TQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 169.0}}
{"item_id": "B00192M24A", "title": "Bushnell Yardage Pro Sport 450 Laser Rangefinder", "description": "Let it hinge on a guess, or nail it with this. The shot of a lifetime is a time for certainty. With the Yardage Pro Sport 450, you're confident to the last yard. It's affordable, simple to use and features a slim, weather-resistant design that's handy in a pinch. Now, jerky or sausage?.", "text": "Bushnell Yardage Pro Sport 450 Laser Rangefinder Let it hinge on a guess, or nail it with this. The shot of a lifetime is a time for certainty. With the Yardage Pro Sport 450, you're confident to the last yard. It's affordable, simple to use and features a slim, weather-resistant design that's handy in a pinch. Now, jerky or sausage?.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H056RT1qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00192M24A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 176.99}}
{"item_id": "B001947Q44", "title": "Wald 933 Front Mesh Quick Release Bicycle Basket (13 x 9.75 x 9, Black, 13X9.75X9)", "description": "Similar in size to our traditional 133 and 3133 baskets, the new 933 mesh basket provides secure transportation for the smallest cargo. An improved contoured handle provides a comfortable grip and retains the same quick-release use provided by the originals. The 933 also uses the same holder as our popular 3133 model, and is now easier to install thanks to the addition of stake nuts to the handlebar clamps.", "text": "Wald 933 Front Mesh Quick Release Bicycle Basket (13 x 9.75 x 9, Black, 13X9.75X9) Similar in size to our traditional 133 and 3133 baskets, the new 933 mesh basket provides secure transportation for the smallest cargo. An improved contoured handle provides a comfortable grip and retains the same quick-release use provided by the originals. The 933 also uses the same holder as our popular 3133 model, and is now easier to install thanks to the addition of stake nuts to the handlebar clamps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mRD8B6HVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001947Q44.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001949J1W", "title": "Sun Slip-On Wrist Compass", "description": "Fits watch bands to 7/8\". Liquid filled, luminous dial.1/6oz.", "text": "Sun Slip-On Wrist Compass Fits watch bands to 7/8\". Liquid filled, luminous dial.1/6oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CB16R5eJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001949J1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 5.2}}
{"item_id": "B001949TKS", "title": "Potable Aqua Water Treatment Tablets", "description": "Used worldwide by campers, hikers, militaries, emergency organizations, and anyone else who needs to drink water of questionable quality, these Portable Aqua iodine tablets will disinfect contaminated drinking water in a pinch. The tablets--which are intended for short-term or limited emergency use only--make most water bacteriologically suitable for drinking, proving effective against Giardia lamblia when used as directed. Each Potable Aqua tablet contains 20 mg of Tetraglycine Hydroperiodide (TGHP), which liberates 8 mg of titratable iodine when released into water. Within 30 minutes, the iodine will have penetrated the cell walls of the microorganisms, rendering them inactive and making the water safe to drink. Potable Aqua tablets also neutralize the iodine aftertaste and color, helping your drinking water taste better.About Potable AquaPotable Aqua iodine water disinfection tablets were developed by Harvard University in conjunction with the U.S. Army in the 1940s, and have been used by the military for emergency drinking water disinfection for more than 50 years. Pharmacal currently supplies the U.S. Military with Potable Aqua for its emergency drinking water needs. Potable Aqua is also widely used by campers, backpackers, and various other militaries around the world. With the addition of the Potable Aqua Traveler and Chlorine Dioxide Water Purification Tablets, Potable Aqua continues to meet the ever-changing needs of today's outdoor enthusiast.", "text": "Potable Aqua Water Treatment Tablets Used worldwide by campers, hikers, militaries, emergency organizations, and anyone else who needs to drink water of questionable quality, these Portable Aqua iodine tablets will disinfect contaminated drinking water in a pinch. The tablets--which are intended for short-term or limited emergency use only--make most water bacteriologically suitable for drinking, proving effective against Giardia lamblia when used as directed. Each Potable Aqua tablet contains 20 mg of Tetraglycine Hydroperiodide (TGHP), which liberates 8 mg of titratable iodine when released into water. Within 30 minutes, the iodine will have penetrated the cell walls of the microorganisms, rendering them inactive and making the water safe to drink. Potable Aqua tablets also neutralize the iodine aftertaste and color, helping your drinking water taste better.About Potable AquaPotable Aqua iodine water disinfection tablets were developed by Harvard University in conjunction with the U.S. Army in the 1940s, and have been used by the military for emergency drinking water disinfection for more than 50 years. Pharmacal currently supplies the U.S. Military with Potable Aqua for its emergency drinking water needs. Potable Aqua is also widely used by campers, backpackers, and various other militaries around the world. With the addition of the Potable Aqua Traveler and Chlorine Dioxide Water Purification Tablets, Potable Aqua continues to meet the ever-changing needs of today's outdoor enthusiast.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GFuGtgWGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001949TKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Potable Aqua", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 6.29}}
{"item_id": "B001949Z4I", "title": "McNett Gear Aid Tenacious Ultra Strong Repair Tape", "description": "Use Tenacious Tape to patch up and repair all sorts of outdoor gear, including tents, rain flys, sleeping bags, packs, jackets, rainwear and paddling gear. With super-aggressive stick and clean adhesive technology, and made from the same fabric as high quality tents, Tenacious Tape takes duct tape to the mat. Tenacious Tape is part of a comprehensive line of Care and Repair products from Gear Aid. With Gear Aid, anyone can be a master of gear repair. Works on nylon, vinyl, netting, plastic, and breathable fabrics.Tenacious Tape uses real tent fabric and high-strength adhesive to provide fast, permanent, nearly invisible repairs. Clean adhesive technology allows Tenacious Tape to be removed without leaving duct tape€TMs ugly gluey mess. Ideal for repairs on tents, tarps, mosquito netting, rain gear, backpacks, sleeping bags, sleeping pads and mattresses, seat cushions, soft coolers, boat covers and more.Tenacious Brand repair tape is ideal for fast in-field repairs on tents, tarps, rain gear, fishing gear and more. Instantly seals leaking seams, tears and pinholes, stops rips from spreading and acts as an abrasion-resistant shield on high-wear areas.Can be used in conjunction with McNett Urethane Adhesives for ultra strong repairs. Includes one 3\" x 20\" (50cm x 7.5cm) strip of tape, 60 sq. inches (375 sq. cm).", "text": "McNett Gear Aid Tenacious Ultra Strong Repair Tape Use Tenacious Tape to patch up and repair all sorts of outdoor gear, including tents, rain flys, sleeping bags, packs, jackets, rainwear and paddling gear. With super-aggressive stick and clean adhesive technology, and made from the same fabric as high quality tents, Tenacious Tape takes duct tape to the mat. Tenacious Tape is part of a comprehensive line of Care and Repair products from Gear Aid. With Gear Aid, anyone can be a master of gear repair. Works on nylon, vinyl, netting, plastic, and breathable fabrics.Tenacious Tape uses real tent fabric and high-strength adhesive to provide fast, permanent, nearly invisible repairs. Clean adhesive technology allows Tenacious Tape to be removed without leaving duct tape€TMs ugly gluey mess. Ideal for repairs on tents, tarps, mosquito netting, rain gear, backpacks, sleeping bags, sleeping pads and mattresses, seat cushions, soft coolers, boat covers and more.Tenacious Brand repair tape is ideal for fast in-field repairs on tents, tarps, rain gear, fishing gear and more. Instantly seals leaking seams, tears and pinholes, stops rips from spreading and acts as an abrasion-resistant shield on high-wear areas.Can be used in conjunction with McNett Urethane Adhesives for ultra strong repairs. Includes one 3\" x 20\" (50cm x 7.5cm) strip of tape, 60 sq. inches (375 sq. cm).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w8jjtI01L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001949Z4I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00194D6ZW", "title": "ThermaCELL MR-9W Mosquito Repellent Pest Control Patio and Outdoor Cordless Decorative Lantern", "description": "The ThermaCELL MR-9W Mosquito Repellent Pest Control Patio and Outdoor Cordless Decorative Lantern will protect your family from biting insects while providing lighting on your deck, backyard or campsite. Keep biting pests away with ThermaCELL’s silent and virtually odor-free mosquito repellent technology. The ThermaCELL Mosquito Repellent Lantern has (4) LEDs that illuminates your environment. Powered by the (4) AAA batteries, the lantern offers a low and high light setting that can be adjusted with the switch allowing the light to be used separately from repellent mechanism. Measuring 7.5-inches tall and 5-inches wide, the MR-9W lantern is a stylish, decorative lantern that repels mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects. Move the lantern quickly from one place to another with the portable handle. The Patio and Outdoor Lantern offers you a 15-foot by 15-foot zone of protection or 225-square feet of repellency. To use the MR-9W lantern, slide the repellent mat into the top of lantern, insert and twist the butane cartridge into the base. Next, engage switch on lantern to activate butane cartridge in the lantern. The ThermaCELL Mosquito Repellent Pest Control MR-9W Lantern comes in a sleek black color and with (1) reusable lantern, (1) butane cartridge, and (3) repellent mats. Each butane cartridge lasts for about (12) hours and each repellent mat lasts for up to (4) hours. ThermaCELL MR-9W is registered with the EPA and feature a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "text": "ThermaCELL MR-9W Mosquito Repellent Pest Control Patio and Outdoor Cordless Decorative Lantern The ThermaCELL MR-9W Mosquito Repellent Pest Control Patio and Outdoor Cordless Decorative Lantern will protect your family from biting insects while providing lighting on your deck, backyard or campsite. Keep biting pests away with ThermaCELL’s silent and virtually odor-free mosquito repellent technology. The ThermaCELL Mosquito Repellent Lantern has (4) LEDs that illuminates your environment. Powered by the (4) AAA batteries, the lantern offers a low and high light setting that can be adjusted with the switch allowing the light to be used separately from repellent mechanism. Measuring 7.5-inches tall and 5-inches wide, the MR-9W lantern is a stylish, decorative lantern that repels mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects. Move the lantern quickly from one place to another with the portable handle. The Patio and Outdoor Lantern offers you a 15-foot by 15-foot zone of protection or 225-square feet of repellency. To use the MR-9W lantern, slide the repellent mat into the top of lantern, insert and twist the butane cartridge into the base. Next, engage switch on lantern to activate butane cartridge in the lantern. The ThermaCELL Mosquito Repellent Pest Control MR-9W Lantern comes in a sleek black color and with (1) reusable lantern, (1) butane cartridge, and (3) repellent mats. Each butane cartridge lasts for about (12) hours and each repellent mat lasts for up to (4) hours. ThermaCELL MR-9W is registered with the EPA and feature a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l5xxW0TqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00194D6ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermacell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 33.95}}
{"item_id": "B00194D72O", "title": "Do-All Outdoors Iron Buck Antler Mount Kit", "description": "The Iron Buck Antler Mount Kit is more than a skull, it's a sculpture. Works with Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, Axis Deer, and Fallow Deer. Simply slide antlers between the Iron Buck and tighten the screw in the rear. That is all there is to it.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors Iron Buck Antler Mount Kit The Iron Buck Antler Mount Kit is more than a skull, it's a sculpture. Works with Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, Axis Deer, and Fallow Deer. Simply slide antlers between the Iron Buck and tighten the screw in the rear. That is all there is to it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51K4n-9yGmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00194D72O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Trophy Mounts"]], "price": 34.82}}
{"item_id": "B00194D81E", "title": "Magnesium Fire Starter", "description": "We think this reliable fire-starting tool should be a staple in everyone's emergency kit for camping, traveling, and otherwise. Simple, effective, safe design allows you to create fuel and light your fire in two steps. Outperforms similar designs from other manufacturers. Used by the U.S. Armed Forces.", "text": "Magnesium Fire Starter We think this reliable fire-starting tool should be a staple in everyone's emergency kit for camping, traveling, and otherwise. Simple, effective, safe design allows you to create fuel and light your fire in two steps. Outperforms similar designs from other manufacturers. Used by the U.S. Armed Forces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hoF2lFBCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00194D81E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Doan Machinery company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 8.27}}
{"item_id": "B00194F70E", "title": "KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath", "description": "KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath Features: Blade Detail: Plain Blade Length (inches): 6.94 Blade Material: 1.4116 Steel Carry System: Leather Belt Sheath Handle Material: Stacked Leather Lock Style: N/A Overall Length (inches): 11.81 Packaging: Box Special Features: N/A Storage: N/A Made In: Taiwan, Province of China", "text": "KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. KA-BAR 2-1236-9 Bowie, Stacked Leather Handle, Leather Sheath Features: Blade Detail: Plain Blade Length (inches): 6.94 Blade Material: 1.4116 Steel Carry System: Leather Belt Sheath Handle Material: Stacked Leather Lock Style: N/A Overall Length (inches): 11.81 Packaging: Box Special Features: N/A Storage: N/A Made In: Taiwan, Province of China", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K-m3Vr62L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00194F70E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.47}}
{"item_id": "B00195LH4S", "title": "Silver Lake Fishing Flies Assortment", "description": "You'll be pulling fish from the water in no time with this excellent assorted set of hand-tied flies. Great for freshwater fly fishing to catch trout and other fish, Silver Lake's Assorted Wet Flies 55-Pack features a wide variety of colors that allow fishing in various conditions. Hand-tied flies. Round bend hooks. With 55 of today's most popular patterns and styles organized in a reusable plastic case, you're sure to find one that works for any given situation.", "text": "Silver Lake Fishing Flies Assortment You'll be pulling fish from the water in no time with this excellent assorted set of hand-tied flies. Great for freshwater fly fishing to catch trout and other fish, Silver Lake's Assorted Wet Flies 55-Pack features a wide variety of colors that allow fishing in various conditions. Hand-tied flies. Round bend hooks. With 55 of today's most popular patterns and styles organized in a reusable plastic case, you're sure to find one that works for any given situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413akvXZtAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00195LH4S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Flies", "Wet Flies"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00196P16M", "title": "U.S. Jaclean Stretch Mate", "description": "Simple back stretching apparatus for improving posture, increasing flexibility, and relieving pain Experience a muscle-relaxing stretch for relief from back pain! Back pain is very often caused by poor posture. Hunching forward to perform everyday tasks forces the spine into an abnormal position for long periods of time. This wears and tears muscles that support the spine, leaving you with constant aches and stiffness. Reverse this trend before it's too late! The Stretch Mate is shaped according to the spine's natural curves to offer support and ease muscular fatigue. Its sturdy, lightweight design allows you to take it with you everywhere!", "text": "U.S. Jaclean Stretch Mate Simple back stretching apparatus for improving posture, increasing flexibility, and relieving pain Experience a muscle-relaxing stretch for relief from back pain! Back pain is very often caused by poor posture. Hunching forward to perform everyday tasks forces the spine into an abnormal position for long periods of time. This wears and tears muscles that support the spine, leaving you with constant aches and stiffness. Reverse this trend before it's too late! The Stretch Mate is shaped according to the spine's natural curves to offer support and ease muscular fatigue. Its sturdy, lightweight design allows you to take it with you everywhere!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jo6S4GCKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00196P16M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Jaclean", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 22.05}}
{"item_id": "B00196P2O8", "title": "Tourna Mesh Carry Bag of 18 Tennis Balls", "description": "Pressureless Balls Never Go Dead. Ideal for practice and throwing machines. The bounce is true and always the same. Made with real felt.", "text": "Tourna Mesh Carry Bag of 18 Tennis Balls Pressureless Balls Never Go Dead. Ideal for practice and throwing machines. The bounce is true and always the same. Made with real felt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61V267mV2IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00196P2O8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unique", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Balls"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00196YC26", "title": "BLACKHAWK SERPA CQC BL/PADDLE SIG SAUER 2022 RH BLACK BH410508BK-R", "description": "Featuring a unique speed-cut design, the CQC Holster allows for smooth draw and easy re-holster without slowing you down. The patented SERPA Auto LockTM release delivers unparalleled weapon security and is automatically positioned to facilitate a correct drawing motion, making it the perfect Level 2 retention holster for concealed carry. Features: - Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto LockTM release - Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique - Immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for security - Speed-cut design allows rapid draw, target acquisition, and re-holster while keeping eyes on target - Includes belt loop and paddle platform Specifications: - Fits: Sig Pro 2022 - Color: Black - Right Hand", "text": "BLACKHAWK SERPA CQC BL/PADDLE SIG SAUER 2022 RH BLACK BH410508BK-R Featuring a unique speed-cut design, the CQC Holster allows for smooth draw and easy re-holster without slowing you down. The patented SERPA Auto LockTM release delivers unparalleled weapon security and is automatically positioned to facilitate a correct drawing motion, making it the perfect Level 2 retention holster for concealed carry. Features: - Passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto LockTM release - Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique - Immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for security - Speed-cut design allows rapid draw, target acquisition, and re-holster while keeping eyes on target - Includes belt loop and paddle platform Specifications: - Fits: Sig Pro 2022 - Color: Black - Right Hand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LcybfZoJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00196YC26.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Hawk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.26}}
{"item_id": "B00198U6UG", "title": "Nathan Stainless Steel 700 mL Flip Straw Bottle", "description": "The Steel Flip Straw allow you to access your fluids without unscrewing the cap or tilting the bottle. The patent-pending lid from Nathan finger loop QuickClip attaches the bottle to a belt, shoulder strap, or pack with ease. The wide-mouth, screw-top lid is easy to grip and large enough for easy refilling and cleaning.", "text": "Nathan Stainless Steel 700 mL Flip Straw Bottle The Steel Flip Straw allow you to access your fluids without unscrewing the cap or tilting the bottle. The patent-pending lid from Nathan finger loop QuickClip attaches the bottle to a belt, shoulder strap, or pack with ease. The wide-mouth, screw-top lid is easy to grip and large enough for easy refilling and cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z8TuG1g1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00198U6UG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B00198ZWY6", "title": "THERACK® Workout Station 30 lb Pro Version", "description": "• Folds up for easy storage • Add up to 40lbs of plates to THERACKfor added resistance for arm curls, rows and shoulder presses • Adjustable wheels for Abs and Core Workout • Sleek Silver powder coat with red urethane wheels and fasteners - Very Sporty • Multiple durable, yet comfortable hand grips • Rubber footings • Sturdy steel construction for durability and long life • Weight plates not included • User can not exceed 6 foot 6 inches and 300lbs These classic exercises have endured over time, because they are safe and effective. THERACK is mapped out grip to grip. Each grip targets the muscles specifically. And, by changing the level, your changing the targeted Muscles AND the Resistance. THERACK Workout Station is the only piece of equipment that takes old school moves like dips, ab crunches, knee raises and pushups to the next level - Highly Versatile. You can hit and sculpt 7 different body parts - Abs, Bicep, Chest, Delts, Lats, Traps and Triceps. While THERACK is a solid piece of equipment, it still remains portable for those people who have limited Time and Space for their workouts. Reviews from Magazines like Iron Man, FitnessRX, Exercise, FitnessRx and Planet Muscle are in on THERACK. And, Iron Man said THERACK is \"old-school exercises with state-of the-art engineering.\" Exercise magazine - described THERACK as \"The perfect home gym\". FitnessRX - says \"This tough little Gem, Just hit the market and it kicks Butt!\" And, Planet Muscle magazine - Awards THERACK with the \"Seal of Certification\".", "text": "THERACK® Workout Station 30 lb Pro Version • Folds up for easy storage • Add up to 40lbs of plates to THERACKfor added resistance for arm curls, rows and shoulder presses • Adjustable wheels for Abs and Core Workout • Sleek Silver powder coat with red urethane wheels and fasteners - Very Sporty • Multiple durable, yet comfortable hand grips • Rubber footings • Sturdy steel construction for durability and long life • Weight plates not included • User can not exceed 6 foot 6 inches and 300lbs These classic exercises have endured over time, because they are safe and effective. THERACK is mapped out grip to grip. Each grip targets the muscles specifically. And, by changing the level, your changing the targeted Muscles AND the Resistance. THERACK Workout Station is the only piece of equipment that takes old school moves like dips, ab crunches, knee raises and pushups to the next level - Highly Versatile. You can hit and sculpt 7 different body parts - Abs, Bicep, Chest, Delts, Lats, Traps and Triceps. While THERACK is a solid piece of equipment, it still remains portable for those people who have limited Time and Space for their workouts. Reviews from Magazines like Iron Man, FitnessRX, Exercise, FitnessRx and Planet Muscle are in on THERACK. And, Iron Man said THERACK is \"old-school exercises with state-of the-art engineering.\" Exercise magazine - described THERACK as \"The perfect home gym\". FitnessRX - says \"This tough little Gem, Just hit the market and it kicks Butt!\" And, Planet Muscle magazine - Awards THERACK with the \"Seal of Certification\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y-u1ac6lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00198ZWY6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00199NUJY", "title": "Maxpedition Grimloc 4-Pack, Desert Tan MXGRML-DT", "description": "Locking D-Ring can be used on any 1\"\" wide piece of webbing and replaces the metal carabiner for attachment of lanyards, weapons, and accessories. lightweight plastic, incorporates GhillieTexTM IR-signature reduction technology, and resists solar heating. Its latch is designed with a detent to maintain an open position if needed and, while strong enough to carry equipment, it will break away with a soldier's weight, eliminating snagging hazards which can cause serious injuries. Low-IR, 80 lb. break strength.", "text": "Maxpedition Grimloc 4-Pack, Desert Tan MXGRML-DT Locking D-Ring can be used on any 1\"\" wide piece of webbing and replaces the metal carabiner for attachment of lanyards, weapons, and accessories. lightweight plastic, incorporates GhillieTexTM IR-signature reduction technology, and resists solar heating. Its latch is designed with a detent to maintain an open position if needed and, while strong enough to carry equipment, it will break away with a soldier's weight, eliminating snagging hazards which can cause serious injuries. Low-IR, 80 lb. break strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xMp0oJQXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00199NUJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 8.7}}
{"item_id": "B00199RQ5S", "title": "Avon SKIN SO SOFT Bug Guard Plus IR3535® EXPEDITION SPF 30 Pump Spray", "description": "Repels mosquitoes that may transmit West Nile Virus for 8 hours. Provides effective protection against gnats, no-seeums, sand flies and biting midges. DEET-free, dermatologist-tested, hypoallergenic. 2-in-1 protection.", "text": "Avon SKIN SO SOFT Bug Guard Plus IR3535® EXPEDITION SPF 30 Pump Spray Repels mosquitoes that may transmit West Nile Virus for 8 hours. Provides effective protection against gnats, no-seeums, sand flies and biting midges. DEET-free, dermatologist-tested, hypoallergenic. 2-in-1 protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cVIe%2BvjkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00199RQ5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 8.7}}
{"item_id": "B0019AI3HC", "title": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish S&W J - Frame, BLACK, RH", "description": "BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Holster is .38, Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame", "text": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish S&W J - Frame, BLACK, RH BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Holster is .38, Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OEgpOxd%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019AI3HC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 40.41}}
{"item_id": "B0019CQMMI", "title": "Park Tool Adjustable Wrench - PAW-12", "description": "Fix your bike with the Park Tool 12in PAW-12 Adjustable Wrench before you get frustrated, drop cycling altogether, and end up a vicious racewalker.Product FeaturesMaterial: steelBox End Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools:Weight:Recommended Use: fixing your rideManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Park Tool Adjustable Wrench - PAW-12 Fix your bike with the Park Tool 12in PAW-12 Adjustable Wrench before you get frustrated, drop cycling altogether, and end up a vicious racewalker.Product FeaturesMaterial: steelBox End Wrench:Open End Wrench:Other Tools:Weight:Recommended Use: fixing your rideManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cnsLjnB8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019CQMMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B0019CRENY", "title": "Daisy Mfg 5845 Shooting Glasses, Wrap-Around Style, Amber", "description": "Amber Colored Shooting Glasses With Stylish Wrap Around Design, Side Shields For Added Protection, Meets ASTI Z87.1 & CSA Safety Standards, Clam Packed.", "text": "Daisy Mfg 5845 Shooting Glasses, Wrap-Around Style, Amber Amber Colored Shooting Glasses With Stylish Wrap Around Design, Side Shields For Added Protection, Meets ASTI Z87.1 & CSA Safety Standards, Clam Packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o-tni3PGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019CRENY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019CSNG6", "title": "Hip Holster with Magazine Pouch for Walther P22 with Underbarrel Laser", "description": "This is a brand new holster from a major USA manufacturer, previously only available in retail gun shops. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\"\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The Cordura nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Hip Holster with Magazine Pouch for Walther P22 with Underbarrel Laser This is a brand new holster from a major USA manufacturer, previously only available in retail gun shops. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\"\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The Cordura nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ypIL0EnaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019CSNG6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B0019D6WEK", "title": "Princeton Tec Swerve Bike Light", "description": "The Swerve Bike Light by Princeton Tec. LEDS. The Swerve uses two high-powered LEDs - a combination of a diffused lens and a collimated focused lens creates a very bright 180 beam pattern that alternates between a wider beam and a narrow beam. Because the eye must juggle these two beams it doesn't get a chance to relax, and the resulting is a very high level of visibility. This technology makes the Swerve one of, if not the most, effective tail lights on the market. Yes, we said so. TOGGLE SWITCH. The switch extends beyond the perimeter of the light and allows for easy operation while riding. It is on a pivot - the middle is the off position. Move the switch down to activate a fl ash pattern or up for a steady light. MOUNTING. We talk to a lot of people about how they use their lights, and you'd be surprised at how personal a choice the mounting part can be. So much so that we've ensured the Swerve has as many mounting options as possible - handle bar, seat post, seat stay and fork mounts are included. And the built-in clip allows for attachment to your helmet, pack or messenger bag. SPECIFICATIONS of the Swerve Bike Light by Princeton Tec Lamp: 2 Half Watt Maxbright LEDs Burn Time: 70 Hours Batteries: 2 AAA Alkaline Weight: 81g with Batteries Weight: 2 Modes without Batteries Waterproof Rating: Level 1", "text": "Princeton Tec Swerve Bike Light The Swerve Bike Light by Princeton Tec. LEDS. The Swerve uses two high-powered LEDs - a combination of a diffused lens and a collimated focused lens creates a very bright 180 beam pattern that alternates between a wider beam and a narrow beam. Because the eye must juggle these two beams it doesn't get a chance to relax, and the resulting is a very high level of visibility. This technology makes the Swerve one of, if not the most, effective tail lights on the market. Yes, we said so. TOGGLE SWITCH. The switch extends beyond the perimeter of the light and allows for easy operation while riding. It is on a pivot - the middle is the off position. Move the switch down to activate a fl ash pattern or up for a steady light. MOUNTING. We talk to a lot of people about how they use their lights, and you'd be surprised at how personal a choice the mounting part can be. So much so that we've ensured the Swerve has as many mounting options as possible - handle bar, seat post, seat stay and fork mounts are included. And the built-in clip allows for attachment to your helmet, pack or messenger bag. SPECIFICATIONS of the Swerve Bike Light by Princeton Tec Lamp: 2 Half Watt Maxbright LEDs Burn Time: 70 Hours Batteries: 2 AAA Alkaline Weight: 81g with Batteries Weight: 2 Modes without Batteries Waterproof Rating: Level 1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mEL9SS1QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D6WEK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 20.45}}
{"item_id": "B0019D73DE", "title": "CamelBak Podium Bottle", "description": "Step up to the podium while cycling with the CamelBak Podium bottle. In addition to the environmental benefits of using a refillable bottle, the Podium offers a number of physical benefits as well. The bottle is made of TruTaste polypropylene, which lets you taste your water and not your bottle. The interior, meanwhile, is lined with HydroGuard to inhibit the growth of bacteria that can cause odors, discoloration, or deterioration of the bottle surface. And in contrast to most water bottles, the Podium doesn't have a \"bite-open, hip-slap-shut\" valve. Instead, the Podium incorporates a Jet Valve, a revolutionary self-sealing valve that lets you sip from any direction or squirt water over your head on long rides. Made of medical-grade silicone, the Jet Valve also eliminates splatter on your bike frame or jersey. Other features include a high flow rate, a positive shut-off closure on the valve for leak-proof transport, and your choice of 21- or 24-ounce sizes.About CamelBakThe CamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved extremely popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off the handlebars. The product eventually began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits. In addition to cycling, CamelBak offers hands-free hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding, and skiing. CamelBak is a privately held company headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "text": "CamelBak Podium Bottle Step up to the podium while cycling with the CamelBak Podium bottle. In addition to the environmental benefits of using a refillable bottle, the Podium offers a number of physical benefits as well. The bottle is made of TruTaste polypropylene, which lets you taste your water and not your bottle. The interior, meanwhile, is lined with HydroGuard to inhibit the growth of bacteria that can cause odors, discoloration, or deterioration of the bottle surface. And in contrast to most water bottles, the Podium doesn't have a \"bite-open, hip-slap-shut\" valve. Instead, the Podium incorporates a Jet Valve, a revolutionary self-sealing valve that lets you sip from any direction or squirt water over your head on long rides. Made of medical-grade silicone, the Jet Valve also eliminates splatter on your bike frame or jersey. Other features include a high flow rate, a positive shut-off closure on the valve for leak-proof transport, and your choice of 21- or 24-ounce sizes.About CamelBakThe CamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved extremely popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off the handlebars. The product eventually began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits. In addition to cycling, CamelBak offers hands-free hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding, and skiing. CamelBak is a privately held company headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Lpc9P6AXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D73DE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
