{"item_id": "B0019D74BU", "title": "CamelBak Insulated 0.75-Liter Bottle Sleeve", "description": "224487 Features: Crafted with insulating neoprene material to keep cold drinks cold and hot drinks hot as long as possible Hold and carry it by the side grip strap or attach it to a pack Specifications:", "text": "CamelBak Insulated 0.75-Liter Bottle Sleeve 224487 Features: Crafted with insulating neoprene material to keep cold drinks cold and hot drinks hot as long as possible Hold and carry it by the side grip strap or attach it to a pack Specifications:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317c84Hp-LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D74BU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0019D78DE", "title": "CamelBak Rain Cover", "description": "The CamelBak Raincover is a water resistant cover that protects your pack and its contents from the elements. Attaches securely with a Velcro closure and drawstring. CamelBak Raincover is compatible with the following CamelBak Hydration Packs S/M: H.A.W.G., Cloud Walker, Trail Blazer, and Day Star M/L: Rim Runner, Peak Bagger, Isis, and ZephyrCamelbak, Better than your average IV!I bought my first Camelbak Raincover in Summer, 2002, and my life has vastly improved. I do not attribute the improvements to the brow lift I got in 2004; though I believe the brow lift was successful, it wasn?t as big a hit in 2002 as my brand new Camelbak. My first Camelbak I initially bought my Raincover by Camelbak to protect my hydration pack while biking. Only cave men use water bottles right? And then I thought it might be nice to take my Camelback skiing, and I?m not kidding that after they saw me wearing my camelbak with Raincover, every one of my friends got a Camelback Raincover of their own. I don?t necessarily think they are copycats, I just think they love their Camelbaks deep down in their hearts, and I am okay with that.Then summer rolled around and out went the nalgene bottle and in came the Camelbak for hiking. Eventually, I was wearing my Camelbak Raincover climbing, running and just to walk the dog. I loved my Camelbak so much that, I started to wear it to take the garbage out and I even started to sleep with my Camelbak. You would think, that my girlfriend would be unhappy with me, but she got a Raincover by Camelbak, too, so it?s us and the Camelbaks in bed, and just imagine the pleasure of not having to miss a minute of Laguna Beach to get up and get a drink of water. Now I can?t take my Camelbak off, and you can?t make me. The only regret I have about the Camelbak Raincover is that I didn?t invent it myself. It?s kind of like my mom who dipped oreo?s in vanilla ice cream before cookies n? cream came out.", "text": "CamelBak Rain Cover The CamelBak Raincover is a water resistant cover that protects your pack and its contents from the elements. Attaches securely with a Velcro closure and drawstring. CamelBak Raincover is compatible with the following CamelBak Hydration Packs S/M: H.A.W.G., Cloud Walker, Trail Blazer, and Day Star M/L: Rim Runner, Peak Bagger, Isis, and ZephyrCamelbak, Better than your average IV!I bought my first Camelbak Raincover in Summer, 2002, and my life has vastly improved. I do not attribute the improvements to the brow lift I got in 2004; though I believe the brow lift was successful, it wasn?t as big a hit in 2002 as my brand new Camelbak. My first Camelbak I initially bought my Raincover by Camelbak to protect my hydration pack while biking. Only cave men use water bottles right? And then I thought it might be nice to take my Camelback skiing, and I?m not kidding that after they saw me wearing my camelbak with Raincover, every one of my friends got a Camelback Raincover of their own. I don?t necessarily think they are copycats, I just think they love their Camelbaks deep down in their hearts, and I am okay with that.Then summer rolled around and out went the nalgene bottle and in came the Camelbak for hiking. Eventually, I was wearing my Camelbak Raincover climbing, running and just to walk the dog. I loved my Camelbak so much that, I started to wear it to take the garbage out and I even started to sleep with my Camelbak. You would think, that my girlfriend would be unhappy with me, but she got a Raincover by Camelbak, too, so it?s us and the Camelbaks in bed, and just imagine the pleasure of not having to miss a minute of Laguna Beach to get up and get a drink of water. Now I can?t take my Camelbak off, and you can?t make me. The only regret I have about the Camelbak Raincover is that I didn?t invent it myself. It?s kind of like my mom who dipped oreo?s in vanilla ice cream before cookies n? cream came out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tyoPI2YoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D78DE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019D78H0", "title": "Stanley Classic Lunchbox Cooler & Bottle Combo", "description": "All Stanley \"Classic\" line products are built to withstand a beating, from job site to camp site, and come in the iconic hammertone green color. Every Classic product is also BPA-free and comes with a lifetime warranty.The Lunchbox Cooler and Bottle Combo is the ultimate pairing for serious lunches on the go. Stanley's ever-popular Vacuum Bottle snaps into the ruggedly durable Stanley Cooler, which locks the 1.1-quart insulated bottle into place. The cooler's interior is cleverly sectioned to keep your grub organized, and foam insulation keeps contents cool, as well. The locking lid is also reversible for use as a lap tray.Lifetime WarrantyAll Stanley Classic products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About StanleyThe iconic green bottle Dad or Grandpa always carried to work, or the fishing hole, was probably well-worn and scuffed, but it still got the job done, while keeping the coffee hot for hours. Today, Stanley's product line has expanded to include a wide array of tough, totally functional food and beverage gear, purpose-built to withstand the toughest conditions.", "text": "Stanley Classic Lunchbox Cooler & Bottle Combo All Stanley \"Classic\" line products are built to withstand a beating, from job site to camp site, and come in the iconic hammertone green color. Every Classic product is also BPA-free and comes with a lifetime warranty.The Lunchbox Cooler and Bottle Combo is the ultimate pairing for serious lunches on the go. Stanley's ever-popular Vacuum Bottle snaps into the ruggedly durable Stanley Cooler, which locks the 1.1-quart insulated bottle into place. The cooler's interior is cleverly sectioned to keep your grub organized, and foam insulation keeps contents cool, as well. The locking lid is also reversible for use as a lap tray.Lifetime WarrantyAll Stanley Classic products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About StanleyThe iconic green bottle Dad or Grandpa always carried to work, or the fishing hole, was probably well-worn and scuffed, but it still got the job done, while keeping the coffee hot for hours. Today, Stanley's product line has expanded to include a wide array of tough, totally functional food and beverage gear, purpose-built to withstand the toughest conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419aRfg3aRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D78H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stanley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 65.06}}
{"item_id": "B0019D93CS", "title": "Tagua Small Frame Inside the Waist Holster, Black, Right Hand /Left Hand", "description": "The Tagua Inside The Waist Holster Frame is a very versatile holster, that can be worn inside the waistband or on the belt. Ambidextrous allows for left and right. Doubled stitched for strength and durability. Leather lined for added protection of your guns finish. Belt slots fits up to 1 1/4 inch wide belts.", "text": "Tagua Small Frame Inside the Waist Holster, Black, Right Hand /Left Hand The Tagua Inside The Waist Holster Frame is a very versatile holster, that can be worn inside the waistband or on the belt. Ambidextrous allows for left and right. Doubled stitched for strength and durability. Leather lined for added protection of your guns finish. Belt slots fits up to 1 1/4 inch wide belts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qh653uBEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D93CS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tagua", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]], "price": 12.45}}
{"item_id": "B0019D9H2O", "title": "Stanley Stainless Steel Classic Mug (18 oz)", "description": "The Stanley Classic Mug with durable double wall stainless steel insulation will keep your coffee hot thru your coffee break. The sealing flip lid, wide stable base and large easy-grip handle protect from leaks and spills. Every Stanley product is backed by a lifetime guarantee. Stanley… Built for Life", "text": "Stanley Stainless Steel Classic Mug (18 oz) The Stanley Classic Mug with durable double wall stainless steel insulation will keep your coffee hot thru your coffee break. The sealing flip lid, wide stable base and large easy-grip handle protect from leaks and spills. Every Stanley product is backed by a lifetime guarantee. Stanley… Built for Life", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cjDRJYEXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019D9H2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stanley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 16.88}}
