{"item_id": "B0019DC28U", "title": "Princeton Tec Fuel Headlamp", "description": "The innovative Fuel headlamp is designed to meet the widest range of applications possible, while remaining small, lightweight, and robust. The remarkably versatile headlamp weighs only 78 grams while still offering 70 lumens of brightness and 146 hours of burn time. An asymmetrical single arm bracket makes directing the light quick and reliable.FeaturesFour Ultrabright LEDs:Ultrabright LEDs are bright and efficient, offering smooth, white, wide-beam light ideal for close to mid-range tasks.Focused Wide Beams:Beam pattern is well suited to multipurpose activities. At close range, focused wide beams simulate normal daylight conditions and allow you to take advantage of your peripheral vision.Multiple Modes:Multiple settings give the flexibility to adjust the light’s brightness and/or beam width to illuminate greater distances or to conserve battery power, depending on your needs.Waterproof to Level 1:Water protection equivalent to IPX4 in the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) standards. Lights rated at Level 1 provide waterproof integrity for splashing and quick dunking.Specifications70 lumens of brightnessFour Ultrabright LED lamps146-hour burn timeRuns on three AAA batteries78-gram weight", "text": "Princeton Tec Fuel Headlamp The innovative Fuel headlamp is designed to meet the widest range of applications possible, while remaining small, lightweight, and robust. The remarkably versatile headlamp weighs only 78 grams while still offering 70 lumens of brightness and 146 hours of burn time. An asymmetrical single arm bracket makes directing the light quick and reliable.FeaturesFour Ultrabright LEDs:Ultrabright LEDs are bright and efficient, offering smooth, white, wide-beam light ideal for close to mid-range tasks.Focused Wide Beams:Beam pattern is well suited to multipurpose activities. At close range, focused wide beams simulate normal daylight conditions and allow you to take advantage of your peripheral vision.Multiple Modes:Multiple settings give the flexibility to adjust the light’s brightness and/or beam width to illuminate greater distances or to conserve battery power, depending on your needs.Waterproof to Level 1:Water protection equivalent to IPX4 in the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) standards. Lights rated at Level 1 provide waterproof integrity for splashing and quick dunking.Specifications70 lumens of brightnessFour Ultrabright LED lamps146-hour burn timeRuns on three AAA batteries78-gram weight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ScDKaFSEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DC28U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 29.75}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCHBW", "title": "Stanley Classic Lunchbox Cooler 7 quart/6.6 liter", "description": "Stanley® Classic line The Pro's choice from construction sites to the Outdoors Built like a battleship and marked by classic hammertone green, the legendary Stanley® Classic line has been the professional's choice from job sites to the outdoors for generations. Made strong and reliable, they are prized items handed proudly from father to son. All Classic products are BPA-free and come with a Lifetime Warranty The boss of lunch. The Official Stanley® Cooler is no rookie when it comes to the business of packing a big lunch. The handle locks the 1.1-quart Stanley® Vacuum Bottle in place on the outside, while the interior features foam-insulated compartments that keep sandwiches separated from deli snacks. The reversible lid flips over to form a lunch tray. Since 1913 the STANLEY brand has been building durable rugged products that last. Passed down from generation to generation the STANLEY bottle is an icon. It has survived a 4,000 foot drop from a plane, been run over by a tractor, and even stopped a bullet. Now in its 96th year the innovation that sparked a revolution in vacuum insulation continues to grow. Today, the STANLEY brand delivers superior food and beverage gear for rugged, active lifestyles and is dedicated to this simple promise: buy STANLEY products, get quality gear. Built for life. Item number: 10-00726-000", "text": "Stanley Classic Lunchbox Cooler 7 quart/6.6 liter Stanley® Classic line The Pro's choice from construction sites to the Outdoors Built like a battleship and marked by classic hammertone green, the legendary Stanley® Classic line has been the professional's choice from job sites to the outdoors for generations. Made strong and reliable, they are prized items handed proudly from father to son. All Classic products are BPA-free and come with a Lifetime Warranty The boss of lunch. The Official Stanley® Cooler is no rookie when it comes to the business of packing a big lunch. The handle locks the 1.1-quart Stanley® Vacuum Bottle in place on the outside, while the interior features foam-insulated compartments that keep sandwiches separated from deli snacks. The reversible lid flips over to form a lunch tray. Since 1913 the STANLEY brand has been building durable rugged products that last. Passed down from generation to generation the STANLEY bottle is an icon. It has survived a 4,000 foot drop from a plane, been run over by a tractor, and even stopped a bullet. Now in its 96th year the innovation that sparked a revolution in vacuum insulation continues to grow. Today, the STANLEY brand delivers superior food and beverage gear for rugged, active lifestyles and is dedicated to this simple promise: buy STANLEY products, get quality gear. Built for life. Item number: 10-00726-000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tIW8P7XsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCHBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stanley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 40.0}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCQVI", "title": "CamelBak Reversible Tactical Cover, Foliage Green 90492", "description": "CamelBak 90492 Reversible Tactical Cover, Foliage Green Protect your hydration pack with this reversible cover that either allows you to blend in, or stand out depending on which side you secure to your pack. The dual-sided Tactical Raincover will keep your pack and gear dry in almost any weather condition. Use the Foliage Green side when a reduced battlefield profile is required. For situations that require maximum visibility or safety precautions, use the high-visibility Signal Orange side.", "text": "CamelBak Reversible Tactical Cover, Foliage Green 90492 CamelBak 90492 Reversible Tactical Cover, Foliage Green Protect your hydration pack with this reversible cover that either allows you to blend in, or stand out depending on which side you secure to your pack. The dual-sided Tactical Raincover will keep your pack and gear dry in almost any weather condition. Use the Foliage Green side when a reduced battlefield profile is required. For situations that require maximum visibility or safety precautions, use the high-visibility Signal Orange side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413MRvi0qYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCQVI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 23.64}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCVK4", "title": "CamelBak Better Bottle Hands Free Adapter", "description": "Convert your Camelbak Bottle into a hands-free hydration system with this adapter. -Adapter easily attaches to all Camelbak Bottles with removable Big Bite valves -Adapter features an ergonomicaly positioned Big Bite valve for easy drinking; HydroLock valve securely shuts off water flow -Route the PureFlow tube through your Camelbak pack harness for a hands-free hydration system -Tube can be cut to desired length", "text": "CamelBak Better Bottle Hands Free Adapter Convert your Camelbak Bottle into a hands-free hydration system with this adapter. -Adapter easily attaches to all Camelbak Bottles with removable Big Bite valves -Adapter features an ergonomicaly positioned Big Bite valve for easy drinking; HydroLock valve securely shuts off water flow -Route the PureFlow tube through your Camelbak pack harness for a hands-free hydration system -Tube can be cut to desired length", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H5Dm1fGsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCVK4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCVKO", "title": "Camelbak Classic Cap", "description": "The Camelbak Classic Cap let's you convert a bottle into a leak-proof container. Cap fits all 63mm opening bottles and is safe to wash in the dishwasher (top shelf).", "text": "Camelbak Classic Cap The Camelbak Classic Cap let's you convert a bottle into a leak-proof container. Cap fits all 63mm opening bottles and is safe to wash in the dishwasher (top shelf).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gBmuzPJIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCVKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 5.45}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCVTA", "title": "Camelbak Big BiteTM Valve", "description": "Camelbak's Big Bite Valve is a great accessory for any sports enthusiast. It's easy to use, easy to clean and works great. This hands-off hydration valve comes in blue and allows you stay hydrated while focusing on your sports efforts. The valve works with a simple bite and sip and then seals itself to avoid drips.", "text": "Camelbak Big BiteTM Valve Camelbak's Big Bite Valve is a great accessory for any sports enthusiast. It's easy to use, easy to clean and works great. This hands-off hydration valve comes in blue and allows you stay hydrated while focusing on your sports efforts. The valve works with a simple bite and sip and then seals itself to avoid drips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h7g8WRTFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCVTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0019DCVYA", "title": "Camelbak HydroLinkTM Filter Adapter", "description": "Camelbak's HydroLink Filter Adapter is easy-to-use and attaches the end of your drinking tube directly to a filter tube for convenient and clean hydration.", "text": "Camelbak HydroLinkTM Filter Adapter Camelbak's HydroLink Filter Adapter is easy-to-use and attaches the end of your drinking tube directly to a filter tube for convenient and clean hydration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Kz3ie3vKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DCVYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 5.99}}
