{"item_id": "B0019DGBC8", "title": "Camelbak Ergo HydroLockTM", "description": "The 90-degree bend in the CamelBak Ergo Hydrolock puts the Big BiteTM Valve into an ergonomic positon for drinking. With a simple flip, the on/off mechanism can be activated or shut off. 90-degree ,", "text": "Camelbak Ergo HydroLockTM The 90-degree bend in the CamelBak Ergo Hydrolock puts the Big BiteTM Valve into an ergonomic positon for drinking. With a simple flip, the on/off mechanism can be activated or shut off. 90-degree ,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KCqC3ipaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DGBC8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B0019DGBFA", "title": "Camelbak Elixir 12 Tablet Tube", "description": "A sugar-free effervescent tablet, loaded with electrolytes, designed specifically for a CamelBak hydration system. Elixir dissolves easily in water and won't leave a sticky residue if used in a reservoir. Use one tablet for every 24 oz of water. Sold in an easy-to-carry portable tube. Only 10 calories per serving.", "text": "Camelbak Elixir 12 Tablet Tube A sugar-free effervescent tablet, loaded with electrolytes, designed specifically for a CamelBak hydration system. Elixir dissolves easily in water and won't leave a sticky residue if used in a reservoir. Use one tablet for every 24 oz of water. Sold in an easy-to-carry portable tube. Only 10 calories per serving.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Ps7xWuPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DGBFA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019DV9ZC", "title": "Wenger 16520 Standard Issue Swiss Army Knife", "description": "Swiss Army Knife, This is the genuine article, issued to soldiers in the Swiss Army. Manufactured since 1901", "text": "Wenger 16520 Standard Issue Swiss Army Knife Swiss Army Knife, This is the genuine article, issued to soldiers in the Swiss Army. Manufactured since 1901", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mDv3AyK0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DV9ZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019DVGBO", "title": "Bianchi Patroltek 8012 Black Expandable Baton Holder", "description": "Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "text": "Bianchi Patroltek 8012 Black Expandable Baton Holder Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lnm3P1gyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019DVGBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Batons"]], "price": 29.23}}
{"item_id": "B0019F03MK", "title": "Tourna Pete Sampras Ballport, Holds 80 Balls", "description": "Ballport 80-Ball Basket is made of tough polypropylene. No wires to rust, welding to break or paint to peel. Handles rotate and lock up or down for easy pickup and dispensing. Ships in a small, 2 wide by 25 high box. Assembly is easy with panels locking into place and legs easily attached with provided screws. Rolling bars on the bottom help ease balls into the basket and hold hold them in. Sliding bars on the top slide open to make dispensing easy, and lock closed to hold balls during transport and storage. Handles lock into an upright position for ball collection, and in a downward position for ball dispensing with a patented locking feature.", "text": "Tourna Pete Sampras Ballport, Holds 80 Balls Ballport 80-Ball Basket is made of tough polypropylene. No wires to rust, welding to break or paint to peel. Handles rotate and lock up or down for easy pickup and dispensing. Ships in a small, 2 wide by 25 high box. Assembly is easy with panels locking into place and legs easily attached with provided screws. Rolling bars on the bottom help ease balls into the basket and hold hold them in. Sliding bars on the top slide open to make dispensing easy, and lock closed to hold balls during transport and storage. Handles lock into an upright position for ball collection, and in a downward position for ball dispensing with a patented locking feature.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PbmH7sQhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019F03MK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Court Equipment", "Ball Hoppers"]], "price": 46.02}}
{"item_id": "B0019FG82O", "title": "Burris Fullfield II 2x-7x-35mm matte Ballistic Plex", "description": "With a legacy of high performance, modest prices and the backing of a Forever Warranty(tm), choosing to purchase a Burris(r) Fullfield II(r) riflescope isn't difficult. The Fullfield II(r) features outstanding optical quality, positive steel-on-steel adjustments, extremely rugged outer tubes, and no-slip grips on the integrated eyepiece and focus adjustment. A mounting kit is not included.", "text": "Burris Fullfield II 2x-7x-35mm matte Ballistic Plex With a legacy of high performance, modest prices and the backing of a Forever Warranty(tm), choosing to purchase a Burris(r) Fullfield II(r) riflescope isn't difficult. The Fullfield II(r) features outstanding optical quality, positive steel-on-steel adjustments, extremely rugged outer tubes, and no-slip grips on the integrated eyepiece and focus adjustment. A mounting kit is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HYqCuuMhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019FG82O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 135.09}}
