{"item_id": "B0019GEW9E", "title": "SKLZ Practice Net - 7' Multi-Sport Training Net", "description": "Lightweight, easy to set up, and incredibly versatile. The 7' Multi-Sport Net is ideal for use with baseball trainers like the SKLZ QuickSwing and V-Tee, as well as for practicing golf, soccer, lacrosse, and football.", "text": "SKLZ Practice Net - 7' Multi-Sport Training Net Lightweight, easy to set up, and incredibly versatile. The 7' Multi-Sport Net is ideal for use with baseball trainers like the SKLZ QuickSwing and V-Tee, as well as for practicing golf, soccer, lacrosse, and football.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41auJC7bRQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019GEW9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Practice Nets"]], "price": 44.92}}
