{"item_id": "B0019GK7LQ", "title": "SKLZ Mini Practice Balls (plastic, 12 Pack)", "description": "The SKLZ Practice Balls allow you to practice your golf swing and or your baseball swing with full force. These lightweight, limited flight balls are safe to use in smaller areas, reduce ball chasing, and still allow you to swing to your fullest. This pack of 12 balls comes in a convenient shag bag.SKLZ Practice Balls can be used with the SKLZ QuickSwing, Power Stick, Quick Stick, Live Wire, Refiner Iron, Refiner Driver, Swing Accelerator Iron, or Swing Accelerator Driver.", "text": "SKLZ Mini Practice Balls (plastic, 12 Pack) The SKLZ Practice Balls allow you to practice your golf swing and or your baseball swing with full force. These lightweight, limited flight balls are safe to use in smaller areas, reduce ball chasing, and still allow you to swing to your fullest. This pack of 12 balls comes in a convenient shag bag.SKLZ Practice Balls can be used with the SKLZ QuickSwing, Power Stick, Quick Stick, Live Wire, Refiner Iron, Refiner Driver, Swing Accelerator Iron, or Swing Accelerator Driver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41169Lqsw7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019GK7LQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Baseballs"]], "price": 6.69}}
