{"item_id": "B0019HR5FG", "title": "12 Pack Keyed Alike Club Brand Gun Trigger Locks", "description": "This is a 12 pack of keyed alike Gun Trigger Locks. There are a total of 24 keys. They are new in bulk packaging as shown in the picture. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks. These are not CA approved locks.", "text": "12 Pack Keyed Alike Club Brand Gun Trigger Locks This is a 12 pack of keyed alike Gun Trigger Locks. There are a total of 24 keys. They are new in bulk packaging as shown in the picture. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks. These are not CA approved locks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tcxyrU6GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019HR5FG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Locks"]], "price": 64.55}}
{"item_id": "B0019HYLBW", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Canteen without Logo", "description": "The Canteen with BLACKHAWK! Logo offers BPA-free, impact-resistant Tritan copolyester construction resists unwanted tastes and smells. It is a military standard 1-qt. capacity canteen with military thread configuration to accommodate issued (NBC) caps. It is offered in a translucent color that shows fluid levels and cleanliness. Features: Temperature range of -40°F to 212°F (freezer and microwave safe); dishwasher safe (when positioned away from heating element on top rack); looped top allows for easy carrying by hand or carabineer; and sized to military specifications to fit in issued canteen cups and pouches.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Canteen without Logo The Canteen with BLACKHAWK! Logo offers BPA-free, impact-resistant Tritan copolyester construction resists unwanted tastes and smells. It is a military standard 1-qt. capacity canteen with military thread configuration to accommodate issued (NBC) caps. It is offered in a translucent color that shows fluid levels and cleanliness. Features: Temperature range of -40°F to 212°F (freezer and microwave safe); dishwasher safe (when positioned away from heating element on top rack); looped top allows for easy carrying by hand or carabineer; and sized to military specifications to fit in issued canteen cups and pouches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bAZK0PA1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019HYLBW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019I0AWA", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Demonstrator Gun", "description": "For all of those in need of a replica weapon that is the exact size of a real pistol, BLACKHAWK! Law Enforcement brings you the Demonstrator Replica Guns. Available in two colors (grey and safety orange) and in several pistol model types.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Demonstrator Gun For all of those in need of a replica weapon that is the exact size of a real pistol, BLACKHAWK! Law Enforcement brings you the Demonstrator Replica Guns. Available in two colors (grey and safety orange) and in several pistol model types.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hlcmSHsjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019I0AWA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
