{"item_id": "B0019K5FX2", "title": "NFL Team Color Retractable Click Pens- 5 Pack", "description": "Showcase your team when you have your favorite NFL team's retractable pens. Write in style with these retractable ballpoint pens. The pens contain black ink and features your team's colors, name and logos. Each pack contains 5 pens. Officially Licensed NFL Product", "text": "NFL Team Color Retractable Click Pens- 5 Pack Showcase your team when you have your favorite NFL team's retractable pens. Write in style with these retractable ballpoint pens. The pens contain black ink and features your team's colors, name and logos. Each pack contains 5 pens. Officially Licensed NFL Product", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412N1iGzNmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019K5FX2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Specialties Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Office Products", "Pens"]], "price": 4.25}}
