{"item_id": "B0019MM45W", "title": "5.11 TDU 1.75-Inch Belt", "description": "If you are looking for a quality tactical belt at a great price our TDU tactical belt with its non-metallic buckle is the one for you. Super-strong nylon webbing has been triple stitched to maintain a great shape and keep the buckle securely in place. The low profile, non-metallic buckle is extremely durable and won’t set off metal detectors at airports in the courthouse. The nylon will hold its color through washings, heavy use and exposure to the sun. The tactical belt makes a great tie-down for securing gear when you’ve run out of tie-down options.", "text": "5.11 TDU 1.75-Inch Belt If you are looking for a quality tactical belt at a great price our TDU tactical belt with its non-metallic buckle is the one for you. Super-strong nylon webbing has been triple stitched to maintain a great shape and keep the buckle securely in place. The low profile, non-metallic buckle is extremely durable and won’t set off metal detectors at airports in the courthouse. The nylon will hold its color through washings, heavy use and exposure to the sun. The tactical belt makes a great tie-down for securing gear when you’ve run out of tie-down options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516RmAaLMdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MM45W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019MNJC4", "title": "5.11 6 X 10 Pouch", "description": "Our 6.1 Vertical Pouch attaches quickly to any molle compatible system to help you organize critical gear. This pouch can be used to stow small items on the exterior of a pack, vest or gear bag; providing easy access to necessary items. Made of 1000D nylon, this 6.1 Vertical pouch is extremely durable and can be easily removed and relocated to other molle compatible systems using our Slickstick™ molle attachment system.", "text": "5.11 6 X 10 Pouch Our 6.1 Vertical Pouch attaches quickly to any molle compatible system to help you organize critical gear. This pouch can be used to stow small items on the exterior of a pack, vest or gear bag; providing easy access to necessary items. Made of 1000D nylon, this 6.1 Vertical pouch is extremely durable and can be easily removed and relocated to other molle compatible systems using our Slickstick™ molle attachment system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51y43MVNm9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MNJC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.76}}
{"item_id": "B0019MNJLK", "title": "5.11 Tactical® 42\" Double Rifle Case", "description": "5.11 Tactical 42\" Double Rifle Case. Loaded with features to secure your rifles, shotguns, ammo and necessary accessories! Designed by operators for operators. It won't take you long to figure that out. Built with durable, water-resistant 1,050-denier nylon and rugged YKK zippers, this Case doesn't just endure tough use, it thrives in it. The details: Center foam divider keeps guns separated and protected from scratches and wear; Exterior and interior MOLLE-compatible panels will accept any MOLLE compatible item; Main compartment features dividers in the corners and hook-and-loop lashing points to secure your firearms; Front smaller compartments included divider panels with MOLLE panels for more options and storage of accessories and ammo; Main and front compartments are padded on all sides to protect your critical gear; Top and bottom compression straps; Backpack straps for low or high carry; Internal measurements 44 1/4 x 12 x 3 1/2. Black or dark earth.; State Color. Stick to your guns! Trust the best: 5.11 Tactical... order now! 5.11 Tactical 42\" Double Rifle Case", "text": "5.11 Tactical® 42\" Double Rifle Case 5.11 Tactical 42\" Double Rifle Case. Loaded with features to secure your rifles, shotguns, ammo and necessary accessories! Designed by operators for operators. It won't take you long to figure that out. Built with durable, water-resistant 1,050-denier nylon and rugged YKK zippers, this Case doesn't just endure tough use, it thrives in it. The details: Center foam divider keeps guns separated and protected from scratches and wear; Exterior and interior MOLLE-compatible panels will accept any MOLLE compatible item; Main compartment features dividers in the corners and hook-and-loop lashing points to secure your firearms; Front smaller compartments included divider panels with MOLLE panels for more options and storage of accessories and ammo; Main and front compartments are padded on all sides to protect your critical gear; Top and bottom compression straps; Backpack straps for low or high carry; Internal measurements 44 1/4 x 12 x 3 1/2. Black or dark earth.; State Color. Stick to your guns! Trust the best: 5.11 Tactical... order now! 5.11 Tactical 42\" Double Rifle Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A58Z3LkWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MNJLK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 145.47}}
