{"item_id": "B0019MNKX2", "title": "5.11 Tactical Operator 1 3/4-Inch Belt", "description": "The operator belt has a solid stainless steel, low profile buckle that has a 6000lb rating. With a quick click of a carabineer, the operator belt can be used for support in extreme emergency climbing situations (only to be used in emergencies, the operator belt is not designed as a climbing harness). The durable nylon webbing locks securely in the belt buckle and is additionally locked with a Velcro® locking system.", "text": "5.11 Tactical Operator 1 3/4-Inch Belt The operator belt has a solid stainless steel, low profile buckle that has a 6000lb rating. With a quick click of a carabineer, the operator belt can be used for support in extreme emergency climbing situations (only to be used in emergencies, the operator belt is not designed as a climbing harness). The durable nylon webbing locks securely in the belt buckle and is additionally locked with a Velcro® locking system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FaaSrrceL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MNKX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019MNL0E", "title": "5.11 Tactical Trainer 1 1/2-Inch Belt", "description": "The 5.11 Trainer Belt has a solid stainless steel, low profile buckle which has a 6000lb rating for emergency climbing. The durable nylon webbing locks securely in the belt buckle and is additionally locked with a Velcro® locking system. The 5.11 Trainer Belt can accommodate most off duty holsters and will not lose its shape even after repeated use.", "text": "5.11 Tactical Trainer 1 1/2-Inch Belt The 5.11 Trainer Belt has a solid stainless steel, low profile buckle which has a 6000lb rating for emergency climbing. The durable nylon webbing locks securely in the belt buckle and is additionally locked with a Velcro® locking system. The 5.11 Trainer Belt can accommodate most off duty holsters and will not lose its shape even after repeated use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EgQnYp7TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MNL0E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019MNL7W", "title": "5.11 #59501 1.5-Inch Leather Casual Belt", "description": "Leave it to 5.11 Tactical Series to listen to officers about their needs in the area of plainclothes and undercover wear. Our Leather Casual Belt is made for everyday-casual but we’ve added special features for carrying your sidearm comfortably and safely. The Leather Casual Belt is 1-1/2” wide, made of full grain leather and has a Permastiff insert to provide stability for the weight of your pistol. We’ve also added a hidden cuff key keeper on the back of the inside of the belt. Leather Casual Belt come with a 5.11 branded brass plated buckle and the black belts include a nickel-platedbuckle. Each buckle features 5.11’s “I-Beam” construction for rugged durability. The stitched Leather Casual Belt features tone-on-tone stitching while the contrast-stitched belt has more visible stitching. With sizes from small to 4XL we’ve got the Leather Casual Belt for you.", "text": "5.11 #59501 1.5-Inch Leather Casual Belt Leave it to 5.11 Tactical Series to listen to officers about their needs in the area of plainclothes and undercover wear. Our Leather Casual Belt is made for everyday-casual but we’ve added special features for carrying your sidearm comfortably and safely. The Leather Casual Belt is 1-1/2” wide, made of full grain leather and has a Permastiff insert to provide stability for the weight of your pistol. We’ve also added a hidden cuff key keeper on the back of the inside of the belt. Leather Casual Belt come with a 5.11 branded brass plated buckle and the black belts include a nickel-platedbuckle. Each buckle features 5.11’s “I-Beam” construction for rugged durability. The stitched Leather Casual Belt features tone-on-tone stitching while the contrast-stitched belt has more visible stitching. With sizes from small to 4XL we’ve got the Leather Casual Belt for you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xL%2BTKV4%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MNL7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]]}}
