{"item_id": "B0019MT4Y6", "title": "FuelBelt Sprint 10-Ounce Palm Holder with Pocket", "description": "Known to pad the fall of trail run crashes…but you didn't hear that from us! 10 oz bottle, adjustable strap, plus a pocket for small essentials.", "text": "FuelBelt Sprint 10-Ounce Palm Holder with Pocket Known to pad the fall of trail run crashes…but you didn't hear that from us! 10 oz bottle, adjustable strap, plus a pocket for small essentials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31n91GyhKGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MT4Y6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019MWRW2", "title": "Hogue Stock Remington 870 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend, 12-Inch L.O.P", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Remington 870 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend, 12-Inch L.O.P OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21BwwOpNkkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019MWRW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 64.9}}
{"item_id": "B0019N0VQA", "title": "Travelchair Slacker Chair", "description": "Three little legs that'll hold 275lbs. the slacker is as tiny as it is tough. When closed and secured with its Velcro strap, is no bigger than a rolled up newspaper. The Slacker is light-weight, easy to pack and a great price.", "text": "Travelchair Slacker Chair Three little legs that'll hold 275lbs. the slacker is as tiny as it is tough. When closed and secured with its Velcro strap, is no bigger than a rolled up newspaper. The Slacker is light-weight, easy to pack and a great price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ilgNTr4WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019N0VQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TravelChair", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 23.48}}
{"item_id": "B0019N36Y4", "title": "Musashi Deluxe Table Top 1 Tier Sword Stand w/ Velvet", "description": "You are now looking at the Musashi Edition Table Top One Tier Stand. A sword is not simply a weapon but a work of art. Don't neglect your sword by leaving it lying around collecting dust. This is an essential piece for any collector. Display in Style!", "text": "Musashi Deluxe Table Top 1 Tier Sword Stand w/ Velvet You are now looking at the Musashi Edition Table Top One Tier Stand. A sword is not simply a weapon but a work of art. Don't neglect your sword by leaving it lying around collecting dust. This is an essential piece for any collector. Display in Style!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/211BA7pxxlL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019N36Y4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sword Demon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapon Stands"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0019N3TZK", "title": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend, 12-Inch L.O.P", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend, 12-Inch L.O.P OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21rHLe23KtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019N3TZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 55.39}}
{"item_id": "B0019N5JHG", "title": "Hogue Ruger Mini 14/30 Stock, Post 180 No, Olive Drab Green", "description": "Hogue Overmold Stock For Ruger Mini 14/30 have a sleek straight comb, palm swells and a varminter style forend which is treated with a unique cobblestone texture. Hunters especially will be attracted to the incredible quietness of these stocks coupled with lightweight, superior non-slip comfort and accuracy. (Fits guns with serial numbers post 180)Features:- Sleek straight comb- Palm swells - Varminter style forendSpecifications:- Color: OD Green- Varmint Barrel- Fits: Ruger Mini 14/30", "text": "Hogue Ruger Mini 14/30 Stock, Post 180 No, Olive Drab Green Hogue Overmold Stock For Ruger Mini 14/30 have a sleek straight comb, palm swells and a varminter style forend which is treated with a unique cobblestone texture. Hunters especially will be attracted to the incredible quietness of these stocks coupled with lightweight, superior non-slip comfort and accuracy. (Fits guns with serial numbers post 180)Features:- Sleek straight comb- Palm swells - Varminter style forendSpecifications:- Color: OD Green- Varmint Barrel- Fits: Ruger Mini 14/30", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310tLqr3OlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019N5JHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 73.89}}
{"item_id": "B0019OSA30", "title": "Maxpedition Rollypoly MM Folding Dump Pouch", "description": "Folding utility dump pouch. Holds seven 30rnd M-16 mags. Shotgun shells, secured evidence.", "text": "Maxpedition Rollypoly MM Folding Dump Pouch Folding utility dump pouch. Holds seven 30rnd M-16 mags. Shotgun shells, secured evidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V2ODejw8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019OSA30.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 24.07}}
