{"item_id": "B0019QHL1U", "title": "Niterider NiteRider TL-5.0 Rear Safety Light 5 LED", "description": "NiteRider Rear Safety Taillight features 5 LEDs that run 160 hours on flashing mode or 70 hours in constant mode. Features: Constant, flash, random and scrolling modes. Universal seatpost mount and belt clip. 70 hour run time in flash mode. Batteries included", "text": "Niterider NiteRider TL-5.0 Rear Safety Light 5 LED NiteRider Rear Safety Taillight features 5 LEDs that run 160 hours on flashing mode or 70 hours in constant mode. Features: Constant, flash, random and scrolling modes. Universal seatpost mount and belt clip. 70 hour run time in flash mode. Batteries included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FWO%2BzAmuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019QHL1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 8.49}}
{"item_id": "B0019RJWZC", "title": "Slime Super Thick Tube", "description": "The ultimate choice for flat prevention. Get flat protection that no other mountain bike tube can match; go for it, take the short cut! The MTB tube is 5X thicker to provide unbeatable protection against even the most damaging thorns, glass and debris", "text": "Slime Super Thick Tube The ultimate choice for flat prevention. Get flat protection that no other mountain bike tube can match; go for it, take the short cut! The MTB tube is 5X thicker to provide unbeatable protection against even the most damaging thorns, glass and debris", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KVcI28nFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019RJWZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0019RLL0G", "title": "Master Lock Street Cuffs", "description": "Master Lock Street Cuffs allow locking to parking meter and fence posts. 3\" cuffs allow locking to parking meter and fence posts. Pivoting Link - prevents a fixed anchor point - takes away use of leverage to defeat. Hardened laminated steel construction with hardened pivot link - virtually impossible to cut. Compact - fold in half to fit in seat bag, back pack or pocket. 12\" long for convenient locking. $3,500 Anti-Theft Guarantee", "text": "Master Lock Street Cuffs Master Lock Street Cuffs allow locking to parking meter and fence posts. 3\" cuffs allow locking to parking meter and fence posts. Pivoting Link - prevents a fixed anchor point - takes away use of leverage to defeat. Hardened laminated steel construction with hardened pivot link - virtually impossible to cut. Compact - fold in half to fit in seat bag, back pack or pocket. 12\" long for convenient locking. $3,500 Anti-Theft Guarantee", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317pT%2BOUq8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019RLL0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Master Lock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0019SS8CE", "title": "Bushnell AR Optics 1x MP Illuminated Red/Green T-Dot Reticle Riflescope, 1x32mm", "description": "As the number one riflescope innovator in the world, Bushnell has worked diligently with law enforcement and military experts nationwide to design, test, and produce the finest family of tactical shooting instruments in the industry. The Bushnell Tactical Elite 1x32 is the latest example, with an illuminated red/green T-dot reticle that provides fast target acquisition and accuracy in dim conditions. The Zoom Dot option gives you the ability to tune the size of your aiming point down to one MOA for precision shooting all the way up to 10 MOA for close quarters. The scope's Amber-Bright lens coating, meanwhile, quickly helps you distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter, making it useful for shooting on autumn days.The scope offers such additional features as tactical turrets for rapid adjustment, a blacked-out finish for optimum concealment, an auto shutoff based on the position of your gun, and a 100-percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction. When the stakes are at their highest, trust your shot to Bushnell.The scope includes an illuminated red/green T-dot reticle.Specifications:Power: 1xObjective lens: 32mmFinish: MatteDry-nitrogen filled: YesBattery: CR2032Reticle: 3 MOA dot, T-dotField of view: 44 feet @ 100 yardsAdjustment range: 70 inches @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 32mmEye relief: UnlimitedClick value: 0.25 @ 100 yardsMounting length: 5.8 inchesOverall length: 6.75 inchesWeight: 15.6 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "text": "Bushnell AR Optics 1x MP Illuminated Red/Green T-Dot Reticle Riflescope, 1x32mm As the number one riflescope innovator in the world, Bushnell has worked diligently with law enforcement and military experts nationwide to design, test, and produce the finest family of tactical shooting instruments in the industry. The Bushnell Tactical Elite 1x32 is the latest example, with an illuminated red/green T-dot reticle that provides fast target acquisition and accuracy in dim conditions. The Zoom Dot option gives you the ability to tune the size of your aiming point down to one MOA for precision shooting all the way up to 10 MOA for close quarters. The scope's Amber-Bright lens coating, meanwhile, quickly helps you distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter, making it useful for shooting on autumn days.The scope offers such additional features as tactical turrets for rapid adjustment, a blacked-out finish for optimum concealment, an auto shutoff based on the position of your gun, and a 100-percent waterproof/fogproof/shockproof construction. When the stakes are at their highest, trust your shot to Bushnell.The scope includes an illuminated red/green T-dot reticle.Specifications:Power: 1xObjective lens: 32mmFinish: MatteDry-nitrogen filled: YesBattery: CR2032Reticle: 3 MOA dot, T-dotField of view: 44 feet @ 100 yardsAdjustment range: 70 inches @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 32mmEye relief: UnlimitedClick value: 0.25 @ 100 yardsMounting length: 5.8 inchesOverall length: 6.75 inchesWeight: 15.6 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kSpPrcJTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0019SS8CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 181.79}}
