{"item_id": "B001A4M8BE", "title": "Maximum Muscle Trainer Wall-Mounted Pull Up Chin Up Bar", "description": "The Maximum Muscle Trainer is the ultimate pull up bar designed for the serious body builder/athlete. New design, adjustable (16 and 24 inches) to mount on solid wall, wood beams, and drywall (with studs 16 inches apart) for permanent safety! Work out readily anytime...no need to mount on a doorway each time you work out. The Maximum Muscle Trainer enables you to do various pull up grip positions (wide grip, reverse grip, close grip, and hammer grip) that work on your compound muscles for fast, maximum results! Develop your back, chest, shoulders, lats, biceps, triceps, and forearms using your body's weight resistance. Achieve those six-pack abs by doing a variety of hanging crunches that effectively target different areas of your abdomen, including your lower core! The heavy duty Maximum Muscle Trainer is built professionaly of hi-grade steel, non-slip powder coating and comfort grips. It is easy to assemble and ready to use. It holds up to 300 lbs of weight! Mount on a solid/thick wall, wood beams, or drywall (with studs 16 inches apart) for safety and maximum performance.", "text": "Maximum Muscle Trainer Wall-Mounted Pull Up Chin Up Bar The Maximum Muscle Trainer is the ultimate pull up bar designed for the serious body builder/athlete. New design, adjustable (16 and 24 inches) to mount on solid wall, wood beams, and drywall (with studs 16 inches apart) for permanent safety! Work out readily anytime...no need to mount on a doorway each time you work out. The Maximum Muscle Trainer enables you to do various pull up grip positions (wide grip, reverse grip, close grip, and hammer grip) that work on your compound muscles for fast, maximum results! Develop your back, chest, shoulders, lats, biceps, triceps, and forearms using your body's weight resistance. Achieve those six-pack abs by doing a variety of hanging crunches that effectively target different areas of your abdomen, including your lower core! The heavy duty Maximum Muscle Trainer is built professionaly of hi-grade steel, non-slip powder coating and comfort grips. It is easy to assemble and ready to use. It holds up to 300 lbs of weight! Mount on a solid/thick wall, wood beams, or drywall (with studs 16 inches apart) for safety and maximum performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21-Qyr0-gOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001A4M8BE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
