{"item_id": "B001A7557A", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Tactical Mag Pouch", "description": "This carbon-fiber mag pouch with molded flap mounts directly to the SERPA Tactical Holster Platform (sold separately.)", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Tactical Mag Pouch This carbon-fiber mag pouch with molded flap mounts directly to the SERPA Tactical Holster Platform (sold separately.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31psIhVHnyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001A7557A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.79}}
{"item_id": "B001A76V50", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Level 3 SERPA Light Bearing Auto Lock Duty Matte Finish Holster", "description": "Featuring BLACKHAWK!'s highest level of security, the Level 3 Light Bearing Duty Holster makes it possible to wear a weapon-mounted light while on duty. The holster features passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release and a thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security. No thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw. This holster works with the BLACKHAWK! Xiphos NT Weapon Mounted Light only (75204BK). Features: Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; no snaps or hoods to accidentally open; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops are also available. Neither the Beretta 92 or 96 have a rail. If you attach an aftermarket rail on the Beretta 92 or 96 to mount the light, it will not fit BLACKHAWK!'s holsters.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Level 3 SERPA Light Bearing Auto Lock Duty Matte Finish Holster Featuring BLACKHAWK!'s highest level of security, the Level 3 Light Bearing Duty Holster makes it possible to wear a weapon-mounted light while on duty. The holster features passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release and a thumb-activated Pivot Guard for additional security. No thumb break or awkward middle finger release to slow down your draw. This holster works with the BLACKHAWK! Xiphos NT Weapon Mounted Light only (75204BK). Features: Reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; no snaps or hoods to accidentally open; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; includes angle-adjustable jacket-slot belt loop; and mid-ride and high-ride belt loops are also available. Neither the Beretta 92 or 96 have a rail. If you attach an aftermarket rail on the Beretta 92 or 96 to mount the light, it will not fit BLACKHAWK!'s holsters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pupgvk0nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001A76V50.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
