{"item_id": "B001A7DVXU", "title": "Instapark® RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 3Watt LED Flashlight w/ Laser Sight", "description": "A compact flashlight and laser sight combo* Super bright 90Lumen LED Bulb * Black color polymer body * Crossbar mounting system mounts the flashlight and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlight * Mode selector set various operation mode such as flashlight only, laser sight only and flashlight/laser sight the same time. Mode selector also works as a safety switch. * Dual Switches: Button switch turns on continuous beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. Included cord remote switch turns flashlight or/and laser sight momentarily. * Two cord switches included, one for pistol use and a longer one for rifle use. * 650nm red laser sight is fully adjustable for Windage and Elevation with included Allen wrench. * 2x CR123 3Volt lithium batteries (included). Battery run time: approximately 2.5hours * Weight: 5 1/2oz (Batteries installed) * Size: 3 1/2\"Lx 1 \"W x 2\"H The flashlight fits onto Picatinny and Weaver rails including RAS/RIS. Please note the red beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a red beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.", "text": "Instapark® RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 3Watt LED Flashlight w/ Laser Sight A compact flashlight and laser sight combo* Super bright 90Lumen LED Bulb * Black color polymer body * Crossbar mounting system mounts the flashlight and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlight * Mode selector set various operation mode such as flashlight only, laser sight only and flashlight/laser sight the same time. Mode selector also works as a safety switch. * Dual Switches: Button switch turns on continuous beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. Included cord remote switch turns flashlight or/and laser sight momentarily. * Two cord switches included, one for pistol use and a longer one for rifle use. * 650nm red laser sight is fully adjustable for Windage and Elevation with included Allen wrench. * 2x CR123 3Volt lithium batteries (included). Battery run time: approximately 2.5hours * Weight: 5 1/2oz (Batteries installed) * Size: 3 1/2\"Lx 1 \"W x 2\"H The flashlight fits onto Picatinny and Weaver rails including RAS/RIS. Please note the red beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a red beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l2WmkveJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001A7DVXU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 34.6}}
{"item_id": "B001A7NGOO", "title": "Instapark® One Piece High Power Magnum Airgun Scope Mount Stop Pin.", "description": "Fits all scopes with a one inch body tube * Mounts onto 3/8inch dovetail rails or grooved receivers * 33mm center height good for mount scope with adjustable objective size up to 50mm * Removable threaded stop pin is built in and can be activated easily * 5 Mounting screws give lots of clamping power and make the mounted scope firm and stay in place under recoil in every shooting situation * Full length of the mount is 4 3/4inch * Opening between two rings: 3inch * Works with typical full-size air rifle scopes around 12inch or longer", "text": "Instapark® One Piece High Power Magnum Airgun Scope Mount Stop Pin. Fits all scopes with a one inch body tube * Mounts onto 3/8inch dovetail rails or grooved receivers * 33mm center height good for mount scope with adjustable objective size up to 50mm * Removable threaded stop pin is built in and can be activated easily * 5 Mounting screws give lots of clamping power and make the mounted scope firm and stay in place under recoil in every shooting situation * Full length of the mount is 4 3/4inch * Opening between two rings: 3inch * Works with typical full-size air rifle scopes around 12inch or longer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oqvIQ127L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001A7NGOO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 17.25}}
{"item_id": "B001AAZR6G", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWMP1B Military and Police Knife with MAGIC Assisted Open and Scooped Back Drop Point Blade, Black", "description": "The M&P; series of knives from renowned gunmaker Smith & Wesson features a side safety M.A.G.I.C. assisted opening system that allows single-handed operation. Designed for military and law enforcement use, it's durable in the extreme, with a black aluminum handle with rubber inserts and a titanium-coated stainless steel, half-serrated blade.FeaturesM.A.G.I.C. assisted opening system for one-handed useBlack aluminum handle with rubber insertsTitanium-coated stainless steel bladeLiner lockWindow punchThumb studPocket clipSpecifications4.2-inch handle2.9-inch blade7.1-inch overall length4034 stainless steel4.1-ounce weightLifetime WarrantySmith & Wesson knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWMP1B Military and Police Knife with MAGIC Assisted Open and Scooped Back Drop Point Blade, Black The M&P; series of knives from renowned gunmaker Smith & Wesson features a side safety M.A.G.I.C. assisted opening system that allows single-handed operation. Designed for military and law enforcement use, it's durable in the extreme, with a black aluminum handle with rubber inserts and a titanium-coated stainless steel, half-serrated blade.FeaturesM.A.G.I.C. assisted opening system for one-handed useBlack aluminum handle with rubber insertsTitanium-coated stainless steel bladeLiner lockWindow punchThumb studPocket clipSpecifications4.2-inch handle2.9-inch blade7.1-inch overall length4034 stainless steel4.1-ounce weightLifetime WarrantySmith & Wesson knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Gum9hbdDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AAZR6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 30.15}}
{"item_id": "B001AB33K2", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWMP1BS Military and Police Knife with MAGIC Assisted Open and Scooped Back Serrated Blade, Black", "description": "The Magic Assisted Opening System helps fold open the blade single handedly.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWMP1BS Military and Police Knife with MAGIC Assisted Open and Scooped Back Serrated Blade, Black The Magic Assisted Opening System helps fold open the blade single handedly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y0JXHr-TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AB33K2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 31.13}}
