{"item_id": "B001ABJXL0", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Mossy Oak Grizzly Air Rifle (Camo/Black, 36.8 Inch)", "description": "A fine airgun for new shooters! Daisy's 840 Grizzly is a single-stroke pneumatic, which means it requires just one pump stroke to power the gun. The airgun is sized for shooters 10 and older (adult supervision required), and the easy pumping effort is geared toward younger folks. The 840 shoots either steel BBs (Never shoot BBs at metal objects) or .177 pellets. With a capacity of 350 BBs, this airgun is truly an all-day shooter. With BBs (350-Feet Per Second), it's a repeater. With pellets (330-Feet Per Second), it's a single-shot. It comes with a fiber optic front sight and an adjustable open rear sight. The receiver is made of tough engineering resin, which helps keep the gun lightweight. The MOBU camo synthetic stock has checkering to ensure a good, steady grip. The dovetail grooves in the receiver make it easy to install a scope or red dot sight. The 840 Grizzly is perfect for plinking, shooting paper targets and training new shooters.... You'll be shooting so much that you had better load up on BBs and pellets. This is a single-stroke pneumatic, which means you pump the lever only one time. A second pump stroke will remove the air the first stroke put in. A great starter rifle. Easy cocking effort, shoots BBs or .177 pellets.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Mossy Oak Grizzly Air Rifle (Camo/Black, 36.8 Inch) A fine airgun for new shooters! Daisy's 840 Grizzly is a single-stroke pneumatic, which means it requires just one pump stroke to power the gun. The airgun is sized for shooters 10 and older (adult supervision required), and the easy pumping effort is geared toward younger folks. The 840 shoots either steel BBs (Never shoot BBs at metal objects) or .177 pellets. With a capacity of 350 BBs, this airgun is truly an all-day shooter. With BBs (350-Feet Per Second), it's a repeater. With pellets (330-Feet Per Second), it's a single-shot. It comes with a fiber optic front sight and an adjustable open rear sight. The receiver is made of tough engineering resin, which helps keep the gun lightweight. The MOBU camo synthetic stock has checkering to ensure a good, steady grip. The dovetail grooves in the receiver make it easy to install a scope or red dot sight. The 840 Grizzly is perfect for plinking, shooting paper targets and training new shooters.... You'll be shooting so much that you had better load up on BBs and pellets. This is a single-stroke pneumatic, which means you pump the lever only one time. A second pump stroke will remove the air the first stroke put in. A great starter rifle. Easy cocking effort, shoots BBs or .177 pellets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iiEJFPZuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABJXL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001ABJXLA", "title": "Walther P22 Pistol (Medium)", "description": "The P22 is a low-impact yet fun-packed airsoft BB gun offered by Walther Special Operations. It's a spring operated pistol that comes with some air soft BBs and an extra P22 magazine", "text": "Walther P22 Pistol (Medium) The P22 is a low-impact yet fun-packed airsoft BB gun offered by Walther Special Operations. It's a spring operated pistol that comes with some air soft BBs and an extra P22 magazine", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ITT1pXzoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABJXLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walther", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 10.87}}
{"item_id": "B001ABJZFO", "title": "Gunvault GVB2000 Multi Vault Biometric Gun Safe", "description": "Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes Keypad and Biometeric pad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. Choose the Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault when you need quick access storage for your handgun. We know that security and reliability are prevaling priorities when you need our products, and that's why gunVault pistol safes have the features you want: Improved high strength lock mechanism. Precise fittings virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes available. Audio feedback instantly confirms correct keypad entries. Audio disable feature allows \"stealth\" mode operation. Battery power for maximum security and easy portability. Tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts. Built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries. GunVault Biometric Technology: GunVault Bio uses biometrics, specifically fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. System can handle a maximum of thirty fingerprint templates between the enrolled fingerprint.", "text": "Gunvault GVB2000 Multi Vault Biometric Gun Safe Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes Keypad and Biometeric pad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. Choose the Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault when you need quick access storage for your handgun. We know that security and reliability are prevaling priorities when you need our products, and that's why gunVault pistol safes have the features you want: Improved high strength lock mechanism. Precise fittings virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes available. Audio feedback instantly confirms correct keypad entries. Audio disable feature allows \"stealth\" mode operation. Battery power for maximum security and easy portability. Tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts. Built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries. GunVault Biometric Technology: GunVault Bio uses biometrics, specifically fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. System can handle a maximum of thirty fingerprint templates between the enrolled fingerprint.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yZCZHIVwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABJZFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GunVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 239.49}}
{"item_id": "B001ABK3IC", "title": "Stansport 2 Burner Propane Stove", "description": "The Stansport 2 Burner Propane Stove is the perfect cooking partner in the great outdoors. Whether it’s a tailgate party or a weekend getaway, this 2-burner stove brings the heat with 25K BTUs. Its stainless steel construction looks great and includes heavy-duty grate, windscreens, and latching top. It also includes a high altitude pressure regulator for elevated cooking. About Stansport Stansport welcomes you to their world, the Great Outdoors, ''Where we make camping fun.'' Stansport believes that camping is a timeless activity for the young and old where a roaring campfire is more than just a heat source, but also the gathering place for stories of the past, present, and future. Camping means a simple time to share of ourselves, get to know each other, and experience all the wonderment of Mother Nature. The people at Stansport have travelled the world to bring you the best values in camping equipment. Burner output: 25,000 BTUs. Stainless steel construction. Piezo electric ignition. Includes steel drip pan. Heavy-duty cooking grate and windscreens. High altitude regulator. Dimensions: 23.5L x 12.5W x 6H in..", "text": "Stansport 2 Burner Propane Stove The Stansport 2 Burner Propane Stove is the perfect cooking partner in the great outdoors. Whether it’s a tailgate party or a weekend getaway, this 2-burner stove brings the heat with 25K BTUs. Its stainless steel construction looks great and includes heavy-duty grate, windscreens, and latching top. It also includes a high altitude pressure regulator for elevated cooking. About Stansport Stansport welcomes you to their world, the Great Outdoors, ''Where we make camping fun.'' Stansport believes that camping is a timeless activity for the young and old where a roaring campfire is more than just a heat source, but also the gathering place for stories of the past, present, and future. Camping means a simple time to share of ourselves, get to know each other, and experience all the wonderment of Mother Nature. The people at Stansport have travelled the world to bring you the best values in camping equipment. Burner output: 25,000 BTUs. Stainless steel construction. Piezo electric ignition. Includes steel drip pan. Heavy-duty cooking grate and windscreens. High altitude regulator. Dimensions: 23.5L x 12.5W x 6H in..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X7bND5e8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABK3IC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 68.48}}
{"item_id": "B001ABLN4A", "title": "Gunvault GVB1000 Mini Vault Biometric Gun Safe", "description": "GunVault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. We know that security and reliability are prevailing priorities when you need our products, and that's why GunVault pistol safes have the features you want. Our Biometric scanner provides lightning-quick access, even in the dark. Improved high strength lock mechanism and precise fittings make it virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Battery powered for maximum security and easy portability. The GVB 1000 (MiniVault Bio) uses fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. The GVB 1000 can handle a maximum of 15 fingerprint templates. The GVB 1000 also comes with an AC/DC Power Adapter, and an interior courtesy light.", "text": "Gunvault GVB1000 Mini Vault Biometric Gun Safe GunVault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. We know that security and reliability are prevailing priorities when you need our products, and that's why GunVault pistol safes have the features you want. Our Biometric scanner provides lightning-quick access, even in the dark. Improved high strength lock mechanism and precise fittings make it virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Battery powered for maximum security and easy portability. The GVB 1000 (MiniVault Bio) uses fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. The GVB 1000 can handle a maximum of 15 fingerprint templates. The GVB 1000 also comes with an AC/DC Power Adapter, and an interior courtesy light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MvDroEXBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABLN4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GunVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 199.79}}
{"item_id": "B001ABLN4K", "title": "Crosman 760 Pumpmaster, Pink Stock air rifle", "description": "", "text": "Crosman 760 Pumpmaster, Pink Stock air rifle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21IQM7uahbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABLN4K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B001ABN3NY", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt HPPBH Ruger P94 ,95,97 with or without rails / Hi Point .45", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Belt HPPBH Ruger P94 ,95,97 with or without rails / Hi Point .45 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418MG6jrhJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABN3NY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.51}}
{"item_id": "B001ABP1XE", "title": "Allen® Marlin® 42\" Scoped Rifle Case", "description": "Allen Marlin 42\" Scoped Rifle Case. Guard your favorite scoped rifle with this Ruger Marlin Gun Case. Your rifle will be protected by a durable Endura fabric shell and 7/8\" foam padding. Zippered closure keeps your gun secure inside while providing easy access. Grab ahold of the comfortable carry straps and you're on your way to getting another impressive trophy! Order Today! Allen Marlin 42\" Scoped Rifle Case", "text": "Allen® Marlin® 42\" Scoped Rifle Case Allen Marlin 42\" Scoped Rifle Case. Guard your favorite scoped rifle with this Ruger Marlin Gun Case. Your rifle will be protected by a durable Endura fabric shell and 7/8\" foam padding. Zippered closure keeps your gun secure inside while providing easy access. Grab ahold of the comfortable carry straps and you're on your way to getting another impressive trophy! Order Today! Allen Marlin 42\" Scoped Rifle Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BVf9XfmhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABP1XE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 29.07}}
{"item_id": "B001ABPB2U", "title": "Stansport Propane Appliance to Distribution Post", "description": "The Stansport Propane Appliance to Distribution Post connects your propane appliance to a distribution pole, this 10' hose attaches easily with the new QCC-1 fittings", "text": "Stansport Propane Appliance to Distribution Post The Stansport Propane Appliance to Distribution Post connects your propane appliance to a distribution pole, this 10' hose attaches easily with the new QCC-1 fittings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q059MkVXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABPB2U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001ABQT9E", "title": "Caldwell Handy NXT Rifle Rest", "description": "The Caldwell Handy Rest NXT is an extremely versatile front rest. It is designed with a full six feet of elevation adjustment at 100 yards, a front sling stud clearance groove, and is constructed of durable, lightweight materials.The intuitive design includes a removable handgun support attachment that easily converts this rifle rest into a handgun rest.The front rest and handgun support feature a material that will not harm your valuable firearm yet also offers a steady shooting surface.", "text": "Caldwell Handy NXT Rifle Rest The Caldwell Handy Rest NXT is an extremely versatile front rest. It is designed with a full six feet of elevation adjustment at 100 yards, a front sling stud clearance groove, and is constructed of durable, lightweight materials.The intuitive design includes a removable handgun support attachment that easily converts this rifle rest into a handgun rest.The front rest and handgun support feature a material that will not harm your valuable firearm yet also offers a steady shooting surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PjqS3M%2BLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABQT9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 28.43}}
{"item_id": "B001ABQT9O", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Media Box, 7-Pound", "description": "Clean, attractive brass should be the goal of every reloader. Cleaning brass by tumbling is the economical, safe first step in assembling quality handloads. Besides ensuring long life for the most valuable component of your ammunition, cleaning your brass will help reduce wear and tear on your expensive reloading dies, not to mention the chamber of your firearm.Grit and grime from uncleaned brass can become imbedded in the inner surfaces of your sizing dies, scratching and marring every subsequent case. The same grime can be expected to accelerate wear in the chamber and feeding system of your rifle or handgun.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Media Box, 7-Pound Clean, attractive brass should be the goal of every reloader. Cleaning brass by tumbling is the economical, safe first step in assembling quality handloads. Besides ensuring long life for the most valuable component of your ammunition, cleaning your brass will help reduce wear and tear on your expensive reloading dies, not to mention the chamber of your firearm.Grit and grime from uncleaned brass can become imbedded in the inner surfaces of your sizing dies, scratching and marring every subsequent case. The same grime can be expected to accelerate wear in the chamber and feeding system of your rifle or handgun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Lg75wvVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ABQT9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 19.45}}
{"item_id": "B001AC1C6I", "title": "Gerber 07520 Multi-Plier 600 Blunt Nose, Black", "description": "Blunt nose pliers have one specific advantage over needle nose pliers. With blunt nose pliers, one can exert more force at the very end of the pliers than with needle nose pliers. This type of biting power is why many people prefer blunt nose pliers. This Gerber MP600 blunt nose pliers is a perfect example of that. This model, 07520, features the integrated carbide cutters and is coated with black oxide to make it non-reflective.", "text": "Gerber 07520 Multi-Plier 600 Blunt Nose, Black Blunt nose pliers have one specific advantage over needle nose pliers. With blunt nose pliers, one can exert more force at the very end of the pliers than with needle nose pliers. This type of biting power is why many people prefer blunt nose pliers. This Gerber MP600 blunt nose pliers is a perfect example of that. This model, 07520, features the integrated carbide cutters and is coated with black oxide to make it non-reflective.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WGkYUuetL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AC1C6I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 47.48}}
{"item_id": "B001AC2M62", "title": "Ontario 8847 RAT Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black coated, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8847 RAT Folding Knife (Black) The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black coated, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xyRr1gViL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AC2M62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 28.17}}
{"item_id": "B001AC804K", "title": "Benchmade Pardue Design Axis Mini-Griptilian Knife Drop-Point with Ambidexterous Thumb Studs (Yellow)", "description": "Get a grip on this compact knife, featuring a modified drop-point blade, molded handle and a smooth AXIS™ locking mechanism. The154 CM stainless-steel blade is strong and sharp enough to slice through food, wire and ropes with ease. The strong, spring-loaded AXIS locking mechanism adjusts smoothly for ease of operation; the ambidextrous blade is keenly unleashed with a simple push of the thumb-stud openers. Molded nylon handle is lightweight and easy to grip. Reversible pocket clip makes storage and carry easy--just clip it on your pocket or belt and go! Silky carrying sheath included.", "text": "Benchmade Pardue Design Axis Mini-Griptilian Knife Drop-Point with Ambidexterous Thumb Studs (Yellow) Get a grip on this compact knife, featuring a modified drop-point blade, molded handle and a smooth AXIS™ locking mechanism. The154 CM stainless-steel blade is strong and sharp enough to slice through food, wire and ropes with ease. The strong, spring-loaded AXIS locking mechanism adjusts smoothly for ease of operation; the ambidextrous blade is keenly unleashed with a simple push of the thumb-stud openers. Molded nylon handle is lightweight and easy to grip. Reversible pocket clip makes storage and carry easy--just clip it on your pocket or belt and go! Silky carrying sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OYxGJ0GDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AC804K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 89.25}}
{"item_id": "B001AC81BW", "title": "Bianchi Patroltek 8014 Black Universal Radio Case", "description": "Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "text": "Bianchi Patroltek 8014 Black Universal Radio Case Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y8pJSK3DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AC81BW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Monadnock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B001ACFPN4", "title": "CamelBak Cleaning Kit with Cleaning Tablets", "description": "Cleaning a wide mouth water bottle is one thing, but properly cleaning a hydration system is a different matter. Fortunately, the folks at Camelbak have come up with a Cleaning Kit to make this task easy. The kit contains two brushes, one designed to scrub the delivery tube, and one designed to clean the reservoir. A cleaning tablet aids the process without leaving unwanted taste or odor, and a collapsible reservoir dryer improves drying efficiency.", "text": "CamelBak Cleaning Kit with Cleaning Tablets Cleaning a wide mouth water bottle is one thing, but properly cleaning a hydration system is a different matter. Fortunately, the folks at Camelbak have come up with a Cleaning Kit to make this task easy. The kit contains two brushes, one designed to scrub the delivery tube, and one designed to clean the reservoir. A cleaning tablet aids the process without leaving unwanted taste or odor, and a collapsible reservoir dryer improves drying efficiency.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A2qchsAjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ACFPN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B001AEASU2", "title": "Pyramex Highlander Safety Eyewear", "description": "Lightweight sports styling. Dual lens provides maximum protection. Inner lens clip provides soft foam for comfort fit and extreme styling. Can be worn with inner foam for additional dust protection or without. Optional headband provides google fit in a sylish glass. Quick release headband system. Lenses provide 99% protection against harmful UV rays.", "text": "Pyramex Highlander Safety Eyewear Lightweight sports styling. Dual lens provides maximum protection. Inner lens clip provides soft foam for comfort fit and extreme styling. Can be worn with inner foam for additional dust protection or without. Optional headband provides google fit in a sylish glass. Quick release headband system. Lenses provide 99% protection against harmful UV rays.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yWo5GAhyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AEASU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramex Safety", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B001AGCL3W", "title": "Bianchi Patroltek 8020 Black Triple Threat II Magazine Pouch (Size 2)", "description": "Fits Beretta 92F, 96F, 92/96F Centurion, 8000/8040 Cougar, 9000S Type F, 92FS/96 Vertec, Browning Hi-Power, Glock 17, 19, 22, 23", "text": "Bianchi Patroltek 8020 Black Triple Threat II Magazine Pouch (Size 2) Fits Beretta 92F, 96F, 92/96F Centurion, 8000/8040 Cougar, 9000S Type F, 92FS/96 Vertec, Browning Hi-Power, Glock 17, 19, 22, 23", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516m7SFdJqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AGCL3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Monadnock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.39}}
{"item_id": "B001AGEVT4", "title": "Spyderco Street Beat Micarta Plain Edge Knife, Black", "description": "Fred Perrin is a custom knifemaker, a former French Army Commando and a world-renowned martial artist. His Street Beat fixed-blade knife reflects all these influences. Ground from VG-10 stainless steel, it featues full-tang construction for strength and a deep finger choil halfway along its length. The finger choil not only provides a solid handguard to protect the user's hand, it also precisely defines the balance point of the knife for deft, responsive handling. The handle is constructed of polished Micarta handle scales that are contoured to fit the hand and double pinned for secure attachment. The full-flat-ground blade provides excellent edge geometry and cutting performance, and an unsharpened swedge on the spine ensures a strong but capable point. The Street Beat includes two lanyard holes--one at the butt end of the handle and one through the blade near the balance point--and comes complete with a black Boltaron (Kydex) sheath with a versatile G-Clip attachment that provides a variety of different carry options.", "text": "Spyderco Street Beat Micarta Plain Edge Knife, Black Fred Perrin is a custom knifemaker, a former French Army Commando and a world-renowned martial artist. His Street Beat fixed-blade knife reflects all these influences. Ground from VG-10 stainless steel, it featues full-tang construction for strength and a deep finger choil halfway along its length. The finger choil not only provides a solid handguard to protect the user's hand, it also precisely defines the balance point of the knife for deft, responsive handling. The handle is constructed of polished Micarta handle scales that are contoured to fit the hand and double pinned for secure attachment. The full-flat-ground blade provides excellent edge geometry and cutting performance, and an unsharpened swedge on the spine ensures a strong but capable point. The Street Beat includes two lanyard holes--one at the butt end of the handle and one through the blade near the balance point--and comes complete with a black Boltaron (Kydex) sheath with a versatile G-Clip attachment that provides a variety of different carry options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41por7pMkML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AGEVT4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 153.69}}
