{"item_id": "B001AGWZOW", "title": "Panaracer Ribmo Wire Bead Mountain Bicycle Tire", "description": "RiBMo is the newest addition to our urban tire line. Aside from a plethora of sizes, the news on RiBMo is PT puncture resistance technology. PT delivers 3x the puncture resistance of Aramid belted technologies.", "text": "Panaracer Ribmo Wire Bead Mountain Bicycle Tire RiBMo is the newest addition to our urban tire line. Aside from a plethora of sizes, the news on RiBMo is PT puncture resistance technology. PT delivers 3x the puncture resistance of Aramid belted technologies.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4123nwCfMmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AGWZOW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AH1DCQ", "title": "Mac Coupler Propane Bottle Cap MacCaps", "description": "This ingenious device protects the threads of disposable 1 pound propane bottles and helps prevent thread damage and seals out dirt. You will receive 2 caps per order. The Mac Caps makes a welcome addition to any camping gear, RV enthusiast, outdoorsmen, or home owner that needs to use a 1 lb. propane tanks. Now you can protect the threads of those tanks with the Mac Cap. Simply attach the Mac Cap to your 1 lb. tank when not in use to help prevent leaks and protect the threads. The Mac Cap is manufactured from the finest brass.", "text": "Mac Coupler Propane Bottle Cap MacCaps This ingenious device protects the threads of disposable 1 pound propane bottles and helps prevent thread damage and seals out dirt. You will receive 2 caps per order. The Mac Caps makes a welcome addition to any camping gear, RV enthusiast, outdoorsmen, or home owner that needs to use a 1 lb. propane tanks. Now you can protect the threads of those tanks with the Mac Cap. Simply attach the Mac Cap to your 1 lb. tank when not in use to help prevent leaks and protect the threads. The Mac Cap is manufactured from the finest brass.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SgK%2BY6HSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AH1DCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mac Coupler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 7.75}}
{"item_id": "B001AHSK2M", "title": "10000 Bb's 0.12g 6mm for Airsoft Guns", "description": "10000 Bb's 0.12g 6mm for Airsoft Guns", "text": "10000 Bb's 0.12g 6mm for Airsoft Guns 10000 Bb's 0.12g 6mm for Airsoft Guns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oSMBrnpaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AHSK2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B001AI0NE4", "title": "Sports Sensors Paintball Radarchron", "description": "Keep your paintball marker operating safely with the Paintball Radarchron from Sports Sensors. The Paintball Radarchron is a small, inexpensive microwave Doppler radar sensor that measures the speed of a paintball as it's shot from a marker, helping you assess whether your marker meets prescribed safety limits. Users have their choice of holding the device in their hand close to the marker barrel, or they can attach the Radarchron to the barrel with a simple loop strap. Once in place, the device measures paintball speeds within a range of 150 to 450 feet per second, at +/- 2 percent of accuracy.Hold the Radarchron close to the marker barrel to measure paintball speed.The Radarchron has proven so successful that many tournaments have written its use into their official rules, as its innovative design allows game officials to conveniently measure speeds before, after, and during competition. The Radarchron is microprocessor controlled--like a mini-computer--and indicates calculated foot-per-second paintball speed on a two-segment liquid crystal display. In addition, the Radarchron is tough enough to withstand serious punishment, with a rugged plastic housing that's sealed to protect the internal electronics from dust, dirt, and moisture encountered during normal use. Perhaps best of all, the Radarchron is simple, safe, and effective. The unit, which offers one-button operation, boasts a transmission level that's well below that of most wireless consumer products, such as cell and portable phones, for example. Transmission characteristics are also well within FCC, CA, and CE requirements and prescribed safety levels.The Radarchron runs on a 3-volt, 160 milliampere/hour lithium battery, which delivers roughly 30 hours of operating life (or more than 3,600 speed measurements). It's also notably compact at 2.5 by 1.19 by 3.5 inches (W x H x D), with a weight of less than 3 ounces.", "text": "Sports Sensors Paintball Radarchron Keep your paintball marker operating safely with the Paintball Radarchron from Sports Sensors. The Paintball Radarchron is a small, inexpensive microwave Doppler radar sensor that measures the speed of a paintball as it's shot from a marker, helping you assess whether your marker meets prescribed safety limits. Users have their choice of holding the device in their hand close to the marker barrel, or they can attach the Radarchron to the barrel with a simple loop strap. Once in place, the device measures paintball speeds within a range of 150 to 450 feet per second, at +/- 2 percent of accuracy.Hold the Radarchron close to the marker barrel to measure paintball speed.The Radarchron has proven so successful that many tournaments have written its use into their official rules, as its innovative design allows game officials to conveniently measure speeds before, after, and during competition. The Radarchron is microprocessor controlled--like a mini-computer--and indicates calculated foot-per-second paintball speed on a two-segment liquid crystal display. In addition, the Radarchron is tough enough to withstand serious punishment, with a rugged plastic housing that's sealed to protect the internal electronics from dust, dirt, and moisture encountered during normal use. Perhaps best of all, the Radarchron is simple, safe, and effective. The unit, which offers one-button operation, boasts a transmission level that's well below that of most wireless consumer products, such as cell and portable phones, for example. Transmission characteristics are also well within FCC, CA, and CE requirements and prescribed safety levels.The Radarchron runs on a 3-volt, 160 milliampere/hour lithium battery, which delivers roughly 30 hours of operating life (or more than 3,600 speed measurements). It's also notably compact at 2.5 by 1.19 by 3.5 inches (W x H x D), with a weight of less than 3 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MQgqMyxrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI0NE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sports Sensors, Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Complete Paintball Sets"]], "price": 74.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AI0NOE", "title": "Carlisle Economy Aluminum Canoe Paddle with T-Grip", "description": "Lightweight and durable, this is the perfect all-purpose paddle. An 8\" X 20\" blade adds power to your stroke. A tempered-aluminum shaft with a 13\" HDPE grip for sure handling. Blade and T-grip are molded of high impact polypropylene.", "text": "Carlisle Economy Aluminum Canoe Paddle with T-Grip Lightweight and durable, this is the perfect all-purpose paddle. An 8\" X 20\" blade adds power to your stroke. A tempered-aluminum shaft with a 13\" HDPE grip for sure handling. Blade and T-grip are molded of high impact polypropylene.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NVhjnC6GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI0NOE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Canoeing", "Paddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AI0PZG", "title": "Carlisle Magic Mystic Poly Kayak Paddle - Polypro Blades/Aluminum Shaft", "description": "A durable aluminum shaft makes the Carlisle Magic Mystic Kayak Paddle a reliable introductory paddle. Fiberglass reinforced polypropylene blades are efficiently designed and offer impressive power when on the water. The blades are created using a gas assist injection method that helps to eliminate excess material and weight without sacrificing either strength or durability. The black anodized tempered aluminum shaft has push button indexing for 60 degree right-hand control offset and in-line paddling. Colors available: Sunrise and Cloud. Lengths available: 220cm, 230cm, and 240cm.", "text": "Carlisle Magic Mystic Poly Kayak Paddle - Polypro Blades/Aluminum Shaft A durable aluminum shaft makes the Carlisle Magic Mystic Kayak Paddle a reliable introductory paddle. Fiberglass reinforced polypropylene blades are efficiently designed and offer impressive power when on the water. The blades are created using a gas assist injection method that helps to eliminate excess material and weight without sacrificing either strength or durability. The black anodized tempered aluminum shaft has push button indexing for 60 degree right-hand control offset and in-line paddling. Colors available: Sunrise and Cloud. Lengths available: 220cm, 230cm, and 240cm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JaZggjBEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI0PZG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AI0Q2I", "title": "Carlisle Day Tripper Aluminum Kayak Paddle - 2 Piece", "description": "With polypropylene blades and a high strength aluminum shaft the Carlisle Day Tripper is the right choice for an inexpensive quality kayak paddle. The push-button two-piece design allows blades to be feathered at 60-degress for right or left hand control or used in-line. It also allows for easy storage as a spare paddle.", "text": "Carlisle Day Tripper Aluminum Kayak Paddle - 2 Piece With polypropylene blades and a high strength aluminum shaft the Carlisle Day Tripper is the right choice for an inexpensive quality kayak paddle. The push-button two-piece design allows blades to be feathered at 60-degress for right or left hand control or used in-line. It also allows for easy storage as a spare paddle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sXKRvF8JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI0Q2I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AI4HNM", "title": "Carlisle Magic Plus Kayak Paddle - Polypro Blades/Fiberglass Shaft", "description": "The Carlisle Magic Plus' fiberglass-filled polypropylene blades in bright colors are lightweight and durable. The asymmetrical, slightly spooned blade shape combined with a lightweight, flexible fiberglass shaft produces smooth yet powerful strokes. The wound fiberglass shaft provides a sweet compromise between the stiffness needed for a strong paddle stroke and the flex needed to reduce stress on your joins. The fiberglass-filled polypropylene blades offer an unbeatable balance of lightweight versus durability. This is a paddle that can take all of the punishment you dish out and give you a great day on the water. Colors available: Sunrise and Cloud. Lengths available: 220cm, 230cm, and 240cm.", "text": "Carlisle Magic Plus Kayak Paddle - Polypro Blades/Fiberglass Shaft The Carlisle Magic Plus' fiberglass-filled polypropylene blades in bright colors are lightweight and durable. The asymmetrical, slightly spooned blade shape combined with a lightweight, flexible fiberglass shaft produces smooth yet powerful strokes. The wound fiberglass shaft provides a sweet compromise between the stiffness needed for a strong paddle stroke and the flex needed to reduce stress on your joins. The fiberglass-filled polypropylene blades offer an unbeatable balance of lightweight versus durability. This is a paddle that can take all of the punishment you dish out and give you a great day on the water. Colors available: Sunrise and Cloud. Lengths available: 220cm, 230cm, and 240cm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GnhvRBuDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI4HNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AI8FX0", "title": "Ka-Bar Fighting Knife with Straight Edge, Foliage Green", "description": "Ka-bar features a 7 in. blade made form 1095 Cro-Van steel with a non-reflective, epoxy coating and a foliage green Kraton G handle. Knife has an overall length of 11 3/4 in. And comes with a black hard plastic sheath.", "text": "Ka-Bar Fighting Knife with Straight Edge, Foliage Green Ka-bar features a 7 in. blade made form 1095 Cro-Van steel with a non-reflective, epoxy coating and a foliage green Kraton G handle. Knife has an overall length of 11 3/4 in. And comes with a black hard plastic sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rfrQmAHrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI8FX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 61.99}}
{"item_id": "B001AI9IRW", "title": "Grand Trunk Parasheet Beach/Picnic Blanket", "description": "The premier beach blanket on the market today, the ParaSheet is perfect for the shore, the park, or the campsite. The ParaSheet is made of sturdy parachute nylon, with patented bottom sand pockets that let you easily secure the blanket in place. The built-in stuff sack, meanwhile, makes transport a breeze, as the blanket folds easily and compactly. Best of all, the blanket's nylon construction stays cool on hot summer days.The corner sand pockets help keep the blanket in place.Just throw it in your beach bag and off you go, with no more heavy towels to weigh you down. Also outfitted with a side pocket for storage, the blanket cleans easily in the washing machine and dries quickly on the laundry line, and is mildew-resistant. The ParaSheet--which measures 7 by 7 feet and weighs 16 ounces--stores easily in the trunk of your car or in the corner of your beach bag.", "text": "Grand Trunk Parasheet Beach/Picnic Blanket The premier beach blanket on the market today, the ParaSheet is perfect for the shore, the park, or the campsite. The ParaSheet is made of sturdy parachute nylon, with patented bottom sand pockets that let you easily secure the blanket in place. The built-in stuff sack, meanwhile, makes transport a breeze, as the blanket folds easily and compactly. Best of all, the blanket's nylon construction stays cool on hot summer days.The corner sand pockets help keep the blanket in place.Just throw it in your beach bag and off you go, with no more heavy towels to weigh you down. Also outfitted with a side pocket for storage, the blanket cleans easily in the washing machine and dries quickly on the laundry line, and is mildew-resistant. The ParaSheet--which measures 7 by 7 feet and weighs 16 ounces--stores easily in the trunk of your car or in the corner of your beach bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W4uZ%2BFlNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI9IRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AI9L0G", "title": "Simple Solutions GCP900 Grunge Brush and Degreaser", "description": "The Grunge Brush is the first specifically designed brush that cleans motorcycle and ATV chains. The Grunge Brush has an innovative design that cleans chain from three angles at once. A long handle keeps fingers away from chain and brush bristles will not harm O-Ring or X-Ring chains. The long bristle side gets into those hard to reach areas. The Grunge Brush uses 3-sided bristles allowing you to clean all 4 sides of your chain and the long bristle side lets you clean other parts of your bike like sprockets and wheels. Combo pack comes with a mild, environmentally friendly degreaser. Easily adjustable for all sizes of motorcycle, ATV, and bicycle chains. Replaceable bristles ensure the Grunge Brush will last a lifetime. Regular component cleaning prevents premature wear and tear on chain and sprockets which assures smooth operation of the drive train.", "text": "Simple Solutions GCP900 Grunge Brush and Degreaser The Grunge Brush is the first specifically designed brush that cleans motorcycle and ATV chains. The Grunge Brush has an innovative design that cleans chain from three angles at once. A long handle keeps fingers away from chain and brush bristles will not harm O-Ring or X-Ring chains. The long bristle side gets into those hard to reach areas. The Grunge Brush uses 3-sided bristles allowing you to clean all 4 sides of your chain and the long bristle side lets you clean other parts of your bike like sprockets and wheels. Combo pack comes with a mild, environmentally friendly degreaser. Easily adjustable for all sizes of motorcycle, ATV, and bicycle chains. Replaceable bristles ensure the Grunge Brush will last a lifetime. Regular component cleaning prevents premature wear and tear on chain and sprockets which assures smooth operation of the drive train.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51c6kGJNvnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AI9L0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simple Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 14.19}}
{"item_id": "B001AIAIP8", "title": "KA-BAR #1213 Black Straight Edge Knife / Hard Sheath", "description": "ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Blade Length (inches): 7.00 Blade Material: High Carbon Black Carry System: Kydex Sheath Handle Material: Kraton Overall Length (inches): 11.75 Packaging: Box", "text": "KA-BAR #1213 Black Straight Edge Knife / Hard Sheath ATTRIBUTES Blade Detail: Plain Blade Length (inches): 7.00 Blade Material: High Carbon Black Carry System: Kydex Sheath Handle Material: Kraton Overall Length (inches): 11.75 Packaging: Box", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dT7ZbHE7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIAIP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 69.67}}
{"item_id": "B001AIBJNS", "title": "Grand Trunk Ultralight Hammock", "description": "When it's time to travel light and fast, turn to the Ultra-Light Hammock from Travel Hammock. The UL Hammock is made of 100-percent polyester taffeta, which is not only comfortable enough for quick naps and evening snoozes, but also packs down to a mere 12 ounces. As a result, it's a breeze to bring this hammock on long hikes without weighing down your pack. The hammock is also compatible with a sleeping pad, creating the ultimate off-the-ground sleeping solution. Other details include attached S-hooks for easy hanging, a 250-pound weight capacity, and a mildew-resistant, quick-dry design. Equipped with an attached stuff sack for easy transport, the UL Hammock measures 9.5 by 4.5 feet and carries a 2-year warranty.Key Features:Weighs 12 ouncesMeasures 9.5 feet long by 4.5 feet wideSupports up to 250 poundsMade with polyester taffetaIncludes stainless steel S-hooks for easy hangingAttached stuff sack for easy storageMildew resistantDries quicklyEasy to hangManufacturer's WarrantyTwo-year warranty", "text": "Grand Trunk Ultralight Hammock When it's time to travel light and fast, turn to the Ultra-Light Hammock from Travel Hammock. The UL Hammock is made of 100-percent polyester taffeta, which is not only comfortable enough for quick naps and evening snoozes, but also packs down to a mere 12 ounces. As a result, it's a breeze to bring this hammock on long hikes without weighing down your pack. The hammock is also compatible with a sleeping pad, creating the ultimate off-the-ground sleeping solution. Other details include attached S-hooks for easy hanging, a 250-pound weight capacity, and a mildew-resistant, quick-dry design. Equipped with an attached stuff sack for easy transport, the UL Hammock measures 9.5 by 4.5 feet and carries a 2-year warranty.Key Features:Weighs 12 ouncesMeasures 9.5 feet long by 4.5 feet wideSupports up to 250 poundsMade with polyester taffetaIncludes stainless steel S-hooks for easy hangingAttached stuff sack for easy storageMildew resistantDries quicklyEasy to hangManufacturer's WarrantyTwo-year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zQeVhaJZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIBJNS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AIFFM4", "title": "Grand Trunk Single Parachute Nylon Hammock", "description": "Tired of sleeping on uncomfortable tent floors? Want a cozy spot to tape a nap after a seven-mile hike? Turn to the single parachute nylon hammock, a portable hammock that packs easily and sets up in less than a minute. The hammock is made of high-strength parachute nylon silk, with 3x stitching on all weight-bearing points. As a result, it can hold up to 400 pounds, giving you plenty of support whether sleeping alone or hanging out with a friend.The hammock sets up just about anywhere.It's also generously sized at 10.5 feet long by 5 feet wide (52.5 total square feet), making it the largest single parachute hammock on the market. Best of all, the hammock offers a trail weight of 1 pound and stuffs tightly into an attached stuff sack. Compact and versatile, it performs equally well at the campsite or in the backyard.The hammock is easy to set up thanks to the included stainless-steel S-hooks and two pieces of 10-foot, pre-knotted 4.5 mm accessory rope. As a bonus, the quick-drying nylon material is mildew-resistant, so it won't rot when sitting in long-term storage. All Travel Hammock hammocks carry a 10-year warranty.Key Features:Weighs 16 ouncesMeasures 10 feet, 6 inches long by 5 feet wideSupports up to 400 poundsHigh-strength parachute nylon silkIncludes stainless steel S-hooks for easy hanging3x stitching on all weight bearing pointsAttached stuff sack for easy storageMildew resistantQuick-dry nylonEasy to hangManufacturer's WarrantyTen-year warranty", "text": "Grand Trunk Single Parachute Nylon Hammock Tired of sleeping on uncomfortable tent floors? Want a cozy spot to tape a nap after a seven-mile hike? Turn to the single parachute nylon hammock, a portable hammock that packs easily and sets up in less than a minute. The hammock is made of high-strength parachute nylon silk, with 3x stitching on all weight-bearing points. As a result, it can hold up to 400 pounds, giving you plenty of support whether sleeping alone or hanging out with a friend.The hammock sets up just about anywhere.It's also generously sized at 10.5 feet long by 5 feet wide (52.5 total square feet), making it the largest single parachute hammock on the market. Best of all, the hammock offers a trail weight of 1 pound and stuffs tightly into an attached stuff sack. Compact and versatile, it performs equally well at the campsite or in the backyard.The hammock is easy to set up thanks to the included stainless-steel S-hooks and two pieces of 10-foot, pre-knotted 4.5 mm accessory rope. As a bonus, the quick-drying nylon material is mildew-resistant, so it won't rot when sitting in long-term storage. All Travel Hammock hammocks carry a 10-year warranty.Key Features:Weighs 16 ouncesMeasures 10 feet, 6 inches long by 5 feet wideSupports up to 400 poundsHigh-strength parachute nylon silkIncludes stainless steel S-hooks for easy hanging3x stitching on all weight bearing pointsAttached stuff sack for easy storageMildew resistantQuick-dry nylonEasy to hangManufacturer's WarrantyTen-year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319augXZ3wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIFFM4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AIFLX2", "title": "Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock", "description": "FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock Grey No-See-Um Mesh Triple Stitching Double Sided Zipper Net Suspension Kit Included Two Inside Storage Pockets SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock Dimension: (L x W): 10'6\" x 5' Weight: 28 oz Capacity: 400 lbs 100% Polyester Nylon Nutical Grade Carabiners", "text": "Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock Grey No-See-Um Mesh Triple Stitching Double Sided Zipper Net Suspension Kit Included Two Inside Storage Pockets SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Skeeter Beeter Pro Hammock Dimension: (L x W): 10'6\" x 5' Weight: 28 oz Capacity: 400 lbs 100% Polyester Nylon Nutical Grade Carabiners", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xunYqxg2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIFLX2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AIHFUO", "title": "Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack", "description": "FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack Split Sides Adds 10 Degrees of Warmth Pillow Pocket Stuff Sack Included SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack 100% Premium Silk The SPECS for Single Dimension: (L x W): 84\" x 36\" Weight: 5 oz Capacity: 1 Persons The SPECS for Double Dimension: (L x W): 84\" x 68\" Weight: 9 oz Capacity: 2 Persons", "text": "Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack Split Sides Adds 10 Degrees of Warmth Pillow Pocket Stuff Sack Included SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Silk Sleep Sack 100% Premium Silk The SPECS for Single Dimension: (L x W): 84\" x 36\" Weight: 5 oz Capacity: 1 Persons The SPECS for Double Dimension: (L x W): 84\" x 68\" Weight: 9 oz Capacity: 2 Persons", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cxp0tXiKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIHFUO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AITVN8", "title": "Serfas Dorado Bicycle Saddle", "description": "Serfas' Performance saddles bring together unique combinations of patented Dual Density bases and specific covers to offer unparalleled comfort, efficiency, and durability.", "text": "Serfas Dorado Bicycle Saddle Serfas' Performance saddles bring together unique combinations of patented Dual Density bases and specific covers to offer unparalleled comfort, efficiency, and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d9VbvVX7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AITVN8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AIX6KM", "title": "Spring Loaded Full Metal Gear Pistol Airsoft Gun.", "description": "THIS GUN IS NOT FULL METAL. Only certain parts of the exterior and interior are metal. The rest is high quality ABS plastic. 200 fps w/ 0.12g BBs and effective range of 50-100 feet. Best handgun for backyard fun shooting target speed competition.", "text": "Spring Loaded Full Metal Gear Pistol Airsoft Gun. THIS GUN IS NOT FULL METAL. Only certain parts of the exterior and interior are metal. The rest is high quality ABS plastic. 200 fps w/ 0.12g BBs and effective range of 50-100 feet. Best handgun for backyard fun shooting target speed competition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SXfQmz1ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AIX6KM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 8.52}}
{"item_id": "B001AJ1AV8", "title": "Wordlock CL-411-BK 4-Letter Combination Bike Lock Cable, Black, 5-Feet", "description": "Wordlock Cable Bike Locks provide maximum security against theft with a heavy duty flexible steel cable. With 10,000 different letter combinations, you can pick words that are easy for you to remember but next to impossible for anyone to guess. The password is easy to set, with a twist of the dial, and you can change your password whenever you want. Since all our locks are weatherproof, they can stand up to the toughest environments. It is perfect for securing your bike as well as locking up items around the house, the garage, the construction site or the farm. And it makes an ideal gift, too. Forget confusing number combinations! Wordlock offers the only products that use the natural preference of your memory for keywords and the alphabet to create word combinations. Our patented Wordlock technology combines the best mix of vowels and consonants on the rotating letter dials. From the occasional need for extra peace of mind to the brute strength required to secure expensive equipment and cherished possessions, Wordlock has you covered. Security, creativity and usability come together in the original family of Wordlock padlocks, bike locks, travel locks, cable locks, sports locks, and maximum-security utility locks. Because what good is a lock if you cannot remember the combination?", "text": "Wordlock CL-411-BK 4-Letter Combination Bike Lock Cable, Black, 5-Feet Wordlock Cable Bike Locks provide maximum security against theft with a heavy duty flexible steel cable. With 10,000 different letter combinations, you can pick words that are easy for you to remember but next to impossible for anyone to guess. The password is easy to set, with a twist of the dial, and you can change your password whenever you want. Since all our locks are weatherproof, they can stand up to the toughest environments. It is perfect for securing your bike as well as locking up items around the house, the garage, the construction site or the farm. And it makes an ideal gift, too. Forget confusing number combinations! Wordlock offers the only products that use the natural preference of your memory for keywords and the alphabet to create word combinations. Our patented Wordlock technology combines the best mix of vowels and consonants on the rotating letter dials. From the occasional need for extra peace of mind to the brute strength required to secure expensive equipment and cherished possessions, Wordlock has you covered. Security, creativity and usability come together in the original family of Wordlock padlocks, bike locks, travel locks, cable locks, sports locks, and maximum-security utility locks. Because what good is a lock if you cannot remember the combination?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wlqcm6qNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AJ1AV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wordlock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 13.57}}
{"item_id": "B001ALRXFI", "title": "3Skull Paintball Tactical Milsim Airsoft Weaver Grip & Bipod", "description": "Description Push Button Bipod is spring loaded and made out of military grade plastic. Awesome upgrade for the Sniper. Push a button and the legs extend out 3-1/2\". Also is a grip for your paintball gun, length of grip is 5\". So total length is 8-1/2\". This Bipod will fit any paintball gun or airsoft that has weaver rails. Works really good for the X7, Ariakon, BT TM15, US Army Carver One, etc.", "text": "3Skull Paintball Tactical Milsim Airsoft Weaver Grip & Bipod Description Push Button Bipod is spring loaded and made out of military grade plastic. Awesome upgrade for the Sniper. Push a button and the legs extend out 3-1/2\". Also is a grip for your paintball gun, length of grip is 5\". So total length is 8-1/2\". This Bipod will fit any paintball gun or airsoft that has weaver rails. Works really good for the X7, Ariakon, BT TM15, US Army Carver One, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310kFr6NpuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ALRXFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball"]], "price": 9.6}}
{"item_id": "B001ALT69O", "title": "Red & Black Shock Wave Oval Focus Mitts", "description": "These punching mitts are made from synthetic leather. They are 12'' long, 8'' wide and 2.5'' thick for extra shock absorbing. Easy closing with Velcro wrist strap. This is for a pair (2) of pads.NOTE: Not all the pads in our current stock have a white dot in the center of the striking surface.Very strong and well made. These are the exact same focus mitts as our black ones - just a slightly flashier color.", "text": "Red & Black Shock Wave Oval Focus Mitts These punching mitts are made from synthetic leather. They are 12'' long, 8'' wide and 2.5'' thick for extra shock absorbing. Easy closing with Velcro wrist strap. This is for a pair (2) of pads.NOTE: Not all the pads in our current stock have a white dot in the center of the striking surface.Very strong and well made. These are the exact same focus mitts as our black ones - just a slightly flashier color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u7KAwGJ0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ALT69O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]], "price": 48.99}}
{"item_id": "B001ALYQ8K", "title": "Manhattan Portage Large Shoulder Pad", "description": "", "text": "Manhattan Portage Large Shoulder Pad", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xiSNzpYNL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ALYQ8K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories"]], "price": 14.46}}
{"item_id": "B001AMZXQI", "title": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Mossberg 500, 590 and 590Da", "description": "[if gte mso 9]> <![endif]The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun.Please note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend as the forend will be too long and will contact the sidesaddle, affecting functionality. If you do not wish to modify the forend, we recommend the Tacstar 4-Shot Sidesaddle.Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "text": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Mossberg 500, 590 and 590Da [if gte mso 9]> <![endif]The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun.Please note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend as the forend will be too long and will contact the sidesaddle, affecting functionality. If you do not wish to modify the forend, we recommend the Tacstar 4-Shot Sidesaddle.Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MS6HW-lzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AMZXQI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 29.25}}
{"item_id": "B001AN7NK6", "title": "Optimus Crux Lite Stove", "description": "FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove One of the world's lightest stoves - only 72 grams Similar to best selling Crux but does not fold as flat Powerful and stable 3000W burner (precise simmering and fast boiling) The lightweight that boils water fast, but won't spot burn while simmering SPECIFICATIONS of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove Fuel: LP-gas 75/25 butane/propane Weight: 2.5 oz / 72 g Measurements: 71 x 57 x 56 mm / 2.8 x 2.2 x 2.2\" Rating: 3000 W / 10200 BTU BTU Burn time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Boil time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Optimus Crux Lite Stove FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove One of the world's lightest stoves - only 72 grams Similar to best selling Crux but does not fold as flat Powerful and stable 3000W burner (precise simmering and fast boiling) The lightweight that boils water fast, but won't spot burn while simmering SPECIFICATIONS of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove Fuel: LP-gas 75/25 butane/propane Weight: 2.5 oz / 72 g Measurements: 71 x 57 x 56 mm / 2.8 x 2.2 x 2.2\" Rating: 3000 W / 10200 BTU BTU Burn time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Boil time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fAzj1rZDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AN7NK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 35.92}}
{"item_id": "B001ANBNUW", "title": "Optimus Terra", "description": "The OPTIMUS TERRA is more than just a hard-anodized aluminum cook set! Including an ultralight hard anodized aluminum cook set with pour spout and measuring marks, this cook set additionally features a fry pan lid and mesh bag.", "text": "Optimus Terra The OPTIMUS TERRA is more than just a hard-anodized aluminum cook set! Including an ultralight hard anodized aluminum cook set with pour spout and measuring marks, this cook set additionally features a fry pan lid and mesh bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bb0j56E9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ANBNUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 29.95}}
