{"item_id": "B001ANPCSQ", "title": "Kelty TripTease LightLine - Reflective Cord", "description": "Kelty TripTease LightLine is 50 ft. of reflective 3M Scotchlite(tm) yarns with a gold color that really stands out in the light or dark. When dark, it looks like a laser beam, when light is shined on it. The Dyneema core gives it a superiorbreaking strength, with a weight of only 1 oz. per 50 ft. Recommended for guylines only. Diameter - 3mm.", "text": "Kelty TripTease LightLine - Reflective Cord Kelty TripTease LightLine is 50 ft. of reflective 3M Scotchlite(tm) yarns with a gold color that really stands out in the light or dark. When dark, it looks like a laser beam, when light is shined on it. The Dyneema core gives it a superiorbreaking strength, with a weight of only 1 oz. per 50 ft. Recommended for guylines only. Diameter - 3mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c4ajyGKgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ANPCSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B001ANQVXQ", "title": "Sawyer Products Premium MAXI-DEET Insect Repellent Spray", "description": "Sawyer's Maxi Deet Repellent is for areas of extreme bug density. You can rely on this 100% DEET spray for application to skin, clothing, and mosquito or head nets. Exclusive low-odor formula protects exposed skin areas against mosquitoes, chiggers, fleas, gnats and ticks. Airline approved sizes.", "text": "Sawyer Products Premium MAXI-DEET Insect Repellent Spray Sawyer's Maxi Deet Repellent is for areas of extreme bug density. You can rely on this 100% DEET spray for application to skin, clothing, and mosquito or head nets. Exclusive low-odor formula protects exposed skin areas against mosquitoes, chiggers, fleas, gnats and ticks. Airline approved sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NSShhxXhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ANQVXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001ANQVYU", "title": "Sawyer Permethrin Clothing and Fabric Insect Repellent Trigger Spray", "description": "FEATURES of the Sawyer Permethrin Clothing and Fabric Insect Repellent Trigger Spray For use on clothing, tents, and other gear Not only repel insects, they actually kill ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other kinds of insects on contact When applied to clothing, Permethrin binds to the fabric eliminating the risk of over-exposure to the skin Odorless when dry, and will not stain or damage clothing, fabrics, plastics, finished surfaces, or any of your outdoor gear A single application lasts 6 washings", "text": "Sawyer Permethrin Clothing and Fabric Insect Repellent Trigger Spray FEATURES of the Sawyer Permethrin Clothing and Fabric Insect Repellent Trigger Spray For use on clothing, tents, and other gear Not only repel insects, they actually kill ticks, mosquitoes, chiggers, mites and more than 55 other kinds of insects on contact When applied to clothing, Permethrin binds to the fabric eliminating the risk of over-exposure to the skin Odorless when dry, and will not stain or damage clothing, fabrics, plastics, finished surfaces, or any of your outdoor gear A single application lasts 6 washings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415imqY8BZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ANQVYU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]]}}
