{"item_id": "B001ANZJW0", "title": "Coghlans 36 HOURS SURVIVAL CANDLE,6 OZ", "description": "Coghlan's 9248 Survival Candle - Three wicks allow variable light and heat. Burning time is 36 hours using one wick at a time or 12 hours using three at once. Includes 1 book of matches.", "text": "Coghlans 36 HOURS SURVIVAL CANDLE,6 OZ Coghlan's 9248 Survival Candle - Three wicks allow variable light and heat. Burning time is 36 hours using one wick at a time or 12 hours using three at once. Includes 1 book of matches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WuoFxd61L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ANZJW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 6.25}}
{"item_id": "B001AO1QXK", "title": "Coghlan's Mosquito Coil - 10 Coils", "description": "Repels mosquitoes. Quick working mosquito repellent. Each mosquito coil lasts 8 hours. Active ingredient: 0.25% d-cis trans allethrin.", "text": "Coghlan's Mosquito Coil - 10 Coils Repels mosquitoes. Quick working mosquito repellent. Each mosquito coil lasts 8 hours. Active ingredient: 0.25% d-cis trans allethrin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FaNbCrF-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AO1QXK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 4.84}}
{"item_id": "B001AO2NU0", "title": "Guyot Designs Squishy Bowl and Cup Set", "description": "Collapsible for easy packing, yet made to retain their shape, these bowls are perfect for hot and cold foods on-the-go. Made of flexible food grade silicone. Temperature resistant to 400 Degree F. Easy clean-up – hand wash using soap and water.", "text": "Guyot Designs Squishy Bowl and Cup Set Collapsible for easy packing, yet made to retain their shape, these bowls are perfect for hot and cold foods on-the-go. Made of flexible food grade silicone. Temperature resistant to 400 Degree F. Easy clean-up – hand wash using soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NPxgraWFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AO2NU0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guyot Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Bowls"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AOEN94", "title": "Sea to Summit Alloy Pocket Trowel", "description": "The Sea to Summit iPOOd! is a super strong and very lightweight full-size camp trowel designed to support the Leave No Trace ethic of minimizing backcountry impact by humans. The iPOOd! redefines the camp trowel with its collapsible, carry-anywhere design and heaps of extra features. The perfect tool for backcountry or outback travel.", "text": "Sea to Summit Alloy Pocket Trowel The Sea to Summit iPOOd! is a super strong and very lightweight full-size camp trowel designed to support the Leave No Trace ethic of minimizing backcountry impact by humans. The iPOOd! redefines the camp trowel with its collapsible, carry-anywhere design and heaps of extra features. The perfect tool for backcountry or outback travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31btKkAfzLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AOEN94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B001APJZ50", "title": "Lowepro Flipside 400 AW Backpack (Black)", "description": "Flipside 400 AWManufacturer Description:Flipside 400 AW is a high-performance backpack designed for extra security, easy access and all-weather protection. Its unique back-entry compartment provides easy access to camera gear when setting up (keeping harness off the ground and clean), plus extra security when on the move. Main compartment secures a professional DSLR, attached zoom lens, plus multiple accessories. The premium set of features includes: Hideaway Tripod Holder, Hypalon SlipLock attachment loops, memory card pockets, and built-in All Weather Cover. Perfect for the traveling photographer who needs to keep expensive gear securely tucked away, yet close at hand to capture the shot in a moment.Hardware Capacity:Up to a Pro DSLR with attached 300mm f/2.8 (most makes), additional body and 4-6 additional lenses, charger and cords, filters, flash unit and 3 memory cards. Flipside 400 AW Highlights:1. Contoured Shoulder Strap with Padded Waist BeltEvenly distributes weight and provides exceptional comfort2. Unique Back Compartment EntryOffers easy access to gear and added security while wearing3. All Weather CoverOffers maximum protection against rain, dust and sand4. Hideaway Tripod HolderSecure a tripod to the pack5. Memory Card PocketsQuickly find memory cards in the same place every time6. Silent Zipper PullsProvide quiet access around film crews or wildlife7. Stretch Mesh Side PocketsKeep water bottles and other personal items within easy reach8. Front Storage PanelProvides quick access to cables, adaptors, small accessories or personal items9. SlipLock Attachment LoopsAdd SlipLock compatible products to customize your pack", "text": "Lowepro Flipside 400 AW Backpack (Black) Flipside 400 AWManufacturer Description:Flipside 400 AW is a high-performance backpack designed for extra security, easy access and all-weather protection. Its unique back-entry compartment provides easy access to camera gear when setting up (keeping harness off the ground and clean), plus extra security when on the move. Main compartment secures a professional DSLR, attached zoom lens, plus multiple accessories. The premium set of features includes: Hideaway Tripod Holder, Hypalon SlipLock attachment loops, memory card pockets, and built-in All Weather Cover. Perfect for the traveling photographer who needs to keep expensive gear securely tucked away, yet close at hand to capture the shot in a moment.Hardware Capacity:Up to a Pro DSLR with attached 300mm f/2.8 (most makes), additional body and 4-6 additional lenses, charger and cords, filters, flash unit and 3 memory cards. Flipside 400 AW Highlights:1. Contoured Shoulder Strap with Padded Waist BeltEvenly distributes weight and provides exceptional comfort2. Unique Back Compartment EntryOffers easy access to gear and added security while wearing3. All Weather CoverOffers maximum protection against rain, dust and sand4. Hideaway Tripod HolderSecure a tripod to the pack5. Memory Card PocketsQuickly find memory cards in the same place every time6. Silent Zipper PullsProvide quiet access around film crews or wildlife7. Stretch Mesh Side PocketsKeep water bottles and other personal items within easy reach8. Front Storage PanelProvides quick access to cables, adaptors, small accessories or personal items9. SlipLock Attachment LoopsAdd SlipLock compatible products to customize your pack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GrTjAgNwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001APJZ50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lowepro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 123.67}}
