{"item_id": "B001AQ4HLG", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Belt Pouch Holster", "description": "These clever concealment pouches allow you to carry “hidden in plain sight.” Designed to mimic a camera or tourist pouch, each has a top zipper opening that can remain open or closed with your handgun hidden behind a hook and loop flap. A separate pocket on the front of the pouch holds keys, cuffs, ID, or change and is an ideal spot for a camera, company patch, or other “corporate camouflage.” Dual belt loops fit any belt up to 2” wide. Mini Belt Pouch Holster: 8”L x 5 1/2”H x 1 5/8”D and fits 2” 5-shot revolvers and subcompact autos Large belt Pouch Holster: 8 1/2”W x 7”H x 1 5/8”D and fits medium/large-frame autos and 3” revolvers", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Belt Pouch Holster These clever concealment pouches allow you to carry “hidden in plain sight.” Designed to mimic a camera or tourist pouch, each has a top zipper opening that can remain open or closed with your handgun hidden behind a hook and loop flap. A separate pocket on the front of the pouch holds keys, cuffs, ID, or change and is an ideal spot for a camera, company patch, or other “corporate camouflage.” Dual belt loops fit any belt up to 2” wide. Mini Belt Pouch Holster: 8”L x 5 1/2”H x 1 5/8”D and fits 2” 5-shot revolvers and subcompact autos Large belt Pouch Holster: 8 1/2”W x 7”H x 1 5/8”D and fits medium/large-frame autos and 3” revolvers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hQ71qAeUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AQ4HLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 35.71}}
{"item_id": "B001AQ5RXS", "title": "Blackhawk Rubber Grip Sleeve", "description": "Add extra grip and padding to any pistol grip stock. Constructed of comfortable, soft rubber with intergrated finger groves. Great accessory for the SpecOps Stock, SpecOps NRS, SpecOps Folder, BreachersGrip, Axiom UL and the Axiom RF. Easy installation.", "text": "Blackhawk Rubber Grip Sleeve Add extra grip and padding to any pistol grip stock. Constructed of comfortable, soft rubber with intergrated finger groves. Great accessory for the SpecOps Stock, SpecOps NRS, SpecOps Folder, BreachersGrip, Axiom UL and the Axiom RF. Easy installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NhhzxLK8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AQ5RXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 15.52}}
