{"item_id": "B001AQ9838", "title": "Large Extreme Pak InvisibleTM Pattern Camouflage Backpack", "description": "Features multiple pockets with zippered closures and adjustable straps for extra security. Measures 34 inch x 13 inch. Limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Large Extreme Pak InvisibleTM Pattern Camouflage Backpack Features multiple pockets with zippered closures and adjustable straps for extra security. Measures 34 inch x 13 inch. Limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gxJDN3E6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AQ9838.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vista", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 41.72}}
{"item_id": "B001AQJO46", "title": "Castelli Pro Gloves - Men's", "description": "If you like the smooth lines of aero gloves, but appreciate the ease of entry and exit of traditional gloves, Castelli Pro Glove is your bag. The back stretches and breathes well, and it has a nose wipe on the thumb and Castelli's Scorpion logo on the back of the hand. Flip it over, check out the palm, and you'll see the hidden Velcro closure at the wrist covering a smartly designed pull tab. Above that, you'll see the hardy silicone patches stitched on top of gel pads on the Ultrasuede palm. Sleek, stylish, smart, 100% Castelli. The Castelli Pro Gloves come in Black and Red/white. Sizes run from Small to XX-Large.", "text": "Castelli Pro Gloves - Men's If you like the smooth lines of aero gloves, but appreciate the ease of entry and exit of traditional gloves, Castelli Pro Glove is your bag. The back stretches and breathes well, and it has a nose wipe on the thumb and Castelli's Scorpion logo on the back of the hand. Flip it over, check out the palm, and you'll see the hidden Velcro closure at the wrist covering a smartly designed pull tab. Above that, you'll see the hardy silicone patches stitched on top of gel pads on the Ultrasuede palm. Sleek, stylish, smart, 100% Castelli. The Castelli Pro Gloves come in Black and Red/white. Sizes run from Small to XX-Large.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Hmv2F5ZFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AQJO46.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AQK0EO", "title": "Diamond Plate Genuine Buffalo Leather Biker Vest", "description": "Size 2 Extra Large, Diamond Plate Rock design genuine buffalo leather construction, Leather side laces, (4) slash pockets, (14) embroidered, pre-sewn-on patches, Designs may vary--our choice only", "text": "Diamond Plate Genuine Buffalo Leather Biker Vest Size 2 Extra Large, Diamond Plate Rock design genuine buffalo leather construction, Leather side laces, (4) slash pockets, (14) embroidered, pre-sewn-on patches, Designs may vary--our choice only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jgNcA-I4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AQK0EO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
