{"item_id": "B001AT4Q9Q", "title": "Caldwell The Rock Deluxe Front Rifle Rest", "description": "The best way to determine the accuracy of your rifle and ammunition is to shoot them from a solid bench -- with a quality shooting rest. With precise repeatability of shots as your goal,The Rock Deluxe Front Rest is the right tool for the job. The Rock helps eliminate the \"human factor\" in shooting and will help you shoot tighter groups.", "text": "Caldwell The Rock Deluxe Front Rifle Rest The best way to determine the accuracy of your rifle and ammunition is to shoot them from a solid bench -- with a quality shooting rest. With precise repeatability of shots as your goal,The Rock Deluxe Front Rest is the right tool for the job. The Rock helps eliminate the \"human factor\" in shooting and will help you shoot tighter groups.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41smunIB84L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AT4Q9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 74.98}}
{"item_id": "B001AT4Z1U", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Load Bearing Suspenders/Harness (Straps Only)", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Load Bearing Suspenders/Harness is a wrap around belt loop system with H-harness. The Harness features drag handles sternum strap and no metal attachment clips. Belt not included.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Load Bearing Suspenders/Harness (Straps Only) The BLACKHAWK! Load Bearing Suspenders/Harness is a wrap around belt loop system with H-harness. The Harness features drag handles sternum strap and no metal attachment clips. Belt not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O2H9yZTgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AT4Z1U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AT6S7O", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 30 Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-30 replaces the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on a Glock 30 magazine. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides extra length for better control and comfort. This extension will NOT fit the Glock M29 magazine.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits GLOCK Model 30 Grip Extension The Pearce PG-30 replaces the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on a Glock 30 magazine. It does not alter the capacity of the magazine and provides extra length for better control and comfort. This extension will NOT fit the Glock M29 magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c8sWhdUCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AT6S7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.18}}
