{"item_id": "B001AUL0O4", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 4 x 15 Scope (Black, 4 x 15)", "description": "This Daisy rifle scope provides 4x magnification with a 15-millimeter objective lens for accurate targeting. The scope features a cross-hair aiming reticle and is adjustable for windage and elevation. Built to last, the scope boasts fog and shockproof construction and is color corrected. The 4x15 scope fits standard 3/8-inch dovetail mounts.Please not: this scope is not recommended for use with break-action (break-barrel) rifles.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 4 x 15 Scope (Black, 4 x 15) This Daisy rifle scope provides 4x magnification with a 15-millimeter objective lens for accurate targeting. The scope features a cross-hair aiming reticle and is adjustable for windage and elevation. Built to last, the scope boasts fog and shockproof construction and is color corrected. The 4x15 scope fits standard 3/8-inch dovetail mounts.Please not: this scope is not recommended for use with break-action (break-barrel) rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uwOK4CO8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AUL0O4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B001AV3STS", "title": "SE Tent Peg with Green Stopper (10PK)", "description": "These 10\" tent stakes make the perfect replacement or upgrade from the plastic stakes that come with most tents. The galvanized steel provides corrosion resistance and the stout 8mm diameter insures that the stakes will not bend. The colorful T top allows for easy visibility of the outer area of your tent which can often be tripped over at night when the sun dips low leaving your tent lines less easily visible.", "text": "SE Tent Peg with Green Stopper (10PK) These 10\" tent stakes make the perfect replacement or upgrade from the plastic stakes that come with most tents. The galvanized steel provides corrosion resistance and the stout 8mm diameter insures that the stakes will not bend. The colorful T top allows for easy visibility of the outer area of your tent which can often be tripped over at night when the sun dips low leaving your tent lines less easily visible.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51en22Tty3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AV3STS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 8.66}}
{"item_id": "B001AWFGDI", "title": "Allen Company Knit Gun Sock fits Guns with Large Scopes (52 inch)", "description": "Guide Gear Silicone Treated Gun Socks, SAVE BIG! Keep your favorite firearm safe! 100% stretch polyester; Drawstring meets legal gun case requirements; Impregnated silicone fabric. Stock up! Order yours today! Stretches 9\" to fit over most assault rifles with scopes. Actual product length is 54-inches, designed to accommodate long guns that are upto 52-inches long.", "text": "Allen Company Knit Gun Sock fits Guns with Large Scopes (52 inch) Guide Gear Silicone Treated Gun Socks, SAVE BIG! Keep your favorite firearm safe! 100% stretch polyester; Drawstring meets legal gun case requirements; Impregnated silicone fabric. Stock up! Order yours today! Stretches 9\" to fit over most assault rifles with scopes. Actual product length is 54-inches, designed to accommodate long guns that are upto 52-inches long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d-oAtzBBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AWFGDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 12.38}}
