{"item_id": "B001AYWXEQ", "title": "RCBS Model 505 Reloading Scale", "description": "The legendary standard in mechanical scales. The 5-0-5 features our magnetic dampening system plus large black on white graduation s for fast recognition. Its three poise bean is graduated in 10, one and 0.1 grain increments to achieve +/- 0.1 accuracy. A tip proof aluminum pan keeps powder from sticking or spilling. Hardened knife blades ride on agate bearings for long life and sensitivity.", "text": "RCBS Model 505 Reloading Scale The legendary standard in mechanical scales. The 5-0-5 features our magnetic dampening system plus large black on white graduation s for fast recognition. Its three poise bean is graduated in 10, one and 0.1 grain increments to achieve +/- 0.1 accuracy. A tip proof aluminum pan keeps powder from sticking or spilling. Hardened knife blades ride on agate bearings for long life and sensitivity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WHjVfyQ-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AYWXEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 86.99}}
{"item_id": "B001AYYEY8", "title": "Big Agnes Insulated Air Core Sleeping Pad", "description": "Turn your campsite from Spartan to snug with the insulated Air Core sleeping pad from Big Agnes--a pad that's so light you'll never tire of carrying it, and so comfortable you may need an alarm clock.The insulated Air Core includes a non-breakable brass valve and an EZ-Flate mouthpiece.The insulated Air Core is built to last, with a durable nylon top and bottom (nylon diamond ripstop in the case of 20-inch-thick pads) and a sturdy I-beam construction that eliminates welded seams. The I-beam design offers several benefits: minimized cold spots, a consistent airflow, and extra stability while you sleep. The pad is also warmer than most sleeping pads, with a temperature rating down to 15 degrees F. That's because the pad is insulated with either PrimaLoft Eco insulation (20-inch pads) or M3 synthetic insulation (25-inch pads). PrimaLoft Eco is a particularly good choice for consumers, as the insulation is made using 50 percent recycled materials. Should the temperature still feel too chilly, you can add a closed cell foam pad to bump up the pad's coziness.The insulated Air Core is a breeze to inflate thanks to the plastic-coated EZ-Flate mouthpiece, which includes a non-breakable brass valve. To inflate, simply twist the black part of the valve counter-clockwise and blow. You can rest assured that the pad won't leak when you bring it home, as each Air Core is individually inflated and tested. And should you eventually need to patch a leak, you can turn to the repair kit, which is located in a small pocket on the inside of the stuff sack.The pad, which also includes an internal polyurethane coating, comes in four sizes.SpecificationsSmall: 20 by 66 by 2.5 inches, weighs 22 ouncesMedium: 20 by 72 by 2.5 inches, weighs 24 ouncesLong: 20 by 78 by 2.5 inches, weighs 27 ouncesLong/wide: 25 by 78 by 2.5 inches, weighs 2 pounds 4 ouncesAbout Big AgnesBig Agnes is either a rocky peak in the Mt. Zirkel Wilderness Area outside of Colorado's Steamboat Springs, a laid-back mountain-town mama, or dependable backcountry gear, depending on whom you ask. The Big Agnes founders think it represents a little bit of each and everything in between. The folks at Big Agnes have spent a lot of time in the Colorado backcountry, giving them a deep appreciation of local history, places, peaks, and rivers. From the Cross Mountain, named after a Yampa River canyon known for classic Class IV/V whitewater, to the Encampment, one of the country's most scenic wilderness river runs, to more obvious choices like the Divide Series, the company names its products after some of the most fascinating landmarks in the region. The spring runoff near Steamboat is also pretty spectacular, so Big Agnes included a few favorite creeks to its name directory, including Sarvis, Deep, Mad, and Lost Dog. The fun product names complement a full catalog of well-constructed outdoor products, which include sleeping bags, tents, pads, duffels, and camping accessories.", "text": "Big Agnes Insulated Air Core Sleeping Pad Turn your campsite from Spartan to snug with the insulated Air Core sleeping pad from Big Agnes--a pad that's so light you'll never tire of carrying it, and so comfortable you may need an alarm clock.The insulated Air Core includes a non-breakable brass valve and an EZ-Flate mouthpiece.The insulated Air Core is built to last, with a durable nylon top and bottom (nylon diamond ripstop in the case of 20-inch-thick pads) and a sturdy I-beam construction that eliminates welded seams. The I-beam design offers several benefits: minimized cold spots, a consistent airflow, and extra stability while you sleep. The pad is also warmer than most sleeping pads, with a temperature rating down to 15 degrees F. That's because the pad is insulated with either PrimaLoft Eco insulation (20-inch pads) or M3 synthetic insulation (25-inch pads). PrimaLoft Eco is a particularly good choice for consumers, as the insulation is made using 50 percent recycled materials. Should the temperature still feel too chilly, you can add a closed cell foam pad to bump up the pad's coziness.The insulated Air Core is a breeze to inflate thanks to the plastic-coated EZ-Flate mouthpiece, which includes a non-breakable brass valve. To inflate, simply twist the black part of the valve counter-clockwise and blow. You can rest assured that the pad won't leak when you bring it home, as each Air Core is individually inflated and tested. And should you eventually need to patch a leak, you can turn to the repair kit, which is located in a small pocket on the inside of the stuff sack.The pad, which also includes an internal polyurethane coating, comes in four sizes.SpecificationsSmall: 20 by 66 by 2.5 inches, weighs 22 ouncesMedium: 20 by 72 by 2.5 inches, weighs 24 ouncesLong: 20 by 78 by 2.5 inches, weighs 27 ouncesLong/wide: 25 by 78 by 2.5 inches, weighs 2 pounds 4 ouncesAbout Big AgnesBig Agnes is either a rocky peak in the Mt. Zirkel Wilderness Area outside of Colorado's Steamboat Springs, a laid-back mountain-town mama, or dependable backcountry gear, depending on whom you ask. The Big Agnes founders think it represents a little bit of each and everything in between. The folks at Big Agnes have spent a lot of time in the Colorado backcountry, giving them a deep appreciation of local history, places, peaks, and rivers. From the Cross Mountain, named after a Yampa River canyon known for classic Class IV/V whitewater, to the Encampment, one of the country's most scenic wilderness river runs, to more obvious choices like the Divide Series, the company names its products after some of the most fascinating landmarks in the region. The spring runoff near Steamboat is also pretty spectacular, so Big Agnes included a few favorite creeks to its name directory, including Sarvis, Deep, Mad, and Lost Dog. The fun product names complement a full catalog of well-constructed outdoor products, which include sleeping bags, tents, pads, duffels, and camping accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ibuszG9NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AYYEY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AYYF1A", "title": "Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Sleeping Pad", "description": "FEATURES of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Superlight and Ultra-compact warm weather pads Welded construction Durable and lightweight polyurethane material Stuff sack included Each pad individually inflated and tested SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Temperature Rating: 35° F / 2° C Thickness: 2.5\" / 6 cm R-Value: 1.5 Insulation: Air Polyurethane Valve: Durable inflation valve SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 66\" / 51 x 168 cm Weight: 14 oz / 397 g Rolled Size: 2 x 10\" / 5 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 72\" / 51 x 183 cm Weight: 15 oz / 425 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 78\" / 51 x 198 cm Weight: 17 oz / 482 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 25 x 78\" / 64 x 198 cm Weight: 20 oz / 567 g Rolled Size: 3 x 10\" / 8 x 25 cm", "text": "Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Sleeping Pad FEATURES of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Superlight and Ultra-compact warm weather pads Welded construction Durable and lightweight polyurethane material Stuff sack included Each pad individually inflated and tested SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Temperature Rating: 35° F / 2° C Thickness: 2.5\" / 6 cm R-Value: 1.5 Insulation: Air Polyurethane Valve: Durable inflation valve SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 66\" / 51 x 168 cm Weight: 14 oz / 397 g Rolled Size: 2 x 10\" / 5 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 72\" / 51 x 183 cm Weight: 15 oz / 425 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 20 x 78\" / 51 x 198 cm Weight: 17 oz / 482 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Rectangular 25 x 78\" / 64 x 198 cm Weight: 20 oz / 567 g Rolled Size: 3 x 10\" / 8 x 25 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o68TvXXdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AYYF1A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AYYF1K", "title": "Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Mummy Sleeping Pad", "description": "FEATURES of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Mummy Pad Superlight and Ultra-compact warm weather pads Welded construction Durable and lightweight polyurethane material Stuff sack included Each pad individually inflated and tested SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Mummy Pad Temperature Rating: 35° F / 2° C Thickness: 2.5\" / 6 cm R-Value: 1.5 Insulation: Air Polyurethane Valve: Durable inflation valve SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 60\" / 51 x 152 cm Weight: 11 oz / 312 g Rolled Size: 2 x 10\" / 5 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 72\" / 51 x 183 cm Weight: 14 oz / 397 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 78\" / 51 x 198 cm Weight: 15 oz / 425 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm", "text": "Big Agnes Clearview Air Pad Mummy Sleeping Pad FEATURES of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Mummy Pad Superlight and Ultra-compact warm weather pads Welded construction Durable and lightweight polyurethane material Stuff sack included Each pad individually inflated and tested SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Clearview Air Mummy Pad Temperature Rating: 35° F / 2° C Thickness: 2.5\" / 6 cm R-Value: 1.5 Insulation: Air Polyurethane Valve: Durable inflation valve SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 60\" / 51 x 152 cm Weight: 11 oz / 312 g Rolled Size: 2 x 10\" / 5 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 72\" / 51 x 183 cm Weight: 14 oz / 397 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm SPECIFICATIONS for Mummy 20 x 78\" / 51 x 198 cm Weight: 15 oz / 425 g Rolled Size: 2.5 x 10\" / 6 x 25 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MosJac7%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AYYF1K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Leg Warmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001AZ5YUA", "title": "Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Pillow Deluxe Pillow by Big Agnes", "description": "FEATURES of the Big Agnes Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Deluxe Pillow Pillows will fit inside Big Agnes sleeping bag pillow pocket Deluxe Pillow: Memory Foam, Air Pillow, Cover and Stuff Sack SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Deluxe Pillow Packed Size: 7.5 x 9 x 3\" / 19 x 23 x 8 cm Flat Size: 12 x 16 x 3.5\" / 30 x 41 x 9 cm Weight: 8.5 oz / 241 g", "text": "Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Pillow Deluxe Pillow by Big Agnes FEATURES of the Big Agnes Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Deluxe Pillow Pillows will fit inside Big Agnes sleeping bag pillow pocket Deluxe Pillow: Memory Foam, Air Pillow, Cover and Stuff Sack SPECIFICATIONS of the Big Agnes Sleeping Giant Memory Foam Deluxe Pillow Packed Size: 7.5 x 9 x 3\" / 19 x 23 x 8 cm Flat Size: 12 x 16 x 3.5\" / 30 x 41 x 9 cm Weight: 8.5 oz / 241 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sGhjxJZwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZ5YUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Big Agnes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AZHFGQ", "title": "Coghlan's LED Micro Lantern", "description": "The Coghlan's LED Micro Lantern uses a specially designed conical reflector and a bright Nichia 5mm LED to illuminate everything within a 6.5' (2m) diameter. It's the perfect tent or walking lantern and it fits in the palm of your hand.Attaches to your pack or jacket for the ultimate in portable light.", "text": "Coghlan's LED Micro Lantern The Coghlan's LED Micro Lantern uses a specially designed conical reflector and a bright Nichia 5mm LED to illuminate everything within a 6.5' (2m) diameter. It's the perfect tent or walking lantern and it fits in the palm of your hand.Attaches to your pack or jacket for the ultimate in portable light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rZOw-vsnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZHFGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001AZJ08C", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger SP101 Rubber Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger SP101 Rubber Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F7b15nzpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZJ08C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 17.47}}
{"item_id": "B001AZLNVY", "title": "CUSCUS 75+10L 5400ci Internal Frame Camping Hiking Travel Backpack", "description": "New internal frame backpack with a capacity of 5,400 cubic inches or 75 liters. Two front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. Two side stretch pockets for water-bottle and accessory. Pockets are 8. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Frame is aluminum, removable. Fits torso is 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hips is 30 - 59 inches.", "text": "CUSCUS 75+10L 5400ci Internal Frame Camping Hiking Travel Backpack New internal frame backpack with a capacity of 5,400 cubic inches or 75 liters. Two front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials or raingear. Two side stretch pockets for water-bottle and accessory. Pockets are 8. Extra webbing holders for attaching additional gear to outside of pack. PVC coated internal provides excellent water protection. Frame is aluminum, removable. Fits torso is 15 - 21.5 inches. Fits waist hips is 30 - 59 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XpB9aYx0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZLNVY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001AZMH46", "title": "Halt Dog Repellant Spray", "description": "Irritating spray, produces 12 stream. Please note: This item can only be shipped ground. It cannot be shipped to an APO, FPO, Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Canada, Guam or Internationally. For other areas, if you have ordered multiple items and select Air shipment, you will receive two shipmen.", "text": "Halt Dog Repellant Spray Irritating spray, produces 12 stream. Please note: This item can only be shipped ground. It cannot be shipped to an APO, FPO, Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Canada, Guam or Internationally. For other areas, if you have ordered multiple items and select Air shipment, you will receive two shipmen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dRL1doh3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZMH46.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 5.75}}
{"item_id": "B001AZNATC", "title": "Outdoor Products 3-Pack Ultimate Dry Sack", "description": "Dry sacks designed to protect the contents from the elements. The Outdoor Products Ultimate Dry Sack comes in a 3-pack so you'll have the right size on hand to protect your gear. Polyurethane-coated fabric combines with a watertight roll top closure and taped seams to keep water out (not intended for full submersion).Double stitched with watertight taped seams..Roll top allows maximum compression..Not intended for full submersion..Dimensions: 6.75in. Dia x 10.75in. W x 22in. H / 9.5in. W x 15.5in. H / 7.75in. W x 13in. H..", "text": "Outdoor Products 3-Pack Ultimate Dry Sack Dry sacks designed to protect the contents from the elements. The Outdoor Products Ultimate Dry Sack comes in a 3-pack so you'll have the right size on hand to protect your gear. Polyurethane-coated fabric combines with a watertight roll top closure and taped seams to keep water out (not intended for full submersion).Double stitched with watertight taped seams..Roll top allows maximum compression..Not intended for full submersion..Dimensions: 6.75in. Dia x 10.75in. W x 22in. H / 9.5in. W x 15.5in. H / 7.75in. W x 13in. H..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q2i-UbWgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZNATC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Strength Trainers"]], "price": 16.42}}
{"item_id": "B001AZNAWY", "title": "Outdoor Products Large Watertight Box (Clear)", "description": "What is your adventure? Whether it's kayaking through rapids, sailing the open sea, fishing or just spending the day at the beach with the family- remember to keep your gear protected from the elements. Our translucent, multi-purpose, watertight box is the perfect solution to protecting your valuables from the elements.", "text": "Outdoor Products Large Watertight Box (Clear) What is your adventure? Whether it's kayaking through rapids, sailing the open sea, fishing or just spending the day at the beach with the family- remember to keep your gear protected from the elements. Our translucent, multi-purpose, watertight box is the perfect solution to protecting your valuables from the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H6HmXvHXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001AZNAWY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Fly Boxes & Storage"]]}}
