{"item_id": "B001B059QI", "title": "Aqua Signal LED Portable Stern Light (Suction Cup Mount)", "description": "Designed for boats that are manually powered or with speeds up to 7 knots, this portable LED stern light from Aqua Signal is ideal for use with inflatables, kayaks, canoes, dinghies, and jon boats. This all-around white light uses a side-emitting luxeon super 1 W LED bulb and it features a shock-resistant, black neoprene housing that floats. It comes with a suction cup mount, enabling you to move it from one boat to another. It's powered by 4 AA batteries (not included).", "text": "Aqua Signal LED Portable Stern Light (Suction Cup Mount) Designed for boats that are manually powered or with speeds up to 7 knots, this portable LED stern light from Aqua Signal is ideal for use with inflatables, kayaks, canoes, dinghies, and jon boats. This all-around white light uses a side-emitting luxeon super 1 W LED bulb and it features a shock-resistant, black neoprene housing that floats. It comes with a suction cup mount, enabling you to move it from one boat to another. It's powered by 4 AA batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PbkC2B2AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B059QI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Signal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Navigation Lights"]], "price": 29.87}}
{"item_id": "B001B06C6E", "title": "Michelin A1 AirSTOP Butyl Road Bike Tube - Presta Valve - Yellow/Blue Box", "description": "Economical high-quality inner tube. 0.9mm wall thickness provides greater resistance to punctures & pinch flats than light weight tubes. Smooth valve. 93 grams.", "text": "Michelin A1 AirSTOP Butyl Road Bike Tube - Presta Valve - Yellow/Blue Box Economical high-quality inner tube. 0.9mm wall thickness provides greater resistance to punctures & pinch flats than light weight tubes. Smooth valve. 93 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51A%2BpPeaCHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B06C6E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001B06VQK", "title": "Aqua Signal LED Portable Bow Light (C-Clamp/Suction)", "description": "Designed for boats that are manually powered or with speeds up to 7 knots, this portable LED bow light from Aqua Signal is ideal for use with inflatables, kayaks, canoes, dinghies, and jon boats. This bi-colored light uses a side-emitting luxeon super 1 W LED bulb and it features a shock-resistant, black neoprene housing that floats. It also offers a rubber-coated on/off switch. It comes with a \"C\" clamp and suction cup mount, enabling you to move it from one boat to another, and the light is powered by 4 AA batteries (not included).", "text": "Aqua Signal LED Portable Bow Light (C-Clamp/Suction) Designed for boats that are manually powered or with speeds up to 7 knots, this portable LED bow light from Aqua Signal is ideal for use with inflatables, kayaks, canoes, dinghies, and jon boats. This bi-colored light uses a side-emitting luxeon super 1 W LED bulb and it features a shock-resistant, black neoprene housing that floats. It also offers a rubber-coated on/off switch. It comes with a \"C\" clamp and suction cup mount, enabling you to move it from one boat to another, and the light is powered by 4 AA batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51czIoSoEOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B06VQK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Signal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Navigation Lights"]], "price": 34.73}}
