{"item_id": "B001B16ZSI", "title": "Victorinox Cybertool Lite Translucent Ruby Multi-Tool", "description": "A wide array of practical tools are all housed in a stylish, transparent casing.The versatility of Swiss Army's popular CyberTool 34 has been miniaturized with the new CyperTool Lite. A practical tool with style to spare, the CyberTool Lite includes an eye-catching, transparent, ruby-hued casing, and its tool list includes:Large and small bladesLarge and small screwdriversFour-millimeter flatheadPatented mini screwdriverCorkscrew and bottle openerWire stripper, cutter, and crimperReamer and scissorsKey ring, tweezers, toothpick, and sewing eyeBit wrenchFour- and five-millimeter hex sockets#0 and #1 Pozidrive bitsFour-millimeter hex bit#8, #10, and #15 Torx bitsBit casePressurized ball point penDip switch setterStraight pinPliersMulti-purpose hookWhite LED flashlightFive-to-eight-X magnifying lensLifetime Limited WarrantyThe SwissTool comes complete with the peace of mind of Victorinox's famous Swiss Army Knife lifetime warranty. Victorinox guarantees all Swiss Army Knives to be of first-class steel, and provides a lifetime warranty against any defects in material and workmanship.The Original Swiss Army KnifeIn 1897, the Original Swiss Army Knife was created in the small village of Ibach, Switzerland. Since that time, Victorinox has become well-known in more than 100 countries for precision, quality, functionality, and versatility, and over 34,000 pocket tools with the distinctive Swiss cross leave the factory in central Switzerland each day.The Victorinox Swiss Army knife even orbits the earth as part of the standard equipment of the Space Shuttle Crew, and the knife has been successfully proven on expeditions to the arctic ice of the North Pole, on Mount Everest, in the tropical rain forests of the Amazon, and similarly challenging environs the world over. Time and again, it has been an invaluable tool.", "text": "Victorinox Cybertool Lite Translucent Ruby Multi-Tool A wide array of practical tools are all housed in a stylish, transparent casing.The versatility of Swiss Army's popular CyberTool 34 has been miniaturized with the new CyperTool Lite. A practical tool with style to spare, the CyberTool Lite includes an eye-catching, transparent, ruby-hued casing, and its tool list includes:Large and small bladesLarge and small screwdriversFour-millimeter flatheadPatented mini screwdriverCorkscrew and bottle openerWire stripper, cutter, and crimperReamer and scissorsKey ring, tweezers, toothpick, and sewing eyeBit wrenchFour- and five-millimeter hex sockets#0 and #1 Pozidrive bitsFour-millimeter hex bit#8, #10, and #15 Torx bitsBit casePressurized ball point penDip switch setterStraight pinPliersMulti-purpose hookWhite LED flashlightFive-to-eight-X magnifying lensLifetime Limited WarrantyThe SwissTool comes complete with the peace of mind of Victorinox's famous Swiss Army Knife lifetime warranty. Victorinox guarantees all Swiss Army Knives to be of first-class steel, and provides a lifetime warranty against any defects in material and workmanship.The Original Swiss Army KnifeIn 1897, the Original Swiss Army Knife was created in the small village of Ibach, Switzerland. Since that time, Victorinox has become well-known in more than 100 countries for precision, quality, functionality, and versatility, and over 34,000 pocket tools with the distinctive Swiss cross leave the factory in central Switzerland each day.The Victorinox Swiss Army knife even orbits the earth as part of the standard equipment of the Space Shuttle Crew, and the knife has been successfully proven on expeditions to the arctic ice of the North Pole, on Mount Everest, in the tropical rain forests of the Amazon, and similarly challenging environs the world over. Time and again, it has been an invaluable tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YGImDxWcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B16ZSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 115.95}}
