{"item_id": "B001B3QLGW", "title": "Benchmade Design Nimravus Tanto Knife", "description": "The fixed blade Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has a large finger groove and textured handle to give you comfort in the hand and the control you need. Able to maintain it's edge, this Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has blade resilience you can count on. Made to last, this Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has been coated to be non reflective and corrosion resistant. This Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife includes a sheath that has MOLLE capabilities too.", "text": "Benchmade Design Nimravus Tanto Knife The fixed blade Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has a large finger groove and textured handle to give you comfort in the hand and the control you need. Able to maintain it's edge, this Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has blade resilience you can count on. Made to last, this Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife has been coated to be non reflective and corrosion resistant. This Benchmade Nimravus Tanto Knife includes a sheath that has MOLLE capabilities too.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UdMNFB6fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B3QLGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 157.25}}
{"item_id": "B001B3U3OS", "title": "Set of 20 Disc Cones Bright Orange", "description": "No coach should be without marking cones, an essential at no matter what level you coach. At this price no coach can do without. Bright orange, they can be used for many activities and games. Use for drills, sideline/boundary markers, obstacles, targets. 2\" high, set of 20. Stackable for easy storage.", "text": "Set of 20 Disc Cones Bright Orange No coach should be without marking cones, an essential at no matter what level you coach. At this price no coach can do without. Bright orange, they can be used for many activities and games. Use for drills, sideline/boundary markers, obstacles, targets. 2\" high, set of 20. Stackable for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-Hac0E49L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B3U3OS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Training Equipment", "Training Cones"]], "price": 8.9}}
