{"item_id": "B001B4Q0WG", "title": "Hammock Bliss Tree Straps-Hang Your Hammock With Ease", "description": "Hammock Bliss Tree Straps make it a breeze to set up Hammock Bliss anywhere. Tree Straps are a tree friendly suspension system and extend the distance for hanging your Hammock Bliss hammock. Tree Straps allow you to hang your hammock on trees or sturdy objects up to 20 feet apart and protect the tender bark of trees by evenly distributing weight over a wider area. Tree Straps are completely adjustable and are ideal for quick set up and fast take down of your hammock. Tree Straps are the ultimate hammock accessory for camping, backpacking, hunting, traveling, backyards, decks and patios.", "text": "Hammock Bliss Tree Straps-Hang Your Hammock With Ease Hammock Bliss Tree Straps make it a breeze to set up Hammock Bliss anywhere. Tree Straps are a tree friendly suspension system and extend the distance for hanging your Hammock Bliss hammock. Tree Straps allow you to hang your hammock on trees or sturdy objects up to 20 feet apart and protect the tender bark of trees by evenly distributing weight over a wider area. Tree Straps are completely adjustable and are ideal for quick set up and fast take down of your hammock. Tree Straps are the ultimate hammock accessory for camping, backpacking, hunting, traveling, backyards, decks and patios.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GbKSXCsAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B4Q0WG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B001B4QVMA", "title": "Soft Air Thompson M1A1 Full-Metal Body AEG airsoft gun", "description": "An incredibly detailed and lifelike replica, the weapon features the original metal construction, wood handle and stock, and bolt action controls.This replica Thompson M1AI is part of an exclusive \"Guns of History\" collection, consisting of authentic airsoft replica weapons. A full metal, one-to-one scale of the original, it's intended for use with heavier weight six-millimeter, 20-gram BBs only.About the Original ThompsonThe Thompson submachine gun was designed by General John T. Thompson, who was inspired by the trench warfare of World War I to develop a one-man, hand-held machine gun firing a rifle caliber round. In 1938, the Thompson was adopted by the U.S. military, serving during World War II and later into the Korean War, as well as early stages of the Vietnam War. Other Allied countries purchased the Thompson as well, notably the United Kingdom and France. Modifications to simplify production and reduce cost were made in 1942, resulting in the M1 and M1A1 models, which were commonly carried by both non-commissioned and commissioned officers.WarrantyThe Thompson M1AI includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Soft Air Thompson M1A1 Full-Metal Body AEG airsoft gun An incredibly detailed and lifelike replica, the weapon features the original metal construction, wood handle and stock, and bolt action controls.This replica Thompson M1AI is part of an exclusive \"Guns of History\" collection, consisting of authentic airsoft replica weapons. A full metal, one-to-one scale of the original, it's intended for use with heavier weight six-millimeter, 20-gram BBs only.About the Original ThompsonThe Thompson submachine gun was designed by General John T. Thompson, who was inspired by the trench warfare of World War I to develop a one-man, hand-held machine gun firing a rifle caliber round. In 1938, the Thompson was adopted by the U.S. military, serving during World War II and later into the Korean War, as well as early stages of the Vietnam War. Other Allied countries purchased the Thompson as well, notably the United Kingdom and France. Modifications to simplify production and reduce cost were made in 1942, resulting in the M1 and M1A1 models, which were commonly carried by both non-commissioned and commissioned officers.WarrantyThe Thompson M1AI includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vpClWb9wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B4QVMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thompson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 129.98}}
{"item_id": "B001B4SFHE", "title": "Gamo Round .22 Cal, 15.43 Grains, Lead Balls, 250ct", "description": "Perfectly formed round balls of pure lead are heavier than pellets and ideal for situations requiring lower velocity but high terminal energy. Perfect for metallic targets", "text": "Gamo Round .22 Cal, 15.43 Grains, Lead Balls, 250ct Perfectly formed round balls of pure lead are heavier than pellets and ideal for situations requiring lower velocity but high terminal energy. Perfect for metallic targets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512R9Z8%2BCAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B4SFHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B001B52RIQ", "title": "Skateboards T-TOOL ALL-IN-ONE TOOL Skateboards", "description": "This skate tool works with all types of skateboards and long boards. Tighten your trucks (bushings) Change wheels, clean/change your bearings Tighten your mounting hardware.. and more... Comes with Allen wrench/Phillip Bit.", "text": "Skateboards T-TOOL ALL-IN-ONE TOOL Skateboards This skate tool works with all types of skateboards and long boards. Tighten your trucks (bushings) Change wheels, clean/change your bearings Tighten your mounting hardware.. and more... Comes with Allen wrench/Phillip Bit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p7gH1eJGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B52RIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "[BLANKNYC]", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Tools"]], "price": 1.83}}
{"item_id": "B001B5I57I", "title": "Chill-Its 6602 Cooling Towel, Blue", "description": "Hot conditions are tough on workers and productivity. The Chill-Its Evaporative Series provides cooling through evaporation to keep workers comfortable all day long. This cost effective approach helps workers stay cool, fight fatigue, and increase productivity. And they're reusable - just resoak 'em and you're good to go. Our Chill-Its Cooling line is the best way to battle heat from the foundry to freeway. Evaporative cooling bandanas, headbands, triangle hats, and hard hat inserts keep cool comfort on tap for hours. No matter what the application, Chill-Its sees to it that cooler heads prevail.", "text": "Chill-Its 6602 Cooling Towel, Blue Hot conditions are tough on workers and productivity. The Chill-Its Evaporative Series provides cooling through evaporation to keep workers comfortable all day long. This cost effective approach helps workers stay cool, fight fatigue, and increase productivity. And they're reusable - just resoak 'em and you're good to go. Our Chill-Its Cooling line is the best way to battle heat from the foundry to freeway. Evaporative cooling bandanas, headbands, triangle hats, and hard hat inserts keep cool comfort on tap for hours. No matter what the application, Chill-Its sees to it that cooler heads prevail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wTYeVGsJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B5I57I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ergodyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Towels"]], "price": 7.76}}
{"item_id": "B001B5K6P2", "title": "Collapsible Tumblers", "description": "The Collapsible Tumblers from Coghlans are perfect to take along wherever you go. They have a strong construction and a protective cover to keep dirt out. Package has two 5 oz. collapsible cups. 341076 , Coghlans Collapsible Tumblers , cup , tumbler , collapsible cup , camping , backpacking , hydration", "text": "Collapsible Tumblers The Collapsible Tumblers from Coghlans are perfect to take along wherever you go. They have a strong construction and a protective cover to keep dirt out. Package has two 5 oz. collapsible cups. 341076 , Coghlans Collapsible Tumblers , cup , tumbler , collapsible cup , camping , backpacking , hydration", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IaycT4cYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B5K6P2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 2.5}}
{"item_id": "B001B62XHU", "title": "QuikClot Sport, Advanced Clotting Sponge 25G", "description": "QuikClot Sportbrand hemostatic agent is based on the same QuikClot brand hemostatic agent used by the US military, federal agencies, EMS, police and fire departments everywhere. Where ever there is blood, QuikClot brand hemostatic agents are saving lives! Whether you choose the original QuikClot Sport formula, or the QuikClot Sport Silver with antimicrobial properties, you can be certain that you have the most widely used and effective \"Over the Counter\" hemostatic agent available. Remove the QuikClot Sport from the package, apply to the wound using pressure and stop the bleeding fast. QuikClot Sport is ideal for schools, individual and team sports, wilderness medicine and even home use. This product is the perfect size for scalp lacerations or bleeding where a bandage is not enough. Every home first aid kit and sports athletic trainer’s first aid kit should contain QuikClot Sportbrand hemostatic.", "text": "QuikClot Sport, Advanced Clotting Sponge 25G QuikClot Sportbrand hemostatic agent is based on the same QuikClot brand hemostatic agent used by the US military, federal agencies, EMS, police and fire departments everywhere. Where ever there is blood, QuikClot brand hemostatic agents are saving lives! Whether you choose the original QuikClot Sport formula, or the QuikClot Sport Silver with antimicrobial properties, you can be certain that you have the most widely used and effective \"Over the Counter\" hemostatic agent available. Remove the QuikClot Sport from the package, apply to the wound using pressure and stop the bleeding fast. QuikClot Sport is ideal for schools, individual and team sports, wilderness medicine and even home use. This product is the perfect size for scalp lacerations or bleeding where a bandage is not enough. Every home first aid kit and sports athletic trainer’s first aid kit should contain QuikClot Sportbrand hemostatic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LpOf0ctQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B62XHU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B001B693DW", "title": "ProActive Deluxe Shoe Bag", "description": "The Delux Shoe Bag is made from 600 Denier polyester material with mesh panels for better air circulation. Separate zippered compartments. I.D. slot and separate pouches for personals.", "text": "ProActive Deluxe Shoe Bag The Delux Shoe Bag is made from 600 Denier polyester material with mesh panels for better air circulation. Separate zippered compartments. I.D. slot and separate pouches for personals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vjFM5P6fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B693DW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Shoe Bags"]], "price": 12.21}}
{"item_id": "B001B6CH0S", "title": "Grassroots Par Three Putting Green (3x9 Feet)", "description": "Hone your putting skills with this fun 3-by-9-foot putting green. The kidney-shaped green's three cups give you plenty of practice targets, while the built-in sand traps are designed to catch missed shots. The green also offers a high-quality putting surface designed to stay smooth over time.", "text": "Grassroots Par Three Putting Green (3x9 Feet) Hone your putting skills with this fun 3-by-9-foot putting green. The kidney-shaped green's three cups give you plenty of practice targets, while the built-in sand traps are designed to catch missed shots. The green also offers a high-quality putting surface designed to stay smooth over time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T6OEKfksL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6CH0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Putt-A-Bout", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Putting Mats"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001B6LFLU", "title": "100-Ft 550 Parachute Cord Military 7-Strand Camping Survival - COLOR MAY VARY", "description": "COLOR MAY VARY FROM PHOTOGRAPH. This is military spec parachute cord. This 550 cord has 7 strands in the core, with a tensile strength of 550-lbs. It is great for camping, tie downs, emergency and survival uses.", "text": "100-Ft 550 Parachute Cord Military 7-Strand Camping Survival - COLOR MAY VARY COLOR MAY VARY FROM PHOTOGRAPH. This is military spec parachute cord. This 550 cord has 7 strands in the core, with a tensile strength of 550-lbs. It is great for camping, tie downs, emergency and survival uses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UVo5iRJPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6LFLU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 8.49}}
{"item_id": "B001B6LFWE", "title": "550lbs. Military Paracord Type III Rope 100' Foliage Green", "description": "Foliage Green 550LB Type III Commercial Nylon Paracord Rope 100 Feet - Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. Constructed By A Certified US Government Contractor. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part Of Any Survival Kit. Type III Commercial Paracord. Enhanced GI Plus Parachute Cord & Is Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail. Has Multiple Uses & Can Be Used By Anyone. GSA Compliant. Color: Foliage Green Military Paracord. Size: 100 Feet Long.THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "text": "550lbs. Military Paracord Type III Rope 100' Foliage Green Foliage Green 550LB Type III Commercial Nylon Paracord Rope 100 Feet - Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. Constructed By A Certified US Government Contractor. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part Of Any Survival Kit. Type III Commercial Paracord. Enhanced GI Plus Parachute Cord & Is Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail. Has Multiple Uses & Can Be Used By Anyone. GSA Compliant. Color: Foliage Green Military Paracord. Size: 100 Feet Long.THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aQdnZ4iqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6LFWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B001B6LKXS", "title": "Park Tool FR-4 Freewheel Remover for Atom Freewheels", "description": "Fits Atom®, Regina®, splined Zeus®, and some Schwinn Approved® freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts.", "text": "Park Tool FR-4 Freewheel Remover for Atom Freewheels Fits Atom®, Regina®, splined Zeus®, and some Schwinn Approved® freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B-lQ2YD1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6LKXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B001B6LNRQ", "title": "Park Tool SPA-2 Cluster Cone Pin Spanner (Red)", "description": "The SPA-2, with red handle, will fit one-key release retaining rings on Shimano® and Campagnolo® cranksets and the adjusting cone on most freewheel clusters (not freehubs). Park Tool Pin Spanners have been designed to give maximum usefulness and versatility at the lowest possible cost. Adjusts to a wide range of pin hole widths. Pin diameter is nominally 0.090\" (2.3mm). Tough, high carbon tool steel is used on each tool to ensure long life. Handle is vinyl coated to give a good grip. Each Pin Spanner is color coated for easy recognition.", "text": "Park Tool SPA-2 Cluster Cone Pin Spanner (Red) The SPA-2, with red handle, will fit one-key release retaining rings on Shimano® and Campagnolo® cranksets and the adjusting cone on most freewheel clusters (not freehubs). Park Tool Pin Spanners have been designed to give maximum usefulness and versatility at the lowest possible cost. Adjusts to a wide range of pin hole widths. Pin diameter is nominally 0.090\" (2.3mm). Tough, high carbon tool steel is used on each tool to ensure long life. Handle is vinyl coated to give a good grip. Each Pin Spanner is color coated for easy recognition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QFQ2ygruL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6LNRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 8.54}}
{"item_id": "B001B6NC48", "title": "Park Tool FR-3 Freewheel Remover for Sun Tour 4 Pin Freewheels", "description": "Fits all Sun Tour four notch freewheels since 1986. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts. Always use a skewer or axle nut to hold tool in place for during removal.", "text": "Park Tool FR-3 Freewheel Remover for Sun Tour 4 Pin Freewheels Fits all Sun Tour four notch freewheels since 1986. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts. Always use a skewer or axle nut to hold tool in place for during removal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vJdbhk24L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6NC48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 11.66}}
{"item_id": "B001B6NEZU", "title": "Park Tool ST-3 Three-Way Socket Wrench", "description": "The three most common bolt and nut sizes are combined with the classic Park Tool 3-way ¿Y¿ body. 8mm, 9mm, and 10mm forged CR-V steel sockets.", "text": "Park Tool ST-3 Three-Way Socket Wrench The three most common bolt and nut sizes are combined with the classic Park Tool 3-way ¿Y¿ body. 8mm, 9mm, and 10mm forged CR-V steel sockets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kdcgtTWXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6NEZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 11.96}}
{"item_id": "B001B6NFH2", "title": "Park Tool TL-1 Tire Lever (Pack of 3)", "description": "Sold in sets of three, Park Tool Tire Levers are made of nylon to ensure long life and damage-free operation. The unique design of the TL-1 actually lifts the tire away from the rim and keeps the tube from being pinched. These blue levers are available carded (TL-1C), or in a 25-set counter display.", "text": "Park Tool TL-1 Tire Lever (Pack of 3) Sold in sets of three, Park Tool Tire Levers are made of nylon to ensure long life and damage-free operation. The unique design of the TL-1 actually lifts the tire away from the rim and keeps the tube from being pinched. These blue levers are available carded (TL-1C), or in a 25-set counter display.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t3YxhD2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6NFH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 5.35}}
{"item_id": "B001B6PGHY", "title": "Park Tool SPA-6 Adjustable Pin Spanner", "description": "This spanner uses hardened, replaceable pins approximately 2.2mm in diameter. Designed for heavy duty use, the distance between the pins is adjustable, allowing use on virtually all hanger cups using pin holes.", "text": "Park Tool SPA-6 Adjustable Pin Spanner This spanner uses hardened, replaceable pins approximately 2.2mm in diameter. Designed for heavy duty use, the distance between the pins is adjustable, allowing use on virtually all hanger cups using pin holes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tYDcdAuYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6PGHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 11.8}}
{"item_id": "B001B6RGXG", "title": "Park Tool FR-1 Freewheel Remover for Shimano Freewheels", "description": "Fits Shimano®, Sachs Aris®, and Sun Race® freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts.", "text": "Park Tool FR-1 Freewheel Remover for Shimano Freewheels Fits Shimano®, Sachs Aris®, and Sun Race® freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z1DKpm0-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6RGXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B001B6RGYU", "title": "Park Tool FR-2 Freewheel Remover for Sun Tour 2 Pin Freewheels", "description": "Fits older Sun Tour® two notch freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts. Not recommended for Sun Tour four to six notch freewheels.", "text": "Park Tool FR-2 Freewheel Remover for Sun Tour 2 Pin Freewheels Fits older Sun Tour® two notch freewheels. Heat treated alloy tool steel, one inch base fits wrench or bench vise. Thin wall construction allows use without removal of cones and locknuts. Not recommended for Sun Tour four to six notch freewheels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rIXj8v5yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6RGYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.06}}
{"item_id": "B001B6RJG0", "title": "Park Tool RBS-5 CM-5 Replacement Brush Set", "description": "The Cyclone Chain Scrubber brushes are replaceable. The RBS-5 brush set includes the large side scrubbing brush, two roller brushes, and two wicking foam blocks.", "text": "Park Tool RBS-5 CM-5 Replacement Brush Set The Cyclone Chain Scrubber brushes are replaceable. The RBS-5 brush set includes the large side scrubbing brush, two roller brushes, and two wicking foam blocks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DY8GqnIlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6RJG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 9.44}}
{"item_id": "B001B6RJXI", "title": "Park Tool SPA-1 Hanger Cup Pin Spanner (Green)", "description": "The green handled SPA-1 fits adjusting cup on many adjustable type bottom brackets. The pin ends are round with a diameter of 2.9mm. Park Tool Pin Spanners have been designed to give maximum usefulness and versatility at the lowest possible cost. Tough, high carbon tool steel is used on each tool to ensure long life. Handle is vinyl coated to give a good grip. Each Pin Spanner is color coated for easy recognition.", "text": "Park Tool SPA-1 Hanger Cup Pin Spanner (Green) The green handled SPA-1 fits adjusting cup on many adjustable type bottom brackets. The pin ends are round with a diameter of 2.9mm. Park Tool Pin Spanners have been designed to give maximum usefulness and versatility at the lowest possible cost. Tough, high carbon tool steel is used on each tool to ensure long life. Handle is vinyl coated to give a good grip. Each Pin Spanner is color coated for easy recognition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jaGjSnWHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6RJXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.96}}
{"item_id": "B001B6Z0WK", "title": "Uncle Mike's Neoprene Buttstock Shotgun Shell Holder (Black, 5 Loops)", "description": "Uncle Mike's Shell holder, 5, Shotgun 88493", "text": "Uncle Mike's Neoprene Buttstock Shotgun Shell Holder (Black, 5 Loops) Uncle Mike's Shell holder, 5, Shotgun 88493", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UPMfCMn0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B6Z0WK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.64}}
{"item_id": "B001B70WO0", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-04G Black Folding Work Knife with Razor Sharp Edge Blade", "description": "M21-04G G10 Work Knife made by Columbia River Knife and Tool has a 3.875-Inch 8Cr14 stainless steel Razor Sharp Edge blade in a swedged, recurved spear point design with a non-reflective black titanium nitride finish. This folding knife has an InterFrame build with stainless steel liner and G10 scales. It features the Carson Flipper blade extension and the patented AutoLawks system.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-04G Black Folding Work Knife with Razor Sharp Edge Blade M21-04G G10 Work Knife made by Columbia River Knife and Tool has a 3.875-Inch 8Cr14 stainless steel Razor Sharp Edge blade in a swedged, recurved spear point design with a non-reflective black titanium nitride finish. This folding knife has an InterFrame build with stainless steel liner and G10 scales. It features the Carson Flipper blade extension and the patented AutoLawks system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316q2zlFBaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B70WO0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.96}}
{"item_id": "B001B72W0C", "title": "Bianchi Patroltek 8002 Hidden Snap Stagerred Double Magazine Pouch (Size 2)", "description": "Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "text": "Bianchi Patroltek 8002 Hidden Snap Stagerred Double Magazine Pouch (Size 2) Bianchi is pleased to offer you the PatrolTek brand of duty accessories - a line of products for the professional that provide significant cost savings over premium brands, yet also offer a considerable improvement over similarly priced products on the market. With the current budget trends, law enforcement agencies often must make price an important part of their purchasing decisions. At Bianchi we have spent forty-seven years making top quality products and we don't believe making compromises in quality vs. price is something agencies should have to do. It's got to be good if it's got our name on it. With PatrolTek you'll be hard pressed to find a better value anywhere! Only from Bianchi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411uZoIya3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B72W0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Monadnock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.09}}
{"item_id": "B001B732VU", "title": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Kydex Clip-On Accessory Tactical Light Holder", "description": "Uncle Mike's Kydex Accessories - Clip-on Tactical Light Holder 5030-1", "text": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Kydex Clip-On Accessory Tactical Light Holder Uncle Mike's Kydex Accessories - Clip-on Tactical Light Holder 5030-1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sGELgGj%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B732VU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 10.66}}
{"item_id": "B001B7ZB4Q", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Quick-N-Ez Impact Bullet Puller", "description": "When you need to pull some bullets, for whatever reason, an impact-style tool is the easiest method. Just one stern “whack” and the bullet is separated from the brass. It is as easy as that. Three different collets are included allowing you to pull bullets from just about every caliber from 22 Hornet to 45-70, whether rimmed or rimless. Versatility like that makes this bullet puller the only one to have. Don’t wait until you need it!", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Quick-N-Ez Impact Bullet Puller When you need to pull some bullets, for whatever reason, an impact-style tool is the easiest method. Just one stern “whack” and the bullet is separated from the brass. It is as easy as that. Three different collets are included allowing you to pull bullets from just about every caliber from 22 Hornet to 45-70, whether rimmed or rimless. Versatility like that makes this bullet puller the only one to have. Don’t wait until you need it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GRYMh-izL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B7ZB4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.88}}
{"item_id": "B001B7ZTRU", "title": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Glock 26 / 27 / 33, BLACK, RH", "description": "BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology... with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! Its patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Springfield XD; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 19 / 23 / 32 / 36; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 17 / 22 / 31 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 26 / 27 / 33", "text": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Glock 26 / 27 / 33, BLACK, RH BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology... with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! Its patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Springfield XD; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 19 / 23 / 32 / 36; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 17 / 22 / 31 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Glock 26 / 27 / 33", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kjwDLx5YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B7ZTRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 43.44}}
{"item_id": "B001B80Q0Y", "title": "United Cutlery 8 Sword Wall Display Stand, Black", "description": "8-up sword stand. Wood with black finish. Dimensions are 15.5 in. by 3.5 in. by 39.88 in.", "text": "United Cutlery 8 Sword Wall Display Stand, Black 8-up sword stand. Wood with black finish. Dimensions are 15.5 in. by 3.5 in. by 39.88 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-q3sYF8tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B80Q0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapon Stands"]], "price": 25.39}}
{"item_id": "B001B850LY", "title": "Cold Steel Bowie Blade Bushman, Black SK-5 Steel, Cordura Survival Shth", "description": "The Cold Steel Bushman is an affordable, reliable outdoor survival knife with a blade that's been carefully ground to extra-thin edge, and honed and buffed by hand . Unlike most hollow handled survival knives, there is no joint or seam between the blades and handles that requires a mechanical fastener. Instead, the blade and integral handle are each expertly cold forged out of a single piece of 2.5-millimeter thick SK-5 high carbon steel, and the resulting knife is heat-treated and tempered to RC54 and tested to withstand more than two tons of pressure on the blade/handle transition.A durable Cor-Ex sheath is also included.For added versatility, the hollow handle accepts survival supplies or a variety of handle extensions which can maximize reach, leverage, or ease of throwing. A continuously curved blade is ideal for skinning, and will pierce, cut, slash, slice, and shear. A durable, heavy-duty Cor-Ex Survival sheath with front utility pocket is also included.SpecificationsSeven-inch blade length2.5-millimeter blade thickness12.25-inch overall length10.1-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Bowie Blade Bushman, Black SK-5 Steel, Cordura Survival Shth The Cold Steel Bushman is an affordable, reliable outdoor survival knife with a blade that's been carefully ground to extra-thin edge, and honed and buffed by hand . Unlike most hollow handled survival knives, there is no joint or seam between the blades and handles that requires a mechanical fastener. Instead, the blade and integral handle are each expertly cold forged out of a single piece of 2.5-millimeter thick SK-5 high carbon steel, and the resulting knife is heat-treated and tempered to RC54 and tested to withstand more than two tons of pressure on the blade/handle transition.A durable Cor-Ex sheath is also included.For added versatility, the hollow handle accepts survival supplies or a variety of handle extensions which can maximize reach, leverage, or ease of throwing. A continuously curved blade is ideal for skinning, and will pierce, cut, slash, slice, and shear. A durable, heavy-duty Cor-Ex Survival sheath with front utility pocket is also included.SpecificationsSeven-inch blade length2.5-millimeter blade thickness12.25-inch overall length10.1-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315cP7YyDYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B850LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.97}}
{"item_id": "B001B88VXI", "title": "Everlast Elite Adjustable Speedbag Platform", "description": "Unleash your inner athlete with the Everlast Elite Adjustable Speedbag Platform. This affordable, 24-inch board accommodates any size speedbag and is adjustable to suit your height using a convenient spring pin lock. The 1 inch thick strike board is perfect for training like a pro in the comfort of your own home. It comes complete with swivel and two brace boards for added support and stability and includes assembly hardware and full-end padding safety. You'll have to supply your own punching bag and the wall mounting hardware is easy to find at any hardware store.", "text": "Everlast Elite Adjustable Speedbag Platform Unleash your inner athlete with the Everlast Elite Adjustable Speedbag Platform. This affordable, 24-inch board accommodates any size speedbag and is adjustable to suit your height using a convenient spring pin lock. The 1 inch thick strike board is perfect for training like a pro in the comfort of your own home. It comes complete with swivel and two brace boards for added support and stability and includes assembly hardware and full-end padding safety. You'll have to supply your own punching bag and the wall mounting hardware is easy to find at any hardware store.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AWT77C7kL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B88VXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bag Accessories", "Speed Bag Platforms"]], "price": 70.17}}
