{"item_id": "B001B92OQC", "title": "SKB ATA Quad-Rifle Case", "description": "The 2SKB-5014 ATA Quad Rife Case is made to ATA 300 Category I specifications - the highest shipping container specification of the ATA. This case is molded from ultra-high density molecular weight polyethylene (the material specified by the U.S. military for cases and containers) and was designed to carry four rifles with SKB's trademarked \"bunk-bed\" padding and divider protection system. The 2SKB-5014 features SKB's unique Perfect Match Valance Bending System for a perfect seal. This case is weather resistant, stackable, and features bumper protected hardware and solid die case zinc locks, built-in Polymer wheels, and both carry and tow handles for easy transport.", "text": "SKB ATA Quad-Rifle Case The 2SKB-5014 ATA Quad Rife Case is made to ATA 300 Category I specifications - the highest shipping container specification of the ATA. This case is molded from ultra-high density molecular weight polyethylene (the material specified by the U.S. military for cases and containers) and was designed to carry four rifles with SKB's trademarked \"bunk-bed\" padding and divider protection system. The 2SKB-5014 features SKB's unique Perfect Match Valance Bending System for a perfect seal. This case is weather resistant, stackable, and features bumper protected hardware and solid die case zinc locks, built-in Polymer wheels, and both carry and tow handles for easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u4HC9LLsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B92OQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 259.92}}
{"item_id": "B001B97CY6", "title": "SKB ATA Large Double Rifle Case", "description": "The 2SKB-5009 ATA Double Rifle Case was designed to carry two rifles with SKB’s trademarked “bunk bed” storage system. The 2SKB-5009 is constructed of a HDPE shell with a weather resistant O-ring seal, and features TSA accepted unbreakable fiberglass reinforced nylon trigger release latches, a spring-loaded tow handle, and molded-in bumper protection to maximize impact resistance, as well as quiet glide heavy duty wheels for easy transport.", "text": "SKB ATA Large Double Rifle Case The 2SKB-5009 ATA Double Rifle Case was designed to carry two rifles with SKB’s trademarked “bunk bed” storage system. The 2SKB-5009 is constructed of a HDPE shell with a weather resistant O-ring seal, and features TSA accepted unbreakable fiberglass reinforced nylon trigger release latches, a spring-loaded tow handle, and molded-in bumper protection to maximize impact resistance, as well as quiet glide heavy duty wheels for easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518-YaljtEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001B97CY6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 213.6}}
{"item_id": "B001BA38KM", "title": "Catahoula Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine", "description": "Catahoula Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine is made from Type AA. This black netcoat treated twine is resistant to abrasion, oil, gasoline, mildew, rot, marine growth and most chemicals. Stiff and at times tacky from the treat this twine has excellent knotting qualities. Uses for this twine include trot line, decoy line, net making and mending, workshop, crafts, gardening, construction and commercial applications. Any place a high quality twisted nylon twine is needed this Tarred twine will fill the bill. #36 Specifications: Size: #36 Feet/Lb: 470 Approximate Tensile: 360 Diameter: .085 inches #48 Specifications: Size: #48 Feet/Lb: 335 Approximate Tensile: 430 Diameter: .103 inches #72 Specifications: Size: #72 Feet/Lb: 240 Approximate Tensile: 625 Diameter: .125 inches", "text": "Catahoula Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine Catahoula Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine is made from Type AA. This black netcoat treated twine is resistant to abrasion, oil, gasoline, mildew, rot, marine growth and most chemicals. Stiff and at times tacky from the treat this twine has excellent knotting qualities. Uses for this twine include trot line, decoy line, net making and mending, workshop, crafts, gardening, construction and commercial applications. Any place a high quality twisted nylon twine is needed this Tarred twine will fill the bill. #36 Specifications: Size: #36 Feet/Lb: 470 Approximate Tensile: 360 Diameter: .085 inches #48 Specifications: Size: #48 Feet/Lb: 335 Approximate Tensile: 430 Diameter: .103 inches #72 Specifications: Size: #72 Feet/Lb: 240 Approximate Tensile: 625 Diameter: .125 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yPc11QVIL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BA38KM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoy Accessories"]]}}
