{"item_id": "B001BA4CZW", "title": "Avery Outdoors Greenhead Gear Mossy Oak Break-up 12' Burlap", "description": "Avery Outdoors Greenhead Gear Mossy Oak Breakup Burlap is Great for Deer Stands, Turkey Blinds, Duck Blinds, Ground Blinds, ATV/Boat Covers and much more! This burlap measures 12 Feet x 54 Inches. It is non-glare and will not reflect UV light", "text": "Avery Outdoors Greenhead Gear Mossy Oak Break-up 12' Burlap Avery Outdoors Greenhead Gear Mossy Oak Breakup Burlap is Great for Deer Stands, Turkey Blinds, Duck Blinds, Ground Blinds, ATV/Boat Covers and much more! This burlap measures 12 Feet x 54 Inches. It is non-glare and will not reflect UV light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41533O0lacL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BA4CZW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Blinds"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BA527O", "title": "Duck Commander Camo Max Duck Call", "description": "Hand-tuned and tested by \"The Duck men,\" this Advantage MAX-4 HD call is the most versatile in the Duck Commander line. Has a precise hen mallard sound, blown soft or loud.", "text": "Duck Commander Camo Max Duck Call Hand-tuned and tested by \"The Duck men,\" this Advantage MAX-4 HD call is the most versatile in the Duck Commander line. Has a precise hen mallard sound, blown soft or loud.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Lrw-jhO8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BA527O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 26.21}}
{"item_id": "B001BAAM2Y", "title": "Benchmade Pardue Design Griptilian Combo Edge Knife with BK1 Coated Blade and Black Handle", "description": "Combining the unmatched functionality of an Axis locking mechanism with the simplicity of a molded handle design, the Benchmade Griptilian is a whole new species of knife. The Griptilian is equipped with a modified drop-point, combo-edge blade made of BK1-coated 154CM stainless steel. The Axis locking mechanism, meanwhile, is a longtime fan favorite. 100-percent ambidextrous, Axis derives its function from a small hardened steel bar that rides forward and back in a machined slot. With a simple thumb rotation, you'll unleash the Griptilian in a flash. Finally, the hand settles naturally over the Noryl GTX handle, which features a palm-swelled shape and textured skin.SpecificationsBlade: 154CM stainless steel with BK1 black coatingBlade hardness: 58 to 60 HRCBlade style: Modified drop point, combo edgePocket clip: Black, reversible, tip-upLock mechanism: AxisBlade length: 3.45 inchesBlade thickness: 0.115 inchesHandle thickness: 0.64 inchesClosed length: 4.62 inchesOverall length: 8.07 inchesWeight: 3.82 ounces", "text": "Benchmade Pardue Design Griptilian Combo Edge Knife with BK1 Coated Blade and Black Handle Combining the unmatched functionality of an Axis locking mechanism with the simplicity of a molded handle design, the Benchmade Griptilian is a whole new species of knife. The Griptilian is equipped with a modified drop-point, combo-edge blade made of BK1-coated 154CM stainless steel. The Axis locking mechanism, meanwhile, is a longtime fan favorite. 100-percent ambidextrous, Axis derives its function from a small hardened steel bar that rides forward and back in a machined slot. With a simple thumb rotation, you'll unleash the Griptilian in a flash. Finally, the hand settles naturally over the Noryl GTX handle, which features a palm-swelled shape and textured skin.SpecificationsBlade: 154CM stainless steel with BK1 black coatingBlade hardness: 58 to 60 HRCBlade style: Modified drop point, combo edgePocket clip: Black, reversible, tip-upLock mechanism: AxisBlade length: 3.45 inchesBlade thickness: 0.115 inchesHandle thickness: 0.64 inchesClosed length: 4.62 inchesOverall length: 8.07 inchesWeight: 3.82 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414fWj0XeiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BAAM2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 110.0}}
{"item_id": "B001BAAO2M", "title": "Big Game Deluxe Shooting Bench", "description": "The Deluxe Shooting Bench folds up compactly making it easy to transport and store. Bench top is 21 inches wide by 28 inches long. Seat has a 12 inch diameter by 1 inch thick, swivels 360 degrees, adjusts forward and back to accommodate shooters with various reaches. Seat height, 19 inches. Gunrest is versatile, accommodates all shooters, is adjustable to any position, coated with non-scratch rubber. Bench top cover includes padded vinyl, and 2 shell/gear pouches.", "text": "Big Game Deluxe Shooting Bench The Deluxe Shooting Bench folds up compactly making it easy to transport and store. Bench top is 21 inches wide by 28 inches long. Seat has a 12 inch diameter by 1 inch thick, swivels 360 degrees, adjusts forward and back to accommodate shooters with various reaches. Seat height, 19 inches. Gunrest is versatile, accommodates all shooters, is adjustable to any position, coated with non-scratch rubber. Bench top cover includes padded vinyl, and 2 shell/gear pouches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R2Sza2WWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BAAO2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BIG GAME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stand Accessories"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BAH0V0", "title": "TITLE Gel World Bag Gloves", "description": "Now with exclusive Gel Enforced Lining™ and multi-layered foam padding for the ultimate in style, performance, protection and power. Gel lining delivers an unbeatable layer of custom form fit and impact resistance. Friends, once you try these you will not go back to regular bag gloves again. All-leather outer with special hand compartment lining for cool, dry and comfortable wear. Awesome wraparound adjustable wrist strap with D-ring and hook-and-loop closure for secure fit.", "text": "TITLE Gel World Bag Gloves Now with exclusive Gel Enforced Lining™ and multi-layered foam padding for the ultimate in style, performance, protection and power. Gel lining delivers an unbeatable layer of custom form fit and impact resistance. Friends, once you try these you will not go back to regular bag gloves again. All-leather outer with special hand compartment lining for cool, dry and comfortable wear. Awesome wraparound adjustable wrist strap with D-ring and hook-and-loop closure for secure fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dorac5voL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BAH0V0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BBRQRM", "title": "Gregory Accessories Raincover", "description": "Our fully seam-taped raincover provides protection from the elements, and is available in five sizes to fit your fully loaded expedition packs or daypacks.", "text": "Gregory Accessories Raincover Our fully seam-taped raincover provides protection from the elements, and is available in five sizes to fit your fully loaded expedition packs or daypacks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gwnnEaYzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BBRQRM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories", "Pack Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BC1S3Y", "title": "Heckler and Koch Nitrous Blitz Tactical Folding Knife with Plain-Edged Blade (Satin, 8-Inch)", "description": "For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Heckler & Koch 14460 Nitrous Blitz Series knives are assisted opening tactical folder. The ambidextrous thumb studs and Nitrous Assist Opening mechanism ensure blade opening is fast and easy. The Nitrous Blitz features a premium American made Satin or Black BT2 coated 154 CM Stainless Steel Modified Clip Point blade that is super tough and holds a sharp edge, so it can handle any task you encounter. The knife has dual 6AL-4V Titanium Liners for the ultimate strength, and black G-10 scales for a secure grip in any conditions.", "text": "Heckler and Koch Nitrous Blitz Tactical Folding Knife with Plain-Edged Blade (Satin, 8-Inch) For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Heckler & Koch 14460 Nitrous Blitz Series knives are assisted opening tactical folder. The ambidextrous thumb studs and Nitrous Assist Opening mechanism ensure blade opening is fast and easy. The Nitrous Blitz features a premium American made Satin or Black BT2 coated 154 CM Stainless Steel Modified Clip Point blade that is super tough and holds a sharp edge, so it can handle any task you encounter. The knife has dual 6AL-4V Titanium Liners for the ultimate strength, and black G-10 scales for a secure grip in any conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314LR%2BiTwVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BC1S3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 86.65}}
{"item_id": "B001BC96Q0", "title": "SPYDERCO Endura 4 Lightweight Combination Edge Knife, Black", "description": "First introduced in 1990, the Spyderco Endura was one of the first lightweight, high-performance, one-hand-open pocketknives ever developed. A consistent best seller, it has evolved steadily over the years through Spyderco's CQI (Constant Quality Improvement) process. The Endura 4 features enhanced ergonomics, screw-together construction, and a four-position clip for versatile carry options. Its fiberglass reinforced nylon handles are molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for improved traction and control and are supported by dual skeletonized stainless steel liners. The liners increase structural strength without adding weight and provide a framework to anchor all external and internal components. Its VG-10 blade is flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. This version is also black titanium carbonitride coated to reduce reflection and provide increased corrosion resistance. Phosphor bronze washers ensure a smooth action, and textured jimping on the spine guarantees positive control during use.", "text": "SPYDERCO Endura 4 Lightweight Combination Edge Knife, Black First introduced in 1990, the Spyderco Endura was one of the first lightweight, high-performance, one-hand-open pocketknives ever developed. A consistent best seller, it has evolved steadily over the years through Spyderco's CQI (Constant Quality Improvement) process. The Endura 4 features enhanced ergonomics, screw-together construction, and a four-position clip for versatile carry options. Its fiberglass reinforced nylon handles are molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for improved traction and control and are supported by dual skeletonized stainless steel liners. The liners increase structural strength without adding weight and provide a framework to anchor all external and internal components. Its VG-10 blade is flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. This version is also black titanium carbonitride coated to reduce reflection and provide increased corrosion resistance. Phosphor bronze washers ensure a smooth action, and textured jimping on the spine guarantees positive control during use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j5AbosMuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BC96Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 67.46}}
{"item_id": "B001BCNTHC", "title": "Quikclot Sport Brand Advanced Clotting Sponge ,Stop Bleeding Fast, 50 Gram Package", "description": "QuikClot sport is a battlefield proven way to stop serious bleeding. An Advanced Clotting Sponge for stopping traumaticbleeding. FDA approved version is ready for every medicalkit. Silver is antibacterial and recommended if it will takeover 24 hours to get professional help.", "text": "Quikclot Sport Brand Advanced Clotting Sponge ,Stop Bleeding Fast, 50 Gram Package QuikClot sport is a battlefield proven way to stop serious bleeding. An Advanced Clotting Sponge for stopping traumaticbleeding. FDA approved version is ready for every medicalkit. Silver is antibacterial and recommended if it will takeover 24 hours to get professional help.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LJeUN3zFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BCNTHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Quikclot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 15.1}}
{"item_id": "B001BELDXM", "title": "Title Boxing MMA Deluxe Equipment Bag, Black", "description": "Ideal size for carrying all of your equipment, apparel and supplies, with room to spare. Sizzling 1260 ripstop honeycomb nylon is flashy but solid. Four extra-large zippered pockets are ideal for all training and travel needs. Full length C-shape top opening, two full size end wet/dry pockets, front center pocket, a water bottle pocket and a side holster for a bevy of options. Complete with padded hook-and-loop seatbelt nylon carry handles with fully adjustable and detachable padded shoulder strap. Free water bottle included.", "text": "Title Boxing MMA Deluxe Equipment Bag, Black Ideal size for carrying all of your equipment, apparel and supplies, with room to spare. Sizzling 1260 ripstop honeycomb nylon is flashy but solid. Four extra-large zippered pockets are ideal for all training and travel needs. Full length C-shape top opening, two full size end wet/dry pockets, front center pocket, a water bottle pocket and a side holster for a bevy of options. Complete with padded hook-and-loop seatbelt nylon carry handles with fully adjustable and detachable padded shoulder strap. Free water bottle included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Z8x2QGFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BELDXM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Title Boxing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts"]], "price": 29.46}}
{"item_id": "B001BFIGWM", "title": "WTB Speed V ProGel Saddle", "description": "WTB's best-selling model utilizes their shock-absorbing Soft-Shell elastomer frame and high-set padding to provide maximum comfort. The mid-width, mid-length size fits many riding and body types. Synthetic cover Progel ABR corners Usage - Recreational Mountain / Road Size - Mid-width x mid-length (142mm x 265mm) Rail - Satin steel Weight - 435g", "text": "WTB Speed V ProGel Saddle WTB's best-selling model utilizes their shock-absorbing Soft-Shell elastomer frame and high-set padding to provide maximum comfort. The mid-width, mid-length size fits many riding and body types. Synthetic cover Progel ABR corners Usage - Recreational Mountain / Road Size - Mid-width x mid-length (142mm x 265mm) Rail - Satin steel Weight - 435g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413mmwMh3uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BFIGWM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WTB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 44.94}}
{"item_id": "B001BFIHGM", "title": "WTB Pure V Pro Saddle", "description": "The Pure V features a distinctive drop nose design, wide whale-tail pedaling platform and an ergonomic contoured shape. This saddle also incorporates a Flex-Tuned shell with Comfort Zone cutouts. The Pure V is the saddle choice of free ride legends Wade Simmons and Thomas Vanderham. Synthetic cover DNA padding Usage - Mountain Size - Mid-width x long (145mm x 277mm) Rail - Nicro Weight - 250g", "text": "WTB Pure V Pro Saddle The Pure V features a distinctive drop nose design, wide whale-tail pedaling platform and an ergonomic contoured shape. This saddle also incorporates a Flex-Tuned shell with Comfort Zone cutouts. The Pure V is the saddle choice of free ride legends Wade Simmons and Thomas Vanderham. Synthetic cover DNA padding Usage - Mountain Size - Mid-width x long (145mm x 277mm) Rail - Nicro Weight - 250g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zlH6HlLkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BFIHGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WTB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 61.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BFZ350", "title": "Advanced Technology® SKS Monte Carlo Stock", "description": "The ATI SKS Monte Carlo Stock with Butt pad recoil impact is absorbed so shooting any load size can now be done with no pain being transferred to the shooter. Reduces the challenge of reacquiring the target by minimizing the weapons muzzle life. Remains flexible in extreme temperature. Eliminates the felt punch of the recoil. Removes limitations from spring and piston type recoil suppression systems. Has a 3M soft touch cheek rest pad for improved comfort when shooting. Scratch resistant and virtually indestructible. Checkered grip and forend. No gunsmithing. DuPont extreme temperature glass reinforced polymer.", "text": "Advanced Technology® SKS Monte Carlo Stock The ATI SKS Monte Carlo Stock with Butt pad recoil impact is absorbed so shooting any load size can now be done with no pain being transferred to the shooter. Reduces the challenge of reacquiring the target by minimizing the weapons muzzle life. Remains flexible in extreme temperature. Eliminates the felt punch of the recoil. Removes limitations from spring and piston type recoil suppression systems. Has a 3M soft touch cheek rest pad for improved comfort when shooting. Scratch resistant and virtually indestructible. Checkered grip and forend. No gunsmithing. DuPont extreme temperature glass reinforced polymer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ol1x8nz9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BFZ350.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technical International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 63.39}}
{"item_id": "B001BG7APA", "title": "United Cutlery Gil Hibben Small Competition Triple Thrower Set w/Leather Sheath", "description": "Each knife is made from a single piece 420 stainless steel and measures 8-1/2-Inch overall in length. They have an ergonomically designed handle to maximize grip for throwing, as well as to help the hand naturally grip the knife in the proper fashion for maximum accuracy and consistency in throwing. The three knife set comes sheathed together in a single sheath. These attractive knives are a good choice for anyone looking for a competition throwing knife.", "text": "United Cutlery Gil Hibben Small Competition Triple Thrower Set w/Leather Sheath Each knife is made from a single piece 420 stainless steel and measures 8-1/2-Inch overall in length. They have an ergonomically designed handle to maximize grip for throwing, as well as to help the hand naturally grip the knife in the proper fashion for maximum accuracy and consistency in throwing. The three knife set comes sheathed together in a single sheath. These attractive knives are a good choice for anyone looking for a competition throwing knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tO6Ddqv9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BG7APA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gil Hibben", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 31.43}}
{"item_id": "B001BGCM3K", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2903 Hissatsu Folding Knife", "description": "2903 Hissatsu Folder made by Columbia River Knife and Tool features a 3.875-Inch blade made from AUS 8 stainless steel that is finished with a non-reflective black Teflon coating. The shape of the blade is classic Samurai. The knife also features CRKT's patented OutBurst assisted opening mechanism and patented AutoLawks safety. It also has heavy-duty stainless steel liners and black textured Zytel scales. It is a knife that is built to last.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2903 Hissatsu Folding Knife 2903 Hissatsu Folder made by Columbia River Knife and Tool features a 3.875-Inch blade made from AUS 8 stainless steel that is finished with a non-reflective black Teflon coating. The shape of the blade is classic Samurai. The knife also features CRKT's patented OutBurst assisted opening mechanism and patented AutoLawks safety. It also has heavy-duty stainless steel liners and black textured Zytel scales. It is a knife that is built to last.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P-KxQKTpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BGCM3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 49.06}}
{"item_id": "B001BHEEC6", "title": "Crosman Semi-Auto Air Pistol", "description": "", "text": "Crosman Semi-Auto Air Pistol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N68H3heML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BHEEC6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 36.49}}
{"item_id": "B001BIZARI", "title": "Crank Brothers Speed Bicycle Tire Lever Tool", "description": "CrankBrothers Speed Lever Tool makes removing and replacing a bicycle tire quick, easy and safe -- and it does it much better than conventional bike tire irons. One side of the head looks like a conventional tire iron and is used to remove the tire. The other hooks over the rim to lever the tire back on after you patch it. The long handle portion is actually three telescoping sections that extend to allow snapping one end onto the axle to hold it in place while you rip the other end along the rim. Fits all wheel sizes and comes with a lifetime warranty. Specs: Weight - 31 grams; Length - Six inches; Material - Polycarbonate.", "text": "Crank Brothers Speed Bicycle Tire Lever Tool CrankBrothers Speed Lever Tool makes removing and replacing a bicycle tire quick, easy and safe -- and it does it much better than conventional bike tire irons. One side of the head looks like a conventional tire iron and is used to remove the tire. The other hooks over the rim to lever the tire back on after you patch it. The long handle portion is actually three telescoping sections that extend to allow snapping one end onto the axle to hold it in place while you rip the other end along the rim. Fits all wheel sizes and comes with a lifetime warranty. Specs: Weight - 31 grams; Length - Six inches; Material - Polycarbonate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Hfnu-v5gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BIZARI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BKVXKO", "title": "Coghlan's 12V DC Electric Air Pump", "description": "Coghlan's 12V DC Electric Air Pump plugs into any 12V DC outlet. Fills small to medium size inflateables quickly and easily. Handy in the boat, RV, or car, it comes with a 10' power cord and 3 valve adapters.", "text": "Coghlan's 12V DC Electric Air Pump Coghlan's 12V DC Electric Air Pump plugs into any 12V DC outlet. Fills small to medium size inflateables quickly and easily. Handy in the boat, RV, or car, it comes with a 10' power cord and 3 valve adapters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VYkbzQSrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BKVXKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 15.93}}
