{"item_id": "B001BN8ITU", "title": "Callaway Golf Iron Headcovers", "description": "Our Callaway Iron Headcovers feature 8 headcovers: 4-PW, X. They are made of a breathable fabric that reduces moisture build-up. They will fit both right or left handed clubs. Easy to put on and take off. Provides excellent protection for your iron clubs as well as your wood and hybrid shafts – while on the course or during travel. A great gift for any golfer.", "text": "Callaway Golf Iron Headcovers Our Callaway Iron Headcovers feature 8 headcovers: 4-PW, X. They are made of a breathable fabric that reduces moisture build-up. They will fit both right or left handed clubs. Easy to put on and take off. Provides excellent protection for your iron clubs as well as your wood and hybrid shafts – while on the course or during travel. A great gift for any golfer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iA7MTvVlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BN8ITU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Head Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BNPJK6", "title": "MSR SweetWater Microfilter", "description": "Perfect for light and moderate use, with the occasional big excursion, the Sweetwater Microfilter makes water treatment painless. It can produce 1.25 liters per minute, and can be cleaned without fuss or tools. Weighing less than a pound, it's one of the lightest filters out there.", "text": "MSR SweetWater Microfilter Perfect for light and moderate use, with the occasional big excursion, the Sweetwater Microfilter makes water treatment painless. It can produce 1.25 liters per minute, and can be cleaned without fuss or tools. Weighing less than a pound, it's one of the lightest filters out there.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c38rQlsrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BNPJK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 79.95}}
