{"item_id": "B001BO1PNK", "title": "Ming's Mark SL1204-BLUE Blue Full Back Folding Director's Chair", "description": "Folding Director's Chair - Blue Folding Full Back Director;s chair with side table and accessory pockets. Flat aluminum frame 600D polyester fabric cushion.23.6 W x 15.7 D x 18.1 H", "text": "Ming's Mark SL1204-BLUE Blue Full Back Folding Director's Chair Folding Director's Chair - Blue Folding Full Back Director;s chair with side table and accessory pockets. Flat aluminum frame 600D polyester fabric cushion.23.6 W x 15.7 D x 18.1 H", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41p2cqkwt3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BO1PNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ming &#39;s Mark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 45.79}}
{"item_id": "B001BOPZ18", "title": "Teeter Hang Ups Vibration Cushion for EP Series", "description": "Revive and energize tired, sore muscles with the Teeter Hang Ups Vibration Cushion with Infrared Neck Arch Support. The powerful vibration motors in the cushion combine with the therapeutic benefits of Infrared heating technology in the neck arch support to help soothe muscle aches and stimulate surface circulation. Studies have shown that the use of pulse and vibration technology can benefit the body by temporarily reducing muscle pain, improving blood circulation and encouraging relaxation. In combination with inversion, the vibration cushion is an effective way to relieve stress and tension while decompressing.With the arch support placed under the curve of the neck, the infrared heaters are positioned to target the upper back and shoulder area. Though not warm to the touch, 93 percent of the energy generated by the infrared rays is absorbed into the body for a deep heat that provides additional relaxation and circulatory benefits.Features:10 vibration massage motors with variable intensity temporarily improve circulation and help relieve tired and aching musclesRemote control with LCD allows you to select target zone, speed, intensity, and optional heat with the touch of a buttonSupports the neck in a gentle arch to restore curvature and to achieve greater decompression of this area while inverted2 infrared heaters embedded in the neck arch support; positioned to target the upper back and shoulder area to deliver warming, deep heatUser-friendly; easily attaches to inversion table with convenient Velcro strapsConvenient storage pouch attaches to the frame of your inversion table for easy access to the remote controlDurable material is made of microfiber material, polyfoam and metal/plastic componentsEasy to clean; wipe with cloth to cleanNote: Chair and base not included", "text": "Teeter Hang Ups Vibration Cushion for EP Series Revive and energize tired, sore muscles with the Teeter Hang Ups Vibration Cushion with Infrared Neck Arch Support. The powerful vibration motors in the cushion combine with the therapeutic benefits of Infrared heating technology in the neck arch support to help soothe muscle aches and stimulate surface circulation. Studies have shown that the use of pulse and vibration technology can benefit the body by temporarily reducing muscle pain, improving blood circulation and encouraging relaxation. In combination with inversion, the vibration cushion is an effective way to relieve stress and tension while decompressing.With the arch support placed under the curve of the neck, the infrared heaters are positioned to target the upper back and shoulder area. Though not warm to the touch, 93 percent of the energy generated by the infrared rays is absorbed into the body for a deep heat that provides additional relaxation and circulatory benefits.Features:10 vibration massage motors with variable intensity temporarily improve circulation and help relieve tired and aching musclesRemote control with LCD allows you to select target zone, speed, intensity, and optional heat with the touch of a buttonSupports the neck in a gentle arch to restore curvature and to achieve greater decompression of this area while inverted2 infrared heaters embedded in the neck arch support; positioned to target the upper back and shoulder area to deliver warming, deep heatUser-friendly; easily attaches to inversion table with convenient Velcro strapsConvenient storage pouch attaches to the frame of your inversion table for easy access to the remote controlDurable material is made of microfiber material, polyfoam and metal/plastic componentsEasy to clean; wipe with cloth to cleanNote: Chair and base not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uC2bPdeEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BOPZ18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teeter Hang Ups", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 99.0}}
{"item_id": "B001BQ1S9E", "title": "TITLE Ultra Lite Incredi-Ball Punch Mitts", "description": "Awesome all-leather construction with contoured pre-curved design for the ultimate in training experience. More than 1.75\" of multi-layered impact resistant foam lining for every level of offensive arsenal. Advanced sweat repellent max lining extends trainer to round after round of comfort and no sweat use. Half ball palm grip inside of mitts affords anatomically correct comfort, shock resistance and wear. You won't believe the feel and comfort of these beasts. Complete with leather back finger cover and leather wrist security strap. Size: 9.5\" x 7.5\"", "text": "TITLE Ultra Lite Incredi-Ball Punch Mitts Awesome all-leather construction with contoured pre-curved design for the ultimate in training experience. More than 1.75\" of multi-layered impact resistant foam lining for every level of offensive arsenal. Advanced sweat repellent max lining extends trainer to round after round of comfort and no sweat use. Half ball palm grip inside of mitts affords anatomically correct comfort, shock resistance and wear. You won't believe the feel and comfort of these beasts. Complete with leather back finger cover and leather wrist security strap. Size: 9.5\" x 7.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vuUNLb%2BQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQ1S9E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZLY2", "title": "Crosman 0407T Rotary Clips, Fits 357 Pistols, 3pk", "description": "Three 407T 10-pellet rotary clips - for all CROSMAN 357 pellet air pistols. This accessory will not fit the 3576BB model. 3 clips in each packet", "text": "Crosman 0407T Rotary Clips, Fits 357 Pistols, 3pk Three 407T 10-pellet rotary clips - for all CROSMAN 357 pellet air pistols. This accessory will not fit the 3576BB model. 3 clips in each packet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T%2BUceNh7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZLY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZOAS", "title": "Deluxe Universal Horizontal Shoulder Holster", "description": "This black, universal horizontal shoulder holster has a modular design for both left- and right-handed users, padded shoulder, and two magazine pouches. Its universal design fits most popular pistols and revolvers, and the holsters' soft lining protects your firearm's finish. All components are fully adjustable for a custom fit, and Velcro straps attach to a web belt for optimum holster and pouch tension.", "text": "Deluxe Universal Horizontal Shoulder Holster This black, universal horizontal shoulder holster has a modular design for both left- and right-handed users, padded shoulder, and two magazine pouches. Its universal design fits most popular pistols and revolvers, and the holsters' soft lining protects your firearm's finish. All components are fully adjustable for a custom fit, and Velcro straps attach to a web belt for optimum holster and pouch tension.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vlSG4fvOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZOAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 10.9}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZOCQ", "title": "UTG Elite Tactical Leg Holster (Left Handed)", "description": "TACTICAL OPERATION HOLSTERS, New Gen Elite Tactical Leg Holster-Left Handed, Velcro Strap for Full Adjustments, High Quality Quick Release Buckle System. Extra Mag Pouch", "text": "UTG Elite Tactical Leg Holster (Left Handed) TACTICAL OPERATION HOLSTERS, New Gen Elite Tactical Leg Holster-Left Handed, Velcro Strap for Full Adjustments, High Quality Quick Release Buckle System. Extra Mag Pouch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uJuBswkOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZOCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 12.65}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZOQ2", "title": "UTG Special Operations Universal Tactical Black Leg Holster (Left Handed)", "description": "UTG's Special Ops Leg Holster has a universal design that fits most medium to large frame pistols, with double thumb-break security system that offers full control of your weapon. Features include a deluxe non-slip holster pad, non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strap for comfort and additional retention. This Special Ops Holster is for the left-handed shooter.Features and Specifications:Universal design for most medium to large pistolsDouble thumb-break security system for full control of your weaponDeluxe non-slip holster padFully adjustable and elastic, non-slip, and removable leg strap for comfort and retentionWeight: 0.9 poundsMaterial: Synthetic leatherAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Special Operations Universal Tactical Black Leg Holster (Left Handed) UTG's Special Ops Leg Holster has a universal design that fits most medium to large frame pistols, with double thumb-break security system that offers full control of your weapon. Features include a deluxe non-slip holster pad, non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strap for comfort and additional retention. This Special Ops Holster is for the left-handed shooter.Features and Specifications:Universal design for most medium to large pistolsDouble thumb-break security system for full control of your weaponDeluxe non-slip holster padFully adjustable and elastic, non-slip, and removable leg strap for comfort and retentionWeight: 0.9 poundsMaterial: Synthetic leatherAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418U8IBrMIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZOQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 18.76}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZOSA", "title": "UTG Deluxe Pistol Case", "description": "Constructed of premium synthetic material for long-lasting durability, the UTG Deluxe Double Pistol Case features double solid padding, a premium fully lockable zipper, 6 mag pouches, and 1 huge outer accessory pocket. It's lightweight at only one pound and holds two pistols plus gear.Features and Specifications:Constructed of premium 1680D synthetic materialDouble solid paddingPremium Lockable #10 Zipper6 mag pouches and 1 huge outer accessory pocketMaterial: PolyesterWeight: 1 poundWeapon Application: 2 pistolsDimensions: 14 by 11 inches (W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Pistol Case Constructed of premium synthetic material for long-lasting durability, the UTG Deluxe Double Pistol Case features double solid padding, a premium fully lockable zipper, 6 mag pouches, and 1 huge outer accessory pocket. It's lightweight at only one pound and holds two pistols plus gear.Features and Specifications:Constructed of premium 1680D synthetic materialDouble solid paddingPremium Lockable #10 Zipper6 mag pouches and 1 huge outer accessory pocketMaterial: PolyesterWeight: 1 poundWeapon Application: 2 pistolsDimensions: 14 by 11 inches (W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/6199X-qksgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZOSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Cases"]], "price": 17.97}}
{"item_id": "B001BQZSZ4", "title": "Leapers Golden Image 38mm Red/Green Dot Sight, Integral Weaver Mount (SCP-RD40RGW)", "description": "An adjustable illumination knob on the ocular tube lets you select different levels of brightness for diverse weather and light conditions.This quick-aim electronic dot sight with red and green dual illumination, from UTG, lets you quickly acquire and sight in on downrange targets. An integrated Weaver mounting deck means you can easily affix the scope to most weapons, and a flip-open lens cap is also included.Specifications1X magnification38-millimeter tube diameter30-millimeter objective diameter16.5-foot field of view at 100 yards25-millimeter exit pupilFlexible eye relief0.5-inch click value at 100 yards119-millimeter total length7.4-ounce weightRuns on three-volt CR2032 batteriesWarrantyIt includes 2 years warranty given by the manufacturer.", "text": "Leapers Golden Image 38mm Red/Green Dot Sight, Integral Weaver Mount (SCP-RD40RGW) An adjustable illumination knob on the ocular tube lets you select different levels of brightness for diverse weather and light conditions.This quick-aim electronic dot sight with red and green dual illumination, from UTG, lets you quickly acquire and sight in on downrange targets. An integrated Weaver mounting deck means you can easily affix the scope to most weapons, and a flip-open lens cap is also included.Specifications1X magnification38-millimeter tube diameter30-millimeter objective diameter16.5-foot field of view at 100 yards25-millimeter exit pupilFlexible eye relief0.5-inch click value at 100 yards119-millimeter total length7.4-ounce weightRuns on three-volt CR2032 batteriesWarrantyIt includes 2 years warranty given by the manufacturer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OME86be7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BQZSZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 37.0}}
