{"item_id": "B001BR1NE8", "title": "Crosman 1377 Custom Shoulder Stock", "description": "This synthetic stock provides an excellent fit for a scope or straight sites. Made from weather resistant polymers it provides a perfect combination of aesthetics and functionality.", "text": "Crosman 1377 Custom Shoulder Stock This synthetic stock provides an excellent fit for a scope or straight sites. Made from weather resistant polymers it provides a perfect combination of aesthetics and functionality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314NtSd%2BDqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR1NE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 29.92}}
{"item_id": "B001BR1O74", "title": "UTG Law Enforcement SWAT Vest", "description": "Numerous pockets and loops keep tactical gear organized, while rugged nylon construction keeps the vest looking new for years.This durable tactical vest is designed for law enforcement entry teams, and firearm enthusiasts who seek a rugged, practical gear-carrying solution in the field. It offers quilted comfort on the inside, and heavy-duty nylon on the exterior. Numerous front pockets and an oversized back pocket help keep your magazines and other accessories in order, and the vest is fully adjustable through the shoulder and waist for a custom fit.Additional features include a thumb break holster, pistol and rifle magazine pouches, elastic loops for shotgun shells, and a radio pocket. The 3.5-pound vest is 23 inches long, with an adjustable, 40-to-54-inch torso.WarrantyUTG accessories include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "UTG Law Enforcement SWAT Vest Numerous pockets and loops keep tactical gear organized, while rugged nylon construction keeps the vest looking new for years.This durable tactical vest is designed for law enforcement entry teams, and firearm enthusiasts who seek a rugged, practical gear-carrying solution in the field. It offers quilted comfort on the inside, and heavy-duty nylon on the exterior. Numerous front pockets and an oversized back pocket help keep your magazines and other accessories in order, and the vest is fully adjustable through the shoulder and waist for a custom fit.Additional features include a thumb break holster, pistol and rifle magazine pouches, elastic loops for shotgun shells, and a radio pocket. The 3.5-pound vest is 23 inches long, with an adjustable, 40-to-54-inch torso.WarrantyUTG accessories include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512FzOp-s-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR1O74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 44.97}}
{"item_id": "B001BR2WAW", "title": "Crosman Speedloader Kit", "description": "Pre-load these three 12-shot clips for virtually uninterrupted shooting with the Crosman 1077.", "text": "Crosman Speedloader Kit Pre-load these three 12-shot clips for virtually uninterrupted shooting with the Crosman 1077.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hdJcyPr-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR2WAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 4.25}}
{"item_id": "B001BR2XH4", "title": "UTG Deluxe Tri-Rail Barrel Mount", "description": "This Universal Tri-Rail Mount comes complete with a laser clamping feature with a .51 to .78 inch range. Its solid aluminum construction has a matte black finish and features a three-piece design for clamping rifle barrel and laser tube. Each rail has 2 slots and is compatible with firearm barrels ranging in diameter from .51 to .78 inches.Features:Solid Aluminum Construction with Matte Black FinishSmart 2 Piece Design for Clamping Rifle BarrelLength: 2.4\" (5 slots)Compatible Firearm Barrel Range: .51 -.78 inch diameterLaser Clamping Diameter Range: .51 -.78 inch diameterSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 2.6 ouncesPieces: 3Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverRail slots: 5Dimensions: 1.2 by 2.1 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Tri-Rail Barrel Mount This Universal Tri-Rail Mount comes complete with a laser clamping feature with a .51 to .78 inch range. Its solid aluminum construction has a matte black finish and features a three-piece design for clamping rifle barrel and laser tube. Each rail has 2 slots and is compatible with firearm barrels ranging in diameter from .51 to .78 inches.Features:Solid Aluminum Construction with Matte Black FinishSmart 2 Piece Design for Clamping Rifle BarrelLength: 2.4\" (5 slots)Compatible Firearm Barrel Range: .51 -.78 inch diameterLaser Clamping Diameter Range: .51 -.78 inch diameterSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 2.6 ouncesPieces: 3Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverRail slots: 5Dimensions: 1.2 by 2.1 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xced%2BiPBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR2XH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B001BR2YG4", "title": "UTG M3 Multi-Shot Shotgun Shell Cartridges", "description": "Designed for M3 triple shot shotguns, these Multi-Shot Shotgun Shell Cartridges can each hold up to 30 BBs. This six-pack holds two red, two, green, and two black cartridges. These high quality cartridges from UTG Sport boast clear PVC packaging.", "text": "UTG M3 Multi-Shot Shotgun Shell Cartridges Designed for M3 triple shot shotguns, these Multi-Shot Shotgun Shell Cartridges can each hold up to 30 BBs. This six-pack holds two red, two, green, and two black cartridges. These high quality cartridges from UTG Sport boast clear PVC packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BQdVwiflL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR2YG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Shotguns"]], "price": 15.28}}
