{"item_id": "B001BR2ZK4", "title": "VisiChalk Ferris Wheel Target System", "description": "The Champion visichalk target wheel provides hours of shooting fun. This dynamic target holds 9 visichalk targets and rotates when you shoot it. Fun for shooters of all ages, the target wheel is a challenging way to hone your skills while enjoying the innovative visichalk targets. Load up the spokes of the Target Wheel, find a comfortable rest and let the fun begin. Holds nine 3 visichalk targets for continuous shooting Rotates when shot to provide interactive fun and challenging shots Sturdy metal frame keeps pinwheel stable Comes with a pack of 18 visichalk Colored 3 targets Designed for easy storage and carry into the field.", "text": "VisiChalk Ferris Wheel Target System The Champion visichalk target wheel provides hours of shooting fun. This dynamic target holds 9 visichalk targets and rotates when you shoot it. Fun for shooters of all ages, the target wheel is a challenging way to hone your skills while enjoying the innovative visichalk targets. Load up the spokes of the Target Wheel, find a comfortable rest and let the fun begin. Holds nine 3 visichalk targets for continuous shooting Rotates when shot to provide interactive fun and challenging shots Sturdy metal frame keeps pinwheel stable Comes with a pack of 18 visichalk Colored 3 targets Designed for easy storage and carry into the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R-iS9km6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR2ZK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 19.19}}
{"item_id": "B001BR306C", "title": "Airsoft Gun M4 Box Magazine, Holds 5000 Rds, Fits M4 AEGs by BBTac", "description": "High-capacity magazine Holds up to 5000 rounds Fits all TM-compatable M4 AEGs Black poly fiber construction 2 refill reserviors for faster loading Recommended for these M4 AEG brands: Echo 1, Jing Gong, TSD Tactical, ICS/Olympic Arms, TM, GP, Gaurder, Star, CA and GG", "text": "Airsoft Gun M4 Box Magazine, Holds 5000 Rds, Fits M4 AEGs by BBTac High-capacity magazine Holds up to 5000 rounds Fits all TM-compatable M4 AEGs Black poly fiber construction 2 refill reserviors for faster loading Recommended for these M4 AEG brands: Echo 1, Jing Gong, TSD Tactical, ICS/Olympic Arms, TM, GP, Gaurder, Star, CA and GG", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i-vgQJu4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR306C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 26.5}}
{"item_id": "B001BR31X4", "title": "Walther PS 22 Red Dot Len-Cap Brightness Point Sight", "description": "The Walther PS 22 Electronic Red Dot Point Sight projects a red aiming dot onto the lens in the target level. Iron sights such as rear- or front-sights are not required, thus allowing you to aim with both eyes open. The PS22 includes a mounting base which can be affixed to a Weaver rail (22 mm), such as on the Walther G22 (soft air or firearm) or Beretta CX4 Storm (air rifle or firearm). The on/off rotary switch is combined with 11 settings for brightness adjustment.", "text": "Walther PS 22 Red Dot Len-Cap Brightness Point Sight The Walther PS 22 Electronic Red Dot Point Sight projects a red aiming dot onto the lens in the target level. Iron sights such as rear- or front-sights are not required, thus allowing you to aim with both eyes open. The PS22 includes a mounting base which can be affixed to a Weaver rail (22 mm), such as on the Walther G22 (soft air or firearm) or Beretta CX4 Storm (air rifle or firearm). The on/off rotary switch is combined with 11 settings for brightness adjustment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yGpGfYxTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR31X4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walther", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 65.19}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4R6E", "title": "UTG Heavy Duty Web Belt - Black", "description": "This heavy-duty web belt is a handy accessory to keep your tactical gear organized in the field. Two inches thick, and with a versatile Velcro system, the belt fits waists up to 48 inches. A quick-release snap makes for easy on-and-off, as well. Constructed of rugged PP webbing material, the belt weighs 0.5 pounds.WarrantyUTG accessories include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "UTG Heavy Duty Web Belt - Black This heavy-duty web belt is a handy accessory to keep your tactical gear organized in the field. Two inches thick, and with a versatile Velcro system, the belt fits waists up to 48 inches. A quick-release snap makes for easy on-and-off, as well. Constructed of rugged PP webbing material, the belt weighs 0.5 pounds.WarrantyUTG accessories include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m8ktjnzuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4R6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4RO6", "title": "MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader with Capacity of 100 Bbs", "description": "Love airsoft guns but hate taking the time to reload? Turn to this airsoft magazine speedloader, which makes loading BBs into your airsoft rifle, pistol, or machine gun easier and less time consuming. The speedloader--which weighs 0.5 pounds--is compatible with all types of standard AEG magazines, and also includes an adapter for the most popular gas blowback pistols.", "text": "MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader with Capacity of 100 Bbs Love airsoft guns but hate taking the time to reload? Turn to this airsoft magazine speedloader, which makes loading BBs into your airsoft rifle, pistol, or machine gun easier and less time consuming. The speedloader--which weighs 0.5 pounds--is compatible with all types of standard AEG magazines, and also includes an adapter for the most popular gas blowback pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512PxduineL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4RO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MetalTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 0.85}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4T7G", "title": "UTG Heavy Duty Elite Law Enforcement Pistol Belt with Dual Mag Pouches", "description": "The UTG Heavy Duty Elite Law Enforcement Pistol Belt with Dual Mag Pouches is the pistol carry belt that elite officers and tactical units rely on in the field. The modern-design belt is sewn with reinforced threads and double-edge stitched for extra durability and strength. It features a quick release buckle system that proves critical when you need fast access to your gun. It also provides two extra-large, horizontal magazine pouches with easy buckle snap closures. The two-inch-wide belt is flexible and adjustable to custom fit up to a 44-inch waist. This stylish, reliable belt is an effortless way to carry your pistol while on duty.", "text": "UTG Heavy Duty Elite Law Enforcement Pistol Belt with Dual Mag Pouches The UTG Heavy Duty Elite Law Enforcement Pistol Belt with Dual Mag Pouches is the pistol carry belt that elite officers and tactical units rely on in the field. The modern-design belt is sewn with reinforced threads and double-edge stitched for extra durability and strength. It features a quick release buckle system that proves critical when you need fast access to your gun. It also provides two extra-large, horizontal magazine pouches with easy buckle snap closures. The two-inch-wide belt is flexible and adjustable to custom fit up to a 44-inch waist. This stylish, reliable belt is an effortless way to carry your pistol while on duty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hElp3f-GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4T7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4TJY", "title": "Leapers Accushot 1-Pc Mount w/1 Rings, 3/8 Dovetail", "description": "1 rings Medium profile Fits 3/8 dovetail 100mm base length 4 hex screws/ring secure the scope Vertical stop pinSpecial tape inside the rings keeps your scope tight without excessive clamp pressure!", "text": "Leapers Accushot 1-Pc Mount w/1 Rings, 3/8 Dovetail 1 rings Medium profile Fits 3/8 dovetail 100mm base length 4 hex screws/ring secure the scope Vertical stop pinSpecial tape inside the rings keeps your scope tight without excessive clamp pressure!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410J0RVfIlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4TJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leapers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 12.85}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4TOE", "title": "VisiChalk 3 Multi-Color Targets, 48ct", "description": "The wildly popular VisiChalkTargets from Champion now come in a pack of three exciting new colors. These brightly colored blue, white, yellow and orange targets provide the same explosive action as the original. Designed for the Champion Single Target, Multi-Target Holder Systems and new Target Wheel, these brightly colored chalk targets deliver great interactive fun for all ages. Take your shot and get immediate results with Champion VisiChalktargets.", "text": "VisiChalk 3 Multi-Color Targets, 48ct The wildly popular VisiChalkTargets from Champion now come in a pack of three exciting new colors. These brightly colored blue, white, yellow and orange targets provide the same explosive action as the original. Designed for the Champion Single Target, Multi-Target Holder Systems and new Target Wheel, these brightly colored chalk targets deliver great interactive fun for all ages. Take your shot and get immediate results with Champion VisiChalktargets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hYsg-ti2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4TOE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 17.54}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4VME", "title": "UTG TACTICAL/Sniper Profile Adjustable Height Universal Bipod with Rubberized Stand", "description": "The UTG tactical sniper-profile universal foldable clamp-on bipod provides the adjust-ability and versatility you need to achieve a stable shot virtually anywhere. The high-tech, durable aluminum construction is lightweight, strong, and built to last. The adjustable leg length provides a height range from 9 to 11 inches to get your target sighted in while you remain hidden. The bipod features an easy to use dual Picatinny or swivel stud mounting system, and the unique posi-lock feature prevents it from tipping. Best of all, it's foldable for quick storage and portability. Grab one of these to steady your aim and you're ready for target practice or hunting season.Key Features:Specifications:Adjustable Center Height from 9 to 11 inchesPanningPosi-lockExtendable LegsFoldable ArmsSwivel Stud MountPicatinny and Swivel Stud MountRubberized StandAluminum constructionWeight: 11.1 ounces", "text": "UTG TACTICAL/Sniper Profile Adjustable Height Universal Bipod with Rubberized Stand The UTG tactical sniper-profile universal foldable clamp-on bipod provides the adjust-ability and versatility you need to achieve a stable shot virtually anywhere. The high-tech, durable aluminum construction is lightweight, strong, and built to last. The adjustable leg length provides a height range from 9 to 11 inches to get your target sighted in while you remain hidden. The bipod features an easy to use dual Picatinny or swivel stud mounting system, and the unique posi-lock feature prevents it from tipping. Best of all, it's foldable for quick storage and portability. Grab one of these to steady your aim and you're ready for target practice or hunting season.Key Features:Specifications:Adjustable Center Height from 9 to 11 inchesPanningPosi-lockExtendable LegsFoldable ArmsSwivel Stud MountPicatinny and Swivel Stud MountRubberized StandAluminum constructionWeight: 11.1 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gLbcUUAbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4VME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 29.97}}
{"item_id": "B001BR4VQ0", "title": "UTG Model 4/16 Complete Match-grade Rear Sight", "description": "Dramatically improve your sight pictures and enhance your shooting accuracy with the Model 4/15 match-grade detachable rear sight from UTG. Boasting rugged aluminum/steel construction with matte-black finish, the Model 4/15 is built to withstand the harshest environments and most demanding requirements. The sight delivers precise MOA windage and elevation adjustment in accordance with current military requirements and has a spring-loaded detent to make adjustments positive and repeatable.The Model 4/15 offers the versatility for multiple applications and situations with A2 style dual apertures. A larger rapid target acquisition aperture is suitable for CQB operations. A smaller, precision aperture is ideal for high accuracy aiming operations. Measuring 1.41 inches tall, the Model 4/15 is the exact height to co-witness with a standard front sight and most electronic dot sights. The Model 4/15 comes with a One piece integral Picatinny mounting deck fits all flat tops and is equipped with a locking retention thumb nut.Features and Specifications:Rugged aluminum/steel constructionMatte-black finishMOA windage and elevation adjustment in accordance with current military requirementsSpring-loaded detent for positive and repeatable W/E adjustmentsA2 style dual aperturesLarger rapid target acquisition aperture for CQB operationsSmaller precision aperture for high accuracy aiming operationsExact height to co-witness with standard front sight and most electronic dot sightsOne-piece integral Picatinny mounting deckFits all flat topsEquipped with locking retention thumb nutDimensions: 1.41 inches in height; 2.79 inches in lengthThe Model 4/15 has the correct size specifications to co-witness with standard front sights.", "text": "UTG Model 4/16 Complete Match-grade Rear Sight Dramatically improve your sight pictures and enhance your shooting accuracy with the Model 4/15 match-grade detachable rear sight from UTG. Boasting rugged aluminum/steel construction with matte-black finish, the Model 4/15 is built to withstand the harshest environments and most demanding requirements. The sight delivers precise MOA windage and elevation adjustment in accordance with current military requirements and has a spring-loaded detent to make adjustments positive and repeatable.The Model 4/15 offers the versatility for multiple applications and situations with A2 style dual apertures. A larger rapid target acquisition aperture is suitable for CQB operations. A smaller, precision aperture is ideal for high accuracy aiming operations. Measuring 1.41 inches tall, the Model 4/15 is the exact height to co-witness with a standard front sight and most electronic dot sights. The Model 4/15 comes with a One piece integral Picatinny mounting deck fits all flat tops and is equipped with a locking retention thumb nut.Features and Specifications:Rugged aluminum/steel constructionMatte-black finishMOA windage and elevation adjustment in accordance with current military requirementsSpring-loaded detent for positive and repeatable W/E adjustmentsA2 style dual aperturesLarger rapid target acquisition aperture for CQB operationsSmaller precision aperture for high accuracy aiming operationsExact height to co-witness with standard front sight and most electronic dot sightsOne-piece integral Picatinny mounting deckFits all flat topsEquipped with locking retention thumb nutDimensions: 1.41 inches in height; 2.79 inches in lengthThe Model 4/15 has the correct size specifications to co-witness with standard front sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bihq8CD6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4VQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 24.95}}
