{"item_id": "B001BR4W6Y", "title": "UTG DC Series Tactical 38-Inch Gun Case", "description": "Deluxe Tactical Gun Case - 38\"X12\" with Supeiorr Water-resistant Outer Shell. 2\" Well Padded High-density Foam, 5 Velcro Closure Mag Pouches, #10 Double Head Zipper - Woodland Camo", "text": "UTG DC Series Tactical 38-Inch Gun Case Deluxe Tactical Gun Case - 38\"X12\" with Supeiorr Water-resistant Outer Shell. 2\" Well Padded High-density Foam, 5 Velcro Closure Mag Pouches, #10 Double Head Zipper - Woodland Camo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cll7Yx3xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR4W6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Cases"]], "price": 39.99}}
