{"item_id": "B001BR6LWC", "title": "UTG Low-Profile Dragon Claw Clamp-on Barrel Bipod", "description": "The Dragon Claw Clamp-On Barrel Bipod features high-tech, durable aluminum construction and a clever adjustment wheel that fits a wide range of barrel sizes from 11mm to 19 mm. It's user-friendly design sports a unique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tipping, a rubberized comfort stand, extendable legs that can be adjusted for best shooting position, and arms that fold up for easy carry and storage.Features:High-tech durable aluminum constructionClever adjustment wheel for wide range of barrel sizes from 11mm to 19mmUser-friendly clamp-on featuresUnique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tippingFoldable with fully adjustable center height from 9 to 11 inchesRubberized comfort standPosi-lock guarantees the position of the folding arm is fully lockedExtendable Legs can be adjusted for best shooting position.Foldable Arms can be folded up for easy carry and storageRubberized stand is coated to increase the friction between the stand and surface for a more stabilized shooting positionSpecifications:Panning: NoPosi-lock: YesExtendable Legs: YesFoldable Arms: YesSwivel Stud Mount: NoPicatinny Mount: NoReversible Arms-Folding: NoStand: Rubberized coatingMaterial: AluminumWeight: 10.3 ouncesFits Barrel Sizes: 11mm - 19mmAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Low-Profile Dragon Claw Clamp-on Barrel Bipod The Dragon Claw Clamp-On Barrel Bipod features high-tech, durable aluminum construction and a clever adjustment wheel that fits a wide range of barrel sizes from 11mm to 19 mm. It's user-friendly design sports a unique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tipping, a rubberized comfort stand, extendable legs that can be adjusted for best shooting position, and arms that fold up for easy carry and storage.Features:High-tech durable aluminum constructionClever adjustment wheel for wide range of barrel sizes from 11mm to 19mmUser-friendly clamp-on featuresUnique Posi-Lock feature to prevent tippingFoldable with fully adjustable center height from 9 to 11 inchesRubberized comfort standPosi-lock guarantees the position of the folding arm is fully lockedExtendable Legs can be adjusted for best shooting position.Foldable Arms can be folded up for easy carry and storageRubberized stand is coated to increase the friction between the stand and surface for a more stabilized shooting positionSpecifications:Panning: NoPosi-lock: YesExtendable Legs: YesFoldable Arms: YesSwivel Stud Mount: NoPicatinny Mount: NoReversible Arms-Folding: NoStand: Rubberized coatingMaterial: AluminumWeight: 10.3 ouncesFits Barrel Sizes: 11mm - 19mmAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31in-AF7ZkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR6LWC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 25.19}}
{"item_id": "B001BR6PT6", "title": "UTG 3-9X32 Full Size A.O. Range Estimating Mil-Dot Scope", "description": "HUNTING RIFLE SCOPES, Golden Image 3-9X32 Full Size Adjustable Objective Scope with TS Platform, Mil-Dot, Sapphire Lens Coating, 5th Gen Square Knob Housing, Finger Adjustment Knobs, Complete with Flip-open Lens Cover", "text": "UTG 3-9X32 Full Size A.O. Range Estimating Mil-Dot Scope HUNTING RIFLE SCOPES, Golden Image 3-9X32 Full Size Adjustable Objective Scope with TS Platform, Mil-Dot, Sapphire Lens Coating, 5th Gen Square Knob Housing, Finger Adjustment Knobs, Complete with Flip-open Lens Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413DdKOXLcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR6PT6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BR6RCG", "title": "Leapers 5th Gen 3-9x40 AO Mil-Dot Rifle Scope with R/G, 1 Tube", "description": "A front adjustable objective allows the shooter to fine-tune focus as near as five yards.This scope from UTG features a mil-dot range estimating reticle for an accurate shot, every time. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance. The scope comes complete with 2.5-inch sniper-style stackable sun shade and flip-open lens caps.Specifications3-to-9X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter39-to-13' field of view at 100 yards3.3-to-3.1-inch eye reliefTen-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards342-millimeter length20.2-ounce weightParallax setting of five yards to infinityWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Leapers 5th Gen 3-9x40 AO Mil-Dot Rifle Scope with R/G, 1 Tube A front adjustable objective allows the shooter to fine-tune focus as near as five yards.This scope from UTG features a mil-dot range estimating reticle for an accurate shot, every time. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance. The scope comes complete with 2.5-inch sniper-style stackable sun shade and flip-open lens caps.Specifications3-to-9X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter39-to-13' field of view at 100 yards3.3-to-3.1-inch eye reliefTen-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards342-millimeter length20.2-ounce weightParallax setting of five yards to infinityWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Jp%2B7D9JNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR6RCG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BR6SCU", "title": "Benjamin Hand Pump, Fits Discovery, Marauder, Katana & Challenger Rifles", "description": "3-stage hand pump Made specifically for the Benjamin Discovery, Maruader, and Katana and the Crosman Challenger Includes a female Foster quick-disconnect on the end of the pump hose Goes up to 3600 psi (although some of the guns listed above operate on a max pressure of 2000 or 3,000 psi) With other hoses, pump can be adapted to other PCPs Requires less effort than other pumps Integral air pressure gauge Moisture filter", "text": "Benjamin Hand Pump, Fits Discovery, Marauder, Katana & Challenger Rifles 3-stage hand pump Made specifically for the Benjamin Discovery, Maruader, and Katana and the Crosman Challenger Includes a female Foster quick-disconnect on the end of the pump hose Goes up to 3600 psi (although some of the guns listed above operate on a max pressure of 2000 or 3,000 psi) With other hoses, pump can be adapted to other PCPs Requires less effort than other pumps Integral air pressure gauge Moisture filter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21PpTL1GIML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BR6SCU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benjamin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 163.79}}
