{"item_id": "B001BS2EZE", "title": "IZH 46M Match Pistol air pistol", "description": "IZH-Baikal 46M air pistol Single-stroke pneumatic Single-shot Bolt-action Hammer-forged barrel Extremely accurate Match barrel 2-stage adjustable trigger (for overtravel & pull) Extra-long cocking stroke Dry-fire mechanism Includes cleaning rod, sight-adjustment tool, drift punch tool & extra seals 90-day limited repair warranty on factory defects of metal parts & 30-day warranty on seals & stock Click the AMMO link to stock up on wadcutter pellets, which are what you shoot in 10-meter matches. Check the ACCESSORIES link for targets and safety gear. In-stock dates are unpredictable and may change without notice due to supply, logistical or U.S. Customs issues. We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding.... ... Outstanding accuracy, dry-fire ability...", "text": "IZH 46M Match Pistol air pistol IZH-Baikal 46M air pistol Single-stroke pneumatic Single-shot Bolt-action Hammer-forged barrel Extremely accurate Match barrel 2-stage adjustable trigger (for overtravel & pull) Extra-long cocking stroke Dry-fire mechanism Includes cleaning rod, sight-adjustment tool, drift punch tool & extra seals 90-day limited repair warranty on factory defects of metal parts & 30-day warranty on seals & stock Click the AMMO link to stock up on wadcutter pellets, which are what you shoot in 10-meter matches. Check the ACCESSORIES link for targets and safety gear. In-stock dates are unpredictable and may change without notice due to supply, logistical or U.S. Customs issues. We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding.... ... Outstanding accuracy, dry-fire ability...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XF4Z9TNYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BS2EZE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]]}}
