{"item_id": "B001BS9AII", "title": "Smith & Wesson 586, 6-inch Barrel air pistol", "description": "The Smith & Wesson CO2 pellet revolvers are complete duplicates of the legendary Smith & Wesson 357 in both weight and handling. Available in 4- and 6-inch barrel lengths with a 10-shot magazine that swings out for easy and realistic loading and replacement. This is one of the most smooth, accurate, and powerful CO2 pistols available. It is our marketing manager's favorite for control, accuracy and number of shots. Comes in a foam-lined plastic gun case.", "text": "Smith & Wesson 586, 6-inch Barrel air pistol The Smith & Wesson CO2 pellet revolvers are complete duplicates of the legendary Smith & Wesson 357 in both weight and handling. Available in 4- and 6-inch barrel lengths with a 10-shot magazine that swings out for easy and realistic loading and replacement. This is one of the most smooth, accurate, and powerful CO2 pistols available. It is our marketing manager's favorite for control, accuracy and number of shots. Comes in a foam-lined plastic gun case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XHXa8rftL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BS9AII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp;  Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 259.95}}
