{"item_id": "B001BTD8D0", "title": "Double Eagle M82 Airsoft Electric Gun S552 Sytle Electric Rifle FULLY LOADED", "description": "A 1:1 scale replica of an SIG 552 Commando carbine rifle, the M82 airsoft electric rifle is remarkably authentic. The M82 fires round pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun electronically. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M82 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft rifle is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The M82 is an electronic gun, with no pumping required: just point and shoot. Other features include a bullet loader, a foldable stock, an adjustable electric scope, a rechargeable battery and charger, and protective eyewear.Specifications:Velocity: Roughly 240 fpsMagazine capacity: 36 BBsFire modes: Full auto, semi-auto, safetyCaliber: 6mm BBsHop-up: AdjustableBullet loaderAdjustable electric scope (battery included)Rechargeable battery and charger", "text": "Double Eagle M82 Airsoft Electric Gun S552 Sytle Electric Rifle FULLY LOADED A 1:1 scale replica of an SIG 552 Commando carbine rifle, the M82 airsoft electric rifle is remarkably authentic. The M82 fires round pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun electronically. The advantage of the airsoft rifle, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M82 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft rifle is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The M82 is an electronic gun, with no pumping required: just point and shoot. Other features include a bullet loader, a foldable stock, an adjustable electric scope, a rechargeable battery and charger, and protective eyewear.Specifications:Velocity: Roughly 240 fpsMagazine capacity: 36 BBsFire modes: Full auto, semi-auto, safetyCaliber: 6mm BBsHop-up: AdjustableBullet loaderAdjustable electric scope (battery included)Rechargeable battery and charger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mtQrkkmzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BTD8D0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 32.0}}
{"item_id": "B001BTIEM0", "title": "Airsoft 6mm BB 0.2g 1Kg 5,000 Pellet Bag", "description": "MetalTac 0.2g BB 6mm Airsoft 5000 Bag. Heavy Weight, perfect for high quality AEG, perfectly balanced BB, extreme accuracy. High Precision, ultra smooth and perfectly balanced BB. Precisely made with minimal variation (+-0.01mm), weight precisely at 0.2g (+-0.01g) The Metal precision rating level has exceeded most the brand out there available on the Market, running head to head to the best Japanese brand BBs'. 5000 Round The most valued package 0.2g BB available.", "text": "Airsoft 6mm BB 0.2g 1Kg 5,000 Pellet Bag MetalTac 0.2g BB 6mm Airsoft 5000 Bag. Heavy Weight, perfect for high quality AEG, perfectly balanced BB, extreme accuracy. High Precision, ultra smooth and perfectly balanced BB. Precisely made with minimal variation (+-0.01mm), weight precisely at 0.2g (+-0.01g) The Metal precision rating level has exceeded most the brand out there available on the Market, running head to head to the best Japanese brand BBs'. 5000 Round The most valued package 0.2g BB available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uyotjjRAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BTIEM0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 14.7}}
{"item_id": "B001BTNNLC", "title": "Marttiini Knives 14 Stainless Steel Skinner Fixed Blade Knife with Black Kraton Handle", "description": "Marttiini Condor Skinner Fixed Blade Knife. Measures 8 7/8\" overall. 4 1/8\" 420 stainless skinner blade. Black textured Kraton handle with a cast metal finger guard. Black leather belt sheath. Made in Finland.", "text": "Marttiini Knives 14 Stainless Steel Skinner Fixed Blade Knife with Black Kraton Handle Marttiini Condor Skinner Fixed Blade Knife. Measures 8 7/8\" overall. 4 1/8\" 420 stainless skinner blade. Black textured Kraton handle with a cast metal finger guard. Black leather belt sheath. Made in Finland.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318tjOpVXNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BTNNLC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marttiini", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 21.5}}
