{"item_id": "B001BVI982", "title": "SightMark Laser Bore Sights Cartridge Sizes: SightMark AccuDot Laser Bore Sight - 223 Model SM39001", "description": "The Sightmark Laser Boresight provides a convenient, accurate, and cost effective method for sighting in rifles and shotguns of all types. Easy-to-use, simply chamber the boresight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming--without firing a single shot. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters, and law enforcement, the Sightmark Laser Boresight offers a 15 to 100 foot sighting range with a 632 to 650 nm laser wavelength. The boresight comes with a lightweight carrying pouch to protect the laser for in the field.Specifications:Laser Wavelength (nm:) 632 to 650LED Type: visible red laserSighting Range: 15 to 100 yardsDot Size: 2 inches at 100 yardsOperation: On/Off End CapConstruction: BrassTemperature: -10 to 50 CelsiusPower: <5 mWBattery Type: two AG5 or three AG3)Battery Life: one hour", "text": "SightMark Laser Bore Sights Cartridge Sizes: SightMark AccuDot Laser Bore Sight - 223 Model SM39001 The Sightmark Laser Boresight provides a convenient, accurate, and cost effective method for sighting in rifles and shotguns of all types. Easy-to-use, simply chamber the boresight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming--without firing a single shot. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters, and law enforcement, the Sightmark Laser Boresight offers a 15 to 100 foot sighting range with a 632 to 650 nm laser wavelength. The boresight comes with a lightweight carrying pouch to protect the laser for in the field.Specifications:Laser Wavelength (nm:) 632 to 650LED Type: visible red laserSighting Range: 15 to 100 yardsDot Size: 2 inches at 100 yardsOperation: On/Off End CapConstruction: BrassTemperature: -10 to 50 CelsiusPower: <5 mWBattery Type: two AG5 or three AG3)Battery Life: one hour", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rA4KACa4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BVI982.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 29.51}}
{"item_id": "B001BWZ29K", "title": "LaserLyte Kryptonyte Laser Bore Sighting System", "description": "Meet the brightest and most visible laser we've ever created. The New Kryptonyte Laser Bore Sighting System uses a green laser that is 100 times more visible to the human eye than traditional red lasers. This daylight-visible 532-nanometer green laser creates a dot that can be seen up to 100 yards with the naked eye, meaning you can sight-in anywhere from 10 yards to 100 yards away. The Kryptonyte LBS System fits any handgun with a four-inch minimum barrel required, rifle or carbine from .22 to .50 caliber and .51 to .75 caliber as well as 12 to 20 gauge shotguns. The Auto Power Control digital circuitry ensures a bright and steady dot for the full 1-1/2-hr. life of the CR2 lithium battery.", "text": "LaserLyte Kryptonyte Laser Bore Sighting System Meet the brightest and most visible laser we've ever created. The New Kryptonyte Laser Bore Sighting System uses a green laser that is 100 times more visible to the human eye than traditional red lasers. This daylight-visible 532-nanometer green laser creates a dot that can be seen up to 100 yards with the naked eye, meaning you can sight-in anywhere from 10 yards to 100 yards away. The Kryptonyte LBS System fits any handgun with a four-inch minimum barrel required, rifle or carbine from .22 to .50 caliber and .51 to .75 caliber as well as 12 to 20 gauge shotguns. The Auto Power Control digital circuitry ensures a bright and steady dot for the full 1-1/2-hr. life of the CR2 lithium battery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wLzzAcTtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BWZ29K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001BXA2S0", "title": "Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set", "description": "Ultralight and super strong, the Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set is an easy way to carry high quality cooking equipment out into the great outdoors. This stove set includes 2 saucepans, an ultralight aluminum non-stick frypan, upper and lower windshields and an aluminum kettle. The ultralight hard adonized aluminum resistant to scratching and corrosion which makes it extremely easy to clean. The ultralight aluminum is designed to move the heat uniformly so you don't get burnt spots. Very lightweight at just 2.32 lbs. the Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set makes cooking for 3-4 people in the outdoors easy. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253406, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 327770, GTIN: 7315081602580", "text": "Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set Ultralight and super strong, the Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set is an easy way to carry high quality cooking equipment out into the great outdoors. This stove set includes 2 saucepans, an ultralight aluminum non-stick frypan, upper and lower windshields and an aluminum kettle. The ultralight hard adonized aluminum resistant to scratching and corrosion which makes it extremely easy to clean. The ultralight aluminum is designed to move the heat uniformly so you don't get burnt spots. Very lightweight at just 2.32 lbs. the Trangia 25-8 Ultralight Hard Anodized Stove Set makes cooking for 3-4 people in the outdoors easy. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253406, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 327770, GTIN: 7315081602580", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nGeoF2zTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BXA2S0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trangia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 121.7}}
{"item_id": "B001BXVCMU", "title": "Hammers 3-9x32AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount", "description": "Hammers 3-9x32AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount-Variable 3x-9x power and 32mm parallex adjustable objective.-MilDot reticle.-Standard 1inch one-piece main tube.-Fingertight windage/elevation adjustments.-Internally reinforced to stand the unique shocking from piston type high power air rifle.-One piece airgun mount with 3 clamping screws plus built-in removable stop pin helps the scope to stay in place against powerful shocking during shooting.-Integral rings for better alignment of the scope.-Fits onto 3/8\" dovetail rail or groove on top of the receiver.-Anodized black matte finish.-Overall Length: 12 3/4\".", "text": "Hammers 3-9x32AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount Hammers 3-9x32AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount-Variable 3x-9x power and 32mm parallex adjustable objective.-MilDot reticle.-Standard 1inch one-piece main tube.-Fingertight windage/elevation adjustments.-Internally reinforced to stand the unique shocking from piston type high power air rifle.-One piece airgun mount with 3 clamping screws plus built-in removable stop pin helps the scope to stay in place against powerful shocking during shooting.-Integral rings for better alignment of the scope.-Fits onto 3/8\" dovetail rail or groove on top of the receiver.-Anodized black matte finish.-Overall Length: 12 3/4\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r1bmpD3ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BXVCMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 53.3}}
{"item_id": "B001BXVOH8", "title": "Hammers Shooting Stick/Monopod Gun Pod", "description": "Made of lightweight aluminum alloy, this shootingg stick/monopod has a yoke mounted on top to provide a steady platform for shooting in a standing, off-hand position, and thus greatly reduces impact of the wobble factor. It obviously benefits rifle, muzzleloader and handgun hunters. With its adjustable height from 30'' to 63\", it works just as well from sitting, or kneeling positions.While on a hunting trip, the stick can also be used as a hiking stick. Its spring-loaded anti-shock design absorbs shock and reduces stress to joints, muscles, and ligaments whether you're strolling through the park or traversing more rugged trials. Ergonomic EVA foam grip with top ball that hides an integrated camera mount; Wear-resistant carbide tip is mounted at the end; Accessories include rubber tip for paved surfaces, snow disc, adjustable nylon wrist strap with liquid-filled mini compass and thermometer. Weight: 12oz. Color: Black", "text": "Hammers Shooting Stick/Monopod Gun Pod Made of lightweight aluminum alloy, this shootingg stick/monopod has a yoke mounted on top to provide a steady platform for shooting in a standing, off-hand position, and thus greatly reduces impact of the wobble factor. It obviously benefits rifle, muzzleloader and handgun hunters. With its adjustable height from 30'' to 63\", it works just as well from sitting, or kneeling positions.While on a hunting trip, the stick can also be used as a hiking stick. Its spring-loaded anti-shock design absorbs shock and reduces stress to joints, muscles, and ligaments whether you're strolling through the park or traversing more rugged trials. Ergonomic EVA foam grip with top ball that hides an integrated camera mount; Wear-resistant carbide tip is mounted at the end; Accessories include rubber tip for paved surfaces, snow disc, adjustable nylon wrist strap with liquid-filled mini compass and thermometer. Weight: 12oz. Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IaZEW2VIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BXVOH8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B001BXVUN6", "title": "Hammers 39\" bungee corded collapsible shooting stick stix bipod", "description": "A quick setup lightweight bipod that has bungee-corded legs of tent pole style: Sections of the legs are made of lightweight and yet strong aluminum alloy tubing of 3/8inch diameter and extends to assembly instantly when swung open. Rubber joints between sections cushions and lessen the noise when the bungee-corded sections come to assembly. Rubber top tips cradle the gun without scratching and allow easy panning move. At the end of each leg, there is a checkered carbide tip that gives solid grip on ground surface. With max. height of 39\", the bipod improves greatly shooting accuracy from sitting or kneeling positions, especially for making long shots. When not in use, the bipod breaks into corded sections and folds easily down to 14\" and is tied up with a elastic Vecro band. Each unit comes with a carrying belt pouch. Length: 39\" extended; 14\" folded. Tube size: 3/8inch Weight: 8 1/2\"oz. Color: Anodized matte black", "text": "Hammers 39\" bungee corded collapsible shooting stick stix bipod A quick setup lightweight bipod that has bungee-corded legs of tent pole style: Sections of the legs are made of lightweight and yet strong aluminum alloy tubing of 3/8inch diameter and extends to assembly instantly when swung open. Rubber joints between sections cushions and lessen the noise when the bungee-corded sections come to assembly. Rubber top tips cradle the gun without scratching and allow easy panning move. At the end of each leg, there is a checkered carbide tip that gives solid grip on ground surface. With max. height of 39\", the bipod improves greatly shooting accuracy from sitting or kneeling positions, especially for making long shots. When not in use, the bipod breaks into corded sections and folds easily down to 14\" and is tied up with a elastic Vecro band. Each unit comes with a carrying belt pouch. Length: 39\" extended; 14\" folded. Tube size: 3/8inch Weight: 8 1/2\"oz. Color: Anodized matte black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LwYwq5SJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BXVUN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 21.9}}
