{"item_id": "B001BYFQUS", "title": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226, BLACK, RH", "description": "BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226", "text": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226, BLACK, RH BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mqdZWM-eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BYFQUS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.16}}
{"item_id": "B001BYK3WE", "title": "Mirrycle Road STI Bicycle Mirror", "description": "Developed exclusively to fit Shimano STI shifter/brake levers, the Mirrycle Road STI bicycle mirror makes it easy to tell when a car is pulling up from the rear. The mirror is easy to mount: just pull the rubber hood off the Shimano STI lever clip, slip the mirror base over the top, and then replace the hood. Once mounted, the mirror is located in the best possible position for watching the road behind. Just a flick of your eyes allows for a quick view of approaching cars or other cyclists. Best of all, the mirror doesn't get in the way of the STI levers, so you can shift and stop safely at all times. The Mirrycle road mirror--which attaches to either the left or right side lever--comes with all the necessary tools and is engineered to fit almost any STI lever.The Road Mirror will NOT fit on most Shimano STI levers installed on bikes after Spring 2010.", "text": "Mirrycle Road STI Bicycle Mirror Developed exclusively to fit Shimano STI shifter/brake levers, the Mirrycle Road STI bicycle mirror makes it easy to tell when a car is pulling up from the rear. The mirror is easy to mount: just pull the rubber hood off the Shimano STI lever clip, slip the mirror base over the top, and then replace the hood. Once mounted, the mirror is located in the best possible position for watching the road behind. Just a flick of your eyes allows for a quick view of approaching cars or other cyclists. Best of all, the mirror doesn't get in the way of the STI levers, so you can shift and stop safely at all times. The Mirrycle road mirror--which attaches to either the left or right side lever--comes with all the necessary tools and is engineered to fit almost any STI lever.The Road Mirror will NOT fit on most Shimano STI levers installed on bikes after Spring 2010.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PNYGqfHTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BYK3WE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BZK8S2", "title": "Frogg Toggs Chilly Pad Cooling Towel", "description": "Frogg Togg Chilly Pad is an innovative way to keep cool during a workout, hard ride, tough climb or any other strenuous activity. When wet, the towel becomes considerably cooler than the outside air, thereby providing cooling relief to the user. When it stops cooling, simply re-wet the towel and wring it out. Machine washable.", "text": "Frogg Toggs Chilly Pad Cooling Towel Frogg Togg Chilly Pad is an innovative way to keep cool during a workout, hard ride, tough climb or any other strenuous activity. When wet, the towel becomes considerably cooler than the outside air, thereby providing cooling relief to the user. When it stops cooling, simply re-wet the towel and wring it out. Machine washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w-lF8CeeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BZK8S2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frogg Toggs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 11.11}}
{"item_id": "B001BZPJRC", "title": "NcStar Airsoft/Paintball LED Flashlight/Quick Release Weaver (AQPTF)", "description": "Illuminate the path ahead with your paintball or airsoft gun with this LED flashlight from NcStar. Designed for airsoft/paintball pistols or rifles, the flashlight is built to match your weapon, with a hard-anodized aluminum construction with reinforced nylon. The flashlight also includes a quick-release mounting latch that attaches to Weaver-style rails, so you can light up almost any Weaver-equipped weapon. Other features include an output of 35 lumens, a right-to-left toggle switch, and a CR123A lithium battery.Mounting the Flashlight:To mount your LED Flashlight onto your Weaver/Picatinny style rail, grasp the unit by the main body and position the unit in front of the rail so the flashlight bezel is facing in the same direction as the muzzle of the firearm. Depress the Quick Release Lever and slide the flashlight straight back and align the recoil stud on the Quick Release mount with one of the recoil groove (s) on the rail of the firearm, until the unit locks into place. Your Tactical Flashlight is now securely mounted to your firearm.WARNING: The flashlight will securely mount on to most Weaver/Picatinny rails, but not all (depending on the location of the cross-slots on the rail itself).Removing the Flashlight:To dismount the Tactical Laser or Flashlight, grasp the Main Body and depress the Quick Release Lever. Slide the unit forward until it has cleared the rail on the firearm completely. Your Tactical Laser or LED Flashlight is now dismounted.SpecificationsBulb: 1-watt LEDPower output: 35 lumensBattery type: CR123A lithium (included)Bezel diameter: 1 inchBody width: 1 inchSliding on/off switch: YesLength: 2.95 inchesWeight: 3.1 ounces", "text": "NcStar Airsoft/Paintball LED Flashlight/Quick Release Weaver (AQPTF) Illuminate the path ahead with your paintball or airsoft gun with this LED flashlight from NcStar. Designed for airsoft/paintball pistols or rifles, the flashlight is built to match your weapon, with a hard-anodized aluminum construction with reinforced nylon. The flashlight also includes a quick-release mounting latch that attaches to Weaver-style rails, so you can light up almost any Weaver-equipped weapon. Other features include an output of 35 lumens, a right-to-left toggle switch, and a CR123A lithium battery.Mounting the Flashlight:To mount your LED Flashlight onto your Weaver/Picatinny style rail, grasp the unit by the main body and position the unit in front of the rail so the flashlight bezel is facing in the same direction as the muzzle of the firearm. Depress the Quick Release Lever and slide the flashlight straight back and align the recoil stud on the Quick Release mount with one of the recoil groove (s) on the rail of the firearm, until the unit locks into place. Your Tactical Flashlight is now securely mounted to your firearm.WARNING: The flashlight will securely mount on to most Weaver/Picatinny rails, but not all (depending on the location of the cross-slots on the rail itself).Removing the Flashlight:To dismount the Tactical Laser or Flashlight, grasp the Main Body and depress the Quick Release Lever. Slide the unit forward until it has cleared the rail on the firearm completely. Your Tactical Laser or LED Flashlight is now dismounted.SpecificationsBulb: 1-watt LEDPower output: 35 lumensBattery type: CR123A lithium (included)Bezel diameter: 1 inchBody width: 1 inchSliding on/off switch: YesLength: 2.95 inchesWeight: 3.1 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y1fkDL1ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BZPJRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B001BZURZG", "title": "Self Defense Keychain Kubotan", "description": "The kubotan is a pressure point self defense device. the principal areas for attacks in self-defense include bony, fleshy and nerve targets such as knuckles, forearms, bridge of the nose, shins, stomach, solar plexus, spine, temple, ribs, groin, neck, eyes etc. The Kubotan is usually held in either an icepick grip (for hammerfist strikes) or forward grip (for stabbing and pressure point attacks). Common uses include hardening the fist (fistload) for punching, attacking vulnerable parts of an assailant's body, and gaining leverage on an assailant's wrist, fingers and joints. With keys attached, it can also function as a flailing weapon. Self Defense keychain kubotan Composition: polymer Length: 5 7/16\" Weight: 2.4 oz. Color: Black", "text": "Self Defense Keychain Kubotan The kubotan is a pressure point self defense device. the principal areas for attacks in self-defense include bony, fleshy and nerve targets such as knuckles, forearms, bridge of the nose, shins, stomach, solar plexus, spine, temple, ribs, groin, neck, eyes etc. The Kubotan is usually held in either an icepick grip (for hammerfist strikes) or forward grip (for stabbing and pressure point attacks). Common uses include hardening the fist (fistload) for punching, attacking vulnerable parts of an assailant's body, and gaining leverage on an assailant's wrist, fingers and joints. With keys attached, it can also function as a flailing weapon. Self Defense keychain kubotan Composition: polymer Length: 5 7/16\" Weight: 2.4 oz. Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jht4EFaGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BZURZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dynamic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Batons"]], "price": 1.46}}
{"item_id": "B001BZYPYU", "title": "Shimano Spinning Reel Cover", "description": "Shimano Spinning Reel Covers. Protect your reels with these super-tough Neoprene Reel Covers! No more scratches, gouges, or other marring when your reel is kept safetly inside. All sides are made of neoprene in an attempt to absorb all the bumps and abrasion it might usually take. Design allows for the Cover to stay attached whether the reel is mounted on your fishing rod, or not. Has a Shimano screen-printed logo on the outside, as well. Choose from a small or medium-sized Spinning Reel Cover. State Size. Order yours today! Shimano Spinning Reel Cover", "text": "Shimano Spinning Reel Cover Shimano Spinning Reel Covers. Protect your reels with these super-tough Neoprene Reel Covers! No more scratches, gouges, or other marring when your reel is kept safetly inside. All sides are made of neoprene in an attempt to absorb all the bumps and abrasion it might usually take. Design allows for the Cover to stay attached whether the reel is mounted on your fishing rod, or not. Has a Shimano screen-printed logo on the outside, as well. Choose from a small or medium-sized Spinning Reel Cover. State Size. Order yours today! Shimano Spinning Reel Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nqvaCTGCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001BZYPYU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001C0E7CE", "title": "Crosman .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 1250ct", "description": "This wadcutter pellet is the standard and most practical pellet for plinking and back yard target practice. Crosman has always produced a quality pellet and these pellets are some of our best. The pellet's flat head and grooved skirt provide excellent accuracy. Plink with the best...Plink with Crosman pellets. 1250 per carton.", "text": "Crosman .177 Cal, 7.4 Grains, Wadcutter, 1250ct This wadcutter pellet is the standard and most practical pellet for plinking and back yard target practice. Crosman has always produced a quality pellet and these pellets are some of our best. The pellet's flat head and grooved skirt provide excellent accuracy. Plink with the best...Plink with Crosman pellets. 1250 per carton.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51c3w2Ai1TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0E7CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B001C0E7FG", "title": "Gamo PBA Armor .177 Cal, 6.8 Grains, Domed, 80ct", "description": "New ARMOR Performance Ballistic Alloy, the non-lead Alloy Airgun Ammunition that increases piercing power up to 20% over lead, while maintaining “match grade” accuracy. Specifically designed as a hunting load, the new P.B.A.™ ARMOR ammunition is 50% harder than lead causing penetration to be enhanced by up to 100% in tests in actual hunting situations as well as ballistic mediums. ARMOR P.B.A. test results show ballistic stability at super-sonic speeds and up to 90% weight retention using the new semi-pointed design. Comes in a 80 count .177cal rocket package. Do not with airgun traps, be sure of your target and beyond.", "text": "Gamo PBA Armor .177 Cal, 6.8 Grains, Domed, 80ct New ARMOR Performance Ballistic Alloy, the non-lead Alloy Airgun Ammunition that increases piercing power up to 20% over lead, while maintaining “match grade” accuracy. Specifically designed as a hunting load, the new P.B.A.™ ARMOR ammunition is 50% harder than lead causing penetration to be enhanced by up to 100% in tests in actual hunting situations as well as ballistic mediums. ARMOR P.B.A. test results show ballistic stability at super-sonic speeds and up to 90% weight retention using the new semi-pointed design. Comes in a 80 count .177cal rocket package. Do not with airgun traps, be sure of your target and beyond.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61%2BWA7OtWUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0E7FG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 11.62}}
{"item_id": "B001C0IDVU", "title": "Insight X2 Sub-Compact Weapon Light with Light", "description": "When it comes to concealed carry low light versatility, nothing beats the X2 and X2L. This is the world's first and best sub-compact weapon-mounted light and laser/light combo. The X2 features include a slide-lock interface, focusable beam, and intuitive rocker switch with Constant and Momentary modes. The X2's peak output is 40+ Lumens, and it comes with a limited lifetime warranty.", "text": "Insight X2 Sub-Compact Weapon Light with Light When it comes to concealed carry low light versatility, nothing beats the X2 and X2L. This is the world's first and best sub-compact weapon-mounted light and laser/light combo. The X2 features include a slide-lock interface, focusable beam, and intuitive rocker switch with Constant and Momentary modes. The X2's peak output is 40+ Lumens, and it comes with a limited lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41My7sxoJSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0IDVU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 139.0}}
{"item_id": "B001C0JKVM", "title": "Fobus Sig Sauer Mosquito Holster", "description": "Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "text": "Fobus Sig Sauer Mosquito Holster Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ewDi7p0pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0JKVM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.61}}
{"item_id": "B001C0JRS8", "title": "Maxpedition M-2 Waistpack", "description": "M-2 Waistpack (#0308) is Maxpedition’s smallest modular pocket, offering even lower profile than the best-selling M-1.", "text": "Maxpedition M-2 Waistpack M-2 Waistpack (#0308) is Maxpedition’s smallest modular pocket, offering even lower profile than the best-selling M-1.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61rSGFnQUeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0JRS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
