{"item_id": "B001C0LS6W", "title": "Berkley Vanish Fluorocarbon Leader Materials (20-Pound,Clear)", "description": "Easy casting Berkley Vanish has become the top selling fluorocarbon fishing line in the U.S. and Canada. We have been continuously improving the Vanish formula since it was first introduced 10 years ago! This newest Vanish formula has 20% more shock strength than the previous formula – without sacrificing the handling properties that has made Vanish America’s favorite.", "text": "Berkley Vanish Fluorocarbon Leader Materials (20-Pound,Clear) Easy casting Berkley Vanish has become the top selling fluorocarbon fishing line in the U.S. and Canada. We have been continuously improving the Vanish formula since it was first introduced 10 years ago! This newest Vanish formula has 20% more shock strength than the previous formula – without sacrificing the handling properties that has made Vanish America’s favorite.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AOyX-C1JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0LS6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Berkley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Leaders & Leader Rigging", "Leaders"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C0PUDY", "title": "EOTech 552.A65/1 Military HOLOgraphic Weapon Sight", "description": "Standardized by the DEA, ATF, and FBI SWAT team, the Model 552 holographic weapon sight is the sight of choice for such military units as the Stryker Brigade, 10th Mountain, and 3rd Infantry. The Model 552 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The Model 552 is built to last, with a rugged aluminum hood assembly and knobbed, tool-free mounting bolt. The battle-proven design can withstand the abuse that any harsh environment, high-powered weapon platform, or military mission can dish out. Other features include a 65 MOA ring reticle with a 1 MOA aiming dot; support for two 1.5-volt AA batteries (lithium or alkaline); unlimited eye relief; and 30 brightness settings. The Model 552 is compatible with Gen I-IV night vision systems and mounts on 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver rails.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 33 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 1 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: 1280:1 with NV switch engagedPower source: Two 1.5-volt AA batteries (supports lithium, alkaline, or rechargeables)Battery life: 1,000 continuous hours (lithium) at nominal setting; 600 continuous hours (alkaline)Brightness settings: 30 with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)Auto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 5.4 by 2.25 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 10.9 ounces", "text": "EOTech 552.A65/1 Military HOLOgraphic Weapon Sight Standardized by the DEA, ATF, and FBI SWAT team, the Model 552 holographic weapon sight is the sight of choice for such military units as the Stryker Brigade, 10th Mountain, and 3rd Infantry. The Model 552 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The Model 552 is built to last, with a rugged aluminum hood assembly and knobbed, tool-free mounting bolt. The battle-proven design can withstand the abuse that any harsh environment, high-powered weapon platform, or military mission can dish out. Other features include a 65 MOA ring reticle with a 1 MOA aiming dot; support for two 1.5-volt AA batteries (lithium or alkaline); unlimited eye relief; and 30 brightness settings. The Model 552 is compatible with Gen I-IV night vision systems and mounts on 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver rails.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 33 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 1 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: 1280:1 with NV switch engagedPower source: Two 1.5-volt AA batteries (supports lithium, alkaline, or rechargeables)Battery life: 1,000 continuous hours (lithium) at nominal setting; 600 continuous hours (alkaline)Brightness settings: 30 with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)Auto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 5.4 by 2.25 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 10.9 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KL4%2BbRajL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0PUDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 529.0}}
{"item_id": "B001C0TUQM", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Pink Gun (Pink/Black, 35.4 Inch)", "description": "The Daisy 1998 is a classic-style BB repeater with a saddle ring and pink leather saddle tie, making it ideal for female adolescents. The 1998 features a blade-and-ramp front sight and adjustable open rear sight, improving your accuracy with every shot. The 0.177-caliber 1998 offers a maximum velocity of 350 feet per second and a capacity of 650 shots. The BB rifle is recommended for ages 10 and older with adult supervision, making the 1998 an excellent training model.SpecificationsAction: Lever cocking, spring airSights: Blade-and-ramp front, adjustable open rearSafety: Cross-bolt trigger blockMuzzle velocity: 350 fpsCaliber: 0.177Stock, forearm, and grip: Painted solid woodBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 195 yardsCapacity: 650 shotsReceiver: Stamped metal, saddle ring with leather thongLength: 36.4 inchesWeight: 2.2 pounds", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Pink Gun (Pink/Black, 35.4 Inch) The Daisy 1998 is a classic-style BB repeater with a saddle ring and pink leather saddle tie, making it ideal for female adolescents. The 1998 features a blade-and-ramp front sight and adjustable open rear sight, improving your accuracy with every shot. The 0.177-caliber 1998 offers a maximum velocity of 350 feet per second and a capacity of 650 shots. The BB rifle is recommended for ages 10 and older with adult supervision, making the 1998 an excellent training model.SpecificationsAction: Lever cocking, spring airSights: Blade-and-ramp front, adjustable open rearSafety: Cross-bolt trigger blockMuzzle velocity: 350 fpsCaliber: 0.177Stock, forearm, and grip: Painted solid woodBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 195 yardsCapacity: 650 shotsReceiver: Stamped metal, saddle ring with leather thongLength: 36.4 inchesWeight: 2.2 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21hvav%2BA00L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C0TUQM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 35.5}}
{"item_id": "B001C10JUM", "title": "Joist Mount Chin Up Bar", "description": "Great for basement mounting. Can be mounted in out of the way locations. Four grip covers. 4- 3/8\" mounting bolts with hardware included. Same day shipping if order is placed in morning. Made out of heavy 14 gauge material not light weight 16 gauge material. 23 1/2\" between brackets.", "text": "Joist Mount Chin Up Bar Great for basement mounting. Can be mounted in out of the way locations. Four grip covers. 4- 3/8\" mounting bolts with hardware included. Same day shipping if order is placed in morning. Made out of heavy 14 gauge material not light weight 16 gauge material. 23 1/2\" between brackets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q3yKhnpQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C10JUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 48.95}}
{"item_id": "B001C1A362", "title": "Coleman SunDome 7-Foot by 7-Foot 3-Person Dome Tent (Orange/Gray)", "description": "Ideal for compact camping adventures, the Coleman Sundome 3 Tent sleeps three comfortably thanks to its seven-by-seven-foot (W x D) layout and four-foot, four-inch center height.A new Ground Vent and privacy vent window improve airflow, which can be controlled with Coleman's unique VariFlow adjustable ventilation system. A convenient electrical access port lets you run a cord from your device in the tent to an outside power source, while an interior gear pocket helps you keep things organized.Setup is quick and simple--taking ten minutes or less--thanks two a two-pole dome design, color-coded poles and continuous pole sleeves, shock-corded fiberglass poles, an exclusive pin-and-ring design, and InstaClip attachments. Straightforward instructions are sewn into the convenient carry bag, and separate stake and pole bags are also included.Coleman's WeatherTec SystemThis proprietary series of interworking features keeps the weather where it belongs--outside the tent--at all times.Leak-free Seams:In addition to fully-taped rainfly seams, the rainfly covers doors and windows, and incorporates easy-to-use Velcro frame attachmentsWeather-resistant Fabric:Coated polyester fabric combined with anti-wicking thread, webbing, and zippers are designed to keep you dryProtected Seams:Inverted floor seams dramatically increase weather resistance by hiding needle holes inside the tent, away from the elementsWaterproof Floors:Welding technology strengthens the tent floor and eliminates needle holesZipper Protection:Zipper cuff adds protection from the elements to the doorWind Strong Frame:Engineered to be a stronger, more wind-responsive frame by using redesigned poles and guy-out triangles to anchor tents and increase performanceSpecifications75-denier polyester taffeta fly68-denier polyester mesh inner tent8.5-millimeter fiberglass polesThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Sundome 3 Tent includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman SunDome 7-Foot by 7-Foot 3-Person Dome Tent (Orange/Gray) Ideal for compact camping adventures, the Coleman Sundome 3 Tent sleeps three comfortably thanks to its seven-by-seven-foot (W x D) layout and four-foot, four-inch center height.A new Ground Vent and privacy vent window improve airflow, which can be controlled with Coleman's unique VariFlow adjustable ventilation system. A convenient electrical access port lets you run a cord from your device in the tent to an outside power source, while an interior gear pocket helps you keep things organized.Setup is quick and simple--taking ten minutes or less--thanks two a two-pole dome design, color-coded poles and continuous pole sleeves, shock-corded fiberglass poles, an exclusive pin-and-ring design, and InstaClip attachments. Straightforward instructions are sewn into the convenient carry bag, and separate stake and pole bags are also included.Coleman's WeatherTec SystemThis proprietary series of interworking features keeps the weather where it belongs--outside the tent--at all times.Leak-free Seams:In addition to fully-taped rainfly seams, the rainfly covers doors and windows, and incorporates easy-to-use Velcro frame attachmentsWeather-resistant Fabric:Coated polyester fabric combined with anti-wicking thread, webbing, and zippers are designed to keep you dryProtected Seams:Inverted floor seams dramatically increase weather resistance by hiding needle holes inside the tent, away from the elementsWaterproof Floors:Welding technology strengthens the tent floor and eliminates needle holesZipper Protection:Zipper cuff adds protection from the elements to the doorWind Strong Frame:Engineered to be a stronger, more wind-responsive frame by using redesigned poles and guy-out triangles to anchor tents and increase performanceSpecifications75-denier polyester taffeta fly68-denier polyester mesh inner tent8.5-millimeter fiberglass polesThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Sundome 3 Tent includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-7DQsT1%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1A362.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 61.77}}
{"item_id": "B001C1JD54", "title": "Tactical Universal Fit Drop Leg Pistol Holster For Colt SIG Beretta S&W Ruger Hk", "description": "Tactical Universal Fit Drop Leg Pistol Holster Features: Padded leg harness w/ straps attaches to your leg and belt. Adjustable width and length for custom fit. Fits most medium & large frame auto pistols including Beretta M9/92F PX4 Storm, Browning Hi-Power, Colt 1911, Hk USP Tactical, Ruger P series, S&W; 4506, SIG P226/P228, Springfield XD, Taurus 24/7 OSS, Walther P99 + more. Holster can be detached from leg harness to use as a belt holster. Built in mag pouch. Black color. Manufacture warranty against defects, Brand New !", "text": "Tactical Universal Fit Drop Leg Pistol Holster For Colt SIG Beretta S&W Ruger Hk Tactical Universal Fit Drop Leg Pistol Holster Features: Padded leg harness w/ straps attaches to your leg and belt. Adjustable width and length for custom fit. Fits most medium & large frame auto pistols including Beretta M9/92F PX4 Storm, Browning Hi-Power, Colt 1911, Hk USP Tactical, Ruger P series, S&W; 4506, SIG P226/P228, Springfield XD, Taurus 24/7 OSS, Walther P99 + more. Holster can be detached from leg harness to use as a belt holster. Built in mag pouch. Black color. Manufacture warranty against defects, Brand New !", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RAFrOkOvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1JD54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TGS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C1JR5U", "title": "NcSTAR 3 - 9x42 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "description": "NcSTAR Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope. Mark III Series Scope delivers BIG quality and performance features in a compact size. Comes with an adjustable-brightness illuminated green reticle. NcSTAR's commitment to quality is evident from the fully multi-coated optics to the 1-Pc. high-grade aluminum tube, and it'll be evident from the time you take your first shot! Features: Reticle illuminates in green or red, with multiple brightness settings to match conditions; Fully multi-coated optics for superior contrast Quick focus eyepiece for fast targeting; Integrated quick-release mount; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for a .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Open target turrets; Built-in sunshade; Includes lens cover and extra battery.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 3X-9X; Objective Size: 42 mm; F.O.V.: 36.8-12'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Mount Style: Weaver/Picatinny; Length / Weight: 7.5\"/16.7 ozs. WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 3-9x42 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope, Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "text": "NcSTAR 3 - 9x42 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope Weaver / Picatinny Mount NcSTAR Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope. Mark III Series Scope delivers BIG quality and performance features in a compact size. Comes with an adjustable-brightness illuminated green reticle. NcSTAR's commitment to quality is evident from the fully multi-coated optics to the 1-Pc. high-grade aluminum tube, and it'll be evident from the time you take your first shot! Features: Reticle illuminates in green or red, with multiple brightness settings to match conditions; Fully multi-coated optics for superior contrast Quick focus eyepiece for fast targeting; Integrated quick-release mount; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for a .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Open target turrets; Built-in sunshade; Includes lens cover and extra battery.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 3X-9X; Objective Size: 42 mm; F.O.V.: 36.8-12'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Mount Style: Weaver/Picatinny; Length / Weight: 7.5\"/16.7 ozs. WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 3-9x42 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope, Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KeGzq-GqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1JR5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 139.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C1RQO4", "title": "Nalgene 12 Oz Flask", "description": "A sip on your hip for quick refreshment. Nalgene ingenuity makes it leak proof; a slender profile makes it less bulky. Wherever you're going and whatever you're drinking, take along a Nalgene flask. Features one-ounce cap, fits easily into bags and packs and includes a durable insulation sleeve. Suitable for long-term beverage storage. Prevents plastic odor and taste. Volume: 12 oz (350 ml).", "text": "Nalgene 12 Oz Flask A sip on your hip for quick refreshment. Nalgene ingenuity makes it leak proof; a slender profile makes it less bulky. Wherever you're going and whatever you're drinking, take along a Nalgene flask. Features one-ounce cap, fits easily into bags and packs and includes a durable insulation sleeve. Suitable for long-term beverage storage. Prevents plastic odor and taste. Volume: 12 oz (350 ml).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dhNgnzZKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1RQO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C1TCXC", "title": "Nalgene Encapsul Bladder, 3 L", "description": "Encapsul is produced using only \"saturated\" polymers. High strength created by blending high-modulus stiff material with low-modulus elastic material to create an energy absorbing strength. Super clean polyethylene encapsulates a flexible core of TPE. Rapid fill cap has 63mm opening.", "text": "Nalgene Encapsul Bladder, 3 L Encapsul is produced using only \"saturated\" polymers. High strength created by blending high-modulus stiff material with low-modulus elastic material to create an energy absorbing strength. Super clean polyethylene encapsulates a flexible core of TPE. Rapid fill cap has 63mm opening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TcsnarBYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1TCXC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Hydration Packs & Bladders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001C1UGVO", "title": "Esbit Ultralight Folding Pocket Stove with Six 14g Solid Fuel Tablets", "description": "Ideal for backpacking, camping as well as home and auto emergency kits, the Esbit Pocket Stove folds compact enough to fit in a pocket. Constructed from durable, galvanized steel, the Esbit Pocket Stove features two selectable cooking grades and are suitable for use with cups, pots, and pans. Includes six Esbit 14 g solid fuel tablets that will burn about 12 minutes each. Extra fuel tablets can be stored inside the stove. Closed dimensions: 3.9 x 3 x 0.9 inches. Weight (including fuel) 6.3 oz (180g).", "text": "Esbit Ultralight Folding Pocket Stove with Six 14g Solid Fuel Tablets Ideal for backpacking, camping as well as home and auto emergency kits, the Esbit Pocket Stove folds compact enough to fit in a pocket. Constructed from durable, galvanized steel, the Esbit Pocket Stove features two selectable cooking grades and are suitable for use with cups, pots, and pans. Includes six Esbit 14 g solid fuel tablets that will burn about 12 minutes each. Extra fuel tablets can be stored inside the stove. Closed dimensions: 3.9 x 3 x 0.9 inches. Weight (including fuel) 6.3 oz (180g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HNxOf0eqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1UGVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Esbit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B001C1UGZ0", "title": "Hennessy Explorer Deluxe Asym Classic Hammock", "description": "Hennessy Explorer Deluxe Asym Classic: Classic bottom entry hammock with velcro closure. The Explorer Deluxe A-sym is a foot longer than the Expedition Asym and was designed for anyone up to 300 lbs /136kg and up to 7' / 213 cm tall. It has the same durable materials, proportions and protection as the smaller Expedition A-sym at an affordable price.", "text": "Hennessy Explorer Deluxe Asym Classic Hammock Hennessy Explorer Deluxe Asym Classic: Classic bottom entry hammock with velcro closure. The Explorer Deluxe A-sym is a foot longer than the Expedition Asym and was designed for anyone up to 300 lbs /136kg and up to 7' / 213 cm tall. It has the same durable materials, proportions and protection as the smaller Expedition A-sym at an affordable price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ty6XNeTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C1UGZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hennessy Hammock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 197.96}}
