{"item_id": "B001C2LGPI", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37SN-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools E37SN-CP Seal Pup Elite Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 4.85-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bUAlSEbuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C2LGPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 65.5}}
{"item_id": "B001C31AGC", "title": "SE 6-in-1 Survival Whistle", "description": "This 7-in-1 survival whistle with LED flashlight set includes: whistle, compass, thermometer (fahrenheit & celsius), 5x magnifier, mirror for signaling, white LED flashlight. It has a green plastic body and is 4in long. It has a compass diameter of 3/4in. Comes with a lanyard. Requires 2CR2016 batteries (batteries are included). Great for camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, outdoor activities, travel, in survival kits, etc.", "text": "SE 6-in-1 Survival Whistle This 7-in-1 survival whistle with LED flashlight set includes: whistle, compass, thermometer (fahrenheit & celsius), 5x magnifier, mirror for signaling, white LED flashlight. It has a green plastic body and is 4in long. It has a compass diameter of 3/4in. Comes with a lanyard. Requires 2CR2016 batteries (batteries are included). Great for camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, outdoor activities, travel, in survival kits, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lovv5rcRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C31AGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.88}}
{"item_id": "B001C36CX8", "title": "SE Lensatic Compass", "description": "This Military Style Lensatic Marching Compass easily folds to fit in your pocket. The compass is highly accurate and features a liquid-damped compass card with a luminous dial that can easily be read at night, and a standard bezel with two yellow lines at 45 degree angles. The compass card has both the standard 0 - 360 degree scale, as well as the 0 - 64 Mil scale (one yard at 1,000 yards). The bezel rotates with detents every 3 degrees so you can change the heading reference a known amount without looking at the compass. The front sight has a magnifier to simultaneously view the magnetic heading when taking a sight. A second magnifier assists in reading the magnetic heading when direct viewing from above. When unfolded flat, the marching compass has a straight edge with a standard 1:50,000 map scale. This compass is protected by a durable cast metal case painted dark green military drab. Comes with nylon carrying pouch with belt loop.", "text": "SE Lensatic Compass This Military Style Lensatic Marching Compass easily folds to fit in your pocket. The compass is highly accurate and features a liquid-damped compass card with a luminous dial that can easily be read at night, and a standard bezel with two yellow lines at 45 degree angles. The compass card has both the standard 0 - 360 degree scale, as well as the 0 - 64 Mil scale (one yard at 1,000 yards). The bezel rotates with detents every 3 degrees so you can change the heading reference a known amount without looking at the compass. The front sight has a magnifier to simultaneously view the magnetic heading when taking a sight. A second magnifier assists in reading the magnetic heading when direct viewing from above. When unfolded flat, the marching compass has a straight edge with a standard 1:50,000 map scale. This compass is protected by a durable cast metal case painted dark green military drab. Comes with nylon carrying pouch with belt loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oPZ2jJKOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C36CX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 5.06}}
{"item_id": "B001C36R4W", "title": "Insight M3 Weapon Light", "description": "The M3 is known for its rugged reliability, with a peak output of 90+ Lumens its no wonder that that it can be found in more law enforcement holsters than any other light today. It features Insight's Universal Slide-Lock interface for easy, tool-free mounting. The ambidextrous backplate rocker switch allows the M3 to be activated in either a Momentary On or Constant On with optional remote backplates, the M3 can be used on rifles and shotguns as well.", "text": "Insight M3 Weapon Light The M3 is known for its rugged reliability, with a peak output of 90+ Lumens its no wonder that that it can be found in more law enforcement holsters than any other light today. It features Insight's Universal Slide-Lock interface for easy, tool-free mounting. The ambidextrous backplate rocker switch allows the M3 to be activated in either a Momentary On or Constant On with optional remote backplates, the M3 can be used on rifles and shotguns as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zQI0IfteL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C36R4W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Insight Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 97.17}}
{"item_id": "B001C3704S", "title": "NcSTAR 2-6x28 Compact Riflescope, Matte Black SC2628B", "description": "NcSTAR 2-6x28 Compact Riflescope, Matte Black SC2628B", "text": "NcSTAR 2-6x28 Compact Riflescope, Matte Black SC2628B NcSTAR 2-6x28 Compact Riflescope, Matte Black SC2628B", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bmlfNPeSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3704S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C39Y24", "title": "NcSTAR 2 - 7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope", "description": "NcSTAR 2 - 7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope. Low light? Bummer. Unless, of course, you're favorite hardware's sporting an Illuminated Reticle Scope from NcSTAR! It's just the thing you need to put your crosshairs right where they need to be when light is scarce. Of course, all the light in the world won't matter a lick if the scope's a melon... well, with NcSTAR you can rely on superior optical quality and relentless durability plus variable magnification to help you drill that round home. Outfit your ordnance the right way: Illuminated mil-plex reticle; Variable 2-7X magnification goes from scan to zoom to shoot in a jiffy; Generous 32 mm objective size produces bright images; Long 10 3/4\" @7X 8 3/4\" @ 2X eye relief for extended mounting capabilities; Multi-coated lenses offer top contrast; 1/2 M.O.A. adjustments; 1\" tube diameter; F.O.V.@ 100 yds. is 14' at 2X, 4.5' at 7X; Measures 11\", 9 1/2 ozs. Includes weaver-style rings and lens caps. State Finish. Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. NcSTAR 2-7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope", "text": "NcSTAR 2 - 7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope NcSTAR 2 - 7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope. Low light? Bummer. Unless, of course, you're favorite hardware's sporting an Illuminated Reticle Scope from NcSTAR! It's just the thing you need to put your crosshairs right where they need to be when light is scarce. Of course, all the light in the world won't matter a lick if the scope's a melon... well, with NcSTAR you can rely on superior optical quality and relentless durability plus variable magnification to help you drill that round home. Outfit your ordnance the right way: Illuminated mil-plex reticle; Variable 2-7X magnification goes from scan to zoom to shoot in a jiffy; Generous 32 mm objective size produces bright images; Long 10 3/4\" @7X 8 3/4\" @ 2X eye relief for extended mounting capabilities; Multi-coated lenses offer top contrast; 1/2 M.O.A. adjustments; 1\" tube diameter; F.O.V.@ 100 yds. is 14' at 2X, 4.5' at 7X; Measures 11\", 9 1/2 ozs. Includes weaver-style rings and lens caps. State Finish. Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. NcSTAR 2-7x32 mm AO Illuminated Reticle Pistol Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BgtsjrT5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C39Y24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 56.65}}
