{"item_id": "B001C3EC12", "title": "Zoggs Aqua Plugz", "description": "Ergonomically shaped ear plugs for ultra comfort and superb water protection. Moulded silicone ear plugs. Ergonomically shaped to fit the outer ear. Ultra comfort fit. Hypo-allergenic. Re-usable with a handy protective carry case.", "text": "Zoggs Aqua Plugz Ergonomically shaped ear plugs for ultra comfort and superb water protection. Moulded silicone ear plugs. Ergonomically shaped to fit the outer ear. Ultra comfort fit. Hypo-allergenic. Re-usable with a handy protective carry case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UgWrFN%2BgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3EC12.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Earplugs"]]}}
