{"item_id": "B001C3LEMW", "title": "Nite Ize Small Figure 9 Rope Tightener", "description": "The Small Figure 9 Rope Tightener by Nite Ize eliminates the frustration of losing tension in your rope while tying a knot or wasting time untying a difficult knot. The patented Figure 9 tightens, tensions, and secures ropes without knots and makes tightening any line a stress-free task. From bundling fire wood for your next camping trip to tying down trunk lids, this handy tool handles small tie-down jobs quickly and keeps the tension where you need it. Loop your rope through its strategically designed prongs, pull it tight, and it stays that way. It's a smart alternative to complicated cam-locking devices or bungee cords. The Figure 9 also controls the release of high tension, avoiding sudden and dangerous unloading.Product weight: .13 oz.", "text": "Nite Ize Small Figure 9 Rope Tightener The Small Figure 9 Rope Tightener by Nite Ize eliminates the frustration of losing tension in your rope while tying a knot or wasting time untying a difficult knot. The patented Figure 9 tightens, tensions, and secures ropes without knots and makes tightening any line a stress-free task. From bundling fire wood for your next camping trip to tying down trunk lids, this handy tool handles small tie-down jobs quickly and keeps the tension where you need it. Loop your rope through its strategically designed prongs, pull it tight, and it stays that way. It's a smart alternative to complicated cam-locking devices or bungee cords. The Figure 9 also controls the release of high tension, avoiding sudden and dangerous unloading.Product weight: .13 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41opE7Cz6TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3LEMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C3Q9BI", "title": "Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter", "description": "Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Several caliber-size housings available to fit all of your favorite firearms. Save time, money and frustration with Sightmark! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; Includes carrying case; Several sizes available. State Size. Pinpoint precision is yours when you order now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter", "text": "Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Several caliber-size housings available to fit all of your favorite firearms. Save time, money and frustration with Sightmark! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; Includes carrying case; Several sizes available. State Size. Pinpoint precision is yours when you order now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. Sightmark Laser Pistol Boresighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pBmXfDxhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3Q9BI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001C3S7G8", "title": "Sightmark Universal Bore Sight (Red)", "description": "The Sightmark Universal Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles and pistols of all types. Simply place the base of the bore sight onto the end of the barrel of your weapon and it will attach magnetically. A laser dot will show exactly where your gun is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark Universal laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the bore sight for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark Universal laser bore sight is protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Sightmark Universal Bore Sight (Red) The Sightmark Universal Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles and pistols of all types. Simply place the base of the bore sight onto the end of the barrel of your weapon and it will attach magnetically. A laser dot will show exactly where your gun is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark Universal laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the bore sight for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark Universal laser bore sight is protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yOOnbSvqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3S7G8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Sights"]], "price": 33.89}}
{"item_id": "B001C3WXJ0", "title": "Ontario 6143 493 M9 Bayonet System (Black)", "description": "The Ontario Knife 493 M9 Bayonet and Scabbard is current issue to the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Textured thermoplastic nylon handle. Fits M16, M4 and AR-15. Includes M9 scabbard with quick release holster made of thermoplastic nylon that includes wire cutter and screwdriver.", "text": "Ontario 6143 493 M9 Bayonet System (Black) The Ontario Knife 493 M9 Bayonet and Scabbard is current issue to the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Textured thermoplastic nylon handle. Fits M16, M4 and AR-15. Includes M9 scabbard with quick release holster made of thermoplastic nylon that includes wire cutter and screwdriver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412JC9PfO6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3WXJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 93.97}}
{"item_id": "B001C3YBCW", "title": "ALMAR ALS2K Sere 2000 Stainless Steel", "description": "Al Mar Sere 2000 Linerlock Knife: Model AM-S2K. 4 7/8\" closed linerlock. Satin finish VG-10 steel false edge spear point blade with easy open thumb stud. Textured G-10 handles with reversible pocket clip and lanyard hole.", "text": "ALMAR ALS2K Sere 2000 Stainless Steel Al Mar Sere 2000 Linerlock Knife: Model AM-S2K. 4 7/8\" closed linerlock. Satin finish VG-10 steel false edge spear point blade with easy open thumb stud. Textured G-10 handles with reversible pocket clip and lanyard hole.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zxdx1EzfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C3YBCW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Al Mar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 220.8}}
{"item_id": "B001C4363Q", "title": "Radians Lowset Low-Profile Hearing Protection Muff with Behing The Neck Band", "description": "Behind the head wire designed to be used with a hat. These pink colored muffs are a bit smaller than standard industrial types. These pink ear muffs are designed especially for the hard working woman. 21 Decibal Noise Reduction Rating.", "text": "Radians Lowset Low-Profile Hearing Protection Muff with Behing The Neck Band Behind the head wire designed to be used with a hat. These pink colored muffs are a bit smaller than standard industrial types. These pink ear muffs are designed especially for the hard working woman. 21 Decibal Noise Reduction Rating.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FU8ZOoqDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C4363Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 10.69}}
{"item_id": "B001C443VA", "title": "Ontario Knives Air Force Survival w/ Sheath 499", "description": "The Ontario Knife 499 Air Force Survival Knife is a current issue to the U.S. Air Force as well as other branches the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Stacked leather washer handle with grip grooves. Steel butt cap. Includes leather sheath with sharpening stone and tie down cord.", "text": "Ontario Knives Air Force Survival w/ Sheath 499 The Ontario Knife 499 Air Force Survival Knife is a current issue to the U.S. Air Force as well as other branches the U.S. military. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Modified stainless steel blade with milled sawteeth on back. Black oxide non-reflective finish. Stacked leather washer handle with grip grooves. Steel butt cap. Includes leather sheath with sharpening stone and tie down cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ACZKBYp8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C443VA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife Co", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 49.79}}
{"item_id": "B001C4N8YS", "title": "Jagwire Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit", "description": "Lighter, faster, and more colorful -- all superlatives that confidently describe Jagwire's Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit. This kit features a compression-less, Kevlar-reinforced housing and a fully-lubricated Light Lube Liner (L3). And because of this, the housing is up to 30% lighter, and considerably stronger, than standard housings. But, let us not forget that you also have eight color choices. Of course, aesthetics are important, but only second to actual performance gains. And that's what you get with the Jagwire Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit. Its L3 technology adds lubricant to the already slippery Teflon-coated stainless steel cables. So, they glide through the housing in order to ensure effortless, snappy shifts. The Jagwire Ripcord DIY Derailleur Kit includes: Three lined ferrules, seven nosed ferrules, six cable donuts, one raincoat boot, two cable tips and 2100mm of sealing liner. The front cable measures 1500mm, and the rear 2100mm. 1800mm of housing is also provided, and it's compatible with both SRAM and Shimano mountain derailleurs. Choose between the colors White, Red, SID Blue, Pink, Maxxis Orange, Lime Green, Sterling Silver, and Black Carbon.", "text": "Jagwire Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit Lighter, faster, and more colorful -- all superlatives that confidently describe Jagwire's Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit. This kit features a compression-less, Kevlar-reinforced housing and a fully-lubricated Light Lube Liner (L3). And because of this, the housing is up to 30% lighter, and considerably stronger, than standard housings. But, let us not forget that you also have eight color choices. Of course, aesthetics are important, but only second to actual performance gains. And that's what you get with the Jagwire Pro Mountain Derailleur Kit. Its L3 technology adds lubricant to the already slippery Teflon-coated stainless steel cables. So, they glide through the housing in order to ensure effortless, snappy shifts. The Jagwire Ripcord DIY Derailleur Kit includes: Three lined ferrules, seven nosed ferrules, six cable donuts, one raincoat boot, two cable tips and 2100mm of sealing liner. The front cable measures 1500mm, and the rear 2100mm. 1800mm of housing is also provided, and it's compatible with both SRAM and Shimano mountain derailleurs. Choose between the colors White, Red, SID Blue, Pink, Maxxis Orange, Lime Green, Sterling Silver, and Black Carbon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517Xoh0Qf6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C4N8YS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jagwire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 28.11}}
{"item_id": "B001C4NJME", "title": "Jagwire Road Pro Complete Road Brake And Derailleur Kit", "description": "A cable is a cable, right? If you've ever just told your mechanic, \"use the cheapest ones you've got\", you've probably figured out that isn't the case. A well-designed cable system for your bike not only makes shifting fluid, it also ensures that braking is smooth and powerful when you need it. Jagwire's Road Pro Complete Road Brake and Derailleur Kit adds style while enhancing shifting and braking. The Jagwire cables are coated in Teflon and they are used with slick-lube liners. This greatly reduces friction while Kevlar reinforced, compression-less brake housings mean that the cables do not get crimped. This allows for optimal braking. All the parts you need for a complete road bike build, including cable ends and adjustment barrels, are included. The Jagwire Road Pro Complete Road Brake and Derailleur Kit comes in 13 colors: Sid Blue, Red, Gold, White, Organic Green, Pink, Hi-Tech Gray, Black, Sterling Silver, Carbon Silver, Bianchi Celeste, Yellow, Orange, and Titanium.", "text": "Jagwire Road Pro Complete Road Brake And Derailleur Kit A cable is a cable, right? If you've ever just told your mechanic, \"use the cheapest ones you've got\", you've probably figured out that isn't the case. A well-designed cable system for your bike not only makes shifting fluid, it also ensures that braking is smooth and powerful when you need it. Jagwire's Road Pro Complete Road Brake and Derailleur Kit adds style while enhancing shifting and braking. The Jagwire cables are coated in Teflon and they are used with slick-lube liners. This greatly reduces friction while Kevlar reinforced, compression-less brake housings mean that the cables do not get crimped. This allows for optimal braking. All the parts you need for a complete road bike build, including cable ends and adjustment barrels, are included. The Jagwire Road Pro Complete Road Brake and Derailleur Kit comes in 13 colors: Sid Blue, Red, Gold, White, Organic Green, Pink, Hi-Tech Gray, Black, Sterling Silver, Carbon Silver, Bianchi Celeste, Yellow, Orange, and Titanium.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417sKi5UVdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C4NJME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jagwire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 34.57}}
{"item_id": "B001C4UHF6", "title": "FSA Omega Compact Road Handelbar", "description": "FSA Omega Drop Handlebar. Shallow Drop bars with the newest-generation Compact Design for improved reach and performance with today's control levels. 4 degree outward bend.", "text": "FSA Omega Compact Road Handelbar FSA Omega Drop Handlebar. Shallow Drop bars with the newest-generation Compact Design for improved reach and performance with today's control levels. 4 degree outward bend.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lEy9G6FML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C4UHF6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]]}}
