{"item_id": "B001C55NOA", "title": "Maxpedition Operator Tactical Attache", "description": "The Maxpedition Operator Tactical Attache (#0605) is a large tactical computer attaché. The main compartment is padded on all sides; has a hook-and-loop divider and sized to fit a 15.4\" (Diagonal Screen Size) laptop, and a legal size pad. This is the perfect office go-bag for the Tactical Officer.", "text": "Maxpedition Operator Tactical Attache The Maxpedition Operator Tactical Attache (#0605) is a large tactical computer attaché. The main compartment is padded on all sides; has a hook-and-loop divider and sized to fit a 15.4\" (Diagonal Screen Size) laptop, and a legal size pad. This is the perfect office go-bag for the Tactical Officer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UirW6hl9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C55NOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 117.99}}
