{"item_id": "B001C5B7S6", "title": "Sea to Summit 100% Premium Silk Liner (Standard Rectangular 73\" x 36\") - Pacific Blue", "description": "Sea to Summit's premium silk traveling sheets are made from the strongest, finest ripstop silk available. Perfect for keeping a sleeping bag clean and for hostel or budget hotel traveling.", "text": "Sea to Summit 100% Premium Silk Liner (Standard Rectangular 73\" x 36\") - Pacific Blue Sea to Summit's premium silk traveling sheets are made from the strongest, finest ripstop silk available. Perfect for keeping a sleeping bag clean and for hostel or budget hotel traveling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51emLnH0IOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5B7S6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]]}}
