{"item_id": "B001C5XOJQ", "title": "Past Super Mag Plus Recoil Shield", "description": "The PAST product line is based on a foam material that dramatically reduces the felt recoil of rifles, shotguns, and handguns. This foam pad, worn over the shoulder, absorbs and spreads the recoil impulse, significantly reducing the recoil felt by the shooter. Other styles of recoil protection tend to bounce into your shoulder, which can create an unstable feeling while offering inadequate protection. The PAST recoil protection system allows a shooter to concentrate on hitting the target instead of fearing the punishment of recoil. Concentration helps to create good shooting habits, and more importantly, prevents developing bad ones.", "text": "Past Super Mag Plus Recoil Shield The PAST product line is based on a foam material that dramatically reduces the felt recoil of rifles, shotguns, and handguns. This foam pad, worn over the shoulder, absorbs and spreads the recoil impulse, significantly reducing the recoil felt by the shooter. Other styles of recoil protection tend to bounce into your shoulder, which can create an unstable feeling while offering inadequate protection. The PAST recoil protection system allows a shooter to concentrate on hitting the target instead of fearing the punishment of recoil. Concentration helps to create good shooting habits, and more importantly, prevents developing bad ones.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LZws8mbdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5XOJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Past", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 27.37}}
{"item_id": "B001C5ZNUE", "title": "Caldwell Tackdriver Shooting Rest Bag-Unfilled", "description": "The most user-friendly and effective, one-piece shooting bag available. This convenient shooting bag takes the place of two. You can use the Tack Driver almost anywhere, from portable and permanent shooting benches to makeshift positions in the field.", "text": "Caldwell Tackdriver Shooting Rest Bag-Unfilled The most user-friendly and effective, one-piece shooting bag available. This convenient shooting bag takes the place of two. You can use the Tack Driver almost anywhere, from portable and permanent shooting benches to makeshift positions in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mln9F9GFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5ZNUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.32}}
{"item_id": "B001C5ZPBG", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle BS2 Bersa Thunder 380 / Firestorm .380 cal", "description": "Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle BS2 Bersa Thunder 380 / Firestorm .380 cal Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q33Xtc12L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5ZPBG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.69}}
{"item_id": "B001C5ZQTM", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL2E2 Glock 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 32, 34, 35 , Walther PK 380", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle GL2E2 Glock 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 32, 34, 35 , Walther PK 380 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CRY9MJdFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5ZQTM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B001C5ZRMI", "title": "Bushnell Magnetic Boresighter", "description": "The Bushnell Magnetic Boresighter revolutionizes optical sighting with a design that works without reliance on arbors or spuds. Thanks to a strong magnetic strip, this Boresighter attaches instantly to the muzzle of any firearm and works on all calibers--and the etched glass reticle provides the accuracy you are looking for.", "text": "Bushnell Magnetic Boresighter The Bushnell Magnetic Boresighter revolutionizes optical sighting with a design that works without reliance on arbors or spuds. Thanks to a strong magnetic strip, this Boresighter attaches instantly to the muzzle of any firearm and works on all calibers--and the etched glass reticle provides the accuracy you are looking for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VnM9FxvoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5ZRMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C5ZSCC", "title": "ASP Textured Black Baton Leverage Cap", "description": "lock the baton in the officer's hand improving retention and control. This unique design Increases both speed to target and impact potential. Cap provides a dramatic increase in striking potential while retaining a Tactical Baton during the most dynamic confrontations. The cap increases the reach of the ASP Baton while improving control. The reduced grip diameter of the Leverage Cap replaces the standard cap of all ASP Expandable Batons.", "text": "ASP Textured Black Baton Leverage Cap lock the baton in the officer's hand improving retention and control. This unique design Increases both speed to target and impact potential. Cap provides a dramatic increase in striking potential while retaining a Tactical Baton during the most dynamic confrontations. The cap increases the reach of the ASP Baton while improving control. The reduced grip diameter of the Leverage Cap replaces the standard cap of all ASP Expandable Batons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PmMnt9rQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C5ZSCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Asp Law Enforcement", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Batons"]], "price": 12.75}}
{"item_id": "B001C6042U", "title": "Cold Steel Assegai with Long Shaft with American Ash Wood Handle", "description": "THE ASSEGAI was invented by the legendary Zulu king Shaka in the early 1800s, revolutionized tribal warfare in Southern Africa. Cold Steel's version is available with your choice of two different shaft lengths.", "text": "Cold Steel Assegai with Long Shaft with American Ash Wood Handle THE ASSEGAI was invented by the legendary Zulu king Shaka in the early 1800s, revolutionized tribal warfare in Southern Africa. Cold Steel's version is available with your choice of two different shaft lengths.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MX1rWGMHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C6042U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 90.0}}
{"item_id": "B001C61USC", "title": "Walther CP99/CPS Laser", "description": "This clever little laser is designed specifically to fit the Walther CP99, CP99Sport and the Nighthawk. (Fits CO2 Powered Guns Only) The simple design fits easily onto the rail beneath the barrel housing with no need for allen keys or screwdrivers.", "text": "Walther CP99/CPS Laser This clever little laser is designed specifically to fit the Walther CP99, CP99Sport and the Nighthawk. (Fits CO2 Powered Guns Only) The simple design fits easily onto the rail beneath the barrel housing with no need for allen keys or screwdrivers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZdXSRlI1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C61USC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walther", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 32.42}}
{"item_id": "B001C622TI", "title": "Fobus Tactical Speed Holster Paddle GLT17 Glock 17,22,31 / Ruger 345 / Berretta PX Storm / S&W M&P Full Size / Berretta PX4 Storm Full Size / S&W 99 Full Size 9/40/45 / Walther 99 Full Size 9/40 / Ruger SR9 / Sig 226 holds Handgun with Laser or Light", "description": "This innovative Fobus tactical holster was created in answer to many requests to provide a carry system that would accommodate a handgun utilizing accessories that were either rail or trigger guard mounted. The GLT answers this request, and more! In addition to allowing the carry of handguns that have accessories such as lights or lasers mounted under the barrel or on the trigger guard. Fobus has addressed safety and retention concerns that are unique to this model holster. The handgun is held securely in place by utilization of a muzzle stud and a safety strap that encircles the trigger guard. While assuring positive retention, rapid presentation of the handgun is made easy due to the open withdrawal slot on the rear of the holster and the design of the safety strap.", "text": "Fobus Tactical Speed Holster Paddle GLT17 Glock 17,22,31 / Ruger 345 / Berretta PX Storm / S&W M&P Full Size / Berretta PX4 Storm Full Size / S&W 99 Full Size 9/40/45 / Walther 99 Full Size 9/40 / Ruger SR9 / Sig 226 holds Handgun with Laser or Light This innovative Fobus tactical holster was created in answer to many requests to provide a carry system that would accommodate a handgun utilizing accessories that were either rail or trigger guard mounted. The GLT answers this request, and more! In addition to allowing the carry of handguns that have accessories such as lights or lasers mounted under the barrel or on the trigger guard. Fobus has addressed safety and retention concerns that are unique to this model holster. The handgun is held securely in place by utilization of a muzzle stud and a safety strap that encircles the trigger guard. While assuring positive retention, rapid presentation of the handgun is made easy due to the open withdrawal slot on the rear of the holster and the design of the safety strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NkEQLv9eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C622TI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 37.69}}
{"item_id": "B001C63IZ0", "title": "HKS MK3-A Revolver Speedloader for Colt MK3 & MK5/King Cobra/Peacekeeper/Ruger Security 6", "description": "\"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits Colt MK3 & MK5/King Cobra/Peacekeeper/Ruger Security 6", "text": "HKS MK3-A Revolver Speedloader for Colt MK3 & MK5/King Cobra/Peacekeeper/Ruger Security 6 \"A\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits Colt MK3 & MK5/King Cobra/Peacekeeper/Ruger Security 6", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GM%2B1sY-8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C63IZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.29}}
{"item_id": "B001C63M7O", "title": "Wheeler 89-Piece Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set, Black/Yellow", "description": "Winner of Field and Stream's Best of the Best Award, the Wheeler 89-Piece Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set is a must for every gunsmith and repair shop. The set includes a complete selection of Torx, Allen, and Phillips bits and includes two each of the smallest bits--if you break one, you can keep going without a hitch. The set also comes with 15 ingenious speciality bits, including a 3-inch shaft extension, a square-to-hex drive adapter, and two screwdriver heads. Wheeler's engineers measured the screws on over one hundred modern and antique firearms to ensure bits for every situation is offered. The well thought-out bit selection will put an end to burred, buggered, busted screw slots on virtually any gun. The included Torx bits are designed to cover scope rings, bases, recoil pads, and more.", "text": "Wheeler 89-Piece Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set, Black/Yellow Winner of Field and Stream's Best of the Best Award, the Wheeler 89-Piece Deluxe Gunsmithing Screwdriver Set is a must for every gunsmith and repair shop. The set includes a complete selection of Torx, Allen, and Phillips bits and includes two each of the smallest bits--if you break one, you can keep going without a hitch. The set also comes with 15 ingenious speciality bits, including a 3-inch shaft extension, a square-to-hex drive adapter, and two screwdriver heads. Wheeler's engineers measured the screws on over one hundred modern and antique firearms to ensure bits for every situation is offered. The well thought-out bit selection will put an end to burred, buggered, busted screw slots on virtually any gun. The included Torx bits are designed to cover scope rings, bases, recoil pads, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u0cRGzvfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C63M7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 68.0}}
