{"item_id": "B001C63ND2", "title": "RWS .22 Quick Cleaning Pellets, 80ct", "description": "Manufactured from heavy felt. These pellets remove dirt and lead residue from the barrel. They do not take the place of a thorough cleaning with a rod but with regular use they will help maintain performance.", "text": "RWS .22 Quick Cleaning Pellets, 80ct Manufactured from heavy felt. These pellets remove dirt and lead residue from the barrel. They do not take the place of a thorough cleaning with a rod but with regular use they will help maintain performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517vaiBgzIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C63ND2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 7.93}}
