{"item_id": "B001C67OWS", "title": "WTB Rocket V Race Saddle", "description": "The Rocket V is WTBs most popular high-performance saddle both on the road and in the dirt. The uniquely contoured pad shape helps increase power output by properly angling the sit bones. This is the saddle of choice for current downhill world champion Steve Peat of the Santa Cruz Syndicate.", "text": "WTB Rocket V Race Saddle The Rocket V is WTBs most popular high-performance saddle both on the road and in the dirt. The uniquely contoured pad shape helps increase power output by properly angling the sit bones. This is the saddle of choice for current downhill world champion Steve Peat of the Santa Cruz Syndicate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C4qeLzmqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C67OWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WTB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 53.95}}
{"item_id": "B001C67ZOA", "title": "Thomson X4 31.8 Bicycle Stem", "description": "The Thomson X4 Stem is stronger and lighter than their older Elite stem. A good part of this weight savings comes from the change in design. Where the Elite used an internal wedge clamp, this X4 relies on a more traditional split clamp for the steerer interface. While it meant losing the knee-saving shape on the Elite, the clamp bolts are pretty minimal given the sculpted design. The Thomson X4 Stem is CNC machined from 7000 series aluminum alloy. It has a 31.8mm clamp diameter. It's available in Black or Silver and with a zero (90) or ten (100) degree rise.Product FeaturesMaterial: 7000-series aluminumBar Diameter: 31.8 mmSteer Tube Diameter: 1.125 inLength: 50 mm, 70 mm, 90 mm, 100 mm, 110 mm, 120 mm, 130 mmRise: 0 deg, 10 degBar Attachment: 4-boltWeight: 174 gRecommended Use: XC, freerideManufacturer Warranty: 3 years", "text": "Thomson X4 31.8 Bicycle Stem The Thomson X4 Stem is stronger and lighter than their older Elite stem. A good part of this weight savings comes from the change in design. Where the Elite used an internal wedge clamp, this X4 relies on a more traditional split clamp for the steerer interface. While it meant losing the knee-saving shape on the Elite, the clamp bolts are pretty minimal given the sculpted design. The Thomson X4 Stem is CNC machined from 7000 series aluminum alloy. It has a 31.8mm clamp diameter. It's available in Black or Silver and with a zero (90) or ten (100) degree rise.Product FeaturesMaterial: 7000-series aluminumBar Diameter: 31.8 mmSteer Tube Diameter: 1.125 inLength: 50 mm, 70 mm, 90 mm, 100 mm, 110 mm, 120 mm, 130 mmRise: 0 deg, 10 degBar Attachment: 4-boltWeight: 174 gRecommended Use: XC, freerideManufacturer Warranty: 3 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K3xuqdLXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C67ZOA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Stems"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001C69YYO", "title": "Profile Design AquaRack Bicycle Water Bottle Cage w/CO2 Mount - ACRACK8", "description": "6061-T6 aluminum clamp and extension. Includes 2 lightweight Profile Design Kages. Includes CO2 mounting brackets. Mounts to seatpost. Fits 31.6mm to 27.2mm seatposts (shim included).", "text": "Profile Design AquaRack Bicycle Water Bottle Cage w/CO2 Mount - ACRACK8 6061-T6 aluminum clamp and extension. Includes 2 lightweight Profile Design Kages. Includes CO2 mounting brackets. Mounts to seatpost. Fits 31.6mm to 27.2mm seatposts (shim included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419lYgBI%2BEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C69YYO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B001C6BTUG", "title": "WTB Pure V Race Bicycle Saddle", "description": "WTB designed the Pure V Race Saddle to do one thing, and that's to keep you insanely comfortable on long rides. The drop nose keeps it from snagging on your shorts, while the cutout at the rear of the saddle aids in blood flow. As a result, both numbness and discomfort are combated. The cover is made from a durable synthetic, while the rails are feature a durable chromoly steel. And with a 148mm tail width, you'll find that it's plenty comfortable for a wide range of body types. The WTB Pure V Race Saddle is available in one size and in the colors Black and Chrome. Please note that this saddle features a synthetic cover, and that it weighs in around 320 grams.", "text": "WTB Pure V Race Bicycle Saddle WTB designed the Pure V Race Saddle to do one thing, and that's to keep you insanely comfortable on long rides. The drop nose keeps it from snagging on your shorts, while the cutout at the rear of the saddle aids in blood flow. As a result, both numbness and discomfort are combated. The cover is made from a durable synthetic, while the rails are feature a durable chromoly steel. And with a 148mm tail width, you'll find that it's plenty comfortable for a wide range of body types. The WTB Pure V Race Saddle is available in one size and in the colors Black and Chrome. Please note that this saddle features a synthetic cover, and that it weighs in around 320 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ghnz41x6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001C6BTUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WTB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 53.95}}
