{"item_id": "B001CA9PQW", "title": "Sawyer Products SP194 Two Bag Complete Water Purifier System, 2 Liters Each", "description": "Sawyer’s 4-liter dual bag portable ultra purification system physically removes viruses from water. This system allows you to effortlessly purify 4 liters of water in as little as 10 minutes. Use this system for one person or a group of people. The convenient bag to bag gravity system doesn’t require any pumping. Simply fill up the grey reservoir with unfiltered water, attach the filter and tube to the clean blue reservoir and gravity does the rest. Once the blue reservoir is full hang by its handle to fill water bottles, containers, and pots and pans from the high flow .5 liters per minute dispensing cap. Bladders are 20-inches x 10-inches each. Included in the system is a drink tube for attaching to the bite valve of your choice (sold separately) so that you can use the reservoir as you would any hydration system. Perfect for hunting, camping, fishing, disaster relief and emergency preparedness kits or on adventure travel where potable tap and bottled water are not easily carried or safe to drink.", "text": "Sawyer Products SP194 Two Bag Complete Water Purifier System, 2 Liters Each Sawyer’s 4-liter dual bag portable ultra purification system physically removes viruses from water. This system allows you to effortlessly purify 4 liters of water in as little as 10 minutes. Use this system for one person or a group of people. The convenient bag to bag gravity system doesn’t require any pumping. Simply fill up the grey reservoir with unfiltered water, attach the filter and tube to the clean blue reservoir and gravity does the rest. Once the blue reservoir is full hang by its handle to fill water bottles, containers, and pots and pans from the high flow .5 liters per minute dispensing cap. Bladders are 20-inches x 10-inches each. Included in the system is a drink tube for attaching to the bite valve of your choice (sold separately) so that you can use the reservoir as you would any hydration system. Perfect for hunting, camping, fishing, disaster relief and emergency preparedness kits or on adventure travel where potable tap and bottled water are not easily carried or safe to drink.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ERui4YvoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CA9PQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 173.7}}
{"item_id": "B001CABG3W", "title": "Sawyer Products Two Bag Complete Water Filtration System", "description": "Sawyer's 2 Liter Complete Water Treatment System provides a safe and highly effective way to filter water with the bag to bag gravity flow system. No pumping, no waiting, no chemicals, and no worries! The system includes a 0.10 micron Absolute Filter, a 2 Liter nylon dirty water dispenser, a 2 Liter clean water storage vessel, faucet adapter, drink tube, quick release tube, cleaning and maintenance instructions and hanging strap. The fast flow hollow fiber membrane uses pore sizes so small that sediment, bacteria, protozoa, cysts and other contaminants are removed to provide you with the highest level of filtration available. Biological Filtration: removes 7 log (99.99999%) of all bacteria like salmonella, cholera, and E. coli. and 6 log (99.9999%) of all Protozoa such as Giardia and Cryptosporidium. This filter exceeds EPA guidelines for removal rates and has a life expectancy of 1 Million Gallons guaranteed by Sawyer. The filtration process is practically hands free. Just hang the system from a tree or any source off the ground and watch gravity do all the work. In as little as 1.5 minutes you will have 2 L of safe drinking water. You can even filter on the go by converting the clean water vessel into a hydration bladder for a pack with the included drinking tube. This filter does not remove dissolved solids, including chemicals and heavy metals. Packed size: 8\" x3\" x 7\" Wt. 12 oz.Cleaning and maintenance instructions.Capacity: 2 Liters.Flow Rate: 2 Liters un under 1.5 minutes.Flow Rate: 2 Liters un under 1.5 minutes.Removes: Bacteria and Protozoa.Life Expectancy: 1 Million Gallons.", "text": "Sawyer Products Two Bag Complete Water Filtration System Sawyer's 2 Liter Complete Water Treatment System provides a safe and highly effective way to filter water with the bag to bag gravity flow system. No pumping, no waiting, no chemicals, and no worries! The system includes a 0.10 micron Absolute Filter, a 2 Liter nylon dirty water dispenser, a 2 Liter clean water storage vessel, faucet adapter, drink tube, quick release tube, cleaning and maintenance instructions and hanging strap. The fast flow hollow fiber membrane uses pore sizes so small that sediment, bacteria, protozoa, cysts and other contaminants are removed to provide you with the highest level of filtration available. Biological Filtration: removes 7 log (99.99999%) of all bacteria like salmonella, cholera, and E. coli. and 6 log (99.9999%) of all Protozoa such as Giardia and Cryptosporidium. This filter exceeds EPA guidelines for removal rates and has a life expectancy of 1 Million Gallons guaranteed by Sawyer. The filtration process is practically hands free. Just hang the system from a tree or any source off the ground and watch gravity do all the work. In as little as 1.5 minutes you will have 2 L of safe drinking water. You can even filter on the go by converting the clean water vessel into a hydration bladder for a pack with the included drinking tube. This filter does not remove dissolved solids, including chemicals and heavy metals. Packed size: 8\" x3\" x 7\" Wt. 12 oz.Cleaning and maintenance instructions.Capacity: 2 Liters.Flow Rate: 2 Liters un under 1.5 minutes.Flow Rate: 2 Liters un under 1.5 minutes.Removes: Bacteria and Protozoa.Life Expectancy: 1 Million Gallons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XwQy3YZTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CABG3W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]]}}
