{"item_id": "B001CEZKV2", "title": "Jugs Hitting Tee", "description": "The tee is an ideal size to introduce children to the game, and a telescoping design will grow with the player.This simple, durable hitting tee is ideal for young players' batting practice and tee ball games. A heavyweight solid rubber base provides a stable platform to hit from, while a fully adjustable telescoping extension tube allows for use by players of different sizes. Disassembles for easy storage when not in use.About JUGSJUGS makes the bestselling pitching machine in the world, and is also the leading producer of popular baseball training aids like batting cages, protective nets, balls, and more.", "text": "Jugs Hitting Tee The tee is an ideal size to introduce children to the game, and a telescoping design will grow with the player.This simple, durable hitting tee is ideal for young players' batting practice and tee ball games. A heavyweight solid rubber base provides a stable platform to hit from, while a fully adjustable telescoping extension tube allows for use by players of different sizes. Disassembles for easy storage when not in use.About JUGSJUGS makes the bestselling pitching machine in the world, and is also the leading producer of popular baseball training aids like batting cages, protective nets, balls, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2B%2BwS53JZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CEZKV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jugs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 29.06}}
{"item_id": "B001CF3KTA", "title": "Jugs Lite-Flite Baseballs (One Dozen)", "description": "The JUGS Lite-Flite ball is the safest practice ball ever made. It is designed specifically to be used with the JUGS Lite-Flite Pitching Machine. Their sponge-like texture makes them safe for indoor hitting without a batting cage. Except no substitutes. Only a JUGS ball comes with the JUGS name on them.", "text": "Jugs Lite-Flite Baseballs (One Dozen) The JUGS Lite-Flite ball is the safest practice ball ever made. It is designed specifically to be used with the JUGS Lite-Flite Pitching Machine. Their sponge-like texture makes them safe for indoor hitting without a batting cage. Except no substitutes. Only a JUGS ball comes with the JUGS name on them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ORYVYhBjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CF3KTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jugs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Baseballs"]], "price": 23.88}}
{"item_id": "B001CF4YTK", "title": "Jugs White Poly Baseballs", "description": "These are 1 ounce hollow poly baseballs.", "text": "Jugs White Poly Baseballs These are 1 ounce hollow poly baseballs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xmWgRTrsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CF4YTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jugs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Starter Balls & Bats", "Plastic Balls"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B001CF4Z26", "title": "Jugs Instant Screen", "description": "The Jugs instant screen is a travel-friendly practice screen which can be used effectively as a hitting screen for short toss, soft toss, and tee drills.The Instant Screen's oversized eight-by-seven-foot size is ideal for short toss, soft toss, and tee drills.Constructed of sturdy lightweight spring steel, the Instant Screen measures eight-by-seven-feet (W x H) yet folds up easily into a 30-inch circle and fits into its own, included, carry bag. The screen weighs less than 14 pounds, fits in the trunk of most cars, and sets up in seconds, with no assembly required. Includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty.Features:Measures 7 feet tall by 8 feet wideFrame made of sturdy, lightweight spring steelFolds down to a compact 36-inch circleWeighs less than 14 pounds", "text": "Jugs Instant Screen The Jugs instant screen is a travel-friendly practice screen which can be used effectively as a hitting screen for short toss, soft toss, and tee drills.The Instant Screen's oversized eight-by-seven-foot size is ideal for short toss, soft toss, and tee drills.Constructed of sturdy lightweight spring steel, the Instant Screen measures eight-by-seven-feet (W x H) yet folds up easily into a 30-inch circle and fits into its own, included, carry bag. The screen weighs less than 14 pounds, fits in the trunk of most cars, and sets up in seconds, with no assembly required. Includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty.Features:Measures 7 feet tall by 8 feet wideFrame made of sturdy, lightweight spring steelFolds down to a compact 36-inch circleWeighs less than 14 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zhkgpXm6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CF4Z26.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jugs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Field Equipment", "Protective Screens"]], "price": 115.0}}
{"item_id": "B001CF4ZHG", "title": "Jugs 5-Point Hitting Tee", "description": "Tees in five different positions help players train for various pitch locations.This unique hitting tee helps baseball and softball players learn how to hit the ball at different locations over the plate, improving hitting fundamentals. A heavyweight solid rubber base provides a stable platform to hit from, while two fully adjustable telescoping extension tubes allow use by players of different sizes. The tee includes a 20-page5-Point Hitting Tee Drill Bookwith detailed, step-by-step instructions on proper use, and a patented Grip-n-Go handle. Disassembles for easy storage when not in use.FeaturesDevelops hand-eye coordination and a quick batTeaches correct hitting fundamentalsLearn proper contact points for inside, middle, and outside pitchesComes with two adjustable extension tubesLightweight unit breaks down for easy transportPatented Grip-n-Go handleComes complete with 20-page5-Point Hitting Tee Drill BookAbout JUGSJUGS makes the bestselling pitching machine in the world, and is also the leading producer of popular baseball training aids like batting cages, protective nets, balls, and more.", "text": "Jugs 5-Point Hitting Tee Tees in five different positions help players train for various pitch locations.This unique hitting tee helps baseball and softball players learn how to hit the ball at different locations over the plate, improving hitting fundamentals. A heavyweight solid rubber base provides a stable platform to hit from, while two fully adjustable telescoping extension tubes allow use by players of different sizes. The tee includes a 20-page5-Point Hitting Tee Drill Bookwith detailed, step-by-step instructions on proper use, and a patented Grip-n-Go handle. Disassembles for easy storage when not in use.FeaturesDevelops hand-eye coordination and a quick batTeaches correct hitting fundamentalsLearn proper contact points for inside, middle, and outside pitchesComes with two adjustable extension tubesLightweight unit breaks down for easy transportPatented Grip-n-Go handleComes complete with 20-page5-Point Hitting Tee Drill BookAbout JUGSJUGS makes the bestselling pitching machine in the world, and is also the leading producer of popular baseball training aids like batting cages, protective nets, balls, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XOBjEQUKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CF4ZHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jugs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 67.99}}
{"item_id": "B001CFSNBK", "title": "Stansport Redwood Ultra Light Sleeping Bag (Green, 55-Degree)", "description": "The Redwood Ultra Light Sleeping Bag from Stansport is designed for people who want a lightweight and compact bag without sacrificing the roomy comfort of rectangular design. The Redwood is comfort rated for temperatures down to 55 degrees Fahrenheit and is made with a soft poly-cotton lining with 1.5 pounds of ultra hollow fiber fill with a nylon outer shell. The Redwood comes with a stuff sack included.", "text": "Stansport Redwood Ultra Light Sleeping Bag (Green, 55-Degree) The Redwood Ultra Light Sleeping Bag from Stansport is designed for people who want a lightweight and compact bag without sacrificing the roomy comfort of rectangular design. The Redwood is comfort rated for temperatures down to 55 degrees Fahrenheit and is made with a soft poly-cotton lining with 1.5 pounds of ultra hollow fiber fill with a nylon outer shell. The Redwood comes with a stuff sack included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sYR3DcK2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CFSNBK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 21.89}}
{"item_id": "B001CGJ0QG", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Spanish Toothpick Folding Pocket Knife, 9-Inch", "description": "The fit and finish of a Spanish Toothpick knife with genuine India polished wood comes from 100 percent in-house production and quality control every step of the way.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Spanish Toothpick Folding Pocket Knife, 9-Inch The fit and finish of a Spanish Toothpick knife with genuine India polished wood comes from 100 percent in-house production and quality control every step of the way.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cplX71TPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CGJ0QG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.17}}
{"item_id": "B001CH199G", "title": "Fobus Elite Double Magazine Pouch For 9Mm/.40/357 Pistol (Glock Magazines will not fit)", "description": "Fobus Holsters 6909P Double Magazine Pouch, Beretta, Paddle, BHP 9&40, Sig 9mmFobus Holsters are the next wave in concealment holsters. Their holsters feature passive retention with rapid deployment, are combat tested, perform in all situations and are comfortable to wear. Plus, a 100% lifetime warranty for repair or replacement stands behind each and every holster.Double magazine pouch paddle 9mm double stack.Fobus Holsters 6909P Double Magazine Pouch, Beretta, Paddle, BHP 9&40, Sig 9mm Features: Made In: Israel", "text": "Fobus Elite Double Magazine Pouch For 9Mm/.40/357 Pistol (Glock Magazines will not fit) Fobus Holsters 6909P Double Magazine Pouch, Beretta, Paddle, BHP 9&40, Sig 9mmFobus Holsters are the next wave in concealment holsters. Their holsters feature passive retention with rapid deployment, are combat tested, perform in all situations and are comfortable to wear. Plus, a 100% lifetime warranty for repair or replacement stands behind each and every holster.Double magazine pouch paddle 9mm double stack.Fobus Holsters 6909P Double Magazine Pouch, Beretta, Paddle, BHP 9&40, Sig 9mm Features: Made In: Israel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MTv7kAQ4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CH199G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.99}}
