{"item_id": "B001CJX1UY", "title": "2Toms SportShield Liquid Roll-On", "description": "Using SportShield liquid roll-on or convenient towelettes, you apply a smooth, thin invisible coating to the skin. This coating eliminates or greatly minimizes the friction that causes blisters, chafing and irritation. It can be used on any part of the body where skin is subjected to chafing by clothing and equipment pressure points. Features: Stays on skin for maximum protection Prevents pain from rubbing and chafing Proven performance under the most extreme conditions Prevents uncomfortable stinging/burning Will not sweat off Prevents sticking Lasts all day Ideal for use: On inside of thighs Over nipples Feet Underarms Inside wetsuits", "text": "2Toms SportShield Liquid Roll-On Using SportShield liquid roll-on or convenient towelettes, you apply a smooth, thin invisible coating to the skin. This coating eliminates or greatly minimizes the friction that causes blisters, chafing and irritation. It can be used on any part of the body where skin is subjected to chafing by clothing and equipment pressure points. Features: Stays on skin for maximum protection Prevents pain from rubbing and chafing Proven performance under the most extreme conditions Prevents uncomfortable stinging/burning Will not sweat off Prevents sticking Lasts all day Ideal for use: On inside of thighs Over nipples Feet Underarms Inside wetsuits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H5QSzyo7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CJX1UY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "2 Toms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]], "price": 7.95}}
