{"item_id": "B001CK0FK2", "title": "KMC MissingLink", "description": "If you've ever broken a chain on the road, you know that without the right tools or a spare link, you'll be making a phone call for a ride home. A spare KMC MissingLink in your saddlebag makes that scenario a lot less likely. The KMC Missing Link is available in Campagnolo 11-speed, Shimano 10 and 11-speed, and SRAM 10 and 11-speed versions.", "text": "KMC MissingLink If you've ever broken a chain on the road, you know that without the right tools or a spare link, you'll be making a phone call for a ride home. A spare KMC MissingLink in your saddlebag makes that scenario a lot less likely. The KMC Missing Link is available in Campagnolo 11-speed, Shimano 10 and 11-speed, and SRAM 10 and 11-speed versions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DrnNIIxrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CK0FK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]]}}
