{"item_id": "B001CK30MC", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 7255Z Lake 111 Zytel Folding Knife", "description": "7255Z Lake 111 zytel folding knife by ron lake features his exclusive patented L.B.S. safety that locks open and closed. The blade on this knife is a classic drop point with a brushed finish made of premium 8cr14mov (equivalent to aus 8) stainless steel. This model comes with a razor-sharp edge. Dual lake-style thumb studs allow fast opening with either hand. The lockback release makes for easy one-hand closing. The frame consists of stainless steel liners and black zytel scales. The black anodized handles features a basketweave texture and pronounced finger coil and pommel for added grip. A custom stainless steel clip in a brushed finish is also included as well as a bonus denim sheath with belt loop.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 7255Z Lake 111 Zytel Folding Knife 7255Z Lake 111 zytel folding knife by ron lake features his exclusive patented L.B.S. safety that locks open and closed. The blade on this knife is a classic drop point with a brushed finish made of premium 8cr14mov (equivalent to aus 8) stainless steel. This model comes with a razor-sharp edge. Dual lake-style thumb studs allow fast opening with either hand. The lockback release makes for easy one-hand closing. The frame consists of stainless steel liners and black zytel scales. The black anodized handles features a basketweave texture and pronounced finger coil and pommel for added grip. A custom stainless steel clip in a brushed finish is also included as well as a bonus denim sheath with belt loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Nw4sf0l3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CK30MC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B001CKA6EW", "title": "Nalgene HDPE Wide Mouth Water Bottle (Green, 1-Quart)", "description": "Made from HDPE (high-density polyethylene) these bottles are very lightweight and durable making them great for backpacking. Wide mouth opening (63 mm) makes them easy to fill with ice or clean.", "text": "Nalgene HDPE Wide Mouth Water Bottle (Green, 1-Quart) Made from HDPE (high-density polyethylene) these bottles are very lightweight and durable making them great for backpacking. Wide mouth opening (63 mm) makes them easy to fill with ice or clean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A9ckE%2BU8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CKA6EW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 5.99}}
