{"item_id": "B001CL3IAU", "title": "Slim in 6 DVD Workout", "description": "Lose up to25 poundsin just6 weeks.Slim in 6 is more effective at helping you lose weight than those super-intense, high-impact workouts. The secret is Debbie's Slim Training, a combination of low-impact cardio moves and light resistance that gets you into the optimal fat-burning zone – and keeps you there longer. The fat melts away as you tone lean muscle, so you get incredible body-shaping results, faster!What You Get with Slim in 6:3 Easy to Follow Fat-Burning WorkoutsGet Slim in 3 Easy Steps:Step 1: Start It Up!– Start melting fat and slimming down with this 30-minute, moderate intensity workout.Step 2: Ramp it Up!– Turn up the calorie burn with moves that target your hips, thighs, and abs in about 45 minutes a day.Step 3: Burn it Up!– Reveal your new slim, toned body with Debbie’s advanced workout that takes less than an hour.Workout CalendarChart your progress with each workout and watch the pounds melt away.Weight Loss Eating PlanDelicious meal plans developed by registered dieticians to help you lose weight faster and easier.Tools to Help you Succeed6-Day Express Plan– Jump-start your results and lose up to 6 pounds and 6 inches in your first 6 days – the healthy way!Simple Steps to Success!– Debbie guides you through your transformation step by step.2 FREE WorkoutsSlim & 6-Pack– This 10-minute workout targets ab flab for a tight, toned midsection and strong core.Slim & Limber– Stretch out your muscles to keep your body lean, flexible, and feeling good all over.BONUS GIFTSSlim Training Resistance Band– Shape and tone a beautiful, sexy body with just the right amount of resistance – no bulky weights required.Cardio Core! Express– Burn fat as you tighten and strengthen your entire core with all-new calorie-blasting moves.", "text": "Slim in 6 DVD Workout Lose up to25 poundsin just6 weeks.Slim in 6 is more effective at helping you lose weight than those super-intense, high-impact workouts. The secret is Debbie's Slim Training, a combination of low-impact cardio moves and light resistance that gets you into the optimal fat-burning zone – and keeps you there longer. The fat melts away as you tone lean muscle, so you get incredible body-shaping results, faster!What You Get with Slim in 6:3 Easy to Follow Fat-Burning WorkoutsGet Slim in 3 Easy Steps:Step 1: Start It Up!– Start melting fat and slimming down with this 30-minute, moderate intensity workout.Step 2: Ramp it Up!– Turn up the calorie burn with moves that target your hips, thighs, and abs in about 45 minutes a day.Step 3: Burn it Up!– Reveal your new slim, toned body with Debbie’s advanced workout that takes less than an hour.Workout CalendarChart your progress with each workout and watch the pounds melt away.Weight Loss Eating PlanDelicious meal plans developed by registered dieticians to help you lose weight faster and easier.Tools to Help you Succeed6-Day Express Plan– Jump-start your results and lose up to 6 pounds and 6 inches in your first 6 days – the healthy way!Simple Steps to Success!– Debbie guides you through your transformation step by step.2 FREE WorkoutsSlim & 6-Pack– This 10-minute workout targets ab flab for a tight, toned midsection and strong core.Slim & Limber– Stretch out your muscles to keep your body lean, flexible, and feeling good all over.BONUS GIFTSSlim Training Resistance Band– Shape and tone a beautiful, sexy body with just the right amount of resistance – no bulky weights required.Cardio Core! Express– Burn fat as you tighten and strengthen your entire core with all-new calorie-blasting moves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RXDhHd0WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CL3IAU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 72.8}}
{"item_id": "B001CLBJ74", "title": "Otis Mossy Oak Tactical Cleaning System", "description": "In order to fill your tag or bag your limit, you’ve got to put in as much time with your gear as you do in the blind or stand. Spend some of that quality time cleaning your firearm correctly. Contains the brushes needed to clean .22, .270, .30, .38, .45 cal. rifles/pistols and 12/20/10 ga. shotguns. Patch cleans all .17-.50 cal. rifles/pistols, .410 – 12/10 ga. shotguns and all in-line muzzleloaders", "text": "Otis Mossy Oak Tactical Cleaning System In order to fill your tag or bag your limit, you’ve got to put in as much time with your gear as you do in the blind or stand. Spend some of that quality time cleaning your firearm correctly. Contains the brushes needed to clean .22, .270, .30, .38, .45 cal. rifles/pistols and 12/20/10 ga. shotguns. Patch cleans all .17-.50 cal. rifles/pistols, .410 – 12/10 ga. shotguns and all in-line muzzleloaders", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qDYfEDqQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CLBJ74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CLFI6W", "title": "Bulldog Extreme Black Rifle Case with Black Trim", "description": "Black with Black Trim 45\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Brushed Tricot, soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Zippered accessory pocket * Heavy-duty double stitching * Removable adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * 4 Velcro external magazine pouches * It Floats!!!", "text": "Bulldog Extreme Black Rifle Case with Black Trim Black with Black Trim 45\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Brushed Tricot, soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Zippered accessory pocket * Heavy-duty double stitching * Removable adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * 4 Velcro external magazine pouches * It Floats!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Q8KVNQCAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CLFI6W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CLSWKQ", "title": "Kool-Stop Dual Compound Mountain Pads for Linear Pull Brakes Threaded", "description": "These Kool-Stop Mountain pads fit linear pull brakes (A.K.A. V-brakes) and feature a dual compound composition for a balance of good stopping power in both wet and dry conditions.", "text": "Kool-Stop Dual Compound Mountain Pads for Linear Pull Brakes Threaded These Kool-Stop Mountain pads fit linear pull brakes (A.K.A. V-brakes) and feature a dual compound composition for a balance of good stopping power in both wet and dry conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ixJARz-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CLSWKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kool Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B001CM5JIS", "title": "Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart", "description": "Save your back! Roll - about Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart hauls up to 250 lbs. in the boonies. BIG BUCKS OFF! Use it to roll your tree stand and gear! Roll your downed deer out. All so effortlessly! Our special make-up means no middleman mark-up. Save! Shucks, this balanced (zero weight on the handle) aluminum Cart is Herculean strong. Silent, puncture-proof, 16\" solid rubber spoked wheels easily roll over the roughest terrain, dead falls, small streams and just about anything else in the way. A lot of our pals used to drag downed deer out of the deep backcountry with rope, back-breaking oomph and plenty of muscle. But then they wised up and now \"drive\" this roll-about Cart. It hauls up to 250 lbs. of gear and supplies. Takes that big trophy out of the deep woods with little effort. Folds flat like a pancake in seconds to fit in your vehicle or for compact storage. Cargo area is 19 x 64\" h., weighs 21 1/2 lbs. Anti-reflective finish. What a drag it would be if you missed this golden opportunity to bag a Deer, er, Cart. Order this dependable transporter today! Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart", "text": "Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart Save your back! Roll - about Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart hauls up to 250 lbs. in the boonies. BIG BUCKS OFF! Use it to roll your tree stand and gear! Roll your downed deer out. All so effortlessly! Our special make-up means no middleman mark-up. Save! Shucks, this balanced (zero weight on the handle) aluminum Cart is Herculean strong. Silent, puncture-proof, 16\" solid rubber spoked wheels easily roll over the roughest terrain, dead falls, small streams and just about anything else in the way. A lot of our pals used to drag downed deer out of the deep backcountry with rope, back-breaking oomph and plenty of muscle. But then they wised up and now \"drive\" this roll-about Cart. It hauls up to 250 lbs. of gear and supplies. Takes that big trophy out of the deep woods with little effort. Folds flat like a pancake in seconds to fit in your vehicle or for compact storage. Cargo area is 19 x 64\" h., weighs 21 1/2 lbs. Anti-reflective finish. What a drag it would be if you missed this golden opportunity to bag a Deer, er, Cart. Order this dependable transporter today! Guide Gear Aluminum Deer Cart", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RkDoBgc%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CM5JIS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Carts"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B001CME56A", "title": "Rothco A.C.U. Digital MICH Helmet Cover", "description": "The Rothco 9651 is the cover for the new M.I.C.H. helmet (Modular Integrated Communications Helmet). It is constructed of 55% cotton/45% polyester ripstop with and ACU Digital pattern. Its front flap has a hook and loop closure and also attaches to the helmet with hook and loop.", "text": "Rothco A.C.U. Digital MICH Helmet Cover The Rothco 9651 is the cover for the new M.I.C.H. helmet (Modular Integrated Communications Helmet). It is constructed of 55% cotton/45% polyester ripstop with and ACU Digital pattern. Its front flap has a hook and loop closure and also attaches to the helmet with hook and loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zS3e5hQUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CME56A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Helmets"]], "price": 10.49}}
