{"item_id": "B001CN6QAC", "title": "KMC Z50 Bicycle Chain (6-7-Speed, 1/2 x 3/32-Inch, 116L, Dark Silver/Brown)", "description": "This bicycle chain, from precision bicycle component maker KMC, is compatible with five-, six-, and seven-speed use. It's IG and HG compatible, and designed without bushings for virtually noiseless function. Outer plate chamfering ensures accurate steering within the drivetrain, while inner plate chamfering enables expeditious articulating. Bushing-less construction is good for smooth transition, as well.SpecificationsBrown/silver color369-gram weight7.3-millimeter width116-link length3/32 speeds3/32-inch chain compatibilityAbout KMCPrecision two-wheeler parts manufacturer KMC creates chains for bicycles, motorcycles, automobiles, and industrial use. For more than three decades, KMC has single-mindedly based its business operations on perfecting chains, primarily for bicycle use, and the company began partnering with Japanese chain supplier Shimano in 1986. All of KMC's precision manufacturing operations have passed ISO9002 and ISO9001 standards of quality regulations to ensure consistent performance across each chain the company sells, and since 2003, all KMC plants adopted the Toyota Production System (TPS), which represents superior standards and regulations for enhanced quality control.", "text": "KMC Z50 Bicycle Chain (6-7-Speed, 1/2 x 3/32-Inch, 116L, Dark Silver/Brown) This bicycle chain, from precision bicycle component maker KMC, is compatible with five-, six-, and seven-speed use. It's IG and HG compatible, and designed without bushings for virtually noiseless function. Outer plate chamfering ensures accurate steering within the drivetrain, while inner plate chamfering enables expeditious articulating. Bushing-less construction is good for smooth transition, as well.SpecificationsBrown/silver color369-gram weight7.3-millimeter width116-link length3/32 speeds3/32-inch chain compatibilityAbout KMCPrecision two-wheeler parts manufacturer KMC creates chains for bicycles, motorcycles, automobiles, and industrial use. For more than three decades, KMC has single-mindedly based its business operations on perfecting chains, primarily for bicycle use, and the company began partnering with Japanese chain supplier Shimano in 1986. All of KMC's precision manufacturing operations have passed ISO9002 and ISO9001 standards of quality regulations to ensure consistent performance across each chain the company sells, and since 2003, all KMC plants adopted the Toyota Production System (TPS), which represents superior standards and regulations for enhanced quality control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21-o5KzjreL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CN6QAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 8.63}}
