{"item_id": "B001CPEZ62", "title": "Black Tom Anderson Kult Folder 6.25 inch", "description": "Kult Folding knife. A fantasy folder that features a fantasy curved hawk blade. Alum. handle scalloped handle with rubber inlays and a ribbed back inlay .6.25 inch overall, 4.25 inch blade.", "text": "Black Tom Anderson Kult Folder 6.25 inch Kult Folding knife. A fantasy folder that features a fantasy curved hawk blade. Alum. handle scalloped handle with rubber inlays and a ribbed back inlay .6.25 inch overall, 4.25 inch blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DO-fvQ8kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CPEZ62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tom Anderson Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CPGVB4", "title": "MTECH XTREME USA MX-8027A TACTICAL FOLDING KNIFE 5\" CLOSED", "description": "The Mtech Extreme Tactical Folding Knife is a designer, collector's knife built for all-purpose utility, ideal for camping and outdoors use. Measuring 8.75 inches overall, the knife has a sharp, 3.75-inch blade forged of high-quality 440 stainless steel that folds into a precisely cut handgrip with a melt. The jet-black blade features a stylish metal fence design and the well-proportioned handgrip offers a secure hold and stealth look. Measuring five inches long when closed, the knife fits perfectly in a pocket or you can use the belt clip to keep the knife at your side.Specifications:Blade length: 3.75 inchesOverall length: 8.75Closed length: 5 inchesBlade construction: 440 stainless steel", "text": "MTECH XTREME USA MX-8027A TACTICAL FOLDING KNIFE 5\" CLOSED The Mtech Extreme Tactical Folding Knife is a designer, collector's knife built for all-purpose utility, ideal for camping and outdoors use. Measuring 8.75 inches overall, the knife has a sharp, 3.75-inch blade forged of high-quality 440 stainless steel that folds into a precisely cut handgrip with a melt. The jet-black blade features a stylish metal fence design and the well-proportioned handgrip offers a secure hold and stealth look. Measuring five inches long when closed, the knife fits perfectly in a pocket or you can use the belt clip to keep the knife at your side.Specifications:Blade length: 3.75 inchesOverall length: 8.75Closed length: 5 inchesBlade construction: 440 stainless steel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VVSOZeh%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CPGVB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTECH USA XTREME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 7.75}}
{"item_id": "B001CPITS2", "title": "BladesUSA HK-1067 Ninja Sword 26-Inch & 18-Inch Overall", "description": "The strength and durability of these vipers will allow you to hack through almost anything. Each sword is constructed with one solid piece of black anodized 420 stainless steel. The handles are nylon wrapped to insure a tight grip at all times. Includes a nylon sheath that houses both swords and easily fits across your back for convenience. (Sm: 18\"ov, 11\"bl) (Lg: 26 1/4\"ov, 16 3/4\"bl)", "text": "BladesUSA HK-1067 Ninja Sword 26-Inch & 18-Inch Overall The strength and durability of these vipers will allow you to hack through almost anything. Each sword is constructed with one solid piece of black anodized 420 stainless steel. The handles are nylon wrapped to insure a tight grip at all times. Includes a nylon sheath that houses both swords and easily fits across your back for convenience. (Sm: 18\"ov, 11\"bl) (Lg: 26 1/4\"ov, 16 3/4\"bl)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dnBd3SUPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CPITS2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BladesUSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Ninja Weapons"]], "price": 19.5}}
{"item_id": "B001CPM62W", "title": "Jungle Master JM-001L Fixed Blade Knife (15-Inch Overall)", "description": "The fifteen-inch Jungle Master Tactical Knife provides a thick, high-quality 10.5-inch stainless steel blade for years of use. The curved clip point blade is great for puncturing and slicing, while the serrated top edge saws effectively. Designed for steady and secure handling, the knife is equipped with a ridged, rubberized metal handle. The knife blade is protected within the included nylon sheath.The item can be shipped only within the U.S , But the item has sales restriction in New YorkSpecifications:Overall length: 15 inchesBlade length: 10.5 inchesBlade Style: Curved, clip point with serrated top edgeBlade Material: 440 stainless steelHandle: Ridged rubberized metalHeavy duty nylon sheath", "text": "Jungle Master JM-001L Fixed Blade Knife (15-Inch Overall) The fifteen-inch Jungle Master Tactical Knife provides a thick, high-quality 10.5-inch stainless steel blade for years of use. The curved clip point blade is great for puncturing and slicing, while the serrated top edge saws effectively. Designed for steady and secure handling, the knife is equipped with a ridged, rubberized metal handle. The knife blade is protected within the included nylon sheath.The item can be shipped only within the U.S , But the item has sales restriction in New YorkSpecifications:Overall length: 15 inchesBlade length: 10.5 inchesBlade Style: Curved, clip point with serrated top edgeBlade Material: 440 stainless steelHandle: Ridged rubberized metalHeavy duty nylon sheath", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31blMat%2BJDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CPM62W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jungle Master", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.75}}
{"item_id": "B001CPM67C", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery's The Woodsmen Folding Pocket Knife", "description": "If you are a fan of the classic pocket knife or hunting knife then you should truly respect the importance and simplicity that our spring assisted Super knives allow you to operate with. Just open the blade a little with the thumb-stud and the knife will take it from there. All of our spring assisted knives have great lock-up power, are built durable, and have the ability to be carried around in your pocket ready to be easily accessed in no time. The Spring Assisted knife will make you feel safer and protected no matter where you go.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery's The Woodsmen Folding Pocket Knife If you are a fan of the classic pocket knife or hunting knife then you should truly respect the importance and simplicity that our spring assisted Super knives allow you to operate with. Just open the blade a little with the thumb-stud and the knife will take it from there. All of our spring assisted knives have great lock-up power, are built durable, and have the ability to be carried around in your pocket ready to be easily accessed in no time. The Spring Assisted knife will make you feel safer and protected no matter where you go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417AFIeJPfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CPM67C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CR2YPO", "title": "Bulldog Medium Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster (Fits 32-Inch - 38-Inch Waist)", "description": "Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster - Medium# 6\" wide elastic and Velcro# Holds 2 weapons and 2 mags # Has a concealed money pocket# Fits 32\" - 38\" waist", "text": "Bulldog Medium Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster (Fits 32-Inch - 38-Inch Waist) Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster - Medium# 6\" wide elastic and Velcro# Holds 2 weapons and 2 mags # Has a concealed money pocket# Fits 32\" - 38\" waist", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qiKLBqOCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CR2YPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.88}}
{"item_id": "B001CR2YQI", "title": "Pro Tech Outdoors 6\" Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster", "description": "Pro Tech Outdoors Belly Wrap Holsters keep your pistol \"close to the vest\"! These VELCRO brand closure elastic Holsters fit snug around your waist to keep pistol and / or wallet close at hand and out of sight. Choose the 4\" wide Standard that's slotted on both sides to hold a single gun and wallet. Or the 6\" Deluxe that will hold 2 guns and 2 mags, and has a concealed cash pocket. State Size. Sm.(28\"-37\"), Med.(38\"-45\") and Lg.(42\"-52\"). Choose yours and order today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Pro Tech Outdoors 4\" Standard Belly Wrap Holster - word search in our store for 'Pro Tech Outdoors'. Pro Tech Outdoors 6\" Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster", "text": "Pro Tech Outdoors 6\" Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster Pro Tech Outdoors Belly Wrap Holsters keep your pistol \"close to the vest\"! These VELCRO brand closure elastic Holsters fit snug around your waist to keep pistol and / or wallet close at hand and out of sight. Choose the 4\" wide Standard that's slotted on both sides to hold a single gun and wallet. Or the 6\" Deluxe that will hold 2 guns and 2 mags, and has a concealed cash pocket. State Size. Sm.(28\"-37\"), Med.(38\"-45\") and Lg.(42\"-52\"). Choose yours and order today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Pro Tech Outdoors 4\" Standard Belly Wrap Holster - word search in our store for 'Pro Tech Outdoors'. Pro Tech Outdoors 6\" Deluxe Belly Wrap Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518unYvbNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CR2YQI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
