{"item_id": "B001CR4AAG", "title": "Timber Rattler Western Outlaw Bowie Knife", "description": "Timber Rattler Western Outlaw Bowie Knife", "text": "Timber Rattler Western Outlaw Bowie Knife Timber Rattler Western Outlaw Bowie Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zSDlOA33L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CR4AAG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Timber Rattler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CR7PZS", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool 3011K Marine Utility Knife with Combo Edge, Black Handle", "description": "3011K Veff M.U.K. (Marine Utility Knife) by Columbia River Knife & Tool has a 4.25-Inch rounded-back drop point blade of high-carbon stainless steel with a combo edge featuring their patented Veff serrations. This knife was designed with a offset handle angle to give knuckles clearance when cutting bait or slicing fish on a cutting table. The handle is a soft, grooved polypropylene in black with four finger choils to give the best grip possible when hands are cold, wet and slippery. A plastic blade protector is included.", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool 3011K Marine Utility Knife with Combo Edge, Black Handle 3011K Veff M.U.K. (Marine Utility Knife) by Columbia River Knife & Tool has a 4.25-Inch rounded-back drop point blade of high-carbon stainless steel with a combo edge featuring their patented Veff serrations. This knife was designed with a offset handle angle to give knuckles clearance when cutting bait or slicing fish on a cutting table. The handle is a soft, grooved polypropylene in black with four finger choils to give the best grip possible when hands are cold, wet and slippery. A plastic blade protector is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qTJZP2W0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CR7PZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 11.32}}
{"item_id": "B001CR9ZR4", "title": "UTG Airgun .22 High Profile Integral 1-Inch Ring Mount", "description": "OFFSET RING MOUNTS, AccuShot Airgun/.22 1\" Bi-direction Integral Offset Mount - 62mm Base Length, 38mm Bi-Directional Eye Relief Offset Adjustment", "text": "UTG Airgun .22 High Profile Integral 1-Inch Ring Mount OFFSET RING MOUNTS, AccuShot Airgun/.22 1\" Bi-direction Integral Offset Mount - 62mm Base Length, 38mm Bi-Directional Eye Relief Offset Adjustment", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rhczNoUrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CR9ZR4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 13.7}}
{"item_id": "B001CRBNEC", "title": "Intex 4 Person Mariner Inflatable Boat Set", "description": "Ideal for a relaxed, low key day on the lake or easy river, the US Coast Guard-approved Intex Mariner 4 has room for four -- with two fishing rod holders, if you'd like to try and catch your lunch -- and four rapidly inflating chambers. Made of Super-Tough PVC material, the Mariner 4 is durable enough to stand up to years of heavy use, and deflates and packs down quickly for easy transport.FeaturesFour-person raft measures 57 by 19 by 129 inches (W x H x D)880-pound maximum weight limitMade of Super-Tough laminated vinyl that resists abrasion, impact, and UV ray damageHeavy-duty extruded plastic flooring for comfort and rigidityInflatable keel for improved control and handlingQuick-fill, fast-deflate Boston valvesRotating oar locks and oar holdersTwo fishing rod holdersThree inflatable seat cushions for comfort and supportAll-around grab line and rock guardGrab handle on each end of the boat for easy carryingBattery and gear pouchesMotor mount fittingCertified by the National Marine Manufacturer's Association (NMMA) and U.S. Coast Guard I.D.Includes inflatable seats, repair patch kit, 54-inch deluxe aluminum oars, and high-output manual hand pumpWarrantyIntex products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Intex RecreationIntex Recreation makes above ground swimming pools, air beds, inflatable toys, pool and lake boats, and the proprietary Intex Saltwater Pool System. The company has been in business for over 40 years, and is a global leader in designing and producing innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation.Intex products meet the most stringent safety standards, undergoing intensive testing to ensure years of safety and satisfaction. During the manufacturing process, trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, including quality of raw materials, calibration of the machines, manufacture and assembly of each product, product testing, and careful packaging of every item.", "text": "Intex 4 Person Mariner Inflatable Boat Set Ideal for a relaxed, low key day on the lake or easy river, the US Coast Guard-approved Intex Mariner 4 has room for four -- with two fishing rod holders, if you'd like to try and catch your lunch -- and four rapidly inflating chambers. Made of Super-Tough PVC material, the Mariner 4 is durable enough to stand up to years of heavy use, and deflates and packs down quickly for easy transport.FeaturesFour-person raft measures 57 by 19 by 129 inches (W x H x D)880-pound maximum weight limitMade of Super-Tough laminated vinyl that resists abrasion, impact, and UV ray damageHeavy-duty extruded plastic flooring for comfort and rigidityInflatable keel for improved control and handlingQuick-fill, fast-deflate Boston valvesRotating oar locks and oar holdersTwo fishing rod holdersThree inflatable seat cushions for comfort and supportAll-around grab line and rock guardGrab handle on each end of the boat for easy carryingBattery and gear pouchesMotor mount fittingCertified by the National Marine Manufacturer's Association (NMMA) and U.S. Coast Guard I.D.Includes inflatable seats, repair patch kit, 54-inch deluxe aluminum oars, and high-output manual hand pumpWarrantyIntex products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Intex RecreationIntex Recreation makes above ground swimming pools, air beds, inflatable toys, pool and lake boats, and the proprietary Intex Saltwater Pool System. The company has been in business for over 40 years, and is a global leader in designing and producing innovative products for indoor and outdoor recreation.Intex products meet the most stringent safety standards, undergoing intensive testing to ensure years of safety and satisfaction. During the manufacturing process, trained Intex employees continuously monitor a wide range of factors, including quality of raw materials, calibration of the machines, manufacture and assembly of each product, product testing, and careful packaging of every item.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CGrnPyzJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CRBNEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boats", "Inflatable Rafts"]], "price": 269.0}}
{"item_id": "B001CS2Q4M", "title": "Leather Conditioner - Bick 4 by Bickmore since 1882", "description": "", "text": "Leather Conditioner - Bick 4 by Bickmore since 1882", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cj9vSuXTL._SY395_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CS2Q4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bickmore", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Tack", "Saddle Accessories"]], "price": 8.38}}
{"item_id": "B001CS53E2", "title": "Datrex Emergency Water Packet - 3 Day/72 Hour Supply(12packets)", "description": "Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Safe drinking water is probably the most important thing to have in reserve when disaster strikes. 125 ml sachets of Datrex purified water are easy to dispense and loss is minimalized due to the durable packaging. USCG, Canadian Coast Guard, EC and NZ approval, with a five year shelf life. Contains (12)- 125 ml sachets.", "text": "Datrex Emergency Water Packet - 3 Day/72 Hour Supply(12packets) Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Safe drinking water is probably the most important thing to have in reserve when disaster strikes. 125 ml sachets of Datrex purified water are easy to dispense and loss is minimalized due to the durable packaging. USCG, Canadian Coast Guard, EC and NZ approval, with a five year shelf life. Contains (12)- 125 ml sachets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ed-Q4CCdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CS53E2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Datrex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B001CS5IRY", "title": "Isokinetics Inc. Hand Exercise Squeeze Ball - Egg Shaped - 5 Resistance Levels - Sold Separately", "description": "We provide all of our squeeze balls with a 1 year guarantee direct from Isokinetics Inc. These are egg shaped squeeze balls used for hand, finger, wrist and grip exercising and rehabilitation. They have a soft, textured surface and are designed to easily fit in your hand. Thermoplastic rubber is not well suited for heating or cooling. If you require a hand exerciser that can be heated or cooled, please see our Eggsercizer or Thera-Band hand exercisers.", "text": "Isokinetics Inc. Hand Exercise Squeeze Ball - Egg Shaped - 5 Resistance Levels - Sold Separately We provide all of our squeeze balls with a 1 year guarantee direct from Isokinetics Inc. These are egg shaped squeeze balls used for hand, finger, wrist and grip exercising and rehabilitation. They have a soft, textured surface and are designed to easily fit in your hand. Thermoplastic rubber is not well suited for heating or cooling. If you require a hand exerciser that can be heated or cooled, please see our Eggsercizer or Thera-Band hand exercisers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j2NFw65lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CS5IRY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 6.79}}
{"item_id": "B001CS7MBE", "title": "Datrex Emergency Survival 2400 Calorie Food Ration Bar, 12 Bars", "description": "Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Food rations from Datrex are made from all natural ingredients, have high energy value and are tabletized and sub packaged for easy rationing. They have a five year shelf life and are USCG approved so you know you can count on them when you need them.200 Calories per bar/pack of 12 bars.", "text": "Datrex Emergency Survival 2400 Calorie Food Ration Bar, 12 Bars Even if you haven't witnessed a disaster firsthand, you've seen the devastation they cause and you know that you can never be too prepared. If you are out on the water; preparation is even more important. Food rations from Datrex are made from all natural ingredients, have high energy value and are tabletized and sub packaged for easy rationing. They have a five year shelf life and are USCG approved so you know you can count on them when you need them.200 Calories per bar/pack of 12 bars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418GXR7FmEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CS7MBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Datrex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 7.89}}
{"item_id": "B001CS8G3C", "title": "Bickmore - Bick 4 Leather Conditioner 16 Ounces", "description": "10FPR108 Size: 16 Oz. Features: -Equine: Leather care and accessories.-Conditioning.-Conditions, cleans, polishes and protects leather.-Does not darken leather! will not affect the breathability of leather.-Recommended for exotic leather.-Does not leave a sticky or gummy residue behind.-No additional cleaners or protestants needed!.-Removes water and oil based stains, soil, grease, spur marks, food and ink stains.-Not recommended for daily use (Bick 4 is the product for regular leather maintenance! ).-Wax and silicone free.-Made in USA. Color/Finish: -Prevents dirt from being trapped in the leather and dulling the finish. Dimensions: -8 Oz.: 6.5\" H x 2\" W x 2\" D, 0.66 lbs.-16 Oz.: 8.5\" H x 2.5\" W x 2.5\" D, 1.33 lbs.", "text": "Bickmore - Bick 4 Leather Conditioner 16 Ounces 10FPR108 Size: 16 Oz. Features: -Equine: Leather care and accessories.-Conditioning.-Conditions, cleans, polishes and protects leather.-Does not darken leather! will not affect the breathability of leather.-Recommended for exotic leather.-Does not leave a sticky or gummy residue behind.-No additional cleaners or protestants needed!.-Removes water and oil based stains, soil, grease, spur marks, food and ink stains.-Not recommended for daily use (Bick 4 is the product for regular leather maintenance! ).-Wax and silicone free.-Made in USA. Color/Finish: -Prevents dirt from being trapped in the leather and dulling the finish. Dimensions: -8 Oz.: 6.5\" H x 2\" W x 2\" D, 0.66 lbs.-16 Oz.: 8.5\" H x 2.5\" W x 2.5\" D, 1.33 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iDX5iApFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CS8G3C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bickmore", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Tack", "Saddle Accessories"]], "price": 6.93}}
{"item_id": "B001CSCC7I", "title": "4 in 1 Emergency Tool", "description": "Designed and tested by professional firefighters to be effective in case of any emergency where it is needed. - Tough Heat Treated Alloy. - Won't Spark - Won't Rust - Shuts off Gas - Shuts off Water - Pries open Doors - Digs through Debris - Made in the U.S.A.", "text": "4 in 1 Emergency Tool Designed and tested by professional firefighters to be effective in case of any emergency where it is needed. - Tough Heat Treated Alloy. - Won't Spark - Won't Rust - Shuts off Gas - Shuts off Water - Pries open Doors - Digs through Debris - Made in the U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JIw6wi1hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSCC7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B001CSK7AW", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 2.5mm Sport Cap", "description": "This little beanie beats the chill and is a smart addition to any diver’s warm water gear bag. The skull-cap design and moderate thickness allow it to provide good thermal protection without the constricting feel of a full hood. The anatomical shape and multi-adjustable neck cinch also give divers a precise fit.", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 2.5mm Sport Cap This little beanie beats the chill and is a smart addition to any diver’s warm water gear bag. The skull-cap design and moderate thickness allow it to provide good thermal protection without the constricting feel of a full hood. The anatomical shape and multi-adjustable neck cinch also give divers a precise fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kh9ZfvOJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSK7AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CSM0CK", "title": "Beartooth Made in USA Universal Fit Brown Color Neoprene Recoil Pad Kit For Mosin Nagant 91/30 M44 M38 M39 Mauser K98 M! Garand Springfield 1903 Remington 700 798 Howa 1500 Weatherby Vanguard Winchester 70 Rifles", "description": "Beartooth Universal Fit Neoprene Recoil Pad Kit For Mosin Nagant 91/30 M44 M38 M39 Mauser K98 Rifles Features: Made by Beartooth, Brown Color, Universal fit - One size fits all, Includes: Rubber backed Slip on neoprene sleeve with non-slip Vertical ribs on the butt, Four interchangeable hi-density foam inserts, Pad sizes are 1/4\", 3/8\", 1/2, and 5/8\". Hi density foam pads will reduce felt recoil by up to 40%. Allows you to use the best sized pad to achieve the perfect stock length for your rifle or shotgun. Easy to put on and take off with no modification to your rifle or shotgun. The rubber backed neoprene material will fit your buttstock like a glove. Neoprene slip on cover can also be used with your existing recoil pad. This kit will help make your shooting more comfortable and improve accuracy. Brand New", "text": "Beartooth Made in USA Universal Fit Brown Color Neoprene Recoil Pad Kit For Mosin Nagant 91/30 M44 M38 M39 Mauser K98 M! Garand Springfield 1903 Remington 700 798 Howa 1500 Weatherby Vanguard Winchester 70 Rifles Beartooth Universal Fit Neoprene Recoil Pad Kit For Mosin Nagant 91/30 M44 M38 M39 Mauser K98 Rifles Features: Made by Beartooth, Brown Color, Universal fit - One size fits all, Includes: Rubber backed Slip on neoprene sleeve with non-slip Vertical ribs on the butt, Four interchangeable hi-density foam inserts, Pad sizes are 1/4\", 3/8\", 1/2, and 5/8\". Hi density foam pads will reduce felt recoil by up to 40%. Allows you to use the best sized pad to achieve the perfect stock length for your rifle or shotgun. Easy to put on and take off with no modification to your rifle or shotgun. The rubber backed neoprene material will fit your buttstock like a glove. Neoprene slip on cover can also be used with your existing recoil pad. This kit will help make your shooting more comfortable and improve accuracy. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qfH8GlKuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSM0CK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CSP0QI", "title": "NcStar 3O8, 10 RD Stripper Clips/20 Pack (AFNC)", "description": ".308 steel stripper clips (pack of 20)", "text": "NcStar 3O8, 10 RD Stripper Clips/20 Pack (AFNC) .308 steel stripper clips (pack of 20)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dwOI0y%2B5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSP0QI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B001CSPTSC", "title": "Feedback Sports Pro Elite Repair Stand (Red)", "description": "A patented quick-release clamp features ratchet-action closing and push-button release.For serious bike maintenance enthusiasts, the Feedback Sports Pro-Elite Work Stand bring professional-quality construction and features out of the bike shop and into your garage. It's a portable yet suitably heavy-duty stand featuring a patented Quick-release Secure-Lock Clamp, with ratchet-action closure and bush-button release for safe, secure, and fast clamping and removal of your bike. The clamp's rubber jaws can accommodate frames up to 2.6-inches thick, and enable 360-degree rotation without clamp re-adjustment, so you can easily reach all of your bike's hard-to-reach places.The stand is made from attractive, rust-proof, red-anodized 6000 series aluminum tubing, and can support up to 85 pounds thanks to a tripod leg design that lets the stand remain stable on bot flat and uneven surfaces. The work height can be adjusted from 42 to 71 inches, and requires no tools for set-up and tear-down.FeaturesPatented Quick-release Clamp: An innovative Secure-Lock features ratchet-action closing and push-button release, and a Tri-Knob allows fine tuning of clamp jaw pressure to quickly get your bike in and out of the standClutch: 360-degree rotation of the clamp head allows you to work on the bike in any positionPortability: No tools required for set-up and tear down; quickly folds into a compact unit when not in useStability: Strong, easy-to-open tripod design allows wrenching on flat or uneven surfaces360-degree rotation of the clamp head allows you to work on the bike in any position.SpecificationsAnodized 6000 series aluminum for lightweight durability12.6-pound weight42-to-71-inch heght19-to-66-millimeter clamp opening3.25-inch jaw width54-inch base diameterMeasures eight by 46 by 5.5 inches (W x H x D)85-pound load capacityWarrantyThis Feedback Sports product includes a limited three-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Feedback SportsBased in Golden, Colorado, Feedback Sports was started by cyclist and racer Doug Hudson in 2004, when he developed the Alpine Digital Scale to weigh bicycles. Early on, the scales were successfully distributed through another Colorado company named Ultimate Bike Support, which Feedback Sports acquired in 2008 to add bicycle work stands and storage stands to the Feedback product mix. The company has since refined and continually improved its award-winning designs while also introducing new bicycle accessories.", "text": "Feedback Sports Pro Elite Repair Stand (Red) A patented quick-release clamp features ratchet-action closing and push-button release.For serious bike maintenance enthusiasts, the Feedback Sports Pro-Elite Work Stand bring professional-quality construction and features out of the bike shop and into your garage. It's a portable yet suitably heavy-duty stand featuring a patented Quick-release Secure-Lock Clamp, with ratchet-action closure and bush-button release for safe, secure, and fast clamping and removal of your bike. The clamp's rubber jaws can accommodate frames up to 2.6-inches thick, and enable 360-degree rotation without clamp re-adjustment, so you can easily reach all of your bike's hard-to-reach places.The stand is made from attractive, rust-proof, red-anodized 6000 series aluminum tubing, and can support up to 85 pounds thanks to a tripod leg design that lets the stand remain stable on bot flat and uneven surfaces. The work height can be adjusted from 42 to 71 inches, and requires no tools for set-up and tear-down.FeaturesPatented Quick-release Clamp: An innovative Secure-Lock features ratchet-action closing and push-button release, and a Tri-Knob allows fine tuning of clamp jaw pressure to quickly get your bike in and out of the standClutch: 360-degree rotation of the clamp head allows you to work on the bike in any positionPortability: No tools required for set-up and tear down; quickly folds into a compact unit when not in useStability: Strong, easy-to-open tripod design allows wrenching on flat or uneven surfaces360-degree rotation of the clamp head allows you to work on the bike in any position.SpecificationsAnodized 6000 series aluminum for lightweight durability12.6-pound weight42-to-71-inch heght19-to-66-millimeter clamp opening3.25-inch jaw width54-inch base diameterMeasures eight by 46 by 5.5 inches (W x H x D)85-pound load capacityWarrantyThis Feedback Sports product includes a limited three-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Feedback SportsBased in Golden, Colorado, Feedback Sports was started by cyclist and racer Doug Hudson in 2004, when he developed the Alpine Digital Scale to weigh bicycles. Early on, the scales were successfully distributed through another Colorado company named Ultimate Bike Support, which Feedback Sports acquired in 2008 to add bicycle work stands and storage stands to the Feedback product mix. The company has since refined and continually improved its award-winning designs while also introducing new bicycle accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c9JXe8-AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSPTSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Feedback Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 229.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CSQ6BQ", "title": "Selle Italia Flite Gel Flow TI Men's Bicycle Saddle (Titanium Rails)", "description": "As one of Selle Italia's super-comfort models, the Selle Italia Flite Gel Flow TI Men's Bicycle Saddle features an anatomic central opening and silicone gel padding with differentiated thickness for a comfortable, perfect fit. Other features include a perforated leather cover for miles and miles of durability and breathability. With tubular titanium rails for reduced weight, this saddle weighs a scant 220 grams and measures 130 x 280 millimeters (WxL). A wide variety of color combinations are available to suit any taste. Like all Selle Italia saddles, the Flite Gel Flow TI was made in Italy.", "text": "Selle Italia Flite Gel Flow TI Men's Bicycle Saddle (Titanium Rails) As one of Selle Italia's super-comfort models, the Selle Italia Flite Gel Flow TI Men's Bicycle Saddle features an anatomic central opening and silicone gel padding with differentiated thickness for a comfortable, perfect fit. Other features include a perforated leather cover for miles and miles of durability and breathability. With tubular titanium rails for reduced weight, this saddle weighs a scant 220 grams and measures 130 x 280 millimeters (WxL). A wide variety of color combinations are available to suit any taste. Like all Selle Italia saddles, the Flite Gel Flow TI was made in Italy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZC0zCcxwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSQ6BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 250.3}}
{"item_id": "B001CSRX18", "title": "Michelin City Tire with Protek Plus and Reflective Sidewalls (Black, 26x1.4)", "description": "The city reflective tire features a tough Protek plus layer under the tread that was designed to make punctures a thing of the past. And the tread pattern makes this tire particularly well-suited to asphalt and cement. Silicium-compound tread for low rolling resistance and mud shedding. Protek plus layer under tread to resist punctures.", "text": "Michelin City Tire with Protek Plus and Reflective Sidewalls (Black, 26x1.4) The city reflective tire features a tough Protek plus layer under the tread that was designed to make punctures a thing of the past. And the tread pattern makes this tire particularly well-suited to asphalt and cement. Silicium-compound tread for low rolling resistance and mud shedding. Protek plus layer under tread to resist punctures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PSUfkcvFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSRX18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Michelin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 19.74}}
{"item_id": "B001CSTJUQ", "title": "O2 Rainwear Original Hooded Jacket", "description": "Our ultra lightweight and packable Original Series Hooded Jacket is the most affordable breathable rain gear you can buy. It is extremely compact to fit into a jersey pocket. It's perfect for casual riders or dedicated race spectators. NOTHING. STOPS.YOU.", "text": "O2 Rainwear Original Hooded Jacket Our ultra lightweight and packable Original Series Hooded Jacket is the most affordable breathable rain gear you can buy. It is extremely compact to fit into a jersey pocket. It's perfect for casual riders or dedicated race spectators. NOTHING. STOPS.YOU.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E8jz2oMnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSTJUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CSV49K", "title": "Hillbilly Impact Shorts", "description": "These legendary Hillbilly Protection Impact Shorts are worn by some of the best (and worst!) riders in the world because they provide the ultimate in hip and tailbone protection.", "text": "Hillbilly Impact Shorts These legendary Hillbilly Protection Impact Shorts are worn by some of the best (and worst!) riders in the world because they provide the ultimate in hip and tailbone protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mnURkT-PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CSV49K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CTNGH2", "title": "Level III Lv3 Molle Assault Pack Backpack--ACU", "description": "Constructed of rugged, tactical polyester. Accepts modular or A.L.I.C.E. attachments. Hydration bladder compatible. Key features include: self repairing zippers, p/u coated lining and pockets, 1 large main zippered compartment with pouch and mesh pocket, 3 additional pockets, adjustable padded shoulder straps, padded back with breathable mesh backing, and carry handle.Made From 600D Polyester Material - P.P. Webbing Rugged Synthetic Material Similar To Rigid Government Specifications. Accepts Modular or Alice Pack Components & MOLLE Compatible. Heavy Duty Zippers with Pull Tabs. Polyurethane Coated Lining & Pockets. Water Resistant Material. Padded Back With Breathable Mesh Backing. Adjustable Padded Shoulder Straps. Adjustable & Removable Waist Belt. Top Carry Handle. Hydration Bladder Compatible. Size : 18\"H x 10\"W x 10\"D", "text": "Level III Lv3 Molle Assault Pack Backpack--ACU Constructed of rugged, tactical polyester. Accepts modular or A.L.I.C.E. attachments. Hydration bladder compatible. Key features include: self repairing zippers, p/u coated lining and pockets, 1 large main zippered compartment with pouch and mesh pocket, 3 additional pockets, adjustable padded shoulder straps, padded back with breathable mesh backing, and carry handle.Made From 600D Polyester Material - P.P. Webbing Rugged Synthetic Material Similar To Rigid Government Specifications. Accepts Modular or Alice Pack Components & MOLLE Compatible. Heavy Duty Zippers with Pull Tabs. Polyurethane Coated Lining & Pockets. Water Resistant Material. Padded Back With Breathable Mesh Backing. Adjustable Padded Shoulder Straps. Adjustable & Removable Waist Belt. Top Carry Handle. Hydration Bladder Compatible. Size : 18\"H x 10\"W x 10\"D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U--opBA%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CTNGH2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 49.99}}
