{"item_id": "B001CU5YBW", "title": "Schwinn 18-Function Bicycle Tool Kit", "description": "Featuring the Schwinn brand Americans have trusted for over one hundred years these mini tools come from the same design styling of folding pocket knives and larger multi-tools to offer the most maintenance and repair options possible without a full service station at hand. Small enough to go anywhere while featuring a multitude of devices that individually would require an entire toolbox; these tools can be used as emergency equipment or can constitute an entire home repair center all by themselves. PTI Sports products are designed with safety as the first and foremost concern and are constructed of high quality parts and materials to prevent degradation over time. Thoroughly tested, our products last through years of use before they are recommended for replacement, ensuring safe cycling for years to come.", "text": "Schwinn 18-Function Bicycle Tool Kit Featuring the Schwinn brand Americans have trusted for over one hundred years these mini tools come from the same design styling of folding pocket knives and larger multi-tools to offer the most maintenance and repair options possible without a full service station at hand. Small enough to go anywhere while featuring a multitude of devices that individually would require an entire toolbox; these tools can be used as emergency equipment or can constitute an entire home repair center all by themselves. PTI Sports products are designed with safety as the first and foremost concern and are constructed of high quality parts and materials to prevent degradation over time. Thoroughly tested, our products last through years of use before they are recommended for replacement, ensuring safe cycling for years to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416ncBflONL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CU5YBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 19.88}}
{"item_id": "B001CW9HUO", "title": "Smith & Wesson 100 Standard Handcuff, Nickel", "description": "Our most popular handcuff. Smith & Wesson handcuffs are fabricated from the finest quality carbon steel. They are manufactured with heat treated internal lockworks, featuring smooth ratchets for swift cuffing and double locks to prevent tampering. All S&W; handcuffs meet or exceed demanding U. S. National Institute of Justice tests for workmanship, strength, corrosion and tamper resistance. Standard Size Nickel.", "text": "Smith & Wesson 100 Standard Handcuff, Nickel Our most popular handcuff. Smith & Wesson handcuffs are fabricated from the finest quality carbon steel. They are manufactured with heat treated internal lockworks, featuring smooth ratchets for swift cuffing and double locks to prevent tampering. All S&W; handcuffs meet or exceed demanding U. S. National Institute of Justice tests for workmanship, strength, corrosion and tamper resistance. Standard Size Nickel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41skbLJTdiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CW9HUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 25.49}}
{"item_id": "B001CWAJO2", "title": "Rothco Orange E.M.S. Rescue Bag", "description": "Be prepared for emergencies wherever you go with this Rothco EMS rescue bag. The bag is made of heavy-duty, water-resistant 1,000-denier polyester, so it stands up to the elements in style. Storage-wise, the bag includes a large main compartment, two side pockets, and two interior pockets with four section dividers. As a result, you have plenty of room for shears, instruments, and tools. Other features include a Star of Life emblem on the side and a detachable, adjustable 1-1/2-inch web shoulder strap. The EMS rescue bag measures 12-1/2 by 6 by 6-1/2 inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Rothco Orange E.M.S. Rescue Bag Be prepared for emergencies wherever you go with this Rothco EMS rescue bag. The bag is made of heavy-duty, water-resistant 1,000-denier polyester, so it stands up to the elements in style. Storage-wise, the bag includes a large main compartment, two side pockets, and two interior pockets with four section dividers. As a result, you have plenty of room for shears, instruments, and tools. Other features include a Star of Life emblem on the side and a detachable, adjustable 1-1/2-inch web shoulder strap. The EMS rescue bag measures 12-1/2 by 6 by 6-1/2 inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41COW8RevQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CWAJO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B001CWCISM", "title": "Aluminum Canteen & Olive Drab Pistol Belt Kit", "description": "* G.I. style aluminum canteen felt-lined cover * Heavy web pistol belt", "text": "Aluminum Canteen & Olive Drab Pistol Belt Kit * G.I. style aluminum canteen felt-lined cover * Heavy web pistol belt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cjX56kp9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CWCISM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 14.68}}
{"item_id": "B001CWCL0C", "title": "133 G.I. STYLE MESS KIT", "description": "A combination of fry pan and plate. Made of durable aluminum. Can be used in both indoor and outdoor settings, cookware used during camping and backpacking, as well as extended military campaigns. GI Government Issued style. Military mess kit are designed to be compact using their space as efficiently as possible.", "text": "133 G.I. STYLE MESS KIT A combination of fry pan and plate. Made of durable aluminum. Can be used in both indoor and outdoor settings, cookware used during camping and backpacking, as well as extended military campaigns. GI Government Issued style. Military mess kit are designed to be compact using their space as efficiently as possible.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PZY9KZ6GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CWCL0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 10.55}}
