{"item_id": "B001CX1F4E", "title": "Maxpedition Fatboy Versipack", "description": "The Maxpedition Fatboy Versipack (#0403) is more than a durable, ergonomic shoulder sling pack; it is the state-of-the-art portable gear organizer that provides secured containment for and rapid accessibility of daily equipment. The versatile main compartment has a huge 156 cu. in. of space with a water-resistant storm collar that can be deployed by pulling a cord-locked drawstring.", "text": "Maxpedition Fatboy Versipack The Maxpedition Fatboy Versipack (#0403) is more than a durable, ergonomic shoulder sling pack; it is the state-of-the-art portable gear organizer that provides secured containment for and rapid accessibility of daily equipment. The versatile main compartment has a huge 156 cu. in. of space with a water-resistant storm collar that can be deployed by pulling a cord-locked drawstring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Pm0I%2B1SpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CX1F4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CXD6GO", "title": "Wahoo Killer Fillet Knife", "description": "This Wahoo Killer Fillet knife is constructed with a stainless steel blade and a rubberized handle. Includes ABS sheath. 8 1/2\" overall", "text": "Wahoo Killer Fillet Knife This Wahoo Killer Fillet knife is constructed with a stainless steel blade and a rubberized handle. Includes ABS sheath. 8 1/2\" overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TvM7FhiUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXD6GO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wahoo Killer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Knives"]], "price": 3.19}}
{"item_id": "B001CXHS7C", "title": "Cold Steel Tokyo Spike Cord Wrapped Handle (Secure-Ex Sheath)", "description": "The Spike, designed by Barry Dawson, is a weapon pared down to its bare essentials. Its thick, narrow blade is distal tapered and flat ground to a zero edge. This creates a unique cross section that facilitates both penetration of the tip and cutting power previously unknown in such a thick, narrow blade. The integral handle of the spike compliments its minimalist theme. It has been carefully shaped out of solid steel, wrapped with cord and had all of its sharp edges \"melted\" so they don't irritate the hand.", "text": "Cold Steel Tokyo Spike Cord Wrapped Handle (Secure-Ex Sheath) The Spike, designed by Barry Dawson, is a weapon pared down to its bare essentials. Its thick, narrow blade is distal tapered and flat ground to a zero edge. This creates a unique cross section that facilitates both penetration of the tip and cutting power previously unknown in such a thick, narrow blade. The integral handle of the spike compliments its minimalist theme. It has been carefully shaped out of solid steel, wrapped with cord and had all of its sharp edges \"melted\" so they don't irritate the hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DIXBi6cVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXHS7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B001CXHSE0", "title": "Cold Steel Rajah II Grivory Handle", "description": "The Rajah folders, designed by Andrew Demko, are big enough to approximate the feel and heft a fixed blade Kukri. Their broad, downward curved blades exhibit the best of a Kukri’s characteristics. First, their unique shape presents their thin, hollow ground edges at just the right angle so they naturally bite deep instead of bouncing or skidding off. And secondly their points are thick, wide and sharp enough to pierce even the toughest targets. New Tri-Ad lock.", "text": "Cold Steel Rajah II Grivory Handle The Rajah folders, designed by Andrew Demko, are big enough to approximate the feel and heft a fixed blade Kukri. Their broad, downward curved blades exhibit the best of a Kukri’s characteristics. First, their unique shape presents their thin, hollow ground edges at just the right angle so they naturally bite deep instead of bouncing or skidding off. And secondly their points are thick, wide and sharp enough to pierce even the toughest targets. New Tri-Ad lock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Txr5w2NlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXHSE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 89.49}}
{"item_id": "B001CXJEYW", "title": "Boker Plus M3 Trench Knife", "description": "Designed in 1943, the M3 Trench Knife was intended to be used by any U.S. soldier during World War II who was not equipped with a bayonet - soldiers with pistols, submachine guns, light and heavy machine guns, etc. The first troops to receive the M3's were the Airborne, Mountain Ranger and Glider infantry units. Among the nine manufacturers who produced the M3 during wartime was H. Boker & Co., with a total of 31,300 pieces, which was the smallest quantity. For the 65th anniversary, Boker Plus reintroduced this classic piece of combat cutlery, along with a reproduction metal U.S. M8A1 scabbard. The black coated blade is made of high carbon SK-5 steel and features the original H. Boker & Co. blade tang. The handle is made of stacked leather pieces. To ensure the quality of the M3, each knife features a laser engraved serial number. Weighs 8.4 ounce.", "text": "Boker Plus M3 Trench Knife Designed in 1943, the M3 Trench Knife was intended to be used by any U.S. soldier during World War II who was not equipped with a bayonet - soldiers with pistols, submachine guns, light and heavy machine guns, etc. The first troops to receive the M3's were the Airborne, Mountain Ranger and Glider infantry units. Among the nine manufacturers who produced the M3 during wartime was H. Boker & Co., with a total of 31,300 pieces, which was the smallest quantity. For the 65th anniversary, Boker Plus reintroduced this classic piece of combat cutlery, along with a reproduction metal U.S. M8A1 scabbard. The black coated blade is made of high carbon SK-5 steel and features the original H. Boker & Co. blade tang. The handle is made of stacked leather pieces. To ensure the quality of the M3, each knife features a laser engraved serial number. Weighs 8.4 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21IYCJwb4FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXJEYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 57.97}}
{"item_id": "B001CXJQ5Y", "title": "Double Eagle M85P Electric Airsoft Gun Rifle AEG", "description": "Description A 1:1 scale replica of an actual M85 machine gun, this Double Eagle electric airsoft gun is remarkably authentic. The Double Eagle fires round plastic pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun by compressed air. The advantage of the airsoft machine gun, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M85 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft gun is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The Double Eagle M85 is considered a low-powered electric rifle (LPEG) due to the use of a plastic gearbox (PGB), making it an ideal entry-level introduction to electric airsoft guns. The M85--which shoots up to 260 fps--includes a battery, charger, flashlight, and electronic sight for a perfect all-in-one airsoft setup. Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 260 FPS. 500 rounds per min. 50 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Folding stock. Includes battery & charger, adjustable electric red cross sight, mock silencer, safety glasses, sling, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system.", "text": "Double Eagle M85P Electric Airsoft Gun Rifle AEG Description A 1:1 scale replica of an actual M85 machine gun, this Double Eagle electric airsoft gun is remarkably authentic. The Double Eagle fires round plastic pellets known as BBs, which are propelled out of the gun by compressed air. The advantage of the airsoft machine gun, however, is that players can safely train, simulate, or play with the gun without fearing serious injury. The M85 looks, feels, weighs, and functions just like a real firearm, but is built for casual recreation rather than weaponized use. In fact, the only way you can typically tell a real-steel firearm from an airsoft gun is the blazing orange tip and the BBs that fire when you pull the trigger. The Double Eagle M85 is considered a low-powered electric rifle (LPEG) due to the use of a plastic gearbox (PGB), making it an ideal entry-level introduction to electric airsoft guns. The M85--which shoots up to 260 fps--includes a battery, charger, flashlight, and electronic sight for a perfect all-in-one airsoft setup. Semi-Auto/Full-Auto selectable. Fires 6mm ammo @ apprx. 260 FPS. 500 rounds per min. 50 round capacity. 7.2V 700mAh. Folding stock. Includes battery & charger, adjustable electric red cross sight, mock silencer, safety glasses, sling, airsoft tools, and a few BBs. Variable Hop-up system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415j07z5FuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXJQ5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 38.12}}
{"item_id": "B001CXJQVS", "title": "Kershaw K.O. Shallot, Stainless Handle, Plain K1840", "description": "Kershaw Shallotes with the patented SpeedSafe assisted ambidextrous index-finger opener to easily slide open the blade when you need it. The knife alsoes with a reversible/removable pocket clip for easy and convenient carrying. Blade length: 3 1/2\" Closed length: 4 3/8\" Steel: Sandvik 13C26 stainless-steel Handle: 410 stainless-steel", "text": "Kershaw K.O. Shallot, Stainless Handle, Plain K1840 Kershaw Shallotes with the patented SpeedSafe assisted ambidextrous index-finger opener to easily slide open the blade when you need it. The knife alsoes with a reversible/removable pocket clip for easy and convenient carrying. Blade length: 3 1/2\" Closed length: 4 3/8\" Steel: Sandvik 13C26 stainless-steel Handle: 410 stainless-steel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316CBvjw2mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXJQVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 45.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CXLSSW", "title": "Cold Steel GI Tanto Polycarbonate Scales Handle (Cordura Sheath)", "description": "The broad Tanto point blade, integral quillion guard, and Polypropylene handle scales, exemplify a tactical knife stripped down to its bare essentials. It’s ground razor sharp out of 1055 carbon steel with a hard spring temper and protected by a black, rust resistant finish so it’s ready to take all the abuse you and Mother Nature can dish out.", "text": "Cold Steel GI Tanto Polycarbonate Scales Handle (Cordura Sheath) The broad Tanto point blade, integral quillion guard, and Polypropylene handle scales, exemplify a tactical knife stripped down to its bare essentials. It’s ground razor sharp out of 1055 carbon steel with a hard spring temper and protected by a black, rust resistant finish so it’s ready to take all the abuse you and Mother Nature can dish out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vjqJ83NwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXLSSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 37.94}}
{"item_id": "B001CXPJAK", "title": "United Cutlery GH201 Gil Hibben III Survival Knife with Sheath", "description": "This extremely impressive knife is designed by master knife maker, Gil Hibben. It measures 16-Inch long, with a blade length of 11-Inch, and comes with a top-grain leather sheath. The first-class weapon features a laminated wood handle, stainless steel guard, and 420-grade stainless steel blade.", "text": "United Cutlery GH201 Gil Hibben III Survival Knife with Sheath This extremely impressive knife is designed by master knife maker, Gil Hibben. It measures 16-Inch long, with a blade length of 11-Inch, and comes with a top-grain leather sheath. The first-class weapon features a laminated wood handle, stainless steel guard, and 420-grade stainless steel blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vWjM%2BASpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXPJAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 81.06}}
{"item_id": "B001CXPJL4", "title": "Knives of Alaska Suregrip Bush Camp Knife", "description": "Our most popular knife.Double finger choils and lanyard opening for perfect grip and safety.The ideal knife for outfitters and taxidermists performing precision skinning duties and fine detail work.", "text": "Knives of Alaska Suregrip Bush Camp Knife Our most popular knife.Double finger choils and lanyard opening for perfect grip and safety.The ideal knife for outfitters and taxidermists performing precision skinning duties and fine detail work.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rcf50zbJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXPJL4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CXPKEK", "title": "Ontario SP16 SPAX Knife with FG/UC Sheath (Black)", "description": "The SP16 SPAX made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. The SPAX is a knife, a hatchet, or a pick axe, whatever the situation dictates. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 52-54 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "text": "Ontario SP16 SPAX Knife with FG/UC Sheath (Black) The SP16 SPAX made by Ontario Knife is part of the Spec Plus Next Generation series designed for military, sporting, and rescue use. The SPAX is a knife, a hatchet, or a pick axe, whatever the situation dictates. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Epoxy textured and powder coated black steel blades. Full tang blades are hardened to 52-54 HRC. Kraton handle resists the elements and has finger grooves for a secure grip. Piped lanyard hole in handle. Includes leather cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O3QhoR7aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CXPKEK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 81.0}}
