{"item_id": "B001CZ9FZS", "title": "GenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No Edge", "description": "GenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No EdgeGenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No Edge Features: Blade Detail: Plain, No Edge Blade Length (inches): 3.75 Blade Material: Stainless Carry System: Pocket Clip Handle Material: Plastic, Black Lock Style: Liner Lock Overall Length (inches): 8.38 Packaging: N/A Special Features: N/A Storage: N/A Made In: China", "text": "GenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No Edge GenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No EdgeGenPro KO2900A Training Knife, Black Handle w/Black Grip Inserts, No Edge Features: Blade Detail: Plain, No Edge Blade Length (inches): 3.75 Blade Material: Stainless Carry System: Pocket Clip Handle Material: Plastic, Black Lock Style: Liner Lock Overall Length (inches): 8.38 Packaging: N/A Special Features: N/A Storage: N/A Made In: China", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NrROBn0GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZ9FZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001CZ9MRY", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact, Pink Case with Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5X's more)", "description": "Stay safe regardless of the situation with this SABRE RED pepper spray with pink keychain. The most popular Sabre style, the 15 gram/0.54-ounce SABRE RED pepper spray offers a quick-release design giving you immediate access to your defense spray when unlocking a door or driving a car. Its powerful ballistic stream has a range of up to 10 feet and reduces wind blowback. As a result, you can reliably protect yourself in unfamiliar or dangerous neighborhoods and situations from a safe distance. Best of all, Sabre makes a donation to the National Breast Cancer Foundation (NBCF) with each purchase of a pink pepper spray unit. The pepper spray canister-which is a breeze to carry-includes approximately 25 shots. Sabre products are used by the New York Police Department, U.S. Marshalls, and thousands of police departments worldwide. This product is restricted from shipping to some states. This includes but is not limited to: CA, NY, MA, WI, MI, AR, NJ, NC, SC, DC, FL and HI.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Compact, Pink Case with Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5X's more) Stay safe regardless of the situation with this SABRE RED pepper spray with pink keychain. The most popular Sabre style, the 15 gram/0.54-ounce SABRE RED pepper spray offers a quick-release design giving you immediate access to your defense spray when unlocking a door or driving a car. Its powerful ballistic stream has a range of up to 10 feet and reduces wind blowback. As a result, you can reliably protect yourself in unfamiliar or dangerous neighborhoods and situations from a safe distance. Best of all, Sabre makes a donation to the National Breast Cancer Foundation (NBCF) with each purchase of a pink pepper spray unit. The pepper spray canister-which is a breeze to carry-includes approximately 25 shots. Sabre products are used by the New York Police Department, U.S. Marshalls, and thousands of police departments worldwide. This product is restricted from shipping to some states. This includes but is not limited to: CA, NY, MA, WI, MI, AR, NJ, NC, SC, DC, FL and HI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fuWIcKPcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZ9MRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 9.55}}
{"item_id": "B001CZ9MVK", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools VL02-CP Vulcan Mini Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools VL02-CP Vulcan Mini Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31up9AiG3TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZ9MVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 73.71}}
{"item_id": "B001CZ9UY4", "title": "Cold Steel Trail Boss Hickory Handle", "description": "The Trail Boss is light and compact enough to carry all day in your hand or strapped to your pack, yet heavy and tough enough for chores that would make a hatchet or tomahawk scream for mercy. Featuring a European style head with a 4\" blade and a 4 1/2\" cutting edge, it takes a big bite with every swing. Plus, it features a very stout straight-grained Hickory handle. Extensively field-tested by Lynn C. Thompson on a month long hunting trip in the outback of Australia, the Trail Boss was really put to the test. He used it to chop kindling, clear roads and trails, to build blinds and even to chop down a fair sized Gidgee Tree (one of the hardest woods found down under).", "text": "Cold Steel Trail Boss Hickory Handle The Trail Boss is light and compact enough to carry all day in your hand or strapped to your pack, yet heavy and tough enough for chores that would make a hatchet or tomahawk scream for mercy. Featuring a European style head with a 4\" blade and a 4 1/2\" cutting edge, it takes a big bite with every swing. Plus, it features a very stout straight-grained Hickory handle. Extensively field-tested by Lynn C. Thompson on a month long hunting trip in the outback of Australia, the Trail Boss was really put to the test. He used it to chop kindling, clear roads and trails, to build blinds and even to chop down a fair sized Gidgee Tree (one of the hardest woods found down under).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219v6LPhqOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZ9UY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 25.66}}
{"item_id": "B001CZBDF8", "title": "Kershaw Skyline Knife with Textured Black G-10 Handle", "description": "One of Kershaw's most popular knives, the Skyline pocketknife is ideal for around-town use. The super-slim Skyline features a 3-1/8-inch blade made of Sandvik 14C28N stainless steel, chosen for its hardness, excellent corrosion resistance, and ability to be sharpened to a perfect Kershaw shaving-sharp edge. The blade's good looks stem from its attractive stonewashed bead-blast finish. The knife also includes a textured G-10 handle in basic black that provides a secure grip, along with a sturdy locking liner that keeps the blade safely in place until you release it. And the knife's Flipper opens easily with the index finger of either hand (NOT an assisted-opening knife). The Skyline comes with a removable pocket clip that can be reversed for tip-up or tip-down carry. NOTE:For consumers to change the clip they must use a “Torx” screwdriver.SpecificationsSteel: Sandvik 14C28N bead-blasted finishHandle: Textured black G-10Blade length: 3-1/8 inchesClosed length: 4-1/4 inchesOverall length: 7-3/8 inchesWeight: 2.3 ounces", "text": "Kershaw Skyline Knife with Textured Black G-10 Handle One of Kershaw's most popular knives, the Skyline pocketknife is ideal for around-town use. The super-slim Skyline features a 3-1/8-inch blade made of Sandvik 14C28N stainless steel, chosen for its hardness, excellent corrosion resistance, and ability to be sharpened to a perfect Kershaw shaving-sharp edge. The blade's good looks stem from its attractive stonewashed bead-blast finish. The knife also includes a textured G-10 handle in basic black that provides a secure grip, along with a sturdy locking liner that keeps the blade safely in place until you release it. And the knife's Flipper opens easily with the index finger of either hand (NOT an assisted-opening knife). The Skyline comes with a removable pocket clip that can be reversed for tip-up or tip-down carry. NOTE:For consumers to change the clip they must use a “Torx” screwdriver.SpecificationsSteel: Sandvik 14C28N bead-blasted finishHandle: Textured black G-10Blade length: 3-1/8 inchesClosed length: 4-1/4 inchesOverall length: 7-3/8 inchesWeight: 2.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qHD7SgJAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZBDF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 40.95}}
{"item_id": "B001CZBMRC", "title": "Benchmade Osborne Design Rift Knife", "description": "The 950 Rift is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation.", "text": "Benchmade Osborne Design Rift Knife The 950 Rift is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QTIA15uwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZBMRC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Chest & Rib Guards"]], "price": 178.5}}
{"item_id": "B001CZDCKM", "title": "Kershaw Junk Yard Dog 2.2 Composite Blade Knife", "description": "The Junk Yard Dog II features a blade made from the composite of two steels, 13C26 and CPM-D2, with a copper accent separator. The knife opens easily with Kershaw's Flipper opening system, and locks into the frame safely. The real dog bite from this knife is seen in the textured black G-10 handle that provides a strong grip in any weather. A frame lock secures the blade in place.Features:Composite blade of two steels, 13C26 and CPM-D2, with a copper accent separatorKershaw's Flipper opening system ensures smooth openingTextured black G-10 handleFrame lock secures blade when openPocket clipMade in the USASpecifications:Steel: Sandvik 14C28N stainless steelHandle: Textured G-10Blade Length: 3 3/4 inchesClosed Length: 4 7/8 inchesWeight: 5.2 ounces", "text": "Kershaw Junk Yard Dog 2.2 Composite Blade Knife The Junk Yard Dog II features a blade made from the composite of two steels, 13C26 and CPM-D2, with a copper accent separator. The knife opens easily with Kershaw's Flipper opening system, and locks into the frame safely. The real dog bite from this knife is seen in the textured black G-10 handle that provides a strong grip in any weather. A frame lock secures the blade in place.Features:Composite blade of two steels, 13C26 and CPM-D2, with a copper accent separatorKershaw's Flipper opening system ensures smooth openingTextured black G-10 handleFrame lock secures blade when openPocket clipMade in the USASpecifications:Steel: Sandvik 14C28N stainless steelHandle: Textured G-10Blade Length: 3 3/4 inchesClosed Length: 4 7/8 inchesWeight: 5.2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UQyGNkQ1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZDCKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 70.65}}
{"item_id": "B001CZDNVU", "title": "Spyderco Endura 4 Folding Plain Edge FRN Knife", "description": "Tip-up, Tip-Down, Right-handed or Left-handed carry", "text": "Spyderco Endura 4 Folding Plain Edge FRN Knife Tip-up, Tip-Down, Right-handed or Left-handed carry", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tB4i7m%2BaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZDNVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 63.07}}
{"item_id": "B001CZDQPI", "title": "Rothco G.I. Pilots Survival Knife", "description": "Stay tough with the Rothco G.I. Pilots survival knife. The same knife issued by the U.S. Army and Air Force, the knife features a 5-inch Parkerized blade with a serrated top edge, along with a leather handle and sheath. GSA-compliant, the knife also comes with a sharpening stone with its own pouch.", "text": "Rothco G.I. Pilots Survival Knife Stay tough with the Rothco G.I. Pilots survival knife. The same knife issued by the U.S. Army and Air Force, the knife features a 5-inch Parkerized blade with a serrated top edge, along with a leather handle and sheath. GSA-compliant, the knife also comes with a sharpening stone with its own pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41szyZDIEpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZDQPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 39.46}}
{"item_id": "B001CZDSHY", "title": "Boker Plus Subcom Folder Knife", "description": "The original -Inch Biscuit.-Inch The Boker Subcom F folding knife has a municipal-friendly blade, at 1 7/8-Inch long and 1/16-Inch thick. The blade is bead blasted AUS-8 stainless steel and boasts an ambidextrous thumb stud. The reversible pocket clip and compact size of this frame lock knife make for an ideal money clip. Both thumb and palm index ramps provide for a secure grip. Handle is fiberglass reinforced nylon. Lightweight, only 2.5 ounce.", "text": "Boker Plus Subcom Folder Knife The original -Inch Biscuit.-Inch The Boker Subcom F folding knife has a municipal-friendly blade, at 1 7/8-Inch long and 1/16-Inch thick. The blade is bead blasted AUS-8 stainless steel and boasts an ambidextrous thumb stud. The reversible pocket clip and compact size of this frame lock knife make for an ideal money clip. Both thumb and palm index ramps provide for a secure grip. Handle is fiberglass reinforced nylon. Lightweight, only 2.5 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31saQWiOQML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZDSHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 27.81}}
{"item_id": "B001CZFHZ0", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Double Stack Single Mag Case (Matte Finish for 9mm/.40 cal)", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s carbon-fiber composite line, offers single magazine cases for 9mm/40 cal/.45 cal/10mm single-stack mags and 9mm/40 cal double-stack mags. Built-in tension springs keep your magazine secure but allow rapid removal when you need it.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Double Stack Single Mag Case (Matte Finish for 9mm/.40 cal) BLACKHAWK!'s carbon-fiber composite line, offers single magazine cases for 9mm/40 cal/.45 cal/10mm single-stack mags and 9mm/40 cal double-stack mags. Built-in tension springs keep your magazine secure but allow rapid removal when you need it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CzKgBfoOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZFHZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 19.11}}
