{"item_id": "B001CZFPSE", "title": "Schrade SCHF1 Extreme Survival Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife, with Nylon Sheath", "description": "The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "text": "Schrade SCHF1 Extreme Survival Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife, with Nylon Sheath The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VntYYEtWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZFPSE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 40.76}}
{"item_id": "B001CZG19Q", "title": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Recon Tanto", "description": "Now you can practice with some of our most popular knife designs, in relative safety, with our new rubber training knives. We have rubber training versions of our Peace Keeper™ I, the R1 Military Classic, Recon Tanto, and the Black Bear Classic. Each has been carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible so they can be effectively used in solo practice, training drills, disarm drills, and demonstrations and any other activity where you want a reasonably close approximation of realism but not the extreme danger and risk associated with an actual knife. The Santoprene rubber blades are soft enough to prevent the likelihood of most bodily injury. They do however, have a level of firmness that might cause injury to the face or the eyes, so it is recommended that appropriate eye protection or a fencing mask is utilized at all times when using a Cold Steel rubber training knife.", "text": "Cold Steel Rubber Training Recon Tanto Now you can practice with some of our most popular knife designs, in relative safety, with our new rubber training knives. We have rubber training versions of our Peace Keeper™ I, the R1 Military Classic, Recon Tanto, and the Black Bear Classic. Each has been carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible so they can be effectively used in solo practice, training drills, disarm drills, and demonstrations and any other activity where you want a reasonably close approximation of realism but not the extreme danger and risk associated with an actual knife. The Santoprene rubber blades are soft enough to prevent the likelihood of most bodily injury. They do however, have a level of firmness that might cause injury to the face or the eyes, so it is recommended that appropriate eye protection or a fencing mask is utilized at all times when using a Cold Steel rubber training knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wH8KHBVaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZG19Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 9.01}}
{"item_id": "B001CZHTKG", "title": "Benchmade 530 Pardue Design Knife", "description": "The Benchmade 530 is based on Benchmade knives Mel Pardue designed Model 350 Knife. The basic looks are the same with the spear point blade and coffin style handle design but, the AXIS lock was incorporated for added performance function of these knives. The overall design was slimmed down for a low profile, low drag carry, and the weight is still incredibly light. So if you liked the Model 350 knife, you’re going to love the Model 530.", "text": "Benchmade 530 Pardue Design Knife The Benchmade 530 is based on Benchmade knives Mel Pardue designed Model 350 Knife. The basic looks are the same with the spear point blade and coffin style handle design but, the AXIS lock was incorporated for added performance function of these knives. The overall design was slimmed down for a low profile, low drag carry, and the weight is still incredibly light. So if you liked the Model 350 knife, you’re going to love the Model 530.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v23ZsGM-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001CZHTKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 97.5}}
{"item_id": "B001D020FE", "title": "Shimano Alivio M411 Hybrid Crankset (Black)", "description": "Shimano alivio M411 hybrid crankest has hyper drive SG-X chain rings. Replaceable steel chain rings, cold forged crank arm, chain case compatible. 50-Millimeter chain line, gearing : 42-32-22T/48-38-28T.", "text": "Shimano Alivio M411 Hybrid Crankset (Black) Shimano alivio M411 hybrid crankest has hyper drive SG-X chain rings. Replaceable steel chain rings, cold forged crank arm, chain case compatible. 50-Millimeter chain line, gearing : 42-32-22T/48-38-28T.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dZoeXgBlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001D020FE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cranksets"]], "price": 54.99}}
