{"item_id": "B001D8E3WY", "title": "Right - hand BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holster Matte Finish", "description": "Forget old - fashioned thumb breaks. USA MADE BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holsters do it better and faster. No two ways about it: thumb breaks slow your draw. BLACKHAWK!'s got the answer! The patented SERPA Technology Lock takes slow-downs out of the equation, offering a \"speed-cut\" design and full firing grip off the draw, and immediate (and secure) retention upon reholster. The perfect retention Holster for concealed carry! Ruggedly built, with a matte finish. Includes both belt loop and paddle mounting platforms. Available for righties or lefties, in a wide range of models. Pick yours and State Model. Order yours today! 08- Sig Pro 2022; 10- SW 5900/4000 9/40 incl. TSW; 11- Ruger P85/89; 12- Ruger P95; 13- Glock 20/21, SW/MP .45 and 9/40 Pro; 14- HK USP Full Size; 17- HK P-30; 18- FN 5.7 (USG version); 19- Taurus 24/7 OSS; 24- Walther P99; 25- SW MP9/40 and Sigma (R only); 28- Beretta PX-4; 29- Taurus 24/7; 30- Glock 29/30/39; 31- Springfield XD Subcompact; 32- Taurus 85; 38- Glock 38; 40- Taurus Judge; 41- Ruger SR9; 42- 1911 Commander and clones (with or without rails); Right-hand BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holster, Matte Finish", "text": "Right - hand BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holster Matte Finish Forget old - fashioned thumb breaks. USA MADE BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holsters do it better and faster. No two ways about it: thumb breaks slow your draw. BLACKHAWK!'s got the answer! The patented SERPA Technology Lock takes slow-downs out of the equation, offering a \"speed-cut\" design and full firing grip off the draw, and immediate (and secure) retention upon reholster. The perfect retention Holster for concealed carry! Ruggedly built, with a matte finish. Includes both belt loop and paddle mounting platforms. Available for righties or lefties, in a wide range of models. Pick yours and State Model. Order yours today! 08- Sig Pro 2022; 10- SW 5900/4000 9/40 incl. TSW; 11- Ruger P85/89; 12- Ruger P95; 13- Glock 20/21, SW/MP .45 and 9/40 Pro; 14- HK USP Full Size; 17- HK P-30; 18- FN 5.7 (USG version); 19- Taurus 24/7 OSS; 24- Walther P99; 25- SW MP9/40 and Sigma (R only); 28- Beretta PX-4; 29- Taurus 24/7; 30- Glock 29/30/39; 31- Springfield XD Subcompact; 32- Taurus 85; 38- Glock 38; 40- Taurus Judge; 41- Ruger SR9; 42- 1911 Commander and clones (with or without rails); Right-hand BLACKHAWK! SERPA CQC Concealment Holster, Matte Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yR8eCKqdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001D8E3WY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
