{"item_id": "B001DA0AJ2", "title": "Spring Double Eagle M41 Assault Rifle FPS-280, Laser Sight, Red Dot, Shoulder Strap Airsoft Gun", "description": "DescriptionFull scale 1/1 size airsoft replicaVelocity: 260fps using 0.12g BB, 200 fps using 0.20g BBUp to 35meter rangeSpring operatedLength: 72cmConstructed from tough black and clear ABS anti-shock resin plasticTransparent 21BB magazineInternal weights for increased sturdinessRemovable stockRemovable front sectionSafety modeWe recommend using quality 0.20g BB with this machine gunManufactured by Double EagleWeaver rail along top and on the bottom of the front endRifle slingScope with electric LED crosshair and weaver mountLaser with weaver mountSpare batteries for scope and laserIncludes 200BB pellets (approx)", "text": "Spring Double Eagle M41 Assault Rifle FPS-280, Laser Sight, Red Dot, Shoulder Strap Airsoft Gun DescriptionFull scale 1/1 size airsoft replicaVelocity: 260fps using 0.12g BB, 200 fps using 0.20g BBUp to 35meter rangeSpring operatedLength: 72cmConstructed from tough black and clear ABS anti-shock resin plasticTransparent 21BB magazineInternal weights for increased sturdinessRemovable stockRemovable front sectionSafety modeWe recommend using quality 0.20g BB with this machine gunManufactured by Double EagleWeaver rail along top and on the bottom of the front endRifle slingScope with electric LED crosshair and weaver mountLaser with weaver mountSpare batteries for scope and laserIncludes 200BB pellets (approx)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sDhcQv35L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DA0AJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 24.79}}
{"item_id": "B001DAWQIK", "title": "BSA® 3 - 12x40 Sweet 17™ Rifle Scope", "description": "The BSA 3 - 12x40 IR Sweet 17 Scope... gains in popularity and gives shooters a leg up for successful shooting every day! You can't go wrong with this Scope! This hot new Scope is catching on fast with varmint and target shooters. You benefit from a quick change turret system specially calibrated for multiple grain weights for the calibers .17HMR, .22LR, .223, .243, .270,.30.06. It's priced to fit your budget too! Features and specifications: Calibrated for the 17 HMR; Adjustable objective ; Includes 17 gr turret drums; Magnification 3-12x ; Objective lens diameter 40 mm ; Exit pupil range 10.8-3.6 mm ; Field of view at 100 yards: 28-'7; Optimum eye relief 3\" ; Parallax setting 10 to infinity. ; Click adjustment value 1/4\"; Adjustment range 30-30; Weight 19.40 ozs. ; Get set up for better shooting... order your BSA Scope today! BSA 3-12x40 IR Sweet 17 Rifle Scope", "text": "BSA® 3 - 12x40 Sweet 17™ Rifle Scope The BSA 3 - 12x40 IR Sweet 17 Scope... gains in popularity and gives shooters a leg up for successful shooting every day! You can't go wrong with this Scope! This hot new Scope is catching on fast with varmint and target shooters. You benefit from a quick change turret system specially calibrated for multiple grain weights for the calibers .17HMR, .22LR, .223, .243, .270,.30.06. It's priced to fit your budget too! Features and specifications: Calibrated for the 17 HMR; Adjustable objective ; Includes 17 gr turret drums; Magnification 3-12x ; Objective lens diameter 40 mm ; Exit pupil range 10.8-3.6 mm ; Field of view at 100 yards: 28-'7; Optimum eye relief 3\" ; Parallax setting 10 to infinity. ; Click adjustment value 1/4\"; Adjustment range 30-30; Weight 19.40 ozs. ; Get set up for better shooting... order your BSA Scope today! BSA 3-12x40 IR Sweet 17 Rifle Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yToyoz-vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DAWQIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 73.99}}
