{"item_id": "B001DBBE5A", "title": "Buck 0225BLS Silver Creek Large Fixed Blade Filet Knife (Blue/Stainless)", "description": "Buck Knives 225 Silver Creek Large Fillet Knife is safe, reliable, and durable. This large sized fillet knife has a titanium coated blade and is designed for added flexibility and corrosion resistance, a rubberized anti slip grip and a stainless steel safety guard. The Silver Creek Medium Fillet features a 9-5/8 inch 420J2 Titanium Coated Steel blade. Its 14-3/8 inches overall and weight 5.3 oz. The handle has a thermoplastic base with a rubber overmolded grip and stainless steel finger guard. It also features an injection molded plastic sheath with an integrated belt clip and stylized drain holes, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 0225BLS Silver Creek Large Fixed Blade Filet Knife (Blue/Stainless) Buck Knives 225 Silver Creek Large Fillet Knife is safe, reliable, and durable. This large sized fillet knife has a titanium coated blade and is designed for added flexibility and corrosion resistance, a rubberized anti slip grip and a stainless steel safety guard. The Silver Creek Medium Fillet features a 9-5/8 inch 420J2 Titanium Coated Steel blade. Its 14-3/8 inches overall and weight 5.3 oz. The handle has a thermoplastic base with a rubber overmolded grip and stainless steel finger guard. It also features an injection molded plastic sheath with an integrated belt clip and stylized drain holes, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V3JSQob3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DBBE5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DBBIHO", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Stainless #11 Nipples with M6x1 Threads (2 per - Traditions, CVA rifles and pistol)", "description": "2 pk Stainless Nipples w/ M6x1 threads - Manufacture ID: A1250Fits all Traditions rifles and pistols. For M6x1 threads and No.11 caps. Per 2Warranty: Lifetime warranty.", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Muzzleloader Stainless #11 Nipples with M6x1 Threads (2 per - Traditions, CVA rifles and pistol) 2 pk Stainless Nipples w/ M6x1 threads - Manufacture ID: A1250Fits all Traditions rifles and pistols. For M6x1 threads and No.11 caps. Per 2Warranty: Lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2B8YmKR1EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DBBIHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 10.75}}
{"item_id": "B001DBHL84", "title": "Weaver Base Top Mount - 92A", "description": "Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Base Top Mount - 92A Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XlQRocP3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DBHL84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 11.62}}
{"item_id": "B001DBJTE8", "title": "Benchmade 950SBK Osborne Rift, Black/Gray G10 Handle, 3.67in. Black ComboEdge Blade Folding Knife", "description": "Designed by Warren Osborne, the Benchmade 950 Rift knife is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation. The Osborne/Benchmade 950 Rift knife features the Benchmade's patented AXIS mechanics, one-hand ambidextrous function and tough 154CM Blade steel. Proudly Made In The USA.", "text": "Benchmade 950SBK Osborne Rift, Black/Gray G10 Handle, 3.67in. Black ComboEdge Blade Folding Knife Designed by Warren Osborne, the Benchmade 950 Rift knife is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation. The Osborne/Benchmade 950 Rift knife features the Benchmade's patented AXIS mechanics, one-hand ambidextrous function and tough 154CM Blade steel. Proudly Made In The USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418l8IG999L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DBJTE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 178.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DBLPJK", "title": "Benchmade 950 Rift Osborne Design Knife", "description": "The 950 Rift is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation.", "text": "Benchmade 950 Rift Osborne Design Knife The 950 Rift is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto for toughness, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it, and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y-8wFOj4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DBLPJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 142.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DC56B2", "title": "2300T Air Pistol (.177)", "description": "This Air Pistol is designed specifically for shooting clubs and organizations that teach pistol shooting. This affordable competition style pistol is perfect for new and advanced shooters. Special Features Include.... - Barrel 10.1 inches in length, 10 lands and groves - Trigger Single-stage, Adjustable trigger pull 1-4 pounds and an over-travel adjustment screw - Power Source Over 40 shots at a consistent velocity from one Crosman Powerlet - Rear LPA Sight micrometric adjustments to both windage and elevation with hardened click screws.", "text": "2300T Air Pistol (.177) This Air Pistol is designed specifically for shooting clubs and organizations that teach pistol shooting. This affordable competition style pistol is perfect for new and advanced shooters. Special Features Include.... - Barrel 10.1 inches in length, 10 lands and groves - Trigger Single-stage, Adjustable trigger pull 1-4 pounds and an over-travel adjustment screw - Power Source Over 40 shots at a consistent velocity from one Crosman Powerlet - Rear LPA Sight micrometric adjustments to both windage and elevation with hardened click screws.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31o3IJlHOoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DC56B2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 161.84}}
{"item_id": "B001DC5HAW", "title": "Stansport 3 Outlet Propane Distribution Post", "description": "Eliminate that plastic bin full of propane canisters on your next car camping trip with this simple, versatile device from outdoor outfitter Stansport. The three-outlet Propane Distribution Post lets you operate three propane devices -- such as a lantern, stove, and heater -- simultaneously from the same bulk cylinder. An adjustable base ensures stability on uneven terrain, and each outlet has its own auto shut-off valve. The 30-inch device weighs just two pounds, and packs easily.About Stansport:Stansport has produced quality camping gear for more than 50 years, from tents to backpacks and rafts to cookware.", "text": "Stansport 3 Outlet Propane Distribution Post Eliminate that plastic bin full of propane canisters on your next car camping trip with this simple, versatile device from outdoor outfitter Stansport. The three-outlet Propane Distribution Post lets you operate three propane devices -- such as a lantern, stove, and heater -- simultaneously from the same bulk cylinder. An adjustable base ensures stability on uneven terrain, and each outlet has its own auto shut-off valve. The 30-inch device weighs just two pounds, and packs easily.About Stansport:Stansport has produced quality camping gear for more than 50 years, from tents to backpacks and rafts to cookware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jATZfyS-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DC5HAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 25.84}}
