{"item_id": "B001DC7FPM", "title": "Stansport Propane Cylinder Base", "description": "Our Stansport Propane Cylinder Base is compatible with most 16.4 oz propane canisters. The wide Dura-Base provides a stable platform for propane accessories. Made of high impact plastic. Swivel extension feet fold away completely. Replacement base.", "text": "Stansport Propane Cylinder Base Our Stansport Propane Cylinder Base is compatible with most 16.4 oz propane canisters. The wide Dura-Base provides a stable platform for propane accessories. Made of high impact plastic. Swivel extension feet fold away completely. Replacement base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UeKeiPW7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DC7FPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 12.07}}
{"item_id": "B001DC94FG", "title": "Otis .22-45 Caliber Pistol Cleaning System", "description": "Sidearms are meant to give you the power, accuracy and portability you need—whether for hunting or at the range—without having to carry the weight of a full-length firearm. Your cleaning system should be just as portable and effective. Contains the brushes needed to clean .38 and .45 caliber pistols. Patch cleans from .22 - .45 caliber", "text": "Otis .22-45 Caliber Pistol Cleaning System Sidearms are meant to give you the power, accuracy and portability you need—whether for hunting or at the range—without having to carry the weight of a full-length firearm. Your cleaning system should be just as portable and effective. Contains the brushes needed to clean .38 and .45 caliber pistols. Patch cleans from .22 - .45 caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D21Ymgu%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DC94FG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 21.4}}
