{"item_id": "B001DCB61Q", "title": "Crosman Destroyer .177 Cal, 7.9 Grains, Pointed, 250ct", "description": "The revolutionary Crosman Destroyer hunting pellet combines with best attributes of a pointed pellet with a hollow point, resulting in complete expansion and energy transfer. The .177-caliber, 7.9-grain pellets feature dished rims and come in a 250-count package.", "text": "Crosman Destroyer .177 Cal, 7.9 Grains, Pointed, 250ct The revolutionary Crosman Destroyer hunting pellet combines with best attributes of a pointed pellet with a hollow point, resulting in complete expansion and energy transfer. The .177-caliber, 7.9-grain pellets feature dished rims and come in a 250-count package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vfUC3rmfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DCB61Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 7.26}}
{"item_id": "B001DCD6JG", "title": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SWMP S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40", "description": "Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "text": "Fobus Standard Holster RH Paddle SWMP S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40 Developed in Israel for the world's military and special security services, the combat-proven Fobus Standard Holster series is a revolutionary step forward in holster design and technology. State of the art design, injection molding and space age high-density plastics are combined to create a holster which cannot be duplicated in leather or any other material. Fobus holsters are high riding, and low profile with unbelievable retention, comfort and lightweight construction. Holsters weigh a mere 2 ounces, and are maintenance free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kUbs19opL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DCD6JG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.75}}
{"item_id": "B001DCEKXM", "title": "Suunto Core Sport Watch: All Black", "description": "Building on the success of the venerable Suunto Vector, the Suunto Core keeps you informed of conditions while you hike, bike, or camp, making it a terrific companion for outdoor enthusiasts of all stripes. What can the Suunto Core do for you? For starters, it can sense an approaching squall even when the sky looks clear. This intelligent Storm Alarm--one of several intelligent features designed to keep you safe and secure--is activated by a rapid drop in air pressure over a three-hour period. Once the Core senses the change, the Storm Alarm sounds and flashes, letting you know that something unpleasant is fast approaching. The built-in altimeter, meanwhile, displays your current elevation, shows how much you've climbed or descended, and records your entire session for later analysis. Accurate to within 30,000 feet, the altimeter is an extremely valuable tool for mountaineering, backcountry skiing, and wilderness travel. Add in such additional features as a barometer, a digital thermometer, a weather trend indicator, and a digital compass and you have a terrific wrist-top computer for almost all your outdoor needs.The altimeter contributes to your excursion in several ways. If you're standing on or near an obvious geographic feature, such as a ridge, trail, or creek, the altimeter can alert you to your current elevation and help you find your position on a topographic map. Similarly, if you plan on climbing a slope to a certain elevation and then traversing, the Core can help you stay on course. And as a bonus, the Suunto Core includes a unique start-from-zero function, so you don't have to enter a reference altitude. Instead, with the single push of a button, the altimeter will begin tracking your ascent and descent.The Core also includes a barometer, which measures and records air pressure to help you predict changing conditions--from sunny skies to hair-bending electrical storms. The barometer helps you decide whether to bring a soft shell or rain shell jacket when the skies look ominous, or even when to high-tail it back to the car. In general, low pressure brings inclement weather, while high pressure brings stability and clear skies. If you've arrived at camp and notice the pressure starting to plunge, it's probably a good idea to secure the tent and crawl in. Likewise, if you were on a climb, it would be prudent to find shelter and retreat. Even at home, the Suunto Core barometer can look beyond office walls, skyscrapers, and nearby hills to help you plan for upcoming activities.If you want a weather forecast that extends out a few hours, you can turn to the built-in weather trend indicator. The indicator shows the barometric history for the last three and six hours, helping you predict the weather with amazing accuracy. What's more, the watch doesn't give you a regional forecast posted earlier in the day, but rather the most current information about the weather directly overhead. And no outdoor watch is worth its salt without a digital compass, a great tool for keeping track of your direction while skiing, hiking, or exploring a new city. You can set and follow a bearing with a traditional rotating bezel, or simply point the top of the watch toward your intended destination and lock it in.Additional features include several traditional watch functions, including dual times, a date display, and an alarm; predicted times for sunrise and sunset to help you maximize your daylight hours; an automatic Alti/Baro mode that senses movement or lack thereof and switches between the altimeter and barometer accordingly; a depth meter that provides accurate water depth readings to 30 feet; and the ability to function in English, German, French, and Spanish. Available in such colors as all black, aluminum black, light black, black orange, aluminum brown, light green, black yellow, and steel , the Suunto Core carries a two-year warranty.Specifications:The Suunto Core watch includes an altimeter, barometer, compass, and weather indicator.The watch is compatible with several different straps (sold separately).Finish: All blackReal-time vertical cumulative value: YesTemperature compensation: YesTotal ascent/descent: YesUser-removable logbook files: YesAutomatic Alti/Baro switch: YesAutomatic 7-day Alti/Baro memory: YesResolution: 1 meterRecording intervals: 1 second, 5 second, 30 seconds, 60 secondsAltitude range: 1,600 to 29,500 feetDifference measurement: YesLog graph: YesLogbook function: YesCountdown timer: YesStopwatch: YesGuided calibration: YesHeading in degrees: YesDeclination setting: YesCardinal directions: YesBearing tracking: YesNorth-South indicator: North indicatorLanguages: English, German, French, and SpanishDepth meter: Yes, to 30 feetRotating bezel: YesTime: 12/24 hoursSunrise/sunset times: YesCalendar clock: YesDual time: YesDaily alarms: 1Alarm snooze: YesWeather memory: 7 daysWeather alarm: YesTrend indicator and graph: YesTemperature range: -5 to 140 degrees FSea level pressure: YesBarometer range: 300 to 1,100 mbarLow battery warning: YesWater resistance: 100 feetBacklight option: YesWeight: 2.26 ouncesWarranty: 2 yearsAbout SuuntoSuunto was founded in 1936 by outdoors man and a keen orienteering enthusiast, Tuomas Vohlonen, who had long been bothered by a problem: the inaccuracy of traditional dry compasses and their lack of steady needle operation. Being an engineer with an inventive turn of mind, he discovered and patented the production method for a much steadier needle, better readings, and a new level of accuracy.By 1950 the company was exporting compasses to over 50 countries around the world, including Canada and the United States. In 1952, Helsinki was hosting the Olympic Games, and the torches carried to light the Olympic flame were Suunto products. The next step was improving the stability and accuracy of marine compasses. The first marine compass, the Suunto K-12, was launched onto the market in 1953. In 1957, Suunto started manufacturing hypsometers, which measure the height of trees.In the 1960s, the compass range grew further and Suunto introduced its first diving compass--initiated by the divers themselves. A British sports diver attached a Suunto compass to his wrist and found that the device also worked underwater. Thanks to his feedback and initiatives, the new business category was found. Suunto's exports and business grew steadily and Suunto then focused on combining its strength in precision mechanics with new skills in electronics. Accuracy, reliability, and ruggedness have been Suunto's key values from the very beginning of the company history.Today, Suunto is a leading designer and manufacturer of sports instruments for training, diving, mountaineering, hiking, skiing, sailing, and golf. True to its roots, Suunto is today the world's biggest compass manufacturer. Prized for their design, accuracy and dependability, Suunto sports instruments combine the aesthetics and functionality of watches with sport-specific computers that help athletes at all levels analyze and improve performance. Headquartered in Vantaa, Finland, Suunto employs more than 500 people worldwide and distributes its products to nearly 60 countries. The company is a subsidiary of Helsinki-based Amer Sports Corporation with the sister brands Wilson, Salomon, Atomic, Precor, and Mavic.", "text": "Suunto Core Sport Watch: All Black Building on the success of the venerable Suunto Vector, the Suunto Core keeps you informed of conditions while you hike, bike, or camp, making it a terrific companion for outdoor enthusiasts of all stripes. What can the Suunto Core do for you? For starters, it can sense an approaching squall even when the sky looks clear. This intelligent Storm Alarm--one of several intelligent features designed to keep you safe and secure--is activated by a rapid drop in air pressure over a three-hour period. Once the Core senses the change, the Storm Alarm sounds and flashes, letting you know that something unpleasant is fast approaching. The built-in altimeter, meanwhile, displays your current elevation, shows how much you've climbed or descended, and records your entire session for later analysis. Accurate to within 30,000 feet, the altimeter is an extremely valuable tool for mountaineering, backcountry skiing, and wilderness travel. Add in such additional features as a barometer, a digital thermometer, a weather trend indicator, and a digital compass and you have a terrific wrist-top computer for almost all your outdoor needs.The altimeter contributes to your excursion in several ways. If you're standing on or near an obvious geographic feature, such as a ridge, trail, or creek, the altimeter can alert you to your current elevation and help you find your position on a topographic map. Similarly, if you plan on climbing a slope to a certain elevation and then traversing, the Core can help you stay on course. And as a bonus, the Suunto Core includes a unique start-from-zero function, so you don't have to enter a reference altitude. Instead, with the single push of a button, the altimeter will begin tracking your ascent and descent.The Core also includes a barometer, which measures and records air pressure to help you predict changing conditions--from sunny skies to hair-bending electrical storms. The barometer helps you decide whether to bring a soft shell or rain shell jacket when the skies look ominous, or even when to high-tail it back to the car. In general, low pressure brings inclement weather, while high pressure brings stability and clear skies. If you've arrived at camp and notice the pressure starting to plunge, it's probably a good idea to secure the tent and crawl in. Likewise, if you were on a climb, it would be prudent to find shelter and retreat. Even at home, the Suunto Core barometer can look beyond office walls, skyscrapers, and nearby hills to help you plan for upcoming activities.If you want a weather forecast that extends out a few hours, you can turn to the built-in weather trend indicator. The indicator shows the barometric history for the last three and six hours, helping you predict the weather with amazing accuracy. What's more, the watch doesn't give you a regional forecast posted earlier in the day, but rather the most current information about the weather directly overhead. And no outdoor watch is worth its salt without a digital compass, a great tool for keeping track of your direction while skiing, hiking, or exploring a new city. You can set and follow a bearing with a traditional rotating bezel, or simply point the top of the watch toward your intended destination and lock it in.Additional features include several traditional watch functions, including dual times, a date display, and an alarm; predicted times for sunrise and sunset to help you maximize your daylight hours; an automatic Alti/Baro mode that senses movement or lack thereof and switches between the altimeter and barometer accordingly; a depth meter that provides accurate water depth readings to 30 feet; and the ability to function in English, German, French, and Spanish. Available in such colors as all black, aluminum black, light black, black orange, aluminum brown, light green, black yellow, and steel , the Suunto Core carries a two-year warranty.Specifications:The Suunto Core watch includes an altimeter, barometer, compass, and weather indicator.The watch is compatible with several different straps (sold separately).Finish: All blackReal-time vertical cumulative value: YesTemperature compensation: YesTotal ascent/descent: YesUser-removable logbook files: YesAutomatic Alti/Baro switch: YesAutomatic 7-day Alti/Baro memory: YesResolution: 1 meterRecording intervals: 1 second, 5 second, 30 seconds, 60 secondsAltitude range: 1,600 to 29,500 feetDifference measurement: YesLog graph: YesLogbook function: YesCountdown timer: YesStopwatch: YesGuided calibration: YesHeading in degrees: YesDeclination setting: YesCardinal directions: YesBearing tracking: YesNorth-South indicator: North indicatorLanguages: English, German, French, and SpanishDepth meter: Yes, to 30 feetRotating bezel: YesTime: 12/24 hoursSunrise/sunset times: YesCalendar clock: YesDual time: YesDaily alarms: 1Alarm snooze: YesWeather memory: 7 daysWeather alarm: YesTrend indicator and graph: YesTemperature range: -5 to 140 degrees FSea level pressure: YesBarometer range: 300 to 1,100 mbarLow battery warning: YesWater resistance: 100 feetBacklight option: YesWeight: 2.26 ouncesWarranty: 2 yearsAbout SuuntoSuunto was founded in 1936 by outdoors man and a keen orienteering enthusiast, Tuomas Vohlonen, who had long been bothered by a problem: the inaccuracy of traditional dry compasses and their lack of steady needle operation. Being an engineer with an inventive turn of mind, he discovered and patented the production method for a much steadier needle, better readings, and a new level of accuracy.By 1950 the company was exporting compasses to over 50 countries around the world, including Canada and the United States. In 1952, Helsinki was hosting the Olympic Games, and the torches carried to light the Olympic flame were Suunto products. The next step was improving the stability and accuracy of marine compasses. The first marine compass, the Suunto K-12, was launched onto the market in 1953. In 1957, Suunto started manufacturing hypsometers, which measure the height of trees.In the 1960s, the compass range grew further and Suunto introduced its first diving compass--initiated by the divers themselves. A British sports diver attached a Suunto compass to his wrist and found that the device also worked underwater. Thanks to his feedback and initiatives, the new business category was found. Suunto's exports and business grew steadily and Suunto then focused on combining its strength in precision mechanics with new skills in electronics. Accuracy, reliability, and ruggedness have been Suunto's key values from the very beginning of the company history.Today, Suunto is a leading designer and manufacturer of sports instruments for training, diving, mountaineering, hiking, skiing, sailing, and golf. True to its roots, Suunto is today the world's biggest compass manufacturer. Prized for their design, accuracy and dependability, Suunto sports instruments combine the aesthetics and functionality of watches with sport-specific computers that help athletes at all levels analyze and improve performance. Headquartered in Vantaa, Finland, Suunto employs more than 500 people worldwide and distributes its products to nearly 60 countries. The company is a subsidiary of Helsinki-based Amer Sports Corporation with the sister brands Wilson, Salomon, Atomic, Precor, and Mavic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416RIvIvsHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DCEKXM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Suunto", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Altimeters"]], "price": 268.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DDIIVQ", "title": "Bleuet Sold Fuel Tablets 12 pk", "description": "The compact solid fuel source will provide a steady and reliable heat for cooking, boiling water or for warmth in the outdoors. AGS Brands has been around for over 30 years.", "text": "Bleuet Sold Fuel Tablets 12 pk The compact solid fuel source will provide a steady and reliable heat for cooking, boiling water or for warmth in the outdoors. AGS Brands has been around for over 30 years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-5fz%2BtAfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DDIIVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bleuet Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 7.57}}
{"item_id": "B001DDPFYY", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters DryFly Raintarp", "description": "Rain can be beautiful. Getting wet? Not so much. Now you can stay dry while camping in your Eagle Nest hammock with the DryFly Raintarp, which turns a rainy afternoon into a peace-filled experience as the rain gently falls all around you.The DryFly Raintarp is perfectly shaped to keep you and your gear dry.The DryFly tarp measures 10 feet 6 inches by 5 feet 2 inches, with perfectly shaped drip lines to cover you and all your gear. The tarp even offers enough room for you to cook while sitting in your hammock, so all your essentials are covered. And when the rain quits, simply stuff the tarp into its compact stuff sack and get back on the trail.The DryFly tarp is part of the Eagles Nest Outfitters sleep system, which includes the SingleNest and DoubleNest hammocks, Slap Straps hammock suspension straps, and Guardian bug net. You can also use the DryFly with other hammock brands or by itself to shade and protect your gear, clothes, motorcycle, or dog.About Eagles Nest OutfittersBrothers Peter and Paul Pinholster opened Eagles Nest Outfitters after embarking on a cross-country adventure in the summer of 1999. The pair had set up shop in their sister's garage sewing hammocks and slap straps, with the goal of traveling the East Coast selling their products at music festivals and community gatherings. They initially lived out of their seen-better-days mini van while building a thriving business. While vending at festivals along the Appalachian Trail, a friend suggested they set up permanent shop in Asheville, North Carolina. In short order, the brothers established themselves high up on the Blue Ridge Mountains, where they continue to supply hammocks and accessories to like-minded people all over the world.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters DryFly Raintarp Rain can be beautiful. Getting wet? Not so much. Now you can stay dry while camping in your Eagle Nest hammock with the DryFly Raintarp, which turns a rainy afternoon into a peace-filled experience as the rain gently falls all around you.The DryFly Raintarp is perfectly shaped to keep you and your gear dry.The DryFly tarp measures 10 feet 6 inches by 5 feet 2 inches, with perfectly shaped drip lines to cover you and all your gear. The tarp even offers enough room for you to cook while sitting in your hammock, so all your essentials are covered. And when the rain quits, simply stuff the tarp into its compact stuff sack and get back on the trail.The DryFly tarp is part of the Eagles Nest Outfitters sleep system, which includes the SingleNest and DoubleNest hammocks, Slap Straps hammock suspension straps, and Guardian bug net. You can also use the DryFly with other hammock brands or by itself to shade and protect your gear, clothes, motorcycle, or dog.About Eagles Nest OutfittersBrothers Peter and Paul Pinholster opened Eagles Nest Outfitters after embarking on a cross-country adventure in the summer of 1999. The pair had set up shop in their sister's garage sewing hammocks and slap straps, with the goal of traveling the East Coast selling their products at music festivals and community gatherings. They initially lived out of their seen-better-days mini van while building a thriving business. While vending at festivals along the Appalachian Trail, a friend suggested they set up permanent shop in Asheville, North Carolina. In short order, the brothers established themselves high up on the Blue Ridge Mountains, where they continue to supply hammocks and accessories to like-minded people all over the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SQZXZE%2BcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DDPFYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DDPGJ8", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Slap Strap 25mm", "description": "At the end of your day, pitching your gear should be as painless as taking off your shoes. ENO's Slap Strap system works anywhere and straps to anything. Hanging your ENO hammock just got even easier. It took only minutes before, now in only a few seconds you can be relaxing. The Slap Straps are efficient and intuitive. Your ENO hammock suspension system allows six points on each side to attach to the carabineer ends on your hammock. This enables two points of contact up twenty feet apart. Carrying bag color may vary.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Slap Strap 25mm At the end of your day, pitching your gear should be as painless as taking off your shoes. ENO's Slap Strap system works anywhere and straps to anything. Hanging your ENO hammock just got even easier. It took only minutes before, now in only a few seconds you can be relaxing. The Slap Straps are efficient and intuitive. Your ENO hammock suspension system allows six points on each side to attach to the carabineer ends on your hammock. This enables two points of contact up twenty feet apart. Carrying bag color may vary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AtDmQr6KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DDPGJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagles Nest Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DDTDT2", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters DryFly Raintarp", "description": "Rain can be beautiful. Getting wet? Not so much. Now you can stay dry while camping in your Eagle Nest hammock with the DryFly Raintarp, which turns a rainy afternoon into a peace-filled experience as the rain gently falls all around you.The DryFly Raintarp is perfectly shaped to keep you and your gear dry.The DryFly tarp measures 10 feet 6 inches by 5 feet 2 inches, with perfectly shaped drip lines to cover you and all your gear. The tarp even offers enough room for you to cook while sitting in your hammock, so all your essentials are covered. And when the rain quits, simply stuff the tarp into its compact stuff sack and get back on the trail.The DryFly tarp is part of the Eagles Nest Outfitters sleep system, which includes the SingleNest and DoubleNest hammocks, Slap Straps hammock suspension straps, and Guardian bug net. You can also use the DryFly with other hammock brands or by itself to shade and protect your gear, clothes, motorcycle, or dog.About Eagles Nest OutfittersBrothers Peter and Paul Pinholster opened Eagles Nest Outfitters after embarking on a cross-country adventure in the summer of 1999. The pair had set up shop in their sister's garage sewing hammocks and slap straps, with the goal of traveling the East Coast selling their products at music festivals and community gatherings. They initially lived out of their seen-better-days mini van while building a thriving business. While vending at festivals along the Appalachian Trail, a friend suggested they set up permanent shop in Asheville, North Carolina. In short order, the brothers established themselves high up on the Blue Ridge Mountains, where they continue to supply hammocks and accessories to like-minded people all over the world.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters DryFly Raintarp Rain can be beautiful. Getting wet? Not so much. Now you can stay dry while camping in your Eagle Nest hammock with the DryFly Raintarp, which turns a rainy afternoon into a peace-filled experience as the rain gently falls all around you.The DryFly Raintarp is perfectly shaped to keep you and your gear dry.The DryFly tarp measures 10 feet 6 inches by 5 feet 2 inches, with perfectly shaped drip lines to cover you and all your gear. The tarp even offers enough room for you to cook while sitting in your hammock, so all your essentials are covered. And when the rain quits, simply stuff the tarp into its compact stuff sack and get back on the trail.The DryFly tarp is part of the Eagles Nest Outfitters sleep system, which includes the SingleNest and DoubleNest hammocks, Slap Straps hammock suspension straps, and Guardian bug net. You can also use the DryFly with other hammock brands or by itself to shade and protect your gear, clothes, motorcycle, or dog.About Eagles Nest OutfittersBrothers Peter and Paul Pinholster opened Eagles Nest Outfitters after embarking on a cross-country adventure in the summer of 1999. The pair had set up shop in their sister's garage sewing hammocks and slap straps, with the goal of traveling the East Coast selling their products at music festivals and community gatherings. They initially lived out of their seen-better-days mini van while building a thriving business. While vending at festivals along the Appalachian Trail, a friend suggested they set up permanent shop in Asheville, North Carolina. In short order, the brothers established themselves high up on the Blue Ridge Mountains, where they continue to supply hammocks and accessories to like-minded people all over the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sIt12QUXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DDTDT2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DDWK9C", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net", "description": "Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412fC90FIJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DDWK9C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagles Nest Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DEEMXS", "title": "KA-BAR Knives Fin Folding Drop Point Straight Knife", "description": "KA-BAR Knives, Inc. has been around since 1898", "text": "KA-BAR Knives Fin Folding Drop Point Straight Knife KA-BAR Knives, Inc. has been around since 1898", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KM9YOcu%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DEEMXS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DF02WC", "title": "Dark Assassin Dagger w/ Sheath", "description": "When infiltrating a castle or keep an assassin would carry only the smallest of weapons so that they could easily be concealed. Small daggers coated in poison were a favored choice until the introduction of long-range weaponry. This dagger is modeled after small weapons that might have appeared during that era and is designed with concealment in mind. When housed in it's sheath it can be lashed to almost anything and measures only 11 inches long overall. The double edged stainless steel blade is sharpened to a factory edge with a subtle blood groove in the center. The entire dagger is accented with silver cast metal over a non-reflective black base. Measures 9 1/2 inches overall with a 5 1/4 inch blade, hard sheath included.", "text": "Dark Assassin Dagger w/ Sheath When infiltrating a castle or keep an assassin would carry only the smallest of weapons so that they could easily be concealed. Small daggers coated in poison were a favored choice until the introduction of long-range weaponry. This dagger is modeled after small weapons that might have appeared during that era and is designed with concealment in mind. When housed in it's sheath it can be lashed to almost anything and measures only 11 inches long overall. The double edged stainless steel blade is sharpened to a factory edge with a subtle blood groove in the center. The entire dagger is accented with silver cast metal over a non-reflective black base. Measures 9 1/2 inches overall with a 5 1/4 inch blade, hard sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ho1zUTitL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DF02WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 8.7}}
{"item_id": "B001DF1PFU", "title": "Gold USMC Marine Corps Dress Uniform Officer NCO Sword", "description": "The Blade of the sword is HQSS stainless steel. The scabbard of the sword is leather wrapped over steel. The guard of the sword is a full wrap guard with highly detailed leaves cast into the brass. This is the strength of pride.", "text": "Gold USMC Marine Corps Dress Uniform Officer NCO Sword The Blade of the sword is HQSS stainless steel. The scabbard of the sword is leather wrapped over steel. The guard of the sword is a full wrap guard with highly detailed leaves cast into the brass. This is the strength of pride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AvRXnIDoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DF1PFU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Etrading", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 26.48}}
{"item_id": "B001DF39M2", "title": "Kenda Tube Bicycle Tire Tube", "description": "29er tube. 95mm wall thickness. Molded tubes for higher quality.", "text": "Kenda Tube Bicycle Tire Tube 29er tube. 95mm wall thickness. Molded tubes for higher quality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mEE6YLK5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DF39M2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DF3KRG", "title": "Leather Medieval Sword Frog Belt Hanger Rapier Renaissance", "description": "Don't use a painted duct tape ring as your sword frog any longer! Constructed from quality genuine leather and cut from a traditonal pattern the Black Leather Traditonal Rapier Sword Frog will surely be noticed on your next costume. Able to be adjusted to any size Rapier and only a fraction of the cost you might see at some booth at a Renn Faire. The metal rivets are quite durable to hold up to long term use. 8 inches overall.", "text": "Leather Medieval Sword Frog Belt Hanger Rapier Renaissance Don't use a painted duct tape ring as your sword frog any longer! Constructed from quality genuine leather and cut from a traditonal pattern the Black Leather Traditonal Rapier Sword Frog will surely be noticed on your next costume. Able to be adjusted to any size Rapier and only a fraction of the cost you might see at some booth at a Renn Faire. The metal rivets are quite durable to hold up to long term use. 8 inches overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QKj-NsWQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DF3KRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B001DF68MA", "title": "WeeRide LTD Kangaroo Child Bike Seat", "description": "The ultimate in child and comfort and safety, the WeeRide LTD Kangaroo child bike seat offers all the features of WeeRide's popular Kangaroo carrier--including a unique carrying position and adjustable foot cups--but ups the ante by adding ultra-thick padding on the seat and back and a padded shoulder harness. As a result, your child will be more secure and comfortable than ever while you ride across the countryside or to the grocery store. The LTD Kangaroo is an unusual child bike seat because it doesn't sit behind the bike saddle, as with most carriers, but in front of the rider. This puts your child in a safer position, where you can easily take note if he or she is upset.The deluxe safety harness and oversized buckle system, meanwhile, will keep your child secure while giving him or her a much better view of the road and surrounding activities. Perhaps the subtlest yet most convenient feature, however, is the enhanced weight distribution, which keeps you from wavering while navigating corners or hitting bumps. The LTD Kangaroo bike seat--the plushest carrier that WeeRide makes--carries a two-year warranty.Frequently Asked QuestionsQ: What are the age and weight limits for passengers of the Kangaroo child carrier?A: The recommended limit is 4 years old and 40 pounds.Q: What is the minimum age for passengers?A: The child should be able to support his or her own head with the added weight of a helmet, usually one years old. Please consult your pediatrician.Q: What is the maximum height for passengers?A: This is also dependent upon the height of the adult piloting the bicycle, obviously the rider needs to see over and reach around the passenger. A good way to judge the height of the passenger is to sit him or her on a bench and have the adult sit directly behind them. If the adult can see over and reach around the child, you should be fine on the bike.Q: Will I have to alter my cycling position or pedal stroke when using the child carrier?A: Yes, but the alteration is minimal. It's not a tremendous alteration of your cycling, but you will have to pedal with your knees slightly more apart than usual to avoid hitting the seat. For the short recreational trips you are taking with your child, this will be a very minor inconvenience in comparison to the quality time spent with them. If you are going for a long training ride you wouldn't want to subject your child to that, so the seat is easily removed for those rides.Q: Will the child carrier fit my bike?A: Wee Ride carriers will fit most bicycles: mountain, hybrid, cruiser, men's, or women's bikes. It will not fit to road bikes with drop style handlebars (rider is too hunched over) and downhill/freeride bikes (DH forks have legs that go up almost to the handlebars and the WeeRide mounting bar will restrict steering).Q: What if I want to switch the carrier between two different bicycles?A: An additional mounting bar is available separately. You can mount it to the other bike and switch the carrier at will.", "text": "WeeRide LTD Kangaroo Child Bike Seat The ultimate in child and comfort and safety, the WeeRide LTD Kangaroo child bike seat offers all the features of WeeRide's popular Kangaroo carrier--including a unique carrying position and adjustable foot cups--but ups the ante by adding ultra-thick padding on the seat and back and a padded shoulder harness. As a result, your child will be more secure and comfortable than ever while you ride across the countryside or to the grocery store. The LTD Kangaroo is an unusual child bike seat because it doesn't sit behind the bike saddle, as with most carriers, but in front of the rider. This puts your child in a safer position, where you can easily take note if he or she is upset.The deluxe safety harness and oversized buckle system, meanwhile, will keep your child secure while giving him or her a much better view of the road and surrounding activities. Perhaps the subtlest yet most convenient feature, however, is the enhanced weight distribution, which keeps you from wavering while navigating corners or hitting bumps. The LTD Kangaroo bike seat--the plushest carrier that WeeRide makes--carries a two-year warranty.Frequently Asked QuestionsQ: What are the age and weight limits for passengers of the Kangaroo child carrier?A: The recommended limit is 4 years old and 40 pounds.Q: What is the minimum age for passengers?A: The child should be able to support his or her own head with the added weight of a helmet, usually one years old. Please consult your pediatrician.Q: What is the maximum height for passengers?A: This is also dependent upon the height of the adult piloting the bicycle, obviously the rider needs to see over and reach around the passenger. A good way to judge the height of the passenger is to sit him or her on a bench and have the adult sit directly behind them. If the adult can see over and reach around the child, you should be fine on the bike.Q: Will I have to alter my cycling position or pedal stroke when using the child carrier?A: Yes, but the alteration is minimal. It's not a tremendous alteration of your cycling, but you will have to pedal with your knees slightly more apart than usual to avoid hitting the seat. For the short recreational trips you are taking with your child, this will be a very minor inconvenience in comparison to the quality time spent with them. If you are going for a long training ride you wouldn't want to subject your child to that, so the seat is easily removed for those rides.Q: Will the child carrier fit my bike?A: Wee Ride carriers will fit most bicycles: mountain, hybrid, cruiser, men's, or women's bikes. It will not fit to road bikes with drop style handlebars (rider is too hunched over) and downhill/freeride bikes (DH forks have legs that go up almost to the handlebars and the WeeRide mounting bar will restrict steering).Q: What if I want to switch the carrier between two different bicycles?A: An additional mounting bar is available separately. You can mount it to the other bike and switch the carrier at will.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415OrX%2Bx5JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DF68MA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WeeRide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Child Seats"]], "price": 71.0}}
{"item_id": "B001DFT79Q", "title": "Spyderco Police 3 G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Black", "description": "The Spyderco Police Model is a cutlery icon. It was designed to have the largest possible blade built into a thin, equally sized handle. Because of this, Save and Serve professionals continue buying the Police Model as an essential tool for their trade. The Police3 is the latest version of this best-selling knife, featuring textured G-10 handle scales, a finger choil, and a full flat-ground blade. The Police3's PlainEdge blade is ground from VG-10, a high-carbon, cobalt-enhanced steel that retains its edge extremely well yet is easily sharpened. The blade locks open via a mid-positioned back lock and features a David Boye Dent for added lock security. A four-way clip positions allows the knife to be configured for tip-up/tip-down and left- or right-side carry, making this knife truly ambidextrous in every way.", "text": "Spyderco Police 3 G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Black The Spyderco Police Model is a cutlery icon. It was designed to have the largest possible blade built into a thin, equally sized handle. Because of this, Save and Serve professionals continue buying the Police Model as an essential tool for their trade. The Police3 is the latest version of this best-selling knife, featuring textured G-10 handle scales, a finger choil, and a full flat-ground blade. The Police3's PlainEdge blade is ground from VG-10, a high-carbon, cobalt-enhanced steel that retains its edge extremely well yet is easily sharpened. The blade locks open via a mid-positioned back lock and features a David Boye Dent for added lock security. A four-way clip positions allows the knife to be configured for tip-up/tip-down and left- or right-side carry, making this knife truly ambidextrous in every way.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21SIJxQU%2B%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DFT79Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 141.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC1OM", "title": "TSD Tactical Full Metal/Semi-Auto M9 Gas Blowback Airsoft Pistol", "description": "TSDTactical High Grade M9 Series Heavyweight Gas Blowback! Full Metal, Semi-Auto only version, shoots hard at 300 FPS! Hop Up system. Magazine holds 26 rounds. If you're looking for a realistic feel to your AirSoft experience, then heaveyweight gas guns are where it's at! Highly realistic look, feel and \"Blowback\" action (slide moves with every shot) simulates the kick of real steel! The body and slide is full metal construction, with some metal internal parts. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand products for optimum performance! Made in Taiwan. Warranty This TSD Tactical product includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. MAKE SURE YOUR PISTOL IS AN AUTHENTIC TSD PRODUCT! Make sure your Pistol comes packaged as pictured, in the authentic TSD Tactical marked brown box . Products not in this packaging are not from TSD and do not carry our 30 Day Warranty. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Brand products for their airsoft needs!", "text": "TSD Tactical Full Metal/Semi-Auto M9 Gas Blowback Airsoft Pistol TSDTactical High Grade M9 Series Heavyweight Gas Blowback! Full Metal, Semi-Auto only version, shoots hard at 300 FPS! Hop Up system. Magazine holds 26 rounds. If you're looking for a realistic feel to your AirSoft experience, then heaveyweight gas guns are where it's at! Highly realistic look, feel and \"Blowback\" action (slide moves with every shot) simulates the kick of real steel! The body and slide is full metal construction, with some metal internal parts. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand products for optimum performance! Made in Taiwan. Warranty This TSD Tactical product includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. MAKE SURE YOUR PISTOL IS AN AUTHENTIC TSD PRODUCT! Make sure your Pistol comes packaged as pictured, in the authentic TSD Tactical marked brown box . Products not in this packaging are not from TSD and do not carry our 30 Day Warranty. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Brand products for their airsoft needs!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qdVoSpf4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC1OM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC214", "title": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm biodegradable airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, white", "description": "TSD Tactical Biodegradable Airsoft BBs are made with an organic base that will break down in just 180 days when exposed to soil, sunlight, and water. However, the organic based construction will not sacrifice performance. Like all TSD Tactical BBs, the biodegradable version BBs are double polished and slick for extreme precision, fewer jams, and an overall competition-grade performance. But, unlike conventional BBs, these BBs will not leave a lasting mark on the environment.", "text": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm biodegradable airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, white TSD Tactical Biodegradable Airsoft BBs are made with an organic base that will break down in just 180 days when exposed to soil, sunlight, and water. However, the organic based construction will not sacrifice performance. Like all TSD Tactical BBs, the biodegradable version BBs are double polished and slick for extreme precision, fewer jams, and an overall competition-grade performance. But, unlike conventional BBs, these BBs will not leave a lasting mark on the environment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ejc6XKBEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC214.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 9.09}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC282", "title": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, white", "description": "Precision-made to fly straight and to resist magazine jamming, these TSD Tactical Airsoft Plastic White 6 mm, 0.20 g BBs come in a 5,000-count bag. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition-grade accuracy and consistency. The 0.20 g size is ideal for use in AEG's and gas pistols and the 5,000-count bag size will provide plenty of trigger time before you next ammunition purchase.", "text": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, white Precision-made to fly straight and to resist magazine jamming, these TSD Tactical Airsoft Plastic White 6 mm, 0.20 g BBs come in a 5,000-count bag. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition-grade accuracy and consistency. The 0.20 g size is ideal for use in AEG's and gas pistols and the 5,000-count bag size will provide plenty of trigger time before you next ammunition purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FZbVZ87pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC282.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC2LO", "title": "TSD Universal Smart Charger 7.2-12V for NiCad & NiMH batteries", "description": "The TSD ERUSC01 can charge large and small plug NiMH and NiCD airsoft batteries. The charger will detect battery voltage automatically. Red LED will be on during charging. When battery is fully charged, current will reduce to trckle charging at 0.1C and green LED will be on. Package includes: charger with large plug, large-to-mini plug adaptor, charger power cable. MAKE SURE YOUR PRODUCT IS AN AUTHENTIC TSD PRODUCT! Make sure your Item looks like and comes packaged as pictured, with the ERUSC01 Part Number on the Label. Products not looking like, or in this packaging are not from TSD and do not carry our 30 Day Warranty. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Brand products for their airsoft needs!", "text": "TSD Universal Smart Charger 7.2-12V for NiCad & NiMH batteries The TSD ERUSC01 can charge large and small plug NiMH and NiCD airsoft batteries. The charger will detect battery voltage automatically. Red LED will be on during charging. When battery is fully charged, current will reduce to trckle charging at 0.1C and green LED will be on. Package includes: charger with large plug, large-to-mini plug adaptor, charger power cable. MAKE SURE YOUR PRODUCT IS AN AUTHENTIC TSD PRODUCT! Make sure your Item looks like and comes packaged as pictured, with the ERUSC01 Part Number on the Label. Products not looking like, or in this packaging are not from TSD and do not carry our 30 Day Warranty. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Brand products for their airsoft needs!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UrNUlkl2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC2LO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]], "price": 24.25}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC2NW", "title": "TSD Metal AK 600rd Roll Up Airsoft Magazine", "description": "The JBU International SDJBI04 is a metal high capacity magazine that can hold 600 rounds and is compatible with most high end AK AEG's", "text": "TSD Metal AK 600rd Roll Up Airsoft Magazine The JBU International SDJBI04 is a metal high capacity magazine that can hold 600 rounds and is compatible with most high end AK AEG's", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f%2BXNCDsDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC2NW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 8.36}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC3G8", "title": "TSD Sports CO2 Gas Powered Non-Blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case", "description": "Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 1911 CO2 Gas Powered Non-blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case looks and feels just like the real thing. Its highly efficient CO2 system can fire over 100 BBs on one CO2 cartridge, and you can shoot at up to 400 feet per second when using .20 gram BBs. Effective at up to 75 feet, this pistol includes a sliding grip panel to conceal the CO2 cartridge. Other features include non-blowback from the cartridge, a fixed blade and fin, a fixed hop-up, and a semi-auto rate of fire. This pistol comes complete with an attractive padded case.", "text": "TSD Sports CO2 Gas Powered Non-Blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 1911 CO2 Gas Powered Non-blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case looks and feels just like the real thing. Its highly efficient CO2 system can fire over 100 BBs on one CO2 cartridge, and you can shoot at up to 400 feet per second when using .20 gram BBs. Effective at up to 75 feet, this pistol includes a sliding grip panel to conceal the CO2 cartridge. Other features include non-blowback from the cartridge, a fixed blade and fin, a fixed hop-up, and a semi-auto rate of fire. This pistol comes complete with an attractive padded case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51N6ozcYK9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC3G8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC3I6", "title": "TSD Sports 4-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver", "description": "Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 4-inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver looks and feels just like the real thing. Shells load into cylinders and the hammer cocks back for a realistic feel. Compact and easy to wield, this spring-powered six-chambered revolver packs a punch despite its small size. Spring-powered and using shells instead of magazines for a more realistic shooting experience, the revolver is capable of shooting .20 gram pellets at 290 to 315 feet per second. Other features include a fixed hop-up, adjustable windage and elevation, and battery-free operation.", "text": "TSD Sports 4-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 4-inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver looks and feels just like the real thing. Shells load into cylinders and the hammer cocks back for a realistic feel. Compact and easy to wield, this spring-powered six-chambered revolver packs a punch despite its small size. Spring-powered and using shells instead of magazines for a more realistic shooting experience, the revolver is capable of shooting .20 gram pellets at 290 to 315 feet per second. Other features include a fixed hop-up, adjustable windage and elevation, and battery-free operation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZDsZcC1KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC3I6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UHC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 26.44}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC3JK", "title": "TSD Sports M9 Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol", "description": "The TSD Sports M9 series is a replica of the standard military-issued sidearm for U.S. troops today, and boasts a functional safety and a heavyweight, lifelike feel. The semiautomatic, spring-powered pistol has a 22-round metal magazine, and fires BB rounds with impressive muzzle velocities.", "text": "TSD Sports M9 Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol The TSD Sports M9 series is a replica of the standard military-issued sidearm for U.S. troops today, and boasts a functional safety and a heavyweight, lifelike feel. The semiautomatic, spring-powered pistol has a 22-round metal magazine, and fires BB rounds with impressive muzzle velocities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DPnV2jr0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC3JK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 20.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DHC7TG", "title": "Gaiam 8-Foot Organic Cotton Yoga Strap", "description": "", "text": "Gaiam 8-Foot Organic Cotton Yoga Strap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CrBslqY0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHC7TG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gaiam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Straps"]], "price": 11.82}}
{"item_id": "B001DHE4MO", "title": "TSD Sports M100 Airsoft Sniper Rifle airsoft gun", "description": "A heavy-duty airsoft gun with surprising power and accuracy for the price, the TSD Sports M100 includes a tactical rail system on the top and front sides for customizing with your accessories of choice. The gun fires at an impressive 350 feet-per-second (FPS) with 0.12-gram BBs and 300 FPS with 0.20-gram BBs. The spring-powered gun is fast, clean, and easy to maintain, requiring no gas or batteries.Additional features include:37-round magazineRemovable tactical rail systemFunctional safety unitAdjustable hop up and rear sightWarrantyThis TSD Sports airsoft rifle includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "TSD Sports M100 Airsoft Sniper Rifle airsoft gun A heavy-duty airsoft gun with surprising power and accuracy for the price, the TSD Sports M100 includes a tactical rail system on the top and front sides for customizing with your accessories of choice. The gun fires at an impressive 350 feet-per-second (FPS) with 0.12-gram BBs and 300 FPS with 0.20-gram BBs. The spring-powered gun is fast, clean, and easy to maintain, requiring no gas or batteries.Additional features include:37-round magazineRemovable tactical rail systemFunctional safety unitAdjustable hop up and rear sightWarrantyThis TSD Sports airsoft rifle includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fm6AmzWhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHE4MO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DHE4RY", "title": "TSD Competition-Grade AEG 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.28g, 5000 rds, white", "description": "Blows away the competition! Beware of Cheap ammo that constantly jam your airsoft guns and cause more problems than they are worth. Where precision and accuracy count, TSD Tactical BB's are a High Grade airsoft BB made to fly straight and resist jamming. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition grade accuracy and consistency. You won't find seams or artifacts on TSD Tactical BB's. The 0.28g weight is ideal for use in some AEG's, some Gas Pistols and most Spring Sniper Rifles. The larger the quantity, the more cost effective, providing you the most trigger time before your next ammunition purchase. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand BB's for optimum performance! TSD Tactical 6mm Extreme Precision Competition Grade BB's are Super Slick, Double Polished to achieve the ultimate precision and the least possibilities of BB jams ! MAKE SURE YOUR BB'S ARE AUTHENTIC TSD TACTICAL BB'S! Make sure your BB's come packaged as pictured, with the authentic glossy TSD Tactical label attached to the front. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Tactical Brand BB's for their airsoft ammo needs!", "text": "TSD Competition-Grade AEG 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.28g, 5000 rds, white Blows away the competition! Beware of Cheap ammo that constantly jam your airsoft guns and cause more problems than they are worth. Where precision and accuracy count, TSD Tactical BB's are a High Grade airsoft BB made to fly straight and resist jamming. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition grade accuracy and consistency. You won't find seams or artifacts on TSD Tactical BB's. The 0.28g weight is ideal for use in some AEG's, some Gas Pistols and most Spring Sniper Rifles. The larger the quantity, the more cost effective, providing you the most trigger time before your next ammunition purchase. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand BB's for optimum performance! TSD Tactical 6mm Extreme Precision Competition Grade BB's are Super Slick, Double Polished to achieve the ultimate precision and the least possibilities of BB jams ! MAKE SURE YOUR BB'S ARE AUTHENTIC TSD TACTICAL BB'S! Make sure your BB's come packaged as pictured, with the authentic glossy TSD Tactical label attached to the front. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Tactical Brand BB's for their airsoft ammo needs!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416BJtJhELL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHE4RY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 20.42}}
{"item_id": "B001DHE5XW", "title": "UHC Shell Magazines for Spring Powered Airsoft Revolvers (8 Pieces)", "description": "The UHC MUG937/8 consists of 8 pieces of 1 round plastic shell magazines and is compatible with UA937, UA937S, UA938, UA938S, UA941, UA941S", "text": "UHC Shell Magazines for Spring Powered Airsoft Revolvers (8 Pieces) The UHC MUG937/8 consists of 8 pieces of 1 round plastic shell magazines and is compatible with UA937, UA937S, UA938, UA938S, UA941, UA941S", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eY1O9KOCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHE5XW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UHC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 9.17}}
{"item_id": "B001DHE6J0", "title": "TSD Sports 8-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver", "description": "Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 8-inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver looks and feels just like the real thing. Shells load into cylinders and the hammer cocks back for a realistic feel. Compact and easy to wield, this spring-powered six-chambered revolver packs a punch despite its small size. Spring-powered and using shells instead of magazines for a more realistic shooting experience, the revolver is capable of shooting .20 gram pellets 290 to 315 feet per second. Other features include a fixed hop-up, adjustable windage and elevation, and battery-free operation.", "text": "TSD Sports 8-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver Ideal for avid collectors and avid shooters, the TSD Sports 8-inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver looks and feels just like the real thing. Shells load into cylinders and the hammer cocks back for a realistic feel. Compact and easy to wield, this spring-powered six-chambered revolver packs a punch despite its small size. Spring-powered and using shells instead of magazines for a more realistic shooting experience, the revolver is capable of shooting .20 gram pellets 290 to 315 feet per second. Other features include a fixed hop-up, adjustable windage and elevation, and battery-free operation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41npNLAlOCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHE6J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 24.49}}
{"item_id": "B001DHE6KO", "title": "TSD Sports 6-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver", "description": "With a six-inch barrel and six cartridges per cycle like the actual revolver, the TSD Sports Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver has the look and feel of the real thing. Featuring Indiana Jones real scale style, heavy-duty construction with metal parts, Antishock ABS and a rotating cylinder system, the revolver has a great weight and feel. With single-shot hammer action and a spring-powered hop-up system, the Airsoft Revolver delivers plenty of punch with a velocity of 260 feet per second. The Airsoft Revolver is designed for use with six millimeter BBs and paintballs.Specifications:1:1 Real scale designRotating cylinder systemSix-inch barrelSix cartridges per cylinderSix shells includedSpare shells: SD+MUA937/8Adjustable rear sightVelocity: 260 feet per secondCaliber: 6 millimeter BBs or paintballSpring-powered hop-up systemMetal partsAntishock ABSManufacturer Warranty30-day", "text": "TSD Sports 6-Inch Barrel Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver With a six-inch barrel and six cartridges per cycle like the actual revolver, the TSD Sports Spring Powered Airsoft Revolver has the look and feel of the real thing. Featuring Indiana Jones real scale style, heavy-duty construction with metal parts, Antishock ABS and a rotating cylinder system, the revolver has a great weight and feel. With single-shot hammer action and a spring-powered hop-up system, the Airsoft Revolver delivers plenty of punch with a velocity of 260 feet per second. The Airsoft Revolver is designed for use with six millimeter BBs and paintballs.Specifications:1:1 Real scale designRotating cylinder systemSix-inch barrelSix cartridges per cylinderSix shells includedSpare shells: SD+MUA937/8Adjustable rear sightVelocity: 260 feet per secondCaliber: 6 millimeter BBs or paintballSpring-powered hop-up systemMetal partsAntishock ABSManufacturer Warranty30-day", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418HapQNDUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHE6KO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DHHPPW", "title": "TSD Tactical 5,000 ct. Bag Plastic White Airsoft BBs (6mm, 0.25g)", "description": "Blows away the competition! Beware of Cheap ammo that constantly jam your airsoft guns and cause more problems than they are worth. Where precision and accuracy count, TSD Tactical BB's are a High Grade airsoft BB made to fly straight and resist jamming. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition grade accuracy and consistency. You won't find seams or artifacts on TSD Tactical BB's. The 0.25g weight is ideal for use in AEG's, Gas Pistols and Spring Sniper Rifles. The larger the quantity, the more cost effective, providing you the most trigger time before your next ammunition purchase. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand BB's for optimum performance! TSD Tactical 6mm Extreme Precision Competition Grade BB's are Super Slick, Double Polished to achieve the ultimate precision and the least possibilities of BB jams ! MAKE SURE YOUR BB'S ARE AUTHENTIC TSD TACTICAL BB'S! Make sure your BB's come packaged as pictured, with the authentic glossy TSD Tactical label attached to the front. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Tactical Brand BB's for their airsoft ammo needs!", "text": "TSD Tactical 5,000 ct. Bag Plastic White Airsoft BBs (6mm, 0.25g) Blows away the competition! Beware of Cheap ammo that constantly jam your airsoft guns and cause more problems than they are worth. Where precision and accuracy count, TSD Tactical BB's are a High Grade airsoft BB made to fly straight and resist jamming. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition grade accuracy and consistency. You won't find seams or artifacts on TSD Tactical BB's. The 0.25g weight is ideal for use in AEG's, Gas Pistols and Spring Sniper Rifles. The larger the quantity, the more cost effective, providing you the most trigger time before your next ammunition purchase. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand BB's for optimum performance! TSD Tactical 6mm Extreme Precision Competition Grade BB's are Super Slick, Double Polished to achieve the ultimate precision and the least possibilities of BB jams ! MAKE SURE YOUR BB'S ARE AUTHENTIC TSD TACTICAL BB'S! Make sure your BB's come packaged as pictured, with the authentic glossy TSD Tactical label attached to the front. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Tactical Brand BB's for their airsoft ammo needs!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51I6dF0Ak%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHHPPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 17.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DHHQHO", "title": "TSD Sports M9 and 1911 Non-GBB 16 Round Stick Airsoft Magazine", "description": "The TSD Sports MSDGP300C is a metal stick magazine that can hold 16 rounds and is compatible with TSD Sport CO2 M9 and 1911 series gas non-blowback pistols", "text": "TSD Sports M9 and 1911 Non-GBB 16 Round Stick Airsoft Magazine The TSD Sports MSDGP300C is a metal stick magazine that can hold 16 rounds and is compatible with TSD Sport CO2 M9 and 1911 series gas non-blowback pistols", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sEGB5s-NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHHQHO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 13.38}}
{"item_id": "B001DHHR7I", "title": "TSD Sports M9 CO2 Gas Powered Non-Blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case", "description": "The cleverly-designed holster slides back to reveal the replaceable CO2 cartridge slot.The TSD Sports CO2 M9 series is a replica of the standard military-issued sidearm for U.S. troops today, and boasts a functional safety and heavyweight metal inserts for a lifelike feel. The semiautomatic, gas-powered pistol has a sliding grip for removal and insertion of 12-gram CO2 cartridges, as well as a 15-round metal magazine. A highly efficient CO2 system can fire more than 100 BBs on one cartridge, and the gun fires 20-gram BB rounds at an impressive muzzle velocity of up to 400-feet-per-second.", "text": "TSD Sports M9 CO2 Gas Powered Non-Blowback Airsoft Pistol with Case The cleverly-designed holster slides back to reveal the replaceable CO2 cartridge slot.The TSD Sports CO2 M9 series is a replica of the standard military-issued sidearm for U.S. troops today, and boasts a functional safety and heavyweight metal inserts for a lifelike feel. The semiautomatic, gas-powered pistol has a sliding grip for removal and insertion of 12-gram CO2 cartridges, as well as a 15-round metal magazine. A highly efficient CO2 system can fire more than 100 BBs on one cartridge, and the gun fires 20-gram BB rounds at an impressive muzzle velocity of up to 400-feet-per-second.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512cj2IvsjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHHR7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 40.0}}
