 before your next ammunition purchase. Whether you're a backyard plinker, a hardcore airsoft gamer, a weekend warrior or a target practice aficionado, you can trust TSD Brand BB's for optimum performance! TSD Tactical 6mm Extreme Precision Competition Grade BB's are Super Slick, Double Polished to achieve the ultimate precision and the least possibilities of BB jams ! MAKE SURE YOUR BB'S ARE AUTHENTIC TSD TACTICAL BB'S! Make sure your BB's come packaged as pictured, with the authentic glossy TSD Tactical label attached to the front. Accept no imitations! See why tens of thousands of airsoft gamers trust TSD Tactical Brand BB's for their airsoft ammo needs!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u9RZDgSIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHJE06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DHJE1K", "title": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, black", "description": "Precision-made to fly straight and to resist magazine jamming, these TSD Tactical Airsoft Plastic Black 6 mm, 0.20 g BBs come in a 5,000-count bag. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition-grade accuracy and consistency. The 0.20 g size is ideal for use in AEG's and gas pistols and the 5,000-count bag size will provide plenty of trigger time before you next ammunition purchase.", "text": "TSD Competition Grade 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 5000 rds, black Precision-made to fly straight and to resist magazine jamming, these TSD Tactical Airsoft Plastic Black 6 mm, 0.20 g BBs come in a 5,000-count bag. Each BB is super slick and double polished for competition-grade accuracy and consistency. The 0.20 g size is ideal for use in AEG's and gas pistols and the 5,000-count bag size will provide plenty of trigger time before you next ammunition purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OkWyZTF7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHJE1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TSD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 9.89}}
{"item_id": "B001DHN7NG", "title": "Gamo P-23 Air Pistol", "description": "For people that love to shoot, Gamo has made the hottest semiautomatic CO2 pistol in the world. With BB’s it’s a 12 shot semiautomatic and if you are really fast you can get 12 shots off in less than 3 seconds! For extreme accuracy, it can be loaded as a single shot pellet pistol.", "text": "Gamo P-23 Air Pistol For people that love to shoot, Gamo has made the hottest semiautomatic CO2 pistol in the world. With BB’s it’s a 12 shot semiautomatic and if you are really fast you can get 12 shots off in less than 3 seconds! For extreme accuracy, it can be loaded as a single shot pellet pistol.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QFmwV-AML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DHN7NG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DIIHI0", "title": "Body Solid GDKR100 Kettlebell / Dumbbell Rack", "description": "The versatile rack's shelves flip to accommodate either dumbbells or kettlebells (sold separately).This convenient, versatile weight rack features two shelves which can be flipped to hold either dumbbells or kettlebells (sold separately), helping you keep your workout area organized and most importantly safe. An open design means you can place the durable, stable rack against a wall or centered in a room. Heavy gauge steel construction includes tubing that's been welded on all four sides, and de-burred inside and out for maximum user safety.The 79-pound rack measures 23-by-33-by-44.5 inches (W x H x D), with 39 inches of total tray length between the two platforms.Lifetime WarrantyBody-Solid gym equipment includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Body-SolidBody-Solid, Inc. is a leading manufacturer and distributor of high quality fitness equipment for the home and commercial markets. With over 20 years of experience, Body-Solid offers one of the widest arrays of products in the industry, including multi-station gyms, free weight machines, a complete line of cardiovascular products, weight plates, kettle bells, dumbbells, and fitness accessories.", "text": "Body Solid GDKR100 Kettlebell / Dumbbell Rack The versatile rack's shelves flip to accommodate either dumbbells or kettlebells (sold separately).This convenient, versatile weight rack features two shelves which can be flipped to hold either dumbbells or kettlebells (sold separately), helping you keep your workout area organized and most importantly safe. An open design means you can place the durable, stable rack against a wall or centered in a room. Heavy gauge steel construction includes tubing that's been welded on all four sides, and de-burred inside and out for maximum user safety.The 79-pound rack measures 23-by-33-by-44.5 inches (W x H x D), with 39 inches of total tray length between the two platforms.Lifetime WarrantyBody-Solid gym equipment includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Body-SolidBody-Solid, Inc. is a leading manufacturer and distributor of high quality fitness equipment for the home and commercial markets. With over 20 years of experience, Body-Solid offers one of the widest arrays of products in the industry, including multi-station gyms, free weight machines, a complete line of cardiovascular products, weight plates, kettle bells, dumbbells, and fitness accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QUMiueibL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DIIHI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Dumbbell Racks"]], "price": 179.0}}
{"item_id": "B001DJ8OVO", "title": "Bionic Men's Full Finger Fitness Gloves", "description": "The men's full finger fitness gloves from Bionic are designed by an orthopedic hand surgeon to provide performance enhancing support for weight lifting and other gym workouts. Constructed with high-grade, washable sheepskin leather and Coolmax Lycra for breathability, the gloves are built for comfort and durability. The gloves feature a patented pad system that is designed to help strengthen your grip, prevent blisters and calluses, and reduce hand fatigue. Motion Zones over the knuckles and Web Zones between the fingers promote natural hand movement and help circulate air, while a pre-rotated fingertip supports the hand's natural grip shape. These unique, full-finger gloves provide an antimicrobial barrier for your entire hand to prevent infection.The Bionic Full-Finger Fitness Gloves are designed to help you lift more by improving your grip and reducing hand fatigue.Exclusive Glove Technology--Developed by an Orthopedic Hand Surgeon to:Reduce Hand Fatigue--Increase Grip Strength--and--Support the Hand's Natural DexterityAnatomical Relief Pad System:The hand has natural peaks and valleys determined by the placement of the bones. Typically the high points of the bone rub against tools and equipment, causing blisters, calluses, and fatigue. Bionic gloves are designed to solve this problem with strategically placed pads in the glove, that eliminate the peaks and valleys--evening the surface of the hand--to result in improved grip strength, reduced hand fatigue, and reduced friction--to virtually eliminate calluses and blisters.Pre-Rotated Finger Design:Because your forefinger and pinky naturally rotate inward toward the center of your hand when grasping an object, Bionic gloves feature a pre-rotated design that follows the natural motion of your fingers, to offer a comfortable, second-skin feel, and natural movement when gripping.Web and Motion Zones:The hands combine 14 phalanx bones as well as large number of tendons and muscles to allow for an intricate range of motion and dexterity. Bionic gloves offer Motion Zones over the knuckles, and Web Zones between the fingers, made of stretchable and breathable Lycra to provide greater flexibility, support the hand's natural dexterity, and keep the hands cool and dry.The Bionic Custom Fit--A guideline to sizing your gloveMen’s SizingSmall:7 3/4 to 8 inchesMedium:8 to 8 1/4 inchesLarge:8 3/8 to 8 3/4 inchesX Large:8 3/4 to 9 1/4 inchesXX Large:9 1/4 to 9 1/2 inchesXXX Large:9 1/2 to 9 7/8 inchesTo find out your glove size, measure (in inches) around your dominant hand (when ordering pairs) with a tape measure at the place indicated on the diagram shown at right. Use the tape measurements below to determine your proper glove size.If you need additional assistance on sizing or fit of the gloves, please contact Bionic at 877-524-6642 or e-mailbionic@slugger.com.", "text": "Bionic Men's Full Finger Fitness Gloves The men's full finger fitness gloves from Bionic are designed by an orthopedic hand surgeon to provide performance enhancing support for weight lifting and other gym workouts. Constructed with high-grade, washable sheepskin leather and Coolmax Lycra for breathability, the gloves are built for comfort and durability. The gloves feature a patented pad system that is designed to help strengthen your grip, prevent blisters and calluses, and reduce hand fatigue. Motion Zones over the knuckles and Web Zones between the fingers promote natural hand movement and help circulate air, while a pre-rotated fingertip supports the hand's natural grip shape. These unique, full-finger gloves provide an antimicrobial barrier for your entire hand to prevent infection.The Bionic Full-Finger Fitness Gloves are designed to help you lift more by improving your grip and reducing hand fatigue.Exclusive Glove Technology--Developed by an Orthopedic Hand Surgeon to:Reduce Hand Fatigue--Increase Grip Strength--and--Support the Hand's Natural DexterityAnatomical Relief Pad System:The hand has natural peaks and valleys determined by the placement of the bones. Typically the high points of the bone rub against tools and equipment, causing blisters, calluses, and fatigue. Bionic gloves are designed to solve this problem with strategically placed pads in the glove, that eliminate the peaks and valleys--evening the surface of the hand--to result in improved grip strength, reduced hand fatigue, and reduced friction--to virtually eliminate calluses and blisters.Pre-Rotated Finger Design:Because your forefinger and pinky naturally rotate inward toward the center of your hand when grasping an object, Bionic gloves feature a pre-rotated design that follows the natural motion of your fingers, to offer a comfortable, second-skin feel, and natural movement when gripping.Web and Motion Zones:The hands combine 14 phalanx bones as well as large number of tendons and muscles to allow for an intricate range of motion and dexterity. Bionic gloves offer Motion Zones over the knuckles, and Web Zones between the fingers, made of stretchable and breathable Lycra to provide greater flexibility, support the hand's natural dexterity, and keep the hands cool and dry.The Bionic Custom Fit--A guideline to sizing your gloveMen’s SizingSmall:7 3/4 to 8 inchesMedium:8 to 8 1/4 inchesLarge:8 3/8 to 8 3/4 inchesX Large:8 3/4 to 9 1/4 inchesXX Large:9 1/4 to 9 1/2 inchesXXX Large:9 1/2 to 9 7/8 inchesTo find out your glove size, measure (in inches) around your dominant hand (when ordering pairs) with a tape measure at the place indicated on the diagram shown at right. Use the tape measurements below to determine your proper glove size.If you need additional assistance on sizing or fit of the gloves, please contact Bionic at 877-524-6642 or e-mailbionic@slugger.com.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZXgkJDiyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DJ8OVO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DKBC62", "title": "Glock 19 23 32 36 Pro Carry LT CCW IWB Leather Gun Holster New Black", "description": "THIS IS ONE OF THE FINEST INSIDE THE PANTS, CLIP ON, SUPER LIGHT WEIGHT HOLSTERS AVAILABLE TODAY. THIS Black FINISHED LEATHER HOLSTER HAS A SMOOTH LEATHER LINING ,ALLOWING FOR A FAST AND EASY DRAW. THIS HOLSTER IS COMFORTABLE WHEN SITTING OR STANDING. This is 100% AMERICAN cowhide - American made product - the very BEST! This is not HORSE HIDE - This is not some imported inexpensive leather. Please compare the cuts on our leather and the stitching to ANY OTHERS and see the quality we put into each and every holster. The Holster Store Holsters are double back stitched at the stress points, and provide maximum durability. This item is for Right handed shooters - LH available upon request", "text": "Glock 19 23 32 36 Pro Carry LT CCW IWB Leather Gun Holster New Black THIS IS ONE OF THE FINEST INSIDE THE PANTS, CLIP ON, SUPER LIGHT WEIGHT HOLSTERS AVAILABLE TODAY. THIS Black FINISHED LEATHER HOLSTER HAS A SMOOTH LEATHER LINING ,ALLOWING FOR A FAST AND EASY DRAW. THIS HOLSTER IS COMFORTABLE WHEN SITTING OR STANDING. This is 100% AMERICAN cowhide - American made product - the very BEST! This is not HORSE HIDE - This is not some imported inexpensive leather. Please compare the cuts on our leather and the stitching to ANY OTHERS and see the quality we put into each and every holster. The Holster Store Holsters are double back stitched at the stress points, and provide maximum durability. This item is for Right handed shooters - LH available upon request", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ChJkJDCRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DKBC62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
