{"item_id": "B001DQ76JI", "title": "10.2 oz. Counter Assault Bear Deterrent", "description": "This 10.2 oz. Counter Assault Bear Deterrent is the hottest formula allowed by EPA at 2% capsaicin! Longest spray time and spray distance of 9.2 seconds; 32 ft. for 10.2 oz. This also features a glow-in-the-dark safety with safety tie to prevent loss of safety mechanism.", "text": "10.2 oz. Counter Assault Bear Deterrent This 10.2 oz. Counter Assault Bear Deterrent is the hottest formula allowed by EPA at 2% capsaicin! Longest spray time and spray distance of 9.2 seconds; 32 ft. for 10.2 oz. This also features a glow-in-the-dark safety with safety tie to prevent loss of safety mechanism.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519PYAazDRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DQ76JI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Counter Assault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 39.26}}
{"item_id": "B001DQH50I", "title": "Adult Snorkel or Snorkeling Vest (crafted in the USA)", "description": "This is our \"economy\" vest for Snorkeling , the same vest others sell as deluxe. We have NOW CRAFTED IN THE USA with a the quality brass inflator (no plastic inflator here), has a crotch strap and waist strap. Fits Adults 100 - 180 lbs.", "text": "Adult Snorkel or Snorkeling Vest (crafted in the USA) This is our \"economy\" vest for Snorkeling , the same vest others sell as deluxe. We have NOW CRAFTED IN THE USA with a the quality brass inflator (no plastic inflator here), has a crotch strap and waist strap. Fits Adults 100 - 180 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511bz3k-LLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DQH50I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DQSKOI", "title": "SigTac Roto Retention Paddle Holster for SIG fits Mosquito Roto Retention Paddle", "description": "The only holster utilizing our quick release retention lever that also contains an integral magazine pouch, offering the ultimate in performance and convenience. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at \"The Ready\" - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Single magazine pouch - Protective sight channel - Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer Mosquito Models", "text": "SigTac Roto Retention Paddle Holster for SIG fits Mosquito Roto Retention Paddle The only holster utilizing our quick release retention lever that also contains an integral magazine pouch, offering the ultimate in performance and convenience. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at \"The Ready\" - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Single magazine pouch - Protective sight channel - Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer Mosquito Models", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tr2QCvbAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DQSKOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 34.0}}
{"item_id": "B001DRGI0U", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Universal Flashlight Sheath", "description": "Product Details Product Features Diameter: Max 2-Inch with Velcro Ret. Overall Width: 2-Inch Belt: 2-Inch Vert. or Horz. Attach: Velcro MAXPEDITION's Universal Flashlight / Baton Holder can be adjusted in height and diameter to carry securely most flashlights and batons on the market today. Length of sheath lids are adjustable with internal Velcro attachments for longer items or are completely removable for those who want the quickest access. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Universal Flashlight Sheath Product Details Product Features Diameter: Max 2-Inch with Velcro Ret. Overall Width: 2-Inch Belt: 2-Inch Vert. or Horz. Attach: Velcro MAXPEDITION's Universal Flashlight / Baton Holder can be adjusted in height and diameter to carry securely most flashlights and batons on the market today. Length of sheath lids are adjustable with internal Velcro attachments for longer items or are completely removable for those who want the quickest access. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NRsAvFK%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DRGI0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 21.35}}
