{"item_id": "B001DRHLJC", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Shemaugh", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Shemaugh is a traditional desert headwear designed to protect the head and neck from sun and sand. It is currently in use with U.S. and coalition forces in Iraq and Afghanistan and is made of 100% cotton. Dimensions are 44” x 44”(112 cm x 112 cm).", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Shemaugh The BLACKHAWK! Shemaugh is a traditional desert headwear designed to protect the head and neck from sun and sand. It is currently in use with U.S. and coalition forces in Iraq and Afghanistan and is made of 100% cotton. Dimensions are 44” x 44”(112 cm x 112 cm).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dEhMHGZ2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DRHLJC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
