{"item_id": "B001DRNLE6", "title": "Cold Steel Brooklyn Crusher", "description": "After reading an article about how often baseball bats break during competitive play -- costing money, and sometime leading to injury -- Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson asked his team to create an indestructible bat. The result was the Brooklyn Crusher, a synthetic polypropylene bat that will never break, rot, crack, splinter, or fade. Smasher can be used as a competition bat, for batting practice, and even at-home self defense.Specifications29-inch lengthTwo-pound, one-ounce weightDurable polypropylene materialWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Brooklyn Crusher After reading an article about how often baseball bats break during competitive play -- costing money, and sometime leading to injury -- Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson asked his team to create an indestructible bat. The result was the Brooklyn Crusher, a synthetic polypropylene bat that will never break, rot, crack, splinter, or fade. Smasher can be used as a competition bat, for batting practice, and even at-home self defense.Specifications29-inch lengthTwo-pound, one-ounce weightDurable polypropylene materialWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dIWsjEzwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DRNLE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Bats", "Standard Bats"]], "price": 28.59}}
{"item_id": "B001DSIJQ0", "title": "Deluxe Emergency Kit w/ Honey Bucket - 4 Person - KEX4P", "description": "This four (4) person kit includes: 1 Honey Bucket w/Lid, 4 2400-Calorie Food Bars, 4 Solar Blankets, 24 Pouches of Water, 4 Dust Masks, 4 Ponchos, 1 12-Pack of Liners, 6 Wet Naps, 1 12-hour Light Stick, 1 T-5 Chemical Toilet Disinfectant, 1 Roll of Duct Tape, 1 Gas & Water Shut Off Tool, 1 Pry Bar, 1 54-Piece First Aid Kit, 1 Dynamo Flashlight/Radio, 1 Pair of Gloves, 1 Utility Knife, 1 Whistle and 50 Water Purification Tablets.", "text": "Deluxe Emergency Kit w/ Honey Bucket - 4 Person - KEX4P This four (4) person kit includes: 1 Honey Bucket w/Lid, 4 2400-Calorie Food Bars, 4 Solar Blankets, 24 Pouches of Water, 4 Dust Masks, 4 Ponchos, 1 12-Pack of Liners, 6 Wet Naps, 1 12-hour Light Stick, 1 T-5 Chemical Toilet Disinfectant, 1 Roll of Duct Tape, 1 Gas & Water Shut Off Tool, 1 Pry Bar, 1 54-Piece First Aid Kit, 1 Dynamo Flashlight/Radio, 1 Pair of Gloves, 1 Utility Knife, 1 Whistle and 50 Water Purification Tablets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/610YNmzeIUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DSIJQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mayday", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DSYO14", "title": "Set 3 Ninja Stealth Silver Throwing Knives with Nylon Case", "description": "These throwing knives are great for practicing your throwing technique. The sport of throwing knives is becoming more and more popular as people realize the fun and excitement of being able to land a knife exactly where you want it. These inexpensive throwing knives are ideal for beginners and those just getting interested in the sport. They're sturdy enough and balanced enough to practice with. While perfecting your throwing technique, you will be able to make these knives stick whenever you want. The set of three throwing knives comes with a case that you can keep them in. Carry on your belt or in your backpack. When camping, bust them out and practice learning your new skill 6\" overall (knife) Features included: Set of three knives Black Nylon sheath included Circle loop on the end of the knife Blade measures 2.75 inches 100% 440 stainless steel construction", "text": "Set 3 Ninja Stealth Silver Throwing Knives with Nylon Case These throwing knives are great for practicing your throwing technique. The sport of throwing knives is becoming more and more popular as people realize the fun and excitement of being able to land a knife exactly where you want it. These inexpensive throwing knives are ideal for beginners and those just getting interested in the sport. They're sturdy enough and balanced enough to practice with. While perfecting your throwing technique, you will be able to make these knives stick whenever you want. The set of three throwing knives comes with a case that you can keep them in. Carry on your belt or in your backpack. When camping, bust them out and practice learning your new skill 6\" overall (knife) Features included: Set of three knives Black Nylon sheath included Circle loop on the end of the knife Blade measures 2.75 inches 100% 440 stainless steel construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BqrrcwEmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DSYO14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 7.75}}
