{"item_id": "B001DVVECS", "title": "9.6V 2000mAh Nunchuck NiMH Battery Packs for Airsoft Gun", "description": "Features and Benefits Product 9.6V NiMH 2000mAh Nun Chuck Battery Pack Make Made of 8 pcs special NiMH AA 10C High Current 2000 mAh Cells, enabling 20A maximal current drain. Guarantee Continuous Shooting Connector MiNi Tamiya male connector assembled with 16 AWG 4\" long wire Feature - Twice longer firing time than original NiCd Battery - Rapidly charge up and long cycle life - Applications: Stock or Mod spring guns, TM M4 Weight 0.52 lb Dimensions 102mm(4\") Length; 29.1mm(1.15\")Width;14.7mm(0.58\") Thickness each side Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "text": "9.6V 2000mAh Nunchuck NiMH Battery Packs for Airsoft Gun Features and Benefits Product 9.6V NiMH 2000mAh Nun Chuck Battery Pack Make Made of 8 pcs special NiMH AA 10C High Current 2000 mAh Cells, enabling 20A maximal current drain. Guarantee Continuous Shooting Connector MiNi Tamiya male connector assembled with 16 AWG 4\" long wire Feature - Twice longer firing time than original NiCd Battery - Rapidly charge up and long cycle life - Applications: Stock or Mod spring guns, TM M4 Weight 0.52 lb Dimensions 102mm(4\") Length; 29.1mm(1.15\")Width;14.7mm(0.58\") Thickness each side Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pRkG4xBzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DVVECS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tenergy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Batteries"]], "price": 17.85}}
{"item_id": "B001DWNK1A", "title": "Kryptonite 180111 New York Black/Yellow 16mm Long Shackle U-Lock", "description": "Big city riders need big city protection, as would-be thieves aren't intimidated by just any lock. Enter the Kryptonite New York LS U-lock, which features a 16mm hardened Max-Performance steel shackle designed to resist bolt cutters and leverage attacks. Ideal for anyone who lives in moderately high crime areas, the New York LS boasts an 11 ranking on the Kryptonite 1-12 comparison system, which ranks the varying levels of security within the company's product range. A lock that ranks 1 on the Kryptonite scale might work if you live in the burbs and have a Rottweiler parked next to your bike or motorcycle. However, city dwellers demand extreme protection, which is why the New York LS is built for serious deterrent security.The U-lock offers such additional security-enhancing features as a high-security disc-style cylinder; a double deadbolt locking system for extensive holding power; a protective vinyl coating; and a sliding dust cover that protects and extends the cylinder life. As a bonus, the lock comes with three keys, one of which is lighted with a high-intensity bulb that makes it easy to unlock the New York LS after dark. The New York LS U-lock measures 10.25 by 4 inches.The Legendary Durability of Kryptonite LocksThe first big test for Kryptonite locks came in 1972, when Kryptonite founder Michael Zane directed the Second Avenue Bicycle Shop in New York City to lock a three-speed bicycle to a signpost in Greenwich Village. Although thieves immediately stripped all of the bicycle's removable parts, the bicycle itself remained for 30 days and 30 nights. The Kryptonite lock and the bike frame were still in place, even though the lock had been attacked numerous times. The publicity gave Kryptonite the boost it needed and forever changed the face of bicycle security.Twenty-two years later, Kryptonite returned to the streets of the Big Apple to test its latest innovation, the New York lock. In April 1994, theNew York Postlaid down the ultimate challenge: Could Kryptonite's New York lock last 48 hours on the toughest streets of New York? In a city where more than 100,000 bikes are stolen each year, Kryptonite and thePostlocked a brand-new, bright green Univega road bike worth $600 to a parking meter in the East Village--the Bermuda Triangle of New York bicycle thievery. For a full 48 hours, the bike remained locked on the corner of Avenue A and 11th Street. Zane and Neil McDaid, director of product development and design for Kryptonite, watched from around the corner as the bike came under every possible means of assault, stumping thieves at every turn. After 48 hours the bike remained intact except for the gear derailleur, which had been stripped off. The lock showed definite signs of abuse, but it had not failed. The New York lock had met thePost's challenge.Not satisfied with the length of the test, Zane moved the bike to SoHo for another six days and, finally, uptown near the Lincoln Center. Even in these high-theft areas the properly locked bike lasted another three weeks before being pulled off the streets by Zane and McDaid. ThePostalso ran the New York lock through a battery of street tests using common bike theft tools: a 4-foot bolt cutter, a crowbar, and a hammer. The non-Kryptonite locks cracked in seconds, but all methods failed on the New York lock, even the monstrous bolt cutter, which was rendered useless with large dents in its jaws.About KryptoniteIn the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include power sports, hardware, and snow sports security. Through innovative product designs, cutting-edge marketing savvy, legendary customer service, and pure fanaticism for security, Kryptonite grew with a cult-like following. In 2001, the company that was started in a VW van was purchased by industry giant Ingersoll Rand and became a flagship brand in the company's Security Technologies sector. Publications such asBicycling,Fortune,The Wall Street Journal,US News & World Report, and a host of others continued to tout Kryptonite products as the best on the market.The company's dedication to its customers is best represented by its actions during the fall of 2004, when it was discovered that the industry-standard tubular cylinder could be compromised, at times, with a household item. Kryptonite flew into action, created a voluntary lock exchange program, and replaced more than 400,000 locks in 21 countries for free. In essence, the company redesigned the equivalent of nine years worth of new products in just 10 short months. Kryptonite is the only company in the world that offered such a comprehensive plan to customers, taking its \"legendary customer service\" pledge to new heights.", "text": "Kryptonite 180111 New York Black/Yellow 16mm Long Shackle U-Lock Big city riders need big city protection, as would-be thieves aren't intimidated by just any lock. Enter the Kryptonite New York LS U-lock, which features a 16mm hardened Max-Performance steel shackle designed to resist bolt cutters and leverage attacks. Ideal for anyone who lives in moderately high crime areas, the New York LS boasts an 11 ranking on the Kryptonite 1-12 comparison system, which ranks the varying levels of security within the company's product range. A lock that ranks 1 on the Kryptonite scale might work if you live in the burbs and have a Rottweiler parked next to your bike or motorcycle. However, city dwellers demand extreme protection, which is why the New York LS is built for serious deterrent security.The U-lock offers such additional security-enhancing features as a high-security disc-style cylinder; a double deadbolt locking system for extensive holding power; a protective vinyl coating; and a sliding dust cover that protects and extends the cylinder life. As a bonus, the lock comes with three keys, one of which is lighted with a high-intensity bulb that makes it easy to unlock the New York LS after dark. The New York LS U-lock measures 10.25 by 4 inches.The Legendary Durability of Kryptonite LocksThe first big test for Kryptonite locks came in 1972, when Kryptonite founder Michael Zane directed the Second Avenue Bicycle Shop in New York City to lock a three-speed bicycle to a signpost in Greenwich Village. Although thieves immediately stripped all of the bicycle's removable parts, the bicycle itself remained for 30 days and 30 nights. The Kryptonite lock and the bike frame were still in place, even though the lock had been attacked numerous times. The publicity gave Kryptonite the boost it needed and forever changed the face of bicycle security.Twenty-two years later, Kryptonite returned to the streets of the Big Apple to test its latest innovation, the New York lock. In April 1994, theNew York Postlaid down the ultimate challenge: Could Kryptonite's New York lock last 48 hours on the toughest streets of New York? In a city where more than 100,000 bikes are stolen each year, Kryptonite and thePostlocked a brand-new, bright green Univega road bike worth $600 to a parking meter in the East Village--the Bermuda Triangle of New York bicycle thievery. For a full 48 hours, the bike remained locked on the corner of Avenue A and 11th Street. Zane and Neil McDaid, director of product development and design for Kryptonite, watched from around the corner as the bike came under every possible means of assault, stumping thieves at every turn. After 48 hours the bike remained intact except for the gear derailleur, which had been stripped off. The lock showed definite signs of abuse, but it had not failed. The New York lock had met thePost's challenge.Not satisfied with the length of the test, Zane moved the bike to SoHo for another six days and, finally, uptown near the Lincoln Center. Even in these high-theft areas the properly locked bike lasted another three weeks before being pulled off the streets by Zane and McDaid. ThePostalso ran the New York lock through a battery of street tests using common bike theft tools: a 4-foot bolt cutter, a crowbar, and a hammer. The non-Kryptonite locks cracked in seconds, but all methods failed on the New York lock, even the monstrous bolt cutter, which was rendered useless with large dents in its jaws.About KryptoniteIn the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include power sports, hardware, and snow sports security. Through innovative product designs, cutting-edge marketing savvy, legendary customer service, and pure fanaticism for security, Kryptonite grew with a cult-like following. In 2001, the company that was started in a VW van was purchased by industry giant Ingersoll Rand and became a flagship brand in the company's Security Technologies sector. Publications such asBicycling,Fortune,The Wall Street Journal,US News & World Report, and a host of others continued to tout Kryptonite products as the best on the market.The company's dedication to its customers is best represented by its actions during the fall of 2004, when it was discovered that the industry-standard tubular cylinder could be compromised, at times, with a household item. Kryptonite flew into action, created a voluntary lock exchange program, and replaced more than 400,000 locks in 21 countries for free. In essence, the company redesigned the equivalent of nine years worth of new products in just 10 short months. Kryptonite is the only company in the world that offered such a comprehensive plan to customers, taking its \"legendary customer service\" pledge to new heights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NVhSUmS9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DWNK1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DX5NLE", "title": "Cocoon Cotton TravelSheet", "description": "A Travel Sheet is an extremely lightweight and roomy sleep sack or sleeping bag liner. These versatile sheets are excellent as a warm weather sleeping bag or a rectangular sleeping bag liner. Compact and lightweight, Travel Sheets are ideal to bring to hotels, youth hostels, alpine huts, boats, planes, trains, or anywhere else you might travel. Fine yarn and a special weaving technique make our high quality cotton a very lightweight and durable fabric. It is breathable, very comfortable against your skin and creates a natural vapor balance. Cotton is machine washable and colorfast.", "text": "Cocoon Cotton TravelSheet A Travel Sheet is an extremely lightweight and roomy sleep sack or sleeping bag liner. These versatile sheets are excellent as a warm weather sleeping bag or a rectangular sleeping bag liner. Compact and lightweight, Travel Sheets are ideal to bring to hotels, youth hostels, alpine huts, boats, planes, trains, or anywhere else you might travel. Fine yarn and a special weaving technique make our high quality cotton a very lightweight and durable fabric. It is breathable, very comfortable against your skin and creates a natural vapor balance. Cotton is machine washable and colorfast.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vbpgx-9sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX5NLE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DX5O6I", "title": "Cocoon Silk MummyLiner", "description": "Our high quality silk is the optimum fabric for minimizing packing size and weight. Silk is soft against your skin and responds well to changing temperatures - it feels cool in the summer and is warm in the winter. Mummy Liners made of silk are easy to hand or machine wash and dry quickly. Woven with a grid-like structure of strong silk threads, Ripstop Silk is more durable and resistant to tearing than regular silk", "text": "Cocoon Silk MummyLiner Our high quality silk is the optimum fabric for minimizing packing size and weight. Silk is soft against your skin and responds well to changing temperatures - it feels cool in the summer and is warm in the winter. Mummy Liners made of silk are easy to hand or machine wash and dry quickly. Woven with a grid-like structure of strong silk threads, Ripstop Silk is more durable and resistant to tearing than regular silk", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ta7GbHoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX5O6I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 59.94}}
{"item_id": "B001DX699Y", "title": "Cocoon CoolMax MummyLiner", "description": "100% Polyester CoolMax is the fastest drying moisture management fabric. Its four-channel fibers move sweat away from your body. CoolMax is highly breathable and easy to care for. CoolMax MummyLiners wick moisture away from your body and keep you dry and comfortable. They do not have a side opening or a zipper for best performance.", "text": "Cocoon CoolMax MummyLiner 100% Polyester CoolMax is the fastest drying moisture management fabric. Its four-channel fibers move sweat away from your body. CoolMax is highly breathable and easy to care for. CoolMax MummyLiners wick moisture away from your body and keep you dry and comfortable. They do not have a side opening or a zipper for best performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310Xq2KYmkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX699Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DX7Q8W", "title": "Konus 7120 20x-60x80mm Spotting Scope with Tripod And Case", "description": "Take a closer look while hunting, shooting photos, or birdwatching with the Konus 20-60x80 spotting scope. Equipped with a powerful 20x to 60x magnification range and a large 80mm objective lens, the Konus scope delivers bright, crisp, high-quality images every time. The scope offers such additional features as a forward-expanding lens hood, a photo adapter, a tabletop tripod, and a tissue case.SpecificationsType: Zoom prismatic spotting scope with tripodMagnification: 20x to 60xObjective lens diameter: 80mmField of view: 157.2 feet @ 1,000 yards (20x)Exit pupil: 2.9mm (20x)Length: 16.8 inchesWeight: 54.7 ounces", "text": "Konus 7120 20x-60x80mm Spotting Scope with Tripod And Case Take a closer look while hunting, shooting photos, or birdwatching with the Konus 20-60x80 spotting scope. Equipped with a powerful 20x to 60x magnification range and a large 80mm objective lens, the Konus scope delivers bright, crisp, high-quality images every time. The scope offers such additional features as a forward-expanding lens hood, a photo adapter, a tabletop tripod, and a tissue case.SpecificationsType: Zoom prismatic spotting scope with tripodMagnification: 20x to 60xObjective lens diameter: 80mmField of view: 157.2 feet @ 1,000 yards (20x)Exit pupil: 2.9mm (20x)Length: 16.8 inchesWeight: 54.7 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MIhBfVJzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX7Q8W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Konus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 238.94}}
{"item_id": "B001DX81D6", "title": "Cocoon CoolMax Blanket", "description": "Ultra compact and lightweight Travel Blanket, The CoolMax TravelBlanket is the perfect companion on planes, trains, in your car and at home. It is small and lightweight enough to be carried along wherever you go. The blanket's special midweight CoolMax knit is warm, breathes well, wicks moisture away effectively and feels great on your skin. Size: 180x140 cm Weight: 320 g", "text": "Cocoon CoolMax Blanket Ultra compact and lightweight Travel Blanket, The CoolMax TravelBlanket is the perfect companion on planes, trains, in your car and at home. It is small and lightweight enough to be carried along wherever you go. The blanket's special midweight CoolMax knit is warm, breathes well, wicks moisture away effectively and feels great on your skin. Size: 180x140 cm Weight: 320 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z4TqMamEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX81D6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 29.04}}
{"item_id": "B001DX8NZ2", "title": "Cocoon Nylon Mesh Bag", "description": "Images and descriptions will be available Spring 2012. Contact your Sales Representative for more information.", "text": "Cocoon Nylon Mesh Bag Images and descriptions will be available Spring 2012. Contact your Sales Representative for more information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yCbiqtLdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX8NZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]], "price": 12.19}}
{"item_id": "B001DX8NZC", "title": "Cocoon Sleeping Bag Storage Bag", "description": "Storing your sleeping bag in a small stuff sack is like keeping your Alaskan malamute in a tiny cage. Your dog and your sleeping bag need to be free, so when you're not on the trail, stash your sleeping bag in the Cocoon Sleeping Bag Storage Bag--it will preserve the life, loft, and temperature rating of your bag. A drawstring closure with cord lock keeps your sleeping bag from spilling out. And one more thing--for crying out loud, let your poor dog out of its cage.", "text": "Cocoon Sleeping Bag Storage Bag Storing your sleeping bag in a small stuff sack is like keeping your Alaskan malamute in a tiny cage. Your dog and your sleeping bag need to be free, so when you're not on the trail, stash your sleeping bag in the Cocoon Sleeping Bag Storage Bag--it will preserve the life, loft, and temperature rating of your bag. A drawstring closure with cord lock keeps your sleeping bag from spilling out. And one more thing--for crying out loud, let your poor dog out of its cage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tDDrIFYGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DX8NZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]], "price": 9.3}}
{"item_id": "B001DXCSSK", "title": "Cocoon Air-Core Pillow Ultralight", "description": "The Cocoon Air-Core Pillow Ultralight combines the comfort and support of superior synthetic pillows with minimal packing size. It features an inflatable air core underneath a layer of premium synthetic fill for a restful sleep.Size: 13\"x17\"..Weight 3.7 oz..4\" thick.", "text": "Cocoon Air-Core Pillow Ultralight The Cocoon Air-Core Pillow Ultralight combines the comfort and support of superior synthetic pillows with minimal packing size. It features an inflatable air core underneath a layer of premium synthetic fill for a restful sleep.Size: 13\"x17\"..Weight 3.7 oz..4\" thick.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h3k%2BWQ50L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DXCSSK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cocoon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DYF8C2", "title": "Jing Gong G608 Airsoft Electric Gun K36c AEG", "description": "Jing Gong has done it again with a high quality airsoft electric gun. You’ll dominate the play field with this solid and accurate AEG. This is one of the most popular airsoft guns on the market. Once you load up and start shooting you'll see why!Mil Specs:Heavy Grade ABS BodyMetal Type 3 Gearbox, 7mm bearing versionAdjustable Hop-upSide Fold Stock For CQBWorking Charging HandleStackable Hi-Cap MagazineLower front metal rail350 FPS, accurate up to 120 feet8.4v - 1100mah Battery and Charger400 Rounds Hicap MagazineBuilt in RIS SystemCompatible With CA and TM partsPackage Includes: AEG, Hi-Cap Magazine, Clearing Rod, Battery, Charger, and Starter BB pack.", "text": "Jing Gong G608 Airsoft Electric Gun K36c AEG Jing Gong has done it again with a high quality airsoft electric gun. You’ll dominate the play field with this solid and accurate AEG. This is one of the most popular airsoft guns on the market. Once you load up and start shooting you'll see why!Mil Specs:Heavy Grade ABS BodyMetal Type 3 Gearbox, 7mm bearing versionAdjustable Hop-upSide Fold Stock For CQBWorking Charging HandleStackable Hi-Cap MagazineLower front metal rail350 FPS, accurate up to 120 feet8.4v - 1100mah Battery and Charger400 Rounds Hicap MagazineBuilt in RIS SystemCompatible With CA and TM partsPackage Includes: AEG, Hi-Cap Magazine, Clearing Rod, Battery, Charger, and Starter BB pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CLssbYpML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DYF8C2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jing Gong", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 151.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DZM482", "title": "Fallkniven A1 Survival Knife", "description": "Fallkniven A1 Survival Knife. 11 1/8\" overall. 6 3/8\" laminate VG-10 stainless modified spear point blade with satin finish. Black checkered Kraton handle with visible tang end and lanyard hole. Black nylon and Zytel sheath. Model A1 is a semi-large all-purpose knife for heavy duty use. The powerful blade is made of extremely hard yet tough laminated VG10 steel and will withstand the stress of hard use. The knife is superb to chop with, but also works very well with daily tasks, thanks to the ergonomic grip. The full tang goes entirely through the handle, so you can strike the end of it without breaking the grip. The sturdy black zytel sheath allows you to fasten the knife on your belt or your pack - even upside down. Fallkniven A1 is a water repelling concept which works just as well in extreme cold as in stifling heat.", "text": "Fallkniven A1 Survival Knife Fallkniven A1 Survival Knife. 11 1/8\" overall. 6 3/8\" laminate VG-10 stainless modified spear point blade with satin finish. Black checkered Kraton handle with visible tang end and lanyard hole. Black nylon and Zytel sheath. Model A1 is a semi-large all-purpose knife for heavy duty use. The powerful blade is made of extremely hard yet tough laminated VG10 steel and will withstand the stress of hard use. The knife is superb to chop with, but also works very well with daily tasks, thanks to the ergonomic grip. The full tang goes entirely through the handle, so you can strike the end of it without breaking the grip. The sturdy black zytel sheath allows you to fasten the knife on your belt or your pack - even upside down. Fallkniven A1 is a water repelling concept which works just as well in extreme cold as in stifling heat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bqt9th2xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZM482.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fallkniven", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 196.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DZM89C", "title": "Meyerco Combination Axe Machete (12-Inch)", "description": "Few tools are as versatile and functional as a good machete. Whether you are hunting, camping, working in your backyard, or surviving in the deepest jungle, nothing is handier or more useful. Staring with durable, spring-tempered blades of corrosion-resistant 420 stainless steel, they add an injection-molded textured rubber handle with a unique D-guard. This guard not only protects your hand during demanding chopping chores, it also ensures a positive grip and unparalleled control of the blade. A unique relief cut in the guard design also provides a thumb rest for more comfortable horizontal cutting strokes. Comes complete with a durable nylon sheath and a wrist lanyard for additional safety. Meyerco machetes are a force to be reckoned with!", "text": "Meyerco Combination Axe Machete (12-Inch) Few tools are as versatile and functional as a good machete. Whether you are hunting, camping, working in your backyard, or surviving in the deepest jungle, nothing is handier or more useful. Staring with durable, spring-tempered blades of corrosion-resistant 420 stainless steel, they add an injection-molded textured rubber handle with a unique D-guard. This guard not only protects your hand during demanding chopping chores, it also ensures a positive grip and unparalleled control of the blade. A unique relief cut in the guard design also provides a thumb rest for more comfortable horizontal cutting strokes. Comes complete with a durable nylon sheath and a wrist lanyard for additional safety. Meyerco machetes are a force to be reckoned with!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416WqYCF5xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZM89C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meyerco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 22.23}}
{"item_id": "B001DZNYFE", "title": "Texsport Ajustable Tent Pole", "description": "The Texsport Adjustable tentpole gives you strength and flexibility for a variety of camping needs. Works with any tarp or camping material with grommets such as cabin tents, screen arbors, and dining canopies. Galvanized steel pole adjusts from 3'2\" to 8'. Height and tension maintained with friction lock. 3/4\" diameter 3-pole system fits into included bag.", "text": "Texsport Ajustable Tent Pole The Texsport Adjustable tentpole gives you strength and flexibility for a variety of camping needs. Works with any tarp or camping material with grommets such as cabin tents, screen arbors, and dining canopies. Galvanized steel pole adjusts from 3'2\" to 8'. Height and tension maintained with friction lock. 3/4\" diameter 3-pole system fits into included bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BqLywWblL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZNYFE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001DZO2TG", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2030 Crawford Triumph N.E.C.K Fixed blade", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Triumph N.E.C.K. (No-nonsense Emergency Compact Knife) is based on the same beefy 0.14-inch thick blade used on the Triumph Folder. In this case it is a full-tang skeletonized design, with recurved dual-grind Tanto to aid cutting and a false top edge grind for penetrating power.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2030 Crawford Triumph N.E.C.K Fixed blade Columbia River Knife and Tool's Triumph N.E.C.K. (No-nonsense Emergency Compact Knife) is based on the same beefy 0.14-inch thick blade used on the Triumph Folder. In this case it is a full-tang skeletonized design, with recurved dual-grind Tanto to aid cutting and a false top edge grind for penetrating power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mzrIcmqOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZO2TG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DZO4U8", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 9095 4-3/4-Inch Multi-Tool Get-A-Way-Driver Torx Set", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 9094 Get-A-Way Driver designed by Launce Barber and Tom Stokes as part of our innovative I.D. Works line of tools has dozens of everyday uses for the craftsman or hobbyist. As a compact screwdriver, it has four standard flat and Phillips hex bits to tackle almost any job. Each of the hex bits has a spring-loaded ball detent to keep it in the holder, and a fingernail groove to aid bit removal. You can also use it as an angle driver when the going gets tough by moving the bit adapter to the hex driver wrench. Just push the button and it's a bright little LED flashlight, especially useful when working in low light. It has an oxygen bottle wrench on the underside, which makes it useful for emergency rescue use. There are also 10 mm wrench and hex bit wrench reliefs. The pry bar on the underside works well to open bottles and jar lids, among other things. It's also removable if you want. The hex bit driver adapter lets you use all of the full-size hex bits with the CRKT Zilla-Tool Jr., too.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 9095 4-3/4-Inch Multi-Tool Get-A-Way-Driver Torx Set Columbia River Knife and Tool's 9094 Get-A-Way Driver designed by Launce Barber and Tom Stokes as part of our innovative I.D. Works line of tools has dozens of everyday uses for the craftsman or hobbyist. As a compact screwdriver, it has four standard flat and Phillips hex bits to tackle almost any job. Each of the hex bits has a spring-loaded ball detent to keep it in the holder, and a fingernail groove to aid bit removal. You can also use it as an angle driver when the going gets tough by moving the bit adapter to the hex driver wrench. Just push the button and it's a bright little LED flashlight, especially useful when working in low light. It has an oxygen bottle wrench on the underside, which makes it useful for emergency rescue use. There are also 10 mm wrench and hex bit wrench reliefs. The pry bar on the underside works well to open bottles and jar lids, among other things. It's also removable if you want. The hex bit driver adapter lets you use all of the full-size hex bits with the CRKT Zilla-Tool Jr., too.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d8j3EwfpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZO4U8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports"]], "price": 12.83}}
{"item_id": "B001DZO5G6", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-02G Black Folding Work Knife with Razor Sharp Edge Blade", "description": "M21-02G G10 Work Knife made by Columbia River Knife and Tool has a 3-Inch 8Cr14 stainless steel Razor Sharp Edge blade in a swedged, recurved spear point design with a non-reflective black titanium nitride finish. This folding knife has an InterFrame build with stainless steel liner and G10 scales. It features the Carson Flipper blade extension and the patented AutoLawks system.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-02G Black Folding Work Knife with Razor Sharp Edge Blade M21-02G G10 Work Knife made by Columbia River Knife and Tool has a 3-Inch 8Cr14 stainless steel Razor Sharp Edge blade in a swedged, recurved spear point design with a non-reflective black titanium nitride finish. This folding knife has an InterFrame build with stainless steel liner and G10 scales. It features the Carson Flipper blade extension and the patented AutoLawks system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213lmeWYHjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZO5G6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 35.01}}
{"item_id": "B001DZO5TS", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Keyper Pouch", "description": "Product Details Product Features Overall: 4.25 in x 1 in Belt: 2 in Quick Release Loop Color Options: Black / Green / Khaki / Foliage Green The Keyper is an advanced key retention system that allows quick belt attachment and detachment with Velcro, adjusts to fit various belt widths. Our own proprietary alloy snap hook holds keys or a pair of gloves. Includes heavy duty key ring. Product classification: Tactical key holder, duty key keeper Government Sales All Maxpedition nylon products are GSA compliant and available for purchase at GSA Advantage.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Keyper Pouch Product Details Product Features Overall: 4.25 in x 1 in Belt: 2 in Quick Release Loop Color Options: Black / Green / Khaki / Foliage Green The Keyper is an advanced key retention system that allows quick belt attachment and detachment with Velcro, adjusts to fit various belt widths. Our own proprietary alloy snap hook holds keys or a pair of gloves. Includes heavy duty key ring. Product classification: Tactical key holder, duty key keeper Government Sales All Maxpedition nylon products are GSA compliant and available for purchase at GSA Advantage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nxBNUixgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZO5TS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001DZPH9A", "title": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strips Pair Black", "description": "Speed Strips - 580 Speed Strips (Per Each)Manufacture ID: 20054Features:- Holds 6 rounds (.38/.357) - Loads two at a time- Compact and convenient - Per EachWarranty: In accordance withthe provisions of the California Song-Beverly Consumer Warranty Act the product is sold AS IS and WITH ALL FAULTS. Should the product prove defective the buyer assumes the entire risk of all necessary servicing orrepair.", "text": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strips Pair Black Speed Strips - 580 Speed Strips (Per Each)Manufacture ID: 20054Features:- Holds 6 rounds (.38/.357) - Loads two at a time- Compact and convenient - Per EachWarranty: In accordance withthe provisions of the California Song-Beverly Consumer Warranty Act the product is sold AS IS and WITH ALL FAULTS. Should the product prove defective the buyer assumes the entire risk of all necessary servicing orrepair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L6wcI6w4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZPH9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 9.39}}
{"item_id": "B001DZPZW4", "title": "Blackhawk High Ride Duty Belt Loop", "description": "only works with 2\" and 2 1/4\" duty belts. does not come with slide holders to allow for wear with smaller belts. this belt loop attachment allows you to move your holster higher on your duty belt. works with any level duty holster.", "text": "Blackhawk High Ride Duty Belt Loop only works with 2\" and 2 1/4\" duty belts. does not come with slide holders to allow for wear with smaller belts. this belt loop attachment allows you to move your holster higher on your duty belt. works with any level duty holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ivDttlx2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZPZW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B001DZQWYE", "title": "Tom Brown Tracker, Gray Micarta Handle, Black Blade, Kydex Model TBT-010", "description": "Features: 2.50\" saw back. Black traction coating on blade. 7.63\" gray linen Micarta handle. 4.25\" blade of 1095 high carbon alloy. Comes complete with a Kydex heavy-duty LBE sheath designed to carry the Tracker in the horizontal position with the cutting edge facing down. Blade Detail: Plain Edge. Blade Length (inches): 5.50. Blade Material: Carbon Steel, Black. Carry System: Kydex Sheath. Handle Material: Micarta. Overall Length (inches): 11.87.", "text": "Tom Brown Tracker, Gray Micarta Handle, Black Blade, Kydex Model TBT-010 Features: 2.50\" saw back. Black traction coating on blade. 7.63\" gray linen Micarta handle. 4.25\" blade of 1095 high carbon alloy. Comes complete with a Kydex heavy-duty LBE sheath designed to carry the Tracker in the horizontal position with the cutting edge facing down. Blade Detail: Plain Edge. Blade Length (inches): 5.50. Blade Material: Carbon Steel, Black. Carry System: Kydex Sheath. Handle Material: Micarta. Overall Length (inches): 11.87.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21LuGPU5F5L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZQWYE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 214.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DZR4NC", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 6470 Pazoda 2 Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Pazoda 2 made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a stylish frame-lock folder with a premium 8Cr14MoV razor edge titanium nitride coated blade. This smaller model has a stainless steel frame and is titanium coated and brushed finish on the outer surface", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 6470 Pazoda 2 Razor Edge Knife Pazoda 2 made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a stylish frame-lock folder with a premium 8Cr14MoV razor edge titanium nitride coated blade. This smaller model has a stainless steel frame and is titanium coated and brushed finish on the outer surface", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MF%2Bk7CGJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZR4NC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 7.59}}
{"item_id": "B001DZR5D6", "title": "Maxpedition Jumbo Versipack", "description": "The long awaited JUMBO Versipack (#0412) fulfills the multitude of requests for (1) a larger Fatboy with more bells and whistles, and (2) an effective concealed carry system utilizing the Fatboy shoulder sling concept.", "text": "Maxpedition Jumbo Versipack The long awaited JUMBO Versipack (#0412) fulfills the multitude of requests for (1) a larger Fatboy with more bells and whistles, and (2) an effective concealed carry system utilizing the Fatboy shoulder sling concept.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IGtBnQU8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZR5D6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 80.91}}
{"item_id": "B001DZT0M0", "title": "", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Swiss Army One-Hand Trekker pocketknife, a compact set of tools for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring 4-3/8 inches long, this version of the One-Hand Trekker is stylishly cased in a black housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. More importantly, the unit contains several handy Swiss Army tools, including a serrated locking blade that opens and closes easily, a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripper, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a Phillips screwdriver, a toothpick, tweezers, a reamer, a wood saw, and a key ring. As with all Victorinox items, the One-Hand Trekker is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The One-Hand Trekker carries a lifetime warranty.About Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Swiss Army One-Hand Trekker pocketknife, a compact set of tools for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring 4-3/8 inches long, this version of the One-Hand Trekker is stylishly cased in a black housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. More importantly, the unit contains several handy Swiss Army tools, including a serrated locking blade that opens and closes easily, a bottle opener with a large locking screwdriver and wire stripper, a can opener with a small screwdriver, a Phillips screwdriver, a toothpick, tweezers, a reamer, a wood saw, and a key ring. As with all Victorinox items, the One-Hand Trekker is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The One-Hand Trekker carries a lifetime warranty.About Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M34lY8o%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZT0M0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 36.19}}
{"item_id": "B001DZT21O", "title": "Spyderco Civilian", "description": "In the 1990s Spyderco was approached by a specialized branch of U.S. law enforcement about making a knife for their undercover agents. These plain-clothed Law Enforcement Officers found themselves in situations where they often could not carry a firearm but carrying a knife was not a problem. Most had no formal training in self-defense tactics or MBC (Martial Blade Craft) but as a last resort could use a blade to protect or extricate themselves from a life-threatening situation. This was how the Civilian model came to be. The Civilian has a patented reverse \"S\" blade that's intended to be used like an oversized claw. The tip is ground to an ultra-thin profile. Because of its distinctly specialized features it is not intended or designed for general utility or everyday use. These are stock photos. Damaged Box Lot. This knife does not come with the box or case.", "text": "Spyderco Civilian In the 1990s Spyderco was approached by a specialized branch of U.S. law enforcement about making a knife for their undercover agents. These plain-clothed Law Enforcement Officers found themselves in situations where they often could not carry a firearm but carrying a knife was not a problem. Most had no formal training in self-defense tactics or MBC (Martial Blade Craft) but as a last resort could use a blade to protect or extricate themselves from a life-threatening situation. This was how the Civilian model came to be. The Civilian has a patented reverse \"S\" blade that's intended to be used like an oversized claw. The tip is ground to an ultra-thin profile. Because of its distinctly specialized features it is not intended or designed for general utility or everyday use. These are stock photos. Damaged Box Lot. This knife does not come with the box or case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m4tMpNdLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZT21O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 152.09}}
{"item_id": "B001DZT4WQ", "title": "Cold Steel Pocket Bushman with Stainless Handle", "description": "While it's physically impossible for any folding knife to ever match the strength and rigidity of a fixed blade, we believe our Pocket Bushman, with its new patent pending lock, is close to hitting the mark. The blade is long and wide with a short, sharp, clip point for usefulness and versatility. And it's hollow ground from top to bottom with just enough belly to be useful for all sorts of tasks.For the handle, we used the mono block construction method famously used in the French Douk Douk line of knives. There are several advantages to using the mono block. It's simple to mass-produce, and, since there are no liners, handle scales or back spacers, the end result is quite affordable. A single sheet of stainless steel is folded in half to form a housing for the closed blade, as well as supplying the enormous strength and rigidity required to compliment our Ram Safe™ lock.", "text": "Cold Steel Pocket Bushman with Stainless Handle While it's physically impossible for any folding knife to ever match the strength and rigidity of a fixed blade, we believe our Pocket Bushman, with its new patent pending lock, is close to hitting the mark. The blade is long and wide with a short, sharp, clip point for usefulness and versatility. And it's hollow ground from top to bottom with just enough belly to be useful for all sorts of tasks.For the handle, we used the mono block construction method famously used in the French Douk Douk line of knives. There are several advantages to using the mono block. It's simple to mass-produce, and, since there are no liners, handle scales or back spacers, the end result is quite affordable. A single sheet of stainless steel is folded in half to form a housing for the closed blade, as well as supplying the enormous strength and rigidity required to compliment our Ram Safe™ lock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pN8o678xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZT4WQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 27.13}}
{"item_id": "B001DZT8BS", "title": "Maxpedition Universal CCW Holster (Black)", "description": "Maxpedition Modular Universal CCW Holster - Black 3501B", "text": "Maxpedition Universal CCW Holster (Black) Maxpedition Modular Universal CCW Holster - Black 3501B", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414IiUlz7sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZT8BS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 5.57}}
{"item_id": "B001DZTKJI", "title": "Maxpedition Black Dual Mag Retention Insert - MAX3503B-P", "description": "The Dual Mag Retention Insert attaches onto the loop field present in the CCW compartment of a variety of Maxpedition packs. Two retention loops of 2\" wide elastic each hold up to two single stack . 45 mags or a double stacked mag. The loops works just as well with multitools, flashlights, batons, pepper spray, etc.", "text": "Maxpedition Black Dual Mag Retention Insert - MAX3503B-P The Dual Mag Retention Insert attaches onto the loop field present in the CCW compartment of a variety of Maxpedition packs. Two retention loops of 2\" wide elastic each hold up to two single stack . 45 mags or a double stacked mag. The loops works just as well with multitools, flashlights, batons, pepper spray, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qyNZlY1JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZTKJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 9.97}}
{"item_id": "B001DZTM4Q", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool's M16-14DSFG Special Forces Big Dog Desert Combo Edge Knife with Tan Tanto Blade, Desert Tan", "description": "M16-14DSFG Special Forces Big Dog G10 made by Columbia River Knife & Tool is a 3.875-Inch Tanto blade combo edge knife. This knife which has a premium 8Cr14 stainless steel blade was designed for military use in desert environments. It features easy one hand opening, open stainless steel InterFrame with Desert Tan scales of G10, dual grind Tanto blade in Desert Tan with titanium nitride coating and AutoLawks system.", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool's M16-14DSFG Special Forces Big Dog Desert Combo Edge Knife with Tan Tanto Blade, Desert Tan M16-14DSFG Special Forces Big Dog G10 made by Columbia River Knife & Tool is a 3.875-Inch Tanto blade combo edge knife. This knife which has a premium 8Cr14 stainless steel blade was designed for military use in desert environments. It features easy one hand opening, open stainless steel InterFrame with Desert Tan scales of G10, dual grind Tanto blade in Desert Tan with titanium nitride coating and AutoLawks system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QkmjXO1FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZTM4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 52.95}}
{"item_id": "B001DZTQE2", "title": "Fobus Single Mag Pouch, Glock 9&40, H&K 9&40, G.A.P. .45 3901G", "description": "Fobus Single Mag Pouch, Glock 9&40, H&K; 9&40, G.A.P. .45 3901G", "text": "Fobus Single Mag Pouch, Glock 9&40, H&K 9&40, G.A.P. .45 3901G Fobus Single Mag Pouch, Glock 9&40, H&K; 9&40, G.A.P. .45 3901G", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nvEBAiMgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZTQE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 20.41}}
{"item_id": "B001DZV2R6", "title": "Kershaw Scallion Frame Lock Knife", "description": "The Kershaw Scallion series features a contoured, elegant design that ensures a comfortable grip and a stylish look. Built with the latest SpeedSafe technology, this knife offers smooth, one-handed manual assisted opening via the thumb stud or finger protrusion and locks into place. The 410 steel handle has a contoured shape that fits nicely into the hand. Choose between serrated or smooth edge.", "text": "Kershaw Scallion Frame Lock Knife The Kershaw Scallion series features a contoured, elegant design that ensures a comfortable grip and a stylish look. Built with the latest SpeedSafe technology, this knife offers smooth, one-handed manual assisted opening via the thumb stud or finger protrusion and locks into place. The 410 steel handle has a contoured shape that fits nicely into the hand. Choose between serrated or smooth edge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zUOxXgFEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZV2R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 36.98}}
{"item_id": "B001DZV3BG", "title": "Ontario 8628 RTAK II Knife (Green)", "description": "The Ontario Knife RTAK II Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 5160 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Foliage green textured and powder coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 54-56 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales rounded for comfort. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "text": "Ontario 8628 RTAK II Knife (Green) The Ontario Knife RTAK II Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 5160 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Foliage green textured and powder coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 54-56 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales rounded for comfort. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21sbH83aILL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001DZV3BG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 92.2}}
