{"item_id": "B001E4E156", "title": "5.11 PUSH Pack", "description": "PUSH, short for Practical Utility Shoulder Hold, is built from rugged 1050D nylon and features a large main compartment with two side-expanding pockets. The side pockets are sized to hold one-liter water bottles. A zippered pocket behind the main compartment has loop-sided Velcro to hold Back-Up-Belt System pouches or any other hook sided pouch.", "text": "5.11 PUSH Pack PUSH, short for Practical Utility Shoulder Hold, is built from rugged 1050D nylon and features a large main compartment with two side-expanding pockets. The side pockets are sized to hold one-liter water bottles. A zippered pocket behind the main compartment has loop-sided Velcro to hold Back-Up-Belt System pouches or any other hook sided pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41he3EX8LkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E4E156.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 53.99}}
{"item_id": "B001E4XL3E", "title": "We Sell Mats Interlocking Anti-Fatigue EVA Foam Floor Mat", "description": "Our interlocking foam tiles are made from premium EVA foam. Similar to a flip flop, the EVA foam provides a durable soft floor surface for exercise rooms, gyms, weight rooms, trade shows, martial arts and more. All EVA tiles are soft and resilient but not sponge like. There are several colors to choose from so feel free to mix and match. Borders are included.", "text": "We Sell Mats Interlocking Anti-Fatigue EVA Foam Floor Mat Our interlocking foam tiles are made from premium EVA foam. Similar to a flip flop, the EVA foam provides a durable soft floor surface for exercise rooms, gyms, weight rooms, trade shows, martial arts and more. All EVA tiles are soft and resilient but not sponge like. There are several colors to choose from so feel free to mix and match. Borders are included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sglLbBBgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E4XL3E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 27.41}}
{"item_id": "B001E5C0L2", "title": "US Army Alpha Black Tactical Paintball Marker Gun Sniper Set - Black", "description": "This kit includes everything you need to get started playing paintball, including the Tippmann US Army Alpha Black Tactical marker, tank, loader, harness, extra paint tubes, neck guard, and goggles.The US Army Alpha Black Tactical marker offers durability, reliability, and realism at an affordable price. The marker features an M16-style, six-position collapsible stock and shroud with built-in sight. An 11-inch barrel, integrated carry handle, and removable magazine that doubles as a tool kit add to the overall military appearance. Additional features include an inline bolt system, all-aluminum die-cast receiver, stainless steel gas line, and quick-release feeder elbow.", "text": "US Army Alpha Black Tactical Paintball Marker Gun Sniper Set - Black This kit includes everything you need to get started playing paintball, including the Tippmann US Army Alpha Black Tactical marker, tank, loader, harness, extra paint tubes, neck guard, and goggles.The US Army Alpha Black Tactical marker offers durability, reliability, and realism at an affordable price. The marker features an M16-style, six-position collapsible stock and shroud with built-in sight. An 11-inch barrel, integrated carry handle, and removable magazine that doubles as a tool kit add to the overall military appearance. Additional features include an inline bolt system, all-aluminum die-cast receiver, stainless steel gas line, and quick-release feeder elbow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510VIL2wR7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E5C0L2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Complete Paintball Sets"]], "price": 194.0}}
{"item_id": "B001E696WM", "title": "Uvex S3200X Genesis Safety Eyewear, Black Frame, Clear UV Extreme Anti-Fog Lens", "description": "The Uvex Genesis is the best selling safety eyewear in the world, offering the best in comfort, protection and style. Built with patented Multi-Material Technology and a high level of adjustablilty, the Uvex Genesis delivers a broad range of superior benefits. Genesis provides workers with extraordinary all-day comfort and raises the bar on compliance. Made in the USA.", "text": "Uvex S3200X Genesis Safety Eyewear, Black Frame, Clear UV Extreme Anti-Fog Lens The Uvex Genesis is the best selling safety eyewear in the world, offering the best in comfort, protection and style. Built with patented Multi-Material Technology and a high level of adjustablilty, the Uvex Genesis delivers a broad range of superior benefits. Genesis provides workers with extraordinary all-day comfort and raises the bar on compliance. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Of8EJNjPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E696WM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uvex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Sunglasses"]], "price": 10.05}}
{"item_id": "B001E6K7V6", "title": "Nalgene HDPE Wide Mouth Bottle", "description": "Made from HDPE (high-density polyethylene) these bottles are very lightweight and durable making them great for backpacking. Wide mouth opening (63 mm) makes them easy to fill with ice or clean.", "text": "Nalgene HDPE Wide Mouth Bottle Made from HDPE (high-density polyethylene) these bottles are very lightweight and durable making them great for backpacking. Wide mouth opening (63 mm) makes them easy to fill with ice or clean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-SJkNVakL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E6K7V6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001E6L9XQ", "title": "Ektelon Fireball Racquetballs Red - 3 ball can", "description": "USA Racquetball approved Designed for fast action play Designed for outdoor and indoor use Hot Red color enhances visability World Outdoor Racquetball approved", "text": "Ektelon Fireball Racquetballs Red - 3 ball can USA Racquetball approved Designed for fast action play Designed for outdoor and indoor use Hot Red color enhances visability World Outdoor Racquetball approved", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41479bvsdbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E6L9XQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ektelon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Racquetball", "Racquetballs"]], "price": 8.44}}
{"item_id": "B001E6LK62", "title": "Tasco Pronghorn 4x 32mm 30/30 Reticle Riflescope", "description": "Just because you don't pay a big price doesn't mean you can't see the big picture. With a 10% larger field of view than most standard scopes, the Tasco Pronghorn series delivers quite an eyeful. Its magenta multi-coating increases light transmission for bright, clear images and its fogproof, shockproof, waterproof construction is designed to make this little investment last a long time.", "text": "Tasco Pronghorn 4x 32mm 30/30 Reticle Riflescope Just because you don't pay a big price doesn't mean you can't see the big picture. With a 10% larger field of view than most standard scopes, the Tasco Pronghorn series delivers quite an eyeful. Its magenta multi-coating increases light transmission for bright, clear images and its fogproof, shockproof, waterproof construction is designed to make this little investment last a long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jkMvOtcPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E6LK62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tasco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 30.31}}
{"item_id": "B001E7S5BO", "title": "Light My Fire Titanium Spork", "description": "The most versatile outdoor eating utensil, the spoon-fork-knife combo makes eating--and cleaning up--on the go a breeze. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, the spork is perfect for your backpack, boat, picnic basket, lunchbox, purse, or briefcase. This spork is made of titanium, one of the toughest alloys on the planet, widely used in aircraft construction because of its lightness, extreme strength, and long-lasting durability. Its high biocompatibility means that it is also safe and non-toxic.Features:1 titanium sporkTough, lightweight, and long-lastingSame design as original SporkNon-corrosive, non-magneticHypoallergenic; non-toxicWeighs 17 grams", "text": "Light My Fire Titanium Spork The most versatile outdoor eating utensil, the spoon-fork-knife combo makes eating--and cleaning up--on the go a breeze. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, the spork is perfect for your backpack, boat, picnic basket, lunchbox, purse, or briefcase. This spork is made of titanium, one of the toughest alloys on the planet, widely used in aircraft construction because of its lightness, extreme strength, and long-lasting durability. Its high biocompatibility means that it is also safe and non-toxic.Features:1 titanium sporkTough, lightweight, and long-lastingSame design as original SporkNon-corrosive, non-magneticHypoallergenic; non-toxicWeighs 17 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zJirI5v9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E7S5BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 12.37}}
{"item_id": "B001E7S8JI", "title": "Light My Fire Salt & Pepper Plus Spice Storage and Dispenser with Three Waterproof Compartments", "description": "Spice is the variety of life, but how do you take it with you on an outing? The Light My Fire Salt & Pepper Plus has three separate waterproof, airtight and shock-resistant compartments that can store and dispense spices. It even floats. Perfect for camping, paddling, picnics or your office desk. Great for medications as well. Designed in Sweden by Martin Pråme. 2.75 inches across by 1.25 inches high (70 x 31 mm). Weight 1.4 ounces (40 g).", "text": "Light My Fire Salt & Pepper Plus Spice Storage and Dispenser with Three Waterproof Compartments Spice is the variety of life, but how do you take it with you on an outing? The Light My Fire Salt & Pepper Plus has three separate waterproof, airtight and shock-resistant compartments that can store and dispense spices. It even floats. Perfect for camping, paddling, picnics or your office desk. Great for medications as well. Designed in Sweden by Martin Pråme. 2.75 inches across by 1.25 inches high (70 x 31 mm). Weight 1.4 ounces (40 g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316JC%2BNoTbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E7S8JI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 9.93}}
{"item_id": "B001E86YAM", "title": "S&W Power Glide Tanto Blade", "description": "S&W; POWER GLIDE 4.8 PLAIN BLACK TANTO BLADE WITH REVOLVING BELT CLIPBlade: 3.9 (9.9 cm)Steel: 400 Series Stainless SteelHandle: AluminumHandle: 5.6 (14.2 cm)Weight: 6.5 oz.", "text": "S&W Power Glide Tanto Blade S&W; POWER GLIDE 4.8 PLAIN BLACK TANTO BLADE WITH REVOLVING BELT CLIPBlade: 3.9 (9.9 cm)Steel: 400 Series Stainless SteelHandle: AluminumHandle: 5.6 (14.2 cm)Weight: 6.5 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ez-0HvmKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E86YAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B001E8AX22", "title": "Pelican 1550 Case with Foam for Camera (Desert Tan)", "description": "Pelican Protector Cases are made with Copolymer Polypropylene, using an open cell core and solid wall construction, which is stronger and lighter that the completion. You can tell its a Pelican case by the distinctive \"twin-ribbed\" top surface. Stainless steel pins are used for hinges and handles. The new Double-Throw latches are much easier to open.", "text": "Pelican 1550 Case with Foam for Camera (Desert Tan) Pelican Protector Cases are made with Copolymer Polypropylene, using an open cell core and solid wall construction, which is stronger and lighter that the completion. You can tell its a Pelican case by the distinctive \"twin-ribbed\" top surface. Stainless steel pins are used for hinges and handles. The new Double-Throw latches are much easier to open.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415bU3ScenL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8AX22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pelican", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 139.95}}
