{"item_id": "B001E8CUN2", "title": "Brunton Watchband Slider Waterproof Compass", "description": "The Brunton Watchband Slider is so small you wont know its there- unless you need it. This watchband compass is completely waterproof. It features the cardinal points and a rotating disc and it fits most watchbands. Theres no place this compass wont go!", "text": "Brunton Watchband Slider Waterproof Compass The Brunton Watchband Slider is so small you wont know its there- unless you need it. This watchband compass is completely waterproof. It features the cardinal points and a rotating disc and it fits most watchbands. Theres no place this compass wont go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WnfQ%2B7QtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8CUN2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001E8DIB0", "title": "BlackHawk Prod Group Omega VI Elite Holster-SIG-226,228/Glock 17,19,22,23,27 (Black) #40QD02BK", "description": "BlackHawk Elite Omega VI Holster Right Hand Black Sig 226/228, Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32 40QD02BK", "text": "BlackHawk Prod Group Omega VI Elite Holster-SIG-226,228/Glock 17,19,22,23,27 (Black) #40QD02BK BlackHawk Elite Omega VI Holster Right Hand Black Sig 226/228, Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32 40QD02BK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HvE6NRHWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8DIB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 74.9}}
{"item_id": "B001E8EM2E", "title": "Ontario 8846 RAT Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black coated, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8846 RAT Folding Knife (Black) The Ontario RAT Model 1 folding knives feature an open post construction for easy cleaning. The ergonomic nylon handles and spine jimping create a great design with great control. This knife is complete with a 4-way position pocket clip and lanyard hole for a choice of carry options. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black coated, flat ground blade. Blade has a hardness of 55-56 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oRSJ0wI5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8EM2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.92}}
{"item_id": "B001E8G8O4", "title": "Maxpedition Gear 2-Inch Shoulder Pad", "description": "Product Details Overall: 12-Inch x 2.5-Inch Attach: Triple Velcro Retention High-breathability shoulder straps with non-slip inserts, compatible with up to 2-Inch wide webbing.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear 2-Inch Shoulder Pad Product Details Overall: 12-Inch x 2.5-Inch Attach: Triple Velcro Retention High-breathability shoulder straps with non-slip inserts, compatible with up to 2-Inch wide webbing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21nWN4gYnKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8G8O4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 9.38}}
{"item_id": "B001E8K2NW", "title": "Maxpedition Proteus Versipack", "description": "Named after a mythological character that could take on many shapes and forms, the Proteus Versipack (#0402) provides a herculean 285 cu. in. of organized storage space and can be worn like a fannypack, hand-carried, piggy-backed onto MAXPEDITION backpacks, or integrated onto ALICE or MOLLE webbing.", "text": "Maxpedition Proteus Versipack Named after a mythological character that could take on many shapes and forms, the Proteus Versipack (#0402) provides a herculean 285 cu. in. of organized storage space and can be worn like a fannypack, hand-carried, piggy-backed onto MAXPEDITION backpacks, or integrated onto ALICE or MOLLE webbing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51q-aQhXFQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8K2NW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 62.99}}
{"item_id": "B001E8PHJ6", "title": "Lezyne Caddy Saddle Bag", "description": "An oversized Caddy for adventure riding. One large rear opening provides access to the main compartment. Internal organizational pockets hold a hand pump, multi-tool, and tire repair to the sides leaving plenty of room for additional gear. Two external zippered pockets provide quick access. Four straps securely attach the Caddy to the seatpost and seat rails. Durable woven nylon fabrics, water resistant zippers and reflective tail light loop make this caddy ready for all weather.", "text": "Lezyne Caddy Saddle Bag An oversized Caddy for adventure riding. One large rear opening provides access to the main compartment. Internal organizational pockets hold a hand pump, multi-tool, and tire repair to the sides leaving plenty of room for additional gear. Two external zippered pockets provide quick access. Four straps securely attach the Caddy to the seatpost and seat rails. Durable woven nylon fabrics, water resistant zippers and reflective tail light loop make this caddy ready for all weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bjZMWArnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8PHJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001E8PNRM", "title": "Champion EasyHit 3.0mm Diameter Shotgun Sight", "description": "Champion Traps & Targets—in partnership with world-renown exhibition shooter Tom Knapp—introduces the EasyHit Fiber Optic Sighting System. This fiber-optic sight attaches by an adhesive strip to any ventilated or solid rib or flat surface (and ported barrels) and is low profile as to not change your point of impact. The hollow tube design helps shooters use both eyes when acquiring their sight picture. It's the safest and best way to shoot.", "text": "Champion EasyHit 3.0mm Diameter Shotgun Sight Champion Traps & Targets—in partnership with world-renown exhibition shooter Tom Knapp—introduces the EasyHit Fiber Optic Sighting System. This fiber-optic sight attaches by an adhesive strip to any ventilated or solid rib or flat surface (and ported barrels) and is low profile as to not change your point of impact. The hollow tube design helps shooters use both eyes when acquiring their sight picture. It's the safest and best way to shoot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RseLKcXPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8PNRM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001E8PPM0", "title": "Champion Electronic Ear Muffs", "description": "Enjoy safe shooting with new sound dampening ear muffs from Champion. These comfortable, stylish muffs provide superior hearing protection while remaining light and comfortable for the shooter. Available in either standard or electronic versions, they reduce harmful noise levels and provide a comfortable fit for those long days of shooting. Don't let your shooting passion damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "text": "Champion Electronic Ear Muffs Enjoy safe shooting with new sound dampening ear muffs from Champion. These comfortable, stylish muffs provide superior hearing protection while remaining light and comfortable for the shooter. Available in either standard or electronic versions, they reduce harmful noise levels and provide a comfortable fit for those long days of shooting. Don't let your shooting passion damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bhJH6P-tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8PPM0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 27.79}}
{"item_id": "B001E8UP2U", "title": "Champion LE B27-E Police Silhouette Paper Target (Pack of 100)", "description": "This addition to the Champion police target lineup are perfect additions to any law enforcement training program or those interested in some home defense target practice. Produced in the most popular designs, these large 23x36” targets offer realistic vital zone recognition and provide positive shot placement feedback that is sure to improve your shooting skills. Anatomically correct vital zone depiction provides the ultimate in paper target scenarios.", "text": "Champion LE B27-E Police Silhouette Paper Target (Pack of 100) This addition to the Champion police target lineup are perfect additions to any law enforcement training program or those interested in some home defense target practice. Produced in the most popular designs, these large 23x36” targets offer realistic vital zone recognition and provide positive shot placement feedback that is sure to improve your shooting skills. Anatomically correct vital zone depiction provides the ultimate in paper target scenarios.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P2HwBxlOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001E8UP2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 64.79}}
{"item_id": "B001EBWK1Q", "title": "Continental Sport Contact Road Tire", "description": "The Continental Sport Contact road tire turns any bike into a speedster. The 700c version helps the bike messenger meet those deadlines while the 26\" version gets any fitness rider into a speed frenzy All this added speed for your bike with zero detriment to puncture protection and reliability Extremely fine and durable casing plies, SafetySystem puncture protection and reflector strips are all integral parts in the Sport Contact road tire", "text": "Continental Sport Contact Road Tire The Continental Sport Contact road tire turns any bike into a speedster. The 700c version helps the bike messenger meet those deadlines while the 26\" version gets any fitness rider into a speed frenzy All this added speed for your bike with zero detriment to puncture protection and reliability Extremely fine and durable casing plies, SafetySystem puncture protection and reflector strips are all integral parts in the Sport Contact road tire", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yNAMRqy9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EBWK1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EBWKTS", "title": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S Clincher Road Bicycle Tire (Black w/Black Chili - 700 x 23)", "description": "", "text": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S Clincher Road Bicycle Tire (Black w/Black Chili - 700 x 23)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BA2%2BYtqZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EBWKTS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EBXH04", "title": "Spyderco byrd Cara Cara2 Rescue Black FRN SpyderEdge Knife", "description": "The newly updated Cara Cara2 Rescue offers lifesaving performance at a very affordable price. Its skeletonized stainless steel liners and textured, injection-molded FRN handles provide the ideal combination of light weight and a secure grip, even in the most demanding environmental conditions. A hollow-ground, fully-serrated sheepfoot blade provides improved edge geometry and cutting performance while protecting against accidental punctures. To complete the package, a four-position clip and sturdy back lock mechanism make the knife completely ambidextrous and an ideal choice for right and left-handed users alike. Whether you’re a duty-bound first responder or a prepared civilian, your kit isn’t complete without the new Cara Cara2 Rescue.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Cara Cara2 Rescue Black FRN SpyderEdge Knife The newly updated Cara Cara2 Rescue offers lifesaving performance at a very affordable price. Its skeletonized stainless steel liners and textured, injection-molded FRN handles provide the ideal combination of light weight and a secure grip, even in the most demanding environmental conditions. A hollow-ground, fully-serrated sheepfoot blade provides improved edge geometry and cutting performance while protecting against accidental punctures. To complete the package, a four-position clip and sturdy back lock mechanism make the knife completely ambidextrous and an ideal choice for right and left-handed users alike. Whether you’re a duty-bound first responder or a prepared civilian, your kit isn’t complete without the new Cara Cara2 Rescue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BgxFP18HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EBXH04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 21.91}}
{"item_id": "B001EBZSA6", "title": "Maxpedition Octa Versipack", "description": "The OCTA Versipack is a combat-ready waist bag designed to maximize usable space in a compact package and to provide comfort while standing, kneeling, or sitting down through its shape and contour.", "text": "Maxpedition Octa Versipack The OCTA Versipack is a combat-ready waist bag designed to maximize usable space in a compact package and to provide comfort while standing, kneeling, or sitting down through its shape and contour.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51de73bXn-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EBZSA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 62.98}}
{"item_id": "B001EC1SMM", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Volta Battery Pouch", "description": "Product Details INCLUDES BATUCA Battery Insert Main Compartment: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch x 0.75-Inch with hook and loop closure Nylon case made from 1000-Denier coated nylon fabric Integral drainage grommet on bottom Fits small camera, iPod, iPhone and most other cellphones Fits 5 rounds of 12 gauge shotgun shells MOLLE compatible attachment clips: 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately) INCLUDES high quality BATUCA battery insert (patents pending) Exclusive clear and smoke combo color for enhanced visual identification Slides apart into 2 small individual versatile sections Holds up to eight (8) CR123, AA, AAA batteries; also fits memory cards Effectively separate new and spent cells We are proud and honored to be able to work on this collaborative project with InAnyCase.com. BATUCA registered trademark and patents pending are owned by PC Card Packaging Inc. Disclaimer: Batteries and other photo -Inch props-Inch not included. Inserts are not waterproof.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Volta Battery Pouch Product Details INCLUDES BATUCA Battery Insert Main Compartment: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch x 0.75-Inch with hook and loop closure Nylon case made from 1000-Denier coated nylon fabric Integral drainage grommet on bottom Fits small camera, iPod, iPhone and most other cellphones Fits 5 rounds of 12 gauge shotgun shells MOLLE compatible attachment clips: 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately) INCLUDES high quality BATUCA battery insert (patents pending) Exclusive clear and smoke combo color for enhanced visual identification Slides apart into 2 small individual versatile sections Holds up to eight (8) CR123, AA, AAA batteries; also fits memory cards Effectively separate new and spent cells We are proud and honored to be able to work on this collaborative project with InAnyCase.com. BATUCA registered trademark and patents pending are owned by PC Card Packaging Inc. Disclaimer: Batteries and other photo -Inch props-Inch not included. Inserts are not waterproof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CKiplyU1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC1SMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001EC1T4E", "title": "KA-BAR 1258 Short USA Clip Point Knife-Hard Sheath", "description": "All Black short Ka-bar features a 5 1/4 in. blade made form 1095 Cro-Van steel with a non-reflective epoxy coating and a black Kraton G handle. Knife has an overall length of 9 1/4 in. Andes with a black hard plastic sheath. ATTRIBUTES Blade Length (inches): 5.25 Blade Material: 1095 Black Overall Length (inches): 9.25", "text": "KA-BAR 1258 Short USA Clip Point Knife-Hard Sheath All Black short Ka-bar features a 5 1/4 in. blade made form 1095 Cro-Van steel with a non-reflective epoxy coating and a black Kraton G handle. Knife has an overall length of 9 1/4 in. Andes with a black hard plastic sheath. ATTRIBUTES Blade Length (inches): 5.25 Blade Material: 1095 Black Overall Length (inches): 9.25", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F3bXjVcaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC1T4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 53.41}}
{"item_id": "B001EC3FSC", "title": "Spyderco Tasman Salt Rust Free Plain Edge", "description": "Spyderco's Tasman Salt folder combines our exclusive H-1 steel with a Hawkbill blade design to yield an exceptional mariner's knife. H1 is an extraordinary Japanese steel that uses nitrogen instead of carbon to create its steel matrix. The result is an austenitic steel that does not require heat treatment, gets harder and tougher with use and is completely impervious to rust! The distinctive curved shape of a hawkbill blade gathers and holds the material being cut, making it perfect for cutting materials like rope, line and netting. cutting against the sharpened edge keeping it from slipping off the tip. The hollow-ground H-1 blade of the Tasman is mated to a black molded fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle with a Volcano Grip texture pattern for a positive grip in all conditions. A titanium pocket clip positions the folder tip-up in the pocket and is reversible for left or right-side carry. The clip attachment screw is also hollow, providing a handy lanyard hole for attachment of a thong or cord when using the knife around water.", "text": "Spyderco Tasman Salt Rust Free Plain Edge Spyderco's Tasman Salt folder combines our exclusive H-1 steel with a Hawkbill blade design to yield an exceptional mariner's knife. H1 is an extraordinary Japanese steel that uses nitrogen instead of carbon to create its steel matrix. The result is an austenitic steel that does not require heat treatment, gets harder and tougher with use and is completely impervious to rust! The distinctive curved shape of a hawkbill blade gathers and holds the material being cut, making it perfect for cutting materials like rope, line and netting. cutting against the sharpened edge keeping it from slipping off the tip. The hollow-ground H-1 blade of the Tasman is mated to a black molded fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle with a Volcano Grip texture pattern for a positive grip in all conditions. A titanium pocket clip positions the folder tip-up in the pocket and is reversible for left or right-side carry. The clip attachment screw is also hollow, providing a handy lanyard hole for attachment of a thong or cord when using the knife around water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xspNRtdoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC3FSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 64.89}}
{"item_id": "B001EC4RTI", "title": "Kershaw Work Knife with Black Injection-Molded Polyimide Handle and Sandvik 14C28N Stainless-Steel Blade", "description": "When it comes to your work knife…a knife that you use a lot, a knife you depend on, you need a knife that fits your hand perfectly. After all, it's going to spend a lot of time there. That's why you'll like this collection of ergonomically contoured knives engineered by Kershaw. Two additions to a great knife collection are the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet. The Needs Work is a tough, versatile knife that demands to be put to work on any cutting task you may have. The blade is Sandvik 14C28N, a stainless steel that provides high hardness as well as excellent corrosion and wear resistance. The handle is made of contoured Polyimide, an engineering polymer that exhibits an exceptional combination of thermal stability and mechanical toughness. The Oso Sweet is a classic design, but with a tasty twist, a handle of injection molded glass-filled nylon with a distinctive \"scales\" pattern. The Oso Sweet offers a blade of high-quality AUS6A stainless steel for toughness and edge retention. Both the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet feature the patented SpeedSafe manual assist for smooth, easy opening. Knife users who appreciate good looking, hardworking knives, a SpeedSafe design, and a great price, are sure to want to add both the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet to the menu.", "text": "Kershaw Work Knife with Black Injection-Molded Polyimide Handle and Sandvik 14C28N Stainless-Steel Blade When it comes to your work knife…a knife that you use a lot, a knife you depend on, you need a knife that fits your hand perfectly. After all, it's going to spend a lot of time there. That's why you'll like this collection of ergonomically contoured knives engineered by Kershaw. Two additions to a great knife collection are the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet. The Needs Work is a tough, versatile knife that demands to be put to work on any cutting task you may have. The blade is Sandvik 14C28N, a stainless steel that provides high hardness as well as excellent corrosion and wear resistance. The handle is made of contoured Polyimide, an engineering polymer that exhibits an exceptional combination of thermal stability and mechanical toughness. The Oso Sweet is a classic design, but with a tasty twist, a handle of injection molded glass-filled nylon with a distinctive \"scales\" pattern. The Oso Sweet offers a blade of high-quality AUS6A stainless steel for toughness and edge retention. Both the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet feature the patented SpeedSafe manual assist for smooth, easy opening. Knife users who appreciate good looking, hardworking knives, a SpeedSafe design, and a great price, are sure to want to add both the Needs Work and the Oso Sweet to the menu.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21xvKSI0nIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC4RTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.37}}
{"item_id": "B001EC4SPQ", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Advanced Tactical Knee Pads V.2", "description": "New dual injection-molded flex cap design allows maximum flexibility for ease of movement and comfort. Minimizes gap between the bottom of the cap and nylon carrier when flexed. Padded side extensions for comfort and improved strap positioning. Contoured interior ledge secures pad positioning. 600 Denier nylon shell. Closed-cell foam padding provides excellent shock resistance and prevents water absorption. Adjustable hook and loop elastic straps.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Advanced Tactical Knee Pads V.2 New dual injection-molded flex cap design allows maximum flexibility for ease of movement and comfort. Minimizes gap between the bottom of the cap and nylon carrier when flexed. Padded side extensions for comfort and improved strap positioning. Contoured interior ledge secures pad positioning. 600 Denier nylon shell. Closed-cell foam padding provides excellent shock resistance and prevents water absorption. Adjustable hook and loop elastic straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WwIzMLrVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC4SPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EC7KMY", "title": "Vortex Diamondback 4-12x40mm Riflescopes", "description": "Vortex Diamondback 4-12x40 Riflescope The Diamondback—loaded with features! First, the solid one-piece aircraft-grade aluminum alloy construction makes the Diamondback riflescope virtually indestructible and highly resistant to magnum recoil. Argon purging puts waterproof and fogproof performance on the agenda, and advanced fully multi-coated optics raise an eyebrow when crystal clear, tack-sharp images appear in the crosshairs. Look for all this and more in a riflescope you'd expect to cost quite a bit more-but doesn't. We can live with that. 4-12x40 riflescope is ideal for big game, predator/varmint, muzzleloader, slug shotgun, long range, and target applications. V-Plex reticle is the single best all-purpose hunting reticle intended for a wide variety of hunting applications. Optical Features Fully Multi-Coated Lenses Increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces. Construction Features One-Inch Tube Standard tube diameter for most American riflescopes. One-Piece Tube Maximizes strength and waterproofness. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum Premium grade of aluminum, valued for fatigue resistance. Precision-Glide Erector System Uses premium components in the zoom lens mechanism, ensuring smooth magnification changes under the harshest conditions. Fast Focus Eyepiece Allows quick and easy reticle focusing. Low Capped Turrets Is less susceptible to accidental impact damage. Reset Turrets Allow re-indexing of the turret housing to zero after sighting in the riflescope—generally requires use of a coin or wrench. Waterproof Optics are sealed with o-rings to prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the binocular. Fogproof Barrels are filled with argon gas to inhibit internal fogging.", "text": "Vortex Diamondback 4-12x40mm Riflescopes Vortex Diamondback 4-12x40 Riflescope The Diamondback—loaded with features! First, the solid one-piece aircraft-grade aluminum alloy construction makes the Diamondback riflescope virtually indestructible and highly resistant to magnum recoil. Argon purging puts waterproof and fogproof performance on the agenda, and advanced fully multi-coated optics raise an eyebrow when crystal clear, tack-sharp images appear in the crosshairs. Look for all this and more in a riflescope you'd expect to cost quite a bit more-but doesn't. We can live with that. 4-12x40 riflescope is ideal for big game, predator/varmint, muzzleloader, slug shotgun, long range, and target applications. V-Plex reticle is the single best all-purpose hunting reticle intended for a wide variety of hunting applications. Optical Features Fully Multi-Coated Lenses Increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces. Construction Features One-Inch Tube Standard tube diameter for most American riflescopes. One-Piece Tube Maximizes strength and waterproofness. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum Premium grade of aluminum, valued for fatigue resistance. Precision-Glide Erector System Uses premium components in the zoom lens mechanism, ensuring smooth magnification changes under the harshest conditions. Fast Focus Eyepiece Allows quick and easy reticle focusing. Low Capped Turrets Is less susceptible to accidental impact damage. Reset Turrets Allow re-indexing of the turret housing to zero after sighting in the riflescope—generally requires use of a coin or wrench. Waterproof Optics are sealed with o-rings to prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the binocular. Fogproof Barrels are filled with argon gas to inhibit internal fogging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L5Dq7KbnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EC7KMY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001ECDKTQ", "title": "Vortex Optics Strikefire Red Dot Scope Low Mount", "description": "When the situation demands fast shooting. And a big scope with a narrow field of view won't cut it, the Strike Fire red dot riflescope lets you shoot quickly with both eyes open. With unlimited field of view and eye relief-nothing gets you on target faster than this tough, shockproof and waterproof red dot scope. High recoil caliber rating-tested with.375 H&H; Magnum for 1000 rounds. Included standard height 30mm ring puts scope's bore center 21 mm (0.8 Inch) above the base height. Commonly used for mounting with most rifles, shotguns and handguns. The Low Mount model will be used for the Strike Fire on most carry handle AR15 models. Carry handles will also require a mounting rail.", "text": "Vortex Optics Strikefire Red Dot Scope Low Mount When the situation demands fast shooting. And a big scope with a narrow field of view won't cut it, the Strike Fire red dot riflescope lets you shoot quickly with both eyes open. With unlimited field of view and eye relief-nothing gets you on target faster than this tough, shockproof and waterproof red dot scope. High recoil caliber rating-tested with.375 H&H; Magnum for 1000 rounds. Included standard height 30mm ring puts scope's bore center 21 mm (0.8 Inch) above the base height. Commonly used for mounting with most rifles, shotguns and handguns. The Low Mount model will be used for the Strike Fire on most carry handle AR15 models. Carry handles will also require a mounting rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415tusb5llL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ECDKTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 128.9}}
{"item_id": "B001ECQPNY", "title": "Plano Deep Dry Storage Box with Tray", "description": "This box is perfect for tool kits, flares, first aid supplies. Anything you put in this box will stay safe and dry. It features a water-resistant O-ring seal and a comfortable over molded handle.", "text": "Plano Deep Dry Storage Box with Tray This box is perfect for tool kits, flares, first aid supplies. Anything you put in this box will stay safe and dry. It features a water-resistant O-ring seal and a comfortable over molded handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DelUPeYUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ECQPNY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001ECQPUW", "title": "Plano Extra Large Dry Storage Box with Tray", "description": "This extra large dry storage box is perfect for tool kits, flares, first aid supplies. Anything you put in this box will stay safe and dry. It features a water-resistant O-ring seal and a comfortable over molded handle. It also comes with a large lift out tray", "text": "Plano Extra Large Dry Storage Box with Tray This extra large dry storage box is perfect for tool kits, flares, first aid supplies. Anything you put in this box will stay safe and dry. It features a water-resistant O-ring seal and a comfortable over molded handle. It also comes with a large lift out tray", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41to0hYxxUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ECQPUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 28.16}}
{"item_id": "B001ECRZOM", "title": "Cateye Uno HL-EL010 Headlight", "description": "Cateye UNO series LED headlights are highly water resistant. One LED with 400 Candlepower One AA battery 15 hours run time Flex tight bracket compatible", "text": "Cateye Uno HL-EL010 Headlight Cateye UNO series LED headlights are highly water resistant. One LED with 400 Candlepower One AA battery 15 hours run time Flex tight bracket compatible", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NbNq4WaiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ECRZOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001ECRZPQ", "title": "Cateye HL-EL135/TL-LD130/VEL05 Headlight, Rear Light and Bicycle Computer Combo Pack", "description": "Cat Eye Value Packs include cycling computer, headlight, and taillight. A package of Cateye's best selling entry level models. Computer: Velo 5 computer in black He", "text": "Cateye HL-EL135/TL-LD130/VEL05 Headlight, Rear Light and Bicycle Computer Combo Pack Cat Eye Value Packs include cycling computer, headlight, and taillight. A package of Cateye's best selling entry level models. Computer: Velo 5 computer in black He", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RDFNOuUsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ECRZPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001ED9U0S", "title": "Leapers Weaver Base Scope Mount With Scope Rings For Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30 And Ranch Rifles", "description": "Leapers Weaver Base Scope Mount With Scope Rings For Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30 And Ranch Rifles Features: Weight: 5.2 ounces, Color: Matte Black, Material: Made out of aircraft aluminum, Rail type: Weaver Style, Rail Dimensions: 5 inches long, The weaver base rail will fit most any rifle/pistol scope, red dot scope and other aiming devices. This X-treme duty mount is considerably thicker and stronger that any other Mini-14 scope mount we carry and it features a dual redundancy mounting system to prevent loss of zero. The installation requires that you replace the original bolt lock cover plate with a new cover plate. This mount includes the new bolt lock cover plate. Place the mount on the side of the new cover plate and use the large knurled knob to attach the mount to your rifle. Then fasten down 2 allen head screws which tighten the mount securely against the rifles receiver and finally tighten 2 more set screws that prevent any of the mounting hardware from coming loose. This mount makes an extremely durable platform that will withstand heavy duty use under most any conditions. Will fit the Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30, AC-556 and Ranch Rifles. See through designs allows using iron sights, and also allows for use of the bolt hold open button on your rifle. Easy no gunsmith installation require no modification to your rifle. Includes all mounting hardware. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "text": "Leapers Weaver Base Scope Mount With Scope Rings For Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30 And Ranch Rifles Leapers Weaver Base Scope Mount With Scope Rings For Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30 And Ranch Rifles Features: Weight: 5.2 ounces, Color: Matte Black, Material: Made out of aircraft aluminum, Rail type: Weaver Style, Rail Dimensions: 5 inches long, The weaver base rail will fit most any rifle/pistol scope, red dot scope and other aiming devices. This X-treme duty mount is considerably thicker and stronger that any other Mini-14 scope mount we carry and it features a dual redundancy mounting system to prevent loss of zero. The installation requires that you replace the original bolt lock cover plate with a new cover plate. This mount includes the new bolt lock cover plate. Place the mount on the side of the new cover plate and use the large knurled knob to attach the mount to your rifle. Then fasten down 2 allen head screws which tighten the mount securely against the rifles receiver and finally tighten 2 more set screws that prevent any of the mounting hardware from coming loose. This mount makes an extremely durable platform that will withstand heavy duty use under most any conditions. Will fit the Ruger Mini-14, Mini-30, AC-556 and Ranch Rifles. See through designs allows using iron sights, and also allows for use of the bolt hold open button on your rifle. Easy no gunsmith installation require no modification to your rifle. Includes all mounting hardware. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2B38Rk8iEL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ED9U0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leapers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 30.39}}
{"item_id": "B001EDH2H6", "title": "Maxpedition Monkey Combat Admin Pouch", "description": "Designed primarily to be attached to and worn on the chest area of a tactical vest or body armor, Maxpedition's new 9811 MONKEY COMBAT ADMIN POUCH solves many of the problems plaguing admin pouches currently on the market while optimizing carry capacity in a compact and organized package.", "text": "Maxpedition Monkey Combat Admin Pouch Designed primarily to be attached to and worn on the chest area of a tactical vest or body armor, Maxpedition's new 9811 MONKEY COMBAT ADMIN POUCH solves many of the problems plaguing admin pouches currently on the market while optimizing carry capacity in a compact and organized package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61%2BLgzhOOcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDH2H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 35.09}}
{"item_id": "B001EDH37A", "title": "Maxpedition Jumbo S-Type Versipack", "description": "Better For Left Side Carry. The S-Type JUMBO’s main compartment is over 38% larger than the Fatboy S-Type. In addition, it has three zippered accessory pockets, two sleeve pockets, and one drawstring pocket fitted for a 32oz/1L Nalgene water bottle or a radio.", "text": "Maxpedition Jumbo S-Type Versipack Better For Left Side Carry. The S-Type JUMBO’s main compartment is over 38% larger than the Fatboy S-Type. In addition, it has three zippered accessory pockets, two sleeve pockets, and one drawstring pocket fitted for a 32oz/1L Nalgene water bottle or a radio.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WFZ%2BYmryL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDH37A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EDIWES", "title": "SPYDERCO Delica 4 Lightweight Blade Combination Edge Knife, Black", "description": "In 1990, innovative cutlery company Spyderco introduced a knife called the Delica, a first of its kind on the market, offering a unique combination of lightweight performance, one-handed opening and closing, and an affordable price. it quickly became one of Spyderco's top-selling knives, and the company has continued to refine the model over the years.This is the fourth iteration of this keenly sharp, refined steel blade, offering screw-together construction that's durable and easy to clean. A fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) handle has proprietary Bi-Directional Texturing for nonslip use with improved ergonomics, while dual skeletonized steel liners to improve strength without adding weight, and also anchor all external components. A razor sharp non-reflective VG-10 blade is coated with black titanium carbonitride, and is flat saber-ground. Crosshatched jimping along the blade's spine further improves grip, and phosphor bronze washers help smooth out the opening action. When it's time to move, a four-way clip offers a number of carrying configurations.Specifications7.125-inch open length4.25-inch closed length2.875-inch VG-10 steel blade2.56-inch cutting edge0.5-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.5-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "SPYDERCO Delica 4 Lightweight Blade Combination Edge Knife, Black In 1990, innovative cutlery company Spyderco introduced a knife called the Delica, a first of its kind on the market, offering a unique combination of lightweight performance, one-handed opening and closing, and an affordable price. it quickly became one of Spyderco's top-selling knives, and the company has continued to refine the model over the years.This is the fourth iteration of this keenly sharp, refined steel blade, offering screw-together construction that's durable and easy to clean. A fiberglass reinforced nylon (FRN) handle has proprietary Bi-Directional Texturing for nonslip use with improved ergonomics, while dual skeletonized steel liners to improve strength without adding weight, and also anchor all external components. A razor sharp non-reflective VG-10 blade is coated with black titanium carbonitride, and is flat saber-ground. Crosshatched jimping along the blade's spine further improves grip, and phosphor bronze washers help smooth out the opening action. When it's time to move, a four-way clip offers a number of carrying configurations.Specifications7.125-inch open length4.25-inch closed length2.875-inch VG-10 steel blade2.56-inch cutting edge0.5-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.5-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OSlq1aUUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDIWES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 66.67}}
{"item_id": "B001EDJ1AM", "title": "Kershaw 1660TGRYST Random Leek Knife with Partially Serrated Blade with SpeedSafe", "description": "The Leek series includes some of our most popular knives. And no wonder. Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. Leeks come in a variety of handle styles, some with technologically advanced coatings for enhanced performance. For example, the bead-blasted stainless steel handle offers strength and beauty. A handle with black Tungsten DLC coating produces a Leek with a non-reflective surface. For lightweight and a one-of-a-kind look, choose our \"smoked\" double-anodized aluminum finish in two colors. Or choose our new Pink Leek with it's fashionable pink anodized aluminum handle, the Rainbow Leek with its titanium oxide coating that produces a highly scratch resistant, brilliant, rainbow finish. Also new in 2007 is our Random Leek with a modified Tanto blade for cutting power and chromium nitride coating for hardness and corrosion resistance. For ease of carrying, all Leeks include a reversible/removable pocket clip.", "text": "Kershaw 1660TGRYST Random Leek Knife with Partially Serrated Blade with SpeedSafe The Leek series includes some of our most popular knives. And no wonder. Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. Leeks come in a variety of handle styles, some with technologically advanced coatings for enhanced performance. For example, the bead-blasted stainless steel handle offers strength and beauty. A handle with black Tungsten DLC coating produces a Leek with a non-reflective surface. For lightweight and a one-of-a-kind look, choose our \"smoked\" double-anodized aluminum finish in two colors. Or choose our new Pink Leek with it's fashionable pink anodized aluminum handle, the Rainbow Leek with its titanium oxide coating that produces a highly scratch resistant, brilliant, rainbow finish. Also new in 2007 is our Random Leek with a modified Tanto blade for cutting power and chromium nitride coating for hardness and corrosion resistance. For ease of carrying, all Leeks include a reversible/removable pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Bn6vso0fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDJ1AM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EDL1L4", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-14SFG Special Forces Big Dog Deep-Bellied Spear Point Knife with Veff Serrated Blade", "description": "M21-14SFG G10 Special Forces Big Dog made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a hefty 3.875-Inch deep-bellied spear point combined Razor-Sharp and Veff serrated edge knife. This knife with an 8Cr14MoV black stainless steel blade is based on a design by a former Army Sergeant Major has easy one handed opening, black G10 scales and our patented Auto Lawks system. The M16-14SFG also has dual flippers.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's M21-14SFG Special Forces Big Dog Deep-Bellied Spear Point Knife with Veff Serrated Blade M21-14SFG G10 Special Forces Big Dog made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a hefty 3.875-Inch deep-bellied spear point combined Razor-Sharp and Veff serrated edge knife. This knife with an 8Cr14MoV black stainless steel blade is based on a design by a former Army Sergeant Major has easy one handed opening, black G10 scales and our patented Auto Lawks system. The M16-14SFG also has dual flippers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314h-HK7AZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDL1L4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 51.18}}
{"item_id": "B001EDOBAM", "title": "Spyderco Endura 4 ZDP-189 Model # C10PGRE", "description": "The knife industry is constantly pushing the envelope searching for, and testing, higher performance blade steels. ZDP189 is rapidly asserting itself as an up-and-coming steel. It's a powdered metal made by Hitachi that has phenomenal chemistry with 3% carbon. The hardness is around 64Rc and edge retention is exceptional. This solid ZDP-189 steel blade is the hottest, hardest and highest performing steel in the knife industry today. The Endura4 features a full flat ground ZDP-189 steel blade, a Green FRN Bi-Drectional Textured Handle, four-way clip option, screw-together construction, skeletonized steel internal liners, phosphor bronze washers, David Boye Dent, spine jimping, and an enlarged opening hole.", "text": "Spyderco Endura 4 ZDP-189 Model # C10PGRE The knife industry is constantly pushing the envelope searching for, and testing, higher performance blade steels. ZDP189 is rapidly asserting itself as an up-and-coming steel. It's a powdered metal made by Hitachi that has phenomenal chemistry with 3% carbon. The hardness is around 64Rc and edge retention is exceptional. This solid ZDP-189 steel blade is the hottest, hardest and highest performing steel in the knife industry today. The Endura4 features a full flat ground ZDP-189 steel blade, a Green FRN Bi-Drectional Textured Handle, four-way clip option, screw-together construction, skeletonized steel internal liners, phosphor bronze washers, David Boye Dent, spine jimping, and an enlarged opening hole.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311vKFObQvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDOBAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 97.95}}
{"item_id": "B001EDOCDI", "title": "Ontario 8632 RAT-3 Knife (Green)", "description": "The Ontario Knife RAT Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 1095 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 55-57 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales rounded for comfort. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "text": "Ontario 8632 RAT-3 Knife (Green) The Ontario Knife RAT Series of knives will stand the test of durability. Constructed from 1095 carbon steel, and canvas textured micarta handles, this is one tough knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Black coated non-reflective blade. Full tang blades are hardened to 55-57 HRC. Canvas Micarta scales rounded for comfort. Lanyard hole in handle. Includes nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IT5Y2VT9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDOCDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 72.52}}
{"item_id": "B001EDXZRW", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Cage Muzzle Brake", "description": "5 directional ports, made from high strength steel with a manganese phosphate finish and 5 retention pin catches for a perfect fit regardless of your AK varient; Need we say more? The Intrafuse AK Cage Muzzle Brake has all that and more. With a 14 x 1 LH threading this rugged brake will install in seconds for a standard threaded AK barrel. On top of that it is an easy, inexpensive way to add a 922r compliance part to your AK.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK Cage Muzzle Brake 5 directional ports, made from high strength steel with a manganese phosphate finish and 5 retention pin catches for a perfect fit regardless of your AK varient; Need we say more? The Intrafuse AK Cage Muzzle Brake has all that and more. With a 14 x 1 LH threading this rugged brake will install in seconds for a standard threaded AK barrel. On top of that it is an easy, inexpensive way to add a 922r compliance part to your AK.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UykgnCz9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EDXZRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B001EE7XYW", "title": "Alpen Micro Adjustable Table Top Tripod", "description": "Stabilize your spotting scope or camera without sacrificing your mobility with the Alpen micro-adjustable tabletop tripod. Designed to fit all spotting scopes and cameras with standard mounts, the tripod adjusts from 10 to 13 inches tall in its default configuration, or up to 16 inches tall by moving the legs closer together. It also makes it easy to acquire your target, with a quick-adjust knob for fast target acquisition and two fine-tuning adjustments for windage and elevation. Equipped with a compact housing that fits easily in most spotting scope or camera bags, the tripod carries Alpen's lifetime warranty.About Alpen OpticsEstablished in 1997, Alpen Optics produces a full line of binoculars, spotting scopes, riflescopes, and accessories designed to offer superior value to the consumer. The company produces more than 70 products and accessories chock full of features and benefits normally found on much more expensive brands. Alpen backs up its commitment to quality manufacturing with a limited lifetime factory warranty. Alpen is headquartered in Rancho Cucamonga, California.", "text": "Alpen Micro Adjustable Table Top Tripod Stabilize your spotting scope or camera without sacrificing your mobility with the Alpen micro-adjustable tabletop tripod. Designed to fit all spotting scopes and cameras with standard mounts, the tripod adjusts from 10 to 13 inches tall in its default configuration, or up to 16 inches tall by moving the legs closer together. It also makes it easy to acquire your target, with a quick-adjust knob for fast target acquisition and two fine-tuning adjustments for windage and elevation. Equipped with a compact housing that fits easily in most spotting scope or camera bags, the tripod carries Alpen's lifetime warranty.About Alpen OpticsEstablished in 1997, Alpen Optics produces a full line of binoculars, spotting scopes, riflescopes, and accessories designed to offer superior value to the consumer. The company produces more than 70 products and accessories chock full of features and benefits normally found on much more expensive brands. Alpen backs up its commitment to quality manufacturing with a limited lifetime factory warranty. Alpen is headquartered in Rancho Cucamonga, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LsSOtJcaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EE7XYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alpen Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 37.29}}
{"item_id": "B001EEEENA", "title": "Maxpedition M-4 Waistpack", "description": "Originally designed to fit a 1qt USGI canteen, the midsize utility M-4 Waistpack offers a total of 100 cu. in. of carry capacity, in addition to two small outer pouches with adjustable lids for cellphone, extra pistol magazines, pocket knife, multi-tool, or flashlight.", "text": "Maxpedition M-4 Waistpack Originally designed to fit a 1qt USGI canteen, the midsize utility M-4 Waistpack offers a total of 100 cu. in. of carry capacity, in addition to two small outer pouches with adjustable lids for cellphone, extra pistol magazines, pocket knife, multi-tool, or flashlight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Fk72x1WeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EEEENA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 40.5}}
{"item_id": "B001EGGQB6", "title": "Thermos Nissan Intak Hydration Water Bottle with Meter, Blue", "description": "Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle is made from BPA free, impact- resistant, dishwasher durable Eastman Tritan copolyester. It has a locking leak-proof lid with one-hand push button operation. Theres a flip up loop for easy carrying; ergonomic design for comfortable usage. Monitor your intake with the rotating intake meter- perfect if you are trying to get those 8 glasses of water in everyday. Ideal for water, iced tea, juices and sports drinks: 24-ounce capacity.", "text": "Thermos Nissan Intak Hydration Water Bottle with Meter, Blue Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle is made from BPA free, impact- resistant, dishwasher durable Eastman Tritan copolyester. It has a locking leak-proof lid with one-hand push button operation. Theres a flip up loop for easy carrying; ergonomic design for comfortable usage. Monitor your intake with the rotating intake meter- perfect if you are trying to get those 8 glasses of water in everyday. Ideal for water, iced tea, juices and sports drinks: 24-ounce capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310K1mR9zRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EGGQB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermos", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.57}}
{"item_id": "B001EGGQI4", "title": "Thermos Large Stainless Steel Hydration Bottle, Charcoal with Black Graphic", "description": "Thermos large, 26-ounce stainless steel hydration bottle is made with thermax double wall vacuum insulation for maximum temperature retention and is bpa free. Designed to keep drinks refreshingly cold for up to 18-hours. Made with Durable stainless steel interior and exterior, with a 'sweat-proof' design: it won't leave water rings. Twist off lid protects spouts from dirt and germs. 26-ounce capacity is ideal for water, iced tea, juices or sports drinks.", "text": "Thermos Large Stainless Steel Hydration Bottle, Charcoal with Black Graphic Thermos large, 26-ounce stainless steel hydration bottle is made with thermax double wall vacuum insulation for maximum temperature retention and is bpa free. Designed to keep drinks refreshingly cold for up to 18-hours. Made with Durable stainless steel interior and exterior, with a 'sweat-proof' design: it won't leave water rings. Twist off lid protects spouts from dirt and germs. 26-ounce capacity is ideal for water, iced tea, juices or sports drinks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31APBMNOTwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EGGQI4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 26.0}}
{"item_id": "B001EGIKCO", "title": "Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle with Meter, Green, 24 Ounce", "description": "Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle is made from BPA free, impact- resistant, dishwasher durable Eastman Tritan copolyester. It has a locking leak-proof lid with one-hand push button operation. Theres a flip up loop for easy carrying; ergonomic design for comfortable usage. Monitor your intake with the rotating intake meter- perfect if you are trying to get those 8 glasses of water in everyday. Ideal for water, iced tea, juices and sports drinks: 24-ounce capacity.", "text": "Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle with Meter, Green, 24 Ounce Thermos Intak Hydration Bottle is made from BPA free, impact- resistant, dishwasher durable Eastman Tritan copolyester. It has a locking leak-proof lid with one-hand push button operation. Theres a flip up loop for easy carrying; ergonomic design for comfortable usage. Monitor your intake with the rotating intake meter- perfect if you are trying to get those 8 glasses of water in everyday. Ideal for water, iced tea, juices and sports drinks: 24-ounce capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FtMG5i1%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EGIKCO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermos", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.36}}
{"item_id": "B001EHF99A", "title": "LIFESAVER Systems 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle", "description": "Developed in response to natural disasters such as 2004's tsunami and Hurricane Katrina, and in response to the world's increasingly threatened supply of clean, drinkable water, the Lifesaver 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a simple-to-use, chemical-free water purification system that removes water-borne pathogens and reduces chemical residues from the water making it safe to drink anywhere. The world's first all-in-one ultra filtration water bottle, the Lifesaver Bottle makes easy-to-use, portable water filtration a reality for travelers and outdoors people everywhere.The Lifesaver bottle eliminates the need for iodine tablets, tedious boiling, chemicals, tubes, shaking, scrubbing, waiting, and effort from the water purification process. The bottle uses a long-term use replaceable filter, which can treat about 4,000 liters of water, 5.5 years of usage if you drank two liters of water every day. The bottle has a unique feature, which shuts the filter off when the cartridge has expired so you can get the maximum life out of your filter without the risk of drinking contaminated water.The Lifesaver Bottle filters out all water-borne pathogens using a filter with holes 15 nanometers across to prevent even the smallest viruses, 25 nanometers across, to cross the filter, eliminating the need for chemicals to treat the water. The Lifesaver Bottle is fitted with a 4000UF replaceable purification cartridge that removes bacteria, viruses, cysts, parasites, fungi, and all other microbiological water-borne pathogens from your water.The Lifesaver bottle also comes with an activated carbon filter made of a high specification activated carbon block, which reduces a broad spectrum of chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metals such as lead and copper. The Carbon filter also eliminates bad tastes and odors from contaminates such as chlorine and sulphur. The carbon filter is designed to last for approximately 250 liters.In addition to the purification cartridge and carbon filter, the Lifesaver Bottle is supplied with a pre-filter disc. The pre-filter disc protects the membranes of the purification cartridge from objects such as gravel, sand, sticks, and mud, prolonging the overall life of the cartridge. Your pre-filter disc may also be used as a sponge to soak up water from those hard to reach areas like cracks in rocks or shallow puddles.Exceptionally easy to use, the Lifesaver Bottle filters water on demand at the time of collection. Simply unscrew the base, dip the bottle in the nearest water source, and pump the water through the filter to a teat at the other end, purifying up to 750 milliliters of water in just under a minute. The clean water can be drank immediately, directly from the Lifesaver bottle or poured into a separate container for storage. Designed to work at any angle and in any axis, not only are you able to drink from the bottle in any position, but you can also fill mugs, water bottles, pans, and other water storage vessels from any position.The Lifesaver Bottle utilizes failsafe technology to protect you from drinking contaminated water toward the end of the filter cartridge's life. As the cartridge approaches the end of its life, the bottle requires a greater number of pumps to induce water to flow. When no more water can be induced to flow despite continuous pumping, the cartridge has expired and it is time to replace it.The Lifesaver Bottle is designed not to over-pressurize as a safety feature to prevent injury. Over-pumping the bottle will cause the flip lid to bulge. If pumping continues, then the teat will open and release the water and the pressure.Due to its unique pneumatic action, the Lifesaver Bottle can be used to direct a jet of sanitized water directly onto a wound, cleaning away any other contaminants, allowing for levels of wound irrigation never before possible in the field.Winner of the \"Best Technological Development for Future Soldier System Enhancement\" at Soldier Technology 2007, the Lifesaver bottle has earned the trust of the armed forces in delivering safe water anywhere in the world. Tested and approved for use by the United States EPA, the UK Water Compliance Guidelines, and the European Drinking Water Directive Council, the Lifesaver 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a portable water purification system that you can rely on.Filter Specifications:Cartridge service rating: 4,000 liters (1,056 U.S. gallons)Replaceable activated carbon filterReplaceable UF cartridgeBacteria retention: >99.999995 % (log 7.5)(2)Virus retention: >99.999 % (log5)(3)Activated carbon reduces chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metalsBottle Specifications:Bottle storage capacity: 750 millilitersChew-proof, replaceable drinking teatWatertight, snap-fit lidCap sealPump tubeProtective sleeveRemovable anti-slip baseTwist lock pump handleDry weight of bottle including cartridge: 635 grams (approximately 22 ounces)Operating Specifications:Minimum operating temperature: >0 degrees Celsius, 32 degrees FahrenheitMaximum operating temperature: 50 degrees Celsius, 122 degrees FahrenheitMinimum storage temperature: -10 degrees Celsius, 14 degrees FahrenheitMaximum storage temperature: 60 degrees Celsius, 140 degrees FahrenheitInitial flow rate: 2.5 liters per minute at 0.25 Bar(1)Flow rates and capacity depend on the quality of the feed waterAfter first use the product should be protected against freezingCompliance and Testing Specifications:U.S. compliance EPA: U.S. National Primary Drinking Water Regulations under the Safe Drinking Water Act 93-523UK compliance: Water Supply (Water Quality) Regulations 2000EU compliance: European Drinking Water Directive Council, Directive 98/83/ECTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Escherichia coli NCTC 10418 in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Poliovirus Type 1 (Sabin vaccine strain) in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesManufacturer WarrantyTwo-year international limited warranty", "text": "LIFESAVER Systems 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle Developed in response to natural disasters such as 2004's tsunami and Hurricane Katrina, and in response to the world's increasingly threatened supply of clean, drinkable water, the Lifesaver 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a simple-to-use, chemical-free water purification system that removes water-borne pathogens and reduces chemical residues from the water making it safe to drink anywhere. The world's first all-in-one ultra filtration water bottle, the Lifesaver Bottle makes easy-to-use, portable water filtration a reality for travelers and outdoors people everywhere.The Lifesaver bottle eliminates the need for iodine tablets, tedious boiling, chemicals, tubes, shaking, scrubbing, waiting, and effort from the water purification process. The bottle uses a long-term use replaceable filter, which can treat about 4,000 liters of water, 5.5 years of usage if you drank two liters of water every day. The bottle has a unique feature, which shuts the filter off when the cartridge has expired so you can get the maximum life out of your filter without the risk of drinking contaminated water.The Lifesaver Bottle filters out all water-borne pathogens using a filter with holes 15 nanometers across to prevent even the smallest viruses, 25 nanometers across, to cross the filter, eliminating the need for chemicals to treat the water. The Lifesaver Bottle is fitted with a 4000UF replaceable purification cartridge that removes bacteria, viruses, cysts, parasites, fungi, and all other microbiological water-borne pathogens from your water.The Lifesaver bottle also comes with an activated carbon filter made of a high specification activated carbon block, which reduces a broad spectrum of chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metals such as lead and copper. The Carbon filter also eliminates bad tastes and odors from contaminates such as chlorine and sulphur. The carbon filter is designed to last for approximately 250 liters.In addition to the purification cartridge and carbon filter, the Lifesaver Bottle is supplied with a pre-filter disc. The pre-filter disc protects the membranes of the purification cartridge from objects such as gravel, sand, sticks, and mud, prolonging the overall life of the cartridge. Your pre-filter disc may also be used as a sponge to soak up water from those hard to reach areas like cracks in rocks or shallow puddles.Exceptionally easy to use, the Lifesaver Bottle filters water on demand at the time of collection. Simply unscrew the base, dip the bottle in the nearest water source, and pump the water through the filter to a teat at the other end, purifying up to 750 milliliters of water in just under a minute. The clean water can be drank immediately, directly from the Lifesaver bottle or poured into a separate container for storage. Designed to work at any angle and in any axis, not only are you able to drink from the bottle in any position, but you can also fill mugs, water bottles, pans, and other water storage vessels from any position.The Lifesaver Bottle utilizes failsafe technology to protect you from drinking contaminated water toward the end of the filter cartridge's life. As the cartridge approaches the end of its life, the bottle requires a greater number of pumps to induce water to flow. When no more water can be induced to flow despite continuous pumping, the cartridge has expired and it is time to replace it.The Lifesaver Bottle is designed not to over-pressurize as a safety feature to prevent injury. Over-pumping the bottle will cause the flip lid to bulge. If pumping continues, then the teat will open and release the water and the pressure.Due to its unique pneumatic action, the Lifesaver Bottle can be used to direct a jet of sanitized water directly onto a wound, cleaning away any other contaminants, allowing for levels of wound irrigation never before possible in the field.Winner of the \"Best Technological Development for Future Soldier System Enhancement\" at Soldier Technology 2007, the Lifesaver bottle has earned the trust of the armed forces in delivering safe water anywhere in the world. Tested and approved for use by the United States EPA, the UK Water Compliance Guidelines, and the European Drinking Water Directive Council, the Lifesaver 4000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a portable water purification system that you can rely on.Filter Specifications:Cartridge service rating: 4,000 liters (1,056 U.S. gallons)Replaceable activated carbon filterReplaceable UF cartridgeBacteria retention: >99.999995 % (log 7.5)(2)Virus retention: >99.999 % (log5)(3)Activated carbon reduces chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metalsBottle Specifications:Bottle storage capacity: 750 millilitersChew-proof, replaceable drinking teatWatertight, snap-fit lidCap sealPump tubeProtective sleeveRemovable anti-slip baseTwist lock pump handleDry weight of bottle including cartridge: 635 grams (approximately 22 ounces)Operating Specifications:Minimum operating temperature: >0 degrees Celsius, 32 degrees FahrenheitMaximum operating temperature: 50 degrees Celsius, 122 degrees FahrenheitMinimum storage temperature: -10 degrees Celsius, 14 degrees FahrenheitMaximum storage temperature: 60 degrees Celsius, 140 degrees FahrenheitInitial flow rate: 2.5 liters per minute at 0.25 Bar(1)Flow rates and capacity depend on the quality of the feed waterAfter first use the product should be protected against freezingCompliance and Testing Specifications:U.S. compliance EPA: U.S. National Primary Drinking Water Regulations under the Safe Drinking Water Act 93-523UK compliance: Water Supply (Water Quality) Regulations 2000EU compliance: European Drinking Water Directive Council, Directive 98/83/ECTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Escherichia coli NCTC 10418 in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Poliovirus Type 1 (Sabin vaccine strain) in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesManufacturer WarrantyTwo-year international limited warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cWUy52D7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EHF99A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifesaver Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 169.99}}
{"item_id": "B001EHF99K", "title": "Lifesaver Bottle 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle", "description": "Developed in response to natural disasters such as 2004's tsunami and Hurricane Katrina, and in response to the world's increasingly threatened supply of clean, drinkable water, the Lifesaver 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a simple-to-use, chemical-free water purification system that removes water-borne pathogens and reduces chemical residues from the water making it safe to drink anywhere. The world's first all-in-one ultra filtration water bottle, the Lifesaver Bottle makes easy-to-use, portable water filtration a reality for travelers and outdoors people everywhere.The Lifesaver bottle eliminates the need for iodine tablets, tedious boiling, chemicals, tubes, shaking, scrubbing, waiting, and effort from the water purification process. The bottle uses a long-term use replaceable filter, which can treat about 6,000 liters of water, eight years of usage if you drank two liters of water every day. The bottle has a unique feature, which shuts the filter off when the cartridge has expired so you can get the maximum life out of your filter without the risk of drinking contaminated water.The Lifesaver Bottle filters out all water-borne pathogens using a filter with holes 15 nanometers across to prevent even the smallest viruses, 25 nanometers across, to cross the filter, eliminating the need for chemicals to treat the water. The Lifesaver Bottle is fitted with a 6000UF replaceable purification cartridge that removes bacteria, viruses, cysts, parasites, fungi, and all other microbiological water-borne pathogens from your water.The Lifesaver Bottle also comes with an activated carbon filter, made of a high specification activated carbon block which reduces a broad spectrum of chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metals such as lead and copper. The Carbon filter also eliminates bad tastes and odors from contaminates such as chlorine and sulphur. The carbon filter is designed to last for approximately 250 liters.In addition to the purification cartridge and carbon filter, the Lifesaver Bottle is supplied with a pre-filter disc. The pre-filter disc protects the membranes of the purification cartridge from objects such as gravel, sand, sticks, and mud, prolonging the overall life of the cartridge. Your pre-filter disc may also be used as a sponge to soak up water from those hard-to-reach areas like cracks in rocks or shallow puddles.Exceptionally easy to use, the Lifesaver Bottle filters water on demand at the time of collection. Simply unscrew the base, dip the bottle in the nearest water source, and pump the water through the filter to a teat at the other end, purifying up to 750 milliliters of water in just under a minute. The clean water can be drank immediately, directly from the Lifesaver bottle or poured into a separate container for storage. Designed to work at any angle and in any axis, not only are you able to drink from the bottle in any position, but you can also fill mugs, water bottles, pans, and other water storage vessels from any position.The Lifesaver Bottle utilizes failsafe technology to protect you from drinking contaminated water toward the end of the filter cartridge's life. As the cartridge approaches the end of its life, the bottle requires a greater number of pumps to induce water to flow. When no more water can be induced to flow despite continuous pumping, the cartridge has expired and it is time to replace it.The Lifesaver Bottle is designed not to over-pressurize as a safety feature to prevent injury. Over-pumping the bottle will cause the flip lid to bulge. If pumping continues, then the teat will open and release the water and the pressure.Due to its unique pneumatic action, the Lifesaver Bottle can be used to direct a jet of sanitized water directly onto a wound, cleaning away any contaminants, allowing for levels of wound irrigation never before possible in the field.Winner of the \"Best Technological Development for Future Soldier System Enhancement\" at Soldier Technology 2007, the Lifesaver bottle has earned the trust of the armed forces in delivering safe water anywhere in the world. Tested and approved for use by the United States EPA, the UK Water Compliance Guidelines, and the European Drinking Water Directive Council, the Lifesaver 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a portable water purification system that you can rely on.Filter Specifications:Cartridge service rating: 6,000 liters (1,585 U.S. gallons)Replaceable activated carbon filterReplaceable UF cartridgeBacteria retention: >99.999995 % (log 7.5)(2)Virus retention: >99.999 % (log5)(3)Activated carbon reduces chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metalsBottle Specifications:Bottle storage capacity: 750 millilitersChew-proof, replaceable drinking teatWatertight, snap-fit lidCap sealPump tubeProtective sleeveRemovable anti-slip baseTwist lock pump handleDry weight of bottle including cartridge: 635 grams (approximately 22 ounces)Operating Specifications:Minimum operating temperature: >0 degrees Celsius, 32 degrees FahrenheitMaximum operating temperature: 50 degrees Celsius, 122 degrees FahrenheitMinimum storage temperature: -10 degrees Celsius, 14 degrees FahrenheitMaximum storage temperature: 60 degrees Celsius, 140 degrees FahrenheitInitial flow rate: 2.5 liters per minute at 0.25 Bar(1)Flow rates and capacity depend on the quality of the feed waterAfter first use, the product should be protected against freezingCompliance and Testing Specifications:U.S. compliance EPA: U.S. National Primary Drinking Water Regulations under the Safe Drinking Water Act 93-523UK compliance: Water Supply (Water Quality) Regulations 2000EU compliance: European Drinking Water Directive Council, Directive 98/83/ECTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Escherichia coli NCTC 10418 in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Poliovirus Type 1 (Sabin vaccine strain) in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with US Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesManufacturer WarrantyTwo-year international limited warranty", "text": "Lifesaver Bottle 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle Developed in response to natural disasters such as 2004's tsunami and Hurricane Katrina, and in response to the world's increasingly threatened supply of clean, drinkable water, the Lifesaver 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a simple-to-use, chemical-free water purification system that removes water-borne pathogens and reduces chemical residues from the water making it safe to drink anywhere. The world's first all-in-one ultra filtration water bottle, the Lifesaver Bottle makes easy-to-use, portable water filtration a reality for travelers and outdoors people everywhere.The Lifesaver bottle eliminates the need for iodine tablets, tedious boiling, chemicals, tubes, shaking, scrubbing, waiting, and effort from the water purification process. The bottle uses a long-term use replaceable filter, which can treat about 6,000 liters of water, eight years of usage if you drank two liters of water every day. The bottle has a unique feature, which shuts the filter off when the cartridge has expired so you can get the maximum life out of your filter without the risk of drinking contaminated water.The Lifesaver Bottle filters out all water-borne pathogens using a filter with holes 15 nanometers across to prevent even the smallest viruses, 25 nanometers across, to cross the filter, eliminating the need for chemicals to treat the water. The Lifesaver Bottle is fitted with a 6000UF replaceable purification cartridge that removes bacteria, viruses, cysts, parasites, fungi, and all other microbiological water-borne pathogens from your water.The Lifesaver Bottle also comes with an activated carbon filter, made of a high specification activated carbon block which reduces a broad spectrum of chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metals such as lead and copper. The Carbon filter also eliminates bad tastes and odors from contaminates such as chlorine and sulphur. The carbon filter is designed to last for approximately 250 liters.In addition to the purification cartridge and carbon filter, the Lifesaver Bottle is supplied with a pre-filter disc. The pre-filter disc protects the membranes of the purification cartridge from objects such as gravel, sand, sticks, and mud, prolonging the overall life of the cartridge. Your pre-filter disc may also be used as a sponge to soak up water from those hard-to-reach areas like cracks in rocks or shallow puddles.Exceptionally easy to use, the Lifesaver Bottle filters water on demand at the time of collection. Simply unscrew the base, dip the bottle in the nearest water source, and pump the water through the filter to a teat at the other end, purifying up to 750 milliliters of water in just under a minute. The clean water can be drank immediately, directly from the Lifesaver bottle or poured into a separate container for storage. Designed to work at any angle and in any axis, not only are you able to drink from the bottle in any position, but you can also fill mugs, water bottles, pans, and other water storage vessels from any position.The Lifesaver Bottle utilizes failsafe technology to protect you from drinking contaminated water toward the end of the filter cartridge's life. As the cartridge approaches the end of its life, the bottle requires a greater number of pumps to induce water to flow. When no more water can be induced to flow despite continuous pumping, the cartridge has expired and it is time to replace it.The Lifesaver Bottle is designed not to over-pressurize as a safety feature to prevent injury. Over-pumping the bottle will cause the flip lid to bulge. If pumping continues, then the teat will open and release the water and the pressure.Due to its unique pneumatic action, the Lifesaver Bottle can be used to direct a jet of sanitized water directly onto a wound, cleaning away any contaminants, allowing for levels of wound irrigation never before possible in the field.Winner of the \"Best Technological Development for Future Soldier System Enhancement\" at Soldier Technology 2007, the Lifesaver bottle has earned the trust of the armed forces in delivering safe water anywhere in the world. Tested and approved for use by the United States EPA, the UK Water Compliance Guidelines, and the European Drinking Water Directive Council, the Lifesaver 6000 Ultra Filtration Water Bottle is a portable water purification system that you can rely on.Filter Specifications:Cartridge service rating: 6,000 liters (1,585 U.S. gallons)Replaceable activated carbon filterReplaceable UF cartridgeBacteria retention: >99.999995 % (log 7.5)(2)Virus retention: >99.999 % (log5)(3)Activated carbon reduces chemical residues including: pesticides, endocrine disrupting compounds, medical residues, and heavy metalsBottle Specifications:Bottle storage capacity: 750 millilitersChew-proof, replaceable drinking teatWatertight, snap-fit lidCap sealPump tubeProtective sleeveRemovable anti-slip baseTwist lock pump handleDry weight of bottle including cartridge: 635 grams (approximately 22 ounces)Operating Specifications:Minimum operating temperature: >0 degrees Celsius, 32 degrees FahrenheitMaximum operating temperature: 50 degrees Celsius, 122 degrees FahrenheitMinimum storage temperature: -10 degrees Celsius, 14 degrees FahrenheitMaximum storage temperature: 60 degrees Celsius, 140 degrees FahrenheitInitial flow rate: 2.5 liters per minute at 0.25 Bar(1)Flow rates and capacity depend on the quality of the feed waterAfter first use, the product should be protected against freezingCompliance and Testing Specifications:U.S. compliance EPA: U.S. National Primary Drinking Water Regulations under the Safe Drinking Water Act 93-523UK compliance: Water Supply (Water Quality) Regulations 2000EU compliance: European Drinking Water Directive Council, Directive 98/83/ECTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Escherichia coli NCTC 10418 in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesTested by London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine using Poliovirus Type 1 (Sabin vaccine strain) in accordance with the Protocol for Microbiological Water Purifiers in accordance with US Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) guidelinesManufacturer WarrantyTwo-year international limited warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315VAeXFKlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EHF99K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifesaver Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 222.73}}
{"item_id": "B001EHJ3H4", "title": "Kershaw LFK Pocket Knife", "description": "The LFK has the features many customers prefer in a smaller carrying knife lightweight, an attractive look, and a comfortable price. The LFK's light weight is made possible, in part, by its anodized 6061-T6 aircraft-aluminum handles. Anodized aluminum is very durable and the permanent matte black finish is highly scratch-resistant. The LFK also offers a compact blade of AUS6A high-carbon stainless steel. The knife features a thumb stud for Kershaw's super-smooth, one-handed, manual opening. A stainless-steel locking liner holds the blade securely in position after the blade is deployed.", "text": "Kershaw LFK Pocket Knife The LFK has the features many customers prefer in a smaller carrying knife lightweight, an attractive look, and a comfortable price. The LFK's light weight is made possible, in part, by its anodized 6061-T6 aircraft-aluminum handles. Anodized aluminum is very durable and the permanent matte black finish is highly scratch-resistant. The LFK also offers a compact blade of AUS6A high-carbon stainless steel. The knife features a thumb stud for Kershaw's super-smooth, one-handed, manual opening. A stainless-steel locking liner holds the blade securely in position after the blade is deployed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2185MSMg%2BLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EHJ3H4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EI70HI", "title": "Fobus Roto Evolution Series RH Paddle SWMPRP S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40", "description": "The Evolution series is the next step in the advancement of holster development. A tension adjustment screw is incorporated to allow the user to customize the ease of presentation and the security of retention, functioning with the proven FOBUS passive retention design.The new E2 series features one-piece holster body construction, and like all FOBUS Holsters, the Evolution, is lightweight and includes steel reinforced rivet attachment and a protective sight channel. The paddle also includes a rubberized insert to provide both comfort and stability. FEATURES: Tension adjustment screw, Steel reinforced rivet attachment system, Protective sight channel", "text": "Fobus Roto Evolution Series RH Paddle SWMPRP S&W M&P 9mm, .40, .45 (compact & full size), SD 9 &40 The Evolution series is the next step in the advancement of holster development. A tension adjustment screw is incorporated to allow the user to customize the ease of presentation and the security of retention, functioning with the proven FOBUS passive retention design.The new E2 series features one-piece holster body construction, and like all FOBUS Holsters, the Evolution, is lightweight and includes steel reinforced rivet attachment and a protective sight channel. The paddle also includes a rubberized insert to provide both comfort and stability. FEATURES: Tension adjustment screw, Steel reinforced rivet attachment system, Protective sight channel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313ijojZ5KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EI70HI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B001EI7578", "title": "Spyderco Tenacious Plain Edge Knife", "description": "Being tenacious means one holds fast. It means being tough and tireless until achieving your goal: all knife-worthy definitions for a worthy knife. This mid-sizedTenacious Plain Edge Knife by Spyderco has a black G-10 laminate handle, milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The 8Cr13Mov stainless blade is leaf-shaped and ground flat from spine to cutting edge for cutting performance. The blade's shape coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Screw together construction.Weight 4oz (115g).", "text": "Spyderco Tenacious Plain Edge Knife Being tenacious means one holds fast. It means being tough and tireless until achieving your goal: all knife-worthy definitions for a worthy knife. This mid-sizedTenacious Plain Edge Knife by Spyderco has a black G-10 laminate handle, milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Tucked inside are skeletonized steel liners increasing the handle's rigidity and strength without adding non-functioning weight or bulky thickness. The 8Cr13Mov stainless blade is leaf-shaped and ground flat from spine to cutting edge for cutting performance. The blade's shape coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole and textured spine jimping allow you to open the blade and position your thumb on the spine in slip-proof confidence ready for work. A Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner) and a 4-way pocket clip lets you set your carry and draw preference: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Screw together construction.Weight 4oz (115g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2145MDJwGDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EI7578.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 38.38}}
{"item_id": "B001EI75CI", "title": "Delica4 FRN Trainer Knife", "description": "Trainers or drones are non-sharpened knives that allow for the safe practice of Martial Blade Craft (MBC). They let the user learn deployment/retrieval techniques, perform drills, and develop confidence and muscle memory without risking cutting themselves or others with a sharp blade. The Delica Trainer is identical in weight and size to the 'live' model. To enhance the balance of the piece we've tapered the unsharpened tip and drilled holes through the blade, removing unnecessary bulk. Volcano grip texturing on both sides of the handle put the brakes on your hand slipping while training. All Spyderco training models have red handles designating them as non-sharpened. Tip-up carry. Delica trainers also fit the bill as a unsharpened practice knife to safely teach non-knife people the fundamental movements in safely opening and closing a folder.", "text": "Delica4 FRN Trainer Knife Trainers or drones are non-sharpened knives that allow for the safe practice of Martial Blade Craft (MBC). They let the user learn deployment/retrieval techniques, perform drills, and develop confidence and muscle memory without risking cutting themselves or others with a sharp blade. The Delica Trainer is identical in weight and size to the 'live' model. To enhance the balance of the piece we've tapered the unsharpened tip and drilled holes through the blade, removing unnecessary bulk. Volcano grip texturing on both sides of the handle put the brakes on your hand slipping while training. All Spyderco training models have red handles designating them as non-sharpened. Tip-up carry. Delica trainers also fit the bill as a unsharpened practice knife to safely teach non-knife people the fundamental movements in safely opening and closing a folder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mRimRUhbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EI75CI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 62.95}}
{"item_id": "B001EI82P2", "title": "GSG-5 4 Reticle Red/green Dot Sight with Low Mount Combo", "description": "Brand Name: CoiTAC California This red/green dot sight includes 4 separate options for shooting accuracy. using the fish tail style rear selector, you can easily switch between 4 different reticles. Using a safe, battery-powered red LED light to point where you're aiming, this tool helps train your eye for dead-center accuracy. The heads up display provides unlimited eye relief and field of view, and allows you to control brightness via the three-position rheostat knob. Built for durable long life from anodized aluminum, the unit comes with an integrated weaver-style mount and tool for easy attachment to a wide variety of weapons. included are an extra CR2032 battery, lens cover, and mounting tool. Specifications: 4 different reticle patterns: Circle Dot Reticle Cross Reticle 10 MOA Reticle 3 MOA Reticle 3-position rheostat Screen Size = 22x33 mm Unlimited eye relief Unlimited field-of view Standard Weaver Mount Fits easily on handguns, shotguns and rifles Powered by lithium battery included are an extra CR2032 battery, lens cover, and allen wrench tool. GSG-5 mount spec: MATERIAL TYPE: ALUMINUM RAIL TYPE: PICATINNY WEAVER RAIL LENGTH (inch):n/a COLOR: BLACK NET WEIGHT (OZ): 2.5 GROSS WEIGHT (OZ): 4.92", "text": "GSG-5 4 Reticle Red/green Dot Sight with Low Mount Combo Brand Name: CoiTAC California This red/green dot sight includes 4 separate options for shooting accuracy. using the fish tail style rear selector, you can easily switch between 4 different reticles. Using a safe, battery-powered red LED light to point where you're aiming, this tool helps train your eye for dead-center accuracy. The heads up display provides unlimited eye relief and field of view, and allows you to control brightness via the three-position rheostat knob. Built for durable long life from anodized aluminum, the unit comes with an integrated weaver-style mount and tool for easy attachment to a wide variety of weapons. included are an extra CR2032 battery, lens cover, and mounting tool. Specifications: 4 different reticle patterns: Circle Dot Reticle Cross Reticle 10 MOA Reticle 3 MOA Reticle 3-position rheostat Screen Size = 22x33 mm Unlimited eye relief Unlimited field-of view Standard Weaver Mount Fits easily on handguns, shotguns and rifles Powered by lithium battery included are an extra CR2032 battery, lens cover, and allen wrench tool. GSG-5 mount spec: MATERIAL TYPE: ALUMINUM RAIL TYPE: PICATINNY WEAVER RAIL LENGTH (inch):n/a COLOR: BLACK NET WEIGHT (OZ): 2.5 GROSS WEIGHT (OZ): 4.92", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412955DJdxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EI82P2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat Optical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 33.16}}
{"item_id": "B001EIAFXY", "title": "Spyderco Dragonfly Stainless Steel Plain Edge Knife", "description": "Made of premium VG-10 stainless, the leaf-shaped blade is flat-ground with a thin-honed performance cutting edge. Poised above the Spyderco Round Hole is a point to set the thumb on, which provides purchase and control while cutting.", "text": "Spyderco Dragonfly Stainless Steel Plain Edge Knife Made of premium VG-10 stainless, the leaf-shaped blade is flat-ground with a thin-honed performance cutting edge. Poised above the Spyderco Round Hole is a point to set the thumb on, which provides purchase and control while cutting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rErTkdMzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EIAFXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 60.0}}
{"item_id": "B001EIAI7M", "title": "Spyderco Caly 3 Carbon Fiber Handle Folding Knife", "description": "As the name implies, the Caly3 is the newest iteration of the Calypso2 and Calypso1 knives. Like comparing a classic Corvette to a modern Corvette, the Caly3 is an offshoot of the original Calypsos--a testament to the knives' durability and long-lasting appeal--but with improved functionality and design. The Caly3 features a high-end, laminated ZDP-189 steel blade made using 3 percent carbon, making it harder and higher on the Rockwell scale while preserving the sharpness. The blade is versatile and exact, with a PlainEdge that's ground flat for precise cutting. The buffed carbon-fiber handle, meanwhile, is shaped so that the index finger sits on the underside and the thumb naturally above the jimped slip-resistant spine. As a result, the knife feels like part of the hand, with a controlled grip and no forward or backward slide while cutting. Other features include an ambidextrous deep-pocket-carry tip-up wire clip and a mid-positioned back lock.SpecificationsBlade: Laminated SDP-189 steelHandle: Buffed carbon fiberBlade length: 3 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchCutting edge: 2-5/8 inchesHole diameter: 15/32 inchesOverall length: 7 inchesClosed length: 4-1/16 inchesWeight: 3 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Caly 3 Carbon Fiber Handle Folding Knife As the name implies, the Caly3 is the newest iteration of the Calypso2 and Calypso1 knives. Like comparing a classic Corvette to a modern Corvette, the Caly3 is an offshoot of the original Calypsos--a testament to the knives' durability and long-lasting appeal--but with improved functionality and design. The Caly3 features a high-end, laminated ZDP-189 steel blade made using 3 percent carbon, making it harder and higher on the Rockwell scale while preserving the sharpness. The blade is versatile and exact, with a PlainEdge that's ground flat for precise cutting. The buffed carbon-fiber handle, meanwhile, is shaped so that the index finger sits on the underside and the thumb naturally above the jimped slip-resistant spine. As a result, the knife feels like part of the hand, with a controlled grip and no forward or backward slide while cutting. Other features include an ambidextrous deep-pocket-carry tip-up wire clip and a mid-positioned back lock.SpecificationsBlade: Laminated SDP-189 steelHandle: Buffed carbon fiberBlade length: 3 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchCutting edge: 2-5/8 inchesHole diameter: 15/32 inchesOverall length: 7 inchesClosed length: 4-1/16 inchesWeight: 3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21NQd9jLLhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EIAI7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 128.63}}
{"item_id": "B001EIALK6", "title": "Ka-Bar Short Tanto Point Serrated Knife, Black", "description": "A compact, stout tanto blade is fiercely rugged and appropriate for piercing through the toughest materials.", "text": "Ka-Bar Short Tanto Point Serrated Knife, Black A compact, stout tanto blade is fiercely rugged and appropriate for piercing through the toughest materials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21tXTGLRV3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EIALK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 48.89}}
{"item_id": "B001EIB05G", "title": "Shimano Derailleur Cable End Cap X10 (Silver, 1.2-mm)", "description": "Shimano alloy cable ends to keep cables from fraying.", "text": "Shimano Derailleur Cable End Cap X10 (Silver, 1.2-mm) Shimano alloy cable ends to keep cables from fraying.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415aOXdFwLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EIB05G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 4.9}}
{"item_id": "B001EICP7S", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Jungle Bowie, 11-Inch UltraBlaC2, Black Handle, Leather Sheath", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Jungle Bowie, 11-Inch UltraBlaC2, Black Handle, Leather Sheath CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21AV2hom0aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EICP7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 48.88}}
{"item_id": "B001EICW7G", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SE37-K Seal Team Elite Knife Partially Serrated Fixed Heat Treated 7-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SE37-K Seal Team Elite Knife Partially Serrated Fixed Heat Treated 7-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pLL9B3wcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EICW7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 98.25}}
