{"item_id": "B001EJ83CI", "title": "Vedante Super Reflective Pop Bands (Pair) in Sustainable Packaging", "description": "Be Cool, be Safe be Seen! Set (2 bands) of Super Reflective arm/leg bands for 360 degree visibility in low light conditions. Use for: biking, walking, jogging, dog walking, in night clubs or just for fun. We recommend wearing at least 2-4 Pop Bands to create 360 degree visibility. Can be worn on arms, ankles, wrists, bike handles, baby carriages, back packs, over non-slick jackets and more. Available in size Medium (30cm/11.75 inch) or Large (38cm/14.75 inch). Colors: Blue, Green, Tangerine, White, Yellow, Pink.", "text": "Vedante Super Reflective Pop Bands (Pair) in Sustainable Packaging Be Cool, be Safe be Seen! Set (2 bands) of Super Reflective arm/leg bands for 360 degree visibility in low light conditions. Use for: biking, walking, jogging, dog walking, in night clubs or just for fun. We recommend wearing at least 2-4 Pop Bands to create 360 degree visibility. Can be worn on arms, ankles, wrists, bike handles, baby carriages, back packs, over non-slick jackets and more. Available in size Medium (30cm/11.75 inch) or Large (38cm/14.75 inch). Colors: Blue, Green, Tangerine, White, Yellow, Pink.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q14U4lvJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EJ83CI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EJI6CK", "title": "48 Square Feet ( 12 tiles + borders) 'We Sell Mats' Charcoal Gray 2' x 2' x 3/8\" Anti-Fatigue Interlocking EVA Foam Exercise Gym Flooring", "description": "This item by \"We Sell Mats\" is designed by our product engineers with quality, durability and value in mind. Because all \"We Sell Mats\" branded items are sold specifically be \"We Sell Mats\", you can always be confident that you will receive a quality product at a great price. Comes with twelve new charcoal gray tiles. Each measuring 2' x 2' for a total of 48 square feet. Each tile measures 3/8\" thick. Borders are included. Perfect for ages 3+. Provides a cushion to hard floor surfaces in gyms, exercise rooms, trade shows, playrooms, etc.", "text": "48 Square Feet ( 12 tiles + borders) 'We Sell Mats' Charcoal Gray 2' x 2' x 3/8\" Anti-Fatigue Interlocking EVA Foam Exercise Gym Flooring This item by \"We Sell Mats\" is designed by our product engineers with quality, durability and value in mind. Because all \"We Sell Mats\" branded items are sold specifically be \"We Sell Mats\", you can always be confident that you will receive a quality product at a great price. Comes with twelve new charcoal gray tiles. Each measuring 2' x 2' for a total of 48 square feet. Each tile measures 3/8\" thick. Borders are included. Perfect for ages 3+. Provides a cushion to hard floor surfaces in gyms, exercise rooms, trade shows, playrooms, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rlKQLZ5HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EJI6CK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001EJMS6K", "title": "Iron Gym Total Upper Body Workout Bar", "description": "Strengthen your back, biceps, and other upper body muscles in the comfort of your living room or dorm with the Iron Gym workout bar. Designed to fit conveniently in most doorway frames or sit on the floor for pushups, dips, and sit-ups, the Iron Gym is an ideal choice for people who want to get fit without buying expensive, space-intensive weight sets. When installed in the doorway, the device lets you perform pull-ups and chin-ups, with three grip positions--narrow, neutral, and wide--for working the inner and outer back. Once you're done with your back workout, you can quickly move the Iron Gym to the floor, where you can perform pushups while facing down, tricep dips while facing the other way, or sit-ups using the Iron Gym for foot stability.The Iron Gym--whose durable steel frame installs quickly without tools or fasteners--holds up to 300 pounds and is designed to fit residential doorways 24 to 32 inches wide, with doorway trim or molding up to 3.5 inches wide.", "text": "Iron Gym Total Upper Body Workout Bar Strengthen your back, biceps, and other upper body muscles in the comfort of your living room or dorm with the Iron Gym workout bar. Designed to fit conveniently in most doorway frames or sit on the floor for pushups, dips, and sit-ups, the Iron Gym is an ideal choice for people who want to get fit without buying expensive, space-intensive weight sets. When installed in the doorway, the device lets you perform pull-ups and chin-ups, with three grip positions--narrow, neutral, and wide--for working the inner and outer back. Once you're done with your back workout, you can quickly move the Iron Gym to the floor, where you can perform pushups while facing down, tricep dips while facing the other way, or sit-ups using the Iron Gym for foot stability.The Iron Gym--whose durable steel frame installs quickly without tools or fasteners--holds up to 300 pounds and is designed to fit residential doorways 24 to 32 inches wide, with doorway trim or molding up to 3.5 inches wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31on-yLI1AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EJMS6K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Iron Gym", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 28.85}}
