{"item_id": "B001EO5IIU", "title": "Sugoi Subzero Skull Cap", "description": "Pull out the big guns when the weather turns nasty. The SUGOI SubZero is our warmest option for head warmth when you don't let the weather tell you when to do the sports you love.", "text": "Sugoi Subzero Skull Cap Pull out the big guns when the weather turns nasty. The SUGOI SubZero is our warmest option for head warmth when you don't let the weather tell you when to do the sports you love.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XcoUciL5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EO5IIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SUGOi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Caps"]], "price": 17.85}}
{"item_id": "B001EOWGB2", "title": "Stansport Mosquito Head Net", "description": "Keep mosquitos and other flying pests off your face and head. Stansport's Mosquito Head Net features fine mesh to keep insects out and an elastic neck for a snug fit. Designed to fit comfortably over most headwear. A safe and effective way to stay bug free without the use of chemicals. Lightweight and easy to carry anywhere.", "text": "Stansport Mosquito Head Net Keep mosquitos and other flying pests off your face and head. Stansport's Mosquito Head Net features fine mesh to keep insects out and an elastic neck for a snug fit. Designed to fit comfortably over most headwear. A safe and effective way to stay bug free without the use of chemicals. Lightweight and easy to carry anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51m659AW3jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EOWGB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]]}}
