{"item_id": "B001EU9M1S", "title": "Thera-Band Latex Exercise Band Pack - Light - 1 Thin/1 Medium/1Heavy - 5.5\" X 5'", "description": "The only resistive exercise bands endorsed by the American Physical Therapy Association (APTA). Ideal for building upper and lower body strength for rehabilitation or fitness. Whether building strength after shoulder or knee surgery or improving athletic performance, our bands, tubing and corresponding resistance exercise programs can be easily and economically used for any exercise program. The progressive resistance of our products parallels the basic concepts of building strength and mobility. As each level is mastered, the resistance can be increased with ability. The use of elastic resistance rather than weight-bearing exercises minimizes pressure on the joints and decreases the possibility of incurring other injuries. They can be used while traveling, sitting at home or even in the office. Uses for the Thera-Band Bands include: exercise, gym, balance, fitness, birthing, yoga, pilates, and stability and resistance.", "text": "Thera-Band Latex Exercise Band Pack - Light - 1 Thin/1 Medium/1Heavy - 5.5\" X 5' The only resistive exercise bands endorsed by the American Physical Therapy Association (APTA). Ideal for building upper and lower body strength for rehabilitation or fitness. Whether building strength after shoulder or knee surgery or improving athletic performance, our bands, tubing and corresponding resistance exercise programs can be easily and economically used for any exercise program. The progressive resistance of our products parallels the basic concepts of building strength and mobility. As each level is mastered, the resistance can be increased with ability. The use of elastic resistance rather than weight-bearing exercises minimizes pressure on the joints and decreases the possibility of incurring other injuries. They can be used while traveling, sitting at home or even in the office. Uses for the Thera-Band Bands include: exercise, gym, balance, fitness, birthing, yoga, pilates, and stability and resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n5oz3--cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EU9M1S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TheraBand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 11.9}}
{"item_id": "B001EUL2DO", "title": "RAD Sportz Kayak Hoist Lift Garage Storage Canoe Hoists (Lifetime Warranty), 125-Pound Capacity", "description": "Tired of your canoes and kayaks taking up all your free space in the garage? Turn to the Rad Sportz kayak/canoe lift hoist, which stores your boat overhead and out of the way. The hoist is equipped with a smooth pulley, latch, and hook system, which let you easily lift products as heavy as 100 pounds. Just attach the pulleys to a ceiling joist, secure the boat with the straps and hooks, and lift. The exclusive rope locking mechanism will keep your kayak or canoe safely suspended above the ground, so you needn't worry about accidentally dropping the boat in mid-lift. Plus, the hooks are rubber coated to protect your gear from scratches and scuffs. Designed for ceilings up to 12 feet tall, the hoist also works with items like bicycles, ladders, and cargo boxes.", "text": "RAD Sportz Kayak Hoist Lift Garage Storage Canoe Hoists (Lifetime Warranty), 125-Pound Capacity Tired of your canoes and kayaks taking up all your free space in the garage? Turn to the Rad Sportz kayak/canoe lift hoist, which stores your boat overhead and out of the way. The hoist is equipped with a smooth pulley, latch, and hook system, which let you easily lift products as heavy as 100 pounds. Just attach the pulleys to a ceiling joist, secure the boat with the straps and hooks, and lift. The exclusive rope locking mechanism will keep your kayak or canoe safely suspended above the ground, so you needn't worry about accidentally dropping the boat in mid-lift. Plus, the hooks are rubber coated to protect your gear from scratches and scuffs. Designed for ceilings up to 12 feet tall, the hoist also works with items like bicycles, ladders, and cargo boxes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31w6sCIEqAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EUL2DO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RAD Sportz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Cabin Products", "Storage"]], "price": 27.55}}
{"item_id": "B001EULPY0", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 3mm Five Finger Glove", "description": "The 3-millimeter Neoprene Five-Finger Wetsuit Gloves from NeoSports are built to deliver both abrasion and thermal protection without sacrificing finger dexterity. The high quality neoprene flexes easily while the hi-grip, cyclone textured palms ensure secure handling of lights, slates, and other small items. Thanks to glued and sewn seams and Gator elastic closures that fit easily over wetsuit sleeves, the gloves provide a secure and streamlined water seal.", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 3mm Five Finger Glove The 3-millimeter Neoprene Five-Finger Wetsuit Gloves from NeoSports are built to deliver both abrasion and thermal protection without sacrificing finger dexterity. The high quality neoprene flexes easily while the hi-grip, cyclone textured palms ensure secure handling of lights, slates, and other small items. Thanks to glued and sewn seams and Gator elastic closures that fit easily over wetsuit sleeves, the gloves provide a secure and streamlined water seal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SKi5w7u%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EULPY0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001EV6DVE", "title": "Allen Company Assault Rifle Case with Removable Pouch and Oversized Pocket (42-Inch)", "description": "Allen Camo Assault Rifle Case. Keep your firearm safe, secure and at-the-ready: Durable, no-nonsense camo endura shell; 7/8\" foam padding; Removeable ammo pouch; Built-in, heavy-duty web sling; 42\" long.; Order Yours Today! Allen Camo Assault Rifle Case", "text": "Allen Company Assault Rifle Case with Removable Pouch and Oversized Pocket (42-Inch) Allen Camo Assault Rifle Case. Keep your firearm safe, secure and at-the-ready: Durable, no-nonsense camo endura shell; 7/8\" foam padding; Removeable ammo pouch; Built-in, heavy-duty web sling; 42\" long.; Order Yours Today! Allen Camo Assault Rifle Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EAA7HWd9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EV6DVE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 39.99}}
