{"item_id": "B001EWNEC4", "title": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Compact, Pink Case & Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "\"Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Cool style and hot protection are combined in SABRE's most popular key chain design. This sleek, compact defense pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE allows for protection at a safe distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range, and its quick release key ring ensures its accessible when needed! Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide! Agencies using SABRE products include the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department and US Marshals. Please Note: This item is not available to ship to certain states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE Pepper Spray - Advanced 3-In-1 Police Strength - Compact, Pink Case & Quick Release Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more) \"Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Cool style and hot protection are combined in SABRE's most popular key chain design. This sleek, compact defense pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE allows for protection at a safe distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range, and its quick release key ring ensures its accessible when needed! Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide! Agencies using SABRE products include the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department and US Marshals. Please Note: This item is not available to ship to certain states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Sk51nVy3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EWNEC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001EXOA3K", "title": "Light My Fire Original BPA-Free Tritan Spork with Full-Sized Spoon, Fork and Serrated Knife Edge", "description": "The perfectly designed outdoor eating utensil. The Light My Fire spoon-fork-knife combo brings a bit of civilization to the wild and a bit of the wild to civilization. Tritan plastic is BPA-free, won't scratch cookware, won't melt in in boiling water and is dishwasher safe. The Spork is perfect for your backpack, boat, picnic basket, lunchbox, purse or briefcase. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall.", "text": "Light My Fire Original BPA-Free Tritan Spork with Full-Sized Spoon, Fork and Serrated Knife Edge The perfectly designed outdoor eating utensil. The Light My Fire spoon-fork-knife combo brings a bit of civilization to the wild and a bit of the wild to civilization. Tritan plastic is BPA-free, won't scratch cookware, won't melt in in boiling water and is dishwasher safe. The Spork is perfect for your backpack, boat, picnic basket, lunchbox, purse or briefcase. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315%2BGlkh8aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EXOA3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 0.01}}
{"item_id": "B001EYBNFW", "title": "TRUGLO 4X32 Camo Crossbow Scope With Mounting Rings", "description": "The TRUGLO 4 x 32 crossbow scope has a special range finding and trajectory compensating reticle. Generous 4\" eye relief. Fully-coated lenses provide maximum brightness, clarity and contrast. Rubber eye-guard. Fingertip windage and elevation adjustment under screw down caps. Durable leaf spring for windage and elevation adjustments. One-piece tube made of aircraft quality aluminum. Durable, scratch-resistant, non-reflective matte finish. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "text": "TRUGLO 4X32 Camo Crossbow Scope With Mounting Rings The TRUGLO 4 x 32 crossbow scope has a special range finding and trajectory compensating reticle. Generous 4\" eye relief. Fully-coated lenses provide maximum brightness, clarity and contrast. Rubber eye-guard. Fingertip windage and elevation adjustment under screw down caps. Durable leaf spring for windage and elevation adjustments. One-piece tube made of aircraft quality aluminum. Durable, scratch-resistant, non-reflective matte finish. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hwgfMnzIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EYBNFW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics"]], "price": 74.08}}
