{"item_id": "B001EYFK1U", "title": "Truglo Red-Dot 30Mm Dual Color Sight, Black", "description": "The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has a 5 MOA reticle designed for quick acquisition. Dual-color reticle illumination (red and green). Shock resistant to 1000g. Waterproof / fog-proof. Unlimited eye relief. Wide field of view. BONUS! See-thru / flip-up lens caps, optical-quality / all-weather. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / easy to mount. Multi-coated lenses produce more than 95 percent light transmittance. Special anti-reflective interior eliminates stray light from appearing inside the sight. Click windage and elevation adjustments. BONUS! Integrated lanyard system prevents loss of screw-down W/E caps. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Ideal for shotguns, handguns, rifles, muzzleloaders, paintball and crossbows. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "text": "Truglo Red-Dot 30Mm Dual Color Sight, Black The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has a 5 MOA reticle designed for quick acquisition. Dual-color reticle illumination (red and green). Shock resistant to 1000g. Waterproof / fog-proof. Unlimited eye relief. Wide field of view. BONUS! See-thru / flip-up lens caps, optical-quality / all-weather. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / easy to mount. Multi-coated lenses produce more than 95 percent light transmittance. Special anti-reflective interior eliminates stray light from appearing inside the sight. Click windage and elevation adjustments. BONUS! Integrated lanyard system prevents loss of screw-down W/E caps. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Ideal for shotguns, handguns, rifles, muzzleloaders, paintball and crossbows. Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410UXdKdylL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EYFK1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 50.9}}
{"item_id": "B001EYFUHO", "title": "100 - Pk. Bohning Blazer Vanes", "description": "100 - Pk. of Bohning Vanes... choose between the Killer or the Blazer for top - flight performance! Killer Vanes: Optimizing spin, maximizing accuracy and producing groups like you never thought possible! QuickSpin rotates arrows up to 300% faster than conventional vanes. Made from durable toughened plastic that sticks in seconds, QuickSpin is innovatively designed for trouble-free and incredibly accurate shooting in many conditions. Patented \"kicker\" and \"micro-grooves\" increase arrow spin for flatter trajectory and tighter groups through faster arrow spin. Blazer Vanes: Simply put, the Blazer's steering capabilities along with the silent, accurate flight will amaze you! The Blazer is a 2\" Vane that weighs only 5 grains and uses a combination of super strong material and the precise leading edge angle to maintain control of even the largest fixed blade broadheads. Hunting or target practice, they're up to the task! Also available is the Mini-Blazer.; Pick yours and State Color. Order Today! 100-Pk. Bohning Blazer Vanes", "text": "100 - Pk. Bohning Blazer Vanes 100 - Pk. of Bohning Vanes... choose between the Killer or the Blazer for top - flight performance! Killer Vanes: Optimizing spin, maximizing accuracy and producing groups like you never thought possible! QuickSpin rotates arrows up to 300% faster than conventional vanes. Made from durable toughened plastic that sticks in seconds, QuickSpin is innovatively designed for trouble-free and incredibly accurate shooting in many conditions. Patented \"kicker\" and \"micro-grooves\" increase arrow spin for flatter trajectory and tighter groups through faster arrow spin. Blazer Vanes: Simply put, the Blazer's steering capabilities along with the silent, accurate flight will amaze you! The Blazer is a 2\" Vane that weighs only 5 grains and uses a combination of super strong material and the precise leading edge angle to maintain control of even the largest fixed blade broadheads. Hunting or target practice, they're up to the task! Also available is the Mini-Blazer.; Pick yours and State Color. Order Today! 100-Pk. Bohning Blazer Vanes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xRw7qiFIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001EYFUHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bohning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 28.99}}
