{"item_id": "B001F0KCWU", "title": "Allen Company Light Weight Low Profile Sound Sensor Hearing Protection, NRR27", "description": "Allen Sound Sensor Ear Plug Plastic Pink 26dB Extra Cushions 2321 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Allen Company Light Weight Low Profile Sound Sensor Hearing Protection, NRR27 Allen Sound Sensor Ear Plug Plastic Pink 26dB Extra Cushions 2321 Please note: This supplier will be closed on 11/24, 11/25, 12/26 for the holidays. The shipping cut off is UPS's cut off of 12/15 to try and have the products delivered by Christmas. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VGA7X1w8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F0KCWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories"]], "price": 20.17}}
{"item_id": "B001F0KNBU", "title": "Allen Company 9/32 Field Points, 100 Grain", "description": "12-Pk. Allen 100-gr. Field Point Target Points... practice now, bullseye later! Slide these Target Points onto your carbon arrows to practice up for hunting season! The all-steel construction 100-gr. Points are 9/32\" in diameter. Shoot with confidence come bow season! Order your Target Points now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase this product. This product cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Allen 100-gr. Field Point Target Points, 12-Pk.", "text": "Allen Company 9/32 Field Points, 100 Grain 12-Pk. Allen 100-gr. Field Point Target Points... practice now, bullseye later! Slide these Target Points onto your carbon arrows to practice up for hunting season! The all-steel construction 100-gr. Points are 9/32\" in diameter. Shoot with confidence come bow season! Order your Target Points now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase this product. This product cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Allen 100-gr. Field Point Target Points, 12-Pk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316NPVpikgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F0KNBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Points"]], "price": 6.27}}
