{"item_id": "B001F0M2IM", "title": "Champion Bench Shooting Bags (Large Filled)", "description": "For your next day at the range, treat yourself to the most comfortable shooting bags available. The Bench Rest Shooting Bags from Shooters Ridge are a pair of ready to use rugged shooting bags with a suede surface that keeps your firearm snug and level. With the ability to be clipped together, the Bench Rest Shooting Bags are easy to transport and store.Make every shot count with a sturdy shooting bag from Shooters Ridge. Each of our shooting bags is designed to provide a steady hold while protecting your firearm from scratches and dents. Get the most rugged, accurate rests on the market. Turn to Shooters Ridge.", "text": "Champion Bench Shooting Bags (Large Filled) For your next day at the range, treat yourself to the most comfortable shooting bags available. The Bench Rest Shooting Bags from Shooters Ridge are a pair of ready to use rugged shooting bags with a suede surface that keeps your firearm snug and level. With the ability to be clipped together, the Bench Rest Shooting Bags are easy to transport and store.Make every shot count with a sturdy shooting bag from Shooters Ridge. Each of our shooting bags is designed to provide a steady hold while protecting your firearm from scratches and dents. Get the most rugged, accurate rests on the market. Turn to Shooters Ridge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G1HWB98HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F0M2IM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooters Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]], "price": 49.59}}
