{"item_id": "B001F0O8KW", "title": "Lyman Revolution Gun Vise", "description": "This versatile gun vise is engineered with a full range of adjustments, it tilts, clamps and has inserts to securely hold any firearm. The padded contact points protect the firearm during cleaning, maintenance or gunsmithing, even bore sighting. Just look at the collection of features built into this - the amazing Lyman Revolution.", "text": "Lyman Revolution Gun Vise This versatile gun vise is engineered with a full range of adjustments, it tilts, clamps and has inserts to securely hold any firearm. The padded contact points protect the firearm during cleaning, maintenance or gunsmithing, even bore sighting. Just look at the collection of features built into this - the amazing Lyman Revolution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FbKE8TOxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F0O8KW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 80.5}}
