{"item_id": "B001F0S6IC", "title": "Elk Ridge Er-052 Fixed Blade Knife 9.5-Inch Overall", "description": "This beautiful Elk Ridge fixed blade knife is perfect for camping, hunting, fishing, whatever outdoor activity you have planned. With an overall length of 9.5\", the blade measures 5\". Setting this knife apart from others is it handsome 440 Stainless Steel blade with double blood grooves. The full tang handle with Pakkawood also has a hole for lanyard carry. Includes a genuine leather sheath.", "text": "Elk Ridge Er-052 Fixed Blade Knife 9.5-Inch Overall This beautiful Elk Ridge fixed blade knife is perfect for camping, hunting, fishing, whatever outdoor activity you have planned. With an overall length of 9.5\", the blade measures 5\". Setting this knife apart from others is it handsome 440 Stainless Steel blade with double blood grooves. The full tang handle with Pakkawood also has a hole for lanyard carry. Includes a genuine leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dMmCGdqJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F0S6IC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elk Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.1}}
{"item_id": "B001F1FVPC", "title": "Brave Soldier Friction Zone", "description": "Endurance sports formula. No petrolatum so safe for wet suits. Long lasting protection from any sports activity where gear chafing of your skin is a problem. Antibacterial formula helps prevent minor skin irritations.", "text": "Brave Soldier Friction Zone Endurance sports formula. No petrolatum so safe for wet suits. Long lasting protection from any sports activity where gear chafing of your skin is a problem. Antibacterial formula helps prevent minor skin irritations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LauSoxnWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F1FVPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brave Soldier", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Personal Care Products"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B001F1YI24", "title": "Seattle Sports Camp Bucket (Blue)", "description": "Conserve space and weight in your pack without sacrificing campsite functionality. The lightweight and super rugged Camp Bucket is ideal for hauling water to your campsite, washing dishes, and other camp chores. This dishwasher-safe bucket is constructed of 19-ounce vinyl-coated nylon and an abrasion-resistant bottom for long-lasting durability.Features and Specifications:Camp bucket for washing dishes, hauling water, and washing clothesDishwasher safeMade of vinyl-coated nylon for long-lasting durabilityHas an abrasion-resistant bottomHeight: 10.5 inches >li>Diameter: 9.5 inchesVolume: 735 cubic inchesCapacity: 12 litersWeight: 5.6 ounces", "text": "Seattle Sports Camp Bucket (Blue) Conserve space and weight in your pack without sacrificing campsite functionality. The lightweight and super rugged Camp Bucket is ideal for hauling water to your campsite, washing dishes, and other camp chores. This dishwasher-safe bucket is constructed of 19-ounce vinyl-coated nylon and an abrasion-resistant bottom for long-lasting durability.Features and Specifications:Camp bucket for washing dishes, hauling water, and washing clothesDishwasher safeMade of vinyl-coated nylon for long-lasting durabilityHas an abrasion-resistant bottomHeight: 10.5 inches >li>Diameter: 9.5 inchesVolume: 735 cubic inchesCapacity: 12 litersWeight: 5.6 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iGiV21vbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F1YI24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 13.97}}
{"item_id": "B001F1ZFPS", "title": "Heat Factory Premium Hand Warmer", "description": "Heat Factory's mini-size warmers are ideal for use inside gloves, mittens, pockets or any place where soothing heat is desired. The lightweight pouches provide reliable, even heat for 10 hours. Hand warmers are safe to use, odorless and non-toxic. The Heat Factory warmer is a soft, lightweight pouch containing a biodegradable mixture of iron powder, charcoal, salt, sawdust and vermiculite. When exposed to the air, an oxidation process takes place that generates heat. Heat Factory warmers are specially engineered to provide heat that is long-lasting, comfortable and even. Heat Factory continually tests its products to ensure that you receive only the highest quality warmers that will consistently deliver warmth as advertised. Once activated, Heat Factory warmers can even be saved for later use (preferably within a week) if placed in an airtight container. Unopened, the Heat Factory warmer has a shelf life of three years or more.", "text": "Heat Factory Premium Hand Warmer Heat Factory's mini-size warmers are ideal for use inside gloves, mittens, pockets or any place where soothing heat is desired. The lightweight pouches provide reliable, even heat for 10 hours. Hand warmers are safe to use, odorless and non-toxic. The Heat Factory warmer is a soft, lightweight pouch containing a biodegradable mixture of iron powder, charcoal, salt, sawdust and vermiculite. When exposed to the air, an oxidation process takes place that generates heat. Heat Factory warmers are specially engineered to provide heat that is long-lasting, comfortable and even. Heat Factory continually tests its products to ensure that you receive only the highest quality warmers that will consistently deliver warmth as advertised. Once activated, Heat Factory warmers can even be saved for later use (preferably within a week) if placed in an airtight container. Unopened, the Heat Factory warmer has a shelf life of three years or more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u3aQ5TkpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F1ZFPS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001F1ZPNA", "title": "Seattle Sports Solar Camp Shower 5 Gallon Capacity", "description": "The Camp Shower is great for washing off in the outdoors! Simply fill and leave in the sun until warm. Constructed of durable PVC, it comes with a separate fill cap, on/off valve, and a hanging/carrying handle. The Camp Shower is also great for washing off dirty hands and feet.", "text": "Seattle Sports Solar Camp Shower 5 Gallon Capacity The Camp Shower is great for washing off in the outdoors! Simply fill and leave in the sun until warm. Constructed of durable PVC, it comes with a separate fill cap, on/off valve, and a hanging/carrying handle. The Camp Shower is also great for washing off dirty hands and feet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-x%2B-IxoRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F1ZPNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 20.97}}
