{"item_id": "B001F2W726", "title": "Feedback Sports Flop Stop Handlebar Holder", "description": "The Feedback Sports System Flop Stop Handlebar Holder keeps your front end from flopping all over the place when you're wrenching on your bike. All that you have to do is, simply, attach the Flop Stop Handlebar Holder between the seatpost and bars, and you're set. In order to fit any bike, this lightweight device is adjustable from 508mm to 889mm. Additionally, it's able to be used for transporting bikes on hitch-mounts or roof racks. The Feedback Sports Flop Stop Handlebar Holder is available in one adjustable size and in the color Black. Please note that it's compatible with any bike, whether it be road, mountain, or BMX.", "text": "Feedback Sports Flop Stop Handlebar Holder The Feedback Sports System Flop Stop Handlebar Holder keeps your front end from flopping all over the place when you're wrenching on your bike. All that you have to do is, simply, attach the Flop Stop Handlebar Holder between the seatpost and bars, and you're set. In order to fit any bike, this lightweight device is adjustable from 508mm to 889mm. Additionally, it's able to be used for transporting bikes on hitch-mounts or roof racks. The Feedback Sports Flop Stop Handlebar Holder is available in one adjustable size and in the color Black. Please note that it's compatible with any bike, whether it be road, mountain, or BMX.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SXiUgALxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F2W726.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Feedback Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 18.95}}
