{"item_id": "B001F2XGNK", "title": "Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand", "description": "FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand Slide-lock clamp rotates 360° Precision adjustable clamp force More compact folded size Ultra Light Weight: 10.6 lbs / 4.8 kg Adjustable height, stable tripod design Clamp: Slide-lock SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand Weight: 10.6 lbs / 4.8 kg Clamp Height: 35.6 - 57.7\" / 904 - 1466 mm Clamp Opening: 1.9\" / 48 mm Folded Dimension: 5 x 6.6 x 36.9\" / 127 x 168 x 937 mm Load Capacity: 85 lbs / 38.6 kg Anodized aluminum", "text": "Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand Slide-lock clamp rotates 360° Precision adjustable clamp force More compact folded size Ultra Light Weight: 10.6 lbs / 4.8 kg Adjustable height, stable tripod design Clamp: Slide-lock SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Ultralight Work Stand Weight: 10.6 lbs / 4.8 kg Clamp Height: 35.6 - 57.7\" / 904 - 1466 mm Clamp Opening: 1.9\" / 48 mm Folded Dimension: 5 x 6.6 x 36.9\" / 127 x 168 x 937 mm Load Capacity: 85 lbs / 38.6 kg Anodized aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IqmKGAN-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F2XGNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Feedback Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 179.95}}
