{"item_id": "B001F4KPH8", "title": "Three Tier Sword Display Wall Rack", "description": "This wall mounted sword rack holds two swords proudly on display for all to see. Each is constructed of solid black wood with a black lacquer finish. Don't leave your swords lying around collecting dust; display their individual uniqueness! Great for every collection! Easy to mount to wall! Measures 16.5 inches tall, 14.5 inches wide and 3.25 inches deep. Tiers are spaced 4 inches from each other.", "text": "Three Tier Sword Display Wall Rack This wall mounted sword rack holds two swords proudly on display for all to see. Each is constructed of solid black wood with a black lacquer finish. Don't leave your swords lying around collecting dust; display their individual uniqueness! Great for every collection! Easy to mount to wall! Measures 16.5 inches tall, 14.5 inches wide and 3.25 inches deep. Tiers are spaced 4 inches from each other.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417dHDCKSEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001F4KPH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapon Stands"]], "price": 21.75}}
