{"item_id": "B001FB5VAW", "title": "Altus Athletic 20-Pound Standard Ankle / Wrist Weights", "description": "Adjustable ankle and wrist weights with durable nylon construction and adjustable weight packets to add or remove total weight. Total of twenty pounds per set - or a maximum of ten pounds per single weight unit.", "text": "Altus Athletic 20-Pound Standard Ankle / Wrist Weights Adjustable ankle and wrist weights with durable nylon construction and adjustable weight packets to add or remove total weight. Total of twenty pounds per set - or a maximum of ten pounds per single weight unit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41duC47zqxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB5VAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Track & Field", "Training Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FB5ZEO", "title": "Altus Athletic Core Balance Disc", "description": "This inflatable balance disc cushion helps shape and tone your lower body, while improving balance and flexibility. A textured massage foot surface improves grip. Your purchase includes a pump and needle, as well as access to multiple downloadable exercise routines.About Altus AthleticFor over 35 years, Altus Athletic has provided quality, innovative fitness products and exercise accessories for the home user and fitness enthusiast. The Altus brand also includes the renowned Fitness by Cathe product line, endorsed by Cathe Friedrich, one of the leading fitness trainers in the USA for over 20 years. Combined, these two brands provide a complimentary line of products to serve today�s consumer fitness needs.", "text": "Altus Athletic Core Balance Disc This inflatable balance disc cushion helps shape and tone your lower body, while improving balance and flexibility. A textured massage foot surface improves grip. Your purchase includes a pump and needle, as well as access to multiple downloadable exercise routines.About Altus AthleticFor over 35 years, Altus Athletic has provided quality, innovative fitness products and exercise accessories for the home user and fitness enthusiast. The Altus brand also includes the renowned Fitness by Cathe product line, endorsed by Cathe Friedrich, one of the leading fitness trainers in the USA for over 20 years. Combined, these two brands provide a complimentary line of products to serve today�s consumer fitness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cTUdoNVsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB5ZEO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B001FB5ZF8", "title": "Altus Athletic 10-Pound 2-in-1 Power Medicine Ball and Kettlebell with DVD", "description": "Durable Rubber 10 LB. 2 in 1 Power Medicine Ball And Kettlebell combination for multiple exercise routines. Removable handles. These balls bounce and have a valve so that more air may be added or removed. Instructional DVD included which illustrates the wide range of exercises possible with this unique fitness product.", "text": "Altus Athletic 10-Pound 2-in-1 Power Medicine Ball and Kettlebell with DVD Durable Rubber 10 LB. 2 in 1 Power Medicine Ball And Kettlebell combination for multiple exercise routines. Removable handles. These balls bounce and have a valve so that more air may be added or removed. Instructional DVD included which illustrates the wide range of exercises possible with this unique fitness product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iUPx-v9uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB5ZF8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Medicine Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FB605W", "title": "Altus Athletic 9-Foot Adjustable Speed Jump Rope with DVD", "description": "High speed lightweight jump rope - 9 Ft. length. The length of the rope may be shortened according to the height of the user. One of the best conditioning exercises is jumping rope, and this fast rotation rope is perfect for an intense cardio workout. You also may vary the rope speed of rotation for a reduced cardio workout.", "text": "Altus Athletic 9-Foot Adjustable Speed Jump Rope with DVD High speed lightweight jump rope - 9 Ft. length. The length of the rope may be shortened according to the height of the user. One of the best conditioning exercises is jumping rope, and this fast rotation rope is perfect for an intense cardio workout. You also may vary the rope speed of rotation for a reduced cardio workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41azaijqU8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB605W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 12.56}}
{"item_id": "B001FB614W", "title": "Fitness by Cathe Starter Hand Grip (Pair)", "description": "Quality pair of handgrips, great as a starter set. Durable chrome steel springs for a long useful life.", "text": "Fitness by Cathe Starter Hand Grip (Pair) Quality pair of handgrips, great as a starter set. Durable chrome steel springs for a long useful life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mWBl5KdKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB614W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fitness by Cathe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B001FB61C4", "title": "Fitness by Cathe 2-Pound Weighted Gloves with DVD", "description": "Neoprene adjustable weighted gloves, up to one lb. weight per individual glove. Secure fit during intensive exercise for added resistance and strength building.", "text": "Fitness by Cathe 2-Pound Weighted Gloves with DVD Neoprene adjustable weighted gloves, up to one lb. weight per individual glove. Secure fit during intensive exercise for added resistance and strength building.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k%2Bty-L0cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FB61C4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FC9HRO", "title": "SRAM X.4 Rear Derailleur (Black, Long Cage)", "description": "The SRAM X.4 line-up sets the standard for recreational level shifting. The X.4 has an intelligent blend of performance and value for MTB or pavement. Compatible with 7-, 8-, and 9-speed systems, 1:1 shifter-to-derailleur actuation ratio for precise light-action indexing. Must be used with ESP shifters.", "text": "SRAM X.4 Rear Derailleur (Black, Long Cage) The SRAM X.4 line-up sets the standard for recreational level shifting. The X.4 has an intelligent blend of performance and value for MTB or pavement. Compatible with 7-, 8-, and 9-speed systems, 1:1 shifter-to-derailleur actuation ratio for precise light-action indexing. Must be used with ESP shifters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mTCWrMS8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FC9HRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Rear Derailleurs"]], "price": 23.25}}
{"item_id": "B001FCBTIY", "title": "Trademark Black Firm 4.5\" Tactical Pocket Knife", "description": "This stainless steel super knife is a must have for anyone who appreciates a quality pocket folder at a great price. It features a blade which opens and securely locks into place and also a convenient belt clip so it will always be at your side. Features: 3.25” stainless steel blade, 4.5” folded, 8” opened, belt clip included.", "text": "Trademark Black Firm 4.5\" Tactical Pocket Knife This stainless steel super knife is a must have for anyone who appreciates a quality pocket folder at a great price. It features a blade which opens and securely locks into place and also a convenient belt clip so it will always be at your side. Features: 3.25” stainless steel blade, 4.5” folded, 8” opened, belt clip included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bt7XbQEvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FCBTIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B001FCDH70", "title": "Bell PRO-GEL Cycling Gloves, Small/Medium", "description": "The Bell PRO-GEL Cycling Gloves feature superior styling and lightweight design. Three divided gel inserts provide shock absorption and reduce hand fatigue. The perforated palm venting and stretch nylon/spandex back provide superior comfort.", "text": "Bell PRO-GEL Cycling Gloves, Small/Medium The Bell PRO-GEL Cycling Gloves feature superior styling and lightweight design. Three divided gel inserts provide shock absorption and reduce hand fatigue. The perforated palm venting and stretch nylon/spandex back provide superior comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EN2jaBG%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FCDH70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FCFK5C", "title": "Bell DASHBOARD 100 12 Function Cyclocomputer", "description": "The surprisingly affordable and versatile F12 Cyclocomputer has 12 functions to track while you're riding, and is easy to install and weather-resistant. A one-button cell battery is included.FunctionsCurrent speedAverage speedMax speedMiles and kilometers per hourSpeedDistanceOdometerTrip distanceTrip timer12- and 24-hour clockScanAuto stop/startAbout BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell DASHBOARD 100 12 Function Cyclocomputer The surprisingly affordable and versatile F12 Cyclocomputer has 12 functions to track while you're riding, and is easy to install and weather-resistant. A one-button cell battery is included.FunctionsCurrent speedAverage speedMax speedMiles and kilometers per hourSpeedDistanceOdometerTrip distanceTrip timer12- and 24-hour clockScanAuto stop/startAbout BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eeiMGeMpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FCFK5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 7.64}}
{"item_id": "B001FCGDYO", "title": "Stans No Tubes Plus Four Tubeless System", "description": "With the growth of 29\" mountain bikes, the Plus 4 Kit is the second most popular kit NoTubes offer. Fits most 29\" cross country rims currently available.", "text": "Stans No Tubes Plus Four Tubeless System With the growth of 29\" mountain bikes, the Plus 4 Kit is the second most popular kit NoTubes offer. Fits most 29\" cross country rims currently available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HwKB7AEiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FCGDYO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stans-No Tubes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 64.99}}
{"item_id": "B001FD77RK", "title": "NcSTAR® Dual Illumination Multi - Reticle Reflex Sights", "description": "NcSTAR Dual Illumination Multi - Reticle Reflex Sights. NcSTAR presents a super-versatile Sight that delivers accuracy, anytime! With your choice of a red or green dot, and your pick of 4 great reticles, you're certain to have success on the range! Use the rear selector to switch between reticles on this Dual Illumination Sight... there's one for every occasion! Features a 100% safe, battery-powered red LED light to point wherever you're aiming, this tool helps you train your eye on dead-center accuracy, every time. You control brightness with a 11-position rheostat knob... no matter your environment, you can always find a mode that's easy to see. Comes with an integrated weaver-style mount and tool for easy attachment. The skinny: Heads up display; 1x magnification and 24 x 34 mm objective lens; You get a cross, bullseye, star burst and dot reticle... dot size is 3 M.O.A.; Click value: 1 M.O.A.; Platinum lens coating ; Unlimited eye relief; Includes extra CR2032 lithium battery and lens covers; Measures 3 1/5\" long and weighs 4 1/5 ozs.; State Color. Straight shooting awaits! Take the winning shot with NcSTAR! Order yours now! WARNING: These items cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR Dual Illumination Multi-Reticle Reflex Sights", "text": "NcSTAR® Dual Illumination Multi - Reticle Reflex Sights NcSTAR Dual Illumination Multi - Reticle Reflex Sights. NcSTAR presents a super-versatile Sight that delivers accuracy, anytime! With your choice of a red or green dot, and your pick of 4 great reticles, you're certain to have success on the range! Use the rear selector to switch between reticles on this Dual Illumination Sight... there's one for every occasion! Features a 100% safe, battery-powered red LED light to point wherever you're aiming, this tool helps you train your eye on dead-center accuracy, every time. You control brightness with a 11-position rheostat knob... no matter your environment, you can always find a mode that's easy to see. Comes with an integrated weaver-style mount and tool for easy attachment. The skinny: Heads up display; 1x magnification and 24 x 34 mm objective lens; You get a cross, bullseye, star burst and dot reticle... dot size is 3 M.O.A.; Click value: 1 M.O.A.; Platinum lens coating ; Unlimited eye relief; Includes extra CR2032 lithium battery and lens covers; Measures 3 1/5\" long and weighs 4 1/5 ozs.; State Color. Straight shooting awaits! Take the winning shot with NcSTAR! Order yours now! WARNING: These items cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR Dual Illumination Multi-Reticle Reflex Sights", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PBHQYVXBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FD77RK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 45.99}}
