{"item_id": "B001FKUL4E", "title": "Mosin Nagant M44 Bolt action rifle cleaning kit", "description": "Mosin Nagant M44 Cleaning Kit STANDARD CLEANING KIT, INCLUDING FIRING PIN DEPTH GUAGE/SCREW DRIVER, BRUSH, CLEANING ROD JAG, MUZZLE PROTECTOR, CLEANING ROD HANDLE, AND POUCH THE MOSIN-NAGANT RIFLES", "text": "Mosin Nagant M44 Bolt action rifle cleaning kit Mosin Nagant M44 Cleaning Kit STANDARD CLEANING KIT, INCLUDING FIRING PIN DEPTH GUAGE/SCREW DRIVER, BRUSH, CLEANING ROD JAG, MUZZLE PROTECTOR, CLEANING ROD HANDLE, AND POUCH THE MOSIN-NAGANT RIFLES", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tukVFPrdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FKUL4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Combat Optical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B001FLK6IY", "title": "Yoga Accessories Extra Wide and Extra Long 1/4'' Deluxe Yoga Mat", "description": "Yoga Accessories (TM) Extra Wide and Extra Long 1/4\" Deluxe Yoga MatOur extra long, extra wide mat is super thick, seven feet long, and a full three feet wide, allowing for extra personal space and added hygienic protection against a gym or yoga studio floor. If you're over six feet tall, this 7-foot long mat gives you the distance you need to extend comfortably in poses like reclining pigeon. And if you have wide shoulders, the 3-foot width gives you plenty of side to side room for wide-legged forward bend.Our Extra Wide/Extra Long Deluxe Yoga Mat mat boasts a textured latex-free surface for maximum stability and is a full 1/4\" thick, making it one of the thickest and densest sticky mats available.Product Features:•The world's largest yoga mat!•Full 7 feet long x 3 feet wide•Latex-free, Phthalate-free dyes and inks•Extra thick: 1/4 inch•Textured, non-slip surface", "text": "Yoga Accessories Extra Wide and Extra Long 1/4'' Deluxe Yoga Mat Yoga Accessories (TM) Extra Wide and Extra Long 1/4\" Deluxe Yoga MatOur extra long, extra wide mat is super thick, seven feet long, and a full three feet wide, allowing for extra personal space and added hygienic protection against a gym or yoga studio floor. If you're over six feet tall, this 7-foot long mat gives you the distance you need to extend comfortably in poses like reclining pigeon. And if you have wide shoulders, the 3-foot width gives you plenty of side to side room for wide-legged forward bend.Our Extra Wide/Extra Long Deluxe Yoga Mat mat boasts a textured latex-free surface for maximum stability and is a full 1/4\" thick, making it one of the thickest and densest sticky mats available.Product Features:•The world's largest yoga mat!•Full 7 feet long x 3 feet wide•Latex-free, Phthalate-free dyes and inks•Extra thick: 1/4 inch•Textured, non-slip surface", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fbwVtVU7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FLK6IY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "YogaAccessories (TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 30.95}}
{"item_id": "B001FNMV3K", "title": "Champion Barbell 15-Pound Solid Hex Dumbell with Ergo Grip", "description": "The Solid Hex Dumbbell with Ergo Grip from Champion Barbell is built to precision specifications. These weights are ergo designed for comfort and safety. The handles are knurled for a secure grip and a safer, more effective workout.", "text": "Champion Barbell 15-Pound Solid Hex Dumbell with Ergo Grip The Solid Hex Dumbbell with Ergo Grip from Champion Barbell is built to precision specifications. These weights are ergo designed for comfort and safety. The handles are knurled for a secure grip and a safer, more effective workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UD2M5P8qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FNMV3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 16.7}}
{"item_id": "B001FNPJKW", "title": "Champion Barbell 20-Pound Solid Hex Dumbell with Ergonomic Grip", "description": "The Solid Hex Dumbbell with Ergo Grip from Champion Barbell is built to precision specifications. These weights are ergo designed for comfort and safety. The handles are knurled for a secure grip and a safer, more effective workout.", "text": "Champion Barbell 20-Pound Solid Hex Dumbell with Ergonomic Grip The Solid Hex Dumbbell with Ergo Grip from Champion Barbell is built to precision specifications. These weights are ergo designed for comfort and safety. The handles are knurled for a secure grip and a safer, more effective workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516C050fQlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FNPJKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 24.98}}
{"item_id": "B001FOPXCA", "title": "Bridgestone E6 Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack)", "description": "Bridgestone E6 golf balls offer advanced polymer engineering, and delivers another technological breakthrough. With superior performance in a straighter more accurate ball flight and a softer feel through its advanced low compression multi-layer construction. Multi layer design offers anti-spin / extra velocity inner cover, engineered for players seeking a straighter ball flight with longer carry distance and roll. The 330 seamless dimple design delivers advanced aerodynamics for consistent trajectory leading to pin-point accuracy. Customer information and care at www.nitrogolf.com (or) 1-414-272-5084.", "text": "Bridgestone E6 Recycled Golf Balls (36 Pack) Bridgestone E6 golf balls offer advanced polymer engineering, and delivers another technological breakthrough. With superior performance in a straighter more accurate ball flight and a softer feel through its advanced low compression multi-layer construction. Multi layer design offers anti-spin / extra velocity inner cover, engineered for players seeking a straighter ball flight with longer carry distance and roll. The 330 seamless dimple design delivers advanced aerodynamics for consistent trajectory leading to pin-point accuracy. Customer information and care at www.nitrogolf.com (or) 1-414-272-5084.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xXlr5RMwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FOPXCA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Recycled & Used Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FOQE3W", "title": "Rollerblade Inline Skate Carry Bag 2011", "description": "The Rollerblade skate bag has double sipper openings with mesh zipper flaps for durable long lasting use. The side mesh pocket is perfect for carrying a helmet and the internal storage pocket is great for holding pads. . Model Year: 2014, Product ID: 122010, Model Number: 8B429160 BAG, GTIN: 0008442457871", "text": "Rollerblade Inline Skate Carry Bag 2011 The Rollerblade skate bag has double sipper openings with mesh zipper flaps for durable long lasting use. The side mesh pocket is perfect for carrying a helmet and the internal storage pocket is great for holding pads. . Model Year: 2014, Product ID: 122010, Model Number: 8B429160 BAG, GTIN: 0008442457871", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5107tyPk%2BFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FOQE3W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Equipment Bags"]], "price": 9.73}}
