{"item_id": "B001FPTSTS", "title": ".223 ( 5.56 NATO ) Caliber Broken Shell Extractor For AR15 M4 CX4 RX4 AUG Mini-14 Ranch Rifles SU16", "description": ".223 ( 5.56 NATO ) Caliber Broken Shell Extractor For AR15 M4 CX4 RX4 Mini-14 Ranch Rifles SU16 Features: Made of steel, Every so often a broken head from a cartridge rips off and leaves the empty case stuck inside the chamber. This problem is especially common with semi-automatic rifles. This easy to use item extracts the broken shell without damaging your guns receiver or rifling. Perfect for any rifle chambered for the .223 caliber ( NATO 5.56mm ) cartridge including AR15, M4, CX4, RX4, AUG, Ruger Mini-14, Ranch Rifles, SU16, GALIL & others. It's a good idea to keep one of these in your range bag at all times just in case. Brand new", "text": ".223 ( 5.56 NATO ) Caliber Broken Shell Extractor For AR15 M4 CX4 RX4 AUG Mini-14 Ranch Rifles SU16 .223 ( 5.56 NATO ) Caliber Broken Shell Extractor For AR15 M4 CX4 RX4 Mini-14 Ranch Rifles SU16 Features: Made of steel, Every so often a broken head from a cartridge rips off and leaves the empty case stuck inside the chamber. This problem is especially common with semi-automatic rifles. This easy to use item extracts the broken shell without damaging your guns receiver or rifling. Perfect for any rifle chambered for the .223 caliber ( NATO 5.56mm ) cartridge including AR15, M4, CX4, RX4, AUG, Ruger Mini-14, Ranch Rifles, SU16, GALIL & others. It's a good idea to keep one of these in your range bag at all times just in case. Brand new", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KDsGuWtVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FPTSTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "m1surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.95}}
