{"item_id": "B001FSGV68", "title": "Low Profile Rail Scope Mount For Hk-91 H&k G3 GSG-5 MP5 SP89 Hk-91 93 94 & Cetme Rifles", "description": "Low Profile Rail Scope Mount For Hk-91 H&k; G3 GSG-5 MP5 SP89 Hk-91 93 94 & Cetme Rifles Features: Approx length: 5 1/2 inches, Rail width: 7/8 inches. Fits most Mil-Spec H&k; MP-5, H&k; 91, 93, 94, G3, GSG-5, Cetme and similar clones, Material: Durable aluminum, Picatinny base rail accepts any scope rings, red dot, reflex sight and other aiming sights that have a Picatinny/Weaver style base. Low profile design allows for mounting your scope in a more ergonomic position. Easy no gunsmith installation. Attaches directly to the existing grooves on the top of rifle/pistol. Manufacture warranty against defects.", "text": "Low Profile Rail Scope Mount For Hk-91 H&k G3 GSG-5 MP5 SP89 Hk-91 93 94 & Cetme Rifles Low Profile Rail Scope Mount For Hk-91 H&k; G3 GSG-5 MP5 SP89 Hk-91 93 94 & Cetme Rifles Features: Approx length: 5 1/2 inches, Rail width: 7/8 inches. Fits most Mil-Spec H&k; MP-5, H&k; 91, 93, 94, G3, GSG-5, Cetme and similar clones, Material: Durable aluminum, Picatinny base rail accepts any scope rings, red dot, reflex sight and other aiming sights that have a Picatinny/Weaver style base. Low profile design allows for mounting your scope in a more ergonomic position. Easy no gunsmith installation. Attaches directly to the existing grooves on the top of rifle/pistol. Manufacture warranty against defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316Xv8E2CNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FSGV68.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TGS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B001FSKDSA", "title": "Minoura Mag Riser 3", "description": "Front wheel leveler block, Injection plastic, Bulk packing", "text": "Minoura Mag Riser 3 Front wheel leveler block, Injection plastic, Bulk packing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HX7YF30FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FSKDSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minoura", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Trainer Accessories"]], "price": 13.77}}
{"item_id": "B001FSKDSK", "title": "Minoura Safe-T-Net Sweat Catcher Trainer", "description": "Indoor bike training is a great form of exercise, but there's no cool wind to keep you from overheating during your workout. As a result, the sweat starts to build. Enter the Safe-T-Net sweat catcher, which stretches over your bike to keep salty sweat from dripping onto the frame and head parts. Made of 100-percent cotton, the Safe-T-Net efficiently absorbs moisture while you ride. It's also easy to install: just hook the rubber loop to the seat post, stretch the net, and wind the Velcro tape to the handlebar. Flexible enough to fit most frame sizes, the net even includes a center cutout to keep your bike computer visible. The washable Safe-T-Net is ideal for cyclists who want to protect their bike from rust and other threats to their frame.", "text": "Minoura Safe-T-Net Sweat Catcher Trainer Indoor bike training is a great form of exercise, but there's no cool wind to keep you from overheating during your workout. As a result, the sweat starts to build. Enter the Safe-T-Net sweat catcher, which stretches over your bike to keep salty sweat from dripping onto the frame and head parts. Made of 100-percent cotton, the Safe-T-Net efficiently absorbs moisture while you ride. It's also easy to install: just hook the rubber loop to the seat post, stretch the net, and wind the Velcro tape to the handlebar. Flexible enough to fit most frame sizes, the net even includes a center cutout to keep your bike computer visible. The washable Safe-T-Net is ideal for cyclists who want to protect their bike from rust and other threats to their frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qRUzBlrpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FSKDSK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minoura", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 16.77}}
{"item_id": "B001FSZV5U", "title": "Stoney Point Accessory Black Rubber V-Yoke, Clam", "description": "E-102 Features: -Rubber over mold. -Attaches all polecat telescoping products. -Made in USA. -Overall dimensions: 4\" H x 7\" W x 1.75\" D.", "text": "Stoney Point Accessory Black Rubber V-Yoke, Clam E-102 Features: -Rubber over mold. -Attaches all polecat telescoping products. -Made in USA. -Overall dimensions: 4\" H x 7\" W x 1.75\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hDtUOgZfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FSZV5U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FT1UK4", "title": "Itac Defense Magazine Pouch fits SIG P229 .40S, .357SIG and P250", "description": "Manufactured using the same durable, black polymer as our holsters, these Double Magazine Pouches feature a paddle back and give you a comfortable, contoured fit.Features: Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.), Fully adjustable for magazine tension and cant, Adjusts with simple Allen key. Fits: Sig Sauer P229 .40 and .357, Sig Sauer P250.", "text": "Itac Defense Magazine Pouch fits SIG P229 .40S, .357SIG and P250 Manufactured using the same durable, black polymer as our holsters, these Double Magazine Pouches feature a paddle back and give you a comfortable, contoured fit.Features: Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.), Fully adjustable for magazine tension and cant, Adjusts with simple Allen key. Fits: Sig Sauer P229 .40 and .357, Sig Sauer P250.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wc5AGwf1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT1UK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sig Sauer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 20.98}}
{"item_id": "B001FT30K2", "title": "Plano Gun Guard 300 Series Shotgun Case (Hunter Green)", "description": "The 35460 Gun Guard case is designed to fit shotguns up to 51” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density foam padding, this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 300 Series soft cases also feature full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, and over-wrapped nylon handles. Product dimensions: 54\" long x 8.5\" wide x 2\" thick", "text": "Plano Gun Guard 300 Series Shotgun Case (Hunter Green) The 35460 Gun Guard case is designed to fit shotguns up to 51” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density foam padding, this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 300 Series soft cases also feature full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, and over-wrapped nylon handles. Product dimensions: 54\" long x 8.5\" wide x 2\" thick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CsYWIt1ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT30K2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FT3MDM", "title": "Walker's Game Ear Ultra Ear ITC (Pair)", "description": "For individuals who are interested in testing out the many uses of hearing amplification while in the field, Walker’s Game Ear is offering the Ultra Ear. This new product, from the leader in hearing protection and sound amplification, offers consumers the opportunity to try sound amplification in the field in a cost-effective manner. The Ultra Ear is a low cost hearing amplification system that is lightweight and can be used in either ear. An adjustment system allows the user to modify tone and volume for optimum hearing. It also incorporates a mild compression circuit to help muffle muzzle blasts.", "text": "Walker's Game Ear Ultra Ear ITC (Pair) For individuals who are interested in testing out the many uses of hearing amplification while in the field, Walker’s Game Ear is offering the Ultra Ear. This new product, from the leader in hearing protection and sound amplification, offers consumers the opportunity to try sound amplification in the field in a cost-effective manner. The Ultra Ear is a low cost hearing amplification system that is lightweight and can be used in either ear. An adjustment system allows the user to modify tone and volume for optimum hearing. It also incorporates a mild compression circuit to help muffle muzzle blasts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yoa8SINsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT3MDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walker&#39;s Game Ear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 26.96}}
{"item_id": "B001FT4RYA", "title": "Plano Gun Guard 300S Soft Rifle Case, Hunter Green", "description": "The 34860 Gun Guard case is designed to fit scoped rifles up to 45” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density foam padding, this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 300 Series soft cases also feature full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, and over-wrapped nylon handles. Product dimensions: 48\" long x 11\" wide x 2\" thick", "text": "Plano Gun Guard 300S Soft Rifle Case, Hunter Green The 34860 Gun Guard case is designed to fit scoped rifles up to 45” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density foam padding, this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 300 Series soft cases also feature full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, and over-wrapped nylon handles. Product dimensions: 48\" long x 11\" wide x 2\" thick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iupMHo6CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT4RYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 20.63}}
{"item_id": "B001FT4RYK", "title": "Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Shotgun Case Realtree AP", "description": "Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Gun Case. Rugged protection for your gun. Super protection, super price! Protect your pride 'n' joy from travel bumps, dust and dirt with the Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Gun Case. It's rugged and ready 600-denier canvas to take the scrapes plus thick foam padding to soak up the bumps. Case Closed: Tough 600-denier material; High-density foam with knit lining; Full-length zipper with lockable zipper pulls; VELCRO Brand wrap closure handle. Give your gun the protection it deserves. Order Today! Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Shotgun Case, Realtree AP", "text": "Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Shotgun Case Realtree AP Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Gun Case. Rugged protection for your gun. Super protection, super price! Protect your pride 'n' joy from travel bumps, dust and dirt with the Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Gun Case. It's rugged and ready 600-denier canvas to take the scrapes plus thick foam padding to soak up the bumps. Case Closed: Tough 600-denier material; High-density foam with knit lining; Full-length zipper with lockable zipper pulls; VELCRO Brand wrap closure handle. Give your gun the protection it deserves. Order Today! Plano Gun Guard 200 Series Shotgun Case, Realtree AP", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412VPvVyYVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT4RYK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001FT4S9E", "title": "SigTac Mini Red Dot Sight", "description": "The Red Dot Sight is a versatile and lightweight sighting solution for handguns, rifles and shotguns. A parallax free 1X red dot with 4 MOA reticle, coated glass lenses and anodized aluminum construction ensures optimal performance in the most extreme conditions. Features:- 12-position rotary on/off switch. Windage and elevation adjustments. Anti-reflex and multilayer band pass optical coating. M1913/Weaver rail mount. (1) CR2032 Lithium battery.", "text": "SigTac Mini Red Dot Sight The Red Dot Sight is a versatile and lightweight sighting solution for handguns, rifles and shotguns. A parallax free 1X red dot with 4 MOA reticle, coated glass lenses and anodized aluminum construction ensures optimal performance in the most extreme conditions. Features:- 12-position rotary on/off switch. Windage and elevation adjustments. Anti-reflex and multilayer band pass optical coating. M1913/Weaver rail mount. (1) CR2032 Lithium battery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311aizTwhAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT4S9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 150.53}}
{"item_id": "B001FT4ZQU", "title": "Plano 10164 Gun Guard SE Four Pistol Access Case", "description": "This Gun Guard four pistol case has a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Case will accommodate up to four long barreled handguns. Product dimensions: 17.1\" long x 14.86\" wide x 5.75\" high", "text": "Plano 10164 Gun Guard SE Four Pistol Access Case This Gun Guard four pistol case has a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Case will accommodate up to four long barreled handguns. Product dimensions: 17.1\" long x 14.86\" wide x 5.75\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tZVrCo9XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT4ZQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 18.19}}
{"item_id": "B001FT8I2M", "title": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Ruger Lcp", "description": "Among Crimson Trace's best-selling products, the revolutionary Laserguard LG-431 is a no-brainer when it comes to bolstering the defensive capabilities of your Ruger LCP. Designed to attach seamlessly to the Ruger's trigger guard, the LG-431 is outfitted with instinctive front activation. That means the laser immediately springs to life as you hold the pistol naturally, projecting from just underneath the muzzle. As a result, the LG-431 increases the accuracy of the Ruger LCP by leaps and bounds. The LG-431 is also versatile, with a design that fits inside a custom Ruger LCP with Laserguard holster. The LG-431 received the Academy of Excellence Award for \"Self-Defense Product of the Year\" in 2009.SpecificationsPlatform: LaserGuardAttachment: Trigger guardActivation: Instinctive frontMaterials: Polymer and rubber combinationInstallation: User installed, no gunsmithing necessarySighting: Factory sighted at 50 feetUser adjustable: Windage and elevationBattery type: 1/3N 3-volt lithium (1) or 357 silver oxide batteries (2)Battery life: 4 hoursOn/off switch: NoLaser output: 5 mW peak, 633 nm, Class 3 red laserLaser visibility: Approximately 0.5-inch diameter at 50 feetFits models: Ruger LCPWrench size: 0.5Warranty: 3 years complete", "text": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Ruger Lcp Among Crimson Trace's best-selling products, the revolutionary Laserguard LG-431 is a no-brainer when it comes to bolstering the defensive capabilities of your Ruger LCP. Designed to attach seamlessly to the Ruger's trigger guard, the LG-431 is outfitted with instinctive front activation. That means the laser immediately springs to life as you hold the pistol naturally, projecting from just underneath the muzzle. As a result, the LG-431 increases the accuracy of the Ruger LCP by leaps and bounds. The LG-431 is also versatile, with a design that fits inside a custom Ruger LCP with Laserguard holster. The LG-431 received the Academy of Excellence Award for \"Self-Defense Product of the Year\" in 2009.SpecificationsPlatform: LaserGuardAttachment: Trigger guardActivation: Instinctive frontMaterials: Polymer and rubber combinationInstallation: User installed, no gunsmithing necessarySighting: Factory sighted at 50 feetUser adjustable: Windage and elevationBattery type: 1/3N 3-volt lithium (1) or 357 silver oxide batteries (2)Battery life: 4 hoursOn/off switch: NoLaser output: 5 mW peak, 633 nm, Class 3 red laserLaser visibility: Approximately 0.5-inch diameter at 50 feetFits models: Ruger LCPWrench size: 0.5Warranty: 3 years complete", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PydB26LmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FT8I2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Rings"]], "price": 165.61}}
{"item_id": "B001FTOPRE", "title": "Frabill Trout Net (11 x 15- Inch)", "description": "Frabill Rubber Handled Trout Landing Net makes hauling trout into your kayak or float tube easy. Haul 'em in with ease! The Frabill Rubber Handled Trout Landing Net is designed specifically for serious wader, canoe, kayak and float tube trout fishing with a smaller more nimble size plus a sure-grip rubber handle for wet use. Built for serious fishin'!", "text": "Frabill Trout Net (11 x 15- Inch) Frabill Rubber Handled Trout Landing Net makes hauling trout into your kayak or float tube easy. Haul 'em in with ease! The Frabill Rubber Handled Trout Landing Net is designed specifically for serious wader, canoe, kayak and float tube trout fishing with a smaller more nimble size plus a sure-grip rubber handle for wet use. Built for serious fishin'!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WXsIggCpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001FTOPRE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frabill", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Nets"]], "price": 18.89}}
