{"item_id": "B001G0MSCG", "title": "Browning Range Kit Shooting Glasses, Foam Earplugs, and Adjustable-fit Earmuffs Combo Pack", "description": "Have a BLAST... safely! Browning Range Kit, ON SALE! The sights and sounds of a gun range can be dangerous! This all-in-one Kit covers all your bases. Tinted polycarbonate-lens Shooting Glasses protect your eyes and increase target visiblity at the same time. Soft foam Ear Plugs provide noise reduction up to 31dB and store in their included plastic case. Adjustable Ear Muffs provide another 27dB of protection, for when you pull out the big guns. From the shooting experts at Browning, offered here for LESS! Protect yourself! Order this Browning Range Kit today! Browning Range Kit", "text": "Browning Range Kit Shooting Glasses, Foam Earplugs, and Adjustable-fit Earmuffs Combo Pack Have a BLAST... safely! Browning Range Kit, ON SALE! The sights and sounds of a gun range can be dangerous! This all-in-one Kit covers all your bases. Tinted polycarbonate-lens Shooting Glasses protect your eyes and increase target visiblity at the same time. Soft foam Ear Plugs provide noise reduction up to 31dB and store in their included plastic case. Adjustable Ear Muffs provide another 27dB of protection, for when you pull out the big guns. From the shooting experts at Browning, offered here for LESS! Protect yourself! Order this Browning Range Kit today! Browning Range Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NzqJNBgHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G0MSCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 29.72}}
{"item_id": "B001G0NPX2", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Select Gel Cycling Glove,Black,X-Large", "description": "When spending a lot of time in the saddle, a good pair of gloves is just as critical as a good pair of cycling shorts for staying comfortable. With 100% gel padding and a Direct-Vent mesh back panel, the Pearl Izumi Select Gel Glove will keep you cool, dry, and provide long ride comfort.A U-bridge design alleviates nerve pressure that can lead to hand and arm numbness and an anti-microbial, moisture wicking lining gets rid of sweaty, stinky palms. For the comfort and protection you require, on or off road, pull on a pair of the SELECT Gel Gloves.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Select Gel Cycling Glove,Black,X-Large When spending a lot of time in the saddle, a good pair of gloves is just as critical as a good pair of cycling shorts for staying comfortable. With 100% gel padding and a Direct-Vent mesh back panel, the Pearl Izumi Select Gel Glove will keep you cool, dry, and provide long ride comfort.A U-bridge design alleviates nerve pressure that can lead to hand and arm numbness and an anti-microbial, moisture wicking lining gets rid of sweaty, stinky palms. For the comfort and protection you require, on or off road, pull on a pair of the SELECT Gel Gloves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KwqFXXs0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G0NPX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001G0QXSG", "title": "Panaracer Pana Pasela Tour Guard Bicycle Tire (Wire Bead, 27x1-1/4)", "description": "The Panaracer Pasela Tourguard Road Tire features a kevlar belt under the tread for flat protection and is available in a variety of sizes. Features: Kevlar belt under tread for flat protection 400D Lite Extra Cord technology increases side-cut resistance while improving the rigidity during cornering TourGuard is an Aramid fiber belt placed under the tread to improve puncture resistance, ideal for touring or urban cycling and commuting", "text": "Panaracer Pana Pasela Tour Guard Bicycle Tire (Wire Bead, 27x1-1/4) The Panaracer Pasela Tourguard Road Tire features a kevlar belt under the tread for flat protection and is available in a variety of sizes. Features: Kevlar belt under tread for flat protection 400D Lite Extra Cord technology increases side-cut resistance while improving the rigidity during cornering TourGuard is an Aramid fiber belt placed under the tread to improve puncture resistance, ideal for touring or urban cycling and commuting", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kvbYGCJtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G0QXSG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001G0X2DA", "title": "Shimano MF-TZ20 Tourney Freewheel (14-28T 6 Speed)", "description": "Shimano Tourney freewheel are all designed to work with indexed shifters at a budget price.", "text": "Shimano MF-TZ20 Tourney Freewheel (14-28T 6 Speed) Shimano Tourney freewheel are all designed to work with indexed shifters at a budget price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51k6lQzkr5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G0X2DA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B001G0Y6J4", "title": "Marine TUF-CLOTH 12\" x 12\" resealable pouch", "description": "Clean + Lubricate + Protect Micro-Bonding Oil-Free Shield, will not Attract Dirt. Developed on request from Navy SEALs - based on TUF-CLOTH but formulated with additional ingredients to boost protection against highly corrosive saltwater and high humidity. Delivers heavy-duty bonded protection- proven in combat but gentle enough for collectibles and exotics. Long lasting, lint-free impregnated durable cloth. Tested and Used by Navy SEALs. Protects guns and gear in extreme conditions, concealed carry, marine use and long term storage + Prevents fingerprint damage + Stops rust + Micro-bonded shield + Displaces moisture + Prevents tarnishing & dulling + Great for all metals & finishes - blued & stainless steel + Safe for woods & plastics.", "text": "Marine TUF-CLOTH 12\" x 12\" resealable pouch Clean + Lubricate + Protect Micro-Bonding Oil-Free Shield, will not Attract Dirt. Developed on request from Navy SEALs - based on TUF-CLOTH but formulated with additional ingredients to boost protection against highly corrosive saltwater and high humidity. Delivers heavy-duty bonded protection- proven in combat but gentle enough for collectibles and exotics. Long lasting, lint-free impregnated durable cloth. Tested and Used by Navy SEALs. Protects guns and gear in extreme conditions, concealed carry, marine use and long term storage + Prevents fingerprint damage + Stops rust + Micro-bonded shield + Displaces moisture + Prevents tarnishing & dulling + Great for all metals & finishes - blued & stainless steel + Safe for woods & plastics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mP33l54cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G0Y6J4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sentry Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cloths"]], "price": 7.68}}
{"item_id": "B001G27C98", "title": "GLOWSTICK GRN FLASHLITE (PPWGLOWSTICKG)", "description": "LIFE GEAR LGGLOWSTICKG GLOWSTICK WITH BUILT-IN FLASHLIGHT & WHISTLE (GREEN LED)", "text": "GLOWSTICK GRN FLASHLITE (PPWGLOWSTICKG) LIFE GEAR LGGLOWSTICKG GLOWSTICK WITH BUILT-IN FLASHLIGHT & WHISTLE (GREEN LED)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jwFqNZNfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G27C98.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 7.64}}
