{"item_id": "B001G92KZ2", "title": "Smidgen", "description": "If you need a small reliable knife then the Smidgen by Buck Knives should be your choice. It is an American made fixed blade that offers a high quality stainless steel in a compact fixed blade frame. Make sure to carry your Smidgen with you at all times with the injection molded nylon sheath. PRODUCT FEATURES: Compact, high-quality American-made fixed blade knife Made of durable 420HC stainless steel, and conveniently stowed in an injection molded Nylon sheath small, easily accessible knife This knife comes in a igid, injection molded Nylon sheath including a carabiner carrying attachment 0160SSS-B , Buck Knives Smidgen , buck knives , buck smidgen , smidgen buck knives , buck knives , buck knives warranty , buck folding knives , buck knives for sale , buck knives pocket knives , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , buck survival knives , buck knives review , buck knifes , best pocket knife , where are buck knives made , buck knife , pocket knives for sale , buck knives usa , vintage buck knives , buck knives direct , buck knives made in usa , buckknives , rescue knives , buck knives wiki , buck knives catalog , buck knives hunting knives , personalized buck knives , buck hunting knives , cheap buck knives , custom buck knives , cold steel , buckknives.com , buck knives repair , buck knives website , buck knives hunting knife , buck knives idaho , buck knives sharpening , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , pocket knives for sale , old timer pocket knives , best pocket knives , good pocket knives , classic pocket knives , buck knives , buck knife , fine pocket knives , high end pocket knives , custom made pocket knives , folding pocket knives , cool pocket knives , pocket knifes , small pocket knives , buck , buck knives", "text": "Smidgen If you need a small reliable knife then the Smidgen by Buck Knives should be your choice. It is an American made fixed blade that offers a high quality stainless steel