{"item_id": "B001G93XZ8", "title": "Slendertone ReVive Professional Muscle Conditioner", "description": "The ReVive Professional Muscle Conditioner uses the same Electrical Muscle Stimulation (EMS) technology used by doctors and physical therapists to rehabilitate and strengthen muscles. The Revive Muscle Conditioner engages the nerves that surround your muscles, gently and safely contracting and relaxing the muscles to ease tension, stress, and tightness. The massage-like action increases blood flow, reducing lactic acid and waste to promote muscle recovery and rejuvenation. With six different muslce recovery and relaxation programs, and customizable intensity levels of 0-99, this convenient and easy to use device soothes tired, expended muscles in ten different body parts. It's hands-free and approved safe by the FDA.Features:All natural way to promote muscle recovery6 different muscle recovery and relaxation programsSoothes tired, expended muscles in 10 different body partsCustomizable intensity levels 0-99, to satisfy your needsConvenient, portable and easy to useHands free and convenientFDA approved safeReduce muscle tension6 different programs1 year warranty", "text": "Slendertone ReVive Professional Muscle Conditioner The ReVive Professional Muscle Conditioner uses the same Electrical Muscle Stimulation (EMS) technology used by doctors and physical therapists to rehabilitate and strengthen muscles. The Revive Muscle Conditioner engages the nerves that surround your muscles, gently and safely contracting and relaxing the muscles to ease tension, stress, and tightness. The massage-like action increases blood flow, reducing lactic acid and waste to promote muscle recovery and rejuvenation. With six different muslce recovery and relaxation programs, and customizable intensity levels of 0-99, this convenient and easy to use device soothes tired, expended muscles in ten different body parts. It's hands-free and approved safe by the FDA.Features:All natural way to promote muscle recovery6 different muscle recovery and relaxation programsSoothes tired, expended muscles in 10 different body partsCustomizable intensity levels 0-99, to satisfy your needsConvenient, portable and easy to useHands free and convenientFDA approved safeReduce muscle tension6 different programs1 year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xfRWZJUSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001G93XZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 67.77}}
{"item_id": "B001GA0QQQ", "title": "Tervis Tumbler Red 16oz. Travel Lid", "description": "Keep your favorite drink where it belongs with this tight-fitting travel lid featuring an open/close slider that's a perfect fit for anyone on the go.Straws fit Tervis straw lids only; universal size that will fit all of our tumblers and mugs.", "text": "Tervis Tumbler Red 16oz. Travel Lid Keep your favorite drink where it belongs with this tight-fitting travel lid featuring an open/close slider that's a perfect fit for anyone on the go.Straws fit Tervis straw lids only; universal size that will fit all of our tumblers and mugs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TltgxVYwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GA0QQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tervis Tumbler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Travel Mugs"]], "price": 4.0}}
