{"item_id": "B001GAOMI4", "title": "Bell Fraction Youth Multi-Sport Helmet", "description": "Big Little Helmet Now the little radster can finally hang with the big kids The Fraction brings the same skate-style cool of its older bother to the pint-sized set. Just like the big Faction, it's dual certified for skate and bike use, and features the same tough ABS plastic shell adorned with edgy graphics as well as dual-density EPS foam for a low-profile fit. Welcome to the club, little one.", "text": "Bell Fraction Youth Multi-Sport Helmet Big Little Helmet Now the little radster can finally hang with the big kids The Fraction brings the same skate-style cool of its older bother to the pint-sized set. Just like the big Faction, it's dual certified for skate and bike use, and features the same tough ABS plastic shell adorned with edgy graphics as well as dual-density EPS foam for a low-profile fit. Welcome to the club, little one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AIl04BCeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOMI4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOMLQ", "title": "Bell Volt Bike Helmet", "description": "Combining massive ventilation, svelte weight, and high-tech comfort features, the Bell Volt Bike Helmet has 11 frontal vents direct the flow of air via the helmet's custom-sculpted Composite Fiber Intakes (CFI) and internal StreamJet Ventilation channels. Designed to be used on- or off-road, the Volt's removable Variable Position Visor (VPV) is well suited to the rigors of road racing as well as cross country (XC) competitions.Rearward exhaust ports and the moisture-wicking X-Static padding work in tandem to help keep the rider cool and dry. The Volt is made even more comfortable by Bell's new Twin Axis Gear (TAG) fit system--an evolution of the highly acclaimed GPS fit system--which allows riders to both dial in the exact fit as well as adjust the mechanism's horizontal position on the back of the head.The Volt's removable variable position visor.Easy adjustment with the Twin Axis Gear fit system.Channeled VentilationSpecially designed ventilation channels on the interior of the helmet's liner bring cool air in through the front, pass it over the head and flushes warm air out of the rear ports. The Volt features deeply sculpted channels that keep air moving whether you're bombing it at 30 mph, or huffing it uphill at single digit speed.Internal ReinforcementIn order to maximize venting and minimize bulk, high-end helmets like the Volt now feature internal reinforcements. These composite skeletons fortify helmets the same way rebar makes concrete stronger. This allows for bigger vents, more advanced styling and lighter weight, while still meeting stringent safety standards.GPS Fit SystemFor a glove-like fit, nothing beats Bell's exclusive Geared Positioning System (GPS), which delivers the ultimate one-hand adjustment for superior fit and comfort. Simply turn the dial to click in to the perfect custom fit.", "text": "Bell Volt Bike Helmet Combining massive ventilation, svelte weight, and high-tech comfort features, the Bell Volt Bike Helmet has 11 frontal vents direct the flow of air via the helmet's custom-sculpted Composite Fiber Intakes (CFI) and internal StreamJet Ventilation channels. Designed to be used on- or off-road, the Volt's removable Variable Position Visor (VPV) is well suited to the rigors of road racing as well as cross country (XC) competitions.Rearward exhaust ports and the moisture-wicking X-Static padding work in tandem to help keep the rider cool and dry. The Volt is made even more comfortable by Bell's new Twin Axis Gear (TAG) fit system--an evolution of the highly acclaimed GPS fit system--which allows riders to both dial in the exact fit as well as adjust the mechanism's horizontal position on the back of the head.The Volt's removable variable position visor.Easy adjustment with the Twin Axis Gear fit system.Channeled VentilationSpecially designed ventilation channels on the interior of the helmet's liner bring cool air in through the front, pass it over the head and flushes warm air out of the rear ports. The Volt features deeply sculpted channels that keep air moving whether you're bombing it at 30 mph, or huffing it uphill at single digit speed.Internal ReinforcementIn order to maximize venting and minimize bulk, high-end helmets like the Volt now feature internal reinforcements. These composite skeletons fortify helmets the same way rebar makes concrete stronger. This allows for bigger vents, more advanced styling and lighter weight, while still meeting stringent safety standards.GPS Fit SystemFor a glove-like fit, nothing beats Bell's exclusive Geared Positioning System (GPS), which delivers the ultimate one-hand adjustment for superior fit and comfort. Simply turn the dial to click in to the perfect custom fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dPOCMIpmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOMLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAONO2", "title": "Giro Bravo Cycling Glove", "description": "", "text": "Giro Bravo Cycling Glove", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zhzu6%2Bu8L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAONO2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOOZ0", "title": "Giro Phase Bike Helmet", "description": "The Phase is compact, cool, and durable enough to handle even the most daunting climbs and rock-strewn ribbons of singletrack. And it's a super value for riders who want high-profile performance in a low-profile helmet. TECHNOLOGIES: -Super Fit Engineering -In-Mold Technology SPECS: -Fit System: Acu Dial 2 -Construction: In-mold - EPS liner, polycarbonate shell -Ventilation: 27 vents -Features: Snap-fit 2 visor", "text": "Giro Phase Bike Helmet The Phase is compact, cool, and durable enough to handle even the most daunting climbs and rock-strewn ribbons of singletrack. And it's a super value for riders who want high-profile performance in a low-profile helmet. TECHNOLOGIES: -Super Fit Engineering -In-Mold Technology SPECS: -Fit System: Acu Dial 2 -Construction: In-mold - EPS liner, polycarbonate shell -Ventilation: 27 vents -Features: Snap-fit 2 visor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B244FbDUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOOZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOPS6", "title": "Giro Saros Road/Racing Bike Helmet", "description": "The Giro Saros Road and Racing helmet provides premier features and modern style at a reasonable price - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "text": "Giro Saros Road/Racing Bike Helmet The Giro Saros Road and Racing helmet provides premier features and modern style at a reasonable price - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41etZ8Y6jeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOPS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOQ9Y", "title": "Giro Xen Full-Fingered MTB Cycling Glove", "description": "", "text": "Giro Xen Full-Fingered MTB Cycling Glove", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l5u45F8jL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOQ9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR0M", "title": "Blackburn Mountain Bicycle Water Bottle Cage", "description": "Cheap plastic bottle holsters might hold onto your gear on the road, but the burly Blackburn Mountain Water Bottle Cage was built for pedal-churning rides in the mountains. Oversized aluminum framing secures your water bottle tight so it won't go flying when you float over a rock garden at mach looney.", "text": "Blackburn Mountain Bicycle Water Bottle Cage Cheap plastic bottle holsters might hold onto your gear on the road, but the burly Blackburn Mountain Water Bottle Cage was built for pedal-churning rides in the mountains. Oversized aluminum framing secures your water bottle tight so it won't go flying when you float over a rock garden at mach looney.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cgMSrKWjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR1Q", "title": "Blackburn AirStik SL Bicycle Frame Pump", "description": "What ever happened to the pump peg? Whenever we look at mini-pumps, and the Blackburn AirStik SL is no different, we find ourselves longing for a way to mount a full-size frame pump under the top tube of our bike. They were so easy. Even the plastic Silca pumps were better than most of the mini-pumps of today. Mini-pumps have a problem; the ones that are small enough and light enough to qualify as \"mini\" don't pump well, and the ones that pump well are too big and cumbersome to qualify as \"mini.\" Despite all our whining, this AirStik SL is the first mini-pump to catch our attention in a long time. It's light, but still made of aluminum, rather than plastic. It has a solid-feeling head that we don't think we'll break the first time we pump a tire up. And it is small enough to fit in a pocket and gives us little reason to fear it will flop out over bumps. When we looked more closely, we liked it even more. It is only 157mm long when closed. The pump stroke is 93mm, delivering 1. 8 cubic inches of air per stroke. It's not exactly frame pump volume, but it does outshine the SKS Sub 40 (1. 6) and Topeak Micro Rocket (1. 2). Yes, it's going to take a long time to get the tire up to 110psi, but it will be rideable long before that. And, with the small volume, there will never be that much resistance per stroke. We wonder if one of the things we like about this pump is that Blackburn hired a suspension fork engineer to work on their pump line. The result is mini-pumps that use the shaft space as an air chamber, which makes the pump action more stable and delivers more air per stroke. The Blackburn AirStik SL comes with a mount that fits under a bottle cage. The head is designed for Presta valves only. Maximum pressure possible with the pump is 160psi. While this may not be important to you, Blackburn has made the pump so it can be rebuilt rather than tossed when a part breaks. There is a lifetime warranty on the pump. The pump comes in three colors: Black, Carbon, and Wh...", "text": "Blackburn AirStik SL Bicycle Frame Pump What ever happened to the pump peg? Whenever we look at mini-pumps, and the Blackburn AirStik SL is no different, we find ourselves longing for a way to mount a full-size frame pump under the top tube of our bike. They were so easy. Even the plastic Silca pumps were better than most of the mini-pumps of today. Mini-pumps have a problem; the ones that are small enough and light enough to qualify as \"mini\" don't pump well, and the ones that pump well are too big and cumbersome to qualify as \"mini.\" Despite all our whining, this AirStik SL is the first mini-pump to catch our attention in a long time. It's light, but still made of aluminum, rather than plastic. It has a solid-feeling head that we don't think we'll break the first time we pump a tire up. And it is small enough to fit in a pocket and gives us little reason to fear it will flop out over bumps. When we looked more closely, we liked it even more. It is only 157mm long when closed. The pump stroke is 93mm, delivering 1. 8 cubic inches of air per stroke. It's not exactly frame pump volume, but it does outshine the SKS Sub 40 (1. 6) and Topeak Micro Rocket (1. 2). Yes, it's going to take a long time to get the tire up to 110psi, but it will be rideable long before that. And, with the small volume, there will never be that much resistance per stroke. We wonder if one of the things we like about this pump is that Blackburn hired a suspension fork engineer to work on their pump line. The result is mini-pumps that use the shaft space as an air chamber, which makes the pump action more stable and delivers more air per stroke. The Blackburn AirStik SL comes with a mount that fits under a bottle cage. The head is designed for Presta valves only. Maximum pressure possible with the pump is 160psi. While this may not be important to you, Blackburn has made the pump so it can be rebuilt rather than tossed when a part breaks. There is a lifetime warranty on the pump. The pump comes in three colors: Black, Carbon, and Wh...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PLX-LPVCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR2K", "title": "Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Bicycle Headlight", "description": "Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Headlight - Compact case packing three high-powered white LED's - No Tools universal clamp works with standard and OS bars - Steady and flash Mode - 100 hour runtime steady; 300+ hour runtime flash - 4 AAA Batteries included - Lifetime Warranty LED's: 3 White Run Time (Steady Flash): 100-300 hours Batteries: 4 AAA", "text": "Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Bicycle Headlight Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Headlight - Compact case packing three high-powered white LED's - No Tools universal clamp works with standard and OS bars - Steady and flash Mode - 100 hour runtime steady; 300+ hour runtime flash - 4 AAA Batteries included - Lifetime Warranty LED's: 3 White Run Time (Steady Flash): 100-300 hours Batteries: 4 AAA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WpAm-LyCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 22.17}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR2U", "title": "Blackburn Mars 4.0 Rear Light", "description": "FEATURES of the Blackburn Mars 4.0 Rear Light Blackburn's most powerful rear flasher 1 Watt ultra-bright red LED 2 Amber side LEDs for side visibility 50hr steady, 150hr flashing runtimes No tool battery installation 2 AAA batteries included 3 mounting options included: belt clip, seatpost clamp and reflector/rear rack mount", "text": "Blackburn Mars 4.0 Rear Light FEATURES of the Blackburn Mars 4.0 Rear Light Blackburn's most powerful rear flasher 1 Watt ultra-bright red LED 2 Amber side LEDs for side visibility 50hr steady, 150hr flashing runtimes No tool battery installation 2 AAA batteries included 3 mounting options included: belt clip, seatpost clamp and reflector/rear rack mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4176mIdqFvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 22.47}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR3Y", "title": "Blackburn Flea Rear Flasher Bicycle Taillight", "description": "This light is AMAZING. It's super small, unbelievably bright and SLICK looking. The lightest, brightest rechargeable cycling light in the world. Flea lights are smaller than cookies, and with a versatile hook/loop strap mounting system (and belt clip for the rear) they'll mount almost anywhere. Blackburn Flea lights include a proprietary charging system that saps juice from any standard 1.5v battery, AA's, C-cells, whatever you have. Just plug the magnetic leads to a battery and leave it---the auto-shutoff will prevent overcharging. - Micro size rechargeable Li-Ion headlight - Uses four super-bright White NichiaT LED's - 40 lumen output - Patented innovative charging system uses any standard 1.5V battery - Flexible and compact mounting design - Normal, Overdrive, and Flash modes - Superlight at 17 grams - 3 hour runtime steady, 6 hours runtime flash LED's: 4 Ultrabright Nichia White Run Time (Steady/Flash): 3-6hrs Batteries: Internal Lithium Ion Rechargeable", "text": "Blackburn Flea Rear Flasher Bicycle Taillight This light is AMAZING. It's super small, unbelievably bright and SLICK looking. The lightest, brightest rechargeable cycling light in the world. Flea lights are smaller than cookies, and with a versatile hook/loop strap mounting system (and belt clip for the rear) they'll mount almost anywhere. Blackburn Flea lights include a proprietary charging system that saps juice from any standard 1.5v battery, AA's, C-cells, whatever you have. Just plug the magnetic leads to a battery and leave it---the auto-shutoff will prevent overcharging. - Micro size rechargeable Li-Ion headlight - Uses four super-bright White NichiaT LED's - 40 lumen output - Patented innovative charging system uses any standard 1.5V battery - Flexible and compact mounting design - Normal, Overdrive, and Flash modes - Superlight at 17 grams - 3 hour runtime steady, 6 hours runtime flash LED's: 4 Ultrabright Nichia White Run Time (Steady/Flash): 3-6hrs Batteries: Internal Lithium Ion Rechargeable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Oz0daQXFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GAOR48", "title": "Blackburn Voyager 3.3 / Mars 1.0 Combo", "description": "If you ride your bike at night, you need lights to keep you safe. The Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Headlight / Mars 1.0 Taillight Combo pack is the simplest most affordable deal around. Including the Voyager headlight and Mars taillight as well as adjustable mounts this combo has everything you need for safe nighttime rides without the hassle of other lighting systems.", "text": "Blackburn Voyager 3.3 / Mars 1.0 Combo If you ride your bike at night, you need lights to keep you safe. The Blackburn Voyager 3.3 Headlight / Mars 1.0 Taillight Combo pack is the simplest most affordable deal around. Including the Voyager headlight and Mars taillight as well as adjustable mounts this combo has everything you need for safe nighttime rides without the hassle of other lighting systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WYWyk5ggL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GAOR48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 29.95}}
