{"item_id": "B001GRSI3C", "title": "OUTDOOR FIRST AID KIT 201 PC FOR CAMPING, BOATING, FISHING, HUNTING", "description": "201 pieces of first aid with an emphasis on outdoor protection. Multi-Compartmental, Hard case is sturdy enough for rugged use. Case includes a adjustable and removeable shoulder strap and a convenient carry handle. Removable inner Mini Pouch for first aid ON THE GO. Kit Measures 7 3/4 inch by 7 inch by 3 1/2.", "text": "OUTDOOR FIRST AID KIT 201 PC FOR CAMPING, BOATING, FISHING, HUNTING 201 pieces of first aid with an emphasis on outdoor protection. Multi-Compartmental, Hard case is sturdy enough for rugged use. Case includes a adjustable and removeable shoulder strap and a convenient carry handle. Removable inner Mini Pouch for first aid ON THE GO. Kit Measures 7 3/4 inch by 7 inch by 3 1/2.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Gc3wq9ZjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GRSI3C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 27.56}}
