{"item_id": "B001GSKN8E", "title": "Shimano America RD-M662 SLX 9-Speed Rear Derailleur", "description": "The Shimano SLX rear derailleur features direct cable routing and low profile Shadow technology so it is even sleeker than in years past, and since there is no contact with the chainstay your pretty frame will have fewer nicks and scratches. A stronger guide spring adds crispness, and lighter materials shave this new version down to only 260 grams.Product Featuresul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px;\"Material: Aluminum/ paintedSpeeds: 9Cage: ShortTop / Low Normal: Top NormalMaximum Front Difference: 22TTotal Capacity: 35TWeight: 253 gramsRecommended Use: Mountain bikingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "Shimano America RD-M662 SLX 9-Speed Rear Derailleur The Shimano SLX rear derailleur features direct cable routing and low profile Shadow technology so it is even sleeker than in years past, and since there is no contact with the chainstay your pretty frame will have fewer nicks and scratches. A stronger guide spring adds crispness, and lighter materials shave this new version down to only 260 grams.Product Featuresul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px;\"Material: Aluminum/ paintedSpeeds: 9Cage: ShortTop / Low Normal: Top NormalMaximum Front Difference: 22TTotal Capacity: 35TWeight: 253 gramsRecommended Use: Mountain bikingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gGcKvMhZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSKN8E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Rear Derailleurs"]]}}
