{"item_id": "B001GSKWQC", "title": "Schwalbe Marathon Supreme HS 382 Touring Road Bike Tire (26x2.0, Triple Nano Triple Nano Folding, Reflex)", "description": "The Schwalbe marathon tires incorporate light-reflecting sidewalls for better visibility and also utilizes a Silica compound for easy rolling and longer life. Multi-use touring tire; elegant and sturdy sidewalls defy abuse. HDV (High-Density Vectran) woven fibers for high puncture protection. Magic compound provides security on wet, slippery roads as well as excellent rolling characteristics. Marathon Silica compound for easy rolling and longer life. Reflex sidewalls incorporate light-reflecting bands.", "text": "Schwalbe Marathon Supreme HS 382 Touring Road Bike Tire (26x2.0, Triple Nano Triple Nano Folding, Reflex) The Schwalbe marathon tires incorporate light-reflecting sidewalls for better visibility and also utilizes a Silica compound for easy rolling and longer life. Multi-use touring tire; elegant and sturdy sidewalls defy abuse. HDV (High-Density Vectran) woven fibers for high puncture protection. Magic compound provides security on wet, slippery roads as well as excellent rolling characteristics. Marathon Silica compound for easy rolling and longer life. Reflex sidewalls incorporate light-reflecting bands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kXt%2BC%2BiZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSKWQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwalbe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 64.93}}
