{"item_id": "B001GSMUDA", "title": "Burley Design Bicycle Trailer Hitch (Standard, Forged)", "description": "Keep all your bikes ready for trailering with an extra hitch. Built with Burley quality you can count on, the Standard Hitch boasts lightweight and ultra-strong forged 6061 T6 aluminum construction. The hitch works with quick release or nutted axel wheels as well as disc brake systems and full suspension MTB bikes. The hitch does not fit Breezer style dropouts. Please note: if you are upgrading from a Burley Classic Hitch to a Standard Forged Hitch, you will also need to purchase a Flex Connector square tow bar or a Flex Connector round tow bar.", "text": "Burley Design Bicycle Trailer Hitch (Standard, Forged) Keep all your bikes ready for trailering with an extra hitch. Built with Burley quality you can count on, the Standard Hitch boasts lightweight and ultra-strong forged 6061 T6 aluminum construction. The hitch works with quick release or nutted axel wheels as well as disc brake systems and full suspension MTB bikes. The hitch does not fit Breezer style dropouts. Please note: if you are upgrading from a Burley Classic Hitch to a Standard Forged Hitch, you will also need to purchase a Flex Connector square tow bar or a Flex Connector round tow bar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZqAJprKML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSMUDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burley Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B001GSOHMC", "title": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle", "description": "The most versatile stainless bottles on the market!? The wide mouth opening is great for easy cleaning or filing with ice. It has a standard Nalgene thread pattern and 63 mm opening, which make them compatible with most water filters.The only wide mouth stainless bottles with stainless steel threads making them incredibly durable and good-looking!", "text": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle The most versatile stainless bottles on the market!? The wide mouth opening is great for easy cleaning or filing with ice. It has a standard Nalgene thread pattern and 63 mm opening, which make them compatible with most water filters.The only wide mouth stainless bottles with stainless steel threads making them incredibly durable and good-looking!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qqSPktaxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSOHMC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 30.96}}
