{"item_id": "B001GSQOCS", "title": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle", "description": "Nalgene's line of Stainless Steel bottles are ultra durable, will withstand temperature extremes, are BPA free, and won't transfer odor or taste to your beverages. Features: BPA free Stainless construction is lightweight and environmentally friendly Dishwasher safe Temperature range -211F to 275F", "text": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle Nalgene's line of Stainless Steel bottles are ultra durable, will withstand temperature extremes, are BPA free, and won't transfer odor or taste to your beverages. Features: BPA free Stainless construction is lightweight and environmentally friendly Dishwasher safe Temperature range -211F to 275F", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZU4tS60BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSQOCS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 24.46}}
