{"item_id": "B001GSQXUG", "title": "Burley Design Flex Connector for Round Tow Arm (Black)", "description": "Built for years of use, the patent-pending Burley Flex Connector attaches the trailer's tow arm to the Burley hitch. Allowing for up to six feet of torque, the Flex Connector allows you to lay your bicycle down flat while the trailer remains in an upright position. The connector comes with a safety strap and a D-ring. Please note: this model is intended for use with aroundtow arm.", "text": "Burley Design Flex Connector for Round Tow Arm (Black) Built for years of use, the patent-pending Burley Flex Connector attaches the trailer's tow arm to the Burley hitch. Allowing for up to six feet of torque, the Flex Connector allows you to lay your bicycle down flat while the trailer remains in an upright position. The connector comes with a safety strap and a D-ring. Please note: this model is intended for use with aroundtow arm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QhfMf6yKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSQXUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burley Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B001GSSDAY", "title": "Kinetic by Kurt Rear Skewer for Trainer", "description": "Kinetic provides this skewer with every new trainer. Extra skewers may be purchased here. NOTE: We strongly recommend replacing your bicycle's stock skewer with this skewer we've provide with the trainer. We also recommend that you use the stock cone cup already installed on your kinetic trainer. You'll save wear and tear on your own skewer and be assured of a solid attachment for your bike.", "text": "Kinetic by Kurt Rear Skewer for Trainer Kinetic provides this skewer with every new trainer. Extra skewers may be purchased here. NOTE: We strongly recommend replacing your bicycle's stock skewer with this skewer we've provide with the trainer. We also recommend that you use the stock cone cup already installed on your kinetic trainer. You'll save wear and tear on your own skewer and be assured of a solid attachment for your bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bV-UtKmFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GSSDAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kinetic by Kurt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 10.0}}
