{"item_id": "B001GX8DS6", "title": "Frankford Arsenal 287178 Arsenal Brass Cleaning Corn Cob Media", "description": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal 287178 Arsenal Brass Cleaning Corn Cob Media Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cCyMOcWgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GX8DS6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 22.05}}
{"item_id": "B001GX8IFE", "title": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Tufnut (12-Pounds)", "description": "Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Rouge Bearing Nutshell. Please note that \"Tufnut\" is the Brand name and not a real nut. Also the the product consists of various crushed nuts.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Tumbler Media Tufnut (12-Pounds) Lyman Case Cleaning Media is the most effective choice for cleaning dirty and tarnished cases. A few hours in a Lyman Turbo Tumbler cases are clean, polished and ready for reloading. Rouge Bearing Nutshell. Please note that \"Tufnut\" is the Brand name and not a real nut. Also the the product consists of various crushed nuts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5163JcUFIkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GX8IFE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.7}}
{"item_id": "B001GXABPY", "title": "BoatBuckle Pro Series Kwik-Lok Transom Tie-Down", "description": "The BoatBuckle Pro Series tie-downs feature our Sur-Grip Kwik-Lok buckle for maximum comfort. For added safety and security, it also comes with standard Hi-Vis protective PVC pads and our Night Eyes reflective closure patch for increased visibility in low light conditions.", "text": "BoatBuckle Pro Series Kwik-Lok Transom Tie-Down The BoatBuckle Pro Series tie-downs feature our Sur-Grip Kwik-Lok buckle for maximum comfort. For added safety and security, it also comes with standard Hi-Vis protective PVC pads and our Night Eyes reflective closure patch for increased visibility in low light conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BS0ssEZDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GXABPY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories", "Tie-Downs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001GXASES", "title": "Sportlock Aluminumlock Series Double Pistol Case", "description": "The entire AluminumLock Series is airline approved and have strong aluminum frames, reinforced corners, and high impact plastic sides to keep your gear secure no matter what your mode of travel.", "text": "Sportlock Aluminumlock Series Double Pistol Case The entire AluminumLock Series is airline approved and have strong aluminum frames, reinforced corners, and high impact plastic sides to keep your gear secure no matter what your mode of travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ghwdaG3yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GXASES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sportlock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 39.2}}
