{"item_id": "B001GXCWR4", "title": "RCBS Scale Pan with Integrated Funnel", "description": "Is your powder funnel always missing when you need it most? The RCBS Scale Pan Powder Funnel eliminates that problem. The Scale Pan features an integrated powder funnel that allows you to pour the powder directly into the case. The new scale pan is designed for use with electronic scales and powder dispensers.", "text": "RCBS Scale Pan with Integrated Funnel Is your powder funnel always missing when you need it most? The RCBS Scale Pan Powder Funnel eliminates that problem. The Scale Pan features an integrated powder funnel that allows you to pour the powder directly into the case. The new scale pan is designed for use with electronic scales and powder dispensers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gOQrnxCrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GXCWR4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 1.99}}
