{"item_id": "B001GZH46Q", "title": "Jagwire 4mm LEX Bicycle Shift Cable Housing - 25 Foot Roll", "description": "Jagwire brake & derailleur housings face a continuous gauntlet of testing to ensure they are fully compatible with all major component systems on the market today. Using Lead-free PVC Jagwire housings meet all international standards and regulations for chemical and material content. Featured equipment on bicycles from BMC to Specialized, Merida to Centurion, Giant to GT and Cannondale to Norco, Jagwire housings are trusted by hundreds of bicycle manufacturers to deliver the performance they demand.", "text": "Jagwire 4mm LEX Bicycle Shift Cable Housing - 25 Foot Roll Jagwire brake & derailleur housings face a continuous gauntlet of testing to ensure they are fully compatible with all major component systems on the market today. Using Lead-free PVC Jagwire housings meet all international standards and regulations for chemical and material content. Featured equipment on bicycles from BMC to Specialized, Merida to Centurion, Giant to GT and Cannondale to Norco, Jagwire housings are trusted by hundreds of bicycle manufacturers to deliver the performance they demand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HDTtN27SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001GZH46Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jagwire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 25.58}}
{"item_id": "B001H0EQA2", "title": "Remington Sportsman Series F.A.S.T. Fixed Blade Knife (Matte Black Handle with Black Blade)", "description": "A highly successful cutlery series, the Remington Sportsman Series F.A.S.T. (Fast Action Soft Touch) Fixed-Blade Knife features an anodized aluminum scale handle with rubberized coating, riveted to a solid one-piece 3.9mm thick tang with lanyard hole. The 5- serrated/straight combo edge blade is constructed of 440 stainless steel. Overall length is 10- inches. Each F.A.S.T. Fixed-Blade Knife comes with a heavy duty, black nylon sheath with handy belt loop. Once you use them, these F.A.S.T. knives will never leave your hands.Blades available with either Bead Blast finish or Black Oxidized coating. Handle options include several camo patterns or matte black.", "text": "Remington Sportsman Series F.A.S.T. Fixed Blade Knife (Matte Black Handle with Black Blade) A highly successful cutlery series, the Remington Sportsman Series F.A.S.T. (Fast Action Soft Touch) Fixed-Blade Knife features an anodized aluminum scale handle with rubberized coating, riveted to a solid one-piece 3.9mm thick tang with lanyard hole. The 5- serrated/straight combo edge blade is constructed of 440 stainless steel. Overall length is 10- inches. Each F.A.S.T. Fixed-Blade Knife comes with a heavy duty, black nylon sheath with handy belt loop. Once you use them, these F.A.S.T. knives will never leave your hands.Blades available with either Bead Blast finish or Black Oxidized coating. Handle options include several camo patterns or matte black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21jqurqqUuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H0EQA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.49}}
