{"item_id": "B001H1JJHG", "title": "Off! Clip-On Starter Kit", "description": "Off! Clip-On Starter repellent provides personal protection from mosquitoes. If you move, allow a few minutes for the unit to rebuild its protection. Protects against mosquitoes that may carry West Nile Virus. Unlike ordinary personal repellents, OFF! Clip-On repellent provides mosquito protection without putting anything on your skin.", "text": "Off! Clip-On Starter Kit Off! Clip-On Starter repellent provides personal protection from mosquitoes. If you move, allow a few minutes for the unit to rebuild its protection. Protects against mosquitoes that may carry West Nile Virus. Unlike ordinary personal repellents, OFF! Clip-On repellent provides mosquito protection without putting anything on your skin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bQ-S0lWIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H1JJHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OFF!", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001H2RXBE", "title": "Shakespeare Travel Mate Telescopic Rod & Reel Combo", "description": "Travel Mate rod and reel fishing combo kits come with a hard body carrying case that has six compartments for tackle. This handy case has a fold-down handle as well as a removable shoulder strap and clear lid. It can easily be displayed on peg hook or flat on a store shelf.", "text": "Shakespeare Travel Mate Telescopic Rod & Reel Combo Travel Mate rod and reel fishing combo kits come with a hard body carrying case that has six compartments for tackle. This handy case has a fold-down handle as well as a removable shoulder strap and clear lid. It can easily be displayed on peg hook or flat on a store shelf.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yhwY8DmcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H2RXBE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spinning Combos"]]}}
