{"item_id": "B001H53Q7G", "title": "Ka-Bar Leather Handled Marine Hunter Knife", "description": "Brown Leather Ka-Bar sheath included.", "text": "Ka-Bar Leather Handled Marine Hunter Knife Brown Leather Ka-Bar sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215eS9-Q99L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53Q7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 37.99}}
{"item_id": "B001H53Q80", "title": "Ka-Bar Black Cutlass Machete", "description": "Equipped with a cutlass-style 1085 carbon-steel blade, the Cutlass machete from Ka-Bar is ideal for chopping down weeds, clearing a campsite, or cutting small limbs and tree branches. The machete is comfortable in the hand, with an ergonomically shaped Kraton G thermoplastic elastomer handle that ensures a nonslip grip. Users will also love the leather/Cordura combination sheath, which fits conveniently on your belt. Other features include a hollow grind, a 20-degree edge angle, and a blade length of 11 inches. The Cutlass machete measures 16-1/2 inches overall and weighs 1.12 pounds.", "text": "Ka-Bar Black Cutlass Machete Equipped with a cutlass-style 1085 carbon-steel blade, the Cutlass machete from Ka-Bar is ideal for chopping down weeds, clearing a campsite, or cutting small limbs and tree branches. The machete is comfortable in the hand, with an ergonomically shaped Kraton G thermoplastic elastomer handle that ensures a nonslip grip. Users will also love the leather/Cordura combination sheath, which fits conveniently on your belt. Other features include a hollow grind, a 20-degree edge angle, and a blade length of 11 inches. The Cutlass machete measures 16-1/2 inches overall and weighs 1.12 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21fwLpSBHTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53Q80.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 53.36}}
{"item_id": "B001H53Q8K", "title": "Ka-Bar Short Black Tanto Knife", "description": "KA-BAR 1254 Short Ka-Bar Black Tanto, Leather Sheath, 5.25 in., Plain KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. 5.25 in. Epoxy powder coated high carbon 1095 stainless steel blade and buff polished edges. Oval shaped Kraton G thermoplastic elastomer handle, with metal butt caps, carbon steel guards. 9.37 in. Overall length. Comes with black leather sheath. KA-BAR 1254 Short Ka-Bar Black Tanto, Leather Sheath, 5.25 in., Plain Features: Made In: United States", "text": "Ka-Bar Short Black Tanto Knife KA-BAR 1254 Short Ka-Bar Black Tanto, Leather Sheath, 5.25 in., Plain KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. 5.25 in. Epoxy powder coated high carbon 1095 stainless steel blade and buff polished edges. Oval shaped Kraton G thermoplastic elastomer handle, with metal butt caps, carbon steel guards. 9.37 in. Overall length. Comes with black leather sheath. KA-BAR 1254 Short Ka-Bar Black Tanto, Leather Sheath, 5.25 in., Plain Features: Made In: United States", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21HBSRzB-fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53Q8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 49.98}}
{"item_id": "B001H53Q94", "title": "Ka-Bar Bull Dozier Knife", "description": "A drop-down attachment piece reverses using simple fasteners to switch the hard-plastic GFN-PA66 sheath from right-hand to left-hand carry.", "text": "Ka-Bar Bull Dozier Knife A drop-down attachment piece reverses using simple fasteners to switch the hard-plastic GFN-PA66 sheath from right-hand to left-hand carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318%2BC3r1TOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53Q94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 76.98}}
{"item_id": "B001H53Q9E", "title": "Ka-Bar D2 Extreme Fighting/Utility Knife", "description": "Cutting tests prove that D2 is one of the toughest steels used in knife making. Featured here in the classic clip point blade shape that made KA-BAR famous.Specifications:- Weight: 0.78 lbs.- Lock Style: N/A- Length: Blade length 7\",- Overall length 11 7/8\"- Grind: Flat- Shape: Clip Handle- Material: Kraton G- Stamp: USA HRC: 59-60 CR- Edge Angle: 20 Degrees Butt Cap /Guard: Pwdrd Metal/1095 Carbon- Steel: D2 Country Mft'd: Knife Made in USA- Pocket Clip: N/A", "text": "Ka-Bar D2 Extreme Fighting/Utility Knife Cutting tests prove that D2 is one of the toughest steels used in knife making. Featured here in the classic clip point blade shape that made KA-BAR famous.Specifications:- Weight: 0.78 lbs.- Lock Style: N/A- Length: Blade length 7\",- Overall length 11 7/8\"- Grind: Flat- Shape: Clip Handle- Material: Kraton G- Stamp: USA HRC: 59-60 CR- Edge Angle: 20 Degrees Butt Cap /Guard: Pwdrd Metal/1095 Carbon- Steel: D2 Country Mft'd: Knife Made in USA- Pocket Clip: N/A", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21RVWTZ6wzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53Q9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 95.87}}
