{"item_id": "B001H53QB2", "title": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Fanny Pack", "description": "Mulitple pockets, loops and straps for carrying pens, extra magazines, a cell phone, badge, keys and flashlights.", "text": "Ka-Bar TDI Law Enforcement Fanny Pack Mulitple pockets, loops and straps for carrying pens, extra magazines, a cell phone, badge, keys and flashlights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uAQx2QfYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H53QB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 29.77}}
{"item_id": "B001H54J4K", "title": "Clicgear Shoe Brush", "description": "Keep your shoes clean for ultimate traction while on the golf course. This unique shoe brush clips to the strut of all Clicgear brand carts. Durable plastic and sturdy bristles make this a must have accessory.", "text": "Clicgear Shoe Brush Keep your shoes clean for ultimate traction while on the golf course. This unique shoe brush clips to the strut of all Clicgear brand carts. Durable plastic and sturdy bristles make this a must have accessory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41khHXm60ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H54J4K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Golf Equipment", "Golf Gear"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B001H54J54", "title": "Clicgear Wheel Cover", "description": "A unique accessory designed to keep your vehicle clean from grass and mud, but also great for off-season storage. Water resistant nylon cover fits snuggly over the 3 tires of all model of the Clicgear Cart.", "text": "Clicgear Wheel Cover A unique accessory designed to keep your vehicle clean from grass and mud, but also great for off-season storage. Water resistant nylon cover fits snuggly over the 3 tires of all model of the Clicgear Cart.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516cW4acZ0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H54J54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Carts"]], "price": 13.24}}
{"item_id": "B001H5530O", "title": "Zebco Omega Z03 Spincast Reel", "description": "An ergonomic design and aircraft-grade aluminum body make for a practical and stylish fish-hunter. (Rod sold separately.)Zebco's Omega line of reels represents an extraordinarily high standard in spincast technology. The first ever seven-bearing spincast, Omega reels also feature a unique, comfortably ergonomic design.Additional features include:Stainless steel bearingsContinuous anti-reverse actionQuick-change spool systemUltra-smooth worm gear drive3X positive line pickupLevelwind oscillating spoolTriple-cam multi-disc dragCeramic line guide and pickup pinsDiecast aluminum body and reel footAircraft-grade aluminum coversSealed soft-touch rubber thumb buttonPre-spooled with lineSpecifications:Designed for medium-type fishingTen-pound line weight85-yard line capacity2.9:1 gear ratioWarrantyZebco tackle products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in material and workmanship.", "text": "Zebco Omega Z03 Spincast Reel An ergonomic design and aircraft-grade aluminum body make for a practical and stylish fish-hunter. (Rod sold separately.)Zebco's Omega line of reels represents an extraordinarily high standard in spincast technology. The first ever seven-bearing spincast, Omega reels also feature a unique, comfortably ergonomic design.Additional features include:Stainless steel bearingsContinuous anti-reverse actionQuick-change spool systemUltra-smooth worm gear drive3X positive line pickupLevelwind oscillating spoolTriple-cam multi-disc dragCeramic line guide and pickup pinsDiecast aluminum body and reel footAircraft-grade aluminum coversSealed soft-touch rubber thumb buttonPre-spooled with lineSpecifications:Designed for medium-type fishingTen-pound line weight85-yard line capacity2.9:1 gear ratioWarrantyZebco tackle products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in material and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Olwx2ONQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H5530O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zebco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spincasting Reels"]], "price": 57.33}}
{"item_id": "B001H55368", "title": "Zebco 33GOLD Gold Series Spincast Reel", "description": "Over 50 years ago, a spincast legend was born, the Zebco 33. Since then, it has grown to become the most popular fishing reel in the world. Simple and easy to use, dependable and a true performe. If anything could improve on the Authentic series, it is the Gold series, featuring three bearings and a Continuous Anti-Reverse clutch for added performance.", "text": "Zebco 33GOLD Gold Series Spincast Reel Over 50 years ago, a spincast legend was born, the Zebco 33. Since then, it has grown to become the most popular fishing reel in the world. Simple and easy to use, dependable and a true performe. If anything could improve on the Authentic series, it is the Gold series, featuring three bearings and a Continuous Anti-Reverse clutch for added performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RaYr-vzgL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H55368.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spincasting Reels"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001H55L2Y", "title": "Coleman 3AA MicroPacker Lantern", "description": "Clever and convenient, the Coleman 3AA MicroPacker Lantern packs innovative features into a small but powerful package. The MicroPacker's Cree XLamp XR-E LED sheds 80 lumens of light on the High setting. A sliding reflector projects light forward for path lighting. On a set of 3AA batteries (included), it will run for up to 14 hours on Low and 8 house on High. Use the easy push-button switch to select from the four settings: Off, Low, High, and blinking Emergency Strobe. The MicroPacker Lantern's pace-saving handle nests against top cap for storage, and can be used to attach or hang the lantern for area lighting. The MicroPacker weighs just 7 ounces with batteries, and measures approximately 6.4\" x 2.2\" x 1.7\".", "text": "Coleman 3AA MicroPacker Lantern Clever and convenient, the Coleman 3AA MicroPacker Lantern packs innovative features into a small but powerful package. The MicroPacker's Cree XLamp XR-E LED sheds 80 lumens of light on the High setting. A sliding reflector projects light forward for path lighting. On a set of 3AA batteries (included), it will run for up to 14 hours on Low and 8 house on High. Use the easy push-button switch to select from the four settings: Off, Low, High, and blinking Emergency Strobe. The MicroPacker Lantern's pace-saving handle nests against top cap for storage, and can be used to attach or hang the lantern for area lighting. The MicroPacker weighs just 7 ounces with batteries, and measures approximately 6.4\" x 2.2\" x 1.7\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lA4-4Su6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H55L2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B001H55L9C", "title": "Coleman Exponent F1 Lite Lantern", "description": "Extremely lightweight and compact, the Coleman Exponent F1 Lite Lantern is an ideal choice for backpackers, kayakers, motorcyclists, and anyone who wants a reliable light that won't take up much space or add much weight to a pack. Weighing only 3.1 ounces without a fuel canister and handle, and measuring two by four inches (W x H), the compact F1 Lite nonetheless puts out a generous amount of light, the equivalent of 24 candlepower or a 38-watt light bulb. The lantern’s total weight -- including handle and pouch -- is just 4.3 ounces, and the lantern runs up to nine hours on high or 16 hours on low on a standard, 7.75-ounce fuel canister.Made to be tough and trail-ready, the lantern's globe is made of fine stainless-steel mesh, and is stronger and lighter-weight than a standard glass globe. The lantern is lit by inserting a match in a small hole in the globe, which is easily removable for no-hassle mantle changing. A large, easy-to-manipulate control knob is fully adjustable from low to high, and the cable handle weighs less than one-tenth of an ounce, and can be detached or attached as needed for convenient carrying or hanging. An included textile pouch is cleverly reinforced on the inside with a plastic cylinder.FeaturesExtremely small and lightweightWeighs only 3.2 ounces without fuel canister and handle; 4.3 ounces with handle and pouchDetachable cable handle for easy transport or hanging lanternOperates from Coleman C100, C250, or C500 fuel cartridgesDurable, detachable mesh globe for easy access to mantleAccess hole in mesh globe for match lightingThe Coleman Limited Lifetime WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Exponent F1 Lite Lantern includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Exponent F1 Lite Lantern Extremely lightweight and compact, the Coleman Exponent F1 Lite Lantern is an ideal choice for backpackers, kayakers, motorcyclists, and anyone who wants a reliable light that won't take up much space or add much weight to a pack. Weighing only 3.1 ounces without a fuel canister and handle, and measuring two by four inches (W x H), the compact F1 Lite nonetheless puts out a generous amount of light, the equivalent of 24 candlepower or a 38-watt light bulb. The lantern’s total weight -- including handle and pouch -- is just 4.3 ounces, and the lantern runs up to nine hours on high or 16 hours on low on a standard, 7.75-ounce fuel canister.Made to be tough and trail-ready, the lantern's globe is made of fine stainless-steel mesh, and is stronger and lighter-weight than a standard glass globe. The lantern is lit by inserting a match in a small hole in the globe, which is easily removable for no-hassle mantle changing. A large, easy-to-manipulate control knob is fully adjustable from low to high, and the cable handle weighs less than one-tenth of an ounce, and can be detached or attached as needed for convenient carrying or hanging. An included textile pouch is cleverly reinforced on the inside with a plastic cylinder.FeaturesExtremely small and lightweightWeighs only 3.2 ounces without fuel canister and handle; 4.3 ounces with handle and pouchDetachable cable handle for easy transport or hanging lanternOperates from Coleman C100, C250, or C500 fuel cartridgesDurable, detachable mesh globe for easy access to mantleAccess hole in mesh globe for match lightingThe Coleman Limited Lifetime WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Exponent F1 Lite Lantern includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41szlEV4c4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H55L9C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001H55PZW", "title": "POSITIV Team Complete Skateboards", "description": "Spring 2012 DIGITAL SERIES from PositiveRide the rails and air out like the guys in the POSITIV skateboard team--Rodney Jones, Andy Macdonald, and Carlos De Andrade--with these Spring 2012 Digital Series complete boards. Every POSITIV deck is manufactured to the demanding specifications of Skate One using its proprietary AirLam skateboard presses and birch veneer source. The AirLam process fuses multiple plies of wood together using waterproof glue, sealed against other moisture, and the bottom is coated with an SST slide treatment to improve the length of your slides. The boards sport POSITIV trucks and MiniLogo bearings.", "text": "POSITIV Team Complete Skateboards Spring 2012 DIGITAL SERIES from PositiveRide the rails and air out like the guys in the POSITIV skateboard team--Rodney Jones, Andy Macdonald, and Carlos De Andrade--with these Spring 2012 Digital Series complete boards. Every POSITIV deck is manufactured to the demanding specifications of Skate One using its proprietary AirLam skateboard presses and birch veneer source. The AirLam process fuses multiple plies of wood together using waterproof glue, sealed against other moisture, and the bottom is coated with an SST slide treatment to improve the length of your slides. The boards sport POSITIV trucks and MiniLogo bearings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C5xwIGeKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H55PZW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Standard Skateboards & Longboards", "Standard Skateboards"]], "price": 69.95}}
