{"item_id": "B001H8FJIW", "title": "Storm All-Weather Safety Whistle -", "description": "Sometimes the only way to be rescued is to be heard. The Storm Safety Whistle is invaluable for signaling rescuers. 2-level volume in a sturdy, loud whistle..", "text": "Storm All-Weather Safety Whistle - Sometimes the only way to be rescued is to be heard. The Storm Safety Whistle is invaluable for signaling rescuers. 2-level volume in a sturdy, loud whistle..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317MXZVr1iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H8FJIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "All Weather Safety Whistle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B001H8PXRE", "title": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 414T for Remington 597", "description": "These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Multi-Slot Base System - 414T for Remington 597 These versatile bases from Weaver help give your gun a versatile edge. Weaver Multi-Slot Bases are constructed of tough, lightweight Aluminum so they can withstand the most powerful recoil. They accept all Weaver Top Mount Rings and accommodate the mounting of devices such as scopes, red dots and laser optics, while allowing for optimal eye relief. Weaver's extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hPV46-yKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H8PXRE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 9.76}}
{"item_id": "B001H8Q576", "title": "Weaver 30mm Six Hole Tactical High Rings (Matte Black)", "description": "In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "text": "Weaver 30mm Six Hole Tactical High Rings (Matte Black) In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uD6aRqV4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H8Q576.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.64}}
{"item_id": "B001H8W80E", "title": "Crosman Raven Compact Break Barrel Rifle", "description": "The Crosman Raven is an ideal air rifle for younger or smaller shooters. A ruggedly durable synthetic stock is ambidextrous and all-weather, corrosion-resistant, and the barrel is constructed of rifled steel. Capable of firing at an impressive 600-feet-per-second (FPS) velocity, the gun additionally includes an adjustable fiber optic scope and dovetail grooves, ready to mount a wide variety of accessories.SpecificationsSpring power source0.177 caliberFiring velocity up to 600 FPSFive-pound weight37.5-inch lengthRifled steel barrelFiber optic front sightMicro-adjust rear sightCross bolt safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "text": "Crosman Raven Compact Break Barrel Rifle The Crosman Raven is an ideal air rifle for younger or smaller shooters. A ruggedly durable synthetic stock is ambidextrous and all-weather, corrosion-resistant, and the barrel is constructed of rifled steel. Capable of firing at an impressive 600-feet-per-second (FPS) velocity, the gun additionally includes an adjustable fiber optic scope and dovetail grooves, ready to mount a wide variety of accessories.SpecificationsSpring power source0.177 caliberFiring velocity up to 600 FPSFive-pound weight37.5-inch lengthRifled steel barrelFiber optic front sightMicro-adjust rear sightCross bolt safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21qTAxofkCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H8W80E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 66.26}}
{"item_id": "B001H90CLA", "title": "Weaver Muzzleloader Gloss Black Base - TC Encore/Omega", "description": "Anchor optics to your muzzleloader with Weaver's new line of muzzleloader rings & bases. Rings are made with lightweight aluminum saddles and strong steel caps wile bases feature aircraft-grade aluminum and Weaver's proven Crosslock design. For more than 75 years, Weaver has been keeping scopes on firearms and hunters on target. 100% rugged service, 100% of the time. And this unwavering dedication to preserving both your optics and your hunt is now available for muzzleloaders. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Muzzleloader Gloss Black Base - TC Encore/Omega Anchor optics to your muzzleloader with Weaver's new line of muzzleloader rings & bases. Rings are made with lightweight aluminum saddles and strong steel caps wile bases feature aircraft-grade aluminum and Weaver's proven Crosslock design. For more than 75 years, Weaver has been keeping scopes on firearms and hunters on target. 100% rugged service, 100% of the time. And this unwavering dedication to preserving both your optics and your hunt is now available for muzzleloaders. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GHS%2B4-9aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001H90CLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 10.04}}
