{"item_id": "B001HAYPDA", "title": "Body Solid SDRS550 5-50-Pound Rubber Hex Dumbbell Set", "description": "A patent-pending Secure Dumbbell System combines one-piece cast iron heads with steel inserts that have been pinned, press-fitted, and welded. The weights' compact design makes them shorter in length and easier to work with than conventional dumbbells, while a durable rubber finish protects both you and your workout area.The set includes two each of five-, ten-, 15-, 20-, 25-, 30-, 35-, 40-, 45-, and 50-pound hexagonal dumbbells.Lifetime WarrantyBody-Solid gym equipment includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Body-SolidBody-Solid, Inc. is a leading manufacturer and distributor of high quality fitness equipment for the home and commercial markets. With over 20 years of experience, Body-Solid offers one of the widest arrays of products in the industry, including multi-station gyms, free weight machines, a complete line of cardiovascular products, weight plates, kettle bells, dumbbells, and fitness accessories.", "text": "Body Solid SDRS550 5-50-Pound Rubber Hex Dumbbell Set A patent-pending Secure Dumbbell System combines one-piece cast iron heads with steel inserts that have been pinned, press-fitted, and welded. The weights' compact design makes them shorter in length and easier to work with than conventional dumbbells, while a durable rubber finish protects both you and your workout area.The set includes two each of five-, ten-, 15-, 20-, 25-, 30-, 35-, 40-, 45-, and 50-pound hexagonal dumbbells.Lifetime WarrantyBody-Solid gym equipment includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Body-SolidBody-Solid, Inc. is a leading manufacturer and distributor of high quality fitness equipment for the home and commercial markets. With over 20 years of experience, Body-Solid offers one of the widest arrays of products in the industry, including multi-station gyms, free weight machines, a complete line of cardiovascular products, weight plates, kettle bells, dumbbells, and fitness accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Fnv2WIHQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HAYPDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 849.0}}
{"item_id": "B001HB77BQ", "title": "Intex Fabric Extra Wide Camping Mattress", "description": "A quick and simple sleeping solution for camping, this inflatable fabric camping mattress from Intex will help smooth out the bumps and give you a restful night's sleep. This extra-wide version measures 74.5 x 39 x 8.75 inches (LxWxH), and it features a durable laminated vinyl construction and a soft fabric top for added comfort. It folds compactly for easy storage or travel, and it can even double as a pool or lake float.", "text": "Intex Fabric Extra Wide Camping Mattress A quick and simple sleeping solution for camping, this inflatable fabric camping mattress from Intex will help smooth out the bumps and give you a restful night's sleep. This extra-wide version measures 74.5 x 39 x 8.75 inches (LxWxH), and it features a durable laminated vinyl construction and a soft fabric top for added comfort. It folds compactly for easy storage or travel, and it can even double as a pool or lake float.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411WbJeFldL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HB77BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001HBHNGU", "title": "Butler Creek AR-15/M-16 Strip LULA Speed Loader", "description": ".223 caliber ammo on stripper clips can now be loaded in your magazine with unmatched speed - 30 rounds in 12 seconds! The Strip LULA is the fastest, easiest-to-use strip loader on the market, and it fits in your pocket.", "text": "Butler Creek AR-15/M-16 Strip LULA Speed Loader .223 caliber ammo on stripper clips can now be loaded in your magazine with unmatched speed - 30 rounds in 12 seconds! The Strip LULA is the fastest, easiest-to-use strip loader on the market, and it fits in your pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Wi2VMxZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HBHNGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001HBHNHE", "title": "Butler Creek Lula Universal Pistol Magazine Loader", "description": "Speed up and simplify the pistol loading process with the Butler Creek UpLula universal magazine loader. Compatible with virtually all 9mm, 10mm, .357, .40-, and .45-caliber mags, the loader/unloader makes filling a magazine as easy as flipping a switch. The UpLula works with both single and double stack pistols from almost all manufacturers. Shooting has never been so easy on your hands.", "text": "Butler Creek Lula Universal Pistol Magazine Loader Speed up and simplify the pistol loading process with the Butler Creek UpLula universal magazine loader. Compatible with virtually all 9mm, 10mm, .357, .40-, and .45-caliber mags, the loader/unloader makes filling a magazine as easy as flipping a switch. The UpLula works with both single and double stack pistols from almost all manufacturers. Shooting has never been so easy on your hands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gyd1PYsfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HBHNHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 27.49}}
{"item_id": "B001HBHNHY", "title": "Butler Creek LULA All-in-One Magazine Speed Loader and Unloader 223 Remington 5.56mm NATO", "description": "Turn on the fastest, most comfortable loading experience possible. The lever engages spring, so rounds slide in and out effortlessly – no finger or mag abuse. Slips on and off your mag with ease. LULA is a trademark of Maglula Ltd. and is used by permission. Made in Israel.", "text": "Butler Creek LULA All-in-One Magazine Speed Loader and Unloader 223 Remington 5.56mm NATO Turn on the fastest, most comfortable loading experience possible. The lever engages spring, so rounds slide in and out effortlessly – no finger or mag abuse. Slips on and off your mag with ease. LULA is a trademark of Maglula Ltd. and is used by permission. Made in Israel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419NdR8A-RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HBHNHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 23.47}}
