{"item_id": "B001HT3ZIM", "title": "Feetures Men's Light Cushion No Show Socks with Tab", "description": "Experience the sock that made Feetures! famous. This multi-sport sock features soft cushioning for extra protection and increased comfort. Perfect for your morning run, your afternoon tennis game or your evening walk - or wear them for all three. After all, this is the most versatile sock. The No Show with Tab hits below the ankle so there is no tan line, but there is Achilles protection. This snug, supportive fit eliminates movement to prevent blisters and mesh construction on top of the sock provides ventilation for added breathe-ability. SnugFit Technology-Unique Power Bands of Lycra hug your entire foot for maximum support.iWick®Feetures' iWickÂ polyester and nylon fibers combine an incredibly soft hand with outstanding moisture managing properties. iWick® fibers pull moisture away from the skin and move it to the outer layer of the fabric where it evaporates and dries quickly. In addition, iWick® fibers are specially engineered to enhance breathabilty by allowing air to move through the fabric with ease. Â The result is that iWick® fibers do a superior job of keeping feet cool and dry.The Perfect Toe®The \"Perfect Toe\" is Feetures' trade-marked seam-free toe closure. The \"Perfect Toe\" is hand-linked so both the inside and outside surface of the sock are completely smooth, eliminating the irritation and discomfort caused by traditional toe seams. As a result, Feetures! socks provide protective comfort all day long.", "text": "Feetures Men's Light Cushion No Show Socks with Tab Experience the sock that made Feetures! famous. This multi-sport sock features soft cushioning for extra protection and increased comfort. Perfect for your morning run, your afternoon tennis game or your evening walk - or wear them for all three. After all, this is the most versatile sock. The No Show with Tab hits below the ankle so there is no tan line, but there is Achilles protection. This snug, supportive fit eliminates movement to prevent blisters and mesh construction on top of the sock provides ventilation for added breathe-ability. SnugFit Technology-Unique Power Bands of Lycra hug your entire foot for maximum support.iWick®Feetures' iWickÂ polyester and nylon fibers combine an incredibly soft hand with outstanding moisture managing properties. iWick® fibers pull moisture away from the skin and move it to the outer layer of the fabric where it evaporates and dries quickly. In addition, iWick® fibers are specially engineered to enhance breathabilty by allowing air to move through the fabric with ease. Â The result is that iWick® fibers do a superior job of keeping feet cool and dry.The Perfect Toe®The \"Perfect Toe\" is Feetures' trade-marked seam-free toe closure. The \"Perfect Toe\" is hand-linked so both the inside and outside surface of the sock are completely smooth, eliminating the irritation and discomfort caused by traditional toe seams. As a result, Feetures! socks provide protective comfort all day long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317KP7eblfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HT3ZIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001HT720O", "title": "3M Utility Duct Tape 2929 Silver, 1-22/25 in x 50 yd 5.8 mils (Pack of 1)", "description": "3M™ Utility Duct Tape 2929 sticks well to metal, plastic, and concrete, yet removes easily—a good choice for temporary repairs and light-duty bundling. The silver duct tape is constructed of polyethylene bonded to cloth and backed with a natural rubber adhesive. It conforms to smooth, contoured, and lightly textured surfaces, can be written on with markers, and tears easily by hand. The water-resistant tape seals out moisture and dust.How to Choose the Right Duct TapeOne of the most important points to think about when choosing a duct tape is how it is going to be used. When it comes to choosing a 3M™ Duct Tape that meets the need for a particular job, consider the following: Performance Plus and Outdoor Masking Tapes are best in class tapes for indoor/outdoor use, offering clean removal and long term weatherability. Extra Heavy Duty, Heavy Duty, and Multi Purpose duct tapes provide reliable performance for demanding contractor, MRO and industrial job site applications. And General Purpose duct tapes offer cost-effective options for general and lighter duty applications such as bundling, sealing, holding, and identifying.Strength, moisture resistance, abrasion resistance, heat resistance, and clean removal impact the effectiveness of any duct tape. Two of three key factors that determine these factors are backing and adhesive. The thicker the backing, the greater tensile strength (the resistance to breaking under tension), moisture, and abrasion resistance provided. A rubber-based or synthetic rubber adhesive provides instant stick, a strong bond, and long-lasting hold, even in moist conditions. Lastly, the distinctive cloth scrim, laminated between the backing and the adhesive, adds additional strength and also helps guide straight, horizontal and vertical tearing.One last and often overlooked fact about tapes in general, is that they all need to be stored correctly and they all have a shelf life. Weak adhesion, lifting, curling, and breakage are more often than not, attributable to age or improperly stored tape, as opposed to quality. In all cases, care should be taken to read all product information thoroughly. In particular, the tape's specifications should be weighed against the task at hand to ensure successful, cost-effective outcomes.About 3M Industrial Tapes and AdhesivesFor more than a century, 3M Company has applied innovative technologies to improve people’s lives and support customers’ business goals. Today, from headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, the company serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries.3M industrial adhesives and tapes include application-specific products that provide durability, strength, and special characteristics such as temperature resistance and short- and long-term protection. The 3M brand, across a spectrum of thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.", "text": "3M Utility Duct Tape 2929 Silver, 1-22/25 in x 50 yd 5.8 mils (Pack of 1) 3M™ Utility Duct Tape 2929 sticks well to metal, plastic, and concrete, yet removes easily—a good choice for temporary repairs and light-duty bundling. The silver duct tape is constructed of polyethylene bonded to cloth and backed with a natural rubber adhesive. It conforms to smooth, contoured, and lightly textured surfaces, can be written on with markers, and tears easily by hand. The water-resistant tape seals out moisture and dust.How to Choose the Right Duct TapeOne of the most important points to think about when choosing a duct tape is how it is going to be used. When it comes to choosing a 3M™ Duct Tape that meets the need for a particular job, consider the following: Performance Plus and Outdoor Masking Tapes are best in class tapes for indoor/outdoor use, offering clean removal and long term weatherability. Extra Heavy Duty, Heavy Duty, and Multi Purpose duct tapes provide reliable performance for demanding contractor, MRO and industrial job site applications. And General Purpose duct tapes offer cost-effective options for general and lighter duty applications such as bundling, sealing, holding, and identifying.Strength, moisture resistance, abrasion resistance, heat resistance, and clean removal impact the effectiveness of any duct tape. Two of three key factors that determine these factors are backing and adhesive. The thicker the backing, the greater tensile strength (the resistance to breaking under tension), moisture, and abrasion resistance provided. A rubber-based or synthetic rubber adhesive provides instant stick, a strong bond, and long-lasting hold, even in moist conditions. Lastly, the distinctive cloth scrim, laminated between the backing and the adhesive, adds additional strength and also helps guide straight, horizontal and vertical tearing.One last and often overlooked fact about tapes in general, is that they all need to be stored correctly and they all have a shelf life. Weak adhesion, lifting, curling, and breakage are more often than not, attributable to age or improperly stored tape, as opposed to quality. In all cases, care should be taken to read all product information thoroughly. In particular, the tape's specifications should be weighed against the task at hand to ensure successful, cost-effective outcomes.About 3M Industrial Tapes and AdhesivesFor more than a century, 3M Company has applied innovative technologies to improve people’s lives and support customers’ business goals. Today, from headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, the company serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries.3M industrial adhesives and tapes include application-specific products that provide durability, strength, and special characteristics such as temperature resistance and short- and long-term protection. The 3M brand, across a spectrum of thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51laWcXcGBL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HT720O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Ice Hockey", "Accessories", "Grips & Tapes"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B001HX3CDG", "title": "Glide Bikes Mini Glider Balance Bike", "description": "The Mini Glider from Glide Bikes allows children to gain confidence, improve motor skills, increase coordination, and learn balance at their own pace all while having fun! Balance Bikes do not have training wheels and pedals to get in the way, so children learn the important first step in riding a bike- BALANCE! Pushing off with alternating feet as if the child were running from a seated position, the child can learn balance and control. Once the child becomes more stable they begin to glide with their feet off the ground. As your child develops balance and begins gliding, they can place their feet on the foot pegs and get accustomed to the natural foot position present on a traditional bicycle. Another important aspect of learning to ride with a Glide Bikes balance bike is how they help build a child's confidence. The problem with bikes that depend on training wheels is the lack of control and stability and the higher probability of tip-overs. This makes the child more prone to injuries and takes the fun out of riding a bike. With the Mini Glider, riders have a lower center of gravity which increases stability similar to a sports car in comparison to a tall sport utility vehicle. We also design our bikes using downhill mountain bike geometry which also increases stability and allows for the lowest balance speed of 1.5 MPH. Unlike the heavy kid's bikes with training wheels, we use high quality, lightweight materials so that children can lift the bike by themselves and avoid getting trapped underneath the bike if they do fall. These are all very important features built into our bikes to make your child's experience a safe and fun one!", "text": "Glide Bikes Mini Glider Balance Bike The Mini Glider from Glide Bikes allows children to gain confidence, improve motor skills, increase coordination, and learn balance at their own pace all while having fun! Balance Bikes do not have training wheels and pedals to get in the way, so children learn the important first step in riding a bike- BALANCE! Pushing off with alternating feet as if the child were running from a seated position, the child can learn balance and control. Once the child becomes more stable they begin to glide with their feet off the ground. As your child develops balance and begins gliding, they can place their feet on the foot pegs and get accustomed to the natural foot position present on a traditional bicycle. Another important aspect of learning to ride with a Glide Bikes balance bike is how they help build a child's confidence. The problem with bikes that depend on training wheels is the lack of control and stability and the higher probability of tip-overs. This makes the child more prone to injuries and takes the fun out of riding a bike. With the Mini Glider, riders have a lower center of gravity which increases stability similar to a sports car in comparison to a tall sport utility vehicle. We also design our bikes using downhill mountain bike geometry which also increases stability and allows for the lowest balance speed of 1.5 MPH. Unlike the heavy kid's bikes with training wheels, we use high quality, lightweight materials so that children can lift the bike by themselves and avoid getting trapped underneath the bike if they do fall. These are all very important features built into our bikes to make your child's experience a safe and fun one!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wmMZrTVML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HX3CDG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Bikes"]], "price": 101.07}}
{"item_id": "B001HY4EI2", "title": "Wheeler 540-127 Scope Mounting Kit", "description": "Wheeler Scope Mounting Kit has put 3 great products in one professional scope mounting kit. This kit has everything needed to do a professional job mounting your scope. It has a Firearm Accurizing Torque (F.A.T.) wrench with 10 bits thread locking compound designed for the majority of your scope mounting needs.", "text": "Wheeler 540-127 Scope Mounting Kit Wheeler Scope Mounting Kit has put 3 great products in one professional scope mounting kit. This kit has everything needed to do a professional job mounting your scope. It has a Firearm Accurizing Torque (F.A.T.) wrench with 10 bits thread locking compound designed for the majority of your scope mounting needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vsseKlzdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HY4EI2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler Fine Gunsmith Equipment", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 82.99}}
{"item_id": "B001HYIHGC", "title": "Esbit Large Ultralight Folding Pocket Stove with 12/14gm Solid Fuel Tablets", "description": "Ideal for backpacking, camping or your home or auto emergency kit, Esbit Folding Pocket Stoves are compact enough to fit in a pocket. The large model has three cooking grades to select from and is suitable for use with cups, pots, and pans. Includes twelve Esbit 14 g solid fuel tablets that will burn about 12 minutes each and fit inside the stove when not in use. The large model is 5.2-Inch x 3.8-Inch x 1.5-Inch when folded closed. Including fuel, the stove weighs 12.7 ounces (360 g). Made from electrolytic galvanized steel.", "text": "Esbit Large Ultralight Folding Pocket Stove with 12/14gm Solid Fuel Tablets Ideal for backpacking, camping or your home or auto emergency kit, Esbit Folding Pocket Stoves are compact enough to fit in a pocket. The large model has three cooking grades to select from and is suitable for use with cups, pots, and pans. Includes twelve Esbit 14 g solid fuel tablets that will burn about 12 minutes each and fit inside the stove when not in use. The large model is 5.2-Inch x 3.8-Inch x 1.5-Inch when folded closed. Including fuel, the stove weighs 12.7 ounces (360 g). Made from electrolytic galvanized steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RlhlLvYtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HYIHGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Esbit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 17.44}}
{"item_id": "B001HYKB2U", "title": "Seattle Sports Sportsman's Paddle Leash", "description": "", "text": "Seattle Sports Sportsman's Paddle Leash", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f-VhwTKFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HYKB2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 8.04}}
{"item_id": "B001HZYBGQ", "title": "Harrows 59204 Voodoo Brass Steel Tip Dart (25-gram)", "description": "Voodoo Steel tip darts by Harrows. This range of superbly styled brass darts features unique black knurled barrels, designed to give optimum grip and control. New Slim line plastic shafts combined with aerodynamic Marathon Gold flights create Perfection in flight.", "text": "Harrows 59204 Voodoo Brass Steel Tip Dart (25-gram) Voodoo Steel tip darts by Harrows. This range of superbly styled brass darts features unique black knurled barrels, designed to give optimum grip and control. New Slim line plastic shafts combined with aerodynamic Marathon Gold flights create Perfection in flight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412zF0rLbyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001HZYBGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harrows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 18.32}}
{"item_id": "B001I10ECE", "title": "Dart 3 Piece Spike Set Black", "description": "Heavy 3 piece dart set for the knife throwing enthusiast. Includes the armband sheath as pictured.", "text": "Dart 3 Piece Spike Set Black Heavy 3 piece dart set for the knife throwing enthusiast. Includes the armband sheath as pictured.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j9KiQColL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I10ECE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SuperKnife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B001I11TAA", "title": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21aTKOFPJML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I11TAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 54.22}}
{"item_id": "B001I13MA0", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Super Swivels for Most Pumps and Autos (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable Super Swivels for Most Pumps and Autos (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZQC4fzbBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I13MA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 15.21}}
{"item_id": "B001I14QUU", "title": "Birchwood Casey Tru Oil Stock Finish (3-Ounce)", "description": "The Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish is a unique blend of linseed and other natural oils. It dries fast, resists water damage and will not cloud, yellow, or crack with age. It also is excellent as a sealer for under butt plates, recoil pads and in inletted actions to prevent stock damage.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Tru Oil Stock Finish (3-Ounce) The Tru-Oil Gun Stock Finish is a unique blend of linseed and other natural oils. It dries fast, resists water damage and will not cloud, yellow, or crack with age. It also is excellent as a sealer for under butt plates, recoil pads and in inletted actions to prevent stock damage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410sJPFawVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I14QUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 6.8}}
{"item_id": "B001I1K6E0", "title": "Classic - Full-size Bullworker & CASE", "description": "NEW SHIPMENT SEPT 24TH. The NEW RED HANDLE \"Professional & Gym Quality\" Bullworker in design and craftsmanship. Super Smooth, Super Quiet. Custom FULL-SIZE rubber coated handles. Our greatest resistance model and custom Carry Case. Before you purchase ANY Bullworker; answer TWO Questions: Does it have steel-cables? (Steel-Cable models are the STRONGEST). Does it have adjustable cable grips? (There is a reason all gym quality cable exercise equipment have handles COMFORT). WHEN YOUR HANDS ARE COMFORTABLE IN EXERCISING, YOU WILL CONTINUE. This is the \"Professional & Gym Quality\" of Bullworkers in design and craftsmanship. Full size in the original design with adjustable cable grips for hand pulling comfort. The Classic is back and BETTER than ever. The FASTEST Muscle building principles known from a single product. The 7-second hold with visual improvement every day. Beginners double their strength in 30 days or less. A new body in 90 Days. A full-size Classic by Bullworker: Greater Resistance - Greater compression distance - 3 adjustable cable grips for all your cable pulls - Steel-etched Powermeter - Instructional Chart - FREE carry case. 36 inches of Steel designed to give you the traditional workout for: Strength - Tone - Flexibility - Endurance - Isometric - Isotonic - Iso-Motion - Power Stretching - Sit-at-Home Fitness Quality Products - Factual Statements - Real Results, GUARANTEED or your money back. Stop breaking elastic bands and PUSH STEEL. This item DOES NOT include a DVD. This is the largest full size Bullworker you can buy, GUARANTEED a full 5 years against mechanical defects. International Buyers responsible for any VAT fees. INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING RATES ARE MORE THAN WE ARE CHARGING. WE HAVE NO CONTROL OVER RISING RATES.", "text": "Classic - Full-size Bullworker & CASE NEW SHIPMENT SEPT 24TH. The NEW RED HANDLE \"Professional & Gym Quality\" Bullworker in design and craftsmanship. Super Smooth, Super Quiet. Custom FULL-SIZE rubber coated handles. Our greatest resistance model and custom Carry Case. Before you purchase ANY Bullworker; answer TWO Questions: Does it have steel-cables? (Steel-Cable models are the STRONGEST). Does it have adjustable cable grips? (There is a reason all gym quality cable exercise equipment have handles COMFORT). WHEN YOUR HANDS ARE COMFORTABLE IN EXERCISING, YOU WILL CONTINUE. This is the \"Professional & Gym Quality\" of Bullworkers in design and craftsmanship. Full size in the original design with adjustable cable grips for hand pulling comfort. The Classic is back and BETTER than ever. The FASTEST Muscle building principles known from a single product. The 7-second hold with visual improvement every day. Beginners double their strength in 30 days or less. A new body in 90 Days. A full-size Classic by Bullworker: Greater Resistance - Greater compression distance - 3 adjustable cable grips for all your cable pulls - Steel-etched Powermeter - Instructional Chart - FREE carry case. 36 inches of Steel designed to give you the traditional workout for: Strength - Tone - Flexibility - Endurance - Isometric - Isotonic - Iso-Motion - Power Stretching - Sit-at-Home Fitness Quality Products - Factual Statements - Real Results, GUARANTEED or your money back. Stop breaking elastic bands and PUSH STEEL. This item DOES NOT include a DVD. This is the largest full size Bullworker you can buy, GUARANTEED a full 5 years against mechanical defects. International Buyers responsible for any VAT fees. INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING RATES ARE MORE THAN WE ARE CHARGING. WE HAVE NO CONTROL OVER RISING RATES.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fvfp-VDEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I1K6E0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001I427US", "title": "Black Aluminum Dart Shafts - 3 Sets, 2BA Medium", "description": "3 sets of aluminum shafts. Also includes 3 sets of O'rings", "text": "Black Aluminum Dart Shafts - 3 Sets, 2BA Medium 3 sets of aluminum shafts. Also includes 3 sets of O'rings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/113K4J08TJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I427US.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US Darts Shafts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Shafts"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B001I45VBA", "title": "Manduka Black Mat Pro Yoga Package, Graphite, 71 Inch Mat", "description": "Be ready for your yoga sessions while on the go about town with this Manduka BlackMatPRO Yoga Package, which includes the 71-inch version of the legendary BlackMatPRO mat and natural cotton canvas MatSak carry bag. With its denser, thicker form, unparalleled comfort and cushioning, superior non-slip fabric finish, and simple, elegant design, the BlackMatPRO comfortably cushions spine, hips, knees, and elbows on hard floors. And only Manduka yoga mats have the unique dotted bottom surface to reduce mat movement during your practice. Made from zero-waste, sustainable materials, it also features a slip-resistant--yet not sticky--surface even when wet from perspiration, OekoTex-certified, emissions-free manufacturing, and a lifetime guarantee. It measures 71 x 26 x 1/4 inches.Manduka MatSaks are made of a durable cotton canvas material with recycled PET mesh detailing. The MatSak's two zippered compartments provide protective carrying space for a yoga mat, towel, strap, and personal items, such as wallet, keys, and light clothing. It also features a comfortable, adjustable, padded shoulder strap and durable metal hardware. It measures 28 x 6.5 inches.", "text": "Manduka Black Mat Pro Yoga Package, Graphite, 71 Inch Mat Be ready for your yoga sessions while on the go about town with this Manduka BlackMatPRO Yoga Package, which includes the 71-inch version of the legendary BlackMatPRO mat and natural cotton canvas MatSak carry bag. With its denser, thicker form, unparalleled comfort and cushioning, superior non-slip fabric finish, and simple, elegant design, the BlackMatPRO comfortably cushions spine, hips, knees, and elbows on hard floors. And only Manduka yoga mats have the unique dotted bottom surface to reduce mat movement during your practice. Made from zero-waste, sustainable materials, it also features a slip-resistant--yet not sticky--surface even when wet from perspiration, OekoTex-certified, emissions-free manufacturing, and a lifetime guarantee. It measures 71 x 26 x 1/4 inches.Manduka MatSaks are made of a durable cotton canvas material with recycled PET mesh detailing. The MatSak's two zippered compartments provide protective carrying space for a yoga mat, towel, strap, and personal items, such as wallet, keys, and light clothing. It also features a comfortable, adjustable, padded shoulder strap and durable metal hardware. It measures 28 x 6.5 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FXDsC3lJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I45VBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Manduka", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Starter Sets"]], "price": 128.25}}
{"item_id": "B001I6JGL4", "title": "Smith's 50008 8-Inch Diamond Tri-Hone 1", "description": "Smith’s 8” Diamond Tri-Hone Sharpening System comes with two interrupted surface diamond stones and a Medium Arkansas stone. The Coarse and Fine grit diamond stones feature a unique, overlapping hole design that speeds sharpening by collecting and holding the metal filings which build up during the sharpening process, thus allowing the stone’s surface to remain clean and clear. The Natural Arkansas Stone is best used for finishing your edge. It removes moderate amounts of metal as it polishes the cutting edge. This 3-stone sharpening system is excellent for sharpening pocket knives, hunting & fishing knives, kitchen knives, and tools of all sizes, large or small.", "text": "Smith's 50008 8-Inch Diamond Tri-Hone 1 Smith’s 8” Diamond Tri-Hone Sharpening System comes with two interrupted surface diamond stones and a Medium Arkansas stone. The Coarse and Fine grit diamond stones feature a unique, overlapping hole design that speeds sharpening by collecting and holding the metal filings which build up during the sharpening process, thus allowing the stone’s surface to remain clean and clear. The Natural Arkansas Stone is best used for finishing your edge. It removes moderate amounts of metal as it polishes the cutting edge. This 3-stone sharpening system is excellent for sharpening pocket knives, hunting & fishing knives, kitchen knives, and tools of all sizes, large or small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BKbFWoHzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I6JGL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 80.99}}
{"item_id": "B001I838NY", "title": "Gripmaster Hand And Finger Exerciser Combo Pack -Red And Black", "description": "The best way to get your fingers and fore arms in shape for bow hunting. The only exercise equipment that works each individual finger exercises each different muscle in your hand and fore arm. Develops superior strength endurance and co-ordination.", "text": "Gripmaster Hand And Finger Exerciser Combo Pack -Red And Black The best way to get your fingers and fore arms in shape for bow hunting. The only exercise equipment that works each individual finger exercises each different muscle in your hand and fore arm. Develops superior strength endurance and co-ordination.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iWdNhX-dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I838NY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gripmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 17.92}}
{"item_id": "B001I8A1Z2", "title": "Stamina 4825 Magnetic Recumbent Exercise Bike", "description": "Magnetic resistance system offers a smooth, quiet workout Wheels for easy transport InTouch one-button control electronic monitor displays workout time, speed, distance, and calories Comfortable padded seat and oversized weighted pedals Dial tension control sets workout intensity with ease Levelling stabilizer caps provide a smooth and comfortable workout Sturdy steel frame Measures 56L x 26W x 33.5H inches Power requirement: 2 AA batteries included Manufacturer's warranty included: see complete details in the Product Guarantee area About Stamina Products, Inc. Founded in 1987, Stamina is dedicated to building a stronger, healthier you. The company supplies high-quality products at excellent value to the fitness and leisure markets, showcasing hundreds of products around the world over the past two decades. Stamina is responsible for such brands as Body by Jake, Suzanne Somers, Tony Little, and more. Their mission is straightforward and admirable: Stamina strives to outperform the competition by maintaining effective communication, consistent quality, and superior service. They will continue to pursue perfection through the design excellence of these home fitness products. 6 preset programs for workout intensity. Comfortable padded seat and oversize weighted pedals. Fingertip pulse sensors built into handrails. InTouch monitor shows pulse, calories burned, and more. Wheels for easy transport. Assembled dimensions: 56L x 26W x 33.5H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Stamina 4825 Magnetic Recumbent Exercise Bike Magnetic resistance system offers a smooth, quiet workout Wheels for easy transport InTouch one-button control electronic monitor displays workout time, speed, distance, and calories Comfortable padded seat and oversized weighted pedals Dial tension control sets workout intensity with ease Levelling stabilizer caps provide a smooth and comfortable workout Sturdy steel frame Measures 56L x 26W x 33.5H inches Power requirement: 2 AA batteries included Manufacturer's warranty included: see complete details in the Product Guarantee area About Stamina Products, Inc. Founded in 1987, Stamina is dedicated to building a stronger, healthier you. The company supplies high-quality products at excellent value to the fitness and leisure markets, showcasing hundreds of products around the world over the past two decades. Stamina is responsible for such brands as Body by Jake, Suzanne Somers, Tony Little, and more. Their mission is straightforward and admirable: Stamina strives to outperform the competition by maintaining effective communication, consistent quality, and superior service. They will continue to pursue perfection through the design excellence of these home fitness products. 6 preset programs for workout intensity. Comfortable padded seat and oversize weighted pedals. Fingertip pulse sensors built into handrails. InTouch monitor shows pulse, calories burned, and more. Wheels for easy transport. Assembled dimensions: 56L x 26W x 33.5H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M6Wftz2zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I8A1Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stamina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 219.0}}
{"item_id": "B001I912SQ", "title": "SKLZ Pro Mini Basketball Hoop", "description": "", "text": "SKLZ Pro Mini Basketball Hoop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uHOr1DMIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I912SQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Basketball Hoops & Goals", "Wall-Mount"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001I9TA9Y", "title": "Gamo Whisper Air Rifle", "description": "You'll be ready to hunt small and medium-sized game and vermin with the Gamo Whisper! Plus, the non-removable noise dampener reduces the report (noise) up to 52%, which means you won't spook game while hunting. But, just because the Whisper is modestly priced doesn't mean you give up anything in the accuracy department! You'll be hitting your targets and making one-shot kills time after time. This just might be the ideal spring gun! We measured the cocking effort with the metal spring, and it was 35 lbs. (Gamo lists it at 30 lbs.). Velocity will vary depending on the type of ammo you use: .177: 1200 fps with PBA, 1000 fps with lead .22: 950 fps with PBA, 750 fps with lead (our tests show 720 fps with 14-grain pellets)... Click on the AMMO link for recommended pellets and the ACCESSORIES link for shooting glasses, targets & more.The owner's manual states that the scope is mounted and bore-sighted. It is not.... ...", "text": "Gamo Whisper Air Rifle You'll be ready to hunt small and medium-sized game and vermin with the Gamo Whisper! Plus, the non-removable noise dampener reduces the report (noise) up to 52%, which means you won't spook game while hunting. But, just because the Whisper is modestly priced doesn't mean you give up anything in the accuracy department! You'll be hitting your targets and making one-shot kills time after time. This just might be the ideal spring gun! We measured the cocking effort with the metal spring, and it was 35 lbs. (Gamo lists it at 30 lbs.). Velocity will vary depending on the type of ammo you use: .177: 1200 fps with PBA, 1000 fps with lead .22: 950 fps with PBA, 750 fps with lead (our tests show 720 fps with 14-grain pellets)... Click on the AMMO link for recommended pellets and the ACCESSORIES link for shooting glasses, targets & more.The owner's manual states that the scope is mounted and bore-sighted. It is not.... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21flVAml7QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001I9TA9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001IANSJ6", "title": "Schwinn Protocol 1.0 Men's Dual-Suspension Mountain Bike (26-Inch Wheels)", "description": "Schwinn protocol 1.0 men's dual-suspension mountain bike features a full-suspension frame with a forgiving steel rear triangle. A front disc brake offers stopping power where you need it the most, and 24-speeds with Shimano EF-50 trigger shifters give you the incremental power and control you need for all terrain.", "text": "Schwinn Protocol 1.0 Men's Dual-Suspension Mountain Bike (26-Inch Wheels) Schwinn protocol 1.0 men's dual-suspension mountain bike features a full-suspension frame with a forgiving steel rear triangle. A front disc brake offers stopping power where you need it the most, and 24-speeds with Shimano EF-50 trigger shifters give you the incremental power and control you need for all terrain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CKU41kT-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IANSJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes"]], "price": 305.99}}
{"item_id": "B001IB3DSQ", "title": "Schwalbe Kojak Tire 26\" x 2.0 Wire Black", "description": "Schwalbe Kojak Bicycle Tires are built for extended durability and outstanding performance. It has a RaceGuard protection belt.", "text": "Schwalbe Kojak Tire 26\" x 2.0 Wire Black Schwalbe Kojak Bicycle Tires are built for extended durability and outstanding performance. It has a RaceGuard protection belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BVE5Gg10L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IB3DSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwalbe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 25.58}}
{"item_id": "B001IBHVPC", "title": "Boone Blue Kayak Crib 2 Paddles", "description": "The Boone Blue Kayak Crib 2 Paddles are a safe, convenient way to store your kayaks. The patented paddles are easy to install onto any wall in a cabin, house, or garage. Made of reinforced, steel-plated tubes, the paddles are 15 inches deep and provide a secure fit for almost all kayaks. No messy, unsightly straps of any kind are needed and you can load the kayak in a matter of seconds. All fasteners for installation are included with the paddles.", "text": "Boone Blue Kayak Crib 2 Paddles The Boone Blue Kayak Crib 2 Paddles are a safe, convenient way to store your kayaks. The patented paddles are easy to install onto any wall in a cabin, house, or garage. Made of reinforced, steel-plated tubes, the paddles are 15 inches deep and provide a secure fit for almost all kayaks. No messy, unsightly straps of any kind are needed and you can load the kayak in a matter of seconds. All fasteners for installation are included with the paddles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zTXMB4e%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBHVPC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]], "price": 45.48}}
{"item_id": "B001IBIQ5Q", "title": "Body Champ IT8070 Inversion Therapy Table", "description": "Inversion therapy counteracts the forces of gravity on the body (particularly the back) by decompressing and elongating the spine. Not only can this relieve pressure on your spinal cord's ligaments and nerve roots, but it can also relax the back muscles that support the vertebrae. And when your back relaxes, the rest of your body invariably follows. The Body Champ IT8070 Inversion Therapy Table can make a great addition to your daily routine, and help to improve your circulation and posture while relieving muscle aches, back pain, and stress.The IT8070 is easy to adjust, with a deluxe dual-pin system that lets you quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 7\" to 6' 8\"). It's also a breeze to use: once you rest your body against the pad and lock your feet behind the ankle supports, you simply reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body will gradually invert until you're almost completely upside down. The only inputs are your energy and gravity itself. Construction features include a lower spring-loaded pull pin that allows for easy ankle adjustments; four safe and comfortable foam rollers; U-shaped handrails; a safety strap that lets you control the desired inverting angles; and a safety lock for when you aren't using the table.The IT8070, which folds for easy storage, will support up to 250 pounds.Key Features:Assembled Dimensions: 55-1/2 by 29-1/2 by 57-7/8 inches (L x W x H)Folded Dimensions:[if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 [if gte mso 10]> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-qformat:yes; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} <![endif]13 by 29 by 75 inches (L x W x H)Adjustable within a height range of 4' 7\" to 6' 8\"Pull-pin adjustment systemLower spring-loaded pull-pin for ankle adjustmentFour foam rollers help to cushion your anklesHigh-density foam cushion for comfortU-shaped handrails for added securitySafety strap allows you to control inverting anglesSafety lock keeps the table in place when not in useFolds for easy storage250-pound user weight capacity", "text": "Body Champ IT8070 Inversion Therapy Table Inversion therapy counteracts the forces of gravity on the body (particularly the back) by decompressing and elongating the spine. Not only can this relieve pressure on your spinal cord's ligaments and nerve roots, but it can also relax the back muscles that support the vertebrae. And when your back relaxes, the rest of your body invariably follows. The Body Champ IT8070 Inversion Therapy Table can make a great addition to your daily routine, and help to improve your circulation and posture while relieving muscle aches, back pain, and stress.The IT8070 is easy to adjust, with a deluxe dual-pin system that lets you quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 7\" to 6' 8\"). It's also a breeze to use: once you rest your body against the pad and lock your feet behind the ankle supports, you simply reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body will gradually invert until you're almost completely upside down. The only inputs are your energy and gravity itself. Construction features include a lower spring-loaded pull pin that allows for easy ankle adjustments; four safe and comfortable foam rollers; U-shaped handrails; a safety strap that lets you control the desired inverting angles; and a safety lock for when you aren't using the table.The IT8070, which folds for easy storage, will support up to 250 pounds.Key Features:Assembled Dimensions: 55-1/2 by 29-1/2 by 57-7/8 inches (L x W x H)Folded Dimensions:[if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 [if gte mso 10]> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-qformat:yes; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} <![endif]13 by 29 by 75 inches (L x W x H)Adjustable within a height range of 4' 7\" to 6' 8\"Pull-pin adjustment systemLower spring-loaded pull-pin for ankle adjustmentFour foam rollers help to cushion your anklesHigh-density foam cushion for comfortU-shaped handrails for added securitySafety strap allows you to control inverting anglesSafety lock keeps the table in place when not in useFolds for easy storage250-pound user weight capacity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pn7PdkDDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBIQ5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Max", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 117.72}}
{"item_id": "B001IBKNO8", "title": "EastonÂ® Arrow Tote", "description": "Easton Arrow Tote protects what's closest to you... your arrows! You love your arrows and they deserve top-quality protection. That's what you get with the Easton Arrow Tote. The locking adjustment customizes the tube between 24 and 40 for minimal movement to keep arrows straight and flying true. Details: Protect your arrows during travel; Tube adjusts between 24 and 40; Holds up to 24 fletched arrows; High-strength hard plastic construction is light and durable; Threaded screw top lid keeps your arrows secure; Includes styrofoam lid inserts to cushion and hold your arrows in place; Fits inside most bow cases; Why trust your arrows to anything less? Order Today! Easton Arrow Tote", "text": "EastonÂ® Arrow Tote Easton Arrow Tote protects what's closest to you... your arrows! You love your arrows and they deserve top-quality protection. That's what you get with the Easton Arrow Tote. The locking adjustment customizes the tube between 24 and 40 for minimal movement to keep arrows straight and flying true. Details: Protect your arrows during travel; Tube adjusts between 24 and 40; Holds up to 24 fletched arrows; High-strength hard plastic construction is light and durable; Threaded screw top lid keeps your arrows secure; Includes styrofoam lid inserts to cushion and hold your arrows in place; Fits inside most bow cases; Why trust your arrows to anything less? Order Today! Easton Arrow Tote", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313v5jTzhQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBKNO8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eastman Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 16.79}}
{"item_id": "B001IBUYUQ", "title": "BudK Boar Hunter Knife", "description": "Each knife features a drop point, heat-forged, hollow ground stainless steel blade with custom handle. Includes top quality leather sheath. 9 1/4\"\" overall, 6\"\" blade", "text": "BudK Boar Hunter Knife Each knife features a drop point, heat-forged, hollow ground stainless steel blade with custom handle. Includes top quality leather sheath. 9 1/4\"\" overall, 6\"\" blade", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o9xQObEXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBUYUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.32}}
{"item_id": "B001IBWVWA", "title": "BudK Fox Hunter Knife", "description": "Each knife features a drop point, heat-forged, hollow ground stainless steel blade with custom handle. Includes top quality leather sheath. 10 1/2\"\" overall, 6\"\" blade", "text": "BudK Fox Hunter Knife Each knife features a drop point, heat-forged, hollow ground stainless steel blade with custom handle. Includes top quality leather sheath. 10 1/2\"\" overall, 6\"\" blade", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zloB8nAcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBWVWA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B001IBWW0Q", "title": "Gil Hibben IV Combat Machete Blade Knife", "description": "The latest edition in the Hibben IV knife series. This knife offers a machete style blade constructed from 440 stainless steel. The solid hardwood handle is surrounded by the stainless steel guard and pommel. Includes custom top grain leather sheath.", "text": "Gil Hibben IV Combat Machete Blade Knife The latest edition in the Hibben IV knife series. This knife offers a machete style blade constructed from 440 stainless steel. The solid hardwood handle is surrounded by the stainless steel guard and pommel. Includes custom top grain leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m0SokgpfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IBWW0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gil Hibben", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001IC6A4O", "title": "14\" Black Tippmann 98 Custom J&J Ceramic Barrel", "description": "Description This barrel uses the most advanced technology available today. While the ceramic is being applied, teflon is injected into the pores of the aluminum, resulting in the slickest, yet most durable surface in the world. This barrel is quiet, light-weight and accurate. This barrel is made from 6061 T6 Aluminium then CNC machined to the highest quality standards in the industry.", "text": "14\" Black Tippmann 98 Custom J&J Ceramic Barrel Description This barrel uses the most advanced technology available today. While the ceramic is being applied, teflon is injected into the pores of the aluminum, resulting in the slickest, yet most durable surface in the world. This barrel is quiet, light-weight and accurate. This barrel is made from 6061 T6 Aluminium then CNC machined to the highest quality standards in the industry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21iYzWKcEuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IC6A4O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Barrels"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B001ID4ZY0", "title": "Military Prismatic Sighting Compass w/ Pouch", "description": "Lensatic Compass How to shoot an azimuth for fun and profit: Get the ultimate direction finder, a lensatic compass. It has a 2-1/8-Inch dia face marked in 5-degree increments, a 1/4-Inch dia sight lens, 9/16-Inch dia bubble level, and a 1-1/2-Inch sight with crosshairs. Measures 3-1/4-Inch x 2-1/2-Inch x 1-1/8-Inch when folded and comes with an 18-Inch long cord and an olive drab belt pouch.", "text": "Military Prismatic Sighting Compass w/ Pouch Lensatic Compass How to shoot an azimuth for fun and profit: Get the ultimate direction finder, a lensatic compass. It has a 2-1/8-Inch dia face marked in 5-degree increments, a 1/4-Inch dia sight lens, 9/16-Inch dia bubble level, and a 1-1/2-Inch sight with crosshairs. Measures 3-1/4-Inch x 2-1/2-Inch x 1-1/8-Inch when folded and comes with an 18-Inch long cord and an olive drab belt pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pR0xN1dcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ID4ZY0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 8.65}}
{"item_id": "B001IDZHF6", "title": "Sunny Twister Stepper with Handle Bar", "description": "Tone your buttocks and thighs and work your muscles deeply with the Twister Stepper from Sunny Health & Fitness. This workout machine's twist action helps tone buttock and thigh areas and allows you to work your muscles deeply without putting as much pressure on your joints and bones. The built-in handlebar and deluxe, non-slip footplates offer balance and stability for a safe workout.Designed to help you meet your individual fitness goals, the Twister Stepper includes a multi-function LCD computer that provides your time, calories, scan, and count. The machine accommodates users of different heights with adjustable stepping height. The Twister Stepper boasts heavy-duty steel construction and is easy to fit into any corner of your home or office thanks to its small 19 by 17-inch platform and 48-inch height.Features and specificationsAdjustable stepping heightHeavy duty steel constructionHandle bar for balanceDeluxe non-slip footplatesLCD computerFunctions: time, calories, scan, and countAssembled dimensions: 19 by 17 by 48 inches (LxWxH)Gross Weight: 28 pounds", "text": "Sunny Twister Stepper with Handle Bar Tone your buttocks and thighs and work your muscles deeply with the Twister Stepper from Sunny Health & Fitness. This workout machine's twist action helps tone buttock and thigh areas and allows you to work your muscles deeply without putting as much pressure on your joints and bones. The built-in handlebar and deluxe, non-slip footplates offer balance and stability for a safe workout.Designed to help you meet your individual fitness goals, the Twister Stepper includes a multi-function LCD computer that provides your time, calories, scan, and count. The machine accommodates users of different heights with adjustable stepping height. The Twister Stepper boasts heavy-duty steel construction and is easy to fit into any corner of your home or office thanks to its small 19 by 17-inch platform and 48-inch height.Features and specificationsAdjustable stepping heightHeavy duty steel constructionHandle bar for balanceDeluxe non-slip footplatesLCD computerFunctions: time, calories, scan, and countAssembled dimensions: 19 by 17 by 48 inches (LxWxH)Gross Weight: 28 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aRGTc0rJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IDZHF6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Step Machines"]], "price": 81.98}}
{"item_id": "B001IEIR66", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK/SKS Military Grade Windage and Elevation Sight Tool", "description": "Designed on request by military services deployed overseas, our wind age and elevation sight tool is the strongest on the market today. Manufactured from 4140 steel, this tool is as rugged as the weapon it was designed to work on. Easily make adjustments to all AK and SKS variants. Marked TAPCO USA and stamped with our CAGE Code 3E2Q7.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK/SKS Military Grade Windage and Elevation Sight Tool Designed on request by military services deployed overseas, our wind age and elevation sight tool is the strongest on the market today. Manufactured from 4140 steel, this tool is as rugged as the weapon it was designed to work on. Easily make adjustments to all AK and SKS variants. Marked TAPCO USA and stamped with our CAGE Code 3E2Q7.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u7vjsIXsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IEIR66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 13.71}}
{"item_id": "B001IHNCXG", "title": "Abus Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 Foldable Lock - 85cm", "description": "5.5mm heavy-duty steel bars and links for highest securityLink construction offers compact folding and transportingAbus Link-Protection-Shield offers high saw protection of the linksThe bars, the links, the case as well as supporting elements of the locking system are made of special hardened steelAbus X-Plus cylinder for extremely high protection against picking2 x keys are supplied with the lock, one LED-lightedRattle free holder with Velcro or bottle cage mounting fits most bikesAbus Code Card for additional or replacement key or keyed alike lock optionsLength: 2.8 feet/85cmWeight: 1625 grams", "text": "Abus Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 Foldable Lock - 85cm 5.5mm heavy-duty steel bars and links for highest securityLink construction offers compact folding and transportingAbus Link-Protection-Shield offers high saw protection of the linksThe bars, the links, the case as well as supporting elements of the locking system are made of special hardened steelAbus X-Plus cylinder for extremely high protection against picking2 x keys are supplied with the lock, one LED-lightedRattle free holder with Velcro or bottle cage mounting fits most bikesAbus Code Card for additional or replacement key or keyed alike lock optionsLength: 2.8 feet/85cmWeight: 1625 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pM4fEOoFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IHNCXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Chain Locks"]], "price": 154.0}}
{"item_id": "B001IHQ05S", "title": "Third Eye On-Lens Micro Bicycle Mirror", "description": "Third Eye On Lens Micro MirrorSticks right onto your glassesSmall and unobtrusive, stays out of the wayFully adjustableno haze or distortion", "text": "Third Eye On-Lens Micro Bicycle Mirror Third Eye On Lens Micro MirrorSticks right onto your glassesSmall and unobtrusive, stays out of the wayFully adjustableno haze or distortion", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X%2BMDhbhTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IHQ05S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Third Eye", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 6.22}}
{"item_id": "B001IK6JY2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Loopback Inner Duty Belt", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Loopback Inner Duty Belt gives you an easy-to-use and comfortable inner belt. The woven nylon hook mates up to the nylon loop on the inside of many duty belts for added stability. Reverse the belt for courtroom wear without the duty belt.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Loopback Inner Duty Belt The BLACKHAWK! Loopback Inner Duty Belt gives you an easy-to-use and comfortable inner belt. The woven nylon hook mates up to the nylon loop on the inside of many duty belts for added stability. Reverse the belt for courtroom wear without the duty belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZJVqD-QML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IK6JY2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001IKFVHI", "title": "CUSCUS 120L Internal Frame Hiking Camp Backpack Travel Bag Gray Black", "description": "New 7500ci 120L backpack with total 7 pockets. Main compartment with two inside velcro closure loops for small items. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials (undetachable). One front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets let you organize your gear with ease. Front compression straps with buckles distribute the load evenly and provide exclusive greater convenience of movement. Webbing and elastic rope on the top for binding sleeping bag, sleeping pad and accessories. Front adjustable loop for water bottle or accessories. Daisy chain for additional attachments at bottom. Extra straps at bottom for attaching sleeping bag or tent. Hydration bladder loop on shoulder straps. A reinforced handle at back for better holding. 600D Water resistant polyester. Approximate dimension: 23(L) x 13(W) x 34(H); Fits torso 37-43 inches; Fits waist hips 30-55 inches.", "text": "CUSCUS 120L Internal Frame Hiking Camp Backpack Travel Bag Gray Black New 7500ci 120L backpack with total 7 pockets. Main compartment with two inside velcro closure loops for small items. Top lid pocket for compass, maps, small essentials (undetachable). One front zippered pocket. Two large zippered side pockets let you organize your gear with ease. Front compression straps with buckles distribute the load evenly and provide exclusive greater convenience of movement. Webbing and elastic rope on the top for binding sleeping bag, sleeping pad and accessories. Front adjustable loop for water bottle or accessories. Daisy chain for additional attachments at bottom. Extra straps at bottom for attaching sleeping bag or tent. Hydration bladder loop on shoulder straps. A reinforced handle at back for better holding. 600D Water resistant polyester. Approximate dimension: 23(L) x 13(W) x 34(H); Fits torso 37-43 inches; Fits waist hips 30-55 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U8OqGekwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IKFVHI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 47.99}}
{"item_id": "B001IKHUNQ", "title": "CAP Barbell Strength Fitness FID Bench", "description": "Get the most out of your home dumbbell set with this Cap Barbell fitness bench. Offering four adjustable positions--upright, flat, incline, and decline--the bench supports a variety of upper body exercises, including dumbbell presses, chest flies, shoulder presses, bicep curls, and more. The bench also includes such extras a dumbbell holder that allows easy access to your dumbbells while workout out, foam-covered handgrips that provide added comfort while doing leg raises, and foam shin supports. The fitness bench offers a weight capacity of 250 pounds.", "text": "CAP Barbell Strength Fitness FID Bench Get the most out of your home dumbbell set with this Cap Barbell fitness bench. Offering four adjustable positions--upright, flat, incline, and decline--the bench supports a variety of upper body exercises, including dumbbell presses, chest flies, shoulder presses, bicep curls, and more. The bench also includes such extras a dumbbell holder that allows easy access to your dumbbells while workout out, foam-covered handgrips that provide added comfort while doing leg raises, and foam shin supports. The fitness bench offers a weight capacity of 250 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mPnxTYnML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IKHUNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches", "Adjustable Benches"]], "price": 63.99}}
{"item_id": "B001IORAIM", "title": "Continental Gatorskin Bicycle Tire (700x23, Wire Beaded, Black)", "description": "Continental 0118537 Ultra Gatorskin 700 x 23 Black Tire has a durable carbon black mixture, a well regarded puncture protection system and the DuraSkin-anti-cut fabric to turn the Ultra GatorSkin into a real long distance runner. In varying widths from 23mm to 32mm it can be used on the way to work as well for training for road races or for sportifs and audax. A durable, tough tire at a really nice price. A modern tread design that collects less debris and the expansion of the product line to the new dimension 28-559 for fast MTB street riding. The DuraSkin technology protects the sidewalls from cuts, punctures and abrasion. The Safety System technology provides additional puncture protection by combining nylon fabric with Kevlar, positioned between the tread and the casing. Specs: Weight - 280 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "text": "Continental Gatorskin Bicycle Tire (700x23, Wire Beaded, Black) Continental 0118537 Ultra Gatorskin 700 x 23 Black Tire has a durable carbon black mixture, a well regarded puncture protection system and the DuraSkin-anti-cut fabric to turn the Ultra GatorSkin into a real long distance runner. In varying widths from 23mm to 32mm it can be used on the way to work as well for training for road races or for sportifs and audax. A durable, tough tire at a really nice price. A modern tread design that collects less debris and the expansion of the product line to the new dimension 28-559 for fast MTB street riding. The DuraSkin technology protects the sidewalls from cuts, punctures and abrasion. The Safety System technology provides additional puncture protection by combining nylon fabric with Kevlar, positioned between the tread and the casing. Specs: Weight - 280 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OBkYOHhKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IORAIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 44.49}}
{"item_id": "B001IORDH0", "title": "Shimano MF-HG37 Tourney Freewheel (13-28T 7 Speed)", "description": "Shimano Tourney freewheel are all designed to work with indexed shifters at a budget price.", "text": "Shimano MF-HG37 Tourney Freewheel (13-28T 7 Speed) Shimano Tourney freewheel are all designed to work with indexed shifters at a budget price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xrr6zcYcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IORDH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]], "price": 15.7}}
{"item_id": "B001IORJVU", "title": "Tektro RL520 Lever Set", "description": "Tektro RL520 Road Levers for Linear Pull Brakes. Features: Long cable pull for linear pull or mountain cable actuated disc brakes", "text": "Tektro RL520 Lever Set Tektro RL520 Road Levers for Linear Pull Brakes. Features: Long cable pull for linear pull or mountain cable actuated disc brakes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TPGJp2nCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IORJVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tektro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Levers"]], "price": 27.88}}
{"item_id": "B001IPILMA", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker BK3 Tac Tool Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "A design collaboration between Ethan Becker of BK&T; and John Benner of TDI, the Tac Tool smashes, bashes, prys, hammers and cuts. It is equally powerful at lifting stubborn hinge pins, prying open doors or windows, and hammering out glass as it is efficient at cutting 550 cord.Specifications:Model: BK3Weight: 1.3 poundsSheath: Glass-filled nylonEdge Angle: 15 degrees; Steel: 1095 cro-vanBlade Length: 7 inchesOverall Length: 12-1/2 inchesGrind: FlatHandle: GrivoryKnife made in the USA; sheath made in Taiwan Product Description Product Description", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker BK3 Tac Tool Fixed Blade Knife A design collaboration between Ethan Becker of BK&T; and John Benner of TDI, the Tac Tool smashes, bashes, prys, hammers and cuts. It is equally powerful at lifting stubborn hinge pins, prying open doors or windows, and hammering out glass as it is efficient at cutting 550 cord.Specifications:Model: BK3Weight: 1.3 poundsSheath: Glass-filled nylonEdge Angle: 15 degrees; Steel: 1095 cro-vanBlade Length: 7 inchesOverall Length: 12-1/2 inchesGrind: FlatHandle: GrivoryKnife made in the USA; sheath made in Taiwan Product Description Product Description", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2181lexkehL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IPILMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B001IPKL7I", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker BK9 Combat Bowie Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Combining Becker's trademark ergonomic handle design with a traditionally profiled American bowie-style blade, the Ka-Bar Combat Bowie knife is ideal for a variety of combat and field-craft chores. The blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Swiss-made Grivory handle, meanwhile, is constructed of a glass-fiber-filled nylon for added strength. Other features include a flat grind, a Ka-Bar Becker stamp, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelShape: Clip pointPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: GrivoryBlade length: 9 inchesOverall length: 14-3/4 inchesWeight: 1.05 pounds", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker BK9 Combat Bowie Fixed Blade Knife Combining Becker's trademark ergonomic handle design with a traditionally profiled American bowie-style blade, the Ka-Bar Combat Bowie knife is ideal for a variety of combat and field-craft chores. The blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Swiss-made Grivory handle, meanwhile, is constructed of a glass-fiber-filled nylon for added strength. Other features include a flat grind, a Ka-Bar Becker stamp, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelShape: Clip pointPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: GrivoryBlade length: 9 inchesOverall length: 14-3/4 inchesWeight: 1.05 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21afD3t2h6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IPKL7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 87.99}}
{"item_id": "B001IPMG8K", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker BK7 Combat Utility Fixed Blade Knife (7-Inch)", "description": "Designed specifically for soldiers and adventures who need a sturdy yet lightweight combat knife, the Ka-Bar Becker BK7 all-purpose utility knife is built to stand up to hard use. The knife blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Swiss-made Grivory handle, meanwhile, is constructed of a glass-fiber-filled nylon for added strength. Other features include a clip point, a flat grind, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: GrivoryBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 12-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.85 pounds", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker BK7 Combat Utility Fixed Blade Knife (7-Inch) Designed specifically for soldiers and adventures who need a sturdy yet lightweight combat knife, the Ka-Bar Becker BK7 all-purpose utility knife is built to stand up to hard use. The knife blade is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Swiss-made Grivory handle, meanwhile, is constructed of a glass-fiber-filled nylon for added strength. Other features include a clip point, a flat grind, and a 20-degree edge angle.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 20 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: GrivoryBlade length: 7 inchesOverall length: 12-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.85 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21T4Xsd4s0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IPMG8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 84.23}}
{"item_id": "B001IQGSFQ", "title": "AK 47 74 FCG Retaining Plate", "description": "If you haven't used one of these yet you're really missing out! This has to be the easiest and most hassle free way to install your fire control group in an AK with the selector hole in the standard location. All you do is install the hammer and trigger with the pins then slide in the plate.... put the selector in and they are locked in place.", "text": "AK 47 74 FCG Retaining Plate If you haven't used one of these yet you're really missing out! This has to be the easiest and most hassle free way to install your fire control group in an AK with the selector hole in the standard location. All you do is install the hammer and trigger with the pins then slide in the plate.... put the selector in and they are locked in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11NBGC7slhL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001IQGSFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 5.69}}
