{"item_id": "B001J8CWAI", "title": "TRX X-Mount", "description": "This durable, discrete mount when used in conjunction with the TRX Suspension Trainer can create a professional-quality training station almost anywhere. The 4.5-inch diameter plate is made of rugged steel and attaches easily to walls, vertical studs, or overhead beams to create an anchoring point for your training routines, helping you achieve greater range of motion and flexibility. It supports all TRX Suspension Trainer models, and includes two wood lag bolts. Professional installation is recommended.Satisfaction GuaranteeAll TRX training tools include a 30-day, 100% customer satisfaction guarantee.About TRX Suspension TrainingOriginating in the U.S. Navy SEALS and developed by Fitness Anywhere, Suspension Training is an innovative method of leveraged bodyweight exercise. Users can easily set up the portable TRX Suspension Trainer and safely perform hundreds of exercises that build power, strength, flexibility, balance, mobility, and prevent injuries.Highly portable and weighing less than two pounds, the TRX delivers performance and functionality comparable to expensive, unwieldy gym equipment, letting users keep fit at home, the gym, or while traveling.", "text": "TRX X-Mount This durable, discrete mount when used in conjunction with the TRX Suspension Trainer can create a professional-quality training station almost anywhere. The 4.5-inch diameter plate is made of rugged steel and attaches easily to walls, vertical studs, or overhead beams to create an anchoring point for your training routines, helping you achieve greater range of motion and flexibility. It supports all TRX Suspension Trainer models, and includes two wood lag bolts. Professional installation is recommended.Satisfaction GuaranteeAll TRX training tools include a 30-day, 100% customer satisfaction guarantee.About TRX Suspension TrainingOriginating in the U.S. Navy SEALS and developed by Fitness Anywhere, Suspension Training is an innovative method of leveraged bodyweight exercise. Users can easily set up the portable TRX Suspension Trainer and safely perform hundreds of exercises that build power, strength, flexibility, balance, mobility, and prevent injuries.Highly portable and weighing less than two pounds, the TRX delivers performance and functionality comparable to expensive, unwieldy gym equipment, letting users keep fit at home, the gym, or while traveling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mek%2BvXR3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001J8CWAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B001J92K7M", "title": "Safariland Beretta PX4 Storm 9-mm, 40 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Beretta PX4 Storm 9-mm, 40 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418eh7-YOIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001J92K7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.78}}
{"item_id": "B001J9H6E4", "title": "Sea to Summit X Plate", "description": "Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "text": "Sea to Summit X Plate Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gt42TMT2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001J9H6E4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Plates"]], "price": 21.95}}
