{"item_id": "B001JEPJZC", "title": "Kestrel 1000 Pocket Wind Meter", "description": "Simple and compact, the Kestrel 1000 fits right into the palm of your hand and weighs a mere 65 grams. It's also extremely durable and totally waterproof, allowing you to measure wind speeds in even the harshest weather conditions--and it even floats. Convenient and reliable, the Kestrel 1000 is the perfect tool for model plane pilots, kite boarders, and other outdoor enthusiasts that rely on accurate wind speed information. It accurately measures current, average, and maximum wind speeds. The Kestrel 1000 uses a sensitive user-replaceable impeller to measure the wind. The clear and durable LCD screen can be changed at any time to display wind data that suits a variety of applications.Beaufort Wind ScaleKnotsMiles Per HourKilometers Per HourFeet Per MinuteFeatures:Protective cover with sure-grip moldingData hold functionLarge easy-to-read displayWaterproof and floatsPatented, user-replaceable impeller (no tools needed)Ultralight impeller is mounted in jewel bearings for precision, wide range of speeds and low startup speedImpeller is shock-mounted in a glass-reinforced plastic housingAll instruments and accessories are completely assembled in the USAActual size: 4.8 x 1.7 x 0.6 inches (size without case)Power: User-replaceable CR2032 coin cell battery with average life of 300 hoursAll Kestrel Pocket Weather Meters are made in the USA and covered by a 5-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Additionally, every single Kestrel manufactured is calibrated for every single value, either directly against NIST-traceable standards or against an intermediary standard that is calibrated daily.What's in the Box?Kestrel 1000, slip-on protective cover, neck lanyard, CR2032 coin cell battery, Kestrel Certificate of Conformity", "text": "Kestrel 1000 Pocket Wind Meter Simple and compact, the Kestrel 1000 fits right into the palm of your hand and weighs a mere 65 grams. It's also extremely durable and totally waterproof, allowing you to measure wind speeds in even the harshest weather conditions--and it even floats. Convenient and reliable, the Kestrel 1000 is the perfect tool for model plane pilots, kite boarders, and other outdoor enthusiasts that rely on accurate wind speed information. It accurately measures current, average, and maximum wind speeds. The Kestrel 1000 uses a sensitive user-replaceable impeller to measure the wind. The clear and durable LCD screen can be changed at any time to display wind data that suits a variety of applications.Beaufort Wind ScaleKnotsMiles Per HourKilometers Per HourFeet Per MinuteFeatures:Protective cover with sure-grip moldingData hold functionLarge easy-to-read displayWaterproof and floatsPatented, user-replaceable impeller (no tools needed)Ultralight impeller is mounted in jewel bearings for precision, wide range of speeds and low startup speedImpeller is shock-mounted in a glass-reinforced plastic housingAll instruments and accessories are completely assembled in the USAActual size: 4.8 x 1.7 x 0.6 inches (size without case)Power: User-replaceable CR2032 coin cell battery with average life of 300 hoursAll Kestrel Pocket Weather Meters are made in the USA and covered by a 5-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Additionally, every single Kestrel manufactured is calibrated for every single value, either directly against NIST-traceable standards or against an intermediary standard that is calibrated daily.What's in the Box?Kestrel 1000, slip-on protective cover, neck lanyard, CR2032 coin cell battery, Kestrel Certificate of Conformity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U7um4s0XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JEPJZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kestrel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]], "price": 71.83}}
{"item_id": "B001JEPJZM", "title": "Kestrel 2000 Pocket Thermo Wind Meter", "description": "The New Kestrel 2000 has been redesigned for even better performance and functionality! For those of you who like to know just how cold and windy it really is, the Kestrel 2000 Pocket Wind Meter is your reality check. Whether contemplating which wet suit the cold water warrants, or checking to see how low the wind chill can go in the blind, the Kestrel 2000 is the easy-to-use tool you need. Winter sports enthusiasts around the world love Kestrel Meters. Thanks to the patented external temperature sensor, the Kestrel 2000 can take accurate water and snow temperature readings, and since it is isolated from the case, you can be sure that the temperature the Kestrel Meter is reading is accurate and not influenced by your hand warming the unit. Kestrel Meters kept riders and spectators abreast of the weather conditions at the 2006 ESPN X Games in Aspen, Colorado, and were used by the 2006 US Biathlon Olympic Team in Turin to measure air and snow temperature to aid in ski-wax selection decisions and measure the wind downrange. . Model Year: 2011, Product ID: 106871, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., GTIN: 0730650020003", "text": "Kestrel 2000 Pocket Thermo Wind Meter The New Kestrel 2000 has been redesigned for even better performance and functionality! For those of you who like to know just how cold and windy it really is, the Kestrel 2000 Pocket Wind Meter is your reality check. Whether contemplating which wet suit the cold water warrants, or checking to see how low the wind chill can go in the blind, the Kestrel 2000 is the easy-to-use tool you need. Winter sports enthusiasts around the world love Kestrel Meters. Thanks to the patented external temperature sensor, the Kestrel 2000 can take accurate water and snow temperature readings, and since it is isolated from the case, you can be sure that the temperature the Kestrel Meter is reading is accurate and not influenced by your hand warming the unit. Kestrel Meters kept riders and spectators abreast of the weather conditions at the 2006 ESPN X Games in Aspen, Colorado, and were used by the 2006 US Biathlon Olympic Team in Turin to measure air and snow temperature to aid in ski-wax selection decisions and measure the wind downrange. . Model Year: 2011, Product ID: 106871, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., GTIN: 0730650020003", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4184qdX8kOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JEPJZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kestrel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]], "price": 93.38}}
{"item_id": "B001JEPK1U", "title": "Kestrel 4500NV Pocket Weather Tracker, Olive Drab", "description": "Kestrel's flagship meter, the Olive Drab Kestrel 4500NV Pocket Weather Tracker is capable of monitoring and reporting an exhaustive list of environmental parameters--from temperature to barometric pressure, dewpoint, wind chill, and more. With a digital compass and monitoring of wind direction, crosswind, and headwind/tailwind, the 4500NV is a great choice for HAZMAT teams and flight crews and it's particularly handy for military applications thanks to its night-vision preserving backlight. Like all the pocket weather meters in the Kestrel 4000 series, the Kestrel 4500NV is capable of storing and charting up to 1400 data points for later analysis. The Kestrel 4500 also measures:Current Wind SpeedMax Wind GustAverage Wind SpeedTemperatureWind ChillRelative HumidityHeat Stress IndexDewpoint TempWet Bulb TempBarometric PressureAltitudeDensity AltitudeFeatures:Additional measurements including digital compass, wind direction, crosswind and head/tailwindWaterproof and floatsTime and dateEasy-to-read, backlit display for low-light conditionsMulti-function 3-line displayExterior temperature, humidity, and pressure sensors for fast and accurate readingsHumidity sensor can be recalibrated in the field in the field with the Kestrel Relative Humidity Calibration Kit.Minimum, maximum, and average valuesAutomatic and manual data storageCustomizable data storage - 1400 data pointsData chartingData upload (with optional interface)Five languages (English, French, Spanish, German, and Italian)Patented, user-replaceable impeller (no tools needed)Ultralight impeller is mounted in jewel bearings for precision, wide range of speeds and low startup speedImpeller is shock-mounted in a glass-reinforced plastic housingFlip-top impeller cover allows use of other functions while protecting the impellerUS Patent Nos. 5,783,753 and 5,939,645 and 6,257,074All instruments and accessories are completely assembled in the USAActual size: 5.0 x 1.8 x 1.1 inches (size without case)Power: 2 AAA batteries (average life of 400 hours)All Kestrel Pocket Weather Meters are made in the USA and covered by a 5-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Additionally, every single Kestrel manufactured is calibrated for every single value, either directly against NIST-traceable standards or against an intermediary standard that is calibrated daily.What's in the Box?Kestrel 4500NV, soft carry pouch, neck lanyard, 2 AAA batteries, Kestrel Certificate of Conformity", "text": "Kestrel 4500NV Pocket Weather Tracker, Olive Drab Kestrel's flagship meter, the Olive Drab Kestrel 4500NV Pocket Weather Tracker is capable of monitoring and reporting an exhaustive list of environmental parameters--from temperature to barometric pressure, dewpoint, wind chill, and more. With a digital compass and monitoring of wind direction, crosswind, and headwind/tailwind, the 4500NV is a great choice for HAZMAT teams and flight crews and it's particularly handy for military applications thanks to its night-vision preserving backlight. Like all the pocket weather meters in the Kestrel 4000 series, the Kestrel 4500NV is capable of storing and charting up to 1400 data points for later analysis. The Kestrel 4500 also measures:Current Wind SpeedMax Wind GustAverage Wind SpeedTemperatureWind ChillRelative HumidityHeat Stress IndexDewpoint TempWet Bulb TempBarometric PressureAltitudeDensity AltitudeFeatures:Additional measurements including digital compass, wind direction, crosswind and head/tailwindWaterproof and floatsTime and dateEasy-to-read, backlit display for low-light conditionsMulti-function 3-line displayExterior temperature, humidity, and pressure sensors for fast and accurate readingsHumidity sensor can be recalibrated in the field in the field with the Kestrel Relative Humidity Calibration Kit.Minimum, maximum, and average valuesAutomatic and manual data storageCustomizable data storage - 1400 data pointsData chartingData upload (with optional interface)Five languages (English, French, Spanish, German, and Italian)Patented, user-replaceable impeller (no tools needed)Ultralight impeller is mounted in jewel bearings for precision, wide range of speeds and low startup speedImpeller is shock-mounted in a glass-reinforced plastic housingFlip-top impeller cover allows use of other functions while protecting the impellerUS Patent Nos. 5,783,753 and 5,939,645 and 6,257,074All instruments and accessories are completely assembled in the USAActual size: 5.0 x 1.8 x 1.1 inches (size without case)Power: 2 AAA batteries (average life of 400 hours)All Kestrel Pocket Weather Meters are made in the USA and covered by a 5-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Additionally, every single Kestrel manufactured is calibrated for every single value, either directly against NIST-traceable standards or against an intermediary standard that is calibrated daily.What's in the Box?Kestrel 4500NV, soft carry pouch, neck lanyard, 2 AAA batteries, Kestrel Certificate of Conformity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dJNntv49L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JEPK1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kestrel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]], "price": 287.19}}
{"item_id": "B001JIL57Y", "title": "Feedback Sports Tool Tray", "description": "FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Tool Tray Attaches to all feedback stands Perfect for holding tools and small parts Built-in beverage holder Small parts washing bin Attaches to all feedback work stands Heavy-duty construction SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Tool Tray Weight: 2 lbs / 0.9 kg Dimension: 2.75 x 10 x 14.5\" / 69.9 x 254 x 368 mm", "text": "Feedback Sports Tool Tray FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Tool Tray Attaches to all feedback stands Perfect for holding tools and small parts Built-in beverage holder Small parts washing bin Attaches to all feedback work stands Heavy-duty construction SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Tool Tray Weight: 2 lbs / 0.9 kg Dimension: 2.75 x 10 x 14.5\" / 69.9 x 254 x 368 mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mh7i70eGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JIL57Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Feedback Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHLG", "title": "BARSKA 3-12x50 IR Huntmaster Pro 30/30 IR Cross Riflescope", "description": "Fully multicoated optics and a center-lit illuminated reticle with 11 brightness settings mean shooters enjoy sharp, crisp target acquisition, regardless of conditions.The BARSKA Huntmaster Pro is an ideal riflescope when lighting conditions are anything but ideal. Combining advanced optic technology, ruggedly durable construction, and remarkable accuracy, it's built around a center-lit illuminated 30/30 IR cross reticle with no fewer than 11 brightness settings. A fast-focus eye bell, large objective lens, and multicoated optics combine to deliver clear, high-contrast downrange views.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proof30/30 infrared cross reticleFully multicoated opticsAdjustable for windage, elevation, and rheostatBlack matte finishIncludes battery and lens clothSpecifications3-to-12X magnification13-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter50-millimeter objective lens16.7-4.2-millimeter exit pupil35-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnificationTen-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification2.7-inch eye relief0.25-inch click value21.3-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 3-12x50 IR Huntmaster Pro 30/30 IR Cross Riflescope Fully multicoated optics and a center-lit illuminated reticle with 11 brightness settings mean shooters enjoy sharp, crisp target acquisition, regardless of conditions.The BARSKA Huntmaster Pro is an ideal riflescope when lighting conditions are anything but ideal. Combining advanced optic technology, ruggedly durable construction, and remarkable accuracy, it's built around a center-lit illuminated 30/30 IR cross reticle with no fewer than 11 brightness settings. A fast-focus eye bell, large objective lens, and multicoated optics combine to deliver clear, high-contrast downrange views.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proof30/30 infrared cross reticleFully multicoated opticsAdjustable for windage, elevation, and rheostatBlack matte finishIncludes battery and lens clothSpecifications3-to-12X magnification13-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter50-millimeter objective lens16.7-4.2-millimeter exit pupil35-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnificationTen-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification2.7-inch eye relief0.25-inch click value21.3-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BTMuzdRXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 91.69}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHMK", "title": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Huntmaster Easy Shot Riflescope", "description": "Fully coated optics and an Easy Shot reticle help ensure clear, accurate firing.The Huntmaster line of riflescopes, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is made to provide target shooters and hunters with firing precision and in-field dependability at an affordable price. Fully-coated optics maximize light transmission for bright, crisp images, while the rugged one-inch monotube is water-, fog-, and shock-proof.Specifications3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lensOne-inch tube diameter36-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X, 14-foot field of view at 100 yards at 9X13.3-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil3.3-inch eye relief12.2-inch length12.9-ounce weight0.25-inch click valueSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully coated opticsEasy Shot reticleWater-, fog-, and shock-proofBlack matte finishIncludes scope caps and lens clothLifetime WarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Huntmaster Easy Shot Riflescope Fully coated optics and an Easy Shot reticle help ensure clear, accurate firing.The Huntmaster line of riflescopes, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is made to provide target shooters and hunters with firing precision and in-field dependability at an affordable price. Fully-coated optics maximize light transmission for bright, crisp images, while the rugged one-inch monotube is water-, fog-, and shock-proof.Specifications3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lensOne-inch tube diameter36-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X, 14-foot field of view at 100 yards at 9X13.3-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil3.3-inch eye relief12.2-inch length12.9-ounce weight0.25-inch click valueSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully coated opticsEasy Shot reticleWater-, fog-, and shock-proofBlack matte finishIncludes scope caps and lens clothLifetime WarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hgeTd7HQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 52.0}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHMU", "title": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Huntmaster 30/30 Riflescope", "description": "The scope comes with two matching, easy-to-use 0.625-inch mounting rings.The Huntmaster line of riflescopes, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is made to provide target shooters and hunters with firing precision and in-field dependability at an affordable price. Fully-coated optics maximize light transmission for bright, crisp images, while the rugged one-inch monotube is water-, fog-, and shock-proof.Specifications3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lensOne-inch tube diameter36-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X, 14-foot field of view at 100 yards at 9XParallax-free at 100 yards13.3-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil3.3-inch eye relief12.2-inch length12.9-ounce weight0.25-inch click valueSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully coated optics30/30 reticleWater-, fog-, and shock-proofStriking silver finishIncludes scope caps, lens cloth, and 0.625-inch mounting ringsLifetime WarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Huntmaster 30/30 Riflescope The scope comes with two matching, easy-to-use 0.625-inch mounting rings.The Huntmaster line of riflescopes, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is made to provide target shooters and hunters with firing precision and in-field dependability at an affordable price. Fully-coated optics maximize light transmission for bright, crisp images, while the rugged one-inch monotube is water-, fog-, and shock-proof.Specifications3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lensOne-inch tube diameter36-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X, 14-foot field of view at 100 yards at 9XParallax-free at 100 yards13.3-to-4.4-millimeter exit pupil3.3-inch eye relief12.2-inch length12.9-ounce weight0.25-inch click valueSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully coated optics30/30 reticleWater-, fog-, and shock-proofStriking silver finishIncludes scope caps, lens cloth, and 0.625-inch mounting ringsLifetime WarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HSmWm7L7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 55.26}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHNY", "title": "BARSKA 10-40X50 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope", "description": "One of Barska's most versatile riflescope lines, Varmint riflescopes are available in a wide selection of sizes and reticles, making them ideal for varmint hunting, target shooting, long-range shooting, and precision shooting. Varmint scopes go the distance on performance. When precision is a critical factor, the scopes deliver the advantage with long-range, deadly accurate targeting. Engineered with an adjustable objective for parallax correction and easy-grip high turrets, Varmint scopes provide you with twice the precision for most hunting applications. Varmint scopes' also include large objective lenses coupled with multicoated optics, helping increase light transmission for superior clarity. Waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof, Barska's Varmint series is like having several scopes in one.Varmint riflescopes--which are available with such reticle types as 30/30, mil-dot, and target dot--come with lens covers and are backed by Barska's limited lifetime warranty.Specifications:Magnification:10-40xField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 9.42/2.62@10x-3.14/0.87@40xExit Pupil: 5mmEye Relief: 3.6\"Click value = 1/8.About BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 10-40X50 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope One of Barska's most versatile riflescope lines, Varmint riflescopes are available in a wide selection of sizes and reticles, making them ideal for varmint hunting, target shooting, long-range shooting, and precision shooting. Varmint scopes go the distance on performance. When precision is a critical factor, the scopes deliver the advantage with long-range, deadly accurate targeting. Engineered with an adjustable objective for parallax correction and easy-grip high turrets, Varmint scopes provide you with twice the precision for most hunting applications. Varmint scopes' also include large objective lenses coupled with multicoated optics, helping increase light transmission for superior clarity. Waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof, Barska's Varmint series is like having several scopes in one.Varmint riflescopes--which are available with such reticle types as 30/30, mil-dot, and target dot--come with lens covers and are backed by Barska's limited lifetime warranty.Specifications:Magnification:10-40xField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 9.42/2.62@10x-3.14/0.87@40xExit Pupil: 5mmEye Relief: 3.6\"Click value = 1/8.About BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uKvvMkICL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHNY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHOI", "title": "BARSKA 6-24x50 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope", "description": "Specifications:6-24x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =15/5@6x-4.2/1.4@24x, Exit Pupil = 8.3-2.0mm, Eye Relief = 3.5\", Click value = 1/8.", "text": "BARSKA 6-24x50 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope Specifications:6-24x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =15/5@6x-4.2/1.4@24x, Exit Pupil = 8.3-2.0mm, Eye Relief = 3.5\", Click value = 1/8.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jDV6YmFVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 76.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHOS", "title": "BARSKA 6.5-20x50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope", "description": "The Barska 6.5-20x50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope is the perfect scope for varmint hunting and target-shooting practice. The large, adjustable 50mm objective lens offers 6.5 to 20 times variable magnification for increased light transmission. This lightweight rifle scope, designed for long-range and precision shooting, is 100% fog-proof and waterproof. The multi-coated optics with target-dot reticles allows for enhanced performance in tough conditions. The one-inch, shockproof construction scope also features caliber-proofed elevation adjustment so you can rely on its accuracy from any altitude. Scope caps are included as a bonus accessory for lens protection.Specifications:Magnification: 6.5x to 20xObjective lens: 50mmReticle: Target dotExit pupil: 7.7 to 2.5mmField of view: 16 feet @ 100 yards (6.5x); 5.7 feet @ 100 yards (20x)Eye relief: 3.6 inchesClick value: 1/8 inchesTube diameter: 1 inchLength: 15.95 inchesWeight: 22.3 ounces", "text": "BARSKA 6.5-20x50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope The Barska 6.5-20x50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope is the perfect scope for varmint hunting and target-shooting practice. The large, adjustable 50mm objective lens offers 6.5 to 20 times variable magnification for increased light transmission. This lightweight rifle scope, designed for long-range and precision shooting, is 100% fog-proof and waterproof. The multi-coated optics with target-dot reticles allows for enhanced performance in tough conditions. The one-inch, shockproof construction scope also features caliber-proofed elevation adjustment so you can rely on its accuracy from any altitude. Scope caps are included as a bonus accessory for lens protection.Specifications:Magnification: 6.5x to 20xObjective lens: 50mmReticle: Target dotExit pupil: 7.7 to 2.5mmField of view: 16 feet @ 100 yards (6.5x); 5.7 feet @ 100 yards (20x)Eye relief: 3.6 inchesClick value: 1/8 inchesTube diameter: 1 inchLength: 15.95 inchesWeight: 22.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-2nQXdeWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 75.16}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHPM", "title": "BARSKA 6-24x42 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope", "description": "Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and shooters can fine-tune for windage and elevation.The BARSKA Varmint riflescope offers long-range accuracy, thanks to an adjustable objective for parallax correction and easy-grip high turrets. A large objective lens, in conjunction with multicoated optics, increases light transmission and provides remarkable clarity. Built to withstand the rugged outdoor conditions most hunters face, its casing is 100% water-, fog-, and shock-proof.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofFully multicoated opticsMil-dot reticleAdjustable for windage, elevation, and parallaxBlack matte finishIncludes scope cap and lens clothSpecifications6-to-24X magnification15.7-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter42-millimeter objective lens7-to-1.75-millimeter exit pupil3.5-inch eye relief15-foot field of view at 100 yards at 6X magnification4.2-foot field of view at 100 yards at 24X magnification0.125-inch click value20.5-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 6-24x42 AO Varmint Mil-Dot Riflescope Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and shooters can fine-tune for windage and elevation.The BARSKA Varmint riflescope offers long-range accuracy, thanks to an adjustable objective for parallax correction and easy-grip high turrets. A large objective lens, in conjunction with multicoated optics, increases light transmission and provides remarkable clarity. Built to withstand the rugged outdoor conditions most hunters face, its casing is 100% water-, fog-, and shock-proof.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofFully multicoated opticsMil-dot reticleAdjustable for windage, elevation, and parallaxBlack matte finishIncludes scope cap and lens clothSpecifications6-to-24X magnification15.7-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter42-millimeter objective lens7-to-1.75-millimeter exit pupil3.5-inch eye relief15-foot field of view at 100 yards at 6X magnification4.2-foot field of view at 100 yards at 24X magnification0.125-inch click value20.5-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z5vR65sXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 75.01}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHR0", "title": "BARSKA 3-9x42 IR Contour Dual Color Reticle 30/30 IR Riflescope", "description": "Two rugged, brushed metal 0.875-inch Picatinny base rings are included with the scope.The BARSKA 3-9x42 Contour Dual Reticle riflescope, as the name implies, features a two-color illuminated reticle, which can be switched between red and green 30/30, as well as standard black. To optimize illumination for shooting conditions, each color also offers five brightness settings. For crystal clarity regardless of how much light you're working with, the Contour has fully coated optics, and its water-, fog-, and shock-proof casing will hold up to years of tough outdoor use.The scope comes complete with a set of brushed metal 0.875-inch Picatinny base rings, ideal for mounting to AR-15s, M-16s, crossbows, pistols, shotguns, and essentially any weapon with a Picatinny rail mounting system.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofDual-color 30/30 infrared reticleFive brightness settingsFully coated opticsAdjustable for windage, elevation, and rheostatBlack matte finishIncludes mounting rings, battery, scope caps, and lens clothSpecifications3-to-9X magnification9.1-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter42-millimeter objective lens14-4.6-millimeter exit pupil36.7-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnification12.5-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification3.9-inch eye relief0.25-inch click value16-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 3-9x42 IR Contour Dual Color Reticle 30/30 IR Riflescope Two rugged, brushed metal 0.875-inch Picatinny base rings are included with the scope.The BARSKA 3-9x42 Contour Dual Reticle riflescope, as the name implies, features a two-color illuminated reticle, which can be switched between red and green 30/30, as well as standard black. To optimize illumination for shooting conditions, each color also offers five brightness settings. For crystal clarity regardless of how much light you're working with, the Contour has fully coated optics, and its water-, fog-, and shock-proof casing will hold up to years of tough outdoor use.The scope comes complete with a set of brushed metal 0.875-inch Picatinny base rings, ideal for mounting to AR-15s, M-16s, crossbows, pistols, shotguns, and essentially any weapon with a Picatinny rail mounting system.FeaturesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofDual-color 30/30 infrared reticleFive brightness settingsFully coated opticsAdjustable for windage, elevation, and rheostatBlack matte finishIncludes mounting rings, battery, scope caps, and lens clothSpecifications3-to-9X magnification9.1-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter42-millimeter objective lens14-4.6-millimeter exit pupil36.7-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnification12.5-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification3.9-inch eye relief0.25-inch click value16-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ri9qLM7QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 73.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHRA", "title": "BARSKA 3-9x42 IR Contour Riflescope (4A Mil-Plex IR 7/8\" Picatinny Base)", "description": "The Barska 3-9x42 IR Contour Riflescope is a compact, lightweight scope providing precision accuracy beyond its size. The 42mm objective lens provides three to nine times variable magnification with an extremely long eye relief. This rifle scope is completely fog-proof and waterproof for even the toughest of weather conditions. The fully-coated optics with illuminated 4A Mil-Plex reticles allow for enhanced performance. The extra rigid, shockproof construction gives you even more control and accuracy. Bonus accessories include a set of 7/8-inch Picatinny base rings with scope caps.", "text": "BARSKA 3-9x42 IR Contour Riflescope (4A Mil-Plex IR 7/8\" Picatinny Base) The Barska 3-9x42 IR Contour Riflescope is a compact, lightweight scope providing precision accuracy beyond its size. The 42mm objective lens provides three to nine times variable magnification with an extremely long eye relief. This rifle scope is completely fog-proof and waterproof for even the toughest of weather conditions. The fully-coated optics with illuminated 4A Mil-Plex reticles allow for enhanced performance. The extra rigid, shockproof construction gives you even more control and accuracy. Bonus accessories include a set of 7/8-inch Picatinny base rings with scope caps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P5hiPzkBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHRA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHUC", "title": "BARSKA 1x, 22mm-33mm Multi-Reticle Electro Sight", "description": "Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =51.84,", "text": "BARSKA 1x, 22mm-33mm Multi-Reticle Electro Sight Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =51.84,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z4ZwkkGEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 47.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHUM", "title": "BARSKA 1x30 IR M-16 Electro Sight Riflescope", "description": "The 1x30 electro sight riflescope is designed for quick tactical shooting.The scope includes a tactical red illuminated cross reticle.Designed for quick tactical shooting, the Barska 1x30 M-16 electro sight riflescope is perfect for everything from targets to turkeys. The riflescope offers such features as a seven-position reticle illumination adjustment, 1/2-inch-click adjustable windage and elevation adjustments, and a removable magnification objective lens. As a result, you'll enjoy plenty of eye relief and increased shooting accuracy. The scope's multi-coated ruby lenses, meanwhile, produce sharp images with minimum glare--a must for precision aiming. And thanks to the scope's high impact rating, it's built strong to withstand high-caliber recoil shot after shot. Other features include a parallax-free image at 100 yards, a standard Weaver-style mount, a black matte finish, a tactical red illuminated cross reticle, and a five-position rheostat that allows you to make individual reticle brightness adjustments. Built to provide unlimited eye relief for such rifles as the AR-15, M-16, M-4, and SKS, the 1x30 scope carries Barska's one-year limited warranty.Specifications:Magnification: 1xObjective lens: 30mmReticle: Red IR crossExit pupil: 23mmOptical coating: Fully coatedField of view: 54 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: UnlimitedAdjustment knob: Side windage and elevationElevation: Black matteLength: 6 inchesWeight: 12.8 ouncesIncluded accessories: Battery and lens clothWarranty: 1 yearAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 1x30 IR M-16 Electro Sight Riflescope The 1x30 electro sight riflescope is designed for quick tactical shooting.The scope includes a tactical red illuminated cross reticle.Designed for quick tactical shooting, the Barska 1x30 M-16 electro sight riflescope is perfect for everything from targets to turkeys. The riflescope offers such features as a seven-position reticle illumination adjustment, 1/2-inch-click adjustable windage and elevation adjustments, and a removable magnification objective lens. As a result, you'll enjoy plenty of eye relief and increased shooting accuracy. The scope's multi-coated ruby lenses, meanwhile, produce sharp images with minimum glare--a must for precision aiming. And thanks to the scope's high impact rating, it's built strong to withstand high-caliber recoil shot after shot. Other features include a parallax-free image at 100 yards, a standard Weaver-style mount, a black matte finish, a tactical red illuminated cross reticle, and a five-position rheostat that allows you to make individual reticle brightness adjustments. Built to provide unlimited eye relief for such rifles as the AR-15, M-16, M-4, and SKS, the 1x30 scope carries Barska's one-year limited warranty.Specifications:Magnification: 1xObjective lens: 30mmReticle: Red IR crossExit pupil: 23mmOptical coating: Fully coatedField of view: 54 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: UnlimitedAdjustment knob: Side windage and elevationElevation: Black matteLength: 6 inchesWeight: 12.8 ouncesIncluded accessories: Battery and lens clothWarranty: 1 yearAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q2iudNYiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 72.0}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHW0", "title": "BARSKA 4x20 Electro Sight Scope M-16 Riflescope", "description": "An integrated peep sight allows you to use the rifle's iron sight for rapid target acquisition.The 4x20 Electro Sight Carry Handle scope, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is specifically designed for use with M-16 and AR-15 rifles. A built-in bullet drop compensation system calibrated to 500 yards, in 100-yard increments, along with a 30/30 reticle and multi-coated optics help ensure firing accuracy. An integrated base easily mounts onto the inside track of a rifle's carry handle, with a peep sight that allows you to use the rifle's iron sight for rapid target acquisition.Specifications4X magnification20-millimeter objective lens22-foot field of view at 100 yardsFive-millimeter exit pupil2.7-inch eye relief6.9-inch length13.4-ounce weightSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully multi-coated optics30/30 reticleBlack matte finishIncludes lens clothWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 4x20 Electro Sight Scope M-16 Riflescope An integrated peep sight allows you to use the rifle's iron sight for rapid target acquisition.The 4x20 Electro Sight Carry Handle scope, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is specifically designed for use with M-16 and AR-15 rifles. A built-in bullet drop compensation system calibrated to 500 yards, in 100-yard increments, along with a 30/30 reticle and multi-coated optics help ensure firing accuracy. An integrated base easily mounts onto the inside track of a rifle's carry handle, with a peep sight that allows you to use the rifle's iron sight for rapid target acquisition.Specifications4X magnification20-millimeter objective lens22-foot field of view at 100 yardsFive-millimeter exit pupil2.7-inch eye relief6.9-inch length13.4-ounce weightSide adjustment knobs for windage and elevationFully multi-coated optics30/30 reticleBlack matte finishIncludes lens clothWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GO8Ion2qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 64.99}}
