{"item_id": "B001JJCHXE", "title": "BARSKA 4x32 Plinker-22 Riflescope (Silver)", "description": "Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and shooters can fine-tune for windage and elevation.The Plinker-22 is one of BARSKA's most popular riflescopes, and is engineered specifically for use with .22 rifles and rimfires. Designed for plinking and general hunting applications, this scope offers bright, sharp optical clarity, longterm durability, and 0.375-inch dovetail rings as an added bonus. Built to withstand the rugged outdoor conditions most hunters face, its casing is 100% water-, fog-, and shock-proof, and features a dramatic silver finish.FeaturesDesigned specifically for use with .22 riflesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofFully coated opticsAdjustable for windage and elevation0.375-inch dovetail ringsSilver finishIncludes mounting rings and lens clothSpecifications4X magnification11.9-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter32-millimeter objective lens30/30 reticleEight-millimeter exit pupilThree-inch eye relief29-foot field of view at 100 yards0.25-inch click value16-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 4x32 Plinker-22 Riflescope (Silver) Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and shooters can fine-tune for windage and elevation.The Plinker-22 is one of BARSKA's most popular riflescopes, and is engineered specifically for use with .22 rifles and rimfires. Designed for plinking and general hunting applications, this scope offers bright, sharp optical clarity, longterm durability, and 0.375-inch dovetail rings as an added bonus. Built to withstand the rugged outdoor conditions most hunters face, its casing is 100% water-, fog-, and shock-proof, and features a dramatic silver finish.FeaturesDesigned specifically for use with .22 riflesWater-, fog-, and shock-proofFully coated opticsAdjustable for windage and elevation0.375-inch dovetail ringsSilver finishIncludes mounting rings and lens clothSpecifications4X magnification11.9-inch tube lengthOne-inch tube diameter32-millimeter objective lens30/30 reticleEight-millimeter exit pupilThree-inch eye relief29-foot field of view at 100 yards0.25-inch click value16-ounce weightWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311ZseL9M1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 44.89}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHXO", "title": "BARSKA 2X30 Red Dot Quick Target Riflescope", "description": "Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and the shooter can fine-tune for windage, elevation, and reticle brightness.Offering exceptional downrange optical clarity in a ruggedly durable package, the BARSKA 2x30 Red Dot Quick Target Riflescope is a hunter and target-shooter's best friend. Designed for rapid target acquisition in low light conditions, it boasts multi-coated optics for crisp, clear images and glare reduction. Windage, elevation, and reticle brightness can all be adjusted to fit conditions and shooter preference, and batteries are included.FeaturesLight weight and compact sizeFully multicoated opticsAdjustable reticle brightness100% water-, fog-, and shock-proofUnlimited eye reliefAdjustable rheostat, windage, and elevationBlack matte finishIncludes base, scope covers, battery, and lens clothSpecifications5.25-inch length8.8-ounce weight30-millimeter tube diameter2X magnification with 28-millimeter objective lensFive MOA reticle15-millimeter exit pupil68-foot field of view at 100 yards0.25-inch click valueWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 2X30 Red Dot Quick Target Riflescope Adjustment knobs offer solid, satisfying 0.25-inch click adjustments, and the shooter can fine-tune for windage, elevation, and reticle brightness.Offering exceptional downrange optical clarity in a ruggedly durable package, the BARSKA 2x30 Red Dot Quick Target Riflescope is a hunter and target-shooter's best friend. Designed for rapid target acquisition in low light conditions, it boasts multi-coated optics for crisp, clear images and glare reduction. Windage, elevation, and reticle brightness can all be adjusted to fit conditions and shooter preference, and batteries are included.FeaturesLight weight and compact sizeFully multicoated opticsAdjustable reticle brightness100% water-, fog-, and shock-proofUnlimited eye reliefAdjustable rheostat, windage, and elevationBlack matte finishIncludes base, scope covers, battery, and lens clothSpecifications5.25-inch length8.8-ounce weight30-millimeter tube diameter2X magnification with 28-millimeter objective lensFive MOA reticle15-millimeter exit pupil68-foot field of view at 100 yards0.25-inch click valueWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's product lines are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pyAYRjDLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 52.0}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHY8", "title": "BARSKA Red Dot 42mm Riflescope", "description": "Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =62/21@1x, Exit Pupil = 42mm, Eye Relief =Unlimited, Click value = 1/2.", "text": "BARSKA Red Dot 42mm Riflescope Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =62/21@1x, Exit Pupil = 42mm, Eye Relief =Unlimited, Click value = 1/2.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518IawNPu%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHZ2", "title": "BARSKA Red Dot 30mm Riflescope", "description": "Ultra-fast target acquisition, pinpoint accuracy and wide field of view make this Red Dot ideal for handguns, rimfire rifles, shotguns, pistols, blackpowders and crossbows. Finger adjustable rheostat for variable reticle brightness control, anti-reflective coating, and integrated mount for optimum performance. Wide field of view, unlimited eye relief and multi-coated opticsSpecifications:Magnification: 1xObjective Lens: 30mmReticle: 5 MOAExit Pupil: 30mmOptical Coating: Multi CoatedField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 57/19@1xEye Relief: UnlimitedClick Value: 1/2\"Adjustment Knob: Adj. rheostat, adj. windage and elevationTube Diameter: 38mmFinish: Black MatteWeight: 4.8 oz.Length: 3.75 inchIncluded Accessories: Battery and Lens ClothWarranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty", "text": "BARSKA Red Dot 30mm Riflescope Ultra-fast target acquisition, pinpoint accuracy and wide field of view make this Red Dot ideal for handguns, rimfire rifles, shotguns, pistols, blackpowders and crossbows. Finger adjustable rheostat for variable reticle brightness control, anti-reflective coating, and integrated mount for optimum performance. Wide field of view, unlimited eye relief and multi-coated opticsSpecifications:Magnification: 1xObjective Lens: 30mmReticle: 5 MOAExit Pupil: 30mmOptical Coating: Multi CoatedField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 57/19@1xEye Relief: UnlimitedClick Value: 1/2\"Adjustment Knob: Adj. rheostat, adj. windage and elevationTube Diameter: 38mmFinish: Black MatteWeight: 4.8 oz.Length: 3.75 inchIncluded Accessories: Battery and Lens ClothWarranty: 1 Year Limited Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IVkk8L%2B-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 36.2}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCHZC", "title": "BARSKA Red Dot 25mm Riflescope (30mm Tube, 3/4\" Dovetail .22 Rings & Extension Tube Included)", "description": "Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =57/19@1x, Exit Pupil = 25mm, Eye Relief =Unlimited, Click value = 1/2.", "text": "BARSKA Red Dot 25mm Riflescope (30mm Tube, 3/4\" Dovetail .22 Rings & Extension Tube Included) Specifications:1x, Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m) =57/19@1x, Exit Pupil = 25mm, Eye Relief =Unlimited, Click value = 1/2.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TM72GQ15L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCHZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 41.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCI06", "title": "BARSKA 3-7x20 Rimfire Riflescope", "description": "This scope will keep you on target. BARSKA’s Rimfire scope is designed specifically for small bore rifles. Calibrated parallax-free at 50 yards for shorter rimfire ranges. Featuring coated optics and a 30/30 reticle, ideal for competitive and recreational target shooting, small game or varmint-type hunting. Standard 3/8” rings are included.Specifications:Magnification: 3-7xField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 21/7@3x-10/3.3@7xExit Pupil: 6.7-2.9mmEye Relief: 2.55\"Click value: 1/4", "text": "BARSKA 3-7x20 Rimfire Riflescope This scope will keep you on target. BARSKA’s Rimfire scope is designed specifically for small bore rifles. Calibrated parallax-free at 50 yards for shorter rimfire ranges. Featuring coated optics and a 30/30 reticle, ideal for competitive and recreational target shooting, small game or varmint-type hunting. Standard 3/8” rings are included.Specifications:Magnification: 3-7xField of View (ft@100yds/m@100m): 21/7@3x-10/3.3@7xExit Pupil: 6.7-2.9mmEye Relief: 2.55\"Click value: 1/4", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gre8qBANL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCI06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001JJCI5Q", "title": "BARSKA Accu Grip Handheld Tripod System", "description": "The Barska Accu Grip Handheld Tripod System is a convenient way to shoot stable pictures with your camera. Now you won't have to take another blurry shot. Easily mounted to any camera, the handheld tripod system's non-slip finish provides a sturdy grip along with a greater range of motion. The Accu Grip can be mounted to a tripod for additional extension and grip. It is even compatible with spotting scopes and binoculars that are tripod adaptable.", "text": "BARSKA Accu Grip Handheld Tripod System The Barska Accu Grip Handheld Tripod System is a convenient way to shoot stable pictures with your camera. Now you won't have to take another blurry shot. Easily mounted to any camera, the handheld tripod system's non-slip finish provides a sturdy grip along with a greater range of motion. The Accu Grip can be mounted to a tripod for additional extension and grip. It is even compatible with spotting scopes and binoculars that are tripod adaptable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cI4QHQZDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JJCI5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 18.96}}
{"item_id": "B001JKWHJC", "title": "Spyderco Native Lightweight Plain Edge Knife, Pink", "description": "Spyderco’s Native Lightweight folder is manufactured right here in the U.S. and combines exceptional ergonomics and a premium CPM®-S30V blade steel for an outstanding value. Its textured fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle provides a positive grip, while its back-lock mechanism and David Boye dent ensure positive blade lock-up. An ambidextrous stainless steel clip support left or right-side tip-up carry. Spyderco is a proud supporter of the Breast Cancer Network of Strength™, and a portion of the sales of this highly collectible pink-handled version of the Native are donated to support this worthy organization. Spyderco extends its sincere appreciation for your purchase and support of the Breast Cancer Network of Strength™.", "text": "Spyderco Native Lightweight Plain Edge Knife, Pink Spyderco’s Native Lightweight folder is manufactured right here in the U.S. and combines exceptional ergonomics and a premium CPM®-S30V blade steel for an outstanding value. Its textured fiberglass-reinforced-nylon (FRN) handle provides a positive grip, while its back-lock mechanism and David Boye dent ensure positive blade lock-up. An ambidextrous stainless steel clip support left or right-side tip-up carry. Spyderco is a proud supporter of the Breast Cancer Network of Strength™, and a portion of the sales of this highly collectible pink-handled version of the Native are donated to support this worthy organization. Spyderco extends its sincere appreciation for your purchase and support of the Breast Cancer Network of Strength™.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G0wUEVMLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JKWHJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 77.79}}
{"item_id": "B001JKY8XU", "title": "Wiley X - BRICK Tactical Sunglasses", "description": "These Wiley X Bricksunglasses have double injected rubber temple tips combined with Facial Cavity™ Seal which provide excellent comfort. The climate Control™ System features removable, durable, symmetrically vented foam gaskets which lock into the Brick series lightweight ANSI certified frames.Features:Filter 8™ polarized lenses combine eight layers of lens technology, two Slick™ clear optical coatings, two Selenite™ polycarbonate lenses, two T-Shell™ scratch-resistant layers, one Violet 4™ anti-reflective coating and a Filter 8™ polarized film layer that creates 99.9% polarization with 100% UV protection.Shatterproof Selenite™polycarbonate lenses. are made from one of the world's most impact resistant lens materials (trust us, we've scoured the globe for durable lens ideas). They far exceed ANSI Z87.1 safety and ANSI Z80.3 optical standards.Aerodynamic frame cuts wind with or without cavity seal™.Patented removable Facial Cavity™seal blocks out top & side light, wind and debris providing excellent comfort, protecting the eyes and allowing polarized lenses to perform at peak levels.Extended orbital design allows for better peripheral vision.Neoprene ear socks grip as you perspire.Frame:Fits Head Size: M - LFrame protects eyes from wind, sun, glare, fragmentation.All Wiley X frames easily surpass the ANSI Z87.1-2003 standard for flammability. Under an open flame, frames must burn at less than 3 minutes per inch. It only takes one horrific accident to appreciate this standard.Frame provides 90 degree wrap-back, eliminating tunnel vision.Includes:Removable Facial Cavity Seal (855G)Medium Black Zippered Case (DM065L)T-Peg Elastic Strap (EH409-4)Leash Cord (EH-492-1)Cleaning Cloth (A425)", "text": "Wiley X - BRICK Tactical Sunglasses These Wiley X Bricksunglasses have double injected rubber temple tips combined with Facial Cavity™ Seal which provide excellent comfort. The climate Control™ System features removable, durable, symmetrically vented foam gaskets which lock into the Brick series lightweight ANSI certified frames.Features:Filter 8™ polarized lenses combine eight layers of lens technology, two Slick™ clear optical coatings, two Selenite™ polycarbonate lenses, two T-Shell™ scratch-resistant layers, one Violet 4™ anti-reflective coating and a Filter 8™ polarized film layer that creates 99.9% polarization with 100% UV protection.Shatterproof Selenite™polycarbonate lenses. are made from one of the world's most impact resistant lens materials (trust us, we've scoured the globe for durable lens ideas). They far exceed ANSI Z87.1 safety and ANSI Z80.3 optical standards.Aerodynamic frame cuts wind with or without cavity seal™.Patented removable Facial Cavity™seal blocks out top & side light, wind and debris providing excellent comfort, protecting the eyes and allowing polarized lenses to perform at peak levels.Extended orbital design allows for better peripheral vision.Neoprene ear socks grip as you perspire.Frame:Fits Head Size: M - LFrame protects eyes from wind, sun, glare, fragmentation.All Wiley X frames easily surpass the ANSI Z87.1-2003 standard for flammability. Under an open flame, frames must burn at less than 3 minutes per inch. It only takes one horrific accident to appreciate this standard.Frame provides 90 degree wrap-back, eliminating tunnel vision.Includes:Removable Facial Cavity Seal (855G)Medium Black Zippered Case (DM065L)T-Peg Elastic Strap (EH409-4)Leash Cord (EH-492-1)Cleaning Cloth (A425)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jbd-ayFSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001JKY8XU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wiley X", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 92.99}}
