{"item_id": "B001KE0MPS", "title": "XLAB Mezzo Tire Bag", "description": "Have you been using electrical tape for holding your spare tire or tubes? Problem solved. This tough bag can store a 700c x 22mm tubular, or a couple of tubes, and fits under the Xlab Carbon Wing, Flat Wing and Super Wing. Specs: Length 6.3\" Volume 53 cubic inches Weight 99 grams Available in: Black, Red or Pink.", "text": "XLAB Mezzo Tire Bag Have you been using electrical tape for holding your spare tire or tubes? Problem solved. This tough bag can store a 700c x 22mm tubular, or a couple of tubes, and fits under the Xlab Carbon Wing, Flat Wing and Super Wing. Specs: Length 6.3\" Volume 53 cubic inches Weight 99 grams Available in: Black, Red or Pink.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V9mvi8LEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KE0MPS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 20.66}}
