{"item_id": "B001KJDXAO", "title": "Speedo Air Seal Tri Swim Goggle", "description": "This Air Seal Tri Goggle is the most comfortable and functional open water goggle around! It is 100% PVC free so friendly to the environment and offers Anti-Fog and UV protection for the outdoor swimmer who is looking for a larger fitting goggle and enhanced peripheral vision of a curved lens. The soft frame and air filled gasket make it extremely easy to wear while the quick adjustment of our trademarked SpeedFit headstrap makes it a snap to custom fit. You don't have to be a triathlete to appreciate this great goggle!", "text": "Speedo Air Seal Tri Swim Goggle This Air Seal Tri Goggle is the most comfortable and functional open water goggle around! It is 100% PVC free so friendly to the environment and offers Anti-Fog and UV protection for the outdoor swimmer who is looking for a larger fitting goggle and enhanced peripheral vision of a curved lens. The soft frame and air filled gasket make it extremely easy to wear while the quick adjustment of our trademarked SpeedFit headstrap makes it a snap to custom fit. You don't have to be a triathlete to appreciate this great goggle!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ndesTnjmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KJDXAO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B001KK6GNO", "title": "Kaito BT409 Anti-Shock Hiking Pole with 9-LED Flashlight", "description": "Made of strong lightweight aluminum, the newly released Kaito hiking pole BT409 is specially spring loaded to absorb shock and reduce stress to joints, muscles, and ligaments, whether you're strolling through the park or traversing more rugged trails. An easy-lock telescoping design offers an ergonomic EVA foam grip with hard plastic handle, which features a 90-degree rotatable 9-LED super-bright flashlight. A wearproof carbide tip is mounted at the end; Adjustable from 22 1/2''H up to an impressive four feet, the stick adapts to hikers of different heights. A pair of watch-band mini-compass and thermometer is mounted on the wrist strap. Also included are rubber tip for paved surfaces, snow disc and attachable nylon wrist strap. 10.80oz.", "text": "Kaito BT409 Anti-Shock Hiking Pole with 9-LED Flashlight Made of strong lightweight aluminum, the newly released Kaito hiking pole BT409 is specially spring loaded to absorb shock and reduce stress to joints, muscles, and ligaments, whether you're strolling through the park or traversing more rugged trails. An easy-lock telescoping design offers an ergonomic EVA foam grip with hard plastic handle, which features a 90-degree rotatable 9-LED super-bright flashlight. A wearproof carbide tip is mounted at the end; Adjustable from 22 1/2''H up to an impressive four feet, the stick adapts to hikers of different heights. A pair of watch-band mini-compass and thermometer is mounted on the wrist strap. Also included are rubber tip for paved surfaces, snow disc and attachable nylon wrist strap. 10.80oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W1FE-AjXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KK6GNO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]]}}
