{"item_id": "B001KMUZR0", "title": "Light My Fire Grandpas FireFork Campfire Roasting Accessory - Set of 4", "description": "Grandpa's Fire-fork attaches firmly to practically any stick, to grill marshmallows, hot dogs or just about anything else. Comes with a classic Light My Fire safety cap for easy and secure storage. Made of stainless steel wire to last and last.", "text": "Light My Fire Grandpas FireFork Campfire Roasting Accessory - Set of 4 Grandpa's Fire-fork attaches firmly to practically any stick, to grill marshmallows, hot dogs or just about anything else. Comes with a classic Light My Fire safety cap for easy and secure storage. Made of stainless steel wire to last and last.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418XX1bH5mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KMUZR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 14.43}}
{"item_id": "B001KN317A", "title": "Desert Eagle .44 Magnum Softair Pistol", "description": "The licensed Desert Eagle 0.44 Magnum spring-operated softair pistol is perfect for target practice and/or as a softair side arm. The gun features an adjustable BAXS system and has a velocity of +/-175 feet per second. Weighing in at one pound overall, the pistol as a 25-round magazine. Additional magazines can be purchased separately (Item #48101).", "text": "Desert Eagle .44 Magnum Softair Pistol The licensed Desert Eagle 0.44 Magnum spring-operated softair pistol is perfect for target practice and/or as a softair side arm. The gun features an adjustable BAXS system and has a velocity of +/-175 feet per second. Weighing in at one pound overall, the pistol as a 25-round magazine. Additional magazines can be purchased separately (Item #48101).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CUbsoKq5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN317A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Desert Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001KN318E", "title": "Soft Air Desert Eagle .44 Magnum Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol (Silver)", "description": "The Desert Eagle comes with magazine and practice rounds.An affordable, durable airsoft pistol that offers a realistic replica feel and surprisingly accurate firing, the Soft Air Desert Eagle is a fun plinking and target shooting gun. The spring-powered, 25-round pistol has a proprietary BAXS Accuracy System, and is capable of hitting a quarter from a distance of 25 feet, with the right sharpshooter pulling the trigger. Capable of muzzle velocities up to an impressive 240-feet-per-second (FPS), the Desert Eagle comes complete with magazine and practice rounds.SpecificationsSpring-powered pistol with BAXS Accuracy SystemCapable of hitting a quarter from 25 feet awayMuzzle velocities up to 240 FPS25-round capacityOne-pound weight", "text": "Soft Air Desert Eagle .44 Magnum Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol (Silver) The Desert Eagle comes with magazine and practice rounds.An affordable, durable airsoft pistol that offers a realistic replica feel and surprisingly accurate firing, the Soft Air Desert Eagle is a fun plinking and target shooting gun. The spring-powered, 25-round pistol has a proprietary BAXS Accuracy System, and is capable of hitting a quarter from a distance of 25 feet, with the right sharpshooter pulling the trigger. Capable of muzzle velocities up to an impressive 240-feet-per-second (FPS), the Desert Eagle comes complete with magazine and practice rounds.SpecificationsSpring-powered pistol with BAXS Accuracy SystemCapable of hitting a quarter from 25 feet awayMuzzle velocities up to 240 FPS25-round capacityOne-pound weight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ynimniSyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN318E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Desert Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 14.13}}
{"item_id": "B001KN318O", "title": "Soft Air Colt 1911 6-Inch Target Model Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol with Laser (Clear)", "description": "The Colt 1911 Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol shoots BBs at up to 210 feet per second with enough accuracy to hit a quarter-sized target that is 18 feet away. The pistol is equipped with a laser to add to the fun of target practice.", "text": "Soft Air Colt 1911 6-Inch Target Model Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol with Laser (Clear) The Colt 1911 Spring Powered Airsoft Pistol shoots BBs at up to 210 feet per second with enough accuracy to hit a quarter-sized target that is 18 feet away. The pistol is equipped with a laser to add to the fun of target practice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PCgt78iwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN318O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 15.99}}
