{"item_id": "B001KN31GG", "title": "Soft Air Famas Foreign Legion AEG Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle", "description": "Not your run-of-the-mill carbine, the Famas Foreign Legion AEG airsoft rifle is so unique that it's been featured in theCall of Dutyvideo game series, including the most recent edition ofBlack Ops. The officially licensed AEG features a bull-pup design, allowing for maximum barrel length and accuracy, yet still maintains an efficient footprint for close-quarters combat maneuvers. In fact, the Famas Foreign Legion AEG can hit a quarter from 45 feet. Other features include an adjustable BAX shooting system, a Generation 3 ultra-high-torque motor, a full metal barrel assembly, an adjustable bi-pod, and an 8-volt battery with a wall charger.SpecificationsMag capacity: 300 roundsVelocity: 350 to 400 feet per second (0.2-gram BBs)Firing rate: 750 to 850 rounds per minutePower: Electric", "text": "Soft Air Famas Foreign Legion AEG Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle Not your run-of-the-mill carbine, the Famas Foreign Legion AEG airsoft rifle is so unique that it's been featured in theCall of Dutyvideo game series, including the most recent edition ofBlack Ops. The officially licensed AEG features a bull-pup design, allowing for maximum barrel length and accuracy, yet still maintains an efficient footprint for close-quarters combat maneuvers. In fact, the Famas Foreign Legion AEG can hit a quarter from 45 feet. Other features include an adjustable BAX shooting system, a Generation 3 ultra-high-torque motor, a full metal barrel assembly, an adjustable bi-pod, and an 8-volt battery with a wall charger.SpecificationsMag capacity: 300 roundsVelocity: 350 to 400 feet per second (0.2-gram BBs)Firing rate: 750 to 850 rounds per minutePower: Electric", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EtQCqCaCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN31GG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FAMAS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 118.4}}
{"item_id": "B001KN31HK", "title": "Soft Air Kalishnikov Tactical AK47 Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle", "description": "The SoftAir Kalishnikov Tactical AK47 Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle is an affordable way to gain a tremendous advantage during your practice sessions. The fully-automatic rifle is capable of firing up to 600 rounds per minute and can obtain velocities of up to 475 feet per second. You can fire off a large number of rounds one after another with impressive accuracy. You'll be able to hit a target the size of a quarter from up to forty feet away. This electric-powered rifle is suited for shooters of all skill levels.", "text": "Soft Air Kalishnikov Tactical AK47 Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle The SoftAir Kalishnikov Tactical AK47 Electric Powered Airsoft Rifle is an affordable way to gain a tremendous advantage during your practice sessions. The fully-automatic rifle is capable of firing up to 600 rounds per minute and can obtain velocities of up to 475 feet per second. You can fire off a large number of rounds one after another with impressive accuracy. You'll be able to hit a target the size of a quarter from up to forty feet away. This electric-powered rifle is suited for shooters of all skill levels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q%2BFKqIu0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN31HK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KALASHNIKOV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 150.11}}
{"item_id": "B001KN31JS", "title": "Soft Air Sig Sauer SP2022 CO2 Gas Powered Airsoft Pistol (Black)", "description": "Hit a quarter from 25 feet away with the Sig Sauer SP2022 CO2-powered airsoft pistol. The SP2022 is equipped with a Ballistic Accuracy Extreme System (BAXS), which improves your accuracy with every shot. The pistol is also more powerful than most BB guns thanks to the CO2 propulsion. Features include a 15-round mag, a velocity of 380 feet per second, a notched blade front sight, and laser compatibility (sold separately).SpecificationsPower: CO2Velocity: 380 feet per second (with 0.2-gram BBs)Mag capacity: 15 roundsWeight: 3 pounds", "text": "Soft Air Sig Sauer SP2022 CO2 Gas Powered Airsoft Pistol (Black) Hit a quarter from 25 feet away with the Sig Sauer SP2022 CO2-powered airsoft pistol. The SP2022 is equipped with a Ballistic Accuracy Extreme System (BAXS), which improves your accuracy with every shot. The pistol is also more powerful than most BB guns thanks to the CO2 propulsion. Features include a 15-round mag, a velocity of 380 feet per second, a notched blade front sight, and laser compatibility (sold separately).SpecificationsPower: CO2Velocity: 380 feet per second (with 0.2-gram BBs)Mag capacity: 15 roundsWeight: 3 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U%2Bt7y5IbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN31JS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Soft Air", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 31.49}}
