{"item_id": "B001KN32AQ", "title": "Soft Air Swiss Arms 4x32 rifle scope with weaver/picatinny rings", "description": "The SoftAir Swiss Arms 4x32mm Airsoft Scope is ideal for all your long-range shooting outings. The full-size, adjustable objective scope provides up to fourx magnification. Compatible with most Airsoft air guns, it comes equipped with a standard 1-inch/25.44mm rail interface system. It's also adjustable for windage and varying elevation so it's precise no matter the terrain or altitude. AccuShot tactical rings, flip-open lens covers, and sunshade are included.", "text": "Soft Air Swiss Arms 4x32 rifle scope with weaver/picatinny rings The SoftAir Swiss Arms 4x32mm Airsoft Scope is ideal for all your long-range shooting outings. The full-size, adjustable objective scope provides up to fourx magnification. Compatible with most Airsoft air guns, it comes equipped with a standard 1-inch/25.44mm rail interface system. It's also adjustable for windage and varying elevation so it's precise no matter the terrain or altitude. AccuShot tactical rings, flip-open lens covers, and sunshade are included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413D5IY1s7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KN32AQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swiss Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 26.99}}
