{"item_id": "B001KNO0UC", "title": "Galaxy G5 MP5 PDW Airsoft Electric Gun", "description": "The real steel MP5 is a 9 mm submachine gun of German design. The MP5K-PDW is the Personal Defense Weapon variant. It sports a folding stock and 3-lug/threaded barrel for mounting of suppressors. It was introduced in 1991. It is very popular with special ops and law enforcement use.The Chinese Airsoft company Galaxy, has produced a top quality TM clone similar to the MP5 PDW. It’s solid construction and accurate rate of fire make it a formidable PDW style weapon on the Airsoft Playfield.Mil Specs:Solid ABS Plastic ConstructionMetal Gearbox, Ver 3Brass barrelFPS: 310+ FPS with 0.20g BBRate of Fire: 12 Rounds Per SecondAdjustable hop-up8.4v 1100mAh Stick Battery and charger1 Hi-Cap 240 round metal magazine1 Standard 24 round magazineFolding stock3-Lug flash hidermetal sling hooksFull and semi-automatic firing modeBuilt in vertical grip and PDW flashhiderAdjustable rear sight.TM CompatibleWeight unloaded: 4lbs 6ozLength (extended): 25\"Length (folded): 16\"Height: 8.25\"Package Includes: AEG, Battery, 110v charger, sling, Starter BBs, BB loader, two magazines, and manual", "text": "Galaxy G5 MP5 PDW Airsoft Electric Gun The real steel MP5 is a 9 mm submachine gun of German design. The MP5K-PDW is the Personal Defense Weapon variant. It sports a folding stock and 3-lug/threaded barrel for mounting of suppressors. It was introduced in 1991. It is very popular with special ops and law enforcement use.The Chinese Airsoft company Galaxy, has produced a top quality TM clone similar to the MP5 PDW. It’s solid construction and accurate rate of fire make it a formidable PDW style weapon on the Airsoft Playfield.Mil Specs:Solid ABS Plastic ConstructionMetal Gearbox, Ver 3Brass barrelFPS: 310+ FPS with 0.20g BBRate of Fire: 12 Rounds Per SecondAdjustable hop-up8.4v 1100mAh Stick Battery and charger1 Hi-Cap 240 round metal magazine1 Standard 24 round magazineFolding stock3-Lug flash hidermetal sling hooksFull and semi-automatic firing modeBuilt in vertical grip and PDW flashhiderAdjustable rear sight.TM CompatibleWeight unloaded: 4lbs 6ozLength (extended): 25\"Length (folded): 16\"Height: 8.25\"Package Includes: AEG, Battery, 110v charger, sling, Starter BBs, BB loader, two magazines, and manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411B%2B0CXxUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KNO0UC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galaxy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 90.0}}
