{"item_id": "B001KYFIA2", "title": "Saranac b-grl Women's just4me Fitness Gloves", "description": "b-grl just4me fitness glove is designed specifically for women. Constructed of ultra lightweight yet durable materials to ease hand fatigue. Soft to the touch durable amara suede palm with thin coat dense gel palm pads for repetitive wear relief. Absorbent terry fabric thumb for moisture wipe. Expansion 1/2 finger joints for ease of removal. Reflex inset thumb improves range and flex. Soft sided, non-binding wrist wrap closure for a comfortable fit. A percentage of the b-grl proceeds will be donated to breast cancer research. A commitment to a cure!", "text": "Saranac b-grl Women's just4me Fitness Gloves b-grl just4me fitness glove is designed specifically for women. Constructed of ultra lightweight yet durable materials to ease hand fatigue. Soft to the touch durable amara suede palm with thin coat dense gel palm pads for repetitive wear relief. Absorbent terry fabric thumb for moisture wipe. Expansion 1/2 finger joints for ease of removal. Reflex inset thumb improves range and flex. Soft sided, non-binding wrist wrap closure for a comfortable fit. A percentage of the b-grl proceeds will be donated to breast cancer research. A commitment to a cure!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QRmQuwO-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KYFIA2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001KZ3NNK", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Ammo Concentricity Gauge", "description": "Hornady never ceases to find ways to provide unmatched accuracy in every facet of the shooting experience. The new Ammunition Concentricity Gauge is the first tool on the market to both identify and eliminate bullet runout. Just place ammunition in the tool, roll it, identify runout, and use the dial indicator to adjust runout to zero. It can be used to true-up factory ammuition as well.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Ammo Concentricity Gauge Hornady never ceases to find ways to provide unmatched accuracy in every facet of the shooting experience. The new Ammunition Concentricity Gauge is the first tool on the market to both identify and eliminate bullet runout. Just place ammunition in the tool, roll it, identify runout, and use the dial indicator to adjust runout to zero. It can be used to true-up factory ammuition as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vge1qmT1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KZ3NNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B001KZGYL8", "title": "Platypus Big Zip SL Hands-Free Hydration System", "description": "FEATURES of the Platypus Big Zip SL Hydration System Secure, easy, wide-opening SlideLock closure Taste-and BPA-free Tough, dual-layer construction Slime Guard antimicrobial treatment Quick-Release Hose 90° Shutoff valve Two-piece, easy-clean HyperFlow bite valve The SPECS 1.8 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 60 oz / 1.8 liter The SPECS for 2.0 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 70 oz / 2.0 liter The SPECS for 3.0 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 100 oz / 3.0 liter", "text": "Platypus Big Zip SL Hands-Free Hydration System FEATURES of the Platypus Big Zip SL Hydration System Secure, easy, wide-opening SlideLock closure Taste-and BPA-free Tough, dual-layer construction Slime Guard antimicrobial treatment Quick-Release Hose 90° Shutoff valve Two-piece, easy-clean HyperFlow bite valve The SPECS 1.8 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 60 oz / 1.8 liter The SPECS for 2.0 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 70 oz / 2.0 liter The SPECS for 3.0 liter Dimension: 7.25 x 14.75\" / 18.5 x 37.5 cm Weight: 100 oz / 3.0 liter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Md8i-4m1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KZGYL8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001KZGYM2", "title": "Platypus Bite Valve Cover", "description": "The molded Bite Valve Cover by Platypus is designed to fit the HyperFlow Bite Valve to keep it clean, insulated, and ready to use.", "text": "Platypus Bite Valve Cover The molded Bite Valve Cover by Platypus is designed to fit the HyperFlow Bite Valve to keep it clean, insulated, and ready to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VG4BW7HnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KZGYM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Platypus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories", "Reservoirs"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B001KZRFQQ", "title": "MARK III QUICK REL 4X32 SCOPE", "description": "No matter which power level is right for you, NcSTAR Mark III Quick - Release Tactical Scopes drive it home! The new \"Marks\" of distinction! Mark III Tactical Targeting Optics from NcSTAR deliver pro-grade performance at prices you won't believe! Choose your magnification level and get ready to split hairs. All feature open-target turrets, fully multi-coated lenses, quick-focus eyepieces, variable-brightness red / green reticles, drop compensation and built-in sunshades. Each benefits from integrated quick-release and is compatible with all Weaver style rails. Scope it out: Mil-dot reticles; 1/2 M.O.A. click value; Matte black finished housings; Green-coated lenses; Quick-release mounts. 4X magnification; 32 mm objective diam.; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 27 3/10'; 8 mm exit pupil; 3\" eye relief. 6 2/3\" long, 14 7/10 ozs. Order today! WARNING: Gun Products cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Gun Products. Mark III Quick-Release 4x32 Tactical Scope", "text": "MARK III QUICK REL 4X32 SCOPE No matter which power level is right for you, NcSTAR Mark III Quick - Release Tactical Scopes drive it home! The new \"Marks\" of distinction! Mark III Tactical Targeting Optics from NcSTAR deliver pro-grade performance at prices you won't believe! Choose your magnification level and get ready to split hairs. All feature open-target turrets, fully multi-coated lenses, quick-focus eyepieces, variable-brightness red / green reticles, drop compensation and built-in sunshades. Each benefits from integrated quick-release and is compatible with all Weaver style rails. Scope it out: Mil-dot reticles; 1/2 M.O.A. click value; Matte black finished housings; Green-coated lenses; Quick-release mounts. 4X magnification; 32 mm objective diam.; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 27 3/10'; 8 mm exit pupil; 3\" eye relief. 6 2/3\" long, 14 7/10 ozs. Order today! WARNING: Gun Products cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Gun Products. Mark III Quick-Release 4x32 Tactical Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FL-pd9OsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KZRFQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001KZVABC", "title": "Troy Industries Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight", "description": "Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight. Easy to install for low - light shooting! You won't find a more durable, reliable sight for your money! This easy-to-install rear sight is a tough-as-nails, stripped-down version for no-nonsense shooting under pressure. No levers or springs to fumble with so deployment in the heat of battle won't give you trouble. Simply press the release button to fold down into locked position. Features rugged aircraft aluminum and stainless steel construction for long-lasting field use. Dead-center shot: Has zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers; Each click is 1/2 M.O.A; No tools required for adjustment; State Color. Pick yours up now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight", "text": "Troy Industries Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight. Easy to install for low - light shooting! You won't find a more durable, reliable sight for your money! This easy-to-install rear sight is a tough-as-nails, stripped-down version for no-nonsense shooting under pressure. No levers or springs to fumble with so deployment in the heat of battle won't give you trouble. Simply press the release button to fold down into locked position. Features rugged aircraft aluminum and stainless steel construction for long-lasting field use. Dead-center shot: Has zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers; Each click is 1/2 M.O.A; No tools required for adjustment; State Color. Pick yours up now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding HK Style Battle Sight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419w72-Z2EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001KZVABC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 81.36}}
