{"item_id": "B001L7UTS4", "title": "ATN MK350 Guardian Gen 1+ 2.5x Magnification Night Vision Rifle Scope", "description": "The ATN Aries MK 350 is an extremely compact 1st Generation Weapon Sight. Measuring only 10.8 inches long and weighing 2.9 pounds, the ATN Aries MK 350 is one of the most rugged yet Compact Scopes made. The accuracy on the ATN Aries MK 350 is unparalleled thanks to a proprietary \"red on green\" reticle system. Windage and elevation adjustments are an amazing 1/4 inch at 100 yards. Combine this accuracy with other features such as a super fast Front Lens System for optimal brightness, easy push button operation, reticle brightness adjustment, our detachable most powerful in the industry 450 mW Infrared Illuminator and you have one of the best 1st Gen. Scopes made. If you are looking for a small, lightweight inexpensive Night Vision Weapon Sight, the ATN Aries MK 350 is a solid choice. The ATN Aries MK 350 Weapon Scope easily mounts onto any U.S. standard 7/8-inch weaver or Picatinny rail.Features:Powerful multi-coated all-glass opticsHigh resolution Gen 1+ Image Intensifier tubeEasy-to-see \"red on green\" reticle systemReticle brightness adjustmentDetachable Long Range infrared illuminatorWater and fog resistantLimited two-year warrantyImportant Export RestrictionsCommodities, products, technologies and services listed herein are subject to one or more export control laws and regulations of the US Government and fall under the jurisdiction of either the US Department of State or the US BIS-Department of Commerce. It is unlawful and strictly prohibited to export, or attempt to export or otherwise transfer or sell any hardware of technical data or furnish any service to any foreign person, whether abroad or in the United States, for which a license or written approval of the US Government is required, without first obtaining the required license or written approval from the US Government department having jurisdiction. By receipt of the above commodities, the entity listed in the \"Ship-To\" assumes all legal responsibilities. Diversion contrary to US law is prohibited.", "text": "ATN MK350 Guardian Gen 1+ 2.5x Magnification Night Vision Rifle Scope The ATN Aries MK 350 is an extremely compact 1st Generation Weapon Sight. Measuring only 10.8 inches long and weighing 2.9 pounds, the ATN Aries MK 350 is one of the most rugged yet Compact Scopes made. The accuracy on the ATN Aries MK 350 is unparalleled thanks to a proprietary \"red on green\" reticle system. Windage and elevation adjustments are an amazing 1/4 inch at 100 yards. Combine this accuracy with other features such as a super fast Front Lens System for optimal brightness, easy push button operation, reticle brightness adjustment, our detachable most powerful in the industry 450 mW Infrared Illuminator and you have one of the best 1st Gen. Scopes made. If you are looking for a small, lightweight inexpensive Night Vision Weapon Sight, the ATN Aries MK 350 is a solid choice. The ATN Aries MK 350 Weapon Scope easily mounts onto any U.S. standard 7/8-inch weaver or Picatinny rail.Features:Powerful multi-coated all-glass opticsHigh resolution Gen 1+ Image Intensifier tubeEasy-to-see \"red on green\" reticle systemReticle brightness adjustmentDetachable Long Range infrared illuminatorWater and fog resistantLimited two-year warrantyImportant Export RestrictionsCommodities, products, technologies and services listed herein are subject to one or more export control laws and regulations of the US Government and fall under the jurisdiction of either the US Department of State or the US BIS-Department of Commerce. It is unlawful and strictly prohibited to export, or attempt to export or otherwise transfer or sell any hardware of technical data or furnish any service to any foreign person, whether abroad or in the United States, for which a license or written approval of the US Government is required, without first obtaining the required license or written approval from the US Government department having jurisdiction. By receipt of the above commodities, the entity listed in the \"Ship-To\" assumes all legal responsibilities. Diversion contrary to US law is prohibited.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G6%2Bq3Gn%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001L7UTS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ATN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 352.5}}
{"item_id": "B001L8N5H0", "title": "Guyot Designs Backpacker Stainless Steel Bottle, 32-Ounce", "description": "This stainless steel bottle from Guyot Designs features a BPA-free body, making for risk-free drinking on the go. The wide mouth is practical and gives you generous drinking power. Great for camping, hiking, sports, or travel, this water bottle has a tapered design that allows for easy transport in full backpacks.", "text": "Guyot Designs Backpacker Stainless Steel Bottle, 32-Ounce This stainless steel bottle from Guyot Designs features a BPA-free body, making for risk-free drinking on the go. The wide mouth is practical and gives you generous drinking power. Great for camping, hiking, sports, or travel, this water bottle has a tapered design that allows for easy transport in full backpacks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QVDXvvx%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001L8N5H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guyot Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 17.0}}
