{"item_id": "B001LF3FQ4", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Lightweight Series Self-Inflating Air Pad", "description": "When you're away from home and want to add extra comfort to your cot or sleeping bag, try this ALPS Mountaineering self-inflating air pad. Par of the lightweight series, this pad inflates and deflates quickly with the jet stream foam and rolls up compactly to fit into the stuff sack. The top fabric is tough, lightweight ripstop and the bottom is made of durable polyester taffeta. Another benefit of adding an air pad is that it will help keep you warmer, which is essential to a well-rested night at the campsite. A stuff sack, compression straps, and repair kit are included with every pad.Features:Jet stream polyurethane open-cell foamFaster inflating and deflatingDiamond ripstop top fabricStrong and lightweightPolyester taffeta bottom fabricDurable and abrasion resistantNon-corrosive nylon valvesLong-term durabilityAdditional XL Features: Thicker pillow area, extra comfort, 2 valves and faster inflating", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Lightweight Series Self-Inflating Air Pad When you're away from home and want to add extra comfort to your cot or sleeping bag, try this ALPS Mountaineering self-inflating air pad. Par of the lightweight series, this pad inflates and deflates quickly with the jet stream foam and rolls up compactly to fit into the stuff sack. The top fabric is tough, lightweight ripstop and the bottom is made of durable polyester taffeta. Another benefit of adding an air pad is that it will help keep you warmer, which is essential to a well-rested night at the campsite. A stuff sack, compression straps, and repair kit are included with every pad.Features:Jet stream polyurethane open-cell foamFaster inflating and deflatingDiamond ripstop top fabricStrong and lightweightPolyester taffeta bottom fabricDurable and abrasion resistantNon-corrosive nylon valvesLong-term durabilityAdditional XL Features: Thicker pillow area, extra comfort, 2 valves and faster inflating", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ioiUUffGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3FQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3G7M", "title": "Alps Mountaineering Lightweight Cot", "description": "The Alps Mountaineering Lightweight Cot offers a compactable and easy way to carry and store this cot. It has a durable steel frame with a 250 lbs weight capacity and is made with a strong 600D Polyester Fabric. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253079, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 422037, GTIN: 0703438820102", "text": "Alps Mountaineering Lightweight Cot The Alps Mountaineering Lightweight Cot offers a compactable and easy way to carry and store this cot. It has a durable steel frame with a 250 lbs weight capacity and is made with a strong 600D Polyester Fabric. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253079, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 422037, GTIN: 0703438820102", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31k61q%2ByfTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3G7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3HYO", "title": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Backpacker", "description": "Enjoy a gourmet feast while camping in the great outdoors with the Bugaboo Backpacker outdoor cookware set. The Bugaboo Backpacker--which stacks conveniently and stores in a welded stuff sack--is fully equipped for the needs of two gourmet backpackers.The welded stuff sack doubles as a wash basin for easy cleaning.The set starts with two pieces of traditional cookware: a 2-liter pot and an 8-inch frypan, both made using Bugaboo technology. Made of high-quality aluminum, Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The pot and frypan also share a lid with a built-in strainer and a folding gripper that locks on to the sides to provide a secure handle while cooking.The tableware steps up when it's time to eat, with two 14-ounce insulated mugs and two 14-ounce bowls. The tableware is made of GSI Outdoors' lightweight, flexible Cascadian material, a chemically inert, BPA-free polypropylene design that remains resilient when exposed to both hot and cold temperatures. Moreover, Cascadian pieces won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. As a bonus, the tableware comes with two Sip-It lids to virtually eliminate spills when you're drinking coffee or soda.The Bugaboo Backpacker's best trait, however, may be its stackable design. The pieces nest together gently and fit inside a rugged stuff sack. Not only does the sack make storage and transport easy, but it also doubles as a sink or washbasin in camp, so you can quickly clean your dishes without hassle.SpecificationsCooking capacity: Up to 2 peopleMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminum and polypropyleneProduct use: Gourmet backpackingDimensions: 8.2 by 5.4 by 8.2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 27.9 ouncesIn the box: 2-liter pot, strainer lid, 8-inch frypan, two 14-ounce insulated mugs, two 14-ounce bowls, two Sip-It lids, folding pot gripper, welded stuff sackAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Backpacker Enjoy a gourmet feast while camping in the great outdoors with the Bugaboo Backpacker outdoor cookware set. The Bugaboo Backpacker--which stacks conveniently and stores in a welded stuff sack--is fully equipped for the needs of two gourmet backpackers.The welded stuff sack doubles as a wash basin for easy cleaning.The set starts with two pieces of traditional cookware: a 2-liter pot and an 8-inch frypan, both made using Bugaboo technology. Made of high-quality aluminum, Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The pot and frypan also share a lid with a built-in strainer and a folding gripper that locks on to the sides to provide a secure handle while cooking.The tableware steps up when it's time to eat, with two 14-ounce insulated mugs and two 14-ounce bowls. The tableware is made of GSI Outdoors' lightweight, flexible Cascadian material, a chemically inert, BPA-free polypropylene design that remains resilient when exposed to both hot and cold temperatures. Moreover, Cascadian pieces won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. As a bonus, the tableware comes with two Sip-It lids to virtually eliminate spills when you're drinking coffee or soda.The Bugaboo Backpacker's best trait, however, may be its stackable design. The pieces nest together gently and fit inside a rugged stuff sack. Not only does the sack make storage and transport easy, but it also doubles as a sink or washbasin in camp, so you can quickly clean your dishes without hassle.SpecificationsCooking capacity: Up to 2 peopleMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminum and polypropyleneProduct use: Gourmet backpackingDimensions: 8.2 by 5.4 by 8.2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 27.9 ouncesIn the box: 2-liter pot, strainer lid, 8-inch frypan, two 14-ounce insulated mugs, two 14-ounce bowls, two Sip-It lids, folding pot gripper, welded stuff sackAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u6iPAGnOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3HYO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3HYY", "title": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Camper", "description": "Enjoy a gourmet feast while camping in the great outdoors with the Bugaboo Camper outdoor cookware set. The Bugaboo Camper set--which stacks conveniently and stores in a welded stuff sack--is reconfigurable for everything from two-person backpacking to four-person car camping.The tableware stacks up and nests inside the pots for easy carrying.The set starts with three pieces of traditional cookware: a 3-liter pot, a 2-liter pot, and a 9-inch frypan, all made using Bugaboo technology. Made of high-quality aluminum, Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The pots also include two lids with built-in strainers and a folding gripper that locks on to the pots to provide a secure handle while cooking.The color-coded tableware steps up when it's time to eat, with four 14-ounce insulated mugs, four 14-ounce bowls, and four 7.5-inch plates. The tableware is made of GSI Outdoors' lightweight, flexible Cascadian material, a chemically inert, BPA-free polypropylene design that remains resilient when exposed to both hot and cold temperatures. Moreover, Cascadian pieces won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. To keep you from spilling when drinking or sipping from the bowls, the set includes four Sip-It lids as well.The Bugaboo Camper's best trait, however, may be its stackable design. The pieces nest together gently and fit inside a rugged stuff sack. Not only does the sack make storage and transport easy, but it also doubles as a sink or washbasin in camp, so you can quickly clean your dishes without hassle.SpecificationsCooking capacity: Up to 4 peopleMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminum and polypropyleneProduct use: Car campingDimensions: 9.1 by 5.8 by 9.1 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 3 pounds 8 ouncesIn the box: 3-liter pot, 2-liter pot, two strainer lids, 9-inch frypan, four 14-ounce insulated mugs, four 14-ounce bowls, four 7.5-inch plates, four Sip-It lids, folding pot gripper, welded stuff sackAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Bugaboo Camper Enjoy a gourmet feast while camping in the great outdoors with the Bugaboo Camper outdoor cookware set. The Bugaboo Camper set--which stacks conveniently and stores in a welded stuff sack--is reconfigurable for everything from two-person backpacking to four-person car camping.The tableware stacks up and nests inside the pots for easy carrying.The set starts with three pieces of traditional cookware: a 3-liter pot, a 2-liter pot, and a 9-inch frypan, all made using Bugaboo technology. Made of high-quality aluminum, Bugaboo pots and pans are light enough for backpacking, yet heat evenly enough to satisfy the most demanding camp cook. Plus, each piece is fully formed and then coated with two layers of durable nonstick coating for added scratch-resistance. The pots also include two lids with built-in strainers and a folding gripper that locks on to the pots to provide a secure handle while cooking.The color-coded tableware steps up when it's time to eat, with four 14-ounce insulated mugs, four 14-ounce bowls, and four 7.5-inch plates. The tableware is made of GSI Outdoors' lightweight, flexible Cascadian material, a chemically inert, BPA-free polypropylene design that remains resilient when exposed to both hot and cold temperatures. Moreover, Cascadian pieces won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. To keep you from spilling when drinking or sipping from the bowls, the set includes four Sip-It lids as well.The Bugaboo Camper's best trait, however, may be its stackable design. The pieces nest together gently and fit inside a rugged stuff sack. Not only does the sack make storage and transport easy, but it also doubles as a sink or washbasin in camp, so you can quickly clean your dishes without hassle.SpecificationsCooking capacity: Up to 4 peopleMaterial: Nonstick coated aluminum and polypropyleneProduct use: Car campingDimensions: 9.1 by 5.8 by 9.1 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 3 pounds 8 ouncesIn the box: 3-liter pot, 2-liter pot, two strainer lids, 9-inch frypan, four 14-ounce insulated mugs, four 14-ounce bowls, four 7.5-inch plates, four Sip-It lids, folding pot gripper, welded stuff sackAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c9xx2DVVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3HYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I02", "title": "Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set", "description": "Go light with the Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set from GSI Outdoors. This cook set is the ultimate, integrated cooking and eating solution for the ultralight backpacker. PRODUCT FEATURES: Crushproof, dual-use, heat-resistant nylon lid will not deform in packs and serves as a Sip-It Lid or integrated strainer Convenient folding handle locks into place for cooking and secures entire set for transport, eliminating the need for a stuff sack Unique mug/bowl solution with low center of gravity and Sip-It virtually eliminates spills while the integrated insulating sleeve keeps your drinks hot Ingenious, welded stuff sack holds set while traveling and doubles as a sink or wash basin in camp 50146 , GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set , cook sets , pots , pans , backcountry cooking , camp cooking , backpacking , camping", "text": "Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set Go light with the Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set from GSI Outdoors. This cook set is the ultimate, integrated cooking and eating solution for the ultralight backpacker. PRODUCT FEATURES: Crushproof, dual-use, heat-resistant nylon lid will not deform in packs and serves as a Sip-It Lid or integrated strainer Convenient folding handle locks into place for cooking and secures entire set for transport, eliminating the need for a stuff sack Unique mug/bowl solution with low center of gravity and Sip-It virtually eliminates spills while the integrated insulating sleeve keeps your drinks hot Ingenious, welded stuff sack holds set while traveling and doubles as a sink or wash basin in camp 50146 , GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist Cook Set , cook sets , pots , pans , backcountry cooking , camp cooking , backpacking , camping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LacX2rRwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I0C", "title": "GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Dualist", "description": "A sturdy, welded carry case holds the entire set, and doubles as a wash basin in camp.The Dualist is a compact, two-person cooking system that includes a 1.8-liter pot made of lightweight Halulite material, a Lexan pot lid with integrated strainer, two 20-ounce insulated cups, two 20-ounce bowls, and two sip tops. The entire set weighs less than 21 ounces, and fits together in a convenient, welded carrying bag that doubles as a sink or wash basin.A folding handle locks into place for cooking, while also securing the entire set for transport to your next campsite. The crush-proof, BPA-free lid is made of a resin that prevents deformation. The unique bowl-and-mug solution, with low center of gravity and sip tops, virtually eliminates spills, which the integrated insulating sleeve keeps your beverages hot or cold.Features:Pinnacle Series Cookware:Teflon with Radiance technology has been tested and approved expressly for campware use. The secret lies in a specially-formulated topcoat, engineered to enhance heat dispersion and virtually eliminate hot spots. The three layer coating was built to survive the toughest conditions, and boasts an unprecedented level of scratch and abrasion resistance.Infinity:This ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-free alternative to polycarbonate resins offers exceptional clarity and 25% weight savings over traditional polycarbonate material. Infinity will not absorb food odors like other plastics, and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into food or beverages. Infinity pieces remain strong in both hot and cold, and are so light they actually remain buoyant when filled with water.Specifications:20.7-ounce weightMeasures 5.9-by-6.4-by-5.9-inches (W x H x D) packedNon-stick coated, hard anodized aluminum", "text": "GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Dualist A sturdy, welded carry case holds the entire set, and doubles as a wash basin in camp.The Dualist is a compact, two-person cooking system that includes a 1.8-liter pot made of lightweight Halulite material, a Lexan pot lid with integrated strainer, two 20-ounce insulated cups, two 20-ounce bowls, and two sip tops. The entire set weighs less than 21 ounces, and fits together in a convenient, welded carrying bag that doubles as a sink or wash basin.A folding handle locks into place for cooking, while also securing the entire set for transport to your next campsite. The crush-proof, BPA-free lid is made of a resin that prevents deformation. The unique bowl-and-mug solution, with low center of gravity and sip tops, virtually eliminates spills, which the integrated insulating sleeve keeps your beverages hot or cold.Features:Pinnacle Series Cookware:Teflon with Radiance technology has been tested and approved expressly for campware use. The secret lies in a specially-formulated topcoat, engineered to enhance heat dispersion and virtually eliminate hot spots. The three layer coating was built to survive the toughest conditions, and boasts an unprecedented level of scratch and abrasion resistance.Infinity:This ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-free alternative to polycarbonate resins offers exceptional clarity and 25% weight savings over traditional polycarbonate material. Infinity will not absorb food odors like other plastics, and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into food or beverages. Infinity pieces remain strong in both hot and cold, and are so light they actually remain buoyant when filled with water.Specifications:20.7-ounce weightMeasures 5.9-by-6.4-by-5.9-inches (W x H x D) packedNon-stick coated, hard anodized aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vitQfN5QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I0C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I2K", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glaicer Stainless Percolator with Silicone Handle, 12 Cup", "description": "Make coffee at the campsite without waiting for the pour-over cone to come your way with the Glacier 12-cup percolator. The percolator is made of heavy-gauge, 18/8 stainless steel, with an ultra-rugged design that stands up to rough handling and ground impacts. To make coffee, just add ground coffee to the filter basket and put the water-filled percolator on a heat source, such as a propane grill or fire grate. It's easy to check your brew's progress thanks to the PercView dome on the top, which is made of clear BPA-free Lexan resin. And you don't need a potholder to lift the percolator, as the unit's heat-resistant silicone handle stays cool to the touch. The Glacier Stainless percolator is even dishwasher-safe, with marine-grade, corrosion-resistant stainless componentry and welds.SpecificationsCapacity: 12 cupsMaterial: Stainless steelProduct use: Destination campingDimensions: 9 by 8.6 by 5.9 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2 pounds 1 ounceAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glaicer Stainless Percolator with Silicone Handle, 12 Cup Make coffee at the campsite without waiting for the pour-over cone to come your way with the Glacier 12-cup percolator. The percolator is made of heavy-gauge, 18/8 stainless steel, with an ultra-rugged design that stands up to rough handling and ground impacts. To make coffee, just add ground coffee to the filter basket and put the water-filled percolator on a heat source, such as a propane grill or fire grate. It's easy to check your brew's progress thanks to the PercView dome on the top, which is made of clear BPA-free Lexan resin. And you don't need a potholder to lift the percolator, as the unit's heat-resistant silicone handle stays cool to the touch. The Glacier Stainless percolator is even dishwasher-safe, with marine-grade, corrosion-resistant stainless componentry and welds.SpecificationsCapacity: 12 cupsMaterial: Stainless steelProduct use: Destination campingDimensions: 9 by 8.6 by 5.9 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2 pounds 1 ounceAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HMlXBDEqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I3Y", "title": "GSI Outdoors Personal Java Press Coffee Maker", "description": "The Personal Java Press separate mug and carafe eliminates over-brewed, muddy coffee produced by most personal French Presses. Silicone ring plunger design virtually eliminates coffee ‘blow-by’ for the most flavorful, mud-free coffee. Nesting, insulated mug includes Sip-It Lid and is made of lightweight, shatter-resistant, BPA-Free Infinity clear polypropylene. Treeline insulating EVA sleeves on mug and carafe remove easily for cleaning.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Personal Java Press Coffee Maker The Personal Java Press separate mug and carafe eliminates over-brewed, muddy coffee produced by most personal French Presses. Silicone ring plunger design virtually eliminates coffee ‘blow-by’ for the most flavorful, mud-free coffee. Nesting, insulated mug includes Sip-It Lid and is made of lightweight, shatter-resistant, BPA-Free Infinity clear polypropylene. Treeline insulating EVA sleeves on mug and carafe remove easily for cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RMOyWOeTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I48", "title": "GSI Outdoors Java Press Coffee Maker", "description": "50 oz. french press coffee maker that is simple and portable. Crystal-clear, BPA-Free Carafe is lightweight and shatter-resistant allowing you to enjoy French Press coffee anywhere. Double-walled, insulated lid holds in temperature while brewing and serving. Silicone ring plunger design virtually eliminates coffee ‘blow-by’ for the most flavorful, mud-free coffee. Insulating EVA sleeve removes easily for cleaning.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Java Press Coffee Maker 50 oz. french press coffee maker that is simple and portable. Crystal-clear, BPA-Free Carafe is lightweight and shatter-resistant allowing you to enjoy French Press coffee anywhere. Double-walled, insulated lid holds in temperature while brewing and serving. Silicone ring plunger design virtually eliminates coffee ‘blow-by’ for the most flavorful, mud-free coffee. Insulating EVA sleeve removes easily for cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21n1nX24BFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I48.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I5W", "title": "GSI Outdoors Kitchen 23", "description": "Sure, there's no kitchen sink, but the Kitchen 23 includes just about every utensil you need to fix a meal in the great outdoors. This all-in-one, 23-piece kitchen set comes with a bunch of handy prep tools, including a Glacier Stainless whisk, a Glacier Stainless grater, a 9.5-by-6-inch cutting board, and two 2.3-ounce squeeze bottles that are ideally sized for your secret sauces. Serving your meals is easy thanks to the telescoping spoon and spatula, which break down for more efficient transport. The Kitchen 23 set keeps your salt and pepper safe and free of clumps thanks to the waterproof salt-and-pepper shaker, which is integrated into a single package for space-saving convenience. The set even includes a 12-piece silverware set for your meals, with four knives, four spoons, and four forks.And cleanup is a breeze thanks to the scrubby sponge and camp towel. No more cleaning up with your T-shirt or paper towels. The Kitchen 23 set stores inside an attractive carrying case made of closed-cell EVA foam.SpecificationsMaterials: Stainless steel, co-polyester, acetal, and EVA foamProduct use: Destination campingDimensions: 12 by 7.5 by 4.3 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2 pounds 4 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Kitchen 23 Sure, there's no kitchen sink, but the Kitchen 23 includes just about every utensil you need to fix a meal in the great outdoors. This all-in-one, 23-piece kitchen set comes with a bunch of handy prep tools, including a Glacier Stainless whisk, a Glacier Stainless grater, a 9.5-by-6-inch cutting board, and two 2.3-ounce squeeze bottles that are ideally sized for your secret sauces. Serving your meals is easy thanks to the telescoping spoon and spatula, which break down for more efficient transport. The Kitchen 23 set keeps your salt and pepper safe and free of clumps thanks to the waterproof salt-and-pepper shaker, which is integrated into a single package for space-saving convenience. The set even includes a 12-piece silverware set for your meals, with four knives, four spoons, and four forks.And cleanup is a breeze thanks to the scrubby sponge and camp towel. No more cleaning up with your T-shirt or paper towels. The Kitchen 23 set stores inside an attractive carrying case made of closed-cell EVA foam.SpecificationsMaterials: Stainless steel, co-polyester, acetal, and EVA foamProduct use: Destination campingDimensions: 12 by 7.5 by 4.3 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2 pounds 4 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BxuvguabL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I5W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 45.36}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I6G", "title": "GSI Outdoors Gourmet Backpack Kitchen Utensil Set", "description": "All-in-one kit for the backcountry gourmet.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Gourmet Backpack Kitchen Utensil Set All-in-one kit for the backcountry gourmet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416Cp9zNtIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I98", "title": "GSI Outdoors Infinity 4 Person Deluxe Table Set", "description": "Infinity is an ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-Free alternative to Polycarbonate resins. The GSI Infinity 4 Person Deluxe Table Set will not absorb food odors like other plastic containers and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into either food or beverage. Infinity pieces remain strong in both hot and cold and are so light that they actually remain buoyant when filled with water. Dishwasher safe and actually becomes more stain-resistant with every wash. Perfect for the family camping trip or backyard use.Jewel-like, color-coded items provide personalized tableware settings..Clean and green construction is non-leaching and 100% recyclable..Unique mugs include insulated EVA sleeves and Sip-It Lids to keep beverages hot and prevent spills..Bowls include sealable lids for easy storage of leftovers..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Infinity 4 Person Deluxe Table Set Infinity is an ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-Free alternative to Polycarbonate resins. The GSI Infinity 4 Person Deluxe Table Set will not absorb food odors like other plastic containers and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into either food or beverage. Infinity pieces remain strong in both hot and cold and are so light that they actually remain buoyant when filled with water. Dishwasher safe and actually becomes more stain-resistant with every wash. Perfect for the family camping trip or backyard use.Jewel-like, color-coded items provide personalized tableware settings..Clean and green construction is non-leaching and 100% recyclable..Unique mugs include insulated EVA sleeves and Sip-It Lids to keep beverages hot and prevent spills..Bowls include sealable lids for easy storage of leftovers..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ieO3R6bZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 49.98}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3I9S", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Steel Plate", "description": "If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on heating, Glacier Stainless is for you. The GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Plate is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last for years to come.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Steel Plate If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on heating, Glacier Stainless is for you. The GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Plate is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last for years to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BRSZYbMlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3I9S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Plates"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IA2", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Steel Bowl With Handle", "description": "If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on heating, Glacier Stainless is for you. The GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Bowl With Handle is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last for years to come.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Steel Bowl With Handle If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on heating, Glacier Stainless is for you. The GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Bowl With Handle is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last for years to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HVWoaU2OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Bowls"]], "price": 12.94}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IAM", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless 14 fl Oz Cup", "description": "Durable with great cosmetics they're quick cleaning perfect for camping and barbecues. Load 'em up with your favorite campfirerecipes.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless 14 fl Oz Cup Durable with great cosmetics they're quick cleaning perfect for camping and barbecues. Load 'em up with your favorite campfirerecipes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313FPffDhfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IB6", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Bottle Cup/Pot", "description": "Lightweight, ultra-rugged bottle cup/pot.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Bottle Cup/Pot Lightweight, ultra-rugged bottle cup/pot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318UlShGDjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 12.33}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IBG", "title": "GSI Outdoors Cascadian 1 Person Tableset", "description": "GSI Cascadian 1 - Person Table Set for easy outdoor eatin'! SAVE BIG! Virtually unbreakable and easy to clean! The Dinnerware is made from flexible, lightweight polypropylene for sturdiness and long life. The 3-Pc. Cutlery Set is made from 100% Lexan, making it almost impossible to break. Say goodbye to expensive disposable plastic silverware and flimsy paper plates... this Set is guaranteed to last. Get one for everyone in the family! Available in bold green or orange. More: Plate measures 9 1/2\" d.; Bowl measures 6\" d.; Cup holds 12 ozs.; Cutlery Set includes a fork, spoon, and knife; State Color. Get \"set\" for the coming RV season and get 1 for everybody! Order yours today! GSI Cascadian 1 Person Table Set", "text": "GSI Outdoors Cascadian 1 Person Tableset GSI Cascadian 1 - Person Table Set for easy outdoor eatin'! SAVE BIG! Virtually unbreakable and easy to clean! The Dinnerware is made from flexible, lightweight polypropylene for sturdiness and long life. The 3-Pc. Cutlery Set is made from 100% Lexan, making it almost impossible to break. Say goodbye to expensive disposable plastic silverware and flimsy paper plates... this Set is guaranteed to last. Get one for everyone in the family! Available in bold green or orange. More: Plate measures 9 1/2\" d.; Bowl measures 6\" d.; Cup holds 12 ozs.; Cutlery Set includes a fork, spoon, and knife; State Color. Get \"set\" for the coming RV season and get 1 for everybody! Order yours today! GSI Cascadian 1 Person Table Set", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d1ZSQuvWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IBG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3ICU", "title": "GSI Outdoors Ultralight Java Drip Coffee Maker", "description": "No more excuses. The diminutive, GSI Outdoors Ultralight Java Drip coffee maker means that even backpackers who pride themselves on traveling the lightest can enjoy fresh brewed coffee on the trail.Ultralight design weighs less than half an ounce..Ultra-compact design nests under a standard fuel cartridge..Enjoy bold, mud-free coffee thanks to sturdy legs which clip to nearly any mug and hold the drip cone above the already brewed coffee..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Ultralight Java Drip Coffee Maker No more excuses. The diminutive, GSI Outdoors Ultralight Java Drip coffee maker means that even backpackers who pride themselves on traveling the lightest can enjoy fresh brewed coffee on the trail.Ultralight design weighs less than half an ounce..Ultra-compact design nests under a standard fuel cartridge..Enjoy bold, mud-free coffee thanks to sturdy legs which clip to nearly any mug and hold the drip cone above the already brewed coffee..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315r%2BA1HhHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3ICU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IDY", "title": "GSI Outdoors JavaGrind", "description": "Every coffee fiend knows to get the best coffee, you have to grind fresh-roasted beans immediately before brewing. But electrical outlets can be hard to find in the great outdoors, which is why most campers bring pre-ground coffee to the campsite.The JavaGrind's nested design fits on top of most round coffee brewers.Now you can do away with stale coffee forever--even when the closest coffee shop is 50 miles away--with the JavaGrind adjustable hand-crank coffee grinder. The JavaGrind is a conical burr grinder, the best kind of grinder for fresh coffee. That's because conical burr grinders mill the coffee to a uniform size without excessive frictional heating, unlike blade-style grinders. With a burr grinder, you'll unlock all of the best flavors of your favorite Costa Rican, Kenyan, or Tanzanian as you awake on a crisp summer morning.The JavaGrind is easy to use: just place the beans in the ceramic chamber, lock the grinder on top of your coffee press or other round brewer, and crank the handle. Soon you'll have perfectly ground beans for whichever brewing method you prefer. Once you're done grinding, the JavaGrind's sturdy alloy handle nests and locks in place for easy packing. And the JavaGrind is easy to clean thanks to the locking cover and protective dust cap.SpecificationsMaterials: BPA-free co-polyesterProduct use: Car campingDimensions: 5.3 by 4 by 6.1 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 11.2 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "text": "GSI Outdoors JavaGrind Every coffee fiend knows to get the best coffee, you have to grind fresh-roasted beans immediately before brewing. But electrical outlets can be hard to find in the great outdoors, which is why most campers bring pre-ground coffee to the campsite.The JavaGrind's nested design fits on top of most round coffee brewers.Now you can do away with stale coffee forever--even when the closest coffee shop is 50 miles away--with the JavaGrind adjustable hand-crank coffee grinder. The JavaGrind is a conical burr grinder, the best kind of grinder for fresh coffee. That's because conical burr grinders mill the coffee to a uniform size without excessive frictional heating, unlike blade-style grinders. With a burr grinder, you'll unlock all of the best flavors of your favorite Costa Rican, Kenyan, or Tanzanian as you awake on a crisp summer morning.The JavaGrind is easy to use: just place the beans in the ceramic chamber, lock the grinder on top of your coffee press or other round brewer, and crank the handle. Soon you'll have perfectly ground beans for whichever brewing method you prefer. Once you're done grinding, the JavaGrind's sturdy alloy handle nests and locks in place for easy packing. And the JavaGrind is easy to clean thanks to the locking cover and protective dust cap.SpecificationsMaterials: BPA-free co-polyesterProduct use: Car campingDimensions: 5.3 by 4 by 6.1 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 11.2 ouncesAbout GSI OutdoorsGSI opened its doors in 1985, after a small group of British Columbian siblings made their way down the West Coast to San Diego. Beginning with a few pieces of blue enamelware and a smattering of campfire accessories, GSI Outdoors grew through the years to include full design, manufacturing, sales, and marketing departments, all tasked with developing and marketing an ever-more-innovative line of outdoor cookware, tableware, and accessories. Siblings Don, Ian, and Kathy Scott eventually relocated to Spokane, Washington, where they continue to define innovation through the creation of unique, imaginative, and fun products that reassert their enthusiasm for the outdoors. GSI Outdoors is still a small, privately held company, with no obligation to shareholders, a corporate board, or anyone else aside from its customers and employees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BeD8W3OeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IDY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001LF3IGQ", "title": "GSI Outdoors 10 fl Oz Flask", "description": "Lightweight, low-profile hip flask design stows easily in pockets and boasts an easy to fill, wide-mouth design and convenient shot cap!", "text": "GSI Outdoors 10 fl Oz Flask Lightweight, low-profile hip flask design stows easily in pockets and boasts an easy to fill, wide-mouth design and convenient shot cap!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JFgC-6p3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LF3IGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LGEGY8", "title": "Continental Travel Contact DuraSkin Bike Tire", "description": "You can't develop a tire for globetrotters on the drawing board. So that is why all of Tilmann Waldthaler's experience has been put to use in the development of the TravelContact. His requirements were obvious: a robust carcass with a high carrying capacity and protection against chafing and cuts, effective puncture resistance and last but not least, a tread that makes it possible to explore paths around the world quickly and safely. A foldable version is of course also available to take along as a spare. The TravelContact is ideal for touring all kinds of routes, along the Weser river in Germany or the best bikespots in the world.", "text": "Continental Travel Contact DuraSkin Bike Tire You can't develop a tire for globetrotters on the drawing board. So that is why all of Tilmann Waldthaler's experience has been put to use in the development of the TravelContact. His requirements were obvious: a robust carcass with a high carrying capacity and protection against chafing and cuts, effective puncture resistance and last but not least, a tread that makes it possible to explore paths around the world quickly and safely. A foldable version is of course also available to take along as a spare. The TravelContact is ideal for touring all kinds of routes, along the Weser river in Germany or the best bikespots in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XdYmttOpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LGEGY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001LGW32A", "title": "Tenergy 9.6V 1600mAh Butterfly Mini NiMH Battery Pack w/ Mini Tamiya Connector for airsoft guns", "description": "Features and Benefits Product 9.6V NiMH 1600mAh 9.6V Nut Chuck Pack Mini Battery Pack Make made of 2/3A x 8 cells 1600mAh NiMH Connector mini Tamiya female connector assembled with 16 G wire Fit Models Airsoft guns G36C, M4A1-RIS, M4A1, CAR15, MP5A5, MC51, FNP90, AUGRT,AUGM, G3A4, G36, STEYR. For use in ERA002, ERA004, ERICS13, EROA002, EROA003, SDGE0507R2, SDGE0501R2, upgraded and/or modified AEGs. Feature - Rapidly charge up and long cycle life - High power with high discharge rate - ~ 8 imnutes firing time at 10A discharge power Best if stored in temperature 35-70 Degree and keep away from sun light or heat. Weight 0.3 lb Dimensions 2 units, each 18 mm in Diameter and 116 mm in length Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "text": "Tenergy 9.6V 1600mAh Butterfly Mini NiMH Battery Pack w/ Mini Tamiya Connector for airsoft guns Features and Benefits Product 9.6V NiMH 1600mAh 9.6V Nut Chuck Pack Mini Battery Pack Make made of 2/3A x 8 cells 1600mAh NiMH Connector mini Tamiya female connector assembled with 16 G wire Fit Models Airsoft guns G36C, M4A1-RIS, M4A1, CAR15, MP5A5, MC51, FNP90, AUGRT,AUGM, G3A4, G36, STEYR. For use in ERA002, ERA004, ERICS13, EROA002, EROA003, SDGE0507R2, SDGE0501R2, upgraded and/or modified AEGs. Feature - Rapidly charge up and long cycle life - High power with high discharge rate - ~ 8 imnutes firing time at 10A discharge power Best if stored in temperature 35-70 Degree and keep away from sun light or heat. Weight 0.3 lb Dimensions 2 units, each 18 mm in Diameter and 116 mm in length Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41abGEOpX2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LGW32A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tenergy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Batteries"]], "price": 14.45}}
{"item_id": "B001LK7Y7A", "title": "Vanguard Scout B62 Gun Pod", "description": "The Scout bi pod is constructed of lightweight aluminum, and features a V-shaped yoke that swivels a full 360 degrees. The quick release leg clips are easy to adjust, and the foam hand grips provides a comfortable grip. The adjustable strap also helps stabilize the leg placement during use.", "text": "Vanguard Scout B62 Gun Pod The Scout bi pod is constructed of lightweight aluminum, and features a V-shaped yoke that swivels a full 360 degrees. The quick release leg clips are easy to adjust, and the foam hand grips provides a comfortable grip. The adjustable strap also helps stabilize the leg placement during use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3187QccLJkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LK7Y7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 36.45}}
{"item_id": "B001LM31AM", "title": "Grimloc 4-Pack, OD Green", "description": "Locking D-Ring can be used on any 1\" wide piece of webbing and replaces the metal carabiner for attachment of lanyards weapons and accessories. lightweight plastic incorporates GhillieTex IR-signature reduction technology and resists solar heating. Its latch is designed with a detent to maintain an open position if needed and while strong enough to carry equipment it will break away with a soldier's weight eliminating snagging hazards which can cause serious injuries. Low-IR 80 lb. break strength.", "text": "Grimloc 4-Pack, OD Green Locking D-Ring can be used on any 1\" wide piece of webbing and replaces the metal carabiner for attachment of lanyards weapons and accessories. lightweight plastic incorporates GhillieTex IR-signature reduction technology and resists solar heating. Its latch is designed with a detent to maintain an open position if needed and while strong enough to carry equipment it will break away with a soldier's weight eliminating snagging hazards which can cause serious injuries. Low-IR 80 lb. break strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xMp0oJQXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LM31AM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B001LMFT34", "title": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - Sf Xd - Ylw Rs, Green/Yellow", "description": "The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "text": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - Sf Xd - Ylw Rs, Green/Yellow The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415qh22j9IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LMFT34.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 88.47}}
{"item_id": "B001LMRYXW", "title": "B4070 Bella Ladies' 5.8 oz., 2x1 Rib Racerback Longer-Length Tank", "description": "", "text": "B4070 Bella Ladies' 5.8 oz., 2x1 Rib Racerback Longer-Length Tank", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LuY7S2%2BcL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LMRYXW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shirts", "Tank Tops"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Girls", "Shirts", "Tank Tops"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "B", "Bella"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Tops & Tees", "Tanks & Camis"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Band & Music Fan", "T-Shirts"]]}}
