{"item_id": "B001LR5PTC", "title": "Camelbak 72 oz/2.1L MG Omega Reservoir (Low Profile) 90342", "description": "Features: This CamelBak hydration reservoir features a huge access port for easy filling and cleaning OMEGA access port is large enough to put your hand inside making cleaning and filling simple Hydroguard anti-microbial technology embeds an FDA-approved silver ion compound into reservoir film and delivery tubes Anti-microbial film eliminates up to 99.99% of common bacteria and fungus Big Bite valve made of medical-grade silicone provides easy access--simply bite and sip Screw-down cap prevents leakage", "text": "Camelbak 72 oz/2.1L MG Omega Reservoir (Low Profile) 90342 Features: This CamelBak hydration reservoir features a huge access port for easy filling and cleaning OMEGA access port is large enough to put your hand inside making cleaning and filling simple Hydroguard anti-microbial technology embeds an FDA-approved silver ion compound into reservoir film and delivery tubes Anti-microbial film eliminates up to 99.99% of common bacteria and fungus Big Bite valve made of medical-grade silicone provides easy access--simply bite and sip Screw-down cap prevents leakage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jIQkFDG7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LR5PTC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001LRCGWG", "title": "Squat Sponge 18\"long, 3.5\" diameter & 1.25\"thick Olympic Barbell Pad", "description": "Squat Sponge 18\"long, 3.5\" diameter & 1.25\"thick Olympic Barbell Pad. enhances and allows for proper form for squats and lunges and provides additional comfort for the upper and lower back and abdomen area during said exercises for supporting a barbell. For a limited time only Giving away a Free consultation with an credited personal trainer like Elise Firestone, This is $75 dollar value. For a limited time only with each Squat Sponge purchase.", "text": "Squat Sponge 18\"long, 3.5\" diameter & 1.25\"thick Olympic Barbell Pad Squat Sponge 18\"long, 3.5\" diameter & 1.25\"thick Olympic Barbell Pad. enhances and allows for proper form for squats and lunges and provides additional comfort for the upper and lower back and abdomen area during said exercises for supporting a barbell. For a limited time only Giving away a Free consultation with an credited personal trainer like Elise Firestone, This is $75 dollar value. For a limited time only with each Squat Sponge purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mPnWhe4RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LRCGWG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment"]], "price": 24.99}}
