{"item_id": "B001LUQGYC", "title": "Xootr Mg with Fender - Black", "description": "The deck of the Mg is solid magnesium (no kidding) providing the lightest deck structure and lowest deck height of any Xootr scooter to date. We believe the Xootr Mg is the most advanced kick scooter ever made. The deck is cast in solid magnesium, powder coated, and then CNC machined. The wheels are die cast aluminum rims with our ultra-low-resistance polyurethane tire (black). Includes rear fender/brake kit. Black color. Frame construction: Magnesium structure integral with deck. Grips: Black conformal foam. Push button ergo pin. Handlebar: TIG-welded 4130 steel. Brake: Front brake with BMX-style brake lever. Wheel diameter: 7.1 in. (180 mm) Wheelbase: 28.3 in. (720 mm) Overall length (deployed): 35.4 in. (900 mm) Folded dimensions: 31.1 in. long x 9.4 in. high x 12.6 in. wide (at handlebar) (790 mm x 240 mm x 320 mm) Minimum handlebar height (from deck): 25 in. (635 mm) Maximum handlebar height (from deck): 38 in. (965 mm) Maximum deck width: 7.4 in. (187 mm) Maximum deck length: 25.0 in. (635 mm) Maximum rider weight: 250 lbs. (114 kg) Weight: 9.9 lbs. (4.5 kg)", "text": "Xootr Mg with Fender - Black The deck of the Mg is solid magnesium (no kidding) providing the lightest deck structure and lowest deck height of any Xootr scooter to date. We believe the Xootr Mg is the most advanced kick scooter ever made. The deck is cast in solid magnesium, powder coated, and then CNC machined. The wheels are die cast aluminum rims with our ultra-low-resistance polyurethane tire (black). Includes rear fender/brake kit. Black color. Frame construction: Magnesium structure integral with deck. Grips: Black conformal foam. Push button ergo pin. Handlebar: TIG-welded 4130 steel. Brake: Front brake with BMX-style brake lever. Wheel diameter: 7.1 in. (180 mm) Wheelbase: 28.3 in. (720 mm) Overall length (deployed): 35.4 in. (900 mm) Folded dimensions: 31.1 in. long x 9.4 in. high x 12.6 in. wide (at handlebar) (790 mm x 240 mm x 320 mm) Minimum handlebar height (from deck): 25 in. (635 mm) Maximum handlebar height (from deck): 38 in. (965 mm) Maximum deck width: 7.4 in. (187 mm) Maximum deck length: 25.0 in. (635 mm) Maximum rider weight: 250 lbs. (114 kg) Weight: 9.9 lbs. (4.5 kg)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HOrM%2BqznL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LUQGYC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]], "price": 269.0}}
{"item_id": "B001LXA2LW", "title": "U.S. Divers Sideview Mask, Paradise Dry Snorkel, Travel Trek Fins, Strap & Coast Bag Package", "description": "Great snorkel package, fins are meant to be worn barefoot. Trek fin sizes below and will not fit wide feet, sorry!SMALL: (Mens 4-7 & Ladies 5-7.5)MEDIUM: (Mens 7.5-10 & Ladies 8-10)LARGE: (Mens 10.5-12 & Ladies 10.5+)", "text": "U.S. Divers Sideview Mask, Paradise Dry Snorkel, Travel Trek Fins, Strap & Coast Bag Package Great snorkel package, fins are meant to be worn barefoot. Trek fin sizes below and will not fit wide feet, sorry!SMALL: (Mens 4-7 & Ladies 5-7.5)MEDIUM: (Mens 7.5-10 & Ladies 8-10)LARGE: (Mens 10.5-12 & Ladies 10.5+)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XGoPkJFQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LXA2LW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LZ4860", "title": "Maxpedition 5-Inch TacTie - Pack Of 4", "description": "Maxpedition’s patent pending TacTie Attachment Strap system is used to integrate accessory pockets onto packs, vests, MOLLE equipment and PALS surfaces effortlessly in an interlocking manner.", "text": "Maxpedition 5-Inch TacTie - Pack Of 4 Maxpedition’s patent pending TacTie Attachment Strap system is used to integrate accessory pockets onto packs, vests, MOLLE equipment and PALS surfaces effortlessly in an interlocking manner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tlZDA9OqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZ4860.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 6.8}}
{"item_id": "B001LZ5FI0", "title": "Safariland J-GL8C COMP II Speedloader", "description": "This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "text": "Safariland J-GL8C COMP II Speedloader This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411C6J4BQVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZ5FI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B001LZ9EEG", "title": "ProForce All Weather Shelter 61670", "description": "The All Weather Shelter is the most versatile multi-purpose shelter for \"ALL WEATHER\" conditions protecting you from the sun, wind, rain and snow. Designed by Military Veterans and avid Outdoorsmen. It can be configured and used as a Fly, Pup Tent, Lean-Too Shelter, Emergency Bivvi and the list goes on. With the components and features offered the All Weather Shelter has endless possibilities, only limited by ones imagination. The All Weather Shelter is ideal for those that travel light and move fast. The All Weather Shelter measures 10'x10' with grommets on each corner as well as numerous webbing tabs along each side. Also there are 3 webbing tabs across the spine when used as a fly. Also down two opposite side are plastic snaps which can allow it to be folded and snapped together to make an emergency bivvi if desired. Included also are 4 guy ropes with adjusters measuring 10' in length and 8 ultra lightweight alloy stakes. Constructed out of 210T Nylon Rip-Stop, PU Coated and is also UV Resistant (ANTI-UV 30). All seams are sealed and taped. Reinforced webbing tabs along sides. The All Weather Shelter as a 2,000mm PU Coated Hydrostatic Head. Available in Olive only. Weight - 36 Ounces (Includes Shelter and all components, ie: Stakes, Guy Ropes, etc.)", "text": "ProForce All Weather Shelter 61670 The All Weather Shelter is the most versatile multi-purpose shelter for \"ALL WEATHER\" conditions protecting you from the sun, wind, rain and snow. Designed by Military Veterans and avid Outdoorsmen. It can be configured and used as a Fly, Pup Tent, Lean-Too Shelter, Emergency Bivvi and the list goes on. With the components and features offered the All Weather Shelter has endless possibilities, only limited by ones imagination. The All Weather Shelter is ideal for those that travel light and move fast. The All Weather Shelter measures 10'x10' with grommets on each corner as well as numerous webbing tabs along each side. Also there are 3 webbing tabs across the spine when used as a fly. Also down two opposite side are plastic snaps which can allow it to be folded and snapped together to make an emergency bivvi if desired. Included also are 4 guy ropes with adjusters measuring 10' in length and 8 ultra lightweight alloy stakes. Constructed out of 210T Nylon Rip-Stop, PU Coated and is also UV Resistant (ANTI-UV 30). All seams are sealed and taped. Reinforced webbing tabs along sides. The All Weather Shelter as a 2,000mm PU Coated Hydrostatic Head. Available in Olive only. Weight - 36 Ounces (Includes Shelter and all components, ie: Stakes, Guy Ropes, etc.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oDkELoalL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZ9EEG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LZPNWS", "title": "BlackHawk Pistol Range Bag SPORTSTER Bag Black Nylon 74RB02BK", "description": "The BLACKHAWK SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from BLACKHAWK! No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "text": "BlackHawk Pistol Range Bag SPORTSTER Bag Black Nylon 74RB02BK The BLACKHAWK SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from BLACKHAWK! No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vydKUokJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZPNWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 29.0}}
