{"item_id": "B001LZV55C", "title": "Mako 3X Magnifier for Red Dot/Reflex Sights (3rd Generation) - Black", "description": "3-power magnifier mounts behind reflex (red-dot) sights to provide magnification when needed. Transition between no magnification for speed in close-range combat and magnification for precision shooting as situation dictates. Rugged construction. Multi-coated lenses and 30mm tube for excellent light transmission. Nitrogen purged, shockproof, waterproof, and fogproof.", "text": "Mako 3X Magnifier for Red Dot/Reflex Sights (3rd Generation) - Black 3-power magnifier mounts behind reflex (red-dot) sights to provide magnification when needed. Transition between no magnification for speed in close-range combat and magnification for precision shooting as situation dictates. Rugged construction. Multi-coated lenses and 30mm tube for excellent light transmission. Nitrogen purged, shockproof, waterproof, and fogproof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pFNbC9EiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZV55C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001LZXVF4", "title": "BallQube Grandstand Baseball Holder Acrylic Display - Made in the USA", "description": "The BallQube Grand Stand Baseball Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene,features a 2 piece design with built-in stand", "text": "BallQube Grandstand Baseball Holder Acrylic Display - Made in the USA The BallQube Grand Stand Baseball Holder is made of high impact, crystal clear polystyrene,features a 2 piece design with built-in stand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tNcCF%2BNbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001LZXVF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BallQube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Memorabilia Display & Storage", "Display Cases"]], "price": 4.32}}
{"item_id": "B001M04RBK", "title": "SurfShelf Treadmill Desk: Laptop and iPad Holder", "description": "The SurfShelf treadmill desk attaches any laptop or tablet (iPad, etc.) to most any exercise machine. Perfect for your treadmill, exercise bike, elliptical trainer, etc.Catch the TV shows you missed, watch DVDs, Facebook, email, Twitter or do some work, all while you get fit.Daily exercise is essential for a happy & healthy life, but with our busy schedules it's hard to fit it in. Now you can! Do your morning emails on the treadmill & your workout is done!Our customers are losing weight like crazy! You will too!In addition to the reviews below, click on the \"Sold by SurfShelf\" link at the top by the pictures for 350+ more 5-STAR customer comments.Easy to install and made of 100% Polycarbonate (same stuff used to make bullet-proof glass) so it won't ever break. A Velcro strap holds your laptop tight. Recently improved instructions make it even easier!It's a great book holder too. One accessory for books, laptops and iPads! The perfect gift!Fits most all exercise machines. If you have any questions whether the SurfShelf will fit on your machine, or if your machine is over 10 years old or has a control console less than 6 inches wide, please contact us with your make and model and we will tell you exactly how it will fit.Your workouts will never be boring again!NEW PRODUCTS ANNOUNCEMENT! Check out our new products THE SAFETY LOUNGERS and THE ZHIP here on Amazon!The Safety Lounger is the only pillow stand for your tablet/eReader with protective bumpers to protect your device from falls. Great for the whole family!The Zhip is the only smartphone stand/holder with 3 feet of retractable zip cord to attach it to anything for hands-free viewing. In the gym, on the plane, in the car, in the kitchen... ANYWHERE!", "text": "SurfShelf Treadmill Desk: Laptop and iPad Holder The SurfShelf treadmill desk attaches any laptop or tablet (iPad, etc.) to most any exercise machine. Perfect for your treadmill, exercise bike, elliptical trainer, etc.Catch the TV shows you missed, watch DVDs, Facebook, email, Twitter or do some work, all while you get fit.Daily exercise is essential for a happy & healthy life, but with our busy schedules it's hard to fit it in. Now you can! Do your morning emails on the treadmill & your workout is done!Our customers are losing weight like crazy! You will too!In addition to the reviews below, click on the \"Sold by SurfShelf\" link at the top by the pictures for 350+ more 5-STAR customer comments.Easy to install and made of 100% Polycarbonate (same stuff used to make bullet-proof glass) so it won't ever break. A Velcro strap holds your laptop tight. Recently improved instructions make it even easier!It's a great book holder too. One accessory for books, laptops and iPads! The perfect gift!Fits most all exercise machines. If you have any questions whether the SurfShelf will fit on your machine, or if your machine is over 10 years old or has a control console less than 6 inches wide, please contact us with your make and model and we will tell you exactly how it will fit.Your workouts will never be boring again!NEW PRODUCTS ANNOUNCEMENT! Check out our new products THE SAFETY LOUNGERS and THE ZHIP here on Amazon!The Safety Lounger is the only pillow stand for your tablet/eReader with protective bumpers to protect your device from falls. Great for the whole family!The Zhip is the only smartphone stand/holder with 3 feet of retractable zip cord to attach it to anything for hands-free viewing. In the gym, on the plane, in the car, in the kitchen... ANYWHERE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BSfurOR5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M04RBK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 39.95}}
