{"item_id": "B001M0O4WM", "title": "FINIS Jr Floating Fins", "description": "Founded in 1993, by John Mix and Olympic Gold Medalist, Pablo Morales, FINIS develops the most technological and advanced training equipment for the swimming industry. From competitive swim wear and technical training equipment to high-end competitive swim goggles and children's water confidence products, FINIS offers something for swimmers of all abilities to improve their technique and add to their enjoyment of being in the water.", "text": "FINIS Jr Floating Fins Founded in 1993, by John Mix and Olympic Gold Medalist, Pablo Morales, FINIS develops the most technological and advanced training equipment for the swimming industry. From competitive swim wear and technical training equipment to high-end competitive swim goggles and children's water confidence products, FINIS offers something for swimmers of all abilities to improve their technique and add to their enjoyment of being in the water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415WVQadi0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M0O4WM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
