{"item_id": "B001M4HT66", "title": "Scotty Baitcaster/Spinning Rod Holder with Flush Mount", "description": "Scotty's Flush mount baitcaster/spinning rod holder provides an adjustable surface-mounted cradle to securely carry either a baitcaster or spinning reel on the deck of a kayak or small boat. The flush mount works extremely well for sit-on-top kayaks and other kayaks that neccessitate a smooth surface from which a rod holder can be entirely removed. The sealed base is watertight to prevent water from flooding the interior of the kayak.", "text": "Scotty Baitcaster/Spinning Rod Holder with Flush Mount Scotty's Flush mount baitcaster/spinning rod holder provides an adjustable surface-mounted cradle to securely carry either a baitcaster or spinning reel on the deck of a kayak or small boat. The flush mount works extremely well for sit-on-top kayaks and other kayaks that neccessitate a smooth surface from which a rod holder can be entirely removed. The sealed base is watertight to prevent water from flooding the interior of the kayak.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413qylFEROL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M4HT66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scotty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 21.79}}
