{"item_id": "B001M4HTNO", "title": "Scotty Rod Holder Extender All Nylon", "description": "Rod Holder Extender increases your odds with easier access to your rod and reel. Extends the height of the rod holder by 6 1/2”, allowing for faster access when that fish strikes. Made from super tough re-enforced nylon. Works with Scotty post mount rod holders, except No. 240 Striker.", "text": "Scotty Rod Holder Extender All Nylon Rod Holder Extender increases your odds with easier access to your rod and reel. Extends the height of the rod holder by 6 1/2”, allowing for faster access when that fish strikes. Made from super tough re-enforced nylon. Works with Scotty post mount rod holders, except No. 240 Striker.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lvNZAvtmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M4HTNO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scotty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Cases & Tubes"]], "price": 13.05}}
