{"item_id": "B001M5TSFK", "title": "BARSKA Tactical Red Laser Sight System with Flashlight and Mount", "description": "Tactical Red Laser Sight with Flashlight and Mount, includes riser bar. Improve accuracy in the dark with this must have system that combine the precision of a laser sight with the illumination of a high intensity flashlight, leaving no doubt in your mind where your shot is headed.Specifications:Tube Diameter (mm): 19Output power: <5mWWavelength: 635-655nmMax Reach Capacity: 500 ydsAdjustment Type: Allen WrenchBattery Type: CR-123A LR-44 Lithium", "text": "BARSKA Tactical Red Laser Sight System with Flashlight and Mount Tactical Red Laser Sight with Flashlight and Mount, includes riser bar. Improve accuracy in the dark with this must have system that combine the precision of a laser sight with the illumination of a high intensity flashlight, leaving no doubt in your mind where your shot is headed.Specifications:Tube Diameter (mm): 19Output power: <5mWWavelength: 635-655nmMax Reach Capacity: 500 ydsAdjustment Type: Allen WrenchBattery Type: CR-123A LR-44 Lithium", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fBdi1QDtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M5TSFK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 58.34}}
{"item_id": "B001M5TSHI", "title": "BARSKA 10-22 Ruger Base Mount", "description": "This rugged base mount, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is specially designed for Ruger 10-22 rifles. It accepts standard picatinny rings and can be used on a rifle's iron sight, and attaches quickly and easily to a hand guard. T6 aluminum construction is lightweight yet durable for long-lasting use.SpecificationsMade for use with Ruger 10-22Weaver, picatinny, and dovetail rails4.14-inch railT6 aluminumBlack matte finishWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "text": "BARSKA 10-22 Ruger Base Mount This rugged base mount, from renowned optics company BARSKA, is specially designed for Ruger 10-22 rifles. It accepts standard picatinny rings and can be used on a rifle's iron sight, and attaches quickly and easily to a hand guard. T6 aluminum construction is lightweight yet durable for long-lasting use.SpecificationsMade for use with Ruger 10-22Weaver, picatinny, and dovetail rails4.14-inch railT6 aluminumBlack matte finishWarrantyThis BARSKA optical product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BARSKABARSKA -- with corporate offices, warehouse, and distribution in La Verne, CA -- is a worldwide optics company offering an extensive line of precision sport and scientific products including binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, telescopes, and microscopes. The company's products are designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy beloved outdoor activities even more, and achieve exacting results when studying objects large and small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JvGyrAosL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M5TSHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 18.32}}
