{"item_id": "B001M5TZZI", "title": "Speedo Competition II Kickboard", "description": "This dual density foam kickboard provides a soft, comfortable top and a rigid bottom that offers support and proper flexibilty. A training aid to strengthen legs while reducing shoulder stress, it's ergonomical design is ideal for single arm and sidekick workouts. Train hard and effecient with this great aid!", "text": "Speedo Competition II Kickboard This dual density foam kickboard provides a soft, comfortable top and a rigid bottom that offers support and proper flexibilty. A training aid to strengthen legs while reducing shoulder stress, it's ergonomical design is ideal for single arm and sidekick workouts. Train hard and effecient with this great aid!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Blz9sjbZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M5TZZI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Kickboards"]], "price": 19.62}}
{"item_id": "B001M5WQN6", "title": "Everest 044XLD Signature Waist Pack - Large", "description": "Manufacturer Part Number: 044XLDLarge sized waist pack. Snap waist buckle.FeatureThe convenience of a waist pack in a large size.Three zippered compartments.Snap waist buckle.Material: 600D PolyesterDimension: 16.5 x 6.5 x 4 inCapacity: 360 in3/ 5.9 LWeight: 12 oz / 0.3 kgAvailable Colors: Black,NavyThe web image is for your reference. The price is for each.NOTE:All the EV- items can\\'t be shipped to California.The item can't be shipped to CA in the Unite States.", "text": "Everest 044XLD Signature Waist Pack - Large Manufacturer Part Number: 044XLDLarge sized waist pack. Snap waist buckle.FeatureThe convenience of a waist pack in a large size.Three zippered compartments.Snap waist buckle.Material: 600D PolyesterDimension: 16.5 x 6.5 x 4 inCapacity: 360 in3/ 5.9 LWeight: 12 oz / 0.3 kgAvailable Colors: Black,NavyThe web image is for your reference. The price is for each.NOTE:All the EV- items can\\'t be shipped to California.The item can't be shipped to CA in the Unite States.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PMMokQI0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M5WQN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 7.77}}
{"item_id": "B001M800O0", "title": "Stans Stan's Yellow Spoke Tape", "description": "High tensile strength and light weight. 21mm designed to seal spoke bed of ZTR rims or as a lightweight spoke tape on any rim. 25mm fits the ZTR Flow rims and wider applications. Weighs only 5 grams per application. 10 yards will tape 5 rims, 60 yards will tape 25 to 28 rims.", "text": "Stans Stan's Yellow Spoke Tape High tensile strength and light weight. 21mm designed to seal spoke bed of ZTR rims or as a lightweight spoke tape on any rim. 25mm fits the ZTR Flow rims and wider applications. Weighs only 5 grams per application. 10 yards will tape 5 rims, 60 yards will tape 25 to 28 rims.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FTpyUeKDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M800O0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001M9OQEY", "title": "Halo Headband Protex Skull Cap", "description": "Halo Headband skull caps are perfect for competing, working our or just recreating. DRYLINE fabric is a unique, dual component fabric featuring polyester inside and nylon outside This uniquie combination createss a push-pull moisture transport design drawing perspiration from the skin to the fabric surface where it evaporates In addition to the technical fabric is their patented Sweat Block Technology--a watertight, non-slip seal built into the front of each Halo Headband to direct sweat away from your eyes The cap fits easily under helmets and is available in a one size fits all", "text": "Halo Headband Protex Skull Cap Halo Headband skull caps are perfect for competing, working our or just recreating. DRYLINE fabric is a unique, dual component fabric featuring polyester inside and nylon outside This uniquie combination createss a push-pull moisture transport design drawing perspiration from the skin to the fabric surface where it evaporates In addition to the technical fabric is their patented Sweat Block Technology--a watertight, non-slip seal built into the front of each Halo Headband to direct sweat away from your eyes The cap fits easily under helmets and is available in a one size fits all", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414irWtM-cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001M9OQEY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001MAH6L8", "title": "NcStar Deluxe Folding Rifle Bipod", "description": "Fits On The Barrel Of Most .223 And .308 Hunting Guns Sturdy Solid Steel Construction Made For The Rigors Of Military Use Independent Leg Height Adjustments Legs Fold Under Barrel When Not In Use", "text": "NcStar Deluxe Folding Rifle Bipod Fits On The Barrel Of Most .223 And .308 Hunting Guns Sturdy Solid Steel Construction Made For The Rigors Of Military Use Independent Leg Height Adjustments Legs Fold Under Barrel When Not In Use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e2RpjTBTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MAH6L8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 26.75}}
{"item_id": "B001MBUGLY", "title": "", "description": "Developed in collaboration with fitness expert Bob Greene, best known as Oprah's personal trainer,EA SPORTS Activeprovides a fun, inexpensive and easy to maintain regimen designed to encourage physical fitness and healthy living. A combination of a wide variety of interactive activities and exercises, linked together into an ever-changing circuit training routine targeting the muscles of the upper and lower body, as well as providing cardio for a healthy heart, it is the perfect exercise option for every member of a modern household..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -15px; } table.callout { font-family: verdana; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1. 3em; } td.vgoverview { height: 125px; background: #9DC4D8 url(http://images.amazon.com/images/G/01/electronics/detail-page/callout-bg.png) repeat-x; border-left: 1px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 10px; width: 250px; font-family: verdana; font-size: 12px; }Easy to follow personal trainer.View larger.Strength training via resistance.View larger.Use leg strap for cardio.View larger.GameplayDesigned around the standard Wii Remote/Nunchuck tethered controller configuration,EA SPORTS Active's interactive fitness program is more focused on physical activities than previous 'fitness' titles for the Wii, but still challenges you to have fun while developing a more healthy lifestyle. Separated into the three sections of workout, nutrition, lifestyle, and other activity, the user's experience begins with a pep talk from Bob Greene which quickly transitions into the beginnings of action as players set up profiles, choose a virtual personal trainer and enter baseline data like age, weight, gender, fitness goals, etc. Although the nutrition, lifestyle, and other activity sections add a holistic element facilitated by a mix of surveys and data input, building fitness through physical activity is the driving force behindEA SPORTS Activeand as such the meat of the content resides in the workout section. Here players will find dozens of themed strength training and cardio workouts which can be customized as you choose and linked into circuit traning routines. These routines are introduced and monitored by your personal trainer, and allow for ongoing player motivation via real-time feedback on your workout form, an approximation of calories burned and the ability to adjust levels of exercise intensity.AccessoriesAlthough activity inEA SPORTS Activeflows exclusively through the combination of the Wii Remote and Nunchuck controllers, it also utilizes a few additional accessories to maximize the functionality of this configuration. The first of these included with the game is the controller leg strap. By attaching this to their upper thigh and then slipping the Nunchuck controller into it, players can utilize the Nunchuck controller's motion sensing capabilities while it is connected to the Wii Remote to monitor their leg movements. This allows for cardio exercises like jogging and cardio boxing and strength training activities like squats. Also included with the game is a resistance band designed to increase the intensity of a variety of exercises such as bicep curls and shoulder presses and lifts. In addition, although not included, the Wii Balance board is compatible with manyEA SPORTS Activeworkouts, but only as an optional added controller configuration.Key Game Features:Active Fitness Made Fun & Easy- 20 minute circuits feature a variety of familiar activities that target upper body, lower body as well as cardio. Start off with a light jog, followed by bicep curls and get your heart beating with some cardio boxing.Benefit of a Virtual Personal Trainer- Your trainer will be the focal point of the experience guiding you towards your own version of personal achievement. Feedback will be given throughout your workout, keeping you on track to reach your fitness goals.The 30 Day Challenge- Take the 30 Day Challenge and experience tailor made 20 minute workouts to your level of fitness. Circuits will change as you progress each day, andEA SPORTS Activewill track calories, intensity and progress throughout your journey.New Way to Play- Slip the Nunchuk into the specially designed leg strap and hold the Wii Remote in your hand to track your movements from both your upper and lower body. A resistance band is also included to increase the intensity of exercises such as bicep curls and shoulder presses.Workout Your Way- Circuits can be customized to your interest and fitness level. Choose your duration, intensity level & set your own goals for calories burned and workout score.Workout with a Friend- Burn calories with a friend as you both workout through routines together in a co-operative mode.Track Your Progress- Expand your Fitness IQ and keep track of your workouts inside and outside ofEA Sports Activewith the in-game Journal.Wii Balance Board Compatibility- Get more out of yourEA SPORTS Activeworkout using a Wii Balance Board with added functionality for many of exercises.Co-op Multiplayer ModeAlong with its single player experience,EA SPORTS Activealso features a deep and entertaining two-player cooperative gameplay mode. Designed to tap into the time tested motivational factor of having a workout buddy beside you as crunch through reps and up your personal best, regardless of a player's current fitness levels or future fitness goals, this mode is sure to enhance the level of fun of players at all levels.", "text": "Developed in collaboration with fitness expert Bob Greene, best known as Oprah's personal trainer,EA SPORTS Activeprovides a fun, inexpensive and easy to maintain regimen designed to encourage physical fitness and healthy living. A combination of a wide variety of interactive activities and exercises, linked together into an ever-changing circuit training routine targeting the muscles of the upper and lower body, as well as providing cardio for a healthy heart, it is the perfect exercise option for every member of a modern household..caption { font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; } ul.indent { list-style: inside disc; text-indent: -15px; } table.callout { font-family: verdana; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1. 3em; } td.vgoverview { height: 125px; background: #9DC4D8 url(http://images.amazon.com/images/G/01/electronics/detail-page/callout-bg.png) repeat-x; border-left: 1px solid #999999; border-right: 1px solid #999999; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 10px; width: 250px; font-family: verdana; font-size: 12px; }Easy to follow personal trainer.View larger.Strength training via resistance.View larger.Use leg strap for cardio.View larger.GameplayDesigned around the standard Wii Remote/Nunchuck tethered controller configuration,EA SPORTS Active's interactive fitness program is more focused on physical activities than previous 'fitness' titles for the Wii, but still challenges you to have fun while developing a more healthy lifestyle. Separated into the three sections of workout, nutrition, lifestyle, and other activity, the user's experience begins with a pep talk from Bob Greene which quickly transitions into the beginnings of action as players set up profiles, choose a virtual personal trainer and enter baseline data like age, weight, gender, fitness goals, etc. Although the nutrition, lifestyle, and other activity sections add a holistic element facilitated by a mix of surveys and data input, building fitness through physical activity is the driving force behindEA SPORTS Activeand as such the meat of the content resides in the workout section. Here players will find dozens of themed strength training and cardio workouts which can be customized as you choose and linked into circuit traning routines. These routines are introduced and monitored by your personal trainer, and allow for ongoing player motivation via real-time feedback on your workout form, an approximation of calories burned and the ability to adjust levels of exercise intensity.AccessoriesAlthough activity inEA SPORTS Activeflows exclusively through the combination of the Wii Remote and Nunchuck controllers, it also utilizes a few additional accessories to maximize the functionality of this configuration. The first of these included with the game is the controller leg strap. By attaching this to their upper thigh and then slipping the Nunchuck controller into it, players can utilize the Nunchuck controller's motion sensing capabilities while it is connected to the Wii Remote to monitor their leg movements. This allows for cardio exercises like jogging and cardio boxing and strength training activities like squats. Also included with the game is a resistance band designed to increase the intensity of a variety of exercises such as bicep curls and shoulder presses and lifts. In addition, although not included, the Wii Balance board is compatible with manyEA SPORTS Activeworkouts, but only as an optional added controller configuration.Key Game Features:Active Fitness Made Fun & Easy- 20 minute circuits feature a variety of familiar activities that target upper body, lower body as well as cardio. Start off with a light jog, followed by bicep curls and get your heart beating with some cardio boxing.Benefit of a Virtual Personal Trainer- Your trainer will be the focal point of the experience guiding you towards your own version of personal achievement. Feedback will be given throughout your workout, keeping you on track to reach your fitness goals.The 30 Day Challenge- Take the 30 Day Challenge and experience tailor made 20 minute workouts to your level of fitness. Circuits will change as you progress each day, andEA SPORTS Activewill track calories, intensity and progress throughout your journey.New Way to Play- Slip the Nunchuk into the specially designed leg strap and hold the Wii Remote in your hand to track your movements from both your upper and lower body. A resistance band is also included to increase the intensity of exercises such as bicep curls and shoulder presses.Workout Your Way- Circuits can be customized to your interest and fitness level. Choose your duration, intensity level & set your own goals for calories burned and workout score.Workout with a Friend- Burn calories with a friend as you both workout through routines together in a co-operative mode.Track Your Progress- Expand your Fitness IQ and keep track of your workouts inside and outside ofEA Sports Activewith the in-game Journal.Wii Balance Board Compatibility- Get more out of yourEA SPORTS Activeworkout using a Wii Balance Board with added functionality for many of exercises.Co-op Multiplayer ModeAlong with its single player experience,EA SPORTS Activealso features a deep and entertaining two-player cooperative gameplay mode. Designed to tap into the time tested motivational factor of having a workout buddy beside you as crunch through reps and up your personal best, regardless of a player's current fitness levels or future fitness goals, this mode is sure to enhance the level of fun of players at all levels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xfkNC4UoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MBUGLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Movies & TV", "TV"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001MCBR8E", "title": "NutSac Disc Golf Bag", "description": "The NutSac is a small, but very high quality disc golf bag. This great bag is designed specifically for players who do not want to be encumbered by carrying a lot of stuff.The NutSac is designed to hold 6-8 discs, depending on the thickness of the discs and also features a small front pocket with two snap closures. The soft lid of this innovative bag snaps over the front pocket, creating a nice secure package when buttoned up. Many players report wearing this lightweight bag even while throwing, so the NutSac comes with an extra-long strap that can be worn around the neck, while having the bag at waist height. The NutSac is handmade in America, so you know its going to last a good, long time!", "text": "NutSac Disc Golf Bag The NutSac is a small, but very high quality disc golf bag. This great bag is designed specifically for players who do not want to be encumbered by carrying a lot of stuff.The NutSac is designed to hold 6-8 discs, depending on the thickness of the discs and also features a small front pocket with two snap closures. The soft lid of this innovative bag snaps over the front pocket, creating a nice secure package when buttoned up. Many players report wearing this lightweight bag even while throwing, so the NutSac comes with an extra-long strap that can be worn around the neck, while having the bag at waist height. The NutSac is handmade in America, so you know its going to last a good, long time!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MyRQyhr4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MCBR8E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Bags & Accessories"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MCCPFI", "title": "Hogue Rubber Over Molded Stock for Ruger, 10-22 Olive Drab", "description": "The Hogue OverMolded stock is the finest and most functional stock made for this rifle. The Hogue stock is super comfortable and will turn your 10-22 into a super trick, and accurate custom rifle! Hogue 10/22 stocks come equipped with sling swivel studs and feature simple, drop in installation. .920 Barrel (Bull)", "text": "Hogue Rubber Over Molded Stock for Ruger, 10-22 Olive Drab The Hogue OverMolded stock is the finest and most functional stock made for this rifle. The Hogue stock is super comfortable and will turn your 10-22 into a super trick, and accurate custom rifle! Hogue 10/22 stocks come equipped with sling swivel studs and feature simple, drop in installation. .920 Barrel (Bull)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219wk4F9-iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MCCPFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 70.82}}
{"item_id": "B001MCT7UO", "title": "Scientific Anglers Supra Floating Fly Fly Line", "description": "Supra Floating fly line has been developed from SA's popular Ultra 4 Freshwater fly line. This is a top quality all-purpose line, with versatile tapers designed for a large spectrum of flies and weather conditions. The core is supple braided multifilament nylon, while the coating is specially formulated 3M PVC integrated with patented Advanced Shooting Technology. The weight forward taper style has a mid-length head for the ideal balance of distance and control. Each weight of this style has an individual taper for optimal performance over that line's typical range. The double taper style has a longer front taper for enhanced delicacy and accuracy from short range. All Supra Floating Lines have a streamlined loop for easy connections and better floatation. Available in buckskin and sunrise colors, length 90'.", "text": "Scientific Anglers Supra Floating Fly Fly Line Supra Floating fly line has been developed from SA's popular Ultra 4 Freshwater fly line. This is a top quality all-purpose line, with versatile tapers designed for a large spectrum of flies and weather conditions. The core is supple braided multifilament nylon, while the coating is specially formulated 3M PVC integrated with patented Advanced Shooting Technology. The weight forward taper style has a mid-length head for the ideal balance of distance and control. Each weight of this style has an individual taper for optimal performance over that line's typical range. The double taper style has a longer front taper for enhanced delicacy and accuracy from short range. All Supra Floating Lines have a streamlined loop for easy connections and better floatation. Available in buckskin and sunrise colors, length 90'.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X7IlDUznL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MCT7UO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
