{"item_id": "B001MJB4WQ", "title": "ProMag AR-15/M16 4-Position Carbine Stock Recoil Pad, Black", "description": "The pad adds 1/2\" length of pull to AR-15 / M16 carbines equipped with four position collapsible stocks. The pad features U.S. and ordnance flaming bomb markings. The pad is modeled after the original rifle grenade recoil pad for 1903 and Garand rifles. Manufactured from injection molded chemical resistant black rubber. No permanent modification required.", "text": "ProMag AR-15/M16 4-Position Carbine Stock Recoil Pad, Black The pad adds 1/2\" length of pull to AR-15 / M16 carbines equipped with four position collapsible stocks. The pad features U.S. and ordnance flaming bomb markings. The pad is modeled after the original rifle grenade recoil pad for 1903 and Garand rifles. Manufactured from injection molded chemical resistant black rubber. No permanent modification required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZDELNepnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MJB4WQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 9.63}}
{"item_id": "B001MJWOYI", "title": "Serfas TLV Tire Levers", "description": "FEATURES of the Serfas TLV Tire Levers High Density Nylon Construction Built In Spoke Hook 3 Per Package SPECIFICATIONS of the Serfas TLV Tire Levers Weight: 30 Grams", "text": "Serfas TLV Tire Levers FEATURES of the Serfas TLV Tire Levers High Density Nylon Construction Built In Spoke Hook 3 Per Package SPECIFICATIONS of the Serfas TLV Tire Levers Weight: 30 Grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FBjcN5R6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MJWOYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 3.9}}
{"item_id": "B001MJYG8U", "title": "Serfas RX Cruiser Bicycle Saddle", "description": "The seat that started the low pressure revolution! Covered by Good Housekeeping, Mens Journal, and other top magazines, this seat has always been known to substancially improve any numbness problem.", "text": "Serfas RX Cruiser Bicycle Saddle The seat that started the low pressure revolution! Covered by Good Housekeeping, Mens Journal, and other top magazines, this seat has always been known to substancially improve any numbness problem.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bIRLye-8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MJYG8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 57.77}}
{"item_id": "B001MK0FUC", "title": "Serfas E-Gel Cruiser Bicycle Saddle", "description": "Serfas E-Gel saddles help smooth things over with Soflex, an innovative infinite stretch material that creates a seamless, low friction interface between bike and rider. Serfas E-Gel saddles also combine 30% more gel than other saddles in it's class to deliver the plushest ride.", "text": "Serfas E-Gel Cruiser Bicycle Saddle Serfas E-Gel saddles help smooth things over with Soflex, an innovative infinite stretch material that creates a seamless, low friction interface between bike and rider. Serfas E-Gel saddles also combine 30% more gel than other saddles in it's class to deliver the plushest ride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ik0Ww9kCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MK0FUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B001MK0G1A", "title": "Serfas Women's Reactive Gel Bicycle Saddle", "description": "Serfas' Reactive Gel acts as a friction reducing second skin. The extra layer of gel in every Reactive Gel saddle enables bike and rider to move fluidly together, while the deep groove design relives pressure on soft tissue areas for increased comfort where it matters.", "text": "Serfas Women's Reactive Gel Bicycle Saddle Serfas' Reactive Gel acts as a friction reducing second skin. The extra layer of gel in every Reactive Gel saddle enables bike and rider to move fluidly together, while the deep groove design relives pressure on soft tissue areas for increased comfort where it matters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oR6oLXmrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MK0G1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 33.94}}
{"item_id": "B001MK1SFI", "title": "Serfas Stop Sign Taillight", "description": "Serfas strives to offer the most technologically advanced safety lights in the industry at affordable prices. For 2010 Serfas offer some of the safest and brightest lights on the market, as well as ease of use and installation on a bike.", "text": "Serfas Stop Sign Taillight Serfas strives to offer the most technologically advanced safety lights in the industry at affordable prices. For 2010 Serfas offer some of the safest and brightest lights on the market, as well as ease of use and installation on a bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511ElGVGoFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MK1SFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001MK3GFS", "title": "Serfas TCPG Bicycle Floor Pump", "description": "", "text": "Serfas TCPG Bicycle Floor Pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x0VFjrYbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MK3GFS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MK80EA", "title": "Rough and Ready English Style Longbow - 45-50 lb. at 28 in.", "description": "This bow is made from Hickory wood backed with linen. The handle is wrapped with tape for a smooth grip. It comes ready to shoot and is tillered to a draw weight of 45 to 50 pounds and a maximum draw length of 28 inches. The bow is unfinished and needs to be sealed. This can be accomplished by simply rubbing petroleum jelly on the bow (including the linen backed side) twice per year. One might also opt to finish the bow permanently by sanding and sealing. This is an economical alternative to our already finished bows, offering the same abilities while allowing you to finish it in a fashion of your choosing.A bow stringer and instructions are included.This bow comes with a 1 year warranty. If this bow breaks or does not function properly as a result of manufacturing defects we will replace it free of charge.Made in the USA", "text": "Rough and Ready English Style Longbow - 45-50 lb. at 28 in. This bow is made from Hickory wood backed with linen. The handle is wrapped with tape for a smooth grip. It comes ready to shoot and is tillered to a draw weight of 45 to 50 pounds and a maximum draw length of 28 inches. The bow is unfinished and needs to be sealed. This can be accomplished by simply rubbing petroleum jelly on the bow (including the linen backed side) twice per year. One might also opt to finish the bow permanently by sanding and sealing. This is an economical alternative to our already finished bows, offering the same abilities while allowing you to finish it in a fashion of your choosing.A bow stringer and instructions are included.This bow comes with a 1 year warranty. If this bow breaks or does not function properly as a result of manufacturing defects we will replace it free of charge.Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ofIU%2BB5KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MK80EA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Longbows"]]}}
