{"item_id": "B001MLCTBE", "title": "MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader with Capacity of 100 Bbs - 2 packs", "description": "Airsoft BB Speed LoadersYou get two (2) CYMA brand 6mm BB Speed Loaders for Airsoft Rifles.Each loader features:Solid ABS Construction90 BB CapacityAllows you to “inject” BBs into most spring loaded Airsoft magazinesAllows for rapid reloading on the playfield", "text": "MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader with Capacity of 100 Bbs - 2 packs Airsoft BB Speed LoadersYou get two (2) CYMA brand 6mm BB Speed Loaders for Airsoft Rifles.Each loader features:Solid ABS Construction90 BB CapacityAllows you to “inject” BBs into most spring loaded Airsoft magazinesAllows for rapid reloading on the playfield", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NkAA-WGKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MLCTBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MetalTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Loaders"]], "price": 6.01}}
{"item_id": "B001MP2M8U", "title": "Airsoft MP5 Magazine for Galaxy G5, G5M & G5k Electric Guns", "description": "Metal MagazineHigh Capacity , 200 RoundsFits the Galaxy G5, G5K, and G5M AEGswind-up typeWill work in Jing Gong and all Classic Army/ICS compatible AEGs", "text": "Airsoft MP5 Magazine for Galaxy G5, G5M & G5k Electric Guns Metal MagazineHigh Capacity , 200 RoundsFits the Galaxy G5, G5K, and G5M AEGswind-up typeWill work in Jing Gong and all Classic Army/ICS compatible AEGs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KHou%2B5u%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MP2M8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galaxy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 7.51}}
{"item_id": "B001MP2P96", "title": "Airsoft G36 Magazine for JG G608 G608-2 AEG", "description": "High Capacity 470 round G36 Style Airsoft MagazineFits Jing Gong G608 and G608-2 AEGsMil Specs:Ratchet wheel typePlastic ABS ConstructionStackable470-round capacityHolds 6mm BBs (not for use with paintballs...regardless of what you hear they will damage your AEG).", "text": "Airsoft G36 Magazine for JG G608 G608-2 AEG High Capacity 470 round G36 Style Airsoft MagazineFits Jing Gong G608 and G608-2 AEGsMil Specs:Ratchet wheel typePlastic ABS ConstructionStackable470-round capacityHolds 6mm BBs (not for use with paintballs...regardless of what you hear they will damage your AEG).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GIQQEPb6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MP2P96.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jing Gong", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 12.39}}
{"item_id": "B001MPU106", "title": "OPTP Axis Roller Black Round 36 x 6", "description": "OPTP's firm Black AXIS foam roller is designed to perform in demanding sports medicine, physical therapy and high-use Pilates and yoga sessions. Its high-density is perfect to relieve tight or injured muscles, perform self-myofascial release on trigger points and knots, self-massage soft tissue and roll away soreness. Professionals use high-density AXIS Black Rollers to roll out tough muscle adhesions in the heavier lower extremities including the iliotibial band (IT band), piriformis, hamstrings or quads.Constructed of heat-molded closed-cell foam beads, the AXIS will not break down or lose its shape after moderate to heavy use.", "text": "OPTP Axis Roller Black Round 36 x 6 OPTP's firm Black AXIS foam roller is designed to perform in demanding sports medicine, physical therapy and high-use Pilates and yoga sessions. Its high-density is perfect to relieve tight or injured muscles, perform self-myofascial release on trigger points and knots, self-massage soft tissue and roll away soreness. Professionals use high-density AXIS Black Rollers to roll out tough muscle adhesions in the heavier lower extremities including the iliotibial band (IT band), piriformis, hamstrings or quads.Constructed of heat-molded closed-cell foam beads, the AXIS will not break down or lose its shape after moderate to heavy use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aMFI5e0TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MPU106.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OPTP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 23.26}}
{"item_id": "B001MQ64JM", "title": "Atomic Aquatics Frameless Mask for Scuba Diving and Snorkeling", "description": "The Atomic Aquatics Frameless Mask is focused on fit, comfort and a wide vision field. The large lens and close fitting skirt work in harmony to create perhaps the widest viewing angle of any frameless mask design. The lens shape was computer designed to maximize upward, downward and side to side vision. Because an external frame is not needed, the viewable area of the lens is optimized. Squeeze-to-adjust buckles are tucked behind the lens for a sleek hydrodynamic design.", "text": "Atomic Aquatics Frameless Mask for Scuba Diving and Snorkeling The Atomic Aquatics Frameless Mask is focused on fit, comfort and a wide vision field. The large lens and close fitting skirt work in harmony to create perhaps the widest viewing angle of any frameless mask design. The lens shape was computer designed to maximize upward, downward and side to side vision. Because an external frame is not needed, the viewable area of the lens is optimized. Squeeze-to-adjust buckles are tucked behind the lens for a sleek hydrodynamic design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3181P1bZWsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MQ64JM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Backpacks"]], "price": 109.0}}
{"item_id": "B001MQ7MEI", "title": "Authentic Nautical Fish Net - Decorative Use 10' X 5' New", "description": "Authentic Fish Net. Grey/Tan. Approximately 5' X 10'. Great for beach houses, luaus, recreation rooms or anywhere a nautical look is needed. Sturdy enough to hold your added touch, such as starfish, seashells, corks, rope, etc.", "text": "Authentic Nautical Fish Net - Decorative Use 10' X 5' New Authentic Fish Net. Grey/Tan. Approximately 5' X 10'. Great for beach houses, luaus, recreation rooms or anywhere a nautical look is needed. Sturdy enough to hold your added touch, such as starfish, seashells, corks, rope, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hGePrZgGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MQ7MEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "9GreenBox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Nets"]], "price": 9.99}}
