{"item_id": "B001MS6OM2", "title": "GoPro Roll Bar Mount", "description": "Use the GoPro Roll Bar Mount to attach your GoPro Hero HD camera to the bars of your dune buggy, four-wheeler, or big mountain bike. Attach this sturdy stainless steel and polycarbonate camera mount to any bar or tube with a diameter 1.4 to 2.5 inches wide and add more angles to your films.. The three-piece orientation arm allows three-way adjustability and gives you the versatility you need to keep up with your avante-shred filmmaking. The Roll Bar Mount works with all quick-release GoPro Hero cameras and tightens onto any bar or tube on your 4x4, roof rack, downhill mountain bike, go cart, or clown car.Product FeaturesMaterial: polycarbonate, stainless steelDimensions:Zoom Length:Effective Focal Length:Field of View:Aperature:Resolution:Megapixels:Memory Card Type:Video Size:Video Formats:Video Processor:Sensor:Photo Formats:Frame Rates:Battery Type:ISO Range:LCD Size:Manual Exposure:Manual Focus:Flash:Mic Type:Operating System:PC Connection:Attachment Type:Weight:Recommended Use: cars, trucks, demolition derby cars, bars or tubesManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "GoPro Roll Bar Mount Use the GoPro Roll Bar Mount to attach your GoPro Hero HD camera to the bars of your dune buggy, four-wheeler, or big mountain bike. Attach this sturdy stainless steel and polycarbonate camera mount to any bar or tube with a diameter 1.4 to 2.5 inches wide and add more angles to your films.. The three-piece orientation arm allows three-way adjustability and gives you the versatility you need to keep up with your avante-shred filmmaking. The Roll Bar Mount works with all quick-release GoPro Hero cameras and tightens onto any bar or tube on your 4x4, roof rack, downhill mountain bike, go cart, or clown car.Product FeaturesMaterial: polycarbonate, stainless steelDimensions:Zoom Length:Effective Focal Length:Field of View:Aperature:Resolution:Megapixels:Memory Card Type:Video Size:Video Formats:Video Processor:Sensor:Photo Formats:Frame Rates:Battery Type:ISO Range:LCD Size:Manual Exposure:Manual Focus:Flash:Mic Type:Operating System:PC Connection:Attachment Type:Weight:Recommended Use: cars, trucks, demolition derby cars, bars or tubesManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OWobAzDVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MS6OM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoPro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Steering Equipment", "Steering Wheels"]], "price": 14.0}}
