{"item_id": "B001MSJQTU", "title": "Harbinger 373700 Leather 3-Inch Double Ring Ankle Cuff Attachment", "description": "Build overall leg and targeted muscle strength with the Harbinger 3\" Heavy Duty Ankle Cuff. The expanded 3\" ankle wrap lessens stress on ankles in lifting heavier weights. With plush shearling lining for enhanced comfort, the Harbinger ankle cuff clips easily to universal gym cable machines with attached D-ring.", "text": "Harbinger 373700 Leather 3-Inch Double Ring Ankle Cuff Attachment Build overall leg and targeted muscle strength with the Harbinger 3\" Heavy Duty Ankle Cuff. The expanded 3\" ankle wrap lessens stress on ankles in lifting heavier weights. With plush shearling lining for enhanced comfort, the Harbinger ankle cuff clips easily to universal gym cable machines with attached D-ring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OgzLCTEHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MSJQTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harbinger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Leg Machines"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B001MSTDHU", "title": "j/fit Vinyl Kettlebells", "description": "Build a gym in the convenience of your own home with j/fit Vinyl Kettlebells. Choose from a 5, 8, 10, 12, 15, 20, 25, 30, or a 35-Pound bell to meet your strength needs. Each cast iron bell is encased in vinyl to help reduce noise and prevent damage to floors. It also features smooth, solid steel handles for a comfortable grip. The handle measures 1-Inch in diameter. Color-coded by weight. For indoor use only.", "text": "j/fit Vinyl Kettlebells Build a gym in the convenience of your own home with j/fit Vinyl Kettlebells. Choose from a 5, 8, 10, 12, 15, 20, 25, 30, or a 35-Pound bell to meet your strength needs. Each cast iron bell is encased in vinyl to help reduce noise and prevent damage to floors. It also features smooth, solid steel handles for a comfortable grip. The handle measures 1-Inch in diameter. Color-coded by weight. For indoor use only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G6uzD9CNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MSTDHU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JFIT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]], "price": 23.04}}
{"item_id": "B001MT5XAA", "title": "150 Lbs Wood Crossbow with Scope and Pack of Metal Arrows", "description": "FEATURES: FIELD TO USE 110 YARDS NOT A TOY...... Safety mechanism Auto safety when cocking ARROWS GO 200+ fps AT 60 YARDS WITH PIN POINT ACCURACY REGULAR CROSSBOW DRAW WEIGHT 150LBS WITH 1 FIBER GLASS BOW 8 ALUMINUM ARROWS AND A SCOPE. THIS IS A HIGH POWER CROSSBOW INTENDED TO BE USED BY THOSE WHO ARE 18 OR OVER.", "text": "150 Lbs Wood Crossbow with Scope and Pack of Metal Arrows FEATURES: FIELD TO USE 110 YARDS NOT A TOY...... Safety mechanism Auto safety when cocking ARROWS GO 200+ fps AT 60 YARDS WITH PIN POINT ACCURACY REGULAR CROSSBOW DRAW WEIGHT 150LBS WITH 1 FIBER GLASS BOW 8 ALUMINUM ARROWS AND A SCOPE. THIS IS A HIGH POWER CROSSBOW INTENDED TO BE USED BY THOSE WHO ARE 18 OR OVER.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BpUQ%2BMx5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MT5XAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Last Punch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 90.0}}
