{"item_id": "B001MTI4AG", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 5510K K.I.S.S. in the Dark 2.25-Inch Serrated Blade Knife, Black", "description": "K.I.S.S in the Dark made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is an all black serrated knife/money clip. The Tanto inspired chisel point grind has a unique flat backside to the blade so when closed it precisely fits onto the frame not allowing it to get cut anything even though the knife is exposed.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 5510K K.I.S.S. in the Dark 2.25-Inch Serrated Blade Knife, Black K.I.S.S in the Dark made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is an all black serrated knife/money clip. The Tanto inspired chisel point grind has a unique flat backside to the blade so when closed it precisely fits onto the frame not allowing it to get cut anything even though the knife is exposed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S471dMgzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MTI4AG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MTUJRM", "title": "SE Dual Zippered Durable Lightweight Travel Pouch Fanny Pack, 11.5\"x5\", Olive", "description": "This product has dual zippered pockts. Measures 11.5 in. x 5 in.. It is durable and lightweight! Has strong elastic straps to fit securely and comfortably around your waist.", "text": "SE Dual Zippered Durable Lightweight Travel Pouch Fanny Pack, 11.5\"x5\", Olive This product has dual zippered pockts. Measures 11.5 in. x 5 in.. It is durable and lightweight! Has strong elastic straps to fit securely and comfortably around your waist.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BUyyAKaHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MTUJRM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 5.02}}
