{"item_id": "B001MVE5NO", "title": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Quick Disconnect (Male)", "description": "From a drop-leg platform to a vest-mount platform, the SERPA Quick Disconnect System allows you to move your SERPA holster effortlessly between any SERPA platforms. Instantly adjust your gear as mission requires, and mount your holster at any of the 360 degree angles. This is an offering of male portion of kit.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! SERPA Quick Disconnect (Male) From a drop-leg platform to a vest-mount platform, the SERPA Quick Disconnect System allows you to move your SERPA holster effortlessly between any SERPA platforms. Instantly adjust your gear as mission requires, and mount your holster at any of the 360 degree angles. This is an offering of male portion of kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZxlGaUv5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MVE5NO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 11.41}}
{"item_id": "B001MVFDO4", "title": "Blackhawk! - 74SG Sportster Tactical Rifle Case (Black)", "description": "This BLACKHAWK! SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from BLACKHAWK! No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range. Perfect case for storage and transport of your AR and mags with extra pockets for accessories. Five exterior mag pockets and two large accessory pockets for gear. Wraparound tactical web handles provide superior weight support and durability. Built from tight-weave, heavyweight 600 denier polyester with thick PVC laminate for added stability. Interior of case features extra soft fabric to protect the finish of your firearm. Dual-density foam design incorporates open-cell foam next to gun for protection and closed-cell foam on the outside to protect against impact. Heavy-duty tactical webbing used on shoulder straps and contact points. Self-healing, heavy-duty, oversized coil zippers last longer. Closure features a loop on the case to lock the zipper pull together for a lockable case. Seams include heavy binding with two rows of locked stitching for durability.", "text": "Blackhawk! - 74SG Sportster Tactical Rifle Case (Black) This BLACKHAWK! SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from BLACKHAWK! No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range. Perfect case for storage and transport of your AR and mags with extra pockets for accessories. Five exterior mag pockets and two large accessory pockets for gear. Wraparound tactical web handles provide superior weight support and durability. Built from tight-weave, heavyweight 600 denier polyester with thick PVC laminate for added stability. Interior of case features extra soft fabric to protect the finish of your firearm. Dual-density foam design incorporates open-cell foam next to gun for protection and closed-cell foam on the outside to protect against impact. Heavy-duty tactical webbing used on shoulder straps and contact points. Self-healing, heavy-duty, oversized coil zippers last longer. Closure features a loop on the case to lock the zipper pull together for a lockable case. Seams include heavy binding with two rows of locked stitching for durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zfc3VfwDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MVFDO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MW31XS", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Sol Survival Blanket, Two Person, 3.2 Ounce", "description": "The most advanced emergency blanket on the market - meticulously designed never to fail when you're counting on it with your life. It all starts with the material - vacuum-metalized polyethylene reflects 90% of your body heat while also offering a number of other important features that set it apart from traditional mylar blankets: it opens easily and will not shred if nicked or punctured, rips and tears can be repaired, it is quiet and won't crinkle in high winds, and its high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to find you. Plus, survival tips and techniques are printed directly on the blanket so you have them when you need them. Sized to fit two people.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Sol Survival Blanket, Two Person, 3.2 Ounce The most advanced emergency blanket on the market - meticulously designed never to fail when you're counting on it with your life. It all starts with the material - vacuum-metalized polyethylene reflects 90% of your body heat while also offering a number of other important features that set it apart from traditional mylar blankets: it opens easily and will not shred if nicked or punctured, rips and tears can be repaired, it is quiet and won't crinkle in high winds, and its high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to find you. Plus, survival tips and techniques are printed directly on the blanket so you have them when you need them. Sized to fit two people.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qHDTRPF1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MW31XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B001MW8IOA", "title": "11,000 BBs for Airsoft Guns 6mm .12g Seamless", "description": "These now come in JARS of 11,000 BBs .12g. Great for those who have automatic guns that fire a lot of BBs. The color of the BBs received by buyers may very depending on shipments, and colors are chosen at random.", "text": "11,000 BBs for Airsoft Guns 6mm .12g Seamless These now come in JARS of 11,000 BBs .12g. Great for those who have automatic guns that fire a lot of BBs. The color of the BBs received by buyers may very depending on shipments, and colors are chosen at random.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61pIoCc10AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MW8IOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B001MWMDIW", "title": "Camp Chef Outdoor Camp Oven Bag", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Outdoor Camp Oven Bag Weather-resistant liner Full zip for easy insertion of oven Padded bag helps protect your camp oven 2 easy carry handles Large EZ glide zipper The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 11 x 13 x 6.5\" Box Weight: 3 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Camp Chef Outdoor Camp Oven Bag DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Outdoor Camp Oven Bag Weather-resistant liner Full zip for easy insertion of oven Padded bag helps protect your camp oven 2 easy carry handles Large EZ glide zipper The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 11 x 13 x 6.5\" Box Weight: 3 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o2ZtGwb8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MWMDIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 49.89}}
{"item_id": "B001MWRRME", "title": "TYR Socket Rockets 2.0 Racing Metallized Goggle", "description": "TYR Socket Rocket 2.0 Metallized Racing Goggles provide a universal fit for adults and youth swimmers. A double silicone headstrap conforms to the side of the head and provides a secure fit. Optical-grade polycarbonate lenses are low-profile and provide wide-angle viewing. Excellent choice for performance oriented athletes. Offers Anti/fog, UV protection.", "text": "TYR Socket Rockets 2.0 Racing Metallized Goggle TYR Socket Rocket 2.0 Metallized Racing Goggles provide a universal fit for adults and youth swimmers. A double silicone headstrap conforms to the side of the head and provides a secure fit. Optical-grade polycarbonate lenses are low-profile and provide wide-angle viewing. Excellent choice for performance oriented athletes. Offers Anti/fog, UV protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31auDQl2mGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MWRRME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MWRRWE", "title": "TYR Nest Pro Metallized Goggle", "description": "The Nest Pro Metallized is our fastest growing goggle. Soft TPR gaskets create a water-tight fit. The gaskets fit comfortably with a lower profile than the Nest Pro. Wide peripheral cellulose propionate lenses feature imbedded anti-fog properties and are UV protected. The Nano offers the same great lenses, headstrap and style of the Nest Pro.", "text": "TYR Nest Pro Metallized Goggle The Nest Pro Metallized is our fastest growing goggle. Soft TPR gaskets create a water-tight fit. The gaskets fit comfortably with a lower profile than the Nest Pro. Wide peripheral cellulose propionate lenses feature imbedded anti-fog properties and are UV protected. The Nano offers the same great lenses, headstrap and style of the Nest Pro.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s3x4f-VnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MWRRWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 20.35}}
{"item_id": "B001MWRS4Q", "title": "TYR Corrective Optical Performance Goggle", "description": "There is no need for contacts or poor vision in the water with the Tyr Corrective Optical Goggles. The Corrective Optical goggle is a distinctive step diopter goggle in spherical prescription lens options. It features a universal eye socket frame design for superior fit, wide angle, optical grade polycarbonate lenses, comfortable Thermal Plastic Rubber gaskets that provide both comfort and leak-proof fit, and a durable, split TPR head strap providing a comfortable yet secure fit.", "text": "TYR Corrective Optical Performance Goggle There is no need for contacts or poor vision in the water with the Tyr Corrective Optical Goggles. The Corrective Optical goggle is a distinctive step diopter goggle in spherical prescription lens options. It features a universal eye socket frame design for superior fit, wide angle, optical grade polycarbonate lenses, comfortable Thermal Plastic Rubber gaskets that provide both comfort and leak-proof fit, and a durable, split TPR head strap providing a comfortable yet secure fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wmNWoH6xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MWRS4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001MXODA2", "title": "6 Pk Keyed Alike Gun Trigger Locks", "description": "6 pack gun locks all keyed the same has 12 keys. These are not CA approved locks. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks.", "text": "6 Pk Keyed Alike Gun Trigger Locks 6 pack gun locks all keyed the same has 12 keys. These are not CA approved locks. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VmkNhWAdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MXODA2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Locks"]], "price": 32.37}}
{"item_id": "B001MXS5QK", "title": "3 Pk Keyed Alike Gun Trigger Locks", "description": "3 pack keyed alike gun locks with 6 keys. Plain brown box packaging only. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks. These are NOT CA approved locks.", "text": "3 Pk Keyed Alike Gun Trigger Locks 3 pack keyed alike gun locks with 6 keys. Plain brown box packaging only. These fit most guns however they will not fit lever action or double barrel guns. They will not fit then Ruger Mark I or most Glocks. The trigger guard is simply too wide on Glocks. These are NOT CA approved locks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e49IS4jLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MXS5QK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Locks"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B001MYCV6E", "title": "Troy Industries Folding Battle Sight Rear", "description": "Durability and dead-on accuracy have made Troy Industries Folding BattleSights the hands-down choice of Special Ops and tactical users worldwide. Easy to install and to deploy, with no levers or springs to fumble with, these sights position apertures at exact factory height. A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions. A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again (they fold to a profile of just 0.460). Troy BattleSights feature a zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers. Features: - No tools are required for adjustment - Each click equals .50 MOA of adjustment - Blackened Stainless Steel - MIL-SPEC Type III Hard Coated - T6 Aircraft Aluminum construction - Made in the USA - Black", "text": "Troy Industries Folding Battle Sight Rear Durability and dead-on accuracy have made Troy Industries Folding BattleSights the hands-down choice of Special Ops and tactical users worldwide. Easy to install and to deploy, with no levers or springs to fumble with, these sights position apertures at exact factory height. A stainless-steel cross-locking system ensures sights remain upright and zeroed under extreme combat conditions. A push of a button folds the sights securely out of the way until you need them again (they fold to a profile of just 0.460). Troy BattleSights feature a zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers. Features: - No tools are required for adjustment - Each click equals .50 MOA of adjustment - Blackened Stainless Steel - MIL-SPEC Type III Hard Coated - T6 Aircraft Aluminum construction - Made in the USA - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DEKC81AhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYCV6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 103.25}}
{"item_id": "B001MYESWE", "title": "Lee Precision 20 Pound Pro 4 Electric Metal Melter (Red)", "description": "The Lee Precision Electric Metal Melter Pro is a large diameter high capacity pot, holds approximately 20 pounds of lead. A generous 4 inches of clearance under the spout accepts all brands of bullet molds and most sinker molds.", "text": "Lee Precision 20 Pound Pro 4 Electric Metal Melter (Red) The Lee Precision Electric Metal Melter Pro is a large diameter high capacity pot, holds approximately 20 pounds of lead. A generous 4 inches of clearance under the spout accepts all brands of bullet molds and most sinker molds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N7LThPXcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYESWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 79.2}}
{"item_id": "B001MYETTQ", "title": "Plano 10-10485 SE Single Rifle/Shotg", "description": "With a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman, this case holds a shotgun or rifle with a standard or high-mount scope. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 52.5\" long x 11.32\" wide x 3.25\" high", "text": "Plano 10-10485 SE Single Rifle/Shotg With a rugged look and solid protection for the beginning sportsman, this case holds a shotgun or rifle with a standard or high-mount scope. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 52.5\" long x 11.32\" wide x 3.25\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i0YbPaWPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYETTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 22.97}}
{"item_id": "B001MYEU0E", "title": "Lyman 49Th Edition Reloading Handbook", "description": "Lyman's new 49th Edition Reloading Handbook is the latest version of their extremely popular rifle and pistol manual. The 49th Edition covers all popular new rifle calibers such as the 204 Ruger, 6.8 Rem SPC, 325 WSM, 338 Federal, 375 Ruger, 405 Winchester and the WSSM series. In addition, new pistol calibers such as the 5.7x28mm, and 460 S&W; are also included. A wide selection of powders are included covering Alliant, Accurate, Hodgdon, Ramshot, VihtaVuori, and Winchester. Additionally, most popular bullet brands are also used including Barnes, Hornady, Nosler, Sierra, Speer, and Swift. As always, full coverage is also given to Lyman cast bullets throughout the handbook. This is the one handbook that should find a home on all reloading benches.", "text": "Lyman 49Th Edition Reloading Handbook Lyman's new 49th Edition Reloading Handbook is the latest version of their extremely popular rifle and pistol manual. The 49th Edition covers all popular new rifle calibers such as the 204 Ruger, 6.8 Rem SPC, 325 WSM, 338 Federal, 375 Ruger, 405 Winchester and the WSSM series. In addition, new pistol calibers such as the 5.7x28mm, and 460 S&W; are also included. A wide selection of powders are included covering Alliant, Accurate, Hodgdon, Ramshot, VihtaVuori, and Winchester. Additionally, most popular bullet brands are also used including Barnes, Hornady, Nosler, Sierra, Speer, and Swift. As always, full coverage is also given to Lyman cast bullets throughout the handbook. This is the one handbook that should find a home on all reloading benches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xvB4vqFkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYEU0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B001MYGLJC", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Quick-n-Ez Case Tumbler", "description": "The Frankford Arsenal Case Tumbler provides a quick, easy, and economical means to clean your brass. Used in conjunction with Frankford Arsenal Walnut and Corn Cob Medias, the Quick-N-EZ Case Tumbler removes fouling, lube, and oxidation quickly and conveniently. It will hold up to 600 9mm or 350 223 cases.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Quick-n-Ez Case Tumbler The Frankford Arsenal Case Tumbler provides a quick, easy, and economical means to clean your brass. Used in conjunction with Frankford Arsenal Walnut and Corn Cob Medias, the Quick-N-EZ Case Tumbler removes fouling, lube, and oxidation quickly and conveniently. It will hold up to 600 9mm or 350 223 cases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411LuDHIlfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYGLJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 45.44}}
{"item_id": "B001MYGM5A", "title": "Plano 10586 Gun Guard SE Double Scoped/Shotgun Case", "description": "With a rugged look and solid protection, this case holds two rifles with high-mount 50mm scopes or two shotguns with room for accessories. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 52.2\" long x 15.97\" wide x 4\" high", "text": "Plano 10586 Gun Guard SE Double Scoped/Shotgun Case With a rugged look and solid protection, this case holds two rifles with high-mount 50mm scopes or two shotguns with room for accessories. Gun Guard SE Series cases feature contoured recessed latches, padlock tabs for added security and strong, rigid ribbed construction. Product dimensions: 52.2\" long x 15.97\" wide x 4\" high", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NFsWjC96L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYGM5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 42.45}}
{"item_id": "B001MYIPJ6", "title": "EOTech 517.A65 Holographic Sight", "description": "Made in the USA, this weapons sight was developed to optimize EOTech's proprietary Holographic Weapon Sight technology. Control buttons have been moved from the back to the left side of the unit for instant access, while allowing for mounting of a magnifier or back-up iron sight. Additionally, a portion of the front base has been raised to allow the sight to fit over standard hand guards found on many M-4 or M-16 style weapons.SpecificationsOperationParallax-free transmission holography optics1X magnificationUnlimited eye reliefMeasures 2.1 by 2.8 by 5.6 inches (W x H x D)11.9-ounce weight-40 to 150 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperatureSubmersible to 10 feet underwaterFog-proof internal optics0.5-inch at 100 yards MOA adjustment+/- MOA travel adjustment rangeOne-inch Picatinny railHeads-up Display WindowAnti-glare optical surface coatingWindow measures 1.2 by 0.85 inches (W x H)0.125-inch solid glass front window0.1875-inch, shatter-resistant laminate rear window30-yard field of view at 100 yards at four-inch eye reliefElectrical146,000:1 brightness adjustment rangePowered by two 1.5-volt AA batteries1,000 continuous hours of use at nominal setting 12 with lithium batteries; 600 hours with alkaline20 brightness settings, with scrolling featureFlashing auto battery check indicator at start-upAuto-shutdownWarrantyEOTech products include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About EOTechEOTech is a subsidiary of L-3 Communications, the sixth largest defense company in the United States, and a leading defense contractor in ISR (Intelligence, Surveillance, and Reconnaissance), secure communications, government services, training and simulation, and aircraft modernization and maintenance. L-3 Communications is also a leading merchant supplier of guidance and navigation products and systems, sensors, scanners, data links, propulsion systems, avionics, electro optics, satellite communications, encryption products, signal intelligence, antennas, and microwave products.L-3 EOTech uses advanced laser and holographic technology to enhance optical devices in target acquisition systems, recreational sport optics, and sighted automation environments, and the company invented, designed, and manufactures the Holographic Weapon Sight (HWS), the world's first holographic sighting system for small- and medium-sized weapon platforms. HWS uses patented technology to provide remarkably durable, parallax-free sighting. HWS additionally removes some of the complexities from targeting, and allows the aiming process to become almost instinctive and reflexive.After winning the \"Optic of the Year Award\" from the Shooting Industry Academy of Excellence, EOTech later introduced their military and law enforcement HWS in 2001. Since then, HWS has been standardized by US Special Operations Command (SOCOM), FBI, DEA, State Department, US Border Patrol, Immigration & Customs Enforcement (ICE), NYPD, LAPD, Texas State Police, and many international special operations forces.", "text": "EOTech 517.A65 Holographic Sight Made in the USA, this weapons sight was developed to optimize EOTech's proprietary Holographic Weapon Sight technology. Control buttons have been moved from the back to the left side of the unit for instant access, while allowing for mounting of a magnifier or back-up iron sight. Additionally, a portion of the front base has been raised to allow the sight to fit over standard hand guards found on many M-4 or M-16 style weapons.SpecificationsOperationParallax-free transmission holography optics1X magnificationUnlimited eye reliefMeasures 2.1 by 2.8 by 5.6 inches (W x H x D)11.9-ounce weight-40 to 150 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperatureSubmersible to 10 feet underwaterFog-proof internal optics0.5-inch at 100 yards MOA adjustment+/- MOA travel adjustment rangeOne-inch Picatinny railHeads-up Display WindowAnti-glare optical surface coatingWindow measures 1.2 by 0.85 inches (W x H)0.125-inch solid glass front window0.1875-inch, shatter-resistant laminate rear window30-yard field of view at 100 yards at four-inch eye reliefElectrical146,000:1 brightness adjustment rangePowered by two 1.5-volt AA batteries1,000 continuous hours of use at nominal setting 12 with lithium batteries; 600 hours with alkaline20 brightness settings, with scrolling featureFlashing auto battery check indicator at start-upAuto-shutdownWarrantyEOTech products include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About EOTechEOTech is a subsidiary of L-3 Communications, the sixth largest defense company in the United States, and a leading defense contractor in ISR (Intelligence, Surveillance, and Reconnaissance), secure communications, government services, training and simulation, and aircraft modernization and maintenance. L-3 Communications is also a leading merchant supplier of guidance and navigation products and systems, sensors, scanners, data links, propulsion systems, avionics, electro optics, satellite communications, encryption products, signal intelligence, antennas, and microwave products.L-3 EOTech uses advanced laser and holographic technology to enhance optical devices in target acquisition systems, recreational sport optics, and sighted automation environments, and the company invented, designed, and manufactures the Holographic Weapon Sight (HWS), the world's first holographic sighting system for small- and medium-sized weapon platforms. HWS uses patented technology to provide remarkably durable, parallax-free sighting. HWS additionally removes some of the complexities from targeting, and allows the aiming process to become almost instinctive and reflexive.After winning the \"Optic of the Year Award\" from the Shooting Industry Academy of Excellence, EOTech later introduced their military and law enforcement HWS in 2001. Since then, HWS has been standardized by US Special Operations Command (SOCOM), FBI, DEA, State Department, US Border Patrol, Immigration & Customs Enforcement (ICE), NYPD, LAPD, Texas State Police, and many international special operations forces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41exoLKwOQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYIPJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 458.99}}
{"item_id": "B001MYIWP8", "title": "Safariland J-K2C COMP II Speedloader", "description": "This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "text": "Safariland J-K2C COMP II Speedloader This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411C6J4BQVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYIWP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.15}}
{"item_id": "B001MYIX7A", "title": "Flambeau Safeshot Oversized Single Case", "description": "This gun case provides extra security with four locking points and offers a durable foam to keep your gun safe.", "text": "Flambeau Safeshot Oversized Single Case This gun case provides extra security with four locking points and offers a durable foam to keep your gun safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4116GZYvH-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYIX7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flambeau", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 41.26}}
{"item_id": "B001MYKG70", "title": "NFL Logo Flag, 3 by 5-Feet", "description": "Officially licensed 3' x 5' flag with attached D-rings. The imprint is 100% show through to the backside with a long lasting color-fast die. Fly on a flagpole or hang it on a wall. Flags come poly-bagged with header and graphic displayed. Made in USA.", "text": "NFL Logo Flag, 3 by 5-Feet Officially licensed 3' x 5' flag with attached D-rings. The imprint is 100% show through to the backside with a long lasting color-fast die. Fly on a flagpole or hang it on a wall. Flags come poly-bagged with header and graphic displayed. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51e6Qj9eILL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYKG70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WinCraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Patio, Lawn & Garden", "Outdoor Flags"]], "price": 28.0}}
{"item_id": "B001MYM7HC", "title": "Ps Holster Mate Bed Bracket", "description": "Quick - access Holster Mate keeps your preferred sidearm close... even in the dead of night. During home invasions, seconds count. And handguns kept out of reach may not protect you or your family in time. The innovative Holster Mate offers a convenient concealment option. Bracket secures between your bed's mattress and box spring, allowing you to use your own clip-style holster to keep an arm's-reach pistol at your bedside, where it can be accessed in seconds to defend against nocturnal intruders. Get the drop, and be the victor... not the victim. Secret storage: Universal, works with any mattress; Installs in seconds; Includes VELCRO brand fastening strip for extra security; Works with all clip-style holsters.; 6 ozs. Order Today! Holster Mate Bedside Handgun Concealment Bracket", "text": "Ps Holster Mate Bed Bracket Quick - access Holster Mate keeps your preferred sidearm close... even in the dead of night. During home invasions, seconds count. And handguns kept out of reach may not protect you or your family in time. The innovative Holster Mate offers a convenient concealment option. Bracket secures between your bed's mattress and box spring, allowing you to use your own clip-style holster to keep an arm's-reach pistol at your bedside, where it can be accessed in seconds to defend against nocturnal intruders. Get the drop, and be the victor... not the victim. Secret storage: Universal, works with any mattress; Installs in seconds; Includes VELCRO brand fastening strip for extra security; Works with all clip-style holsters.; 6 ozs. Order Today! Holster Mate Bedside Handgun Concealment Bracket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QnOSY0u2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYM7HC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.48}}
{"item_id": "B001MYYOB4", "title": "Fobus Holster Double Magazine Pouch, Paddle, Single Stack, .45 Cal 9MM", "description": "Double mag pouch single stack. Custom retention system with a low profile and is streamlined.", "text": "Fobus Holster Double Magazine Pouch, Paddle, Single Stack, .45 Cal 9MM Double mag pouch single stack. Custom retention system with a low profile and is streamlined.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414nT3ZlWHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MYYOB4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.96}}
{"item_id": "B001MZ2EHO", "title": "Signal Mirror", "description": "Heliography is the use of the sun's light to transmit messages dating back to ancient Greek & Roman times. This mirror is made of \" laminated glass, and instructions are printed on the back. The sighting hole features a special reflectorized screen that directs a beam of sunlight onto the target. Reflect sunlight from mirror onto a nearby surface (raft, hand etc.) Slowly bring mirror up to eye level and look through sighting hole. You will see a bright spot: this is the aim indicator. Hold mirror close to the eye and slowly turn and manipulate it so that the bright light spot is on the target. Even if no potential rescuers are in sight, continue sweeping the horizon or other possible rescuer locations, as mirror flashes can be seen for distances up to 20 miles.", "text": "Signal Mirror Heliography is the use of the sun's light to transmit messages dating back to ancient Greek & Roman times. This mirror is made of \" laminated glass, and instructions are printed on the back. The sighting hole features a special reflectorized screen that directs a beam of sunlight onto the target. Reflect sunlight from mirror onto a nearby surface (raft, hand etc.) Slowly bring mirror up to eye level and look through sighting hole. You will see a bright spot: this is the aim indicator. Hold mirror close to the eye and slowly turn and manipulate it so that the bright light spot is on the target. Even if no potential rescuers are in sight, continue sweeping the horizon or other possible rescuer locations, as mirror flashes can be seen for distances up to 20 miles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419N82CSRiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001MZ2EHO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B001N14UEM", "title": "PROMATE Backpack Style Bag For Mask, Snorkel, & Fins Scuba Diving Gear Snorkeling Surfing Travel Overnight Back Pack Bag", "description": "Both practical, convenient and affordable backpack-style bags for Snorkeling Gear are perfect for vacation or carrying your snorkel gear to your local snorkeling spots. Both feature 600 denier nylon/PVC for highest protection, Heavy duty PVC coated mesh insertion at top & sides for ventilation, Nylon Top Carry Handle, Elastic cord on front for beach towels. See Product Features above for different size and some features to fits various needs.", "text": "PROMATE Backpack Style Bag For Mask, Snorkel, & Fins Scuba Diving Gear Snorkeling Surfing Travel Overnight Back Pack Bag Both practical, convenient and affordable backpack-style bags for Snorkeling Gear are perfect for vacation or carrying your snorkel gear to your local snorkeling spots. Both feature 600 denier nylon/PVC for highest protection, Heavy duty PVC coated mesh insertion at top & sides for ventilation, Nylon Top Carry Handle, Elastic cord on front for beach towels. See Product Features above for different size and some features to fits various needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YGTTKkWML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N14UEM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Promate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Backpacks"]], "price": 28.67}}
{"item_id": "B001N1CBB6", "title": "Ka-Bar BK11 Becker Necker Neck Knife", "description": "The Ka-Bar Becker Necker is the quintessential neck knife. The knife is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Becker Necker also includes a black plastic, injection-molded, glass-filled nylon sheath that's designed to work with the TDI metal belt clip. As a result, it's easy to mount the knife to a belt, boot, or tactical vest. Marked with the new Ka-Bar Becker stamp, the Necker is a true high-quality performer.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 15 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelShape: Drop pointPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: N/ABlade length: 3-1/4 inchesOverall length: 6-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.15 pounds", "text": "Ka-Bar BK11 Becker Necker Neck Knife The Ka-Bar Becker Necker is the quintessential neck knife. The knife is made of 1095 Cro-Van steel, an easy-to-sharpen carbon steel that keeps its edge well. The Becker Necker also includes a black plastic, injection-molded, glass-filled nylon sheath that's designed to work with the TDI metal belt clip. As a result, it's easy to mount the knife to a belt, boot, or tactical vest. Marked with the new Ka-Bar Becker stamp, the Necker is a true high-quality performer.SpecificationsStamp: Ka-Bar BeckerEdge angle: 15 degreesBlade: 1095 Cro-Van steelShape: Drop pointPocket clip: N/ALock style: N/AGrind: FlatHandle material: N/ABlade length: 3-1/4 inchesOverall length: 6-3/4 inchesWeight: 0.15 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R%2BKbMpOxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N1CBB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 38.99}}
{"item_id": "B001N43GK8", "title": "Nodor Professional Tungseel Steel Tip Darts", "description": "Made by Nodor, these three tungsten-plated darts feature striped aluminum shafts and weigh between 20 and 22 grams apiece. (Weights will vary.) Included with the darts are spare flights and plastic shafts along with a Slim Trac case. This product is covered by a one-year warranty against defectsAbout NodorSince inventing the bristle dartboard in 1932, Nodor has always been at the forefront of darts innovation and technology.", "text": "Nodor Professional Tungseel Steel Tip Darts Made by Nodor, these three tungsten-plated darts feature striped aluminum shafts and weigh between 20 and 22 grams apiece. (Weights will vary.) Included with the darts are spare flights and plastic shafts along with a Slim Trac case. This product is covered by a one-year warranty against defectsAbout NodorSince inventing the bristle dartboard in 1932, Nodor has always been at the forefront of darts innovation and technology.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nOMzsUpZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N43GK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nodor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B001N43GLM", "title": "Nodor Black & Brass Steel Tip Darts", "description": "NODOR Painted Brass Steel-tip Dart Set features: Aggressively honed barrels for maximum control, Black aluminum shafts, 20, 22, and 24 gram (gram weights will vary), Set Includes: 3 darts with spare flights and plastic shafts, and Slim Trac case. One year warranty against defects.", "text": "Nodor Black & Brass Steel Tip Darts NODOR Painted Brass Steel-tip Dart Set features: Aggressively honed barrels for maximum control, Black aluminum shafts, 20, 22, and 24 gram (gram weights will vary), Set Includes: 3 darts with spare flights and plastic shafts, and Slim Trac case. One year warranty against defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fWp-5Lr0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N43GLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nodor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001N43GNU", "title": "Nodor Striped Metallic Steel Tip Darts (18-Gram)", "description": "NODOR Striped Metallic Steel-tip Dart Set features: Coated barrels with striping, Embossed foil flights, 18 gram, Set Includes: 3 darts with spare flights and shafts, and Slim carry case. One year warranty against defects.", "text": "Nodor Striped Metallic Steel Tip Darts (18-Gram) NODOR Striped Metallic Steel-tip Dart Set features: Coated barrels with striping, Embossed foil flights, 18 gram, Set Includes: 3 darts with spare flights and shafts, and Slim carry case. One year warranty against defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f87%2BW9nBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N43GNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nodor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B001N4I4NC", "title": "Continental Vertical Tire 26 x 2.3\" Black", "description": "Continental 0116008 Vertical 26 x 2.3 MTB Tire has everything a classic tire needs. It is at home on all trails, really showing what it can do when the terrain turns rugged. Still the top choice for tours in Alpine terrain where low weight and high puncture protection are paramount. The Vertical provides smooth rolling on hard pack and telepathic handling in the loose stuff. Equally suited for front or rear use. Not only does the Vertical provide such great cornering traction due to it's Endless Edge tread design and 2.3-inch profile, but it's lightweight construction also means that climbing is easier than you'd expect for a 2.3-inch tire. Specs: Weight - 730 grams; Recommended PSI - 50; Maximum PSI - 65; PU - 5.", "text": "Continental Vertical Tire 26 x 2.3\" Black Continental 0116008 Vertical 26 x 2.3 MTB Tire has everything a classic tire needs. It is at home on all trails, really showing what it can do when the terrain turns rugged. Still the top choice for tours in Alpine terrain where low weight and high puncture protection are paramount. The Vertical provides smooth rolling on hard pack and telepathic handling in the loose stuff. Equally suited for front or rear use. Not only does the Vertical provide such great cornering traction due to it's Endless Edge tread design and 2.3-inch profile, but it's lightweight construction also means that climbing is easier than you'd expect for a 2.3-inch tire. Specs: Weight - 730 grams; Recommended PSI - 50; Maximum PSI - 65; PU - 5.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BIm%2B2lp-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N4I4NC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 31.46}}
{"item_id": "B001N4K3G8", "title": "Scuba BC Knife", "description": "Scubamax Rounded Tip Stainless Steel BCD Dive KnifeScubamax Rounded Tip Stainless Steel BCD Dive Knife Details:420 Stainless steel BCD dive knife. Attachable to a hose. Single action button locking system sheath.BLADE SIZE : 3.25\"OVERALL SIZE : 7.5\"COLORS: Yellow, Blue, Clear, Black", "text": "Scuba BC Knife Scubamax Rounded Tip Stainless Steel BCD Dive KnifeScubamax Rounded Tip Stainless Steel BCD Dive Knife Details:420 Stainless steel BCD dive knife. Attachable to a hose. Single action button locking system sheath.BLADE SIZE : 3.25\"OVERALL SIZE : 7.5\"COLORS: Yellow, Blue, Clear, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rxQ0sOfvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N4K3G8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Divers' Knives & Shears"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B001N4P9W6", "title": "Akona 2mm Low-Cut Sock", "description": "2mm nylon II neoprene with glue and blind stitched seams for a superior water seal. Airprene side panels allow for water to drain while providing protection and warmth. Redesigned to provide a better fitting, warmer dive sock.Sizes:2-13", "text": "Akona 2mm Low-Cut Sock 2mm nylon II neoprene with glue and blind stitched seams for a superior water seal. Airprene side panels allow for water to drain while providing protection and warmth. Redesigned to provide a better fitting, warmer dive sock.Sizes:2-13", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xQV%2BnatTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N4P9W6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Surfing Booties"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001N82TP2", "title": "KMC Z510 1-Speed 1/8 112L Bike Chain", "description": "KMC Z510 1 chain specification is 1/2 x 1/8-Inch. Maximum speed of sprocket 1. Compatible bikes Freestyle, Anti-Drop series, Beach Cruiser, Internal Gear Hub System, Single Speed Bike, BMX.", "text": "KMC Z510 1-Speed 1/8 112L Bike Chain KMC Z510 1 chain specification is 1/2 x 1/8-Inch. Maximum speed of sprocket 1. Compatible bikes Freestyle, Anti-Drop series, Beach Cruiser, Internal Gear Hub System, Single Speed Bike, BMX.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Dk8Lkcl5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N82TP2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 18.25}}
{"item_id": "B001N82VSC", "title": "Replacement Mirror For Mirrycle Bicycle Mirrors", "description": "Break or crack a Mirrycle mirror without ruining the mounting hardware? This replacement mirror is just the ticket!", "text": "Replacement Mirror For Mirrycle Bicycle Mirrors Break or crack a Mirrycle mirror without ruining the mounting hardware? This replacement mirror is just the ticket!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31z3TBJ0siL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N82VSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 5.47}}
{"item_id": "B001N84J9G", "title": "HangTime Snowboard Wall Mount - Black", "description": "Snowboarders need a better way to store their boards. HangTime™ board mounts solve this while making the board a piece of art! No longer do you need to hang your board from the garage rafters, trip over it as it falls out of the closet or continuously move it out of the way. The HangTime™ mount allows the snowboard to be displayed on a wall either on an angle or vertical. It shows the board’s full graphics. Let’s face it you spent a lot for your board, why hide it in a closet.The HangTime™ mount is small, easy to install and use. Your snowboard will hang securely. You can hang or remove your board in less than a second. This makes it ready to use when you are ready to go. The plastic and rubber construction will not scratch your board. Everything you need to hang one snowboard is provided including hardware and instructions.Mount is black with metallic logo.Product is Made in the USA.", "text": "HangTime Snowboard Wall Mount - Black Snowboarders need a better way to store their boards. HangTime™ board mounts solve this while making the board a piece of art! No longer do you need to hang your board from the garage rafters, trip over it as it falls out of the closet or continuously move it out of the way. The HangTime™ mount allows the snowboard to be displayed on a wall either on an angle or vertical. It shows the board’s full graphics. Let’s face it you spent a lot for your board, why hide it in a closet.The HangTime™ mount is small, easy to install and use. Your snowboard will hang securely. You can hang or remove your board in less than a second. This makes it ready to use when you are ready to go. The plastic and rubber construction will not scratch your board. Everything you need to hang one snowboard is provided including hardware and instructions.Mount is black with metallic logo.Product is Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EuJZ8BdqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N84J9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HangTime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowboarding"]], "price": 18.14}}
{"item_id": "B001N888OS", "title": "Kryptonite 999522 Black 12mm x 66\" (1217) New York Chain and Evolution Series-4 Orange 14mm Disc Lock", "description": "A high security lock with innovative oval crossbar disc lock designed to defeat thieves' maximum attacks. 12mm six sided chain links made of 3t hardened manganese steel for maximum strength. Durable protective nylon cover with hook and loop fasteners to hold in place. Reinforced anti-drill or pull cylinder protection system. Sliding dustcover protects and extends cylinder life. Includes 3 stainless steel \"I\" keys for better ergonomics.", "text": "Kryptonite 999522 Black 12mm x 66\" (1217) New York Chain and Evolution Series-4 Orange 14mm Disc Lock A high security lock with innovative oval crossbar disc lock designed to defeat thieves' maximum attacks. 12mm six sided chain links made of 3t hardened manganese steel for maximum strength. Durable protective nylon cover with hook and loop fasteners to hold in place. Reinforced anti-drill or pull cylinder protection system. Sliding dustcover protects and extends cylinder life. Includes 3 stainless steel \"I\" keys for better ergonomics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lBOdIL3OL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N888OS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Chain Locks"]], "price": 113.79}}
{"item_id": "B001N9FT12", "title": "SE Natural Wooden Walking Stick - Hiking Pole - 50 Inch", "description": "Hand Carved Flower Design on Body. Removable Metal Reinforced Rubber Tip. Wrist Strap. Use for Support While Hiking and Walking. Material : Wood. Height : 50.", "text": "SE Natural Wooden Walking Stick - Hiking Pole - 50 Inch Hand Carved Flower Design on Body. Removable Metal Reinforced Rubber Tip. Wrist Strap. Use for Support While Hiking and Walking. Material : Wood. Height : 50.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21MgBDZdYrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001N9FT12.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 14.54}}
{"item_id": "B001NCDE1Q", "title": "NALGENE Tritan Grip-N-Gulp BPA-Free Water Bottle", "description": "", "text": "NALGENE Tritan Grip-N-Gulp BPA-Free Water Bottle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316l2vcGeYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NCDE1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.23}}
{"item_id": "B001NCDE34", "title": "NALGENE Tritan 1-Pint Narrow Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle", "description": "For those who prefer a roomy bottle with a smaller opening, we offer our narrow-mouth loop-top bottle. It offers all the same advantages as our wide-mouth, with a top that minimizes the chance of spills and a cap that never gets lost.", "text": "NALGENE Tritan 1-Pint Narrow Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle For those who prefer a roomy bottle with a smaller opening, we offer our narrow-mouth loop-top bottle. It offers all the same advantages as our wide-mouth, with a top that minimizes the chance of spills and a cap that never gets lost.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nwGf2fwQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NCDE34.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NCDE48", "title": "NALGENE Tritan 1-Quart Narrow Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle", "description": "Not everyone likes the wide-mouth design of traditional Nalgene water bottles, which is one reason the company built the narrow-mouth Nalgene Tritan. Made of super-tough Eastman Tritan polycarbonate, the Tritan offers the same roomy interior as most Nalgenes, but with a narrow loop top that minimizes the chance of spills and a cap that never gets lost. In addition, the bottle's BPA-free construction is impact-, odor-, and stain-resistant, helping it withstand a wide range of temperatures (from -40 to 212 degrees F) and last for years. Finally, the bottle includes printed graduations on the side, making it easy measure water quantities. Recommended for extreme adventures, the Tritan bottle is available in a variety of vivacious colors.About Nalgene OutdoorBased in Rochester, N.Y., Nalgene was founded in 1949 as a manufacturer of the first plastic pipette holder. The company soon expanded its product line to include state-of-the-art polyethylene labware under the Nalgene brand. By the 1970s, outdoor enthusiasts had discovered the taste and odor-resistant, leakproof, and rugged properties of Nalgene's large selection of plastic containers. In response to this emerging demand, Nalgene created a Consumer Products Division. In the ensuing years, Nalgene created a full line of bottles that were perfect for storing everything from water to powdered drinks to pancake mix to shampoo.", "text": "NALGENE Tritan 1-Quart Narrow Mouth BPA-Free Water Bottle Not everyone likes the wide-mouth design of traditional Nalgene water bottles, which is one reason the company built the narrow-mouth Nalgene Tritan. Made of super-tough Eastman Tritan polycarbonate, the Tritan offers the same roomy interior as most Nalgenes, but with a narrow loop top that minimizes the chance of spills and a cap that never gets lost. In addition, the bottle's BPA-free construction is impact-, odor-, and stain-resistant, helping it withstand a wide range of temperatures (from -40 to 212 degrees F) and last for years. Finally, the bottle includes printed graduations on the side, making it easy measure water quantities. Recommended for extreme adventures, the Tritan bottle is available in a variety of vivacious colors.About Nalgene OutdoorBased in Rochester, N.Y., Nalgene was founded in 1949 as a manufacturer of the first plastic pipette holder. The company soon expanded its product line to include state-of-the-art polyethylene labware under the Nalgene brand. By the 1970s, outdoor enthusiasts had discovered the taste and odor-resistant, leakproof, and rugged properties of Nalgene's large selection of plastic containers. In response to this emerging demand, Nalgene created a Consumer Products Division. In the ensuing years, Nalgene created a full line of bottles that were perfect for storing everything from water to powdered drinks to pancake mix to shampoo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41awXZsDLHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NCDE48.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NCDE5C", "title": "NALGENE Tritan OTG BPA-Free Water Bottle 24 Oz", "description": "Do away with plastic water bottles and go the reusable route with the Nalgene OTG. Made of super-tough Eastman Tritan polycarbonate, the OTG is the ultimate in mobile hydration, with a size that fits in most car cup holders, bike cages, and even exercise machines. In addition, the bottle offers an easy flip-top lid, so you can open the top with one hand for easy drinking on the go. Perhaps most importantly, the bottle's BPA-free construction is impact-, odor-, and stain-resistant, so you can enjoy your liquids without the dreaded plastic taste and smell. The OTG bottle--which boasts a sleek, slender profile--holds 24 ounces and weighs 0.26 pounds.About Nalgene OutdoorBased in Rochester, N.Y., Nalgene was founded in 1949 as a manufacturer of the first plastic pipette holder. The company soon expanded its product line to include state-of-the-art polyethylene labware under the Nalgene brand. By the 1970s, outdoor enthusiasts had discovered the taste and odor-resistant, leakproof, and rugged properties of Nalgene's large selection of plastic containers. In response to this emerging demand, Nalgene created a Consumer Products Division. In the ensuing years, Nalgene created a full line of bottles that were perfect for storing everything from water to powdered drinks to pancake mix to shampoo.", "text": "NALGENE Tritan OTG BPA-Free Water Bottle 24 Oz Do away with plastic water bottles and go the reusable route with the Nalgene OTG. Made of super-tough Eastman Tritan polycarbonate, the OTG is the ultimate in mobile hydration, with a size that fits in most car cup holders, bike cages, and even exercise machines. In addition, the bottle offers an easy flip-top lid, so you can open the top with one hand for easy drinking on the go. Perhaps most importantly, the bottle's BPA-free construction is impact-, odor-, and stain-resistant, so you can enjoy your liquids without the dreaded plastic taste and smell. The OTG bottle--which boasts a sleek, slender profile--holds 24 ounces and weighs 0.26 pounds.About Nalgene OutdoorBased in Rochester, N.Y., Nalgene was founded in 1949 as a manufacturer of the first plastic pipette holder. The company soon expanded its product line to include state-of-the-art polyethylene labware under the Nalgene brand. By the 1970s, outdoor enthusiasts had discovered the taste and odor-resistant, leakproof, and rugged properties of Nalgene's large selection of plastic containers. In response to this emerging demand, Nalgene created a Consumer Products Division. In the ensuing years, Nalgene created a full line of bottles that were perfect for storing everything from water to powdered drinks to pancake mix to shampoo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31G6YwoYtsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NCDE5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 7.74}}
{"item_id": "B001NCDE7K", "title": "Nalgene BPA Free Tritan Wide Mouth Water Bottle", "description": "Free from BPA, this is an Everyday bottle that is one you will want close at hand at all times. Nalgene's classic 16 oz wide-mouth water bottle made in tough, translucent Eastman Tritan copolyester.", "text": "Nalgene BPA Free Tritan Wide Mouth Water Bottle Free from BPA, this is an Everyday bottle that is one you will want close at hand at all times. Nalgene's classic 16 oz wide-mouth water bottle made in tough, translucent Eastman Tritan copolyester.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QMCsANWBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NCDE7K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.44}}
