{"item_id": "B001NGAP5U", "title": "Knog Skink 4-LED Bicycle Light", "description": "Make sure the rest of the road can see your bike coming with the Knog Skink LED bike light--available in white headlight and red taillight models--both of which feature an innovative integrated mount that fits easily just about anywhere on your bike. The compact silicon body protects the Skink from the elements, and its flexible loop wraps around handlebars, seat post, or frame tube while securely connecting to the Skink's body.The Skink features four super-bright LEDs with a number of flashing options (5 for the red taillight and 2 for the white headlight) as well as one constant on mode. It's powered by two AAA batteries (included), and its battery life indicator--a small LED next to the switch--comes on when batteries are at 25 percent charge. It's rated to be visible up to 600 meters and provide up to 30 hours of constant lighting or 220 hours of flashing lighting.", "text": "Knog Skink 4-LED Bicycle Light Make sure the rest of the road can see your bike coming with the Knog Skink LED bike light--available in white headlight and red taillight models--both of which feature an innovative integrated mount that fits easily just about anywhere on your bike. The compact silicon body protects the Skink from the elements, and its flexible loop wraps around handlebars, seat post, or frame tube while securely connecting to the Skink's body.The Skink features four super-bright LEDs with a number of flashing options (5 for the red taillight and 2 for the white headlight) as well as one constant on mode. It's powered by two AAA batteries (included), and its battery life indicator--a small LED next to the switch--comes on when batteries are at 25 percent charge. It's rated to be visible up to 600 meters and provide up to 30 hours of constant lighting or 220 hours of flashing lighting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L71MGVjsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGAP5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KNOG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 25.02}}
{"item_id": "B001NGBG8K", "title": "Ventura 5-LED Bicycle Flashlight", "description": "The Ventura Bicycle Flashlight has 5 LEDs with 2 functions. It has focused lumination by optical lenses. It has a clip-on bracket which can be removable and can be used as a flashlight. Batteries included.", "text": "Ventura 5-LED Bicycle Flashlight The Ventura Bicycle Flashlight has 5 LEDs with 2 functions. It has focused lumination by optical lenses. It has a clip-on bracket which can be removable and can be used as a flashlight. Batteries included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fHe-Z23iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGBG8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ventura", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NGBH66", "title": "M-Wave Foldable Bicycle Display Stand", "description": "The M-Wave Foldable Bicycle Display Stand offers a simple way to store your bike. This durable stand features a space-saving foldable design. It mounts on your bicycles rear hub axle and is capable of fitting 12in - 28in tire sizes.", "text": "M-Wave Foldable Bicycle Display Stand The M-Wave Foldable Bicycle Display Stand offers a simple way to store your bike. This durable stand features a space-saving foldable design. It mounts on your bicycles rear hub axle and is capable of fitting 12in - 28in tire sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V%2Bou8hpRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGBH66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 28.23}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD3NQ", "title": "Tranz X Adjustable Alloy Bicycle Kickstand", "description": "The M-Wave Adjustable Alloy Kickstand fits 24in, 26in, or 28in bicycles. This durable stand is constructed out of alloy and features a rubber stopper. It is designed for almost all rear stay angles.", "text": "Tranz X Adjustable Alloy Bicycle Kickstand The M-Wave Adjustable Alloy Kickstand fits 24in, 26in, or 28in bicycles. This durable stand is constructed out of alloy and features a rubber stopper. It is designed for almost all rear stay angles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ibk6Z9j-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD3NQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tranz-X", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 14.01}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD49O", "title": "M-Wave Bicycle Saddle Bag (Clip-On)", "description": "The M-Wave Clip-On Bike Saddle Bag is perfect for holding any smaller personal items during your ride. This durable bag features a zippered enlargement for even greater item storage! The easy-to-use black clip-on bracket easily attaches to your seat stem. A light bracket allows for easy taillight attachment. Reflective tape is included for added safety.", "text": "M-Wave Bicycle Saddle Bag (Clip-On) The M-Wave Clip-On Bike Saddle Bag is perfect for holding any smaller personal items during your ride. This durable bag features a zippered enlargement for even greater item storage! The easy-to-use black clip-on bracket easily attaches to your seat stem. A light bracket allows for easy taillight attachment. Reflective tape is included for added safety.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eWtyHgiEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD49O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 9.04}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD4BM", "title": "M-Wave Bicycle Safety Reflective Pant Leg Band", "description": "The M-Wave Reflective Trouser Belts are worn around your ankles to keep your pants out of the chains way. These effective belts are made out of durable steel. They feature an orange reflective stripe. Youll receive 1 pair of M-Wave Reflective Trouser Belts.", "text": "M-Wave Bicycle Safety Reflective Pant Leg Band The M-Wave Reflective Trouser Belts are worn around your ankles to keep your pants out of the chains way. These effective belts are made out of durable steel. They feature an orange reflective stripe. Youll receive 1 pair of M-Wave Reflective Trouser Belts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317joB68YdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD4BM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 12.55}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD4E4", "title": "M-Wave Bicycle Triangle Frame Bag", "description": "The M-Wave Triangle Bag features 3 Velcro straps that easily fit around the frame of your bicycle. This durable bag features a zippered compartment to keep your gear secure. Soft pads allow for easy bicycle carrying. Reflective tap is also included on the sides for added safety and visibility.", "text": "M-Wave Bicycle Triangle Frame Bag The M-Wave Triangle Bag features 3 Velcro straps that easily fit around the frame of your bicycle. This durable bag features a zippered compartment to keep your gear secure. Soft pads allow for easy bicycle carrying. Reflective tap is also included on the sides for added safety and visibility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DO6gGLDZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD4E4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 10.22}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD4I0", "title": "Velo bio:logic Bicycle Seat", "description": "The Velo bio:logic Bicycle Seat features a sleek and innovative design specially made for pressure relief. This bike saddle features Arc-Tech suspension for a smoother ride. It includes an O-Zone Full Cut design with a wide channel and air-way guard for cool ventilation. The bio:logic saddle features a seamless cover material and protection on the front and rear of the saddle. It is available in male or female models.", "text": "Velo bio:logic Bicycle Seat The Velo bio:logic Bicycle Seat features a sleek and innovative design specially made for pressure relief. This bike saddle features Arc-Tech suspension for a smoother ride. It includes an O-Zone Full Cut design with a wide channel and air-way guard for cool ventilation. The bio:logic saddle features a seamless cover material and protection on the front and rear of the saddle. It is available in male or female models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yT3Mr6UIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD4I0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VELO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD4UI", "title": "M-Wave Double Day Tripper Bicycle Pannier", "description": "Double up on hauling convenience! M - Wave Double \"Day Tripper\" Pannier turns your bike into a fast - moving pack horse. For snacks, extra clothing, and all the other stuff you'd rather not leave behind... here's the way to carry it in lightweight, well-protected style! Sturdy-made from 600-denier tearproof nylon, and supported internally by a lightweight plastic framework. Each of the two side bags measures 13 1/2 x 7 x 12\" h., 30 liters of storage combined; Sturdy-made from 600-denier tearproof nylon; Internal plastic framework provides lightweight strength and stability; Slots on top for safe, easy attachment to a rear carrier rack (rack not included); Reflective tape and net on back. Order yours today! M-Wave Double \"Day Tripper\" Pannier", "text": "M-Wave Double Day Tripper Bicycle Pannier Double up on hauling convenience! M - Wave Double \"Day Tripper\" Pannier turns your bike into a fast - moving pack horse. For snacks, extra clothing, and all the other stuff you'd rather not leave behind... here's the way to carry it in lightweight, well-protected style! Sturdy-made from 600-denier tearproof nylon, and supported internally by a lightweight plastic framework. Each of the two side bags measures 13 1/2 x 7 x 12\" h., 30 liters of storage combined; Sturdy-made from 600-denier tearproof nylon; Internal plastic framework provides lightweight strength and stability; Slots on top for safe, easy attachment to a rear carrier rack (rack not included); Reflective tape and net on back. Order yours today! M-Wave Double \"Day Tripper\" Pannier", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xxQsKh0gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD4UI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 41.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD4V2", "title": "Ventura Flexi Bicycle Mirror", "description": "Stay safe and aware of your surroundings with the M-Wave Flexi Bicycle Mirror. This 3in bike mirror is attached to a useful flexi rod.in This allows for 360-degree views. The durable handlebar clamp allows for easy bicycle attachment.", "text": "Ventura Flexi Bicycle Mirror Stay safe and aware of your surroundings with the M-Wave Flexi Bicycle Mirror. This 3in bike mirror is attached to a useful flexi rod.in This allows for 360-degree views. The durable handlebar clamp allows for easy bicycle attachment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FipZuRkbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD4V2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 4.41}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD56G", "title": "M-Wave Plastic Bicycle Bottle Cage", "description": "The M-Wave Plastic Water Bottle Cage features a quick release clamp for easy attachment and removal to your handlebar stem or bike frame. This bicycle water bottle cage is constructed of durable plastic. It is designed to hold 700 ml or 1L size bottles. The Quick release clamp can be easily removed for traditional water bottle cage mounting.", "text": "M-Wave Plastic Bicycle Bottle Cage The M-Wave Plastic Water Bottle Cage features a quick release clamp for easy attachment and removal to your handlebar stem or bike frame. This bicycle water bottle cage is constructed of durable plastic. It is designed to hold 700 ml or 1L size bottles. The Quick release clamp can be easily removed for traditional water bottle cage mounting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qUIqBvCFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD56G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 6.98}}
{"item_id": "B001NGD5D4", "title": "M-Wave Steel Double Leg Side Bicycle Kickstand", "description": "The M-Wave Steel Double Leg Kickstand fits most 26in and 28in bikes. This sturdy kickstand features a double leg design. The adjustable height provides for just the right fit, while anti-slide feet keep you bike standing upright.", "text": "M-Wave Steel Double Leg Side Bicycle Kickstand The M-Wave Steel Double Leg Kickstand fits most 26in and 28in bikes. This sturdy kickstand features a double leg design. The adjustable height provides for just the right fit, while anti-slide feet keep you bike standing upright.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vL%2BylxS5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGD5D4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF4W4", "title": "Ventura Bike Rack", "description": "Mighty Alloy Carrier Rack. Simple, reliable transportation for baskets, backpacks and more! Fits universally, holds up to 55 lbs. of gear, and accommodates bike tires 24-28\"... this is simple, affordable transportation at its best. Made from durable alloy, and features a universal fitting set for easy attachment. A reflector bracket and spring flap are also included. Order yours today! Mighty Alloy Bike Carrier Rack", "text": "Ventura Bike Rack Mighty Alloy Carrier Rack. Simple, reliable transportation for baskets, backpacks and more! Fits universally, holds up to 55 lbs. of gear, and accommodates bike tires 24-28\"... this is simple, affordable transportation at its best. Made from durable alloy, and features a universal fitting set for easy attachment. A reflector bracket and spring flap are also included. Order yours today! Mighty Alloy Bike Carrier Rack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CJdbjEoiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF4W4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 25.39}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF4XS", "title": "Ventura ASA MTB Mountain Bike Racing Saddle", "description": "The Ventura ASA Racing Bicycle Seat is ideal for mountain biking or racing. This comfortable bike saddle includes air shock absorbers for a more comfortable ride. Seat clamp not included.", "text": "Ventura ASA MTB Mountain Bike Racing Saddle The Ventura ASA Racing Bicycle Seat is ideal for mountain biking or racing. This comfortable bike saddle includes air shock absorbers for a more comfortable ride. Seat clamp not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31msaB9LewL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF4XS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 10.74}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF52S", "title": "Beto Double Shot Mini Bicycle/Ball Pump", "description": "The Beto Double Shot Mini Bike Pump offers fast, convenient inflation on the go! This handy air pump features double shot function,in which allows for faster tire inflation. It is compatible with AV, DV, and FV valve types. The sturdy mounting bracket allows for easy frame attachment. An adapter needle is also included for easy ball inflation.", "text": "Beto Double Shot Mini Bicycle/Ball Pump The Beto Double Shot Mini Bike Pump offers fast, convenient inflation on the go! This handy air pump features double shot function,in which allows for faster tire inflation. It is compatible with AV, DV, and FV valve types. The sturdy mounting bracket allows for easy frame attachment. An adapter needle is also included for easy ball inflation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BEvwW0AIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF52S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 8.66}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF56O", "title": "Ventura Bicycle Headlight and Taillight Combo", "description": "Make sure youre seen with the Ventura Bike Headlight/Taillight Combo. Featuring a bright headlight and taillight, youll definitely see where youre going, while remaining visible to motorists. The Ventura 5 LED Bicycle Headlight includes 5 white LED lights, 3 helpful functions, a quick release clip-on bracket, and an optical lens for focused illumination. It can even be removed and used as a handheld flashlight! The Ventura LED Taillight includes 5 LED lights, 4 helpful functions, and a clip-on bracket for easy seatpost attachment. Both lights come complete with batteries.", "text": "Ventura Bicycle Headlight and Taillight Combo Make sure youre seen with the Ventura Bike Headlight/Taillight Combo. Featuring a bright headlight and taillight, youll definitely see where youre going, while remaining visible to motorists. The Ventura 5 LED Bicycle Headlight includes 5 white LED lights, 3 helpful functions, a quick release clip-on bracket, and an optical lens for focused illumination. It can even be removed and used as a handheld flashlight! The Ventura LED Taillight includes 5 LED lights, 4 helpful functions, and a clip-on bracket for easy seatpost attachment. Both lights come complete with batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v%2BYcVkk7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF56O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ventura", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF582", "title": "M-Wave Small Saddle Bicycle Bag", "description": "The M-Wave Small Saddle Bicycle Bag is perfect for holding your keys, MP3 Player, money, or any other small personal item. This durable little bag features rugged straps and Velcro for easy attachment to saddle stem. The zippered compartment ensures your items are secure while reflective tape helps keep you safe!", "text": "M-Wave Small Saddle Bicycle Bag The M-Wave Small Saddle Bicycle Bag is perfect for holding your keys, MP3 Player, money, or any other small personal item. This durable little bag features rugged straps and Velcro for easy attachment to saddle stem. The zippered compartment ensures your items are secure while reflective tape helps keep you safe!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lOU4BHdHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF582.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 19.4}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF5XM", "title": "Ventura Mini Alloy Ding-Dong Bicycle Bell", "description": "The M-Wave Mini Ding-Dong Bike Bell produces a unique ding-dong sound unlike traditional bicycle bells. This bell is constructed of durable silver anodized alloy. It sits in a rugged black plastic housing. An easy clip allows for easy application to your handlebars.", "text": "Ventura Mini Alloy Ding-Dong Bicycle Bell The M-Wave Mini Ding-Dong Bike Bell produces a unique ding-dong sound unlike traditional bicycle bells. This bell is constructed of durable silver anodized alloy. It sits in a rugged black plastic housing. An easy clip allows for easy application to your handlebars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HlAXw9TnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF5XM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Bells"]], "price": 4.31}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF6AY", "title": "Ventura Universal Bicycle Carrier Rack", "description": "The Ventura Universal Bicycle Carrier Rack mounts to the back of your bicycle to help you easily transport your gear. This durable steel rack can carry up to 55 pounds, and is ideally used with panniers, backpacks, baskets, and more. It's adjustable for 26- or 28-inch bicycle tires and features a universal fitting set. A reflector bracket and spring flap are also included.", "text": "Ventura Universal Bicycle Carrier Rack The Ventura Universal Bicycle Carrier Rack mounts to the back of your bicycle to help you easily transport your gear. This durable steel rack can carry up to 55 pounds, and is ideally used with panniers, backpacks, baskets, and more. It's adjustable for 26- or 28-inch bicycle tires and features a universal fitting set. A reflector bracket and spring flap are also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AoZFgLujL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF6AY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NGF6EU", "title": "Velo Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle", "description": "Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle. Your posterior will thank you. Extra cush for your tush. It's perfectly sized, perfectly soft, with a non-slip waterproof top... all the good stuff to make your ride, be it on a cruiser, a hybrid, or an exercise bike, as comfortable as possible. Ride: Velo's special D2 foam construction provides a soft, yet firm ride for just the right amount of support; Non-slip, waterproof top fabric; Elastomer shock-absorbing bumper; Comes complete with a seat clamp for easy seatpost attachment; Measures 10.4 x 8.7\" w. (264 x 220 mm). Weighs 1.9 lbs. (860 grams). Order yours today! Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle", "text": "Velo Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle. Your posterior will thank you. Extra cush for your tush. It's perfectly sized, perfectly soft, with a non-slip waterproof top... all the good stuff to make your ride, be it on a cruiser, a hybrid, or an exercise bike, as comfortable as possible. Ride: Velo's special D2 foam construction provides a soft, yet firm ride for just the right amount of support; Non-slip, waterproof top fabric; Elastomer shock-absorbing bumper; Comes complete with a seat clamp for easy seatpost attachment; Measures 10.4 x 8.7\" w. (264 x 220 mm). Weighs 1.9 lbs. (860 grams). Order yours today! Velo Elastomer Bicycle Saddle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eHb6sGiEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NGF6EU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NI6TBW", "title": "Texsport Deluxe Folding Camp Cot", "description": "Sturdy aluminum frame with steel legs is what holds up the Texsport Deluxe Folding Camp Cot. It is constructed of a water resistant coated 600 denier polyester cover with Velcro® wrap around closure for quick set-up. Includes a heavy-duty carry/storage bag with shoulder strap and informational panel.", "text": "Texsport Deluxe Folding Camp Cot Sturdy aluminum frame with steel legs is what holds up the Texsport Deluxe Folding Camp Cot. It is constructed of a water resistant coated 600 denier polyester cover with Velcro® wrap around closure for quick set-up. Includes a heavy-duty carry/storage bag with shoulder strap and informational panel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61rxvXTk3qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NI6TBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 56.8}}
{"item_id": "B001NIB7F0", "title": "Mark III Quick - Release 4x32 Tactical Scope", "description": "Made by NcStar MARK III TACTICAL SERIES See Description", "text": "Mark III Quick - Release 4x32 Tactical Scope Made by NcStar MARK III TACTICAL SERIES See Description", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PcgmxMYfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NIB7F0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NID36Q", "title": "NcSTAR® 2 - 7x32 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "description": "NcSTAR Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope. Mark III Series Scope delivers BIG quality and performance features in a compact size. Comes with an adjustable-brightness illuminated green reticle. NcSTAR's commitment to quality is evident from the fully multi-coated optics to the 1-Pc. high-grade aluminum tube, and it'll be evident from the time you take your first shot! Features: Reticle illuminates in green or red, with multiple brightness settings to match conditions; Fully multi-coated optics for superior contrast Quick focus eyepiece for fast targeting; Integrated quick-release mount; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for a .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Open target turrets; Built-in sunshade; Includes lens cover and extra battery.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 2X-7X; Objective Size:32 mm; F.O.V.: 39.1-13'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2.9\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Mount Style: Weaver/Picatinny; Length / Weight: 7.3\"/14.9 ozs.; WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 2-7x32 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope, Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "text": "NcSTAR® 2 - 7x32 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope Weaver / Picatinny Mount NcSTAR Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope. Mark III Series Scope delivers BIG quality and performance features in a compact size. Comes with an adjustable-brightness illuminated green reticle. NcSTAR's commitment to quality is evident from the fully multi-coated optics to the 1-Pc. high-grade aluminum tube, and it'll be evident from the time you take your first shot! Features: Reticle illuminates in green or red, with multiple brightness settings to match conditions; Fully multi-coated optics for superior contrast Quick focus eyepiece for fast targeting; Integrated quick-release mount; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for a .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Open target turrets; Built-in sunshade; Includes lens cover and extra battery.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 2X-7X; Objective Size:32 mm; F.O.V.: 39.1-13'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2.9\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Mount Style: Weaver/Picatinny; Length / Weight: 7.3\"/14.9 ozs.; WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 2-7x32 mm Mark III Illuminated Reticle Tactical Scope, Weaver / Picatinny Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eBL3JtmgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NID36Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 113.6}}
{"item_id": "B001NIE3ZG", "title": "NcStar Mark III Tactical Mil-Dot 3-9X42/Scope Adaptor Mount/Red Dot Combo Package (STM3942G/D)", "description": "Built using the Ultimate Sighting System (USS), the Mark III Tactical 3-9x42 scope combines the benefits of a Mark III tactical scope with the advantage of a backup red dot sight. The system is equipped with a Mark III tactical scope and a specially designed MRD34 ring. The ring, which mounts directly to the ocular lens housing with a built-in Weaver-style platform, stabilizes the DDAB red dot sight so you can lock confidently lock on your target. With the scope and sight, the USS is perfect for both close quarter battle and long-range shooting.The scope also includes fully multicoated lenses for brightness and clarity, along with a red/green illuminated mil-dot reticle with multiple brightness settings. Other features include open target turrets, a bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-grain bullet, a rotating mount for users who prefer offset functionality, a built-in sunshade, and a quick-focus eyepiece.SpecificationsMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens diameter: 42mmField of view: 36.8 to 12.0 @ 100 yardsEye relief: 2 inchesExit pupil: 9.3 to 3.1mmReticle: Mil-dotClick value: 1/2 MOAExterior finish: Matte blackLens coating: GreenMount: Integrated Weaver-style quick releaseLength: 7.54 inchesWeight: 16.7 ounces", "text": "NcStar Mark III Tactical Mil-Dot 3-9X42/Scope Adaptor Mount/Red Dot Combo Package (STM3942G/D) Built using the Ultimate Sighting System (USS), the Mark III Tactical 3-9x42 scope combines the benefits of a Mark III tactical scope with the advantage of a backup red dot sight. The system is equipped with a Mark III tactical scope and a specially designed MRD34 ring. The ring, which mounts directly to the ocular lens housing with a built-in Weaver-style platform, stabilizes the DDAB red dot sight so you can lock confidently lock on your target. With the scope and sight, the USS is perfect for both close quarter battle and long-range shooting.The scope also includes fully multicoated lenses for brightness and clarity, along with a red/green illuminated mil-dot reticle with multiple brightness settings. Other features include open target turrets, a bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-grain bullet, a rotating mount for users who prefer offset functionality, a built-in sunshade, and a quick-focus eyepiece.SpecificationsMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens diameter: 42mmField of view: 36.8 to 12.0 @ 100 yardsEye relief: 2 inchesExit pupil: 9.3 to 3.1mmReticle: Mil-dotClick value: 1/2 MOAExterior finish: Matte blackLens coating: GreenMount: Integrated Weaver-style quick releaseLength: 7.54 inchesWeight: 16.7 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j%2BSRypKsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NIE3ZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 179.99}}
