{"item_id": "B001NOCD5C", "title": "Zefal Doobak Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror", "description": "Ideal for leisure and city use. Folding. Diameter : From 16.5 mm to 21 mm. Material : Unbreakable chrome plated plastic. Mirror : Convex. Mirror surface : 40 cm. Mounting : Universal bar end fitting. Rotation : Adjustable. Weight : 70g.", "text": "Zefal Doobak Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror Ideal for leisure and city use. Folding. Diameter : From 16.5 mm to 21 mm. Material : Unbreakable chrome plated plastic. Mirror : Convex. Mirror surface : 40 cm. Mounting : Universal bar end fitting. Rotation : Adjustable. Weight : 70g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ptnEFSeGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NOCD5C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]]}}
