{"item_id": "B001NOEC38", "title": "ZEFAL Spring Bottle Cage", "description": "One piece thermoplastic resin cage, available in subtle black or stylish up to the minute crisp white, this great looking bottle cage comes in at only 46grams for under", "text": "ZEFAL Spring Bottle Cage One piece thermoplastic resin cage, available in subtle black or stylish up to the minute crisp white, this great looking bottle cage comes in at only 46grams for under", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MckOHAJIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NOEC38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 5.88}}
