{"item_id": "B001NOGF8I", "title": "Promate snorkeling dive beach sport game mesh bag", "description": "Provides great space from your large equipments form longer dive fins to small gears or clothings after out of water. With ventilated mesh design and meterial, allows air flow and prevents mildew easily. Goods for any water sports, and any other activities.", "text": "Promate snorkeling dive beach sport game mesh bag Provides great space from your large equipments form longer dive fins to small gears or clothings after out of water. With ventilated mesh design and meterial, allows air flow and prevents mildew easily. Goods for any water sports, and any other activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51acCMjZ4GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NOGF8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Promate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Backpacks"]], "price": 26.25}}
{"item_id": "B001NOVF92", "title": "Gunslick Handgun Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod", "description": "Stay straight and true when cleaning your handguns with Gunslick's new Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod. At 8\" in length, this carbon fiber rod is ideal for handgun cleaning and remains straight despite rigorous cleaning sessions. Soft, easy-grip handle makes this rod a pleasure to use while the ball-bearing rotation is gentle on your barrel yet tough on stubborn fouling. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "text": "Gunslick Handgun Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod Stay straight and true when cleaning your handguns with Gunslick's new Carbon Fiber Cleaning Rod. At 8\" in length, this carbon fiber rod is ideal for handgun cleaning and remains straight despite rigorous cleaning sessions. Soft, easy-grip handle makes this rod a pleasure to use while the ball-bearing rotation is gentle on your barrel yet tough on stubborn fouling. Gunslick offers a full spectrum of top-quality cleaning rods that feature soft-grips, ergonomic handles, and double-ball bearings. Every cleaning accessory in the Gunslick Pro line delivers the ultimate performance, without all the work.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21VNb12VgZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NOVF92.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B001NPG99C", "title": "Troy Industries Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight", "description": "Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight. A super - tough Sight to aid in 'round - the - clock firing! You won't find a more durable, reliable sight for your money! This easy-to-install rear sight is a tough-as-nails, stripped-down version for no-nonsense shooting under pressure. No levers or springs to fumble with so deployment in the heat of battle won't give you trouble. Simply press the release button to fold down into locked position. Features rugged aircraft aluminum and stainless steel construction for long-lasting field use. Dead-center shot: Has zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers; Each click is 1/2 M.O.A; No tools required for adjustment; State Color. Order yours today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight", "text": "Troy Industries Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight. A super - tough Sight to aid in 'round - the - clock firing! You won't find a more durable, reliable sight for your money! This easy-to-install rear sight is a tough-as-nails, stripped-down version for no-nonsense shooting under pressure. No levers or springs to fumble with so deployment in the heat of battle won't give you trouble. Simply press the release button to fold down into locked position. Features rugged aircraft aluminum and stainless steel construction for long-lasting field use. Dead-center shot: Has zero-canting attachment system for use on all military and aftermarket receivers; Each click is 1/2 M.O.A; No tools required for adjustment; State Color. Order yours today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Assault Rifle Parts. Assault Rifle Parts cannot be shipped to CA; Chicago, IL; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Assault Rifle Parts. Troy Industries, Inc. Front Folding M4 Style Battle Sight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d5jMKPX%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NPG99C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 72.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NPQ6E0", "title": "GoPong Pool Pong Rack Floating Beer Pong Set, Includes 2 Rafts and 3 Pong Balls", "description": "Take your beer pong game into the water with the pool pong racks. The pool pong rack game consists of 2 floating islands with room for 6 cups each and have extra-high sidewalls to prevent cannonball sized waves from ruining your game. Provides a much more affordable alternative to the other floating tables out on the market. Design is also compatible with freezable racks to keep your beer cold under the sun. Can also be used as a floating drink holder when not being used for a game.", "text": "GoPong Pool Pong Rack Floating Beer Pong Set, Includes 2 Rafts and 3 Pong Balls Take your beer pong game into the water with the pool pong racks. The pool pong rack game consists of 2 floating islands with room for 6 cups each and have extra-high sidewalls to prevent cannonball sized waves from ruining your game. Provides a much more affordable alternative to the other floating tables out on the market. Design is also compatible with freezable racks to keep your beer cold under the sun. Can also be used as a floating drink holder when not being used for a game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KZ5d5BtSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NPQ6E0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoPong", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Arcade & Table Games", "Combination Tables"]], "price": 15.79}}
