{"item_id": "B001NRHRV4", "title": "Stoney Point Shooting Rest with Bench Anchor", "description": "Stoney Point Bench Anchor Adjustable Shooting Rest. For the truest test of your rifle's accuracy, there's no finer choice! Experience the ultimate level of precision and comfort from the bench! Stoney Point's new Adjustable Shooting Rest keeps your rifle locked on target and virtually eliminates felt recoil. More: Substantial all-steel construction and butt-plate guard cancel recoil; Coarse and fine elevation adjustments, front and back; For left or right-handed shooters; Studded feet keep it in place; Includes shooting bag that saddles bottom support.; Order yours today! Stoney Point Bench Anchor Adjustable Shooting Rest", "text": "Stoney Point Shooting Rest with Bench Anchor Stoney Point Bench Anchor Adjustable Shooting Rest. For the truest test of your rifle's accuracy, there's no finer choice! Experience the ultimate level of precision and comfort from the bench! Stoney Point's new Adjustable Shooting Rest keeps your rifle locked on target and virtually eliminates felt recoil. More: Substantial all-steel construction and butt-plate guard cancel recoil; Coarse and fine elevation adjustments, front and back; For left or right-handed shooters; Studded feet keep it in place; Includes shooting bag that saddles bottom support.; Order yours today! Stoney Point Bench Anchor Adjustable Shooting Rest", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MW7ydvopL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NRHRV4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 68.79}}
