{"item_id": "B001NXD0XW", "title": "Rapala Jointed Shad Rap 04 Fishing Lures", "description": "This plastic version of the legendary Shad Rap is more than just a wounded minnow. The rhythmic rattles send out the \"distressed minnow\" signal loud and clear for all to hear. Seasoned anglers know that sometimes it takes a slight exaggeration of the lure's unique baitfish-in-distress behavior to get the undivided attention of an otherwise disinterested fish.", "text": "Rapala Jointed Shad Rap 04 Fishing Lures This plastic version of the legendary Shad Rap is more than just a wounded minnow. The rhythmic rattles send out the \"distressed minnow\" signal loud and clear for all to hear. Seasoned anglers know that sometimes it takes a slight exaggeration of the lure's unique baitfish-in-distress behavior to get the undivided attention of an otherwise disinterested fish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SUkVoeq%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NXD0XW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rapala", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Hard Lures", "Diving Lures"]], "price": 7.95}}
