{"item_id": "B001NXDB90", "title": "Storm WildEye Swim Shad 03 Fishing Lures", "description": "These ultra-realistic swim shad baits feature super-soft hand-poured bodies that are so lifelike, you might be tempted to take a bite yourself. Sporting strong soft bodies with internal lead heads and bio-salt impregnated tails, an excellent holographic swimmin’ foil finish and crazy 3-D WildEye stare, these durable baits are pre-rigged with a superior VMC needle point hooks. 3 per pack.", "text": "Storm WildEye Swim Shad 03 Fishing Lures These ultra-realistic swim shad baits feature super-soft hand-poured bodies that are so lifelike, you might be tempted to take a bite yourself. Sporting strong soft bodies with internal lead heads and bio-salt impregnated tails, an excellent holographic swimmin’ foil finish and crazy 3-D WildEye stare, these durable baits are pre-rigged with a superior VMC needle point hooks. 3 per pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eahn1nExL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NXDB90.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Baits & Attractants", "Artificial Bait"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NXK8CS", "title": "Serfas Pro Flo Lock On Grip", "description": "Serfas' Dual Density Grips are the best in the business. They are egonmoically designed, stylish, and will stand the test of time.", "text": "Serfas Pro Flo Lock On Grip Serfas' Dual Density Grips are the best in the business. They are egonmoically designed, stylish, and will stand the test of time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q9KoHhaaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NXK8CS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B001NZLJA6", "title": "SiteLite Mag Laser Boresighter", "description": "The SL-100 uses a red laser and has approximately 2 hours continous battery life. It's guaranteed more accurate than any other boresighter. That's why the US Navy and USMC selected our boresighters, over all others, for their Aviation Unit weapons from 5.56mm to the 20mm canon on the AH-1Z Cobra Attack Helicopter. In addition, the US Navy is using our boresighter, with our special adapter, for the 25mm Gatling Gun on the new F-35 Strike Fighter. The SL-100 includes all adapters to fit .22 cal. To .50 Cal. & 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The system also includes our Ballistic Targeting System software program to create a custom laser boresighting target for your specific rifle and ammo. All Sitelite Mag Laser Boresighters have a lifetime warranty. And, an optional app is available for your iPad and iPhone for use in the field.", "text": "SiteLite Mag Laser Boresighter The SL-100 uses a red laser and has approximately 2 hours continous battery life. It's guaranteed more accurate than any other boresighter. That's why the US Navy and USMC selected our boresighters, over all others, for their Aviation Unit weapons from 5.56mm to the 20mm canon on the AH-1Z Cobra Attack Helicopter. In addition, the US Navy is using our boresighter, with our special adapter, for the 25mm Gatling Gun on the new F-35 Strike Fighter. The SL-100 includes all adapters to fit .22 cal. To .50 Cal. & 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The system also includes our Ballistic Targeting System software program to create a custom laser boresighting target for your specific rifle and ammo. All Sitelite Mag Laser Boresighters have a lifetime warranty. And, an optional app is available for your iPad and iPhone for use in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31olvBnRgzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NZLJA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SiteLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B001NZOCEQ", "title": "LPG Muscle Haulin' Hooks ORIGINALS Weightlifting Hooks and Straps (Pair)", "description": "LPG Muscle Haulin' Hooks - Originals - Respect. Big lifts bring it, grip slip robs it. Eliminate performance thieving grip loss and stay focused on the big lifts with the best-selling Haulin' Hooks Originals. Like no other weightlifting straps / weightlifting hooks on the planet, Haulin' Hooks Originals keep on holding weights beyond grip failure to deliver record smashing lifts up to 650 pounds. With your choice of a patented combination of 1-1/2\" strap-n-wraps and instant hook ups you can handle any exercise situation with ease. Use the patented \"never drop\" hooks to bypass arms and target muscles with expert precision. And enjoy the plush comfort of a wrist wrap that stays put and won't strangle wrists like common lifting hooks / lifting straps do. Lift more, Pull more, Grow more - Own it with best-selling Haulin' Hooks Originals.", "text": "LPG Muscle Haulin' Hooks ORIGINALS Weightlifting Hooks and Straps (Pair) LPG Muscle Haulin' Hooks - Originals - Respect. Big lifts bring it, grip slip robs it. Eliminate performance thieving grip loss and stay focused on the big lifts with the best-selling Haulin' Hooks Originals. Like no other weightlifting straps / weightlifting hooks on the planet, Haulin' Hooks Originals keep on holding weights beyond grip failure to deliver record smashing lifts up to 650 pounds. With your choice of a patented combination of 1-1/2\" strap-n-wraps and instant hook ups you can handle any exercise situation with ease. Use the patented \"never drop\" hooks to bypass arms and target muscles with expert precision. And enjoy the plush comfort of a wrist wrap that stays put and won't strangle wrists like common lifting hooks / lifting straps do. Lift more, Pull more, Grow more - Own it with best-selling Haulin' Hooks Originals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lW3KSvEkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NZOCEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Haulin&#39; Hooks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 45.4}}
{"item_id": "B001NZV4BA", "title": "Emotion Glide Kayak, Purple Haze", "description": "Emotion’s next generation family recreational kayak, the Glide is the perfect blend of comfort, stability, and performance. The ultra lightweight design and construction makes it a joy to handle both on and off the water. Great initial stability for beginners; added secondary stability and V shaped hull aid tracking and performance for more discerning paddlers. Unlike some recreational kayaks that you out grow the third day on the water; this boat is designed to grow with the paddler, and take you to new destinations with each stroke of the paddle. Local ponds, rivers, tidal creeks, estuaries and harbors, this boat is the SUV of recreational kayaks for every member of the family. Size: 9'7\" Length 28\" Width 37lbs", "text": "Emotion Glide Kayak, Purple Haze Emotion’s next generation family recreational kayak, the Glide is the perfect blend of comfort, stability, and performance. The ultra lightweight design and construction makes it a joy to handle both on and off the water. Great initial stability for beginners; added secondary stability and V shaped hull aid tracking and performance for more discerning paddlers. Unlike some recreational kayaks that you out grow the third day on the water; this boat is designed to grow with the paddler, and take you to new destinations with each stroke of the paddle. Local ponds, rivers, tidal creeks, estuaries and harbors, this boat is the SUV of recreational kayaks for every member of the family. Size: 9'7\" Length 28\" Width 37lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uvzI1IKlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NZV4BA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001NZWQ1C", "title": "Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow Deluxe 8-Person Tent", "description": "Whether you're heading to the campground with the family or the elk camp with your hunting buddies, the rugged, all-season Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow eight-person tent is well suited to the occasion. The Flex-Bow tent is made of a superior, marine-grade, 100-percent cotton duck Hydra-Shield canvas. The custom-woven, treated canvas is ideal for tents, as the double-fill design is strong and durable, while the silicone, dry-finish treatment is watertight, breathable, and durable. As a result, campers will stay comfortable and dry even in a downpour. Unlike synthetic fabrics or canvas with a paraffin- or oil-based treatment, Kodiak's canvas allows water vapor to escape, minimizing condensation, humidity, and mugginess. Plus, you'll rarely--if ever--have to retreat Kodiak canvas.The Flex-Bow frame is every bit as strong, with 1-inch galvanized steel tubing and 3/8-inch Flex-Bow spring steel rods keeping the tent taut at all times. To further improve ventilation, the tent includes two funnel-flow vents that circulate air and assist with temperature management. And campers won't feel claustrophobic thanks to the tent's spacious 6-foot 6-inch ceiling height, two large D-shaped doors (front and back), and four large windows, all covered with no-see-um mesh. Other details include a 16-ounce, polyester-reinforced vinyl floor; a large 84-by-78-inch awning; a customizable gear loft and organizer pockets; and a handy strap-and-cinch storage bag. The Flex-Bow, which sets up easily with one person, is designed for year-round use, but isn't suitable for extreme winter mountaineering or heavy snow accumulations.The Flex-Bow's spacious footprint sleeps up to 8 people.SpecificationsCapacity: 8 peopleCeiling material: 10-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasWall material: 8.5-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasFloor material: 16-ounce polyester-reinforced vinyl with welded seamsFrame: 1-inch galvanized steel tubingRods: 3/8-inch solid spring steel Flex-Bow rodsTent dimensions: 10 by 14 feetCeiling height: 6 feet 6 inchesPack weight: 79 pounds (includes stakes weighing 6.5 pounds total)Pack size: 30 by 16 inches, with pole bundle measuring 48 inches long and 5.5 inches in diameterWarranty: Limited lifetime warrantyAbout Kodiak CanvasBorn in the ruggedness of the Rockies, Kodiak Canvas has quickly earned a reputation for making tough, long-lasting tents ideal for almost any camping scenario. Each tent is made of top-of-the-line materials and components, helping Kodiak tents far outlive cheaper-made tents. The company's tents feature Hydra-Shield canvas construction, a tough, long-lasting material that minimizes mugginess and holds up to strong winds, driving rain, and even moderate snowfalls.", "text": "Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow Deluxe 8-Person Tent Whether you're heading to the campground with the family or the elk camp with your hunting buddies, the rugged, all-season Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow eight-person tent is well suited to the occasion. The Flex-Bow tent is made of a superior, marine-grade, 100-percent cotton duck Hydra-Shield canvas. The custom-woven, treated canvas is ideal for tents, as the double-fill design is strong and durable, while the silicone, dry-finish treatment is watertight, breathable, and durable. As a result, campers will stay comfortable and dry even in a downpour. Unlike synthetic fabrics or canvas with a paraffin- or oil-based treatment, Kodiak's canvas allows water vapor to escape, minimizing condensation, humidity, and mugginess. Plus, you'll rarely--if ever--have to retreat Kodiak canvas.The Flex-Bow frame is every bit as strong, with 1-inch galvanized steel tubing and 3/8-inch Flex-Bow spring steel rods keeping the tent taut at all times. To further improve ventilation, the tent includes two funnel-flow vents that circulate air and assist with temperature management. And campers won't feel claustrophobic thanks to the tent's spacious 6-foot 6-inch ceiling height, two large D-shaped doors (front and back), and four large windows, all covered with no-see-um mesh. Other details include a 16-ounce, polyester-reinforced vinyl floor; a large 84-by-78-inch awning; a customizable gear loft and organizer pockets; and a handy strap-and-cinch storage bag. The Flex-Bow, which sets up easily with one person, is designed for year-round use, but isn't suitable for extreme winter mountaineering or heavy snow accumulations.The Flex-Bow's spacious footprint sleeps up to 8 people.SpecificationsCapacity: 8 peopleCeiling material: 10-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasWall material: 8.5-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasFloor material: 16-ounce polyester-reinforced vinyl with welded seamsFrame: 1-inch galvanized steel tubingRods: 3/8-inch solid spring steel Flex-Bow rodsTent dimensions: 10 by 14 feetCeiling height: 6 feet 6 inchesPack weight: 79 pounds (includes stakes weighing 6.5 pounds total)Pack size: 30 by 16 inches, with pole bundle measuring 48 inches long and 5.5 inches in diameterWarranty: Limited lifetime warrantyAbout Kodiak CanvasBorn in the ruggedness of the Rockies, Kodiak Canvas has quickly earned a reputation for making tough, long-lasting tents ideal for almost any camping scenario. Each tent is made of top-of-the-line materials and components, helping Kodiak tents far outlive cheaper-made tents. The company's tents feature Hydra-Shield canvas construction, a tough, long-lasting material that minimizes mugginess and holds up to strong winds, driving rain, and even moderate snowfalls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pTjAwLSwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NZWQ1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kodiak Canvas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 619.99}}
{"item_id": "B001NZWQ2Q", "title": "LuxuryLite UltraLite Cot Sleeping pads", "description": "If you think packing a cot to sleep on in the backcountry is too much of a luxury, you haven't tried the UltraLite Cot from LuxuryLite, a 3 lb cot that packs down to 16 inches long with a 5-inch diameter. Sleep on a stable comfortable bed measuring 24 x 74 inches, it keeps you cool in summer while air circulates beneath you - for warmth in winter, simply stack your sleeping pads on top of it.", "text": "LuxuryLite UltraLite Cot Sleeping pads If you think packing a cot to sleep on in the backcountry is too much of a luxury, you haven't tried the UltraLite Cot from LuxuryLite, a 3 lb cot that packs down to 16 inches long with a 5-inch diameter. Sleep on a stable comfortable bed measuring 24 x 74 inches, it keeps you cool in summer while air circulates beneath you - for warmth in winter, simply stack your sleeping pads on top of it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s%2BJ6mwC5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001NZWQ2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001O02TK4", "title": "Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow 6-Person Canvas Tent, Deluxe", "description": "Whether you're heading to the campground with the family or the elk camp with your hunting buddies, the rugged, all-season Kodiak Canvas Flex-Bow six-person tent is well suited to the occasion. The Flex-Bow tent is made of a superior, marine-grade, 100-percent cotton duck Hydra-Shield canvas. The custom-woven, treated canvas is ideal for tents, as the double-fill design is strong and durable, while the silicone, dry-finish treatment is watertight, breathable, and durable. As a result, campers will stay comfortable and dry even in a downpour. Unlike synthetic fabrics or canvas with a paraffin- or oil-based treatment, Kodiak's canvas allows water vapor to escape, minimizing condensation, humidity, and mugginess. Plus, you'll rarely--if ever--have to retreat Kodiak canvas.The Flex-Bow frame is every bit as strong, with 1-inch galvanized steel tubing and 3/8-inch Flex-Bow spring steel rods keeping the tent taut at all times. To further improve ventilation, the tent includes two funnel-flow vents that circulate air and assist with temperature management. And campers won't feel claustrophobic thanks to the tent's spacious 6-foot 6-inch ceiling height, two large D-shaped doors (front and back), and four large windows, all covered with no-see-um mesh. Other details include a 16-ounce, polyester-reinforced vinyl floor; a large 72-by-78-inch awning; a customizable gear loft and organizer pockets; and a handy strap-and-cinch storage bag. The Flex-Bow, which sets up easily with one person, is designed for year-round use, but isn't suitable for extreme winter mountaineering or heavy snow accumulations.The Flex-Bow's spacious footprint sleeps up to 6 people.SpecificationsCapacity: 6 peopleCeiling material: 10-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasWall material: 8.5-ounce Hydra-Shield canvasFloor material: 16-ounce polyester-reinforced vinyl with welded seamsFrame: 1-inch galvanized steel 