{"item_id": "B001O2KCPG", "title": "Flakjak dust free Desert ANTI-FOG Goggles - Paintball, motorcycle, mountain biking, skiing, snowboarding, and many more sports", "description": "These Flakjak Goggles are dust free, ANTI-FOG and comfortable to wear. Changeable lenses (clear and tint lenses). Flakjak goggles have a low flow venting. Flakjak goggles come with a cleaning cloth. Flakjak goggles are good for paintball, skiing, rope climbing, motorcycling, mountain biking, and many more sports. Keep your eyes clear from dust. Lens can be cleaned with water-avoid using soaps or cleaners. The goggle frame and vents can be cleaned with water. To clear the vents of debris, shake or gently tap goggle on a hard surface. If necessary, use running water to purge vents of impacted debris. Avoid vigorous rubbing of goggle and vent surfaces. Do NOT remove vents from goggles. GOOD FATHER'S DAY GIFT!", "text": "Flakjak dust free Desert ANTI-FOG Goggles - Paintball, motorcycle, mountain biking, skiing, snowboarding, and many more sports These Flakjak Goggles are dust free, ANTI-FOG and comfortable to wear. Changeable lenses (clear and tint lenses). Flakjak goggles have a low flow venting. Flakjak goggles come with a cleaning cloth. Flakjak goggles are good for paintball, skiing, rope climbing, motorcycling, mountain biking, and many more sports. Keep your eyes clear from dust. Lens can be cleaned with water-avoid using soaps or cleaners. The goggle frame and vents can be cleaned with water. To clear the vents of debris, shake or gently tap goggle on a hard surface. If necessary, use running water to purge vents of impacted debris. Avoid vigorous rubbing of goggle and vent surfaces. Do NOT remove vents from goggles. GOOD FATHER'S DAY GIFT!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316yYb9gIxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O2KCPG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001O2L80E", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant, Non-Aerosol, 16 oz. can, No Spray Trigger", "description": "Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant, Non-Aerosol, 16 oz. can, No Spray Trigger Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417xHMqXstL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O2L80E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 17.5}}
{"item_id": "B001O2PKGM", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Aerosol Can Lubricant Cleaner Protectant, 1.5-Ounce", "description": "Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Aerosol Can Lubricant Cleaner Protectant, 1.5-Ounce Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U9MvxqD%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O2PKGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001O2SRGM", "title": "Body Max IT6000 Inversion Therapy Table", "description": "Inversion therapy counteracts the forces of gravity on the body (particularly the back) by decompressing and elongating the spine. Not only can this relieve pressure on your spinal cord's ligaments and nerve roots, but it can also relax the back muscles that support the vertebrae. And when your back relaxes, the rest of your body invariably follows. The Body Max IT6000 Inversion Therapy Table can make a great addition to your daily routine, and help to improve your circulation and posture while relieving muscle aches, back pain, and stress.The IT6000 is easy to adjust, with a deluxe dual-pin system that lets you quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 8\" to 6' 3\"). It's also a breeze to use: once you rest your body against the pad and lock your feet behind the ankle supports, you simply reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body will gradually invert until you're almost completely upside down. The only inputs are your energy and gravity itself. Construction features include a lower spring-loaded pull pin that allows for easy ankle adjustments; four safe and comfortable foam rollers; U-shaped handrails; a safety strap that lets you control the desired inverting angles; and a safety lock for when you aren't using the table.The IT6000, which folds for easy storage, will support up to 250 pounds.The IT6000 is easy to adjust with its deluxe dual-pin system that allows you to quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 8\" to 6' 3\").", "text": "Body Max IT6000 Inversion Therapy Table Inversion therapy counteracts the forces of gravity on the body (particularly the back) by decompressing and elongating the spine. Not only can this relieve pressure on your spinal cord's ligaments and nerve roots, but it can also relax the back muscles that support the vertebrae. And when your back relaxes, the rest of your body invariably follows. The Body Max IT6000 Inversion Therapy Table can make a great addition to your daily routine, and help to improve your circulation and posture while relieving muscle aches, back pain, and stress.The IT6000 is easy to adjust, with a deluxe dual-pin system that lets you quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 8\" to 6' 3\"). It's also a breeze to use: once you rest your body against the pad and lock your feet behind the ankle supports, you simply reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body will gradually invert until you're almost completely upside down. The only inputs are your energy and gravity itself. Construction features include a lower spring-loaded pull pin that allows for easy ankle adjustments; four safe and comfortable foam rollers; U-shaped handrails; a safety strap that lets you control the desired inverting angles; and a safety lock for when you aren't using the table.The IT6000, which folds for easy storage, will support up to 250 pounds.The IT6000 is easy to adjust with its deluxe dual-pin system that allows you to quickly find the right position (within a height range of 4' 8\" to 6' 3\").", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gEYgfh0iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O2SRGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Max", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B001O3F5Y8", "title": "Coleman Twin High Power LED Lantern", "description": "When you need an extraordinarily bright, reliable light, you need the Coleman Twin High-Power LED Lantern. Coleman's brightest battery lantern available, the Twin High-Power LED Lantern features four Cree LEDs, providing an impressive 580 lumens of light. On a set of 8 D-cell batteries (sold separately), the lantern will run up to a full 100 hours on Low, and 10 hours on High. The lantern's rotating dial lets you shed just as much light as you need—from Ultra-Low to High. The High-Power LED Lantern is durably constructed to be weather-resistant, so it stands up to the elements.", "text": "Coleman Twin High Power LED Lantern When you need an extraordinarily bright, reliable light, you need the Coleman Twin High-Power LED Lantern. Coleman's brightest battery lantern available, the Twin High-Power LED Lantern features four Cree LEDs, providing an impressive 580 lumens of light. On a set of 8 D-cell batteries (sold separately), the lantern will run up to a full 100 hours on Low, and 10 hours on High. The lantern's rotating dial lets you shed just as much light as you need—from Ultra-Low to High. The High-Power LED Lantern is durably constructed to be weather-resistant, so it stands up to the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31n8E%2Bn5DbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O3F5Y8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B001O43NQE", "title": "Vargo Outdoors Titanium Eagle Spork", "description": "Comes with a handy locking mechanism that can attach to theoutside of your backpack or other areas for easy access whenhiking. Features a blasted handle for easy gripping and apolished tip. Weight: 0.5 oz. Length: 6 inches.", "text": "Vargo Outdoors Titanium Eagle Spork Comes with a handy locking mechanism that can attach to theoutside of your backpack or other areas for easy access whenhiking. Features a blasted handle for easy gripping and apolished tip. Weight: 0.5 oz. Length: 6 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ARFm%2BFplL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O43NQE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vargo Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B001O47J9G", "title": "Guyot Designs 5 in 1 Microbite Set", "description": "The Guyot Designs Utensils are designed to be your \"go to\" utensils either on the trail or cooking at home. These innovative Utensils are designed for slurping hot soup on a cold trail or cutting the toughest of food. The Utensils are made of reclaimable nylon and 2% of their sales go to support environmental action charities. Finally another reason to feel great about chow time!", "text": "Guyot Designs 5 in 1 Microbite Set The Guyot Designs Utensils are designed to be your \"go to\" utensils either on the trail or cooking at home. These innovative Utensils are designed for slurping hot soup on a cold trail or cutting the toughest of food. The Utensils are made of reclaimable nylon and 2% of their sales go to support environmental action charities. Finally another reason to feel great about chow time!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419AEPlxJUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O47J9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guyot Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 7.18}}
{"item_id": "B001O4BSQ6", "title": "Ontario 8155 Mark III Trench Knife (Brown)", "description": "The Ontario Knife company is renowned for its military and tactical products. The Mark III Trench Knife is another OKC knife built to strictest of military combat standards. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Features plain edge and fixed lock type.", "text": "Ontario 8155 Mark III Trench Knife (Brown) The Ontario Knife company is renowned for its military and tactical products. The Mark III Trench Knife is another OKC knife built to strictest of military combat standards. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Features plain edge and fixed lock type.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kyCZLnjZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O4BSQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 49.34}}
{"item_id": "B001O4YIO0", "title": "Birchwood Casey B8-60 SHOOT-N-C 6\" Round Target 60PK", "description": "These targets are great for close-range shooting with airguns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns.", "text": "Birchwood Casey B8-60 SHOOT-N-C 6\" Round Target 60PK These targets are great for close-range shooting with airguns and sharp shooting with .22 rimfire or centerfire guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OSzNZ6COL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O4YIO0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 20.06}}
{"item_id": "B001O5MMZQ", "title": "Folding Mini Shovel", "description": "This unique folding mini shovel is great for outdoor adventures or for use in your own personal survival kit! Made of tempered forged steel, the folding mini shovel can be used as a shovel, a pick, a self defense weapon, or the serrated edge can also allows it to be used as a saw! Folded, it only measures 6\" long and comes with a carry pouch for easy storage and transport. Unfolded, it measures 16\" and is a cinch to assemble and use! May be green or black, sorry no color choice. Order today!", "text": "Folding Mini Shovel This unique folding mini shovel is great for outdoor adventures or for use in your own personal survival kit! Made of tempered forged steel, the folding mini shovel can be used as a shovel, a pick, a self defense weapon, or the serrated edge can also allows it to be used as a saw! Folded, it only measures 6\" long and comes with a carry pouch for easy storage and transport. Unfolded, it measures 16\" and is a cinch to assemble and use! May be green or black, sorry no color choice. Order today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t2thUGySL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O5MMZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BRAND NOT SPECIFIED", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 1.14}}
{"item_id": "B001O7GPAC", "title": "Guyot Designs Stainless Steel Water Bottle - The Backpacker", "description": "Guyot Designs Stainless Steel Water Bottle - The Backpacker", "text": "Guyot Designs Stainless Steel Water Bottle - The Backpacker Guyot Designs Stainless Steel Water Bottle - The Backpacker", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21JSKofx-rL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O7GPAC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B001O7OD5G", "title": "Princeton Tec Apex Pro 200 Lumen Headlamp", "description": "When you need a powerful, versatile, and rugged headlamp in a lightweight design--look no further than the Apex Pro from Princeton. Over 100 grams lighter than their original Apex Headlamp, the lighter and faster Apex Pro was designed with the unique and ever evolving needs of professional athletes and extreme adventurers in mind. Powered by 2 CR123 lithium batteries protected in a highly durable and waterproof casing, the Apex Pro offers 200 lumens of light with 5 output modes--ideal for the professional and perfect for anyone. Backed by a limited lifetime warranty.Specifications:Power: 200 LumensLamp: 4 Ultrabright LEDs, Maxbright LEDBurn Time: 35 HoursBatteries: 2 CR123 LithiumWeight: 173 GramsUL Rating: approved Class I Division 2 Groups A, B, C & DUL Temp Code: T4", "text": "Princeton Tec Apex Pro 200 Lumen Headlamp When you need a powerful, versatile, and rugged headlamp in a lightweight design--look no further than the Apex Pro from Princeton. Over 100 grams lighter than their original Apex Headlamp, the lighter and faster Apex Pro was designed with the unique and ever evolving needs of professional athletes and extreme adventurers in mind. Powered by 2 CR123 lithium batteries protected in a highly durable and waterproof casing, the Apex Pro offers 200 lumens of light with 5 output modes--ideal for the professional and perfect for anyone. Backed by a limited lifetime warranty.Specifications:Power: 200 LumensLamp: 4 Ultrabright LEDs, Maxbright LEDBurn Time: 35 HoursBatteries: 2 CR123 LithiumWeight: 173 GramsUL Rating: approved Class I Division 2 Groups A, B, C & DUL Temp Code: T4", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cjdQETuIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O7OD5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 68.5}}
{"item_id": "B001O9XUW6", "title": "Pocket Size Fishing Survival Kit", "description": "Kit Contents (1) This Manual of Basic Fishing Instructions (4) Plastic Baits (1) Lead Jig Heads (6) Hooks (4) Split Shot (1) Bobber (50 Ft) Line This kit is not meant to be a complete survival kit, but rather an important addition to a survival kit. It provides a method of obtaining food in a survival situation. Recommended is a full survival kit, backed with a good survival manual and knowledge of its contents.", "text": "Pocket Size Fishing Survival Kit Kit Contents (1) This Manual of Basic Fishing Instructions (4) Plastic Baits (1) Lead Jig Heads (6) Hooks (4) Split Shot (1) Bobber (50 Ft) Line This kit is not meant to be a complete survival kit, but rather an important addition to a survival kit. It provides a method of obtaining food in a survival situation. Recommended is a full survival kit, backed with a good survival manual and knowledge of its contents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WhY3KnbCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001O9XUW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 3.97}}
{"item_id": "B001OA4IKS", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Dragon Samurai Sword Set, Black", "description": "This three-piece Dragon Samurai Sword set from Whetstone cutlery includes a 39.5-inch katana sword, a 29-inch wakizashi sword, and a 19-inch tanto with printed gold dragon wood on scabbard. Perfect for collectors, the sword set comes with an elegant black wood display stand included.What's in the Box?One 39.5-inch katana sword, one 29-inch wakizashi sword, one 19-inch tanto sword, black wood display stand", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Dragon Samurai Sword Set, Black This three-piece Dragon Samurai Sword set from Whetstone cutlery includes a 39.5-inch katana sword, a 29-inch wakizashi sword, and a 19-inch tanto with printed gold dragon wood on scabbard. Perfect for collectors, the sword set comes with an elegant black wood display stand included.What's in the Box?One 39.5-inch katana sword, one 29-inch wakizashi sword, one 19-inch tanto sword, black wood display stand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lLdoizDtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OA4IKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 28.67}}
{"item_id": "B001OATJUM", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Slot Muzzle Brake", "description": "The Intrafuse AK Slot Muzzle Brake is perfect to help with the tough AK muzzle climb. The 5 top slots and the 6 side ports (3 on each side) let you get more control of your AK. Finished in a manganese phosphate on high strength steel, this brake can handle thousands of rounds. With a 14 x 1 LH threading this rugged brake will install in seconds on a standard threaded AK brarrel.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Slot Muzzle Brake The Intrafuse AK Slot Muzzle Brake is perfect to help with the tough AK muzzle climb. The 5 top slots and the 6 side ports (3 on each side) let you get more control of your AK. Finished in a manganese phosphate on high strength steel, this brake can handle thousands of rounds. With a 14 x 1 LH threading this rugged brake will install in seconds on a standard threaded AK brarrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KSk52yIcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OATJUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.7}}
{"item_id": "B001OC6CK0", "title": "Continental GatorSkin DuraSkin Folding Tire", "description": "If you're at all serious about high-mileage training, cycle touring or bike commuting, the Continental Gatorskin road tire is made for you. With a durable carbon black tread compound, smooth center tread and tenaciously gripping shoulders, the Continental Gatorskin road tire rolls easily, yet delivers great all-conditions cornering performance. The special tread design is also less prone to picking up road debris. Combine that with the proven PolyX puncture-resistant breaker and DuraSkin anti-cut sidewalls, and you've got a tire that's going to last you an incredibly long time. A durable, long-wearing tire for training, commuting or touring DuraSkin-anti-cut fabric sidewalls Carbon black tread compound for durability PolyX breaker provides excellent puncture-resistance", "text": "Continental GatorSkin DuraSkin Folding Tire If you're at all serious about high-mileage training, cycle touring or bike commuting, the Continental Gatorskin road tire is made for you. With a durable carbon black tread compound, smooth center tread and tenaciously gripping shoulders, the Continental Gatorskin road tire rolls easily, yet delivers great all-conditions cornering performance. The special tread design is also less prone to picking up road debris. Combine that with the proven PolyX puncture-resistant breaker and DuraSkin anti-cut sidewalls, and you've got a tire that's going to last you an incredibly long time. A durable, long-wearing tire for training, commuting or touring DuraSkin-anti-cut fabric sidewalls Carbon black tread compound for durability PolyX breaker provides excellent puncture-resistance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ekmUn8PLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OC6CK0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
