{"item_id": "B001OLZRZW", "title": "humangear capCAP Water Bottle Lid", "description": "The capCAP is a 2-in-1 accessory cap that works with all major wide mouth bottles including Nalgene, Cyclone, Guyot stainless, and many others. A small spout affords splash-free drinking, while the large cap permits easy bottle cleaning and filling with ice. Features an easy-grip rubberized small cap, and a strong, comfortable strap.", "text": "humangear capCAP Water Bottle Lid The capCAP is a 2-in-1 accessory cap that works with all major wide mouth bottles including Nalgene, Cyclone, Guyot stainless, and many others. A small spout affords splash-free drinking, while the large cap permits easy bottle cleaning and filling with ice. Features an easy-grip rubberized small cap, and a strong, comfortable strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PlmpN4s9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OLZRZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "humangear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 6.4}}
{"item_id": "B001OM0VSY", "title": "Harbinger 1205 Big Grip II WristWrap Weight Lifting Gloves (Small)", "description": "The ultimate weight training glove for serious lifters. New, revolutionary, patented WristWrap integrates the entire hand for maximum stability and support. The graduated, patented WristWrap insures proper positioning of the hand and wrist helping to prevent hyperextension. \"No-Slip\" Dura-Grip rubber pads on the palm and fingers grab the bar providing increased traction, cushioning and durability. Innovative curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand. Exclusive machine wash & air dry \"Comfort Tech\" leathers and fabrics stay supple, comfortable and last longer. NoSweat materials wick moisture away for increased comfort.", "text": "Harbinger 1205 Big Grip II WristWrap Weight Lifting Gloves (Small) The ultimate weight training glove for serious lifters. New, revolutionary, patented WristWrap integrates the entire hand for maximum stability and support. The graduated, patented WristWrap insures proper positioning of the hand and wrist helping to prevent hyperextension. \"No-Slip\" Dura-Grip rubber pads on the palm and fingers grab the bar providing increased traction, cushioning and durability. Innovative curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand. Exclusive machine wash & air dry \"Comfort Tech\" leathers and fabrics stay supple, comfortable and last longer. NoSweat materials wick moisture away for increased comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IWUMYK4LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OM0VSY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OM1FY8", "title": "NcStar AR15/Mini 14 Mag Loader/Unloader (AARLA)", "description": "AR15/Mini 14 Mag Loader/Unloader Specifications: - AR-15, M16, Mini-14 Speed Loader for Detachable .223 magazines - Load Magazines Quickly and Efficiently using this Speed Loader / Stripper Clips (not included)", "text": "NcStar AR15/Mini 14 Mag Loader/Unloader (AARLA) AR15/Mini 14 Mag Loader/Unloader Specifications: - AR-15, M16, Mini-14 Speed Loader for Detachable .223 magazines - Load Magazines Quickly and Efficiently using this Speed Loader / Stripper Clips (not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gp3K0d-TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OM1FY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OMQK6Q", "title": "SKS Airchecker Digital Presta and Schrader Pressure Gauge", "description": "The SKS Airchecker Digital Display Pressure Gauge is a far cry from a squeeze and a \"seems good enough\" as you roll towards the door for a long training ride. In the same amount of time that you can wonder what your tire pressure is at, you can check it and know. SKS uses modern technology to make this happen. The Airchecker has a lit digital readout that gives you a reading in PSI or BAR. Simply push the 180 degree swiveling head onto the valve stem and you'll get an instantaneous reading that remains displayed on the screen after you remove the checker. It runs off of a standard CR-2032 battery. The SKS Airchecker Digital Display Pressure Gauge works with Presta and Shrader valves.Product FeaturesMaterial:Dimensions:Valve Type: Presta, SchraderMax Pressure:Hose Length:Deflate:Weight: 45 gRecommended Use: pressure gauge, cycling accessoryManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "SKS Airchecker Digital Presta and Schrader Pressure Gauge The SKS Airchecker Digital Display Pressure Gauge is a far cry from a squeeze and a \"seems good enough\" as you roll towards the door for a long training ride. In the same amount of time that you can wonder what your tire pressure is at, you can check it and know. SKS uses modern technology to make this happen. The Airchecker has a lit digital readout that gives you a reading in PSI or BAR. Simply push the 180 degree swiveling head onto the valve stem and you'll get an instantaneous reading that remains displayed on the screen after you remove the checker. It runs off of a standard CR-2032 battery. The SKS Airchecker Digital Display Pressure Gauge works with Presta and Shrader valves.Product FeaturesMaterial:Dimensions:Valve Type: Presta, SchraderMax Pressure:Hose Length:Deflate:Weight: 45 gRecommended Use: pressure gauge, cycling accessoryManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i98QytcoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OMQK6Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OPEX8U", "title": "GSI Outdoors Ultralight Nesting Bowl and Mug", "description": "The GSI Outdoors Ultralight Nesting Bowl and Mug are the ultra-stable personal food + drink solution for backpacking. Cascadian lightweight, flexible material is easy to pack, stack and carry. Chemically inert and BPA-free, Cascadian pieces remain resilient in both hot and temperatures and are also extremely durable. They won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. Plus, they float!.EVA foam insulated sleeve and Sip-It top keep drinks hot..Low profile/low center of gravity design and Sip-It top work to virtually eliminate spills..Unique bowl + mug solution provides integrated nesting for fuel canisters and nests within the nFORM ultralight Dualist Cook System..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Ultralight Nesting Bowl and Mug The GSI Outdoors Ultralight Nesting Bowl and Mug are the ultra-stable personal food + drink solution for backpacking. Cascadian lightweight, flexible material is easy to pack, stack and carry. Chemically inert and BPA-free, Cascadian pieces remain resilient in both hot and temperatures and are also extremely durable. They won't absorb food odors like other plastics and are completely recyclable at the end of their service life. Plus, they float!.EVA foam insulated sleeve and Sip-It top keep drinks hot..Low profile/low center of gravity design and Sip-It top work to virtually eliminate spills..Unique bowl + mug solution provides integrated nesting for fuel canisters and nests within the nFORM ultralight Dualist Cook System..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415cX4pPCDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPEX8U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OPEZ3I", "title": "Coleman R690B048C Lantern Globe", "description": "Clear, straight type globe. Used on lanterns modelNo. 220 and 228 series, 290, 295, and 235. 4 7/8'' diameter x 5 1/4'' H.", "text": "Coleman R690B048C Lantern Globe Clear, straight type globe. Used on lanterns modelNo. 220 and 228 series, 290, 295, and 235. 4 7/8'' diameter x 5 1/4'' H.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ciXCLDX6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPEZ3I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 15.59}}
{"item_id": "B001OPF6IQ", "title": "Hyperflex Wetsuits Men's Polyolefin 1.5mm 50/50 S/S Shirt", "description": "The Men's Polyolefin Short Sleeve Top from Hyperflex provides an ideal insulating layer to be worn under a full suit or winter hooded suit in brutal conditions--or is a great chill breaker for standalone use with boardshorts. The shirt's Polyolefin fabric offers moisture wicking warmth and insulation so that you can stay in or on the water longer. Easy to care for, the shirt is washable and will not retain odors.Benefits of Polyolefin:Moisture Wicking: Polyolefin material wicks moisture away from the skin more effectively than any other fiber. As a result, there is no evaporative cooling against the skin which allows the user to stay warm and dry.Superior Insulation: Polyolefin has the highest insulating capacity of any fiber, natural or man-made.Lightweight: Polyolefin is an extremely lightweight material. Warmth without excess bulk.Durable: Polyolefin fabric is incredibly strong and is remarkably resistant to abrasion and tears. Color is locked into the fiber so this garment will not fade when exposed to sunlight, chlorine or perspiration.No Odor Retention and Easy Care: Polyolefin is washable and virtually care free. Because Polyolefin is inert, the fabric does not support the growth of odor causing bacteria.", "text": "Hyperflex Wetsuits Men's Polyolefin 1.5mm 50/50 S/S Shirt The Men's Polyolefin Short Sleeve Top from Hyperflex provides an ideal insulating layer to be worn under a full suit or winter hooded suit in brutal conditions--or is a great chill breaker for standalone use with boardshorts. The shirt's Polyolefin fabric offers moisture wicking warmth and insulation so that you can stay in or on the water longer. Easy to care for, the shirt is washable and will not retain odors.Benefits of Polyolefin:Moisture Wicking: Polyolefin material wicks moisture away from the skin more effectively than any other fiber. As a result, there is no evaporative cooling against the skin which allows the user to stay warm and dry.Superior Insulation: Polyolefin has the highest insulating capacity of any fiber, natural or man-made.Lightweight: Polyolefin is an extremely lightweight material. Warmth without excess bulk.Durable: Polyolefin fabric is incredibly strong and is remarkably resistant to abrasion and tears. Color is locked into the fiber so this garment will not fade when exposed to sunlight, chlorine or perspiration.No Odor Retention and Easy Care: Polyolefin is washable and virtually care free. Because Polyolefin is inert, the fabric does not support the growth of odor causing bacteria.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417qGUnskbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPF6IQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OPF80W", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 1.5mm 3/4 Finger Glove", "description": "The 3/4 Finger Gloves from NeoSports offer durable and flexible construction that provides a secure grip for any water-sport application. Constructed of 1.5-millimeter neoprene, the gloves offer warmth and protection without sacrificing mobility. Meanwhile, the vented, padded synthetic leather palm releases heat and keeps the hands from slipping from paddles, oars, or towlines. The gloves stay in place thanks to wrist fasteners.", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Premium Neoprene 1.5mm 3/4 Finger Glove The 3/4 Finger Gloves from NeoSports offer durable and flexible construction that provides a secure grip for any water-sport application. Constructed of 1.5-millimeter neoprene, the gloves offer warmth and protection without sacrificing mobility. Meanwhile, the vented, padded synthetic leather palm releases heat and keeps the hands from slipping from paddles, oars, or towlines. The gloves stay in place thanks to wrist fasteners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5176Cq18R6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPF80W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OPFBOU", "title": "Omega Pacific Figure 8 Belay/Rappel Device", "description": "SPECIFICATIONS of the Figure 8 Belay/Rappel Device by Omega Pacific Weight: 105 grams / 3.7 ounces Strength: 35kN ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "Omega Pacific Figure 8 Belay/Rappel Device SPECIFICATIONS of the Figure 8 Belay/Rappel Device by Omega Pacific Weight: 105 grams / 3.7 ounces Strength: 35kN ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oJG8fidnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPFBOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Omega Pacific", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Hardware", "Belay & Rappel Equipment"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B001OPH29W", "title": "Liberty Mountain Nylon Gaiter", "description": "Made of heavy duty nylon with full zipper down the back. Long flap with hook fastener extends down covering boot laces. Heavy elastic at the top of the boot and at the ankle plus drawcord at top. Gaiter ties under boot sole.", "text": "Liberty Mountain Nylon Gaiter Made of heavy duty nylon with full zipper down the back. Long flap with hook fastener extends down covering boot laces. Heavy elastic at the top of the boot and at the ankle plus drawcord at top. Gaiter ties under boot sole.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LK2w6bH-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPH29W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Liberty Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories", "Pack Pockets"]], "price": 15.41}}
{"item_id": "B001OPH5R6", "title": "McNett Gore-Tex Fabric Repair Kit", "description": "The GORE-TEX Fabric Repair Kit is the essential for field repairs to rainwear and skiwear. Kit includes two adhesive backed GORE-TEX fabric pressure-sensitive patches. Ideal for all GORE-TEX outwear. Available in assorted solid colors and camouflage patterns.", "text": "McNett Gore-Tex Fabric Repair Kit The GORE-TEX Fabric Repair Kit is the essential for field repairs to rainwear and skiwear. Kit includes two adhesive backed GORE-TEX fabric pressure-sensitive patches. Ideal for all GORE-TEX outwear. Available in assorted solid colors and camouflage patterns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vde1EOldL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPH5R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 6.73}}
{"item_id": "B001OPH8NC", "title": "Seattle Sports Kayak Wall Cradles", "description": "Space is limited in the garage--make the most of it by storing your kayak up and out of the way where it's protected from scuffs and abrasions with Kayak Wall Cradles from Seattle Sports. These easy-mount kayak wall cradles offer quick and easy kayak storage. Built with strong and lightweight powder-coated steel, the cradles come with mounting lag bolts for quick and easy installation.Specifications:Quick and easy kayak storage wall cradlesMade of strong, yet lightweight, powder-coated steelComes with mounting lag bolts for quick and easy installation24 by 14 inches (H x W).Weight: 4.5 pounds", "text": "Seattle Sports Kayak Wall Cradles Space is limited in the garage--make the most of it by storing your kayak up and out of the way where it's protected from scuffs and abrasions with Kayak Wall Cradles from Seattle Sports. These easy-mount kayak wall cradles offer quick and easy kayak storage. Built with strong and lightweight powder-coated steel, the cradles come with mounting lag bolts for quick and easy installation.Specifications:Quick and easy kayak storage wall cradlesMade of strong, yet lightweight, powder-coated steelComes with mounting lag bolts for quick and easy installation24 by 14 inches (H x W).Weight: 4.5 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dK%2BnL7HxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPH8NC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 39.98}}
