{"item_id": "B001OPJDLM", "title": "Texsport Aluminum Mess Kit (5-Piece)", "description": "Aluminum and plastic 5 piece set for one person. Contains: One polished aluminum saucepan, one polished aluminum fry pan, one aluminum handle, one aluminum pan cover and one plastic cup.", "text": "Texsport Aluminum Mess Kit (5-Piece) Aluminum and plastic 5 piece set for one person. Contains: One polished aluminum saucepan, one polished aluminum fry pan, one aluminum handle, one aluminum pan cover and one plastic cup.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MdMD6--UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPJDLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 10.35}}
