{"item_id": "B001OPL80Q", "title": "Hornady Primer Turning Plate", "description": "Orients all primers either up or down. A \"must have\" if you're using an automatic primer feed with a pick-up tube.", "text": "Hornady Primer Turning Plate Orients all primers either up or down. A \"must have\" if you're using an automatic primer feed with a pick-up tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yHYCLPUZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPL80Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B001OPLBNA", "title": "MTM Primer Flipper (Clear Smoke)", "description": "The MTM Primer Flipper is indispensable for saving the reloader time, especially when using an automatic feed priming device. Simply dump a box of primers into the flipper, replace the top, shake, and within seconds, all of your primers are anvil-side up. Could it be any easier?", "text": "MTM Primer Flipper (Clear Smoke) The MTM Primer Flipper is indispensable for saving the reloader time, especially when using an automatic feed priming device. Simply dump a box of primers into the flipper, replace the top, shake, and within seconds, all of your primers are anvil-side up. Could it be any easier?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ydvbX%2BZNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPLBNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.39}}
{"item_id": "B001OPLFKY", "title": "Allen Company Ruger Gun Sock (52-Inch)", "description": "Allen 52\" Ruger Gun Sock. Protect your piece from scratches and marring: Silicone treated knit fabric; Will not hold moisture; Ruger logo; Drawstring closure. Order Yours Today! Allen 52\" Ruger Gun Sock", "text": "Allen Company Ruger Gun Sock (52-Inch) Allen 52\" Ruger Gun Sock. Protect your piece from scratches and marring: Silicone treated knit fabric; Will not hold moisture; Ruger logo; Drawstring closure. Order Yours Today! Allen 52\" Ruger Gun Sock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vr2MgjQ2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPLFKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.83}}
{"item_id": "B001OPLHZW", "title": "Lyman Large Double and Single Handles", "description": "Solid metal frame is easily attached to blocks with slotted screws. Hardwood handles provide a cool secure grip. Designed to provide uniform grip with different mould blocks. Fit Lyman Double Cavity and current Single Cavity bullet moulds.", "text": "Lyman Large Double and Single Handles Solid metal frame is easily attached to blocks with slotted screws. Hardwood handles provide a cool secure grip. Designed to provide uniform grip with different mould blocks. Fit Lyman Double Cavity and current Single Cavity bullet moulds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WiVkBSWxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPLHZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 47.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OPLJUU", "title": "Lyman Lead Dipper", "description": "Our dipper with cast iron head is shaped for easy, accurate pouring and prevents air pockets in the finished bullet. In addition, the cast iron keeps the alloy warm while pouring. The long stem dipper can also be used for stirring molten lead alloys. Wooden handle stays cool in use.", "text": "Lyman Lead Dipper Our dipper with cast iron head is shaped for easy, accurate pouring and prevents air pockets in the finished bullet. In addition, the cast iron keeps the alloy warm while pouring. The long stem dipper can also be used for stirring molten lead alloys. Wooden handle stays cool in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fhFV8N1CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPLJUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNH3M", "title": "Hornady Pistol Rotor & Metering Assembly", "description": "For use in your L-N-L Powder Measure, this pistol rotor features a smaller chamber for more precise metering of charge weights between .5 and 17 grains", "text": "Hornady Pistol Rotor & Metering Assembly For use in your L-N-L Powder Measure, this pistol rotor features a smaller chamber for more precise metering of charge weights between .5 and 17 grains", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EM%2BlhXpGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNH3M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNKTI", "title": "Blackpowder Products The Claw Shotgun Sling without Sling Swivel Studs", "description": "The Claw Shotgun Sling incorporates the same advanced design, quality control and handling/maintenance features found in our Claw Rifle Slings.", "text": "Blackpowder Products The Claw Shotgun Sling without Sling Swivel Studs The Claw Shotgun Sling incorporates the same advanced design, quality control and handling/maintenance features found in our Claw Rifle Slings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ER9qNIwDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNKTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackpowder Products Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNO44", "title": "Sweets 7.62 Solvent", "description": "Sweet's 7.62 Solvent200mlRemoves copper fouling from the bore - One of the strongest solvents on the market", "text": "Sweets 7.62 Solvent Sweet's 7.62 Solvent200mlRemoves copper fouling from the bore - One of the strongest solvents on the market", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B5f726QCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNO44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sweets", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 17.05}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNODA", "title": "Lyman Spray Case Lube (5.5 Fl-Ounce)", "description": "This new petroleum based lube in a can allows you to spray an entire loading block of cases in seconds. Super slick lube helps prevent case dents and takes away the mess.", "text": "Lyman Spray Case Lube (5.5 Fl-Ounce) This new petroleum based lube in a can allows you to spray an entire loading block of cases in seconds. Super slick lube helps prevent case dents and takes away the mess.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i8hPy8YSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNODA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.55}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNT9E", "title": "Lyman Reloading Universal Trimmer with Power Adapter and 9 Pilot Multi-Pack", "description": "The Power Pack Combo combines Lyman's Power Adapter with Lyman's popular Universal trimmer. This allows quick and simple conversion from hand to power trimming. All you need is a standard electric hand drill or power screwdriver. Simply unscrew the cutter head from the standard shaft and slide it out of the trimmer. Then slip the power adapter shaft in its place, screw on the cutter head and attach your drill. You're ready to power trim over 250 cases an hour. The adapter shaft comes with its own cutter and stop collars so you can convert back and forth from power to hand operation without changing settings. The patented Lyman Universal Chuckhead system allows you to switch to any caliber from .17 up to .458. No collets required. This is a remarkable bargain. Includes 9 of the most popular pilots.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Universal Trimmer with Power Adapter and 9 Pilot Multi-Pack The Power Pack Combo combines Lyman's Power Adapter with Lyman's popular Universal trimmer. This allows quick and simple conversion from hand to power trimming. All you need is a standard electric hand drill or power screwdriver. Simply unscrew the cutter head from the standard shaft and slide it out of the trimmer. Then slip the power adapter shaft in its place, screw on the cutter head and attach your drill. You're ready to power trim over 250 cases an hour. The adapter shaft comes with its own cutter and stop collars so you can convert back and forth from power to hand operation without changing settings. The patented Lyman Universal Chuckhead system allows you to switch to any caliber from .17 up to .458. No collets required. This is a remarkable bargain. Includes 9 of the most popular pilots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414Az8qDNXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNT9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 99.41}}
{"item_id": "B001OPNVWY", "title": "Beretta PX4 Storm pellet gun air pistol", "description": "The PX4 Storm looks, feels and shoots just like the firearm it copies! This 16-shot repeater will have you shooting as fast as you can pull the trigger. There's an 8-shot rotary clip on one end of the stick mag, and another one at the other end. After you're done shooting the first clip, flip the mag for the rest of the shots! Since it shoots BBs or pellets, you can pick whatever ammo you have on hand. A 12-gram CO2 cartridge is easily loaded into the grip and gives you plenty of shots before you need a refill. There's even an accessory rail under the barrel. Like the handgun, it has real blowback action (cocking the gun with each slide action), giving you a feeling of power that most airguns only hope to achieve! Once you start shooting, you won't want to stop, so get lots of ammo and CO2 cartridges!A misprint in the manual says there's an operational slide release lever. There is none.... BB & pellet shooter with REAL blowback action....", "text": "Beretta PX4 Storm pellet gun air pistol The PX4 Storm looks, feels and shoots just like the firearm it copies! This 16-shot repeater will have you shooting as fast as you can pull the trigger. There's an 8-shot rotary clip on one end of the stick mag, and another one at the other end. After you're done shooting the first clip, flip the mag for the rest of the shots! Since it shoots BBs or pellets, you can pick whatever ammo you have on hand. A 12-gram CO2 cartridge is easily loaded into the grip and gives you plenty of shots before you need a refill. There's even an accessory rail under the barrel. Like the handgun, it has real blowback action (cocking the gun with each slide action), giving you a feeling of power that most airguns only hope to achieve! Once you start shooting, you won't want to stop, so get lots of ammo and CO2 cartridges!A misprint in the manual says there's an operational slide release lever. There is none.... BB & pellet shooter with REAL blowback action....", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U0mkwhS3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPNVWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Beretta", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 89.19}}
{"item_id": "B001OPP09Q", "title": "Bulldog Extreme Black Shotgun Case with Black Trim (52-Inch)", "description": "Black with Black Trim 52\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 50\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 7\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Soft, fur inner lining for maximum protection * Zippered accessory pocket * Removable, adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon water-resistant outer shell * Heavy-duty double stitching * New, improved shape * It Floats!!!", "text": "Bulldog Extreme Black Shotgun Case with Black Trim (52-Inch) Black with Black Trim 52\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 50\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 7\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Soft, fur inner lining for maximum protection * Zippered accessory pocket * Removable, adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon water-resistant outer shell * Heavy-duty double stitching * New, improved shape * It Floats!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314-e%2BAShmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPP09Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 23.94}}
{"item_id": "B001OPPB90", "title": "RCBS Hex Lock Ring Wrench, 1-3/16-Inch", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Hex Lock Ring Wrench, 1-3/16-Inch RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gR%2B5%2BED2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPPB90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B001OPPF46", "title": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .22-250 to 7.62 X 39", "description": "", "text": "MTM 50 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .22-250 to 7.62 X 39", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AiT5ZUn0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPPF46.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B001OPQYPK", "title": "Primos Mastering The Art Turkey Call", "description": "This in-depth CD will teach you just how simple and effective the mouth call is to use. Listen and practice along with Will Primos and Troy Ruiz from Team Primos, as they give you detailed instructions and tips on how to become an expert caller. Three easy-to-blow calls are included with the CD to help you figure out what type of mouth call suits you best. As a special bonus, this CD includes one of our favorite songs – -InchOn God’s Front Porch-Inch.", "text": "Primos Mastering The Art Turkey Call This in-depth CD will teach you just how simple and effective the mouth call is to use. Listen and practice along with Will Primos and Troy Ruiz from Team Primos, as they give you detailed instructions and tips on how to become an expert caller. Three easy-to-blow calls are included with the CD to help you figure out what type of mouth call suits you best. As a special bonus, this CD includes one of our favorite songs – -InchOn God’s Front Porch-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414UYOZvKhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OPQYPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 15.44}}
{"item_id": "B001OQXGP0", "title": "Kershaw OD-1 Knife with Sandvik 14C28N Stainless Steel Blade", "description": "The new OD-1 is guaranteed to shift your “knife need” into OverDrive. Designed by Lee Williams, the OD-1 features a blade of Sandvik 14C28N stainless steel for superior hardness, excellent corrosion resistance, and its ability to be sharpened to a precision edge. This premium blade is paired with a handsome two-toned handle—textured, black G-10 on one side and pure stainless steel on the other. The OD-1 features Flipper ambidextrous opening; just pull back on the blade protrusion and flick your wrist forward slightly to open the blade and lock it in place. Once the blade is open, the blade protrusion folds neatly into a recess in the liner to give the OD-1 a smooth line all the way down.", "text": "Kershaw OD-1 Knife with Sandvik 14C28N Stainless Steel Blade The new OD-1 is guaranteed to shift your “knife need” into OverDrive. Designed by Lee Williams, the OD-1 features a blade of Sandvik 14C28N stainless steel for superior hardness, excellent corrosion resistance, and its ability to be sharpened to a precision edge. This premium blade is paired with a handsome two-toned handle—textured, black G-10 on one side and pure stainless steel on the other. The OD-1 features Flipper ambidextrous opening; just pull back on the blade protrusion and flick your wrist forward slightly to open the blade and lock it in place. Once the blade is open, the blade protrusion folds neatly into a recess in the liner to give the OD-1 a smooth line all the way down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E4U-x%2BMUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OQXGP0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OR8KVO", "title": "36 Pistol Crossbow Arrows 50 - 80 Lb", "description": "Metal Tip - Black", "text": "36 Pistol Crossbow Arrows 50 - 80 Lb Metal Tip - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511B7cmYZpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OR8KVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rex Dist.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 8.84}}
{"item_id": "B001ORBBP6", "title": "Hammers Telescopic Shooting Tripod w/ Pivot V Yoke Max. Height 68\"", "description": "* Lightweight aluminum alloy legs have 3 telescopic sections with twist locks* V yoke mounted on top pivots freely and provides a steady platform for shooting in a standing, off-hand position* Height adjustable from 25\" to 68\", it works just as well from sitting, or kneeling positions* EVA foam grips on the legs* Wear-resistant carbide tip is mounted at the end of each leg and give better grip on rock hard surfaces. A rubber end cap covers the tip* Vecro strap tie down* Folded length: 32inch* Weight: 38oz.* Color: Black* Nylon carrying pouch with should strap is included with the tripod", "text": "Hammers Telescopic Shooting Tripod w/ Pivot V Yoke Max. Height 68\" * Lightweight aluminum alloy legs have 3 telescopic sections with twist locks* V yoke mounted on top pivots freely and provides a steady platform for shooting in a standing, off-hand position* Height adjustable from 25\" to 68\", it works just as well from sitting, or kneeling positions* EVA foam grips on the legs* Wear-resistant carbide tip is mounted at the end of each leg and give better grip on rock hard surfaces. A rubber end cap covers the tip* Vecro strap tie down* Folded length: 32inch* Weight: 38oz.* Color: Black* Nylon carrying pouch with should strap is included with the tripod", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CvyEBrtXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ORBBP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B001ORZF94", "title": "Shimano FD-M310 Aultus Front Derailleur (28.6-34.9-mm 3x7/8 Speed Low-Clamp)", "description": "Shimano Altus front derailleur will accommodate double or triple drive trains, top or bottom cable routing, and 28.6-34.9 seat tube diameters.", "text": "Shimano FD-M310 Aultus Front Derailleur (28.6-34.9-mm 3x7/8 Speed Low-Clamp) Shimano Altus front derailleur will accommodate double or triple drive trains, top or bottom cable routing, and 28.6-34.9 seat tube diameters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e3W7wcrkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ORZF94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Front Derailleurs"]], "price": 11.24}}
{"item_id": "B001OT82PQ", "title": "Caldwell 777800 Lead Sled Large Weight Bag", "description": "These stout bags are designed to be placed in the shot tray of your Lead Sled, Lead Sled Plus or Lead Sled DFT and conveniently hold lead shot, sand, or other weighted media. The durable handles make toting your weight bags to the range a snap. Available in standard and Large size.", "text": "Caldwell 777800 Lead Sled Large Weight Bag These stout bags are designed to be placed in the shot tray of your Lead Sled, Lead Sled Plus or Lead Sled DFT and conveniently hold lead shot, sand, or other weighted media. The durable handles make toting your weight bags to the range a snap. Available in standard and Large size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4162nga2YzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OT82PQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.26}}
{"item_id": "B001OTD4LS", "title": "Howard Leight R-01727 Women's Shooting Safety Combo Kit", "description": "Howard Leight Women's Combo Shooting Kit includes one dusty rose earmuff and one pair of anti-fog eyewear with clear lenses and a dusty rose frame. Eyewear is specially designed to fit smaller head and face sizes. Earmuff is dusty rose with an adjustable headband allowing a secure fit for virtually all head sizes. Earmuffs is a convenient folding design for easy storage and lightweight. The ear cushions are soft providing comfort for long use. NRR 25.", "text": "Howard Leight R-01727 Women's Shooting Safety Combo Kit Howard Leight Women's Combo Shooting Kit includes one dusty rose earmuff and one pair of anti-fog eyewear with clear lenses and a dusty rose frame. Eyewear is specially designed to fit smaller head and face sizes. Earmuff is dusty rose with an adjustable headband allowing a secure fit for virtually all head sizes. Earmuffs is a convenient folding design for easy storage and lightweight. The ear cushions are soft providing comfort for long use. NRR 25.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Iiu4Y6LxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OTD4LS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Howard Leight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 27.18}}
{"item_id": "B001OTZIJE", "title": "Manduka eQua Yoga Mat Towel.", "description": "The Manduka eQua Mat Towel has been updated with a thicker and plusher build for better absorbency and increased traction when laid over a yoga mat. This durable, lightweight microfiber towel offers a soft, suede-like surface that is slip-resistant when moist, providing extra grip for sweaty hands and feet during intense yoga sessions. The eQua functions equally well as a germ-free gym towel to absorb perspiration, a meditation shawl for warmth during cool sitting sessions, or as a highly absorbent travel or hiking towel that takes up minimal packing space. The towel's \"split\" microfiber technology outperforms ordinary cotton or polyester towels in weight, absorbency, and ability to dry quickly. While the towel will last for years of use and countless washes, the fabric is recyclable so that it need not ever enter a landfill. The standard sized eQua mat towel lies over any standard-sized yoga mat and the long-sized towel fits over mats up of up to 85 inches in length. The towel comes in packaging made from 100 percent recycled PET material.Features:Tightly woven microfiber fabricSoft, suede-like feel\"Split\" microfiber technology moisture absorption, evaporation, and \"wet-grip\"Fabric becomes slip-resistant when dampLightweight and durabilitySurvives countless washingsMachine wash and dryRecyclableComes in 100 percent recycled PET packagingStandard Specifications:Dimensions: 72 x 26.5 inches (LxW)Weight: one poundFits most yoga mats of up to 71 inches longLong Specifications:Dimensions: 86 x 26.5 inches (LxW)Weight: one poundFits longer yoga mats of up to 85 inches long", "text": "Manduka eQua Yoga Mat Towel. The Manduka eQua Mat Towel has been updated with a thicker and plusher build for better absorbency and increased traction when laid over a yoga mat. This durable, lightweight microfiber towel offers a soft, suede-like surface that is slip-resistant when moist, providing extra grip for sweaty hands and feet during intense yoga sessions. The eQua functions equally well as a germ-free gym towel to absorb perspiration, a meditation shawl for warmth during cool sitting sessions, or as a highly absorbent travel or hiking towel that takes up minimal packing space. The towel's \"split\" microfiber technology outperforms ordinary cotton or polyester towels in weight, absorbency, and ability to dry quickly. While the towel will last for years of use and countless washes, the fabric is recyclable so that it need not ever enter a landfill. The standard sized eQua mat towel lies over any standard-sized yoga mat and the long-sized towel fits over mats up of up to 85 inches in length. The towel comes in packaging made from 100 percent recycled PET material.Features:Tightly woven microfiber fabricSoft, suede-like feel\"Split\" microfiber technology moisture absorption, evaporation, and \"wet-grip\"Fabric becomes slip-resistant when dampLightweight and durabilitySurvives countless washingsMachine wash and dryRecyclableComes in 100 percent recycled PET packagingStandard Specifications:Dimensions: 72 x 26.5 inches (LxW)Weight: one poundFits most yoga mats of up to 71 inches longLong Specifications:Dimensions: 86 x 26.5 inches (LxW)Weight: one poundFits longer yoga mats of up to 85 inches long", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XG88VMQxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OTZIJE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001OTZIMG", "title": "Manduka eQua Yoga Hand Towel", "description": "The next generation in eco-conscious, multipurpose towels, Manduka's small eQua towel is ideal for practicing yoga or working out at the gym. The towel is extremely lightweight, durable, and super-absorbent, helping it outperform ordinary cotton or polyester towels. For yoga, eQua is the ideal \"rug\" to keep you and your mat hygienic and slip-free. Plus, it dries quickly in minutes, so you can use it as a warm-down shawl after practice. For working out, eQua provides the perfect moisture-wicking wipe for the excessively sweaty. And for the space-challenged traveler, the eQua and its re-usable mesh bag is an ideal road companion. Soft and natural to the touch (with no PVC nubs), the high-quality microfiber towel is even resilient enough to survive countless washings. This small version of the towel measures 25 by 0.1 by 16 inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Manduka eQua Yoga Hand Towel The next generation in eco-conscious, multipurpose towels, Manduka's small eQua towel is ideal for practicing yoga or working out at the gym. The towel is extremely lightweight, durable, and super-absorbent, helping it outperform ordinary cotton or polyester towels. For yoga, eQua is the ideal \"rug\" to keep you and your mat hygienic and slip-free. Plus, it dries quickly in minutes, so you can use it as a warm-down shawl after practice. For working out, eQua provides the perfect moisture-wicking wipe for the excessively sweaty. And for the space-challenged traveler, the eQua and its re-usable mesh bag is an ideal road companion. Soft and natural to the touch (with no PVC nubs), the high-quality microfiber towel is even resilient enough to survive countless washings. This small version of the towel measures 25 by 0.1 by 16 inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fQA%2BEumiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OTZIMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Manduka", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Towels"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B001OX3I5Q", "title": "Fizik Superlight Bicycle Handlebar Tape, White", "description": "Fizik White Bar Tape is preferred by professionals and their mechanics. The bar tape is made of Microtex that is durable, strong, stretch resistant and breathable. It is smooth and comfortable to touch, even when wet. This thin tape adds almost zero weight. The bar tape matches fiz'i:k saddles covers for a customized, personal look!", "text": "Fizik Superlight Bicycle Handlebar Tape, White Fizik White Bar Tape is preferred by professionals and their mechanics. The bar tape is made of Microtex that is durable, strong, stretch resistant and breathable. It is smooth and comfortable to touch, even when wet. This thin tape adds almost zero weight. The bar tape matches fiz'i:k saddles covers for a customized, personal look!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417bgHoau6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001OX3I5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fizik", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 18.0}}
