{"item_id": "B001P4FNCU", "title": "Mares Cruise Mesh Duffle Bag", "description": "Ideal for transporting and rinsing your equipmentFull mesh, this bag is the ideal bag to store your equipment after scuba, snorkeling or free diving. It is long enough to store even the longest fins on the market. It can be folded up in seconds, becoming a small round bag with a handle no bigger than a round pizza. Great bag for a day trip or to store in your main wheeled dive travel bag, once you arrive at your dive destination just transfer your gear to the mesh bag and you now have a lightweight breathable self draining gear bag.Once you complete your day of diving just dunk the entire bag in the rinse tank and let it drip and air dry for your next day of diving. Plenty of room with overall dimensions of 37.5\" x 15\" x 15\" (95.3 x 38.1 x 38.1 cm) and a 3.8 cubic foot (108.53 liter) volume, durably constructed from 600* 6,000 72T w/PVC with a full wrap around carry handles and durable spiral zipper closure and weights only 1.5 lbs (0.67 kg) making this a great stand alone or part of your travel bag system. Cruise Mesh Bag comes with a 24 month limited warranty.", "text": "Mares Cruise Mesh Duffle Bag Ideal for transporting and rinsing your equipmentFull mesh, this bag is the ideal bag to store your equipment after scuba, snorkeling or free diving. It is long enough to store even the longest fins on the market. It can be folded up in seconds, becoming a small round bag with a handle no bigger than a round pizza. Great bag for a day trip or to store in your main wheeled dive travel bag, once you arrive at your dive destination just transfer your gear to the mesh bag and you now have a lightweight breathable self draining gear bag.Once you complete your day of diving just dunk the entire bag in the rinse tank and let it drip and air dry for your next day of diving. Plenty of room with overall dimensions of 37.5\" x 15\" x 15\" (95.3 x 38.1 x 38.1 cm) and a 3.8 cubic foot (108.53 liter) volume, durably constructed from 600* 6,000 72T w/PVC with a full wrap around carry handles and durable spiral zipper closure and weights only 1.5 lbs (0.67 kg) making this a great stand alone or part of your travel bag system. Cruise Mesh Bag comes with a 24 month limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jpgggpAqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P4FNCU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mares", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Duffles"]], "price": 34.14}}
{"item_id": "B001P4FPAK", "title": "NeoSport Triathlon 5/3mm Men's NRG Sleeveless", "description": "Developed through years of research and competitive experience, the NRG Sleeveless is one of NeoSport's most advanced triathlon wetsuits to date. Lightweight Speed Skin neoprene, combined with soft Coated Skin neoprene, provides outstanding buoyancy, flexibility, and comfort. Five-millimeter neoprene on the chest panel creates ideal positioning in the water, reducing drag, and a three-millimeter back panel permits efficient stroke performance. Range of motion is further improved thanks to the strategic placement of three-millimeter, Super Four-Way Stretch neoprene along the shoulders and underarms for unrestricted reach.Raised placement of the mid-calf leg openings increases kick efficiency and decreases drag, and the wider exit openings diminish heel snag, speeding up suit removal and transition times. An EZ Out zipper remains secure in the water but easy to find on land, further reducing critical transition times. An adjustable collar provides precise fit with no unwanted scooping, while its smooth, narrow contours reduce chafe. Glued and sewn seams increase hydrodynamics and mean the suit will last race after race.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "NeoSport Triathlon 5/3mm Men's NRG Sleeveless Developed through years of research and competitive experience, the NRG Sleeveless is one of NeoSport's most advanced triathlon wetsuits to date. Lightweight Speed Skin neoprene, combined with soft Coated Skin neoprene, provides outstanding buoyancy, flexibility, and comfort. Five-millimeter neoprene on the chest panel creates ideal positioning in the water, reducing drag, and a three-millimeter back panel permits efficient stroke performance. Range of motion is further improved thanks to the strategic placement of three-millimeter, Super Four-Way Stretch neoprene along the shoulders and underarms for unrestricted reach.Raised placement of the mid-calf leg openings increases kick efficiency and decreases drag, and the wider exit openings diminish heel snag, speeding up suit removal and transition times. An EZ Out zipper remains secure in the water but easy to find on land, further reducing critical transition times. An adjustable collar provides precise fit with no unwanted scooping, while its smooth, narrow contours reduce chafe. Glued and sewn seams increase hydrodynamics and mean the suit will last race after race.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411VDaqP8NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P4FPAK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001P4Q2SO", "title": "Troy Industries OEM Sling Mount", "description": "Troy Professional Grade and M4 BattleSling Mounts and adapters, swivel mounts and other sling accessories are all made from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel push down buttons. - Flat Black", "text": "Troy Industries OEM Sling Mount Troy Professional Grade and M4 BattleSling Mounts and adapters, swivel mounts and other sling accessories are all made from hardened aircraft aluminum with stainless steel push down buttons. - Flat Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z41rsYKAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P4Q2SO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 43.4}}
{"item_id": "B001P51GRU", "title": "Umarex Magazine, BB, Walther CP99 Compact, 2-Pack", "description": "If you have a Walther CP99 Compact, you'll want some additional BB Magazines. This 2-pack of BB Clips for your CP99 Compact provides quick reloading during fast shooting action when you keep them pre-loaded by your side. 2 per package.", "text": "Umarex Magazine, BB, Walther CP99 Compact, 2-Pack If you have a Walther CP99 Compact, you'll want some additional BB Magazines. This 2-pack of BB Clips for your CP99 Compact provides quick reloading during fast shooting action when you keep them pre-loaded by your side. 2 per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YJVTk6NbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P51GRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walther", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 11.97}}
{"item_id": "B001P5HRK0", "title": "Maranda Enterprises Metal Ladderball Game", "description": "Designed for two to four players, this ladderball game is great whether you're at the beach or in the backyard with friends and family members. Ladderball is a lawn game played by throwing bolas (two balls connected by a string) onto a ladder-shaped upright. Included in this game are two durable, steel goal uprights; three red bolas; three blue bolas; instructions; and a convenient carrying and storage bag. The officially sized bolas are made with safe, soft plastic. Suitable for ages 8 and up, this product is the winner of a Dr. Toy Best Picks award as well as a 2010 Game of the Year award from Creative Child magazine. Assembly is required.Manufacturer WarrantyMaranda Enterprises warrants each of its products to be free from manufacturer defects in material and workmanship. Liability under this warranty is limited to replacing products found to be defective within 30 days of the date of purchase.What's in the BoxTwo steel goal uprights, three red bolas, three blue bolas, carrying bag, and instructions.", "text": "Maranda Enterprises Metal Ladderball Game Designed for two to four players, this ladderball game is great whether you're at the beach or in the backyard with friends and family members. Ladderball is a lawn game played by throwing bolas (two balls connected by a string) onto a ladder-shaped upright. Included in this game are two durable, steel goal uprights; three red bolas; three blue bolas; instructions; and a convenient carrying and storage bag. The officially sized bolas are made with safe, soft plastic. Suitable for ages 8 and up, this product is the winner of a Dr. Toy Best Picks award as well as a 2010 Game of the Year award from Creative Child magazine. Assembly is required.Manufacturer WarrantyMaranda Enterprises warrants each of its products to be free from manufacturer defects in material and workmanship. Liability under this warranty is limited to replacing products found to be defective within 30 days of the date of purchase.What's in the BoxTwo steel goal uprights, three red bolas, three blue bolas, carrying bag, and instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XeNL6uYcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P5HRK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ladderball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Ladder Ball"]], "price": 65.4}}
{"item_id": "B001P5Y08C", "title": "WITZ See it Safe Waterproof ID/Badge Holder Case", "description": "Witz waterproof ID and Badge Holders are perfect for carrying drivers Licenses, TWIC cards, photo IDs, credit cards or any other forms of ID. These cases are made of crush resistant ABS plastic and have rubber O-rings to keep out the water and dust. These cases come with a neck lanyard and Carabiner.", "text": "WITZ See it Safe Waterproof ID/Badge Holder Case Witz waterproof ID and Badge Holders are perfect for carrying drivers Licenses, TWIC cards, photo IDs, credit cards or any other forms of ID. These cases are made of crush resistant ABS plastic and have rubber O-rings to keep out the water and dust. These cases come with a neck lanyard and Carabiner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Me27cSumL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P5Y08C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Witz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 6.52}}
