{"item_id": "B001P82D3S", "title": "Buck 285 BLW Bantam Camo Folding Hunting Knife (Camo)", "description": "Buck Knives 285 Medium Bantam Camo is an easy handling, lightweight, one-hand deployment folding knife. The BLW has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added grip and a lanyard hole for easy attachment. The 285 BLW features a 3-1/8 inch 420HC drop point stainless steel blade. It's 4-3/8 inches long closed and weighs only 2.4 ounces. It has a textured thermoplastic handle in Mossy Oak Break-Up Camo, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 285 BLW Bantam Camo Folding Hunting Knife (Camo) Buck Knives 285 Medium Bantam Camo is an easy handling, lightweight, one-hand deployment folding knife. The BLW has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added grip and a lanyard hole for easy attachment. The 285 BLW features a 3-1/8 inch 420HC drop point stainless steel blade. It's 4-3/8 inches long closed and weighs only 2.4 ounces. It has a textured thermoplastic handle in Mossy Oak Break-Up Camo, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mg9PbWPSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P82D3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.36}}
{"item_id": "B001P82D4C", "title": "Buck 286 BHW Large Bantam Camo Folding Hunting Knife (Camo)", "description": "Buck Knives 286 Large Bantam Camo is an easy handling, lightweight, one-hand deployment folding knife. The BHW has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added grip and a lanyard hole for easy attachment. The 286 BHW features a 3-5/8 inch 420HC drop point stainless steel blade. It's 5-1/8 inches long closed and weighs only 3.2 ounces. It has a textured thermoplastic handle in Mossy Oak Break-Up Camo, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Buck 286 BHW Large Bantam Camo Folding Hunting Knife (Camo) Buck Knives 286 Large Bantam Camo is an easy handling, lightweight, one-hand deployment folding knife. The BHW has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added grip and a lanyard hole for easy attachment. The 286 BHW features a 3-5/8 inch 420HC drop point stainless steel blade. It's 5-1/8 inches long closed and weighs only 3.2 ounces. It has a textured thermoplastic handle in Mossy Oak Break-Up Camo, and as with all Buck Knives, it features Buck's 4-Ever Unconditional Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dkZehQNSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P82D4C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.12}}
