{"item_id": "B001P9IA0C", "title": "Caddy Daddy CDX-10 Wheeled Travel Cover", "description": "CDX-10 Travel Covers...Superior Quality & Functionality! Play wherever you go with this all-in-one design for the course and travel. Superior quality, functionality and performance make transportation a breeze. Perfect for golfers who are frequent travelers. Caddy Daddy CDX-10 Wheeled Travel Covers feature: 50 x 13 x 13 dimensions Ultra-durable 600D nylon construction Heavy-duty curb rails Riveted handles for added strength In-line skates for easy rolling Heavily padded on top to protect clubheads Fully adjustable clamps to keep clubs secure 2 oversized shoe pockets for extra gear Accommodates bags up to 10\" cart bag sizes Lockable zipper 1-Year Manufacturer Warranty Color: Black Caddy Daddy Travel Covers...For Golfers On The Go!", "text": "Caddy Daddy CDX-10 Wheeled Travel Cover CDX-10 Travel Covers...Superior Quality & Functionality! Play wherever you go with this all-in-one design for the course and travel. Superior quality, functionality and performance make transportation a breeze. Perfect for golfers who are frequent travelers. Caddy Daddy CDX-10 Wheeled Travel Covers feature: 50 x 13 x 13 dimensions Ultra-durable 600D nylon construction Heavy-duty curb rails Riveted handles for added strength In-line skates for easy rolling Heavily padded on top to protect clubheads Fully adjustable clamps to keep clubs secure 2 oversized shoe pockets for extra gear Accommodates bags up to 10\" cart bag sizes Lockable zipper 1-Year Manufacturer Warranty Color: Black Caddy Daddy Travel Covers...For Golfers On The Go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JVQYYjcoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P9IA0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caddy Daddy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Travel Covers"]], "price": 63.0}}
