{"item_id": "B001P9JJNO", "title": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Kahr Cw9, Cw40, P9, P40, Pm9, Pm40, Tp9, Tp40", "description": "Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "text": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Kahr Cw9, Cw40, P9, P40, Pm9, Pm40, Tp9, Tp40 Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uxvi1gM3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P9JJNO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 189.31}}
{"item_id": "B001P9MXDC", "title": "Weaver Quad Lock 1-Inch Extra High Detachable Rings (Matte Black)", "description": "Weaver Quad Lock Detachable Rings off two straps and four screws provide added gripping power. The rings are lightweight and all-aluminum. Thumbscrews allow for quick detach. These rings feature the positive dovetail locking system and boast rear mount windage adjustments. They offer maximum strength in steel construction and top-notch recoil resistance for the ultimate hold on your scope. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "text": "Weaver Quad Lock 1-Inch Extra High Detachable Rings (Matte Black) Weaver Quad Lock Detachable Rings off two straps and four screws provide added gripping power. The rings are lightweight and all-aluminum. Thumbscrews allow for quick detach. These rings feature the positive dovetail locking system and boast rear mount windage adjustments. They offer maximum strength in steel construction and top-notch recoil resistance for the ultimate hold on your scope. Weaver rings can handle any scope-mounting need. Whether you're looking for our classic Weaver's original cross-lock Top Mount, windage adjustable or dovetail extension rings; we have many great options. These rings are available in a variety of choices including aircraft-grade aluminum options or Grand Slam steel, and many more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z8TFFNk8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001P9MXDC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001PBIWHG", "title": "Safariland J-C7 COMP I Speedloader", "description": "This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "text": "Safariland J-C7 COMP I Speedloader This Safariland injection molded Speedloaders are designed to meet the needs of every shooter and features simple push-loading operation which combines maximum speed with ease of use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TjJduvx%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PBIWHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.43}}
{"item_id": "B001PCTSZK", "title": "Honeywell Low Profile Earmuff, NRR 25, Red", "description": "Lightning L1 has a contemporary low profile, utlraslim earcups and a padded foam headband with ultra soft ear cushions providing great comfort. Durable steel wire headband features telescoping height adjustment. Patented Air Flow Technology delivers optimal attenuation across all frequencies. Noise Reduction Rating is 25.", "text": "Honeywell Low Profile Earmuff, NRR 25, Red Lightning L1 has a contemporary low profile, utlraslim earcups and a padded foam headband with ultra soft ear cushions providing great comfort. Durable steel wire headband features telescoping height adjustment. Patented Air Flow Technology delivers optimal attenuation across all frequencies. Noise Reduction Rating is 25.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XkSTpdZOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PCTSZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Honeywell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 11.51}}
