{"item_id": "B001PDRVV2", "title": "Nylon Tactical Leg Holster Fits Smith & Wesson M&p Sigma 9mm 40 V Side Holster Glock 17,19,22,31,33,23,32,25,38 Sig Sauer P226,p228,p229 See Size Chart Inside.", "description": "Pro-Tech's Tactical Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Pro-Tech tactical holster has Rugged 4- wall construction. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Pro-Tech's Tactical holster has adjustable leg straps with quick-release buckles and safety strap. A clip pouch on front has a velcro closure retention strap and adjusts for many extended magazines. Fits belts up to 3\" wide. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Custom fit for Smith & Wesson M&p; Sigma 9mm 40 V Side Holster Glock 17,19,22,31,33,23,32,25,38 Sig Sauer P226,p228,p229. Any medium or large frame 3.5 to 4.2'' barrel AUTOS ONLY. Order your tactical holster today. When quality means something our militaries choice is the Pro-Tech tactical holster. Why not make it yours today.", "text": "Nylon Tactical Leg Holster Fits Smith & Wesson M&p Sigma 9mm 40 V Side Holster Glock 17,19,22,31,33,23,32,25,38 Sig Sauer P226,p228,p229 See Size Chart Inside. Pro-Tech's Tactical Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Pro-Tech tactical holster has Rugged 4- wall construction. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Pro-Tech's Tactical holster has adjustable leg straps with quick-release buckles and safety strap. A clip pouch on front has a velcro closure retention strap and adjusts for many extended magazines. Fits belts up to 3\" wide. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Custom fit for Smith & Wesson M&p; Sigma 9mm 40 V Side Holster Glock 17,19,22,31,33,23,32,25,38 Sig Sauer P226,p228,p229. Any medium or large frame 3.5 to 4.2'' barrel AUTOS ONLY. Order your tactical holster today. When quality means something our militaries choice is the Pro-Tech tactical holster. Why not make it yours today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KihfPuQbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PDRVV2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B001PE21CK", "title": "Ka-bar Dozier Folding Hunter Thumb Notch Knife, Blaze Orange Handles", "description": "4 1/4\" closed lockback. Black finish AUS-8 stainless blade with thumb notch. Blaze orange checkered Zytel handles with lanyard hole. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "text": "Ka-bar Dozier Folding Hunter Thumb Notch Knife, Blaze Orange Handles 4 1/4\" closed lockback. Black finish AUS-8 stainless blade with thumb notch. Blaze orange checkered Zytel handles with lanyard hole. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wkur2sjzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PE21CK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B001PE21CU", "title": "Ka-Bar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Foliage Green", "description": "Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR, and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since.", "text": "Ka-Bar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Foliage Green Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR, and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213Xv33RtLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PE21CU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B001PE5VGI", "title": "KA-BAR Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Pink", "description": "KA-BAR is proud to partner with the country's leading cancer research center and it's physicians. The sales of this product will help accelerate new breast cancer research to seek a cure", "text": "KA-BAR Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Pink KA-BAR is proud to partner with the country's leading cancer research center and it's physicians. The sales of this product will help accelerate new breast cancer research to seek a cure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Gbs%2BaBRPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PE5VGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.49}}
{"item_id": "B001PE7J7M", "title": "Ka-Bar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Coyote Brown", "description": "Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR, and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since.", "text": "Ka-Bar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife, Coyote Brown Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR, and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rXNBnBF3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PE7J7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B001PGWNYY", "title": "Classic Accessories Seat Back Gun Rack", "description": "The Classic Accessories Seat Back Gun Rack quickly hangs across the seat back in SUVs or pickup trucks to help protect and conceal valuable rifles or shotguns. The rack holds up to three rifles or shotguns, has non-slip foam pocket interiors so your guns will not get scratched, and folds up for easily storage. A great product at a great price. No tools required.", "text": "Classic Accessories Seat Back Gun Rack The Classic Accessories Seat Back Gun Rack quickly hangs across the seat back in SUVs or pickup trucks to help protect and conceal valuable rifles or shotguns. The rack holds up to three rifles or shotguns, has non-slip foam pocket interiors so your guns will not get scratched, and folds up for easily storage. A great product at a great price. No tools required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nABka4yxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PGWNYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Classic Accessories", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 18.28}}
{"item_id": "B001PIM00O", "title": "K.O. Shallot, Stainless Handle, Plain - Kershaw Knives", "description": "For this one, we've peeled away the layers, leaving nothing but superb form, keen function, and pure stainless steel. The Shallot features a Sandvik 14C28N recurve blade. The unique recurve blade design provides for low mass and high performance, while the 14C28N steel offers excellent hardness, corrosion, and wear resistance. This high-carbon chromium steel provides for a high quality blade ideal for a wide range of both everyday and extraordinary tasks. The Shallot is available with a smooth blade and a partially serrated blade. This exceptional blade is partnered with a sleek stainless-steel handle designed for a sure, ergonomic grip. The handle is built of 410 stainless steel, hardened and tempered to provide maximum strength. For safety, there's a convenient frame lock to secure the blade in position until you choose to release it. Both blade and handle are polished to a steely matte-gray finish. Or, if you prefer the dark, choose the Black Shallot, with a smooth or partially serrated blade featuring a Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating. All Shallots feature our SpeedSafe ambidextrous manually assisted opening. Just pull back on the blade protrusion with the index finger of either the left or right hand. The SpeedSafe system then moves the blade out of the handle and smoothly and easily into position, ready for use. The Shallot is a pocket-perfect 4-3/8 inches closed and weighs just 4.2 ounces. It is made in the USA and built to uphold Kershaw's high standards of quality and performance. Like the tasty shallot it's named for, the new Kershaw Shallot is sure to make your mouth water for more.", "text": "K.O. Shallot, Stainless Handle, Plain - Kershaw Knives For this one, we've peeled away the layers, leaving nothing but superb form, keen function, and pure stainless steel. The Shallot features a Sandvik 14C28N recurve blade. The unique recurve blade design provides for low mass and high performance, while the 14C28N steel offers excellent hardness, corrosion, and wear resistance. This high-carbon chromium steel provides for a high quality blade ideal for a wide range of both everyday and extraordinary tasks. The Shallot is available with a smooth blade and a partially serrated blade. This exceptional blade is partnered with a sleek stainless-steel handle designed for a sure, ergonomic grip. The handle is built of 410 stainless steel, hardened and tempered to provide maximum strength. For safety, there's a convenient frame lock to secure the blade in position until you choose to release it. Both blade and handle are polished to a steely matte-gray finish. Or, if you prefer the dark, choose the Black Shallot, with a smooth or partially serrated blade featuring a Tungsten DLC (Diamond-Like Carbon) coating. All Shallots feature our SpeedSafe ambidextrous manually assisted opening. Just pull back on the blade protrusion with the index finger of either the left or right hand. The SpeedSafe system then moves the blade out of the handle and smoothly and easily into position, ready for use. The Shallot is a pocket-perfect 4-3/8 inches closed and weighs just 4.2 ounces. It is made in the USA and built to uphold Kershaw's high standards of quality and performance. Like the tasty shallot it's named for, the new Kershaw Shallot is sure to make your mouth water for more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Ue42dFOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PIM00O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 47.05}}
{"item_id": "B001PKPZGS", "title": "NcStar .223 Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ223)", "description": "Get on paper the quick and easy way with these High Grade Aluminum Bore Sighters. Designed to drop right into the chamber of your firearm projecting a straight Laser Beam right down the middle of the bore giving you precise trajectory.", "text": "NcStar .223 Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ223) Get on paper the quick and easy way with these High Grade Aluminum Bore Sighters. Designed to drop right into the chamber of your firearm projecting a straight Laser Beam right down the middle of the bore giving you precise trajectory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213ufJusC5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PKPZGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001PKV6MK", "title": "CamelBak Podium 21-Ounce Chill Jacket Insulated Bottle,Clear/Green", "description": "The New Bottle that is changing it all starts its dominance of the bike bottle market with even more color options than ever. Cool without compromise!. CamelBak has been the innovation and performance leader in outdoor hydration products since 1989", "text": "CamelBak Podium 21-Ounce Chill Jacket Insulated Bottle,Clear/Green The New Bottle that is changing it all starts its dominance of the bike bottle market with even more color options than ever. Cool without compromise!. CamelBak has been the innovation and performance leader in outdoor hydration products since 1989", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413x6r%2BAQiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PKV6MK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001PKV6XY", "title": "Camelbak M.U.L.E. 100 Oz Hydration Pack, Estate Blue/Charcoal", "description": "The premier mountain bike hydration system.", "text": "Camelbak M.U.L.E. 100 Oz Hydration Pack, Estate Blue/Charcoal The premier mountain bike hydration system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QPZWtM7%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PKV6XY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001PLG7UK", "title": "Allen Sports Deluxe 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver)", "description": "", "text": "Allen Sports Deluxe 4-Bike Hitch Mount Rack (2-Inch Receiver)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fjajdGRVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PLG7UK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 105.99}}
{"item_id": "B001PM9EC2", "title": "Outers Gun Cleaning Tool Set", "description": "Outers assortment of specialty, gun-cleaning accessories helps you always have the right tool for a wide variety of dirty jobs. Keep your firearms clean and functioning properly by removing even the tiniest pieces of gunk, grime, dirt and debris. This assortment of cleaning picks easily removes small pieces of dirt and debris from hard to reach places such as the tight corners of actions and receivers. Also included is a universal double-ended brush for various cleaning chores.", "text": "Outers Gun Cleaning Tool Set Outers assortment of specialty, gun-cleaning accessories helps you always have the right tool for a wide variety of dirty jobs. Keep your firearms clean and functioning properly by removing even the tiniest pieces of gunk, grime, dirt and debris. This assortment of cleaning picks easily removes small pieces of dirt and debris from hard to reach places such as the tight corners of actions and receivers. Also included is a universal double-ended brush for various cleaning chores.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41reNTfnpEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PM9EC2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 6.4}}
{"item_id": "B001PM9EFY", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Ruger LCP Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-LCP units replace the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on the Ruger LCP. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine. These units provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2\" of gripping surface. These extensions will not fit any other .380 firearms. (Two extensions per package.)", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Ruger LCP Grip Extension The Pearce PG-LCP units replace the magazine base plate and retain all other factory components on the Ruger LCP. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine. These units provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2\" of gripping surface. These extensions will not fit any other .380 firearms. (Two extensions per package.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jIu4M-ezL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PM9EFY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.75}}
{"item_id": "B001PM9FBC", "title": "Birchwood Casey Swauber Applicators (20 Pack)", "description": "Swauber Applicators are great for applying gun blue chemicals such as Plum Brown, Perma Blue and Super Blue. Or, use them to apply any firearm cleaning chemicals such as Bore Scrubber and Barricade. Any job that requires the application of a liquid product, the Swauber is the right tool for the job!", "text": "Birchwood Casey Swauber Applicators (20 Pack) Swauber Applicators are great for applying gun blue chemicals such as Plum Brown, Perma Blue and Super Blue. Or, use them to apply any firearm cleaning chemicals such as Bore Scrubber and Barricade. Any job that requires the application of a liquid product, the Swauber is the right tool for the job!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N7Pg4VVZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PM9FBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 6.49}}
{"item_id": "B001PM9FC6", "title": "Kershaw Mini Biner with Anodized Aluminum Handle", "description": "Cut open a package. Slice through a cord. Carve off a slice of apple. It's always a good idea to have a Kershaw blade on hand. That's why you'll like the award-winning Kershaw Carabiner Tool's new little brother, the Mini Biner. In addition to its lightweight and durable aircraft-aluminum construction, the Mini Biner features a brilliantly sharp Kershaw blade built right in. This high-carbon 420J2 stainless steel blade is designed to provide extended use without re-sharpening. You'll also like the ergonomic \"contoured carabiner\" design that makes this mini tool as comfortable to use as it is handy. The spring-loaded carabiner closure attaches the tool to vest, backpack, hydro-pack, key ring, or belt loop with ease. Like its big brother, the Mini Biner is available in scratch-resistant black, silver, ruby red, and sapphire blue.", "text": "Kershaw Mini Biner with Anodized Aluminum Handle Cut open a package. Slice through a cord. Carve off a slice of apple. It's always a good idea to have a Kershaw blade on hand. That's why you'll like the award-winning Kershaw Carabiner Tool's new little brother, the Mini Biner. In addition to its lightweight and durable aircraft-aluminum construction, the Mini Biner features a brilliantly sharp Kershaw blade built right in. This high-carbon 420J2 stainless steel blade is designed to provide extended use without re-sharpening. You'll also like the ergonomic \"contoured carabiner\" design that makes this mini tool as comfortable to use as it is handy. The spring-loaded carabiner closure attaches the tool to vest, backpack, hydro-pack, key ring, or belt loop with ease. Like its big brother, the Mini Biner is available in scratch-resistant black, silver, ruby red, and sapphire blue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mnNcPPCVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PM9FC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.77}}
{"item_id": "B001PM9FEE", "title": "Kershaw 1770 OD-2 Knife", "description": "Kershaw’s new OverDrive-2 was created to give you the “OverDrive” style you want at a value price. Designed by Lee Williams, this larger OD-2 has a blade of 8CR13MOV stainless steel to take and hold its edge well. The glass-filled nylon handle provides stability, rigidity, and a non-slip grip. Of course, the OD-2 is one of our Flipper knives. Just pull back on the blade protrusion and flick your wrist forward slightly and knife will open smoothly and lock in place. But the OD offers a twist on the basic Flipper. Once the blade is open, the blade protrusion folds into a recess in the liner to give the OD-2 a sleek, smooth line all the way down.", "text": "Kershaw 1770 OD-2 Knife Kershaw’s new OverDrive-2 was created to give you the “OverDrive” style you want at a value price. Designed by Lee Williams, this larger OD-2 has a blade of 8CR13MOV stainless steel to take and hold its edge well. The glass-filled nylon handle provides stability, rigidity, and a non-slip grip. Of course, the OD-2 is one of our Flipper knives. Just pull back on the blade protrusion and flick your wrist forward slightly and knife will open smoothly and lock in place. But the OD offers a twist on the basic Flipper. Once the blade is open, the blade protrusion folds into a recess in the liner to give the OD-2 a sleek, smooth line all the way down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SowyM2-2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PM9FEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 11.45}}
{"item_id": "B001PO5LNQ", "title": "Wilson Staff Fifty Elite Golf Balls, Pack of 12", "description": "Fifty Elite launched an entirely new performance expectation into the 2 piece distance ball category. As the original and only 50 compression golf ball, fifty offered unmatched feel in a ball that is as long as any on the market. Today Fifty is hands down the best value in premium balls, offering performance similar to balls twice the price.", "text": "Wilson Staff Fifty Elite Golf Balls, Pack of 12 Fifty Elite launched an entirely new performance expectation into the 2 piece distance ball category. As the original and only 50 compression golf ball, fifty offered unmatched feel in a ball that is as long as any on the market. Today Fifty is hands down the best value in premium balls, offering performance similar to balls twice the price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NyhSqZRML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PO5LNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson Golf", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Distance Balls"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001PO5QAO", "title": "Crosman 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.25g, 2000 rds, black", "description": "Crosman Airsoft 2,000 ct. 25 gram black 6mm Bb's", "text": "Crosman 6mm plastic airsoft BBs, 0.25g, 2000 rds, black Crosman Airsoft 2,000 ct. 25 gram black 6mm Bb's", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Di392cHmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PO5QAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001PO5QAY", "title": "Crosman 6mm biodegradable airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 2000 rds, white", "description": "2000 count, .20g, biodegradable 6mm airsoft BBs - a great alternative for indoor and outdoor target shooting and tactical gaming. Biodegradable BBs meet the demands of airsoft fields and tactical skirmish events with environmental requirements. They are seamless, accurate and leave no long lasting clutter on the playing field. Made with P-Life™, and patented OXO biodegradable compound, they will begin to degrade within 45 days under favorable environmental conditions.", "text": "Crosman 6mm biodegradable airsoft BBs, 0.20g, 2000 rds, white 2000 count, .20g, biodegradable 6mm airsoft BBs - a great alternative for indoor and outdoor target shooting and tactical gaming. Biodegradable BBs meet the demands of airsoft fields and tactical skirmish events with environmental requirements. They are seamless, accurate and leave no long lasting clutter on the playing field. Made with P-Life™, and patented OXO biodegradable compound, they will begin to degrade within 45 days under favorable environmental conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41evbehvS3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PO5QAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B001PO5QNG", "title": "Crosman CenterPoint Adventure Class 2-7x32mm riflescope with dual illuminated reticle", "description": "CenterPoint Adventure Class riflescopes are go anywhere, do anything scopes, offering highly resolved images in all conditions. With many features found on elite level scopes, the Adventure Class delivers more performance at affordable prices. Adventure Class scopes feature one piece tube construction, multi-coated lenses for optimum light transmission and adjustable objectives, delivering a parallax-free image at any distance. These scopes are 100% waterproof, fogproof and shockproof and come standard with a limited lifetime warranty. * Ideal for Shotgun and Muzzleloader Hunting * Red/Green Illuminated Mil-Dot Reticle * True Hunter Windage and Elevation Dials * Includes flip open lens covers and Weaver-style Rings", "text": "Crosman CenterPoint Adventure Class 2-7x32mm riflescope with dual illuminated reticle CenterPoint Adventure Class riflescopes are go anywhere, do anything scopes, offering highly resolved images in all conditions. With many features found on elite level scopes, the Adventure Class delivers more performance at affordable prices. Adventure Class scopes feature one piece tube construction, multi-coated lenses for optimum light transmission and adjustable objectives, delivering a parallax-free image at any distance. These scopes are 100% waterproof, fogproof and shockproof and come standard with a limited lifetime warranty. * Ideal for Shotgun and Muzzleloader Hunting * Red/Green Illuminated Mil-Dot Reticle * True Hunter Windage and Elevation Dials * Includes flip open lens covers and Weaver-style Rings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FTW7XDldL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PO5QNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 58.99}}
{"item_id": "B001PO5QU4", "title": "Crosman AirSoft Shoulder Holster", "description": "Carry your airsoft pistol in a discrete location with the Crosman airsoft shoulder holster. The ambidextrous garment is fully adjustable, with quick-release retention straps for easy on and off. The unit comes with a pistol holster that fits most medium-sized handguns, along with a pouch for two spare clips.", "text": "Crosman AirSoft Shoulder Holster Carry your airsoft pistol in a discrete location with the Crosman airsoft shoulder holster. The ambidextrous garment is fully adjustable, with quick-release retention straps for easy on and off. The unit comes with a pistol holster that fits most medium-sized handguns, along with a pouch for two spare clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417nYu54POL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PO5QU4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.99}}
