{"item_id": "B001PPVRWE", "title": "GUN CLEANING KIT - 27 Parts SHOTGUN PISTOL RIFLE tools", "description": "BRAND NEW - ALUMINUM CASE - GUN CLEANING TOOL KIT!Foam lined case is filled with over 25 Tools and Cleaning accesories. Includes the following: - 10 / 12 gauge brass wire brush- 20 / 28 gauge brass wire brush- 410 gauge brass wire brush- .45 caliber brass wire brush- .40 caliber brass wire brush- 357 / .38 / 9mm caliber brass wire brush- .17 caliver brass wire brush- 30 caliber brass wire brush- 270 / 280 caliber wire brush- .22 caliber brass wire brush- 10 / 12 gauge terry cleaning mop- 20 / 28 gauge terry cleaning mop- 410 shotgun terry cleaning mop- 357 / .38 / 9mm terry cleaning mop- .22 caliber terry cleaning mopAlso,Enough Rods to clean pistols and rifles of ANY caliber.Enough Rods for high power rifles and SHOTGUNS. Theres a couple of different adaptors including slotted tips for running cleaning patches through smaller caliber rifles and pistols.Theres also a stack of cleaning patches included. Rotating handles for both the pistol rods and the shotgun rods, ROTATION is important since many barrels have twists / \"rifled\" and the handle needs to spin!Brand New", "text": "GUN CLEANING KIT - 27 Parts SHOTGUN PISTOL RIFLE tools BRAND NEW - ALUMINUM CASE - GUN CLEANING TOOL KIT!Foam lined case is filled with over 25 Tools and Cleaning accesories. Includes the following: - 10 / 12 gauge brass wire brush- 20 / 28 gauge brass wire brush- 410 gauge brass wire brush- .45 caliber brass wire brush- .40 caliber brass wire brush- 357 / .38 / 9mm caliber brass wire brush- .17 caliver brass wire brush- 30 caliber brass wire brush- 270 / 280 caliber wire brush- .22 caliber brass wire brush- 10 / 12 gauge terry cleaning mop- 20 / 28 gauge terry cleaning mop- 410 shotgun terry cleaning mop- 357 / .38 / 9mm terry cleaning mop- .22 caliber terry cleaning mopAlso,Enough Rods to clean pistols and rifles of ANY caliber.Enough Rods for high power rifles and SHOTGUNS. Theres a couple of different adaptors including slotted tips for running cleaning patches through smaller caliber rifles and pistols.Theres also a stack of cleaning patches included. Rotating handles for both the pistol rods and the shotgun rods, ROTATION is important since many barrels have twists / \"rifled\" and the handle needs to spin!Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51G%2BygRKQXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PPVRWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 21.49}}
{"item_id": "B001PQNI70", "title": "For Taurus 24/7,PT-58,PT-92C,PT-911,PT-938 See inside For more Fit.", "description": "\"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster.Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-0007 holster is Custom fit for Taurus Models 24/7,PT-58,PT- 92C,PT-911,PT-938,809,840,845,909,917,PT38S,945,PT-945.", "text": "For Taurus 24/7,PT-58,PT-92C,PT-911,PT-938 See inside For more Fit. \"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster.Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-0007 holster is Custom fit for Taurus Models 24/7,PT-58,PT- 92C,PT-911,PT-938,809,840,845,909,917,PT38S,945,PT-945.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PatX4zgUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PQNI70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B001PQQG24", "title": "Thule Atlantis Rooftop Cargo Box", "description": "All Thule roof box orders must be separately from any other products, including other Thule non-Roof Box products. Multiple box styles may be ordered on one order.", "text": "Thule Atlantis Rooftop Cargo Box All Thule roof box orders must be separately from any other products, including other Thule non-Roof Box products. Multiple box styles may be ordered on one order.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jot8Ypd9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PQQG24.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Cargo Boxes"]]}}
