{"item_id": "B001PR12Q8", "title": "Cressi Big Eyes Evolution Mask", "description": "This high performance mask from renowned Italian dive company Cressi is made from innovative High Seal material, known for its remarkable softness. A new skirt design also creates an open-angle point of contact between the mask and your face, improving comfort and line of sight, while also leaving no mark on your skin, even after extended use.Raked lenses, with a patented inverted drop shape, are small in shape and placed very close to your pupils, improving visibility by 25% over prior models. The headband, meanwhile, uses Cressi's exclusive patented, double-injected elastomer, allowing the strap's buckles to be mounted on an elastic element that tilts vertically for ease of use and improved durability. It's easy to install prescription lenses, as well, as it takes only a screwdriver and a few moments to replace the standard lenses with prescription lenses.FeaturesSkirt made of soft, High Seal siliconeUnique skirt design offers differentiated rigidity for a comfortable fitNarrow headband is nearly invisible when wornEasily adjusted buckles are joined to the headband with a durable plastic elementPatented inverted drop shape lenses improve downward visibilityAbout CressiRenowned Italian dive brand Cressi was first founded in 1946, and was the first company to create products now considered essential gear, such as a dive mask with dedicated nose pocket, and an adjustable open-heel fin. Cressi's products have always been designed and manufactured in Italy, and the company remains an innovator in product research, development, and production of apparel and equipment for diving, spear fishing, snorkeling, and swimming.", "text": "Cressi Big Eyes Evolution Mask This high performance mask from renowned Italian dive company Cressi is made from innovative High Seal material, known for its remarkable softness. A new skirt design also creates an open-angle point of contact between the mask and your face, improving comfort and line of sight, while also leaving no mark on your skin, even after extended use.Raked lenses, with a patented inverted drop shape, are small in shape and placed very close to your pupils, improving visibility by 25% over prior models. The headband, meanwhile, uses Cressi's exclusive patented, double-injected elastomer, allowing the strap's buckles to be mounted on an elastic element that tilts vertically for ease of use and improved durability. It's easy to install prescription lenses, as well, as it takes only a screwdriver and a few moments to replace the standard lenses with prescription lenses.FeaturesSkirt made of soft, High Seal siliconeUnique skirt design offers differentiated rigidity for a comfortable fitNarrow headband is nearly invisible when wornEasily adjusted buckles are joined to the headband with a durable plastic elementPatented inverted drop shape lenses improve downward visibilityAbout CressiRenowned Italian dive brand Cressi was first founded in 1946, and was the first company to create products now considered essential gear, such as a dive mask with dedicated nose pocket, and an adjustable open-heel fin. Cressi's products have always been designed and manufactured in Italy, and the company remains an innovator in product research, development, and production of apparel and equipment for diving, spear fishing, snorkeling, and swimming.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NWWf2AUzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PR12Q8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cressi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001PR12ZO", "title": "Cressi Palau Light Weight Travel Snorkeling Swim Fins (Made in Italy)", "description": "The Palau Snorkeling Fin is the first open-heel snorkeling specific fin in Cressi's line. Incorporating technology that has previously only been used in Scuba fins, the Palau is a phenomenal product and value. The blade gives a powerful and efficient kick and the foot pocket is ultra-soft. Comes in 3 great colors including Blue, Black/Yellow and Black/Pink.", "text": "Cressi Palau Light Weight Travel Snorkeling Swim Fins (Made in Italy) The Palau Snorkeling Fin is the first open-heel snorkeling specific fin in Cressi's line. Incorporating technology that has previously only been used in Scuba fins, the Palau is a phenomenal product and value. The blade gives a powerful and efficient kick and the foot pocket is ultra-soft. Comes in 3 great colors including Blue, Black/Yellow and Black/Pink.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ozoh2ghCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PR12ZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001PR6JMU", "title": "NEW - Ultralight Travel Daypack / Backpack - The Perfect Light Weight Daypack For Sightseeing, Hiking, Biking & Travel - Super Durable & Comfortable Yet Only 6.5 oz", "description": "The self-stowing Ultralight Travel Daypack is so amazingly practical that it will become one of your travel essentials. It comes as a 6.5 oz compact pouch which opens up to a feature rich, super strong and comfortable daypack. Providing 1100 cubic inches of space to store your all of your gear, it is the perfect daypack for a sightseeing, hiking, biking traveling or shopping. When stuffed back into its tiny storage pouch, your daypack is always there ready for action in your car, your purse, your backpack or your bike saddlebag. Bliss has never been so convenient.", "text": "NEW - Ultralight Travel Daypack / Backpack - The Perfect Light Weight Daypack For Sightseeing, Hiking, Biking & Travel - Super Durable & Comfortable Yet Only 6.5 oz The self-stowing Ultralight Travel Daypack is so amazingly practical that it will become one of your travel essentials. It comes as a 6.5 oz compact pouch which opens up to a feature rich, super strong and comfortable daypack. Providing 1100 cubic inches of space to store your all of your gear, it is the perfect daypack for a sightseeing, hiking, biking traveling or shopping. When stuffed back into its tiny storage pouch, your daypack is always there ready for action in your car, your purse, your backpack or your bike saddlebag. Bliss has never been so convenient.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qILg1lSwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PR6JMU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 20.95}}
