{"item_id": "B001PS1M4E", "title": "Outdoor Research Ultralight Dry Sack", "description": "These ultralight stuff sacks can be used to organize your gear on any adventure. The fully seam taped silnyl fabric keeps the weight down and helps shed wet weather to protect your gear. A durable buckle secures the roll-top closure.", "text": "Outdoor Research Ultralight Dry Sack These ultralight stuff sacks can be used to organize your gear on any adventure. The fully seam taped silnyl fabric keeps the weight down and helps shed wet weather to protect your gear. A durable buckle secures the roll-top closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BAPekDCbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PS1M4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]]}}
