{"item_id": "B001PT5WU8", "title": "RockyMounts Clutch SD", "description": "It's no wonder why the Clutch SD is our most popular bike rack out there. The Clutch SD is a hardcore fork mount bolt on system perfect for securing your bikes in a Toyota, Nissan, Chevy or GMC bed channel system. It fits bikes with a 9mm front axle and is designed with mounting plates that easily slide into the channel of your pickup truck. Its burly cast aluminum body has a roomy center opening making it easy to feed a cable lock through for extra security or serves as a tie down. *Includes locking quick release and keys.*", "text": "RockyMounts Clutch SD It's no wonder why the Clutch SD is our most popular bike rack out there. The Clutch SD is a hardcore fork mount bolt on system perfect for securing your bikes in a Toyota, Nissan, Chevy or GMC bed channel system. It fits bikes with a 9mm front axle and is designed with mounting plates that easily slide into the channel of your pickup truck. Its burly cast aluminum body has a roomy center opening making it easy to feed a cable lock through for extra security or serves as a tie down. *Includes locking quick release and keys.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nUjLKhmXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PT5WU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RockyMounts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 62.95}}
