{"item_id": "B001PT9UAQ", "title": "Nalgene BPA Free Tritan Narrow Mouth 32 Oz Water Bottle", "description": "Free from BPA, this is an Everyday bottle that is one you will want close at hand at all times. Nalgene's classic 32 oz narrow-mouth water bottle made in tough, translucent Eastman Tritan copolyester.", "text": "Nalgene BPA Free Tritan Narrow Mouth 32 Oz Water Bottle Free from BPA, this is an Everyday bottle that is one you will want close at hand at all times. Nalgene's classic 32 oz narrow-mouth water bottle made in tough, translucent Eastman Tritan copolyester.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tSkqae0gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PT9UAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001PTA294", "title": "Campmor Cue ClipMap & Cue Sheet Holder", "description": "The CueClip Map and Cue Sheet Holder mounts to bar or stem and holds firmly at any speed.", "text": "Campmor Cue ClipMap & Cue Sheet Holder The CueClip Map and Cue Sheet Holder mounts to bar or stem and holds firmly at any speed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CIoihX7bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PTA294.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Campmor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 7.11}}
{"item_id": "B001PTGO5A", "title": "Flexi Freeze Refreezable Ice Sheets 3 pack", "description": "Flexi Freeze Ice Sheets provide a convenient and economical replacement for soggy bags of ice and chemical-based freezer packs for your cooler. Coming in a pack of three, these Flexi Freeze sheets measure 0.62 by 19 by 15.5 inches (HxWxL) and can be cut down to a just-right size to fit your exact needs. Unlike most freezer packs, the Flex Freeze sheets remain flexible when frozen, allowing them to contour to the food or drinks you are cooling. Made from 100 percent water, the Flexi Freeze sheets can be stored in your freezer and used over and over again.", "text": "Flexi Freeze Refreezable Ice Sheets 3 pack Flexi Freeze Ice Sheets provide a convenient and economical replacement for soggy bags of ice and chemical-based freezer packs for your cooler. Coming in a pack of three, these Flexi Freeze sheets measure 0.62 by 19 by 15.5 inches (HxWxL) and can be cut down to a just-right size to fit your exact needs. Unlike most freezer packs, the Flex Freeze sheets remain flexible when frozen, allowing them to contour to the food or drinks you are cooling. Made from 100 percent water, the Flexi Freeze sheets can be stored in your freezer and used over and over again.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y812qIZYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PTGO5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flexi Freeze", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 20.0}}
