{"item_id": "B001PTGOO6", "title": "Gerber 22-01967 Mini Covert Knife with Serrated Edge", "description": "", "text": "Gerber 22-01967 Mini Covert Knife with Serrated Edge", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wUN85xF3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PTGOO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.98}}
{"item_id": "B001PTHKMG", "title": "MinnKota Trolling Motor Power Center", "description": "Ideal for small-boat transom applications (i.e., boats that don't have battery compartments), the Minn Kota Motor Power Center stores your battery securely and out of the way while you boat. The Motor Power Center features easy-access external battery terminals that allow you to connect trolling motor leads and charger leads without opening the box. The built-in battery meter, meanwhile, displays the current \"state of charge.\" Designed to fit group 24- and 27-size batteries, the Motor Power Center offers two 12-volt accessory plugs and two manual reset circuit breakers: a 15 amp breaker for accessory plugs and a 60 amp breaker for the trolling motor.", "text": "MinnKota Trolling Motor Power Center Ideal for small-boat transom applications (i.e., boats that don't have battery compartments), the Minn Kota Motor Power Center stores your battery securely and out of the way while you boat. The Motor Power Center features easy-access external battery terminals that allow you to connect trolling motor leads and charger leads without opening the box. The built-in battery meter, meanwhile, displays the current \"state of charge.\" Designed to fit group 24- and 27-size batteries, the Motor Power Center offers two 12-volt accessory plugs and two manual reset circuit breakers: a 15 amp breaker for accessory plugs and a 60 amp breaker for the trolling motor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416mnHW0O2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PTHKMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minn Kota", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Motors", "Trolling Motors"]], "price": 58.66}}
{"item_id": "B001PYSNAO", "title": "Cold Steel Gurkha Kukri Kraton Handle", "description": "The Gurkha Kukri’s SK-5 high carbon blade is the heaviest Kukri on the market, with remarkable cutting power. The blade is almost an inch wider near the tip than at the handle, shifting the knife’s balance point forward to allow a substantial blow to be struck with minimal effort, using inertia alone to complete the cut.A durable Secure-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications12-inch blade length0.3125-inch blade thickness17-inch overall length22-ounce weightKray-Ex handleSK-5 high carbon steel bladeIncludes Secure-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Gurkha Kukri Kraton Handle The Gurkha Kukri’s SK-5 high carbon blade is the heaviest Kukri on the market, with remarkable cutting power. The blade is almost an inch wider near the tip than at the handle, shifting the knife’s balance point forward to allow a substantial blow to be struck with minimal effort, using inertia alone to complete the cut.A durable Secure-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications12-inch blade length0.3125-inch blade thickness17-inch overall length22-ounce weightKray-Ex handleSK-5 high carbon steel bladeIncludes Secure-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HJTkjQEtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PYSNAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 152.64}}
{"item_id": "B001PYUL0O", "title": "Cold Steel Trail Master Black Kraton Handle", "description": "If you want a Bowie knife that requires minimum maintenance and withstands water, salt, air, and the humidity of jungle environments, the SK-5 Trail Master fits the bill. As an added bonus, it's equipped with an attractive rolled edge, capable of easily severing four inches of rope or more.SpecificationsSK-5 high carbon steel blade9.5-inch blade length14.5-inch overall length16.7-ounce weightIncludes a leather sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Trail Master Black Kraton Handle If you want a Bowie knife that requires minimum maintenance and withstands water, salt, air, and the humidity of jungle environments, the SK-5 Trail Master fits the bill. As an added bonus, it's equipped with an attractive rolled edge, capable of easily severing four inches of rope or more.SpecificationsSK-5 high carbon steel blade9.5-inch blade length14.5-inch overall length16.7-ounce weightIncludes a leather sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21PGXi8VjhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PYUL0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 124.64}}
{"item_id": "B001PZB2WO", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools AE07-CP Aegis Knife with Part-Serrated Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Tanto Blade and GRN Camo Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "description": "Showcasing top-end opening and locking technology from SOG, the AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife is a sleek, versatile, and easy-to-handle tool that can stand up to tough use. Featuring a half-serrated 3.5-inch stainless steel Tanto blade with a black TiNi finish, a well-balanced body, and SOG's trademarked DigiGrip handle, this knife makes quick work of a wide variety of tasks--whether you expected to come across them or not.AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife with Black TiNi FinishAt a Glance:3.5-inch half-serrated AUS-8 stainless steel Tanto blade with black TiNi finishPatented SOG Assisted Technology for fast, easy openingBlade lock with red-means-ready safety indicatorTough, lightweight Zytel handle with Digi Camo finish and rubber anti-slip insertsLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipSOG's trademarked bayonet clip allows the knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in useDesigned to fit comfortably in your hand, this knife is well balanced for a natural feel.View larger.Secure DigiGrip for confident cuts.Reversible clip can be positioned on either side of the handle.An Ambitious Name for an Ambitious KnifeAegis means \"shield\" or \"protection\" in Greek, and it is also the code name for both the world's premier integrated air defense system and the sea-based element of the United States Ballistic Missile Defense System. Thanks to SOG's thoughtful design features, this versatile knife lives up to its illustrious name. The knife opens to a full length of 8.25 inches, and its 3.5-inch half-serrated blade is crafted from AUS-8 stainless steel for improved strength and edge retention. You get the best of both straight and serrated blades with this design, and the Tanto shape of the blade offers an extra strong tip, while the black TiNi finish on this blade offers improved durability along with anti-reflective good looks.Cryogenic Heat Treatment for a Sharp, Dependable BladeSOG's unique cryogenic heat treatment process increases the toughness and wear resistance of the blade. The blade's temperature is slowly taken down to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit and then slowly brought back up to room temperature. This stress relieves the material on an atomic level and increases overall strength and edge retention. This means the knife edge stays sharp longer with significantly less micro-fracturing and edge-chipping.SOG Assisted Technology Increases Speed, Safety, and UsabilityWhen you start to open the AE-07's blade, SOG's patented S.A.T. (SOG Assisted Technology) takes over and high-tension coil springs propel the blade the rest of the way open. This means fast, easy, one-handed access to the AE-07's blade whenever you need it.Additionally, the unique design of S.A.T. offers security and peace of mind by incorporating locking mechanisms that are stronger, more reliable, and easier to access than other mechanisms. For Aegis Series knives, this means a safety on the side of the handle that delivers extra protection against accidental openings. When the safety is protecting you, its button shows green to confirm that you're ready to slip the knife in your pocket. When you switch the safety off, this button turns red to signal that your blade is ready for deployment.Ergonomic, Slip-Free Grip Ensures Accurate HandlingThis Aegis knife is designed to sit comfortably in either hand, and it's well-balanced for a natural feel that inspires confident cuts. SOG's trademarked, checkered DigiGrip handle provides a sure grip for safe, accurate positioning, while tacky rubber inserts in the handle offer extra anti-slip security. Plus this handle is crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. And the AE-07's Digi Camo finish fits in with your military or hunting gear.The knife weighs in at just 3.1 ounces, and it includes SOG's trademarked bayonet clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Tanto Folding Knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxAE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools AE07-CP Aegis Knife with Part-Serrated Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Tanto Blade and GRN Camo Handle, Black TiNi Finish Showcasing top-end opening and locking technology from SOG, the AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife is a sleek, versatile, and easy-to-handle tool that can stand up to tough use. Featuring a half-serrated 3.5-inch stainless steel Tanto blade with a black TiNi finish, a well-balanced body, and SOG's trademarked DigiGrip handle, this knife makes quick work of a wide variety of tasks--whether you expected to come across them or not.AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife with Black TiNi FinishAt a Glance:3.5-inch half-serrated AUS-8 stainless steel Tanto blade with black TiNi finishPatented SOG Assisted Technology for fast, easy openingBlade lock with red-means-ready safety indicatorTough, lightweight Zytel handle with Digi Camo finish and rubber anti-slip insertsLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipSOG's trademarked bayonet clip allows the knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in useDesigned to fit comfortably in your hand, this knife is well balanced for a natural feel.View larger.Secure DigiGrip for confident cuts.Reversible clip can be positioned on either side of the handle.An Ambitious Name for an Ambitious KnifeAegis means \"shield\" or \"protection\" in Greek, and it is also the code name for both the world's premier integrated air defense system and the sea-based element of the United States Ballistic Missile Defense System. Thanks to SOG's thoughtful design features, this versatile knife lives up to its illustrious name. The knife opens to a full length of 8.25 inches, and its 3.5-inch half-serrated blade is crafted from AUS-8 stainless steel for improved strength and edge retention. You get the best of both straight and serrated blades with this design, and the Tanto shape of the blade offers an extra strong tip, while the black TiNi finish on this blade offers improved durability along with anti-reflective good looks.Cryogenic Heat Treatment for a Sharp, Dependable BladeSOG's unique cryogenic heat treatment process increases the toughness and wear resistance of the blade. The blade's temperature is slowly taken down to less than -300 degrees Fahrenheit and then slowly brought back up to room temperature. This stress relieves the material on an atomic level and increases overall strength and edge retention. This means the knife edge stays sharp longer with significantly less micro-fracturing and edge-chipping.SOG Assisted Technology Increases Speed, Safety, and UsabilityWhen you start to open the AE-07's blade, SOG's patented S.A.T. (SOG Assisted Technology) takes over and high-tension coil springs propel the blade the rest of the way open. This means fast, easy, one-handed access to the AE-07's blade whenever you need it.Additionally, the unique design of S.A.T. offers security and peace of mind by incorporating locking mechanisms that are stronger, more reliable, and easier to access than other mechanisms. For Aegis Series knives, this means a safety on the side of the handle that delivers extra protection against accidental openings. When the safety is protecting you, its button shows green to confirm that you're ready to slip the knife in your pocket. When you switch the safety off, this button turns red to signal that your blade is ready for deployment.Ergonomic, Slip-Free Grip Ensures Accurate HandlingThis Aegis knife is designed to sit comfortably in either hand, and it's well-balanced for a natural feel that inspires confident cuts. SOG's trademarked, checkered DigiGrip handle provides a sure grip for safe, accurate positioning, while tacky rubber inserts in the handle offer extra anti-slip security. Plus this handle is crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. And the AE-07's Digi Camo finish fits in with your military or hunting gear.The knife weighs in at just 3.1 ounces, and it includes SOG's trademarked bayonet clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG AE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Tanto Folding Knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxAE-07 Digi Camo Aegis Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Dsk-GgvlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001PZB2WO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 67.49}}
{"item_id": "B001Q221GM", "title": "Pedros Trixie-Fixie Tool", "description": "", "text": "Pedros Trixie-Fixie Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31djlUoLCsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q221GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pedro&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B001Q270CC", "title": "Pedro's Vise Whip", "description": "Face it. Chain whips are a pain to use--that's why Pedros created the Vise Whip. Now you can remove cassettes quickly and easily without the juggling act. Clamp the Pedros Vice Whip on cogs from 11 to 23 teeth to hold it in place, then just use a cassette socket to unscrew the keeper. Wasn't that easy?", "text": "Pedro's Vise Whip Face it. Chain whips are a pain to use--that's why Pedros created the Vise Whip. Now you can remove cassettes quickly and easily without the juggling act. Clamp the Pedros Vice Whip on cogs from 11 to 23 teeth to hold it in place, then just use a cassette socket to unscrew the keeper. Wasn't that easy?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312-UL70%2BCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q270CC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pedro&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 46.19}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3KKC8", "title": "Sea to Summit Lightweight Dry Sack", "description": "A less expensive and less bulky alternative to traditional dry bags. You can squash these into spots ordinary heavy dry bags won’t go. Fits into little corners of a sea kayak or light enough to take backpacking or adventure traveling. Not intended for situations where dry sack will be submerged under water. Proper Use: Any roll-top dry sack must be closed properly to ensure water can’t get in. Begin by folding the Hypalon strip down first and be sure to have at least three rolls before closing the buckle. Avoid contact with sharp objects or subjecting the sack to high abrasion, as this could compromise the waterproof fabric. Like all manufacturers of roll-top, fabric dry sacks, Sea to Summit recommends that sensitive electronic devices be ‘double bagged’ (i.e. putting electronics inside one dry sack then placing this inside a second dry sack). For maximum protection, the use of a waterproof hard case should be considered.", "text": "Sea to Summit Lightweight Dry Sack A less expensive and less bulky alternative to traditional dry bags. You can squash these into spots ordinary heavy dry bags won’t go. Fits into little corners of a sea kayak or light enough to take backpacking or adventure traveling. Not intended for situations where dry sack will be submerged under water. Proper Use: Any roll-top dry sack must be closed properly to ensure water can’t get in. Begin by folding the Hypalon strip down first and be sure to have at least three rolls before closing the buckle. Avoid contact with sharp objects or subjecting the sack to high abrasion, as this could compromise the waterproof fabric. Like all manufacturers of roll-top, fabric dry sacks, Sea to Summit recommends that sensitive electronic devices be ‘double bagged’ (i.e. putting electronics inside one dry sack then placing this inside a second dry sack). For maximum protection, the use of a waterproof hard case should be considered.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iJFUtp62L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3KKC8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3KKOG", "title": "Sea to Summit eVAC Dry Sack", "description": "The new eVAC Dry Sack is a slimmed down version of our award winning eVENT Compression Dry Sack. We use waterproof, air permeable eVENT fabric on the base for valve-free air expelling, allowing compact packing. Instead of straps for compression, you just roll the sack down and air is pushed out of the base. Then close the buckle and you’ve just saved space and weight. The sack is oval-shaped, rather than round so they resist rolling when laid on their side.", "text": "Sea to Summit eVAC Dry Sack The new eVAC Dry Sack is a slimmed down version of our award winning eVENT Compression Dry Sack. We use waterproof, air permeable eVENT fabric on the base for valve-free air expelling, allowing compact packing. Instead of straps for compression, you just roll the sack down and air is pushed out of the base. Then close the buckle and you’ve just saved space and weight. The sack is oval-shaped, rather than round so they resist rolling when laid on their side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uMP3AkOCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3KKOG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3KLU4", "title": "Sea to Summit X Mug", "description": "Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "text": "Sea to Summit X Mug Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bpj8wvuAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3KLU4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 32.21}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3KUAK", "title": "Green Toys Jump Rope, Pink", "description": "Crisscrosses, can-cans and double-unders are all good for the planet when they are done with the Green Toy Jump Rope made from recycled plastic and all cotton rope. Manufactured in the U.S.A. from 100% recycled plastic milk containers, happy jumpers will burn energy while saving energy and greenhouse gas emissions.", "text": "Green Toys Jump Rope, Pink Crisscrosses, can-cans and double-unders are all good for the planet when they are done with the Green Toy Jump Rope made from recycled plastic and all cotton rope. Manufactured in the U.S.A. from 100% recycled plastic milk containers, happy jumpers will burn energy while saving energy and greenhouse gas emissions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bPbLqQMeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3KUAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Green Toys", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 9.98}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3L70W", "title": "Advanced Elements Canoe and Kayak Anchor System", "description": "Made by Advanced Elements, this anchor system can be used with either a canoe or a kayak, and is designed to hold well to most types of bottoms, from sand to rock. The anchor features a sliding collar that keeps the flukes drawn up tight against the shank when stowed, then drops to lock the flukes open when deployed. To remove the anchor from the water, simply pull and stow. This anchor system includes a 3-pound collared, galvanized grapple anchor; 60 feet of line; a carabineer; a line float; and a mesh travel bag for the anchor and line.Features3-pound collared, galvanized grapple anchorSliding collar that locks flukes open when deployed60 feet of lineCarabineerLine floatMesh travel bagManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.What's in the BoxAnchor, line, carabineer, line float, and mesh travel bag.", "text": "Advanced Elements Canoe and Kayak Anchor System Made by Advanced Elements, this anchor system can be used with either a canoe or a kayak, and is designed to hold well to most types of bottoms, from sand to rock. The anchor features a sliding collar that keeps the flukes drawn up tight against the shank when stowed, then drops to lock the flukes open when deployed. To remove the anchor from the water, simply pull and stow. This anchor system includes a 3-pound collared, galvanized grapple anchor; 60 feet of line; a carabineer; a line float; and a mesh travel bag for the anchor and line.Features3-pound collared, galvanized grapple anchorSliding collar that locks flukes open when deployed60 feet of lineCarabineerLine floatMesh travel bagManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.What's in the BoxAnchor, line, carabineer, line float, and mesh travel bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Be1kPKDXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3L70W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Anchors"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3L720", "title": "Advanced Elements 10-Liter Portable Foldup Pocket Sink with Carry Bag", "description": "Ideal for camping, fishing, or other outdoor trips, this portable, folding sink makes it easy to wash dishes at your campsite or transport water. The sink springs open and stands freely and features a durable, four-layer construction with a metal spring rim for extra rigidity. Other highlights include an extra-wide opening on the top and two wide handles that make the sink simple to carry. A small mesh bag attached to the sink is handy for holding soap, sponges, and other items. When you're done, the sink folds flat and takes up minimal space, making storage easy. The sink holds up to 2.6 gallons of water.FeaturesDurable, four-layer constructionMetal spring rim for extra rigidityExtra-wide openingTwo wide carrying handlesSmall mesh bag for soap and sponges2.6-gallon capacityManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "text": "Advanced Elements 10-Liter Portable Foldup Pocket Sink with Carry Bag Ideal for camping, fishing, or other outdoor trips, this portable, folding sink makes it easy to wash dishes at your campsite or transport water. The sink springs open and stands freely and features a durable, four-layer construction with a metal spring rim for extra rigidity. Other highlights include an extra-wide opening on the top and two wide handles that make the sink simple to carry. A small mesh bag attached to the sink is handy for holding soap, sponges, and other items. When you're done, the sink folds flat and takes up minimal space, making storage easy. The sink holds up to 2.6 gallons of water.FeaturesDurable, four-layer constructionMetal spring rim for extra rigidityExtra-wide openingTwo wide carrying handlesSmall mesh bag for soap and sponges2.6-gallon capacityManufacturer WarrantyAdvanced Elements warrants its products to be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of one year from the date of purchase, or 90 days for Friday Harbor brand products. Products that prove to be defective under conditions of normal and proper use during the warranty period because of defective workmanship or faulty material will be replaced or repaired without charge. For warranty service, contact Advanced Elements.About Advanced ElementsNearly 10 years ago Advanced Elements was started by two inventors with the desire to bring to market a new type of inflatable kayak: a \"hybrid\" of inflatable and rigid components that performs like a rigid kayak, but is portable, lightweight, and affordable.Today the company offers more than 70 different products to customers worldwide. It continues to push the innovation and evolution of the inflatable kayak with new patented designs that use unique combinations of materials and components.The people at Advanced Elements believe that their boats are the very best combination of quality, performance, and price in the world. They feel that it is extremely important to make sure that customers are having the best experience possible. One of the ways they do this is by a passionate focus on customer support. It is the feedback from customers that has allowed the company to excel and continue to grow over the years.The Advanced Elements distribution center and offices are located in Benicia, California, just east of San Francisco. This is also where you will find the company's excellent customer service team that is ready to answer any questions you might have.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41grs2AlihL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3L720.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3LEDW", "title": "Louisville Slugger MLB180 Natural Wood Baseball Bat", "description": "Don't make the mistake of thinking all wood bats are the same. They may look similar, but the quality of the wood is very different from one wood bat company to another. Louisville Slugger, however, sets itself apart from other bat makers with more than 120 years of bat-making experience, outstanding turning models, and access to the best-quality wood on the market. The MLB180 bat, for instance, is made of professional-grade ash, pound for pound the strongest timber available. Ash offers a flexibility that isn't found in other timbers, including maple, resulting in a barrel that tends to flex rather than break. This gives you a larger, more forgiving sweet spot in terms of breakage. In addition, ash is lighter than maple, so players can choose from among several large-barrel sizes. It all adds up to a terrific choice for casual players who love the look and feel of a genuine wood bat, or professionals who value a high-quality bat performance.The MLB180 also boasts a randomly selected turning model, with such possibilities as C271, P72, C243, R161, T141, and K55.Bat SpecificationsWood: AshFinish: NaturalLength: 32, 33, or 34 inchesTurning model: C271, P72, C243, R161, T141, or K55Note:The biggest factors that influence the life of a wood bat are the quality of wood and where the ball hits your bat. Until you gain experience hitting with wood bats, however, don't be surprised if you break a lot of bats. Unlike with aluminum bats, when you hit a ball along the handle or at the end of a wood bat, you may break the bat rather than get a hit. It takes a lot of practice, but with work, you will find that you break fewer bats and become a much better hitter.About Louisville SluggerIn many ways, the rich 120-year history of the Louisville Slugger baseball bat began in the talented hands of 17-year-old John A. \"Bud\" Hillerich. Bud's father, J.F. Hillerich, owned a woodworking shop in Louisville in the 1880s when Bud began working for him. Legend has it that Bud slipped away from work one afternoon in 1884 to watch the Louisville Eclipse, the town's major league team. After Pete Browning--the Eclipse's star who was mired in a hitting slump--broke his bat, Bud invited him to his father's shop to make a new one. With Browning at his side giving advice, Bud handcrafted a new bat from a long slab of wood. Browning got three hits using the bat the next day. Browning told his teammates, which began a surge of professional ballplayers visiting the Hillerich shop.Although J.F. Hillerich had little interest in making bats, Bud persisted, eventually registering the name Louisville Slugger with the U.S. patent office in 1894. In the early 1900s, the company was one of the first to use a sports endorsement as a marketing strategy, paying Hall of Famer Honus Wagner to use his name on a bat. By 1923, Louisville Slugger was the selling more bats than any other bat maker in the country, with such famed clients as Babe Ruth, Ty Cobb, and Lou Gehrig. In the ensuing years, the company has sold more than 100 million bats, and 60 percent of all Major League players currently use Louisville Sluggers. The company now sells far more than bats, including fielding and batting gloves, helmets, catchers' gear, equipment bags, training aids, and accessories.", "text": "Louisville Slugger MLB180 Natural Wood Baseball Bat Don't make the mistake of thinking all wood bats are the same. They may look similar, but the quality of the wood is very different from one wood bat company to another. Louisville Slugger, however, sets itself apart from other bat makers with more than 120 years of bat-making experience, outstanding turning models, and access to the best-quality wood on the market. The MLB180 bat, for instance, is made of professional-grade ash, pound for pound the strongest timber available. Ash offers a flexibility that isn't found in other timbers, including maple, resulting in a barrel that tends to flex rather than break. This gives you a larger, more forgiving sweet spot in terms of breakage. In addition, ash is lighter than maple, so players can choose from among several large-barrel sizes. It all adds up to a terrific choice for casual players who love the look and feel of a genuine wood bat, or professionals who value a high-quality bat performance.The MLB180 also boasts a randomly selected turning model, with such possibilities as C271, P72, C243, R161, T141, and K55.Bat SpecificationsWood: AshFinish: NaturalLength: 32, 33, or 34 inchesTurning model: C271, P72, C243, R161, T141, or K55Note:The biggest factors that influence the life of a wood bat are the quality of wood and where the ball hits your bat. Until you gain experience hitting with wood bats, however, don't be surprised if you break a lot of bats. Unlike with aluminum bats, when you hit a ball along the handle or at the end of a wood bat, you may break the bat rather than get a hit. It takes a lot of practice, but with work, you will find that you break fewer bats and become a much better hitter.About Louisville SluggerIn many ways, the rich 120-year history of the Louisville Slugger baseball bat began in the talented hands of 17-year-old John A. \"Bud\" Hillerich. Bud's father, J.F. Hillerich, owned a woodworking shop in Louisville in the 1880s when Bud began working for him. Legend has it that Bud slipped away from work one afternoon in 1884 to watch the Louisville Eclipse, the town's major league team. After Pete Browning--the Eclipse's star who was mired in a hitting slump--broke his bat, Bud invited him to his father's shop to make a new one. With Browning at his side giving advice, Bud handcrafted a new bat from a long slab of wood. Browning got three hits using the bat the next day. Browning told his teammates, which began a surge of professional ballplayers visiting the Hillerich shop.Although J.F. Hillerich had little interest in making bats, Bud persisted, eventually registering the name Louisville Slugger with the U.S. patent office in 1894. In the early 1900s, the company was one of the first to use a sports endorsement as a marketing strategy, paying Hall of Famer Honus Wagner to use his name on a bat. By 1923, Louisville Slugger was the selling more bats than any other bat maker in the country, with such famed clients as Babe Ruth, Ty Cobb, and Lou Gehrig. In the ensuing years, the company has sold more than 100 million bats, and 60 percent of all Major League players currently use Louisville Sluggers. The company now sells far more than bats, including fielding and batting gloves, helmets, catchers' gear, equipment bags, training aids, and accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21E4Rb5W16L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3LEDW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Bats", "Standard Bats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3LT8M", "title": "Aqua Sphere Stationary Swimmer", "description": "Aqua Sphere Stationary Swimmer turns any backyard pool into a lap pool. Comfortable Neoprene straps with Velcro closures connect to your feet and ankles to allow you perpetually swim in a fixed position. Super flexible elastic bands allow for full kicking motion.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Stationary Swimmer Aqua Sphere Stationary Swimmer turns any backyard pool into a lap pool. Comfortable Neoprene straps with Velcro closures connect to your feet and ankles to allow you perpetually swim in a fixed position. Super flexible elastic bands allow for full kicking motion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xfd9MxpBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3LT8M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 17.85}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3LTE6", "title": "Aqua Sphere Vista Swim Mask Clear Lens Goggles", "description": "The Aqua Sphere Swim Masks feature: Wraparound, 180-degree visibility Quick-FitTM one-touch adjustments Comfortable, leak resistant Silicone skirt 100% UVA -amp-amp; UVB protection Durable Polycarbonate lenses with anti-fog and scratch resistant coating", "text": "Aqua Sphere Vista Swim Mask Clear Lens Goggles The Aqua Sphere Swim Masks feature: Wraparound, 180-degree visibility Quick-FitTM one-touch adjustments Comfortable, leak resistant Silicone skirt 100% UVA -amp-amp; UVB protection Durable Polycarbonate lenses with anti-fog and scratch resistant coating", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WxzIo3yDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3LTE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 27.25}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3LTH8", "title": "Aqua Sphere SEAL XPT LADY Clear lens /Clear/ Aqua", "description": "These Aqua Sphere goggles offer great visibility with outstanding comfort for hours of swimming. The flexible, one-piece frame is watertight and the adjustable silicone strap provides comfort and durability.", "text": "Aqua Sphere SEAL XPT LADY Clear lens /Clear/ Aqua These Aqua Sphere goggles offer great visibility with outstanding comfort for hours of swimming. The flexible, one-piece frame is watertight and the adjustable silicone strap provides comfort and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dx78xy-RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3LTH8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B001Q3LTNM", "title": "Aqua Sphere Kaiman Lady Swim Goggle", "description": "The Kaiman Lady with clear lenses are designed to provide the greatest visibility while swimming indoors or in low light situations.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Kaiman Lady Swim Goggle The Kaiman Lady with clear lenses are designed to provide the greatest visibility while swimming indoors or in low light situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XUJ4%2BvIHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q3LTNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 19.06}}
{"item_id": "B001Q4FG3A", "title": "Black Diamond Trail Back Hiking Poles", "description": "No frills, gets you out and back at a great price. Traditionalround shape, rubber grip with webbing strap. Double Flicklocklow profile trekking baskets and a long flex tip. Sold inpairs and comes with a ski basket.1 lb. 4 oz., collaspsed: 26\", usable: 27-55\"", "text": "Black Diamond Trail Back Hiking Poles No frills, gets you out and back at a great price. Traditionalround shape, rubber grip with webbing strap. Double Flicklocklow profile trekking baskets and a long flex tip. Sold inpairs and comes with a ski basket.1 lb. 4 oz., collaspsed: 26\", usable: 27-55\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Mjqj-MsYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q4FG3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 79.0}}
{"item_id": "B001Q4SLM8", "title": "Kolpin 21515 Rhino X-Large Grip - Double", "description": "Don’t let rough terrain wreck havoc on your valuable gear - Rhino Grips heavy-duty design will keep your firearm or other gear securely in place and cushion it from any jolts or shocks . The unmatched design provides superior gripping power and cushioning support that reduces side to side movement. Strong, flexible static grips and rubber straps securely hold tools and gear of various configurations. the only gear grips that feature a 360-degree rotating and multi-angle design adjustable without tools, making installation a snap regardless of where and how you desire to mount them—you’ll love that! Installation to ATV racks, rear truck windows and even UTV cabs (not roll bars) is easy thanks to the universal-fit design and included mounting hardware. Compatible with Kolpin's Gear Lock & Load and Utility Gear Rail Systems. For secure, convenient transport of your gun, bow, or other gear – choose only the best – Kolpin Rhino Grips", "text": "Kolpin 21515 Rhino X-Large Grip - Double Don’t let rough terrain wreck havoc on your valuable gear - Rhino Grips heavy-duty design will keep your firearm or other gear securely in place and cushion it from any jolts or shocks . The unmatched design provides superior gripping power and cushioning support that reduces side to side movement. Strong, flexible static grips and rubber straps securely hold tools and gear of various configurations. the only gear grips that feature a 360-degree rotating and multi-angle design adjustable without tools, making installation a snap regardless of where and how you desire to mount them—you’ll love that! Installation to ATV racks, rear truck windows and even UTV cabs (not roll bars) is easy thanks to the universal-fit design and included mounting hardware. Compatible with Kolpin's Gear Lock & Load and Utility Gear Rail Systems. For secure, convenient transport of your gun, bow, or other gear – choose only the best – Kolpin Rhino Grips", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gSZJ-kuWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q4SLM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kolpin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Racquet Grips"]], "price": 49.24}}
{"item_id": "B001Q72ARC", "title": "Cold Steel Hand & A Half Training Sword with Polypropylene Handle with Blunt", "description": "Authentic Kashi wood Bokkens are still used today, but are becoming quite costly. They also have the disadvantages, being made of wood, that they may rot, crack split or splinter. Cold Steel’s solution to these dilemmas was to design a synthetic substitute, low in price and impervious to the elements.Our Bokken and our new Wakazashi Bokken are made of the heaviest grade polypropylene available and closely duplicate a real Katana and Wakazashi in length, size, weight and feel. While they’re not quite as rigid as wood, they have the advantages of being virtually unbreakable and remarkably stiff and cut resistant.", "text": "Cold Steel Hand & A Half Training Sword with Polypropylene Handle with Blunt Authentic Kashi wood Bokkens are still used today, but are becoming quite costly. They also have the disadvantages, being made of wood, that they may rot, crack split or splinter. Cold Steel’s solution to these dilemmas was to design a synthetic substitute, low in price and impervious to the elements.Our Bokken and our new Wakazashi Bokken are made of the heaviest grade polypropylene available and closely duplicate a real Katana and Wakazashi in length, size, weight and feel. While they’re not quite as rigid as wood, they have the advantages of being virtually unbreakable and remarkably stiff and cut resistant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FV5MB5DWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q72ARC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 27.19}}
{"item_id": "B001Q7JKYI", "title": "Mountain Hardwear Men's Wicked Lite Double Short Sleeve T", "description": "", "text": "Mountain Hardwear Men's Wicked Lite Double Short Sleeve T", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DNVdfRMjL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q7JKYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Hardwear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Shorts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Big & Tall"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8D55C", "title": "MTM 100 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .17, .222, 223, 6x47, .222 Mag", "description": "Between cleaning kits, shooting gear and a good supply of ammo, space can be rather limited in a shooting box. We understand this because as a family of shooters, we share your dilemma. This is why MTM created the Case-Gard 100 round ammo box, a compact way to hold large amounts of ammo. Great for varmint hunters and competitive shooters, the RS-100 features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, and is covered by MTM's 25 year guarantee. For: 17 Fireball, 17 / 221 / 222 / 223 Rem., 204 Ruger, 218 Bee, 22 Hornet, 222 Rem. Mag., 223 Rem. HP, 25-20 Win., 300 Sherwood, 300 Wisper, 32 Ideal, 32 / 401 Win. S.L., 351 WSL, 38-55 Win., 6x47, 6mm TCU, 6mm-223 Rem.", "text": "MTM 100 Round Flip-Top Rifle Ammo Box .17, .222, 223, 6x47, .222 Mag Between cleaning kits, shooting gear and a good supply of ammo, space can be rather limited in a shooting box. We understand this because as a family of shooters, we share your dilemma. This is why MTM created the Case-Gard 100 round ammo box, a compact way to hold large amounts of ammo. Great for varmint hunters and competitive shooters, the RS-100 features a scuff-resistant textured surface, snap-lock latch, stacking feet, mechanical hinge and load labels, and is covered by MTM's 25 year guarantee. For: 17 Fireball, 17 / 221 / 222 / 223 Rem., 204 Ruger, 218 Bee, 22 Hornet, 222 Rem. Mag., 223 Rem. HP, 25-20 Win., 300 Sherwood, 300 Wisper, 32 Ideal, 32 / 401 Win. S.L., 351 WSL, 38-55 Win., 6x47, 6mm TCU, 6mm-223 Rem.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iyGYU286L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8D55C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 7.23}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8D5OI", "title": "Allen Company Automatic Peep Sight", "description": "Large hole peep designed for hunters. Features the proper angle to fit today''s short bows. Complete with latex tubing and cable anchor.", "text": "Allen Company Automatic Peep Sight Large hole peep designed for hunters. Features the proper angle to fit today''s short bows. Complete with latex tubing and cable anchor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S5Il29hqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8D5OI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 7.74}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8GEWS", "title": "Vortex® StrikeFire Red Dot Rifle Scope(Suitable for AR-15)", "description": "When the situation demands fast shooting... And a big scope with a narrow field of view won't cut it, the StikeFire red dot riflescope lets you shoot with both eyes open! With unlimited field of view and eye relief nothing gets you on target faster than this tough, shockproof and waterproof compact little red dot scope. The rugged StrikeFire red dot is a perfect match with the popular flat-top AR-15 rifles and is also compatible with night vision optics. The Strikefire has state-of-the-art circuitry, a typical battery life of 2000 hours, and automatically shuts down after two hours", "text": "Vortex® StrikeFire Red Dot Rifle Scope(Suitable for AR-15) When the situation demands fast shooting... And a big scope with a narrow field of view won't cut it, the StikeFire red dot riflescope lets you shoot with both eyes open! With unlimited field of view and eye relief nothing gets you on target faster than this tough, shockproof and waterproof compact little red dot scope. The rugged StrikeFire red dot is a perfect match with the popular flat-top AR-15 rifles and is also compatible with night vision optics. The Strikefire has state-of-the-art circuitry, a typical battery life of 2000 hours, and automatically shuts down after two hours", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4wqT1HqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8GEWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 124.0}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8H6DY", "title": "Otis Deluxe Law Enforcement Cleaning System", "description": "Designed for Law Enforcement pistols and sub guns 9MM through .45 caliber, .223 caliber/5.56MM, .308 caliber/7.62MM rifles and 12 gauge shotguns", "text": "Otis Deluxe Law Enforcement Cleaning System Designed for Law Enforcement pistols and sub guns 9MM through .45 caliber, .223 caliber/5.56MM, .308 caliber/7.62MM rifles and 12 gauge shotguns", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yYUoGgkiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8H6DY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 54.79}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8IKOS", "title": "Wheeler 204-061 Scope Alignment and Lapping Kit", "description": "The Wheeler Scope Ring Alignment and Lapping Kit should become the standard practice whenever a scope is installed on a quality firearm. Alignment bars provide for perfect alignment of both rings and will also diagnose any misalignment problem, vertical or horizontal, giving you the opportunity to fix the problem before damaging the scope or experiencing frustration at the range. Lapping scope rings increases the surface area of contact between the inside of the rings and the scope tube. This creates better holding force, keeping the scope much more secure.", "text": "Wheeler 204-061 Scope Alignment and Lapping Kit The Wheeler Scope Ring Alignment and Lapping Kit should become the standard practice whenever a scope is installed on a quality firearm. Alignment bars provide for perfect alignment of both rings and will also diagnose any misalignment problem, vertical or horizontal, giving you the opportunity to fix the problem before damaging the scope or experiencing frustration at the range. Lapping scope rings increases the surface area of contact between the inside of the rings and the scope tube. This creates better holding force, keeping the scope much more secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WnaH98r5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8IKOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler Fine Gunsmith Equipment", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.32}}
{"item_id": "B001Q8ILP6", "title": "Allen Company Single Box Heavy Canvas Shotgun Shell Carrier", "description": "2142 Features: -Convenient sturdy metal belt clip.-External compartment for two spare shotgun shells. Dimensions: -Dimensions: 5.25'' H x 4'' W x 2.75'' D.", "text": "Allen Company Single Box Heavy Canvas Shotgun Shell Carrier 2142 Features: -Convenient sturdy metal belt clip.-External compartment for two spare shotgun shells. Dimensions: -Dimensions: 5.25'' H x 4'' W x 2.75'' D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SET5qmxgL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q8ILP6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001Q96D14", "title": "Fits Glock 26,27,28,29,30,36,39", "description": "Pro-Tech's Ankle Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Has Elastic and Velcro closure. Adjustable nylon velcro strap to secure your weapon. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining.Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Fits the Glock 26,27,28,29,30,36,39 \"Our Customers say this is the best ankle holster on the market!\" WHAT A FIELDTESTER HAD TO SAY This Pro-Tech ankle holster is one of the best all around ankle holster we've ever tested. The WANK holster exhibit quality throughout. I think, it also stacks up against the biggest competitors on the market.", "text": "Fits Glock 26,27,28,29,30,36,39 Pro-Tech's Ankle Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Has Elastic and Velcro closure. Adjustable nylon velcro strap to secure your weapon. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining.Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Fits the Glock 26,27,28,29,30,36,39 \"Our Customers say this is the best ankle holster on the market!\" WHAT A FIELDTESTER HAD TO SAY This Pro-Tech ankle holster is one of the best all around ankle holster we've ever tested. The WANK holster exhibit quality throughout. I think, it also stacks up against the biggest competitors on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EvYnVCZLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q96D14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B001Q98TNY", "title": "SPORTSSTUFF 53-2030 4K Booster Ball for Towables", "description": "The SportsStuff 4K Booster Ball System replaces traditional towlines with an inflatable \"Booster Ball\" buoy with sturdy towline rope at both ends. Suitable for use on any boat, but especially good for boats with low transom tow points, the Booster Ball system provides a way to keep the tow rope elevated out of the water during the ride and increases the visibility of the tow line at all times. The increased height of the towline reduces line drag, absorbs shock, and even enhances the boat's fuel economy. The Booster Ball system is designed to improve your towable's performance with quicker starts, reduced rope spray, decreased chance that the towable will dive during the ride, and less wear and tear on your actual towable.Built for long term durability, the Booster Ball inflatable buoy features bright water-sports graphics with a heavy-gauge PVC bladder and a tough nylon cover with double stitching and reinforced stress points. The system is equipped with a patented speed safety valve for quick inflation and deflation and has a self bailing drain vent to prevent the uptake of water. The system measures 60 feet overall, including the Booster Ball, and the tow rope offers 4100-pound break strength for a worry-free performance. Designed for use with one to four-person towables, the 4K Booster Ball System is built for years of fun on the water.Features and Specifications:Heavy-gauge PVC bladder840 denier full nylon cover with zipperTough two-inch webbingPatented speed safety valveSelf bailing drain ventDouble stitching and reinforced stress pointsLength: 60 feet (including booster ball)4K tow rope4100-pound break strengthDesigned for one to four person towablesWhat's in the Box?4K Booster Ball and Custom Tow Rope", "text": "SPORTSSTUFF 53-2030 4K Booster Ball for Towables The SportsStuff 4K Booster Ball System replaces traditional towlines with an inflatable \"Booster Ball\" buoy with sturdy towline rope at both ends. Suitable for use on any boat, but especially good for boats with low transom tow points, the Booster Ball system provides a way to keep the tow rope elevated out of the water during the ride and increases the visibility of the tow line at all times. The increased height of the towline reduces line drag, absorbs shock, and even enhances the boat's fuel economy. The Booster Ball system is designed to improve your towable's performance with quicker starts, reduced rope spray, decreased chance that the towable will dive during the ride, and less wear and tear on your actual towable.Built for long term durability, the Booster Ball inflatable buoy features bright water-sports graphics with a heavy-gauge PVC bladder and a tough nylon cover with double stitching and reinforced stress points. The system is equipped with a patented speed safety valve for quick inflation and deflation and has a self bailing drain vent to prevent the uptake of water. The system measures 60 feet overall, including the Booster Ball, and the tow rope offers 4100-pound break strength for a worry-free performance. Designed for use with one to four-person towables, the 4K Booster Ball System is built for years of fun on the water.Features and Specifications:Heavy-gauge PVC bladder840 denier full nylon cover with zipperTough two-inch webbingPatented speed safety valveSelf bailing drain ventDouble stitching and reinforced stress pointsLength: 60 feet (including booster ball)4K tow rope4100-pound break strengthDesigned for one to four person towablesWhat's in the Box?4K Booster Ball and Custom Tow Rope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gdGRFa2nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q98TNY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SportsStuff", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Waterskiing & Towsports", "Towables"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001Q9JAYG", "title": "Hodgdon Annual Reloading Manual", "description": "The new 2014 Hodgdon Annual Manual (the 11th Annual Edition) has just been released. The manual now contains over 5000 loads, with updates for 21 rifle and pistol cartridges. You'll also find data from Hodgdon's popular, new CFE Pistol Powder - including additional load info for 17 more cartridges. Varmint hunters will be pleased to see the addition of complete data for the popular 17 Hornet. Along with comprehensive load data, the 2014 Hodgdon Annual Manual offers authoritative articles by top gun and outdoor industry writers working with the editors of Shooting Times magazine.", "text": "Hodgdon Annual Reloading Manual The new 2014 Hodgdon Annual Manual (the 11th Annual Edition) has just been released. The manual now contains over 5000 loads, with updates for 21 rifle and pistol cartridges. You'll also find data from Hodgdon's popular, new CFE Pistol Powder - including additional load info for 17 more cartridges. Varmint hunters will be pleased to see the addition of complete data for the popular 17 Hornet. Along with comprehensive load data, the 2014 Hodgdon Annual Manual offers authoritative articles by top gun and outdoor industry writers working with the editors of Shooting Times magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aiD2pqtmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001Q9JAYG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 17.99}}
