{"item_id": "B001QBZI90", "title": "Fold a Carrier - 5 Gal", "description": "Carry larger volumes of water in these cubes. Collapsible plastic containers conveniently carry or store water. On/off spigot locks closed to avoid messy spills. A strong plastic handle folds flat. Capacity - 5 Gal. 341095 , Fold a Carrier - 5 Gal , water storage , water bag , water cube , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping", "text": "Fold a Carrier - 5 Gal Carry larger volumes of water in these cubes. Collapsible plastic containers conveniently carry or store water. On/off spigot locks closed to avoid messy spills. A strong plastic handle folds flat. Capacity - 5 Gal. 341095 , Fold a Carrier - 5 Gal , water storage , water bag , water cube , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X%2Bp2HvjPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QBZI90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 13.27}}
