{"item_id": "B001QC55DI", "title": "Bushnell H20 8 x 42 Roof Prism Binocular", "description": "Never worry about dropping your optics off the side of the boat again--the Bushnell H20 Binoculars are O-ring sealed and nitrogen purged for fully submersible, waterproof viewing. With the addition of dry nitrogen purging, you will never have to worry about the optics fogging up due to changes in humidity. Rubber armoring with textured pads offers a secure grip even in slippery, wet situations and the large center focusing knob is easy to operate even with gloves on.The standard-sized 150842 H20 Binoculars offer 8x magnification with large, light gathering 42-millimeter objectives, and a field of view of 365 feet at 1,000 yards. Thanks to multi-coated optics and a roof prism system with premium quality BaK-4 prism glass, the binoculars provide great light transmission and image clarity at a budget friendly price. Built to last, the 150842 H20 Binoculars carry a limited lifetime warranty from Bushnell.Features and Specifications:Magnification: 8xObjective Lens: 42 millimetersField of View: 365 feet at 1000 yards / 123 meters at 1000 metersClose Focus: 12 feet / 3.6 metersExit Pupil: 5.25 millimetersEye Relief: 17 millimeters100 percent water and fog proofRoof prism systemBaK-4 prism glassMulti-coated LensesCenter focus systemTwist-up eyecupsSize Class: StandardWeight: 25 ounces / 708.5 gramsModel: 150842About Roof Prism Binoculars:The prism system of a binocular reduces the size needed to contain a long optical path and turns what would be an upside-down image right-side-up. In roof prism binoculars, the prisms overlap closely, allowing the objective lenses to line up directly with the eyepiece. The result is a slim, streamlined shape in which the lenses and prisms are in a straight line. Roof prism binoculars are less bulky and more rugged than an equivalent porro model.", "text": "Bushnell H20 8 x 42 Roof Prism Binocular Never worry about dropping your optics off the side of the boat again--the Bushnell H20 Binoculars are O-ring sealed and nitrogen purged for fully submersible, waterproof viewing. With the addition of dry nitrogen purging, you will never have to worry about the optics fogging up due to changes in humidity. Rubber armoring with textured pads offers a secure grip even in slippery, wet situations and the large center focusing knob is easy to operate even with gloves on.The standard-sized 150842 H20 Binoculars offer 8x magnification with large, light gathering 42-millimeter objectives, and a field of view of 365 feet at 1,000 yards. Thanks to multi-coated optics and a roof prism system with premium quality BaK-4 prism glass, the binoculars provide great light transmission and image clarity at a budget friendly price. Built to last, the 150842 H20 Binoculars carry a limited lifetime warranty from Bushnell.Features and Specifications:Magnification: 8xObjective Lens: 42 millimetersField of View: 365 feet at 1000 yards / 123 meters at 1000 metersClose Focus: 12 feet / 3.6 metersExit Pupil: 5.25 millimetersEye Relief: 17 millimeters100 percent water and fog proofRoof prism systemBaK-4 prism glassMulti-coated LensesCenter focus systemTwist-up eyecupsSize Class: StandardWeight: 25 ounces / 708.5 gramsModel: 150842About Roof Prism Binoculars:The prism system of a binocular reduces the size needed to contain a long optical path and turns what would be an upside-down image right-side-up. In roof prism binoculars, the prisms overlap closely, allowing the objective lenses to line up directly with the eyepiece. The result is a slim, streamlined shape in which the lenses and prisms are in a straight line. Roof prism binoculars are less bulky and more rugged than an equivalent porro model.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2Bk82M0nRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QC55DI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 42.49}}
{"item_id": "B001QC78GK", "title": "Reliance Products Hydroller 8 Gallon Wheeled Water Container", "description": "Hydroller 8 gallon (30 liter) rigid wheeled container is the largest water container available. Great for outdoor activities and for storage.", "text": "Reliance Products Hydroller 8 Gallon Wheeled Water Container Hydroller 8 gallon (30 liter) rigid wheeled container is the largest water container available. Great for outdoor activities and for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ew3X8xSFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QC78GK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 29.88}}
{"item_id": "B001QC78QK", "title": "Primus Micron Lantern", "description": "Micron Lantern - A brighter future, is a compact, lightweight and durable lantern that provides light and warmth when you need small dimensions, low weight and durability. Has a frosted glass cover that provides a powerful light. Brightness is infinitely adjustable, up to 360 lumens. The EasyTrigger ignition system allows for quick and easy lighting. The patented burner ensures that the lantern is virtually silent and uses little gas. A sturdy plastic case is included for storage.", "text": "Primus Micron Lantern Micron Lantern - A brighter future, is a compact, lightweight and durable lantern that provides light and warmth when you need small dimensions, low weight and durability. Has a frosted glass cover that provides a powerful light. Brightness is infinitely adjustable, up to 360 lumens. The EasyTrigger ignition system allows for quick and easy lighting. The patented burner ensures that the lantern is virtually silent and uses little gas. A sturdy plastic case is included for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AhKM95j-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QC78QK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 42.71}}
