{"item_id": "B001QD9XQ2", "title": "Lyman Reloading 30-06 Case Length/Headspace Gauge", "description": "To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "text": "Lyman Reloading 30-06 Case Length/Headspace Gauge To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B3IQiqq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QD9XQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B001QDLZ90", "title": "MTM SF100D-09 Deluxe Case", "description": "Ideal for duck, dove, and goose hunting, the MTM 100 deluxe box features a large handle and latch for easy opening with gloves. The SF100D deluxe shotshell box holds 100 shotshells in two removable trays designed to hold 12 or 20 gauge shotshells spaced for easy removal. The lid has two covered compartments for accessories and five shell holders for quick access to cripple loads. Hunting load recommended usage chart included. This box is lockable for security.Features:Deluxe shotshell case offers rugged, versatile storage for shotgunnersHolds 100 rounds of either 12 or 20 gauge shells in two traysOutside lid compartmentsWater-shedding lid designLarge comfortable handleEasy open latch5 cripple load holdersRugged constructionFull-length mechanical hingeLockableCamo", "text": "MTM SF100D-09 Deluxe Case Ideal for duck, dove, and goose hunting, the MTM 100 deluxe box features a large handle and latch for easy opening with gloves. The SF100D deluxe shotshell box holds 100 shotshells in two removable trays designed to hold 12 or 20 gauge shotshells spaced for easy removal. The lid has two covered compartments for accessories and five shell holders for quick access to cripple loads. Hunting load recommended usage chart included. This box is lockable for security.Features:Deluxe shotshell case offers rugged, versatile storage for shotgunnersHolds 100 rounds of either 12 or 20 gauge shells in two traysOutside lid compartmentsWater-shedding lid designLarge comfortable handleEasy open latch5 cripple load holdersRugged constructionFull-length mechanical hingeLockableCamo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BgIjhrgXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QDLZ90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 27.27}}
{"item_id": "B001QDNACU", "title": "MTM Forest Green Survivor Dry Box", "description": "Don't be caught without a MTM Survivor Dry box, they keep all your survival gear safe and dry. Water and weather resistant, they can be used to carry all types of personal and safety items such as medicines, first aid kits, flash lights, flares, ammo, wallets, snacks, rain gear, maps, etc. Features include built-in compass, signaling mirror, water resistant, tongue and groove O-ring design, triple latched for best possible seal, lockable, rugged construction, and it will float. Makes an ideal geocaching container due to its color, O-ring seal, and rugged construction.", "text": "MTM Forest Green Survivor Dry Box Don't be caught without a MTM Survivor Dry box, they keep all your survival gear safe and dry. Water and weather resistant, they can be used to carry all types of personal and safety items such as medicines, first aid kits, flash lights, flares, ammo, wallets, snacks, rain gear, maps, etc. Features include built-in compass, signaling mirror, water resistant, tongue and groove O-ring design, triple latched for best possible seal, lockable, rugged construction, and it will float. Makes an ideal geocaching container due to its color, O-ring seal, and rugged construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qAxyYX0nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QDNACU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001QDR29W", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Medium Range Bag (Black, Medium)", "description": "This Medium Range Bag is perfect size to head to the range. Carries up to 3 hand guns and multiple magazines. Its superior padding will give you confidence that all of your gear will be protected. Case is constructed with water resistant 600 Denier. Removable gun rug helps with range organization. Hand Carry handles and Shoulder strap for easy carry.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Medium Range Bag (Black, Medium) This Medium Range Bag is perfect size to head to the range. Carries up to 3 hand guns and multiple magazines. Its superior padding will give you confidence that all of your gear will be protected. Case is constructed with water resistant 600 Denier. Removable gun rug helps with range organization. Hand Carry handles and Shoulder strap for easy carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E0kRmiWFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QDR29W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 38.94}}
{"item_id": "B001QDR2DS", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Mini-Range Bag", "description": "This Mini-Range Bag is perfect for carrying your hand gun to the range. It's padded interior pockets fit up to 2 pistols and 8 magazines. It's large front pocket perfect for your hearing and eye protection or personal items. Mini-Range has duel zippers allowing this case & front pocket to be lockable. It's wrap around handles make this case a secure carry with added shoulder strap for a convenient carry. Case is made of Black 600 Water Resistant Denier fabric with heavy duty self-repariing zippers. The front pocket is large for easy add on embroidery.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Mini-Range Bag This Mini-Range Bag is perfect for carrying your hand gun to the range. It's padded interior pockets fit up to 2 pistols and 8 magazines. It's large front pocket perfect for your hearing and eye protection or personal items. Mini-Range has duel zippers allowing this case & front pocket to be lockable. It's wrap around handles make this case a secure carry with added shoulder strap for a convenient carry. Case is made of Black 600 Water Resistant Denier fabric with heavy duty self-repariing zippers. The front pocket is large for easy add on embroidery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517qVZuo43L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QDR2DS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 31.13}}
{"item_id": "B001QDR2SI", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Assault Case", "description": "This Assault Case fits your AR15/M16. less lethal, SOCOM with exterior pockets to hold double or single magazines", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Assault Case This Assault Case fits your AR15/M16. less lethal, SOCOM with exterior pockets to hold double or single magazines", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316y-lll97L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QDR2SI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001QFE06I", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2060 Elishewitz F.T.W.S Fixed Blade", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Elishewitz F.T.W.S. Allen has carefully considered every facet of the full-tang 6.30-inch blade. SK 5 carbon steel was chosen for its strength and hardness. The tip is a modified spear point with full width near the tip for penetrating strength. The top of the blade features a four-inch-long flat grind with a chisel ground edge for heavy hacking and chopping tasks. The blade is black powder coated to resist corrosion and minimize reflectivity.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2060 Elishewitz F.T.W.S Fixed Blade Columbia River Knife and Tool's Elishewitz F.T.W.S. Allen has carefully considered every facet of the full-tang 6.30-inch blade. SK 5 carbon steel was chosen for its strength and hardness. The tip is a modified spear point with full width near the tip for penetrating strength. The top of the blade features a four-inch-long flat grind with a chisel ground edge for heavy hacking and chopping tasks. The blade is black powder coated to resist corrosion and minimize reflectivity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cMTtxMgsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFE06I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 84.16}}
{"item_id": "B001QFE0EK", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2380 Ritter RSK Mk5", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Ritter RSK Mk5 it is compact and light enough to fit in almost any small personal survival kit or stash-away location, yet robust enough that it's a knife you can bet your life on. Weighing in at less than an ounce, the skeletonized fixed blade sports a 1.75-inch wide-chord drop-point blade with a high flat grind. The high-carbon steel blade has Doug's preferred stonewashed finish for improved corrosion resistance.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2380 Ritter RSK Mk5 Columbia River Knife and Tool's Ritter RSK Mk5 it is compact and light enough to fit in almost any small personal survival kit or stash-away location, yet robust enough that it's a knife you can bet your life on. Weighing in at less than an ounce, the skeletonized fixed blade sports a 1.75-inch wide-chord drop-point blade with a high flat grind. The high-carbon steel blade has Doug's preferred stonewashed finish for improved corrosion resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P4m60lY%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFE0EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 18.62}}
{"item_id": "B001QFH2D6", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 1160 McGinnis Tuition Razor Edge Knife", "description": "McGinnis Tuition made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 8Cr14MoV stainless steel razor edge knife. This compact and powerful work knife is equipped with a 2.88-Inch blade, has a high hollow grind that gives fast cutting, accurate trimming and excellent tip strength. One hand opening is fast with a friction grooved flipper which duals as a blade guard. The handle is hand shaped black and green layered polished Micarta scales.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 1160 McGinnis Tuition Razor Edge Knife McGinnis Tuition made by Columbia River Knife and Tool is a 8Cr14MoV stainless steel razor edge knife. This compact and powerful work knife is equipped with a 2.88-Inch blade, has a high hollow grind that gives fast cutting, accurate trimming and excellent tip strength. One hand opening is fast with a friction grooved flipper which duals as a blade guard. The handle is hand shaped black and green layered polished Micarta scales.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xyJZtWrNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFH2D6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QFH2DQ", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool's 1165 McGinnis Summa Razor-Sharp Cutting Edge Knife, Black/Blue", "description": "McGinnis Summa made by Columbia River Knife & Tool is a sleek full sized folder with a 3.75-Inch drop point blade. The 8Cr14MoV stainless steel blade has a very high hollow grind and a satin finish. Equipped with a Inter Frame build with stainless steel liners, hand shaped black and blue layered polished Micarta scales and a rigid Zytel spacer.", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool's 1165 McGinnis Summa Razor-Sharp Cutting Edge Knife, Black/Blue McGinnis Summa made by Columbia River Knife & Tool is a sleek full sized folder with a 3.75-Inch drop point blade. The 8Cr14MoV stainless steel blade has a very high hollow grind and a satin finish. Equipped with a Inter Frame build with stainless steel liners, hand shaped black and blue layered polished Micarta scales and a rigid Zytel spacer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318bDKSsjXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFH2DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QFJ76G", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2385 Folts Minimalist Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Folts Minimalist is a very small and lightweight knife which gives surprising comfort and control, thanks to the unusual geometry of the full-tang 2.0-inch Wharncliffe blade, aided by three finger choils, hand-contoured green/black Micarta scales, and a braided fob. The Minimalist comes with a custom-fitted Zytel sheath and neck paracord for inverted carry as a neck knife. Because the knife and sheath weigh only 1.6 ounces together, it is a personal carry you will barely notice.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2385 Folts Minimalist Razor Edge Knife Columbia River Knife and Tool's Folts Minimalist is a very small and lightweight knife which gives surprising comfort and control, thanks to the unusual geometry of the full-tang 2.0-inch Wharncliffe blade, aided by three finger choils, hand-contoured green/black Micarta scales, and a braided fob. The Minimalist comes with a custom-fitted Zytel sheath and neck paracord for inverted carry as a neck knife. Because the knife and sheath weigh only 1.6 ounces together, it is a personal carry you will barely notice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BST3ZRqqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFJ76G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.85}}
{"item_id": "B001QFJ7QQ", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2910 Hisshou Knife", "description": "2910 Hisshou by Columbia River Knife and Tool is close-quarters knife (sword) designed for use by military and special forces professionals. The 13-Inch full-tang dual grind Tanto blade is made of YK-30 high-carbon steel with a high satin finish and has a Razor-Sharp cutting edge. The classic cord-wrapped handle was designed in the Japanese tradition and give excellent grip in all conditions. A custom Kydex sheath with a patented quick-release belt-mounting system is included.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2910 Hisshou Knife 2910 Hisshou by Columbia River Knife and Tool is close-quarters knife (sword) designed for use by military and special forces professionals. The 13-Inch full-tang dual grind Tanto blade is made of YK-30 high-carbon steel with a high satin finish and has a Razor-Sharp cutting edge. The classic cord-wrapped handle was designed in the Japanese tradition and give excellent grip in all conditions. A custom Kydex sheath with a patented quick-release belt-mounting system is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-DFUfsgKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QFJ7QQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 188.95}}
