{"item_id": "B001QG1D1W", "title": "CORE wheels Ab and Upper Body Fitness Workout Equipment", "description": "With exercises suitable for all fitness levels, COREwheels bring strength and flexibility training to a new level. Used by the US Navy Seals, Pilates studios, and fitness professionals, they provide a whole body toning system in a lightweight package. An amazing core workout, improve flexibility with unique dynamic stretches, and dramatically sculpt the upper body. By controlling the ergonomic rolling handles, you engage your core with each movement, providing measurable results in weeks. The wheels allow for more push up variations and hit the abs from more angles than other similar products. With over 10 simple exercises, COREwheels are a versatile, highly effective and inexpensive way to get in shape. Package includes a pair of COREwheels, DVD with guided workouts and an exercise wall poster.", "text": "CORE wheels Ab and Upper Body Fitness Workout Equipment With exercises suitable for all fitness levels, COREwheels bring strength and flexibility training to a new level. Used by the US Navy Seals, Pilates studios, and fitness professionals, they provide a whole body toning system in a lightweight package. An amazing core workout, improve flexibility with unique dynamic stretches, and dramatically sculpt the upper body. By controlling the ergonomic rolling handles, you engage your core with each movement, providing measurable results in weeks. The wheels allow for more push up variations and hit the abs from more angles than other similar products. With over 10 simple exercises, COREwheels are a versatile, highly effective and inexpensive way to get in shape. Package includes a pair of COREwheels, DVD with guided workouts and an exercise wall poster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-fc6MBhHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QG1D1W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QGERB0", "title": "Black Diamond Trail Ergo Cork Trekking Pole", "description": "A versatile pole with an ergonomically-angled grip with natural cork. A four-season trekking pole for use in all conditions and terrains.", "text": "Black Diamond Trail Ergo Cork Trekking Pole A versatile pole with an ergonomically-angled grip with natural cork. A four-season trekking pole for use in all conditions and terrains.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AzDnzZA6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QGERB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001QGFVXI", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Red Cross ID Patch", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Red Cross Patch is smooth embroidery, not printed, with a hook backing with loop panel included. It can be sewn to clothing or gear. The patch is offered in black, olive drab, coyote tan, or foliage green; it measures 2.5\" square.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Red Cross ID Patch The BLACKHAWK! Red Cross Patch is smooth embroidery, not printed, with a hook backing with loop panel included. It can be sewn to clothing or gear. The patch is offered in black, olive drab, coyote tan, or foliage green; it measures 2.5\" square.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51v3TkQjesL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QGFVXI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001QGFZ2K", "title": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Hydration System Carrier with Speed Clips", "description": "Designed to hold the BLACKHAWK! 100 oz reservoir (672556; not inc.) the S.T.R.I.K.E. Hydration System Carrier works best with insulated hydration carrier (65TX00; not inc.). The carrier measures 6 ½”W x 17 1/8”H x 2 ¾”D and includes (4) #7 with Speed Clips. External S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing allows additional pouch attachment. The Speed Clip system is the fastest, lightest, and strongest method for mounting tactical gear to S.T.R.I.K.E. platforms. Constructed of a durable yet flexible carbon-fiber polymer blend, BLACKHAWK!'s innovative Speed Clips are the most versatile S.T.R.I.K.E. hardware available. BLACKHAWK! designed these clips in order to eliminate tedious weaving of bulky straps associated with more traditional means of modular attachment. Quickly mount and disconnect gear and rearrange your kit without hesitation.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! S.T.R.I.K.E. Hydration System Carrier with Speed Clips Designed to hold the BLACKHAWK! 100 oz reservoir (672556; not inc.) the S.T.R.I.K.E. Hydration System Carrier works best with insulated hydration carrier (65TX00; not inc.). The carrier measures 6 ½”W x 17 1/8”H x 2 ¾”D and includes (4) #7 with Speed Clips. External S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing allows additional pouch attachment. The Speed Clip system is the fastest, lightest, and strongest method for mounting tactical gear to S.T.R.I.K.E. platforms. Constructed of a durable yet flexible carbon-fiber polymer blend, BLACKHAWK!'s innovative Speed Clips are the most versatile S.T.R.I.K.E. hardware available. BLACKHAWK! designed these clips in order to eliminate tedious weaving of bulky straps associated with more traditional means of modular attachment. Quickly mount and disconnect gear and rearrange your kit without hesitation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51plqRZG4AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QGFZ2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 39.49}}
