{"item_id": "B001QGTZIU", "title": "UDAP 18CP Super Magnum Bear Spray", "description": "Introducing the largest bear deterrent registered by the EPA! Largest Canister Available at 13.4oz or 380g! 7 Seconds of spray time! Furthest Spray Distance at 35 feet! FREE 32 Page UDAP Bear Satey Tips booklet included! Hottest Bear Spray Formula Available at 2.0% CRC! Highest Amount of Spray Volume! Unlike other brands that spray a slower forming narrow fog of bear pepper spray, UDAP Pepper Power Bear Spray deploys a high volume powerful blast of highly concentrated pepper spray in a dense fog - covering a broader area in a much shorter period of time. Cannot take on comercial airlines", "text": "UDAP 18CP Super Magnum Bear Spray Introducing the largest bear deterrent registered by the EPA! Largest Canister Available at 13.4oz or 380g! 7 Seconds of spray time! Furthest Spray Distance at 35 feet! FREE 32 Page UDAP Bear Satey Tips booklet included! Hottest Bear Spray Formula Available at 2.0% CRC! Highest Amount of Spray Volume! Unlike other brands that spray a slower forming narrow fog of bear pepper spray, UDAP Pepper Power Bear Spray deploys a high volume powerful blast of highly concentrated pepper spray in a dense fog - covering a broader area in a much shorter period of time. Cannot take on comercial airlines", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qD6ZFWwoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QGTZIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Udap", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QGYH7Y", "title": "UDAP 12HP Bear Spray", "description": "Premuim Holster with Strap and Snap Included.Same Formula for over 10 years. High volume spray when you need it most.Cannot take on commercial airlines.", "text": "UDAP 12HP Bear Spray Premuim Holster with Strap and Snap Included.Same Formula for over 10 years. High volume spray when you need it most.Cannot take on commercial airlines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419VcH1PeAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QGYH7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Udap", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QI5X52", "title": "Bicycle Hamburger Bell", "description": "What great gift idea! Don't miss out on this unique bicycle bell. Hamburger bell complete with sesame seeds, tomato, cheese and lettuce.", "text": "Bicycle Hamburger Bell What great gift idea! Don't miss out on this unique bicycle bell. Hamburger bell complete with sesame seeds, tomato, cheese and lettuce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11FTS%2BptswL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QI5X52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dimension", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Bells"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001QJNUYC", "title": "Handmade White Zetsurin Samurai Katana Sword Sharp", "description": "This is Handmade Zetsurin Samurai Katana Sword Sharp. The blade of the sword has been constructed from high carbon steel with a Maru lamination. This is the fully mounted Shira-Saya featuring a mini tanto fitted into the side of the scabbard. The sword comes full tang.", "text": "Handmade White Zetsurin Samurai Katana Sword Sharp This is Handmade Zetsurin Samurai Katana Sword Sharp. The blade of the sword has been constructed from high carbon steel with a Maru lamination. This is the fully mounted Shira-Saya featuring a mini tanto fitted into the side of the scabbard. The sword comes full tang.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ce8VhiV7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QJNUYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "247Swords", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 52.95}}
{"item_id": "B001QKXJEC", "title": "EOTech XPS3-0 HOLOgraphic Weapon Site", "description": "EOTech's shortest sight yet, the XPS3-0 holographic weapons sight (HWS) is smaller and lighter than other HWS sights yet still provides high-quality visibility in any light condition. The XPS3-0 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The XPS3-0 runs on a single 123 battery and requires at most 2-3/4 inches of rail space. This leaves more room for rear iron sights, magnifiers, or NV mounts. EOTech also eliminated the battery cap and latch and replaced them with a simple tethered O-ring cap to better seal out moisture. Other features include a battery life of up to 600 hours at brightness level 12, fogproof internal optics, water-resistance to 33 feet, and night vision compatibility.The XPS3-0 projects a holographic red reticle onto the target plane.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 33 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver (MIL-STD-1913) railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 2 MOA after remountingNight vision compatibility: Yes, with 10 additional settingsDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision brightness range: 1280:1 with NV switch engagedPower source: Single 123 lithium batteryBattery life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12Brightness settings: 30 with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)Auto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 3.5 by 2.4 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 8 ounces", "text": "EOTech XPS3-0 HOLOgraphic Weapon Site EOTech's shortest sight yet, the XPS3-0 holographic weapons sight (HWS) is smaller and lighter than other HWS sights yet still provides high-quality visibility in any light condition. The XPS3-0 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The XPS3-0 runs on a single 123 battery and requires at most 2-3/4 inches of rail space. This leaves more room for rear iron sights, magnifiers, or NV mounts. EOTech also eliminated the battery cap and latch and replaced them with a simple tethered O-ring cap to better seal out moisture. Other features include a battery life of up to 600 hours at brightness level 12, fogproof internal optics, water-resistance to 33 feet, and night vision compatibility.The XPS3-0 projects a holographic red reticle onto the target plane.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 33 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver (MIL-STD-1913) railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 2 MOA after remountingNight vision compatibility: Yes, with 10 additional settingsDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision brightness range: 1280:1 with NV switch engagedPower source: Single 123 lithium batteryBattery life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12Brightness settings: 30 with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)Auto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 3.5 by 2.4 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 8 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DyylBBzxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QKXJEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 585.0}}
{"item_id": "B001QKXJJC", "title": "EOTech XPS2-0 HOLOgraphic Weapon Sight", "description": "Smaller and lighter than other holographic weapon sights, the EOTech XPS2-0 is an ideal compact option for your weapon platform. The XPS2-0 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The XPS2-0 runs on a single 123 battery, making it small enough to leave plenty of rail space for rear iron sights, magnifiers, and other tools (the shortened base requires 2.75 inches of rail space maximum). EOTech also eliminated the battery cap and latch and replaced them with a simple O-ring tethered cap, helping the sight achieve better sealing. Note that the XPS2 is not night vision compatible.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 10 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 2 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: NonePower source: 123 lithium battery (1)Battery life: 600 continuous hours at nominal settingBrightness settings: 20 with scrolling featureAuto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 3.5 by 2.4 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 8 ounces", "text": "EOTech XPS2-0 HOLOgraphic Weapon Sight Smaller and lighter than other holographic weapon sights, the EOTech XPS2-0 is an ideal compact option for your weapon platform. The XPS2-0 sports a revolutionary sighting system based on advanced holographic technology. The design works by using laser light to illuminate a holographic pattern embedded in the heads-up display window. When the shooter looks through the window, he or she will see a virtual red image of a reticle pattern projected onto the target plane. Overall, the holographic sight improves target acquisition, boosts accuracy, and increases control over the shooting environment.The XPS2-0 runs on a single 123 battery, making it small enough to leave plenty of rail space for rear iron sights, magnifiers, and other tools (the shortened base requires 2.75 inches of rail space maximum). EOTech also eliminated the battery cap and latch and replaced them with a simple O-ring tethered cap, helping the sight achieve better sealing. Note that the XPS2 is not night vision compatible.SpecificationsOptics: Transmission holography, parallax-freeMagnification: 1xEye relief: UnlimitedWaterproof: Submersible to 10 feetSealing: Fogproof internal opticsAdjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2 inch @ 100 yards)Adjustment range: +/- 40 MOA travelMount: 1-inch Picatinny or Weaver railReturn to zero: Repeatable to 2 MOA after remountingDisplay window optical surfaces: Anti-glare coatingWindow dimensions: 1.2 by 0.85 inchesFront window material: 1/8-inch solid glassRear window material: Shatter-resistant laminate (3/16 inches thick)Field of view: 30 yards @ 100 yards at 4 inches eye reliefBrightness adjustment range: 146,000:1 (brightest to lowest)Night vision compatibility: NonePower source: 123 lithium battery (1)Battery life: 600 continuous hours at nominal settingBrightness settings: 20 with scrolling featureAuto battery check indicator: Flashing reticle upon startupAuto shutdown: At 8 hours; programmable to 4 hoursDimensions: 3.5 by 2.4 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 8 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41De2WOsx3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QKXJJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 485.89}}
{"item_id": "B001QL141Q", "title": "Eotech With 3x Magnifier/Flip-To-Side Mount Md: G23FTS", "description": "Improve your accuracy at medium range distances while increasing target recognition with the EOTech G23.FTS 3x magnifier. Designed to transition a fielded holographic weapons sight into a lethal medium range optic, the magnifier puts the competition to shame. The magnifier is outfitted with a rugged streamlined optic with superior light transmission, giving you clear images in almost any conditions. The magnifier's unique holographic technology, meanwhile, allows the center dot to remain 1 moa in size while magnifying the angular size of the target. As a result, it's easy to maintain and even improve accuracy without moving closer. Plus, the zero is maintained in the holographic weapons sight and not in the magnifier. That means you never lose zero whether you're targeting through the magnifier or only through the sight.This is the second generation of EOTech magnifiers, with a half-inch of additional eye relief compared to the first generation, along with fewer moving parts to keep the mount more stable. The company also positioned the windage and elevation adjustments inside the optic rather than in the mount, and added a locking, quick-detach lever for easy attachment and removal of both the optic and the mount. The magnifier--which aligns perfectly with standard height sights--comes with a 7mm riser to accommodate raised sights and works with all existing holographic weapons sights.", "text": "Eotech With 3x Magnifier/Flip-To-Side Mount Md: G23FTS Improve your accuracy at medium range distances while increasing target recognition with the EOTech G23.FTS 3x magnifier. Designed to transition a fielded holographic weapons sight into a lethal medium range optic, the magnifier puts the competition to shame. The magnifier is outfitted with a rugged streamlined optic with superior light transmission, giving you clear images in almost any conditions. The magnifier's unique holographic technology, meanwhile, allows the center dot to remain 1 moa in size while magnifying the angular size of the target. As a result, it's easy to maintain and even improve accuracy without moving closer. Plus, the zero is maintained in the holographic weapons sight and not in the magnifier. That means you never lose zero whether you're targeting through the magnifier or only through the sight.This is the second generation of EOTech magnifiers, with a half-inch of additional eye relief compared to the first generation, along with fewer moving parts to keep the mount more stable. The company also positioned the windage and elevation adjustments inside the optic rather than in the mount, and added a locking, quick-detach lever for easy attachment and removal of both the optic and the mount. The magnifier--which aligns perfectly with standard height sights--comes with a 7mm riser to accommodate raised sights and works with all existing holographic weapons sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BcvcKBFGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QL141Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001QL2C0S", "title": "Country Brook Design® 1 Inch Black Polypro Webbing, 100 Yards", "description": "Description:Polypropylene webbing is a soft, flexible fabric of woven fibers. Made from thermoplastic resins, this versitile material is perfect for outdoor use due to it's UV resistance and waterproof fibers. Polypropylene webbing won't stretch like Nylon webbing can, and is more resistant to acid, alkaline, oil and grease.Some rolls may contain factory splices.Specifications:Width: 1 InchApproximately .048 Inch or 1.20mm thick600 lbs Tensile StrengthWater Proof / Mildew ResistantMelting Point of 330 Degrees FahrenheitNotes On Use:It is best to use 1 Inch hardware webbing, strapping, and/or material. D-rings, buckle, triglides etc. are sized by the webbing or straps they are meant to be used with.Tensile strength is the average breaking point under good conditions at the factory. We recommend that you use no more that 75% of the tensile strength of any webbing.Country Brook Design cannot be held responsible for misuse of our product. It is the responsibility of the purchaser to determine the suitability of the product for their use.Lightweight polypropylene webbing is a multi-purpose product and is commonly used in making:Bags, luggage, backpacks & tote bagsSporting Goods, tents, sleeping bags & life jacketsUnderwater diving gear & personal flotation devicesFashion belts, apparel, shoesChildren's ProductsHorse halters, collars, leashesGeneral Purpose Straps", "text": "Country Brook Design® 1 Inch Black Polypro Webbing, 100 Yards Description:Polypropylene webbing is a soft, flexible fabric of woven fibers. Made from thermoplastic resins, this versitile material is perfect for outdoor use due to it's UV resistance and waterproof fibers. Polypropylene webbing won't stretch like Nylon webbing can, and is more resistant to acid, alkaline, oil and grease.Some rolls may contain factory splices.Specifications:Width: 1 InchApproximately .048 Inch or 1.20mm thick600 lbs Tensile StrengthWater Proof / Mildew ResistantMelting Point of 330 Degrees FahrenheitNotes On Use:It is best to use 1 Inch hardware webbing, strapping, and/or material. D-rings, buckle, triglides etc. are sized by the webbing or straps they are meant to be used with.Tensile strength is the average breaking point under good conditions at the factory. We recommend that you use no more that 75% of the tensile strength of any webbing.Country Brook Design cannot be held responsible for misuse of our product. It is the responsibility of the purchaser to determine the suitability of the product for their use.Lightweight polypropylene webbing is a multi-purpose product and is commonly used in making:Bags, luggage, backpacks & tote bagsSporting Goods, tents, sleeping bags & life jacketsUnderwater diving gear & personal flotation devicesFashion belts, apparel, shoesChildren's ProductsHorse halters, collars, leashesGeneral Purpose Straps", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aSzswF0gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QL2C0S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Ropes, Cords & Webbing", "Webbing"]], "price": 18.95}}
