{"item_id": "B001QQ9QJ8", "title": "Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra - Light Rifle Stock Howa / Wthby", "description": "Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra - Light Rifle Stock. Revolutionary and modern stock takes your rifle to the next level of performance, function and accuracy! For pain free accuracy, the Axiom U/L stock combines the SpecOps recoil-reducing stock along with a lightweight fiberglass reinforced forestock. The Axiom V/S Rifle Stock is extremely comfortable in the way it fits, feels, and adjusts to any size shooter. Set the adjustable length-of-pull to the ideal setting in seconds. The Axiom U/L Rifle Stock will draw out a rifle's full accuracy potential without the punishing recoil found with most larger calibers. A closer look: Durable reinforced polymer construction with aluminum pillar bedding; Adjustable length-of-pull from 11 1/4 to 15 1/4\"; Two recoil suppression devices for maximum recoil reduction; Completely free-floated barrel; Stock weight 2 lbs. 9 ozs.; WARNING: These items cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. Pick yours and State Short or Long Action. Order Today! Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra-Light Rifle Stock, Howa / Wthby", "text": "Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra - Light Rifle Stock Howa / Wthby Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra - Light Rifle Stock. Revolutionary and modern stock takes your rifle to the next level of performance, function and accuracy! For pain free accuracy, the Axiom U/L stock combines the SpecOps recoil-reducing stock along with a lightweight fiberglass reinforced forestock. The Axiom V/S Rifle Stock is extremely comfortable in the way it fits, feels, and adjusts to any size shooter. Set the adjustable length-of-pull to the ideal setting in seconds. The Axiom U/L Rifle Stock will draw out a rifle's full accuracy potential without the punishing recoil found with most larger calibers. A closer look: Durable reinforced polymer construction with aluminum pillar bedding; Adjustable length-of-pull from 11 1/4 to 15 1/4\"; Two recoil suppression devices for maximum recoil reduction; Completely free-floated barrel; Stock weight 2 lbs. 9 ozs.; WARNING: These items cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. Pick yours and State Short or Long Action. Order Today! Blackhawk Knoxx Axiom Ultra-Light Rifle Stock, Howa / Wthby", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319eAshNhsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QQ9QJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 176.14}}
{"item_id": "B001QSZVZE", "title": "Trijicon RMR Sight (LED) 6.5 MOA Red Dot, RM02", "description": "Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG. The RM02 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments. The Trijicon RMR is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.", "text": "Trijicon RMR Sight (LED) 6.5 MOA Red Dot, RM02 Developed to improve precision and accuracy with any style or caliber of weapon, the Trijicon RMR (Ruggedized Miniature Reflex) is designed to be as durable as the legendary ACOG. The RM02 is an LED sight powered by a standard CR2032 battery. Housed in rugged forged aluminum, the RMR is extremely tough yet lightweight. New easy-to-use adjusters with audible clicks allow for quick windage and elevation adjustments. The Trijicon RMR is tougher than any alternative and suitable for military, law enforcement and hunting applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21mQ085MH6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QSZVZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruggedized Miniature Reflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 545.94}}
