{"item_id": "B001QUKH6U", "title": "Crosman Benjamin Marauder Air Rifle", "description": "Crosman Benjamin Marauder. .177, .22 or .25 - caliber... offering all the features needed for field, target shooting and small game hunting. Like a Crosman Custom choked barrel and internal shroud for unsurpassed accuracy and ultra quiet operation. And a new 2-stage adjustable, match grade trigger pack with a metal trigger that makes every shot smooth and steady. You'll also find the raised aluminum breech with a heavy duty pull bolt lets you load the gun and mount a scope a snap with no hassle at all. Operating at fill pressures between 2,000 and 3,000 psi, the Marauder is also a Multi-Shot rifle, thanks to the 10-shot auto indexing clip. Can be filled with the Benjamin hand pump or a high pressure tank. Velocity up to: 1,100 F.P.S. (.177); 1,000 F.P.S. (.22); 900 F.P.S. (.25). A powerful, exciting shooter you can count on! State Caliber. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; IL; MI; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Crosman Benjamin Marauder Air Rifle", "text": "Crosman Benjamin Marauder Air Rifle Crosman Benjamin Marauder. .177, .22 or .25 - caliber... offering all the features needed for field, target shooting and small game hunting. Like a Crosman Custom choked barrel and internal shroud for unsurpassed accuracy and ultra quiet operation. And a new 2-stage adjustable, match grade trigger pack with a metal trigger that makes every shot smooth and steady. You'll also find the raised aluminum breech with a heavy duty pull bolt lets you load the gun and mount a scope a snap with no hassle at all. Operating at fill pressures between 2,000 and 3,000 psi, the Marauder is also a Multi-Shot rifle, thanks to the 10-shot auto indexing clip. Can be filled with the Benjamin hand pump or a high pressure tank. Velocity up to: 1,100 F.P.S. (.177); 1,000 F.P.S. (.22); 900 F.P.S. (.25). A powerful, exciting shooter you can count on! State Caliber. Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; IL; MI; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Crosman Benjamin Marauder Air Rifle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21oC49jFVGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QUKH6U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benjamin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 614.33}}
{"item_id": "B001QUXH5S", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army One Hand Sentinel Pocket Knife", "description": "Grip it, flip it, lock it--it's that easy with the One-Hand Sentinel lock-blade pocketknife from Victorinox. The serrated version of the One-Hand Sentinel combines functionality with accessibility, boasting a contoured, no-slip handle and a one-hand-opening blade for quick blade access when you need it most. The One-Hand Sentinel also includes a few additional mini-tools, including tweezers, a toothpick and a key ring.The One-Hand Sentinel includes a locking serrated blade.As with all Victorinox items, the One-Hand Sentinel is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The One-Hand Sentinel measures 4.38 inches, weighs 2.9 ounces, and carries a lifetime warranty.One-Hand Sentinel ToolsSerrated one-hand locking bladeTweezersToothpickKey ringAbout VictorinoxIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army One Hand Sentinel Pocket Knife Grip it, flip it, lock it--it's that easy with the One-Hand Sentinel lock-blade pocketknife from Victorinox. The serrated version of the One-Hand Sentinel combines functionality with accessibility, boasting a contoured, no-slip handle and a one-hand-opening blade for quick blade access when you need it most. The One-Hand Sentinel also includes a few additional mini-tools, including tweezers, a toothpick and a key ring.The One-Hand Sentinel includes a locking serrated blade.As with all Victorinox items, the One-Hand Sentinel is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The One-Hand Sentinel measures 4.38 inches, weighs 2.9 ounces, and carries a lifetime warranty.One-Hand Sentinel ToolsSerrated one-hand locking bladeTweezersToothpickKey ringAbout VictorinoxIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TTxsYgBXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QUXH5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.96}}
{"item_id": "B001QVIUQ8", "title": "Gerber Curve Keychain Tool", "description": "Curve Mini Tool - BlueKey FeaturesFits on keychainsIntegrated bottle openerProduct The Gerber Curve Mini Tool is the beer-opening mini tool. In addition to having five tool components the Gerber Curve hooks to your keychain and has a built-in bottle opener. This Gerber 30-000071 model is blue and has a fine edge knife blade, flat head screwdriver, phillips screwdriver, awl, and a file. The Gerber Curve hooks to your keychain with a carabiner.Technical Specs:Overall Length: 3.5 inchesClosed Length: 2.25 inchesClosed Width: 0.75 inchesOpen Width: 0.75inchesBlade Length: 1.25 inchesWeight: 0.8 ozStainless steel construction", "text": "Gerber Curve Keychain Tool Curve Mini Tool - BlueKey FeaturesFits on keychainsIntegrated bottle openerProduct The Gerber Curve Mini Tool is the beer-opening mini tool. In addition to having five tool components the Gerber Curve hooks to your keychain and has a built-in bottle opener. This Gerber 30-000071 model is blue and has a fine edge knife blade, flat head screwdriver, phillips screwdriver, awl, and a file. The Gerber Curve hooks to your keychain with a carabiner.Technical Specs:Overall Length: 3.5 inchesClosed Length: 2.25 inchesClosed Width: 0.75 inchesOpen Width: 0.75inchesBlade Length: 1.25 inchesWeight: 0.8 ozStainless steel construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N3YY--sWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QVIUQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.9}}
{"item_id": "B001QVIV1C", "title": "Gerber 06 F.A.S.T Serrated Knife", "description": "Tactical and tough. That's what you get with the 06 F.A.S.T., a quick opening knife with G-10 handles for extra grip when wet. The Tanto shaped blade is designed for thrusting. Specifications: - Blade Length: 3.80\" - Closed Length: 4.8\" - Overall Length: 8.60\" - Weight: 5.70 oz. - Handle: G-10.", "text": "Gerber 06 F.A.S.T Serrated Knife Tactical and tough. That's what you get with the 06 F.A.S.T., a quick opening knife with G-10 handles for extra grip when wet. The Tanto shaped blade is designed for thrusting. Specifications: - Blade Length: 3.80\" - Closed Length: 4.8\" - Overall Length: 8.60\" - Weight: 5.70 oz. - Handle: G-10.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NnS0NOmSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QVIV1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 49.73}}
{"item_id": "B001QVQ9A2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Universal Swift Sling", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Universal Swift Sling is constructed of high-quality 1.25” nylon webbing and three-point sling design for fixed or collapsible stocks. A quick-cam buckle provides rapid one-hand adjustment and a heavy-duty tri-glide buckle, metal oval ring, and 300 lb. test side-release buckle offers quick sling detachment, firearm attachment, and weapon removal. The sling features quick shoulder-to-shoulder transition, a fully adjustable, ambidextrous design and robust bar tacking and box stitching for maximum strength. Available in Black, Multi Cam, and Coyote Tan.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Universal Swift Sling The BLACKHAWK! Universal Swift Sling is constructed of high-quality 1.25” nylon webbing and three-point sling design for fixed or collapsible stocks. A quick-cam buckle provides rapid one-hand adjustment and a heavy-duty tri-glide buckle, metal oval ring, and 300 lb. test side-release buckle offers quick sling detachment, firearm attachment, and weapon removal. The sling features quick shoulder-to-shoulder transition, a fully adjustable, ambidextrous design and robust bar tacking and box stitching for maximum strength. Available in Black, Multi Cam, and Coyote Tan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312rUfZofoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QVQ9A2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 31.67}}
{"item_id": "B001QVR4K6", "title": "Otis Elite Cleaning System with Optics", "description": "The most innovative gun cleaning system in the Otis line, the Otis Elite is suitable for an armorer but used by thousands. The Elite is designed to maintain all rifles from .17 to .50 caliber, pistols from .17 to .50 caliber, shotguns from .410 to 12/10 gauge, and all inline muzzleloaders. There's no better way to keep your weapons collection performing like new. The Otis Elite starts with the world-famous 750 Tactical Cleaning System, which includes an entire line of bronze bore and chamber cleaning brushes. Also included in the cleaning system are six Memory-Flex cleaning rods, an all-purpose nylon receiver brush, a T-handle bar, three slotted tips, obstruction removers, small and large Patch Savers, a bore reflector/flag safety, small caliber and all-caliber 100-percent cotton patches, and two 5-ounce tubes of Otis O85 Ultra Bore solvent.", "text": "Otis Elite Cleaning System with Optics The most innovative gun cleaning system in the Otis line, the Otis Elite is suitable for an armorer but used by thousands. The Elite is designed to maintain all rifles from .17 to .50 caliber, pistols from .17 to .50 caliber, shotguns from .410 to 12/10 gauge, and all inline muzzleloaders. There's no better way to keep your weapons collection performing like new. The Otis Elite starts with the world-famous 750 Tactical Cleaning System, which includes an entire line of bronze bore and chamber cleaning brushes. Also included in the cleaning system are six Memory-Flex cleaning rods, an all-purpose nylon receiver brush, a T-handle bar, three slotted tips, obstruction removers, small and large Patch Savers, a bore reflector/flag safety, small caliber and all-caliber 100-percent cotton patches, and two 5-ounce tubes of Otis O85 Ultra Bore solvent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519lIQtwlQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QVR4K6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 101.86}}
{"item_id": "B001QVUGA6", "title": "HKS 29-M Revolver Speedloader for S&W 29, 629/Dan Wesson/Ruger Redhawk/Super Redhawk/Colt Anaconda/Taurus .44, 444 Raging Bull", "description": "\"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 29, 629/Dan Wesson/Ruger Redhawk/Super Redhawk/Colt Anaconda/Taurus .44, 444 Raging Bull", "text": "HKS 29-M Revolver Speedloader for S&W 29, 629/Dan Wesson/Ruger Redhawk/Super Redhawk/Colt Anaconda/Taurus .44, 444 Raging Bull \"M\" Series Speedloader loads cartridges into revolver instantly. The principle is simple, strong metal points hold cartridges securely in the loader until you release them into the revolver with a turn of the speed loader knob. Fits S&W; 29, 629/Dan Wesson/Ruger Redhawk/Super Redhawk/Colt Anaconda/Taurus .44, 444 Raging Bull", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ftmux89VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QVUGA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 9.79}}
