{"item_id": "B001QXBNS8", "title": "Schwinn Bicycle Floor Pump (16-Inch)", "description": "Nozzle can inflate schrader valves and includes presta valve adapter and the long swiveling hose makes inflating tires easy with max 120 psi.", "text": "Schwinn Bicycle Floor Pump (16-Inch) Nozzle can inflate schrader valves and includes presta valve adapter and the long swiveling hose makes inflating tires easy with max 120 psi.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CyQSDshxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QXBNS8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 10.42}}
{"item_id": "B001QXBORI", "title": "Schwinn Artemis Adult Women Micro Bicycle Helmet (Colors and Graphics May Vary)", "description": "Make sure to protect yourself with the Schwinn Artemis Adult Women Micro Bicycle Helmet. The fashionable, flower-printed helmet (colors and patterns may vary) was made specifically with women in mind. Even on a long ride, the 21 airflow vents keep your head cool while the heat-sealed pads and handy bug net provide additional comfort and protection. The adjustable dial-fit system allows you to change the length of the strap easily for a custom fit, and a reflective sticker on the back helps keep you visible at night. The Schwinn Artemis helmet will keep you safe and comfortable while riding in style.", "text": "Schwinn Artemis Adult Women Micro Bicycle Helmet (Colors and Graphics May Vary) Make sure to protect yourself with the Schwinn Artemis Adult Women Micro Bicycle Helmet. The fashionable, flower-printed helmet (colors and patterns may vary) was made specifically with women in mind. Even on a long ride, the 21 airflow vents keep your head cool while the heat-sealed pads and handy bug net provide additional comfort and protection. The adjustable dial-fit system allows you to change the length of the strap easily for a custom fit, and a reflective sticker on the back helps keep you visible at night. The Schwinn Artemis helmet will keep you safe and comfortable while riding in style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51N2AxMv1UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QXBORI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B001QXF9LK", "title": "Mongoose Cable Combo Bicycle Lock (5-Feet)", "description": "Steel coil cable for use in moderate-risk areas 5-foot long coil cable is vinyl coated and compact Comes with 1 combination and 1 key lock", "text": "Mongoose Cable Combo Bicycle Lock (5-Feet) Steel coil cable for use in moderate-risk areas 5-foot long coil cable is vinyl coated and compact Comes with 1 combination and 1 key lock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DZDDewUOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001QXF9LK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mongoose", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 9.98}}
