{"item_id": "B001R1CQQW", "title": "Nite Ize Figure 9 Tent Line Kit", "description": "The days of attempt after attempt to get sufficient tension on your tent guy lines are gone with the Nite Ize Figure 9 Tent Line Kit. Four lightweight plastic rope tighteners utilize a simple loop, pull, and clip technique to secure your tent for the worst conditions. The eight foot guy lines have reflective accents to assist in pitching your tent at night and increase visibility of the lines.", "text": "Nite Ize Figure 9 Tent Line Kit The days of attempt after attempt to get sufficient tension on your tent guy lines are gone with the Nite Ize Figure 9 Tent Line Kit. Four lightweight plastic rope tighteners utilize a simple loop, pull, and clip technique to secure your tent for the worst conditions. The eight foot guy lines have reflective accents to assist in pitching your tent at night and increase visibility of the lines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51L-KNEX24L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R1CQQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 10.25}}
