{"item_id": "B001R1RT4G", "title": "PROMATE Snorkeling Scuba Dive Panoramic PURGE Mask Dry Snorkel Fins Gear Set", "description": "Fins:High quality and stylish looking.Lightweight for east of travel.Open heel design.Soft rubber foot pocket for comfortable fit with either socks or barefoot.Easy adjust strap with release buttons.Men's USA Size (Shoes):S/M(5-8.5 ), ML/XL(9-13)Women's USA Size (Shoes):S/M(6-9.5), ML/XL(10-14)3-window Side-view Edgeless Purge Mask:Patented single lens with Edgeless technology on sides, which increases field of vision dramatically.Patented purge design.Patented channeled skirt design directs bubbles away from view.Crystal, liquid silicone injected skirt and strap.Double skirt edge comfort seal.Tempered glasses for Safety.Made in Thailand.Dry Snorkel w/ Signal Whistle:A unique, 100% absolute dry design -- Patented upper valve keeps water from entering the snorkel. Allows air to easily enter snorkel for clean and unobstructed breathing. Specially designed cover guards against water splashing into the snorkel. When the dry snorkel is submerged in water, the patented hinged seal reacts to seal the snorkel, preventing water from entering. As you surface, the hinged seal swings open allowing air to enter.Built-in whistle housing.Quick slip-in snorkel keeper.Pre-curved flexible silicone corrugated low section.Easy purge valve keeps stocking water out.Pre-curved silicone mouthpiece, prevents jaw fatigue.Silicone purge valve for easy draining.", "text": "PROMATE Snorkeling Scuba Dive Panoramic PURGE Mask Dry Snorkel Fins Gear Set Fins:High quality and stylish looking.Lightweight for east of travel.Open heel design.Soft rubber foot pocket for comfortable fit with either socks or barefoot.Easy adjust strap with release buttons.Men's USA Size (Shoes):S/M(5-8.5 ), ML/XL(9-13)Women's USA Size (Shoes):S/M(6-9.5), ML/XL(10-14)3-window Side-view Edgeless Purge Mask:Patented single lens with Edgeless technology on sides, which increases field of vision dramatically.Patented purge design.Patented channeled skirt design directs bubbles away from view.Crystal, liquid silicone injected skirt and strap.Double skirt edge comfort seal.Tempered glasses for Safety.Made in Thailand.Dry Snorkel w/ Signal Whistle:A unique, 100% absolute dry design -- Patented upper valve keeps water from entering the snorkel. Allows air to easily enter snorkel for clean and unobstructed breathing. Specially designed cover guards against water splashing into the snorkel. When the dry snorkel is submerged in water, the patented hinged seal reacts to seal the snorkel, preventing water from entering. As you surface, the hinged seal swings open allowing air to enter.Built-in whistle housing.Quick slip-in snorkel keeper.Pre-curved flexible silicone corrugated low section.Easy purge valve keeps stocking water out.Pre-curved silicone mouthpiece, prevents jaw fatigue.Silicone purge valve for easy draining.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XUSQN0UEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R1RT4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001R1XOW2", "title": "Weight Stack Adapter Plates 2.5 Lb & 5Lb", "description": "We will ship out one of each 2.5 lbs, 5Lbs plates. or Ship 3 pieces of 2.5 Lbs special design patent pending easy stack add on weights.", "text": "Weight Stack Adapter Plates 2.5 Lb & 5Lb We will ship out one of each 2.5 lbs, 5Lbs plates. or Ship 3 pieces of 2.5 Lbs special design patent pending easy stack add on weights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LAmM6IH%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R1XOW2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001R20IAW", "title": "Vittoria Open Corsa Evo CX Tire", "description": "The Vittoria Open Corsa Evo CX clincher tire got a facelift thanks to its new 320 TPI Corespun K casing made from alternating Polycotton and Kevlar threads. More TPI means a more supple ride, no matter what PSI you prefer. Vittoria's Compressed Wrap makes use of the highest grade of Corespun casing cord and rubber compounds, resulting in a casing that allows the Polycotton and Kevlar threads to act independently, which reduces surface deflection and rolling resistance while maximizing puncture resistance. The classic herringbone tread pattern on the Vittoria Open Corsa CX gives it an ideal combination of traction and rolling resistance, which is likely the reason that this our our best selling Vittoria tire. It's built with Twin Tread Technology where harder tread is placed in the center of the tire where the wear occurs, and a softer compound is used on the shoulder for better grip. A thin, lightweight PRB puncture resistant belt is placed immediately beneath the tread to provide maximum puncture protection while maintaining low rolling resistance. And the tread is built with a silica enhanced Kevlar Carbon 3D SiO2 compound to give their tires longer wear life and supreme grip. 700x23. Available in the following tread/sidewall combinations: Black/Black, Red/Black, and White/Black. 210g.Product FeaturesType:Material: [tread and sidewalls] rubber compound, KEVLARAA, silica; [puncture protection] Aramid PRB 2.0; [casing] TPI polyester-cotton (320D), aramidSize: 700 x 20 C, 700 x 23 C, 700 x 25 CBead: KEVLARAAFoldable: yesWeight: (20c) 195 g, (23c) 210 g, (25c) 220 gRecommended Use: road racingManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Vittoria Open Corsa Evo CX Tire The Vittoria Open Corsa Evo CX clincher tire got a facelift thanks to its new 320 TPI Corespun K casing made from alternating Polycotton and Kevlar threads. More TPI means a more supple ride, no matter what PSI you prefer. Vittoria's Compressed Wrap makes use of the highest grade of Corespun casing cord and rubber compounds, resulting in a casing that allows the Polycotton and Kevlar threads to act independently, which reduces surface deflection and rolling resistance while maximizing puncture resistance. The classic herringbone tread pattern on the Vittoria Open Corsa CX gives it an ideal combination of traction and rolling resistance, which is likely the reason that this our our best selling Vittoria tire. It's built with Twin Tread Technology where harder tread is placed in the center of the tire where the wear occurs, and a softer compound is used on the shoulder for better grip. A thin, lightweight PRB puncture resistant belt is placed immediately beneath the tread to provide maximum puncture protection while maintaining low rolling resistance. And the tread is built with a silica enhanced Kevlar Carbon 3D SiO2 compound to give their tires longer wear life and supreme grip. 700x23. Available in the following tread/sidewall combinations: Black/Black, Red/Black, and White/Black. 210g.Product FeaturesType:Material: [tread and sidewalls] rubber compound, KEVLARAA, silica; [puncture protection] Aramid PRB 2.0; [casing] TPI polyester-cotton (320D), aramidSize: 700 x 20 C, 700 x 23 C, 700 x 25 CBead: KEVLARAAFoldable: yesWeight: (20c) 195 g, (23c) 210 g, (25c) 220 gRecommended Use: road racingManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iIaAGcq4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R20IAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001R4HFII", "title": "Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain", "description": "Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain Features: Blade: 7 1/2\" Thick: 5/16\" Overall: 12 1/2\" Handle: 5\" Long. Kraton Sheath: Secure-Ex Sheath Steel: SK-5 High Carbon Black Epoxy Powder Coat Finish", "text": "Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain Cold Steel 39LRST Recon Scout, Black Kraton Handle, Black Blade, Plain Features: Blade: 7 1/2\" Thick: 5/16\" Overall: 12 1/2\" Handle: 5\" Long. Kraton Sheath: Secure-Ex Sheath Steel: SK-5 High Carbon Black Epoxy Powder Coat Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31evHuHtCAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R4HFII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 118.44}}
