{"item_id": "B001R5RBE0", "title": "Allen 545 3CT BLK String Loop", "description": "3 Count, Black, Archery String Loop, 225 LB Test, Wear Resistant Nylon Cord Forms A Loop For Attaching The Release To The String, Eliminates String Wear & String Torque.", "text": "Allen 545 3CT BLK String Loop 3 Count, Black, Archery String Loop, 225 LB Test, Wear Resistant Nylon Cord Forms A Loop For Attaching The Release To The String, Eliminates String Wear & String Torque.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r%2BHJI%2BWkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R5RBE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 5.35}}
{"item_id": "B001R5RFAA", "title": "Primos Stretch-Fit Gloves with Sure-Grip and Extended Cuff, Mossy Oak New Break-Up", "description": "Our light-weight stretch-fit gloves are cool and breathable with a 5-Inch extended cuff. They are great for spring turkey season or early bow season. One size fits most.", "text": "Primos Stretch-Fit Gloves with Sure-Grip and Extended Cuff, Mossy Oak New Break-Up Our light-weight stretch-fit gloves are cool and breathable with a 5-Inch extended cuff. They are great for spring turkey season or early bow season. One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v3J7zBF5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R5RFAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowboarding", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 11.45}}
{"item_id": "B001R5ZZXY", "title": "Umarex RWS-Model LP8, .177 Pellet", "description": "RWS - Model LP8 .177 Pellet Pistol *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: Fully Rifled Barrel Automatic Safety Adjustable Trigger Rigid Quality Control Inspections Limited Lifetime Warranty Specifications: Caliber: .177 Feet Per Second: 700 Sights: Fiber Optic Total Length: 17.625\" Barrel Length: 9.125\" Weight in lbs: 3.35 Trigger Pull in lbs: 3.3 Cocking Effort in lbs: 24", "text": "Umarex RWS-Model LP8, .177 Pellet RWS - Model LP8 .177 Pellet Pistol *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: Fully Rifled Barrel Automatic Safety Adjustable Trigger Rigid Quality Control Inspections Limited Lifetime Warranty Specifications: Caliber: .177 Feet Per Second: 700 Sights: Fiber Optic Total Length: 17.625\" Barrel Length: 9.125\" Weight in lbs: 3.35 Trigger Pull in lbs: 3.3 Cocking Effort in lbs: 24", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q%2BYOraEQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R5ZZXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 233.66}}
{"item_id": "B001R644IU", "title": "Cold Steel Inferno 2.5 oz. (70 gram unit) Pepper Spray", "description": "Inferno is a new pepper canister weapon from Cold Steel that will turn the biggest, meanest, most violent criminal into helpless molten wax at your feet. Unlike other pepper sprays you may have heard about, Inferno deploys a highly targetable foam that contains 8% Oleoresin Capsicum and 2% black pepper. It dissolves into a liquid on contact (this liquefaction effect is tactically important, since other sprays remain \"foamy\" -like a pie in the face-and make it possible for your assailant to wipe the foam from his face and chuck it at you). One good shot in the face with Inferno will dilate the capillaries of the eyes causing temporary blindness. It will induce choking, coughing and nausea and most importantly trigger and immediate and massive sneeze reflex (due to the atomized black pepper particles) that will drag the super hot Habanero chili extract deep into the mucous membranes of the sinus cavities of the nose, throat and lungs causing them to swell up and prevent all but desperate life support breathing. In short Inferno will melt any attacker(s) into the ground and leave them totally incapacitated for a considerable period of time giving you ample opportunity to escape and summon the police.DescriptionInferno 2.5 oz. (70 Grams)", "text": "Cold Steel Inferno 2.5 oz. (70 gram unit) Pepper Spray Inferno is a new pepper canister weapon from Cold Steel that will turn the biggest, meanest, most violent criminal into helpless molten wax at your feet. Unlike other pepper sprays you may have heard about, Inferno deploys a highly targetable foam that contains 8% Oleoresin Capsicum and 2% black pepper. It dissolves into a liquid on contact (this liquefaction effect is tactically important, since other sprays remain \"foamy\" -like a pie in the face-and make it possible for your assailant to wipe the foam from his face and chuck it at you). One good shot in the face with Inferno will dilate the capillaries of the eyes causing temporary blindness. It will induce choking, coughing and nausea and most importantly trigger and immediate and massive sneeze reflex (due to the atomized black pepper particles) that will drag the super hot Habanero chili extract deep into the mucous membranes of the sinus cavities of the nose, throat and lungs causing them to swell up and prevent all but desperate life support breathing. In short Inferno will melt any attacker(s) into the ground and leave them totally incapacitated for a considerable period of time giving you ample opportunity to escape and summon the police.DescriptionInferno 2.5 oz. (70 Grams)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d3kXNs8HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R644IU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 14.89}}
