{"item_id": "B001R67OBE", "title": "Umarex H and K P30, Black (Pellets/BB's), .177", "description": "This replica air pistol is made after the Heckler & Koch P30. It can shoot either lead pellets or steel BBs and utilizes an 8-shot rotary magazine and drop-out BB magazine respectively. Made of metals and composites this replica is near true to weight and feel. The ambidextrous magazine release and integrated accessory rail are just as they are on the firearm. The sights are fully adjustable on this quality German made H&K; Pellet Pistol. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: - Shoots Pellets or BBs - Full metal slide - Drop out 15-round magazine also holds CO2 cylinder - 8-shot Rotary magazine - Ambidextrous magazine release - Adjustable sights - Integrated accessory rail - German quality - Plastic Gun Case Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - Action: Semi-Auto (repeater) - Power: CO2 - Barrel Length: 3.3\" - Brand: Heckler & Koch - Safety Type: Manual - Rear Sight Type: Open - Adjustable for Windage - Front Sight Type: Blade - Adjustable for Windage - Barrel Type: Rifled - Ammo Type: Pellet / BB - Velocity: FPS 360", "text": "Umarex H and K P30, Black (Pellets/BB's), .177 This replica air pistol is made after the Heckler & Koch P30. It can shoot either lead pellets or steel BBs and utilizes an 8-shot rotary magazine and drop-out BB magazine respectively. Made of metals and composites this replica is near true to weight and feel. The ambidextrous magazine release and integrated accessory rail are just as they are on the firearm. The sights are fully adjustable on this quality German made H&K; Pellet Pistol. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: - Shoots Pellets or BBs - Full metal slide - Drop out 15-round magazine also holds CO2 cylinder - 8-shot Rotary magazine - Ambidextrous magazine release - Adjustable sights - Integrated accessory rail - German quality - Plastic Gun Case Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - Action: Semi-Auto (repeater) - Power: CO2 - Barrel Length: 3.3\" - Brand: Heckler & Koch - Safety Type: Manual - Rear Sight Type: Open - Adjustable for Windage - Front Sight Type: Blade - Adjustable for Windage - Barrel Type: Rifled - Ammo Type: Pellet / BB - Velocity: FPS 360", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BLe-FSXBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R67OBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 176.35}}
{"item_id": "B001R6B06E", "title": "Shooting Chrony 7000099 F1 Master Chronograph, Green", "description": "The Shooting Chrony F1 Chronograph measures the speed of bullets and other projectiles. It features a large remote LCD display that shows numbered shot velocities, and the velocity stays on the display until you shoot again.", "text": "Shooting Chrony 7000099 F1 Master Chronograph, Green The Shooting Chrony F1 Chronograph measures the speed of bullets and other projectiles. It features a large remote LCD display that shows numbered shot velocities, and the velocity stays on the display until you shoot again.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mrI3kJcKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R6B06E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooting Chrony", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 109.31}}
{"item_id": "B001R6COIW", "title": "Primos Stretch-Fit Full-Hood Face Mask", "description": "Our stretch-fit masks are great for warm-weather hunts. They fit like a second layer of skin and will not get in the way of drawing or anchoring your bow. For masks that totally conceal your face and neck while keeping you comfortable during warm early-season hunts choose our stretch-fit masks.", "text": "Primos Stretch-Fit Full-Hood Face Mask Our stretch-fit masks are great for warm-weather hunts. They fit like a second layer of skin and will not get in the way of drawing or anchoring your bow. For masks that totally conceal your face and neck while keeping you comfortable during warm early-season hunts choose our stretch-fit masks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AM98PMm3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R6COIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 14.97}}
