{"item_id": "B001R7F4SI", "title": "Ninja Paintball Fill Whip Hose Extension - Black", "description": "Description Use a nitrogen tank with your remote / tactical vest? No more removing your tank to refill!Features:Made In The USA Ninja Fill Hose Extension Hose extension for remote tank pack Great for in-flight refueling using remote set-ups! Working pressure: 4500psi", "text": "Ninja Paintball Fill Whip Hose Extension - Black Description Use a nitrogen tank with your remote / tactical vest? No more removing your tank to refill!Features:Made In The USA Ninja Fill Hose Extension Hose extension for remote tank pack Great for in-flight refueling using remote set-ups! Working pressure: 4500psi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FG8nkePoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R7F4SI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001R9T6EE", "title": "Police Magnum OC-17 Pen Design Pepper Spray with UV Dye, Black, .5-Ounce", "description": "Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. This is a full pen canister of 17 percent pepper spray that blends perfectly in your purse or bag. They will never know you are so well protected. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "text": "Police Magnum OC-17 Pen Design Pepper Spray with UV Dye, Black, .5-Ounce Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. This is a full pen canister of 17 percent pepper spray that blends perfectly in your purse or bag. They will never know you are so well protected. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Kx4DP2r2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001R9T6EE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Police", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RAS48W", "title": "Cold Steel Mini Tac Kiridash Black G-10 Handle", "description": "Cold Steel's new generation of Mini Tac Neck Knives are astonishingly light at 3 ounces each. Because they're so lightweight, they can be comfortably worn practically 24 hours a day. With their sturdy bead chain lanyards and their rugged Secure Ex sheaths (specially designed to snugly retain the knife while allowing a speedy draw stroke), they can be worn outside clothing and perform as a handy utility or rescue knife.", "text": "Cold Steel Mini Tac Kiridash Black G-10 Handle Cold Steel's new generation of Mini Tac Neck Knives are astonishingly light at 3 ounces each. Because they're so lightweight, they can be comfortably worn practically 24 hours a day. With their sturdy bead chain lanyards and their rugged Secure Ex sheaths (specially designed to snugly retain the knife while allowing a speedy draw stroke), they can be worn outside clothing and perform as a handy utility or rescue knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TYosHkZDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RAS48W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.66}}
{"item_id": "B001RATY5O", "title": "Ladybug3 Salt with SpyderEdge Knife", "description": "The Spyderco Ladybug Salt is nearly as tiny as your car keys and easily carries in your pocket or purse. Its lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon handle is coated with Bi-Directional Texturing, and is bright yellow to make it easy to spot if dropped. The H-1 hollow ground blade is a SpyderEdge configuration and will never rust. PRODUCT FEATURES: Length overall: 4.375\" Blade length: 1.938\" Blade steel: H-1 Length closed: 2.438\" Cutting edge: 1.687\" Weight: .6oz Blade thickness: .078\" Handle material: Fibreglass Reinforced Nylon LYLS3 , Spyderco Ladybug3 Salt SpyderEdge , spyderco ladybug 3 , spyderco lady bug 3 , spyderco ladybug sypyder edge , spyderco spyder edge , spyderco salt spyder edge , pocket knife , pocket knifes , best pocket knife , personalized pocket knife , pocket knife reviews , pocket knife brands , pocket knife laws , pocket knife sharpener , pocket knife review , small pocket knife , quality pocket knife , folding pocket knife , pocket knife gift , utility pocket knife , mini pocket knife , best pocket knife in the world , spyderco , spyderco knives , spyderco knife , spyderco pocket knife , spyderco pocket knives", "text": "Ladybug3 Salt with SpyderEdge Knife The Spyderco Ladybug Salt is nearly as tiny as your car keys and easily carries in your pocket or purse. Its lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon handle is coated with Bi-Directional Texturing, and is bright yellow to make it easy to spot if dropped. The H-1 hollow ground blade is a SpyderEdge configuration and will never rust. PRODUCT FEATURES: Length overall: 4.375\" Blade length: 1.938\" Blade steel: H-1 Length closed: 2.438\" Cutting edge: 1.687\" Weight: .6oz Blade thickness: .078\" Handle material: Fibreglass Reinforced Nylon LYLS3 , Spyderco Ladybug3 Salt SpyderEdge , spyderco ladybug 3 , spyderco lady bug 3 , spyderco ladybug sypyder edge , spyderco spyder edge , spyderco salt spyder edge , pocket knife , pocket knifes , best pocket knife , personalized pocket knife , pocket knife reviews , pocket knife brands , pocket knife laws , pocket knife sharpener , pocket knife review , small pocket knife , quality pocket knife , folding pocket knife , pocket knife gift , utility pocket knife , mini pocket knife , best pocket knife in the world , spyderco , spyderco knives , spyderco knife , spyderco pocket knife , spyderco pocket knives", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wVRwXmXML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RATY5O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 40.95}}
{"item_id": "B001RAX6VC", "title": "Spyderco Ladybug 3 Plain Edge Knife, Purple", "description": "Like its insect namesake, the Spyderco Ladybug is beneficial and advantageous to humans. An indispensible tool for daily life, this handy knife is small, innocuous, easily carried on a keychain, and ideal for thousands of everyday cutting chores. The Ladybug's modified clip-point VG-10 stainless steel blade is hollow-ground and uniformly thick from heel to tip for durability and strength. Its FRN (fiberglass-reinforced-nylon) handle is Bi-Directionally Textured and comfortably shaped to ensure a secure grip and positive control. Despite its small size, its Trademark Round Hole is fully functional and supports one-handed opening with either hand. The blade locks open via a back lock mechanism, and a lanyard hole allows easy attachment to a keychain or thong. This version of the Ladybug features a purple FRN handle.", "text": "Spyderco Ladybug 3 Plain Edge Knife, Purple Like its insect namesake, the Spyderco Ladybug is beneficial and advantageous to humans. An indispensible tool for daily life, this handy knife is small, innocuous, easily carried on a keychain, and ideal for thousands of everyday cutting chores. The Ladybug's modified clip-point VG-10 stainless steel blade is hollow-ground and uniformly thick from heel to tip for durability and strength. Its FRN (fiberglass-reinforced-nylon) handle is Bi-Directionally Textured and comfortably shaped to ensure a secure grip and positive control. Despite its small size, its Trademark Round Hole is fully functional and supports one-handed opening with either hand. The blade locks open via a back lock mechanism, and a lanyard hole allows easy attachment to a keychain or thong. This version of the Ladybug features a purple FRN handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FX6S0L6LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RAX6VC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 31.55}}
