{"item_id": "B001RC9NHG", "title": "Infini Amuse Twin Pack (Safety & Tail Light) (Black/Red, 10.5g ea)", "description": "Infini amuse twin pack has both the safety and tail lights are included in this combo pack. Both have a flexible tail that wraps around handlebars, seat posts, helmets and more. Features flashing and steady modes. Water resistant. 50-120 hour batter life.", "text": "Infini Amuse Twin Pack (Safety & Tail Light) (Black/Red, 10.5g ea) Infini amuse twin pack has both the safety and tail lights are included in this combo pack. Both have a flexible tail that wraps around handlebars, seat posts, helmets and more. Features flashing and steady modes. Water resistant. 50-120 hour batter life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Lq9vUjiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RC9NHG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RE06WU", "title": "Ultimate Survival Deluxe Survival Kit - Black", "description": "Deluxe Survival KitThe Deluxe Survival Kit is a collection of some of the world's finest camping and survival gear, containing what you need to start a fire, cut limbs for shelter, and signal for help. Whatever you do outdoors, (camping, hiking, climbing, hunting, fishing, etc.) these premier recreational, safety and camping supplies can simplify your life every day, and can help save your life on the worst days. This kit is ideal for your backpack, glovebox, ATV or boat.Includes:BlastMatch™ Fire Starter:Simply put it is the world's finest one-handed fire starter! It generates intensely hot sparks three times hotter than a standard match. Once you?ve tried it you'll never go back to flint again. BlastMatch™ is safe, easy-to-use, and works in any weather.WetFire™ Tinder: You will love this amazing fire starting tinder is non-toxic, odorless, smokeless, and you can start a fire even in the driving rain. In fact, WetFire™ tinder burns longer when its WET! A small pile of tinder shavings is all you need to start a roaring fire.StarFlash Signal Mirror:This signal mirror is unbreakable, can be aimed precisely, floats and can signal for communications up to 100 miles away. You can use it hiking, camping, or backpacking to apply first aid or camouflage. StarFlash was chosen as the premier signal mirror of the U.S. Air Force and other government agencies 10 years ago.JetScream™ Whistle:This whistle is one of the loudest in the world, any louder and it would cause physical pain, literally. You can hear JetScream's™ amazing 122Db ear-piercing shriek, above most natural or man-made noises. It is equivalent to the sound of a rock concert or a jet at take off. You can use JetScream™ in the city or woods for communication and personal protection.SaberCut™ Saw:Our revolu", "text": "Ultimate Survival Deluxe Survival Kit - Black Deluxe Survival KitThe Deluxe Survival Kit is a collection of some of the world's finest camping and survival gear, containing what you need to start a fire, cut limbs for shelter, and signal for help. Whatever you do outdoors, (camping, hiking, climbing, hunting, fishing, etc.) these premier recreational, safety and camping supplies can simplify your life every day, and can help save your life on the worst days. This kit is ideal for your backpack, glovebox, ATV or boat.Includes:BlastMatch™ Fire Starter:Simply put it is the world's finest one-handed fire starter! It generates intensely hot sparks three times hotter than a standard match. Once you?ve tried it you'll never go back to flint again. BlastMatch™ is safe, easy-to-use, and works in any weather.WetFire™ Tinder: You will love this amazing fire starting tinder is non-toxic, odorless, smokeless, and you can start a fire even in the driving rain. In fact, WetFire™ tinder burns longer when its WET! A small pile of tinder shavings is all you need to start a roaring fire.StarFlash Signal Mirror:This signal mirror is unbreakable, can be aimed precisely, floats and can signal for communications up to 100 miles away. You can use it hiking, camping, or backpacking to apply first aid or camouflage. StarFlash was chosen as the premier signal mirror of the U.S. Air Force and other government agencies 10 years ago.JetScream™ Whistle:This whistle is one of the loudest in the world, any louder and it would cause physical pain, literally. You can hear JetScream's™ amazing 122Db ear-piercing shriek, above most natural or man-made noises. It is equivalent to the sound of a rock concert or a jet at take off. You can use JetScream™ in the city or woods for communication and personal protection.SaberCut™ Saw:Our revolu", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a7ZNnDJSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RE06WU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 70.68}}
{"item_id": "B001RE6ZPW", "title": "Morrell Yellow Jacket Crossbow Target", "description": "- A target specifically designed for crossbow fieldpoint practice. This target will take a serious pounding from the heaviest weight and fastest crossbows available", "text": "Morrell Yellow Jacket Crossbow Target - A target specifically designed for crossbow fieldpoint practice. This target will take a serious pounding from the heaviest weight and fastest crossbows available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hhnCuxFJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RE6ZPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morrell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 61.77}}
{"item_id": "B001RI7A66", "title": "Lyman Reloading 223 Case Length/Headspace Gauge", "description": "To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "text": "Lyman Reloading 223 Case Length/Headspace Gauge To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B3IQiqq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RI7A66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.75}}
{"item_id": "B001RICMUA", "title": "Lyman 38 Spec 357 Mag Carbide 3 Die Set", "description": "Lyman was the originator of the Tungsten Carbide (T-C) sizing die and \"Multi-Inchconcept with the addition of extra seating screws for pistol die sets. Combined with another Lyman original - the two step neck expanding die, our Multi-Deluxe Die Sets offer these features: a one piece hardened steel decapping rod and extra seating screws for all popular bullet nose shapes, and all steel construction.", "text": "Lyman 38 Spec 357 Mag Carbide 3 Die Set Lyman was the originator of the Tungsten Carbide (T-C) sizing die and \"Multi-Inchconcept with the addition of extra seating screws for pistol die sets. Combined with another Lyman original - the two step neck expanding die, our Multi-Deluxe Die Sets offer these features: a one piece hardened steel decapping rod and extra seating screws for all popular bullet nose shapes, and all steel construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EPO0OaSyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RICMUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 50.88}}
