{"item_id": "B001RJ4Q2G", "title": "Kan Jam Game Set", "description": "Kan Jam is the Ultimate Outdoor Game. Play it everywhere. Great for Backyards, Barbecues, Parties, Beaches, Tailgating, Gym Class and More. Team Members take turns throwing and deflecting the Kan Jam Disc to score points up to 21 or by throwing an exciting Instant win. The Kan Jam Game Set Includes: 2 Durable Highly Portable Official Kan Jam Goals, 2 Official Kan Jam Labels, Custom Designed Official Kan Jam Flying Disc, Instructions.", "text": "Kan Jam Game Set Kan Jam is the Ultimate Outdoor Game. Play it everywhere. Great for Backyards, Barbecues, Parties, Beaches, Tailgating, Gym Class and More. Team Members take turns throwing and deflecting the Kan Jam Disc to score points up to 21 or by throwing an exciting Instant win. The Kan Jam Game Set Includes: 2 Durable Highly Portable Official Kan Jam Goals, 2 Official Kan Jam Labels, Custom Designed Official Kan Jam Flying Disc, Instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51f1YFXI6%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RJ4Q2G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kan-Jam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Flying Discs"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B001RJO7YI", "title": "Allen Company Ruger Embroidered Logo Attache Case (15-Inch)", "description": "This Ruger attache case can carry one or two handguns, pistols, or revolvers ranging from sub-compact semi-autos to 8\" revolvers.", "text": "Allen Company Ruger Embroidered Logo Attache Case (15-Inch) This Ruger attache case can carry one or two handguns, pistols, or revolvers ranging from sub-compact semi-autos to 8\" revolvers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jUCCDvS7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RJO7YI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 24.4}}
{"item_id": "B001RL0SO4", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FX21N-CP Revolver Seal Knife with a Double Tooth Saw and Part-Serrated 4.75-Inch Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FX21N-CP Revolver Seal Knife with a Double Tooth Saw and Part-Serrated 4.75-Inch Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IW%2Bt4WnWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RL0SO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 17.25}}
{"item_id": "B001RLQNSO", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering King Kong Camp Chair with Shoulder Carry Bag and Padded Back/Seat", "description": "We don’t have to ask, we know everyone is tired of buying cheap, quad chairs that last a couple of times and then break. Not only is it embarrassing to have your chair break in front of family and friends, but why buy a chair that’s not going to last? No more disposable chairs! The King Kong is pure luxury. It has a sturdy powder coated steel frame with 600D polyester fabric … quality you can count on and that will last a lifetime – we guarantee it. And the King Kong holds up to 800 lbs … it’s time to move on to a chair that you can trust. Even if you’re a person who doesn’t need the extra weight capacity, the comfort and strength that you’ll gain from this chair is incomparable to any other chair on the market that folds up, fits in a carry bag, and can be brought to all your events.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering King Kong Camp Chair with Shoulder Carry Bag and Padded Back/Seat We don’t have to ask, we know everyone is tired of buying cheap, quad chairs that last a couple of times and then break. Not only is it embarrassing to have your chair break in front of family and friends, but why buy a chair that’s not going to last? No more disposable chairs! The King Kong is pure luxury. It has a sturdy powder coated steel frame with 600D polyester fabric … quality you can count on and that will last a lifetime – we guarantee it. And the King Kong holds up to 800 lbs … it’s time to move on to a chair that you can trust. Even if you’re a person who doesn’t need the extra weight capacity, the comfort and strength that you’ll gain from this chair is incomparable to any other chair on the market that folds up, fits in a carry bag, and can be brought to all your events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BpwaP7LyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RLQNSO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 55.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RLRPXQ", "title": "Makarov CO2 BB Pistol air pistol", "description": "Umarex Makarov pistol CO2-powered Uses one 12-gram CO2 cartridge Shoots steel BBs 16-shot removable BB mag Double- and single-action Fixed front and rear sights Full metal construction Moveable slide Black frame with brown grips Never shoot steel BBs at hard objects ... ... Umarex Makarov 16-shot CO2 BB pistol with removable mag...", "text": "Makarov CO2 BB Pistol air pistol Umarex Makarov pistol CO2-powered Uses one 12-gram CO2 cartridge Shoots steel BBs 16-shot removable BB mag Double- and single-action Fixed front and rear sights Full metal construction Moveable slide Black frame with brown grips Never shoot steel BBs at hard objects ... ... Umarex Makarov 16-shot CO2 BB pistol with removable mag...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BKASep4EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RLRPXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RLXU30", "title": "Knight & Hale Yella Hammer Turkey Pot Call", "description": "The Knight and Hale Yalla Hammer is the next step in the evolution of the friction turkey call classic, the Ol' Yeller. It's got the same advanced Slatek™ calling surface, with a few new features. First, its base is made with wood-impregnated plastic for the durability of plastic and the sound of wood. Second, it features an integrated soundboard for unbeatable realism. Third, it comes with the Super Striker, which works in any weather.", "text": "Knight & Hale Yella Hammer Turkey Pot Call The Knight and Hale Yalla Hammer is the next step in the evolution of the friction turkey call classic, the Ol' Yeller. It's got the same advanced Slatek™ calling surface, with a few new features. First, its base is made with wood-impregnated plastic for the durability of plastic and the sound of wood. Second, it features an integrated soundboard for unbeatable realism. Third, it comes with the Super Striker, which works in any weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wtkhBtGvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RLXU30.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Knight &amp; Hale", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 14.25}}
{"item_id": "B001RMQ5IG", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Tactical Field/Trauma w/ QuikClot Kit", "description": "FEATURES of the Tactical Field/Trauma w/ QuikClot Kit by Adventure Medical QuikClot Sport 25 g. Petrolatum Gauze Dressing Trauma Pads Elastic Bandage Wound Closure Strips SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 1 lb Dimensions: 7\" x 4.5\" x 6\"", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Tactical Field/Trauma w/ QuikClot Kit FEATURES of the Tactical Field/Trauma w/ QuikClot Kit by Adventure Medical QuikClot Sport 25 g. Petrolatum Gauze Dressing Trauma Pads Elastic Bandage Wound Closure Strips SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 1 lb Dimensions: 7\" x 4.5\" x 6\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411YMGgP7WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMQ5IG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RMUOKG", "title": "Barnett Outdoors Junior Archery 28-Inch Arrows (3 Pack)", "description": "These 28-inch arrows feature strong, lightweight fiberglass shafts and are for use in any Barnett youth bow. The three-pack of arrows also includes target points.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors Junior Archery 28-Inch Arrows (3 Pack) These 28-inch arrows feature strong, lightweight fiberglass shafts and are for use in any Barnett youth bow. The three-pack of arrows also includes target points.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-q9xd4qfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMUOKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B001RMUTYM", "title": "Buck BuckLite Max Folding Knife", "description": "Buck's Folding BuckLite Max has a 3-5/8\" drop point, 420HC stainless steel blade. It features black glass reinforced nylon handles and comes with a stainless steel belt clip for discreet carry.", "text": "Buck BuckLite Max Folding Knife Buck's Folding BuckLite Max has a 3-5/8\" drop point, 420HC stainless steel blade. It features black glass reinforced nylon handles and comes with a stainless steel belt clip for discreet carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21l2eIu3rEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMUTYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RMUU3M", "title": "Buck BuckLite MAX Knife", "description": "For those who are seeking a very lightweight, dependable knife, the BuckLite MAX TM is the answer. These fixed blade knives are built with a durable full tang construction and non-slip Alcryn rubber handles.", "text": "Buck BuckLite MAX Knife For those who are seeking a very lightweight, dependable knife, the BuckLite MAX TM is the answer. These fixed blade knives are built with a durable full tang construction and non-slip Alcryn rubber handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PZGlXZvPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMUU3M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RMUVXQ", "title": "Outdoor Cap Remington Cap, Blaze Camo", "description": "From Outdoor Cap comes this brilliantly colored, blaze orange \"Remington Country\" cap. Features a structured 6 panel design for integrity and comfort. Polyester material and flat stitch embroidery on front and back make this a truly stand-out hat.", "text": "Outdoor Cap Remington Cap, Blaze Camo From Outdoor Cap comes this brilliantly colored, blaze orange \"Remington Country\" cap. Features a structured 6 panel design for integrity and comfort. Polyester material and flat stitch embroidery on front and back make this a truly stand-out hat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kqIucqPHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMUVXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Cap", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B001RMV0R2", "title": "Stack-On SPAO-3317 Large Fabric Organizer for Stack-On Long-Gun Cabinets, Black", "description": "Stack-On's handy large fabric organizer expands the storage possibilities in your safe and keep frequently used supplies and items close at hand. This double organizer has mesh and full panel pockets for storing tools and supplies. A \"belt strap\" is also included for hanging knives and other equipment. This unit easily attached to the safe or cabinet door.", "text": "Stack-On SPAO-3317 Large Fabric Organizer for Stack-On Long-Gun Cabinets, Black Stack-On's handy large fabric organizer expands the storage possibilities in your safe and keep frequently used supplies and items close at hand. This double organizer has mesh and full panel pockets for storing tools and supplies. A \"belt strap\" is also included for hanging knives and other equipment. This unit easily attached to the safe or cabinet door.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HxrWA%2BtkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMV0R2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 18.4}}
{"item_id": "B001RMWRHE", "title": "Bear Archery First Shot Youth Bow Set", "description": "The First Shot Youth Bow Set from Bear Archery provides beginning archers with everything they need to get started and learn to hit the target. The set features a 36-inch bow with durable composite limbs, two safety glass arrows, an Armguard, and an arrow quiver. The bow offers a 14 to 16-inch draw length and an 8 to 12 pound draw weight. The set is recommended for children from 4 to 7 years old. Please note that ages may vary for each bow in accordance with a child's size and shooting ability. This product is not a toy. Children under 16 require adult supervision to use this bow set.The First Shot Youth Bow offers kids a great way to get started in archery.What's in the Box?36-inch bow, two safety glass arrows, Armguard, arrow quiver", "text": "Bear Archery First Shot Youth Bow Set The First Shot Youth Bow Set from Bear Archery provides beginning archers with everything they need to get started and learn to hit the target. The set features a 36-inch bow with durable composite limbs, two safety glass arrows, an Armguard, and an arrow quiver. The bow offers a 14 to 16-inch draw length and an 8 to 12 pound draw weight. The set is recommended for children from 4 to 7 years old. Please note that ages may vary for each bow in accordance with a child's size and shooting ability. This product is not a toy. Children under 16 require adult supervision to use this bow set.The First Shot Youth Bow offers kids a great way to get started in archery.What's in the Box?36-inch bow, two safety glass arrows, Armguard, arrow quiver", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a7Z4dYDcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMWRHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bear Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Youth Bow Sets"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RMWTJA", "title": "Simmons 8-Point Truplex Reticle Riflescope, 3-9x40mm (Matte)", "description": "As easy on the wallet as it is on the eye, the 8-Point riflescope offers more high-quality features than any other in its class. All models come with fully-coated optics for a brighter, higher-contrast image, and 1/4-MOA SureGrip audible-click windage and elevation adjustments for effortless adjustment. Waterproof, fogproof, and recoilproof, the 8-Point delivers outstanding precision in a basic riflescope.Features:8-point riflescopeFully-coated optics1-4-MOA SureGrip audible-click windage and elevation adjustmentsWaterproof, fogproof, recoilproofTruplex reticleSpecifications:Model Number: 510513Finish: MatteMagnification & Objective (mm): 3-9x 40Field of View (ft. at 100 yds.): 31.4 / 10.5Eye Relief: 95 mm; 3.75 inchesExit Pupil: 10.7 / 3.6 mmWeight: 70 ouncesClick Value (in at 100Y): 0.25Adjustment Range (in at 100Y): 60Reticle: Truplex", "text": "Simmons 8-Point Truplex Reticle Riflescope, 3-9x40mm (Matte) As easy on the wallet as it is on the eye, the 8-Point riflescope offers more high-quality features than any other in its class. All models come with fully-coated optics for a brighter, higher-contrast image, and 1/4-MOA SureGrip audible-click windage and elevation adjustments for effortless adjustment. Waterproof, fogproof, and recoilproof, the 8-Point delivers outstanding precision in a basic riflescope.Features:8-point riflescopeFully-coated optics1-4-MOA SureGrip audible-click windage and elevation adjustmentsWaterproof, fogproof, recoilproofTruplex reticleSpecifications:Model Number: 510513Finish: MatteMagnification & Objective (mm): 3-9x 40Field of View (ft. at 100 yds.): 31.4 / 10.5Eye Relief: 95 mm; 3.75 inchesExit Pupil: 10.7 / 3.6 mmWeight: 70 ouncesClick Value (in at 100Y): 0.25Adjustment Range (in at 100Y): 60Reticle: Truplex", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312zmiHQfSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMWTJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.89}}
{"item_id": "B001RMX0AW", "title": "Primos Trigger Stick Tall Tri Pod", "description": "The Trigger Stick Tall Tripod from Primos is a lightweight, height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount designed for hunters. Suitable for sitting, kneeling, or standing, the Trigger Stick offers one-handed, trigger-pull height adjustment from 36.5 to 61 inches tall so that you can stay focused on the task at hand. The Trigger Stick comes with a detachable V yoke for resting your rifle and holds any optical gear with a 1/4-20 or 3/8-16 threaded socket. Compatible with most cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable device, the Trigger Stick Tripod provides a steady base you can count on in the field.Features:Two-piece constructionOne-handed, trigger-pull height adjustmentDesigned for kneeling, sitting, or standingUse with cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable deviceFits 1/4-20 and 3/8-16 threaded socket mountsHeight adjusts from 36.5 to 61 inches", "text": "Primos Trigger Stick Tall Tri Pod The Trigger Stick Tall Tripod from Primos is a lightweight, height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount designed for hunters. Suitable for sitting, kneeling, or standing, the Trigger Stick offers one-handed, trigger-pull height adjustment from 36.5 to 61 inches tall so that you can stay focused on the task at hand. The Trigger Stick comes with a detachable V yoke for resting your rifle and holds any optical gear with a 1/4-20 or 3/8-16 threaded socket. Compatible with most cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable device, the Trigger Stick Tripod provides a steady base you can count on in the field.Features:Two-piece constructionOne-handed, trigger-pull height adjustmentDesigned for kneeling, sitting, or standingUse with cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders, and almost any other socket mountable deviceFits 1/4-20 and 3/8-16 threaded socket mountsHeight adjusts from 36.5 to 61 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BHj88jAzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMX0AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 127.92}}
{"item_id": "B001RMY69G", "title": "Viridian Nylon Holster Built for Viridian-Equipped Large Frame Auto Pistols (Size 16)", "description": "Viridian Green Laser Sights is proud to partner with BLACKHAWK! to bring you these exceptional holsters. This is the perfect belt holster for Viridian-equipped large frame autos. These holsters feature a hard polymer thumb break and are designed to fit virtually all gun-specific Viridian-equipped pistols. Made from durable 1000 denier Cordura nylon.", "text": "Viridian Nylon Holster Built for Viridian-Equipped Large Frame Auto Pistols (Size 16) Viridian Green Laser Sights is proud to partner with BLACKHAWK! to bring you these exceptional holsters. This is the perfect belt holster for Viridian-equipped large frame autos. These holsters feature a hard polymer thumb break and are designed to fit virtually all gun-specific Viridian-equipped pistols. Made from durable 1000 denier Cordura nylon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nNk2vTiXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMY69G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Viridian Green Laser Sights", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.69}}
{"item_id": "B001RMYHX6", "title": "Primos Trigger Stick Short Bi Pod", "description": "With just one hand and the pull of a trigger, you can adjust the Primos Trigger Stick to your desired height. The Trigger Stick is a lightweight height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount, perfect for sitting, kneeling or standing. It comes equipped with a detachable V yoke. The Trigger Stick fits 1/4-Inch-20 & 3/8-Inch-16 threaded fixtures for securing optical gear. It is perfect for cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders and almost any other mono pod, bi, and tri pod mountable device.", "text": "Primos Trigger Stick Short Bi Pod With just one hand and the pull of a trigger, you can adjust the Primos Trigger Stick to your desired height. The Trigger Stick is a lightweight height-adjustable gun rest and optical gear mount, perfect for sitting, kneeling or standing. It comes equipped with a detachable V yoke. The Trigger Stick fits 1/4-Inch-20 & 3/8-Inch-16 threaded fixtures for securing optical gear. It is perfect for cameras, spotting scopes, binoculars, laser range finders and almost any other mono pod, bi, and tri pod mountable device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CvZ4wqJcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RMYHX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 73.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RN057M", "title": "Cobra All Adjust Release Camo Loop Lock", "description": "This archery release features precision machined center release jaws, padded nylon camo strap for a custom fit, black anodized release head and a gun style curved trigger. The release head attachment strap allows for infinite adjustment for a custom fit.", "text": "Cobra All Adjust Release Camo Loop Lock This archery release features precision machined center release jaws, padded nylon camo strap for a custom fit, black anodized release head and a gun style curved trigger. The release head attachment strap allows for infinite adjustment for a custom fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iuMLWtanL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RN057M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cobra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 21.25}}
{"item_id": "B001RN0C9I", "title": "Buck Vantage TM Select Knife", "description": "Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "text": "Buck Vantage TM Select Knife Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31z78xL%2B8CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RN0C9I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RN0JA0", "title": "Bog Gear Shooting and Photography Camo Tall Tripod", "description": "TRIPOD - three telescoping legs, designed for rifle or pistol shooting and photography. Useful for many other outdoor purposes while camping or hiking", "text": "Bog Gear Shooting and Photography Camo Tall Tripod TRIPOD - three telescoping legs, designed for rifle or pistol shooting and photography. Useful for many other outdoor purposes while camping or hiking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TBlTMOgIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RN0JA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bog Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 88.99}}
