{"item_id": "B001RN26B0", "title": "Stack-On SPAO-148 Small Fabric Organizer for Stack-On Long-Gun Cabinets", "description": "The single organizer has been sized to fit Stack-On’s Security Cabinets and can be mounted to the inside of the door for added storage. A mesh pocket at the top of the organizer, can be sectioned off into smaller compartments. A belt strap is included for hanging storage such as knives or walkie talkies. A deep pocket at the bottom of the organizer is great for larger items. This organizer will greatly expand your Stack-On Security Cabinet’s storage capacity.", "text": "Stack-On SPAO-148 Small Fabric Organizer for Stack-On Long-Gun Cabinets The single organizer has been sized to fit Stack-On’s Security Cabinets and can be mounted to the inside of the door for added storage. A mesh pocket at the top of the organizer, can be sectioned off into smaller compartments. A belt strap is included for hanging storage such as knives or walkie talkies. A deep pocket at the bottom of the organizer is great for larger items. This organizer will greatly expand your Stack-On Security Cabinet’s storage capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415Ixkts69L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RN26B0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 10.97}}
