{"item_id": "B001RRISOU", "title": "KA-BAR Mini Dozier Folder Hunting Knife,Black ,Small", "description": "Ka-Bar Dozier Small Folder. 3 3/8\" closed lockback. AUS-8A stainless drop point blade with thumb stud. Checkered back Zytel handles with lanyard hole. Comes with keyring attachment. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "text": "KA-BAR Mini Dozier Folder Hunting Knife,Black ,Small Ka-Bar Dozier Small Folder. 3 3/8\" closed lockback. AUS-8A stainless drop point blade with thumb stud. Checkered back Zytel handles with lanyard hole. Comes with keyring attachment. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rDXfV-2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RRISOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 20.51}}
