{"item_id": "B001RTEQ62", "title": "Fobus RU97 Elite Paddle Holster", "description": "Fobus Paddle Holster Right Hand Black 4.5 RugP94, 95, 97 RU97. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Fobus RU97 Elite Paddle Holster Fobus Paddle Holster Right Hand Black 4.5 RugP94, 95, 97 RU97. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L3VgxgxqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RTEQ62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.13}}
{"item_id": "B001RTGIE0", "title": "Outdoor Research Mesh Ditty Sacks - Set Of 3 (Dark Grey, One Size)", "description": "Keep the contents of your pack in line with these light, breathable ditty bags. The sturdy dark grey mesh allows you to see the contents of the bag from the outside.", "text": "Outdoor Research Mesh Ditty Sacks - Set Of 3 (Dark Grey, One Size) Keep the contents of your pack in line with these light, breathable ditty bags. The sturdy dark grey mesh allows you to see the contents of the bag from the outside.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aRh55lujL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RTGIE0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RTL5L6", "title": "Rimfire Lighting System for Bicycles", "description": "Rimfire bicycle lighting system is an exciting, new, ultra-bright lighting product that significantly increases the visibility of the bicycle rider to the motorist. With rising fuel costs and the advent of the green consumer, more cyclists are sharing the road with motorists each year. The number of accidents involving automobiles and bicyclists has increased at an alarming rate. Spinning Innovations, an American sporting goods and safety light design company, has designed an outstanding product to aid in the safety, fun and enjoyment of riding your bicycle in the hours of darkness. Rimfire is unique in its ability to make the bicycle most visible in its most vulnerable angle, the broadside, during the dusk and hours of darkness. Rimfire bicycle lighting system utilizes ultra- bright, red, green and blue LED lights that can be set in one of nine modes of light sequencing that can be seen at over mile away to give a motorist ample time to see and avoid the cyclist. Rimfire is not only safe but fun as well. Each mode of light sequencing, that you can choose, will give a different dazzling effect that will enhance the cycling experience of the young and old alike. Rimfire is easy to install with only a screwdriver and will fit any spoke wheel including bike trailers and joggers. Package contains: One Rimfire Power Hub One each, RED, GREEN, and BLUE Hyper-Bright LED light lens assemblies to accessorize one wheel One unit will light one bicycle wheel with 3 LED lights, if you want to light two wheels you need to buy two units Mounting clips and hardware. Detailed easy installation instructions Requires: 3 AA batteries (not included)", "text": "Rimfire Lighting System for Bicycles Rimfire bicycle lighting system is an exciting, new, ultra-bright lighting product that significantly increases the visibility of the bicycle rider to the motorist. With rising fuel costs and the advent of the green consumer, more cyclists are sharing the road with motorists each year. The number of accidents involving automobiles and bicyclists has increased at an alarming rate. Spinning Innovations, an American sporting goods and safety light design company, has designed an outstanding product to aid in the safety, fun and enjoyment of riding your bicycle in the hours of darkness. Rimfire is unique in its ability to make the bicycle most visible in its most vulnerable angle, the broadside, during the dusk and hours of darkness. Rimfire bicycle lighting system utilizes ultra- bright, red, green and blue LED lights that can be set in one of nine modes of light sequencing that can be seen at over mile away to give a motorist ample time to see and avoid the cyclist. Rimfire is not only safe but fun as well. Each mode of light sequencing, that you can choose, will give a different dazzling effect that will enhance the cycling experience of the young and old alike. Rimfire is easy to install with only a screwdriver and will fit any spoke wheel including bike trailers and joggers. Package contains: One Rimfire Power Hub One each, RED, GREEN, and BLUE Hyper-Bright LED light lens assemblies to accessorize one wheel One unit will light one bicycle wheel with 3 LED lights, if you want to light two wheels you need to buy two units Mounting clips and hardware. Detailed easy installation instructions Requires: 3 AA batteries (not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V8uOgkhqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RTL5L6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001RTLTBC", "title": "Nathan Sprint Handheld Bottle Carrier", "description": "Nathan's QuickShot Handheld holds 10oz and has a unique hand strap eliminating need to grip flask", "text": "Nathan Sprint Handheld Bottle Carrier Nathan's QuickShot Handheld holds 10oz and has a unique hand strap eliminating need to grip flask", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YzC3DSz1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RTLTBC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001RU04XK", "title": "Coleman Fold N Go Instastart Grill", "description": "This Coleman Fold N Go™ Portable Grill is ready for your next adventure. Take it along for camping, roadtrips, the beach, tailgating and more.Its unique folding design is sleek and compact, making it easy to transport and store but it's big enough to cook for 5-6 people. The fully-adjustable 6,000-BTU horseshoe-shaped, stainless steel burner provides even heat distribution. Coleman's InstaStart matchless ignition provides push-button lighting, so you can leave the matches at home. The grill's porcelain-coated stamped-steel grate is removable for easy clean-up and can be washed in the dishwasher. A convenient carry handle and secure lid latch make for easy transport. The Fold N Go Grill uses a standard 16.4-ounce propane bottle (sold separately).Instastart™ for convenient matchless lighting..Convenient carry handle..Removable water pan, grease tray for simple clean up (pan is dishwasher safe.).Folding metal feet and handle tuck out of the way when not in use..PerfectFlow™ pressure control system regulates fuel for constant, even heat..Perfect heat design for optimal cooking performance..Acessory grate, griddle and carry case sold separately..Operates up to 3.5 hours on one 16.4 oz Coleman propane cylindar (propane not included).Size: 16.6\" x 14.5\" x 6.8\"..", "text": "Coleman Fold N Go Instastart Grill This Coleman Fold N Go™ Portable Grill is ready for your next adventure. Take it along for camping, roadtrips, the beach, tailgating and more.Its unique folding design is sleek and compact, making it easy to transport and store but it's big enough to cook for 5-6 people. The fully-adjustable 6,000-BTU horseshoe-shaped, stainless steel burner provides even heat distribution. Coleman's InstaStart matchless ignition provides push-button lighting, so you can leave the matches at home. The grill's porcelain-coated stamped-steel grate is removable for easy clean-up and can be washed in the dishwasher. A convenient carry handle and secure lid latch make for easy transport. The Fold N Go Grill uses a standard 16.4-ounce propane bottle (sold separately).Instastart™ for convenient matchless lighting..Convenient carry handle..Removable water pan, grease tray for simple clean up (pan is dishwasher safe.).Folding metal feet and handle tuck out of the way when not in use..PerfectFlow™ pressure control system regulates fuel for constant, even heat..Perfect heat design for optimal cooking performance..Acessory grate, griddle and carry case sold separately..Operates up to 3.5 hours on one 16.4 oz Coleman propane cylindar (propane not included).Size: 16.6\" x 14.5\" x 6.8\"..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gjrSIiHQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RU04XK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 78.75}}
{"item_id": "B001RVCUFO", "title": "G2 Full Metal Airsoft Handgun bbs pistol", "description": "G2 Full Metal Airsoft Handgun New G2 Galaxy (Full Metal) Manufacturer : Galaxy Body Material : Full metal Power : 180fps with 0.12g BB System : Spring Weight : 0.7 kg with box Magazine : 7 rounds", "text": "G2 Full Metal Airsoft Handgun bbs pistol G2 Full Metal Airsoft Handgun New G2 Galaxy (Full Metal) Manufacturer : Galaxy Body Material : Full metal Power : 180fps with 0.12g BB System : Spring Weight : 0.7 kg with box Magazine : 7 rounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C0iF4VELL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RVCUFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galaxy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B001RVEX3G", "title": "G.1 Airsoft 6mm Pistol Metal Zinc Alloy Shell Hand Gun", "description": "This Airsoft gun is made with Metal Alloy Shell. The Spring Airsoft Pistol is powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. It's fast, clean, inexpensive and easily maintained; it requires no gas or batteries to operate. Also, Spring Airsoft Guns are the toughest, most durable of all Airsoft Guns, because they're made with few breakable pieces.", "text": "G.1 Airsoft 6mm Pistol Metal Zinc Alloy Shell Hand Gun This Airsoft gun is made with Metal Alloy Shell. The Spring Airsoft Pistol is powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. It's fast, clean, inexpensive and easily maintained; it requires no gas or batteries to operate. Also, Spring Airsoft Guns are the toughest, most durable of all Airsoft Guns, because they're made with few breakable pieces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d89Xvu%2BGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RVEX3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galaxy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 9.5}}
{"item_id": "B001RWUZ0U", "title": "Primos Hunting Double Bull Qs3 Magnum Ground Swat Camo Chair", "description": "When you spend as much time in our ground blinds as we do, you eventually create the “best seat in the house” instead of trying to “make do” with some chair from a discount store. Standard chairs are apt to cut off blood flow on the back of your legs, leading to discomfort and cold feet. They also restrict mobility and don’t allow the range of motion that our QS3 Tri-Stool provides. Of course, we designed this tri-stool at the perfect height to see through all of our blind window openings.", "text": "Primos Hunting Double Bull Qs3 Magnum Ground Swat Camo Chair When you spend as much time in our ground blinds as we do, you eventually create the “best seat in the house” instead of trying to “make do” with some chair from a discount store. Standard chairs are apt to cut off blood flow on the back of your legs, leading to discomfort and cold feet. They also restrict mobility and don’t allow the range of motion that our QS3 Tri-Stool provides. Of course, we designed this tri-stool at the perfect height to see through all of our blind window openings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ha-yoq6YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001RWUZ0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 38.92}}
