{"item_id": "B001SGZI7U", "title": "Champion Score Keeper Large Fluorescent Green Bull 100-yard Target (Pack of 12)", "description": "Champion ScoreKeper Targets off bright fluorescent colors make it easier to pick out your mark and know where you hit. A \"built-in\" record-keeping section lets you track vital data to refine your loads and zero-in on tight groups. Available for rifles, pistols, and airguns.", "text": "Champion Score Keeper Large Fluorescent Green Bull 100-yard Target (Pack of 12) Champion ScoreKeper Targets off bright fluorescent colors make it easier to pick out your mark and know where you hit. A \"built-in\" record-keeping section lets you track vital data to refine your loads and zero-in on tight groups. Available for rifles, pistols, and airguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vqq5qfanL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SGZI7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.44}}
{"item_id": "B001SH1J2M", "title": "Kwikee Kwiver (6-Arrow) Kwikee Kompound", "description": "Larger capacity quiver for those needing additional arrows. Ideal for multi-day hunts and multi-game opportunities.", "text": "Kwikee Kwiver (6-Arrow) Kwikee Kompound Larger capacity quiver for those needing additional arrows. Ideal for multi-day hunts and multi-game opportunities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PB17WuaPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH1J2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kwikee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Quivers"]], "price": 33.04}}
{"item_id": "B001SH1JZY", "title": "Martin Jaguar Takedown Bow", "description": "The Martin Jaguar Take Down Bow has a smooth draw, a powerful shot, a durable riser, and a comfortable grip. Our list of important features isn't short. The Jaguar is an ideal choice for the archer wanting to give the traditional side a serious try. Laminated wood and glass limbs offer a smooth draw, but send an arrow with authority. You can easily remove limbs from the riser for convenient transport and storage. We even throw in an arrow rest, all for a very reasonable price. Let your curiosity get the best of you and give traditional a shot. Satisfying curiosity is what the Jaguar Take-Down is all about. Includes owners manual.Brace Height: 7 InchMass Weight: 2.7 PoundsAMO Length: 60 InchRight Hand OnlyBlackDraw Weight: 30 Pound", "text": "Martin Jaguar Takedown Bow The Martin Jaguar Take Down Bow has a smooth draw, a powerful shot, a durable riser, and a comfortable grip. Our list of important features isn't short. The Jaguar is an ideal choice for the archer wanting to give the traditional side a serious try. Laminated wood and glass limbs offer a smooth draw, but send an arrow with authority. You can easily remove limbs from the riser for convenient transport and storage. We even throw in an arrow rest, all for a very reasonable price. Let your curiosity get the best of you and give traditional a shot. Satisfying curiosity is what the Jaguar Take-Down is all about. Includes owners manual.Brace Height: 7 InchMass Weight: 2.7 PoundsAMO Length: 60 InchRight Hand OnlyBlackDraw Weight: 30 Pound", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hvJaJnrhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH1JZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Recurve Bows"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001SH1KR6", "title": "Arrow Precision Girl Power Pink Camo Youth Archery Set (20-Pounds)", "description": "The Girl Power compound bow is the ideal beginner bow for the female. With its Pink design, the bow carries a forgiving 20 pound draw weight that comes packed with accessories.", "text": "Arrow Precision Girl Power Pink Camo Youth Archery Set (20-Pounds) The Girl Power compound bow is the ideal beginner bow for the female. With its Pink design, the bow carries a forgiving 20 pound draw weight that comes packed with accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EHyorAbGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH1KR6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Youth Bow Sets"]], "price": 44.42}}
