{"item_id": "B001SH5S06", "title": "Arrow Precision 28\" Fiberglass Arrows - 12 Pack", "description": "Original Manufacturer's replacement part. 28\" arrow fletched with 3\" Vanes, Nocks and Practice Tips.", "text": "Arrow Precision 28\" Fiberglass Arrows - 12 Pack Original Manufacturer's replacement part. 28\" arrow fletched with 3\" Vanes, Nocks and Practice Tips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21pLuxVza3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH5S06.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B001SH5S4M", "title": "Blackhawk Double Stack Double Mag Case", "description": "Now twice the capacity of our single mag pouch with the same great tension spring for different width magazines. Available in both single stack and staggered column magazine versions. Includes both belt loops and belt clip. Adjustable hook for different width belts on the belt clip. Curved to waist line for slimmer profile.", "text": "Blackhawk Double Stack Double Mag Case Now twice the capacity of our single mag pouch with the same great tension spring for different width magazines. Available in both single stack and staggered column magazine versions. Includes both belt loops and belt clip. Adjustable hook for different width belts on the belt clip. Curved to waist line for slimmer profile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51copbHgwmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH5S4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 28.26}}
{"item_id": "B001SH5SG0", "title": "Carbon Express 100 Grain Native Broadhead (Pack of 3)", "description": "The Native broadhead is versatile, so it can be use on low to high poundage bows. It has a solid 2-blade, and an aircraft grade aluminum ferrule for superior lightweight strength.", "text": "Carbon Express 100 Grain Native Broadhead (Pack of 3) The Native broadhead is versatile, so it can be use on low to high poundage bows. It has a solid 2-blade, and an aircraft grade aluminum ferrule for superior lightweight strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jJ5blt5zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH5SG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carbon Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 5.33}}
{"item_id": "B001SH7VHO", "title": "Allen Company Brass Gun Hanger", "description": "BRASS GUN HANGER - Hangs any gun horizontally to wall or cabinet - One piece fitted for pistol grip area of buttstock & barrel - Installs w/4 brass plated screws (included)", "text": "Allen Company Brass Gun Hanger BRASS GUN HANGER - Hangs any gun horizontally to wall or cabinet - One piece fitted for pistol grip area of buttstock & barrel - Installs w/4 brass plated screws (included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mKtbD-u3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH7VHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B001SH7VXS", "title": "Champion Pink Electronic Ear Muffs", "description": "Enjoy safe shooting with new sound dampening ear muffs from Champion. These comfortable, stylish muffs provide superior hearing protection while remaining light and comfortable for the shooter. Available in either standard or electronic versions, they reduce harmful noise levels and provide a comfortable fit for those long days of shooting. Don't let your shooting passion damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "text": "Champion Pink Electronic Ear Muffs Enjoy safe shooting with new sound dampening ear muffs from Champion. These comfortable, stylish muffs provide superior hearing protection while remaining light and comfortable for the shooter. Available in either standard or electronic versions, they reduce harmful noise levels and provide a comfortable fit for those long days of shooting. Don't let your shooting passion damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TBOZA2HNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH7VXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 36.95}}
{"item_id": "B001SH92C6", "title": "Hogue Hogue AR/M16 AK Grip Storage Black", "description": "The Hogue Cargo Management System comes with a battery cradle that can store 3 SureFire 123A, 2 AA batteries or 4 2032 batteries. An extra cover is provided that can be used in place of the battery cradle to allow storage of other items. Fits inside our Hogue AR/AK Monogrips. This is the same system that is available in our combined AR/AK grip with storage kits. Batteries Not Included.", "text": "Hogue Hogue AR/M16 AK Grip Storage Black The Hogue Cargo Management System comes with a battery cradle that can store 3 SureFire 123A, 2 AA batteries or 4 2032 batteries. An extra cover is provided that can be used in place of the battery cradle to allow storage of other items. Fits inside our Hogue AR/AK Monogrips. This is the same system that is available in our combined AR/AK grip with storage kits. Batteries Not Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gLs0Zn3VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH92C6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 15.67}}
{"item_id": "B001SH949W", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove (Beretta 92Fs, M9)", "description": "Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits Beretta 92FS, M9.", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove (Beretta 92Fs, M9) Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits Beretta 92FS, M9.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pfV%2B8Q4vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SH949W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B001SIGEQC", "title": "NcStar .30-06 Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ3006)", "description": "Get on paper the quick and easy way with these High Grade Aluminum Bore Sighters. Designed to drop right into the chamber of your firearm projecting a straight Laser Beam right down the middle of the bore giving you precise trajectory.", "text": "NcStar .30-06 Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ3006) Get on paper the quick and easy way with these High Grade Aluminum Bore Sighters. Designed to drop right into the chamber of your firearm projecting a straight Laser Beam right down the middle of the bore giving you precise trajectory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11u95j66W9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SIGEQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 14.16}}
{"item_id": "B001SJSXHE", "title": "Serfas Seat Stay Taillight", "description": "This little light packs a big punch. With a 1/2 watt center LED, the Serfas Seat Stay light is a great addtion to stay as visable as possible on the road or trail.", "text": "Serfas Seat Stay Taillight This little light packs a big punch. With a 1/2 watt center LED, the Serfas Seat Stay light is a great addtion to stay as visable as possible on the road or trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gSSC4LbIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SJSXHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 7.77}}
{"item_id": "B001SMJ63Q", "title": "Mirrycle Original Bicycle Mirror", "description": "Yes, it's still available. Once the most popular mirror in the world. Every week we get a call from someone in Nepal or Timbuktu or Colorado who loves this product.Only fits older style brake levers which have the brake cable coming out of the end of the lever as shown in the photo.", "text": "Mirrycle Original Bicycle Mirror Yes, it's still available. Once the most popular mirror in the world. Every week we get a call from someone in Nepal or Timbuktu or Colorado who loves this product.Only fits older style brake levers which have the brake cable coming out of the end of the lever as shown in the photo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ei01A9ljL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SMJ63Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 14.16}}
