{"item_id": "B001SMPEL4", "title": "Kryptonite 998600 Black 2.6mm R4 Retractor Combination Lock Cable with LED light", "description": "Deterrent security for low crime areas. 2.6mm vinyl coated steel retracting steel cable. 4-digit resettable combination with easy-grip dials. Patented anti-reset button prevents accidental resetting. Detachable LED light for use in low light areas. Ergonomic, rubberized grips provide easy handling in snow and ice.", "text": "Kryptonite 998600 Black 2.6mm R4 Retractor Combination Lock Cable with LED light Deterrent security for low crime areas. 2.6mm vinyl coated steel retracting steel cable. 4-digit resettable combination with easy-grip dials. Patented anti-reset button prevents accidental resetting. Detachable LED light for use in low light areas. Ergonomic, rubberized grips provide easy handling in snow and ice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412dTRZc6SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001SMPEL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 22.97}}
