{"item_id": "B001T7JVWQ", "title": "Plano 45460 Soft Gun Case", "description": "The 45460 Gun Guard case is designed to fit shotguns up to 51” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density padding this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 400 Series soft cases feature lockable full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, protective rubber muzzle cap, wrapped nylon handles and adjustable shoulder strap. Product dimensions: 54\" long x 8.5\" wide x 2.5\" thick", "text": "Plano 45460 Soft Gun Case The 45460 Gun Guard case is designed to fit shotguns up to 51” in length. Constructed using a durable 600D shell and high-density padding this case will shield firearms against hunting's bumps and bangs. All Gun Guard 400 Series soft cases feature lockable full length zippers with dual pulls, a gusseted exterior side pocket, protective rubber muzzle cap, wrapped nylon handles and adjustable shoulder strap. Product dimensions: 54\" long x 8.5\" wide x 2.5\" thick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31te3o5hq%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001T7JVWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
