{"item_id": "B001TADF16", "title": "SPLASHGUARD MINI BLUE", "description": "Sized to fit Nalgene N-gen or 16 oz. wide-mouth bottles. The SplashGuard is a plastic insert which provides a smaller drinking hole, blocks the splash, is easily removed for cleaning and is dishwasher safe. Allows for easy filling without removing the SplashGuard.", "text": "SPLASHGUARD MINI BLUE Sized to fit Nalgene N-gen or 16 oz. wide-mouth bottles. The SplashGuard is a plastic insert which provides a smaller drinking hole, blocks the splash, is easily removed for cleaning and is dishwasher safe. Allows for easy filling without removing the SplashGuard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qaFzDPJOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TADF16.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 10.49}}
{"item_id": "B001TCZQAC", "title": "Outdoor Research Dry Ditty Sack", "description": "Whether you're heading out for a rainy hike or paddling down the river, you can keep your gear dry in the Outdoor Research Dry Ditty Sacks, sold in a set of 3.", "text": "Outdoor Research Dry Ditty Sack Whether you're heading out for a rainy hike or paddling down the river, you can keep your gear dry in the Outdoor Research Dry Ditty Sacks, sold in a set of 3.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jJgqniYDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TCZQAC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001TD9J04", "title": "Intech Approach Two- Way Chipper", "description": "While those around the green chip shots seem like they should be easy, for many of us, they’re the most difficult shots on the course to hit consistently well. Fortunately, Intech has designed a club built to provide everyday golfers with the type of reliability that everyone looks for around the greens. Made for left and right-handed players, the Two-Way Chipper is meant to be played like any low-lofted wedge. Simply put the ball back a bit in your stance, and you’ll be able to chip it close easier and more often than ever before.", "text": "Intech Approach Two- Way Chipper While those around the green chip shots seem like they should be easy, for many of us, they’re the most difficult shots on the course to hit consistently well. Fortunately, Intech has designed a club built to provide everyday golfers with the type of reliability that everyone looks for around the greens. Made for left and right-handed players, the Two-Way Chipper is meant to be played like any low-lofted wedge. Simply put the ball back a bit in your stance, and you’ll be able to chip it close easier and more often than ever before.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411xVihHynL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TD9J04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Irons", "Single Clubs"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B001TDUBYC", "title": "Tippmann 98 Custom Pro Flatline PS Barrel Paintball", "description": "", "text": "Tippmann 98 Custom Pro Flatline PS Barrel Paintball", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WgdDu1x6L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TDUBYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Barrels"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B001TE7CUM", "title": "Kershaw 1028OR Antelope Hunter II Knife", "description": "One of our most popular hunting knives now comes in safety orange. The Antelope Hunter II Orange features a robust, drop-point skinning blade of tough AUS8A stainless steel. The blade’s strength and curve enables quick skinning without damaging the meat. The Antelope Hunter II’s sturdy blade also handles the full range of field-cleaning chores with ease. In addition to its easy-to-find orange color, the Antelope Hunter II’s handle offers significant advantages. The injection-molded co-polymer handle is contoured to fit the hand and offers enhanced control, even in wet or slippery conditions. Includes a leather sheath.", "text": "Kershaw 1028OR Antelope Hunter II Knife One of our most popular hunting knives now comes in safety orange. The Antelope Hunter II Orange features a robust, drop-point skinning blade of tough AUS8A stainless steel. The blade’s strength and curve enables quick skinning without damaging the meat. The Antelope Hunter II’s sturdy blade also handles the full range of field-cleaning chores with ease. In addition to its easy-to-find orange color, the Antelope Hunter II’s handle offers significant advantages. The injection-molded co-polymer handle is contoured to fit the hand and offers enhanced control, even in wet or slippery conditions. Includes a leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Idwb6QIXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TE7CUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B001TE7O9Q", "title": "Hogue Winchester 1300 Overrubber Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Winchester 1300 Overrubber Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31v-DBWwLdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TE7O9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 24.07}}
{"item_id": "B001TE9MAA", "title": "Hogue Stock Remington 870 Overrubber Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Remington 870 Overrubber Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31trYijM2KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TE9MAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 18.52}}
{"item_id": "B001TEBMG2", "title": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Shotgun Stock Kit with Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21j-RTASPVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TEBMG2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 63.19}}
{"item_id": "B001TEBPZA", "title": "Fobus Double Magazine Pouch .22, .380, .32", "description": "Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "text": "Fobus Double Magazine Pouch .22, .380, .32 Made of a unique high-tech injection molded plastic, these magazine holders offer a fit that is impossible to duplicate with leather or other materials. They offer security and comfort with unbelievable retention. Lightweight and impervious to hot or cold weather, they will provide a lifetime of maintenance-free use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qw2ReSXzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TEBPZA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.88}}
{"item_id": "B001TECT4Q", "title": "Kershaw Ram Knife with Black Tungsten DLC Coated Blade", "description": "When a knife is this bold, safety is a key consideration. That’s where the Hawk-Lock® on Kershaw’s new all-black R.A.M. (Restraint Articulated Mechanism) comes in. The patent-pending Hawk-Lock® keeps the R.A.M.’s Tungsten DLC coated blade exactly where the knife user wants it—either securely locked inside the handle for carrying, or safely locked into position for use. The R.A.M. features Flipper ambidextrous opening, as well as built-in thumb knobs for fast and easy opening. To close the blade, unlock the Hawk-Lock® and fold the blade in. This unique technology led Blade Magazine to name the original R.A.M. as 2007’s Most Innovative American Design. Includes removable/reversible, 3-position pocket clip.", "text": "Kershaw Ram Knife with Black Tungsten DLC Coated Blade When a knife is this bold, safety is a key consideration. That’s where the Hawk-Lock® on Kershaw’s new all-black R.A.M. (Restraint Articulated Mechanism) comes in. The patent-pending Hawk-Lock® keeps the R.A.M.’s Tungsten DLC coated blade exactly where the knife user wants it—either securely locked inside the handle for carrying, or safely locked into position for use. The R.A.M. features Flipper ambidextrous opening, as well as built-in thumb knobs for fast and easy opening. To close the blade, unlock the Hawk-Lock® and fold the blade in. This unique technology led Blade Magazine to name the original R.A.M. as 2007’s Most Innovative American Design. Includes removable/reversible, 3-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31faZXCnlxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TECT4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TED2PG", "title": "HOGUE shotgun stock, O.M. series soft rubber over molded stock", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "HOGUE shotgun stock, O.M. series soft rubber over molded stock OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21NI9aSIsoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TED2PG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 49.5}}
{"item_id": "B001TED2RO", "title": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Stock Mossberg 500 Overrubber Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mFCoPklnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TED2RO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 21.25}}
{"item_id": "B001TED9EK", "title": "Hogue 10/22 Overmolded Stock Rubber, Standard Barrel, Olive Drab Green", "description": "These Hogue rifle stocks for the Ruger 10/22 series of rifles are constructed of a reinforced polymer that has Hogue's popular OverMolded rubber on the exterior surfaces for unbeatable control and comfort while shooting. The construction of these stocks yields an extremely strong stock that is also quiet in the field. These stocks feature a factory barrel channel for a drop-in fit. The stock features sling studs and a recoil pad pre-installed for comfort and utility. Specifications: - Fits: 10-22 Rubber OverMolded™ Stock with Standard Barrel Channel - Color: OD Green", "text": "Hogue 10/22 Overmolded Stock Rubber, Standard Barrel, Olive Drab Green These Hogue rifle stocks for the Ruger 10/22 series of rifles are constructed of a reinforced polymer that has Hogue's popular OverMolded rubber on the exterior surfaces for unbeatable control and comfort while shooting. The construction of these stocks yields an extremely strong stock that is also quiet in the field. These stocks feature a factory barrel channel for a drop-in fit. The stock features sling studs and a recoil pad pre-installed for comfort and utility. Specifications: - Fits: 10-22 Rubber OverMolded™ Stock with Standard Barrel Channel - Color: OD Green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2197cUy5h0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TED9EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 88.68}}
{"item_id": "B001TF8UY8", "title": "GAS ONE Stainless Steel Portable Gas Stove UL and CSA List", "description": "Original Gasone stove from the manufacturer. The GS-3500 is CSA approved and UL listed for higher level of safety standards. This stove uses standard 8oz butane canisters (sold separately) and is perfect for any outdoor occasion. With the included black carrying case and color box packaging, it also makes a great gift idea. For optimal results, use with Gasone butane canisters. Dimensions: 12.8 in x 10.9 in x 3.6 in Weight: 3.3 lbs. Safety features: Safety shut-off device, Safety joint, Safety cartridge setting device, Safety governor system (Silver Color).", "text": "GAS ONE Stainless Steel Portable Gas Stove UL and CSA List Original Gasone stove from the manufacturer. The GS-3500 is CSA approved and UL listed for higher level of safety standards. This stove uses standard 8oz butane canisters (sold separately) and is perfect for any outdoor occasion. With the included black carrying case and color box packaging, it also makes a great gift idea. For optimal results, use with Gasone butane canisters. Dimensions: 12.8 in x 10.9 in x 3.6 in Weight: 3.3 lbs. Safety features: Safety shut-off device, Safety joint, Safety cartridge setting device, Safety governor system (Silver Color).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rzk-wxyvL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TF8UY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GasOne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B001TG79JE", "title": "Olive Drab Recon Butt Pack", "description": "RECON Butt Pack: Three outer pockets with cord-lock ties and quick-release buckles. MOLLE compatible or for use with ALICE clips. Main compartment with 2-way zipper and rain flap.", "text": "Olive Drab Recon Butt Pack RECON Butt Pack: Three outer pockets with cord-lock ties and quick-release buckles. MOLLE compatible or for use with ALICE clips. Main compartment with 2-way zipper and rain flap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J-N6vaCZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TG79JE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B001TH6Q1K", "title": "Guardian Gear Terylene Dog Training Treat Bag, Blue", "description": "Training dog treat bag can be worn around the waist or clipped to a pocket or belt loop to keep treats handy during agility training sessions. The main pouch has a stay-open spring hinge top that snaps shut to keep treats securely stored. Water-resistant bag has a key ring and two additional pockets for storing supplies and personal items. Bag measures 8 3/4-inch length by 6 3/4-inch width by 3 1/2-inch height and adjust to fit waists up to 50-inch. Available in blue color.", "text": "Guardian Gear Terylene Dog Training Treat Bag, Blue Training dog treat bag can be worn around the waist or clipped to a pocket or belt loop to keep treats handy during agility training sessions. The main pouch has a stay-open spring hinge top that snaps shut to keep treats securely stored. Water-resistant bag has a key ring and two additional pockets for storing supplies and personal items. Bag measures 8 3/4-inch length by 6 3/4-inch width by 3 1/2-inch height and adjust to fit waists up to 50-inch. Available in blue color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Lkl%2BPHR1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TH6Q1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guardian", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Dog Equipment"]], "price": 13.25}}
{"item_id": "B001TH9ZEK", "title": "BARSKA 10-40X50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope", "description": "One of Barska's most versatile riflescopes, the Varmint is available in a wide selection of sizes and reticles, making it ideal for varmint hunting, target shooting, long-range and precision shooting, and more. This particular scope, for instance, offers a magnification of 10x to 40x and a 50mm objective lens, helping you hit targets from extremely long distances. All Varmint scopes feature adjustable objectives (AO) for parallax correction and unsurpassed accuracy, as well as easy-grip extra-high windage and elevation turrets. The Varmint's large objective lens size, meanwhile, couples with the multicoated and fully multicoated optics to increase light transmission and provide superior image quality. Finally, the 10-40x50 comes with a target dot reticle, helping you line up your target with confidence. Other features include a waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof housing; a 1-inch tube construction; a quick-access magnification zoom ring; 1/8 MOA fingertip adjustments on select models; and scope caps.The 10-40x50 Varmint riflescope includes a target dot reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 10 to 40xObjective lens: 50mmReticle: Target dotField of view: 11 to 2.5 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 5 to 3mmEye relief: 3.6 inchesClick value: 1/8Tube diameter: 1 inchFinish: Black matteLength: 15.5 inchesWeight: 20.53 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 10-40X50 AO Varmint Target Dot Riflescope One of Barska's most versatile riflescopes, the Varmint is available in a wide selection of sizes and reticles, making it ideal for varmint hunting, target shooting, long-range and precision shooting, and more. This particular scope, for instance, offers a magnification of 10x to 40x and a 50mm objective lens, helping you hit targets from extremely long distances. All Varmint scopes feature adjustable objectives (AO) for parallax correction and unsurpassed accuracy, as well as easy-grip extra-high windage and elevation turrets. The Varmint's large objective lens size, meanwhile, couples with the multicoated and fully multicoated optics to increase light transmission and provide superior image quality. Finally, the 10-40x50 comes with a target dot reticle, helping you line up your target with confidence. Other features include a waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof housing; a 1-inch tube construction; a quick-access magnification zoom ring; 1/8 MOA fingertip adjustments on select models; and scope caps.The 10-40x50 Varmint riflescope includes a target dot reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 10 to 40xObjective lens: 50mmReticle: Target dotField of view: 11 to 2.5 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 5 to 3mmEye relief: 3.6 inchesClick value: 1/8Tube diameter: 1 inchFinish: Black matteLength: 15.5 inchesWeight: 20.53 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417WAw10MDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TH9ZEK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 109.49}}
{"item_id": "B001THBEPI", "title": "BARSKA 4x28 Electro Sight IR Mil-Dot Riflescope", "description": "Hailing from Barska's Electro sight series, this 4x28 IR scope is a terrific choice for tactical shooting from close range. The scope is equipped with a dual-color (red/green) mil-dot reticle, with a five-position rheostat knob that lets you adjust the brightness to five different levels. As a result, you can hunt confidently in both daytime and low-light conditions. The scope also offers integrated Weaver-style tactical 7/8-inch Picatinny rails that allow you to customize your scope. The rails work in combination with laser sights, secondary sights, and other accessories. And thanks to the 1/2-inch click-adjustable windage and elevation adjustments and the 4.52 inches of eye relief, you'll enjoy unmatched shooting accuracy. Other features include fully coated optics that produce crisp images, a 4x fixed magnification and 28mm objective lens, and a lithium battery. Want an electrifying hunting experience with lightning-quick target acquisition? Look no further than Barska's Electro sights.The 4x28 Electro tactical scope includes Weaver-style 7/8-inch Picatinny rails for customizing your sight.Specifications:Magnification: 4xObjective lens: 28mmReticle: Dual-color IR mil-dotField of view: 19.9 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 12mmEye relief: 4.52 inchesFinish: Black matteLength: 8 inchesWeight: 14.81 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 4x28 Electro Sight IR Mil-Dot Riflescope Hailing from Barska's Electro sight series, this 4x28 IR scope is a terrific choice for tactical shooting from close range. The scope is equipped with a dual-color (red/green) mil-dot reticle, with a five-position rheostat knob that lets you adjust the brightness to five different levels. As a result, you can hunt confidently in both daytime and low-light conditions. The scope also offers integrated Weaver-style tactical 7/8-inch Picatinny rails that allow you to customize your scope. The rails work in combination with laser sights, secondary sights, and other accessories. And thanks to the 1/2-inch click-adjustable windage and elevation adjustments and the 4.52 inches of eye relief, you'll enjoy unmatched shooting accuracy. Other features include fully coated optics that produce crisp images, a 4x fixed magnification and 28mm objective lens, and a lithium battery. Want an electrifying hunting experience with lightning-quick target acquisition? Look no further than Barska's Electro sights.The 4x28 Electro tactical scope includes Weaver-style 7/8-inch Picatinny rails for customizing your sight.Specifications:Magnification: 4xObjective lens: 28mmReticle: Dual-color IR mil-dotField of view: 19.9 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 12mmEye relief: 4.52 inchesFinish: Black matteLength: 8 inchesWeight: 14.81 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zk49p7hKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THBEPI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 70.0}}
{"item_id": "B001THHXA8", "title": "Big Bohica Kukhri Machete", "description": "This monster machete is equipped with a 13 1/2\" kukhri style blade with black baked finish. The impact resistant handle is thick and rugged for a tight, no-slip grip. Includes heavy-duty nylon sheath. 19\" overall", "text": "Big Bohica Kukhri Machete This monster machete is equipped with a 13 1/2\" kukhri style blade with black baked finish. The impact resistant handle is thick and rugged for a tight, no-slip grip. Includes heavy-duty nylon sheath. 19\" overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rzjU9bIkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THHXA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 11.64}}
{"item_id": "B001THHXDU", "title": "Medieval Broadsword", "description": "This collectible replica is crafted after a medieval short sword and will make a fine addition to your historical collection! This sword features a stainless steel 17\" traditional pattern blade. The cast metal handle offers an ornate guard and pommel along with a brown composite grip. This item measures 22 1/2\" overall and includes a coordinating black sheath. Tomahawk, XL1123.", "text": "Medieval Broadsword This collectible replica is crafted after a medieval short sword and will make a fine addition to your historical collection! This sword features a stainless steel 17\" traditional pattern blade. The cast metal handle offers an ornate guard and pommel along with a brown composite grip. This item measures 22 1/2\" overall and includes a coordinating black sheath. Tomahawk, XL1123.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QwedzOoPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THHXDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 27.15}}
{"item_id": "B001THIRQW", "title": "SS12 ScopeShield Neoprene Scope Cover", "description": "Created by Jon Stram of Anchorage, ScopeShield riflescope covers solved the problems which outfitters and their clients were having with flip-up style and all previous neoprene covers. They will not accidentally open, they will not snag and fall off in brush, they will not break, come partially or fully off in the rifle scabbard. Many outfitters now insist that flip-ups be removed, and issue their clients ScopeShield covers, just what their guides use.", "text": "SS12 ScopeShield Neoprene Scope Cover Created by Jon Stram of Anchorage, ScopeShield riflescope covers solved the problems which outfitters and their clients were having with flip-up style and all previous neoprene covers. They will not accidentally open, they will not snag and fall off in brush, they will not break, come partially or fully off in the rifle scabbard. Many outfitters now insist that flip-ups be removed, and issue their clients ScopeShield covers, just what their guides use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ubsWQHiJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THIRQW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001THO2Q6", "title": "Burris FastFire Red-Dot Reflex Sight with Picatinny Mount ( 4 MOA Dot Reticle)", "description": "The lightweight, low profile FastFire II features a light sensor that automatically adjusts the dot's brightness to the surrounding condition.The FastFire II from Burris dramatically increases firing speed and accuracy by simplifying the act of aiming, eliminating the need to focus on and align the front sight, rear sight, and target. With the FastFire, the aiming red dot and target are always in focus and properly aligned for ultimate accuracy. A small sight that mounts low and weighs just 1.6-ounces, the FastFire II is additionally the only fully waterproof unit in its product category.Constructed of metal for strength and durability, the FastFire II's lenses are precision-ground and polished to exacting geometries to virtually eliminate parallax and provide a clear, crisp sight picture. Fully windage and elevation adjustable and lockable, the sight features both an on/off switch and a light sensor that automatically adjusts the dot's brightness to the surrounding conditions. An included plastic hood covers the light sensor and puts the unit in sleep mode when the on/off switch is set to \"on.\" The Picatinny Mount allows mounting on just about any rifle, and special bases are available for most common firearms.WarrantyAll Burris products include a limited manufacturer's warranty, which varies by product. Warranty specifics will be included with your purchase.About BurrisBurris makes tools that let you take in every detail in the great outdoors. Binoculars engineered to penetrate the twilight, superb spotting scopes that get you up close and personal with the most elusive game, rugged rifle scopes so precise that long-range shots become second nature, and all at affordable prices. The company manufactures most of its products in the USA, in its own factory.", "text": "Burris FastFire Red-Dot Reflex Sight with Picatinny Mount ( 4 MOA Dot Reticle) The lightweight, low profile FastFire II features a light sensor that automatically adjusts the dot's brightness to the surrounding condition.The FastFire II from Burris dramatically increases firing speed and accuracy by simplifying the act of aiming, eliminating the need to focus on and align the front sight, rear sight, and target. With the FastFire, the aiming red dot and target are always in focus and properly aligned for ultimate accuracy. A small sight that mounts low and weighs just 1.6-ounces, the FastFire II is additionally the only fully waterproof unit in its product category.Constructed of metal for strength and durability, the FastFire II's lenses are precision-ground and polished to exacting geometries to virtually eliminate parallax and provide a clear, crisp sight picture. Fully windage and elevation adjustable and lockable, the sight features both an on/off switch and a light sensor that automatically adjusts the dot's brightness to the surrounding conditions. An included plastic hood covers the light sensor and puts the unit in sleep mode when the on/off switch is set to \"on.\" The Picatinny Mount allows mounting on just about any rifle, and special bases are available for most common firearms.WarrantyAll Burris products include a limited manufacturer's warranty, which varies by product. Warranty specifics will be included with your purchase.About BurrisBurris makes tools that let you take in every detail in the great outdoors. Binoculars engineered to penetrate the twilight, superb spotting scopes that get you up close and personal with the most elusive game, rugged rifle scopes so precise that long-range shots become second nature, and all at affordable prices. The company manufactures most of its products in the USA, in its own factory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ql1KLs6%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THO2Q6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 179.9}}
{"item_id": "B001THPILE", "title": "KA-BAR Dozier Mini Folder Knife, Pink", "description": "KA-BAR is proud to partner with the country's leading cancer research center and it's physicians. The sales of this product will help accelerate new breast cancer research to seek a cure", "text": "KA-BAR Dozier Mini Folder Knife, Pink KA-BAR is proud to partner with the country's leading cancer research center and it's physicians. The sales of this product will help accelerate new breast cancer research to seek a cure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Yyf9oUHVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001THPILE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 17.89}}
