{"item_id": "B001TI4XQO", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Men's Premium Neoprene 3mm Shorty", "description": "One of NeoSport's bestselling wetsuits, the 3mm Shorty is a versatile, all-around warm water wetsuit. It provides core warmth without overheating, making it ideal for snorkeling, diving, surfing, paddle sports, personal watercraft, tubing, and other water sports. Its back-zip design provides a comfortable, non-confining stretch fit, and flat lock seam construction is highly durable and helps prevent chafing. Other features include an adjustable collar, flat lock construction, #10 YKK zipper, internal key pocket, and flexible lycra edge trim.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Men's SizingXSSMLXLXXL3XLChest (inches)34-3636-3838-4040-4242-4444-4646-48Waist (inches)29-3131-3333-3535-3737-3939-4141-44Weight (pounds)125-135135-150150-170170-190190-210210-230230-250Height5'6\"5'8\"5'10\"5'11\"6'0\"6'1\"6'2\"", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Men's Premium Neoprene 3mm Shorty One of NeoSport's bestselling wetsuits, the 3mm Shorty is a versatile, all-around warm water wetsuit. It provides core warmth without overheating, making it ideal for snorkeling, diving, surfing, paddle sports, personal watercraft, tubing, and other water sports. Its back-zip design provides a comfortable, non-confining stretch fit, and flat lock seam construction is highly durable and helps prevent chafing. Other features include an adjustable collar, flat lock construction, #10 YKK zipper, internal key pocket, and flexible lycra edge trim.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Men's SizingXSSMLXLXXL3XLChest (inches)34-3636-3838-4040-4242-4444-4646-48Waist (inches)29-3131-3333-3535-3737-3939-4141-44Weight (pounds)125-135135-150150-170170-190190-210210-230230-250Height5'6\"5'8\"5'10\"5'11\"6'0\"6'1\"6'2\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Nn%2BniKJoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TI4XQO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TIBQ1Y", "title": "CycleAware Roadie Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror", "description": "Roadie is the sleek and aerodynamic bar-end mirror designed for road bikes. The simple ball and socket joint on Roadie allows you to install it on the left side or, if you prefer, both sides of the handlebars. Roadie takes just seconds to install -- just remove the existing road bar end plugs, insert the internal rubber socket and then simply insert Roadie into the socket.", "text": "CycleAware Roadie Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror Roadie is the sleek and aerodynamic bar-end mirror designed for road bikes. The simple ball and socket joint on Roadie allows you to install it on the left side or, if you prefer, both sides of the handlebars. Roadie takes just seconds to install -- just remove the existing road bar end plugs, insert the internal rubber socket and then simply insert Roadie into the socket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yJnXxVv6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TIBQ1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleAware", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 17.65}}
