{"item_id": "B001TIDWX4", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Black Rifle Case", "description": "If you need a high-quality protective carry case for your valuable firearms, then BLACKHAWK!'s Rifle Case is for you! It is constructed of abrasion- and mildew-resistant 1000 denier nylon and is padded with .375” closed-cell foam that absorbs the shock but not water. Features: Full wraparound carry handle and handle grabber; heavy-duty #9 YKK zipper and sliders; detachable, fully adjustable, padded shoulder strap; removable foam inserts; and full-opening for shooting mat configuration.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Black Rifle Case If you need a high-quality protective carry case for your valuable firearms, then BLACKHAWK!'s Rifle Case is for you! It is constructed of abrasion- and mildew-resistant 1000 denier nylon and is padded with .375” closed-cell foam that absorbs the shock but not water. Features: Full wraparound carry handle and handle grabber; heavy-duty #9 YKK zipper and sliders; detachable, fully adjustable, padded shoulder strap; removable foam inserts; and full-opening for shooting mat configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ML15zasPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TIDWX4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TIHCAS", "title": "Bill Moran Drop Point Folding Knife", "description": "The Spyderco Bill Moran Drop Point Folding Knife: Bill Moran is recognized as the grandfather of American custom knifemaking and the founding father of the American Bladesmith Society.", "text": "Bill Moran Drop Point Folding Knife The Spyderco Bill Moran Drop Point Folding Knife: Bill Moran is recognized as the grandfather of American custom knifemaking and the founding father of the American Bladesmith Society.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ok2AkGN%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TIHCAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 91.57}}
