{"item_id": "B001TINEJG", "title": "Lezyne Micro Caddy Saddle Bag", "description": "The Micro Caddy tucks underneath the saddle by wrapping around the saddle rails. The neoprene attachment band dampens vibration, creating a quieter and more secure connection. Water resistant zippers and reflective piping keep it ready for all weather. The Micro Caddy S is a small, yet capable saddle-bag that can fit all of the essentials for your road ride flat repair needs.", "text": "Lezyne Micro Caddy Saddle Bag The Micro Caddy tucks underneath the saddle by wrapping around the saddle rails. The neoprene attachment band dampens vibration, creating a quieter and more secure connection. Water resistant zippers and reflective piping keep it ready for all weather. The Micro Caddy S is a small, yet capable saddle-bag that can fit all of the essentials for your road ride flat repair needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pbYpdn1SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TINEJG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TK51HM", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Youth Premium Neoprene 2mm Youth's Shorty", "description": "These stylish neoprene shorties -- identical in construction and features to Mom and Dad's full-sized versions -- keep little ones comfortable in the water, while helping to shield them from UV rays, sea lice, jelly stings, and other irritants. Durable flat-lock stitching and a heavy-duty back zip stand up to the rigors of adventurous, water-bound kids, and parents will appreciate the affordable price.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Children's Sizing123468Height2'10\" - 3'1\"3'1\" - 3'5\"3'5\" - 3'9\"3'9\" - 4'2\"4'2\" - 4'5\"4'5\" - 4'8\"Weight (pounds)20-2525-3035-4040-5050-6060-75", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Youth Premium Neoprene 2mm Youth's Shorty These stylish neoprene shorties -- identical in construction and features to Mom and Dad's full-sized versions -- keep little ones comfortable in the water, while helping to shield them from UV rays, sea lice, jelly stings, and other irritants. Durable flat-lock stitching and a heavy-duty back zip stand up to the rigors of adventurous, water-bound kids, and parents will appreciate the affordable price.WarrantyNeoSport products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Children's Sizing123468Height2'10\" - 3'1\"3'1\" - 3'5\"3'5\" - 3'9\"3'9\" - 4'2\"4'2\" - 4'5\"4'5\" - 4'8\"Weight (pounds)20-2525-3035-4040-5050-6060-75", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31o4sUmA5GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TK51HM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Wetsuits"]]}}
