{"item_id": "B001TK765W", "title": "Allen Company Deluxe Tactical Range Bag", "description": "Removable padded handgun pocket. Internal compartment dividers. Web carry strap with shoulder gripper.", "text": "Allen Company Deluxe Tactical Range Bag Removable padded handgun pocket. Internal compartment dividers. Web carry strap with shoulder gripper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5190V9hfRRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TK765W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B001TK9CL8", "title": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Compact Contour IR 4A Mil Plex Riflescope", "description": "Offering performance that doesn't stop short, Barska's Contour series meets the hunter's demands by combining performance and innovation in a compact riflescope without sacrificing ruggedness, dependability, or craftsmanship. This particular scope, for instance, offers a magnification of 3 to 9x and a 40mm objective lens, helping you hit targets from short and medium ranges. Contour scopes offer low magnification ranges combined with long eye relief, making them ideal for close-range action--from crossbow hunting to pistol shooting even down to simple rimfire action. Contours are also engineered with an extra-rigid shockproof construction to handle the demands of pistols, shotguns, and other types of high-recoil firearms. And thanks to the waterproof and fogproof housing, the scope excels in all types of weather conditions. Other features include an ultra-compact housing, tactical rubber armor, a 1-inch tube construction, flip-up scope caps and rings, and an ultra-precise 4A mil-plex IR illuminated reticle.The 3-9x40 rubber-armored Contour riflescope includes flip-up scope caps and rings.Specifications:Magnification: 3 to 9xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: 4A mil-plex IRField of view: 12.5 to 37.7 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 4.4 to 13.3mmEye relief: 3 inchesClick value: 1/2Tube diameter: 1 inchFinish: Black matteLength: 8 inchesWeight: 14.81 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 3-9x40 Compact Contour IR 4A Mil Plex Riflescope Offering performance that doesn't stop short, Barska's Contour series meets the hunter's demands by combining performance and innovation in a compact riflescope without sacrificing ruggedness, dependability, or craftsmanship. This particular scope, for instance, offers a magnification of 3 to 9x and a 40mm objective lens, helping you hit targets from short and medium ranges. Contour scopes offer low magnification ranges combined with long eye relief, making them ideal for close-range action--from crossbow hunting to pistol shooting even down to simple rimfire action. Contours are also engineered with an extra-rigid shockproof construction to handle the demands of pistols, shotguns, and other types of high-recoil firearms. And thanks to the waterproof and fogproof housing, the scope excels in all types of weather conditions. Other features include an ultra-compact housing, tactical rubber armor, a 1-inch tube construction, flip-up scope caps and rings, and an ultra-precise 4A mil-plex IR illuminated reticle.The 3-9x40 rubber-armored Contour riflescope includes flip-up scope caps and rings.Specifications:Magnification: 3 to 9xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: 4A mil-plex IRField of view: 12.5 to 37.7 feet @ 1,000 yardsExit pupil: 4.4 to 13.3mmEye relief: 3 inchesClick value: 1/2Tube diameter: 1 inchFinish: Black matteLength: 8 inchesWeight: 14.81 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetimeAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HvYwf8wIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TK9CL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 87.36}}
{"item_id": "B001TKEU60", "title": "Allen Company Master Tactical Range Bag", "description": "Tactical meets practical. Padded Allen Range Bag is LESS! Everything organized and ready to go! The solution to keeping your handgun, ammo and shooting accessories fully portable and ready to rock 'n' roll is here. Introducing this handy Range Bag for the avid shooter. It's well made by the Allen Company, dedicated to committing itself to the outdoor industry for more than 30 years. Isn't it time to drop the \"old bag\" for this handsome carrier? Right now you can pocket BIG SAVINGS, due to our volume buy! It's sure to be at home on the range! Check it out: Heavy-duty nylon construction; Smooth-operating, lockable zippers; Removable ammo carry case; Two 7 x 8 x 2\" side pockets; 18 x 9 x 9\" main area; Removable, quick clip web carry strap with shoulder pad; 8 x 5\" end pocket; Removable 13 x 7\" handgun case; 7 x 8 x 2\" secondary end pocket; 16 x 9 x 2\" side pocket; Removable bag for fired brass. Fire in your order in right away for doorstep delivery! Order Now! Allen Tactical Range Bag, Black", "text": "Allen Company Master Tactical Range Bag Tactical meets practical. Padded Allen Range Bag is LESS! Everything organized and ready to go! The solution to keeping your handgun, ammo and shooting accessories fully portable and ready to rock 'n' roll is here. Introducing this handy Range Bag for the avid shooter. It's well made by the Allen Company, dedicated to committing itself to the outdoor industry for more than 30 years. Isn't it time to drop the \"old bag\" for this handsome carrier? Right now you can pocket BIG SAVINGS, due to our volume buy! It's sure to be at home on the range! Check it out: Heavy-duty nylon construction; Smooth-operating, lockable zippers; Removable ammo carry case; Two 7 x 8 x 2\" side pockets; 18 x 9 x 9\" main area; Removable, quick clip web carry strap with shoulder pad; 8 x 5\" end pocket; Removable 13 x 7\" handgun case; 7 x 8 x 2\" secondary end pocket; 16 x 9 x 2\" side pocket; Removable bag for fired brass. Fire in your order in right away for doorstep delivery! Order Now! Allen Tactical Range Bag, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AwE0-X4WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TKEU60.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 83.05}}
{"item_id": "B001TKF3ZC", "title": "Seasense Double Braid Nylon Dockline", "description": "Give your boat a sharp well-kept look with premium pre-spliced double braid nylon dock lines. Both the cover and the core are manufactured from the highest quality marine grade nylon giving you the strongest and easiest to handle line. Whipped on the splice and bitter end.", "text": "Seasense Double Braid Nylon Dockline Give your boat a sharp well-kept look with premium pre-spliced double braid nylon dock lines. Both the cover and the core are manufactured from the highest quality marine grade nylon giving you the strongest and easiest to handle line. Whipped on the splice and bitter end.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511jsAep66L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TKF3ZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Dock Lines & Rope"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TKFXMA", "title": "Shooting Chrony 7000129 Beta Master Chronograph, Blue", "description": "The Shooting Chrony's Beta Master Chrony includes the features of the Beta-Chrony chronograph plus a remote read-out-monitor that also functions as a remote control.", "text": "Shooting Chrony 7000129 Beta Master Chronograph, Blue The Shooting Chrony's Beta Master Chrony includes the features of the Beta-Chrony chronograph plus a remote read-out-monitor that also functions as a remote control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XfIAPtutL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TKFXMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooting Chrony", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 138.65}}
{"item_id": "B001TKG7RA", "title": "LaserLyte Pistol Bayonet (Black)", "description": "Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "text": "LaserLyte Pistol Bayonet (Black) Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qp39IbHOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TKG7RA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001TLL1UC", "title": "Buck Paradigm TM Avid Knife (Black/Silver, 4 3/8-Inch)", "description": "More and more knife users prefer the convenience of an assisted-opening knife. The Paradigm features our latest breakthrough in the patent-pending Shift Mechanism. This feature, incorporated into the Paradigm series, serves as an advanced locking mechanism through a rotating bolster that keep the blade from accidently opening or closing. With a slight glide of the bolster and a flick of the finger, this knife is easily opened. Combined with Buck's patented ASAP opening technology, the Shift Mechanism TM creates a knife that's ready the instant it's needed.", "text": "Buck Paradigm TM Avid Knife (Black/Silver, 4 3/8-Inch) More and more knife users prefer the convenience of an assisted-opening knife. The Paradigm features our latest breakthrough in the patent-pending Shift Mechanism. This feature, incorporated into the Paradigm series, serves as an advanced locking mechanism through a rotating bolster that keep the blade from accidently opening or closing. With a slight glide of the bolster and a flick of the finger, this knife is easily opened. Combined with Buck's patented ASAP opening technology, the Shift Mechanism TM creates a knife that's ready the instant it's needed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HPKfo6NdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TLL1UC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 75.61}}
{"item_id": "B001TMA6TS", "title": "FOX Transition Hard Shell Helmet", "description": "The Transition Hard Shell Helmet takes design cues from our Transition helmet, but uses an ABS outer shell with an EPS liner for a more traditional street style look. Suitable for dirt jumping, park riding, or aggressive trail riding.", "text": "FOX Transition Hard Shell Helmet The Transition Hard Shell Helmet takes design cues from our Transition helmet, but uses an ABS outer shell with an EPS liner for a more traditional street style look. Suitable for dirt jumping, park riding, or aggressive trail riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yAL9bzxML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TMA6TS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
