{"item_id": "B001TO1D48", "title": "Conntek 14340 RV Pigtail Adapter RV 30 Amp Male Plug To 15/20 Amp U.S Female Connector", "description": "RV Camp Power Pigtail Adapter Cord, 30A 125V RV Plug to 15/20A 125V Connector, Clear NEMA TT-30P to NEMA 5-15/20R Cable: 1.5FT STW 10/3 Approval: Plug, Connector, and STW: UL, C-UL", "text": "Conntek 14340 RV Pigtail Adapter RV 30 Amp Male Plug To 15/20 Amp U.S Female Connector RV Camp Power Pigtail Adapter Cord, 30A 125V RV Plug to 15/20A 125V Connector, Clear NEMA TT-30P to NEMA 5-15/20R Cable: 1.5FT STW 10/3 Approval: Plug, Connector, and STW: UL, C-UL", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qEtCFlttL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TO1D48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Conntek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Shore Power Cords"]], "price": 12.99}}
