{"item_id": "B001TOLNCK", "title": "Galco Draw-Ez Solution For Holsters", "description": "Draw-EZ is applied to the inside of your leather holster to shorten the break-in period and to provide a slicker draw. When applied sparingly to the interior surface of the leather pocket Draw-EZ will not be absorbed by the leather, alter the fit of the holster, or harm the finish on either the firearm or the holster.", "text": "Galco Draw-Ez Solution For Holsters Draw-EZ is applied to the inside of your leather holster to shorten the break-in period and to provide a slicker draw. When applied sparingly to the interior surface of the leather pocket Draw-EZ will not be absorbed by the leather, alter the fit of the holster, or harm the finish on either the firearm or the holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41laqHLY7%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TOLNCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 9.83}}
{"item_id": "B001TONIAK", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 5-Ounce Bottle Clamshell", "description": "In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Gun Bore Cleaning Solvent, 5-Ounce Bottle Clamshell In 1903, Frank August Hoppe mixed nine chemicals and created the most potent gun-cleaning solvent. Since then, the Hoppe’s brand has walked arm-in-arm with generations of hunters and shooters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4173GbpgUcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TONIAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.0}}
