{"item_id": "B001TZO5UQ", "title": "Bell iPulse LED Bike Torch", "description": "iPulse LED Bike Torch™ Advanced LED design. Incredibly bright, small in size. High Power LED and specialized reflector produce extremely bright light (1,700 Lux)Long Run Time. 28+ hour run time is nearly 9x longer than traditional Halogen and Xenon bike lights. 5,000 Hour Bulb Life. Constant on and flash modes. Requires 4 AAA batteries (not included).", "text": "Bell iPulse LED Bike Torch iPulse LED Bike Torch™ Advanced LED design. Incredibly bright, small in size. High Power LED and specialized reflector produce extremely bright light (1,700 Lux)Long Run Time. 28+ hour run time is nearly 9x longer than traditional Halogen and Xenon bike lights. 5,000 Hour Bulb Life. Constant on and flash modes. Requires 4 AAA batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415vrjtKWIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001TZO5UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 28.79}}
