{"item_id": "B001U3T5GG", "title": "M-Wave Alloy Bar Ends Pair", "description": "The M-Wave Alloy Handlebar End fits 22.2 diameter handlebars. It features an alloy construction with a black rubber grip and a silver polished clamp. The Handlebar End includes a comfortable anatomic shape for maximum control and black handlebar plugs.", "text": "M-Wave Alloy Bar Ends Pair The M-Wave Alloy Handlebar End fits 22.2 diameter handlebars. It features an alloy construction with a black rubber grip and a silver polished clamp. The Handlebar End includes a comfortable anatomic shape for maximum control and black handlebar plugs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318VacNEiIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U3T5GG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 11.12}}
{"item_id": "B001U4ZZPK", "title": "Blue Sea Systems 12 Volt Dash Socket", "description": "Corrosion resistant materials to ensure solid contact and low voltage drop Features watertight cap, easy installation and twist locks securely with plug Designed to withstand the rigors of wet environments and constant vibration.", "text": "Blue Sea Systems 12 Volt Dash Socket Corrosion resistant materials to ensure solid contact and low voltage drop Features watertight cap, easy installation and twist locks securely with plug Designed to withstand the rigors of wet environments and constant vibration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41orj6%2B4dIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U4ZZPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blue Sea Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment"]], "price": 10.87}}
{"item_id": "B001U6MJCK", "title": "US Military Surplus Army Molle II Sleep Carrier Bag BackPack", "description": "From Fort Bragg, NC. USA Military Surplus Molle II Sleep Carrier System. Please be advised all used military surplus quipment may have markings on them such as names, numbers, color paint, etc. Sometimes we may miss a imperfection and will do our best to provide the closest condition listed. Pictures listed may not be the exact item you receive, but are shown as illustrations. * Water resistant * Nylon material * Bag can be used as a tote bag if you put shoulder strap on side clips. (does not come with shoulder strap)", "text": "US Military Surplus Army Molle II Sleep Carrier Bag BackPack From Fort Bragg, NC. USA Military Surplus Molle II Sleep Carrier System. Please be advised all used military surplus quipment may have markings on them such as names, numbers, color paint, etc. Sometimes we may miss a imperfection and will do our best to provide the closest condition listed. Pictures listed may not be the exact item you receive, but are shown as illustrations. * Water resistant * Nylon material * Bag can be used as a tote bag if you put shoulder strap on side clips. (does not come with shoulder strap)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U1VCDT4oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U6MJCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Special Defense Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 17.8}}
{"item_id": "B001U7GX8K", "title": "Sightmark Triple Duty Universal Bore Sight (Red)", "description": "The Sightmark Triple Duty Universal Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles and pistols of all types. Simply place the arbor of the bore sight into the barrel of your weapon; the base will attach magnetically with the retractable arbor centering the bore sight automatically. A laser dot will show exactly where your gun is aiming making it easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark Triple Duty Universal bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the bore sight for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark Triple Duty Universal bore sight is protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Sightmark Triple Duty Universal Bore Sight (Red) The Sightmark Triple Duty Universal Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles and pistols of all types. Simply place the arbor of the bore sight into the barrel of your weapon; the base will attach magnetically with the retractable arbor centering the bore sight automatically. A laser dot will show exactly where your gun is aiming making it easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark Triple Duty Universal bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the bore sight for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark Triple Duty Universal bore sight is protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V%2B4TIs03L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U7GX8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 41.05}}
