{"item_id": "B001U9CWP6", "title": "Coleman 2000000236 Mallet w/Peg", "description": "Coleman Mallet with Peg Remover pounds 'em in and pulls 'em out! It's an all-in-one tool to help knock out the \"fun\" task of putting up your tent. The Mallet with Tent Peg Remover has a tough, heavy-duty ABS plastic body with a mallet end for driving tent stakes into the ground. The handle has convenient slot holes for stake removal when it's time to tear down. For plastic or steel pegs. Weighs 7.4 oz. Get yours now! Coleman Mallet with Peg Remover", "text": "Coleman 2000000236 Mallet w/Peg Coleman Mallet with Peg Remover pounds 'em in and pulls 'em out! It's an all-in-one tool to help knock out the \"fun\" task of putting up your tent. The Mallet with Tent Peg Remover has a tough, heavy-duty ABS plastic body with a mallet end for driving tent stakes into the ground. The handle has convenient slot holes for stake removal when it's time to tear down. For plastic or steel pegs. Weighs 7.4 oz. Get yours now! Coleman Mallet with Peg Remover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21D7fcti6eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U9CWP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B001U9YK8I", "title": "Birchwood Casey Save-It 12-Gauge Semi-Auto Shotgun Shell Catcher", "description": "Save-It Shell Catcher 12-Gauge Semi-Auto Shotguns The original Peterson Save-It Shell Catcher is back. An all-steel shotgun shell catcher that prevents empty hulls from being ejected through the receiver opening on semi-automatic shotguns and holds the empties for easy removal. One model works with all 12-gauge semi-auto shotguns. Simply peel off the double-faced tape to attach the unit to the gun's receiver. The semi-permanent adhesive can be removed if desired. Softly padded tape acts like a barrier, keeping the metal plate away from the gun. There is no movement or vibration to scratch the receiver's finish. The Save-It Shell Catcher is adjustable for different shot shell loads and guns if needed. Simply close or open the ends of the wire with no modifications to the gun. Save shells from hitting your neighbor on the range, hitting their expensive gun, causing distractions for you and other shooters and the empties from hitting the ground. Save the empties for reloading or having to pick them up later. Easy-to-use and works great.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Save-It 12-Gauge Semi-Auto Shotgun Shell Catcher Save-It Shell Catcher 12-Gauge Semi-Auto Shotguns The original Peterson Save-It Shell Catcher is back. An all-steel shotgun shell catcher that prevents empty hulls from being ejected through the receiver opening on semi-automatic shotguns and holds the empties for easy removal. One model works with all 12-gauge semi-auto shotguns. Simply peel off the double-faced tape to attach the unit to the gun's receiver. The semi-permanent adhesive can be removed if desired. Softly padded tape acts like a barrier, keeping the metal plate away from the gun. There is no movement or vibration to scratch the receiver's finish. The Save-It Shell Catcher is adjustable for different shot shell loads and guns if needed. Simply close or open the ends of the wire with no modifications to the gun. Save shells from hitting your neighbor on the range, hitting their expensive gun, causing distractions for you and other shooters and the empties from hitting the ground. Save the empties for reloading or having to pick them up later. Easy-to-use and works great.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41p1Kon1xqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U9YK8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B001U9YS6W", "title": "Pearce Grips PG-XD45+ Springfield Armory XD Series Plus Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-XD45+ grip extension replaces the magazine base plate and internal locking plate. The extension will add approximately one inch additional gripping surface and will add two rounds to the capacity of the magazine. The added length provides better control and comfort. They blend with the contours and texture of the handgun and have a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. Will not fit XDM frames.", "text": "Pearce Grips PG-XD45+ Springfield Armory XD Series Plus Grip Extension The Pearce PG-XD45+ grip extension replaces the magazine base plate and internal locking plate. The extension will add approximately one inch additional gripping surface and will add two rounds to the capacity of the magazine. The added length provides better control and comfort. They blend with the contours and texture of the handgun and have a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. Will not fit XDM frames.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QQ3B2VeOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U9YS6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B001U9Z60Y", "title": "Galco Stow-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32", "description": "Part of Galco's new Concealed Carry Lite line of holsters, the Stow-N-Go offers an exceptional combination of high performance, comfort and affordability. The Stow-N-Go's open top allows a very fast draw, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. A sturdy injection-molded nylon clip secures the holster onto the belt. The Stow-N-Go inside the pants holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. It can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Stow-N-Go fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Stow-N-Go is available in right hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Stow-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32 Part of Galco's new Concealed Carry Lite line of holsters, the Stow-N-Go offers an exceptional combination of high performance, comfort and affordability. The Stow-N-Go's open top allows a very fast draw, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. A sturdy injection-molded nylon clip secures the holster onto the belt. The Stow-N-Go inside the pants holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. It can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Stow-N-Go fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Stow-N-Go is available in right hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h-CqklFuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001U9Z60Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stow-N-Go", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 26.36}}
{"item_id": "B001UA6K9E", "title": "GSI Salt and Pepper Shaker", "description": "The GSI Salt and Pepper Shaker is a compact and lightweight solution for carrying salt and pepper or other spices while backpacking and camping. This camping salt and pepper shaker has waterproof screw caps that will keep contents fresh and dry, and a twin-compartment design that carries both salt and pepper in one convenient shaker. The caps and dispensing screens of the salt and pepper dispenser can be easily removed for cleaning and refilling. Keep it alongside your GSI flask when it's time for a tequila shot. I'm just saying. FEATURES of the Salt and Pepper Shaker by GSI Waterproof screw caps keep your salt and pepper dry Compact, twin-compartment design perfectly suited to carrying both salt and pepper, or other spices while backpacking Dispensing screens and caps remove easily for cleaning and refilling Ideal for use destination camping, gourmet backpacking and motorbivy SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 1 oz Material: Co-polyester Dimensions: 1.5\" x 1.5\" x 2.7\" Imported", "text": "GSI Salt and Pepper Shaker The GSI Salt and Pepper Shaker is a compact and lightweight solution for carrying salt and pepper or other spices while backpacking and camping. This camping salt and pepper shaker has waterproof screw caps that will keep contents fresh and dry, and a twin-compartment design that carries both salt and pepper in one convenient shaker. The caps and dispensing screens of the salt and pepper dispenser can be easily removed for cleaning and refilling. Keep it alongside your GSI flask when it's time for a tequila shot. I'm just saying. FEATURES of the Salt and Pepper Shaker by GSI Waterproof screw caps keep your salt and pepper dry Compact, twin-compartment design perfectly suited to carrying both salt and pepper, or other spices while backpacking Dispensing screens and caps remove easily for cleaning and refilling Ideal for use destination camping, gourmet backpacking and motorbivy SPECIFICATIONS: Weight: 1 oz Material: Co-polyester Dimensions: 1.5\" x 1.5\" x 2.7\" Imported", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KUezMPY%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UA6K9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 6.77}}
{"item_id": "B001UABDIC", "title": "MSR Alpine 4 Pot Set", "description": "Whether you're cooking for a group in a high-mountain base camp or rustling up some grub for a horde of hungry backpackers, the MSR Alpine 4 Stainless Steel Pot Cookset gives you what you need to cook large meals for big groups. Three different pots all have their own lid that also doubles as a plate when some unexpected guests show up. The lightweight pot gripper makes quick work of transferring pots to and from the stove.", "text": "MSR Alpine 4 Pot Set Whether you're cooking for a group in a high-mountain base camp or rustling up some grub for a horde of hungry backpackers, the MSR Alpine 4 Stainless Steel Pot Cookset gives you what you need to cook large meals for big groups. Three different pots all have their own lid that also doubles as a plate when some unexpected guests show up. The lightweight pot gripper makes quick work of transferring pots to and from the stove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415eFQkJCoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UABDIC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B001UAMZD4", "title": "Gunvault MVB500 Microvault Biometric Pistol Gun Safe", "description": "Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes Keypad and Biometeric pad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. Choose the Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault when you need quick access storage for your handgun. We know that security and reliability are prevaling priorities when you need our products, and that's why gunVault pistol safes have the features you want: Improved high strength lock mechanism. Precise fittings virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes available. Audio feedback instantly confirms correct keypad entries. Audio disable feature allows \"stealth\" mode operation. Battery power for maximum security and easy portability. Tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts. Built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries. GunVault Biometric Technology: GunVault Bio uses biometrics, specifically fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. System can handle a maximum of thirty fingerprint templates between the enrolled fingerprint.", "text": "Gunvault MVB500 Microvault Biometric Pistol Gun Safe Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes Keypad and Biometeric pad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. Choose the Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault when you need quick access storage for your handgun. We know that security and reliability are prevaling priorities when you need our products, and that's why gunVault pistol safes have the features you want: Improved high strength lock mechanism. Precise fittings virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools. Over 12 million user selectable access codes available. Audio feedback instantly confirms correct keypad entries. Audio disable feature allows \"stealth\" mode operation. Battery power for maximum security and easy portability. Tamper indicator notes invalid entry attempts. Built in computer blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries. GunVault Biometric Technology: GunVault Bio uses biometrics, specifically fingerprint recognition, to access the safe contents. A high-performance algorithm is used to achieve speedy identification of enrolled fingerprints; and at the same time has a very low False Reject rate (FRR) for a given False Accept Rate (FAR). This self-learning algorithm of the GunVault Bio adds new minutiae to the fingerprint templates each time a user touches the finger print sensor, which decreases the likelihood of FRR, updates slight changes that might occur over time to an enrolled fingerprint, as well as to help distinguish variations. System can handle a maximum of thirty fingerprint templates between the enrolled fingerprint.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-DKQUyutL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UAMZD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GunVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 179.99}}
{"item_id": "B001UAOWJ4", "title": "Safariland Restraints Double Cuff Disposable Handcuffs (Pack of 10)", "description": "These disposable cuffs feature two individual cuffs rather than the standard single strap (cuff). Gives an officer the ability to control a suspect after one cuff is placed on the suspect's wrist/forearm. ½\" wide plastic strap so it will not cut into a suspect's wrist. Designed to cuff a suspect using standard handcuffing techniques. One Double Cuff™ does the job of two standard single-strap disposable cuffs. Double Cuff can be used to secure a suspect's legs at the ankles. One Double Cuff™ can be used to interlock into another Double Cuff™ through the slots in the locking head. Double Cuff™ can be used to secure a suspect to the railing of an ambulance cot to make transportation to a hospital safer for medical personnel, patient and officer. Double Cuff™ reduces stress in the suspect's shoulders while handcuffed from behind. A special metal cuff cutter is available. You can write on the white Double Cuff.", "text": "Safariland Restraints Double Cuff Disposable Handcuffs (Pack of 10) These disposable cuffs feature two individual cuffs rather than the standard single strap (cuff). Gives an officer the ability to control a suspect after one cuff is placed on the suspect's wrist/forearm. ½\" wide plastic strap so it will not cut into a suspect's wrist. Designed to cuff a suspect using standard handcuffing techniques. One Double Cuff™ does the job of two standard single-strap disposable cuffs. Double Cuff can be used to secure a suspect's legs at the ankles. One Double Cuff™ can be used to interlock into another Double Cuff™ through the slots in the locking head. Double Cuff™ can be used to secure a suspect to the railing of an ambulance cot to make transportation to a hospital safer for medical personnel, patient and officer. Double Cuff™ reduces stress in the suspect's shoulders while handcuffed from behind. A special metal cuff cutter is available. You can write on the white Double Cuff.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BFg8y7OzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UAOWJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 21.25}}
{"item_id": "B001UAWRQ4", "title": "3 Pairs of Choppers Glasses Padded Frame Lense Block 100% UVB for Outdoor Activity Sport", "description": "", "text": "3 Pairs of Choppers Glasses Padded Frame Lense Block 100% UVB for Outdoor Activity Sport", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U6tNuaITL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UAWRQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "G&amp;G", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Sunglasses"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Accessories", "Sunglasses & Eyewear Accessories", "Sunglasses"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Sunglasses & Eyewear Accessories", "Sunglasses"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001UC4IA0", "title": "Maxpedition Fliegerduffel Adventure Bag", "description": "Meets FAA Carry-On Bag Size Requirement. Perfect for the frequent flyer, the FLIEGERDUFFEL Adventure Bag is a unique travel bag sized properly to carry-on luggage dimensions.", "text": "Maxpedition Fliegerduffel Adventure Bag Meets FAA Carry-On Bag Size Requirement. Perfect for the frequent flyer, the FLIEGERDUFFEL Adventure Bag is a unique travel bag sized properly to carry-on luggage dimensions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o778-LUDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UC4IA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 199.95}}
{"item_id": "B001UCBSNU", "title": "Tennebrex Killflash 4 X 32 Rco Acog Scope Anti-Reflection Device", "description": "Trijicon Tennebrex killFLASH Anti-Reflection Device for 4x32 RCO ACOG Scope", "text": "Tennebrex Killflash 4 X 32 Rco Acog Scope Anti-Reflection Device Trijicon Tennebrex killFLASH Anti-Reflection Device for 4x32 RCO ACOG Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ax574BEfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UCBSNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ACOG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 47.67}}
{"item_id": "B001UE7D4Q", "title": "Andis Dual Voltage Cord/Cordless Hair Clipper (24140)", "description": "The Andis Dual Voltage Cord / Cordless clipper anchors an 18 piece home haircutting kit. The unique cord / cordless design allows for freedom from cords and can be used worldwide. The battery allows for one full hour of cordless run time. The clipper will easily power through wet or dry hair and is lightweight for comfortable, controlled clipper. In addition to the clipper, included in this kit are: 8 attachment combs, a How-to-DVD with easy to follow instructions, stainless steel scissors, a styling barber comb, a barber cape, a blade cleaning brush, lubricating blade oil, a protective blade guard, and stainless steel scissors. The kit all tucks away in a durable hard case for proper storage. Designed and engineered in the United States, Andis also offers a complete line of quality clippers and trimmers for consumers and animal grooming as well as a full line of wall mounted hair dryers for the hotel industry. Andis warrants its products to the original purchaser against defective material or workmanship for five years from the date of purchase. All implied warranties are also limited to five years. Andis will replace the product without cost to the consumer. The defective unit must be returned to: The Andis Co., 1800 Renaissance Blvd., Sturtevant, WI 53177. To reach a customer service representative, please call 1-800-558-9441.", "text": "Andis Dual Voltage Cord/Cordless Hair Clipper (24140) The Andis Dual Voltage Cord / Cordless clipper anchors an 18 piece home haircutting kit. The unique cord / cordless design allows for freedom from cords and can be used worldwide. The battery allows for one full hour of cordless run time. The clipper will easily power through wet or dry hair and is lightweight for comfortable, controlled clipper. In addition to the clipper, included in this kit are: 8 attachment combs, a How-to-DVD with easy to follow instructions, stainless steel scissors, a styling barber comb, a barber cape, a blade cleaning brush, lubricating blade oil, a protective blade guard, and stainless steel scissors. The kit all tucks away in a durable hard case for proper storage. Designed and engineered in the United States, Andis also offers a complete line of quality clippers and trimmers for consumers and animal grooming as well as a full line of wall mounted hair dryers for the hotel industry. Andis warrants its products to the original purchaser against defective material or workmanship for five years from the date of purchase. All implied warranties are also limited to five years. Andis will replace the product without cost to the consumer. The defective unit must be returned to: The Andis Co., 1800 Renaissance Blvd., Sturtevant, WI 53177. To reach a customer service representative, please call 1-800-558-9441.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PEdPlsrlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UE7D4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Andis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 34.94}}
{"item_id": "B001UE8DAO", "title": "Glacier Glove Gray Sunglove", "description": "The Dr. Shade sun glove is a fingerless glove for 100% dexterity. The glove is perfect for all outdoor activities like hiking and paddling. The 50+ UPF rating is the best rating for clothing. This material is tested by an independent lab in the USA and is certified as 50+ sun protection. This is a very comfortable glove and you will forget that you have it on.", "text": "Glacier Glove Gray Sunglove The Dr. Shade sun glove is a fingerless glove for 100% dexterity. The glove is perfect for all outdoor activities like hiking and paddling. The 50+ UPF rating is the best rating for clothing. This material is tested by an independent lab in the USA and is certified as 50+ sun protection. This is a very comfortable glove and you will forget that you have it on.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JGLWX9gaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UE8DAO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001UEAJBU", "title": "Bell Windstorm Floor Pump with Gauge", "description": "7015734 Features: -Floor foot pump.-Easy-to-read gauge.-Textured handle.-Textured base.-Clip mount.-Made in the USA.-21.25\" H x 8.75\" W x 4.5\" D, 1.87 lbs.", "text": "Bell Windstorm Floor Pump with Gauge 7015734 Features: -Floor foot pump.-Easy-to-read gauge.-Textured handle.-Textured base.-Clip mount.-Made in the USA.-21.25\" H x 8.75\" W x 4.5\" D, 1.87 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jKhU5mNQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UEAJBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 16.67}}
