{"item_id": "B001ULCHD6", "title": "Stanley RST-63005 AM/FM Earmuff with AUX Input", "description": "AM/FM radio earmuff with superior sound quality and excellent stereo reception. Easy toggle switch to change between AM and FM on side. Radio volume does not exceed 82 db. It's a lightweight design for all-day comfort, and its quick-click height adjustment remains fixed while wearing. Includes two AA batteries with 140 hours of battery life, and the automatic shut off feature after four hours helping preserve battery life. Battery replacement is easy. Noise Reduction Rating is 23 when radio is in off position.", "text": "Stanley RST-63005 AM/FM Earmuff with AUX Input AM/FM radio earmuff with superior sound quality and excellent stereo reception. Easy toggle switch to change between AM and FM on side. Radio volume does not exceed 82 db. It's a lightweight design for all-day comfort, and its quick-click height adjustment remains fixed while wearing. Includes two AA batteries with 140 hours of battery life, and the automatic shut off feature after four hours helping preserve battery life. Battery replacement is easy. Noise Reduction Rating is 23 when radio is in off position.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qFYFiORHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ULCHD6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 58.49}}
{"item_id": "B001ULCHDQ", "title": "Howard Leight QM24 Multiple Positioning Headband Earmuff", "description": "This Howard Light earmuff is an ultra-lightweight, multiple position, dielectric earmuff designed for extended wear at an affordable price. Multiple position headband for over-the-head, behind-the-head, or under-the-chin wearing. It's a good alternative to cap-mounted earmuffs when using other PPE, and the dielectric construction makes it suitable for electrical environments. Noise Reduction Rating is 25.", "text": "Howard Leight QM24 Multiple Positioning Headband Earmuff This Howard Light earmuff is an ultra-lightweight, multiple position, dielectric earmuff designed for extended wear at an affordable price. Multiple position headband for over-the-head, behind-the-head, or under-the-chin wearing. It's a good alternative to cap-mounted earmuffs when using other PPE, and the dielectric construction makes it suitable for electrical environments. Noise Reduction Rating is 25.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SiY3DoSeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ULCHDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Howard Leight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 4.13}}
{"item_id": "B001ULCHEA", "title": "Stanley RST-63008 Low Pressure Foam Earplugs 80-Pack Tube", "description": "Stanley low pressure foam earplugs ideal for long-term wear. 80 Pack tube. Noise Reduction Rating 32.", "text": "Stanley RST-63008 Low Pressure Foam Earplugs 80-Pack Tube Stanley low pressure foam earplugs ideal for long-term wear. 80 Pack tube. Noise Reduction Rating 32.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZxugkFgVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001ULCHEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stanley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 13.96}}
{"item_id": "B001UNX4Q8", "title": "Sure-Pak fully prepared MRE Meals (12 pack)", "description": "Because MRE's are strictly reserved for military use, SOPAKCO created Sure-Pak 12 Meals for public consumption, employing the same technologies they use to make the military meals", "text": "Sure-Pak fully prepared MRE Meals (12 pack) Because MRE's are strictly reserved for military use, SOPAKCO created Sure-Pak 12 Meals for public consumption, employing the same technologies they use to make the military meals", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aiPMRLeqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UNX4Q8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sopakco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B001UO9ZYC", "title": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 17, 22, 31 (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "text": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 17, 22, 31 (Black, Right-hand) Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417-gY7hIuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UO9ZYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 43.96}}
{"item_id": "B001UOFMQC", "title": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield", "description": "The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410MCXsl8AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UOFMQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 60.76}}
{"item_id": "B001UOHL2U", "title": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for Sig-Sauer P226, P220", "description": "The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for Sig-Sauer P226, P220 The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418WOKf1bAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UOHL2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 60.76}}
{"item_id": "B001UOHLCU", "title": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32 (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "text": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 19, 23, 32 (Black, Right-hand) Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416kkaEOJrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UOHLCU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 43.96}}
{"item_id": "B001UOHLDY", "title": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33", "description": "Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "text": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417-gY7hIuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UOHLDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 43.96}}
{"item_id": "B001UPU40K", "title": "Suisse Sport Yosemite 5 Person 2 Room Dome Tent 10' x 8'", "description": "Enjoy a little extra privacy when camping with friends with the Suisse Sport Yosemite two-room dome tent. Designed to sleep up to four people, the tent includes a removable divider that splits the tent in two. As a result, you can wall off other campers when changing clothes or sleeping, or you can remove the divider to create a single large room. The Yosemite also includes a double D door for easy entry and exit, along with a full four-point rainfly to keep you dry on moist evenings. And ventilation is always a concern in warm, muggy climates, which is why the tent includes three mesh zippered windows and a mesh ceiling. The tent measures 10 by 6 by 8 feet (W x H x D) and weighs roughly 13.65 pounds.", "text": "Suisse Sport Yosemite 5 Person 2 Room Dome Tent 10' x 8' Enjoy a little extra privacy when camping with friends with the Suisse Sport Yosemite two-room dome tent. Designed to sleep up to four people, the tent includes a removable divider that splits the tent in two. As a result, you can wall off other campers when changing clothes or sleeping, or you can remove the divider to create a single large room. The Yosemite also includes a double D door for easy entry and exit, along with a full four-point rainfly to keep you dry on moist evenings. And ventilation is always a concern in warm, muggy climates, which is why the tent includes three mesh zippered windows and a mesh ceiling. The tent measures 10 by 6 by 8 feet (W x H x D) and weighs roughly 13.65 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WuAId2sRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UPU40K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001UQ6E3K", "title": "Celestron 52229 60mm Refractor Zoom Spotting Scope", "description": "Refractor Series 2.4-Inch diameter spotting scope. 341 mm focal length f/5.7 . Fully coated optics 20-60x zoom eyepiece. Tabletop tripod", "text": "Celestron 52229 60mm Refractor Zoom Spotting Scope Refractor Series 2.4-Inch diameter spotting scope. 341 mm focal length f/5.7 . Fully coated optics 20-60x zoom eyepiece. Tabletop tripod", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MW2uQkaNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UQ6E3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Celestron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 84.95}}
{"item_id": "B001UQXAT6", "title": "HotHands Insole Foot Warmers (16 pairs)", "description": "HotHands Insole Foot Warmers are single use air-activated heat packs that provide everyday warmth and are ideal for keeping your feet warm when the temperature gets cold. These warmers provide safe, natural heat, so you can enjoy the great outdoors during those harsh winter months. The insole foot warmers are ultra-thin and measure the full length of an insole to keep your entire foot warm. Features: • Ultra thin • Ready to use • Air-activated • Safe, natural heat • Adhesive – It stays where you stick it! • Odorless • Each warmer provides up to 9 hours of heat How to use: Simply open the package, peel away the paper backing, and stick the warmers to the bottom of your sock. See package for detailed instructions. When to use: HotHands warmers are great for any occasion where long-lasting heat is desired. • Outdoor sports • Hunting & Fishing • Tailgating at events • Working in the yard • Taking the pet for a walk • Shopping or commuting to work", "text": "HotHands Insole Foot Warmers (16 pairs) HotHands Insole Foot Warmers are single use air-activated heat packs that provide everyday warmth and are ideal for keeping your feet warm when the temperature gets cold. These warmers provide safe, natural heat, so you can enjoy the great outdoors during those harsh winter months. The insole foot warmers are ultra-thin and measure the full length of an insole to keep your entire foot warm. Features: • Ultra thin • Ready to use • Air-activated • Safe, natural heat • Adhesive – It stays where you stick it! • Odorless • Each warmer provides up to 9 hours of heat How to use: Simply open the package, peel away the paper backing, and stick the warmers to the bottom of your sock. See package for detailed instructions. When to use: HotHands warmers are great for any occasion where long-lasting heat is desired. • Outdoor sports • Hunting & Fishing • Tailgating at events • Working in the yard • Taking the pet for a walk • Shopping or commuting to work", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515tgm6WV1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UQXAT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heatmax, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 49.5}}
{"item_id": "B001UVOG2G", "title": "SAM Medical Products Finger Splints (Orange, 5-Pack)", "description": "36\" SAM SPLINT FLAT FOLDIndispensable backcountry first aid gear. Just mold it to shape, wrap or strap it into place, and youre done. Transparent to X-rays. Firm and extra-firm ends allow different levels of resistance to motion, according to needs. Allows exercise without splint removal. Washable, reusable, waterproof, lightweight and compact. Can be rolled or folded for easy storage. Not affected by extreme temperatures.", "text": "SAM Medical Products Finger Splints (Orange, 5-Pack) 36\" SAM SPLINT FLAT FOLDIndispensable backcountry first aid gear. Just mold it to shape, wrap or strap it into place, and youre done. Transparent to X-rays. Firm and extra-firm ends allow different levels of resistance to motion, according to needs. Allows exercise without splint removal. Washable, reusable, waterproof, lightweight and compact. Can be rolled or folded for easy storage. Not affected by extreme temperatures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tU38tFmKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UVOG2G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SAM Medical Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B001UXQXSE", "title": "Flair Hair Men's Red Visor and Hair", "description": "Get your flair hair here what better way to show off your fun side than the flair hair visor, great for parties, gag gifts, a gift outing with friends, or anywhere that needs a little flair, take one home today", "text": "Flair Hair Men's Red Visor and Hair Get your flair hair here what better way to show off your fun side than the flair hair visor, great for parties, gag gifts, a gift outing with friends, or anywhere that needs a little flair, take one home today", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BCsYynFAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UXQXSE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flair Hair", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Clothing", "Men"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B001UYIDZY", "title": "Ninja Paintball 4500 PSI Carbon Fiber HPA Tanks w/ Regulator", "description": "Made in the USA. 68 cubic inch bottle and 4500 psi. 5 year Hydro. Available with your choice of regulator. DOT and TC approved. Call about PI approval. 10 1/2 inches long x 4 1/2 inches wide - 1 3/8 inches bottle to ASA. Weight with brass bonnet 2.7 pounds, with aluminum bonnet 2.6 pounds. Gives you 1200 shots per fill depending on marker.", "text": "Ninja Paintball 4500 PSI Carbon Fiber HPA Tanks w/ Regulator Made in the USA. 68 cubic inch bottle and 4500 psi. 5 year Hydro. Available with your choice of regulator. DOT and TC approved. Call about PI approval. 10 1/2 inches long x 4 1/2 inches wide - 1 3/8 inches bottle to ASA. Weight with brass bonnet 2.7 pounds, with aluminum bonnet 2.6 pounds. Gives you 1200 shots per fill depending on marker.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-jxmhgseL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UYIDZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts", "Tanks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001UZ26J2", "title": "McNett Sea Drops Anti-Fog & Lens Cleaner, (1.25 oz)", "description": "Safe for all glass and plastic lenses-will not harm surrounding silicone or rubber support frames. Sea Drops are designed for maximum dive mask defogging and quick, easy, in-field application. Also excellent for ski goggles, eye glasses, face masks, binoculars and telescopes. Not recommended for swim goggles. {:-)", "text": "McNett Sea Drops Anti-Fog & Lens Cleaner, (1.25 oz) Safe for all glass and plastic lenses-will not harm surrounding silicone or rubber support frames. Sea Drops are designed for maximum dive mask defogging and quick, easy, in-field application. Also excellent for ski goggles, eye glasses, face masks, binoculars and telescopes. Not recommended for swim goggles. {:-)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rgj9OeEtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001UZ26J2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Mask Defoggers"]], "price": 5.36}}
{"item_id": "B001V2CBIK", "title": "BLACKHAWK! KNOXX Axiom Ultra-Light Black Rifle Stock - Remington 700 BDL L/A", "description": "For pain-free accuracy, the BLACKHAWK! Axiom Ultra-Light Rifle Stock combines the benefits of dual recoil-compensation systems with the lightweight resilience of a fiberglass-reinforced forestock. Weighing in at only 2 lbs. 9 oz., this stock delivers remarkable comfort while shooting bolt-action rifles and draws out your rifle’s full accuracy potential without the punishing recoil found with most larger calibers. Available in Black and King's Desert Shadow Camo. Features: Dual recoil-compensation systems deliver maximum recoil reduction; rugged, fiberglass-reinforced polymer construction with aluminum pillar bedding; 11.25” to 15.25” length-of-pull; and a completely free-floated barrel channel that fits all barrel diameters.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! KNOXX Axiom Ultra-Light Black Rifle Stock - Remington 700 BDL L/A For pain-free accuracy, the BLACKHAWK! Axiom Ultra-Light Rifle Stock combines the benefits of dual recoil-compensation systems with the lightweight resilience of a fiberglass-reinforced forestock. Weighing in at only 2 lbs. 9 oz., this stock delivers remarkable comfort while shooting bolt-action rifles and draws out your rifle’s full accuracy potential without the punishing recoil found with most larger calibers. Available in Black and King's Desert Shadow Camo. Features: Dual recoil-compensation systems deliver maximum recoil reduction; rugged, fiberglass-reinforced polymer construction with aluminum pillar bedding; 11.25” to 15.25” length-of-pull; and a completely free-floated barrel channel that fits all barrel diameters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NF3A2wxkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2CBIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 178.41}}
{"item_id": "B001V2E0BQ", "title": "Buck Vantage 0346GYS TM Avid Knife (Charcoal, Large)", "description": "Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "text": "Buck Vantage 0346GYS TM Avid Knife (Charcoal, Large) Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EFh9DRTpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2E0BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001V2E0QG", "title": "Maxpedition Sitka Gearslinger", "description": "A one-strap design maximizes utility when the bag is rotated to the front of your body, and a ventilated, padded back keeps you comfortable.The Sitka Gearslinger is a practically indestructible, sling-style bag that allows you to \"swing\" the pack to the front while it's still being worn. Originally designed for military and law enforcement professionals in the field, the bag has a main compartment and hydration compartment which can accept CCW accessories, and the shoulder strap is designed to go over left shoulder for better weapon shouldering.Top and side handles offer numerous alternative carrying positions, while the PALS modular webbing throughout enables you to easily attach accessories. A water bottle pocket is sized to fit a standard 32-ounce Nalgene bottle.Specifications:Main compartment measures eight-by-three-by-15-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizersTop front compartment measures 7.5-by-two-by-four-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizersBottom front compartment measures 7.5-by-two-by-eight-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizers618-cubic-inch cargo capacityCompatible with 100-ounce hydration reservoirDurable Materials:1000-denier water- and abrasion-resistant ballistic nylon fabricTeflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceHigh strength zippers and zipper tracksUTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closuresTriple polyurethane-coated for water resistanceHigh tensile strength nylon webbingHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread#AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protectionInternal seams taped and finishedParacord zipper pullsDouble-stitched stress points", "text": "Maxpedition Sitka Gearslinger A one-strap design maximizes utility when the bag is rotated to the front of your body, and a ventilated, padded back keeps you comfortable.The Sitka Gearslinger is a practically indestructible, sling-style bag that allows you to \"swing\" the pack to the front while it's still being worn. Originally designed for military and law enforcement professionals in the field, the bag has a main compartment and hydration compartment which can accept CCW accessories, and the shoulder strap is designed to go over left shoulder for better weapon shouldering.Top and side handles offer numerous alternative carrying positions, while the PALS modular webbing throughout enables you to easily attach accessories. A water bottle pocket is sized to fit a standard 32-ounce Nalgene bottle.Specifications:Main compartment measures eight-by-three-by-15-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizersTop front compartment measures 7.5-by-two-by-four-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizersBottom front compartment measures 7.5-by-two-by-eight-inches (W x H x D), with internal organizers618-cubic-inch cargo capacityCompatible with 100-ounce hydration reservoirDurable Materials:1000-denier water- and abrasion-resistant ballistic nylon fabricTeflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceHigh strength zippers and zipper tracksUTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closuresTriple polyurethane-coated for water resistanceHigh tensile strength nylon webbingHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread#AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protectionInternal seams taped and finishedParacord zipper pullsDouble-stitched stress points", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zxP%2B586UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2E0QG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 106.31}}
{"item_id": "B001V2IAVC", "title": "Buck Vantage TM Pro Knife (Black/Silver, Large)", "description": "Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "text": "Buck Vantage TM Pro Knife (Black/Silver, Large) Buck's Vantages TM offer so many great features, it's hard to know where to begin. A good starting point is their ultra-smooth one hand opening through the use of a flipper of a thumb hole. The flipper works of fast, you would think these are assisted openers. The Vantages TM lock open using strong stainless steel liner and are actually built with dual liners for extra strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315mtgJJ6mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2IAVC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001V2IB5W", "title": "Maxpedition Kodiak Gearslinger", "description": "The Kodiak Gearslinger is our sling designed bag which allows the user to \"swing\" the pack to the front while the pack is still worn.", "text": "Maxpedition Kodiak Gearslinger The Kodiak Gearslinger is our sling designed bag which allows the user to \"swing\" the pack to the front while the pack is still worn.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OTrfToCgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2IB5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 137.29}}
{"item_id": "B001V2MDEC", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army One-Hand Sentinel Clip Non-Serrated Knife", "description": "Intended to be ready whenever you need it most, the Victorinox Swiss Army Sentinel Clip Knife comes prepared with its high-quality stainless steel locking blade and four other useful implements. The Sentinel offers 4 implements, a lifetime warranty and unsurpassed Swiss-Made quality and functionality.Length: 111mm.Width: 1.2\"..Wt. 2.5 oz..", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army One-Hand Sentinel Clip Non-Serrated Knife Intended to be ready whenever you need it most, the Victorinox Swiss Army Sentinel Clip Knife comes prepared with its high-quality stainless steel locking blade and four other useful implements. The Sentinel offers 4 implements, a lifetime warranty and unsurpassed Swiss-Made quality and functionality.Length: 111mm.Width: 1.2\"..Wt. 2.5 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BiVxIoHTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2MDEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B001V2P8X0", "title": "Remote Dual Preassure Switch for SureFire WeaponLights", "description": "The SureFire SR07 provides remote activation for any SureFire WeaponLight with a switch socket. Two switches-a momentary-on pressure pad switch and a constant-on pushbutton switch-are integrated with a snap-on clamp for easy attachment to your firearm's Picatinny rail forend. The seven-inch cable length works with most rifle/carbine applications.", "text": "Remote Dual Preassure Switch for SureFire WeaponLights The SureFire SR07 provides remote activation for any SureFire WeaponLight with a switch socket. Two switches-a momentary-on pressure pad switch and a constant-on pushbutton switch-are integrated with a snap-on clamp for easy attachment to your firearm's Picatinny rail forend. The seven-inch cable length works with most rifle/carbine applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QiBhHkFDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2P8X0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 77.0}}
{"item_id": "B001V2T1IS", "title": "Safariland Glock 26, 27 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Glock 26, 27 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418eh7-YOIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2T1IS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 42.27}}
