{"item_id": "B001V2X4WC", "title": "Surefire Nylon Quick-Detach Holster", "description": "Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster, featuring an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure. Quick-detach belt loop allows user to attach or remove holster without having to remove belt.", "text": "Surefire Nylon Quick-Detach Holster Heavy-duty Cordura nylon holster, featuring an extra-long retention flap with Velcro closure. Quick-detach belt loop allows user to attach or remove holster without having to remove belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418tqbCHRSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V2X4WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.35}}
