{"item_id": "B001V52ZYM", "title": "Promax V-brake Pad W/thread", "description": "The Promax Brake V-Brake Pads feature a threaded asymmetric design. They are 70 mm in length and include threaded nuts and bolts.", "text": "Promax V-brake Pad W/thread The Promax Brake V-Brake Pads feature a threaded asymmetric design. They are 70 mm in length and include threaded nuts and bolts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31v3AMOWBLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V52ZYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B001V57KKG", "title": "Ventura Mudguard Set 26\"-28\"", "description": "The Ventura Mudguard Set includes rear and front mudguards, which both prevent splash-ups and protect your tires during use. These mudguards are designed for use with 26in, 27in, or 28in tires. Each fender includes a variable clip-on system for V or cantilever brakes. They are constructed of durable plastic and feature reinforced sides for added support.", "text": "Ventura Mudguard Set 26\"-28\" The Ventura Mudguard Set includes rear and front mudguards, which both prevent splash-ups and protect your tires during use. These mudguards are designed for use with 26in, 27in, or 28in tires. Each fender includes a variable clip-on system for V or cantilever brakes. They are constructed of durable plastic and feature reinforced sides for added support.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412I0yDuapL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V57KKG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 9.46}}
