{"item_id": "B001V5A2M4", "title": "M-Wave Alloy Bicycle Suspension Seat Post with Clamp", "description": "This adjustable suspension bike seat pillar by M-Wave has a silver finish alloy clamp and tube. It measures approximately 11.8\" x 1\" (300mm x 25.4mm). It offers the option of adjustable preload and side play for a custom ride.", "text": "M-Wave Alloy Bicycle Suspension Seat Post with Clamp This adjustable suspension bike seat pillar by M-Wave has a silver finish alloy clamp and tube. It measures approximately 11.8\" x 1\" (300mm x 25.4mm). It offers the option of adjustable preload and side play for a custom ride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P4tRVLMiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V5A2M4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
