{"item_id": "B001V5CF38", "title": "Zoom 25.4mm Adjustable Stem", "description": "Project your handlebars out with the adjustable angle ahead-stem by Zoom. Made of 3D forged alloy with matte black sandblasted finish and silver sandblasted top clamp, it fits 25.4mm stems. Length: 105mm (approximately 4.13\").", "text": "Zoom 25.4mm Adjustable Stem Project your handlebars out with the adjustable angle ahead-stem by Zoom. Made of 3D forged alloy with matte black sandblasted finish and silver sandblasted top clamp, it fits 25.4mm stems. Length: 105mm (approximately 4.13\").", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cDn%2B6hoTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V5CF38.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Stems"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001V5G5HU", "title": "Promax V-brake Shoe 3 Color", "description": "The Promax 3-Color Brake Shoe provides multiple features for a great all around bicycle braking system! These alloy V-brake shoes include exchangeable 3-color rubbers. The black rubber provides high all around brake performance while the green offers excellent stopping power in wet conditions, and the brown lowers the noise level. Dont settle for one style of brake pad when you can have the benefits of 3 with the Promax 3-Color Brake Shoe!", "text": "Promax V-brake Shoe 3 Color The Promax 3-Color Brake Shoe provides multiple features for a great all around bicycle braking system! These alloy V-brake shoes include exchangeable 3-color rubbers. The black rubber provides high all around brake performance while the green offers excellent stopping power in wet conditions, and the brown lowers the noise level. Dont settle for one style of brake pad when you can have the benefits of 3 with the Promax 3-Color Brake Shoe!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-Fk-uXyRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V5G5HU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 13.49}}
