{"item_id": "B001V662ZY", "title": "Avenir Nylon Bicycle Cover (Mountain Bike)", "description": "Your bike takes enough abuse when you're riding -- be sure to keep it well protected when you're not, with this form-fitting nylon bike cover. Constructed of heavy-duty, tear- and rip-resistant material, the cover offers year-round protection from moisture and dust. It's designed and cut specifically to fit mountain bikes, and measures 27.5 by 42.5 by 69 inches (W x H x D). A hook and straps at the bottom of the cover keeps it in place, and a convenient zippered storage pouch is also included.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Nylon Bicycle Cover (Mountain Bike) Your bike takes enough abuse when you're riding -- be sure to keep it well protected when you're not, with this form-fitting nylon bike cover. Constructed of heavy-duty, tear- and rip-resistant material, the cover offers year-round protection from moisture and dust. It's designed and cut specifically to fit mountain bikes, and measures 27.5 by 42.5 by 69 inches (W x H x D). A hook and straps at the bottom of the cover keeps it in place, and a convenient zippered storage pouch is also included.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HYaHSQoSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V662ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Covers"]], "price": 21.23}}
{"item_id": "B001V6630S", "title": "Avenir Wicker Bicycle Basket with Black Velcro (8 - inch x 10 - inch x 7.5 - inch)", "description": "This classic, simple bike basket from Avenir is made of natural wicker, with a fold-down handle. It easily attaches in just moments with a hook and loop straps, enabling you to tote your books home from the library, groceries home from the market, and more.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Wicker Bicycle Basket with Black Velcro (8 - inch x 10 - inch x 7.5 - inch) This classic, simple bike basket from Avenir is made of natural wicker, with a fold-down handle. It easily attaches in just moments with a hook and loop straps, enabling you to tote your books home from the library, groceries home from the market, and more.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xpoHcsrML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V6630S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 13.45}}
{"item_id": "B001V67HTY", "title": "Ruger Blackhawk Combo air rifle", "description": "Ruger Blackhawk rifle spring-piston break-barrel single-shot. All-weather ambi composite stock fiber optic sights (fully adjustable rear) Includes 4x32 scope and mount. Ideal for plinking and dispatching rodents. 4x magnification 32-Millimeter objective lens 1 tube 1/4 MOA Duplex reticle Parallax setting unknown 29-Feet field of view at 100-Yards 3 eye relief 8-Millimeter exit pupil 13.2-Ounce. (with mount) 12.9 long. Includes 11-Millimeter dovetail rings. Other features nitrogen-filled shockproof Fog-proof, waterproof, wind-age and elevation adjustments Multiple lens coatings Matte black finish.", "text": "Ruger Blackhawk Combo air rifle Ruger Blackhawk rifle spring-piston break-barrel single-shot. All-weather ambi composite stock fiber optic sights (fully adjustable rear) Includes 4x32 scope and mount. Ideal for plinking and dispatching rodents. 4x magnification 32-Millimeter objective lens 1 tube 1/4 MOA Duplex reticle Parallax setting unknown 29-Feet field of view at 100-Yards 3 eye relief 8-Millimeter exit pupil 13.2-Ounce. (with mount) 12.9 long. Includes 11-Millimeter dovetail rings. Other features nitrogen-filled shockproof Fog-proof, waterproof, wind-age and elevation adjustments Multiple lens coatings Matte black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21KLyj-X4wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V67HTY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B001V687D4", "title": "Avenir Cargo Bicycle Trailer", "description": "A sturdy, handy companion on long bike trips or gear-loaded runs around town, the Avenir Cargo Bicycle Trailer lets you take it with you. Ideal for toting groceries, camping gear, sporting goods, or whatever else you need on your ride, the trailer features tool-free assembly right out of the box. Quick-release 20-inch wheels provide easy on-and-off when you need to store the trailer or pack it in the car, and rugged 420-denier nylon fabric resists all kinds of outdoor abuse. The trailer, which has a 77-pound cargo capacity, comes complete with rain cover and two-piece safety flag.", "text": "Avenir Cargo Bicycle Trailer A sturdy, handy companion on long bike trips or gear-loaded runs around town, the Avenir Cargo Bicycle Trailer lets you take it with you. Ideal for toting groceries, camping gear, sporting goods, or whatever else you need on your ride, the trailer features tool-free assembly right out of the box. Quick-release 20-inch wheels provide easy on-and-off when you need to store the trailer or pack it in the car, and rugged 420-denier nylon fabric resists all kinds of outdoor abuse. The trailer, which has a 77-pound cargo capacity, comes complete with rain cover and two-piece safety flag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VtttA1-rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V687D4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Cargo Trailers"]]}}
