{"item_id": "B001V6OF3A", "title": "Serfas Echelon Bar Tape", "description": "Serfas Bar Tape is designed to absorb the vibrations of the road, look cool, and most importantly - it's easy to install. It is 100% washable and available in many different styles.", "text": "Serfas Echelon Bar Tape Serfas Bar Tape is designed to absorb the vibrations of the road, look cool, and most importantly - it's easy to install. It is 100% washable and available in many different styles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f1MT7iLqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V6OF3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B001V7KT2U", "title": "Okuma SLV Graphite 4-Piece Fly Rod", "description": "Crafted from Okuma's latest IM-8 graphite, the SLV Series of Fly Rods are versatile, moderate-fast rods packed full of features.", "text": "Okuma SLV Graphite 4-Piece Fly Rod Crafted from Okuma's latest IM-8 graphite, the SLV Series of Fly Rods are versatile, moderate-fast rods packed full of features.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21DgB--pliL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V7KT2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Fly Fishing Rods"]], "price": 66.99}}
{"item_id": "B001V7MX5Q", "title": "Okuma Crisium Graphite 2-Piece Fly Rod", "description": "With a traditional build that includes a half wells grip, rosewood reel seat and stainless steel snake guides, Crisium fly rods are constructed for those who cast with a smooth and patient stroke. As reward for their patience, casters receive nearly effortless casting and exceptional protection of light tippets. Built in two-piece models from 7- to 9-feet in length, Crisium fly rods are exceptional on smaller waters where the quality of the presentation reaps greater rewards than casting distance.", "text": "Okuma Crisium Graphite 2-Piece Fly Rod With a traditional build that includes a half wells grip, rosewood reel seat and stainless steel snake guides, Crisium fly rods are constructed for those who cast with a smooth and patient stroke. As reward for their patience, casters receive nearly effortless casting and exceptional protection of light tippets. Built in two-piece models from 7- to 9-feet in length, Crisium fly rods are exceptional on smaller waters where the quality of the presentation reaps greater rewards than casting distance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/218ySA9Sg0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V7MX5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
