{"item_id": "B001V8FVJA", "title": "BONEShieldz Bomber Adult Helmet", "description": "It comes with adjustable chin straps which complies with CPSC safety standards. Also adjustable fit ring provides a dial size. It also complies with features like front intake vents, race-style exhaust diffusers, and rear exhaust vents.", "text": "BONEShieldz Bomber Adult Helmet It comes with adjustable chin straps which complies with CPSC safety standards. Also adjustable fit ring provides a dial size. It also complies with features like front intake vents, race-style exhaust diffusers, and rear exhaust vents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EkmpIlJ5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V8FVJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BoneShieldz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Helmets"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B001V9HENU", "title": "Bear Vault BV450 Solo Bear Resistant Food Canister", "description": "Nature is great. Until you get eaten by a bear. So next time you're on a solo trip into bear country, bring along the Bear Vault BV450 Bear Resistant Food Canister. With 440 cubic inches of space, this rugged polycarbonate container keeps up to four days worth of supplies and food out of the mouth of hungry bears. An extra-wide, tool-free opening and transparent design let you quickly find the grub you're looking for. Slip this lightweight Bear Vault canister into your pack or use the handy strap-guides to attach the BV450 to the outside of your pack and enjoy a safe trip.", "text": "Bear Vault BV450 Solo Bear Resistant Food Canister Nature is great. Until you get eaten by a bear. So next time you're on a solo trip into bear country, bring along the Bear Vault BV450 Bear Resistant Food Canister. With 440 cubic inches of space, this rugged polycarbonate container keeps up to four days worth of supplies and food out of the mouth of hungry bears. An extra-wide, tool-free opening and transparent design let you quickly find the grub you're looking for. Slip this lightweight Bear Vault canister into your pack or use the handy strap-guides to attach the BV450 to the outside of your pack and enjoy a safe trip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fshFQFYzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001V9HENU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BearVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B001VA0LSO", "title": "Rubber Cal Treadmill Mat", "description": "Designed to withstand heavy treadmill machines and protect subsurface floors, Rubber-Cal's Treadmill Mat is the perfect exercise equipment mat for any home gym fitness floor. When treadmills are in use, they vibrate, sending shock waves into the floor that bounce back up into the equipment. This can harm your expensive treadmill machines over time. by using this sturdy recycled rubber mat, the impact from the treadmill is absorbed into the mat. by reducing the amount of collision with the floors, this product also acts a protector mat for subfloors. for residential fitness rooms, this will keep your wood, laminate or tile floors from getting scratched or damaged. The treadmill mat also reduces noise to ensure a quieter workout area. This product is created from recycled rubber tire crumbs that are molded together to form a resilient floor. Completely made in the US, this rubber equipment mat is sustainable and durable. Tires are meant to withstand weathering and abrasive environments, two properties that are inherited down to our treadmill mat. with a high content of EPDM from the tire crumb, this exercise equipment mat is excellent for both indoor and outdoor use due to its excellent UV and Ozone resistance qualities. This rubber equipment mat is available in a 3/16-inch thickness in two sizes: 4 ft. by 6.5 ft. and 4 ft. by 7.5 ft. This mat for treadmill machines is will cover the footprint of most home or commercial treadmills. This is the most durable and sturdy treadmill mat in the market today.", "text": "Rubber Cal Treadmill Mat Designed to withstand heavy treadmill machines and protect subsurface floors, Rubber-Cal's Treadmill Mat is the perfect exercise equipment mat for any home gym fitness floor. When treadmills are in use, they vibrate, sending shock waves into the floor that bounce back up into the equipment. This can harm your expensive treadmill machines over time. by using this sturdy recycled rubber mat, the impact from the treadmill is absorbed into the mat. by reducing the amount of collision with the floors, this product also acts a protector mat for subfloors. for residential fitness rooms, this will keep your wood, laminate or tile floors from getting scratched or damaged. The treadmill mat also reduces noise to ensure a quieter workout area. This product is created from recycled rubber tire crumbs that are molded together to form a resilient floor. Completely made in the US, this rubber equipment mat is sustainable and durable. Tires are meant to withstand weathering and abrasive environments, two properties that are inherited down to our treadmill mat. with a high content of EPDM from the tire crumb, this exercise equipment mat is excellent for both indoor and outdoor use due to its excellent UV and Ozone resistance qualities. This rubber equipment mat is available in a 3/16-inch thickness in two sizes: 4 ft. by 6.5 ft. and 4 ft. by 7.5 ft. This mat for treadmill machines is will cover the footprint of most home or commercial treadmills. This is the most durable and sturdy treadmill mat in the market today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ux-pv234L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VA0LSO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]]}}
