{"item_id": "B001VC16LS", "title": "Slendertone Flex Pro Arms Muscle Training System", "description": "Enjoy firm and toned arms within four weeks with the Slendertone Flex Pro arms muscle training system. The easy-to-use upper arm toner employs Slendertone's patented Electronic Muscle Stimulation (EMS) technology to create strong, deep, comfortable contractions in your muscles.The Flex Pro arm training system uses electronic stimulation to tone and strengthen your biceps and triceps.EMS mimics the body's natural muscle movements by sending signals between the pads, engaging the nerves that control your muscles and causing them to contract naturally. As a result, you simply have to wear the system arms five times a week for four weeks to tone and strengthen your triceps and biceps without trudging to the gym on a regular basis. Equipped with three training programs (one each for conditioning, strength, and power), several gel pads, and a rechargeable handheld controller, the Flex Pro system can tone both arms at once using up to 99 intensity levels. There's no better way for your upper body to look its best. The Flex Pro training system fits upper arm sizes from 10 to 19.5 inches.About SlendertoneHeadquartered in Galway, Ireland, Bio Medical Research (BMR) manufactures and markets medical products under the Neurotech brand and consumer products under the Slendertone and ReVive brands. Slendertone is a world leader in providing products that improve muscle tone and body shape. The company produced the first toning belt to be cleared for market by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). In addition, all products are classified under the European Medical Device Directive. And Slendertone, which has sold more than 2.5 million toning belts worldwide, won the Irish Consumer Goods Export Award in 2005.", "text": "Slendertone Flex Pro Arms Muscle Training System Enjoy firm and toned arms within four weeks with the Slendertone Flex Pro arms muscle training system. The easy-to-use upper arm toner employs Slendertone's patented Electronic Muscle Stimulation (EMS) technology to create strong, deep, comfortable contractions in your muscles.The Flex Pro arm training system uses electronic stimulation to tone and strengthen your biceps and triceps.EMS mimics the body's natural muscle movements by sending signals between the pads, engaging the nerves that control your muscles and causing them to contract naturally. As a result, you simply have to wear the system arms five times a week for four weeks to tone and strengthen your triceps and biceps without trudging to the gym on a regular basis. Equipped with three training programs (one each for conditioning, strength, and power), several gel pads, and a rechargeable handheld controller, the Flex Pro system can tone both arms at once using up to 99 intensity levels. There's no better way for your upper body to look its best. The Flex Pro training system fits upper arm sizes from 10 to 19.5 inches.About SlendertoneHeadquartered in Galway, Ireland, Bio Medical Research (BMR) manufactures and markets medical products under the Neurotech brand and consumer products under the Slendertone and ReVive brands. Slendertone is a world leader in providing products that improve muscle tone and body shape. The company produced the first toning belt to be cleared for market by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). In addition, all products are classified under the European Medical Device Directive. And Slendertone, which has sold more than 2.5 million toning belts worldwide, won the Irish Consumer Goods Export Award in 2005.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RDiNiTU6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VC16LS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slendertone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 95.62}}
