{"item_id": "B001VE9RY4", "title": "ZFOsports® - 20LBS -UNISEX- Comfortable Exercise Adjustable Weighted Vest", "description": "This 20lbs weighted vest is designed to contour and stay tight to your body even under the most intense workouts. This adjustable weighted vest that's designed for both men and women is a great starter for people who wants a reliabe vest at a great price. It fits snuggly to your body, and allows you to move and breathe easy when you workout. Adjust the weight by adding or removing individual weighted bags to achieve desired weight. Fasten tight to the torso, molded, custom fit eliminates weight shifting during activities like power walking, polymeric, hill bounding, running, lateral drills and vertical jumps. Weighted vests are also used in the gym when performing squats, lunges, dips, pull-ups, push-ups, etc. Add resistance to training programs without compromising biomechanics. Increase Strength and Speed, Accelerate Weight Loss, Improve Respiration, Build muscle, Gain quickness and power.", "text": "ZFOsports® - 20LBS -UNISEX- Comfortable Exercise Adjustable Weighted Vest This 20lbs weighted vest is designed to contour and stay tight to your body even under the most intense workouts. This adjustable weighted vest that's designed for both men and women is a great starter for people who wants a reliabe vest at a great price. It fits snuggly to your body, and allows you to move and breathe easy when you workout. Adjust the weight by adding or removing individual weighted bags to achieve desired weight. Fasten tight to the torso, molded, custom fit eliminates weight shifting during activities like power walking, polymeric, hill bounding, running, lateral drills and vertical jumps. Weighted vests are also used in the gym when performing squats, lunges, dips, pull-ups, push-ups, etc. Add resistance to training programs without compromising biomechanics. Increase Strength and Speed, Accelerate Weight Loss, Improve Respiration, Build muscle, Gain quickness and power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zDSDA4whL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VE9RY4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Vests"]], "price": 33.96}}
{"item_id": "B001VIJLAU", "title": "UTG Deluxe Mesh Trap Shell Catcher", "description": "MAGAZINE AND ACCESSORY POUCHES, Deluxe Mesh Trap Shell Catcher – for AR15 and Compatible Rifles, Steel Framed with Wrap-around Synthetic Material Protection and Adjustable Velcro Attachement to Caprute Shells from Ejection Port, Zippered Pocket for Easy Access and Removal of Shell.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Mesh Trap Shell Catcher MAGAZINE AND ACCESSORY POUCHES, Deluxe Mesh Trap Shell Catcher – for AR15 and Compatible Rifles, Steel Framed with Wrap-around Synthetic Material Protection and Adjustable Velcro Attachement to Caprute Shells from Ejection Port, Zippered Pocket for Easy Access and Removal of Shell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51R30WVCdgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VIJLAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B001VIYJUM", "title": "Cold Steel Spartan Grivory Handle", "description": "The Spartans were a tough breed, trained from childhood in the art of war and inured to most privations, both mental and physical. Designed by Andrew Demko, the Cold Steel Spartan pays tribute to the Spartans' vivid history while accommodating the demands of a tamer, more sophisticated world. The knife starts with a 4-1/2-inch blade that evokes the classic Kopis of the ancients, with its characteristic re-curved edge, big belly, and sharp, acute point. The blade is hollow ground from Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel and has some similarities with a Kukri, including an edge that's always positioned at an angle to the cut to produce a deep sheering effect. However, because the point is narrower and more acute than most Kukri blades, the knife stabs almost as well as it cuts.The Spartan also echoes the ancient Kopis in its handle, which is designed to help the hand resist the pull of centrifugal force. As a result, the handle retards forward momentum when stabbing and backward movement when hammering or smashing with its pommel. The injection-molded Grivory handle is also heavily contoured for comfort, and features irregular fluting and a heavily textured surface finish. This creates an exceptionally effective grip.To ensure quick-draw opening, the Spartan features a dual thumb plate. You can use the plate to open the knife like a conventional one-handed opener, or snag it on the edge of a pocket during the draw stroke and open it automatically (the Spartan includes dual pocket clips to ensure ambidextrous carrying). Finally, the Spartan incorporates Cold Steel's Tri-Ad locking mechanism, which has proven under torture testing to be almost impervious to stress, strain, and shock. The mechanism is almost impossible to overcome, keeping you safe from accidental opening.SpecificationsBlade thickness: 4mmBlade length: 4-1/2 inchesSteel: Japanese AUS 8A stainlessHandle material: Grivory with steel linersHandle length: 6 inchesPocket/belt clip: Ambidextrous stainless Battle GearOverall length: 10-1/2 inchesWeight: 7.5 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel Spartan Grivory Handle The Spartans were a tough breed, trained from childhood in the art of war and inured to most privations, both mental and physical. Designed by Andrew Demko, the Cold Steel Spartan pays tribute to the Spartans' vivid history while accommodating the demands of a tamer, more sophisticated world. The knife starts with a 4-1/2-inch blade that evokes the classic Kopis of the ancients, with its characteristic re-curved edge, big belly, and sharp, acute point. The blade is hollow ground from Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel and has some similarities with a Kukri, including an edge that's always positioned at an angle to the cut to produce a deep sheering effect. However, because the point is narrower and more acute than most Kukri blades, the knife stabs almost as well as it cuts.The Spartan also echoes the ancient Kopis in its handle, which is designed to help the hand resist the pull of centrifugal force. As a result, the handle retards forward momentum when stabbing and backward movement when hammering or smashing with its pommel. The injection-molded Grivory handle is also heavily contoured for comfort, and features irregular fluting and a heavily textured surface finish. This creates an exceptionally effective grip.To ensure quick-draw opening, the Spartan features a dual thumb plate. You can use the plate to open the knife like a conventional one-handed opener, or snag it on the edge of a pocket during the draw stroke and open it automatically (the Spartan includes dual pocket clips to ensure ambidextrous carrying). Finally, the Spartan incorporates Cold Steel's Tri-Ad locking mechanism, which has proven under torture testing to be almost impervious to stress, strain, and shock. The mechanism is almost impossible to overcome, keeping you safe from accidental opening.SpecificationsBlade thickness: 4mmBlade length: 4-1/2 inchesSteel: Japanese AUS 8A stainlessHandle material: Grivory with steel linersHandle length: 6 inchesPocket/belt clip: Ambidextrous stainless Battle GearOverall length: 10-1/2 inchesWeight: 7.5 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tW7LTLBAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VIYJUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 57.82}}
{"item_id": "B001VIYJXE", "title": "Cold Steel Mini Lawman Black G-10 Handle with Black Blade", "description": "The drop point blade is “civilian friendly” in appearance yet big, wide and most importantly, pointed enough for any cutting or piercing task. made from japanese aus 8a stainless steel and hollow ground to a thin, hand-polished edge, it’s as sharp as a serpent’s tooth and will easily sever the toughest, most fibrous materials. to further protect it from rust and the constant exposure to inclement weather, it comes with a black, non-reflective teflon finish.", "text": "Cold Steel Mini Lawman Black G-10 Handle with Black Blade The drop point blade is “civilian friendly” in appearance yet big, wide and most importantly, pointed enough for any cutting or piercing task. made from japanese aus 8a stainless steel and hollow ground to a thin, hand-polished edge, it’s as sharp as a serpent’s tooth and will easily sever the toughest, most fibrous materials. to further protect it from rust and the constant exposure to inclement weather, it comes with a black, non-reflective teflon finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yQyahI41L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VIYJXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.7}}
{"item_id": "B001VJ3GM8", "title": "Evans Sports Gun Rack with Storage Compartment, Deer", "description": "The Evans Gun Rack measuring 21\"x5\"x28\" is made of solid native pine. It holds four guns and has a storage compartment to hold shells or other accessories. Comes fully assembled with deer imprint. Finishing and mounting hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "text": "Evans Sports Gun Rack with Storage Compartment, Deer The Evans Gun Rack measuring 21\"x5\"x28\" is made of solid native pine. It holds four guns and has a storage compartment to hold shells or other accessories. Comes fully assembled with deer imprint. Finishing and mounting hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XhfDm3mcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VJ3GM8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 44.98}}
{"item_id": "B001VJJYBU", "title": "Zoot Sports Men's Race-Day Belt", "description": "Zoot Race-Day Belt :: The Zoot Race Day Belt is the perfect accessory for a race of any distance. With ultra soft brushed elastic and spring-loaded toggles that fit any race number, this belt is ideal for triathletes and runners alike.", "text": "Zoot Sports Men's Race-Day Belt Zoot Race-Day Belt :: The Zoot Race Day Belt is the perfect accessory for a race of any distance. With ultra soft brushed elastic and spring-loaded toggles that fit any race number, this belt is ideal for triathletes and runners alike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gsjAnrVeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VJJYBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zoot Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]], "price": 7.19}}
{"item_id": "B001VJSLNM", "title": "Genuine Gi Canteen Cover - Od", "description": "This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "text": "Genuine Gi Canteen Cover - Od This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M4Q-ESY0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VJSLNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Military issue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B001VLFEDU", "title": "The Firm Wave Kit", "description": "The Firm Wave Kit is a personal gym system that helps you burn calories, while providing a great cardio workout. This kit includes three DVDs to help to tone abs, shape thighs, and tighten glutes. The Ride the WAVE DVD teaches proper exercise techniques to get you maximum results. The Speed Slimming SCULPT DVD is a targeted workout that trims and tones your body, while increasing your metabolism and helping to burn fat and calories during and after your workout. The Rock it OFF DVD is a total body fat-burning and strength-interval workout.The Firm Wave Kit also includes an accessory mat to stabilize and protect you, while you use the system and a Weight Loss Success Guide Book to offer you proper health habits and motivation through workouts.", "text": "The Firm Wave Kit The Firm Wave Kit is a personal gym system that helps you burn calories, while providing a great cardio workout. This kit includes three DVDs to help to tone abs, shape thighs, and tighten glutes. The Ride the WAVE DVD teaches proper exercise techniques to get you maximum results. The Speed Slimming SCULPT DVD is a targeted workout that trims and tones your body, while increasing your metabolism and helping to burn fat and calories during and after your workout. The Rock it OFF DVD is a total body fat-burning and strength-interval workout.The Firm Wave Kit also includes an accessory mat to stabilize and protect you, while you use the system and a Weight Loss Success Guide Book to offer you proper health habits and motivation through workouts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hcjYGFt%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VLFEDU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B001VMX5J4", "title": "Moultrie 6 Volt Deluxe Solar Panel", "description": "Ensure a continued source of power for your wildlife feeders and trail cameras with Moultrie's solar panel. Redesigned connections allow you to plug solar panel into game feeder or digital trail camera (compatible with cameras powered by 6-volt batteries only). Retro fitted with alligator clips for feeders and cameras purchased before June 2007. Trickle charge maintains battery life and will never overcharge 6-volt batteries. Redesigned connections allow you to plug solar panel into game feeder or digital trail camera (compatible with cameras powered by 6-volt batteries only) Retro fitted with alligator clips for feeders and cameras purchased before June 2007 Trickle charge maintains battery life and will never overcharge 6-volt", "text": "Moultrie 6 Volt Deluxe Solar Panel Ensure a continued source of power for your wildlife feeders and trail cameras with Moultrie's solar panel. Redesigned connections allow you to plug solar panel into game feeder or digital trail camera (compatible with cameras powered by 6-volt batteries only). Retro fitted with alligator clips for feeders and cameras purchased before June 2007. Trickle charge maintains battery life and will never overcharge 6-volt batteries. Redesigned connections allow you to plug solar panel into game feeder or digital trail camera (compatible with cameras powered by 6-volt batteries only) Retro fitted with alligator clips for feeders and cameras purchased before June 2007 Trickle charge maintains battery life and will never overcharge 6-volt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415t3AM6aQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VMX5J4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Feeders"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B001VNO4DY", "title": "Crane Suzu Lever Strike Bicycle Bell", "description": "A timeless design with a loud and clear tone.", "text": "Crane Suzu Lever Strike Bicycle Bell A timeless design with a loud and clear tone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q8V94nIHL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VNO4DY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Bells"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B001VQ5D4K", "title": "MSR Alpine Fry Pan", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the MSR Alpine Fry Pan Stainless steel fry pan with folding handle The SPECS of the MSR Alpine Fry Pan Weight: 11.4 oz / 323 g Dimension: 8 x 2\" / 20.3 x 5.1 cm", "text": "MSR Alpine Fry Pan DECENT FEATURES of the MSR Alpine Fry Pan Stainless steel fry pan with folding handle The SPECS of the MSR Alpine Fry Pan Weight: 11.4 oz / 323 g Dimension: 8 x 2\" / 20.3 x 5.1 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GrtH-nWJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VQ5D4K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B001VQB25E", "title": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Ozon Short Bibtight", "description": "High-end padded cycling bibtights for the medium to long distance road cyclist. They offer high functionality and comfort.", "text": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Ozon Short Bibtight High-end padded cycling bibtights for the medium to long distance road cyclist. They offer high functionality and comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pdksYpIzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VQB25E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001VQVWIG", "title": "Boker Cruel Girl Action Roper Folding Knife", "description": "This is the perfect tool for anyone that likes to get out in the field. The Action Roper by Boker has a tough AUS-8 stainless steel blade and a durable Zytel handle with a lanyard hole and pocket clip.", "text": "Boker Cruel Girl Action Roper Folding Knife This is the perfect tool for anyone that likes to get out in the field. The Action Roper by Boker has a tough AUS-8 stainless steel blade and a durable Zytel handle with a lanyard hole and pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21aZOg8E4qL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VQVWIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 29.21}}
{"item_id": "B001VRFXBC", "title": "Ninja Flexible Coil With Slide Check Remote", "description": "Coil With Slide Check Remote. Made in the USA. Extremely flexible. 3000psi working pressure. Works with any HPA or CO2 system. Aluminum slide check.", "text": "Ninja Flexible Coil With Slide Check Remote Coil With Slide Check Remote. Made in the USA. Extremely flexible. 3000psi working pressure. Works with any HPA or CO2 system. Aluminum slide check.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410AkfKgk9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VRFXBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ninja", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts", "Remotes"]], "price": 39.11}}
{"item_id": "B001VRMEQY", "title": "Park Tool Fr-5 Cassette Lockring Remover Tool", "description": "Use a chain whip and wrench with this tool to remove your bike's lockring and cassette. Fits Shimano, SRAM, SunRace, SunTour, Chris King, and other lockrings.", "text": "Park Tool Fr-5 Cassette Lockring Remover Tool Use a chain whip and wrench with this tool to remove your bike's lockring and cassette. Fits Shimano, SRAM, SunRace, SunTour, Chris King, and other lockrings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418wu7ivGIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VRMEQY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 6.85}}
{"item_id": "B001VRMN8S", "title": "Park Tool Shop Cone Wrench", "description": "Crack some nuts, repack the bearings, and lock it back together with Park Tool's Cone Wrench. With sizes ranging from 13mm to 28mm, this wrench will have you servicing hubs from sidewalk-ruling kids' bikes to work-horse ice-cream trikes.", "text": "Park Tool Shop Cone Wrench Crack some nuts, repack the bearings, and lock it back together with Park Tool's Cone Wrench. With sizes ranging from 13mm to 28mm, this wrench will have you servicing hubs from sidewalk-ruling kids' bikes to work-horse ice-cream trikes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31em7nockoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001VRMN8S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]]}}
