{"item_id": "B001WIUX88", "title": "Model 4/15 Tactical Rail Mount for Carry Handle- 12 Slots, STANAG", "description": "AR-15 Military Tactical Mount with STANAG Dimension", "text": "Model 4/15 Tactical Rail Mount for Carry Handle- 12 Slots, STANAG AR-15 Military Tactical Mount with STANAG Dimension", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41maxVpFHJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WIUX88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B001WIV0RQ", "title": "UTG M87 Tactical Mount", "description": "The M87 Tactical Mount fits Remington 870 shotgun 12 Ga. and compatibles and is made from aircraft aluminum with a matte black finish. It has a low profile with a see-through feature and a V cut on the top rail that allows for convenient use of iron sights. 14 Picatinny slots on top for scope applications and includes two locking bolts for replacing the original trigger pins.Features:Made from aircraft aluminum with matte black finishLow profile with see-through feature and V-cut on top rail for use with iron sights14 Picatinny slots on top For scope applicationsTwo locking bolts for replacing the original trigger pinsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 5.5 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 7.5 by 1.9 by 2.6 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG M87 Tactical Mount The M87 Tactical Mount fits Remington 870 shotgun 12 Ga. and compatibles and is made from aircraft aluminum with a matte black finish. It has a low profile with a see-through feature and a V cut on the top rail that allows for convenient use of iron sights. 14 Picatinny slots on top for scope applications and includes two locking bolts for replacing the original trigger pins.Features:Made from aircraft aluminum with matte black finishLow profile with see-through feature and V-cut on top rail for use with iron sights14 Picatinny slots on top For scope applicationsTwo locking bolts for replacing the original trigger pinsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 5.5 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 7.5 by 1.9 by 2.6 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j1hnxdfSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WIV0RQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 25.0}}
