{"item_id": "B001WIYQNG", "title": "UTG Weaver Picatinny Style Tactical Low Profile Mount MNT-MB500T", "description": "Designed for Mossberg Shotguns, this is a tactical, low-profile top rail mount for all scope applications. The mount offers and easy to install design and comes with screws for installation on Mossberg 500 Series and compatibles included. The mount measures 5.5 inches long with 13 slots on the rail for flexible eye relief.The mount offers 13 rail slots for flexible eye relief adjustment.", "text": "UTG Weaver Picatinny Style Tactical Low Profile Mount MNT-MB500T Designed for Mossberg Shotguns, this is a tactical, low-profile top rail mount for all scope applications. The mount offers and easy to install design and comes with screws for installation on Mossberg 500 Series and compatibles included. The mount measures 5.5 inches long with 13 slots on the rail for flexible eye relief.The mount offers 13 rail slots for flexible eye relief adjustment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Qn%2BMLf9uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WIYQNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B001WIYTUG", "title": "UTG Mosin Nagant Tri-Rail Mount", "description": "UTG Tactical Mosin Nagant Tri-Rail Mount–Features 2 Steel Adaptors on Rear Sight for Full Length & Carbine Rifles, Extended Top Rail with 17 Slots for Most Scopes, 2 Removable Side Mounts with 12 Slots/Each for Most Tactical Accessory Applications", "text": "UTG Mosin Nagant Tri-Rail Mount UTG Tactical Mosin Nagant Tri-Rail Mount–Features 2 Steel Adaptors on Rear Sight for Full Length & Carbine Rifles, Extended Top Rail with 17 Slots for Most Scopes, 2 Removable Side Mounts with 12 Slots/Each for Most Tactical Accessory Applications", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419ZjKDV2sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WIYTUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 32.97}}
{"item_id": "B001WJ09T0", "title": "UTG Universal Shotgun/Paintball Tri-Rail Barrel Mount (Each Rail with 5 Slots)", "description": "This Universal Shotgun/Paintball Tri-Rail Barrel Mount has 3 rails with 5 Picatinny slots on each rail and a solid aluminum construction with a matte black finish. It features a smart, three-piece design for clamping shotgun/paintball barrels and flashlight tubes and is compatible with firearms that have a barrel range of .75 to 1.1 inches. It's lightweight, at only 4.4 ounces.Features:Solid aluminum construction with matte black finishSmart 3-piece design for clamping shotgun/paintball barrel and flashlight tubeLength: 1.6 inchesSlots: 15; 5 on each railCompatible Firearm Barrel Range: .75 - 1.1 inches diameterFlashlight Clamping Range: Diameter .75 - 1.0 inchesSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 4.4 ouncesPieces: 3Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNumber of Rails: 3Dimensions: 1.6 by 2.4 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Universal Shotgun/Paintball Tri-Rail Barrel Mount (Each Rail with 5 Slots) This Universal Shotgun/Paintball Tri-Rail Barrel Mount has 3 rails with 5 Picatinny slots on each rail and a solid aluminum construction with a matte black finish. It features a smart, three-piece design for clamping shotgun/paintball barrels and flashlight tubes and is compatible with firearms that have a barrel range of .75 to 1.1 inches. It's lightweight, at only 4.4 ounces.Features:Solid aluminum construction with matte black finishSmart 3-piece design for clamping shotgun/paintball barrel and flashlight tubeLength: 1.6 inchesSlots: 15; 5 on each railCompatible Firearm Barrel Range: .75 - 1.1 inches diameterFlashlight Clamping Range: Diameter .75 - 1.0 inchesSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 4.4 ouncesPieces: 3Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNumber of Rails: 3Dimensions: 1.6 by 2.4 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417sVWQ2jWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WJ09T0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 24.95}}
