{"item_id": "B001WJ4J64", "title": "AccuShot Premium 1-Inch Weaver Style See-Thru 10mm Low-Profile Rings", "description": "Securely mount your riflescope to your weapon with these AccuShot 1-inch Weaver-style rings. Precision-machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy, the rings are tough and well built, with an anodized black matte finish that adds longevity. The rings are also low profile compared to other mounting rings, with a height that measures 10mm from the bottom to the lower half housing. Designed to fit all Picatinny/Weaver rails, the rings come with two friendly hex screws and a full-length locking plate to guarantee easy installation and a secure fit.", "text": "AccuShot Premium 1-Inch Weaver Style See-Thru 10mm Low-Profile Rings Securely mount your riflescope to your weapon with these AccuShot 1-inch Weaver-style rings. Precision-machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy, the rings are tough and well built, with an anodized black matte finish that adds longevity. The rings are also low profile compared to other mounting rings, with a height that measures 10mm from the bottom to the lower half housing. Designed to fit all Picatinny/Weaver rails, the rings come with two friendly hex screws and a full-length locking plate to guarantee easy installation and a secure fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KFBvDJsHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WJ4J64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AccuShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 9.03}}
