{"item_id": "B001WJ6VJ2", "title": "UTG Adjustable Leg Holster for Pistol with Non-Slip Strap/Buckle, Black", "description": "Holster your pistol or flashlight and always have it at the ready with this leg holster that's fully adjustable for height and tension. High-quality Velcro straps, a non-slip strap and quick-release buckle system round out the features with a tactical design, extra magazine attache, and a frame that fits most medium-to-large frame automatics, glocks, berettas, Taurus, Rugers, Sigs, M-1911s and other.Features:New Gen leg holster with composite paddingTactical design keeps gun in ready position; fully adjustable for height and tensionHigh-quality non-slip Velcro strap and quick-release buckle systemExtra magazine pouch attachedFits most medium-to-large frame pistols and flashlightsWeight: 0.5 poundsMaterial: PolyesterColor: Army DigitalAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Adjustable Leg Holster for Pistol with Non-Slip Strap/Buckle, Black Holster your pistol or flashlight and always have it at the ready with this leg holster that's fully adjustable for height and tension. High-quality Velcro straps, a non-slip strap and quick-release buckle system round out the features with a tactical design, extra magazine attache, and a frame that fits most medium-to-large frame automatics, glocks, berettas, Taurus, Rugers, Sigs, M-1911s and other.Features:New Gen leg holster with composite paddingTactical design keeps gun in ready position; fully adjustable for height and tensionHigh-quality non-slip Velcro strap and quick-release buckle systemExtra magazine pouch attachedFits most medium-to-large frame pistols and flashlightsWeight: 0.5 poundsMaterial: PolyesterColor: Army DigitalAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UMBnLpQfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WJ6VJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
