· [endif]Length: 4.8\";Color: BlackWarning:Avoid direct eye exposure. Follow battery safety procedures when you use your light or laser. Leaving operating lights in gun cases or any areas with minimal heat dissipation will cause overheating and battery explosion. Always make sure your light is off and will not be accidentally turned on during storage or transportation. For products equipped with pressure switch, improper placement of the pressure switch on your gun may activate your light or laser when stored in gun cases or other areas. Always make sure pressure switch is fastened to your firearm in a way where it will not be accidentally pressed to activate your light, causing overheating and safety concerns.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Tactical Flashlight [if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 [if gte mso 10]> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";} Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 [if gte mso 10]> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";} <![endif]Features:[if !supportLists]· [endif]UTG Tactical Weapon-mount Xenon Flashlight[if !supportLists]· [endif]Twist-on, Push-Button and Remote Pressure Switch Triple on/off System[if !supportLists]· [endif]Fully Adjustable from Flood-to-spot Focus[if !supportLists]· [endif]Integral Mounting Deck Specification:[if !supportLists]· [endif]Material: Aluminum[if !supportLists]· [endif]Flashlight Bulb Type: 6V Xenon Light Bulb[if !supportLists]· [endif]Flashlight Voltage(V): 6[if !supportLists]· [endif]Flashlight Max. Lumen(Lumens): 95[if !supportLists]· [endif]Flashlight Battery Operating Time: 70mins[if !supportLists]· [endif]Switch Operating Type: Push-button Momentary/Twist-on Permanent Switch[if !supportLists]· [endif]Flashlight Focus: Adjustable[if !supportLists]· [endif]Battery Type: CR123A Lithium Battery X2[if !supportLists]· [endif]Pressure Switch Included: Yes[if !supportLists]· [endif]Weight with Battery: 8.3 oz[if !supportLists]· [endif]Length: 4.8\";Color: BlackWarning:Avoid direct eye exposure. Follow battery safety procedures when you use your light or laser. Leaving operating lights in gun cases or any areas with minimal heat dissipation will cause overheating and battery explosion. Always make sure your light is off and will not be accidentally turned on during storage or transportation. For products equipped with pressure switch, improper placement of the pressure switch on your gun may activate your light or laser when stored in gun cases or other areas. Always make sure pressure switch is fastened to your firearm in a way where it will not be accidentally pressed to activate your light, causing overheating and safety concerns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mkl2tieFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WJ70EC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 29.89}}
{"item_id": "B001WJ72MW", "title": "UTG ZL337 Weapon-mount & Handheld Tactical Xenon Flashlight", "description": "The Zl337 UTG Combat Weapon-mount and Handheld Tactical Xenon Flashlight features a combat tactical front head, a twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch with triple on/off systems, and an interchangeable mounting deck. In addition, it has a rated rolling stop shoulder rated for law enforcement.Features:Twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch triple on/off systemsCombat tactical front headRemovable tactical flashlight mountLaw enforcement rated rolling stop shoulderInterchangeable mounting deckSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight with Battery: 9 ouncesFlashlight Bulb Type: 37mm Xenon IRBFlashlight Voltage(V): 9V; 3 Lithium batteriesFlashlight Max. Lumen(Lumens): 260 lumensFlashlight Battery Operating Time: 70 minutesSwitch Operating Type: Push-button momentary/twist-on permanent switchFlashlight Focus: PresetBattery Type: CR123A Lithium Battery X3Pressure Switch Included: YesDiameter: 1.07 inchesLength: 7 inchesColor: BlackWarning:Avoid direct eye exposure. Follow battery safety procedures when you use your light or laser. Leaving operating lights in gun cases or any areas with minimal heat dissipation will cause overheating and battery explosion. Always make sure your light is off and will not be accidentally turned on during storage or transportation. For products equipped with pressure switch, improper placement of the pressure switch on your gun may activate your light or laser when stored in gun cases or other areas. Always make sure pressure switch is fastened to your firearm in a way where it will not be accidentally pressed to activate your light, causing overheating, and safety concerns.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG ZL337 Weapon-mount & Handheld Tactical Xenon Flashlight The Zl337 UTG Combat Weapon-mount and Handheld Tactical Xenon Flashlight features a combat tactical front head, a twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch with triple on/off systems, and an interchangeable mounting deck. In addition, it has a rated rolling stop shoulder rated for law enforcement.Features:Twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch triple on/off systemsCombat tactical front headRemovable tactical flashlight mountLaw enforcement rated rolling stop shoulderInterchangeable mounting deckSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight with Battery: 9 ouncesFlashlight Bulb Type: 37mm Xenon IRBFlashlight Voltage(V): 9V; 3 Lithium batteriesFlashlight Max. Lumen(Lumens): 260 lumensFlashlight Battery Operating Time: 70 minutesSwitch Operating Type: Push-button momentary/twist-on permanent switchFlashlight Focus: PresetBattery Type: CR123A Lithium Battery X3Pressure Switch Included: YesDiameter: 1.07 inchesLength: 7 inchesColor: BlackWarning:Avoid direct eye exposure. Follow battery safety procedures when you use your light or laser. Leaving operating lights in gun cases or any areas with minimal heat dissipation will cause overheating and battery explosion. Always make sure your light is off and will not be accidentally turned on during storage or transportation. For products equipped with pressure switch, improper placement of the pressure switch on your gun may activate your light or laser when stored in gun cases or other areas. Always make sure pressure switch is fastened to your firearm in a way where it will not be accidentally pressed to activate your light, causing overheating, and safety concerns.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yBa%2BAUzXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WJ72MW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001WWWAA8", "title": "humangear GoToob Travel Bottle", "description": "", "text": "humangear GoToob Travel Bottle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215SfjyRMPL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001WWWAA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "humangear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Luggage & Travel Gear", "Travel Accessories", "Packing Organizers"]], "price": 8.9}}
{"item_id": "B001X5HS24", "title": "Surefire E1B Dual-Output LED Flashlight", "description": "The Backup is an ultra compact dual-output flashlight developed as a duty light for plainclothes officers or as a backup light for patrol officers as described in SureFire's Tactical Trinity system for law enforcement, but is also ideal for outdoor, self-defense, and everyday use. It features a virtually indestructible power-regulated LED emitter and a precision Total Internal Reflection (TIR) lens. The Backup's pushbutton tailcap switch lets you activate the flashlight and select an output level: press or click for an 80-lumen high beam—four times the light of a big two-D-cell flashlight, and more than enough to overwhelm an aggressor's night-adapted vision; release or click off and press or click again for a 5-lumen ultra long-runtime low beam that's perfect for reading a map, checking an ID, or navigating in the dark. The E1B Backup produces useful light levels for 37 hours. Smooth body styling minimizes pocket snag and pressure points when worn close to the body, and the two-way clip allows bezel-up or bezel-down carry.", "text": "Surefire E1B Dual-Output LED Flashlight The Backup is an ultra compact dual-output flashlight developed as a duty light for plainclothes officers or as a backup light for patrol officers as described in SureFire's Tactical Trinity system for law enforcement, but is also ideal for outdoor, self-defense, and everyday use. It features a virtually indestructible power-regulated LED emitter and a precision Total Internal Reflection (TIR) lens. The Backup's pushbutton tailcap switch lets you activate the flashlight and select an output level: press or click for an 80-lumen high beam—four times the light of a big two-D-cell flashlight, and more than enough to overwhelm an aggressor's night-adapted vision; release or click off and press or click again for a 5-lumen ultra long-runtime low beam that's perfect for reading a map, checking an ID, or navigating in the dark. The E1B Backup produces useful light levels for 37 hours. Smooth body styling minimizes pocket snag and pressure points when worn close to the body, and the two-way clip allows bezel-up or bezel-down carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lUu-R-pGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001X5HS24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 149.09}}
{"item_id": "B001XG5W80", "title": "UTG Deluxe See-Thru Riser Mount with Picatinny and STANAG Dimension", "description": "3rd Gen Deluxe See-Thru Riser Mount with Picatinny and STANAG Dimension", "text": "UTG Deluxe See-Thru Riser Mount with Picatinny and STANAG Dimension 3rd Gen Deluxe See-Thru Riser Mount with Picatinny and STANAG Dimension", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lnmexLYmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XG5W80.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 22.5}}
{"item_id": "B001XRPBOY", "title": "Everlast 70-Pound Poly Canvas Heavy Bag", "description": "70 lb. Everlast Poly Canvas black Heavy Bag with new webbing and adjustable chain system. Double end tie down feature. More durable than traditional canvas shell.", "text": "Everlast 70-Pound Poly Canvas Heavy Bag 70 lb. Everlast Poly Canvas black Heavy Bag with new webbing and adjustable chain system. Double end tie down feature. More durable than traditional canvas shell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21DdQ9SiXlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XRPBOY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 105.0}}
{"item_id": "B001XRTZPK", "title": "Finish Line Shop Quality Bicycle Chain Cleaner", "description": "", "text": "Finish Line Shop Quality Bicycle Chain Cleaner", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51k0kQW8cUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XRTZPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 19.16}}
{"item_id": "B001XRXZFG", "title": "Finish Line Ceramic WET Bicycle Chain Lube, 4-Ounce Drip Squeeze Bottle", "description": "Ceramic WET is Finish Line’s most advanced, effective racing lubricant. The wet-style synthetic lubricant is enhanced with nano-sized platelets of boron nitride and micron particles of fluoropolymer which build a ceramic coating on the frictional surfaces of a drivetrain over time. The lubricant optimizes drivetrain efficiency for both physiological and psychological advantages -- the smooth, quiet chain action preserves energy and can promote rider confidence, as well. The patented, fully waterproof lubricant can be used in all cycling disciplines, including road, track, cyclocross, and mountain biking.Application tips:Apply generously to clean chain (degrease, rinse with water, and dry)Work into chain, then wipe off excessReapply after first ride to complete ceramic coating processNote that the white ceramic particles may turn grey or black over time. This discoloration is normal, will not compromise performance, and the effect will lessen after several applications.Safety, Health, and the EnvironmentFinish Line's Ceramic WET Lubricant features an \"inherently biodegradable\" formulation, meaning between 20% and 60% of the product's base oils will degrade within 28 days once exposed to contact with common soil-borne bacterias. It's non-toxic when used in quantities and applications as intended, contains no carcinogenic or hazardous air polluting (HAP) ingredients, and emits no Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs). All ingredients used are listed with all major worldwide chemical inventories, and thus Ceramic WET conforms to all environmental regulations for use as intended. It contains no artificial dyes or fragrances, is non-flammable, and is packaged in recyclable HDPE #2 plastic squeeze bottles.", "text": "Finish Line Ceramic WET Bicycle Chain Lube, 4-Ounce Drip Squeeze Bottle Ceramic WET is Finish Line’s most advanced, effective racing lubricant. The wet-style synthetic lubricant is enhanced with nano-sized platelets of boron nitride and micron particles of fluoropolymer which build a ceramic coating on the frictional surfaces of a drivetrain over time. The lubricant optimizes drivetrain efficiency for both physiological and psychological advantages -- the smooth, quiet chain action preserves energy and can promote rider confidence, as well. The patented, fully waterproof lubricant can be used in all cycling disciplines, including road, track, cyclocross, and mountain biking.Application tips:Apply generously to clean chain (degrease, rinse with water, and dry)Work into chain, then wipe off excessReapply after first ride to complete ceramic coating processNote that the white ceramic particles may turn grey or black over time. This discoloration is normal, will not compromise performance, and the effect will lessen after several applications.Safety, Health, and the EnvironmentFinish Line's Ceramic WET Lubricant features an \"inherently biodegradable\" formulation, meaning between 20% and 60% of the product's base oils will degrade within 28 days once exposed to contact with common soil-borne bacterias. It's non-toxic when used in quantities and applications as intended, contains no carcinogenic or hazardous air polluting (HAP) ingredients, and emits no Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs). All ingredients used are listed with all major worldwide chemical inventories, and thus Ceramic WET conforms to all environmental regulations for use as intended. It contains no artificial dyes or fragrances, is non-flammable, and is packaged in recyclable HDPE #2 plastic squeeze bottles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41knrNdiQML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XRXZFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B001XSH8Z8", "title": "Rafter Mount Chin up Bar", "description": "Can be mounted in out of the way locations. Use for P 90 workout. Mounting hardware included.", "text": "Rafter Mount Chin up Bar Can be mounted in out of the way locations. Use for P 90 workout. Mounting hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21w2KcOHo9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XSH8Z8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 43.95}}
{"item_id": "B001XSN8M0", "title": "Everlast Double End Heavy Bag Anchor", "description": "The Everlast Double End Heavy Bag Anchor allows you to secure your heavy bag or double-end striking bag without having to drill holes in the floor or come up with other complicated solutions. Equipped with an easy-to-fill, heavy-duty laser welded PVC bladder with nylon reinforcements, the anchor holds up to 45-pounds of water for excellent stability. Built to last, the anchor is constructed with premium synthetic leather and reinforced with webbing that goes well with most heavy bags. Measuring 20 inches wide by 5 inches high, the Double End Heavy Bag Anchor is a durable, portable, and convenient solution for your boxing set up.", "text": "Everlast Double End Heavy Bag Anchor The Everlast Double End Heavy Bag Anchor allows you to secure your heavy bag or double-end striking bag without having to drill holes in the floor or come up with other complicated solutions. Equipped with an easy-to-fill, heavy-duty laser welded PVC bladder with nylon reinforcements, the anchor holds up to 45-pounds of water for excellent stability. Built to last, the anchor is constructed with premium synthetic leather and reinforced with webbing that goes well with most heavy bags. Measuring 20 inches wide by 5 inches high, the Double End Heavy Bag Anchor is a durable, portable, and convenient solution for your boxing set up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KdiSauGGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XSN8M0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 26.5}}
{"item_id": "B001XU09AM", "title": "USGI Military Surplus Army ALICE Combat Field Pack Backpack", "description": "From Fort Bragg, NC. US Military Surplus (ALICE) Combat Field Pack. Please be advised used military surplus equipment may have markings on them such as soldiers names, numbers, color stamp, etc. Sometimes we may miss a imperfection and will do our best to provide the closest condition listed. Pictures listed may not be the exact item you receive, but are shown as illustrations", "text": "USGI Military Surplus Army ALICE Combat Field Pack Backpack From Fort Bragg, NC. US Military Surplus (ALICE) Combat Field Pack. Please be advised used military surplus equipment may have markings on them such as soldiers names, numbers, color stamp, etc. Sometimes we may miss a imperfection and will do our best to provide the closest condition listed. Pictures listed may not be the exact item you receive, but are shown as illustrations", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P8Ixx1xvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XU09AM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B001XUEY30", "title": "USGI Military Surplus Army ALICE Field Pack Frame", "description": "Government Issue ALICE Field Pack Frame. This listing is for the frame only.", "text": "USGI Military Surplus Army ALICE Field Pack Frame Government Issue ALICE Field Pack Frame. This listing is for the frame only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uIKrL%2BPbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XUEY30.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B001XUF57E", "title": "Military Surplus Army ALICE Field Pack Quick Release Shoulder Straps Woodland", "description": "US Military (ALICE) Combat Field Pack Quick Release Shoulder Straps. Please be advised the manufacturer put thin white tape around shoulder straps that may leave glue residue, washes off with soap and water.", "text": "Military Surplus Army ALICE Field Pack Quick Release Shoulder Straps Woodland US Military (ALICE) Combat Field Pack Quick Release Shoulder Straps. Please be advised the manufacturer put thin white tape around shoulder straps that may leave glue residue, washes off with soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O7Tbif2%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B001XUF57E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Government Contractor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 22.5}}
