{"item_id": "B00202YT44", "title": "Primos Coyote Bear Buster Call", "description": "The Coyote Bear Buster reproduces the pitch, tone and volume of a deer-Feets bleat as deer communicate, and it reproduces the bawl of a fawn or a young deer in distress. It attracts coyotes, bears, foxes, bobcats, mountain lions, and other predators looking for an easy meal.", "text": "Primos Coyote Bear Buster Call The Coyote Bear Buster reproduces the pitch, tone and volume of a deer-Feets bleat as deer communicate, and it reproduces the bawl of a fawn or a young deer in distress. It attracts coyotes, bears, foxes, bobcats, mountain lions, and other predators looking for an easy meal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L%2BbcDWT-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00202YT44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Coyote"]], "price": 9.97}}
