{"item_id": "B0020FWCEK", "title": "Shiflett Steel Throwing Axe with Sheath", "description": "Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bullseye with ease. Includes custom sheath.", "text": "Shiflett Steel Throwing Axe with Sheath Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bullseye with ease. Includes custom sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jfhGSnvXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020FWCEK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0020GZ1QA", "title": "Ruger® Blackhawk® .177 cal. Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope", "description": "1,000 F.P.S. Ruger Blackhawk .177 cal. Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope, NEW FOR '09, ON SALE! Varmints, cans and targets, beware! This brand-new model is ready to deliver pellets with power and dead-on precision with a reliable Ruger quality build. Air power, done Ruger right: Break-barrel spring piston with easy single 30-lb. cocking effort, brings the 1,000 F.P.S. speed. No CO2 cartridges needed; 18 3/4\" precision crafted rifled barrel. It and the receiver are blued steel; Ambidextrous black weatherproof composite stock; Rubber recoil pad; Adjustable rear sight, fixed front sight, both high-visibility fiber optics; Comes with 4x32 mm air gun Scope with duplex reticle. F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 32'. Mount included; Automatic safety; 3.3-lb. trigger pull.; 44 4/5\" long, weighs 8 1/3 lbs. Shoot your order in fast, now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; Chicago, IL; MI; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Ruger Blackhawk .177 cal.Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope", "text": "Ruger® Blackhawk® .177 cal. Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope 1,000 F.P.S. Ruger Blackhawk .177 cal. Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope, NEW FOR '09, ON SALE! Varmints, cans and targets, beware! This brand-new model is ready to deliver pellets with power and dead-on precision with a reliable Ruger quality build. Air power, done Ruger right: Break-barrel spring piston with easy single 30-lb. cocking effort, brings the 1,000 F.P.S. speed. No CO2 cartridges needed; 18 3/4\" precision crafted rifled barrel. It and the receiver are blued steel; Ambidextrous black weatherproof composite stock; Rubber recoil pad; Adjustable rear sight, fixed front sight, both high-visibility fiber optics; Comes with 4x32 mm air gun Scope with duplex reticle. F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 32'. Mount included; Automatic safety; 3.3-lb. trigger pull.; 44 4/5\" long, weighs 8 1/3 lbs. Shoot your order in fast, now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; Chicago, IL; MI; New York City; NJ; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Ruger Blackhawk .177 cal.Air Rifle with 4x32 mm Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21yjjiADbUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020GZ1QA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 153.62}}
{"item_id": "B0020H2K7C", "title": "Victory Crossbow Bolts w/Dura Vanes Moon Nock 22\" 4\" Vanes 6 pk.", "description": "The Victory Xbolt is the perfect arrow for crossbow enthusiasts. Made with 100% carbon fiber and matched with a brass insert to achieve an Extreme Front of Center measurement for fantastic down range accuracy and penetration. The Xbolt comes standard with a brass insert and Bohning halfmoon nock. 22\" Length 6-Pack.", "text": "Victory Crossbow Bolts w/Dura Vanes Moon Nock 22\" 4\" Vanes 6 pk. The Victory Xbolt is the perfect arrow for crossbow enthusiasts. Made with 100% carbon fiber and matched with a brass insert to achieve an Extreme Front of Center measurement for fantastic down range accuracy and penetration. The Xbolt comes standard with a brass insert and Bohning halfmoon nock. 22\" Length 6-Pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31b4nJsG6WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020H2K7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victory Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Crossbow Bolts"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B0020HJVHE", "title": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black P32/P3AT/LCP w/CT LG Nylon N38BJG5Z0", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black P32/P3AT/LCP w/CT LG Nylon N38BJG5Z0 This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YH3ZR2RzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020HJVHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B0020HJVME", "title": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black Kahr PM9,PM40,MK9,MK40 Nylon N38BJMKZ0", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black Kahr PM9,PM40,MK9,MK40 Nylon N38BJMKZ0 This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PxXkbBPeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020HJVME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B0020HL1OK", "title": "DeSantis Pro Stealth Large Frame Auto Black", "description": "The N87 is made of premium padded ballistic nylon. The 1 3/4-Inch sturdy, powder coated black spring clip keeps this beauty securely anchored to your belt. A spare magazine pouch is standard for the auto loader models, and they are ambidextrous. The clip may be removed and inserted on opposite side for left hand carry. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Pro Stealth Large Frame Auto Black The N87 is made of premium padded ballistic nylon. The 1 3/4-Inch sturdy, powder coated black spring clip keeps this beauty securely anchored to your belt. A spare magazine pouch is standard for the auto loader models, and they are ambidextrous. The clip may be removed and inserted on opposite side for left hand carry. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518aWAgfL4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020HL1OK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.01}}
