{"item_id": "B0020M9G6A", "title": "Champion Gel Corded Ear Plugs with Case", "description": "Champion promotes safe shooting with their new hearing protection plugs. Available individually on a soft nylon cord or in bulk pack, these soft silicone gel plugs feature a firm inner stem to insert comfortably into a shooter’s ears for great auditory protection at an affordable price. Don’t let your passion for shooting damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "text": "Champion Gel Corded Ear Plugs with Case Champion promotes safe shooting with their new hearing protection plugs. Available individually on a soft nylon cord or in bulk pack, these soft silicone gel plugs feature a firm inner stem to insert comfortably into a shooter’s ears for great auditory protection at an affordable price. Don’t let your passion for shooting damage your hearing—rely on Champion protection when at the range or in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mX2Iao3QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020M9G6A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 4.25}}
