{"item_id": "B0020R399A", "title": "Proto Switch EL Goggle", "description": "The SwitchTM EL Goggle System has the same great features as the FS system, but is slightly different in its design. The EL system comes standard with a solid one-piece face mask and a single pane fog resistant lens. Additionally, the single pane triodial lens is treated with an exterior hard coat for abrasion resistance. The SwitchTM EL Goggle System is available in Black and Woodland Camo.", "text": "Proto Switch EL Goggle The SwitchTM EL Goggle System has the same great features as the FS system, but is slightly different in its design. The EL system comes standard with a solid one-piece face mask and a single pane fog resistant lens. Additionally, the single pane triodial lens is treated with an exterior hard coat for abrasion resistance. The SwitchTM EL Goggle System is available in Black and Woodland Camo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514DJ54FyPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0020R399A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Proto Paintball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00213DMUE", "title": "MIR® - 50LBS (SHORT STYLE) ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST", "description": "This MiR Weighted vest comes with a full set of weights that can be adjusted from 3 to 60lbs to increase the resistance adeptness. For the purpose of weight loss, the removable weights are located high on the torso to protect the stomach from pounding as you run and also is delicate to the whole body while exercising. The vest is made of heavy-duty 1200D reinforced nylon, featuring double padded shoulders for added comfort and mesh vented inside for breath ability. The padding is designed to be contoured to your shoulder for maximum comfort. The MiR Weighted Vests are completely adjustable for even more comfort. There are two adjustable straps that can be adjusted underneath so you can easily adjust the body length of the vest by sliding the straps up and down through the D-rings. To adjust the weight level, remove or transfer the weights from the packets which secure the weights with the durable Velcro weight closures.", "text": "MIR® - 50LBS (SHORT STYLE) ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST This MiR Weighted vest comes with a full set of weights that can be adjusted from 3 to 60lbs to increase the resistance adeptness. For the purpose of weight loss, the removable weights are located high on the torso to protect the stomach from pounding as you run and also is delicate to the whole body while exercising. The vest is made of heavy-duty 1200D reinforced nylon, featuring double padded shoulders for added comfort and mesh vented inside for breath ability. The padding is designed to be contoured to your shoulder for maximum comfort. The MiR Weighted Vests are completely adjustable for even more comfort. There are two adjustable straps that can be adjusted underneath so you can easily adjust the body length of the vest by sliding the straps up and down through the D-rings. To adjust the weight level, remove or transfer the weights from the packets which secure the weights with the durable Velcro weight closures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wGQVv3ggL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00213DMUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MiR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Vests"]], "price": 169.99}}
{"item_id": "B00213UEYQ", "title": "Martin XR Recurve Bow", "description": "The bow breaks down quickly and easily for storage and transport.The XR Recurve bow, from Martin Archery, is a youth bow with a new design that converts easily from right- to left-handed use. An ideal, affordable way to introduce aspiring archers to this exciting sport, the 46-inch bow features a full sight window and elevated rest for easier and more accurate shooting. The fully capturing arrow rest holds arrows in place while lining up your shot, making it both easier and safer to shoot. The XR includes a bowstring, and has a ten-to-20-pound draw weight that's manageable for young archers. When it's time to store or transport the bow, it breaks down quickly and easily into smaller components.About Martin ArcheryAfter returning home from WWII, Gail Martin rekindled his passion for archery and bowhunting. In 1951 he and his wife, Eva, made the decision to turn the family hobby into a full blown business. More than 60 years later, Gail and Eva remain involved to this day, and Martin Archery now employs three generations of Martin family employees. Gail innovated the manufacturing of bowstrings and still designs traditional bows, and the company owns more than 25 compound bow patents. Martin continues to evolve and seek new archery designs, while remaining a close-knit, family-run business.", "text": "Martin XR Recurve Bow The bow breaks down quickly and easily for storage and transport.The XR Recurve bow, from Martin Archery, is a youth bow with a new design that converts easily from right- to left-handed use. An ideal, affordable way to introduce aspiring archers to this exciting sport, the 46-inch bow features a full sight window and elevated rest for easier and more accurate shooting. The fully capturing arrow rest holds arrows in place while lining up your shot, making it both easier and safer to shoot. The XR includes a bowstring, and has a ten-to-20-pound draw weight that's manageable for young archers. When it's time to store or transport the bow, it breaks down quickly and easily into smaller components.About Martin ArcheryAfter returning home from WWII, Gail Martin rekindled his passion for archery and bowhunting. In 1951 he and his wife, Eva, made the decision to turn the family hobby into a full blown business. More than 60 years later, Gail and Eva remain involved to this day, and Martin Archery now employs three generations of Martin family employees. Gail innovated the manufacturing of bowstrings and still designs traditional bows, and the company owns more than 25 compound bow patents. Martin continues to evolve and seek new archery designs, while remaining a close-knit, family-run business.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316Kl2OVr9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00213UEYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Martin Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Recurve Bows"]], "price": 58.05}}
{"item_id": "B00217F974", "title": "Heavy Grip 150lbs. Intermediate, Hand Grippers", "description": "The Heavy GripsTM hand gripper series was developed for athletes who want to take the training of their grip strength to the next level.These high-quality aluminum-handled handgrippers are made in 50lb increments from 100lbs to 350lbs *so that you can train your grip similar to training any other bodypart-- by increasing resistance. *Grip strength is approximate and does not compare to strengths of any other grippers on the market. The strength of our grippers is tested mid-handle.If you want to develop serious hand strength for a sport, or just want to impress your friends, than the Heavy GripsTM hand grippers is the perfect choice for you! The Heavy Grip 100TM takes 100lbs of pressure to close, and the Heavy Grip 350TM takes a mind boggling 350lbs to close. Compare that to most store bought hand grippers that only take 40lbs to 60lbs of pressure to close!!The Heavy Grip 100TM is perfect for beginners and warm-ups, and the Heavy Grip 350TM takes a mind boggling 350lbs** to close. Compare that to most store bought hand grippers that only take 50lbs of pressure to close!!! **advertised weight is approximate and not compared to any other grip device on the market.This is the perfect hand gripper for Arm Wrestlers, Powerlifters, Strongmen, Rock Climbers, Gymnasts and anyone else who wants to develop a strong crushing grip and massive wrists and forearms.Sold individually: Heavy Grip 150", "text": "Heavy Grip 150lbs. Intermediate, Hand Grippers The Heavy GripsTM hand gripper series was developed for athletes who want to take the training of their grip strength to the next level.These high-quality aluminum-handled handgrippers are made in 50lb increments from 100lbs to 350lbs *so that you can train your grip similar to training any other bodypart-- by increasing resistance. *Grip strength is approximate and does not compare to strengths of any other grippers on the market. The strength of our grippers is tested mid-handle.If you want to develop serious hand strength for a sport, or just want to impress your friends, than the Heavy GripsTM hand grippers is the perfect choice for you! The Heavy Grip 100TM takes 100lbs of pressure to close, and the Heavy Grip 350TM takes a mind boggling 350lbs to close. Compare that to most store bought hand grippers that only take 40lbs to 60lbs of pressure to close!!The Heavy Grip 100TM is perfect for beginners and warm-ups, and the Heavy Grip 350TM takes a mind boggling 350lbs** to close. Compare that to most store bought hand grippers that only take 50lbs of pressure to close!!! **advertised weight is approximate and not compared to any other grip device on the market.This is the perfect hand gripper for Arm Wrestlers, Powerlifters, Strongmen, Rock Climbers, Gymnasts and anyone else who wants to develop a strong crushing grip and massive wrists and forearms.Sold individually: Heavy Grip 150", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/218n8WVkMYL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00217F974.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heavy Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 14.75}}
{"item_id": "B0021ECKSI", "title": "8184 SUPREME LOW PROFILE CAP - WOODLAND DIGITAL CAMO", "description": "", "text": "8184 SUPREME LOW PROFILE CAP - WOODLAND DIGITAL CAMO", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W2kL%2BP8%2BL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0021ECKSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Boys", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 8.38}}
{"item_id": "B0021H1P1I", "title": "HDE 1-Inch Tactical Flashlight and Laser Scope Mount", "description": "This 1 inch Tactical Flashlight and Laser Scope Mount is made to fit perfectly on your Picatinny or Weaver Rail. This scope mount is made out of Aluminum Alloy and comes with 3 screws: 2 - Allen screws, and 1 - Allen Head Bolt, and an Allen Key for easy access.", "text": "HDE 1-Inch Tactical Flashlight and Laser Scope Mount This 1 inch Tactical Flashlight and Laser Scope Mount is made to fit perfectly on your Picatinny or Weaver Rail. This scope mount is made out of Aluminum Alloy and comes with 3 screws: 2 - Allen screws, and 1 - Allen Head Bolt, and an Allen Key for easy access.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-Z1NgzCvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0021H1P1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HDE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0021TOPPY", "title": "UTG Bug Buster 3-9X32 Compact CQB Combat AO Scope", "description": "Shoot confidently from a range of distances with the UTG Bug Buster 3-9x32 CQB scope. The Bug Buster scope is built using a revolutionary Smart Spherical Structure known as Triple S.The Bug Buster scope is parallax adjustable from 3 yards to infinity.The design simplifies and strengthens the interaction between the inner and outer scope tubes, creating precise, responsive windage and elevation adjustments and tough recoil resistance. To make the adjustments even smoother, UTG added a brass-based windage/elevation turret, which includes a screw-on cap. The Mil-Dot reticle is adjustable, too, thanks to the side-wheel turret. You can use the turret to control different levels of red or green illumination, or even return it to the black reticle depending on the weather and light conditions. And hunters will love the reticle's range estimating technology, which increases your shooting accuracy in whole new ways.Finally, the scope is parallax adjustable from 3 yards at close range to infinity at long distances, giving you a range of distance options. Other features include a 2-inch sniper sunshade and black flip-open lens caps.SpecificationsMagnification: 3x to 9xObjective diameter: 32mmTube diameter: 1 inchField of view: 37.8 to 13.6 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: 3.3 to 3 inchesExit pupil: 7mm to 3.6mmClick value: 1/4 inch @ 100 yardsParallax setting: 3 yards to infinityBatteries: CR1620 (3 volt)Length: 8.4 inchesWeight: 14.4 ouncesAbout LeapersHeadquartered in Michigan, Leapers has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company sets uncompromising standards for its business operations, looking to make best-in-class niche products for outdoor enthusiasts. Leapers started its Made in the USA campaign in 2009, announcing that it would manufacture its unique mounting systems under the UTG Pro brand exclusively in Michigan.", "text": "UTG Bug Buster 3-9X32 Compact CQB Combat AO Scope Shoot confidently from a range of distances with the UTG Bug Buster 3-9x32 CQB scope. The Bug Buster scope is built using a revolutionary Smart Spherical Structure known as Triple S.The Bug Buster scope is parallax adjustable from 3 yards to infinity.The design simplifies and strengthens the interaction between the inner and outer scope tubes, creating precise, responsive windage and elevation adjustments and tough recoil resistance. To make the adjustments even smoother, UTG added a brass-based windage/elevation turret, which includes a screw-on cap. The Mil-Dot reticle is adjustable, too, thanks to the side-wheel turret. You can use the turret to control different levels of red or green illumination, or even return it to the black reticle depending on the weather and light conditions. And hunters will love the reticle's range estimating technology, which increases your shooting accuracy in whole new ways.Finally, the scope is parallax adjustable from 3 yards at close range to infinity at long distances, giving you a range of distance options. Other features include a 2-inch sniper sunshade and black flip-open lens caps.SpecificationsMagnification: 3x to 9xObjective diameter: 32mmTube diameter: 1 inchField of view: 37.8 to 13.6 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: 3.3 to 3 inchesExit pupil: 7mm to 3.6mmClick value: 1/4 inch @ 100 yardsParallax setting: 3 yards to infinityBatteries: CR1620 (3 volt)Length: 8.4 inchesWeight: 14.4 ouncesAbout LeapersHeadquartered in Michigan, Leapers has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company sets uncompromising standards for its business operations, looking to make best-in-class niche products for outdoor enthusiasts. Leapers started its Made in the USA campaign in 2009, announcing that it would manufacture its unique mounting systems under the UTG Pro brand exclusively in Michigan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hPsWjpBqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0021TOPPY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 92.09}}
