{"item_id": "B0022A19ME", "title": "Fury Tactical Double Lock Hinged Handcuffs (Chrome Silver)", "description": "The Fury Tactical Hinged Handcuffs from Joy Enterprises are built to meet and or exceed Military Specifications. Made using a patented design to significantly decrease weight and a Zinc Oxide coating for its anticorrosive properties. These cuffs are a perfect pair for back-up or use in wet environments. Includes two universal keys for the double locking mechanism.", "text": "Fury Tactical Double Lock Hinged Handcuffs (Chrome Silver) The Fury Tactical Hinged Handcuffs from Joy Enterprises are built to meet and or exceed Military Specifications. Made using a patented design to significantly decrease weight and a Zinc Oxide coating for its anticorrosive properties. These cuffs are a perfect pair for back-up or use in wet environments. Includes two universal keys for the double locking mechanism.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xxR1e6boL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0022A19ME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Handcuffs & Restraints", "Handcuffs"]], "price": 14.92}}
{"item_id": "B0022A1BHC", "title": "Fury Mustang G.I. 1 Quart Canteen with Aluminum Cup, Camo Nylon Cover with Pocket", "description": "The Mustang G.I. Aluminium 1 qt Canteen with Aluminum Cup, Camo Nylon Cover with Pocket is manufactured by Joy Enterprises the owners of Fury, Fury Tactical and Mustang products and the importer of Muela of Spain. With production in the USA, Europe and Asia, Joy has been providing high-quality, valued priced products since 1941. Many of our products are proprietary designs (often copied) and others inspired by classic survival/defensive tools and edged weapons. Joy is proud to offer a limited lifetime warranty on all products. Enjoy and be careful.", "text": "Fury Mustang G.I. 1 Quart Canteen with Aluminum Cup, Camo Nylon Cover with Pocket The Mustang G.I. Aluminium 1 qt Canteen with Aluminum Cup, Camo Nylon Cover with Pocket is manufactured by Joy Enterprises the owners of Fury, Fury Tactical and Mustang products and the importer of Muela of Spain. With production in the USA, Europe and Asia, Joy has been providing high-quality, valued priced products since 1941. Many of our products are proprietary designs (often copied) and others inspired by classic survival/defensive tools and edged weapons. Joy is proud to offer a limited lifetime warranty on all products. Enjoy and be careful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WEGjnWB7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0022A1BHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 14.3}}
