{"item_id": "B0022SI1A4", "title": "Eotech Holographic Weapon Sight Md: 516A651 .", "description": "Specifications:- Buttons on left side of sight (not in back) to work specifically with magnifiers - CR123 Lithium batteries; model with 65 MOA ring/1 MOA dot reticle - Raised 7mm base with knurled cross bolt - Fits to standard 1-Inch Weaver dovetail/Picatinny rail", "text": "Eotech Holographic Weapon Sight Md: 516A651 . Specifications:- Buttons on left side of sight (not in back) to work specifically with magnifiers - CR123 Lithium batteries; model with 65 MOA ring/1 MOA dot reticle - Raised 7mm base with knurled cross bolt - Fits to standard 1-Inch Weaver dovetail/Picatinny rail", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J7FItUcUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0022SI1A4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 498.78}}
{"item_id": "B0022UYBII", "title": "Chums Ski Carrier", "description": "Ski Carrier is an all in one ski and pole carrier. Adjustable webbing sling with articulating rubber shoulder pad. Skisnugger is an extra wide 2\" nylon webbing with high density foam padding that goes between skis. Hook/loop fastner to fit all styles of skis.", "text": "Chums Ski Carrier Ski Carrier is an all in one ski and pole carrier. Adjustable webbing sling with articulating rubber shoulder pad. Skisnugger is an extra wide 2\" nylon webbing with high density foam padding that goes between skis. Hook/loop fastner to fit all styles of skis.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pNEVaEFeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0022UYBII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chums", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 8.37}}
