{"item_id": "B00235WB02", "title": "TippmannTP420 Goggle", "description": "The TP420 Goggle from Tippmann offers high-level face and eye protection for fierce competition. The goggle features a thermo cured anti-fog lens with a 160 degree vertical range of view and a 260 degree horizontal range of view, to ensure maximum visibility even in extreme conditions. The goggle provides an ergonomic design with a comfortable fit for long scenario games. Built to last, the goggle lens can be replaced quickly and easily with just a flip of two locking tabs on either side.", "text": "TippmannTP420 Goggle The TP420 Goggle from Tippmann offers high-level face and eye protection for fierce competition. The goggle features a thermo cured anti-fog lens with a 160 degree vertical range of view and a 260 degree horizontal range of view, to ensure maximum visibility even in extreme conditions. The goggle provides an ergonomic design with a comfortable fit for long scenario games. Built to last, the goggle lens can be replaced quickly and easily with just a flip of two locking tabs on either side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Uhoo6PdRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00235WB02.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B002368VJ6", "title": "SABRE RED Police Strength Pepper Spray - Family, Home & Property Defense Fogger with Wall Mount Bracket & 25 Foot Range", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Protect your largest investment with a 13. 0 oz fogger unit. This small fire extinguisher pepper spray delivers a strong blast covering an entire doorway. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its twenty-five (25) foot range. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Police Strength Pepper Spray - Family, Home & Property Defense Fogger with Wall Mount Bracket & 25 Foot Range Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Protect your largest investment with a 13. 0 oz fogger unit. This small fire extinguisher pepper spray delivers a strong blast covering an entire doorway. Offering extremely practical protection, SABRE provides distance from your threat with its twenty-five (25) foot range. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BppMAPJ6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002368VJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 33.19}}
{"item_id": "B00236J1OA", "title": "Safariland 080-12 Shot Shell Holder, 12-Gauge", "description": "The 080-12 molded shotgun shell holder conveniently holds two 12 guage shells. Clips on for easy on, easy off use. The belt clip features an extended bottom keeping the 080-12 secure", "text": "Safariland 080-12 Shot Shell Holder, 12-Gauge The 080-12 molded shotgun shell holder conveniently holds two 12 guage shells. Clips on for easy on, easy off use. The belt clip features an extended bottom keeping the 080-12 secure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bps30FANL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00236J1OA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.71}}
