{"item_id": "B00236S7M2", "title": "Eliminator Global Vision Kit #2 (3 Lenses - Smoke, Clear & Yellow Tint)", "description": "The Eliminator goggles kit will take care of whatever competition stands in its way. The kit features interchangeable clear, smoke and yellow tint lenses and comes with a neoprene zipper bag with lens dividers. The shatterproof polycarbonate lenses provide UV400 protection from the sun and are coated with a scratch resistant finish.", "text": "Eliminator Global Vision Kit #2 (3 Lenses - Smoke, Clear & Yellow Tint) The Eliminator goggles kit will take care of whatever competition stands in its way. The kit features interchangeable clear, smoke and yellow tint lenses and comes with a neoprene zipper bag with lens dividers. The shatterproof polycarbonate lenses provide UV400 protection from the sun and are coated with a scratch resistant finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419CuQn4yWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00236S7M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Vision Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B00236U5HW", "title": "Smith & Wesson SW911B First Respon Knife with Magic Assisted Opening Serrated Blade, Black", "description": "A must for the first-responder. This rescue knife features a glass breaker, and a serrted blade designed for cutting seat belt material. This knife is equipped with a spring-assist opening blade.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SW911B First Respon Knife with Magic Assisted Opening Serrated Blade, Black A must for the first-responder. This rescue knife features a glass breaker, and a serrted blade designed for cutting seat belt material. This knife is equipped with a spring-assist opening blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MTM91HBxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00236U5HW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 44.95}}
