{"item_id": "B0023F9YTS", "title": "Camp Chef Bulk Tank Hose Adapter", "description": "You've only been camping for one weekend, but already your campsite looks like an industrial-waste disaster. Empty fuel bottles are piled around your cooking area like so much factory excess. The Camp Chef Bulk Tank Hose Adapter hooks your stove directly to a bulk tank so you can cook from one large, refillable source rather than burning through several small, disposable bottles.", "text": "Camp Chef Bulk Tank Hose Adapter You've only been camping for one weekend, but already your campsite looks like an industrial-waste disaster. Empty fuel bottles are piled around your cooking area like so much factory excess. The Camp Chef Bulk Tank Hose Adapter hooks your stove directly to a bulk tank so you can cook from one large, refillable source rather than burning through several small, disposable bottles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XB67hhVwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023F9YTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B0023FDQ2O", "title": "Potable Aqua Chlorine Dioxide Tablets", "description": "Potable Aqua the most trusted name in water purification products. Potable Aqua products provide time-tested, simple-to-use water treatment optiions for campers, backpackers and other outdoor enthusiasts. No aftertaste-improves the taste and odor of water.", "text": "Potable Aqua Chlorine Dioxide Tablets Potable Aqua the most trusted name in water purification products. Potable Aqua products provide time-tested, simple-to-use water treatment optiions for campers, backpackers and other outdoor enthusiasts. No aftertaste-improves the taste and odor of water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cNtNrzBwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023FDQ2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Potable Aqua", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Chemical Water Treaters"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0023MG6P6", "title": "Caldwell XLA Pivot Gun BiPod", "description": "The Best Value in External Spring Bipods is here! The Caldwell XLA 13-23 inch Pivot Gun BiPod provides a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button. The legs are notched for easy indexing to a specific height. There is a connection point for sling attachment and multi section legs that collapse forward allowing for convenient carry of the firearm. Soft rubber feet provide enhanced stability, while the padded bipod base protects the firearm's forend. In the real world of hunting, the chances of the ideal shot opportunity occurring while on a level ground are slim-to-none. A pivoting bipod will allow the shooter to compensate for ground that is unlevel by up to 20 degrees. The lower portion of the bipod pivots independently from the upper stock mount, allowing the firearm to be quickly leveled on uneven ground. The tension knob can be adjusted to control the resistance of the pivoting motion. Features: Durable, light-weight design (weights from 9-16 ounces) Quickly attach or detach from gun using swivel stud Attachment point for sling Maximum stability design Pad to protect for-end of gun Spring loaded legs are notched to extend to multiple lengths Available in 9-13 inch or 13-23 inch rest.", "text": "Caldwell XLA Pivot Gun BiPod The Best Value in External Spring Bipods is here! The Caldwell XLA 13-23 inch Pivot Gun BiPod provides a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button. The legs are notched for easy indexing to a specific height. There is a connection point for sling attachment and multi section legs that collapse forward allowing for convenient carry of the firearm. Soft rubber feet provide enhanced stability, while the padded bipod base protects the firearm's forend. In the real world of hunting, the chances of the ideal shot opportunity occurring while on a level ground are slim-to-none. A pivoting bipod will allow the shooter to compensate for ground that is unlevel by up to 20 degrees. The lower portion of the bipod pivots independently from the upper stock mount, allowing the firearm to be quickly leveled on uneven ground. The tension knob can be adjusted to control the resistance of the pivoting motion. Features: Durable, light-weight design (weights from 9-16 ounces) Quickly attach or detach from gun using swivel stud Attachment point for sling Maximum stability design Pad to protect for-end of gun Spring loaded legs are notched to extend to multiple lengths Available in 9-13 inch or 13-23 inch rest.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uoE3Hk8rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023MG6P6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B0023MHZLA", "title": "Caldwell Lead Sled Plus Recoil Reducing Rifle Rest", "description": "The original Lead Sled revolutionized the shooting rest market by nearly eliminating felt recoil from even the heaviest magnum rifles.The Lead Sled Plus reduces weapon recoil by up to 95 percent.With the Lead Sled, hunters faced up to 95 percent less recoil while securely holding their gun on target. The next-generation Lead Sled Plus takes the Lead Sled to the next level, adding such key improvements as a newly designed precision elevation shaft that eliminates wobble, play-in-front elevation that keeps you perfectly on target, and a universal weight tray that adjusts to accommodate a variety of weight types, including 25-pound barbells, sand, or lead shot bags (up to 100 pounds). Additional features include a padded rear rest, non-marring rubber feet, and an adjustable-height rear foot.SpecificationsFrame material: SteelWeight capacity: Up to 100 poundsLength: 27 inchesWidth: 12 inchesWeight: Approximately 15 pounds", "text": "Caldwell Lead Sled Plus Recoil Reducing Rifle Rest The original Lead Sled revolutionized the shooting rest market by nearly eliminating felt recoil from even the heaviest magnum rifles.The Lead Sled Plus reduces weapon recoil by up to 95 percent.With the Lead Sled, hunters faced up to 95 percent less recoil while securely holding their gun on target. The next-generation Lead Sled Plus takes the Lead Sled to the next level, adding such key improvements as a newly designed precision elevation shaft that eliminates wobble, play-in-front elevation that keeps you perfectly on target, and a universal weight tray that adjusts to accommodate a variety of weight types, including 25-pound barbells, sand, or lead shot bags (up to 100 pounds). Additional features include a padded rear rest, non-marring rubber feet, and an adjustable-height rear foot.SpecificationsFrame material: SteelWeight capacity: Up to 100 poundsLength: 27 inchesWidth: 12 inchesWeight: Approximately 15 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zlW0FA-ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023MHZLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 109.78}}
{"item_id": "B0023QLWZQ", "title": "SIG SAUER SP2022 SEMI CO2 PSTL", "description": "328 F.P.S. FAST Sig Sauer SP 2022 Semi - auto .177 cal. CO2 Air Pistol! A .177 cal. CO2 \"repro\" of the famed Sig Sauer as used by law enforcement worldwide. It's fast and fun, with realistic semi-auto action. It's ready to rock: Realistic detail, including texturized grip and grooved slide; Accessory rail system, for adding a light, laser sight, etc.; Approx. 328 F.P.S. velocity, 66-yd. power range; 23 .177 cal. BB capacity. Comes with 250 steel BBs; Fires fast as you pull the trigger, with your CO2 cartridges, no cocking required. Realistic scale and heft: 7 1/3\" l., 1 lb., 5 ozs.; State Color. It's a blast... get yours now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; Chicago, IL; MI; NJ; NY; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Sig Sauer SP 2022 Semi-auto .177 cal. CO2 Air Pistol", "text": "SIG SAUER SP2022 SEMI CO2 PSTL 328 F.P.S. FAST Sig Sauer SP 2022 Semi - auto .177 cal. CO2 Air Pistol! A .177 cal. CO2 \"repro\" of the famed Sig Sauer as used by law enforcement worldwide. It's fast and fun, with realistic semi-auto action. It's ready to rock: Realistic detail, including texturized grip and grooved slide; Accessory rail system, for adding a light, laser sight, etc.; Approx. 328 F.P.S. velocity, 66-yd. power range; 23 .177 cal. BB capacity. Comes with 250 steel BBs; Fires fast as you pull the trigger, with your CO2 cartridges, no cocking required. Realistic scale and heft: 7 1/3\" l., 1 lb., 5 ozs.; State Color. It's a blast... get yours now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Air Guns. Air Guns cannot be shipped to CA; CT; DE; Chicago, IL; MI; NJ; NY; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Air Guns cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Air Guns. Sig Sauer SP 2022 Semi-auto .177 cal. CO2 Air Pistol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nUKPPk8BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023QLWZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sig Sauer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 64.49}}
