{"item_id": "B0023X8D1U", "title": "Precut 6' Thera-Band - Gold (25 mils)", "description": "Thera-Band exercise bands provide positive and negative force on the muscles, improving strength, range of motion and cooperation of muscle groups. They are used in yoga, Pilates, stability, balance, birthing, and rehabilitation exercises. They can also help restore muscle and joint mobility. Color-coded progressive resistance gives at-a-glance documentation of progress from one level to the next. Different resistance levels are determined by thickness of the band with color-coded levels increasing in difficulty from tan (Extra Thin) to gold (Max). This comprehensive system provides positive reinforcement and feedback for gauging results. Thera-Band resistive exercise systems cost much less than other exercise equipment sold with claims of achieving similar results, plus they are portable and versatile with virtually unlimited uses. Recognized and used throughout the world, Thera-Band exercise bands are endorsed by the American Physical Therapy Association (APTA). The individual Thera-Bands by are sold in 6' long pieces. You may also purchase Thera-Bands in 150' rolls, which is long enough for 25 six-foot long bands.", "text": "Precut 6' Thera-Band - Gold (25 mils) Thera-Band exercise bands provide positive and negative force on the muscles, improving strength, range of motion and cooperation of muscle groups. They are used in yoga, Pilates, stability, balance, birthing, and rehabilitation exercises. They can also help restore muscle and joint mobility. Color-coded progressive resistance gives at-a-glance documentation of progress from one level to the next. Different resistance levels are determined by thickness of the band with color-coded levels increasing in difficulty from tan (Extra Thin) to gold (Max). This comprehensive system provides positive reinforcement and feedback for gauging results. Thera-Band resistive exercise systems cost much less than other exercise equipment sold with claims of achieving similar results, plus they are portable and versatile with virtually unlimited uses. Recognized and used throughout the world, Thera-Band exercise bands are endorsed by the American Physical Therapy Association (APTA). The individual Thera-Bands by are sold in 6' long pieces. You may also purchase Thera-Bands in 150' rolls, which is long enough for 25 six-foot long bands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21xlSInUPVL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0023X8D1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TheraBand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 9.06}}
