{"item_id": "B00245LJX6", "title": "Competitor CB 729 Olympic Weight Bench", "description": "The Competitor CB 729 weight bench from Impex Fitness offers a complete strength training station in the comfort and convenience of your own home, with five back pad positions to help you isolate and develop all areas of your pectorals. Adjustable-height bar catches put your body in the ideal position throughout your bench press workout, optimizing safety and maximizing your workout time. An included leg developer, with contoured foam roller pads, allows you to develop major leg muscle groups. The bench comes with detailed instructions for quick and easy assembly, right out of the box.Features and Specifications2.5-by-2.5-inch, heavy duty steel tube frameDurable powder-coated finishIndependent, adjustable-height crutches with quick release pop pin knobsMulti-position back pad adjusts to chest press, incline press, decline press, and military pressesDual function leg developer with contoured foam roller padsBoxed upholstery constructed from top-grade high density foamAccepts Olympic size weights plates, with 600-pound capacity (user body weight plus barbells)Measures 45 by 50 by 67 inches (W x H x D)WarrantyThis Competitor weight bench includes a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Competitor CB 729 Olympic Weight Bench The Competitor CB 729 weight bench from Impex Fitness offers a complete strength training station in the comfort and convenience of your own home, with five back pad positions to help you isolate and develop all areas of your pectorals. Adjustable-height bar catches put your body in the ideal position throughout your bench press workout, optimizing safety and maximizing your workout time. An included leg developer, with contoured foam roller pads, allows you to develop major leg muscle groups. The bench comes with detailed instructions for quick and easy assembly, right out of the box.Features and Specifications2.5-by-2.5-inch, heavy duty steel tube frameDurable powder-coated finishIndependent, adjustable-height crutches with quick release pop pin knobsMulti-position back pad adjusts to chest press, incline press, decline press, and military pressesDual function leg developer with contoured foam roller padsBoxed upholstery constructed from top-grade high density foamAccepts Olympic size weights plates, with 600-pound capacity (user body weight plus barbells)Measures 45 by 50 by 67 inches (W x H x D)WarrantyThis Competitor weight bench includes a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lDq2QXRvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00245LJX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Competitor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches", "Olympic Weight Benches"]], "price": 120.04}}
{"item_id": "B00245PTPU", "title": "Marcy Multiple Dumbbell Rack", "description": "Keep your weights in place with the Marcy Multiple Dumbbell Rack. Made of 14-gauge, solid steel, this durable rack accommodates neoprene or cast iron dumbbell and keeps your weights organized and easily accessible. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Accommodates neoprene or cast iron dumbbell. Durable 14-gauge, solid steel construction. Compact, upright design. Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 27L x 8.5W x 21H inches.", "text": "Marcy Multiple Dumbbell Rack Keep your weights in place with the Marcy Multiple Dumbbell Rack. Made of 14-gauge, solid steel, this durable rack accommodates neoprene or cast iron dumbbell and keeps your weights organized and easily accessible. About Impex Fitness Established in 1980, Impex Fitness is on the front lines of innovation in today's health marketplace. They specialize in home fitness/smith machine style equipment that appeals to the whole family and offers a complete workout experience. Impex encompasses a variety of brands including Marcy, Competitor, Hers, Easy Outdoor and Gym Dandy for children. Your family's health as their highest priority, Impex Fitness strives to develop the most pioneering fitness equipment available. Accommodates neoprene or cast iron dumbbell. Durable 14-gauge, solid steel construction. Compact, upright design. Easy to assemble. Assembled product dimensions: 27L x 8.5W x 21H inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ODRDt-PvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00245PTPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marcy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B00245TWWG", "title": "Marcy Classic MD 859P Mid Size Bench", "description": "Tough, versatile, and comfortable, the Marcy MD 859 mid-size weight bench is geared for a lifetime of body sculpting. The device is equipped with heavy-duty 3-inch-round steel uprights to hold the weight bar, with a 40-inch crutch width that accommodates both 6-foot and 7-foot bars. To ensure safety during walk-in squats and bench presses, the MD 859 also includes oversized bar catches to safely catch or cradle the bar. The unit's main attraction is its multi-position workout bench, which adjusts to decline, incline, flat, and military press positions. That's not the unit's only workout station, however, as the unit also includes a dual-action leg developer with six oversized roller pads, along with an integrated arm curl pad. The pivot point on the leg developer is ideally placed for correct joint alignment.Other features include an adjustable pop-pin tightening feature; sturdy no-tip front and rear stabilizers; deluxe high-density boxed upholstery; and a durable powder-coated finish. Suitable for both beginning and advanced users, the unit measures 63 by 51 by 43 inches (W x H x D) and carries a two-year limited warranty on parts.", "text": "Marcy Classic MD 859P Mid Size Bench Tough, versatile, and comfortable, the Marcy MD 859 mid-size weight bench is geared for a lifetime of body sculpting. The device is equipped with heavy-duty 3-inch-round steel uprights to hold the weight bar, with a 40-inch crutch width that accommodates both 6-foot and 7-foot bars. To ensure safety during walk-in squats and bench presses, the MD 859 also includes oversized bar catches to safely catch or cradle the bar. The unit's main attraction is its multi-position workout bench, which adjusts to decline, incline, flat, and military press positions. That's not the unit's only workout station, however, as the unit also includes a dual-action leg developer with six oversized roller pads, along with an integrated arm curl pad. The pivot point on the leg developer is ideally placed for correct joint alignment.Other features include an adjustable pop-pin tightening feature; sturdy no-tip front and rear stabilizers; deluxe high-density boxed upholstery; and a durable powder-coated finish. Suitable for both beginning and advanced users, the unit measures 63 by 51 by 43 inches (W x H x D) and carries a two-year limited warranty on parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BDQpL3-ZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00245TWWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marcy Classic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches", "Adjustable Benches"]], "price": 204.0}}
{"item_id": "B00248GSY8", "title": "Fossil Men's CH2573 Black silicon Strap Black Analog Dial Chronograph Watch", "description": "", "text": "Fossil Men's CH2573 Black silicon Strap Black Analog Dial Chronograph Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TX4vDhNgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00248GSY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fossil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Fashion Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "F", "FOSSIL"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Fossil Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men's Athletic Watches"]], "price": 88.0}}
{"item_id": "B0024ALB4S", "title": "Seattle Sports Deck Mount Rod Holder", "description": "A handy and convenient accessory for kayaking anglers. This easy-to-install rod holder mounts on any kayak deck to add convenient and secure placement for your rod so you can free your hands for other things. It features an angled design and a clean, natural surface-mounted look.Features and Specifications:Kayak deck mount fishing rod holderEasy to install; mounts to kayak deckAngled design; clean, natural surface-mounted lookDiameter: 2 inchesLength: 9 inches", "text": "Seattle Sports Deck Mount Rod Holder A handy and convenient accessory for kayaking anglers. This easy-to-install rod holder mounts on any kayak deck to add convenient and secure placement for your rod so you can free your hands for other things. It features an angled design and a clean, natural surface-mounted look.Features and Specifications:Kayak deck mount fishing rod holderEasy to install; mounts to kayak deckAngled design; clean, natural surface-mounted lookDiameter: 2 inchesLength: 9 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311UD82faVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024ALB4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 11.05}}
{"item_id": "B0024ALDMS", "title": "Sherpak Hood Loops (Pair)", "description": "Ideal for vehicles with plastic bumpers that have no metal underneath, these innovative loops install on the quarter panel bolts under the hood to provide a tie-down attachment.", "text": "Sherpak Hood Loops (Pair) Ideal for vehicles with plastic bumpers that have no metal underneath, these innovative loops install on the quarter panel bolts under the hood to provide a tie-down attachment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P7694VwpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024ALDMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sherpak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories", "Tie-Downs"]], "price": 9.75}}
{"item_id": "B0024ART4Y", "title": "Seattle Sports Rain Rider Pannier", "description": "Are you one of the brave few who can call himself \"rain rider?\" Well, Seattle Sports knows riding in the rain, and their Rain Rider Panniers are not only some of the coolest looking gear around, they feature a large main compartment, a zippered exterior dry pocket and all radio frequency-welded construction with 1000 cubic inches of space...so we're talking plenty of room for your touring/commuting needs, and technology that keeps your gear bone dry. The Rain Rider's symmetric design allows it to be used on either side of the front or back rack. And how about some non-toxic PVC-Free urethane-coated nylon? It's tough as nails and offers excellent protection, plus top compression straps keep your load snug, while a detachable shoulder strap means easy cross body or over the shoulder carrying. PVC-free nylon is toxin free Easy to grab off the bike and sling over the shoulder Huge 1000 cubic inches of storage Dry pocket on the outside for convenience and safety 12 x 14 x 6.5 16 Liters 850 g", "text": "Seattle Sports Rain Rider Pannier Are you one of the brave few who can call himself \"rain rider?\" Well, Seattle Sports knows riding in the rain, and their Rain Rider Panniers are not only some of the coolest looking gear around, they feature a large main compartment, a zippered exterior dry pocket and all radio frequency-welded construction with 1000 cubic inches of space...so we're talking plenty of room for your touring/commuting needs, and technology that keeps your gear bone dry. The Rain Rider's symmetric design allows it to be used on either side of the front or back rack. And how about some non-toxic PVC-Free urethane-coated nylon? It's tough as nails and offers excellent protection, plus top compression straps keep your load snug, while a detachable shoulder strap means easy cross body or over the shoulder carrying. PVC-free nylon is toxin free Easy to grab off the bike and sling over the shoulder Huge 1000 cubic inches of storage Dry pocket on the outside for convenience and safety 12 x 14 x 6.5 16 Liters 850 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tKsLOP9IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024ART4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B0024AVPO4", "title": "Seattle Sports Quick Loops", "description": "The perfect vehicle accessory for boaters with newer cars that have no place to attach front tie down straps. These Quick Loops provide an under-hood anchor point to keep the nose of a boat pointing forward without drilling, bolting, or otherwise altering a vehicle to safely carry a boat. Pair.", "text": "Seattle Sports Quick Loops The perfect vehicle accessory for boaters with newer cars that have no place to attach front tie down straps. These Quick Loops provide an under-hood anchor point to keep the nose of a boat pointing forward without drilling, bolting, or otherwise altering a vehicle to safely carry a boat. Pair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Uz0CrXLJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024AVPO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sherpak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories", "Tie-Downs"]], "price": 14.94}}
{"item_id": "B0024FOTOW", "title": "Reese Towpower 7018100 Canoe Loader", "description": "Reese Towpower Canoe Loader is designed to load or unload a canoe or kayak quickly on to the vehicle equipped with a trailer hitch. To load the canoe simply place one end of the canoe onto the cross bar, then pick up the other end, tie around to the front of the vehicle and secure the canoe for travel. The canoe loader will swivel to allow for easy movement while supporting one end of the canoe. It includes an adapter bracket to allow for towing while using the canoe loader.", "text": "Reese Towpower 7018100 Canoe Loader Reese Towpower Canoe Loader is designed to load or unload a canoe or kayak quickly on to the vehicle equipped with a trailer hitch. To load the canoe simply place one end of the canoe onto the cross bar, then pick up the other end, tie around to the front of the vehicle and secure the canoe for travel. The canoe loader will swivel to allow for easy movement while supporting one end of the canoe. It includes an adapter bracket to allow for towing while using the canoe loader.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31a1%2BD9KPQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024FOTOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reese", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 66.05}}
{"item_id": "B0024GHYDE", "title": "Barracuda Ear Plugs", "description": "The contoured design of these soft Silicone earplugs makes them a comfortable and secure way to avoid painful pressure changes and swimmer's ear.", "text": "Barracuda Ear Plugs The contoured design of these soft Silicone earplugs makes them a comfortable and secure way to avoid painful pressure changes and swimmer's ear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313zlwesqXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024GHYDE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barracuda", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Earplugs"]], "price": 3.99}}
