{"item_id": "B0024NLH6M", "title": "MAGLITE ASXX07B Traffic Wand, Red", "description": "The Mag-Lite traffic wand fits on the end of your flashlight system and comes in the colors red or yellow..", "text": "MAGLITE ASXX07B Traffic Wand, Red The Mag-Lite traffic wand fits on the end of your flashlight system and comes in the colors red or yellow..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317sUnxs61L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024NLH6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mag Instrument", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 3.88}}
{"item_id": "B0024O0W94", "title": "Reliance Products Double Doodie Toilet Waste Bags (6-Pack)", "description": "Double Doodie toilet waste bags are designed for easy, no mess waste disposal. Each bag consists of an inner bag and an outer bag that is sealable and leak proof. This bag can be used with our Reliance Hassock and Luggable Loo toilets as well as most other portable toilets.", "text": "Reliance Products Double Doodie Toilet Waste Bags (6-Pack) Double Doodie toilet waste bags are designed for easy, no mess waste disposal. Each bag consists of an inner bag and an outer bag that is sealable and leak proof. This bag can be used with our Reliance Hassock and Luggable Loo toilets as well as most other portable toilets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ngX-kb9YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024O0W94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 16.61}}
{"item_id": "B0024O0X5C", "title": "Reliance 1 Gallon Fold-A-Jug", "description": "The Fold-A-Jug is a premium quality, collapsible water container designed specifically with backpackers in mind. The 1 gal./4L size holds enough hot or cold liquid for any daypack adventure and when you're done it collapses down to a very small size.", "text": "Reliance 1 Gallon Fold-A-Jug The Fold-A-Jug is a premium quality, collapsible water container designed specifically with backpackers in mind. The 1 gal./4L size holds enough hot or cold liquid for any daypack adventure and when you're done it collapses down to a very small size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P1urvCxGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024O0X5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 10.32}}
{"item_id": "B0024O8JV2", "title": "Reliance Products Aqua-Pak 2.5 Gallon Rigid Water Container", "description": "Aqua-Pak 2.5 gallon (10 liter) rigid water container features a highly engineered design that strengthens the container so it is stackable empty or full. Great for all outdoor activities as well as emergency water storage at home.", "text": "Reliance Products Aqua-Pak 2.5 Gallon Rigid Water Container Aqua-Pak 2.5 gallon (10 liter) rigid water container features a highly engineered design that strengthens the container so it is stackable empty or full. Great for all outdoor activities as well as emergency water storage at home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZZWNMRndL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024O8JV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 19.4}}
{"item_id": "B0024OAQ3Q", "title": "Reliance Fold-To-Go Portable Toilet", "description": "When space is your concern, rely on the Reliance Fold-To-Go. This collapsible portable toilet folds down to just 5 inches and weighs only 4.5 lbs. It has an integrated handle, making it easy to carry. It also boasts an innovative leg locking system, making it one of the sturdiest portable toilets around. The Fold-To-Go has an impressive weight capacity and is great for camping, RV's, hunting, boating, and emergency preparedness. This unit is ideally suited to be used with the Double Doodie bag bagging system.Comes with 1 free Double Doodie bag..", "text": "Reliance Fold-To-Go Portable Toilet When space is your concern, rely on the Reliance Fold-To-Go. This collapsible portable toilet folds down to just 5 inches and weighs only 4.5 lbs. It has an integrated handle, making it easy to carry. It also boasts an innovative leg locking system, making it one of the sturdiest portable toilets around. The Fold-To-Go has an impressive weight capacity and is great for camping, RV's, hunting, boating, and emergency preparedness. This unit is ideally suited to be used with the Double Doodie bag bagging system.Comes with 1 free Double Doodie bag..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pzGAE9pWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024OAQ3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Reliance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 55.95}}
{"item_id": "B0024VFRX8", "title": "American Flag Embroidered Patch Gold Border USA United States of America Military Uniform Emblem", "description": "", "text": "American Flag Embroidered Patch Gold Border USA United States of America Military Uniform Emblem", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IokPZwMiL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024VFRX8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B0024XEB7E", "title": "C41 Air Pistol (BB)", "description": "The Crosman C41 air pistol features alloy construction that gives it a realistic weight and feel. A medium framed pistol, the gun has ambidextrous checkered grips and is modeled after the famous German pistols of WWII.Powered by a 12-gram Powerlet CO2 cartridge, and boasting muzzle velocities up to 495-feet-per-second (FPS), the C41 has an 18-round, spring-fed magazine that ensures accurate BB feeding with every shot. An easy-slide grip guarantees quick CO2 replacement, resulting in less downtime and more time on the range.SpecificationsPowered by 12-gram CO2 cartridge0.177 caliberFiring velocity up to 495 FPSTwo-pound, 14-ounce weight6.75-inch lengthSmooth bore barrelFixed blade front sightNotch rear sightSlide safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "text": "C41 Air Pistol (BB) The Crosman C41 air pistol features alloy construction that gives it a realistic weight and feel. A medium framed pistol, the gun has ambidextrous checkered grips and is modeled after the famous German pistols of WWII.Powered by a 12-gram Powerlet CO2 cartridge, and boasting muzzle velocities up to 495-feet-per-second (FPS), the C41 has an 18-round, spring-fed magazine that ensures accurate BB feeding with every shot. An easy-slide grip guarantees quick CO2 replacement, resulting in less downtime and more time on the range.SpecificationsPowered by 12-gram CO2 cartridge0.177 caliberFiring velocity up to 495 FPSTwo-pound, 14-ounce weight6.75-inch lengthSmooth bore barrelFixed blade front sightNotch rear sightSlide safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KCPkde2VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024XEB7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 59.95}}
