{"item_id": "B0024XEXQS", "title": "Gamo Silent Cat Air Rifle", "description": "The GAMO Silent Cat Air Rifle with 4X32 Scope, Mounts and PBA Ammunition will change the way you think about hunting with air guns. This high-powered adult air gun is ideal for small game hunting and pest control. The non-removable noise dampener reduces noise by up to 52%. The velocity is an impressive 1,200 feet per second with PBA ammunition or 1,000 feet per second with 0.177 caliber match-grade lead bullets. Made of durable all-weather black synthetic stock, you can take this tough, single shot air rifle out in any kind of weather. It also has a ventilated rubber pad for recoil absorption. It features a manual trigger safety and automatic cocking safety system and has a base for mounting the 4x32 rifle scope.", "text": "Gamo Silent Cat Air Rifle The GAMO Silent Cat Air Rifle with 4X32 Scope, Mounts and PBA Ammunition will change the way you think about hunting with air guns. This high-powered adult air gun is ideal for small game hunting and pest control. The non-removable noise dampener reduces noise by up to 52%. The velocity is an impressive 1,200 feet per second with PBA ammunition or 1,000 feet per second with 0.177 caliber match-grade lead bullets. Made of durable all-weather black synthetic stock, you can take this tough, single shot air rifle out in any kind of weather. It also has a ventilated rubber pad for recoil absorption. It features a manual trigger safety and automatic cocking safety system and has a base for mounting the 4x32 rifle scope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21S43294NML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024XEXQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 175.62}}
{"item_id": "B0024ZS53S", "title": "NcStar Quick Detach Tactical Weaver Style Riser Scope Mount For AR15 M4 CX4 G22 SU16 X7 ( MARFQ )", "description": "NcStar Quick Detach Tactical Weaver Style Riser Scope Mount For AR15 M4 CX4 G22 SU16 X7 (MARFQ) - Made by NcStar, Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, This riser mount provides almost an inch of additional height. The extra height is ideal for gaining the extra clearance to clear iron sights from your scopes field of view and also provides a more ergonomic location for mounting your scope. Quick release function provides quick detach capability. Fits most any weaver/Picatinny style scope mount or rail system as commonly found on AR15, Beretta CX4 Storm, SU16 and other rifles. Top rail will accept most any scope/red dot/reflex sight and other accessories that have a Wevaer/Picatinny compatible base. Made to withstand heavy shock and recoil. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "text": "NcStar Quick Detach Tactical Weaver Style Riser Scope Mount For AR15 M4 CX4 G22 SU16 X7 ( MARFQ ) NcStar Quick Detach Tactical Weaver Style Riser Scope Mount For AR15 M4 CX4 G22 SU16 X7 (MARFQ) - Made by NcStar, Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, This riser mount provides almost an inch of additional height. The extra height is ideal for gaining the extra clearance to clear iron sights from your scopes field of view and also provides a more ergonomic location for mounting your scope. Quick release function provides quick detach capability. Fits most any weaver/Picatinny style scope mount or rail system as commonly found on AR15, Beretta CX4 Storm, SU16 and other rifles. Top rail will accept most any scope/red dot/reflex sight and other accessories that have a Wevaer/Picatinny compatible base. Made to withstand heavy shock and recoil. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rCaln6o3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0024ZS53S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 30.75}}
