{"item_id": "B0025U2NX0", "title": "Continental Double Fighter 2 Urban Mountain Bicycle Tire - Wire Bead", "description": "The Double Fighter is back! In a sturdy gumwall design for urban biking. It rolls smoothly and quietly on asphalt. Its side lugs give it the right tracking bite on park and gravel paths. The ideal combination for turning a proven knobbly all-terrain tyre into one good for zipping around the metro area.", "text": "Continental Double Fighter 2 Urban Mountain Bicycle Tire - Wire Bead The Double Fighter is back! In a sturdy gumwall design for urban biking. It rolls smoothly and quietly on asphalt. Its side lugs give it the right tracking bite on park and gravel paths. The ideal combination for turning a proven knobbly all-terrain tyre into one good for zipping around the metro area.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YJV1RetGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025U2NX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 26.96}}
{"item_id": "B0025U3AQ4", "title": "Kershaw Fire Starter", "description": "This magnesium fire starter always strikes a spark, even in damp conditions. A molded plastic handle makes it easy to use and a nylon cord keeps it handy when you need it.", "text": "Kershaw Fire Starter This magnesium fire starter always strikes a spark, even in damp conditions. A molded plastic handle makes it easy to use and a nylon cord keeps it handy when you need it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315HZVOYGkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025U3AQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 9.29}}
{"item_id": "B0025U4L9Y", "title": "Caldwell XLA Bipod (6 - 9-Inch)", "description": "The Caldwell XLA Bipods provide a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button.", "text": "Caldwell XLA Bipod (6 - 9-Inch) The Caldwell XLA Bipods provide a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UjGJT0CZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025U4L9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 26.0}}
