{"item_id": "B0025UGU3O", "title": "Headsweats Spin Cycle Cap", "description": "All the nostalgia of a classic cycling cap right out of ‘Breaking Away’ with high-wicking CoolMax technology to keep you cool under that aero helmet. Traditional styling of a cycle cap with a soft flexible bill coupled with a fitted cap construction. Spincycle can be worn alone or under a helmet.", "text": "Headsweats Spin Cycle Cap All the nostalgia of a classic cycling cap right out of ‘Breaking Away’ with high-wicking CoolMax technology to keep you cool under that aero helmet. Traditional styling of a cycle cap with a soft flexible bill coupled with a fitted cap construction. Spincycle can be worn alone or under a helmet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413atL0JYuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025UGU3O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Headsweats", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 13.0}}
