{"item_id": "B0025VWAS2", "title": "Birchwood Casey PSP Gun Blue (3 Ounce)", "description": "Perma Blue Liquid Offers you the best way to touch up scratches and worn spots or even completely reblue most guns. It will give you a non-streaky, even blue-black finish to steel(except stainless steel). It provides a great blueing to metal that has already been thoroughly cleaned and is free of rust.", "text": "Birchwood Casey PSP Gun Blue (3 Ounce) Perma Blue Liquid Offers you the best way to touch up scratches and worn spots or even completely reblue most guns. It will give you a non-streaky, even blue-black finish to steel(except stainless steel). It provides a great blueing to metal that has already been thoroughly cleaned and is free of rust.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T-epBxZ4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025VWAS2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 7.09}}
{"item_id": "B0025VWB9A", "title": "Birchwood Casey Portable Shooting Range, Steel Frame + 39 Shoot-N-C Targets", "description": "Target holder (heavy-duty welded steel w/footrest) 18x18 weatherproof corrugated plastic backboard (1) 12 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (2) 12 sight-in Shoot-N-C target (1) 8 bullseye Shoot-N-C target (1) 5.5 bullseye Shoot-N-C target (1) 3 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (2) 2 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (6) 1 Shoot-N-C pasters (22) 2 Shoot-N-C pasters (4) Durable powder-coated steel target holder resists rust Lifetime frame guarantee", "text": "Birchwood Casey Portable Shooting Range, Steel Frame + 39 Shoot-N-C Targets Target holder (heavy-duty welded steel w/footrest) 18x18 weatherproof corrugated plastic backboard (1) 12 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (2) 12 sight-in Shoot-N-C target (1) 8 bullseye Shoot-N-C target (1) 5.5 bullseye Shoot-N-C target (1) 3 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (2) 2 bullseye Shoot-N-C targets (6) 1 Shoot-N-C pasters (22) 2 Shoot-N-C pasters (4) Durable powder-coated steel target holder resists rust Lifetime frame guarantee", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PQq9zVHgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025VWB9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B0025VWBCM", "title": "Birchwood Shoot?N?C Self-Adhesive Targets", "description": "When you go out shooting, you want a reaction. That's why for years old cans and bottles were a favorite at the practice range. Until now! These revolutionary self-adhesive targets explode in color upon impact. And the bright yellow ring around the bullet hole is visible to the naked eye - allowing you shot after shot without interruption.", "text": "Birchwood Shoot?N?C Self-Adhesive Targets When you go out shooting, you want a reaction. That's why for years old cans and bottles were a favorite at the practice range. Until now! These revolutionary self-adhesive targets explode in color upon impact. And the bright yellow ring around the bullet hole is visible to the naked eye - allowing you shot after shot without interruption.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41grhxzbN-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025VWBCM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0025VYL48", "title": "Versatile Universal Handgun Rack (Holds 4 or 6)", "description": "* Advanced 3-In-1 Formulation Red Pepper, CS Military Tear Gas & UV Marking Dye * Compact - Easy to carry and takes up little space * Very Accessible - quick release key ring - separate from keys when in lock or car ignition * Very Effective - 10 foot range with 25 Shots for protection against multiple threats from a safe distance * Great Stopping Power - SABRE products are used by the NYPD, US Marshals and thousands of police departments worldwide * This item is not for sale in certain states", "text": "Versatile Universal Handgun Rack (Holds 4 or 6) * Advanced 3-In-1 Formulation Red Pepper, CS Military Tear Gas & UV Marking Dye * Compact - Easy to carry and takes up little space * Very Accessible - quick release key ring - separate from keys when in lock or car ignition * Very Effective - 10 foot range with 25 Shots for protection against multiple threats from a safe distance * Great Stopping Power - SABRE products are used by the NYPD, US Marshals and thousands of police departments worldwide * This item is not for sale in certain states", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31blk%2BoK6nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025VYL48.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0025YCYK8", "title": "Spyderco Temperence 2 Canvas Micarta Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Temperance 2 is Spyderco's latest evolution of a field-tested fixed-blade design. Its VG-10 stainless steel blade features a full flat grind and a distal taper along its entire length. When combined with skeletonized full-tang construction and mocha-colored canvas Micarta scales, the result is an incredibly well balanced knife with exceptional edge geometry and cutting power. Its ergonomically contoured handle scales are bead blasted to provide an enhanced texture, and a custom-molded Boltaron (Kydex) sheath with a G-Clip attachment system provides safe, secure carry with a variety of different mounting options.", "text": "Spyderco Temperence 2 Canvas Micarta Plain Edge Knife The Temperance 2 is Spyderco's latest evolution of a field-tested fixed-blade design. Its VG-10 stainless steel blade features a full flat grind and a distal taper along its entire length. When combined with skeletonized full-tang construction and mocha-colored canvas Micarta scales, the result is an incredibly well balanced knife with exceptional edge geometry and cutting power. Its ergonomically contoured handle scales are bead blasted to provide an enhanced texture, and a custom-molded Boltaron (Kydex) sheath with a G-Clip attachment system provides safe, secure carry with a variety of different mounting options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uhXzRPd8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025YCYK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 207.72}}
{"item_id": "B0025Z52XI", "title": "Benchmade Osbourne Design Rift Knife with Black G10 Handle and AXIS Lock", "description": "The Benchmade 950 Rift, a Warren Osborne design, is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto with an ambidextrous dual thumb-stud opener, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation. Features an AXIS locking mechanism, 420J stainless steel liners and a reversible tip-up carry-clip.", "text": "Benchmade Osbourne Design Rift Knife with Black G10 Handle and AXIS Lock The Benchmade 950 Rift, a Warren Osborne design, is packed with features to help get the job done. Reverse Tanto with an ambidextrous dual thumb-stud opener, large-bellied blade for all the utility cutting you can throw at it and heavily milled and textured G10 scales to help you get a firm grip on any situation. Features an AXIS locking mechanism, 420J stainless steel liners and a reversible tip-up carry-clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wmvoVv9KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0025Z52XI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 161.25}}
{"item_id": "B002611RSU", "title": "Penn Pressureless Tennis Balls (12 Balls in Mesh Carrying Bag)", "description": "Penn Pressureless Tennis BallsPenn Preasureless Tennis balls are great practice balls.Features:Pressureless core for longer lifeSuitable for all court surfacesPacked in a mesh bag with drawstring for easy transport and storage", "text": "Penn Pressureless Tennis Balls (12 Balls in Mesh Carrying Bag) Penn Pressureless Tennis BallsPenn Preasureless Tennis balls are great practice balls.Features:Pressureless core for longer lifeSuitable for all court surfacesPacked in a mesh bag with drawstring for easy transport and storage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61MMoipug-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002611RSU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Penn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Balls"]], "price": 17.9}}
{"item_id": "B00261SK9Y", "title": "Jungle Recon Knife Set", "description": "The practical Jungle Recon Knife Set feature a sharp 10 1/2 inch full tang stainless steel knife with a resilient non-reflective matte black finish and a slightly smaller comparable 7 1/2 inch full tang stainless steel knife with the same non-reflective matte black finish. These knives also features thick green cord wrapped handles with convenient wrist lanyards. This outstanding field knife set comes complete with a durable military green nylon sheath.", "text": "Jungle Recon Knife Set The practical Jungle Recon Knife Set feature a sharp 10 1/2 inch full tang stainless steel knife with a resilient non-reflective matte black finish and a slightly smaller comparable 7 1/2 inch full tang stainless steel knife with the same non-reflective matte black finish. These knives also features thick green cord wrapped handles with convenient wrist lanyards. This outstanding field knife set comes complete with a durable military green nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vcPCLSqIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00261SK9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.13}}
{"item_id": "B00262JH2C", "title": "U.S. Military Tent Half Shelter", "description": "(2) Military Surplus, G.I. 12 Foot \"Half Tent\" Shelter. Olive Drab, comes with 10 tent pins and 2- 3 section poles. Made from sturdy cotton duck. TWO shelter halves. Can be assembled in a classic \"Pup\" tent configuration.", "text": "U.S. Military Tent Half Shelter (2) Military Surplus, G.I. 12 Foot \"Half Tent\" Shelter. Olive Drab, comes with 10 tent pins and 2- 3 section poles. Made from sturdy cotton duck. TWO shelter halves. Can be assembled in a classic \"Pup\" tent configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SGwV1OQ3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00262JH2C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00262MLHU", "title": "Harbinger Flexfit Training Gloves", "description": "WASH&DRY;® All purpose fitness training gloves for athletes who require the maximum range of motion in a minimal glove design. Mesh is treated to control odor, staining, and deterioration caused by bacteria.", "text": "Harbinger Flexfit Training Gloves WASH&DRY;® All purpose fitness training gloves for athletes who require the maximum range of motion in a minimal glove design. Mesh is treated to control odor, staining, and deterioration caused by bacteria.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vVZsXowvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00262MLHU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00262NV06", "title": "Harbinger Women's Flex Fit Weight Lifting Gloves, Purple", "description": "The newly-redesigned Women’s FlexFit glove is antimicrobial treated to control odor and staining caused by bacteria. The BiFlex™ palm features integrated layers of material, leather and TechGel padding that flex naturally with the hand. The TechGel pads cushion key stress points in the hand for enhanced comfort while lifting. Shorty finger length ends below the first joint for maximum surface contact. This stylish glove makes a statement and is fully machine washable and dryable, to boot! Available in Purple/black and Gray/black", "text": "Harbinger Women's Flex Fit Weight Lifting Gloves, Purple The newly-redesigned Women’s FlexFit glove is antimicrobial treated to control odor and staining caused by bacteria. The BiFlex™ palm features integrated layers of material, leather and TechGel padding that flex naturally with the hand. The TechGel pads cushion key stress points in the hand for enhanced comfort while lifting. Shorty finger length ends below the first joint for maximum surface contact. This stylish glove makes a statement and is fully machine washable and dryable, to boot! Available in Purple/black and Gray/black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-KNE3P5zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00262NV06.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00263G7O2", "title": "NEW! Black Genuine Leather Single Western Holster Cowboy Rig 44/45 LC Ammo Loops By GUNS4US ***", "description": "THIS HOLSTER ONLY SOLD BY GUNS4US!! NEW! Black Genuine Leather Single Western Holster Rig By GUNS4US. The holster barrels are open ended so if your gun barrel is longer than 5 1/2 inches the barrel will just stick out on the bottom the difference between the 5 1/2 inches and the length of your gun barrel. Holsters fit any single action revolver sized like a Colt, Ruger, Uberti, Beretta, and the like. Will also fit smaller double action guns that are the same size as the single actions sited here. This holster does NOT fit the Super Blackhawk gun. Silver belt ring. I am a gun dealer that has the posted item for sale in my store. Bid on it as soon as you can, because once it has a bid on the auction site, I then pull it from my store display to be sold here ONLY. Dimensions are actual measurements in inches. So, MEASURE PLEASE as indicated below and EMAIL US THE MEASUREMENT THAT YOU HAVE OBTAINED USING THE METHOD BELOW AFTER YOUR PURCHASE. IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT MEASUREMENTS: When measuring for ordering this holster rig, PLEASE make sure that you measure just below your waist approximately where the holster will hang and over your clothes. Often, people think just because they wear a 36 inch pair of pants, that is the size holster to order. It's NOT the right size. After you add the pants material and belt thickness, most people need a holster belt at least 5 inches bigger than what they wear in a pants size. Also, some rely on that they are wearing a pair of pants with 36 inch waist. And then after you wear them for a while, they stretch. PLEASE measure again BEFORE ordering. And please measure exactly where you'll actually be wearing your belt. **PLEASE NOTE** If you do not see your size listed then please check back frequently as we are constantly adding new holsters to our inventory listings. Also please email us regarding any special size requests. Your holster will be shipped Priority Mail insured and carefully packed!! **SAME DAY SHIPPING!!**", "text": "NEW! Black Genuine Leather Single Western Holster Cowboy Rig 44/45 LC Ammo Loops By GUNS4US *** THIS HOLSTER ONLY SOLD BY GUNS4US!! NEW! Black Genuine Leather Single Western Holster Rig By GUNS4US. The holster barrels are open ended so if your gun barrel is longer than 5 1/2 inches the barrel will just stick out on the bottom the difference between the 5 1/2 inches and the length of your gun barrel. Holsters fit any single action revolver sized like a Colt, Ruger, Uberti, Beretta, and the like. Will also fit smaller double action guns that are the same size as the single actions sited here. This holster does NOT fit the Super Blackhawk gun. Silver belt ring. I am a gun dealer that has the posted item for sale in my store. Bid on it as soon as you can, because once it has a bid on the auction site, I then pull it from my store display to be sold here ONLY. Dimensions are actual measurements in inches. So, MEASURE PLEASE as indicated below and EMAIL US THE MEASUREMENT THAT YOU HAVE OBTAINED USING THE METHOD BELOW AFTER YOUR PURCHASE. IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT MEASUREMENTS: When measuring for ordering this holster rig, PLEASE make sure that you measure just below your waist approximately where the holster will hang and over your clothes. Often, people think just because they wear a 36 inch pair of pants, that is the size holster to order. It's NOT the right size. After you add the pants material and belt thickness, most people need a holster belt at least 5 inches bigger than what they wear in a pants size. Also, some rely on that they are wearing a pair of pants with 36 inch waist. And then after you wear them for a while, they stretch. PLEASE measure again BEFORE ordering. And please measure exactly where you'll actually be wearing your belt. **PLEASE NOTE** If you do not see your size listed then please check back frequently as we are constantly adding new holsters to our inventory listings. Also please email us regarding any special size requests. Your holster will be shipped Priority Mail insured and carefully packed!! **SAME DAY SHIPPING!!**", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iHS93K9yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00263G7O2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B00265MBSG", "title": "Clear2GO Water Bottle with Filter", "description": "The Clear2Go water bottle provides clean, filtered water straight from the tap, providing you with clean water while saving you money on bottled water (not to mention reducing the plastic bottle load at the landfill). The Clear2Go replaceable filter improves the taste and smell of water by reducing aesthetic chlorine and removing 99.9 percent of microbial cysts such as cryptosporidium and giardia. As you pour the water, the filter works by attracting and blocking particulates. One filter can process up to 100 gallons of water, which is equal to 757 store-bought 16.9-ounce water bottles. And because the filter is incorporated right into the bottle, the Clear2Go provides convenient and hassle-free clean water wherever and whenever you need it. The 24-ounce bottle is completely BPA-free, features an easy-squeeze \"fast flow\" valve for speedy hydration on the go, and comes complete with one filter.Clear2Go filters employ NanoCeram NASA-derived technology that attracts and blocks particulates such as cryptosporidium and giardia from passing through the filter. It reduces chlorine taste and odor in the water you drink by 83.8 percent and is certified by the WQA to exceed the minimum NSF/ANSI standard requirements--both Standard 42 for the reduction of aesthetic chlorine, taste, odor, and particulates, and Standard 53 for the reduction of turbidity and cysts (cryptosporidium and giardia).Features & Benefits:Removes 99.9 percent of microbial cysts including cryptosporidium and giardiaReduces aesthetic chlorine taste and odor by 83.8 percent1 filter purifies 100 gallons of water; equal to 757 16.9-ounce water bottlesNanoCeram NASA-derived filter technology attracts and blocks particulates from passing through filterEasy to use; filters water as you pourFills at any tap water sourceFirst filter includedFast flow easy-squeeze feature offers speedy hydration24-ounce capacityMade of durable Tritan material that's 100 percent BPA-free", "text": "Clear2GO Water Bottle with Filter The Clear2Go water bottle provides clean, filtered water straight from the tap, providing you with clean water while saving you money on bottled water (not to mention reducing the plastic bottle load at the landfill). The Clear2Go replaceable filter improves the taste and smell of water by reducing aesthetic chlorine and removing 99.9 percent of microbial cysts such as cryptosporidium and giardia. As you pour the water, the filter works by attracting and blocking particulates. One filter can process up to 100 gallons of water, which is equal to 757 store-bought 16.9-ounce water bottles. And because the filter is incorporated right into the bottle, the Clear2Go provides convenient and hassle-free clean water wherever and whenever you need it. The 24-ounce bottle is completely BPA-free, features an easy-squeeze \"fast flow\" valve for speedy hydration on the go, and comes complete with one filter.Clear2Go filters employ NanoCeram NASA-derived technology that attracts and blocks particulates such as cryptosporidium and giardia from passing through the filter. It reduces chlorine taste and odor in the water you drink by 83.8 percent and is certified by the WQA to exceed the minimum NSF/ANSI standard requirements--both Standard 42 for the reduction of aesthetic chlorine, taste, odor, and particulates, and Standard 53 for the reduction of turbidity and cysts (cryptosporidium and giardia).Features & Benefits:Removes 99.9 percent of microbial cysts including cryptosporidium and giardiaReduces aesthetic chlorine taste and odor by 83.8 percent1 filter purifies 100 gallons of water; equal to 757 16.9-ounce water bottlesNanoCeram NASA-derived filter technology attracts and blocks particulates from passing through filterEasy to use; filters water as you pourFills at any tap water sourceFirst filter includedFast flow easy-squeeze feature offers speedy hydration24-ounce capacityMade of durable Tritan material that's 100 percent BPA-free", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3155FJKmiTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00265MBSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Clear2GO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.17}}
{"item_id": "B00265MBV8", "title": "Clear2GO Grab N Go Replacement Filters, 2-Pack", "description": "Save money from expensive bottled water and reduce up to 757 in plastic bottle waste. Improves taste and smell by reducing aesthetic chlorine. Removes 99.9% of microbial cysts (cryptosporidium & giardia). Filters 100 gallons of water, equal to 757 of store bought 16.9 oz water bottles. Take it anywhere: office, home, car or gym", "text": "Clear2GO Grab N Go Replacement Filters, 2-Pack Save money from expensive bottled water and reduce up to 757 in plastic bottle waste. Improves taste and smell by reducing aesthetic chlorine. Removes 99.9% of microbial cysts (cryptosporidium & giardia). Filters 100 gallons of water, equal to 757 of store bought 16.9 oz water bottles. Take it anywhere: office, home, car or gym", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lO2FHMWFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00265MBV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Clear2GO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 3.13}}
{"item_id": "B0026634BI", "title": "DeSantis Nemesis S&W J-Frame/Bodyguard 38 Ambidextrous Black", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Nemesis S&W J-Frame/Bodyguard 38 Ambidextrous Black This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WzOJ85kAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026634BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B0026658U8", "title": "Blackhawk Sportster Deluxe Range Hunting Bag", "description": "The Blackhawk SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from Blackhawk No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "text": "Blackhawk Sportster Deluxe Range Hunting Bag The Blackhawk SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from Blackhawk No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vVkGVQV7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026658U8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026690NY", "title": "Ergon GC3 Bicycle Handlebar Grip", "description": "In some situations people simply need more hand positions. Featuring rubberized inserts for positive grip, like all of Ergon’s bar ends it can be independently positioned relative to the grip and acts as the clamp preventing accidental rotation. The grip itself is available in two sizes. Large and Small.", "text": "Ergon GC3 Bicycle Handlebar Grip In some situations people simply need more hand positions. Featuring rubberized inserts for positive grip, like all of Ergon’s bar ends it can be independently positioned relative to the grip and acts as the clamp preventing accidental rotation. The grip itself is available in two sizes. Large and Small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J%2BCedfeuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026690NY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00266AHQ8", "title": "DeSantis Nemesis LCP/P3AT Ambidextrous Black", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Nemesis LCP/P3AT Ambidextrous Black This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iFVA8EftL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266AHQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.96}}
{"item_id": "B00266D41S", "title": "McNett Saturna Blunt Tip Outdoor and Dive Knife", "description": "High quality essential tools for all outdoor activities including fishing, hunting, rafting, boating, kayaking, scuba diving and more. McNett knives are made under exacting conditions using corrosion resistant 420 stainless steel. Ultra-tough Kydex sheath features a quick release design with multiple attachment options. Completely disassembles for easy cleaning. McNett customer care @ 1-800-221-7325 (or) www.mcnett.com", "text": "McNett Saturna Blunt Tip Outdoor and Dive Knife High quality essential tools for all outdoor activities including fishing, hunting, rafting, boating, kayaking, scuba diving and more. McNett knives are made under exacting conditions using corrosion resistant 420 stainless steel. Ultra-tough Kydex sheath features a quick release design with multiple attachment options. Completely disassembles for easy cleaning. McNett customer care @ 1-800-221-7325 (or) www.mcnett.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PfMZSTDCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266D41S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Divers' Knives & Shears"]], "price": 28.19}}
{"item_id": "B00266IZBM", "title": "Hides H2O Floating Eyewear Retainer and Case", "description": "The Hides H2O is the ultimate multifunctional eyewear that floats. Made with high buoyancy neoprene, the H2O retainer and case offers excellent flotation for most sunglasses and eyewear. The Neoprene case is detachable from the retainer for a tighter fit, or wear during highly physical activities. Hides patented detachable strap system includes the Impact Expansion Joint (IEJ) shock absorber. The IEJ adds protection during high impact situations such as extreme sports, high endurance activities, racing and bodily inversion activities. The neoprene case is interchangeable with the Hides Clipcase microfiber eyewear case and lens cleaner. Build a complete Hides retainer system for your eyewear! Whether you are boating, kayaking, canoeing, rowing, surfing, fishing, in the pool or at the beach, your H2O floating eyewear retainer will give you added peace of mind!", "text": "Hides H2O Floating Eyewear Retainer and Case The Hides H2O is the ultimate multifunctional eyewear that floats. Made with high buoyancy neoprene, the H2O retainer and case offers excellent flotation for most sunglasses and eyewear. The Neoprene case is detachable from the retainer for a tighter fit, or wear during highly physical activities. Hides patented detachable strap system includes the Impact Expansion Joint (IEJ) shock absorber. The IEJ adds protection during high impact situations such as extreme sports, high endurance activities, racing and bodily inversion activities. The neoprene case is interchangeable with the Hides Clipcase microfiber eyewear case and lens cleaner. Build a complete Hides retainer system for your eyewear! Whether you are boating, kayaking, canoeing, rowing, surfing, fishing, in the pool or at the beach, your H2O floating eyewear retainer will give you added peace of mind!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TByNhAP5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266IZBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hides", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 11.62}}
{"item_id": "B00266N2PG", "title": "Stansport Steel Mug, 14-Ounce, Black Granite", "description": "Stansport Black Granite Steel 14 oz. Mug is tough, durable and can stand up to years of rugged use. It's stronger than aluminum, lead free, has a permanent non-stick finish and is easier to clean than stainless steel. Finish withstands cooking temperatures of 300 degrees and each piece is carefully polished.", "text": "Stansport Steel Mug, 14-Ounce, Black Granite Stansport Black Granite Steel 14 oz. Mug is tough, durable and can stand up to years of rugged use. It's stronger than aluminum, lead free, has a permanent non-stick finish and is easier to clean than stainless steel. Finish withstands cooking temperatures of 300 degrees and each piece is carefully polished.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BiuDzg%2BkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266N2PG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 7.33}}
{"item_id": "B00266O46C", "title": "Franklin Sports #1917 MLB 10YD Bat Tape - Black", "description": "Use the Franklin Bat Tape to make the bat easier to hold. This tape can reduce sting and absorb more of the shock when the bat hits the ball.", "text": "Franklin Sports #1917 MLB 10YD Bat Tape - Black Use the Franklin Bat Tape to make the bat easier to hold. This tape can reduce sting and absorb more of the shock when the bat hits the ball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QgU8zeWeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266O46C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MLB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Tools & Home Improvement", "Tape Measures"]], "price": 5.5}}
{"item_id": "B00266OLVK", "title": "NcSTAR 3 - 9x42 mm Mark III Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser", "description": "NcSTAR Mark III Series Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser. Tag team targeting! Take a closer look through crystal-clear optics, or opt for quick \"flash\" targeting with the integrated laser when seconds count! Gain the tactical advantage with Tac Scopes by NcSTAR, PLUS, comes with your choice of P4 Sniper, Mil-Dot, or Rangefinder reticle for targeting tailored to your needs! Feature: Illuminated blue reticle with multiple brightness settings; Integrated laser sight gives you a fast-target option; Fully multi-coated optics for enhanced contrast; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Integrated quick-release weaver-style / picatinny mounting system; Quick-focus eyepiece; Open target turrets; Angle-cut sun shade to reduce glare. Extra battery included.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 3X-9X; Objective Size: 42 mm; F.O.V.: 36.8-12'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Length: 8.5\"; Weight: 20.3 ozs.; WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 3-9x42 mm Mark III Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser", "text": "NcSTAR 3 - 9x42 mm Mark III Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser NcSTAR Mark III Series Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser. Tag team targeting! Take a closer look through crystal-clear optics, or opt for quick \"flash\" targeting with the integrated laser when seconds count! Gain the tactical advantage with Tac Scopes by NcSTAR, PLUS, comes with your choice of P4 Sniper, Mil-Dot, or Rangefinder reticle for targeting tailored to your needs! Feature: Illuminated blue reticle with multiple brightness settings; Integrated laser sight gives you a fast-target option; Fully multi-coated optics for enhanced contrast; Bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-gr. bullet; Integrated quick-release weaver-style / picatinny mounting system; Quick-focus eyepiece; Open target turrets; Angle-cut sun shade to reduce glare. Extra battery included.; State Reticle. Order on-target optics today! Magnification: 3X-9X; Objective Size: 42 mm; F.O.V.: 36.8-12'@100 yds.; Eye Relief: 2\"; Click Value: 1/2 MOA@100 yds.; Length: 8.5\"; Weight: 20.3 ozs.; WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering these products. NcSTAR 3-9x42 mm Mark III Rubber Tactical Scope with Integrated Laser", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oJBAyz%2BmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00266OLVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 117.49}}
{"item_id": "B00267KIQ6", "title": "Schrade ST1NB Tough Tool Black", "description": "This Schrade Tough Tool has it all. Blades, screw drivers, openers, scissors, file, and multi-function pliers. Perfect for the emergency kit at home or in the car. Perfect on the job site, or in the field.", "text": "Schrade ST1NB Tough Tool Black This Schrade Tough Tool has it all. Blades, screw drivers, openers, scissors, file, and multi-function pliers. Perfect for the emergency kit at home or in the car. Perfect on the job site, or in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H86HYIQvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00267KIQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.73}}
{"item_id": "B00268C0VQ", "title": "B-Square 17025 2-Pc 3/8 to Weaver Base", "description": "Made from aluminum, the Dovetail to Weaver adapter provides shooters with more options for mounting a scope. The adapter clamps to the factory dovetail and give the shooter a Weaver style rail on top. The adapter is a two piece base system, this allows placement for proper eye relief. Installs easily with no gunsmithing required.", "text": "B-Square 17025 2-Pc 3/8 to Weaver Base Made from aluminum, the Dovetail to Weaver adapter provides shooters with more options for mounting a scope. The adapter clamps to the factory dovetail and give the shooter a Weaver style rail on top. The adapter is a two piece base system, this allows placement for proper eye relief. Installs easily with no gunsmithing required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OFip3ikML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00268C0VQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B-Square", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 29.5}}
{"item_id": "B00269ZVGG", "title": "Safariland Glock 19, 23 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Glock 19, 23 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418eh7-YOIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00269ZVGG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 42.26}}
{"item_id": "B0026A6YIO", "title": "Callaway Hx Practice Balls", "description": "Practice makes perfect with the Callaway HX Practice Golf Balls. Unique patented HEX dimple pattern simulates actual ball flight at reduced distances. Soft foam construction safe to use anywhere - won't damage clubs or property. Includes mesh bag for easy storage and portability. Also great for baseball soft toss. Available in multiple colors and sizes.", "text": "Callaway Hx Practice Balls Practice makes perfect with the Callaway HX Practice Golf Balls. Unique patented HEX dimple pattern simulates actual ball flight at reduced distances. Soft foam construction safe to use anywhere - won't damage clubs or property. Includes mesh bag for easy storage and portability. Also great for baseball soft toss. Available in multiple colors and sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QxpwyeyBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026A6YIO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Practice Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0026H7SGY", "title": "Banjo Brothers Seat Bag", "description": "Banjo Brothers 01009 Mini Seat Bag is a small seat bag (33 cubic Inches) sized for a tube, tire levers, patch kit and mini tool. Perfect for road bikes. It features 360 degrees of reflective accents, a heavy-duty 840 denier nylon construction, and a wide-opening design for easier access. The three-point mounting allows for a secure fit on the back of your bike.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Seat Bag Banjo Brothers 01009 Mini Seat Bag is a small seat bag (33 cubic Inches) sized for a tube, tire levers, patch kit and mini tool. Perfect for road bikes. It features 360 degrees of reflective accents, a heavy-duty 840 denier nylon construction, and a wide-opening design for easier access. The three-point mounting allows for a secure fit on the back of your bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AZx-gx8wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026H7SGY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0026HYWRW", "title": "Black High Density Foam Rollers - Extra Firm - 6\" x 12\" Round", "description": "This foam roller will aid in stretching muscles. Use your own body weight to help increase blood flow and circulation to the soft tissues. Improve springiness and range of motion and shrink pain and soreness. Made from the highest grade foam available.", "text": "Black High Density Foam Rollers - Extra Firm - 6\" x 12\" Round This foam roller will aid in stretching muscles. Use your own body weight to help increase blood flow and circulation to the soft tissues. Improve springiness and range of motion and shrink pain and soreness. Made from the highest grade foam available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41erIhscpzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026HYWRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Foam Roller", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026IXQFU", "title": "CamelBak 0.75- Liter Stainless Steel Better Bottle", "description": "Go stainless with the CamelBak 0.75-liter Better Bottle. In addition to the environmental benefits of using a refillable water bottle, the Better Bottle offers a number of physical benefits as well. The bottle is made from medical-grade stainless steel, with none of the inner liners or plastic coatings that aluminum bottles require. As a result, the bottle is naturally BPA-free and stain-resistant, with none of the odors or tastes that plastic water bottles can accumulate over time. The bottle also offers a revolutionary Big Bite Valve that's re-energized the reusable bottle category, creating the ultimate spill-proof companion. Recently called \"the best bite valve on the planet\" byBicycling Magazine, the Big Bite Valve has no moving parts that could lead to potential leaks, ensuring that the water gets to you and not on you. The Better Bottle is available in an assortment of colorful styles.About CamelBakThe CamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved extremely popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off the handlebars. The product eventually began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits. In addition to cycling, CamelBak offers hands-free hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding, and skiing. CamelBak is a privately held company headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "text": "CamelBak 0.75- Liter Stainless Steel Better Bottle Go stainless with the CamelBak 0.75-liter Better Bottle. In addition to the environmental benefits of using a refillable water bottle, the Better Bottle offers a number of physical benefits as well. The bottle is made from medical-grade stainless steel, with none of the inner liners or plastic coatings that aluminum bottles require. As a result, the bottle is naturally BPA-free and stain-resistant, with none of the odors or tastes that plastic water bottles can accumulate over time. The bottle also offers a revolutionary Big Bite Valve that's re-energized the reusable bottle category, creating the ultimate spill-proof companion. Recently called \"the best bite valve on the planet\" byBicycling Magazine, the Big Bite Valve has no moving parts that could lead to potential leaks, ensuring that the water gets to you and not on you. The Better Bottle is available in an assortment of colorful styles.About CamelBakThe CamelBak is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. The first CamelBak products proved extremely popular among mountain bikers and motocross riders, because it allowed them to drink without taking their hands off the handlebars. The product eventually began to cross over into other sports when scientific studies showed athletes drank more fluids and performed better when they wore a CamelBak. Since then, athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use CamelBak hydration systems for their convenience and performance benefits. In addition to cycling, CamelBak offers hands-free hydration systems for hiking, running, snowboarding, and skiing. CamelBak is a privately held company headquartered in Petaluma, California.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I0GHNDjQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026IXQFU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026IXR18", "title": "CamelBak 0.4-Liter Kids Bottle", "description": "Kid sized bottles for Big adventures and easy for parents to clean", "text": "CamelBak 0.4-Liter Kids Bottle Kid sized bottles for Big adventures and easy for parents to clean", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bk8ekTvCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026IXR18.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026JELLW", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering MicroFiber Rectangle Sleeping Bag Liner", "description": "If you're tired of trying to clean the inside of your sleeping bag and it's constantly getting dirty, an ALPS Mountaineering Rectangle Sleeping Bag Liner will be a great solution. Using a liner will eliminate all the dirt that gets transferred from the great outdoors to your sleeping bag. Liners are easy to remove and toss into the washer when you get back home (a lot easier than trying to clean the whole inside of your bag!) If you ever need a light cover in the summer time, the liner can double as a sheet as well. Fabric Choices: Poly Cotton (#4900011) or MicroFiber (#5900014). Stuff sack included. Shape: Rectangle. Dimensions: 33\" x 80\". Weight: 1 pound, 5 ounces. Zipper: #5.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering MicroFiber Rectangle Sleeping Bag Liner If you're tired of trying to clean the inside of your sleeping bag and it's constantly getting dirty, an ALPS Mountaineering Rectangle Sleeping Bag Liner will be a great solution. Using a liner will eliminate all the dirt that gets transferred from the great outdoors to your sleeping bag. Liners are easy to remove and toss into the washer when you get back home (a lot easier than trying to clean the whole inside of your bag!) If you ever need a light cover in the summer time, the liner can double as a sheet as well. Fabric Choices: Poly Cotton (#4900011) or MicroFiber (#5900014). Stuff sack included. Shape: Rectangle. Dimensions: 33\" x 80\". Weight: 1 pound, 5 ounces. Zipper: #5.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S%2BDDXqUUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026JELLW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 21.01}}
{"item_id": "B0026JOS4W", "title": "Bodylastics 13 pcs *MAX TENSION (134 lbs.) Quick-Clip Resistance Bands System with 5 D.G.S.anti-snap exercise tubes and Heavy Duty components", "description": "Everything about this complete home workout system is heavy duty, from the latex, to the Patented D.G.S. (Distance Governor Safety) anti-snap technology, to the welded O-rings. Easy to use, this system is designed build or tone and tighten your body. By simply attaching and detaching the bands on or off the handles and ankle straps, you can create a custom workout with 33 levels of resistance. The included door anchors also increase the versatility so that the most effective gym exercises can be recreated almost anywhere. Ideal for all ages and fitness levels, this set will help to work your arms, legs, back, chest, shoulders, and stomach.Levels of Tension: 33Great for: Individuals of above-average strengthFeatures:Bands are dipped so they have more latex for greater resistanceHigh-grade molded nylon is used in the core of the handles and door anchorPatented D.G.S. anti-snap technology for nearly unbreakable bandsOver 1,000 free Bodylastics workouts on liveexercise.com. Simply turn on a show and follow along; no guessworkWhats in the Box?1 continuous dipped yellow band with D.G.S Technology (5 pounds)1 continuous dipped green band with D.G.S Technology (7 pounds)1 continuous dipped red band with D.G.S Technology (13 pounds)1 continuous dipped blue band with D.G.S Technology (19 pounds)1 continuous dipped black band with D.G.S Technology (23 pounds)2 extra wide heavy duty foam covered handles2 heavy duty ankle straps2 heavy duty door anchors1 Bodylastics User Book1 Year certificate with login information for the online learning center1 storage/travel bagLifetime Warranty", "text": "Bodylastics 13 pcs *MAX TENSION (134 lbs.) Quick-Clip Resistance Bands System with 5 D.G.S.anti-snap exercise tubes and Heavy Duty components Everything about this complete home workout system is heavy duty, from the latex, to the Patented D.G.S. (Distance Governor Safety) anti-snap technology, to the welded O-rings. Easy to use, this system is designed build or tone and tighten your body. By simply attaching and detaching the bands on or off the handles and ankle straps, you can create a custom workout with 33 levels of resistance. The included door anchors also increase the versatility so that the most effective gym exercises can be recreated almost anywhere. Ideal for all ages and fitness levels, this set will help to work your arms, legs, back, chest, shoulders, and stomach.Levels of Tension: 33Great for: Individuals of above-average strengthFeatures:Bands are dipped so they have more latex for greater resistanceHigh-grade molded nylon is used in the core of the handles and door anchorPatented D.G.S. anti-snap technology for nearly unbreakable bandsOver 1,000 free Bodylastics workouts on liveexercise.com. Simply turn on a show and follow along; no guessworkWhats in the Box?1 continuous dipped yellow band with D.G.S Technology (5 pounds)1 continuous dipped green band with D.G.S Technology (7 pounds)1 continuous dipped red band with D.G.S Technology (13 pounds)1 continuous dipped blue band with D.G.S Technology (19 pounds)1 continuous dipped black band with D.G.S Technology (23 pounds)2 extra wide heavy duty foam covered handles2 heavy duty ankle straps2 heavy duty door anchors1 Bodylastics User Book1 Year certificate with login information for the online learning center1 storage/travel bagLifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51I7Lzq8XjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026JOS4W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0026KEF12", "title": "Hunter's Specialties Scent-A-Way Odorless Detergent, 24-Ounce", "description": "Scent-A-Way Laundry Detergent. 24 oz bottle. Odorless.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties Scent-A-Way Odorless Detergent, 24-Ounce Scent-A-Way Laundry Detergent. 24 oz bottle. Odorless.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rvw31WPTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026KEF12.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scent Eliminators"]], "price": 9.25}}
{"item_id": "B0026LNDFU", "title": "Light-up Scooter Wheels 4-Color-LED's 100mm", "description": "Please note this is a pair (2) wheels 102mm. AXtion System's 4-led color light up scooter wheels feature super bright RED, BLUE, GREEN and ORANGE LED's. Batteries are not needed, the power to light the lights is generated by the turning of the wheel. It's also waterproof, so now not only are you encouraging your little ones to ride their scooters at night, but now they can even ride them at night in the rain! Seriously though, besides looking cool they do make the scooters much more visible and safer. These wheels have high quality 7-ball stainless steel ABEC-5 bearings with top quality lubricants", "text": "Light-up Scooter Wheels 4-Color-LED's 100mm Please note this is a pair (2) wheels 102mm. AXtion System's 4-led color light up scooter wheels feature super bright RED, BLUE, GREEN and ORANGE LED's. Batteries are not needed, the power to light the lights is generated by the turning of the wheel. It's also waterproof, so now not only are you encouraging your little ones to ride their scooters at night, but now they can even ride them at night in the rain! Seriously though, besides looking cool they do make the scooters much more visible and safer. These wheels have high quality 7-ball stainless steel ABEC-5 bearings with top quality lubricants", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZKsmMWwdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026LNDFU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Components & Parts", "Replacement Wheels"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026LQPEG", "title": "FS Mini Biner Carabiner by Metolius, One Size", "description": "FEATURES of the Metolius FS Mini Carabiner Lightweight, full-strength mini carabiner Hot forged Individually tested to 1/2 its rated strength SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius FS Mini Carabiner Major-Axis Strength: 22 kN / 4950 lbf Minor-Axis Strength: 7 kN / 1575 lbf Gate-Open Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Weight: 0.81 oz / 23 g Gate Opening: 0.66\" / 17 mm Rope-Bearing: 9.5 mm Surface Width: 0.37\" CE/UIAA certified ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "FS Mini Biner Carabiner by Metolius, One Size FEATURES of the Metolius FS Mini Carabiner Lightweight, full-strength mini carabiner Hot forged Individually tested to 1/2 its rated strength SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius FS Mini Carabiner Major-Axis Strength: 22 kN / 4950 lbf Minor-Axis Strength: 7 kN / 1575 lbf Gate-Open Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Weight: 0.81 oz / 23 g Gate Opening: 0.66\" / 17 mm Rope-Bearing: 9.5 mm Surface Width: 0.37\" CE/UIAA certified ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qQCH-6VBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026LQPEG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0026LSP76", "title": "Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner", "description": "FEATURES of the Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner Hot-forged, key-lock design Compact, pear-shaped design for belaying and rappelling Workhorse belay biner for an exceptional price Perfect for our BRD, munter hitch and other belay devices Individually tested to 1/2 its rated strength SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner Major-Axis Strength: 24 kN / 5400 lbf Minor-Axis Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Gate-Open Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Weight: 2.5 oz / 73 g Gate Opening: 0.74\" / 19 mm Rope-Bearing: 12 mm Surface Width: 0.47\" CE/UIAA certified ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner FEATURES of the Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner Hot-forged, key-lock design Compact, pear-shaped design for belaying and rappelling Workhorse belay biner for an exceptional price Perfect for our BRD, munter hitch and other belay devices Individually tested to 1/2 its rated strength SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius Element Key Lock Carabiner Major-Axis Strength: 24 kN / 5400 lbf Minor-Axis Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Gate-Open Strength: 8 kN / 1800 lbf Weight: 2.5 oz / 73 g Gate Opening: 0.74\" / 19 mm Rope-Bearing: 12 mm Surface Width: 0.47\" CE/UIAA certified ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41swOX9c7DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026LSP76.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Metolius", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B0026LZBYG", "title": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Bersa Thunder 380", "description": "The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Waistband Inside The Pant Holster for Bersa Thunder 380 The Galco Waistband IWB offers functionality and economy. Featuring a reinforced thumb break retention strap, a sturdy injection-molded nylon clip locks the holster onto the belt. The Waistband holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle, so it can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of premium center cut steerhide, the Waistband fits belts up to 13/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Waistband is available in right or left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O2n-F-k8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026LZBYG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 25.86}}
{"item_id": "B0026MCMXI", "title": "Galco Stow-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for Ruger LCP, KelTec P3AT, P32", "description": "Part of Galco's new Concealed Carry Lite line of holsters, the Stow-N-Go offers an exceptional combination of high performance, comfort and affordability. The Stow-N-Go's open top allows a very fast draw, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. A sturdy injection-molded nylon clip secures the holster onto the belt. The Stow-N-Go inside the pants holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. It can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Stow-N-Go fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Stow-N-Go is available in right hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Stow-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for Ruger LCP, KelTec P3AT, P32 Part of Galco's new Concealed Carry Lite line of holsters, the Stow-N-Go offers an exceptional combination of high performance, comfort and affordability. The Stow-N-Go's open top allows a very fast draw, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. A sturdy injection-molded nylon clip secures the holster onto the belt. The Stow-N-Go inside the pants holster carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. It can be used strong side, crossdraw, or in front of the hip (appendix carry). Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Stow-N-Go fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Stow-N-Go is available in right hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h-CqklFuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026MCMXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.99}}
