{"item_id": "B0026MMTSQ", "title": "Outdoor Research Swift Sun Hat,One Size", "description": "The Swift hat has a full mesh liner crown for superior ventilation in warm weather on the trails or for your daily run. The shaped brim and nylon panels in conjunction with the 30 UPF sun protection of the fabric offer you serious protection from the sun's harmful rays.", "text": "Outdoor Research Swift Sun Hat,One Size The Swift hat has a full mesh liner crown for superior ventilation in warm weather on the trails or for your daily run. The shaped brim and nylon panels in conjunction with the 30 UPF sun protection of the fabric offer you serious protection from the sun's harmful rays.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kFODkuh9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026MMTSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Research", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0026NB3LE", "title": "Bodylastics 19-Piece Strong Man Quick-Clip Resistance Band System", "description": "Bodylastics Super Strong Man Edition (254 lbs, 127 pounds per side) Resistance Bands System is designed to build strength, tone your muscles, and improve your overall fitness level. How effective is the Super Strong Man set? Back before the 2007 NFL football season, Bodylastics Int’l sent a few prototypes to the Dallas Cowboys' strength and conditioning coach. Not only did the coach order 10 sets on the spot, but eventually ordered enough sets for every player on the team. Everything about this system is HEAVY DUTY, from the latex, to the Patented D.G.S. (Distance Governor Safety) anti-snap technology, to the welded O-rings. Easy to use, this system is designed build or tone and tighten your body. By simply attaching and detaching the bands on or off the handles and ankle straps, you can create a custom workout with 94 levels of resistance. The included door anchors increase the versatility, so that the most effective gym exercises can be recreated almost anywhere. Ideal for all ages and fitness levels, this set will help to work your arms, legs, back, chest, shoulders, and stomach. Over 600,000 sold since 1998! ***Exclusive! Bodylastics now streams free daily, live, workout shows that ONLY use the Bodylastics bands. Muscle Building, Ab Workouts, Pilates, Body Toning, Cardio Kickboxing, Plyometrics, Sport Specific Training, Teen Workouts– we’ve got you covered. No workout Partner...No problem. It's simple - You get your Bodylastics bands...you workout with us...you see results – done!The complete system includes:1 continuous dipped yellow band with D.G.S Technology (5 lbs.)1 continuous dipped green band with D.G.S Technology (7 lbs.)1 continuous dipped red band with D.G.S Technology (13 lbs.)1 continuous dipped blue band with D.G.S Technology (19 lbs.)1 continuous dipped black band with D.G.S Technology (23 lbs.)2 continuous dipped orange bands with D.G.S Technology (30 lbs.)4 extra wide heavy duty foam covered handles4 heavy duty ankle straps2 heavy duty door anchors1 Bodylastics User Book (76 pages)1 Lifetime certificate with login information for the online learning center1 upgraded Heavy Duty gym bagLifetime Warranty", "text": "Bodylastics 19-Piece Strong Man Quick-Clip Resistance Band System Bodylastics Super Strong Man Edition (254 lbs, 127 pounds per side) Resistance Bands System is designed to build strength, tone your muscles, and improve your overall fitness level. How effective is the Super Strong Man set? Back before the 2007 NFL football season, Bodylastics Int’l sent a few prototypes to the Dallas Cowboys' strength and conditioning coach. Not only did the coach order 10 sets on the spot, but eventually ordered enough sets for every player on the team. Everything about this system is HEAVY DUTY, from the latex, to the Patented D.G.S. (Distance Governor Safety) anti-snap technology, to the welded O-rings. Easy to use, this system is designed build or tone and tighten your body. By simply attaching and detaching the bands on or off the handles and ankle straps, you can create a custom workout with 94 levels of resistance. The included door anchors increase the versatility, so that the most effective gym exercises can be recreated almost anywhere. Ideal for all ages and fitness levels, this set will help to work your arms, legs, back, chest, shoulders, and stomach. Over 600,000 sold since 1998! ***Exclusive! Bodylastics now streams free daily, live, workout shows that ONLY use the Bodylastics bands. Muscle Building, Ab Workouts, Pilates, Body Toning, Cardio Kickboxing, Plyometrics, Sport Specific Training, Teen Workouts– we’ve got you covered. No workout Partner...No problem. It's simple - You get your Bodylastics bands...you workout with us...you see results – done!The complete system includes:1 continuous dipped yellow band with D.G.S Technology (5 lbs.)1 continuous dipped green band with D.G.S Technology (7 lbs.)1 continuous dipped red band with D.G.S Technology (13 lbs.)1 continuous dipped blue band with D.G.S Technology (19 lbs.)1 continuous dipped black band with D.G.S Technology (23 lbs.)2 continuous dipped orange bands with D.G.S Technology (30 lbs.)4 extra wide heavy duty foam covered handles4 heavy duty ankle straps2 heavy duty door anchors1 Bodylastics User Book (76 pages)1 Lifetime certificate with login information for the online learning center1 upgraded Heavy Duty gym bagLifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51evpzfsJBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0026NB3LE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
