{"item_id": "B0027ICCTA", "title": "GoFit Elevated Chin Up Station", "description": "The Elevated Chin up station raises the bar for a full range of motion and takes your chin-up routine to a whole new level--literally. This multi-use Chin Up Station by GoFit incorporates a new patent-pending design that elevates you above the door frame giving more clearance and a full range of motion for a better workout.The Elevated Chin Up Station instantly and easily mounts in a standard doorway with no screws, using leverage and gravity. The Station can be used for chin ups and pull ups in several hand positions at two elevations, as well as sit ups, push ups, and dips. Abdominal straps are sold separately, to be attached onto provided eyebolt.What's in the Box?Elevated Chin Up StationAssembly HardwareLaminated Exercise BookletAssembly InstructionsSpecifications:Fits most standard doorwaysDimensions: 36 by 10.5 y 11.5 inches (W x H x D)Weight Limit: 300 pounds", "text": "GoFit Elevated Chin Up Station The Elevated Chin up station raises the bar for a full range of motion and takes your chin-up routine to a whole new level--literally. This multi-use Chin Up Station by GoFit incorporates a new patent-pending design that elevates you above the door frame giving more clearance and a full range of motion for a better workout.The Elevated Chin Up Station instantly and easily mounts in a standard doorway with no screws, using leverage and gravity. The Station can be used for chin ups and pull ups in several hand positions at two elevations, as well as sit ups, push ups, and dips. Abdominal straps are sold separately, to be attached onto provided eyebolt.What's in the Box?Elevated Chin Up StationAssembly HardwareLaminated Exercise BookletAssembly InstructionsSpecifications:Fits most standard doorwaysDimensions: 36 by 10.5 y 11.5 inches (W x H x D)Weight Limit: 300 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aiWEW7kyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027ICCTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoFit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 29.75}}
{"item_id": "B0027M0CNE", "title": "Primus Fuel Bottle", "description": "The connection threads are standard and suitable for Omni Fuel, MultiFuel, VariFuel, Gravity VF and MF and Eta Power MF as well as most common pump stoves that burn liquid fuels.", "text": "Primus Fuel Bottle The connection threads are standard and suitable for Omni Fuel, MultiFuel, VariFuel, Gravity VF and MF and Eta Power MF as well as most common pump stoves that burn liquid fuels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L5mlIQWwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027M0CNE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Empty Fuel Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0027M53MO", "title": "Finis Spandex Swim Cap", "description": "Cleanly Keep Hair off Face and Neck", "text": "Finis Spandex Swim Cap Cleanly Keep Hair off Face and Neck", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H1r83tOtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027M53MO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FINIS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0027MSC2M", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Swisstool Spirit X", "description": "Victorinox, the company that introduced the original Swiss Army knife in 1897, invigorates a new generation of adventurous craftsmen with its SwissTool Spirit X. The user-friendly multitool measures a mere 3-1/4 inches in length yet offers approximately 25 clever and convenient functions. Among the essential features for the casual camper are bottle and can openers; 2, 3, and 6 mm screwdrivers; and traditional cutting blades and scissors. However, it never hurts to be prepared, and more specialized users will no doubt appreciate the needle-nose pliers, wire cutter, chisel/scraper, wire bender, wire stripper, and crate opener. Whether you're a carpenter looking for a handy, compact tool for the job site or a cyclist who believes in vigilance, the SwissTool Spirit X multitool is a must. The tool is made of 100 percent stainless steel, with a pair of durable plier handles that fold up neatly when not in use. Many of the arms open from the outside without disturbing the handles, adding to the tool's accessibility. The tools are controlled by a series of springs that hold the arms securely in place when open or closed. The SwissTool Spirit even includes a lanyard hole for hanging around the neck (it weighs only 5-3/4 ounces), or, alternately, users can store it in the included leather case. The tool carries a lifetime warranty against defects in material and workmanship.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Swisstool Spirit X Victorinox, the company that introduced the original Swiss Army knife in 1897, invigorates a new generation of adventurous craftsmen with its SwissTool Spirit X. The user-friendly multitool measures a mere 3-1/4 inches in length yet offers approximately 25 clever and convenient functions. Among the essential features for the casual camper are bottle and can openers; 2, 3, and 6 mm screwdrivers; and traditional cutting blades and scissors. However, it never hurts to be prepared, and more specialized users will no doubt appreciate the needle-nose pliers, wire cutter, chisel/scraper, wire bender, wire stripper, and crate opener. Whether you're a carpenter looking for a handy, compact tool for the job site or a cyclist who believes in vigilance, the SwissTool Spirit X multitool is a must. The tool is made of 100 percent stainless steel, with a pair of durable plier handles that fold up neatly when not in use. Many of the arms open from the outside without disturbing the handles, adding to the tool's accessibility. The tools are controlled by a series of springs that hold the arms securely in place when open or closed. The SwissTool Spirit even includes a lanyard hole for hanging around the neck (it weighs only 5-3/4 ounces), or, alternately, users can store it in the included leather case. The tool carries a lifetime warranty against defects in material and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rNyn1osQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027MSC2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B0027PXSWS", "title": "ENO Pro Fly Rain Tarp", "description": "Hammock Accessory", "text": "ENO Pro Fly Rain Tarp Hammock Accessory", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LvFnxDAKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027PXSWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eno", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B0027QR55S", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Triple Pistol Magazine Pouch", "description": "The Voodoo Tactical Triple Pistol Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable coyote tan nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the triple pistol magazine pouch will securely hold most double stacked magazines and will also fit single stack 9mm or .45 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 7.625\" W x 4.875\" H x 1.5\" D.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Triple Pistol Magazine Pouch The Voodoo Tactical Triple Pistol Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable coyote tan nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the triple pistol magazine pouch will securely hold most double stacked magazines and will also fit single stack 9mm or .45 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 7.625\" W x 4.875\" H x 1.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eBbG8ZgjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027QR55S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0027QR5B2", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Shotgun Shell Ammo Pouch", "description": "Mount a couple of these pouches on your assault vest and you'll be ready for entry duty or close quarter combat. Of course, you can snap them into place on your chest rig, belt, pack or other MOLLE compatible gear as well.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Shotgun Shell Ammo Pouch Mount a couple of these pouches on your assault vest and you'll be ready for entry duty or close quarter combat. Of course, you can snap them into place on your chest rig, belt, pack or other MOLLE compatible gear as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414cGLff8hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027QR5B2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0027QSP1G", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Double Pistol Magazine Pouch", "description": "The Voodoo Tactical Double Pistol Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the double pistol magazine pouch will securely hold most double stacked magazines and will also fit single stack 9mm or .45 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 4.375\" W x 4.5\" H x 1.5\" D.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Double Pistol Magazine Pouch The Voodoo Tactical Double Pistol Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the double pistol magazine pouch will securely hold most double stacked magazines and will also fit single stack 9mm or .45 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 4.375\" W x 4.5\" H x 1.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513GZEfmROL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027QSP1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.59}}
{"item_id": "B0027QSPN4", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible M4/M16 Rifle Magazine Pouch", "description": "The Voodoo Tactical M4/M16 Rifle Double Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the double rifle magazine pouch will securely hold four 20 or 30-round .223 magazines for the M4/M16 or AR-15 and can adjust to hold two .308 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 6.5\" W x 6.5\" H x 2.5\" D.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible M4/M16 Rifle Magazine Pouch The Voodoo Tactical M4/M16 Rifle Double Magazine pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, weapon bag, or even inside of your pack. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with Velcro closures, the double rifle magazine pouch will securely hold four 20 or 30-round .223 magazines for the M4/M16 or AR-15 and can adjust to hold two .308 magazines. Quick release pull tabs allow for quick access and fast reloads. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 6.5\" W x 6.5\" H x 2.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Dia6-4i1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027QSPN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.7}}
{"item_id": "B0027QWNKK", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Triple Open Top Rifle Magazine Pouch fits M4", "description": "These modular magazine pouches can be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, gun bag, or even inside your pack. Mix and match them with our single and double mag pouches, pistol mag pouches, first aid pouch, radio pouch and other modular equipment to design the best load layout for your mission profile.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Triple Open Top Rifle Magazine Pouch fits M4 These modular magazine pouches can be attached to your tactical vest, belt, drop leg platform, gun bag, or even inside your pack. Mix and match them with our single and double mag pouches, pistol mag pouches, first aid pouch, radio pouch and other modular equipment to design the best load layout for your mission profile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l52Z9BXSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027QWNKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.95}}
