{"item_id": "B0027YVUC4", "title": "Hogue Winchester 1300 Overrubber Shotgun Stock 12-Inch L.O.P Kit with Forend", "description": "OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "text": "Hogue Winchester 1300 Overrubber Shotgun Stock 12-Inch L.O.P Kit with Forend OverMolding provides the ultimate in a comfortable, non-slip, super smooth attractive finish that is durable and extremely quiet. The exclusive Cobblestone texture further enhances all Hogue stocks by providing an efficient non-slip, non irritating stippling pattern. OverMolded Stocks are constructed by molding a super strong, rigid fiberglass reinforced skeleton or \"insert\" that precisely fits the guns' action. This rigid skeleton is then OverMolded with a durable but soft synthetic elastomer (rubber). During the heat and extreme pressure of injection molding the elastomer adheres chemically as well as mechanically to the skeleton, resulting in a permanent bond between the rubber and the insert. The super strong skeleton gives the stocks their strength, and the precise molded dimensions provide a perfect drop-in fit of your rifle or shotgun. The state of the art elastomer material used on Hogue stocks won't harden with age and is virtually impervious to all oils and solvents found around firearms, providing years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TsC%2BHxjKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0027YVUC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 58.99}}
{"item_id": "B00280MJXQ", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Transfer Headband,Black,One", "description": "With its high performance material, the Pearl Izumi Transfer Headband provides perfect form fit protection for underneath a helmet during cold weather cycling. Made using Pearl's exclusive P.R.O. Series Transfer fabric that combines unsurpassed moisture-transfer with a soft, comfortable brushed fabric interior. Form fitted design fits easily and comfortably under helmets. Contour shape provides protection from the wind and cold for the forehead and ears. Ponytail compatible with a center back opening. Stretch binding bottom edge construction. Black only. One size fits most. Fabric Content: 69% nylon/16% Polyester/15% Lycra. Weight: 0.6 oz.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Transfer Headband,Black,One With its high performance material, the Pearl Izumi Transfer Headband provides perfect form fit protection for underneath a helmet during cold weather cycling. Made using Pearl's exclusive P.R.O. Series Transfer fabric that combines unsurpassed moisture-transfer with a soft, comfortable brushed fabric interior. Form fitted design fits easily and comfortably under helmets. Contour shape provides protection from the wind and cold for the forehead and ears. Ponytail compatible with a center back opening. Stretch binding bottom edge construction. Black only. One size fits most. Fabric Content: 69% nylon/16% Polyester/15% Lycra. Weight: 0.6 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410XueI31VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00280MJXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]]}}
