{"item_id": "B00280MJYA", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Transfer Skull Cap,Black,One", "description": "A skull cap dedicated to keeping your head dry. P.R.O. Series Transfer fabric with Ultrasensor wicks moisture extremely well Ergonomic cut fit fits snugly over ears Layers easily under a helmet Ponytail compatible Reflective logos for low light visibility 69% Nylon/16% Polyester/15% Lycra ONE SIZE", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Transfer Skull Cap,Black,One A skull cap dedicated to keeping your head dry. P.R.O. Series Transfer fabric with Ultrasensor wicks moisture extremely well Ergonomic cut fit fits snugly over ears Layers easily under a helmet Ponytail compatible Reflective logos for low light visibility 69% Nylon/16% Polyester/15% Lycra ONE SIZE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y7DbytGlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00280MJYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Cold Weather Hats"]]}}
