{"item_id": "B00280N0DO", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Barrier Covertible Cycling Jacket", "description": "The Pearl Izumi Elite Barrier convertible jacket is a water-and wind-resistant jacket constructed of Elite-Barrier fabric for top-notch weather protection. It's lightweight and extremely packable, with Direct-Vent panels for superior ventilation and a full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage to seal in warmth. The one-piece integrated sleeves quickly zip-off for easy conversion and storage when removed. Other features include two hand-warmer pockets and one easy-access Napoleon pocket, reflective elements for low-light visibility, and a one-hand pull elastic draw cord at the waist.Features:ELITE Barrier Fabric provides superior wind and water protectionHighly packable and lightweightOne-piece, integrated sleeve zips off stores easily when removedTwo hand-warmer pockets and one easy-access Napoleon pocketFull-length draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmthReflective elements for low-light visibilitySpecifications:Shell: 100 percent polyesterLining: 100 percent polyesterFabric Weight: 115g/m2", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Barrier Covertible Cycling Jacket The Pearl Izumi Elite Barrier convertible jacket is a water-and wind-resistant jacket constructed of Elite-Barrier fabric for top-notch weather protection. It's lightweight and extremely packable, with Direct-Vent panels for superior ventilation and a full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage to seal in warmth. The one-piece integrated sleeves quickly zip-off for easy conversion and storage when removed. Other features include two hand-warmer pockets and one easy-access Napoleon pocket, reflective elements for low-light visibility, and a one-hand pull elastic draw cord at the waist.Features:ELITE Barrier Fabric provides superior wind and water protectionHighly packable and lightweightOne-piece, integrated sleeve zips off stores easily when removedTwo hand-warmer pockets and one easy-access Napoleon pocketFull-length draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmthReflective elements for low-light visibilitySpecifications:Shell: 100 percent polyesterLining: 100 percent polyesterFabric Weight: 115g/m2", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RQjFX00qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00280N0DO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]], "price": 69.99}}
