{"item_id": "B00287ZFMQ", "title": "Scotty Nylon Snap Hooks", "description": "Scotty #590-BK is a pack of six black nylon Snap Hooks. These tough nylon snap hooks are great for a multitude of tasks.", "text": "Scotty Nylon Snap Hooks Scotty #590-BK is a pack of six black nylon Snap Hooks. These tough nylon snap hooks are great for a multitude of tasks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41owG9Y9xvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00287ZFMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scotty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B002882QYU", "title": "Simmons .44 Mag Truplex Reticle Side Parallax Adjustment Riflescope, 4-12x44mm (Matte)", "description": "Signature 0.44 Mag Riflescopes from Simmons provide multi-coated optics with huge 44-millimeter objective lenses for the bright and wide field of view hunters look for. Designed for lightning fast target acquisition, the scopes all feature trademark QTA (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepieces with generous 3.75-inch eye relief for user comfort. Meanwhile, the TrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system offers 1/4 and 1/8 MOA fingertip adjustments, allowing you to lock in your zero with confidence. Finally, one-piece tube construction with waterproof, fogproof, and recoil-proof construction stand up to the most demanding field applications with less overall weight and more durability.The 441124 Signature Mag 0.44 Riflescope features 4 to 12x adjustable magnification to deliver a close up view without sacrificing the wide-angle field range. The scope comes equipped with a Truplex aiming reticule and offers side parallax adjustment for increased precision.Truplex Target TurretSignature 0.44 Mag Riflescope Features:One-piece, one-inch tube construction for reduced weight, better handling, and durabilityMulti-coated, high-quality optics for clearer, brighter imageQTA (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepiece with Fast FocusComfortable 3.75-inch eye reliefTrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system for a locked-in zeroPrecise 1/4 and 1/8 MOA fingertip windage and elevation adjustmentsSide parallax adjustmentWaterproof, fogproof, and recoil-proof construction441124 Specifications:Objective lens diameter: 44 millimetersMagnification: 4-12xReticle: TruplexField of View: 23.8 to 8.2 feet at 100 yards / 7.9 to 2.7 meters at 100 metersClick Value: 0.25 inches at 100 yards / 7 meters at 100 metersAdjustment: 60 inches at 100 yards / 1.7 meters at 100 metersEye relief: 3.75 inches / 95 millimetersExit Pupil: 11 to 3.7 millimetersWeight: 13.3 ounces / 377 gramsFinish: Matte", "text": "Simmons .44 Mag Truplex Reticle Side Parallax Adjustment Riflescope, 4-12x44mm (Matte) Signature 0.44 Mag Riflescopes from Simmons provide multi-coated optics with huge 44-millimeter objective lenses for the bright and wide field of view hunters look for. Designed for lightning fast target acquisition, the scopes all feature trademark QTA (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepieces with generous 3.75-inch eye relief for user comfort. Meanwhile, the TrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system offers 1/4 and 1/8 MOA fingertip adjustments, allowing you to lock in your zero with confidence. Finally, one-piece tube construction with waterproof, fogproof, and recoil-proof construction stand up to the most demanding field applications with less overall weight and more durability.The 441124 Signature Mag 0.44 Riflescope features 4 to 12x adjustable magnification to deliver a close up view without sacrificing the wide-angle field range. The scope comes equipped with a Truplex aiming reticule and offers side parallax adjustment for increased precision.Truplex Target TurretSignature 0.44 Mag Riflescope Features:One-piece, one-inch tube construction for reduced weight, better handling, and durabilityMulti-coated, high-quality optics for clearer, brighter imageQTA (Quick Target Acquisition) eyepiece with Fast FocusComfortable 3.75-inch eye reliefTrueZero windage and elevation adjustment system for a locked-in zeroPrecise 1/4 and 1/8 MOA fingertip windage and elevation adjustmentsSide parallax adjustmentWaterproof, fogproof, and recoil-proof construction441124 Specifications:Objective lens diameter: 44 millimetersMagnification: 4-12xReticle: TruplexField of View: 23.8 to 8.2 feet at 100 yards / 7.9 to 2.7 meters at 100 metersClick Value: 0.25 inches at 100 yards / 7 meters at 100 metersAdjustment: 60 inches at 100 yards / 1.7 meters at 100 metersEye relief: 3.75 inches / 95 millimetersExit Pupil: 11 to 3.7 millimetersWeight: 13.3 ounces / 377 gramsFinish: Matte", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HGM%2BIFI6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002882QYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 94.99}}
