{"item_id": "B00288NC5C", "title": "Greenfield KS2SB Kickstand With Retro Kit Black", "description": "Greenfield's Kickstand enjoys enormous popularity. It's lightweight, durable, and looks great on any bike. Kickstand features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Non-Slip Clamping Surface, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin, Zinc Plated Screw, Calibrated Stem, and Solid Non-porous Casting. Weight: Only 266 grams", "text": "Greenfield KS2SB Kickstand With Retro Kit Black Greenfield's Kickstand enjoys enormous popularity. It's lightweight, durable, and looks great on any bike. Kickstand features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Non-Slip Clamping Surface, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin, Zinc Plated Screw, Calibrated Stem, and Solid Non-porous Casting. Weight: Only 266 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31n5SXMXT3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00288NC5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Greenfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 7.89}}
{"item_id": "B00288OPDK", "title": "Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants Wood 'N' Trail Camo", "description": "Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants... soft and comfortable with can't - bust - it durability! Click image to enlarge... Slip on these warm Fleece Pants to lock out cool weather when you step outdoors. All the good stuff: Features a 250-gram,100% polyester fleece construction Adjustable cord waistband offers a comfortable fit Elastic ankle cuff fits snugly over your boots or shoes 2 hand warmer pockets Machine wash / dry. Imported. State Size, as available in the Shopping Cart below. It's simple... put 'em on and stay warm in brisk weather! Order yours ONLINE today! Please Note: This item is shipped directly from the factory. To see the expected shipping date, please add it to your Shopping Cart. Sorry, no express shipping available. We are unable to ship factory direct items to Puerto Rico or APO or FPO addresses. Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants,Wood 'N' Trail Camo", "text": "Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants Wood 'N' Trail Camo Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants... soft and comfortable with can't - bust - it durability! Click image to enlarge... Slip on these warm Fleece Pants to lock out cool weather when you step outdoors. All the good stuff: Features a 250-gram,100% polyester fleece construction Adjustable cord waistband offers a comfortable fit Elastic ankle cuff fits snugly over your boots or shoes 2 hand warmer pockets Machine wash / dry. Imported. State Size, as available in the Shopping Cart below. It's simple... put 'em on and stay warm in brisk weather! Order yours ONLINE today! Please Note: This item is shipped directly from the factory. To see the expected shipping date, please add it to your Shopping Cart. Sorry, no express shipping available. We are unable to ship factory direct items to Puerto Rico or APO or FPO addresses. Big Bill Northland Fleece Pants,Wood 'N' Trail Camo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XQFaje71L._SY300_.jpg", "