{"item_id": "B0028AQLYE", "title": "FINIS Swimmer's Snorkel Dry Top", "description": "The Swimmer's Snorkel Dry-Top by FINIS is a new patented design attachment to help keep your snorkel free of water. When submerging under the water, a small buoy inside the Dry-Top rises, effectively sealing the tube. Water is then prevented from entering, keeping your snorkel completely dry! When you surface, the buoy drops, opening the air passage for maximum airflow.", "text": "FINIS Swimmer's Snorkel Dry Top The Swimmer's Snorkel Dry-Top by FINIS is a new patented design attachment to help keep your snorkel free of water. When submerging under the water, a small buoy inside the Dry-Top rises, effectively sealing the tube. Water is then prevented from entering, keeping your snorkel completely dry! When you surface, the buoy drops, opening the air passage for maximum airflow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IrhCY153L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028AQLYE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FINIS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkels"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0028CU44K", "title": "USED German Military Mess Kit Flatware - Nesting", "description": "Authentic German military-issued flatware set, made in Germany with classic German engineeringPractical, full-size utensils neatly nest together for compact storage & carrying4-piece mess kit includes 7-1/2\" fork, serrated-edge knife and over-sized spoonCombination can & bottle opener doubles as unique clasp to hold all tightly togetherHigh-grade non-rusting stainless steel. Recent military issued/used in very good condition.", "text": "USED German Military Mess Kit Flatware - Nesting Authentic German military-issued flatware set, made in Germany with classic German engineeringPractical, full-size utensils neatly nest together for compact storage & carrying4-piece mess kit includes 7-1/2\" fork, serrated-edge knife and over-sized spoonCombination can & bottle opener doubles as unique clasp to hold all tightly togetherHigh-grade non-rusting stainless steel. Recent military issued/used in very good condition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jk%2BtBCanL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028CU44K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0028EBRWQ", "title": "Mammut Skywalker 2 Climbing Helmet", "description": "Well-ventilated climber's helmet with ergonomic fit made from extremely durable plastic hard shell. The thumb wheel enables quick, single-handed adjustment. New with stronger EPS inner for a longer life span. Optimally suited for Via Ferrata, Expeditions, Speleology / Caving, Classical Alpinism, Mixed- and Iceclimbing, Rescue / Guide / Work. Suitable for Multipitch Rockclimbing, Sportsclimbing .", "text": "Mammut Skywalker 2 Climbing Helmet Well-ventilated climber's helmet with ergonomic fit made from extremely durable plastic hard shell. The thumb wheel enables quick, single-handed adjustment. New with stronger EPS inner for a longer life span. Optimally suited for Via Ferrata, Expeditions, Speleology / Caving, Classical Alpinism, Mixed- and Iceclimbing, Rescue / Guide / Work. Suitable for Multipitch Rockclimbing, Sportsclimbing .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sYdrqnp%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028EBRWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mammut", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Helmets"]], "price": 59.95}}
