{"item_id": "B0028JNRW4", "title": "Burris 410341 AR PEPR 30-mm Scope Mount (Black)", "description": "The Burris AR-332 Prism Sight is a 3x tactical sights that's rugged, compact, and waterproof. It features Burris's unique Ballistic/CQ reticle that performs at long range too, with a bullet compensation out to 500 yards.", "text": "Burris 410341 AR PEPR 30-mm Scope Mount (Black) The Burris AR-332 Prism Sight is a 3x tactical sights that's rugged, compact, and waterproof. It features Burris's unique Ballistic/CQ reticle that performs at long range too, with a bullet compensation out to 500 yards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ST8ymSjWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028JNRW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers"]], "price": 79.16}}
