{"item_id": "B0028M9ZBI", "title": "MTM Front Rifle Rest", "description": "Looking for an affordable, \"all-around\" Front Rifle Rest? You just found it! The versatile, MTM Front Rifle Rest offers excellent, rock-solid stability at a price any shooter can afford. This three legged rest not only accommodates nearly any shape gun stock but handgun enthusiasts will find it just as accurate.", "text": "MTM Front Rifle Rest Looking for an affordable, \"all-around\" Front Rifle Rest? You just found it! The versatile, MTM Front Rifle Rest offers excellent, rock-solid stability at a price any shooter can afford. This three legged rest not only accommodates nearly any shape gun stock but handgun enthusiasts will find it just as accurate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BoMOxM62L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028M9ZBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 30.64}}
{"item_id": "B0028MCOAM", "title": "Meprolight Smith & Wesson Tru-Dot Night Sight for M&P full size, compact & sub-compact. Fixed set", "description": "The ML11766 is a fixed set for the Smith and Wesson M&P; full size and compact 9mm and .40 caliber pistols. Please note, S&W; offers many heights of front sight. Meprolight produces the most common height. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "text": "Meprolight Smith & Wesson Tru-Dot Night Sight for M&P full size, compact & sub-compact. Fixed set The ML11766 is a fixed set for the Smith and Wesson M&P; full size and compact 9mm and .40 caliber pistols. Please note, S&W; offers many heights of front sight. Meprolight produces the most common height. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AqHLJIDML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028MCOAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meprolight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 100.63}}
{"item_id": "B0028MLRIM", "title": "Primos Hunting Squirrel Buster Call Pack", "description": "From the distress squeal of a young squirrel to the chatter of fox and grey squirrel, this call does it all. You won't be disappointed with your selection.", "text": "Primos Hunting Squirrel Buster Call Pack From the distress squeal of a young squirrel to the chatter of fox and grey squirrel, this call does it all. You won't be disappointed with your selection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310HO-DpTIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028MLRIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls"]], "price": 12.98}}
{"item_id": "B0028MNJ42", "title": "Western Recreation Vista Big John Back Quiver Camo", "description": "Comfortable for all practice situations.Lil John has a 14 deep arrow pocket.Big John has a 20 deep arrow pocket.Reversible right to left hand.UNIT OF MEASURE: EA", "text": "Western Recreation Vista Big John Back Quiver Camo Comfortable for all practice situations.Lil John has a 14 deep arrow pocket.Big John has a 20 deep arrow pocket.Reversible right to left hand.UNIT OF MEASURE: EA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415Z9BGaUCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028MNJ42.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Western Recreation", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Quivers"]], "price": 24.71}}
{"item_id": "B0028MTBJ4", "title": "Competition Electronics ProChrono Digital Chronograph", "description": "Digital chronograph Large 4-digit LCD readout 21-7000 fps measurement Meters per second (mps) or feet per second (fps) readout Stores 9 shot strings with up to 99 shots each in power down memory Review each velocity and shot string data Records average velocity, standard deviation and extreme spread Delete individual shots or entire string with the touch of a button Serial data connection port for use with remote accessories 32-100 deg. F operating temperature range 250 mSec to 500 mSec time between shots 750 nSec crystal-controlled shot timing resolution +/-1% or better accuracy of measured velocity 1/4x20 mounting hole thread 3/16x16 guide wire size 16x4x3.25 15 mAh power consumption On/off switch Uses one 9V alkaline battery (not included)There are lots of optional accessories you can get to customize your Competition Electronics ProChrono digital chronograph. The accuracy of this chronograph is so well-respected in the shooting industry, that this chronograph is used for the record in Bianchi Cup events. Use the ProChrono chronograph to measure the velocities of your airguns, firearms and airsoft guns. It can do it all!", "text": "Competition Electronics ProChrono Digital Chronograph Digital chronograph Large 4-digit LCD readout 21-7000 fps measurement Meters per second (mps) or feet per second (fps) readout Stores 9 shot strings with up to 99 shots each in power down memory Review each velocity and shot string data Records average velocity, standard deviation and extreme spread Delete individual shots or entire string with the touch of a button Serial data connection port for use with remote accessories 32-100 deg. F operating temperature range 250 mSec to 500 mSec time between shots 750 nSec crystal-controlled shot timing resolution +/-1% or better accuracy of measured velocity 1/4x20 mounting hole thread 3/16x16 guide wire size 16x4x3.25 15 mAh power consumption On/off switch Uses one 9V alkaline battery (not included)There are lots of optional accessories you can get to customize your Competition Electronics ProChrono digital chronograph. The accuracy of this chronograph is so well-respected in the shooting industry, that this chronograph is used for the record in Bianchi Cup events. Use the ProChrono chronograph to measure the velocities of your airguns, firearms and airsoft guns. It can do it all!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dc54dLCYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028MTBJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Competition Electronics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 97.97}}
