{"item_id": "B0028PGR6G", "title": "Plano 108115 AW Bow Case Black", "description": "Designed to keep your bow and accessories protected in the most extreme conditions, the Bow Guard AW Case offers thick walled construction, crush resistant strength thanks to the PillarLock System, and complete protection against the elements thanks to a rubberized seal to keep water, air and dust out of the case. Built and approved for airline travel, the AW Case allows for fully loaded quiver storage of in-line or offset quivers (mounting bracket required not included, contact quiver manufacturer for bracket). Meanwhile elastomeric arrow retainers hold both standard and carbon fiber arrows while secure holding straps for strings and limbs protect the bow from shifting during transport.The AW Bow Case latches provide security for travel and storage.Features and Specifications:Rugged thick-wall constructionCrush resistant PillarLock systemLockable, spring assisted dual-stage latchesAllows for the storage of a fully-loaded quiver (mounting bracket required)Weather resistant rubber sealAdditional accessory tie-down strap includedElastomeric arrow storage fits both standard and carbon fiber arrowsPadlock tabs for airline travelExterior dimensions: 48 by 20.75 by 7.5 inchesInterior dimensions: 46.5 by 16 by 6.75 inches", "text": "Plano 108115 AW Bow Case Black Designed to keep your bow and accessories protected in the most extreme conditions, the Bow Guard AW Case offers thick walled construction, crush resistant strength thanks to the PillarLock System, and complete protection against the elements thanks to a rubberized seal to keep water, air and dust out of the case. Built and approved for airline travel, the AW Case allows for fully loaded quiver storage of in-line or offset quivers (mounting bracket required not included, contact quiver manufacturer for bracket). Meanwhile elastomeric arrow retainers hold both standard and carbon fiber arrows while secure holding straps for strings and limbs protect the bow from shifting during transport.The AW Bow Case latches provide security for travel and storage.Features and Specifications:Rugged thick-wall constructionCrush resistant PillarLock systemLockable, spring assisted dual-stage latchesAllows for the storage of a fully-loaded quiver (mounting bracket required)Weather resistant rubber sealAdditional accessory tie-down strap includedElastomeric arrow storage fits both standard and carbon fiber arrowsPadlock tabs for airline travelExterior dimensions: 48 by 20.75 by 7.5 inchesInterior dimensions: 46.5 by 16 by 6.75 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41URRsGReFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028PGR6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 109.61}}
