{"item_id": "B0028XERR4", "title": "Granger XT Waterproofer", "description": "Advanced spray-on formula adds durable water and stain repellency to all outdoor fabrics and enhances breathability. XT is ideal for any garments with wicking linings, such as soft shells, and also insulated garments and sleeping bags.", "text": "Granger XT Waterproofer Advanced spray-on formula adds durable water and stain repellency to all outdoor fabrics and enhances breathability. XT is ideal for any garments with wicking linings, such as soft shells, and also insulated garments and sleeping bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318gfpmZStL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028XERR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0028XY4RW", "title": "Knog Nerd 9 Function Bicycle Computer", "description": "The Knog Nerd 9-Function Bicycle Computer offers a fun and efficient way to record your cycle stats with smart, simple functionality and painless tool/wire-free set up. Rather than hassling with connecting wires and rubber cutouts, the Nerd uses a silicon tension fit system that simply wraps around your handlebar or stem for your preferred vantage point. The wireless transmitter attaches the same way--so that you are good to go--finished with \"installation\" in seconds--and without a single tool. This super-speedy and easy installation also makes the Nerd a great computer to move between bikes.After you have installed your Nerd it is time to experience the computer's functionality. The wireless Nerd will transmit information without interference from any of the cellular/electronic noise of your surroundings. With single button operation, the Nerd's face functions as one big button, allowing you to scroll between its nine functions with ease. Pressing the face allows you to either display individual functions or cycle through all available function screens in a looped sequence using scan mode. The computer allows you to view data through numeric representations as well as with visual representation bars that show your current speed versus your average speed.With nine functions and the ability to maintain unique data between rides, the Nerd allows you to document, review, and analyze your riding data to your heart's content on and off the bike. The Nerd displays current speed and a 12/24 hour clock and computes your average speed, maximum speed, and relative speed output as a bar graph of your current versus average speed. In addition, the Nerd records trip distance and total riding time and has an odometer and low-battery indicator.The Knog Nerd offers unequaled ease of use, ease of installation, and smart functionality for biking. The computer is also 100 percent waterproof for worry-free use in any weather conditions.Features:Animated rolling displayTouch screen functionalityCan be set up for use on two bikesThe Nerd 9-function bike computer comes in several striking colors.Maintains unique data between ridesSimple tool-less attachment to handlebar or stemNo signal or function interference100 percent waterproofMaterials: Medical grade siliconFunctions:Current speed12/24 hour clockTrip distanceAverage speedMaximum speedRelative speed gauge (output as a bar graph of current vs. average speed)Total riding timeOdometerScanning (will display all functions in a looped sequence)Low-battery indicatorSize Specifications:Nerd Weight: 45 gramsTransmitter Weight: 39 gramsMain unit size: 53 x 51 x 40 millimetersTransmitter size: 52 x 27 x 52 millimetersBatteries:1 CR2032 3V cell: N.E.R.D.1 LR44 1.5V cell: TransmitterBattery life: Approximately 1-2 years with normal operationWhat's in the Box?Nerd computer, transmitter, silicone attachment for computer and transmitterManufacturer's WarrantyTwo-year limited warranty", "text": "Knog Nerd 9 Function Bicycle Computer The Knog Nerd 9-Function Bicycle Computer offers a fun and efficient way to record your cycle stats with smart, simple functionality and painless tool/wire-free set up. Rather than hassling with connecting wires and rubber cutouts, the Nerd uses a silicon tension fit system that simply wraps around your handlebar or stem for your preferred vantage point. The wireless transmitter attaches the same way--so that you are good to go--finished with \"installation\" in seconds--and without a single tool. This super-speedy and easy installation also makes the Nerd a great computer to move between bikes.After you have installed your Nerd it is time to experience the computer's functionality. The wireless Nerd will transmit information without interference from any of the cellular/electronic noise of your surroundings. With single button operation, the Nerd's face functions as one big button, allowing you to scroll between its nine functions with ease. Pressing the face allows you to either display individual functions or cycle through all available function screens in a looped sequence using scan mode. The computer allows you to view data through numeric representations as well as with visual representation bars that show your current speed versus your average speed.With nine functions and the ability to maintain unique data between rides, the Nerd allows you to document, review, and analyze your riding data to your heart's content on and off the bike. The Nerd displays current speed and a 12/24 hour clock and computes your average speed, maximum speed, and relative speed output as a bar graph of your current versus average speed. In addition, the Nerd records trip distance and total riding time and has an odometer and low-battery indicator.The Knog Nerd offers unequaled ease of use, ease of installation, and smart functionality for biking. The computer is also 100 percent waterproof for worry-free use in any weather conditions.Features:Animated rolling displayTouch screen functionalityCan be set up for use on two bikesThe Nerd 9-function bike computer comes in several striking colors.Maintains unique data between ridesSimple tool-less attachment to handlebar or stemNo signal or function interference100 percent waterproofMaterials: Medical grade siliconFunctions:Current speed12/24 hour clockTrip distanceAverage speedMaximum speedRelative speed gauge (output as a bar graph of current vs. average speed)Total riding timeOdometerScanning (will display all functions in a looped sequence)Low-battery indicatorSize Specifications:Nerd Weight: 45 gramsTransmitter Weight: 39 gramsMain unit size: 53 x 51 x 40 millimetersTransmitter size: 52 x 27 x 52 millimetersBatteries:1 CR2032 3V cell: N.E.R.D.1 LR44 1.5V cell: TransmitterBattery life: Approximately 1-2 years with normal operationWhat's in the Box?Nerd computer, transmitter, silicone attachment for computer and transmitterManufacturer's WarrantyTwo-year limited warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V5rLdQ1KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028XY4RW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B0028YRJE6", "title": "Park Tool Socket and Bit Set", "description": "The SBS-1 is a shop quality set of sockets, hex bits and Torx style bits for the bike mechanic. Ideal for use with Park Tool Torque Wrenches, the SBS-1's 3/8\" drive bits and sockets are made from tough, chrome vanadium steel for long life Includes.", "text": "Park Tool Socket and Bit Set The SBS-1 is a shop quality set of sockets, hex bits and Torx style bits for the bike mechanic. Ideal for use with Park Tool Torque Wrenches, the SBS-1's 3/8\" drive bits and sockets are made from tough, chrome vanadium steel for long life Includes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dvdq4kq-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YRJE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B0028YUZJC", "title": "Park Tool Work Tray (For PCS-1, PCS-4, PCS-9, PCS-10, PCS-11, and PRS-15)", "description": "A great work stand accessory built to keep tools, lubes and spare parts close at hand. The #106 installs directly and easily utilizing our exclusive receiver pod accessory system found on the PRS-25, PRS-15, PCS-10 and PCS-11 Repair Stands. The #106 Work Tray also fits the PRS-20 and PRS-21 from 2012. Any of the PRS-20 and PRS-21 previous to 2012 can add the #1707.2 Collar to fit the tray, as well as most post-1996 PCS stands without height adjustment (1-5/8\" tube).", "text": "Park Tool Work Tray (For PCS-1, PCS-4, PCS-9, PCS-10, PCS-11, and PRS-15) A great work stand accessory built to keep tools, lubes and spare parts close at hand. The #106 installs directly and easily utilizing our exclusive receiver pod accessory system found on the PRS-25, PRS-15, PCS-10 and PCS-11 Repair Stands. The #106 Work Tray also fits the PRS-20 and PRS-21 from 2012. Any of the PRS-20 and PRS-21 previous to 2012 can add the #1707.2 Collar to fit the tray, as well as most post-1996 PCS stands without height adjustment (1-5/8\" tube).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x2X5953ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YUZJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 30.56}}
{"item_id": "B0028YUZSS", "title": "Park Tool Compact Crank Puller", "description": "The universal design of the CWP-7 has a rotating tip pressed into each end of the tool (11.3mm and 16.3mm) so it will remove both square taper and splined (ISIS Drive, Octalink) crank arms. The CWP-7 is made for the 22 x 1mm threading in the common cranks.", "text": "Park Tool Compact Crank Puller The universal design of the CWP-7 has a rotating tip pressed into each end of the tool (11.3mm and 16.3mm) so it will remove both square taper and splined (ISIS Drive, Octalink) crank arms. The CWP-7 is made for the 22 x 1mm threading in the common cranks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fEv3GwIeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YUZSS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 13.46}}
{"item_id": "B0028YVE6U", "title": "H&K USP CO2 BB Pistol air pistol", "description": "H&K; USP pistol CO2-powered Uses one 12-gram CO2 cartridge Shoots steel BBs 22-shot removable BB mag also holds CO2 cartridge Double-action only Fixed front and rear sights Integrated Weaver accessory rail under the barrel (no slots) Realistic hammer movement Never shoot steel BBs at hard objects ... H&K; USP CO2 BB pistol with 22-rd removable mag...", "text": "H&K USP CO2 BB Pistol air pistol H&K; USP pistol CO2-powered Uses one 12-gram CO2 cartridge Shoots steel BBs 22-shot removable BB mag also holds CO2 cartridge Double-action only Fixed front and rear sights Integrated Weaver accessory rail under the barrel (no slots) Realistic hammer movement Never shoot steel BBs at hard objects ... H&K; USP CO2 BB pistol with 22-rd removable mag...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y6mrco0dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YVE6U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 48.34}}
{"item_id": "B0028YWHPW", "title": "Park Tool Derailleur Hanger Alignment Gauge", "description": "An updated version of the popular DAG-1, the new DAG-2 utilizes a longer measuring pointer, longer threaded stud and a longer, narrower alignment boss to fit a wider variety of bikes.", "text": "Park Tool Derailleur Hanger Alignment Gauge An updated version of the popular DAG-1, the new DAG-2 utilizes a longer measuring pointer, longer threaded stud and a longer, narrower alignment boss to fit a wider variety of bikes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xbr2MXEXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YWHPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters"]], "price": 67.46}}
{"item_id": "B0028YYKNO", "title": "SealLine EcoSee Clear Dry Bag", "description": "The EcoSee Bag delivers a host of performance benefits, making it our premium transparent dry bag in every respect. Extra tough urethane outshines traditional vinyl with superior abrasion resistance, lighter weight, better cold-weather performance and an improved seal. Plus it is 100% PVC-free, making it a great alternative for your eco-minded customers who are looking to make environmentally responsible purchases.", "text": "SealLine EcoSee Clear Dry Bag The EcoSee Bag delivers a host of performance benefits, making it our premium transparent dry bag in every respect. Extra tough urethane outshines traditional vinyl with superior abrasion resistance, lighter weight, better cold-weather performance and an improved seal. Plus it is 100% PVC-free, making it a great alternative for your eco-minded customers who are looking to make environmentally responsible purchases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u2FfQDrYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028YYKNO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0028ZAO60", "title": "CST - Cheng Shin Tire C-740 Road tire Wire Bead 700", "description": "CST - Cheng Shin Tire C-740 Road tire Wire Bead 700. Great Valve Road Tire ! Tough & Long Tread Life ! Grooved Tread with Directional Siping for Wet Conditions. Weighs only 400g s. 100 PSI. 27 TPI.", "text": "CST - Cheng Shin Tire C-740 Road tire Wire Bead 700 CST - Cheng Shin Tire C-740 Road tire Wire Bead 700. Great Valve Road Tire ! Tough & Long Tread Life ! Grooved Tread with Directional Siping for Wet Conditions. Weighs only 400g s. 100 PSI. 27 TPI.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21wGlkI02lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028ZAO60.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CST", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 20.93}}
