{"item_id": "B0028ZZUKK", "title": "Gamma Elite Head Band", "description": "3 ply thickness, made from ultra plush terry cloth. Highly absorbent for maximum comfort and superior durability. One size fits all. 1/pkg", "text": "Gamma Elite Head Band 3 ply thickness, made from ultra plush terry cloth. Highly absorbent for maximum comfort and superior durability. One size fits all. 1/pkg", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312WBe90eRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0028ZZUKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamma", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 5.39}}
{"item_id": "B00292SHKC", "title": "SE Blk Plastic Gold Mining Pan Clean Prospecting Panning 13-", "description": "Brand new gold mining pan. This is a very sturdy, hard plastic pan with concentric ridges on one side, and funnel-shaped ridges on the other side (for pouring off the water.) This pan is sturdy but also very lightweight. The surface feels like it is teflon-coated. Dimensions: 13 1/2 diameter, and 2 1/2 deep", "text": "SE Blk Plastic Gold Mining Pan Clean Prospecting Panning 13- Brand new gold mining pan. This is a very sturdy, hard plastic pan with concentric ridges on one side, and funnel-shaped ridges on the other side (for pouring off the water.) This pan is sturdy but also very lightweight. The surface feels like it is teflon-coated. Dimensions: 13 1/2 diameter, and 2 1/2 deep", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dt01oqsgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00292SHKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sona Enterprises", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 5.12}}
{"item_id": "B00295ERRG", "title": "Pure Hydration Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Drinking Vessel", "description": "Your search is over Pure Hydration makes one of the best insulated stainless steel bottles on the market. Our bottles all feature screw on lids made from # 5 poly propylene and FDA approved silicone seals so you are guaranteed to have a bottle that will not leak. We use only high quality #304 Korean stainless steel, so you will not to get a tinny taste like other lower quality bottles. The 100% BPA free and recyclable bottles feature a wide opening making them very easy to both clean, and get ice cubes in. Each bottle ships with two very strong tea and ice strainers, so your tea leaves and ice stay in the bottle where they belong; not in your mouth. The bottle feature a vacuum sealed double wall stainless steel construction that is triple insulated. Very few companies bother with the expense of triple insulation, but rest assured every one of our bottles has this feature. Based on customer feedback over the years we have continued to improve on this product. One change that we made was making the drinking spout black. Why you ask, to hide all those annoying lipstick stains of coarse. The second improvement was to reduce the number of screw threads on our cap, so you can access your drink with only 3/4 of one turn. That is a reduction of 1 full turn from the previous model. We are confident that once you have tried this product you too will agree that this is the best bottle on the market and wonder how you lived this long without it.", "text": "Pure Hydration Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Drinking Vessel Your search is over Pure Hydration makes one of the best insulated stainless steel bottles on the market. Our bottles all feature screw on lids made from # 5 poly propylene and FDA approved silicone seals so you are guaranteed to have a bottle that will not leak. We use only high quality #304 Korean stainless steel, so you will not to get a tinny taste like other lower quality bottles. The 100% BPA free and recyclable bottles feature a wide opening making them very easy to both clean, and get ice cubes in. Each bottle ships with two very strong tea and ice strainers, so your tea leaves and ice stay in the bottle where they belong; not in your mouth. The bottle feature a vacuum sealed double wall stainless steel construction that is triple insulated. Very few companies bother with the expense of triple insulation, but rest assured every one of our bottles has this feature. Based on customer feedback over the years we have continued to improve on this product. One change that we made was making the drinking spout black. Why you ask, to hide all those annoying lipstick stains of coarse. The second improvement was to reduce the number of screw threads on our cap, so you can access your drink with only 3/4 of one turn. That is a reduction of 1 full turn from the previous model. We are confident that once you have tried this product you too will agree that this is the best bottle on the market and wonder how you lived this long without it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BUNlSDmNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00295ERRG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002970M1E", "title": "Genji Sports Pop Up Family Beach Tent And Beach Sunshelter", "description": "Self Expanded Beach Sun shelter tent. Auto pop opened in one second, easily folded down in 3 seconds. Packed in a 22-Inch carrying shoulder bag. Light weigh, easy to carry, suitable for beach, park and outdoor activities. Durable T190 nylon UV protected Nylon (50+ UPF) rating on 3 sides of tent, flame retardant nylon meets CPAI-84 standard. Zippers back panel can be opened or closed. 2 large side screen windows allow more fresh air to breezes through, both windows come with roll up cover. This self erecting tent is an excellent outdoor must have equipment to carry to all outdoor activities, specially for the family with baby and children, it can prevent youngster over exposed under the sun and give parent a nice relaxing shelter to read or take a nap.An optional beach sun shelter water proof tent cover is available, it converts sun shelter into a standard camping tent in seconds. The special designed water proof cover equip with zipper, ventilation windows and 4 ground stakes.Beach Sun shelter tent Specifications:*Self expanded in one second, folds down in 3 second.*3 sides and floor are made from durable T190 nylon cloth, UV protective coating rating 50 + UPF, flame resistance nylon meets CPAI-84 standard. 2 side screen windows with roll up cover. Fully opened zipper back panel. Strong steel beam frame covered by 600D Oxford nylon, light weight and durable. Comes with 4 plastic ground stakes, sand bags pockets on both side panels. Full size carrying case with shoulder strap. Tent dimension 82.7 x 52 x 50-Inch (length x width x height). Large enough for two adults or one adult and many kids. Weight 4-Pounds 7-Ounce.", "text": "Genji Sports Pop Up Family Beach Tent And Beach Sunshelter Self Expanded Beach Sun shelter tent. Auto pop opened in one second, easily folded down in 3 seconds. Packed in a 22-Inch carrying shoulder bag. Light weigh, easy to carry, suitable for beach, park and outdoor activities. Durable T190 nylon UV protected Nylon (50+ UPF) rating on 3 sides of tent, flame retardant nylon meets CPAI-84 standard. Zippers back panel can be opened or closed. 2 large side screen windows allow more fresh air to breezes through, both windows come with roll up cover. This self erecting tent is an excellent outdoor must have equipment to carry to all outdoor activities, specially for the family with baby and children, it can prevent youngster over exposed under the sun and give parent a nice relaxing shelter to read or take a nap.An optional beach sun shelter water proof tent cover is available, it converts sun shelter into a standard camping tent in seconds. The special designed water proof cover equip with zipper, ventilation windows and 4 ground stakes.Beach Sun shelter tent Specifications:*Self expanded in one second, folds down in 3 second.*3 sides and floor are made from durable T190 nylon cloth, UV protective coating rating 50 + UPF, flame resistance nylon meets CPAI-84 standard. 2 side screen windows with roll up cover. Fully opened zipper back panel. Strong steel beam frame covered by 600D Oxford nylon, light weight and durable. Comes with 4 plastic ground stakes, sand bags pockets on both side panels. Full size carrying case with shoulder strap. Tent dimension 82.7 x 52 x 50-Inch (length x width x height). Large enough for two adults or one adult and many kids. Weight 4-Pounds 7-Ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PnOOG%2BJsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002970M1E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]], "price": 50.41}}
{"item_id": "B002994ES4", "title": "Axiom Journey Tubular Alloy Rack (Black)", "description": "Axiom Journey Rear Mount Rack fit 26\", 27\", and 700c wheels. Journey racks fit 26\", 27\" and 700c wheels Made from AL-6061-T6 aluminum Fits, road, MTB and hybrid bikes with fenders Versalock tubular aluminum stay mounts Item Specifications Color Black Weight 700g Rack Weight Limit 150lbs", "text": "Axiom Journey Tubular Alloy Rack (Black) Axiom Journey Rear Mount Rack fit 26\", 27\", and 700c wheels. Journey racks fit 26\", 27\" and 700c wheels Made from AL-6061-T6 aluminum Fits, road, MTB and hybrid bikes with fenders Versalock tubular aluminum stay mounts Item Specifications Color Black Weight 700g Rack Weight Limit 150lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yWmOnLGjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002994ES4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Axiom", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 37.69}}
{"item_id": "B00299CGZM", "title": "Texsport Canvas Parachute Bag", "description": "TexSport 11860 Travel/Luggage Case for Travel Essential - Black 11860 Laptop & Notebook Cases", "text": "Texsport Canvas Parachute Bag TexSport 11860 Travel/Luggage Case for Travel Essential - Black 11860 Laptop & Notebook Cases", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hQLd9LqNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00299CGZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags"]], "price": 21.39}}
{"item_id": "B00299RY5E", "title": "Spyderco Pacific Salt Plain Edge Yellow H1-Steel Knife", "description": "A big myth in the knife world is that out there somewhere is a knife that seriously cuts but cannot rust. Knives claiming these super powers are usually made with steels that are unable to hold a cutting edge for any measurable amount of time. Finally a steel foundry in Japan called Myodo Foundry makes this myth a reality with the introduction of a new steel called H1. H1 steel is a PH steel, meaning it is a precipitation-hardened steel. \"Huh\" you ask? Utilizing .1% nitrogen instead of carbon to harden the steel, it reaches a Rockwell hardness of 57-58rc. Spyderco uses H1 on its new C91 Pacific Salt model. It's PlainEdge is similar in shape and size to Spyderco's best-selling Endura model but with a slightly more rounded tip. All internal steel parts are treated as well making them impervious to rust and pitting and of course, salt. Those challenged by cleaning and maintaining their knives will find the Pacific Salt stays rust-free even if put away wet. The blade's hole is enlarged to 14mm for easier opening/closing with gloved, wet or cold hands. Textured in a checkerboard pattern, the yellow FRN handle has a grippy texture and is fitted with a reversible titanium pocket clip which positions for right-handers and lefties. The addition of a lanyard hole offers a backup method of attachment (thong or lanyard cord) for use around water where once dropped, a knife is often lost or elusively hard to retrieve.", "text": "Spyderco Pacific Salt Plain Edge Yellow H1-Steel Knife A big myth in the knife world is that out there somewhere is a knife that seriously cuts but cannot rust. Knives claiming these super powers are usually made with steels that are unable to hold a cutting edge for any measurable amount of time. Finally a steel foundry in Japan called Myodo Foundry makes this myth a reality with the introduction of a new steel called H1. H1 steel is a PH steel, meaning it is a precipitation-hardened steel. \"Huh\" you ask? Utilizing .1% nitrogen instead of carbon to harden the steel, it reaches a Rockwell hardness of 57-58rc. Spyderco uses H1 on its new C91 Pacific Salt model. It's PlainEdge is similar in shape and size to Spyderco's best-selling Endura model but with a slightly more rounded tip. All internal steel parts are treated as well making them impervious to rust and pitting and of course, salt. Those challenged by cleaning and maintaining their knives will find the Pacific Salt stays rust-free even if put away wet. The blade's hole is enlarged to 14mm for easier opening/closing with gloved, wet or cold hands. Textured in a checkerboard pattern, the yellow FRN handle has a grippy texture and is fitted with a reversible titanium pocket clip which positions for right-handers and lefties. The addition of a lanyard hole offers a backup method of attachment (thong or lanyard cord) for use around water where once dropped, a knife is often lost or elusively hard to retrieve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21V%2Bugl%2BAuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00299RY5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 69.03}}
{"item_id": "B0029AAUUY", "title": "Earth Jamboree Military Style Aluminum Cot", "description": "An included hanging side storage system helps keep you organized and comfortable.The Earth Jamboree military-style aluminum cot offers a sturdy, well-designed, and versatile sleep solution, whether camping, furnishing a cabin or shelter, or simply entertaining out of town guests. Rigid anodized aluminum tubing and steel-reinforced legs provide a solid base, and the washable polyester fabric is supportive, and surprisingly comfortable. With a full 77-inch length, there's plenty of room to enjoy a solid night's sleep without your feet hanging off the edge, and an innovative dual side bag storage system helps you keep all of those small essentials organized and within reach.FeaturesSupportive, sturdy cot with form-fitting fabricStrong yet lightweight anodized aluminum tubingLegs are reinforced with steel pipe insertsPolyester cover is removable, washable, and mildew-resistantIncludes hanging side storage system and carrying bagSpecificationsMeasures 25 by 17 by 77 inches (W x H x D) expandedMeasures eight by five by 37 inches (W x H x D) folded13-pound weight and 350-pound total capacityWarrantyEarth folding furniture products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Earth Jamboree Military Style Aluminum Cot An included hanging side storage system helps keep you organized and comfortable.The Earth Jamboree military-style aluminum cot offers a sturdy, well-designed, and versatile sleep solution, whether camping, furnishing a cabin or shelter, or simply entertaining out of town guests. Rigid anodized aluminum tubing and steel-reinforced legs provide a solid base, and the washable polyester fabric is supportive, and surprisingly comfortable. With a full 77-inch length, there's plenty of room to enjoy a solid night's sleep without your feet hanging off the edge, and an innovative dual side bag storage system helps you keep all of those small essentials organized and within reach.FeaturesSupportive, sturdy cot with form-fitting fabricStrong yet lightweight anodized aluminum tubingLegs are reinforced with steel pipe insertsPolyester cover is removable, washable, and mildew-resistantIncludes hanging side storage system and carrying bagSpecificationsMeasures 25 by 17 by 77 inches (W x H x D) expandedMeasures eight by five by 37 inches (W x H x D) folded13-pound weight and 350-pound total capacityWarrantyEarth folding furniture products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SN%2B91ikeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029AAUUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Earth", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 46.0}}
{"item_id": "B0029BE7AW", "title": "Emergency Survival Food Supply 275 Meal Pack", "description": "Packaged in a weather-proof bucket that is easily stacked to conserve space, our 200-serving kit can be store up to 20 years in a cool, dry area*. Although typically thought of as an emergency food, it is taste, nutrition and convenience that are now making out entrees legitimate alternatives for daily use, as well as the perfect solution for any outdoor or camping activity. Save your money and invest in your health. Serve these hearty meals for breakfast, lunch and dinner.Food Supply Kit includes:275 Servings - 55 pouches per kit (5 servings in each product)- Tuscan butter noodles, 25 servings - Cheesy Broccoli Rice, 25 servings - Creamy Vegetable Rice, 30 servings - Creamy Potato Soup, 35 servings - Italian Tomato Pasta, 25 servings - Vegetable Barley, 35 servings - Brown Sugar Oatmeal, 50 servings - Whey Milk, 50 servings* For best taste and nutritional value, use product before 20 years of manufacturing date when stored at 60 degrees Fahrenheit (16.6 degrees Celsius) or 10 years of manufacturing date when stored at 70 degrees Fahrenheit (21.1 degrees Celsius)", "text": "Emergency Survival Food Supply 275 Meal Pack Packaged in a weather-proof bucket that is easily stacked to conserve space, our 200-serving kit can be store up to 20 years in a cool, dry area*. Although typically thought of as an emergency food, it is taste, nutrition and convenience that are now making out entrees legitimate alternatives for daily use, as well as the perfect solution for any outdoor or camping activity. Save your money and invest in your health. Serve these hearty meals for breakfast, lunch and dinner.Food Supply Kit includes:275 Servings - 55 pouches per kit (5 servings in each product)- Tuscan butter noodles, 25 servings - Cheesy Broccoli Rice, 25 servings - Creamy Vegetable Rice, 30 servings - Creamy Potato Soup, 35 servings - Italian Tomato Pasta, 25 servings - Vegetable Barley, 35 servings - Brown Sugar Oatmeal, 50 servings - Whey Milk, 50 servings* For best taste and nutritional value, use product before 20 years of manufacturing date when stored at 60 degrees Fahrenheit (16.6 degrees Celsius) or 10 years of manufacturing date when stored at 70 degrees Fahrenheit (21.1 degrees Celsius)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417%2BFU2fWLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029BE7AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 159.99}}
{"item_id": "B0029D1PAA", "title": "78 pc Universal Hand Gun, Rifle & Shot Gun Cleaning Kit", "description": "2 (Two) 3-piece Brass Cleaning Rods. (1 (One) for Rifle / Pistols, and 1 (One) for Shotguns.) * 2 (Two) universal handles. * 10 (Ten) Brass Wire Brushes to Fit 12 Gauge, 20 Gauge, 410 Gauge, .45 caliber, .40 caliber, .357/.38 caliber./ 9mm, .30 caliber, .270/.280 caliber, .22 caliber and .17 caliber * 5 (Five) Mops to fit 10/12 gauge, 20/28 gauge, 410 caliber, 357/38 caliber/9mm, 22 caliber * 3 (Three) Brass Adapters * (2) Two Slotted patch holders * 50 cleaning patches. * Aluminum storage carry case.", "text": "78 pc Universal Hand Gun, Rifle & Shot Gun Cleaning Kit 2 (Two) 3-piece Brass Cleaning Rods. (1 (One) for Rifle / Pistols, and 1 (One) for Shotguns.) * 2 (Two) universal handles. * 10 (Ten) Brass Wire Brushes to Fit 12 Gauge, 20 Gauge, 410 Gauge, .45 caliber, .40 caliber, .357/.38 caliber./ 9mm, .30 caliber, .270/.280 caliber, .22 caliber and .17 caliber * 5 (Five) Mops to fit 10/12 gauge, 20/28 gauge, 410 caliber, 357/38 caliber/9mm, 22 caliber * 3 (Three) Brass Adapters * (2) Two Slotted patch holders * 50 cleaning patches. * Aluminum storage carry case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ClisGuvpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029D1PAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 19.28}}
{"item_id": "B0029D2YBO", "title": "Vector Quintuple Refined Butane Gas Fuel Refill", "description": "Vector's Quintuplus Refined (5 Times) refined fuel is the cleanest fuel available on the market. The Quintuplus Refined (5 Times) refined fuel has virtually no impurities and will also help clear the jets on lighters which have been clogged by inferior fuel. Can contains a whopping 10.6 ounces (320 ml) of the best fuel on the planet for your lighters. Please note - WE CAN NOT SHIP THIS ITEM OUTSIDE THE USA", "text": "Vector Quintuple Refined Butane Gas Fuel Refill Vector's Quintuplus Refined (5 Times) refined fuel is the cleanest fuel available on the market. The Quintuplus Refined (5 Times) refined fuel has virtually no impurities and will also help clear the jets on lighters which have been clogged by inferior fuel. Can contains a whopping 10.6 ounces (320 ml) of the best fuel on the planet for your lighters. Please note - WE CAN NOT SHIP THIS ITEM OUTSIDE THE USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FDkc-9MNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029D2YBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vector", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]], "price": 9.99}}
