{"item_id": "B0029X8ILO", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Scalloped Sandwich Knife", "description": "Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Scalloped Sandwich Knife Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21k1GoJYQdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029X8ILO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kai Pure Komachi 2", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B0029X8IM8", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Serrated Multi-Utility Knife", "description": "Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Serrated Multi-Utility Knife Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21%2BqYhuOeUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029X8IM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kai Pure Komachi 2", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0029X8INC", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Hollow-Ground Santoku Knife", "description": "Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Hollow-Ground Santoku Knife Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217WgypcjEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029X8INC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kai Pure Komachi 2", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 11.25}}
{"item_id": "B0029XAAQ0", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series 9-Piece Knife Set with Block", "description": "Brilliant Monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food-for instance, by using the knife you've just used to cut meat on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple, and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatique-reducing grip. Incredible sharp and decidedly attention-getting. Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen. The 9 piece block set includes: 4-inch tomato/cheese knife, 4-inch citrus knife, 3 1/2-inch paring knife, 6-inch multi utility knife, 5 3/4-inch sandwich knife, 6 1/2-inch Chef knife, 8-inch chefs knife, 8-inch bread knife, and clear acrylic block.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series 9-Piece Knife Set with Block Brilliant Monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food-for instance, by using the knife you've just used to cut meat on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple, and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatique-reducing grip. Incredible sharp and decidedly attention-getting. Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen. The 9 piece block set includes: 4-inch tomato/cheese knife, 4-inch citrus knife, 3 1/2-inch paring knife, 6-inch multi utility knife, 5 3/4-inch sandwich knife, 6 1/2-inch Chef knife, 8-inch chefs knife, 8-inch bread knife, and clear acrylic block.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BaT7fEyoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029XAAQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pure Komachi 2", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 74.95}}
{"item_id": "B0029XBUKK", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Bread Knife", "description": "Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series Bread Knife Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21iwIHBanoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029XBUKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kai Pure Komachi 2", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 9.99}}
