{"item_id": "B0029XEFCA", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Wallet J.R.", "description": "Features & Benefits: 3 carrying options; pockets, on the belt, or can be worn around the neck. 4 credit card slots (will hold up to 2 cards per slot). Divided, full-length compartment for cash, receipts, etc. (can be zipped closed to form a hidden pocket.) Inside and outside non-glare ID windows. Zippered, Challenge-coin / spare change pocket. Exclusive \"Shark-Bite\" closure, an ultra secure closure that has no Velcro, buckles, or snaps to wear-out / make noise. Super durable, made from 1000 D. Cordura fabric and Nylon Pack-cloth (double stitched and bar-tack reinforced at critical stress points). Compact size, 4\"x4\". • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Wallet J.R. Features & Benefits: 3 carrying options; pockets, on the belt, or can be worn around the neck. 4 credit card slots (will hold up to 2 cards per slot). Divided, full-length compartment for cash, receipts, etc. (can be zipped closed to form a hidden pocket.) Inside and outside non-glare ID windows. Zippered, Challenge-coin / spare change pocket. Exclusive \"Shark-Bite\" closure, an ultra secure closure that has no Velcro, buckles, or snaps to wear-out / make noise. Super durable, made from 1000 D. Cordura fabric and Nylon Pack-cloth (double stitched and bar-tack reinforced at critical stress points). Compact size, 4\"x4\". • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LaBrCZj3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029XEFCA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 29.7}}
{"item_id": "B0029XHQXK", "title": "Pure Komachi 2 Series 8\" Chef's Knife, Fuchsia", "description": "Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "Pure Komachi 2 Series 8\" Chef's Knife, Fuchsia Brilliant monochromatic colors make the Pure Komachi 2 series a real eye-catcher. But all that fun-loving color has a serious purpose too. The color-coding makes it easy to choose the right knife for the job. It also helps guard against cross-contaminating food; color coding can help to prevent you from using the knife the knife you used to cut meat now on the vegetables. The bold blade color is achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knife glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi 2 color-matched handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable, fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting, Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215B9AorJDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0029XHQXK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": 