{"item_id": "B002AK7KMO", "title": "BSA 3-9X40 Sweet 22 Rifle Scope with Side Parallax Adjustment and Multi-Grain Turret", "description": "Keep your target clear, in sight, and on line with the BSA 3-9X40 Sweet 22 Rifle Scope. Featuring a quick-change turret system specifically calibrated for multiple grain weights for calibers .17HMR, .22LR, .223, .270, and .30-06, the Sweet series are trajectory compensated scopes for target and varmint shooters or for hunting big game. The trajectory is compensated from 50 to 175 yards, and each scope has fully coated optics, with adjustable objective for parallax along with a one-inch tube. The Sweet 22 is 1/4 MOA, meaning one click will move the bullet 1/4 inch at 100 yards. Note that when zeroing at a different yardage, such as 50 yards, one click will move the bullet only 1/8 inch at 50 yards.Camera-quality glass provides a clear and undistorted image at any magnifications, and all lenses are fully multi-coated to provide the brightest possible view without glare or reflections. Water-, fog-, and shock-proof, these scopes are \"fast focus\" and have standard four-inch eye relief. The scope comes with a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty.Technical Specifications.36, .38, and .40 gr. compensation drum3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lens diameter13-4.3-millimeter exit pupil range42-20 field of view at 100 yardsFour-inch optimum eye relief7.5-to-infinite parallax setting1/4 click adjustment value45-45 adjustment range16.8-ounce weight", "text": "BSA 3-9X40 Sweet 22 Rifle Scope with Side Parallax Adjustment and Multi-Grain Turret Keep your target clear, in sight, and on line with the BSA 3-9X40 Sweet 22 Rifle Scope. Featuring a quick-change turret system specifically calibrated for multiple grain weights for calibers .17HMR, .22LR, .223, .270, and .30-06, the Sweet series are trajectory compensated scopes for target and varmint shooters or for hunting big game. The trajectory is compensated from 50 to 175 yards, and each scope has fully coated optics, with adjustable objective for parallax along with a one-inch tube. The Sweet 22 is 1/4 MOA, meaning one click will move the bullet 1/4 inch at 100 yards. Note that when zeroing at a different yardage, such as 50 yards, one click will move the bullet only 1/8 inch at 50 yards.Camera-quality glass provides a clear and undistorted image at any magnifications, and all lenses are fully multi-coated to provide the brightest possible view without glare or reflections. Water-, fog-, and shock-proof, these scopes are \"fast focus\" and have standard four-inch eye relief. The scope comes with a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty.Technical Specifications.36, .38, and .40 gr. compensation drum3-9X magnification40-millimeter objective lens diameter13-4.3-millimeter exit pupil range42-20 field of view at 100 yardsFour-inch optimum eye relief7.5-to-infinite parallax setting1/4 click adjustment value45-45 adjustment range16.8-ounce weight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J%2BHTYqWfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AK7KMO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 107.99}}
{"item_id": "B002AKEEQ4", "title": "BSA 3-12X44 Catseye Rifle Scope with Side Parallax Adjustment", "description": "BSA Optics Catseye 3 - 12x44 Riflescope. Say goodbye to eye strain! With a larger ocular lens, the Catseye Riflescope is less of a strain on your eyes! Helps to create a longer 4-5\" eye relief and a larger exit pupil so your eye gets a greater amount of light. On top of that, all lenses are fully multi-coated to provide the brightest possible view without glare or reflections. And what's more, this Scope is waterproof fogproof and shockproof too, for top-end performance, rain or shine. More: Has 3-12x magnification and a 44 mm objective diameter; Exit pupil: 9.4-4.6 mm; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 40 ft. at 3x and 10 ft. at 12x; Generous 4\" eye relief; Finger-adjustable 1/4 M.O.A. adjustments; Matte finish; Standard Duplex Reticle; Weighs 16 ozs.; Lifetime limited manufacturer's warranty.; Pick your new Scope today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Optics Catseye 3-12x44 Riflescope", "text": "BSA 3-12X44 Catseye Rifle Scope with Side Parallax Adjustment BSA Optics Catseye 3 - 12x44 Riflescope. Say goodbye to eye strain! With a larger ocular lens, the Catseye Riflescope is less of a strain on your eyes! Helps to create a longer 4-5\" eye relief and a larger exit pupil so your eye gets a greater amount of light. On top of that, all lenses are fully multi-coated to provide the brightest possible view without glare or reflections. And what's more, this Scope is waterproof fogproof and shockproof too, for top-end performance, rain or shine. More: Has 3-12x magnification and a 44 mm objective diameter; Exit pupil: 9.4-4.6 mm; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 40 ft. at 3x and 10 ft. at 12x; Generous 4\" eye relief; Finger-adjustable 1/4 M.O.A. adjustments; Matte finish; Standard Duplex Reticle; Weighs 16 ozs.; Lifetime limited manufacturer's warranty.; Pick your new Scope today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. BSA Optics Catseye 3-12x44 Riflescope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZfCEXxh6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AKEEQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002ALJ3YG", "title": "939 UHC Revolver, 2.5\" Barrel airsoft gun", "description": "UHC model UA-939. This beautiful, full-size handgun holds 6 rounds of BBs in lifelike replica shells! Pop open the cylinder and pop in the shells, just like the real thing, and fire all six shots with one hand, just like the movies.... 1:1 scale cylinder swivel, loads like a real gun cocking of the spring piston by the hammer rear sight adjustable for windage and elevation colored front sight 6 round cylinder press the hammer for chambering, actions the same way as the real gun gun body and grip have satin finish ... 939 revolver, 2.5 barrel air/spring action with 6 BB shells....", "text": "939 UHC Revolver, 2.5\" Barrel airsoft gun UHC model UA-939. This beautiful, full-size handgun holds 6 rounds of BBs in lifelike replica shells! Pop open the cylinder and pop in the shells, just like the real thing, and fire all six shots with one hand, just like the movies.... 1:1 scale cylinder swivel, loads like a real gun cocking of the spring piston by the hammer rear sight adjustable for windage and elevation colored front sight 6 round cylinder press the hammer for chambering, actions the same way as the real gun gun body and grip have satin finish ... 939 revolver, 2.5 barrel air/spring action with 6 BB shells....", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X-Gt5GEfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ALJ3YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UHC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B002ALTDL4", "title": "Dye i4 Thermal Lens (Click-a-Color)", "description": "The i4 features an industry first compound radius lens with thermal technology, giving the player the ultimate vertical/ horizontal peripheral vision. Dye thermal lenses provide the bench mark for anti-fog performance. All Invision lenses provide perfect optical clarity and set the standard for visual performance. The i4 offers unmatched peripheral vision, more than any other mask system on the market today. This added vision makes movement easier to recognize, providing a distinct tactical advantage for users. In addition the i4 goggle comes standard with HARDCOAT, a scratch resistant coating that protects both sides of the lens against scratches and minor abrasions. The included UV coating also provides exceptional protection from the sun's harmful rays. The i4 has a revolutionary patent pending rapid lens change system, allowing lens changes in ten seconds or less. It is as simple as pushing on each interior tab arm and then sliding them forward, instantly freeing the i4 lens for replacement.", "text": "Dye i4 Thermal Lens (Click-a-Color) The i4 features an industry first compound radius lens with thermal technology, giving the player the ultimate vertical/ horizontal peripheral vision. Dye thermal lenses provide the bench mark for anti-fog performance. All Invision lenses provide perfect optical clarity and set the standard for visual performance. The i4 offers unmatched peripheral vision, more than any other mask system on the market today. This added vision makes movement easier to recognize, providing a distinct tactical advantage for users. In addition the i4 goggle comes standard with HARDCOAT, a scratch resistant coating that protects both sides of the lens against scratches and minor abrasions. The included UV coating also provides exceptional protection from the sun's harmful rays. The i4 has a revolutionary patent pending rapid lens change system, allowing lens changes in ten seconds or less. It is as simple as pushing on each interior tab arm and then sliding them forward, instantly freeing the i4 lens for replacement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310mp9OHeLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ALTDL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dye", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Replacement Mask Lenses"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ANX944", "title": "Hydrapak Softflask", "description": "The Hydrapak Softflask is the perfect companion for almost any energy gel. It is superior to any hard gel flask because it's flexible material allows you to squeeze the entire contents out of the flask instead of waisting the contents in a hard flask. The Bite Valve works well with fluid, gel, or a mixture of each.", "text": "Hydrapak Softflask The Hydrapak Softflask is the perfect companion for almost any energy gel. It is superior to any hard gel flask because it's flexible material allows you to squeeze the entire contents out of the flask instead of waisting the contents in a hard flask. The Bite Valve works well with fluid, gel, or a mixture of each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MQ6177IhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ANX944.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydrapak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B002APAWY2", "title": "Caldwell Deadshot Shooting Bag Combo", "description": "Every hunter and shooter is looking for a versatile and steady shooting system that can be set up almost anywhere, and at any time. Whether you have minutes or seconds to set up for your next shot, the filled DeadShot Shooting Bags are the answer.", "text": "Caldwell Deadshot Shooting Bag Combo Every hunter and shooter is looking for a versatile and steady shooting system that can be set up almost anywhere, and at any time. Whether you have minutes or seconds to set up for your next shot, the filled DeadShot Shooting Bags are the answer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416G80bzTeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APAWY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 29.97}}
{"item_id": "B002APDC0I", "title": "Gamo Spinner Target, 6 Spinners", "description": "Spinner targets 6 x 8 (width x height) additional 8 metal attachment included. 6 targets powder-coated, corrosion-resistant finish. Sturdy construction. Includes 12 orange bulls eye stickers and 6 balloons. 1 Year limited warranty for .177 pellet guns with muzzle velocities up to 1000 fps. Place targets at least 25 Yards from muzzle of gun.", "text": "Gamo Spinner Target, 6 Spinners Spinner targets 6 x 8 (width x height) additional 8 metal attachment included. 6 targets powder-coated, corrosion-resistant finish. Sturdy construction. Includes 12 orange bulls eye stickers and 6 balloons. 1 Year limited warranty for .177 pellet guns with muzzle velocities up to 1000 fps. Place targets at least 25 Yards from muzzle of gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O26HGeSyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APDC0I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 18.28}}
{"item_id": "B002APFBUM", "title": "Gamo Spire Point Double Ring .22 Caliber Magnum Pellets (Tin of 250)", "description": "Gamo Magnum 0.22-caliber pellets feature pointed tips for superior penetration, along with a double ring design that enhances the mushroom effect on impact. The pellets are not recommended for use in repeating rifles or pistols. This tin comes with 250 pellets.SpecificationsVelocity: 676 feet per second (muzzle), 610 fps (10 yards), 525 fps (30 yards)Kinetic energy: 16.21 ft/lbs. (muzzle), 13.21 ft/lbs. (10 yards), 9.78 ft/lbs. (30 yards)Paraffin penetration: 1.14 inches (muzzle), 0.87 inches (10 yards), 1.02 inches (30 yards)Paraffin expansion: 0.39 inches (muzzle), 0.30 inches (10 yards), 0.26 inches (30 yards)Grouping: 0.35 inches (10 yards); 0.94 inches (30 yards)Pellet weight: 15.43 grains", "text": "Gamo Spire Point Double Ring .22 Caliber Magnum Pellets (Tin of 250) Gamo Magnum 0.22-caliber pellets feature pointed tips for superior penetration, along with a double ring design that enhances the mushroom effect on impact. The pellets are not recommended for use in repeating rifles or pistols. This tin comes with 250 pellets.SpecificationsVelocity: 676 feet per second (muzzle), 610 fps (10 yards), 525 fps (30 yards)Kinetic energy: 16.21 ft/lbs. (muzzle), 13.21 ft/lbs. (10 yards), 9.78 ft/lbs. (30 yards)Paraffin penetration: 1.14 inches (muzzle), 0.87 inches (10 yards), 1.02 inches (30 yards)Paraffin expansion: 0.39 inches (muzzle), 0.30 inches (10 yards), 0.26 inches (30 yards)Grouping: 0.35 inches (10 yards); 0.94 inches (30 yards)Pellet weight: 15.43 grains", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Os%2BBln0eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APFBUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 7.95}}
