{"item_id": "B002APN1C2", "title": "GAMO Rocket Pellet .22 Caliber Pellets, 100 Pellets", "description": "The new Rocket Superior Accuracy and Penetration airgun ammunition combines our performance lead with a hardened steel tip to yield enhanced penetration and shock with precision accuracy. The Rocket enhances down-range performance without any sacrifice of accuracy and consistency. Consistency, uniformity and performance are what makes Gamo ammunition superior to all others.", "text": "GAMO Rocket Pellet .22 Caliber Pellets, 100 Pellets The new Rocket Superior Accuracy and Penetration airgun ammunition combines our performance lead with a hardened steel tip to yield enhanced penetration and shock with precision accuracy. The Rocket enhances down-range performance without any sacrifice of accuracy and consistency. Consistency, uniformity and performance are what makes Gamo ammunition superior to all others.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pKvnOrJKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APN1C2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B002APPJTK", "title": "HiViz Ruger SR9 Overmolded Fiber Optic Front Sight (Green)", "description": "HiViz's overmolded pistol sights are suited to the demands placed on duty pistols or rugged competition guns. These sights combine the strength of our durable LightPipes with an incredibly tough resin overmold that protects the sight while allowing light to reach the LitePipe.", "text": "HiViz Ruger SR9 Overmolded Fiber Optic Front Sight (Green) HiViz's overmolded pistol sights are suited to the demands placed on duty pistols or rugged competition guns. These sights combine the strength of our durable LightPipes with an incredibly tough resin overmold that protects the sight while allowing light to reach the LitePipe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416RaWFETML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APPJTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 45.4}}
