{"item_id": "B002APSUE6", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Suspenders", "description": "Features & Benefits: DURABLE: Proprietary \"Dura-Lastic\" material is made from Cordura fibers and utilizes natural rubber with twice the UV and water resistant coatings of any other elastic on the market. This is the most durable elastic material available on the market today. COMFORTABLE, LOW-PROFILE DESIGN: allows you to comfortably wear the Super Suspenders under armor or load-bearing gearing while supporting your belt mounted gear. VERSATILE: Side connection design provides consistent support in any position, allowing you to sit or squat without the suspenders getting loose in the front and tight in the back like traditional suspenders. FULLY ADJUSTABLE: Unique adjustment system allows for one-size-fits all versatility with a custom made fit. EASY TO USE: Easy access side release buckle attachment system fits belts of any size and lets you disconnect the Super Suspenders from your belt, even when worn under your armor. BUILT TO LAST: Double needle stitch construction and stress points reinforced with 42 stitch bartacks for extreme durability. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Suspenders Features & Benefits: DURABLE: Proprietary \"Dura-Lastic\" material is made from Cordura fibers and utilizes natural rubber with twice the UV and water resistant coatings of any other elastic on the market. This is the most durable elastic material available on the market today. COMFORTABLE, LOW-PROFILE DESIGN: allows you to comfortably wear the Super Suspenders under armor or load-bearing gearing while supporting your belt mounted gear. VERSATILE: Side connection design provides consistent support in any position, allowing you to sit or squat without the suspenders getting loose in the front and tight in the back like traditional suspenders. FULLY ADJUSTABLE: Unique adjustment system allows for one-size-fits all versatility with a custom made fit. EASY TO USE: Easy access side release buckle attachment system fits belts of any size and lets you disconnect the Super Suspenders from your belt, even when worn under your armor. BUILT TO LAST: Double needle stitch construction and stress points reinforced with 42 stitch bartacks for extreme durability. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L%2BceKUJ%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002APSUE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 37.39}}
