{"item_id": "B002AQET2C", "title": "Esbit 11.5g (0.4 Ounce) Ultralight Folding Titanium Stove for Use with Solid Fuel Tablets", "description": "The Esbit Titanium Stove is made from Ultralight titanium, weighing only 0.4 oz. It is foldable and can be stored in an included compact meshbag that fits in a shirt pocket. It uses the Esbit solid fuel cubes.", "text": "Esbit 11.5g (0.4 Ounce) Ultralight Folding Titanium Stove for Use with Solid Fuel Tablets The Esbit Titanium Stove is made from Ultralight titanium, weighing only 0.4 oz. It is foldable and can be stored in an included compact meshbag that fits in a shirt pocket. It uses the Esbit solid fuel cubes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y3Uiev2DL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AQET2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Esbit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 12.14}}
{"item_id": "B002AQHEQA", "title": "Tapco AK Folding Stock - Black", "description": "Sometimes shooting isn't just about standing at a firing range. Sometimes you don't have the luxury of a lot of space to handle your rifle in.You might need to be in a vehicle, or in an enclosed space for home defense. In these situations, the INTRAFUSE� AK Folding Stock is your best option. The stock enables you to fold it to the right to drastically reduce the length of the rifle. When needed, you can easily deploy it back to its open position for a rigid shooting platform. The stock even provides a sling attachment point in the knuckle. Made of high strength composite, you be sure that you've got the highest quality folding stock at your disposal whenever you need it. Specifications: - Fits Stamped Receivers - Will not fit on AK variants with a milled receiver, a bottom tang, a slant-cut receiver at the rear, or an underfolder stock - Folds to the Right - High Strength Composite Stock Body - High Strength Reinforced Composite Knuckle with Steel Hinge Pin - Sling Attachment Point in the Knuckle - Counts as 1 U.S. 922r Compliant Part - Length of Pull: 15\" - Black", "text": "Tapco AK Folding Stock - Black Sometimes shooting isn't just about standing at a firing range. Sometimes you don't have the luxury of a lot of space to handle your rifle in.You might need to be in a vehicle, or in an enclosed space for home defense. In these situations, the INTRAFUSE� AK Folding Stock is your best option. The stock enables you to fold it to the right to drastically reduce the length of the rifle. When needed, you can easily deploy it back to its open position for a rigid shooting platform. The stock even provides a sling attachment point in the knuckle. Made of high strength composite, you be sure that you've got the highest quality folding stock at your disposal whenever you need it. Specifications: - Fits Stamped Receivers - Will not fit on AK variants with a milled receiver, a bottom tang, a slant-cut receiver at the rear, or an underfolder stock - Folds to the Right - High Strength Composite Stock Body - High Strength Reinforced Composite Knuckle with Steel Hinge Pin - Sling Attachment Point in the Knuckle - Counts as 1 U.S. 922r Compliant Part - Length of Pull: 15\" - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21nc3fT-inL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AQHEQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 33.13}}
{"item_id": "B002AQRJZQ", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Pack Frame (Black)", "description": "Features & Benefits: DURABLE: Made from a high-tech polymer that is crack-proof and will not degrade - designed for prolonged use. COMFORTABLE: Distributes pack weight between shoulders, back and hips for a more comfortable carry with extreme loads. VERSATILE: Aluminum stiffeners for extra support with heavy loads -can be formed to “custom” fit • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE!", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Pack Frame (Black) Features & Benefits: DURABLE: Made from a high-tech polymer that is crack-proof and will not degrade - designed for prolonged use. COMFORTABLE: Distributes pack weight between shoulders, back and hips for a more comfortable carry with extreme loads. VERSATILE: Aluminum stiffeners for extra support with heavy loads -can be formed to “custom” fit • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w0tZnwM9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AQRJZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 29.19}}
{"item_id": "B002AR19WE", "title": "TMS Bipod with Sling Adapter", "description": "Mounts onto rifles with sling stud or with Picatinny rails under forendMade of durable, light-weight aluminum alloyLegs extend from 6\" to 9\"Quickly attach to or detach from the rifle using existing swivel studKit Includes a sling adapter which attaches to Picatinny RAS rails and then works with the bipodBipod has an attachment point for sling with bipod installedRubber padded on top to protect forend of gunSpring loaded foldable legs are notched and have T numbers marked to extend to multiple lengths quicklyThis bipod does not have swivel top and does not tilt from side to sideAnodized matte finishWeights a mere 9.5oz.Sold exclusively on Amazon by Treadpro! Watch out for fake products!!!", "text": "TMS Bipod with Sling Adapter Mounts onto rifles with sling stud or with Picatinny rails under forendMade of durable, light-weight aluminum alloyLegs extend from 6\" to 9\"Quickly attach to or detach from the rifle using existing swivel studKit Includes a sling adapter which attaches to Picatinny RAS rails and then works with the bipodBipod has an attachment point for sling with bipod installedRubber padded on top to protect forend of gunSpring loaded foldable legs are notched and have T numbers marked to extend to multiple lengths quicklyThis bipod does not have swivel top and does not tilt from side to sideAnodized matte finishWeights a mere 9.5oz.Sold exclusively on Amazon by Treadpro! Watch out for fake products!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413GHZaOjAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AR19WE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B002AR3JCC", "title": "Champion Shooting Gear Pivot Bi-Pod 9-13\" 9po-13po Bipode Pivotant", "description": "Where the game goes, so does your reticle. Shooters Ridge Pivot Bi-Pods smoothly rotate to keep you on target and in the action. These pivoting bi-pods are designed specifically for hunters who need a steady, portable and versatile rest out in the field. Available in three length options, you're sure to find the right fit for your hunting situation. From sitting or kneeling to prone position, there's a Pivot Bi-Pod for you.When you need to make the shot, don't depend on a branch. Get on Target with Shooters Ridge bi-pods. Delivering a rock solid rest and fast target acquisition, our bi-pods allow precise shot placements on the rockiest terrain.", "text": "Champion Shooting Gear Pivot Bi-Pod 9-13\" 9po-13po Bipode Pivotant Where the game goes, so does your reticle. Shooters Ridge Pivot Bi-Pods smoothly rotate to keep you on target and in the action. These pivoting bi-pods are designed specifically for hunters who need a steady, portable and versatile rest out in the field. Available in three length options, you're sure to find the right fit for your hunting situation. From sitting or kneeling to prone position, there's a Pivot Bi-Pod for you.When you need to make the shot, don't depend on a branch. Get on Target with Shooters Ridge bi-pods. Delivering a rock solid rest and fast target acquisition, our bi-pods allow precise shot placements on the rockiest terrain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ArRo-zlZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AR3JCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shooters Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 44.29}}
{"item_id": "B002AT80B0", "title": "Nike Elite Men's Cushioned Crew Sock Dri-Fit Basketball", "description": "Stay DryDri-FIT fabric wicks sweat away from the skin to the fabric's surface, helping keep your feet dry and comfortable on the court.CushioningCushioning around the ankle and Achilles helps protect the foot from irritation caused by rubbing, while thicker padding on pressure points of the sole creates comfort where you need it.Secure Fit<Arch support and thick ribbing from the top to the ankle provide a stable, secure fit. Spandex adds stretch and compression throughout, and a left/right-specific design maximizes comfort.Small - Youth 3Y-5YMedium - Men's 6-8Large - Men's 8-12X-Large - Men's 12-15", "text": "Nike Elite Men's Cushioned Crew Sock Dri-Fit Basketball Stay DryDri-FIT fabric wicks sweat away from the skin to the fabric's surface, helping keep your feet dry and comfortable on the court.CushioningCushioning around the ankle and Achilles helps protect the foot from irritation caused by rubbing, while thicker padding on pressure points of the sole creates comfort where you need it.Secure Fit<Arch support and thick ribbing from the top to the ankle provide a stable, secure fit. Spandex adds stretch and compression throughout, and a left/right-specific design maximizes comfort.Small - Youth 3Y-5YMedium - Men's 6-8Large - Men's 8-12X-Large - Men's 12-15", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UmjvaTGfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AT80B0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports"]]}}
