{"item_id": "B002AUCDCQ", "title": "Soft Air Famas Tactical Rifle/Red Dot Scope/Silencer/Light, Black", "description": "The FAMAS Assault Rifle is featured in the newestCall of Duty: Black Opsfor a reason. Its unique design and aggressive styling help it stand out from other carbine rifles. Unique \"Bullpup\" configuration, with the ammo feed behind the trigger, maximizes barrel length while maintaining efficient use in CQB maneuvers.FeaturesRed dot scope, silencer and tactical flashlight includedHigh density composite material45-round ammunition magazineMuzzle speeds up to 370 feet per second (FPS) with 0.12-gram BBs and 300 FPS with 0.2-gram BBsBAX Shooting System offers exceptional stability, and increased velocity and accuracyIntegrated tactical flashlight and functional red dot sight", "text": "Soft Air Famas Tactical Rifle/Red Dot Scope/Silencer/Light, Black The FAMAS Assault Rifle is featured in the newestCall of Duty: Black Opsfor a reason. Its unique design and aggressive styling help it stand out from other carbine rifles. Unique \"Bullpup\" configuration, with the ammo feed behind the trigger, maximizes barrel length while maintaining efficient use in CQB maneuvers.FeaturesRed dot scope, silencer and tactical flashlight includedHigh density composite material45-round ammunition magazineMuzzle speeds up to 370 feet per second (FPS) with 0.12-gram BBs and 300 FPS with 0.2-gram BBsBAX Shooting System offers exceptional stability, and increased velocity and accuracyIntegrated tactical flashlight and functional red dot sight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u4D4ldjUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AUCDCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FAMAS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 36.9}}
