{"item_id": "B002AXQIWO", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove", "description": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove. The slip-on that fits like a glove. Get top pistol-handling performance and control with this Grip Glove. Ideal for polymer-frame handguns with no replacement grips available. The custom fit feels like an extension of your grip. Soft, stretchy material makes installation a snap. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves; Contoured; Flexible, soft rubber. State Style. Order yours today! Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove. The slip-on that fits like a glove. Get top pistol-handling performance and control with this Grip Glove. Ideal for polymer-frame handguns with no replacement grips available. The custom fit feels like an extension of your grip. Soft, stretchy material makes installation a snap. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves; Contoured; Flexible, soft rubber. State Style. Order yours today! Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wO0VgpKEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AXQIWO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002AXSNNG", "title": "Oxy-Sorb 10-Pack Oxygen Absorber, 2000cc", "description": "Each Bag contains 10 - 2,000cc oxygen absorbers made by OxySorb with indicator freshness pill/eye. When used with proper packaging and sealing, the oxygen in the packaging is greatly reduced. Our absorbers bring the oxygen level down reliably to .01% or less. These Absorbers are perfect when combined with 5-6 gallon Mylar Bags. The benefits of using oxygen absorbers are as follows: * Significantly improves keeping qualities of polyunsaturated fats and oils * Helps retain fresh-roasted flavor of coffee and nuts * Prevents oxidation of spice oleoresins present in spices themselves and in seasoned foods * Prevents oxidation of vitamins A, C and E * Extends life of pharmaceuticals * Inhibits mold in natural cheeses and other fermented dairy products * Delays non-enzymatic browning of fruits and some vegetables * Inhibits oxidation and condensation of red pigment of most berries and sauces.", "text": "Oxy-Sorb 10-Pack Oxygen Absorber, 2000cc Each Bag contains 10 - 2,000cc oxygen absorbers made by OxySorb with indicator freshness pill/eye. When used with proper packaging and sealing, the oxygen in the packaging is greatly reduced. Our absorbers bring the oxygen level down reliably to .01% or less. These Absorbers are perfect when combined with 5-6 gallon Mylar Bags. The benefits of using oxygen absorbers are as follows: * Significantly improves keeping qualities of polyunsaturated fats and oils * Helps retain fresh-roasted flavor of coffee and nuts * Prevents oxidation of spice oleoresins present in spices themselves and in seasoned foods * Prevents oxidation of vitamins A, C and E * Extends life of pharmaceuticals * Inhibits mold in natural cheeses and other fermented dairy products * Delays non-enzymatic browning of fruits and some vegetables * Inhibits oxidation and condensation of red pigment of most berries and sauces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511MWW0NqtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AXSNNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Oxy-Sorb", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 8.89}}
{"item_id": "B002AXYZYM", "title": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for S&W L FR 686 4-Inch (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for S&W L FR 686 4-Inch (Black, Right-hand) The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vBpU6tzOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AXYZYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 60.76}}
{"item_id": "B002AXZ032", "title": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33", "description": "The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "text": "Galco Summer Comfort Inside Pant Holster for Glock 26, 27, 33 The Summer Comfort is the perfect concealed carry holster for all seasons. Lightweight and comfortable, it features a snap-on design that allows the holster to attach and detach from your belt without taking off your belt. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. The smooth-out leather construction rides comfortably against the body, and features a full combat grip for a quick and sure draw. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Summer Comfort fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Summer Comfort is available in right or left hand designs in black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414s2OgpnXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AXZ032.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 60.76}}
{"item_id": "B002AYO7OE", "title": "SE - Storage Box - For Matches, 3 In 1, Water Proof, Size 3x 1in. - CCH6-1", "description": "Brand new Waterproof Match Box with Signal Mirror and Fire-Starting Flint. There is a small flint on the base of the storage container, for use in starting emergency fires. The inside of the cap is a mirror for signaling in emergencies. This container is made of ultra-durable plastic. Color: Alert Orange Size: 3 in. tall x 1 in. Condition: Brand new", "text": "SE - Storage Box - For Matches, 3 In 1, Water Proof, Size 3x 1in. - CCH6-1 Brand new Waterproof Match Box with Signal Mirror and Fire-Starting Flint. There is a small flint on the base of the storage container, for use in starting emergency fires. The inside of the cap is a mirror for signaling in emergencies. This container is made of ultra-durable plastic. Color: Alert Orange Size: 3 in. tall x 1 in. Condition: Brand new", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YXuas0MQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AYO7OE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 2.94}}
{"item_id": "B002AZAKBW", "title": "Colt Knives 278 Damascus Hunter Fixed Blade Knife with Genuine Stag Handles", "description": "Colt Damascus Hunter. 12 1/4\" overall. 7 5/8\" damascus steel blade with filework. Full tang. Genuine stag handles with Damascus steel guard. Lanyard. Brown leather belt sheath.", "text": "Colt Knives 278 Damascus Hunter Fixed Blade Knife with Genuine Stag Handles Colt Damascus Hunter. 12 1/4\" overall. 7 5/8\" damascus steel blade with filework. Full tang. Genuine stag handles with Damascus steel guard. Lanyard. Brown leather belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319vu7C0p2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002AZAKBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Colt Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 65.85}}
{"item_id": "B002B2C09E", "title": "13\" Armed Force Tactical Full Tang Fixed Blade Tanto Knife", "description": "Up for sale is a brand new full tang black straight Tanto tactical combat knife with nylon sheath. The blade of the knife has been constructed from 440 Stainless Steel in a Tanto style. The blade is chissel ground and fully sharpened. The back of the blade is fully serrated. The blade extends to the end of the handle, and two pieces of wood is used to secure the handle and give comfortable grip. The guard is solid steel. The knife features a leather sheath that can be used to hang on the belt. A snap safety secures the knife in the sheath.", "text": "13\" Armed Force Tactical Full Tang Fixed Blade Tanto Knife Up for sale is a brand new full tang black straight Tanto tactical combat knife with nylon sheath. The blade of the knife has been constructed from 440 Stainless Steel in a Tanto style. The blade is chissel ground and fully sharpened. The back of the blade is fully serrated. The blade extends to the end of the handle, and two pieces of wood is used to secure the handle and give comfortable grip. The guard is solid steel. The knife features a leather sheath that can be used to hang on the belt. A snap safety secures the knife in the sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v0maYzjhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B2C09E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002B3WOW6", "title": "Police Magnum O C-17 Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top, 0.5-Ounce Keyring, Pack of 2", "description": "Protect yourself, protect your family. Police Magnum OC-17 Aerosol Red Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Designed with a Twist-Top with Safety to lessen accidental discharge. Police Magnum OC is a defense weapon in a canister. UV Identifying Dye Aids Police in Suspect Identification. Nontoxic and Nonflammable can be safely used with Electronic Discharge Weapons (EDWs). Made in Florida, USA with all natural ingredients. Keep out of reach of children. First Aid and instructions for use on container. Please, check your shipment for official Police Magnum product, do not be fooled by copies.", "text": "Police Magnum O C-17 Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top, 0.5-Ounce Keyring, Pack of 2 Protect yourself, protect your family. Police Magnum OC-17 Aerosol Red Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Designed with a Twist-Top with Safety to lessen accidental discharge. Police Magnum OC is a defense weapon in a canister. UV Identifying Dye Aids Police in Suspect Identification. Nontoxic and Nonflammable can be safely used with Electronic Discharge Weapons (EDWs). Made in Florida, USA with all natural ingredients. Keep out of reach of children. First Aid and instructions for use on container. Please, check your shipment for official Police Magnum product, do not be fooled by copies.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r9DKqjxoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B3WOW6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Police", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B002B5KXHW", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Utility Pouch for use on Tactical Vest", "description": "The Voodoo Tactical Utility Pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, or other MOLLE/PALS equipment. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with a zipper closure, the utility pouch is conveniently sized and will securely hold an array of gear. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 8.5\" W x 4.5\" H x 3.5\" D.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Utility Pouch for use on Tactical Vest The Voodoo Tactical Utility Pouch is a modular piece designed to be attached to your tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, or other MOLLE/PALS equipment. Constructed from durable nylon canvas with a zipper closure, the utility pouch is conveniently sized and will securely hold an array of gear. The MOLLE/PALS compatible straps and heavy duty snaps lock it into place where you need it, when you need it. Measures 8.5\" W x 4.5\" H x 3.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q4cA3hXTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B5KXHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.12}}
{"item_id": "B002B5OW7Y", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard (Olive Drab) (20-8917)", "description": "Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard - 20-891704000", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard (Olive Drab) (20-8917) Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard - 20-891704000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PMV-zKgAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B5OW7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 29.24}}
{"item_id": "B002B5TZ4Y", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard", "description": "This MOLLE compatible shotgun scabbard is designed to give you a safe, convenient way to transport your shotgun by strapping it to your backpack, rucksack, or padded weapons case. It can also be slung across your back with the adjustable, removable nylon web sling, allowing you to draw it quickly when needed. A clever person will undoubtedly find many other suitable locations where the scabbard can useful to protect your shotgun from dirt, sand and weather while allowing quick and easy access.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard This MOLLE compatible shotgun scabbard is designed to give you a safe, convenient way to transport your shotgun by strapping it to your backpack, rucksack, or padded weapons case. It can also be slung across your back with the adjustable, removable nylon web sling, allowing you to draw it quickly when needed. A clever person will undoubtedly find many other suitable locations where the scabbard can useful to protect your shotgun from dirt, sand and weather while allowing quick and easy access.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e4fXVOpBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B5TZ4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B002B5ZJCG", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Level III MOLLE Compatible Assault Pack", "description": "This enhanced Level III MOLLE compatible assault pack (18\"h x 10\"w x 10\"d) is perfect when you don't want to lug around a full three-day assault pack. With less than half the cubic inches of our larger assault pack, you will find it is the perfect size for when you want to travel light, such as a one-day or overnight excursion. Thanks to the many MOLLE compatible attachment points (PALs) you can add additional MOLLE, ALICE or similar pouches if more carrying capacity is needed. The pack has two main compartments and two large exterior pockets for stowing gear you may need to access in a hurry. It is hydration pouch compatible (bladder sold separately), and has vertical and horizontal compression straps to help hold your gear in place. It also offers an adjustable waist belt and a web carry handle on the top.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Level III MOLLE Compatible Assault Pack This enhanced Level III MOLLE compatible assault pack (18\"h x 10\"w x 10\"d) is perfect when you don't want to lug around a full three-day assault pack. With less than half the cubic inches of our larger assault pack, you will find it is the perfect size for when you want to travel light, such as a one-day or overnight excursion. Thanks to the many MOLLE compatible attachment points (PALs) you can add additional MOLLE, ALICE or similar pouches if more carrying capacity is needed. The pack has two main compartments and two large exterior pockets for stowing gear you may need to access in a hurry. It is hydration pouch compatible (bladder sold separately), and has vertical and horizontal compression straps to help hold your gear in place. It also offers an adjustable waist belt and a web carry handle on the top.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YpdGH%2BLiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B5ZJCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 78.95}}
