{"item_id": "B002B8H296", "title": "Radio Flyer Girls Classic Pink Dual Deck Tricycle", "description": "About Radio Flyer Like the Original Red Wagon that lent the company its name, Radio Flyer has become an American classic. From humble beginnings, Radio Flyer has been rediscovered with each new generation - creating a legacy of toys that continue to spark the imagination. For over 90 years, millions of children have played with Radio Flyer wagons, launching countless voyages of imagination. Their beauty, simplicity, and standards of safety encourage adventure, discovery, and the wonders of childhood. As the new millennium gains momentum, Radio Flyer is still in the driver's seat - creating tomorrow's innovative products with the same classic quality and sheer sense of play that have been their trademarks from the beginning. Radio Flyer wagons are truly icons of Americana. Timelessly fun dual deck tricycle. Adorable pink finish girls will love. Includes bell and handlebar streamers for extra fun. Shining chrome handlebars and fender. Seat adjusts to grow with your child. Stable turning radius keeps riders safe and prevents falling. Durable 12-inch front wheel. Weight capacity: 49 lbs.. Suitable for ages 2-5.", "text": "Radio Flyer Girls Classic Pink Dual Deck Tricycle About Radio Flyer Like the Original Red Wagon that lent the company its name, Radio Flyer has become an American classic. From humble beginnings, Radio Flyer has been rediscovered with each new generation - creating a legacy of toys that continue to spark the imagination. For over 90 years, millions of children have played with Radio Flyer wagons, launching countless voyages of imagination. Their beauty, simplicity, and standards of safety encourage adventure, discovery, and the wonders of childhood. As the new millennium gains momentum, Radio Flyer is still in the driver's seat - creating tomorrow's innovative products with the same classic quality and sheer sense of play that have been their trademarks from the beginning. Radio Flyer wagons are truly icons of Americana. Timelessly fun dual deck tricycle. Adorable pink finish girls will love. Includes bell and handlebar streamers for extra fun. Shining chrome handlebars and fender. Seat adjusts to grow with your child. Stable turning radius keeps riders safe and prevents falling. Durable 12-inch front wheel. Weight capacity: 49 lbs.. Suitable for ages 2-5.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XI9L1%2B1AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002B8H296.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radio Flyer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Tricycles"]], "price": 57.97}}
