{"item_id": "B002BTSSIO", "title": "NcStar 1X40 Red Dot Sight with Built in Red Laser/Quick Release Weaver Mount (DLB140)", "description": "The NcSTAR Team has come together to create the first Quick Release Red Dot Sight with Integrated Laser. This new Red Dot falls right in line with Our Mark III Tactical Series with a similar exterior flow and the same great Lever-Locking Quick Release Weaver Style Mount.", "text": "NcStar 1X40 Red Dot Sight with Built in Red Laser/Quick Release Weaver Mount (DLB140) The NcSTAR Team has come together to create the first Quick Release Red Dot Sight with Integrated Laser. This new Red Dot falls right in line with Our Mark III Tactical Series with a similar exterior flow and the same great Lever-Locking Quick Release Weaver Style Mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B3pv6eGQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002BTSSIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 54.99}}
