{"item_id": "B002BVUGA0", "title": "Diamondback Bigfoot Pedals", "description": "Add stability to your BMX ride with the Diamondback Bigfoot pedals. Ideal for riders with larger feet, the classic BMX-style pedals feature aluminum platforms; hardened, CNC-machined chromoly axles; pressed traction pins; and precision-ground ball bearings. The pedals weigh 3.88 ounces as a pair and are available in 1/2- and 9/16-inch sizes.", "text": "Diamondback Bigfoot Pedals Add stability to your BMX ride with the Diamondback Bigfoot pedals. Ideal for riders with larger feet, the classic BMX-style pedals feature aluminum platforms; hardened, CNC-machined chromoly axles; pressed traction pins; and precision-ground ball bearings. The pedals weigh 3.88 ounces as a pair and are available in 1/2- and 9/16-inch sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517VPs3%2BbcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002BVUGA0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]]}}
