{"item_id": "B002BW3HM8", "title": "Avenir Ultralight Pedals with Toe Clips and Straps, Black/Silver, 9/16 Inch Axle", "description": "Affordable Avenir Ultralight pedals come pre-installed with toe clips, straps, and reflectors. Sealed bearings and full alloy construction ensure optimal durability and years of dependable use. The pedals weigh just 280 grams a pair.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "text": "Avenir Ultralight Pedals with Toe Clips and Straps, Black/Silver, 9/16 Inch Axle Affordable Avenir Ultralight pedals come pre-installed with toe clips, straps, and reflectors. Sealed bearings and full alloy construction ensure optimal durability and years of dependable use. The pedals weigh just 280 grams a pair.About AvenirAvenir by Raleigh is the premier bicycle accessory line from renowned cycling company Raleigh Bicycles. Raleigh -- a company whose history started in 1887, in Raleigh Street, Nottingham, in the United Kingdom -- is one of the oldest bicycle companies in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U1Hhtnh-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002BW3HM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 23.78}}
