{"item_id": "B002BXGDIM", "title": "Razor E300 Electric Scooter (Black)", "description": "Exclusive to Amazon.com. Get around with power and style on this cool electric scooter by Razor. Featuring a super-size deck and frame for riders ages 12 and older, the E300 can reach speeds of up to 15 miles per hour thanks to its high-performance, ultra-quiet chain-drive motor. The scooter also includes a pair of extra-wide 10-inch pneumatic tires to ensure a smooth ride while you zip around the neighborhood. Other details include variable speed acceleration, a twist-grip throttle, and a rechargeable battery that delivers up to 45 minutes of continuous use per charge (the battery requires roughly eight hours of charge time). The charger and tools are included with the E300, though riders should note that some assembly is required.", "text": "Razor E300 Electric Scooter (Black) Exclusive to Amazon.com. Get around with power and style on this cool electric scooter by Razor. Featuring a super-size deck and frame for riders ages 12 and older, the E300 can reach speeds of up to 15 miles per hour thanks to its high-performance, ultra-quiet chain-drive motor. The scooter also includes a pair of extra-wide 10-inch pneumatic tires to ensure a smooth ride while you zip around the neighborhood. Other details include variable speed acceleration, a twist-grip throttle, and a rechargeable battery that delivers up to 45 minutes of continuous use per charge (the battery requires roughly eight hours of charge time). The charger and tools are included with the E300, though riders should note that some assembly is required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uE7TvTwnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002BXGDIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002BXO4Q0", "title": "Mosin Nagant Weaver Rail Type Scout Rifle Scope Mount For 91/30 M38 M44 M39", "description": "Mosin Nagant Weaver Rail Type Scout Rifle Scope Mount For 91/30 M38 M44 M39 - Features: Weight: Approx 2.6 ounces, Length: Approx 6.6 inches, This mount replaces the rear sight leaf on your Nagant rifle. Features a weaver base mount that will fit most any rifle/pistol scope, red dot scope and other aiming devices. Comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. This mount must be used in conjunction with a long eye relief scope or a red dot/reflex sight that has no magnification. Tested to fit on the following rifles: Mosin Nagant 91/30, M38, M44, Hungarian, Chinese 53, Finnish M39 and Polish & Russian Mosin Nagants. Brand New! Due to the Mosin Nagants heavy recoil, thread locking compound such as loc-tite should be used on all screws and bolts. Thread locking compound is not included.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Weaver Rail Type Scout Rifle Scope Mount For 91/30 M38 M44 M39 Mosin Nagant Weaver Rail Type Scout Rifle Scope Mount For 91/30 M38 M44 M39 - Features: Weight: Approx 2.6 ounces, Length: Approx 6.6 inches, This mount replaces the rear sight leaf on your Nagant rifle. Features a weaver base mount that will fit most any rifle/pistol scope, red dot scope and other aiming devices. Comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. This mount must be used in conjunction with a long eye relief scope or a red dot/reflex sight that has no magnification. Tested to fit on the following rifles: Mosin Nagant 91/30, M38, M44, Hungarian, Chinese 53, Finnish M39 and Polish & Russian Mosin Nagants. Brand New! Due to the Mosin Nagants heavy recoil, thread locking compound such as loc-tite should be used on all screws and bolts. Thread locking compound is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sDnqqJMTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002BXO4Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 8.29}}
