{"item_id": "B002C01MGC", "title": "NcStar Tactical Red Laser Sight and 3W 120 Lumens Led Flashlight with Weaver Quick Release (AQPFLS)", "description": "The NcStar AQPFLS laser/flashlight combo mount brings you the extra edge you've been craving. The combo--which mounts to both pistols and rifles--features a specially designed rear switch that allows you to use the laser or ultra-bright LED flashlight individually, or both at the same time. The 3-watt flashlight puts out a white-hot 120 lumens, so you can easily see the path ahead. The fully adjustable 5 mW red laser, meanwhile, sits right below the flashlight in an easy-access location. And thanks to the combo's rough-and-tumble hard-anodized aluminum and reinforced nylon construction, the unit is sure to handle even the toughest abuse.SpecificationsFlashlight: 3-watt LEDFlashlight power output: 120 lumensBattery type: CR123C lithium (requires 2), includedLaser maximum output power: 5 mWWavelength: 635 to 655 nmBezel diameter: 1 inchSwitches: Standard on/off and 3-position selector switchDimensions: 3.37 by 1.9 by 1.44 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 4 ounces", "text": "NcStar Tactical Red Laser Sight and 3W 120 Lumens Led Flashlight with Weaver Quick Release (AQPFLS) The NcStar AQPFLS laser/flashlight combo mount brings you the extra edge you've been craving. The combo--which mounts to both pistols and rifles--features a specially designed rear switch that allows you to use the laser or ultra-bright LED flashlight individually, or both at the same time. The 3-watt flashlight puts out a white-hot 120 lumens, so you can easily see the path ahead. The fully adjustable 5 mW red laser, meanwhile, sits right below the flashlight in an easy-access location. And thanks to the combo's rough-and-tumble hard-anodized aluminum and reinforced nylon construction, the unit is sure to handle even the toughest abuse.SpecificationsFlashlight: 3-watt LEDFlashlight power output: 120 lumensBattery type: CR123C lithium (requires 2), includedLaser maximum output power: 5 mWWavelength: 635 to 655 nmBezel diameter: 1 inchSwitches: Standard on/off and 3-position selector switchDimensions: 3.37 by 1.9 by 1.44 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 4 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412QfM95aRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C01MGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 59.99}}
