{"item_id": "B002C1UEQU", "title": "Fits Ruger MARK I ; MARK II ; 22/45 MARK III ;MARK III With 5 1/2\" Barrel", "description": "The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-21 holster is Custom fit for Ruger Models With 5 1/2 barrel Mark II, 22/45, Mark III, Mark I", "text": "Fits Ruger MARK I ; MARK II ; 22/45 MARK III ;MARK III With 5 1/2\" Barrel The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-21 holster is Custom fit for Ruger Models With 5 1/2 barrel Mark II, 22/45, Mark III, Mark I", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415KNuvaEaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C1UEQU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B002C31LAQ", "title": "Bolle Kids Boost Over the Glasses Goggle", "description": "Pump up your ride with the Boost OTG's classic, curvy design that fits right over your prescription glasses. This small-fit goggle's forestay system gives you a perfect over-the-helmet fit while its flow-tech venting keeps your view free from fog so you can see clearly and comfortably.", "text": "Bolle Kids Boost Over the Glasses Goggle Pump up your ride with the Boost OTG's classic, curvy design that fits right over your prescription glasses. This small-fit goggle's forestay system gives you a perfect over-the-helmet fit while its flow-tech venting keeps your view free from fog so you can see clearly and comfortably.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QG2ZHuS5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C31LAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B002C39XWY", "title": "Pedalite 360 Degree Visibility Pedals, Black/Multi, 9.5 x 9.5 x 2.5 cm", "description": "Pedalite 360 degree visibility pedals harvest energy from the rotation of the pedal spindle and stores this energy to not only flash the pedal lights but to uniquely continue to flash them after pedaling stops for a full 5 minutes. There are no batteries to run out or damage the environment and pedalite pedals can be seen from up to 1km away, from any angle.", "text": "Pedalite 360 Degree Visibility Pedals, Black/Multi, 9.5 x 9.5 x 2.5 cm Pedalite 360 degree visibility pedals harvest energy from the rotation of the pedal spindle and stores this energy to not only flash the pedal lights but to uniquely continue to flash them after pedaling stops for a full 5 minutes. There are no batteries to run out or damage the environment and pedalite pedals can be seen from up to 1km away, from any angle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uUyR8hWSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C39XWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pedalite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 50.99}}
{"item_id": "B002C3KC8S", "title": "Kupilka Cup", "description": "Camping kitchen equipment:Applicatioins: DrinkType: cupsMaterial: pine fibre and plasticMaterial:dishwasher proof: yesSize:Volume: 210 mlHeight: 17 cmDiameter: 10 cmLength: 7 cmWeight: 80 gAdditional Information:suitable for usage in temperatures from -30C up to 100C", "text": "Kupilka Cup Camping kitchen equipment:Applicatioins: DrinkType: cupsMaterial: pine fibre and plasticMaterial:dishwasher proof: yesSize:Volume: 210 mlHeight: 17 cmDiameter: 10 cmLength: 7 cmWeight: 80 gAdditional Information:suitable for usage in temperatures from -30C up to 100C", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vEo7emAQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C3KC8S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 23.34}}
{"item_id": "B002C3RNMG", "title": "Coghlan's Windscreen", "description": "Once you use the Windscreen you will wonder why you hadn't brought this before. Blocking the wind helps you cook faster and more efficient.The screen is made out of anodized aluminum so it is lightweight and sturdy. When opened the screen measures 10\"X19\". Great item for the cook.", "text": "Coghlan's Windscreen Once you use the Windscreen you will wonder why you hadn't brought this before. Blocking the wind helps you cook faster and more efficient.The screen is made out of anodized aluminum so it is lightweight and sturdy. When opened the screen measures 10\"X19\". Great item for the cook.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GthN8XO1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C3RNMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 8.89}}
{"item_id": "B002C4PUZC", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Full Tang 24.75-Inch Rubber Grip Machete with Sheath (Black)", "description": "The versatile saw back machete features a sharp 17.75 inch stainless steel blade with a coarse toothed saw back serration. The contoured impact resistant ABS handle features a hand guard and a convenient wrist lanyard. This strong work horse machete has an overall length of 25.75 inches and comes complete with a durable black nylon sheath.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Full Tang 24.75-Inch Rubber Grip Machete with Sheath (Black) The versatile saw back machete features a sharp 17.75 inch stainless steel blade with a coarse toothed saw back serration. The contoured impact resistant ABS handle features a hand guard and a convenient wrist lanyard. This strong work horse machete has an overall length of 25.75 inches and comes complete with a durable black nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ghie4u4zL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C4PUZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B002C5BXGQ", "title": "CREE 40426 110 Lumens Bright Light CREE XLamp Warm White Camping LED Lantern", "description": "Superior quality LED lantern powered by the XR-E CREE warm white LED. Tender warm white light protects your eyes in dark environment. Features with 3 different mode - High, Low and Flashing mode. Comes with a carabiner clip, you can hang it on a tree or tent. Durable aluminum housing and it is water resistant, perfect for hiking, backpacking, fishing, camping, or emergency home use. Small in Size - Dimension: 5-Inch x 2-Inch x 2.5-Inch Long battery life, uses 3 AA batteries (Alkaline Duracell batteries included) - 24 hours on High, 48 hours on Low, 55 hours on Flashlight.", "text": "CREE 40426 110 Lumens Bright Light CREE XLamp Warm White Camping LED Lantern Superior quality LED lantern powered by the XR-E CREE warm white LED. Tender warm white light protects your eyes in dark environment. Features with 3 different mode - High, Low and Flashing mode. Comes with a carabiner clip, you can hang it on a tree or tent. Durable aluminum housing and it is water resistant, perfect for hiking, backpacking, fishing, camping, or emergency home use. Small in Size - Dimension: 5-Inch x 2-Inch x 2.5-Inch Long battery life, uses 3 AA batteries (Alkaline Duracell batteries included) - 24 hours on High, 48 hours on Low, 55 hours on Flashlight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aXo9hRT5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C5BXGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B002C8DQ7M", "title": "Diamondback Response Sport Mountain Bike (26-Inch Wheels), Matte Blue, X-Large/22-Inch", "description": "When the going gets tough the Diamondback Response Sport answers \"so what\". With a SR Suntour XCM 120mm travel fork, a butted aluminum trail frame, 24 gears, double wall rims, and mechanical disc brakes this bike is ready to take on the trail less travelled. There are a number of other hard tail mountain bikes, but the Response Sport is the one you should be riding.", "text": "Diamondback Response Sport Mountain Bike (26-Inch Wheels), Matte Blue, X-Large/22-Inch When the going gets tough the Diamondback Response Sport answers \"so what\". With a SR Suntour XCM 120mm travel fork, a butted aluminum trail frame, 24 gears, double wall rims, and mechanical disc brakes this bike is ready to take on the trail less travelled. There are a number of other hard tail mountain bikes, but the Response Sport is the one you should be riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q1DR8iQXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C8DQ7M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Hardtail Mountain Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002C9IMVQ", "title": "OPTP Slant (Pair)", "description": "OPTP Slant boards are integral in the prevention and treatment of common lower-leg and foot problems such as Achilles tendonitis, heel spurs, shin splints, calf strains, plantar fasciitis, overuse syndromes and post-surgery contraction. They're perfectly suited for stretching and weight-bearing exercise at home or in a clinic.These lightweight, but sturdy, slant boards are constructed of special weight-bearing foam, making them easier-to-handle and more cost-effective compared to wooden, metal or plastic boards. 18 degree incline. Latex-free. Sold in pairs.", "text": "OPTP Slant (Pair) OPTP Slant boards are integral in the prevention and treatment of common lower-leg and foot problems such as Achilles tendonitis, heel spurs, shin splints, calf strains, plantar fasciitis, overuse syndromes and post-surgery contraction. They're perfectly suited for stretching and weight-bearing exercise at home or in a clinic.These lightweight, but sturdy, slant boards are constructed of special weight-bearing foam, making them easier-to-handle and more cost-effective compared to wooden, metal or plastic boards. 18 degree incline. Latex-free. Sold in pairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BdwOY5i1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C9IMVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OPTP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Step Platforms"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B002C9MSAC", "title": "OPTP Pro-Roller Soft Pink Marble", "description": "Soft, yet supportive, the PRO-ROLLER Soft stays consistent with the rest of the PRO-ROLLER series with its cross-linked, closed-cell construction for lasting durability. Its comfortable support is gentle on tight or rigid areas making it ideal for lying supine, yet it's functional enough for gentle massage rolling. The soft compression also creates a more stable environment for high-risk users so that exercises are easier than on other rollers that are traditionally more firm.PRO-ROLLER Soft measures 36\" x 6\" and is easily cleaned using a disinfecting wipe, or a wet, soapy cloth.", "text": "OPTP Pro-Roller Soft Pink Marble Soft, yet supportive, the PRO-ROLLER Soft stays consistent with the rest of the PRO-ROLLER series with its cross-linked, closed-cell construction for lasting durability. Its comfortable support is gentle on tight or rigid areas making it ideal for lying supine, yet it's functional enough for gentle massage rolling. The soft compression also creates a more stable environment for high-risk users so that exercises are easier than on other rollers that are traditionally more firm.PRO-ROLLER Soft measures 36\" x 6\" and is easily cleaned using a disinfecting wipe, or a wet, soapy cloth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sE8tstfyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002C9MSAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OPTP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 33.95}}
{"item_id": "B002CACMR0", "title": "Callaway FT Launch Zone Hitting Mat", "description": "The FT Launch Zone Hitting Mat is highly resistant to wear and features a tru-turf surface that simulates hitting from a real fairway or tee box. The ultra-durable, heavy rubber backing minimizes sliding at impact and helps soften the strike to better protect your hands, wrists and clubs. The FT Launch Zone also features a unique tee holder that allows you to use your tee of choice and adjust to any height desirable.", "text": "Callaway FT Launch Zone Hitting Mat The FT Launch Zone Hitting Mat is highly resistant to wear and features a tru-turf surface that simulates hitting from a real fairway or tee box. The ultra-durable, heavy rubber backing minimizes sliding at impact and helps soften the strike to better protect your hands, wrists and clubs. The FT Launch Zone also features a unique tee holder that allows you to use your tee of choice and adjust to any height desirable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51T9z5PzDmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CACMR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Callaway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Hitting Mats"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B002CBWQ0C", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Rodan 5.25-Inch Drop Point Blade, Polypropylene Handle, Leather Belt Sheath", "description": "Handle material high impact polypropylene. Blade steel 1075 high carbon steel. Blade finish Epoxy black powder coating. Blade thickness 3/16-Inch. Overall length 10 1/2-Inch. Blade length 5 1/4-Inch. Carry system hand crafted welted leather. Made in El Salvador.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Rodan 5.25-Inch Drop Point Blade, Polypropylene Handle, Leather Belt Sheath Handle material high impact polypropylene. Blade steel 1075 high carbon steel. Blade finish Epoxy black powder coating. Blade thickness 3/16-Inch. Overall length 10 1/2-Inch. Blade length 5 1/4-Inch. Carry system hand crafted welted leather. Made in El Salvador.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21keh6wNbYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CBWQ0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.14}}
{"item_id": "B002CC1ARQ", "title": "MySack Golf Ball Storage Sack", "description": "You will get many laughs from this great gift idea. Perfect for the avid golfer. Pouch hold two golf balls. He will be the talk of the golf course with this one.", "text": "MySack Golf Ball Storage Sack You will get many laughs from this great gift idea. Perfect for the avid golfer. Pouch hold two golf balls. He will be the talk of the golf course with this one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VCdEkCEPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CC1ARQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MySack", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B002CC6BPM", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushlore 4.375-Inch Drop Point Blade, Walnut Handle with Leather Sheath (Plain)", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushlore 4.375-Inch Drop Point Blade, Walnut Handle with Leather Sheath (Plain) CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dcdqwt7QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CC6BPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.34}}
{"item_id": "B002CC6BSO", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushcraft Basic 5-Inch Black Blade, Walnut Handle, Leather Sheath", "description": "Handle material hardwood, blade steel 1075 high carbon steel. Blade finish epoxy black powder coating. Blade thickness 1/8-Inch. Overall length 9 5/8-Inch. Blade length 5-Inch. Carry system hand crafted welted leather. Made in El Salvador.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushcraft Basic 5-Inch Black Blade, Walnut Handle, Leather Sheath Handle material hardwood, blade steel 1075 high carbon steel. Blade finish epoxy black powder coating. Blade thickness 1/8-Inch. Overall length 9 5/8-Inch. Blade length 5-Inch. Carry system hand crafted welted leather. Made in El Salvador.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21m0Fb5djKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CC6BSO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 37.52}}
{"item_id": "B002CETP2Q", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife 14-Inch Golok Machete Only", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife 14-Inch Golok Machete Only CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HhmGdmVTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CETP2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 64.87}}
{"item_id": "B002CIEKWM", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Extended Mag Catch", "description": "Have you ever had gloves on and tried to remove your magazine from your SKS? We have too and its a pain. That is why we designed the Intrafuse SKS Extended Mag Catch. It allows you to easily get a hold of the mag catch for quick and easy removal of your mag.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Extended Mag Catch Have you ever had gloves on and tried to remove your magazine from your SKS? We have too and its a pain. That is why we designed the Intrafuse SKS Extended Mag Catch. It allows you to easily get a hold of the mag catch for quick and easy removal of your mag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fVe3w83tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CIEKWM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 5.98}}
{"item_id": "B002CK55JM", "title": "M58b Airsoft Pump Action Shotgun Rifle 400 FPS Police", "description": "Item Condition: Brand New In Box SEALED Contains: 1x Airsoft Pump Shotgun FPS: 375-400 (NO JOKE) Magazine Capacity: ~14 Power: Pump Action This is one POWERFUL and REALISTIC airsoft gun. This airsoft pump shotgun fires at an amazing 375-400 FPS. Yes, it is 375-400 FPS! This airsoft pump action shotgun is GREAT and RELIABLE for its price! This airsoft gun is made mainly by metal alloy and hard ABS plastic! Grerat durable heavy weight version! This is in our opinion the BEST airsoft pump shotgun rifle made for its value and price! The price is unbeatable for its power!", "text": "M58b Airsoft Pump Action Shotgun Rifle 400 FPS Police Item Condition: Brand New In Box SEALED Contains: 1x Airsoft Pump Shotgun FPS: 375-400 (NO JOKE) Magazine Capacity: ~14 Power: Pump Action This is one POWERFUL and REALISTIC airsoft gun. This airsoft pump shotgun fires at an amazing 375-400 FPS. Yes, it is 375-400 FPS! This airsoft pump action shotgun is GREAT and RELIABLE for its price! This airsoft gun is made mainly by metal alloy and hard ABS plastic! Grerat durable heavy weight version! This is in our opinion the BEST airsoft pump shotgun rifle made for its value and price! The price is unbeatable for its power!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E9OIDsprL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CK55JM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Shotguns"]], "price": 28.27}}
{"item_id": "B002CKB064", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Hand Guard Removal Tool", "description": "This tool is a necessity for any AR style rifle shooter or agency armorer. It eases the removal of the hand guards on both carbines and full sized rifles. All areas that contact the rifle are protected to prevent damage to the finish of the rifle.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Hand Guard Removal Tool This tool is a necessity for any AR style rifle shooter or agency armorer. It eases the removal of the hand guards on both carbines and full sized rifles. All areas that contact the rifle are protected to prevent damage to the finish of the rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R7qCu%2B%2BiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CKB064.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B002CKB0CI", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Carry Handle Mount, Black", "description": "Weve designed our AR Carry Handle Mount around the thought that some users out there want the ability to use both optics and the iron sights. Our mounts lock into either a removable or fixed carry handle and allow you to take advantage of the iron sights even when an optic is installed. The mount, constructed of high strength composite, provides you with a true Picatinny rail so you can be assured that no matter what optic you might want to use, this mount will accept it.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Carry Handle Mount, Black Weve designed our AR Carry Handle Mount around the thought that some users out there want the ability to use both optics and the iron sights. Our mounts lock into either a removable or fixed carry handle and allow you to take advantage of the iron sights even when an optic is installed. The mount, constructed of high strength composite, provides you with a true Picatinny rail so you can be assured that no matter what optic you might want to use, this mount will accept it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313T8nEbdsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CKB0CI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 12.79}}
{"item_id": "B002CKWQ9Y", "title": "GSG-5 GSG5 3 Position Retractable Stock", "description": "New retractable stock compatible for GSG5 Rifles. This retractable stock is specially design for your GSG-5 and the retractable stock will not block your ejection port under any circumstances.", "text": "GSG-5 GSG5 3 Position Retractable Stock New retractable stock compatible for GSG5 Rifles. This retractable stock is specially design for your GSG-5 and the retractable stock will not block your ejection port under any circumstances.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41--bkbVVrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CKWQ9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "COI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 48.9}}
