{"item_id": "B002COCF3M", "title": "Hammock Bliss No-See-Um No More - The Ultimate Bug Free Hammock", "description": "Change the way you camp forever with our Hammock Bliss No-See-Um No More Hammock - the ideal hammock when pesky insects are a problem. Our 2100 holes per square inch no-see-um netting offers the utmost in protection as the netting is so fine, even the tiniest creatures cannot penetrate including sand flies, fleas, gnats, midges, mosquitoes & no-see-ums. This extremely durable netting is attached to the entire length of the hammock and is supported by 100\" of cord per side, allowing the net to hang well above the sleeping area. Double pull YKK zippers make it a snap to enter or exit your insect free space. Lay back, let go and relax in bug free bliss.", "text": "Hammock Bliss No-See-Um No More - The Ultimate Bug Free Hammock Change the way you camp forever with our Hammock Bliss No-See-Um No More Hammock - the ideal hammock when pesky insects are a problem. Our 2100 holes per square inch no-see-um netting offers the utmost in protection as the netting is so fine, even the tiniest creatures cannot penetrate including sand flies, fleas, gnats, midges, mosquitoes & no-see-ums. This extremely durable netting is attached to the entire length of the hammock and is supported by 100\" of cord per side, allowing the net to hang well above the sleeping area. Double pull YKK zippers make it a snap to enter or exit your insect free space. Lay back, let go and relax in bug free bliss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514T2ZdKzmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002COCF3M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B002CQUA14", "title": "Space Brand All Weather Blanket", "description": "COMPLETE body coverage for the ultimate in warmth. It's windproof, waterproof, lightweight and flexible to -20. Size: 60\" x 84\". Weight 12oz.", "text": "Space Brand All Weather Blanket COMPLETE body coverage for the ultimate in warmth. It's windproof, waterproof, lightweight and flexible to -20. Size: 60\" x 84\". Weight 12oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Lnak3GneL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CQUA14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grabber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 15.41}}
