{"item_id": "B002CTAJ80", "title": "Troy Industries Front Folding Tritium M4 Style Battle Sight (Black )", "description": "Front Folding M4 Tritium BattleSight Just because the light’s not perfect doesn’t mean your aim shouldn’t be. Troy Industries’ TRITIUM BattleSights are designed for twilight or any low-light situation. TRITIUM is a form of hydrogen that emits a continuous light source where using batteries or electricity is not possible. The front post is centered between two Tritium points of reference to allow proper alignment, eliminating the poor sight orientation that’s typical in twilight. - Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gas block that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "text": "Troy Industries Front Folding Tritium M4 Style Battle Sight (Black ) Front Folding M4 Tritium BattleSight Just because the light’s not perfect doesn’t mean your aim shouldn’t be. Troy Industries’ TRITIUM BattleSights are designed for twilight or any low-light situation. TRITIUM is a form of hydrogen that emits a continuous light source where using batteries or electricity is not possible. The front post is centered between two Tritium points of reference to allow proper alignment, eliminating the poor sight orientation that’s typical in twilight. - Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gas block that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EjuVC40qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CTAJ80.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 118.21}}
{"item_id": "B002CTCFTQ", "title": "M-Pro 7 Soft Sided Tactical Gun Cleaning Kit (Black)", "description": "M-Pro 7 Tactical Soft Sided Cleaning Kit Md: 0701556, Rod, brushes, swabs and patches. Cleans .22, .38, .40, .45 and 12 ga. Folding case with belt attachment. Includes M-Pro7 2 oz. Gun cleaner and M-Pro7 2 oz. cleaner lubricant protectant CLP. M16 breach brush. Screwdriver handle for cleaning rod., Type: Cleaning Kit Size: N/A Quantity: 1 Kit, Manufacturer: M-Pro 7, Model: 0701556", "text": "M-Pro 7 Soft Sided Tactical Gun Cleaning Kit (Black) M-Pro 7 Tactical Soft Sided Cleaning Kit Md: 0701556, Rod, brushes, swabs and patches. Cleans .22, .38, .40, .45 and 12 ga. Folding case with belt attachment. Includes M-Pro7 2 oz. Gun cleaner and M-Pro7 2 oz. cleaner lubricant protectant CLP. M16 breach brush. Screwdriver handle for cleaning rod., Type: Cleaning Kit Size: N/A Quantity: 1 Kit, Manufacturer: M-Pro 7, Model: 0701556", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P7GNyKWAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002CTCFTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Pro 7", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 41.46}}
