{"item_id": "B002D4BGKO", "title": "BLACKHAWK! KNOXX PowerPak System Modular Cheek Piece and Ammo Carrier - Black", "description": "The innovative PowerPak System, from special ops gear maker BLACKHAWK!, boosts the versatility and performance of the company's SpecOps Stock. The four-piece modular system is designed for rigid and stable use in the toughest of environments, providing a convenient spot to stow extra shells and small tactical gear.Purpose built for military and law enforcement, the PowerPak provides rigid, stable use in the toughest of environments.FeaturesHigh cheekpiece for use with raised opticsLow cheekpiece for use with low-rise sightsShell holder for five 12-gauge shells allows for rapid reloadsAmbidextrous design can be assembled for left- or right-handed shooters by snapping onto rear portion of stockWatertight storage compartment with threaded end caps for spare CR123A batteries or similar-sized itemsDesigned specifically for use with all versions of SpecOps Stock, SpecOps Stock Gen II, and SpecOps NRSRugged, corrosion- and weather-resistant 8018 polymer construction for years of reliable serviceComplete installation hardware and tools includedLifetime WarrantyThis BLACKHAWK! product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BLACKHAWK!BLACKHAWK! was founded in 1993 by former Navy SEAL Mike Noell. His US Navy experience provided him the inspiration for the gear BLACKHAWK! now manufactures. While operating inside Northern Iraq, he had to haul a great deal of gear by foot in an enemy minefield. His pack failed, dumping his gear onto the mine-ridden ground. \"If I get out of this alive, I'll make this stuff the way it needs to be built, so none of my buddies have to go through this,\" he remarked to a fellow operator. Upon entering the private sector, that's just what he did, making gear and packs in a garage, and growing ever since.As a member of the SEALs, Mike served his country with distinction. While still at Basic Underwater Demolition School/SEAL Training (BUD/S), he was presented with the \"Honor Man\" award, given to the class's top achiever in academics and physical field performance overall. He was also given the \"Fire in the Gut\" award, an honor for exemplary effort voted by his teammates, the first time in history that both awards when to the same sailor. Many of those former classmates now use his gear in operations around the globe.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! KNOXX PowerPak System Modular Cheek Piece and Ammo Carrier - Black The innovative PowerPak System, from special ops gear maker BLACKHAWK!, boosts the versatility and performance of the company's SpecOps Stock. The four-piece modular system is designed for rigid and stable use in the toughest of environments, providing a convenient spot to stow extra shells and small tactical gear.Purpose built for military and law enforcement, the PowerPak provides rigid, stable use in the toughest of environments.FeaturesHigh cheekpiece for use with raised opticsLow cheekpiece for use with low-rise sightsShell holder for five 12-gauge shells allows for rapid reloadsAmbidextrous design can be assembled for left- or right-handed shooters by snapping onto rear portion of stockWatertight storage compartment with threaded end caps for spare CR123A batteries or similar-sized itemsDesigned specifically for use with all versions of SpecOps Stock, SpecOps Stock Gen II, and SpecOps NRSRugged, corrosion- and weather-resistant 8018 polymer construction for years of reliable serviceComplete installation hardware and tools includedLifetime WarrantyThis BLACKHAWK! product includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BLACKHAWK!BLACKHAWK! was founded in 1993 by former Navy SEAL Mike Noell. His US Navy experience provided him the inspiration for the gear BLACKHAWK! now manufactures. While operating inside Northern Iraq, he had to haul a great deal of gear by foot in an enemy minefield. His pack failed, dumping his gear onto the mine-ridden ground. \"If I get out of this alive, I'll make this stuff the way it needs to be built, so none of my buddies have to go through this,\" he remarked to a fellow operator. Upon entering the private sector, that's just what he did, making gear and packs in a garage, and growing ever since.As a member of the SEALs, Mike served his country with distinction. While still at Basic Underwater Demolition School/SEAL Training (BUD/S), he was presented with the \"Honor Man\" award, given to the class's top achiever in academics and physical field performance overall. He was also given the \"Fire in the Gut\" award, an honor for exemplary effort voted by his teammates, the first time in history that both awards when to the same sailor. Many of those former classmates now use his gear in operations around the globe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PSYHla7BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D4BGKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B002D4IJ0Y", "title": "Cold Steel Brooklyn Smasher", "description": "After reading an article about how often baseball bats break during competitive play -- costing money, and sometime leading to injury -- Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson asked his team to create an indestructible bat. The result was the Brooklyn Smasher, a synthetic polypropylene bat that will never break, rot, crack, splinter, or fade. Smasher can be used as a competition bat, for batting practice, and even at-home self defense.Specifications34-inch lengthTwo-pound, seven-ounce weightDurable polypropylene materialWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Brooklyn Smasher After reading an article about how often baseball bats break during competitive play -- costing money, and sometime leading to injury -- Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson asked his team to create an indestructible bat. The result was the Brooklyn Smasher, a synthetic polypropylene bat that will never break, rot, crack, splinter, or fade. Smasher can be used as a competition bat, for batting practice, and even at-home self defense.Specifications34-inch lengthTwo-pound, seven-ounce weightDurable polypropylene materialWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cnIWEEChL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D4IJ0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Bats"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B002D4K9GG", "title": "Kershaw Tanto Groove Knife with 3-D Machined Grooves on Blade", "description": "The Kershaw Tanto Groove is a highly durable, outdoor knife that provides excellent rust resistance. Made with Sandvik 13C26 stainless steel with 3-D machined grooves and Tungsten DLC black coating, the blade retains its sharpness with proper use and care. The Tanto's 410 stainless-steel handle gives a solid grip with its Tungsten DLC black coating and black G-10 overlays. Open the knife easily using just the index finger of either hand and a frame lock secures the blade in place.", "text": "Kershaw Tanto Groove Knife with 3-D Machined Grooves on Blade The Kershaw Tanto Groove is a highly durable, outdoor knife that provides excellent rust resistance. Made with Sandvik 13C26 stainless steel with 3-D machined grooves and Tungsten DLC black coating, the blade retains its sharpness with proper use and care. The Tanto's 410 stainless-steel handle gives a solid grip with its Tungsten DLC black coating and black G-10 overlays. Open the knife easily using just the index finger of either hand and a frame lock secures the blade in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ric2x-2IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D4K9GG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002D4X26U", "title": "Snow Peak LiteMax Stove Stoves", "description": "214957 Features: Pack it up and never worry about the weight, with titanium and aluminum construction, this little stove weighs in at a mere 19 ounces Cloth storage bag included Specifications: Weight (no fuel): 19 ounces Packed size: 3-7-8 dia x 3-1-2 x 3 inches Fuel: propane to isobutane mixture", "text": "Snow Peak LiteMax Stove Stoves 214957 Features: Pack it up and never worry about the weight, with titanium and aluminum construction, this little stove weighs in at a mere 19 ounces Cloth storage bag included Specifications: Weight (no fuel): 19 ounces Packed size: 3-7-8 dia x 3-1-2 x 3 inches Fuel: propane to isobutane mixture", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B0MNfJ3RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D4X26U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Snow Peak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B002D7UEOA", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Saiga Hand Guard, Black", "description": "Saiga rifles continue to be the new rage, so why not take yours to the next level with our Intrafuse Saiga Hand guard? Included are a sling nut and three removable accessory rails allow you to bolt almost anything you'd like to your rifle. What? You have a Saiga shotgun? No worries, the hand guard includes adapters to fit all rifles and shotguns except the .410. Counts as 1 U.S. 922r Compliant Part.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Saiga Hand Guard, Black Saiga rifles continue to be the new rage, so why not take yours to the next level with our Intrafuse Saiga Hand guard? Included are a sling nut and three removable accessory rails allow you to bolt almost anything you'd like to your rifle. What? You have a Saiga shotgun? No worries, the hand guard includes adapters to fit all rifles and shotguns except the .410. Counts as 1 U.S. 922r Compliant Part.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i%2BZJphuRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D7UEOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B002D98FJY", "title": "Airsoft Shotgun Shells 6-pack for Double Eagle M56 Series Spring Shotguns", "description": "Airsoft Shotgun Shells - Double Eagle M56 series 6-Pack. Fits the Double Eagle M56 shotgun series. Each Shell features:30 round, Spring-Loaded3-round shot groupsSolid Construction, realistic designFits in most shotgun shell bandoliers", "text": "Airsoft Shotgun Shells 6-pack for Double Eagle M56 Series Spring Shotguns Airsoft Shotgun Shells - Double Eagle M56 series 6-Pack. Fits the Double Eagle M56 shotgun series. Each Shell features:30 round, Spring-Loaded3-round shot groupsSolid Construction, realistic designFits in most shotgun shell bandoliers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P24RNw69L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002D98FJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B002DD0Z5C", "title": "Snow Peak Titanium Single Wall Cup 450", "description": "The Snow Peak Titanium Single Wall Cup 450 is rust proof and tough. This 14 fluid oz, titanium cup/pot with an ergonomic handle weighs in at a mere 2. 4 oz. Corrosion-resistant titanium is super lightweight and has superior strength compared to steel. Use it for your favorite backcountry beverages--it won't taint your coffee with the taste of the soup you had for dinner.", "text": "Snow Peak Titanium Single Wall Cup 450 The Snow Peak Titanium Single Wall Cup 450 is rust proof and tough. This 14 fluid oz, titanium cup/pot with an ergonomic handle weighs in at a mere 2. 4 oz. Corrosion-resistant titanium is super lightweight and has superior strength compared to steel. Use it for your favorite backcountry beverages--it won't taint your coffee with the taste of the soup you had for dinner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nvnlgFfbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DD0Z5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Snow Peak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B002DELUPK", "title": "SentrySafe GM1459E Electronic Lock Fire Safe, 14-Gun Capacity", "description": "Sentry Safe 14-Gun capacity fire safe with electronic lock security gun safe with solid steel pry-resistant door with concealed hinges to protect against theft and unauthorized entry. Carpeted interior protects priceless guns and collectibles. Satin and bright chrome hardware with lever handle for a high end appearance", "text": "SentrySafe GM1459E Electronic Lock Fire Safe, 14-Gun Capacity Sentry Safe 14-Gun capacity fire safe with electronic lock security gun safe with solid steel pry-resistant door with concealed hinges to protect against theft and unauthorized entry. Carpeted interior protects priceless guns and collectibles. Satin and bright chrome hardware with lever handle for a high end appearance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LsyWakGDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DELUPK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 16.69}}
{"item_id": "B002DELUQO", "title": "SentrySafe G1055E Electronic Lock Safe, Black Powder Coat, 10-Gun Capacity", "description": "Sentry Safe 55-Inch 10-Gun electronic lock security gun safe with solid steel pry-resistant door with concealed hinges to protect against theft and unauthorized entry. Capacity is 6.2-Cubic-Feet with carpeted interior which protects priceless guns and collectibles.", "text": "SentrySafe G1055E Electronic Lock Safe, Black Powder Coat, 10-Gun Capacity Sentry Safe 55-Inch 10-Gun electronic lock security gun safe with solid steel pry-resistant door with concealed hinges to protect against theft and unauthorized entry. Capacity is 6.2-Cubic-Feet with carpeted interior which protects priceless guns and collectibles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qVDk7JUDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DELUQO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 249.49}}
