{"item_id": "B002DGVQIO", "title": "Sportcraft Ladderball", "description": "Sportcraft's Ladderball game adds fun for all ages to outdoor and indoor events. Ideal for tailgating, camping, or your weekend backyard barbecue, this set includes two PVC ladders, six weighted bolos, and game instructions. Create teams or play head-to-head with friends or family.Quick set-up and take-down get you to the fun as quickly as possible, and the assembled PVC ladders measure 22-by-39 inches (W x H), with a deep 35-inch base for added stability.About Sportcraft:The General Sportcraft Company was founded in 1926. In those times, most department stores did not carry sporting goods, so General Sportcraft helped pioneer the concept of \"family-fun\" departments within the store. Soon, the popularity of these departments spawned stand-alone sporting goods stores.In the 1940s and 1950s, Sportcraft introduced new outdoor games to America, such as bocce, horseshoes, and volleyball. In time, Sportcraft's focus moved to indoors games like table tennis, billiards, foosball, and darts, now the company's most popular product lines. Today, more than 13 million customers a year purchase Sportcraft products.", "text": "Sportcraft Ladderball Sportcraft's Ladderball game adds fun for all ages to outdoor and indoor events. Ideal for tailgating, camping, or your weekend backyard barbecue, this set includes two PVC ladders, six weighted bolos, and game instructions. Create teams or play head-to-head with friends or family.Quick set-up and take-down get you to the fun as quickly as possible, and the assembled PVC ladders measure 22-by-39 inches (W x H), with a deep 35-inch base for added stability.About Sportcraft:The General Sportcraft Company was founded in 1926. In those times, most department stores did not carry sporting goods, so General Sportcraft helped pioneer the concept of \"family-fun\" departments within the store. Soon, the popularity of these departments spawned stand-alone sporting goods stores.In the 1940s and 1950s, Sportcraft introduced new outdoor games to America, such as bocce, horseshoes, and volleyball. In time, Sportcraft's focus moved to indoors games like table tennis, billiards, foosball, and darts, now the company's most popular product lines. Today, more than 13 million customers a year purchase Sportcraft products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oJBx-8VKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DGVQIO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Ladder Ball"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002DHC6PK", "title": "Body Solid NB59 Adjustable Nylon Cable Handle", "description": "", "text": "Body Solid NB59 Adjustable Nylon Cable Handle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312p71OS%2BeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DHC6PK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B002DHM5LU", "title": "Weider Adjustable Weight Leather Jump Rope", "description": "Get fit the old-fashioned way with this Weider adjustable-weight leather jump rope. The 9-foot rope is made of durable leather, helping it hold up for the long haul. More significantly for workout enthusiasts, the rope's soft foam handles include a pair of 1/2-pound removable weights. As a result, you can add or remove a little resistance during your routine, a nice option for people who like to vary their routines.", "text": "Weider Adjustable Weight Leather Jump Rope Get fit the old-fashioned way with this Weider adjustable-weight leather jump rope. The 9-foot rope is made of durable leather, helping it hold up for the long haul. More significantly for workout enthusiasts, the rope's soft foam handles include a pair of 1/2-pound removable weights. As a result, you can add or remove a little resistance during your routine, a nice option for people who like to vary their routines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rt1ZqMTcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DHM5LU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002DILRFY", "title": "New Drab Alice Pack Frame with Camo Straps", "description": "Black medal frame with nylon olive drab straps. Made to fit all medium and large Alice packs (LC-1 packs, Government issued style packs, and official Government packs). This frame can also fit other type of backpacks, book bags, etc. GI Government Issued style. Black ALICE pack frame with olive drab straps. Olive Drab.", "text": "New Drab Alice Pack Frame with Camo Straps Black medal frame with nylon olive drab straps. Made to fit all medium and large Alice packs (LC-1 packs, Government issued style packs, and official Government packs). This frame can also fit other type of backpacks, book bags, etc. GI Government Issued style. Black ALICE pack frame with olive drab straps. Olive Drab.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UXalZExPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DILRFY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B002DJ95H0", "title": "SKLZ Reaction Belts Partnered Breakaway Trainer", "description": "Trains speed, agility, and reaction time Break-away Velcro for safe and simple use Ideal for any court, field, or rink sports Included training plan for guided success Assists both offensive and defensive players About SKLZ As an innovator in athletic training, SKLZ is the flagship brand of Pro Performance, a premier player in the development and marketing of training aids and equipment for basketball, football, soccer, baseball, softball, and golf. With products designed for players of all ages and skill levels, SKLZ focuses on finding innovative products and methods that help maximize athletic potential and meet goals. Located in San Diego, California, SKLZ and Pro Performance operate internationally, with their products found at major sporting goods retailers, specialty shops, and training centers everywhere. Belts for partner drills to create faster movements. Dimensions: 120L x 24W x 3H inches. 3 sets of breakaway leashes in 4-, 7-, and 10-ft lengths. 360 rotation belts clip on easily and snugly.", "text": "SKLZ Reaction Belts Partnered Breakaway Trainer Trains speed, agility, and reaction time Break-away Velcro for safe and simple use Ideal for any court, field, or rink sports Included training plan for guided success Assists both offensive and defensive players About SKLZ As an innovator in athletic training, SKLZ is the flagship brand of Pro Performance, a premier player in the development and marketing of training aids and equipment for basketball, football, soccer, baseball, softball, and golf. With products designed for players of all ages and skill levels, SKLZ focuses on finding innovative products and methods that help maximize athletic potential and meet goals. Located in San Diego, California, SKLZ and Pro Performance operate internationally, with their products found at major sporting goods retailers, specialty shops, and training centers everywhere. Belts for partner drills to create faster movements. Dimensions: 120L x 24W x 3H inches. 3 sets of breakaway leashes in 4-, 7-, and 10-ft lengths. 360 rotation belts clip on easily and snugly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PDmhJYTaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DJ95H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Straps"]], "price": 21.95}}
