{"item_id": "B002DODONG", "title": "Vortex Viper PA 30mm Tube Rifle Scope", "description": "Vortex Viper 6.5-20x50 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x50 riflescope is ideal for tactical, long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Mil Dot reticle is useful for helping estimate range, windage and bullet hold-over. Good for long distance shooters and hunters who need the ranging ability. The Mil Dot subtensions are accurate at 14x. Side knob parallax adjust allows quick and easy parallax adjustments with range numbers visible while in the shooting position. 30mm main tube offers improved windage and elevation adjustment along with greater strength. Tall turrets allow quick and easy field adjustments. Viper 6.5-20x44 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x44 riflescope is ideal for long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Dead-Hold BDC reticle has a customized design that helps eliminate guesswork on hold-over and windage corrections. Good for any hunting or shooting at varying ranges where estimating hold-over would be a concern.", "text": "Vortex Viper PA 30mm Tube Rifle Scope Vortex Viper 6.5-20x50 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x50 riflescope is ideal for tactical, long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Mil Dot reticle is useful for helping estimate range, windage and bullet hold-over. Good for long distance shooters and hunters who need the ranging ability. The Mil Dot subtensions are accurate at 14x. Side knob parallax adjust allows quick and easy parallax adjustments with range numbers visible while in the shooting position. 30mm main tube offers improved windage and elevation adjustment along with greater strength. Tall turrets allow quick and easy field adjustments. Viper 6.5-20x44 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x44 riflescope is ideal for long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Dead-Hold BDC reticle has a customized design that helps eliminate guesswork on hold-over and windage corrections. Good for any hunting or shooting at varying ranges where estimating hold-over would be a concern.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RXiwA44LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DODONG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]]}}
