{"item_id": "B002DQSLUK", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Shotgun Snap Cap (12 Gauge)", "description": "Snap Caps are made to protect your firearms by relieving the stress on your firing pins and firing pin springs. When you safely store your unloaded...", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Shotgun Snap Cap (12 Gauge) Snap Caps are made to protect your firearms by relieving the stress on your firing pins and firing pin springs. When you safely store your unloaded...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YW3-dm7ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DQSLUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.88}}
{"item_id": "B002DQSROU", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Rifle Snap Cap (.223)", "description": "Use of a snap cap prevents firing pin breakage often caused by \"dry firing\" during practice or when wanting to remove spring tension from the firing pin or hammer. Don't think a fired cartridge can do the same because once the primer is indented, there is no more cushioning effect. In these well made snap caps, when the solid brass \"primer\" is hit, it moves forward against spring pressure to cushion the firing pin so it does not slam against steel. With today's high gunsmithing prices, a broken firing pin can be very expensive. Protect yours with a quality snap cap. These are not made in some Third World country either, but are first rate European quality. Also excellent to illustrate flinching so it can be corrected, just mix one in with live rounds, and a flinch will be obvious. Sold in package of 2 ea.", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Rifle Snap Cap (.223) Use of a snap cap prevents firing pin breakage often caused by \"dry firing\" during practice or when wanting to remove spring tension from the firing pin or hammer. Don't think a fired cartridge can do the same because once the primer is indented, there is no more cushioning effect. In these well made snap caps, when the solid brass \"primer\" is hit, it moves forward against spring pressure to cushion the firing pin so it does not slam against steel. With today's high gunsmithing prices, a broken firing pin can be very expensive. Protect yours with a quality snap cap. These are not made in some Third World country either, but are first rate European quality. Also excellent to illustrate flinching so it can be corrected, just mix one in with live rounds, and a flinch will be obvious. Sold in package of 2 ea.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ld54WMCDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DQSROU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 13.75}}
{"item_id": "B002DQUVXU", "title": "TMS AR15 Tactical High Scope Ring Set for Picatinny Rails QD", "description": "TACTICAL SCOPE RING SET, 30MM/1INCH, SEE-THRU, PICATINNYThis ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. This heavy duty tactical scope ring set is made of solid aluminum alloy for military and law enforcement uses.Fits Picatinny 1913 rails RIS RAS. Does NOT fit Weaver.Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts.1 1/2inch (38mm) center height. Good for mounting scopes with up to 65mm (outside diameter)Objectives.See-thru design allows use of regular iron sights with scope mounted.Large HEX clamping nut for secure mounting.Anodized black matte finish.Replacement butterfly nuts is included for quick and easy finger tightening.TWO identical rings are included in the set.", "text": "TMS AR15 Tactical High Scope Ring Set for Picatinny Rails QD TACTICAL SCOPE RING SET, 30MM/1INCH, SEE-THRU, PICATINNYThis ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. This heavy duty tactical scope ring set is made of solid aluminum alloy for military and law enforcement uses.Fits Picatinny 1913 rails RIS RAS. Does NOT fit Weaver.Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts.1 1/2inch (38mm) center height. Good for mounting scopes with up to 65mm (outside diameter)Objectives.See-thru design allows use of regular iron sights with scope mounted.Large HEX clamping nut for secure mounting.Anodized black matte finish.Replacement butterfly nuts is included for quick and easy finger tightening.TWO identical rings are included in the set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lxs6sMiHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DQUVXU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B002DQWRLE", "title": "Hammers Scope Rail Adapters for Crossbows Airguns 3/8\" Dovetail to Weaver", "description": "A set of two Hammers adapter mounts that convert 3/8\" dovetail to Weaver rails. Made of solid aluminum alloy to withstand shock and recoil Fits 3/8\" dovetails mounts, rails and bases as commonly found on air rifles, paintball markers, rimfire rifles and crossbows. Clamps and tightens using included Allen head wrench. 2 identical pieces in the set. Each measures 1 1/2inch long Anodized matte black finish", "text": "Hammers Scope Rail Adapters for Crossbows Airguns 3/8\" Dovetail to Weaver A set of two Hammers adapter mounts that convert 3/8\" dovetail to Weaver rails. Made of solid aluminum alloy to withstand shock and recoil Fits 3/8\" dovetails mounts, rails and bases as commonly found on air rifles, paintball markers, rimfire rifles and crossbows. Clamps and tightens using included Allen head wrench. 2 identical pieces in the set. Each measures 1 1/2inch long Anodized matte black finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q8zPMr%2BLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DQWRLE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B002DS1F2E", "title": "Tactical Cross Draw Shoulder Holster--BLACK", "description": "-Concealed design with horizontal carry right hand cross-draw holster with attached spare magazine carrier. -Double Mag Pouch is attached to the right side so you'll never run out of ammo. -Fully adjustable belt loops, harness and Pouch. -Made of Ballistic Polycloth. -Belt Not Included*", "text": "Tactical Cross Draw Shoulder Holster--BLACK -Concealed design with horizontal carry right hand cross-draw holster with attached spare magazine carrier. -Double Mag Pouch is attached to the right side so you'll never run out of ammo. -Fully adjustable belt loops, harness and Pouch. -Made of Ballistic Polycloth. -Belt Not Included*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RculJmsZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DS1F2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B002DT0OTS", "title": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Bamboo Handle Fixed Blade Knife, 8- Inch", "description": "This Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Fixed Blade Knife is specially crafted for fishing, hunting, sporting and tactical use. The high quality blade is made drom Japanese AUS-8 Steel. The handle is made from bamboo and features an integrated lanyard hole. A convenient sheath is included for safe carrying and storage. Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Bamboo Handle Fixed Blade Knife, 8- Inch This Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Fixed Blade Knife is specially crafted for fishing, hunting, sporting and tactical use. The high quality blade is made drom Japanese AUS-8 Steel. The handle is made from bamboo and features an integrated lanyard hole. A convenient sheath is included for safe carrying and storage. Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TAWj5yqCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DT0OTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camillus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 30.18}}
{"item_id": "B002DT4E62", "title": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Cuda Black Folding Knife with Quick Release, 9- Inch", "description": "Camillus Folding Knives are made from the very best steels with Carbonitride Titanium Blades. These blades are 10x harder than untreated steel and will stay sharper for a longer period of time, while resisting rust, stains and corrosion. Included in the folding knife category are knives that feature Marlin Spikes along with the CUDA® and Lev-R-Lok® lines of quick-action blade knives.", "text": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Cuda Black Folding Knife with Quick Release, 9- Inch Camillus Folding Knives are made from the very best steels with Carbonitride Titanium Blades. These blades are 10x harder than untreated steel and will stay sharper for a longer period of time, while resisting rust, stains and corrosion. Included in the folding knife category are knives that feature Marlin Spikes along with the CUDA® and Lev-R-Lok® lines of quick-action blade knives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S7mWxO7hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DT4E62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camillus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 36.65}}
{"item_id": "B002DT4GO2", "title": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Bamboo Handle Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "This Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Fixed Blade Knife is specially crafted for fishing, hunting, sporting and tactical use. The high quality blade is made drom Japanese AUS-8 Steel. The handle is made from bamboo and features an integrated lanyard hole. A convenient sheath is included for safe carrying and storage. Covered by Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Bamboo Handle Fixed Blade Knife This Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Fixed Blade Knife is specially crafted for fishing, hunting, sporting and tactical use. The high quality blade is made drom Japanese AUS-8 Steel. The handle is made from bamboo and features an integrated lanyard hole. A convenient sheath is included for safe carrying and storage. Covered by Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qjPYjj1pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DT4GO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camillus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 46.89}}
{"item_id": "B002DUZL3G", "title": "Sage2 Titanium PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The first Sage knife recognized knifemaker Michael Walker's creation of the LinerLock, which offered a ball-bearing detent method of keeping a folding knife closed. The Sage2 focuses on prime mover Chris Reeve's embellishment of the original Walker LinerLock, which he morphed into the Reeve Integral Lock (RIL). The modification uses the handle scale as the lock's liner. With the back portion of the handle doubling as both handle spring and lock, the knife no longer needs an internal liner, meaning the knife can be manufactured lighter and slimmer without sacrificing strength.The Sage2 also includes a spear-point blade made of CPM-S30V steel, with a flat-ground edge that pays tribute to Spyderco's Caly3 and Native models in shape and function. The screw-constructed titanium handle is also sturdy, with interior phosphor bronze washers ensuring a smooth opening and closing. The Sage concludes with a silhouette wire pocket clip that adjusts for left- or right-hand carry.Spyderco donates approximately five percent of sales of each Sage to the National Alzheimer's Association Denver, Colorado chapter.SpecificationsBlade: CPM-S30V steelHandle material: TitaniumBlade length: 3 inchesCutting edge: 2-5/8 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchHole diameter: 1/2 inchClosed length: 4-3/16 inchesOverall length: 7-1/8 inchesWeight: 3.5 ounces", "text": "Sage2 Titanium PlainEdge Knife The first Sage knife recognized knifemaker Michael Walker's creation of the LinerLock, which offered a ball-bearing detent method of keeping a folding knife closed. The Sage2 focuses on prime mover Chris Reeve's embellishment of the original Walker LinerLock, which he morphed into the Reeve Integral Lock (RIL). The modification uses the handle scale as the lock's liner. With the back portion of the handle doubling as both handle spring and lock, the knife no longer needs an internal liner, meaning the knife can be manufactured lighter and slimmer without sacrificing strength.The Sage2 also includes a spear-point blade made of CPM-S30V steel, with a flat-ground edge that pays tribute to Spyderco's Caly3 and Native models in shape and function. The screw-constructed titanium handle is also sturdy, with interior phosphor bronze washers ensuring a smooth opening and closing. The Sage concludes with a silhouette wire pocket clip that adjusts for left- or right-hand carry.Spyderco donates approximately five percent of sales of each Sage to the National Alzheimer's Association Denver, Colorado chapter.SpecificationsBlade: CPM-S30V steelHandle material: TitaniumBlade length: 3 inchesCutting edge: 2-5/8 inchesBlade thickness: 1/8 inchHole diameter: 1/2 inchClosed length: 4-3/16 inchesOverall length: 7-1/8 inchesWeight: 3.5 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ERGkNDtkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002DUZL3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 168.94}}
{"item_id": "B002DV19TK", "title": "Ladybug3 LW PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Spyderco Ladybug Plain Edge is nearly as tiny as your car keys, and easily carries in your pocket or purse. Its foliage green lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon handle is coated with Bi-Directional Texturing for a secure grip. This camo color has the ability to shade-shift from green to gray, and blends into surrounding colors and backgrounds. The VG-10 stainless steel, hollow ground, blade comes in a PlainEdge configuration. PRODUCT FEATURES: Length overall: 4.375\" Blade length: 1.938\" Blade steel: VG-10 Length closed: 2.438\" Cutting edge: 1.687\" Weight: .6oz Blade thickness: .078\" Handle material: Fiberglass Reinforced Nylon LFGP3 , Spyderco Ladybug3 LW PlainEdge , spyderco ladybug 3 , spyderco plain edge lady bug , spyderco ladybug , spyderco plain edge , pocket knife , pocket knifes , best pocket knife , personalized pocket knife , pocket knife reviews , pocket knife brands , pocket knife laws , pocket knife sharpener , pocket knife review , small pocket knife , quality pocket knife , folding pocket knife , pocket knife gift , utility pocket knife , mini pocket knife , best pocket knife in the world , spyderco , spyderco knives , spyderco knife , spyderco pocket knife , spyderco pocket kinives", "text": "Ladybug3 LW PlainEdge Knife The Spyderco Ladybug Plain Edge is nearly as tiny as your car keys, and easily carries in your pocket or purse. Its foliage green lightweight fiberglass reinforced nylon handle is coated with Bi-Directional Texturing for a secure grip. This camo color has the ability to shade-shift from green to gray, and blends into surrounding colors and backgrounds. The VG-10 stainless steel, hollow ground, blade comes in a PlainEdge configuration. PRODUCT FEATURES: Length overall: 4.375\" Blade length: 1.938\" Blade steel: VG-10 Length closed: 2.438\" Cutting edge: 1.687\" Weight: .6oz Blade thickness: .078\" Handle material: Fiberglass Reinforced Nylon