{"item_id": "B002E4A0ZU", "title": "Pachmayr Cz 75/85 Tactical Grip Glove", "description": "Grip Gloves are custom molded for each pistol model. Ideal for polymer frame handguns with no replacement grips available. Made from Pachmayr Decelerator material, Grip Gloves deliver enhanced control and will absorb recoil. The custom fit feels like an extension of your handgun grip. The ultra-soft, ultra-stretchy material makes installation a snap. No trimming, no need for soap and water. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation and a professional look. Tactical Grip Gloves are the only Slip-Ons that “fit like a glove.”", "text": "Pachmayr Cz 75/85 Tactical Grip Glove Grip Gloves are custom molded for each pistol model. Ideal for polymer frame handguns with no replacement grips available. Made from Pachmayr Decelerator material, Grip Gloves deliver enhanced control and will absorb recoil. The custom fit feels like an extension of your handgun grip. The ultra-soft, ultra-stretchy material makes installation a snap. No trimming, no need for soap and water. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation and a professional look. Tactical Grip Gloves are the only Slip-Ons that “fit like a glove.”", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y6O727IwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E4A0ZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E4NHZK", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove-Slip On's for Semi Auto S&W Sigma", "description": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove Grip Gloves are custom molded for each pistol model. Ideal for polymer frame handguns with no replacement grips available. Made from Pachmayr Decelerator material, Grip Gloves deliver enhanced control and will absorb recoil. The custom fit feels like an extension of your handgun grip. The ultra-soft, ultra-stretchy material makes installation a snap. No trimming, no need for soap and water. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation and a professional look. Tactical Grip gloves are the only Slip-Ons that \"fit like a glove.\" Fits: S&W; Sigma", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove-Slip On's for Semi Auto S&W Sigma Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove Grip Gloves are custom molded for each pistol model. Ideal for polymer frame handguns with no replacement grips available. Made from Pachmayr Decelerator material, Grip Gloves deliver enhanced control and will absorb recoil. The custom fit feels like an extension of your handgun grip. The ultra-soft, ultra-stretchy material makes installation a snap. No trimming, no need for soap and water. Distinctive ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation and a professional look. Tactical Grip gloves are the only Slip-Ons that \"fit like a glove.\" Fits: S&W; Sigma", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WJ-PQ1gBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E4NHZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.98}}
{"item_id": "B002E6NA0U", "title": "Truglo Fiber Optic Sight", "description": "PTOOMA Productions LLC of Spokane Washington has assembled a group of the finest Glock certified advanced Armorers, former high-ranking Glock Employees, and leaders of the Glock parts and accessories industry to produce \"The Complete Glock Reference Guide\". Subjects include extensive coverage of Glock history, assembly/disassembly, maintenance, customization, parts interchangeability, and everything else you ever wanted or needed to know about your Glock handgun. Jam-packed with more than 300 pages and over 400 black and white/color photos. Special featured section includes \"The Ultimate Glock Torture Test\". We subjected a G23 to the most rigorous torture test ever performed and captured on video. This guide is the most comprehensive collection of Glock information ever offered. If you own or use any Glock handgun, this book is an absolute necessity! \"The Complete Glock Reference Guide\" is the follow up to the very successful \"Glock Repair & Maintenance CD-ROM\" released in 2002, which was used as courseware at the well-known Front Sight Training Institute in Las Vegas Nevada. Most Recent Revision of the 3rd Edition", "text": "Truglo Fiber Optic Sight PTOOMA Productions LLC of Spokane Washington has assembled a group of the finest Glock certified advanced Armorers, former high-ranking Glock Employees, and leaders of the Glock parts and accessories industry to produce \"The Complete Glock Reference Guide\". Subjects include extensive coverage of Glock history, assembly/disassembly, maintenance, customization, parts interchangeability, and everything else you ever wanted or needed to know about your Glock handgun. Jam-packed with more than 300 pages and over 400 black and white/color photos. Special featured section includes \"The Ultimate Glock Torture Test\". We subjected a G23 to the most rigorous torture test ever performed and captured on video. This guide is the most comprehensive collection of Glock information ever offered. If you own or use any Glock handgun, this book is an absolute necessity! \"The Complete Glock Reference Guide\" is the follow up to the very successful \"Glock Repair & Maintenance CD-ROM\" released in 2002, which was used as courseware at the well-known Front Sight Training Institute in Las Vegas Nevada. Most Recent Revision of the 3rd Edition", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QBWgnJulL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6NA0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 48.05}}
