{"item_id": "B002E6NMF8", "title": "Outers 32 - Piece Universal Aluminum Gun Care Case", "description": "This 32-piece high quality aluminum case is designed to protect your cleaning hardware in the back of your truck or luggage. It includes two sets of brass rods, as well as a full assortment of brushes, mops, and cleaning tips. Full care case contents include a latched aluminum storage case with handle, ,custom parts organizer, 3 solid brass rods (.17-270-cal rifles and pistols), 3 solid brass rods (30-cal and larger rifles, pistols and shotguns), 9 bronze brushes (17-cal, 22-cal, 270-cal, 30-cal, 9mm/38-cal, 40-45-cal/10mm, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 mops (.22-25-cal, .38-357-cal, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 6 spear pointed jags (17-cal, 22-cal, .270/7mm cal, .30-32-cal, 35-cal/9mm, .40-45-cal/10mm), 2 slotted patch loops (rifles/pistol and shotgun), 50 cleaning patches, and 2 accessory adaptors (rifle/pistol and shotgun).", "text": "Outers 32 - Piece Universal Aluminum Gun Care Case This 32-piece high quality aluminum case is designed to protect your cleaning hardware in the back of your truck or luggage. It includes two sets of brass rods, as well as a full assortment of brushes, mops, and cleaning tips. Full care case contents include a latched aluminum storage case with handle, ,custom parts organizer, 3 solid brass rods (.17-270-cal rifles and pistols), 3 solid brass rods (30-cal and larger rifles, pistols and shotguns), 9 bronze brushes (17-cal, 22-cal, 270-cal, 30-cal, 9mm/38-cal, 40-45-cal/10mm, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 5 mops (.22-25-cal, .38-357-cal, 410-ga, 20/28-ga, 10/12-ga), 6 spear pointed jags (17-cal, 22-cal, .270/7mm cal, .30-32-cal, 35-cal/9mm, .40-45-cal/10mm), 2 slotted patch loops (rifles/pistol and shotgun), 50 cleaning patches, and 2 accessory adaptors (rifle/pistol and shotgun).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u5F9%2B02AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6NMF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 27.99}}
