{"item_id": "B002E6P3IM", "title": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Lower Receiver Magazine Well Vise Block, Black", "description": "The ProMag PM123 Vise Block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch; the block is then locked into the users vise. Constructed of black injection molded polymer.", "text": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Lower Receiver Magazine Well Vise Block, Black The ProMag PM123 Vise Block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch; the block is then locked into the users vise. Constructed of black injection molded polymer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z7Z4N8cIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6P3IM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 10.29}}
{"item_id": "B002E6P4ZY", "title": "Sand Texture Finger Groove Decal Grips", "description": "The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "text": "Sand Texture Finger Groove Decal Grips The DECAL GRIP for your Glock gives you a positive grip every time, allowing for ultimate control of the handgun from shot to shot. Available for Glocks, H&K;, Kahr, Springfield XD and Taurus and easy to apply.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nn7OD4zEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6P4ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
