{"item_id": "B002E6R4HU", "title": "ProMag AR-15 / M16 Handguard Removal Delta Ring Wrench, Black", "description": "The ProMag PM009 Delta Ring Wrench aids in the removal and installation of AR-15 / M16 rifle and carbine handquards. This must have tool turns a difficult task into a simple function. Manufactured from injection molded black polymer and steel; reinforced rubber non-marring arms. This is the last AR-15 / M16 handguard tool you will ever purchase.", "text": "ProMag AR-15 / M16 Handguard Removal Delta Ring Wrench, Black The ProMag PM009 Delta Ring Wrench aids in the removal and installation of AR-15 / M16 rifle and carbine handquards. This must have tool turns a difficult task into a simple function. Manufactured from injection molded black polymer and steel; reinforced rubber non-marring arms. This is the last AR-15 / M16 handguard tool you will ever purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310xMsdZdYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6R4HU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.49}}
