{"item_id": "B002E6R786", "title": "Birchwood Casey PSP PRESTO GUN BLUE TOUCH UP PEN", "description": "Presto Gun Blue Touch-Up PenThe fastest and easiest way to touch-up nicks and scratches - Penetrates hard steel instantly & gives a durable blue-black finish that won't rub off - Use like a marking pen for one coat coverage on non-stainless steels", "text": "Birchwood Casey PSP PRESTO GUN BLUE TOUCH UP PEN Presto Gun Blue Touch-Up PenThe fastest and easiest way to touch-up nicks and scratches - Penetrates hard steel instantly & gives a durable blue-black finish that won't rub off - Use like a marking pen for one coat coverage on non-stainless steels", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21RKuGxbUCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6R786.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 6.69}}
{"item_id": "B002E6RCZE", "title": "Umarex Hyper Velocity Pellets, .22 Caliber, 100 CT", "description": "RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets produce ultra high velocities in all medium powered air rifles. RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets sit inside a plastic sabot that provides a snug barrel fit for optimum velocity and accuracy. These lead free pellets will not produce lead particles in the air, in your barrel, or leave lead residue on your fingers. Specifications: - Caliber: .22 - 100 ct.", "text": "Umarex Hyper Velocity Pellets, .22 Caliber, 100 CT RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets produce ultra high velocities in all medium powered air rifles. RWS Hyper Velocity Pellets sit inside a plastic sabot that provides a snug barrel fit for optimum velocity and accuracy. These lead free pellets will not produce lead particles in the air, in your barrel, or leave lead residue on your fingers. Specifications: - Caliber: .22 - 100 ct.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zYce5HPjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6RCZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6RD6C", "title": "Diana RWS 34 Breakbarrel Rifle, T06 Trigger air rifle", "description": "The most popular rifle sold by RWS, this German rifle will keep you shooting accurately and powerfully for decades. While it doesn't have some of the frills that more expensive guns have, it goes head-to-head where it really counts! The well-balanced hardwood stock makes it easy to hold and shoot the RWS 34. Quality is evident in other places, too: a two-stage adjustable trigger, fiber optic sights (fully adj. rear) and a finely rifled barrel. No need to worry about cocking difficulty, as that's where this rifle really shines (just 33 lbs., although our own tests showed just 30 lbs.). Both calibers are ideal for plinking, paper targets and spinners. Like to hunt? The .22 cal. should be your choice for small game and pests. If you're a serious airgunner on a budget, the RWS 34 was made for you! RWS is known for standing behind their guns, and their warranty has always been viewed as the best in the business. We've recommended a variety of appropriate pellets, which are listed in the AMMO link. Click on the ACCESSORIES link to select from a variety of suggested scopes, mounts and other shooting gear.... ...", "text": "Diana RWS 34 Breakbarrel Rifle, T06 Trigger air rifle The most popular rifle sold by RWS, this German rifle will keep you shooting accurately and powerfully for decades. While it doesn't have some of the frills that more expensive guns have, it goes head-to-head where it really counts! The well-balanced hardwood stock makes it easy to hold and shoot the RWS 34. Quality is evident in other places, too: a two-stage adjustable trigger, fiber optic sights (fully adj. rear) and a finely rifled barrel. No need to worry about cocking difficulty, as that's where this rifle really shines (just 33 lbs., although our own tests showed just 30 lbs.). Both calibers are ideal for plinking, paper targets and spinners. Like to hunt? The .22 cal. should be your choice for small game and pests. If you're a serious airgunner on a budget, the RWS 34 was made for you! RWS is known for standing behind their guns, and their warranty has always been viewed as the best in the business. We've recommended a variety of appropriate pellets, which are listed in the AMMO link. Click on the ACCESSORIES link to select from a variety of suggested scopes, mounts and other shooting gear.... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21gcapCSfVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6RD6C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002E6RERU", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Runner with Hand Strap (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Perfect for the palm of your hand when running or walking, SABRE's jogger/runner pepper spray is equipped with a convenient hand strap for immediate deployment. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back and permits safe distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide, including the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department & US Marshals! Size: 3/4 oz. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Runner with Hand Strap (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more) Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Perfect for the palm of your hand when running or walking, SABRE's jogger/runner pepper spray is equipped with a convenient hand strap for immediate deployment. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back and permits safe distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide, including the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department & US Marshals! Size: 3/4 oz. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NpA2YzKGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6RERU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6SX0C", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Classic Rifle Kit (.30/7.62mm)", "description": "Classic Rifle Kits utilize steel rods rather than aluminum because they are more durable and less abrasive. Engineered like the rods specified by the US Government, they offer a much better thread system than the competition. Rods are simply less apt to bend and break where the sections connect. Kits are caliber specific and include the appropriate bore brush and cotton patches.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Classic Rifle Kit (.30/7.62mm) Classic Rifle Kits utilize steel rods rather than aluminum because they are more durable and less abrasive. Engineered like the rods specified by the US Government, they offer a much better thread system than the competition. Rods are simply less apt to bend and break where the sections connect. Kits are caliber specific and include the appropriate bore brush and cotton patches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413bm7QFsSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6SX0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B002E6SXN4", "title": "MaTech Mil-Spec Back-up Iron Sight (B.U.I.S)", "description": "The Picatinny Backup Iron Sight, manufactured by MaTech is the standard issue BUIS for all new and fielded U.S. Military M4 carbines and M16 flat top rifles. Rigorously tested at Fort Benning and Aberdeen Proving Grounds, our product has the strength, durability, and accuracy to meet your sighting requirements. NSN 1005-01-484-8000", "text": "MaTech Mil-Spec Back-up Iron Sight (B.U.I.S) The Picatinny Backup Iron Sight, manufactured by MaTech is the standard issue BUIS for all new and fielded U.S. Military M4 carbines and M16 flat top rifles. Rigorously tested at Fort Benning and Aberdeen Proving Grounds, our product has the strength, durability, and accuracy to meet your sighting requirements. NSN 1005-01-484-8000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-79576VzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6SXN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MaTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 85.59}}
{"item_id": "B002E6SYEC", "title": "Butler Creek M16/AR15 Strip LULA Black Stripper Clip Speed Loader 24200", "description": "Butler Creek M16/AR15 Strip LULA Black Stripper Clip Speed Loader 24200", "text": "Butler Creek M16/AR15 Strip LULA Black Stripper Clip Speed Loader 24200 Butler Creek M16/AR15 Strip LULA Black Stripper Clip Speed Loader 24200", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UmQxj5HHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6SYEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 27.84}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T0BI", "title": "Butler Creek Shooting Necessities Cut-To-Length Shotgun Plug", "description": "Butler Creek Shotgun Plug. GREAT PRICE! Fits most 12, 16 and 20-gauge pump and automatic shotguns. It can be cut to the desired length to limit the magazine capacity to 2 rounds. And unlike wooden plugs, this durable plastic Plug won't collect moisture or mildew! Order Now! Butler Creek 50001 Shotgun Plug", "text": "Butler Creek Shooting Necessities Cut-To-Length Shotgun Plug Butler Creek Shotgun Plug. GREAT PRICE! Fits most 12, 16 and 20-gauge pump and automatic shotguns. It can be cut to the desired length to limit the magazine capacity to 2 rounds. And unlike wooden plugs, this durable plastic Plug won't collect moisture or mildew! Order Now! Butler Creek 50001 Shotgun Plug", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z9F9sGqfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T0BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T1HG", "title": "De Hogue Fg Rubber Grip Mkvii,Xix", "description": "Desert Eagle Hogue Soft Rubber Grips. Complete with finger grooves! Get a grip! Soft synthetic Rubber Grips sport a cobblestoned texture for a secure hold. 1-Pc. grip with comfortable finger grooves retrofit Mark I, VII and XIX. Field installable. Made exclusively for the Desert Eagle. Get the best. Order up today! Desert Eagle Hogue Soft Rubber Grips", "text": "De Hogue Fg Rubber Grip Mkvii,Xix Desert Eagle Hogue Soft Rubber Grips. Complete with finger grooves! Get a grip! Soft synthetic Rubber Grips sport a cobblestoned texture for a secure hold. 1-Pc. grip with comfortable finger grooves retrofit Mark I, VII and XIX. Field installable. Made exclusively for the Desert Eagle. Get the best. Order up today! Desert Eagle Hogue Soft Rubber Grips", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NiRLPSMAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T1HG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Desert Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 49.03}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T1NU", "title": "Uncle Mike's 115 RGS Sling Swivel Wood Screw Set, One each 1/2-Inch and 3/4-Inch Screws", "description": "Uncle Mike's 115 RGS Magnum Band screw set includes one each of 1/2\" wood screw, fore-end base, and 3/4\" rear wood screw base with white spacers only.", "text": "Uncle Mike's 115 RGS Sling Swivel Wood Screw Set, One each 1/2-Inch and 3/4-Inch Screws Uncle Mike's 115 RGS Magnum Band screw set includes one each of 1/2\" wood screw, fore-end base, and 3/4\" rear wood screw base with white spacers only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v3CW8hdLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T1NU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 6.88}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T7AC", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Front Sight Tool", "description": "The Intrafuse AR Front Sight Tool is a four post model designed to work with the A2 front sight. Machined from 4140 steel and finished in black oxide, our tool will provide years of use and is backed by our lifetime warranty. The lanyard hole allows attachment to your key ring and provides a location to tie down the tool to prevent loss.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Front Sight Tool The Intrafuse AR Front Sight Tool is a four post model designed to work with the A2 front sight. Machined from 4140 steel and finished in black oxide, our tool will provide years of use and is backed by our lifetime warranty. The lanyard hole allows attachment to your key ring and provides a location to tie down the tool to prevent loss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lGUozNN3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T7AC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T7ZM", "title": "Radians CEP001-T Tan Custom Molded Earplugs", "description": "The Custom Molded Earplugs provide an easy, do-it-yourself kit for a custom molded plug designed to fit your ear. In just 10 minutes, you can have a pair of custom plugs made just for you. The simple instructions provided are easy to follow. The plugs can be washed to ensure long lasting wear.", "text": "Radians CEP001-T Tan Custom Molded Earplugs The Custom Molded Earplugs provide an easy, do-it-yourself kit for a custom molded plug designed to fit your ear. In just 10 minutes, you can have a pair of custom plugs made just for you. The simple instructions provided are easy to follow. The plugs can be washed to ensure long lasting wear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L9DAN6bkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T7ZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 10.7}}
{"item_id": "B002E6T9RS", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2030CW Crawford N.E.C.K fixed blade", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Triumph N.E.C.K. Cord Wrapped model is based on the same beefy 0.14-inch thick blade used on the Triumph Folder. In this case it is a full-tang skeletonized design, with recurved dual-grind Tanto to aid cutting and a false top edge grind for penetrating power. This deluxe system includes the knife with a non-reflective black EDP coating and cord-wrapped handle. The olive drab nylon paracord wrap gives excellent feel and grip, and terminates in a fob. The custom molded sheath with patented quick release belt mounting system. Also included is a spare injection molded sheath for extra mounting options.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2030CW Crawford N.E.C.K fixed blade Columbia River Knife and Tool's Triumph N.E.C.K. Cord Wrapped model is based on the same beefy 0.14-inch thick blade used on the Triumph Folder. In this case it is a full-tang skeletonized design, with recurved dual-grind Tanto to aid cutting and a false top edge grind for penetrating power. This deluxe system includes the knife with a non-reflective black EDP coating and cord-wrapped handle. The olive drab nylon paracord wrap gives excellent feel and grip, and terminates in a fob. The custom molded sheath with patented quick release belt mounting system. Also included is a spare injection molded sheath for extra mounting options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Jkm%2BgWlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6T9RS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 31.86}}
