{"item_id": "B002E6WV78", "title": "Butler Creek 50 Round Hot Lips Loader 10/22", "description": "- Simply pour 50 22 LR shells into the hopper, insert the magazine and crank it full- Field portable and loads in-line magazines- Package Contents: Butler Creek 50 Round Hot Lips Loader 10/22, 24211", "text": "Butler Creek 50 Round Hot Lips Loader 10/22 - Simply pour 50 22 LR shells into the hopper, insert the magazine and crank it full- Field portable and loads in-line magazines- Package Contents: Butler Creek 50 Round Hot Lips Loader 10/22, 24211", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ig9Is8BiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6WV78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B002E6WYBQ", "title": "Ergo grip ladder lowpro rail covers 18 slot (dark earth, pack of 3)", "description": "The EG4373-3PK Ergo Grip 18-Slot Ladder LowPro Rail Covers protect rail areas from damage and shield the operator from sharp rail edges and prevent damage to gear such as rapelling ropes that may be abraded or cut by uncovered rail sections. Sold in three packs. Unified in the mission to provide military, law enforcement, citizens and shooters with the finest mission enhancing firearms accessories available, the people of ERGO have grown their business through a combination of precision manufacturing and exemplary customer service. All ERGO products are 100% manufactured in the USA to the highest standards and the tightest possible tolerances. Expanding far beyond industry standards, every ERGO product is backed by a comprehensive satisfaction guarantee.", "text": "Ergo grip ladder lowpro rail covers 18 slot (dark earth, pack of 3) The EG4373-3PK Ergo Grip 18-Slot Ladder LowPro Rail Covers protect rail areas from damage and shield the operator from sharp rail edges and prevent damage to gear such as rapelling ropes that may be abraded or cut by uncovered rail sections. Sold in three packs. Unified in the mission to provide military, law enforcement, citizens and shooters with the finest mission enhancing firearms accessories available, the people of ERGO have grown their business through a combination of precision manufacturing and exemplary customer service. All ERGO products are 100% manufactured in the USA to the highest standards and the tightest possible tolerances. Expanding far beyond industry standards, every ERGO product is backed by a comprehensive satisfaction guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410JPXkyHwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6WYBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6WYTI", "title": "1911 Shok Buff Buffers 6Pk", "description": "Wilson Combat Replacement Shok Buff", "text": "1911 Shok Buff Buffers 6Pk Wilson Combat Replacement Shok Buff", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GJku2uvQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6WYTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson Combat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6X15E", "title": "Decal XDS Sand Texture Pistol Grip for Springfield Armory XD Sub Compact, Tactical, Service, Custom (9-mm/.357/.40/.45GAP, Black)", "description": "Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "text": "Decal XDS Sand Texture Pistol Grip for Springfield Armory XD Sub Compact, Tactical, Service, Custom (9-mm/.357/.40/.45GAP, Black) Decal Grip offers no nonsense grip enhancement, and reflects a tactical practicality that is valued by the tactical officer and the recreational shooter alike. Adhesive backed, pre-cut panels adhere to the frame and slide for a superior grip in the most extreme conditions imaginable without increasing bulk. They are perfect for both the duty weapon and for everyday carry. Easy to install, just peel and stick. They are just as easily replaced or removed. Extremely durable and resistant to most solvents and oils. Especially developed for the new generation of polymer frame pistols (Glock, Heckler and Koch USP, Springfield Armory XD, XDM, HS2000, Kahr P and PM, Magpul MIAD and MOE, Taurus Millennium PT, etc.). Looks OEM. The trend in modern handgun design incorporates a polymer frame that is lightweight, but tends to get slippery when wet or sweaty; severely affecting your grip and accuracy. Decal Grip's specially designed panel additions provide a positive grip surface, improving your grip in wet, dry, hot or cold environments. Decal Grip is recognized by many Law Enforcement Officers for its proven enhanced grip, and is available in two types of textures: Sand, and Synthetic Rubber. Approved for use in IDPA and IPSC competition and used by many Law Enforcement and Military Agencies around the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q0hhlJrSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6X15E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Decal Grip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.22}}
{"item_id": "B002E6X44C", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Stock Spanner Wrench TOOL0904", "description": "Precision machined from heat treated steel, our multifunction tool is a necessity for any AR enthusiast. This tool includes a Mil-Spec castle nut wrench, a standard length receiver extension removal wrench, and an A1/A2 Flash Suppressor wrench. Offering an improved grip, each tool has a rubberized grip for both safety and comfort. Every tool is coated in manganese phosphate for reduced visibility and corrosion resistance. Made in the USA and features a lifetime warranty.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AR Stock Spanner Wrench TOOL0904 Precision machined from heat treated steel, our multifunction tool is a necessity for any AR enthusiast. This tool includes a Mil-Spec castle nut wrench, a standard length receiver extension removal wrench, and an A1/A2 Flash Suppressor wrench. Offering an improved grip, each tool has a rubberized grip for both safety and comfort. Every tool is coated in manganese phosphate for reduced visibility and corrosion resistance. Made in the USA and features a lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316xmD2EM3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6X44C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B002E6X460", "title": "Caldwell 103654 Handgun Resetting Target", "description": "Caldwell Resetting Targets are easily portable and create an interactive shooting experience that makes plinking and target practice fun. Made of heavy-duty steel, these targets are built to last.", "text": "Caldwell 103654 Handgun Resetting Target Caldwell Resetting Targets are easily portable and create an interactive shooting experience that makes plinking and target practice fun. Made of heavy-duty steel, these targets are built to last.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SjiUIdsCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E6X460.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 46.4}}
{"item_id": "B002E7UL92", "title": "Avenir Coil Key Cable Lock (10mm/6 Feet)", "description": "A great choice for the cyclist who doesn't want the hassle of remembering a combination, Avenir's Coil Key Cable Lock will keep your bike secure. It features a covered, braided steel cable with an integrated key and lock and a cylinder design that prevent lock bumping from occurring. The lock includes two safety keys and a mounting bracket.", "text": "Avenir Coil Key Cable Lock (10mm/6 Feet) A great choice for the cyclist who doesn't want the hassle of remembering a combination, Avenir's Coil Key Cable Lock will keep your bike secure. It features a covered, braided steel cable with an integrated key and lock and a cylinder design that prevent lock bumping from occurring. The lock includes two safety keys and a mounting bracket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41piYTU3kIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E7UL92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 8.64}}
{"item_id": "B002E82AOA", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Carbon Steel Gurkha Service Kukri With Sheath And 2 K, Brown", "description": "This Gurkha Service Kukri has a large, heavy, polished and functional carbon steel blade making it the ideal tool for heavy chopping and brush clearing work or as an addition to a collection. Also includes two small knives which fit neatly in the brass tipped leather sheath.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Carbon Steel Gurkha Service Kukri With Sheath And 2 K, Brown This Gurkha Service Kukri has a large, heavy, polished and functional carbon steel blade making it the ideal tool for heavy chopping and brush clearing work or as an addition to a collection. Also includes two small knives which fit neatly in the brass tipped leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vt9cE4%2BmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002E82AOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.99}}
