{"item_id": "B002EOGFUE", "title": "Speedo Biofuse Training Fin", "description": "The Silicone Biofuse Training Fin is a great choice for the performance and sport swimmer looking for a short blade fin that provides power, speed, and strength. The short blade design balances kicking tempo with a swimmer's arm stroke, but is still long enough to provide added speed and strength building. It utilizes our biofuse dual density technology which combines hard and soft materials in a way that maximizes performance and comfort. You will notice the comfort difference between this fin and our competitor's right away when your foot slips into the soft silicone non chafing contoured foot pocket. But you still have the advantage of the stiff blade for maximum power while training. Sizing may run small, so size up if necessary.", "text": "Speedo Biofuse Training Fin The Silicone Biofuse Training Fin is a great choice for the performance and sport swimmer looking for a short blade fin that provides power, speed, and strength. The short blade design balances kicking tempo with a swimmer's arm stroke, but is still long enough to provide added speed and strength building. It utilizes our biofuse dual density technology which combines hard and soft materials in a way that maximizes performance and comfort. You will notice the comfort difference between this fin and our competitor's right away when your foot slips into the soft silicone non chafing contoured foot pocket. But you still have the advantage of the stiff blade for maximum power while training. Sizing may run small, so size up if necessary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e-iY9xCCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EOGFUE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B002EOJWAO", "title": "Speedo Air Seal Tri Swim Goggle, Mirrored", "description": "This Air Seal Tri Mirror Goggle with mirror coating to reduce glare is the most comfortable and functional open water goggle around! It is 100% PVC free so friendly to the environment and offers Anti-Fog and UV protection for the outdoor swimmer who is looking for a larger fitting goggle and enhanced peripheral vision of a curved lens. The soft frame and air filled gasket make it extremely easy to wear while the quick adjustment of our trademarked SpeedFit headstrap makes it a snap to custom fit. You don't have to be a triathlete to appreciate this great goggle!", "text": "Speedo Air Seal Tri Swim Goggle, Mirrored This Air Seal Tri Mirror Goggle with mirror coating to reduce glare is the most comfortable and functional open water goggle around! It is 100% PVC free so friendly to the environment and offers Anti-Fog and UV protection for the outdoor swimmer who is looking for a larger fitting goggle and enhanced peripheral vision of a curved lens. The soft frame and air filled gasket make it extremely easy to wear while the quick adjustment of our trademarked SpeedFit headstrap makes it a snap to custom fit. You don't have to be a triathlete to appreciate this great goggle!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31njUqOTZ8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EOJWAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 18.93}}
{"item_id": "B002EP37XG", "title": "Eastman Outdoors Gorilla Gear Deluxe Shooting Stick (23-62-Inch)", "description": "Compact 4-section shooting stick quickly adjusts from 23\" to 62\". Quick-release lever lock system. Improved rubber-finned gun rest for unmatched gripping power. Lightweight tempered aluminum for rock-solid stability. SilenTech rubber-coated finish for ultimate stealth. Mossy Oak Brush camo.", "text": "Eastman Outdoors Gorilla Gear Deluxe Shooting Stick (23-62-Inch) Compact 4-section shooting stick quickly adjusts from 23\" to 62\". Quick-release lever lock system. Improved rubber-finned gun rest for unmatched gripping power. Lightweight tempered aluminum for rock-solid stability. SilenTech rubber-coated finish for ultimate stealth. Mossy Oak Brush camo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qFXZm-EhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EP37XG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eastman Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 34.98}}
{"item_id": "B002EPS5HE", "title": "Schrade 44OT Old Timer Workmate 4 blade Folding Knife with Delrin Handle", "description": "This Schrade \"workmate\" features a durable Delrin handle and four useful stainless steel blades.", "text": "Schrade 44OT Old Timer Workmate 4 blade Folding Knife with Delrin Handle This Schrade \"workmate\" features a durable Delrin handle and four useful stainless steel blades.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F2c8SoqoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EPS5HE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 16.01}}
{"item_id": "B002EVWDJ4", "title": "B.E.S.T. 50032 Black Streak Remover with Sprayer - 32 oz.", "description": "Easily removes black streaks, tar and road grime build up on any RV with minimal rubbing. Also great for tires, white walls, wheels and gutters. Environmental Products of America’s Black Streak Remover is safe for use on fiberglass, metal and painted surfaces when used as directed. BEST products contain no acids or caustics, will not harm or fade decals. B.E.S.T., Better Environmental Solutions Today Black Streak Remover is the number one consumer product on the market. It comes in 32 ounce sprayer or 128 ounce and 5 gallon refills. If you have not tried EPA Midwest Black Streak yet trust Ralph Epperson of Michigan - I have tried them all and this product truly is the best streak remover I have ever used. It comes in 32 oz spray bottles or 128 oz refills. Cleaning Tips: Works best when surface is dry and work in small areas from bottom up.", "text": "B.E.S.T. 50032 Black Streak Remover with Sprayer - 32 oz. Easily removes black streaks, tar and road grime build up on any RV with minimal rubbing. Also great for tires, white walls, wheels and gutters. Environmental Products of America’s Black Streak Remover is safe for use on fiberglass, metal and painted surfaces when used as directed. BEST products contain no acids or caustics, will not harm or fade decals. B.E.S.T., Better Environmental Solutions Today Black Streak Remover is the number one consumer product on the market. It comes in 32 ounce sprayer or 128 ounce and 5 gallon refills. If you have not tried EPA Midwest Black Streak yet trust Ralph Epperson of Michigan - I have tried them all and this product truly is the best streak remover I have ever used. It comes in 32 oz spray bottles or 128 oz refills. Cleaning Tips: Works best when surface is dry and work in small areas from bottom up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412zXeZeefL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EVWDJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B.E.S.T.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 7.39}}
{"item_id": "B002EW5G2O", "title": "B.E.S.T. 52032 Awning Cleaner - 32 oz.", "description": "Keeps your awning looking new. Use to remove mold, mildew, dirt and grime. Helps protect against damaging sun rays, weathering and salt. Works great on acrylic, vinyl, synthetic and natural fibers and will work on convertible tops and Jeep tops as well. Prevents weathering deterioration and fading if used four or five times annually; keeps your awning looking new with optic brighteners. Safe for all awnings and easy to use, just spray it on and hose it off. Comes in a 32 ounce spray bottle and/or 5 gallon refill. Like Alex Tinney from South Carolina said - We have clean up day once a month with myself and my RV fanatic buddies. A newcomer came in with a nasty awning and your product made it look brand new. Just had to tell you and ask where can we buy all of your products?", "text": "B.E.S.T. 52032 Awning Cleaner - 32 oz. Keeps your awning looking new. Use to remove mold, mildew, dirt and grime. Helps protect against damaging sun rays, weathering and salt. Works great on acrylic, vinyl, synthetic and natural fibers and will work on convertible tops and Jeep tops as well. Prevents weathering deterioration and fading if used four or five times annually; keeps your awning looking new with optic brighteners. Safe for all awnings and easy to use, just spray it on and hose it off. Comes in a 32 ounce spray bottle and/or 5 gallon refill. Like Alex Tinney from South Carolina said - We have clean up day once a month with myself and my RV fanatic buddies. A newcomer came in with a nasty awning and your product made it look brand new. Just had to tell you and ask where can we buy all of your products?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N9FTcUTLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EW5G2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B.E.S.T.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 12.64}}
{"item_id": "B002EW7KX2", "title": "AVI 12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 100 Pack", "description": "Features:AVI CO2 cartridge - 100 Pack12 gram*Cartridge brand may vary***Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Orders that have selected air shipping and include CO2 cartridges will automatically be modified to ship in separate packages. Additional freight may apply.**", "text": "AVI 12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 100 Pack Features:AVI CO2 cartridge - 100 Pack12 gram*Cartridge brand may vary***Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Orders that have selected air shipping and include CO2 cartridges will automatically be modified to ship in separate packages. Additional freight may apply.**", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wVcORRUkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EW7KX2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SDN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B002EWWKOQ", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Strobe/GPS/Compass Pouch", "description": "Product Details Product Features Internal dims 2.25-Inch wide x 1.25-Inch thick; height adjustable between 4-Inch to 5-Inch Fits the MS-2000 and SDU-5E military strobes Fits the Garmin Etrex and other small handheld GPS's Fits a lensatic compass Hook and loop lid closure plus 1-Inch side release buckle for extra security Lid folds and adheres to itself to stay open Two (2) internal tie-down points provides added retention Drainage grommet MOLLE compatible Attach using one 3-Inch TacTie Attachment Straps Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closures Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach. Government Sales All Maxpedition nylon products are GSA compliant and available for purchase at GSA Advantage.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Strobe/GPS/Compass Pouch Product Details Product Features Internal dims 2.25-Inch wide x 1.25-Inch thick; height adjustable between 4-Inch to 5-Inch Fits the MS-2000 and SDU-5E military strobes Fits the Garmin Etrex and other small handheld GPS's Fits a lensatic compass Hook and loop lid closure plus 1-Inch side release buckle for extra security Lid folds and adheres to itself to stay open Two (2) internal tie-down points provides added retention Drainage grommet MOLLE compatible Attach using one 3-Inch TacTie Attachment Straps Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closures Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach. Government Sales All Maxpedition nylon products are GSA compliant and available for purchase at GSA Advantage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X0kJcqWrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EWWKOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 14.39}}
{"item_id": "B002EWY0TY", "title": "Maxpedition SPARTAN Wallet Wallet Soft 5.5\"x3.5\"x0.5\" 0229B", "description": "Product FeaturesClosed, empty size: 5.5\" x 3.5\" x 0.5\"Open, empty size: 9\" x 5.5\" x 0.3\"Empty weight: 2.1 oz.The new Maxpedition #0229 SPARTAN Wallet replaces the \"over-engineered\" PUG Wallet design. The evolution was a result of popular demand for our general purpose wallet design WITHOUT the bulky zippered coin purse that made pocket carry difficult. Customers were right; this simplification makes for a much better yet less expensive wallet. The SPARTAN still contains a plethora of small compartments secured with velcro tabs to prevent slippage. Two longer slots for paper bills make carrying multiple currency types easy. An external mesh pocket is great for quick access to ticket stubs or to separate receipts. Sewn-in Hypalon tie-down tab allows attachment of a tether for additional security.Product Materials1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabricDupont Teflon® fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceTriple polyurethane coated for water resistanceHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread)Internal seams taped and finishedStress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength", "text": "Maxpedition SPARTAN Wallet Wallet Soft 5.5\"x3.5\"x0.5\" 0229B Product FeaturesClosed, empty size: 5.5\" x 3.5\" x 0.5\"Open, empty size: 9\" x 5.5\" x 0.3\"Empty weight: 2.1 oz.The new Maxpedition #0229 SPARTAN Wallet replaces the \"over-engineered\" PUG Wallet design. The evolution was a result of popular demand for our general purpose wallet design WITHOUT the bulky zippered coin purse that made pocket carry difficult. Customers were right; this simplification makes for a much better yet less expensive wallet. The SPARTAN still contains a plethora of small compartments secured with velcro tabs to prevent slippage. Two longer slots for paper bills make carrying multiple currency types easy. An external mesh pocket is great for quick access to ticket stubs or to separate receipts. Sewn-in Hypalon tie-down tab allows attachment of a tether for additional security.Product Materials1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabricDupont Teflon® fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceTriple polyurethane coated for water resistanceHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread)Internal seams taped and finishedStress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cTyI-0mkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EWY0TY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002EX0MQI", "title": "Classic Accessories Personal Watercraft Travel and Storage Cover", "description": "Heavy-duty travel cover with an integrated trailering system. The tough ProtekX Plus fabric has a water-resistant backing for optimum weather and abrasion protection. Rear air vents reduce inside moisture and wind lofting, and an elastic hem cord provides a fast, tight fit.", "text": "Classic Accessories Personal Watercraft Travel and Storage Cover Heavy-duty travel cover with an integrated trailering system. The tough ProtekX Plus fabric has a water-resistant backing for optimum weather and abrasion protection. Rear air vents reduce inside moisture and wind lofting, and an elastic hem cord provides a fast, tight fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315b7eCBQrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EX0MQI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002EYASY8", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman II Knife", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Huntsman II, a compact set of tools for campers, hikers, hunters, fishers, picnic enthusiasts, and people all trades--all neatly contained in a single implement. Measuring 3-1/2 inches long, the Huntsman II is stylishly red cased matte finish nylon handle. More importantly, the pocket knife contains 14 tools appropriate for just about any occasion. The tools include a large knife blade, small knife blade, can opener, bottle opener, small screwdriver, reamer, sewing eye, tweezers, corkscrew, scissors, hook, wood saw, toothpick, and key ring.The Huntsman II features 14 convenient tools.Ideal for stashing in the glove box, utility drawer, tool box, backpack, desk drawer, or any other place imaginable, you'll always find a use for one of the Huntsman II's handy tools.Huntsman II Tools:Large knife bladeSmall knife bladeCan openerBottle openerSmall screwdriverReamerSewing eyeTweezersCorkscrewScissorsHookWood sawToothpickKey ringAbout Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Huntsman II Knife From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army Knife a century ago comes the Huntsman II, a compact set of tools for campers, hikers, hunters, fishers, picnic enthusiasts, and people all trades--all neatly contained in a single implement. Measuring 3-1/2 inches long, the Huntsman II is stylishly red cased matte finish nylon handle. More importantly, the pocket knife contains 14 tools appropriate for just about any occasion. The tools include a large knife blade, small knife blade, can opener, bottle opener, small screwdriver, reamer, sewing eye, tweezers, corkscrew, scissors, hook, wood saw, toothpick, and key ring.The Huntsman II features 14 convenient tools.Ideal for stashing in the glove box, utility drawer, tool box, backpack, desk drawer, or any other place imaginable, you'll always find a use for one of the Huntsman II's handy tools.Huntsman II Tools:Large knife bladeSmall knife bladeCan openerBottle openerSmall screwdriverReamerSewing eyeTweezersCorkscrewScissorsHookWood sawToothpickKey ringAbout Swiss Army KnivesIn 1884, Swiss cutler Karl Elsener set up shop in Ibach-Schwyz, installing a waterwheel in Tobelbach Brook to run his grinding and polishing machines. Thus began what would become the international brand name Victorinox, a combination of Victoria, for Elsener's mother, and \"inox,\" or stainless steel. Today, Victorinox produces watches, luggage, clothing, and, famously, Swiss Army Knives. The original product dates to 1897, when Elsener patented the Swiss Officer's and Sports Knife he supplied to the Swiss Army. Following World War II, American servicemen and women shopping in PX stores shortened the name to Swiss Army Knife, which lives on in English-speaking countries around the world and has become a metaphor for versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bT86ylk7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EYASY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002EZ6ZPI", "title": "Ergon GC3 Comfort Bicycle Handlebar Grips (Large)", "description": "ERGON GC3 GRIPS W/FULL BAR END LARGE BLACK. Ergon GC-3 Grips introduce a hollow formed glass fiber reinforced ergonomically shaped, full size bar end. Featuring rubberized inserts for positive grip, like all of Ergon's bar ends it can be independently positioned relative to the grip and acts as the clamp preventing accidental rotation. Allows user for many more hand posisions ! Grip shape may be slightly different between the two sizes (Small & Large). Sizing: Small = 6.5-8.5 size hands. Large = 8.5-10.5 size hands.", "text": "Ergon GC3 Comfort Bicycle Handlebar Grips (Large) ERGON GC3 GRIPS W/FULL BAR END LARGE BLACK. Ergon GC-3 Grips introduce a hollow formed glass fiber reinforced ergonomically shaped, full size bar end. Featuring rubberized inserts for positive grip, like all of Ergon's bar ends it can be independently positioned relative to the grip and acts as the clamp preventing accidental rotation. Allows user for many more hand posisions ! Grip shape may be slightly different between the two sizes (Small & Large). Sizing: Small = 6.5-8.5 size hands. Large = 8.5-10.5 size hands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418ojGDOzvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002EZ6ZPI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B002F0NZGY", "title": "NFL Trailer Hitch Cover", "description": "", "text": "NFL Trailer Hitch Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jUCEZQeGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002F0NZGY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Great American Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Auto Accessories", "Trailer Hitch Covers"]], "price": 11.9}}
{"item_id": "B002F85L40", "title": "Tilley Endurables TH9 Women'S Hemp Hat", "description": "Constructed of all-natural hemp, the TH9 women's hat from Tilley Endurables is both elegant and hard-working, with 50+ UPF sun protection. The hat features a down-sloping brim for a fashionable and protective silhouette. Easy to dress up or down, the hat offers a linen-like feel that belies its 'tough as nails' durability. The 100 percent hemp hat is breathable and naturally resistant to UV light, mold, mildew, and salt water--making this a great choice for boating. The easy to care for hat can be hand or machine washed on a gentle cycle, then reshaped and air dried.The TH9 offers a flattering and protective down-sloping brim.", "text": "Tilley Endurables TH9 Women'S Hemp Hat Constructed of all-natural hemp, the TH9 women's hat from Tilley Endurables is both elegant and hard-working, with 50+ UPF sun protection. The hat features a down-sloping brim for a fashionable and protective silhouette. Easy to dress up or down, the hat offers a linen-like feel that belies its 'tough as nails' durability. The 100 percent hemp hat is breathable and naturally resistant to UV light, mold, mildew, and salt water--making this a great choice for boating. The easy to care for hat can be hand or machine washed on a gentle cycle, then reshaped and air dried.The TH9 offers a flattering and protective down-sloping brim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J4C62kMxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002F85L40.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Women", "Hats"]]}}
