{"item_id": "B002FP3PLY", "title": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strip Pair Fits .44/.45 Caliber", "description": "Developed by John Bianchi over 50 years ago, Bianchi Speed Strips are just as useful today as they were then. A compact and handy device for loading revolvers, Speed Strips fit in most single mag/knife pouches and trouser or shirt pockets. They are a perfect, slim back up to speedloaders. Injection molded from a flexible urethane material, Speed Strips hold 6 rounds of either .38/.357 or .44/.45 ammo and load two at a time. Sold in a two-pack. Fits .44/.45 Caliber", "text": "Bianchi 580 Speed Strip Pair Fits .44/.45 Caliber Developed by John Bianchi over 50 years ago, Bianchi Speed Strips are just as useful today as they were then. A compact and handy device for loading revolvers, Speed Strips fit in most single mag/knife pouches and trouser or shirt pockets. They are a perfect, slim back up to speedloaders. Injection molded from a flexible urethane material, Speed Strips hold 6 rounds of either .38/.357 or .44/.45 ammo and load two at a time. Sold in a two-pack. Fits .44/.45 Caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413STkydTdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002FP3PLY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bianchi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.08}}
{"item_id": "B002FSGYNM", "title": "Spyderco Stretch Lightweight plain Edge Knife,Black", "description": "The popular Spyderco Stretch has evolved over the years, and what initially began as a small, basic Hunter model in the 1980s has matured into an elegant, performance drop point folder, available in a variety of handle materials and blade steels. The latest incarnation is a lightweight model with durable, fiberglass reinforced nylon handle and VG-10 steel blade, ground thin and fully flat with an arcing belly. Turned-out with a mid-spine positioned back lock, the FRN handle is injection-molded and surfaced with Bi-Directional Texturing. When the palm meets the texturing, tactile resistance results, stopping forward or backward sliding under harsh, wet, or slippery cutting circumstances. A steel pocket clip screws into pre-drilled holes on both sides and both ends of the knife, allowing four possible carry options.Specifications7.9-inch overall length4.4-inch closed length3.5-inch VG-10 steel blade3.2-inch cutting edge0.125-inch blade thickness3.4-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco Stretch Lightweight plain Edge Knife,Black The popular Spyderco Stretch has evolved over the years, and what initially began as a small, basic Hunter model in the 1980s has matured into an elegant, performance drop point folder, available in a variety of handle materials and blade steels. The latest incarnation is a lightweight model with durable, fiberglass reinforced nylon handle and VG-10 steel blade, ground thin and fully flat with an arcing belly. Turned-out with a mid-spine positioned back lock, the FRN handle is injection-molded and surfaced with Bi-Directional Texturing. When the palm meets the texturing, tactile resistance results, stopping forward or backward sliding under harsh, wet, or slippery cutting circumstances. A steel pocket clip screws into pre-drilled holes on both sides and both ends of the knife, allowing four possible carry options.Specifications7.9-inch overall length4.4-inch closed length3.5-inch VG-10 steel blade3.2-inch cutting edge0.125-inch blade thickness3.4-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ykEInKZsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002FSGYNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 82.95}}
{"item_id": "B002FVYTLI", "title": "Greenfield SKS2-305B 305mm Stablizer Rear Stay-Mount Black aluminum", "description": "Best Selling in the U.S.A. Greenfield's Kickstand enjoys enormous popularity. It's lightweight, durable, and looks great on any bike. Kickstand features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Non-Slip Clamping Surface, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin, Zinc Plated Screw, Calibrated Stem, and Solid Non-porous Casting. Weight: Only 266 grams", "text": "Greenfield SKS2-305B 305mm Stablizer Rear Stay-Mount Black aluminum Best Selling in the U.S.A. Greenfield's Kickstand enjoys enormous popularity. It's lightweight, durable, and looks great on any bike. Kickstand features: Certified Non-Corrosive Casting, Dual Spring Pressure Plate, Snap Action Mechanism, Non-Slip Clamping Surface, Hardened Steel Pivot Pin, Zinc Plated Screw, Calibrated Stem, and Solid Non-porous Casting. Weight: Only 266 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21b-Z0qMFFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002FVYTLI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Greenfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 14.93}}
{"item_id": "B002FWGCQW", "title": "Body-Solid Quad Rubber Grip Olympic Weight Plates", "description": "Encased in durable, heavy-duty rubber- impact resistant, these Olympic Plates will not split, crack or peel", "text": "Body-Solid Quad Rubber Grip Olympic Weight Plates Encased in durable, heavy-duty rubber- impact resistant, these Olympic Plates will not split, crack or peel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vZDZV2sXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002FWGCQW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002FY9136", "title": "Spyder Victor 09 Paintball Gun Marker Mega Set", "description": "The Spyder Victor has been redesigned to be 15% lighter and 10% shorter than prior models, sporting a revamped look and feel. A tool-free striker plug was developed to enable fast, simple maintenance in the field. With this set, you get everything you need to get started right out of the box.In addition to the Victor marker, you also receive:20-ounce tank with pin valve200-round hopperProtective mask with visor and anti-fog lensSix 140-round tubesOne-ounce Gold Cup oilJerk squeegeeMarker FeaturesAll-aluminum extruded bodyStreamlined, lightweight designHigh-impact polymer triggerPull pin top cockingAnodized matte finishTool-free striker plugMicro-ported barrelNon-slip rubber grip panelTwo-finger triggerExternal velocity adjusterSteel braided hose lineWarrantySpyder paintball markers include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Spyder Victor 09 Paintball Gun Marker Mega Set The Spyder Victor has been redesigned to be 15% lighter and 10% shorter than prior models, sporting a revamped look and feel. A tool-free striker plug was developed to enable fast, simple maintenance in the field. With this set, you get everything you need to get started right out of the box.In addition to the Victor marker, you also receive:20-ounce tank with pin valve200-round hopperProtective mask with visor and anti-fog lensSix 140-round tubesOne-ounce Gold Cup oilJerk squeegeeMarker FeaturesAll-aluminum extruded bodyStreamlined, lightweight designHigh-impact polymer triggerPull pin top cockingAnodized matte finishTool-free striker plugMicro-ported barrelNon-slip rubber grip panelTwo-finger triggerExternal velocity adjusterSteel braided hose lineWarrantySpyder paintball markers include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qlEPi%2BnML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002FY9136.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A.C. Kerman - Paintball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Complete Paintball Sets"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B002G1INUK", "title": "Troy Industries Di-Optic Aperture Folding Battle Sight Rear", "description": "Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Folding Rear Sight Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industries’ Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Folding Rear BattleSight. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 500 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gas block that is higher or lower than the receiver. Features: - Faster target acquisition with Di-Optic Aperture - Increases accuracy to 550m - Quick install, easy adjust - 0.460\" profile when folded - Protected adjustment wheel - Dual same plane aperture .50 MOA per click - Aircraft aluminum 6061 & stainless steel - Type III hard coat w/ Black oxide finish", "text": "Troy Industries Di-Optic Aperture Folding Battle Sight Rear Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Folding Rear Sight Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industries’ Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Folding Rear BattleSight. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 500 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gas block that is higher or lower than the receiver. Features: - Faster target acquisition with Di-Optic Aperture - Increases accuracy to 550m - Quick install, easy adjust - 0.460\" profile when folded - Protected adjustment wheel - Dual same plane aperture .50 MOA per click - Aircraft aluminum 6061 & stainless steel - Type III hard coat w/ Black oxide finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fdEg15R5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002G1INUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 99.33}}
