{"item_id": "B002G3QAS0", "title": "Crosman 2100 Multi-Pump BB and Pellet Air Rifle with Scope -2104X", "description": "Crosman's highest-velocity variable pump air rifle, the 2104x shoots pellets at a whopping 725 feet per second (755 fps with BBs), so you can efficiently hit targets from a distance. The air rifle is equipped with a 4x15mm riflescope and a fiber-optic front sight, making it easy to acquire your target. Pellets are loaded one at a time, while BBs are loaded into a reservoir that holds 200 at once and then dropped into a 17-capacity magazine. Finally, the rifle feels as good as it shoots, with an all-metal die-cast receiver that offers the heft and feel of a sporting gun. Other features include adjustable windage and elevation, a bolt-action mechanism, and a cross-bolt safety.Warning:Not a toy. This airgun is recommended for adult use only. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury or death. Read all instructions before using. Buyer and user have the duty to obey all laws about the use and ownership of this airgun. You and others with you should always wear shooting glasses to protect your eyes.SpecificationsPellet velocity: Up to 725 fpsBB velocity: Up to 755 fpsMechanism: Bolt actionPower source: PumpCaliber: 0.177BB reservoir: 200BB magazine: 17 shotsBarrel: RifledFront sight: Fiber opticRear sight: Adjustable for windage and elevationSafety: Cross boltMaterial: Metal receiver, synthetic stock and forearmLength: 39.75 inchesWeight: 4.8 pounds", "text": "Crosman 2100 Multi-Pump BB and Pellet Air Rifle with Scope -2104X Crosman's highest-velocity variable pump air rifle, the 2104x shoots pellets at a whopping 725 feet per second (755 fps with BBs), so you can efficiently hit targets from a distance. The air rifle is equipped with a 4x15mm riflescope and a fiber-optic front sight, making it easy to acquire your target. Pellets are loaded one at a time, while BBs are loaded into a reservoir that holds 200 at once and then dropped into a 17-capacity magazine. Finally, the rifle feels as good as it shoots, with an all-metal die-cast receiver that offers the heft and feel of a sporting gun. Other features include adjustable windage and elevation, a bolt-action mechanism, and a cross-bolt safety.Warning:Not a toy. This airgun is recommended for adult use only. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury or death. Read all instructions before using. Buyer and user have the duty to obey all laws about the use and ownership of this airgun. You and others with you should always wear shooting glasses to protect your eyes.SpecificationsPellet velocity: Up to 725 fpsBB velocity: Up to 755 fpsMechanism: Bolt actionPower source: PumpCaliber: 0.177BB reservoir: 200BB magazine: 17 shotsBarrel: RifledFront sight: Fiber opticRear sight: Adjustable for windage and elevationSafety: Cross boltMaterial: Metal receiver, synthetic stock and forearmLength: 39.75 inchesWeight: 4.8 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3165zU4ZfuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002G3QAS0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002G3QTUE", "title": "Crosman 664GT air rifle", "description": "The Crosman Powermaster 66 shoots BB's or Pellets. It's convenient variable pump-power produces pellet velocities up to 645 feet per second and BB velocities upto 680 FPS. This package includes 4x15mm scope, a 5-shot manual pellet clip, 100 pellets, 100 bb's, shooting glasses, and 5 paper targets.", "text": "Crosman 664GT air rifle The Crosman Powermaster 66 shoots BB's or Pellets. It's convenient variable pump-power produces pellet velocities up to 645 feet per second and BB velocities upto 680 FPS. This package includes 4x15mm scope, a 5-shot manual pellet clip, 100 pellets, 100 bb's, shooting glasses, and 5 paper targets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314FZ3G2dAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002G3QTUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B002G3UMU2", "title": "Crosman Remington Vantage .177 Caliber Hardwood Stock Break Barrel Air Rifle with 4 X 32mm Scope", "description": "An included 4x32mm CenterPoint scope offers tool-free windage and elevation turrets.The Crosman Remington Vantage is capable of a remarkable 1,200-feet-per-second muzzle velocity (FPS) using alloy pellets. The gun features an ambidextrous, hardwood stock with a satin finish and attractive blued barrel. Its light cocking force, rifled steel barrel, and two-stage, adjustable trigger make it an ideal choice for small game hunting, plinking, and target shooting. Along with fiber optic sights, the Vantage is equipped with a 4x32mm CenterPoint scope that offers tool free windage and elevation turrets.SpecificationsSpring power source0.177 caliberFiring velocity of up to 1,200 FPSSix-pound weight44.5-inch lengthRifled steel barrelFiber optic front and rear sightsAmbidextrous manual safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "text": "Crosman Remington Vantage .177 Caliber Hardwood Stock Break Barrel Air Rifle with 4 X 32mm Scope An included 4x32mm CenterPoint scope offers tool-free windage and elevation turrets.The Crosman Remington Vantage is capable of a remarkable 1,200-feet-per-second muzzle velocity (FPS) using alloy pellets. The gun features an ambidextrous, hardwood stock with a satin finish and attractive blued barrel. Its light cocking force, rifled steel barrel, and two-stage, adjustable trigger make it an ideal choice for small game hunting, plinking, and target shooting. Along with fiber optic sights, the Vantage is equipped with a 4x32mm CenterPoint scope that offers tool free windage and elevation turrets.SpecificationsSpring power source0.177 caliberFiring velocity of up to 1,200 FPSSix-pound weight44.5-inch lengthRifled steel barrelFiber optic front and rear sightsAmbidextrous manual safetyAbout CrosmanIn 1923 in Rochester, New York, Crosman was founded as Crosman Arms Company. From its inception, Crosman's principal products were airguns and airgun ammunition. During the 1950s, new accounts included Sears Roebuck & Co., Montgomery Ward, and Western Auto, all of which sold Crosman's products under their respective brand names.In 1966, Crosman introduced its own Crosman brand airgun, the Crosman Pumpmaster 760, which has sold more than 11 million units to date. Crosman Corporation is now an international designer, manufacturer, and marketer of Crosman pellet, BB, airsoft rifles and pistols, Copperhead ammunition, and Benjamin pellet rifles and ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21IQV%2BKMTPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002G3UMU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 152.18}}
{"item_id": "B002G55XXQ", "title": "Camp Chef Alpine Heavy Duty Cylinder Stove", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Alpine Heavy Duty Cylinder Stove Adjustable legs for uneven ground 5\" diameter chimney pipe (over 10 ft. total height) Chimney has 5\"damper Wire spark arrestor Fire grate in the bottom to protect base from overheating The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 25 x 15 x 14\" Box Weight: 73 lbs", "text": "Camp Chef Alpine Heavy Duty Cylinder Stove DECENT FEATURES of the Camp Chef Alpine Heavy Duty Cylinder Stove Adjustable legs for uneven ground 5\" diameter chimney pipe (over 10 ft. total height) Chimney has 5\"damper Wire spark arrestor Fire grate in the bottom to protect base from overheating The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 25 x 15 x 14\" Box Weight: 73 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-T9DVwIUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002G55XXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 165.0}}
{"item_id": "B002GCALOU", "title": "Bell Sports 7015913 Bicycle Fix Cable Set", "description": "Bicycle Fix Cable Set, Complete Set Of Gear & Brake Cables, Universal Front & Rear Brake Cable With Housing, Universal Front & Rear Gear Cable With Housing, Comes With Extra Ferrules & End Cap.", "text": "Bell Sports 7015913 Bicycle Fix Cable Set Bicycle Fix Cable Set, Complete Set Of Gear & Brake Cables, Universal Front & Rear Brake Cable With Housing, Universal Front & Rear Gear Cable With Housing, Comes With Extra Ferrules & End Cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51374UTzBsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GCALOU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Bike Brake Cables & Housing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002GF79QA", "title": "BOSU Sport Balance Trainer, 55cm", "description": "Appropriate for everyone from elite athletes to kids to weekend warriors trying to stay in shape, the Bosu balance trainer helps you strengthen and coordinate several major muscle groups, including the muscles you don't see. The Bosu targets your core muscles--the muscles around your abdominal and back area--while you perform a host of different workouts, from squats and bicep curls to lateral shoulder raises and hip extensions. As a result, you not only gain strength, trim, and tone, but also improve your balance and coordination along the way. In addition, Bosu training helps strengthen the mind, with thoughtful movement that requires the participant to not only be physically involved, but also \"here and present\" with the mind fully engaged. By combining physical and mental focus, Bosu training will boost your performance across a wide continuum of activities, including sports, recreation, and daily tasks.The Bosu balance trainer--which measures 55 cm and comes in blue--comes with a foot pump and an exercise manual.", "text": "BOSU Sport Balance Trainer, 55cm Appropriate for everyone from elite athletes to kids to weekend warriors trying to stay in shape, the Bosu balance trainer helps you strengthen and coordinate several major muscle groups, including the muscles you don't see. The Bosu targets your core muscles--the muscles around your abdominal and back area--while you perform a host of different workouts, from squats and bicep curls to lateral shoulder raises and hip extensions. As a result, you not only gain strength, trim, and tone, but also improve your balance and coordination along the way. In addition, Bosu training helps strengthen the mind, with thoughtful movement that requires the participant to not only be physically involved, but also \"here and present\" with the mind fully engaged. By combining physical and mental focus, Bosu training will boost your performance across a wide continuum of activities, including sports, recreation, and daily tasks.The Bosu balance trainer--which measures 55 cm and comes in blue--comes with a foot pump and an exercise manual.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gqoFBdgxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GF79QA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bosu", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 86.93}}
{"item_id": "B002GIFV6M", "title": "Shoe Goo Footwear Adhesive", "description": "Shoe GOO is water resistant immediately upon application. Apply Shoe GOO directly to the surface to be sealed. The tape should be removed from the inside and all bumps smoothed out within 2 hours, before the glue is completely hard.", "text": "Shoe Goo Footwear Adhesive Shoe GOO is water resistant immediately upon application. Apply Shoe GOO directly to the surface to be sealed. The tape should be removed from the inside and all bumps smoothed out within 2 hours, before the glue is completely hard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51x3g2Vt4dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GIFV6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoegoo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding"]], "price": 7.49}}
{"item_id": "B002GIOYVU", "title": "Spyderco Manix 2 G-10 Combination Edge Knife, Black", "description": "Spyderco's dramatic Manix2 is a full-service folding knife that features our improved, patented Ball Bearing Lock. The hardened ball bearing that forms the heart of this high-strength lock is encased in a polymer cage that makes ambidextrous operation and release of the lock even easier. The lock is housed in a handle constructed of stainless steel liners and G-10 handle scales that feature strategically placed texturing at the edges for an exceptional grip. The blade is hollow-ground 154CM stainless steel and features textured jimping above a super-sized 14mm Spyderco Round Hole. These details guarantee positive one-handed deployment of the blade with either hand and a secure platform for the thumb during use. A three-screw, deep-pocket clip supports left or right-hand tip-up carry and a lined lanyard hole allows the attachment of safety lanyards or thongs.", "text": "Spyderco Manix 2 G-10 Combination Edge Knife, Black Spyderco's dramatic Manix2 is a full-service folding knife that features our improved, patented Ball Bearing Lock. The hardened ball bearing that forms the heart of this high-strength lock is encased in a polymer cage that makes ambidextrous operation and release of the lock even easier. The lock is housed in a handle constructed of stainless steel liners and G-10 handle scales that feature strategically placed texturing at the edges for an exceptional grip. The blade is hollow-ground 154CM stainless steel and features textured jimping above a super-sized 14mm Spyderco Round Hole. These details guarantee positive one-handed deployment of the blade with either hand and a secure platform for the thumb during use. A three-screw, deep-pocket clip supports left or right-hand tip-up carry and a lined lanyard hole allows the attachment of safety lanyards or thongs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PQ7HAcosL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GIOYVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 86.95}}
{"item_id": "B002GIOYX8", "title": "Spyderco Dragonfly G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Foliage Green", "description": "The Spyderco Dragonfly knife may be small, but its cutting ability is high performance all the way. The Dragonfly features a 2-1/4-inch VG-10 steel blade with a full flat grind and spine cusp jutting out the top. The cusp is positioned where the thumb naturally settles itself, giving you complete control over the cutting edge. The knife also includes a G-10 foliage green handle that's ergonomically blueprinted to feel bigger than it actually is. As a result, the Dragonfly handles like a large tool despite its small size. Even the positioning of the round hole in relation to the pivot is tweaked to hit all the correct pressure points in the hand when you open the knife. The blade and handle geometry create a series of grip angles with a purposeful flat shelf at the base, letting the pinkie finger ride as a leverage point.The Dragonfly comes with a wire clip that carries the knife tip-up either right- or left-handed. The wire clip doubles as a money clip in a pinch.SpecificationsBlade: VG-10 steelHandle: G-10Blade length: 2-1/4 inchesCutting edge: 1-7/8 inchesBlade thickness: 3/32 inchesHole diameter: 7/16 inchesLength closed: 3-3/16 inchesLength overall: 5-1/2 inchesWeight: 2 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Dragonfly G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Foliage Green The Spyderco Dragonfly knife may be small, but its cutting ability is high performance all the way. The Dragonfly features a 2-1/4-inch VG-10 steel blade with a full flat grind and spine cusp jutting out the top. The cusp is positioned where the thumb naturally settles itself, giving you complete control over the cutting edge. The knife also includes a G-10 foliage green handle that's ergonomically blueprinted to feel bigger than it actually is. As a result, the Dragonfly handles like a large tool despite its small size. Even the positioning of the round hole in relation to the pivot is tweaked to hit all the correct pressure points in the hand when you open the knife. The blade and handle geometry create a series of grip angles with a purposeful flat shelf at the base, letting the pinkie finger ride as a leverage point.The Dragonfly comes with a wire clip that carries the knife tip-up either right- or left-handed. The wire clip doubles as a money clip in a pinch.SpecificationsBlade: VG-10 steelHandle: G-10Blade length: 2-1/4 inchesCutting edge: 1-7/8 inchesBlade thickness: 3/32 inchesHole diameter: 7/16 inchesLength closed: 3-3/16 inchesLength overall: 5-1/2 inchesWeight: 2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VVeKjUHbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GIOYX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 87.95}}
{"item_id": "B002GJNECY", "title": "Pachmayr Piece Professional Driver Set", "description": "Our 31 piece gunsmith screwdriver set contains the best selection of bits for working on all firearms. Gunsmith slotted bits for action screws, hex bits to fit the new scope mounting screws and Phillips bits including special long Phillips bits for buttplate and recoil pad removal. A must for the serious shooter.", "text": "Pachmayr Piece Professional Driver Set Our 31 piece gunsmith screwdriver set contains the best selection of bits for working on all firearms. Gunsmith slotted bits for action screws, hex bits to fit the new scope mounting screws and Phillips bits including special long Phillips bits for buttplate and recoil pad removal. A must for the serious shooter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f1iM3wKuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GJNECY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B002GNFO0U", "title": "Wideview Scope Mount WSM-GG See Thru Scope Mount for the Marlin 62, 93, 336, 375, 444, 922M, 989, 1893, 1894, 1895, Glenfield 30, Zane Grey and Mossberg 500 835 (1997 and NEWER) Firearms", "description": "THE WIDEVIEW SEE THRU SCOPE MOUNT IS MANUFACTURED IN THE USA SINCE 1970. THIS PRODUCT IS MADE OF ALUMINUM EXTRUSION ANODIZED BRIGHT FOR LIFETIME USE. THE SCREWS ARE HEAT TREATED SOCKET CAP SCREWS. THEY HAVE AN SPECIAL OVERSIZE HEAD FOR MORE HOLDING POWER IN THE ALUMINUM . THE THREADED HOLES ARE ROLLED RATHER THAN CUT FOR 60% MORE STRENGTH. THESE MOUNTS SCREW DIRECTLY TO THE RECEIVER. THESE SEE-THRU MOUNTS ALLOW YOU TO USE THE IRON SIGHTS AS WELL AS THE SCOPE SO YOU WON'T MISS THAT CLOSE RUNNING SHOT. ALSO GREAT IN WINTER WHEN THE ONLY THING YOU SEE IN YOUR SCOPE IS SNOW FLAKES.", "text": "Wideview Scope Mount WSM-GG See Thru Scope Mount for the Marlin 62, 93, 336, 375, 444, 922M, 989, 1893, 1894, 1895, Glenfield 30, Zane Grey and Mossberg 500 835 (1997 and NEWER) Firearms THE WIDEVIEW SEE THRU SCOPE MOUNT IS MANUFACTURED IN THE USA SINCE 1970. THIS PRODUCT IS MADE OF ALUMINUM EXTRUSION ANODIZED BRIGHT FOR LIFETIME USE. THE SCREWS ARE HEAT TREATED SOCKET CAP SCREWS. THEY HAVE AN SPECIAL OVERSIZE HEAD FOR MORE HOLDING POWER IN THE ALUMINUM . THE THREADED HOLES ARE ROLLED RATHER THAN CUT FOR 60% MORE STRENGTH. THESE MOUNTS SCREW DIRECTLY TO THE RECEIVER. THESE SEE-THRU MOUNTS ALLOW YOU TO USE THE IRON SIGHTS AS WELL AS THE SCOPE SO YOU WON'T MISS THAT CLOSE RUNNING SHOT. ALSO GREAT IN WINTER WHEN THE ONLY THING YOU SEE IN YOUR SCOPE IS SNOW FLAKES.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FUPTfuN8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GNFO0U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 17.75}}
