{"item_id": "B002GNMSNG", "title": "Wideview Scope Mount WSM-EB-8 See Thru Scope Mount for the Remington 4, 6, 74, 76, 750, 7400 and 7600 Firearms", "description": "THE WIDEVIEW SEE THRU SCOPE MOUNT IS MANUFACTURED IN THE USA SINCE 1970. THIS PRODUCT IS MADE OF ALUMINUM EXTRUSION ANODIZED BRIGHT FOR LIFETIME USE. THE SCREWS ARE HEAT TREATED SOCKET CAP SCREWS. THEY HAVE AN SPECIAL OVERSIZE HEAD FOR MORE HOLDING POWER IN THE ALUMINUM . THE THREADED HOLES ARE ROLLED RATHER THAN CUT FOR 60% MORE STRENGTH. THESE MOUNTS SCREW DIRECTLY TO THE RECEIVER. THESE SEE-THRU MOUNTS ALLOW YOU TO USE THE IRON SIGHTS AS WELL AS THE SCOPE SO YOU WON'T MISS THAT CLOSE RUNNING SHOT. ALSO GREAT IN WINTER WHEN THE ONLY THING YOU SEE IN YOUR SCOPE IS SNOW FLAKES.", "text": "Wideview Scope Mount WSM-EB-8 See Thru Scope Mount for the Remington 4, 6, 74, 76, 750, 7400 and 7600 Firearms THE WIDEVIEW SEE THRU SCOPE MOUNT IS MANUFACTURED IN THE USA SINCE 1970. THIS PRODUCT IS MADE OF ALUMINUM EXTRUSION ANODIZED BRIGHT FOR LIFETIME USE. THE SCREWS ARE HEAT TREATED SOCKET CAP SCREWS. THEY HAVE AN SPECIAL OVERSIZE HEAD FOR MORE HOLDING POWER IN THE ALUMINUM . THE THREADED HOLES ARE ROLLED RATHER THAN CUT FOR 60% MORE STRENGTH. THESE MOUNTS SCREW DIRECTLY TO THE RECEIVER. THESE SEE-THRU MOUNTS ALLOW YOU TO USE THE IRON SIGHTS AS WELL AS THE SCOPE SO YOU WON'T MISS THAT CLOSE RUNNING SHOT. ALSO GREAT IN WINTER WHEN THE ONLY THING YOU SEE IN YOUR SCOPE IS SNOW FLAKES.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tf45PNfgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GNMSNG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 16.54}}
{"item_id": "B002GNYCI0", "title": "UTG New Gen. 4-Point Locking Deluxe M14/M1A Scope Mount", "description": "This New Gen Deluxe Scope Mount is made for M14/M1A rifles and features a one-piece design machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with a black matte finish. It features a 6-inch fully Picatinny-compatible top rail with 15 slots, a lockable rear end with charger guide dovetail, side plate with locking point, horizontal bottom guide, and adjustable side screw to provide a rock solid foundation. Its accepts Weaver style rings and is see-through to allow for the use of iron sights for aiming when installed. Plus, it installs easily with no gunsmith required and comes with black rubber rail guards.Features:New Gen mil-spec quality deluxe sniper mount for M14/M1A riflesSee-through design for use with original sights; may be low profile with special cutting, high profile with tunnel, or clearance so as not to block the user's vision from the rear aperture to front postOver 6-inch fully Picatinny-compatible top rail with 15 slotsRear end locks into the charger guide dovetail1-piece machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with black matte finishSide plate features locking point, horizontal bottom guide and adjustable side screw to provide a rock solid foundationAccepts Weaver-style rings and allows use of iron sightInstalls easily, no gunsmithing requiredBlack rubber rail guards includedSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 5.7 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverRails: 1Dimensions: 6.1 by 1.6 by 1.8 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG New Gen. 4-Point Locking Deluxe M14/M1A Scope Mount This New Gen Deluxe Scope Mount is made for M14/M1A rifles and features a one-piece design machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with a black matte finish. It features a 6-inch fully Picatinny-compatible top rail with 15 slots, a lockable rear end with charger guide dovetail, side plate with locking point, horizontal bottom guide, and adjustable side screw to provide a rock solid foundation. Its accepts Weaver style rings and is see-through to allow for the use of iron sights for aiming when installed. Plus, it installs easily with no gunsmith required and comes with black rubber rail guards.Features:New Gen mil-spec quality deluxe sniper mount for M14/M1A riflesSee-through design for use with original sights; may be low profile with special cutting, high profile with tunnel, or clearance so as not to block the user's vision from the rear aperture to front postOver 6-inch fully Picatinny-compatible top rail with 15 slotsRear end locks into the charger guide dovetail1-piece machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with black matte finishSide plate features locking point, horizontal bottom guide and adjustable side screw to provide a rock solid foundationAccepts Weaver-style rings and allows use of iron sightInstalls easily, no gunsmithing requiredBlack rubber rail guards includedSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 5.7 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverRails: 1Dimensions: 6.1 by 1.6 by 1.8 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jOuWy9sFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GNYCI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 27.93}}
{"item_id": "B002GNYCIU", "title": "UTG Mini-14 3-Point Locking Double Rail Tactical Mount", "description": "The Mini-14 Tactical Mount has an optimum tactical profile with see-through design that allows for the use of the original iron sights and can be made lower with special cutting, used as high profile with tunnel, or with total clearance from the rear aperture to the front post. Precision machined from aircraft grade aluminum alloy for maximum strength, the mount features two double mil-spec Picatinny rails for versatile accessory applications, a smart design with elevation adjustment tension screws and thumb knob for rock solid locking, and an insert block that replaces the bolt locking cover plate as the mounting base.Features:Precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with maximum strengthInsert block replaces the bolt locking cover plate as the mounting baseSmart design with elevation adjustment tension screws and thumb knob for rock solid lockingDouble mil-spec Picatinny rails for versatile accessory applicationsOptimum Profile with See-thru Feature for Use of Iron SightsFits Both the Conventional Model and Ranch ModelSimple and Friendly Installation, No Gunsmith or Tool RequiredComplete with 1\" Weaver RingsSee-through design allows for use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 7.3 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 2Dimensions: 8.6 by 1.7 by 2.1 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Mini-14 3-Point Locking Double Rail Tactical Mount The Mini-14 Tactical Mount has an optimum tactical profile with see-through design that allows for the use of the original iron sights and can be made lower with special cutting, used as high profile with tunnel, or with total clearance from the rear aperture to the front post. Precision machined from aircraft grade aluminum alloy for maximum strength, the mount features two double mil-spec Picatinny rails for versatile accessory applications, a smart design with elevation adjustment tension screws and thumb knob for rock solid locking, and an insert block that replaces the bolt locking cover plate as the mounting base.Features:Precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with maximum strengthInsert block replaces the bolt locking cover plate as the mounting baseSmart design with elevation adjustment tension screws and thumb knob for rock solid lockingDouble mil-spec Picatinny rails for versatile accessory applicationsOptimum Profile with See-thru Feature for Use of Iron SightsFits Both the Conventional Model and Ranch ModelSimple and Friendly Installation, No Gunsmith or Tool RequiredComplete with 1\" Weaver RingsSee-through design allows for use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 7.3 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 2Dimensions: 8.6 by 1.7 by 2.1 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s1gLmNOUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GNYCIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 32.97}}
{"item_id": "B002GNYCJ4", "title": "UTG .22 Tactical Low Profile Rail Mount (#22)", "description": "This UTG 10/22 Tactical Low-Profile Rail Mount features a 4.7-inch Picatinny rail with 11 slots for convenient scope eye relief adjustments. It features a low profile with a middle V-cut that allows the use or iron sights, a bottom with contour perfect for fitting receiver, and comes with 5 screws for fast and easy installationFeatures:10/22 tactical rail mount1 Picatinny rail with 11 slotsLow profile with middle V-cut for use with iron sightsPrecision machined from aircraft aluminumBottom with contour perfect fitting the receiverComplete with 5 screws for fast installationSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 1.2 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Length: 4.6 inchesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG .22 Tactical Low Profile Rail Mount (#22) This UTG 10/22 Tactical Low-Profile Rail Mount features a 4.7-inch Picatinny rail with 11 slots for convenient scope eye relief adjustments. It features a low profile with a middle V-cut that allows the use or iron sights, a bottom with contour perfect for fitting receiver, and comes with 5 screws for fast and easy instal