{"item_id": "B002GO05LM", "title": "UTG Full 180 Degree View Tactical Goggles", "description": "These Full 180 Degree View Tactical Goggles from UTG Sport offer level II protection while maintaining the visibility required for aggressive play. The goggles come with adjustable elastic straps included and sport a low profile design for comfort and for compatibility with a Low Pro iron sight. The goggles featured anti-reflective lenses with an anti-fog venting feature to keep your view clear. The BB deflection lens deflects 0.2-gram BBs from long distances to point blank range from 450 feet-per-second AEG and Airsoft sniper rifles.Features:Full 180 degree viewLevel II tactical gogglesAnti-reflective lensAnti-fog venting featureShot-resistant BB deflection lensDeflects 0.2-gram BBs from long distance to point blank range from 450 feet-per-second AEG and Airsoft sniper riflesAllows wearer to use low profile iron sight while shootingAdjustable elastic straps included", "text": "UTG Full 180 Degree View Tactical Goggles These Full 180 Degree View Tactical Goggles from UTG Sport offer level II protection while maintaining the visibility required for aggressive play. The goggles come with adjustable elastic straps included and sport a low profile design for comfort and for compatibility with a Low Pro iron sight. The goggles featured anti-reflective lenses with an anti-fog venting feature to keep your view clear. The BB deflection lens deflects 0.2-gram BBs from long distances to point blank range from 450 feet-per-second AEG and Airsoft sniper rifles.Features:Full 180 degree viewLevel II tactical gogglesAnti-reflective lensAnti-fog venting featureShot-resistant BB deflection lensDeflects 0.2-gram BBs from long distance to point blank range from 450 feet-per-second AEG and Airsoft sniper riflesAllows wearer to use low profile iron sight while shootingAdjustable elastic straps included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eoX7hpVSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GO05LM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 8.01}}
