{"item_id": "B002GO5WK6", "title": "UTG 3rd Gen SKS High-profile See-thru Mount With 1 -Inch Rings", "description": "The latest SKS high-profile scope base, this 3rd Gen mount is see-through to allow for the use of the original iron sights when installed. It features 10 slots for flexible eye relief adjustments, a solid steel construction with a matte finish, and comes complete with AccuShot 1-inch tactical rings. Easy to install, with no gunsmithing or tools required. Allows scope to return to zero when reinstalled.Features:Latest SKS high-profile scope base with raised integral Picatinny railComplete with AccuShot 1\" tactical rings10 slots for flexible eye relief adjustmentsSolid steel construction with matte finishEasy to install; no gunsmithing or tool requiredScope returns to zero when reinstalledSee-through design allows for use of the original iron sights for aiming when installedSpecifications:Material: SteelWeight: 8.7 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 4.9 by 1.3 by 1.9 inchesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG 3rd Gen SKS High-profile See-thru Mount With 1 -Inch Rings The latest SKS high-profile scope base, this 3rd Gen mount is see-through to allow for the use of the original iron sights when installed. It features 10 slots for flexible eye relief adjustments, a solid steel construction with a matte finish, and comes complete with AccuShot 1-inch tactical rings. Easy to install, with no gunsmithing or tools required. Allows scope to return to zero when reinstalled.Features:Latest SKS high-profile scope base with raised integral Picatinny railComplete with AccuShot 1\" tactical rings10 slots for flexible eye relief adjustmentsSolid steel construction with matte finishEasy to install; no gunsmithing or tool requiredScope returns to zero when reinstalledSee-through design allows for use of the original iron sights for aiming when installedSpecifications:Material: SteelWeight: 8.7 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 4.9 by 1.3 by 1.9 inchesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412VLyt0krL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GO5WK6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002GO85IW", "title": "Benchmade Design HK Ally Knife", "description": "For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Ally Series is a mono-lock mechanism knife with combo-edged coated blade having Ambidextrous Thumb-Hole Opener. The blade length is 2.8-Inch with an overall length of 6.87-Inch. The Ally series is made of AUS8 Stainless Steel. Removable Steel Pocket Clip. Glass Breaker, one Piece 420J Stainless handle assembly.", "text": "Benchmade Design HK Ally Knife For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Ally Series is a mono-lock mechanism knife with combo-edged coated blade having Ambidextrous Thumb-Hole Opener. The blade length is 2.8-Inch with an overall length of 6.87-Inch. The Ally series is made of AUS8 Stainless Steel. Removable Steel Pocket Clip. Glass Breaker, one Piece 420J Stainless handle assembly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NPmeKnYNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GO85IW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.18}}
{"item_id": "B002GO85U0", "title": "Benchmade Osborne Design Barrage Knife", "description": "For the first time ever, Benchmade’s best selling AXIS lock gets a boost. These spring assisted models combine speed and strength in one complete package! The 580 series is comfortable, quick and a hard deal to beat. The knife has a safety on the back and a reversible pocket clip for easy carry", "text": "Benchmade Osborne Design Barrage Knife For the first time ever, Benchmade’s best selling AXIS lock gets a boost. These spring assisted models combine speed and strength in one complete package! The 580 series is comfortable, quick and a hard deal to beat. The knife has a safety on the back and a reversible pocket clip for easy carry", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZLJ1rMQdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GO85U0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 140.0}}
{"item_id": "B002GOYRZW", "title": "Trumark Slingshots Slingshot with Tapered Bands", "description": "S9T: Trumark slingshot Specifications: - Clear, plastic handle slides up, and down the U-shaped aluminum frame. - The frame locks the handle parts together without the use of rivets or glue. - When pushed up, the chamber releases SA30 ammo from the handle's bottom. - When pushed down, the chamber becomes \"self-sealing\" and traps the ammunition. - The fast, Tapered Powerbands are designed to release maximum energy with minimum hand strain while aiming. - They are 15% to 35% more efficient than conventional non-tapered bands. - The S9T is excellent when faster ammo velocity and accuracy are necessary to increase Bull's-Eye scores. - 225 YD. Range. The S9T sling shot stores SA30 5/16\" steel-balls in the handle. - The ammo is not included - The S9T slingshot has matched-pull latex RR-T Powerbands with a soft split-leather pouch.", "text": "Trumark Slingshots Slingshot with Tapered Bands S9T: Trumark slingshot Specifications: - Clear, plastic handle slides up, and down the U-shaped aluminum frame. - The frame locks the handle parts together without the use of rivets or glue. - When pushed up, the chamber releases SA30 ammo from the handle's bottom. - When pushed down, the chamber becomes \"self-sealing\" and traps the ammunition. - The fast, Tapered Powerbands are designed to release maximum energy with minimum hand strain while aiming. - They are 15% to 35% more efficient than conventional non-tapered bands. - The S9T is excellent when faster ammo velocity and accuracy are necessary to increase Bull's-Eye scores. - 225 YD. Range. The S9T sling shot stores SA30 5/16\" steel-balls in the handle. - The ammo is not included - The S9T slingshot has matched-pull latex RR-T Powerbands with a soft split-leather pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415or1g9iDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GOYRZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trumark Slingshots", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 8.93}}
