{"item_id": "B002GQIMRE", "title": "Shimano Spirex RG Spinning Reel (6.2:1)", "description": "The newly designed Spirex FG features quick fire II for easy, one-handed casts and A-RB bearings for smooth-as-silk retrieves, along with the fighting drag rear drag system. Reel features propulsion line management system, power roller III, quick fire II one-handed casting system, varispeed oscillation, shielded stainless steel ball bearings, lightweight graphite frame, side plate rotor, cold forged aluminum spool. Rubber handle grips.", "text": "Shimano Spirex RG Spinning Reel (6.2:1) The newly designed Spirex FG features quick fire II for easy, one-handed casts and A-RB bearings for smooth-as-silk retrieves, along with the fighting drag rear drag system. Reel features propulsion line management system, power roller III, quick fire II one-handed casting system, varispeed oscillation, shielded stainless steel ball bearings, lightweight graphite frame, side plate rotor, cold forged aluminum spool. Rubber handle grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zXbh0SOsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GQIMRE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
