{"item_id": "B002GQZDJE", "title": "Steripen FitsAll Filter", "description": "The FitsAll Filter by SteriPen. To quickly filter water to purify with a SteriPEN, use the new SteriPEN FitsAll Filter to remove particulates from water with the use of a durable 4 micron screen. SPECIFICATIONS of the FitsAll Filter by SteriPen Product Dimensions: 2.8 L x 3.7 W x 3.5 H in. Product Weight: W/O Batteries: 2.3 oz Package Dimensions: 6.0 L x 2.8 W x 9.0 H in. Pkg. Wt.: 4.3 oz Units/Case: 24 Case Dimensions: 19.3 L x 16.5 W x 10.8 H in. Case Wt.: 9.4 lbs Harmonized Code: 8421.21.0000", "text": "Steripen FitsAll Filter The FitsAll Filter by SteriPen. To quickly filter water to purify with a SteriPEN, use the new SteriPEN FitsAll Filter to remove particulates from water with the use of a durable 4 micron screen. SPECIFICATIONS of the FitsAll Filter by SteriPen Product Dimensions: 2.8 L x 3.7 W x 3.5 H in. Product Weight: W/O Batteries: 2.3 oz Package Dimensions: 6.0 L x 2.8 W x 9.0 H in. Pkg. Wt.: 4.3 oz Units/Case: 24 Case Dimensions: 19.3 L x 16.5 W x 10.8 H in. Case Wt.: 9.4 lbs Harmonized Code: 8421.21.0000", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W7PytubrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GQZDJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 17.57}}
{"item_id": "B002GSZ9I2", "title": "Lezyne Pen Gauge", "description": "A replacement inflation hose with an integrated in-line pressure gauge with improved easy to read markings. Stores inside the handle of Flex Hose equipped Lezyne hand pumps on Medium and Large sizes only. The 100% aluminum Flip-Thread Chuck threads onto Presta and Schrader valves for a secure connection. Not compatible with ABS.", "text": "Lezyne Pen Gauge A replacement inflation hose with an integrated in-line pressure gauge with improved easy to read markings. Stores inside the handle of Flex Hose equipped Lezyne hand pumps on Medium and Large sizes only. The 100% aluminum Flip-Thread Chuck threads onto Presta and Schrader valves for a secure connection. Not compatible with ABS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31b24fcA-vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GSZ9I2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lezyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B002GT1C28", "title": "Bern Watts Summer EPS Matte Hatstyle Helmet, Black", "description": "The Watts is highly imitated by other brands so be sure you have the original! With the molded visor styling it functions as well as it looks which is what BERN is all about. This lid will save your life while keeping your style in full effect.", "text": "Bern Watts Summer EPS Matte Hatstyle Helmet, Black The Watts is highly imitated by other brands so be sure you have the original! With the molded visor styling it functions as well as it looks which is what BERN is all about. This lid will save your life while keeping your style in full effect.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w4e9y%2BDBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GT1C28.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
