{"item_id": "B002GXKAX6", "title": "DAJO Survivor Knife", "description": "For any adventure where coming home depends entirely on you, the DAJO survivor knife should be at your side. The DAJO survivor knife contains a knife, Swedish FireSteel fire starter, and a signal whistle. Each of these items is designed to be as light as possible while still being fully functional, all at an affordable price.Durable nylon sheath has two belt loops to attach vertically or horizontally. Other sheath features include a Velcro closure pocket for the FireSteel fire starter and whistle, seven eyelets for storing the paracord and a Velcro knife retention strap..A knife with a 1/8th inch thick, full tang, fixed blade made of 7Cr17MoWV stainless steel with 57 HRC, a high strength, durable, anti-slip G-10 polymer handle. The handle area is relieved to achieve light weight and has small holes to facilitate fashioning a spear..Swedish FireSteel Mini fire starter from Light My Fire offers 1500 strikes while weighing only 0.3 oz..Lightweight aluminum emergency whistle weighs only 0.2 oz..Five feet of paracord is incorporated into the sheath..", "text": "DAJO Survivor Knife For any adventure where coming home depends entirely on you, the DAJO survivor knife should be at your side. The DAJO survivor knife contains a knife, Swedish FireSteel fire starter, and a signal whistle. Each of these items is designed to be as light as possible while still being fully functional, all at an affordable price.Durable nylon sheath has two belt loops to attach vertically or horizontally. Other sheath features include a Velcro closure pocket for the FireSteel fire starter and whistle, seven eyelets for storing the paracord and a Velcro knife retention strap..A knife with a 1/8th inch thick, full tang, fixed blade made of 7Cr17MoWV stainless steel with 57 HRC, a high strength, durable, anti-slip G-10 polymer handle. The handle area is relieved to achieve light weight and has small holes to facilitate fashioning a spear..Swedish FireSteel Mini fire starter from Light My Fire offers 1500 strikes while weighing only 0.3 oz..Lightweight aluminum emergency whistle weighs only 0.2 oz..Five feet of paracord is incorporated into the sheath..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416V1%2BVAHVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GXKAX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DAJO Adventure Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B002GYE2KC", "title": "Clicgear Sand Bottle", "description": "Fill that divot! Durble plastic with molded handle and snap open lid, make filling divots an easy task. Mounts to most brand of golf carts (1-Inch tubing required). Mounting clip included. No drilling or hardware required.", "text": "Clicgear Sand Bottle Fill that divot! Durble plastic with molded handle and snap open lid, make filling divots an easy task. Mounts to most brand of golf carts (1-Inch tubing required). Mounting clip included. No drilling or hardware required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t0aaBleML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GYE2KC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Carts"]], "price": 19.68}}
{"item_id": "B002GYV962", "title": "Adidas Women's Cushioned Variegated 3-pair No Show Sock", "description": "These 3-Pack socks feature ClimaLite construction to wick moisture. They are cushioned for comfort with a reinforced heel and toe and a welt cuff for added durability. This product is Odor Resistant and has been treated to resist bacterial odors.- Order Multiple: Four 3-packs", "text": "Adidas Women's Cushioned Variegated 3-pair No Show Sock These 3-Pack socks feature ClimaLite construction to wick moisture. They are cushioned for comfort with a reinforced heel and toe and a welt cuff for added durability. This product is Odor Resistant and has been treated to resist bacterial odors.- Order Multiple: Four 3-packs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V08wx4XgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002GYV962.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Football"]]}}
