{"item_id": "B002H0MS56", "title": "Ultra Pro 8\" x 10\" Soft Sleeves (50)", "description": "Protects your collectibles from scratching. Acid free, no PVC. Clear polypropylene. 50 sleeves per package.", "text": "Ultra Pro 8\" x 10\" Soft Sleeves (50) Protects your collectibles from scratching. Acid free, no PVC. Clear polypropylene. 50 sleeves per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hoxQJt4lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H0MS56.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultra Pro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Memorabilia Display & Storage", "Card Sleeves"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B002H0NBOI", "title": "Tippmann U.S. Army Project Salvo Paintball Marker", "description": "The Project Salvo has the looks, performance and reliability you would expect from a much higher priced marker. The Project Salvo marker features a high performance 11\" ported barrel, top and side Picatinny rails for accessories, and a magazine that doubles as tool storage. Upgrades include an E-Trigger Kit, Response Trigger and the Cyclone Feed System.", "text": "Tippmann U.S. Army Project Salvo Paintball Marker The Project Salvo has the looks, performance and reliability you would expect from a much higher priced marker. The Project Salvo marker features a high performance 11\" ported barrel, top and side Picatinny rails for accessories, and a magazine that doubles as tool storage. Upgrades include an E-Trigger Kit, Response Trigger and the Cyclone Feed System.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316-dnyWY7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H0NBOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Markers"]], "price": 149.0}}
{"item_id": "B002H10PW8", "title": "Suisse Sport Alpine Adult Mummy Double Layer Sleeping Bag 33 x 24 x 84 inches", "description": "Stay extra-warm on high-altitude camping trips with the Suisse Sport Alpine double-layer sleeping bag.The Alpine is equipped with 3 pounds of Hollowblend MicroTekk Z1 fill, a cozy synthetic insulation that keeps you warm at temperatures as low as 5 degrees F. Comfort range is from 5-40 degrees depending on other variables such as wind, no tent, light clothing and no ground cover. The fill makes this bag a great choice for chilly fall or winter camping, or for alpine hiking trips when you're preparing an ascent. The bag also includes a double-layer offset quilt construction that keeps the fill from bunching up, eliminating cold spots as you sleep. And to make sure the wind doesn't sneak in while you sleep, Suisse Sport added a drawstring hood and draft tube.Other features include a soft polyester lining for added comfort, Comes with a handy light compression sack for transport for ultra compact backpacking you will need a heavy compression sack. The Alpine Mummy Style Sleeping bag measures 84 by 24 by 33 inches (W x H x D) idea for most people up to 6’2” tall and weighs 5 pounds fully packed and is machine washable.", "text": "Suisse Sport Alpine Adult Mummy Double Layer Sleeping Bag 33 x 24 x 84 inches Stay extra-warm on high-altitude camping trips with the Suisse Sport Alpine double-layer sleeping bag.The Alpine is equipped with 3 pounds of Hollowblend MicroTekk Z1 fill, a cozy synthetic insulation that keeps you warm at temperatures as low as 5 degrees F. Comfort range is from 5-40 degrees depending on other variables such as wind, no tent, light clothing and no ground cover. The fill makes this bag a great choice for chilly fall or winter camping, or for alpine hiking trips when you're preparing an ascent. The bag also includes a double-layer offset quilt construction that keeps the fill from bunching up, eliminating cold spots as you sleep. And to make sure the wind doesn't sneak in while you sleep, Suisse Sport added a drawstring hood and draft tube.Other features include a soft polyester lining for added comfort, Comes with a handy light compression sack for transport for ultra compact backpacking you will need a heavy compression sack. The Alpine Mummy Style Sleeping bag measures 84 by 24 by 33 inches (W x H x D) idea for most people up to 6’2” tall and weighs 5 pounds fully packed and is machine washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x5b7012HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H10PW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002H3B1HO", "title": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Water Bottle", "description": "Dishwasher-safe,high-quality stainless steel water bottles from Klean Kanteen offer a great alternative to plastic and lined metal bottles. Constructed of food-grade #304 stainless steel, Kleen Kanteen bottles are BPA-free and 100 percent recyclable. An all-stainless steel interior, 18/8 stainless caps, and stainless steel threads mean the bottles won't retain or leach flavors, so you get a fresh, clean, crisp drink every time. Because Klean Kanteen bottles are constructed of food-grade stainless steel, they're not coated with a plastic or epoxy lining like aluminum bottles.The new wide mouth line of bottles have an opening more than two inches in diameter, which makes filling, pouring, and cleaning the bottle a cinch, and the universal thread design works with most standard backcountry water filters without an adapter. With the Klean Kanteen Wide, you have even more earth- and body-friendly choices. They come in five sizes, ranging from 12 to 64 ounces, and all come in pure, shiny brushed stainless steel. The wide bottles are shorter and more compact than Klean Kanteen Classic bottles but incorporate the same slim design, meaning sizes up to 27 ounces fit in most cup holders. They also come standard with the Stainless Loop Cap, which works seamlessly with the S-Biner, so it's a snap to clip it right onto a shoulder strap or pack.Bottle FeaturesExtra-wide 2.125-inch mouth for easy filling and pouringExternal, stainless steel threads100 percent food-grade stainless steel interiorWorks with standard backcountry water filters18/8, food-grade stainless steelNo BPA, phthalates, lead, or other toxinsSlim design of 12-, 18-, and 27-ounce sizes fit in most cup holdersRounded corners are easy to clean, with no hard angles where dirt, germs, or bacteria can stickReusable and recyclableEasy to hand washDishwasher safeKlean Kanteen WarrantyAll Klean Kanteen bottles, caps, and lids have a one-year warranty against manufacturer's defects.About Klean KanteenBefore anyone else was making stainless steel water bottles for personal daily hydration, before the current widespread concern about health and environmental issues in relation to plastics, Klean Kanteen was cobbling together the first Klean Kanteen prototype from items bought at the local hardware store in Chico, California. In 2004, the first Klean Kanteen bottles were released because the company wanted to give people something better than plastic and aluminum--a lightweight, reusable, body-friendly bottle free of BPA; a bottle durable enough to last a lifetime; an easy-to-clean, easy-to-carry beverage container for people of all ages; a bottle that keeps drinks fresh and clean-tasting no matter how many times you refill it; a simple design engineered for function in every way. In those early days, Klean Kanteen shared bottles with people at music festivals, environmental fairs, outdoor recreation events, and other sorts of progressive gatherings.Klean Kanteen has grown over the past five years from a tiny, upstart company to a leader in the stainless beverage bottle industry. During this time, it's also taken significant steps toward lowering the environmental footprint through consideration and adjustments in every aspect of production facilities and practices. Ensuring office paper is 100 percent post-consumer content, providing hand and dish soaps that are fair trade and , using Energy Star-certified office equipment--these are just a few of Earth-in-mind internal operations choices. This commitment to sustainability also extends to the very beginning of the production process, where Klean Kanteen has increased oversight and conducted third-party audits of factories to ensure they're meeting Klean Kanteen’s high environmental and fair labor standards.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Water Bottle Dishwasher-safe,high-quality stainless steel water bottles from Klean Kanteen offer a great alternative to plastic and lined metal bottles. Constructed of food-grade #304 stainless steel, Kleen Kanteen bottles are BPA-free and 100 percent recyclable. An all-stainless steel interior, 18/8 stainless caps, and stainless steel threads mean the bottles won't retain or leach flavors, so you get a fresh, clean, crisp drink every time. Because Klean Kanteen bottles are constructed of food-grade stainless steel, they're not coated with a plastic or epoxy lining like aluminum bottles.The new wide mouth line of bottles have an opening more than two inches in diameter, which makes filling, pouring, and cleaning the bottle a cinch, and the universal thread design works with most standard backcountry water filters without an adapter. With the Klean Kanteen Wide, you have even more earth- and body-friendly choices. They come in five sizes, ranging from 12 to 64 ounces, and all come in pure, shiny brushed stainless steel. The wide bottles are shorter and more compact than Klean Kanteen Classic bottles but incorporate the same slim design, meaning sizes up to 27 ounces fit in most cup holders. They also come standard with the Stainless Loop Cap, which works seamlessly with the S-Biner, so it's a snap to clip it right onto a shoulder strap or pack.Bottle FeaturesExtra-wide 2.125-inch mouth for easy filling and pouringExternal, stainless steel threads100 percent food-grade stainless steel interiorWorks with standard backcountry water filters18/8, food-grade stainless steelNo BPA, phthalates, lead, or other toxinsSlim design of 12-, 18-, and 27-ounce sizes fit in most cup holdersRounded corners are easy to clean, with no hard angles where dirt, germs, or bacteria can stickReusable and recyclableEasy to hand washDishwasher safeKlean Kanteen WarrantyAll Klean Kanteen bottles, caps, and lids have a one-year warranty against manufacturer's defects.About Klean KanteenBefore anyone else was making stainless steel water bottles for personal daily hydration, before the current widespread concern about health and environmental issues in relation to plastics, Klean Kanteen was cobbling together the first Klean Kanteen prototype from items bought at the local hardware store in Chico, California. In 2004, the first Klean Kanteen bottles were released because the company wanted to give people something better than plastic and aluminum--a lightweight, reusable, body-friendly bottle free of BPA; a bottle durable enough to last a lifetime; an easy-to-clean, easy-to-carry beverage container for people of all ages; a bottle that keeps drinks fresh and clean-tasting no matter how many times you refill it; a simple design engineered for function in every way. In those early days, Klean Kanteen shared bottles with people at music festivals, environmental fairs, outdoor recreation events, and other sorts of progressive gatherings.Klean Kanteen has grown over the past five years from a tiny, upstart company to a leader in the stainless beverage bottle industry. During this time, it's also taken significant steps toward lowering the environmental footprint through consideration and adjustments in every aspect of production facilities and practices. Ensuring office paper is 100 percent post-consumer content, providing hand and dish soaps that are fair trade and , using Energy Star-certified office equipment--these are just a few of Earth-in-mind internal operations choices. This commitment to sustainability also extends to the very beginning of the production process, where Klean Kanteen has increased oversight and conducted third-party audits of factories to ensure they're meeting Klean Kanteen’s high environmental and fair labor standards.", "image_url": "http://g-ecx.images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-site/icons/no-img-sm._CB192198896_.gif", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H3B1HO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002H4YVKC", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Handgun Snap Cap (9mm)", "description": "Handgun Caliber Plastic Snap Caps: 9mm - 5 pack: Relieve stress on your firing pin & firing pin springs - Practice dry-firing to tech safe gun handling, improve your shooting skills & tuning your trigger", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Plastic Handgun Snap Cap (9mm) Handgun Caliber Plastic Snap Caps: 9mm - 5 pack: Relieve stress on your firing pin & firing pin springs - Practice dry-firing to tech safe gun handling, improve your shooting skills & tuning your trigger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PXzqAQkyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H4YVKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.5}}
{"item_id": "B002H9XSWO", "title": "Contour 3100 Universal Mount Adaptor", "description": "Now your ContourHD or VholdR Wearable Camcorder is ideal for your favorite camera mounts. Use the ¼”-20 Universal Mount Adapter to attach your camera to any mounts or tripods that have their own male ¼”-20 screw.", "text": "Contour 3100 Universal Mount Adaptor Now your ContourHD or VholdR Wearable Camcorder is ideal for your favorite camera mounts. Use the ¼”-20 Universal Mount Adapter to attach your camera to any mounts or tripods that have their own male ¼”-20 screw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fvk6IdalL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002H9XSWO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B002HHQNL4", "title": "Cateye Cat Eye Strada Double Wireless Computer", "description": "Cat Eye Strada Double Wireless Cycling Computers. Transmission distance up to 40inches - 100cm New flex tight mounting bracket for Handlebars and forks Tool free mo", "text": "Cateye Cat Eye Strada Double Wireless Computer Cat Eye Strada Double Wireless Cycling Computers. Transmission distance up to 40inches - 100cm New flex tight mounting bracket for Handlebars and forks Tool free mo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AwGquVTuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HHQNL4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 87.95}}
{"item_id": "B002HHVJK4", "title": "Wildgame Innovations Halo 400 Yard Laser Rangefinder", "description": "Offered at a fun value, the Halo 400 Yard Laser Rangefinder from Wildgame Innovations delivers exceptionally accurate and efficient range finding with a maximum reflective range of 400 yards at an affordable price. Featuring a scan mode that allows you to range multiple targets without reactivating the laser and an easy to read LCD screen, the Halo 400 offers everything you need to hit your target. Built for a long life of use in the field, the Halo 400 boasts a water resistant housing, an anti-fog lens, and has a 20-second power saver to conserve battery life. Equipped with 6X magnification with a 15.5-millimeter lens and a 24-millimeter objective lens with a 7-degree view angle, the Halo 400 fits in the palm of your hand for incredibly lightweight ease of use. Backed by a one year warranty from Wildgame Innovations, the Halo 400 is ready to deliver your next trophy.Features:Scan Modeallows you to actively range multiple targets without having to reactivate the laser for each target.Easy to read LCD Screendisplays reticle, low battery icon, active ranging icon, numerical display, and unit of measure (yards or meters).Compact and lightweight, the Halo delivers range finding to the palm of your hand.Specifications:Power: 6XEye Lens: 15.5-millimeter--anti-fogObject Lens: 24 millimetersView Angle: 7 degreesPrecision: +/- 1 yardScan Mode: YesPower Saver: 20 seconds without pressing a buttonWeight: 8 ouncesSize: 4.2 x 3 x 1.7 inchesWater resistantBattery: CR2What's in the Box?Halo 400 Laser Rangefinder, carrying case, lanyard, product information guide, lens cloth", "text": "Wildgame Innovations Halo 400 Yard Laser Rangefinder Offered at a fun value, the Halo 400 Yard Laser Rangefinder from Wildgame Innovations delivers exceptionally accurate and efficient range finding with a maximum reflective range of 400 yards at an affordable price. Featuring a scan mode that allows you to range multiple targets without reactivating the laser and an easy to read LCD screen, the Halo 400 offers everything you need to hit your target. Built for a long life of use in the field, the Halo 400 boasts a water resistant housing, an anti-fog lens, and has a 20-second power saver to conserve battery life. Equipped with 6X magnification with a 15.5-millimeter lens and a 24-millimeter objective lens with a 7-degree view angle, the Halo 400 fits in the palm of your hand for incredibly lightweight ease of use. Backed by a one year warranty from Wildgame Innovations, the Halo 400 is ready to deliver your next trophy.Features:Scan Modeallows you to actively range multiple targets without having to reactivate the laser for each target.Easy to read LCD Screendisplays reticle, low battery icon, active ranging icon, numerical display, and unit of measure (yards or meters).Compact and lightweight, the Halo delivers range finding to the palm of your hand.Specifications:Power: 6XEye Lens: 15.5-millimeter--anti-fogObject Lens: 24 millimetersView Angle: 7 degreesPrecision: +/- 1 yardScan Mode: YesPower Saver: 20 seconds without pressing a buttonWeight: 8 ouncesSize: 4.2 x 3 x 1.7 inchesWater resistantBattery: CR2What's in the Box?Halo 400 Laser Rangefinder, carrying case, lanyard, product information guide, lens cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QFTlC9gEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HHVJK4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002HIC7D6", "title": "Perri's Black Crop with Loop Handle, Black, 26-Inch", "description": "A Nice Economically Priced Riding Crop.Plain Braided Stem. The Hand Grip Is Rubber With A Loop Handle.", "text": "Perri's Black Crop with Loop Handle, Black, 26-Inch A Nice Economically Priced Riding Crop.Plain Braided Stem. The Hand Grip Is Rubber With A Loop Handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Xzhq5iWzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HIC7D6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perri&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Crops, Whips & Spurs"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B002HJ1CK4", "title": "1000 Foot Black Parachute Cord Paracord Type III Military Specification 550", "description": "The product featured here is the 1000 foot spool of black parachute cord, direct from the manufacturer. This is the exact type of cord that is sold to the US Military for non-critical missions, where reliability is a must. The paracord advertised here is not a cheap imitation, it is the real thing! Because individual strands of 550 paracord can be easily removed and combined into your own configurations, this small rope can be put to a wide variety of survival uses. As a general purpose utility cord 550 can be used for: Ridge lines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces Hanging Food from Bears Vehicle Tie Downs Sewing Fabric Repairing Equipment Making a Fire Bow Fishing Line Paracord String for a Bow Making a Shelter Fish Gill Nets Fishing Line Animal Snares Clothes Lines Paracord Lanyards Anchor Line Binding Twine Animal Restraints Tooth Floss Splints Tourniquet Paracord Braiding Other Paracord Crafts From setting up a tarp to paracord braiding, no survival kit is complete without a long hank of paracord. This strong cordage is the survival experts friend.", "text": "1000 Foot Black Parachute Cord Paracord Type III Military Specification 550 The product featured here is the 1000 foot spool of black parachute cord, direct from the manufacturer. This is the exact type of cord that is sold to the US Military for non-critical missions, where reliability is a must. The paracord advertised here is not a cheap imitation, it is the real thing! Because individual strands of 550 paracord can be easily removed and combined into your own configurations, this small rope can be put to a wide variety of survival uses. As a general purpose utility cord 550 can be used for: Ridge lines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces Hanging Food from Bears Vehicle Tie Downs Sewing Fabric Repairing Equipment Making a Fire Bow Fishing Line Paracord String for a Bow Making a Shelter Fish Gill Nets Fishing Line Animal Snares Clothes Lines Paracord Lanyards Anchor Line Binding Twine Animal Restraints Tooth Floss Splints Tourniquet Paracord Braiding Other Paracord Crafts From setting up a tarp to paracord braiding, no survival kit is complete without a long hank of paracord. This strong cordage is the survival experts friend.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VQMkekM5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HJ1CK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The US Military Manufacturer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 40.25}}
