{"item_id": "B002HMBJHC", "title": "Arrow Precision Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit (175-Pounds)", "description": "The popular Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit from Arrow Precision provides everything a seasoned crossbow hunter needs in a lightweight package--and is also a great starter kit for beginners who are looking for a fully equipped package at affordable price. The Fury Kit comes complete with the Recurve Crossbow that provides 175 pounds of draw weight for an impressive velocity of 235 feet per second. The premium 3-dot multi range red dot scope, meanwhile, allows you to aim at your target precisely while the Weaver-style mount is easy to adjust. The kit also includes a quick detach quiver with four arrows and a shoulder sling that is padded for comfort. Designed for both right and left-handed operation, the crossbow has an ambidextrous auto safety and an ambidextrous rear stock. The Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit carries a one-year limited warranty from Arrow Precision and comes with all assembly hardware included.Key Features:175-pound Recurve CrossbowPremium 3-dot multi-range red dot copeQuick detach quiver with four arrowsPadded shoulder slingAdjustable, Weaver-style scope mountFull-coverage dipped camo patternAmbidextrous auto safetySpecifications:Draw weight: 175 poundsSpeed: 235 feet per secondWeight: 4.84 poundsLength (without foot stirrup): 31 inchesWidth--limb tip to limb tip: 27 inchesString length: 26.5 inchesLimb: compression fiberglassRear stock: lightweight compositeTruck/barrel: aluminumSuggested arrow: 16-inch 2219, 20-inch CarbonWhat's in the Box?Recurve Crossbow, Premium 3-Dot Scope, Weaver-style mount, quiver, four arrows, shoulder sling, assembly hardware", "text": "Arrow Precision Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit (175-Pounds) The popular Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit from Arrow Precision provides everything a seasoned crossbow hunter needs in a lightweight package--and is also a great starter kit for beginners who are looking for a fully equipped package at affordable price. The Fury Kit comes complete with the Recurve Crossbow that provides 175 pounds of draw weight for an impressive velocity of 235 feet per second. The premium 3-dot multi range red dot scope, meanwhile, allows you to aim at your target precisely while the Weaver-style mount is easy to adjust. The kit also includes a quick detach quiver with four arrows and a shoulder sling that is padded for comfort. Designed for both right and left-handed operation, the crossbow has an ambidextrous auto safety and an ambidextrous rear stock. The Inferno Fury Crossbow Kit carries a one-year limited warranty from Arrow Precision and comes with all assembly hardware included.Key Features:175-pound Recurve CrossbowPremium 3-dot multi-range red dot copeQuick detach quiver with four arrowsPadded shoulder slingAdjustable, Weaver-style scope mountFull-coverage dipped camo patternAmbidextrous auto safetySpecifications:Draw weight: 175 poundsSpeed: 235 feet per secondWeight: 4.84 poundsLength (without foot stirrup): 31 inchesWidth--limb tip to limb tip: 27 inchesString length: 26.5 inchesLimb: compression fiberglassRear stock: lightweight compositeTruck/barrel: aluminumSuggested arrow: 16-inch 2219, 20-inch CarbonWhat's in the Box?Recurve Crossbow, Premium 3-Dot Scope, Weaver-style mount, quiver, four arrows, shoulder sling, assembly hardware", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413CK7QskJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HMBJHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Arrow Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 165.97}}
{"item_id": "B002HMO54G", "title": "Princeton Tec Remix Headlamp", "description": "The Princeton Tec Remix headlamp is equipped with an asymmetrical single arm bracket, easily accessible battery door enclosure, and large push button switch. Combine these features with a simple and lightweight design and you have a headlamp built to perform in any environment. Whether your requirements call for long distance spotting, or close range area light, the Remix is up to the task with a combination of a single Maxbright LED and 3 Ultrabright LEDs.The highest quality LED available from Lumileds, Princeton Tec's Maxbright LED is extremely bright and efficient. This single LED emits a smooth, powerful, white light useful for a wide range of tasks. The Ultrabright LED is bright and efficient, and its smooth, white, wide-beam light is ideal for close to mid-range tasks. Ultrabright LEDs are usually grouped together to offer a more powerful light source.The multiple beam pattern combines focused narrow and focused wide beams to allow for the most versatility. At close range, the focused wide beams simulate normal daylight conditions so you can take advantage of your peripheral vision. The focused narrow beams create a long-throw spotlight ideal for night hiking and search and rescue.This headlamp offers a Level 1 waterproof rating, which is assigned to lights that offer a degree of water protection equivalent to IPX4 in the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) standards. Lights rated at Level 1 are designed for water resistance to splashing and quick dunkings. If a light with a Level 1 rating is accidentally submerged for a longer period of time, the batteries should be removed and the cabinets should be carefully inspected for signs of battery leakage. If water has entered the housing, the light should be dried and batteries replaced.Specifications:Power: 100 LumensLamp: 3 Ultrabright LEDs, 1 Maxbright LEDBurn time: 200 hoursBatteries: 3 AAAWeight: 2.92 ounces (83g)", "text": "Princeton Tec Remix Headlamp The Princeton Tec Remix headlamp is equipped with an asymmetrical single arm bracket, easily accessible battery door enclosure, and large push button switch. Combine these features with a simple and lightweight design and you have a headlamp built to perform in any environment. Whether your requirements call for long distance spotting, or close range area light, the Remix is up to the task with a combination of a single Maxbright LED and 3 Ultrabright LEDs.The highest quality LED available from Lumileds, Princeton Tec's Maxbright LED is extremely bright and efficient. This single LED emits a smooth, powerful, white light useful for a wide range of tasks. The Ultrabright LED is bright and efficient, and its smooth, white, wide-beam light is ideal for close to mid-range tasks. Ultrabright LEDs are usually grouped together to offer a more powerful light source.The multiple beam pattern combines focused narrow and focused wide beams to allow for the most versatility. At close range, the focused wide beams simulate normal daylight conditions so you can take advantage of your peripheral vision. The focused narrow beams create a long-throw spotlight ideal for night hiking and search and rescue.This headlamp offers a Level 1 waterproof rating, which is assigned to lights that offer a degree of water protection equivalent to IPX4 in the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) standards. Lights rated at Level 1 are designed for water resistance to splashing and quick dunkings. If a light with a Level 1 rating is accidentally submerged for a longer period of time, the batteries should be removed and the cabinets should be carefully inspected for signs of battery leakage. If water has entered the housing, the light should be dried and batteries replaced.Specifications:Power: 100 LumensLamp: 3 Ultrabright LEDs, 1 Maxbright LEDBurn time: 200 hoursBatteries: 3 AAAWeight: 2.92 ounces (83g)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WP1af8lFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HMO54G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 31.69}}
{"item_id": "B002HMQ486", "title": "Maxpedition TAC-LINK / TacLink Carabiners . BLACK", "description": "Product Features The TAC-LINK is a high strength polymer attachment device with GhillieTEXTM IR signature reduction technology. This product has considerable weight and cost savings over metal climbing carabiners. All of the external components are high strength molded polymer, which eliminates metal noise and paint scratches. GhillieTEXTM IR signature reduction technology Corossion resistant stainless steel spring High strength polymer design Weight savings compared to metal carabiner Resistance to solar heating Textured grip for use with wet/gloved hands Large latch opening eliminates snags Eliminates metal-on-metal noise and paint scratches Use for securing tactical accessories WEIGHT: 2.4 oz. Made In U.S.A. NOT FOR CLIMBING OR LIFESAVING USE", "text": "Maxpedition TAC-LINK / TacLink Carabiners . BLACK Product Features The TAC-LINK is a high strength polymer attachment device with GhillieTEXTM IR signature reduction technology. This product has considerable weight and cost savings over metal climbing carabiners. All of the external components are high strength molded polymer, which eliminates metal noise and paint scratches. GhillieTEXTM IR signature reduction technology Corossion resistant stainless steel spring High strength polymer design Weight savings compared to metal carabiner Resistance to solar heating Textured grip for use with wet/gloved hands Large latch opening eliminates snags Eliminates metal-on-metal noise and paint scratches Use for securing tactical accessories WEIGHT: 2.4 oz. Made In U.S.A. NOT FOR CLIMBING OR LIFESAVING USE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m6Jx01p2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HMQ486.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002HOFBQU", "title": "JT Sports Elite Headshield Single Mask, Black", "description": "The JT Elite Headshield Paintball Goggle provides an entry level player with a full coverage protection that includes an Elite lens. It also features a fully adjustable rear occipital plate that is designed to cradle your head to protect you from multidirectional shots. This system is ideal for smaller heads or entry level players.", "text": "JT Sports Elite Headshield Single Mask, Black The JT Elite Headshield Paintball Goggle provides an entry level player with a full coverage protection that includes an Elite lens. It also features a fully adjustable rear occipital plate that is designed to cradle your head to protect you from multidirectional shots. This system is ideal for smaller heads or entry level players.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QHYXjyGnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HOFBQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JT Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 31.95}}
{"item_id": "B002HOFTQC", "title": "Coghlans 940BP Waterproof Matches, 4-Pack", "description": "Approximately 45 wooden matches to a pocket size box. Ideal for hunters, fishermen, campers or outdoor workers. Safety matches cannot light accidentally, must be struck on waterproof striker surface on box.4 packWaterproof matchesApproximately 45 wooden matches to a pocket size boxIdeal for hunters, fishermen, campers or outdoor workersSafety matches cannot light accidentallyMust be struck on waterproof striker surface on box.", "text": "Coghlans 940BP Waterproof Matches, 4-Pack Approximately 45 wooden matches to a pocket size box. Ideal for hunters, fishermen, campers or outdoor workers. Safety matches cannot light accidentally, must be struck on waterproof striker surface on box.4 packWaterproof matchesApproximately 45 wooden matches to a pocket size boxIdeal for hunters, fishermen, campers or outdoor workersSafety matches cannot light accidentallyMust be struck on waterproof striker surface on box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517rV%2BsMDjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HOFTQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 5.77}}
{"item_id": "B002HOLG2I", "title": "Gunvault GV1000D Mini Vault Deluxe Gun Safe", "description": "Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes keypad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. There are Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault sizes available for when you need quick access storage for your handgun. This gun safe has an improved high strength lock mechanism, precise fittings that are virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools, over 12 million user selectable access codes, audio feedback that instantly confirms correct keypad entries, and audio disable feature that allows for \"stealth\" mode operation, battery power for maximum security and easy portability, and a tamper indicator that notes invalid entry attempts. The built-in computer also blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries.", "text": "Gunvault GV1000D Mini Vault Deluxe Gun Safe Gunvault pistol safes are truly premium products that set the standard for the rest of the industry. Our patented No-Eyes keypad provide lighting-quick access, even in the dark. There are Micro, Mini, Multi or Bio Vault sizes available for when you need quick access storage for your handgun. This gun safe has an improved high strength lock mechanism, precise fittings that are virtually impossible to pry open with hand tools, over 12 million user selectable access codes, audio feedback that instantly confirms correct keypad entries, and audio disable feature that allows for \"stealth\" mode operation, battery power for maximum security and easy portability, and a tamper indicator that notes invalid entry attempts. The built-in computer also blocks access after repeated invalid keypad entries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TpASM-tDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HOLG2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GunVault", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 109.14}}
{"item_id": "B002HOOC56", "title": "Camelbak Thermobak 100oz Mil-Spec Tactical Hydration Pack - Long", "description": "Our original product, continuously improved and upgraded, then battle-tested by hundreds of thousands of troops worldwide. Now with external fill access to the OMEGA HydroTanium Reservoir. Tough, abrasion-resistant 1000D Cordura® Fabric exterior. Its ergonomic design keeps you comfortable for hours. Low infrared reflective [LIRR] buckles, webbing, and materials on the Coyote and Army Universal Camo models provide an edge on the battlefield during night ops. With streamlined features, external fill OMEGA Reservoir, and zippered front access panel, operators ask for it by name. Includes the 100 oz (3 L) OMEGA® Water Beast™ Reservoir with HydroLink Exit Port.", "text": "Camelbak Thermobak 100oz Mil-Spec Tactical Hydration Pack - Long Our original product, continuously improved and upgraded, then battle-tested by hundreds of thousands of troops worldwide. Now with external fill access to the OMEGA HydroTanium Reservoir. Tough, abrasion-resistant 1000D Cordura® Fabric exterior. Its ergonomic design keeps you comfortable for hours. Low infrared reflective [LIRR] buckles, webbing, and materials on the Coyote and Army Universal Camo models provide an edge on the battlefield during night ops. With streamlined features, external fill OMEGA Reservoir, and zippered front access panel, operators ask for it by name. Includes the 100 oz (3 L) OMEGA® Water Beast™ Reservoir with HydroLink Exit Port.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lOClcks4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HOOC56.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 73.0}}
{"item_id": "B002HR7K3O", "title": "MTECH USA MT-424 Series Tactical Folding Knife 4.75-Inch Closed", "description": "If you’re in need of a tough knife with loads of features then look no further! This durable knife features a 3.25 inch 440 stainless steel blade with matte black finish and an easy open thumb stud. The handle is black aluminum with a textured design for a solid grip. Also included are a seatbelt cutter, glass breaker, liner lock blade and convenient belt clip.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-424 Series Tactical Folding Knife 4.75-Inch Closed If you’re in need of a tough knife with loads of features then look no further! This durable knife features a 3.25 inch 440 stainless steel blade with matte black finish and an easy open thumb stud. The handle is black aluminum with a textured design for a solid grip. Also included are a seatbelt cutter, glass breaker, liner lock blade and convenient belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310SSCIEU9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HR7K3O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 7.75}}
{"item_id": "B002HSCHPO", "title": "Pearce Grips PG-XD+ Springfield Armory XD Series Plus Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-XD+ Grip Extension replaces the magazine floor plate and internal floor plate on the 9mm (13 round only), 40 S&W;, 375 SIG and the 45 GAP. These units will add approximately 1 inch in length and additional capacity. NOTE: These extensions will not work with the 10 round 9mm magazines nor the XDM frame. The extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing concealability It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun and maintains a factory appearance.", "text": "Pearce Grips PG-XD+ Springfield Armory XD Series Plus Grip Extension The Pearce PG-XD+ Grip Extension replaces the magazine floor plate and internal floor plate on the 9mm (13 round only), 40 S&W;, 375 SIG and the 45 GAP. These units will add approximately 1 inch in length and additional capacity. NOTE: These extensions will not work with the 10 round 9mm magazines nor the XDM frame. The extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing concealability It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun and maintains a factory appearance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NDHKk3UrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HSCHPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.64}}
{"item_id": "B002HSMFZQ", "title": "Blackhawk Gladius Flashlight Holder with MOD-U-Lok Attachment 75GH00BK", "description": "The Night-Ops Flashlight Mod-U-Lok holder was designed to allow the operatorto securely hold many of the most popular issued personal tactical lights with a1.25\" diameter bezel and a 1\" diameter body. This holder is recommended foroperators to carry their tactical lights in a bezel down carry mode however it will work in a bezel up configuration. This holder features BlackHawk's new patent pending \"Mod-U-Lok\" belt mounting attachment system. It allows the end usert o mount the holder without having to strip accessories off of a duty or personal belt. Additionally the \"Mod-U-Lok\" will allow the holder to be mounted at various angles for user comfort and for ease of rapid deployment of the tactical light. An optional Blackhawk S.T.R.I.K.E. platform can be purchased separately that will attach to the holder as well for mounting on to any MOLLE vest or similar platform attachment option.", "text": "Blackhawk Gladius Flashlight Holder with MOD-U-Lok Attachment 75GH00BK The Night-Ops Flashlight Mod-U-Lok holder was designed to allow the operatorto securely hold many of the most popular issued personal tactical lights with a1.25\" diameter bezel and a 1\" diameter body. This holder is recommended foroperators to carry their tactical lights in a bezel down carry mode however it will work in a bezel up configuration. This holder features BlackHawk's new patent pending \"Mod-U-Lok\" belt mounting attachment system. It allows the end usert o mount the holder without having to strip accessories off of a duty or personal belt. Additionally the \"Mod-U-Lok\" will allow the holder to be mounted at various angles for user comfort and for ease of rapid deployment of the tactical light. An optional Blackhawk S.T.R.I.K.E. platform can be purchased separately that will attach to the holder as well for mounting on to any MOLLE vest or similar platform attachment option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NRe1A5TRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HSMFZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.6}}
{"item_id": "B002HSMJES", "title": "Bulldog Nylon Ambi Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip", "description": "Nylon Black Ambi Cell Phone Holster w/ Belt Loop & Clip Fits Mini .380 Automatics (Taurus TCP, Ruger LCP, Keltec 380 and S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate ) Measures: 5\" x 4\" x 1\" * Heavy-duty Nylon outer shell * Magnetic latches for easy open and close * Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying * Conceals the weapon 100%", "text": "Bulldog Nylon Ambi Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip Nylon Black Ambi Cell Phone Holster w/ Belt Loop & Clip Fits Mini .380 Automatics (Taurus TCP, Ruger LCP, Keltec 380 and S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate ) Measures: 5\" x 4\" x 1\" * Heavy-duty Nylon outer shell * Magnetic latches for easy open and close * Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying * Conceals the weapon 100%", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-gXFV338L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HSMJES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B002HSSJIS", "title": "Bulldog Black Vinyl Ambi Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip", "description": "Black Vinyl Ambi Cell Phone Holster w/ Belt Loop & Clip Fits Mini .380 Automatics (Taurus TCP, Ruger LCP, Keltec 380, and S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate) Measures: 5\" x 4\" x 1\" * Vinyl outer shell * Magnetic latches for easy open and close * Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying * Conceals the weapon 100%", "text": "Bulldog Black Vinyl Ambi Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip Black Vinyl Ambi Cell Phone Holster w/ Belt Loop & Clip Fits Mini .380 Automatics (Taurus TCP, Ruger LCP, Keltec 380, and S&W; Bodyguard if using flat face plate) Measures: 5\" x 4\" x 1\" * Vinyl outer shell * Magnetic latches for easy open and close * Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying * Conceals the weapon 100%", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fLSLvsOsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HSSJIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B002HSWR1I", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products .22 500ct Hollow Point Pellets (Silver, 5.5 mm)", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Daisy's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products .22 500ct Hollow Point Pellets (Silver, 5.5 mm) Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Daisy's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51q-GM98QtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HSWR1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 7.13}}
{"item_id": "B002HT0MDM", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products .177 500ct Hollow Point Pellets (Silver, 4.5 mm)", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Daisy's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products .177 500ct Hollow Point Pellets (Silver, 4.5 mm) Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Daisy brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Daisy's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-Ntqy483L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HT0MDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B002HT138K", "title": "Daiwa Sweepfire 4000-2B Spin Fishing Reel NEW", "description": "Great features and affordable pricing make Sweepfire-B a winner for the budget conscious. Big fish don't care how much you paid for your Reel... and aren't they what it's all about? That's the beauty of the Daiwa Sweepfire series. These reels are perfect for all fresh and saltwater applications. Sweepfire-B Features: * Digigear digital gear design * Advanced Locomotive Levelwind for even line winding * Smooth ball bearing drive * Twistbuster line twist reduction * One-touch folding handle * ABS aluminum spool * Gyro Spin balanced rotor", "text": "Daiwa Sweepfire 4000-2B Spin Fishing Reel NEW Great features and affordable pricing make Sweepfire-B a winner for the budget conscious. Big fish don't care how much you paid for your Reel... and aren't they what it's all about? That's the beauty of the Daiwa Sweepfire series. These reels are perfect for all fresh and saltwater applications. Sweepfire-B Features: * Digigear digital gear design * Advanced Locomotive Levelwind for even line winding * Smooth ball bearing drive * Twistbuster line twist reduction * One-touch folding handle * ABS aluminum spool * Gyro Spin balanced rotor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w5sjNon0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HT138K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002HU086C", "title": "Coleman 10-Inch Steel Tent Stakes", "description": "Coleman 10\" Steel Tent Stakes are rugged and can withstand heavy use, ensuring that your tent stays securely in place. They're made of heavy-duty plated steel, with high-impact polypropylene tops that can take a pounding. The tops are designed to be thread-through, for easily attaching guy ropes and hooks. Four stakes included.", "text": "Coleman 10-Inch Steel Tent Stakes Coleman 10\" Steel Tent Stakes are rugged and can withstand heavy use, ensuring that your tent stays securely in place. They're made of heavy-duty plated steel, with high-impact polypropylene tops that can take a pounding. The tops are designed to be thread-through, for easily attaching guy ropes and hooks. Four stakes included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wPaJV1GcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HU086C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 2.52}}
{"item_id": "B002HYRSOI", "title": "Spyderco Chokwe G-10 Titanium Plain Edge Knife, Black", "description": "Knives have existed as essential survival, agricultural, spiritual, and culinary tools for ages, and for every culture on Earth. This is why innovative cutlery company Spyderco established its Ethnic Series of folding blades, honoring specific types of historically significant cultural knives.The Chokwe is one of these knives, named after the eponymous people from the Zambia/Democratic Republic of Congo region of Central Africa. Primarily agricultural, the Chokwe are gatherers, fishermen, and hunters, and also happen to be a people who revere their knifemakers and blacksmiths. The Spyderco Chokwe is a folding knife patterned on a Chokwe fixed blade knife used daily for feeding, harvesting, and protection. This knife mimics the originals' triangular blades and rectangular handles, updated with CPM-S30V steel, flat-ground for cutting performance.The handle is made of lightweight yet durable black G-10 material, with bored out handle holes to reduce overall weight, and enabling through-holes for attachment to a longer handle or pole. Full length internal metal liners reinforce the locking device, a Chris Reeve-style integral lock. When it's time to be on the move, a metal hourglass clip carries the Chokwe tucked safely in a pocket tip-down and right-handed.5% of sales of the Chokwe knife go to the Keep a Child Alive Organization.Keep a Child AliveSpyderco donates approximately 5% of sales of the Chokwe knife to Keep a Child Alive. This organization is dedicated to providing lifesaving antiretroviral treatment, care, and support services to children and their families dealing with HIV/AIDS in Africa and the developing world. For more information, visitwww.keepachildalive.org.WarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco Chokwe G-10 Titanium Plain Edge Knife, Black Knives have existed as essential survival, agricultural, spiritual, and culinary tools for ages, and for every culture on Earth. This is why innovative cutlery company Spyderco established its Ethnic Series of folding blades, honoring specific types of historically significant cultural knives.The Chokwe is one of these knives, named after the eponymous people from the Zambia/Democratic Republic of Congo region of Central Africa. Primarily agricultural, the Chokwe are gatherers, fishermen, and hunters, and also happen to be a people who revere their knifemakers and blacksmiths. The Spyderco Chokwe is a folding knife patterned on a Chokwe fixed blade knife used daily for feeding, harvesting, and protection. This knife mimics the originals' triangular blades and rectangular handles, updated with CPM-S30V steel, flat-ground for cutting performance.The handle is made of lightweight yet durable black G-10 material, with bored out handle holes to reduce overall weight, and enabling through-holes for attachment to a longer handle or pole. Full length internal metal liners reinforce the locking device, a Chris Reeve-style integral lock. When it's time to be on the move, a metal hourglass clip carries the Chokwe tucked safely in a pocket tip-down and right-handed.5% of sales of the Chokwe knife go to the Keep a Child Alive Organization.Keep a Child AliveSpyderco donates approximately 5% of sales of the Chokwe knife to Keep a Child Alive. This organization is dedicated to providing lifesaving antiretroviral treatment, care, and support services to children and their families dealing with HIV/AIDS in Africa and the developing world. For more information, visitwww.keepachildalive.org.WarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-RDf9jnLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HYRSOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 181.75}}
{"item_id": "B002HZ4XMC", "title": "Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System DVD Set", "description": "Shed pounds and have a blast in the process with the Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System DVD set. Loaded with red-hot dance steps, pulsating Latin rhythms, and easy-to-follow routines, this invigorating dance-fitness \"party\" will have you movin', groovin', and shakin' the weight off to the sexy, exotic rhythms of salsa, cumbia, samba, merengue, and more. Each routine features interval training sessions that combine fast and slow rhythms with resistance training, helping sculpt and tone your body while burning fat. As a result, Zumba fanatics can enjoy multiple long-term health benefits while having fun in the moment. Working out can be a lot of things, but it's never been known to be an exhilarating experience--until now.The set--which comes with four DVDs and six total workouts--will work your body from head to toe, starting with the basics and then moving to your favorite targets, such as your core, thighs, and abs. The set also comes with maraca-like toning sticks to add some muscle to your body sculpting routines. The DVDs include the following workouts: Zumba Fitness Basics Workout, Zumba Fitness 20-Minute Express Workout, Zumba Fitness Sculpt & Tone Workout, Zumba Fitness Cardio Party Workout, Zumba Fitness Live! Workout, and Zumba Fitness Flat Abs Workout.About Zumba FitnessThe Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System includes four DVDs and two toning sticks.Zumba Fitness® is the only Latin-inspired dance-fitness program that blends red-hot international music, created by Grammy Award-winning producers, and contagious steps to form a \"fitness-party\" that is downright addictive. Since its inception in 2001, Zumba Fitness has grown to become the world's largest and most successful dance-fitness program with more than 10 million people of all shapes, sizes, and ages taking weekly Zumba classes in over 90,000 locations across more than 110 countries.As a fitness instructor in his native Cali, Colombia, the life of Zumba program's founder, Alberto \"Beto\" Perez, took an unexpected turn one fateful day in the mid-'90s. He darted off to teach an aerobics class and forgot his traditional aerobics music, so he improvised using his own mix of music from tapes he had in his backpack (the salsa and merengue music he grew up with). Spontaneously, he created a new kind of dance-fitness, one that focused on letting the music move you (instead of counting reps over the music). Energy electrified the room; people couldn't stop smiling. His class loved it! And on that day, a revolutionary new fitness concept was born--the Zumba Fitness-Party.In 2001, Beto brought his new dance-fitness style to Miami, Florida, and, through a student (Alberto Perlman's mom), met entrepreneurs Alberto Perlman and Alberto Aghion. All three hailed from Colombia and all three had a vision to bring this dynamic dance-fitness class to the masses. The three Albertos formed an alliance and created a business, calling it Zumba Fitness. They trademarked the word Zumba® and set a goal to expand the brand all over the world. First came the DVDs, then the infomercial--which introduced the Zumba Fitness-Party to the public on a wide-scale basis. That followed with the demand for Zumba classes and Zumba instructors and then the company took off and the Zumba program expanded in a big way. By 2005, Zumba Fitness spawned a full-fledged Zumba Academy to license Zumba Instructors to teach Zumba classes. More expansion followed with the launch of Zumbawear apparel and accessories, music CDs, and in 2008, one of the bestselling at-home fitness DVD series ever--the Zumba Fitness® Total Body Transformation System--which starred Beto and introduced Zumba Fitness' newest stars, Tanya Beardsley and Gina Grant. In 2010, Zumba shook the ground by being the first branded fitness program to launch a video game on all three major gaming platforms: Wii, Xbox, and PS3.Fast forward to today, the Zumba program is now taught in gyms and studios all over the world to millions of Zumba enthusiasts. And as the program continues to evolve from its humble beginnings, to a global movement, to a way of life--its growth has only deepened the company's commitment to providing accessible fitness, without the strain, without the sacrifice, just the pure joy of a party.What's in the Box?Four DVDs with workouts: Zumba Fitness Basics Workout, Zumba Fitness 20-Minute Express Workout, Zumba Fitness Sculpt & Tone Workout, Zumba Fitness Cardio Party Workout, Zumba Fitness Live! Workout, and Zumba Fitness Flat Abs Workout; two toning sticks", "text": "Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System DVD Set Shed pounds and have a blast in the process with the Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System DVD set. Loaded with red-hot dance steps, pulsating Latin rhythms, and easy-to-follow routines, this invigorating dance-fitness \"party\" will have you movin', groovin', and shakin' the weight off to the sexy, exotic rhythms of salsa, cumbia, samba, merengue, and more. Each routine features interval training sessions that combine fast and slow rhythms with resistance training, helping sculpt and tone your body while burning fat. As a result, Zumba fanatics can enjoy multiple long-term health benefits while having fun in the moment. Working out can be a lot of things, but it's never been known to be an exhilarating experience--until now.The set--which comes with four DVDs and six total workouts--will work your body from head to toe, starting with the basics and then moving to your favorite targets, such as your core, thighs, and abs. The set also comes with maraca-like toning sticks to add some muscle to your body sculpting routines. The DVDs include the following workouts: Zumba Fitness Basics Workout, Zumba Fitness 20-Minute Express Workout, Zumba Fitness Sculpt & Tone Workout, Zumba Fitness Cardio Party Workout, Zumba Fitness Live! Workout, and Zumba Fitness Flat Abs Workout.About Zumba FitnessThe Zumba Fitness Total Body Transformation System includes four DVDs and two toning sticks.Zumba Fitness® is the only Latin-inspired dance-fitness program that blends red-hot international music, created by Grammy Award-winning producers, and contagious steps to form a \"fitness-party\" that is downright addictive. Since its inception in 2001, Zumba Fitness has grown to become the world's largest and most successful dance-fitness program with more than 10 million people of all shapes, sizes, and ages taking weekly Zumba classes in over 90,000 locations across more than 110 countries.As a fitness instructor in his native Cali, Colombia, the life of Zumba program's founder, Alberto \"Beto\" Perez, took an unexpected turn one fateful day in the mid-'90s. He darted off to teach an aerobics class and forgot his traditional aerobics music, so he improvised using his own mix of music from tapes he had in his backpack (the salsa and merengue music he grew up with). Spontaneously, he created a new kind of dance-fitness, one that focused on letting the music move you (instead of counting reps over the music). Energy electrified the room; people couldn't stop smiling. His class loved it! And on that day, a revolutionary new fitness concept was born--the Zumba Fitness-Party.In 2001, Beto brought his new dance-fitness style to Miami, Florida, and, through a student (Alberto Perlman's mom), met entrepreneurs Alberto Perlman and Alberto Aghion. All three hailed from Colombia and all three had a vision to bring this dynamic dance-fitness class to the masses. The three Albertos formed an alliance and created a business, calling it Zumba Fitness. They trademarked the word Zumba® and set a goal to expand the brand all over the world. First came the DVDs, then the infomercial--which introduced the Zumba Fitness-Party to the public on a wide-scale basis. That followed with the demand for Zumba classes and Zumba instructors and then the company took off and the Zumba program expanded in a big way. By 2005, Zumba Fitness spawned a full-fledged Zumba Academy to license Zumba Instructors to teach Zumba classes. More expansion followed with the launch of Zumbawear apparel and accessories, music CDs, and in 2008, one of the bestselling at-home fitness DVD series ever--the Zumba Fitness® Total Body Transformation System--which starred Beto and introduced Zumba Fitness' newest stars, Tanya Beardsley and Gina Grant. In 2010, Zumba shook the ground by being the first branded fitness program to launch a video game on all three major gaming platforms: Wii, Xbox, and PS3.Fast forward to today, the Zumba program is now taught in gyms and studios all over the world to millions of Zumba enthusiasts. And as the program continues to evolve from its humble beginnings, to a global movement, to a way of life--its growth has only deepened the company's commitment to providing accessible fitness, without the strain, without the sacrifice, just the pure joy of a party.What's in the Box?Four DVDs with workouts: Zumba Fitness Basics Workout, Zumba Fitness 20-Minute Express Workout, Zumba Fitness Sculpt & Tone Workout, Zumba Fitness Cardio Party Workout, Zumba Fitness Live! Workout, and Zumba Fitness Flat Abs Workout; two toning sticks", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q8h59PjVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002HZ4XMC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zumba Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 75.0}}
