{"item_id": "B002I33JUA", "title": "Zebco 11 Micro Fishing Fishing Reel", "description": "Zebco Micro. Little Reel. Little money. Big fun! A great price on some nice features: Smooth ball-bearing drive; Selective anti-reverse; Extra-hard magnum gears for long life; Right-hand / left-hand retrieve; Prespooled with 4-lb. test line; 60 / 4 Line capacity and 4.1:1 ratio. 11MTSCP model has triggerspin line release and cut-proof ceramic pick-up pin", "text": "Zebco 11 Micro Fishing Fishing Reel Zebco Micro. Little Reel. Little money. Big fun! A great price on some nice features: Smooth ball-bearing drive; Selective anti-reverse; Extra-hard magnum gears for long life; Right-hand / left-hand retrieve; Prespooled with 4-lb. test line; 60 / 4 Line capacity and 4.1:1 ratio. 11MTSCP model has triggerspin line release and cut-proof ceramic pick-up pin", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sof6oV5JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I33JUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zebco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels"]], "price": 18.61}}
{"item_id": "B002I4U58I", "title": "Set of 25 World Sport Disc Cones (6 Colors to Choose From)", "description": "Used by top coaches around the world. A highly versitle training aid for coaches of any field sport (Soccer, Football, La Crosse, Field Hockey etc). These cones are used to mark boundaries, set up a slalom run forcing change of speed and direction and can be used to create goals for small sided games. Manufactured with safety in mind. Low profile dics prevent injury when fallen upon.", "text": "Set of 25 World Sport Disc Cones (6 Colors to Choose From) Used by top coaches around the world. A highly versitle training aid for coaches of any field sport (Soccer, Football, La Crosse, Field Hockey etc). These cones are used to mark boundaries, set up a slalom run forcing change of speed and direction and can be used to create goals for small sided games. Manufactured with safety in mind. Low profile dics prevent injury when fallen upon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NWwav25JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I4U58I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Training Equipment", "Training Cones"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B002I6C9ZS", "title": "Hawk Hawk Bill Blade Stainless Steel Folder Knife,8.75 Inch Knife,Black", "description": "This one of a kind design from the likes of Jose Negron is sure to be a useful tool as well as an excellent addition to anyone’s knife collection. The blade is in the shape of a hawk’s bill and features a partial serration. The blade is composed of durable 440stainless steel and features an easy open thumb stud. The handle is aluminum with a unique grip design in addition to the liner lock blade locking design and a convenient belt clip.", "text": "Hawk Hawk Bill Blade Stainless Steel Folder Knife,8.75 Inch Knife,Black This one of a kind design from the likes of Jose Negron is sure to be a useful tool as well as an excellent addition to anyone’s knife collection. The blade is in the shape of a hawk’s bill and features a partial serration. The blade is composed of durable 440stainless steel and features an easy open thumb stud. The handle is aluminum with a unique grip design in addition to the liner lock blade locking design and a convenient belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4164dGgjAvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I6C9ZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 12.54}}
