{"item_id": "B002I6RWSW", "title": "Handmade Practical Musashi Samurai Katana Sword Sharp", "description": "This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and constructed of carbon steel. The scabbard of the sword is wooden with a high gloss red lacquer finish. 40.3\" Overall Length, 29\" Blade Length, Carbon Steel Blade, Hardwood Handle with Black cotton cord wrap, Package include a free Sword Bag.", "text": "Handmade Practical Musashi Samurai Katana Sword Sharp This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and constructed of carbon steel. The scabbard of the sword is wooden with a high gloss red lacquer finish. 40.3\" Overall Length, 29\" Blade Length, Carbon Steel Blade, Hardwood Handle with Black cotton cord wrap, Package include a free Sword Bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PDbwO5tVL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I6RWSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Samurai Sword", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 54.0}}
