{"item_id": "B002I7REMU", "title": "Origin8 Single Bicycle Chainring Bolts - Black Steel Set of 5", "description": "Includes 5 single speed chainring boltsMaterial - Chrome SteelCompatibility - All single chainrings, no triplesColor - BlackCondition - Brand NewThese bolts are great for creating a converted single speed. You can get rid of all of your other chainrings because they are the proper length for a single chainring. This auction is for a set of 5. They require a 5mm allen key and possibly a chainring bolt spanner for installation. If you would like any other information, please contact us.", "text": "Origin8 Single Bicycle Chainring Bolts - Black Steel Set of 5 Includes 5 single speed chainring boltsMaterial - Chrome SteelCompatibility - All single chainrings, no triplesColor - BlackCondition - Brand NewThese bolts are great for creating a converted single speed. You can get rid of all of your other chainrings because they are the proper length for a single chainring. This auction is for a set of 5. They require a 5mm allen key and possibly a chainring bolt spanner for installation. If you would like any other information, please contact us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317nrYNuITL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I7REMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Origin 8", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chainrings"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B002I9EZHA", "title": "Aurora Fire Starter 440C", "description": "Created and manufactured by Solo Scientific in the USA to be used to start your campfires. Our goal was to design and manufacture the best all-around survival fire starter in the world and we have absolutely done it! AEROSPACE QUALITY, our Aurora Fire StarterTM (Patent Pending) is a true survival tool and will work in any environment that will support life!", "text": "Aurora Fire Starter 440C Created and manufactured by Solo Scientific in the USA to be used to start your campfires. Our goal was to design and manufacture the best all-around survival fire starter in the world and we have absolutely done it! AEROSPACE QUALITY, our Aurora Fire StarterTM (Patent Pending) is a true survival tool and will work in any environment that will support life!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n7jV78OQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002I9EZHA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 19.76}}
