{"item_id": "B002IEIDG4", "title": "Kleenbore Gun Care Lead Away Gun Cloth", "description": "This chemically treated cloth is ideal for removing tough lead and carbon build-up. Excellent for removing burn rings on cylinders and on stainless steel. Over 100 square inch cloth. Caution: excessive rubbing may remove bluing.", "text": "Kleenbore Gun Care Lead Away Gun Cloth This chemically treated cloth is ideal for removing tough lead and carbon build-up. Excellent for removing burn rings on cylinders and on stainless steel. Over 100 square inch cloth. Caution: excessive rubbing may remove bluing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pkj54G1EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IEIDG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kleenbore Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cloths"]], "price": 7.78}}
{"item_id": "B002IEIGZM", "title": "Bulldog Extreme OD Green Rifle Case", "description": "OD Green with Green Trim 45\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Brushed Tricot, soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Zippered accessory pocket * Heavy-duty double stitching * Removable adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * 4 Velcro external magazine pouches * It Floats!!!", "text": "Bulldog Extreme OD Green Rifle Case OD Green with Green Trim 45\" Rifle Case INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/4\" total soft padding * Full-length zipper with pull * Brushed Tricot, soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Zippered accessory pocket * Heavy-duty double stitching * Removable adjustable shoulder strap with swivels * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * 4 Velcro external magazine pouches * It Floats!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YB20ZsRhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IEIGZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IEIJJ0", "title": "Remington Rem Cloth with MoistureGuard (10 x 10-Inch)", "description": "The Rem Care gun cloth with Moisture Guard should be used to wipe down all of your fine weapons.", "text": "Remington Rem Cloth with MoistureGuard (10 x 10-Inch) The Rem Care gun cloth with Moisture Guard should be used to wipe down all of your fine weapons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vzUPJTRlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IEIJJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 3.02}}
{"item_id": "B002IEK5EC", "title": "A-Zoom 32 Auto Precision Snap Caps (5 Pack)", "description": "A-Zoom 32 Auto Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 5 rounds per package.", "text": "A-Zoom 32 Auto Precision Snap Caps (5 Pack) A-Zoom 32 Auto Snap Caps are ideal for training, storage, testing and practice. 5 rounds per package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MmFZ8tK2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IEK5EC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "A-ZOOM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.49}}
