{"item_id": "B002IEO16U", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable .22 Tube Magazine Magnum Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Tri-Lock assures silent operation and zero finish wear by completely eliminating swivel contact with your gun. Other swivels can mar your finish and make noise against your stock. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable .22 Tube Magazine Magnum Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Tri-Lock assures silent operation and zero finish wear by completely eliminating swivel contact with your gun. Other swivels can mar your finish and make noise against your stock. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412ovWpBlOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IEO16U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 11.76}}
{"item_id": "B002IGIVQ4", "title": "Tms 30Mm Tactical Scope Rings For Picatinny/Weaver Mounts", "description": "T.M.S. PICATINNY TACTICAL SCOPE RING SET w/ACCESSORY RAIL TOP, 30MM/1INCHThis ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy and are perfect for military and law enforcement uses as well.* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails ( Does NOT Fit Weaver ).* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 21mm center height. Good with up to 40mm (outside diameter) objectives* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO rings in the set with Allen head wrench", "text": "Tms 30Mm Tactical Scope Rings For Picatinny/Weaver Mounts T.M.S. PICATINNY TACTICAL SCOPE RING SET w/ACCESSORY RAIL TOP, 30MM/1INCHThis ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy and are perfect for military and law enforcement uses as well.* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails ( Does NOT Fit Weaver ).* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 21mm center height. Good with up to 40mm (outside diameter) objectives* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO rings in the set with Allen head wrench", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tbbJrj9qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IGIVQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 23.9}}
