{"item_id": "B002IIZZTS", "title": "Ibera iPhone 4 Handlebar Bag with Stem Mount", "description": "Stylish iPhone 4 mount for bicycles. Ideal for bikes with limited space on handlebars. Access touch pad controls on the fly or use the iPhone as a GPS. Adjustable angle stem mount is ideal for customizing view angles and reducing glare from the sun. (iPhone 4 cases must be removed in order to fit)", "text": "Ibera iPhone 4 Handlebar Bag with Stem Mount Stylish iPhone 4 mount for bicycles. Ideal for bikes with limited space on handlebars. Access touch pad controls on the fly or use the iPhone as a GPS. Adjustable angle stem mount is ideal for customizing view angles and reducing glare from the sun. (iPhone 4 cases must be removed in order to fit)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u7SllchFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IIZZTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B002IJ5VSW", "title": "ProActive Groove Tube Squeeze Bottle Groove Cleaner", "description": "Keep your grooves clean - dirty grooves means less backspin, less accuracy and less distance. The Groove Tube Groove Cleaner attaches to your bag for ease of use cleaning your clubs.", "text": "ProActive Groove Tube Squeeze Bottle Groove Cleaner Keep your grooves clean - dirty grooves means less backspin, less accuracy and less distance. The Groove Tube Groove Cleaner attaches to your bag for ease of use cleaning your clubs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ncD8s2VtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IJ5VSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bag Accessories"]], "price": 7.54}}
{"item_id": "B002IJ7LV2", "title": "ProActive Greenbuddy Switch-Blade Divot Tool", "description": "Compact, handy, high-tech, durable and easy to use. Prongs snap into action with the push of a button and fold away to avoid creating pocket holes. One-handed ball mark retrieval is the most convenient and unique of it's kind. Easy to remove and replace, but it will never become accidentally dislodged. Prop you putter handle up and out of wet grass while chipping to the green. Prong tips are handy for clearing dirt and debris from grooves on clubs and shoes.", "text": "ProActive Greenbuddy Switch-Blade Divot Tool Compact, handy, high-tech, durable and easy to use. Prongs snap into action with the push of a button and fold away to avoid creating pocket holes. One-handed ball mark retrieval is the most convenient and unique of it's kind. Easy to remove and replace, but it will never become accidentally dislodged. Prop you putter handle up and out of wet grass while chipping to the green. Prong tips are handy for clearing dirt and debris from grooves on clubs and shoes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NVbuVOeiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IJ7LV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Divot Tools"]], "price": 3.75}}
{"item_id": "B002IKWG4I", "title": "", "description": "Decade Motorsport Street Gloves are constructed from full-grain goatskin leather over a spandex body for mobility, comfort and durability. These gloves feature double-stitched leather, an embedded high-impact polymer knuckle cage, and knuckle caps at each knuckle providing full armor for ultimate protection.", "text": "Decade Motorsport Street Gloves are constructed from full-grain goatskin leather over a spandex body for mobility, comfort and durability. These gloves feature double-stitched leather, an embedded high-impact polymer knuckle cage, and knuckle caps at each knuckle providing full armor for ultimate protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xgJRYIc0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IKWG4I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Motorcycle & Powersports", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]], "price": 104.88}}
{"item_id": "B002IKWGV6", "title": "", "description": "The Decade Motorsport Street Classic gloves adapt the proven ergonomic design of Decade's popular Street Ride Gloves to a comfortable, fingerless summer style. Constructed of full-grain, top-quality leather, the Classic features an inset, Bolton-cut thumb, long-lasting double stitching at wear points, and comfortable padding across the palm and base of fingers. Pads are securely stitched at strategic points to reduce bulk and allow the hand to curve comfortably around handlebars. It is classic and most favored. Embossed leather wrist strap fastens with a hook-and-loop to keep dirt and debris out, while keeping the glove in place. A comfortable warm-weather alternative to full-finger biker's gloves, Street Classics provide a more secure grip, plus shock and impact protection from prolonged contact stress.", "text": "The Decade Motorsport Street Classic gloves adapt the proven ergonomic design of Decade's popular Street Ride Gloves to a comfortable, fingerless summer style. Constructed of full-grain, top-quality leather, the Classic features an inset, Bolton-cut thumb, long-lasting double stitching at wear points, and comfortable padding across the palm and base of fingers. Pads are securely stitched at strategic points to reduce bulk and allow the hand to curve comfortably around handlebars. It is classic and most favored. Embossed leather wrist strap fastens with a hook-and-loop to keep dirt and debris out, while keeping the glove in place. A comfortable warm-weather alternative to full-finger biker's gloves, Street Classics provide a more secure grip, plus shock and impact protection from prolonged contact stress.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uWRB8pLPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IKWGV6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Motorcycle & Powersports", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]], "price": 38.8}}
{"item_id": "B002IN6LKA", "title": "Horizon Fitness T101 Treadmill", "description": "Get a great workout in your home with the quiet and smooth continuous-duty Horizon T101 treadmill, which can reach speeds up to 10 miles per hour. Perfect for rigorous training routines, the T101 has a 2.25 hp (horsepower) incline motor with a 0 to 10-percent grade and speed increments of 0.5 mph. It's easily storable, thanks to Horizon's exclusive FeatherLIGHT lift, which incorporates two hydraulic shocks to assist you when raising and lowering the deck. They even hold the deck in place above 45 degrees, eliminating drops. Other features include PerfectFLEX deck cushioning, Sonic Surround speakers with MP3 compatibility, pulse grip heart rate monitoring, and a COOLfit workout fan.The computer console has three orange LED windows, LED brickyard, and target/workout LED indicators. You'll be able to challenge yourself with nine programming options that include three targets (time, distance, calories) and three workouts (manual, intervals, weight loss).SpecificationsMotor: 2.25 HPSpeed range: 0 to 10 MPHIncline: 0 to 10 percentBelt size: 20 x 55 inchesMaximum user weight: 300 poundsWarranty: Lifetime frame and motor, 1-year parts and laborAbout TreadmillsWalking is still considered one of the most beneficial cardiovascular exercises for people of all ages, body types, and fitness levels. As a fundamental form of aerobic training, walking has numerous physical benefits for the heart, lungs, and circulatory system, while also increasing muscle tone and burning fat calories. Treadmills provide a convenient way to regularly exercise in all weather conditions in the comfort and safety of your own home.From beginners just starting an exercise regimen to advanced athletes looking to maintain their fitness level, anyone interested in getting and staying in shape can benefit greatly from regular use of a treadmill. Treadmills allow you to determine the pace, distance, and complexity of the workout based on your needs, all while watching television, talking on the telephone, or reading a magazine. Much easier on sensitive joints like the knees and hips, treadmill walking and running surfaces are typically long, padded platforms that allow ample room for a long stride and comfortable, low-impact walk or jog without the harsh contact of a concrete surface.While many different types, styles, and price ranges of treadmills exist, many of them offer unique features like a fold-up design for easy storage, an electronic display monitor showing speed, distance, workout time, incline level, and burned calories, and EKG grip pulses to monitor the heart rate while exercising. Regardless of the simple to complex features you may choose, treadmills offer an array of aerobic exercise opportunities that will provide long-lasting beneficial cardiovascular results without a commute to the gym or a jog in the rain.About Horizon FitnessHorizon is part of Johnson Health Tech, one of the largest manufacturers of fitness equipment in the world. They are committed to designing, engineering, and manufacturing superior products for health clubs and homes. Horizon's manufacturing facilities rank among the most sophisticated in the industry, with an intricate mix of robotics and skilled workers that maintain the highest standards of accuracy and quality. Every stage of manufacturing has a testing phase and 10 percent of Horizon's products go through a rigorous quality inspection that includes completely taking them apart and reassembling them.", "text": "Horizon Fitness T101 Treadmill Get a great workout in your home with the quiet and smooth continuous-duty Horizon T101 treadmill, which can reach speeds up to 10 miles per hour. Perfect for rigorous training routines, the T101 has a 2.25 hp (horsepower) incline motor with a 0 to 10-percent grade and speed increments of 0.5 mph. It's easily storable, thanks to Horizon's exclusive FeatherLIGHT lift, which incorporates two hydraulic shocks to assist you when raising and lowering the deck. They even hold the deck in place above 45 degrees, eliminating drops. Other features include PerfectFLEX deck cushioning, Sonic Surround speakers with MP3 compatibility, pulse grip heart rate monitoring, and a COOLfit workout fan.The computer console has three orange LED windows, LED brickyard, and target/workout LED indicators. You'll be able to challenge yourself with nine programming options that include three targets (time, distance, calories) and three workouts (manual, intervals, weight loss).SpecificationsMotor: 2.25 HPSpeed range: 0 to 10 MPHIncline: 0 to 10 percentBelt size: 20 x 55 inchesMaximum user weight: 300 poundsWarranty: Lifetime frame and motor, 1-year parts and laborAbout TreadmillsWalking is still considered one of the most beneficial cardiovascular exercises for people of all ages, body types, and fitness levels. As a fundamental form of aerobic training, walking has numerous physical benefits for the heart, lungs, and circulatory system, while also increasing muscle tone and burning fat calories. Treadmills provide a convenient way to regularly exercise in all weather conditions in the comfort and safety of your own home.From beginners just starting an exercise regimen to advanced athletes looking to maintain their fitness level, anyone interested in getting and staying in shape can benefit greatly from regular use of a treadmill. Treadmills allow you to determine the pace, distance, and complexity of the workout based on your needs, all while watching television, talking on the telephone, or reading a magazine. Much easier on sensitive joints like the knees and hips, treadmill walking and running surfaces are typically long, padded platforms that allow ample room for a long stride and comfortable, low-impact walk or jog without the harsh contact of a concrete surface.While many different types, styles, and price ranges of treadmills exist, many of them offer unique features like a fold-up design for easy storage, an electronic display monitor showing speed, distance, workout time, incline level, and burned calories, and EKG grip pulses to monitor the heart rate while exercising. Regardless of the simple to complex features you may choose, treadmills offer an array of aerobic exercise opportunities that will provide long-lasting beneficial cardiovascular results without a commute to the gym or a jog in the rain.About Horizon FitnessHorizon is part of Johnson Health Tech, one of the largest manufacturers of fitness equipment in the world. They are committed to designing, engineering, and manufacturing superior products for health clubs and homes. Horizon's manufacturing facilities rank among the most sophisticated in the industry, with an intricate mix of robotics and skilled workers that maintain the highest standards of accuracy and quality. Every stage of manufacturing has a testing phase and 10 percent of Horizon's products go through a rigorous quality inspection that includes completely taking them apart and reassembling them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lr9ojFfuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IN6LKA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 629.0}}
{"item_id": "B002IRV232", "title": "CAP Barbell 2\" Rubber Coated Grip Plate, Black", "description": "CAP Barbell's Rubber Coated Olympic Grip plates are designed with openings around the edges to provide a secure grip while handling plates. The rubber coating helps protect floors and equipment. The plates are made of sold cast iron with a baked enamel finish. Accomodates 2\" bars.", "text": "CAP Barbell 2\" Rubber Coated Grip Plate, Black CAP Barbell's Rubber Coated Olympic Grip plates are designed with openings around the edges to provide a secure grip while handling plates. The rubber coating helps protect floors and equipment. The plates are made of sold cast iron with a baked enamel finish. Accomodates 2\" bars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dc4pgXfJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IRV232.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002ISYAWQ", "title": "Halo Halo Protex Skull Cap with Tie, Royal", "description": "Halo Protex Comes In Blue", "text": "Halo Halo Protex Skull Cap with Tie, Royal Halo Protex Comes In Blue", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410b%2BQ6QwIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ISYAWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ITAUP6", "title": "Everlast Train Wrist Wrap Heavy Bag Glove Level 1 (Black, 14-Ounce)", "description": "These wristwrap training gloves, from boxing and martial arts gear leader Everlast, conform to the natural shape of the fist for maximum comfort, and are ideal for all boxing workouts, from the heavy bag to sparring with an opponent. An adjustable strap creates a secure fit, while a thumb lock keeps the thumb and fist positioned correctly to help avoid injury. Premium synthetic leather, along with solid glove construction, ensure long-lasting durability and functionality. Innovative \"Ever Fresh\" materials guard against microbes and odor, and each glove weighs 14 ounces.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "text": "Everlast Train Wrist Wrap Heavy Bag Glove Level 1 (Black, 14-Ounce) These wristwrap training gloves, from boxing and martial arts gear leader Everlast, conform to the natural shape of the fist for maximum comfort, and are ideal for all boxing workouts, from the heavy bag to sparring with an opponent. An adjustable strap creates a secure fit, while a thumb lock keeps the thumb and fist positioned correctly to help avoid injury. Premium synthetic leather, along with solid glove construction, ensure long-lasting durability and functionality. Innovative \"Ever Fresh\" materials guard against microbes and odor, and each glove weighs 14 ounces.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C0DgiHJ9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ITAUP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ITYNOA", "title": "ZFOsports® - ZFS - 60LBS ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST", "description": "This ZF Weighted vest comes with a full set of weights that can be adjusted from 3 to 60lbs to increase the resistance adeptness. For the purpose of weight loss, the removable weights are located high on the torso to protect the stomach from pounding as you run and also is delicate to the whole body while exercising. The vest is made of heavy-duty 1200D reinforced nylon, featuring double padded shoulders for added comfort, and mesh vented inside for breath ability. The padding is designed to be contoured to your shoulder for maximum comfort. The ZF Weighted Vests are completely adjustable for even more comfort. There are two adjustable straps that can be adjusted underneath so you can easily adjust the body length of the vest by sliding the straps up and down through the D-rings. To adjust the weight level, remove or transfer the weights from the packets which secure the weights with the durable Velcro weight closures. The new ZF weighted vests are designed for all purpose training.", "text": "ZFOsports® - ZFS - 60LBS ADJUSTABLE WEIGHTED VEST This ZF Weighted vest comes with a full set of weights that can be adjusted from 3 to 60lbs to increase the resistance adeptness. For the purpose of weight loss, the removable weights are located high on the torso to protect the stomach from pounding as you run and also is delicate to the whole body while exercising. The vest is made of heavy-duty 1200D reinforced nylon, featuring double padded shoulders for added comfort, and mesh vented inside for breath ability. The padding is designed to be contoured to your shoulder for maximum comfort. The ZF Weighted Vests are completely adjustable for even more comfort. There are two adjustable straps that can be adjusted underneath so you can easily adjust the body length of the vest by sliding the straps up and down through the D-rings. To adjust the weight level, remove or transfer the weights from the packets which secure the weights with the durable Velcro weight closures. The new ZF weighted vests are designed for all purpose training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MUig5iaZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ITYNOA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Vests"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B002IVGKJY", "title": "Tissot Men's T0394171105702 Tissot V8 Black Chronograph Dial Watch", "description": "", "text": "Tissot Men's T0394171105702 Tissot V8 Black Chronograph Dial Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HFmpOOKNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVGKJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tissot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Jewelry: International Shipping Available"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Fashion Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Available for International Shipping"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men's Athletic Watches"]], "price": 329.18}}
{"item_id": "B002IVHQ5Q", "title": "Kershaw Chill Pocket Knife", "description": "The Chill pocket knife, from established cutlery company Kershaw, offers clean lines and reliable performance. Designed by popular knifemaker RJ Martin, it's a \"gentleman’s folder,\" with a sharp, matte-finished blade that holds its edge over time. For easy one-handed opening, the Chill features an ambidextrous flipper, and a CNC-machined G-10 handle provides an attractive finish and nonslip reliability.Features and SpecificationsLocking linerComes with pocket clipAmbidextrous flipper8CR13MOV satin finish steelCNC-machined G-10 handle3.125-inch bladeSeven-inch open lengthTwo-ounce weightLifetime warrantyKershaw knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Kershaw Chill Pocket Knife The Chill pocket knife, from established cutlery company Kershaw, offers clean lines and reliable performance. Designed by popular knifemaker RJ Martin, it's a \"gentleman’s folder,\" with a sharp, matte-finished blade that holds its edge over time. For easy one-handed opening, the Chill features an ambidextrous flipper, and a CNC-machined G-10 handle provides an attractive finish and nonslip reliability.Features and SpecificationsLocking linerComes with pocket clipAmbidextrous flipper8CR13MOV satin finish steelCNC-machined G-10 handle3.125-inch bladeSeven-inch open lengthTwo-ounce weightLifetime warrantyKershaw knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3185pRLqLdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVHQ5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B002IVHQ8I", "title": "Kershaw Scamp Serrated Knife", "description": "The new partially serrated Scamp is designed to take whatever you can dish out. It features a big, wide multitasking blade with a thick tip for durability. The blade and frame lock are blackened with tough PVD metal coating. G-10 front scale/frame lock look good and provide a great grip.", "text": "Kershaw Scamp Serrated Knife The new partially serrated Scamp is designed to take whatever you can dish out. It features a big, wide multitasking blade with a thick tip for durability. The blade and frame lock are blackened with tough PVD metal coating. G-10 front scale/frame lock look good and provide a great grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xCOk2hUmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVHQ8I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B002IVNI3K", "title": "Kershaw Nerve Pocket Knife", "description": "Kershaw's new Nerve, designed by RJ Martin, is ideal for the knife user who prefers a bigger knife for tougher tasks. Ambidextrous thumb studs for easy open left- or right-handed.", "text": "Kershaw Nerve Pocket Knife Kershaw's new Nerve, designed by RJ Martin, is ideal for the knife user who prefers a bigger knife for tougher tasks. Ambidextrous thumb studs for easy open left- or right-handed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316olYPjbqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVNI3K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IVNIE4", "title": "Kershaw Zing-Tanto Blade", "description": "RJ Martin has designed what just may become a new favorite carrying knife. It's the Zing-in zingy orange or classic black. The Zing features the Flipper ambidextrous opening system for smooth and easy opening. It also has a unique 3-D machined blade with a \"groovy\" striated pattern for sheer good looks. The grooved blade is built of high-carbon Sandvik 14C28N stainless-steel for hardness, corrosion resistance, and wear resistance. This premium quality blade is paired with a sturdy handle of injection-molded Polyimide® that provides strength, light weight, and a secure grip in most any environmental conditions. A locking stainless-steel liner ensures the blade locks securely. Knife users are sure to want to put some zing in their knife collections with the new Zings from Kershaw.", "text": "Kershaw Zing-Tanto Blade RJ Martin has designed what just may become a new favorite carrying knife. It's the Zing-in zingy orange or classic black. The Zing features the Flipper ambidextrous opening system for smooth and easy opening. It also has a unique 3-D machined blade with a \"groovy\" striated pattern for sheer good looks. The grooved blade is built of high-carbon Sandvik 14C28N stainless-steel for hardness, corrosion resistance, and wear resistance. This premium quality blade is paired with a sturdy handle of injection-molded Polyimide® that provides strength, light weight, and a secure grip in most any environmental conditions. A locking stainless-steel liner ensures the blade locks securely. Knife users are sure to want to put some zing in their knife collections with the new Zings from Kershaw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31blO%2BF%2BI4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVNIE4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IVPKKY", "title": "Kershaw Chill Serrated Pocket Knife", "description": "The new partially serrated Chill, designed by RJ Martin, is a slim, gentleman's folder with a matte-finished blade that hones to an extremely sharp edge and resharpens easily. It offers Flipper ambidextrous manual opening and includes a matte-finished pocket clip.", "text": "Kershaw Chill Serrated Pocket Knife The new partially serrated Chill, designed by RJ Martin, is a slim, gentleman's folder with a matte-finished blade that hones to an extremely sharp edge and resharpens easily. It offers Flipper ambidextrous manual opening and includes a matte-finished pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tPiuDKOHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVPKKY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IVPKN6", "title": "Kershaw Scamp Pocket Knife", "description": "The new Scamp is designed to take whatever you can dish out. It features a big, wide multitasking blade with a thick tip for durability. The blade and frame lock are blackened with tough PVD metal coating. G-10 front scale/frame lock look good and provide a great grip.", "text": "Kershaw Scamp Pocket Knife The new Scamp is designed to take whatever you can dish out. It features a big, wide multitasking blade with a thick tip for durability. The blade and frame lock are blackened with tough PVD metal coating. G-10 front scale/frame lock look good and provide a great grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Vp4vUtCUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVPKN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IVPKOU", "title": "Kershaw 1920 Select Fire Multi-Tool", "description": "The Select Fire brings a new definition to a tool knife. A folding knife that includes a bit driver. Bits are stored in the handle. Bit holder can be opened to remove bits and retracts back into the handle. Holds standard 1/4\" driver bits. The handle is made of glass-reinforced nylon.", "text": "Kershaw 1920 Select Fire Multi-Tool The Select Fire brings a new definition to a tool knife. A folding knife that includes a bit driver. Bits are stored in the handle. Bit holder can be opened to remove bits and retracts back into the handle. Holds standard 1/4\" driver bits. The handle is made of glass-reinforced nylon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iSQypFbwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IVPKOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B002IWR43E", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Black Instructor's Gun Belt", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Black Instructor's Gun Belt is made with parachute grade buckles and adapters and 1.75” webbing (7,000 lb tensile strength). It includes Kydex stiffener to support gun holsters and equipment and a hook and loop secures running end.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Black Instructor's Gun Belt The BLACKHAWK! Black Instructor's Gun Belt is made with parachute grade buckles and adapters and 1.75” webbing (7,000 lb tensile strength). It includes Kydex stiffener to support gun holsters and equipment and a hook and loop secures running end.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MRts2l3XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWR43E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IWRFLK", "title": "ProMag RD USGI Magazine Loader, Black Polymer", "description": "The ProMag PM017 magazine loader was originally designed to load the (100) Round .223 / 5.56 BETA magazine. The loader is slipped over any AR-15 / M16 .223 / 5.56 type magazine. Five cartridges are dropped in and loaded by depressing the plunger. The process is repeated until the magazine is loaded. Manufactured from injection molded, glass filled black Mil-Spec polymer construction.", "text": "ProMag RD USGI Magazine Loader, Black Polymer The ProMag PM017 magazine loader was originally designed to load the (100) Round .223 / 5.56 BETA magazine. The loader is slipped over any AR-15 / M16 .223 / 5.56 type magazine. Five cartridges are dropped in and loaded by depressing the plunger. The process is repeated until the magazine is loaded. Manufactured from injection molded, glass filled black Mil-Spec polymer construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mr-kZFYDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWRFLK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B002IWTHW0", "title": "LaserLyte Stainless Pistol Bayonet", "description": "Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its 3CR13 martensitic stainless steel blade has a PTFE blade coating prior to the bevel grinds and is sharpened to a fine edge. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "text": "LaserLyte Stainless Pistol Bayonet Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its 3CR13 martensitic stainless steel blade has a PTFE blade coating prior to the bevel grinds and is sharpened to a fine edge. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317oFRBnEFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWTHW0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002IWWYS4", "title": "Spyderco Persistence G-10 Plain Edge Knife", "description": "Persistence means steadfastness and never-give-up-attitude. Spyderco?s G-10 Persistence Plain Edge Knife sports a milled G-10 laminate handle with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Comfort in hand means easier use long-term. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength level without adding non-functional weight or bulkiness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is a modified skinning-style, ground-flat. Careful positioning of the oversized Spyderco Round Hole, relative to the location of the pivot, pre-set the hand in just the right spot for fumble-free one-hand blade open/close. Fully sharpened edge from tip to tang generates the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A 4-way pocket clip lets the folder set tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Walker Linerlock has a jimped liner. Screw together construction.Weight 4.2 oz (120 g).", "text": "Spyderco Persistence G-10 Plain Edge Knife Persistence means steadfastness and never-give-up-attitude. Spyderco?s G-10 Persistence Plain Edge Knife sports a milled G-10 laminate handle with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Comfort in hand means easier use long-term. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength level without adding non-functional weight or bulkiness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is a modified skinning-style, ground-flat. Careful positioning of the oversized Spyderco Round Hole, relative to the location of the pivot, pre-set the hand in just the right spot for fumble-free one-hand blade open/close. Fully sharpened edge from tip to tang generates the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A 4-way pocket clip lets the folder set tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Walker Linerlock has a jimped liner. Screw together construction.Weight 4.2 oz (120 g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hHWRiCMmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWWYS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 35.33}}
{"item_id": "B002IWX5TG", "title": "Kel-Tec Belt Clip Blue For P-32", "description": "Kel-Tec Belt Clip Right Hand Blue P32 P32-380RB. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Kel-Tec Belt Clip Blue For P-32 Kel-Tec Belt Clip Right Hand Blue P32 P32-380RB. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ioeJDuzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWX5TG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kel Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.89}}
{"item_id": "B002IWXJ4W", "title": "Magpul Industries XTM Rail Panels Accessory Rail Covers Picatinny MAG410-BLK", "description": "Magpul Industries XTM Rail Panels Accessory Black Rail Covers Picatinny MAG410-BLK", "text": "Magpul Industries XTM Rail Panels Accessory Rail Covers Picatinny MAG410-BLK Magpul Industries XTM Rail Panels Accessory Black Rail Covers Picatinny MAG410-BLK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zod23Qn7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWXJ4W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B002IWY15S", "title": "Kershaw 1445 Half Ton Folding Knife", "description": "Don't underestimate this small-in-stature knife--the short, chubby blade works on and on. Glass-reinforced nylon handles with super-grippy Santoprene inserts make your hold on the Half Ton firm and secure, a locking liner adds safety to the open blade, and the steel features a satin finish that makes it shiny but tough as nails. Kershaw completes the package with a patented Wrench Clip, a pocket clip shaped like a mini-wrench. Easy open with the thumb stud rounds out the package.Features:Stainless steel pocket knife; small but durableGlass-reinforced nylon handles with super-grippy Santoprene insertsLocking liner adds safety to the open bladeSteel blade features a satin finishPatented Wrench Clip, pocket clip shaped like a mini wrenchEasy open with thumb studSpecifications:Steel: Stainless steel with satin finishHandle: Glass-filled nylon, Santoprene insertsBlade Length: 2.5 inchesClosed Length: 3 5/8 inchesOverall Length: 6 1/8 inchesWeight: 3.2 ounces", "text": "Kershaw 1445 Half Ton Folding Knife Don't underestimate this small-in-stature knife--the short, chubby blade works on and on. Glass-reinforced nylon handles with super-grippy Santoprene inserts make your hold on the Half Ton firm and secure, a locking liner adds safety to the open blade, and the steel features a satin finish that makes it shiny but tough as nails. Kershaw completes the package with a patented Wrench Clip, a pocket clip shaped like a mini-wrench. Easy open with the thumb stud rounds out the package.Features:Stainless steel pocket knife; small but durableGlass-reinforced nylon handles with super-grippy Santoprene insertsLocking liner adds safety to the open bladeSteel blade features a satin finishPatented Wrench Clip, pocket clip shaped like a mini wrenchEasy open with thumb studSpecifications:Steel: Stainless steel with satin finishHandle: Glass-filled nylon, Santoprene insertsBlade Length: 2.5 inchesClosed Length: 3 5/8 inchesOverall Length: 6 1/8 inchesWeight: 3.2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312QhNIJhbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWY15S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.05}}
{"item_id": "B002IWY91O", "title": "Blackhawk Shotgun Bandoleer", "description": "Over the shoulder design. Carries 55 shotgun shells. Made of heavy-duty nylon-2.25\" military pistol belt webbing. 1.5\" wide heavy-duty elastic holds the shells securely.", "text": "Blackhawk Shotgun Bandoleer Over the shoulder design. Carries 55 shotgun shells. Made of heavy-duty nylon-2.25\" military pistol belt webbing. 1.5\" wide heavy-duty elastic holds the shells securely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K-M%2BojaiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWY91O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B002IWYAX6", "title": "Remington 19425 Internal Scope Mount", "description": "Precision machined in the U.S.A., Remington integral scope mounts are constructed from quality steel and hard-coated with a matte finish for rust resistance. These integral scope mounts, which fit all Model 700 Rifles, feature Z-2 alloy construction, which is 50% stronger than aluminum. The base and lower ring, available in black or silver, are all-in-one, creating a super strong design attached by 8 TORx grade tactical screws.", "text": "Remington 19425 Internal Scope Mount Precision machined in the U.S.A., Remington integral scope mounts are constructed from quality steel and hard-coated with a matte finish for rust resistance. These integral scope mounts, which fit all Model 700 Rifles, feature Z-2 alloy construction, which is 50% stronger than aluminum. The base and lower ring, available in black or silver, are all-in-one, creating a super strong design attached by 8 TORx grade tactical screws.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JZ3bFmx7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IWYAX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 26.45}}
{"item_id": "B002IX04GC", "title": "Command Arms Adjustable Cheek Rest for the CBS and PRFCS", "description": "Adjustable cheek rest Fits the Command Arms CBS and PRFCS adapter rail Command Arms", "text": "Command Arms Adjustable Cheek Rest for the CBS and PRFCS Adjustable cheek rest Fits the Command Arms CBS and PRFCS adapter rail Command Arms", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CZ9lAX48L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IX04GC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Command Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 20.11}}
{"item_id": "B002IX06DI", "title": "Global Military Gear Tactical Vest", "description": "Tactical vest with four dual rifle magazine pouches, six pistol magazine/grenade pouches, multipurpose pouches for shotgun shells, first aid supplies, GPS, or other gear, Universal pistol holster, and tactical belt.", "text": "Global Military Gear Tactical Vest Tactical vest with four dual rifle magazine pouches, six pistol magazine/grenade pouches, multipurpose pouches for shotgun shells, first aid supplies, GPS, or other gear, Universal pistol holster, and tactical belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zbkAVMWUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IX06DI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Vests"]], "price": 44.49}}
{"item_id": "B002IY5BZ0", "title": "Glock OEM Range Bag (One Pistol)", "description": "Glock Black Nylon Pistol Range Bag Md: AP60211, A must have item for the serious Glock enthusiast, this heavy-duty pistol bag has room for your Glock pistol, ammunition. It is also constructed of DuPont ballistic nylon so it is built to last. These are a much more practical way for carrying you pistol around than the standard tupperware box that the Glock pistols come in from the factory. This is the official licensed Glock merchandise!, Type: Range Bag Color: Black Dimensions: 1 Pistol Material: Dupont Ballistic Nylon Finish: Textured, Manufacturer: GLOCK INC, Model: AP60211", "text": "Glock OEM Range Bag (One Pistol) Glock Black Nylon Pistol Range Bag Md: AP60211, A must have item for the serious Glock enthusiast, this heavy-duty pistol bag has room for your Glock pistol, ammunition. It is also constructed of DuPont ballistic nylon so it is built to last. These are a much more practical way for carrying you pistol around than the standard tupperware box that the Glock pistols come in from the factory. This is the official licensed Glock merchandise!, Type: Range Bag Color: Black Dimensions: 1 Pistol Material: Dupont Ballistic Nylon Finish: Textured, Manufacturer: GLOCK INC, Model: AP60211", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MxaHZz08L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IY5BZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 8.73}}
{"item_id": "B002IY8DBE", "title": "Halo Headband Solar Skull Cap", "description": "Halo Headband skull caps are perfect for competing, working our or just recreating. DRYLINE fabric is a unique, dual component fabric featuring polyester inside and nylon outside This uniquie combination createss a push-pull moisture transport design drawing perspiration from the skin to the fabric surface where it evaporates In addition to the technical fabric is their patented Sweat Block Technology--a watertight, non-slip seal built into the front of each Halo Headband to direct sweat away from your eyes This style provides reflective sun blocking protection, the pullover design protects your ears and neck, fits comfortably under hats and helmets", "text": "Halo Headband Solar Skull Cap Halo Headband skull caps are perfect for competing, working our or just recreating. DRYLINE fabric is a unique, dual component fabric featuring polyester inside and nylon outside This uniquie combination createss a push-pull moisture transport design drawing perspiration from the skin to the fabric surface where it evaporates In addition to the technical fabric is their patented Sweat Block Technology--a watertight, non-slip seal built into the front of each Halo Headband to direct sweat away from your eyes This style provides reflective sun blocking protection, the pullover design protects your ears and neck, fits comfortably under hats and helmets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FDPFfphTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002IY8DBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 16.22}}
