{"item_id": "B002J1S21W", "title": "Trumark Slingshots Ammo Tracer (1/2-Inch 72 CT)", "description": "Your eyes will follow the white tracer right to the target. Spot hits, ricochets, and near misses quickly improve your accuracy in just a few tries. Specifications: - Ammo is easy to center in pouch and aim - It's large size and smooth surface allow the ammo to be pulled back slowly without tiring the hand while sighting. - Can be shot over and over - They are easy to see, find and last longer than other ammo. - 1/2\" marbles - 72 count", "text": "Trumark Slingshots Ammo Tracer (1/2-Inch 72 CT) Your eyes will follow the white tracer right to the target. Spot hits, ricochets, and near misses quickly improve your accuracy in just a few tries. Specifications: - Ammo is easy to center in pouch and aim - It's large size and smooth surface allow the ammo to be pulled back slowly without tiring the hand while sighting. - Can be shot over and over - They are easy to see, find and last longer than other ammo. - 1/2\" marbles - 72 count", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cZJuXDbAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J1S21W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trumark Slingshots", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Slingshots"]], "price": 6.86}}
{"item_id": "B002J1U846", "title": "Benjamin 397 Air Rifle (.177)", "description": "The rich wood stock is carved to fit the arm and the eye for smooth, clean shooting. At 33 feet, it can deliver a half inch group. You'll get accuracy and durability from one of the finest air rifles made today.", "text": "Benjamin 397 Air Rifle (.177) The rich wood stock is carved to fit the arm and the eye for smooth, clean shooting. At 33 feet, it can deliver a half inch group. You'll get accuracy and durability from one of the finest air rifles made today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lmG4Vl0oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J1U846.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 160.64}}
{"item_id": "B002J1WF9W", "title": "Crosman 2 Pk Spare Clips for P10, C11 and TACC11 BB Air Pistols", "description": "More clips means more shooting! Load up on BBs with these extra clips for your P10, C11 and TACC11 Air Pistols. NOT FOR AIRSOFT.Features:", "text": "Crosman 2 Pk Spare Clips for P10, C11 and TACC11 BB Air Pistols More clips means more shooting! Load up on BBs with these extra clips for your P10, C11 and TACC11 Air Pistols. NOT FOR AIRSOFT.Features:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GAmvvwQbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J1WF9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 13.83}}
{"item_id": "B002J20TJ4", "title": "Troy Industries Folding Tritium Battle Sight Rear (Black)", "description": "Troy Rear Tritium Folding Sights TRITIUM is a form of hydrogen that emits a continuous light source where using batteries or electricity is not possible. Target acquisition is made possible in low or no light conditions. - No limited sight orientation due to low light conditions - Front post is centered between two tritium points of reference to allow for proper alignment - Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "text": "Troy Industries Folding Tritium Battle Sight Rear (Black) Troy Rear Tritium Folding Sights TRITIUM is a form of hydrogen that emits a continuous light source where using batteries or electricity is not possible. Target acquisition is made possible in low or no light conditions. - No limited sight orientation due to low light conditions - Front post is centered between two tritium points of reference to allow for proper alignment - Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ec3V%2BirIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J20TJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 126.0}}
{"item_id": "B002J3LFRS", "title": "Aimshot 9mm Laser Boresight", "description": "The Aimshot Laser boresight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately boresight your weapon. Just slide the aimshot laser boresight cartridge into the caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot is projected down the exact centerline of your barrel. Cartridge sleeves are meticulously engineered with precision for a flawlessly centered dot every time. An invaluable tool for any gun enthusiast, this boresighting unit will save time and ammunition while allowing you to sight your weapon in areas where discharging a firearm may not be possible and takes up no more space in your pocket than a rifle cartridge. A durable nylon case is included with bore signets. It is specifically designed to hold your bore sight along with all the arbors you need. Arbors are sold separately.", "text": "Aimshot 9mm Laser Boresight The Aimshot Laser boresight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately boresight your weapon. Just slide the aimshot laser boresight cartridge into the caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot is projected down the exact centerline of your barrel. Cartridge sleeves are meticulously engineered with precision for a flawlessly centered dot every time. An invaluable tool for any gun enthusiast, this boresighting unit will save time and ammunition while allowing you to sight your weapon in areas where discharging a firearm may not be possible and takes up no more space in your pocket than a rifle cartridge. A durable nylon case is included with bore signets. It is specifically designed to hold your bore sight along with all the arbors you need. Arbors are sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vBO8X8mHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J3LFRS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 30.3}}
{"item_id": "B002J4UBJ0", "title": "Casio Men's F201WA-1A Black Resin Multi-Function Alarm Sport Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's F201WA-1A Black Resin Multi-Function Alarm Sport Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414uwoprKCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J4UBJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men's Athletic Watches"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B002J8YKUC", "title": "Ledge Sports FeatherLite +0 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20)", "description": "Built for size and weight restrictions on extended journeys. The Featherlite is regular size with premium fill. Temperature rating is a guage for experienced users who understand proper equipment use. Unlike other Ledge classic and oversize bags it is not a comfort rating but a guide for use.", "text": "Ledge Sports FeatherLite +0 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20) Built for size and weight restrictions on extended journeys. The Featherlite is regular size with premium fill. Temperature rating is a guage for experienced users who understand proper equipment use. Unlike other Ledge classic and oversize bags it is not a comfort rating but a guide for use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414vM7N1bxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J8YKUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ledge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 73.99}}
{"item_id": "B002J900EQ", "title": "Sven Saw Original 21\" Folding Saw", "description": "An excellent backpacker's saw, which folds safely and completely into the rugged high-strength aluminum frame when not in use, is extremely light, and features an aluminum handle with a 21\" Swedish Steel blade with specially hardened teeth. Weight: 16 oz.", "text": "Sven Saw Original 21\" Folding Saw An excellent backpacker's saw, which folds safely and completely into the rugged high-strength aluminum frame when not in use, is extremely light, and features an aluminum handle with a 21\" Swedish Steel blade with specially hardened teeth. Weight: 16 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i2QG9e1lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J900EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SVEN SAW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 36.65}}
{"item_id": "B002J98X2C", "title": "Flip Up Red Filter for SureFire Flashlights with 1.25\" Diameter Bezels", "description": "The Surefire FM35 Red Filter produces a smooth beam of red light that will not degrade night vision as white light would. Hunters use the red filter to avoid spooking game during predawn hours - deer see poorly in the red color spectrum. The filter is also useful for close range, non-tactical applications - such as map reading -- as it reduces the intensity of light output. Applying thumb pressure to the locking tab releases the cover; a spring mechanism keeps the open cover out of the way by holding it flat against the flashlight. A cam-locking lever keeps the entire unit securely attached to the flashlight.", "text": "Flip Up Red Filter for SureFire Flashlights with 1.25\" Diameter Bezels The Surefire FM35 Red Filter produces a smooth beam of red light that will not degrade night vision as white light would. Hunters use the red filter to avoid spooking game during predawn hours - deer see poorly in the red color spectrum. The filter is also useful for close range, non-tactical applications - such as map reading -- as it reduces the intensity of light output. Applying thumb pressure to the locking tab releases the cover; a spring mechanism keeps the open cover out of the way by holding it flat against the flashlight. A cam-locking lever keeps the entire unit securely attached to the flashlight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wx6T9Gv1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J98X2C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 34.56}}
{"item_id": "B002J997EU", "title": "Shimano Ultegra PD-6700 SL Pedal", "description": "Not surprisingly, Shimano did not make any design changes to Ultegra pedals when they upgraded the PD-6620-S SPD-SL pedal to the PD-6700s. To make changes, they'd probably have to re-vamp their entire pedal line-up. Besides, the pedal is pretty good already. The only change they made was updating the finish so it fits in with the finish on all the other components in the new Ultegra group. As with the previous iteration, it's the same steel-spindled, aluminum bodied pedal with the composite cleat retention bar. The spring tension is adjustable. Each pedal runs on two sets of ball bearings. There is a steel plate atop the pedal so cleat rub will wear the plate without damaging the rest of the body. The pedal comes with the same SM-SH11 floating cleat (the one with the yellow wear tabs). The float is three degrees either way. Stack height is 13.7mmThe pedals come with a pair of cleats and mounting hardware.Product FeaturesMaterial: aluminumFloat: cleat-dependent, floating cleats includedCleat Type: SPD-SLEntry / Release:Spindle Diameter:Pedal Wrench Type:Compatible Components:Weight: [pair] 387 gRecommended Use: road cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "Shimano Ultegra PD-6700 SL Pedal Not surprisingly, Shimano did not make any design changes to Ultegra pedals when they upgraded the PD-6620-S SPD-SL pedal to the PD-6700s. To make changes, they'd probably have to re-vamp their entire pedal line-up. Besides, the pedal is pretty good already. The only change they made was updating the finish so it fits in with the finish on all the other components in the new Ultegra group. As with the previous iteration, it's the same steel-spindled, aluminum bodied pedal with the composite cleat retention bar. The spring tension is adjustable. Each pedal runs on two sets of ball bearings. There is a steel plate atop the pedal so cleat rub will wear the plate without damaging the rest of the body. The pedal comes with the same SM-SH11 floating cleat (the one with the yellow wear tabs). The float is three degrees either way. Stack height is 13.7mmThe pedals come with a pair of cleats and mounting hardware.Product FeaturesMaterial: aluminumFloat: cleat-dependent, floating cleats includedCleat Type: SPD-SLEntry / Release:Spindle Diameter:Pedal Wrench Type:Compatible Components:Weight: [pair] 387 gRecommended Use: road cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BEhNqxmtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002J997EU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 160.0}}
{"item_id": "B002JB40JU", "title": "Body Champ BRM3671 Cardio Dual Trainer", "description": "The Cardio Dual Trainer is an ingenious two-in-one exercise machine that serves as both an elliptical trainer and a stationary bike. It features patented elliptical motion design technology and an advanced magnetic resistance system that provides quiet and smooth rides with no impact to your knees.A programmable LCD console features preset workout programs, heart-rate-driven programs, and user-customizable programs. The seat adjusts both vertically and horizontally for optimal comfort. Other highlights include a sturdy, oversized steel construction and a pass-through frame design. Made in China, the machine has a 14-inch stroke length and a weight capacity of 275 pounds.Manufacturer's WarrantyBody Flex Sports warrants your product for a period of one year for the frame and 90 days on all parts if the item is used for the intended purpose, properly maintained, and not used commercially. This warranty applies only to products purchased from Body Flex or from an authorized Body Flex reseller.Any alterations or incorrect assembly of the product will void this warranty. Proof of purchase must be presented for any warranty validation, with no exceptions. This warranty applies to the original purchaser only and is not transferable. This warranty does not cover abuse or defects caused during use, storage, or assembly.About Body Flex SportsEach and every one of Body Flex's products undergoes highly detailed and meticulous quality control. In addition, Body Flex extensively monitors the shipment and delivery of its products to the market and stores so that you can immediately experience the benefits and enjoyment that its products offer. Body Flex is committed to providing quality that you can depend and rely on.", "text": "Body Champ BRM3671 Cardio Dual Trainer The Cardio Dual Trainer is an ingenious two-in-one exercise machine that serves as both an elliptical trainer and a stationary bike. It features patented elliptical motion design technology and an advanced magnetic resistance system that provides quiet and smooth rides with no impact to your knees.A programmable LCD console features preset workout programs, heart-rate-driven programs, and user-customizable programs. The seat adjusts both vertically and horizontally for optimal comfort. Other highlights include a sturdy, oversized steel construction and a pass-through frame design. Made in China, the machine has a 14-inch stroke length and a weight capacity of 275 pounds.Manufacturer's WarrantyBody Flex Sports warrants your product for a period of one year for the frame and 90 days on all parts if the item is used for the intended purpose, properly maintained, and not used commercially. This warranty applies only to products purchased from Body Flex or from an authorized Body Flex reseller.Any alterations or incorrect assembly of the product will void this warranty. Proof of purchase must be presented for any warranty validation, with no exceptions. This warranty applies to the original purchaser only and is not transferable. This warranty does not cover abuse or defects caused during use, storage, or assembly.About Body Flex SportsEach and every one of Body Flex's products undergoes highly detailed and meticulous quality control. In addition, Body Flex extensively monitors the shipment and delivery of its products to the market and stores so that you can immediately experience the benefits and enjoyment that its products offer. Body Flex is committed to providing quality that you can depend and rely on.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h%2Bniijd9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002JB40JU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Max", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Elliptical Trainers"]], "price": 271.59}}
{"item_id": "B002JB40MC", "title": "Body Rider Fan Bike", "description": "This versatile Body Rider Fan Bike allows you to have an elliptical and upper body workout in one machine. The bike's ergonomic design engages your arms and upper body for a true full-body workout by targeting cardio and strength training. It also features an adjustable seat for multiple users and a fan wheel to keep you cool while working up a sweat.Key Features:Dual-action handlebars engage an upper and lower body workoutTension adjusts easily with the turn of a knobInnovative fan wheel emits a gentle, cooling breezeEasy-to-use digital display tracks time, speed, distance, and calories burnedStable steel frameAssembled Dimensions: 41.75 by 22 by 46.5 inchesAssembled Weight: 47.3 poundsWeight Capacity: 250 poundsManufacturer's WarrantyBody Flex Sports warrants your product for a period of one year for the frame and 90 days on all parts if the item is used for the intended purpose, properly maintained, and not used commercially. Any alterations or incorrect assembly of the product will void this warranty.", "text": "Body Rider Fan Bike This versatile Body Rider Fan Bike allows you to have an elliptical and upper body workout in one machine. The bike's ergonomic design engages your arms and upper body for a true full-body workout by targeting cardio and strength training. It also features an adjustable seat for multiple users and a fan wheel to keep you cool while working up a sweat.Key Features:Dual-action handlebars engage an upper and lower body workoutTension adjusts easily with the turn of a knobInnovative fan wheel emits a gentle, cooling breezeEasy-to-use digital display tracks time, speed, distance, and calories burnedStable steel frameAssembled Dimensions: 41.75 by 22 by 46.5 inchesAssembled Weight: 47.3 poundsWeight Capacity: 250 poundsManufacturer's WarrantyBody Flex Sports warrants your product for a period of one year for the frame and 90 days on all parts if the item is used for the intended purpose, properly maintained, and not used commercially. Any alterations or incorrect assembly of the product will void this warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l3eU6RyHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002JB40MC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Rider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B002JCW2CG", "title": "Birchwood Casey Aluminum Black Metal Finish, 3 oz.", "description": "Aluminum Black metal finish Restores scratched & marred areas Fast-acting liquid Easy to apply with no dimensional change No heating required! Use at room temperature Color varies from deep gray to black depending on metal's alloy Use on guns & many other metal products 3 oz.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Aluminum Black Metal Finish, 3 oz. Aluminum Black metal finish Restores scratched & marred areas Fast-acting liquid Easy to apply with no dimensional change No heating required! Use at room temperature Color varies from deep gray to black depending on metal's alloy Use on guns & many other metal products 3 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419OnQKdUyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002JCW2CG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.96}}
