{"item_id": "B002JT1DOM", "title": "Athena Brands Soladyne 7-Inch Mini Solar Lantern", "description": "Mini Solar Lantern is a great personal sized solar/dynamo lantern that will hang inside a tent, on a string line or sit on the picnic table in the evening. No fuel or batteries are required. Powered by Solar Energy, Dynamo Hand Crank, 120V Wall charger or 12V Car Charger. Features high & Low light levels, cell phone charging, compact size and weight for easy storage and travel. Compact ambient lighting solution for camping, hunting, patio, home and emergency prepardness.", "text": "Athena Brands Soladyne 7-Inch Mini Solar Lantern Mini Solar Lantern is a great personal sized solar/dynamo lantern that will hang inside a tent, on a string line or sit on the picnic table in the evening. No fuel or batteries are required. Powered by Solar Energy, Dynamo Hand Crank, 120V Wall charger or 12V Car Charger. Features high & Low light levels, cell phone charging, compact size and weight for easy storage and travel. Compact ambient lighting solution for camping, hunting, patio, home and emergency prepardness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411SsvJpbAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002JT1DOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Athena", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 23.65}}
{"item_id": "B002JVB44E", "title": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent Hands-Free Lotion, 1.5-Ounce (SRL-12HF)", "description": "3M Ultrathon insect repellent was developed for the military to provide long lasting, time released protection against mosquitoes for up to 12 hours. Repels Ticks that may carry West Nile Virus and also mosquitoes, biting flies, chiggers, gnats, fleas and deer flies. Splash & Sweat Resistant. Unique 3M Polymer Technologh optimized to enhance the efficacy of DEET and provide time controlled release of DEET. Stable in Freeze/Thaw conditions. 5 year guarantee. Consistantly rated as a top insect repellent by independent testing labs. Tested in the harshest conditions of South America. Works longer with less DEET. Competitive products are alcohol based and when the alcohol evaporates you lose your protection. Ultrathon uses the time released technology to provide a longer lasting repellent.", "text": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent Hands-Free Lotion, 1.5-Ounce (SRL-12HF) 3M Ultrathon insect repellent was developed for the military to provide long lasting, time released protection against mosquitoes for up to 12 hours. Repels Ticks that may carry West Nile Virus and also mosquitoes, biting flies, chiggers, gnats, fleas and deer flies. Splash & Sweat Resistant. Unique 3M Polymer Technologh optimized to enhance the efficacy of DEET and provide time controlled release of DEET. Stable in Freeze/Thaw conditions. 5 year guarantee. Consistantly rated as a top insect repellent by independent testing labs. Tested in the harshest conditions of South America. Works longer with less DEET. Competitive products are alcohol based and when the alcohol evaporates you lose your protection. Ultrathon uses the time released technology to provide a longer lasting repellent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cl44trOVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002JVB44E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 8.96}}
