{"item_id": "B002K7LC08", "title": "Bicycle Top Tube Mini Pannier/ Bike Top Tube Bag", "description": "Ibera's all weather top tube pannier bag hangs over a bike's top tube and includes a rain cover that will keep cell phones, cameras, snacks and keys dry in wet conditions. It has multiple compartments and attaches with buckle straps and Velcro. Reflective trim adds to nighttime safety. The 2.2 liter capacity holds all the cyclist's essentials right in front of them for easy access. External mesh pockets hold items for immediate access.SpecificationsMaterial:1680D NylonMount:Buckle and Velcro StrapsRain Cover:YesCapacity:2.2 LDimensions:7\" x 4.3\" x 1.6\"Weight:0.53 lbs", "text": "Bicycle Top Tube Mini Pannier/ Bike Top Tube Bag Ibera's all weather top tube pannier bag hangs over a bike's top tube and includes a rain cover that will keep cell phones, cameras, snacks and keys dry in wet conditions. It has multiple compartments and attaches with buckle straps and Velcro. Reflective trim adds to nighttime safety. The 2.2 liter capacity holds all the cyclist's essentials right in front of them for easy access. External mesh pockets hold items for immediate access.SpecificationsMaterial:1680D NylonMount:Buckle and Velcro StrapsRain Cover:YesCapacity:2.2 LDimensions:7\" x 4.3\" x 1.6\"Weight:0.53 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PlEEp%2Bv3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002K7LC08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B002K9J26W", "title": "True Utility Telepen Telescopic Pen", "description": "Take Note - A full length pen that is as small as your door key? Now that’s something to write home about! This beautifully crafted miniature stainless steel pen is only 50mm long when in the closed position. That is no bigger than a typical door key! With just a simple tug, it smoothly extends to a full 115mm to become an instantly useable full size quality pen. it will always be there - on your key ring, or attached to a bag or item of clothing, for you to use at a moments notice. Never be without a pen again! It comes complete with a total of 4 refills, all included in the price, and should you ever use all of these up, it will accept a bic type refill, simply cut to length. This really is an absolutely essential personal accessory, and also makes a great gift. Why would anyone ever be without one? Patent Pending.", "text": "True Utility Telepen Telescopic Pen Take Note - A full length pen that is as small as your door key? Now that’s something to write home about! This beautifully crafted miniature stainless steel pen is only 50mm long when in the closed position. That is no bigger than a typical door key! With just a simple tug, it smoothly extends to a full 115mm to become an instantly useable full size quality pen. it will always be there - on your key ring, or attached to a bag or item of clothing, for you to use at a moments notice. Never be without a pen again! It comes complete with a total of 4 refills, all included in the price, and should you ever use all of these up, it will accept a bic type refill, simply cut to length. This really is an absolutely essential personal accessory, and also makes a great gift. Why would anyone ever be without one? Patent Pending.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yuf9QhvIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002K9J26W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "True Utility", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Office Products", "Pens"]], "price": 14.0}}
{"item_id": "B002KA00KS", "title": "Safety Glasses Intruder Multi Color Clear Lens 12/box", "description": "S4110SMP by Pyramex - 12 Pairs - Variety of Colors Model: Intruder Intruder Features: Economical lightweight glass offers superior protections. Comes with six assorted temple colors: Red, Blue, Green, Purple, Orange, Black. Multi-pack includes two of each temple color with clear lenses. Exceeds the ANSI Z87.1 High Velocity Impact Standards. CAN/CSA Z94.3-07 Clear Lens: General purposes for indoor applications that require impact protection. Offers protection from excessive glare. Scratch-resistant lenses Provides 99% protection from harmful UV-A and UV-B rays. 100% polycarbonate lenses", "text": "Safety Glasses Intruder Multi Color Clear Lens 12/box S4110SMP by Pyramex - 12 Pairs - Variety of Colors Model: Intruder Intruder Features: Economical lightweight glass offers superior protections. Comes with six assorted temple colors: Red, Blue, Green, Purple, Orange, Black. Multi-pack includes two of each temple color with clear lenses. Exceeds the ANSI Z87.1 High Velocity Impact Standards. CAN/CSA Z94.3-07 Clear Lens: General purposes for indoor applications that require impact protection. Offers protection from excessive glare. Scratch-resistant lenses Provides 99% protection from harmful UV-A and UV-B rays. 100% polycarbonate lenses", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Lr6BlhP%2BL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KA00KS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 11.39}}
{"item_id": "B002KCZ61O", "title": "BSA Tactical Weapon 4 x 30mm Rifle Scope with Mil-Dot Reticle, Rings and AR/SKS Mount", "description": "The Tactical Weapon Series scopes are engineered specifically for use with tactical style firearms. These scopes are built tough to handle the most demanding tasks that one faces in tactical situations", "text": "BSA Tactical Weapon 4 x 30mm Rifle Scope with Mil-Dot Reticle, Rings and AR/SKS Mount The Tactical Weapon Series scopes are engineered specifically for use with tactical style firearms. These scopes are built tough to handle the most demanding tasks that one faces in tactical situations", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31luEBulx1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KCZ61O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSA Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 57.99}}
