{"item_id": "B002KE0LJ4", "title": "MTM Arrow Plus Case (36 Arrows, Black)", "description": "Made of luggage-grade plastic, with smooth, rounded corners, the Arrow-Plus case is uniquely styled for several uses. It has the capacity for 36+ arrows (up to 35\" total length), or 18 arrows and an average-sized quiver. In addition, this arrow case can hold two removable sights by their sight bars. It was designed for the older removal sight bars and may not be able to hold the more modern removal sights. Four large compartments are designed to hold wrist guards, tabs, stabilizers, scents, foot steps, range finders, etc. Or, you can use them to hold our Broadhead Accessory Box where the built-in Broadhead wrench will always be at your fingertips. Additional features are snap latches which resist impact resistant openings and double padlocks tabs for security.", "text": "MTM Arrow Plus Case (36 Arrows, Black) Made of luggage-grade plastic, with smooth, rounded corners, the Arrow-Plus case is uniquely styled for several uses. It has the capacity for 36+ arrows (up to 35\" total length), or 18 arrows and an average-sized quiver. In addition, this arrow case can hold two removable sights by their sight bars. It was designed for the older removal sight bars and may not be able to hold the more modern removal sights. Four large compartments are designed to hold wrist guards, tabs, stabilizers, scents, foot steps, range finders, etc. Or, you can use them to hold our Broadhead Accessory Box where the built-in Broadhead wrench will always be at your fingertips. Additional features are snap latches which resist impact resistant openings and double padlocks tabs for security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410BSR0aspL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KE0LJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 28.49}}
{"item_id": "B002KE0RZM", "title": "Bowjax Crossbow Kit", "description": "Bowjax Crossbow Kit quiets even the most powerful crossbows! Shhh! Give yourself the stealth advantage by using this Bowjax Crossbow Kit to make your crossbow quieter. Includes cross-bow tough Monster Jax, Crossbow Slip-Jax and Retention Spring Dampener Set. A must-have for crossbow hunters! State Model. Order Today! Bowjax Crossbow Kit", "text": "Bowjax Crossbow Kit Bowjax Crossbow Kit quiets even the most powerful crossbows! Shhh! Give yourself the stealth advantage by using this Bowjax Crossbow Kit to make your crossbow quieter. Includes cross-bow tough Monster Jax, Crossbow Slip-Jax and Retention Spring Dampener Set. A must-have for crossbow hunters! State Model. Order Today! Bowjax Crossbow Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BzRD9OmOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KE0RZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]]}}
