{"item_id": "B002KE89MU", "title": "Carbon Express Pro Bow Square", "description": "The Pro Bow Square has two different bow string settings and a wide 3-1/2\" scale working area. Strong lightweight non-corrosive anodized aluminum. Inches on one side, metric on reverse.", "text": "Carbon Express Pro Bow Square The Pro Bow Square has two different bow string settings and a wide 3-1/2\" scale working area. Strong lightweight non-corrosive anodized aluminum. Inches on one side, metric on reverse.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hmKzrqjrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KE89MU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carbon Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts"]], "price": 9.39}}
