{"item_id": "B002KENWZY", "title": "MTM Survivor Dry Box with O-Ring Seal", "description": "With a water-resistant O-Ring seal, built-in compass and signaling mirror, MTM Survivor boxes are designed for extreme environments. Water and weather resistant, they can be used to carry all types of personal and safety items such as medicines, first-aid kits, flashlights, flares, ammo, wallets, snacks, rain gear, maps, and more. Ruggedly constructed, the box provides dry storage for the outdoor enthusiast and is lanyard- and shoulder-strap-compatible.Features:Provides dry storage for the outdoor enthusiastRuggedly constructed; lanyard and shoulder-strap-capatibleBuilt-in compassSignaling mirrorWater resistant; floatsTongue and groove O-ring designTriple latched for best possible sealLockable; padlock tabbedRugged construction,Tall enough to hold any non-handled, Case-Gard 50 ammo boxSpecifications:Outside Dimensions: 9.8 by 6.8 by 4.8 inchesInside Dimensions: 8.2 by 5.0 by 4.4 inches", "text": "MTM Survivor Dry Box with O-Ring Seal With a water-resistant O-Ring seal, built-in compass and signaling mirror, MTM Survivor boxes are designed for extreme environments. Water and weather resistant, they can be used to carry all types of personal and safety items such as medicines, first-aid kits, flashlights, flares, ammo, wallets, snacks, rain gear, maps, and more. Ruggedly constructed, the box provides dry storage for the outdoor enthusiast and is lanyard- and shoulder-strap-compatible.Features:Provides dry storage for the outdoor enthusiastRuggedly constructed; lanyard and shoulder-strap-capatibleBuilt-in compassSignaling mirrorWater resistant; floatsTongue and groove O-ring designTriple latched for best possible sealLockable; padlock tabbedRugged construction,Tall enough to hold any non-handled, Case-Gard 50 ammo boxSpecifications:Outside Dimensions: 9.8 by 6.8 by 4.8 inchesInside Dimensions: 8.2 by 5.0 by 4.4 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411bGV8lVcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KENWZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 14.2}}
{"item_id": "B002KEPX2E", "title": "Hoppe's M-Pro 7 Copper Remover Solvent, 4-Ounce Bottle", "description": "Eliminates copper fouling without the use of ammonia or other toxic chemicals. Works even faster when used in conjunction with M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner.", "text": "Hoppe's M-Pro 7 Copper Remover Solvent, 4-Ounce Bottle Eliminates copper fouling without the use of ammonia or other toxic chemicals. Works even faster when used in conjunction with M-Pro 7 Gun Cleaner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MF3bo8CYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KEPX2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Pro 7", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.31}}
{"item_id": "B002KEQF4Y", "title": "Cammenga .223 Easyloader Rifle Magazine Loader", "description": "Cammenga's custom magazine loaders are used by fighting forces and sports shooters all over the world. The Cammenga Easyloader's innovative design facilitates quick and effortless loading of high capacity magazines without the frustration and fatigue of the traditional method of loading rounds one-by-one. The superior quality and design of the Cammenga Easloaders are made from impact proof nylon fiberglass to resist heat, cold, and corrosion. With models available for over 10 different caliber rounds, there is a Cammenga Easyloader for every popular firearm on the market.", "text": "Cammenga .223 Easyloader Rifle Magazine Loader Cammenga's custom magazine loaders are used by fighting forces and sports shooters all over the world. The Cammenga Easyloader's innovative design facilitates quick and effortless loading of high capacity magazines without the frustration and fatigue of the traditional method of loading rounds one-by-one. The superior quality and design of the Cammenga Easloaders are made from impact proof nylon fiberglass to resist heat, cold, and corrosion. With models available for over 10 different caliber rounds, there is a Cammenga Easyloader for every popular firearm on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vNTZJaQdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KEQF4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cammenga", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 17.8}}
{"item_id": "B002KEQFJE", "title": "Cammenga Easyloader For 7.62x39", "description": "Cammenga Easyloader for 7.62x39 Quick magazine loader. Used by fighting forces and sport shooters everywhere. Facilitates quick loading of high capacity magazines without fatigue.", "text": "Cammenga Easyloader For 7.62x39 Cammenga Easyloader for 7.62x39 Quick magazine loader. Used by fighting forces and sport shooters everywhere. Facilitates quick loading of high capacity magazines without fatigue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31foF756o%2BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KEQFJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cammenga", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 23.39}}
{"item_id": "B002KEUSWY", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Shell Deflector", "description": "The Intrafuse SKS Shell Deflector is built for years of shooting. Its universal design allows our deflector to interface with most receiver scope mounts on the market, including the Tri Rail Receiver Cover Mount. Once properly installed, it prevents damage to optics and loss of weapons zero by deflecting spent cartridge casings.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse SKS Shell Deflector The Intrafuse SKS Shell Deflector is built for years of shooting. Its universal design allows our deflector to interface with most receiver scope mounts on the market, including the Tri Rail Receiver Cover Mount. Once properly installed, it prevents damage to optics and loss of weapons zero by deflecting spent cartridge casings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lT5IHbbeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KEUSWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 9.47}}
{"item_id": "B002KFOKMC", "title": "Global Military Gear Shotgun Barrel Flashlight Mount Ring", "description": "The Shotgun Barrel Flashlight Mount from Global Military Gear is great for flashlights and lasers. Attaches tactical lights to shotgun barrels and may also be used to attach sling-swivels to some shotguns.", "text": "Global Military Gear Shotgun Barrel Flashlight Mount Ring The Shotgun Barrel Flashlight Mount from Global Military Gear is great for flashlights and lasers. Attaches tactical lights to shotgun barrels and may also be used to attach sling-swivels to some shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZMThYnvDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KFOKMC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 7.8}}
{"item_id": "B002KHN6VG", "title": "Power Balance Bracelet Black/White Letters size: MEDIUM", "description": "POWER BALANCE bracelets contain two Mylar Hologram's which are embedded with frequencies that react with your body's electro-magnetic field. When the static POWER BALANCE Hologram comes in contact with your body's energy field, it begins to resonate in accordance with each individual's biological energy system, creating a harmonic loop that optimizes your energy field, maintains maximum energy flow while it clears the pathways so the electro-chemical exchange functions like the well-tuned generator it was designed to be, resulting in immediate improved balance, increased core strength, greater flexibility, increased range of motion and overall well-being.", "text": "Power Balance Bracelet Black/White Letters size: MEDIUM POWER BALANCE bracelets contain two Mylar Hologram's which are embedded with frequencies that react with your body's electro-magnetic field. When the static POWER BALANCE Hologram comes in contact with your body's energy field, it begins to resonate in accordance with each individual's biological energy system, creating a harmonic loop that optimizes your energy field, maintains maximum energy flow while it clears the pathways so the electro-chemical exchange functions like the well-tuned generator it was designed to be, resulting in immediate improved balance, increased core strength, greater flexibility, increased range of motion and overall well-being.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MCGAj729L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KHN6VG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Power Balance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Wristbands"]], "price": 1.03}}
{"item_id": "B002KI8VY2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 2 Tactical Coyote Tan Holster", "description": "Made specifically to meet the demands of tactical operations, the Level 2 Tactical Holster gives you the benefits of a drop-leg configuration for ideal holster location. It also comes equipped with a flexible thigh platform that conforms to leg size, a Y-harness suspension system for even weight distribution, and quick-disconnect swivel buckles on belt mounts for superior maneuverability. Features: Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size; Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket; quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting; accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc.; rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding; passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; and a hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Serpa Level 2 Tactical Coyote Tan Holster Made specifically to meet the demands of tactical operations, the Level 2 Tactical Holster gives you the benefits of a drop-leg configuration for ideal holster location. It also comes equipped with a flexible thigh platform that conforms to leg size, a Y-harness suspension system for even weight distribution, and quick-disconnect swivel buckles on belt mounts for superior maneuverability. Features: Flexible thigh platform conforms to leg size; Y-harness suspension system distributes weight evenly, keeps holster vertical when kneeling, and allows use of pants pocket; quick-disconnect swivel buckles allow superior flexibility and quick holster mounting and dismounting; accessory mounting locations for pouches, knives, mag cases, etc.; rubberized leg straps eliminate sliding; passive retention detent adjustment screw and SERPA Auto Lock release; reinforces full master grip and superior draw technique; immediate retention and audible click upon re-holster for increased officer safety; full-length holster body protects rear sights; same drawing technique for undercover, tactical, and duty; and a hole in holster body for bungee retention if desired.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51krN7KQK-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KI8VY2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
