{"item_id": "B002KMK006", "title": "LockState LS-52EN Large Digital Wall Safe", "description": "The LS-52EN Wall Safe is the perfect hidden safe for any home or business. This safe is easily veiled behind mirrors, pictures or furniture. The inset door and knob allow it to sit flush against the wall, providing complete concealment. The LS-52EN retrofits easily between standard 16-Inch studs and its spacious interior provides enough room for your valuables! This secure model is perfect for do-it-yourself installation.", "text": "LockState LS-52EN Large Digital Wall Safe The LS-52EN Wall Safe is the perfect hidden safe for any home or business. This safe is easily veiled behind mirrors, pictures or furniture. The inset door and knob allow it to sit flush against the wall, providing complete concealment. The LS-52EN retrofits easily between standard 16-Inch studs and its spacious interior provides enough room for your valuables! This secure model is perfect for do-it-yourself installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W01NwWjRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KMK006.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LockState", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 142.66}}
