{"item_id": "B002KNLX10", "title": "Shimano CS-6700 Ultegra Bicycle Cassette (10-Speed)", "description": "We'll tell you straight up that while we appreciate the appeal of Dura-Ace cassettes, we understand why you would choose Ultegra for your bike. Smart racers routinely save money by going with Ultegra cassettes; the money saved can go for other weight shaving measures. On the plus side, Shimano Ultegra CS-6700 Cassettes are lighter than their 6600 brothers, doing a nice job of closing the gap on Dura-Ace. The tallest cogs are riveted onto an aluminum carrier for weight savings, and they're more gentle on aluminum cassette bodies. Shimano has improved their manufacturing quality; now they can make the ramps stronger because they can build to tighter tolerances. And the ramps themselves have been revised for faster shifting. The Ultegra CS-6700 Cassette has ten cogs and comes in the following ratios: 11-23, 11-25, 11-28, 12-23, 12-25. It comes with a nice alloy lock ring. The finish is Chrome (a color, not old-style chrome-plating). The 11-23 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23The 11-25 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,23,25The 11-28 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,24,28The 12-23 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,18,19,21,23The 12-25 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,25", "text": "Shimano CS-6700 Ultegra Bicycle Cassette (10-Speed) We'll tell you straight up that while we appreciate the appeal of Dura-Ace cassettes, we understand why you would choose Ultegra for your bike. Smart racers routinely save money by going with Ultegra cassettes; the money saved can go for other weight shaving measures. On the plus side, Shimano Ultegra CS-6700 Cassettes are lighter than their 6600 brothers, doing a nice job of closing the gap on Dura-Ace. The tallest cogs are riveted onto an aluminum carrier for weight savings, and they're more gentle on aluminum cassette bodies. Shimano has improved their manufacturing quality; now they can make the ramps stronger because they can build to tighter tolerances. And the ramps themselves have been revised for faster shifting. The Ultegra CS-6700 Cassette has ten cogs and comes in the following ratios: 11-23, 11-25, 11-28, 12-23, 12-25. It comes with a nice alloy lock ring. The finish is Chrome (a color, not old-style chrome-plating). The 11-23 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23The 11-25 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,23,25The 11-28 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,24,28The 12-23 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,18,19,21,23The 12-25 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,25", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t-35KcwYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KNLX10.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KSVXGU", "title": "Bird B Gone MMRTH1 Hawk Decoy", "description": "The Bird B Gone Hawk Decoy is the first Red Tailed Hawk Decoy available in today's market and is used the same way as owl decoys to scare birds from open areas. Mock predator eye and shiny reflective surface work together appealing to a bird's sight and sense of danger. Red Tailed Hawks are known for hunting during the day, while most owl species hunt at night when birds are roosting. This makes the hawk a more identifiable predator to birds. When birds see the decoy, they will want to avoid the area! The Hawk Decoy is ideal for protecting open outdoor spaces such as gardens, backyards, balconies/patios, boats, overhangs, under eaves, and rooftops. The life like painted features and menacing look add to the overall effectiveness. The Hawk Decoy can be hung from rope or twine, weighted down, or simply placed in affected areas. The Bird B Gone Hawk Decoy is made of a durable plastic, designed for outdoor use, and can be mounted on patio covers, rooftops, boat canvases, and other flat surfaces. Open bottom tab of Hawk Decoy and fill with sand (not included) to weight. Hang the Hawk Decoy using the convenient loop at the top of the decoy or simply place the decoy in the affected area. It can be helpful to move the position of your hawk about once a week. For over 20-years, Bird B Gone, Inc. has been an industry leader in commercial and residential bird control. Bird B Gone, Inc. has a devoted team of Bird Control Engineers with over 80 years of combined experience to help in all aspects of bird control.", "text": "Bird B Gone MMRTH1 Hawk Decoy The Bird B Gone Hawk Decoy is the first Red Tailed Hawk Decoy available in today's market and is used the same way as owl decoys to scare birds from open areas. Mock predator eye and shiny reflective surface work together appealing to a bird's sight and sense of danger. Red Tailed Hawks are known for hunting during the day, while most owl species hunt at night when birds are roosting. This makes the hawk a more identifiable predator to birds. When birds see the decoy, they will want to avoid the area! The Hawk Decoy is ideal for protecting open outdoor spaces such as gardens, backyards, balconies/patios, boats, overhangs, under eaves, and rooftops. The life like painted features and menacing look add to the overall effectiveness. The Hawk Decoy can be hung from rope or twine, weighted down, or simply placed in affected areas. The Bird B Gone Hawk Decoy is made of a durable plastic, designed for outdoor use, and can be mounted on patio covers, rooftops, boat canvases, and other flat surfaces. Open bottom tab of Hawk Decoy and fill with sand (not included) to weight. Hang the Hawk Decoy using the convenient loop at the top of the decoy or simply place the decoy in the affected area. It can be helpful to move the position of your hawk about once a week. For over 20-years, Bird B Gone, Inc. has been an industry leader in commercial and residential bird control. Bird B Gone, Inc. has a devoted team of Bird Control Engineers with over 80 years of combined experience to help in all aspects of bird control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417OCz6UpZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KSVXGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bird B Gone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]], "price": 17.71}}
{"item_id": "B002KSZB0Y", "title": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Tactical Rifle Assault Case", "description": "More than super tough, our bags and cases are loaded with storage options you can't get from folks that don't understand the needs of avid shooters and law enforcement professionals. Protect just about any rifle or shotgun in this ruggedly built tactical case. Stow extra gear in handy, exterior pouches, plus you can stow your favorite pistol in its own hidden, interior pocket. Features three exterior pockets for gear. Made of tough 600D polyester. Interior handgun pocket. 2-inch foam padding for added protection. Handy, adjustable shoulder strap.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Tactical Rifle Assault Case More than super tough, our bags and cases are loaded with storage options you can't get from folks that don't understand the needs of avid shooters and law enforcement professionals. Protect just about any rifle or shotgun in this ruggedly built tactical case. Stow extra gear in handy, exterior pouches, plus you can stow your favorite pistol in its own hidden, interior pocket. Features three exterior pockets for gear. Made of tough 600D polyester. Interior handgun pocket. 2-inch foam padding for added protection. Handy, adjustable shoulder strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JnxzGkBiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KSZB0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT3XD0", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Cycling Short,Black,Small", "description": "Featuring Elite-Transfer (Ultrasensor) fabric for cool, dry comfort. The Elite short is a classic performance short coveted by cyclists around the world. Reflective elements for low-light visibility.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Cycling Short,Black,Small Featuring Elite-Transfer (Ultrasensor) fabric for cool, dry comfort. The Elite short is a classic performance short coveted by cyclists around the world. Reflective elements for low-light visibility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lXXMZBPnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT3XD0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT3XJE", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Attack Cycling Short", "description": "Among Pearl Izumi's most popular cycling shorts, the Attack provide function and durability with features found only in high-end shorts. These shorts are ergonomically designed with eight panels and crafted of a blend of nylon and spandex with superior breathability and moisture-wicking properties, plus UPF 50+ sun protection. Silicone grippers at the leg hems hold the shorts in position while a seamless, male-specific 3D Race chamois with Pressure Relief Technology and contoured padding protects key areas and eliminates friction, making for ultimate comfort on long stretches in the saddle. The Attack also features reflective elements for low-light visibility and an inseam of 9.25 inches.Features:SELECT Transfer fabric blends nylon and spandex for excellent breathability, moisture wicking, and cooling propertiesFabric incorporates quick-drying hydrophobic yarnsAnatomic 8-panel design eliminates the inseam and potential pressure pointsMale-specific, seamless 3D Race chamois with Pressure Relief Technology reduces pressure points and friction; wicks moistureChamois features natural silver fibers that help control odors while providing thermal regulationFusion technology bonds the dual-density padding to eliminate seams and thereby increase comfortSilicone grippers at leg hems hold the shorts in positionFabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection, shielding skin from harmful ultraviolet raysSpecifications:Type: Men's Cycling ShortsBest Use: Road cyclingFabric: 86 percent nylon, 14 percent spandexSun Protection: UPF 50+Pad Type: 3D Race chamois; male-specificPanel Construction: 8 panelInseam: 9.25 inches (size medium)", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Attack Cycling Short Among Pearl Izumi's most popular cycling shorts, the Attack provide function and durability with features found only in high-end shorts. These shorts are ergonomically designed with eight panels and crafted of a blend of nylon and spandex with superior breathability and moisture-wicking properties, plus UPF 50+ sun protection. Silicone grippers at the leg hems hold the shorts in position while a seamless, male-specific 3D Race chamois with Pressure Relief Technology and contoured padding protects key areas and eliminates friction, making for ultimate comfort on long stretches in the saddle. The Attack also features reflective elements for low-light visibility and an inseam of 9.25 inches.Features:SELECT Transfer fabric blends nylon and spandex for excellent breathability, moisture wicking, and cooling propertiesFabric incorporates quick-drying hydrophobic yarnsAnatomic 8-panel design eliminates the inseam and potential pressure pointsMale-specific, seamless 3D Race chamois with Pressure Relief Technology reduces pressure points and friction; wicks moistureChamois features natural silver fibers that help control odors while providing thermal regulationFusion technology bonds the dual-density padding to eliminate seams and thereby increase comfortSilicone grippers at leg hems hold the shorts in positionFabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection, shielding skin from harmful ultraviolet raysSpecifications:Type: Men's Cycling ShortsBest Use: Road cyclingFabric: 86 percent nylon, 14 percent spandexSun Protection: UPF 50+Pad Type: 3D Race chamois; male-specificPanel Construction: 8 panelInseam: 9.25 inches (size medium)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415KfdcbtmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT3XJE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT3XQC", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Cycling Short", "description": "A perennial cycling favorite, the highly popular Quest Cycling Short delivers value, fit, durability and a plush, four-way stretch Tour 3D chamois for a comfortable ride. The Quest features a six-panel anatomic design, silicone leg grippers, reflective elements for low-light visibility, and soft Select Transfer fabric with UPF 50+ sun protection and superior moisture-wicking properties to keep you cool and dry. Pressure Relief Technology in the gender-specific chamois reduces pressure points via differentiated levels of padding while effectively wicking moisture off skin. A 6-panel anatomic design offers superior, chafe-free comfort. Features and Specifications: Select Transfer fabric sets the benchmark for moisture transfer and four-way performance stretch 6-panel anatomic design for superior, chafe-free comfort Comfortable silicone leg grippers keep shorts in place Tour 3D Chamois is male-specific and non-chafing with padding in key areas and moisture-wicking Reflective elements for low-light visibility Fabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection Specifications: Best Use: Road cycling Type: Men's cycling short Fabric: 86 percent nylon, 14 percent spandex Inseam: 9 inches (size medium)", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Cycling Short A perennial cycling favorite, the highly popular Quest Cycling Short delivers value, fit, durability and a plush, four-way stretch Tour 3D chamois for a comfortable ride. The Quest features a six-panel anatomic design, silicone leg grippers, reflective elements for low-light visibility, and soft Select Transfer fabric with UPF 50+ sun protection and superior moisture-wicking properties to keep you cool and dry. Pressure Relief Technology in the gender-specific chamois reduces pressure points via differentiated levels of padding while effectively wicking moisture off skin. A 6-panel anatomic design offers superior, chafe-free comfort. Features and Specifications: Select Transfer fabric sets the benchmark for moisture transfer and four-way performance stretch 6-panel anatomic design for superior, chafe-free comfort Comfortable silicone leg grippers keep shorts in place Tour 3D Chamois is male-specific and non-chafing with padding in key areas and moisture-wicking Reflective elements for low-light visibility Fabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection Specifications: Best Use: Road cycling Type: Men's cycling short Fabric: 86 percent nylon, 14 percent spandex Inseam: 9 inches (size medium)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ty3Sn%2BU8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT3XQC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT3XSU", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Cycling Bib Short,Black,X-Large", "description": "target group:menGender:menLeg end:siliconeSafety features:reflecting elementsColour:blackMaterial:86% Polyamid, 14% spandexFurther features 1:Select wicking fabricUses:raceLeg length:23 cm inner leg lengthPadding/Padded insert:Tour 3 DTracks:6-track trim", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Quest Cycling Bib Short,Black,X-Large target group:menGender:menLeg end:siliconeSafety features:reflecting elementsColour:blackMaterial:86% Polyamid, 14% spandexFurther features 1:Select wicking fabricUses:raceLeg length:23 cm inner leg lengthPadding/Padded insert:Tour 3 DTracks:6-track trim", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315SfZuahML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT3XSU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT41WW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Jersey", "description": "Soft and lightweight, the Pearl Izumi Quest jersey is quick drying and highly breathable with superior moisture transfer properties for dependable performance and thermal regulation during long training rides. The Ultra Sensor moisture-wicking fabric moves sweat away from your skin and to the outer surface of the fabric for quick evaporation. Features include three generous mesh rear pockets to hold riding essentials, three quarter-length hidden front zippers for maximum temperature control, an elasticized hem, and a semi-form comfort fit.Features:UltraSensor moisture-transfer fabric is wicking and breathable to regulate body temperatureThree generous mesh rear pockets hold riding essentialsThree-quarter-length hidden front zipper delivers maximum temperature controlReflective elements for low-light visibilityElasticized hemSemi-form comfort fitSpecifications:Fabric: PolyesterPockets: 3Sleeve Length: LongZipper Length: Partial; 13.5 inchesBest Use: CyclingType: Men's", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Jersey Soft and lightweight, the Pearl Izumi Quest jersey is quick drying and highly breathable with superior moisture transfer properties for dependable performance and thermal regulation during long training rides. The Ultra Sensor moisture-wicking fabric moves sweat away from your skin and to the outer surface of the fabric for quick evaporation. Features include three generous mesh rear pockets to hold riding essentials, three quarter-length hidden front zippers for maximum temperature control, an elasticized hem, and a semi-form comfort fit.Features:UltraSensor moisture-transfer fabric is wicking and breathable to regulate body temperatureThree generous mesh rear pockets hold riding essentialsThree-quarter-length hidden front zipper delivers maximum temperature controlReflective elements for low-light visibilityElasticized hemSemi-form comfort fitSpecifications:Fabric: PolyesterPockets: 3Sleeve Length: LongZipper Length: Partial; 13.5 inchesBest Use: CyclingType: Men's", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EACAA61nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT41WW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT42OO", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Impact Jersey", "description": "A relaxed fit jersey that can adapt to many different personas while providing cool, dry comfort and UPF 40+ protection.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Impact Jersey A relaxed fit jersey that can adapt to many different personas while providing cool, dry comfort and UPF 40+ protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ncJT0PqmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT42OO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KT42ZS", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite LTD Jersey", "description": "Team inspired construction and performance fabrics are combined with original Pearl Izumi sublimated graphics and Direct-Vent side panels for style, performance and comfort.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite LTD Jersey Team inspired construction and performance fabrics are combined with original Pearl Izumi sublimated graphics and Direct-Vent side panels for style, performance and comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DfEsmfMXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KT42ZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KV1MJU", "title": "Marcy Recumbent Mag Cycle", "description": "Getting fit at home has never been easier with the Marcy magnetic recumbent exercise bike. The cycle offers eight levels of preset resistance, with an easy-to-adjust tension-tightening knob helping you match the workout to your fitness level. It's also easy to track your workout progress thanks to the large console display, which tracks your speed, distance, time, and calories burned. Best of all, the bike is comfortable and supportive, with a recumbent step-through frame for easy mounting and dismounting and an adjustable seat that accommodates different body types and sizes. The recumbent frame is ideal for people who find traditional upright bikes uncomfortable, or for folks who are recovering from injury.Other features include counterbalanced pedals with adjustable foot straps, a powder-coated finish, and transport wheels for easy mobility. The bike measures 55 by 40 by 25 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 66 pounds.", "text": "Marcy Recumbent Mag Cycle Getting fit at home has never been easier with the Marcy magnetic recumbent exercise bike. The cycle offers eight levels of preset resistance, with an easy-to-adjust tension-tightening knob helping you match the workout to your fitness level. It's also easy to track your workout progress thanks to the large console display, which tracks your speed, distance, time, and calories burned. Best of all, the bike is comfortable and supportive, with a recumbent step-through frame for easy mounting and dismounting and an adjustable seat that accommodates different body types and sizes. The recumbent frame is ideal for people who find traditional upright bikes uncomfortable, or for folks who are recovering from injury.Other features include counterbalanced pedals with adjustable foot straps, a powder-coated finish, and transport wheels for easy mobility. The bike measures 55 by 40 by 25 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 66 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kUZiULO-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KV1MJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marcy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 131.98}}
{"item_id": "B002KV3518", "title": "Coghlan's Flint Striker", "description": "This ferro-cerrium fire-starting tool lasts for thousands of strikes! Pushing the striker provided down the rod emits sparks to light combustibles.", "text": "Coghlan's Flint Striker This ferro-cerrium fire-starting tool lasts for thousands of strikes! Pushing the striker provided down the rod emits sparks to light combustibles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h-UC4iLuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KV3518.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 4.94}}
{"item_id": "B002KV383S", "title": "Marcy Upright Mag Cycle", "description": "Getting fit at home has never been easier with the Marcy magnetic upright exercise bike. The cycle offers a smooth and quiet magnetic resistance system, with eight levels of preset resistance to accommodate several fitness levels. It's also easy to track your workout progress thanks to the large console display, which tracks your speed, distance, time, and calories burned. And to ensure maximum comfort while you ride, the bike includes a unique seat that's height adjustable to match different body types and sizes. Other features include foam padded grips, a durable powder-coated finish, counterbalanced pedals with adjustable foot straps, and transport wheels for easy mobility. The upright bike measures 31.5 by 48.75 by 18 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 43 pounds.", "text": "Marcy Upright Mag Cycle Getting fit at home has never been easier with the Marcy magnetic upright exercise bike. The cycle offers a smooth and quiet magnetic resistance system, with eight levels of preset resistance to accommodate several fitness levels. It's also easy to track your workout progress thanks to the large console display, which tracks your speed, distance, time, and calories burned. And to ensure maximum comfort while you ride, the bike includes a unique seat that's height adjustable to match different body types and sizes. Other features include foam padded grips, a durable powder-coated finish, counterbalanced pedals with adjustable foot straps, and transport wheels for easy mobility. The upright bike measures 31.5 by 48.75 by 18 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 43 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZCrVY-hfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KV383S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marcy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B002KV79YC", "title": "Coghlan's 2 Egg Holder", "description": "Designed for short trips into the outdoors, the egg holder is a compact and durable storage solution for two eggs. Carrier is made from virtually unbreakable plastic that won't crush.", "text": "Coghlan's 2 Egg Holder Designed for short trips into the outdoors, the egg holder is a compact and durable storage solution for two eggs. Carrier is made from virtually unbreakable plastic that won't crush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uTCUZ3EXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KV79YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 2.0}}
{"item_id": "B002KV9PNA", "title": "Lifeline 29-Piece Ultralight Survival Kit", "description": "29 Piece Kit Includes: Weatherproof Carry Case, Survival Guide, 10' Emergency Cord, Map Compass, Emergency Whistle, Survival Blanket, 3 Safety Pins, 36\" Roll Duct Tape, 18\"x12\" Sheet Aluminum Foil, 8' Snare Wire, Box Waterproof Matches, 4 Fishing Hooks, 4 Fishing Sinker Weights, 50' 10lb Fishing Line, Surgical Blade, Reusable Zipper-Lock Bag, 5 Wound Closure Strips,", "text": "Lifeline 29-Piece Ultralight Survival Kit 29 Piece Kit Includes: Weatherproof Carry Case, Survival Guide, 10' Emergency Cord, Map Compass, Emergency Whistle, Survival Blanket, 3 Safety Pins, 36\" Roll Duct Tape, 18\"x12\" Sheet Aluminum Foil, 8' Snare Wire, Box Waterproof Matches, 4 Fishing Hooks, 4 Fishing Sinker Weights, 50' 10lb Fishing Line, Surgical Blade, Reusable Zipper-Lock Bag, 5 Wound Closure Strips,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kRMlgpQ%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KV9PNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifeline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 12.99}}
