{"item_id": "B002KVOVPC", "title": "Avenir Standard U-Lock and Cable Lock Duo", "description": "Lock your bike and its components securely with the Standard U-Lock and Cable Combo from Avenir. This affordable combo provides both the beefed up security of Avenir's Standard U-Lock with shackle with pick/pull/drill-resistant cylinder, and the flexibility of the four-foot, coated steel cable. The 4.5 by 9-inch U-Lock is built to last with a rotating dust cover to protect the cylinder and a protective covering. The cable measures 10-millimeters in diameter and offers four feet to wrap around larger stationary objects, lock multiple bikes together, and/or secure quick-release components to your bike. The combo comes complete with two safety keys and a quick-release mounting bracket included.What's in the Box?Standard U-Lock, Four-Foot Cable, two safety keys, Mounting bracket>", "text": "Avenir Standard U-Lock and Cable Lock Duo Lock your bike and its components securely with the Standard U-Lock and Cable Combo from Avenir. This affordable combo provides both the beefed up security of Avenir's Standard U-Lock with shackle with pick/pull/drill-resistant cylinder, and the flexibility of the four-foot, coated steel cable. The 4.5 by 9-inch U-Lock is built to last with a rotating dust cover to protect the cylinder and a protective covering. The cable measures 10-millimeters in diameter and offers four feet to wrap around larger stationary objects, lock multiple bikes together, and/or secure quick-release components to your bike. The combo comes complete with two safety keys and a quick-release mounting bracket included.What's in the Box?Standard U-Lock, Four-Foot Cable, two safety keys, Mounting bracket>", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41acnwlCnTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KVOVPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 23.99}}
