{"item_id": "B002KW3HQ0", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Glove", "description": "Comfort Bridge padding and an Easy-Off glove removal tab combine to deliver benchmark cycling glove performance and value. Clarino synthetic leather is soft and durable Comfort Bridge Gel-Foam padding relieves pressure on Ulnar and Median nerves for riding comfort Easy-off glove removal tab Direct-vent mesh ventilates while providing UPF 40+ sun protection Soft low-profile wiping surface on thumb Velcro closure", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Glove Comfort Bridge padding and an Easy-Off glove removal tab combine to deliver benchmark cycling glove performance and value. Clarino synthetic leather is soft and durable Comfort Bridge Gel-Foam padding relieves pressure on Ulnar and Median nerves for riding comfort Easy-off glove removal tab Direct-vent mesh ventilates while providing UPF 40+ sun protection Soft low-profile wiping surface on thumb Velcro closure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OF3bpN4DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KW3HQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KW3I0A", "title": "Pearl Izumi Sun Sleeve Shirt,White,Small", "description": "This lightweight and cool Sun Sleeve provides protection against the sun's ultraviolet rays. UPF 50+ sun protection on top Direct-Vent mesh on bottom Anatomic right and left specific fits", "text": "Pearl Izumi Sun Sleeve Shirt,White,Small This lightweight and cool Sun Sleeve provides protection against the sun's ultraviolet rays. UPF 50+ sun protection on top Direct-Vent mesh on bottom Anatomic right and left specific fits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L4tt-TrVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KW3I0A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Armwarmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002KW3I3C", "title": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Lite Arm Warmer", "description": "Lightweight and packable, the seamless Pearl Izumi Thermal Lite arm warmer is perfect for cool days when ThermaFleece is too warm.Features:ELITE Thermal Lite fabric provides superior insulation in mild conditionsSeamless knit construction stretches to fitAvailable in SM, MD, and LG only79% Nylon/18% Olefin/3% SpandexMachine washable (no fabric softeners)", "text": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Lite Arm Warmer Lightweight and packable, the seamless Pearl Izumi Thermal Lite arm warmer is perfect for cool days when ThermaFleece is too warm.Features:ELITE Thermal Lite fabric provides superior insulation in mild conditionsSeamless knit construction stretches to fitAvailable in SM, MD, and LG only79% Nylon/18% Olefin/3% SpandexMachine washable (no fabric softeners)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41emZ7i2SlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002KW3I3C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Armwarmers"]]}}
