{"item_id": "B002LH0EBA", "title": "2 pcs Tenergy 8.4V 1600mAh NiMH Flat Battery Packs for Airsoft Guns", "description": "Features and Benefits Product 8.4V 1600mAh NiMH Flat Battery Pack Make Made of 2/3A x 7 cells Connector Mini Tamiya FeMale connector assembled with 16 G wire Fit Models Most Airsoft Mini AK series, upgraded and/or modified AEG's Feature Rapidly charge ande had a long life cycle span Weight 5.3 Oz Dimensions 104 mm (Length);35 mm (Width); 18.5mm (Height) Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "text": "2 pcs Tenergy 8.4V 1600mAh NiMH Flat Battery Packs for Airsoft Guns Features and Benefits Product 8.4V 1600mAh NiMH Flat Battery Pack Make Made of 2/3A x 7 cells Connector Mini Tamiya FeMale connector assembled with 16 G wire Fit Models Most Airsoft Mini AK series, upgraded and/or modified AEG's Feature Rapidly charge ande had a long life cycle span Weight 5.3 Oz Dimensions 104 mm (Length);35 mm (Width); 18.5mm (Height) Recommended Charger Smart Universal Battery Pack Charger Use attention Set charging current to 0.9A when charging with the above charger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413AmW8rxJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002LH0EBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tenergy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Batteries"]], "price": 25.0}}
