{"item_id": "B002LTLXB8", "title": "Bulldog X-Large Deluxe Black Range Bag with Pistol Rug", "description": "Extra Large Deluxe Black Range Bag with Pistol Rug * Heavy-duty, durable Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Extra large main compartment with three hidden pockets * Pistol Rug included for extra protection * Three outer pockets for extra storage * Adjustable shoulder strap with deluxe buckle and hardware * Deluxe padding and quality for extra protection * 15\" x 8\" x 10\"", "text": "Bulldog X-Large Deluxe Black Range Bag with Pistol Rug Extra Large Deluxe Black Range Bag with Pistol Rug * Heavy-duty, durable Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Extra large main compartment with three hidden pockets * Pistol Rug included for extra protection * Three outer pockets for extra storage * Adjustable shoulder strap with deluxe buckle and hardware * Deluxe padding and quality for extra protection * 15\" x 8\" x 10\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VV5OJ%2BQlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002LTLXB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 49.93}}
