{"item_id": "B002LY8GYA", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Pink Fun Kit Boxed (Pink/Black, 35.4 Inch)", "description": "From the pages of comic books to the big screen, the Daisy Red Ryder is an all-time classic. With its solid wood stock and forearm and lariat ring with a leather thong, the most popular BB gun in the world remains faithful to its original design. This 650 shot carbine is the spittin’ image of the one you cherished growing up and its legendary status continues to grow.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Pink Fun Kit Boxed (Pink/Black, 35.4 Inch) From the pages of comic books to the big screen, the Daisy Red Ryder is an all-time classic. With its solid wood stock and forearm and lariat ring with a leather thong, the most popular BB gun in the world remains faithful to its original design. This 650 shot carbine is the spittin’ image of the one you cherished growing up and its legendary status continues to grow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JJODBPQIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002LY8GYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 42.64}}
