{"item_id": "B002M0EDG8", "title": "Vapur 0.5 Litres Anti-Bottle", "description": "The Vapur Anti-Bottle is a foldable, reusable water bottle designed for convenient on-the-go use. Unlike traditional rigid bottles, the Anti-Bottle is flexible. It stands upright when full and can be rolled, folded or flattened when empty - easily fitting into pockets, purses or packs.", "text": "Vapur 0.5 Litres Anti-Bottle The Vapur Anti-Bottle is a foldable, reusable water bottle designed for convenient on-the-go use. Unlike traditional rigid bottles, the Anti-Bottle is flexible. It stands upright when full and can be rolled, folded or flattened when empty - easily fitting into pockets, purses or packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xP-VbKuuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M0EDG8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vapur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B002M0MF4K", "title": "Mosin nagant M44 Slack Spring", "description": "Get rid of that loose feel associated with most Mosin Nagants. Simple installation. Gives much improved pull. Will work on all Mosin Nagants including the Finnish Models .", "text": "Mosin nagant M44 Slack Spring Get rid of that loose feel associated with most Mosin Nagants. Simple installation. Gives much improved pull. Will work on all Mosin Nagants including the Finnish Models .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UXzSmvyXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M0MF4K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002M2Y5IC", "title": "Stack-On SPAPR-4 4-Position Pistol Rack", "description": "Stack-On's SPAPR-4 4 Position Pistol Rack is a uniquely designed pistol rack that allows for quick and easy access of handguns. Multiple units of the SPAPR-4 can be stacked on top of each other to accommodate more handguns. There are 2 steel stacking supports that are included with each pistol rack. This rack is made of tough ABS materials with snap-fit construction. Works great inside of safes and security cabinets.", "text": "Stack-On SPAPR-4 4-Position Pistol Rack Stack-On's SPAPR-4 4 Position Pistol Rack is a uniquely designed pistol rack that allows for quick and easy access of handguns. Multiple units of the SPAPR-4 can be stacked on top of each other to accommodate more handguns. There are 2 steel stacking supports that are included with each pistol rack. This rack is made of tough ABS materials with snap-fit construction. Works great inside of safes and security cabinets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GZ8wUfAHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M2Y5IC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B002M3785I", "title": "Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D", "description": "FEATURES of the Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D Innovative, portable training device Two independent units, each with flexible, single point suspension; allow rotation of joints for injury prevention CAD/CAM designed master for perfect symmetry Fine texture Includes comprehensive instructions and training guide Sold in sets of two SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D Diameter: 7.25 x 5.75 x 2.25\" / 184 x 146 x 57 mm Weight: Set of Two: 4 lbs 2 oz / 1.9 kg ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D FEATURES of the Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D Innovative, portable training device Two independent units, each with flexible, single point suspension; allow rotation of joints for injury prevention CAD/CAM designed master for perfect symmetry Fine texture Includes comprehensive instructions and training guide Sold in sets of two SPECIFICATIONS of the Metolius Rock Rings CNC 3D Diameter: 7.25 x 5.75 x 2.25\" / 184 x 146 x 57 mm Weight: Set of Two: 4 lbs 2 oz / 1.9 kg ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G0RkNh1tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M3785I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Metolius", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B002M3JB8A", "title": "TYR Ergo Swim Clip", "description": "The newest in low profile swim clip technology. This small nose clip comes in four stylish colors that make a bold statement in the water. Hypo-allergenic TPR nose pad and polyurethane frame. Ideal for training with front mount snorkels.", "text": "TYR Ergo Swim Clip The newest in low profile swim clip technology. This small nose clip comes in four stylish colors that make a bold statement in the water. Hypo-allergenic TPR nose pad and polyurethane frame. Ideal for training with front mount snorkels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eWwJ9Ww9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M3JB8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Nose Clips"]], "price": 2.95}}
{"item_id": "B002M3JCC0", "title": "TYR Big Mesh Mummy Gear Bag", "description": "All of your swim gear is contained in the redefined Big Mesh Mummy Gear Bag from TYR. Larger mesh panels let your gear dry quickly, front zip pocket for cap & goggles, drawstring side pocket for waterbottle, large main compartment with drawstring enclosure, backpack straps & identification patch make this gear bag an essential for every swimmer! Available in 3 colors.", "text": "TYR Big Mesh Mummy Gear Bag All of your swim gear is contained in the redefined Big Mesh Mummy Gear Bag from TYR. Larger mesh panels let your gear dry quickly, front zip pocket for cap & goggles, drawstring side pocket for waterbottle, large main compartment with drawstring enclosure, backpack straps & identification patch make this gear bag an essential for every swimmer! Available in 3 colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gHh-2EvqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M3JCC0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002M9YG3Y", "title": "Jagwire Hyper DIY Derailleur Cable Kit", "description": "Jagwire Hyper Mountain/Road Derailleur Cable & Housing Sets Kits include Jagwire's L3 fully lubricated liner technology Slick stainless wires are double-ended Campy & Shimano/", "text": "Jagwire Hyper DIY Derailleur Cable Kit Jagwire Hyper Mountain/Road Derailleur Cable & Housing Sets Kits include Jagwire's L3 fully lubricated liner technology Slick stainless wires are double-ended Campy & Shimano/", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rOhukFDpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002M9YG3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jagwire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Bike Brake Cables & Housing"]], "price": 18.72}}
{"item_id": "B002MA7XXS", "title": "SKLZ Shoot-Around - Basketball Ball Return Trainer", "description": "The SKLZ Shoot-Around ball return enables solo repetitive shooting training, helping basketball players lock into a solid stroke and develop a rhythm, without the help of a rebounder. You can hit shots from around the court, and have the ball returned right back to you rapidly and consistently with the Shoot-Around's rotating 180-degree ball return, spending more time working on your game, and less time retrieving balls. The set includes four-piece Shoot-Around ball return chute, attachment nuts and bolts, and rotating insert ring with four rim straps and hooks.FeaturesEasily attaches to any standard rim with four snap-on strapsProvides repetitive shooting training to help groove a solid stroke180-degree rotation without having to remove from the rimChute design returns balls rapidly and consistentlyNon-distracting monochromatic color keeps you focused on rimSimple angle adjustment lets you rotate without moving or detaching strapsIdeal for height adjustable backboardWarrantySKLZ products include a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About SKLZThe flagship brand of Pro Performance Sports, LLC, SKLZ started out creating a popular baseball swing trainer, the Hit-A-Way. Starting with a complete line of baseball and softball trainers, SKLZ has added basketball, football, tennis, soccer, hockey, lacrosse, and training products.SKLZ training equipment is endorsed and used by many of the top professional players across a variety of sports, including:Erica BlasbergReggie JacksonDerek JeterJoe MauerPaul MolitorJoe MontanaLeah O'Brien-AmicoAlbert PujolsAndy RoddickMaria SharapovaRick Smith", "text": "SKLZ Shoot-Around - Basketball Ball Return Trainer The SKLZ Shoot-Around ball return enables solo repetitive shooting training, helping basketball players lock into a solid stroke and develop a rhythm, without the help of a rebounder. You can hit shots from around the court, and have the ball returned right back to you rapidly and consistently with the Shoot-Around's rotating 180-degree ball return, spending more time working on your game, and less time retrieving balls. The set includes four-piece Shoot-Around ball return chute, attachment nuts and bolts, and rotating insert ring with four rim straps and hooks.FeaturesEasily attaches to any standard rim with four snap-on strapsProvides repetitive shooting training to help groove a solid stroke180-degree rotation without having to remove from the rimChute design returns balls rapidly and consistentlyNon-distracting monochromatic color keeps you focused on rimSimple angle adjustment lets you rotate without moving or detaching strapsIdeal for height adjustable backboardWarrantySKLZ products include a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About SKLZThe flagship brand of Pro Performance Sports, LLC, SKLZ started out creating a popular baseball swing trainer, the Hit-A-Way. Starting with a complete line of baseball and softball trainers, SKLZ has added basketball, football, tennis, soccer, hockey, lacrosse, and training products.SKLZ training equipment is endorsed and used by many of the top professional players across a variety of sports, including:Erica BlasbergReggie JacksonDerek JeterJoe MauerPaul MolitorJoe MontanaLeah O'Brien-AmicoAlbert PujolsAndy RoddickMaria SharapovaRick Smith", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415hunBHK5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MA7XXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment", "Ball Returns & Guard Nets"]], "price": 37.91}}
