{"item_id": "B002MBC008", "title": "Speedo Adult Recreation Dive Mask", "description": "The Adult Recreational Dive Mask from Speedo offers recreational swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask to your face without pulling hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water and when you come up for air. The Speedo Recreational Mask offers a long-lasting, comfortable performance you can count on for use in virtually any recreational setting from the beach to the pool.", "text": "Speedo Adult Recreation Dive Mask The Adult Recreational Dive Mask from Speedo offers recreational swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask to your face without pulling hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water and when you come up for air. The Speedo Recreational Mask offers a long-lasting, comfortable performance you can count on for use in virtually any recreational setting from the beach to the pool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319Ajp5sVAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MBC008.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Masks"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B002MCYWHG", "title": "WeeRide Kangaroo Child Bike Seat", "description": "Product Description The WeeRide Kangaroo Center Mounted Child Carrier offers an award-winning design that allows children to enjoy and share in the cycling experience, surrounded by your protective pair of arms. Your child is not behind you uninterested and distanced by the limited view. The child’s position also keeps the center of gravity where it belongs – on the bicycle frame, not behind the rider. This all adds up to a more comfortable ride for the cyclist AND the passenger. The Child Carrier is mounted on an independent adjustable steel support bar that attaches firmly between the frame’s head tube and the seat post. The support bar is designed to mount on almost any bicycle. Customer contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com -- Safety Information - Always wear a helmet, knee and elbow pads when riding. Check all nuts and bolts for tightness before riding. For casual riding on smooth, flat, paved and dry surfaces free of sand , gravel or dirt. Do not ride at night or in areas of traffic. For children up to 40lbs, \"If you need straps in a different size please call us at Kent International and we will have them shipped to you right away.\"", "text": "WeeRide Kangaroo Child Bike Seat Product Description The WeeRide Kangaroo Center Mounted Child Carrier offers an award-winning design that allows children to enjoy and share in the cycling experience, surrounded by your protective pair of arms. Your child is not behind you uninterested and distanced by the limited view. The child’s position also keeps the center of gravity where it belongs – on the bicycle frame, not behind the rider. This all adds up to a more comfortable ride for the cyclist AND the passenger. The Child Carrier is mounted on an independent adjustable steel support bar that attaches firmly between the frame’s head tube and the seat post. The support bar is designed to mount on almost any bicycle. Customer contact information at 1-800-451-KENT (5368) or www.kentbicycles.com -- Safety Information - Always wear a helmet, knee and elbow pads when riding. Check all nuts and bolts for tightness before riding. For casual riding on smooth, flat, paved and dry surfaces free of sand , gravel or dirt. Do not ride at night or in areas of traffic. For children up to 40lbs, \"If you need straps in a different size please call us at Kent International and we will have them shipped to you right away.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415BsLJ9L-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MCYWHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WeeRide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Child Seats"]], "price": 55.21}}
{"item_id": "B002MD01DE", "title": "Nite Ize SBP2-03-01BG S-Biner Plastic Size-2 Double Gated Carabiner, Black", "description": "The Nite Ize S-Biner is a unique double gated carabiner with multiple uses for carrying keys, water bottles, camping and diving gear. Weight rated, not for climbing", "text": "Nite Ize SBP2-03-01BG S-Biner Plastic Size-2 Double Gated Carabiner, Black The Nite Ize S-Biner is a unique double gated carabiner with multiple uses for carrying keys, water bottles, camping and diving gear. Weight rated, not for climbing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CkAwx9MUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MD01DE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]], "price": 3.14}}
{"item_id": "B002MD01KC", "title": "Nite Ize SBP0-2PK-01 S-Biner Plastic Size-0 Double Gated Carabiner,Black, 2-Pack", "description": "The Nite Ize S-Biner is a unique double gated carabiner with multiple uses for carrying keys, water bottles, camping and diving gear. The size 0 is perfect for organizing keys on the ring by color; easily clipping and unclipping your pet's tags. Weight rated, not for climbing", "text": "Nite Ize SBP0-2PK-01 S-Biner Plastic Size-0 Double Gated Carabiner,Black, 2-Pack The Nite Ize S-Biner is a unique double gated carabiner with multiple uses for carrying keys, water bottles, camping and diving gear. The size 0 is perfect for organizing keys on the ring by color; easily clipping and unclipping your pet's tags. Weight rated, not for climbing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cpz198b-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MD01KC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]], "price": 2.63}}
{"item_id": "B002ME5J3A", "title": "Valor Athletics Inc. BD - 8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage", "description": "Valor Athletics, Inc. BD - 8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage helps you get your workout done safely. Get down low, then explode up! For any athlete, the quick first step or initial explosive move is paramount. These BD-8 Squat Stands help get you set up to build and bulk up your hamstrings, calves and quadriceps for enhanced performance. Each stand is adjustable from 36\" to 56\" to promote proper form and provide the safety net you need while lifting. Has weight plate holders too, for convenient storage and quick weight transitions while you work. Pump you up: Solid base with each covering 400 sq. in.; 5\" chrome back plate to catch bar as lifter maneuvers back to stand; 2 1/2\" mouth opening for bar support; For added safety, do not do squats alone; Posts are 36\" tall.; Weighs 48.5 lbs.; Order Now! Valor Athletics, Inc. BD-8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage", "text": "Valor Athletics Inc. BD - 8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage Valor Athletics, Inc. BD - 8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage helps you get your workout done safely. Get down low, then explode up! For any athlete, the quick first step or initial explosive move is paramount. These BD-8 Squat Stands help get you set up to build and bulk up your hamstrings, calves and quadriceps for enhanced performance. Each stand is adjustable from 36\" to 56\" to promote proper form and provide the safety net you need while lifting. Has weight plate holders too, for convenient storage and quick weight transitions while you work. Pump you up: Solid base with each covering 400 sq. in.; 5\" chrome back plate to catch bar as lifter maneuvers back to stand; 2 1/2\" mouth opening for bar support; For added safety, do not do squats alone; Posts are 36\" tall.; Weighs 48.5 lbs.; Order Now! Valor Athletics, Inc. BD-8 Deluxe Squat Rack with Plate Storage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JoDAB-y9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ME5J3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment"]], "price": 169.88}}
