{"item_id": "B002MN6YEE", "title": "Topeak AlienLux Tail Light", "description": "A fun little tail light sculpted to look like a tiny space visitor. Two bright LEDs with constant or blinking modes warn motorists of your location. The ALiEN is the coolest tail light in the galaxy.", "text": "Topeak AlienLux Tail Light A fun little tail light sculpted to look like a tiny space visitor. Two bright LEDs with constant or blinking modes warn motorists of your location. The ALiEN is the coolest tail light in the galaxy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p0sK6ZHkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MN6YEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B002MPRT6Y", "title": "Elite Forces Survival Bowie Knife", "description": "Are you a survivalist who only takes one item? You need this 12\" Elite Forces Bowie. The 7 1/2\" black anodized stainless steel blade will cut through anything. Strap it to your leg with the included ABS sheath and you're ready for action. Includes lanyard cord. 12\" overall. 7 1/2\" blade.", "text": "Elite Forces Survival Bowie Knife Are you a survivalist who only takes one item? You need this 12\" Elite Forces Bowie. The 7 1/2\" black anodized stainless steel blade will cut through anything. Strap it to your leg with the included ABS sheath and you're ready for action. Includes lanyard cord. 12\" overall. 7 1/2\" blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Z3zNRByRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MPRT6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 13.11}}
