{"item_id": "B002MTIQRG", "title": "5.11 Select Carry Pistol Pouch", "description": "The Select Carry Pistol Pouch is built from rugged 1050D nylon and features a compact front pocket with magazine slots. The Select Carry Pistol Pouch has been designed to carry small firearms for quick and rapid deployment.", "text": "5.11 Select Carry Pistol Pouch The Select Carry Pistol Pouch is built from rugged 1050D nylon and features a compact front pocket with magazine slots. The Select Carry Pistol Pouch has been designed to carry small firearms for quick and rapid deployment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jMIyVsYvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MTIQRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 33.77}}
{"item_id": "B002MUNZQ2", "title": "Speedo Adult Recreation Mask Snorkel Set", "description": "The Adult Recreational Mask Snorkel Set from Speedo offers recreational swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask and snorkel to your face without pulling your hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water and when you come up for air. The Speedo snorkel is equally well designed with a splash resistant top that prevents water from entering the snorkel top and that makes it easy to clear water from the snorkel once you surface. Finally, the mask snorkel set is 100% latex free for years of worry-free use.What's in the Box?Recreational mask and snorkel", "text": "Speedo Adult Recreation Mask Snorkel Set The Adult Recreational Mask Snorkel Set from Speedo offers recreational swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask and snorkel to your face without pulling your hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water and when you come up for air. The Speedo snorkel is equally well designed with a splash resistant top that prevents water from entering the snorkel top and that makes it easy to clear water from the snorkel once you surface. Finally, the mask snorkel set is 100% latex free for years of worry-free use.What's in the Box?Recreational mask and snorkel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zANPp9%2B1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MUNZQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 19.62}}
{"item_id": "B002MUS0SU", "title": "Speedo Junior Recreation Mask Snorkel Set", "description": "Ideally sized for kids and adults with smaller or narrower faces, the Junior Recreational Dive Mask Snorkel Set from Speedo offers swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask to your face without pulling hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water. The splash resistant snorkel reduces water entry while surface swimming and is easy to clear. Ideal for young swimmers gaining confidence in the water, the Speedo Recreational Mask Snorkel set offers a long-lasting, comfortable performance you can count on for use in virtually any recreational setting from the beach to the pool.", "text": "Speedo Junior Recreation Mask Snorkel Set Ideally sized for kids and adults with smaller or narrower faces, the Junior Recreational Dive Mask Snorkel Set from Speedo offers swimmers and snorkelers maximum comfort and performance at an affordable price. Thanks to a 100% silicone skirt, the mask creates a strong and comfortable seal to prevent water from penetrating the mask without hurting the face. Speedo's trademarked Speed Fit head strap system makes it fast and easy to secure the mask to your face without pulling hair. Once on, the mask's high-quality polycarbonate lens with Speedo's exclusive Anti Fog Max coating offers great clarity under water. The splash resistant snorkel reduces water entry while surface swimming and is easy to clear. Ideal for young swimmers gaining confidence in the water, the Speedo Recreational Mask Snorkel set offers a long-lasting, comfortable performance you can count on for use in virtually any recreational setting from the beach to the pool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sbobCk%2B3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MUS0SU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 14.48}}
