{"item_id": "B002MX3VM2", "title": "Mountain Khakis Webbing Belt", "description": "The word's most versatile belt, brought to you by Mountain Khakis. This stain-resistant belt has super strong stainless steel teeth. Use it to double as a dog leash, tie-down or a beer opener, making it the ultimate multi-purpose belt for your MK high quality pants. One belt, unlimited possibilities. Rise Above It with MK.", "text": "Mountain Khakis Webbing Belt The word's most versatile belt, brought to you by Mountain Khakis. This stain-resistant belt has super strong stainless steel teeth. Use it to double as a dog leash, tie-down or a beer opener, making it the ultimate multi-purpose belt for your MK high quality pants. One belt, unlimited possibilities. Rise Above It with MK.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51p1Ux-U8QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MX3VM2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"]]}}
