{"item_id": "B002MY7RAI", "title": "Mace Brand Pepper Spray Soft-Case Nylon Holster", "description": "The Mace Pepper Gun is one of the most accurate defense sprays available. The OC pepper spray formula is contained in a replaceable cartridge. The cartridge utilizes advanced bag-in-a-can technology that allows you to spray a constant stream,reaching up t", "text": "Mace Brand Pepper Spray Soft-Case Nylon Holster The Mace Pepper Gun is one of the most accurate defense sprays available. The OC pepper spray formula is contained in a replaceable cartridge. The cartridge utilizes advanced bag-in-a-can technology that allows you to spray a constant stream,reaching up t", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LWVtp1A7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MY7RAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mace Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.81}}
{"item_id": "B002MZQTL0", "title": "Inno Velo Gripper Truck Bed Bike Rack for Standard Pickup Truck", "description": "Introducing the all-new Inno RT201 Velo Gripper Truck Bike Racks from Inno Rack System. The most efficient pickup truck bed bike racks for securely transporting any bicycle without wasting any unnecessary truck bed space. Saves up to 90% of pickup truck bed space! The RT201 Inno Velo Gripper truck bike rack is for use with any standard pickup truck beds and Includes two mounts for attaching to the truck bed side rail and securing both the bicycle's front bike fork and the rear seat stay using the quick ratcheting holders. No need to take front bike wheel off. No need to have to get inside the pickup truck bed to mount the bicycle to the bike rack either. Even includes a D-ring on both mounts if you want to use the mounts to attach tie-down straps. Quick and easy to mount, no tools or drilling required. Optionally use a cable bike lock to secure the RT201 Velo Gripper truck bike rack mounts to the truck bed side rails. Holds one bicycle.", "text": "Inno Velo Gripper Truck Bed Bike Rack for Standard Pickup Truck Introducing the all-new Inno RT201 Velo Gripper Truck Bike Racks from Inno Rack System. The most efficient pickup truck bed bike racks for securely transporting any bicycle without wasting any unnecessary truck bed space. Saves up to 90% of pickup truck bed space! The RT201 Inno Velo Gripper truck bike rack is for use with any standard pickup truck beds and Includes two mounts for attaching to the truck bed side rail and securing both the bicycle's front bike fork and the rear seat stay using the quick ratcheting holders. No need to take front bike wheel off. No need to have to get inside the pickup truck bed to mount the bicycle to the bike rack either. Even includes a D-ring on both mounts if you want to use the mounts to attach tie-down straps. Quick and easy to mount, no tools or drilling required. Optionally use a cable bike lock to secure the RT201 Velo Gripper truck bike rack mounts to the truck bed side rails. Holds one bicycle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j7GwTPPhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002MZQTL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Inno", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B002N0KR4E", "title": "Glacier Glove Premium Neoprene Slit Finger Fishing Glove", "description": "This is the top of the line neoprene fishing glove. Great for all kinds of fishing and keeps the angler warm while allowing access to the thumb and index finger to tie knots, etc.", "text": "Glacier Glove Premium Neoprene Slit Finger Fishing Glove This is the top of the line neoprene fishing glove. Great for all kinds of fishing and keeps the angler warm while allowing access to the thumb and index finger to tie knots, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZbCigp7sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N0KR4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002N14G22", "title": "Flash Personal Cooking System", "description": "Add a little extra fun to your outdoor cooking adventures with the Jetboil Flash personal cooking system. The all-in-one Flash combines an adjustable stainless-steel burner and a 1-liter FluxRing cooking vessel in a single compact unit.The all-in-one Flash cooking system boils 2 cups of water for cocoa, coffee, instant soup, or other meals.To use, simply add water or liquid to the 1-liter cooking cup and fix it to the burner. Within two minutes, the Flash will provide two cups of boiling water for cocoa, coffee, instant soup, or a gourmet freeze-dried meal. It's easy, convenient, and fun. Plus, everything you need stacks and stores inside the FluxRing cooking cup, including the burner and fuel canister.The Flash is one of the safest outdoor cooking solutions on the market. The cooking cup clips onto the burner, preventing accidental spills, while the fuel canister tripod keeps the entire unit stable while you cook. And you'll know when your liquid is hot thanks to the color-changing heat indicator within the insulating cozy. Other features include a pushbutton \"through-cup\" igniter, a drink-through lid, an insulating bottom cover/measuring cup, a built-in windscreen that protects the flame during inclement weather, and a neoprene lining within the cup that keeps food and beverages warm.The Flash runs on 100-gram Jetpower fuel canisters, which provide enough energy to boil 12 liters or 100 cups of water each. The Flash is available in blue, carbon, green, gold, violet, and sapphire.SpecificationsVolume: 32 ounces (1 liter)Boil time: 2 minutes (1/2 liter)Water boiled: 12 liters per 100-gram Jetpower canisterDimensions: 4.1 by 7.1 inchesWeight: 14 ounces", "text": "Flash Personal Cooking System Add a little extra fun to your outdoor cooking adventures with the Jetboil Flash personal cooking system. The all-in-one Flash combines an adjustable stainless-steel burner and a 1-liter FluxRing cooking vessel in a single compact unit.The all-in-one Flash cooking system boils 2 cups of water for cocoa, coffee, instant soup, or other meals.To use, simply add water or liquid to the 1-liter cooking cup and fix it to the burner. Within two minutes, the Flash will provide two cups of boiling water for cocoa, coffee, instant soup, or a gourmet freeze-dried meal. It's easy, convenient, and fun. Plus, everything you need stacks and stores inside the FluxRing cooking cup, including the burner and fuel canister.The Flash is one of the safest outdoor cooking solutions on the market. The cooking cup clips onto the burner, preventing accidental spills, while the fuel canister tripod keeps the entire unit stable while you cook. And you'll know when your liquid is hot thanks to the color-changing heat indicator within the insulating cozy. Other features include a pushbutton \"through-cup\" igniter, a drink-through lid, an insulating bottom cover/measuring cup, a built-in windscreen that protects the flame during inclement weather, and a neoprene lining within the cup that keeps food and beverages warm.The Flash runs on 100-gram Jetpower fuel canisters, which provide enough energy to boil 12 liters or 100 cups of water each. The Flash is available in blue, carbon, green, gold, violet, and sapphire.SpecificationsVolume: 32 ounces (1 liter)Boil time: 2 minutes (1/2 liter)Water boiled: 12 liters per 100-gram Jetpower canisterDimensions: 4.1 by 7.1 inchesWeight: 14 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OXMpDy49L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N14G22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jetboil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 84.64}}
{"item_id": "B002N15XQ0", "title": "Helly Hansen Men's Voss Pant", "description": "Voss Pant Waterproof rainwear protection when needed Pull-on style pants for everyday use or for the outdoors. Made of 76% polyester and 24% PU material. The Voss pant is ideal when you need waterproof protection. The Voss Pant keeps you dry which means that it also keeps you warm.", "text": "Helly Hansen Men's Voss Pant Voss Pant Waterproof rainwear protection when needed Pull-on style pants for everyday use or for the outdoors. Made of 76% polyester and 24% PU material. The Voss pant is ideal when you need waterproof protection. The Voss Pant keeps you dry which means that it also keeps you warm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E3aQ7MnrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N15XQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002N2B0DO", "title": "LaserLyte Pistol Laser Trainer (9, 40, 45-Caliber)", "description": "Become a crack shot without spending cash on expensive training ammo with the LaserLyte Laser Trainer Pro. The trainer--which fits the most popular pistol calibers--mounts inside the barrel of your pistol. Every time your hammer or striker fires, the trainer's sound-activated switch will flash a laser dot for 100 milliseconds, simulating bullet impact. It's the easiest way to train without ammo. The Laser Trainer Pro expands your training possibilities by nearly flush mounting with the muzzle. This makes it easier to train from the holster, concealment, or close quarters.The Laser Trainer Pro installs from the muzzle of the barrel, and fits extra tight with the user of LaserLyte's patented arbor and taper system, which fits weapons chambered in 9mm, .40 S&W;, and .45 ACP with 2-inch minimum barrels. The laser also fits such calibers as .38 special, .380 auto, .357 Sig, 10mm, and .45 LC.SpecificationsActivation: Sound of striker or hammerBatteries: Three 377 batteries (not included)Run time: 3,000 shotsMinimum diameter: 0.1 inchMaximum diameter: 0.5 inchLength: 2.1 inches", "text": "LaserLyte Pistol Laser Trainer (9, 40, 45-Caliber) Become a crack shot without spending cash on expensive training ammo with the LaserLyte Laser Trainer Pro. The trainer--which fits the most popular pistol calibers--mounts inside the barrel of your pistol. Every time your hammer or striker fires, the trainer's sound-activated switch will flash a laser dot for 100 milliseconds, simulating bullet impact. It's the easiest way to train without ammo. The Laser Trainer Pro expands your training possibilities by nearly flush mounting with the muzzle. This makes it easier to train from the holster, concealment, or close quarters.The Laser Trainer Pro installs from the muzzle of the barrel, and fits extra tight with the user of LaserLyte's patented arbor and taper system, which fits weapons chambered in 9mm, .40 S&W;, and .45 ACP with 2-inch minimum barrels. The laser also fits such calibers as .38 special, .380 auto, .357 Sig, 10mm, and .45 LC.SpecificationsActivation: Sound of striker or hammerBatteries: Three 377 batteries (not included)Run time: 3,000 shotsMinimum diameter: 0.1 inchMaximum diameter: 0.5 inchLength: 2.1 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ScJ3-SHdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N2B0DO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 84.99}}
{"item_id": "B002N2ILPE", "title": "Tapco AK Retaining Plate", "description": "The TAPCO G2 fire control groups are the most reliable and best selling AK triggers on the market. To accompany that product we have created an equally impressive AK retaining plate. The TAPCO Retaining Plate installs in seconds, quickly securing pins in position to keep your trigger group in place. The TAPCO Retaining Plate works in virtually all AK's including the Tantal version. Unlike other retaining plates on the market, the TAPCO Retaining Plate is finished in a military phosphate coating, one of the most durable and longest lasting coating options available. It also features an installation tab for ease of use when inserting and removing the plate. This small bend at the top of the plate gives you multi-directional control when working with the tight confines of the AK receiver.", "text": "Tapco AK Retaining Plate The TAPCO G2 fire control groups are the most reliable and best selling AK triggers on the market. To accompany that product we have created an equally impressive AK retaining plate. The TAPCO Retaining Plate installs in seconds, quickly securing pins in position to keep your trigger group in place. The TAPCO Retaining Plate works in virtually all AK's including the Tantal version. Unlike other retaining plates on the market, the TAPCO Retaining Plate is finished in a military phosphate coating, one of the most durable and longest lasting coating options available. It also features an installation tab for ease of use when inserting and removing the plate. This small bend at the top of the plate gives you multi-directional control when working with the tight confines of the AK receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3183v9AoKzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N2ILPE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 7.59}}
{"item_id": "B002N2LZJS", "title": "CygoLite Milion 200 LED Rechargable 1-Piece HeadLight W/ Helmet Mount.", "description": "1 light + 1 battery =OnePiece = MiliOn For riders that want a light to be used off road but small enough for commuting, your wait is over.The MiliOn 200 is the top of the line for the MiliOn series, incorporating a powerful High-Brightness LED with a Quick Release USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery into a one piece design. It shares the same features of the standard Milion 150 like 3 brightness modes and battery indicators but it also has more light output as well as both helmet and handlebar mounts. With 200 lumens of light weighing a scant 130 grams on your bike or helmet, this versatile light will shine trhough any road or trail.", "text": "CygoLite Milion 200 LED Rechargable 1-Piece HeadLight W/ Helmet Mount. 1 light + 1 battery =OnePiece = MiliOn For riders that want a light to be used off road but small enough for commuting, your wait is over.The MiliOn 200 is the top of the line for the MiliOn series, incorporating a powerful High-Brightness LED with a Quick Release USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery into a one piece design. It shares the same features of the standard Milion 150 like 3 brightness modes and battery indicators but it also has more light output as well as both helmet and handlebar mounts. With 200 lumens of light weighing a scant 130 grams on your bike or helmet, this versatile light will shine trhough any road or trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hqDnxEKXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N2LZJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
