{"item_id": "B002N4DG2K", "title": "Walther P99 -- Black Extra Kit airsoft gun", "description": "WALTHER AIR SOFTAn exact replica of the legendary P99. International police forces rely on the Walther P99, and the famous British secret agent saved the world with it in his last three films. Synonymous with quality and innovative technology. Great for Indoor/Outdoor Action! Designed to scale, even with safety and magazine release.Fake silencer does not silence gun.... Extra Kit Includes: P99 Black Pistol, 400 6mm Blue BBs, 400 6mm Nightglow BBs, Compensator, XL Extra back grip for a custom fitNOTE:This gun has a 100-shot reservoir and a 14-shot clip. The gun box is misprinted, stating that it comes with two 100-shot clips. It does not.... Authentic 1:1 Scale replica of the Walther P99 Full licensed Walther Trademarks all over gun from Walther Color: Black Safety : Lever Action: Single Length: 13.5in. (34cm)with Compensator Package: Plastic clam formMagazine holds up to 14 BBs Reservoir holds up to 100 BBsOrange muzzle...", "text": "Walther P99 -- Black Extra Kit airsoft gun WALTHER AIR SOFTAn exact replica of the legendary P99. International police forces rely on the Walther P99, and the famous British secret agent saved the world with it in his last three films. Synonymous with quality and innovative technology. Great for Indoor/Outdoor Action! Designed to scale, even with safety and magazine release.Fake silencer does not silence gun.... Extra Kit Includes: P99 Black Pistol, 400 6mm Blue BBs, 400 6mm Nightglow BBs, Compensator, XL Extra back grip for a custom fitNOTE:This gun has a 100-shot reservoir and a 14-shot clip. The gun box is misprinted, stating that it comes with two 100-shot clips. It does not.... Authentic 1:1 Scale replica of the Walther P99 Full licensed Walther Trademarks all over gun from Walther Color: Black Safety : Lever Action: Single Length: 13.5in. (34cm)with Compensator Package: Plastic clam formMagazine holds up to 14 BBs Reservoir holds up to 100 BBsOrange muzzle...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XGcw4OsfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N4DG2K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002N4P786", "title": "Osprey Stratos 24 Backpack", "description": "The Stratos 24 offers simple panel access in a lightweight, comfortable, custom fit daypack. Dual mesh side pockets with InsideOut compression and zippered mesh hipbelt pockets allow for easy gear access. All Stratos packs feature spacer mesh harness and hipbelt and an Osprey AirSpeed suspension that incorporates a 3D mesh backpanel and LightWire frame.Features:Best Use: Day hiking, peak baggingBackpanel and suspensionHarness pocketHydration compatibleIce axe attachmentInsideOut compressionIntegrated raincoverPanel loadZippered hipbelt pocketsSpecifications:Size: 1343 cubic inches (S); 1465 cubic inches (M); 1587 cubic inches (L)Volume: 22 liters (S); 24 liters (M); 26 liters (L)Weight: 2 pounds, 6 ounces (S); 2 pounds, 8 ounces (M); 2 pounds, 10 ounces (L)Dimensions: 19.5 by 12.5 by 8.5 inches", "text": "Osprey Stratos 24 Backpack The Stratos 24 offers simple panel access in a lightweight, comfortable, custom fit daypack. Dual mesh side pockets with InsideOut compression and zippered mesh hipbelt pockets allow for easy gear access. All Stratos packs feature spacer mesh harness and hipbelt and an Osprey AirSpeed suspension that incorporates a 3D mesh backpanel and LightWire frame.Features:Best Use: Day hiking, peak baggingBackpanel and suspensionHarness pocketHydration compatibleIce axe attachmentInsideOut compressionIntegrated raincoverPanel loadZippered hipbelt pocketsSpecifications:Size: 1343 cubic inches (S); 1465 cubic inches (M); 1587 cubic inches (L)Volume: 22 liters (S); 24 liters (M); 26 liters (L)Weight: 2 pounds, 6 ounces (S); 2 pounds, 8 ounces (M); 2 pounds, 10 ounces (L)Dimensions: 19.5 by 12.5 by 8.5 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PkfaDk1TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N4P786.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002N4PAMO", "title": "Osprey Raptor 10 Daypack, Silt Gray, Medium/Large", "description": "The Raptor Series brings Osprey's Hydraulics solutions to mountain biking and trail running. An innovative suspenion and ergonomic backpanel provide superb bike riding comfort and great stability while trail running. Bike specific pocketing along with our proprietary LidLock system keeps your gear organized. These packs feature a LidLock helmet clip, top zippered pocket for quick access, side compression straps, full elasticstretch sternum strap, magnetic sternum buckle, main compartment with tool organization sleeves/mesh pockets, blinker light attchment patch, stretch woven front pocket, and reflective graphics. BioStretch Harness offers a built-in magnet for quick bite valve attachment. AirScape suspension has the ridge molded foam with air chimney that creates a lightweight, yet supportive and ventilated backpanel, stretch sternum strap with magnetic hose attachment, and lightweight webbing. The BioStretch built-in hipbelt offers a mesh covered, perforated hip belt and a modified straight ErgoPull hipbelt closure.", "text": "Osprey Raptor 10 Daypack, Silt Gray, Medium/Large The Raptor Series brings Osprey's Hydraulics solutions to mountain biking and trail running. An innovative suspenion and ergonomic backpanel provide superb bike riding comfort and great stability while trail running. Bike specific pocketing along with our proprietary LidLock system keeps your gear organized. These packs feature a LidLock helmet clip, top zippered pocket for quick access, side compression straps, full elasticstretch sternum strap, magnetic sternum buckle, main compartment with tool organization sleeves/mesh pockets, blinker light attchment patch, stretch woven front pocket, and reflective graphics. BioStretch Harness offers a built-in magnet for quick bite valve attachment. AirScape suspension has the ridge molded foam with air chimney that creates a lightweight, yet supportive and ventilated backpanel, stretch sternum strap with magnetic hose attachment, and lightweight webbing. The BioStretch built-in hipbelt offers a mesh covered, perforated hip belt and a modified straight ErgoPull hipbelt closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gr5CT6oFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N4PAMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002N5AHBW", "title": "Pure Fun Mini Trampoline", "description": "The Pure Fun 38\" Mini Trampoline is safety rated and features the same sturdy construction and attention to detail as our full sized versions. Safety is the first consideration for all Pure Fun trampolines, and each mini tramp features a padded cover over the springs and frame to help keep you bouncing safely.Since our mini trampolines are easy to assemble with no additional tools required, you can start jumping and jogging your way to fitness on the same day yours arrives.", "text": "Pure Fun Mini Trampoline The Pure Fun 38\" Mini Trampoline is safety rated and features the same sturdy construction and attention to detail as our full sized versions. Safety is the first consideration for all Pure Fun trampolines, and each mini tramp features a padded cover over the springs and frame to help keep you bouncing safely.Since our mini trampolines are easy to assemble with no additional tools required, you can start jumping and jogging your way to fitness on the same day yours arrives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414oW-We9mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N5AHBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pure Fun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 57.49}}
{"item_id": "B002N5AHFS", "title": "Pure Fun 40 in. Mini Trampoline with Hand Rail", "description": "The Pure Fun 40\"Mini Trampoline with Hand Rail is safety rated and features the same sturdy construction and attention to detail as our full sized versions. Safety is the first consideration for all Pure Fun trampolines, and each mini tramp features a padded cover over the springs and frame to help keep you bouncing safely. For added safety, we offer this 40\" mini trampoline with an easily adjustable hand rail that's perfect for novice rebounders or those who prefer to have something to hang on to. Since our mini trampolines are easy to assemble and you can start jumping and jogging your way to fitness on the same day yours arrive. 90 day Limited warranty", "text": "Pure Fun 40 in. Mini Trampoline with Hand Rail The Pure Fun 40\"Mini Trampoline with Hand Rail is safety rated and features the same sturdy construction and attention to detail as our full sized versions. Safety is the first consideration for all Pure Fun trampolines, and each mini tramp features a padded cover over the springs and frame to help keep you bouncing safely. For added safety, we offer this 40\" mini trampoline with an easily adjustable hand rail that's perfect for novice rebounders or those who prefer to have something to hang on to. Since our mini trampolines are easy to assemble and you can start jumping and jogging your way to fitness on the same day yours arrive. 90 day Limited warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w-X10QR2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N5AHFS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 79.99}}
