{"item_id": "B002N6A12G", "title": "Polarlens G7 Multisport Sunglasses/ Ski Goggles / Snowboarding Goggles / Motor Sports / Water Sports/ Triathlete Sport Glasses / Reflective Flash Mirror / High Performance Flexible Polycarbonate Plastic / weight without accessories - sunglasses only - 30 g /With accessories - sunglasses, headstrap and forehead padding - 50 g/Introductory pricing for the U.S market", "description": "Flexible sportsframes made from high performance polycarbonate *** black / red-gloss black *** perfect fit ***vented nose pads *** Quality lenses that are cosmetically thin and light. *** Virtually unbreakable and highly impact resistant with hard coating*** High elasticity for high stability *** Reflective FLASH MIRROR*** Weight without accessories - sunglasses only - 30 g / With accessories - sunglasses, headstrap and forehead padding - 50 g ***UV400, 100% UV protection *** ANTI-FOG coating ***solar filter: CAT. 3 ***removable front *** adjustable stretch strap *** CE ***included: sports glasses, forehead padding, stretch strap, functional micro-fiber cleaning bag.", "text": "Polarlens G7 Multisport Sunglasses/ Ski Goggles / Snowboarding Goggles / Motor Sports / Water Sports/ Triathlete Sport Glasses / Reflective Flash Mirror / High Performance Flexible Polycarbonate Plastic / weight without accessories - sunglasses only - 30 g /With accessories - sunglasses, headstrap and forehead padding - 50 g/Introductory pricing for the U.S market Flexible sportsframes made from high performance polycarbonate *** black / red-gloss black *** perfect fit ***vented nose pads *** Quality lenses that are cosmetically thin and light. *** Virtually unbreakable and highly impact resistant with hard coating*** High elasticity for high stability *** Reflective FLASH MIRROR*** Weight without accessories - sunglasses only - 30 g / With accessories - sunglasses, headstrap and forehead padding - 50 g ***UV400, 100% UV protection *** ANTI-FOG coating ***solar filter: CAT. 3 ***removable front *** adjustable stretch strap *** CE ***included: sports glasses, forehead padding, stretch strap, functional micro-fiber cleaning bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IBZF19P7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N6A12G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 39.9}}
