{"item_id": "B002N6NOR0", "title": "Stainless Steel Water Bottle Canteen 40oz. - Single Pack - Stainless Finish", "description": "Our Simply Green Canteens provide a simple and effective way to aid in reducing your carbon footprint by eliminating needless plastic bottles, which pile up in landfills and take over 1000 years to decompose. Simply Green Canteens are reusable, durable and made from high-grade, food safe stainless steel, which does not contain the chemical Bisphenol A (BPA) found in plastic bottles. In addition, your water, juice or drink of choice is always clean tasting and odor free.", "text": "Stainless Steel Water Bottle Canteen 40oz. - Single Pack - Stainless Finish Our Simply Green Canteens provide a simple and effective way to aid in reducing your carbon footprint by eliminating needless plastic bottles, which pile up in landfills and take over 1000 years to decompose. Simply Green Canteens are reusable, durable and made from high-grade, food safe stainless steel, which does not contain the chemical Bisphenol A (BPA) found in plastic bottles. In addition, your water, juice or drink of choice is always clean tasting and odor free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417OD5jlWFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002N6NOR0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.99}}
