{"item_id": "B002NBDXBW", "title": "Buck Paklite TM Caper Knife (Silver, 6 3/4-Inch)", "description": "As the name implies, nothing is lighter or easier to carry than the skeletal steel frame PakLites TM. The PakLites TM are tough enough to ensure years of reliable performance, and so lightweight you'll hardly know you're carrying them. Made out of durable 420HC Stainless Steel, with a heavy-duty nylon sheath.", "text": "Buck Paklite TM Caper Knife (Silver, 6 3/4-Inch) As the name implies, nothing is lighter or easier to carry than the skeletal steel frame PakLites TM. The PakLites TM are tough enough to ensure years of reliable performance, and so lightweight you'll hardly know you're carrying them. Made out of durable 420HC Stainless Steel, with a heavy-duty nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bYNi3HvOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002NBDXBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.5}}
