{"item_id": "B002NSYSBO", "title": "SaltStick Dispenser", "description": "Saltstick Capsules Dispenser is designed to fit inside mountain, triathlon or road style handlebars to deliver salt capsules or other supplements when needed during your ride. Turn the front knob with one hand and out pops a capsule!Fits all capsules currently on the marketIncludes an extra color-coded nozzle for multiple supplement dispensingUsed by top pros at Ironman Kona 2005-2008Complies with USA Triathlon regulationsWater-resistant nozzle: Keeps capsules dryPrevents capsule damage from bouncingHides discreetly inside most bicycle handlebarsUnique design is patentedMiniHolds 3 size 0 or 00 capsules. Usi", "text": "SaltStick Dispenser Saltstick Capsules Dispenser is designed to fit inside mountain, triathlon or road style handlebars to deliver salt capsules or other supplements when needed during your ride. Turn the front knob with one hand and out pops a capsule!Fits all capsules currently on the marketIncludes an extra color-coded nozzle for multiple supplement dispensingUsed by top pros at Ironman Kona 2005-2008Complies with USA Triathlon regulationsWater-resistant nozzle: Keeps capsules dryPrevents capsule damage from bouncingHides discreetly inside most bicycle handlebarsUnique design is patentedMiniHolds 3 size 0 or 00 capsules. Usi", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514PCYP40BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002NSYSBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002NV5B08", "title": "Leather Belt Slide Holster Fits All 1911 Autos W/ 3.5\" To 5\" Barrels. Also Fits The Browning High Power,Colt Model M 1911-A1, Kahr PM9,P40,P45,CW9, Keltec P-11,PF9, Kimber 1911, MP9,40,45 and Walther P22", "description": "AMERICAN PRIDE LEATHER IS MADE IN THE USA. THEY ARE A TOP OF THE LINE COMPANY MADE WITH AMERICAN HANDS. Domestic Steer Hide Leather, Size 346 Bonded Nylon Thread. 30 Day Money Back Guarantee. Fits All 1911 Autos W/ 3.5\" To 5\" Barrels. Also Fits The Browning High Power,Colt Model M 1911-A1, Kahr PM9,P40,P45,CW9, Keltec P-11,PF9, Kimber 1911, MP9,40,45 and Walther P22 Brown in color. 100% 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!! MADE IN THE USA!!!", "text": "Leather Belt Slide Holster Fits All 1911 Autos W/ 3.5\" To 5\" Barrels. Also Fits The Browning High Power,Colt Model M 1911-A1, Kahr PM9,P40,P45,CW9, Keltec P-11,PF9, Kimber 1911, MP9,40,45 and Walther P22 AMERICAN PRIDE LEATHER IS MADE IN THE USA. THEY ARE A TOP OF THE LINE COMPANY MADE WITH AMERICAN HANDS. Domestic Steer Hide Leather, Size 346 Bonded Nylon Thread. 30 Day Money Back Guarantee. Fits All 1911 Autos W/ 3.5\" To 5\" Barrels. Also Fits The Browning High Power,Colt Model M 1911-A1, Kahr PM9,P40,P45,CW9, Keltec P-11,PF9, Kimber 1911, MP9,40,45 and Walther P22 Brown in color. 100% 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!! MADE IN THE USA!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21osrKsjKKL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002NV5B08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
