{"item_id": "B002OD76YE", "title": "4 PACK - MUST HAVE item! Emergency Rain Coat Rainwear w/ Hood & Sleeve - Clear", "description": "Most of us don't think far enough ahead, especially if we trust our weatherperson. Dropping the kids off at school, out hiking, hunting, fishing or running we normally are not prepared when wet weather strikes. How many times have you a left for work or an outing on a bright sunny day, only to have it cloud up and pour. This is a MUST HAVE item, that everyone should have at home, in the car, boat, RV and OTV. These items cost so little, and can save so much it doesn't make sense not to stock up and BE PREPARED!", "text": "4 PACK - MUST HAVE item! Emergency Rain Coat Rainwear w/ Hood & Sleeve - Clear Most of us don't think far enough ahead, especially if we trust our weatherperson. Dropping the kids off at school, out hiking, hunting, fishing or running we normally are not prepared when wet weather strikes. How many times have you a left for work or an outing on a bright sunny day, only to have it cloud up and pour. This is a MUST HAVE item, that everyone should have at home, in the car, boat, RV and OTV. These items cost so little, and can save so much it doesn't make sense not to stock up and BE PREPARED!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BRRinA%2BfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OD76YE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 4.45}}
{"item_id": "B002OD9L0Q", "title": "4 PACK EMERGENCY GOTTA HAVE IT! HOODED RAIN PONCHO -YELLOW", "description": "FOUR (4) Emergency Hooded Rain Ponchos YELLOW Most of us don't think far enough ahead, especially if we trust our weatherperson. Dropping the kids off at school, out hiking, hunting, fishing or running we normally are not prepared when wet weather strikes. How many times have you a left for work or an outing on a bright sunny day, only to have it cloud up and pour. This is a MUST HAVE item, that everyone should have at home, in the car, boat, RV and OTV. These items cost so little, and can save so much it doesn't make sense not to stock up & BE PREPARED! Remember it is better to have them and need them, than to need them and not have them!", "text": "4 PACK EMERGENCY GOTTA HAVE IT! HOODED RAIN PONCHO -YELLOW FOUR (4) Emergency Hooded Rain Ponchos YELLOW Most of us don't think far enough ahead, especially if we trust our weatherperson. Dropping the kids off at school, out hiking, hunting, fishing or running we normally are not prepared when wet weather strikes. How many times have you a left for work or an outing on a bright sunny day, only to have it cloud up and pour. This is a MUST HAVE item, that everyone should have at home, in the car, boat, RV and OTV. These items cost so little, and can save so much it doesn't make sense not to stock up & BE PREPARED! Remember it is better to have them and need them, than to need them and not have them!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z8MQUaHbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OD9L0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SIS E-Store", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 4.54}}
{"item_id": "B002OEI5U2", "title": "Bike & Runner's Safety Light 4 Pack - Flashing 5 Red LED, 7 Function, 6 Patterns Red Cover for Outdoor Runner's, Jogger's & Walker's with Arm Strap, Belt Clip and Bike Mount", "description": "STANDARD LED Safety Lights for Cyclists 5 LED'S 6 PATTERNS Our highly visible flashing safety light contains five LED lights and allows you to choose from six separate flashing patterns. A belt clip, bike mount, and an adjustable elastic arm strap are included to ensure your safety during all outdoor activities. Requires two \"AA\" batteries (Not included) 5 Red LED Flasher, 120 degree Adjustable Bicycle Attachement, Made of New Material, Rohs Quality Includes: Arm Band and Bicycle Attachment 4 Packages of 1 Each LEDSKR1 Total of (4) Standard Red Flashing LEDSKR1 Kits", "text": "Bike & Runner's Safety Light 4 Pack - Flashing 5 Red LED, 7 Function, 6 Patterns Red Cover for Outdoor Runner's, Jogger's & Walker's with Arm Strap, Belt Clip and Bike Mount STANDARD LED Safety Lights for Cyclists 5 LED'S 6 PATTERNS Our highly visible flashing safety light contains five LED lights and allows you to choose from six separate flashing patterns. A belt clip, bike mount, and an adjustable elastic arm strap are included to ensure your safety during all outdoor activities. Requires two \"AA\" batteries (Not included) 5 Red LED Flasher, 120 degree Adjustable Bicycle Attachement, Made of New Material, Rohs Quality Includes: Arm Band and Bicycle Attachment 4 Packages of 1 Each LEDSKR1 Total of (4) Standard Red Flashing LEDSKR1 Kits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418MZ7e36sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OEI5U2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 7.88}}
{"item_id": "B002OEKU0A", "title": "SE - Whistle - 5-in-1, Compass, Lanyard, And Compass", "description": "Survival Kit Someday when you're lost in the woods, you'll be very, very glad you ordered this compact survival kit. It's the classic camp director's whistle, raised to new heights. The 4-1/2 in. x 1-1/8 in. dia orange-plastic treasure hangs around your neck on a yellow nylon cord. On one end, the whistle. On the other, a compass. Unscrew the compass, and it reverses to a signal mirror, and reveals a 2-1/2 in. deep waterproof compartment for aspirin or medicinal brandy - or for the matches you're going to strike against the 3/4 in. long sparker. No, it's not overkill for a teacher to wear it on the playground. 'S cool.", "text": "SE - Whistle - 5-in-1, Compass, Lanyard, And Compass Survival Kit Someday when you're lost in the woods, you'll be very, very glad you ordered this compact survival kit. It's the classic camp director's whistle, raised to new heights. The 4-1/2 in. x 1-1/8 in. dia orange-plastic treasure hangs around your neck on a yellow nylon cord. On one end, the whistle. On the other, a compass. Unscrew the compass, and it reverses to a signal mirror, and reveals a 2-1/2 in. deep waterproof compartment for aspirin or medicinal brandy - or for the matches you're going to strike against the 3/4 in. long sparker. No, it's not overkill for a teacher to wear it on the playground. 'S cool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411rjrZuouL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OEKU0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.08}}
{"item_id": "B002OEQ50Y", "title": "Definity HHP-001 Pair of Push Up Bars", "description": "Designed to improve your positioning for deeper pushups, the Definity Push Up Holders from Cap Barbell provide stability and comfort for your workout. Constructed of chrome plated medal, the holders have the durability required for holding up your full body weight. Meanwhile, the slip-resistant foam covered handles offer increased comfort, while the hard rubber footpads prevent the holders from sliding as you push up. Pushups are an effective and inexpensive way to build upper and lower body strength that targets your chest, shoulders, and back muscles. Pushups are also known to improve strength in your arms, legs, and stomach.", "text": "Definity HHP-001 Pair of Push Up Bars Designed to improve your positioning for deeper pushups, the Definity Push Up Holders from Cap Barbell provide stability and comfort for your workout. Constructed of chrome plated medal, the holders have the durability required for holding up your full body weight. Meanwhile, the slip-resistant foam covered handles offer increased comfort, while the hard rubber footpads prevent the holders from sliding as you push up. Pushups are an effective and inexpensive way to build upper and lower body strength that targets your chest, shoulders, and back muscles. Pushups are also known to improve strength in your arms, legs, and stomach.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BkkkWD5%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OEQ50Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]], "price": 12.41}}
{"item_id": "B002OEU3GQ", "title": "CAP Neoprene Coated Dumbbell", "description": "CAP Barbell's neoprene dumbbells have comfortable contoured grips for easy handling. Ideal for toning and sculpting arms, shoulders and back. Hexogonal shape is designed to prevent rolling and easy storage.", "text": "CAP Neoprene Coated Dumbbell CAP Barbell's neoprene dumbbells have comfortable contoured grips for easy handling. Ideal for toning and sculpting arms, shoulders and back. Hexogonal shape is designed to prevent rolling and easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zC0QT7c0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OEU3GQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 8.76}}
{"item_id": "B002OEU47E", "title": "CAP Barbell Rubber Coated Hex Dumbbell with Contoured Chrome Handle, Single", "description": "Prevent damage to floors by using these Hex Dumbbells with Rubber Heads and Ergo handgrips. The Ergo design helps to reduce fatigue and maximize comfort. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "text": "CAP Barbell Rubber Coated Hex Dumbbell with Contoured Chrome Handle, Single Prevent damage to floors by using these Hex Dumbbells with Rubber Heads and Ergo handgrips. The Ergo design helps to reduce fatigue and maximize comfort. Warning: This product contains one or more phthalate chemicals known to the state of California to cause birth defects and other reproductive harm. Consumer may return the product for a full refund, including shipping cost for both receipt and return of the product within 15 days of his or her receipt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uUfDUIKRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OEU47E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]]}}
