{"item_id": "B002OOYINA", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch ECO Chrome Bar, 7-Feet", "description": "7’ Olympic Bar is the most popular international bar on the market. Precision engineered for balance and long lasting performance. Designed with medium depth diamond knurled surface and sleeves that swivel at the most delicate touch. This prohibits the bar from warping and reduces pressure on the wrists.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch ECO Chrome Bar, 7-Feet 7’ Olympic Bar is the most popular international bar on the market. Precision engineered for balance and long lasting performance. Designed with medium depth diamond knurled surface and sleeves that swivel at the most delicate touch. This prohibits the bar from warping and reduces pressure on the wrists.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zcgwP95cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OOYINA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 57.93}}
{"item_id": "B002OOYIOY", "title": "CAP Barbell Black A Frame Dumbbell Rack", "description": "Keep your dumbbells close at hand with the functional design of the CAP Barbell Black A Frame Dumbbell Rack. This rack holds five pairs of hex, rubber hex, or neoprene dumbbells and features a solid steel construction with black powder-coat finish. With a 200-pound weight capacity, this A-frame is ideal for your home gym or workout room. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Holds 5 pairs of hex dumbbells. Durable steel construction. 200-pound weight capacity. Powder-coated finish. Dimensions: 15L x 13W x 27H inches.", "text": "CAP Barbell Black A Frame Dumbbell Rack Keep your dumbbells close at hand with the functional design of the CAP Barbell Black A Frame Dumbbell Rack. This rack holds five pairs of hex, rubber hex, or neoprene dumbbells and features a solid steel construction with black powder-coat finish. With a 200-pound weight capacity, this A-frame is ideal for your home gym or workout room. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Holds 5 pairs of hex dumbbells. Durable steel construction. 200-pound weight capacity. Powder-coated finish. Dimensions: 15L x 13W x 27H inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N9NaLRyaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OOYIOY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Dumbbell Racks"]], "price": 39.98}}
{"item_id": "B002OP0AEA", "title": "Cap Barbell High Hex Bar (2-Inch)", "description": "Cap's Olympic High Hex Bar was engineered specifically for squat or shoulder shrug exercises. This bar can stand any test of strength. Made of heavy duty alloy steel.", "text": "Cap Barbell High Hex Bar (2-Inch) Cap's Olympic High Hex Bar was engineered specifically for squat or shoulder shrug exercises. This bar can stand any test of strength. Made of heavy duty alloy steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ixUmorXjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OP0AEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 108.88}}
{"item_id": "B002OP3UJW", "title": "5.11 Tactical ThumbDrive Holster", "description": "ThumbDrive Holster from 5.11 Tactical gives you style, savings, and a lightning - fast draw! Packed with features! 5.11 Tactical has done it again. Their new ThumbDrive Level II Holster isn't just any old pistol-packer. It's reinforced, for better firearm retention. It's adaptable, fitting nearly any size belt. But what really sets it apart is security. A thumb-operated safety keeps your sidearm right where it belongs until you need it. Additionally, the optional Chop - Block attachment works hard to prevent removal of the gun by anyone except you. Get yours, and stay safe! Reinforced build; Belt slide adjusts to fit belts up to 2 1/4\"; Removable / optional Chop - Block prevents unauthorized retrievals; Includes belt slide and paddle; Several sizes and styles available in either left or right-hand variants; State Size and Style. Order yours, and holster that heat safely! Size / Styles Glock 17/22 RH, Glock 17/22 LH, Glock 34/35 RH, Glock 34/35 LH, Glock 19/23 RH, Glock 19/23 LH 5.11 Tactical ThumbDrive Holster", "text": "5.11 Tactical ThumbDrive Holster ThumbDrive Holster from 5.11 Tactical gives you style, savings, and a lightning - fast draw! Packed with features! 5.11 Tactical has done it again. Their new ThumbDrive Level II Holster isn't just any old pistol-packer. It's reinforced, for better firearm retention. It's adaptable, fitting nearly any size belt. But what really sets it apart is security. A thumb-operated safety keeps your sidearm right where it belongs until you need it. Additionally, the optional Chop - Block attachment works hard to prevent removal of the gun by anyone except you. Get yours, and stay safe! Reinforced build; Belt slide adjusts to fit belts up to 2 1/4\"; Removable / optional Chop - Block prevents unauthorized retrievals; Includes belt slide and paddle; Several sizes and styles available in either left or right-hand variants; State Size and Style. Order yours, and holster that heat safely! Size / Styles Glock 17/22 RH, Glock 17/22 LH, Glock 34/35 RH, Glock 34/35 LH, Glock 19/23 RH, Glock 19/23 LH 5.11 Tactical ThumbDrive Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VFUfQOLjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OP3UJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
