{"item_id": "B002OQMP1A", "title": "Tactical Pistol Compact Red Laser with QD Quick Release Flash Light Compatible with M1913 weaver rail", "description": "Compact Red Laser and Flash Light Combo. Field Tested with over 2000rd fired. Improve your shot and a true life saver for home defense.SpecificationFor: Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (w/ minimum rail length of 1.75\") Battery Type: 357 (2) Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage & elevation Laser Operating Temperature: 5F - 150F Wavelength: 635nm (red/orange) Power Output: 5mW Spot Size: 5/16\" @ 7 Yds; 3/4\" @ 25 Yds Please note it does not fit Ruger SR9C", "text": "Tactical Pistol Compact Red Laser with QD Quick Release Flash Light Compatible with M1913 weaver rail Compact Red Laser and Flash Light Combo. Field Tested with over 2000rd fired. Improve your shot and a true life saver for home defense.SpecificationFor: Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (w/ minimum rail length of 1.75\") Battery Type: 357 (2) Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage & elevation Laser Operating Temperature: 5F - 150F Wavelength: 635nm (red/orange) Power Output: 5mW Spot Size: 5/16\" @ 7 Yds; 3/4\" @ 25 Yds Please note it does not fit Ruger SR9C", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mHToG24kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OQMP1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 44.9}}
