{"item_id": "B002OUFHMU", "title": "Pistol Compact Red Laser", "description": "Improve your shot and a sure life saver for home defense. All Aluminum Alloy body unlike imitations built for airsoft. For pistols of all caliber.SpecificationSpecifications:For: Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (w/ minimum rail length of 1.75\")Battery Type: 357 (2)Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage & elevation Laser Operating Temperature: 10F - 130FWavelength: 635nm (red/orange)Power Output: 5mWSpot Size: 5/16\" @ 7 Yds; 3/4\" @ 25 Yds", "text": "Pistol Compact Red Laser Improve your shot and a sure life saver for home defense. All Aluminum Alloy body unlike imitations built for airsoft. For pistols of all caliber.SpecificationSpecifications:For: Picatinny; Mil-Spec; Weaver Style Rails (w/ minimum rail length of 1.75\")Battery Type: 357 (2)Accuracy: User-adjusted for windage & elevation Laser Operating Temperature: 10F - 130FWavelength: 635nm (red/orange)Power Output: 5mWSpot Size: 5/16\" @ 7 Yds; 3/4\" @ 25 Yds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C56LfBpJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OUFHMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Sport Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 13.61}}
{"item_id": "B002OWKP0C", "title": "Tilos Neoprene Fin Socks", "description": "Product Features: 3 millimeter neoprene keeps feet warm Nylon II neoprene is very durable and stretchy Blindstitched seams lay flat on skin Seams glued to minimize water entry Honeycomb silkscreen bottom provides traction Product Description: Keep your feet insulated with Tilos's 3 millimeter paddleboard socks. The thin neoprene does not take up excess room and is well worth brining on cooler days while paddleboarding. The silkscreen design on the bottom of the sock aids in traction on boards, docks and boat decks. In addition to being creat paddleboarding socks, these socks are also great to include with your scuba equipment. Because there is no hard sole, these socks fit most snorkeling and diving fins, both open heel and full foot. However, be sure there is enough room in your fins to wear socks, which may include ordering the next size up in full-foot fins.", "text": "Tilos Neoprene Fin Socks Product Features: 3 millimeter neoprene keeps feet warm Nylon II neoprene is very durable and stretchy Blindstitched seams lay flat on skin Seams glued to minimize water entry Honeycomb silkscreen bottom provides traction Product Description: Keep your feet insulated with Tilos's 3 millimeter paddleboard socks. The thin neoprene does not take up excess room and is well worth brining on cooler days while paddleboarding. The silkscreen design on the bottom of the sock aids in traction on boards, docks and boat decks. In addition to being creat paddleboarding socks, these socks are also great to include with your scuba equipment. Because there is no hard sole, these socks fit most snorkeling and diving fins, both open heel and full foot. However, be sure there is enough room in your fins to wear socks, which may include ordering the next size up in full-foot fins.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417ne1%2BJ8rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002OWKP0C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002P0SY5Q", "title": "Avenir Cable Tips, Bottle of 500", "description": "DONT MISS OUT ON THIS EXCELLENT PRODUCTPackaged in resealable bottles with dispenser topsEnd caps (Brake)/ 1.5-1.8mm", "text": "Avenir Cable Tips, Bottle of 500 DONT MISS OUT ON THIS EXCELLENT PRODUCTPackaged in resealable bottles with dispenser topsEnd caps (Brake)/ 1.5-1.8mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bI21D2CJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P0SY5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002P35JJ2", "title": "Pair of PaceMaker \"Journey\" Trekking Poles with Extended Life Rubber Feet and Attachments", "description": "Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 24.5 to 54 inches long. At only 9.5 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest available. Superior ultralight 7075 aluminum, sweat absorbing and durable cork grips, tungsten tips, and vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match for the price. No antishock mechanism means that these poles are more stable, lighter, and less prone to fail than those that have antishock. (The supposed benefits of antishock are unfounded) These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "text": "Pair of PaceMaker \"Journey\" Trekking Poles with Extended Life Rubber Feet and Attachments Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 24.5 to 54 inches long. At only 9.5 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest available. Superior ultralight 7075 aluminum, sweat absorbing and durable cork grips, tungsten tips, and vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match for the price. No antishock mechanism means that these poles are more stable, lighter, and less prone to fail than those that have antishock. (The supposed benefits of antishock are unfounded) These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sw29jt2rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P35JJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B002P4ST3O", "title": "LEBERNA BRAND FROM FN INC Disposable Poncho One Size Fit All with Hood 20 Per Pack Assorted Color", "description": "MAKE SURE YOU BUY LEBERNA BRAND FROM FN INC. SIMILAR ITEMS MIGHT BE CHEAPER, BUT NOT THE SAME QUALITY. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This adult sized poncho measures 50 x 80 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "text": "LEBERNA BRAND FROM FN INC Disposable Poncho One Size Fit All with Hood 20 Per Pack Assorted Color MAKE SURE YOU BUY LEBERNA BRAND FROM FN INC. SIMILAR ITEMS MIGHT BE CHEAPER, BUT NOT THE SAME QUALITY. This Emergency Poncho is lightweight and compact. It can easily fit in your backpack, glove box, or even your pocket. This adult sized poncho measures 50 x 80 inches and has an attached hood. This is the perfect, inexpensive option for emergency weather protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NloQCgvuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P4ST3O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leberna", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 12.25}}
