{"item_id": "B002P82260", "title": "Proform 6.0 ZE Elliptical", "description": "Enjoy a challenging cardio workout without leaving the home with the ProForm 6.0 ZE elliptical trainer. The 6.0 ZE starts with a blue-tinted LCD window that tracks your time, resistance, calories burned, and more. As a result, it's easy to monitor your workout progress. The trainer's 12 built-in workouts, meanwhile, take the guesswork out of your routine by automatically adjusting the resistance for increased intensity. Simply choose between aerobic, weight loss, or performance categories and you'll be on your way to success. And to ensure comfort and stability, the trainer is equipped with an 18-inch stride length and oversized, slip-resistant pedals.Other features include an iPod-compatible music port, an integrated workout fan, 10 levels of digital resistance, a bottle holder, and a 250-pound weight capacity.About ProFormWhen most people hear the name ProForm, they automatically think of treadmills. That's because in its early days ProForm revolutionized the treadmill industry with its now-world-famous SpaceSaver foldaway design. ProForm continues its tradition of quality and innovation today, with cutting-edge advances in cushioning, electronics, and reliability. Fortunately, ProForm wasn't satisfied with treadmills, unveiling a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more--all geared to providing the most effective workout available.", "text": "Proform 6.0 ZE Elliptical Enjoy a challenging cardio workout without leaving the home with the ProForm 6.0 ZE elliptical trainer. The 6.0 ZE starts with a blue-tinted LCD window that tracks your time, resistance, calories burned, and more. As a result, it's easy to monitor your workout progress. The trainer's 12 built-in workouts, meanwhile, take the guesswork out of your routine by automatically adjusting the resistance for increased intensity. Simply choose between aerobic, weight loss, or performance categories and you'll be on your way to success. And to ensure comfort and stability, the trainer is equipped with an 18-inch stride length and oversized, slip-resistant pedals.Other features include an iPod-compatible music port, an integrated workout fan, 10 levels of digital resistance, a bottle holder, and a 250-pound weight capacity.About ProFormWhen most people hear the name ProForm, they automatically think of treadmills. That's because in its early days ProForm revolutionized the treadmill industry with its now-world-famous SpaceSaver foldaway design. ProForm continues its tradition of quality and innovation today, with cutting-edge advances in cushioning, electronics, and reliability. Fortunately, ProForm wasn't satisfied with treadmills, unveiling a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more--all geared to providing the most effective workout available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sE%2BxeWnQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P82260.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Elliptical Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002P9UJPK", "title": "Louis Garneau T-Cover Cycling Shoe Covers", "description": "The Louis Garneau T-Cover Cycling Shoe Cover is perfect for moderate weather conditions when you want to get out and enjoy the ride. Made with Stopzone (waterproof coated Lycra) fabric that blocks wind and rain without compromising its breathability and moisture wicking. Double opening under the sole to clear studs at the front and the back of the sole make these cyclocross and mountain shoe friendly. Large cleat opening under shoe cover. Easy slip-on entry.Reflective stripe for security and better visibility. Recommended for fall cycling. Sizing: Small: Men's 6.5- 7.5 (Euro 39-41), Womens 8 - 9.5; Medium: Men's 8 - 9.5 (Euro 41.5-43); Large: Men's 10- 11.5 (Euro 43.5- 45); X-Large: Men's 12+ (Euro 45.5- 50).", "text": "Louis Garneau T-Cover Cycling Shoe Covers The Louis Garneau T-Cover Cycling Shoe Cover is perfect for moderate weather conditions when you want to get out and enjoy the ride. Made with Stopzone (waterproof coated Lycra) fabric that blocks wind and rain without compromising its breathability and moisture wicking. Double opening under the sole to clear studs at the front and the back of the sole make these cyclocross and mountain shoe friendly. Large cleat opening under shoe cover. Easy slip-on entry.Reflective stripe for security and better visibility. Recommended for fall cycling. Sizing: Small: Men's 6.5- 7.5 (Euro 39-41), Womens 8 - 9.5; Medium: Men's 8 - 9.5 (Euro 41.5-43); Large: Men's 10- 11.5 (Euro 43.5- 45); X-Large: Men's 12+ (Euro 45.5- 50).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418byavigEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P9UJPK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002P9VEQ8", "title": "Rothco Polar Fleece Neck Warmers", "description": "The Rothco 5570 Polar Fleece Neck Warmer is an indispensible piece of extreme cold weather gear. It adjusts to cover the neck, mouth and ears and is lightweight and breathable. Available in Black, Foliage Green, and Coyote Brown", "text": "Rothco Polar Fleece Neck Warmers The Rothco 5570 Polar Fleece Neck Warmer is an indispensible piece of extreme cold weather gear. It adjusts to cover the neck, mouth and ears and is lightweight and breathable. Available in Black, Foliage Green, and Coyote Brown", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FlMcZXaoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002P9VEQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Neck Gaiters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002PA23PI", "title": "Louis Garneau Helmet Cover", "description": "When the rain starts falling, pull the Louis Garneau Helmet Cover over your helmet and ride in weather-protected comfort. This cover is treated with a water-resistant and breathable membrane that repels moisture and keeps the top of your head from turning into a swamp. The reflective logo and trim help the distracted masses see you a little better, and elastic edges keep the cover from flapping in the breeze.Product FeaturesMaterial: Stopzone polyamide, elastaneAdjustability: elasticSPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: riding in the rain, commuting, touringManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "Louis Garneau Helmet Cover When the rain starts falling, pull the Louis Garneau Helmet Cover over your helmet and ride in weather-protected comfort. This cover is treated with a water-resistant and breathable membrane that repels moisture and keeps the top of your head from turning into a swamp. The reflective logo and trim help the distracted masses see you a little better, and elastic edges keep the cover from flapping in the breeze.Product FeaturesMaterial: Stopzone polyamide, elastaneAdjustability: elasticSPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: riding in the rain, commuting, touringManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318fvSEQQ2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PA23PI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
