{"item_id": "B002POAYDW", "title": "Far Infrared FIR Portable Foldable Spa Sauna Detox Ion, SI01", "description": "PRODUCT CODE: JYS-B5 THIS UNIT DOES NOT COME WITH A CHAIR, ANY NON-UPHOLSTERED CHAIR CAN BE USED. NOTE: This portable sauna is Far Infrared sauna, not the ordinary steam sauna. It adopts Conductive Far Infrared Ray Carbon Fiber Heating Element for 3 Walls Of Built In Panel. The most important is Far Infrared Ray has many and many benefits for your health. Please see the following description. Dry Heat -Slimming- Detoxifying - Energizing - Beautifying - A Feeling of Well-Being!!!!! • FIR Sauna Heat Therapy allows increase blood circulation to carry great amounts of nutrients to the skin, thus promoting healthy tone, texture and mild cleansing of the skin. Low Operating Cost - approximately $0.08 for 30 minutes use. NOTE: USES 15 AMPS -- MUST HAVE OWN DEDICATED WALL OUTLET. DO NOT USE EXTENSION CORD. Components: A: Hand-held controller B: FIR heating panels C: Two supporting poles D: One Heated Foot Pad **Please note that the folding chair has been removed from the package for customer's safety** Please Follow Easy Operating Instructions Below: Instruction for Infrared Sauna 1) Plug in the cord, red light locates on top of POWER turns RED 2) Press ON/OFF button once, the yellow light above WORK goes on, then press FOUNCTION button to set the temperature by pressing + sign to go up to 150 while the number is flashing. 3) Press FOUNCTION again to set the time while the two-digit number is flashing. You may choose how much time you like to be in the session (from 15 minutes to 60 minutes). You may adjust the temperature to lower during session, just simply press the FOUNCTION key once then press - key to lower it to the level your body is comfortable with. A bath towel is highly recommended to put on the floor inside of the sauna underneath the chair for sweat and a small towel around the neck. This would allow you to have an easy clean up after the session. PS. drink water before and after session.", "text": "Far Infrared FIR Portable Foldable Spa Sauna Detox Ion, SI01 PRODUCT CODE: JYS-B5 THIS UNIT DOES NOT COME WITH A CHAIR, ANY NON-UPHOLSTERED CHAIR CAN BE USED. NOTE: This portable sauna is Far Infrared sauna, not the ordinary steam sauna. It adopts Conductive Far Infrared Ray Carbon Fiber Heating Element for 3 Walls Of Built In Panel. The most important is Far Infrared Ray has many and many benefits for your health. Please see the following description. Dry Heat -Slimming- Detoxifying - Energizing - Beautifying - A Feeling of Well-Being!!!!! • FIR Sauna Heat Therapy allows increase blood circulation to carry great amounts of nutrients to the skin, thus promoting healthy tone, texture and mild cleansing of the skin. Low Operating Cost - approximately $0.08 for 30 minutes use. NOTE: USES 15 AMPS -- MUST HAVE OWN DEDICATED WALL OUTLET. DO NOT USE EXTENSION CORD. Components: A: Hand-held controller B: FIR heating panels C: Two supporting poles D: One Heated Foot Pad **Please note that the folding chair has been removed from the package for customer's safety** Please Follow Easy Operating Instructions Below: Instruction for Infrared Sauna 1) Plug in the cord, red light locates on top of POWER turns RED 2) Press ON/OFF button once, the yellow light above WORK goes on, then press FOUNCTION button to set the temperature by pressing + sign to go up to 150 while the number is flashing. 3) Press FOUNCTION again to set the time while the two-digit number is flashing. You may choose how much time you like to be in the session (from 15 minutes to 60 minutes). You may adjust the temperature to lower during session, just simply press the FOUNCTION key once then press - key to lower it to the level your body is comfortable with. A bath towel is highly recommended to put on the floor inside of the sauna underneath the chair for sweat and a small towel around the neck. This would allow you to have an easy clean up after the session. PS. drink water before and after session.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IhdiYzhIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002POAYDW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Sauna Suits"]], "price": 192.0}}
{"item_id": "B002PQKGSI", "title": "Wheeler Scope Mounting Kit Combo, 1-Inch/30mm", "description": "Complete kit provides everything necessary to mount a scope the correct way, including an instructional DVD. Proper scope installation is critical to the accuracy of your firearm. Get the most accuracy possible out of your gun by ensuring proper scope installation. The Wheeler Alignment Bars, Lapping Bars and Lapping Compound allow you to achieve the perfect fit between scope and rings. Securing Fasteners properly is critical to accuracy as well. Precisely controlled torque along with thread locking compound will keep your scope held securely in place. Professional grade bits and the F.A.T. Wrench are the perfect combination to properly secure fasteners without deformation.", "text": "Wheeler Scope Mounting Kit Combo, 1-Inch/30mm Complete kit provides everything necessary to mount a scope the correct way, including an instructional DVD. Proper scope installation is critical to the accuracy of your firearm. Get the most accuracy possible out of your gun by ensuring proper scope installation. The Wheeler Alignment Bars, Lapping Bars and Lapping Compound allow you to achieve the perfect fit between scope and rings. Securing Fasteners properly is critical to accuracy as well. Precisely controlled torque along with thread locking compound will keep your scope held securely in place. Professional grade bits and the F.A.T. Wrench are the perfect combination to properly secure fasteners without deformation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514hQ2b7CbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PQKGSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 107.78}}
