{"item_id": "B002PTSBNM", "title": "Origin8 Pro Uno Saddle", "description": "Origin8 Pro Uno Saddle with high contrast stitching. Fully chromoly rails, gel foam internal material, 275mm length x 140mm width.", "text": "Origin8 Pro Uno Saddle Origin8 Pro Uno Saddle with high contrast stitching. Fully chromoly rails, gel foam internal material, 275mm length x 140mm width.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ai5nkFFwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PTSBNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Origin 8", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 22.75}}
{"item_id": "B002PTVDP0", "title": "Park Tool Head-Gear Lockring Wrench", "description": "The HCW-17 features two different radius hooks for a precise fit on most fixed-gear lock rings. The HCW-17 has two different ends.", "text": "Park Tool Head-Gear Lockring Wrench The HCW-17 features two different radius hooks for a precise fit on most fixed-gear lock rings. The HCW-17 has two different ends.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21L3EYz9SFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PTVDP0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 15.26}}
{"item_id": "B002PU9PG8", "title": "Gore Bike Wear Race Power III Thermo Overshoe, Black, Large", "description": "These waterproof road cycling overshoes fit on any cycling shoes. Your feet stay dry and warm and thanks to the stretch material, they fit tightly, won’t slow you down or flap around. Thermo lining adds extra warmth.", "text": "Gore Bike Wear Race Power III Thermo Overshoe, Black, Large These waterproof road cycling overshoes fit on any cycling shoes. Your feet stay dry and warm and thanks to the stretch material, they fit tightly, won’t slow you down or flap around. Thermo lining adds extra warmth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C65KBd1TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PU9PG8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002PUOIB0", "title": "Weaver Base Top Mount - 24", "description": "Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "text": "Weaver Base Top Mount - 24 Each Weaver base is machined to tight tolerances for a custom fit. These Aluminum bases offer maximum strength for rings to hold tight. Our extensive line of bases provides a precision fit to custom match your Weaver rings of choice. Whether you need a base to accommodate your modern sporting rifle, a competition pistol, inline muzzleloader or your favorite bolt-action hunting rifle; every one of our mounts delivers a solid start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412qTA5KVvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PUOIB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Trophy Mounts"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B002PUUCDS", "title": "Quickfletch Bone Collector (6-Pack), White/Green", "description": "The Pros know! NAP Quikfletch shrinks your groups and extends your kill zone. The Quikfletch™ Pro Series Vane System feature NAP's patented QuikSpin SPEEDHUNTER kicker/micro-groove technology that that spins arrows up to 6 times faster than conventional vanes. Result? Stable, straight driving arrows for tack-driving accuracy and optimum penetration. QuikFletch QuikSpin ST features NAP's patented kicker and micro-grooved combination on the 2\" vanes. This spins arrows up to 300% faster than conventional vanes. Result - increased accuracy, tighter groups and extended effective kill range. Award winning performance for hunting, 3D, or competition shooting.", "text": "Quickfletch Bone Collector (6-Pack), White/Green The Pros know! NAP Quikfletch shrinks your groups and extends your kill zone. The Quikfletch™ Pro Series Vane System feature NAP's patented QuikSpin SPEEDHUNTER kicker/micro-groove technology that that spins arrows up to 6 times faster than conventional vanes. Result? Stable, straight driving arrows for tack-driving accuracy and optimum penetration. QuikFletch QuikSpin ST features NAP's patented kicker and micro-grooved combination on the 2\" vanes. This spins arrows up to 300% faster than conventional vanes. Result - increased accuracy, tighter groups and extended effective kill range. Award winning performance for hunting, 3D, or competition shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51opVXXwkKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PUUCDS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Quikfletch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 25.11}}
{"item_id": "B002PW8S7S", "title": "Thermarest DreamTime, Large", "description": "Now featuring contour-hugging memory foam, the DreamTime mattress provides unmatched support and pillow top comfort. A machine-washable cover encases this foam and a luxurious, self-inflating mattress with protection for use anywhere. A microfiber top adds next-to-skin comfort for a truely decadent rest. Dimensions: 63x196cm(25x77in) Weight: 3600 grams (7lbs 15oz) Thickness: 9cm (3.5 inches) R-Value: 9.0", "text": "Thermarest DreamTime, Large Now featuring contour-hugging memory foam, the DreamTime mattress provides unmatched support and pillow top comfort. A machine-washable cover encases this foam and a luxurious, self-inflating mattress with protection for use anywhere. A microfiber top adds next-to-skin comfort for a truely decadent rest. Dimensions: 63x196cm(25x77in) Weight: 3600 grams (7lbs 15oz) Thickness: 9cm (3.5 inches) R-Value: 9.0", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319BosyZVNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PW8S7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002PW8S9Q", "title": "Thermarest Luxury Map Air Mattress, Blue", "description": "On the air mattress's interior, body-mapped foam provides added support where it's needed most.Therm-A-Rest's new Luxury Map mattress improves upon the company's most comfortable self-inflating mattress with innovative pressure mapping technology. Hidden inside the mattress, innovative die-cut foam supports the body at pressure points, resulting in a more even sleep surface and a better night's rest -- the most crucial component of any successful camping trip. A convenient stuff sack is also included.FeaturesAdvanced die-cutting selectively decreases foam density in high-pressure areasFull-density foam in low-pressure areas provides increased support where needed mostLight, compact, low-volume mattress is efficient for packing and carryingSoft, stretch-knit top and tough nonslip bottom keep you and the mattress together through the nightThree inches thick, with 6.8 R valueMade in Seattle, WASpecificationsRegular:Three-pound, seven-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 72 inches (W x D)Measures 5.4 by 21 inches (W x D) packedLarge:Four-pound, eight-ounce weightMeasures 25 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 5.6 by 26 inches (W x D) packedX-Large:Five-pound, seven-ounce weightMeasures 30 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 5.6 by 30 inches (W x D) packedLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Thermarest Luxury Map Air Mattress, Blue On the air mattress's interior, body-mapped foam provides added support where it's needed most.Therm-A-Rest's new Luxury Map mattress improves upon the company's most comfortable self-inflating mattress with innovative pressure mapping technology. Hidden inside the mattress, innovative die-cut foam supports the body at pressure points, resulting in a more even sleep surface and a better night's rest -- the most crucial component of any successful camping trip. A convenient stuff sack is also included.FeaturesAdvanced die-cutting selectively decreases foam density in high-pressure areasFull-density foam in low-pressure areas provides increased support where needed mostLight, compact, low-volume mattress is efficient for packing and carryingSoft, stretch-knit top and tough nonslip bottom keep you and the mattress together through the nightThree inches thick, with 6.8 R valueMade in Seattle, WASpecificationsRegular:Three-pound, seven-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 72 inches (W x D)Measures 5.4 by 21 inches (W x D) packedLarge:Four-pound, eight-ounce weightMeasures 25 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 5.6 by 26 inches (W x D) packedX-Large:Five-pound, seven-ounce weightMeasures 30 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 5.6 by 30 inches (W x D) packedLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P6%2BG3cBrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PW8S9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]], "price": 129.95}}
{"item_id": "B002PW8SCI", "title": "Therm-A-Rest Basecamp", "description": "Part workhorse, part luxury, the BaseCamp mattress is today’s deluxe version of the classic Therm-a-Rest® mattress—a straightforward design that’s been providing dependable comfort under the stars for over 35 years. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, we’ve updated it with an expanded foam core that makes it lighter, more compressible and an even better travel companion. Includes stuff sack.", "text": "Therm-A-Rest Basecamp Part workhorse, part luxury, the BaseCamp mattress is today’s deluxe version of the classic Therm-a-Rest® mattress—a straightforward design that’s been providing dependable comfort under the stars for over 35 years. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, we’ve updated it with an expanded foam core that makes it lighter, more compressible and an even better travel companion. Includes stuff sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Fc3-Ayr-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PW8SCI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002PYY1YA", "title": "Paul Components Stem Cap Light Mount", "description": "For those of you who care how your bike looks, Paul Components offers an elegant solution to the old problem of where to mount your headlight. The Paul Stem Cap Light Mount eliminates the handlebar traffic jam that occurs when you try to mount too many things on the dashboard. Now you can easily mount your headlight, GPS, or computer right in front of you, but still out of the way of the rest of the controls. Paul gives you this convenience in a lightweight, elegant package that saves your bars from looking like a plate of spaghetti.", "text": "Paul Components Stem Cap Light Mount For those of you who care how your bike looks, Paul Components offers an elegant solution to the old problem of where to mount your headlight. The Paul Stem Cap Light Mount eliminates the handlebar traffic jam that occurs when you try to mount too many things on the dashboard. Now you can easily mount your headlight, GPS, or computer right in front of you, but still out of the way of the rest of the controls. Paul gives you this convenience in a lightweight, elegant package that saves your bars from looking like a plate of spaghetti.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SQKJmONzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002PYY1YA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Paul", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 24.95}}
