{"item_id": "B002Q2N7R8", "title": "DE M56DL Tri-Shot CQB-L Airsoft Shotgun", "description": "- Triple Firing Fun - 3 Simultaneous BB's - Adjustable Stock - 290 fps (0.2 g BB) - Capacity: 30 Rounds / 1 Shotgun Shell - 1 Shot Gun Shell Included - Includes Speed Loader & Sling - Metal Barrel - Adjustable Front Sling Loop", "text": "DE M56DL Tri-Shot CQB-L Airsoft Shotgun - Triple Firing Fun - 3 Simultaneous BB's - Adjustable Stock - 290 fps (0.2 g BB) - Capacity: 30 Rounds / 1 Shotgun Shell - 1 Shot Gun Shell Included - Includes Speed Loader & Sling - Metal Barrel - Adjustable Front Sling Loop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31axPa87h2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q2N7R8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Shotguns"]], "price": 53.99}}
{"item_id": "B002Q3LICS", "title": "Columbia Cougar Flats II Family Cabin Dome Tent", "description": "Bring the family to the campsite and still have plenty of room to spare with the two-room Columbia Cougar Flats II cabin dome tent. The Cougar Flats II--which sleeps from six to 10 people--is equipped with both a Cyclone venting system and a GoBe Dry rain protection system. The Cyclone system greatly increases the air circulation within the tent, helping you stay cool on warmer days or dry out after a nasty rainstorm. The GoBe Dry system, meanwhile, ensures that the pounding rain won't find a way inside. The tent even includes a patented bay window design that lets you keep the windows open during the storm.The real highlight of the tent, however, is the spacious interior, which divides its ample sleeping space between two different rooms. As a result, you can give the kids one room and the adults the other, or you can use one room as a bedroom and the other as a living space. You can even zip up the divider and turn the tent into one large room. In addition, the interior of the tent offers plenty of organizational features, such as internal pockets, hanging cupholders for coffee or soft drinks, storage lockers for your clothes, and a gear loft that holds your valuables out of the way. And once it's time to leave the campsite, the tent collapses quickly into a wheeled EZ Pak storage bag, which features an expandable zippered gusset for easy stuffing.Other features include a sturdy hybrid steel/fiberglass frame with steel and fiberglass poles, two separate doors, a Camp Port for easy cable passage, and a fully seam-taped polyester fly with an 800mm waterproof coating. The Cougar Flats II measures 15 by 7.16 by 10 feet (W x H x D) and weighs 54 pounds.Key Features:Tent type: FamilySleeps: 6 to 10 peopleRooms: 2Weatherproof: GoBe Dry rain protection systemVenting: Cyclone system for air circulationCamp Port: YesWindows: 2Doors: 2Extras: Internal pockets, hanging cupholders, storage lockers, and gear loftStorage: Wheeled carrying bagRainfly: Yes, with 800mm waterproof coatingDimensions: 15 by 7.16 by 10 feet (W x H x D)Weight: 54 poundsAbout Columbia SportswearFounded in 1938, Columbia Sportswear Company has grown from a small family-owned hat distributor to one of the world's largest outerwear brands and the leading seller of skiwear in the United States. Columbia's extensive product line includes a wide variety of outerwear, sportswear, rugged footwear and accessories. Columbia specializes in developing innovative products that are functional yet stylish and offer great value. Eighty-year-old matriarch Gert Boyle, chairman of the board, and her son, Tim Boyle, president and CEO, lead the company.Columbia's history starts with Gert's parents, Paul and Marie Lamfrom, when they fled Germany in 1937. They bought a small hat distributorship in Portland, Oregon, and named it Columbia Hat Company, after the river bordering the city. Soon frustrated by poor deliveries from suppliers, the Lamfroms decided to start manufacturing products themselves. In 1948, Gert married college sweetheart Neal Boyle, who joined the family business and later took the helm of the growing company. When Neal suddenly died of a heart attack in 1970, Gert enlisted help from Tim, then a college senior. After that it wasn't long before business really started to take off. Columbia was one of the first companies to make jackets from waterproof/breathable fabric. The company introduced the breakthrough technology called the Columbia Interchange System, in which a shell and liner combine for multiple wearing options. In the early 1980s, then-60-year-old Gert began her role as \"Mother Boyle\" in Columbia's successful and popular advertising campaign.The company went public in 1998 and moved into a new era as a world leader in the active outdoor apparel industry. Today, Columbia Sportswear employs more than 1,800 people around the world and distributes and sells products in more than 50 countries and to more than 12,000 retailers internationally.", "text": "Columbia Cougar Flats II Family Cabin Dome Tent Bring the family to the campsite and still have plenty of room to spare with the two-room Columbia Cougar Flats II cabin dome tent. The Cougar Flats II--which sleeps from six to 10 people--is equipped with both a Cyclone venting system and a GoBe Dry rain protection system. The Cyclone system greatly increases the air circulation within the tent, helping you stay cool on warmer days or dry out after a nasty rainstorm. The GoBe Dry system, meanwhile, ensures that the pounding rain won't find a way inside. The tent even includes a patented bay window design that lets you keep the windows open during the storm.The real highlight of the tent, however, is the spacious interior, which divides its ample sleeping space between two different rooms. As a result, you can give the kids one room and the adults the other, or you can use one room as a bedroom and the other as a living space. You can even zip up the divider and turn the tent into one large room. In addition, the interior of the tent offers plenty of organizational features, such as internal pockets, hanging cupholders for coffee or soft drinks, storage lockers for your clothes, and a gear loft that holds your valuables out of the way. And once it's time to leave the campsite, the tent collapses quickly into a wheeled EZ Pak storage bag, which features an expandable zippered gusset for easy stuffing.Other features include a sturdy hybrid steel/fiberglass frame with steel and fiberglass poles, two separate doors, a Camp Port for easy cable passage, and a fully seam-taped polyester fly with an 800mm waterproof coating. The Cougar Flats II measures 15 by 7.16 by 10 feet (W x H x D) and weighs 54 pounds.Key Features:Tent type: FamilySleeps: 6 to 10 peopleRooms: 2Weatherproof: GoBe Dry rain protection systemVenting: Cyclone system for air circulationCamp Port: YesWindows: 2Doors: 2Extras: Internal pockets, hanging cupholders, storage lockers, and gear loftStorage: Wheeled carrying bagRainfly: Yes, with 800mm waterproof coatingDimensions: 15 by 7.16 by 10 feet (W x H x D)Weight: 54 poundsAbout Columbia SportswearFounded in 1938, Columbia Sportswear Company has grown from a small family-owned hat distributor to one of the world's largest outerwear brands and the leading seller of skiwear in the United States. Columbia's extensive product line includes a wide variety of outerwear, sportswear, rugged footwear and accessories. Columbia specializes in developing innovative products that are functional yet stylish and offer great value. Eighty-year-old matriarch Gert Boyle, chairman of the board, and her son, Tim Boyle, president and CEO, lead the company.Columbia's history starts with Gert's parents, Paul and Marie Lamfrom, when they fled Germany in 1937. They bought a small hat distributorship in Portland, Oregon, and named it Columbia Hat Company, after the river bordering the city. Soon frustrated by poor deliveries from suppliers, the Lamfroms decided to start manufacturing products themselves. In 1948, Gert married college sweetheart Neal Boyle, who joined the family business and later took the helm of the growing company. When Neal suddenly died of a heart attack in 1970, Gert enlisted help from Tim, then a college senior. After that it wasn't long before business really started to take off. Columbia was one of the first companies to make jackets from waterproof/breathable fabric. The company introduced the breakthrough technology called the Columbia Interchange System, in which a shell and liner combine for multiple wearing options. In the early 1980s, then-60-year-old Gert began her role as \"Mother Boyle\" in Columbia's successful and popular advertising campaign.The company went public in 1998 and moved into a new era as a world leader in the active outdoor apparel industry. Today, Columbia Sportswear employs more than 1,800 people around the world and distributes and sells products in more than 50 countries and to more than 12,000 retailers internationally.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417VQRJ9n4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q3LICS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6CL1W", "title": "Truglo Fiber Optic Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P, Red/Green", "description": "The TRUGLO Fiber Optic handgun sights use our traditional fiber optic technology. CNC-machined steel construction. Contrasting red front and green rear. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "text": "Truglo Fiber Optic Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P, Red/Green The TRUGLO Fiber Optic handgun sights use our traditional fiber optic technology. CNC-machined steel construction. Contrasting red front and green rear. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21-ZlXlrRML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6CL1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 42.45}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6DB7A", "title": "Radians Eclipse RXT Photochromic Lens with Black Frame Glass", "description": "The Eclipse RXT utilizes photochromic technology. The photochromic lenses darken or lighten according to the amount of UV rays exposed to them. The frameless design provides a unobstructed view and the aluminum alloy temples provides lightweight comfort with durable strength. Reverse hinges and adjustable nosepiece provides a custom fit.", "text": "Radians Eclipse RXT Photochromic Lens with Black Frame Glass The Eclipse RXT utilizes photochromic technology. The photochromic lenses darken or lighten according to the amount of UV rays exposed to them. The frameless design provides a unobstructed view and the aluminum alloy temples provides lightweight comfort with durable strength. Reverse hinges and adjustable nosepiece provides a custom fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31puBxjaVEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6DB7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 61.99}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6ETC6", "title": "Barnett Outdoors X Blade Expandable Broadheads 125 Grain", "description": "These 125-grain broadheads are ideal for crossbow hunters, and feature a patented, mechanized tip that's pushed in upon impact, locking the blades into place at both the point of entry and exit. The rear-deploying blades won't deflect on angled shots, because the blades are locked open before entering their target, and you can reset the broadhead by pulling the tip back out. The set of three broadheads is intended for use with 20- or 22-inch crossbow arrows, and each has a 1.375-inch cutting diameter.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Outdoors X Blade Expandable Broadheads 125 Grain These 125-grain broadheads are ideal for crossbow hunters, and feature a patented, mechanized tip that's pushed in upon impact, locking the blades into place at both the point of entry and exit. The rear-deploying blades won't deflect on angled shots, because the blades are locked open before entering their target, and you can reset the broadhead by pulling the tip back out. The set of three broadheads is intended for use with 20- or 22-inch crossbow arrows, and each has a 1.375-inch cutting diameter.WarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tP3yBoBFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6ETC6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6GTK6", "title": "Itac Defense Roto Retention Paddle Holster fits SIG PRO SP2022 for SIG", "description": "Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Note: Will not fit serial number 24Axxxxx or 24Bxxxxx series pistols the tac rail is a true picatinny (mil Spec) rail. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at “The Ready” - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Protective sight channel Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer SP2022 Models", "text": "Itac Defense Roto Retention Paddle Holster fits SIG PRO SP2022 for SIG Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Note: Will not fit serial number 24Axxxxx or 24Bxxxxx series pistols the tac rail is a true picatinny (mil Spec) rail. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at “The Ready” - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Protective sight channel Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer SP2022 Models", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jwT5uL56L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6GTK6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.1}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6ILG6", "title": "Pelican Storm IM3300-00001 Pelican Storm iM3300 Case with Foam, (Black)", "description": "You've got equipment to protect, and a Pelican Storm Case is the best way to do it. Why? It's all about the resin: our proprietary HPX Polymer is proven to resist impacts even in low-temperature laboratory testing. But the real proof is in the bragging rights that come with survival. Because to a Pelican Storm Case, whether falling from a helicopter, crashing down class V rapids or taking a hit in the center lane of the New Jersey turnpike is all in a day's work.", "text": "Pelican Storm IM3300-00001 Pelican Storm iM3300 Case with Foam, (Black) You've got equipment to protect, and a Pelican Storm Case is the best way to do it. Why? It's all about the resin: our proprietary HPX Polymer is proven to resist impacts even in low-temperature laboratory testing. But the real proof is in the bragging rights that come with survival. Because to a Pelican Storm Case, whether falling from a helicopter, crashing down class V rapids or taking a hit in the center lane of the New Jersey turnpike is all in a day's work.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fg2JNdZqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6ILG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pelican", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 244.57}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6OD4K", "title": "Keystone KSA035P Rifle Case", "description": "KSA Crickett Case Hot Pink PADDED PINK GUN CASE. Rifles with scopes will fit in cases. Includes Davey Crickett Logo \"My First Rifle\" \"-Not a toy-\".Thick padding to protect rifle. Dimensions: 34\" (Length) X 7\" (Width). Manufacturer: CRICKETT Model: 035HP", "text": "Keystone KSA035P Rifle Case KSA Crickett Case Hot Pink PADDED PINK GUN CASE. Rifles with scopes will fit in cases. Includes Davey Crickett Logo \"My First Rifle\" \"-Not a toy-\".Thick padding to protect rifle. Dimensions: 34\" (Length) X 7\" (Width). Manufacturer: CRICKETT Model: 035HP", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WgCI0EyxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6OD4K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Keystone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 22.59}}
{"item_id": "B002Q6UQIW", "title": "Mako 7X Magnifier for Red Dot/Reflex Sights (3rd Generation) - Black", "description": "7-power magnifier mounts behind reflex (red-dot) sights to provide magnification when needed. Transition between no magnification for speed in close-range combat and magnification for precision shooting as situation dictates. Rugged construction. Multi-coated lenses and 30mm tube for excellent light transmission. Nitrogen purged, shockproof, waterproof, and fogproof.", "text": "Mako 7X Magnifier for Red Dot/Reflex Sights (3rd Generation) - Black 7-power magnifier mounts behind reflex (red-dot) sights to provide magnification when needed. Transition between no magnification for speed in close-range combat and magnification for precision shooting as situation dictates. Rugged construction. Multi-coated lenses and 30mm tube for excellent light transmission. Nitrogen purged, shockproof, waterproof, and fogproof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YdCrvtUiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q6UQIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B002Q759YC", "title": "Firefield Shotgun Flashlight", "description": "Firefield Tactical Shotgun Flashlight Features Up to 120 lumens Weapons mountable - will mount to any 1” tube Tactical momentary “On” remote pressure pad Push button On/Off battery cap Integrated Weaver mount on weapons mount Can handle recoil of 12 Gauge shotgun", "text": "Firefield Shotgun Flashlight Firefield Tactical Shotgun Flashlight Features Up to 120 lumens Weapons mountable - will mount to any 1” tube Tactical momentary “On” remote pressure pad Push button On/Off battery cap Integrated Weaver mount on weapons mount Can handle recoil of 12 Gauge shotgun", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31drapJwMAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q759YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Firefield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 28.22}}
{"item_id": "B002Q83CPY", "title": "Safariland Beretta 92, 92F, 92FS, 92D 4.9-Inch Barrel 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Beretta 92, 92F, 92FS, 92D 4.9-Inch Barrel 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VPy-HcTNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Q83CPY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.97}}
{"item_id": "B002QACUGO", "title": "Okuma Classic Levelwind Trolling Reel", "description": "Okuma-Feet s classic level wind drag reels are a graphite frame trolling reel has a ported graphite frame design with multi disc rubidium drag system. With a dependable multi-disc Rubidium drag system, self lubricating gear system, stainless steel level wind line guide system the Classic reel is ready to fish anywhere. Classic series is backed by a standard one year warranty.", "text": "Okuma Classic Levelwind Trolling Reel Okuma-Feet s classic level wind drag reels are a graphite frame trolling reel has a ported graphite frame design with multi disc rubidium drag system. With a dependable multi-disc Rubidium drag system, self lubricating gear system, stainless steel level wind line guide system the Classic reel is ready to fish anywhere. Classic series is backed by a standard one year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hkWbZ8R%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QACUGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels"]], "price": 36.09}}
{"item_id": "B002QAG6MI", "title": "Rothco Black Raider I Boot Knife", "description": "Keep your knife close at hand with the Rothco Black Raider I boot knife. The Black Raider I features a sharp stainless-steel blade with a matte black finish, giving it a sleek, long-lasting appeal. You can also fasten the knife to your belt thanks to the leather sheath, which comes with a stainless-steel belt clip. The Black Raider I measures 9 inches long.", "text": "Rothco Black Raider I Boot Knife Keep your knife close at hand with the Rothco Black Raider I boot knife. The Black Raider I features a sharp stainless-steel blade with a matte black finish, giving it a sleek, long-lasting appeal. You can also fasten the knife to your belt thanks to the leather sheath, which comes with a stainless-steel belt clip. The Black Raider I measures 9 inches long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FRYiWma4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QAG6MI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B002QAVQ14", "title": "InSTEP Take 2 Double Bicycle Trailer", "description": "Take your family out on a bike ride in style with the InSTEP Take 2 Double Bicycle Trailer. While you'll appreciate the lightweight aluminum frame for carrying ease and fast assembly, it's durable enough to hold two children with a combined weight of up to 80 pounds. The 2-in-1 light blue canopy is crafted with a mesh screen to keep bugs away. It also features a weather shield to keep wind and raindrops from dampening your fun. On the inside, you'll find a sturdy harness to help secure your little passengers. The 16-inch pneumatic tires feature a quick release to make storage easier, while the versatile coupler on the front of the trailer will attach to almost any bike. Optional stroller kit sold separately. About InSTEP Now you can spend more time with your little one, get in the workout you need, and show your children how much fun a healthy lifestyle can be - and without the sticker shock. InSTEP prides itself on providing joggers and trailers that not only measure up to your expectations of comfort, performance, and convenience, but also appease your budget with outstanding value prices. InSTEP products have more features, more function, tasteful style, and sharp colors that you will be proud to roll out on the town. Hey, becoming a parent doesn't have to mean surrendering your sense of taste. Canopy with bug screen and weather shield. Frame folds, wheels release for easy storage. 16-in. pneumatic tires roll smoothly. Harness secures child in seat. Holds 2 children; 40 lbs. maximum weight each.", "text": "InSTEP Take 2 Double Bicycle Trailer Take your family out on a bike ride in style with the InSTEP Take 2 Double Bicycle Trailer. While you'll appreciate the lightweight aluminum frame for carrying ease and fast assembly, it's durable enough to hold two children with a combined weight of up to 80 pounds. The 2-in-1 light blue canopy is crafted with a mesh screen to keep bugs away. It also features a weather shield to keep wind and raindrops from dampening your fun. On the inside, you'll find a sturdy harness to help secure your little passengers. The 16-inch pneumatic tires feature a quick release to make storage easier, while the versatile coupler on the front of the trailer will attach to almost any bike. Optional stroller kit sold separately. About InSTEP Now you can spend more time with your little one, get in the workout you need, and show your children how much fun a healthy lifestyle can be - and without the sticker shock. InSTEP prides itself on providing joggers and trailers that not only measure up to your expectations of comfort, performance, and convenience, but also appease your budget with outstanding value prices. InSTEP products have more features, more function, tasteful style, and sharp colors that you will be proud to roll out on the town. Hey, becoming a parent doesn't have to mean surrendering your sense of taste. Canopy with bug screen and weather shield. Frame folds, wheels release for easy storage. 16-in. pneumatic tires roll smoothly. Harness secures child in seat. Holds 2 children; 40 lbs. maximum weight each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414GENqVAuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QAVQ14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B002QAVQ2S", "title": "InStep Sierra Double Bicycle Trailer", "description": "Take your kids for a bike ride in the Instep Sierra Double Bicycle Trailer with 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims for superior performance and durability. The 2-in-1 canopy includes a bug screen and weather shield and the versatile bicycle coupler attaches to most bicycles. The parking brake offers extra safety while in stroller mode and a deluxe harness and seat has padding for added child comfort. Other features include a stroller kit with swiveling front wheel and handle bar and a folding frame design with quick-release wheels for compact transport and storage.A dual trigger folding mechanism makes folding the jogger for transport easy and safe.Features:16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and styleFolding frame design with quick release wheels makes compact2-in-1 canopy includes a bug screen and weather shieldVersatile bicycle coupler attaches to most bicyclesIncludes stroller kit with swiveling front wheel & handle barParking brake offers extra safety while in stroller modeDeluxe harness & seat with padding for added child comfortSpecifications:Assembled Weight: 33.08 poundsWeight Limit: 80 poundsInstep's Stance on SafetyInstep is a proud member of the JPMA organization and choose to have our strollers tested by an independent testing laboratory to the specific ASTM standard to ensure each and every stroller is safe. Instep recommends that a child be at least 6 months of age before putting him/her in any stroller. Bike trailers are not for use with children under the age of 12 months or one year. Children must be able to support the weight of their heads so they can support the weight of a helmet, which is always recommended for use while a child is riding in a trailer.", "text": "InStep Sierra Double Bicycle Trailer Take your kids for a bike ride in the Instep Sierra Double Bicycle Trailer with 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims for superior performance and durability. The 2-in-1 canopy includes a bug screen and weather shield and the versatile bicycle coupler attaches to most bicycles. The parking brake offers extra safety while in stroller mode and a deluxe harness and seat has padding for added child comfort. Other features include a stroller kit with swiveling front wheel and handle bar and a folding frame design with quick-release wheels for compact transport and storage.A dual trigger folding mechanism makes folding the jogger for transport easy and safe.Features:16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and styleFolding frame design with quick release wheels makes compact2-in-1 canopy includes a bug screen and weather shieldVersatile bicycle coupler attaches to most bicyclesIncludes stroller kit with swiveling front wheel & handle barParking brake offers extra safety while in stroller modeDeluxe harness & seat with padding for added child comfortSpecifications:Assembled Weight: 33.08 poundsWeight Limit: 80 poundsInstep's Stance on SafetyInstep is a proud member of the JPMA organization and choose to have our strollers tested by an independent testing laboratory to the specific ASTM standard to ensure each and every stroller is safe. Instep recommends that a child be at least 6 months of age before putting him/her in any stroller. Bike trailers are not for use with children under the age of 12 months or one year. Children must be able to support the weight of their heads so they can support the weight of a helmet, which is always recommended for use while a child is riding in a trailer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413bg-5y20L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QAVQ2S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pacific Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 160.49}}
{"item_id": "B002QAZ8WC", "title": "InStep Sync Single Bicycle Trailer, Green/Gray", "description": "The entire trailer packs down to a remarkably compact size, allowing for easy transport.Take your kids along on the next bike ride while keeping them safe, dry, and comfortable in the InStep Sync trailer. An outstanding value for family-minded recreational cyclists, it boasts a simple design that folds down for easy storage and transportation and a versatile coupler attaches to almost any bicycle. 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and style in spades, and the two-in-one canopy has a bug screen and weather shield to keep your precious cargo protected.", "text": "InStep Sync Single Bicycle Trailer, Green/Gray The entire trailer packs down to a remarkably compact size, allowing for easy transport.Take your kids along on the next bike ride while keeping them safe, dry, and comfortable in the InStep Sync trailer. An outstanding value for family-minded recreational cyclists, it boasts a simple design that folds down for easy storage and transportation and a versatile coupler attaches to almost any bicycle. 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and style in spades, and the two-in-one canopy has a bug screen and weather shield to keep your precious cargo protected.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zMWkv3%2B9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QAZ8WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pacific Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 98.0}}
{"item_id": "B002QAZ8ZY", "title": "InStep Quick N EZ Double Bicycle Trailer", "description": "The entire trailer packs down to a remarkably compact size, allowing for easy transport.Take your kids along on the next bike ride while keeping them safe, dry, and comfortable in the InStep Quick N EZ trailer. An outstanding value for family-minded recreational cyclists, it boasts a simple design that folds down for easy storage and transportation. 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and style in spades, and the two-in-one canopy has a bug screen and weather shield to keep your precious cargo protected.A versatile coupler attaches to almost any bicycle, and the included stroller kit with swiveling front wheel and handle bar means this versatile device instantly transforms into a double stroller in seconds. The 33-pound trailer has a 80-pound weight limit.", "text": "InStep Quick N EZ Double Bicycle Trailer The entire trailer packs down to a remarkably compact size, allowing for easy transport.Take your kids along on the next bike ride while keeping them safe, dry, and comfortable in the InStep Quick N EZ trailer. An outstanding value for family-minded recreational cyclists, it boasts a simple design that folds down for easy storage and transportation. 16-inch pneumatic tires with molded rims provide performance and style in spades, and the two-in-one canopy has a bug screen and weather shield to keep your precious cargo protected.A versatile coupler attaches to almost any bicycle, and the included stroller kit with swiveling front wheel and handle bar means this versatile device instantly transforms into a double stroller in seconds. The 33-pound trailer has a 80-pound weight limit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XfvMta-xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QAZ8ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pacific Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 178.76}}
{"item_id": "B002QB02EK", "title": "Winchester by Daisy Outdoor Products 2-7 x 32 AO Winchester Scope (Black, 2-7 x 32)", "description": "This scope features 2-7 variable power with cross-hair reticle, Adjustable objective, Fully adjustable for windage and elevation, Fog proof and shock resistant, and Mounting hardware", "text": "Winchester by Daisy Outdoor Products 2-7 x 32 AO Winchester Scope (Black, 2-7 x 32) This scope features 2-7 variable power with cross-hair reticle, Adjustable objective, Fully adjustable for windage and elevation, Fog proof and shock resistant, and Mounting hardware", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oojN836IL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QB02EK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B002QBUL5U", "title": "Extreme Shock Black Gripwell CQB Mag Grip Md: GRIPWELL .", "description": "Extreme Shock Black Gripwell CQB Mag Grip Md: GRIPWELL, The Gripwell weighs in at 110 grams. The Gripwell is independent of the barrel length and can be interchanged between a full length weapon and a carbine length. In high stress environment it has been shown that gross motor skills can be repeated without conscious thought where fine motor skills take repetitious training to be able to be accomplished properly and with speed. The Gripwell allows the operator to reload quickly by adding a funnel to the magazine well that allows the use of gross motor skills. This has shown reduction of up to 21% in time per magazine change in newer personnel and 12% in trained operators., Type: Grip Model/Style: GW Color: Black Size: N/A Material: N/A, Manufacturer: EXTREME SHOCK USA, Model: GRIPWELL", "text": "Extreme Shock Black Gripwell CQB Mag Grip Md: GRIPWELL . Extreme Shock Black Gripwell CQB Mag Grip Md: GRIPWELL, The Gripwell weighs in at 110 grams. The Gripwell is independent of the barrel length and can be interchanged between a full length weapon and a carbine length. In high stress environment it has been shown that gross motor skills can be repeated without conscious thought where fine motor skills take repetitious training to be able to be accomplished properly and with speed. The Gripwell allows the operator to reload quickly by adding a funnel to the magazine well that allows the use of gross motor skills. This has shown reduction of up to 21% in time per magazine change in newer personnel and 12% in trained operators., Type: Grip Model/Style: GW Color: Black Size: N/A Material: N/A, Manufacturer: EXTREME SHOCK USA, Model: GRIPWELL", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31G5Qrs8PuL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QBUL5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EXTREME SHOCK USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B002QEDRI0", "title": "Benchmade 585 Mini Barrage", "description": "AXIS locking mechanism with dual thumb-stud openerReversible tip-up pocket clipBenchmade's Free Knife sharpening for life - $5 for postageLimited Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Benchmade 585 Mini Barrage AXIS locking mechanism with dual thumb-stud openerReversible tip-up pocket clipBenchmade's Free Knife sharpening for life - $5 for postageLimited Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Eq4sorLhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QEDRI0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002QEGVQA", "title": "Schrade 735RPB Mariners Knife and Marlin Spike, Red Pick Bone Handle", "description": "The Mariner's Knife features a red pick-bone handle with ship's wheel inlay, and stainless steel blade.", "text": "Schrade 735RPB Mariners Knife and Marlin Spike, Red Pick Bone Handle The Mariner's Knife features a red pick-bone handle with ship's wheel inlay, and stainless steel blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ljQ-NaecL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QEGVQA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 31.33}}
{"item_id": "B002QEJRAM", "title": "Benchmade 580 Barrage Osborne Design Knife", "description": "For the first time ever, Benchmade’s best selling AXIS lock gets a boost. These spring assisted models combine speed and strength in one complete package.", "text": "Benchmade 580 Barrage Osborne Design Knife For the first time ever, Benchmade’s best selling AXIS lock gets a boost. These spring assisted models combine speed and strength in one complete package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zXZbNZuKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QEJRAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 127.5}}
{"item_id": "B002QETQZ8", "title": "Stack-On GCG-500 Pistol Ammo Security Cabinet with 1 shelf, Hunter Green", "description": "Stack-On GCG-500 Steel Pistol / Ammo Cabinet is a California approved firearms safety device that meets the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued thereunder. This steel cabinet has a locking mechanism passes through steel door and is secured behind the steel door frame for added security. This unit is fully lockable with key coded, double-bitted lock. The GCG-500 cabinet includes 1 removable shelf and foam padded bottom. Both the Stack-On GCB-500 and Stack-On GCG-500 fit on top of all standard pre-assembled Security Plus Gun Cabinets.", "text": "Stack-On GCG-500 Pistol Ammo Security Cabinet with 1 shelf, Hunter Green Stack-On GCG-500 Steel Pistol / Ammo Cabinet is a California approved firearms safety device that meets the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued thereunder. This steel cabinet has a locking mechanism passes through steel door and is secured behind the steel door frame for added security. This unit is fully lockable with key coded, double-bitted lock. The GCG-500 cabinet includes 1 removable shelf and foam padded bottom. Both the Stack-On GCB-500 and Stack-On GCG-500 fit on top of all standard pre-assembled Security Plus Gun Cabinets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f-ikltt-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QETQZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 65.4}}
{"item_id": "B002QEUPEE", "title": "Burris 300208 AR-332 3x32 Prism Sight (Black)", "description": "The Burris XTR Base was made to meet the demands of extreme shooters. Ask most marksmen what contributes to their accuracy over any distance and they’ll brag about their scopes, barrels, triggers or even skill. At Burris we know the true building blocks of an accurate shooting system are the rings and bases. To consistently put your rounds on target time and time again, your scope needs to be properly aligned and anchored to your gun. That’s why every ring and base we offer is computer designed and engineered to specifications that would make NASA proud. They guarantee precise optical alignment and shot placement. They will withstand years of use and punishing recoil and look good with any scope on any gun. Go ahead. Give all the credit to your gun, scope or shooting skills. Just remember that without Burris rings and bases, you wouldn’t have that accuracy to brag about", "text": "Burris 300208 AR-332 3x32 Prism Sight (Black) The Burris XTR Base was made to meet the demands of extreme shooters. Ask most marksmen what contributes to their accuracy over any distance and they’ll brag about their scopes, barrels, triggers or even skill. At Burris we know the true building blocks of an accurate shooting system are the rings and bases. To consistently put your rounds on target time and time again, your scope needs to be properly aligned and anchored to your gun. That’s why every ring and base we offer is computer designed and engineered to specifications that would make NASA proud. They guarantee precise optical alignment and shot placement. They will withstand years of use and punishing recoil and look good with any scope on any gun. Go ahead. Give all the credit to your gun, scope or shooting skills. Just remember that without Burris rings and bases, you wouldn’t have that accuracy to brag about", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M9Nc-lxqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QEUPEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 299.99}}
