{"item_id": "B002QG1EMO", "title": "Outdoor Products Trekking Pole", "description": "Trek through the seasons with ease and the sure-footedness of a mountain goat.", "text": "Outdoor Products Trekking Pole Trek through the seasons with ease and the sure-footedness of a mountain goat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TqijDUZaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QG1EMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002QG1P6E", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat", "description": "Add an ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat to the bottom of your sleeping bag to improve the level of comfort. The foam mats are all extremely lightweight so you won't be hauling along too much extra weight on your next hike, but will be adding enough padding to make a noticeable difference in how well you sleep at night. The textured foam insulates to keep you warmer and also keeps the mat from sliding around. Each foam mat comes with straps so when you're finished, you can roll it up and easily transport and store it. Dense closed cell textured foam, Protects and insulates. Six sizes available: Regular 375 (#7551007), Regular 625 (#7552011), Regular 750 (#7552999), Large 625 (#7553011), Large 750 (#7553999), Extra Large 625 (#7554011). Refer to sizing chart for dimensions.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat Add an ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat to the bottom of your sleeping bag to improve the level of comfort. The foam mats are all extremely lightweight so you won't be hauling along too much extra weight on your next hike, but will be adding enough padding to make a noticeable difference in how well you sleep at night. The textured foam insulates to keep you warmer and also keeps the mat from sliding around. Each foam mat comes with straps so when you're finished, you can roll it up and easily transport and store it. Dense closed cell textured foam, Protects and insulates. Six sizes available: Regular 375 (#7551007), Regular 625 (#7552011), Regular 750 (#7552999), Large 625 (#7553011), Large 750 (#7553999), Extra Large 625 (#7554011). Refer to sizing chart for dimensions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CAyps7okL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QG1P6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 18.07}}
{"item_id": "B002QG1WJY", "title": "Easton Quick Bond Fletch Glue 1oz", "description": "Adhesive that works well for attaching nocks and vanes to carbon, aluminum and fiberglass shafts. It bonds in seconds and comes in a 1 oz. bottle.", "text": "Easton Quick Bond Fletch Glue 1oz Adhesive that works well for attaching nocks and vanes to carbon, aluminum and fiberglass shafts. It bonds in seconds and comes in a 1 oz. bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A-GCAhZDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QG1WJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eastman Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Fletches"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B002QG3DAA", "title": "Primos Gunhunter's Vest", "description": "The GunHunter-Feets Vest keeps everything that is essential to gun and muzzloader hunters stored and organized. Jimmy Primos and members of the Primos Team have been working on perfecting this vest for 3 years. All the features of the GunHunter-Feets Vest are here to keep you organized, comfortable and ready to make the shot. The GunHunter-Feets Vest has hand warmer pockets, large button pockets on the exterior for binoculars with interior shot gun shell loops.", "text": "Primos Gunhunter's Vest The GunHunter-Feets Vest keeps everything that is essential to gun and muzzloader hunters stored and organized. Jimmy Primos and members of the Primos Team have been working on perfecting this vest for 3 years. All the features of the GunHunter-Feets Vest are here to keep you organized, comfortable and ready to make the shot. The GunHunter-Feets Vest has hand warmer pockets, large button pockets on the exterior for binoculars with interior shot gun shell loops.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YUOphvBeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QG3DAA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
