{"item_id": "B002QJZADK", "title": "Universal Decline Bench", "description": "The surprisingly versatile, compact bench offers numerous core-strengthening exercises.The simple, effective challenge of a free weight workout remains one of the most efficient ways to build strength and muscle mass. The Universal decline bench, from parent company Nautilus, offers a wide variety of core workouts, from sit-ups to twists and more. Users can choose from two decline positions, while eight-inch padded foam rollers keep feet comfortably and safely in place. The bench measures 17 by 23 by 45 inches (W x H x D) and has a 200-pound maximum user weight.", "text": "Universal Decline Bench The surprisingly versatile, compact bench offers numerous core-strengthening exercises.The simple, effective challenge of a free weight workout remains one of the most efficient ways to build strength and muscle mass. The Universal decline bench, from parent company Nautilus, offers a wide variety of core workouts, from sit-ups to twists and more. Users can choose from two decline positions, while eight-inch padded foam rollers keep feet comfortably and safely in place. The bench measures 17 by 23 by 45 inches (W x H x D) and has a 200-pound maximum user weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rx7YbvyIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QJZADK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Universal by Nautilus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]], "price": 59.98}}
{"item_id": "B002QJZAE4", "title": "Universal Five-Position Weight Bench", "description": "The simple, effective challenge of a free weight workout remains one of the most efficient ways to build strength and muscle mass. The Universal Five-Position bench, from parent company Nautilus, offers positions of -10, 0, 15, 30, and 45 degrees, and dozens of exercises to challenge your entire core and upper body. Its contoured shape and five-inch foam rollers ensure a safe and comfortable workout, while stabilizer levelers provide a stable base on almost any type of flooring. The bench measures 17 by 25 by 51 inches (W x H x D). It has a 250-pound maximum user weight and a maximum combined user weight and lift load of 430 pounds.", "text": "Universal Five-Position Weight Bench The simple, effective challenge of a free weight workout remains one of the most efficient ways to build strength and muscle mass. The Universal Five-Position bench, from parent company Nautilus, offers positions of -10, 0, 15, 30, and 45 degrees, and dozens of exercises to challenge your entire core and upper body. Its contoured shape and five-inch foam rollers ensure a safe and comfortable workout, while stabilizer levelers provide a stable base on almost any type of flooring. The bench measures 17 by 25 by 51 inches (W x H x D). It has a 250-pound maximum user weight and a maximum combined user weight and lift load of 430 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KCQ1U5xmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QJZAE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Universal by Nautilus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]], "price": 129.98}}
{"item_id": "B002QK39J6", "title": "Fobus Roto Level 2 Thumb Holster RH Roto-Paddle & Belt GL2PB Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32/34/35 Level 2 Thumb Lever", "description": "Need quick access and level 2 retention? The new FOBUS thumb release holster is your solution. Giving you instant access to your handgun, utilizing a thumb release lever mechanism, retention and speed are your allies. No need to alter your presentation or grip, the handgun is released during natural draw stroke with a smooth and quick motion. A revolutionary retention concept engages the trigger guard area during re-holstering, keeping the handgun secure at all times. Available in Roto Paddle and up to 1.75\" Belt.", "text": "Fobus Roto Level 2 Thumb Holster RH Roto-Paddle & Belt GL2PB Glock 17/19/22/23/31/32/34/35 Level 2 Thumb Lever Need quick access and level 2 retention? The new FOBUS thumb release holster is your solution. Giving you instant access to your handgun, utilizing a thumb release lever mechanism, retention and speed are your allies. No need to alter your presentation or grip, the handgun is released during natural draw stroke with a smooth and quick motion. A revolutionary retention concept engages the trigger guard area during re-holstering, keeping the handgun secure at all times. Available in Roto Paddle and up to 1.75\" Belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-W-glggiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QK39J6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.28}}
