{"item_id": "B002QWB8HY", "title": "CamelBak BFM 3L Backpack", "description": "Includes the 100 oz (3 L) Mil Spec AntidoteTM Long Reservoir with Quick LinkTM Exit Port Reservoir Features:More than just a reservoir, the Mil Spec AntidoteTM Reservoir redefines the ultimate delivery system for an operator's water supply and provides maximum adaptability for changing missions or combat environments. Includes our Quick LinkTM Exit Port and QL HydroLockTM Bite Valve Adapter: tube clicks off for faster refilling with auto shut-off; new Fillport: industry's largest opening with air-light turn open/close for quick, secure seal that can't be over-tightened; lighter-weight, lower-profile design. Key Pack Features:Shoulder harness and back panel provide better load distribution and comfort while carrying a heavy load, Full clamshell opening for easy access to gear and MedBakTM Insert (sold separately), 4 zippers on main compartment allow for multiple access points to gear, ASIPS Radio attachment points hold communications securely with dual antenna ports, Glasses, goggles and NVG pocket with external access, Multiple drink tube exit ports -- for routing drink tube over the shoulder or under an arm, Lightweight, durable 1000D Cordura Fabric", "text": "CamelBak BFM 3L Backpack Includes the 100 oz (3 L) Mil Spec AntidoteTM Long Reservoir with Quick LinkTM Exit Port Reservoir Features:More than just a reservoir, the Mil Spec AntidoteTM Reservoir redefines the ultimate delivery system for an operator's water supply and provides maximum adaptability for changing missions or combat environments. Includes our Quick LinkTM Exit Port and QL HydroLockTM Bite Valve Adapter: tube clicks off for faster refilling with auto shut-off; new Fillport: industry's largest opening with air-light turn open/close for quick, secure seal that can't be over-tightened; lighter-weight, lower-profile design. Key Pack Features:Shoulder harness and back panel provide better load distribution and comfort while carrying a heavy load, Full clamshell opening for easy access to gear and MedBakTM Insert (sold separately), 4 zippers on main compartment allow for multiple access points to gear, ASIPS Radio attachment points hold communications securely with dual antenna ports, Glasses, goggles and NVG pocket with external access, Multiple drink tube exit ports -- for routing drink tube over the shoulder or under an arm, Lightweight, durable 1000D Cordura Fabric", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C--UkkTPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QWB8HY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 214.01}}
{"item_id": "B002QWG0DQ", "title": "Camelbak MOLLE Attachable Bottle Pouch", "description": "CamelBak's Bottle Pouch will specifically carry either a 0.75 L (25 oz) or 1.0 L (33 oz) CamelBak Bottle while securely fastened to any MOLLE attachment system.", "text": "Camelbak MOLLE Attachable Bottle Pouch CamelBak's Bottle Pouch will specifically carry either a 0.75 L (25 oz) or 1.0 L (33 oz) CamelBak Bottle while securely fastened to any MOLLE attachment system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gZHKDOKBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QWG0DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 20.44}}
{"item_id": "B002QWKRNU", "title": "Pocket Holster for Keltec P32 & P3AT, 32 & 380", "description": "It is a slim-line, soft sided holster with a band of genuine suede wrapped around the outside of the holster. It is designed for use inside the front pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "text": "Pocket Holster for Keltec P32 & P3AT, 32 & 380 It is a slim-line, soft sided holster with a band of genuine suede wrapped around the outside of the holster. It is designed for use inside the front pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414zcK4esJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QWKRNU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.9}}
