{"item_id": "B002QX2A2K", "title": "Camelbak 70 oz/2.0L MG Omega Reservoir 90271", "description": "CamelBak 90271 Omega Water Beast, 70 oz., BlackThe OMEGA Water Beast\" Reservoir is the ultimate delivery system for an operator's water supply. The reservoir€TMs proven durability, OMEGA wide mouth opening, rugged materials ensures the reliable delivery of water during extreme operational situations. Also includes Big Bite\" Valve and HydroGuard\" Technology. Our reservoirs are 100% BPA-Free, so you can be worry free.", "text": "Camelbak 70 oz/2.0L MG Omega Reservoir 90271 CamelBak 90271 Omega Water Beast, 70 oz., BlackThe OMEGA Water Beast\" Reservoir is the ultimate delivery system for an operator's water supply. The reservoir€TMs proven durability, OMEGA wide mouth opening, rugged materials ensures the reliable delivery of water during extreme operational situations. Also includes Big Bite\" Valve and HydroGuard\" Technology. Our reservoirs are 100% BPA-Free, so you can be worry free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412PYWFkRrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QX2A2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 34.0}}
