{"item_id": "B002QXB1PC", "title": "Grand Trunk Double Parachute Nylon Hammock with Carabiners", "description": "There are hammocks and then there is the Grand Trunk Parachute Nylon Double Hammock. Our guarantee to you is that once you hang up this hammock you will love it; if you don't let us know! Offers the largest portable hammock bed space on the market and only weighs 20 oz. Great by yourself or with that special someone.", "text": "Grand Trunk Double Parachute Nylon Hammock with Carabiners There are hammocks and then there is the Grand Trunk Parachute Nylon Double Hammock. Our guarantee to you is that once you hang up this hammock you will love it; if you don't let us know! Offers the largest portable hammock bed space on the market and only weighs 20 oz. Great by yourself or with that special someone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zF6RfNjUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002QXB1PC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 64.99}}
