{"item_id": "B002R027B6", "title": "Kelsyus Ogo Table, Green", "description": "The Canopy Chair folds up into an integrated carry bag for easy portability.Engineered for immediate tabletop gratification, this camp table goes anywhere. The Ogo Table features an all-in-one tabletop and bench seating design. The Kelsyus oGo Table gives you the convenience of both a folding camp table and bench seating in one easy-to-carry package. The innovative design utilizes rugged outdoor materials and a durable steel frame that supports up to 500 pounds (or 250 pounds per bench). Extras include two cup holders and a hands-free carry bag.Features:Tabletop and bench seating in one, the ogoTable is a revolutionary portable table designIntuitive one-piece design for effortless setupRugged outdoor fabric and steel frameHands-free carry bag and two cup holders includedSupports up to 500 pounds or 250 pounds per bench", "text": "Kelsyus Ogo Table, Green The Canopy Chair folds up into an integrated carry bag for easy portability.Engineered for immediate tabletop gratification, this camp table goes anywhere. The Ogo Table features an all-in-one tabletop and bench seating design. The Kelsyus oGo Table gives you the convenience of both a folding camp table and bench seating in one easy-to-carry package. The innovative design utilizes rugged outdoor materials and a durable steel frame that supports up to 500 pounds (or 250 pounds per bench). Extras include two cup holders and a hands-free carry bag.Features:Tabletop and bench seating in one, the ogoTable is a revolutionary portable table designIntuitive one-piece design for effortless setupRugged outdoor fabric and steel frameHands-free carry bag and two cup holders includedSupports up to 500 pounds or 250 pounds per bench", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jm6m%2BrqPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002R027B6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 68.56}}
{"item_id": "B002R0J5KC", "title": "DeMarini Voodoo Backpack (Black and Royal)", "description": "Extra-large main compartment easily fits a helmet with mask, a glove and extra equiptment. Separate compartment keeps clothes away from dirty gear. Two neoprene barrel lock sleeves secure and protect bats up to 2 5/8\" in diameter. Two small zipper pockets for storing valuables. Two mesh water bottle pockets. Breathable padded straps with integrated fence hooks. 600D polyester, 4000D dobby nylon, neoprene.", "text": "DeMarini Voodoo Backpack (Black and Royal) Extra-large main compartment easily fits a helmet with mask, a glove and extra equiptment. Separate compartment keeps clothes away from dirty gear. Two neoprene barrel lock sleeves secure and protect bats up to 2 5/8\" in diameter. Two small zipper pockets for storing valuables. Two mesh water bottle pockets. Breathable padded straps with integrated fence hooks. 600D polyester, 4000D dobby nylon, neoprene.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eqAaApsCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002R0J5KC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags", "Gear Bags"]], "price": 45.98}}
{"item_id": "B002R1DIQS", "title": "Ruger Mark I, II, III Magazine Loader Loading Aid Tool - USA Made", "description": "Tool to aid in loading ALL the Ruger Mark I, II, and III magazines (.22LR 9-round or 10-round magazines) as well as the Browning Buckmark & Challenger III, Colt Woodsman and AMT Lightning magazines. Constructed of rugged, clear, non-yellowing, weatherproof hard plastic (same plastic as aircraft windows)... Simply slide it over the top of the magazine and pull the loader down against the side loading lever to compress the spring. There are no moving parts to break or jam. No more aching thumbs or sore finger nails. Makes loading a breeze from the first round to the last round. This design works better than any other because the hard plastic does not flex and because you pull it down evenly by placing two fingers on the loader and your thumb at the mag base keeping the loader straight and sliding easily. If you are wanting a loading aid for your magazine and tired of struggling to get the last rounds in, look no further. Features a small lanyard hole in one corner. Bright yellow nylon lanyard (36\" loop) with split ring is included. Made in USA by Turtlecreek Products. Buy two or more loaders. Make sure each of your shooting buddies has a loader of this quality for his/her own use. Sharing is great but having your own loader is even better.", "text": "Ruger Mark I, II, III Magazine Loader Loading Aid Tool - USA Made Tool to aid in loading ALL the Ruger Mark I, II, and III magazines (.22LR 9-round or 10-round magazines) as well as the Browning Buckmark & Challenger III, Colt Woodsman and AMT Lightning magazines. Constructed of rugged, clear, non-yellowing, weatherproof hard plastic (same plastic as aircraft windows)... Simply slide it over the top of the magazine and pull the loader down against the side loading lever to compress the spring. There are no moving parts to break or jam. No more aching thumbs or sore finger nails. Makes loading a breeze from the first round to the last round. This design works better than any other because the hard plastic does not flex and because you pull it down evenly by placing two fingers on the loader and your thumb at the mag base keeping the loader straight and sliding easily. If you are wanting a loading aid for your magazine and tired of struggling to get the last rounds in, look no further. Features a small lanyard hole in one corner. Bright yellow nylon lanyard (36\" loop) with split ring is included. Made in USA by Turtlecreek Products. Buy two or more loaders. Make sure each of your shooting buddies has a loader of this quality for his/her own use. Sharing is great but having your own loader is even better.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z-6AXRb1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002R1DIQS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B002R1WSAU", "title": "Camelbak Armorbak 100oz Mil-Spec Tactical MOLLE Attachable Hydration Pack", "description": "Lightweight and simple to use, the Armorbak is deigned specifically to attach to the back of the IOTV, MTV or any other vest that offers a MOLLE/PAL back panel. Quick Attach Pressure Straps increase the flow from the low profile reservoir and stabilize the load.", "text": "Camelbak Armorbak 100oz Mil-Spec Tactical MOLLE Attachable Hydration Pack Lightweight and simple to use, the Armorbak is deigned specifically to attach to the back of the IOTV, MTV or any other vest that offers a MOLLE/PAL back panel. Quick Attach Pressure Straps increase the flow from the low profile reservoir and stabilize the load.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mG5cVZCOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002R1WSAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 63.25}}
