{"item_id": "B002RILCQO", "title": "Gerber 31-000486 EVO Combo Edge Mid-Size Tanto Knife", "description": "Gerber 33-000486 EVO mid-size Tanto knife. A mid-sized addition to EVO family. The Tanto blade shape adds more tactical styling to the already popular EVO family. Surgical stainless steel; blade for strength and corrosion resistance. Liner lock mechanism for one handed closing. Finger flip for easy opening. Low rise pocket clip for easy carrying.", "text": "Gerber 31-000486 EVO Combo Edge Mid-Size Tanto Knife Gerber 33-000486 EVO mid-size Tanto knife. A mid-sized addition to EVO family. The Tanto blade shape adds more tactical styling to the already popular EVO family. Surgical stainless steel; blade for strength and corrosion resistance. Liner lock mechanism for one handed closing. Finger flip for easy opening. Low rise pocket clip for easy carrying.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J5bXbFooL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RILCQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B002RIOJPK", "title": "Gerber 31-000346 Mini-Remix, Fine Edge", "description": "Gerber 31-000346 mini-remix, fine edge. Design is paramount with the Mini-Remix. Poke your index finger through the anodized aluminum pivot and experience blade control like never before. Clip it to a pack or on a pocket and show it off to envious on-lookers.", "text": "Gerber 31-000346 Mini-Remix, Fine Edge Gerber 31-000346 mini-remix, fine edge. Design is paramount with the Mini-Remix. Poke your index finger through the anodized aluminum pivot and experience blade control like never before. Clip it to a pack or on a pocket and show it off to envious on-lookers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zMZCUoUIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RIOJPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.94}}
{"item_id": "B002RIU3SW", "title": "Gerber 31-000372 Icon Tanto Knife, Serrated Edge", "description": "Gerber 31-000372 Icon tanto knife, serrated edge. The Gerber Icon is a large, strong tactical folder. It offers one-handed opening and a liner lock design for easy use. The Aluminum handles have large textured inlays for extra grip.", "text": "Gerber 31-000372 Icon Tanto Knife, Serrated Edge Gerber 31-000372 Icon tanto knife, serrated edge. The Gerber Icon is a large, strong tactical folder. It offers one-handed opening and a liner lock design for easy use. The Aluminum handles have large textured inlays for extra grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WNH3IeC5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RIU3SW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 26.28}}
{"item_id": "B002RJPL7Y", "title": "Hornady Unprimed 30-06 Cartridge Case", "description": "With Hornady brass you'll get more reloads, greater consistency, predictable performance with accuracy that commodity brass simply cannot deliver. Hornady builds cases with the same precision, attention to detail and focus on perfection that has made us a world-leader in bullets and ammunition. We measure for consistent walls concentricity and we run our cases through pressure calibration tests to ensure uniform case expansion. And, taking quality control to the extreme, each and every case is hand inspected. Thanks to this kind of manufacturing care, Hornady brass will ensure proper seating of the bullet, both in the case and in the chamber. It means consistent pressures, and ultimately yields optimal velocity and repeatable accuracy.", "text": "Hornady Unprimed 30-06 Cartridge Case With Hornady brass you'll get more reloads, greater consistency, predictable performance with accuracy that commodity brass simply cannot deliver. Hornady builds cases with the same precision, attention to detail and focus on perfection that has made us a world-leader in bullets and ammunition. We measure for consistent walls concentricity and we run our cases through pressure calibration tests to ensure uniform case expansion. And, taking quality control to the extreme, each and every case is hand inspected. Thanks to this kind of manufacturing care, Hornady brass will ensure proper seating of the bullet, both in the case and in the chamber. It means consistent pressures, and ultimately yields optimal velocity and repeatable accuracy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gbVVwV2SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RJPL7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 47.8}}
{"item_id": "B002RJURSM", "title": "Lyman Reloading 308 Win Case Length/Headspace Gauge", "description": "To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "text": "Lyman Reloading 308 Win Case Length/Headspace Gauge To achieve the highest degree of safety and accuracy, Lyman recommends that all bottleneck rifle cases be inspected after resizing to ensure that the proper headspace dimension is maintained. The best way to check this critical dimension is with a Lyman case length/headspace gauge. The reloader simply inserts the case into the gauge to insure that it does not exceed the maximum or fall below the minimum allowable headspace. In addition, the gauge will identify a case which exceeds the maximum allowable case length . Caution: Any case found with excessive headspace should be destroyed immediately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B3IQiqq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RJURSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B002RL83DQ", "title": "EZE-LAP L PAK5 Set SF/F/M/C/XC Color Coded Diamond Hones", "description": "EZE-LAP Diamond Products has been the pioneer and originator of diamond sharpening tools, starting in the early seventies. Our patented bonding process and modern technology allows us to produce the finest quality sharpening products at an affordable price. This process has often been imitated but never duplicated. EZE-LAP's unique blend of industrial diamonds combined with our patented bonding process gives you the hardest, most durable, longest lasting surface available. Because of this you are able to easily sharpen carbide, tool steel, titanium, ceramics and most any super hard material including the newer materials being used by most knife manufacturers. EZE-LAP manufactures the widest variety of diamond sharpening tools available. This allows you to pick and choose the sharpener that will best serve your needs. No other manufacturer offers the choices we do. We have items for use in the kitchen, shop or field, servicing the outdoor, DIY, machine tool, wood working/wood carving, culinary/food service and other markets. All of our items are proudly Made in the USA.", "text": "EZE-LAP L PAK5 Set SF/F/M/C/XC Color Coded Diamond Hones EZE-LAP Diamond Products has been the pioneer and originator of diamond sharpening tools, starting in the early seventies. Our patented bonding process and modern technology allows us to produce the finest quality sharpening products at an affordable price. This process has often been imitated but never duplicated. EZE-LAP's unique blend of industrial diamonds combined with our patented bonding process gives you the hardest, most durable, longest lasting surface available. Because of this you are able to easily sharpen carbide, tool steel, titanium, ceramics and most any super hard material including the newer materials being used by most knife manufacturers. EZE-LAP manufactures the widest variety of diamond sharpening tools available. This allows you to pick and choose the sharpener that will best serve your needs. No other manufacturer offers the choices we do. We have items for use in the kitchen, shop or field, servicing the outdoor, DIY, machine tool, wood working/wood carving, culinary/food service and other markets. All of our items are proudly Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bVk2X3ASL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RL83DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EZE-LAP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 16.2}}
{"item_id": "B002RL9BS2", "title": "Wobble Wedges Leveling Shims, Set of 12", "description": "Fix anything that wobbles; level anything that tilts with Wobble Wedges. Set of twelve shims. Shims provide consistent expansive / stabilizing force when compressed between two surfaces. They're perfect for leveling plumbing fixtures, fountains and statuary, furniture and appliances - cabinets, shelving, workbenches, bookshelves, patio furniture, and herb and flower pots. Use them indoors or outdoors; use them to level nearly anything, anywhere. Made of Polypropylene and made in the USA.", "text": "Wobble Wedges Leveling Shims, Set of 12 Fix anything that wobbles; level anything that tilts with Wobble Wedges. Set of twelve shims. Shims provide consistent expansive / stabilizing force when compressed between two surfaces. They're perfect for leveling plumbing fixtures, fountains and statuary, furniture and appliances - cabinets, shelving, workbenches, bookshelves, patio furniture, and herb and flower pots. Use them indoors or outdoors; use them to level nearly anything, anywhere. Made of Polypropylene and made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ss2uQ-yQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RL9BS2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wobble Wedges", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 7.59}}
{"item_id": "B002RO1E70", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Rapid Deployment Pack", "description": "US Peacekeeper Rapid Deployment Packs keep all of the essentials organized in a light weight package and ready to go in an emergency. 10”h x 12”w x 3”d, Ergonomic shoulder sling pack, Designed with front buckle for quick release, main compartment with U-shaped zipper (8.5”h x 7.5”w x 2.5”d), Inside compartment offers wide elastic band & front net pocket (5”h x 6.5”w) to help organize gear. Zippered concealed pocket (8.5”h x 8”w) with velcro holster straps. External pouches include two front double rifle magazine pouches, a single pistol magazine pouch on the side, and an open side pouch with drawstring. Nylon webbing anchors to accommodate additional modular pouches.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Rapid Deployment Pack US Peacekeeper Rapid Deployment Packs keep all of the essentials organized in a light weight package and ready to go in an emergency. 10”h x 12”w x 3”d, Ergonomic shoulder sling pack, Designed with front buckle for quick release, main compartment with U-shaped zipper (8.5”h x 7.5”w x 2.5”d), Inside compartment offers wide elastic band & front net pocket (5”h x 6.5”w) to help organize gear. Zippered concealed pocket (8.5”h x 8”w) with velcro holster straps. External pouches include two front double rifle magazine pouches, a single pistol magazine pouch on the side, and an open side pouch with drawstring. Nylon webbing anchors to accommodate additional modular pouches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CSQD7awnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RO1E70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 43.17}}
{"item_id": "B002RO30UY", "title": "US PeaceKeeper M4 Rapid Assault Tactical Case", "description": "USP MRAT (M4 Rapid Assault Tactical) Rifle Case is designed for a M4 Carbine with collapsible stock. features include: Webbing system with adjustable straps for securing rifle, Wide elastic straps to accommodate extra magazines, Removable padding allows for rapid drying if exposed to moisture, Two drainage vents, Wrap-around carry handles, Padded shoulder strap with swivels, Allows for changeable carry positions, Interior dimensions: 32” x 11” x 2.75”", "text": "US PeaceKeeper M4 Rapid Assault Tactical Case USP MRAT (M4 Rapid Assault Tactical) Rifle Case is designed for a M4 Carbine with collapsible stock. features include: Webbing system with adjustable straps for securing rifle, Wide elastic straps to accommodate extra magazines, Removable padding allows for rapid drying if exposed to moisture, Two drainage vents, Wrap-around carry handles, Padded shoulder strap with swivels, Allows for changeable carry positions, Interior dimensions: 32” x 11” x 2.75”", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h84EbNTgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RO30UY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 52.2}}
