{"item_id": "B002RPMUHM", "title": "Ready 2 Fish Soft Sided Tackle Bag", "description": "Easily transport your tackle from garage to fishing hole -- while keeping it protected, well organized, and easily accessible -- with the South Bend Ready 2 Fish Tackle Bag. The waterproof bag offers a variety of adjustable compartments, including a dedicated electronics pocket, as well as a cable net to hold a jacket and gloves.FeaturesWaterproof and weather-resistantNumerous adjustable pockets and compartmentsEight external accessory pocketsInterior map pocketInsulated strong-box bagHook and lure organizationLeak-proof, easy-to-clean interiorAdjustable shoulder strapSpecificationsMeasures 18 by ten by 14 inches (W x H x D)Fits up to five medium utility boxes2.75-pound weightAbout South BendSouth Bend Sporting Goods, established in 1906, is dedicated to creating products that allow families to experience the joys of fishing. The company designs and manufactures durable angling products for all ages and skill levels.", "text": "Ready 2 Fish Soft Sided Tackle Bag Easily transport your tackle from garage to fishing hole -- while keeping it protected, well organized, and easily accessible -- with the South Bend Ready 2 Fish Tackle Bag. The waterproof bag offers a variety of adjustable compartments, including a dedicated electronics pocket, as well as a cable net to hold a jacket and gloves.FeaturesWaterproof and weather-resistantNumerous adjustable pockets and compartmentsEight external accessory pocketsInterior map pocketInsulated strong-box bagHook and lure organizationLeak-proof, easy-to-clean interiorAdjustable shoulder strapSpecificationsMeasures 18 by ten by 14 inches (W x H x D)Fits up to five medium utility boxes2.75-pound weightAbout South BendSouth Bend Sporting Goods, established in 1906, is dedicated to creating products that allow families to experience the joys of fishing. The company designs and manufactures durable angling products for all ages and skill levels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TSd2Jv9VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RPMUHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ready 2 Fish", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Storage Bags"]], "price": 26.2}}
{"item_id": "B002RQJTDY", "title": "Blackburn Mars 3.0 Flasher Tail Light", "description": "You know your mom worries about you when you ride at night without a light, so make her happy while staying safe with the Blackburn Mars 3. 0 Flasher Tail Light. Seven bright red LED's keep your rear-end visible, and the durable, water-resistant case prevents the Mars 3. 0 from becoming another addition to your 'doesn't-work' pile.", "text": "Blackburn Mars 3.0 Flasher Tail Light You know your mom worries about you when you ride at night without a light, so make her happy while staying safe with the Blackburn Mars 3. 0 Flasher Tail Light. Seven bright red LED's keep your rear-end visible, and the durable, water-resistant case prevents the Mars 3. 0 from becoming another addition to your 'doesn't-work' pile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QF0LSAuLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RQJTDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B002RQLYRI", "title": "Blackburn Tech Mag 6 Trainer (Adjustable Trainer)", "description": "A FastCrank mounting system enables fast, secure mounting and dismounting of your bike to the trainer.Blackburn designers consider a wide array of surprisingly complex factors -- from the fluid mechanics of shear stress, to magnetic eddy currents, to Lenz's Law -- to create their high performance line of trainers. The company maintains its own trainer research and development center, outfitted with a number of proprietary testing equipment. Blackburn tested more than 15 different trainers, benchmarking factors such as frame rack and spread stiffness and thermal decay at 40 MPH, then used this data to design a new trainer from scratch.The result of all this prep work was the Tech Mag 6 trainer. An adjustable-height tubular steel frame offers outstanding stiffness and stability, while fluidly magnetic resistance units create sculpted, smooth, and progressive power curves. The mounting hardware was also redesigned to speed up the process, and you can choose between six different resistance settings with a bar-mounted remote.Lifetime WarrantyBlackburn products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BlackburnThe Blackburn brand is part of the Easton-Bell Sports, Inc. family of companies. Easton-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Blackburn Tech Mag 6 Trainer (Adjustable Trainer) A FastCrank mounting system enables fast, secure mounting and dismounting of your bike to the trainer.Blackburn designers consider a wide array of surprisingly complex factors -- from the fluid mechanics of shear stress, to magnetic eddy currents, to Lenz's Law -- to create their high performance line of trainers. The company maintains its own trainer research and development center, outfitted with a number of proprietary testing equipment. Blackburn tested more than 15 different trainers, benchmarking factors such as frame rack and spread stiffness and thermal decay at 40 MPH, then used this data to design a new trainer from scratch.The result of all this prep work was the Tech Mag 6 trainer. An adjustable-height tubular steel frame offers outstanding stiffness and stability, while fluidly magnetic resistance units create sculpted, smooth, and progressive power curves. The mounting hardware was also redesigned to speed up the process, and you can choose between six different resistance settings with a bar-mounted remote.Lifetime WarrantyBlackburn products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About BlackburnThe Blackburn brand is part of the Easton-Bell Sports, Inc. family of companies. Easton-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514w-3lRc4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RQLYRI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Rollers"]], "price": 211.99}}
{"item_id": "B002RQNY0S", "title": "Blackburn AirTower 2 Bicycle Pump, Silver", "description": "AT-2 handle - New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip, and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-2 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when kicked down and still extremely accurate. AT-2 base - The base is formed out of stamped steel, which is welded to the barrel, Wider and longer, it provides a wobble-free platform for pumping.", "text": "Blackburn AirTower 2 Bicycle Pump, Silver AT-2 handle - New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip, and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-2 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when kicked down and still extremely accurate. AT-2 base - The base is formed out of stamped steel, which is welded to the barrel, Wider and longer, it provides a wobble-free platform for pumping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OcEiChwtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RQNY0S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002RRT5IW", "title": "Katadyn MyBottle Purifier, Blue Splash", "description": "Purification Method: 3 stage Virustat purification technologyBottle Capacity: 24 oz after cartridge displacement Cartridge Capacity: Up to 26 gallons (100 Liters) depending on water quality Weight: 8 oz Height: 10 oz", "text": "Katadyn MyBottle Purifier, Blue Splash Purification Method: 3 stage Virustat purification technologyBottle Capacity: 24 oz after cartridge displacement Cartridge Capacity: Up to 26 gallons (100 Liters) depending on water quality Weight: 8 oz Height: 10 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EWk%2BHo%2BRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RRT5IW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Katadyn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 43.37}}
{"item_id": "B002RT8Y78", "title": "Avenir Bicycle Tube Schrader Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch", "description": "It measures 26 x 1.90 - 2.125. It has a 32 milli meter Schrader valve. The tube is 0.90 thick.", "text": "Avenir Bicycle Tube Schrader Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch It measures 26 x 1.90 - 2.125. It has a 32 milli meter Schrader valve. The tube is 0.90 thick.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LTUhVjOoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RT8Y78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 2.87}}
{"item_id": "B002RT8Y7S", "title": "Avenir Bicycle Tube Presta Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch", "description": "Avenir Bicycle Tube Presta Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch", "text": "Avenir Bicycle Tube Presta Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch Avenir Bicycle Tube Presta Valve - 26 x 1.90-2.125 Inch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LR37CwyJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RT8Y7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avenir", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 3.72}}
{"item_id": "B002RVUXMU", "title": "Blackburn AirTower 3 Bicycle Pump, White", "description": "Features easy-to-read and durable diaphragm-type top-mounted pressure gauge. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. Oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip and features storage drawers at both ends. Handle lanyard - Rubber T-handle lanyard holds pump together for easy transport.", "text": "Blackburn AirTower 3 Bicycle Pump, White Features easy-to-read and durable diaphragm-type top-mounted pressure gauge. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. Oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip and features storage drawers at both ends. Handle lanyard - Rubber T-handle lanyard holds pump together for easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iHJxcai-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RVUXMU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002RWKFMW", "title": "Dorcy 41-3102 Floating Waterproof LED Flashlight Lantern, 80-Lumens, Green Finish", "description": "The 80 Lumen Single Globe LED Lantern has the illumination characteristics of traditional gas / mantel lanterns without any of the safety concerns. This lantern’s design allows it to radiate 360° of light with 80 Lumens of light output. The durable body construction allows this lantern to float and makes it completely waterproof with an IPX7 rating. The Single Globe LED Lantern contains two brightness settings, for high and low output, and an amber night light. The highest LED settings allows for 200 hours of continuous use, the lowest giving 300 hours, and the amber LED allows for 1,000 hour of continuous use. The lantern is topped off with a sturdy handle featuring a built-in pop-out hanger hook allowing for hands free use. The 80 Lumen Single Globe LED Lantern requires 4 C cell batteries (not included).", "text": "Dorcy 41-3102 Floating Waterproof LED Flashlight Lantern, 80-Lumens, Green Finish The 80 Lumen Single Globe LED Lantern has the illumination characteristics of traditional gas / mantel lanterns without any of the safety concerns. This lantern’s design allows it to radiate 360° of light with 80 Lumens of light output. The durable body construction allows this lantern to float and makes it completely waterproof with an IPX7 rating. The Single Globe LED Lantern contains two brightness settings, for high and low output, and an amber night light. The highest LED settings allows for 200 hours of continuous use, the lowest giving 300 hours, and the amber LED allows for 1,000 hour of continuous use. The lantern is topped off with a sturdy handle featuring a built-in pop-out hanger hook allowing for hands free use. The 80 Lumen Single Globe LED Lantern requires 4 C cell batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z6UJuLp7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RWKFMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dorcy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B002RX2QLY", "title": "Fenix HP10 7 Level 225 Lumen LED Headlamp", "description": "The HP10 headlamp provides users with remarkably bright and powerful light, a long runtime, waterproof design (to IPX-8 standard), and a lightweight body. The bulb housing body weighs just 40 grams, and the battery pack is only 77 grams without batteries. A single CREE XR-E LED (Q5) bulb, combined with advanced reflective lens technology, reaches light output levels as high as 225 lumens, casting a 120-meter beam. A digitally-regulated, microprocessor-controlled output maintains constant brightness at all levels.Four lighting levels provide convenient versatility. The seven-lumen setting runs for 210 hours, the 50-lumen setting runs for 22 hours, the 120-lumen setting runs for 7.5 hours, and the super-bright 225-lumen setting runs for a three-minute, emergency lighting burst. After three minutes, the lamp automatically reverts to the lower setting to avoid overheating. The headlamp additionally includes a strobe setting that runs for five hours, SOS flash that will last 50 hours, and a 44-hour warning flash.The HP10 runs on three AA batteries, with the battery pack mounted in the back of your head for optimal balance and long-wear comfort. The lighting head is made of aircraft-grade aluminum with premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish, with the rest of the unit constructed of high-impact polymer plastic. A toughened, ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating completes the package.", "text": "Fenix HP10 7 Level 225 Lumen LED Headlamp The HP10 headlamp provides users with remarkably bright and powerful light, a long runtime, waterproof design (to IPX-8 standard), and a lightweight body. The bulb housing body weighs just 40 grams, and the battery pack is only 77 grams without batteries. A single CREE XR-E LED (Q5) bulb, combined with advanced reflective lens technology, reaches light output levels as high as 225 lumens, casting a 120-meter beam. A digitally-regulated, microprocessor-controlled output maintains constant brightness at all levels.Four lighting levels provide convenient versatility. The seven-lumen setting runs for 210 hours, the 50-lumen setting runs for 22 hours, the 120-lumen setting runs for 7.5 hours, and the super-bright 225-lumen setting runs for a three-minute, emergency lighting burst. After three minutes, the lamp automatically reverts to the lower setting to avoid overheating. The headlamp additionally includes a strobe setting that runs for five hours, SOS flash that will last 50 hours, and a 44-hour warning flash.The HP10 runs on three AA batteries, with the battery pack mounted in the back of your head for optimal balance and long-wear comfort. The lighting head is made of aircraft-grade aluminum with premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish, with the rest of the unit constructed of high-impact polymer plastic. A toughened, ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating completes the package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4109te6-YVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002RX2QLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]]}}
