{"item_id": "B002S4UA92", "title": "Scientific Anglers Fly Fishing Trout Leader 7.5 ft", "description": "Scientific Anglers(TM) Premium Freshwater Leader - 7 1/2' Trout With LoopLeader Characteristics:* Specially designed with a longer, larger butt for easy turnover and delivery of trout and panfish flies* Unique, new composition lays straighter on the water* Very low memory, less coiling, easy to straightenApplications:* 7.5 ' - ideal for most situations, windSizeTippet DiameterButt DiameterMax Break Strength6X0.005\"0.020\"3.7 lb5X0.006\"0.022\"4.8 lb4X0.007\"0.022\"6.8 lb3X0.008\"0.022\"8.8 lb2X0.009\"0.022\"10.5 lbLine Color:", "text": "Scientific Anglers Fly Fishing Trout Leader 7.5 ft Scientific Anglers(TM) Premium Freshwater Leader - 7 1/2' Trout With LoopLeader Characteristics:* Specially designed with a longer, larger butt for easy turnover and delivery of trout and panfish flies* Unique, new composition lays straighter on the water* Very low memory, less coiling, easy to straightenApplications:* 7.5 ' - ideal for most situations, windSizeTippet DiameterButt DiameterMax Break Strength6X0.005\"0.020\"3.7 lb5X0.006\"0.022\"4.8 lb4X0.007\"0.022\"6.8 lb3X0.008\"0.022\"8.8 lb2X0.009\"0.022\"10.5 lbLine Color:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UAteptn4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S4UA92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Leaders & Leader Rigging", "Fly Fishing Leaders & Tippets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002S5110I", "title": "Fox Labs Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (2 Oz)", "description": "Fox Labs Law Enforcement Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (2 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox pepper spray is refined to 5.3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in stream or cone fog models and in 2 oz or 4 oz sprays. This is for a Flip Top Stream (2 oz) Features: 5.3 million Scoville heat units 2 oz convenient carry size Flip top The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement Includes manufactured date (born on) stamped on each can- has 3 year shelf life", "text": "Fox Labs Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (2 Oz) Fox Labs Law Enforcement Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (2 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox pepper spray is refined to 5.3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in stream or cone fog models and in 2 oz or 4 oz sprays. This is for a Flip Top Stream (2 oz) Features: 5.3 million Scoville heat units 2 oz convenient carry size Flip top The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement Includes manufactured date (born on) stamped on each can- has 3 year shelf life", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vQvnRGVmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S5110I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 16.44}}
{"item_id": "B002S51BEY", "title": "Fox Labs Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (4 Oz)", "description": "Fox Labs Law Enforcement Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (4 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox pepper spray is refined to 5.3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in stream or cone fog models and in 2 oz or 4 oz sprays. This is for a Flip Top Stream (4 oz) Features: 5.3 million Scoville heat units 4 oz convenient carry size Flip top The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement", "text": "Fox Labs Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (4 Oz) Fox Labs Law Enforcement Defense Spray- Flip Top Stream (4 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox pepper spray is refined to 5.3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in stream or cone fog models and in 2 oz or 4 oz sprays. This is for a Flip Top Stream (4 oz) Features: 5.3 million Scoville heat units 4 oz convenient carry size Flip top The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vQvnRGVmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S51BEY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 22.64}}
{"item_id": "B002S53M7S", "title": "Pinemeadow Wedge", "description": "Pinemeadows' most popular wedge has been updated with a new look, while maintaining the club shape and features that have made the club such a popular, affordable option. The expanded face area creates an oversized sweet spot, and you can get under the ball while still having enough club to generate proper control and ball flight, making it easy to play out of difficult lies.FeaturesDesigned for beginner to average golfersBuilt standard, with high quality Pinemeadow steel from Apollo125-gram shaft with a low-to-mid kick pointLarge face with oversized sweet spotAvailable for left- and right-handed playersWarrantyPinemeadow Gold products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Pinemeadow GolfLocated in Portland, Oregon, Pinemeadow Golf Products, Inc. creates custom golf clubs and accessories that are sold around the world, and can be found in most local sporting goods stores, mass merchandisers, warehouse clubs, and golf shops. The company manufactures hundreds of thousands of clubs annually, and continues to be one of the top ten golf club makers in the United States.", "text": "Pinemeadow Wedge Pinemeadows' most popular wedge has been updated with a new look, while maintaining the club shape and features that have made the club such a popular, affordable option. The expanded face area creates an oversized sweet spot, and you can get under the ball while still having enough club to generate proper control and ball flight, making it easy to play out of difficult lies.FeaturesDesigned for beginner to average golfersBuilt standard, with high quality Pinemeadow steel from Apollo125-gram shaft with a low-to-mid kick pointLarge face with oversized sweet spotAvailable for left- and right-handed playersWarrantyPinemeadow Gold products include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Pinemeadow GolfLocated in Portland, Oregon, Pinemeadow Golf Products, Inc. creates custom golf clubs and accessories that are sold around the world, and can be found in most local sporting goods stores, mass merchandisers, warehouse clubs, and golf shops. The company manufactures hundreds of thousands of clubs annually, and continues to be one of the top ten golf club makers in the United States.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U-xOeN1IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S53M7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pinemeadow Golf", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Irons", "Single Clubs"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B002S55FP0", "title": "Fox Labs Mean Green Defense Spray- Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 Oz)", "description": "Fox Labs Mean Green Defense Spray- Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox Mean Green pepper spray is refined to 3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in Mean Green stream or cone fog models and in 1.5 oz or 3 oz sprays. This is for a Mean Green Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 oz) Mean Green Features: Searing 3,000,000 SHU formula at 6% concentration Provides 180,000 SHU out the nozzle and 1.2% total capsaicinoids Fast acting formula Non-flammable and safe to use with Tasers or other stun devices Bright green dye to mark the offender for easy identification by police or sheriff officers. Dye is a vegetable-base and safe for human use Features: 3 million Scoville heat units 1.5 oz convenient carry size Flip top Mean Green formula The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement Includes manufactured date (born on) stamped on each can- has 3 year shelf life", "text": "Fox Labs Mean Green Defense Spray- Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 Oz) Fox Labs Mean Green Defense Spray- Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 oz) Fox Labs Pepper Spray is the hottest pepper spray used by Police and Military Worldwide now available to the public. Most pepper sprays are between 1/2 million to 2 million Scoville heat units; however, Fox Mean Green pepper spray is refined to 3 million Scoville heat units. What is PEPPER SPRAY? Pepper Spray is an inflammatory agent that works upon contact. It creates a very painful burning sensation in the eyes, nose, mouth, and throat; making it very difficult for someone who has been sprayed to do the simplest functions. Pepper Spray is a reasonable alternative to lethal force and will work better on individuals under the influence of drugs, alcohol, or who are mentally unstable. \"Every year nearly 5 million people are victims of violent crime; murder, rape, robberies or lifethreatening assault.\" - National Center of Policy Analysis Protect yopurself they way law enforcement and the military do. Available in Mean Green stream or cone fog models and in 1.5 oz or 3 oz sprays. This is for a Mean Green Flip Top Cone Fog (1.5 oz) Mean Green Features: Searing 3,000,000 SHU formula at 6% concentration Provides 180,000 SHU out the nozzle and 1.2% total capsaicinoids Fast acting formula Non-flammable and safe to use with Tasers or other stun devices Bright green dye to mark the offender for easy identification by police or sheriff officers. Dye is a vegetable-base and safe for human use Features: 3 million Scoville heat units 1.5 oz convenient carry size Flip top Mean Green formula The hottest pepper spray used by military and law enforcement Includes manufactured date (born on) stamped on each can- has 3 year shelf life", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21mcq3JI6SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S55FP0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 18.94}}
