{"item_id": "B002S9EQ1A", "title": "K-Edge Chain Catcher - Braze-on", "description": "The violence of the spring classics' cobbles can make a chain do bad things mid-shift. It's for this very reason that pro team mechanics have long fashioned one-off metal widgets to keep chains from dropping between the inner chainring and the bottom bracket. Like 44t Record chainrings and custom-embroidered saddles, these anti-drop chain retention devices have long been exclusive to the pros. That is, until now. With the K-Edge Braze-on Chain Catcher you get the same safeguards: your chain will never shoot inward beyond the inner chainring, giving you the confidence to slam it into the small ring at will when you round a corner on an unknown race course and are faced with the fleeting terror that comes with the first sighting of an abrupt climb. The real benefits, aside from quick and worry-free shifts, are protection for your lovely carbon fiber race bike and your chain will be right where you want it to be when you aim to grind your rivals into the tarmac. The K-Edge Braze-on Chain Catcher is made specifically for braze-on front derailleur tabs. What this really means is that you need to use either a braze-on front derailleur, or a clamp-on front derailleur that does NOT have an integrated clamp (i. e. it's a braze-on front derailleur mated to an adapter clamp.) It's made from CNC-machined 6061 T6 aluminum in Boise, ID. It weighs 10g and is available in six colors -- Black, Blue, Gunmetal, Gold, Red, and White. It comes with 2 mounting bolts -- 20mm for Shimano or Campagnolo, and a 25mm for SRAM. It's worth noting, too, that the instructions are phenomenal.", "text": "K-Edge Chain Catcher - Braze-on The violence of the spring classics' cobbles can make a chain do bad things mid-shift. It's for this very reason that pro team mechanics have long fashioned one-off metal widgets to keep chains from dropping between the inner chainring and the bottom bracket. Like 44t Record chainrings and custom-embroidered saddles, these anti-drop chain retention devices have long been exclusive to the pros. That is, until now. With the K-Edge Braze-on Chain Catcher you get the same safeguards: your chain will never shoot inward beyond the inner chainring, giving you the confidence to slam it into the small ring at will when you round a corner on an unknown race course and are faced with the fleeting terror that comes with the first sighting of an abrupt climb. The real benefits, aside from quick and worry-free shifts, are protection for your lovely carbon fiber race bike and your chain will be right where you want it to be when you aim to grind your rivals into the tarmac. The K-Edge Braze-on Chain Catcher is made specifically for braze-on front derailleur tabs. What this really means is that you need to use either a braze-on front derailleur, or a clamp-on front derailleur that does NOT have an integrated clamp (i. e. it's a braze-on front derailleur mated to an adapter clamp.) It's made from CNC-machined 6061 T6 aluminum in Boise, ID. It weighs 10g and is available in six colors -- Black, Blue, Gunmetal, Gold, Red, and White. It comes with 2 mounting bolts -- 20mm for Shimano or Campagnolo, and a 25mm for SRAM. It's worth noting, too, that the instructions are phenomenal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415k2yHCpJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002S9EQ1A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "K-Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Deflectors"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B002SBBCJC", "title": "CATCH-ALL BRASS CATCHER, PISTOL", "description": "Don't suffer from \"the bends!\" Catch-All Brass Catchers are the super easy solution to casing control! SAVE! It attaches to your hand, not the gun, for the fastest, easiest possible way to deal with scattering brass. No more crawling for and losing casings, nor hitting your buddies in the head with hot ones. A Velcro closure strap attaches to the back of your right hand, for use with most right-hand ejection auto or semiauto guns. It's lightweight plastic, just 2 1/4 ozs., and doesn't at all interfere with the view of the target or the gun's operation. Assembles / disassembles easily for storage. State Style. This is a cinch to save time, effort and money. It's a smart no-brainer, act ONLINE now! Catch-All Brass Catcher", "text": "CATCH-ALL BRASS CATCHER, PISTOL Don't suffer from \"the bends!\" Catch-All Brass Catchers are the super easy solution to casing control! SAVE! It attaches to your hand, not the gun, for the fastest, easiest possible way to deal with scattering brass. No more crawling for and losing casings, nor hitting your buddies in the head with hot ones. A Velcro closure strap attaches to the back of your right hand, for use with most right-hand ejection auto or semiauto guns. It's lightweight plastic, just 2 1/4 ozs., and doesn't at all interfere with the view of the target or the gun's operation. Assembles / disassembles easily for storage. State Style. This is a cinch to save time, effort and money. It's a smart no-brainer, act ONLINE now! Catch-All Brass Catcher", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BVjuI39cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SBBCJC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002SC1JFS", "title": "JT Toxin Paintballs - Green Shell, Yellow Fill - 2,000 Count", "description": "JT Toxin Paintballs are designed with the recreational player in mind. This all weather paintball has a green shell and vibrant yellow fill for maximum marking visibility. Standard .68 caliber bore size. 2000ct box of paintballs made using legendary RPS technology.", "text": "JT Toxin Paintballs - Green Shell, Yellow Fill - 2,000 Count JT Toxin Paintballs are designed with the recreational player in mind. This all weather paintball has a green shell and vibrant yellow fill for maximum marking visibility. Standard .68 caliber bore size. 2000ct box of paintballs made using legendary RPS technology.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512tpnvOthL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SC1JFS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Paintballs"]]}}
