{"item_id": "B002SCV3BS", "title": "Vortex Viper 6.5-20x44mm PA Riflescopes", "description": "Vortex Viper 6.5-20x44 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x44 riflescope is ideal for long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Dead-Hold BDC reticle has a customized design that helps eliminate guesswork on hold-over and windage corrections. Good for any hunting or shooting at varying ranges where estimating hold-over would be a concern. Side knob parallax adjust allows quick and easy parallax adjustments with range numbers visible while in the shooting position. 30mm main tube offers improved windage and elevation adjustment along with greater strength. Tall capped turrets allow quick and easy field adjustments. Optical Features XD Lens Elements Extra-low dispersion (XD) glass increases resolution and color fidelity, resulting in crisp, sharp images. XR Lens Coatings Vortex proprietary XR fully multi-coated lens coatings increase light transmission for maximum brightness. Construction Features 30 mm Tube Allows greater windage and elevation adjustment travel along with greater strength compared to the one-inch tube. One-Piece Tube Maximizes strength and waterproofness. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum Premium grade of aluminum, valued for fatigue resistance. Precision-Force Spring System Uses premium components in the erector-spring system, ensuring maximum repeatability and ease of adjustment.", "text": "Vortex Viper 6.5-20x44mm PA Riflescopes Vortex Viper 6.5-20x44 PA Riflescope Effortlessly shrugging off recoil, moisture and darkness! The Viper's status as a premium riflescope won't be as easy to shake. Discover a riflescope with incredible performance features like premium, fully multi-coated optics with 95 percent light transmission, heavy duty Precision Force spring systems and the glass smooth Precision Glide erector system—delivering all this and more at a price that should have pulled a few more hundreds from your wallet than it did. 6.5-20x44 riflescope is ideal for long range, predator/varmint, and target applications. Dead-Hold BDC reticle has a customized design that helps eliminate guesswork on hold-over and windage corrections. Good for any hunting or shooting at varying ranges where estimating hold-over would be a concern. Side knob parallax adjust allows quick and easy parallax adjustments with range numbers visible while in the shooting position. 30mm main tube offers improved windage and elevation adjustment along with greater strength. Tall capped turrets allow quick and easy field adjustments. Optical Features XD Lens Elements Extra-low dispersion (XD) glass increases resolution and color fidelity, resulting in crisp, sharp images. XR Lens Coatings Vortex proprietary XR fully multi-coated lens coatings increase light transmission for maximum brightness. Construction Features 30 mm Tube Allows greater windage and elevation adjustment travel along with greater strength compared to the one-inch tube. One-Piece Tube Maximizes strength and waterproofness. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum Premium grade of aluminum, valued for fatigue resistance. Precision-Force Spring System Uses premium components in the erector-spring system, ensuring maximum repeatability and ease of adjustment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tqwT9edeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SCV3BS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002SCV674", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Kudu Stretch Sling", "description": "Constructed of high-quality 2” nylon webbing the BLACKHAWK! Kudu Stretch Sling offers elastic webbing that conforms to shoulder for comfort and ease of carry. It offers a fully adjustable length to fit all body sizes and around bulky tactical vests or gear and the strap features integrated non-slip rubber ribs. Includes two 1” LOK-DOWN swivels and is compatible with a wide variety of rifles and shotguns. Fully adjustable, ambidextrous design. Available in Black and Coyote Tan.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Kudu Stretch Sling Constructed of high-quality 2” nylon webbing the BLACKHAWK! Kudu Stretch Sling offers elastic webbing that conforms to shoulder for comfort and ease of carry. It offers a fully adjustable length to fit all body sizes and around bulky tactical vests or gear and the strap features integrated non-slip rubber ribs. Includes two 1” LOK-DOWN swivels and is compatible with a wide variety of rifles and shotguns. Fully adjustable, ambidextrous design. Available in Black and Coyote Tan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UkfWiASiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SCV674.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 27.99}}
