{"item_id": "B002SEZ5PG", "title": "Lee Precision Pacesetter .223 Dies (Red)", "description": "Lee Precision 223 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision Pacesetter .223 Dies (Red) Lee Precision 223 Pacesetter 3-Die Set includes Full Length Sizing Die, Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions with Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P52ElTemL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SEZ5PG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.02}}
{"item_id": "B002SEZD9E", "title": "Lee Precision 40 S and W Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for 40 S&W; set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your 40 Smith and Wesson ammunition. It can also be used to load the 10MM auto which makes it a versatile set. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "text": "Lee Precision 40 S and W Carbide 3-Die Set (Silver) The Lee Precision Carbide 3 Die Set for 40 S&W; set includes powder through expanding die, bullet seating die, and a carbide full length sizing die. This 3 die set is perfect for effective and efficient re-use of your 40 Smith and Wesson ammunition. It can also be used to load the 10MM auto which makes it a versatile set. The dies have been packaged in an air-tight, low profile box that will preserve the integrity of your dies and keep them organized and at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KA%2B8TDR%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SEZD9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 30.14}}
{"item_id": "B002SF2ZXU", "title": "Lee Precision Decapping Die", "description": "Lee Decapping Die, no cleaning or lubing of cases necessary. Even removes crimped primers, one size fits most cases.Important Note:The most likely reason a pin would bend is that the user is trying to primers from Berdan casings. Berdan casings are not designed to be reloaded, only casings with crimped primers can be reloaded. Most steel and aluminum casings are Berdan casings. Another common cause of a bent pin is not placing the shell casing all the way into the shell holder.", "text": "Lee Precision Decapping Die Lee Decapping Die, no cleaning or lubing of cases necessary. Even removes crimped primers, one size fits most cases.Important Note:The most likely reason a pin would bend is that the user is trying to primers from Berdan casings. Berdan casings are not designed to be reloaded, only casings with crimped primers can be reloaded. Most steel and aluminum casings are Berdan casings. Another common cause of a bent pin is not placing the shell casing all the way into the shell holder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v6Hgs005L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SF2ZXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.28}}
{"item_id": "B002SF306G", "title": "Lee Precision .45 Caliber 6 Cavity Mold (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision 6-Cavity Bullet Mold .45 Caliber blocks are machined from commercial quality aluminum and feature steel bushing and alignment pins. It is machined from aluminum blocks making them rust resistant. Aluminum molds heat up and cool down faster than iron or steel molds so good bullets can usually be produced after only a few casts. In addition, they are one-third the weight of iron or steel mold blocks for less fatigue during extended casting sessions. To ensure the best possible bullets, mold block halves are clamped together and then lathe-bored for unmatched roundness and size control. It comes with a cam operated, hard-anodized sprue plate which is held tightly with tempered spring washers at each end.", "text": "Lee Precision .45 Caliber 6 Cavity Mold (Silver) The Lee Precision 6-Cavity Bullet Mold .45 Caliber blocks are machined from commercial quality aluminum and feature steel bushing and alignment pins. It is machined from aluminum blocks making them rust resistant. Aluminum molds heat up and cool down faster than iron or steel molds so good bullets can usually be produced after only a few casts. In addition, they are one-third the weight of iron or steel mold blocks for less fatigue during extended casting sessions. To ensure the best possible bullets, mold block halves are clamped together and then lathe-bored for unmatched roundness and size control. It comes with a cam operated, hard-anodized sprue plate which is held tightly with tempered spring washers at each end.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21fT3DYK6ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SF306G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 37.41}}
{"item_id": "B002SF4X5I", "title": "Lee Reloading Press Md: 90045", "description": "Even if you already own a press, an extra press is always useful for decapping, bullet seating or bullet sizing. The Lee Precision Reloader Press accepts standard 7/8 x14 thread dies and standard universal press shell holders.", "text": "Lee Reloading Press Md: 90045 Even if you already own a press, an extra press is always useful for decapping, bullet seating or bullet sizing. The Lee Precision Reloader Press accepts standard 7/8 x14 thread dies and standard universal press shell holders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jlBt%2BvTgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SF4X5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 36.97}}
{"item_id": "B002SF6QQW", "title": "Lee Precision Primer Pocket Cleaner", "description": "Lee Primer Pocket Cleaners double ended design cleans both large and small primer pockets so that primers can be fully seated for better accuracy and safety.", "text": "Lee Precision Primer Pocket Cleaner Lee Primer Pocket Cleaners double ended design cleans both large and small primer pockets so that primers can be fully seated for better accuracy and safety.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DiouWkLaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SF6QQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 4.42}}
