{"item_id": "B002SFQELY", "title": "Rothco Men's The Medium Transport Pack", "description": "Rothco Men's The Medium Transport Pack. The Medium Transport Backpack in Woodland Camo This 600D Polyester backpack with Molle Compatible webbing, has polyurethane coated lining and pockets for water repellent. This Pack goes great with some Supra boots for any hiking trip. The Medium Transport Backpack is also available in Coyote Brown and Black. Adjustable Padded Shoulder Straps Top Carry Handle One large compartment with zippered pouch and Mesh Pocket Three Additional pockets and storage compartments Polyurethane coated lining and pockets 600D Polyester By Rothco imported Size & Fit: Measurements 17”W x 8.25”H x 4.25”D.", "text": "Rothco Men's The Medium Transport Pack Rothco Men's The Medium Transport Pack. The Medium Transport Backpack in Woodland Camo This 600D Polyester backpack with Molle Compatible webbing, has polyurethane coated lining and pockets for water repellent. This Pack goes great with some Supra boots for any hiking trip. The Medium Transport Backpack is also available in Coyote Brown and Black. Adjustable Padded Shoulder Straps Top Carry Handle One large compartment with zippered pouch and Mesh Pocket Three Additional pockets and storage compartments Polyurethane coated lining and pockets 600D Polyester By Rothco imported Size & Fit: Measurements 17”W x 8.25”H x 4.25”D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eJlSHdZGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SFQELY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]]}}
