{"item_id": "B002SG7HEQ", "title": "Giro Ambient Cold-Weather Cycling Gloves", "description": "A glove for cold days that demand a little more from you and your equipment (40ºF/5ºC). The Ambient combines a water and wind resistant, breathable soft shell upper with X-Static fleece lining and a Clarino palm for warmth, durability and dexterity. It's light enough to wear for long rides and warm enough to fight off temperatures that hover above freezing. Upper features a 3-layer soft shell with water and wind resistant membrane to resist cold, stormy weather. X-Static fleece lining; insulated, moisture-wicking cuff with adjustable closure. Palm features Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit; Clarino synthetic leather for enhanced durability; silicone detailing for enhanced grip. Padding is 3mm of EVA that distributes pressure for comfort and durability. Giro's unique 3-piece palm construction allows your hands to move naturally for enhanced control, while providing a layer of protection that deosn't compromise bar fell. By designing each part of the palm to mimic a hand's features and articulation, Giro gloves increase grip and provude a superior level of protection for the entire hand. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most.", "text": "Giro Ambient Cold-Weather Cycling Gloves A glove for cold days that demand a little more from you and your equipment (40ºF/5ºC). The Ambient combines a water and wind resistant, breathable soft shell upper with X-Static fleece lining and a Clarino palm for warmth, durability and dexterity. It's light enough to wear for long rides and warm enough to fight off temperatures that hover above freezing. Upper features a 3-layer soft shell with water and wind resistant membrane to resist cold, stormy weather. X-Static fleece lining; insulated, moisture-wicking cuff with adjustable closure. Palm features Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit; Clarino synthetic leather for enhanced durability; silicone detailing for enhanced grip. Padding is 3mm of EVA that distributes pressure for comfort and durability. Giro's unique 3-piece palm construction allows your hands to move naturally for enhanced control, while providing a layer of protection that deosn't compromise bar fell. By designing each part of the palm to mimic a hand's features and articulation, Giro gloves increase grip and provude a superior level of protection for the entire hand. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DJtqXJBGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SG7HEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002SIR91A", "title": "", "description": "AAA Red Aluminum Sport Utility Shovel is given a 3-piece aluminum construction. It weighs approximately 1.3 pounds and the length can be adjusted from 25-inch to 32-inch. This shovel is an ideal accessory for your car, truck, SUV, recreational vehicle or snowmobile.", "text": "AAA Red Aluminum Sport Utility Shovel is given a 3-piece aluminum construction. It weighs approximately 1.3 pounds and the length can be adjusted from 25-inch to 32-inch. This shovel is an ideal accessory for your car, truck, SUV, recreational vehicle or snowmobile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AwEP8viqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SIR91A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "Interior Accessories", "Safety"], ["Patio, Lawn & Garden", "Snow Removal", "Snow Shovels"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Backcountry Equipment", "Snow Shovels"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B002SJX2II", "title": "Lezyne Chain Drive - Chain Breaker Tool", "description": "A chain breaker is one of those tools that you just kind of take for granted. You can get away with an attachment on a multi-tool, but once you've used a precise, shop-quality chain breaker you won't want to go back. A well-designed, comfortable chain tool like the Lezyne Chain Drive can make all the difference between a smooth, well-executed adjustment and a drawn-out frustrating mess. After all, those multi-tool attachments were made to be used during your ride as a last-ditch, ride-or-walk quick fix. Precise adjustments should be left to a shop-quality instrument. The Lezyne Chain Drive Tool is tough. The forged steel body is CNC-machined to tight tolerances for accuracy. The body is contoured to feel comfortable in your hands. Lezyne even integrated two Mavic splined and two square spoke wrenches into the body for a little extra versatility. The breaker pin can be replaced in the unlikely event of a break, and Lezyne even had the foresight to include a spare just in case. The Lezyne Chain Drive Tool is compatible with nine or ten speed chains and can be used for adjustment of wheels equipped with Mavic splined or standard square spoke nipples.", "text": "Lezyne Chain Drive - Chain Breaker Tool A chain breaker is one of those tools that you just kind of take for granted. You can get away with an attachment on a multi-tool, but once you've used a precise, shop-quality chain breaker you won't want to go back. A well-designed, comfortable chain tool like the Lezyne Chain Drive can make all the difference between a smooth, well-executed adjustment and a drawn-out frustrating mess. After all, those multi-tool attachments were made to be used during your ride as a last-ditch, ride-or-walk quick fix. Precise adjustments should be left to a shop-quality instrument. The Lezyne Chain Drive Tool is tough. The forged steel body is CNC-machined to tight tolerances for accuracy. The body is contoured to feel comfortable in your hands. Lezyne even integrated two Mavic splined and two square spoke wrenches into the body for a little extra versatility. The breaker pin can be replaced in the unlikely event of a break, and Lezyne even had the foresight to include a spare just in case. The Lezyne Chain Drive Tool is compatible with nine or ten speed chains and can be used for adjustment of wheels equipped with Mavic splined or standard square spoke nipples.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qcv4FjnIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SJX2II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lezyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Guards"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B002SLRFDY", "title": "SE - Whistle - 5-in-1, Compass, Lanyard, And Compass - CCH5-1", "description": "Survival Kit Someday when you're lost in the woods, you'll be very, very glad you ordered this compact survival kit. It's the classic camp director's whistle, raised to new heights. The 4-1/2 in. x 1-1/8 in. dia orange-plastic treasure hangs around your neck on a yellow nylon cord. On one end, the whistle. On the other, a compass. Unscrew the compass, and it reverses to a signal mirror, and reveals a 2-1/2 in. deep waterproof compartment for aspirin or medicinal brandy - or for the matches you're going to strike against the 3/4 in. long sparker. No, it's not overkill for a teacher to wear it on the playground. 'S cool.", "text": "SE - Whistle - 5-in-1, Compass, Lanyard, And Compass - CCH5-1 Survival Kit Someday when you're lost in the woods, you'll be very, very glad you ordered this compact survival kit. It's the classic camp director's whistle, raised to new heights. The 4-1/2 in. x 1-1/8 in. dia orange-plastic treasure hangs around your neck on a yellow nylon cord. On one end, the whistle. On the other, a compass. Unscrew the compass, and it reverses to a signal mirror, and reveals a 2-1/2 in. deep waterproof compartment for aspirin or medicinal brandy - or for the matches you're going to strike against the 3/4 in. long sparker. No, it's not overkill for a teacher to wear it on the playground. 'S cool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V7KP-0bzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SLRFDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.24}}
{"item_id": "B002SPN0RU", "title": "Pro Ears Carry Bag", "description": "The Pro Ears carry bags are designed to protect your Pro Ears when they are not in use. The bags are Made in America and will resist wear and tear, bumping, scratching and the elements.", "text": "Pro Ears Carry Bag The Pro Ears carry bags are designed to protect your Pro Ears when they are not in use. The bags are Made in America and will resist wear and tear, bumping, scratching and the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wp77byQCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SPN0RU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Ears", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 15.61}}
{"item_id": "B002SPQN9M", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Extra Magazine Pouch Insert", "description": "This US Peacekeeper extra magazine pouch is designed to fit our RAT (Rapid Assault Tactical) cases and will hold three single or double rifle magazines. The heavy duty velcro backing allows for easy attachment in multiple areas of our RAT case and it also includes D-rings for attaching a shoulder strap.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Extra Magazine Pouch Insert This US Peacekeeper extra magazine pouch is designed to fit our RAT (Rapid Assault Tactical) cases and will hold three single or double rifle magazines. The heavy duty velcro backing allows for easy attachment in multiple areas of our RAT case and it also includes D-rings for attaching a shoulder strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t1vIKSN1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SPQN9M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.06}}
{"item_id": "B002SPVBGW", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glass PercView Top", "description": "GSI Outdoors Glass PercView Top is a universal replacement top for coffee percolators. Made to twist securely into perc top. Made of glass, BPA-free, and dishwasher safe.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glass PercView Top GSI Outdoors Glass PercView Top is a universal replacement top for coffee percolators. Made to twist securely into perc top. Made of glass, BPA-free, and dishwasher safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21xUqd48R6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SPVBGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B002SQZZDG", "title": "Continental Touring Plus Reflex Bike Tire", "description": "The Touring Plus is an excellent choice for any and every touring bicycle. Its balanced tread pattern has bikes rolling effortlessly down roads and paths, while its finely siped shoulder blocks provide surefooted grip in curves. Additionally the PlusBreaker and highly visible reflective sidewall make for top-level safety. No wonder our Touring Plus is one of the most popular and frequently used bike tires anywhere.", "text": "Continental Touring Plus Reflex Bike Tire The Touring Plus is an excellent choice for any and every touring bicycle. Its balanced tread pattern has bikes rolling effortlessly down roads and paths, while its finely siped shoulder blocks provide surefooted grip in curves. Additionally the PlusBreaker and highly visible reflective sidewall make for top-level safety. No wonder our Touring Plus is one of the most popular and frequently used bike tires anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412HTRUBooL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SQZZDG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
