{"item_id": "B002SR1ICW", "title": "Vittoria Randonneur City Tire", "description": "Transform any 700c bike into an urban assault vehicle with the Vittoria Randonneur 700c City Bike Tire. A 60 TPI bead is supple and highly versatile on all types of surfaces ranging from roads, greenways, gravel/dirt. Aqua-flow tread technology helps keep you on the bike even on slick city streets, and if you're worrying about a city tire weighing your rig down, you don't have to; at 490g, Randonneurs bring much to the fight in traction, versatility, and durability without adding a lot of weight. Aqua-Flow tread pattern enhances grip in all kinds of weather conditions Double Shielding puncture protection gives you peace of mind on various surfaces", "text": "Vittoria Randonneur City Tire Transform any 700c bike into an urban assault vehicle with the Vittoria Randonneur 700c City Bike Tire. A 60 TPI bead is supple and highly versatile on all types of surfaces ranging from roads, greenways, gravel/dirt. Aqua-flow tread technology helps keep you on the bike even on slick city streets, and if you're worrying about a city tire weighing your rig down, you don't have to; at 490g, Randonneurs bring much to the fight in traction, versatility, and durability without adding a lot of weight. Aqua-Flow tread pattern enhances grip in all kinds of weather conditions Double Shielding puncture protection gives you peace of mind on various surfaces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jUMLqhH8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SR1ICW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002SU97BI", "title": "Igloo Island Breeze 28 Qt. Roller Cooler", "description": "Pack 28 quarts' worth of your favorite food and beverages, then roll it to your destination of choice, with the rolling Igloo Island Breeze cooler. The push-button, locking, telescoping handle, along with soft ride sports wheels and molded side scoop handles to help with loading in and out of the car, combine to make for delightful portability. An elevated cooler design improves cooling performance by minimizing contact with the ground and other hot surfaces, making it ideal for the beach, tailgating, and camping.FeaturesPatent-pending Cool Riser technology improves cooling performanceErgonomic curved backside for ultimate carrying comfortSwing-up handle with three grab/carry points for one-handed carryingMolded side scoop handles for optional two handed carrying29-quart size holds 37 cans, 12 20-ounce sports drinks, or six two-liter bottles uprightPush-button, locking, telescoping handleSoft-ride sport wheelsMolded-in side carry handlesWarrantyThis Igloo product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About IglooIgloo has been one of the leading cooler brands for more than 60 years, since essentially originating the product category in 1947.", "text": "Igloo Island Breeze 28 Qt. Roller Cooler Pack 28 quarts' worth of your favorite food and beverages, then roll it to your destination of choice, with the rolling Igloo Island Breeze cooler. The push-button, locking, telescoping handle, along with soft ride sports wheels and molded side scoop handles to help with loading in and out of the car, combine to make for delightful portability. An elevated cooler design improves cooling performance by minimizing contact with the ground and other hot surfaces, making it ideal for the beach, tailgating, and camping.FeaturesPatent-pending Cool Riser technology improves cooling performanceErgonomic curved backside for ultimate carrying comfortSwing-up handle with three grab/carry points for one-handed carryingMolded side scoop handles for optional two handed carrying29-quart size holds 37 cans, 12 20-ounce sports drinks, or six two-liter bottles uprightPush-button, locking, telescoping handleSoft-ride sport wheelsMolded-in side carry handlesWarrantyThis Igloo product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About IglooIgloo has been one of the leading cooler brands for more than 60 years, since essentially originating the product category in 1947.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31v0rtFhAYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SU97BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Igloo Products Corp.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 35.99}}
{"item_id": "B002SUJ4F2", "title": "TapouT Adult Mouthguard", "description": "Finally, a mouthguard for every athlete in every sport. Ameture or Pro, Male or Female, with or without braces, there is now just one mouthguard. From the fiercest brand in sports, comes mouth protection like no other. TapouT® Mouthguard has innovated a mouth protection system so advanced it rivals the safety and performance of custom-molded mouthguards that cost hundreds of dollars, but at a fraction of the cost.", "text": "TapouT Adult Mouthguard Finally, a mouthguard for every athlete in every sport. Ameture or Pro, Male or Female, with or without braces, there is now just one mouthguard. From the fiercest brand in sports, comes mouth protection like no other. TapouT® Mouthguard has innovated a mouth protection system so advanced it rivals the safety and performance of custom-molded mouthguards that cost hundreds of dollars, but at a fraction of the cost.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412JSdBTNLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SUJ4F2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002SUT7G8", "title": "Szco Supplies Tanto Survivor Fire starter Knife, Black", "description": "This Tanto Survivor Fire Starter Knife is71\" in overall length. It has a black cord wrapped handle. The black finish blade is made of stainless steel. This knife comes with a sheath. This knife also comes with a fire starter tool.", "text": "Szco Supplies Tanto Survivor Fire starter Knife, Black This Tanto Survivor Fire Starter Knife is71\" in overall length. It has a black cord wrapped handle. The black finish blade is made of stainless steel. This knife comes with a sheath. This knife also comes with a fire starter tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ya3vnY8LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SUT7G8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SZCO Supplies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 7.36}}
{"item_id": "B002SUVCFW", "title": "Gracie Lifestyle Combatives Standard DVD Package", "description": "The Course Although Gracie Jiu-Jitsu consists of more than 600 techniques, studies of the fights conducted by members of the Gracie Family show that 36 techniques have been used more often, and with greater success, than all the other techniques combined. Originally developed for the U.S. Army, Gracie Combatives is the only course that is entirely dedicated to the mastery of these 36 essential techniques. Up until now, this course was taught exclusively at a small network of Gracie Academy certified training centers, but now, for the first time ever, the complete Gracie Combatives course is available on DVD and can be learned from the comfort of your own home. The Objective What makes the Gracie Combatives collection so unique is that it is the only instructional DVD series ever produced with the sole objective of taking the viewer - regardless of their age, gender or athletic ability - from no knowledge to street ready without ever stepping foot into a school of martial arts. Every other instructional video series to date was designed to give viewers additional techniques and tips to complement the training they were receiving at an actual school of martial arts, whereas the entire Gracie Combatives series was produced under the assumption that the viewer had absolutely no previous experience and, for one reason or another, would never have the privilege of learning at a Certified Gracie Jiu-Jitsu Training Center.", "text": "Gracie Lifestyle Combatives Standard DVD Package The Course Although Gracie Jiu-Jitsu consists of more than 600 techniques, studies of the fights conducted by members of the Gracie Family show that 36 techniques have been used more often, and with greater success, than all the other techniques combined. Originally developed for the U.S. Army, Gracie Combatives is the only course that is entirely dedicated to the mastery of these 36 essential techniques. Up until now, this course was taught exclusively at a small network of Gracie Academy certified training centers, but now, for the first time ever, the complete Gracie Combatives course is available on DVD and can be learned from the comfort of your own home. The Objective What makes the Gracie Combatives collection so unique is that it is the only instructional DVD series ever produced with the sole objective of taking the viewer - regardless of their age, gender or athletic ability - from no knowledge to street ready without ever stepping foot into a school of martial arts. Every other instructional video series to date was designed to give viewers additional techniques and tips to complement the training they were receiving at an actual school of martial arts, whereas the entire Gracie Combatives series was produced under the assumption that the viewer had absolutely no previous experience and, for one reason or another, would never have the privilege of learning at a Certified Gracie Jiu-Jitsu Training Center.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KIDtkdT9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SUVCFW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 119.9}}
{"item_id": "B002SYWX9M", "title": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Velo Shell", "description": "The Canari Men's Velo Shell is a super lightweight, packable shell that will protect you against the elements at a great value. The WindShear fabric is lightweight, which means it won't get in your way. It's also windproof and water-repellant. There is a full zipper at the center front that features a draft flap to keep out the wind and rain. It's got a 9\" back zip pocket with reflective trim for added visibility as well as storage that also converts to a stuff sack with waist attachments. Other features include reflective trim on the front and back shoulders, a back drop tail for added coverage, and elastic bottom and sleeve hem. Material: (Body) Polyester WindShear Fabric. Size Chart (Chest Measurement); SM 38-40, MD 40-42, LG 42-44, XL 44-46, XXL 46-48.", "text": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Velo Shell The Canari Men's Velo Shell is a super lightweight, packable shell that will protect you against the elements at a great value. The WindShear fabric is lightweight, which means it won't get in your way. It's also windproof and water-repellant. There is a full zipper at the center front that features a draft flap to keep out the wind and rain. It's got a 9\" back zip pocket with reflective trim for added visibility as well as storage that also converts to a stuff sack with waist attachments. Other features include reflective trim on the front and back shoulders, a back drop tail for added coverage, and elastic bottom and sleeve hem. Material: (Body) Polyester WindShear Fabric. Size Chart (Chest Measurement); SM 38-40, MD 40-42, LG 42-44, XL 44-46, XXL 46-48.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Eg6IQcs7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002SYWX9M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002T04QHW", "title": "Dockers Men's 6-Pack Athletic Quarter Socks", "description": "", "text": "Dockers Men's 6-Pack Athletic Quarter Socks", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AWMh1FpqL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T04QHW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "D", "Dockers"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Athletic Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002T08MOU", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Identification Panel Base with Speed Clips", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Identification Panel Base offers hook and loop panel for attaching ID panels to MOLLE/S.T.R.I.K.E. systems. Panel mounts with Speed Clips (included) and measures 2.5”h x 5.5”w.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Identification Panel Base with Speed Clips The BLACKHAWK! Identification Panel Base offers hook and loop panel for attaching ID panels to MOLLE/S.T.R.I.K.E. systems. Panel mounts with Speed Clips (included) and measures 2.5”h x 5.5”w.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dSa1CWEqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T08MOU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002T0IOVG", "title": "Under Armour UA Extreme ColdGear® Gloves", "description": "Breathable, wind-resistant materials block wind, keeping you warm, protected, and comfortable. Durable Water Repellent (DWR) finished fabric keeps you dry, no matter what Mother Nature throws at you. Reflective piping, Under Armour® script and UA logo give you added safety on even the darkest evening runs. A zipper gusset (added fabric behind the zipper) combined with a hidden key pocket allows you to seal out the elements and seal in your valuables. ColdGear® cuff makes these ultimate gloves for extreme cold. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour UA Extreme ColdGear® Gloves Breathable, wind-resistant materials block wind, keeping you warm, protected, and comfortable. Durable Water Repellent (DWR) finished fabric keeps you dry, no matter what Mother Nature throws at you. Reflective piping, Under Armour® script and UA logo give you added safety on even the darkest evening runs. A zipper gusset (added fabric behind the zipper) combined with a hidden key pocket allows you to seal out the elements and seal in your valuables. ColdGear® cuff makes these ultimate gloves for extreme cold. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Kcv%2BorXZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T0IOVG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002T1ZW2E", "title": "Mil-Comm TW25B grease 1.5 oz tapered tip tube", "description": "Mil-Comms TW25B exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military. TW25B light synthetic grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide because it performs so well under so many conditions. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B is unparalleled in performing in extreme pressure and heavy load bearing applications. Additionally, TW25B and its derivatives are environmentally safe, non-toxic, non-flammable and easy to apply. Finally, TW25B and its derivatives work exceptionally well under extreme temperature conditions, performing well in ranges from -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C). TW25B and its derivatives are truly the most versatile extreme performance lubricants in the world. Benefits: Extremely reliable in all climates, under all weather conditions, on all types of firearms Minimizes friction, reduces wear and extends the life of weapon parts Minimizes carbon residue and build-up of copper (Cu) and lead (Pb) Minimizes accumulation of sand, dust, salt and gun powder residues Greatly inhibits rust and corrosion Eliminates galling and short-stroking Performs in a broad temperature range: -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C) Provides improved bore accuracy and increased muzzle velocity Permits storage of weapon in fire-ready condition for extended periods Reduces time and frequency of maintenance with easy wipe-off cleaning Delivers very long lasting lubrication and corrosion protection; will not freeze Resists wash-off, wear-off, burn-off, and evaporation between cleanings Repels moisture, sand and dust Generally harmless to wood, rubber, plastic and composite parts Non-toxic and environmentally safe Proudly made in the USA Benefits: Extremely reliable in all climates, under all weather conditions, on all types of firearms Minimizes friction, reduces wear and extends the life of weapon parts Minimizes carbon residue and build-up of copper (Cu) and lead (Pb) Minimizes accumulation of sand, dust, salt and gun powder residues Greatly inhibits rust and corrosion Eliminates galling and short-stroking Performs in a broad temperature range: -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C) Provides improved bore accuracy and increased muzzle velocity Permits storage of weapon in fire-ready condition for extended periods Reduces time and frequency of maintenance with easy wipe-off cleaning Delivers very long lasting lubrication and corrosion protection; will not freeze Resists wash-off, wear-off, burn-off, and evaporation between cleanings Repels moisture, sand and dust Generally harmless to wood, rubber, plastic and composite parts Non-toxic and environmentally safe Proudly made in the USA", "text": "Mil-Comm TW25B grease 1.5 oz tapered tip tube Mil-Comms TW25B exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military. TW25B light synthetic grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide because it performs so well under so many conditions. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B is unparalleled in performing in extreme pressure and heavy load bearing applications. Additionally, TW25B and its derivatives are environmentally safe, non-toxic, non-flammable and easy to apply. Finally, TW25B and its derivatives work exceptionally well under extreme temperature conditions, performing well in ranges from -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C). TW25B and its derivatives are truly the most versatile extreme performance lubricants in the world. Benefits: Extremely reliable in all climates, under all weather conditions, on all types of firearms Minimizes friction, reduces wear and extends the life of weapon parts Minimizes carbon residue and build-up of copper (Cu) and lead (Pb) Minimizes accumulation of sand, dust, salt and gun powder residues Greatly inhibits rust and corrosion Eliminates galling and short-stroking Performs in a broad temperature range: -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C) Provides improved bore accuracy and increased muzzle velocity Permits storage of weapon in fire-ready condition for extended periods Reduces time and frequency of maintenance with easy wipe-off cleaning Delivers very long lasting lubrication and corrosion protection; will not freeze Resists wash-off, wear-off, burn-off, and evaporation between cleanings Repels moisture, sand and dust Generally harmless to wood, rubber, plastic and composite parts Non-toxic and environmentally safe Proudly made in the USA Benefits: Extremely reliable in all climates, under all weather conditions, on all types of firearms Minimizes friction, reduces wear and extends the life of weapon parts Minimizes carbon residue and build-up of copper (Cu) and lead (Pb) Minimizes accumulation of sand, dust, salt and gun powder residues Greatly inhibits rust and corrosion Eliminates galling and short-stroking Performs in a broad temperature range: -90F (-67C) to +450F (232C) Provides improved bore accuracy and increased muzzle velocity Permits storage of weapon in fire-ready condition for extended periods Reduces time and frequency of maintenance with easy wipe-off cleaning Delivers very long lasting lubrication and corrosion protection; will not freeze Resists wash-off, wear-off, burn-off, and evaporation between cleanings Repels moisture, sand and dust Generally harmless to wood, rubber, plastic and composite parts Non-toxic and environmentally safe Proudly made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dBc7%2Ben5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T1ZW2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mil-Comm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B002T263F8", "title": "Ibera Cell Phone Handlebar Bag with Stem Mount", "description": "The PB2 holds cell phones, 2-way radios, and small items safe and close at hand. Made of durable 1680D nylon, it also has a zippered pocket for additional items including keys or small tools. There is an additional headphone opening for use with hands-free devices. Angle adjustable stem mount. Great for bikes with limited handlebar space.", "text": "Ibera Cell Phone Handlebar Bag with Stem Mount The PB2 holds cell phones, 2-way radios, and small items safe and close at hand. Made of durable 1680D nylon, it also has a zippered pocket for additional items including keys or small tools. There is an additional headphone opening for use with hands-free devices. Angle adjustable stem mount. Great for bikes with limited handlebar space.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VQV0rXHSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T263F8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002T2KX7W", "title": "Plastic Transparent Flashlights On A Rope (12)", "description": "Plastic Transparent Flashlights On A Rope. Each 3 assorted color flashlight is on a 28 nylon cord. (1 dz./PBH) Each requires 1 ?AA? battery, not included.", "text": "Plastic Transparent Flashlights On A Rope (12) Plastic Transparent Flashlights On A Rope. Each 3 assorted color flashlight is on a 28 nylon cord. (1 dz./PBH) Each requires 1 ?AA? battery, not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wIQtN2dZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T2KX7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fun Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 7.7}}
{"item_id": "B002T4QA40", "title": "ENO ProNest Hammock", "description": "The ProNest is ENO's smallest and lightest hammock. Weighing in at only 12.8 ounces, this hammock is compact but still offers the same ease and comfort ENO hammocks are known for. To reduce weight, the hammock has a redesigned attachment point with custom aluminum carabiners created specifically for the ProNest. The ProNest's size and weight allows users to lighten their pack or carry load without sacrificing comfort.Features and Specifications:Dimensions: 54 by 96 inches (W x H)Dimensions Stuffed: 4 by 4 by 4 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 12.8 ouncesMaximum Weight Capacity: 400 poundsMade of high-strength breathable woven nylonLightweight custom aluminum carabinerHigh-grade nylon triple interlock stitching", "text": "ENO ProNest Hammock The ProNest is ENO's smallest and lightest hammock. Weighing in at only 12.8 ounces, this hammock is compact but still offers the same ease and comfort ENO hammocks are known for. To reduce weight, the hammock has a redesigned attachment point with custom aluminum carabiners created specifically for the ProNest. The ProNest's size and weight allows users to lighten their pack or carry load without sacrificing comfort.Features and Specifications:Dimensions: 54 by 96 inches (W x H)Dimensions Stuffed: 4 by 4 by 4 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 12.8 ouncesMaximum Weight Capacity: 400 poundsMade of high-strength breathable woven nylonLightweight custom aluminum carabinerHigh-grade nylon triple interlock stitching", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cv48iL88L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002T4QA40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eno", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 64.95}}
