{"item_id": "B002TE5Y38", "title": "SKB Hunter Series Bow Case", "description": "The new 2SKB-4117 SKB Hunter Series Parallel Limb Bow case offers solid protection for your equipment at an affordable price point. The 4117 will accommodate most parallel limb bows with quiver attached, including the Mathews Z7®, Bowtech Admiral®, PSE X-Force®, and many others. Includes 5 year Warranty against manufacturer defect for the case.", "text": "SKB Hunter Series Bow Case The new 2SKB-4117 SKB Hunter Series Parallel Limb Bow case offers solid protection for your equipment at an affordable price point. The 4117 will accommodate most parallel limb bows with quiver attached, including the Mathews Z7®, Bowtech Admiral®, PSE X-Force®, and many others. Includes 5 year Warranty against manufacturer defect for the case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418I4DTiR1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TE5Y38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKB Corp.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 124.99}}
{"item_id": "B002TJW1D4", "title": "Replacement Rubber Tips for Hammers Hiking Poles, 2 Pack", "description": "Replacement rubber end caps for Hammers and LEKI hiking sticks and poles. Replacement rubber end caps for Hammers hiking sticks and poles.The end caps might be good for use on hiking poles of other brands. The inside hole diameter of these caps is 12mm. These are identical to the ones on the poles and can be used interchangably. There is a metal insert inside the bottom of the end cap for better durability.Inside diameter of the cap: 12mm. Two caps in this set. 2pcs.", "text": "Replacement Rubber Tips for Hammers Hiking Poles, 2 Pack Replacement rubber end caps for Hammers and LEKI hiking sticks and poles. Replacement rubber end caps for Hammers hiking sticks and poles.The end caps might be good for use on hiking poles of other brands. The inside hole diameter of these caps is 12mm. These are identical to the ones on the poles and can be used interchangably. There is a metal insert inside the bottom of the end cap for better durability.Inside diameter of the cap: 12mm. Two caps in this set. 2pcs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41912juaXML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TJW1D4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 6.88}}
{"item_id": "B002TM5LOW", "title": "Camp Chef Rainier Grill and Portable Camp Stove", "description": "Camp Chef Mountain Series are designed to cook better than traditional portable products. the Camp Chef Rainier Two Burner Grill / Stove Combo 10,000 BTU burner 8,000 BTU burner Stainless steel drip tray for easy clean up Matchless ignition Convenient carry handle Non-stick coated aluminum grill The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 24 x 6 x 13.5\" Box Weight: 12 lbs Great tasting food will always bring people together and Camp Chef has that figured out. As an industry leading manufacture for more than 20 years, Camp Chef produces high quality products offering efficient ways to cook for almost any outdoor gathering. From social functions to campouts or even dinner on the back patio, Camp Chef can do it all.", "text": "Camp Chef Rainier Grill and Portable Camp Stove Camp Chef Mountain Series are designed to cook better than traditional portable products. the Camp Chef Rainier Two Burner Grill / Stove Combo 10,000 BTU burner 8,000 BTU burner Stainless steel drip tray for easy clean up Matchless ignition Convenient carry handle Non-stick coated aluminum grill The SPECS Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 24 x 6 x 13.5\" Box Weight: 12 lbs Great tasting food will always bring people together and Camp Chef has that figured out. As an industry leading manufacture for more than 20 years, Camp Chef produces high quality products offering efficient ways to cook for almost any outdoor gathering. From social functions to campouts or even dinner on the back patio, Camp Chef can do it all.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4141hGQyT7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TM5LOW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B002TOKR1M", "title": "Stack-On GCB-18-C 18 Gun Convertible Steel Security Cabinet, Black", "description": "Stack-On's Gun Cabinets feature welded, steel box construction and superior all steel 3 point locking system with double butted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Also features Stack-On's patented, contoured non-marring barrel rest and barrel standoffs for scoped guns. Durable baked epoxy finish in hunter green. Flush mount bottom for easier fastening to floor. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening and finishing hardware included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On's Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. Stack-On's superior all steel 3-point locking system provides greater security. The locking plate passes behind the steel cabinet frame at the top and bottom of each unit. In addition, a large steel locking plate is secured behind the steel door frame in the center section of the door panel. Molded barrel rests won't deteriorate or compress over time. The contour of the barrel rest will accommodate rifles as well as side-by-side shotguns. Stack-On's patented barrel rests keep your guns in place. Stack-On's patented barrel rest standoffs keep most scoped rifles away from the back of the cabinet and allow for one position storage. This unique standoff can be attached to any Stack-On barrel rest and removed if your needs change.", "text": "Stack-On GCB-18-C 18 Gun Convertible Steel Security Cabinet, Black Stack-On's Gun Cabinets feature welded, steel box construction and superior all steel 3 point locking system with double butted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Also features Stack-On's patented, contoured non-marring barrel rest and barrel standoffs for scoped guns. Durable baked epoxy finish in hunter green. Flush mount bottom for easier fastening to floor. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening and finishing hardware included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On's Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. Stack-On's superior all steel 3-point locking system provides greater security. The locking plate passes behind the steel cabinet frame at the top and bottom of each unit. In addition, a large steel locking plate is secured behind the steel door frame in the center section of the door panel. Molded barrel rests won't deteriorate or compress over time. The contour of the barrel rest will accommodate rifles as well as side-by-side shotguns. Stack-On's patented barrel rests keep your guns in place. Stack-On's patented barrel rest standoffs keep most scoped rifles away from the back of the cabinet and allow for one position storage. This unique standoff can be attached to any Stack-On barrel rest and removed if your needs change.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31at0XSn6xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TOKR1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 299.99}}
