{"item_id": "B002TT9NL2", "title": "Rothco paracord 550LB NYLON 100 FT / FOLIAGE", "description": "Foliage Green 550LB Type III Nylon Paracord Rope 100 Feet - Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. Constructed By A Certified US Government Contractor. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part Of Any Survival Kit. Type III Commercial Paracord. Enhanced GI Plus Parachute Cord. Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail. Has Multiple Uses & Can Be Used By Anyone. Lightweight, Strong & Durable. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. GSA Compliant. Made In The USA. Color: Foliage Green Military Paracord. Size: 100 Feet Long. http://www.armyuniverse.com/images/product_images/GSA_Compliant_logo.gif http://www.armyuniverse.com/images/USA_Made.jpg This 550 paracord is the exact type of cord that the US Military uses for non critical missions & they have to have the best and most reliable cord. This is not a cheap immitation and is as advertised. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 strands can be easily removed to be used for: Securing Equipment, Shoelaces, Hanging Food From Bears, Vehicle Tie Down, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making A Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String For A Bow, Making A Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares, Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, & Other Paracord Crafts. No survival kit is complete without a hank of genuine paracord rope.", "text": "Rothco paracord 550LB NYLON 100 FT / FOLIAGE Foliage Green 550LB Type III Nylon Paracord Rope 100 Feet - Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. Constructed By A Certified US Government Contractor. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part Of Any Survival Kit. Type III Commercial Paracord. Enhanced GI Plus Parachute Cord. Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail. Has Multiple Uses & Can Be Used By Anyone. Lightweight, Strong & Durable. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. GSA Compliant. Made In The USA. Color: Foliage Green Military Paracord. Size: 100 Feet Long. http://www.armyuniverse.com/images/product_images/GSA_Compliant_logo.gif http://www.armyuniverse.com/images/USA_Made.jpg This 550 paracord is the exact type of cord that the US Military uses for non critical missions & they have to have the best and most reliable cord. This is not a cheap immitation and is as advertised. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 strands can be easily removed to be used for: Securing Equipment, Shoelaces, Hanging Food From Bears, Vehicle Tie Down, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making A Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String For A Bow, Making A Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares, Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, & Other Paracord Crafts. No survival kit is complete without a hank of genuine paracord rope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4197VnKD6TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TT9NL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B002TTDKCU", "title": "Nylon Military Paracord 550 lbs Type III 7 Strand Utility Cord Rope 100 Feet", "description": "Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 7 Removable Nylon Inner Strands by 2 Ply. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. Easy to Clean. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. Made In The USA.Paracords direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 strands can be easily removed Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts.No survival kit is complete without a hank of genuine paracord rope. Get all your official 550 paracord ropes from here with our wide selection of colors. Our 550 paracords for sale are great and those looking to get the real stuff, with a wide selection of colors you came to the right spot. We offer the 100 feet military 550 paracords in solid color paracords, camouflage paracords, reflective paracords & glow in the dark paracords for all your projects and needs.***We offer a lifetime guarantee on these ropes and if there are any issues, contact us and we will take care of it for you!***THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING", "text": "Nylon Military Paracord 550 lbs Type III 7 Strand Utility Cord Rope 100 Feet Made From 100% Heavy Duty Nylon Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 7 Removable Nylon Inner Strands by 2 Ply. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. Easy to Clean. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. Made In The USA.Paracords direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 strands can be easily removed Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts.No survival kit is complete without a hank of genuine paracord rope. Get all your official 550 paracord ropes from here with our wide selection of colors. Our 550 paracords for sale are great and those looking to get the real stuff, with a wide selection of colors you came to the right spot. We offer the 100 feet military 550 paracords in solid color paracords, camouflage paracords, reflective paracords & glow in the dark paracords for all your projects and needs.***We offer a lifetime guarantee on these ropes and if there are any issues, contact us and we will take care of it for you!***THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x-wFmfPBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TTDKCU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B002TTDKH0", "title": "Woodland Camouflage 550lb Nylon 50 Foot GI Enhanced Paracord Rope", "description": "100% Heavy duty nylon material. Made by a certified US government contractor. 550 pound tested - 7 strand core. Made in USA. 5/32\" diameter. Important part of any survival kit. Type III commercial paracord. Enhanced para cord is better than military specifications. Top quality craftsmanship, detailed construction, improving every last detail. Woodland Camouflage - 550lb nylon 50 foot cord. This product is GSA Compliant.", "text": "Woodland Camouflage 550lb Nylon 50 Foot GI Enhanced Paracord Rope 100% Heavy duty nylon material. Made by a certified US government contractor. 550 pound tested - 7 strand core. Made in USA. 5/32\" diameter. Important part of any survival kit. Type III commercial paracord. Enhanced para cord is better than military specifications. Top quality craftsmanship, detailed construction, improving every last detail. Woodland Camouflage - 550lb nylon 50 foot cord. This product is GSA Compliant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MZN0457IL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TTDKH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B002TTI7C8", "title": "MP5 Rail Mount", "description": "The MP5 Rail Mount allows easy attachment of scopes and accessories of all shapes and sizes onto the MP5 / G3 / GSG5 or the same series H&K; firearms / airgun. It is made of very durable metal and will hold the accessory very steadily. Perfectly sits on top of your firearm with claws which can be tightened by screws. MP5 is a trademark of it prespective owners. This item is an accessory compatible with the item, not from the original manufacturer. MP5 is a trademark of it prespective owners.", "text": "MP5 Rail Mount The MP5 Rail Mount allows easy attachment of scopes and accessories of all shapes and sizes onto the MP5 / G3 / GSG5 or the same series H&K; firearms / airgun. It is made of very durable metal and will hold the accessory very steadily. Perfectly sits on top of your firearm with claws which can be tightened by screws. MP5 is a trademark of it prespective owners. This item is an accessory compatible with the item, not from the original manufacturer. MP5 is a trademark of it prespective owners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dnf0QH11L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TTI7C8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 18.51}}
