{"item_id": "B002TUSDS0", "title": "UTG SKS Shell Deflector", "description": "This useful add-on accessory deflects flying shells and prevents them from hitting nearby people and objects. It fits all SKS style rifles and is compatible with SKS Tri-Rails and Hi-Pro Mounts and is constructed of steel with a matte black finish.Features and Specifications:Add-on accessory to deflect flying shells to prevent them from hitting people and objectsFits SKS style riflesCompatible with SKS Tri-Rails and Hi-Pro MountsMatte black finishMaterial: SteelWeight: 2.1 ouncesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG SKS Shell Deflector This useful add-on accessory deflects flying shells and prevents them from hitting nearby people and objects. It fits all SKS style rifles and is compatible with SKS Tri-Rails and Hi-Pro Mounts and is constructed of steel with a matte black finish.Features and Specifications:Add-on accessory to deflect flying shells to prevent them from hitting people and objectsFits SKS style riflesCompatible with SKS Tri-Rails and Hi-Pro MountsMatte black finishMaterial: SteelWeight: 2.1 ouncesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iPVCBKLUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSDS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 7.69}}
{"item_id": "B002TUSDSU", "title": "UTG LED Flashlight", "description": "The UTG LED Flashlight features a combat tactical front head, a twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch with triple on/off systems, and an interchangeable mounting deck. It also features an integrated reflector and light bulb to provide instant spot focus for clear object identification.Features:LED Light has the advantage of white brightness, longer life time, and power saveHandheld with an easy-to-hold main bodyBest in class with CREE Xlamp XR-E Q5 LEDTwist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch triple on/off systemsCombat tactical front headIntegrated reflector and light bulb to provide instant spot focus for clear object identificationRemovable tactical flashlight mountInterchangeable mounting deckSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight with Battery: 6.5 ouncesFlashlight Bulb Type: 26mm LED IRBFlashlight Voltage(V): 6VFlashlight Max. Lumen(Lumens): 150 lumensFlashlight Battery Operating Time: 2 hours +Switch Operating Type: Push-button momentary/twist-on permanent switchFlashlight Focus: PresetBattery Type: CR123A Lithium Battery X2Pressure Switch Included: YesDiameter: 1.07 inchesLength: 5.26 inchesColor: BlackAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG LED Flashlight The UTG LED Flashlight features a combat tactical front head, a twist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch with triple on/off systems, and an interchangeable mounting deck. It also features an integrated reflector and light bulb to provide instant spot focus for clear object identification.Features:LED Light has the advantage of white brightness, longer life time, and power saveHandheld with an easy-to-hold main bodyBest in class with CREE Xlamp XR-E Q5 LEDTwist-on, push-button and remote pressure switch triple on/off systemsCombat tactical front headIntegrated reflector and light bulb to provide instant spot focus for clear object identificationRemovable tactical flashlight mountInterchangeable mounting deckSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight with Battery: 6.5 ouncesFlashlight Bulb Type: 26mm LED IRBFlashlight Voltage(V): 6VFlashlight Max. Lumen(Lumens): 150 lumensFlashlight Battery Operating Time: 2 hours +Switch Operating Type: Push-button momentary/twist-on permanent switchFlashlight Focus: PresetBattery Type: CR123A Lithium Battery X2Pressure Switch Included: YesDiameter: 1.07 inchesLength: 5.26 inchesColor: BlackAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HrcjDDy-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSDSU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 64.04}}
