{"item_id": "B002TUSHSQ", "title": "UTG Ultimate Tactical Gear Modular 10 Piece Complete Kit", "description": "You'll have room for all your gear and ammo in the UTG Ultimate Tactical Gear Modular 10-Piece kit, complete with versatile UTG web straps on the front and 7 UTG web straps on the back to allow for attachment of various modular web pockets/pouches and all essential gear. With a front and back Velcro system for ID patches, heavy-duty zippers, and three quick-release buckles for a secure fit that enable the vest to be worn over body armor, this kit has it all. It features a well-designed black mesh support, two zippered UTG mesh interior side pockets, Velcro and snap belt loops for web/pistol belt attachment, cell phone pouch, flashlight pound, two open-top double mag pouches, a dual pistol mag pouch, a medical/utility pouch, duty belt, drop-leg platform ambidextrous holster, and a drop-leg platform dump pouch.Features and Specifications:Front and back Velcro system for ID patchesComplete with heavy-duty zippers and 3 quick release buckles for secure fit and wear over body armorWell-designed black mesh support and 2 zippered UTG mesh interior side pockets for cooling comfort and storage of documents, maps and other survival itemsVelcro and snap belt loops for web/pistol belt attachmentWaist: 38 to 55 inchesVest length: 21 to 23 inchesWhat's in the Kit?Web Tactical VestThis web tactical vest has 10 webs on the front, 7 webs on the back, zippered and Q.R. buckles, waist-hanging loops, adjustable straps, adjustable padded shoulder, mesh interior with zippered pockets and front/back Velcro patches. Weighs 2 pounds and has an adjustable height of 21 to 23 inches and an adjustable girth of 38 to 55 inches.UTG Web System GPS/Cell Phone PouchThe GPS/cell phone pouch with double zippered compartment and buckle-secured closure. Weighs 4 ounces and measures 5 by 3.5 by 2 inches.UTG Web System Single Flashlight PouchThis single flashlight pouch with Velcro and buckle-secured closure with an open bottom for easy access. It weighs 2 ounces and measures 6.5 by 2.5 inches.2 UTG Web System Open Top Double Rifle Mag PouchesTwo double rifle mag pouches with adjustable retention cord. It holds Model 4 and Model 15 type magazines, weighs 5 ounces, and measures 6 by 6.6 inches.UTG Web System Double High Capacity Pistol Mag PouchThe double high-capacity pistol mag pouch has Velcro closure, weighs 2.5 ounces, and measures 6 by 4 inches.Heavy-Duty Law Enforcement Pistol Beltthis heavy-duty law enforcement pistol belt is adjustable from 44 to 52 inches.UTG Web System Medical/Utility PouchThe medical/utility pouch has removable trauma mesh bags and utility loops and dual zipper closure. It weighs 10 ounces and measures 9 by 5 by 3.5 inches.UTG Web System Vertical Drop Leg PlatformThe vertical drop leg platform has a detachable ammo dump pouch, a fully adjustable double-vertical belt hanger with a quick-release buckle, a double non-slip leg strap/buckle system for full adjustment and an optimal platform.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Ultimate Tactical Gear Modular 10 Piece Complete Kit You'll have room for all your gear and ammo in the UTG Ultimate Tactical Gear Modular 10-Piece kit, complete with versatile UTG web straps on the front and 7 UTG web straps on the back to allow for attachment of various modular web pockets/pouches and all essential gear. With a front and back Velcro system for ID patches, heavy-duty zippers, and three quick-release buckles for a secure fit that enable the vest to be worn over body armor, this kit has it all. It features a well-designed black mesh support, two zippered UTG mesh interior side pockets, Velcro and snap belt loops for web/pistol belt attachment, cell phone pouch, flashlight pound, two open-top double mag pouches, a dual pistol mag pouch, a medical/utility pouch, duty belt, drop-leg platform ambidextrous holster, and a drop-leg platform dump pouch.Features and Specifications:Front and back Velcro system for ID patchesComplete with heavy-duty zippers and 3 quick release buckles for secure fit and wear over body armorWell-designed black mesh support and 2 zippered UTG mesh interior side pockets for cooling comfort and storage of documents, maps and other survival itemsVelcro and snap belt loops for web/pistol belt attachmentWaist: 38 to 55 inchesVest length: 21 to 23 inchesWhat's in the Kit?Web Tactical VestThis web tactical vest has 10 webs on the front, 7 webs on the back, zippered and Q.R. buckles, waist-hanging loops, adjustable straps, adjustable padded shoulder, mesh interior with zippered pockets and front/back Velcro patches. Weighs 2 pounds and has an adjustable height of 21 to 23 inches and an adjustable girth of 38 to 55 inches.UTG Web System GPS/Cell Phone PouchThe GPS/cell phone pouch with double zippered compartment and buckle-secured closure. Weighs 4 ounces and measures 5 by 3.5 by 2 inches.UTG Web System Single Flashlight PouchThis single flashlight pouch with Velcro and buckle-secured closure with an open bottom for easy access. It weighs 2 ounces and measures 6.5 by 2.5 inches.2 UTG Web System Open Top Double Rifle Mag PouchesTwo double rifle mag pouches with adjustable retention cord. It holds Model 4 and Model 15 type magazines, weighs 5 ounces, and measures 6 by 6.6 inches.UTG Web System Double High Capacity Pistol Mag PouchThe double high-capacity pistol mag pouch has Velcro closure, weighs 2.5 ounces, and measures 6 by 4 inches.Heavy-Duty Law Enforcement Pistol Beltthis heavy-duty law enforcement pistol belt is adjustable from 44 to 52 inches.UTG Web System Medical/Utility PouchThe medical/utility pouch has removable trauma mesh bags and utility loops and dual zipper closure. It weighs 10 ounces and measures 9 by 5 by 3.5 inches.UTG Web System Vertical Drop Leg PlatformThe vertical drop leg platform has a detachable ammo dump pouch, a fully adjustable double-vertical belt hanger with a quick-release buckle, a double non-slip leg strap/buckle system for full adjustment and an optimal platform.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JuZPdwpOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSHSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 103.38}}
