{"item_id": "B002TUSRTA", "title": "UTG Homeland Security KIS 38-Inch Covert Gun Case", "description": "Conceal your weapon in Homeland Security KIS Covert gun case that offers dual rifle concealed storage, a huge 11 by 10 inch pocket with Velcro closure for storing mags, ammo, cleaning supplies, and other accessories, and thick, well-padded high-density foam to protect your scoped rifle. Other features include a generous zippered pocket for additional storage, a heavy-duty and fully lockable zipper with dual zipper heads, double D-rings at both ends, a reinforced one-piece wrap-around carry handle, and an adjustable shoulder strap that's sewn right to the case.Features:High-quality synthetic material for outer shellConcealed dual rifle storageHigh-density foam for scoped rifle; more than 1.5 inches thickHuge 11\" x 10\" Pocket with Velcro Closure for Storing Mags, Ammo, Cleaning Supplies and Other AccessoriesGenerous 15\" x 8\" Zippered Pocket for Additional Storage1 �\" Reinforced One-piece Wrap-around Carry Handle1 �\" Adjustable Shoulder Strap Sewn to the Case#8 Heavy Duty Zipper with Dual Zipper Heads, Fully LockableDouble D-rings at Both EndsClear Name Tag HolderSpecifications:Material: PolyesterColor: BlackApplication: Sporting firearms, knock-down firearms, rifle with retractable stock, pistols and paintball gunsDimensions: 38 inch by 11 inches (W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Homeland Security KIS 38-Inch Covert Gun Case Conceal your weapon in Homeland Security KIS Covert gun case that offers dual rifle concealed storage, a huge 11 by 10 inch pocket with Velcro closure for storing mags, ammo, cleaning supplies, and other accessories, and thick, well-padded high-density foam to protect your scoped rifle. Other features include a generous zippered pocket for additional storage, a heavy-duty and fully lockable zipper with dual zipper heads, double D-rings at both ends, a reinforced one-piece wrap-around carry handle, and an adjustable shoulder strap that's sewn right to the case.Features:High-quality synthetic material for outer shellConcealed dual rifle storageHigh-density foam for scoped rifle; more than 1.5 inches thickHuge 11\" x 10\" Pocket with Velcro Closure for Storing Mags, Ammo, Cleaning Supplies and Other AccessoriesGenerous 15\" x 8\" Zippered Pocket for Additional Storage1 �\" Reinforced One-piece Wrap-around Carry Handle1 �\" Adjustable Shoulder Strap Sewn to the Case#8 Heavy Duty Zipper with Dual Zipper Heads, Fully LockableDouble D-rings at Both EndsClear Name Tag HolderSpecifications:Material: PolyesterColor: BlackApplication: Sporting firearms, knock-down firearms, rifle with retractable stock, pistols and paintball gunsDimensions: 38 inch by 11 inches (W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B6BspKkiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSRTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 31.71}}
