{"item_id": "B002TUSRYK", "title": "UTG Tactical Patrol Bag", "description": "This Tactical Patrol Bag is made of super-tough, water-resistant synthetic material for use in extreme conditions and has all the space you need to store your tools and ammo with a generous double-zippered main compartment. Heavy-duty zippers are bound and double-stitched on all edges and wall inserts in the bag ensure stand-up rigidity. A fully adjustable internal divider has padded insert panels and removable internal plastic panels that allow for organization and protection of your gear. The bag features two top pockets, one large Velcro document pocket with 3 pen sleeves, two large, zippered side pockets, two easy-access elastic trimmed front pockets, and one outside pocket with Velcro flap for passport, documents, and tools.Features:UTG combat quality Patrol Bag made of extremely tough and water-resistant synthetic materialHeavy-duty #10 zippers; bound and double-stitched on all edges4 wall inserts create stand-up rigidity and remove to fold bag flat2-inch wrap-around carry handle is sewn around the bagLarge, double-zippered main compartmentProtective and water-resistant materialFully adjustable internal divider with padded insert panels and hideaway internal plastic panelsAll insert panels removable to fold the bag flatT2 top pockets measuring 6 by 10 by 2 inches1 large Velcro closure document pocket with 3 pen sleeves2 large, zippered side pockets measuring 9 by 10 by 2 inches2 easy-access elastic trimmed front pockets1 exterior pocket with Velcro-lined flap for ticket book, documents, and toolsSpecifications:Weight: 6 poundsMaterial: Synthetic leatherDimensions: 13 by 23 by 11 inches (H x W x D)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Tactical Patrol Bag This Tactical Patrol Bag is made of super-tough, water-resistant synthetic material for use in extreme conditions and has all the space you need to store your tools and ammo with a generous double-zippered main compartment. Heavy-duty zippers are bound and double-stitched on all edges and wall inserts in the bag ensure stand-up rigidity. A fully adjustable internal divider has padded insert panels and removable internal plastic panels that allow for organization and protection of your gear. The bag features two top pockets, one large Velcro document pocket with 3 pen sleeves, two large, zippered side pockets, two easy-access elastic trimmed front pockets, and one outside pocket with Velcro flap for passport, documents, and tools.Features:UTG combat quality Patrol Bag made of extremely tough and water-resistant synthetic materialHeavy-duty #10 zippers; bound and double-stitched on all edges4 wall inserts create stand-up rigidity and remove to fold bag flat2-inch wrap-around carry handle is sewn around the bagLarge, double-zippered main compartmentProtective and water-resistant materialFully adjustable internal divider with padded insert panels and hideaway internal plastic panelsAll insert panels removable to fold the bag flatT2 top pockets measuring 6 by 10 by 2 inches1 large Velcro closure document pocket with 3 pen sleeves2 large, zippered side pockets measuring 9 by 10 by 2 inches2 easy-access elastic trimmed front pockets1 exterior pocket with Velcro-lined flap for ticket book, documents, and toolsSpecifications:Weight: 6 poundsMaterial: Synthetic leatherDimensions: 13 by 23 by 11 inches (H x W x D)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kSFL2198L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSRYK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002TUSRZ4", "title": "UTG Tactical Shooter's Bag", "description": "This Tactical Shooter's Bag has everything you need to store your tools and ammo with a new generation extra-large capacity and high-density synthetic fabric for durability with back coating to resist moisture and is more durable than canvas bags. It features eight exterior mag pouches with snap flap closure that each hold a 30 round magazine, two-wide opening, full-size Velcro pockets tucked behind the mag pockets, two side pockets with Velcro closure for easy access, a heavy-duty zipper configuration that allows for easy and full access to the entire main compartment of the bag. A shoulder strap with a sturdy metal hook and buckle for strength and a flexible non-slip grip provides shoulder comfort while a sturdy interior bottom panel adds stability to the bag.Features:New generation extra-large capacity tactical bag stores tools and ammoHigh-density, durable synthetic fabric for durability with back coating to resist moisture8 exterior mag pouches with snap flap closure; each can hold a 30 round magazineTwo wide-opening, full-sized Velcro pockets tucked behind mag pocketsTwo-side pockets with Velcro closure for easy access storageHeavy-duty zipper configuration allows for easy and full access into the entire main compartment of the bagShoulder strap has a sturdy metal hook and buckle for strength; flexible non-slip grip provides comfortWrap-around carry handle provides alternative to shoulder strap transportSturdy interior bottom support panel adds stabilitySpecifications:Weight: 3 poundsMaterial: PolyesterColor: BlackDimensions:[if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-qformat:yes; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} <![endif]10.5 x 15 x 7.5 inches (H x W x D)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Tactical Shooter's Bag This Tactical Shooter's Bag has everything you need to store your tools and ammo with a new generation extra-large capacity and high-density synthetic fabric for durability with back coating to resist moisture and is more durable than canvas bags. It features eight exterior mag pouches with snap flap closure that each hold a 30 round magazine, two-wide opening, full-size Velcro pockets tucked behind the mag pockets, two side pockets with Velcro closure for easy access, a heavy-duty zipper configuration that allows for easy and full access to the entire main compartment of the bag. A shoulder strap with a sturdy metal hook and buckle for strength and a flexible non-slip grip provides shoulder comfort while a sturdy interior bottom panel adds stability to the bag.Features:New generation extra-large capacity tactical bag stores tools and ammoHigh-density, durable synthetic fabric for durability with back coating to resist moisture8 exterior mag pouches with snap flap closure; each can hold a 30 round magazineTwo wide-opening, full-sized Velcro pockets tucked behind mag pocketsTwo-side pockets with Velcro closure for easy access storageHeavy-duty zipper configuration allows for easy and full access into the entire main compartment of the bagShoulder strap has a sturdy metal hook and buckle for strength; flexible non-slip grip provides comfortWrap-around carry handle provides alternative to shoulder strap transportSturdy interior bottom support panel adds stabilitySpecifications:Weight: 3 poundsMaterial: PolyesterColor: BlackDimensions:[if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-qformat:yes; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} <![endif]10.5 x 15 x 7.5 inches (H x W x D)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jOw%2BWSKML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSRZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 22.39}}
{"item_id": "B002TUSSNU", "title": "UTG Deluxe Vertical Shoulder Holster", "description": "The UTG Deluxe Vertical Shoulder Holster features an innovative design for fully equipped pistols and MP submachine guns. Made of a premium synthetic material with reinforced thread stitching and double-edge stitching at pressure points for durability, this holster is fully adjustable with Velcro straps attached to web belt for holster/pouch tension. The well-padded shoulder harness offers maximum comfort and the modular design with reversible thumb break system enables ambidextrous use.Features and Specifications:Vertical shoulder holster for fully equipped pistols and MP sub-machine gunsReinforced thread stitching; double-edge stitched at pressure points for extra durabilityAll components are fully adjustable; Velcro straps attached web belt for holster/pouch tensionWell-padded shoulder harness for maximum comfortModular design; reversible thumb break system for ambidextrous useLaw enforcement quality Velcro; snap-on and buckle systemsDoublemag pouch with Velcro closure for auto or speed loader for revolversCustom fit for UZI, MP5 Pistol, or medium-to-large with laser/flashlight accessoriesMaterial: PolyesterAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Deluxe Vertical Shoulder Holster The UTG Deluxe Vertical Shoulder Holster features an innovative design for fully equipped pistols and MP submachine guns. Made of a premium synthetic material with reinforced thread stitching and double-edge stitching at pressure points for durability, this holster is fully adjustable with Velcro straps attached to web belt for holster/pouch tension. The well-padded shoulder harness offers maximum comfort and the modular design with reversible thumb break system enables ambidextrous use.Features and Specifications:Vertical shoulder holster for fully equipped pistols and MP sub-machine gunsReinforced thread stitching; double-edge stitched at pressure points for extra durabilityAll components are fully adjustable; Velcro straps attached web belt for holster/pouch tensionWell-padded shoulder harness for maximum comfortModular design; reversible thumb break system for ambidextrous useLaw enforcement quality Velcro; snap-on and buckle systemsDoublemag pouch with Velcro closure for auto or speed loader for revolversCustom fit for UZI, MP5 Pistol, or medium-to-large with laser/flashlight accessoriesMaterial: PolyesterAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y7IcOW8RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002TUSSNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
