{"item_id": "B002UD5HJO", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Home & Away Protection Kit (Most Popular Key Chain & Home Pepper Foam)", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975”, SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The Sabre Red Pepper Spray Home and Away Protection Kit provides self-defense tools to protect you from both home invasions and threats away from home. The kit includes Sabre's popular 0.54-ounce pepper spray with a quick release key ring for immediate access. This pepper spray fits easily on a keychain or in a purse for away protection anytime/anywhere. The home protection component of the kit includes a 2.5-ounce foam spray unit that comes with a wall mount clip that keeps the spray both accessible and safely out of reach of children. A glow-in-the-dark safety on the unit makes it easier to find and deploy in the dark and prevents accidental discharge. Both the \"Home\" pepper spray and \"Away\" pepper spray models deploy up to 10-feet and contain multiple blasts for protection against more than one attacker.Please note: this item not available to ship to DC, Florida, Hawaii, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, or Wisconsin due to state laws.SABRE RED Maximum Strength Pepper Spray:.54 oz key chain spray with free quick release key ring2.5 oz home unit with wall mount & glow in dark safetyFour year expiration dateHPLC Laboratory ensures guaranteed heat2.5-ounce Home Unit:Glow-in-the-dark safety and a wall mount clipFoam delivery reduces indoor contaminationContains approximately 10 shotsRange: 10 feet0.54-ounce Key Ring Canister:Canister Contents: 0.54 ouncesStream delivery reduces wind blow-backContains approximately 25 shotsRange: 10 feetPlease Note:This item is not available to ship to Florida, Hawaii, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, South Carolina, Washington DC, or WisconsinWhat's in the Box?0.54-ounce keychain pepper spray with case, home pepper spray wall unit", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Home & Away Protection Kit (Most Popular Key Chain & Home Pepper Foam) Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975”, SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The Sabre Red Pepper Spray Home and Away Protection Kit provides self-defense tools to protect you from both home invasions and threats away from home. The kit includes Sabre's popular 0.54-ounce pepper spray with a quick release key ring for immediate access. This pepper spray fits easily on a keychain or in a purse for away protection anytime/anywhere. The home protection component of the kit includes a 2.5-ounce foam spray unit that comes with a wall mount clip that keeps the spray both accessible and safely out of reach of children. A glow-in-the-dark safety on the unit makes it easier to find and deploy in the dark and prevents accidental discharge. Both the \"Home\" pepper spray and \"Away\" pepper spray models deploy up to 10-feet and contain multiple blasts for protection against more than one attacker.Please note: this item not available to ship to DC, Florida, Hawaii, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, or Wisconsin due to state laws.SABRE RED Maximum Strength Pepper Spray:.54 oz key chain spray with free quick release key ring2.5 oz home unit with wall mount & glow in dark safetyFour year expiration dateHPLC Laboratory ensures guaranteed heat2.5-ounce Home Unit:Glow-in-the-dark safety and a wall mount clipFoam delivery reduces indoor contaminationContains approximately 10 shotsRange: 10 feet0.54-ounce Key Ring Canister:Canister Contents: 0.54 ouncesStream delivery reduces wind blow-backContains approximately 25 shotsRange: 10 feetPlease Note:This item is not available to ship to Florida, Hawaii, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, South Carolina, Washington DC, or WisconsinWhat's in the Box?0.54-ounce keychain pepper spray with case, home pepper spray wall unit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jhowcJf8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UD5HJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 17.99}}
