{"item_id": "B002UIZWTE", "title": "The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S. Target by Morrell", "description": "The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S. Target by Morrell. Endorsed by all - world archer Michael Waddell... and guaranteed to stop the heaviest - hitting bows! For 15 years running, Morrell targets have been voted #1 in both consumer and dealer contests. It's little wonder why. The 400 FPS is the perfect target for just about any shooter's needs. Endorsed by Michael Waddell and Lee and Tiffany Lakosky, the 400 FPS is a 4-sided field point target... mix up your practice shooting by zoning in on six bull's-eyes, a 9-ball game, a full-color midsection of a deer (vitals in color), and a dart board. Nucleus Center made with super-dense rubber and flex back foam for maximum life. E-Z Tote carrying handle for easy transportation. Arrow-removal is very easy, too. So go ahead, gather up your friends and have a ball shooting at this multi-purpose four-sided target! 19 x 19 x 19. 32 lbs. Order Today! The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S.Target by Morrell", "text": "The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S. Target by Morrell The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S. Target by Morrell. Endorsed by all - world archer Michael Waddell... and guaranteed to stop the heaviest - hitting bows! For 15 years running, Morrell targets have been voted #1 in both consumer and dealer contests. It's little wonder why. The 400 FPS is the perfect target for just about any shooter's needs. Endorsed by Michael Waddell and Lee and Tiffany Lakosky, the 400 FPS is a 4-sided field point target... mix up your practice shooting by zoning in on six bull's-eyes, a 9-ball game, a full-color midsection of a deer (vitals in color), and a dart board. Nucleus Center made with super-dense rubber and flex back foam for maximum life. E-Z Tote carrying handle for easy transportation. Arrow-removal is very easy, too. So go ahead, gather up your friends and have a ball shooting at this multi-purpose four-sided target! 19 x 19 x 19. 32 lbs. Order Today! The Bone Collector 400 F.P.S.Target by Morrell", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Jb8Ln-0BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UIZWTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morrell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B002UJ53EW", "title": "RinehartÂ® 18 - 1 Broadhead Target", "description": "Rinehart 18 - 1 Broadhead Target. A target that shows you its best side, every time! With 18 vivid target zones made from legendary solid Rinehart \"self-healing\" foam, the 18-1 can take arrow after arrow without losing its shape or integrity. The 18-1 is lightweight with its own easy-to-carry handle, making it perfect for practice almost anywhere... at the club, in the backyard, or even a quick practice session at hunting camp. Whether shooting broadheads, field points or even expandables, the combination of solid Rinehart \"self-healing\" foam and 18 sides make this the longest lasting target available. 15 x 15\". Order Today! Rinehart 18-1 Broadhead Target", "text": "RinehartÂ® 18 - 1 Broadhead Target Rinehart 18 - 1 Broadhead Target. A target that shows you its best side, every time! With 18 vivid target zones made from legendary solid Rinehart \"self-healing\" foam, the 18-1 can take arrow after arrow without losing its shape or integrity. The 18-1 is lightweight with its own easy-to-carry handle, making it perfect for practice almost anywhere... at the club, in the backyard, or even a quick practice session at hunting camp. Whether shooting broadheads, field points or even expandables, the combination of solid Rinehart \"self-healing\" foam and 18 sides make this the longest lasting target available. 15 x 15\". Order Today! Rinehart 18-1 Broadhead Target", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410dfd4iXQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UJ53EW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rinehart Targets", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 129.99}}
{"item_id": "B002UK9WK2", "title": "Fox 40 Sonik Blast CMG Whistle with Lanyard", "description": "Advanced science and technology makes the Sonik BLAST the most efficient whistle in its class. Flawless patented pealess whistle emits sound power of +120dB. Extremely easy to blow, cannot be overblown. Superior clear loud blast carries over long distances. 4 sound-producing resonators built into 2 chambers. Includes cushioned mouth grip and lanyard.", "text": "Fox 40 Sonik Blast CMG Whistle with Lanyard Advanced science and technology makes the Sonik BLAST the most efficient whistle in its class. Flawless patented pealess whistle emits sound power of +120dB. Extremely easy to blow, cannot be overblown. Superior clear loud blast carries over long distances. 4 sound-producing resonators built into 2 chambers. Includes cushioned mouth grip and lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N80ZXgYIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UK9WK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox 40", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 8.9}}
{"item_id": "B002UKHE5W", "title": "Everlast 70-Pound MMA Poly Canvas Heavy Bag", "description": "Specially blended filler mix of sanitized synthetic and natural fibers provide resilient shock absorbency.› Premium synthetic polycanvas along with excellent heavy bag construction provides long-lasting durability› Heavy-duty nylon straps provide security and safety, while the double-end loop provides increased functionality", "text": "Everlast 70-Pound MMA Poly Canvas Heavy Bag Specially blended filler mix of sanitized synthetic and natural fibers provide resilient shock absorbency.› Premium synthetic polycanvas along with excellent heavy bag construction provides long-lasting durability› Heavy-duty nylon straps provide security and safety, while the double-end loop provides increased functionality", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gMGRhUQeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UKHE5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 21.0}}
{"item_id": "B002UKHEDO", "title": "Everlast 100-Pound C3 Foam Heavy Bag", "description": "The C3 Foam 100-Pound Heavy Bag from Everlast is built and designed to provide professional level training for boxers and a great workout for all athletes who box for fitness. The C3 (Contoured Closed Cell Foam Technology) is designed to provide the increased cushioning, support, and force dispersion that serious hitters need during heavy workouts. The high density foam's closed-cells also inhibit moisture transfer into the foam padding to keep your gloves lighter and drier during use. Meanwhile, the bag's custom filling of natural and synthetic fibers blended with sifted sand, offers a homogenous feel and resilient shock absorption. Encased within a durable polycanvas shell, the C3 Heavy Bag is built to last. The bag is equipped with a durable webbing system for safety that includes heavy-duty nylon straps and double end loops for solid anchoring.", "text": "Everlast 100-Pound C3 Foam Heavy Bag The C3 Foam 100-Pound Heavy Bag from Everlast is built and designed to provide professional level training for boxers and a great workout for all athletes who box for fitness. The C3 (Contoured Closed Cell Foam Technology) is designed to provide the increased cushioning, support, and force dispersion that serious hitters need during heavy workouts. The high density foam's closed-cells also inhibit moisture transfer into the foam padding to keep your gloves lighter and drier during use. Meanwhile, the bag's custom filling of natural and synthetic fibers blended with sifted sand, offers a homogenous feel and resilient shock absorption. Encased within a durable polycanvas shell, the C3 Heavy Bag is built to last. The bag is equipped with a durable webbing system for safety that includes heavy-duty nylon straps and double end loops for solid anchoring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HIthfWKyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UKHEDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 56.99}}
{"item_id": "B002UKOP7W", "title": "Saranac Cycling Metro BI-14 Glove (Black, Medium)", "description": "Metro Rider Pro Series Cycling Glove has a double layered Leather palm for long wear & durability. Great Impact absorption and comfort from Comfort Gel padding is provided in this glove. The Metro Rider is Breathable and has full range of motion to go along with great Fit and Function.", "text": "Saranac Cycling Metro BI-14 Glove (Black, Medium) Metro Rider Pro Series Cycling Glove has a double layered Leather palm for long wear & durability. Great Impact absorption and comfort from Comfort Gel padding is provided in this glove. The Metro Rider is Breathable and has full range of motion to go along with great Fit and Function.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MsaIKFuPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UKOP7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002UL34ZK", "title": "Podsacs Ruck Sac Raincover", "description": "Quick and easy to fit waterproof raincover. Fits up to: 30 L (SM), 40 L (MD), 60 L (LG), 80 L (XL). Wt: 3.9 oz. (MD).", "text": "Podsacs Ruck Sac Raincover Quick and easy to fit waterproof raincover. Fits up to: 30 L (SM), 40 L (MD), 60 L (LG), 80 L (XL). Wt: 3.9 oz. (MD).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w7qDgo3ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UL34ZK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories", "Pack Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002UL458K", "title": "Accu Wedge Buffer For AR-15 M-4 S&W M&P Rifles", "description": "Accu Wedge Buffer For AR-15 M-4 S&W; M&P; Rifles - This item will Instantly tightens loose upper & lower receivers. Will fit any AR15, M16 and M4 rifle, carbine or pistol. Fits near the takedown pin and keeps the upper receiver section snug and tight against the lower receiver. This products helps promote better accuracy by making the upper and lower receiver fit tighter and will also decreases vibration and prevents wear. Easy no gunsmith installation. Just open your upper receiver and drop this rubber wedge into the rear of the lower receiver behind the push pin. Brand New", "text": "Accu Wedge Buffer For AR-15 M-4 S&W M&P Rifles Accu Wedge Buffer For AR-15 M-4 S&W; M&P; Rifles - This item will Instantly tightens loose upper & lower receivers. Will fit any AR15, M16 and M4 rifle, carbine or pistol. Fits near the takedown pin and keeps the upper receiver section snug and tight against the lower receiver. This products helps promote better accuracy by making the upper and lower receiver fit tighter and will also decreases vibration and prevents wear. Easy no gunsmith installation. Just open your upper receiver and drop this rubber wedge into the rear of the lower receiver behind the push pin. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Nu-IHetNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UL458K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ergo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 6.46}}
