{"item_id": "B002UNMET0", "title": "Camelbak Podium 21oz Bottle", "description": "Squeeze and drink. It self-seals. No more nibbling on your water bottle's valve. And with Camelbak's Podium, your water tastes like water, not some odd combination of dirt and dish soap.", "text": "Camelbak Podium 21oz Bottle Squeeze and drink. It self-seals. No more nibbling on your water bottle's valve. And with Camelbak's Podium, your water tastes like water, not some odd combination of dirt and dish soap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ETM6Y9wgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UNMET0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 13.46}}
