{"item_id": "B002UPL7HS", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net", "description": "Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412fC90FIJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UPL7HS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagles Nest Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B002UPPAV2", "title": "Weslo Inversion Flex System", "description": "The Weslo Inversion Flex System is a safe and easy exercise tool that helps you increase blood flow and decompress your spine. The cushioned frame provides maximum back support and comfort, and it adjusts in length for a variety of users. Handlebars provide support for proper form and balance.The Inversion Flex System puts you in the perfect position to help you truly relax and get rid of everyday stress. Employing a safety chain and a foam ankle lock, the Inversion Flex allows you to train in worry-free comfort. Using the adjustable height and adjustable pivot bar features, you can customize the Inversion Flex to fit your needs and meet your natural center of gravity. An adjustable foam ankle lock provides further comfort and keeps you securely in place during your training so that you don't slip. Invert fully or stop at any pivot lock to get the angle you want.The Inversion Flex System measures 60 inches by 49 inches by 27 inches and folds away for quick and convenient storage when you're done.Manufacturer's WarrantyWeslo fitness equipment features a 90 day limited warranty that covers defects, materials and workmanship. Warranty does not cover misuse, abuse or commercial use.", "text": "Weslo Inversion Flex System The Weslo Inversion Flex System is a safe and easy exercise tool that helps you increase blood flow and decompress your spine. The cushioned frame provides maximum back support and comfort, and it adjusts in length for a variety of users. Handlebars provide support for proper form and balance.The Inversion Flex System puts you in the perfect position to help you truly relax and get rid of everyday stress. Employing a safety chain and a foam ankle lock, the Inversion Flex allows you to train in worry-free comfort. Using the adjustable height and adjustable pivot bar features, you can customize the Inversion Flex to fit your needs and meet your natural center of gravity. An adjustable foam ankle lock provides further comfort and keeps you securely in place during your training so that you don't slip. Invert fully or stop at any pivot lock to get the angle you want.The Inversion Flex System measures 60 inches by 49 inches by 27 inches and folds away for quick and convenient storage when you're done.Manufacturer's WarrantyWeslo fitness equipment features a 90 day limited warranty that covers defects, materials and workmanship. Warranty does not cover misuse, abuse or commercial use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DcfUfwS1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UPPAV2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002UQERYM", "title": "Ninja Durable Aluminum Protects Bonnet Thread Savers", "description": "", "text": "Ninja Durable Aluminum Protects Bonnet Thread Savers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZYwShgdTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UQERYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ninja", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Marker Parts & Upgrades", "Accessory Kits"]], "price": 6.49}}
{"item_id": "B002USGP7C", "title": "Rollerblade LUX Plus Wrist Guard", "description": "Protect yourself while skating or performing other outdoor sports with the Rollerblade Lux Plus wrist guard. Featuring a breathable mesh construction that's comfortable and cool, the wrist guard prevents scrapes and scratches while cushioning the blow from falls. The wrist guard is also padded with a Velcro closure for a secure fit, making it ideal for safety-conscious skaters.About RollerbladeThe world leader in the inline skate market, Rollerblade pioneered the inline skating boom by changing the perception of inline skates. Once seen strictly as an offseason training device for hockey players, inline skates are now a widely accepted lifestyle product that can be used by just about anyone, including professional athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and fun seekers of all ages. Rollerblade traces its history to 1980, when two hockey-playing Minnesota brothers discovered an inline skate while rummaging through a sporting goods store and decided that this design would make an ideal offseason training tool. They refined the skate and began assembling the first Rollerblade skates in the basement of their parents' home. Nordic and alpine skiers soon began integrating the skates into their own training regimes. In the ensuing years, the brothers used grassroots marketing tactics in such markets as Miami Beach, Florida; Minneapolis, Minnesota; and Venice Beach, California to position inline skating as a new sport. Headquartered in West Lebanon, New Hampshire, Rollerblade is now an established brand, and continues to push the sport in new frontiers with innovative technologies and revolutionary marketing programs.", "text": "Rollerblade LUX Plus Wrist Guard Protect yourself while skating or performing other outdoor sports with the Rollerblade Lux Plus wrist guard. Featuring a breathable mesh construction that's comfortable and cool, the wrist guard prevents scrapes and scratches while cushioning the blow from falls. The wrist guard is also padded with a Velcro closure for a secure fit, making it ideal for safety-conscious skaters.About RollerbladeThe world leader in the inline skate market, Rollerblade pioneered the inline skating boom by changing the perception of inline skates. Once seen strictly as an offseason training device for hockey players, inline skates are now a widely accepted lifestyle product that can be used by just about anyone, including professional athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and fun seekers of all ages. Rollerblade traces its history to 1980, when two hockey-playing Minnesota brothers discovered an inline skate while rummaging through a sporting goods store and decided that this design would make an ideal offseason training tool. They refined the skate and began assembling the first Rollerblade skates in the basement of their parents' home. Nordic and alpine skiers soon began integrating the skates into their own training regimes. In the ensuing years, the brothers used grassroots marketing tactics in such markets as Miami Beach, Florida; Minneapolis, Minnesota; and Venice Beach, California to position inline skating as a new sport. Headquartered in West Lebanon, New Hampshire, Rollerblade is now an established brand, and continues to push the sport in new frontiers with innovative technologies and revolutionary marketing programs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51169Lc0lCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002USGP7C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear", "Wrist Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002UT009A", "title": "Desert Sand/Yellow & Black Shemagh Arab Keffiyeh Neck Scarf", "description": "Yellow Sand/Black Shemagh Arab Keffiyeh Neck Scarf - 100% cotton material. Desert Sand/Yellow & Black. Size 42\" x 42\" (inches). Traditional desert Arab head dress, which evolved from turbans in ancient times. Essential for protecting the eyes, nose, mouth, ears and face from sand. Can also be used as a neck warmer or hand towel. Scarf is high quality stitch. Worn by soldiers in Iraq and Afghanistan and abroad. Retains heat and absorbs sweat in warm/hot conditions. Imported. The keffiyeh is also known as a shmagh, shemagh or yashmag, a ghutra or a hatta, and is a traditional headdress of Arab men, made of a square of cloth (\"scarf\"), folded and wrapped in various styles around the head. It is commonly found in arid climate areas to provide protection from direct sun exposure, as well as for occasional use in protecting the mouth and eyes from blown dust and sand. Worn and known by Palestinians.", "text": "Desert Sand/Yellow & Black Shemagh Arab Keffiyeh Neck Scarf Yellow Sand/Black Shemagh Arab Keffiyeh Neck Scarf - 100% cotton material. Desert Sand/Yellow & Black. Size 42\" x 42\" (inches). Traditional desert Arab head dress, which evolved from turbans in ancient times. Essential for protecting the eyes, nose, mouth, ears and face from sand. Can also be used as a neck warmer or hand towel. Scarf is high quality stitch. Worn by soldiers in Iraq and Afghanistan and abroad. Retains heat and absorbs sweat in warm/hot conditions. Imported. The keffiyeh is also known as a shmagh, shemagh or yashmag, a ghutra or a hatta, and is a traditional headdress of Arab men, made of a square of cloth (\"scarf\"), folded and wrapped in various styles around the head. It is commonly found in arid climate areas to provide protection from direct sun exposure, as well as for occasional use in protecting the mouth and eyes from blown dust and sand. Worn and known by Palestinians.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516Sw603QyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UT009A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 12.8}}
{"item_id": "B002UVGD6M", "title": "Cintz Half Cone Markers (Set of 12), 2-Inch, Orange", "description": "Half Cone Markers are multi-use 2\" high cones available in different colors, ideal for marking sections of training area/field or pitch. These cones are made of soft plastic (LDPE - Low Density Poly Ethylene) which is safe incase a player falls on them.", "text": "Cintz Half Cone Markers (Set of 12), 2-Inch, Orange Half Cone Markers are multi-use 2\" high cones available in different colors, ideal for marking sections of training area/field or pitch. These cones are made of soft plastic (LDPE - Low Density Poly Ethylene) which is safe incase a player falls on them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bn%2BeqGWfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UVGD6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cintz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Training Equipment", "Training Cones"]], "price": 5.25}}
{"item_id": "B002UZKUAI", "title": "Shimano Deore 9 Speed Mountain Bicycle Front Derailleur - FD-M591", "description": "9 speed design. Wide pivots create a rigid structure that ensures assertive shifting and longer pivot life. 50mm chainline. Angled clamp bolt position. Better clearance between tire and FD inner chain guard.", "text": "Shimano Deore 9 Speed Mountain Bicycle Front Derailleur - FD-M591 9 speed design. Wide pivots create a rigid structure that ensures assertive shifting and longer pivot life. 50mm chainline. Angled clamp bolt position. Better clearance between tire and FD inner chain guard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ca%2BkFJq6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002UZKUAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Front Derailleurs"]], "price": 29.98}}
