{"item_id": "B002V129NM", "title": "SE - Brush - Gun Cleaning, Double Ended, 7in.", "description": "This is a single double-ended gun cleaning brush. Perfect for reaching those hard to reach nooks and crannies. Don't waste a toothbrush, use these specially-designed gun brushes!", "text": "SE - Brush - Gun Cleaning, Double Ended, 7in. This is a single double-ended gun cleaning brush. Perfect for reaching those hard to reach nooks and crannies. Don't waste a toothbrush, use these specially-designed gun brushes!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21k-Enmn8mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V129NM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 4.49}}
{"item_id": "B002V14FCK", "title": "Emergency Survival Mylar Sleeping Blanket - 2 Pack", "description": "Whether it's in your car, camping gear or your bug-out stash, don't leave home without this emergency survival sleeping blanket. This must-have blanket is essential for overcoming exposure to harsh outdoor elements like rain, sleet and snow. Thanks to its innovative design, this emergency survival blanket won't crack, mildew or shrink. It's great for constructing a survival shelter, too!", "text": "Emergency Survival Mylar Sleeping Blanket - 2 Pack Whether it's in your car, camping gear or your bug-out stash, don't leave home without this emergency survival sleeping blanket. This must-have blanket is essential for overcoming exposure to harsh outdoor elements like rain, sleet and snow. Thanks to its innovative design, this emergency survival blanket won't crack, mildew or shrink. It's great for constructing a survival shelter, too!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gcaU-HYFL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V14FCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mylar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 8.38}}
{"item_id": "B002V1H0W2", "title": "Intex Recreation Pool Volleyball Game, Age 6+", "description": "Enjoy this green and yellow 94\" x 25\" x 36\" inflatable volleyball game. Includes a repair kit. Also has a shelf box.", "text": "Intex Recreation Pool Volleyball Game, Age 6+ Enjoy this green and yellow 94\" x 25\" x 36\" inflatable volleyball game. Includes a repair kit. Also has a shelf box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Uqr%2BX6RQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V1H0W2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 17.81}}
{"item_id": "B002V2IPDY", "title": "Safariland Glock 29, 30 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Glock 29, 30 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s3aF839uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V2IPDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 41.13}}
{"item_id": "B002V3CHKA", "title": "Stack-On SPAD-60 Safe 'N Dry Desiccant for Stack-On Long-Gun Safes and Cabinets, 10-Pack", "description": "Safe ‘n Dry desiccants pull moisture from the air and can be used almost anywhere. Each packet is individually wrapped in a foil pouch to prevent the desiccant from activating. Once opened each packet can draw moisture from 5 – 7 cubic feet for about 6 weeks before it will need to be recharged. Each packet includes a handy moisture indicator to let you know when it is time to recharge. Units can be recharged in a standard, vented oven at 200 degrees F for 3 hours and can be recharged 3 – 4 times before its moisture absorbing properties are lost.", "text": "Stack-On SPAD-60 Safe 'N Dry Desiccant for Stack-On Long-Gun Safes and Cabinets, 10-Pack Safe ‘n Dry desiccants pull moisture from the air and can be used almost anywhere. Each packet is individually wrapped in a foil pouch to prevent the desiccant from activating. Once opened each packet can draw moisture from 5 – 7 cubic feet for about 6 weeks before it will need to be recharged. Each packet includes a handy moisture indicator to let you know when it is time to recharge. Units can be recharged in a standard, vented oven at 200 degrees F for 3 hours and can be recharged 3 – 4 times before its moisture absorbing properties are lost.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51K%2B3ZxllNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V3CHKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 9.32}}
{"item_id": "B002V3X96G", "title": "Pure Fun 14-Foot Trampoline", "description": "Pure Fun trampolines are made with strong, rust-resistant galvanized iron steel tubing using patented T-Section construction, which is safer and longer-lasting than conventional welded trampolines. The snug, secure fit of T-Section assembly insures extra stability and prevents shifting over time, which increases the life and safety of the trampoline while giving parents peace of mind.W-shaped legs with eight balanced contact points add stability and prevent wobbling or tipping. High-performance steel springs provide a deeper, more exciting bounce. A weather-resistant mat, PVC frame cover, and thick foam rail padding over the springs add extra protection and increase the landing area. This 14-foot, 88-spring trampoline has a 250-pound maximum weight capacity, is easy to assemble and requires no tools or extra drilling, and is certified by an independent laboratory to pass all ASTM safety requirements.Features and Specifications:ASTM approved88 springs250-pound weight capacityPolypro jump padsPatented T-jointsNo-weld constructionRust resistant steel frameGalvanized iron/steel tubingHigh performance steel springsThick foam rail padding over the sprintsManufacturer's WarrantyPure Fun trampolines include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Pure Fun 14-Foot Trampoline Pure Fun trampolines are made with strong, rust-resistant galvanized iron steel tubing using patented T-Section construction, which is safer and longer-lasting than conventional welded trampolines. The snug, secure fit of T-Section assembly insures extra stability and prevents shifting over time, which increases the life and safety of the trampoline while giving parents peace of mind.W-shaped legs with eight balanced contact points add stability and prevent wobbling or tipping. High-performance steel springs provide a deeper, more exciting bounce. A weather-resistant mat, PVC frame cover, and thick foam rail padding over the springs add extra protection and increase the landing area. This 14-foot, 88-spring trampoline has a 250-pound maximum weight capacity, is easy to assemble and requires no tools or extra drilling, and is certified by an independent laboratory to pass all ASTM safety requirements.Features and Specifications:ASTM approved88 springs250-pound weight capacityPolypro jump padsPatented T-jointsNo-weld constructionRust resistant steel frameGalvanized iron/steel tubingHigh performance steel springsThick foam rail padding over the sprintsManufacturer's WarrantyPure Fun trampolines include a limited two-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BHcy%2B1xkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V3X96G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pure Fun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 263.49}}
{"item_id": "B002V4MLK0", "title": "Bison Designs Tap Cap 38mm Belt with Gunmetal Buckle", "description": "The Tap Cap belt series uniquely incorporates a bottle opener into the buckle.", "text": "Bison Designs Tap Cap 38mm Belt with Gunmetal Buckle The Tap Cap belt series uniquely incorporates a bottle opener into the buckle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51o9nHRmHFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V4MLK0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002V7JOUM", "title": "Kershaw 1620H3 All Black Scallion Folding Pocket Knife", "description": "Kershaw's Scallion offers high-performance styling and all the convenience of the SpeedSafe® ambidextrous assisted opening system in a medium-sized knife. It's ideal for everyday carrying. The blade is built of high-carbon 420HC stainless steel for good edge retention and excellent corrosion resistance. All Scallions include a secure liner lock to keep the blade securely in place until the user closes it and a Tip Lock to keep the blade stored in the handle. This all black version of the scallion offers a black anodized aluminum handle and a black 420HC stainless steel blade. Features: SpeedSafe Assisted Opening, Locking Liner, Thumb Stud, and Pocket Clip. Blade Length: 2-1/4”; Closed Length: 3-1/2”; Overall Length: 5-3/4”; Weight: 2.3 ounces. Kershaw SKU #1620H3. Made in USA.", "text": "Kershaw 1620H3 All Black Scallion Folding Pocket Knife Kershaw's Scallion offers high-performance styling and all the convenience of the SpeedSafe® ambidextrous assisted opening system in a medium-sized knife. It's ideal for everyday carrying. The blade is built of high-carbon 420HC stainless steel for good edge retention and excellent corrosion resistance. All Scallions include a secure liner lock to keep the blade securely in place until the user closes it and a Tip Lock to keep the blade stored in the handle. This all black version of the scallion offers a black anodized aluminum handle and a black 420HC stainless steel blade. Features: SpeedSafe Assisted Opening, Locking Liner, Thumb Stud, and Pocket Clip. Blade Length: 2-1/4”; Closed Length: 3-1/2”; Overall Length: 5-3/4”; Weight: 2.3 ounces. Kershaw SKU #1620H3. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SojJvuhUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V7JOUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.81}}
