{"item_id": "B002V94KCW", "title": "The Travel Toilet", "description": "Whenever or wherever Mother Nature calls, be ready with the Travel Toilet! It comes fully assembled and sets up in seconds, and is constructed with standard toilet seat dimensions so you'll feel right at home. The stainless steel/ABS design ensures your Travel Toilet will stand strong for years to come.", "text": "The Travel Toilet Whenever or wherever Mother Nature calls, be ready with the Travel Toilet! It comes fully assembled and sets up in seconds, and is constructed with standard toilet seat dimensions so you'll feel right at home. The stainless steel/ABS design ensures your Travel Toilet will stand strong for years to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4167phLQLJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002V94KCW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 74.95}}
{"item_id": "B002VAKU8E", "title": "Light My Fire 3-Pack Spork Little", "description": "The Light My Fire Spork Little has been designed from the ground up for infants and toddlers. The Spork Little is not only smaller, it’s thicker and rounder for ease of use and safety. The serrated edges have also been removed to protect small mouths. Great to carry in your bag. Versatile enough for both a rugged camping trip and dishing out baby food at a city cafe.", "text": "Light My Fire 3-Pack Spork Little The Light My Fire Spork Little has been designed from the ground up for infants and toddlers. The Spork Little is not only smaller, it’s thicker and rounder for ease of use and safety. The serrated edges have also been removed to protect small mouths. Great to carry in your bag. Versatile enough for both a rugged camping trip and dishing out baby food at a city cafe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316K2maTz4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002VAKU8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 6.44}}
{"item_id": "B002VBTLP6", "title": "Millett Tactical Detachable Aluminum Rings", "description": "Millett Tactical Rings are a lightweight, strong solution for the most demanding uses. Six cap-clamping screws positively hold your scope, no matter the level of recoil, and the base clamp holds the scope to the base. Millett tactical rings are your answer to any mounting needs.", "text": "Millett Tactical Detachable Aluminum Rings Millett Tactical Rings are a lightweight, strong solution for the most demanding uses. Six cap-clamping screws positively hold your scope, no matter the level of recoil, and the base clamp holds the scope to the base. Millett tactical rings are your answer to any mounting needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ydp6sFVWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002VBTLP6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
