{"item_id": "B002VK765O", "title": "Bar Mitts Cold Weather Road Bicycle Handlebar Mittens, fits Shimano Shifters with Externally Routed Shift Cables", "description": "Neoprene stay attached to bars, protecting hands from the elements and allowing the rider to wear thinner gloves for greater dexterity and comfortEasy to install and removeA must for every cold weather rider!Designed for drop style road handle bars with external shift cable.Easily installed and removed for temperature changes", "text": "Bar Mitts Cold Weather Road Bicycle Handlebar Mittens, fits Shimano Shifters with Externally Routed Shift Cables Neoprene stay attached to bars, protecting hands from the elements and allowing the rider to wear thinner gloves for greater dexterity and comfortEasy to install and removeA must for every cold weather rider!Designed for drop style road handle bars with external shift cable.Easily installed and removed for temperature changes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61eRmmw-XfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002VK765O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]]}}
