{"item_id": "B002VM2AUS", "title": "AR15 M4 CX4 SU16 Tactical Combo Set w/ NcStar MKIII 3-9x42 Rifle Scope + NcStar Red Dot Reflex Sight", "description": "AR15 M4 CX4 SU16 Tactical Combo Set w/ NcStar MKIII 3-9x42 Rifle Scope + NcStar Red Dot Reflex Sight - This it the NcStar Ultimate Sighting System. NcSTAR introduces the Ultimate Sighting System (USS). With the Ultimate Sighting System you get all the Benefits of a Mark III 3-9x42 Tactical Scope with the Advantage of a Back-up Red Dot Reflex Sight. This System is comprised of a Mark III Tactical Scope with a Specially Designed Ring that mounts directly to the Ocular Lens Housing with a Built-in Weaver Style Platform. This System is perfect for both Close Quarter Battle and Long Range Shooting. The Specially Designed Mount you can be rotated left or right for those who prefer Offset Functionality. Includes the following items: NcStar Mark III Tactical 3-9x42 illuminated Mil-Dot reticle scope with integral mount for flattop Weaver/Picatinny rails, NcStar Tactical Red Dot Reflex Sight, NcStar 34mm ring mount with Weaver style mounting rail. All items are brand new with full manufacture warranty against defects. Manufacture catalog# STM3942G/D", "text": "AR15 M4 CX4 SU16 Tactical Combo Set w/ NcStar MKIII 3-9x42 Rifle Scope + NcStar Red Dot Reflex Sight AR15 M4 CX4 SU16 Tactical Combo Set w/ NcStar MKIII 3-9x42 Rifle Scope + NcStar Red Dot Reflex Sight - This it the NcStar Ultimate Sighting System. NcSTAR introduces the Ultimate Sighting System (USS). With the Ultimate Sighting System you get all the Benefits of a Mark III 3-9x42 Tactical Scope with the Advantage of a Back-up Red Dot Reflex Sight. This System is comprised of a Mark III Tactical Scope with a Specially Designed Ring that mounts directly to the Ocular Lens Housing with a Built-in Weaver Style Platform. This System is perfect for both Close Quarter Battle and Long Range Shooting. The Specially Designed Mount you can be rotated left or right for those who prefer Offset Functionality. Includes the following items: NcStar Mark III Tactical 3-9x42 illuminated Mil-Dot reticle scope with integral mount for flattop Weaver/Picatinny rails, NcStar Tactical Red Dot Reflex Sight, NcStar 34mm ring mount with Weaver style mounting rail. All items are brand new with full manufacture warranty against defects. Manufacture catalog# STM3942G/D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HkphvGYAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002VM2AUS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 174.95}}
{"item_id": "B002VN6X1Y", "title": "Manzella Men's Silkweight Windstopper Glove", "description": "Our winter sports line is built around the passionate pursuit of your favorite actitivies and your personal warmth performance. Silkweight Windstopper has a warmer rating as it is built with a Gore Windstopper nylon. This glove offers 360 degrees reflective grid pattern for enhanced visability during night or winter aerobic activities.", "text": "Manzella Men's Silkweight Windstopper Glove Our winter sports line is built around the passionate pursuit of your favorite actitivies and your personal warmth performance. Silkweight Windstopper has a warmer rating as it is built with a Gore Windstopper nylon. This glove offers 360 degrees reflective grid pattern for enhanced visability during night or winter aerobic activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nY753uFhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002VN6X1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
