{"item_id": "B002W03H10", "title": "Leather Pro Shooters Bag - Bagmaster Range Bag", "description": "Leather Pro Shooters Bag - Bagmaster If you absolutely, positively insist on having the very best, the Bagmaster Leather Pro-Shooter Bag is the one for you. The Leather Pro-Shooters Bag features: Main Compartment: 7 \"T x 7\"W x 16\"L Double zipper top for easy access to main compartment. Two dividers that are adjustable and removable. Two removable pistol inserts 6\"T x 14\"L lined with true Sherpa surrounding a 1/2\" high-density foam core. Single piece wraparound handles with a leather handle wrap. Removable/adjustable shoulder strap with our padded, non-slip cowhide leather shoulder pad. Heavy duty nylon zippers and metal hardware. Hard bottom panel. LPSB S", "text": "Leather Pro Shooters Bag - Bagmaster Range Bag Leather Pro Shooters Bag - Bagmaster If you absolutely, positively insist on having the very best, the Bagmaster Leather Pro-Shooter Bag is the one for you. The Leather Pro-Shooters Bag features: Main Compartment: 7 \"T x 7\"W x 16\"L Double zipper top for easy access to main compartment. Two dividers that are adjustable and removable. Two removable pistol inserts 6\"T x 14\"L lined with true Sherpa surrounding a 1/2\" high-density foam core. Single piece wraparound handles with a leather handle wrap. Removable/adjustable shoulder strap with our padded, non-slip cowhide leather shoulder pad. Heavy duty nylon zippers and metal hardware. Hard bottom panel. LPSB S", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Acyv6g5NL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002W03H10.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bagmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 182.52}}
