{"item_id": "B002W3JLHQ", "title": "Full Size Samurai Sword Fully Handmade Razor Sharp Musashi Katana", "description": "This is a brand new full tang hand crafted samurai katana with a Musashi ring tsuba. The sword comes with razor sharp blade and is well balanced. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and made with high carbon steel. This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. This sword can be used for practice use and features a visible kissake on the tip of the blade.", "text": "Full Size Samurai Sword Fully Handmade Razor Sharp Musashi Katana This is a brand new full tang hand crafted samurai katana with a Musashi ring tsuba. The sword comes with razor sharp blade and is well balanced. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and made with high carbon steel. This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. This sword can be used for practice use and features a visible kissake on the tip of the blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yWG5%2BYT3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002W3JLHQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 47.94}}
{"item_id": "B002W7ZZU4", "title": "Lipstick Mini Pepper Spray", "description": "Description: The pepper spray designed for women. This attractive lipstick case is sure to deceive and ward off potential attackers. Pretend you need to freshen your lipstick and POW! This 1/2 oz. canister contains 5 one second sprays with a range of 6 feet and is available in 4 attractive colors.", "text": "Lipstick Mini Pepper Spray Description: The pepper spray designed for women. This attractive lipstick case is sure to deceive and ward off potential attackers. Pretend you need to freshen your lipstick and POW! This 1/2 oz. canister contains 5 one second sprays with a range of 6 feet and is available in 4 attractive colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wTAATmuvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002W7ZZU4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ST", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 8.79}}
