{"item_id": "B002WBRZN0", "title": "Sea To Summit Delta Insul Mug", "description": "The lightweight Delta InsulMug features a ground-breaking advance in thermal insulation: a molded non-absorbing closed-cell Thermoskin. A snug-fitting, self-draining lid allows drip-free sipping. Ideal for expeditions, camping and daily commuting.", "text": "Sea To Summit Delta Insul Mug The lightweight Delta InsulMug features a ground-breaking advance in thermal insulation: a molded non-absorbing closed-cell Thermoskin. A snug-fitting, self-draining lid allows drip-free sipping. Ideal for expeditions, camping and daily commuting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tOWDG5cVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WBRZN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 16.95}}
