{"item_id": "B002WCDR72", "title": "Nu-Source Yoga Block (2-Piece)", "description": "Enhance your yoga practice with our yoga blocks. These blocks will safely allow you to reach deeper into your poses, while maintaining proper form and alignment. They are the perfect modification tool for beginners to assist with their flexibility, or for more experienced yogi's to perfect challenging poses. Use them at home, or take them with you to the studio. These yoga blocks are light weight and easy to travel with and store, weighing in at a total of 0.7lbs for both blocks. Made from 4LB density foam with bevelled edges for extra comfort and support. One of the best Yoga Blocks on the market, these studio quality yoga blocks are a great addition to your yoga practice. Add our 6mm 24\"x72\" Piloga Mats for a complete yoga experience.", "text": "Nu-Source Yoga Block (2-Piece) Enhance your yoga practice with our yoga blocks. These blocks will safely allow you to reach deeper into your poses, while maintaining proper form and alignment. They are the perfect modification tool for beginners to assist with their flexibility, or for more experienced yogi's to perfect challenging poses. Use them at home, or take them with you to the studio. These yoga blocks are light weight and easy to travel with and store, weighing in at a total of 0.7lbs for both blocks. Made from 4LB density foam with bevelled edges for extra comfort and support. One of the best Yoga Blocks on the market, these studio quality yoga blocks are a great addition to your yoga practice. Add our 6mm 24\"x72\" Piloga Mats for a complete yoga experience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FAOFLGcjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WCDR72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nu-Source", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Blocks"]], "price": 13.02}}
{"item_id": "B002WGEE48", "title": "Classic Crane Tsuba Handmade Samurai Katana Sword Sharp", "description": "This is the Handmade Full Tang Crane Katana Samurai Sword. The blade has been handmade with high carbon steel, hammered out so that the carbon is evenly distributed throughout the blade for a consistent hardness. The Tsuba is a beautiful cut out steel design of a crane spreading its wings.", "text": "Classic Crane Tsuba Handmade Samurai Katana Sword Sharp This is the Handmade Full Tang Crane Katana Samurai Sword. The blade has been handmade with high carbon steel, hammered out so that the carbon is evenly distributed throughout the blade for a consistent hardness. The Tsuba is a beautiful cut out steel design of a crane spreading its wings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q9l7uUJ5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WGEE48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 33.06}}
