{"item_id": "B002WTNDVK", "title": "Triple 8 Saver Series Wristsavers/Kneesavers/Elbowsavers", "description": "Triple Eight's Kneesaver Knee Pads, Elbowsaver Elbow Pads, and Wristsaver Wrist Guards are packaged together in a convenient three-pack.The knee pads and elbow pads are made of high grade durable fabrics, EVA foam padding, and polycarbonate full coverage caps to provide superior protection without restricting movement. The wrist guards offer great support and protection with high density impact-resistant molded ABS splints on front and back of wrists for support.", "text": "Triple 8 Saver Series Wristsavers/Kneesavers/Elbowsavers Triple Eight's Kneesaver Knee Pads, Elbowsaver Elbow Pads, and Wristsaver Wrist Guards are packaged together in a convenient three-pack.The knee pads and elbow pads are made of high grade durable fabrics, EVA foam padding, and polycarbonate full coverage caps to provide superior protection without restricting movement. The wrist guards offer great support and protection with high density impact-resistant molded ABS splints on front and back of wrists for support.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511IupeowrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WTNDVK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002WTT2NS", "title": "United Cutlery GH5013 Gil Hibben Old West Bowie with Leather Sheath", "description": "This knife is an actual copy of a typical Bowie knife of the 1830s. The story of the Bowie began on a sandbar of the Mississippi River above Natchez, Mississippi on September 19, 1827. A brawl that eventually involved Col. James \"Jim\" Bowie, who, having been shot and stabbed, successfully defended himself killing Major Norris Wright and wounding Alfred Blanchard with what onlookers described as a \"large butcher knife.\" This and other tales of Bowie's abilities with a knife led to the widespread popularity of what became known as the \"Bowie\" knife. This elegant recreation offers a hardwood handle accented by the gold-plated blade catcher and guard, which are reminiscent of the styling of original Bowie. The classic 14\" 420 Stainless steel blade features a crisp mirror finish. Includes a genuine leather sheath with brass-plated star.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5013 Gil Hibben Old West Bowie with Leather Sheath This knife is an actual copy of a typical Bowie knife of the 1830s. The story of the Bowie began on a sandbar of the Mississippi River above Natchez, Mississippi on September 19, 1827. A brawl that eventually involved Col. James \"Jim\" Bowie, who, having been shot and stabbed, successfully defended himself killing Major Norris Wright and wounding Alfred Blanchard with what onlookers described as a \"large butcher knife.\" This and other tales of Bowie's abilities with a knife led to the widespread popularity of what became known as the \"Bowie\" knife. This elegant recreation offers a hardwood handle accented by the gold-plated blade catcher and guard, which are reminiscent of the styling of original Bowie. The classic 14\" 420 Stainless steel blade features a crisp mirror finish. Includes a genuine leather sheath with brass-plated star.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O35Zf-8wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WTT2NS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 82.6}}
{"item_id": "B002WVC0FI", "title": "Scout Fire Piston", "description": "Amazing fire starting device that causes spontaneous combustion using air. Similar to the Diesel engine, heat generated by compressed air molecules is used to ignite tinder. Can be used to ignite numerous natural tinders plus charred cotton cloth. The Scout Model is manufacured from space age polymer and features an aluminum piston shaft. Comes with complete instructions, Char-cloth and a spare O ring. Many other models and performance demonstration videos are available on the Wilderness Solutions website. LIFETIME WARRANTEE. We will repair or replace any product that fails to perform for any reason. You may return unused product within 5 business days for full refund.", "text": "Scout Fire Piston Amazing fire starting device that causes spontaneous combustion using air. Similar to the Diesel engine, heat generated by compressed air molecules is used to ignite tinder. Can be used to ignite numerous natural tinders plus charred cotton cloth. The Scout Model is manufacured from space age polymer and features an aluminum piston shaft. Comes with complete instructions, Char-cloth and a spare O ring. Many other models and performance demonstration videos are available on the Wilderness Solutions website. LIFETIME WARRANTEE. We will repair or replace any product that fails to perform for any reason. You may return unused product within 5 business days for full refund.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YqmvMi4tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WVC0FI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilderness Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 34.86}}
{"item_id": "B002WWWT8U", "title": "Fobus Ankle RU101A RUGER SP101 / LCR RH ANKLE", "description": "Ankle holsters are ultra lightweight and comfortable for all-day use", "text": "Fobus Ankle RU101A RUGER SP101 / LCR RH ANKLE Ankle holsters are ultra lightweight and comfortable for all-day use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ib12fHzrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WWWT8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 37.86}}
{"item_id": "B002WX4D24", "title": "LaserLyte Serrated Pistol Bayonet", "description": "PB-3 This aggressive looking \"Mini Survival Knife\" design is now available for your pistol. It is the 3rd generation of the extremely popular line of LaserLyte/Ka-bar brand pistol bayonets. The exaggerated top serrated blade and two-tone design will look great on any semi-auto pistol. The PB-3 \"Mini Survival Knife\" is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun. This razor-sharp, 2.75 inch Ka-Bar blade fits on any medium to large pistol with rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. Featuring a full tang design, the blade also comes with a custom polymer sheath. The blade handle is constructed from 30 percent glass-filled nylon for extra strength and durability.", "text": "LaserLyte Serrated Pistol Bayonet PB-3 This aggressive looking \"Mini Survival Knife\" design is now available for your pistol. It is the 3rd generation of the extremely popular line of LaserLyte/Ka-bar brand pistol bayonets. The exaggerated top serrated blade and two-tone design will look great on any semi-auto pistol. The PB-3 \"Mini Survival Knife\" is ready for any situation-or just looking cool on your favorite gun. This razor-sharp, 2.75 inch Ka-Bar blade fits on any medium to large pistol with rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. Featuring a full tang design, the blade also comes with a custom polymer sheath. The blade handle is constructed from 30 percent glass-filled nylon for extra strength and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310eR3g3vzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002WX4D24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.98}}
{"item_id": "B002X4PZUQ", "title": "Power Balance-The Original Performance Wristband", "description": "Made to last, this durable, 100% Surgical Grade Silicone wristband can go anywhere you do. Made with a stretch feature that extends easily over your hand, you'll love the style and comfort it provides. Complete with two Power Balance holograms, this sporty and fun band goes with everything. Find your size and see where the day takes you. XS (6.3 in or 16 cm) S (6.9 in or 17.5 cm) M (7.5 in or 19 cm) L (8.1 in or 20.5 cm) XL (8.7 in or 22 cm)", "text": "Power Balance-The Original Performance Wristband Made to last, this durable, 100% Surgical Grade Silicone wristband can go anywhere you do. Made with a stretch feature that extends easily over your hand, you'll love the style and comfort it provides. Complete with two Power Balance holograms, this sporty and fun band goes with everything. Find your size and see where the day takes you. XS (6.3 in or 16 cm) S (6.9 in or 17.5 cm) M (7.5 in or 19 cm) L (8.1 in or 20.5 cm) XL (8.7 in or 22 cm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iLlROPrpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002X4PZUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Wristbands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002X5UNZC", "title": "Stud Bar Pull Up Bar", "description": "Stud Bar is a ceiling or wall mountable pull up bar designed for those looking for a sturdy fixed mount bar. Stud Bar is available in 3 sizes to accommodate varying ceiling heights. Stud Bar is 48\" wide allowing it's mounting holes to center on your existing ceiling or wall studs for easy mounting. Stud Bar is a gym quality pull up bar made using 14 gauge steel with triangular gussets for added strength. Stud Bar can support up to 600 lbs. The bar is 1 1/4\" diameter for a comfortable grip. Hammer tone powder coated finish. Wood mounting hardware included. Lifetime warranty. Patent pending. Please measure your ceiling prior to ordering.", "text": "Stud Bar Pull Up Bar Stud Bar is a ceiling or wall mountable pull up bar designed for those looking for a sturdy fixed mount bar. Stud Bar is available in 3 sizes to accommodate varying ceiling heights. Stud Bar is 48\" wide allowing it's mounting holes to center on your existing ceiling or wall studs for easy mounting. Stud Bar is a gym quality pull up bar made using 14 gauge steel with triangular gussets for added strength. Stud Bar can support up to 600 lbs. The bar is 1 1/4\" diameter for a comfortable grip. Hammer tone powder coated finish. Wood mounting hardware included. Lifetime warranty. Patent pending. Please measure your ceiling prior to ordering.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xiB2iB0QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002X5UNZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
