{"item_id": "B002XEMDA6", "title": "Magpul Industries Grip Core Accessory Storage Core AA/AAA MIAD Grip MAG056-BLK", "description": "Features:Internal core unit for the MIAD as well as the MOE Grips designed to hold two (2) AA type batteries in a self contained waterproof unit.Included internal spacer provides rattle free storage of either (2) AAA or (2) N size batteries (commonly used for EOTech sights).Rubber cap has two sides with marking to identify \"spent\" batteries and can be opened with a push of the thumb.", "text": "Magpul Industries Grip Core Accessory Storage Core AA/AAA MIAD Grip MAG056-BLK Features:Internal core unit for the MIAD as well as the MOE Grips designed to hold two (2) AA type batteries in a self contained waterproof unit.Included internal spacer provides rattle free storage of either (2) AAA or (2) N size batteries (commonly used for EOTech sights).Rubber cap has two sides with marking to identify \"spent\" batteries and can be opened with a push of the thumb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Od-e%2BEm4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XEMDA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 5.75}}
