{"item_id": "B002XJVIEI", "title": "Maxxis 29 x 2.4 Ardent Fldg 60A Tire", "description": "An aggressive tread in high-volume casing, designed with a great traction in mind. The Ardent doesn't forget the racer with large block-style side knobs offering numerous edges for high-speed cornering. The center tread while ideal for braking and acceleration traction, also features ramped knobs to minimized rolling resistance with a wide variety of size offerings, The ardent captures every mountain riders needs.", "text": "Maxxis 29 x 2.4 Ardent Fldg 60A Tire An aggressive tread in high-volume casing, designed with a great traction in mind. The Ardent doesn't forget the racer with large block-style side knobs offering numerous edges for high-speed cornering. The center tread while ideal for braking and acceleration traction, also features ramped knobs to minimized rolling resistance with a wide variety of size offerings, The ardent captures every mountain riders needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xl8%2BQ43vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XJVIEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxxis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 53.6}}
