{"item_id": "B002XLHLME", "title": "Maxpedition Jumbo S-Type Versipack", "description": "Point 1: The S-Type Jumbo's main compartment is over 38% larger than the Fatboy S-Type. In addition, it has three zippered accessory pockets, two sleeve pockets, and one drawstring pocket fitted for a 32oz/1L Nalgene water bottle or a radio. The Jumbo S-Type has three places for modular expansion with other Maxpedition accessories using 3\" TacTie. External keyper on shoulder strap for gloves and internal silent keyper for keys.Point 2: The S-Type JUMBO's rear slip compartment is now equipped with large loop Velcro patches to accommodate Maxpedition Hook & Loop Modular Accessories (e.g. #3501 Universal Modular Holster, sold separately). This allows the user to position their concealed carry firearm for a quick strong side draw or weak side cross draw.", "text": "Maxpedition Jumbo S-Type Versipack Point 1: The S-Type Jumbo's main compartment is over 38% larger than the Fatboy S-Type. In addition, it has three zippered accessory pockets, two sleeve pockets, and one drawstring pocket fitted for a 32oz/1L Nalgene water bottle or a radio. The Jumbo S-Type has three places for modular expansion with other Maxpedition accessories using 3\" TacTie. External keyper on shoulder strap for gloves and internal silent keyper for keys.Point 2: The S-Type JUMBO's rear slip compartment is now equipped with large loop Velcro patches to accommodate Maxpedition Hook & Loop Modular Accessories (e.g. #3501 Universal Modular Holster, sold separately). This allows the user to position their concealed carry firearm for a quick strong side draw or weak side cross draw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F%2BKfb1u7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XLHLME.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 84.33}}
{"item_id": "B002XMTXX8", "title": "Perma-Guard Diatomaceous Earth DE Food Grade 50 lb bag", "description": "Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth (Fossil Shell Flour) has many uses: in the household, with pets, on plants, around livestock, and for stored grain. It is totally organic and listed with OMRI. With more than 600 deposits of diatomite west of the Mississippi-and only four (to our knowledge) that can be considered food grade-it is very important that people know what they are using. The vast majority of diatomite deposits are impure. When diatomite is formed, water currents bring in foreign material that mixes with the microscopic diatom shells. This type of diatomite is absolutely without value for practical purposes, but many people tend to think that if it is \"Diatomaceous Earth,\" then it has the same value as other, purer deposits. There are many places where diatomite deposits can be loaded up \"for free,\" but generally this substance has no value. If this impure diatomite is sold for practical usage, the customer may end up with an unpleasant surprise. Home: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as an Organic Pesticide Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth is used around the house as an organic pesticide for the control of ants, cockroaches, silverfish, bedbugs, fleas, box elder bugs, scorpions, crickets, ticks, and many other unwelcome pests. Natural ant control is one of the biggest reasons for the usage of Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth in and around the home. For complete ant control, simply sprinkle the area of concern with fossil shell flour (DE). When the ants or other pests come in contact with the powder, it is like stepping on broken glass, they will be killed or abandon the area. Pets: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth for Flea, Tick, and Lice Control Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth is an effective, organic pesticide against fleas, ticks, lice, and other pests that bother our pets. Plants: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as a Natural Insecticide Use Perma-Guard Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as a natural insecticide for the non-chemical control.", "text": "Perma-Guard Diatomaceous Earth DE Food Grade 50 lb bag Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth (Fossil Shell Flour) has many uses: in the household, with pets, on plants, around livestock, and for stored grain. It is totally organic and listed with OMRI. With more than 600 deposits of diatomite west of the Mississippi-and only four (to our knowledge) that can be considered food grade-it is very important that people know what they are using. The vast majority of diatomite deposits are impure. When diatomite is formed, water currents bring in foreign material that mixes with the microscopic diatom shells. This type of diatomite is absolutely without value for practical purposes, but many people tend to think that if it is \"Diatomaceous Earth,\" then it has the same value as other, purer deposits. There are many places where diatomite deposits can be loaded up \"for free,\" but generally this substance has no value. If this impure diatomite is sold for practical usage, the customer may end up with an unpleasant surprise. Home: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as an Organic Pesticide Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth is used around the house as an organic pesticide for the control of ants, cockroaches, silverfish, bedbugs, fleas, box elder bugs, scorpions, crickets, ticks, and many other unwelcome pests. Natural ant control is one of the biggest reasons for the usage of Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth in and around the home. For complete ant control, simply sprinkle the area of concern with fossil shell flour (DE). When the ants or other pests come in contact with the powder, it is like stepping on broken glass, they will be killed or abandon the area. Pets: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth for Flea, Tick, and Lice Control Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth is an effective, organic pesticide against fleas, ticks, lice, and other pests that bother our pets. Plants: Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as a Natural Insecticide Use Perma-Guard Food Grade Diatomaceous Earth as a natural insecticide for the non-chemical control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yg6dmFKFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XMTXX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perma Guard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 56.99}}
{"item_id": "B002XNMTQK", "title": "Dreamie Fleece Camping Blanket With Travel Bag - Dreamie Z-00204", "description": "Better than any blanket! Dreamie Fleece is a comfy FLEECE cocoon with a pillow pocket. Now you can have comfort all around your body, including coverage in the back and on your feet for all over warmth! Its like 2 fleece blankets in 1 to keep you warm. Pillow pocket helps keep your pillow in place while you sleep. Durable fleece material with a machine-washable design for easy cleaning. Espresso color for a stylish look. The all new Dreamie FLEECE is the \"better than any blanket\" invention of the year. It's unique design affords you full body comfort and coverage, Dreamie's side opening and built in pillow pocket makes DREAMIE so comfy you might not want to get out.", "text": "Dreamie Fleece Camping Blanket With Travel Bag - Dreamie Z-00204 Better than any blanket! Dreamie Fleece is a comfy FLEECE cocoon with a pillow pocket. Now you can have comfort all around your body, including coverage in the back and on your feet for all over warmth! Its like 2 fleece blankets in 1 to keep you warm. Pillow pocket helps keep your pillow in place while you sleep. Durable fleece material with a machine-washable design for easy cleaning. Espresso color for a stylish look. The all new Dreamie FLEECE is the \"better than any blanket\" invention of the year. It's unique design affords you full body comfort and coverage, Dreamie's side opening and built in pillow pocket makes DREAMIE so comfy you might not want to get out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FMuYOTU8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XNMTQK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 34.75}}
{"item_id": "B002XO48RC", "title": "Grand Trunk Single Parachute Nylon Hammock with Carabiners", "description": "There are hammocks and then there is the Grand Trunk Parachute Nylon Double Hammock. Our guarantee to you is that once you hang up this hammock you will love it; if you don't let us know! Offers the largest portable hammock bed space on the market and only weighs 20 oz. Great by yourself or with that special someone.", "text": "Grand Trunk Single Parachute Nylon Hammock with Carabiners There are hammocks and then there is the Grand Trunk Parachute Nylon Double Hammock. Our guarantee to you is that once you hang up this hammock you will love it; if you don't let us know! Offers the largest portable hammock bed space on the market and only weighs 20 oz. Great by yourself or with that special someone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zF6RfNjUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XO48RC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B002XOJD9A", "title": "Aeromax Alloy Wheelset Road Bike Comp 700c Wheels", "description": "AEROMAX 700C ROAD COMP BLACK WHEELESETNEW / HAND-BUILT / SHIPS IN 24hrsDETAILS:Wheels come with rim strips and skewersServiceable Vuelta Ball BearingsHand BuiltEvery wheel is stressed 3 timesTrued to a tolerance 0.3 for roadEvery spoke is tension tested with a DT Swiss GaugeThese 700c clincher wheels are greatfor around town, daily training rides or racing.Comparable wheels sell in bikes shops around the country for $275 to$300SPECIFICATIONS:Type-RoadColor:BlackNormal quick release skewered hubs24spoke aero double wall alloy rims, machined sidewalls andblack satin finishType: Clincher, tubedStainless Steel Black aero 3.0mm spokesPatented 2-left/2-right spoke patternDrilled for Presta valveRim Width: 20mm (outer width)Rim Width: 13.7mm (inner width)Rim Height: 29.3mmSpacing: front 100mm, rear 130mmWeight: Front 980g / Rear 1220gCOMPATIBILITY:Cassette compatibility: Shimano or SRAM 7, 8, 9, or 10 speed (7 speed will require an additional spacer - not included)Fits 700c tires - from 700 x 18 up to 700 x 42 - the second number is the width, the first refers to the diameter. How wide a tire you can install depends on what type of clearance your frame has between the seat stays and brake arms.Not compatible with single speed or multi-speed freewheels - compatible with cassettes only. Please research the difference between cassettes and freewheels if you are unsure what you have.For rim brakes only - does not have mounts for disc brake rotors.Not intended for use with 27\" wheeled frames. They will fit, but 700c wheels are smaller in diameter than 27\" an", "text": "Aeromax Alloy Wheelset Road Bike Comp 700c Wheels AEROMAX 700C ROAD COMP BLACK WHEELESETNEW / HAND-BUILT / SHIPS IN 24hrsDETAILS:Wheels come with rim strips and skewersServiceable Vuelta Ball BearingsHand BuiltEvery wheel is stressed 3 timesTrued to a tolerance 0.3 for roadEvery spoke is tension tested with a DT Swiss GaugeThese 700c clincher wheels are greatfor around town, daily training rides or racing.Comparable wheels sell in bikes shops around the country for $275 to$300SPECIFICATIONS:Type-RoadColor:BlackNormal quick release skewered hubs24spoke aero double wall alloy rims, machined sidewalls andblack satin finishType: Clincher, tubedStainless Steel Black aero 3.0mm spokesPatented 2-left/2-right spoke patternDrilled for Presta valveRim Width: 20mm (outer width)Rim Width: 13.7mm (inner width)Rim Height: 29.3mmSpacing: front 100mm, rear 130mmWeight: Front 980g / Rear 1220gCOMPATIBILITY:Cassette compatibility: Shimano or SRAM 7, 8, 9, or 10 speed (7 speed will require an additional spacer - not included)Fits 700c tires - from 700 x 18 up to 700 x 42 - the second number is the width, the first refers to the diameter. How wide a tire you can install depends on what type of clearance your frame has between the seat stays and brake arms.Not compatible with single speed or multi-speed freewheels - compatible with cassettes only. Please research the difference between cassettes and freewheels if you are unsure what you have.For rim brakes only - does not have mounts for disc brake rotors.Not intended for use with 27\" wheeled frames. They will fit, but 700c wheels are smaller in diameter than 27\" an", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513bkKSsUuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XOJD9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Wheels & Accessories", "Wheels"]], "price": 113.97}}
{"item_id": "B002XOSGPW", "title": "TITLE Boxing Gyro Balanced Speed Bags", "description": "Constructed with precision Gyro Balanced manufacturing to assure true rebounds and rapid recoiling that helps develop lighting fast reflexes, improve your quickness and hand-eye coordination. Top grade leather shell with triple reinforced leather seams and lacing for relentless and balanced workouts every time. Includes a butyl rubber pro bladder with special internal balancing for maximum results.", "text": "TITLE Boxing Gyro Balanced Speed Bags Constructed with precision Gyro Balanced manufacturing to assure true rebounds and rapid recoiling that helps develop lighting fast reflexes, improve your quickness and hand-eye coordination. Top grade leather shell with triple reinforced leather seams and lacing for relentless and balanced workouts every time. Includes a butyl rubber pro bladder with special internal balancing for maximum results.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qi7XB1A3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XOSGPW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Speed Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XP94ZW", "title": "Giro Bravo Cycling Gloves, Black/Yellow, Medium", "description": "The best glove for the money, hands down. The Bravo is a nicely padded, comfortable glove that delivers Giro's Super Fit ergonomic design and high-quality construction at an affordable price. It's the perfect choice for rider who prefer the feel of a more traditional padded glove. Upper feature moisture-wicking, 4-way stretch, breathable mesh. Palm features the Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most. Clarino synthetic leather provides enhanced durability.", "text": "Giro Bravo Cycling Gloves, Black/Yellow, Medium The best glove for the money, hands down. The Bravo is a nicely padded, comfortable glove that delivers Giro's Super Fit ergonomic design and high-quality construction at an affordable price. It's the perfect choice for rider who prefer the feel of a more traditional padded glove. Upper feature moisture-wicking, 4-way stretch, breathable mesh. Palm features the Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most. Clarino synthetic leather provides enhanced durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DQA7lVoKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XP94ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XQGFDK", "title": "Easton 113mm Bocce Set", "description": "Fabric carry/storage bag, 8-113mm steel with chrome and black finish. Comes in 2 different scoring pattern styles, 1-60mm Phenolic Palino", "text": "Easton 113mm Bocce Set Fabric carry/storage bag, 8-113mm steel with chrome and black finish. Comes in 2 different scoring pattern styles, 1-60mm Phenolic Palino", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412AB%2BhI3sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XQGFDK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Bocce", "Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XQI984", "title": "Easton Platinum Volleyball Set", "description": "Made by Easton-Bell Sports, this volleyball set features a pair of round, heavy-duty steel poles that adjusts to 7, 7.4, or 8 feet high. The 6-ply volleyball net measures 32 feet by 3 feet and includes a 1.75-inch tape along the top and a 1.25-inch tape on the bottom. A patented assembly system ensures quick setup. The set also comes with an officially sized volleyball made of PVC sponge.About Easton-Bell SportsEaston-Bell Sports is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection. The company markets and licenses products under well-known brands such as Easton, Bell, Riddell, Giro, and Blackburn. From Easton to Riddell to Bell to Giro, the brands of Easton-Bell Sports set the standard of design and protective excellence across multiple sports, equipment categories, and sales channels. Easton-Bell's commitment to this philosophy and standard is reflected in its unrivaled history and foundational belief in technological innovation. It is the reason each brand holds a strong number-one status within key product categories in baseball, softball, hockey, football, and cycling as well as snow, action, and power sports.What's in the BoxTwo poles, volleyball net, volleyball, and carrying bag.", "text": "Easton Platinum Volleyball Set Made by Easton-Bell Sports, this volleyball set features a pair of round, heavy-duty steel poles that adjusts to 7, 7.4, or 8 feet high. The 6-ply volleyball net measures 32 feet by 3 feet and includes a 1.75-inch tape along the top and a 1.25-inch tape on the bottom. A patented assembly system ensures quick setup. The set also comes with an officially sized volleyball made of PVC sponge.About Easton-Bell SportsEaston-Bell Sports is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection. The company markets and licenses products under well-known brands such as Easton, Bell, Riddell, Giro, and Blackburn. From Easton to Riddell to Bell to Giro, the brands of Easton-Bell Sports set the standard of design and protective excellence across multiple sports, equipment categories, and sales channels. Easton-Bell's commitment to this philosophy and standard is reflected in its unrivaled history and foundational belief in technological innovation. It is the reason each brand holds a strong number-one status within key product categories in baseball, softball, hockey, football, and cycling as well as snow, action, and power sports.What's in the BoxTwo poles, volleyball net, volleyball, and carrying bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BCaJrH1ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XQI984.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Court Equipment", "Pole Sets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XR4KBI", "title": "Classic Accessories Fairway Golf Cart Seat Blanket", "description": "Unzip this attractive golf seat blanket and you will have instant protection from cold, damp or dirty golf car seats. The reversible quilted design features a water resistant fabric on one side and a soft, plush fleece fabric on the other. This golf seat blanket quickly secures to the golf car seat over the armrests and can be used as a seat cover or as a lap blanket to keep your legs warm. This golf seat blanket easily and conveniently folds up into its own case for easy transport to and from your car. One year limited warranty.", "text": "Classic Accessories Fairway Golf Cart Seat Blanket Unzip this attractive golf seat blanket and you will have instant protection from cold, damp or dirty golf car seats. The reversible quilted design features a water resistant fabric on one side and a soft, plush fleece fabric on the other. This golf seat blanket quickly secures to the golf car seat over the armrests and can be used as a seat cover or as a lap blanket to keep your legs warm. This golf seat blanket easily and conveniently folds up into its own case for easy transport to and from your car. One year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EERUhbzhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XR4KBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fairway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Cart Accessories"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B002XUG0Y0", "title": "TITLE Weighted Gloves, Black, 3-Pounds", "description": "Comfortable neoprene glove custom conforms to the hand for a snug, no slip fit. Ideal for all aerobic activities to add superior benefits to your workout. A hook-and-loop attachment makes for a one-size-fits-most wear. Add speed, power, endurance and maximum cardio benefits while shadow boxing, running, aerobics, etc. Helps build powerful arms, forearms and shoulders. Unique design allows hands free to perform most activities while wearing. Now in 3 weights for every level athlete.", "text": "TITLE Weighted Gloves, Black, 3-Pounds Comfortable neoprene glove custom conforms to the hand for a snug, no slip fit. Ideal for all aerobic activities to add superior benefits to your workout. A hook-and-loop attachment makes for a one-size-fits-most wear. Add speed, power, endurance and maximum cardio benefits while shadow boxing, running, aerobics, etc. Helps build powerful arms, forearms and shoulders. Unique design allows hands free to perform most activities while wearing. Now in 3 weights for every level athlete.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vddujLJDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XUG0Y0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XUHM88", "title": "TITLE Boxing Pro Style Leather Training Gloves", "description": "A top full grain leather shell provides a super durable training glove that is built to go the distance. Multi-layer shock absorbing foams over the fist and back of hand offer all the power and coverage you demand in a training glove. Full wrap around twin-ply leather wrist strap with hook-and-loop closure for maximum security, support and delivery. A satin nylon hand compartment liner helps repel moisture retention and keep gloves fresh between uses. Take a step up with TITLE.", "text": "TITLE Boxing Pro Style Leather Training Gloves A top full grain leather shell provides a super durable training glove that is built to go the distance. Multi-layer shock absorbing foams over the fist and back of hand offer all the power and coverage you demand in a training glove. Full wrap around twin-ply leather wrist strap with hook-and-loop closure for maximum security, support and delivery. A satin nylon hand compartment liner helps repel moisture retention and keep gloves fresh between uses. Take a step up with TITLE.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z6aPaXiGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XUHM88.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Fight Gloves", "Pro Boxing Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XUMC2O", "title": "Dye Paintball Performance Neck Protectors (Click-a-Color)", "description": "The new Dye Performance Neck Protector is a revolution in neck protection technology. This neck protector is unlike any other. We've specifically constructed the most critical areas utilizing plush, ventilated padding. The inside material that is against your neck is made of the softest, most breathable material available. The ultimate in comfort and protection for your neck. ONE SIZE FITS ALL", "text": "Dye Paintball Performance Neck Protectors (Click-a-Color) The new Dye Performance Neck Protector is a revolution in neck protection technology. This neck protector is unlike any other. We've specifically constructed the most critical areas utilizing plush, ventilated padding. The inside material that is against your neck is made of the softest, most breathable material available. The ultimate in comfort and protection for your neck. ONE SIZE FITS ALL", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E-GL25%2BlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XUMC2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dye", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Neck Protectors"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B002XUMC4C", "title": "Dye Precision Head Wrap", "description": "Stay cool and clean with the Dye paintball Headwrap. Black mesh fabric provides neck protection as well as keeping your head clean. Available in a light or dark camo.", "text": "Dye Precision Head Wrap Stay cool and clean with the Dye paintball Headwrap. Black mesh fabric provides neck protection as well as keeping your head clean. Available in a light or dark camo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dIdRIX6mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XUMC4C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dye", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Clothing"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B002XW24MK", "title": "Eezox Gun Care", "description": "Advanced Technology Triple Action Solution that cleans, lubricates, and preserves firearms. It is one of the finest treatments that you can give your guns. Synthetic Eezox Premium Gun Care is a total gun-care system with ONE PRODUCT for all guns. This includes black powder guns. Since Eezox is not petroleum based, it will not affect the seasoning of a muzzleloader bore. Eezox enables your firearm to function as designed by the manufacturer.", "text": "Eezox Gun Care Advanced Technology Triple Action Solution that cleans, lubricates, and preserves firearms. It is one of the finest treatments that you can give your guns. Synthetic Eezox Premium Gun Care is a total gun-care system with ONE PRODUCT for all guns. This includes black powder guns. Since Eezox is not petroleum based, it will not affect the seasoning of a muzzleloader bore. Eezox enables your firearm to function as designed by the manufacturer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FSWCAQqeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XW24MK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Cue Sticks & Accessories", "Cue Sticks"]], "price": 8.6}}
{"item_id": "B002XXL1ZA", "title": "Giro DJ Mountain Biking Gloves, Cyan/Black, Medium", "description": "Light, comfortable and tough enough to be legit. The DJ is a team-driven evolution of the Xen glove, built for a supple feel with enough durability for all-day sessions and all-mountain riding. The Super Fit engineered Clarino palm is tailored to minimize bulk for enhanced bar feel and control, and matched with a breathable upper that pops with color. Upper features moisture-wicking, 4-way stretch, breathable mesh and reinforced fingertips for hard-wearing durability and knuckle flex zones. Palm features the Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most. Clarino synthetic leather provides enhanced durability. 3mm EVA crash pad distributes impact energy.", "text": "Giro DJ Mountain Biking Gloves, Cyan/Black, Medium Light, comfortable and tough enough to be legit. The DJ is a team-driven evolution of the Xen glove, built for a supple feel with enough durability for all-day sessions and all-mountain riding. The Super Fit engineered Clarino palm is tailored to minimize bulk for enhanced bar feel and control, and matched with a breathable upper that pops with color. Upper features moisture-wicking, 4-way stretch, breathable mesh and reinforced fingertips for hard-wearing durability and knuckle flex zones. Palm features the Super Fit design with three-panel palm for a tailored fit. 1 - Thumb: The Super Fit Engineered thumb panel is essential to providing a snug fit with your hand while also allowing freedom of movement and enhanced grip necessary for maximum control and bar feel. 2- Palm: The Super Fit Engineered palm panel is optimized to provide a snug, comfortable fit without bunching when you grip the handlebar. By selecting the best material for each glove design and carefully sizing the palm panel to match the natural curve of the hand, the palm remains supple while providing a layer of protection. 3 - Body: the Super Fit Engineered body of a Giro glove is designed to support your hand's natural movement, while providing a platform for padding and protection where you need it most. Clarino synthetic leather provides enhanced durability. 3mm EVA crash pad distributes impact energy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dfb%2BKXfaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XXL1ZA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XYN9XQ", "title": "Continental Gator Hardshell Duraskin Urban Premium Bicycle Tire", "description": "The SUPER Gator. The Ultra Gatorskin has set the bar for a perfectly-balanced blend of ride quality and long-term durability without breaking the bank..but still the roads of North America demand a model even tougher. The all NEW Gator Hardshell delivers!!! Sharing the bead-to-bead protection of DuraSkin, the Hardshell casing wraps further into the sidewall and an extra-wide Poly-X breaker covers the entire tread strip from shoulder-to-shoulder. Added material in the tread strip not only improves mileage, but lends yet another degree of puncture resistance. More isnt always better, but in this case - MORE is exactly what you get.", "text": "Continental Gator Hardshell Duraskin Urban Premium Bicycle Tire The SUPER Gator. The Ultra Gatorskin has set the bar for a perfectly-balanced blend of ride quality and long-term durability without breaking the bank..but still the roads of North America demand a model even tougher. The all NEW Gator Hardshell delivers!!! Sharing the bead-to-bead protection of DuraSkin, the Hardshell casing wraps further into the sidewall and an extra-wide Poly-X breaker covers the entire tread strip from shoulder-to-shoulder. Added material in the tread strip not only improves mileage, but lends yet another degree of puncture resistance. More isnt always better, but in this case - MORE is exactly what you get.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NZTKfsmWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XYN9XQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XYNA2Q", "title": "Continental Gator Hardshell Urban Bicycle Tire with Duraskin (700x23, Folding)", "description": "Continental 0100311 Gator Hardshell 700 x 23 Foldable Urban Tire with Duraskin has set the bar for a perfectly-balanced blend of ride quality and long-term durability without breaking the bank…but still the roads of North America demand a model even tougher. The all new Gator Hardshell delivers! Sharing the bead-to-bead protection of Duraskin, the Hardshell casing wraps further into the sidewall and an extra-wide Poly-X breaker covers the entire tread strip from shoulder-to-shoulder. Added material in the tread strip not only improves mileage, but lends yet another degree of puncture resistance. More isn't always better, but in this case - more is exactly what you get. Specs: Weight - 260 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10. Tread wear indicators are part of the tire design.", "text": "Continental Gator Hardshell Urban Bicycle Tire with Duraskin (700x23, Folding) Continental 0100311 Gator Hardshell 700 x 23 Foldable Urban Tire with Duraskin has set the bar for a perfectly-balanced blend of ride quality and long-term durability without breaking the bank…but still the roads of North America demand a model even tougher. The all new Gator Hardshell delivers! Sharing the bead-to-bead protection of Duraskin, the Hardshell casing wraps further into the sidewall and an extra-wide Poly-X breaker covers the entire tread strip from shoulder-to-shoulder. Added material in the tread strip not only improves mileage, but lends yet another degree of puncture resistance. More isn't always better, but in this case - more is exactly what you get. Specs: Weight - 260 grams; Recommended PSI - 110; Maximum PSI - 120; PU - 10. Tread wear indicators are part of the tire design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NZTKfsmWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XYNA2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B002XYNAFS", "title": "Continental Gator Hardshell DuraSkin Folding Tire", "description": "First there was GatorSkin, a remarkably durable tire in its own right. Then came Ultra GatorSkin. Now, Continental takes durability beyond the limits with the GatorHardshell Road Tire. Like the Ultra GatorSkin, the Gator HardShell tire balances great ride characteristics with long life--and at an affordable price. The Continental GatorHardshell road tire features the bead-to-bead protection of DuraSkin, PLUS a Hardshell casing and extra-wide PolyX breaker. The result is a super-durable road tire that's about as puncture-resistant as a tire can get. A super long-wearing tire that resists punctures and sidewall cuts Casing reinforced with DuraSkin and Hardshell-anti-cut sidewalls for extra protection Smooth-rolling center tread with shoulders optimized for cornering traction Extra-wide PolyX breaker covers tread from shoulder-to-shoulder, providing enhanced puncture-resistance", "text": "Continental Gator Hardshell DuraSkin Folding Tire First there was GatorSkin, a remarkably durable tire in its own right. Then came Ultra GatorSkin. Now, Continental takes durability beyond the limits with the GatorHardshell Road Tire. Like the Ultra GatorSkin, the Gator HardShell tire balances great ride characteristics with long life--and at an affordable price. The Continental GatorHardshell road tire features the bead-to-bead protection of DuraSkin, PLUS a Hardshell casing and extra-wide PolyX breaker. The result is a super-durable road tire that's about as puncture-resistant as a tire can get. A super long-wearing tire that resists punctures and sidewall cuts Casing reinforced with DuraSkin and Hardshell-anti-cut sidewalls for extra protection Smooth-rolling center tread with shoulders optimized for cornering traction Extra-wide PolyX breaker covers tread from shoulder-to-shoulder, providing enhanced puncture-resistance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NZTKfsmWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XYNAFS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XYTNZ4", "title": "Continental Trail King Tire", "description": "Wild Trails and Killer loops, Alp-crossing, as long as the partying continues! Touring suitability is ensured by a voluminous and light structured carcase. Just when you think one tire cannot do it all this tyre delivers. With the tyre available in basic wire and folding formats with no extras like apex, black chilli or german manufacture, it is a tyre for all price ranges!", "text": "Continental Trail King Tire Wild Trails and Killer loops, Alp-crossing, as long as the partying continues! Touring suitability is ensured by a voluminous and light structured carcase. Just when you think one tire cannot do it all this tyre delivers. With the tyre available in basic wire and folding formats with no extras like apex, black chilli or german manufacture, it is a tyre for all price ranges!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IUrlkNXXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XYTNZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XZLJ4G", "title": "Race Face Atlas FR Riser Handlebar", "description": "Designed with the extreme gravity set in mind, the Atlas riser bar sets the standard. Perfect for intense FR or full on DH Race applications.", "text": "Race Face Atlas FR Riser Handlebar Designed with the extreme gravity set in mind, the Atlas riser bar sets the standard. Perfect for intense FR or full on DH Race applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2B0VcIeVRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XZLJ4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002XZTNFS", "title": "Nikwax Tent and Gear Solar Proof", "description": "Adds waterproof and UV proctection to any weatherproof fabrics on tents, awnings, covers etc.", "text": "Nikwax Tent and Gear Solar Proof Adds waterproof and UV proctection to any weatherproof fabrics on tents, awnings, covers etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QdPogiqcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002XZTNFS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikwax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care"]], "price": 13.45}}
{"item_id": "B002Y0KUSG", "title": "Sapien Arms SAP05B V2 Metal Propane Adapter", "description": "The Sapien Arms SAP05B is the revolutionary new way to power your gas Airsoft products. Threads perfectly onto your standard green, propane tanks used for camping.", "text": "Sapien Arms SAP05B V2 Metal Propane Adapter The Sapien Arms SAP05B is the revolutionary new way to power your gas Airsoft products. Threads perfectly onto your standard green, propane tanks used for camping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BqBJaam5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Y0KUSG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sapien Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B002Y17IR6", "title": "JBU JA46 Phantom Airsoft Flash Hider", "description": "Our take: This full metal upgrade/ mod flash hider fits most AEGs with 14mm counter clockwise threaded outer barrels. This Phantom flash hider is CNC manufactured from high grade and durable metal.Simple installation involves removing current flash hider and screwing on the flat black, full metal flash hider to give your rifle a more aggressive look. Airsoft Megastore is not responsible for installation/removal of flash hiders, so we highly suggest you take your AEG to a professional to have the flash hider removed/installed, unless you are able to do so yourself.Disclaimer: Be sure to check your local laws and regulations regarding coloration of the tip of your airsoft gun. This tip is not painted orange, therefore modification of the flash hider may be necessary before it is attached to your AEG.Features:- Fits most counter clockwise outer barrel AEGs- Full metal heavy duty construction- Extremely durable and lightweight design- Ready to use right out of the box- Precision machined- Locking set screw included- 14mm CCW threaded barrel compatible", "text": "JBU JA46 Phantom Airsoft Flash Hider Our take: This full metal upgrade/ mod flash hider fits most AEGs with 14mm counter clockwise threaded outer barrels. This Phantom flash hider is CNC manufactured from high grade and durable metal.Simple installation involves removing current flash hider and screwing on the flat black, full metal flash hider to give your rifle a more aggressive look. Airsoft Megastore is not responsible for installation/removal of flash hiders, so we highly suggest you take your AEG to a professional to have the flash hider removed/installed, unless you are able to do so yourself.Disclaimer: Be sure to check your local laws and regulations regarding coloration of the tip of your airsoft gun. This tip is not painted orange, therefore modification of the flash hider may be necessary before it is attached to your AEG.Features:- Fits most counter clockwise outer barrel AEGs- Full metal heavy duty construction- Extremely durable and lightweight design- Ready to use right out of the box- Precision machined- Locking set screw included- 14mm CCW threaded barrel compatible", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dEbWuC0iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Y17IR6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JBU", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 25.4}}
{"item_id": "B002Y1DBL8", "title": "JBU JB37 Metal Tactical Latch for MIL4/MIL16 Airsoft AEG Charging Handle", "description": "Our take: Tactics and techniques have evolved since the creation of the M16/ M4 platform. One of the more innovative designs of the 21st century has been the extension of the charging handle latch, which allows the user to easily and comfortably manipulate the charging handle. JBU's NEW full metal charging handle extension latch attaches easily to most M16 and M4 AEG charging handles, and provides them with a more modern and tactical look. These charging handles are quality crafted from a single piece of aluminum, guaranteeing durability.Note: This product is ONLY compatible with M4/ M16 metal gearbox AEGs.Specifications:Weight: 0.2 oz.Construction: AluminumPackage Includes: 1x JBU Full Metal Charging Handle Extension Latch", "text": "JBU JB37 Metal Tactical Latch for MIL4/MIL16 Airsoft AEG Charging Handle Our take: Tactics and techniques have evolved since the creation of the M16/ M4 platform. One of the more innovative designs of the 21st century has been the extension of the charging handle latch, which allows the user to easily and comfortably manipulate the charging handle. JBU's NEW full metal charging handle extension latch attaches easily to most M16 and M4 AEG charging handles, and provides them with a more modern and tactical look. These charging handles are quality crafted from a single piece of aluminum, guaranteeing durability.Note: This product is ONLY compatible with M4/ M16 metal gearbox AEGs.Specifications:Weight: 0.2 oz.Construction: AluminumPackage Includes: 1x JBU Full Metal Charging Handle Extension Latch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31asC5RzAOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Y1DBL8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 12.82}}
