{"item_id": "B002Y1PCRO", "title": "Spyderco HoneyBee SS PlainEdge Knife", "description": "Small but mighty, the HoneyBee plain-edge folding knife from Spyderco offers an expectation defying performance for a micro-sized Slipit. The Honeybee knife packs stinging cutting clout with a razor sharp, flat-ground 3Cr stainless steel blade. Resistance pressure at the knife's pivot area holds the blade open and extended when cutting. The stainless steel handle is flat with an engravable surface that also sports a laser engraved Spyderco bug logo. A lanyard-hole at the handle end accommodates a necklace-chain or key chain.Spyderco Slipit Knives:Spyderco perceived a gap between traditional slip joints and modern locking folders and created a product line called Slipits. Slipits are reliable and sophisticated non-locking folders that open with one hand, have a finger choil for comfort and safety, and are conveniently accessible.The subcategory of micro-sized Slipits with stainless steel handles are known as the Spyderco Bugs. Affable Bugs draw comments like \"how cute\" a beneficial perception in a knife-cautious world but their size trumps the reality that they're serious business when it comes to cutting.The Honeybee folds into a neat, smooth, stainless steel handle with a lanyard hole for attachment.Key Features:Clip-less, lanyard holeLaser engraved Spyderco bug logo on handleFlat-ground bladePlain EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 3.625 inchesLength closed: 2.063 inchesBlade length: 1.625 inchesCutting edge: 1.375 inchesBlade thickness: 0.078 inchesHole diameter: 0.234 inchesBlade steel: 3CrHandle material: Stainless SteelWeight: 0.56 ounces", "text": "Spyderco HoneyBee SS PlainEdge Knife Small but mighty, the HoneyBee plain-edge folding knife from Spyderco offers an expectation defying performance for a micro-sized Slipit. The Honeybee knife packs stinging cutting clout with a razor sharp, flat-ground 3Cr stainless steel blade. Resistance pressure at the knife's pivot area holds the blade open and extended when cutting. The stainless steel handle is flat with an engravable surface that also sports a laser engraved Spyderco bug logo. A lanyard-hole at the handle end accommodates a necklace-chain or key chain.Spyderco Slipit Knives:Spyderco perceived a gap between traditional slip joints and modern locking folders and created a product line called Slipits. Slipits are reliable and sophisticated non-locking folders that open with one hand, have a finger choil for comfort and safety, and are conveniently accessible.The subcategory of micro-sized Slipits with stainless steel handles are known as the Spyderco Bugs. Affable Bugs draw comments like \"how cute\" a beneficial perception in a knife-cautious world but their size trumps the reality that they're serious business when it comes to cutting.The Honeybee folds into a neat, smooth, stainless steel handle with a lanyard hole for attachment.Key Features:Clip-less, lanyard holeLaser engraved Spyderco bug logo on handleFlat-ground bladePlain EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 3.625 inchesLength closed: 2.063 inchesBlade length: 1.625 inchesCutting edge: 1.375 inchesBlade thickness: 0.078 inchesHole diameter: 0.234 inchesBlade steel: 3CrHandle material: Stainless SteelWeight: 0.56 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21%2BQ0amXodL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Y1PCRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.75}}
