{"item_id": "B002Y4LSYW", "title": "AVI 12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 10 Pack", "description": "Features:AVI CO2 cartridge - 10 Pack12 gram*Cartridge brand may vary***Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Orders that have selected air shipping and include CO2 cartridges will automatically be modified to ship in separate packages. Additional freight may apply.**", "text": "AVI 12 Gram CO2 Cartridge - 10 Pack Features:AVI CO2 cartridge - 10 Pack12 gram*Cartridge brand may vary***Note: Because CO2 Cartridges are under pressure, they are not allowed to ship via any air transportation. Orders that have selected air shipping and include CO2 cartridges will automatically be modified to ship in separate packages. Additional freight may apply.**", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g0OvR3T1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Y4LSYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SDN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 11.24}}
