{"item_id": "B002YAWZ02", "title": "Sightmark Multi - reticle Reflex Sight Black", "description": "Sightmark Multi reticle Reflex Sight! Compact. Enjoy faster target acquisition without breaking the bank. This affordable little beauty gives you 4 reticle options and a wide field of view. Suitable for homing in on stationary and moving targets with speed. Right now, my special buy puts HUGE savings within range! Specs: 4 reticle choices include: 3 M.O.A. dot, crosshair, 10 M.O.A. dot crosshair and 65 M.O.A. circle with 3 M.O.A dot. Adjustable reticle brightness; Tubeless design with 33 mm reflex lens aperture. F.O.V. is 115' @ 100 yds.; Parallax-corrected, unlimited eye relief; 1X power; Allen head screw windage and elevation adjustments with locking screw; Built-in integrated Weaver style mount fits standard bases, no need to re-zero when remounting; Waterproof; Shockproof; Uses common 3V lithium battery (included); 3 1/4\"l., weighs just 4 ozs. Now's the time to score this bargain! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Sightmark Multi-reticle Reflex Sight, Camo - word search in our store for 'Sightmark'. Sightmark Multi-reticle Reflex Sight, Black", "text": "Sightmark Multi - reticle Reflex Sight Black Sightmark Multi reticle Reflex Sight! Compact. Enjoy faster target acquisition without breaking the bank. This affordable little beauty gives you 4 reticle options and a wide field of view. Suitable for homing in on stationary and moving targets with speed. Right now, my special buy puts HUGE savings within range! Specs: 4 reticle choices include: 3 M.O.A. dot, crosshair, 10 M.O.A. dot crosshair and 65 M.O.A. circle with 3 M.O.A dot. Adjustable reticle brightness; Tubeless design with 33 mm reflex lens aperture. F.O.V. is 115' @ 100 yds.; Parallax-corrected, unlimited eye relief; 1X power; Allen head screw windage and elevation adjustments with locking screw; Built-in integrated Weaver style mount fits standard bases, no need to re-zero when remounting; Waterproof; Shockproof; Uses common 3V lithium battery (included); 3 1/4\"l., weighs just 4 ozs. Now's the time to score this bargain! Order Today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: Sightmark Multi-reticle Reflex Sight, Camo - word search in our store for 'Sightmark'. Sightmark Multi-reticle Reflex Sight, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Vy90y7aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YAWZ02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Landmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.97}}
{"item_id": "B002YBJXB0", "title": "Foxpro Spitfire Digital High Performance Game call", "description": "Mimic the call of the wild the easy way with the Foxpro SpitFire digital high-performance game call. Bundled with a TX 24 transmitter and 24 high-quality Foxpro sounds--including coyotes (howls, screams, and challenges), foxes, bobcats, jackrabbits, cottontails, calves, fawns, voles, prairie dogs, raccoons, and more--the SpitFire puts you in the middle of the action.The SpitFire is made to last, with a rugged ABS injection-molded housing for superior strength and durability. Sound plays through the unit's single high-quality horn speaker, which produces loud, crisp audio that sounds just like your prey. You can also plug an additional speaker into the external speaker jack to increase your volume, or an approved auxiliary device--such as the Foxpro Jack-in-the-Box decoy--into the auxiliary jack.The TX-24 transmitter puts the full control of the SpitFire at your fingertips. The transmitter boasts an LCD display that lists the sound you're playing and the volume level (with five volume steps). Pausing the sound is easy thanks to the mute button. Plus, when you un-mute the sound, it starts playing where you left off rather than starting over. More significantly, the SpitFire works at ranges of 100-plus yards, so you can locate the speaker in a remote location and settle into your blind a football field away, if necessary.The SpitFire runs on 4 AA batteries (alkaline recommended), with a runtime of 20 to 24 hours on a single set. The TX-24, meanwhile, operates off a single 9-volt alkaline battery, with runtimes of 100-plus hours. It's also easy to add or make changes to the sounds, as they're stored on a MicroSD card (the SpitFire supports Foxpro's FXP audio files along with MP3 and WAV files). When you're ready to upload the sound list to the TX-24, simply use the upload jack located on the side of the transmitter.Other features include a speaker on/off slide switch for disabling the internal speaker, a low battery/pilot light, and a tripod mount. The SpitFire carries a one-year manufacturer's warranty.", "text": "Foxpro Spitfire Digital High Performance Game call Mimic the call of the wild the easy way with the Foxpro SpitFire digital high-performance game call. Bundled with a TX 24 transmitter and 24 high-quality Foxpro sounds--including coyotes (howls, screams, and challenges), foxes, bobcats, jackrabbits, cottontails, calves, fawns, voles, prairie dogs, raccoons, and more--the SpitFire puts you in the middle of the action.The SpitFire is made to last, with a rugged ABS injection-molded housing for superior strength and durability. Sound plays through the unit's single high-quality horn speaker, which produces loud, crisp audio that sounds just like your prey. You can also plug an additional speaker into the external speaker jack to increase your volume, or an approved auxiliary device--such as the Foxpro Jack-in-the-Box decoy--into the auxiliary jack.The TX-24 transmitter puts the full control of the SpitFire at your fingertips. The transmitter boasts an LCD display that lists the sound you're playing and the volume level (with five volume steps). Pausing the sound is easy thanks to the mute button. Plus, when you un-mute the sound, it starts playing where you left off rather than starting over. More significantly, the SpitFire works at ranges of 100-plus yards, so you can locate the speaker in a remote location and settle into your blind a football field away, if necessary.The SpitFire runs on 4 AA batteries (alkaline recommended), with a runtime of 20 to 24 hours on a single set. The TX-24, meanwhile, operates off a single 9-volt alkaline battery, with runtimes of 100-plus hours. It's also easy to add or make changes to the sounds, as they're stored on a MicroSD card (the SpitFire supports Foxpro's FXP audio files along with MP3 and WAV files). When you're ready to upload the sound list to the TX-24, simply use the upload jack located on the side of the transmitter.Other features include a speaker on/off slide switch for disabling the internal speaker, a low battery/pilot light, and a tripod mount. The SpitFire carries a one-year manufacturer's warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FI3HYxwmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YBJXB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Big Game Calls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002YEFY8I", "title": "Portland Design Works Shiny Object CO2 Inflator with 16G Cartridge", "description": "The Shiny Object CO2 Inflator from Portland Design Works liberates you from hand pumps and stand-up pumps with quick CO2 inflation. The Shiny Object attaches to any threaded CO2 cartridge and allows you to slowly release air into your tire with the control knob. The inflator works with Presta and Schrader valves and comes with a 16-gram CO2 cartridge included. The Shiny Object fits neatly into its stitched leather sleeve, is constructed of sturdy alloy for long term use, and carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Portland Design Works.The powerful yet diminutive Shiny Object fits in the palm of your hand.Specifications:Inflator height: 1.75 inchesLeather sleeve length: 2.25 inchesWeight (including cartridge): 80 gramsWhat's in the Box?CO2 Inflator, 16-gram CO2 cartridge, stitched leather sleeve", "text": "Portland Design Works Shiny Object CO2 Inflator with 16G Cartridge The Shiny Object CO2 Inflator from Portland Design Works liberates you from hand pumps and stand-up pumps with quick CO2 inflation. The Shiny Object attaches to any threaded CO2 cartridge and allows you to slowly release air into your tire with the control knob. The inflator works with Presta and Schrader valves and comes with a 16-gram CO2 cartridge included. The Shiny Object fits neatly into its stitched leather sleeve, is constructed of sturdy alloy for long term use, and carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Portland Design Works.The powerful yet diminutive Shiny Object fits in the palm of your hand.Specifications:Inflator height: 1.75 inchesLeather sleeve length: 2.25 inchesWeight (including cartridge): 80 gramsWhat's in the Box?CO2 Inflator, 16-gram CO2 cartridge, stitched leather sleeve", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gyHGpWa0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YEFY8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Portland Design Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 26.0}}
