{"item_id": "B002YJ1Y1O", "title": "Louis Garneau Men's 0 Calory Glove Cycling Glove", "description": "The Louis Garneau Men's 0 Calory Glove Cycling Glove are lightweight and comfortable and let you stay focused on race day. The upper hand is made with Lycra (75% Polyester/25% Lycra) fabric that has fantastic stretch recovery and the palm with foam padding offers unbeatable comfort and is made with Amara (40% Polyurethane/60% Polyester) fabric that is extremely water resistant and durable. Ergo Air Zone provides ventilation for maximum airflow during your ride. Microfiber thumb absorbs excess sweat and drips. Puller at fingers for easy-on, easy-off convenience. Sizing (Palm Circumference):S: 7-8\", M: 8-9\", L: 9-10\", XL: 10-11\", XXL: 11+\".", "text": "Louis Garneau Men's 0 Calory Glove Cycling Glove The Louis Garneau Men's 0 Calory Glove Cycling Glove are lightweight and comfortable and let you stay focused on race day. The upper hand is made with Lycra (75% Polyester/25% Lycra) fabric that has fantastic stretch recovery and the palm with foam padding offers unbeatable comfort and is made with Amara (40% Polyurethane/60% Polyester) fabric that is extremely water resistant and durable. Ergo Air Zone provides ventilation for maximum airflow during your ride. Microfiber thumb absorbs excess sweat and drips. Puller at fingers for easy-on, easy-off convenience. Sizing (Palm Circumference):S: 7-8\", M: 8-9\", L: 9-10\", XL: 10-11\", XXL: 11+\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BOFRFhlzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YJ1Y1O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
