{"item_id": "B002YMHGBI", "title": "Igloo Parts Kit for Ice Chests", "description": "When your Igloo cooler gets damaged, this affordably-priced repair kit not only keeps it out of a landfill or recycle center, but it also saves you the cost of a replacement cooler. The universal design of Igloo's hinges and latches makes them interchangeable, allowing you to retrofit all current and original Igloo hinges and latches when needed.The kit contains:Four hinges that fit 25-165-quart Igloo coolersTwo latches and two latch posts that fit 60-165-quart Igloo coolersOne push-on triple snap drain plug that fits 25-70-quart Igloo coolersOne screw-on cap, with threaded drain plug that fits 70-165-quart Igloo coolers24 screwsWarrantyThis Igloo product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About IglooIgloo has been one of the leading cooler brands for more than 60 years, since essentially originating the product category in 1947.", "text": "Igloo Parts Kit for Ice Chests When your Igloo cooler gets damaged, this affordably-priced repair kit not only keeps it out of a landfill or recycle center, but it also saves you the cost of a replacement cooler. The universal design of Igloo's hinges and latches makes them interchangeable, allowing you to retrofit all current and original Igloo hinges and latches when needed.The kit contains:Four hinges that fit 25-165-quart Igloo coolersTwo latches and two latch posts that fit 60-165-quart Igloo coolersOne push-on triple snap drain plug that fits 25-70-quart Igloo coolersOne screw-on cap, with threaded drain plug that fits 70-165-quart Igloo coolers24 screwsWarrantyThis Igloo product includes a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About IglooIgloo has been one of the leading cooler brands for more than 60 years, since essentially originating the product category in 1947.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bv5OBYFlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YMHGBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Igloo Products Corp.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 18.15}}
{"item_id": "B002YO51W2", "title": "Centurion 12 Gun Safe by Liberty Safe", "description": "Protect your firearms and valuables with Liberty Safe's Centurion 12-gun safe. It features a 14-gauge 3-piece body with a textured black finish and handsome chrome hardware. Four active locking pins combine with a 3-number combination lock to provide unbeatable security, while the 1\" composite fire door is capable of safeguarding your possessions for 20 minutes at 1200F.", "text": "Centurion 12 Gun Safe by Liberty Safe Protect your firearms and valuables with Liberty Safe's Centurion 12-gun safe. It features a 14-gauge 3-piece body with a textured black finish and handsome chrome hardware. Four active locking pins combine with a 3-number combination lock to provide unbeatable security, while the 1\" composite fire door is capable of safeguarding your possessions for 20 minutes at 1200F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xcu97mhsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YO51W2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 19.87}}
{"item_id": "B002YOKWGW", "title": "Benchmade Model 30200 - Houdini-Pro Rescue Hook Tool, Yellow", "description": "The illustrated Benchmade Knife is the Benchmade Houdini Pro Knife that features a rescue hook blade made of 9Cr13CoMoV stainless steel, .10-Inch thick, with a Rockwell hardness of 57-58. The blade of this Benchmade knife has a .50-Inch opening and a thumb stud for one hand deployment. The textured bright yellow synthetic handle, 4.67-Inch closed, has a switch activated LED light that shines on what is to be cut, a spring loaded glass breaker and a lockback. A removable black steel pocket clip is mounted at the pivot end of this Benchmade knife, and a black nylon sheath with Velcro closure is included. The Benchmade Houdini Pro Knife has an overall open length of 5.90-Inch, and weighs 3.60 ounces", "text": "Benchmade Model 30200 - Houdini-Pro Rescue Hook Tool, Yellow The illustrated Benchmade Knife is the Benchmade Houdini Pro Knife that features a rescue hook blade made of 9Cr13CoMoV stainless steel, .10-Inch thick, with a Rockwell hardness of 57-58. The blade of this Benchmade knife has a .50-Inch opening and a thumb stud for one hand deployment. The textured bright yellow synthetic handle, 4.67-Inch closed, has a switch activated LED light that shines on what is to be cut, a spring loaded glass breaker and a lockback. A removable black steel pocket clip is mounted at the pivot end of this Benchmade knife, and a black nylon sheath with Velcro closure is included. The Benchmade Houdini Pro Knife has an overall open length of 5.90-Inch, and weighs 3.60 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VM%2BTPw-yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YOKWGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 38.25}}
