{"item_id": "B002YQUP7Q", "title": "ProSource Heavy-Duty Easy Gym Doorway Chin-Up/Pull-Up Bar", "description": "The Heavy Duty Easy Gym Doorway Chin-up Pull-up Bar from ProSource provides an inexpensive way to tone and build muscles at home, without large equipment or marring your doorframe with installation screws. Designed to slip into doorways from 24 to 32 inches wide, the Easy Gym can be installed anywhere you have a sturdy doorframe. But, if you have a permanent location in mind, the gym can also be mounted to the wall with the optional, included wall brackets. Thanks to the gym's multi-position design, you will be able to develop your back, chest, shoulders, arms, and abdominal compound muscles with one simple piece of equipment. In addition to traditional pull-ups and chin-ups, the bar allows you to perform closed-wide angle and hammer grips as well as multiple leg raises and oblique curls. Built to last, the Easy Gym is constructed of high-grade steel with ProSource Comfort Grip technology for a secure and pain-free grip. The bar's maximum weight capacity is 300 pounds within a sturdy doorframe.", "text": "ProSource Heavy-Duty Easy Gym Doorway Chin-Up/Pull-Up Bar The Heavy Duty Easy Gym Doorway Chin-up Pull-up Bar from ProSource provides an inexpensive way to tone and build muscles at home, without large equipment or marring your doorframe with installation screws. Designed to slip into doorways from 24 to 32 inches wide, the Easy Gym can be installed anywhere you have a sturdy doorframe. But, if you have a permanent location in mind, the gym can also be mounted to the wall with the optional, included wall brackets. Thanks to the gym's multi-position design, you will be able to develop your back, chest, shoulders, arms, and abdominal compound muscles with one simple piece of equipment. In addition to traditional pull-ups and chin-ups, the bar allows you to perform closed-wide angle and hammer grips as well as multiple leg raises and oblique curls. Built to last, the Easy Gym is constructed of high-grade steel with ProSource Comfort Grip technology for a secure and pain-free grip. The bar's maximum weight capacity is 300 pounds within a sturdy doorframe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41daqGgtdLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YQUP7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 26.69}}
{"item_id": "B002YRB35I", "title": "TRX Suspension Trainer Basic Kit + Door Anchor", "description": "Build strength, power and mobility from any door in your home, with the TRX Pro Pack Home Suspension Training Program. Weighing less than 2-pounds and fitting inside a lunch bag, this innovative home gym builds strength, increases flexibility, and develops core stability and power--anytime you want, anywhere you want. All you need is a door, a tree branch, or any number of easy anchor points.The Pro Pack with Door Anchor includes the TRX Suspension Training P2 Model used by pro-athletes, the US military, and top trainers everywhere. Rated for up to 1000 pounds the system mounts to any sturdy door with the TRX Door Anchor. A 65-minute Basic Training DVD and full-color 35-page Workout Guide get you started and 2 bonus workouts--the TRX Endurance Circuit and the TRX Metabolic Blast--keep you on the path to greater strength and fitness.What's in the Box?TRX Suspension Training P2 Model, TRX Door Anchor, 65-minute Basic Training DVD, full-color 35 page Workout Guide (found inside the DVD case), TRX Endurance Circuit and TRX Metabolic Blast bonus workouts, TRX Mesh Carrying Bag", "text": "TRX Suspension Trainer Basic Kit + Door Anchor Build strength, power and mobility from any door in your home, with the TRX Pro Pack Home Suspension Training Program. Weighing less than 2-pounds and fitting inside a lunch bag, this innovative home gym builds strength, increases flexibility, and develops core stability and power--anytime you want, anywhere you want. All you need is a door, a tree branch, or any number of easy anchor points.The Pro Pack with Door Anchor includes the TRX Suspension Training P2 Model used by pro-athletes, the US military, and top trainers everywhere. Rated for up to 1000 pounds the system mounts to any sturdy door with the TRX Door Anchor. A 65-minute Basic Training DVD and full-color 35-page Workout Guide get you started and 2 bonus workouts--the TRX Endurance Circuit and the TRX Metabolic Blast--keep you on the path to greater strength and fitness.What's in the Box?TRX Suspension Training P2 Model, TRX Door Anchor, 65-minute Basic Training DVD, full-color 35 page Workout Guide (found inside the DVD case), TRX Endurance Circuit and TRX Metabolic Blast bonus workouts, TRX Mesh Carrying Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VA503RytL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YRB35I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TRX", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 180.99}}
{"item_id": "B002YSN5W6", "title": "Ibera PakRak Bicycle Seat Post Commuter Rack and Quick-Release Bag", "description": "Handy carry strap, Detachable shoulder strap. Reflective strips for night protection. Tail light hanger. Large compartment with inner mesh pocket. 2 side pockets, rear pocket, top pouch with external bungee cords. ABS base, 1680 nylon. Quick-release bag mounting system only works with IBERA Rack.Carries up to 10 kg (22 pound), Rubber sizing shims included, Reflector attachable, TIG-welded, heat-treated, anodized aluminum.", "text": "Ibera PakRak Bicycle Seat Post Commuter Rack and Quick-Release Bag Handy carry strap, Detachable shoulder strap. Reflective strips for night protection. Tail light hanger. Large compartment with inner mesh pocket. 2 side pockets, rear pocket, top pouch with external bungee cords. ABS base, 1680 nylon. Quick-release bag mounting system only works with IBERA Rack.Carries up to 10 kg (22 pound), Rubber sizing shims included, Reflector attachable, TIG-welded, heat-treated, anodized aluminum.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OoVpcmSdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YSN5W6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 82.38}}
{"item_id": "B002YT2CFG", "title": "GSI Outdoors Stainless Steel Nesting Wine Goblet", "description": "It may not be crystal, but the GSI Outdoors Stainless Steel Nesting Wine Goblet is a whole lot more practical around the cabin or camp, when it's time to break open the cabernet while you sit back and enjoy the sunset. Practical design for easy packing.Polished finish will not rust, tarnish or corrode..Surface is non-scratching, tough, and wear resistant..Base snaps into rim for efficient packing and storing..Stable, non-slip base..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Stainless Steel Nesting Wine Goblet It may not be crystal, but the GSI Outdoors Stainless Steel Nesting Wine Goblet is a whole lot more practical around the cabin or camp, when it's time to break open the cabernet while you sit back and enjoy the sunset. Practical design for easy packing.Polished finish will not rust, tarnish or corrode..Surface is non-scratching, tough, and wear resistant..Base snaps into rim for efficient packing and storing..Stable, non-slip base..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wu60-IetL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YT2CFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B002YT2CII", "title": "GSI Outdoors Collapsible Java Drip", "description": "Don't settle for instant, when you're on the trail or in camp. Pack a GSI Outdoors Collapsible Java Drip on your next outing, and enjoy freshly brewed coffee, just as you would at home. Folds flat, weighs next to nothing, for easy packing.Collapsible drip cone holds #4 filter to brew 1 to 12 cups of coffee..Unique flanged design helps center drip cone over mugs, cups and wide-mouth bottles for stable, spill-free brewing..Lid doubles as a trivet after brewing..Product Use: Car Camping,Gourmet Backpacking..", "text": "GSI Outdoors Collapsible Java Drip Don't settle for instant, when you're on the trail or in camp. Pack a GSI Outdoors Collapsible Java Drip on your next outing, and enjoy freshly brewed coffee, just as you would at home. Folds flat, weighs next to nothing, for easy packing.Collapsible drip cone holds #4 filter to brew 1 to 12 cups of coffee..Unique flanged design helps center drip cone over mugs, cups and wide-mouth bottles for stable, spill-free brewing..Lid doubles as a trivet after brewing..Product Use: Car Camping,Gourmet Backpacking..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ez-vC6daL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YT2CII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B002YT2COM", "title": "", "description": "How could we improve the almost magical mealtime mug that is our original fairshare - by making in infinitely more flexible. With a folding handle that locks in two places, a collapsible, silicone body which expands from an easy- packing 1.7\" high to a generous 22 fl oz capacity and a reduced weight we have perfected a design original finally making it accessible to all.", "text": "How could we improve the almost magical mealtime mug that is our original fairshare - by making in infinitely more flexible. With a folding handle that locks in two places, a collapsible, silicone body which expands from an easy- packing 1.7\" high to a generous 22 fl oz capacity and a reduced weight we have perfected a design original finally making it accessible to all.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4173QSffJVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YT2COM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 52.95}}
{"item_id": "B002YWHEVU", "title": "Camelbak Better 1L Bottle, Forest", "description": "The Spill-Proof Bottle that makes it easy to stay hydrated on the go.", "text": "Camelbak Better 1L Bottle, Forest The Spill-Proof Bottle that makes it easy to stay hydrated on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SqX%2BYX%2BOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YWHEVU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002YXR766", "title": "Coleman 2000003098 Pack-Away Outdoor 4-in-1 Table", "description": "Pack Away 4 In 1 Table, 2 Separate 18\" Tables Can Be Used Separately Or Together In Multiple Configurations & Heights, Moisture Resistant Tabletop On A Lightweight, Sturdy Aluminum Frame, Lightweight For Easy Transport & Set Up, Table Adjusts To 3 Different Heights, Folds In Half For Easy Storage, Table Weight Capacity 300 LB.", "text": "Coleman 2000003098 Pack-Away Outdoor 4-in-1 Table Pack Away 4 In 1 Table, 2 Separate 18\" Tables Can Be Used Separately Or Together In Multiple Configurations & Heights, Moisture Resistant Tabletop On A Lightweight, Sturdy Aluminum Frame, Lightweight For Easy Transport & Set Up, Table Adjusts To 3 Different Heights, Folds In Half For Easy Storage, Table Weight Capacity 300 LB.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417bpKQtOfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YXR766.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 67.7}}
{"item_id": "B002YY1PUO", "title": "Kelty Gunnison 3-Person Tent", "description": "When the weather turns wet, a full-coverage rainfly goes on in minutes, and keeps the tent's interior completely dry while still allowing sufficient ventilation.Kelty produces outdoor equipment, backed by a limited lifetime warranty, that's built to withstand the punishment dished out by active outdoor enthusiasts. The Gunnison 3.1 tent is a fairly recent addition to the company's popular series of the same name, and earned a \"2009 Best All-around\" award fromBackpackermagazine, as well as a \"2009 Great Buy\" nod fromOutdoor Life.A spacious three-person, three-season home away from home, the 3.1 boasts 48 square feet of interior space to spread out sleeping bags, gear, and sleepy campers. Two vestibules and two doors make for easy in-and-out, and the air always stays fresh thanks to ample mesh material in the roof and walls. If the weather should turns damp--or more privacy is desired--the full coverage rainfly goes on in just moments, and still lets air circulate.Body FeaturesFreestanding dome designArcEdge floor with taped seamsMesh wall panels and internal storage pocketsClip constructionITW stakeoutsRainfly FeaturesFully-taped seamsSide-release buckle tent-fly connectionFly ventsNoiseless zipper pullsGuyout pointsMaterialsTwo DAC Featherlite NSL poles with swivel hub70-denier DyeFree polyester taffeta walls1,800-millimeter-rated polyurethane taffeta floor and flySpecificationsThree-season, three-person tentTwo doors and two ten-square-foot vestibulesFive-pound, 14-ounce minimum weightSix-pound, eight-ounce total weightMeasures 75 by 46 by 92 inches (W x H x D)48-square-foot floorMeasures eight by 28 inches (W x D) packedLifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "text": "Kelty Gunnison 3-Person Tent When the weather turns wet, a full-coverage rainfly goes on in minutes, and keeps the tent's interior completely dry while still allowing sufficient ventilation.Kelty produces outdoor equipment, backed by a limited lifetime warranty, that's built to withstand the punishment dished out by active outdoor enthusiasts. The Gunnison 3.1 tent is a fairly recent addition to the company's popular series of the same name, and earned a \"2009 Best All-around\" award fromBackpackermagazine, as well as a \"2009 Great Buy\" nod fromOutdoor Life.A spacious three-person, three-season home away from home, the 3.1 boasts 48 square feet of interior space to spread out sleeping bags, gear, and sleepy campers. Two vestibules and two doors make for easy in-and-out, and the air always stays fresh thanks to ample mesh material in the roof and walls. If the weather should turns damp--or more privacy is desired--the full coverage rainfly goes on in just moments, and still lets air circulate.Body FeaturesFreestanding dome designArcEdge floor with taped seamsMesh wall panels and internal storage pocketsClip constructionITW stakeoutsRainfly FeaturesFully-taped seamsSide-release buckle tent-fly connectionFly ventsNoiseless zipper pullsGuyout pointsMaterialsTwo DAC Featherlite NSL poles with swivel hub70-denier DyeFree polyester taffeta walls1,800-millimeter-rated polyurethane taffeta floor and flySpecificationsThree-season, three-person tentTwo doors and two ten-square-foot vestibulesFive-pound, 14-ounce minimum weightSix-pound, eight-ounce total weightMeasures 75 by 46 by 92 inches (W x H x D)48-square-foot floorMeasures eight by 28 inches (W x D) packedLifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tkp8VXCOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002YY1PUO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 199.33}}
{"item_id": "B002Z4JGL8", "title": "Pellet Pen, Holds 20 .177-cal Pellets", "description": "Correct pellet orientation every time Fastest loading & shooting Maximum stealth while hunting Holds 20 pellets Load your gun even while wearing gloves No fumbling with awkward pellet containers in the field Designed for .177-cal breakbarrel air rifles and pistols Any .177 pellet fits!", "text": "Pellet Pen, Holds 20 .177-cal Pellets Correct pellet orientation every time Fastest loading & shooting Maximum stealth while hunting Holds 20 pellets Load your gun even while wearing gloves No fumbling with awkward pellet containers in the field Designed for .177-cal breakbarrel air rifles and pistols Any .177 pellet fits!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WfnHqyehL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Z4JGL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pellet Pen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B002Z4KR70", "title": "Alps Mountaineering - Razor Summer Sleep Bag", "description": "The Razor is a mummy version of our Fleece Cover. It can be used year round as an accessory or as a standalone bag. It is a great accessory, even if you already have several bags. It can help add extra warmth on those extra cold nights. As a standalone bag, it can be used in warmer temperatures when you only need a very lightweight bag. With a bag that works, whether it is warm or cold, and with mummy or rectangle bags, you can't go wrong with this choice... a value that lasts all year long!", "text": "Alps Mountaineering - Razor Summer Sleep Bag The Razor is a mummy version of our Fleece Cover. It can be used year round as an accessory or as a standalone bag. It is a great accessory, even if you already have several bags. It can help add extra warmth on those extra cold nights. As a standalone bag, it can be used in warmer temperatures when you only need a very lightweight bag. With a bag that works, whether it is warm or cold, and with mummy or rectangle bags, you can't go wrong with this choice... a value that lasts all year long!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j-KMsNu6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Z4KR70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 68.99}}
{"item_id": "B002Z7WSJM", "title": "Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove", "description": "FEATURES of the Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove 8,000 BTU burner Porcelain drip tray for easy clean up Matchless ignition Convenient carry case The SPECS of the Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 14.5 x 12.5 x 3.5\" Box Weight: 5 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove FEATURES of the Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove 8,000 BTU burner Porcelain drip tray for easy clean up Matchless ignition Convenient carry case The SPECS of the Camp Chef Mountain Series Butane 1 Burner Stove Box Dimension: (L x W x H): 14.5 x 12.5 x 3.5\" Box Weight: 5 lbs This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DiYMA7%2BjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002Z7WSJM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B002ZC50PG", "title": "Everlast ProTex2 EverGel Training Gloves", "description": "ProTex2 Gloves with EverGel infused into the glove where the protection is needed most! Designed for the serious athlete with maximum wrist protection.", "text": "Everlast ProTex2 EverGel Training Gloves ProTex2 Gloves with EverGel infused into the glove where the protection is needed most! Designed for the serious athlete with maximum wrist protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412oF-QoxNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZC50PG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B002ZFH696", "title": "Acclaim Double Black Kickstand", "description": "Acclaim Double Leg Kickstand - Heavy duty, bottom bracket mount, double legs for extra support for big bikes and heavy loads, aluminum alloy, rubber feet, adjusts to fit 24\"-26\"-700c, black", "text": "Acclaim Double Black Kickstand Acclaim Double Leg Kickstand - Heavy duty, bottom bracket mount, double legs for extra support for big bikes and heavy loads, aluminum alloy, rubber feet, adjusts to fit 24\"-26\"-700c, black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XlJyA6GuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZFH696.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Action", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B002ZFHPXS", "title": "Cressi Palau Long Fins, Focus Mask, Dry Snorkel, Snorkeling Gear Package", "description": "Palau opens the way for a new type of snorkelling and swimming fin. In actual fact, it has been designed for two specific needs. The first was to have a foot pocket that could easily adapt to at least three or four consecutive sizes so that the same fin could be used by all the members of a family, or by a group of friends or easily rented out in a diving centre or on a charter boat, without requiring an infinite number of sizes. The second need was that of guaranteeing extreme comfort and an easy fit even if this is a fin with a strap to be worn with bare feet. The result is a fin that is extraordinarily practical, that adapts to practically any foot and that allows for very quick fitting in any situation. The blade is made from a light yet responsive material that assures a kick that is fluid, effortless yet at the same time quite powerful. The strap has a strong ring on the upper part to allow reversal of the strap itself or to fix the fins to the body or the equipment.", "text": "Cressi Palau Long Fins, Focus Mask, Dry Snorkel, Snorkeling Gear Package Palau opens the way for a new type of snorkelling and swimming fin. In actual fact, it has been designed for two specific needs. The first was to have a foot pocket that could easily adapt to at least three or four consecutive sizes so that the same fin could be used by all the members of a family, or by a group of friends or easily rented out in a diving centre or on a charter boat, without requiring an infinite number of sizes. The second need was that of guaranteeing extreme comfort and an easy fit even if this is a fin with a strap to be worn with bare feet. The result is a fin that is extraordinarily practical, that adapts to practically any foot and that allows for very quick fitting in any situation. The blade is made from a light yet responsive material that assures a kick that is fluid, effortless yet at the same time quite powerful. The strap has a strong ring on the upper part to allow reversal of the strap itself or to fix the fins to the body or the equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IC5FFgAtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZFHPXS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ZG7RCG", "title": "Chaos -CTR Chinook Micro Fleece Neck Gaiter/Tube, Black, One Size", "description": "Protect your neck from the harshest elements with the Chaos CTR Chinook micro-fleece neck gaiter/ tube. CTR stands for Chaos Thermal Regulation, a line of apparel that's extra-warm and soft. The Chinook neck gaiter lives up to the name with its 100-percent polyester Micro Flex four-way stretch fleece, which is lightweight, cozy, and extremely comfortable against the skin. The gaiter also includes a shaped bottom that provides full coverage while preventing excessive gathering. The Chinook gaiter is machine-washable but should be line dried.", "text": "Chaos -CTR Chinook Micro Fleece Neck Gaiter/Tube, Black, One Size Protect your neck from the harshest elements with the Chaos CTR Chinook micro-fleece neck gaiter/ tube. CTR stands for Chaos Thermal Regulation, a line of apparel that's extra-warm and soft. The Chinook neck gaiter lives up to the name with its 100-percent polyester Micro Flex four-way stretch fleece, which is lightweight, cozy, and extremely comfortable against the skin. The gaiter also includes a shaped bottom that provides full coverage while preventing excessive gathering. The Chinook gaiter is machine-washable but should be line dried.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YyXbLucpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZG7RCG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men"]], "price": 7.2}}
{"item_id": "B002ZHS6JS", "title": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Day Pack (20-Liter)", "description": "This bag is great as a summit pack, for carrying groceries, or as an extra traveling tote. When packed into the attached mini stuff sack, it's easy to take anywhere. It is strong, yet compact and light; a must have for everyone from backpackers to moms.", "text": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Day Pack (20-Liter) This bag is great as a summit pack, for carrying groceries, or as an extra traveling tote. When packed into the attached mini stuff sack, it's easy to take anywhere. It is strong, yet compact and light; a must have for everyone from backpackers to moms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-iv9isd5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZHS6JS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ZIB4DW", "title": "Nathan Speed 2R Auto-Cant Waist Pack with Two 8-Ounce Nutrition Flasks", "description": "The first custom-fitting pak from Nathan, with a patent-pending Auto-Cant Disk that instantly adjusts the position of the Flasks while a canted, limited-stretch belt solidly holds the pack in the desired position on the body.Instant-access Power Stretch Mesh pocket with interior flat pocket secures gear and fuel.Flasks angle depending on body shape and the pak's position on the body so they are always easy to remove and never in the way of your arm swing. The Velcro-fastened Titanium belt features two 8-ounce flasks with race caps, angled and streamlined molded holsters, an instant access Power Stretch mesh pocket with an interior flat pocket, and an incorporated waterproof I.D./medical emergency card.Features:Auto-Cant Disk for custom fitCanted, limited-stretch elasticized Velcro-fastened Titanium beltTwo 8-ounce Nutrition Flasks with Race CapAngled, streamlined molded holstersInstant-access Power Stretch Mesh pocket; interior flat pocketIncorporated, waterproof I.D./medical emergency cardWeighs 7.2 ouncesThree sizes: Small 26-32 inches; Medium 32-36 inches, Large 36-42 inches", "text": "Nathan Speed 2R Auto-Cant Waist Pack with Two 8-Ounce Nutrition Flasks The first custom-fitting pak from Nathan, with a patent-pending Auto-Cant Disk that instantly adjusts the position of the Flasks while a canted, limited-stretch belt solidly holds the pack in the desired position on the body.Instant-access Power Stretch Mesh pocket with interior flat pocket secures gear and fuel.Flasks angle depending on body shape and the pak's position on the body so they are always easy to remove and never in the way of your arm swing. The Velcro-fastened Titanium belt features two 8-ounce flasks with race caps, angled and streamlined molded holsters, an instant access Power Stretch mesh pocket with an interior flat pocket, and an incorporated waterproof I.D./medical emergency card.Features:Auto-Cant Disk for custom fitCanted, limited-stretch elasticized Velcro-fastened Titanium beltTwo 8-ounce Nutrition Flasks with Race CapAngled, streamlined molded holstersInstant-access Power Stretch Mesh pocket; interior flat pocketIncorporated, waterproof I.D./medical emergency cardWeighs 7.2 ouncesThree sizes: Small 26-32 inches; Medium 32-36 inches, Large 36-42 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F1MDLiZaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZIB4DW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]]}}
