{"item_id": "B002ZNA488", "title": "Cat Crap", "description": "Cleans and polishes glass and plastic. Repels lint and dust. Prevents fogging of lenses. Great for eyeglasses, ski goggles, swim goggles, face shields, sunglasses and binocular lenses. Available in Blister pack or Litter Box (which holds 24).", "text": "Cat Crap Cleans and polishes glass and plastic. Repels lint and dust. Prevents fogging of lenses. Great for eyeglasses, ski goggles, swim goggles, face shields, sunglasses and binocular lenses. Available in Blister pack or Litter Box (which holds 24).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SGbye697L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZNA488.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EK", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.15}}
