{"item_id": "B002ZQOGF2", "title": "Two Pack of MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader 100 Rds", "description": "Value pack of Two Airsoft Speed Loader by MetalTac. MetalTac Loader comes with Pistol Adaptor for pistol mag and other varies of airsoft magazine to give you a quick reload. Using the pump to reload faster. Forget those days with pushing in your bb to the mag one by one. This loader is Essential airsoft accessory for everyone who owns an airsoft gun. Look for Authorized MetalTac Dealer to get Genuine product with Warranty.", "text": "Two Pack of MetalTac Airsoft Speed Loader 100 Rds Value pack of Two Airsoft Speed Loader by MetalTac. MetalTac Loader comes with Pistol Adaptor for pistol mag and other varies of airsoft magazine to give you a quick reload. Using the pump to reload faster. Forget those days with pushing in your bb to the mag one by one. This loader is Essential airsoft accessory for everyone who owns an airsoft gun. Look for Authorized MetalTac Dealer to get Genuine product with Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yZTmd-ZuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZQOGF2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 1.99}}
