{"item_id": "B002ZVFF20", "title": "Aim Sports Red Dot Sight with 4 Different Reticles", "description": "The open sight lets you select from four different reticle patterns and seven unique brightness settings.Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this red dot sight from aptly named AIM Sports. In addition to windage and elevation adjustments, there are four different reticle patterns and seven brightness settings to choose from. Durable anodized aluminum is water- and shock-proof, and the unit mounts easily with a standard weaver rail base.Specifications1X magnification33-millimeter objective aperture24 x 34 objective diameterThree-inch length4.2-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports Red Dot Sight with 4 Different Reticles The open sight lets you select from four different reticle patterns and seven unique brightness settings.Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this red dot sight from aptly named AIM Sports. In addition to windage and elevation adjustments, there are four different reticle patterns and seven brightness settings to choose from. Durable anodized aluminum is water- and shock-proof, and the unit mounts easily with a standard weaver rail base.Specifications1X magnification33-millimeter objective aperture24 x 34 objective diameterThree-inch length4.2-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YuFlW-AyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVFF20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 20.99}}
