{"item_id": "B002ZVGV6Y", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse AK M16 Style Muzzle Brake", "description": "If you like the look of the traditional M16 birdcage but youre an AK owner, this is the item youve been waiting for. Designed to replicate the M16 flash hider, this AK muzzle device is a beefed-up version engineered to withstand the muzzle blast from the more powerful 7.62 x 39-mm rounds. Quality machined threads and multiple locking tabs make this muzzle attachment a breeze to install.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse AK M16 Style Muzzle Brake If you like the look of the traditional M16 birdcage but youre an AK owner, this is the item youve been waiting for. Designed to replicate the M16 flash hider, this AK muzzle device is a beefed-up version engineered to withstand the muzzle blast from the more powerful 7.62 x 39-mm rounds. Quality machined threads and multiple locking tabs make this muzzle attachment a breeze to install.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Smb2fLINL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVGV6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 16.6}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVIX8S", "title": "NcStar 7MM Remington Mag. Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ7MM)", "description": "Get your shots on paper the quick and easy way! NcSTAR introduces 3 New Cartridge Laser Bore Sighters added to the TLZ Line-up. TLZ300W for the .300 Winchester Mag. Cartridge TLZ7MM for the 7mm Remington Mag. Cartridge and TLZ3030 for the .30-30 Winchester cartridge. Just install the provided batteries and twist the cap on. Drop the laser into the chamber of your rifle and you have a laser that is projecting the exact alignment of the bore. This tool is extremely useful for initial scope sight in or to confirm zero before the big hunt. Made of durable aluminum the Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter is light weight yet tough as nails. Use it for your scopes red dot sights or even your iron sights!", "text": "NcStar 7MM Remington Mag. Cartridge Red Laser Bore Sighter (TLZ7MM) Get your shots on paper the quick and easy way! NcSTAR introduces 3 New Cartridge Laser Bore Sighters added to the TLZ Line-up. TLZ300W for the .300 Winchester Mag. Cartridge TLZ7MM for the 7mm Remington Mag. Cartridge and TLZ3030 for the .30-30 Winchester cartridge. Just install the provided batteries and twist the cap on. Drop the laser into the chamber of your rifle and you have a laser that is projecting the exact alignment of the bore. This tool is extremely useful for initial scope sight in or to confirm zero before the big hunt. Made of durable aluminum the Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter is light weight yet tough as nails. Use it for your scopes red dot sights or even your iron sights!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VKtLjm8bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVIX8S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVKMVY", "title": "Aim Sports Ar15 Stock Combo New Style Wrench Tool", "description": "AR15 STOCK COMBO WRENCH/NEW STYLE HEAVY DUTY MULTI TOOL LENGTH: 12.5\" WEIGHT (OZ): 20 FEATURES: CAR STOCK W/3 POINT CASTLE NUT/LOCKING RING FINISH: ALL STEEL CONSTRUCTION", "text": "Aim Sports Ar15 Stock Combo New Style Wrench Tool AR15 STOCK COMBO WRENCH/NEW STYLE HEAVY DUTY MULTI TOOL LENGTH: 12.5\" WEIGHT (OZ): 20 FEATURES: CAR STOCK W/3 POINT CASTLE NUT/LOCKING RING FINISH: ALL STEEL CONSTRUCTION", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jVBKgzmwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVKMVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 23.39}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVKTKI", "title": "Aim Sports Pistol/Rifle Laser Sight", "description": "Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this laser sight from aptly named AIM Sports. The compact laser's size, streamlined design, and light weight keeps a low profile atop the weapon, and it mounts easily via weaver-style mounts.Specifications635/655nm power wavelength5mW red laser2.25-inch lengthTwo-ounce weightLR44 battery14-to-113 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperature500-meter rangeLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports Pistol/Rifle Laser Sight Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this laser sight from aptly named AIM Sports. The compact laser's size, streamlined design, and light weight keeps a low profile atop the weapon, and it mounts easily via weaver-style mounts.Specifications635/655nm power wavelength5mW red laser2.25-inch lengthTwo-ounce weightLR44 battery14-to-113 degrees Fahrenheit operating temperature500-meter rangeLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MMZ3If3eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVKTKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 12.68}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVKUXY", "title": "Condor MA22 3 Fold Mag Recovery Pouch", "description": "Drawstring with cord lock. Double layered 600D Nylon with 420D Nylon packcloth closure. Two Grommets for drainage. Pouch rolls up and is held closed with 1 1/2\" x 2 1/2\" Velcro Tab. Measures 4\" x 10\" when folded.", "text": "Condor MA22 3 Fold Mag Recovery Pouch Drawstring with cord lock. Double layered 600D Nylon with 420D Nylon packcloth closure. Two Grommets for drainage. Pouch rolls up and is held closed with 1 1/2\" x 2 1/2\" Velcro Tab. Measures 4\" x 10\" when folded.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tjMvOwR9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVKUXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVMJ9W", "title": "Aim Sports Dual III. Sight with 4 Different Reticles", "description": "The reflex lens on this optical scope from aptly named AIM Sports provides a wide field of view, and is ideal for use in low light conditions. Shooters can choose from three different brightness settings, as well as a red or green reticle dot.Specifications1X magnification25-millimeter objective lens24 x 34 objective diameterUnlimited eye reliefThree-inch total length4.2-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports Dual III. Sight with 4 Different Reticles The reflex lens on this optical scope from aptly named AIM Sports provides a wide field of view, and is ideal for use in low light conditions. Shooters can choose from three different brightness settings, as well as a red or green reticle dot.Specifications1X magnification25-millimeter objective lens24 x 34 objective diameterUnlimited eye reliefThree-inch total length4.2-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YzQO7HIgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVMJ9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 27.01}}
