{"item_id": "B002ZVNOK0", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife 6 5/16-Inch Blade Jungle Bowie II High Carbon Steel with Black Leather Sheath", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife 6 5/16-Inch Blade Jungle Bowie II High Carbon Steel with Black Leather Sheath CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311txVgvVmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVNOK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 35.46}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVQL1E", "title": "NcSTAR Laser Boresighter, 7.62X39", "description": "A better way to zero! NcSTAR Laser Boresighter, SAVE BIG! Accurate, easy and convenient to operate. Just insert the batteries and twist on the end cap for a brilliant, perfectly straight, constant laser beam. Laser dot size at 100 yds. is 2\". Includes 3 LR41 button-style batteries for approx. 1 hour run time. A good tool to have in your kit, and now offered here for LESS! Please Note: The boresighters may come in silver or gold color depending on the caliber. Sorry, no choice. State Caliber. Order yours right now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. NcSTAR Laser Boresighter", "text": "NcSTAR Laser Boresighter, 7.62X39 A better way to zero! NcSTAR Laser Boresighter, SAVE BIG! Accurate, easy and convenient to operate. Just insert the batteries and twist on the end cap for a brilliant, perfectly straight, constant laser beam. Laser dot size at 100 yds. is 2\". Includes 3 LR41 button-style batteries for approx. 1 hour run time. A good tool to have in your kit, and now offered here for LESS! Please Note: The boresighters may come in silver or gold color depending on the caliber. Sorry, no choice. State Caliber. Order yours right now! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. NcSTAR Laser Boresighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m-0rNnNEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVQL1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B002ZVQMEU", "title": "Tapco Pack of 20 AR Gas Tube Mops", "description": "Proper cycling of your rifle depends on a clean gas system. They easily remove carbon deposits from within the gas tube and other hard to reach areas.", "text": "Tapco Pack of 20 AR Gas Tube Mops Proper cycling of your rifle depends on a clean gas system. They easily remove carbon deposits from within the gas tube and other hard to reach areas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21QuhxbvwhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZVQMEU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 5.64}}
{"item_id": "B002ZW7LHQ", "title": "Aqua Sphere Kayenne Goggle With Low Profile Lens (Smaller Fit)", "description": "The Kayenne opens up the playing field – quite literally. Oversized lenses with our patented curved lens technology gives you style while providing an undistorted, expanded, 180-degree field of vision. An all new super slim microframe keeps the goggle close to the face for superior, low-drag hydrodynamic performance. And an updated one-touch buckle makes fitting easier than ever. Pair these new technologies with Aqua Sphere’s standard UV protection, leak resistance, anti-fog and scratch resistant lenses, and the Kayenne is easily the most superior performance swim goggle available", "text": "Aqua Sphere Kayenne Goggle With Low Profile Lens (Smaller Fit) The Kayenne opens up the playing field – quite literally. Oversized lenses with our patented curved lens technology gives you style while providing an undistorted, expanded, 180-degree field of vision. An all new super slim microframe keeps the goggle close to the face for superior, low-drag hydrodynamic performance. And an updated one-touch buckle makes fitting easier than ever. Pair these new technologies with Aqua Sphere’s standard UV protection, leak resistance, anti-fog and scratch resistant lenses, and the Kayenne is easily the most superior performance swim goggle available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YoOQ708%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZW7LHQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 23.83}}
{"item_id": "B002ZWAZLA", "title": "Aqua Sphere Kayenne Lady Swim Goggle", "description": "Aqua Sphere engineered the new shape of the Kayenne gaskets in conjunction with its exclusive Softeril material to provide an Irritation free fit for swimmers. As a byproduct of this larger format design, the oversized lenses provide an undistorted and expanded 180-degree field of vision. The all new super slim micro-frame keeps the goggle close to the face for superior, hydrodynamic performance and integrates the new Quick-fit buckle system which makes fitting easier than ever. Pair these new technologies with Aqua Sphere’s standard UV protection, leak free fit, anti-fog and scratch resistant lenses, and the Kayenne is easily the most superior performance swim goggle available.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Kayenne Lady Swim Goggle Aqua Sphere engineered the new shape of the Kayenne gaskets in conjunction with its exclusive Softeril material to provide an Irritation free fit for swimmers. As a byproduct of this larger format design, the oversized lenses provide an undistorted and expanded 180-degree field of vision. The all new super slim micro-frame keeps the goggle close to the face for superior, hydrodynamic performance and integrates the new Quick-fit buckle system which makes fitting easier than ever. Pair these new technologies with Aqua Sphere’s standard UV protection, leak free fit, anti-fog and scratch resistant lenses, and the Kayenne is easily the most superior performance swim goggle available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LiWDIyemL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZWAZLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Lung America", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 16.42}}
{"item_id": "B002ZWWFGS", "title": "ProForm 290 SPX Indoor Cycle Trainer", "description": "ProForm 290 SPXGet an incredible workout with the ProForm 290 SPX, designed for performance and built for the ultimate cardio workout. Whether you are a weekend warrior or a first time fitness buyer, the 290 SPX is for you. Enjoy a top notch workout without leaving your home with the ProForm 290 SPX indoor cycle trainer.", "text": "ProForm 290 SPX Indoor Cycle Trainer ProForm 290 SPXGet an incredible workout with the ProForm 290 SPX, designed for performance and built for the ultimate cardio workout. Whether you are a weekend warrior or a first time fitness buyer, the 290 SPX is for you. Enjoy a top notch workout without leaving your home with the ProForm 290 SPX indoor cycle trainer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B2L35K4nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZWWFGS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 243.16}}
{"item_id": "B002ZYRV2E", "title": "OFF SET TACTICAL Weapon Mount For Olight M20/M21/M30, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21, JETBeam M1X/M2S/JET-III M/RRT-1/RRT-2 and many more 1\" Diameter size Flashlight", "description": "The UTAC (by Light Junction) Off-Set Weapon Mount by Light Junction is a heavy duty 1\" light mount designed for the M20 & M30 series flashlights, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21 flashlights. Constructed of aluminum with a black anodized finish for long lasting performance. Designed to be compatible with all weaver/picatinny style rails. Features large knurled knob for secure \"no-tool\" rail mounting. Includes flashlight mounting wrench. This mount will fit many of todays most popular tactical flashlights including: Olight M20 Warrior, Olight M30 Triton, Fenix TK10/11/12 TA21, Surefire 6P, G2 and many other 1\" diameter lights.", "text": "OFF SET TACTICAL Weapon Mount For Olight M20/M21/M30, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21, JETBeam M1X/M2S/JET-III M/RRT-1/RRT-2 and many more 1\" Diameter size Flashlight The UTAC (by Light Junction) Off-Set Weapon Mount by Light Junction is a heavy duty 1\" light mount designed for the M20 & M30 series flashlights, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21 flashlights. Constructed of aluminum with a black anodized finish for long lasting performance. Designed to be compatible with all weaver/picatinny style rails. Features large knurled knob for secure \"no-tool\" rail mounting. Includes flashlight mounting wrench. This mount will fit many of todays most popular tactical flashlights including: Olight M20 Warrior, Olight M30 Triton, Fenix TK10/11/12 TA21, Surefire 6P, G2 and many other 1\" diameter lights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LawEogOsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B002ZYRV2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LightJunction", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 4.65}}
{"item_id": "B00300CG5Y", "title": "Colt Defender Pistol (Black, Medium)", "description": "The Colt Defender BB Pistol has an all metal construction and a built in 16-shot BB magazine. The spring powered grip release and the CO2 compartment in the grip make this pistol extremely easy to operate. A fixed blade front sight makes aiming a breeze. Realistic weight of 1.6 lbs.", "text": "Colt Defender Pistol (Black, Medium) The Colt Defender BB Pistol has an all metal construction and a built in 16-shot BB magazine. The spring powered grip release and the CO2 compartment in the grip make this pistol extremely easy to operate. A fixed blade front sight makes aiming a breeze. Realistic weight of 1.6 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a%2Beuo6%2B5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00300CG5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Colt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 46.97}}
{"item_id": "B003029OU2", "title": "Soft Air Firepower Propane Adapter for Green Gas Guns", "description": "This durable metal adapter gives you great performance for the price. The fill tube is made of brass to prevent damage to your magazines while charging them. Power your gas airsoft gun with inexpensive propane. Reduce gas coats up to 90%! Enable disposable propane tanks to be used as alternative fuel on green gas Airsoft guns. Threads onto standard disposable propane tanks. This unit features:All metal constructionTextured finish for easy an easy gripBrass fill tube to prevent damage while filling your magazine.", "text": "Soft Air Firepower Propane Adapter for Green Gas Guns This durable metal adapter gives you great performance for the price. The fill tube is made of brass to prevent damage to your magazines while charging them. Power your gas airsoft gun with inexpensive propane. Reduce gas coats up to 90%! Enable disposable propane tanks to be used as alternative fuel on green gas Airsoft guns. Threads onto standard disposable propane tanks. This unit features:All metal constructionTextured finish for easy an easy gripBrass fill tube to prevent damage while filling your magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rrLNVK0ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003029OU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fire Power", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00305I2R0", "title": "Tru-Spec - 5971 MICH Helmet Cover 50/50 Nylon Cotton Rip-Stop (Multicam)", "description": "Made to US military specifications to fit MICH combat helmet", "text": "Tru-Spec - 5971 MICH Helmet Cover 50/50 Nylon Cotton Rip-Stop (Multicam) Made to US military specifications to fit MICH combat helmet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ca4mIjXDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00305I2R0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Protective Gear", "Batting Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00305K99Y", "title": "Magpul CTR Carbine Mil-Spec Buttstock - Black", "description": "The Magpul CTR (Compact/Type Restricted) - Mil-Spec Model is a drop-in replacement buttstock for AR15/M16 carbines using mil-spec sized receiver extension tubes. Designed for light, fast action the streamlined A-frame profile avoids snagging and shields the release latch to prevent accidental activation. The CTR also features a supplemental friction lock system that minimizes excessive stock movement for enhanced weapon stability* and an ambidextrous QD sling mount that will accept any push-button sling swivel. The Mil-Spec Model includes a standard 0.30\" rubber butt-pad which provides positive shoulder purchase to prevent slippage even with body armor or modular gear. Made in U.S.A. Features Mounts on mil-spec sized carbine receiver extension tube (not included) from manufacturers such as Colt, Armalite, S&W;, LMT, and others (please see the note below) Supplemental friction lock minimizes accuracy robbing wobble* Sloping cheek weld combines a slim profile with user comfort Shielded release latch prevents snagging and accidental operation Premium chrome-silicon lock spring provides positive locking and long service life Side mounting slots accept optional cheek risers for NON-AR15/M16 applications Removable 0.30\" Rubber Butt-Pad offers an anti-slip surface and increases impact protection Compatible with Magpul ASAP and other receiver-mount sling attachments Sling Mounts Rear - Push-button QD swivel sling mount accommodates up to 1.5\" swivels (ambidextrous) Rear/Bottom - 1.25\" sling loops Toe - Lanyard hole for custom para-cord rigs Optional Accessories** Extended Rubber Butt-Pad, 0.55\" Enhanced Rubber Butt-Pad, 0.70\" Cheek Risers (0.25\", 0.50\", 0.75\" for NON-AR15/M16 applications) Specifications** CTR, Mil-Spec (stock configuration) Weight: 0.55 lb. Weight, w/ Rec. Extension: 0.80 lb. Length, Maximum: 6.90 in. LOP Adjustment Range: 3.25 in. LOP, M4 Collapsed: 10.70 in. LOP, M4 Extended: 13.95 in.", "text": "Magpul CTR Carbine Mil-Spec Buttstock - Black The Magpul CTR (Compact/Type Restricted) - Mil-Spec Model is a drop-in replacement buttstock for AR15/M16 carbines using mil-spec sized receiver extension tubes. Designed for light, fast action the streamlined A-frame profile avoids snagging and shields the release latch to prevent accidental activation. The CTR also features a supplemental friction lock system that minimizes excessive stock movement for enhanced weapon stability* and an ambidextrous QD sling mount that will accept any push-button sling swivel. The Mil-Spec Model includes a standard 0.30\" rubber butt-pad which provides positive shoulder purchase to prevent slippage even with body armor or modular gear. Made in U.S.A. Features Mounts on mil-spec sized carbine receiver extension tube (not included) from manufacturers such as Colt, Armalite, S&W;, LMT, and others (please see the note below) Supplemental friction lock minimizes accuracy robbing wobble* Sloping cheek weld combines a slim profile with user comfort Shielded release latch prevents snagging and accidental operation Premium chrome-silicon lock spring provides positive locking and long service life Side mounting slots accept optional cheek risers for NON-AR15/M16 applications Removable 0.30\" Rubber Butt-Pad offers an anti-slip surface and increases impact protection Compatible with Magpul ASAP and other receiver-mount sling attachments Sling Mounts Rear - Push-button QD swivel sling mount accommodates up to 1.5\" swivels (ambidextrous) Rear/Bottom - 1.25\" sling loops Toe - Lanyard hole for custom para-cord rigs Optional Accessories** Extended Rubber Butt-Pad, 0.55\" Enhanced Rubber Butt-Pad, 0.70\" Cheek Risers (0.25\", 0.50\", 0.75\" for NON-AR15/M16 applications) Specifications** CTR, Mil-Spec (stock configuration) Weight: 0.55 lb. Weight, w/ Rec. Extension: 0.80 lb. Length, Maximum: 6.90 in. LOP Adjustment Range: 3.25 in. LOP, M4 Collapsed: 10.70 in. LOP, M4 Extended: 13.95 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316jyvExV-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00305K99Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 62.79}}
{"item_id": "B00305LCXG", "title": "Flexfit 6477 Structured Wool Cap", "description": "", "text": "Flexfit 6477 Structured Wool Cap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VqkOdWCwL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00305LCXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Novelty, Costumes & More", "Novelty", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003069D2C", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger SP101 Nylon Monogrip", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Ruger SP101 Nylon Monogrip Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hVbNPVyKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003069D2C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B00306V4T2", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Grip Plate, Single", "description": "CAP Barbell's Standard Grip Plates come in a variety of different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. 3 hole grip design allows for easy and safe handling. The plates accomodate 1\" bars. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Grip Plate, Single CAP Barbell's Standard Grip Plates come in a variety of different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. 3 hole grip design allows for easy and safe handling. The plates accomodate 1\" bars. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UtfI4fWKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00306V4T2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003072HC4", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Weight Plate, Gray", "description": "CAP Barbell's Cast Iron Olympic Weight Plates have a hole that is 2\" in diameter. These weight lifting plates come in many different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. Featuring smooth edges and extra rib for more support. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training. Made of solid cast iron.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Weight Plate, Gray CAP Barbell's Cast Iron Olympic Weight Plates have a hole that is 2\" in diameter. These weight lifting plates come in many different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. Featuring smooth edges and extra rib for more support. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training. Made of solid cast iron.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R31oVdxeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003072HC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]], "price": 7.93}}
{"item_id": "B00307OOLG", "title": "SKS Grand D.A.D. Dual Adjust Dirtboard Front Bicycle Fender", "description": "The cool stealthy appearance of this extra wide coverage fender is only a bonus to the advanced adjustability features and super strong mounting hardware.", "text": "SKS Grand D.A.D. Dual Adjust Dirtboard Front Bicycle Fender The cool stealthy appearance of this extra wide coverage fender is only a bonus to the advanced adjustability features and super strong mounting hardware.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OgZyqHbqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00307OOLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 23.99}}
