{"item_id": "B00309HQPK", "title": "Casio Men's GW7900B-1 \"G-Shock\" Solar Sport Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's GW7900B-1 \"G-Shock\" Solar Sport Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uJ-pWfc9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00309HQPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women's Athletic Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men's Athletic Watches"]], "price": 110.09}}
{"item_id": "B00309XSRU", "title": "Serfas Twin 1/2 Watt Tail Bike Light", "description": "The TWIN 1/2 WATT TAIL BIKE LIGHT is a super bright 2 LED tail light that has 2 very strong 1/2 watt LED on each side. It has 2 options: Steady 1/2 watt on, or 2 LEDs flashing. This is our brightest imported tail light, and at a great price!.Burn Time: Up to 80 Hours (flash).", "text": "Serfas Twin 1/2 Watt Tail Bike Light The TWIN 1/2 WATT TAIL BIKE LIGHT is a super bright 2 LED tail light that has 2 very strong 1/2 watt LED on each side. It has 2 options: Steady 1/2 watt on, or 2 LEDs flashing. This is our brightest imported tail light, and at a great price!.Burn Time: Up to 80 Hours (flash).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dmBr7FGcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00309XSRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030ATZCG", "title": "SimplySleeper SS-47T Ultra Tough Premium Twin Air Bed (Air Mattress) with Built-in Fully Automatic Electric Pump (Puncture & Stretch Resistant!)", "description": "This is a more expensive airbed because of the highest quality material and construction. Less expensive airbeds will leak, stretch and sag more quickly and may not include an integrated built-in pump. Hassle-free inflating & deflating with an easy switch. Our airbeds will LAST LONGER than the competition. The SimplySleeper is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or area into a comfortable bedroom in only minutes. The SimplySleeper airbed offers a best-in-class feature, a patented breathable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate Technology that is topped with a lustrous 100% microfiber surface moderates your changing body temperature during sleep by wicking moisture away. The unique three-layers of materials perfectly sealed together to make SimplySleeper airbeds incredibly puncture resistant and durable, yet sensually soft to your skin. The thermo-induced laminate adhesive layer works to bind heavy gauge PVC together with a PVC coating to reduce stretch and prevent airbed pressure loss.", "text": "SimplySleeper SS-47T Ultra Tough Premium Twin Air Bed (Air Mattress) with Built-in Fully Automatic Electric Pump (Puncture & Stretch Resistant!) This is a more expensive airbed because of the highest quality material and construction. Less expensive airbeds will leak, stretch and sag more quickly and may not include an integrated built-in pump. Hassle-free inflating & deflating with an easy switch. Our airbeds will LAST LONGER than the competition. The SimplySleeper is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or area into a comfortable bedroom in only minutes. The SimplySleeper airbed offers a best-in-class feature, a patented breathable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate Technology that is topped with a lustrous 100% microfiber surface moderates your changing body temperature during sleep by wicking moisture away. The unique three-layers of materials perfectly sealed together to make SimplySleeper airbeds incredibly puncture resistant and durable, yet sensually soft to your skin. The thermo-induced laminate adhesive layer works to bind heavy gauge PVC together with a PVC coating to reduce stretch and prevent airbed pressure loss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BqigPL9jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030ATZCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SimplySleeper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 82.47}}
{"item_id": "B0030AVEF2", "title": "Joist Mounted Pull Up Bar with Neutral Grip Handles", "description": "DO NOT BE FOOLED BY OTHER IMITATIONS...This chin up bar is one weld with neutral grips attached....this is not a bar you put together that compromises the integrity of the bar like other companies joist mounted chin up bars. Heavy Gauge Steel Construction with down degree angle at ends. Comes with multiple grips from neutral to angled. Chin Up Bar is 48\" long and comes with knurled grips on angle, middle, and traverse handles to give the user various positions to achieve pull up results. This Chin up Bar is strong enough to use (as long as your joist is strong enough) with Rings and other band devices for reverse push ups, dips and other various exercises. There is NO break in the middle of the chin up bar so this can be used for multiple functions.", "text": "Joist Mounted Pull Up Bar with Neutral Grip Handles DO NOT BE FOOLED BY OTHER IMITATIONS...This chin up bar is one weld with neutral grips attached....this is not a bar you put together that compromises the integrity of the bar like other companies joist mounted chin up bars. Heavy Gauge Steel Construction with down degree angle at ends. Comes with multiple grips from neutral to angled. Chin Up Bar is 48\" long and comes with knurled grips on angle, middle, and traverse handles to give the user various positions to achieve pull up results. This Chin up Bar is strong enough to use (as long as your joist is strong enough) with Rings and other band devices for reverse push ups, dips and other various exercises. There is NO break in the middle of the chin up bar so this can be used for multiple functions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dI8HIMrkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030AVEF2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 45.94}}
{"item_id": "B0030AZSIG", "title": "Bike Brightz LED Bicycle Safety Light Lightweight Fashion Accessory", "description": "Be cool! Be seen! Bike Brightz LED Lights are a revolution in bicycle lighting. This unique new light uses 6 long lasting wide-beam LEDs to make bicyclists more visible at night. It lights up any bike with a vivid halo of intense color in 4 modes: constant, slow flashing, medium flashing, and fast flashing. Bike Brightz are lightweight, durable, easy to install, affordable, and water resistant. These lights fit on kids' and adult bikes and run on 2 AAA batteries (not included). Comes with 2 plastic ties for secure installation and 1 non-skid barrier pad to protect your bike's finish. Measures 5.5\" L x 1.25\" H x 0.75\" W.", "text": "Bike Brightz LED Bicycle Safety Light Lightweight Fashion Accessory Be cool! Be seen! Bike Brightz LED Lights are a revolution in bicycle lighting. This unique new light uses 6 long lasting wide-beam LEDs to make bicyclists more visible at night. It lights up any bike with a vivid halo of intense color in 4 modes: constant, slow flashing, medium flashing, and fast flashing. Bike Brightz are lightweight, durable, easy to install, affordable, and water resistant. These lights fit on kids' and adult bikes and run on 2 AAA batteries (not included). Comes with 2 plastic ties for secure installation and 1 non-skid barrier pad to protect your bike's finish. Measures 5.5\" L x 1.25\" H x 0.75\" W.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uu4JVMzDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030AZSIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bike Brightz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030BLI70", "title": "Burley Bee Bike Trailer", "description": "Burley's most basic bike trailer, the Burley Bee is made specifically for cyclists looking to bike on a budget without sacrificing safety. The Bee is comfortable and secure, with such features as a padded, hammock-style seat, a lightweight aluminum frame, and a five-point harness system. The trailer's clear windows, meanwhile, include a UV inhibitor to protect your child from sun exposure. And although it's designed primarily to transport your child, the trailer also includes an interior storage pocket with a water bottle slot. Other features include a folding frame for easy storage, wheel guards, a safety flag, a 20-inch quick-release composite rim, and a two-in-one water-repellent cover that's stain- and mildew-resistant. All Burley trailers meet and exceed the American Society for Testing and Materials (ASTM) safety requirements.Specifications:Capacity: 1 or 2 children, 100 poundsFabric: 600D polyesterPockets: Interior pocket with water bottle slotSeat: Hammock style with 5-point harness systemCover: 2-in-1 all-weather coverSafety flag: YesParking brake: NoFolding frame: YesFolded dimensions: 35 by 30 by 12 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 20 poundsAbout Burley DesignBurley Design has been the leader in child bicycle trailer design for nearly 30 years and has earned a strong reputation for high quality, superior design, safety, and trailer strength. Burley's testing and safety standards are among the most rigorous in the industry, and their designs provide a high level of child comfort in an aerodynamic and lightweight trailer. Burley's trailers are all made from lightweight aluminum tubing and covered with a stain-resistant, mildew-resistant, and water-repelling polyester, high-quality fabric. The geometry of each trailer is specifically tuned to reduce the weight on the connecting hitch, while at the same time providing an even balance point over the trailer wheels. This minimizes the load on the bicycle to maximize handling and ensure an extremely stable and secure ride.The stylish designs are also functional with large windows, a comfortable suspended hammock-style seat that minimizes the bumps in the road, and a generous storage compartment to enable you to do it all and enjoy time with family, exercise, and run errands all at the same time. Burley trailers store easily with a quick fold and easy-to-remove wheels. You can store it in a garage, hang it indoors, or put it easily into the trunk of a car. With easy-to-use jogger or stroller options, Burley trailers can convert for a run, a stroll in the park, or a cycling adventure.", "text": "Burley Bee Bike Trailer Burley's most basic bike trailer, the Burley Bee is made specifically for cyclists looking to bike on a budget without sacrificing safety. The Bee is comfortable and secure, with such features as a padded, hammock-style seat, a lightweight aluminum frame, and a five-point harness system. The trailer's clear windows, meanwhile, include a UV inhibitor to protect your child from sun exposure. And although it's designed primarily to transport your child, the trailer also includes an interior storage pocket with a water bottle slot. Other features include a folding frame for easy storage, wheel guards, a safety flag, a 20-inch quick-release composite rim, and a two-in-one water-repellent cover that's stain- and mildew-resistant. All Burley trailers meet and exceed the American Society for Testing and Materials (ASTM) safety requirements.Specifications:Capacity: 1 or 2 children, 100 poundsFabric: 600D polyesterPockets: Interior pocket with water bottle slotSeat: Hammock style with 5-point harness systemCover: 2-in-1 all-weather coverSafety flag: YesParking brake: NoFolding frame: YesFolded dimensions: 35 by 30 by 12 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 20 poundsAbout Burley DesignBurley Design has been the leader in child bicycle trailer design for nearly 30 years and has earned a strong reputation for high quality, superior design, safety, and trailer strength. Burley's testing and safety standards are among the most rigorous in the industry, and their designs provide a high level of child comfort in an aerodynamic and lightweight trailer. Burley's trailers are all made from lightweight aluminum tubing and covered with a stain-resistant, mildew-resistant, and water-repelling polyester, high-quality fabric. The geometry of each trailer is specifically tuned to reduce the weight on the connecting hitch, while at the same time providing an even balance point over the trailer wheels. This minimizes the load on the bicycle to maximize handling and ensure an extremely stable and secure ride.The stylish designs are also functional with large windows, a comfortable suspended hammock-style seat that minimizes the bumps in the road, and a generous storage compartment to enable you to do it all and enjoy time with family, exercise, and run errands all at the same time. Burley trailers store easily with a quick fold and easy-to-remove wheels. You can store it in a garage, hang it indoors, or put it easily into the trunk of a car. With easy-to-use jogger or stroller options, Burley trailers can convert for a run, a stroll in the park, or a cycling adventure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EiwGsvEAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030BLI70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 298.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030BOUWU", "title": "Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light", "description": "Accidents happen, but some can be avoided with a little preparation. The Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light puts you one step ahead of danger. Named for our bright red galactic neighbor, the Red Planet is also your ticket to not getting a light ticket.Portland Design Works' Red Planet Tail Light features a simple, no-nonsense design. It uses five LEDs to illuminate the darkness in your wake. Three of the LEDs point straight back into the eyes of drivers, while the two outer LEDs project outwards for side-to-side coverage. The lights are affordably powered by two AAA batteries, and the whole sub-50g system is housed in a durable, water-resistant plastic case.The Red Planet has three strobe settings -- steady, blinking, and 'kitt.' We're sure that you can imagine the actions of the first two, but 'kitt' was something new to us. This mode sweeps across the LEDs, side to side, much like the voice of a certain 1980s talking car of the same name. So, when you're a 'rider of the night', and you don't want to be just another blinky-blinky on the rode, you can activate this function to stand out to the inattentive driver.For easy attachment, the light comes with mounts for your seatpost and seat stays. PDW also included a backpack clip if you think that your bike is too pretty for mounting hardware.The Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light is available in one color and in 32x70x43mm size.", "text": "Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light Accidents happen, but some can be avoided with a little preparation. The Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light puts you one step ahead of danger. Named for our bright red galactic neighbor, the Red Planet is also your ticket to not getting a light ticket.Portland Design Works' Red Planet Tail Light features a simple, no-nonsense design. It uses five LEDs to illuminate the darkness in your wake. Three of the LEDs point straight back into the eyes of drivers, while the two outer LEDs project outwards for side-to-side coverage. The lights are affordably powered by two AAA batteries, and the whole sub-50g system is housed in a durable, water-resistant plastic case.The Red Planet has three strobe settings -- steady, blinking, and 'kitt.' We're sure that you can imagine the actions of the first two, but 'kitt' was something new to us. This mode sweeps across the LEDs, side to side, much like the voice of a certain 1980s talking car of the same name. So, when you're a 'rider of the night', and you don't want to be just another blinky-blinky on the rode, you can activate this function to stand out to the inattentive driver.For easy attachment, the light comes with mounts for your seatpost and seat stays. PDW also included a backpack clip if you think that your bike is too pretty for mounting hardware.The Portland Design Works Red Planet Tail Light is available in one color and in 32x70x43mm size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Z6lqSM7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030BOUWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Portland Design Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B0030BS30K", "title": "Portland Design Works Radbot 1000 1W LED Tail Light", "description": "Built with a powerful 1.0-watt Nichia LED bulb in red, the Radbot 1000 from Portland Design Works defends you and your bike against rear collisions with three eye-catching modes. Running with two AAA batteries, the Radbot offers runtimes of 30 hours in flashing mode and 15 hours in steady modes. The Radbot's precision Euro reflector, meanwhile, maintains your visibility even when the LED is not illuminated. The Radbot comes complete with a backpack clip as well as a rack, seatpost, and seatstay mount so that it is easy to secure to your bike or your person. The on/off switch must be held for 1.5 seconds, preventing the Radbot from being accidentally turned on in your pocket or bag when not in use. Built to withstand all weather conditions, the Radbot carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Portland Design Works.Specifications:Nichia brand 1.0 watt red LEDModes: zZz, zZzPOP!, cornea blitz, and rock steadyRuntimes: 30 hours flashing; 15 hours steady1.5 send hold switch prevents light from turning on unintentionallyEuro reflector--conforms to EU standardsRack, seatpost and seatstay mountsBackpack clipPower: two AAA batteries (included)What's in the Box?Radbot 1000 Taillight, two AAA batteries, backpack clip, rack, seatpost and seatstay mounts", "text": "Portland Design Works Radbot 1000 1W LED Tail Light Built with a powerful 1.0-watt Nichia LED bulb in red, the Radbot 1000 from Portland Design Works defends you and your bike against rear collisions with three eye-catching modes. Running with two AAA batteries, the Radbot offers runtimes of 30 hours in flashing mode and 15 hours in steady modes. The Radbot's precision Euro reflector, meanwhile, maintains your visibility even when the LED is not illuminated. The Radbot comes complete with a backpack clip as well as a rack, seatpost, and seatstay mount so that it is easy to secure to your bike or your person. The on/off switch must be held for 1.5 seconds, preventing the Radbot from being accidentally turned on in your pocket or bag when not in use. Built to withstand all weather conditions, the Radbot carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Portland Design Works.Specifications:Nichia brand 1.0 watt red LEDModes: zZz, zZzPOP!, cornea blitz, and rock steadyRuntimes: 30 hours flashing; 15 hours steady1.5 send hold switch prevents light from turning on unintentionallyEuro reflector--conforms to EU standardsRack, seatpost and seatstay mountsBackpack clipPower: two AAA batteries (included)What's in the Box?Radbot 1000 Taillight, two AAA batteries, backpack clip, rack, seatpost and seatstay mounts", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OscvnWOnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030BS30K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Portland Design Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 21.77}}
{"item_id": "B0030C2PY4", "title": "VISM by NcStar Gun Case (CV2907-36), Black, 36 x 13-Inch", "description": "Get your hands on one of our New Digital Camo Pattern Gun cases. These Durable Cases are constructed of Tough PVC Material with High Density Foam for Superior Protection of your valuable rifle. These Cases feature Covered Exterior Pockets so you can store your extra magazines vertical grip flashlight and all of your other accessories. Choose from 5 different lengths to fit your rifle: 36 inches 38 inches 40 inches 42 inches and 45 inches. Every Case includes a 1.5 inch wide Rugged Adjustable Carry Strap and Heavy Stitched Carry Grips.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Gun Case (CV2907-36), Black, 36 x 13-Inch Get your hands on one of our New Digital Camo Pattern Gun cases. These Durable Cases are constructed of Tough PVC Material with High Density Foam for Superior Protection of your valuable rifle. These Cases feature Covered Exterior Pockets so you can store your extra magazines vertical grip flashlight and all of your other accessories. Choose from 5 different lengths to fit your rifle: 36 inches 38 inches 40 inches 42 inches and 45 inches. Every Case includes a 1.5 inch wide Rugged Adjustable Carry Strap and Heavy Stitched Carry Grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dKgrvZwjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030C2PY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 23.09}}
{"item_id": "B0030C4W2M", "title": "Condor 3 Day Assault Pack", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor 3 Day Assault Pack Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MS6cVCXTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030C4W2M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030C61EY", "title": "Sigma BC 1009 STS Wireless Bicycle Speedometer", "description": "Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the Sigma BC 1009 STS wireless bicycle speedometer. Also available in a wired model, the speedometer displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The speedometer even includes a built-in clock, so you can check the current time or see how long you've been pedaling.Other features include a low battery warning (all presets and total values remain intact when the battery is changed), a PC link that allows you to plug your data into training software for analysis, and a water-resistant housing.", "text": "Sigma BC 1009 STS Wireless Bicycle Speedometer Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the Sigma BC 1009 STS wireless bicycle speedometer. Also available in a wired model, the speedometer displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The speedometer even includes a built-in clock, so you can check the current time or see how long you've been pedaling.Other features include a low battery warning (all presets and total values remain intact when the battery is changed), a PC link that allows you to plug your data into training software for analysis, and a water-resistant housing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O5nBRvN4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030C61EY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigma Sport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 47.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030C62WK", "title": "Stock Drop Spacer", "description": "Lower vertical angle of stock. Lower cheek position 1/2\". Improves shooters alignment with front bead. Used with 6-position collapsible stock. (MRW4100, MRF6200, MRF6200C)", "text": "Stock Drop Spacer Lower vertical angle of stock. Lower cheek position 1/2\". Improves shooters alignment with front bead. Used with 6-position collapsible stock. (MRW4100, MRF6200, MRF6200C)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YebJdXAvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030C62WK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Advanced Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B0030C67PM", "title": "AIM Mosin Nagant Sling", "description": "Fits Mosin Nagant Rifles Thick Canvas Strap High Quality Leather Tabs Modeled After The Original Fully Adjustable Strap Lifetime Warranty", "text": "AIM Mosin Nagant Sling Fits Mosin Nagant Rifles Thick Canvas Strap High Quality Leather Tabs Modeled After The Original Fully Adjustable Strap Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sw6lMbeFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030C67PM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 14.25}}
{"item_id": "B0030CHBM0", "title": "V-Share waterproof Bike computer/meter", "description": "Wired bicycle computer ideal for cyclists in training Displays current speed, average speed, and maximum speed Countdown timer, stopwatch, and riding time calculator Optional cadence measurement; current and total trip distance PC-compatible; temperature display; adjustable to 2 wheel sizes", "text": "V-Share waterproof Bike computer/meter Wired bicycle computer ideal for cyclists in training Displays current speed, average speed, and maximum speed Countdown timer, stopwatch, and riding time calculator Optional cadence measurement; current and total trip distance PC-compatible; temperature display; adjustable to 2 wheel sizes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iANabuqlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030CHBM0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigma Sport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 39.97}}
{"item_id": "B0030CI9BC", "title": "Martin Threshold Bow Set", "description": "The Adventure Series Threshold is a full size hunting bow, featuring a lightweight, durable riser and powerful limbs capable of achieving 310 FPS! The M-Pro machined aluminum single cam system includes a full set of interchangeable modules that allow adjustment from 25\" – 31\" (50#, 70# adult model) and 23.5\" - 29\" (40# youth model) in one inch increments without affecting draw weight. Draw weight is adjustbale down 10# from peak weight.This bow comes to you with everything you need to start shooting today. Included a Mantis Rest,Twist Lock 6-arrow Quiver and a Fiber optic Striker Sight.Introduce yourself to hunting adventure today, with the Adventure Series Threshold.", "text": "Martin Threshold Bow Set The Adventure Series Threshold is a full size hunting bow, featuring a lightweight, durable riser and powerful limbs capable of achieving 310 FPS! The M-Pro machined aluminum single cam system includes a full set of interchangeable modules that allow adjustment from 25\" – 31\" (50#, 70# adult model) and 23.5\" - 29\" (40# youth model) in one inch increments without affecting draw weight. Draw weight is adjustbale down 10# from peak weight.This bow comes to you with everything you need to start shooting today. Included a Mantis Rest,Twist Lock 6-arrow Quiver and a Fiber optic Striker Sight.Introduce yourself to hunting adventure today, with the Adventure Series Threshold.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QGoqhcSnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030CI9BC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Compound Bows"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030D63R8", "title": "Cold Steel Point Guard Black G-10 Handle", "description": "We think our Pro Guard offers several features that are sure to appeal to any neck knife aficionado. Inspired ty Fred Perrin custom knife, it's thin, flat, light as a feather, and comes complete with a terrific Secure Ex® sheath. Without a doubt, what really sets it apart from the competition is the big advantage it offers in overall length, and its blade to handle ratio. These advantages are made possible because the Pro Guard's fiendishly sharp, slant point blade includes an integral finger hole, which in turn makes possible the use of an abbreviated pistol grip handle. It's fitted with G-10 scales and skeletonized to save weight, making it a natural in the forward/reverse grip. And, thanks to the integral finger hold, there is no possibility of the hand moving forward on the blade on impact or losing control of it due to the effects of centrifugal force.", "text": "Cold Steel Point Guard Black G-10 Handle We think our Pro Guard offers several features that are sure to appeal to any neck knife aficionado. Inspired ty Fred Perrin custom knife, it's thin, flat, light as a feather, and comes complete with a terrific Secure Ex® sheath. Without a doubt, what really sets it apart from the competition is the big advantage it offers in overall length, and its blade to handle ratio. These advantages are made possible because the Pro Guard's fiendishly sharp, slant point blade includes an integral finger hole, which in turn makes possible the use of an abbreviated pistol grip handle. It's fitted with G-10 scales and skeletonized to save weight, making it a natural in the forward/reverse grip. And, thanks to the integral finger hold, there is no possibility of the hand moving forward on the blade on impact or losing control of it due to the effects of centrifugal force.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ixphYaqpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D63R8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 40.2}}
{"item_id": "B0030D63ZU", "title": "Cold Steel Latin Machete with Polypropylene Handle (21-Inch )", "description": "Have you been looking for a machete with extra reach and leverage? Perhaps something with a more traditional style blade and handle? Then Cold Steel has the tool for you! With their non-slip, shock absorbing rubber handles, they are perfect in almost every environment fom the jungle to the forest or even on the farm.", "text": "Cold Steel Latin Machete with Polypropylene Handle (21-Inch ) Have you been looking for a machete with extra reach and leverage? Perhaps something with a more traditional style blade and handle? Then Cold Steel has the tool for you! With their non-slip, shock absorbing rubber handles, they are perfect in almost every environment fom the jungle to the forest or even on the farm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sq59ZgiNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D63ZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 19.24}}
{"item_id": "B0030D645O", "title": "Cold Steel Spike Hawk Sheath Only Cover", "description": "While it's certainly capable of performing utility chores, our Spike Hawk really excels when it's used as a weapon. With one highly effective edge and a long spike, it puts any adversary on the horns of a fierce dilemma: Face the edge in brutal chopping, cutting, slashing and gouging attacks, or risk getting huge deep holes punched in you by the fearsome spike.To make matters even worse for an attacker, either end of the hawk can be used to hook or trap an opponent's weapon, neck, arm or leg, to control or manipulate the situation to one's advantage. Furthermore, the overall length of the of the hawk measures 9\" across making it a wide, stiff platform that can be punched into an incoming weapon arm to momentarily stop its forward motion and immobilize it. A superbly crafted leather sheath designed to safely house the point and edge is available and sold separately.", "text": "Cold Steel Spike Hawk Sheath Only Cover While it's certainly capable of performing utility chores, our Spike Hawk really excels when it's used as a weapon. With one highly effective edge and a long spike, it puts any adversary on the horns of a fierce dilemma: Face the edge in brutal chopping, cutting, slashing and gouging attacks, or risk getting huge deep holes punched in you by the fearsome spike.To make matters even worse for an attacker, either end of the hawk can be used to hook or trap an opponent's weapon, neck, arm or leg, to control or manipulate the situation to one's advantage. Furthermore, the overall length of the of the hawk measures 9\" across making it a wide, stiff platform that can be punched into an incoming weapon arm to momentarily stop its forward motion and immobilize it. A superbly crafted leather sheath designed to safely house the point and edge is available and sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311pto7pJ0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D645O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B0030D82W2", "title": "Cold Steel Pro Balance Thrower Composite Plastic Handle", "description": "With its substantial heft and dagger like point, our Pro Balance Thrower is made for the professional knife thrower and amateur throwing enthusiast as well. You can throw from either the blade or handle and it will sink into even hard targets with ease. Made out of sturdy 1055 Carbon steel, with a black, weather resistant finish and equipped with replaceable composite handle scales, it's ready to endure all that you can dish out and will last for hundreds of tournaments and shows.", "text": "Cold Steel Pro Balance Thrower Composite Plastic Handle With its substantial heft and dagger like point, our Pro Balance Thrower is made for the professional knife thrower and amateur throwing enthusiast as well. You can throw from either the blade or handle and it will sink into even hard targets with ease. Made out of sturdy 1055 Carbon steel, with a black, weather resistant finish and equipped with replaceable composite handle scales, it's ready to endure all that you can dish out and will last for hundreds of tournaments and shows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i7iAUg9YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D82W2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030D82ZY", "title": "Cold Steel Italian Long Sword", "description": "Since our Italian Long Sword is light and well balanced enough to use in one hand we thought we'd offer a companion dagger to take the place of a shield, targe, or buckler. Scaled down in size but almost identical in appearance, its sharply tapered, double edged blade slightly favors attacks with the point over the edge and is stiff and strong enough to parry any sword.", "text": "Cold Steel Italian Long Sword Since our Italian Long Sword is light and well balanced enough to use in one hand we thought we'd offer a companion dagger to take the place of a shield, targe, or buckler. Scaled down in size but almost identical in appearance, its sharply tapered, double edged blade slightly favors attacks with the point over the edge and is stiff and strong enough to parry any sword.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31o4Jot3XcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D82ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 223.18}}
{"item_id": "B0030D9REY", "title": "Cold Steel Rajah III Folding Knife", "description": "The Rajah folders, designed by Andrew Demko, are big enough to approximate the feel and heft a fixed blade Kukri. Their broad, downward curved blades exhibit the best of a Kukri’s characteristics. First, their unique shape presents their thin, hollow ground edges at just the right angle so they naturally bite deep instead of bouncing or skidding off. And secondly their points are thick, wide and sharp enough to pierce even the toughest targets. New Tri-Ad lock.", "text": "Cold Steel Rajah III Folding Knife The Rajah folders, designed by Andrew Demko, are big enough to approximate the feel and heft a fixed blade Kukri. Their broad, downward curved blades exhibit the best of a Kukri’s characteristics. First, their unique shape presents their thin, hollow ground edges at just the right angle so they naturally bite deep instead of bouncing or skidding off. And secondly their points are thick, wide and sharp enough to pierce even the toughest targets. New Tri-Ad lock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31L0mzgTYkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D9REY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 45.35}}
{"item_id": "B0030D9RFI", "title": "Cold Steel Two Handed Katana with Machete Black Blade", "description": "With the two-handed Katana Machete, from innovative cutlery company Cold Steel, you can clear a path through the wilds, samurai-style. The razor-sharp blade is 19 inches in length, with a modified, Tanto-style point. Heat treated to a tough spring temper and sporting a black, baked-on anti-rust finish, the Katana Machete comes with a utility edge that can easily be fully sharpened. To facilitate one- or two-handed use, the blade is paired with a long handle with sturdy cross guard, and the durable handle is injection-molded over the blade's tang, and secured by two thick bolts.Specifications19-inch blade length16.5-inch polypropylene handle35.5-inch overall length1055 carbon steelBaked-on, anti-rust matte black finish33-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Two Handed Katana with Machete Black Blade With the two-handed Katana Machete, from innovative cutlery company Cold Steel, you can clear a path through the wilds, samurai-style. The razor-sharp blade is 19 inches in length, with a modified, Tanto-style point. Heat treated to a tough spring temper and sporting a black, baked-on anti-rust finish, the Katana Machete comes with a utility edge that can easily be fully sharpened. To facilitate one- or two-handed use, the blade is paired with a long handle with sturdy cross guard, and the durable handle is injection-molded over the blade's tang, and secured by two thick bolts.Specifications19-inch blade length16.5-inch polypropylene handle35.5-inch overall length1055 carbon steelBaked-on, anti-rust matte black finish33-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21pZ8cKEKiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D9RFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 42.66}}
{"item_id": "B0030D9RFS", "title": "Cold Steel Two Handed Kukri Machete with Polypropylene Handle", "description": "Our two handed Kukri Machete offers so many advantages as a tool or weapon that it's hard to know where to begin when attempting to describe them. Small trees saplings, vines, thorn bushes, cane, reeds, bamboo, corn stocks and sugar cane all fall to its over sized blade and very long handle. When two or four legged predators threaten, the two handed Kukri will make short work of them as well, as its broad, down turned blade features a surprisingly sharp point capable of piercing the toughest hide or lopping off the most massive limb. And, as an added unexpected bonus the two handed Kukri can be thrown up to 10 yards with surprising accuracy and incredible penetration.", "text": "Cold Steel Two Handed Kukri Machete with Polypropylene Handle Our two handed Kukri Machete offers so many advantages as a tool or weapon that it's hard to know where to begin when attempting to describe them. Small trees saplings, vines, thorn bushes, cane, reeds, bamboo, corn stocks and sugar cane all fall to its over sized blade and very long handle. When two or four legged predators threaten, the two handed Kukri will make short work of them as well, as its broad, down turned blade features a surprisingly sharp point capable of piercing the toughest hide or lopping off the most massive limb. And, as an added unexpected bonus the two handed Kukri can be thrown up to 10 yards with surprising accuracy and incredible penetration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fy24sWJhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D9RFS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 27.76}}
{"item_id": "B0030D9RJ4", "title": "Cold Steel Two Handed Kukri Machete Sheath Cover SC97THKM", "description": "Our two handed Kukri Machete offers so many advantages as a tool or weapon that it’s hard to know where to begin when attempting to describe them. Small trees saplings, vines, thorn bushes, cane, reeds, bamboo, corn stocks and sugar cane all fall to its over sized blade and very long handle.When two or four legged predators threaten, the two handed Kukri will make short work of them as well, as its broad, down turned blade features a surprisingly sharp point capable of piercing the toughest hide or lopping off the most massive limb. And, as an added unexpected bonus the two handed Kukri can be thrown up to 10 yards with surprising accuracy and incredible penetration. Two Handed Kukri Machete SHEATH ONLY, Cordura\"", "text": "Cold Steel Two Handed Kukri Machete Sheath Cover SC97THKM Our two handed Kukri Machete offers so many advantages as a tool or weapon that it’s hard to know where to begin when attempting to describe them. Small trees saplings, vines, thorn bushes, cane, reeds, bamboo, corn stocks and sugar cane all fall to its over sized blade and very long handle.When two or four legged predators threaten, the two handed Kukri will make short work of them as well, as its broad, down turned blade features a surprisingly sharp point capable of piercing the toughest hide or lopping off the most massive limb. And, as an added unexpected bonus the two handed Kukri can be thrown up to 10 yards with surprising accuracy and incredible penetration. Two Handed Kukri Machete SHEATH ONLY, Cordura\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31abhB5wpRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D9RJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 5.69}}
{"item_id": "B0030D9ROE", "title": "Cold Steel Pipe Hawk Frontier Hawk", "description": "Do you prize the look and authentic lines of a traditional Pipe Hawk, but have little use for the hollow bowl and the strength-compromised, drilled-out wooden \"smoking\" handle? Well here's a Pipe Hawk without those disadvantageous features.Precision forged from 5150 carbon steel, the Pipe Hawk offers a long, reasonably wide cutting edge and a solid, fully hardened hammer poll that's turned and ribbed to mimic a hollow pipe bowl.Fitted with a 19\" hickory handle and weighing approximately 26 ounces it's heavy enough to be brutally effective as a chopping tool and weapon plus its solid bowl will drive nails, spikes and stakes with the power of a framing hammer.Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 7 1/2\"Primary Edge : 3\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 26 oz Handle : American Hickory", "text": "Cold Steel Pipe Hawk Frontier Hawk Do you prize the look and authentic lines of a traditional Pipe Hawk, but have little use for the hollow bowl and the strength-compromised, drilled-out wooden \"smoking\" handle? Well here's a Pipe Hawk without those disadvantageous features.Precision forged from 5150 carbon steel, the Pipe Hawk offers a long, reasonably wide cutting edge and a solid, fully hardened hammer poll that's turned and ribbed to mimic a hollow pipe bowl.Fitted with a 19\" hickory handle and weighing approximately 26 ounces it's heavy enough to be brutally effective as a chopping tool and weapon plus its solid bowl will drive nails, spikes and stakes with the power of a framing hammer.Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 7 1/2\"Primary Edge : 3\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 26 oz Handle : American Hickory", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310BzsAnN1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030D9ROE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 27.55}}
{"item_id": "B0030DAFT0", "title": "Aqua Sphere Vista Junior Swim Mask", "description": "The newest Junior Swim mask combines the best Aqua Sphere technologies resulting in a comfortable, leak resistant fit with expanded visibility. The low profile frame is made with the soft yet durable Softeril material for a comfortable fit and the stylized frame offers fun and exciting colors that kids will love. The lightweight Plexisol lens offers 100% UVA and UVB protection, has a special anti-fog treatment, and is scratch resistant. Integrating the new Quick-fit buckle makes finding the perfect fit faster and easier than ever.", "text": "Aqua Sphere Vista Junior Swim Mask The newest Junior Swim mask combines the best Aqua Sphere technologies resulting in a comfortable, leak resistant fit with expanded visibility. The low profile frame is made with the soft yet durable Softeril material for a comfortable fit and the stylized frame offers fun and exciting colors that kids will love. The lightweight Plexisol lens offers 100% UVA and UVB protection, has a special anti-fog treatment, and is scratch resistant. Integrating the new Quick-fit buckle makes finding the perfect fit faster and easier than ever.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h1JETx00L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DAFT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aqua Sphere", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030DBGXY", "title": "Cold Steel SRK Black Kraton Handle", "description": "All of the knives featured in our Battle Ready Classics Series have been made by Cold Steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. Frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price. The answer was to offer them in our famous San Mai III steel. Made in Japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, San Mai III has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening. Over the years, other \"super steels\" have come and gone but San Mai III remains as the most proven high performance stainless steel in the world.", "text": "Cold Steel SRK Black Kraton Handle All of the knives featured in our Battle Ready Classics Series have been made by Cold Steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. Frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price. The answer was to offer them in our famous San Mai III steel. Made in Japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, San Mai III has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening. Over the years, other \"super steels\" have come and gone but San Mai III remains as the most proven high performance stainless steel in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lzHJiFjbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DBGXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 107.9}}
{"item_id": "B0030DBHDI", "title": "Cold Steel US Marine NCO Saber with Leather Scabbard", "description": "While we heartily approve of our Armed Forces wearing dress swords and sabers, we thought it was a shame that only unsharpened, poorly tempered wall hangers made of weak stainless steel are all that's available.That's why we decided to make our own truly battle worthy reproductions.They're faithful in every detail to government specifications; they offer highly polished blades, appropriate etching and quality hilts and scabbards.The only real changes we have made are to drastically improve their performance as weapons by forging them from 1050 Carbon Steel and properly heat treating them to a tough spring temper before sharpening.", "text": "Cold Steel US Marine NCO Saber with Leather Scabbard While we heartily approve of our Armed Forces wearing dress swords and sabers, we thought it was a shame that only unsharpened, poorly tempered wall hangers made of weak stainless steel are all that's available.That's why we decided to make our own truly battle worthy reproductions.They're faithful in every detail to government specifications; they offer highly polished blades, appropriate etching and quality hilts and scabbards.The only real changes we have made are to drastically improve their performance as weapons by forging them from 1050 Carbon Steel and properly heat treating them to a tough spring temper before sharpening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21br-kiVstL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DBHDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 159.64}}
{"item_id": "B0030DBHGU", "title": "Cold Steel Trench Hawk Axe", "description": "Get out of confined spaces to safety with the Cold Steel Trench Hawk axe, which features a 3-1/2-inch cutting edge and a wedge-shaped spike. Drop forged from 5150 carbon steel and differentially hardened, the head of the Trench Hawk withstand tremendous blows and the stress of continued throwing. The handle is highly resistant to shock and impact, and it will withstand abuse that would easily break even a tough hickory handle. And it's easily and cheaply replaced when finally worn out or broken from repeated throwing. To protect you from its cutting edge and dangerously sharp spike, it comes with a patented Secure- Ex sheath that features a cleverly articulated design. The Trench Hawk has an overall length of 19 inches and a 24-ounce weight.", "text": "Cold Steel Trench Hawk Axe Get out of confined spaces to safety with the Cold Steel Trench Hawk axe, which features a 3-1/2-inch cutting edge and a wedge-shaped spike. Drop forged from 5150 carbon steel and differentially hardened, the head of the Trench Hawk withstand tremendous blows and the stress of continued throwing. The handle is highly resistant to shock and impact, and it will withstand abuse that would easily break even a tough hickory handle. And it's easily and cheaply replaced when finally worn out or broken from repeated throwing. To protect you from its cutting edge and dangerously sharp spike, it comes with a patented Secure- Ex sheath that features a cleverly articulated design. The Trench Hawk has an overall length of 19 inches and a 24-ounce weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NEWkXH4tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DBHGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 41.18}}
{"item_id": "B0030DBHHO", "title": "Cold Steel Spike Hawk Frontier Hawk", "description": "While it's certainly capable of performing utility chores, our Spike Hawk really excels when it's used as a weapon. With one highly effective edge and a long spike, it puts any adversary on the horns of a fierce dilemma: Face the edge in brutal chopping, cutting, slashing and gouging attacks, or risk getting huge deep holes punched in you by the fearsome spike.To make matters even worse for an attacker, either end of the hawk can be used to hook or trap an opponent's weapon, neck, arm or leg, to control or manipulate the situation to one's advantage. Furthermore, the overall length of the of the hawk measures 9\" across making it a wide, stiff platform that can be punched into an incoming weapon arm to momentarily stop its forward motion and immobilize it. A superbly crafted leather sheath designed to safely house the point and edge is available and sold separately.Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 9\"Primary Edge : 3 1/8\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 23.7 oz (approx.)Handle : American Hickory", "text": "Cold Steel Spike Hawk Frontier Hawk While it's certainly capable of performing utility chores, our Spike Hawk really excels when it's used as a weapon. With one highly effective edge and a long spike, it puts any adversary on the horns of a fierce dilemma: Face the edge in brutal chopping, cutting, slashing and gouging attacks, or risk getting huge deep holes punched in you by the fearsome spike.To make matters even worse for an attacker, either end of the hawk can be used to hook or trap an opponent's weapon, neck, arm or leg, to control or manipulate the situation to one's advantage. Furthermore, the overall length of the of the hawk measures 9\" across making it a wide, stiff platform that can be punched into an incoming weapon arm to momentarily stop its forward motion and immobilize it. A superbly crafted leather sheath designed to safely house the point and edge is available and sold separately.Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 9\"Primary Edge : 3 1/8\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 23.7 oz (approx.)Handle : American Hickory", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317mROev6XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DBHHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 32.98}}
{"item_id": "B0030DDFRY", "title": "Cold Steel Mini Tac Tanto Black G-10 Handle", "description": "Cold Steel's new generation of Mini Tac Neck Knives are astonishingly light at 3 ounces each. Because they're so lightweight, they can be comfortably worn practically 24 hours a day. With their sturdy bead chain lanyards and their rugged Secure Ex sheaths (specially designed to snugly retain the knife while allowing a speedy draw stroke), they can be worn outside clothing and perform as a handy utility or rescue knife.", "text": "Cold Steel Mini Tac Tanto Black G-10 Handle Cold Steel's new generation of Mini Tac Neck Knives are astonishingly light at 3 ounces each. Because they're so lightweight, they can be comfortably worn practically 24 hours a day. With their sturdy bead chain lanyards and their rugged Secure Ex sheaths (specially designed to snugly retain the knife while allowing a speedy draw stroke), they can be worn outside clothing and perform as a handy utility or rescue knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jeJybY9dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DDFRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 28.83}}
{"item_id": "B0030DDG00", "title": "Cold Steel Sure Balance Thrower All Black 1055 Carbon Steel Handle", "description": "Definitely in the heavyweight class, our Sure Balance Thrower is just shy of 13 1/2\" long and weighs a little over a pound. It'll wreak havoc no matter how it lands! It’s designed to resemble a classic thrower from the 1950’s and features a narrow, yet robust point that drives deep into a wood target, but is resilient enough to resist bending or breaking. Made of 1055 carbon steel with a black, baked-on protective coat, it casts off rainy and inclement weather like an umbrella and is sure to last for many years.", "text": "Cold Steel Sure Balance Thrower All Black 1055 Carbon Steel Handle Definitely in the heavyweight class, our Sure Balance Thrower is just shy of 13 1/2\" long and weighs a little over a pound. It'll wreak havoc no matter how it lands! It’s designed to resemble a classic thrower from the 1950’s and features a narrow, yet robust point that drives deep into a wood target, but is resilient enough to resist bending or breaking. Made of 1055 carbon steel with a black, baked-on protective coat, it casts off rainy and inclement weather like an umbrella and is sure to last for many years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C9OoNQ-rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DDG00.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030DDG9Q", "title": "Cold Steel Frontier Hawk", "description": "Suitable for re-enactors from any period stretching from the French and Indian War clear up to the final settling of the West in the late 1800's. The authentic, good looking Frontier Hawk is one tough customer you're sure to appreciate.This light weight Hawk is a joy to use too as it reduces wrist, elbow, and shoulder strain without sacrificing anything in chopping power or ease of handling. The merits of its light weight are revealed in combat too because the Frontier Hawk can be used at light speed from any angle and immediately recovered!Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 6\"Primary Edge : 3 1/4\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 21 oz (approx.)Handle : American Hickory", "text": "Cold Steel Frontier Hawk Suitable for re-enactors from any period stretching from the French and Indian War clear up to the final settling of the West in the late 1800's. The authentic, good looking Frontier Hawk is one tough customer you're sure to appreciate.This light weight Hawk is a joy to use too as it reduces wrist, elbow, and shoulder strain without sacrificing anything in chopping power or ease of handling. The merits of its light weight are revealed in combat too because the Frontier Hawk can be used at light speed from any angle and immediately recovered!Specifications:Overall Length : 22\"Hawk Length : 6\"Primary Edge : 3 1/4\"Steel : Drop Forged 1055 CarbonWeight : 21 oz (approx.)Handle : American Hickory", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31570XKTUGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DDG9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 29.17}}
{"item_id": "B0030DEAUK", "title": "US Divers Trek Travel Fin", "description": "These adjustable short-bladed fins with an adjustable heel strap are easy to pack, lightweight and great for the traveling snorkeler. Dual-composite fin blade for excellent snap, power and styling Compact length is great as a travel snorkeling fin and for other water sports activities. Super-soft and comfortable foot pocket. Adjustable foot strap to fine tune fit.", "text": "US Divers Trek Travel Fin These adjustable short-bladed fins with an adjustable heel strap are easy to pack, lightweight and great for the traveling snorkeler. Dual-composite fin blade for excellent snap, power and styling Compact length is great as a travel snorkeling fin and for other water sports activities. Super-soft and comfortable foot pocket. Adjustable foot strap to fine tune fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j4gUXlUiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DEAUK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030DH1RY", "title": "Katadyn Combi Microfilter", "description": "The Katadyn Combi is a compact, travel-ready water filtration device that combines a cleanable, silver-impregnated ceramic element and refillable, activated carbon cartridge. It's capable of quickly and easily turning stream, river, and lake water into crisp, clean, delicious, and -- most importantly -- safe drinking water. The Combi is effective against bacteria and protozoa, while also reducing chemicals and bad taste.The compact filter lets you quickly and easily turn Mother Nature's water into drinking water.Specifications13,000-gallon capacity per filterOne quart per minute outputMeasures 2.4 by 12 inches (W x H)0.2-micron ceramic depth filterActivated carbon granulate21-ounce weightWarrantyThis Katadyn product includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KatadynWater treatment products are in high demand for outdoor enthusiasts, international travelers, relief groups, and preparedness-minded individuals. The Swiss company Katadyn provides users with a water system for every need, including traveling, camping, backpacking, sailing, paddling, fishing, biking, and anytime you need to, as the company says, \"make water drinking water.\"", "text": "Katadyn Combi Microfilter The Katadyn Combi is a compact, travel-ready water filtration device that combines a cleanable, silver-impregnated ceramic element and refillable, activated carbon cartridge. It's capable of quickly and easily turning stream, river, and lake water into crisp, clean, delicious, and -- most importantly -- safe drinking water. The Combi is effective against bacteria and protozoa, while also reducing chemicals and bad taste.The compact filter lets you quickly and easily turn Mother Nature's water into drinking water.Specifications13,000-gallon capacity per filterOne quart per minute outputMeasures 2.4 by 12 inches (W x H)0.2-micron ceramic depth filterActivated carbon granulate21-ounce weightWarrantyThis Katadyn product includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KatadynWater treatment products are in high demand for outdoor enthusiasts, international travelers, relief groups, and preparedness-minded individuals. The Swiss company Katadyn provides users with a water system for every need, including traveling, camping, backpacking, sailing, paddling, fishing, biking, and anytime you need to, as the company says, \"make water drinking water.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QiwvGDuHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DH1RY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Katadyn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 181.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030DH1TM", "title": "Optimus Terra HE 3 piece cookset", "description": "The only fuel-saving cookset! Neroprene cover keeps food hot and protects your fingertips. Anodized aluminum pot for boiling, thicker Teflon pot for simmering and Teflon fry pan. New heat exchanger for more efficient cooking.", "text": "Optimus Terra HE 3 piece cookset The only fuel-saving cookset! Neroprene cover keeps food hot and protects your fingertips. Anodized aluminum pot for boiling, thicker Teflon pot for simmering and Teflon fry pan. New heat exchanger for more efficient cooking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D5Kq-H5NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DH1TM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 56.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030DH1U6", "title": "Optimus Terra Weekend HE .95L Pot", "description": "This versatile, and lightweight camping cook set from Katadyn has two modular pieces made of hard anodized aluminum. A unique heat exchanger feature reduces time to boil by 20%, boosting efficiency and reducing fuel consumption. The 0.95-liter Heat Exchange saucepan has a pouring lip and measuring marks in both milliliters and ounces, while the attachable fry pan doubles as a lid. The convenient mesh storage bag keeps everything together, and when you're on the move, a standard eight-ounce gas cartridge fits inside.SpecificationsMeasures 12.4 by 16.5 inches (W x H) assembled9.7-ounce weightKit includes:0.95-liter Heat Exchange saucepan with pouring lip and measuring marksFry pan that doubles as a lidMesh storage bagWarrantyAll Katadyn products include a limited three-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KatadynWater treatment products are in high demand for outdoor enthusiasts, international travelers, relief groups, and preparedness-minded individuals. The Swiss company Katadyn provides users with a water system for every need, including traveling, camping, backpacking, sailing, paddling, fishing, biking, and anytime you need to, as the company says, \"make water drinking water.\"", "text": "Optimus Terra Weekend HE .95L Pot This versatile, and lightweight camping cook set from Katadyn has two modular pieces made of hard anodized aluminum. A unique heat exchanger feature reduces time to boil by 20%, boosting efficiency and reducing fuel consumption. The 0.95-liter Heat Exchange saucepan has a pouring lip and measuring marks in both milliliters and ounces, while the attachable fry pan doubles as a lid. The convenient mesh storage bag keeps everything together, and when you're on the move, a standard eight-ounce gas cartridge fits inside.SpecificationsMeasures 12.4 by 16.5 inches (W x H) assembled9.7-ounce weightKit includes:0.95-liter Heat Exchange saucepan with pouring lip and measuring marksFry pan that doubles as a lidMesh storage bagWarrantyAll Katadyn products include a limited three-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KatadynWater treatment products are in high demand for outdoor enthusiasts, international travelers, relief groups, and preparedness-minded individuals. The Swiss company Katadyn provides users with a water system for every need, including traveling, camping, backpacking, sailing, paddling, fishing, biking, and anytime you need to, as the company says, \"make water drinking water.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TvaWIYuoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DH1U6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Katadyn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 30.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030DHIJA", "title": "Cold Steel 58TMAK Mini AK-47d Tanto", "description": "Legendary Russian gun designer Mikhail Kalashnikov created the AK-47 assault rifle in 1947. Adopted by the Red Army in 1949, the rifle earned a reputation as the \"people's rifle.\" The Cold Steel Mini AK-47 heavy-duty tactical knife pays tribute to the famed assault weapon, with a similarly rugged, economical, easy-to-operate design.Designed by knife designer Andrew Demko, the Mini AK-47 knife is built for hard and rugged use, with a hollow-ground 2-3/4-inch blade that's honed by hand until it reaches levels of sharpness usually seen on a surgeon's scalpel. The blade is made from Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel, which is vacuum-heat-treated and sub-zero-quenched for maximum toughness. The blade's black coating, meanwhile, boosts corrosion resistance, enhances cutting power, and improves edge retention.The blade is supported by Cold Steel's state-of-the-art Tri-Ad lock, which has been tested to resist shock induced by blows on the spine or over-strike that lands on the handle. The Mini AK-47 supplements the blade toughness with a rugged, rigid, and incomparably strong G-10 handle. Finally, the Mini AK-47 comes with an ambidextrous pocket clip and patented thumb plate. The thumb plate has a dual purpose: It allows you to draw and quickly open the knife by snagging it on the edge of a pocket, or you can use it like a conventional thumb stud or disc for easy one-handed opening.SpecificationsBlade: Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel with black coatingHandle: G-10Blade length: 2-3/4 inchesBlade thickness: 3mmHandle length: 4-3/8 inchesOverall length: 7-1/8 inchesPocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 2.9 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel 58TMAK Mini AK-47d Tanto Legendary Russian gun designer Mikhail Kalashnikov created the AK-47 assault rifle in 1947. Adopted by the Red Army in 1949, the rifle earned a reputation as the \"people's rifle.\" The Cold Steel Mini AK-47 heavy-duty tactical knife pays tribute to the famed assault weapon, with a similarly rugged, economical, easy-to-operate design.Designed by knife designer Andrew Demko, the Mini AK-47 knife is built for hard and rugged use, with a hollow-ground 2-3/4-inch blade that's honed by hand until it reaches levels of sharpness usually seen on a surgeon's scalpel. The blade is made from Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel, which is vacuum-heat-treated and sub-zero-quenched for maximum toughness. The blade's black coating, meanwhile, boosts corrosion resistance, enhances cutting power, and improves edge retention.The blade is supported by Cold Steel's state-of-the-art Tri-Ad lock, which has been tested to resist shock induced by blows on the spine or over-strike that lands on the handle. The Mini AK-47 supplements the blade toughness with a rugged, rigid, and incomparably strong G-10 handle. Finally, the Mini AK-47 comes with an ambidextrous pocket clip and patented thumb plate. The thumb plate has a dual purpose: It allows you to draw and quickly open the knife by snagging it on the edge of a pocket, or you can use it like a conventional thumb stud or disc for easy one-handed opening.SpecificationsBlade: Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel with black coatingHandle: G-10Blade length: 2-3/4 inchesBlade thickness: 3mmHandle length: 4-3/8 inchesOverall length: 7-1/8 inchesPocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 2.9 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BupTrjQqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DHIJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 58.5}}
{"item_id": "B0030DHIN6", "title": "Cold Steel Two Handed Panga with Machete Black Blade", "description": "If you like the look and cutting power of our traditional African Panga Machete (see page 68), you're going to love the two handed model. It's ideal for even the biggest jobs and will shear through small trees, saplings, limbs, vines and thorn bushes with equal abandon. An excellent companion whenever you venture out into the field or forest it's tough as nails and will provide years of hard faithful service.Specifications:Blade Length : 16\"Overall Length : 36 3/4\"Steel : 1055 Carbon Steel w/ Black Baked on Anti Rust Matte FinishWeight : 37 ozHandle : 20 3/4\" Long Polypropylene", "text": "Cold Steel Two Handed Panga with Machete Black Blade If you like the look and cutting power of our traditional African Panga Machete (see page 68), you're going to love the two handed model. It's ideal for even the biggest jobs and will shear through small trees, saplings, limbs, vines and thorn bushes with equal abandon. An excellent companion whenever you venture out into the field or forest it's tough as nails and will provide years of hard faithful service.Specifications:Blade Length : 16\"Overall Length : 36 3/4\"Steel : 1055 Carbon Steel w/ Black Baked on Anti Rust Matte FinishWeight : 37 ozHandle : 20 3/4\" Long Polypropylene", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ukni2TJxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DHIN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030DHIOK", "title": "Cold Steel Perfect Balance Thrower, Composite Plastic Handle", "description": "Our Perfect Balance Thrower takes inspiration from a 1950's classic. Its center of balance is at the midpoint of its overall length. It hits hard and penetrates its target efficiently because of its considerable weight and fully sharpened clip point. The strong 1055 carbon steel construction, black rust resistant finish, and replaceable composite handle scales, make it durable enough for thousands of throws. Plus, it has an additional benefit in that it can also hold its own as a heavy duty survival knife, cleaver or hatchet. Get yours today!", "text": "Cold Steel Perfect Balance Thrower, Composite Plastic Handle Our Perfect Balance Thrower takes inspiration from a 1950's classic. Its center of balance is at the midpoint of its overall length. It hits hard and penetrates its target efficiently because of its considerable weight and fully sharpened clip point. The strong 1055 carbon steel construction, black rust resistant finish, and replaceable composite handle scales, make it durable enough for thousands of throws. Plus, it has an additional benefit in that it can also hold its own as a heavy duty survival knife, cleaver or hatchet. Get yours today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bXx1S3hfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030DHIOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 18.2}}
{"item_id": "B0030ECYH0", "title": "Tenn Waterproof Windproof Cycle Cycling Gloves - 3M Insulation & Gel Grip Palms", "description": "Manufactured by Tenn Outdoors, these fantastic cold weather, windproof and waterproof Cycle Gloves give you, the Cyclist what you need without fancy prices. They are the perfect addition to your winter kit, getting you out on the road without your hands freezing to your handlebars. Featuring our own Gel Grip technology in addition to 3M Thinsulate insulated lining, these won't let you down. Lightweight and having extended cuffs with strong Velcro fastening to keep the wind and rain off your wrists. Comfortable to wear, making your riding experience much more pleasurable. Whether for road or cross country use, the gel grip palms provide a grippy interface between hand and handlebar. A good pair of gloves is worth its weight in gold, affording extra protection from the elements, when riding, off roading through the bush, or during those unforeseen crashes. Easily wearable for general outdoor use too. Composition: Neoprene cuff and thumb.Nylon knuckle area.Synthetic suede palm with waterproof membrane throughout entire glove.Foam insulated padding.", "text": "Tenn Waterproof Windproof Cycle Cycling Gloves - 3M Insulation & Gel Grip Palms Manufactured by Tenn Outdoors, these fantastic cold weather, windproof and waterproof Cycle Gloves give you, the Cyclist what you need without fancy prices. They are the perfect addition to your winter kit, getting you out on the road without your hands freezing to your handlebars. Featuring our own Gel Grip technology in addition to 3M Thinsulate insulated lining, these won't let you down. Lightweight and having extended cuffs with strong Velcro fastening to keep the wind and rain off your wrists. Comfortable to wear, making your riding experience much more pleasurable. Whether for road or cross country use, the gel grip palms provide a grippy interface between hand and handlebar. A good pair of gloves is worth its weight in gold, affording extra protection from the elements, when riding, off roading through the bush, or during those unforeseen crashes. Easily wearable for general outdoor use too. Composition: Neoprene cuff and thumb.Nylon knuckle area.Synthetic suede palm with waterproof membrane throughout entire glove.Foam insulated padding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OcO9Q3n-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030ECYH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030EW7Q8", "title": "LifeSpan TR 1200i Folding Treadmill", "description": "The LifeSpan TR1200i folding treadmill is durable, reliable, and loaded with valuable features, helping you walk, jog, or run with confidence in the comfort of your own home. The treadmill's pleasing design includes safe and convenient handlebar controls, which let you control your speed and incline without ever removing your hands from the handlebars. As a result, you can run or walk without fear of losing your concentration or balance while adjusting your pace. The TR1200i is also built for comfort and power, with a 2.5-horsepower motor, 2.5-inch front rollers, a spacious 20-by-56-inch running surface, and a biomechanically sound deck suspension system that supports people up to 300 pounds. And to help you track your workout progress, the treadmill automatically saves your exercise data. Once the info is saved, you can upload it to your personal online LifeSpan Fitness Club account, giving you access to exercise programs and detailed reports of your exercise and health results.The multicolored LCD console tracks your time, distance, calories, and more.The centerpiece of the TR1200i, however, is the multicolored LCD console, which offers several simultaneous readouts and exercise programs to help you achieve your health and fitness goals. The display tracks your time, calories, distance, steps, heart rate, speed, and incline level, with large soft-touch keys helping you get started and control your momentum. More importantly, the console offers 17 preset workout programs that help you vary your exercise routine--a critical factor for people trying to get in shape. The TR1200i's workout programs, which are designed by exercise physiologists to keep you safe and motivated, are grouped by exercise motivation, so you can quickly choose a workout that's right for you. All programs include 20 different segments, each with its own speed and inline level set according to the purpose of the program.In addition to the preset programs, the treadmill offers two My Zone heart rate control programs and two custom programs. The My Zone Constant program keeps your heart rate at a constant level--thereby using your heart rate as a fitness tool--while the My Zone Interval program lets you enter your own minimum and maximum hear rate. As you exercise, the treadmill speed and incline will automatically adjust to keep your heart rate at the preferred level. By contrast, the custom programs are fully adaptable to your favored workout formula. That's because you're in charge of setting the speed and incline level for each of the 20 program segments, and then saving them for future use.As a bonus, when you purchase a LifeSpan TR1200i treadmill, you automatically receive a membership to the LifeSpan Fitness Club. This comprehensive online health management program, powered by the Interactive Health Partner, lets you select exercise programs, track and manage your fitness and health results, and receive motivating support as you work toward achieving your goals. The LifeSpan Fitness Club is easy to use: each time you work out on the TR1200i, the treadmill automatically saves your exercise results on your LifeSpan . Because the device is personalized with your age, gender, and weight, not only do you bypass setup screens, you also receive accurate calorie calculations based on your data. Every 20 seconds during your workout, the console will then record your heart rate, minutes, miles, steps, and calories. You'll then have access to a full set of detailed reports and fun facts that you can analyze or share with friends, family, fitness coaches, or physicians.Other details include a set of built-in, high-quality speakers and a iPod/headphone jack, making it easy to listen to music as you walk or run; an Intelli-Step step-counting feature that works like a pedometer; 15 incline levels.The treadmill includes a folding frame with an automatic EZ Drop system.Specifications:Belt size: 20 by 56 inchesDrive motor: 2.5-horsepower continuous-duty DCBelt type: 2 plyIncline motor: 800-pounds maximum liftRollers: 2.5 inches (front), 2 inches (rear)Speed: 0.5 to 11 miles per hourIncline: 15 levelsDeck suspension: 6 variable-density elastomersDeck: 3/4-inch phenolicFolding system: EZ DropSide rails: Nonslip plasticFull dimensions: 33 by 54 by 70 inches (W x H x D)Folded dimensions: 39 by 66 by 33 inchesCapacity: 300 poundsManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime on the frame and motor, 3 years on parts, 1 year on laborAbout PCE Health and FitnessFounded in 1994 in Park City, Utah, PCE Health and Fitness has established a reputation for innovation, quality, and community responsibility. In 2001, the company introduced the LifeSpan line of fitness equipment targeting the over-55, value-conscious consumer. The award-winning line of exercise equipment is now sold by fitness retailers across the U.S, and has grown to include both a high-value home series and a pro series that targets the high-end home user and the institutional customer. This product can only be shipped inside the US. The company's awards include a Gold Medal Excellence Award from the Industrial Design Society of America, the Treadmill Doctor Best New Treadmill of the Year, and multiple Best Buy and Recommend Buy awards from theConsumer Guideand many others.", "text": "LifeSpan TR 1200i Folding Treadmill The LifeSpan TR1200i folding treadmill is durable, reliable, and loaded with valuable features, helping you walk, jog, or run with confidence in the comfort of your own home. The treadmill's pleasing design includes safe and convenient handlebar controls, which let you control your speed and incline without ever removing your hands from the handlebars. As a result, you can run or walk without fear of losing your concentration or balance while adjusting your pace. The TR1200i is also built for comfort and power, with a 2.5-horsepower motor, 2.5-inch front rollers, a spacious 20-by-56-inch running surface, and a biomechanically sound deck suspension system that supports people up to 300 pounds. And to help you track your workout progress, the treadmill automatically saves your exercise data. Once the info is saved, you can upload it to your personal online LifeSpan Fitness Club account, giving you access to exercise programs and detailed reports of your exercise and health results.The multicolored LCD console tracks your time, distance, calories, and more.The centerpiece of the TR1200i, however, is the multicolored LCD console, which offers several simultaneous readouts and exercise programs to help you achieve your health and fitness goals. The display tracks your time, calories, distance, steps, heart rate, speed, and incline level, with large soft-touch keys helping you get started and control your momentum. More importantly, the console offers 17 preset workout programs that help you vary your exercise routine--a critical factor for people trying to get in shape. The TR1200i's workout programs, which are designed by exercise physiologists to keep you safe and motivated, are grouped by exercise motivation, so you can quickly choose a workout that's right for you. All programs include 20 different segments, each with its own speed and inline level set according to the purpose of the program.In addition to the preset programs, the treadmill offers two My Zone heart rate control programs and two custom programs. The My Zone Constant program keeps your heart rate at a constant level--thereby using your heart rate as a fitness tool--while the My Zone Interval program lets you enter your own minimum and maximum hear rate. As you exercise, the treadmill speed and incline will automatically adjust to keep your heart rate at the preferred level. By contrast, the custom programs are fully adaptable to your favored workout formula. That's because you're in charge of setting the speed and incline level for each of the 20 program segments, and then saving them for future use.As a bonus, when you purchase a LifeSpan TR1200i treadmill, you automatically receive a membership to the LifeSpan Fitness Club. This comprehensive online health management program, powered by the Interactive Health Partner, lets you select exercise programs, track and manage your fitness and health results, and receive motivating support as you work toward achieving your goals. The LifeSpan Fitness Club is easy to use: each time you work out on the TR1200i, the treadmill automatically saves your exercise results on your LifeSpan . Because the device is personalized with your age, gender, and weight, not only do you bypass setup screens, you also receive accurate calorie calculations based on your data. Every 20 seconds during your workout, the console will then record your heart rate, minutes, miles, steps, and calories. You'll then have access to a full set of detailed reports and fun facts that you can analyze or share with friends, family, fitness coaches, or physicians.Other details include a set of built-in, high-quality speakers and a iPod/headphone jack, making it easy to listen to music as you walk or run; an Intelli-Step step-counting feature that works like a pedometer; 15 incline levels.The treadmill includes a folding frame with an automatic EZ Drop system.Specifications:Belt size: 20 by 56 inchesDrive motor: 2.5-horsepower continuous-duty DCBelt type: 2 plyIncline motor: 800-pounds maximum liftRollers: 2.5 inches (front), 2 inches (rear)Speed: 0.5 to 11 miles per hourIncline: 15 levelsDeck suspension: 6 variable-density elastomersDeck: 3/4-inch phenolicFolding system: EZ DropSide rails: Nonslip plasticFull dimensions: 33 by 54 by 70 inches (W x H x D)Folded dimensions: 39 by 66 by 33 inchesCapacity: 300 poundsManufacturer's WarrantyLifetime on the frame and motor, 3 years on parts, 1 year on laborAbout PCE Health and FitnessFounded in 1994 in Park City, Utah, PCE Health and Fitness has established a reputation for innovation, quality, and community responsibility. In 2001, the company introduced the LifeSpan line of fitness equipment targeting the over-55, value-conscious consumer. The award-winning line of exercise equipment is now sold by fitness retailers across the U.S, and has grown to include both a high-value home series and a pro series that targets the high-end home user and the institutional customer. This product can only be shipped inside the US. The company's awards include a Gold Medal Excellence Award from the Industrial Design Society of America, the Treadmill Doctor Best New Treadmill of the Year, and multiple Best Buy and Recommend Buy awards from theConsumer Guideand many others.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DxKlrN%2BfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030EW7Q8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LifeSpan Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 999.0}}
{"item_id": "B0030F3TRI", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350ST G10 Handle with SpeedSafe and Serrated Blade", "description": "The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new partially serrated blade for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350ST G10 Handle with SpeedSafe and Serrated Blade The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new partially serrated blade for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qjA539YvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030F3TRI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 121.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030FNYQO", "title": "Estwing Extra Sheath for Sportsman's Axe", "description": "Estwing Extra Sheath for Sportsman's Axe", "text": "Estwing Extra Sheath for Sportsman's Axe Estwing Extra Sheath for Sportsman's Axe", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xHBd2vHQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030FNYQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Estwing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030FY0GM", "title": "Grizzly Fitness Power Training Wrist Wrap", "description": "Grizzly Wrist Wraps will give the Wrist Support needed to hold form while Bench Pressing, Military Pressing or Overhead Triceps Extensions. 3\" wide Elastic Thumb Loop Wrist Wraps for added Support. Soft White Elastic with Hook and Loop Closure for Adjustable Sizing. Sold as pair.", "text": "Grizzly Fitness Power Training Wrist Wrap Grizzly Wrist Wraps will give the Wrist Support needed to hold form while Bench Pressing, Military Pressing or Overhead Triceps Extensions. 3\" wide Elastic Thumb Loop Wrist Wraps for added Support. Soft White Elastic with Hook and Loop Closure for Adjustable Sizing. Sold as pair.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HF06WnWNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030FY0GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grizzly Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 14.37}}
{"item_id": "B0030GQA00", "title": "Fox 40 Sonik Blast Official Whistle (Black)", "description": "Extremely easy to blow! Advanced Science and technology makes this the most efficient, loudest whistle ever produced by Fox 40. Cannot be overblown and emits 120 dB. This clear loud blast carries above the loudest crowds and noise, and over extremely long distances.", "text": "Fox 40 Sonik Blast Official Whistle (Black) Extremely easy to blow! Advanced Science and technology makes this the most efficient, loudest whistle ever produced by Fox 40. Cannot be overblown and emits 120 dB. This clear loud blast carries above the loudest crowds and noise, and over extremely long distances.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ajnh%2BoHhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030GQA00.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0030H59PG", "title": "NcStar Mark III Tactical P4 Sniper 3-9X42/Scope Adaptor Mount/Red Dot Combo Package (STP3942G/D)", "description": "Built using the Ultimate Sighting System (USS), the Mark III Tactical P4 3-9x42 scope combines the benefits of a Mark III tactical scope with the advantage of a backup red dot sight. The system is equipped with a Mark III tactical scope and a specially designed MRD34 ring. The ring, which mounts directly to the ocular lens housing with a built-in Weaver-style platform, stabilizes the DDAB red dot sight so you can lock confidently lock on your target. With the scope and sight, the USS is perfect for both close quarter battle and long-range shooting.The scope also includes fully multicoated lenses for brightness and clarity, along with a red/green illuminated P4 sniper reticle with multiple brightness settings. Other features include open target turrets, a bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-grain bullet, a rotating mount for users who prefer offset functionality, a built-in sunshade, and a quick-focus eyepiece.SpecificationsMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens diameter: 42mmField of view: 36.8 to 12.0 @ 100 yardsEye relief: 2 inchesExit pupil: 9.3 to 3.1mmReticle: P4 sniperClick value: 1/2 MOAExterior finish: Matte blackLens coating: GreenMount: Integrated Weaver-style quick releaseLength: 7.54 inchesWeight: 16.7 ounces", "text": "NcStar Mark III Tactical P4 Sniper 3-9X42/Scope Adaptor Mount/Red Dot Combo Package (STP3942G/D) Built using the Ultimate Sighting System (USS), the Mark III Tactical P4 3-9x42 scope combines the benefits of a Mark III tactical scope with the advantage of a backup red dot sight. The system is equipped with a Mark III tactical scope and a specially designed MRD34 ring. The ring, which mounts directly to the ocular lens housing with a built-in Weaver-style platform, stabilizes the DDAB red dot sight so you can lock confidently lock on your target. With the scope and sight, the USS is perfect for both close quarter battle and long-range shooting.The scope also includes fully multicoated lenses for brightness and clarity, along with a red/green illuminated P4 sniper reticle with multiple brightness settings. Other features include open target turrets, a bullet drop compensator calibrated for the .223 cartridge with a 55-grain bullet, a rotating mount for users who prefer offset functionality, a built-in sunshade, and a quick-focus eyepiece.SpecificationsMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens diameter: 42mmField of view: 36.8 to 12.0 @ 100 yardsEye relief: 2 inchesExit pupil: 9.3 to 3.1mmReticle: P4 sniperClick value: 1/2 MOAExterior finish: Matte blackLens coating: GreenMount: Integrated Weaver-style quick releaseLength: 7.54 inchesWeight: 16.7 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EojVKCzPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030H59PG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 167.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030HL5O0", "title": "Grace USA Original Gun Care Screwdriver Set", "description": "This Made in the USA premium screwdriver set includes 8 hollow ground, square shanked screwdrivers that are made from high-grade tool steel and hardened to a Rockwell standard.", "text": "Grace USA Original Gun Care Screwdriver Set This Made in the USA premium screwdriver set includes 8 hollow ground, square shanked screwdrivers that are made from high-grade tool steel and hardened to a Rockwell standard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kqXCmBInL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HL5O0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grace USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030HMU08", "title": "Walkers Sport Combo Kit", "description": "- Range Muffs:- Noise reducing rating, NRR 29dB- Ultra-light weight- Ear Plugs:- Noise reducing rating, NRR 31dB- Conforms to shape of ear- Sports Glasses:- High grade Polycarbonate lenses- Meets ANSI Z87.1-2003 high impact requirements- Adapts to a broad range of facial sizes- Adjustable nose pad", "text": "Walkers Sport Combo Kit - Range Muffs:- Noise reducing rating, NRR 29dB- Ultra-light weight- Ear Plugs:- Noise reducing rating, NRR 31dB- Conforms to shape of ear- Sports Glasses:- High grade Polycarbonate lenses- Meets ANSI Z87.1-2003 high impact requirements- Adapts to a broad range of facial sizes- Adjustable nose pad", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UOsGcbc3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HMU08.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walker&#39;s Game Ear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 13.41}}
{"item_id": "B0030HMXH8", "title": "Desantis Apache Holster For Glock 26 Right Hand Black", "description": "The Apache's wide, elasticized leg band largely eliminates the unwanted rocking motion commonly associated with ankle holsters. The Apache is made for small, medium and large frame semi-autos and small frame revolvers. All semi-auto models feature an adjustable Velcro thumb break. Revolver and .32cal holsters feature an adjustable thumb strap (without snap, Velcro closure). Designs may vary. Available in black. Semi-auto and revolver holster models are constructed with elastic and have a sheepskin lining with a snap thumb break. The .32cal holster models are constructed of neoprene and feature a Velcro thumb break. Optional C14 strap accommodates semi-auto and revolver holster models only.", "text": "Desantis Apache Holster For Glock 26 Right Hand Black The Apache's wide, elasticized leg band largely eliminates the unwanted rocking motion commonly associated with ankle holsters. The Apache is made for small, medium and large frame semi-autos and small frame revolvers. All semi-auto models feature an adjustable Velcro thumb break. Revolver and .32cal holsters feature an adjustable thumb strap (without snap, Velcro closure). Designs may vary. Available in black. Semi-auto and revolver holster models are constructed with elastic and have a sheepskin lining with a snap thumb break. The .32cal holster models are constructed of neoprene and feature a Velcro thumb break. Optional C14 strap accommodates semi-auto and revolver holster models only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513ZpNAPv9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HMXH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 37.74}}
{"item_id": "B0030HQ194", "title": "NcStar AR15 Flip Up Front Sight (MARFLF)", "description": "For a durable and compact flip-up front A2 iron sight the NcSTAR MARFLF is the AR-15 back-up front iron sight that should equip your AR-15 rifle.", "text": "NcStar AR15 Flip Up Front Sight (MARFLF) For a durable and compact flip-up front A2 iron sight the NcSTAR MARFLF is the AR-15 back-up front iron sight that should equip your AR-15 rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BO0Nc19JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HQ194.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 18.36}}
{"item_id": "B0030HS4UI", "title": "NcStar AR15 Detachable Rear Sight (MARDRS)", "description": "For solid and dependable back-up fixed A2 rear sight, the NcSTAR MARDRS does not take up much of your valuable Picatinny rail space. You can have a back-up iron sight ready to go at a moment’s notice and have space for a red-dot/ reflex/ holographic optic on your AR-15 upper receiver.", "text": "NcStar AR15 Detachable Rear Sight (MARDRS) For solid and dependable back-up fixed A2 rear sight, the NcSTAR MARDRS does not take up much of your valuable Picatinny rail space. You can have a back-up iron sight ready to go at a moment’s notice and have space for a red-dot/ reflex/ holographic optic on your AR-15 upper receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hZKurhKNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HS4UI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0030HUDLQ", "title": "Otis Technology Nylon Double End All Purpose Receiver Brush, Variety Bulk FG-316-BP", "description": "Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a more aggressive bronze bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' Variety Pack of All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the steel bristled brush. Combined, these brushes have over 1001 uses. Try these brushes on: firearms, automobile detailing, boats, golf equipment, battery terminals, camping, grout, jewelry, wood working, RC hobbies, crafts, and much, much more! *Includes 3 of each Nylon, Bronze, and Steel", "text": "Otis Technology Nylon Double End All Purpose Receiver Brush, Variety Bulk FG-316-BP Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a more aggressive bronze bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' Variety Pack of All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the steel bristled brush. Combined, these brushes have over 1001 uses. Try these brushes on: firearms, automobile detailing, boats, golf equipment, battery terminals, camping, grout, jewelry, wood working, RC hobbies, crafts, and much, much more! *Includes 3 of each Nylon, Bronze, and Steel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j5HbZ-RaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HUDLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 16.45}}
{"item_id": "B0030HUE9C", "title": "Radians 25 Pair Disposable Uncorded Foam Earplugs", "description": "Tapered shape offers the most natural fit and seal for the ear canal. Smooth shiny surface repels dirt. Low pressure, self adjusting foam offers long wearing comfort and quick recovery time.", "text": "Radians 25 Pair Disposable Uncorded Foam Earplugs Tapered shape offers the most natural fit and seal for the ear canal. Smooth shiny surface repels dirt. Low pressure, self adjusting foam offers long wearing comfort and quick recovery time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pxz0E7MeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030HUE9C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030I0PAO", "title": "Portland Design Works 3wrencho Tire Lever/Wrench", "description": "No, we're not talking about Yoshi Konno (RIP), but the Portland Design Works 3wrencho Tire Lever/Wrench is a solemn tribute to his master craftsmanship. The 3wrencho combines a 15mm box wrench with one of the best tire levers on the market. Impeccable design, tasteful representation, and a true work horse of function -- we think Yoshi would approve.Portland Design Works' 3wrencho is made from a durable, heat-treated steel. However, while this guarantees longevity, strength alone can't remove pesky tires and axle nuts. So, PDW mated the solid construction with a 4. 5in length handle to provide enough stiffness and leverage to remove any stubbornly torqued 15mm axle nut. And when you're not cranking the 15mm box wrench, the slope of the design makes for a comfortable handle when using the opposite end as a tire lever. That's right -- a wrench and a lever. This is where we'll note that you've been given two options of the 3wrencho to consider. The Black version has been given a glass-filled nylon coating that will protect your pretty rims; while the Silver is completely raw and a little less friendly with carbon fiber. So, if you love your rims more than yourself, we recommend using the coated 3wrencho.As you would assume, the 3wrencho does have three uses. However, the third usage is entirely up to you. Use the 3wrencho for any task that can benefit from a strong, 4. 5in stick. Crack a beer, spread on your peanut butter (a la Campy), or use it as a pointer in your next boardroom presentation -- it's up to you.The Portland Design Works 3wrencho - Tire Lever/Wrench is available in both colors Black (coated) and Silver (raw).", "text": "Portland Design Works 3wrencho Tire Lever/Wrench No, we're not talking about Yoshi Konno (RIP), but the Portland Design Works 3wrencho Tire Lever/Wrench is a solemn tribute to his master craftsmanship. The 3wrencho combines a 15mm box wrench with one of the best tire levers on the market. Impeccable design, tasteful representation, and a true work horse of function -- we think Yoshi would approve.Portland Design Works' 3wrencho is made from a durable, heat-treated steel. However, while this guarantees longevity, strength alone can't remove pesky tires and axle nuts. So, PDW mated the solid construction with a 4. 5in length handle to provide enough stiffness and leverage to remove any stubbornly torqued 15mm axle nut. And when you're not cranking the 15mm box wrench, the slope of the design makes for a comfortable handle when using the opposite end as a tire lever. That's right -- a wrench and a lever. This is where we'll note that you've been given two options of the 3wrencho to consider. The Black version has been given a glass-filled nylon coating that will protect your pretty rims; while the Silver is completely raw and a little less friendly with carbon fiber. So, if you love your rims more than yourself, we recommend using the coated 3wrencho.As you would assume, the 3wrencho does have three uses. However, the third usage is entirely up to you. Use the 3wrencho for any task that can benefit from a strong, 4. 5in stick. Crack a beer, spread on your peanut butter (a la Campy), or use it as a pointer in your next boardroom presentation -- it's up to you.The Portland Design Works 3wrencho - Tire Lever/Wrench is available in both colors Black (coated) and Silver (raw).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31D6edkY84L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030I0PAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Portland Design Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 16.0}}
