{"item_id": "B0030IC24Q", "title": "SKS Supershort Mini Pump", "description": "The SKS Supershort bicycle pump lives up to its name, providing efficient, high-volume strokes that fill a tire quickly, in a compact and incredibly portable package. The detachable aluminum body transforms into a slide-on T-handle that won't pinch like many standard T-handle hinge pumps. With the clamp lever, the reversible valve head can be easily connected to both Presta and Schrader valves, and a thumb lock lever is also included. The pump can fill to 90 PSI, measures 164 millimeters long, and weighs just 103 grams.A simple, durable bike mount is also included.About SKSIn 1921, German bicycle accessory company SKS was founded by Karl Scheffer-Klute in Sundern, Germany (SKS = Scheffer-Klute Sundern). The company, which originally just produced high quality bike pumps, today manufactures floor pumps, mini pumps, mudguards, bike fenders, chain guards, and other accessories.", "text": "SKS Supershort Mini Pump The SKS Supershort bicycle pump lives up to its name, providing efficient, high-volume strokes that fill a tire quickly, in a compact and incredibly portable package. The detachable aluminum body transforms into a slide-on T-handle that won't pinch like many standard T-handle hinge pumps. With the clamp lever, the reversible valve head can be easily connected to both Presta and Schrader valves, and a thumb lock lever is also included. The pump can fill to 90 PSI, measures 164 millimeters long, and weighs just 103 grams.A simple, durable bike mount is also included.About SKSIn 1921, German bicycle accessory company SKS was founded by Karl Scheffer-Klute in Sundern, Germany (SKS = Scheffer-Klute Sundern). The company, which originally just produced high quality bike pumps, today manufactures floor pumps, mini pumps, mudguards, bike fenders, chain guards, and other accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e6PeodpUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030IC24Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 19.99}}
