{"item_id": "B0030L6HUI", "title": "Chromax M1 75 Compression Golf Balls", "description": "Featuring bright metallic finishes, Chromax M1 75 Compression Balls have introduced a unique style of ball to the game of golf that is easy to see on the ground and in the air. With their reflective finishes in multiple color choices, the Chromax Balls distinguish themselves from their all-white counterparts offering multiple advantages to players including sharply reduced ball loss, reduced search time, and easier to see ball flight that helps golfers correct their swings. In addition, the Chromax balls are beautiful to look at, adding character to tradition. The lower compression Chromax ball is designed for optimum performance at lower swing speeds. All Chromax balls conform to USGA regulations and are legal for tournament play.What's in the Box?6 Chromax M1 75 Compression Golf Balls", "text": "Chromax M1 75 Compression Golf Balls Featuring bright metallic finishes, Chromax M1 75 Compression Balls have introduced a unique style of ball to the game of golf that is easy to see on the ground and in the air. With their reflective finishes in multiple color choices, the Chromax Balls distinguish themselves from their all-white counterparts offering multiple advantages to players including sharply reduced ball loss, reduced search time, and easier to see ball flight that helps golfers correct their swings. In addition, the Chromax balls are beautiful to look at, adding character to tradition. The lower compression Chromax ball is designed for optimum performance at lower swing speeds. All Chromax balls conform to USGA regulations and are legal for tournament play.What's in the Box?6 Chromax M1 75 Compression Golf Balls", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iNeyjUC1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030L6HUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chromax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Trick & Novelty Balls"]], "price": 17.88}}
{"item_id": "B0030LBLAY", "title": "Park Tool Professional Wheel Truing Stand - TS-2.2", "description": "The Park Tool TS-2. 2 Professional Wheel Truing Stand is the one to choose for heavy shop use. Alternatively, if you do your own wheel work at home, this is the one you'll want if you appreciate high quality tools and settle for nothing less than the best. The TS-2. 2 accepts wheels up to 29\" with or without the tire removed. Both axle-holding uprights move simultaneously, always centering your wheel within the rim calipers, regardless of hub width. The calipers and caliper arm are spring-loaded to prevent jamming with badly out-of-true wheels. It will even accept a four inch wide rim, so if you have a Pugsly, you're in luck. The TS-2. 2 also comes with composite caliper tip covers to protect your rims from scratches as you dial in the wheelbuild. The Park Tool TS-2. 2 Truing Stand is made of heavy-duty, chrome plated steel with nylon bushings at all the pivot points. It can be bench-mounted or held in a vise. Removable / replaceable composite caliper tips protect your fancy rims from unsightly scratchesAccepts hub widths up to 175mm and rim widths up to 4 inches so there's not much you can't straightenSpring-loaded calipers prevent bindingUprights move together to accommodate front and rear wheelsEasily installed in a bench vice or mounted on a bench", "text": "Park Tool Professional Wheel Truing Stand - TS-2.2 The Park Tool TS-2. 2 Professional Wheel Truing Stand is the one to choose for heavy shop use. Alternatively, if you do your own wheel work at home, this is the one you'll want if you appreciate high quality tools and settle for nothing less than the best. The TS-2. 2 accepts wheels up to 29\" with or without the tire removed. Both axle-holding uprights move simultaneously, always centering your wheel within the rim calipers, regardless of hub width. The calipers and caliper arm are spring-loaded to prevent jamming with badly out-of-true wheels. It will even accept a four inch wide rim, so if you have a Pugsly, you're in luck. The TS-2. 2 also comes with composite caliper tip covers to protect your rims from scratches as you dial in the wheelbuild. The Park Tool TS-2. 2 Truing Stand is made of heavy-duty, chrome plated steel with nylon bushings at all the pivot points. It can be bench-mounted or held in a vise. Removable / replaceable composite caliper tips protect your fancy rims from unsightly scratchesAccepts hub widths up to 175mm and rim widths up to 4 inches so there's not much you can't straightenSpring-loaded calipers prevent bindingUprights move together to accommodate front and rear wheelsEasily installed in a bench vice or mounted on a bench", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41veCbnR-mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030LBLAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 233.96}}
{"item_id": "B0030MGO2I", "title": "Tenn Mens Light Flo Mk II Waterproof/Breathable Cycle Jacket", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Welcoming this seasons newest fluorescent colours. This cycling-specific ultra lightweight jacket is the ideal solution to keep you comfortable whilst riding whatever the conditions. Manufactured in technical Taslan nylon fabric, resulting in a waterproof, breathable and windproof garment. Averaging around 480g, this is the perfect jacket for cyclists who want to work hard but stay dry. Incorporating a night visibility reflective trim around the sleeves and across the back. Fully taped seams for full garment waterproofing. Soft and comfortable mesh lining. Under arm zipped and large rear ventilation to allow a through flow of cool air. Micro fleece lined draw corded collar. A zipped, easy access large rear pocket, 2 zipped side pockets, Velcro adjustable cuffs and a quick-adjust draw-corded waist. The stow-away press-stud drop-tail allows the rear of the jacket to increase in length by 3.5 inches (particularly useful if you are riding without mud guards). A rear LED bike light attachment tab is also incorporated. The full length zip with a Velcro sealed storm flap will ensure that the rain is kept out. Chest sizes given are the chest sizes this garment will fit. This is a cycling jacket and therefore close-fitting. If you are intending to wear over a fleece for example, please consider ordering the next size up. This jacket is available in 3 colours (Hi-Viz Yellow, Hi-Viz Orange and Hi-Viz Green) and various sizes.", "text": "Tenn Mens Light Flo Mk II Waterproof/Breathable Cycle Jacket Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Welcoming this seasons newest fluorescent colours. This cycling-specific ultra lightweight jacket is the ideal solution to keep you comfortable whilst riding whatever the conditions. Manufactured in technical Taslan nylon fabric, resulting in a waterproof, breathable and windproof garment. Averaging around 480g, this is the perfect jacket for cyclists who want to work hard but stay dry. Incorporating a night visibility reflective trim around the sleeves and across the back. Fully taped seams for full garment waterproofing. Soft and comfortable mesh lining. Under arm zipped and large rear ventilation to allow a through flow of cool air. Micro fleece lined draw corded collar. A zipped, easy access large rear pocket, 2 zipped side pockets, Velcro adjustable cuffs and a quick-adjust draw-corded waist. The stow-away press-stud drop-tail allows the rear of the jacket to increase in length by 3.5 inches (particularly useful if you are riding without mud guards). A rear LED bike light attachment tab is also incorporated. The full length zip with a Velcro sealed storm flap will ensure that the rain is kept out. Chest sizes given are the chest sizes this garment will fit. This is a cycling jacket and therefore close-fitting. If you are intending to wear over a fleece for example, please consider ordering the next size up. This jacket is available in 3 colours (Hi-Viz Yellow, Hi-Viz Orange and Hi-Viz Green) and various sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RP9iUAwsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030MGO2I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]], "price": 49.99}}
