{"item_id": "B0030ONQUE", "title": "Sea to Summit X-Mug and X-Bowl Set with Storage Pouch", "description": "For the outdoor enthusiast who likes to keep their gear organized! The two piece X-Set includes a zippered storage pouch with an X Mug and an X Bowl inside.", "text": "Sea to Summit X-Mug and X-Bowl Set with Storage Pouch For the outdoor enthusiast who likes to keep their gear organized! The two piece X-Set includes a zippered storage pouch with an X Mug and an X Bowl inside.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bI6FUQqAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030ONQUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 29.95}}
