{"item_id": "B0030RS6IS", "title": "Schwinn Solar Combo Light", "description": "This combination headlight and taillight set, from iconic cycling brand Schwinn, runs on batteries which are rechargeable via solar energy. Each unit has super-bright LED bulbs, and the rear light has rapid flash, slow flash, and steady modes. Low-profile mounting hardware is included and easy to use.About SchwinnFor more than 100 years, Schwinn has been building bikes that allow riders of all ages and abilities to experience the joy of riding. From \"walk 'n' roll\" kids bikes to the Le Tour Legacy, Schwinn offers a comprehensive line of bikes and related fitness equipment that suit the needs of riders across the United States and around the world. The company's \"Schwinn Quality Standard,\" based on a century of cycling heritage, passion, and expertise, is the foundation of its commitment to creating standard-setting bicycles.", "text": "Schwinn Solar Combo Light This combination headlight and taillight set, from iconic cycling brand Schwinn, runs on batteries which are rechargeable via solar energy. Each unit has super-bright LED bulbs, and the rear light has rapid flash, slow flash, and steady modes. Low-profile mounting hardware is included and easy to use.About SchwinnFor more than 100 years, Schwinn has been building bikes that allow riders of all ages and abilities to experience the joy of riding. From \"walk 'n' roll\" kids bikes to the Le Tour Legacy, Schwinn offers a comprehensive line of bikes and related fitness equipment that suit the needs of riders across the United States and around the world. The company's \"Schwinn Quality Standard,\" based on a century of cycling heritage, passion, and expertise, is the foundation of its commitment to creating standard-setting bicycles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ZNlfc%2BrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030RS6IS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 26.59}}
