{"item_id": "B0030RSDYU", "title": "V-Share Cycling MTB Road Bicycle Helmet Riding Equipment Male And Female Models (Head Circumference 56-62cm and the Head-width Below 17.5cm.please Check the Size Before Buying)", "description": "Stay safe while cycling with adjustable bike helmet. The Thrasher is comfortable in any weather, with integrated flow vents and moisture-wicking pads to keep you dry. To ensure a secure fit, the helmet includes a Dual Fit adjustable design and easy-to-adjust webbing. And riders will love the built-in visor, which provides increased shade while riding.with a flashlight in the helmet's tail.", "text": "V-Share Cycling MTB Road Bicycle Helmet Riding Equipment Male And Female Models (Head Circumference 56-62cm and the Head-width Below 17.5cm.please Check the Size Before Buying) Stay safe while cycling with adjustable bike helmet. The Thrasher is comfortable in any weather, with integrated flow vents and moisture-wicking pads to keep you dry. To ensure a secure fit, the helmet includes a Dual Fit adjustable design and easy-to-adjust webbing. And riders will love the built-in visor, which provides increased shade while riding.with a flashlight in the helmet's tail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U86xMle3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030RSDYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030RSEW6", "title": "Schwinn Women's Starlet Wave Helmet, Green", "description": "The Schwinn Starlet Wave bike helmet offers a lightweight comfort and protection with an aerodynamic design for women riders. The Starlet Wave is offered at a budget-friendly price-point, yet offers advanced features typically reserved for pricier helmets. First and foremost, the helmet provides the custom fit you need for comfort and safety with the Dial Fit system. This system allows you to tension the helmet for an exact fit by turning a dial at the back of the helmet. This eliminates the need for the extra foam spacer cushions common to inexpensive bike helmets, which also can compress and compromise the fit over time. The Dial Fit system also makes it easy to adjust the under-chin strap which features soft, dual-stitch straps for increased comfort. Designed to keep you cool and air circulating especially in hot weather, the Starlet Wave features 21 contoured air vents with exhaust ports that bring cool air in and force hot air out. Finally, the helmet is equipped with an optional snap on/off visor to keep the sun off your face and out of your eyes.", "text": "Schwinn Women's Starlet Wave Helmet, Green The Schwinn Starlet Wave bike helmet offers a lightweight comfort and protection with an aerodynamic design for women riders. The Starlet Wave is offered at a budget-friendly price-point, yet offers advanced features typically reserved for pricier helmets. First and foremost, the helmet provides the custom fit you need for comfort and safety with the Dial Fit system. This system allows you to tension the helmet for an exact fit by turning a dial at the back of the helmet. This eliminates the need for the extra foam spacer cushions common to inexpensive bike helmets, which also can compress and compromise the fit over time. The Dial Fit system also makes it easy to adjust the under-chin strap which features soft, dual-stitch straps for increased comfort. Designed to keep you cool and air circulating especially in hot weather, the Starlet Wave features 21 contoured air vents with exhaust ports that bring cool air in and force hot air out. Finally, the helmet is equipped with an optional snap on/off visor to keep the sun off your face and out of your eyes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51I6XFMiPIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030RSEW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 21.56}}
{"item_id": "B0030RSFQ6", "title": "Schwinn 700c X 38mm Comfort/Hybrid Tire With Kevlar", "description": "The Schwinn 700c Comfort/Hybrid Tire with Kevlar offers a mixed terrain traction pattern to keep your wheels turning smoothly on the road, while providing extra traction when you hit the trail. Built for durability and to reduce the risk of flats, the tire offers durable, steel bead construction with a built-in flat resistant layer for greater protection on and off the road. Ideal for comfort and hybrid bikes, the tire fits 700c wheels and measures 38-millimeters in width.", "text": "Schwinn 700c X 38mm Comfort/Hybrid Tire With Kevlar The Schwinn 700c Comfort/Hybrid Tire with Kevlar offers a mixed terrain traction pattern to keep your wheels turning smoothly on the road, while providing extra traction when you hit the trail. Built for durability and to reduce the risk of flats, the tire offers durable, steel bead construction with a built-in flat resistant layer for greater protection on and off the road. Ideal for comfort and hybrid bikes, the tire fits 700c wheels and measures 38-millimeters in width.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WVcKiRIGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030RSFQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0030U8SU6", "title": "Schwinn Discover Men's Hybrid Bike (700C Wheels)", "description": "Outfitted with an aluminum city frame, an SR Suntour suspension fork to absorb shock, and a padded saddle with a suspension seat post, the Schwinn Discovery men's comfort bike is ideal for commuting to work or cruising down a leisurely bike path. The bike offers such additional features as 21-speed SRAM grip shifters for fast, easy gear changes, a Shimano TX-31 rear derailleur, an SR Suntour alloy crank, Promax alloy linear pull brakes, a swept-back upright handlebar with an adjustable stem, fenders, and a rear gear carrier.About SchwinnFounded in 1895, Schwinn is an American icon that's long been synonymous with quality and innovation. The company has built some of the best-known and best-loved bikes of multiple generations, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, and Homegrown. Today, Schwinn continues to innovate with such releases as the redesigned Sting-Ray, Rocket mountain bikes, and Fastback road bikes. With a continued dedication to quality forever synonymous with the Schwinn name, America's most famous bicycle brand looks forward to providing another century of innovation, freedom, and performance to people of all ages.", "text": "Schwinn Discover Men's Hybrid Bike (700C Wheels) Outfitted with an aluminum city frame, an SR Suntour suspension fork to absorb shock, and a padded saddle with a suspension seat post, the Schwinn Discovery men's comfort bike is ideal for commuting to work or cruising down a leisurely bike path. The bike offers such additional features as 21-speed SRAM grip shifters for fast, easy gear changes, a Shimano TX-31 rear derailleur, an SR Suntour alloy crank, Promax alloy linear pull brakes, a swept-back upright handlebar with an adjustable stem, fenders, and a rear gear carrier.About SchwinnFounded in 1895, Schwinn is an American icon that's long been synonymous with quality and innovation. The company has built some of the best-known and best-loved bikes of multiple generations, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, and Homegrown. Today, Schwinn continues to innovate with such releases as the redesigned Sting-Ray, Rocket mountain bikes, and Fastback road bikes. With a continued dedication to quality forever synonymous with the Schwinn name, America's most famous bicycle brand looks forward to providing another century of innovation, freedom, and performance to people of all ages.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GSf%2Bk36fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030U8SU6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Hybrid Bikes"]], "price": 297.91}}
{"item_id": "B0030U8T14", "title": "Schwinn Volare Hybrid Bike (700C Wheels)", "description": "Outfitted with an aluminum fitness frame, a Schwinn steel road fork that absorbs imperfections in the pavement, and a flat bar that provides a more upright riding experience, the Schwinn's men's Volare road bike is ideal for commuting to work or riding hard on rural roads. The bike offers such additional features as Shimano EasyFire 21-speed shifters, a Shimano TX-51 rear derailleur, alloy linear pull brakes, SR Suntour alloy three-piece cranks, alloy rims, and a quality padded saddle.About SchwinnFounded in 1895, Schwinn is an American icon that's long been synonymous with quality and innovation. The company has built some of the best-known and best-loved bikes of multiple generations, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, and Homegrown. Today, Schwinn continues to innovate with such releases as the redesigned Sting-Ray, Rocket mountain bikes, and Fastback road bikes. With a continued dedication to quality forever synonymous with the Schwinn name, America's most famous bicycle brand looks forward to providing another century of innovation, freedom, and performance to people of all ages.", "text": "Schwinn Volare Hybrid Bike (700C Wheels) Outfitted with an aluminum fitness frame, a Schwinn steel road fork that absorbs imperfections in the pavement, and a flat bar that provides a more upright riding experience, the Schwinn's men's Volare road bike is ideal for commuting to work or riding hard on rural roads. The bike offers such additional features as Shimano EasyFire 21-speed shifters, a Shimano TX-51 rear derailleur, alloy linear pull brakes, SR Suntour alloy three-piece cranks, alloy rims, and a quality padded saddle.About SchwinnFounded in 1895, Schwinn is an American icon that's long been synonymous with quality and innovation. The company has built some of the best-known and best-loved bikes of multiple generations, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, and Homegrown. Today, Schwinn continues to innovate with such releases as the redesigned Sting-Ray, Rocket mountain bikes, and Fastback road bikes. With a continued dedication to quality forever synonymous with the Schwinn name, America's most famous bicycle brand looks forward to providing another century of innovation, freedom, and performance to people of all ages.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H14dBEmfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030U8T14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Comfort Bikes"]], "price": 281.32}}
