{"item_id": "B0030V95P2", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse T6 Rubber Butt Pad", "description": "Easily installed on any T6 or M4 style collapsible stock, this rubber butt pad reduces the weapons felt recoil while positioning the stock to the shoulder for better control. Added texturing ensures a proper stock weld to the shoulder.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse T6 Rubber Butt Pad Easily installed on any T6 or M4 style collapsible stock, this rubber butt pad reduces the weapons felt recoil while positioning the stock to the shoulder for better control. Added texturing ensures a proper stock weld to the shoulder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wJun0woQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0030V95P2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 4.21}}
