{"item_id": "B00313Q51Q", "title": "SE - Compass - Watch Band Clip On, Navigation, 12 Pk", "description": "Set of 12 Precision Watch Band Clip-On Compasses, Bulk Pack These are miniature size rotate-able dial precision compasses These compasses have built in universal clip-ons on the back of the units These are ideal for clipping on watches, belts, purses and pockets These are highly sensitive miniature compasses These are useful for detecting the presence of a magnetic field in watches, instruments and other components These are perfect navigation tool for hunting, hiking and other outdoor activities Measurements are 1 1/8\"x 1\"x 6/8\"", "text": "SE - Compass - Watch Band Clip On, Navigation, 12 Pk Set of 12 Precision Watch Band Clip-On Compasses, Bulk Pack These are miniature size rotate-able dial precision compasses These compasses have built in universal clip-ons on the back of the units These are ideal for clipping on watches, belts, purses and pockets These are highly sensitive miniature compasses These are useful for detecting the presence of a magnetic field in watches, instruments and other components These are perfect navigation tool for hunting, hiking and other outdoor activities Measurements are 1 1/8\"x 1\"x 6/8\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fvJZjz80L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00313Q51Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00314DM6Q", "title": "Arctic Zone Eco Blend 45 Can Freezer Tote", "description": "Go green with great style and function. This insulated grocery bag's exterior is made from rugged Eco Blend recycable material. With a 45 can/6.5 gallon capacity and an easy clean, leak proof lining. The 45 Can Eco Blend Thermal Tote has high density thermal insulation plus a Therma-Flect radiant barrier that reflects heat instead of absorbing it, keeping your perishables and frozen foods chilled for hours. And though the tote is spacious, it's small enough to fit in the back of the car or even on a boat. It's a stylish grocery bag. It's a tough cooler. And it's green. Who could ask for more?", "text": "Arctic Zone Eco Blend 45 Can Freezer Tote Go green with great style and function. This insulated grocery bag's exterior is made from rugged Eco Blend recycable material. With a 45 can/6.5 gallon capacity and an easy clean, leak proof lining. The 45 Can Eco Blend Thermal Tote has high density thermal insulation plus a Therma-Flect radiant barrier that reflects heat instead of absorbing it, keeping your perishables and frozen foods chilled for hours. And though the tote is spacious, it's small enough to fit in the back of the car or even on a boat. It's a stylish grocery bag. It's a tough cooler. And it's green. Who could ask for more?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JNm4A4CkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00314DM6Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooler Accessories"]], "price": 13.97}}
