{"item_id": "B003178LWS", "title": "SE CCV18 1 Precision \"Watch Band Clip-On\" Navigation Compass Tool", "description": "Precision Watch Band Clip-On Compass, Factory Sealed This compass has a built in universal clip-on on the back of the unit This is ideal for clipping on watches, belts, purses and pockets This is a highly sensitive miniature compass This item is also useful for detecting the presence of a magnetic field in watches, instruments and other components This compass is a perfect navigation tool for hunting, hiking and other outdoor activities Measurements are 1 1/8-Inchx 1-Inchx 6/8-Inch Perfect miniature size rotate-able dial precision compass", "text": "SE CCV18 1 Precision \"Watch Band Clip-On\" Navigation Compass Tool Precision Watch Band Clip-On Compass, Factory Sealed This compass has a built in universal clip-on on the back of the unit This is ideal for clipping on watches, belts, purses and pockets This is a highly sensitive miniature compass This item is also useful for detecting the presence of a magnetic field in watches, instruments and other components This compass is a perfect navigation tool for hunting, hiking and other outdoor activities Measurements are 1 1/8-Inchx 1-Inchx 6/8-Inch Perfect miniature size rotate-able dial precision compass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316mWh1ophL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003178LWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 3.0}}
{"item_id": "B00318BKGQ", "title": "Halo Skull Cap", "description": "4-way stretch micro-mesh top releases heat for year-round comfortOne size fits both men and womenPatented SweatBlock Seal channels sweat back and away from the eyes and faceDryline fabric absorbs sweat, wicks moisture and dries quicklyStays in place during any activity and works great under helmets", "text": "Halo Skull Cap 4-way stretch micro-mesh top releases heat for year-round comfortOne size fits both men and womenPatented SweatBlock Seal channels sweat back and away from the eyes and faceDryline fabric absorbs sweat, wicks moisture and dries quicklyStays in place during any activity and works great under helmets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vogebE8QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00318BKGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 14.77}}
