{"item_id": "B0031ESIVK", "title": "ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Operated Personal Pest Control Appliance in Olive Green", "description": "The ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Repellent Personal Pest Control Battery Operated Appliance is a convenient, lightweight and odor-free way to repel bugs and other pests. Without greasy, sticky or oily sprays and lotions, the mosquito repellent appliance offers a silent, no open flame option in establishing a protective barrier for pests. The ThermaCELL odor-free repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, which is a synthetic copy of the natural mosquito repellent found in chrysanthemum flowers. Weighing only 11.2-ounces, the personal appliance offers you a 15-foot by 15-foot zone of protection that is the equivalent of an average sized deck, patio or campsite. To use the MR-GJ appliance, insert the butane cartridge into the base of the appliance, then slide the repellent mat into the appliance. Turn the dial clockwise into the ON position and click the START button to turn on the device. The heating element will warm the mat and begin vaporizing the repellent into the air. Within 15 to 30 minutes, the 225 square foot of biting pest protection will be created by the MR-GJ appliance. The ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Repellent Personal Pest Control Appliance comes in an olive green color and comes with (1) pocket sized reusable appliance, (1) butane cartridge, and (3) repellent mats. Each butane cartridge lasts for about (12) hours and each repellent mat lasts for up to (4) hours. All ThermaCELL products feature a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "text": "ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Operated Personal Pest Control Appliance in Olive Green The ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Repellent Personal Pest Control Battery Operated Appliance is a convenient, lightweight and odor-free way to repel bugs and other pests. Without greasy, sticky or oily sprays and lotions, the mosquito repellent appliance offers a silent, no open flame option in establishing a protective barrier for pests. The ThermaCELL odor-free repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, which is a synthetic copy of the natural mosquito repellent found in chrysanthemum flowers. Weighing only 11.2-ounces, the personal appliance offers you a 15-foot by 15-foot zone of protection that is the equivalent of an average sized deck, patio or campsite. To use the MR-GJ appliance, insert the butane cartridge into the base of the appliance, then slide the repellent mat into the appliance. Turn the dial clockwise into the ON position and click the START button to turn on the device. The heating element will warm the mat and begin vaporizing the repellent into the air. Within 15 to 30 minutes, the 225 square foot of biting pest protection will be created by the MR-GJ appliance. The ThermaCELL MR-GJ Mosquito Repellent Personal Pest Control Appliance comes in an olive green color and comes with (1) pocket sized reusable appliance, (1) butane cartridge, and (3) repellent mats. Each butane cartridge lasts for about (12) hours and each repellent mat lasts for up to (4) hours. All ThermaCELL products feature a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310MhsBKVBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031ESIVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermacell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 22.25}}
{"item_id": "B0031FHSII", "title": "Sightmark SM39005 243, 308, 7.62 x 54 Rifle Laser Bore Sight", "description": "Sightmark SM39005 Features: -Precision accuracy. -Reliable and durable. -Fastest gun zeroing and sighting system. -Reduce wasted cartridges and shells. -Compact. -Lightweight. -Easy to pack and travel. -Comes with a carrying case. -Protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Sightmark SM39005 243, 308, 7.62 x 54 Rifle Laser Bore Sight Sightmark SM39005 Features: -Precision accuracy. -Reliable and durable. -Fastest gun zeroing and sighting system. -Reduce wasted cartridges and shells. -Compact. -Lightweight. -Easy to pack and travel. -Comes with a carrying case. -Protected by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EJBkU5h7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031FHSII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0031O490E", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Top Tube Bag", "description": "With a lightweight minimalist design, the top tube bag is perfect for a daily commute or day trip. It actually sits on the top tube and has a soft non-scratch base and strap protectors that won't damage paint on bikes. It attaches to both the top tube and the bike stem with Velcro straps.Made of durable 1680D nylon, the top tube bag has reinforced padded sides for shock protection.Compact compartments store additional cycling essentials such as phones, wallets, keys, tools or small cameras. External mesh pocket holds items for immediate access. SpecificationsMaterial: 1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapsCapacity:0.4 LDimensions:5.5\" x 3.5\" x 1.2\"Weight:0.2 lbs.", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Top Tube Bag With a lightweight minimalist design, the top tube bag is perfect for a daily commute or day trip. It actually sits on the top tube and has a soft non-scratch base and strap protectors that won't damage paint on bikes. It attaches to both the top tube and the bike stem with Velcro straps.Made of durable 1680D nylon, the top tube bag has reinforced padded sides for shock protection.Compact compartments store additional cycling essentials such as phones, wallets, keys, tools or small cameras. External mesh pocket holds items for immediate access. SpecificationsMaterial: 1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapsCapacity:0.4 LDimensions:5.5\" x 3.5\" x 1.2\"Weight:0.2 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Af85oSmUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031O490E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 32.54}}
{"item_id": "B0031P5DIK", "title": "Ka-Bar USA Leather Sheath, 5-1/4 Inch, Brown", "description": "KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "text": "Ka-Bar USA Leather Sheath, 5-1/4 Inch, Brown KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zgYqkTg3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031P5DIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.01}}
{"item_id": "B0031QCS8C", "title": "ProSource Exercise Fitness Gymnastic Rings", "description": "Challenge yourself in a whole new way with this set of ProSource Fitness gymnastic rings. The rings are made of premium-quality Lexan, and include extra-long 17-foot straps for greater flexibility. Once installed, you can use the rings for such exercises as push-ups, iron cross, dips, pull-ups, and many more. The unique nature of the rings creates a fun, athletic challenge while toning and strengthening your muscles in a coordinated, complementary manner. Easy to install and adjust, the rings are also light enough to bring along while traveling. And you don't have to be an expert to use the rings, as they're easily accessible for beginners but gently progress toward harder skills.", "text": "ProSource Exercise Fitness Gymnastic Rings Challenge yourself in a whole new way with this set of ProSource Fitness gymnastic rings. The rings are made of premium-quality Lexan, and include extra-long 17-foot straps for greater flexibility. Once installed, you can use the rings for such exercises as push-ups, iron cross, dips, pull-ups, and many more. The unique nature of the rings creates a fun, athletic challenge while toning and strengthening your muscles in a coordinated, complementary manner. Easy to install and adjust, the rings are also light enough to bring along while traveling. And you don't have to be an expert to use the rings, as they're easily accessible for beginners but gently progress toward harder skills.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j3Ag59ISL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031QCS8C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Gymnastics", "Training Equipment", "Skill Shapes"]], "price": 22.5}}
{"item_id": "B0031QK4RE", "title": "Viking Tactics 2 Point Padded Sling Black", "description": "The Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling provides added comfort for heavier firearms. Same great features as original sling. The Viking Tactics, Inc. Wide (padded) Sling was developed after listening to feedback from our customers. Customers with heavier firearms who wanted a wider, more comfortable sling with the same great features of the original Viking Tactics, Inc. sling. The Viking Tactics Wide Sling is made with a shoulder strap with closed cell foam for increased comfort. The forward adjustable portion of the sling remains the same as the original sling, giving you quick, easy adjustments from any position.", "text": "Viking Tactics 2 Point Padded Sling Black The Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling provides added comfort for heavier firearms. Same great features as original sling. The Viking Tactics, Inc. Wide (padded) Sling was developed after listening to feedback from our customers. Customers with heavier firearms who wanted a wider, more comfortable sling with the same great features of the original Viking Tactics, Inc. sling. The Viking Tactics Wide Sling is made with a shoulder strap with closed cell foam for increased comfort. The forward adjustable portion of the sling remains the same as the original sling, giving you quick, easy adjustments from any position.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DFXEhxVBL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031QK4RE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0031R7DQ8", "title": "Well P90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric Gun AEG - D90H", "description": "Well P90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric Gun AEG This is a brand name P90 made by Well. This rifle has full auto and semi auto capabilities. The Well brand is very durable and accurate. Full size, Full auto, Functional safety switch. Includes battery & charger & Sample BBs. Additional Accessories: BB trap, safety goggle, tactical sling, laser sights, flash light, mock silencer, cleaning rod. Manufacturer: WELL Velocity: 220 fps (0.12g BB) Capacity: 200 rounds All airsoft guns are required to have the tip (1/4 inch) of the barrel permanently colored in blaze orange. Includes Battery & Charger Flashlight Scope Silencer Sling Starter Pack of BBs Goggles", "text": "Well P90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric Gun AEG - D90H Well P90 Laser Red Dot Airsoft Electric Gun AEG This is a brand name P90 made by Well. This rifle has full auto and semi auto capabilities. The Well brand is very durable and accurate. Full size, Full auto, Functional safety switch. Includes battery & charger & Sample BBs. Additional Accessories: BB trap, safety goggle, tactical sling, laser sights, flash light, mock silencer, cleaning rod. Manufacturer: WELL Velocity: 220 fps (0.12g BB) Capacity: 200 rounds All airsoft guns are required to have the tip (1/4 inch) of the barrel permanently colored in blaze orange. Includes Battery & Charger Flashlight Scope Silencer Sling Starter Pack of BBs Goggles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312nCDFIg4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031R7DQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0031SB1VU", "title": "Kelty Camp Sink (Azul)", "description": "Bring the conveniences of home to the campground with the Camp Sink. The freestanding design and integrated drying racks make after-meal clean-up quick and effortless. You can also zip the lid closed to keep your dishes stored and organized for your next adventure.", "text": "Kelty Camp Sink (Azul) Bring the conveniences of home to the campground with the Camp Sink. The freestanding design and integrated drying racks make after-meal clean-up quick and effortless. You can also zip the lid closed to keep your dishes stored and organized for your next adventure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Gv24b6FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031SB1VU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0031SRKHO", "title": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling Tan", "description": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Coyote Tan VTAC-MK2-CT", "text": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling Tan Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Coyote Tan VTAC-MK2-CT", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wj%2BwgyUjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031SRKHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bravo Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B0031SX97O", "title": "Viking Tactics Light Mount - Black", "description": "Consistent with the VTAC Mission, the Viking Tactics Light Mount was designed for today's modern warriors- providing a light-weight and versatile option to mount a flashlight onto any Picatinny or Weaver rail system. Made of a Modified Acrylic PVC Alloy Thermoplastic with high impact and abrasion resistant qualities which have been proven to withstand the harshest environments, the Viking Tactics Light Mount is designed so that you can mount your light so that it is our of your field of view and easily activated. This new and improved version of the original VTAC Light Mount Design gives you enormous flexibility. It will allow you to mount most lights with a .80 or 1\" diameter and will fit the VTAC-L4 as well as the inexpensive Surefire G2 Nitrolon, Executive Series, and many others. The sleek VTAC design even offers a position in the insert to accommodate the clip on the light. Depending on your mounting preferences, the VTAC can be mounted in such a way that the light can be activated using a tape switch or it can be mounted in such a manner allowing you activate your light using the push button on the back of the light. (Note: Flashlights and firearms not included and must be purchased separately). The VTAC Light Mount is impervious to most chemicals, solvents and oils and its highly advanced thermoplastics will not shrink. With the high quality and innovative design that you expect from a Viking Tactics product, the VTAC Light Mount will keep you in the light and out of the dark", "text": "Viking Tactics Light Mount - Black Consistent with the VTAC Mission, the Viking Tactics Light Mount was designed for today's modern warriors- providing a light-weight and versatile option to mount a flashlight onto any Picatinny or Weaver rail system. Made of a Modified Acrylic PVC Alloy Thermoplastic with high impact and abrasion resistant qualities which have been proven to withstand the harshest environments, the Viking Tactics Light Mount is designed so that you can mount your light so that it is our of your field of view and easily activated. This new and improved version of the original VTAC Light Mount Design gives you enormous flexibility. It will allow you to mount most lights with a .80 or 1\" diameter and will fit the VTAC-L4 as well as the inexpensive Surefire G2 Nitrolon, Executive Series, and many others. The sleek VTAC design even offers a position in the insert to accommodate the clip on the light. Depending on your mounting preferences, the VTAC can be mounted in such a way that the light can be activated using a tape switch or it can be mounted in such a manner allowing you activate your light using the push button on the back of the light. (Note: Flashlights and firearms not included and must be purchased separately). The VTAC Light Mount is impervious to most chemicals, solvents and oils and its highly advanced thermoplastics will not shrink. With the high quality and innovative design that you expect from a Viking Tactics product, the VTAC Light Mount will keep you in the light and out of the dark", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mpcoZCQ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031SX97O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 17.15}}
{"item_id": "B0031VXG4C", "title": "JG M4 S-System Airsoft AEG Rifle 2010 Upgraded Version", "description": "Description The JG M4 S-System is an exact replica of the famous assault rifle that is in use with the U.S. Military today. It comes with a retractable stock that makes this gun great for CQB and outdoor. The working charging handle gives this gun a realistic action that even higher priced guns like CA do not have. The S-System also has flip-up sights that fold down to give optics an unobstructed view. It also features an exclusive rail system that has a rail that bridges the traditional gap between the handguard and the receiver. JG AEGs are fully upgradeable and compatible with most after market external and internal parts. This airsoft gun includes a metal hi-capacity magazine and is also compatible with other major brands of standard and high capacity after market magazines. : S-System Style RIS : Retractable Stock : Flip-UP Front & Rear Sights : Functional Bolt & Charging Handle : high torque motor : precision metal gearbox : M120 grade spring : Integrated barrel for increased shooting accuracy and starting speed", "text": "JG M4 S-System Airsoft AEG Rifle 2010 Upgraded Version Description The JG M4 S-System is an exact replica of the famous assault rifle that is in use with the U.S. Military today. It comes with a retractable stock that makes this gun great for CQB and outdoor. The working charging handle gives this gun a realistic action that even higher priced guns like CA do not have. The S-System also has flip-up sights that fold down to give optics an unobstructed view. It also features an exclusive rail system that has a rail that bridges the traditional gap between the handguard and the receiver. JG AEGs are fully upgradeable and compatible with most after market external and internal parts. This airsoft gun includes a metal hi-capacity magazine and is also compatible with other major brands of standard and high capacity after market magazines. : S-System Style RIS : Retractable Stock : Flip-UP Front & Rear Sights : Functional Bolt & Charging Handle : high torque motor : precision metal gearbox : M120 grade spring : Integrated barrel for increased shooting accuracy and starting speed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AooL22jiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031VXG4C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jing Gong", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 157.95}}
{"item_id": "B0031Y4S0U", "title": "Bodyglide Skin Glide Anti-Friction Liquified Powder - 1.60 oz", "description": "Safe on neoprene with no greasy mess. Washes away with soap and water.", "text": "Bodyglide Skin Glide Anti-Friction Liquified Powder - 1.60 oz Safe on neoprene with no greasy mess. Washes away with soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Aa3lLofL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031Y4S0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BodyGlide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Personal Care Products"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0031Y4TRW", "title": "Bodyglide Her Skin Formula - Men's", "description": "Women swim, ride, and run as hard as men, even if we do have curves. But those curves can lead to chafing: sports bras, waistbands, underarms -- any place that isn't covered with skin-tight fabric is fair game for rubbing and skin damage. Bodyglide Her Skin Formula is an anti-chafe formula specifically for active women. Developed using only natural, plant-based ingredients, Bodyglide Her Skin is a lightweight formula that creates a natural barrier to keep your skin moisturized. At the same time, your skin is allowed to breathe and perspiration escapes to keep you dry. It stays where you need it and doesn't end up feeling cold or slimy. Additionally, the glide comes in a portable stick form so you can throw it in your bag and take it with you. It's perfect for bra straps on a humid day, inner thighs in shorts skirts, or between your toes.Bodyglide's Her Skin Formula comes in a . 8 ounce size.", "text": "Bodyglide Her Skin Formula - Men's Women swim, ride, and run as hard as men, even if we do have curves. But those curves can lead to chafing: sports bras, waistbands, underarms -- any place that isn't covered with skin-tight fabric is fair game for rubbing and skin damage. Bodyglide Her Skin Formula is an anti-chafe formula specifically for active women. Developed using only natural, plant-based ingredients, Bodyglide Her Skin is a lightweight formula that creates a natural barrier to keep your skin moisturized. At the same time, your skin is allowed to breathe and perspiration escapes to keep you dry. It stays where you need it and doesn't end up feeling cold or slimy. Additionally, the glide comes in a portable stick form so you can throw it in your bag and take it with you. It's perfect for bra straps on a humid day, inner thighs in shorts skirts, or between your toes.Bodyglide's Her Skin Formula comes in a . 8 ounce size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KWxlPH-ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031Y4TRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BodyGlide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B0031YQOZC", "title": "O'Neill Reactor Reef Boot (Black/Coal)", "description": "ONEILL REACTOR REEF BOOTS 2mm 3285A81COLOR: BLACK/COALWater shoes provide protection for feet and traction when walking. As with any footgear, please use caution when walking on a wet and slippery surfaceUnisex Slipon design w/heel tab Lightweight Ergonomic flex sole Neoprene mesh for drainage 2mm Neoprene Super tough sole Imported", "text": "O'Neill Reactor Reef Boot (Black/Coal) ONEILL REACTOR REEF BOOTS 2mm 3285A81COLOR: BLACK/COALWater shoes provide protection for feet and traction when walking. As with any footgear, please use caution when walking on a wet and slippery surfaceUnisex Slipon design w/heel tab Lightweight Ergonomic flex sole Neoprene mesh for drainage 2mm Neoprene Super tough sole Imported", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aH5h8MvwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031YQOZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Surfing Booties"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0031YS5N6", "title": "O'Neill Superlite USCG Vest (Blk/Met/Blk)", "description": "The soft and comfortable O'Neill Superlite flotation vest features closed cell PVC marine foam for optimal buoyancy while minimizing bulk, as well as a durable coated nylon shell that will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use. Quick release buckles make for easy on-and-off, and the vest is United States Coast Guard (USCG) certified.WarrantyO'Neill wetsuits include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About O'NeillBack in1952, Jack O'Neill opened the first Surf Shop in a garage. He shaped balsa surfboards and sold accessories like paraffin wax and vests he started gluing together from neoprene. When the vests started selling, Jack decided to go into the wetsuit business, and the Surf Shop became a local gathering place. Soon surfers were riding more waves, and riding them better, in large measure because they could enjoy longer sessions in cold water in their new neoprene suits.Surfers' territories expanded -- Northern California became a year-round surf zone, and people were surfing New Hampshire and Rhode Island in January. Explorations and transplants to surf culture opened up Oregon, Washington, and Canada. O'Neill eventually relocated to a large manufacturing facility, and his surf shop has morphed into an international company, leading the world's wetsuit market and innovating beach lifestyle sportswear in the US, Japan, and Europe.", "text": "O'Neill Superlite USCG Vest (Blk/Met/Blk) The soft and comfortable O'Neill Superlite flotation vest features closed cell PVC marine foam for optimal buoyancy while minimizing bulk, as well as a durable coated nylon shell that will hold up to years of heavy outdoor use. Quick release buckles make for easy on-and-off, and the vest is United States Coast Guard (USCG) certified.WarrantyO'Neill wetsuits include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About O'NeillBack in1952, Jack O'Neill opened the first Surf Shop in a garage. He shaped balsa surfboards and sold accessories like paraffin wax and vests he started gluing together from neoprene. When the vests started selling, Jack decided to go into the wetsuit business, and the Surf Shop became a local gathering place. Soon surfers were riding more waves, and riding them better, in large measure because they could enjoy longer sessions in cold water in their new neoprene suits.Surfers' territories expanded -- Northern California became a year-round surf zone, and people were surfing New Hampshire and Rhode Island in January. Explorations and transplants to surf culture opened up Oregon, Washington, and Canada. O'Neill eventually relocated to a large manufacturing facility, and his surf shop has morphed into an international company, leading the world's wetsuit market and innovating beach lifestyle sportswear in the US, Japan, and Europe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KHa%2Bue8qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031YS5N6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0031YU2R8", "title": "Pflueger President Spinning Reel", "description": "• 9 stainless steel ball bearings (6920 has 7 ball bearings)• Instant anti-reverse one-way clutch bearing• Machined, ported and double anodized aluminum spool with distinctive hole pattern for lighter weight• Braid ready spool• Titanium co", "text": "Pflueger President Spinning Reel • 9 stainless steel ball bearings (6920 has 7 ball bearings)• Instant anti-reverse one-way clutch bearing• Machined, ported and double anodized aluminum spool with distinctive hole pattern for lighter weight• Braid ready spool• Titanium co", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cNpUuuT4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0031YU2R8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00320OJAW", "title": "Topeak RaceRocket Master Blaster Bicycle Pump", "description": "Designed to meet the demands of a professional racing and training schedule this elegant and sleek mini pump features a full aluminum body, head and pump handle. An extendable hose helps take stress off the valve stem and the dependable single action stroke fills tires fast. The RaceRockets compact size easily fits in a jersey pocket and its low weight is welcome on long training rides and endurance races.", "text": "Topeak RaceRocket Master Blaster Bicycle Pump Designed to meet the demands of a professional racing and training schedule this elegant and sleek mini pump features a full aluminum body, head and pump handle. An extendable hose helps take stress off the valve stem and the dependable single action stroke fills tires fast. The RaceRockets compact size easily fits in a jersey pocket and its low weight is welcome on long training rides and endurance races.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BejFVEJDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00320OJAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B00322DOWY", "title": "Cold Steel 27TLCH Recon Clip Point", "description": "Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry and our Recon 1 tactical folders are setting a standard that's hard to beat. Why? Because they are as tough as nails and will cut like a chain saw! Every facet of their construction has been over engineered to make them as strong, durable and effective as humanly possible. The blades are made out of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched and the handles feature G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped for a terrific non slip grip.", "text": "Cold Steel 27TLCH Recon Clip Point Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry and our Recon 1 tactical folders are setting a standard that's hard to beat. Why? Because they are as tough as nails and will cut like a chain saw! Every facet of their construction has been over engineered to make them as strong, durable and effective as humanly possible. The blades are made out of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched and the handles feature G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped for a terrific non slip grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wl3l3As8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322DOWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.35}}
{"item_id": "B00322DOXI", "title": "Cold Steel 29TLC Voyager Large", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. If you like serrations, you'll really appreciate our exclusive pattern. It features groups of very small, sharply pointed teeth separated by wide, shallow arcs so it will rip smoothly yet very aggressively through a wide variety of tough fibrous materials without snagging or hanging up. The Voyager Series also offers all the other latest refinements in lock-back construction including lightning quick, one-handed opening, state of the art mechanical fasteners, massively oversized pivot pins that are fully adjustable and properly hardened, and dual stainless steel pocket clips for ambidextrous carry and deployment. The Grivory handles feature 6061 heat treated aluminum liners for the utmost in strength and stiffness and are ergonomically designed to afford a wide array of grip options including the palm reinforced forward grip for which they are particularly well suited. Grivory is unparalleled as a handle material as it is considerably stronger than Zytel and, when deeply textured, offers a terrific non-slip grip. As an added bonus, it's impervious to moisture and won't crack, warp or shrink and remains remarkably resistant to abrasion or discoloration. As tools these lightweight, super sharp knives are appropriate in almost any environment from hunting and camping to hiking and general utility chores. They can also readily fill specialty functions such as a boat or river knife, chute knife or police/military and survival/rescue applications.", "text": "Cold Steel 29TLC Voyager Large The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. If you like serrations, you'll really appreciate our exclusive pattern. It features groups of very small, sharply pointed teeth separated by wide, shallow arcs so it will rip smoothly yet very aggressively through a wide variety of tough fibrous materials without snagging or hanging up. The Voyager Series also offers all the other latest refinements in lock-back construction including lightning quick, one-handed opening, state of the art mechanical fasteners, massively oversized pivot pins that are fully adjustable and properly hardened, and dual stainless steel pocket clips for ambidextrous carry and deployment. The Grivory handles feature 6061 heat treated aluminum liners for the utmost in strength and stiffness and are ergonomically designed to afford a wide array of grip options including the palm reinforced forward grip for which they are particularly well suited. Grivory is unparalleled as a handle material as it is considerably stronger than Zytel and, when deeply textured, offers a terrific non-slip grip. As an added bonus, it's impervious to moisture and won't crack, warp or shrink and remains remarkably resistant to abrasion or discoloration. As tools these lightweight, super sharp knives are appropriate in almost any environment from hunting and camping to hiking and general utility chores. They can also readily fill specialty functions such as a boat or river knife, chute knife or police/military and survival/rescue applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K8ajrpm-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322DOXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B00322DOY2", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager Vaquero Serrated Edge Knife", "description": "Cold Steel Voyager Vaquero Serrated Edge Knife", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager Vaquero Serrated Edge Knife Cold Steel Voyager Vaquero Serrated Edge Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31z%2B9Pn7mAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322DOY2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00322FPBW", "title": "Cold Steel Peace Keeper I in San Mai III Knives", "description": "All of the knives featured in our Battle Ready Classics Series have been made by Cold Steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. Frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price.The answer was to offer them in our famous San Mai III steel. Made in Japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, San Mai III has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening. Over the years, other \"super steels\" have come and gone but San Mai III remains as the most proven high performance stainless steel in the world. If you want a combat knife you can bet your life on, and reasonably priced, check out our Battle ReSpecifications:Blade Length : 7\"Overall Length : 12 1/3\"Steel : VG-1 San Mai IIIWeight : 7.9 ozHandle : 5 1/4\" Long KratonPocket Clip : Stainless Pocket / Belt ClipSheath : Secure-Ex Sheath", "text": "Cold Steel Peace Keeper I in San Mai III Knives All of the knives featured in our Battle Ready Classics Series have been made by Cold Steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. Frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price.The answer was to offer them in our famous San Mai III steel. Made in Japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, San Mai III has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening. Over the years, other \"super steels\" have come and gone but San Mai III remains as the most proven high performance stainless steel in the world. If you want a combat knife you can bet your life on, and reasonably priced, check out our Battle ReSpecifications:Blade Length : 7\"Overall Length : 12 1/3\"Steel : VG-1 San Mai IIIWeight : 7.9 ozHandle : 5 1/4\" Long KratonPocket Clip : Stainless Pocket / Belt ClipSheath : Secure-Ex Sheath", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YSX0fen7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322FPBW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00322FPC6", "title": "Cold Steel 27TLT Recon I Tanto Point", "description": "Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer.To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black coated finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, the coating is a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black finishHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel 27TLT Recon I Tanto Point Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer.To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black coated finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, the coating is a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black finishHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SLN6IL7lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322FPC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 67.99}}
{"item_id": "B00322FPCQ", "title": "Cold Steel 29TLT Voyager Large Tanto", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time. Made of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless w/ Stone Wash Finish.", "text": "Cold Steel 29TLT Voyager Large Tanto The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time. Made of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless w/ Stone Wash Finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31odKtTaPZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322FPCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 37.3}}
{"item_id": "B00322FPDU", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Tanto Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous AUS-8A IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of AUS-8A IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Tanto Plain Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous AUS-8A IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of AUS-8A IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LzT-FROhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322FPDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 42.6}}
{"item_id": "B00322HR1S", "title": "Cold Steel Counter Point I and II Folding Knives - 10ALC/10AMC Out", "description": "Counter Point folders offer almost all the same benefits as the Counter TAC boot knife series but in a smaller, lighter, and more easily concealed package. The blades are in a classic boot knife shape with long false edges and needle sharp points to guarantee the ultimate in penetration. The handles are also reminiscent of the Counter TAC's; Injection molded from Grivory with steel liners to enhance their strength and rigidity. They offer an unusually secure grip for their diminutive size. They're carefully sculptured and contoured with strategically placed holes to reduce weight, and they sport a unique thumb rest built into the butt, affording excellent purchase and a wide variety of grip options. While no folding knife can ever hope to compete with a fixed blade boot knife in overall strength, the Counter Point folders come much closer than any competitor in their size range due to the revolutionary Tri-Ad lock. Designed to withstand horrendous stress and strain, it shrugs off impact from any angle without fail and offers a huge margin of safety for your precious fingers. To enable your Counter Point to be swiftly drawn and ready for action they are equipped with fully ambidextrous pocket clips and thumb studs. Clipped to a boot top, pocket or waistband, the Counter Points are just about invisible and so light they truly can be carried 24-7.", "text": "Cold Steel Counter Point I and II Folding Knives - 10ALC/10AMC Out Counter Point folders offer almost all the same benefits as the Counter TAC boot knife series but in a smaller, lighter, and more easily concealed package. The blades are in a classic boot knife shape with long false edges and needle sharp points to guarantee the ultimate in penetration. The handles are also reminiscent of the Counter TAC's; Injection molded from Grivory with steel liners to enhance their strength and rigidity. They offer an unusually secure grip for their diminutive size. They're carefully sculptured and contoured with strategically placed holes to reduce weight, and they sport a unique thumb rest built into the butt, affording excellent purchase and a wide variety of grip options. While no folding knife can ever hope to compete with a fixed blade boot knife in overall strength, the Counter Point folders come much closer than any competitor in their size range due to the revolutionary Tri-Ad lock. Designed to withstand horrendous stress and strain, it shrugs off impact from any angle without fail and offers a huge margin of safety for your precious fingers. To enable your Counter Point to be swiftly drawn and ready for action they are equipped with fully ambidextrous pocket clips and thumb studs. Clipped to a boot top, pocket or waistband, the Counter Points are just about invisible and so light they truly can be carried 24-7.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HrPWTo0aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322HR1S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00322HR2C", "title": "Cold Steel Recon 1 Tactical Knife with G-10 Handle Tanto Point with Black Blade, ComboEdge", "description": "Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The ComboEdge blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer.To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black coated finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, the knife is coated with a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black finishHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel Recon 1 Tactical Knife with G-10 Handle Tanto Point with Black Blade, ComboEdge Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The ComboEdge blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer.To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black coated finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, the knife is coated with a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black finishHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hPaUbUdRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322HR2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 65.07}}
{"item_id": "B00322HR3G", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Tanto Combo Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Tanto Combo Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r-JcANTWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322HR3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 30.22}}
{"item_id": "B00322JP04", "title": "Cold Steel Recon 1 Tactical Knife with G-10 Handle Clip Point and Black Blade", "description": "Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The clip-point blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer. Do not put any pressure on the back of the blade until the locking lever is depressed To close the knife and using it regularly (with time it will break in)To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black Teflon finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, Teflon is a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the non-Teflon coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.Do not put any pressure on the back of the blade until the locking lever is depressed.Close the knife and use it regularly so that with time it will break in.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black Teflon finishBlade edge: Clip pointHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "text": "Cold Steel Recon 1 Tactical Knife with G-10 Handle Clip Point and Black Blade Cold Steel is famous for raising the bar in the knife industry. The Recon 1 continues the trend with its tough-as-nails build and chainsaw-like performance, setting a standard that's tough to beat. Every facet of the Recon 1's construction has been over-engineered to make it as strong, durable, and effective as humanly possible. The clip-point blade is made of imported Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel that's been vacuum heat treated and sub-zero quenched, while the handle features G-10 laminate scales artfully contoured and scalloped to produce a superior nonslip grip. Plus, the knife is held together by the latest in high-strength mechanical fasteners and further anchored by a 6061 heat-treated spacer. Do not put any pressure on the back of the blade until the locking lever is depressed To close the knife and using it regularly (with time it will break in)To complement the knife's tactical mission, Cold Steel gave the Recon 1 a tough, black Teflon finish, which gives the blade three major tactical advantages. First, it helps the blade resist rust. Second, it eliminates glare and light reflections, which otherwise might give the user away. And third, Teflon is a superior lubricant, which causes the blade to slip through even tough material with markedly less friction. This means you can cut deeper and far longer than with the non-Teflon coated blade. Cold Steel also added a thumb disc and extra-strong pocket clip, making the Recon 1 easy to open and carry. The clip is completely ambidextrous, and its small size is designed to keep the palm comfortable under protracted use. Finally, the knife is outfitted with the company's revolutionary Tri Ad lock, which practically eliminates lock failure.Do not put any pressure on the back of the blade until the locking lever is depressed.Close the knife and use it regularly so that with time it will break in.SpecificationsBlade length: 4 inchesBlade thickness: 3.5mmOverall length: 9-3/8 inchesSteel: Japanese Aus 8A stainless with black Teflon finishBlade edge: Clip pointHandle: 5-3/8-inch Long G-10Pocket clip: Stainless pocket/belt clipWeight: 5.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31U1ejI53SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322JP04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B00322JP0E", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Clip Point Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A you¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Clip Point Plain Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A you¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c1eF57GaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322JP0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.98}}
{"item_id": "B00322LQA6", "title": "Cold Steel Recon Tanto Black Kraton Handle", "description": "All of the knives featured in our battle ready classics series have been made by cold steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price. the answer was to offer them in our famous san mai iii steel. Made in japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, san mai iii has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening.", "text": "Cold Steel Recon Tanto Black Kraton Handle All of the knives featured in our battle ready classics series have been made by cold steel for many years and are well proven in the field as well as in hand to hand combat. frankly, we have been scratching our heads trying to figure out how we could improve them without drastically raising their price. the answer was to offer them in our famous san mai iii steel. Made in japan according to our strict standards since the mid 1980's, san mai iii has proven unsurpassed in strength, toughness, sharpness and ease of re-sharpening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/210Ggb4NUeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322LQA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 114.88}}
{"item_id": "B00322LQB0", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Tanto Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A Stainless wish Stone Wash Finish and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless with Stone Wash Finish, you¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager Med. Tanto Plain Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A Stainless wish Stone Wash Finish and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless with Stone Wash Finish, you¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dWc4V%2BNsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322LQB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B00322NAE6", "title": "Cold Steel Pendleton Lite Hunter Black Poly Handle", "description": "Back in 1973, Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson bought the first knife that renowned customer maker Lloyd Pendleton ever made, and the two friends have now collaborated to produce variations of Pendleton's popular Hunter model. In fabricating the knives, Cold Steel has duplicated Pendleton's hand-made work as accurately as possible, with blades honed to a fine keen. Each knife's handle has contours and cross sections exactly mapped to Pendleton's originals, with durable Secure-Ex sheaths.The Lite Hunter features a drop point blade, modest guard, hollowed bolster area, and flared but to aid retention. German 4116 stainless steel is affordable but high performing, and the Kray-Ex handle holds up to all kinds of environmental and use-based abuses.Don't let the small size fool you -- the knife offers serious cutting power.Specifications3.625-inch blade length8.5-inch overall length4.875-inch, high impact polypropylene handle4116 German stainless steel blade2.7-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Pendleton Lite Hunter Black Poly Handle Back in 1973, Cold Steel President Lynn Thompson bought the first knife that renowned customer maker Lloyd Pendleton ever made, and the two friends have now collaborated to produce variations of Pendleton's popular Hunter model. In fabricating the knives, Cold Steel has duplicated Pendleton's hand-made work as accurately as possible, with blades honed to a fine keen. Each knife's handle has contours and cross sections exactly mapped to Pendleton's originals, with durable Secure-Ex sheaths.The Lite Hunter features a drop point blade, modest guard, hollowed bolster area, and flared but to aid retention. German 4116 stainless steel is affordable but high performing, and the Kray-Ex handle holds up to all kinds of environmental and use-based abuses.Don't let the small size fool you -- the knife offers serious cutting power.Specifications3.625-inch blade length8.5-inch overall length4.875-inch, high impact polypropylene handle4116 German stainless steel blade2.7-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheathWarrantyAll Cold Steel products are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i-9uW8LUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322NAE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 16.89}}
{"item_id": "B00322NAEG", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Clip Point Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A Stainless and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Clip Point Plain Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous Japanese AUS 8A Stainless and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of Japanese AUS 8A Stainless IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I43dNWIOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322NAEG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 50.78}}
