}}
{"item_id": "B00322NAF0", "title": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Vaquero Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "text": "Cold Steel Voyager XL Vaquero Plain Edge Knife The Voyagerfolders are, ounce for ounce, far stronger than 99% of our competitor¹s folders. And this is a fact, not an idle boast. Each knife features laser cut and hand fitted parts with a stiff spring and our incomparable Tri-Ad™ lock mechanism which is arguably the strongest, most reliable, low maintenance lock in the world. The thick, extra wide blades in each Voyageralso put the competition to shame, as they are laser cut from our famous VG-1 San Mai IIIsteel and precision ground to a thin edge for maximum shearing potential. This thin edge also allows us to hone the blades to astounding sharpness. Plus, the cutting surface is continuously curved along its entire length for the most efficient and effective slicing action possible. Additionally, because of their perfect heat treatment and the high carbon content in the center layer of VG-1 San Mai IIIyou¹ll find the sharpness really lasts a surprisingly long time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UWOx0CuUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00322NAF0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 36.45}}
{"item_id": "B00325SE9O", "title": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 8) by SC Cornhole", "description": "Cornhole is the game that has been sweeping the nation and we've been there since the beginning. SC Cornhole has sold well over 100,000 weather resistant cornhole bags and it's because of the quality of the product. These bags are exactly like corn-filled bags except they use a weather resistant plastic filling so you can get your bags wet and keep them safe from critters. Other than that, they are made with the same size, material, and weight of standard cornhole bags.The listing is for 4 RED & 4 Royal Blue Weather Resistant Cornhole bags. For this particular listing, you no longer have the option to customize colors. If you are looking for other color options, please visit our other listing where you have that option at checkout. You can locate that listing by searching for the same product name in \"All Departments\".Important Shipping Information-Although the shipping time for Standard Shipping is listed as 7-14 days, we can ship within 24 hours. Since the shipping location is Chicago, most shipments arrive from 1 day (Chicagoland) to 5 days (West Coast). The average days in transit is 2 days.", "text": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 8) by SC Cornhole Cornhole is the game that has been sweeping the nation and we've been there since the beginning. SC Cornhole has sold well over 100,000 weather resistant cornhole bags and it's because of the quality of the product. These bags are exactly like corn-filled bags except they use a weather resistant plastic filling so you can get your bags wet and keep them safe from critters. Other than that, they are made with the same size, material, and weight of standard cornhole bags.The listing is for 4 RED & 4 Royal Blue Weather Resistant Cornhole bags. For this particular listing, you no longer have the option to customize colors. If you are looking for other color options, please visit our other listing where you have that option at checkout. You can locate that listing by searching for the same product name in \"All Departments\".Important Shipping Information-Although the shipping time for Standard Shipping is listed as 7-14 days, we can ship within 24 hours. Since the shipping location is Chicago, most shipments arrive from 1 day (Chicagoland) to 5 days (West Coast). The average days in transit is 2 days.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wEG5jc2wL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00325SE9O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00328609W", "title": "Sunlite Bicycle Tube, 700 x 28-35 (27 x 1-1/8 - 1-1/4) 48mm PRESTA valve", "description": "TUBES SUNLT 700x28-35 PV48 27x1-1/8x1-1/", "text": "Sunlite Bicycle Tube, 700 x 28-35 (27 x 1-1/8 - 1-1/4) 48mm PRESTA valve TUBES SUNLT 700x28-35 PV48 27x1-1/8x1-1/", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HQbo8-CmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00328609W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B00329TVEM", "title": "Century BOB Body Opponent Training Bag", "description": "Unleash your alpha male by inflicting powerful blows against this lifelike mannequin Low-profile base, rugged covering, and high-density foam interior ensure long product life Fill the base with 270 lbs. of either water or sand to create stability Lightweight, rounded base allows you to easily roll it into storage after each use Suitable for fitness, home gym, or competitive use Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee for complete details About Century LLC Century's core belief is that martial arts can profoundly impact people's lives, and they want everyone to reap the lifetime benefits. In 1976, Century began by creating martial arts products, and has grown to become the largest supplier of martial arts products in the world. When the company moved to Midwest City, Oklahoma, in 1982, the original building provided 50,000 square feet to help the founders achieve their mission. Since then, the company has expanded to a 650,000 square foot facility, and also broadened its product offering to include yoga, boxing, MMA gear, and physical fitness equipment. Enhance your technique with this sparring partner. Covered in high-strength plastisol. Bag packed with high density urethane foam. 7 height adjustments from 60 to 78 inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Century BOB Body Opponent Training Bag Unleash your alpha male by inflicting powerful blows against this lifelike mannequin Low-profile base, rugged covering, and high-density foam interior ensure long product life Fill the base with 270 lbs. of either water or sand to create stability Lightweight, rounded base allows you to easily roll it into storage after each use Suitable for fitness, home gym, or competitive use Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee for complete details About Century LLC Century's core belief is that martial arts can profoundly impact people's lives, and they want everyone to reap the lifetime benefits. In 1976, Century began by creating martial arts products, and has grown to become the largest supplier of martial arts products in the world. When the company moved to Midwest City, Oklahoma, in 1982, the original building provided 50,000 square feet to help the founders achieve their mission. Since then, the company has expanded to a 650,000 square foot facility, and also broadened its product offering to include yoga, boxing, MMA gear, and physical fitness equipment. Enhance your technique with this sparring partner. Covered in high-strength plastisol. Bag packed with high density urethane foam. 7 height adjustments from 60 to 78 inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vDfnKBBBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00329TVEM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Pedestal Bags"]], "price": 231.94}}
{"item_id": "B0032ALK72", "title": "Onyx M 24 Manual Inflatable PFD Universal Belt Pack in Colors", "description": "Features:Inflatable life jacket inflates by manual activation or oral inflationConvenient, compact belt pack style allows for total freedom of movement when fishing, flatwater paddling, sailing, recreational boating and huntingProvides comfort, safety and peace of mind without knowing you have it on, until you may need itZippered pocket for convenient storage of keys, cell phone, license, etc.ReliaPull Guide for predictable inflation and assists in repackingReflective piping for increased visibilityConvenient reusable mesh storage/carry bagUniversal size fits adults over 80 lbs.Not approved for children under 16 years of ageFor replacement CO2 cartridge, use Onyx Rearming Kit K301* U.S. Coast Guard Approved Type V Life Jacket / Personal Flotation Device PFD with Type III Performance", "text": "Onyx M 24 Manual Inflatable PFD Universal Belt Pack in Colors Features:Inflatable life jacket inflates by manual activation or oral inflationConvenient, compact belt pack style allows for total freedom of movement when fishing, flatwater paddling, sailing, recreational boating and huntingProvides comfort, safety and peace of mind without knowing you have it on, until you may need itZippered pocket for convenient storage of keys, cell phone, license, etc.ReliaPull Guide for predictable inflation and assists in repackingReflective piping for increased visibilityConvenient reusable mesh storage/carry bagUniversal size fits adults over 80 lbs.Not approved for children under 16 years of ageFor replacement CO2 cartridge, use Onyx Rearming Kit K301* U.S. Coast Guard Approved Type V Life Jacket / Personal Flotation Device PFD with Type III Performance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RiBMpYHNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032ALK72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Absolute Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 88.5}}
{"item_id": "B0032BYOG0", "title": "Trumark Slingshots Power Bands Heavy Pull with 303 Protectant", "description": "High velocity heavy pull bands Specifications: - Fits all tubular design slingshots - Free powerband saver (303 aerospace protectant) - Made from high quality surgical latex tubing - Made in the USA - With a small amount of alcohol the bands can be easily installed without the use of tools - Has a leather pouch", "text": "Trumark Slingshots Power Bands Heavy Pull with 303 Protectant High velocity heavy pull bands Specifications: - Fits all tubular design slingshots - Free powerband saver (303 aerospace protectant) - Made from high quality surgical latex tubing - Made in the USA - With a small amount of alcohol the bands can be easily installed without the use of tools - Has a leather pouch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q0tGAgfbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032BYOG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trumark Slingshots", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Slingshots"]], "price": 7.08}}
