{"item_id": "B0032DTF1M", "title": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Contest Short Bibtight", "description": "Short bibtights: Keeping your muscles warm for greater power on your recreational and mountain bike trips. The ergonomic seat padding provides perfect fit.", "text": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Contest Short Bibtight Short bibtights: Keeping your muscles warm for greater power on your recreational and mountain bike trips. The ergonomic seat padding provides perfect fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IqnmiHpaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032DTF1M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032FTRS6", "title": "Look 2010 KEO Classic Pedal", "description": "Look 6010110100 KEO Classic Grey 2010 is ideal for starting cycling using automatic pedals , or for recreational cycle tourism. Slightly heavier than the KEO Sprint pedal, the weight of the KEO Classic remains very light at 140 grams. The glass fiber charged polyamide body, allows for a high resistance and very light pedal body. There is one ball bearing (10mm in and 19mm out) for axial loads and a needle bearing at the middle of the pedal to support radial loads. All Look spindles are subjected to a grueling rotation test of one million cycles at 100 revolutions per minute, with an off centered load of 80kg (which creates an impact at each rev). The adjustable spring tension mechanism allows a smooth release.", "text": "Look 2010 KEO Classic Pedal Look 6010110100 KEO Classic Grey 2010 is ideal for starting cycling using automatic pedals , or for recreational cycle tourism. Slightly heavier than the KEO Sprint pedal, the weight of the KEO Classic remains very light at 140 grams. The glass fiber charged polyamide body, allows for a high resistance and very light pedal body. There is one ball bearing (10mm in and 19mm out) for axial loads and a needle bearing at the middle of the pedal to support radial loads. All Look spindles are subjected to a grueling rotation test of one million cycles at 100 revolutions per minute, with an off centered load of 80kg (which creates an impact at each rev). The adjustable spring tension mechanism allows a smooth release.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pbTsA2AvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032FTRS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032GPLRG", "title": "Hogue Govt. Model Rubber Grip Panel Checkered with Diamonds", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Govt. Model Rubber Grip Panel Checkered with Diamonds Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W8sVtR0RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032GPLRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 13.49}}
{"item_id": "B0032HONJW", "title": "Altus Athletic 32-Pound Dumbbell Set with Stand", "description": "Complete your workout room with this set of neoprene-coated dumbbells from Altus. Featuring a pair of 3-pound, 5-pound, and 8-pound neoprene-coated dumbbells, this set is ideal for working out at home and also includes a stand for tidy storage. Develop strength, power, and your core while also shaping and toning.About Altus AthleticFor over 35 years Altus Athletic has provided quality, innovative fitness proucts for the home user and exercise enthusiast. The Altus brand also now includes the Fitness by Cathe product line, endorsed by Cathe Friedrich, one of the leading fitness trainers in the USA for over 20 years. Combined, these two brands provide a powerful line of fitness products to serve today's consumer fitness needs.", "text": "Altus Athletic 32-Pound Dumbbell Set with Stand Complete your workout room with this set of neoprene-coated dumbbells from Altus. Featuring a pair of 3-pound, 5-pound, and 8-pound neoprene-coated dumbbells, this set is ideal for working out at home and also includes a stand for tidy storage. Develop strength, power, and your core while also shaping and toning.About Altus AthleticFor over 35 years Altus Athletic has provided quality, innovative fitness proucts for the home user and exercise enthusiast. The Altus brand also now includes the Fitness by Cathe product line, endorsed by Cathe Friedrich, one of the leading fitness trainers in the USA for over 20 years. Combined, these two brands provide a powerful line of fitness products to serve today's consumer fitness needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nHzQmNymL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032HONJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 60.72}}
{"item_id": "B0032HOOBO", "title": "Altus Athletic Altus 4-Pound Weighted Training Gloves, Small/Medium", "description": "The altus 4 lb micro-load weighted gloves are excellent gloves for developing power, quickness and agility. Featuring eight (8) 1/2 lb weights, each glove is adjustable from 1/2 lb to 2 lbs, adding an additiona", "text": "Altus Athletic Altus 4-Pound Weighted Training Gloves, Small/Medium The altus 4 lb micro-load weighted gloves are excellent gloves for developing power, quickness and agility. Featuring eight (8) 1/2 lb weights, each glove is adjustable from 1/2 lb to 2 lbs, adding an additiona", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xoFZ8NpHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032HOOBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032HOOQO", "title": "Cathe Friedrich Fitness by Cathe Altus Step at Home with 2-Risers", "description": "1211 423 Features: -Step home with 2 risers.-Fabric: 100pct High-density polyethylene.-Step home has a slip-resistant surface on platform with a stepping surface of 11'' x 25''.-Adjust height 4'' - 6'' and is ideal for step aerobics.-Easy to increase height for enhanced workouts.-Use with hand weights or stretch bands to increase difficulty.-Weight capacity up to 350 lbs.-Slip-resistant surface on platform. Includes: -Step includes Cathe low max 69 minute workout DVD (1) platform with (4) risers. Color/Finish: -Color: Gray and green.", "text": "Cathe Friedrich Fitness by Cathe Altus Step at Home with 2-Risers 1211 423 Features: -Step home with 2 risers.-Fabric: 100pct High-density polyethylene.-Step home has a slip-resistant surface on platform with a stepping surface of 11'' x 25''.-Adjust height 4'' - 6'' and is ideal for step aerobics.-Easy to increase height for enhanced workouts.-Use with hand weights or stretch bands to increase difficulty.-Weight capacity up to 350 lbs.-Slip-resistant surface on platform. Includes: -Step includes Cathe low max 69 minute workout DVD (1) platform with (4) risers. Color/Finish: -Color: Gray and green.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ufd4-VDPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032HOOQO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Step Platforms"]]}}
