{"item_id": "B0032HSD1Q", "title": "Altus Athletic Altus 36-Inch L Foam Roller", "description": "1211 023 Features: -Roller.-Fabric: 100pct PE foam.-Durable foam roller.-Perfect for stretching, yoga / pilates exercises, rehabilitation, and massage key muscle groups.-Use the foam roller for stretching and to increase flexibility.-Relieve stress and target areas can be isolated for pin-point massage.-Use for stretching and flexibility.-Shape, tone and massage all muscle groups.-Improve core strength. Color/Finish: -Color: Blue. Assembly Instructions: -Assembly required.", "text": "Altus Athletic Altus 36-Inch L Foam Roller 1211 023 Features: -Roller.-Fabric: 100pct PE foam.-Durable foam roller.-Perfect for stretching, yoga / pilates exercises, rehabilitation, and massage key muscle groups.-Use the foam roller for stretching and to increase flexibility.-Relieve stress and target areas can be isolated for pin-point massage.-Use for stretching and flexibility.-Shape, tone and massage all muscle groups.-Improve core strength. Color/Finish: -Color: Blue. Assembly Instructions: -Assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ETcHo%2BoYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032HSD1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032HW1B4", "title": "Altus Athletic Altus Turbo Tower", "description": "Use the Altus Turbo Tower™ for strength development, fitness exercise and stretching. It's designed with an adjustable crossbar that offers multiple workout options, and it assembles quickly in just 5 minutes. An exercise chart is included.", "text": "Altus Athletic Altus Turbo Tower Use the Altus Turbo Tower™ for strength development, fitness exercise and stretching. It's designed with an adjustable crossbar that offers multiple workout options, and it assembles quickly in just 5 minutes. An exercise chart is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rz-77eTUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032HW1B4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032I9V20", "title": "Maranda Enterprises 6 Pack Ladderball Bolas", "description": "MEBLA3B-BLARR Features: -Ladderball bolas game.-Six pack with three red and three blue bolas.-Soft but strong material for safety.-Play just like real golf balls. Includes: -Includes a full set of bolas to allow for more players or replace lost parts. Assembly Instructions: -No assembly required.", "text": "Maranda Enterprises 6 Pack Ladderball Bolas MEBLA3B-BLARR Features: -Ladderball bolas game.-Six pack with three red and three blue bolas.-Soft but strong material for safety.-Play just like real golf balls. Includes: -Includes a full set of bolas to allow for more players or replace lost parts. Assembly Instructions: -No assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lHxdzp1NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032I9V20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maranda Enterprises", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games"]], "price": 15.45}}
