{"item_id": "B0032UJ2C2", "title": "Arctix Men's Classic Insulated Overalls Bib", "description": "Season after season, the Arctix Men's Classic Insulated Bib Overalls serves as an outstanding value priced snow bib. Offering maximum coverage and protection from the elements, while allowing a full range of motion. The 1350 snow bib serves as a versatile cornerstone of the Arctix line. Arctix men's snow pants provide men with comfort and warmth when playing or working in the cold. Our men's ski pants and snowboard pants are perfect for snowboarding, skiing, hunting, fishing, staying warm at cold football or hockey game, or clearing the snow after a storm. If you're on the slopes, Arctix snowboarding gear will keep you looking good and feeling good. Arctix is the #1 supplier of black bottoms to the snow sports industry, offering high-quality, value-priced Snow pants, Ski Pants & Bib Overalls. Arctix bottoms are perfect for active sport lifestyles, including snowboarding, skiing, playing outdoors, working in the snow, shoveling or blowing snow, ice fishing, hunting and attending outdoor sporting events. Unlike most competitors, Arctix pants and bibs are made of Nylon fabrics with ThermaLock coating and ThermaTech Insulation. Arctix snow and ski pants are designed for maximum comfort and motion.", "text": "Arctix Men's Classic Insulated Overalls Bib Season after season, the Arctix Men's Classic Insulated Bib Overalls serves as an outstanding value priced snow bib. Offering maximum coverage and protection from the elements, while allowing a full range of motion. The 1350 snow bib serves as a versatile cornerstone of the Arctix line. Arctix men's snow pants provide men with comfort and warmth when playing or working in the cold. Our men's ski pants and snowboard pants are perfect for snowboarding, skiing, hunting, fishing, staying warm at cold football or hockey game, or clearing the snow after a storm. If you're on the slopes, Arctix snowboarding gear will keep you looking good and feeling good. Arctix is the #1 supplier of black bottoms to the snow sports industry, offering high-quality, value-priced Snow pants, Ski Pants & Bib Overalls. Arctix bottoms are perfect for active sport lifestyles, including snowboarding, skiing, playing outdoors, working in the snow, shoveling or blowing snow, ice fishing, hunting and attending outdoor sporting events. Unlike most competitors, Arctix pants and bibs are made of Nylon fabrics with ThermaLock coating and ThermaTech Insulation. Arctix snow and ski pants are designed for maximum comfort and motion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G6A1YXHGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032UJ2C2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men", "Bibs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032V4WJO", "title": "Mr. Tuffy Ultra Lite Bicycle Tire Liner", "description": "Mr. Tuffy tire liners are made of durable, lightweight polyurethane. When inserted between the bike tire and the tube it provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube Thorns or glass that may penetrate are blocked from the inner tube.", "text": "Mr. Tuffy Ultra Lite Bicycle Tire Liner Mr. Tuffy tire liners are made of durable, lightweight polyurethane. When inserted between the bike tire and the tube it provides a protective layer between road hazards and the inner tube Thorns or glass that may penetrate are blocked from the inner tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j0ZCkcS3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032V4WJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mr. Tuffy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 15.55}}
{"item_id": "B0032X015Q", "title": "Guide Gear 20' Climbing Stick", "description": "Guide Gear 20 Climbing Stick. Strong, stable, convenient for backwoods hunting. SAVE BIG BUCKS! This Climbing Stick has five 4' sections that are nearly effortless to carry through the woods, simple to assemble and place. Carrying the Climbing Stick and your hang-on stand is easier than hauling a bulky ladder stand to a remote hunting area. The details: Strong, all steel construction; 20' tall; Five 4' stick sections for portability and storage; Sturdy angled steps; 4\" tree braces; Cam buckle system attaches your Climbing Stick to the tree securely and quickly; 300-lb. capacity. Weighs 23 lbs., 2 ozs.; Get yours today! Guide Gear 20' Climbing Stick", "text": "Guide Gear 20' Climbing Stick Guide Gear 20 Climbing Stick. Strong, stable, convenient for backwoods hunting. SAVE BIG BUCKS! This Climbing Stick has five 4' sections that are nearly effortless to carry through the woods, simple to assemble and place. Carrying the Climbing Stick and your hang-on stand is easier than hauling a bulky ladder stand to a remote hunting area. The details: Strong, all steel construction; 20' tall; Five 4' stick sections for portability and storage; Sturdy angled steps; 4\" tree braces; Cam buckle system attaches your Climbing Stick to the tree securely and quickly; 300-lb. capacity. Weighs 23 lbs., 2 ozs.; Get yours today! Guide Gear 20' Climbing Stick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TGqWHW-6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032X015Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Steps"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B0032X017O", "title": "Guide Gear Tree Stand", "description": "Guide Gear Hang - on Tree Stand, SAVE! Click image to enlarge... 300-lb. capacity A sturdy, easy-to-set-up, quality-made Tree Stand! You'll be comfortable, and confident to make your best shot when your trophy makes an appearance. Lightweight folding steel frame forms a super-sturdy perch Weighs in at 18 lbs. for easy backpacking, can support up to 300 lbs. 14 x 8\" flip-up seat is 20 1/2\"h. with black closed cell foam Hefty platform cables for serious support 18 x 25 1/2\" mesh platform All-welded seams 2 ratchet straps make it secure and tree-friendly Powder-coated surface resists corrosion Includes FAS safety harness. 300-lb. capacity. Order yours now, for much less than similar tree stands somewhere else! Guide Gear Tree Stand Built to Sportsman's Guide's exact specifications, Guide Gear stands for dependability, long-lasting quality and unmatched value! Guaranteed!", "text": "Guide Gear Tree Stand Guide Gear Hang - on Tree Stand, SAVE! Click image to enlarge... 300-lb. capacity A sturdy, easy-to-set-up, quality-made Tree Stand! You'll be comfortable, and confident to make your best shot when your trophy makes an appearance. Lightweight folding steel frame forms a super-sturdy perch Weighs in at 18 lbs. for easy backpacking, can support up to 300 lbs. 14 x 8\" flip-up seat is 20 1/2\"h. with black closed cell foam Hefty platform cables for serious support 18 x 25 1/2\" mesh platform All-welded seams 2 ratchet straps make it secure and tree-friendly Powder-coated surface resists corrosion Includes FAS safety harness. 300-lb. capacity. Order yours now, for much less than similar tree stands somewhere else! Guide Gear Tree Stand Built to Sportsman's Guide's exact specifications, Guide Gear stands for dependability, long-lasting quality and unmatched value! Guaranteed!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BdBcwJE8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032X017O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0032X0M0A", "title": "Camp Chef HWP20 Water Dispenser - 5 gal - 13\" x 13\" x 12.50\"", "description": "Camp Chef HWP20 Water Dispenser - 5 gal - 13\" x 13\" x 12.50\"The Hot Pot is made of steel with anenamel coating inside and out. The Hot Pot also includes a enamel coated lid and a spigot style valve for quick and easy dispensing. The Hot Pot is aperfect companion for Camping, Tailgating, Partiesand for use on your backyard patio. Great for hotchocolate, washing dishes, food prep and hygieneneeds.", "text": "Camp Chef HWP20 Water Dispenser - 5 gal - 13\" x 13\" x 12.50\" Camp Chef HWP20 Water Dispenser - 5 gal - 13\" x 13\" x 12.50\"The Hot Pot is made of steel with anenamel coating inside and out. The Hot Pot also includes a enamel coated lid and a spigot style valve for quick and easy dispensing. The Hot Pot is aperfect companion for Camping, Tailgating, Partiesand for use on your backyard patio. Great for hotchocolate, washing dishes, food prep and hygieneneeds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tz5RZJFQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032X0M0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B0032Y2OTQ", "title": "Leatherman - Squirt ES4 Multitool", "description": "The Squirt ES4 by Leatherman was built to be the electricians companion, but is perfect for everyone. Electronics users gush over this product as well due to the handy spring-action needlenose pliers, spring-action wire strippers as well as many other hand tools.", "text": "Leatherman - Squirt ES4 Multitool The Squirt ES4 by Leatherman was built to be the electricians companion, but is perfect for everyone. Electronics users gush over this product as well due to the handy spring-action needlenose pliers, spring-action wire strippers as well as many other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kI2oMqVlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0032Y2OTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
