{"item_id": "B00337BSY4", "title": "Buck Chairman Series Stockman Comfort Craft TM Knife (Wood, 3 7/8-Inch)", "description": "Every American boy dreams of the day when he gets his first pocket knife. For generations, that pocket knife has been one of the 300 Series knives from Buck. These multi purpose folders are more than just knives; they are companions as you navigate the outdoors and explore life. the 300 Series pocket knives are as American as Buck. The Chairman Series Knives were designed with extra attention to detail and hand finished so they faith comfortably in your pocket and in use. Crafted in the USA and modeled after the high standards and hand craftsmanship set forth by founder Hoyt Buck, the knives in the Chairman Series are the epitome of Buck. With design counsel from the Chairman of the Board, the Chairman Series holds the Chuck Buck signature on each knife handle.", "text": "Buck Chairman Series Stockman Comfort Craft TM Knife (Wood, 3 7/8-Inch) Every American boy dreams of the day when he gets his first pocket knife. For generations, that pocket knife has been one of the 300 Series knives from Buck. These multi purpose folders are more than just knives; they are companions as you navigate the outdoors and explore life. the 300 Series pocket knives are as American as Buck. The Chairman Series Knives were designed with extra attention to detail and hand finished so they faith comfortably in your pocket and in use. Crafted in the USA and modeled after the high standards and hand craftsmanship set forth by founder Hoyt Buck, the knives in the Chairman Series are the epitome of Buck. With design counsel from the Chairman of the Board, the Chairman Series holds the Chuck Buck signature on each knife handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OOxeS0VNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00337BSY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.26}}
