{"item_id": "B00339NSIG", "title": "Wenzel Camp Pad (Blue)", "description": "Add extra cushion and enjoy a better night’s sleep with Wenzel's Camp Pad. Lightweight, durable and comfortable, it not only adds insulation keeping cold and damp away from you, it protects your sleeping bag as well. This pad has an extra soft surface, will not absorb water, and cleans easily. It is ideal for camping, hiking, mountaineering, exercising and picnics. Two elastic tie bands make bundling and storage convenient. Specifications: • Material: Cross link foam • Size: 71 in x 24 in. x 0.5 in.", "text": "Wenzel Camp Pad (Blue) Add extra cushion and enjoy a better night’s sleep with Wenzel's Camp Pad. Lightweight, durable and comfortable, it not only adds insulation keeping cold and damp away from you, it protects your sleeping bag as well. This pad has an extra soft surface, will not absorb water, and cleans easily. It is ideal for camping, hiking, mountaineering, exercising and picnics. Two elastic tie bands make bundling and storage convenient. Specifications: • Material: Cross link foam • Size: 71 in x 24 in. x 0.5 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ohFPa4NGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00339NSIG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wenzel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]], "price": 11.59}}
