{"item_id": "B0033BRRU4", "title": "Okuma Longitude Surf Graphite Rods", "description": "Featuring graphite composite blanks, stainless steel double-foot guides with aluminum oxide inserts, Okuma Longitude surf fishing rods deliver a lot of fishing rod for their very modest cost. Lengths from 9- to 12-feet in length focus on spinning models to serve the greatest number of anglers with easy-handling performance. Traditional cork tape grips with EVA cushions above and below the reel seat complete these highly capable tools that are sure to please.", "text": "Okuma Longitude Surf Graphite Rods Featuring graphite composite blanks, stainless steel double-foot guides with aluminum oxide inserts, Okuma Longitude surf fishing rods deliver a lot of fishing rod for their very modest cost. Lengths from 9- to 12-feet in length focus on spinning models to serve the greatest number of anglers with easy-handling performance. Traditional cork tape grips with EVA cushions above and below the reel seat complete these highly capable tools that are sure to please.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318mTLH8AjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033BRRU4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Baitcasting Rods"]], "price": 50.32}}
{"item_id": "B0033C5EJE", "title": "Redfield Rampage 20-60x60mm Spotting Scope Kit", "description": "The imported full-size Rampage™ spotting scope delivers big-time performance at a hunter- friendly price. If you need more magnification on your hunts, this 20-60x60mm spotter fits the bill. The Rampage comes equipped with a standard tripod adapter, so you can mount it on most standard tripods or window mounts. When dollars count and you need more magnification, the Redfield Rampage 20-60x60mm spotting scope is up to the challenge. All of the features you need for a lifetime of use in the field, with none of the additional cost. Features like a polycarbonate body to reduce weight; fully multicoated lenses and a premium BAK4 prism for a superior image; a retractable lens shade to reduce glare; a twist up/down eyecup for use with or without eyeglasses; and Redfield’s renowned waterproof and fog proof technology. With a magnification range from 20x to 60x, the Rampage allows for the perfect balance of magnification and field-of-view regardless of the situation; and the standard 1/4 -20 thread tripod adapter port allows for easy installation on any standard tripod or window mount. Includes a compact tripod, view-thru soft case, neoprene neck strap, and lens covers. Covered by the Redfield Limited Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Redfield Rampage 20-60x60mm Spotting Scope Kit The imported full-size Rampage™ spotting scope delivers big-time performance at a hunter- friendly price. If you need more magnification on your hunts, this 20-60x60mm spotter fits the bill. The Rampage comes equipped with a standard tripod adapter, so you can mount it on most standard tripods or window mounts. When dollars count and you need more magnification, the Redfield Rampage 20-60x60mm spotting scope is up to the challenge. All of the features you need for a lifetime of use in the field, with none of the additional cost. Features like a polycarbonate body to reduce weight; fully multicoated lenses and a premium BAK4 prism for a superior image; a retractable lens shade to reduce glare; a twist up/down eyecup for use with or without eyeglasses; and Redfield’s renowned waterproof and fog proof technology. With a magnification range from 20x to 60x, the Rampage allows for the perfect balance of magnification and field-of-view regardless of the situation; and the standard 1/4 -20 thread tripod adapter port allows for easy installation on any standard tripod or window mount. Includes a compact tripod, view-thru soft case, neoprene neck strap, and lens covers. Covered by the Redfield Limited Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MSJP8hJrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033C5EJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 209.49}}
{"item_id": "B0033H7V6S", "title": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Delegate Edc 1055W Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife", "description": "If you were a delegate to the Constitutional Convention in Philadelphia in 1787, you would feel right at home with our new line of gentleman's folders, so we're calling it the Delegate line. Classic knife making tradition comes through in their understated design and use of natural materials. But like the Founding Fathers, there is a revolutionary aspect to this line. We have incorporated our Outburst assist with our patent-pending", "text": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Delegate Edc 1055W Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife If you were a delegate to the Constitutional Convention in Philadelphia in 1787, you would feel right at home with our new line of gentleman's folders, so we're calling it the Delegate line. Classic knife making tradition comes through in their understated design and use of natural materials. But like the Founding Fathers, there is a revolutionary aspect to this line. We have incorporated our Outburst assist with our patent-pending", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MVEnDALiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033H7V6S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.78}}
{"item_id": "B0033H7V72", "title": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's M4-02W Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Custom knifemaker and Knifemakers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4 . In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tacticals, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The M4 -02W Burled Wood is a deluxe model with burled wood scales and brushed stainless steel bolsters. It's a very classy look. While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our patented", "text": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's M4-02W Razor Edge Knife Custom knifemaker and Knifemakers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4 . In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tacticals, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The M4 -02W Burled Wood is a deluxe model with burled wood scales and brushed stainless steel bolsters. It's a very classy look. While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our patented", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p6LZE%2BjOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033H7V72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 38.71}}
{"item_id": "B0033H7VI6", "title": "Schrade SCHF9 Extreme Survival Knife with Fixed 1095 High Carbon Steel Blade and Black Kraton Handle and Sheath", "description": "This survival style knife comes with a nylon belt sheath.", "text": "Schrade SCHF9 Extreme Survival Knife with Fixed 1095 High Carbon Steel Blade and Black Kraton Handle and Sheath This survival style knife comes with a nylon belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414eWbWpV0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033H7VI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 41.87}}
{"item_id": "B0033HBFW4", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENAKS Elishewitz Tao Pen Tactical Pen", "description": "Award-winning knife designer Allen Elishewitz has lived in the Far East and has practiced martial arts over the past 30 years. This training, along with his experience as a Recon Marine, gave Allen the perfect background to design these defensive writing instruments, CRKT Tao Pens. If the user is threatened or attacked, the pens can be used at three levels of defensive force, depending on the type of threat. \"At the lowest level of engagement, the impact crown on the cap can be used to strike the assailant on the head or hands by raking or thrusting. \"At the second level, the more pointed butt of the pen may be used to thrust or provide a disabling pressure point behind the ears, at the armpit or throat. \"At the third level, if the attack persists, the pen point may be thrust for penetration in soft tissues of the throat, chest or abdomen with potentially lethal results if the assailant does not break off the attack.\" The pens are made of 6061 aluminum, precision-machined and hard anodized. The heavy cap is threaded so that it will not pull off in use, and castellated for greater impact. The flutes and grooves on the pen, combined with the pewter-toned stainless steel pocket clip, provide a secure grip. Four color schemes are available: no reflective olive drab and tactical black, plus brown with bright grooves and black with bright grooves. All Tao models are functional writing instruments which use the Fisher Space Pen ball point cartridge, a pressurized design developed for NASA. It has a tungsten carbide ball point and thixotropic ink which will write in freezing cold, boiling heat, underwater and at any angle-even upside down.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENAKS Elishewitz Tao Pen Tactical Pen Award-winning knife designer Allen Elishewitz has lived in the Far East and has practiced martial arts over the past 30 years. This training, along with his experience as a Recon Marine, gave Allen the perfect background to design these defensive writing instruments, CRKT Tao Pens. If the user is threatened or attacked, the pens can be used at three levels of defensive force, depending on the type of threat. \"At the lowest level of engagement, the impact crown on the cap can be used to strike the assailant on the head or hands by raking or thrusting. \"At the second level, the more pointed butt of the pen may be used to thrust or provide a disabling pressure point behind the ears, at the armpit or throat. \"At the third level, if the attack persists, the pen point may be thrust for penetration in soft tissues of the throat, chest or abdomen with potentially lethal results if the assailant does not break off the attack.\" The pens are made of 6061 aluminum, precision-machined and hard anodized. The heavy cap is threaded so that it will not pull off in use, and castellated for greater impact. The flutes and grooves on the pen, combined with the pewter-toned stainless steel pocket clip, provide a secure grip. Four color schemes are available: no reflective olive drab and tactical black, plus brown with bright grooves and black with bright grooves. All Tao models are functional writing instruments which use the Fisher Space Pen ball point cartridge, a pressurized design developed for NASA. It has a tungsten carbide ball point and thixotropic ink which will write in freezing cold, boiling heat, underwater and at any angle-even upside down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y%2BDRFgVqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HBFW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B0033HBG00", "title": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Fire Spark 1050 Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Our goal in producing this new folder is to combine all of our recent technological advances in one heavy-duty tactical folder. We call it the Fire Spark , and it is primarily intended for law enforcement and military professionals, although it also makes a fine general-purpose sport and work folder for those who want to carry a large knife. The innovative construction starts with our rigid InterFrame build with stainless steel liners, one locking. We add 6061 aluminum scales, which are CNC machined to receive black textured G10 inlays. The handle is a full 4-3/4-Inch long to be comfortable for those with large hands, or when wearing gloves, and features four finger choils to give optimum grip. The cross section is flat enough for in-pocket carry. Finally, there is a strong stainless steel back spacer that extends to the butt, which culminates in a \"skull cracker\" pointed tip. The back spacer is relieved to allow a double lanyard loop to be cut in the stainless steel liners. The blade on the Fire Spark is a modified tactical spear point design with a Razor-Sharp edge, high hollow grind and swedged top edge for penetration. Blade steel is premium 8Cr14MoV stainless steel. The sport model 1050 has a high satin blade finish, silver anodized frames, and polished three-position stainless steel clip. We have combined our Outburst assisted opening with our patent-pending", "text": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Fire Spark 1050 Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife Our goal in producing this new folder is to combine all of our recent technological advances in one heavy-duty tactical folder. We call it the Fire Spark , and it is primarily intended for law enforcement and military professionals, although it also makes a fine general-purpose sport and work folder for those who want to carry a large knife. The innovative construction starts with our rigid InterFrame build with stainless steel liners, one locking. We add 6061 aluminum scales, which are CNC machined to receive black textured G10 inlays. The handle is a full 4-3/4-Inch long to be comfortable for those with large hands, or when wearing gloves, and features four finger choils to give optimum grip. The cross section is flat enough for in-pocket carry. Finally, there is a strong stainless steel back spacer that extends to the butt, which culminates in a \"skull cracker\" pointed tip. The back spacer is relieved to allow a double lanyard loop to be cut in the stainless steel liners. The blade on the Fire Spark is a modified tactical spear point design with a Razor-Sharp edge, high hollow grind and swedged top edge for penetration. Blade steel is premium 8Cr14MoV stainless steel. The sport model 1050 has a high satin blade finish, silver anodized frames, and polished three-position stainless steel clip. We have combined our Outburst assisted opening with our patent-pending", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zA%2BQhPWTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HBG00.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 45.68}}
{"item_id": "B0033HD9LE", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENAOD Elishewitz Tao Pen Tactical Pen", "description": "Award-winning knife designer Allen Elishewitz has lived in the Far East and has practiced martial arts over the past 30 years. This training, along with his experience as a Recon Marine, gave Allen the perfect background to design these defensive writing instruments, CRKT Tao Pens. If the user is threatened or attacked, the pens can be used at three levels of defensive force, depending on the type of threat. \"At the lowest level of engagement, the impact crown on the cap can be used to strike the assailant on the head or hands by raking or thrusting. \"At the second level, the more pointed butt of the pen may be used to thrust or provide a disabling pressure point behind the ears, at the armpit or throat. \"At the third level, if the attack persists, the pen point may be thrust for penetration in soft tissues of the throat, chest or abdomen with potentially lethal results if the assailant does not break off the attack.\" The pens are made of 6061 aluminum, precision-machined and hard anodized. The heavy cap is threaded so that it will not pull off in use, and castellated for greater impact. The flutes and grooves on the pen, combined with the pewter-toned stainless steel pocket clip, provide a secure grip. Four color schemes are available: no reflective olive drab and tactical black, plus brown with bright grooves and black with bright grooves. All Tao models are functional writing instruments which use the Fisher Space Pen ball point cartridge, a pressurized design developed for NASA. It has a tungsten carbide ball point and thixotropic ink which will write in freezing cold, boiling heat, underwater and at any angle-even upside down.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENAOD Elishewitz Tao Pen Tactical Pen Award-winning knife designer Allen Elishewitz has lived in the Far East and has practiced martial arts over the past 30 years. This training, along with his experience as a Recon Marine, gave Allen the perfect background to design these defensive writing instruments, CRKT Tao Pens. If the user is threatened or attacked, the pens can be used at three levels of defensive force, depending on the type of threat. \"At the lowest level of engagement, the impact crown on the cap can be used to strike the assailant on the head or hands by raking or thrusting. \"At the second level, the more pointed butt of the pen may be used to thrust or provide a disabling pressure point behind the ears, at the armpit or throat. \"At the third level, if the attack persists, the pen point may be thrust for penetration in soft tissues of the throat, chest or abdomen with potentially lethal results if the assailant does not break off the attack.\" The pens are made of 6061 aluminum, precision-machined and hard anodized. The heavy cap is threaded so that it will not pull off in use, and castellated for greater impact. The flutes and grooves on the pen, combined with the pewter-toned stainless steel pocket clip, provide a secure grip. Four color schemes are available: no reflective olive drab and tactical black, plus brown with bright grooves and black with bright grooves. All Tao models are functional writing instruments which use the Fisher Space Pen ball point cartridge, a pressurized design developed for NASA. It has a tungsten carbide ball point and thixotropic ink which will write in freezing cold, boiling heat, underwater and at any angle-even upside down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tAEGVOGnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HD9LE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 36.97}}
{"item_id": "B0033HD9O6", "title": "M4 Stag Handle Stainless Bolster", "description": "Custom knifemaker and Knifemakers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4. In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tacticals, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The M4 -02S Stag is a deluxe model which has a traditional look with stag scales and brushed stainless steel bolsters. While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our OutBurst assisted opening, and our patented", "text": "M4 Stag Handle Stainless Bolster Custom knifemaker and Knifemakers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4. In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tacticals, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The M4 -02S Stag is a deluxe model which has a traditional look with stag scales and brushed stainless steel bolsters. While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our OutBurst assisted opening, and our patented", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xLqi1QA0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HD9O6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 41.95}}
{"item_id": "B0033HF4CQ", "title": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Heiho 2900 Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife", "description": "", "text": "Columbia River Knife And Tool's Heiho 2900 Assisted Opening Razor Edge Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YMMx2ZZhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HF4CQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.01}}
{"item_id": "B0033HHEL0", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M4-02 Razor Edge Assisted Opening Knife", "description": "Custom knife maker and Knife makers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4. In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tactical, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The new M4-02 lightweight model features white bone scales and contrasting black G10 bolsters, hand contoured like a Carson custom. (A LAWKS safety cannot be fitted with this bolster.) While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our Outburst assisted opening. The Outburst mechanism instantly springs the blade fully open after you have opened the blade approximately 30 degrees. M4 models have dual thumb studs for ambidextrous one-hand opening and bronze bearings and lubrous washers at the adjustable blade pivot for smooth, fast action. The 3.25-Inch blade is a high-hollow-grind drop point of premium 8Cr13MoV stainless steel in a bead-blast finish with a Razor-Sharp edge. Our heavy-duty InterFrame build is true to Kit's design, with dual stainless steel liners, one locking, and a stainless steel back spacer. All M4 models have high-mounted pocket/gear clips. So here you have a friendly E.D.C. knife that fits the hand naturally for all kinds of cutting and carving tasks. Like Kit, it's a bit unassuming, but it's a knife you'll come back to year after year.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M4-02 Razor Edge Assisted Opening Knife Custom knife maker and Knife makers' Guild member Kit Carson is widely known for his M16 design, which we offer in many CRKT production models. But since 1990, Kit's most consistent selling custom model has been his classic M4. In his usual unassuming manner, Kit says, \"I guess you'd say it's my flagship custom. It's simple, with form following function. No tricks that look slick but aren't worth a flip in your hand. I've made many variations on it, from exotic collectibles to working tactical, in maybe 20 versions. But I still get more and more calls to make the M4.\" This year we're offering the M4 design in Kit's smaller every day carry (E.D.C.) size. The new M4-02 lightweight model features white bone scales and contrasting black G10 bolsters, hand contoured like a Carson custom. (A LAWKS safety cannot be fitted with this bolster.) While we were engineering it, we decided to add some more value by offering our Outburst assisted opening. The Outburst mechanism instantly springs the blade fully open after you have opened the blade approximately 30 degrees. M4 models have dual thumb studs for ambidextrous one-hand opening and bronze bearings and lubrous washers at the adjustable blade pivot for smooth, fast action. The 3.25-Inch blade is a high-hollow-grind drop point of premium 8Cr13MoV stainless steel in a bead-blast finish with a Razor-Sharp edge. Our heavy-duty InterFrame build is true to Kit's design, with dual stainless steel liners, one locking, and a stainless steel back spacer. All M4 models have high-mounted pocket/gear clips. So here you have a friendly E.D.C. knife that fits the hand naturally for all kinds of cutting and carving tasks. Like Kit, it's a bit unassuming, but it's a knife you'll come back to year after year.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21jGVQPbFNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HHEL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 41.95}}
{"item_id": "B0033HMKQ4", "title": "Maxpedition Jumbo E.D.C. Versipack", "description": "Rear/CCW Compartment: 9” x 8.5” with 7” x 8” loop field", "text": "Maxpedition Jumbo E.D.C. Versipack Rear/CCW Compartment: 9” x 8.5” with 7” x 8” loop field", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xZ6lx-Q0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033HMKQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 71.74}}
