{"item_id": "B0033K5U36", "title": "Umarex Steel Storm Air Pistol (Black, Medium)", "description": "The Umarex Steel Storm Tactical BB gun has a 30 shot capacity, with a 300-round reserve! It allows you to shoot 6-shot bursts in \"full-auto\" mode, and single shots in semi-auto mode. The gun gives the feel of a real gun in your hands with its ultra-accurate look and feel. The gun is powered by dual 12 g CO2 capsules, and the CO2 is housed in a drop out magazine for ease of access.", "text": "Umarex Steel Storm Air Pistol (Black, Medium) The Umarex Steel Storm Tactical BB gun has a 30 shot capacity, with a 300-round reserve! It allows you to shoot 6-shot bursts in \"full-auto\" mode, and single shots in semi-auto mode. The gun gives the feel of a real gun in your hands with its ultra-accurate look and feel. The gun is powered by dual 12 g CO2 capsules, and the CO2 is housed in a drop out magazine for ease of access.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415uzakBotL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033K5U36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 88.8}}
{"item_id": "B0033K9TP6", "title": "Umarex SA177 Air Pistol (Black, Medium)", "description": "The Umarex SA177 BB Repeater is modeled after a popular carry pistol widely used by governmental agencies, and it uses blowback action to simulate a real firearm. The metal slide and integrated accessory rail add to the overall realism of the gun, as does a drop-out magazine that houses the CO2 and the BB rounds. Fiber optic sights and a comfortable ergonomic grip allow for accurate, natural shooting at speeds up to 380 feet-per-second (FPS).FeaturesModeled after popular carry pistolBlowback action simulates real firearmMetal slide and drop-out magazine houses CO2 and BBsErgonomic gripIntegrated accessory railSpecifications.177 caliberDouble action, CO2 power16-shot capacity4.1-inch barrelManual safetyFiber optic rear sightFixed tactical dot front sightFiring speed up to 380 feet-per-secondWarrantyUmarex products include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.", "text": "Umarex SA177 Air Pistol (Black, Medium) The Umarex SA177 BB Repeater is modeled after a popular carry pistol widely used by governmental agencies, and it uses blowback action to simulate a real firearm. The metal slide and integrated accessory rail add to the overall realism of the gun, as does a drop-out magazine that houses the CO2 and the BB rounds. Fiber optic sights and a comfortable ergonomic grip allow for accurate, natural shooting at speeds up to 380 feet-per-second (FPS).FeaturesModeled after popular carry pistolBlowback action simulates real firearmMetal slide and drop-out magazine houses CO2 and BBsErgonomic gripIntegrated accessory railSpecifications.177 caliberDouble action, CO2 power16-shot capacity4.1-inch barrelManual safetyFiber optic rear sightFixed tactical dot front sightFiring speed up to 380 feet-per-secondWarrantyUmarex products include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Perg95ZdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033K9TP6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0033MI1YE", "title": "Buff Wool Buff - In Your Choice of Colors", "description": "", "text": "Buff Wool Buff - In Your Choice of Colors", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31E1y%2BuLK7L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033MI1YE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0033OI7V4", "title": "Gee's G-40 Galvanized Steel Minnow Trap", "description": "The Gee's G-40 Steel Minnow Trap can be used for catching minnows off a boat and is made of 1/4-inch galvanized steel. This two-piece trap is durable and collapses for easy storage when not in use. The minnow trap can be used with dry bait and measures 12-inches by 8-inches at the top and tapers to 10-inches by 6-inches at the bottom. This model measures 16.5-inches in overall length and 7.5-inches in diameter. Efficient, durable, easy to operate and semi-collapsible, the G-40 conforms to most State laws for overall dimensions and size of entrance holes. The Gee's G-40 Steel Minnow Trap is made in the U.S.A. Gee's minnow traps have been used and endorsed by fishermen for over 100-years. Gee's uses the finest quality steel and wire, heavily galvanized and strongly reinforced.", "text": "Gee's G-40 Galvanized Steel Minnow Trap The Gee's G-40 Steel Minnow Trap can be used for catching minnows off a boat and is made of 1/4-inch galvanized steel. This two-piece trap is durable and collapses for easy storage when not in use. The minnow trap can be used with dry bait and measures 12-inches by 8-inches at the top and tapers to 10-inches by 6-inches at the bottom. This model measures 16.5-inches in overall length and 7.5-inches in diameter. Efficient, durable, easy to operate and semi-collapsible, the G-40 conforms to most State laws for overall dimensions and size of entrance holes. The Gee's G-40 Steel Minnow Trap is made in the U.S.A. Gee's minnow traps have been used and endorsed by fishermen for over 100-years. Gee's uses the finest quality steel and wire, heavily galvanized and strongly reinforced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U7ZSTZ%2BJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033OI7V4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gees", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Bait Traps"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0033VNCTE", "title": "Topeak Trolley Tote Folding Basket", "description": "The perfect solution for around town shopping and errands. TrolleyTote features a telescopic handle and trolley wheels for easy handling at the market and the large capacity durable frame is collapsible for easy storage. The TrolleyTote is MTX QuickTrack compatible for secure slide and click mounting and removal on all Topeak MTX racks.", "text": "Topeak Trolley Tote Folding Basket The perfect solution for around town shopping and errands. TrolleyTote features a telescopic handle and trolley wheels for easy handling at the market and the large capacity durable frame is collapsible for easy storage. The TrolleyTote is MTX QuickTrack compatible for secure slide and click mounting and removal on all Topeak MTX racks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JHOopEBdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033VNCTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 51.95}}
{"item_id": "B0033WRWL2", "title": "Tilley Endurables TWC4 Outback Waxed Hat", "description": "The Tilley Outback Hat fuses a traditional broad-brim hat silhouette with a modern waxed cotton technology that can be washed, worn, packed, used, and abused. Even with heavy use, the hat will not transfer wax, will remain non-sticky, and will not emit a strong waxy odor. In time, the waxed finish will take on a leather-like appearance unique to its owner. Designed for any outdoor activity and unisex wear, the 100 percent cotton waxed hat offers 50+ UPF sun protection. The easy to care for hat can be hand or machine washed on a gentle cycle, then reshaped and air dried.The Outback Waxed Hat looks great on men and women.", "text": "Tilley Endurables TWC4 Outback Waxed Hat The Tilley Outback Hat fuses a traditional broad-brim hat silhouette with a modern waxed cotton technology that can be washed, worn, packed, used, and abused. Even with heavy use, the hat will not transfer wax, will remain non-sticky, and will not emit a strong waxy odor. In time, the waxed finish will take on a leather-like appearance unique to its owner. Designed for any outdoor activity and unisex wear, the 100 percent cotton waxed hat offers 50+ UPF sun protection. The easy to care for hat can be hand or machine washed on a gentle cycle, then reshaped and air dried.The Outback Waxed Hat looks great on men and women.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PEnqm%2BGjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033WRWL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]], "price": 79.0}}
{"item_id": "B0033XZT0M", "title": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P, Green/Green", "description": "The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "text": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P, Green/Green The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HWPZy9EVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0033XZT0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 74.33}}
{"item_id": "B00340H2TU", "title": "The Flex Belt Flex System Abdominal Toning Belt, Black", "description": "", "text": "The Flex Belt Flex System Abdominal Toning Belt, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jdeNBiJsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00340H2TU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The Flex Belt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 199.99}}
{"item_id": "B00342XXDM", "title": "Vanguard 62-Inch Pro Gun Pod Shooting Stick", "description": "Vanguard's Pro M62 shooting stick is loaded with innovative features that have quickly set the industry standard. Whether you're a beginning or expert hunter, this stick will have you shooting like a professional.Ahead of the gameWith patents pending, PRO M62 shooting stick's innovative head features a Yoke Adjustment System (YAS) that offers an adjustable rubber V yoke, the first of its kind. With the simple push of a button, the head adjusts and locks to 160, 120 and 80-degree angles to fit different-sized firearms with soft rubber fins that contour around the forearm. The head also spins 360 degrees, allowing shots from any angle, so you can reposition quickly without moving the stick.Leg upPRO M62 shooting stick's leg includes a depth scale for water or snow measurement, as well as a removable snow shoe. An ergonomic handle with foam grip and adjustable wrist strap provides a comfortable grip. It also includes a bonus walking stick handle with compass. Deluxe, strong flip leg locks offer quick height adjustment and a convertible rubber to metal-spiked foot provides increased stability in extreme conditions.", "text": "Vanguard 62-Inch Pro Gun Pod Shooting Stick Vanguard's Pro M62 shooting stick is loaded with innovative features that have quickly set the industry standard. Whether you're a beginning or expert hunter, this stick will have you shooting like a professional.Ahead of the gameWith patents pending, PRO M62 shooting stick's innovative head features a Yoke Adjustment System (YAS) that offers an adjustable rubber V yoke, the first of its kind. With the simple push of a button, the head adjusts and locks to 160, 120 and 80-degree angles to fit different-sized firearms with soft rubber fins that contour around the forearm. The head also spins 360 degrees, allowing shots from any angle, so you can reposition quickly without moving the stick.Leg upPRO M62 shooting stick's leg includes a depth scale for water or snow measurement, as well as a removable snow shoe. An ergonomic handle with foam grip and adjustable wrist strap provides a comfortable grip. It also includes a bonus walking stick handle with compass. Deluxe, strong flip leg locks offer quick height adjustment and a convertible rubber to metal-spiked foot provides increased stability in extreme conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21SoIet-LFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00342XXDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 48.35}}
{"item_id": "B00342XXMS", "title": "Vanguard Steady Aim Gun Rest", "description": "Heavy duty 1 1/2 inch steel construction and smooth precise micro elevation adjustment, sighting in your rifle will be hassle free. Our large central elevation adjustment dial provides -5 to +20 range of movement getting you on target in almost any up range position. An anti viabration pillow securely holds your rifle's forearm and leather sling cradles the stock. We also provide anti slip rubber free that can convert to spikes for the shooters using this bench on the ground.", "text": "Vanguard Steady Aim Gun Rest Heavy duty 1 1/2 inch steel construction and smooth precise micro elevation adjustment, sighting in your rifle will be hassle free. Our large central elevation adjustment dial provides -5 to +20 range of movement getting you on target in almost any up range position. An anti viabration pillow securely holds your rifle's forearm and leather sling cradles the stock. We also provide anti slip rubber free that can convert to spikes for the shooters using this bench on the ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410uDdYCIwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00342XXMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 81.47}}
{"item_id": "B0034361BC", "title": "Vanguard Porta Aim Gun Rest", "description": "Constructed of rugged aluminum, the benefit of this portable base will eliminate any doubt that can erode a hunter's confidence. The pillow swivels 360 degrees allowing you to get on target fast and staying on target. Center column quick adjusts with a one hand movment", "text": "Vanguard Porta Aim Gun Rest Constructed of rugged aluminum, the benefit of this portable base will eliminate any doubt that can erode a hunter's confidence. The pillow swivels 360 degrees allowing you to get on target fast and staying on target. Center column quick adjusts with a one hand movment", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jYAi8HIPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034361BC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 34.85}}
{"item_id": "B003450PNA", "title": "Rifle/Shotgun Red Laser Sight with Mount and Switch", "description": "5mw laser sight with universal mount, perfect for .223 or shotgun barrel. It can fit on any rifle with enough space for the mount.", "text": "Rifle/Shotgun Red Laser Sight with Mount and Switch 5mw laser sight with universal mount, perfect for .223 or shotgun barrel. It can fit on any rifle with enough space for the mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BsRpUnbPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003450PNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 12.9}}
