{"item_id": "B00345EAE0", "title": "RIP-IT Defense Softball Fielder's Mask", "description": "Before the Defense from Rip-It, players were forced to use fielding masks that limited their vision, were bulky, and were uncomfortable. With the Rip-It Defense the field of view opens up and comfort is possible thanks to a simplified design that eliminates any unnecessary bulk, while maximizing protection. Players wearing the Defense can actually see their feet when they look down--allowing them an unobstructed view of grounders, pop-ups, and fly balls. With steel safety cell design, ball impacts are repelled and the force is absorbed and transferred away from the point of impact for maximum protection. Go out to the field with confidence and comfort--with the Defense Fielder's Mask from Rip-It.The Rip-It Defense offers an exceptionally wide field of view, designed not to interfere with your ability to see the ball.The Steel Safety Cell:Variable Flex Design: Providing the same impact protection known in the car industry as a crumple zone, the Defense's steel safety cell is designed to be either stiff or flexible depending on the force of impact. This feature allows the Defense to stay rigid for a majority of the impacts a player may receive while playing. However, in that rare instance when the ball is traveling at an excessive speed, the steel safety cell will flex to transfer energy away from the point of contact offering the best possible protection in extreme circumstances. No matter how great the impact, when a ball strikes the Defense the energy and force of the impact is instantly spread over the entire surface area of the padding. With nearly two feet of padded surface area, the Defense is able to absorb more impact, transfer more energy, and reduce impact related injury.Severity Index of 56 MPH Softball Impact: without Rip-It Defense--1200 SI; with Rip-It Defense--330 SISuperior Wide Angle Viewing:The Defense creates such a wide angle of view that players are able to forget they are wearing a facemask. With a simplified design that eliminates any unnecessary bulk, while maximizing protection, the Defense offers the best vision possible in a fielder’s facemask. Players wearing the Defense can actually see their feet when they look down--allowing them an unobstructed view when fielding grounders or pop-ups. The Defense's clutter free design makes seeing the ball to your glove easy and flawless.Superior Comfort:Ponytails Strap: Ponytails are part of the game. If you wear a ponytail while playing you know the issues it can cause. The Defense solves this problem with its ponytail strap. The ponytail strap allows you to pull your ponytail through the opening so everything fits perfectly.Chin Cups:With a back made of one continuous piece of Velcro, the Defense chin cup is infinitely adjustable--enabling it to fit exactly how you want it to. This means more comfort, better positioning, and the ability to talk easily while wearing a fielder’s mask.", "text": "RIP-IT Defense Softball Fielder's Mask Before the Defense from Rip-It, players were forced to use fielding masks that limited their vision, were bulky, and were uncomfortable. With the Rip-It Defense the field of view opens up and comfort is possible thanks to a simplified design that eliminates any unnecessary bulk, while maximizing protection. Players wearing the Defense can actually see their feet when they look down--allowing them an unobstructed view of grounders, pop-ups, and fly balls. With steel safety cell design, ball impacts are repelled and the force is absorbed and transferred away from the point of impact for maximum protection. Go out to the field with confidence and comfort--with the Defense Fielder's Mask from Rip-It.The Rip-It Defense offers an exceptionally wide field of view, designed not to interfere with your ability to see the ball.The Steel Safety Cell:Variable Flex Design: Providing the same impact protection known in the car industry as a crumple zone, the Defense's steel safety cell is designed to be either stiff or flexible depending on the force of impact. This feature allows the Defense to stay rigid for a majority of the impacts a player may receive while playing. However, in that rare instance when the ball is traveling at an excessive speed, the steel safety cell will flex to transfer energy away from the point of contact offering the best possible protection in extreme circumstances. No matter how great the impact, when a ball strikes the Defense the energy and force of the impact is instantly spread over the entire surface area of the padding. With nearly two feet of padded surface area, the Defense is able to absorb more impact, transfer more energy, and reduce impact related injury.Severity Index of 56 MPH Softball Impact: without Rip-It Defense--1200 SI; with Rip-It Defense--330 SISuperior Wide Angle Viewing:The Defense creates such a wide angle of view that players are able to forget they are wearing a facemask. With a simplified design that eliminates any unnecessary bulk, while maximizing protection, the Defense offers the best vision possible in a fielder’s facemask. Players wearing the Defense can actually see their feet when they look down--allowing them an unobstructed view when fielding grounders or pop-ups. The Defense's clutter free design makes seeing the ball to your glove easy and flawless.Superior Comfort:Ponytails Strap: Ponytails are part of the game. If you wear a ponytail while playing you know the issues it can cause. The Defense solves this problem with its ponytail strap. The ponytail strap allows you to pull your ponytail through the opening so everything fits perfectly.Chin Cups:With a back made of one continuous piece of Velcro, the Defense chin cup is infinitely adjustable--enabling it to fit exactly how you want it to. This means more comfort, better positioning, and the ability to talk easily while wearing a fielder’s mask.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bFNQ5z7HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00345EAE0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00345JY28", "title": "Stadium Chairs", "description": "Rain Or Shine, Win Or Lose... Stadium Chairs! Stadium Chairs have it all! Comfortable cushioning, durable support and convenient transportability make these chairs your go-to choice at the stadium. Stadium Chairs feature: Soft cushioning keeps you comfortable during the game Durable steel frame construction Tough Cordova canvas with bungee cord reinforcements is very supportive Fits any metal or wooden bleacher Custom printable on front and back Open dimensions: 15.5\" x 17\"W x 14.5\"H Folded dimensions: 15.5\" x 17\"W x 4\" H 350 lb. weight capacity The Best Seat In The House... Bring It!", "text": "Stadium Chairs Rain Or Shine, Win Or Lose... Stadium Chairs! Stadium Chairs have it all! Comfortable cushioning, durable support and convenient transportability make these chairs your go-to choice at the stadium. Stadium Chairs feature: Soft cushioning keeps you comfortable during the game Durable steel frame construction Tough Cordova canvas with bungee cord reinforcements is very supportive Fits any metal or wooden bleacher Custom printable on front and back Open dimensions: 15.5\" x 17\"W x 14.5\"H Folded dimensions: 15.5\" x 17\"W x 4\" H 350 lb. weight capacity The Best Seat In The House... Bring It!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51At%2Bzk0vNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00345JY28.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stadium Chair Co.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball"]], "price": 39.84}}
{"item_id": "B00345OMR0", "title": "UCO Stormproof Matches, Waterproof and Windproof with 15 Second Burn Time - 25 Matches", "description": "UCO Stormproof Matches are the best matches available for harsh conditions. Each match burns for about 15 seconds even if it is windy, rainy, or cold. The matches even burn underwater. Extra strikers are included.", "text": "UCO Stormproof Matches, Waterproof and Windproof with 15 Second Burn Time - 25 Matches UCO Stormproof Matches are the best matches available for harsh conditions. Each match burns for about 15 seconds even if it is windy, rainy, or cold. The matches even burn underwater. Extra strikers are included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510irt9deaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00345OMR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 5.0}}
{"item_id": "B003468CM0", "title": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN1-GM Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with DNA Catcher, Gun Metal", "description": "The UZI UZI-TACPEN1-GM Defender Tactical Pen is made of lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a DNA catcher. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "text": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN1-GM Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with DNA Catcher, Gun Metal The UZI UZI-TACPEN1-GM Defender Tactical Pen is made of lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a DNA catcher. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Uofmn4m5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003468CM0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uzi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 15.65}}
{"item_id": "B00346K68S", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Medical Pouch", "description": "Features & Benefits: Permanently attached RED top strap designates this pouch as medical specific. Easy and instant identification reduces response time. Large opening allows medic or first responder fast access to first aid components. Modular, fits on all SPEC.-OPS. Brand packs and vests and Interceptor Body armor. Double-wall 1000 D. Cordura pouch, double stitching and bartacks make this the toughest, most durable pouch on the market today • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in two sizes, Medium and Large Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Medical Pouch Features & Benefits: Permanently attached RED top strap designates this pouch as medical specific. Easy and instant identification reduces response time. Large opening allows medic or first responder fast access to first aid components. Modular, fits on all SPEC.-OPS. Brand packs and vests and Interceptor Body armor. Double-wall 1000 D. Cordura pouch, double stitching and bartacks make this the toughest, most durable pouch on the market today • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in two sizes, Medium and Large Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LosABK2oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00346K68S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00348XB6K", "title": "Scuba Diving Log Book - Red Cordura Diver Down Flag Three-Ring Binder", "description": "Scuba Diving Log Book Red Cordura Diver Down Flag ThreeRing BinderZippered 3 ring binder holds log insertsCard and pen holdersQuick snap to hold keysFRONT COVER PRINT STYLE: Large Dive Flag Image 10inches tall x 7inches wide Threering binder fits PADI inserts Waterresistant Cordura won't scuff or tear 10 Credit Card Slots, 3 Pen Holders, CelPhoneSized pocket, Mesh Pocket with Hook Zips closed to keep logs safe", "text": "Scuba Diving Log Book - Red Cordura Diver Down Flag Three-Ring Binder Scuba Diving Log Book Red Cordura Diver Down Flag ThreeRing BinderZippered 3 ring binder holds log insertsCard and pen holdersQuick snap to hold keysFRONT COVER PRINT STYLE: Large Dive Flag Image 10inches tall x 7inches wide Threering binder fits PADI inserts Waterresistant Cordura won't scuff or tear 10 Credit Card Slots, 3 Pen Holders, CelPhoneSized pocket, Mesh Pocket with Hook Zips closed to keep logs safe", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rFKx4%2BMxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00348XB6K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innovative Scuba Concepts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B00349M20U", "title": "Picnic Time Portable Reclining Camp Chair, Black/Gray", "description": "This Picnic Time Reclining Camp Chair is no ordinary camp chair. It features a folding steel frame that can hold up to 300 pounds, a padded seat and back rest covered in durable 600D polyester canvas. Three seating positions add to this chair's functionality, along with the adjustable armrests, an insulated drink holder in the right armrest, a large zippered pocket on back of chair, and a matching storage tote with carrying strap. The Reclining Camp Chair is great as a spectator chair at sporting events or for outdoor activity such as lounging by the lake or beach, camping and fishing. Throw this chair in the back end of the car, so you are never without it!", "text": "Picnic Time Portable Reclining Camp Chair, Black/Gray This Picnic Time Reclining Camp Chair is no ordinary camp chair. It features a folding steel frame that can hold up to 300 pounds, a padded seat and back rest covered in durable 600D polyester canvas. Three seating positions add to this chair's functionality, along with the adjustable armrests, an insulated drink holder in the right armrest, a large zippered pocket on back of chair, and a matching storage tote with carrying strap. The Reclining Camp Chair is great as a spectator chair at sporting events or for outdoor activity such as lounging by the lake or beach, camping and fishing. Throw this chair in the back end of the car, so you are never without it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419D6V2KLUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00349M20U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Picnic Time", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 69.95}}
