{"item_id": "B0034C6GDG", "title": "Zippo Hand Warmer", "description": "The Zippo Hand Warmer is a rugged, metal hand warmer with a high-polish finish and a sleek, thin design so it easily fits into your pocket. The hand warmer is virtually odorless (great for hunters) and stays warm for up to 12 hours. Plus, it's reusable with Zippo lighter fluid and includes a convenient filler cup and warming bag. Whether you're skiing, tailgating at the game, hunting, sledding, or enjoying any other cold-weather activity, keep a Zippo Hand Warmer in your pocket and keep your fingers toasty warm.Features:Rugged metal constructionSleek and compact designReusable with Zippo premium lighter fluidVirtually odorless; great for huntersLasts for up to 12 hoursIncludes convenient filler cup and warming bagIdeal for skiing, sledding, other outdoor excursionsHand warmer replacement burners sold separatelyDimensions: 2.75 by 3.75 by .25 inchesEND", "text": "Zippo Hand Warmer The Zippo Hand Warmer is a rugged, metal hand warmer with a high-polish finish and a sleek, thin design so it easily fits into your pocket. The hand warmer is virtually odorless (great for hunters) and stays warm for up to 12 hours. Plus, it's reusable with Zippo lighter fluid and includes a convenient filler cup and warming bag. Whether you're skiing, tailgating at the game, hunting, sledding, or enjoying any other cold-weather activity, keep a Zippo Hand Warmer in your pocket and keep your fingers toasty warm.Features:Rugged metal constructionSleek and compact designReusable with Zippo premium lighter fluidVirtually odorless; great for huntersLasts for up to 12 hoursIncludes convenient filler cup and warming bagIdeal for skiing, sledding, other outdoor excursionsHand warmer replacement burners sold separatelyDimensions: 2.75 by 3.75 by .25 inchesEND", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41af5-ShkgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034C6GDG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zippo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 13.85}}
{"item_id": "B0034HPO5M", "title": "Valken V-TAC MOLLE Tank Pouch (click-a-Color/Orientation)", "description": "Add our V-Tac Tank pouch to your MOLLE setup to run your tank off-gun with a remote or carry an extra tank onto the field for those long scenarios. This new design reduces tank bounce and more securely holds the pouch to your vest in either the right or left orientation.", "text": "Valken V-TAC MOLLE Tank Pouch (click-a-Color/Orientation) Add our V-Tac Tank pouch to your MOLLE setup to run your tank off-gun with a remote or carry an extra tank onto the field for those long scenarios. This new design reduces tank bounce and more securely holds the pouch to your vest in either the right or left orientation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IkiFrchDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034HPO5M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0034IAQM2", "title": "Bell iPulse LED Bike Torch", "description": "Illuminate the road ahead -- and let those cars know where you are -- with the super-bright iPulse LED bike light, from leading bicycle accessory maker Bell. Five advanced LEDs are remarkably bright, yet compact in size, and a sculpted lens amplifies advanced brightness. With up to nine times longer run time than traditional halogen or xenon lights, you can expect up to 5,000 hours of bulb life. The light includes both steady and rapid flash modes, and no tools are required for installation. Runs on four AAA batteries (not included).About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell iPulse LED Bike Torch Illuminate the road ahead -- and let those cars know where you are -- with the super-bright iPulse LED bike light, from leading bicycle accessory maker Bell. Five advanced LEDs are remarkably bright, yet compact in size, and a sculpted lens amplifies advanced brightness. With up to nine times longer run time than traditional halogen or xenon lights, you can expect up to 5,000 hours of bulb life. The light includes both steady and rapid flash modes, and no tools are required for installation. Runs on four AAA batteries (not included).About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oivXhyFHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034IAQM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 28.79}}
