{"item_id": "B0034JR4EO", "title": "Cold Steel 17T Kobun Tanto Fixed", "description": "The Kobun, from creative cutlery company Cold Steel, is a Tanto-style boot knife named after the Japanese word for \"soldier.\" The sleek, lightweight knife has a blade made of Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel, with a reinforced point that's highly resistant to bending and breakage. The blade's spine runs nearly to the tip of the blade for added durability, and a checkered, nonslip Kraton handle has minimum bulk with a great deal of grip. Its cross section is designed to be as thin as possible at only a half inch, and contoured to resist turning or shifting in your palm. A Secure-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications9.875-inch overall length5.5-inch bladeJapanese AUS 8A stainless steel4.375-inch Kraton handleSecure-Ex sheath4.4-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel 17T Kobun Tanto Fixed The Kobun, from creative cutlery company Cold Steel, is a Tanto-style boot knife named after the Japanese word for \"soldier.\" The sleek, lightweight knife has a blade made of Japanese AUS 8A stainless steel, with a reinforced point that's highly resistant to bending and breakage. The blade's spine runs nearly to the tip of the blade for added durability, and a checkered, nonslip Kraton handle has minimum bulk with a great deal of grip. Its cross section is designed to be as thin as possible at only a half inch, and contoured to resist turning or shifting in your palm. A Secure-Ex sheath is also included.Specifications9.875-inch overall length5.5-inch bladeJapanese AUS 8A stainless steel4.375-inch Kraton handleSecure-Ex sheath4.4-ounce weightWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vw7iYYGZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034JR4EO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B0034JTARI", "title": "Gerber Epic Knife", "description": "Its a compact, multi-use, fixed-blade knifeits the Gerber Epic Knife. The name speaks to the impact this little knife will have on your camping or backpacking experience. A deep thumb and finger notch between the blade and handle makes multiple uses and holding techniques possible. Gerber even made the end of the handle a bottle opener and the sheath converts to a tip-up or tipdown carry for even more versatility.Product FeaturesBlade Material: Hard chrome-molybdenum stainless steelHandle Material: Textured, glass-filled nylonLock Mechanism: NoneBlade Style: Drop-pointHandle Length: 3.85in (9.8cm)Closed Length:Blade Length: 3.45in (8.8cm)Finish:Sheath Included: Yes/NoWeight: 5.12oz (145g)Recommended Use: Camping, backpacking, hikingManufacturer Warranty: Limited lifetime", "text": "Gerber Epic Knife Its a compact, multi-use, fixed-blade knifeits the Gerber Epic Knife. The name speaks to the impact this little knife will have on your camping or backpacking experience. A deep thumb and finger notch between the blade and handle makes multiple uses and holding techniques possible. Gerber even made the end of the handle a bottle opener and the sheath converts to a tip-up or tipdown carry for even more versatility.Product FeaturesBlade Material: Hard chrome-molybdenum stainless steelHandle Material: Textured, glass-filled nylonLock Mechanism: NoneBlade Style: Drop-pointHandle Length: 3.85in (9.8cm)Closed Length:Blade Length: 3.45in (8.8cm)Finish:Sheath Included: Yes/NoWeight: 5.12oz (145g)Recommended Use: Camping, backpacking, hikingManufacturer Warranty: Limited lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FArW-tqRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034JTARI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber Blades", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B0034K4JFU", "title": "Condor Rip-Away EMT Pouch", "description": "The Condor Rip-Away EMT pouch carries all your 1st aid gear. The pouch is designed to be rip-away from the modular platform when needed, and the strap on the platform keeps it from falling off accidentally.", "text": "Condor Rip-Away EMT Pouch The Condor Rip-Away EMT pouch carries all your 1st aid gear. The pouch is designed to be rip-away from the modular platform when needed, and the strap on the platform keeps it from falling off accidentally.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Czh3AluvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034K4JFU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0034K4YZ0", "title": "Condor Shotgun Scabbard", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor Shotgun Scabbard Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FKCOag6ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034K4YZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 27.92}}
{"item_id": "B0034L3D74", "title": "Lyman Big Dipper Casting Kit (115-Volt)", "description": "Includes \"Big Dipper-Inchelectric casting furnace with 10+ lbs capacity, Lyman Casting Dipper, Ingot Mould for storing excess lead, Super Moly Bullet Lube, Orange Magic Bullet Lube, Alox Bullet Lube, the Lyman Cast Bullet Handbook and the Instruction Guide for Lyman Reloading & Bullet Casting Products.", "text": "Lyman Big Dipper Casting Kit (115-Volt) Includes \"Big Dipper-Inchelectric casting furnace with 10+ lbs capacity, Lyman Casting Dipper, Ingot Mould for storing excess lead, Super Moly Bullet Lube, Orange Magic Bullet Lube, Alox Bullet Lube, the Lyman Cast Bullet Handbook and the Instruction Guide for Lyman Reloading & Bullet Casting Products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DpM-00AvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034L3D74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 73.79}}
{"item_id": "B0034L3DOW", "title": "Redfield Revolution 3-9x40mm Accu-Range", "description": "This go-to scope gives hunters a great combination of low-end and high-end magnification, with a range that combines low-power field of view and high-power precision. This Revolution will be right at home in any terrain you fill your tag. The rebirth of an American legend; the all-new Redfield Revolution™. Made in Oregon using state-of-the-art design, manufacturing, assembly, and testing techniques, the Revolution™ produces optical, mechanical, and functional superiority that no import can rival. The Illuminator Lens System™ combines premium lenses with cuttingedge multilayer, vapor-deposition coatings to provide unparalleled image quality, a greater usable field of view, and superior light transmission. For absolute long-range precision, the available Accu-Range™ reticle provides hold points to 500 yards with matchless simplicity and deadly accuracy, while meticulous attention to detail generates the ultimate repeatability and reliability of the Accu-Trac™ adjustment system. Painstaking design effort resulted in Redfield’s exclusive Rapid Target Acquisition™ (RTA) eyepiece, meaning no more missed opportunities because you couldn’t find the “sweet spot” behind the scope. Tested to levels that literally render competitive scopes useless, you can rest assured that your Revolution™ is absolutely waterproof, fog proof, shock proof, and covered by the Redfield Full Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Redfield Revolution 3-9x40mm Accu-Range This go-to scope gives hunters a great combination of low-end and high-end magnification, with a range that combines low-power field of view and high-power precision. This Revolution will be right at home in any terrain you fill your tag. The rebirth of an American legend; the all-new Redfield Revolution™. Made in Oregon using state-of-the-art design, manufacturing, assembly, and testing techniques, the Revolution™ produces optical, mechanical, and functional superiority that no import can rival. The Illuminator Lens System™ combines premium lenses with cuttingedge multilayer, vapor-deposition coatings to provide unparalleled image quality, a greater usable field of view, and superior light transmission. For absolute long-range precision, the available Accu-Range™ reticle provides hold points to 500 yards with matchless simplicity and deadly accuracy, while meticulous attention to detail generates the ultimate repeatability and reliability of the Accu-Trac™ adjustment system. Painstaking design effort resulted in Redfield’s exclusive Rapid Target Acquisition™ (RTA) eyepiece, meaning no more missed opportunities because you couldn’t find the “sweet spot” behind the scope. Tested to levels that literally render competitive scopes useless, you can rest assured that your Revolution™ is absolutely waterproof, fog proof, shock proof, and covered by the Redfield Full Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kH0b0FjtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034L3DOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 209.49}}
{"item_id": "B0034L3E9G", "title": "Bushnell Trophy XLT DOA 600 Reticle Riflescope, 4-12x40", "description": "The most proven riflescope in history is now deadlier than ever. From the class-leading 91 percent light transmission to the nearly indestructible one-piece tube, every aspect of the new Trophy XLT is optimized, helping America's best-selling riflescope meet a new standard of excellence. The Trophy XLT 4-12x40 scope--which includes Bushnell's ultra-precise DOA 600 reticle--starts with fully multicoated optics, helping the scope create ultra-bright images at those troublesome moments between dark and almost dark. Bushnell also put the scope through rigorous recoil testing to ensure that its one-piece tube performs dependably in the field. And thanks to the Butler Creek flip-up scope covers, your scope's lenses will stay protected from precipitation and fogging.The DOA 600 reticle is the scope's centerpiece, however, as it dramatically extends your effective range and helps you judge a buck's trophy quality in record time. Short for Dead On Accurate, DOA technology features Rack Bracket reference lines, which help you accurately gauge the size of whitetail and mule deer antlers at distances that are difficult for standard optics. Because these lines represent the distance between an average deer's ears, you'll know the approximate distance once the lines fit the image. It all adds up to drop-dead certainty and fewer excuses at the moment of truth. Offering aiming points from 100 to 600 yards in 100-yard increments, the DOA 600 is compatible with today's most popular deer-hunting bullet/load combinations (Bushnell also offers a DOA 250 for muzzleloaders).Ideal for long-range accuracy and field judging, the Trophy XLT 4-12x40 is guaranteed to make your trophy room runneth over. Other details include a fast-focus eyepiece, 1/4 MOA fingertip windage and elevation adjustments, and a 100-percent waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof housing.The scope's DOA 600 reticle includes reference lines that help you determine the distance to your target.Specifications:Magnification: 4 to 12xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: DOA 600Field of view: 29 feet @ 100 feet (4x); 10 feet @ 100 feet (12x)Adjustment range: 60 inches @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 10.0mmEye relief: 3.5 inchesMounting length: 5.4 inchesClick value: 0.25 inches @ 100 yardsFinish: Matte blackLength: 12.8 inchesWeight: 16.4 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "text": "Bushnell Trophy XLT DOA 600 Reticle Riflescope, 4-12x40 The most proven riflescope in history is now deadlier than ever. From the class-leading 91 percent light transmission to the nearly indestructible one-piece tube, every aspect of the new Trophy XLT is optimized, helping America's best-selling riflescope meet a new standard of excellence. The Trophy XLT 4-12x40 scope--which includes Bushnell's ultra-precise DOA 600 reticle--starts with fully multicoated optics, helping the scope create ultra-bright images at those troublesome moments between dark and almost dark. Bushnell also put the scope through rigorous recoil testing to ensure that its one-piece tube performs dependably in the field. And thanks to the Butler Creek flip-up scope covers, your scope's lenses will stay protected from precipitation and fogging.The DOA 600 reticle is the scope's centerpiece, however, as it dramatically extends your effective range and helps you judge a buck's trophy quality in record time. Short for Dead On Accurate, DOA technology features Rack Bracket reference lines, which help you accurately gauge the size of whitetail and mule deer antlers at distances that are difficult for standard optics. Because these lines represent the distance between an average deer's ears, you'll know the approximate distance once the lines fit the image. It all adds up to drop-dead certainty and fewer excuses at the moment of truth. Offering aiming points from 100 to 600 yards in 100-yard increments, the DOA 600 is compatible with today's most popular deer-hunting bullet/load combinations (Bushnell also offers a DOA 250 for muzzleloaders).Ideal for long-range accuracy and field judging, the Trophy XLT 4-12x40 is guaranteed to make your trophy room runneth over. Other details include a fast-focus eyepiece, 1/4 MOA fingertip windage and elevation adjustments, and a 100-percent waterproof, fogproof, and shockproof housing.The scope's DOA 600 reticle includes reference lines that help you determine the distance to your target.Specifications:Magnification: 4 to 12xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: DOA 600Field of view: 29 feet @ 100 feet (4x); 10 feet @ 100 feet (12x)Adjustment range: 60 inches @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 10.0mmEye relief: 3.5 inchesMounting length: 5.4 inchesClick value: 0.25 inches @ 100 yardsFinish: Matte blackLength: 12.8 inchesWeight: 16.4 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31or2cvMg0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034L3E9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 174.0}}
{"item_id": "B0034L70M8", "title": "Redfield Revolution 4-12x40mm Accu-Range", "description": "For those wide-open spaces, cutovers, clear-cuts, and bean fields where long-range shots make a difference. Dial it all the way up to 12x magnification, and you have a scope for everything from pronghorn and whitetail to woodchucks. The rebirth of an American legend; the all-new Redfield Revolution™. Made in Oregon using state-of-the-art design, manufacturing, assembly, and testing techniques, the Revolution™ produces optical, mechanical, and functional superiority that no import can rival. The Illuminator Lens System™ combines premium lenses with cuttingedge multilayer, vapor-deposition coatings to provide unparalleled image quality, a greater usable field of view, and superior light transmission. For absolute long-range precision, the available Accu-Range™ reticle provides hold points to 500 yards with matchless simplicity and deadly accuracy, while meticulous attention to detail generates the ultimate repeatability and reliability of the Accu- Trac™ adjustment system. Painstaking design effort resulted in Redfield’s exclusive Rapid Target Acquisition™ (RTA) eyepiece, meaning no more missed opportunities because you couldn’t find the “sweet spot” behind the scope. Tested to levels that literally render competitive scopes useless, you can rest assured that your Revolution™ is absolutely waterproof, fog proof, shock proof, and covered by the Redfield Full Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Redfield Revolution 4-12x40mm Accu-Range For those wide-open spaces, cutovers, clear-cuts, and bean fields where long-range shots make a difference. Dial it all the way up to 12x magnification, and you have a scope for everything from pronghorn and whitetail to woodchucks. The rebirth of an American legend; the all-new Redfield Revolution™. Made in Oregon using state-of-the-art design, manufacturing, assembly, and testing techniques, the Revolution™ produces optical, mechanical, and functional superiority that no import can rival. The Illuminator Lens System™ combines premium lenses with cuttingedge multilayer, vapor-deposition coatings to provide unparalleled image quality, a greater usable field of view, and superior light transmission. For absolute long-range precision, the available Accu-Range™ reticle provides hold points to 500 yards with matchless simplicity and deadly accuracy, while meticulous attention to detail generates the ultimate repeatability and reliability of the Accu- Trac™ adjustment system. Painstaking design effort resulted in Redfield’s exclusive Rapid Target Acquisition™ (RTA) eyepiece, meaning no more missed opportunities because you couldn’t find the “sweet spot” behind the scope. Tested to levels that literally render competitive scopes useless, you can rest assured that your Revolution™ is absolutely waterproof, fog proof, shock proof, and covered by the Redfield Full Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QOAlypOtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034L70M8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 255.88}}
{"item_id": "B0034LAVUG", "title": "Lyman Universal Case Prep Accessory Set", "description": "This new accessory features all the items necessary for quality case preparation in one deluxe set. Includes both large and small primer pocket reamers, primer pocket cleaners, outside deburring tool, inside (VLD) chamfer tool and large and small primer pocket uniformer tools. All individual items have their own molded handle with rubber insert for sure grip. Includes custom zippered case for storage or easy transport to the range. (Save 40% over individual purchases).", "text": "Lyman Universal Case Prep Accessory Set This new accessory features all the items necessary for quality case preparation in one deluxe set. Includes both large and small primer pocket reamers, primer pocket cleaners, outside deburring tool, inside (VLD) chamfer tool and large and small primer pocket uniformer tools. All individual items have their own molded handle with rubber insert for sure grip. Includes custom zippered case for storage or easy transport to the range. (Save 40% over individual purchases).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415RVG8-1YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034LAVUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 55.29}}
{"item_id": "B0034M3EYA", "title": "1 3/4\" Brass Face Pocket Compass w/Cover: Hiking and Camping", "description": "This functioning brass face pocket compass with antique finish is approximately 1.75\" in diameter. It has a spring loaded protective cover that opens easily, and a top loop so you can attach it to your key chain, belt or backpack. This compass may have some minor cosmetic imperfections such as small scratches. Use it to navigate while hiking or camping.Compasses have been used for years to help travelers determine their location as well as the location of their destination. Used while hunting, camping, hiking or working, the compass can be a lost individual's most prized possession.", "text": "1 3/4\" Brass Face Pocket Compass w/Cover: Hiking and Camping This functioning brass face pocket compass with antique finish is approximately 1.75\" in diameter. It has a spring loaded protective cover that opens easily, and a top loop so you can attach it to your key chain, belt or backpack. This compass may have some minor cosmetic imperfections such as small scratches. Use it to navigate while hiking or camping.Compasses have been used for years to help travelers determine their location as well as the location of their destination. Used while hunting, camping, hiking or working, the compass can be a lost individual's most prized possession.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41soXJORBsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034M3EYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ITDC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 20.21}}
{"item_id": "B0034PA1UC", "title": "Wilson Energy Extra Large Tennis Racquet without Cover", "description": "V-Matrix Technology with V-Lock Bridge has a new concave frame geometry broadens the racket sweet spot for increased power on off-centered hits. It consists of stop shock sleeves, power String for increased power and enlarged head for greater power.", "text": "Wilson Energy Extra Large Tennis Racquet without Cover V-Matrix Technology with V-Lock Bridge has a new concave frame geometry broadens the racket sweet spot for increased power on off-centered hits. It consists of stop shock sleeves, power String for increased power and enlarged head for greater power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QnYQdAecL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034PA1UC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Racquets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0034PXYRY", "title": "Eotech EXPS3-0 Holographic Weapon Site", "description": "Specifications:Operation- Optics: Transmission holography - parallax free- Magnification: 1x - Eye Relief: Unlimited- Length/Width/Height: 3.5-Inch by 2.4-Inch by 2.8-Inch (91.4X 60.9x71mm)- Weight: 11.2 oz (317grams)- Temperature: -40 to 150 F - Waterproof: Submersible to 33 ft depth- Sealing: Fogproof internal optics- Color/Finish: Non reflective black with hard coat finish- Adjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2-Inch at 100 yds)- Adjustment Range: +/- 40 MOA travel- Mount: 1-Inch Weaver or(MILSTD913) - Return to Zero: Repeatable to within 2 MOA after re-mounting- Night Vision Compatibility: 10 brightness setting (generation I-III+)Heads-Up-Display Window- Optical Surfaces: Anti-glare coating- Window Dimensions: 1.20-Inch x 0.85-Inch (30 x 23mm)- Front Window Material: 1/8-Inch solid glass- Rear Window Material: Shatter resistant laminate (3/16-Inch thick)- Field of View (100 yds): 30 yds (28m) at a 4-Inch eye reliefElectrical- Brightness Adjustment Range: 146,000:1 brightest to lowest- Night Vision Brightness Range: 1280:1 with NV switch engaged- Power Source: (1) 123 lithium battery- Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12- Brightness Settings: 30 settings with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)- Auto Battery Check Indicator: Flashing reticle upon start-up- Auto Shut-down: At 8 hrs- programmable to 4 hrs- Eotech has done it again by making the best even better. Offering true 2 eyes open shooting, a transversely mounted lithium 123 battery, and 7 mm raised base offering iron sight access, the new Extreme-XPS (EXPS) features easy to adjust side buttons and a single, quick release throw lever for easy attachment and removal.", "text": "Eotech EXPS3-0 Holographic Weapon Site Specifications:Operation- Optics: Transmission holography - parallax free- Magnification: 1x - Eye Relief: Unlimited- Length/Width/Height: 3.5-Inch by 2.4-Inch by 2.8-Inch (91.4X 60.9x71mm)- Weight: 11.2 oz (317grams)- Temperature: -40 to 150 F - Waterproof: Submersible to 33 ft depth- Sealing: Fogproof internal optics- Color/Finish: Non reflective black with hard coat finish- Adjustment (per click): 0.5 MOA (1/2-Inch at 100 yds)- Adjustment Range: +/- 40 MOA travel- Mount: 1-Inch Weaver or(MILSTD913) - Return to Zero: Repeatable to within 2 MOA after re-mounting- Night Vision Compatibility: 10 brightness setting (generation I-III+)Heads-Up-Display Window- Optical Surfaces: Anti-glare coating- Window Dimensions: 1.20-Inch x 0.85-Inch (30 x 23mm)- Front Window Material: 1/8-Inch solid glass- Rear Window Material: Shatter resistant laminate (3/16-Inch thick)- Field of View (100 yds): 30 yds (28m) at a 4-Inch eye reliefElectrical- Brightness Adjustment Range: 146,000:1 brightest to lowest- Night Vision Brightness Range: 1280:1 with NV switch engaged- Power Source: (1) 123 lithium battery- Battery Life: 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12- Brightness Settings: 30 settings with scrolling feature (10 settings for NV use)- Auto Battery Check Indicator: Flashing reticle upon start-up- Auto Shut-down: At 8 hrs- programmable to 4 hrs- Eotech has done it again by making the best even better. Offering true 2 eyes open shooting, a transversely mounted lithium 123 battery, and 7 mm raised base offering iron sight access, the new Extreme-XPS (EXPS) features easy to adjust side buttons and a single, quick release throw lever for easy attachment and removal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414O-dQKv1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034PXYRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 606.92}}
{"item_id": "B0034VP4UI", "title": "Sawyer 4-Way Water Filtration System with 32-Ounce Durable Bottle", "description": "Sawyer’s 4-way filter is a lightweight versatile solution to clean water in the backcountry. This system can be used as a water treatment bottle, inline on a hydration pack, as an ultra light drink straw and attached to a faucet with the included faucet adaptor. Fill up the bottle or your hydration pack directly from a lake, stream or creek, and drink instantly. You can also adapt the standard 63mm cap to your existing bottle. This is a must have when travelling abroad to areas with unsafe drinking water and for disaster preparedness kits. Use the included faucet adaptor to drink straight from the tap during boil alerts or in areas of natural disasters such as floods, hurricanes, and earthquakes. Included is a hydration pack assembly kit for installing the inline filter on a hydration pack. Hollow Fiber Membrane filter physically removes particles, Protozoa, and bacteria down to 0.1 micron absolute in size, including giardia, salmonella and cryptosporidium.This field cleanable solution comes with Sawyers' One Million Gallon guarantee. Field Weight: 5 ounces, capacity: 32 ounces. Dimensions: 11 x 3 inches.", "text": "Sawyer 4-Way Water Filtration System with 32-Ounce Durable Bottle Sawyer’s 4-way filter is a lightweight versatile solution to clean water in the backcountry. This system can be used as a water treatment bottle, inline on a hydration pack, as an ultra light drink straw and attached to a faucet with the included faucet adaptor. Fill up the bottle or your hydration pack directly from a lake, stream or creek, and drink instantly. You can also adapt the standard 63mm cap to your existing bottle. This is a must have when travelling abroad to areas with unsafe drinking water and for disaster preparedness kits. Use the included faucet adaptor to drink straight from the tap during boil alerts or in areas of natural disasters such as floods, hurricanes, and earthquakes. Included is a hydration pack assembly kit for installing the inline filter on a hydration pack. Hollow Fiber Membrane filter physically removes particles, Protozoa, and bacteria down to 0.1 micron absolute in size, including giardia, salmonella and cryptosporidium.This field cleanable solution comes with Sawyers' One Million Gallon guarantee. Field Weight: 5 ounces, capacity: 32 ounces. Dimensions: 11 x 3 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SSUp1A7EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034VP4UI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 56.71}}
{"item_id": "B0034VR8ES", "title": "Sawyer 3-Way Inline Water Filter", "description": "Use the Sawyer lightweight 3-way inline filter water treatment system to filter water directly from a river, lake or stream along the trail or from other non potable sources. Works great as a hydration pack reservoir filter for long hikes where the water source is in quesion. You can even just attach it to a household faucet filter. For Hydration packs, insert the filter inline with the drinking tube, then simply fill your reservoir with unfiltered water and drink away. As long as the filter is inline on your hydration pack you don’t need to worry about cleaning the reservoir. You can also attach a drink tube of your choice (sold separately) to the filter, then submerge the filter into dirty water and drink directly from the source. This is a great alternative to carrying potable water long distances or while out canoeing, kayaking, backpacking, or travelling abroad. Filter cartridge is 1.75 inches x 3.5 inches.", "text": "Sawyer 3-Way Inline Water Filter Use the Sawyer lightweight 3-way inline filter water treatment system to filter water directly from a river, lake or stream along the trail or from other non potable sources. Works great as a hydration pack reservoir filter for long hikes where the water source is in quesion. You can even just attach it to a household faucet filter. For Hydration packs, insert the filter inline with the drinking tube, then simply fill your reservoir with unfiltered water and drink away. As long as the filter is inline on your hydration pack you don’t need to worry about cleaning the reservoir. You can also attach a drink tube of your choice (sold separately) to the filter, then submerge the filter into dirty water and drink directly from the source. This is a great alternative to carrying potable water long distances or while out canoeing, kayaking, backpacking, or travelling abroad. Filter cartridge is 1.75 inches x 3.5 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ISQlNIWVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034VR8ES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 49.94}}
{"item_id": "B0034YRHEQ", "title": "Condor Multicam Battle Belt - Small", "description": "Two rows of webbing across belt. Four D-rings for harness. Padded mesh with non-slip lining.Two leg rig attachment openings. Webbing covered in multicam fabric. Rigger belt not included. The size is Small.", "text": "Condor Multicam Battle Belt - Small Two rows of webbing across belt. Four D-rings for harness. Padded mesh with non-slip lining.Two leg rig attachment openings. Webbing covered in multicam fabric. Rigger belt not included. The size is Small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uOzIY8jnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034YRHEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0034YWJ1M", "title": "Morakniv Wood Carving 163 Hook Knife with Carbon Steel Blade", "description": "Generations of carpenters and wood carvers have appreciated the precision tools made by Morakniv in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. The Mora 163 Hook knife for spoon carving is double-edged with a carbon steel blade. Oiled birch wood handle. Blade length 61 mm. Internal radius 20-25 mm.", "text": "Morakniv Wood Carving 163 Hook Knife with Carbon Steel Blade Generations of carpenters and wood carvers have appreciated the precision tools made by Morakniv in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. The Mora 163 Hook knife for spoon carving is double-edged with a carbon steel blade. Oiled birch wood handle. Blade length 61 mm. Internal radius 20-25 mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mjfmzugEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034YWJ1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 23.69}}
{"item_id": "B0034ZC2JA", "title": "Modular Chest Rig", "description": "The Condor Modular Chest Set features 6 built-in M4 mag pouches and 2 internal mesh pockets. There is webbing for modular attachments and an interneal pocket with webbing for modular attachments. The chest platform is adjustable and removable, and the waist is adjustable. There is also padded shoulder straps for comfort, and there is a built-in hydration carrier (bladder not included). The size is adjustable from Medium to X-Large.", "text": "Modular Chest Rig The Condor Modular Chest Set features 6 built-in M4 mag pouches and 2 internal mesh pockets. There is webbing for modular attachments and an interneal pocket with webbing for modular attachments. The chest platform is adjustable and removable, and the waist is adjustable. There is also padded shoulder straps for comfort, and there is a built-in hydration carrier (bladder not included). The size is adjustable from Medium to X-Large.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41giP6xifrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034ZC2JA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 46.95}}
{"item_id": "B0034ZECX4", "title": "Sea Pearls Lead Shot Soft Weights", "description": "The most comfortable weights available, if you are placing them in weight pockets hanging from a belt or placing them in your quick release weight integrated BCD you won't find a more comfortable weight type on the market. Soft outer material allows the thousands of lead shot balls to conform to you equipment or more important body shape. If you have gotten bruises from hard weight resting on your hip bone these weights will eliminate that problem for you.", "text": "Sea Pearls Lead Shot Soft Weights The most comfortable weights available, if you are placing them in weight pockets hanging from a belt or placing them in your quick release weight integrated BCD you won't find a more comfortable weight type on the market. Soft outer material allows the thousands of lead shot balls to conform to you equipment or more important body shape. If you have gotten bruises from hard weight resting on your hip bone these weights will eliminate that problem for you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4114hFnInEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034ZECX4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Weights & Belts"]], "price": 15.93}}
{"item_id": "B0034ZO8E2", "title": "Molle Tactical Sling BAG Backpack --Acu, Tan, Black, Od Green", "description": "- Ambidextrous shoulder/waist strap for left and right hand usage. - Build-In Hydration Compatible Pocket. (bladder is not included) - Zipper Closure Concealment Pockets, with Hook and Loop Panel. (for UH1 Holster, Sold Separately) - Double Zipper Pulls on ALL Three Compartments. - Compression Straps on Top and Side. - Padded Mesh Back Panel. - Heavy Duty Webbing Over Entire Pack and Inside of Main Compartment for Attachment. - Two outer layer with multiple compartments and slots. - VOLUME : 1585 CU IN", "text": "Molle Tactical Sling BAG Backpack --Acu, Tan, Black, Od Green - Ambidextrous shoulder/waist strap for left and right hand usage. - Build-In Hydration Compatible Pocket. (bladder is not included) - Zipper Closure Concealment Pockets, with Hook and Loop Panel. (for UH1 Holster, Sold Separately) - Double Zipper Pulls on ALL Three Compartments. - Compression Straps on Top and Side. - Padded Mesh Back Panel. - Heavy Duty Webbing Over Entire Pack and Inside of Main Compartment for Attachment. - Two outer layer with multiple compartments and slots. - VOLUME : 1585 CU IN", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41szd79n8HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0034ZO8E2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 58.91}}
{"item_id": "B003517NVA", "title": "Arm Warmer Cover Uv Protection Cooling Sleeves Coolmax - Pair", "description": "These white or pink multi-sport, unisex arm warmers exclusively from Seavenger are made with a luxurious combination of Nylon, Lycra and Cool Max. They're perfect for any outdoor activity: Golf, tennis, fishing, soccer, baseball, climbing, jogging inline skating, cycling, driving - you name it. These easy to put on and take off arm warmers protect you from UV rays, and help you stay cool in hot weather. The specially woven, silk-like fabric is lightweight and elastic has a UV protective factor of +400, and quickly absorbing away any perspiration, keeping arms dry and feeling fresh. Arm-warmers from Seavenger are just possibly the single most popular item in our store -- they fly out of here!", "text": "Arm Warmer Cover Uv Protection Cooling Sleeves Coolmax - Pair These white or pink multi-sport, unisex arm warmers exclusively from Seavenger are made with a luxurious combination of Nylon, Lycra and Cool Max. They're perfect for any outdoor activity: Golf, tennis, fishing, soccer, baseball, climbing, jogging inline skating, cycling, driving - you name it. These easy to put on and take off arm warmers protect you from UV rays, and help you stay cool in hot weather. The specially woven, silk-like fabric is lightweight and elastic has a UV protective factor of +400, and quickly absorbing away any perspiration, keeping arms dry and feeling fresh. Arm-warmers from Seavenger are just possibly the single most popular item in our store -- they fly out of here!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DmsXWz90L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003517NVA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Armwarmers"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003527E3G", "title": "Summit Godspeed Ss Tensioner", "description": "Godspeed Single Speed Chain TensionerGreat for off road use or your townie bikeAdjustable arm fits any chain lineAluminum arm and Aluminum pulley with sealed bearingReplacement spring includedDon't be fooled by the imitators with plastic pulleysFully Adjustable chain line106 grams!", "text": "Summit Godspeed Ss Tensioner Godspeed Single Speed Chain TensionerGreat for off road use or your townie bikeAdjustable arm fits any chain lineAluminum arm and Aluminum pulley with sealed bearingReplacement spring includedDon't be fooled by the imitators with plastic pulleysFully Adjustable chain line106 grams!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lV9J7W9HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003527E3G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chain Tension Idlers"]]}}
