{"item_id": "B00358QZZ8", "title": "NeoSport Wetsuits Paddle Low Top Boots", "description": "These easy-on Paddle Low Top Boots are warm and super streamlined, thanks to the absence of a bulky zipper. A wrap-around guard reinforces the toe section and an extended heel is perfect for catching onto fin straps. Though these boots are great for paddling, they are also excellent all-around water shoes for navigating rocky beaches or river bottoms and work well in and out of the kayak. Made of comfortable neoprene material with Water Entry Barrier to keep your toes warm with glued and sewn seams to keep water out. A hardened insert sole offers puncture-resistant protection so you can keep a sure footing in the rockiest of rivers. Other features include an adjustable hook-and-loop arch strap and durable YKK side zippers for an easy on and off.Features:3mm neoprene material is comfortable and keeps feet warm and drySeams are both stitched and gluedDurable traction sole; perfect for all water activitiesHardened insert sole for puncture-resistant protectionAnkle barrel cinch shock cordAdjustable hook-and-loop arch strapDurable YKK side zippersEasy on/easy off design with pull tabs", "text": "NeoSport Wetsuits Paddle Low Top Boots These easy-on Paddle Low Top Boots are warm and super streamlined, thanks to the absence of a bulky zipper. A wrap-around guard reinforces the toe section and an extended heel is perfect for catching onto fin straps. Though these boots are great for paddling, they are also excellent all-around water shoes for navigating rocky beaches or river bottoms and work well in and out of the kayak. Made of comfortable neoprene material with Water Entry Barrier to keep your toes warm with glued and sewn seams to keep water out. A hardened insert sole offers puncture-resistant protection so you can keep a sure footing in the rockiest of rivers. Other features include an adjustable hook-and-loop arch strap and durable YKK side zippers for an easy on and off.Features:3mm neoprene material is comfortable and keeps feet warm and drySeams are both stitched and gluedDurable traction sole; perfect for all water activitiesHardened insert sole for puncture-resistant protectionAnkle barrel cinch shock cordAdjustable hook-and-loop arch strapDurable YKK side zippersEasy on/easy off design with pull tabs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lB6kecE0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00358QZZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Surfing", "Surfing Booties"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00359L13S", "title": "Wolverine Holsters Under - the - Desk Holster", "description": "Under - the - Desk Holster, a \"stealth stash\" nearly anywhere! For home, business, even in a big rig... this is made to safely hold any size handgun in easy, secret reach. Under a desk, in a cabinet, along a closet wall, almost any place. Tough synthetic panel with elastic gun-holder, metal grommets and complete with 4 screws for fast, stable installation. Get this smart hideaway now! Wolverine Holsters Under-the-Desk Holster", "text": "Wolverine Holsters Under - the - Desk Holster Under - the - Desk Holster, a \"stealth stash\" nearly anywhere! For home, business, even in a big rig... this is made to safely hold any size handgun in easy, secret reach. Under a desk, in a cabinet, along a closet wall, almost any place. Tough synthetic panel with elastic gun-holder, metal grommets and complete with 4 screws for fast, stable installation. Get this smart hideaway now! Wolverine Holsters Under-the-Desk Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Umhv58GoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00359L13S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLUE STONE SAFETY", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00359L1AQ", "title": "Caldwell Ultimate Target Stand With Target Backer", "description": "This durable stand features a oversized backer to hold up multiple large targets (two 15-Inch targets side by side) and is constructed of an all-weather moisture resistant material. The modular frame collapses to occupy less space during transport and storage. The frame arms are constructed of durable steel rod and hold the backer securely in place. Removable ground stabilizer adds support from wind during use and conveniently stows onto feet. The base of the stand is open so that you can use your foot to drive the molded-in spikes into the ground. This stand also has an integrated storage container for holding miscellaneous range supplies such as staples or target pasters.", "text": "Caldwell Ultimate Target Stand With Target Backer This durable stand features a oversized backer to hold up multiple large targets (two 15-Inch targets side by side) and is constructed of an all-weather moisture resistant material. The modular frame collapses to occupy less space during transport and storage. The frame arms are constructed of durable steel rod and hold the backer securely in place. Removable ground stabilizer adds support from wind during use and conveniently stows onto feet. The base of the stand is open so that you can use your foot to drive the molded-in spikes into the ground. This stand also has an integrated storage container for holding miscellaneous range supplies such as staples or target pasters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qmKFFbu%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00359L1AQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B00359P0YY", "title": "Caldwell Lead Sled Solo", "description": "The latest addition to Caldwell's line of recoil-reducing rests, the Lead Sled Solo provides a fraction of the recoil while securely holding your gun on target.The Lead Sled Solo greatly reduces recoil while holding your gun on target.The Lead Sled Solo features a smooth pivoting elevation system that's controlled by a single knob, making target adjustments fast and precise. The unit is well built, with a heavy-duty steel construction that provides a stable, solid shooting platform. And shooters will love the Lead Sled Solo's unique offset frame, which is designed to accommodate all rifles, including detachable magazine rifles such as the popular AR-15 platform as well as lever action guns. The front support is also height-adjustable, with a durable rubberized coating that won't scratch or mar your gun.The secret to the Lead Sled Solo's effectiveness is its integrated weight tray, which holds a single 25-pound bag of shot. The combination of the weight and the heavy-duty spring--which is located between the frame members--all but eliminates recoil on non-magnum calibers and greatly reduces recoil on all calibers. To attach the rifle, simply use the welded steel brace to secure the butt of the gun and the integrated front strap to secure the rifle to the rest. The steel brace includes a durable rubber boot to protect your rifle from abrasions.SpecificationsFrame material: SteelWeight tray capacity: Up to 25 poundsLength: 26 inchesWidth: 18 inchesWeight: Approximately 14 pounds", "text": "Caldwell Lead Sled Solo The latest addition to Caldwell's line of recoil-reducing rests, the Lead Sled Solo provides a fraction of the recoil while securely holding your gun on target.The Lead Sled Solo greatly reduces recoil while holding your gun on target.The Lead Sled Solo features a smooth pivoting elevation system that's controlled by a single knob, making target adjustments fast and precise. The unit is well built, with a heavy-duty steel construction that provides a stable, solid shooting platform. And shooters will love the Lead Sled Solo's unique offset frame, which is designed to accommodate all rifles, including detachable magazine rifles such as the popular AR-15 platform as well as lever action guns. The front support is also height-adjustable, with a durable rubberized coating that won't scratch or mar your gun.The secret to the Lead Sled Solo's effectiveness is its integrated weight tray, which holds a single 25-pound bag of shot. The combination of the weight and the heavy-duty spring--which is located between the frame members--all but eliminates recoil on non-magnum calibers and greatly reduces recoil on all calibers. To attach the rifle, simply use the welded steel brace to secure the butt of the gun and the integrated front strap to secure the rifle to the rest. The steel brace includes a durable rubber boot to protect your rifle from abrasions.SpecificationsFrame material: SteelWeight tray capacity: Up to 25 poundsLength: 26 inchesWidth: 18 inchesWeight: Approximately 14 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DsaYiGNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00359P0YY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 67.99}}
{"item_id": "B00359T1Z8", "title": "Barska CO11342 3-9X 40mm Colorado Riflescope", "description": "Now you can have more for less. Accuracy, precision and dependability at a popular price. The 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope is the perfect choice for serious shooters or hunters who want a wealth of features and performance but don't want to spend a fortune. The Colorado scopes combine high quality optics and rugged construction with accuracy and ease of use. This scope features fully-coated optics for bright, clear, distortion-free views, a 30/30 reticle and rugged 1 Inch monotube construction. If you're looking for a premium riflescope at an affordable price, look no farther than the 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope. Protected by BARSKA's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Specifications: Magnification 3-9x; Objective Lens 40mm; Reticle: 30/30; Exit Pupil: 13.33-4.44mm; Optical Coating: Fully Coated; Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m):12.04 ft-37.35 ft.; Focus Type: Eye Bell; Tube Diameter: 1 Inch; Included Accessories: Scope Caps and Lens Cloth.", "text": "Barska CO11342 3-9X 40mm Colorado Riflescope Now you can have more for less. Accuracy, precision and dependability at a popular price. The 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope is the perfect choice for serious shooters or hunters who want a wealth of features and performance but don't want to spend a fortune. The Colorado scopes combine high quality optics and rugged construction with accuracy and ease of use. This scope features fully-coated optics for bright, clear, distortion-free views, a 30/30 reticle and rugged 1 Inch monotube construction. If you're looking for a premium riflescope at an affordable price, look no farther than the 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope. Protected by BARSKA's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Specifications: Magnification 3-9x; Objective Lens 40mm; Reticle: 30/30; Exit Pupil: 13.33-4.44mm; Optical Coating: Fully Coated; Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m):12.04 ft-37.35 ft.; Focus Type: Eye Bell; Tube Diameter: 1 Inch; Included Accessories: Scope Caps and Lens Cloth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zPAT9NY3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00359T1Z8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0035EEMPC", "title": "Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad", "description": "FEATURES of the Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad Available for Tuo Luxury, Tuo Cub, all Astro and Cosmo sleeping pads Weight and dimensions vary by model. See PIllowtop Product Chart on page 25 for information on specific models SPECIFICATIONS of the Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad Fabric: Washable Polyester Microsuede OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean. This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us. Nemo products cannot be shipped to Japan. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad FEATURES of the Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad Available for Tuo Luxury, Tuo Cub, all Astro and Cosmo sleeping pads Weight and dimensions vary by model. See PIllowtop Product Chart on page 25 for information on specific models SPECIFICATIONS of the Nemo Cosmo Air with Pillowtop Sleeping Pad Fabric: Washable Polyester Microsuede OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean. This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us. Nemo products cannot be shipped to Japan. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yduuTn60L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035EEMPC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]], "price": 229.5}}
{"item_id": "B0035EJMTI", "title": "Nemo Equipment Meta 2-Person Ultralight Trekking Tent", "description": "NEMO's Meta tent is a striking example of the efficiency and weight savings possible with a well-designed trekking pole tent. NEMO's products are often cited for their comfort and usability, and Meta tents -- with tall peak heights, generous overall length, and multiple well-placed vents -- certainly continue this standard.Dual vestibules/entries on Meta 2P eliminate jostling for position and gear storage.Reinforced hoops keep the upper vents open at all times, allowing low-to high ventilation.Oversized grommets locate the tips of trekking poles and reinforced areas at the top of the tent receive the pole handles.A fixed webbing length to the vestibule anchor makes setup quick and straightforward, while the unique vestibules on the Meta 2P overhang the inner tent so they can be rolled back out of the way in light rain, allowing air to flow freely through the tent. Clever side vents promote cross ventilation, funnel condensation out of the tent, and provide extra headroom when guyed out.SpecificationsTwo-person tentTwo-pound, 15-ounce minimum weightTwo trekking pole (not included) frameMesh and 20-denier polyurethane nylon shell fabric20-denier polyurethane nylon fabric vestibule30-denier polyurethane nylon fabric floor with 5,000mm coating43-inch interior height37-square-foot floor measures 53 by 96 inches (W x D)22-square-foot vestibuleIncludes dry bag-style stuff sack, stakes, guy-out cord, and repair kitOptional accessories include Footprint, Pawprint, and Meta 2P polesLifetime WarrantyNEMO products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About NEMOInnovative outdoor gear maker NEMO is a company \"founded on a commitment to adventure, to the fearless pursuit of uncharted paths.\" This vision informs both the equipment NEMO builds and the way the organization runs its business, keeping an open mind while pursuing new designs and directions. NEMO believes that meaningful adventures are possible for everyone equipped with the will, imagination, and the right gear.", "text": "Nemo Equipment Meta 2-Person Ultralight Trekking Tent NEMO's Meta tent is a striking example of the efficiency and weight savings possible with a well-designed trekking pole tent. NEMO's products are often cited for their comfort and usability, and Meta tents -- with tall peak heights, generous overall length, and multiple well-placed vents -- certainly continue this standard.Dual vestibules/entries on Meta 2P eliminate jostling for position and gear storage.Reinforced hoops keep the upper vents open at all times, allowing low-to high ventilation.Oversized grommets locate the tips of trekking poles and reinforced areas at the top of the tent receive the pole handles.A fixed webbing length to the vestibule anchor makes setup quick and straightforward, while the unique vestibules on the Meta 2P overhang the inner tent so they can be rolled back out of the way in light rain, allowing air to flow freely through the tent. Clever side vents promote cross ventilation, funnel condensation out of the tent, and provide extra headroom when guyed out.SpecificationsTwo-person tentTwo-pound, 15-ounce minimum weightTwo trekking pole (not included) frameMesh and 20-denier polyurethane nylon shell fabric20-denier polyurethane nylon fabric vestibule30-denier polyurethane nylon fabric floor with 5,000mm coating43-inch interior height37-square-foot floor measures 53 by 96 inches (W x D)22-square-foot vestibuleIncludes dry bag-style stuff sack, stakes, guy-out cord, and repair kitOptional accessories include Footprint, Pawprint, and Meta 2P polesLifetime WarrantyNEMO products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About NEMOInnovative outdoor gear maker NEMO is a company \"founded on a commitment to adventure, to the fearless pursuit of uncharted paths.\" This vision informs both the equipment NEMO builds and the way the organization runs its business, keeping an open mind while pursuing new designs and directions. NEMO believes that meaningful adventures are possible for everyone equipped with the will, imagination, and the right gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HJh2IkksL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035EJMTI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0035ENP8C", "title": "Nemo FILLOTM Backpacking & Camping Pillow", "description": "FilloTM is soft and yielding, yet substantial enough for side-sleepers. It's amazing in the backcountry, but also great on an airplane or as lumbar support. It feels big when it's cradling your head, but it packs surprisingly small. It's everything you want in a sidekick pillow for all adventures.", "text": "Nemo FILLOTM Backpacking & Camping Pillow FilloTM is soft and yielding, yet substantial enough for side-sleepers. It's amazing in the backcountry, but also great on an airplane or as lumbar support. It feels big when it's cradling your head, but it packs surprisingly small. It's everything you want in a sidekick pillow for all adventures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31da1lgFDAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035ENP8C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nemo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B0035EQDTA", "title": "Learning Resources Simple Stopwatch", "description": "Simple Stopwatch. Even your youngest students can master it. Only 3 buttons—green for go, red for stop and yellow for clear. Great for classroom management, centers, timed math exercises, science investigations and measuring elapsed time. Easy-to-read display shows minutes, seconds and 1/100 seconds. Measures 3\"H. Requires one 1.5V button-cell battery, included. Grades K+.", "text": "Learning Resources Simple Stopwatch Simple Stopwatch. Even your youngest students can master it. Only 3 buttons—green for go, red for stop and yellow for clear. Great for classroom management, centers, timed math exercises, science investigations and measuring elapsed time. Easy-to-read display shows minutes, seconds and 1/100 seconds. Measures 3\"H. Requires one 1.5V button-cell battery, included. Grades K+.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BLCYVCV-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035EQDTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Learning Resources", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Stopwatches"]], "price": 10.95}}
