{"item_id": "B0035LTXUY", "title": "Allen Company Tactical Gun Sock", "description": "Features a 42-Inch Black Gun Sock. Silicone treated. Great for use in conjunction with a gun safe or hard case. Fits guns with or without scopes up to 42-Inch long. Includes a Cinch strap closure. The 42 and 47 inches Gun Sock fits long-guns upto 41” or 46” respectively.", "text": "Allen Company Tactical Gun Sock Features a 42-Inch Black Gun Sock. Silicone treated. Great for use in conjunction with a gun safe or hard case. Fits guns with or without scopes up to 42-Inch long. Includes a Cinch strap closure. The 42 and 47 inches Gun Sock fits long-guns upto 41” or 46” respectively.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219OKnYG7EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LTXUY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0035LTYQC", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Glock Model 20SF/21SF Grip Frame Insert For Glock 20 and 21 Short Frame", "description": "This unit fits in the bottom rear cavity of a Glock 20 and 21 SHORT FRAME utilizing the lanyard hole to secure it to the frame. These grip frame inserts will not fit a Generation 4 frame nor a standard Glock 20 or 21 frame", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Glock Model 20SF/21SF Grip Frame Insert For Glock 20 and 21 Short Frame This unit fits in the bottom rear cavity of a Glock 20 and 21 SHORT FRAME utilizing the lanyard hole to secure it to the frame. These grip frame inserts will not fit a Generation 4 frame nor a standard Glock 20 or 21 frame", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oX7M-OiQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LTYQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 5.8}}
{"item_id": "B0035LTYR6", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Glock Model 29/30 Grip Frame Insert", "description": "This units fits in the bottom rear cavity of a Glock 29 or 30 utilizing a friction fit to secure it in the frame. This product will not fit Glock 29SF or 30SF (Short Frame models)", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Glock Model 29/30 Grip Frame Insert This units fits in the bottom rear cavity of a Glock 29 or 30 utilizing a friction fit to secure it in the frame. This product will not fit Glock 29SF or 30SF (Short Frame models)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q5XWqcZGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LTYR6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0035LU0O2", "title": "Tipton Rapid Universal Bore Guide Kit", "description": "The Tipton RAPID Deluxe Bore Guide Kit contains several great tools that ensure the safest, easiest, and most effective cleaning possible. RAPID allows you to easily align and secure a patch for solvent application, and then holds it with the correct amount of tension for perfect jag penetration. When the rod is pushed into the RAPID, it automatically releases the patch. It also keeps harmful solvents off your gun’s finish in the process. A bore guide will help protect the bore and action of your rifle by properly aligning the cleaning rod and reducing solvent overflow. Cleaning without a bore guide can allow the rod to “bow” and rub or gouge the chamber and throat of the bore causing real damage and loss of accuracy. Keeping the rod properly alignednot only protects your barrel, it properly directs the force exerted on the cleaning rod handle, allowing tight patches to be pushed safer and easier. (Will not fit .22 Rimfire)", "text": "Tipton Rapid Universal Bore Guide Kit The Tipton RAPID Deluxe Bore Guide Kit contains several great tools that ensure the safest, easiest, and most effective cleaning possible. RAPID allows you to easily align and secure a patch for solvent application, and then holds it with the correct amount of tension for perfect jag penetration. When the rod is pushed into the RAPID, it automatically releases the patch. It also keeps harmful solvents off your gun’s finish in the process. A bore guide will help protect the bore and action of your rifle by properly aligning the cleaning rod and reducing solvent overflow. Cleaning without a bore guide can allow the rod to “bow” and rub or gouge the chamber and throat of the bore causing real damage and loss of accuracy. Keeping the rod properly alignednot only protects your barrel, it properly directs the force exerted on the cleaning rod handle, allowing tight patches to be pushed safer and easier. (Will not fit .22 Rimfire)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fPS-gDpaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LU0O2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 29.84}}
