{"item_id": "B0035LVTMY", "title": "Bulldog Extreme Rectangle Discreet Black Assault Rifle Case", "description": "Extreme Rectangle Discreet Assault Rifle Case 45\" - Black INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length heavy-duty zipper with pull * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Brushed tricot soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Extra large main compartments with 6 hidden magazine holders * Wrap-around carry handles * Fiber reinforced sidewalls for extra durability", "text": "Bulldog Extreme Rectangle Discreet Black Assault Rifle Case Extreme Rectangle Discreet Assault Rifle Case 45\" - Black INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 43\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 11\" * 2 1/2\" total soft padding * Full-length heavy-duty zipper with pull * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Brushed tricot soft scratch-resistant inner lining * Extra large main compartments with 6 hidden magazine holders * Wrap-around carry handles * Fiber reinforced sidewalls for extra durability", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31T5VxZ0tyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LVTMY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0035LVU5K", "title": "Hogue Handall Junior Grip - Black or Pink", "description": "Hogue HandAll grip sleeves are scientifically designed with a special contoured shape that hugs the contours of your gun. This exclusive shape gives a secure fit with no loose spots, giving HandAll the tightest and most secure fit to your gun possible. Our special shape is far superior to any simple \"\"tube\"\" sleeve. Hogue HandAll grip sleeves are a simple and inexpensive way to make a tremendous improvement in shooting comfort, accuracy and control.", "text": "Hogue Handall Junior Grip - Black or Pink Hogue HandAll grip sleeves are scientifically designed with a special contoured shape that hugs the contours of your gun. This exclusive shape gives a secure fit with no loose spots, giving HandAll the tightest and most secure fit to your gun possible. Our special shape is far superior to any simple \"\"tube\"\" sleeve. Hogue HandAll grip sleeves are a simple and inexpensive way to make a tremendous improvement in shooting comfort, accuracy and control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cFCNc9BaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LVU5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.59}}
{"item_id": "B0035LVWN0", "title": "Xs Std Dot Tritium Rug Lcr", "description": "XS Sight Systems Standard Dot Tritium Sight Ruger LCR Green w/White Outline Front Sight RP-0008N-4. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Xs Std Dot Tritium Rug Lcr XS Sight Systems Standard Dot Tritium Sight Ruger LCR Green w/White Outline Front Sight RP-0008N-4. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sorEvR8NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LVWN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XS Sight Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 56.13}}
{"item_id": "B0035LVZFK", "title": "Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit", "description": "The Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit could be the thing that saves your bacon or at least gives you the confidence to foray into the great outdoors. In the outdoors, getting a fire started quickly can be a matter of life and death. And with the Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit, starting a fire has never been easier. The reliable flint wheel ignition easily lights the water-resistant waxed tinder sticks. And with a water-resistant O-ring seal built into the case, the contents stay dry.Great addition to Emergency Survival Kits.Ideal for camping, hiking, extreme altitudes, hunting, and emergency situations.Made in the USA..", "text": "Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit The Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit could be the thing that saves your bacon or at least gives you the confidence to foray into the great outdoors. In the outdoors, getting a fire started quickly can be a matter of life and death. And with the Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit, starting a fire has never been easier. The reliable flint wheel ignition easily lights the water-resistant waxed tinder sticks. And with a water-resistant O-ring seal built into the case, the contents stay dry.Great addition to Emergency Survival Kits.Ideal for camping, hiking, extreme altitudes, hunting, and emergency situations.Made in the USA..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zAlmbJWBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LVZFK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zippo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 13.88}}
{"item_id": "B0035LXWOW", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits PG-380 Grip Extension", "description": "The Pearce PG-380 Grip Extensions replace the magazine base plate and internal locking plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine. These units provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2\" of gripping surface. (Two extensions per package)", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits PG-380 Grip Extension The Pearce PG-380 Grip Extensions replace the magazine base plate and internal locking plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine. These units provide better comfort and control by adding approximately 1/2\" of gripping surface. (Two extensions per package)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DaOFU5JcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LXWOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.94}}
{"item_id": "B0035LY25A", "title": "Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks 8 Pack", "description": "Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks are a great standalone fire starter but they are made specifically for the Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit as replacement tinder. In the outdoors, getting a fire started quickly can be a matter of life and death. And with Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks, starting a fire has never been easier. Just fray the end and give it a light. It will burn easily and allow you to build a warm fire quickly.Good to have in your pack.Lightweight and small..", "text": "Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks 8 Pack Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks are a great standalone fire starter but they are made specifically for the Zippo Emergency Fire Starter Kit as replacement tinder. In the outdoors, getting a fire started quickly can be a matter of life and death. And with Zippo Waxed Tinder Sticks, starting a fire has never been easier. Just fray the end and give it a light. It will burn easily and allow you to build a warm fire quickly.Good to have in your pack.Lightweight and small..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tMqatO45L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LY25A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zippo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 5.02}}
{"item_id": "B0035LZW9K", "title": "Trijicon Ruggedized Miniature Reflex Dual Illuminated Sight - 7.0 Moa Amber Dot", "description": "Trijicon RMR 7.0 MOA Amber Dot Dual Illuminated Sight, Black", "text": "Trijicon Ruggedized Miniature Reflex Dual Illuminated Sight - 7.0 Moa Amber Dot Trijicon RMR 7.0 MOA Amber Dot Dual Illuminated Sight, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21nQt95NAZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035LZW9K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruggedized Miniature Reflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 437.93}}
{"item_id": "B0035M1F8Q", "title": "Bulldog 35-Inch Tactical Shotgun Case (Black)", "description": "35\" Tactical Shotgun Case - Black Pistol grip tactical shotgun case offers a discreet way to carry your tactical shotgun. INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 33\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 8\" * 1 3/4\" total soft padding * Full-length heavy-duty zipper with pull * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Brushed Tricot, soft, scratch-resistant inner lining * Two external pockets with elastic loops hold 12 extra shells", "text": "Bulldog 35-Inch Tactical Shotgun Case (Black) 35\" Tactical Shotgun Case - Black Pistol grip tactical shotgun case offers a discreet way to carry your tactical shotgun. INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 33\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 8\" * 1 3/4\" total soft padding * Full-length heavy-duty zipper with pull * Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell * Brushed Tricot, soft, scratch-resistant inner lining * Two external pockets with elastic loops hold 12 extra shells", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31chPwGd8QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035M1F8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 15.54}}
