{"item_id": "B0035M3GMO", "title": "Tipton Universal Bore Guide kit", "description": "The Tipton universal bore guide will help protect the bore and action of your rifle by properly aligning the cleaning rod and reducing solvent overflow. Cleaning without a bore guide can allow the rod to \"bow\" and rub or gouge chamber and throat of the bore causing real damage and loss of accuracy. Keeping the rod properly aligned not only protects your barrel, it directs the force exerted on the cleaning rod handle allowing tight patches to be pushed more easily.", "text": "Tipton Universal Bore Guide kit The Tipton universal bore guide will help protect the bore and action of your rifle by properly aligning the cleaning rod and reducing solvent overflow. Cleaning without a bore guide can allow the rod to \"bow\" and rub or gouge chamber and throat of the bore causing real damage and loss of accuracy. Keeping the rod properly aligned not only protects your barrel, it directs the force exerted on the cleaning rod handle allowing tight patches to be pushed more easily.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-LcVBTwSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035M3GMO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.7}}
{"item_id": "B0035MX7BY", "title": "Victorinox 6 pc Large Swiss Army Knife Scissor Spring", "description": "A 6 pack of small replacement scissor springs for Swiss Army Knives sized 91mm and larger.", "text": "Victorinox 6 pc Large Swiss Army Knife Scissor Spring A 6 pack of small replacement scissor springs for Swiss Army Knives sized 91mm and larger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31o8v7L6K1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035MX7BY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 3.21}}
{"item_id": "B0035PMIGG", "title": "Petzl Oscillante Pulley", "description": "FEATURES of the Petzl Oscillante Pulley Quick and easy installation due to the swinging side plates Nylon sheave and aluminum side plates for excellent strength to weight ratio The SPECS of the Petzl Oscillante Pulley Weight: 42 g Case Quantity: 12 Rope Diameter: Minimum: 7 mm, Maximum: 11 mm Sheave Diameter: 25 mm Efficiency: 71% Working Load: 4 kN (2 kN on one strand) Breaking Strength: 15 kN Aluminum side plates, nylon sheave Certification(s): CE EN 12278, UIAA ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "text": "Petzl Oscillante Pulley FEATURES of the Petzl Oscillante Pulley Quick and easy installation due to the swinging side plates Nylon sheave and aluminum side plates for excellent strength to weight ratio The SPECS of the Petzl Oscillante Pulley Weight: 42 g Case Quantity: 12 Rope Diameter: Minimum: 7 mm, Maximum: 11 mm Sheave Diameter: 25 mm Efficiency: 71% Working Load: 4 kN (2 kN on one strand) Breaking Strength: 15 kN Aluminum side plates, nylon sheave Certification(s): CE EN 12278, UIAA ALL CLIMBING SALES ARE FINAL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nGF8%2BbVHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035PMIGG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Petzl", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Hardware", "Pulleys"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0035QOLJM", "title": "Harmony Smiley's Nose Plug", "description": "Designed with serious whitewater paddlers in mind, the Harmony Smiley's Nose Plug is built to stay in place on the nastiest stretches of river while keeping the comfort level high with cushioned nose pads and a fully adjustable wire frame.", "text": "Harmony Smiley's Nose Plug Designed with serious whitewater paddlers in mind, the Harmony Smiley's Nose Plug is built to stay in place on the nastiest stretches of river while keeping the comfort level high with cushioned nose pads and a fully adjustable wire frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KvwshGpgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035QOLJM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harmony", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Nose Clips"]], "price": 10.75}}
{"item_id": "B0035QSAA8", "title": "Buck Tops/CSAR-T Knife (Black/Silver, 8 1/2-Inch)", "description": "As Buck has done successfully before, they have forged a new collaboration with TOPS Knives, blending the talents of two Idaho knife makers to produce the first of a new series of knives designed to be reliable tools for those who protect and serve our country. It's the ideal blend of a highly respected custom knife company with their ability to produce custom-production knives, making them affordable to a far wider market. The TOPPS/Buck CSAR-T (Combat Search and Recue Tool) is the first result. A liner-lock folding knife with tough G10 handles and a 3-1/2\" modified tanto blade, made of .175\" thick, ATS-34 Stainless Steel.", "text": "Buck Tops/CSAR-T Knife (Black/Silver, 8 1/2-Inch) As Buck has done successfully before, they have forged a new collaboration with TOPS Knives, blending the talents of two Idaho knife makers to produce the first of a new series of knives designed to be reliable tools for those who protect and serve our country. It's the ideal blend of a highly respected custom knife company with their ability to produce custom-production knives, making them affordable to a far wider market. The TOPPS/Buck CSAR-T (Combat Search and Recue Tool) is the first result. A liner-lock folding knife with tough G10 handles and a 3-1/2\" modified tanto blade, made of .175\" thick, ATS-34 Stainless Steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ATrc644eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035QSAA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 83.67}}
{"item_id": "B0035RQLL2", "title": "4' x 50' Dry Top Green Multi Purpose/Garden Fencing item #714500", "description": "This Multi Purpose/Garden Fence is 4 feet tall and 50 feet long. The mesh is approx. 70 by 40mm and weighs around 7lbs per roll. It is U.V stabilized to last 1-2 years in the sun.", "text": "4' x 50' Dry Top Green Multi Purpose/Garden Fencing item #714500 This Multi Purpose/Garden Fence is 4 feet tall and 50 feet long. The mesh is approx. 70 by 40mm and weighs around 7lbs per roll. It is U.V stabilized to last 1-2 years in the sun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fRWHeUtwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035RQLL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Fencing"]], "price": 23.0}}
{"item_id": "B0035S9HWG", "title": "Crosman Benjamin Trail NP XL 1500 .177 Caliber Nitro Piston Air Rifle with Hardwood Stock (Includes 3-9 X 40mm Scope)", "description": "The XL1500 features a handsome, checkered, hardwood stock. With its daunting 24 ft-lbs of muzzle energy, and shot velocities of up to 1500 fps*, small game – it’s game over", "text": "Crosman Benjamin Trail NP XL 1500 .177 Caliber Nitro Piston Air Rifle with Hardwood Stock (Includes 3-9 X 40mm Scope) The XL1500 features a handsome, checkered, hardwood stock. With its daunting 24 ft-lbs of muzzle energy, and shot velocities of up to 1500 fps*, small game – it’s game over", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VGNMsd0QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035S9HWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 297.0}}
