{"item_id": "B0035SGRLK", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Brown Holster with Clip", "description": "With the Inside-the-Pants w/Clip Holster, your weapon will stay out of sight and out of the way. This deep concealment holster features a high inner body to protect your shirt and skin from the weapon’s sharp edges and to protect your pistol from moisture.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Inside-the-Pants Brown Holster with Clip With the Inside-the-Pants w/Clip Holster, your weapon will stay out of sight and out of the way. This deep concealment holster features a high inner body to protect your shirt and skin from the weapon’s sharp edges and to protect your pistol from moisture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418KOuVQYnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035SGRLK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
