{"item_id": "B0035UO01W", "title": "BV Bicycle Aluminum Plate Reinforced Rim Water Bottle Cage", "description": "Patented Design. Aluminum alloy water bottle cage for bicycles. The BV bottle cage is perfect for taking refreshments along for a ride.Reinforced plastic rim protects water bottles from bottle cage paint.Carbon Look and White in a glossy finish, Black and Silver in a sandblast anode finish.SpecificationsMaterial:Heat-treated aluminum plateWeight:2 oz. (56g)Dimensions:5\" x 3\" x 3.5\".", "text": "BV Bicycle Aluminum Plate Reinforced Rim Water Bottle Cage Patented Design. Aluminum alloy water bottle cage for bicycles. The BV bottle cage is perfect for taking refreshments along for a ride.Reinforced plastic rim protects water bottles from bottle cage paint.Carbon Look and White in a glossy finish, Black and Silver in a sandblast anode finish.SpecificationsMaterial:Heat-treated aluminum plateWeight:2 oz. (56g)Dimensions:5\" x 3\" x 3.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41meZHx-NtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035UO01W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B0035Y2542", "title": "Tactical Gear Holster TG200 Series", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Small holster with belt loop Durable polyester with PVC coating Pouches can hold 2 magazines and a flashlight Designed for security, comfort and quick draw Compact Design for guns up to 7\" Long. with a width of up to 3 1/2\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 2\". Which Will Fit Most Full Size Pistols", "text": "Tactical Gear Holster TG200 Series Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Small holster with belt loop Durable polyester with PVC coating Pouches can hold 2 magazines and a flashlight Designed for security, comfort and quick draw Compact Design for guns up to 7\" Long. with a width of up to 3 1/2\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 2\". Which Will Fit Most Full Size Pistols", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gbdEees6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0035Y2542.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 6.97}}
{"item_id": "B003622YRG", "title": "Aurora Fire Starter 2SA", "description": "Lightweight and designed for outdoor adventurers and pilots who like to be prepared, our Aurora Fire Starter has even climbed Mount Everest! Created and manufactured by Solo Scientific in the USA to be used to start your campfires. This 2SA model Aurora Fire StarterTM (Patent Pending) is equipped with our unbeatable life-time tungsten, carbide, cobalt built-in guided Super Alloy Striking Blade that will never dull! Note: Super Alloy Striking Blade not shown in photos. The Super Alloy Blade is so hard that it can be used to sharpen your knives when your not starting fires! Simply used the back side of the blade to sharpen your knives in the field!", "text": "Aurora Fire Starter 2SA Lightweight and designed for outdoor adventurers and pilots who like to be prepared, our Aurora Fire Starter has even climbed Mount Everest! Created and manufactured by Solo Scientific in the USA to be used to start your campfires. This 2SA model Aurora Fire StarterTM (Patent Pending) is equipped with our unbeatable life-time tungsten, carbide, cobalt built-in guided Super Alloy Striking Blade that will never dull! Note: Super Alloy Striking Blade not shown in photos. The Super Alloy Blade is so hard that it can be used to sharpen your knives when your not starting fires! Simply used the back side of the blade to sharpen your knives in the field!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316oBEZuXmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003622YRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aurora", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 22.75}}
{"item_id": "B0036234ZM", "title": "Aurora Fire Starter 440C with Hardened Steel Striking Blade (Silver)", "description": "The Aurora Fire Starter is simply the best magnesium fire starter on the marked. Designed and made in the USA by Solo Scientific Aurora Fire Starters are a true survival tool designed to support life by starting a fire in just about any environment. Designed to start a lifetime of camp or survival fires, the Aurora Fire Starter 440C - Silver comes with a hardened steel striking blade that can be sharped and reversed for long life (extra blades available sold separately). When stuck properly with the integral blade, the Aurora Fire Starter fires of a stream of sparks as hot as 5000 degrees Fahrenheit guaranteed to ignite tinder and is designed to light thousands of fires before being replaced. The Aurora Fire Starter is a rugged tool, designed for survival in extreme condition, but also handy on an average camping trip or lighting a charcoal fire. Made of a solid piece of lightweight aircraft aluminum with a composite flint steel & magnesium rod and integrated striking blade, the Aurora Fire Starter 440C weighs only 1.6 oz and is 3.6\" in length. Wear it around you neck, on a key-ring or on your belt on one of the custom designed pouches (sold separately), just don't forget to bring it!", "text": "Aurora Fire Starter 440C with Hardened Steel Striking Blade (Silver) The Aurora Fire Starter is simply the best magnesium fire starter on the marked. Designed and made in the USA by Solo Scientific Aurora Fire Starters are a true survival tool designed to support life by starting a fire in just about any environment. Designed to start a lifetime of camp or survival fires, the Aurora Fire Starter 440C - Silver comes with a hardened steel striking blade that can be sharped and reversed for long life (extra blades available sold separately). When stuck properly with the integral blade, the Aurora Fire Starter fires of a stream of sparks as hot as 5000 degrees Fahrenheit guaranteed to ignite tinder and is designed to light thousands of fires before being replaced. The Aurora Fire Starter is a rugged tool, designed for survival in extreme condition, but also handy on an average camping trip or lighting a charcoal fire. Made of a solid piece of lightweight aircraft aluminum with a composite flint steel & magnesium rod and integrated striking blade, the Aurora Fire Starter 440C weighs only 1.6 oz and is 3.6\" in length. Wear it around you neck, on a key-ring or on your belt on one of the custom designed pouches (sold separately), just don't forget to bring it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51S-7ecnSxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036234ZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aurora", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 19.13}}
{"item_id": "B003623Y2U", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 10 .223 Magazine Dust Covers", "description": "Your magazine is no good if its filled with dirt and debris. Keep your .223 mags clean and in good working condition with Intrafuse Mag Dust Covers. Each cover is made of flexible rubber that snuggly fits and grips the top of your mag.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 10 .223 Magazine Dust Covers Your magazine is no good if its filled with dirt and debris. Keep your .223 mags clean and in good working condition with Intrafuse Mag Dust Covers. Each cover is made of flexible rubber that snuggly fits and grips the top of your mag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YRXhXtiWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003623Y2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00362AKZY", "title": "New Right Side Black Drop Leg Holster TaiGear", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEARNice quality tactical leg holster assemblyHas strap to secure to tactical utility beltExtra pouch on holster for magazineAdjustable closure for a tight pistol barrel fitDeluxe non-slip holster pad, and non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strapDesigned for maximum comfort, additional retention and for most pistols", "text": "New Right Side Black Drop Leg Holster TaiGear Manufacturer: TAIGEARNice quality tactical leg holster assemblyHas strap to secure to tactical utility beltExtra pouch on holster for magazineAdjustable closure for a tight pistol barrel fitDeluxe non-slip holster pad, and non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strapDesigned for maximum comfort, additional retention and for most pistols", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZpWQtjXSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00362AKZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B00363PRK6", "title": "Coleman Biscayne Large Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Biscayne Sleeping Bag is great for warm-weather camping. It-Inchs made for big & tall sizes, measuring 39-Inch wide by 81-Inch long and fitting most people up to 6-Inch4-Inch. The Biscayne is durably constructed of a polyester cover over a soft tricot liner, with 4 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-60Degree Fahrenheit. The Trinidad features the QuickCord storage system for easy storage -- no tying required. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "text": "Coleman Biscayne Large Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag The Coleman Biscayne Sleeping Bag is great for warm-weather camping. It-Inchs made for big & tall sizes, measuring 39-Inch wide by 81-Inch long and fitting most people up to 6-Inch4-Inch. The Biscayne is durably constructed of a polyester cover over a soft tricot liner, with 4 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-60Degree Fahrenheit. The Trinidad features the QuickCord storage system for easy storage -- no tying required. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PSNHWQ24L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PRK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B00363PRQ0", "title": "Coleman Calgary 20 Degree Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Calgary 20 Degree Sleeping Bag features a contoured shape, so your head is always on the bag and the bag is never on your face. Polyester construction for easy care.", "text": "Coleman Calgary 20 Degree Sleeping Bag The Coleman Calgary 20 Degree Sleeping Bag features a contoured shape, so your head is always on the bag and the bag is never on your face. Polyester construction for easy care.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vzuKQ0lYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PRQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 42.11}}
{"item_id": "B00363PRWE", "title": "Coleman Candle Lantern", "description": "The Coleman Candle Lantern is an old fashioned, ambience-boosting lighting choice for the campsite, patio, or any time you need an easy emergency light source. One candle will provide up to nine hours of warm light, safely contained inside the classic Coleman lantern design. A spring-loaded design lets the candle rise as it burns down, to keep the flame at a consistent height, and the integrated carrying handle is designed for convenient hanging.FeaturesEach candle provides up to nine hours of warm lightSpring-loaded to keep candle at consistent heightPerfect for home or patio use; also great for emergency lightUses Coleman nine-hour candlesMeasures 3.2 by 7.1 inches (W x H)The Coleman Limited Lifetime WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Candle Lantern The Coleman Candle Lantern is an old fashioned, ambience-boosting lighting choice for the campsite, patio, or any time you need an easy emergency light source. One candle will provide up to nine hours of warm light, safely contained inside the classic Coleman lantern design. A spring-loaded design lets the candle rise as it burns down, to keep the flame at a consistent height, and the integrated carrying handle is designed for convenient hanging.FeaturesEach candle provides up to nine hours of warm lightSpring-loaded to keep candle at consistent heightPerfect for home or patio use; also great for emergency lightUses Coleman nine-hour candlesMeasures 3.2 by 7.1 inches (W x H)The Coleman Limited Lifetime WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wx5t0y%2BwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PRWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 15.67}}
{"item_id": "B00363PS3W", "title": "Coleman Converta Cot", "description": "The Coleman Converta Cot provides comfortable seating at the campsite or in the backyard. Four back position and two foot positions for use as a lounge chair or cot.Unfolded Dimensions: 76 in. x 26 in. x 15.5 in..Folded Dimensions: 27.8 in. x 25 in. x 4.9 in..", "text": "Coleman Converta Cot The Coleman Converta Cot provides comfortable seating at the campsite or in the backyard. Four back position and two foot positions for use as a lounge chair or cot.Unfolded Dimensions: 76 in. x 26 in. x 15.5 in..Folded Dimensions: 27.8 in. x 25 in. x 4.9 in..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IddB33k2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PS3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B00363PSEQ", "title": "Coleman Deck Chair With Table", "description": "Take the comfort with you to the campsite, BBQ or picnic when you pack a Coleman Portable Deck Chair with Table. Relax with a drink and a snack on the side tray all afternoon with padded arm rests and an aluminum frame that supports up to 225 lbs. (102.05 kg) When the fun is done, easily fold up the lightweight chair, and take it to the car with one hand using the convenient carry handles. - Relax with a drink and a snack on the side table - Padded arm rests for comfortable relaxation - Heavy-duty aluminum frame supports up to 225 lbs. (102.05 kg) - Folds flat for easy packing - Carry handles for convenient portability - Unfolded Dimensions: 34 in. x 20.9 in. x 31.1 in. (87.6 cm x 53 cm x 79 cm) - Folded Dimensions: 31.1 in. 22 in. 6.1 in. (79 cm x 56 cm x 55 cm) - Carry Weight: 7.7 lbs. (3.5 kg) - Made in China.", "text": "Coleman Deck Chair With Table Take the comfort with you to the campsite, BBQ or picnic when you pack a Coleman Portable Deck Chair with Table. Relax with a drink and a snack on the side tray all afternoon with padded arm rests and an aluminum frame that supports up to 225 lbs. (102.05 kg) When the fun is done, easily fold up the lightweight chair, and take it to the car with one hand using the convenient carry handles. - Relax with a drink and a snack on the side table - Padded arm rests for comfortable relaxation - Heavy-duty aluminum frame supports up to 225 lbs. (102.05 kg) - Folds flat for easy packing - Carry handles for convenient portability - Unfolded Dimensions: 34 in. x 20.9 in. x 31.1 in. (87.6 cm x 53 cm x 79 cm) - Folded Dimensions: 31.1 in. 22 in. 6.1 in. (79 cm x 56 cm x 55 cm) - Carry Weight: 7.7 lbs. (3.5 kg) - Made in China.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Kxa9US38L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PSEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 44.8}}
{"item_id": "B00363PSKK", "title": "Coleman Dunnock Large Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Dunnock Sleeping Bag is great for cold-weather camping. It-Inchs made for big & tall sizes, measuring 39-Inch wide by 81-Inch long and fitting most people up to 6-Inch4-Inch. The Dunnock is durably constructed of a cotton cover over a cozy cotton-flannel liner, with 5 pounds of ColeTherm insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-20Degree Fahrenheit. The Dunnock features the Coleman Wrap -InchN-Inch Roll storage system: simply roll up the sleeping bag into the attached carrier, and you-Inchre good to go. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "text": "Coleman Dunnock Large Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag The Coleman Dunnock Sleeping Bag is great for cold-weather camping. It-Inchs made for big & tall sizes, measuring 39-Inch wide by 81-Inch long and fitting most people up to 6-Inch4-Inch. The Dunnock is durably constructed of a cotton cover over a cozy cotton-flannel liner, with 5 pounds of ColeTherm insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-20Degree Fahrenheit. The Dunnock features the Coleman Wrap -InchN-Inch Roll storage system: simply roll up the sleeping bag into the attached carrier, and you-Inchre good to go. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AZv-piYLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PSKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 62.0}}
{"item_id": "B00363PTGI", "title": "Coleman Dunnock Large Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "Oak Point, 39\" x 81\", Big & Tall Sleeping Bag, 4 LB Coletherm Insulation, Fits Most Up To 6' 4\", Polyester Dark Brown Cover With Brown Soft Cotton Flannel Liner, Zipplow, Plows Away From Zipper To Prevent Snags, For Cool Weather Conditions With Temperatures 50-30 Degrees, Roll Control Locks Bag In Place For Easier Rolling, Fiberlock Prevents Insulation From Shifting & Increases Durability, Quickcord For Easy, No Tie Closure.", "text": "Coleman Dunnock Large Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag Oak Point, 39\" x 81\", Big & Tall Sleeping Bag, 4 LB Coletherm Insulation, Fits Most Up To 6' 4\", Polyester Dark Brown Cover With Brown Soft Cotton Flannel Liner, Zipplow, Plows Away From Zipper To Prevent Snags, For Cool Weather Conditions With Temperatures 50-30 Degrees, Roll Control Locks Bag In Place For Easier Rolling, Fiberlock Prevents Insulation From Shifting & Increases Durability, Quickcord For Easy, No Tie Closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AIa2dyfBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363PTGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 49.02}}
{"item_id": "B00363RSXU", "title": "Coleman 1-Gallon Jug", "description": "The Coleman 1-Gallon Jug will keep your beverage cool and easy to dispense. The wide-mouth twist-on cap makes it easy to fill, while the flip-top spout allows for no-mess pouring. The Jug has a bail handle for comfortable carrying. The Jug is durably constructed to resist dents, scratches and fading.", "text": "Coleman 1-Gallon Jug The Coleman 1-Gallon Jug will keep your beverage cool and easy to dispense. The wide-mouth twist-on cap makes it easy to fill, while the flip-top spout allows for no-mess pouring. The Jug has a bail handle for comfortable carrying. The Jug is durably constructed to resist dents, scratches and fading.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bg%2BQLubWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363RSXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 13.79}}
{"item_id": "B00363RUII", "title": "Coleman Nimbus Large Warm-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag", "description": "Stay cozy on warmer nights with the Coleman Nimbus large sleeping bag. Designed for temperatures between 40 and 60 degrees F, the Nimbus is perfect for the summer months when the mercury seldom dips below freezing. The Nimbus is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft tricot liner, with 4 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable. The bag also includes a groundbreaking contoured headrest, which keeps your head on the bag and the bag off your face.To ensure all-night snugness, the Nimbus is outfitted with Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, which includes such features as a ComfortCuff that surrounds your face with softness, a FiberLock design that prevents the insulation from shifting, and a QuickCord for easy, no-tie closure. And to keep heat from escaping on cooler nights, the Nimbus includes a ThermoLock construction that prevents heat loss through the zipper. Other features include a ZipPlow that plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags, a Roll Control that locks the bag into place for easier rolling, and ZipperGlide tailoring that allows for smooth zipper operation around the corners. The Nimbus measures 39 by 84 inches and fits campers up to 6 feet 4 inches tall. Machine-washable in commercial machines, the bag carries a five-year warranty.", "text": "Coleman Nimbus Large Warm-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag Stay cozy on warmer nights with the Coleman Nimbus large sleeping bag. Designed for temperatures between 40 and 60 degrees F, the Nimbus is perfect for the summer months when the mercury seldom dips below freezing. The Nimbus is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft tricot liner, with 4 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable. The bag also includes a groundbreaking contoured headrest, which keeps your head on the bag and the bag off your face.To ensure all-night snugness, the Nimbus is outfitted with Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, which includes such features as a ComfortCuff that surrounds your face with softness, a FiberLock design that prevents the insulation from shifting, and a QuickCord for easy, no-tie closure. And to keep heat from escaping on cooler nights, the Nimbus includes a ThermoLock construction that prevents heat loss through the zipper. Other features include a ZipPlow that plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags, a Roll Control that locks the bag into place for easier rolling, and ZipperGlide tailoring that allows for smooth zipper operation around the corners. The Nimbus measures 39 by 84 inches and fits campers up to 6 feet 4 inches tall. Machine-washable in commercial machines, the bag carries a five-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h1zTjEHzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363RUII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 38.53}}
{"item_id": "B00363RW4A", "title": "Coleman 5-Gallon Beverage Cooler", "description": "The Coleman 5-Gallon Beverage Cooler is perfect for sports events, family gatherings, parties and BBQs. It features a screw-top lid for easy filling, with a tight seal to ensure that your beverage stays cold. The drip-resistant spout is removable and dishwasher safe. The Beverage Cooler has two side handles for easy lifting and carrying.", "text": "Coleman 5-Gallon Beverage Cooler The Coleman 5-Gallon Beverage Cooler is perfect for sports events, family gatherings, parties and BBQs. It features a screw-top lid for easy filling, with a tight seal to ensure that your beverage stays cold. The drip-resistant spout is removable and dishwasher safe. The Beverage Cooler has two side handles for easy lifting and carrying.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pZ-gaynUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363RW4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 35.59}}
{"item_id": "B00363V3M2", "title": "Coleman Big Basin Extreme Weather 0-20 Degree Sleeping Bag", "description": "Sleep comfortably from 0-20 Degrees with the Coleman Big Basin™ Sleeping Bag. Roomy design for big and tall folks up to 6 ft. 6 in. tall. The draft tube blocks heat loss through the zipper and the fleece foot adds extra warmth at the bottom.Quilting construction eliminates potential cold spots.Thermolock™ full-length draft tube prevents heat loss through the zipper.Two-way no-snag patented zipper plows fabric away from the zipper.Unzip the bottom for extra ventilation on warmer nights.Stuff sack included for quick and easy storage.", "text": "Coleman Big Basin Extreme Weather 0-20 Degree Sleeping Bag Sleep comfortably from 0-20 Degrees with the Coleman Big Basin™ Sleeping Bag. Roomy design for big and tall folks up to 6 ft. 6 in. tall. The draft tube blocks heat loss through the zipper and the fleece foot adds extra warmth at the bottom.Quilting construction eliminates potential cold spots.Thermolock™ full-length draft tube prevents heat loss through the zipper.Two-way no-snag patented zipper plows fabric away from the zipper.Unzip the bottom for extra ventilation on warmer nights.Stuff sack included for quick and easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W2X7K6NgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363V3M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 61.51}}
{"item_id": "B00363V3OK", "title": "Coleman Brazos Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "Nothing is as crucial to a successful camping trip as a good night's sleep, and the Coleman Brazos Cold-Weather sleeping bag will keep you cozy down to 20 degrees Fahrenheit. The bag measures 33 by 75 inches (W x D), and fits most campers up to five feet, eleven inches tall. Durably constructed of a stain-resistant polyester outer with soft tricot liner, the Brazos holds four pounds of proprietary ColeTherm insulation. A QuickCord system makes for easy packing and storage, with no tying required.Completely machine washable, this sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Brazos Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Brazos Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag Nothing is as crucial to a successful camping trip as a good night's sleep, and the Coleman Brazos Cold-Weather sleeping bag will keep you cozy down to 20 degrees Fahrenheit. The bag measures 33 by 75 inches (W x D), and fits most campers up to five feet, eleven inches tall. Durably constructed of a stain-resistant polyester outer with soft tricot liner, the Brazos holds four pounds of proprietary ColeTherm insulation. A QuickCord system makes for easy packing and storage, with no tying required.Completely machine washable, this sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Brazos Cold-Weather Sleeping Bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OxVOFRYQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363V3OK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 29.98}}
{"item_id": "B00363V43K", "title": "Coleman Clear Lake Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "Ideal for warm weather camping where the temperature won't dip below 40 degrees, the Coleman Clear Lake sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft, cozy cotton-flannel lining. Three pounds of ThermoTech insulation keep you comfortable throughout the night, and the bag measures 33-by-75 inches (W x D), fitting most campers up to five feet, 11 inches tall.The Clear Lake sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Clear Lake sleeping bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Clear Lake Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag Ideal for warm weather camping where the temperature won't dip below 40 degrees, the Coleman Clear Lake sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft, cozy cotton-flannel lining. Three pounds of ThermoTech insulation keep you comfortable throughout the night, and the bag measures 33-by-75 inches (W x D), fitting most campers up to five feet, 11 inches tall.The Clear Lake sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Clear Lake sleeping bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CcDwQmx0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363V43K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 37.6}}
{"item_id": "B00363V534", "title": "Coleman Green Valley Sleeping Bag 2014", "description": "The Coleman Green Valley Sleeping Bag is a cool weather bag for temperatures between 30 and 50 degrees. With its rectangle shape, it can fit sizes up to 5'11'' tall. The Green Valley is made with Polyester cover and cotton flannel liner that will help keep you warm and cozy. . Temperature Rating: 30 to 39 Degrees, Shape: Rectangular, Size: 75x33 in, Insulation Type: Synthetic, Zipper Side: Right Hand, Lower Temperature Limit: 30 degrees, Actual Temperature Rating: 30 degrees, Weight: 4.655 lbs., Weight (lbs): 4.00 to 5.99, Shell Material: Polyester, Lining Material: Cotton, Fill Type: Polyester, Fill Weight: 48 lbs., Fits up to: 5ft 11in, Stuff Sack Size: 10x17in, Model Year: 2014, Product ID: 251786, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 344961, GTIN: 0076501048650", "text": "Coleman Green Valley Sleeping Bag 2014 The Coleman Green Valley Sleeping Bag is a cool weather bag for temperatures between 30 and 50 degrees. With its rectangle shape, it can fit sizes up to 5'11'' tall. The Green Valley is made with Polyester cover and cotton flannel liner that will help keep you warm and cozy. . Temperature Rating: 30 to 39 Degrees, Shape: Rectangular, Size: 75x33 in, Insulation Type: Synthetic, Zipper Side: Right Hand, Lower Temperature Limit: 30 degrees, Actual Temperature Rating: 30 degrees, Weight: 4.655 lbs., Weight (lbs): 4.00 to 5.99, Shell Material: Polyester, Lining Material: Cotton, Fill Type: Polyester, Fill Weight: 48 lbs., Fits up to: 5ft 11in, Stuff Sack Size: 10x17in, Model Year: 2014, Product ID: 251786, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 344961, GTIN: 0076501048650", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515tIQsdZ2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363V534.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 43.14}}
{"item_id": "B00363WYWU", "title": "Coleman Event Stool with Carry Case", "description": "The Coleman Event Stool can be used as a chair or a footrest! The space saving design folds down easily and stores in the included carry case.Unfolded Dimensions: 15.5 in. x 7.5 in. x 13.5 x in. (39 cm x 19 cm x 34 cm).Folded Dimensions: 10.2 in. x 8.4 in. x 1.6 in. (26 cm x 21 cm x 4 cm).", "text": "Coleman Event Stool with Carry Case The Coleman Event Stool can be used as a chair or a footrest! The space saving design folds down easily and stores in the included carry case.Unfolded Dimensions: 15.5 in. x 7.5 in. x 13.5 x in. (39 cm x 19 cm x 34 cm).Folded Dimensions: 10.2 in. x 8.4 in. x 1.6 in. (26 cm x 21 cm x 4 cm).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hty-lh4-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363WYWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Stools"]], "price": 11.22}}
{"item_id": "B00363WZSS", "title": "Coleman Packaway Deluxe Camp Kitchen", "description": "Outdoor cooking is a ton of fun, but it's not always easy to prep your meal on coolers, picnic tables, and car tailgates. Enter the Coleman deluxe Camp Kitchen, a complete outdoor food preparation center that fits inside a compact carrying case.The Camp Kitchen includes a removable dish tub for post-meal cleanup.The Camp Kitchen is outfitted with a rust-resistant aluminum frame made using heavy-duty channel-extruded aluminum for added strength. More important than the construction, however, is the functionality. The kitchen's main body includes a moisture-resistant MDF tabletop food prep area with plenty of space for chopping onions and shaping hamburger patties. To the side is a wire-grid extender shelf that easily holds most Coleman and other brands of camping stoves at countertop level. No more cooking on the ground or an unstable stump.It's the extras that really make the Camp Kitchen go. The unit offers a handy bottom shelf for storing items like pots, dishware, and bread, along with chrome-plated wire hooks and a spice rack/shelves along the back for mugs, spatulas, and condiments. The Camp Kitchen even includes a removable tub for washing your dishes and a produce bin. And when you're ready to head home, the Camp Kitchen folds up into an easy-to-carry suitcase-style frame that fits easily in most car trunks. Other details include stable leg braces for added support, plastic guards to protect the corners, a lantern hook, a paper-towel holder, and a hand-towel holder.The Camp Kitchen measures 74.5 by 64 by 20 inches (W x H x D) when open and 39.5 by 7 by 20 inches when closed and weighs 24.2 pounds.About ColemanMore than 100 years ago, a young man with an entrepreneurial spirit and a better idea began manufacturing lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. His name was W.C. Coleman, and the company he founded would change life in America. A man plagued with such poor vision he sometimes had to ask classmates to read aloud to him, Coleman saw a brilliant light in 1900 in a drugstore window that stopped him in his tracks. He inquired about the light inside and discovered he was able to read even the small print on a medicine bottle by the illumination. The lamps had mantles, not wicks, and were fueled by gasoline under pressure instead of coal oil. Soon afterward, Coleman started a lighting service that offered a \"no light, no pay\" clause--a big step forward for merchants who were burned by inferior products that rarely worked--and drew substantial interest from businesses that wanted to keep their lights on after dark.In the ensuing years, Coleman expanded its product line well beyond lanterns. The company's current catalog is thick with products that make spending time outdoors a pleasure. There are coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days on end, comfortable airbeds that won't deflate during the night, a complete line of LED lights that last for years, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and much, much more. Coleman has truly fashioned much of our outdoor camping experience, and expects to do so for generations to come.", "text": "Coleman Packaway Deluxe Camp Kitchen Outdoor cooking is a ton of fun, but it's not always easy to prep your meal on coolers, picnic tables, and car tailgates. Enter the Coleman deluxe Camp Kitchen, a complete outdoor food preparation center that fits inside a compact carrying case.The Camp Kitchen includes a removable dish tub for post-meal cleanup.The Camp Kitchen is outfitted with a rust-resistant aluminum frame made using heavy-duty channel-extruded aluminum for added strength. More important than the construction, however, is the functionality. The kitchen's main body includes a moisture-resistant MDF tabletop food prep area with plenty of space for chopping onions and shaping hamburger patties. To the side is a wire-grid extender shelf that easily holds most Coleman and other brands of camping stoves at countertop level. No more cooking on the ground or an unstable stump.It's the extras that really make the Camp Kitchen go. The unit offers a handy bottom shelf for storing items like pots, dishware, and bread, along with chrome-plated wire hooks and a spice rack/shelves along the back for mugs, spatulas, and condiments. The Camp Kitchen even includes a removable tub for washing your dishes and a produce bin. And when you're ready to head home, the Camp Kitchen folds up into an easy-to-carry suitcase-style frame that fits easily in most car trunks. Other details include stable leg braces for added support, plastic guards to protect the corners, a lantern hook, a paper-towel holder, and a hand-towel holder.The Camp Kitchen measures 74.5 by 64 by 20 inches (W x H x D) when open and 39.5 by 7 by 20 inches when closed and weighs 24.2 pounds.About ColemanMore than 100 years ago, a young man with an entrepreneurial spirit and a better idea began manufacturing lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. His name was W.C. Coleman, and the company he founded would change life in America. A man plagued with such poor vision he sometimes had to ask classmates to read aloud to him, Coleman saw a brilliant light in 1900 in a drugstore window that stopped him in his tracks. He inquired about the light inside and discovered he was able to read even the small print on a medicine bottle by the illumination. The lamps had mantles, not wicks, and were fueled by gasoline under pressure instead of coal oil. Soon afterward, Coleman started a lighting service that offered a \"no light, no pay\" clause--a big step forward for merchants who were burned by inferior products that rarely worked--and drew substantial interest from businesses that wanted to keep their lights on after dark.In the ensuing years, Coleman expanded its product line well beyond lanterns. The company's current catalog is thick with products that make spending time outdoors a pleasure. There are coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days on end, comfortable airbeds that won't deflate during the night, a complete line of LED lights that last for years, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and much, much more. Coleman has truly fashioned much of our outdoor camping experience, and expects to do so for generations to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CykrafHML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363WZSS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 112.11}}
{"item_id": "B00363WZY2", "title": "Coleman Palmetto Cool-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Palmetto sleeping bag is ideal for cool weather camping, and -- at 33 by 75 inches (W x D) -- it comfortably fits most campers up to five feet, 11 inches tall. The bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft tricot liner, stuffed with three pounds of ColeTherm insulation to keep you comfortable down to 30 degrees Fahrenheit. A QuickCord storage system enables easy storage, with no tying required.Completely machine washable, this sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Palmetto Cool-Weather Sleeping Bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Palmetto Cool-Weather Sleeping Bag The Coleman Palmetto sleeping bag is ideal for cool weather camping, and -- at 33 by 75 inches (W x D) -- it comfortably fits most campers up to five feet, 11 inches tall. The bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft tricot liner, stuffed with three pounds of ColeTherm insulation to keep you comfortable down to 30 degrees Fahrenheit. A QuickCord storage system enables easy storage, with no tying required.Completely machine washable, this sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Palmetto Cool-Weather Sleeping Bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c1RI%2B7W5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363WZY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 27.98}}
{"item_id": "B00363X1DQ", "title": "Coleman Trinidad Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag", "description": "Stay cozy on warmer nights with the Coleman Trinidad sleeping bag. Designed for temperatures between 40 and 60 degrees F, the Trinidad is perfect for the summer months when the mercury seldom dips below freezing. The Trinidad is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft tricot fiber-blend liner, with 3 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfy. The bag is also outfitted with Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, which includes such features as a ComfortCuff that surrounds your face with softness, a FiberLock design that prevents the insulation from shifting, and a QuickCord for easy, no-tie closure.To keep heat from escaping on cooler nights, the Trinidad includes a ThermoLock construction that prevents heat loss through the zipper. Other features include a Roll Control that locks the bag in place for easier rolling, ZipperGlide tailoring that allows smooth zipper operation around the corners, and a rectangular build that measures 33 by 75 inches. The bag is machine-washable in commercial machines and carries a five-year warranty.", "text": "Coleman Trinidad Warm-Weather Sleeping Bag Stay cozy on warmer nights with the Coleman Trinidad sleeping bag. Designed for temperatures between 40 and 60 degrees F, the Trinidad is perfect for the summer months when the mercury seldom dips below freezing. The Trinidad is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft tricot fiber-blend liner, with 3 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfy. The bag is also outfitted with Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, which includes such features as a ComfortCuff that surrounds your face with softness, a FiberLock design that prevents the insulation from shifting, and a QuickCord for easy, no-tie closure.To keep heat from escaping on cooler nights, the Trinidad includes a ThermoLock construction that prevents heat loss through the zipper. Other features include a Roll Control that locks the bag in place for easier rolling, ZipperGlide tailoring that allows smooth zipper operation around the corners, and a rectangular build that measures 33 by 75 inches. The bag is machine-washable in commercial machines and carries a five-year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zVWW-YBZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363X1DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B00363X1IG", "title": "Coleman White Water Large Cool-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag", "description": "Ideal for cool weather camping where the temperature range is between 30 and 50 degrees Fahrenheit, the Coleman White Water large sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft, cozy cotton-flannel tricot lining. Four pounds of ColeTherm insulation keep you comfortable throughout the night, and the oversized bag measures 39-by-84 inches (W x D), fitting taller campers up to six feet, four inches tall.A unique scoop shape creates a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground, while QuickCord storage means fast, tie-free closure of the sleeping bag when it's time to strike camp.The White Water sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the White Water sleeping bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman White Water Large Cool-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag Ideal for cool weather camping where the temperature range is between 30 and 50 degrees Fahrenheit, the Coleman White Water large sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with soft, cozy cotton-flannel tricot lining. Four pounds of ColeTherm insulation keep you comfortable throughout the night, and the oversized bag measures 39-by-84 inches (W x D), fitting taller campers up to six feet, four inches tall.A unique scoop shape creates a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground, while QuickCord storage means fast, tie-free closure of the sleeping bag when it's time to strike camp.The White Water sleeping bag includes Coleman's ComfortSmart technology, meaning it's full of features to keep you warm and comfortable, such as:ZipPlow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiberLock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermoLock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softnessThe Coleman Limited WarrantyColeman has been in business for more than 100 years, and continues to produce high-quality, affordable tents, lanterns, table-top stoves, and more. All Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the White Water sleeping bag includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pHRZRniNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363X1IG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 53.0}}
{"item_id": "B00363X1M2", "title": "Coleman Willow Creek Warm-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Willow Creek Scoop Sleeping Bag is great for warm-weather camping. It measures 33-Inch wide by 78-Inch long, and fits most people up to 5-Inch11-Inch. The unique scoop shape makes a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground. The Willow Creek Sleeping Bag is durably constructed of a soft brushed-polyester cover and liner, with 3 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-60Degree Fahrenheit. The Willow Creek features the QuickCord storage system for easy storage -- no tying required. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "text": "Coleman Willow Creek Warm-Weather Scoop Sleeping Bag The Coleman Willow Creek Scoop Sleeping Bag is great for warm-weather camping. It measures 33-Inch wide by 78-Inch long, and fits most people up to 5-Inch11-Inch. The unique scoop shape makes a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground. The Willow Creek Sleeping Bag is durably constructed of a soft brushed-polyester cover and liner, with 3 pounds of ThermoTech insulation to keep you comfortable down to 40°-60Degree Fahrenheit. The Willow Creek features the QuickCord storage system for easy storage -- no tying required. Coleman-Inchs ComfortSmart technology means your sleeping bag is packed with features to keep you warm and comfortable: ZipPlow plows fabric away from the zipper to prevent snags; Comfort Cuff surrounds your face with softness; FiberLock prevents insulation from shifting keeping you warm and increasing durability; ThermoLock reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmer; Zipper Glide tailoring allows smooth zipper operation around corners; and Roll Control locks the bag in place for easier rolling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eozubFyFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00363X1M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 34.79}}
{"item_id": "B003640KD4", "title": "Coleman Sabine 20 Degree Sleeping Bag", "description": "For the big and tall among us, sleep comfortably in the Coleman Sabine 20 Degree Sleeping Bag. Contoured shape keeps your head on the bag and the bag off your face. Machine washable.Machine washable..", "text": "Coleman Sabine 20 Degree Sleeping Bag For the big and tall among us, sleep comfortably in the Coleman Sabine 20 Degree Sleeping Bag. Contoured shape keeps your head on the bag and the bag off your face. Machine washable.Machine washable..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gIty8VqlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003640KD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 55.29}}
{"item_id": "B003644MQ0", "title": "Light My Fire 3-Piece BPA-Free Lunch Box Food Container with Plate, Bowl and Spork", "description": "The lunchbox has remained unchanged for half a century an ugly metal box with a handle to carry your sandwich back and forth to school or work. Our customers wanted something different and we listened. The result is a slim triangular container that could be combined with our MealKit Harness for a new kind of LunchBox. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, our LunchBox is perfect for your backpack. The LunchBox contains everything you need to eat a meal anytime, anywhere: A bowl, a plate, and a \"spork\" (combined spoon and serrated fork). The spork is made of a tough and durable material and the rest is made of PP (polypropylene), an plastic. The whole kit is completely BPA-free.", "text": "Light My Fire 3-Piece BPA-Free Lunch Box Food Container with Plate, Bowl and Spork The lunchbox has remained unchanged for half a century an ugly metal box with a handle to carry your sandwich back and forth to school or work. Our customers wanted something different and we listened. The result is a slim triangular container that could be combined with our MealKit Harness for a new kind of LunchBox. Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, our LunchBox is perfect for your backpack. The LunchBox contains everything you need to eat a meal anytime, anywhere: A bowl, a plate, and a \"spork\" (combined spoon and serrated fork). The spork is made of a tough and durable material and the rest is made of PP (polypropylene), an plastic. The whole kit is completely BPA-free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312E4G%2BaQBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003644MQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B003648NYM", "title": "Stearns Kids Puddle Jumper Basic Life Jacket", "description": "", "text": "Stearns Kids Puddle Jumper Basic Life Jacket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B2b-prADL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003648NYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stearns", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 21.01}}
{"item_id": "B003648OKK", "title": "Stearns Kids Puddle Jumper Deluxe Life Jacket", "description": "Keep your youngster out of danger anytime you're near water with the Stearns Puddle Jumper Deluxe lifejacket. Designed for kids between 30 and 50 pounds, the Puddle Jumper Deluxe is made of soft, durable woven polyester, so it won't chafe. More importantly, the vest fits comfortably over a child's chest, with arm pieces that offer excellent stability and free range of motion in the water. Guaranteeing serious stability and confidence, the Puddle Jumper Deluxe is available in several animal designs/colors, including crab, penguin, toucan, and bug. The personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved.", "text": "Stearns Kids Puddle Jumper Deluxe Life Jacket Keep your youngster out of danger anytime you're near water with the Stearns Puddle Jumper Deluxe lifejacket. Designed for kids between 30 and 50 pounds, the Puddle Jumper Deluxe is made of soft, durable woven polyester, so it won't chafe. More importantly, the vest fits comfortably over a child's chest, with arm pieces that offer excellent stability and free range of motion in the water. Guaranteeing serious stability and confidence, the Puddle Jumper Deluxe is available in several animal designs/colors, including crab, penguin, toucan, and bug. The personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dDXKLzw5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003648OKK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 21.28}}
{"item_id": "B003652EQY", "title": "Sevylor Tahiti Fishing/Hunting Inflatable Kayak", "description": "A fishing-specific version of the kayak that twice traversed the entire length of the Amazon, the Sevylor Tahiti fishing/hunting inflatable two-person kayak is ready for adventures the world over. The Tahiti was released in 1963 and maintains a similar build after all these years. The kayak is durably constructed of heavy-duty 26-gauge PVC, with two air chambers for security and a tubular I-beam floor for stability. The Tahiti is also extremely comfortable thanks to the specially designed inflatable seats, which offer ample back support. And hunters will love the kayak's camo color, which ensures low visibility in grassy marshes. Other features include two spray covers for protection, an optional directional skeg for maximum control, and a leak-proof guarantee from Sevylor.Certified by the National Marine Manufacturers Association (NMMA), the two-person Tahiti measures 10 feet 9 inches by 2 feet 4 inches and holds up to 400 pounds.About SevylorThe road from Sevylor's founding in 1948 to its current role as the dominant supplier of a wide range of inflatables--such as kayaks, boats, and towables--is a long one, with plenty of original inventions and innovations along the way. Established in a city suburb of Vitry, France, by electronics engineer Berco Grimbert, Sevylor originally built electrical accessories, with a sideline business dedicated to using its high-frequency welding machines to manufacture PVC consumer goods. The first inflatable to receive rave notice was a small bathtub called the Dou Dou. Perfect for postwar France, the inflatable tub was portable, convenient, practical, easy to clean, durable, and, best of all, affordable.After moving to the picturesque Alsatian village of Buhl, the company expanded into developing valves, pumps, boats, inflatable pools, and a variety of water toys. In the ensuing years, Sevylor first developed a PVC that had \"memory\"--meaning it could return to its original shape regardless of temperature--and then made history by releasing an inflatable pool mattress with a headrest and circular pockets. In 1986, the company invented the Ski Bob, a real turning point in the evolution of the towables business. Today, Sevylor's innovative designs include tenders, hunting and fishing boats, specialty boats and kayaks, towables, snow tubes, air beds, pool floats, river tubes, swim and sport rings, and more.", "text": "Sevylor Tahiti Fishing/Hunting Inflatable Kayak A fishing-specific version of the kayak that twice traversed the entire length of the Amazon, the Sevylor Tahiti fishing/hunting inflatable two-person kayak is ready for adventures the world over. The Tahiti was released in 1963 and maintains a similar build after all these years. The kayak is durably constructed of heavy-duty 26-gauge PVC, with two air chambers for security and a tubular I-beam floor for stability. The Tahiti is also extremely comfortable thanks to the specially designed inflatable seats, which offer ample back support. And hunters will love the kayak's camo color, which ensures low visibility in grassy marshes. Other features include two spray covers for protection, an optional directional skeg for maximum control, and a leak-proof guarantee from Sevylor.Certified by the National Marine Manufacturers Association (NMMA), the two-person Tahiti measures 10 feet 9 inches by 2 feet 4 inches and holds up to 400 pounds.About SevylorThe road from Sevylor's founding in 1948 to its current role as the dominant supplier of a wide range of inflatables--such as kayaks, boats, and towables--is a long one, with plenty of original inventions and innovations along the way. Established in a city suburb of Vitry, France, by electronics engineer Berco Grimbert, Sevylor originally built electrical accessories, with a sideline business dedicated to using its high-frequency welding machines to manufacture PVC consumer goods. The first inflatable to receive rave notice was a small bathtub called the Dou Dou. Perfect for postwar France, the inflatable tub was portable, convenient, practical, easy to clean, durable, and, best of all, affordable.After moving to the picturesque Alsatian village of Buhl, the company expanded into developing valves, pumps, boats, inflatable pools, and a variety of water toys. In the ensuing years, Sevylor first developed a PVC that had \"memory\"--meaning it could return to its original shape regardless of temperature--and then made history by releasing an inflatable pool mattress with a headrest and circular pockets. In 1986, the company invented the Ski Bob, a real turning point in the evolution of the towables business. Today, Sevylor's innovative designs include tenders, hunting and fishing boats, specialty boats and kayaks, towables, snow tubes, air beds, pool floats, river tubes, swim and sport rings, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MpCwR9QqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003652EQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003652EY6", "title": "Sevylor Tahiti Classic Inflatable Kayak", "description": "The same kayak that twice traversed the entire length of the Amazon, the Sevylor Tahiti classic inflatable two-person kayak is ready for adventures the world over.The Tahiti inflatable kayak seats 2 people comfortably for all-day kayaking.The Tahiti was released in 1963 and maintains a similar build after all these years. The kayak is durably constructed of heavy-duty 26-gauge PVC, with two air chambers for security and a tubular I-beam floor for stability. The Tahiti is also extremely comfortable thanks to the specially designed inflatable seats, which offer back support in the traditional classic Sevylor color. And as with all Sevylor boats, the Tahiti's exclusive Airtight system is guaranteed not to leak. Other features include two spray covers for protection, an optional directional skeg for maximum control, Boston valves, and a repair kit.Certified by the National Marine Manufacturers Association (NMMA), the two-person Tahiti measures 10 feet 7 inches by 2 feet 7 inches and holds up to 400 pounds.About SevylorThe road from Sevylor's founding in 1948 to its current role as the dominant supplier of a wide range of inflatables--such as kayaks, boats, and towables--is a long one, with plenty of original inventions and innovations along the way. Established in a city suburb of Vitry, France, by electronics engineer Berco Grimbert, Sevylor originally built electrical accessories, with a sideline business dedicated to using its high-frequency welding machines to manufacture PVC consumer goods. The first inflatable to receive rave notice was a small bathtub called the Dou Dou. Perfect for postwar France, the inflatable tub was portable, convenient, practical, easy to clean, durable, and, best of all, affordable.After moving to the picturesque Alsatian village of Buhl, the company expanded into developing valves, pumps, boats, inflatable pools, and a variety of water toys. In the ensuing years, Sevylor first developed a PVC that had \"memory\"--meaning it could return to its original shape regardless of temperature--and then made history by releasing an inflatable pool mattress with a headrest and circular pockets. In 1986, the company invented the Ski Bob, a real turning point in the evolution of the towables business. Today, Sevylor's innovative designs include tenders, hunting and fishing boats, specialty boats and kayaks, towables, snow tubes, air beds, pool floats, river tubes, swim and sport rings, and more.", "text": "Sevylor Tahiti Classic Inflatable Kayak The same kayak that twice traversed the entire length of the Amazon, the Sevylor Tahiti classic inflatable two-person kayak is ready for adventures the world over.The Tahiti inflatable kayak seats 2 people comfortably for all-day kayaking.The Tahiti was released in 1963 and maintains a similar build after all these years. The kayak is durably constructed of heavy-duty 26-gauge PVC, with two air chambers for security and a tubular I-beam floor for stability. The Tahiti is also extremely comfortable thanks to the specially designed inflatable seats, which offer back support in the traditional classic Sevylor color. And as with all Sevylor boats, the Tahiti's exclusive Airtight system is guaranteed not to leak. Other features include two spray covers for protection, an optional directional skeg for maximum control, Boston valves, and a repair kit.Certified by the National Marine Manufacturers Association (NMMA), the two-person Tahiti measures 10 feet 7 inches by 2 feet 7 inches and holds up to 400 pounds.About SevylorThe road from Sevylor's founding in 1948 to its current role as the dominant supplier of a wide range of inflatables--such as kayaks, boats, and towables--is a long one, with plenty of original inventions and innovations along the way. Established in a city suburb of Vitry, France, by electronics engineer Berco Grimbert, Sevylor originally built electrical accessories, with a sideline business dedicated to using its high-frequency welding machines to manufacture PVC consumer goods. The first inflatable to receive rave notice was a small bathtub called the Dou Dou. Perfect for postwar France, the inflatable tub was portable, convenient, practical, easy to clean, durable, and, best of all, affordable.After moving to the picturesque Alsatian village of Buhl, the company expanded into developing valves, pumps, boats, inflatable pools, and a variety of water toys. In the ensuing years, Sevylor first developed a PVC that had \"memory\"--meaning it could return to its original shape regardless of temperature--and then made history by releasing an inflatable pool mattress with a headrest and circular pockets. In 1986, the company invented the Ski Bob, a real turning point in the evolution of the towables business. Today, Sevylor's innovative designs include tenders, hunting and fishing boats, specialty boats and kayaks, towables, snow tubes, air beds, pool floats, river tubes, swim and sport rings, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oboqIjOFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003652EY6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sevylor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]], "price": 166.23}}
{"item_id": "B003652I9M", "title": "Sevylor Skeg", "description": "Attach the Sevylor Skeg to your Sevylor Tahiti or Fiji inflatable kayak, and you Feetll experience increased directional control on the water. With a skilled operator, the Skeg can substantially increase the speed of the kayak. Patent No. 5,921, 197.", "text": "Sevylor Skeg Attach the Sevylor Skeg to your Sevylor Tahiti or Fiji inflatable kayak, and you Feetll experience increased directional control on the water. With a skilled operator, the Skeg can substantially increase the speed of the kayak. Patent No. 5,921, 197.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iHsEIFUTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003652I9M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Propellers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00365NKL2", "title": "Boker Plus Credit Card Knife", "description": "With its compact dimensions, slim profile, and removable pocket clip, this piece offers a variety of carry options. Extremely lightweight with a sturdy frame and lock mechanism. Closed length: 2 3/4\" Blade length: 2 1/4\" Overall length: 5\" Weight: 1.1 oz", "text": "Boker Plus Credit Card Knife With its compact dimensions, slim profile, and removable pocket clip, this piece offers a variety of carry options. Extremely lightweight with a sturdy frame and lock mechanism. Closed length: 2 3/4\" Blade length: 2 1/4\" Overall length: 5\" Weight: 1.1 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Oz1kvkrWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00365NKL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.96}}
{"item_id": "B00365UTYS", "title": "Shimano Deore SL 2-piece 9-Speed Mountain Bicycle Crank Set - FC-M590", "description": "As Mountain Bikes continue to become more diverse, components must evolve. Deore XT addresses the needs of today's riders just like it did when it was first introduced back in 1982 as the world's first MTB group. Revolutionary new designs like the Shimano Shadow rear derailleur complement the the latest evolution of traditional designs to give you the right choice for your riding style. DEORE XT Hollowtech II Cranksets featuring smooth shifting SG-X chainrings, hollow forged crank arms, and integrated pipe billet axles.", "text": "Shimano Deore SL 2-piece 9-Speed Mountain Bicycle Crank Set - FC-M590 As Mountain Bikes continue to become more diverse, components must evolve. Deore XT addresses the needs of today's riders just like it did when it was first introduced back in 1982 as the world's first MTB group. Revolutionary new designs like the Shimano Shadow rear derailleur complement the the latest evolution of traditional designs to give you the right choice for your riding style. DEORE XT Hollowtech II Cranksets featuring smooth shifting SG-X chainrings, hollow forged crank arms, and integrated pipe billet axles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FRTOENMkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00365UTYS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cranksets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003679Q72", "title": "Gripad Workout Grips", "description": "Thanks to GRIPAD lifting gloves you no longer have to deal with your hands breaking sweat as you try to maintain a firm grip while working out! Are you tired of calluses and blisters? Do you suffer from smelly, sweaty hands? Do your weight lifting gloves stain your hands? Can't find gym gloves that fit your hands? - Introducing the new patented GRIPAD lifting gloves! Say goodbye to hot, sweaty Workout Glove and hello to callus free hands to match your sculpted body! GRIPAD lifting gloves provide minimal coverage of your hands while maximizing protection! The cushioning weight lifting gloves are secured to the palm of the hands with finger bands that stretch to fit most. Made of neoprene, GRIPAD lifting gloves provide a firm and comfortable grip while preventing calluses, heat, and odor usually associated with regular workout gloves. Available in four colors: Black, Red, Blue and *Pink. *A portion of sales of the pink gripads are donated to the Breast Cancer Foundation.", "text": "Gripad Workout Grips Thanks to GRIPAD lifting gloves you no longer have to deal with your hands breaking sweat as you try to maintain a firm grip while working out! Are you tired of calluses and blisters? Do you suffer from smelly, sweaty hands? Do your weight lifting gloves stain your hands? Can't find gym gloves that fit your hands? - Introducing the new patented GRIPAD lifting gloves! Say goodbye to hot, sweaty Workout Glove and hello to callus free hands to match your sculpted body! GRIPAD lifting gloves provide minimal coverage of your hands while maximizing protection! The cushioning weight lifting gloves are secured to the palm of the hands with finger bands that stretch to fit most. Made of neoprene, GRIPAD lifting gloves provide a firm and comfortable grip while preventing calluses, heat, and odor usually associated with regular workout gloves. Available in four colors: Black, Red, Blue and *Pink. *A portion of sales of the pink gripads are donated to the Breast Cancer Foundation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PbjF38w8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003679Q72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "gripad", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00367ERMQ", "title": "25 Pound Solid Rubber Bumper Plates Pair", "description": "Body-Solid Rubber Olympic Bumper Plates. Quieter and helps protect the floor and equipment. Each bumper plate is fitted with a 3mm thick metal sleeve for proper fit and easy sliding. Use with Olympic size bars only. Raised white numbers markings. All plates are 17.7\" diameter. 35lb. plates are 2.5\" thick. IMPORTANT- These are rubber, but are not meant to be thrown around. Consistent abuse may lead to cracks or splits. ALSO AVAILABLE- color coded plates and commercial rated plates.", "text": "25 Pound Solid Rubber Bumper Plates Pair Body-Solid Rubber Olympic Bumper Plates. Quieter and helps protect the floor and equipment. Each bumper plate is fitted with a 3mm thick metal sleeve for proper fit and easy sliding. Use with Olympic size bars only. Raised white numbers markings. All plates are 17.7\" diameter. 35lb. plates are 2.5\" thick. IMPORTANT- These are rubber, but are not meant to be thrown around. Consistent abuse may lead to cracks or splits. ALSO AVAILABLE- color coded plates and commercial rated plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41arQEf8aGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00367ERMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "By Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]], "price": 120.0}}
{"item_id": "B00367HXF4", "title": "Confidence Slim Full Body Vibration Platform Fitness Machine", "description": "The latest design from Confidence Fitness is the new Power Plus Vibration Plate. This compact machine is the answer to low impact, easy exercise with fast results in your own home. With a user friendly display console and simple to navigate menu, will make even the most inexperienced gym goers comfortable in training immediately.The Power Plus Vibration Plate enhances even the most casual of activities and maximises the potential of your normal fitness regime. Whether your aim is to reduce weight improving your fitness and flexibility, or build up your muscles the power plate trainer plus will help you reach your goals. Sitting, standing or even lying on the vibration plate while doing simple weight-bearing exercises allows the vibration to stimulate and amplify the exercise.The vibration plate creates a high frequency vibration which causes a stretch reflex within the body. This means that the muscles contract involuntarily so creating the effects of exercise without the exertion of conventional exercises.The Power Plus Vibration Plate is fitted with yoga straps to enhance its potential for improving the upper body and arms. Extending the straps in different positions works different muscle groups, pulling against the resistance of the straps further the muscle fibres for growth and toning.Just 10 minutes on the Power Plus Vibration Plate is equivalent to 60 minutes of conventional exercise. You can begin to see results using for 10 minutes 2-3 times a week as part of a low fat and low calorie diet.Dimensions: 29\" x 27.5\" x 48\".Vibration plate dimensions: 21\" x 15\".Weight 70 lbs.Maximum user weight: 300 lbs. Maximum Power 1.5hp.Input Power: 600W. Input Voltage: 100-120v. Frequency Range 50-60Hz. Speed Range 1-50. If you suffer from joint problems, have a heart condition or use a pacemaker, we recommend seeking medical advice before using a vibration trainer.", "text": "Confidence Slim Full Body Vibration Platform Fitness Machine The latest design from Confidence Fitness is the new Power Plus Vibration Plate. This compact machine is the answer to low impact, easy exercise with fast results in your own home. With a user friendly display console and simple to navigate menu, will make even the most inexperienced gym goers comfortable in training immediately.The Power Plus Vibration Plate enhances even the most casual of activities and maximises the potential of your normal fitness regime. Whether your aim is to reduce weight improving your fitness and flexibility, or build up your muscles the power plate trainer plus will help you reach your goals. Sitting, standing or even lying on the vibration plate while doing simple weight-bearing exercises allows the vibration to stimulate and amplify the exercise.The vibration plate creates a high frequency vibration which causes a stretch reflex within the body. This means that the muscles contract involuntarily so creating the effects of exercise without the exertion of conventional exercises.The Power Plus Vibration Plate is fitted with yoga straps to enhance its potential for improving the upper body and arms. Extending the straps in different positions works different muscle groups, pulling against the resistance of the straps further the muscle fibres for growth and toning.Just 10 minutes on the Power Plus Vibration Plate is equivalent to 60 minutes of conventional exercise. You can begin to see results using for 10 minutes 2-3 times a week as part of a low fat and low calorie diet.Dimensions: 29\" x 27.5\" x 48\".Vibration plate dimensions: 21\" x 15\".Weight 70 lbs.Maximum user weight: 300 lbs. Maximum Power 1.5hp.Input Power: 600W. Input Voltage: 100-120v. Frequency Range 50-60Hz. Speed Range 1-50. If you suffer from joint problems, have a heart condition or use a pacemaker, we recommend seeking medical advice before using a vibration trainer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g3hSTQ1dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00367HXF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Vibration Platform Machines"]], "price": 249.99}}
{"item_id": "B00367PAO0", "title": "Paul Jr. Designs Coleman RoadTrip Grill", "description": "Featuring authentic open flame grilling, two powerful and fully adjustable burners, InstaStart match-free electronic ignition, and uncommon cooking versatility thanks to \"mix & match\" cooking surface options--the Paul Jr. Designs Coleman RoadTrip Grill takes portable grilling to the next level. With 22,000 BTUs of total cooking power and a 285-square-inch cooking surface with interchangeable cooking surfaces, the grill allows you to cook in any style you want to--for a crowd. Running off of a 16.4-ounce disposable propane cylinder and adaptable to a 20-pound propane tank, the grill boasts exceptionally long cooking times, especially given its high power output.Designed for versatile outdoor cooking, the grill comes complete with two high-quality grill surfaces included and can be used interchangeably with a griddle or a stove top surface (griddle and stove-top surfaces sold separately). Thanks to a removable grease management tray, the grill is easy to clean and equipped with two integrated side tables that slide out when needed for cooking and retract under the unit for travel and storage, as well as cook's tool-holders, the Paul Jr. RoadTrip Grill is practically a full kitchen on the road.Designed to set up quickly, travel easily, and provide excellent stability for cooking, the Paul Jr. RoadTrip Grill is ultra sturdy in its assembled for cooking position and easy to move when collapsed thanks its scissor-like leg and frame design. The entire grill folds into a compact size that will fit into most cars and is equipped with easy-to-pull handles and wheels. Because the grill is affixed to the stand and the lid features a locking mechanism, the unit is secure and steady while towing it to and from a vehicle. Fully redesigned by Paul Jr. Designs, the grill looks as good as it cooks with a custom black finish, chrome accents, knobs, and tool hooks, and diamond-plate side table inserts. Backed by a 5-year limited warranty from Coleman, the Paul Jr. Designs RoundTrip Grill is a great choice if you're serious about outdoor cooking.Features:Fully redesigned by Paul Jr. DesignsCustom black finish with chrome accentsDiamond plate side table insertsChrome knobs and tool hooksTool holders and side tables built in for easy useTwo grill grates includedFolds to compact size with easy to pull handle and wheels285-square-inch cooking surface areaIntegrated thermometerRemovable \"mix & match\" surfaces - grill, griddle or stove (each sold separately)Removable grease management trayInstaStart electronic ignition for simple, matchless lightingConsistent cooking performance even in cold weather, high altitudes and when fuel is low2 fully adjustable burners11,000 BTU per burner; 22,000 BTU (total) for hotter, faster cookingOperates on 16.4-ounce propane cylinder (sold separatelyAdaptable to 20-pound propane tank (tank hose and tank sold separately)Run times on one 16.4-ounce propane cylinder: 1.1 hours--both burners on high; 4.5 hours--both burners on lowSpecifications:Total Weight (grill on stand): 44 poundsDimensions: 46 x 18 x 35 (LxWxH)Folded dimensions: 36 x 22 x 13 inchesMade in China5-year warrantyAdditional Accessories (sold separately):Extra GrillGriddle SurfaceStove GrateWheeled Carry Case", "text": "Paul Jr. Designs Coleman RoadTrip Grill Featuring authentic open flame grilling, two powerful and fully adjustable burners, InstaStart match-free electronic ignition, and uncommon cooking versatility thanks to \"mix & match\" cooking surface options--the Paul Jr. Designs Coleman RoadTrip Grill takes portable grilling to the next level. With 22,000 BTUs of total cooking power and a 285-square-inch cooking surface with interchangeable cooking surfaces, the grill allows you to cook in any style you want to--for a crowd. Running off of a 16.4-ounce disposable propane cylinder and adaptable to a 20-pound propane tank, the grill boasts exceptionally long cooking times, especially given its high power output.Designed for versatile outdoor cooking, the grill comes complete with two high-quality grill surfaces included and can be used interchangeably with a griddle or a stove top surface (griddle and stove-top surfaces sold separately). Thanks to a removable grease management tray, the grill is easy to clean and equipped with two integrated side tables that slide out when needed for cooking and retract under the unit for travel and storage, as well as cook's tool-holders, the Paul Jr. RoadTrip Grill is practically a full kitchen on the road.Designed to set up quickly, travel easily, and provide excellent stability for cooking, the Paul Jr. RoadTrip Grill is ultra sturdy in its assembled for cooking position and easy to move when collapsed thanks its scissor-like leg and frame design. The entire grill folds into a compact size that will fit into most cars and is equipped with easy-to-pull handles and wheels. Because the grill is affixed to the stand and the lid features a locking mechanism, the unit is secure and steady while towing it to and from a vehicle. Fully redesigned by Paul Jr. Designs, the grill looks as good as it cooks with a custom black finish, chrome accents, knobs, and tool hooks, and diamond-plate side table inserts. Backed by a 5-year limited warranty from Coleman, the Paul Jr. Designs RoundTrip Grill is a great choice if you're serious about outdoor cooking.Features:Fully redesigned by Paul Jr. DesignsCustom black finish with chrome accentsDiamond plate side table insertsChrome knobs and tool hooksTool holders and side tables built in for easy useTwo grill grates includedFolds to compact size with easy to pull handle and wheels285-square-inch cooking surface areaIntegrated thermometerRemovable \"mix & match\" surfaces - grill, griddle or stove (each sold separately)Removable grease management trayInstaStart electronic ignition for simple, matchless lightingConsistent cooking performance even in cold weather, high altitudes and when fuel is low2 fully adjustable burners11,000 BTU per burner; 22,000 BTU (total) for hotter, faster cookingOperates on 16.4-ounce propane cylinder (sold separatelyAdaptable to 20-pound propane tank (tank hose and tank sold separately)Run times on one 16.4-ounce propane cylinder: 1.1 hours--both burners on high; 4.5 hours--both burners on lowSpecifications:Total Weight (grill on stand): 44 poundsDimensions: 46 x 18 x 35 (LxWxH)Folded dimensions: 36 x 22 x 13 inchesMade in China5-year warrantyAdditional Accessories (sold separately):Extra GrillGriddle SurfaceStove GrateWheeled Carry Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-FS8Zy-9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00367PAO0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00367PJLO", "title": "GRIPAD-WEIGHT LIFTING & GYM WORKOUT GRIP GLOVES", "description": "Thanks to GRIPADLifting Gloves, you no longer have to deal with your hands breaking sweat as you try to maintain a firm grip while working out. Are you tired of calluses and blisters? Do you suffer from smelly, sweaty hands? Do your Weight Lifting Gloves stain your hands? Can't find Gym Gloves that fit your hands? - Introducing the new patented GRIPAD Lifting Gloves!- Say goodbye to hot, sweaty Workout Gloves and hello to callus free hands to match your sculpted body! GRIPAD Lifting Gloves provide minimal coverage of your hands while maximizing protection! The cushioning Weight Lifting Gloves are secured to the palm of the hands with finger bands that stretch to fit most. Made of neoprene, GRIPAD Lifting Gloves provide a firm and comfortable grip while preventing calluses, heat, and odor usually associated with regular Workout Gloves", "text": "GRIPAD-WEIGHT LIFTING & GYM WORKOUT GRIP GLOVES Thanks to GRIPADLifting Gloves, you no longer have to deal with your hands breaking sweat as you try to maintain a firm grip while working out. Are you tired of calluses and blisters? Do you suffer from smelly, sweaty hands? Do your Weight Lifting Gloves stain your hands? Can't find Gym Gloves that fit your hands? - Introducing the new patented GRIPAD Lifting Gloves!- Say goodbye to hot, sweaty Workout Gloves and hello to callus free hands to match your sculpted body! GRIPAD Lifting Gloves provide minimal coverage of your hands while maximizing protection! The cushioning Weight Lifting Gloves are secured to the palm of the hands with finger bands that stretch to fit most. Made of neoprene, GRIPAD Lifting Gloves provide a firm and comfortable grip while preventing calluses, heat, and odor usually associated with regular Workout Gloves", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419qBj-Kn0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00367PJLO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "gripad", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 14.95}}
