{"item_id": "B0036C0TW8", "title": "UTG Tactical Scenario Vest", "description": "Premium Synthetic Material, Law Enforcement Quality Velcro, Snap-on and Buckle Systems, Reinforced Sniper Shoulder, Four Generous Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, Three Pistol/Flashlight Pouches, Utility and Grenade Pouches, Survival Radio Pouch, Elastic Cartridge Holders for Close Quarter Battle Operations, Premium Quick Draw Holster with Spare Pouch, Velcro and Strap Attachable Double Mag Pouches, Law Enforcement Belt System Complete with Two Mag Pouches, Three Large Mesh Pockets for Document and Hydration System, Combat Quality Zipper, Fully Adjustable and Most Accommodating Height and Width, Complete Ventilation Mesh System for Great Comfort During Battles, This vest fits from teenager (small size) up to adult. Waist fits from 32 up to 56, belt fits up to 52", "text": "UTG Tactical Scenario Vest Premium Synthetic Material, Law Enforcement Quality Velcro, Snap-on and Buckle Systems, Reinforced Sniper Shoulder, Four Generous Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, Three Pistol/Flashlight Pouches, Utility and Grenade Pouches, Survival Radio Pouch, Elastic Cartridge Holders for Close Quarter Battle Operations, Premium Quick Draw Holster with Spare Pouch, Velcro and Strap Attachable Double Mag Pouches, Law Enforcement Belt System Complete with Two Mag Pouches, Three Large Mesh Pockets for Document and Hydration System, Combat Quality Zipper, Fully Adjustable and Most Accommodating Height and Width, Complete Ventilation Mesh System for Great Comfort During Battles, This vest fits from teenager (small size) up to adult. Waist fits from 32 up to 56, belt fits up to 52", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B1Bt0aqEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036C0TW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0036CE2O4", "title": "Profile Design T1+ AL Aero Bar (Black)", "description": "Profile Design T1+ AL aero bar multi-position ski bend extensions suitable for triathlon or time trial. 6061-T6 aluminum extensions and forged brackets. Injection molded F-19 length, width, and rotationally adjustable anatomic armrests. Equipped with “J2” brackets for an adjustable lower arm position. Clamp fits 26.0-Millimeter and 31.8-Millimeter bars. Weight 545-Grams.", "text": "Profile Design T1+ AL Aero Bar (Black) Profile Design T1+ AL aero bar multi-position ski bend extensions suitable for triathlon or time trial. 6061-T6 aluminum extensions and forged brackets. Injection molded F-19 length, width, and rotationally adjustable anatomic armrests. Equipped with “J2” brackets for an adjustable lower arm position. Clamp fits 26.0-Millimeter and 31.8-Millimeter bars. Weight 545-Grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iGeXZij%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036CE2O4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 132.04}}
{"item_id": "B0036DT2CK", "title": "Nike Legend Dri-Fit Poly - 371642", "description": "The Nike Legend Dri-FIT Poly Men's Training T-shirt delivers an ultra-lightweight feel and superior performance, taking it beyond basic to downright essential. Dri-FIT fabric to wick sweat away and help keep you dry and comfortable. Fitted to move with you and stay out of the way, all day. Seams designed to reduce distraction and bulk.", "text": "Nike Legend Dri-Fit Poly - 371642 The Nike Legend Dri-FIT Poly Men's Training T-shirt delivers an ultra-lightweight feel and superior performance, taking it beyond basic to downright essential. Dri-FIT fabric to wick sweat away and help keep you dry and comfortable. Fitted to move with you and stay out of the way, all day. Seams designed to reduce distraction and bulk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318GojY-o1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036DT2CK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0036F0Z7E", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K455TXP Ken Onion Eros Lightweight Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Ken Onion was inducted into the Blade Magazine Hall of Fame in 2008 and is recognized as one of the most innovative and successful knife designers of our time. He has been making custom knives since 1991 and invented the first commercially successful assisted opening mechanism in 1996, creating a new product class. He holds more than 36 patents on locks, gadgetry, mechanisms, safeties, and designs. He has collaborated on production designs with a number of prominent manufacturers, and conducts classes on knife technology around the world. He also teaches classes in design, knife making and business in his home state of Hawaii. In addition to cutlery, Ken has a wide variety of other product designs to his credit and in the works. We are delighted to have him as part of the CRKT team. The Eros is an incredibly light and fast pocket knife. Ken likes to call them \"Gentleman Tactical.\" The Titanium frame lock is CNC machined and the Japanese Acuto + blade steel is incredibly sharp. The IKBS bearing system make these blades fly open. Once you pick up an Eros you will not be able to set it down", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K455TXP Ken Onion Eros Lightweight Razor Edge Knife Ken Onion was inducted into the Blade Magazine Hall of Fame in 2008 and is recognized as one of the most innovative and successful knife designers of our time. He has been making custom knives since 1991 and invented the first commercially successful assisted opening mechanism in 1996, creating a new product class. He holds more than 36 patents on locks, gadgetry, mechanisms, safeties, and designs. He has collaborated on production designs with a number of prominent manufacturers, and conducts classes on knife technology around the world. He also teaches classes in design, knife making and business in his home state of Hawaii. In addition to cutlery, Ken has a wide variety of other product designs to his credit and in the works. We are delighted to have him as part of the CRKT team. The Eros is an incredibly light and fast pocket knife. Ken likes to call them \"Gentleman Tactical.\" The Titanium frame lock is CNC machined and the Japanese Acuto + blade steel is incredibly sharp. The IKBS bearing system make these blades fly open. Once you pick up an Eros you will not be able to set it down", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410BbVzQn2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036F0Z7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 109.49}}
