{"item_id": "B0036JT4RC", "title": "Air Venturi Fly Shooter", "description": "This nifty fly shooter rounds out your arsenal of weapons, as it targets one of the most obnoxious of all of man's enemies -- the fly! Practical field testing has indicated it's deadly on all species of flies within the effective range of its yard-long tether. Get several -- everyone who sees it wants it. Fun gifts!Comes in a variety of colors. We cannot guarantee you'll get a specific color.", "text": "Air Venturi Fly Shooter This nifty fly shooter rounds out your arsenal of weapons, as it targets one of the most obnoxious of all of man's enemies -- the fly! Practical field testing has indicated it's deadly on all species of flies within the effective range of its yard-long tether. Get several -- everyone who sees it wants it. Fun gifts!Comes in a variety of colors. We cannot guarantee you'll get a specific color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f6IN4y59L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036JT4RC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Air Venturi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 6.99}}
