{"item_id": "B0036R8K10", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Chaos 3 Person Aluminum Pole Backpacker Tent (5-Feet 6-Inch x 7-Feet 6-Inch)", "description": "The Chaos three-person backpacking tent is lightweight and weatherproof, making it ideal for trail hikes in the fall, summer, and spring. The freestanding Chaos is easy to assemble, with lightweight, shock-corded aluminum poles and secure tent clips that work together in a single continuous system. As a result, you don't have to waste time setting up the tent when you could be kicking back at the campfire. The tent's body is made of lightweight but strong polyester taffeta fabrics, with a multi-pass urethane coating on the full-coverage fly and floor providing maximum weather protection. And to further protect the tent's interior from moisture, the Chaos includes factory seals on the seams and floor and secure fly buckles. The design helps the tent resist rainy, windy weather conditions.The tent also offers two doors for easy entry and exit during midnight bathroom trips, along with two vestibules for gear storage. And users will love the mesh roof vents and pair of windows (integrated within the doors), which increase ventilation on hot, muggy nights. Other features include extra-large #8 zippers that make it a breeze to open and close the doors, extra guy-outs on the fly for added stability in bad weather, and mesh storage pockets and a gear loft for storing smaller items. Outfitted with a tent bag for transport, the Chaos also comes in a two-person version.Specifications:Wall material: 75D, 185T polyester taffetaFloor material: 75D, 185T polyester taffeta, 2,000mm multi-pass urethane coatingFly material: 75D, 185T polyester taffeta, 1,500mm multi-pass urethane coatingMesh: Nylon no-see-um mesh, 40DFrame: 8.5 mm, 7,000 series aluminumBase size: 5 feet by 7 feet 6 inchesCenter height: 3 feet 8 inchesVestibule depth: 35 inchesTent area: 41 square feetVestibule area: 22 square feetTent and fly weight: 5 pounds 15 ouncesTotal weight: 6 pounds 4 ouncesPacked size: 7 by 24 inchesPole diameter: 11 mmUse rating: 3 seasonIncluded with tent: Rain fly, aluminum poles, pole bag, stake bag, aluminum stakes, guy ropes, repair swatches, gear loft, mesh storage pocket, and tent bagAbout ALPS MountaineeringBased in rural east central Missouri, ALPS Mountaineering sells performance-oriented packs, tents, sleeping bags, furniture, and air pads. All ALPS products are \"consumer designed\" to encourage comfortable, enjoyable trips, and are built to withstand a lifetime of use. The company uses only quality raw materials assembled at the best factories in the world, and tests all its products with avid outdoorsmen, such as people rafting the Grand Canyon, hiking the Appalachian Trail, or day hiking their favorite local trail.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Chaos 3 Person Aluminum Pole Backpacker Tent (5-Feet 6-Inch x 7-Feet 6-Inch) The Chaos three-person backpacking tent is lightweight and weatherproof, making it ideal for trail hikes in the fall, summer, and spring. The freestanding Chaos is easy to assemble, with lightweight, shock-corded aluminum poles and secure tent clips that work together in a single continuous system. As a result, you don't have to waste time setting up the tent when you could be kicking back at the campfire. The tent's body is made of lightweight but strong polyester taffeta fabrics, with a multi-pass urethane coating on the full-coverage fly and floor providing maximum weather protection. And to further protect the tent's interior from moisture, the Chaos includes factory seals on the seams and floor and secure fly buckles. The design helps the tent resist rainy, windy weather conditions.The tent also offers two doors for easy entry and exit during midnight bathroom trips, along with two vestibules for gear storage. And users will love the mesh roof vents and pair of windows (integrated within the doors), which increase ventilation on hot, muggy nights. Other features include extra-large #8 zippers that make it a breeze to open and close the doors, extra guy-outs on the fly for added stability in bad weather, and mesh storage pockets and a gear loft for storing smaller items. Outfitted with a tent bag for transport, the Chaos also comes in a two-person version.Specifications:Wall material: 75D, 185T polyester taffetaFloor material: 75D, 185T polyester taffeta, 2,000mm multi-pass urethane coatingFly material: 75D, 185T polyester taffeta, 1,500mm multi-pass urethane coatingMesh: Nylon no-see-um mesh, 40DFrame: 8.5 mm, 7,000 series aluminumBase size: 5 feet by 7 feet 6 inchesCenter height: 3 feet 8 inchesVestibule depth: 35 inchesTent area: 41 square feetVestibule area: 22 square feetTent and fly weight: 5 pounds 15 ouncesTotal weight: 6 pounds 4 ouncesPacked size: 7 by 24 inchesPole diameter: 11 mmUse rating: 3 seasonIncluded with tent: Rain fly, aluminum poles, pole bag, stake bag, aluminum stakes, guy ropes, repair swatches, gear loft, mesh storage pocket, and tent bagAbout ALPS MountaineeringBased in rural east central Missouri, ALPS Mountaineering sells performance-oriented packs, tents, sleeping bags, furniture, and air pads. All ALPS products are \"consumer designed\" to encourage comfortable, enjoyable trips, and are built to withstand a lifetime of use. The company uses only quality raw materials assembled at the best factories in the world, and tests all its products with avid outdoorsmen, such as people rafting the Grand Canyon, hiking the Appalachian Trail, or day hiking their favorite local trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31atIn1khgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036R8K10.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0036S5W42", "title": "Hilight 300 Lumen Pistol LED Strobe Flashlight with Weaver Quick Release", "description": "HiLight P10S with output of 300 lumen is a perfect flashlight for your pistol. Its quick detachable rail mount allows you install & uninstall the light quickly without using any tool. Its strobe light can momentarily blind someone at 10 yards of distance.", "text": "Hilight 300 Lumen Pistol LED Strobe Flashlight with Weaver Quick Release HiLight P10S with output of 300 lumen is a perfect flashlight for your pistol. Its quick detachable rail mount allows you install & uninstall the light quickly without using any tool. Its strobe light can momentarily blind someone at 10 yards of distance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xLAtHa0iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036S5W42.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 34.75}}
{"item_id": "B0036TN0F4", "title": "Mountain Hardwear Men's Elkommando Kilt", "description": "The Mountain Hardwear Men's Elkommando Kilt frees you from the constraints of shorts and pants so you can enjoy your next outdoor adventure. Made from rugged nylon canvas Hardwear Cloth fabric and features a Micro-Chamois-lined seamless conical waist that won't bunch up or irritate skin while you are underway with a pack. Antimicrobial finish controls odor. DWR finish repels water. Integrated webbing belt with buckle closure for easy fit adjustments ensure a comfortable fit. Two cargo snap/flap pockets to store your essentials. Internal snap closure for modesty. Fully pleated across back panel for mobility. UPF 50 sun protection against harmful ultraviolet rays. Sizing (Waist): S: 30-31\", M: 32-34\", L: 36-38\", XL: 40-42\", XXL: 44\".", "text": "Mountain Hardwear Men's Elkommando Kilt The Mountain Hardwear Men's Elkommando Kilt frees you from the constraints of shorts and pants so you can enjoy your next outdoor adventure. Made from rugged nylon canvas Hardwear Cloth fabric and features a Micro-Chamois-lined seamless conical waist that won't bunch up or irritate skin while you are underway with a pack. Antimicrobial finish controls odor. DWR finish repels water. Integrated webbing belt with buckle closure for easy fit adjustments ensure a comfortable fit. Two cargo snap/flap pockets to store your essentials. Internal snap closure for modesty. Fully pleated across back panel for mobility. UPF 50 sun protection against harmful ultraviolet rays. Sizing (Waist): S: 30-31\", M: 32-34\", L: 36-38\", XL: 40-42\", XXL: 44\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vk-qOjjGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036TN0F4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0036TWNQ6", "title": "Spiderwire EZ Mono 220-Yard Spool", "description": "Spiderwire has been a renegade from its very beginning. Back in 1994, a California high-end manufacturer of law enforcement equipment discovered that the high-tech fibers they used for bullet-proof vests were ideal for other applications – including super-strong fishing line. Today, SpiderWire continues to push to the edge of current Technology to make the strongest, thinnest, most sensitive lines on the market.", "text": "Spiderwire EZ Mono 220-Yard Spool Spiderwire has been a renegade from its very beginning. Back in 1994, a California high-end manufacturer of law enforcement equipment discovered that the high-tech fibers they used for bullet-proof vests were ideal for other applications – including super-strong fishing line. Today, SpiderWire continues to push to the edge of current Technology to make the strongest, thinnest, most sensitive lines on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IUcKHTPpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036TWNQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0036U0394", "title": "Browning Camping Fireside Chair", "description": "Need a comfortable place to relax after work, during hobbies or sporting events, or while sitting around the campfire? Look no further than the Browning Fireside chair, a folding chair that's ready for any occasion. The chair features a sturdy powder-coated steel frame that supports up to 300 pounds, along with a cool, reinforced mesh center that increases airflow on hot, humid days. Users can relax with a beer or soda by their side thanks to the built-in cup holder. And when it's time to hit the road, the chair folds up compactly and slides into the included 7-by-45-inch shoulder bag. As a result, it's easy to bring the chair along on camping trips or to a friend's backyard barbecue.SpecificationsFabrics: 600D/meshCapacity: 300 poundsSeat height: 20 inches (front), 16 inches (back)Seat width: 22 inchesSeat depth: 16 inchesTotal width (back/arms): 27 inchesTotal dimensions: 27 by 38 by 16 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13 pounds", "text": "Browning Camping Fireside Chair Need a comfortable place to relax after work, during hobbies or sporting events, or while sitting around the campfire? Look no further than the Browning Fireside chair, a folding chair that's ready for any occasion. The chair features a sturdy powder-coated steel frame that supports up to 300 pounds, along with a cool, reinforced mesh center that increases airflow on hot, humid days. Users can relax with a beer or soda by their side thanks to the built-in cup holder. And when it's time to hit the road, the chair folds up compactly and slides into the included 7-by-45-inch shoulder bag. As a result, it's easy to bring the chair along on camping trips or to a friend's backyard barbecue.SpecificationsFabrics: 600D/meshCapacity: 300 poundsSeat height: 20 inches (front), 16 inches (back)Seat width: 22 inchesSeat depth: 16 inchesTotal width (back/arms): 27 inchesTotal dimensions: 27 by 38 by 16 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WRifLnQaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036U0394.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 55.82}}
{"item_id": "B0036U35QM", "title": "Markwort Patented Deluxe Wide Model Stadium Chair", "description": "This durable, comfortable stadium seat features quality Cordova canvas material and a black steel frame. The seat fits virtually any type of wood or metal bleacher, and supports up to 400 pounds. The patented model offers an extra three inches of width than the company's standard sized stadium seat, and measures 20.5-by-11.25-by-13.5-inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Markwort Patented Deluxe Wide Model Stadium Chair This durable, comfortable stadium seat features quality Cordova canvas material and a black steel frame. The seat fits virtually any type of wood or metal bleacher, and supports up to 400 pounds. The patented model offers an extra three inches of width than the company's standard sized stadium seat, and measures 20.5-by-11.25-by-13.5-inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xguii8WKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036U35QM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Markwort", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Playing Field Equipment", "Stadium Seats & Cushions"]], "price": 56.22}}
{"item_id": "B0036UNK0I", "title": "Park Tool Team Issue Portable Repair Stand - PRS-25", "description": "Like the PCS-10 Home Mechanic Stand, Park Tool's PRS-25 Team Issue Repair Stand employs a folding design for easy storage and a three-point base for stability on any surface -- be it smooth concrete in your garage or in a rain soaked gravel lot at a 24 hour race. But compared to the PCS-10, the Team Issue Stand has a few added niceties. The clamp unit is cam actuated, like a giant quick-release lever, and it has micro adjustment capability. So you've got a bike that's worth more than your car? No worries, as you can dial in the clamping pressure like a baby soft caress. And for funky frame geometry, the clamp head is narrower at 2. 7\" to get into tight spots. The Team Issue clamp can open to safely accommodate frame tubes from 7/8\" to 3\". The jaws open along the plane of the bike, so it works great for deep, aero-shaped frame tubes. The clamp head can be rotated to work on your bike at any angle. And to accommodate different sized bikes and different sized mechanics, the Team Issue Repair Stand is height adjustable to 60\" at the clamp. It even has a soft rubber saddle cradle to protect your seatpost and saddle if you just want to hang the bike quickly from the clamp body. The Park Tool PRS-25 Team Issue Repair Stand is all aluminum so it's strong enough for regular use and lightweight as well. At just 13 pounds, you won't hesitate to throw it into the car for a weekend trip to the races. It folds down to just 47\" for easy storage when not in use. 360-degree clamp rotation add versatility, and fully adjustable clamping pressure prevents crushing carbon tubesStraps connected to aluminum legs ensure all parts slide, fold and unfold together60-inch adjustable clamping height makes lubing those hard-to-reach places easy. Hex-shaped aluminum tubing keeps flex low and eliminates rotationSoft, durable composite-rubber clamping pads protect your frame from scratches100-25D Professional Micro Adjust Clamp quickly clamps and releases nearly any tube from 7/8 to 3 inch (23-7...", "text": "Park Tool Team Issue Portable Repair Stand - PRS-25 Like the PCS-10 Home Mechanic Stand, Park Tool's PRS-25 Team Issue Repair Stand employs a folding design for easy storage and a three-point base for stability on any surface -- be it smooth concrete in your garage or in a rain soaked gravel lot at a 24 hour race. But compared to the PCS-10, the Team Issue Stand has a few added niceties. The clamp unit is cam actuated, like a giant quick-release lever, and it has micro adjustment capability. So you've got a bike that's worth more than your car? No worries, as you can dial in the clamping pressure like a baby soft caress. And for funky frame geometry, the clamp head is narrower at 2. 7\" to get into tight spots. The Team Issue clamp can open to safely accommodate frame tubes from 7/8\" to 3\". The jaws open along the plane of the bike, so it works great for deep, aero-shaped frame tubes. The clamp head can be rotated to work on your bike at any angle. And to accommodate different sized bikes and different sized mechanics, the Team Issue Repair Stand is height adjustable to 60\" at the clamp. It even has a soft rubber saddle cradle to protect your seatpost and saddle if you just want to hang the bike quickly from the clamp body. The Park Tool PRS-25 Team Issue Repair Stand is all aluminum so it's strong enough for regular use and lightweight as well. At just 13 pounds, you won't hesitate to throw it into the car for a weekend trip to the races. It folds down to just 47\" for easy storage when not in use. 360-degree clamp rotation add versatility, and fully adjustable clamping pressure prevents crushing carbon tubesStraps connected to aluminum legs ensure all parts slide, fold and unfold together60-inch adjustable clamping height makes lubing those hard-to-reach places easy. Hex-shaped aluminum tubing keeps flex low and eliminates rotationSoft, durable composite-rubber clamping pads protect your frame from scratches100-25D Professional Micro Adjust Clamp quickly clamps and releases nearly any tube from 7/8 to 3 inch (23-7...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K71aO33DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036UNK0I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 305.96}}
