{"item_id": "B0036VHZD0", "title": "Condor Urban GO BAG", "description": "So, you're looking for an urban-styled backpack that offers convenience along with comfort at a fraction of another competitor's price? Well, leave your worries behind as Condor has created something you may be looking for. The Condor Urban Go Pack features a padded laptop sleeve that will fit up to 15.4\" laptop and plenty of pockets for all your accessories to put a stop to your worries about organization. In addition to convenience, this Urban Go Pack has a padded backing with mesh reinforcement for airflow along with a sternum strap and detachable padded waist belt to provide maximum comfort. Comfort and convenience is just what Condor aims to offer in this Urban Go Pack, and only at a fraction of the competitor's cost...so, what are you waiting for? Imported. Available in Multicam, ACU, Olive Drab, Coyote Tan, and Black.", "text": "Condor Urban GO BAG So, you're looking for an urban-styled backpack that offers convenience along with comfort at a fraction of another competitor's price? Well, leave your worries behind as Condor has created something you may be looking for. The Condor Urban Go Pack features a padded laptop sleeve that will fit up to 15.4\" laptop and plenty of pockets for all your accessories to put a stop to your worries about organization. In addition to convenience, this Urban Go Pack has a padded backing with mesh reinforcement for airflow along with a sternum strap and detachable padded waist belt to provide maximum comfort. Comfort and convenience is just what Condor aims to offer in this Urban Go Pack, and only at a fraction of the competitor's cost...so, what are you waiting for? Imported. Available in Multicam, ACU, Olive Drab, Coyote Tan, and Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SUDNx4mZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036VHZD0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 64.47}}
{"item_id": "B0036XE3K6", "title": "Pflueger Fly Kit, 8-Feet 0-Inch", "description": "Pflueger is 8 -feet three piece 5/6 weight fly rod with cork grip, 3 pieces, 2 5/8-Inch spool diameter, 25/32-Inch spool width, up to 7 fly Line 1094 control fly reel 25 yards of level fly line 4X tapered leader braided dacron backing.", "text": "Pflueger Fly Kit, 8-Feet 0-Inch Pflueger is 8 -feet three piece 5/6 weight fly rod with cork grip, 3 pieces, 2 5/8-Inch spool diameter, 25/32-Inch spool width, up to 7 fly Line 1094 control fly reel 25 yards of level fly line 4X tapered leader braided dacron backing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hqTEAFFZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0036XE3K6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pflueger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Fly Fishing Combos"]], "price": 51.69}}
