{"item_id": "B00373AB0G", "title": "New Pistol Concealed Ankle Holster Black", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Ankle holster for concealed carry.Cost effective design holster for small pistols.The elasticity of the wrap firmly holds the gun in the desired position", "text": "New Pistol Concealed Ankle Holster Black Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Ankle holster for concealed carry.Cost effective design holster for small pistols.The elasticity of the wrap firmly holds the gun in the desired position", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W-aXPjo3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00373AB0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B00373MZJQ", "title": "New Left Hand Black Tactical Gear Belt Holster Taigear", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Made from lightweight durable polyester with PVC coating.Belt pistol holster.Works on any belt up to 2\" wide.Fits most popular auto pistols and revolvers.Versatile design. Can strap on your belt either vertical on your side or horizontal on the back of your belt.Extra magazine pouch on the front edge of the holster.Designed for comfort and quick draw.Compact Design for guns up to 7 1/2\" Long. with a width of up to 3\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 1 1/2\".", "text": "New Left Hand Black Tactical Gear Belt Holster Taigear Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Made from lightweight durable polyester with PVC coating.Belt pistol holster.Works on any belt up to 2\" wide.Fits most popular auto pistols and revolvers.Versatile design. Can strap on your belt either vertical on your side or horizontal on the back of your belt.Extra magazine pouch on the front edge of the holster.Designed for comfort and quick draw.Compact Design for guns up to 7 1/2\" Long. with a width of up to 3\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 1 1/2\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51z1coRbKBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00373MZJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 7.85}}
