{"item_id": "B00373XYJQ", "title": "Ka-Bar Besh Boga Self Defense Knife", "description": "KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "text": "Ka-Bar Besh Boga Self Defense Knife KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qOr-EWWZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00373XYJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B00373XYUK", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker Remora Knife", "description": "The KA-BAR Becker Knife and Tool Remora is just the right size for detailed field work like capping around delicate areas. Throw it in your pack, carry it in a pocket or wear it around your neck. You never know when you'll need one.", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker Remora Knife The KA-BAR Becker Knife and Tool Remora is just the right size for detailed field work like capping around delicate areas. Throw it in your pack, carry it in a pocket or wear it around your neck. You never know when you'll need one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FsTAB5yXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00373XYUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 22.25}}
{"item_id": "B00379N38M", "title": "Optimus Crux Lite Stove With Terra Cook Set", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove With Terra Cook Set UItra Light - Total kit weight = 238 g / 8.1 oz Ultra Compact - Smallest Cook System available Ultra Versatile - Each piece can be used independently The SPECS Weight: 8.1 oz / 238 g Measurements: 4.8 x 4.1\" /121 x 105 mm Crux Lite Rating: 3000 W / 10200 BTU Crux Lite Burn time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Crux Lite Boil time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc Includes: Terra Solo Cookset with Mesh Bag and Crux Lite Ultralite Stove This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Optimus Crux Lite Stove With Terra Cook Set DECENT FEATURES of the Optimus Crux Lite Stove With Terra Cook Set UItra Light - Total kit weight = 238 g / 8.1 oz Ultra Compact - Smallest Cook System available Ultra Versatile - Each piece can be used independently The SPECS Weight: 8.1 oz / 238 g Measurements: 4.8 x 4.1\" /121 x 105 mm Crux Lite Rating: 3000 W / 10200 BTU Crux Lite Burn time: Up to 60 minutes at high maximum output, using 220 g / 8 oz canister Crux Lite Boil time (1 L / 34 fl. oz of water): Down to 3 minutes depending on climate, altitude, etc Includes: Terra Solo Cookset with Mesh Bag and Crux Lite Ultralite Stove This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sVOgjT1pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00379N38M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 59.94}}
{"item_id": "B0037A6KNG", "title": "Crosman Stinger S32P. Tactical AirSoft Shotgun with Adjustable Hop-Up System (Clear and Black)", "description": "The Stinger S32P tactical airsoft shotgun offers fun pump-and-shoot action at velocities up to 350 feet per second, making it a great choice for mid-size fields. Features include a comfortable pistol grip, an adjustable hop-up system, and a snap-in magazine that holds 175 rounds.Warning:Misuse or careless use of this airsoft rifle may cause serious injury, particularly to the eye. This airsoft gun is intended for use by those 16 years or older. Read all instructions before using. Buyer and user have the duty to obey all laws about the use and ownership of this airsoft gun. You and others with you should always wear shooting glasses to protect your eyes.SpecificationsVelocity: Up to 350 fpsMechanism: PumpPower source: SpringCaliber: 6mm plastic BBsMagazine capacity: 13Reservoir capacity: 175Material: SyntheticLength: 20.5 inchesWeight: 2.98 pounds", "text": "Crosman Stinger S32P. Tactical AirSoft Shotgun with Adjustable Hop-Up System (Clear and Black) The Stinger S32P tactical airsoft shotgun offers fun pump-and-shoot action at velocities up to 350 feet per second, making it a great choice for mid-size fields. Features include a comfortable pistol grip, an adjustable hop-up system, and a snap-in magazine that holds 175 rounds.Warning:Misuse or careless use of this airsoft rifle may cause serious injury, particularly to the eye. This airsoft gun is intended for use by those 16 years or older. Read all instructions before using. Buyer and user have the duty to obey all laws about the use and ownership of this airsoft gun. You and others with you should always wear shooting glasses to protect your eyes.SpecificationsVelocity: Up to 350 fpsMechanism: PumpPower source: SpringCaliber: 6mm plastic BBsMagazine capacity: 13Reservoir capacity: 175Material: SyntheticLength: 20.5 inchesWeight: 2.98 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ASZsP3kwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037A6KNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Shotguns"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B0037B0A40", "title": "United Cutlery UC2657 Combat Commander Boot Knife with Shoulder Sheath, Black", "description": "For fast, reliable protection whenever you need it, this United Cutlery boot knife offers excellent concealment and strength in one small package. The shoulder harness lets you be prepared for almost anything with this menacing, black double-edged, AUS8 stainless steel blade. The handle is constructed from injection molded impact resistant TPR with a brass lanyard sleeve.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2657 Combat Commander Boot Knife with Shoulder Sheath, Black For fast, reliable protection whenever you need it, this United Cutlery boot knife offers excellent concealment and strength in one small package. The shoulder harness lets you be prepared for almost anything with this menacing, black double-edged, AUS8 stainless steel blade. The handle is constructed from injection molded impact resistant TPR with a brass lanyard sleeve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xLiuAMzeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037B0A40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 14.21}}
