{"item_id": "B0037D751O", "title": "GSI Outdoors Halulite Pressure Cooker", "description": "Say goodbye to scratches, burn circles and ounces. As light as Titanium, Halulite is a proprietary alloy that also conducts heat better and more evenly—so you can leave the extra fuel at home. Plus, every piece is Hard Anodized to create a surface that withstands scratches and abrasions like nothing else. It's ultra light without the sacrifices. Now that's smart.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Halulite Pressure Cooker Say goodbye to scratches, burn circles and ounces. As light as Titanium, Halulite is a proprietary alloy that also conducts heat better and more evenly—so you can leave the extra fuel at home. Plus, every piece is Hard Anodized to create a surface that withstands scratches and abrasions like nothing else. It's ultra light without the sacrifices. Now that's smart.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qDUpbqqJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037D751O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]]}}
