{"item_id": "B0037N32VG", "title": "Topeak Hexus II Multi-tool", "description": "The award winning Hexus II multi-tool from Topeak offers 16 pro-quality, hardened steel tools that fold into an ergonomic composite body. Providing a blend of tool selection, low weight, and compact size, the Hexus II features an integrated, full sized CrMo chain tool head compatible with all single and multi-speed bicycle chains, Allen and spoke wrench sets, a chain hook, Phillips and flat head screw drivers, a Torx bit, and two modular tire levers that snap onto the sides of the body. An excellent choice for road or mountain use, the Hexus II will have you covered on the road or trail.Side panel, snap-out tire levers.16 Tools:Allen Wrenches: 2; 2.5; 3; 4-2 piece; 5; 6; 8-millimeterSpoke Wrenches: 15 and 14 gramChain Tool: Cast CrMo SteelChain Hook: Steel WireTire Levers: Two Engineering Grade Plastic LeversScrew Drivers: Phillips and Flat HeadTorx Bit: T25Specifications:Tool Material: Hardened SteelBody: Engineering Grade PlasticSize: 3.7 x 1.7 x 1 inches / 9.5 x 4.4 x 2.6 centimeters (LxWxH)Weight: 5.88 ounces / 167 grams2 year warranty", "text": "Topeak Hexus II Multi-tool The award winning Hexus II multi-tool from Topeak offers 16 pro-quality, hardened steel tools that fold into an ergonomic composite body. Providing a blend of tool selection, low weight, and compact size, the Hexus II features an integrated, full sized CrMo chain tool head compatible with all single and multi-speed bicycle chains, Allen and spoke wrench sets, a chain hook, Phillips and flat head screw drivers, a Torx bit, and two modular tire levers that snap onto the sides of the body. An excellent choice for road or mountain use, the Hexus II will have you covered on the road or trail.Side panel, snap-out tire levers.16 Tools:Allen Wrenches: 2; 2.5; 3; 4-2 piece; 5; 6; 8-millimeterSpoke Wrenches: 15 and 14 gramChain Tool: Cast CrMo SteelChain Hook: Steel WireTire Levers: Two Engineering Grade Plastic LeversScrew Drivers: Phillips and Flat HeadTorx Bit: T25Specifications:Tool Material: Hardened SteelBody: Engineering Grade PlasticSize: 3.7 x 1.7 x 1 inches / 9.5 x 4.4 x 2.6 centimeters (LxWxH)Weight: 5.88 ounces / 167 grams2 year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s0EzbOkcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037N32VG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B0037N33CO", "title": "Ergon GP1 Biokork Bicycle Handlebar Grip", "description": "The new BioKork version of the GP1 provides ultimate ergonomics for the hand just as the rest of Ergon’s Performance Comfort series do, however the unique qualities of cork means that it is now antibacterial and hypoallergenic. Cork’s natural damping qualities also make it an ideal grip material, and its now density mean the resulting grip is a lot lighter. The GP1 BioKork uses 40% cork, sourced from sustainable forests in Portugal which is certified for its ecologically sound production. This ecological theme is continued throughout the rest of the grip. The inner core is plastic reinforced using natural fibre, which make up 40% of its mass. In place of mineral oil, the gel in the palm section of the grip is vegetable oil based. The clamp can also be 100% recycled. It is all a result of Ergon’s “GreenLab” initiative.", "text": "Ergon GP1 Biokork Bicycle Handlebar Grip The new BioKork version of the GP1 provides ultimate ergonomics for the hand just as the rest of Ergon’s Performance Comfort series do, however the unique qualities of cork means that it is now antibacterial and hypoallergenic. Cork’s natural damping qualities also make it an ideal grip material, and its now density mean the resulting grip is a lot lighter. The GP1 BioKork uses 40% cork, sourced from sustainable forests in Portugal which is certified for its ecologically sound production. This ecological theme is continued throughout the rest of the grip. The inner core is plastic reinforced using natural fibre, which make up 40% of its mass. In place of mineral oil, the gel in the palm section of the grip is vegetable oil based. The clamp can also be 100% recycled. It is all a result of Ergon’s “GreenLab” initiative.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LUA%2BUSa5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037N33CO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0037N341O", "title": "Lizard Skins DSP Dual-Color Bar Tape - 2.5MM", "description": "Lizard Skins DSP Dual-Color Bar Tape offers you better shock absorption with a full 2. 5mm of cushion to eliminate numbness and fatigue. It also dishes out the good looks by the ladle-full with slick dual-color design and embossed logos.", "text": "Lizard Skins DSP Dual-Color Bar Tape - 2.5MM Lizard Skins DSP Dual-Color Bar Tape offers you better shock absorption with a full 2. 5mm of cushion to eliminate numbness and fatigue. It also dishes out the good looks by the ladle-full with slick dual-color design and embossed logos.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RE7RlsZeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037N341O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0037N34N2", "title": "Park Tool PFP-6 Home Mechanic Floor Pump", "description": "The Park Tool PFP-6 Home Mechanic Floor Pump is an economical and versatile pump, perfect for just about any job.Includes ball inflating needle.", "text": "Park Tool PFP-6 Home Mechanic Floor Pump The Park Tool PFP-6 Home Mechanic Floor Pump is an economical and versatile pump, perfect for just about any job.Includes ball inflating needle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d5%2BbPhBgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037N34N2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0037N6IXA", "title": "Lyman Magnum Inertia Bullet Puller", "description": "Safely strips loaded rounds in seconds without damage to bullet or case. Features newly engineered head design that allows use on full range of calibers from tiny 5.7 X 28FN to the largest Magnums. New \"full-size-Inchergonomic molded handle with rubber insert for comfort and sure grip. Traps components with just a few raps on the bench.", "text": "Lyman Magnum Inertia Bullet Puller Safely strips loaded rounds in seconds without damage to bullet or case. Features newly engineered head design that allows use on full range of calibers from tiny 5.7 X 28FN to the largest Magnums. New \"full-size-Inchergonomic molded handle with rubber insert for comfort and sure grip. Traps components with just a few raps on the bench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f0IF7Ma9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037N6IXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.69}}
