{"item_id": "B0037SHXLG", "title": "Mountainsmith Lumbar-Recycled Series Tour TLS R Backpack", "description": "The Classic Tour Lumbar Pack is now made using a brand new fabric woven from threads that are produced from 100 recycled plastic beverage bottles. The same performance, comfort, and durability you've come to expect from Mountainsmith but in a recycled package. Each pack reuses roughly four bottles and the benefits multiply through increased employment, less reliance on petroleum resources and lessened impact on land fills. Further, consumer demand helps drive development and investment in recycling and recycled products.", "text": "Mountainsmith Lumbar-Recycled Series Tour TLS R Backpack The Classic Tour Lumbar Pack is now made using a brand new fabric woven from threads that are produced from 100 recycled plastic beverage bottles. The same performance, comfort, and durability you've come to expect from Mountainsmith but in a recycled package. Each pack reuses roughly four bottles and the benefits multiply through increased employment, less reliance on petroleum resources and lessened impact on land fills. Further, consumer demand helps drive development and investment in recycling and recycled products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NipqUWELL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037SHXLG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0037SJQNE", "title": "Buck 110 EcoLite TM Paperstone Knife", "description": "We understand the importance of integrating materials into our products, and we are enthusiastic about our major step forward with the use of Paperstone TM for our handles. Made from 100% Post-Consumer recycled products, it's the greenest material you can find. More importantly, it's rugged, withstands heat or cold, and is very durable. First used on handles for our Metro TM Knives, with positive results, it's now key to the beginning of our new EcoLite TM knives, which are very light but extremely durable. Imagine a knife with exactly the same great features as our classic 110, but now with half the weight and without sacrificing any of the features and advantages you want and need on the trail or on the job.", "text": "Buck 110 EcoLite TM Paperstone Knife We understand the importance of integrating materials into our products, and we are enthusiastic about our major step forward with the use of Paperstone TM for our handles. Made from 100% Post-Consumer recycled products, it's the greenest material you can find. More importantly, it's rugged, withstands heat or cold, and is very durable. First used on handles for our Metro TM Knives, with positive results, it's now key to the beginning of our new EcoLite TM knives, which are very light but extremely durable. Imagine a knife with exactly the same great features as our classic 110, but now with half the weight and without sacrificing any of the features and advantages you want and need on the trail or on the job.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NlIa1CIuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0037SJQNE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.69}}
