{"item_id": "B00386B610", "title": "Casio Men's GW2310-1 G-Shock Solar Atomic Digital Sports Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's GW2310-1 G-Shock Solar Atomic Digital Sports Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BTF5IZrxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00386B610.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"]], "price": 77.0}}
{"item_id": "B00387ET9A", "title": "Wilson Advantage Triple Tennis Racquet Bag (Black\\Gray)", "description": "Wilson now offers the Advantage Triple in a classic black and white cosmetic. Triple holds 2 racquets without covers.", "text": "Wilson Advantage Triple Tennis Racquet Bag (Black\\Gray) Wilson now offers the Advantage Triple in a classic black and white cosmetic. Triple holds 2 racquets without covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dmgno6hjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00387ET9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00389TOWK", "title": "Buck Silver Creek TM Folding Fillet Knife (Silver/blue, 13 3/4-Inch)", "description": "Our Silver Creek Fillet Knives have quickly become popular among fishermen with their corrosion resistant Titanium coated flexible blades and rubberized handles. For added convenience Buck now offers a folding Silver Creek Fillet Knife, which is great for any fishing kit. The folder still has all the benefits of the fixed blade fillet knives, but is convenient for fisherman to carry with them, due to its compact size. It utilizes a mid-lock back design for safety while in use.", "text": "Buck Silver Creek TM Folding Fillet Knife (Silver/blue, 13 3/4-Inch) Our Silver Creek Fillet Knives have quickly become popular among fishermen with their corrosion resistant Titanium coated flexible blades and rubberized handles. For added convenience Buck now offers a folding Silver Creek Fillet Knife, which is great for any fishing kit. The folder still has all the benefits of the fixed blade fillet knives, but is convenient for fisherman to carry with them, due to its compact size. It utilizes a mid-lock back design for safety while in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eKPXTJFfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00389TOWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.94}}
{"item_id": "B00389XY94", "title": "Hikker HP-5 Anti-shock Hiking Pole, 2-pack", "description": "HP5 is a perfect companion for your weekend hiking trips. It has a comfortable cork handle with nylon strap and a small EVA grip for use when the stick is folded. The telescopic stick is made of 3 strong aluminum alloy sections and can be adjusted to a desired height between 55\" and 27 1/2\". It also has spring-loaded anti-shock mechanism inside which can be turned on/off with a twist between the two sections. Functional graphic on the stick includes a US/Metric Ruler. At the bottom end of the stick, there is a carbide tip hidden inside the rubber end cap. It is very helpful when walking on rocky hard surface. A snow disc is included for use on loose top soil or muddy road. Other convenient accessories include a liquid filled mini compass and a thermometer. Both could be worn on watch band if preferred. Each package comes with 2 HP-5 hiking poles.", "text": "Hikker HP-5 Anti-shock Hiking Pole, 2-pack HP5 is a perfect companion for your weekend hiking trips. It has a comfortable cork handle with nylon strap and a small EVA grip for use when the stick is folded. The telescopic stick is made of 3 strong aluminum alloy sections and can be adjusted to a desired height between 55\" and 27 1/2\". It also has spring-loaded anti-shock mechanism inside which can be turned on/off with a twist between the two sections. Functional graphic on the stick includes a US/Metric Ruler. At the bottom end of the stick, there is a carbide tip hidden inside the rubber end cap. It is very helpful when walking on rocky hard surface. A snow disc is included for use on loose top soil or muddy road. Other convenient accessories include a liquid filled mini compass and a thermometer. Both could be worn on watch band if preferred. Each package comes with 2 HP-5 hiking poles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fx7Bevk7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00389XY94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 38.0}}
{"item_id": "B0038A05X6", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives F08-N Entrenching Tool", "description": "A folding shovel can be an indispensable tool in today's constantly changing environment. When you need to move sand, dirt or snow you wish you had that shovel close at hand. The all-steel construction entrenching tool features a tempered-steel blade with teeth cut into it for cutting and slashing. The triangular handle is strong and fits the hand well.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives F08-N Entrenching Tool A folding shovel can be an indispensable tool in today's constantly changing environment. When you need to move sand, dirt or snow you wish you had that shovel close at hand. The all-steel construction entrenching tool features a tempered-steel blade with teeth cut into it for cutting and slashing. The triangular handle is strong and fits the hand well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BzN2ad0EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038A05X6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 15.98}}
{"item_id": "B0038A1YRC", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SP01-CP Sogzilla Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.25-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "Fast, compact, and built for intuitive handling, the SOG SP-01 is a member of the innovative SOGzilla Folding Knife family. This is one \"small\" knife that's capable of tackling big jobs, thanks to a 3.2-inch straight blade with a polished satin finish, a tough, ergonomic grip, and a unique design that offers a large thumb hole for smooth, one-handed opening.SP-01 SOGzillaFolding Knife, SmallAt a Glance:3.2-inch straight blade with satin polish finishUnique design with oversized thumbhole for fast, easy openingSteel liners for strength and durabilityTough, lightweight Zytel handle with reversible pocket clipLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipWith its well-balanced design, this knife feels comfortable and natural in either hand.View larger.Textured, non-slip sidesgive you a secure grip to make safe,confident cuts.View larger.Unique Shape for Fast Opening and Easy HandlingThanks to a unique opening shape, the SOGzilla's blade not only looks distinctive, it's actually easier to handle than its more traditional counterparts. The oversized thumbhole is easy to find and utilize for fast deployment whenever you need the knife's blade. The knife opens to a ready-to-use position in the hand, and it's well-balanced for a familiar, natural feel that leads to quick, accurate cuts.Sharp, Dependable Steel Blade and Stout Steel LinersThanks to a 3.2-inch straight-edge blade with a wide body, this SOGzilla opens to full length of 7.35 inches, and it makes quick work of routine cutting applications. Crafted from 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, its blade delivers a combination of strength and value, along with the ability to take a fine edge.In addition, the knife's steel liners make for a stout overall construction that can stand up to tough use wherever your daily life takes you--whether that means up mountains, across deserts, or to the office.Tough, Lightweight Zytel Handle and Reversible Belt ClipDespite its big-bodied steel blade and sturdy steel liners, this SOGzilla knife weighs in at just four ounces, thanks to a handle crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. This handle is textured to provide a sure grip for safe, accurate cuts, and it is shaped to sit comfortably in both your right hand and your left hand.The knife also includes SOG's patented low-carry clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG SP-01 Small SOGzilla Folding Knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxSP-01 SOGzilla Folding Knife, Small.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SP01-CP Sogzilla Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.25-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish Fast, compact, and built for intuitive handling, the SOG SP-01 is a member of the innovative SOGzilla Folding Knife family. This is one \"small\" knife that's capable of tackling big jobs, thanks to a 3.2-inch straight blade with a polished satin finish, a tough, ergonomic grip, and a unique design that offers a large thumb hole for smooth, one-handed opening.SP-01 SOGzillaFolding Knife, SmallAt a Glance:3.2-inch straight blade with satin polish finishUnique design with oversized thumbhole for fast, easy openingSteel liners for strength and durabilityTough, lightweight Zytel handle with reversible pocket clipLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipWith its well-balanced design, this knife feels comfortable and natural in either hand.View larger.Textured, non-slip sidesgive you a secure grip to make safe,confident cuts.View larger.Unique Shape for Fast Opening and Easy HandlingThanks to a unique opening shape, the SOGzilla's blade not only looks distinctive, it's actually easier to handle than its more traditional counterparts. The oversized thumbhole is easy to find and utilize for fast deployment whenever you need the knife's blade. The knife opens to a ready-to-use position in the hand, and it's well-balanced for a familiar, natural feel that leads to quick, accurate cuts.Sharp, Dependable Steel Blade and Stout Steel LinersThanks to a 3.2-inch straight-edge blade with a wide body, this SOGzilla opens to full length of 7.35 inches, and it makes quick work of routine cutting applications. Crafted from 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, its blade delivers a combination of strength and value, along with the ability to take a fine edge.In addition, the knife's steel liners make for a stout overall construction that can stand up to tough use wherever your daily life takes you--whether that means up mountains, across deserts, or to the office.Tough, Lightweight Zytel Handle and Reversible Belt ClipDespite its big-bodied steel blade and sturdy steel liners, this SOGzilla knife weighs in at just four ounces, thanks to a handle crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. This handle is textured to provide a sure grip for safe, accurate cuts, and it is shaped to sit comfortably in both your right hand and your left hand.The knife also includes SOG's patented low-carry clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG SP-01 Small SOGzilla Folding Knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxSP-01 SOGzilla Folding Knife, Small.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31quvPcBM0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038A1YRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0038A4YCY", "title": "Schrade SCHF1SM Extreme Survival One-Piece Steel Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife with Nylon Sheath", "description": "The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "text": "Schrade SCHF1SM Extreme Survival One-Piece Steel Special Forces Fixed Blade Knife with Nylon Sheath The Extreme Survival knife is a tool like no other. It stands alone as a finely crafted fixed-blade survival style knife, but had a multi-bit screwdriver that threads into the butt end of the handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3105yDarjxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038A4YCY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 49.35}}
{"item_id": "B0038A718S", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SP23-CP Sogzilla Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.8-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade with GRN Handle, Hardcase Black Finish", "description": "Fast, bold, and built for intuitive handling, the SOG SP-23 is a member of the innovative SOGzilla Folding Knife family. This is one \"large\" knife that lives up to its big billing, thanks to a 3.8-inch straight blade with a black TiNi finish, a tough, ergonomic grip, and a unique design that offers a large thumb hole for smooth, one-handed opening.SP-23 SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish, LargeAt a Glance:3.8-inch straight-edge steel blade with black TiNi finishUnique design with oversized thumbhole for fast, easy openingSteel liners for strength and durabilityTough, lightweight Zytel handle with reversible pocket clipLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipTextured, non-slip sides give you a secure grip to make quick, confident cuts.View larger.SOG's trademarked low-carry clip allows the knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use.Unique Shape for Fast Opening and Easy HandlingThanks to a unique opening shape, the SOGzilla's blade not only looks distinctive, it's actually easier to handle than its more traditional counterparts. The oversized thumbhole is easy to find and utilize for fast deployment whenever you need the knife's blade. The knife opens to a ready-to-use position in the hand, and it's well-balanced for a familiar, natural feel that leads to quick, accurate cuts.Sharp, Dependable Steel Blade and Stout Steel LinersThanks to a 3.8-inch straight-edge blade with a wide body, this SOGzilla opens to full length of 8.54 inches, and it makes quick work of routine cutting applications. Crafted from 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, its blade delivers a combination of strength and value, along with the ability to take a fine edge, and the black TiNi finish on this blade offers improved durability along with anti-reflective good looks.In addition, the knife's steel liners make for a stout overall construction that can stand up to tough use wherever your daily life takes you--whether that means up mountains, across deserts, or to the office.Tough, Lightweight Zytel Handle and Reversible Belt ClipDespite its big-bodied steel blade and sturdy steel liners, this large SOGzilla knife weighs in at just 4.8 ounces, thanks to a handle crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. This handle is textured to provide a sure grip for safe, accurate cuts, and it is shaped to sit comfortably in both your right hand and your left hand.The knife also includes SOG's patented low-carry clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG SP-23 Large SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxSP-23 SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish, Large.Designed to feel natural in either hand,this knife is well balanced for safe and easy use.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SP23-CP Sogzilla Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.8-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade with GRN Handle, Hardcase Black Finish Fast, bold, and built for intuitive handling, the SOG SP-23 is a member of the innovative SOGzilla Folding Knife family. This is one \"large\" knife that lives up to its big billing, thanks to a 3.8-inch straight blade with a black TiNi finish, a tough, ergonomic grip, and a unique design that offers a large thumb hole for smooth, one-handed opening.SP-23 SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish, LargeAt a Glance:3.8-inch straight-edge steel blade with black TiNi finishUnique design with oversized thumbhole for fast, easy openingSteel liners for strength and durabilityTough, lightweight Zytel handle with reversible pocket clipLifetime warranty on materials and workmanshipTextured, non-slip sides give you a secure grip to make quick, confident cuts.View larger.SOG's trademarked low-carry clip allows the knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use.Unique Shape for Fast Opening and Easy HandlingThanks to a unique opening shape, the SOGzilla's blade not only looks distinctive, it's actually easier to handle than its more traditional counterparts. The oversized thumbhole is easy to find and utilize for fast deployment whenever you need the knife's blade. The knife opens to a ready-to-use position in the hand, and it's well-balanced for a familiar, natural feel that leads to quick, accurate cuts.Sharp, Dependable Steel Blade and Stout Steel LinersThanks to a 3.8-inch straight-edge blade with a wide body, this SOGzilla opens to full length of 8.54 inches, and it makes quick work of routine cutting applications. Crafted from 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, its blade delivers a combination of strength and value, along with the ability to take a fine edge, and the black TiNi finish on this blade offers improved durability along with anti-reflective good looks.In addition, the knife's steel liners make for a stout overall construction that can stand up to tough use wherever your daily life takes you--whether that means up mountains, across deserts, or to the office.Tough, Lightweight Zytel Handle and Reversible Belt ClipDespite its big-bodied steel blade and sturdy steel liners, this large SOGzilla knife weighs in at just 4.8 ounces, thanks to a handle crafted from tough, glass-reinforced Zytel--a compound that's lightweight, abrasion resistant, and impact resistant. This handle is textured to provide a sure grip for safe, accurate cuts, and it is shaped to sit comfortably in both your right hand and your left hand.The knife also includes SOG's patented low-carry clip, which allows the folded knife to ride securely and unobtrusively in your pocket when not in use. This clip is reversible, which means it can be positioned on whichever side of the knife is most convenient for you.The SOG SP-23 Large SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials.About SOG: Strong, Innovative Specialty ToolsSOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives & Tools was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.What's in the BoxSP-23 SOGzilla Folding Knife with Black TiNi Finish, Large.Designed to feel natural in either hand,this knife is well balanced for safe and easy use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lKwhS9bsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038A718S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 31.53}}
{"item_id": "B0038A71VU", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TS01-N Tsunami Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 6.5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Black Kraton Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "With the reintroduction of the popular Tsunami, SOG has taken what made the knife so great and improved it. Some of the changes made are subtle, like refining the overall balance. Some are more obvious like the grooves in our crossguards and a tough Ti-Ni coating option. You will like the different shapes of both of these blades.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TS01-N Tsunami Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 6.5-Inch AUS-8 Steel Blade and Black Kraton Handle, Satin Finish With the reintroduction of the popular Tsunami, SOG has taken what made the knife so great and improved it. Some of the changes made are subtle, like refining the overall balance. Some are more obvious like the grooves in our crossguards and a tough Ti-Ni coating option. You will like the different shapes of both of these blades.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rsHrH3DrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038A71VU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 56.53}}
