{"item_id": "B0038F1EJK", "title": "Topeak Cargo Net for Tote and Basket", "description": "Elastic nylon cargo net attaches to Topeak TrolleyTote or other basket types and keeps contents safe and secure while riding. Attaches to rack or basket with durable, coated hooks.", "text": "Topeak Cargo Net for Tote and Basket Elastic nylon cargo net attaches to Topeak TrolleyTote or other basket types and keeps contents safe and secure while riding. Attaches to rack or basket with durable, coated hooks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xMvuEu28L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038F1EJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 2.0}}
{"item_id": "B0038KSIWQ", "title": "Grand Trunk Stainless Steel Food Carrier", "description": "Grand Trunk’s imported Zebra Thai Stainless Steel Lunch Carriers offer a great alternative to baggies and plastic food containers, which always seem to warp, crack, drip, or get lost in the dark recesses of your kitchen. These stackable containers all fit together with a single latching lid that holds everything securely shut. Pack snacks for camping, school lunches, potluck offerings, salsas and dips, chopped fruit, salads, or whatever is on the day’s menu.", "text": "Grand Trunk Stainless Steel Food Carrier Grand Trunk’s imported Zebra Thai Stainless Steel Lunch Carriers offer a great alternative to baggies and plastic food containers, which always seem to warp, crack, drip, or get lost in the dark recesses of your kitchen. These stackable containers all fit together with a single latching lid that holds everything securely shut. Pack snacks for camping, school lunches, potluck offerings, salsas and dips, chopped fruit, salads, or whatever is on the day’s menu.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PCR81ClWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038KSIWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0038KYF9Q", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools AC20-CP AutoClip Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and Black GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "SOG has brought back the AutoClip series, a no nonsense line of lockbacks that are lightweight, durable and affordable. The name comes from our spring-activated clip design, which allows variable thickness pant edges to be treated equally with the proper clamping force. The next thing you might notice is our adjustable thumbstud (patent-pending) fine tune its position and tailor it to your hand. Appreciate the AutoClip's signature basket weave texture, which insures non-slip performance. The blades are beautifully ground with a two directional high gloss satin finish, typically only found in much more expensive knives. Several sizes and styles are available to fit your many applications.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools AC20-CP AutoClip Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and Black GRN Handle, Satin Finish SOG has brought back the AutoClip series, a no nonsense line of lockbacks that are lightweight, durable and affordable. The name comes from our spring-activated clip design, which allows variable thickness pant edges to be treated equally with the proper clamping force. The next thing you might notice is our adjustable thumbstud (patent-pending) fine tune its position and tailor it to your hand. Appreciate the AutoClip's signature basket weave texture, which insures non-slip performance. The blades are beautifully ground with a two directional high gloss satin finish, typically only found in much more expensive knives. Several sizes and styles are available to fit your many applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o5EHS2kFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038KYF9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.94}}
