{"item_id": "B0038MQIA8", "title": "Grand Trunk Loop Handle Pot", "description": "The 12cm (4.75in) Billy Pot by Grand Trunk is an all in one portable cookware set perfect for all your outdoor activities. What makes the Billy Pot unique is it's internal dish that allows you to steam or cook inside the main pot itself. You can also use the dish to eat out of after cooking. Grand Trunks Billy Pot is made out of durable 18-10 stainless steel that will resist corroding, provide years of use and still look great. The positive locking handle keeps everything in place during transport.", "text": "Grand Trunk Loop Handle Pot The 12cm (4.75in) Billy Pot by Grand Trunk is an all in one portable cookware set perfect for all your outdoor activities. What makes the Billy Pot unique is it's internal dish that allows you to steam or cook inside the main pot itself. You can also use the dish to eat out of after cooking. Grand Trunks Billy Pot is made out of durable 18-10 stainless steel that will resist corroding, provide years of use and still look great. The positive locking handle keeps everything in place during transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4195O48xMSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038MQIA8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]]}}
