{"item_id": "B0038NSMVU", "title": "Primos Arm Guard", "description": "Have you ever wanted real protection from the sting of a bow string? Well, here it is, the Arm Guard. It is very durable, quiet and strong – providing you the best protection. The arm guard features unique honeycomb vents, which allow for maximum comfort during warm weather bow hunts. It features a quick-hook with elastic strap system to help keep bulky sleeves out of the way during cold weather bow hunts. The TRUTH is, the arm guard from Primos, is the best arm protection you, as a bow hunter, could ask for.", "text": "Primos Arm Guard Have you ever wanted real protection from the sting of a bow string? Well, here it is, the Arm Guard. It is very durable, quiet and strong – providing you the best protection. The arm guard features unique honeycomb vents, which allow for maximum comfort during warm weather bow hunts. It features a quick-hook with elastic strap system to help keep bulky sleeves out of the way during cold weather bow hunts. The TRUTH is, the arm guard from Primos, is the best arm protection you, as a bow hunter, could ask for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51p1s%2BaYtpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038NSMVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Arm Guards"]], "price": 3.0}}
