{"item_id": "B0038YYI1C", "title": "Shimano Spinning Reel", "description": "This lightweight, rear-drag Shimano IX features Quick Fire II, Graphite Frame, Graphite Sideplate, Graphite Rotor, Graphite Spool, Rear Drag. Approved for use in Saltwater. Rated for use with Mono, Fluorocarbon and PowerPro lines.", "text": "Shimano Spinning Reel This lightweight, rear-drag Shimano IX features Quick Fire II, Graphite Frame, Graphite Sideplate, Graphite Rotor, Graphite Spool, Rear Drag. Approved for use in Saltwater. Rated for use with Mono, Fluorocarbon and PowerPro lines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IJnBIzMrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0038YYI1C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
