{"item_id": "B003905I7S", "title": "Portland Design Works Spaceship Headlight and Radbot 500 Light Set", "description": "Cut through the darkness ahead and stay safe while you ride with the Spaceship/Radbot 500 light set from Portland Design Works. The compact Spaceship bike light blasts a brilliant Japanese LED through a special German-engineered lens. As a result, you can easily see the road ahead, helping you avoid pedestrians, other cyclists, and all manner of obstacles. The Radbot 500, meanwhile, comes equipped with a blazing red eye that contains a 0.5-watt Japanese LED to stare down vehicles. The Radbot's precision reflector also conforms to strict EU standards for safety. Both lights are built to withstand rain and meteor showers and to keep you safe from blastoff to touchdown in all conditions.The Spaceship offers your choice of steady or flashing modes, and runs for more than 100 hours on two AA batteries (included). The light--which includes a Mission Control QR bracket that fits 22mm to 31.8mm handlebars--measures 3.85 by 1.61 by 1.38 and weighs 3.2 ounces.The Radbot 500 offers three modes--zZz, zZzPOP!, and rock steady--and comes with rack, seat post, and seat stay mounts along with a backpack clip. The Radbot 500 runs on two AAA batteries (included), measures 1.42 by 1.57 by 3.22 inches, and weighs 2.2 ounces.", "text": "Portland Design Works Spaceship Headlight and Radbot 500 Light Set Cut through the darkness ahead and stay safe while you ride with the Spaceship/Radbot 500 light set from Portland Design Works. The compact Spaceship bike light blasts a brilliant Japanese LED through a special German-engineered lens. As a result, you can easily see the road ahead, helping you avoid pedestrians, other cyclists, and all manner of obstacles. The Radbot 500, meanwhile, comes equipped with a blazing red eye that contains a 0.5-watt Japanese LED to stare down vehicles. The Radbot's precision reflector also conforms to strict EU standards for safety. Both lights are built to withstand rain and meteor showers and to keep you safe from blastoff to touchdown in all conditions.The Spaceship offers your choice of steady or flashing modes, and runs for more than 100 hours on two AA batteries (included). The light--which includes a Mission Control QR bracket that fits 22mm to 31.8mm handlebars--measures 3.85 by 1.61 by 1.38 and weighs 3.2 ounces.The Radbot 500 offers three modes--zZz, zZzPOP!, and rock steady--and comes with rack, seat post, and seat stay mounts along with a backpack clip. The Radbot 500 runs on two AAA batteries (included), measures 1.42 by 1.57 by 3.22 inches, and weighs 2.2 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KH-3MrJmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003905I7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 45.31}}
{"item_id": "B00395YPO0", "title": "Camo Form Protective Fabric Wrap, ACU Universal Digital", "description": "McNett Camo Form Protective Camouflage Wrap 12 ft roll ACU Digital, BagCamo Form dramatically improves grip and insulates hands from uncomfortably hot or cold surfaces and helps prevent guns and bows from slipping in the field. Wrap Camo Form around any piece of outdoor equipment to keep it from clanking against other objects and to reduce glare. Washable and reusable! One roll covers 1 average shotgun, rifle or bow.Finally you can bring any of your guns or optics into the field without worrying about damage from scratches, nicks or worse! And unlike messy tapes, Camo Form leaves no sticky residue when removed. This heavy duty stretch fabric wrap clings to itself as it's wrapped on the gun. It stays solidly in place and won't sag, even in wet weather. It conforms to any shape and be cut and applied to the smallest moving parts. 1 Unstretched Roll: 2\" Wide x 144\" (12 Feet) Long.Mil Specs:Easy to Use Stretch FabricClings to Itself, Not to Your Weapon or Gear, non-marringProvides Heavy Duty ProtectionQuiets Loose Items and Gun PartsProtects Hands; Improves Grip in Extreme ConditionsConceals and Reduces GlareConforms to Any Object - Weapons, Knife Handles, Scopes, Binoculars, Flashlights, Sheaths, Ammo Clips and More!Weather proof! Adhesion not affected by Rain or immersion or water Versatile, Hundreds of Uses.Reuseable!Packaged in a resealable Bag Made in USA", "text": "Camo Form Protective Fabric Wrap, ACU Universal Digital McNett Camo Form Protective Camouflage Wrap 12 ft roll ACU Digital, BagCamo Form dramatically improves grip and insulates hands from uncomfortably hot or cold surfaces and helps prevent guns and bows from slipping in the field. Wrap Camo Form around any piece of outdoor equipment to keep it from clanking against other objects and to reduce glare. Washable and reusable! One roll covers 1 average shotgun, rifle or bow.Finally you can bring any of your guns or optics into the field without worrying about damage from scratches, nicks or worse! And unlike messy tapes, Camo Form leaves no sticky residue when removed. This heavy duty stretch fabric wrap clings to itself as it's wrapped on the gun. It stays solidly in place and won't sag, even in wet weather. It conforms to any shape and be cut and applied to the smallest moving parts. 1 Unstretched Roll: 2\" Wide x 144\" (12 Feet) Long.Mil Specs:Easy to Use Stretch FabricClings to Itself, Not to Your Weapon or Gear, non-marringProvides Heavy Duty ProtectionQuiets Loose Items and Gun PartsProtects Hands; Improves Grip in Extreme ConditionsConceals and Reduces GlareConforms to Any Object - Weapons, Knife Handles, Scopes, Binoculars, Flashlights, Sheaths, Ammo Clips and More!Weather proof! Adhesion not affected by Rain or immersion or water Versatile, Hundreds of Uses.Reuseable!Packaged in a resealable Bag Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PBPbb4njL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00395YPO0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00399DE2K", "title": "NcStar 7.62x39/SKS Mag Loader/Unloader [Misc.]", "description": "Product Features:Ak-47/Sks Speed Loader for Detachable 7.62x39 MagazinesLoad Magazines Quickly and Efficiently Using Stripper Clips (Not Included)Dimensions (Inches): 7.2l X 2.9wWeight: 5.2 Oz.", "text": "NcStar 7.62x39/SKS Mag Loader/Unloader [Misc.] Product Features:Ak-47/Sks Speed Loader for Detachable 7.62x39 MagazinesLoad Magazines Quickly and Efficiently Using Stripper Clips (Not Included)Dimensions (Inches): 7.2l X 2.9wWeight: 5.2 Oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rZ-BjDbdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00399DE2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 18.3}}
{"item_id": "B00399FK4A", "title": "VISM by NcStar Molle Pals Vest", "description": "NcSTAR has introduced a PALs Modular Vest with PALs webbing sewn on the front and back panel for the ultimate in customizable tactical vest with PALs pouches/accessories. Constructed from tough PVC mesh webbing for maximum ventilation and durability. With three adjustable front buckles, side straps, and adjustable shoulder panels, the vest is adjustable to fit most body types. The PALs Modular Vest includes a heavy duty belt with two additional pistol magazine/utility pouches, reinforced drag handle strap, and the vest is also hydration system compatible (bladder not included). For the player looking for a modular vest for different playing scenarios, here is the modular vest you’ve always been looking for. You can attach your PALs (Molle) compatible pouches in any fashion on this PALs Modular Vest.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Molle Pals Vest NcSTAR has introduced a PALs Modular Vest with PALs webbing sewn on the front and back panel for the ultimate in customizable tactical vest with PALs pouches/accessories. Constructed from tough PVC mesh webbing for maximum ventilation and durability. With three adjustable front buckles, side straps, and adjustable shoulder panels, the vest is adjustable to fit most body types. The PALs Modular Vest includes a heavy duty belt with two additional pistol magazine/utility pouches, reinforced drag handle strap, and the vest is also hydration system compatible (bladder not included). For the player looking for a modular vest for different playing scenarios, here is the modular vest you’ve always been looking for. You can attach your PALs (Molle) compatible pouches in any fashion on this PALs Modular Vest.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E3HREpj3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00399FK4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 30.28}}
{"item_id": "B00399HDP4", "title": "NcStar AR15 Flip Up Rear Sight (MARFLR)", "description": "For a durable and compact flip-up rear A2 iron sight the NcSTAR MARFLR is the AR-15 back-up rear iron sight that you’re looking for.", "text": "NcStar AR15 Flip Up Rear Sight (MARFLR) For a durable and compact flip-up rear A2 iron sight the NcSTAR MARFLR is the AR-15 back-up rear iron sight that you’re looking for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ACAdLycHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00399HDP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 21.63}}
{"item_id": "B0039B9GW0", "title": "Kabar Johnson Adventure Piggyback Knife", "description": "The Piggyback is the smallest knife in the Johnson Adventure® line but it doesn't know that. The Piggyback® is purpose-built for field dressing game from upland birds to big, nasty hogs and everything in between. Its simple skeleton design is very easy to clean up and it is made of high carbon stainless steel so keeping an edge on it is easy. It has a deep belly and an abrupt clip point that is perfect for unzipping skin from forelegs and other critical areas when caping out a trophy. The Piggyback® is all about toughness, simplicity and ease of use. It comes standard with the Baconmaker® and Potbelly® but is also sold here separately.", "text": "Kabar Johnson Adventure Piggyback Knife The Piggyback is the smallest knife in the Johnson Adventure® line but it doesn't know that. The Piggyback® is purpose-built for field dressing game from upland birds to big, nasty hogs and everything in between. Its simple skeleton design is very easy to clean up and it is made of high carbon stainless steel so keeping an edge on it is easy. It has a deep belly and an abrupt clip point that is perfect for unzipping skin from forelegs and other critical areas when caping out a trophy. The Piggyback® is all about toughness, simplicity and ease of use. It comes standard with the Baconmaker® and Potbelly® but is also sold here separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21VRy-mHI8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039B9GW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 10.67}}
{"item_id": "B0039B9GWU", "title": "Ka-Bar 5600 Johnson Adventure Potbelly, Brown", "description": "The Potbelly -- the workhorse Adventure blade -- borrows its strength from legendary big blades like the kukri and the machete for amazing chopping power. This is a perfectly turned knife, with weight-forward balance for heavy cutting and multi-position handle that allows for delicate work. The handle is texture with our proprietary Adventure grip so you're always in control, even when things get messy. The blade is precision crafted from 0.25\" 1095 crow-van steel, hollow ground to a razor's edge and powder coated for corrosion resistance.", "text": "Ka-Bar 5600 Johnson Adventure Potbelly, Brown The Potbelly -- the workhorse Adventure blade -- borrows its strength from legendary big blades like the kukri and the machete for amazing chopping power. This is a perfectly turned knife, with weight-forward balance for heavy cutting and multi-position handle that allows for delicate work. The handle is texture with our proprietary Adventure grip so you're always in control, even when things get messy. The blade is precision crafted from 0.25\" 1095 crow-van steel, hollow ground to a razor's edge and powder coated for corrosion resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yiLRGfP-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039B9GWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B0039BJ92W", "title": "Radians Remington Interchangeable 5 Lens Kit", "description": "The T-85 is an interchangeable 5 lens kit. The glass has a sleek lightweight design with adjustable temples, rubber nosepiece and rubber temple pads. One piece interchangeable lens design allows a wearer to easily switch lenses for different lighting situations. Includes neoprene carrying case, neck cord, and microfiber lens cloth bag. Exceeds ANSI Z87.1+ Standards.", "text": "Radians Remington Interchangeable 5 Lens Kit The T-85 is an interchangeable 5 lens kit. The glass has a sleek lightweight design with adjustable temples, rubber nosepiece and rubber temple pads. One piece interchangeable lens design allows a wearer to easily switch lenses for different lighting situations. Includes neoprene carrying case, neck cord, and microfiber lens cloth bag. Exceeds ANSI Z87.1+ Standards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B%2BZ0fPkiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039BJ92W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B0039D374G", "title": "Official US Military Army ACU Molle II M4 2 Double Mag Ammo Pouch (ACU Camouflage)", "description": "Official US Military Molle II Double Mag Ammo Pouch. ACU Camouflage.", "text": "Official US Military Army ACU Molle II M4 2 Double Mag Ammo Pouch (ACU Camouflage) Official US Military Molle II Double Mag Ammo Pouch. ACU Camouflage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z0f78S96L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039D374G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The Specialty Group, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.9}}
{"item_id": "B0039D6RHK", "title": "Official US Military ACU MOLLE II Canteen Utility Pouch", "description": "Official US Military ACU Molle II Canteen Pouch/Utility Pouch. Color ACU. New condition.", "text": "Official US Military ACU MOLLE II Canteen Utility Pouch Official US Military ACU Molle II Canteen Pouch/Utility Pouch. Color ACU. New condition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BrwUn%2BvRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039D6RHK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specialty Defense Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B0039DYI1M", "title": "Mcr Strength Muscle Clamp", "description": "MCR STRENGTH INC. 1250060 2\" Muscle Clamp (PR) Black", "text": "Mcr Strength Muscle Clamp MCR STRENGTH INC. 1250060 2\" Muscle Clamp (PR) Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BRdyud2LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039DYI1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MCR STRENGTH INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 40.53}}
{"item_id": "B0039GEB5M", "title": "Sigma BC 1609 STS Wireless Bicycle Speedometer", "description": "There's no such thing as too much information when you're training for a big race. Enter the Sigma BC 1609 STS wireless bicycle computer, which includes everything from a speedometer to a countdown timer to an optional cadence measurement function--all compatible with online PC software. The BC 1609 STS, which is adjustable to fit two wheel sizes, displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The computer even offers a programmable trip section counter, a roadbook that lets you create a back-and-forth itinerary.The BC 1609 STS's timing functions include a countdown timer that's perfect for racing against the clock; a stopwatch that keeps you sharp on intervals; a display for elapsed and total riding time (the latter is only available after your ride); and a time-keeping clock. And serious cyclists can opt to use the cadence functions (current and average), which help you ride efficiently both on the road and in the woods. You can also turn off the cadence functions while riding.The BC 1609 STS is versatile in other ways, too, with the ability to automatically recognize a second bike. That means you can gauge the total distance and ride time of either or both bikes, a handy option for couples or friends who train together. Other features include a temperature display, seven language settings, a backlight, a battery status display, and a backup function that preserves your settings and info even when the battery dies. Also available in a wired version, the PC-compatible BC 1609 STS mounts on your handlebar or stem for easy access.", "text": "Sigma BC 1609 STS Wireless Bicycle Speedometer There's no such thing as too much information when you're training for a big race. Enter the Sigma BC 1609 STS wireless bicycle computer, which includes everything from a speedometer to a countdown timer to an optional cadence measurement function--all compatible with online PC software. The BC 1609 STS, which is adjustable to fit two wheel sizes, displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The computer even offers a programmable trip section counter, a roadbook that lets you create a back-and-forth itinerary.The BC 1609 STS's timing functions include a countdown timer that's perfect for racing against the clock; a stopwatch that keeps you sharp on intervals; a display for elapsed and total riding time (the latter is only available after your ride); and a time-keeping clock. And serious cyclists can opt to use the cadence functions (current and average), which help you ride efficiently both on the road and in the woods. You can also turn off the cadence functions while riding.The BC 1609 STS is versatile in other ways, too, with the ability to automatically recognize a second bike. That means you can gauge the total distance and ride time of either or both bikes, a handy option for couples or friends who train together. Other features include a temperature display, seven language settings, a backlight, a battery status display, and a backup function that preserves your settings and info even when the battery dies. Also available in a wired version, the PC-compatible BC 1609 STS mounts on your handlebar or stem for easy access.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7PUUZ9OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039GEB5M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 64.21}}
