{"item_id": "B0039LRLD6", "title": "Rothco 550-Pound Safety Type III Commercial", "description": "Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "Rothco 550-Pound Safety Type III Commercial Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oQoE7rwhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039LRLD6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0039O3Y3E", "title": "Mikasa Glow in the Dark outdoor tetherball, green/red/Smart Glo", "description": "The greatest playground game just got better. Now you and your friends can play well into the night with Mikasa’s “Glow in the Dark” tetherball. The soft stitch outer shell reacts best with artificial light. Charge the ball and then play in the dark and watch this baby light up. Rope included.", "text": "Mikasa Glow in the Dark outdoor tetherball, green/red/Smart Glo The greatest playground game just got better. Now you and your friends can play well into the night with Mikasa’s “Glow in the Dark” tetherball. The soft stitch outer shell reacts best with artificial light. Charge the ball and then play in the dark and watch this baby light up. Rope included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413HoE9z2lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039O3Y3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mikasa Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Tetherball"]], "price": 12.62}}
{"item_id": "B0039OSF56", "title": "Condor Tactical Cap - BLACK", "description": "Hat With Velcro For Patch 1000 Denier Cordura Nylon Authentic Crye Precision Fabric One Size Fits All(Adjustable) With Velcro For Patch color Black.", "text": "Condor Tactical Cap - BLACK Hat With Velcro For Patch 1000 Denier Cordura Nylon Authentic Crye Precision Fabric One Size Fits All(Adjustable) With Velcro For Patch color Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sMbzoEh-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039OSF56.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 8.36}}
