{"item_id": "B0039RFJI4", "title": "Crosman Domed Premier Pellets, 0.22-Calibre, 500 Count", "description": "Crosman Premier Pellets are made using the highest grade precision tolling to ensure each pellet is nearly indistinguishable from the next. This means consistent accuracy.", "text": "Crosman Domed Premier Pellets, 0.22-Calibre, 500 Count Crosman Premier Pellets are made using the highest grade precision tolling to ensure each pellet is nearly indistinguishable from the next. This means consistent accuracy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WBcPV5rNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039RFJI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 8.28}}
{"item_id": "B0039T4S3O", "title": "Fuel Belt Plus One Single Bottle 7oz", "description": "", "text": "Fuel Belt Plus One Single Bottle 7oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zP6KDdvWL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039T4S3O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FuelBelt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 12.56}}
{"item_id": "B0039TDD94", "title": "FuelBelt Wedge Bottle with Clip, 7-Oz", "description": "We came up with the idea for the Wedge during a training run when all I needed was an 8oz FuelBelt bottle and a gel packet. I tucked the bottle between the elastic band of my run shorts and my lower back/butt. It was an instant hit but needed some added security, so we added a small clip to keep the bottle from slipping downward. It provides you with the ultimate hands-free/waist-free experience, but still allows you to carry several ounces of fluids with you for that quick run. The smooth contoured bottle is very comfortable tucked behind your waist or at the side of your hip.", "text": "FuelBelt Wedge Bottle with Clip, 7-Oz We came up with the idea for the Wedge during a training run when all I needed was an 8oz FuelBelt bottle and a gel packet. I tucked the bottle between the elastic band of my run shorts and my lower back/butt. It was an instant hit but needed some added security, so we added a small clip to keep the bottle from slipping downward. It provides you with the ultimate hands-free/waist-free experience, but still allows you to carry several ounces of fluids with you for that quick run. The smooth contoured bottle is very comfortable tucked behind your waist or at the side of your hip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21DV0dvDiTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039TDD94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FuelBelt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.0}}
{"item_id": "B0039TE2US", "title": "Topeak LineUp Stand", "description": "A lightweight, tubular folding stand for storing and displaying bicycles. A spring-loaded arm stabilizes the front or rear wheel and accepts wheel diameters from 20” to 29”.", "text": "Topeak LineUp Stand A lightweight, tubular folding stand for storing and displaying bicycles. A spring-loaded arm stabilizes the front or rear wheel and accepts wheel diameters from 20” to 29”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dzuDTYnfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039TE2US.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 61.94}}
{"item_id": "B0039TKAQ8", "title": "Topeak Mini 9 Pro Mini Tool with Neoprene Bag", "description": "The Mini 9 Pro features 9 precision tools folded into a sleek, machined body. The rigid, high-strength forged alloy body resists torque during hard use and its pro-quality hardened steel tools are built to last. An integrated, folding tire lever secures inside tool body for a streamlined profile. The small size hides in a jersey pocket or saddle bag and is the minimal repair solution for long road rides or endurance mountain biking.", "text": "Topeak Mini 9 Pro Mini Tool with Neoprene Bag The Mini 9 Pro features 9 precision tools folded into a sleek, machined body. The rigid, high-strength forged alloy body resists torque during hard use and its pro-quality hardened steel tools are built to last. An integrated, folding tire lever secures inside tool body for a streamlined profile. The small size hides in a jersey pocket or saddle bag and is the minimal repair solution for long road rides or endurance mountain biking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Uo44dQhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039TKAQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B0039TM1EW", "title": "Ergon GP3 Bicycle Handlebar Grip", "description": "The GR2 features a composite 3-finger bar end with anti-slip rubber inserts. Its size and shape are ideal for small to medium sized hands (Size S: 6.5 – 8.5) as well as for medium to larger sized hands (Size L: 8.5 – 10.5). The bar end and the grip platform can be independently adjusted for the correct support angle and provides the perfect fit for your individual riding style.", "text": "Ergon GP3 Bicycle Handlebar Grip The GR2 features a composite 3-finger bar end with anti-slip rubber inserts. Its size and shape are ideal for small to medium sized hands (Size S: 6.5 – 8.5) as well as for medium to larger sized hands (Size L: 8.5 – 10.5). The bar end and the grip platform can be independently adjusted for the correct support angle and provides the perfect fit for your individual riding style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ynXI1ij0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039TM1EW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0039TMFSY", "title": "Topeak Mini 20 Pro Mini Tool", "description": "The Mini 20 Pro is a precision built, 20 function mini tool designed to handle any road or trailside repair. The lightweight, high-strength forged alloy body resists torque during hard use and its pro-quality hardened steel tools will provide years of service. An integrated, cast CrMo chain tool nestles and locks between tool body forming a low profile, snag-proof shape. The perfect tool for endurance racing and training.", "text": "Topeak Mini 20 Pro Mini Tool The Mini 20 Pro is a precision built, 20 function mini tool designed to handle any road or trailside repair. The lightweight, high-strength forged alloy body resists torque during hard use and its pro-quality hardened steel tools will provide years of service. An integrated, cast CrMo chain tool nestles and locks between tool body forming a low profile, snag-proof shape. The perfect tool for endurance racing and training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S3kM0IuUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039TMFSY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 34.19}}
{"item_id": "B0039UZ7FQ", "title": "Avenir Quick Release Rear Hub Skewer For 7/8Sp Wheels", "description": "Avenir Quick Release Rear Hub Skewer For 7/8Sp Wheels comes with alloy levers and steel skewer with cam actuation. Measures 125-127 millimeter inner diameter", "text": "Avenir Quick Release Rear Hub Skewer For 7/8Sp Wheels Avenir Quick Release Rear Hub Skewer For 7/8Sp Wheels comes with alloy levers and steel skewer with cam actuation. Measures 125-127 millimeter inner diameter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21%2BBQnnFS%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039UZ7FQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Michelin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Wheels & Accessories"]], "price": 3.64}}
{"item_id": "B0039WDYYA", "title": "Dynaflex Platinum Powerball", "description": "Sculpt, shape, and tone your body without lifting weights with the Platinum Powerball, which delivers up to 40 pounds of silky-smooth, dynamic resistance in the palm of your hand. The secret to the Platinum Powerball's success is the built-in gyro mechanism, which spins left-handed, right-handed, clockwise, and counter-clockwise to challenge your muscles. Just keep it spinning to generate results comparable to that of pure resistance lifting while you barely break a sweat. Overall, the Platinum Powerball exerciser reaches up to 13,000 RPMs, helping increase grip strength and range of motion while conditioning your arm, elbow, and shoulder muscles. But what really makes the device so unique and appealing is the impressive light show it produces. The Platinum Powerball incorporates six incredibly intense white neon LEDs that put on a dazzling display when activated. The faster the gyro spins, the brighter the LED array. In a matter of seconds, your entire hand will be fully engulfed in an envelope of light.The Platinum Powerball is also an excellent tool for rehabbing athletes, as it helps strengthen an injured hand or arm in just minutes per day. And unlike most other exercise equipment, the Platinum Powerball is so small, it fits almost anywhere. To use, simply place the Powerball into the included PowerDock docking station and press the red button on top. The gyro will engage and be ready for use in a matter of seconds.", "text": "Dynaflex Platinum Powerball Sculpt, shape, and tone your body without lifting weights with the Platinum Powerball, which delivers up to 40 pounds of silky-smooth, dynamic resistance in the palm of your hand. The secret to the Platinum Powerball's success is the built-in gyro mechanism, which spins left-handed, right-handed, clockwise, and counter-clockwise to challenge your muscles. Just keep it spinning to generate results comparable to that of pure resistance lifting while you barely break a sweat. Overall, the Platinum Powerball exerciser reaches up to 13,000 RPMs, helping increase grip strength and range of motion while conditioning your arm, elbow, and shoulder muscles. But what really makes the device so unique and appealing is the impressive light show it produces. The Platinum Powerball incorporates six incredibly intense white neon LEDs that put on a dazzling display when activated. The faster the gyro spins, the brighter the LED array. In a matter of seconds, your entire hand will be fully engulfed in an envelope of light.The Platinum Powerball is also an excellent tool for rehabbing athletes, as it helps strengthen an injured hand or arm in just minutes per day. And unlike most other exercise equipment, the Platinum Powerball is so small, it fits almost anywhere. To use, simply place the Powerball into the included PowerDock docking station and press the red button on top. The gyro will engage and be ready for use in a matter of seconds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416R3XScFYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039WDYYA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dynaflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 30.69}}
{"item_id": "B0039XCWPQ", "title": "Mesa Tactical SureShell shtogun shell carrier for Mossberg 500/590 (6-Shell, 12-GA)", "description": "MESA 6-Shell SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged, reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Mossberg 500, 590 12Ga 90390. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Mesa Tactical SureShell shtogun shell carrier for Mossberg 500/590 (6-Shell, 12-GA) MESA 6-Shell SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged, reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Mossberg 500, 590 12Ga 90390. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TG1JruU3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039XCWPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mesa Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B0039XD1KG", "title": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Back Pack", "description": "NcSTAR is introducing New Tactical Back Packs.Keep your gear at-the-ready with this Tactical Back Pack.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Back Pack NcSTAR is introducing New Tactical Back Packs.Keep your gear at-the-ready with this Tactical Back Pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BIGbXc1qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039XD1KG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 30.0}}
