{"item_id": "B0039Z5FHQ", "title": "Body Solid 7-Feet Olympic Bar", "description": "Free weight exercise is more popular today than ever before. Cost, versatility and quality of workouts are all reasons customers are buying free weights and free weight equipment. Outside of the weights, the other essential to any free weight workout are bars and Body Solid is a great source for free weights and bars of all types.", "text": "Body Solid 7-Feet Olympic Bar Free weight exercise is more popular today than ever before. Cost, versatility and quality of workouts are all reasons customers are buying free weights and free weight equipment. Outside of the weights, the other essential to any free weight workout are bars and Body Solid is a great source for free weights and bars of all types.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Dw0crVS9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039Z5FHQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Body Solid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 99.0}}
{"item_id": "B0039ZCX3A", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 25 Pump Gun (Brown/Black, 36.5 Inch)", "description": "Originally introduced by Daisy in 1914, the Model 25 pump gun remained part of the company's air gun lineup through 1978. Now the Model 25 is back again, with a pump-action spring design that shoots BBs at up to 350 feet per second. The Model 25 is equipped with such features as a stained solid-wood pistol grip stock and forearm grip, a steel body construction, and a removable screw-in shot tube. The rear sight, which is adjustable for windage and elevation, can also be flipped from open/iron sights to peep sights, giving the Model 25 extra versatility. Daisy tops off the weapon with decorative engraving on the receiver.SpecificationsAction: Pump action, spring airSights: Open/iron and peep front, adjustable rearSafety: Trigger blockMuzzle velocity: 350 feet per secondCaliber: .177 caliber (4.5mm) BBStock/forearm/grip: Stained solid woodBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 195 yardsCapacity: 50 shotReceiver: Decorative embossed steelLength: 37 inches", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 25 Pump Gun (Brown/Black, 36.5 Inch) Originally introduced by Daisy in 1914, the Model 25 pump gun remained part of the company's air gun lineup through 1978. Now the Model 25 is back again, with a pump-action spring design that shoots BBs at up to 350 feet per second. The Model 25 is equipped with such features as a stained solid-wood pistol grip stock and forearm grip, a steel body construction, and a removable screw-in shot tube. The rear sight, which is adjustable for windage and elevation, can also be flipped from open/iron sights to peep sights, giving the Model 25 extra versatility. Daisy tops off the weapon with decorative engraving on the receiver.SpecificationsAction: Pump action, spring airSights: Open/iron and peep front, adjustable rearSafety: Trigger blockMuzzle velocity: 350 feet per secondCaliber: .177 caliber (4.5mm) BBStock/forearm/grip: Stained solid woodBarrel: Smooth bore steelMax shooting distance: 195 yardsCapacity: 50 shotReceiver: Decorative embossed steelLength: 37 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WpWPLFgwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0039ZCX3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 43.36}}
{"item_id": "B003A0KN5E", "title": "Triple Stacker M4 Magazine Pouch (Hold 6 Mags) Color: Coyote Tan", "description": "Triple Stacker Magazine Pouch holds 6 high capacity M4 / M16 Magazines. Open top design with elastic restraints.", "text": "Triple Stacker M4 Magazine Pouch (Hold 6 Mags) Color: Coyote Tan Triple Stacker Magazine Pouch holds 6 high capacity M4 / M16 Magazines. Open top design with elastic restraints.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t8n4Lq6RL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A0KN5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B003A0RU9G", "title": "Double Stacker Open Top M4 Mag Pouch", "description": "Condor Tactical Double Stacker M4 Mag PouchThe Condor Stacker Mag Pouch is a simple yet effective system to carry your M4 magazine. It utilize the open-top design with bungee cords to hold the mags in placeFeatures:", "text": "Double Stacker Open Top M4 Mag Pouch Condor Tactical Double Stacker M4 Mag PouchThe Condor Stacker Mag Pouch is a simple yet effective system to carry your M4 magazine. It utilize the open-top design with bungee cords to hold the mags in placeFeatures:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NUQcBy4PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A0RU9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 21.62}}
{"item_id": "B003A0SX06", "title": "Triple Kangaroo Magazine Pouch holds (3) M4/M16 Mag, (3) Pistol Mag - Color: Multicam", "description": "Triple Kangaroo Magazine Pouch holds (3) M4/M16 Mag, (3) Pistol Mag - Color: Multicam", "text": "Triple Kangaroo Magazine Pouch holds (3) M4/M16 Mag, (3) Pistol Mag - Color: Multicam Triple Kangaroo Magazine Pouch holds (3) M4/M16 Mag, (3) Pistol Mag - Color: Multicam", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aRSuB47YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A0SX06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B003A0WIAM", "title": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (Black)", "description": "The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "text": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (Black) The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41koGdGE1oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A0WIAM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003A0Y7HO", "title": "South Bend Crab Caliper (Yellow)", "description": "Accurately measures the legal size of many different types of crabs. Designed with more measuring gauges than any other caliper. Both male and female crab diagrams are molded into the unit for easy reference. Covers all Northwestern and Pacific crabs including Red Rock, Alaska King, and Dungeness. Made in the U.S.A. from glass-filled ABS plastic--will not expand or contract in hot or cold temperatures. Hi-visibility yellow color. Packaged individually in poly bag with header.", "text": "South Bend Crab Caliper (Yellow) Accurately measures the legal size of many different types of crabs. Designed with more measuring gauges than any other caliper. Both male and female crab diagrams are molded into the unit for easy reference. Covers all Northwestern and Pacific crabs including Red Rock, Alaska King, and Dungeness. Made in the U.S.A. from glass-filled ABS plastic--will not expand or contract in hot or cold temperatures. Hi-visibility yellow color. Packaged individually in poly bag with header.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dvBUVS6gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A0Y7HO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "South Bend", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing"]], "price": 5.32}}
{"item_id": "B003A1MURC", "title": "SteriPen Adventurer Opti Water Purifier", "description": "The smallest, lightest SteriPEN, the AdventurerOpti Water Purifier uses a revolutionary optical eye to sense the water. The patent-pending technology provides safe use and the standard insulating sleeve around the UV lamp allows purification in even the coldest of waters. Fast, light, easy and effective, the AdventurerOpti provides the ultimate protection from waterborne illnesses. Giardia, cryptosporidium, bacteria and viruses are all destroyed in seconds-by SteriPEN UV light. The UV lamp provides up to 8,000 one-liter treatments. UV purification works as the ultraviolet energy emitted by the light is absorbed by the cells of the microbe, preventing cell enzymes from 'reading' its DNA. Without intact DNA, microbes can't reproduce to make you sick. The process is simple but effective, destroying over 99.9 percent of harmful microorganisms. Great for camping, hiking and backpacking.Easy to use 1 button operation; LED light quickly indicates when ready to purify, then place the pen like lamp in clear water and stir until indicator light turns green..Dirty water should be pre filtered until clear prior to treatment..The UV lamp provides up to 8,000 one liter treatments..Device works with containers with minimum 1.75 in. diameter opening (ie Nalgene wide-mouth bottles)..Low power indicator lets you know when batteries need replacing..Automatic shut off when treatment is complete..Includes black neoprene case with belt loop and 2 non-rechargeable CR123 batteries and instructions..Size: 15.5cm. (6.1in.) x 3.3cm. (1.5in.) x 2.2cm. (1.0in.).Weight: 103g/3.6 oz. with batteries.", "text": "SteriPen Adventurer Opti Water Purifier The smallest, lightest SteriPEN, the AdventurerOpti Water Purifier uses a revolutionary optical eye to sense the water. The patent-pending technology provides safe use and the standard insulating sleeve around the UV lamp allows purification in even the coldest of waters. Fast, light, easy and effective, the AdventurerOpti provides the ultimate protection from waterborne illnesses. Giardia, cryptosporidium, bacteria and viruses are all destroyed in seconds-by SteriPEN UV light. The UV lamp provides up to 8,000 one-liter treatments. UV purification works as the ultraviolet energy emitted by the light is absorbed by the cells of the microbe, preventing cell enzymes from 'reading' its DNA. Without intact DNA, microbes can't reproduce to make you sick. The process is simple but effective, destroying over 99.9 percent of harmful microorganisms. Great for camping, hiking and backpacking.Easy to use 1 button operation; LED light quickly indicates when ready to purify, then place the pen like lamp in clear water and stir until indicator light turns green..Dirty water should be pre filtered until clear prior to treatment..The UV lamp provides up to 8,000 one liter treatments..Device works with containers with minimum 1.75 in. diameter opening (ie Nalgene wide-mouth bottles)..Low power indicator lets you know when batteries need replacing..Automatic shut off when treatment is complete..Includes black neoprene case with belt loop and 2 non-rechargeable CR123 batteries and instructions..Size: 15.5cm. (6.1in.) x 3.3cm. (1.5in.) x 2.2cm. (1.0in.).Weight: 103g/3.6 oz. with batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YNi2hf1UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A1MURC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B003A1U3LW", "title": "SteriPen Emergency Online Pack", "description": "FEATURES of the SteriPen Emergency Online Pack Can provide access to safe drinking water in a time of crisis The Emergency purifies 200 half-liter servings of water on just one set of AA lithium batteries Designed to fit perfectly into commercial water bottles Forms a seal that lets you keep the water in the original bottle for purification Insert the Emergency securely into the mouth of the bottle, turn it upside down, and you have safe drinking water in less than a minute It is recommended using only well-known brand name Lithium or Nickel Metal Hydride batteries. Alkaline batteries of any kind are not recommended SPECIFICATIONS of the SteriPen Emergency Online Pack Weight: 5.7 oz / 162 g with lithium batteries Dimension (L x W x H): 7.6\" x 1.5\" x 1.5\" Battery: Uses four AA lithium batteries (not included) Battery Life : 200 treatments (16 oz./0.5L) UV Lamp Life: 3,000 treatments", "text": "SteriPen Emergency Online Pack FEATURES of the SteriPen Emergency Online Pack Can provide access to safe drinking water in a time of crisis The Emergency purifies 200 half-liter servings of water on just one set of AA lithium batteries Designed to fit perfectly into commercial water bottles Forms a seal that lets you keep the water in the original bottle for purification Insert the Emergency securely into the mouth of the bottle, turn it upside down, and you have safe drinking water in less than a minute It is recommended using only well-known brand name Lithium or Nickel Metal Hydride batteries. Alkaline batteries of any kind are not recommended SPECIFICATIONS of the SteriPen Emergency Online Pack Weight: 5.7 oz / 162 g with lithium batteries Dimension (L x W x H): 7.6\" x 1.5\" x 1.5\" Battery: Uses four AA lithium batteries (not included) Battery Life : 200 treatments (16 oz./0.5L) UV Lamp Life: 3,000 treatments", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iEcSzIgBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003A1U3LW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 43.94}}
