{"item_id": "B003AFOV84", "title": "KMC Z7 6/7/8-Speed 116L Shimano HG Bicycle Chain", "description": "Compatible with Shimano HG systems. For 7 speed and casual 8 speed use. Bushingless construction. Inner and outer plate chamfering. Width: 7.3mm. 340g.", "text": "KMC Z7 6/7/8-Speed 116L Shimano HG Bicycle Chain Compatible with Shimano HG systems. For 7 speed and casual 8 speed use. Bushingless construction. Inner and outer plate chamfering. Width: 7.3mm. 340g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hVm5HpPgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AFOV84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KMC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 12.42}}
{"item_id": "B003AH8JU8", "title": "Melissa & Doug Sunny Patch Cinco Starfish Ball", "description": "Let the good times roll with this shiny red, starfish-spangled ball. The ball is ideal for early throwing and catching activities with its \"just right\" size and light weight!", "text": "Melissa & Doug Sunny Patch Cinco Starfish Ball Let the good times roll with this shiny red, starfish-spangled ball. The ball is ideal for early throwing and catching activities with its \"just right\" size and light weight!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51M768TcDZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AH8JU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Melissa &amp; Doug", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Balls", "Playground Balls"]], "price": 5.26}}
{"item_id": "B003AJEM8E", "title": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net", "description": "Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "text": "Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net Turn your hammock into an insect-proof fortress with the Eagles Nest Outfitters Guardian Bug Net. Ideal for backpackers and campers who frequent buggy terrain, this net easily attaches to your ENO hammock and keeps the buzzing critters at bay while you catch some Z's. The light, packable design is more compact than a tent, and the whole package compresses in the attached compression stuff sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412fC90FIJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AJEM8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagles Nest Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B003AJQ5OS", "title": "5.11 #80008 Poly/Cotton TacLite Pro Vest", "description": "The 5.11 Tactical Vest has been a hit with law enforcement, military and security forces since it was first introduced. Part of our original law enforcement collaboration effort to design top quality, functional clothing; the Tactical Tactical vests serves many needs. With two easily accessible hidden compartments for handgun and accessory storage using our Back-Up-Belt System , these tactical vests easily conceals and carries what you need, when you need it. It’s not always practical to carry a handgun in a holster on your belt. The 5.11 Tactical Vests is a great alternative to conventional concealed carry methods. Designed for quick access, the Tactical Vests have two concealed carry compartments which can accommodate a compact handgun and associated gear. Our tactical vests are used by law enforcement professionals all over the world on security and special operation details and is the tactical vests of choice for dignitary protection in the Middle East.", "text": "5.11 #80008 Poly/Cotton TacLite Pro Vest The 5.11 Tactical Vest has been a hit with law enforcement, military and security forces since it was first introduced. Part of our original law enforcement collaboration effort to design top quality, functional clothing; the Tactical Tactical vests serves many needs. With two easily accessible hidden compartments for handgun and accessory storage using our Back-Up-Belt System , these tactical vests easily conceals and carries what you need, when you need it. It’s not always practical to carry a handgun in a holster on your belt. The 5.11 Tactical Vests is a great alternative to conventional concealed carry methods. Designed for quick access, the Tactical Vests have two concealed carry compartments which can accommodate a compact handgun and associated gear. Our tactical vests are used by law enforcement professionals all over the world on security and special operation details and is the tactical vests of choice for dignitary protection in the Middle East.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nykiuiqjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AJQ5OS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
