{"item_id": "B003AO5MW4", "title": "Rivers Edge Fishing Rod Fly Swatter", "description": "The Rivers Edge Fishing Rod Fly Swatter g raphite shaft, EVA foam handle with trigger grip make smashing those pesky flies as easy as fishin'! Great item to keep handy on your porch or deck. Fun and practical.", "text": "Rivers Edge Fishing Rod Fly Swatter The Rivers Edge Fishing Rod Fly Swatter g raphite shaft, EVA foam handle with trigger grip make smashing those pesky flies as easy as fishin'! Great item to keep handy on your porch or deck. Fun and practical.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21VFXDZRr8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AO5MW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "River&#39;s Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing"]], "price": 9.26}}
{"item_id": "B003AP5CRS", "title": "Magpul Airsoft PTS AFG Foregrip BLK", "description": "Low-profile forward grip/hand stop takes advantage of natural body mechanics to give the shooter more precise control, faster pointing, and less operator fatigue. The Magpul AFG (Angled Fore-Grip) positions the support hand close to the centerline of the bore for maximum recoil control to aid in fast, accurate follow-up shots. Provides a consistent reference point for finding the correct hand position quickly when mounting the weapon under stress", "text": "Magpul Airsoft PTS AFG Foregrip BLK Low-profile forward grip/hand stop takes advantage of natural body mechanics to give the shooter more precise control, faster pointing, and less operator fatigue. The Magpul AFG (Angled Fore-Grip) positions the support hand close to the centerline of the bore for maximum recoil control to aid in fast, accurate follow-up shots. Provides a consistent reference point for finding the correct hand position quickly when mounting the weapon under stress", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cIjepSvJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AP5CRS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]]}}
