{"item_id": "B003AQKQAA", "title": "Vortex Viper PST 6-24x50 Rifle PST-624S1-M", "description": "Vortex Viper PST 6-24x50 Riflescope W/ EBR-1 MOA Reticle - Black Matte - PST-624S1-A. PST-624S1-A. Rifle Scopes. This Vortex Viper PST (Precision Shooting Tactical) Riflescope is built to deliver consistently repeatable accuracy at extreme distances in harsh environments and stressful situations. Available in six models with a choice of reticles in either the first or second focal plane, the Viper PSTs are built on one-piece 30mm tubes machined from aircraftgrade 6061 T6 aluminum for optimum strength and rigidity, and ample room for extreme range elevation adjustment.", "text": "Vortex Viper PST 6-24x50 Rifle PST-624S1-M Vortex Viper PST 6-24x50 Riflescope W/ EBR-1 MOA Reticle - Black Matte - PST-624S1-A. PST-624S1-A. Rifle Scopes. This Vortex Viper PST (Precision Shooting Tactical) Riflescope is built to deliver consistently repeatable accuracy at extreme distances in harsh environments and stressful situations. Available in six models with a choice of reticles in either the first or second focal plane, the Viper PSTs are built on one-piece 30mm tubes machined from aircraftgrade 6061 T6 aluminum for optimum strength and rigidity, and ample room for extreme range elevation adjustment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iKoL6Ph7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AQKQAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 749.0}}
{"item_id": "B003AQOZHA", "title": "Vortex Viper PST 1-4x24mm Riflescopes", "description": "30mm Main Tube. Second Focal Plane Reticle. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum. One-Piece Tube. Waterproof and Fogproof.", "text": "Vortex Viper PST 1-4x24mm Riflescopes 30mm Main Tube. Second Focal Plane Reticle. Aircraft-Grade Aluminum. One-Piece Tube. Waterproof and Fogproof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u0dxgV8vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AQOZHA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003AST7N0", "title": "Primos Double Cottontail Call", "description": "This call houses two metal reeds thus giving it the name double. The special reeds are designed to give this call a high-pitched and raspy sound unique to the predator calling world. You can use this call as the primary call or sometimes it works best to save it for later in the set to jar loose those educated critters. Works on all predators including coyotes, bobcats, fox, etc.", "text": "Primos Double Cottontail Call This call houses two metal reeds thus giving it the name double. The special reeds are designed to give this call a high-pitched and raspy sound unique to the predator calling world. You can use this call as the primary call or sometimes it works best to save it for later in the set to jar loose those educated critters. Works on all predators including coyotes, bobcats, fox, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qWPokDmbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AST7N0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Predator"]], "price": 15.21}}
{"item_id": "B003ASV2ZQ", "title": "Kuat 2 Bike Sherpa Rack ( 1.25-2-Inch)", "description": "So you spent more on your dream bike than you did on your first car. We agree, it was well worth every dime and it deserves the best when it comes to transportation. The Sherpa will get you and your bikes there in style. You can easily mount almost any sized bike by the wheels so you won't have to worry about scratching that sweet paint job or fanaggling bungee cords around a frame that looks like a geometry quiz. It's light enough to take on and off the car with ease but it looks so good that you'll want to leave it on all year. Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Kuat 2 Bike Sherpa Rack ( 1.25-2-Inch) So you spent more on your dream bike than you did on your first car. We agree, it was well worth every dime and it deserves the best when it comes to transportation. The Sherpa will get you and your bikes there in style. You can easily mount almost any sized bike by the wheels so you won't have to worry about scratching that sweet paint job or fanaggling bungee cords around a frame that looks like a geometry quiz. It's light enough to take on and off the car with ease but it looks so good that you'll want to leave it on all year. Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cBMLSN66L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ASV2ZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ASX6G4", "title": "Kuat 2 Bike NV Rack", "description": "The NV comes fully equipped with front and rear tire ratchet system, hitch lock and integrated bike cable lock. \"Holy smokes, a built in repair stand for pre-ride prep, post-ride, clean up, or looking smart.\" Decked out with Kuat's hand tight cam system, this rack is available for 2\" and 1.25\" receivers. After equipping your ride with NV, you will need to haul more people due to increased friendship as a result of coolness. Simple storage with lever action pivot for rapid, folding, tilting, and hiding. Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Kuat 2 Bike NV Rack The NV comes fully equipped with front and rear tire ratchet system, hitch lock and integrated bike cable lock. \"Holy smokes, a built in repair stand for pre-ride prep, post-ride, clean up, or looking smart.\" Decked out with Kuat's hand tight cam system, this rack is available for 2\" and 1.25\" receivers. After equipping your ride with NV, you will need to haul more people due to increased friendship as a result of coolness. Simple storage with lever action pivot for rapid, folding, tilting, and hiding. Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZIl4rVF9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ASX6G4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003AT51CK", "title": "FURY Tactical Shield Concealed Weapons Permit Badge", "description": "The Fury line of badges and shields from Joy Enterprises are crafted with German steel and duty strength pin backs. The full color emblem in the center features crossed American Flags with the inscription \"Liberty & Justice for All\".", "text": "FURY Tactical Shield Concealed Weapons Permit Badge The Fury line of badges and shields from Joy Enterprises are crafted with German steel and duty strength pin backs. The full color emblem in the center features crossed American Flags with the inscription \"Liberty & Justice for All\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YmqtwtSiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003AT51CK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.42}}
