{"item_id": "B003B8JYPU", "title": "Shimano Tourney 7Spd 14-28T Freewheel", "description": "7 Speed hyper-glide freewheel from Shimano, ideal replacement for mountain and hybrid bikes. A reliable 7-speed screw-on freewheel. Hyper-glide gear sprockets ensure accurate and smooth shifting every time - up or down the gears. Compact and convenient unit for 7-speed gear systems. Multi-freewheel design means the whole unit is simply screwed onto a compatible hub. Suitable for a wide range of bikes. For use with mountain and hybrid bikes.", "text": "Shimano Tourney 7Spd 14-28T Freewheel 7 Speed hyper-glide freewheel from Shimano, ideal replacement for mountain and hybrid bikes. A reliable 7-speed screw-on freewheel. Hyper-glide gear sprockets ensure accurate and smooth shifting every time - up or down the gears. Compact and convenient unit for 7-speed gear systems. Multi-freewheel design means the whole unit is simply screwed onto a compatible hub. Suitable for a wide range of bikes. For use with mountain and hybrid bikes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WC304eAAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003B8JYPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]], "price": 15.29}}
{"item_id": "B003BAAJVG", "title": "ProMag Ruger 10/22 Carbine Tactical Barrel Band, Black", "description": "The PM185 Ruger 10/22* Carbine Tactical Barrel Band is CNC machined from T6 aircraft grade aluminum, and type-III hard anodized. The barrel band is reversible. The Tactical Barrel band places a short MIL-STD 1913 Picatinny rail or a fixed loop to accept up to 1.25\" slings on the left or right side of the carbine. The Tactical Barrel Band also places a short MIL-STD 1913 Picatinny rail on the bottom of the band. The rails are handy for mounting a fore-grip, flashlight, laser, or bipod to your Ruger 10-22* carbine. No permanent modification is required, all mounting hardware is included.", "text": "ProMag Ruger 10/22 Carbine Tactical Barrel Band, Black The PM185 Ruger 10/22* Carbine Tactical Barrel Band is CNC machined from T6 aircraft grade aluminum, and type-III hard anodized. The barrel band is reversible. The Tactical Barrel band places a short MIL-STD 1913 Picatinny rail or a fixed loop to accept up to 1.25\" slings on the left or right side of the carbine. The Tactical Barrel Band also places a short MIL-STD 1913 Picatinny rail on the bottom of the band. The rails are handy for mounting a fore-grip, flashlight, laser, or bipod to your Ruger 10-22* carbine. No permanent modification is required, all mounting hardware is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412VhL6nUtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BAAJVG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 30.5}}
{"item_id": "B003BACMU2", "title": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Bayonet Lug Accessory Rail", "description": "The ProMag Ar-15 bayonet lug accessory rail attaches to a standard mil-spec bayonet lug and provides a picatinny rail for mounting accessories such as lights and lasers. There are also slots on either side of the rail to attach a sling. The Mil-Spec sling swivel must be removed to install this rail. Constructed of aluminum and finished in matte black.", "text": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Bayonet Lug Accessory Rail The ProMag Ar-15 bayonet lug accessory rail attaches to a standard mil-spec bayonet lug and provides a picatinny rail for mounting accessories such as lights and lasers. There are also slots on either side of the rail to attach a sling. The Mil-Spec sling swivel must be removed to install this rail. Constructed of aluminum and finished in matte black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fpApLvUkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BACMU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BAEL42", "title": "ProMag Ruger 10/22 Extended Tactical Magazine Release, Black", "description": "The PM235 Archangel 10/22 Extended Magazine Release allows the shooter to rapidly change magazines (standard and high capacity). The military styled release compliments all 10/22 variants. The magazine release is molded from a modern chemical resistant Mil-Spec polymer. The polymer is impact resistant thanks to a scientifically formulated compound providing superior strength. No permanent modification required. Installation is simple, follow owner manual for assembly and disassembly.", "text": "ProMag Ruger 10/22 Extended Tactical Magazine Release, Black The PM235 Archangel 10/22 Extended Magazine Release allows the shooter to rapidly change magazines (standard and high capacity). The military styled release compliments all 10/22 variants. The magazine release is molded from a modern chemical resistant Mil-Spec polymer. The polymer is impact resistant thanks to a scientifically formulated compound providing superior strength. No permanent modification required. Installation is simple, follow owner manual for assembly and disassembly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FEaBJ3vGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BAEL42.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 14.99}}
