{"item_id": "B003BC7ND6", "title": "Sigma BC 1909 STS Triple Wireless Bicycle Speedometer", "description": "Dynamic, sporty, and elegant, the Sigma BC 1909 STS triple wireless bike computer is ideal for fitness-minded cyclists who place a high emphasis on measuring heart rate and calories burned. The BC 1909 STS, which is adjustable to fit two wheel sizes, displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The computer even offers a programmable trip section counter, a roadbook that lets you create a back-and-forth itinerary.The BC 1909 STS's HR functions include ECG-precise measurements of your actual, average, and maximum heart rate, along with a zone alarm that tells you when you're exceeding or falling below your target heart rate. In the process, the computer keeps track of your calories burned thus far. The BC 1909 STS also includes a number of time-specific functions, including a countdown timer that's perfect for racing against the clock; a stopwatch that keeps you sharp on intervals; a display for elapsed and total riding time (the latter is only available after your ride); and a time-keeping clock. And serious cyclists can opt to use the cadence functions (current and average), which help you ride efficiently both on the road and in the woods. You can also turn off the cadence functions while riding.The BC 1909 STS is versatile in other ways, too, with the ability to automatically recognize a second bike. That means you can gauge the total distance and ride time of either or both bikes, a handy option for couples or friends who train together. Other features include a temperature display, seven language settings, a backlight, a battery status display, and a backup function that preserves your settings and info even when the battery dies. The PC-compatible BC 1909 STS is also available in a wired version.", "text": "Sigma BC 1909 STS Triple Wireless Bicycle Speedometer Dynamic, sporty, and elegant, the Sigma BC 1909 STS triple wireless bike computer is ideal for fitness-minded cyclists who place a high emphasis on measuring heart rate and calories burned. The BC 1909 STS, which is adjustable to fit two wheel sizes, displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter is only available after your ride). The computer even offers a programmable trip section counter, a roadbook that lets you create a back-and-forth itinerary.The BC 1909 STS's HR functions include ECG-precise measurements of your actual, average, and maximum heart rate, along with a zone alarm that tells you when you're exceeding or falling below your target heart rate. In the process, the computer keeps track of your calories burned thus far. The BC 1909 STS also includes a number of time-specific functions, including a countdown timer that's perfect for racing against the clock; a stopwatch that keeps you sharp on intervals; a display for elapsed and total riding time (the latter is only available after your ride); and a time-keeping clock. And serious cyclists can opt to use the cadence functions (current and average), which help you ride efficiently both on the road and in the woods. You can also turn off the cadence functions while riding.The BC 1909 STS is versatile in other ways, too, with the ability to automatically recognize a second bike. That means you can gauge the total distance and ride time of either or both bikes, a handy option for couples or friends who train together. Other features include a temperature display, seven language settings, a backlight, a battery status display, and a backup function that preserves your settings and info even when the battery dies. The PC-compatible BC 1909 STS is also available in a wired version.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oyWqK%2BlCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC7ND6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 125.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BC8IW6", "title": "Avenir Fixed Gear Cog 18 Tooth (1/2 X (1/8)", "description": "DONT MISS OUT ON THIS EXCELLENT PRODUCT", "text": "Avenir Fixed Gear Cog 18 Tooth (1/2 X (1/8) DONT MISS OUT ON THIS EXCELLENT PRODUCT", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sq8HBlHtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC8IW6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Michelin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]], "price": 5.89}}
{"item_id": "B003BC8K8S", "title": "Avenir Fixed Gear Lock Ring", "description": "Tight fitting, hard metal and labeled for which direction to tighten. Avenir is a great brand. Not high end, but fits right and is plenty good enough for a fixed gear buildup.", "text": "Avenir Fixed Gear Lock Ring Tight fitting, hard metal and labeled for which direction to tighten. Avenir is a great brand. Not high end, but fits right and is plenty good enough for a fixed gear buildup.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WTf3iZWpL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC8K8S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Michelin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BC9PHS", "title": "CatEye Commuter Bicycle Computer - CC-COM10W", "description": "The first ever cycle computer specifically designed for commuters and those who ride for transportation, errands, and utility. Critical trip details make the CatEye Commuter Computer the best option for making your rides stress-free. Estimated Time of Arrival, clock, temperature, and back light help you stay on schedule. The new larger font size makes it even easier to read trip details with a quick glance. Carbon Offset information is included along with standard computer features so you will not only feel better from the ride, youll feel better about the ride. The Carbon Offsets are computed by using a fixed 150g/km or 240g/mile figure and multiplying it by the distance ridden. It tracks it in real time and shows day to day, week to week, month to month and total carbon saved. The innovative FlexTight bracket mounts quickly, securely and without tools to virtually any handlebar or stem. The tool-free speed sensor mounts effortlessly to any standard fork.", "text": "CatEye Commuter Bicycle Computer - CC-COM10W The first ever cycle computer specifically designed for commuters and those who ride for transportation, errands, and utility. Critical trip details make the CatEye Commuter Computer the best option for making your rides stress-free. Estimated Time of Arrival, clock, temperature, and back light help you stay on schedule. The new larger font size makes it even easier to read trip details with a quick glance. Carbon Offset information is included along with standard computer features so you will not only feel better from the ride, youll feel better about the ride. The Carbon Offsets are computed by using a fixed 150g/km or 240g/mile figure and multiplying it by the distance ridden. It tracks it in real time and shows day to day, week to week, month to month and total carbon saved. The innovative FlexTight bracket mounts quickly, securely and without tools to virtually any handlebar or stem. The tool-free speed sensor mounts effortlessly to any standard fork.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vnPxtMgvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC9PHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B003BC9PJ6", "title": "Sigma BC 509 Bicycle Speedometer", "description": "Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the entry-level Sigma BC 509 wired bicycle speedometer. The speedometer displays such info as your current speed, trip distance, and total distance, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. The PC-compatible speedometer also includes a clock, a scan mode, and a large display. Other features include automatic start/stop, self-explaining icons, and a water-resistant housing.", "text": "Sigma BC 509 Bicycle Speedometer Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the entry-level Sigma BC 509 wired bicycle speedometer. The speedometer displays such info as your current speed, trip distance, and total distance, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. The PC-compatible speedometer also includes a clock, a scan mode, and a large display. Other features include automatic start/stop, self-explaining icons, and a water-resistant housing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Vun0R0-3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC9PJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BC9Q54", "title": "Origin8 ATB V-Brake Caliper Set - Front and Rear with Levers, Silver", "description": "Forged alloy constructionFront dual-spring tension adjustmentKit includes calipers, levers, cables and housing", "text": "Origin8 ATB V-Brake Caliper Set - Front and Rear with Levers, Silver Forged alloy constructionFront dual-spring tension adjustmentKit includes calipers, levers, cables and housing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SvU1-dVfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BC9Q54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Origin 8", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Levers"]], "price": 38.5}}
{"item_id": "B003BCG9EK", "title": "Sigma BC 1009 Bicycle Speedometer", "description": "Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the Sigma BC 1009 wired bicycle speedometer. Also available in a wireless model, the speedometer displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter isn't shown while riding). The speedometer even includes a built-in clock, so you can check the current time or see how long you've been riding.Other features include a low battery warning (all presets and total values remain intact when the battery is changed), a PC link that allows you to plug your data into training software for analysis, and a water-resistant housing.", "text": "Sigma BC 1009 Bicycle Speedometer Learn just how fast you're cycling on commutes or training rides with the Sigma BC 1009 wired bicycle speedometer. Also available in a wireless model, the speedometer displays your current speed, average speed, and maximum speed, so you'll have a good idea whether you're the tortoise or the hare on the bike trail. You can also compare your current and average speed on the same screen, or check the trip distance and total distance (the latter isn't shown while riding). The speedometer even includes a built-in clock, so you can check the current time or see how long you've been riding.Other features include a low battery warning (all presets and total values remain intact when the battery is changed), a PC link that allows you to plug your data into training software for analysis, and a water-resistant housing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51K2TpUJxbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BCG9EK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 22.38}}
