{"item_id": "B003BE78DY", "title": "Michelin Avenir Alloy Pletscher Style Rear Rack", "description": "Michelin avenir alloy pletscher style rear rack universal fit with classic styling and spring wire top. Fold flat for easy storage when not on bike. Holds up to 15-Pounds.", "text": "Michelin Avenir Alloy Pletscher Style Rear Rack Michelin avenir alloy pletscher style rear rack universal fit with classic styling and spring wire top. Fold flat for easy storage when not on bike. Holds up to 15-Pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hyXx7s6bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BE78DY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B003BEP3RW", "title": "Hollywood Racks Recumbent 2-Bike Hitch Rack", "description": "The SportRider 2-Bike Hitch Rack from Hollywood makes it fast and simple to unload and load up to two recumbent bikes. With a padded universal top clamp and adjustable wheel holders, the SportRider 2 is able to carry two recumbent bikes with wheelbases of up to 74-inches, weighing up to 50 pounds per bike. Easy to use, simply drop your bike into the wheel holders and slide the self-locking clamp onto the frame to secure the bike. The rack holds bikes 18 inches apart to prevent any bike-on-bike damage and includes Velcro wheel straps, and two \"small wheel\" adapters for additional security. The SportRider 2 folds easily when not in use, and fits both 1-1/4 and 2-inch hitches securely with a \"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin-bolt. Backed by a limited lifetime warranty from Hollywood Racks, carrying your bikes safely and securely has never been easier.Specifications:Capacity: Two Bikes/100 pounds (maximum of 50 pounds per bike)Hitch Size: fits both 1-1/4 and 2-inch hitchesMaximum bike wheel base: 74 inchesIncludes 2 \"small wheel\" adapters\"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin-bolt, 1/2-13Padded universal top clampAdjustable wheel holdersVelcro wheel strapsSelf-locking press leverSpace between bikes: 18 inchesWeight: 33 poundsFolds easily when not in useManufacturer WarrantyLimited lifetimeWarranty Specifications:Hollywood Racks will warranty its car racks and accessories during the time that an original retail purchaser owns the product subject to the exclusions and limitations of this warranty. Hollywood Racks will remedy defects in materials and workmanship by repairing or replacing (at its option) a defective part without charge for labor or parts. Hollywood Racks may elect (at its option) to issue a refund equal to the purchase price paid for the product.This warranty does not cover problems caused by normal wear and tear including (but not limited to) weather, scratches, dents, rust, accidents, unlawful vehicle operation, misuse, abuse, neglect, theft, unauthorized modifications, or unauthorized repair. No warranty is given for defects resulting in incorrect assembly, incorrect installation onto the vehicle, installation on a \"no fit\" vehicle, incorrect attachment of bicycles onto the rack, or overloading of the rack's weight restrictions. This warranty terminates if the original retail purchaser transfers the product to any other person.", "text": "Hollywood Racks Recumbent 2-Bike Hitch Rack The SportRider 2-Bike Hitch Rack from Hollywood makes it fast and simple to unload and load up to two recumbent bikes. With a padded universal top clamp and adjustable wheel holders, the SportRider 2 is able to carry two recumbent bikes with wheelbases of up to 74-inches, weighing up to 50 pounds per bike. Easy to use, simply drop your bike into the wheel holders and slide the self-locking clamp onto the frame to secure the bike. The rack holds bikes 18 inches apart to prevent any bike-on-bike damage and includes Velcro wheel straps, and two \"small wheel\" adapters for additional security. The SportRider 2 folds easily when not in use, and fits both 1-1/4 and 2-inch hitches securely with a \"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin-bolt. Backed by a limited lifetime warranty from Hollywood Racks, carrying your bikes safely and securely has never been easier.Specifications:Capacity: Two Bikes/100 pounds (maximum of 50 pounds per bike)Hitch Size: fits both 1-1/4 and 2-inch hitchesMaximum bike wheel base: 74 inchesIncludes 2 \"small wheel\" adapters\"No Wobble\" threaded hitch pin-bolt, 1/2-13Padded universal top clampAdjustable wheel holdersVelcro wheel strapsSelf-locking press leverSpace between bikes: 18 inchesWeight: 33 poundsFolds easily when not in useManufacturer WarrantyLimited lifetimeWarranty Specifications:Hollywood Racks will warranty its car racks and accessories during the time that an original retail purchaser owns the product subject to the exclusions and limitations of this warranty. Hollywood Racks will remedy defects in materials and workmanship by repairing or replacing (at its option) a defective part without charge for labor or parts. Hollywood Racks may elect (at its option) to issue a refund equal to the purchase price paid for the product.This warranty does not cover problems caused by normal wear and tear including (but not limited to) weather, scratches, dents, rust, accidents, unlawful vehicle operation, misuse, abuse, neglect, theft, unauthorized modifications, or unauthorized repair. No warranty is given for defects resulting in incorrect assembly, incorrect installation onto the vehicle, installation on a \"no fit\" vehicle, incorrect attachment of bicycles onto the rack, or overloading of the rack's weight restrictions. This warranty terminates if the original retail purchaser transfers the product to any other person.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aYOtjCikL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BEP3RW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywood Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 287.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BF8NSM", "title": "Wilson Titanium Ball (18 Ball Pack)", "description": "Boost your distance on every shot with this 18-pack of Wilson Titanium golf balls. Each two-piece Titanium ball features a titanium core that allows for maximum energy transfer on impact, helping the ball travel far and straight every time. The balls also include sturdy Surlyn covers.", "text": "Wilson Titanium Ball (18 Ball Pack) Boost your distance on every shot with this 18-pack of Wilson Titanium golf balls. Each two-piece Titanium ball features a titanium core that allows for maximum energy transfer on impact, helping the ball travel far and straight every time. The balls also include sturdy Surlyn covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415Uv6rjzNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BF8NSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Distance Balls"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B003BFFQ4Q", "title": "Osprey HydraForm Reservoir (2L)", "description": "Our customized reservoirs have a rigid handle/spine that stabilizes the water load and makes it easier to slide the reservoir into your pack. They also feature a 80mm Rapidfill cap, a wide-mouth that makes filling the reservoir with ice and cleaning easy; an ergonomic handle that makes water fill up even easier; a convenient magnetic connection to the sternum buckle for easy hose management, and an articulated pivoting on/off bite valve that eliminates unexpected leaks.", "text": "Osprey HydraForm Reservoir (2L) Our customized reservoirs have a rigid handle/spine that stabilizes the water load and makes it easier to slide the reservoir into your pack. They also feature a 80mm Rapidfill cap, a wide-mouth that makes filling the reservoir with ice and cleaning easy; an ergonomic handle that makes water fill up even easier; a convenient magnetic connection to the sternum buckle for easy hose management, and an articulated pivoting on/off bite valve that eliminates unexpected leaks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aq1L7gbkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BFFQ4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BFS8WI", "title": "Lifefactory 22-Ounce Beverage Bottle, Midnight Blue", "description": "Lifefactory creates innovative, non-toxic products that make it easy to lead a healthy and eco-conscious lifestyle. They fuse modern sensible composition, and exceptional utility to produce a glass beverage bottle that is free of known harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalate, PVC, and polycarbonate. All materials are FDA approved. The unique patent pending silicone sleeve is free of plastics, 100% non-toxic, provides a great gripping surface and helps prevent breakage. The benefit of using a glass beverage bottle is that there is no risk of chemicals leaching into your drink and no metallic taste. The widemouth bottle design makes it easy to add ice, citrus slices, tea bags, etc. Beverage bottles are easy clean and dishwasher safe (the glass bottle and silicone sleeve can also be washed together in the dishwasher). Each bottle holds 22 ounces (650ml) and measures 3.125 x 3.125 x 10.5 inches. Available in 6 great colors!", "text": "Lifefactory 22-Ounce Beverage Bottle, Midnight Blue Lifefactory creates innovative, non-toxic products that make it easy to lead a healthy and eco-conscious lifestyle. They fuse modern sensible composition, and exceptional utility to produce a glass beverage bottle that is free of known harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalate, PVC, and polycarbonate. All materials are FDA approved. The unique patent pending silicone sleeve is free of plastics, 100% non-toxic, provides a great gripping surface and helps prevent breakage. The benefit of using a glass beverage bottle is that there is no risk of chemicals leaching into your drink and no metallic taste. The widemouth bottle design makes it easy to add ice, citrus slices, tea bags, etc. Beverage bottles are easy clean and dishwasher safe (the glass bottle and silicone sleeve can also be washed together in the dishwasher). Each bottle holds 22 ounces (650ml) and measures 3.125 x 3.125 x 10.5 inches. Available in 6 great colors!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416VK%2B8yIZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BFS8WI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifefactory", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 23.0}}
