{"item_id": "B003BHKH0M", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Eclipse Table", "description": "Is there anything worse than getting your head stuck in a revolving door' Yes, and it's spilling hot chocolate all over your campsite poker winnings. The Alps Mountaineering Eclipse Table safely stores four beverages on its lower deck, so your board games, turkey sandwiches, or newly acquired cash-piles don't get doused.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Eclipse Table Is there anything worse than getting your head stuck in a revolving door' Yes, and it's spilling hot chocolate all over your campsite poker winnings. The Alps Mountaineering Eclipse Table safely stores four beverages on its lower deck, so your board games, turkey sandwiches, or newly acquired cash-piles don't get doused.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CkDah0d0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BHKH0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 31.47}}
{"item_id": "B003BHR9KI", "title": "Blackhawk Men's 1700 Shirt", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s breathable, easy-care 1700 Shirt is the perfect casual performance shirt for any occasion. Made with a durable, quick-drying material and UV protection (-UPF30+), this shirt provides lightweight comfort while on or off duty. Features: Wrinkle-resistant and moisture-wicking treatments; left side-entry, zippered chest pocket; left patch chest pocket; pleated back yoke for ease of motion; notched collar; lower side slits for easy pant-pocket access; pattern options include: Flat weave small plaid (Brown or Gray), flat weave solid (Slate or Clay), and a Textured medium plaid to discreetly conceal weapon (Blue or Green).", "text": "Blackhawk Men's 1700 Shirt BLACKHAWK!'s breathable, easy-care 1700 Shirt is the perfect casual performance shirt for any occasion. Made with a durable, quick-drying material and UV protection (-UPF30+), this shirt provides lightweight comfort while on or off duty. Features: Wrinkle-resistant and moisture-wicking treatments; left side-entry, zippered chest pocket; left patch chest pocket; pleated back yoke for ease of motion; notched collar; lower side slits for easy pant-pocket access; pattern options include: Flat weave small plaid (Brown or Gray), flat weave solid (Slate or Clay), and a Textured medium plaid to discreetly conceal weapon (Blue or Green).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CuDEqgN7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BHR9KI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BIP38M", "title": "Trademark Rite Edge Stainless Steel Military Combo Set Knife,Green", "description": "These excellent knives are durable and make an excellent addition to any hunter or outdoor enthusiasts’ collection. Their contoured grip handle features digital camo and the blades are black coated carbon steel with drop points. The fixed blade knife is a full tang combat knife and the folding knife features an easy open thumb stud and lock blade design.", "text": "Trademark Rite Edge Stainless Steel Military Combo Set Knife,Green These excellent knives are durable and make an excellent addition to any hunter or outdoor enthusiasts’ collection. Their contoured grip handle features digital camo and the blades are black coated carbon steel with drop points. The fixed blade knife is a full tang combat knife and the folding knife features an easy open thumb stud and lock blade design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f6bw%2BpVNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BIP38M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.49}}
{"item_id": "B003BIT004", "title": "Sea to Summit Reactor Extreme Thermolite Liner", "description": "Increases sleeping bag performance by up to 25F (14C) with super-insulating 110g/m Thermolite fabric. Thermolite is a hollow core fiber that provides extraordinary warmth for its weight and remains extremely breathable. Spacious design allows for a comfortable night's sleep, even when the mercury plummets. Perfect for extending the season of your sleeping bag.", "text": "Sea to Summit Reactor Extreme Thermolite Liner Increases sleeping bag performance by up to 25F (14C) with super-insulating 110g/m Thermolite fabric. Thermolite is a hollow core fiber that provides extraordinary warmth for its weight and remains extremely breathable. Spacious design allows for a comfortable night's sleep, even when the mercury plummets. Perfect for extending the season of your sleeping bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g3%2BFkD6cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BIT004.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 66.95}}
{"item_id": "B003BJ9Q9I", "title": "M-Wave 3-Piece Traveller Pannier", "description": "Easily haul clothes, cycling gear, food, and other essentials while cycling with the M-Wave three-piece traveling pannier system. Ideal for road trips, the pannier system features large main compartments, a series of mesh pockets, and a host of other spots for stashing your stuff. The bags are also tough, with 600D tear-proof construction to ensure a long-lasting performance. And once you arrive at your destination, the panniers convert into a backpack using the handy backpack straps. Other details include rain-protecting zippers and reflective stripes. Each side bag measures 14 by 13 by 7 inches while the top bag measures 13.5 by 18 by 8.5 inches.", "text": "M-Wave 3-Piece Traveller Pannier Easily haul clothes, cycling gear, food, and other essentials while cycling with the M-Wave three-piece traveling pannier system. Ideal for road trips, the pannier system features large main compartments, a series of mesh pockets, and a host of other spots for stashing your stuff. The bags are also tough, with 600D tear-proof construction to ensure a long-lasting performance. And once you arrive at your destination, the panniers convert into a backpack using the handy backpack straps. Other details include rain-protecting zippers and reflective stripes. Each side bag measures 14 by 13 by 7 inches while the top bag measures 13.5 by 18 by 8.5 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CXGvX6V6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BJ9Q9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "M-Wave", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BJ9QB6", "title": "M-Wave Pannier Rain Cover", "description": "The M-Wave Pannier Rain Cover is universal and protects your Pannier from the elements.", "text": "M-Wave Pannier Rain Cover The M-Wave Pannier Rain Cover is universal and protects your Pannier from the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51f6sb8rk-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BJ9QB6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 13.93}}
{"item_id": "B003BJRY8I", "title": "\"No Glove\" Benders", "description": "\"No Glove\" Benders. Can't get comfortable with a glove or tab? The \"No Glove\" Bender protects your fingers, while completely eliminating the need for a glove or tab! It's form fit for reliable, constant pressure and a smooth release. Just slip it on over the string, and presto- you're all set. It's form fit for reliable, constant pressure and a smooth release. Order yours today! No Glove Benders", "text": "\"No Glove\" Benders \"No Glove\" Benders. Can't get comfortable with a glove or tab? The \"No Glove\" Bender protects your fingers, while completely eliminating the need for a glove or tab! It's form fit for reliable, constant pressure and a smooth release. Just slip it on over the string, and presto- you're all set. It's form fit for reliable, constant pressure and a smooth release. Order yours today! No Glove Benders", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MWpeLni3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BJRY8I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]], "price": 4.69}}
{"item_id": "B003BK5X1W", "title": "Aimpoint Flip Cap Rear", "description": "This rear lens cover flip-up cap is compatible with Aimpoint's comp sights, and comes in a stealthy black color.WarrantyAimpoint products include limited manufacturer's warranties of two years for professional or competitive use, and ten years for personal or recreational use.About AimpointIn 1974, a small group of Swedish entrepreneurs started exploring ways to improve shooting accuracy, with the deceptively simple goal of creating a sighting technology that would allow shooters to acquire their target quickly, and hit moving targets in all weather and lighting conditions consistently and accurately. The result of their efforts, the now ubiquitous red dot sight, would eventually revolutionize the shooting and hunting industry.The company's first commercial sight product, the Aimpoint Electronic, was introduced in 1975, and quickly developed a reputation as one of the fastest way to aim a firearm. The Aimpoint red dot sight has continued to evolve over the past 35 years by working closely with experienced hunters, marksmen and military weapon experts, and there are more than one million Aimpoint red dot sights in use worldwide today.", "text": "Aimpoint Flip Cap Rear This rear lens cover flip-up cap is compatible with Aimpoint's comp sights, and comes in a stealthy black color.WarrantyAimpoint products include limited manufacturer's warranties of two years for professional or competitive use, and ten years for personal or recreational use.About AimpointIn 1974, a small group of Swedish entrepreneurs started exploring ways to improve shooting accuracy, with the deceptively simple goal of creating a sighting technology that would allow shooters to acquire their target quickly, and hit moving targets in all weather and lighting conditions consistently and accurately. The result of their efforts, the now ubiquitous red dot sight, would eventually revolutionize the shooting and hunting industry.The company's first commercial sight product, the Aimpoint Electronic, was introduced in 1975, and quickly developed a reputation as one of the fastest way to aim a firearm. The Aimpoint red dot sight has continued to evolve over the past 35 years by working closely with experienced hunters, marksmen and military weapon experts, and there are more than one million Aimpoint red dot sights in use worldwide today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31U-KxwQc1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BK5X1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimPoint", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOS3U", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's AmFIB Cycling Tight", "description": "Keep your legs warm with the Pearl Izumi men's AmFIB cycling tights. When the mercury starts heading south, just pull these tights on, and you'll be ready to ride in any weather. ELITE softshell fabric provides wind and water protection ELITE thermal fleece fabric panels are warm and provide excellent moisture transfer Elite 3D chamois is designed for longer riding in colder weather to keep you comfortable without chaffing, rubbing or hot spots 8\" lower leg zipper makes it easy to get into and out of the tights Reflective accents for safety", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's AmFIB Cycling Tight Keep your legs warm with the Pearl Izumi men's AmFIB cycling tights. When the mercury starts heading south, just pull these tights on, and you'll be ready to ride in any weather. ELITE softshell fabric provides wind and water protection ELITE thermal fleece fabric panels are warm and provide excellent moisture transfer Elite 3D chamois is designed for longer riding in colder weather to keep you comfortable without chaffing, rubbing or hot spots 8\" lower leg zipper makes it easy to get into and out of the tights Reflective accents for safety", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417UdkFkQnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOS3U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]], "price": 75.0}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOSBW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Cycling Tight", "description": "ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth ELITE 3D Chamois Constructed leg articulation for a full range of motion 8'' lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage Contoured leg opening provides additional coverage at top of shoe Silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place 360 degree reflectivity", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Cycling Tight ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth ELITE 3D Chamois Constructed leg articulation for a full range of motion 8'' lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage Contoured leg opening provides additional coverage at top of shoe Silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place 360 degree reflectivity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rezHvnyrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOSBW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOSJO", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Thermal Tight", "description": "Featuring a new design, the Pearl Izumi Elite Thermafleece cycling tight also offers wind-resistant softshell panels at the front and rear quad area and at the knees, increasing its effective temperature range. The Elite Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth, while the Elite Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue.Leg articulation is constructed for a dynamic range of motion. Other features include an 8-inch lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage, silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place, and 360-degree reflectivity. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Elite Thermal Tight Featuring a new design, the Pearl Izumi Elite Thermafleece cycling tight also offers wind-resistant softshell panels at the front and rear quad area and at the knees, increasing its effective temperature range. The Elite Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth, while the Elite Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue.Leg articulation is constructed for a dynamic range of motion. Other features include an 8-inch lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage, silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place, and 360-degree reflectivity. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413d5XJzj-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOSJO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOSLC", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Barrier WxB Pant", "description": "SELECT Barrier WxB Pant The perfect companion to our SELECT and QUEST Barrier WxB Jackets, we utilize the same 2.5-layer stretch fabric and semi-form fit to accommodate layering and range of motion. SELECT Barrier WxB 2.5 Layer fabric sets the benchmark in waterproof-breathable protection Waterproof, fully taped internal seams 15” lower leg zipper with adjustable storm flap Elasticized hem and cuffs 360 degree reflectivity", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Barrier WxB Pant SELECT Barrier WxB Pant The perfect companion to our SELECT and QUEST Barrier WxB Jackets, we utilize the same 2.5-layer stretch fabric and semi-form fit to accommodate layering and range of motion. SELECT Barrier WxB 2.5 Layer fabric sets the benchmark in waterproof-breathable protection Waterproof, fully taped internal seams 15” lower leg zipper with adjustable storm flap Elasticized hem and cuffs 360 degree reflectivity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q-wqism0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOSLC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOT5W", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Ltd Jersey", "description": "SELECT Thermal Jersey Packing the best warmth-to-value in the line, the SELECT Thermal Jersey is great worn alone for the chilly days or as the core thermal piece in a layering system. SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Full-length zipper for venting Contoured, shaped sleeve hem adds warmth Three back pockets with hidden sweat-proof pocket Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Ltd Jersey SELECT Thermal Jersey Packing the best warmth-to-value in the line, the SELECT Thermal Jersey is great worn alone for the chilly days or as the core thermal piece in a layering system. SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Full-length zipper for venting Contoured, shaped sleeve hem adds warmth Three back pockets with hidden sweat-proof pocket Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zR6rP23yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOT5W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOTAM", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Select Barrier Wxb Jacket", "description": "The Pearl Izumi Select Barrier WxB Jacket will keep you warm, dry, and comfortable, even when the weather's headed towards unbearably bad. The Select Barrier features a polyurethane/polyester blend that provides a good balance of breathability with water impermeability. Two hand pockets and a single rear pocket offer plenty of storage options, and a detachable hood makes the Barrier ideal for commuting and touring as well.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Select Barrier Wxb Jacket The Pearl Izumi Select Barrier WxB Jacket will keep you warm, dry, and comfortable, even when the weather's headed towards unbearably bad. The Select Barrier features a polyurethane/polyester blend that provides a good balance of breathability with water impermeability. Two hand pockets and a single rear pocket offer plenty of storage options, and a detachable hood makes the Barrier ideal for commuting and touring as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419l6Yi5AfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOTAM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOTEI", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elt Thermal Barrier Jacket", "description": "The Elite Thermal Barrier Jacket from Pearl Izumi is designed to allow you to stay in saddle longer and get back in the saddle earlier to extend your riding season. The jacket features two-layer construction that provides warmth plus wind protection with strategically placed Barrier fabric panels over a thermal fleece body. The Barrier panels provide protection where you need it most while the thermal fleece provides insulation without sacrificing breathability. The jacket is equipped with a full-length internal draft flap with a zipper garage to seal in warmth and defend against wind chill. An elasticized hem keeps the jacket in place. Additional details include two zippered back pockets for essentials and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Built to last, the Barrier Jacket carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Semi form fittedTwo-layer constructionElite Barrier fabric panelsThermal Fleece bodyFull length internal draft flap with zipper garageElasticized hemTwo zippered back pocketsReflective elementsLifetime warranty", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elt Thermal Barrier Jacket The Elite Thermal Barrier Jacket from Pearl Izumi is designed to allow you to stay in saddle longer and get back in the saddle earlier to extend your riding season. The jacket features two-layer construction that provides warmth plus wind protection with strategically placed Barrier fabric panels over a thermal fleece body. The Barrier panels provide protection where you need it most while the thermal fleece provides insulation without sacrificing breathability. The jacket is equipped with a full-length internal draft flap with a zipper garage to seal in warmth and defend against wind chill. An elasticized hem keeps the jacket in place. Additional details include two zippered back pockets for essentials and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Built to last, the Barrier Jacket carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Semi form fittedTwo-layer constructionElite Barrier fabric panelsThermal Fleece bodyFull length internal draft flap with zipper garageElasticized hemTwo zippered back pocketsReflective elementsLifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xCrSgSnTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOTEI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 84.0}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOTX4", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Jacket", "description": "Fall/Winter 2013. Windproof and water resistant, Pearl Izumi's Elite Barrier jacket for men provides lightweight, packable protection for a wide range of weather conditions. The semi form-fitting jacket is constructed of Elite-Barrier fabric for top-notch weather protection. It's lightweight and extremely packable, with Direct-Vent panels for superior ventilation and a full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage to seal in warmth. A contoured, shaped sleeve hem adds warmth, and it offers elasticized hem and cuffs. Other features include a single back Velcro pocket, a collar that tapers from front to back for biking ergonomics, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Jacket Fall/Winter 2013. Windproof and water resistant, Pearl Izumi's Elite Barrier jacket for men provides lightweight, packable protection for a wide range of weather conditions. The semi form-fitting jacket is constructed of Elite-Barrier fabric for top-notch weather protection. It's lightweight and extremely packable, with Direct-Vent panels for superior ventilation and a full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage to seal in warmth. A contoured, shaped sleeve hem adds warmth, and it offers elasticized hem and cuffs. Other features include a single back Velcro pocket, a collar that tapers from front to back for biking ergonomics, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kXY8u9p8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOTX4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOU74", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Vest", "description": "The ELITE Barrier Vest delivers comfortable, breathable, lightweight and packable protection for a wide range of weather conditions. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct-Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and armholes One back Hook and Loop pocket Collar tapers from front to back for on-bike ergonomics Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Vest The ELITE Barrier Vest delivers comfortable, breathable, lightweight and packable protection for a wide range of weather conditions. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct-Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and armholes One back Hook and Loop pocket Collar tapers from front to back for on-bike ergonomics Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vWkK3CRLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOU74.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOXB2", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Infinity Knicker,Black/ White,Small", "description": "", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Infinity Knicker,Black/ White,Small", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yT2sdJysL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOXB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "P", "Pearl iZUMi"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOXG2", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Tight", "description": "The versatile Select Tights from Pearl Izumi are constructed with high performance Select Transfer fabric that combines compressive support with moisture management. Designed for running or riding, the tights provide support with an internal brief that is also detailed with a convenient key pocket. The form fitting tights have eight-inch lower leg zippers so that they are easy to take on and off, with zipper garages for a seamless appearance. The elasticized waistband and flat stretch drawcord offer an adjustable fit, while reflective elements provide low-light visibility. Built to last, the Select Tights carry a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Select Transfer fabric for compression and moisture transferElasticized waistbandFlat-stretch drawcord8-inch lower leg zipper with zipper garageOne internal key pocketInternal brief for supportForm fitting28-inch inseam in size mediumReflective elements", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Tight The versatile Select Tights from Pearl Izumi are constructed with high performance Select Transfer fabric that combines compressive support with moisture management. Designed for running or riding, the tights provide support with an internal brief that is also detailed with a convenient key pocket. The form fitting tights have eight-inch lower leg zippers so that they are easy to take on and off, with zipper garages for a seamless appearance. The elasticized waistband and flat stretch drawcord offer an adjustable fit, while reflective elements provide low-light visibility. Built to last, the Select Tights carry a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Select Transfer fabric for compression and moisture transferElasticized waistbandFlat-stretch drawcord8-inch lower leg zipper with zipper garageOne internal key pocketInternal brief for supportForm fitting28-inch inseam in size mediumReflective elements", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415NCOIEmCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOXG2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOXIU", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Run Select Thermal Tight", "description": "Designed for maximum warmth and comfort for cold weather activities, the Pearl Izumi men's Select Thermal tight sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer with its thermal fleece. It offers an elasticized waistband with flat stretch drawcord for unrestricted belly breathing and an internal brief for added support and comfort. Other features include a single internal key pocket, 8-inch lower leg zipper with zipper garage, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Run Select Thermal Tight Designed for maximum warmth and comfort for cold weather activities, the Pearl Izumi men's Select Thermal tight sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer with its thermal fleece. It offers an elasticized waistband with flat stretch drawcord for unrestricted belly breathing and an internal brief for added support and comfort. Other features include a single internal key pocket, 8-inch lower leg zipper with zipper garage, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SPpF7oD6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOXIU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOXK8", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Select Long Thermal Tight", "description": "The SELECT Thermal Tight is designed for maximum warmth and comfort for cold weather running. SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer. 8\" lower leg zipper with zipper garage.", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Men's Select Long Thermal Tight The SELECT Thermal Tight is designed for maximum warmth and comfort for cold weather running. SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer. 8\" lower leg zipper with zipper garage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b3E7nblIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOXK8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLOZ1A", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Barrier Long Sleeve Base", "description": "P.R.O. Barrier fabric provides optimal wind protection and water–resistance P.R.O. Transfer fabric with Minerale provides optimal moisture transfer, dry time and odor absorbance Plush elastic waistband Elasticized hem Form Fit 7” inseam [size medium]Main body: 52% Minerale polyester 48% polyesterFront panel: 100% polyester", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Barrier Long Sleeve Base P.R.O. Barrier fabric provides optimal wind protection and water–resistance P.R.O. Transfer fabric with Minerale provides optimal moisture transfer, dry time and odor absorbance Plush elastic waistband Elasticized hem Form Fit 7” inseam [size medium]Main body: 52% Minerale polyester 48% polyesterFront panel: 100% polyester", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cODM3SrSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLOZ1A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
