{"item_id": "B003BLP00K", "title": "Pearl Izumi Pro Leader Arm Warmer", "description": "P.R.O. Leader Arm Warmer The P.R.O. Leader Arm Warmer combines wind tunnel knowledge, P.R.O. Aero panels and P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric to make this the fastest arm warmer available. P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric provides optimal warmth in mild conditions P.R.O. Transfer Aero panels provide aerodynamics and UV sun protection Anatomic left and right arm–specific fit Plush, elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip Silicone on exterior of upper arm grabs your jersey Reflective logos for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Pro Leader Arm Warmer P.R.O. Leader Arm Warmer The P.R.O. Leader Arm Warmer combines wind tunnel knowledge, P.R.O. Aero panels and P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric to make this the fastest arm warmer available. P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric provides optimal warmth in mild conditions P.R.O. Transfer Aero panels provide aerodynamics and UV sun protection Anatomic left and right arm–specific fit Plush, elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip Silicone on exterior of upper arm grabs your jersey Reflective logos for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4119iySEMBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLP00K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Armwarmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLP03W", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Arm Warmer", "description": "Pearl Izumi's thermal arm warmer provides great coverage with an innovative upper arm and wrist scallop. The P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth, while the nylon face sheds the weather and a polyester back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. The upper arm scallop interfaces perfectly with jerseys for full coverage. Other features include a plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip and reflective logos for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Arm Warmer Pearl Izumi's thermal arm warmer provides great coverage with an innovative upper arm and wrist scallop. The P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth, while the nylon face sheds the weather and a polyester back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. The upper arm scallop interfaces perfectly with jerseys for full coverage. Other features include a plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip and reflective logos for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BK09we%2BlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLP03W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Armwarmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLP0A0", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Knee Warmer", "description": "The new Pearl Izumi Thermal Knee Warmers have a refined anatomic fit to eliminate bunching through your full range of motion. P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth. Nylon face sheds the weather while a poly back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. Anatomic construction eliminates bunching through your full range of motion. Plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip. Reflective logos for low-light visibility. 58% nylon / 27% polyester / 15% spandex. Size Chart: Length (garment Measurement) XS 23\", Sm 24\", Md 25\", Lg 26\", XL 27\". Thigh (circumfrence) XS 19.5\", Sm 21.25, Md 23\", Lg 24.75\", XL 26.5\". Calf (circumfrence) XS 13.25\", Sm 14\", Md 14.75\", Lg 15.5\", XL 16.5\".", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Knee Warmer The new Pearl Izumi Thermal Knee Warmers have a refined anatomic fit to eliminate bunching through your full range of motion. P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth. Nylon face sheds the weather while a poly back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. Anatomic construction eliminates bunching through your full range of motion. Plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip. Reflective logos for low-light visibility. 58% nylon / 27% polyester / 15% spandex. Size Chart: Length (garment Measurement) XS 23\", Sm 24\", Md 25\", Lg 26\", XL 27\". Thigh (circumfrence) XS 19.5\", Sm 21.25, Md 23\", Lg 24.75\", XL 26.5\". Calf (circumfrence) XS 13.25\", Sm 14\", Md 14.75\", Lg 15.5\", XL 16.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cGlfMZxtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLP0A0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Leg Warmers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BLP0DC", "title": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Leg Warmer", "description": "Pearl Izumi's thermal leg warmer offers full coverage with an anatomic fit to eliminate bunching through your full range of motion. The P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth, while the nylon face sheds the weather and a polyester back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. Other features include a plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip and reflective logos for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl iZUMi Thermal Leg Warmer Pearl Izumi's thermal leg warmer offers full coverage with an anatomic fit to eliminate bunching through your full range of motion. The P.R.O. Thermal Fleece panels provide optimal warmth, while the nylon face sheds the weather and a polyester back holds warmth and is soft next to skin. Other features include a plush elasticized gripper for a soft, smooth grip and reflective logos for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H%2BIw30V2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BLP0DC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Tights & Leggings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BM5LWQ", "title": "Champ Scorpion Stinger Tri-Lok for FootJoy Golf Shoes", "description": "Go ahead, make the change! What are you waiting for? Join in with Tour players who choose the #1 Golf Spike Brand on Tour. The durable CHAMP Stinger spike provides outstanding traction with superior comfort. The revolutionary Visible Wear Indicator lets you know when it's time to change. Go ahead, change over to the world's best golf spike. Fits all FootJoy (or any) golf shoes that utilize a FastTwist fastener system. Get more info http://champspikes.com/products/golf/", "text": "Champ Scorpion Stinger Tri-Lok for FootJoy Golf Shoes Go ahead, make the change! What are you waiting for? Join in with Tour players who choose the #1 Golf Spike Brand on Tour. The durable CHAMP Stinger spike provides outstanding traction with superior comfort. The revolutionary Visible Wear Indicator lets you know when it's time to change. Go ahead, change over to the world's best golf spike. Fits all FootJoy (or any) golf shoes that utilize a FastTwist fastener system. Get more info http://champspikes.com/products/golf/", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SKgM-pHbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BM5LWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Spikes"]], "price": 8.2}}
{"item_id": "B003BM98UC", "title": "NIKE Tech Xtreme Regular White/White-Chall Red-Black Glove", "description": "NIKE GG0343-106-XXL Tech Xtreme Reg LH gloves have lightweight, engineered textile in the back of the hand that offers excellent range of motion and breathability. For a soft, supple feel on every shot, these gloves have utilized Cabretta leather in the entire palm, index finger and thumb. The strategically placed Lycra spandex in the finger and thumb gusset, combined with perforated fingers, provides flexibility and breathability, while the angled tab design gives a superior ergonomic fit. The customized fitting system for these gloves, allows a comfortable fit for all hand shapes and sizes. Color: White/White-Chall Red-Black.", "text": "NIKE Tech Xtreme Regular White/White-Chall Red-Black Glove NIKE GG0343-106-XXL Tech Xtreme Reg LH gloves have lightweight, engineered textile in the back of the hand that offers excellent range of motion and breathability. For a soft, supple feel on every shot, these gloves have utilized Cabretta leather in the entire palm, index finger and thumb. The strategically placed Lycra spandex in the finger and thumb gusset, combined with perforated fingers, provides flexibility and breathability, while the angled tab design gives a superior ergonomic fit. The customized fitting system for these gloves, allows a comfortable fit for all hand shapes and sizes. Color: White/White-Chall Red-Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sI2RrEDUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BM98UC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Gloves"]], "price": 8.04}}
{"item_id": "B003BMDI9E", "title": "Innovations Air Chuck Elite Inflator", "description": "You don't need to carry the kitchen sink with you when you ride, but you should at least have a tube and CO2 cartridges. Genuine Innovations' Air Chuck Elite is a compact CO2 inflator with a lifetime warranty to keep you rolling for the long haul. The inflator features easy push-to-inflate single-hand technology. It's constructed from all metal alloy and is backed with a lifetime warranty. It is compatible with 12gm, 16gm, and 25gm threaded cartridges and the Big Air. The simple design is fully controllable so that you don't over inflate your tires. It works with both Presta and Schrader valves. It weighs only 17 grams and fits easily into your saddle bag, leaving plenty of room for tubes and a patch kit. The Genuine Innovations Air Chuck Elite Inflator comes with one 16gm and one 20gm cartridge.", "text": "Innovations Air Chuck Elite Inflator You don't need to carry the kitchen sink with you when you ride, but you should at least have a tube and CO2 cartridges. Genuine Innovations' Air Chuck Elite is a compact CO2 inflator with a lifetime warranty to keep you rolling for the long haul. The inflator features easy push-to-inflate single-hand technology. It's constructed from all metal alloy and is backed with a lifetime warranty. It is compatible with 12gm, 16gm, and 25gm threaded cartridges and the Big Air. The simple design is fully controllable so that you don't over inflate your tires. It works with both Presta and Schrader valves. It weighs only 17 grams and fits easily into your saddle bag, leaving plenty of room for tubes and a patch kit. The Genuine Innovations Air Chuck Elite Inflator comes with one 16gm and one 20gm cartridge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tbi5Et8pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BMDI9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Genuine Innovations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 17.17}}
{"item_id": "B003BMDIHG", "title": "AK47 STOCK BUTT PAD RECOIL PAD", "description": "Butt Pad Fits original wood stock AK47 Adds 1\" to the length of rifle. Prevents slip and softens recoil.", "text": "AK47 STOCK BUTT PAD RECOIL PAD Butt Pad Fits original wood stock AK47 Adds 1\" to the length of rifle. Prevents slip and softens recoil.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hKh8zjrgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BMDIHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "COI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B003BMHPK2", "title": "Mares Rash Guard Top - Mens Short Sleeve for Scuba , Snorkeling, and Water Sports", "description": "Ideal as under suit or by itself for superior UV protection Characterized by the Mares Trilastic look, the rash guard is built with a material that provides UV protection of 50 plus. The seams, sewn with flatlock stitching, wont leave marks on your skin. Perfect to wear underneath your suit and ideal for all kinds of water sports.", "text": "Mares Rash Guard Top - Mens Short Sleeve for Scuba , Snorkeling, and Water Sports Ideal as under suit or by itself for superior UV protection Characterized by the Mares Trilastic look, the rash guard is built with a material that provides UV protection of 50 plus. The seams, sewn with flatlock stitching, wont leave marks on your skin. Perfect to wear underneath your suit and ideal for all kinds of water sports.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YPabUNNjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BMHPK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Rash Guards"]]}}
