{"item_id": "B003BT2EYW", "title": "Spyder Paintball Slate Classic 0.50 Caliber Paintballs (1000 Round Box)", "description": "Featuring vibrant yellow shells and bright yellow fill, the Slate Classic 0.50 caliber paintballs are perfect for recreational play. These quality Spyder paintballs are designed to be perfectly round and consistent in size for a reliable performance on the field.Please Note: The Slate Classic Paintballs are not compatible with 0.68 or 0.43 caliber markers.", "text": "Spyder Paintball Slate Classic 0.50 Caliber Paintballs (1000 Round Box) Featuring vibrant yellow shells and bright yellow fill, the Slate Classic 0.50 caliber paintballs are perfect for recreational play. These quality Spyder paintballs are designed to be perfectly round and consistent in size for a reliable performance on the field.Please Note: The Slate Classic Paintballs are not compatible with 0.68 or 0.43 caliber markers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eyVu%2B2r1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BT2EYW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Paintballs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BT2TAQ", "title": "Sportcraft Soft Tip Sky Dart", "description": "Sportcraft Soft Tip Sky Dart comes with four large weighted darts with soft rounded tips and two scoring rings. The weighted tips are designed to ensure that the dart remains upright after every toss, for easy and accurate scoring.The soft tip sky arts come in a convenient mesh carry and storage bag. The length is 7.75-Inch, height is 12.0-Inch and Width is 7.75-Inch.", "text": "Sportcraft Soft Tip Sky Dart Sportcraft Soft Tip Sky Dart comes with four large weighted darts with soft rounded tips and two scoring rings. The weighted tips are designed to ensure that the dart remains upright after every toss, for easy and accurate scoring.The soft tip sky arts come in a convenient mesh carry and storage bag. The length is 7.75-Inch, height is 12.0-Inch and Width is 7.75-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TRD739f6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BT2TAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003BU8IW8", "title": "ENO Twilights LED Camp Lights", "description": "Stars on a cloudy night; a backcountry disco; Christmas in your hammock. Twilights are not one, but 23 lights to show you the way. This string of ultra-bright LED Lights is powered b 2 AA batteries and keeps the party going long after the fire is out.", "text": "ENO Twilights LED Camp Lights Stars on a cloudy night; a backcountry disco; Christmas in your hammock. Twilights are not one, but 23 lights to show you the way. This string of ultra-bright LED Lights is powered b 2 AA batteries and keeps the party going long after the fire is out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qoccL1WNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BU8IW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 19.95}}
