{"item_id": "B003BYYPYO", "title": "Serfas FP-35 Floor Pump, Black", "description": "This pump has it all: 160 PSI capabilities, oversized gauge, and Dual Head valve. With a lifetime warranty, this will be the last pump you ever buy.", "text": "Serfas FP-35 Floor Pump, Black This pump has it all: 160 PSI capabilities, oversized gauge, and Dual Head valve. With a lifetime warranty, this will be the last pump you ever buy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312c1vKtOwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BYYPYO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 22.44}}
{"item_id": "B003BZC3R4", "title": "Fury Tactical Ez-Grip Handcuff Key Pen Clip (Black)", "description": "The Fury Tactical #15403 EZ Grip Tactical Handcuff Key has a clip that allows it to be carried in a shirt pocket just like you'd carry a pen. With an overall length of 3-5/8\", its textured carbon fiber body provides a sure, positive grip even with wet, cold, or gloved hands. The stainless steel tip insures that you'll be using this key cuff and uncuff bad guys for years to come. Fury Tactical means Practical Tactical.", "text": "Fury Tactical Ez-Grip Handcuff Key Pen Clip (Black) The Fury Tactical #15403 EZ Grip Tactical Handcuff Key has a clip that allows it to be carried in a shirt pocket just like you'd carry a pen. With an overall length of 3-5/8\", its textured carbon fiber body provides a sure, positive grip even with wet, cold, or gloved hands. The stainless steel tip insures that you'll be using this key cuff and uncuff bad guys for years to come. Fury Tactical means Practical Tactical.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oAzRIC3wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BZC3R4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 3.88}}
{"item_id": "B003BZS0FI", "title": "Ventura Gel Cycling Gloves - Medium", "description": "The comfortable and cool Ventura Gel Cycling Gloves offer movement and protection, for an enjoyable bike ride. These bike gloves feature a half finger design with non-slip knobs for added confidence. They are made with breathable, washable Lycra to keep you cool. The Ventura Cycling Gloves are suitable for grip shift use and are available in red, blue, and gray.", "text": "Ventura Gel Cycling Gloves - Medium The comfortable and cool Ventura Gel Cycling Gloves offer movement and protection, for an enjoyable bike ride. These bike gloves feature a half finger design with non-slip knobs for added confidence. They are made with breathable, washable Lycra to keep you cool. The Ventura Cycling Gloves are suitable for grip shift use and are available in red, blue, and gray.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B4QyL-6rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003BZS0FI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
