{"item_id": "B003C2ETI2", "title": "Cyper Wp Insecticide -1 Lb. Control Spray", "description": "Controls Ants, spiders, scorpions, roaches, occasional invaders,A gallon of finished of Demon WP mix usually completely covers a 2,000 to 2,500 sq. foot home.Non-volatile and stable in sunlight. It is authorized by the USDA for use in inedible product areas in federally inspected meat, poultry and egg processing plants.Can not be shipped to NY or CT", "text": "Cyper Wp Insecticide -1 Lb. Control Spray Controls Ants, spiders, scorpions, roaches, occasional invaders,A gallon of finished of Demon WP mix usually completely covers a 2,000 to 2,500 sq. foot home.Non-volatile and stable in sunlight. It is authorized by the USDA for use in inedible product areas in federally inspected meat, poultry and egg processing plants.Can not be shipped to NY or CT", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wNgRKzkzL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C2ETI2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Control Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 34.15}}
