{"item_id": "B003C4Z7W2", "title": "Guide Gear 10x10' Teepee Tent", "description": "Guide Gear Teepee Tents are the \"peak\" of camping comfort! You SAVE BIG BUCKS! Ageless design meets contemporary convenience. Teepee-style Tents from Guide Gear may look old fashioned, but don't be fooled! A host of modern features make these shelters much more than bare-bones slumber shacks! Constructed of heavy-duty, lightweight, waterproofed polyester to brilliantly weather wind and precipitation. Timeless peak-style construction affords loads and loads of interior room. Covered mesh windows allow air to circulate, keeping your camp fresh. Bring the Guide Gear Teepee Tent on your next outdoor adventure, and you'll sleep soundly knowing you saved BIG money! Peak Performance: Waterproof 190-denier polyester shell is lightweight and rugged; Weatherproofed windows; Sewn-in polyethylene floor; Center steel pole support adds durability; Factory-sealed seams for superior hold and seal; 1,000 mm polyurethane coating for excellent weather resistance; Includes stakes and black / silver pull-through guy ropes (prevents tripping in the dark!); Rain-protected ventilation in peak and multiple ground air vents for breathable comfort; Comfortable, lots of space. 6'6\" center height. Sleeps 6 people. Weighs 14 lbs., 13 ozs. Imported. Order Yours Today! Guide Gear 10x10' Teepee Tent", "text": "Guide Gear 10x10' Teepee Tent Guide Gear Teepee Tents are the \"peak\" of camping comfort! You SAVE BIG BUCKS! Ageless design meets contemporary convenience. Teepee-style Tents from Guide Gear may look old fashioned, but don't be fooled! A host of modern features make these shelters much more than bare-bones slumber shacks! Constructed of heavy-duty, lightweight, waterproofed polyester to brilliantly weather wind and precipitation. Timeless peak-style construction affords loads and loads of interior room. Covered mesh windows allow air to circulate, keeping your camp fresh. Bring the Guide Gear Teepee Tent on your next outdoor adventure, and you'll sleep soundly knowing you saved BIG money! Peak Performance: Waterproof 190-denier polyester shell is lightweight and rugged; Weatherproofed windows; Sewn-in polyethylene floor; Center steel pole support adds durability; Factory-sealed seams for superior hold and seal; 1,000 mm polyurethane coating for excellent weather resistance; Includes stakes and black / silver pull-through guy ropes (prevents tripping in the dark!); Rain-protected ventilation in peak and multiple ground air vents for breathable comfort; Comfortable, lots of space. 6'6\" center height. Sleeps 6 people. Weighs 14 lbs., 13 ozs. Imported. Order Yours Today! Guide Gear 10x10' Teepee Tent", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51e6fTUaAjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C4Z7W2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B003C5UR4Y", "title": "Elite Survival Pocket Holster for Ruger LCR and 2-Inch J Frame Revolvers, Black", "description": "The Elite Pocket Holster for Rugger LCR and 2 inch J Frame Revolvers is constructed of Toughtek non-slip material with soft nylon lining. Holds firearm in the upright position. Helps protect weapon from pocket debris. Non-slip outer layer helps keep holster in place while gun is removed. Fits 2 inch J Frame Revolvers; Rugger LCR.", "text": "Elite Survival Pocket Holster for Ruger LCR and 2-Inch J Frame Revolvers, Black The Elite Pocket Holster for Rugger LCR and 2 inch J Frame Revolvers is constructed of Toughtek non-slip material with soft nylon lining. Holds firearm in the upright position. Helps protect weapon from pocket debris. Non-slip outer layer helps keep holster in place while gun is removed. Fits 2 inch J Frame Revolvers; Rugger LCR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SFHPc0x-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C5UR4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite Survival", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.01}}
{"item_id": "B003C6FDEW", "title": "Blackhawk AR15 Cheek Pad", "description": "The AR-15 Cheek Pad is height adjustable for proper eye relief and has a cut-out which allows it to be used on fixed AR-15/M-16 rifles.", "text": "Blackhawk AR15 Cheek Pad The AR-15 Cheek Pad is height adjustable for proper eye relief and has a cut-out which allows it to be used on fixed AR-15/M-16 rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oiuKc2xQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C6FDEW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 18.49}}
{"item_id": "B003C6HGW4", "title": "Harbinger Eco Fit Exercise Mat", "description": "Perform your downward dog in full comfort with the Harbinger Eco Fit exercise mat. The mat is made of 100-percent recyclable and biodegradable Eco-foam, a closed-cell foam that's 25 percent lighter than traditional foam but still provides the same level of thick cushioning. This makes the mat easier to carry and store without sacrificing performance. The mat is made even more comfortable through its dual layer design, which increases the cushioning to 3/8 inches without sacrificing traction. In fact, the second layer has nonskid traction ridges to prevent slipping, while the innovative top layer includes a patterned surface that lessens the chance of injury and strains. Warm and comfortable to the touch, the Eco Fit mat also wipes down quickly for easy cleaning. The mat--which includes a removable strap for storage and transport--measures 72 by 24 inches.About Harbinger FitnessHarbinger is a leading fitness accessory company in the United States. Based in Napa, California, Harbinger develops, produces, and sells a full range of innovative, high-performance fitness products designed to enhance even the most rigorous training regimen. Harbinger's products include fitness gloves and training gear such as balls, jump ropes, resistance cables, balance trainers, and mats, which are distributed via sporting goods retailers, fitness specialty retailers, and fitness clubs.This mat includes a bottom layer with nonskid traction ridges.", "text": "Harbinger Eco Fit Exercise Mat Perform your downward dog in full comfort with the Harbinger Eco Fit exercise mat. The mat is made of 100-percent recyclable and biodegradable Eco-foam, a closed-cell foam that's 25 percent lighter than traditional foam but still provides the same level of thick cushioning. This makes the mat easier to carry and store without sacrificing performance. The mat is made even more comfortable through its dual layer design, which increases the cushioning to 3/8 inches without sacrificing traction. In fact, the second layer has nonskid traction ridges to prevent slipping, while the innovative top layer includes a patterned surface that lessens the chance of injury and strains. Warm and comfortable to the touch, the Eco Fit mat also wipes down quickly for easy cleaning. The mat--which includes a removable strap for storage and transport--measures 72 by 24 inches.About Harbinger FitnessHarbinger is a leading fitness accessory company in the United States. Based in Napa, California, Harbinger develops, produces, and sells a full range of innovative, high-performance fitness products designed to enhance even the most rigorous training regimen. Harbinger's products include fitness gloves and training gear such as balls, jump ropes, resistance cables, balance trainers, and mats, which are distributed via sporting goods retailers, fitness specialty retailers, and fitness clubs.This mat includes a bottom layer with nonskid traction ridges.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z%2BWpW-w0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C6HGW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harbinger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 40.49}}
{"item_id": "B003C6M6K6", "title": "Allen Company Fitted Crossbow Case with 2 Pockets", "description": "Premier grade fitted endura crossbow case, arrow pocket, accessory pocket, bow compartment has rigid support for additional protection, built-in sling, black/APG. Comes in a pack of 4.", "text": "Allen Company Fitted Crossbow Case with 2 Pockets Premier grade fitted endura crossbow case, arrow pocket, accessory pocket, bow compartment has rigid support for additional protection, built-in sling, black/APG. Comes in a pack of 4.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z2CSmUn7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C6M6K6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 50.53}}
{"item_id": "B003C6O2V2", "title": "Excalibur C2 Crank Cocking Aid", "description": "Excalibur's C2 crank is the perfect solution for hunters who have difficulty drawing high poundage crossbows. The C2 crank dramatically reduces the effort required to draw any current Excalibur crossbow model, as well as guaranteeing consistent string alignment. Unlike cumbersome permanently mounted cranks, it detaches in seconds when the bow is cocked, and is carried separately in a pack or pocket. Constructed of high strength aluminum alloys and machined to tightest tolerances, it will provide years of trouble free service. Please note that this Cranking aid is for use with Excalibur's thumbhole or 2008 and newer traditional stocks identified by five diagonal slash marks located on the forend on either side of the trigger. This will not fit Relayer Y25.", "text": "Excalibur C2 Crank Cocking Aid Excalibur's C2 crank is the perfect solution for hunters who have difficulty drawing high poundage crossbows. The C2 crank dramatically reduces the effort required to draw any current Excalibur crossbow model, as well as guaranteeing consistent string alignment. Unlike cumbersome permanently mounted cranks, it detaches in seconds when the bow is cocked, and is carried separately in a pack or pocket. Constructed of high strength aluminum alloys and machined to tightest tolerances, it will provide years of trouble free service. Please note that this Cranking aid is for use with Excalibur's thumbhole or 2008 and newer traditional stocks identified by five diagonal slash marks located on the forend on either side of the trigger. This will not fit Relayer Y25.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nMMVZopJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C6O2V2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Excalibur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Cocking Devices"]], "price": 135.98}}
{"item_id": "B003C6O5DM", "title": "Ameriglo Laser Sight Accessories GTOOL2", "description": "This is a heavy duty tool for Glock rear sight removal and installation. Easy to use and made to last. Take it to the range for quick sight adjustments.", "text": "Ameriglo Laser Sight Accessories GTOOL2 This is a heavy duty tool for Glock rear sight removal and installation. Easy to use and made to last. Take it to the range for quick sight adjustments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Klr2JP85L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003C6O5DM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AmeriGlo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 121.1}}
