{"item_id": "B003CGHDFE", "title": "Avenir Long Schrader 48mm Valve Tube (26 X 1.9-2.125)", "description": "Avenir Long Schrader 48mm Valve Tube measures 26 X 1.9 - 2.125. Get back on the road with the Avenir Bicycle Tube Shrader 700c Valve. It serves as a replacement tube for wider 700c road tires and features a Schrader valve.", "text": "Avenir Long Schrader 48mm Valve Tube (26 X 1.9-2.125) Avenir Long Schrader 48mm Valve Tube measures 26 X 1.9 - 2.125. Get back on the road with the Avenir Bicycle Tube Shrader 700c Valve. It serves as a replacement tube for wider 700c road tires and features a Schrader valve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XrBGjH2jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CGHDFE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
