{"item_id": "B003CJWRE8", "title": "Chums No Tail Adjustable Eyewear Retainer", "description": "Chums No Tail Adjustable Eyewear Retainer includes an intense, active sports like kayaking and climbing require a secure retainer that fits under a helmet. This sunglass strap is perfect for those who prefer their CHUMS without a tail. Great for activities that require helmets it has a similar fit and feel.", "text": "Chums No Tail Adjustable Eyewear Retainer Chums No Tail Adjustable Eyewear Retainer includes an intense, active sports like kayaking and climbing require a secure retainer that fits under a helmet. This sunglass strap is perfect for those who prefer their CHUMS without a tail. Great for activities that require helmets it has a similar fit and feel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ms3n6ILML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CJWRE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chums", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B003CK11P8", "title": "Chums RearView Mirror", "description": "Now you can easily check on your child while in your kid carrier. Our patented retractable convex mirror clips easily to any child carrier and gives you a full view of your child. Simply pull it out, check your child, and it retracts back. Locking clip attaches securely to your child carrier.", "text": "Chums RearView Mirror Now you can easily check on your child while in your kid carrier. Our patented retractable convex mirror clips easily to any child carrier and gives you a full view of your child. Simply pull it out, check your child, and it retracts back. Locking clip attaches securely to your child carrier.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Yw1-uM4PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CK11P8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 7.44}}
{"item_id": "B003CK2EFO", "title": "Chums Surfshort Wallet, Colors May Vary", "description": "Perfect stash wallet for ID, cash, cards and keys. Low bulk, low profile, minimalist wallet. A good surf wallet is essential for safely carrying those items you don’t want to leave behind.", "text": "Chums Surfshort Wallet, Colors May Vary Perfect stash wallet for ID, cash, cards and keys. Low bulk, low profile, minimalist wallet. A good surf wallet is essential for safely carrying those items you don’t want to leave behind.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414%2BdikGmGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CK2EFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chums", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Bags, Packs & Accessories", "Wallets"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B003CK7D3W", "title": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Extreme Ultra-Light Towel, 28 x 34-Inch, Weighs 2.8oz", "description": "This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. (approx size: Large 34\"x58\" 6.5oz, Regular 28\"x34\" 2.8oz, Mini 19\"x19\" 1.3oz). Perfect for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping and Running. Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). To see what people are saying about our towels visit http://www.discoverytrekking.com/review", "text": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Extreme Ultra-Light Towel, 28 x 34-Inch, Weighs 2.8oz This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. (approx size: Large 34\"x58\" 6.5oz, Regular 28\"x34\" 2.8oz, Mini 19\"x19\" 1.3oz). Perfect for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping and Running. Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). To see what people are saying about our towels visit http://www.discoverytrekking.com/review", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZSXf1R7OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CK7D3W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B003CK92M2", "title": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, Small (Hand Towel) , Weighs 2.6oz", "description": "Product Description: The Ultra Fast-Dry Swim and Travel towel by Discovery Trekking is a revolutionary product that no one should be without. Top Gear reviewers agree. With 5 Star ratings, this “Editor’s Choice” is making the list of essential gear for swim, backpacking, travel and everything in between. Unlike conventional microfiber and cotton towels that absorb moisture, our innovative fabric is designed to pull water from your skin and then spread the moisture across the surface area of the fabric so it evaporates quickly. Over time odor causing bacteria can build up on towels resulting in “stinky towels” Discovery Trekking towels uses an odor resistant technology that inhibits the growth of odor causing bacteria in the material, creating an odor free effect. The permanent silver antimicrobial treatment will never wash out and is safe for you and the environment. These breathable towels offer high sun protection and sand won’t stick to them at the beach. The Ultra fast-dry towel is super lightweight and compact for travel and backpacking. Even when you can’t wash them regularly they will remain soft and luxurious against your skin but don’t let the softness fool you. You’ll wear out long before this towel does! Specifications: 3 sizes available Small (hand towel) 16\"x28\" 2.6oz (for a small backpacking towel or going to the gym) Medium (hair towel or small bath towel) 28\"x34\" 5.3oz (great size if space is a concern) Large (beach towel) 34\"x58\" 10.6oz (best for full body use) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. For an even lighter weigh version see our Discovery Trekking Outfitters Extreme Ultra-Light Towel.", "text": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, Small (Hand Towel) , Weighs 2.6oz Product Description: The Ultra Fast-Dry Swim and Travel towel by Discovery Trekking is a revolutionary product that no one should be without. Top Gear reviewers agree. With 5 Star ratings, this “Editor’s Choice” is making the list of essential gear for swim, backpacking, travel and everything in between. Unlike conventional microfiber and cotton towels that absorb moisture, our innovative fabric is designed to pull water from your skin and then spread the moisture across the surface area of the fabric so it evaporates quickly. Over time odor causing bacteria can build up on towels resulting in “stinky towels” Discovery Trekking towels uses an odor resistant technology that inhibits the growth of odor causing bacteria in the material, creating an odor free effect. The permanent silver antimicrobial treatment will never wash out and is safe for you and the environment. These breathable towels offer high sun protection and sand won’t stick to them at the beach. The Ultra fast-dry towel is super lightweight and compact for travel and backpacking. Even when you can’t wash them regularly they will remain soft and luxurious against your skin but don’t let the softness fool you. You’ll wear out long before this towel does! Specifications: 3 sizes available Small (hand towel) 16\"x28\" 2.6oz (for a small backpacking towel or going to the gym) Medium (hair towel or small bath towel) 28\"x34\" 5.3oz (great size if space is a concern) Large (beach towel) 34\"x58\" 10.6oz (best for full body use) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. For an even lighter weigh version see our Discovery Trekking Outfitters Extreme Ultra-Light Towel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NiPe-tcHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CK92M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 9.99}}
