{"item_id": "B003CO4QHO", "title": "CST Czar Comp Road Tire", "description": "Perfect for the style-conscious rider, the CST Czar road bike tire is available with several color options sure to match any bicycle. The Czar can be used for commuting or training on the road. Take corners with ease thanks to the dual-compound rubber.", "text": "CST Czar Comp Road Tire Perfect for the style-conscious rider, the CST Czar road bike tire is available with several color options sure to match any bicycle. The Czar can be used for commuting or training on the road. Take corners with ease thanks to the dual-compound rubber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aKJaRjnPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CO4QHO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003CO8IO6", "title": "Sigma Docking Station for Sigma BC 1909 and BC 2209 with Data Center", "description": "Easily download your ride data from your Sigma BC 1909 or BC 2209 bicycle speedometer to your computer with this handy docking station. Compatible with PCs and Macs, the docking station transfers your data to Sigma's Data Center training software, where you can perform a comprehensive analysis of each cycling session.", "text": "Sigma Docking Station for Sigma BC 1909 and BC 2209 with Data Center Easily download your ride data from your Sigma BC 1909 or BC 2209 bicycle speedometer to your computer with this handy docking station. Compatible with PCs and Macs, the docking station transfers your data to Sigma's Data Center training software, where you can perform a comprehensive analysis of each cycling session.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AvLqlxAOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CO8IO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigma Sport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 20.51}}
{"item_id": "B003COAE2K", "title": "Sigma Docking Station for Sigma BC 509, BC 1009, BC 1609 with Data Center", "description": "Easily download your ride data from your Sigma BC 509, BC 1009, BC 1009 STS, BC 1609, or BC 1609 STS bicycle speedometer to your computer with this handy docking station. Compatible with PCs and Macs, the docking station transfers your data to Sigma's Data Center training software, where you can perform a comprehensive analysis of each cycling session.", "text": "Sigma Docking Station for Sigma BC 509, BC 1009, BC 1609 with Data Center Easily download your ride data from your Sigma BC 509, BC 1009, BC 1009 STS, BC 1609, or BC 1609 STS bicycle speedometer to your computer with this handy docking station. Compatible with PCs and Macs, the docking station transfers your data to Sigma's Data Center training software, where you can perform a comprehensive analysis of each cycling session.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jJhnr2NQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003COAE2K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 25.95}}
