{"item_id": "B003COE2E6", "title": "Delta MegaRack Ultra Frame Mounted Bicycle Rack", "description": "Adjustable legs for correct installation on almost any bike style. Weighs 675 grams. Recommended cargo limit: 40 lbs. Dimensions 13\"x4.5\"x12.5-14.5\"(adjustable mount)", "text": "Delta MegaRack Ultra Frame Mounted Bicycle Rack Adjustable legs for correct installation on almost any bike style. Weighs 675 grams. Recommended cargo limit: 40 lbs. Dimensions 13\"x4.5\"x12.5-14.5\"(adjustable mount)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h%2B%2BIYO3KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003COE2E6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Cycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 20.81}}
{"item_id": "B003COEDMW", "title": "Misc Sailors Tool", "description": "Features honed blade, spike, bottle opener, shackle key and stainless steel handle with 2 inches ruler on one side and 5cm ruler on the other. Measures 3-3/4 inches closed, 6-1/8 inches open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.Honed BladeSpikeBottle OpenerShackle KeyStainless Steel Handle with RulerMeasures 3-3/4 inches Closed, 6-1/8 inches OpenLimited Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Misc Sailors Tool Features honed blade, spike, bottle opener, shackle key and stainless steel handle with 2 inches ruler on one side and 5cm ruler on the other. Measures 3-3/4 inches closed, 6-1/8 inches open. Limited lifetime warranty. Gift boxed.Honed BladeSpikeBottle OpenerShackle KeyStainless Steel Handle with RulerMeasures 3-3/4 inches Closed, 6-1/8 inches OpenLimited Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418%2BVJEIB5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003COEDMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BF Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 13.91}}
{"item_id": "B003CRIWWG", "title": "Seattle Sports Super Deluxe Bilge Pump", "description": "Combine a tough, oversized metal pump shaft with a clear plastic body and our easy-grip rubber overmolded handle, and you've got one great looking, great performing pump. An oversized float ensures your pump will be easily spotted if dropped overboard and a reflective band aids your visibility. The distinctive clear body allows you to see the pump action in operation, making it a great teaching tool for young paddlers as well. Although not needed or included, a 1-inch internal diameter hose can be added to the output valve to route water away from your boat.Features and Specifications:Bilge pump with oversized metal pump shaft and clear bodyEasy-grip rubber handleOversized floatReflective band for visibilityDiameter: 1.75 inchesLength: 21.5 inchesWeight: 11.2 ounces", "text": "Seattle Sports Super Deluxe Bilge Pump Combine a tough, oversized metal pump shaft with a clear plastic body and our easy-grip rubber overmolded handle, and you've got one great looking, great performing pump. An oversized float ensures your pump will be easily spotted if dropped overboard and a reflective band aids your visibility. The distinctive clear body allows you to see the pump action in operation, making it a great teaching tool for young paddlers as well. Although not needed or included, a 1-inch internal diameter hose can be added to the output valve to route water away from your boat.Features and Specifications:Bilge pump with oversized metal pump shaft and clear bodyEasy-grip rubber handleOversized floatReflective band for visibilityDiameter: 1.75 inchesLength: 21.5 inchesWeight: 11.2 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QjVoNXA-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CRIWWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seattle Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Plumbing", "Bilge Pumps"]], "price": 29.91}}
{"item_id": "B003CRVHMS", "title": "American Trails Mid Peaked Tent", "description": "Great camping tent in the most popular size", "text": "American Trails Mid Peaked Tent Great camping tent in the most popular size", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mm7SPVqmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CRVHMS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 31.87}}
{"item_id": "B003CSZ62E", "title": "Solar Powered and Hand Cranking Camping Lantern. 6V/70 mA Solar Panel. 12 LEDs, 8.5\" tall.", "description": "This weather proof solar lantern is a handy product for family outings, and outdoor activities. Adjustable brightness help you to light up from 5-15 hours using different number of LED lights. This way, it could be used as a night-light, or a serious camping lantern for your next outdoor activities. No maintenance needed, no bulb and battery replacement ever. Eco-friendly product using free solar energy. When there is no sun, it's always good to have its dynamic powering option by hand-crank.", "text": "Solar Powered and Hand Cranking Camping Lantern. 6V/70 mA Solar Panel. 12 LEDs, 8.5\" tall. This weather proof solar lantern is a handy product for family outings, and outdoor activities. Adjustable brightness help you to light up from 5-15 hours using different number of LED lights. This way, it could be used as a night-light, or a serious camping lantern for your next outdoor activities. No maintenance needed, no bulb and battery replacement ever. Eco-friendly product using free solar energy. When there is no sun, it's always good to have its dynamic powering option by hand-crank.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319CxtlEmlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CSZ62E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003CTCFRC", "title": "Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates Kit", "description": "Take inches off your waistline while simultaneously sculpting your muscles with the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit. Winsor, America's leading Pilates instructor, has designed a groundbreaking Pilates workout that employs a revolutionary new technique called Seamless Transitioning. The technique helps you move quickly through a series of Pilates exercises that challenge your muscles and your cardio system, so you burn calories and fat without the impact and pounding of traditional aerobics. Plus, you'll enjoy the body toning benefits of Pilates, including the long, lean look you've always dreamed of--with a narrow waistline, flat stomach, and firm, lifted rear. And because you'll ramp up your metabolism for a \"continuous burn effect,\" you'll burn fat 24/7, even while you sleep. It gives you the exact look you want without adding bulk, leaving you feeling taller, slimmer, and sculpted.The kit's Accelerator tool combines the best of resistance cords, hand weights, and weighted bars.The Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit comes with everything you need for a challenging Pilates workout. The kit starts with the Accelerator, a versatile piece of equipment that provides all the resistance, range of motion, and muscle sculpting of a Pilates Reformer and Cadillac--equipment that traditionally costs thousands of dollars--plus the toning and shaping movements of Pilates mat exercises. This one-of-a-kind Pilates tool combines the best of resistance cords, hand weights, and weighted bars all in one, delivering more than 200 unique strength-building moves. Plus, it's compact and portable, so you'll never have to miss a workout.The kit also comes with a variety of other fitness accessories, including three DVD workouts.Superfast Body Blastis a fast and fun program that chisels your body slim in just 20 minutes per day. Combining the best body sculpting moves with powerful, easy-to-follow footwork, the workout melts away extra pounds and inches in no time. The super-effectiveABsessionworkout brings cardio and Pilates together to get rid of belly flab and produce bikini-ready abs once and for all. Also 20 minutes long,ABsessionwill give you the sexy stomach you've been dreaming about regardless of your fitness level. And folks who want to maximize their weight loss can turn to theQuick Start Pilates for Weight LossDVD. The routine includes a 20-minute Cardio Sculpt workout, which delivers classic Pilates strength conditioning along with heart-rate-boosting, calorie-burning cardiovascular work. The routine then transitions into a 20-minute Burn & Firm Pilates workout, which provides super-fast sculpting moves focused on two common problem areas--the lower body, including buns, hips, and thighs, and the upper body, including shoulders, arms, and back.Mari Winsor leads users through a variety of slimming, body-sculpting workouts.Nutrition is a key element of any workout strategy, which is why the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit also comes with aRapid Results Weight Loss Planbooklet. The manual includes an introduction to the workout system, plus two workout calendars, a tutorial of the moves, a seven-day jumpstart weight-loss meal plan with a shopping list, and a four-week meal plan with snack lists. Another item in the kit include a tape measure to help you watch the inches melt away.Lastly, people who order the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit will receive 30 days of free VIP access to the Mari Winsor Web Club. The club offers daily online coaching and motivation, meal plans, and workout rotational calendars, as well as live auditoriums with Mari Winsor and her web team of trained instructors. Studies have shown that people with online support such as the Mari Winsor Web Club lose more than twice as much weight as people without any support.About Mari WinsorLos Angeles-based fitness expert Mari Winsor is the most celebrated name in Pilates. A former professional dancer certified in Pilates by Romana Kryzanowska, Winsor has co-authored three fitness books:The Pilates Powerhouse,The Pilates Pregnancy, andThe Pilates Workout Journal. She opened her first Pilates studio in Los Angeles in 1990, where she introduced her innovative signature workout based on Joseph Pilates' techniques. Soon after, musicians, professional athletes, and celebrities began to flock to her studio to be shaped, toned, and strengthened. In 2003, Mari moved her teaching beyond the Los Angeles studio to a national audience, and has since sold more than 29 million DVDs while helping millions of people get the bodies they want with her groundbreaking body-shaping techniques. Mari Winsor has been featured onOprahand in such magazines asAllure,Fitness,Glamour,InStyle,More, andShape.", "text": "Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates Kit Take inches off your waistline while simultaneously sculpting your muscles with the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit. Winsor, America's leading Pilates instructor, has designed a groundbreaking Pilates workout that employs a revolutionary new technique called Seamless Transitioning. The technique helps you move quickly through a series of Pilates exercises that challenge your muscles and your cardio system, so you burn calories and fat without the impact and pounding of traditional aerobics. Plus, you'll enjoy the body toning benefits of Pilates, including the long, lean look you've always dreamed of--with a narrow waistline, flat stomach, and firm, lifted rear. And because you'll ramp up your metabolism for a \"continuous burn effect,\" you'll burn fat 24/7, even while you sleep. It gives you the exact look you want without adding bulk, leaving you feeling taller, slimmer, and sculpted.The kit's Accelerator tool combines the best of resistance cords, hand weights, and weighted bars.The Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit comes with everything you need for a challenging Pilates workout. The kit starts with the Accelerator, a versatile piece of equipment that provides all the resistance, range of motion, and muscle sculpting of a Pilates Reformer and Cadillac--equipment that traditionally costs thousands of dollars--plus the toning and shaping movements of Pilates mat exercises. This one-of-a-kind Pilates tool combines the best of resistance cords, hand weights, and weighted bars all in one, delivering more than 200 unique strength-building moves. Plus, it's compact and portable, so you'll never have to miss a workout.The kit also comes with a variety of other fitness accessories, including three DVD workouts.Superfast Body Blastis a fast and fun program that chisels your body slim in just 20 minutes per day. Combining the best body sculpting moves with powerful, easy-to-follow footwork, the workout melts away extra pounds and inches in no time. The super-effectiveABsessionworkout brings cardio and Pilates together to get rid of belly flab and produce bikini-ready abs once and for all. Also 20 minutes long,ABsessionwill give you the sexy stomach you've been dreaming about regardless of your fitness level. And folks who want to maximize their weight loss can turn to theQuick Start Pilates for Weight LossDVD. The routine includes a 20-minute Cardio Sculpt workout, which delivers classic Pilates strength conditioning along with heart-rate-boosting, calorie-burning cardiovascular work. The routine then transitions into a 20-minute Burn & Firm Pilates workout, which provides super-fast sculpting moves focused on two common problem areas--the lower body, including buns, hips, and thighs, and the upper body, including shoulders, arms, and back.Mari Winsor leads users through a variety of slimming, body-sculpting workouts.Nutrition is a key element of any workout strategy, which is why the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit also comes with aRapid Results Weight Loss Planbooklet. The manual includes an introduction to the workout system, plus two workout calendars, a tutorial of the moves, a seven-day jumpstart weight-loss meal plan with a shopping list, and a four-week meal plan with snack lists. Another item in the kit include a tape measure to help you watch the inches melt away.Lastly, people who order the Mari Winsor Slimming Pilates kit will receive 30 days of free VIP access to the Mari Winsor Web Club. The club offers daily online coaching and motivation, meal plans, and workout rotational calendars, as well as live auditoriums with Mari Winsor and her web team of trained instructors. Studies have shown that people with online support such as the Mari Winsor Web Club lose more than twice as much weight as people without any support.About Mari WinsorLos Angeles-based fitness expert Mari Winsor is the most celebrated name in Pilates. A former professional dancer certified in Pilates by Romana Kryzanowska, Winsor has co-authored three fitness books:The Pilates Powerhouse,The Pilates Pregnancy, andThe Pilates Workout Journal. She opened her first Pilates studio in Los Angeles in 1990, where she introduced her innovative signature workout based on Joseph Pilates' techniques. Soon after, musicians, professional athletes, and celebrities began to flock to her studio to be shaped, toned, and strengthened. In 2003, Mari moved her teaching beyond the Los Angeles studio to a national audience, and has since sold more than 29 million DVDs while helping millions of people get the bodies they want with her groundbreaking body-shaping techniques. Mari Winsor has been featured onOprahand in such magazines asAllure,Fitness,Glamour,InStyle,More, andShape.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K0Zmkr9UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CTCFRC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Pilates", "Flexbands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003CTKSTY", "title": "Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combo", "description": "Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combos. A GREAT PRICE for a reliable rig! No need to sink your whole budget on an overpriced rig! The Safina Pro Combo delivers smooth operation and outstanding durability, all for a fraction of the price you'd pay for \"top-of-the-line\" tackle. Here, you get a graphite composite Rod complete with an easy-casting, easy-retrieving 4-ball bearing Reel. Rod: Graphite composite blank construction for lightweight sensitivity; Durable dura-flow stainless steel guides; Comfortable EVA foam fore and rear grips. Reel: 3+1BB for true smoothness; Multi-disc oil felt drag washers; 1 quick-set anti-reverse roller bearing; Machined aluminum 2-toned anodized spool. State Model. Model No. 602: Length: 6'; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 210 yds. / 8 lb. test. Model No. 662: Length: 6'6\"; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 200 yds. / 10 lb. test. Model No. 702: Length: 7'; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 200 yds. / 10 lb. test. Order Today! Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combo", "text": "Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combo Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combos. A GREAT PRICE for a reliable rig! No need to sink your whole budget on an overpriced rig! The Safina Pro Combo delivers smooth operation and outstanding durability, all for a fraction of the price you'd pay for \"top-of-the-line\" tackle. Here, you get a graphite composite Rod complete with an easy-casting, easy-retrieving 4-ball bearing Reel. Rod: Graphite composite blank construction for lightweight sensitivity; Durable dura-flow stainless steel guides; Comfortable EVA foam fore and rear grips. Reel: 3+1BB for true smoothness; Multi-disc oil felt drag washers; 1 quick-set anti-reverse roller bearing; Machined aluminum 2-toned anodized spool. State Model. Model No. 602: Length: 6'; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 210 yds. / 8 lb. test. Model No. 662: Length: 6'6\"; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 200 yds. / 10 lb. test. Model No. 702: Length: 7'; Pcs.: 2; Power: Medium; Reel ball bearings: 4; Line Capacity: 200 yds. / 10 lb. test. Order Today! Okuma Safina Pro Spinning Combo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219xwGLe0OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CTKSTY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spinning Combos"]]}}
