{"item_id": "B003CUP35W", "title": "South Bend \"Lunker\" Bass Spinner Kit", "description": "Get your fish on with this kit of \"lunker\" spinners. Deadly for bass, walleye, northern pike, pike, and salmon, the kit comes with six popular-type spoons in assorted sizes and colors. Pre-spooled with monofilament line, the spoons include dressed treble hooks.", "text": "South Bend \"Lunker\" Bass Spinner Kit Get your fish on with this kit of \"lunker\" spinners. Deadly for bass, walleye, northern pike, pike, and salmon, the kit comes with six popular-type spoons in assorted sizes and colors. Pre-spooled with monofilament line, the spoons include dressed treble hooks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gr52Q0cBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003CUP35W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "South Bend", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Hard Lures", "Spinners & Spinnerbaits"]], "price": 9.84}}
