{"item_id": "B003D1B444", "title": "AR15 M4 FLAT TOP COMPACT 1/2 INCH RISER MOUNT PICATINNY RAIL", "description": "One piece body designAttaches to flat top Picatinny rails to raise line of sight by 1/2\"Locks firmly in place with two large thumb screwsInstalls in secondsMultiple ring slots (8) to adjust for proper sight positionMade of heavy duty quality aluminum alloy 6061Anodized matte black finishTakes standard PICATINNY OR Weaver ringsMount overall length: 3.5\"(85mm)Weight: 3.4OZ", "text": "AR15 M4 FLAT TOP COMPACT 1/2 INCH RISER MOUNT PICATINNY RAIL One piece body designAttaches to flat top Picatinny rails to raise line of sight by 1/2\"Locks firmly in place with two large thumb screwsInstalls in secondsMultiple ring slots (8) to adjust for proper sight positionMade of heavy duty quality aluminum alloy 6061Anodized matte black finishTakes standard PICATINNY OR Weaver ringsMount overall length: 3.5\"(85mm)Weight: 3.4OZ", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pydoQfomL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D1B444.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 12.75}}
{"item_id": "B003D3F4TI", "title": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, 34x58-Inch, Weighs 10.6oz", "description": "This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. These towels are perfect for Swimming, Travelling, Backpacking, Boating, Camping and All Sports. 3 sizes avaliable (Small 16\"x28\" 2.6oz, Medium 28\"x34\" 5.3oz, Large 34\"x58\" 10.6oz) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). Google \"wickingtowel\" to see just some of over 50 major media reviews.", "text": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, 34x58-Inch, Weighs 10.6oz This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. These towels are perfect for Swimming, Travelling, Backpacking, Boating, Camping and All Sports. 3 sizes avaliable (Small 16\"x28\" 2.6oz, Medium 28\"x34\" 5.3oz, Large 34\"x58\" 10.6oz) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). Google \"wickingtowel\" to see just some of over 50 major media reviews.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eNrH2SZpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D3F4TI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 29.51}}
{"item_id": "B003D3H5MC", "title": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, 28x34-Inch, Weighs 5.3oz", "description": "This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. These towels are perfect for Swimming, Travelling, Backpacking, Boating, Camping and All Sports. 3 sizes avaliable (Small 16\"x28\" 2.6oz, Medium 28\"x34\" 5.3oz, Large 34\"x58\" 10.6oz) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). Google \"wickingtowel\" to see just some of over 50 major media reviews.", "text": "Discovery Trekking Outfitters Ultra Fast-Dry Towel, 28x34-Inch, Weighs 5.3oz This towel distributes moisture across fabric surface, promoting rapid evaporation. Kills bacteria, stays soft and fresh smelling. These towels are perfect for Swimming, Travelling, Backpacking, Boating, Camping and All Sports. 3 sizes avaliable (Small 16\"x28\" 2.6oz, Medium 28\"x34\" 5.3oz, Large 34\"x58\" 10.6oz) Choose size based on activity. For full body use, the larger surface offers faster drying as there is more area to move the water, which speeds evaporation. Rated 5 of 5 for functional/desigh perfection (as reported by SNEWSR www.snewsnet.com). Google \"wickingtowel\" to see just some of over 50 major media reviews.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eNrH2SZpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D3H5MC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003D4BQ94", "title": "Banjo Brothers Deluxe Seat Bag", "description": "Banjo Brothers 03009 Mini Deluxe Seat Bag is the perfect size for the road essentials: spare tube, tire levers, mini tool, or change/keys if you are so inclined. This seat bag is 33 cubic inches in size, with dimensions of 5.5-inches long x 3-inches wide x 3-inches high. This bag is made of 1680 denier ballistic nylon exterior fabric that wears like iron to keep all of your valuables safe while on the trails. Both the top and bottom are padded for extra support and the gusseted sides help keep things in place when you open the bag. This deluxe Banjo Brothers bag features three interior pockets to keep tools and other sharp objects away from your tube. To keep your keys safe from dropping or getting lost, there is a key clip tether on this seat bag.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Deluxe Seat Bag Banjo Brothers 03009 Mini Deluxe Seat Bag is the perfect size for the road essentials: spare tube, tire levers, mini tool, or change/keys if you are so inclined. This seat bag is 33 cubic inches in size, with dimensions of 5.5-inches long x 3-inches wide x 3-inches high. This bag is made of 1680 denier ballistic nylon exterior fabric that wears like iron to keep all of your valuables safe while on the trails. Both the top and bottom are padded for extra support and the gusseted sides help keep things in place when you open the bag. This deluxe Banjo Brothers bag features three interior pockets to keep tools and other sharp objects away from your tube. To keep your keys safe from dropping or getting lost, there is a key clip tether on this seat bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wm-n6QUJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D4BQ94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003D4EY5C", "title": "Banjo Brothers Rack Top Bicycle Rack Top Pannier Bag", "description": "900 to 1300 cubic inches with drop-down panniers (Main compartment 14.5 L x 5.5 W x 7 H). The kitchen sink would probably be too heavy, but with the expanding design, you could use it for a trip around town, or a credit card tour out of town. Its trim design is perfect when you just need to throw in a picnic or an extra jacket, but with drop-down panniers and expanding top, it has surprising capacity. 360 degree reflective accents. Includes web loop for light, inside key clip, coin pocket, and detachable shoulder strap.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Rack Top Bicycle Rack Top Pannier Bag 900 to 1300 cubic inches with drop-down panniers (Main compartment 14.5 L x 5.5 W x 7 H). The kitchen sink would probably be too heavy, but with the expanding design, you could use it for a trip around town, or a credit card tour out of town. Its trim design is perfect when you just need to throw in a picnic or an extra jacket, but with drop-down panniers and expanding top, it has surprising capacity. 360 degree reflective accents. Includes web loop for light, inside key clip, coin pocket, and detachable shoulder strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ytlua%2BJ4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D4EY5C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 64.99}}
{"item_id": "B003D4GRS4", "title": "Banjo Brothers Large Top Tube Bicycle Bag", "description": "41 cubic inches (6.25? L x 2? W x 3.25? H). A famed shop in North Dakota with account #007 told our best rep We sell the living #$%^ out of this bag he said pointing to an inferior, but novel concept. Cant you guys do better? Sure we can. Designed originally for triathletes (and ours still works great for that use), our Top Tube Bag is a great add-on to keep your must-haves (phone, wallet, keys) within reach. The clear top allows you to see whats in there while keeping it all dry. Plenty of room for race tools, food, or camera, phone, etc.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Large Top Tube Bicycle Bag 41 cubic inches (6.25? L x 2? W x 3.25? H). A famed shop in North Dakota with account #007 told our best rep We sell the living #$%^ out of this bag he said pointing to an inferior, but novel concept. Cant you guys do better? Sure we can. Designed originally for triathletes (and ours still works great for that use), our Top Tube Bag is a great add-on to keep your must-haves (phone, wallet, keys) within reach. The clear top allows you to see whats in there while keeping it all dry. Plenty of room for race tools, food, or camera, phone, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ue5CYm81L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D4GRS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Banjo Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 17.58}}
{"item_id": "B003D4GSEC", "title": "Banjo Brothers Saddlebag Bicycle Pannier", "description": "SADDLEBAG PANNIERS One-piece saddlebag design is easy-on and easy-off. Its ideal for commuting or a weekend trip to a nearby bed and breakfast. The bags are low-profile, so they wont slow you down. They also feature cinch straps on top to hold extra gear and 360 degree reflective accents.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Saddlebag Bicycle Pannier SADDLEBAG PANNIERS One-piece saddlebag design is easy-on and easy-off. Its ideal for commuting or a weekend trip to a nearby bed and breakfast. The bags are low-profile, so they wont slow you down. They also feature cinch straps on top to hold extra gear and 360 degree reflective accents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4155QpbHZhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D4GSEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Banjo Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 59.99}}
