{"item_id": "B003D6FEYA", "title": "SKLZ Safety Ball (Pack of 2) - Reduced Impact Balls", "description": "Perfect for teaching young players how to bat and field without fear of injury or impact, SKLZ First Team Safety Balls have an authentic baseball look with a soft, cushioned construction. Worrying less about the ball means your players and/or children can focus on developing their coordination and skill and build the confidence needed to succeed. Safety balls are the same size and look the same as standard balls to ensure effective training and come in packs of two. Use the balls with the First Team Pop-Back Tee and PitchBack Trainers or individually.Reduced-impact training balls provide an authentic baseball look with soft, cushioned constructionHelps youth players build confidence by reducing fear about impactSame size and visual cues as standard baseballs for effective trainingComes in a pack of 2 Safety BallsStandard baseball circumference of 9 inches", "text": "SKLZ Safety Ball (Pack of 2) - Reduced Impact Balls Perfect for teaching young players how to bat and field without fear of injury or impact, SKLZ First Team Safety Balls have an authentic baseball look with a soft, cushioned construction. Worrying less about the ball means your players and/or children can focus on developing their coordination and skill and build the confidence needed to succeed. Safety balls are the same size and look the same as standard balls to ensure effective training and come in packs of two. Use the balls with the First Team Pop-Back Tee and PitchBack Trainers or individually.Reduced-impact training balls provide an authentic baseball look with soft, cushioned constructionHelps youth players build confidence by reducing fear about impactSame size and visual cues as standard baseballs for effective trainingComes in a pack of 2 Safety BallsStandard baseball circumference of 9 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WhxgsDefL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FEYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Baseballs"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B003D6FFB2", "title": "SKLZ Fastpitch Reaction Ball - Softball Agility Trainer", "description": "Reaction Ball fielding aid is perfect for improvement of hand-eye coordination and reaction time. Volley the Reaction Ball between two athletes, or rebound it against a wall. Upon landing, the ball will bounce in an unpredictable manner. Repeating these steps will improve your speed and coordination for baseball.", "text": "SKLZ Fastpitch Reaction Ball - Softball Agility Trainer Reaction Ball fielding aid is perfect for improvement of hand-eye coordination and reaction time. Volley the Reaction Ball between two athletes, or rebound it against a wall. Upon landing, the ball will bounce in an unpredictable manner. Repeating these steps will improve your speed and coordination for baseball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eMO2aK%2BaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FFB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Softball", "Softballs", "Fast-Pitch Softballs"]], "price": 5.85}}
{"item_id": "B003D6FFGW", "title": "SKLZ Field Shield - Full-Face Protection Mask", "description": "SKLZ Field Shield Face Mask. Play to your maximum potential without fear of getting hit by the ball. The Field Shield is a comfortable fielding facemask that gives you complete facial and dental protection. The chin pad and head straps both adjust for a perfect fit. Materials: high density plastic, rubber, polyester. Dimensions: Small/Medium: 7.5\"L x 6\"W x 7\"H; 0.41 lbs. Large/XLarge: 8.5\"L x 7.5\"W x 9\"H; 0.6 lbs.", "text": "SKLZ Field Shield - Full-Face Protection Mask SKLZ Field Shield Face Mask. Play to your maximum potential without fear of getting hit by the ball. The Field Shield is a comfortable fielding facemask that gives you complete facial and dental protection. The chin pad and head straps both adjust for a perfect fit. Materials: high density plastic, rubber, polyester. Dimensions: Small/Medium: 7.5\"L x 6\"W x 7\"H; 0.41 lbs. Large/XLarge: 8.5\"L x 7.5\"W x 9\"H; 0.6 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gECG3FZsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FFGW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Protective Gear", "Face Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003D6FFJY", "title": "SKLZ Refiner Driver Graphite Pro-Hinged Training Club", "description": "The Refiner Driver Graphite Pro is the only graphite hinged training club available. The dual-colored shaft guides an on-plane swing while giving you the feel of a real driver.", "text": "SKLZ Refiner Driver Graphite Pro-Hinged Training Club The Refiner Driver Graphite Pro is the only graphite hinged training club available. The dual-colored shaft guides an on-plane swing while giving you the feel of a real driver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Be8BqZveL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FFJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 85.74}}
{"item_id": "B003D6FFNU", "title": "SKLZ Practice POD-PRO Allignment Tool", "description": "The SKLZ Practice Pod Pro is a three-rod system which helps teach a variety of shots, including draws and fades. Includes an alignment mirror for perfecting correct shoulder and head positioning.", "text": "SKLZ Practice POD-PRO Allignment Tool The SKLZ Practice Pod Pro is a three-rod system which helps teach a variety of shots, including draws and fades. Includes an alignment mirror for perfecting correct shoulder and head positioning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l9A9pxLeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FFNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 24.98}}
