{"item_id": "B003D6FFU8", "title": "SKLZ Vari-Break Putting Course", "description": "The SKLZ Vari-Break Putting Green gives you the ability to contour the green for almost any putt: uphill, downhill, left and right. Includes the SKLZ Putt Pocket to make the hole smaller and help the golfer focus on putting to the high side of the hole; also works as a movable hole around the mat.", "text": "SKLZ Vari-Break Putting Course The SKLZ Vari-Break Putting Green gives you the ability to contour the green for almost any putt: uphill, downhill, left and right. Includes the SKLZ Putt Pocket to make the hole smaller and help the golfer focus on putting to the high side of the hole; also works as a movable hole around the mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HcDeUAt8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FFU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Putting Mats"]], "price": 99.99}}
