{"item_id": "B003D6FGB6", "title": "SKLZ D-Man Basketball - Defensive Mannequin", "description": "Bring defender mannequins into your practice session and shoot over the D-Man to encourage proper shot trajectory over and around the hands-up defending position. Dribbling around one or more D-Men helps with ball-handling skills and court awareness. The adjustable telescoping pole gives you varying defensive options to practice low post moves and jump shots. Ideal for solo practice or team setting for basketball, football, or any other hands-up defensive sport. Adjustable height of 5.5 feet to 6.5 feet, plus an additional 1.5 feet of arms and hands help build your offensive skills while a sturdy wire frame construction, wind-friendly mesh, a weighted base, and ground stake attachments ensure stability on any surface. The D-Man is portable, lightweight, and sets up/tears down easily and quickly.Features:Defensive mannequin encourages proper shot trajectory and builds offensive skillsAdjustable height of 5.5 to 6.5 feet, plus an additional telescoping pole with 1.5 feet of arms/handsSturdy wire frame construction with wind-friendly mesh; weighted base (sand not included) for added stabilityConvenient and compact storage with easy-fold designGround stake attachments included for stability on any surfacePortable, lightweight, sets up and breaks down easily", "text": "SKLZ D-Man Basketball - Defensive Mannequin Bring defender mannequins into your practice session and shoot over the D-Man to encourage proper shot trajectory over and around the hands-up defending position. Dribbling around one or more D-Men helps with ball-handling skills and court awareness. The adjustable telescoping pole gives you varying defensive options to practice low post moves and jump shots. Ideal for solo practice or team setting for basketball, football, or any other hands-up defensive sport. Adjustable height of 5.5 feet to 6.5 feet, plus an additional 1.5 feet of arms and hands help build your offensive skills while a sturdy wire frame construction, wind-friendly mesh, a weighted base, and ground stake attachments ensure stability on any surface. The D-Man is portable, lightweight, and sets up/tears down easily and quickly.Features:Defensive mannequin encourages proper shot trajectory and builds offensive skillsAdjustable height of 5.5 to 6.5 feet, plus an additional telescoping pole with 1.5 feet of arms/handsSturdy wire frame construction with wind-friendly mesh; weighted base (sand not included) for added stabilityConvenient and compact storage with easy-fold designGround stake attachments included for stability on any surfacePortable, lightweight, sets up and breaks down easily", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UltKzzjUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FGB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 43.54}}
{"item_id": "B003D6FGFW", "title": "SKLZ Shot Spotz - Basketball Training Markers", "description": "A fun and entertaining training, learning, and coaching tool, Shot Spotz Markers develop players' court awareness by providing reference points for instruction with challenging situational play. The set includes five durable, high-density ground discs number 1 through 5 that allow you to create a variety of drills and games all over the court to help your players or yourself learn plays and master court sense and positioning. Also includes detailed basketball drill and game instructions, plus an all-weather digital timer with a magnet on the back so you can time drills as players make their way from spot to spot, perfecting their shot and quickness, and a carrying case.Features:Fun Basketball game and effective learning toolAllows for a variety of drills and games all over the court, find your spot and take the shotDevelops good court sense and positioningWhat's in the Box?Five 8-inch numbered disks made of all-weather rubber for indoor or outdoor useMagnetic, all-weather digital timerDetailed instructions for 9 fun training games and drillsConvenient carrying case included", "text": "SKLZ Shot Spotz - Basketball Training Markers A fun and entertaining training, learning, and coaching tool, Shot Spotz Markers develop players' court awareness by providing reference points for instruction with challenging situational play. The set includes five durable, high-density ground discs number 1 through 5 that allow you to create a variety of drills and games all over the court to help your players or yourself learn plays and master court sense and positioning. Also includes detailed basketball drill and game instructions, plus an all-weather digital timer with a magnet on the back so you can time drills as players make their way from spot to spot, perfecting their shot and quickness, and a carrying case.Features:Fun Basketball game and effective learning toolAllows for a variety of drills and games all over the court, find your spot and take the shotDevelops good court sense and positioningWhat's in the Box?Five 8-inch numbered disks made of all-weather rubber for indoor or outdoor useMagnetic, all-weather digital timerDetailed instructions for 9 fun training games and drillsConvenient carrying case included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nOKYx5sgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6FGFW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 15.38}}
{"item_id": "B003D6ZLXE", "title": "Hornady Powder Cop", "description": "Install on your progressive press after the powder drop station to automatically check dropped charges. Checking powder charges on your progressive press can be difficult, and is sometimes ignored, even though it's a smart practice. Hornady uses a similar device on our own ammo manufacturing presses. It won't replace careful attention, but helps monitor the reloading process. Works with all powder types and cartridges", "text": "Hornady Powder Cop Install on your progressive press after the powder drop station to automatically check dropped charges. Checking powder charges on your progressive press can be difficult, and is sometimes ignored, even though it's a smart practice. Hornady uses a similar device on our own ammo manufacturing presses. It won't replace careful attention, but helps monitor the reloading process. Works with all powder types and cartridges", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KoWezYcOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D6ZLXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 32.1}}
{"item_id": "B003D7K07K", "title": "Smith & Wesson SWPENMPBK Military and Police Tactical Pen, Black", "description": "This stylish tactical pen is machined from T6061 aircraft aluminim.", "text": "Smith & Wesson SWPENMPBK Military and Police Tactical Pen, Black This stylish tactical pen is machined from T6061 aircraft aluminim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Z1ALK900L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D7K07K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 23.45}}
{"item_id": "B003D7LX3U", "title": "3M Peltor WorkTunes Digital Hearing Protector, MP3 Compatible with AM/FM Tuner", "description": "Getting people to wear ear protection just got easier. Peltor Worktunes WTD2600 provides critical attenuation against dangerous noise levels while it puts clear-sounding digital audio entertainment at a workers fingertips. Worktunes gives workers the protection they need and the entertainment they want. Requires 2 AA batteries (not included).", "text": "3M Peltor WorkTunes Digital Hearing Protector, MP3 Compatible with AM/FM Tuner Getting people to wear ear protection just got easier. Peltor Worktunes WTD2600 provides critical attenuation against dangerous noise levels while it puts clear-sounding digital audio entertainment at a workers fingertips. Worktunes gives workers the protection they need and the entertainment they want. Requires 2 AA batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vs58MYRBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D7LX3U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 57.0}}
{"item_id": "B003D7OPO4", "title": "Metal Airsoft", "description": "# BRAND NEW # METAL # SPRING LOADED # FULL SIZE # MAGAZINE HOLDS 10 IN CLIP # PACK OF BB'S INCLUDED # 250 FPS # FAST PRIORITY MAIL SHIPPING (2-3 DAYS)", "text": "Metal Airsoft # BRAND NEW # METAL # SPRING LOADED # FULL SIZE # MAGAZINE HOLDS 10 IN CLIP # PACK OF BB'S INCLUDED # 250 FPS # FAST PRIORITY MAIL SHIPPING (2-3 DAYS)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GKcp%2BFZZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D7OPO4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003D8K88U", "title": "Handmade Sharp Japanese Samurai Sword Musashi Wakizashi", "description": "Item Description This is a brand new full tang hand crafted samurai Wakizashi with a Musashi ring tsuba. The sword comes with razor sharp blade and is well balanced. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and made with high carbon steel. This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. This sword can be used for practice or self defense. The blade features a visible kissake on the tip of the blade. History Miyamoto Musashi was the legendary Japanese swordsman famed for his duels and distinctive sword skills. He is the founder of the Hyoho Niten Ichi-ryu style of swordsmanship and the author of the Book of Five Rings, a book on strategy, tactics, and philosophy that is still studied today. Musashi is often considered the greatest ever swordsman in Japanese history. Legends said that he dueled more than 60 times in his life time and was never defeated.", "text": "Handmade Sharp Japanese Samurai Sword Musashi Wakizashi Item Description This is a brand new full tang hand crafted samurai Wakizashi with a Musashi ring tsuba. The sword comes with razor sharp blade and is well balanced. The blade of the sword is hand crafted and made with high carbon steel. This sword is full tang and can be disassembled. This sword can be used for practice or self defense. The blade features a visible kissake on the tip of the blade. History Miyamoto Musashi was the legendary Japanese swordsman famed for his duels and distinctive sword skills. He is the founder of the Hyoho Niten Ichi-ryu style of swordsmanship and the author of the Book of Five Rings, a book on strategy, tactics, and philosophy that is still studied today. Musashi is often considered the greatest ever swordsman in Japanese history. Legends said that he dueled more than 60 times in his life time and was never defeated.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51debiO-k6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D8K88U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SDN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 40.49}}
{"item_id": "B003D9L96Y", "title": "TufForce Adjustable AK Side Mount MT-2K15", "description": "1) 18mm Height Adjustment 2) 3mm Center Line Adjustment 3) Accepts NATO STANAG Type Scope 4) Easy to Install 5) Fits Variety of AKs 6) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 7) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "text": "TufForce Adjustable AK Side Mount MT-2K15 1) 18mm Height Adjustment 2) 3mm Center Line Adjustment 3) Accepts NATO STANAG Type Scope 4) Easy to Install 5) Fits Variety of AKs 6) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 7) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41atZcCLizL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D9L96Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TufForce", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 30.11}}
{"item_id": "B003D9ORK4", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife El Salvador Machete, 18-Inch Micarta Handle, Leather Sheath", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife El Salvador Machete, 18-Inch Micarta Handle, Leather Sheath CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217-RqKFOuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D9ORK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 82.46}}
{"item_id": "B003D9ORT0", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushlore 4.375-Inch Drop Point Blade, Micarta Handle with Leather Sheath (Plain)", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Bushlore 4.375-Inch Drop Point Blade, Micarta Handle with Leather Sheath (Plain) CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uSnfEALsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003D9ORT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": 