{"item_id": "B003DC8Z86", "title": "TufForce Compact Low Riser Mount MT-1RT8L", "description": "1) 8 Slots Compact See-Through Weaver /Picatinny Rail 2) 1/2\" Low Profile 3) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts 4) Fits AR15/ M16 /FALs Flat Tops 5) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 6) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "text": "TufForce Compact Low Riser Mount MT-1RT8L 1) 8 Slots Compact See-Through Weaver /Picatinny Rail 2) 1/2\" Low Profile 3) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts 4) Fits AR15/ M16 /FALs Flat Tops 5) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 6) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N8L156AHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DC8Z86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TufForce", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 16.59}}
{"item_id": "B003DET1U0", "title": "Zoic Men's Ether Mountain Bike Shorts with RPL Liner", "description": "Ether mountain biking shorts from ZOIC are packed with features and built to last, delivering performance for all types of riders in any trail conditions: cross country, all mountain, freeride, downhill and even urban and commuting. Our Ether shorts offer the 3 for 1 value of the ZOIC RPL System: a fully integrated cycling short that separates into a versatile technical short and a high-performance RPL Essential padded liner. RPL = Removable Padded Liner. Machine wash cold with mild detergent, line dry. For almost 20 years ZOIC has been making quality, comfortable cycling apparel for people who enjoy riding bikes. We utilize the finest fabrics, the best factories, and our product is always guaranteed. ZOIC means pertaining to animal life or action, ZOIC is clothing for an active life, ZOIC is the style of cycling.", "text": "Zoic Men's Ether Mountain Bike Shorts with RPL Liner Ether mountain biking shorts from ZOIC are packed with features and built to last, delivering performance for all types of riders in any trail conditions: cross country, all mountain, freeride, downhill and even urban and commuting. Our Ether shorts offer the 3 for 1 value of the ZOIC RPL System: a fully integrated cycling short that separates into a versatile technical short and a high-performance RPL Essential padded liner. RPL = Removable Padded Liner. Machine wash cold with mild detergent, line dry. For almost 20 years ZOIC has been making quality, comfortable cycling apparel for people who enjoy riding bikes. We utilize the finest fabrics, the best factories, and our product is always guaranteed. ZOIC means pertaining to animal life or action, ZOIC is clothing for an active life, ZOIC is the style of cycling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lXPSoB2hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DET1U0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]], "price": 74.99}}
