{"item_id": "B003DKK7MA", "title": "Evernew Titanium Alcohol Stove Cross Stand", "description": "Bi-level jet system creates strong and stable flame. Fuel capacity: 70ml. Optional Cross Stand gives an optimal height to burn the stove efficiently. Wt: 0.5 oz. Optional DX Stand allows for multi-fuel versatility (wood, solid fuel, alcohol). It also acts as a pot stand and provides protection from wind. Wt: 1.83 oz.", "text": "Evernew Titanium Alcohol Stove Cross Stand Bi-level jet system creates strong and stable flame. Fuel capacity: 70ml. Optional Cross Stand gives an optimal height to burn the stove efficiently. Wt: 0.5 oz. Optional DX Stand allows for multi-fuel versatility (wood, solid fuel, alcohol). It also acts as a pot stand and provides protection from wind. Wt: 1.83 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lZ%2ByGgGPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DKK7MA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EVERNEW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 13.16}}
