{"item_id": "B003DO5L3G", "title": "Lee Precision Load Master 223 Remington Reloading Rifle Kit (Red)", "description": "The Lee Precision Load-Master progressive 5-hole reloading kit for 223 Rem. Includes press, Pace Setter dies (full length sizing, bullet seating, and factory crimp dies) turret, and #4s shell plate.", "text": "Lee Precision Load Master 223 Remington Reloading Rifle Kit (Red) The Lee Precision Load-Master progressive 5-hole reloading kit for 223 Rem. Includes press, Pace Setter dies (full length sizing, bullet seating, and factory crimp dies) turret, and #4s shell plate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-UrkMoWAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DO5L3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 249.26}}
{"item_id": "B003DQALBQ", "title": "Slick Trick ST100M Broadhead 100 Grain-Pack of 3, Silver", "description": "The Magnum Slick Trick Broadhead 100 Grain was the first super short broadhead in 2000. As a result of it’s demand and result, the whole broadhead industry followed. The Magnum has mechanical-like flight with crazy, damaging holes but with fixed blade strength, penetration and reliability. Amazed bow hunters coined the term “Slug Holes” after seeing Magnum kills. Sold in packages of three, black and silver in color.", "text": "Slick Trick ST100M Broadhead 100 Grain-Pack of 3, Silver The Magnum Slick Trick Broadhead 100 Grain was the first super short broadhead in 2000. As a result of it’s demand and result, the whole broadhead industry followed. The Magnum has mechanical-like flight with crazy, damaging holes but with fixed blade strength, penetration and reliability. Amazed bow hunters coined the term “Slug Holes” after seeing Magnum kills. Sold in packages of three, black and silver in color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315sSteQEoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQALBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slick Trick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 27.99}}
