{"item_id": "B003DQRFGU", "title": "Gold Tip EZ- Pull 125 Grain Field Points (12-Pack)", "description": "Gold Tip's target points are the extreme in versatility and customization. We offer three different base The Our E-Z pull screw-in points have become very popular with our customers for their easy removal from targets. Precise field points for tuning and practice. They can be removed from even the toughest foam targets with ease. .246\" fits all Gold Tip hunting arrows and most other carbon arrow manufacturers.", "text": "Gold Tip EZ- Pull 125 Grain Field Points (12-Pack) Gold Tip's target points are the extreme in versatility and customization. We offer three different base The Our E-Z pull screw-in points have become very popular with our customers for their easy removal from targets. Precise field points for tuning and practice. They can be removed from even the toughest foam targets with ease. .246\" fits all Gold Tip hunting arrows and most other carbon arrow manufacturers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xb08QBLAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQRFGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gold Tip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Points"]], "price": 10.45}}
{"item_id": "B003DQRSB2", "title": "Lumenok Lumen-Arrow 20-Inch Carbon Bolts with Crescent Bolt End (3-Pack), Red", "description": "Lumen-Arrow bolts are 100% carbon bolts that are equipped with Lumenok brand lighted arrow nocks. The Lumenok is activated upon the shot and relies upon the conductivity of the shaft. NO switches or magnets required. The Lumenok is designed to be used over and over to allow archers to follow the path of their bolts. Each Lumenok has easily replaceable batteries for dozens of well lit shots.", "text": "Lumenok Lumen-Arrow 20-Inch Carbon Bolts with Crescent Bolt End (3-Pack), Red Lumen-Arrow bolts are 100% carbon bolts that are equipped with Lumenok brand lighted arrow nocks. The Lumenok is activated upon the shot and relies upon the conductivity of the shaft. NO switches or magnets required. The Lumenok is designed to be used over and over to allow archers to follow the path of their bolts. Each Lumenok has easily replaceable batteries for dozens of well lit shots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DZif-eybL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQRSB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lumenok", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Nocks"]], "price": 52.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DQSTCY", "title": "Stamina 36-Pound Adjustable Kettle Versa-Bell", "description": "The 36-pound Adjustable Kettle Versa Bell from Stamina packs six kettlebell weights into one discrete unit. The Versa Bell features a 16-pound base and cast-iron handle and holds five additional steel weight plates inside the interior of the frame. This innovative design allows you to workout with the weight in six weight levels, from 16 to 36 pounds--while saving space and the expense of purchasing individual kettlebells.The Versa Bell is designed for ease of use with a simple locking pin that allows you to choose your weight setting of 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, or 36 pounds. The Versa Bell comes with a square base pad that holds the weights that aren't in use. In addition, the Versa Bell offers a sturdy base that allows you to use it for off-the-floor pushups as well as a large grip that allows for a one-or-two-handed hold.The adjustable kettlebell holds up to five four-pound weight plates in its main cavity--for weight adjustment levels from 16 to 36 pounds.Specifications:Cast iron handleSteel weight platesResistance: adjusts from 16 to 36 pounds in four-pound increments16-pound base weightWide handle for one or two-handed gripComes with owner's manualNo assembly required90-day warrantyAbout Kettlebells:Traditional kettlebells are made from cast iron and have been described as resembling a bowling ball with a handle. The round part of the kettlebell is the main weight, and when you hold the handle it displaces that weight away from your body. This makes the physics of lifting different than with regular weights or dumbbells. When you lift, lower, or swing the kettlebell, your stabilizing muscles engage so your entire body is working, including your core muscles.", "text": "Stamina 36-Pound Adjustable Kettle Versa-Bell The 36-pound Adjustable Kettle Versa Bell from Stamina packs six kettlebell weights into one discrete unit. The Versa Bell features a 16-pound base and cast-iron handle and holds five additional steel weight plates inside the interior of the frame. This innovative design allows you to workout with the weight in six weight levels, from 16 to 36 pounds--while saving space and the expense of purchasing individual kettlebells.The Versa Bell is designed for ease of use with a simple locking pin that allows you to choose your weight setting of 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, or 36 pounds. The Versa Bell comes with a square base pad that holds the weights that aren't in use. In addition, the Versa Bell offers a sturdy base that allows you to use it for off-the-floor pushups as well as a large grip that allows for a one-or-two-handed hold.The adjustable kettlebell holds up to five four-pound weight plates in its main cavity--for weight adjustment levels from 16 to 36 pounds.Specifications:Cast iron handleSteel weight platesResistance: adjusts from 16 to 36 pounds in four-pound increments16-pound base weightWide handle for one or two-handed gripComes with owner's manualNo assembly required90-day warrantyAbout Kettlebells:Traditional kettlebells are made from cast iron and have been described as resembling a bowling ball with a handle. The round part of the kettlebell is the main weight, and when you hold the handle it displaces that weight away from your body. This makes the physics of lifting different than with regular weights or dumbbells. When you lift, lower, or swing the kettlebell, your stabilizing muscles engage so your entire body is working, including your core muscles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y%2BocadnTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQSTCY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stamina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]], "price": 121.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DQTJMI", "title": "Mountain Man Beaver Balls String Silencer", "description": "Lightweight, long lasting, tanned beaver hide string silencer that works on all bows in all kinds of weather. Natural brown.1 pr./pk.", "text": "Mountain Man Beaver Balls String Silencer Lightweight, long lasting, tanned beaver hide string silencer that works on all bows in all kinds of weather. Natural brown.1 pr./pk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jkuTUK1xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQTJMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bowstrings"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DQU0RG", "title": "Trufire Draw Check Tool", "description": "The Trufire Draw Check Tool is designed to eliminate accidents due to dry firing of a bow. Can be used to adjust draw length,peep sights, or any other string attachments. Fits both right or left hand, simulates a real release in the customers hand, can be used to safely exercise drawing muscles with your own bow, works either directly on the string or with string loop.", "text": "Trufire Draw Check Tool The Trufire Draw Check Tool is designed to eliminate accidents due to dry firing of a bow. Can be used to adjust draw length,peep sights, or any other string attachments. Fits both right or left hand, simulates a real release in the customers hand, can be used to safely exercise drawing muscles with your own bow, works either directly on the string or with string loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J7gitAU4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQU0RG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tru-Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Release Aids"]], "price": 21.78}}
{"item_id": "B003DQVN54", "title": "Primos Stretch-Fit Gloves (Realtree APG HD)", "description": "Our light-weight stretch-fit gloves are cool and breathable with a 5-Inch extended cuff. They are great for spring turkey season or early bow season. One size fits most.", "text": "Primos Stretch-Fit Gloves (Realtree APG HD) Our light-weight stretch-fit gloves are cool and breathable with a 5-Inch extended cuff. They are great for spring turkey season or early bow season. One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419mkIYdP3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQVN54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowboarding", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 11.45}}
