{"item_id": "B003DQZEZE", "title": "Gold Tip EZ-Pull 100 Grain Field Points (12-Pack)", "description": "Gold Tip's target points are the extreme in versatility and customization. We offer three different base The Our E-Z pull screw-in points have become very popular with our customers for their easy removal from targets. Precise field points for tuning and practice. They can be removed from even the toughest foam targets with ease. .246\" fits all Gold Tip hunting arrows and most other carbon arrow manufacturers.", "text": "Gold Tip EZ-Pull 100 Grain Field Points (12-Pack) Gold Tip's target points are the extreme in versatility and customization. We offer three different base The Our E-Z pull screw-in points have become very popular with our customers for their easy removal from targets. Precise field points for tuning and practice. They can be removed from even the toughest foam targets with ease. .246\" fits all Gold Tip hunting arrows and most other carbon arrow manufacturers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xb08QBLAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DQZEZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gold Tip", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Points"]], "price": 10.66}}
{"item_id": "B003DR12ZO", "title": "New Archery Products 125 Grain 3-Pack Crossbow Spitfire Broadhead", "description": "Super durable hardened carbon steel Trophy Tip® Slimline ferrule improves flight and penetration. Micro-grooves to enhance accuracy and penetration. Snap locking blade system holds the blades closed during flight. Stainless steel blades have the exclusive Diamize Edge for a super sharpness.", "text": "New Archery Products 125 Grain 3-Pack Crossbow Spitfire Broadhead Super durable hardened carbon steel Trophy Tip® Slimline ferrule improves flight and penetration. Micro-grooves to enhance accuracy and penetration. Snap locking blade system holds the blades closed during flight. Stainless steel blades have the exclusive Diamize Edge for a super sharpness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512kQhEsWoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DR12ZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "New Archery Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DR1768", "title": "October Mountain Products EZ Peeper String Separator", "description": "The October Mountain Products tool will allow you to insert a peep sight in seconds without damaging any of the fibers in the string. Without removing the string and without the aid of a bow press, separate and lock open the bow string while you install center servings, peeps and silencers. Sturdy aluminum construction. It`s a must have item for every archer`s tool box. Item Number: 32043", "text": "October Mountain Products EZ Peeper String Separator The October Mountain Products tool will allow you to insert a peep sight in seconds without damaging any of the fibers in the string. Without removing the string and without the aid of a bow press, separate and lock open the bow string while you install center servings, peeps and silencers. Sturdy aluminum construction. It`s a must have item for every archer`s tool box. Item Number: 32043", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PYdsNnMOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DR1768.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "October Mountain Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 10.94}}
{"item_id": "B003DR90AS", "title": "New Black Covered Handcuff Case TG222B", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Covered handcuff case with snap closure Lightweight material Holds one pair of standard or hinged handcuffs Fits up to 2\" belt", "text": "New Black Covered Handcuff Case TG222B Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Covered handcuff case with snap closure Lightweight material Holds one pair of standard or hinged handcuffs Fits up to 2\" belt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518-tpygMTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DR90AS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.5}}
