{"item_id": "B003DTLNTC", "title": "Takeya Classic Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve, Black, 16 oz", "description": "This Takeya Classic Water Bottle features a high quality glass bottle with a wide mouth, and is encapsulated by a silicone jacket that provides a nice grip, as well as protection for the bottle. The sleeve has a see-through window for checking the liquid level. The twist-off cap is airtight and includes an easy carry loop. This H2O bottle provides a healthier way to drink, and eliminates metallic or plastic tastes, and leaching from toxic plastics. This bottle holds 16-1/2 ounces, is dishwasher safe, and is available in several colors.", "text": "Takeya Classic Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve, Black, 16 oz This Takeya Classic Water Bottle features a high quality glass bottle with a wide mouth, and is encapsulated by a silicone jacket that provides a nice grip, as well as protection for the bottle. The sleeve has a see-through window for checking the liquid level. The twist-off cap is airtight and includes an easy carry loop. This H2O bottle provides a healthier way to drink, and eliminates metallic or plastic tastes, and leaching from toxic plastics. This bottle holds 16-1/2 ounces, is dishwasher safe, and is available in several colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213aOJwKfbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DTLNTC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Takeya", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DTLO32", "title": "Takeya Modern Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve, Black/Black Mist, 16-Ounce", "description": "This Takeya Slim Glass Water Bottle features a high quality glass bottle with a wide mouth, and is encapsulated by a silicone jacket that provides a nice grip, as well as protection for the bottle. The sleeve has a see-through window for checking the liquid level. The twist-off cap is airtight and includes an easy carry loop. This H2O bottle provides a healthier way to drink, and eliminates metallic or plastic tastes, and leaching from toxic plastics. This bottle holds 16 ounces, is dishwasher safe, and is available in several frosted colors.", "text": "Takeya Modern Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve, Black/Black Mist, 16-Ounce This Takeya Slim Glass Water Bottle features a high quality glass bottle with a wide mouth, and is encapsulated by a silicone jacket that provides a nice grip, as well as protection for the bottle. The sleeve has a see-through window for checking the liquid level. The twist-off cap is airtight and includes an easy carry loop. This H2O bottle provides a healthier way to drink, and eliminates metallic or plastic tastes, and leaching from toxic plastics. This bottle holds 16 ounces, is dishwasher safe, and is available in several frosted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21RfD-jqDAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DTLO32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Takeya", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DUHS4A", "title": "Bushnell Bear Safe Security Case for Trophy Cam Trail Cameras", "description": "Allows high level of protection from game. Can be used with Deluxe Tree Bracket (shown below). Can be secured with lag screws or with Master Python Lock. Comes with keyed padlock.", "text": "Bushnell Bear Safe Security Case for Trophy Cam Trail Cameras Allows high level of protection from game. Can be used with Deluxe Tree Bracket (shown below). Can be secured with lag screws or with Master Python Lock. Comes with keyed padlock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BpT7kgHjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DUHS4A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 26.93}}
{"item_id": "B003DVEICE", "title": "Elite Survival IWB BCH-6 Inside the Pant Clip Holster, Black", "description": "The Elite Inside the Pant Clip Holster is constructed of multi-layer, turned and quilted ballistic nylon and has a sturdy spring-steel clip that clamps on and off belts up to 2.25 Inch wide. The Elite Belt Clip Holster is ambidextrous, suited to multiple draw styles and available in sizes to fit most pistols and revolvers. This holster's sleek, comfortable design has made it a best seller. Fits the Glock 26,27,28,39; Taurus PT111/145, PT138; Kel-Tec P11; Bursa Thunder 45 Compact; S&W; M&P; Shield.", "text": "Elite Survival IWB BCH-6 Inside the Pant Clip Holster, Black The Elite Inside the Pant Clip Holster is constructed of multi-layer, turned and quilted ballistic nylon and has a sturdy spring-steel clip that clamps on and off belts up to 2.25 Inch wide. The Elite Belt Clip Holster is ambidextrous, suited to multiple draw styles and available in sizes to fit most pistols and revolvers. This holster's sleek, comfortable design has made it a best seller. Fits the Glock 26,27,28,39; Taurus PT111/145, PT138; Kel-Tec P11; Bursa Thunder 45 Compact; S&W; M&P; Shield.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YEnrE2DGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DVEICE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite Survival", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.97}}
{"item_id": "B003DVSPYG", "title": "Holster for SW9VE, SW40VE with Underbarrel Laser", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for SW9VE, SW40VE with Underbarrel Laser This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YSi6ewu5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DVSPYG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B003DW3Q8A", "title": "BARSKA Cross Dot Electro Sight Multi Rail Tactical Riflescope (1x30)", "description": "Barska's Multi-Rail Electro Sight riflescope is specifically designed for tactical shooters that need a versatile scope for both short-distance, quick-acquisition shooting and medium- to long-distance shooting. The scope is equipped with integrated Weaver-style 7/8-inch Picatinny tactical rails, which allow you to customize the scope with additional aiming accessories, such as a laser sight, flashlight, or secondary sight. For example, a laser sight helps you zero in the scope at a short distance (50 yards) and then zero the scope reticle in at a longer distance (100 yards). This allows you to instantly shoot targets at two different distances. Other features include an IR cross dot reticle, adjustable rheostat settings, and a variety of accessories, including a flashlight, red laser sight, scope caps, battery, and lens cloth.The Electro Sight riflescope includes an IR cross dot reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 1xObjective lens: 30mmReticle: IR cross dotField of view: 47.2 feet @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 9 to 16.5mmEye relief: UnlimitedAdjustment knob: Rheostat settingsFinish: Black matteLength: 5.5 inchesWeight: 14 ouncesWarranty: 1 year limitedAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA Cross Dot Electro Sight Multi Rail Tactical Riflescope (1x30) Barska's Multi-Rail Electro Sight riflescope is specifically designed for tactical shooters that need a versatile scope for both short-distance, quick-acquisition shooting and medium- to long-distance shooting. The scope is equipped with integrated Weaver-style 7/8-inch Picatinny tactical rails, which allow you to customize the scope with additional aiming accessories, such as a laser sight, flashlight, or secondary sight. For example, a laser sight helps you zero in the scope at a short distance (50 yards) and then zero the scope reticle in at a longer distance (100 yards). This allows you to instantly shoot targets at two different distances. Other features include an IR cross dot reticle, adjustable rheostat settings, and a variety of accessories, including a flashlight, red laser sight, scope caps, battery, and lens cloth.The Electro Sight riflescope includes an IR cross dot reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 1xObjective lens: 30mmReticle: IR cross dotField of view: 47.2 feet @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 9 to 16.5mmEye relief: UnlimitedAdjustment knob: Rheostat settingsFinish: Black matteLength: 5.5 inchesWeight: 14 ouncesWarranty: 1 year limitedAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qhgSBLt%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DW3Q8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DW5KH0", "title": "GAMO Blue Flame .177 Caliber Pellets (100 Count Blister Pack)", "description": "Specially formulated blue polymer tip causes rapid expansion in the ultra light, 5.4 grain PBA Pellet. Velocity is enhanced an additional 5% over standard lead ammo.", "text": "GAMO Blue Flame .177 Caliber Pellets (100 Count Blister Pack) Specially formulated blue polymer tip causes rapid expansion in the ultra light, 5.4 grain PBA Pellet. Velocity is enhanced an additional 5% over standard lead ammo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510nP1e1LRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DW5KH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 9.91}}
{"item_id": "B003DW6SZS", "title": "Allen Company Pagosa Day Pack (1600 Cubic Inch Capacity, Realtree Ap)", "description": "19090 Features: -Waist belt adjusts to 54''.-Shoulder straps have mesh ventilation.-Hydration ready holds up to 2.5 liter bladder (not included).-Quiet zipper pulls.-Built in padded carry handle. Dimensions: -Main compartment: 19'' H x 13'' W x 6'' D.-Front compartment: 11.5'' H x 9.5'' W x 2'' D.-Dimensions: 22'' H x 12'' W x 6.5'' D.", "text": "Allen Company Pagosa Day Pack (1600 Cubic Inch Capacity, Realtree Ap) 19090 Features: -Waist belt adjusts to 54''.-Shoulder straps have mesh ventilation.-Hydration ready holds up to 2.5 liter bladder (not included).-Quiet zipper pulls.-Built in padded carry handle. Dimensions: -Main compartment: 19'' H x 13'' W x 6'' D.-Front compartment: 11.5'' H x 9.5'' W x 2'' D.-Dimensions: 22'' H x 12'' W x 6.5'' D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511i1Zxm6eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DW6SZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DW8NBU", "title": "Allen Company Pathfinder Fanny Pack with Shoulder Straps (Realtree Ap)", "description": "19180 Features: -Wide shoulder straps.-Silent zipper pulls.-Dual cinch straps accommodates lashing of jackets and accessories.-Removable waist belt with 4 buddy lock accessory attachment points.-Adjustable sternum strap. Construction: -Constructed of waterproof fabric. Dimensions: -Dimensions: 15.5'' H x 18'' W x 4'' D.", "text": "Allen Company Pathfinder Fanny Pack with Shoulder Straps (Realtree Ap) 19180 Features: -Wide shoulder straps.-Silent zipper pulls.-Dual cinch straps accommodates lashing of jackets and accessories.-Removable waist belt with 4 buddy lock accessory attachment points.-Adjustable sternum strap. Construction: -Constructed of waterproof fabric. Dimensions: -Dimensions: 15.5'' H x 18'' W x 4'' D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ha69VPkoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DW8NBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 56.99}}
