{"item_id": "B003DWD6IU", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Dual Mag for Single Stacks)", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Dual Mag for Single Stacks) BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NsrSQfvAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DWD6IU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B003DWDBQM", "title": "Lyman Universal Case Trimmer with Carbide Cutter and 9 Pilot Multi-Pack", "description": "The new Universal Carbide Case Trimmer features a premium Carbide Cutter Head with a fine grain and ultra-sharp cutting edge. The new Carbide Head will hold its edge longer, making this Trimmer ideal for volume reloaders. The popular patented Universal Chuckhead handles any case from .17 caliber to .458 caliber with no collets required. The Trimmer includes 9 of the most popular pilots.", "text": "Lyman Universal Case Trimmer with Carbide Cutter and 9 Pilot Multi-Pack The new Universal Carbide Case Trimmer features a premium Carbide Cutter Head with a fine grain and ultra-sharp cutting edge. The new Carbide Head will hold its edge longer, making this Trimmer ideal for volume reloaders. The popular patented Universal Chuckhead handles any case from .17 caliber to .458 caliber with no collets required. The Trimmer includes 9 of the most popular pilots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xeSB2dBBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DWDBQM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 97.79}}
{"item_id": "B003DWEWHO", "title": "Allen Company Nomad 3 Pocket Fanny Pack with Water Bottle Holster (Oakbrush)", "description": "19002 Features: -Padded hip pad.-Belt adjusts to 54''.-Water bottle pocket.-Outside pocket with zipper closure for small accessories. Construction: -Constructed of waterproof fabric. Dimensions: -Main compartment: 8'' H x 10'' W x 6'' D.-Dimensions: 8'' H x 12'' W x 2.5'' D.", "text": "Allen Company Nomad 3 Pocket Fanny Pack with Water Bottle Holster (Oakbrush) 19002 Features: -Padded hip pad.-Belt adjusts to 54''.-Water bottle pocket.-Outside pocket with zipper closure for small accessories. Construction: -Constructed of waterproof fabric. Dimensions: -Main compartment: 8'' H x 10'' W x 6'' D.-Dimensions: 8'' H x 12'' W x 2.5'' D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l%2BO2i6wcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DWEWHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 20.41}}
{"item_id": "B003DWFCDC", "title": "Lyman Reloading Cast Iron Lead Pot, 10-Pounds", "description": "Lyman's new 10 lb. Cast Iron lead pot allows the bullet caster to use any source of heat for melting his lead alloy. Nominal pot capacity is ten pounds of alloy. Flat bottom prevents tipping. New design includes convenient pour spout.", "text": "Lyman Reloading Cast Iron Lead Pot, 10-Pounds Lyman's new 10 lb. Cast Iron lead pot allows the bullet caster to use any source of heat for melting his lead alloy. Nominal pot capacity is ten pounds of alloy. Flat bottom prevents tipping. New design includes convenient pour spout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O9DeABNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DWFCDC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B003DWGNJO", "title": "Allen Company Tejon Scoped Rifle Case with Pockets (Break-Up, 48-Inch)", "description": "Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling is super-tough protection for you rifle AND MORE. More than just a rifle case! This tough Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling gives your rifle A+ protection with a rugged Endura nylon shell and thick foam to absorb punishment and rough handling. But it's also made with easy transport in mind, too. Extra wide construction accommodates your scope and bi-pod, while 3 handy pockets carry any extra accessories. There's even and adjustable, padded sling! Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. One tough customer: Tough Endura nylon shell resists scrapes and snags... oversized design fits scopes and bipods too; 1 1/4\" foam padding offers heavy-duty protection for your gun while you travel... sturdy-yet soft 210-denier polyester lining; Reinforced padded web handles are strong and reliable... won't come apart at the seams like the handles on bargain cases; Adjustable, padded sling; 3 zippered side storage pockets for ammo and field gear; Fits any rifle up to 48\". Dependable storage and transport for your weapon! Order Today! Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling", "text": "Allen Company Tejon Scoped Rifle Case with Pockets (Break-Up, 48-Inch) Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling is super-tough protection for you rifle AND MORE. More than just a rifle case! This tough Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling gives your rifle A+ protection with a rugged Endura nylon shell and thick foam to absorb punishment and rough handling. But it's also made with easy transport in mind, too. Extra wide construction accommodates your scope and bi-pod, while 3 handy pockets carry any extra accessories. There's even and adjustable, padded sling! Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. One tough customer: Tough Endura nylon shell resists scrapes and snags... oversized design fits scopes and bipods too; 1 1/4\" foam padding offers heavy-duty protection for your gun while you travel... sturdy-yet soft 210-denier polyester lining; Reinforced padded web handles are strong and reliable... won't come apart at the seams like the handles on bargain cases; Adjustable, padded sling; 3 zippered side storage pockets for ammo and field gear; Fits any rifle up to 48\". Dependable storage and transport for your weapon! Order Today! Allen Tejon Oversized Gun Case With Built-in Sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414LayuxE3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DWGNJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 49.99}}
