{"item_id": "B003DX9ATI", "title": "GO BELT-Go Belt-The Original No Bounce Runners Belt, Runners Gear Belt, Refuel Belt, Hydration Belt, Running, Hiking, Cycling, Fanny Pack, Marathon, 10K, 5K--GUARANTEED TO SHIP WITHIN 12 HRS OF ORDER TIME!", "description": "The \"Go Belt\" by Hippie Runner is an EXPANDABLE gear belt for triathalons, marathons, running races or just out being active. This new one-inch wide elastic belt is light weight and is fully adjustable which means a perfect fit every time for all waist sizes. Incredibly comfortable, each belt comes with 2 expandable zippered compartments that do not bounce and provide more than ample storage space for energy bars, gels, cell phones, and supplements. Additionally, the separate pockets were designed to keep your expensive cell phone or iPod safe from rubbing against your keys! Any cell phone will fit and you can even carry your passport & cash in the main pouch if you are travelling. No more worries about pick-pockets. NEW!! We have added 4 utility loops. These loops are located outside the pockets and are used for quick access to gels, bars, beans, inhalers, epi-pens, mace, etc. Also included are re-usable ties to attach your race number to the belt. This is handy during events which require layering of clothing early on. No more pinning your number to your shirt! Available in Black, Red, Silver, Teal, Orange, Neon Green, Purple, Neon Pink, Navy, Neon Yellow. The Hippie Runner Go Belt gear belt has set the standard for what runners have been asking for: a lightweight belt that will provide ample storage and does not bounce! Shop for yourself and as gifts! Multiple item discounts apply! All of our products are proudly MADE IN THE USA!", "text": "GO BELT-Go Belt-The Original No Bounce Runners Belt, Runners Gear Belt, Refuel Belt, Hydration Belt, Running, Hiking, Cycling, Fanny Pack, Marathon, 10K, 5K--GUARANTEED TO SHIP WITHIN 12 HRS OF ORDER TIME! The \"Go Belt\" by Hippie Runner is an EXPANDABLE gear belt for triathalons, marathons, running races or just out being active. This new one-inch wide elastic belt is light weight and is fully adjustable which means a perfect fit every time for all waist sizes. Incredibly comfortable, each belt comes with 2 expandable zippered compartments that do not bounce and provide more than ample storage space for energy bars, gels, cell phones, and supplements. Additionally, the separate pockets were designed to keep your expensive cell phone or iPod safe from rubbing against your keys! Any cell phone will fit and you can even carry your passport & cash in the main pouch if you are travelling. No more worries about pick-pockets. NEW!! We have added 4 utility loops. These loops are located outside the pockets and are used for quick access to gels, bars, beans, inhalers, epi-pens, mace, etc. Also included are re-usable ties to attach your race number to the belt. This is handy during events which require layering of clothing early on. No more pinning your number to your shirt! Available in Black, Red, Silver, Teal, Orange, Neon Green, Purple, Neon Pink, Navy, Neon Yellow. The Hippie Runner Go Belt gear belt has set the standard for what runners have been asking for: a lightweight belt that will provide ample storage and does not bounce! Shop for yourself and as gifts! Multiple item discounts apply! All of our products are proudly MADE IN THE USA!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sJ%2BYq6LhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003DX9ATI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYTENZ SPORTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 19.99}}
