{"item_id": "B003E0OWKW", "title": "Ameriglo Front Sight Tool for Glocks - Economy Model", "description": "GTool 3: 3/16\" nut driver for front sight installation Made of steel. Will perform multiple installations 1.5\" in length.", "text": "Ameriglo Front Sight Tool for Glocks - Economy Model GTool 3: 3/16\" nut driver for front sight installation Made of steel. Will perform multiple installations 1.5\" in length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aLHrCfVSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E0OWKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AmeriGlo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B003E2WQE4", "title": "TMS T-NS-MRC001 500-Pound Heavy Duty Motorcycle Dirt Bike Scooter Carrier Hitch Rack Hauler Trailer with Loading Ramp and Anti-Tilt Locking Device", "description": "The T-NS-MRC001 is time tested and proven to be the most reliable solution for hauling motocross bikes, scooters and off road dirt bikes. It is made out of 100% heavy duty for added strength and durability. It is extremely portable and includes a loading ramp for loading your cycle on the carrier. Once loaded, the loading ramp attaches on the carrier next to the carrier track for easy transport. This motorcycle hitch carrier has a carrying capacity of 500 lbs. It fits a standard 2\" square class II, III, IV, or V receiver.", "text": "TMS T-NS-MRC001 500-Pound Heavy Duty Motorcycle Dirt Bike Scooter Carrier Hitch Rack Hauler Trailer with Loading Ramp and Anti-Tilt Locking Device The T-NS-MRC001 is time tested and proven to be the most reliable solution for hauling motocross bikes, scooters and off road dirt bikes. It is made out of 100% heavy duty for added strength and durability. It is extremely portable and includes a loading ramp for loading your cycle on the carrier. Once loaded, the loading ramp attaches on the carrier next to the carrier track for easy transport. This motorcycle hitch carrier has a carrying capacity of 500 lbs. It fits a standard 2\" square class II, III, IV, or V receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gteX5WHqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E2WQE4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]]}}
