{"item_id": "B003E6O1UW", "title": "Nylon Gun Hoster For Smith and Wesson 22A With 5.5\" Barrel", "description": "The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-21 holster is Custom fit for the Smith and Wesson 22A with 5.5\" barrel.", "text": "Nylon Gun Hoster For Smith and Wesson 22A With 5.5\" Barrel The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster. Has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is the best looking best quality holster on the market, Look at what it offers. It's Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon, inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Comes with extra mag pouch on front of holster. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-21 holster is Custom fit for the Smith and Wesson 22A with 5.5\" barrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PatX4zgUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E6O1UW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B003E7NH5Q", "title": "Universal Polymer Clamp On Bipod", "description": "Great light weight universal bipod, you can use as back up bipod. Made by polymer, it won't scratch your barrel like conventional aluminum made bipod.", "text": "Universal Polymer Clamp On Bipod Great light weight universal bipod, you can use as back up bipod. Made by polymer, it won't scratch your barrel like conventional aluminum made bipod.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316Up1ZbjmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E7NH5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B003E7R004", "title": "ESS Eyewear CDI MAX Sunglasses, Black", "description": "Think of the CDI MAX as the original CDI on steroids. With a larger frame, thicker lenses and a whole lot more attitude, this is the ultimate sunglass for those who live life to the max. The extra-tough 2.4mm lenses are some of the thickest of any sunglass in the world and with maximum lens wrap you'll be more covered than ever before. Similar to the battlefield-proven CDI, the CDI MAX features the ESS Lateral Exchange System, allowing you to quickly adapt to your environment by interchanging any of the five available lens colors. Medium-Large Fit. Compliant with U.S. MIL SPEC MIL-PRF-31013 (Clause 3.5.1.1), ANSI Z87.1-2010, CE EN 166 and U.S. Federal OSHA. All CDI MAX lenses provide 100% UVA/UVB protection. The CDI MAX kit includes: A Black CDI MAX frame, two sets of high-impact lenses (Clear & Smoke Gray), an elastic retention strap, a zippered hard case and a micro-fiber drawstring pouch.", "text": "ESS Eyewear CDI MAX Sunglasses, Black Think of the CDI MAX as the original CDI on steroids. With a larger frame, thicker lenses and a whole lot more attitude, this is the ultimate sunglass for those who live life to the max. The extra-tough 2.4mm lenses are some of the thickest of any sunglass in the world and with maximum lens wrap you'll be more covered than ever before. Similar to the battlefield-proven CDI, the CDI MAX features the ESS Lateral Exchange System, allowing you to quickly adapt to your environment by interchanging any of the five available lens colors. Medium-Large Fit. Compliant with U.S. MIL SPEC MIL-PRF-31013 (Clause 3.5.1.1), ANSI Z87.1-2010, CE EN 166 and U.S. Federal OSHA. All CDI MAX lenses provide 100% UVA/UVB protection. The CDI MAX kit includes: A Black CDI MAX frame, two sets of high-impact lenses (Clear & Smoke Gray), an elastic retention strap, a zippered hard case and a micro-fiber drawstring pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DyTY08VPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E7R004.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESS Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 69.32}}
{"item_id": "B003E89038", "title": "Smiffy's Men's Belt And Holster", "description": "", "text": "Smiffy's Men's Belt And Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d96hre1lL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E89038.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smiffy&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"], ["Toys & Games", "Party Supplies"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B003E8K15Y", "title": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for S&W M&P 9/40 (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "text": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for S&W M&P 9/40 (Black, Right-hand) Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417suLjav6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E8K15Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 42.65}}
{"item_id": "B003E8RXZA", "title": "Millett 4-16x50 Illuminated Tactical Riflescope (30mm Tube, .1 mil Click), Matte", "description": "With a virtually bulletproof design and precision controls, the Millet TRS 4-16x50 precision tactical riflescope makes you the master of any mission. The riflescope is equipped with an illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle system that clears the way through low light and over great distances, helping deliver your bullet with pinpoint accuracy. Using the same math as the standard Mil-Dot, the illuminated Mil-DotBar adds a thin line, dot, and adjustable green illumination. The reticle not only excels in varied lighting conditions, but is also easier to align during range-finding and holdover. Other features include multicoated optics that produce bright, crisp images and 3.5 inches of eye relief.The tactical riflescope includes an illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 4 to 16xObjective diameter: 50mmEye relief: 3.5 inchesTube diameter: 30mmAdjustment graduation: 0.1 mil click illuminatedOptics: MulticoatedReticle: Illuminated Mil-DotBarFinish: MatteAbout Millett IndustriesFounded in the mid-1970s, Millett Industries was the brainchild of Betty and Ray Millett, who purchased surplus cleaning equipment from an out-of-business clothing cleaner in Huntington Beach, California, and used the tanks and much of the plumbing to develop a new process for manufacturing metal and ceramic parts. Millett's first parts were made for the aerospace industry, but the company transitioned into firearms after the arrival of Betty and Ray's son Tom. The company's initial firearm products included the Mark 1 and 2 pistol sights, along with the Dual Crimp system. In 1999, Millett added red dot sights from Japan, and soon afterward developed a line of riflescopes. Now a division of Bushnell, Millett is currently headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "text": "Millett 4-16x50 Illuminated Tactical Riflescope (30mm Tube, .1 mil Click), Matte With a virtually bulletproof design and precision controls, the Millet TRS 4-16x50 precision tactical riflescope makes you the master of any mission. The riflescope is equipped with an illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle system that clears the way through low light and over great distances, helping deliver your bullet with pinpoint accuracy. Using the same math as the standard Mil-Dot, the illuminated Mil-DotBar adds a thin line, dot, and adjustable green illumination. The reticle not only excels in varied lighting conditions, but is also easier to align during range-finding and holdover. Other features include multicoated optics that produce bright, crisp images and 3.5 inches of eye relief.The tactical riflescope includes an illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle.Specifications:Magnification: 4 to 16xObjective diameter: 50mmEye relief: 3.5 inchesTube diameter: 30mmAdjustment graduation: 0.1 mil click illuminatedOptics: MulticoatedReticle: Illuminated Mil-DotBarFinish: MatteAbout Millett IndustriesFounded in the mid-1970s, Millett Industries was the brainchild of Betty and Ray Millett, who purchased surplus cleaning equipment from an out-of-business clothing cleaner in Huntington Beach, California, and used the tanks and much of the plumbing to develop a new process for manufacturing metal and ceramic parts. Millett's first parts were made for the aerospace industry, but the company transitioned into firearms after the arrival of Betty and Ray's son Tom. The company's initial firearm products included the Mark 1 and 2 pistol sights, along with the Dual Crimp system. In 1999, Millett added red dot sights from Japan, and soon afterward developed a line of riflescopes. Now a division of Bushnell, Millett is currently headquartered in Overland Park, Kansas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZNZ46lcrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E8RXZA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Millett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 302.66}}
{"item_id": "B003E8TZOW", "title": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for S&W M&P Compact 9/40 (Black, Right-hand)", "description": "Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "text": "Galco Triton Kydex IWB Holster for S&W M&P Compact 9/40 (Black, Right-hand) Constructed of durable, virtually maintenance-free Kydex, the Triton is fast, thin and easy to conceal. The belt clip offers quick on and off capability, while the sweat guard protects both gun and gun carrier. The firm holster body allows a smooth and easy return to the holster after the draw, while the raised sweat guard protects the pistol from corrosive perspiration – and also protects your skin from hard steel. Constructed of Kydex, the Triton is available in black and fits belts up to 13/4”.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JDRUlO7nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003E8TZOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 42.65}}
{"item_id": "B003EAOKL8", "title": "Maxforce Ant Bait Gel- (4 Tubes),ant Poison,ant Pest Control Products, Kill Ant", "description": "Maxforce Ant Bait Gel is effective against Argentine, Odorous House, Ghost, Pavement, Cornfield, and Little Black Ants. Ants ,sugar antwill carry the bait back to the nest and destroy the colony. You will see fewer ants in 3-5 days. Maxforce Ant Bait Gel provides for the sugar feeding needs of ants. If the ants are foraging for protein as well, it is recommended that a protein-based bait be used in conjunction with the gel bait. Box of 4/ 27 gram tubes. Plastic plunger included.", "text": "Maxforce Ant Bait Gel- (4 Tubes),ant Poison,ant Pest Control Products, Kill Ant Maxforce Ant Bait Gel is effective against Argentine, Odorous House, Ghost, Pavement, Cornfield, and Little Black Ants. Ants ,sugar antwill carry the bait back to the nest and destroy the colony. You will see fewer ants in 3-5 days. Maxforce Ant Bait Gel provides for the sugar feeding needs of ants. If the ants are foraging for protein as well, it is recommended that a protein-based bait be used in conjunction with the gel bait. Box of 4/ 27 gram tubes. Plastic plunger included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vzgOP1Q2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EAOKL8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxforce", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 31.4}}
{"item_id": "B003EAU5CG", "title": "Shimano XT CS-M771 Bicycle Cassette (10-Speed)", "description": "For their Dyna-Sys 10-speed system, Shimano added another cog to their venerable XT level cassette. So like the previous 9-speed versions, the CS-M771-10 XT Cassette has the same Hyperglide tooth and ramp shapes to help the chain move effortlessly across its range. The XT 10-Speed Cassette uses plated steel cogs for superior durability, but that doesn't mean that it weighs a ton. The largest six cogs are minimal in design and are pinned to two lightweight alloy spiders -- three cogs for each spider. The four smallest cogs go on separately, and the whole batch is secured with a sleek alloy lockring. This cassette is compatible with Shimano's Dyna-Sys 10-Speed shifter and rear derailleur. The Shimano CS-M771-10 XT Cassette is available with three different cog options -- 11/32t, 11/34t, and 11/36t. The cogs are configured as follows:11/32: 11-12-14-16-18-20-22-25-28-3211/34: 11-13-15-17-19-21-23-26-30-3411/36: 11-13-15-17-19-21-24-28-32-36", "text": "Shimano XT CS-M771 Bicycle Cassette (10-Speed) For their Dyna-Sys 10-speed system, Shimano added another cog to their venerable XT level cassette. So like the previous 9-speed versions, the CS-M771-10 XT Cassette has the same Hyperglide tooth and ramp shapes to help the chain move effortlessly across its range. The XT 10-Speed Cassette uses plated steel cogs for superior durability, but that doesn't mean that it weighs a ton. The largest six cogs are minimal in design and are pinned to two lightweight alloy spiders -- three cogs for each spider. The four smallest cogs go on separately, and the whole batch is secured with a sleek alloy lockring. This cassette is compatible with Shimano's Dyna-Sys 10-Speed shifter and rear derailleur. The Shimano CS-M771-10 XT Cassette is available with three different cog options -- 11/32t, 11/34t, and 11/36t. The cogs are configured as follows:11/32: 11-12-14-16-18-20-22-25-28-3211/34: 11-13-15-17-19-21-23-26-30-3411/36: 11-13-15-17-19-21-24-28-32-36", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wJ9Ge5JZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EAU5CG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EBJ36E", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Dial a Pellet (Silver, 4.5 mm)", "description": "Daisy comes to the rescue with the versatile Model 7781 Dial-A-Pellet. With the simple turn of a dial, one can choose from a variety of Precision Max ammo. Make a choice between a .177 cal. flat nosed pellet, a .177 cal. hollow-point pellet or a .177 cal. pointed pellet in one convenient package that will save space and handling time.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Dial a Pellet (Silver, 4.5 mm) Daisy comes to the rescue with the versatile Model 7781 Dial-A-Pellet. With the simple turn of a dial, one can choose from a variety of Precision Max ammo. Make a choice between a .177 cal. flat nosed pellet, a .177 cal. hollow-point pellet or a .177 cal. pointed pellet in one convenient package that will save space and handling time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511LrO898PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EBJ36E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 3.25}}
{"item_id": "B003EBL2VI", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products Model 35 Boxed (Black, 34.5 Inch)", "description": "Daisy introduces the latest in our PowerLine series of adult air rifles, the Model 35. This gun has a molded stock and forearm with checkering and woodgrain. The multi-pump pneumatic action and dual ammo capability makes it a fantastic backyard gun!", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products Model 35 Boxed (Black, 34.5 Inch) Daisy introduces the latest in our PowerLine series of adult air rifles, the Model 35. This gun has a molded stock and forearm with checkering and woodgrain. The multi-pump pneumatic action and dual ammo capability makes it a fantastic backyard gun!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21PD4vEo7QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EBL2VI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B003EEN8SA", "title": "ASICS Asics Led Light Light", "description": "", "text": "ASICS Asics Led Light Light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513VvB7W3oL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EEN8SA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ASICS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]], "price": 14.98}}
{"item_id": "B003EET2OE", "title": "Attwood Car-Top Kayak Carrier Kit", "description": "A simple, convenient kit for carrying a canoe or small boat on car top. Includes four supporting foam blocks that snap on boat's gunwale and help prevent scratches on car top. Two straps with adjusting buckles and clips. Includes 20' of polypropylene rope and S-hooks to secure bow and stern to bumpers. Straps are sturdy poly web with vinyl-coated clips.", "text": "Attwood Car-Top Kayak Carrier Kit A simple, convenient kit for carrying a canoe or small boat on car top. Includes four supporting foam blocks that snap on boat's gunwale and help prevent scratches on car top. Two straps with adjusting buckles and clips. Includes 20' of polypropylene rope and S-hooks to secure bow and stern to bumpers. Straps are sturdy poly web with vinyl-coated clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KFtBl0sAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EET2OE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "attwood", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 30.68}}
{"item_id": "B003EFF5LW", "title": "MSR Lightning Axis Snow Shoes", "description": "Packed with MSR's latest technologies, the Lightning Axis snowshoes represent a giant leap in snowshoeing performance, ease, and comfort. First, the new Axis Gait Efficiency system allows you to laterally adjust bindings independently of the frame, ensuring efficient, parallel-tracking snowshoes, regardless of natural toe-out and toe-in stances. In addition, new SpeedLock bindings offer set-it and forget-it simplicity with all-terrain comfort, while new Ergo Televators save you on the steeps. And of course, you get the benefit of our most aggressive, 360 degree Traction frames and Modular Flotation tails to provide you with the confidence and versatility you need to enjoy broad range of snowshoeing experiences.Features:360 degree Traction frames and Pivot crampons deliver advanced, edge-to-edge grip, delivering unmatched traction and securityWorld's first bilateral binding adjustment neutralizes variances in natural foot positions to ensure an efficient, parallel strideSet it and forget it, glove-friendly adjustment and comfort, plus an optional, included strap for maximum security on challenging terrainModular Flotation tails allow you the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with the added, on-demand flotation of optional, 5-inch tailsErgo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on climbs, with a new, ergonomic design that engages with a simply flick of a pole gripMade in Seattle, USASpecifications:Sizes: 22 inch / 25 inch / 30 inchWeight Per Pair: 4 pounds, 12 ounces / 4 pounds, 3 ounces / 4 pounds, 12 ouncesDimensions: 22 by 8 inches / 25 by 8 inches / 30 by 8 inches (L x W)Binding Type: SpeedLockGait: Unisex; normal widthFootwear Size Range: 4.5 M - 15 MWeight Capacity: Up to 180 pounds / 120 - 220 pounds / 150 - 280 poundsLoad with Tails: Up to 250 pounds / 120 - 280 pounds / 180 - 300+ pounds", "text": "MSR Lightning Axis Snow Shoes Packed with MSR's latest technologies, the Lightning Axis snowshoes represent a giant leap in snowshoeing performance, ease, and comfort. First, the new Axis Gait Efficiency system allows you to laterally adjust bindings independently of the frame, ensuring efficient, parallel-tracking snowshoes, regardless of natural toe-out and toe-in stances. In addition, new SpeedLock bindings offer set-it and forget-it simplicity with all-terrain comfort, while new Ergo Televators save you on the steeps. And of course, you get the benefit of our most aggressive, 360 degree Traction frames and Modular Flotation tails to provide you with the confidence and versatility you need to enjoy broad range of snowshoeing experiences.Features:360 degree Traction frames and Pivot crampons deliver advanced, edge-to-edge grip, delivering unmatched traction and securityWorld's first bilateral binding adjustment neutralizes variances in natural foot positions to ensure an efficient, parallel strideSet it and forget it, glove-friendly adjustment and comfort, plus an optional, included strap for maximum security on challenging terrainModular Flotation tails allow you the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with the added, on-demand flotation of optional, 5-inch tailsErgo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on climbs, with a new, ergonomic design that engages with a simply flick of a pole gripMade in Seattle, USASpecifications:Sizes: 22 inch / 25 inch / 30 inchWeight Per Pair: 4 pounds, 12 ounces / 4 pounds, 3 ounces / 4 pounds, 12 ouncesDimensions: 22 by 8 inches / 25 by 8 inches / 30 by 8 inches (L x W)Binding Type: SpeedLockGait: Unisex; normal widthFootwear Size Range: 4.5 M - 15 MWeight Capacity: Up to 180 pounds / 120 - 220 pounds / 150 - 280 poundsLoad with Tails: Up to 250 pounds / 120 - 280 pounds / 180 - 300+ pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mSX2ZEJHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EFF5LW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Snowshoes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EFF602", "title": "MSR Lightning Ascent Snow Shoes", "description": "Now compatible with the all-condition adaptability of MSR's Modular Flotation tails, the company's most aggressive snowshoes are built on a solid foundation of our advanced, 360 degree Traction frames and deliver a level of ultralight security that tubular frames simply can't--especially on traverses. New, dual-component, PosiLock AT bindings offer our most secure attachment, while aggressive steel cross members, Pivot Crampons and new, easily-engaged Ergo Televators back you up with every step.Features:360 degree Traction frames and Pivot crampons deliver advanced, edge-to-edge grip, delivering unmatched traction and securityTwo-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create our most secure, freeze-resistant attachment, regardless of footwearNow available with Modular Flotation tails to allow you the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with on-demand 5-inch tailsErgo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on climbs with an ergonomic design that engages with a simply flick of a pole gripMade in Seattle, USASpecifications:Sizes: 22 inch / 25 inch / 30 inchWeight Per Pair: 3 pounds, 12 ounces / 3 pounds, 14 ounces / 4 pounds, 8 ouncesDimensions: 22 by 8 inches / 25 by 8 inches / 30 by 8 inches (L x W)Binding Type: PosiTrack ATGait: Unisex; normal widthFootwear Size Range: 4.5 M - 15 MWeight Capacity: Up to 180 pounds / 120 - 220 pounds / 150 - 280 poundsLoad with Tails: Up to 250 pounds / 120 - 280 pounds / 180 - 300+ pounds", "text": "MSR Lightning Ascent Snow Shoes Now compatible with the all-condition adaptability of MSR's Modular Flotation tails, the company's most aggressive snowshoes are built on a solid foundation of our advanced, 360 degree Traction frames and deliver a level of ultralight security that tubular frames simply can't--especially on traverses. New, dual-component, PosiLock AT bindings offer our most secure attachment, while aggressive steel cross members, Pivot Crampons and new, easily-engaged Ergo Televators back you up with every step.Features:360 degree Traction frames and Pivot crampons deliver advanced, edge-to-edge grip, delivering unmatched traction and securityTwo-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create our most secure, freeze-resistant attachment, regardless of footwearNow available with Modular Flotation tails to allow you the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with on-demand 5-inch tailsErgo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on climbs with an ergonomic design that engages with a simply flick of a pole gripMade in Seattle, USASpecifications:Sizes: 22 inch / 25 inch / 30 inchWeight Per Pair: 3 pounds, 12 ounces / 3 pounds, 14 ounces / 4 pounds, 8 ouncesDimensions: 22 by 8 inches / 25 by 8 inches / 30 by 8 inches (L x W)Binding Type: PosiTrack ATGait: Unisex; normal widthFootwear Size Range: 4.5 M - 15 MWeight Capacity: Up to 180 pounds / 120 - 220 pounds / 150 - 280 poundsLoad with Tails: Up to 250 pounds / 120 - 280 pounds / 180 - 300+ pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417e-c9ZezL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EFF602.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Snowshoes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EFKMJW", "title": "Thermarest Ridge Rest Solar Sleeping Pad", "description": "Our most durable and economical closed-cell foam pad is now 10% warmer with no increase I weight. A new aluminized surface reflects body heat addingto the effectiveness of heat-trapping valleys and soft, supportive ridges. R-Value: 3.5, Thickness: 2 cm,", "text": "Thermarest Ridge Rest Solar Sleeping Pad Our most durable and economical closed-cell foam pad is now 10% warmer with no increase I weight. A new aluminized surface reflects body heat addingto the effectiveness of heat-trapping valleys and soft, supportive ridges. R-Value: 3.5, Thickness: 2 cm,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51g0GUW%2BHDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EFKMJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads"]]}}
