{"item_id": "B003EGR118", "title": "Aurorae Yoga Slip Free Value Package (Yoga Slip Free Rosin Bag with Sport Micro-Fiber 30\"x20\"Towel) Stop Slipping on your Yoga Mat.", "description": "Stop Slipping on your Yoga MatAurorae's Yoga Slip Free Package Combines our Aurorae's Sport/Yoga Towel. Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multi-purpose Lush Micro-fiber material. Provides Slip Free Surface. Measures 30\" x 20\"Aurorae Yoga Rosin Bag has been developed to aid in the prevention of Slipping on your Yoga mat.Similar to gymnasts, tennis players and baseball pitchers, perspiration creates slipping problems when a firm grip is necessary to maximize their performance.Our Aurorae Yoga Rosin Bag increases your gripping power and absorbs perspiration with the touch of the bag.The Rosin should be applied to both your hands and feet as well as your mat before your practice. Use as needed during your practice.The materials in this Rosin come from Trees, Plants and Rocks.Please make sure you store your Yoga Rosin Bag in the Zip lock bag it comes with to increase it's life.Works incredibly well with our Yoga Micro-Fiber Sport Towel to keep you from slipping on your mat.Our new Yoga Micro-Fiber Sport Towel, with Embroidery, will keep you dry and help prevent you from slipping on your Mat.It's 80% Polyester 20% Polycimide to absorb perspiration and keep you dry during your practice.It's just the right dimensions 30\"x20\" to keep you dry yet still be practical enough to easily fold into your yoga bag.Machine washable and hemmed on all sides for long lasting quality you expect from Aurorae.What a great value when sold together.", "text": "Aurorae Yoga Slip Free Value Package (Yoga Slip Free Rosin Bag with Sport Micro-Fiber 30\"x20\"Towel) Stop Slipping on your Yoga Mat. Stop Slipping on your Yoga MatAurorae's Yoga Slip Free Package Combines our Aurorae's Sport/Yoga Towel. Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multi-purpose Lush Micro-fiber material. Provides Slip Free Surface. Measures 30\" x 20\"Aurorae Yoga Rosin Bag has been developed to aid in the prevention of Slipping on your Yoga mat.Similar to gymnasts, tennis players and baseball pitchers, perspiration creates slipping problems when a firm grip is necessary to maximize their performance.Our Aurorae Yoga Rosin Bag increases your gripping power and absorbs perspiration with the touch of the bag.The Rosin should be applied to both your hands and feet as well as your mat before your practice. Use as needed during your practice.The materials in this Rosin come from Trees, Plants and Rocks.Please make sure you store your Yoga Rosin Bag in the Zip lock bag it comes with to increase it's life.Works incredibly well with our Yoga Micro-Fiber Sport Towel to keep you from slipping on your mat.Our new Yoga Micro-Fiber Sport Towel, with Embroidery, will keep you dry and help prevent you from slipping on your Mat.It's 80% Polyester 20% Polycimide to absorb perspiration and keep you dry during your practice.It's just the right dimensions 30\"x20\" to keep you dry yet still be practical enough to easily fold into your yoga bag.Machine washable and hemmed on all sides for long lasting quality you expect from Aurorae.What a great value when sold together.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/610OqzXPAAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EGR118.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aurorae", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga"]], "price": 15.65}}
