{"item_id": "B003EGRSWK", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible EMT/First Aid Pouch", "description": "Designed to securely hold your first aid kit, including a battle dressing or blood stopper kit. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself. 7\" tall x 5\" wide x 2-1/2\" deep.Fits on your MOLLE compatible tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, belt, or other equipment.Please note: This listing is for the empty first aid kit is empty and does not contain medical supplies. You must add the contents yourself.This listing is for a pouch.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible EMT/First Aid Pouch Designed to securely hold your first aid kit, including a battle dressing or blood stopper kit. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself. 7\" tall x 5\" wide x 2-1/2\" deep.Fits on your MOLLE compatible tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, belt, or other equipment.Please note: This listing is for the empty first aid kit is empty and does not contain medical supplies. You must add the contents yourself.This listing is for a pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o1h0fZmnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EGRSWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 13.95}}
