{"item_id": "B003EIXFHA", "title": "Banjo Brothers Minnehaha Canvas Bicycle Barrel Bag", "description": "This versatile bag mounts either to handlebars or saddle with capacity for tools, mini-pump, wallet, phone and more. Internal HDPE keeps it from sagging, and a detachable lower strap prevents sway.", "text": "Banjo Brothers Minnehaha Canvas Bicycle Barrel Bag This versatile bag mounts either to handlebars or saddle with capacity for tools, mini-pump, wallet, phone and more. Internal HDPE keeps it from sagging, and a detachable lower strap prevents sway.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413taTv%2BxZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EIXFHA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]], "price": 27.99}}
