{"item_id": "B003EL7122", "title": "Sightmark CRL Triple Duty Laser Sights", "description": "The Sightmark series of Triple Duty tactical laser sights are multifunctional weapon sights inspired by military and law enforcement applications. They feature intense, accurate laser beams that are nearly flawless in their quickness of target acquisition, which make them perfect for rapid fire or moving target shooting. The Triple Duty CRL laser sight has an ultra compact, low profile design with a built-in Weaver mount. The unique plastic composite body is lightweight, yet durable, and was created with the avid shooter in mind. With all these features, included accessories and a Limited Lifetime Warranty, the Triple Duty CRL laser sight is a must-have addition to any well-stocked arsenal.", "text": "Sightmark CRL Triple Duty Laser Sights The Sightmark series of Triple Duty tactical laser sights are multifunctional weapon sights inspired by military and law enforcement applications. They feature intense, accurate laser beams that are nearly flawless in their quickness of target acquisition, which make them perfect for rapid fire or moving target shooting. The Triple Duty CRL laser sight has an ultra compact, low profile design with a built-in Weaver mount. The unique plastic composite body is lightweight, yet durable, and was created with the avid shooter in mind. With all these features, included accessories and a Limited Lifetime Warranty, the Triple Duty CRL laser sight is a must-have addition to any well-stocked arsenal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-tvVXvDuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EL7122.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 39.97}}
{"item_id": "B003EL97V0", "title": "NcStar AR15 QR Weaver Mount/Cantilever Scope Mount Rear Ring/30mm and 1-Inch Inserts (MARCQ), Black", "description": "The MARCQ quick-release Weaver-style cantilever mount is the most versatile mount in the NcStar lineup. With the MARCQ, you can mount virtually any riflescope or red dot sight to your AR-15 or M16 rifle in a number of different configurations. The unit includes NcStar's renowned QR lever system, which makes it lightning fast to mount the MARCQ to your flat top. The MARCQ also includes a detachable 30mm rear ring with 1-inch inserts. The rear rings rides on a dovetail so you can easily adjust the spacing to create a customized fit. Or you can remove the rear ring and set up your red dot sight to co-witness with your iron sights. Made of hard-anodized aluminum and solid steel, the mount isn't going anywhere once it's locked in.", "text": "NcStar AR15 QR Weaver Mount/Cantilever Scope Mount Rear Ring/30mm and 1-Inch Inserts (MARCQ), Black The MARCQ quick-release Weaver-style cantilever mount is the most versatile mount in the NcStar lineup. With the MARCQ, you can mount virtually any riflescope or red dot sight to your AR-15 or M16 rifle in a number of different configurations. The unit includes NcStar's renowned QR lever system, which makes it lightning fast to mount the MARCQ to your flat top. The MARCQ also includes a detachable 30mm rear ring with 1-inch inserts. The rear rings rides on a dovetail so you can easily adjust the spacing to create a customized fit. Or you can remove the rear ring and set up your red dot sight to co-witness with your iron sights. Made of hard-anodized aluminum and solid steel, the mount isn't going anywhere once it's locked in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414Eg%2BOBaqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EL97V0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ELGD2G", "title": "12 Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows", "description": "12 - Pk. of Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows. Hit 'em hard and sharp! Nothing is faster or more hard-hitting accurate than a carbon arrow, loaded with quality and performance! Multi-layer, seamless carbon construction for maximum durability. They come ready to cut to your specific draw length with aluminum inserts so you can attach your own broadheads. For hunting or target shooting, you simply can't find a better mix of performance and value. True flight: Seamless carbon arrow shaft for maximum durability; Straightness: +/- .006\"; Aluminum inserts and internal nocks included; 2\" high-performance VaneTec vanes increase speed, accuracy and silence of arrow performance. Durability, too; +/- 2 gr. / dozen; 8.6 gpi; .400 spine; 100% pure carbon construction; Rated up to 70-lb. draw weight, for both fixed-blade broadheads and mechanical heads; 32\" uncut arrow length (use high-speed saw to customize). Order yours today! Please Note: Color of nocks may vary. Sorry, no color choice. WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase this product. This product cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. 12 Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows", "text": "12 Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows 12 - Pk. of Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows. Hit 'em hard and sharp! Nothing is faster or more hard-hitting accurate than a carbon arrow, loaded with quality and performance! Multi-layer, seamless carbon construction for maximum durability. They come ready to cut to your specific draw length with aluminum inserts so you can attach your own broadheads. For hunting or target shooting, you simply can't find a better mix of performance and value. True flight: Seamless carbon arrow shaft for maximum durability; Straightness: +/- .006\"; Aluminum inserts and internal nocks included; 2\" high-performance VaneTec vanes increase speed, accuracy and silence of arrow performance. Durability, too; +/- 2 gr. / dozen; 8.6 gpi; .400 spine; 100% pure carbon construction; Rated up to 70-lb. draw weight, for both fixed-blade broadheads and mechanical heads; 32\" uncut arrow length (use high-speed saw to customize). Order yours today! Please Note: Color of nocks may vary. Sorry, no color choice. WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase this product. This product cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. 12 Gold Tip Trophy Hunter HP Arrows", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S-FdnFFgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ELGD2G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ELH3F2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Dual Mag for Double Stacks)", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Dual Mag for Double Stacks) BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qaKjZfVBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ELH3F2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 36.09}}
{"item_id": "B003ELH4M4", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Double Stack - Brown), (All dbl stack mags except Glock 21)", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Leather Magazine Pouch (Double Stack - Brown), (All dbl stack mags except Glock 21) BLACKHAWK!'s single-stack and double-stack leather magazine pouches not only give you the ability to fit a variety of magazines, but an integral tension-adjustable screw allows you to adjust the carry angle by 30 degrees in either direction. The angle-adjustable belt clip features an aggressive talon that keeps the pouch in place. For additional versatility, remove the belt clip from its mount, and use the clip mount as a belt loop with most dress belts. The Leather Magazine Pouch is available for single-stack 9mm, 10mm, .40 cal, and .45 cal magazines or for double-stack 9mm and .40 cal magazines (metal or polymer).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lHGsov-lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ELH4M4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 27.49}}
{"item_id": "B003ELMSFC", "title": "NcStar AR15 Golf Ball Launcher (AGOLF)", "description": "Let the fun begin with the NcStar AR-15 golf ball launcher. The launcher attaches to virtually any AR-15 with a threaded barrel. To use, remove the flash hider from your AR-15, install the launcher, and load blank ammunition into your rifle. Then you simply drop golf balls into the launcher and propel them down the range.", "text": "NcStar AR15 Golf Ball Launcher (AGOLF) Let the fun begin with the NcStar AR-15 golf ball launcher. The launcher attaches to virtually any AR-15 with a threaded barrel. To use, remove the flash hider from your AR-15, install the launcher, and load blank ammunition into your rifle. Then you simply drop golf balls into the launcher and propel them down the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21DKDxJaOhL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ELMSFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 31.5}}
{"item_id": "B003ELQVQE", "title": "Wiley X Guard Sunglasses, Smoke Grey/Clear/Light Rust, Matte Black", "description": "Featuring shatterproof Selenite polycarbonate lenses, these sunglasses meet all lighting conditions for shooting, hunting and everyday wear. The nearly indestructible nylon frames have removable soft-foam brow pads and rubber no-slip nose pads for a secure fit. T-peg adjustable head straps. ANSI Z87.1-2003-certified as OSHA occupational-grade eye protection. Smoke gray, light rust and clear lenses meet military ballistic specs for combat eyewear protection. Includes a zippered nylon case with belt loops. Mil Spec rated as Protective Combat Eyewear.", "text": "Wiley X Guard Sunglasses, Smoke Grey/Clear/Light Rust, Matte Black Featuring shatterproof Selenite polycarbonate lenses, these sunglasses meet all lighting conditions for shooting, hunting and everyday wear. The nearly indestructible nylon frames have removable soft-foam brow pads and rubber no-slip nose pads for a secure fit. T-peg adjustable head straps. ANSI Z87.1-2003-certified as OSHA occupational-grade eye protection. Smoke gray, light rust and clear lenses meet military ballistic specs for combat eyewear protection. Includes a zippered nylon case with belt loops. Mil Spec rated as Protective Combat Eyewear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K442IpQ5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ELQVQE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wiley X", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 49.29}}
