{"item_id": "B003EM8VAM", "title": "Cablz Original Style Cable Eyewear Retention System", "description": "Why wear other eyewear retainers that hang on your neck, soak up sweat, get dirty, stink and fray. Cablz are unique in the way that they do not lie on your neck, distract you or irritate your skin. Pick the size and finish that you need. Whether you are fishing, biking, hiking, rock climbing, snow skiing, snowmobiling or just enjoying the great outdoors Cablz are the ideal eyewear retenetion system that will keep your eyewear secure and stylish.", "text": "Cablz Original Style Cable Eyewear Retention System Why wear other eyewear retainers that hang on your neck, soak up sweat, get dirty, stink and fray. Cablz are unique in the way that they do not lie on your neck, distract you or irritate your skin. Pick the size and finish that you need. Whether you are fishing, biking, hiking, rock climbing, snow skiing, snowmobiling or just enjoying the great outdoors Cablz are the ideal eyewear retenetion system that will keep your eyewear secure and stylish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wr2%2BNxf%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EM8VAM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Safety Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EM9AIY", "title": "Nalgene HDPE Grip-N-Gulp Water Bottle (Slime Green), 12 ounces", "description": "Side indents are easy for tiny hands to grasp. Soft touch lid makes drinking comfortable. Superior threading on cup and lid is engineered to prevent spills. Cup, lid and removable sipper valve are all top rack dishwasher safe. Lid loop can be clipped to backpack, diaper bag or stroller. Cup is compatible with OTG, ATB & wide-mouth closures.", "text": "Nalgene HDPE Grip-N-Gulp Water Bottle (Slime Green), 12 ounces Side indents are easy for tiny hands to grasp. Soft touch lid makes drinking comfortable. Superior threading on cup and lid is engineered to prevent spills. Cup, lid and removable sipper valve are all top rack dishwasher safe. Lid loop can be clipped to backpack, diaper bag or stroller. Cup is compatible with OTG, ATB & wide-mouth closures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314A1kcWwbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EM9AIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 6.94}}
{"item_id": "B003EMEGA6", "title": "Slumberjack Micro Fleece Mummy Liner", "description": "Add warmth to your mummy bag, and keep the inside clean to, with the Slumberjack Micro Fleece Mummy Liner. Polyester micro fleece keeps you comfortable all night.Anti-pilling, double-brushed polyester micro fleece fabric..Fits to 6'..Size: 30\"x82\"..Weight: 1 lb. 1 oz..Pack Size: 5\"x11\"..", "text": "Slumberjack Micro Fleece Mummy Liner Add warmth to your mummy bag, and keep the inside clean to, with the Slumberjack Micro Fleece Mummy Liner. Polyester micro fleece keeps you comfortable all night.Anti-pilling, double-brushed polyester micro fleece fabric..Fits to 6'..Size: 30\"x82\"..Weight: 1 lb. 1 oz..Pack Size: 5\"x11\"..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jousI5iDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EMEGA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slumberjack", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B003EMP89Y", "title": "The Clink N Drink Bottle Opener and Cap Catcher with Logo", "description": "The Clink N Drink bottle opener and cap catcher combo! Now with NEW, IMPROVED OPENER! The Clink N Drink has 4 rubber coated magnets that catch all your caps and hold it to any metallic* surface without scratching. You can put them anywhere you to love to drink. The Clink N Drink also comes with holes in the top and bottom for mounting against a non-magnetic surface. Easily mount the Clink n Drink to any solid surface including walls, cabinets, bars, decks, boats, RV's and even trees. It measures 5\" x 10\" and weighs 1.85lbs. The Clink N Drink comes with a quality stainless steel opener but you can always switch it out with any standard wall mounted opener. (*Aluminum is not magnetic. Stainless steel varies depending on the nickel content within the alloy.)", "text": "The Clink N Drink Bottle Opener and Cap Catcher with Logo The Clink N Drink bottle opener and cap catcher combo! Now with NEW, IMPROVED OPENER! The Clink N Drink has 4 rubber coated magnets that catch all your caps and hold it to any metallic* surface without scratching. You can put them anywhere you to love to drink. The Clink N Drink also comes with holes in the top and bottom for mounting against a non-magnetic surface. Easily mount the Clink n Drink to any solid surface including walls, cabinets, bars, decks, boats, RV's and even trees. It measures 5\" x 10\" and weighs 1.85lbs. The Clink N Drink comes with a quality stainless steel opener but you can always switch it out with any standard wall mounted opener. (*Aluminum is not magnetic. Stainless steel varies depending on the nickel content within the alloy.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wAB4mE%2B%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EMP89Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ENXY4E", "title": "Proform Ifit Module", "description": "Take your home cardio workouts to the next level with the ProForm iFit module. The iFit module connects your iFit Live-compatible home fitness equipment with the Internet via a wireless connection, allowing you to enjoy trails all over the world in the comfort of your living room. With iFit Live, you can customize your own fitness program, receive automatic workout downloads, manage your profile on iFit.com, and work out with famed trainer Jillian Michaels. You can also add competition to your workout with 5k races against your Facebook friends. Other interactive features include a nutrition and activity tracker, motivating text messages and emails, and workout videos available for download.The iFit module automatically uploads diverse workouts to your iFit Live-compatible fitness equipment.The iFit Live workouts are powered by Google Maps, giving you access to the world's running trails whether in Paris or Pasadena. Just decide where you want to run and draw your route; iFit will then turn it into a workout that's automatically uploaded to your fitness equipment. You can also select from dozens of iFit's favorite runs from around the world, or train for and compete in distance runs. You'll discover everything from 5k full runs to full marathons, taking you through the streets of Boston or the boroughs of New York City. As you work out, iFit Live controls the speed, incline, and resistance of your fitness equipment to simulate the terrain and distance of the route you're running.If running the globe isn't part of your program, you can work out instead with Jillian Michaels, America's Toughest Trainer. iFit teamed up with Jillian to develop workout programs that challenge beginners and seasoned athletes alike. Whether you want to power walk your way to your weight loss goals or perform at your highest level, Jillian's customized workout programs will get you there. And as you work out, you'll actually hear Jillian coaching, motivating, and helping you reach your goals.Best of all, the connection is completely wireless, so you can upload your workout results to your iFit.com profile in real time. Using iFit technology and your home wireless network, you'll find new workouts waiting for you everyday. The iFit module accommodates wired homes, too, with USB technology that delivers a powerful iFit experience.", "text": "Proform Ifit Module Take your home cardio workouts to the next level with the ProForm iFit module. The iFit module connects your iFit Live-compatible home fitness equipment with the Internet via a wireless connection, allowing you to enjoy trails all over the world in the comfort of your living room. With iFit Live, you can customize your own fitness program, receive automatic workout downloads, manage your profile on iFit.com, and work out with famed trainer Jillian Michaels. You can also add competition to your workout with 5k races against your Facebook friends. Other interactive features include a nutrition and activity tracker, motivating text messages and emails, and workout videos available for download.The iFit module automatically uploads diverse workouts to your iFit Live-compatible fitness equipment.The iFit Live workouts are powered by Google Maps, giving you access to the world's running trails whether in Paris or Pasadena. Just decide where you want to run and draw your route; iFit will then turn it into a workout that's automatically uploaded to your fitness equipment. You can also select from dozens of iFit's favorite runs from around the world, or train for and compete in distance runs. You'll discover everything from 5k full runs to full marathons, taking you through the streets of Boston or the boroughs of New York City. As you work out, iFit Live controls the speed, incline, and resistance of your fitness equipment to simulate the terrain and distance of the route you're running.If running the globe isn't part of your program, you can work out instead with Jillian Michaels, America's Toughest Trainer. iFit teamed up with Jillian to develop workout programs that challenge beginners and seasoned athletes alike. Whether you want to power walk your way to your weight loss goals or perform at your highest level, Jillian's customized workout programs will get you there. And as you work out, you'll actually hear Jillian coaching, motivating, and helping you reach your goals.Best of all, the connection is completely wireless, so you can upload your workout results to your iFit.com profile in real time. Using iFit technology and your home wireless network, you'll find new workouts waiting for you everyday. The iFit module accommodates wired homes, too, with USB technology that delivers a powerful iFit experience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-ucJzjQnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ENXY4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProForm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]], "price": 140.47}}
{"item_id": "B003EQENZ0", "title": "Bicygnals Indicator Bicycle Light", "description": "The Bicygnal Indicators are the lights to have to see and be seen! They include front switches to control front and rear indicators, wire-free communication, 5 super bright white LED's on head light, 3 super bright red LED's on rear light, flashing and non-flashing lighting modes, 8 super bright orange LED front indicators, 6 super bright orange LED rear indicators, and storage carry case.", "text": "Bicygnals Indicator Bicycle Light The Bicygnal Indicators are the lights to have to see and be seen! They include front switches to control front and rear indicators, wire-free communication, 5 super bright white LED's on head light, 3 super bright red LED's on rear light, flashing and non-flashing lighting modes, 8 super bright orange LED front indicators, 6 super bright orange LED rear indicators, and storage carry case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417tQ5rO97L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EQENZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EU6LS8", "title": "Drymax Lite Hiking Crew Socks", "description": "Hiking is one of the most fun outdoor activities, enjoyed by people of all ages. Hiking can be a challenge depending on the location, destination or weather. Hiking gear can make a big difference, using the wrong gear can ruin the fun. Wet socks are a hiker's worst enemy. Wet socks are uncomfortable, causing blisters, Athlete's Foot fungus and bacterial odors. In cold or freezing temperatures, moisture pulls heat away from the skin 23 times faster than air. This can reduce skin temperature so rapidly that wet feet not only feel painfully cold, but are much more susceptible to frostbite. The Lite Hiking v4 Socks have a special Dual Layer Moisture Removal System. This system instantly moves moisture from the skin, through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer, keeping feet dry. Staying dry is critical to remaining warm and safe in cold weather and comfortable in hot weather. Drymax is the least thermally conductive fiber. This means Drymax fibers keep feet warmer in cold weather because they draw less heat away from the skin. The Lite Hiking socks possess top mesh areas which help to release heat and sweat vapors keeping feet drier, cooler and more comfortable in warm weather. The Lite Hiking Sock is a Medium+ Density protective padded sock. Using dense padding, as opposed to thick padding protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. The Lite Hiking Socks were designed for use in cool to hot conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free all day long.", "text": "Drymax Lite Hiking Crew Socks Hiking is one of the most fun outdoor activities, enjoyed by people of all ages. Hiking can be a challenge depending on the location, destination or weather. Hiking gear can make a big difference, using the wrong gear can ruin the fun. Wet socks are a hiker's worst enemy. Wet socks are uncomfortable, causing blisters, Athlete's Foot fungus and bacterial odors. In cold or freezing temperatures, moisture pulls heat away from the skin 23 times faster than air. This can reduce skin temperature so rapidly that wet feet not only feel painfully cold, but are much more susceptible to frostbite. The Lite Hiking v4 Socks have a special Dual Layer Moisture Removal System. This system instantly moves moisture from the skin, through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer, keeping feet dry. Staying dry is critical to remaining warm and safe in cold weather and comfortable in hot weather. Drymax is the least thermally conductive fiber. This means Drymax fibers keep feet warmer in cold weather because they draw less heat away from the skin. The Lite Hiking socks possess top mesh areas which help to release heat and sweat vapors keeping feet drier, cooler and more comfortable in warm weather. The Lite Hiking Sock is a Medium+ Density protective padded sock. Using dense padding, as opposed to thick padding protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. The Lite Hiking Socks were designed for use in cool to hot conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free all day long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eQqe13B6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EU6LS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EU6LUQ", "title": "Drymax Lite Trail Run 1/4 Crew Socks", "description": "Trail dirt inside a sock is a bad thing; it can easily cause blisters or rib the skin raw. To help prevent dirt from getting inside Drymax Light Trail socks, we did not include vents. In addition, the Trail socks' double welted leg has extra padding around the ankle. This extra padding protects the leg and seals the top of the shoe to keep out dirt and debris. Wet feet can be a trail runner's worst enemy and getting wet feet is almost inevitable. The Drymax Light Trail Running socks' Dual Layer Moisture Elimination System actually removes sweat, sweat vapors and water from the skin through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer. The double welt top is made of Drymax fibers to repel water, so when a runner splashes through a creek, the top of the socks stay dry. Drymax Lite Trail Running Socks are a Medium + Density protective padded sock. Dense padding is used, as opposed to thick padding, as it protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. The Lite Trail Running Socks were designed for use in Mild to Hot conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free all day long.", "text": "Drymax Lite Trail Run 1/4 Crew Socks Trail dirt inside a sock is a bad thing; it can easily cause blisters or rib the skin raw. To help prevent dirt from getting inside Drymax Light Trail socks, we did not include vents. In addition, the Trail socks' double welted leg has extra padding around the ankle. This extra padding protects the leg and seals the top of the shoe to keep out dirt and debris. Wet feet can be a trail runner's worst enemy and getting wet feet is almost inevitable. The Drymax Light Trail Running socks' Dual Layer Moisture Elimination System actually removes sweat, sweat vapors and water from the skin through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer. The double welt top is made of Drymax fibers to repel water, so when a runner splashes through a creek, the top of the socks stay dry. Drymax Lite Trail Running Socks are a Medium + Density protective padded sock. Dense padding is used, as opposed to thick padding, as it protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. The Lite Trail Running Socks were designed for use in Mild to Hot conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free all day long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DvO%2BXQ%2BYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EU6LUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Boys", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EU8G22", "title": "Drymax Run Mini Crew Socks", "description": "As a runner, moisture is your feet's worst enemy. Moisture causes blisters, discomfort, Athlete's Foot and allows odor causing bacteria to flourish. However you also know your feet are going to get wet, either from sweating, stepping in a puddle, running across wet grass or getting caught in the rain. You can even get splashed at a race water station and instead of the water going in you, it goes on you. The new Running Socks were designed with a special Dual Layer Moisture Removal System that moves moisture off the skin through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer almost instantly. Our Running Socks are a Medium+ Density protective padded sock. We use dense padding, as opposed to thick padding, as it protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. Our Running Socks were designed to be used in cool to warm conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free.", "text": "Drymax Run Mini Crew Socks As a runner, moisture is your feet's worst enemy. Moisture causes blisters, discomfort, Athlete's Foot and allows odor causing bacteria to flourish. However you also know your feet are going to get wet, either from sweating, stepping in a puddle, running across wet grass or getting caught in the rain. You can even get splashed at a race water station and instead of the water going in you, it goes on you. The new Running Socks were designed with a special Dual Layer Moisture Removal System that moves moisture off the skin through the inner Drymax layer to the outer absorbent layer almost instantly. Our Running Socks are a Medium+ Density protective padded sock. We use dense padding, as opposed to thick padding, as it protects feet without adversely affecting the fit of the shoes. Our Running Socks were designed to be used in cool to warm conditions, keeping feet dry, comfortable and odor free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ELDy7E8%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EU8G22.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003EUBO80", "title": "ACCU-RISER MOLDED BLACK CHEEK REST", "description": "ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST MADE IN USA Ambidextrous cheek rest incorporates two interchangeable rubber cheek pads, one 5/8\" and 1\" which can be switched to better fit your line of sight. A proper cheek weld reduces felt recoil and aligns your optic sight. This will greatly improve comfort and accuracy on your rifle or shotgun. The hard nylon base can be mounted temporarily with supplied 3M double sided tape and held fast with or without a supplied Velcro cinch strap, or unit can be permanently mounted with two screws which are then covered with the pad for a clean secure mount. Fits most factory rifles and shotguns with classic style stock without cheek pads. Does not fit Hogue overmolded stock or Monte Carlo If you think your stock is wide then it will not fit. Please keep in mind the bolt travel and removal of bolt action rifles when mounting a cheek pad. In this model, cheek pad may be removed from base for bolt removal. No need to remove entire unit. MOUNTING INSTRUCTIONS: ~ Position the ACCUR-RISER cheek rest on your weapon. ~ Bolt action, check that the bolt can be cycled and removed for cleaning before mounting to stock. ~ Check fit to stock (underside of base can be trimmed for wider stocks). ~ If mounting temporarily, cut a 1\" length of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ If mounting permanent, use the 3\" of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ Permanent without strap, drill two 5/16\" holes and fasten with two #6 screws provided with kit. ~ 5/8\" or 1\" cheek pads press onto base easily by pressing down from front to back. ~ Remove pads from base by prying with a dull kitchen knife. ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST Comes with: Two interchangeable pads 5/8\" & 1\" 3\" of double sided 3M tape 2- #6 screws to mount permanently Mounting instructions MADE IN USA", "text": "ACCU-RISER MOLDED BLACK CHEEK REST ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST MADE IN USA Ambidextrous cheek rest incorporates two interchangeable rubber cheek pads, one 5/8\" and 1\" which can be switched to better fit your line of sight. A proper cheek weld reduces felt recoil and aligns your optic sight. This will greatly improve comfort and accuracy on your rifle or shotgun. The hard nylon base can be mounted temporarily with supplied 3M double sided tape and held fast with or without a supplied Velcro cinch strap, or unit can be permanently mounted with two screws which are then covered with the pad for a clean secure mount. Fits most factory rifles and shotguns with classic style stock without cheek pads. Does not fit Hogue overmolded stock or Monte Carlo If you think your stock is wide then it will not fit. Please keep in mind the bolt travel and removal of bolt action rifles when mounting a cheek pad. In this model, cheek pad may be removed from base for bolt removal. No need to remove entire unit. MOUNTING INSTRUCTIONS: ~ Position the ACCUR-RISER cheek rest on your weapon. ~ Bolt action, check that the bolt can be cycled and removed for cleaning before mounting to stock. ~ Check fit to stock (underside of base can be trimmed for wider stocks). ~ If mounting temporarily, cut a 1\" length of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ If mounting permanent, use the 3\" of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ Permanent without strap, drill two 5/16\" holes and fasten with two #6 screws provided with kit. ~ 5/8\" or 1\" cheek pads press onto base easily by pressing down from front to back. ~ Remove pads from base by prying with a dull kitchen knife. ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST Comes with: Two interchangeable pads 5/8\" & 1\" 3\" of double sided 3M tape 2- #6 screws to mount permanently Mounting instructions MADE IN USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Sq9T1rOFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EUBO80.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B003EUBXRC", "title": "TufForce Rifle Carry Handle TL-CH7535", "description": "1) Durable Material 2) Low Profile Design. 3) Won't Block Your Front Site After Fold Down 4) Attach to Weaver/Picatinny Rail", "text": "TufForce Rifle Carry Handle TL-CH7535 1) Durable Material 2) Low Profile Design. 3) Won't Block Your Front Site After Fold Down 4) Attach to Weaver/Picatinny Rail", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mb-49kfIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EUBXRC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TufForce", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B003EUXO42", "title": "TMS Tactical 3x Magnifier Scope with Quick Flip to Side FTS Mount 42mm Center Height for Red Dot Sights and AIMPOINT Sights", "description": "A great add-on to tactical red dot sights. It converts the sights instantly into a sighting system for longer range targeting and sniping. Sometimes the combination use of red dot sight and magnifier scope will have the dot reticle out of center in the field of view of the magnifier due to misalignment of optical axis between the sight and the magnifier. This TMS magnifier scope is adjustable for windage and elevation to better align with the red dot sight without changing the actual ZERO of the sight. 30mm main tube of the magnifier works with standard 30mm scope mount of desired center height that matches that of the red dot sight. Rubber armored turret and grip area.Included with the magnifier is a quick flip to side mount that rotates to stay on and off line of sight quickly with push of a button. The mount also works with other magnifiers of standard 30mm tube size..Magnification: 3x.Eye relief: 45mm (1 3/4inch) .Weight:7.8oz.Overall length: 4 1/2inch.Flip mount center height: 42mmAccessories: lens covers.", "text": "TMS Tactical 3x Magnifier Scope with Quick Flip to Side FTS Mount 42mm Center Height for Red Dot Sights and AIMPOINT Sights A great add-on to tactical red dot sights. It converts the sights instantly into a sighting system for longer range targeting and sniping. Sometimes the combination use of red dot sight and magnifier scope will have the dot reticle out of center in the field of view of the magnifier due to misalignment of optical axis between the sight and the magnifier. This TMS magnifier scope is adjustable for windage and elevation to better align with the red dot sight without changing the actual ZERO of the sight. 30mm main tube of the magnifier works with standard 30mm scope mount of desired center height that matches that of the red dot sight. Rubber armored turret and grip area.Included with the magnifier is a quick flip to side mount that rotates to stay on and off line of sight quickly with push of a button. The mount also works with other magnifiers of standard 30mm tube size..Magnification: 3x.Eye relief: 45mm (1 3/4inch) .Weight:7.8oz.Overall length: 4 1/2inch.Flip mount center height: 42mmAccessories: lens covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BL5TtZWUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EUXO42.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 92.5}}
{"item_id": "B003EV37AW", "title": "1/2\" Offset AR-15 See-through Riser Mount MT-1R6E8L", "description": "1/2\" Offset AR15 See-Through Riser Mount 1) Extend Low Profile Weaver /Picatinny Rail 2) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts 3) 14 Slots on Top Rail 4) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 5) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "text": "1/2\" Offset AR-15 See-through Riser Mount MT-1R6E8L 1/2\" Offset AR15 See-Through Riser Mount 1) Extend Low Profile Weaver /Picatinny Rail 2) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts 3) 14 Slots on Top Rail 4) Hard-coat Anodized Finish 5) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Zp-xiphfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EV37AW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TufForce", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003EZQ53E", "title": "MSR Lightning Flotation Tail - 5 inch", "description": "Lightning Modular Flotation Tails bring the advantage of MSR's proprietary, adaptable flotation to the elite 360 Traction™ frames. Small and light enough to bring on any trip, you can take advantage of the agility of a smaller, primary snowshoe in packed conditions, while adding 5-inches (13cm) of flotation on-demand for deeper snow, or when carrying heavier packs.", "text": "MSR Lightning Flotation Tail - 5 inch Lightning Modular Flotation Tails bring the advantage of MSR's proprietary, adaptable flotation to the elite 360 Traction™ frames. Small and light enough to bring on any trip, you can take advantage of the agility of a smaller, primary snowshoe in packed conditions, while adding 5-inches (13cm) of flotation on-demand for deeper snow, or when carrying heavier packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nfxOe71DL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EZQ53E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B003EZQ7YG", "title": "MSR Evo Snow Shoes (22-Inch, Dark Green)", "description": "Evo™ Snowshoes from MSR™The Evo Snowshoes from MSR's Trek Line are built for smooth, secure, and efficient footing over rolling terrain--with many of the same top-of-the-line features found on MSR's most aggressive snowshoes. With same UniBody™ Traction foundation found on the incline-oriented MSR Ascent Line, the Evo Trek Snowshoes provide the confident traction you need to take on slopes in less than ideal conditions. The Evo's also feature weather-resistant, three-strap PosiLock™ bindings for extra security--and--easy on/off in all conditions. Finally, Modular Flotation tails make the Evo Snowshoes amazingly versatile for use on conditions that range from packed and icy to deep powder with the addition of the 6-inch flotation tails (flotation tails are sold separately). Hands down, the Evo Snowshoes provide amazing versatility and performance for all-condition use on winter trail hikes and expeditions.The MSR® Trek Snowshoe LineBe it a casual day trip close to home or a multi-day traverse through the frozen expanses of the Yellowstone Basin, Trek snowshoes are built for maximum efficiency across rolling terrain. As with all MSR snowshoes, you get the same elite traction of their most aggressive shoes, plus a streamlined efficiency that makes them ideal for covering serious distance or having fun closer to home.The Evo Snowshoes offer essential performance and versatility over rolling terrain.Key Features:Unibody Traction:Steel traction rails and brake bars molded directly into snowshoe decks provide a secure and lasting grip.Essential Security:PosiLock™ bindings deliver ample, freeze-proof and glove-friendly security, easily accommodating a wide range of footwear.All-Condition Adaptability:Modular Flotation tails allow you the maneuverability of a smaller shoe in packed conditions with the added, on-demand flotation of optional, 6-inch (15-centimeter) tails for powder or carrying heavier loads.Specifications:Weight per pair: 3 pounds, 10 ounces / 1640 gramsWidth: 8.2 inches / 20.3 centimetersLength: 22.2 inches / 56.5 centimetersBinding Type: PosiLockGait: Unisex/normal widthFootwear size range: men's 4.5/women's 5.5 to men's 15/women's 16Load: Up to 180 pounds / Up to 80 kilosLoad with tails: Up to 250 pounds / Up to 114 kilosMade in Seattle, USA", "text": "MSR Evo Snow Shoes (22-Inch, Dark Green) Evo™ Snowshoes from MSR™The Evo Snowshoes from MSR's Trek Line are built for smooth, secure, and efficient footing over rolling terrain--with many of the same top-of-the-line features found on MSR's most aggressive snowshoes. With same UniBody™ Traction foundation found on the incline-oriented MSR Ascent Line, the Evo Trek Snowshoes provide the confident traction you need to take on slopes in less than ideal conditions. The Evo's also feature weather-resistant, three-strap PosiLock™ bindings for extra security--and--easy on/off in all conditions. Finally, Modular Flotation tails make the Evo Snowshoes amazingly versatile for use on conditions that range from packed and icy to deep powder with the addition of the 6-inch flotation tails (flotation tails are sold separately). Hands down, the Evo Snowshoes provide amazing versatility and performance for all-condition use on winter trail hikes and expeditions.The MSR® Trek Snowshoe LineBe it a casual day trip close to home or a multi-day traverse through the frozen expanses of the Yellowstone Basin, Trek snowshoes are built for maximum efficiency across rolling terrain. As with all MSR snowshoes, you get the same elite traction of their most aggressive shoes, plus a streamlined efficiency that makes them ideal for covering serious distance or having fun closer to home.The Evo Snowshoes offer essential performance and versatility over rolling terrain.Key Features:Unibody Traction:Steel traction rails and brake bars molded directly into snowshoe decks provide a secure and lasting grip.Essential Security:PosiLock™ bindings deliver ample, freeze-proof and glove-friendly security, easily accommodating a wide range of footwear.All-Condition Adaptability:Modular Flotation tails allow you the maneuverability of a smaller shoe in packed conditions with the added, on-demand flotation of optional, 6-inch (15-centimeter) tails for powder or carrying heavier loads.Specifications:Weight per pair: 3 pounds, 10 ounces / 1640 gramsWidth: 8.2 inches / 20.3 centimetersLength: 22.2 inches / 56.5 centimetersBinding Type: PosiLockGait: Unisex/normal widthFootwear size range: men's 4.5/women's 5.5 to men's 15/women's 16Load: Up to 180 pounds / Up to 80 kilosLoad with tails: Up to 250 pounds / Up to 114 kilosMade in Seattle, USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TGtGBliQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003EZQ7YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Snowshoes"]], "price": 134.95}}
