{"item_id": "B003F960Z2", "title": "Oxy-Sorb 50-Pack Oxygen Absorber, 300cc", "description": "Each Bag contains 50 - 300cc oxygen absorbers. When used with proper packaging and sealing, the oxygen in the packaging is greatly reduced. Absorbers bring the oxygen level down reliably to. 01% or less. These Absorbers are perfect when combined with one gallon (10\"x14\") Mylar Bags or a #10 can. Benefits of using Oxygen Absorbers in a household storage program:. Extends shelf life. Prevents growth of aerobic pathogens and spoilage organisms, including molds. Eliminates the need for additives such as BHA, BHT, sulfur dioxide, sorbates, benzoates,tc. Use with gas flushing/vacuum packaging to absorb virtually all oxygen and absorb any oxygen that may permeate the package. Significantly improves keeping qualities of polyunsaturated fats and oils. Helps retain fresh-roasted flavor of coffee and nuts. Prevents oxidation of spice oleoresins present in spices themselves and in seasoned foods. Prevents oxidation of vitamins A, C and E. Extends life of pharmaceuticals. Inhibits mold in natural cheeses and other fermented dairy products. Delays non-enzymatic browning of fruits and some vegetables. Inhibits oxidation and condensation of red pigment of most berries and sauces.", "text": "Oxy-Sorb 50-Pack Oxygen Absorber, 300cc Each Bag contains 50 - 300cc oxygen absorbers. When used with proper packaging and sealing, the oxygen in the packaging is greatly reduced. Absorbers bring the oxygen level down reliably to. 01% or less. These Absorbers are perfect when combined with one gallon (10\"x14\") Mylar Bags or a #10 can. Benefits of using Oxygen Absorbers in a household storage program:. Extends shelf life. Prevents growth of aerobic pathogens and spoilage organisms, including molds. Eliminates the need for additives such as BHA, BHT, sulfur dioxide, sorbates, benzoates,tc. Use with gas flushing/vacuum packaging to absorb virtually all oxygen and absorb any oxygen that may permeate the package. Significantly improves keeping qualities of polyunsaturated fats and oils. Helps retain fresh-roasted flavor of coffee and nuts. Prevents oxidation of spice oleoresins present in spices themselves and in seasoned foods. Prevents oxidation of vitamins A, C and E. Extends life of pharmaceuticals. Inhibits mold in natural cheeses and other fermented dairy products. Delays non-enzymatic browning of fruits and some vegetables. Inhibits oxidation and condensation of red pigment of most berries and sauces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cpVqjGh3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003F960Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Oxy-Sorb", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 8.46}}
{"item_id": "B003FD2534", "title": "Umarex Universal Steel BB Speed Loader, .177", "description": "The Umarex Universal BB Speed loader is the latest and greatest tool for CO2 BB Pistols. Load BB magazines with speed and ease. The four included adapters make this speed loader usable with Walther's CP99 Compact and PPK/S, the Beretta Elite II, Smith & Wesson M&P;, and any other CO2 BB pistol with magazine loading ports similar to that of Umarex BB pistols. - Four adapters included! - Loads CO2 BB Pistol magazines with speed, ease, and accuracy. - Caliber: .177 - Brand: Umarex", "text": "Umarex Universal Steel BB Speed Loader, .177 The Umarex Universal BB Speed loader is the latest and greatest tool for CO2 BB Pistols. Load BB magazines with speed and ease. The four included adapters make this speed loader usable with Walther's CP99 Compact and PPK/S, the Beretta Elite II, Smith & Wesson M&P;, and any other CO2 BB pistol with magazine loading ports similar to that of Umarex BB pistols. - Four adapters included! - Loads CO2 BB Pistol magazines with speed, ease, and accuracy. - Caliber: .177 - Brand: Umarex", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fCWtHHrrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FD2534.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Loaders"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B003FJEGSU", "title": "Clicgear Cart Model 3.0-Black", "description": "Clicgear Push Cart 2.0 folds to a sub-compact 24″ x 15″ 13″, easily making it the most compact push cart available. The 2008 Model 2.0 features an easier to open design, new maintenance free airless tires, improved positive lock brake system, and a new storage bracket for your umbrella tube. The full size console features an improved beverage holder, and also has a magnetically locking storage tray.", "text": "Clicgear Cart Model 3.0-Black Clicgear Push Cart 2.0 folds to a sub-compact 24″ x 15″ 13″, easily making it the most compact push cart available. The 2008 Model 2.0 features an easier to open design, new maintenance free airless tires, improved positive lock brake system, and a new storage bracket for your umbrella tube. The full size console features an improved beverage holder, and also has a magnetically locking storage tray.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ew%2BD5kmVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FJEGSU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Carts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003FKJX5A", "title": "Slumberjack Latitude 20 Degree SyntheticSleeping Bag", "description": "Slumberjack Latitude 20 degree Mummy Bag keeps cold OUT for sound sleep on camping trips! Get cozy in cool camping weather with the Latitude Mummy Bag from the seasoned outdoorsman at Slumberjack! This baby really keeps the chill off your body with sensational Slumberloft insulation, and a draft tube on along the zipper that doesn't let cold air seep in. Has slippery, soft polyester taffeta inside, too, for that \"snug-as-a-bug\" feel that's rare when you're roughing it in harsh conditions. Stuff sack included for easy carrying! Two-layer, off-set construction and differential cut prevents cold spots; Flip-over hood allows you to flip the hood inside out for a flat, or contoured feel; Draft collar prevents heat loss from neck and shoulder area; Anti snag zipper protection; Trapezoidal foot box provides space so feet remain in a natural position for enhanced comfort.; Short Right measures 74 x 30\" and weighs 2 lbs., 15 ozs. (fill is 1 lbs., 12 ozs.). Fits up to 5'6\" tall. Regular Right measures 82 x 32\" and weighs 3 lbs., 8 ozs. (fill is 2 lbs., 1 ozs.). Fits up to 6' tall. Long Left measures 86 x 34\" and weighs 3 lbs., 11 ozs. (fill is 2 lbs., 3 ozs.). Fits up to 6'6\" tall.; Short Right packs to 9 x 17\", Regular Right packs down to 10 x 17\", Long Left packs to 10 x 18\"; State Regular Right or Long Left. Stay nice and warm when outdoor temps dip down low! Order your Bag today! Slumberjack Latitude 20 degree Mummy Bag", "text": "Slumberjack Latitude 20 Degree SyntheticSleeping Bag Slumberjack Latitude 20 degree Mummy Bag keeps cold OUT for sound sleep on camping trips! Get cozy in cool camping weather with the Latitude Mummy Bag from the seasoned outdoorsman at Slumberjack! This baby really keeps the chill off your body with sensational Slumberloft insulation, and a draft tube on along the zipper that doesn't let cold air seep in. Has slippery, soft polyester taffeta inside, too, for that \"snug-as-a-bug\" feel that's rare when you're roughing it in harsh conditions. Stuff sack included for easy carrying! Two-layer, off-set construction and differential cut prevents cold spots; Flip-over hood allows you to flip the hood inside out for a flat, or contoured feel; Draft collar prevents heat loss from neck and shoulder area; Anti snag zipper protection; Trapezoidal foot box provides space so feet remain in a natural position for enhanced comfort.; Short Right measures 74 x 30\" and weighs 2 lbs., 15 ozs. (fill is 1 lbs., 12 ozs.). Fits up to 5'6\" tall. Regular Right measures 82 x 32\" and weighs 3 lbs., 8 ozs. (fill is 2 lbs., 1 ozs.). Fits up to 6' tall. Long Left measures 86 x 34\" and weighs 3 lbs., 11 ozs. (fill is 2 lbs., 3 ozs.). Fits up to 6'6\" tall.; Short Right packs to 9 x 17\", Regular Right packs down to 10 x 17\", Long Left packs to 10 x 18\"; State Regular Right or Long Left. Stay nice and warm when outdoor temps dip down low! Order your Bag today! Slumberjack Latitude 20 degree Mummy Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jjYk16YfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FKJX5A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003FKRCZ8", "title": "Duck Commander Ole Raspy Duck Call", "description": "You're a true fan of Duck Dynasty and now you can be a true Duck Commander with the Duck Dynasty Duck Commander Ole Raspy Duck Call.", "text": "Duck Commander Ole Raspy Duck Call You're a true fan of Duck Dynasty and now you can be a true Duck Commander with the Duck Dynasty Duck Commander Ole Raspy Duck Call.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RRzo519IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FKRCZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 14.85}}
{"item_id": "B003FKY7BU", "title": "Wicked Ridge 20-Inch Black Aluminum 6 Pack Crossbow Arrows", "description": "Combines the art and tradition of fletching arrows with the unparalleled quality of Easton shafts to produce the highest quality aluminum crossbow arrows. Easton 20'' 2219 shafts are equipped with orange SuperBriteTM blunt nocks, CPC inserts and fletched with a slight offset using Norway Duravanes and 100 grain field points. 6 per pack.", "text": "Wicked Ridge 20-Inch Black Aluminum 6 Pack Crossbow Arrows Combines the art and tradition of fletching arrows with the unparalleled quality of Easton shafts to produce the highest quality aluminum crossbow arrows. Easton 20'' 2219 shafts are equipped with orange SuperBriteTM blunt nocks, CPC inserts and fletched with a slight offset using Norway Duravanes and 100 grain field points. 6 per pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GtDBKozaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FKY7BU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wicked Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 31.1}}
{"item_id": "B003FM5CWG", "title": "Pro Ears Tac Mag Gold NRR 30 Ear Muffs with 2 Lithium 123a Batteries", "description": "The Pro Tac Mag is for professional shooters, range officers and NRA instructors. Very high NRR of 30. The exclusive DLSC Technology has the fastest response time in the industry - 1.5 milliseconds. Military grade dual circuit boards. No wires to break or get snagged. Maximum adjustability. Five year warranty. Made in the USA.", "text": "Pro Ears Tac Mag Gold NRR 30 Ear Muffs with 2 Lithium 123a Batteries The Pro Tac Mag is for professional shooters, range officers and NRA instructors. Very high NRR of 30. The exclusive DLSC Technology has the fastest response time in the industry - 1.5 milliseconds. Military grade dual circuit boards. No wires to break or get snagged. Maximum adjustability. Five year warranty. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TyLqIxlSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FM5CWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Ears", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 242.83}}
{"item_id": "B003FM5E1K", "title": "Galco Ankle Lite / Ankle Holster for Ruger LCR", "description": "After two decades of universal praise for the Ankle Glove, Galco has added the Ankle Lite to the Concealed Carry Lite family of holsters. Using the same wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure as the Ankle Glove with Center Cut Steerhide for the holster, the Ankle Lite combines extended wearing comfort with unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle, while speed of draw is enhanced with a reinforced thumb break retention strap. The Ankle Lite may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately), and accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Lite is available in right or left hand draw in black or khaki finish.", "text": "Galco Ankle Lite / Ankle Holster for Ruger LCR After two decades of universal praise for the Ankle Glove, Galco has added the Ankle Lite to the Concealed Carry Lite family of holsters. Using the same wide neoprene ankle band and Velcro closure as the Ankle Glove with Center Cut Steerhide for the holster, the Ankle Lite combines extended wearing comfort with unmatched security. Additional comfort is provided by sheepskin padding between the holster and ankle, while speed of draw is enhanced with a reinforced thumb break retention strap. The Ankle Lite may be worn with or without the optional adjustable calf strap (sold separately), and accommodates ankles up to 13\" in circumference. Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Ankle Lite is available in right or left hand draw in black or khaki finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jaGSsZdhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FM5E1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 63.16}}
{"item_id": "B003FN85BA", "title": "Ontario 8916 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Matte satin finished tanto blade style with square Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8916 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black) This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Matte satin finished tanto blade style with square Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hRtVF8tcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FN85BA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife Co", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.36}}
{"item_id": "B003FNQ28I", "title": "Mustad Multi-purpose Braid Cutter, Splitring Pliers", "description": "Locking split-nose for grabbing split rings, crimping, punching and cutting mono/braid line. Fine polished stainless steel for maximum corrosion resistance and high-impact acrylic handle with 20-Inch adjustable wrist lanyard.", "text": "Mustad Multi-purpose Braid Cutter, Splitring Pliers Locking split-nose for grabbing split rings, crimping, punching and cutting mono/braid line. Fine polished stainless steel for maximum corrosion resistance and high-impact acrylic handle with 20-Inch adjustable wrist lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nemSVILWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FNQ28I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mustad", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Pliers & Multi-Tools"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B003FNS3FI", "title": "Mustad Heavy Duty Sheath Pliers", "description": "", "text": "Mustad Heavy Duty Sheath Pliers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PfvCKoV6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FNS3FI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Pliers & Multi-Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003FO2B5U", "title": "Fit & Fresh Cool Coolers Slim Lunch Ice Packs - Set of 4", "description": "Cool Coolers Ice Packs are perfectly sized to fit in all types of lunch bags and boxes. So go ahead and send them off to school with cheese, milk, fruit or veggies knowing that what you pack will stay cool and fresh. With the Cool Coolers Ice Packs no matter what food you pair with them, it will stay safe and fresh from morning ‘til lunch and beyond.", "text": "Fit & Fresh Cool Coolers Slim Lunch Ice Packs - Set of 4 Cool Coolers Ice Packs are perfectly sized to fit in all types of lunch bags and boxes. So go ahead and send them off to school with cheese, milk, fruit or veggies knowing that what you pack will stay cool and fresh. With the Cool Coolers Ice Packs no matter what food you pair with them, it will stay safe and fresh from morning ‘til lunch and beyond.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510kUQyNHvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FO2B5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fit &amp; Fresh", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 8.74}}
{"item_id": "B003FOPP0I", "title": "Proform 590T Treadmill", "description": "A SpaceSaver Design makes for a small footprint when the unit's not in use, and is ideal for compact spaces.The ProForm 590T, part of the ProForm Tech Series, features a built-in sound system, workouts created by Certified Personal Trainers, and performance-driven cushioning.Stay motivated during your workout with the Compatible Music Port for iPod and crisp, clear sound quality with Intermix Acoustics 2.0 speakers. With iFit Workout Card Technology, each card automatically adjusts your speed and incline while the voice of a personal trainer coaches you through your workout, or you can try one of the 12 Quick Calorie-Burn Workouts.Features:2.25 CHP Mach Z Motor:Quiet, self-cooling drive system employs an axial fan, to reduce noise as it cools internal componentsProTech Cushioning:Superior absorption system reduces impact on joints by 15 percent as compared to road running0-10 Percent Quick Incline:Allows you to change the incline with the single touch of a buttonSpaceSaver Design:Patented design allows treadmill to fold vertically for storage1-10 MPH QuickSpeed:Allows you to instantly change the speed of the treadmill between 0-10 MPH12 Quick Calorie-Burn Workouts:Quickly select the amount of calories you want to burn and the treadmill automatically adjusts your speed, incline and workout time to meet your goalDual-Grip EKG Heart Rate Monitor:Monitor your heart rate with via sensors built into the handlebars, ensuring you're always in the right training zone for your goalsiFit Workout Card Technology:Each card is designed by a Certified Personal Trainer and plugs directly into the treadmill's console, automatically adjusting speed and incline, while the voice of a personal trainer takes you through each workoutBacklit LCD:High resolution display provides accurate, animated readings throughout your workoutRaceTrack:Patented feature allows you to monitor workout progress in a track-style displaySpecifications:Unit measures 34-by-59.5-by-70 inches (W x H x D)Running area measures 20-by-55 inches (W x D)300-pound weight capacityWarrantyThe ProForm 705 CST includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty on the frame, limited 25-year manufacturer's warranty on the motor, and limited one-year manufacturer's warranty on parts. If an issue arises in the first year you own the treadmill, the company will send a technician to fix it onsite.About ProFormProForm is primarily known for innovating treadmill design with the renowned fold-away SpaceSaver. Today, the company continues to make advances in cushioning, electronics, durability, and reliability. In recent years, ProForm has introduced a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more, all geared to provide the most effective workout available.", "text": "Proform 590T Treadmill A SpaceSaver Design makes for a small footprint when the unit's not in use, and is ideal for compact spaces.The ProForm 590T, part of the ProForm Tech Series, features a built-in sound system, workouts created by Certified Personal Trainers, and performance-driven cushioning.Stay motivated during your workout with the Compatible Music Port for iPod and crisp, clear sound quality with Intermix Acoustics 2.0 speakers. With iFit Workout Card Technology, each card automatically adjusts your speed and incline while the voice of a personal trainer coaches you through your workout, or you can try one of the 12 Quick Calorie-Burn Workouts.Features:2.25 CHP Mach Z Motor:Quiet, self-cooling drive system employs an axial fan, to reduce noise as it cools internal componentsProTech Cushioning:Superior absorption system reduces impact on joints by 15 percent as compared to road running0-10 Percent Quick Incline:Allows you to change the incline with the single touch of a buttonSpaceSaver Design:Patented design allows treadmill to fold vertically for storage1-10 MPH QuickSpeed:Allows you to instantly change the speed of the treadmill between 0-10 MPH12 Quick Calorie-Burn Workouts:Quickly select the amount of calories you want to burn and the treadmill automatically adjusts your speed, incline and workout time to meet your goalDual-Grip EKG Heart Rate Monitor:Monitor your heart rate with via sensors built into the handlebars, ensuring you're always in the right training zone for your goalsiFit Workout Card Technology:Each card is designed by a Certified Personal Trainer and plugs directly into the treadmill's console, automatically adjusting speed and incline, while the voice of a personal trainer takes you through each workoutBacklit LCD:High resolution display provides accurate, animated readings throughout your workoutRaceTrack:Patented feature allows you to monitor workout progress in a track-style displaySpecifications:Unit measures 34-by-59.5-by-70 inches (W x H x D)Running area measures 20-by-55 inches (W x D)300-pound weight capacityWarrantyThe ProForm 705 CST includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty on the frame, limited 25-year manufacturer's warranty on the motor, and limited one-year manufacturer's warranty on parts. If an issue arises in the first year you own the treadmill, the company will send a technician to fix it onsite.About ProFormProForm is primarily known for innovating treadmill design with the renowned fold-away SpaceSaver. Today, the company continues to make advances in cushioning, electronics, durability, and reliability. In recent years, ProForm has introduced a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more, all geared to provide the most effective workout available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31STDBHrRJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FOPP0I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 599.0}}
{"item_id": "B003FSONTS", "title": "DeSantis Mini Slide S&W M&P 9/40 Right Hand Black", "description": "Premium saddle leather, double seams and a highly detailed molded fit, make this exposed muzzle, tight fitting, two-slot holster a great choice for your favorite pistol. It features an adjustable-tension device. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide.", "text": "DeSantis Mini Slide S&W M&P 9/40 Right Hand Black Premium saddle leather, double seams and a highly detailed molded fit, make this exposed muzzle, tight fitting, two-slot holster a great choice for your favorite pistol. It features an adjustable-tension device. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hDqZKHOgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FSONTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B003FSQOTU", "title": "Caldwell Matrix Shooting Rest", "description": "The Matrix combines great features and rock solid stability. The innovative, ultra rigid U-channel frame quickly adjusts in length for the perfect fit with any gun while remaining completely stable. The 2-piece sliding frame incorporates an open center channel with extra clearance for hi-capacity detachable magazines (AR-15 style guns) as well as lever action guns. This rest also has a convenient storage area incorporated into the front of the base which features a removable lid that adds additional clearance when detached, but provides a rubberized rear support surface for firing handguns when left in place.", "text": "Caldwell Matrix Shooting Rest The Matrix combines great features and rock solid stability. The innovative, ultra rigid U-channel frame quickly adjusts in length for the perfect fit with any gun while remaining completely stable. The 2-piece sliding frame incorporates an open center channel with extra clearance for hi-capacity detachable magazines (AR-15 style guns) as well as lever action guns. This rest also has a convenient storage area incorporated into the front of the base which features a removable lid that adds additional clearance when detached, but provides a rubberized rear support surface for firing handguns when left in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HaI0hdEDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FSQOTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 50.33}}
{"item_id": "B003FYJU9A", "title": "Morakniv Bushcraft Forest Fixed Blade Outdoor Knife with Sandvik Stainless Steel Blade, 4.3-Inch", "description": "The Mora Bushcraft Forest is an all around version of the heavier Mora Bushcraft series, featuring a slightly thinner (2.5 mm), 4.3-inch (109 mm)profile-ground stainless steel blade. Green patterned grip and sheath. Mora Stainless steel options are ideally suited for marine, fishing, outdoor and construction applications, where knives see hard use and are commonly exposed to dirt and moisture. The chromium content of stainless steel makes them less susceptible to corrosion and oxidation than carbon steels, giving them a longer life overall. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "text": "Morakniv Bushcraft Forest Fixed Blade Outdoor Knife with Sandvik Stainless Steel Blade, 4.3-Inch The Mora Bushcraft Forest is an all around version of the heavier Mora Bushcraft series, featuring a slightly thinner (2.5 mm), 4.3-inch (109 mm)profile-ground stainless steel blade. Green patterned grip and sheath. Mora Stainless steel options are ideally suited for marine, fishing, outdoor and construction applications, where knives see hard use and are commonly exposed to dirt and moisture. The chromium content of stainless steel makes them less susceptible to corrosion and oxidation than carbon steels, giving them a longer life overall. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31esr0qsrpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FYJU9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 31.35}}
{"item_id": "B003FYOHPM", "title": "Cajun Cast Fishing Line", "description": "CAJUN RED CAST fishing line is formulated for maximum strength and castability, and is great for use on all types of fishing reels. Cajun Red Cast is the proven choice of anglers. When casting is required to catch more and bigger fish, Cajun Red Cast gives everyone an added advantage.", "text": "Cajun Cast Fishing Line CAJUN RED CAST fishing line is formulated for maximum strength and castability, and is great for use on all types of fishing reels. Cajun Red Cast is the proven choice of anglers. When casting is required to catch more and bigger fish, Cajun Red Cast gives everyone an added advantage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51K2Ec8pb9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FYOHPM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Monofilament Line"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003FYZGC0", "title": "Mora Bushcraft Series Force Sandvik 12c27 Blade Knife", "description": "Bushcraft Force has a black hand grip and an olive colored sheath. The stainless steel blade in not profile-ground, resulting in a heavier, stronger blade ideal when used for slaughtering. Includes Plastic sheath with a flexible rotational strap.", "text": "Mora Bushcraft Series Force Sandvik 12c27 Blade Knife Bushcraft Force has a black hand grip and an olive colored sheath. The stainless steel blade in not profile-ground, resulting in a heavier, stronger blade ideal when used for slaughtering. Includes Plastic sheath with a flexible rotational strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RRzh21sNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FYZGC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mora", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B003FZ0QAQ", "title": "Mora Bushcraft Triflex Carbon Steel Knife", "description": "Mora Bushcraft Triflex Carbon Steel Knife Bushcraft Triflex has an olive-colored hand grip and a black sheath. Triflex is harder and very resistant to breakage compared to a stainless steel blade. It is also easy to light a fire with a Triflex blade and a fire steel. Triflex is not stainless and should therefore be handled accordingly. Plastic sheath with a flexible rotational strap. Blade Length = 4.1\", Thickness = 0.098\"", "text": "Mora Bushcraft Triflex Carbon Steel Knife Mora Bushcraft Triflex Carbon Steel Knife Bushcraft Triflex has an olive-colored hand grip and a black sheath. Triflex is harder and very resistant to breakage compared to a stainless steel blade. It is also easy to light a fire with a Triflex blade and a fire steel. Triflex is not stainless and should therefore be handled accordingly. Plastic sheath with a flexible rotational strap. Blade Length = 4.1\", Thickness = 0.098\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BCVMNU75L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003FZ0QAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003G09XDQ", "title": "Standard Lock-Jaw Collar", "description": "Lock-Jaw One Barbell Collar (Pair) -Fit 1” Bars -Weigh 4 oz. per pair -Tough nylon construction -Easily installed with one hand -Extremely durable.", "text": "Standard Lock-Jaw Collar Lock-Jaw One Barbell Collar (Pair) -Fit 1” Bars -Weigh 4 oz. per pair -Tough nylon construction -Easily installed with one hand -Extremely durable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415fKxFya%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G09XDQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Power Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B003G2S6DM", "title": "VISM by NcStar NcStar Drag BagNcStar Drag Rifle Shooting Bag, Tan", "description": "NcSTAR Drag Bag. An un - bust - able, carry - all Bag! Get all your gear from here to there in this rugged Drag Bag. Made with heavy-duty PVC-coated material with thick padding throughout to protect contents from taking any kind of punishment. With reinforced shoulder straps, drag straps and carry handles, you can sling this beast over your shoulder, tote it like a briefcase or drag it on the ground. It's built to withstand hard knocks, abrasive environments and even ugly weather. What's more, there are a ton of pockets for storing extra gear... your binoculars, spotting scope, tripod, ammo and more! Just pack it full, zip it up and head out! Available in black, tan, green or camo colors. Measures 46\" long and holds up to 2 rifles. State Color. Pick this sweet accessory up for LESS, right now! NcSTAR Drag Bag", "text": "VISM by NcStar NcStar Drag BagNcStar Drag Rifle Shooting Bag, Tan NcSTAR Drag Bag. An un - bust - able, carry - all Bag! Get all your gear from here to there in this rugged Drag Bag. Made with heavy-duty PVC-coated material with thick padding throughout to protect contents from taking any kind of punishment. With reinforced shoulder straps, drag straps and carry handles, you can sling this beast over your shoulder, tote it like a briefcase or drag it on the ground. It's built to withstand hard knocks, abrasive environments and even ugly weather. What's more, there are a ton of pockets for storing extra gear... your binoculars, spotting scope, tripod, ammo and more! Just pack it full, zip it up and head out! Available in black, tan, green or camo colors. Measures 46\" long and holds up to 2 rifles. State Color. Pick this sweet accessory up for LESS, right now! NcSTAR Drag Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wsEhV3JoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G2S6DM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 69.21}}
{"item_id": "B003G2S6J6", "title": "VISM by NcStar Rifle Case Shooting Mat", "description": "NcSTAR Rifle Case / Shooting Mat. Folds out for a dry surface to set up shop. Shooting from the forest floor? This Rifle Case / Shooting mat provides a solid spot to fire from the prone position, while delivering a can't-miss mode of transportation for your favorite rifle. Made with heavy-duty PVC-coated material with thick padding throughout to protect contents from taking any kind of punishment. With reinforced shoulder straps, drag straps and carry handles, you can sling this beast over your shoulder, tote it like a briefcase or drag it on the ground. It's built to withstand hard knocks, abrasive environments and even ugly weather. What's more, there's room for up to 10 cartridges inside! Comes built with webbing outside to tote along your must-have shooting accessories... a rangefinder or binocs, perhaps? Just pack it full, zip it up and head out! Available in black, tan, green or camo colors. Measures 46\" long. State Color. Order yours today! NcSTAR Rifle Case / Shooting Mat", "text": "VISM by NcStar Rifle Case Shooting Mat NcSTAR Rifle Case / Shooting Mat. Folds out for a dry surface to set up shop. Shooting from the forest floor? This Rifle Case / Shooting mat provides a solid spot to fire from the prone position, while delivering a can't-miss mode of transportation for your favorite rifle. Made with heavy-duty PVC-coated material with thick padding throughout to protect contents from taking any kind of punishment. With reinforced shoulder straps, drag straps and carry handles, you can sling this beast over your shoulder, tote it like a briefcase or drag it on the ground. It's built to withstand hard knocks, abrasive environments and even ugly weather. What's more, there's room for up to 10 cartridges inside! Comes built with webbing outside to tote along your must-have shooting accessories... a rangefinder or binocs, perhaps? Just pack it full, zip it up and head out! Available in black, tan, green or camo colors. Measures 46\" long. State Color. Order yours today! NcSTAR Rifle Case / Shooting Mat", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B2qmu8rVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G2S6J6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B003G3DM58", "title": "Casio Men's GW3000B-1ACR G-Shock Solar Power Black With Orange Dial Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's GW3000B-1ACR G-Shock Solar Power Black With Orange Dial Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zdJSsCnHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G3DM58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"]], "price": 256.95}}
{"item_id": "B003G4IGP8", "title": "Mad Rock Super Tech Keylock Carabiner", "description": "Carabiners are the ultimate tool for a climber, and the Mad Rock Super Tech Straight Keylock Carabiner offers another versatile tool for your collection.", "text": "Mad Rock Super Tech Keylock Carabiner Carabiners are the ultimate tool for a climber, and the Mad Rock Super Tech Straight Keylock Carabiner offers another versatile tool for your collection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411-m4ajGIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G4IGP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003G5OJXU", "title": "NIKON M-223 8485 1-4x20 Riflescope (Black)", "description": "", "text": "NIKON M-223 8485 1-4x20 Riflescope (Black)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O8L4PvmUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G5OJXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 289.49}}
{"item_id": "B003G5QPC8", "title": "NIKON M-223 8488 3-12x42SF Riflescope (Black)", "description": "", "text": "NIKON M-223 8488 3-12x42SF Riflescope (Black)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GB8NxBXVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G5QPC8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 388.0}}
{"item_id": "B003G5SO7C", "title": "Nikon M-223 XR (743) AR Mount w/ 20 MOA Slope (Black)", "description": "The M-223 XR Mount was developed for use with Nikon's M-223 series of riflescopes. Featuring lightweight yet sturdy alloy construction, this mount fits Picatinny rails found on most flattop ARs, as well as Weaver-style bases. The mount offers a built-in 20-degree minute of angle (MOA) incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.The M-223 features lightweight and sturdy alloy construction.", "text": "Nikon M-223 XR (743) AR Mount w/ 20 MOA Slope (Black) The M-223 XR Mount was developed for use with Nikon's M-223 series of riflescopes. Featuring lightweight yet sturdy alloy construction, this mount fits Picatinny rails found on most flattop ARs, as well as Weaver-style bases. The mount offers a built-in 20-degree minute of angle (MOA) incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.The M-223 features lightweight and sturdy alloy construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S74XNZT%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G5SO7C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B003G5WMQQ", "title": "NIKON M-223 BDC 600 8489 3-12x42SF Riflescope (Black)", "description": "Built for extreme shooting, long range aiming, speed, and precision, the M-233 BDC 600 3-12X42SF Riflescope from Nikon is the big brother of the M-223 lineup. The scope offers an adjustable 3 to 12x magnification range to provide the combined benefits of a wide field of view at the low range and fine-tuned detail at the top of the range. Meanwhile the 42-millimeter objective lens with fully multi-coated optics offers up to 92 percent light transmission for large, clear, and crisp sight images. Paired with the BDC 600 aiming reticle, this scope provides precise target acquisition from 100 to 600 yards. The scope's side focus parallax adjustment lays down a serious power range for your most extreme shooting, while the quick focus-eyepiece, and 1/4 MOA reticle adjustments allow you to zero in and focus quickly. Built to last the M-233 BDC 600 scope boasts one-piece tube construction of aircraft-grade aluminum--and the scope is nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed to keep the optics in pristine condition. The scope is backed by Nikon's full lifetime warranty.The M-223's large ocular lenses deliver bright, high-resolution sight pictures.Key Features:BDC 600 Reticle:Developed specifically for the trajectory of the 0.223 Rem 5.56 NATO round with 55-grain polymer tip bullet, the new BDC 600 reticle offers shooters unique open circle aiming points and hash marks from 100 to 600 yards.Ultra ClearCoat Optical System:Bright, sharp, incredibly flat sight picture and light transmission up to 92 percent.Eye Box technology:Impressive four-times zoom range and four inches of constant, non-critical eye relief. A large ocular lens delivers a bright, high-resolution sight picture.Zero-Reset Turrets:Simplify field adjustments--simply sight in at 100 yards as usual, then lift the adjustment knob, rotate to your \"zero\", and re-engage.Smooth Zoom Control:Magnification reference numbers are viewable from the shooters position.Side Focus Parallax AdjustmentQuick Focus Eyepiece:This allows the shooter to bring the reticle into sharp focus quickly.1/4 MOA Reticle Adjustmentswith easy-to use positive click adjustments to get you zeroed in quicker and maintain your setting even with recoil.One-piece Main Body Tube:This tube construction reduces weight while maximizing strength and durability.Enhanced Mount Ring Spacing:With enhanced ring mount spacing--hunters can mount the scope on virtually any rifle action regardless of caliber--including magnum-length actions.M-223 Mount:Fits Picatinny rails found on most flattop ARs. Lightweight alloy construction with built-in 20-MOA incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.ARD Removable Anti-Reflective Device:Eliminates objective lens glare.Waterproof, Fogproof, Shockproof:Nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed.Full Lifetime WarrantySpecifications:Reticle: BDC 600Finish: MatteActual Magnification: 3 to 12xEffective Objective Diameter: 42 millimetersExit Pupil: 14 to 3.5 millimetersEye Relief: 4 to 3.7 inchesField of View at 100 yards: 33.6 to 8.4 feetTube Diameter: 1 inch / 25.4 millimetersObjective Diameter: 49.3 millimeters / 1.94 inchesEyepiece Objective Diameter: 44 millimeters / 1.73 inchesLength: 13.1 inchesWeight: 19.93 ouncesAdjustment Graduation: 1/4 MOA per one clickMaximum Internal Adjustment: 60 MOAParallax setting: 50 yards to infinityMounting Space: 2.28 inches (section A); 1.34 inches (section B); 2.13 inches (section C)", "text": "NIKON M-223 BDC 600 8489 3-12x42SF Riflescope (Black) Built for extreme shooting, long range aiming, speed, and precision, the M-233 BDC 600 3-12X42SF Riflescope from Nikon is the big brother of the M-223 lineup. The scope offers an adjustable 3 to 12x magnification range to provide the combined benefits of a wide field of view at the low range and fine-tuned detail at the top of the range. Meanwhile the 42-millimeter objective lens with fully multi-coated optics offers up to 92 percent light transmission for large, clear, and crisp sight images. Paired with the BDC 600 aiming reticle, this scope provides precise target acquisition from 100 to 600 yards. The scope's side focus parallax adjustment lays down a serious power range for your most extreme shooting, while the quick focus-eyepiece, and 1/4 MOA reticle adjustments allow you to zero in and focus quickly. Built to last the M-233 BDC 600 scope boasts one-piece tube construction of aircraft-grade aluminum--and the scope is nitrogen purged and O-ring sealed to keep the optics in pristine condition. The scope is backed by Nikon's full lifetime warranty.The M-223's large ocular lenses deliver bright, high-resolution sight pictures.Key Features:BDC 600 Reticle:Developed specifically for the trajectory of the 0.223 Rem 5.56 NATO round with 55-grain polymer tip bullet, the new BDC 600 reticle offers shooters unique open circle aiming points and hash marks from 100 to 600 yards.Ultra ClearCoat Optical System:Bright, sharp, incredibly flat sight picture and light transmission up to 92 percent.Eye Box technology:Impressive four-times zoom range and four inches of constant, non-critical eye relief. A large ocular lens delivers a bright, high-resolution sight picture.Zero-Reset Turrets:Simplify field adjustments--simply sight in at 100 yards as usual, then lift the adjustment knob, rotate to your \"zero\", and re-engage.Smooth Zoom Control:Magnification reference numbers are viewable from the shooters position.Side Focus Parallax AdjustmentQuick Focus Eyepiece:This allows the shooter to bring the reticle into sharp focus quickly.1/4 MOA Reticle Adjustmentswith easy-to use positive click adjustments to get you zeroed in quicker and maintain your setting even with recoil.One-piece Main Body Tube:This tube construction reduces weight while maximizing strength and durability.Enhanced Mount Ring Spacing:With enhanced ring mount spacing--hunters can mount the scope on virtually any rifle action regardless of caliber--including magnum-length actions.M-223 Mount:Fits Picatinny rails found on most flattop ARs. Lightweight alloy construction with built-in 20-MOA incline to maximize elevation for extreme long range shooting.ARD Removable Anti-Reflective Device:Eliminates objective lens glare.Waterproof, Fogproof, Shockproof:Nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed.Full Lifetime WarrantySpecifications:Reticle: BDC 600Finish: MatteActual Magnification: 3 to 12xEffective Objective Diameter: 42 millimetersExit Pupil: 14 to 3.5 millimetersEye Relief: 4 to 3.7 inchesField of View at 100 yards: 33.6 to 8.4 feetTube Diameter: 1 inch / 25.4 millimetersObjective Diameter: 49.3 millimeters / 1.94 inchesEyepiece Objective Diameter: 44 millimeters / 1.73 inchesLength: 13.1 inchesWeight: 19.93 ouncesAdjustment Graduation: 1/4 MOA per one clickMaximum Internal Adjustment: 60 MOAParallax setting: 50 yards to infinityMounting Space: 2.28 inches (section A); 1.34 inches (section B); 2.13 inches (section C)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WBILEd%2B1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003G5WMQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 399.95}}
