{"item_id": "B003GC4WLC", "title": "Stansport \"Black Granite\" Star-Light Tent with Rainfly", "description": "Designed for lightweight backpacking expeditions, the \"Black Granite Series\" Star-Light Tent from Stansport sleeps up to two adults with 41.25 square feet of interior space. Built for rugged terrain, the Star Light features a sturdy PU coated floor, no-see-um mesh for ventilation, and a full-coverage rainfly. With a trail weight of 5 pounds, 6 ounces, the Star Light is equipped with two shock-corded fiberglass poles and packs down to 13 by 5 inches.Specifications:Sleep capacity: two adultsInterior Area: 41.25 square feetAssembled dimensions: 90 by 66 by 44 inches (L x W x H)Peak Height: 44 inchesTrail weight: 5 pounds, 6 ouncesPacked dimensions: 13 by 5 inchesOne doorMesh: No-see-umFloor Material: 190T polyester, 2000-millimeter PU coatedPoles: two 8.5-millimeter shock corded fiberglass polesPole sections lengths: 12 inchesRainfly included", "text": "Stansport \"Black Granite\" Star-Light Tent with Rainfly Designed for lightweight backpacking expeditions, the \"Black Granite Series\" Star-Light Tent from Stansport sleeps up to two adults with 41.25 square feet of interior space. Built for rugged terrain, the Star Light features a sturdy PU coated floor, no-see-um mesh for ventilation, and a full-coverage rainfly. With a trail weight of 5 pounds, 6 ounces, the Star Light is equipped with two shock-corded fiberglass poles and packs down to 13 by 5 inches.Specifications:Sleep capacity: two adultsInterior Area: 41.25 square feetAssembled dimensions: 90 by 66 by 44 inches (L x W x H)Peak Height: 44 inchesTrail weight: 5 pounds, 6 ouncesPacked dimensions: 13 by 5 inchesOne doorMesh: No-see-umFloor Material: 190T polyester, 2000-millimeter PU coatedPoles: two 8.5-millimeter shock corded fiberglass polesPole sections lengths: 12 inchesRainfly included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4140BIxWcJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GC4WLC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 43.11}}
{"item_id": "B003GC89WU", "title": "Umarex Meisterkugeln Pellets, .177, Pistol 7.0g /500", "description": "For decades RWS Meisterkugeln (\"Master Target\") pellets have been part of every ambitious air gun shooter's equipment. Significant improvements in airgun ammo production technology have led to yet another enhancement in quality. New material compositions and optimized surface treatment have created a permanently bright and shiny appearance. The production of accurate dimension and weight of each RWS pellet is subject to continuous checks. Remarkably accurate. Features: .177 caliber. 7.0 grains. Match grade accuracy. Perfect for sighting-in and general target shooting. Precision for competition and training. High performance finish. RWS Professional Line. 500 count tin. Specifications: Caliber: 0.177. Brand: RWS. Ammo: Type Diabolo.", "text": "Umarex Meisterkugeln Pellets, .177, Pistol 7.0g /500 For decades RWS Meisterkugeln (\"Master Target\") pellets have been part of every ambitious air gun shooter's equipment. Significant improvements in airgun ammo production technology have led to yet another enhancement in quality. New material compositions and optimized surface treatment have created a permanently bright and shiny appearance. The production of accurate dimension and weight of each RWS pellet is subject to continuous checks. Remarkably accurate. Features: .177 caliber. 7.0 grains. Match grade accuracy. Perfect for sighting-in and general target shooting. Precision for competition and training. High performance finish. RWS Professional Line. 500 count tin. Specifications: Caliber: 0.177. Brand: RWS. Ammo: Type Diabolo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QYXjVkkhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GC89WU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 11.25}}
{"item_id": "B003GCE9BK", "title": "Specialized Bike Wide-Mouth Water Bottle", "description": "This water bottle has a Big Mouth opening for easy refilling and cleaning. It has a 24 fluid ounce capacity and is made from a low density plastic for squeezability.", "text": "Specialized Bike Wide-Mouth Water Bottle This water bottle has a Big Mouth opening for easy refilling and cleaning. It has a 24 fluid ounce capacity and is made from a low density plastic for squeezability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mR40fOrsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GCE9BK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B003GCVYM2", "title": "Browning Hearing Protector, Buckmark", "description": "Buckmark Hearing Protector. Unobtrusive low-profile design. Soft, comfortable foam ear cups. Foldable padded headband. NRR 31dB. Black", "text": "Browning Hearing Protector, Buckmark Buckmark Hearing Protector. Unobtrusive low-profile design. Soft, comfortable foam ear cups. Foldable padded headband. NRR 31dB. Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kY-PehW3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GCVYM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 18.89}}
{"item_id": "B003GIHKNS", "title": "Cinelli Cork Tape", "description": "There are few products in the world of bike stuff as classic as Cinelli Cork Handlebar Tape. It's been the leading choice for wrapping bars for decades. The natural cork construction is soft, it absorbs sweat, and it's sufficiently grippy so your hands won't slip. Installation is a breeze thanks to its adhesive backing. Available in a rainbow of colors. The actual weight of the Cinelli Cork Handlebar Tape is 68g.", "text": "Cinelli Cork Tape There are few products in the world of bike stuff as classic as Cinelli Cork Handlebar Tape. It's been the leading choice for wrapping bars for decades. The natural cork construction is soft, it absorbs sweat, and it's sufficiently grippy so your hands won't slip. Installation is a breeze thanks to its adhesive backing. Available in a rainbow of colors. The actual weight of the Cinelli Cork Handlebar Tape is 68g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51J77rS809L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GIHKNS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]]}}
