{"item_id": "B003GXUYLS", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Zephyr 3 Tent Floor Saver", "description": "Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Zephyr 3 Tent Floor Saver Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KLgKDq4mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003GXUYLS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]], "price": 28.09}}
