{"item_id": "B003H17YF8", "title": "Umarex Superdome Field Line Pellets, .22 (Per 250)", "description": "The RWS Superwomen has the so-called English bulldog design with a round head and a rifled skirt. The Super Dome Pellet has the typical German quality features of all RWS Air Gun Pellets. The RWS Super dome for air rifles and pistols is a great field line pellet with excellent knock down power that's great for hunting and target shooting with your airgun. Features: RWS Field Line Pellet. Excellent knock-down power. Excellent for hunting. Great target shooting pellet. Rifle skirt. English bulldog design. 250 count tin. Specifications: Caliber: 0.22. Brand: RWS. Ammo Type: Diabolo", "text": "Umarex Superdome Field Line Pellets, .22 (Per 250) The RWS Superwomen has the so-called English bulldog design with a round head and a rifled skirt. The Super Dome Pellet has the typical German quality features of all RWS Air Gun Pellets. The RWS Super dome for air rifles and pistols is a great field line pellet with excellent knock down power that's great for hunting and target shooting with your airgun. Features: RWS Field Line Pellet. Excellent knock-down power. Excellent for hunting. Great target shooting pellet. Rifle skirt. English bulldog design. 250 count tin. Specifications: Caliber: 0.22. Brand: RWS. Ammo Type: Diabolo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vbQP9rgmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H17YF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 9.84}}
