{"item_id": "B003H26X2W", "title": "ProSource Stackable Exercise Resistance Band Tube Cords", "description": "Get the beach body you've always wanted with ProSource stackable resistance bands. Ideal for use with P90X, Pilates Slimin6, Insanity, yoga, and a host of other fitness programs, ProSource resistance bands help you work your back, chest, arms, and abs, with several resistance levels to accommodate everyone from beginners to experts. Each band color offers a different challenge: the yellow band provides 2 to 5 pounds of resistance; the green band offers 5 to 8 pounds; the red band offers 8 to 12 pounds; the blue band delivers 12 to 16 pounds; and the black band offers 16 to 20 pounds. Just select the right band for your fitness level and get to work.The bands are made from the highest-quality latex rubber, so they'll hold up to serious strain. They also include cushioned foam handles to ensure a secure, comfortable grip, along with convenient door anchors that let you do your exercises anywhere in the house. And because each 48-inch band comes with a pair of high-quality metal carabineers, you can combine the bands to create even more tension. You can even bring the bands on the road, as they're light and small enough to fit in any luggage.Resistance bands make great alternatives to free weights and workout machines, but are also ideal for all types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees.", "text": "ProSource Stackable Exercise Resistance Band Tube Cords Get the beach body you've always wanted with ProSource stackable resistance bands. Ideal for use with P90X, Pilates Slimin6, Insanity, yoga, and a host of other fitness programs, ProSource resistance bands help you work your back, chest, arms, and abs, with several resistance levels to accommodate everyone from beginners to experts. Each band color offers a different challenge: the yellow band provides 2 to 5 pounds of resistance; the green band offers 5 to 8 pounds; the red band offers 8 to 12 pounds; the blue band delivers 12 to 16 pounds; and the black band offers 16 to 20 pounds. Just select the right band for your fitness level and get to work.The bands are made from the highest-quality latex rubber, so they'll hold up to serious strain. They also include cushioned foam handles to ensure a secure, comfortable grip, along with convenient door anchors that let you do your exercises anywhere in the house. And because each 48-inch band comes with a pair of high-quality metal carabineers, you can combine the bands to create even more tension. You can even bring the bands on the road, as they're light and small enough to fit in any luggage.Resistance bands make great alternatives to free weights and workout machines, but are also ideal for all types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Of7iB2seL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H26X2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B003H2EODW", "title": "Elite Large Fully Stocked GI Issue Medic First Aid Kit Bag", "description": "M17 Medic Bag - FA110 The M17 Medic Bag is a GI style issued kit that folds out three ways for easy and quick access to all your first aid supplies Dimensions: 16\" x 10\" x 13.5\", 12.25 lbs Item Quantity Item Quantity Skin and Eye Wash 5 Tweezers 1 Hand Sanitizer 1 Petroleum Jelly 1 Hand Soap 1 Skin Probe 1", "text": "Elite Large Fully Stocked GI Issue Medic First Aid Kit Bag M17 Medic Bag - FA110 The M17 Medic Bag is a GI style issued kit that folds out three ways for easy and quick access to all your first aid supplies Dimensions: 16\" x 10\" x 13.5\", 12.25 lbs Item Quantity Item Quantity Skin and Eye Wash 5 Tweezers 1 Hand Sanitizer 1 Petroleum Jelly 1 Hand Soap 1 Skin Probe 1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515NKbBhsZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H2EODW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite First Aid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 134.0}}
{"item_id": "B003H3Z8CW", "title": "X Factor 3-Inch Bicycle Generator Light Set", "description": "Never run out of the light you need to see what's in front of you. Large white headlight and small red tail light are powered by a 6 volt, 3 watt generator. No need for batteries, every pedal powers the lights.", "text": "X Factor 3-Inch Bicycle Generator Light Set Never run out of the light you need to see what's in front of you. Large white headlight and small red tail light are powered by a 6 volt, 3 watt generator. No need for batteries, every pedal powers the lights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZAvK9E1VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H3Z8CW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "X-Factor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 17.4}}
{"item_id": "B003H4OWUA", "title": "M3181ab M4a1 Carbine with M203 Grenade Launcher, 2 Mags, 2 Adjustable Stocks, 2 Handguards, Tactical Flashlight", "description": "This package comes complete with everything you need to customize your battle rifle. It includes a pump action grenade launcher, two stocks, a PEQ Box to attach to the included railed forend. The carry handle can be detached for optic mounting options. It also includes two magazines, regular round carbine handguards and a vertical forward grip. - Tons of Addons Included! - Two Magazines Included! - Battery and Charger Included (Small) This airsoft gun is not to be misrepresented as a real firearm or gun that is manufactured by Colt and is merely an airsoft gun that fires 6mm pellets. The manufacturer of this airsoft gun is Boyi/DBoys. - Made in China", "text": "M3181ab M4a1 Carbine with M203 Grenade Launcher, 2 Mags, 2 Adjustable Stocks, 2 Handguards, Tactical Flashlight This package comes complete with everything you need to customize your battle rifle. It includes a pump action grenade launcher, two stocks, a PEQ Box to attach to the included railed forend. The carry handle can be detached for optic mounting options. It also includes two magazines, regular round carbine handguards and a vertical forward grip. - Tons of Addons Included! - Two Magazines Included! - Battery and Charger Included (Small) This airsoft gun is not to be misrepresented as a real firearm or gun that is manufactured by Colt and is merely an airsoft gun that fires 6mm pellets. The manufacturer of this airsoft gun is Boyi/DBoys. - Made in China", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t3OkEexqL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H4OWUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ukarms m-series", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 99.99}}
