{"item_id": "B003H7YUQS", "title": "Discraft Beginner Disc Golf Set (3-Pack)", "description": "Best seller The Surge is perfect for long bombs, yet still highly controllable for virtually all skill levels. Everyone will benefit from the extra glide the Surge delivers in calm to moderate wind conditions. Distance driver of choice for 2007 World Champion Nate Doss.", "text": "Discraft Beginner Disc Golf Set (3-Pack) Best seller The Surge is perfect for long bombs, yet still highly controllable for virtually all skill levels. Everyone will benefit from the extra glide the Surge delivers in calm to moderate wind conditions. Distance driver of choice for 2007 World Champion Nate Doss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UoP-R2CeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H7YUQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Discraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Starter Sets"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003H7Z2YC", "title": "Joist Mount Chin up Bar Rafter Mounted Pull up for P90x Crossfit Rings", "description": "This chin up bar is great to work your back, shoulders, arms, and biceps. Professional Gym quality bar allows you to workout in the comfort of your home. Handles are lightly knurled for a better grip. Perfect to do P90x exercises. Once mounted will feel solid as a rock. Mounting hardware included. If using for kipping type exercises, use the nuts and bolts provided to mount, versus the lag screws. Color: Black. Note: Does not include p90x or crossfit rings.", "text": "Joist Mount Chin up Bar Rafter Mounted Pull up for P90x Crossfit Rings This chin up bar is great to work your back, shoulders, arms, and biceps. Professional Gym quality bar allows you to workout in the comfort of your home. Handles are lightly knurled for a better grip. Perfect to do P90x exercises. Once mounted will feel solid as a rock. Mounting hardware included. If using for kipping type exercises, use the nuts and bolts provided to mount, versus the lag screws. Color: Black. Note: Does not include p90x or crossfit rings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417xZmeBcLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H7Z2YC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003H8F44Y", "title": "Gaiam Stretch & Strength Foam Roller Kit", "description": "There's no need for large, bulky and expensive exercise equipment when you can enjoy a simpler way to regain movement and flexibility with this foam roller kit from Gaiam. Gentle roller exercise routines help expand your range of motion as they relax your muscles, release tension, and restore soft tissue. Learn to use your new roller in two 12-minute workouts with famed fitness instructor James D'Silva. The kit includes an 18 inch foam roller and DVD with 2 express workouts totaling 24 minutes.What's in the Kit?Foam roller with 6-inch diameter; 18 inches longWeighs 14.6 ouncesAbout GaiamGaiam was created as a lifestyle company with the vision that, given a choice, people would choose a lifestyle that is healthy and life enhancing, for themselves, their families and the Earth. The Gaiam lifestyle is a vote for individual health as well as the future sustainability of the Earth's resources. Gaiam strives to provide customers with alternatives to traditional products by offering natural or healthy versions that compare with the style quality and price of conventional products.Gaiam's goal is to become the trusted source and unifying brand for Lifestyle of Health and Sustainability (LOHAS) participants. They understand that the opportunity to affect people's lives with information and products is both a privilege and a responsibility. Gaiam believes in the concept of Conscious Commerce, the practice of making purchasing decisions based on personal values and beliefs. It takes into consideration all the aspects of our lives and the impact we have upon the planet. Research indicates this concept appeals to approximately 50 million people in the U.S. alone. Gaiam's strategy in delivering the distinctive quality for which they are known is to partner with experts in health/wellness, eco-living and personal development to develop proprietary products that meet our customers' needs with meaningful solutions.The name GAIAM is a fusion of the words Gaia (the name of Mother Earth from the Minoan civilization in ancient Crete), and I am reminds us that we are all interconnected with the Earth, the air and water, and very much a part of this living system that sustains us all.", "text": "Gaiam Stretch & Strength Foam Roller Kit There's no need for large, bulky and expensive exercise equipment when you can enjoy a simpler way to regain movement and flexibility with this foam roller kit from Gaiam. Gentle roller exercise routines help expand your range of motion as they relax your muscles, release tension, and restore soft tissue. Learn to use your new roller in two 12-minute workouts with famed fitness instructor James D'Silva. The kit includes an 18 inch foam roller and DVD with 2 express workouts totaling 24 minutes.What's in the Kit?Foam roller with 6-inch diameter; 18 inches longWeighs 14.6 ouncesAbout GaiamGaiam was created as a lifestyle company with the vision that, given a choice, people would choose a lifestyle that is healthy and life enhancing, for themselves, their families and the Earth. The Gaiam lifestyle is a vote for individual health as well as the future sustainability of the Earth's resources. Gaiam strives to provide customers with alternatives to traditional products by offering natural or healthy versions that compare with the style quality and price of conventional products.Gaiam's goal is to become the trusted source and unifying brand for Lifestyle of Health and Sustainability (LOHAS) participants. They understand that the opportunity to affect people's lives with information and products is both a privilege and a responsibility. Gaiam believes in the concept of Conscious Commerce, the practice of making purchasing decisions based on personal values and beliefs. It takes into consideration all the aspects of our lives and the impact we have upon the planet. Research indicates this concept appeals to approximately 50 million people in the U.S. alone. Gaiam's strategy in delivering the distinctive quality for which they are known is to partner with experts in health/wellness, eco-living and personal development to develop proprietary products that meet our customers' needs with meaningful solutions.The name GAIAM is a fusion of the words Gaia (the name of Mother Earth from the Minoan civilization in ancient Crete), and I am reminds us that we are all interconnected with the Earth, the air and water, and very much a part of this living system that sustains us all.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wziHYMeTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003H8F44Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
