{"item_id": "B003HGO6SQ", "title": "Smith and Wesson SWBLOP3TS Third Generation Black Ops M.A.G.I.C. Folder with 40-Percent Serrated Tanto Blade, Grey Aluminum Handle and Pocket Clip", "description": "When you first open up this knife, the first words out of your mouth are going to be \"It's M.A.G.I.C.\" And that is what this truly is. M.A.G.I.C. stands for Multipurpose Assisted Generational Innovative Cutlery. M.A.G.I.C. refers to the dual patented, revolutionary assisted opening mechanism that is an integral part of this series of knives. You will find that the M.A.G.I.C. assisted opening mechanism is the easiest, single handed opening system you have ever used. Once you have used it, you will know that it's M.A.G.I.C.", "text": "Smith and Wesson SWBLOP3TS Third Generation Black Ops M.A.G.I.C. Folder with 40-Percent Serrated Tanto Blade, Grey Aluminum Handle and Pocket Clip When you first open up this knife, the first words out of your mouth are going to be \"It's M.A.G.I.C.\" And that is what this truly is. M.A.G.I.C. stands for Multipurpose Assisted Generational Innovative Cutlery. M.A.G.I.C. refers to the dual patented, revolutionary assisted opening mechanism that is an integral part of this series of knives. You will find that the M.A.G.I.C. assisted opening mechanism is the easiest, single handed opening system you have ever used. Once you have used it, you will know that it's M.A.G.I.C.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310%2BdRrDK1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003HGO6SQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 29.79}}
