{"item_id": "B003HLOI0M", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Zephyr 2 Tent Floor Saver", "description": "Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Zephyr 2 Tent Floor Saver Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KLgKDq4mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003HLOI0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]], "price": 21.82}}
{"item_id": "B003HM4XP6", "title": "Allen Company Gun Cleaning Kit (in Aluminum Box, 60 Piece)", "description": "Keep your firearms in tiptop shape with the Allen 60-piece gun cleaning kit. The kit starts with 14 brass brushes: .17 caliber through .54 caliber, and 12-gauge through 20-gauge. The set's two sets of brass rods, meanwhile, work for shotguns, rifles, and pistols. The kit also includes six wool swabs--.30 caliber through 12-gauge--two sets of cleaning patches, a patch cutting diagram, and three accessory adapters. The set concludes with four polishing cloths, two plastic handles, two muzzle guards, 13 plastic jags, and four slotted tips. The whole kit 'n' caboodle stores inside a custom aluminum case for easy transport. The kit measures 14 by 2-3/4 by 12 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 3 pounds 9 ounces.", "text": "Allen Company Gun Cleaning Kit (in Aluminum Box, 60 Piece) Keep your firearms in tiptop shape with the Allen 60-piece gun cleaning kit. The kit starts with 14 brass brushes: .17 caliber through .54 caliber, and 12-gauge through 20-gauge. The set's two sets of brass rods, meanwhile, work for shotguns, rifles, and pistols. The kit also includes six wool swabs--.30 caliber through 12-gauge--two sets of cleaning patches, a patch cutting diagram, and three accessory adapters. The set concludes with four polishing cloths, two plastic handles, two muzzle guards, 13 plastic jags, and four slotted tips. The whole kit 'n' caboodle stores inside a custom aluminum case for easy transport. The kit measures 14 by 2-3/4 by 12 inches (W x H x D) and weighs 3 pounds 9 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mafh0u8YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003HM4XP6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B003HO30TE", "title": "6\" Portable Hand Held Heat Sealer (Model KF-150CST) For Mylar Bags For Long Term Food Storage", "description": "This lightweight and versatile 6\" sealer can be used anywhere. THIS is Model KF-150CST It is the best hand held sealer on the market. It is a direct heat sealer with a Teflon coated serrated jaw. Ideal for sealing Cellophane, Coated aluminum foil, Kraft paper and other thick materials, this sealer is the BEST way to seal Mylar bags used in long term food storage. The sealer makes a perfect 6\" long, strong seal on poly bags and other thermoplastic material. It is easy to operate. Simply place the bag or plastic case between the sealing bars, press down and release. Included are easy to understand instructions, and a detailed parts list. Additional Information: Model: IPK606 Two Sided Heat: Yes Cerrated Jaws: Yes Teflon Coating: Yes Crack Resistant Housing: Yes Dual Temperature Settings: Yes Foot pedal option: Yes Typical Price $134.80", "text": "6\" Portable Hand Held Heat Sealer (Model KF-150CST) For Mylar Bags For Long Term Food Storage This lightweight and versatile 6\" sealer can be used anywhere. THIS is Model KF-150CST It is the best hand held sealer on the market. It is a direct heat sealer with a Teflon coated serrated jaw. Ideal for sealing Cellophane, Coated aluminum foil, Kraft paper and other thick materials, this sealer is the BEST way to seal Mylar bags used in long term food storage. The sealer makes a perfect 6\" long, strong seal on poly bags and other thermoplastic material. It is easy to operate. Simply place the bag or plastic case between the sealing bars, press down and release. Included are easy to understand instructions, and a detailed parts list. Additional Information: Model: IPK606 Two Sided Heat: Yes Cerrated Jaws: Yes Teflon Coating: Yes Crack Resistant Housing: Yes Dual Temperature Settings: Yes Foot pedal option: Yes Typical Price $134.80", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418J3psS2fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003HO30TE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HotJaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 98.99}}
