{"item_id": "B003I5YND4", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Sniper Operations Data Book", "description": "This spiral notebook is crammed with important information, charts, and formulas, including scope adjustments, windage and elevation. Designed for the law enforcement sniper, it will benefit any serious shooter who wishes to log their performance at different ranges and under different conditions. Plenty of space for personal notes and observations.66 pages in a hardcover spiral bound format that can be laid flat or folded back on itself.Designed with input from a former Army Ranger and current law enforcement sniper Todd Swank, who is one of today's top sniper competitors, shooting for Team Voodoo.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Sniper Operations Data Book This spiral notebook is crammed with important information, charts, and formulas, including scope adjustments, windage and elevation. Designed for the law enforcement sniper, it will benefit any serious shooter who wishes to log their performance at different ranges and under different conditions. Plenty of space for personal notes and observations.66 pages in a hardcover spiral bound format that can be laid flat or folded back on itself.Designed with input from a former Army Ranger and current law enforcement sniper Todd Swank, who is one of today's top sniper competitors, shooting for Team Voodoo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UrJ1J4e4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003I5YND4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 16.78}}
{"item_id": "B003I6WZIS", "title": "MTECH USA XTREME MX-8038 FIXED BLADE KNIFE 6.5\" OVERALL", "description": "China Made - Misc Neck Knife Black. Model: M3712. 6 5/8\" overall. 3\" black finish stainless modified tanto blade. Full tang. Black G-10 handles. Molded black sheath with black beaded neck chain.", "text": "MTECH USA XTREME MX-8038 FIXED BLADE KNIFE 6.5\" OVERALL China Made - Misc Neck Knife Black. Model: M3712. 6 5/8\" overall. 3\" black finish stainless modified tanto blade. Full tang. Black G-10 handles. Molded black sheath with black beaded neck chain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ivYUYM-QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003I6WZIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTECH USA XTREME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 12.3}}
{"item_id": "B003I7CB4A", "title": "ProSource 125-Pound Heavy Duty Garage Utility Canoe and Kayak Storage Lift", "description": "Store your kayak or canoe safely out of the way in your garage with this ProSource 125-pound canoe and kayak storage lift. This premium-quality hoist comes with sturdy rubber-coated hooks, fully adjustable straps, and a safe locking mechanism to prevent accidental release. As a result, your kayak will suspend securely from your ceiling and not hang down unsteadily. Easy to install and use, the storage lift is designed for ceilings up to 12 feet tall.", "text": "ProSource 125-Pound Heavy Duty Garage Utility Canoe and Kayak Storage Lift Store your kayak or canoe safely out of the way in your garage with this ProSource 125-pound canoe and kayak storage lift. This premium-quality hoist comes with sturdy rubber-coated hooks, fully adjustable straps, and a safe locking mechanism to prevent accidental release. As a result, your kayak will suspend securely from your ceiling and not hang down unsteadily. Easy to install and use, the storage lift is designed for ceilings up to 12 feet tall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41unJrAfsoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003I7CB4A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Indoor Kayak Storage"]], "price": 29.33}}
