{"item_id": "B003I9F3CA", "title": "Axiom Power Bag 2 Top Tube Bag", "description": "Like a mini set of panniers, they attach to your top tube right behind the stem. Keep your food, keys, phone, or whatever else you need quick access to in this convenient pack.", "text": "Axiom Power Bag 2 Top Tube Bag Like a mini set of panniers, they attach to your top tube right behind the stem. Keep your food, keys, phone, or whatever else you need quick access to in this convenient pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FbkmfAtGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003I9F3CA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003I9HOKO", "title": "Kool Stop Dura 2 Brake Insert", "description": "Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Dura2 insert is a newly designed road pad insert. The pad is thicker than their standard Dura type for longer life. Plus, it has a 7.65 mm contact width for narrow rims and cut outs for reduced weight. Finally, the pads sit flat on the rim for superior modulation. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-DR2B) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-DR2SA) Water Grooves for max stopping power in adverse conditions 7.65 contact width Reduced weight Rim Friendly Compounds", "text": "Kool Stop Dura 2 Brake Insert Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Dura2 insert is a newly designed road pad insert. The pad is thicker than their standard Dura type for longer life. Plus, it has a 7.65 mm contact width for narrow rims and cut outs for reduced weight. Finally, the pads sit flat on the rim for superior modulation. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Choose from Black (standard compound; MFG Part Number KS-DR2B) or Salmon (most aggressive compounds for extreme all weather conditions; MFG Part Number KS-DR2SA) Water Grooves for max stopping power in adverse conditions 7.65 contact width Reduced weight Rim Friendly Compounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514Nu89QjNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003I9HOKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kool Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads"]], "price": 7.65}}
{"item_id": "B003IAYEG0", "title": "5.11 Taclite 2 Gloves", "description": "The Taclite2 glove features patented TacticalTouch™ fingertip construction system for maximum dexterity and longer service life. There is no seam at the fingertip to add bulk, wear out, or irritate you", "text": "5.11 Taclite 2 Gloves The Taclite2 glove features patented TacticalTouch™ fingertip construction system for maximum dexterity and longer service life. There is no seam at the fingertip to add bulk, wear out, or irritate you", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FL8ZiD6BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IAYEG0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
