{"item_id": "B003IMIPF4", "title": "Bifen XTS 25.1% Bifenthrin Oil Base Multi Use Pest Control Insecticide Concentrate 32 oz quart 753985", "description": "Bifen XTS is an emulsifiable concentrate containing 25.1% bifenthrin. Bifen XTS penetrates porous surfaces far better than Bifen IT making it the product of choice for boring bark beetles such as black turpentine beetles, mountain pine beetles, western pine tip beetles, southern pine tip beetles, and engraver beetles. In addition to the beetles, Bifen XTS is labeled for a full range of insects including termites, ants and many lawn and garden insects.", "text": "Bifen XTS 25.1% Bifenthrin Oil Base Multi Use Pest Control Insecticide Concentrate 32 oz quart 753985 Bifen XTS is an emulsifiable concentrate containing 25.1% bifenthrin. Bifen XTS penetrates porous surfaces far better than Bifen IT making it the product of choice for boring bark beetles such as black turpentine beetles, mountain pine beetles, western pine tip beetles, southern pine tip beetles, and engraver beetles. In addition to the beetles, Bifen XTS is labeled for a full range of insects including termites, ants and many lawn and garden insects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o0JYCvijL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IMIPF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bifen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 22.2}}
