{"item_id": "B003IP9ZJ6", "title": "Umarex H and K MP5 K-PDW, .177", "description": "The H&K; MP5K-PDW Air Gun features high velocity, 400 fps semi-automatic action from a high capacity 40-shot clip. The repeater has realistic recoil action when shooting BBs from the ultra-realistic barrel. A foldable stock, forearm grip, and drop-out magazine make this one of the most exciting and fun to shoot BB air guns ever created. The gun weighs in at a lightweight 2.4 lbs. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: - High velocity - BB repeater - Foldable stock - Powered by a single 12g CO2 - Forearm grip - Drop-free magazine - Lightweight - High capacity 40-shot clip - Fixed front grip Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - Action: Semi-Auto (repeater) - Power: CO2 (not included) - Capacity: 40-shot - Barrel Length: 9.75 inches - Brand: Heckler & Koch - Safety Type: Manual - Ammo Type: BB - Total Length in Inches: 24.5 inches - Velocity- FPS: 400", "text": "Umarex H and K MP5 K-PDW, .177 The H&K; MP5K-PDW Air Gun features high velocity, 400 fps semi-automatic action from a high capacity 40-shot clip. The repeater has realistic recoil action when shooting BBs from the ultra-realistic barrel. A foldable stock, forearm grip, and drop-out magazine make this one of the most exciting and fun to shoot BB air guns ever created. The gun weighs in at a lightweight 2.4 lbs. *(Check Air Gun Restriction List) Features: - High velocity - BB repeater - Foldable stock - Powered by a single 12g CO2 - Forearm grip - Drop-free magazine - Lightweight - High capacity 40-shot clip - Fixed front grip Specifications: - Caliber: .177 - Action: Semi-Auto (repeater) - Power: CO2 (not included) - Capacity: 40-shot - Barrel Length: 9.75 inches - Brand: Heckler & Koch - Safety Type: Manual - Ammo Type: BB - Total Length in Inches: 24.5 inches - Velocity- FPS: 400", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ysmBGVvEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IP9ZJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 98.7}}
{"item_id": "B003IPTCP8", "title": "Elite First Aid Fully Stocked Rapid Response Trauma First Aid Bag", "description": "Fully Stocked Rapid Response Trauma First Aid Bag. This is the model FA143. The Rapid Response Bag was custom designed by request of elite military units, who were looking for a more compact and lightweight kit for their daily field operations. The Rapid Response Bag measures 11\"x6\"x6.5\", and the complete kit weight only 2.5 lbs. The bag has M.O.L.L.E. straps on the back. The FA143 comes shrink wrapped with content list. A well-stocked first-aid kit can help you respond effectively to common injuries and emergencies. Keep at least one first-aid kit in your home and one in your car. Store your kits in easy-to-retrieve locations that are out of the reach of young children. Item Quantity Item Quantity Bleedstop Bandages 2 Stainless Steel Hemostat 1 Elastic Bandage - 2\" 2 Iodine Wipes 12", "text": "Elite First Aid Fully Stocked Rapid Response Trauma First Aid Bag Fully Stocked Rapid Response Trauma First Aid Bag. This is the model FA143. The Rapid Response Bag was custom designed by request of elite military units, who were looking for a more compact and lightweight kit for their daily field operations. The Rapid Response Bag measures 11\"x6\"x6.5\", and the complete kit weight only 2.5 lbs. The bag has M.O.L.L.E. straps on the back. The FA143 comes shrink wrapped with content list. A well-stocked first-aid kit can help you respond effectively to common injuries and emergencies. Keep at least one first-aid kit in your home and one in your car. Store your kits in easy-to-retrieve locations that are out of the reach of young children. Item Quantity Item Quantity Bleedstop Bandages 2 Stainless Steel Hemostat 1 Elastic Bandage - 2\" 2 Iodine Wipes 12", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41shUFWwtrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IPTCP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite First Aid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 46.15}}
{"item_id": "B003IPZRYI", "title": "C-A-T Combat Application Tourniquet All black version", "description": "Noted as the best prehospital tourniquet in the February 2008 supplement of The Journal of Trauma The C-A-T is a true one-handed tourniquet proven to be 100% effective by the U.S. Army's Institute of Surgical Research. Tests proved that the C-A-T completely occluded blood flow of an extremity in the event of a traumatic wound with significant hemorrhage. The C-A-T utilizes a durable windlass system with a free-moving internal band providing true circumferential pressure to the extremity. Once adequately tightened, bleeding will cease and the windlass is locked into place. A Hook and Loop strap is then applied, securing the windlass to maintain pressure during casualty evacuation. The C-A-T's unique dual securing system avoids the use of screws and clips which can become difficult to operate under survival stress or where fine motor skills are compromised.", "text": "C-A-T Combat Application Tourniquet All black version Noted as the best prehospital tourniquet in the February 2008 supplement of The Journal of Trauma The C-A-T is a true one-handed tourniquet proven to be 100% effective by the U.S. Army's Institute of Surgical Research. Tests proved that the C-A-T completely occluded blood flow of an extremity in the event of a traumatic wound with significant hemorrhage. The C-A-T utilizes a durable windlass system with a free-moving internal band providing true circumferential pressure to the extremity. Once adequately tightened, bleeding will cease and the windlass is locked into place. A Hook and Loop strap is then applied, securing the windlass to maintain pressure during casualty evacuation. The C-A-T's unique dual securing system avoids the use of screws and clips which can become difficult to operate under survival stress or where fine motor skills are compromised.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dXHwnDJQL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IPZRYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 32.99}}
