{"item_id": "B003IT9B8M", "title": "MTM Clay Target Thrower with Pivotal Arm Swing", "description": "Introducing the world's easiest, handheld clay target thrower. No tricky gimmicks, no tangled bands or expensive mechanics to fumble with, just easy, affordable clay launching fun. The EZ-3'x new (patent pending) Power Pivot Arm makes sending clays easier than ever before. People who normally lack the arm strength for a hand-held target thrower suddenly find themselves with no mechanical adjustments, means hours of challenging, fast paced shooting fun, at a price, less than a box of birds.", "text": "MTM Clay Target Thrower with Pivotal Arm Swing Introducing the world's easiest, handheld clay target thrower. No tricky gimmicks, no tangled bands or expensive mechanics to fumble with, just easy, affordable clay launching fun. The EZ-3'x new (patent pending) Power Pivot Arm makes sending clays easier than ever before. People who normally lack the arm strength for a hand-held target thrower suddenly find themselves with no mechanical adjustments, means hours of challenging, fast paced shooting fun, at a price, less than a box of birds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hSrRK253L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IT9B8M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 11.61}}
{"item_id": "B003ITAFMS", "title": "PS Products AR15/M16 - Gun Cleaning Kit", "description": "AR-15 / M16 Cleaning Kit! Includes: G.I.-style toothbrush / cleaning brush, bronze bore brush, bronze and stainless steel chamber brush, 6-pc. cleaning rod and a small plastic bottle you can fill with oil or solvent. All comes in an Olive Drab nylon pouch with 2 compartments and Velcro and snap closures. Order Today! AR-15 / M16 Cleaning Kit", "text": "PS Products AR15/M16 - Gun Cleaning Kit AR-15 / M16 Cleaning Kit! Includes: G.I.-style toothbrush / cleaning brush, bronze bore brush, bronze and stainless steel chamber brush, 6-pc. cleaning rod and a small plastic bottle you can fill with oil or solvent. All comes in an Olive Drab nylon pouch with 2 compartments and Velcro and snap closures. Order Today! AR-15 / M16 Cleaning Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h0w2RhGuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITAFMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ITBBA8", "title": "SigTac Leather Concealment Pocket Holster, Black", "description": "P238 Conceal Carry black leather Holster has a hinged pocket guard to allow quick access to your firearm and to facilitate a smooth extraction from your pocket. Also fits P938 models.", "text": "SigTac Leather Concealment Pocket Holster, Black P238 Conceal Carry black leather Holster has a hinged pocket guard to allow quick access to your firearm and to facilitate a smooth extraction from your pocket. Also fits P938 models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BASP7REkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITBBA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ITBKRC", "title": "Hoppe's Boresnake Viper Rifle Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber)", "description": "With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue with the bronze brush, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "text": "Hoppe's Boresnake Viper Rifle Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber) With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue with the bronze brush, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gw5n0VIdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITBKRC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ITDCBE", "title": "Bog Gear Xtreme Shooting Rest For Shooting Sticks", "description": "Xtreme Shooting Rest is designed to fit on any BOGgear BOG-POD tripod. Allows a user to get a steadier rest in the field and have the firearm in the ready postion eliminating extra movement.", "text": "Bog Gear Xtreme Shooting Rest For Shooting Sticks Xtreme Shooting Rest is designed to fit on any BOGgear BOG-POD tripod. Allows a user to get a steadier rest in the field and have the firearm in the ready postion eliminating extra movement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DUMm5PkFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITDCBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bog Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 47.42}}
{"item_id": "B003ITDPXE", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol and Revolver Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber)", "description": "With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue with the bronze brush, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol and Revolver Bore Cleaner (Choose Your Caliber) With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue with the bronze brush, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GQgE59BzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITDPXE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ITF15O", "title": "Butler Creek Ultra Grip Sling with Swivels (Right Hand Rib, Black)", "description": "Butler Creek Rhino Rib Sling, Black, Ultra Grip w/Swivels 23616", "text": "Butler Creek Ultra Grip Sling with Swivels (Right Hand Rib, Black) Butler Creek Rhino Rib Sling, Black, Ultra Grip w/Swivels 23616", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mHdtoujEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITF15O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B003ITF3IE", "title": "ThermaCELL E-4 Earth Scent Mosquito Repellent 48-hour Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns", "description": "The ThermaCELL E-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns ensures that you are never left unprotected against biting insects. Keep insect pests away when using these replacement packs with any ThermaCELL appliance or lantern. The ThermaCELL repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, a synthetic copy naturally found in chrysanthemum flowers. Earth scent is designed for hunters to smell like raw earth or dirt while masking your human scent and protect you from bites while out on your hunt. Do use in a casual outdoor or backyard setting. ThermaCELL’s Mosquito Repellent mats repel bugs without greasy, sticky, or oily sprays or lotions. Repellent mats are easy to use and require no open flame or messy wax to ignite. In order to continue to repel mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects, repellent mats should be replaced every (4) hours. Mats can be used for short or long periods of time and to be stored in a dry, dark place between uses. Each ThermaCELL butane cartridge will last up to (12) hours and can be used for short or long periods of time. To ensure the life of each butane cartridge, make sure to turn off appliance or lantern after each use. The E-4 Refill Pack comes with (12) repellent mats and (4) butane cartridge for a total of 48 hours of repellency. The ThermaCELL E-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns are only for use outdoors, do not use indoors or in enclosed spaces. Each ThermaCELL product features a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "text": "ThermaCELL E-4 Earth Scent Mosquito Repellent 48-hour Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns The ThermaCELL E-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns ensures that you are never left unprotected against biting insects. Keep insect pests away when using these replacement packs with any ThermaCELL appliance or lantern. The ThermaCELL repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, a synthetic copy naturally found in chrysanthemum flowers. Earth scent is designed for hunters to smell like raw earth or dirt while masking your human scent and protect you from bites while out on your hunt. Do use in a casual outdoor or backyard setting. ThermaCELL’s Mosquito Repellent mats repel bugs without greasy, sticky, or oily sprays or lotions. Repellent mats are easy to use and require no open flame or messy wax to ignite. In order to continue to repel mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects, repellent mats should be replaced every (4) hours. Mats can be used for short or long periods of time and to be stored in a dry, dark place between uses. Each ThermaCELL butane cartridge will last up to (12) hours and can be used for short or long periods of time. To ensure the life of each butane cartridge, make sure to turn off appliance or lantern after each use. The E-4 Refill Pack comes with (12) repellent mats and (4) butane cartridge for a total of 48 hours of repellency. The ThermaCELL E-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Appliances and Lanterns are only for use outdoors, do not use indoors or in enclosed spaces. Each ThermaCELL product features a (1) year warranty against manufacturer’s defects. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d-daV-xKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITF3IE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermacell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 20.93}}
{"item_id": "B003ITFZE6", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 5 Rail Panel Covers", "description": "Designed for use on any Picatinny rail, our Rail Panel Covers are sold in packs of five to give you more options. To prevent damage to the rails or injuries to the users hands, the unused portions of aluminum hand guards need to be covered. The individual user can either use the full length covers as they are designed or cut them in half for placement around lights or other aiming devices. The soft material and aggressive texturing provides a solid grip when firing.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 5 Rail Panel Covers Designed for use on any Picatinny rail, our Rail Panel Covers are sold in packs of five to give you more options. To prevent damage to the rails or injuries to the users hands, the unused portions of aluminum hand guards need to be covered. The individual user can either use the full length covers as they are designed or cut them in half for placement around lights or other aiming devices. The soft material and aggressive texturing provides a solid grip when firing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cWYDb9LPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITFZE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 15.08}}
{"item_id": "B003ITG05O", "title": "SmartReloader 100 Rounds #1a Ammo Box", "description": "SmartReloader ammo boxes are made from high quality plastic with the best technology available to make sure your ammunition is stored properly. Our ammo boxes are not only storing boxes, they will also work great at the range. They will stay open from the first time you use them thanks to the hinge that connects the cover to the base. Moreover, most of the non-hinged ammo boxes in the market have a limited life due to the plastic hinge (that connects the cover and the base) which will eventually break with continued use. SmartReloader Ammo Boxes will last virtually forever and give you the best quality available at the best price. We guarantee for 10 millions openings. Fits 100 rounds 9x19, 9x21 and .380 Auto.", "text": "SmartReloader 100 Rounds #1a Ammo Box SmartReloader ammo boxes are made from high quality plastic with the best technology available to make sure your ammunition is stored properly. Our ammo boxes are not only storing boxes, they will also work great at the range. They will stay open from the first time you use them thanks to the hinge that connects the cover to the base. Moreover, most of the non-hinged ammo boxes in the market have a limited life due to the plastic hinge (that connects the cover and the base) which will eventually break with continued use. SmartReloader Ammo Boxes will last virtually forever and give you the best quality available at the best price. We guarantee for 10 millions openings. Fits 100 rounds 9x19, 9x21 and .380 Auto.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MSsDnzJtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITG05O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SmartReloader", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 2.59}}
{"item_id": "B003ITG62Q", "title": "Allen Cascade Rifle Sling", "description": "Allen Cascade Rifle Sling is slip-free, bounce-free comfort for your rifle. Like suspension for your rifle! The Allen Cascade Rifle Sling features a wide stretchy neoprene pad that virtually eliminates rifle bounce as you walk over tough terrain plus a tacky \"sharkskin\" back to hold fast on your shoulder. No slips and slides, no annoying bouncing! Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. Sling this: Extra-wide neoprene adds suspension to your shoulder for all-day comfort; Tacky \"sharkskin\" back keeps the sling from slipping off the shoulder; Heavy-duty 1\" webbing; Allen quick detachable swivels with locking system included. Shoulder the load in comfort! State Color. Order Today! Allen Cascade Rifle Sling", "text": "Allen Cascade Rifle Sling Allen Cascade Rifle Sling is slip-free, bounce-free comfort for your rifle. Like suspension for your rifle! The Allen Cascade Rifle Sling features a wide stretchy neoprene pad that virtually eliminates rifle bounce as you walk over tough terrain plus a tacky \"sharkskin\" back to hold fast on your shoulder. No slips and slides, no annoying bouncing! Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. Sling this: Extra-wide neoprene adds suspension to your shoulder for all-day comfort; Tacky \"sharkskin\" back keeps the sling from slipping off the shoulder; Heavy-duty 1\" webbing; Allen quick detachable swivels with locking system included. Shoulder the load in comfort! State Color. Order Today! Allen Cascade Rifle Sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RDsDbp8kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITG62Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 20.93}}
{"item_id": "B003ITK6HM", "title": "Hogue Handall Hybrid Springfield XD9 9mm, 40S&W, 357SIG Grip Sleeve", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Handall Hybrid Springfield XD9 9mm, 40S&W, 357SIG Grip Sleeve Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kHkhQHlbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITK6HM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.59}}
{"item_id": "B003ITKHKI", "title": "Butler Creek 30mm Flip Open Black Red Dot Tactical Scope Cover Dual Pack", "description": "40010 Features: -Red dot pack.-One finger operation to fold down caps.-30mm Red dot compatibility. Includes: -Purchase by the pair - eye and objective covers included. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 5.62\" H x 3\" W x 1.5\" D.", "text": "Butler Creek 30mm Flip Open Black Red Dot Tactical Scope Cover Dual Pack 40010 Features: -Red dot pack.-One finger operation to fold down caps.-30mm Red dot compatibility. Includes: -Purchase by the pair - eye and objective covers included. Dimensions: -Overall dimensions: 5.62\" H x 3\" W x 1.5\" D.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415bP22qvRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITKHKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 15.84}}
{"item_id": "B003ITKHM6", "title": "Butler Creek .22-.380 Caliber Baby LULA Universal Pistol Loader and Unloader", "description": "Butler Creek Baby LULA Black Pistol Loader 24223Does not load the following:*Converted .22LR mags*Mags with projecting button like:Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIIIBeretta U22 NEOSS&W 22A/22SBrowning BubkMarkWalther P22Ruger SR22", "text": "Butler Creek .22-.380 Caliber Baby LULA Universal Pistol Loader and Unloader Butler Creek Baby LULA Black Pistol Loader 24223Does not load the following:*Converted .22LR mags*Mags with projecting button like:Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIIIBeretta U22 NEOSS&W 22A/22SBrowning BubkMarkWalther P22Ruger SR22", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gyd1PYsfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ITKHM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Butler Creek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 29.09}}
{"item_id": "B003IVK2JC", "title": "Sea To Summit Tpu Guide Waterproof Accessory Case", "description": "Fully welded construction with die-cut corner anchor points and neck strap. The top closure folds the tacky TPU film against itself three times and then secures this with double Velcro - waterproof enough for brief submersion for electronics.", "text": "Sea To Summit Tpu Guide Waterproof Accessory Case Fully welded construction with die-cut corner anchor points and neck strap. The top closure folds the tacky TPU film against itself three times and then secures this with double Velcro - waterproof enough for brief submersion for electronics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mGMvookzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IVK2JC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]]}}
