{"item_id": "B003IXB1LI", "title": "Set of 20 NEW Stripper Clips For Mosin Nagant M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 7.62X54r Rifles", "description": "Set of 20 NEW Stripper Clips For Mosin Nagant M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 7.62X54r Rifles - This is a pack of 20 BRAND NEW production stripper clips for use with 7.62x54R ammunition. Each clip holds up to 5 rounds. Use these to quickly charge ammuntion directly into your rifle. Will work with all Mosin Nagant variants including M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 and Dragoon. Brand new Item", "text": "Set of 20 NEW Stripper Clips For Mosin Nagant M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 7.62X54r Rifles Set of 20 NEW Stripper Clips For Mosin Nagant M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 7.62X54r Rifles - This is a pack of 20 BRAND NEW production stripper clips for use with 7.62x54R ammunition. Each clip holds up to 5 rounds. Use these to quickly charge ammuntion directly into your rifle. Will work with all Mosin Nagant variants including M44 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 and Dragoon. Brand new Item", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3124j3zuMML.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXB1LI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "m1surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B003IXBYCY", "title": "Benjamin Trail NP XL Air Rifle air rifle", "description": "The owner's manual states that the .25-caliber rifle delivers 950 fps. That's a misprint. The max is 900 fps.Benjamin Trail NP (Nitro Piston) XL Air Rifle Breakbarrel Gas piston Bull barrel Ambidextrous stock with twin cheekpieces Textured grip & forearm 70% quieter than most other breakbarrels! Includes unmounted CenterPoint Optics 3-9x40AO scope Sling swivel studs already mounted Hardwood stock 9.70 lbs. with included scope & mount; 8.50 lbs. for just the gun (we've found that the weight can vary as much as 8 oz. due to fluctuations in wood densities)The video on this page states it comes with a sling. It does not come with one.If you shoot a lightweight pellet so its velocity exceeds the speed of sound, it could result in your pellet breaking the sound barrier and the gun being louder than expected! The speed of sound depends on humidity, temperature and altitude. Generally speaking, it's between 1,060 fps and 1,115 fps.Here are the benefits of the Crosman Nitro Piston:Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "text": "Benjamin Trail NP XL Air Rifle air rifle The owner's manual states that the .25-caliber rifle delivers 950 fps. That's a misprint. The max is 900 fps.Benjamin Trail NP (Nitro Piston) XL Air Rifle Breakbarrel Gas piston Bull barrel Ambidextrous stock with twin cheekpieces Textured grip & forearm 70% quieter than most other breakbarrels! Includes unmounted CenterPoint Optics 3-9x40AO scope Sling swivel studs already mounted Hardwood stock 9.70 lbs. with included scope & mount; 8.50 lbs. for just the gun (we've found that the weight can vary as much as 8 oz. due to fluctuations in wood densities)The video on this page states it comes with a sling. It does not come with one.If you shoot a lightweight pellet so its velocity exceeds the speed of sound, it could result in your pellet breaking the sound barrier and the gun being louder than expected! The speed of sound depends on humidity, temperature and altitude. Generally speaking, it's between 1,060 fps and 1,115 fps.Here are the benefits of the Crosman Nitro Piston:Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Hxw1rNPUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXBYCY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003IXFDE4", "title": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable .22 Tube Magazine Full Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Quick Detachable .22 Tube Magazine Full Band Sling Swivels (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418ZG5OJKgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXFDE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 15.21}}
{"item_id": "B003IXJDHW", "title": "Umarex .177 Caliber 100ct Hyper Max", "description": "HyperMAX Extreme Velocity Airgun Pellets. Maximum precision accuracy. Up to 30% faster than standard lead pellets. Conical head design for superior penetration. Technically advanced alloy. Brilliant high-speed finish. Lead free. Per 100.", "text": "Umarex .177 Caliber 100ct Hyper Max HyperMAX Extreme Velocity Airgun Pellets. Maximum precision accuracy. Up to 30% faster than standard lead pellets. Conical head design for superior penetration. Technically advanced alloy. Brilliant high-speed finish. Lead free. Per 100.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FbsB3xK0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXJDHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 9.67}}
{"item_id": "B003IXKN8K", "title": "Uncle Mike's Centerfire Lever Action Full Band Sling Swivels for .645-.660-Inch Magazine Tube Diameters (Blued, 1-Inch Loop)", "description": "Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Centerfire Lever Action Full Band Sling Swivels for .645-.660-Inch Magazine Tube Diameters (Blued, 1-Inch Loop) Uncle Mike's pioneered the modern swivel in 1947 and has continued to make the strongest, most reliable swivels on the market. Any other brand is a weak link between you and your firearm. Swivel Lock is a spring loaded plunger and a knurled, threaded sleeve that locks down to completely eliminate accidental opening of the swivel. Uncle Mike's swivels are positively secured for the long haul. Closed Link technology creates a permanent ring bond that will never fail you. It was the first of its kind and started the entire generation of Uncle Mike's QD Swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h-BG9-R2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXKN8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Swivels & Snaps"]], "price": 14.43}}
{"item_id": "B003IXYW3M", "title": "TDI Law Enforcement Knife", "description": "The TDI Law Enforcement Knife was designed to be used as a \"last option\" knife. In extreme close quarters encounters where a suspect is attempting to take an officer's handgun, or the officer cannot access his/her handgun, the TDI Knife is available. Designed as an \"off hand\" knife that draws like a pistol, the reversible sheath can be worn on either the right or left side of the officer's pant belt. Specifications: - Weight : 0.18 - Overall Length : 5 5/8\" - Blade Length: 2 5/16\" - Steel: AUS 8A stainless steel - Handle: Zytel", "text": "TDI Law Enforcement Knife The TDI Law Enforcement Knife was designed to be used as a \"last option\" knife. In extreme close quarters encounters where a suspect is attempting to take an officer's handgun, or the officer cannot access his/her handgun, the TDI Knife is available. Designed as an \"off hand\" knife that draws like a pistol, the reversible sheath can be worn on either the right or left side of the officer's pant belt. Specifications: - Weight : 0.18 - Overall Length : 5 5/8\" - Blade Length: 2 5/16\" - Steel: AUS 8A stainless steel - Handle: Zytel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CwOjfwFhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IXYW3M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.75}}
{"item_id": "B003IZFPZO", "title": "Galco Tuck-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for S&W J Frame 640 Cent 2 1/8-Inch .357 (Natural, Right-hand)", "description": "Deep concealment and amazing affordability combine in Galco’s new Tuck-N-Go, which builds on the success of the enduring USA/UDC tuckable holsters and the huge popularity of the Stow-N-Go IWB. The Tuck-N-Go's open top allows a fast draw once the concealing garment is swept up and away, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. For the utmost in concealability, the holster features Galco's patented Generation III tuckable J-Hook. The Gen III J-Hook’s streamlined design hooks over the pants and behind the belt, hooking upward and only showing a small piece at the bottom. A tucked-in shirt will completely conceal your firearm. The Tuck-N-Go carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Tuck-N-Go fits belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Tuck-N-Go is available in right and left hand designs in natural finish.", "text": "Galco Tuck-N-Go Inside The Pant Holster for S&W J Frame 640 Cent 2 1/8-Inch .357 (Natural, Right-hand) Deep concealment and amazing affordability combine in Galco’s new Tuck-N-Go, which builds on the success of the enduring USA/UDC tuckable holsters and the huge popularity of the Stow-N-Go IWB. The Tuck-N-Go's open top allows a fast draw once the concealing garment is swept up and away, while the reinforced mouth allows a smooth and easy return to the holster. For the utmost in concealability, the holster features Galco's patented Generation III tuckable J-Hook. The Gen III J-Hook’s streamlined design hooks over the pants and behind the belt, hooking upward and only showing a small piece at the bottom. A tucked-in shirt will completely conceal your firearm. The Tuck-N-Go carries the handgun in a vertical orientation, with no cant or angle. Constructed of comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Tuck-N-Go fits belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Tuck-N-Go is available in right and left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410JNPysFYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IZFPZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 27.96}}
