comfortable premium Center Cut Steerhide, the Tuck-N-Go fits belts up to 1 1/2\". Made for semiautomatic pistols and double-action revolvers, the Tuck-N-Go is available in right and left hand designs in natural finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410JNPysFYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IZHOWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 27.96}}
{"item_id": "B003IZZZMM", "title": "BARSKA Green Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail", "description": "Conveniently designed with a Picatinny accessory rail under the laser and a built in weaver mount, GLX compact laser sights from Barska are built to withstand the extremely high impact shock generated by large caliber rifles and hand guns. The GLX Green Laser's intense laser beam was developed with high impact rated 5 mW compact laser diodes and produces light of 532 nm in wavelength that can emit constantly for accurate targeting powered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium battery. Designed for practical ease of use in the field, the GLX is equipped with an accessible on/off slide switch ideal for hand guns and the slide switch can also be bypassed by adding the included cable pressure switch securely screwed to the back of the laser. Standard windage and elevation adjustments are accessible externally on the front side and bottom of the laser.Equally stable and secure on a rifle's Picatinny rail as a handgun's bottom rail, the GLX Laser Sight features a built-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross bar insert for added support on even the shortest rails. The integrated military standard Picatinny rail provides a strong, stable platform to mount accessories to and with a T6 aluminum body, the laser is extremely impact resistant. Backed by a 1-year laser warranty from Barska, the GLX Green Laser comes complete with a CR-123A lithium battery.Specifications:Highly visible intense green laser beamHigh impact rated 5 mW compact laser diodesWavelength: Light of 532 nmBuilt-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross barIntegrated military standard picatinny railT6 aluminum bodyEasy access on/off slide switch ideal for hand gunsBypass slide switch with a cable pressure switchExternally accessible standard windage and elevation adjustmentsPowered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium batteryWhat's in the Box?Barska Green Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail, mounting hardware, cable pressure switch; 1-piece CR-123A lithium batteryManufacturer WarrantyOne-year laser warrantyWarranty Specifications:Barska's Customer Service & Support Line will help you with any specific warranty questions you may have about Barska optics products. Barska Customer Service & Support line hours are Monday through Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5:30 p.m. PST. Customer Service & Support Line: 1-888-666-6769 or e-mail: service@barska.com", "text": "BARSKA Green Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail Conveniently designed with a Picatinny accessory rail under the laser and a built in weaver mount, GLX compact laser sights from Barska are built to withstand the extremely high impact shock generated by large caliber rifles and hand guns. The GLX Green Laser's intense laser beam was developed with high impact rated 5 mW compact laser diodes and produces light of 532 nm in wavelength that can emit constantly for accurate targeting powered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium battery. Designed for practical ease of use in the field, the GLX is equipped with an accessible on/off slide switch ideal for hand guns and the slide switch can also be bypassed by adding the included cable pressure switch securely screwed to the back of the laser. Standard windage and elevation adjustments are accessible externally on the front side and bottom of the laser.Equally stable and secure on a rifle's Picatinny rail as a handgun's bottom rail, the GLX Laser Sight features a built-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross bar insert for added support on even the shortest rails. The integrated military standard Picatinny rail provides a strong, stable platform to mount accessories to and with a T6 aluminum body, the laser is extremely impact resistant. Backed by a 1-year laser warranty from Barska, the GLX Green Laser comes complete with a CR-123A lithium battery.Specifications:Highly visible intense green laser beamHigh impact rated 5 mW compact laser diodesWavelength: Light of 532 nmBuilt-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross barIntegrated military standard picatinny railT6 aluminum bodyEasy access on/off slide switch ideal for hand gunsBypass slide switch with a cable pressure switchExternally accessible standard windage and elevation adjustmentsPowered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium batteryWhat's in the Box?Barska Green Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail, mounting hardware, cable pressure switch; 1-piece CR-123A lithium batteryManufacturer WarrantyOne-year laser warrantyWarranty Specifications:Barska's Customer Service & Support Line will help you with any specific warranty questions you may have about Barska optics products. Barska Customer Service & Support line hours are Monday through Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5:30 p.m. PST. Customer Service & Support Line: 1-888-666-6769 or e-mail: service@barska.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nhRecpbML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003IZZZMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 69.13}}
{"item_id": "B003J01YXU", "title": "BARSKA Red Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail", "description": "Conveniently designed with a Picatinny accessory rail under the laser and a built-in weaver mount, GLX compact laser sights from Barska are built to withstand the extremely high-impact shock generated by large caliber rifles and hand guns. The GLX Red Laser's intense laser beam was developed with high-impact rated 5 mW compact laser diodes and produces light of 635 nm in wavelength that can emit constantly for accurate targeting powered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium battery. Designed for practical ease of use in the field, the GLX is equipped with an accessible on/off slide switch ideal for hand guns and the slide switch can also be bypassed by adding the included cable pressure switch securely screwed to the back of the laser. Standard windage and elevation adjustments are accessible externally on the front side and bottom of the laser.Equally stable and secure on a rifle's Picatinny rail as a handgun's bottom rail, the GLX Laser Sight features a built-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross bar insert for added support on even the shortest rails. The integrated military standard Picatinny rail provides a strong, stable platform to mount accessories to and with a T6 aluminum body, the laser is extremely impact resistant. Backed by a one-year laser warranty from Barska, the GLX Red Laser comes complete with a CR-123A lithium battery.Specifications:Highly visible intense green laser beamHigh-impact Rated 5 mW compact laser diodesWavelength: Light of 532 nmBuilt-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross barIntegrated military standard picatinny railT6 aluminum bodyEasy access on/off slide switch ideal for hand gunsBypass slide switch with a cable pressure switchExternally accessible standard windage and elevation adjustmentsPowered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium batteryWhat's in the Box?Barska Green Laser with Built-in Mount an