ngth: Light of 532 nmBuilt-in weaver standard compact mount with a stabilizing cross barIntegrated military standard picatinny railT6 aluminum bodyEasy access on/off slide switch ideal for hand gunsBypass slide switch with a cable pressure switchExternally accessible standard windage and elevation adjustmentsPowered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium batteryWhat's in the Box?Barska Green Laser with Built-in Mount and Rail, mounting hardware, cable pressure switch, 1-piece CR-123A lithium batteryManufacturer WarrantyOne-year laser warrantyWarranty Specifications:Barska's Customer Service & Support Line will help you with any specific warranty questions you may have about Barska optics products. Barska Customer Service & Support line hours are Monday through Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5:30 p.m. PST. Customer Service & Support Line: 1-888-666-6769 or e-mail: service@barska.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nhRecpbML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J01YXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 49.94}}
{"item_id": "B003J1TSI2", "title": "Brand New Fashion Us Waterproof Hooded Ripstop Wet Festival Rain Poncho Vegetato Woodland Camo", "description": "", "text": "Brand New Fashion Us Waterproof Hooded Ripstop Wet Festival Rain Poncho Vegetato Woodland Camo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UaCzbGNoL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J1TSI2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003J3YC5E", "title": "Tac Force TF-428W Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed", "description": "Our Raptor II spring assisted knife opens fast with the flick of the finger. Offers stainless steel construction with black aluminum scales and has wood overlay on one side of handle. Has liner lock, removable pocket clip and half serrated teflon coated 440 stainless steel blade. This knife is NOT classified as a switchblade. Spring assisted knives are legal to have under Federal law. State or city exceptions may apply. Buyers must be 18 years and older to order.", "text": "Tac Force TF-428W Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed Our Raptor II spring assisted knife opens fast with the flick of the finger. Offers stainless steel construction with black aluminum scales and has wood overlay on one side of handle. Has liner lock, removable pocket clip and half serrated teflon coated 440 stainless steel blade. This knife is NOT classified as a switchblade. Spring assisted knives are legal to have under Federal law. State or city exceptions may apply. Buyers must be 18 years and older to order.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kF9Qofp1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J3YC5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B003J44Y74", "title": "Cap Barbell Kettlebell", "description": "Kettlebells were originally designed for Russian Red Army soldiers and world-class athletes Works all the muscles you use for balance and leverage Steadily progress the intensity of your workouts by increasing weight amount Increase your agility, build strength, and improve your endurance Great for squats, throws, clean and jerks, snatches, rotational swings, and much more About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Cast iron weight with black enamel finish. 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, 60, 70, or 80 lbs.. Heavier weights accommodate both hands. Handles reinforced with steel for durability. No assembly required. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "Cap Barbell Kettlebell Kettlebells were originally designed for Russian Red Army soldiers and world-class athletes Works all the muscles you use for balance and leverage Steadily progress the intensity of your workouts by increasing weight amount Increase your agility, build strength, and improve your endurance Great for squats, throws, clean and jerks, snatches, rotational swings, and much more About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Cast iron weight with black enamel finish. 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, 60, 70, or 80 lbs.. Heavier weights accommodate both hands. Handles reinforced with steel for durability. No assembly required. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413JI97EIoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J44Y74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]], "price": 8.33}}
{"item_id": "B003J565UW", "title": "Tyvek 4 X 8 Foot Ground Cloth w/ TIE OFF LOOPS", "description": "Tyvek ground cloth for easy transportation because it's ultralight and compact. Tyvek sheet measures 4 feet by 8 feet.", "text": "Tyvek 4 X 8 Foot Ground Cloth w/ TIE OFF LOOPS Tyvek ground cloth for easy transportation because it's ultralight and compact. Tyvek sheet measures 4 feet by 8 feet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qxfCVgO7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J565UW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 14.89}}
{"item_id": "B003J5JGY4", "title": "Cyma AK47 AEG Airsoft Gun", "description": "The CYMA CM028 is a great airsoft rifle for only a fraction of the cost of the high end guns. This gun features full metal Gears/Gearbox with an imitation wood stock and grip. Includes a 600rd. high capacity Metal magazine, Battery and Charger also included. If you're looking for a solidly built AK47 AEG, you really can't beat this deal.", "text": "Cyma AK47 AEG Airsoft Gun The CYMA CM028 is a great airsoft rifle for only a fraction of the cost of the high end guns. This gun features full metal Gears/Gearbox with an imitation wood stock and grip. Includes a 600rd. high capacity Metal magazine, Battery and Charger also included. If you're looking for a solidly built AK47 AEG, you really can't beat this deal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YSrvztL-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J5JGY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CYMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 74.6}}
{"item_id": "B003J7XCRO", "title": "FSA Hammer Headset", "description": "The FSA Hammer is, as its name suggests, a simple and rugged tool. Designed for durability, it may not have the bells and whistles of fancier headsets, but it does one thing well: it allows your bars to turn.", "text": "FSA Hammer Headset The FSA Hammer is, as its name suggests, a simple and rugged tool. Designed for durability, it may not have the bells and whistles of fancier headsets, but it does one thing well: it allows your bars to turn.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f236cBoHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J7XCRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Headsets"]], "price": 13.76}}
{"item_id": "B003J80XQG", "title": "Tervis Tumbler Black 24oz. Travel Lid", "description": "Keep your favorite drink where it belongs with this tight-fitting travel lid featuring an open/close slider that's a perfect fit for anyone on the go.Straws fit Tervis straw lids only; universal size that will fit all of our tumblers and mugs.", "text": "Tervis Tumbler Black 24oz. Travel Lid Keep your favorite drink where it belongs with this tight-fitting travel lid featuring an open/close slider that's a perfect fit for anyone on the go.Straws fit Tervis straw lids only; universal size that will fit all of our tumblers and mugs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413a-FQbq-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003J80XQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tervis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Cups & Glasses", "Tumblers"]], "price": 8.75}}
