{"item_id": "B003JSO18C", "title": "Eagle Claw Classic Bamboo Trout Net (15 x 11 x 9-Inch)", "description": "Eagle Claw Catch and Release Classic Trout Landing Net. Just like Grandpa's! Timeless and trusty! This classic, high-quality Trout Landing Net features fine mesh netting for safe catch and release trout fishing. Varnished bamboo laminate frame will stand the test of time. 15 x 11 x 9\". Order Today! Eagle Claw Catch and Release Classic Trout Landing Net", "text": "Eagle Claw Classic Bamboo Trout Net (15 x 11 x 9-Inch) Eagle Claw Catch and Release Classic Trout Landing Net. Just like Grandpa's! Timeless and trusty! This classic, high-quality Trout Landing Net features fine mesh netting for safe catch and release trout fishing. Varnished bamboo laminate frame will stand the test of time. 15 x 11 x 9\". Order Today! Eagle Claw Catch and Release Classic Trout Landing Net", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mbls%2BCIXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003JSO18C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Nets"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B003JTBR74", "title": "20 Round Shooter's Pouch w/ MOLLE Straps On Back", "description": "The New 20 Round Shooter's Pouch utilizes a Hook-n-Loop flap to protect your .308, .223 or similar size ammo. Just remove original ammo holders from your favorite ammo manufacturers carton and insert them into the pouch. Ammo is held in place with elastic cording. The rear universal straps provide for easy attachment to your pack or vest.", "text": "20 Round Shooter's Pouch w/ MOLLE Straps On Back The New 20 Round Shooter's Pouch utilizes a Hook-n-Loop flap to protect your .308, .223 or similar size ammo. Just remove original ammo holders from your favorite ammo manufacturers carton and insert them into the pouch. Ammo is held in place with elastic cording. The rear universal straps provide for easy attachment to your pack or vest.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KfuJX1psL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003JTBR74.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.95}}
