{"item_id": "B003JTL260", "title": "Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer", "description": "Access your images in the field and view them directly from your camera's SD card with the hand-held Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer. Equipped with both an internal SD card that allows you to save images and an external SD card slot that allows you to view, save, and empty your camera's SD card, the Picture Viewer enables you to manage all of your game camera scouting photos and videos in the field--to increase the effectiveness of your game camera(s). In addition, the Picture Viewer's USB connection allows you to download all of your images with ease to your computer in just one step.The Picture Viewer is equipped with an internal SD card slot, an exterior SD card slot, and a USB Port for easy image management.With the Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer you can:Copy images from your camera's SD card onto the Viewer's internal SD card.Deleteallorsomeof the images from your Camera's SD card in the field and put the empty SD card back into your camera.Scroll through images one by one, or view the images in a slideshow.Brighten images and zoom in on images.Scroll through and view movies.Download all images via USB to your PC.Picture Viewer Menu Functions:Delete: Deletes the picture currently being viewedDelete All: Delete all the pictures on the active SD cardCopy: Copies the currently viewed picture from the camera's SD card to the Internal SD cardCopy All: Copies all the pictures from the Camera's SD card to the Internal SD cardBrightness: Allows you to increase or decrease the picture brightness using the navigation buttonsSlideshow: Scrolls through all the pictures on the active SD card. The Navigation Buttons can be used to advance or go back to previous images.Movie: Scrolls through all movies on the active SD card. Left button advanced the previous movie, Right Button advances to the previous move, and Enter Button plays the movie.Photo Index: Quickly scrolls through the pictures by index number by holding down the Right or Left Button. Enter Button allows you to view the picture.5-Way Button Pad:Up Button: In Picture-Mode zooms-in on image 3 times before returning to normal size. In Menu-Mode or split screen mode, advances cursor to the option or picture above.Down Button: In Menu-Mode or split screen mode, advances cursor to the option or picture below. When viewing a picture, this button splits the screen so you can view 4 images simultaneously. When viewing a picture, the button also can zoom-out on the image.Left Button: advances to the previous picture or movie when viewing images.Right Button: advances to the next picture or movie when viewing images.Enter Button: selects the picture or menu item highlighted.Delete Button: Deletes the currently viewed picture/movie.Copy Button: Copies the currently viewed picture/movie to the internal SD card.Specifications:2.8-inch TFT LCD viewing screenDual SD Card slotsMini USB connectionAccepts SD memory cards up to 16GBOperates on 4 AAA batteries (not included)", "text": "Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer Access your images in the field and view them directly from your camera's SD card with the hand-held Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer. Equipped with both an internal SD card that allows you to save images and an external SD card slot that allows you to view, save, and empty your camera's SD card, the Picture Viewer enables you to manage all of your game camera scouting photos and videos in the field--to increase the effectiveness of your game camera(s). In addition, the Picture Viewer's USB connection allows you to download all of your images with ease to your computer in just one step.The Picture Viewer is equipped with an internal SD card slot, an exterior SD card slot, and a USB Port for easy image management.With the Moultrie Digital Picture Viewer you can:Copy images from your camera's SD card onto the Viewer's internal SD card.Deleteallorsomeof the images from your Camera's SD card in the field and put the empty SD card back into your camera.Scroll through images one by one, or view the images in a slideshow.Brighten images and zoom in on images.Scroll through and view movies.Download all images via USB to your PC.Picture Viewer Menu Functions:Delete: Deletes the picture currently being viewedDelete All: Delete all the pictures on the active SD cardCopy: Copies the currently viewed picture from the camera's SD card to the Internal SD cardCopy All: Copies all the pictures from the Camera's SD card to the Internal SD cardBrightness: Allows you to increase or decrease the picture brightness using the navigation buttonsSlideshow: Scrolls through all the pictures on the active SD card. The Navigation Buttons can be used to advance or go back to previous images.Movie: Scrolls through all movies on the active SD card. Left button advanced the previous movie, Right Button advances to the previous move, and Enter Button plays the movie.Photo Index: Quickly scrolls through the pictures by index number by holding down the Right or Left Button. Enter Button allows you to view the picture.5-Way Button Pad:Up Button: In Picture-Mode zooms-in on image 3 times before returning to normal size. In Menu-Mode or split screen mode, advances cursor to the option or picture above.Down Button: In Menu-Mode or split screen mode, advances cursor to the option or picture below. When viewing a picture, this button splits the screen so you can view 4 images simultaneously. When viewing a picture, the button also can zoom-out on the image.Left Button: advances to the previous picture or movie when viewing images.Right Button: advances to the next picture or movie when viewing images.Enter Button: selects the picture or menu item highlighted.Delete Button: Deletes the currently viewed picture/movie.Copy Button: Copies the currently viewed picture/movie to the internal SD card.Specifications:2.8-inch TFT LCD viewing screenDual SD Card slotsMini USB connectionAccepts SD memory cards up to 16GBOperates on 4 AAA batteries (not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZBD5q40yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003JTL260.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B003JTLJFY", "title": "FitDesk Semi-Recumbent Pedal Desk", "description": "Imagine surfing the web, checking your email, keeping up with friends on social networks, beating the next level on your favorite game, or finishing that big deadline, all while losing weight and improving your cardiovascular health. Now you can converge health and productivity with FitDesk. This unique patent pending design provides comfortable placement of your forearms on a padded and contoured desk surface for stable handsfree use of keyboards and game controllers. Supports your upper body for extremely comfortable use. Like no other exercise product available you will find your self \"lost\" in your favorite wired era pastime while your heart rate is increased for longer, and more consistent daily exercise. Not only will your entire body benefit from this movement but you will be amazed at how much more you can get done by staying connected and organized with the increased time found. While health and productivity are important enough we did not stop there. We used the highest quality parts and designs available to insure years of quiet, smooth and highly adjustable performance. You will find the resistance level has plenty of room to \"grow\" into.", "text": "FitDesk Semi-Recumbent Pedal Desk Imagine surfing the web, checking your email, keeping up with friends on social networks, beating the next level on your favorite game, or finishing that big deadline, all while losing weight and improving your cardiovascular health. Now you can converge health and productivity with FitDesk. This unique patent pending design provides comfortable placement of your forearms on a padded and contoured desk surface for stable handsfree use of keyboards and game controllers. Supports your upper body for extremely comfortable use. Like no other exercise product available you will find your self \"lost\" in your favorite wired era pastime while your heart rate is increased for longer, and more consistent daily exercise. Not only will your entire body benefit from this movement but you will be amazed at how much more you can get done by staying connected and organized with the increased time found. While health and productivity are important enough we did not stop there. We used the highest quality parts and designs available to insure years of quiet, smooth and highly adjustable performance. You will find the resistance level has plenty of room to \"grow\" into.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410PSVHbjKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003JTLJFY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 299.0}}
