{"item_id": "B003JWP6O6", "title": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Sig Sauer P220 Imprint, Black", "description": "Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "text": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Sig Sauer P220 Imprint, Black Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eTkTH4hsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003JWP6O6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TekMat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 14.09}}
{"item_id": "B003K1C1R6", "title": "Spyderco Grasshopper Slipit SS PlainEdge Knife", "description": "Small but mighty, the Spyderco Bug line of micro Slipits deliver cutting power that belies their diminutive size. The GrassHopper's size is closest to that of a true penknife with its blade measuring just over two-inches. Its PlainEdge 8Cr13MoV stainless steel blade stays open when you're cutting, held by resistant pressure at the knife's pivot area. The GrassHopper handle is chamfered with no squared-off edges to dig or bite into a gripping hand. The handle is also stainless steel with a laser engraved Spyderco bug and enough blank area for a small amount of engraving or customization as jewelry or a gift item. The handle lanyard-hole welcomes a chain for wear around a neck or a key chain.Spyderco Slipit Knives:Spyderco perceived a gap between traditional slip joints and modern locking folders and created a product line called Slipits. Slipits are reliable and sophisticated non-locking folders that open with one hand, have a finger choil for comfort and safety, and are conveniently accessible.The subcategory of micro-sized Slipits with stainless steel handles are known as the Spyderco Bugs. Affable Bugs draw comments like \"how cute\" a beneficial perception in a knife-cautious world but their size trumps the reality that they're serious business when it comes to cutting.Key Features:Clip-less, lanyard holeLaser engraved Spyderco bug logo on handleFlat-ground bladePlain EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 5.031 inchesLength closed: 2.75 inchesBlade length: 2.313 inchesCutting edge: 2.063 inchesBlade thickness: 0.078 inchesHole diameter: 0.281 inchesBlade steel: 8Cr13MoVHandle material: Stainless SteelWeight: 1.4 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Grasshopper Slipit SS PlainEdge Knife Small but mighty, the Spyderco Bug line of micro Slipits deliver cutting power that belies their diminutive size. The GrassHopper's size is closest to that of a true penknife with its blade measuring just over two-inches. Its PlainEdge 8Cr13MoV stainless steel blade stays open when you're cutting, held by resistant pressure at the knife's pivot area. The GrassHopper handle is chamfered with no squared-off edges to dig or bite into a gripping hand. The handle is also stainless steel with a laser engraved Spyderco bug and enough blank area for a small amount of engraving or customization as jewelry or a gift item. The handle lanyard-hole welcomes a chain for wear around a neck or a key chain.Spyderco Slipit Knives:Spyderco perceived a gap between traditional slip joints and modern locking folders and created a product line called Slipits. Slipits are reliable and sophisticated non-locking folders that open with one hand, have a finger choil for comfort and safety, and are conveniently accessible.The subcategory of micro-sized Slipits with stainless steel handles are known as the Spyderco Bugs. Affable Bugs draw comments like \"how cute\" a beneficial perception in a knife-cautious world but their size trumps the reality that they're serious business when it comes to cutting.Key Features:Clip-less, lanyard holeLaser engraved Spyderco bug logo on handleFlat-ground bladePlain EdgeSpecificationsOverall length: 5.031 inchesLength closed: 2.75 inchesBlade length: 2.313 inchesCutting edge: 2.063 inchesBlade thickness: 0.078 inchesHole diameter: 0.281 inchesBlade steel: 8Cr13MoVHandle material: Stainless SteelWeight: 1.4 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zgD3VnIYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K1C1R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 16.03}}
{"item_id": "B003K2126G", "title": "Bear Warrior III Realtree Camo Bow Set - Right Handed", "description": "About Bear Archery Founded over 50 years ago by Fred Bear himself, Bear Bows is dedicated to the hunt. Using Fred's extensive experience as an expert marksman and craftsman, the company continues to produce innovative and celebrated equipment for archers of all types. Whether you're looking for a first bow for practice, honing your skills on targets, or out in the field, it'll go better with a Bear by your side. 25.5 inches axle-to-axle. 21- to 23-inch draw length. 24 - 29 lb. draw weight. Durable composite limbs and riser. 6-inch brace height. 70% let off. Suggested age range: 11 and up.", "text": "Bear Warrior III Realtree Camo Bow Set - Right Handed About Bear Archery Founded over 50 years ago by Fred Bear himself, Bear Bows is dedicated to the hunt. Using Fred's extensive experience as an expert marksman and craftsman, the company continues to produce innovative and celebrated equipment for archers of all types. Whether you're looking for a first bow for practice, honing your skills on targets, or out in the field, it'll go better with a Bear by your side. 25.5 inches axle-to-axle. 21- to 23-inch draw length. 24 - 29 lb. draw weight. Durable composite limbs and riser. 6-inch brace height. 70% let off. Suggested age range: 11 and up.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mvTEOA73L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K2126G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bear Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Compound Bows"]], "price": 102.23}}
{"item_id": "B003K22WIS", "title": "Moultrie Gamespy 5 Megapixel Digital Game Camera", "description": "Prepare for the hunting season and keep up with the daily action in the stand with Moultrie's D-50 digital trail camera. Offering all the essential scouting features you need at an affordable price, the D-50 allows you to scout more areas in less time and get to know every mile of the property you intend to hunt before the season even begins. Combining 5.0 megapixels, quick trigger time, and 45-foot flash, the D-50 game camera is a great value, delivering clear pictures day and night help you determine how many deer are using a particular trail and how often they visit. The flash provides optimal shots of your subject up to 45 feet away, while the multi-shot setting gives you up to three shots in a row. Videos taken during the day will provide you with insightful clips of wildlife activity, giving you a better idea of the direction that deer are traveling. The trail camera's rapid response trigger captures moving game, and every photo and video gives you an imprint of the time, date, and camera ID for that particular location.From waterholes to game trails and food plots, the D-50's infrared aim helps you place your game camera in a prime position for capturing clear pictures. Your D-50 goes to work immediately snapping pictures when movement occurs in front of its sensor. An easy-to-operate LCD menu-driven display guides you through a selection of modes. The tough weather-resistant housing is sealed air tight to protect against moisture or extreme heat and cold. The D-50 game camera can use up to a 16 GB SD memory card and runs on 6 D-cell batteries (batteries and SD cards sold separately).Specifications:5.0 megapixel digital game cameraQuick response time45-foot flashImprint time, date and camera ID on every photo or videoColor day and night picturesVideo clips during the day (10 seconds)Three picture resolutionsTwo video resolutions16 MB internal memorySD Memory Card Slot - up to 16 GBOperates on 6 D-cell batteries (not included)Includes weather-resistant casing, TV out cable, and mounting strap", "text": "Moultrie Gamespy 5 Megapixel Digital Game Camera Prepare for the hunting season and keep up with the daily action in the stand with Moultrie's D-50 digital trail camera. Offering all the essential scouting features you need at an affordable price, the D-50 allows you to scout more areas in less time and get to know every mile of the property you intend to hunt before the season even begins. Combining 5.0 megapixels, quick trigger time, and 45-foot flash, the D-50 game camera is a great value, delivering clear pictures day and night help you determine how many deer are using a particular trail and how often they visit. The flash provides optimal shots of your subject up to 45 feet away, while the multi-shot setting gives you up to three shots in a row. Videos taken during the day will provide you with insightful clips of wildlife activity, giving you a better idea of the direction that deer are traveling. The trail camera's rapid response trigger captures moving game, and every photo and video gives you an imprint of the time, date, and camera ID for that particular location.From waterholes to game trails and food plots, the D-50's infrared aim helps you place your game camera in a prime position for capturing clear pictures. Your D-50 goes to work immediately snapping pictures when movement occurs in front of its sensor. An easy-to-operate LCD menu-driven display guides you through a selection of modes. The tough weather-resistant housing is sealed air tight to protect against moisture or extreme heat and cold. The D-50 game camera can use up to a 16 GB SD memory card and runs on 6 D-cell batteries (batteries and SD cards sold separately).Specifications:5.0 megapixel digital game cameraQuick response time45-foot flashImprint time, date and camera ID on every photo or videoColor day and night picturesVideo clips during the day (10 seconds)Three picture resolutionsTwo video resolutions16 MB internal memorySD Memory Card Slot - up to 16 GBOperates on 6 D-cell batteries (not included)Includes weather-resistant casing, TV out cable, and mounting strap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D0txNMkbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K22WIS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003K27A8K", "title": "New Archery Products Apache Arrow Rest Right Hand (Black)", "description": "Whisper quiet, fail safe and reliability! With no tools required the Apache™ drop away rests offer easy set up and tuning. Features lazer-indexed horizontal and vertical marks for fine tuning and tack driving accuracy. The combination of all metal construction and complete sound dampening feature applied to the full-containment housing provides bombproof reliability and stealth in the field. The V-shaped launcher is self centering and comes with sound deadening felt preinstalled for further whisper quiet performance. Simply put, you will not find a more durable, reliable drop away arrow rest that can match the Apache is both performance and value!", "text": "New Archery Products Apache Arrow Rest Right Hand (Black) Whisper quiet, fail safe and reliability! With no tools required the Apache™ drop away rests offer easy set up and tuning. Features lazer-indexed horizontal and vertical marks for fine tuning and tack driving accuracy. The combination of all metal construction and complete sound dampening feature applied to the full-containment housing provides bombproof reliability and stealth in the field. The V-shaped launcher is self centering and comes with sound deadening felt preinstalled for further whisper quiet performance. Simply put, you will not find a more durable, reliable drop away arrow rest that can match the Apache is both performance and value!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Mbl2K0lHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K27A8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "New Archery Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]], "price": 52.32}}
{"item_id": "B003K2940W", "title": "Field Logic Shooter Buck 3D Archery Target 71600", "description": "The Block Shooter 3 D Buck Archery Target has a 25% larger insert than comparable 3-D Targets. Ground stakes included. Features 125 inch Antlers and 31 inch shoulder height.", "text": "Field Logic Shooter Buck 3D Archery Target 71600 The Block Shooter 3 D Buck Archery Target has a 25% larger insert than comparable 3-D Targets. Ground stakes included. Features 125 inch Antlers and 31 inch shoulder height.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fL4dlEifL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K2940W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Logic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 84.99}}
{"item_id": "B003K2AA64", "title": "Summit Universal Treestand Seat - Realtree", "description": "Fits most model Summit climbing treestands including: Viper, Goliath, Razor, Titan, Switchblade, Dagger, Bullet, and Python. Also fits many commercially available stands.", "text": "Summit Universal Treestand Seat - Realtree Fits most model Summit climbing treestands including: Viper, Goliath, Razor, Titan, Switchblade, Dagger, Bullet, and Python. Also fits many commercially available stands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vAcCSptYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K2AA64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Summit Treestands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stand Accessories"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B003K2BNR4", "title": "Country Brook Design® 2 Inch Heavy Black Polypro Webbing, 25 Yards", "description": "Description:Polypropylene webbing is a soft, flexible fabric of woven fibers. Made from thermoplastic resins, this versitile material is perfect for outdoor use due to it's UV resistance and waterproof fibers. Polypropylene webbing won't stretch like Nylon webbing can, and is more resistant to acid, alkaline, oil and grease.Specifications:Width: 2 inchesApproximately 1.71mm thick1600 lbs tensile strengthUV resistantWater Proof / Mildew ResistantMelting Point of 330 Degrees FahrenheitNotes On Use:It is best to use 2 Inch hardware webbing, strapping, and/or material. D-rings, buckle, triglides etc. are sized by the webbing or straps they are meant to be used with.Country Brook Design cannot be held responsible for misuse of our product. It is the responsibility of the purchaser to determine the suitability of the product for their use.Tensile strength is the average breaking point under good conditions at the factory. We recommend that you use no more that 75% of the tensile strength of any webbing.Some rolls may contain factory splices. If you need a continuous roll let us know.Heavyweight webbing is a multi-purpose product and is commonly used in making:BagsStrapsHandlesReinforcementsLuggageBackpacksSporting GoodsGeneral Purpose Straps", "text": "Country Brook Design® 2 Inch Heavy Black Polypro Webbing, 25 Yards Description:Polypropylene webbing is a soft, flexible fabric of woven fibers. Made from thermoplastic resins, this versitile material is perfect for outdoor use due to it's UV resistance and waterproof fibers. Polypropylene webbing won't stretch like Nylon webbing can, and is more resistant to acid, alkaline, oil and grease.Specifications:Width: 2 inchesApproximately 1.71mm thick1600 lbs tensile strengthUV resistantWater Proof / Mildew ResistantMelting Point of 330 Degrees FahrenheitNotes On Use:It is best to use 2 Inch hardware webbing, strapping, and/or material. D-rings, buckle, triglides etc. are sized by the webbing or straps they are meant to be used with.Country Brook Design cannot be held responsible for misuse of our product. It is the responsibility of the purchaser to determine the suitability of the product for their use.Tensile strength is the average breaking point under good conditions at the factory. We recommend that you use no more that 75% of the tensile strength of any webbing.Some rolls may contain factory splices. If you need a continuous roll let us know.Heavyweight webbing is a multi-purpose product and is commonly used in making:BagsStrapsHandlesReinforcementsLuggageBackpacksSporting GoodsGeneral Purpose Straps", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51S82rZU5xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K2BNR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Ropes, Cords & Webbing", "Webbing"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B003K2E59C", "title": "Summit Surround Seat - Realtree", "description": "Offers full coverage enclosed seat and convenient pockerts within easy reach. Fits most Summit climbing treestand models.", "text": "Summit Surround Seat - Realtree Offers full coverage enclosed seat and convenient pockerts within easy reach. Fits most Summit climbing treestand models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QyOca1IdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K2E59C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Summit Treestands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stand Accessories"]], "price": 77.32}}
{"item_id": "B003K6W9G4", "title": "Primos Truth Cam 46 Camera", "description": "Designed to be your eyes in the woods, the Truth Cam 46 from Primos comes pre-configured and ready to use with 46 infrared LEDs for clear night vision. However--all settings, including camera resolution, are adjustable for your specific needs and conditions. Capable of capturing both still and video images, the Truth Cam 46 offers a 50-foot nighttime range with the full power of its 46 LEDs. However, if you want to conserve battery life, the number of active LEDs is user selectable. The fully-adjustable Truth Cam 46 has operational instructions printed on the camera door for convenience in the field. With the aim to catch every movement in the stand, the Truth Cam 46 boasts a trigger speed of 1.5 seconds of out of sleep mode and takes images every 0.3 seconds when active. The camera can be set for multi-shot bursts of 1, 3, 5, 7, or 9 images per triggering. All images are stamped with date, time, temperature, and moon phase information. The Truth Cam 46 features a back lit LED screen with large easy to read menu settings. Designed for concealment, the Truth Cam 46 has a thin, low-profile casing with a Matrix camo finish. Finally, the Truth Cam 46 supports an eight gigabyte SD card for image storage and is equipped with a molded security cable hole for theft prevention.Features and Specifications:46 infrared LED bankNighttime range: 50 feetAllows selection of number of active LEDs (more night range or battery life)Captures video or still imagesStamps photos or video with date, time, temperature, and moon phase informationSupports up to 8 gigabyte SD cardTrigger speed: 1.5 seconds (0.3-second when camera is not in sleep mode)Back lit LED screen with large easy to read menu settingsLive screen preview for setting up field of viewPassword protection for operating the cameraHeavy-duty hook strap includedMolded security cable hole through case for theft preventionComes pre-configured out-of-the-box with default settingsAll settings are adjustableQuick instructions are printed on camera doorDimensions: 8.75 by 6.625 by 2.875 inches (H x W x D)One-year warranty", "text": "Primos Truth Cam 46 Camera Designed to be your eyes in the woods, the Truth Cam 46 from Primos comes pre-configured and ready to use with 46 infrared LEDs for clear night vision. However--all settings, including camera resolution, are adjustable for your specific needs and conditions. Capable of capturing both still and video images, the Truth Cam 46 offers a 50-foot nighttime range with the full power of its 46 LEDs. However, if you want to conserve battery life, the number of active LEDs is user selectable. The fully-adjustable Truth Cam 46 has operational instructions printed on the camera door for convenience in the field. With the aim to catch every movement in the stand, the Truth Cam 46 boasts a trigger speed of 1.5 seconds of out of sleep mode and takes images every 0.3 seconds when active. The camera can be set for multi-shot bursts of 1, 3, 5, 7, or 9 images per triggering. All images are stamped with date, time, temperature, and moon phase information. The Truth Cam 46 features a back lit LED screen with large easy to read menu settings. Designed for concealment, the Truth Cam 46 has a thin, low-profile casing with a Matrix camo finish. Finally, the Truth Cam 46 supports an eight gigabyte SD card for image storage and is equipped with a molded security cable hole for theft prevention.Features and Specifications:46 infrared LED bankNighttime range: 50 feetAllows selection of number of active LEDs (more night range or battery life)Captures video or still imagesStamps photos or video with date, time, temperature, and moon phase informationSupports up to 8 gigabyte SD cardTrigger speed: 1.5 seconds (0.3-second when camera is not in sleep mode)Back lit LED screen with large easy to read menu settingsLive screen preview for setting up field of viewPassword protection for operating the cameraHeavy-duty hook strap includedMolded security cable hole through case for theft preventionComes pre-configured out-of-the-box with default settingsAll settings are adjustableQuick instructions are printed on camera doorDimensions: 8.75 by 6.625 by 2.875 inches (H x W x D)One-year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51T4JCU4rGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K6W9G4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 165.97}}
{"item_id": "B003K7X53O", "title": "Desantis Intruder For Glock 17 Right Hand Black", "description": "The Intruder is designed for both concealment and comfort. It is tuck-able and adjustable for both height and cant. The holster back consists of top grain premium steer-hide and the leather front component is finished with a supremely durable polyurethane film for lasting beauty. Each Intruder is molded from genuine Kydex sheet to exact specifications. Available in black.", "text": "Desantis Intruder For Glock 17 Right Hand Black The Intruder is designed for both concealment and comfort. It is tuck-able and adjustable for both height and cant. The holster back consists of top grain premium steer-hide and the leather front component is finished with a supremely durable polyurethane film for lasting beauty. Each Intruder is molded from genuine Kydex sheet to exact specifications. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jOQ4UGN9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K7X53O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 45.45}}
{"item_id": "B003K7X5AC", "title": "Desantis Superfly For Glock 26 Ambidextrous Black", "description": "When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "text": "Desantis Superfly For Glock 26 Ambidextrous Black When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EXcIFS%2BsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K7X5AC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.89}}
{"item_id": "B003K7X75U", "title": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black J-Frm/LCR/SP101 Nylon N38BJN3Z0", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black J-Frm/LCR/SP101 Nylon N38BJN3Z0 This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WzOJ85kAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K7X75U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]], "price": 19.26}}
{"item_id": "B003K7Y82Q", "title": "Troy Enhanced Rifle Trigger Guard, Black", "description": "Allows shooter to access trigger while wearing a glove. Also rotates down much like a standard trigger guard. Fills width gap on receivers. No sharp edges or corners.", "text": "Troy Enhanced Rifle Trigger Guard, Black Allows shooter to access trigger while wearing a glove. Also rotates down much like a standard trigger guard. Fills width gap on receivers. No sharp edges or corners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3151-PLSehL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K7Y82Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 23.13}}
{"item_id": "B003K826WO", "title": "DeSantis Apache DB380/Sig238 Right Hand Black", "description": "The Apache's wide, elasticized leg band largely eliminates the unwanted rocking motion commonly associated with ankle holsters. The Apache is made for small, medium and large frame semi-autos and small frame revolvers. All semi-auto models feature an adjustable Velcro thumb break. Revolver and .32cal holsters feature an adjustable thumb strap (without snap, Velcro closure). Designs may vary. Available in black. Semi-auto and revolver holster models are constructed with elastic and have a sheepskin lining with a snap thumb break. The .32cal holster models are constructed of neoprene and feature a Velcro thumb break. Optional C14 strap accommodates semi-auto and revolver holster models only.", "text": "DeSantis Apache DB380/Sig238 Right Hand Black The Apache's wide, elasticized leg band largely eliminates the unwanted rocking motion commonly associated with ankle holsters. The Apache is made for small, medium and large frame semi-autos and small frame revolvers. All semi-auto models feature an adjustable Velcro thumb break. Revolver and .32cal holsters feature an adjustable thumb strap (without snap, Velcro closure). Designs may vary. Available in black. Semi-auto and revolver holster models are constructed with elastic and have a sheepskin lining with a snap thumb break. The .32cal holster models are constructed of neoprene and feature a Velcro thumb break. Optional C14 strap accommodates semi-auto and revolver holster models only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aFZ0ygOqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K826WO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B003K827PU", "title": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black J-Frm/LCR/SP101 Nylon M44BJN3Z0", "description": "When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black J-Frm/LCR/SP101 Nylon M44BJN3Z0 When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51y6OWGGjTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K827PU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 30.23}}
{"item_id": "B003K84C6M", "title": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black LCP/P3AT/DB Nylon M44BJG3Z0", "description": "When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black LCP/P3AT/DB Nylon M44BJG3Z0 When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EXcIFS%2BsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K84C6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 27.8}}
{"item_id": "B003K84C9O", "title": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black P32/P3AT/LCP w/CT LG Nylon M44BJG5Z0", "description": "When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "text": "DESANTIS M44 Super Fly Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black P32/P3AT/LCP w/CT LG Nylon M44BJG5Z0 When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EXcIFS%2BsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K84C9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 30.09}}
{"item_id": "B003K84DO8", "title": "HiViz Ruger LCR Front Sight", "description": "Hi Viz is very excited to offer a front sight for the new Ruger LCR with a steel base and our exclusive clear overmold design making it durable enough for the most extreme use. This sight has two unique features: the Litepipe has a square profile instead of round and the base is pre-drilled for the retaining pin allowing for easier installation", "text": "HiViz Ruger LCR Front Sight Hi Viz is very excited to offer a front sight for the new Ruger LCR with a steel base and our exclusive clear overmold design making it durable enough for the most extreme use. This sight has two unique features: the Litepipe has a square profile instead of round and the base is pre-drilled for the retaining pin allowing for easier installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lQQ55eF5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K84DO8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B003K8AI60", "title": "LaserMax Mantarail Momentary Switch Control System", "description": "It's time to stop re-applying adhesive to your firearm to keep your pressure pad in place. No more zip strips or industrial strength tape getting in your way. The MantaRail® momentary swich control system solves all those problems by pocketing your pressure pad and securely attaching it directly to the Picatinny or Weaver style rail. The flexible material allows for easy activation from anywhere along the pocketed pad while the clips keep your cord tucked and out of your way. Clean up your rail with this ingenius product.", "text": "LaserMax Mantarail Momentary Switch Control System It's time to stop re-applying adhesive to your firearm to keep your pressure pad in place. No more zip strips or industrial strength tape getting in your way. The MantaRail® momentary swich control system solves all those problems by pocketing your pressure pad and securely attaching it directly to the Picatinny or Weaver style rail. The flexible material allows for easy activation from anywhere along the pocketed pad while the clips keep your cord tucked and out of your way. Clean up your rail with this ingenius product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P7CK0LtOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003K8AI60.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserMax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Rails"]], "price": 33.85}}
{"item_id": "B003KI0Q6W", "title": "Chompers Team Catfish Fish Grips", "description": "You have to try an awesome new product called THE FLOATING FISH GRIP (HD). It snaps on their jaws and won’t let go until you do. It’s a great product for kids and other anglers that aren't sure how to hold a catfish. Works great when releasing or taking pictures of your next big catfish! THE FLOATNG FISH GRIPS (HD) even have a hole in the handle to hang a scale from.", "text": "Chompers Team Catfish Fish Grips You have to try an awesome new product called THE FLOATING FISH GRIP (HD). It snaps on their jaws and won’t let go until you do. It’s a great product for kids and other anglers that aren't sure how to hold a catfish. Works great when releasing or taking pictures of your next big catfish! THE FLOATNG FISH GRIPS (HD) even have a hole in the handle to hang a scale from.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31G7Cr%2BdbGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KI0Q6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chompers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Pliers & Multi-Tools"]], "price": 18.18}}
{"item_id": "B003KJYQ3K", "title": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Mossberg 930/935", "description": "The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun. Note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend. Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "text": "Tacstar Sidesaddle Fits Mossberg 930/935 The patented TacStar Sidesaddle mounts 6 extra rounds on your shotgun in a convenient and accessible location for fast reloading. The tough, weatherproof shell carrier is attached to an aluminum mounting plate that installs directly on the shotgun receiver. All mounting screws are included, no gunsmithing required. Installation is easy, and in most cases requires no alterations to the shotgun. Note: some field grade shotguns may require a modification to the shotgun's forend. Shotguns using the TacStar pistol grip forend do not require modification. 12 Gauge only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r3m0A%2B7eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KJYQ3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TacStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.48}}
{"item_id": "B003KK0P16", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove (S&W M&P Series)", "description": "Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits S&W; M&P; Series.", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove (S&W M&P Series) Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits S&W; M&P; Series.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yzZ4xga1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KK0P16.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B003KNC1MO", "title": "Lifeline Pullup Revolution", "description": "Unleash the potential of your pull-up bar. Convert it into a revolutionary full-body muscle sculpting machine. The Pull-up Revolution Plus has a patented design that provides easily adjustable assistance. Assisting up to 100 pounds of your body weight, it opens up an entirely new level of bar exercises, allowing you to sculpt and strengthen more muscles than ever before. The Pull-up Revolution will take you from any starting fitness level to above and beyond the bar. Improve arm, shoulders, and chest strength with assisted pull ups and chin ups. Build stabilizer muscles in abs and back with planks, pushups and knee ups!INCLUDES:-Three 16” resistance cables (R6 resistance level)-One foot stirrup with cable pocket- One bar attachment hook with webbing strap and cable pocket-Included Downloadable WorkoutFEATURES:- Assist in pull up efficiency- Perform more reps and higher quality reps-100 lbs. of adjusted power assistanceBENEFITS:- Perform more proper form pull up reps- Do extra reps past muscle exhaustion- Develop a V-shaped torso–broad shoulders and narrow waist- Gain assistance throughout entire motion- Progressively get stronger–decrease assistance over time- Easy to follow Included Downloadable Workout", "text": "Lifeline Pullup Revolution Unleash the potential of your pull-up bar. Convert it into a revolutionary full-body muscle sculpting machine. The Pull-up Revolution Plus has a patented design that provides easily adjustable assistance. Assisting up to 100 pounds of your body weight, it opens up an entirely new level of bar exercises, allowing you to sculpt and strengthen more muscles than ever before. The Pull-up Revolution will take you from any starting fitness level to above and beyond the bar. Improve arm, shoulders, and chest strength with assisted pull ups and chin ups. Build stabilizer muscles in abs and back with planks, pushups and knee ups!INCLUDES:-Three 16” resistance cables (R6 resistance level)-One foot stirrup with cable pocket- One bar attachment hook with webbing strap and cable pocket-Included Downloadable WorkoutFEATURES:- Assist in pull up efficiency- Perform more reps and higher quality reps-100 lbs. of adjusted power assistanceBENEFITS:- Perform more proper form pull up reps- Do extra reps past muscle exhaustion- Develop a V-shaped torso–broad shoulders and narrow waist- Gain assistance throughout entire motion- Progressively get stronger–decrease assistance over time- Easy to follow Included Downloadable Workout", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uyJOSKabL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KNC1MO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifeline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 36.35}}
{"item_id": "B003KOX294", "title": "Accu-Shot Atlas Bipod With Screw Clamp Style", "description": "The Atlas has been tested by professionals and civilians alike, tested in the sands of Iraq and found to not foul, tested in a Red Bull induced shooting session and survived. The V7 Atlas is ready for you. -Construction from T6061 Aluminum, Type III Hard Anodized black. -Stainless steel springs and fasteners. -UHMW components used for smooth tracking. -15 degrees +/- of preloaded Pan. -15 degrees +/- of preloaded Cant. -Preload on Pan and Cant can be tightened by means of the knurled knob. -Picitinny Rail Mount interface by either standard machine screw fastener based clamp or optional ARMS 17S lever mount (we offer the ARMS 17S on the BT10-LW17 but any lever mount with that same hole spacing will work on the BT10-NC). -Non orientated leg positioning use either hand to move leg into any of the four leg positions; legs stowed back, 90 degrees straight down, 45 degrees forward and stowed forward. -All 4 leg positions are solid allowing the shooter to load the bipod at the 45 and 90 degree positions. -Non orientated leg length adjustment, Outer leg slides on the Inner leg locating on any of five positions 3/4\" apart and can be done by either hand. -Optional 3\" leg extensions to increase height available. -Standard soft durable Rubber feet that are suitable for many surfaces. -Optional interchangeable Ski and Cleat style feet can be swapped in the field with the press of a ball plunger with a bullet tip. -Optional mounting systems available for Accuracy International and Sako rifles. Estimated range of elevation on the BT10 is 5-9\" from the surface up to the rail. -Estimated weight of 10.5 ounces for the clamp on style. -Proudly Made in America.", "text": "Accu-Shot Atlas Bipod With Screw Clamp Style The Atlas has been tested by professionals and civilians alike, tested in the sands of Iraq and found to not foul, tested in a Red Bull induced shooting session and survived. The V7 Atlas is ready for you. -Construction from T6061 Aluminum, Type III Hard Anodized black. -Stainless steel springs and fasteners. -UHMW components used for smooth tracking. -15 degrees +/- of preloaded Pan. -15 degrees +/- of preloaded Cant. -Preload on Pan and Cant can be tightened by means of the knurled knob. -Picitinny Rail Mount interface by either standard machine screw fastener based clamp or optional ARMS 17S lever mount (we offer the ARMS 17S on the BT10-LW17 but any lever mount with that same hole spacing will work on the BT10-NC). -Non orientated leg positioning use either hand to move leg into any of the four leg positions; legs stowed back, 90 degrees straight down, 45 degrees forward and stowed forward. -All 4 leg positions are solid allowing the shooter to load the bipod at the 45 and 90 degree positions. -Non orientated leg length adjustment, Outer leg slides on the Inner leg locating on any of five positions 3/4\" apart and can be done by either hand. -Optional 3\" leg extensions to increase height available. -Standard soft durable Rubber feet that are suitable for many surfaces. -Optional interchangeable Ski and Cleat style feet can be swapped in the field with the press of a ball plunger with a bullet tip. -Optional mounting systems available for Accuracy International and Sako rifles. Estimated range of elevation on the BT10 is 5-9\" from the surface up to the rail. -Estimated weight of 10.5 ounces for the clamp on style. -Proudly Made in America.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XBwL6H5uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KOX294.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AccuShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 219.95}}
{"item_id": "B003KP1PYW", "title": "Benjamin Marauder PCP Air Pistol (.22)", "description": "An excellent choice for hunting, the new Benjamin Marauder .22 caliber PCP pistol is ultra-quiet and more than accurate enough to easily take out small game from up to 33 yards away at velocities up to 700 fps. The improved trigger on the Marauder pistol is accomplished by redesigning the grip frame from our popular 2240 series of guns and adding an adjustable, two-stage, drop sear trigger utilizing precision heat treated metal components. The mechanism is designed and built with the same materials and precision as the very popular Marauder rifle trigger group. The Marauder PCP Pistol features a self-indexing, 8-shot clip and a 12-inch choked and shrouded barrel (scope not included). Overall length of the pistol is 18-inches (pistol grip configuration). A shoulder stock is included and is easily interchangeable with the pistol grips. With 3000 psi of compressed air, this gun has the muscle to quietly and dependably get the job done.", "text": "Benjamin Marauder PCP Air Pistol (.22) An excellent choice for hunting, the new Benjamin Marauder .22 caliber PCP pistol is ultra-quiet and more than accurate enough to easily take out small game from up to 33 yards away at velocities up to 700 fps. The improved trigger on the Marauder pistol is accomplished by redesigning the grip frame from our popular 2240 series of guns and adding an adjustable, two-stage, drop sear trigger utilizing precision heat treated metal components. The mechanism is designed and built with the same materials and precision as the very popular Marauder rifle trigger group. The Marauder PCP Pistol features a self-indexing, 8-shot clip and a 12-inch choked and shrouded barrel (scope not included). Overall length of the pistol is 18-inches (pistol grip configuration). A shoulder stock is included and is easily interchangeable with the pistol grips. With 3000 psi of compressed air, this gun has the muscle to quietly and dependably get the job done.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ke6LQY1dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KP1PYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 392.95}}
{"item_id": "B003KP4WGU", "title": "ACCU-SHOT ATLAS Bipod with ADM 170-S Lever", "description": "The Atlas bipod offers many features that place it in a category of its own.Those featuresincludelegsthat move independently and can be deployed in a 45 degree position either forwards or backwards, in the traditional 90 degree position, and facing directly to the front or back, locking securely into 5 positions through a 180 degree arc.Itprovides the shooter with30 total degrees left to right Pan as well as 30 total degrees of Cant; making it easy to align your cross hairs on the target regardless of the terrain. Offering the strength and stability that shooters demand, the Atlas provides rock solid support while weighing less than 11 ounces. The Patented Atlas is constructed of the finest materials and built to the highest standards right here in the USA. Mounts directly to any 1913 style Picatinny rail via included ADM 170-S Lever. Height Range approximately 4.75 - 9.0\". Weight 12.7 ounces. Available in black only.", "text": "ACCU-SHOT ATLAS Bipod with ADM 170-S Lever The Atlas bipod offers many features that place it in a category of its own.Those featuresincludelegsthat move independently and can be deployed in a 45 degree position either forwards or backwards, in the traditional 90 degree position, and facing directly to the front or back, locking securely into 5 positions through a 180 degree arc.Itprovides the shooter with30 total degrees left to right Pan as well as 30 total degrees of Cant; making it easy to align your cross hairs on the target regardless of the terrain. Offering the strength and stability that shooters demand, the Atlas provides rock solid support while weighing less than 11 ounces. The Patented Atlas is constructed of the finest materials and built to the highest standards right here in the USA. Mounts directly to any 1913 style Picatinny rail via included ADM 170-S Lever. Height Range approximately 4.75 - 9.0\". Weight 12.7 ounces. Available in black only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fZI6vT2uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KP4WGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AccuShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 294.95}}
{"item_id": "B003KP72OY", "title": "Crank Brothers Candy 3 Hangtag Bike Pedal", "description": "Aluminum body with chromoly spindle and steel cast wings perfect for all mountain application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner needle bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "text": "Crank Brothers Candy 3 Hangtag Bike Pedal Aluminum body with chromoly spindle and steel cast wings perfect for all mountain application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner needle bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Sa5aOs2TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KP72OY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 91.02}}
{"item_id": "B003KPQ1RI", "title": "ProSource Set of 4 Premium Stackable Latex Exercise Resistance Bands", "description": "The Premium Stackable Latex Exercise Resistance Bands system from ProSource provide a convenient and economical way for you tone and strengthen your entire body--from the comfort of home. The system includes four, 48-inch resistance bands that each have their own resistance level. The bands can be used individually or stacked to provide you with a total of 14 resistance levels that ranges from five to 56 pounds. In addition to the bands, the system comes complete with cushioned foam handles for a secure, comfortable grip, a door anchor for use anywhere with a solid door, and ankle straps. Designed and built for a safe and effective workout, each band is constructed with high-quality latex rubber that provides reliable stretch resistance. The bands are equipped with durable carabineer attachments for long term performance. The system comes with an exercise guide to get you started, as well as a carry case for easy storage and transport. This resistance band set supports some of the latest workout routines including but not limited to P90X, CrossFit, Slimin6, Insanity, TurboJam, and more.Resistance Specifications:Green band: 5 to 8 poundsRed band: 8 to 12 poundsBlue band: 12 to 16 poundsBlack band: 16 to 20 poundsAbout Resistance Band Training:Resistance band training provides a great alternative to free weights and workout machines. The adjustable bands enable you to train with resistance virtually anywhere--without cumbersome and expensive equipment. In addition to fitness training, resistance bands can also be used for many types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees. Resistance bands are light and compact enough to travel with you anywhere--so that you can maintain your routine even on trips.", "text": "ProSource Set of 4 Premium Stackable Latex Exercise Resistance Bands The Premium Stackable Latex Exercise Resistance Bands system from ProSource provide a convenient and economical way for you tone and strengthen your entire body--from the comfort of home. The system includes four, 48-inch resistance bands that each have their own resistance level. The bands can be used individually or stacked to provide you with a total of 14 resistance levels that ranges from five to 56 pounds. In addition to the bands, the system comes complete with cushioned foam handles for a secure, comfortable grip, a door anchor for use anywhere with a solid door, and ankle straps. Designed and built for a safe and effective workout, each band is constructed with high-quality latex rubber that provides reliable stretch resistance. The bands are equipped with durable carabineer attachments for long term performance. The system comes with an exercise guide to get you started, as well as a carry case for easy storage and transport. This resistance band set supports some of the latest workout routines including but not limited to P90X, CrossFit, Slimin6, Insanity, TurboJam, and more.Resistance Specifications:Green band: 5 to 8 poundsRed band: 8 to 12 poundsBlue band: 12 to 16 poundsBlack band: 16 to 20 poundsAbout Resistance Band Training:Resistance band training provides a great alternative to free weights and workout machines. The adjustable bands enable you to train with resistance virtually anywhere--without cumbersome and expensive equipment. In addition to fitness training, resistance bands can also be used for many types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees. Resistance bands are light and compact enough to travel with you anywhere--so that you can maintain your routine even on trips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tZHEIUPjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KPQ1RI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003KQ696A", "title": "WIGWAM MILLS INC F4707-052-OS WORSTED WOOL WATCH CAP - BLACK", "description": "", "text": "WIGWAM MILLS INC F4707-052-OS WORSTED WOOL WATCH CAP - BLACK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oio42kZCL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KQ696A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wigwam", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skullies & Beanies"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B003KSXVIC", "title": "GOGO Thick Solid Color Wristband with Zipper / Wrist Wallet", "description": "Price for single piece, not pair.Type: Wristband, wrist walletsSize: approximately 4\" x 3.2\" (10cm x 8cm), fit most adult male and femaleMaterial: 95% cotton and 5% lycra, extra thick in two-plyColor: available in pink, green, yellow, red, orange, black, grey and white.With Wrist Wallet, you won't need a purse -- or risk losing valuables by carrying them in a pocket.Features:* Made from soft cotton, fits the skin comfortably.* The pocket can contain credit cards, money and keys. Things will stay safely zipped inside.* Lightweight and convenient, perfect for travel, trips to the gym, jogging, even shopping at the mall.* Material is durable and Colors are beautiful.", "text": "GOGO Thick Solid Color Wristband with Zipper / Wrist Wallet Price for single piece, not pair.Type: Wristband, wrist walletsSize: approximately 4\" x 3.2\" (10cm x 8cm), fit most adult male and femaleMaterial: 95% cotton and 5% lycra, extra thick in two-plyColor: available in pink, green, yellow, red, orange, black, grey and white.With Wrist Wallet, you won't need a purse -- or risk losing valuables by carrying them in a pocket.Features:* Made from soft cotton, fits the skin comfortably.* The pocket can contain credit cards, money and keys. Things will stay safely zipped inside.* Lightweight and convenient, perfect for travel, trips to the gym, jogging, even shopping at the mall.* Material is durable and Colors are beautiful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t972cviXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KSXVIC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Wristbands"]], "price": 2.68}}
