{"item_id": "B003KUX9DW", "title": "Crosman Benjamin Destroyer Hunting Pellets,.25 Caliber, 200 Count", "description": "High quality, precision heavy weight pellets. Designed to complement the power and accuracy of Benjamin PCP guns, these premium pellets will enhance the performance of any and all airguns.", "text": "Crosman Benjamin Destroyer Hunting Pellets,.25 Caliber, 200 Count High quality, precision heavy weight pellets. Designed to complement the power and accuracy of Benjamin PCP guns, these premium pellets will enhance the performance of any and all airguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i7SQkYlKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KUX9DW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Pellets"]], "price": 7.44}}
{"item_id": "B003KV2A04", "title": "303 Protectant", "description": "This is the maintenance product manufacturers recommend most! Only '303' beautifies as intensely, protects as powerfully or lasts as long. This provides powerful UV screening protection for colored gel-coat fiberglass, inflatable boats, vinyl, clear vinyl windows, rubber, plastics and leather.? Just spray on and wipe dry!? Treated surfaces repel dirt, soiling, staining, water spots, salt water and mildew. Note: Each bottle of 303 is sold separately.", "text": "303 Protectant This is the maintenance product manufacturers recommend most! Only '303' beautifies as intensely, protects as powerfully or lasts as long. This provides powerful UV screening protection for colored gel-coat fiberglass, inflatable boats, vinyl, clear vinyl windows, rubber, plastics and leather.? Just spray on and wipe dry!? Treated surfaces repel dirt, soiling, staining, water spots, salt water and mildew. Note: Each bottle of 303 is sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mqdbItgnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KV2A04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "303 Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 18.6}}
{"item_id": "B003KVO9VM", "title": "Pro-Tec Athletics Foam Roller 4 X 12", "description": "PRO-TECH® ATHLETICS FOAM ROLLER 4 x 12 :: The Pro-Tech® Athletics Foam roller is the perfect tool for balance training, muscle relaxation and release, self massage and stretching. This high density foam roller is the perfect size for stuffing in your travel bag for out-of-town races or trips when you know you'll fit a run or two in. 4\" diameter x 12\" length.", "text": "Pro-Tec Athletics Foam Roller 4 X 12 PRO-TECH® ATHLETICS FOAM ROLLER 4 x 12 :: The Pro-Tech® Athletics Foam roller is the perfect tool for balance training, muscle relaxation and release, self massage and stretching. This high density foam roller is the perfect size for stuffing in your travel bag for out-of-town races or trips when you know you'll fit a run or two in. 4\" diameter x 12\" length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qw92iALBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KVO9VM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro-tec Athletics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003KVY9VM", "title": "Hybrid Lights Hybrid Solar Power Lantern Yellow", "description": "Hybrid Solar Power Lantern Yellow. Once charged it can be stored any where. Holds charge for over 1 year. Super bright LED-200 Lumens. Waterproof and it floats. Extremely durable. Environmentally friendly. Full charge = 6 hours on. Back up batteries included. Recharge with sun or artificial light AC or 12V Adaptor. Hi Vis Yellow in color.", "text": "Hybrid Lights Hybrid Solar Power Lantern Yellow Hybrid Solar Power Lantern Yellow. Once charged it can be stored any where. Holds charge for over 1 year. Super bright LED-200 Lumens. Waterproof and it floats. Extremely durable. Environmentally friendly. Full charge = 6 hours on. Back up batteries included. Recharge with sun or artificial light AC or 12V Adaptor. Hi Vis Yellow in color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31M-PrCc7KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KVY9VM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hybrid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B003KZKDG8", "title": "Contigo AUTOSEAL Water Bottle, 32-Ounce, Blue", "description": "Easy to drink, easy to carry. You need your water bottle to look good and go anywhere, while still being easy to drink from. Enter the autoseal Water Bottle- a unique combination of style and function. Durable. Colorful. Functional. 100-percent leak-proof and 100-percent spill-proof so it can go anywhere. The autoseal Water Bottle is easy to drink from, and easy to carry. It's the ultimate in on-the-go hydration.", "text": "Contigo AUTOSEAL Water Bottle, 32-Ounce, Blue Easy to drink, easy to carry. You need your water bottle to look good and go anywhere, while still being easy to drink from. Enter the autoseal Water Bottle- a unique combination of style and function. Durable. Colorful. Functional. 100-percent leak-proof and 100-percent spill-proof so it can go anywhere. The autoseal Water Bottle is easy to drink from, and easy to carry. It's the ultimate in on-the-go hydration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/113a-nQ7AaL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KZKDG8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 23.29}}
