{"item_id": "B003KZKE4Y", "title": "Contigo AUTOSEAL Kangaroo Water Bottle with Storage Compartment, 24-Ounce, Blue", "description": "This water bottle delivers on essential needs while on the go. The AUTOSEAL Water Bottle with compartment delivers on a unique combination of style and function. Durable. Colorful. Functional. Holds your keys and credit cards. The AUTOSEAL Water Bottle is easy to drink from, easy to carry and has a protective cover at the spout . It's the ultimate in on-the-go hydration with a compartment that holds your essentials while on-the-go.", "text": "Contigo AUTOSEAL Kangaroo Water Bottle with Storage Compartment, 24-Ounce, Blue This water bottle delivers on essential needs while on the go. The AUTOSEAL Water Bottle with compartment delivers on a unique combination of style and function. Durable. Colorful. Functional. Holds your keys and credit cards. The AUTOSEAL Water Bottle is easy to drink from, easy to carry and has a protective cover at the spout . It's the ultimate in on-the-go hydration with a compartment that holds your essentials while on-the-go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Cc1PoEjRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003KZKE4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Contigo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.99}}
