{"item_id": "B003L643KS", "title": "NOCO ISCC2 5-Way SAE Adapter Connector", "description": "The NOCO ISCC2 5-Way SAE Adapter Connector is designed to connect up to five SAE devices. Made from a heavy-duty 16 AWG SPT-2 cable, the ISCC2 minimizes voltage drop and heating through the cable. It features rugged overmolded connectors with strain relief protection for a rugged connection and five six inch independent SAE adapter leads. Ideal for daisy chaining multiple SAE devices, like a solar panel, charger, GPS, heat clothing, and other related SAE devices.", "text": "NOCO ISCC2 5-Way SAE Adapter Connector The NOCO ISCC2 5-Way SAE Adapter Connector is designed to connect up to five SAE devices. Made from a heavy-duty 16 AWG SPT-2 cable, the ISCC2 minimizes voltage drop and heating through the cable. It features rugged overmolded connectors with strain relief protection for a rugged connection and five six inch independent SAE adapter leads. Ideal for daisy chaining multiple SAE devices, like a solar panel, charger, GPS, heat clothing, and other related SAE devices.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rrz0aPhAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003L643KS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NOCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Battery Chargers"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B003L75SSI", "title": "Kimber Pepperblaster 2 Red, One Size", "description": "The Kimber PepperBlaster II features an ergonomic pistol grip along with front and rear sights to increase the likelihood of hitting an assailant with the exceptionally powerful OC mixture capable of incapacitating the assailant for up to 45 minutes. A second reserve shot is available as needed. PepperBlaster II pyrotechnic drive blasts the OC out at 90 mph, greatly reducing the chance of contaminating anyone other than your target.This unit is not reusable and should be properly disposed of once both shots are discharged.Measures: 4.7\" L x 1.0\" W x 3.3\"", "text": "Kimber Pepperblaster 2 Red, One Size The Kimber PepperBlaster II features an ergonomic pistol grip along with front and rear sights to increase the likelihood of hitting an assailant with the exceptionally powerful OC mixture capable of incapacitating the assailant for up to 45 minutes. A second reserve shot is available as needed. PepperBlaster II pyrotechnic drive blasts the OC out at 90 mph, greatly reducing the chance of contaminating anyone other than your target.This unit is not reusable and should be properly disposed of once both shots are discharged.Measures: 4.7\" L x 1.0\" W x 3.3\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HG8PGYeCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003L75SSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kimber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care"]], "price": 35.76}}
{"item_id": "B003L8U95Y", "title": "180\" Elastic Cotton MMA Handwraps (Pair)", "description": "NEED WRAPS WITH GOOD PROTECTION? HERE THEY ARE. Meister MMA's 180\" MMA and boxing handwraps. These handwraps are made of high-quality cotton and spandex. They also feature a thumb loop to keep the wraps snug. These wraps come in pairs. Meister MMA handwraps also feature velcro on one end to secure the wraps from sliding. These handwraps are a must for any MMA fighter or boxer. And this is the best deal on Amazon. Get yours today!", "text": "180\" Elastic Cotton MMA Handwraps (Pair) NEED WRAPS WITH GOOD PROTECTION? HERE THEY ARE. Meister MMA's 180\" MMA and boxing handwraps. These handwraps are made of high-quality cotton and spandex. They also feature a thumb loop to keep the wraps snug. These wraps come in pairs. Meister MMA handwraps also feature velcro on one end to secure the wraps from sliding. These handwraps are a must for any MMA fighter or boxer. And this is the best deal on Amazon. Get yours today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517odH864QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003L8U95Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B003L94HTC", "title": "Ritchey Snap-On Bicycle Rim Tape - Pair", "description": "New design offers secure, snug fit to rim. New coating resist \"creeping\" on the rim. Will not dimple into spoke holes, even at high pressure.", "text": "Ritchey Snap-On Bicycle Rim Tape - Pair New design offers secure, snug fit to rim. New coating resist \"creeping\" on the rim. Will not dimple into spoke holes, even at high pressure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ef4gHow9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003L94HTC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003L9EIZK", "title": "TruVativ GXP Team Bottom Bracket Cups", "description": "Get that mountain, road bike, or commuter built up with the SRAM GXP Team Bottom Bracket Cups. Steel construction and cartridge bearings mean exceptional durability without the maintenanceAAAit doesn't get much better than that.Product FeaturesMaterial: steelThreading: English, ItalianShell Width:Weight: 103 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "TruVativ GXP Team Bottom Bracket Cups Get that mountain, road bike, or commuter built up with the SRAM GXP Team Bottom Bracket Cups. Steel construction and cartridge bearings mean exceptional durability without the maintenanceAAAit doesn't get much better than that.Product FeaturesMaterial: steelThreading: English, ItalianShell Width:Weight: 103 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qGMlF27ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003L9EIZK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Bottom Brackets"]]}}
