{"item_id": "B003LS3T0Q", "title": "Magpul MOE Illumination Kit, Black", "description": "Magpul Original Equipment, Rail, Fits MOE Hand Guard, Light Mounting Kit, Short/Cantilever Rails, Pad Mount, Black.", "text": "Magpul MOE Illumination Kit, Black Magpul Original Equipment, Rail, Fits MOE Hand Guard, Light Mounting Kit, Short/Cantilever Rails, Pad Mount, Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EZvdjZgKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LS3T0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003LS3YLK", "title": "Weigand Buckmark Micro Bullseye Plus Camper Scope Mount. BLACK", "description": "Lightweight, versatile scope mount easily converts the Buckmark from open sights to scope sights with no permanent modifications required. Simply remove the factory sight rail and install with the screws provided. Accepts Weaver-style rings and accessories. 6-1/4\" black or silver, matte anodized finish, weighs 1.7 ounces.", "text": "Weigand Buckmark Micro Bullseye Plus Camper Scope Mount. BLACK Lightweight, versatile scope mount easily converts the Buckmark from open sights to scope sights with no permanent modifications required. Simply remove the factory sight rail and install with the screws provided. Accepts Weaver-style rings and accessories. 6-1/4\" black or silver, matte anodized finish, weighs 1.7 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lOR4MZv%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LS3YLK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B003LS898I", "title": "Accu-Shot PRM (Precision Rail Monopod) Standard (BT12) with Quick Knob Option", "description": "The new patented Precision Rail monopod (PRM) was inspired by the Magpul Precision Rifle Stock (PRS) and has several other applications where a Picatinny rail is found, including as a folding vertical fore grip. The PRM is our second departure from our original monopod, the first being the ASAI which we borrowed the mechanics from to provide a proven system for the PRM including the push button deployment and retraction feature. Major components are constructed from T6061 Aluminum with a hard anodize finish, internal components made from alloy steels, heat treated to Rockwell 52 for long lasting strength and durability. All PRM's come with a Thumbnut which allows the operator to \"jam\" the knob removing all of the tolerance found between the Male/Female threads for an extremely solid shooting platform. The leg folds up and retracts out of the way when not needed. Black only. Made in the USA. Approximate elevation range of 3.5 - 4.75\". Consider upgrading with the new Quick Knob (QK01) for faster target acquisition. These monopods are being delivered now and are manufactured in limited quantities on a regular basis. They are available on first come first served basis so delays might be experienced. If you place an order your credit card will be charged immediately and we will ship your ASAI asap. If you want to be notified when units are available, please email us with your requests and you will be notified. Those that prepay will get preference over those on the \"to be notified\" list. Quick Knob-Standard Option The new Standard Quick Knob (QK01) allows quick gross adjustments into the target with a push of a button! The QK01 has a spring loaded button that when depressed allows the operator to slide the knob up or down on the Actuator Rod quickly into the desired sight picture. When the button is released, the fine threads are re-engaged and the operator can make the final adjustments by rotating the QK01 knob.", "text": "Accu-Shot PRM (Precision Rail Monopod) Standard (BT12) with Quick Knob Option The new patented Precision Rail monopod (PRM) was inspired by the Magpul Precision Rifle Stock (PRS) and has several other applications where a Picatinny rail is found, including as a folding vertical fore grip. The PRM is our second departure from our original monopod, the first being the ASAI which we borrowed the mechanics from to provide a proven system for the PRM including the push button deployment and retraction feature. Major components are constructed from T6061 Aluminum with a hard anodize finish, internal components made from alloy steels, heat treated to Rockwell 52 for long lasting strength and durability. All PRM's come with a Thumbnut which allows the operator to \"jam\" the knob removing all of the tolerance found between the Male/Female threads for an extremely solid shooting platform. The leg folds up and retracts out of the way when not needed. Black only. Made in the USA. Approximate elevation range of 3.5 - 4.75\". Consider upgrading with the new Quick Knob (QK01) for faster target acquisition. These monopods are being delivered now and are manufactured in limited quantities on a regular basis. They are available on first come first served basis so delays might be experienced. If you place an order your credit card will be charged immediately and we will ship your ASAI asap. If you want to be notified when units are available, please email us with your requests and you will be notified. Those that prepay will get preference over those on the \"to be notified\" list. Quick Knob-Standard Option The new Standard Quick Knob (QK01) allows quick gross adjustments into the target with a push of a button! The QK01 has a spring loaded button that when depressed allows the operator to slide the knob up or down on the Actuator Rod quickly into the desired sight picture. When the button is released, the fine threads are re-engaged and the operator can make the final adjustments by rotating the QK01 knob.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318UnTqCeJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LS898I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Accu-Shot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 100.5}}
{"item_id": "B003LT3ISI", "title": "UTG Low Profile Riser Mount with 13 slots", "description": "", "text": "UTG Low Profile Riser Mount with 13 slots", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n%2BmFZYmQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LT3ISI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 10.28}}
{"item_id": "B003LUWUF4", "title": "Set of 12 Large 10\" Galvanized Steel Tent Peg Stake Nail with T-Top - Heavy-Duty 8mm Diameter", "description": "Besides doing a great job at keeping your tent where you put it, these heavy-duty pegs have multiple uses around home and ranch, too: anchor canopies, gazebos and other temporary shelters, as landscaping stakes and just about anything else you want to stay put on the ground. Heavy-duty 8mm galvanized steel pegs with thermoplastic T-Top. Color of T-top may vary from item pictured.", "text": "Set of 12 Large 10\" Galvanized Steel Tent Peg Stake Nail with T-Top - Heavy-Duty 8mm Diameter Besides doing a great job at keeping your tent where you put it, these heavy-duty pegs have multiple uses around home and ranch, too: anchor canopies, gazebos and other temporary shelters, as landscaping stakes and just about anything else you want to stay put on the ground. Heavy-duty 8mm galvanized steel pegs with thermoplastic T-Top. Color of T-top may vary from item pictured.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bMk2zEdDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LUWUF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JND", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 11.98}}
{"item_id": "B003LVHZ4O", "title": "Safe Zone Bicycle Helmet Mirror", "description": "The Safe Zone Bicycle Helmet Mirror is simply the finest helmet-mounted bicycle mirror made. We are certain of this because of thousands of our customers who have told us this in no uncertain terms. Cyclists who are safety-oriented quickly come to realize that our product is superior in functionality and durability to all competing helmet mirrors. The 2 1/4\" mirror yields a huge field of view, much larger than any other helmet mirror. The mirror's size makes it easy to view everything approaching from the rear while the sturdy mounting is unparalleled - with no weak adhesives or fragile parts! Additionally, the linked stalk is easy to adjust , maintains functionality and is guaranteed not to loosen! Simply attach to helmet with included zip-ties, bend it into a position that offers best visibility, and watch your awareness of the road behind you go beyond anything you previously knew was possible. We personally service the 5-Year No-Fault Warranty, so you don't have to worry about your bicycle rear-view needs for at least 5 years from purchase. Try it out and we're sure you'll agree that the Safe Zone is the finest bicycle helmet mirror made. Product ships with a protective plastic film over mirror which must be removed before first use.", "text": "Safe Zone Bicycle Helmet Mirror The Safe Zone Bicycle Helmet Mirror is simply the finest helmet-mounted bicycle mirror made. We are certain of this because of thousands of our customers who have told us this in no uncertain terms. Cyclists who are safety-oriented quickly come to realize that our product is superior in functionality and durability to all competing helmet mirrors. The 2 1/4\" mirror yields a huge field of view, much larger than any other helmet mirror. The mirror's size makes it easy to view everything approaching from the rear while the sturdy mounting is unparalleled - with no weak adhesives or fragile parts! Additionally, the linked stalk is easy to adjust , maintains functionality and is guaranteed not to loosen! Simply attach to helmet with included zip-ties, bend it into a position that offers best visibility, and watch your awareness of the road behind you go beyond anything you previously knew was possible. We personally service the 5-Year No-Fault Warranty, so you don't have to worry about your bicycle rear-view needs for at least 5 years from purchase. Try it out and we're sure you'll agree that the Safe Zone is the finest bicycle helmet mirror made. Product ships with a protective plastic film over mirror which must be removed before first use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BhUMPZldL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LVHZ4O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 40.0}}
{"item_id": "B003LXJN3I", "title": "Inside Pants holster for Ruger LCP with Underbarrel laser", "description": "This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn either right or left handed, anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip and an adjustable, removable thumb break. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Inside Pants holster for Ruger LCP with Underbarrel laser This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn either right or left handed, anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip and an adjustable, removable thumb break. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UKO-sHBlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LXJN3I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B003LXNVHM", "title": "Holster for Ruger LCP pistol", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for Ruger LCP pistol This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t%2BsOZ0cfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LXNVHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.9}}
{"item_id": "B003LXPX3W", "title": "Weigand Ruger MKI MKII 22/45 No Gunsmithing Scope Mount - Black", "description": "If you have and older Ruger MKI, MKII that's not drilled and tapped you can install this SCOPEMOUNT without making any permanent alterations to your favorite pistol. Remove the rear sight, insert the threaded dovetail filler and install the mount with the screws provided. Accepts all Weaver-style rings and accessories. 5-1/4\" long, silver or Black, matte anodoized finish, weighs 2.5 ounces.", "text": "Weigand Ruger MKI MKII 22/45 No Gunsmithing Scope Mount - Black If you have and older Ruger MKI, MKII that's not drilled and tapped you can install this SCOPEMOUNT without making any permanent alterations to your favorite pistol. Remove the rear sight, insert the threaded dovetail filler and install the mount with the screws provided. Accepts all Weaver-style rings and accessories. 5-1/4\" long, silver or Black, matte anodoized finish, weighs 2.5 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kxwUrwkKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LXPX3W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B003LXUOH2", "title": "Weigand Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIII, 22/45 Scope Mount - Black", "description": "Scope Mount Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIII, Government Model Competition 22/45 You can pay more money but you can't buy a better stronger scope mount for your MkII MKI 22/45. Lightweight scope rail attaches in just seconds to pistols that are factory drilled and tapped. Provides a \"rock steady\" base that accepts all Weaver-style rings and accessories. Includes mounting screws which are 6-48 thread.", "text": "Weigand Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIII, 22/45 Scope Mount - Black Scope Mount Ruger MKI, MKII, MKIII, Government Model Competition 22/45 You can pay more money but you can't buy a better stronger scope mount for your MkII MKI 22/45. Lightweight scope rail attaches in just seconds to pistols that are factory drilled and tapped. Provides a \"rock steady\" base that accepts all Weaver-style rings and accessories. Includes mounting screws which are 6-48 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3153HCPU6nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LXUOH2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003LYFM0A", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Stealth Black 15-40x50mm Compact Tactical Hunting Spotting Scope +Tripod+ Carry Case", "description": "Brand New. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Brand. Stealth Black Color. Magnification- 15x - 40x-Zoom Adjustable. Objective Diameter-50mm .Field of view at 100 Yards- 2.5 FT. multi Coated Lens Coating. Easy One hand Operation. Compact Design. Rubber Armored. Soft Rubber Eye piece. Built_in Adjustable Sunshade. Wide Field of View. 3\" Foldable Tripod Included. Lens protective Caps . CArry Case. Length-8.5\" , Weight- 12.8oz.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Stealth Black 15-40x50mm Compact Tactical Hunting Spotting Scope +Tripod+ Carry Case Brand New. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Brand. Stealth Black Color. Magnification- 15x - 40x-Zoom Adjustable. Objective Diameter-50mm .Field of view at 100 Yards- 2.5 FT. multi Coated Lens Coating. Easy One hand Operation. Compact Design. Rubber Armored. Soft Rubber Eye piece. Built_in Adjustable Sunshade. Wide Field of View. 3\" Foldable Tripod Included. Lens protective Caps . CArry Case. Length-8.5\" , Weight- 12.8oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I7L-aahXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LYFM0A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003LZ2QYE", "title": "UTG Medium Profile Riser Mount with 13 slots", "description": "This UTG New Gen, riser mount has a 5.7-inchPicatinny rail with 13 slots, a medium profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .83 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing. Includes a mounting base, two through holes, and proper clearance below the base for installing the classic STANAG-styled scopes.Features:New Gen. riser mount for rifles with Picatinny/Weaver rail1 Picatinny rail with 13 slotsMedium profileSide plate with spring tension for quick and easy installationPrecision machined from aircraft aluminum with matte black anodizing0.83-inch saddle height with see-through designSee-through design allows for the use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 6.1 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 5.7 by 1.75 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Medium Profile Riser Mount with 13 slots This UTG New Gen, riser mount has a 5.7-inchPicatinny rail with 13 slots, a medium profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .83 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing. Includes a mounting base, two through holes, and proper clearance below the base for installing the classic STANAG-styled scopes.Features:New Gen. riser mount for rifles with Picatinny/Weaver rail1 Picatinny rail with 13 slotsMedium profileSide plate with spring tension for quick and easy installationPrecision machined from aircraft aluminum with matte black anodizing0.83-inch saddle height with see-through designSee-through design allows for the use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 6.1 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 5.7 by 1.75 inches (L x W)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oZ%2BUgY%2BDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003LZ2QYE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 14.89}}
