{"item_id": "B003M67L2O", "title": "Mosin Nagant Military Style Replica Rifle Sling For 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 M44", "description": "Mosin Nagant Military Style Replica Rifle Sling For 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 M44 - Material: Sling: Heavy canvas, End tabs and keepers: Leather, Color: Sling: Green, End tabs and keepers: Brown, Dimensions Width: 1.40 inches, Length: 36\" when fully open. Fits all the following Mosin Nagant rifles and carbines: M38, M39, M44, M53, 91/30, 1891/30, Dragoon, Brand new replica NOT a vintage surplus sling", "text": "Mosin Nagant Military Style Replica Rifle Sling For 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 M44 Mosin Nagant Military Style Replica Rifle Sling For 1891/30 91/30 M38 M39 M44 - Material: Sling: Heavy canvas, End tabs and keepers: Leather, Color: Sling: Green, End tabs and keepers: Brown, Dimensions Width: 1.40 inches, Length: 36\" when fully open. Fits all the following Mosin Nagant rifles and carbines: M38, M39, M44, M53, 91/30, 1891/30, Dragoon, Brand new replica NOT a vintage surplus sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51buDGWdbxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003M67L2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "m1surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B003M6PZAO", "title": "Sig Sauer P226 X-Five .177cal.- BAX System-Full Metal Body-Blow Back", "description": "Full Metal Blowback with an authentic look and feel. Shoots extremely accurate, and has one of the strongest recoil's in it's class.", "text": "Sig Sauer P226 X-Five .177cal.- BAX System-Full Metal Body-Blow Back Full Metal Blowback with an authentic look and feel. Shoots extremely accurate, and has one of the strongest recoil's in it's class.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VYtZDVW7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003M6PZAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sig Sauer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 119.99}}
{"item_id": "B003M7N0PK", "title": "P-Line Adaro 7.5-Inch Aluminum Pliers", "description": "", "text": "P-Line Adaro 7.5-Inch Aluminum Pliers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FhNuAMsKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003M7N0PK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "P-Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Pliers & Multi-Tools"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B003MA1SSI", "title": "Sadlak Industries M14 National Match Spring Guide", "description": "Our National Match Spring Guide improves the consistency and smooth motion of the operating rod which help reduce wear and increase rifle accuracy over the standard stamped GI guide. Our NM Spring Guides are NOT made from a cut-off stamped GI guide welded to a round drill rod. These make-shift NM GI guides often have a soft magazine catch caused by the welding and may not be precisely aligned because of poor fixturing. SpacerOur NM spring guides are produced to the same specifications as the military�s national match rifles. The precision is enhanced by making them from one-solid piece of round 8620 tool steel with no welding to cause distortion. Each is case hardened to 40-45 HRc in an inert gas furnace to help maintain straightness and uniform hardness for long service. They are finished with a corrosive resistant Mil. Spec. manganese phosphate (aka Parkerized). What makes our NM Spring Guides unique and more accurate is our precision alignment of the magazine catch to the guide shaft. This is achieved by turning the .344 diameter shaft from a larger diameter solid rod. The magazine catch is then precision CNC machined while being located from the guide shaft. Four flats are milled into .344 shaft body to reduce weight and friction between the spring which adds to the smooth action while precisely guiding the operating rod.", "text": "Sadlak Industries M14 National Match Spring Guide Our National Match Spring Guide improves the consistency and smooth motion of the operating rod which help reduce wear and increase rifle accuracy over the standard stamped GI guide. Our NM Spring Guides are NOT made from a cut-off stamped GI guide welded to a round drill rod. These make-shift NM GI guides often have a soft magazine catch caused by the welding and may not be precisely aligned because of poor fixturing. SpacerOur NM spring guides are produced to the same specifications as the military�s national match rifles. The precision is enhanced by making them from one-solid piece of round 8620 tool steel with no welding to cause distortion. Each is case hardened to 40-45 HRc in an inert gas furnace to help maintain straightness and uniform hardness for long service. They are finished with a corrosive resistant Mil. Spec. manganese phosphate (aka Parkerized). What makes our NM Spring Guides unique and more accurate is our precision alignment of the magazine catch to the guide shaft. This is achieved by turning the .344 diameter shaft from a larger diameter solid rod. The magazine catch is then precision CNC machined while being located from the guide shaft. Four flats are milled into .344 shaft body to reduce weight and friction between the spring which adds to the smooth action while precisely guiding the operating rod.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21pfYJJIT-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MA1SSI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 40.75}}
{"item_id": "B003MA3VWY", "title": "Sadlak Industries M14/M1A Gas Cylinder Wrench - Aluminum, 1/2\" Thick", "description": "Combination tool to hold and prevent damaging gas cylinder during gas plug removal plus conveniently hold piston to prevent it from rotating during cleaning using a special D-shaped hole built into the wrench. The finish is a .004 thick mil-spec. durable non-mar baked-on coating in OD Green", "text": "Sadlak Industries M14/M1A Gas Cylinder Wrench - Aluminum, 1/2\" Thick Combination tool to hold and prevent damaging gas cylinder during gas plug removal plus conveniently hold piston to prevent it from rotating during cleaning using a special D-shaped hole built into the wrench. The finish is a .004 thick mil-spec. durable non-mar baked-on coating in OD Green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/216mlbUcbjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MA3VWY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003MA7QG6", "title": "Sadlak Industries M14/M1A 4pc Service Tools", "description": "Olive Drab Green. The aluminum model is CNC machined from 1/2 thick aircraft quality 6061 heat-treated aluminum. The thicker material and large beveled edges provide added comfort. Oversized-Wrench For foreign made gas cylinders, we offer an over-sized version available only in 1/2 thk. alum., olive drab color. Gas Cylinder Wrench Combo Tool The large hole in the wrench is internally D-Shaped to conveniently hold the small end of the piston from rotating during cleaning (see photos at bottom). Cleaning Drill Set Drill Set The cleaning drill set includes a #15 (.180 dia) & Letter 'P' (.323 dia.) drill for scraping the carbon deposits from the internal bores. The drill handles are CNC machined from the same type of 6061 aluminum with a comfortable ergonomic design. Gas Cylinder Plug Cleaning Drill - Letter \"O\" Drill (Dia .316) After removing the gas plug using the Sadlak Gas Cylinder Wrench and a USGI Combo Tool (or a 3/8 box wrench), insert the new \"O\" drill into the gas plug to scrape and remove carbon deposits. Finish All tools are finished with a baked-on Non-Mar Mil Spec coating (same spec used by the military) in your choice of colors. This finish is .002 - .004 thick and very durable, plus, the wrench won't damage or mark your gas cylinder.", "text": "Sadlak Industries M14/M1A 4pc Service Tools Olive Drab Green. The aluminum model is CNC machined from 1/2 thick aircraft quality 6061 heat-treated aluminum. The thicker material and large beveled edges provide added comfort. Oversized-Wrench For foreign made gas cylinders, we offer an over-sized version available only in 1/2 thk. alum., olive drab color. Gas Cylinder Wrench Combo Tool The large hole in the wrench is internally D-Shaped to conveniently hold the small end of the piston from rotating during cleaning (see photos at bottom). Cleaning Drill Set Drill Set The cleaning drill set includes a #15 (.180 dia) & Letter 'P' (.323 dia.) drill for scraping the carbon deposits from the internal bores. The drill handles are CNC machined from the same type of 6061 aluminum with a comfortable ergonomic design. Gas Cylinder Plug Cleaning Drill - Letter \"O\" Drill (Dia .316) After removing the gas plug using the Sadlak Gas Cylinder Wrench and a USGI Combo Tool (or a 3/8 box wrench), insert the new \"O\" drill into the gas plug to scrape and remove carbon deposits. Finish All tools are finished with a baked-on Non-Mar Mil Spec coating (same spec used by the military) in your choice of colors. This finish is .002 - .004 thick and very durable, plus, the wrench won't damage or mark your gas cylinder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eRSLwsuML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MA7QG6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003MG67GA", "title": "Crosman Biodegradable AirSoft BBs (5000 .20G 6mm, White BBs)", "description": "5000 count white, .20 gram, 6mm, biodegradable airsoft BBs in a convenient clear plastic container with carry handle.", "text": "Crosman Biodegradable AirSoft BBs (5000 .20G 6mm, White BBs) 5000 count white, .20 gram, 6mm, biodegradable airsoft BBs in a convenient clear plastic container with carry handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51v7XUDd9xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MG67GA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003MGA1E4", "title": "Eagle Claw Pack-It Telescopic Spinning Rod, 5-Feet x 6-Inch", "description": "This Pack-It rod is perfect for fisherman on the go. Eagle Claw's Pack-It Rods feature durable glass construction which makes them perfect for the trail. Made of Glass blank material, EVA foam handle, Ceramic guides and graphite reel seat. 5 Foot 6 Inch telescopic rod.", "text": "Eagle Claw Pack-It Telescopic Spinning Rod, 5-Feet x 6-Inch This Pack-It rod is perfect for fisherman on the go. Eagle Claw's Pack-It Rods feature durable glass construction which makes them perfect for the trail. Made of Glass blank material, EVA foam handle, Ceramic guides and graphite reel seat. 5 Foot 6 Inch telescopic rod.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311m4RiioeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MGA1E4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Spinning Rods"]], "price": 17.79}}
{"item_id": "B003MIDAAY", "title": "4 Oz Ounce Magnum Red Pepper Spray w/ UV Dye", "description": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray - 4oz ORMD Pepper Spray. Contains 4 ounces of HOT OC pepper spray. UV identifying dye. One hand operation. Multiple blasts up to 12 feet. Causes no permanent injuries. Nontoxic and nonflammable. 17% Oleoresin Capsicum. Made in USA.", "text": "4 Oz Ounce Magnum Red Pepper Spray w/ UV Dye Police Magnum Pepper Spray - 4oz ORMD Pepper Spray. Contains 4 ounces of HOT OC pepper spray. UV identifying dye. One hand operation. Multiple blasts up to 12 feet. Causes no permanent injuries. Nontoxic and nonflammable. 17% Oleoresin Capsicum. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316ETMkw1pL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MIDAAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pepper Spray", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B003MILW2W", "title": "Elite Force 0.20 gram - 2700 count Airsoft Bottle", "description": "The Elite Force 0.20g BB's are seamless precision grade BB's, perfect for all Elite Force guns and high end AEGs. Using 0.20g BBs provide greater accuracy and shot consistency than 0.12g BB's, and won't break apart in your airsoft gun which can void your gun's warranty and damage your airsoft gun. The Elite Force 0.20g BB's are a great high performance seamless BB for your Airsoft gun. 2,700 rounds come in a bottle.", "text": "Elite Force 0.20 gram - 2700 count Airsoft Bottle The Elite Force 0.20g BB's are seamless precision grade BB's, perfect for all Elite Force guns and high end AEGs. Using 0.20g BBs provide greater accuracy and shot consistency than 0.12g BB's, and won't break apart in your airsoft gun which can void your gun's warranty and damage your airsoft gun. The Elite Force 0.20g BB's are a great high performance seamless BB for your Airsoft gun. 2,700 rounds come in a bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ad0qY4S8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MILW2W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003MNO9F4", "title": "Ontario 8910 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black EDP coated tanto blade style with rounded Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8910 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black) This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Black EDP coated tanto blade style with rounded Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3153F-vcofL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003MNO9F4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
