{"item_id": "B003N6X9YC", "title": "Well D90f Aeg Auto Electric Sub Machine Gun Airsoft P90 Assault Rifle", "description": "WELL D90F AEG - Auto Electric P90 Airsoft Assault Rifle (FPS 200) - Plastic Gear Box - EG1000 High Torque Motor - Hop-up System High Capacity Magazine (400 Rounds) (Retail 9.99) Features: * (AEG) Auto Electric Gun - P90 Style Airsoft Rifle * New Version 6 Plastic Gearbox * High Capacity Magazine - 400 Rounds * Shoots 400 Rounds Per Minute * FPS - 200 w/ 0.12g 6mm BB's * Overall Length - 19.5\" Inches Includes : * Well D90F AEG Airsoft Rifle * High Capacity Magazine - 400 Rounds * 100 Free 6mm 0.12g BB Bag * Safety Goggles * 7.2V Rechargeable Battery Pack * Battery Charger * Shoulder Strap Sling * Cleaning / Jamming Rod Specification : * FPS : 200 w/ 0.12g BB * High Capacity Magazine Clip : 400 Rounds * Overall Length : 19.5\" inches * Weight : 2.2 lbs", "text": "Well D90f Aeg Auto Electric Sub Machine Gun Airsoft P90 Assault Rifle WELL D90F AEG - Auto Electric P90 Airsoft Assault Rifle (FPS 200) - Plastic Gear Box - EG1000 High Torque Motor - Hop-up System High Capacity Magazine (400 Rounds) (Retail 9.99) Features: * (AEG) Auto Electric Gun - P90 Style Airsoft Rifle * New Version 6 Plastic Gearbox * High Capacity Magazine - 400 Rounds * Shoots 400 Rounds Per Minute * FPS - 200 w/ 0.12g 6mm BB's * Overall Length - 19.5\" Inches Includes : * Well D90F AEG Airsoft Rifle * High Capacity Magazine - 400 Rounds * 100 Free 6mm 0.12g BB Bag * Safety Goggles * 7.2V Rechargeable Battery Pack * Battery Charger * Shoulder Strap Sling * Cleaning / Jamming Rod Specification : * FPS : 200 w/ 0.12g BB * High Capacity Magazine Clip : 400 Rounds * Overall Length : 19.5\" inches * Weight : 2.2 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vpH-z6nIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003N6X9YC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 39.46}}
{"item_id": "B003N73S9M", "title": "Garmin 010-11478-02 AC Charger U.S.", "description": "This kit includes one micro cable and one mini cable, so you can use it to charge or power your compatible device. Plug the appropriate cable into your device, then attach the AC outlet adapter for power or connect to a personal computer for data transfer. Compatible with the following Garmin Models: nuLink: 1695 and nuvi: 2200, 2250, 2250LT, 3750, 3760T, 3790T", "text": "Garmin 010-11478-02 AC Charger U.S. This kit includes one micro cable and one mini cable, so you can use it to charge or power your compatible device. Plug the appropriate cable into your device, then attach the AC outlet adapter for power or connect to a personal computer for data transfer. Compatible with the following Garmin Models: nuLink: 1695 and nuvi: 2200, 2250, 2250LT, 3750, 3760T, 3790T", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DmoF%2BzLfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003N73S9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Garmin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 19.28}}
{"item_id": "B003N7NQOY", "title": "BARSKA CO11502 20-60x60 Waterproof Straight Spotting Scope with Tripod", "description": "Barska 20-60x60 Waterproof Straight Spotting Scope with Tripod, Colorado Series is perfect for birders, hunters and naturalists. This spotting scope delivers astounding brightness and clarity for optimal viewing. The Barska 20-60x60 Spotting Scope features variable 20x-60x zoom magnification that allows you to lock on to your subject and then zoom in for greater detail. This Barska Spotting Scope has a 60mm fully coated objective lens that reveals images in optimum contrast, vivid color, and with sharp resolution. The Barska Colorado Series Spotting Scope is 100 percent waterproof and fogproof, housed in a rubber armor covering to protect the scope from harsh weather conditions and includes an attached lens cover for added protection. Accessories include pan-head tripod and soft carrying case.Features:Waterproof spotting scope with tripodFully coated lensesRubber armor housing100 percent waterproof and fogproofHoused in rubber armor covering for protectionIncludes attached lens cover, soft carrying case, pan-head tripod20x-60x magnification60mm fully coated lensLifetime warranty", "text": "BARSKA CO11502 20-60x60 Waterproof Straight Spotting Scope with Tripod Barska 20-60x60 Waterproof Straight Spotting Scope with Tripod, Colorado Series is perfect for birders, hunters and naturalists. This spotting scope delivers astounding brightness and clarity for optimal viewing. The Barska 20-60x60 Spotting Scope features variable 20x-60x zoom magnification that allows you to lock on to your subject and then zoom in for greater detail. This Barska Spotting Scope has a 60mm fully coated objective lens that reveals images in optimum contrast, vivid color, and with sharp resolution. The Barska Colorado Series Spotting Scope is 100 percent waterproof and fogproof, housed in a rubber armor covering to protect the scope from harsh weather conditions and includes an attached lens cover for added protection. Accessories include pan-head tripod and soft carrying case.Features:Waterproof spotting scope with tripodFully coated lensesRubber armor housing100 percent waterproof and fogproofHoused in rubber armor covering for protectionIncludes attached lens cover, soft carrying case, pan-head tripod20x-60x magnification60mm fully coated lensLifetime warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ff8JOi0HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003N7NQOY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 89.79}}
{"item_id": "B003N7OZV2", "title": "8946 Spring Metal Airsoft M9 Pistol Gun FPS 260", "description": "New UKARMS 8946 Spring Metal M9 Handgun Airsoft Pistol (FPS - 260) - Detachable Metal Receiver (Retail: $24.99) Item #: 8946 Brand : UKARMS Includes: * 8946 Spring Metal Airsoft Pistol * Detachable Metal Receiver * Magazine * Sample Bag of 6mm 0.12g bb Specifications: * Color: Black * FPS - 260 * ABS Hard Plastic Construction w/ Metal Receiver & Barrel * Overall Length: 8.5\" inches * Gun Net Weight: 1.38 lbs", "text": "8946 Spring Metal Airsoft M9 Pistol Gun FPS 260 New UKARMS 8946 Spring Metal M9 Handgun Airsoft Pistol (FPS - 260) - Detachable Metal Receiver (Retail: $24.99) Item #: 8946 Brand : UKARMS Includes: * 8946 Spring Metal Airsoft Pistol * Detachable Metal Receiver * Magazine * Sample Bag of 6mm 0.12g bb Specifications: * Color: Black * FPS - 260 * ABS Hard Plastic Construction w/ Metal Receiver & Barrel * Overall Length: 8.5\" inches * Gun Net Weight: 1.38 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BtoCiYH1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003N7OZV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UKARMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B003N9LQE4", "title": "ESS Eyewear Ice 3LS Eyeshield Kit, Black", "description": "The ESS Interchangeable Component Eyeshield (ICE) is a lightweight, frameless eye protection system that offers a unique combination of high-impact resistance, unrestricted field of view and interchangeable lenses for effective eye protection in any light condition. Equipped with the ICE temple designs, the ICE eye shield features improved fit with head borne equipment and increased ease of temple adjustment and lens interchange. Adjustable ear bends allow for a comfortable, secure, anatomical fit. Telescoping temples offer bend-to-fit inner-wire ear tabs and a Snap-On leash system. All ICE lenses provide 100% UVA/UVB protection and exceed ANSI Z87.1-2010 and the U.S Military.15 caliber ballistic impact test MIL-PRF-31013 (Clause 3.5.1.1). The Ice 3LS Kit includes one fully assembled Black frame with clear lens. They also include the interchangeable Smoke Gray and Hi-Def Yellow lenses, an elastic strap, anti-fog cloth and Protective case.", "text": "ESS Eyewear Ice 3LS Eyeshield Kit, Black The ESS Interchangeable Component Eyeshield (ICE) is a lightweight, frameless eye protection system that offers a unique combination of high-impact resistance, unrestricted field of view and interchangeable lenses for effective eye protection in any light condition. Equipped with the ICE temple designs, the ICE eye shield features improved fit with head borne equipment and increased ease of temple adjustment and lens interchange. Adjustable ear bends allow for a comfortable, secure, anatomical fit. Telescoping temples offer bend-to-fit inner-wire ear tabs and a Snap-On leash system. All ICE lenses provide 100% UVA/UVB protection and exceed ANSI Z87.1-2010 and the U.S Military.15 caliber ballistic impact test MIL-PRF-31013 (Clause 3.5.1.1). The Ice 3LS Kit includes one fully assembled Black frame with clear lens. They also include the interchangeable Smoke Gray and Hi-Def Yellow lenses, an elastic strap, anti-fog cloth and Protective case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-U3cDn2DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003N9LQE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESS Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 58.85}}
{"item_id": "B003NAOERO", "title": "Improved Military UTM/MGRS Reader & Protractor \"Super GTA\"", "description": "This tool is an improved version of the Graphic Training Aid 5-2-12 Coordinate Scale and Protractor used by United States and NATO military forces around the world. By using a slot on one side of the tool for access to the map, the tool can be more compact than the traditional GTA tool. The tool features several additional map scales, including 1:24,000, which is the most common topographic map scale found within the United States. The 1:100,000 scale now spans 5km grid lines, making it much more usable. Plus, the overall dimensions of the tool have been reduced so that it is the size of a music CD, easially fitting into a pocket or any slot where you could store a CD. The inner protractor is marked in degrees and the outer protractor is in mils.", "text": "Improved Military UTM/MGRS Reader & Protractor \"Super GTA\" This tool is an improved version of the Graphic Training Aid 5-2-12 Coordinate Scale and Protractor used by United States and NATO military forces around the world. By using a slot on one side of the tool for access to the map, the tool can be more compact than the traditional GTA tool. The tool features several additional map scales, including 1:24,000, which is the most common topographic map scale found within the United States. The 1:100,000 scale now spans 5km grid lines, making it much more usable. Plus, the overall dimensions of the tool have been reduced so that it is the size of a music CD, easially fitting into a pocket or any slot where you could store a CD. The inner protractor is marked in degrees and the outer protractor is in mils.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61tnBAdkw6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NAOERO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MapTools", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Topographic Maps"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B003NBFKDK", "title": "Highland 1042000 Hitch Mounted Cargo Carrier", "description": "The Highland hitch mounted cargo carrier is made from heavy duty powder coated steel construction. The carrier will fit any 2 inch receiver style hitch and has a capacity of up to 500 pounds. The 60 inch x 20 inch x 2-1/2 inch platform adds additional and convenient capacity for your gear.", "text": "Highland 1042000 Hitch Mounted Cargo Carrier The Highland hitch mounted cargo carrier is made from heavy duty powder coated steel construction. The carrier will fit any 2 inch receiver style hitch and has a capacity of up to 500 pounds. The 60 inch x 20 inch x 2-1/2 inch platform adds additional and convenient capacity for your gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5148F9j%2BCBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NBFKDK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Highland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 78.58}}
