{"item_id": "B003NFI092", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount", "description": "Brand New. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Brand. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings. Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail BAse-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. Battery Included", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount Brand New. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Brand. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings. Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail BAse-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. Battery Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KZczarcrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NFI092.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B003NG9QCG", "title": "Ambient Weather HP816A Handheld Wind Meter with Temperature", "description": "Wind SpeedMax & Average Wind Speed Since Power OnBeaufort Scale Bar Graph (0-12)Temp (°F or °C)Backlight with Auto OffBattery Saving Auto OffNeck Band Included for Easy CarryingDisplays current wind speedDisplays Maximum and Average wind speeds since last power-onUser can select Knots, meters/sec, miles/hour or km/hourBar graph displays Beaufort scale (0-12)Displays current temperatureUser can select F or CBacklit Display with auto-off featureBattery saving auto-off (entire unit)Includes lanyard for ease of carryingBattery: 1 - CR2032 watch type battery (included)Dimensions: 4.4\" x 1.57\" x 0.59\"Specifications:Windspeed:0-65 mph0.2 mph resolution±5% accuracyUpdate Rate: 0.5 secondsTemperature:14 to 113 degFResolution: 0.4 degF±3.6 degF accuracy", "text": "Ambient Weather HP816A Handheld Wind Meter with Temperature Wind SpeedMax & Average Wind Speed Since Power OnBeaufort Scale Bar Graph (0-12)Temp (°F or °C)Backlight with Auto OffBattery Saving Auto OffNeck Band Included for Easy CarryingDisplays current wind speedDisplays Maximum and Average wind speeds since last power-onUser can select Knots, meters/sec, miles/hour or km/hourBar graph displays Beaufort scale (0-12)Displays current temperatureUser can select F or CBacklit Display with auto-off featureBattery saving auto-off (entire unit)Includes lanyard for ease of carryingBattery: 1 - CR2032 watch type battery (included)Dimensions: 4.4\" x 1.57\" x 0.59\"Specifications:Windspeed:0-65 mph0.2 mph resolution±5% accuracyUpdate Rate: 0.5 secondsTemperature:14 to 113 degFResolution: 0.4 degF±3.6 degF accuracy", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-LZDd0d%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NG9QCG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003NGRL46", "title": "Primos Up Roar Deer Call", "description": "The Up ROAR truly is a \"Triple Threat\". It combines 3 of the most effective calls to bring deer in close. It has 2 chambers, an Aggressive Grunt and an Estrus Bleat, topped off with a Wheeze tube to challenge bucks to a fight. The Grunt chamber reproduces a deep, resonating aggressive grunt that is made by bucks during the rut. The Bleat chamber reproduces a loud Estrus Bleat made by receptive does. When using these calls in combination you can sound like a buck chasing a hot doe. This will make other bucks jealous and come running to see what's causing the Up ROAR.", "text": "Primos Up Roar Deer Call The Up ROAR truly is a \"Triple Threat\". It combines 3 of the most effective calls to bring deer in close. It has 2 chambers, an Aggressive Grunt and an Estrus Bleat, topped off with a Wheeze tube to challenge bucks to a fight. The Grunt chamber reproduces a deep, resonating aggressive grunt that is made by bucks during the rut. The Bleat chamber reproduces a loud Estrus Bleat made by receptive does. When using these calls in combination you can sound like a buck chasing a hot doe. This will make other bucks jealous and come running to see what's causing the Up ROAR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31id0qxxI1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NGRL46.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 20.45}}
{"item_id": "B003NHCLMM", "title": "Mesa Tactical Sureshell Shotshell Carrier For Remington 870/1100/11-87", "description": "MESA 6-Shell SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged, reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Rem 870 12Ga 90210. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Mesa Tactical Sureshell Shotshell Carrier For Remington 870/1100/11-87 MESA 6-Shell SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged, reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Rem 870 12Ga 90210. Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order for any of our items. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wZVfy3DTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NHCLMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mesa Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 64.99}}
