{"item_id": "B003NU7CNC", "title": "Amphipod AirFlow Lite Waistpack", "description": "AMPHIPOD® AIRFLOW LITE™ :: An ultra-lightweight waistpack that stores everything you need on your run, the Amphipod® AirFlow Lite™ is designed to circulate air between your back and the pack to keep you cool and dry. Features quick access outer side pockets and inner storage capacity with the same ventilated AirFlow mesh on the front as on back. Comfortable bounce-free design.", "text": "Amphipod AirFlow Lite Waistpack AMPHIPOD® AIRFLOW LITE™ :: An ultra-lightweight waistpack that stores everything you need on your run, the Amphipod® AirFlow Lite™ is designed to circulate air between your back and the pack to keep you cool and dry. Features quick access outer side pockets and inner storage capacity with the same ventilated AirFlow mesh on the front as on back. Comfortable bounce-free design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41er-hZ2-WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NU7CNC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]]}}
