{"item_id": "B003NZ9W9E", "title": "TMS AR15 M4 Flat Top Offset One Piece Scope Mount for 1913 Picatinny Rails", "description": "A heavy duty offset ring mount to install magnified optics scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticles.Ring Size: 30mm (1inch metal size inserts included)Centerline Height - 40mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Hard anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two hex nuts with coin slotsHeight from top of rail to bottom of cradle: 1\"Overall height 2.50\"Overall length 5.30\"Inner space between the rings 64mm (2.52inch)Ring width: 16mm(0.63inch)Recoil lug: 2 cross-slot screw shaftsIncludes one extra ring top with accessory railMount weight: 8oz.", "text": "TMS AR15 M4 Flat Top Offset One Piece Scope Mount for 1913 Picatinny Rails A heavy duty offset ring mount to install magnified optics scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticles.Ring Size: 30mm (1inch metal size inserts included)Centerline Height - 40mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Hard anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two hex nuts with coin slotsHeight from top of rail to bottom of cradle: 1\"Overall height 2.50\"Overall length 5.30\"Inner space between the rings 64mm (2.52inch)Ring width: 16mm(0.63inch)Recoil lug: 2 cross-slot screw shaftsIncludes one extra ring top with accessory railMount weight: 8oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iF9JfuiLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003NZ9W9E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003O1OHY2", "title": "Champion LE B27FSA 24x45-Inch Green Silhouette Target (Pack of 100)", "description": "Whether it’s qualification for law enforcement officers or personal home defense practice, these new police silhouette targets bring tactical precision to your shooting. Available in either standard paper or with cardboard backing, these new targets feature a high contrast green silhouette, scoring area and LE approved scoring rings. Repair centers are also available to maximize the life of the target.", "text": "Champion LE B27FSA 24x45-Inch Green Silhouette Target (Pack of 100) Whether it’s qualification for law enforcement officers or personal home defense practice, these new police silhouette targets bring tactical precision to your shooting. Available in either standard paper or with cardboard backing, these new targets feature a high contrast green silhouette, scoring area and LE approved scoring rings. Repair centers are also available to maximize the life of the target.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vYV4EYCyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O1OHY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 49.39}}
