{"item_id": "B003O1XK5E", "title": "Wiley X Airrage Sunglasses, Smoke Grey, Matte Black", "description": "Featuring a removable (easily snaps in and out) Facial Cavity Seal gasket, these sunglasses completely seal out peripheral light, dust and pollen for long-lasting comfort and protection in high speeds or wind and other outside hazards. ANSI Z87.1-2003-certified for exceptional optical quality and shatterproof resistance. Each pair includes a \"T-Peg\" adjustable elastic strap, leash cord, cleaning cloth and zippered nylon case.", "text": "Wiley X Airrage Sunglasses, Smoke Grey, Matte Black Featuring a removable (easily snaps in and out) Facial Cavity Seal gasket, these sunglasses completely seal out peripheral light, dust and pollen for long-lasting comfort and protection in high speeds or wind and other outside hazards. ANSI Z87.1-2003-certified for exceptional optical quality and shatterproof resistance. Each pair includes a \"T-Peg\" adjustable elastic strap, leash cord, cleaning cloth and zippered nylon case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310Lu9JsGgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O1XK5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wiley X", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 63.25}}
{"item_id": "B003O20UOW", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Auto Charge", "description": "The Hornady Lock-N-Load Auto Charge engineered for fast, high-precision, powder measures with accuracy to within 0.1 grains, with a scale capacity of 1000 grains. Designed for ease of use, the Auto Charge is equipped with an easy-to-use keypad coupled with a large, easy-to-read backlit display. The Auto Charge offers automatic and manual dispense options, as well as trickle function, three speed settings, and overcharge protection. This highly sensitive instrument is backed by a one year warranty from Hornady.Features and Specifications:Precise to within 0.1 grainsScale capacity of 1000 grainsEasy-to-operate keypadLarge backlit displayAutomatic and manual dispense optionsTrickle functionThree speed settingsOvercharge protectionEasy clean outOne year warranty**This a highly sensitive instrument, which must be repaired and serviced by a factory qualified technician to maintain the warranty.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Auto Charge The Hornady Lock-N-Load Auto Charge engineered for fast, high-precision, powder measures with accuracy to within 0.1 grains, with a scale capacity of 1000 grains. Designed for ease of use, the Auto Charge is equipped with an easy-to-use keypad coupled with a large, easy-to-read backlit display. The Auto Charge offers automatic and manual dispense options, as well as trickle function, three speed settings, and overcharge protection. This highly sensitive instrument is backed by a one year warranty from Hornady.Features and Specifications:Precise to within 0.1 grainsScale capacity of 1000 grainsEasy-to-operate keypadLarge backlit displayAutomatic and manual dispense optionsTrickle functionThree speed settingsOvercharge protectionEasy clean outOne year warranty**This a highly sensitive instrument, which must be repaired and serviced by a factory qualified technician to maintain the warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rvg3o580L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O20UOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 201.48}}
{"item_id": "B003O2C9HI", "title": "Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand", "description": "Hunt in COMFORT where the squirrels live. Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand is the one. PRICED LESS! Set your sights on this awesome Tree Stand! It's Guide Gear brand, built to our specs for easy use, quick setup and superior comfort, guaranteed. 300-lb. weight capacity. Just what you need for a safe, successful hunt, season after season. No middleman means BIG BUCKS OFF! Goodies: 17 x 10\" flip-up, suspension-style seat is 21\"h. in padded camo; Comfortable backrest for serious support; Padded armrests; 24 x 29 1/2\" thick mesh platform with cable supports; All-welded seams, steel construction; Green powder-coated surface resists corrosion; 2 ratchet straps make it secure and tree-friendly; Includes FAS safety harness. Shoot your order in today! Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand", "text": "Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand Hunt in COMFORT where the squirrels live. Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand is the one. PRICED LESS! Set your sights on this awesome Tree Stand! It's Guide Gear brand, built to our specs for easy use, quick setup and superior comfort, guaranteed. 300-lb. weight capacity. Just what you need for a safe, successful hunt, season after season. No middleman means BIG BUCKS OFF! Goodies: 17 x 10\" flip-up, suspension-style seat is 21\"h. in padded camo; Comfortable backrest for serious support; Padded armrests; 24 x 29 1/2\" thick mesh platform with cable supports; All-welded seams, steel construction; Green powder-coated surface resists corrosion; 2 ratchet straps make it secure and tree-friendly; Includes FAS safety harness. Shoot your order in today! Guide Gear Deluxe Fixed Tree Stand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VlWI5wa7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O2C9HI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stands"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B003O2HYQ4", "title": "Ocean Kayak Comfort Plus Seat Back", "description": "Outfit your sit-on-top kayak with the Ocean Kayak Comfort Plus Seat Back and make long tours feel like a short trip around the pond. Four-way adjustable nylon straps allow you to change the lean and side wrapping supports, while a molded backrest keeps your posture comfortably upright. Reinforced stays, solid brass clips, and stainless steel springs help the Comfort Plus keep it's shape after seasons of long paddles. After dark reflective logo patches illuminate when shone upon so your paddle craft is visible to larger vessels.", "text": "Ocean Kayak Comfort Plus Seat Back Outfit your sit-on-top kayak with the Ocean Kayak Comfort Plus Seat Back and make long tours feel like a short trip around the pond. Four-way adjustable nylon straps allow you to change the lean and side wrapping supports, while a molded backrest keeps your posture comfortably upright. Reinforced stays, solid brass clips, and stainless steel springs help the Comfort Plus keep it's shape after seasons of long paddles. After dark reflective logo patches illuminate when shone upon so your paddle craft is visible to larger vessels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J%2BgamLRQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O2HYQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ocean Kayak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Canoeing", "Canoe Seats & Thwarts"]], "price": 40.0}}
{"item_id": "B003O3R7HE", "title": "Holster for CZ75 & CZ85", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for CZ75 & CZ85 This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41map7%2BoaIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O3R7HE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B003O4PSME", "title": "Bike Cable - Jagwire - Hyper Brake DIY Cable Kit", "description": "The Hyper series cable kits are an upgrade over OEM housings and are compatible with SRAM(R) and Shimano(R) road and mountain systems. These versatile cable kits are packed with value and the L3 lined housings will deliver miles of smooth performance. Tech: Brake. Housing: 5mm CGX low-compression brake housing w/ L3 liner. Housing Length: 3000mm Cables: Slick stainless, double-ended road & mountain. Cable Length: Front - 1350mm, Rear - 2350mm. Small Parts: 6 open alloy ferrules, 3 donuts, 2 cable crimps, 2 Tube Tops.", "text": "Bike Cable - Jagwire - Hyper Brake DIY Cable Kit The Hyper series cable kits are an upgrade over OEM housings and are compatible with SRAM(R) and Shimano(R) road and mountain systems. These versatile cable kits are packed with value and the L3 lined housings will deliver miles of smooth performance. Tech: Brake. Housing: 5mm CGX low-compression brake housing w/ L3 liner. Housing Length: 3000mm Cables: Slick stainless, double-ended road & mountain. Cable Length: Front - 1350mm, Rear - 2350mm. Small Parts: 6 open alloy ferrules, 3 donuts, 2 cable crimps, 2 Tube Tops.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YSPkqkJqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O4PSME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jagwire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Bike Brake Cables & Housing"]], "price": 15.84}}
{"item_id": "B003O5QQW4", "title": "Schiek SSI-1112WSB 12 Heavy Duty Wrist Wrap Black", "description": "Model 1112 Wrist Wraps are 12 inch in length for added wrist support. The wraps are made with 3 wide heavyweight cotton elastic and have an extra wide hook and loop closure. Made in the USA.", "text": "Schiek SSI-1112WSB 12 Heavy Duty Wrist Wrap Black Model 1112 Wrist Wraps are 12 inch in length for added wrist support. The wraps are made with 3 wide heavyweight cotton elastic and have an extra wide hook and loop closure. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fDCjh19LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003O5QQW4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schiek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 17.95}}
