{"item_id": "B003OBFECG", "title": "Scientific Anglers Vest Pack Assortment", "description": "Instead of piecing together your small fly-fishing essentials one by one, the Scientific Anglers Vest Pack Assortment bundles it for you in one convenient pack. The Vest includes a retractor that stretches to 15-inches and has a pin-back attachment and a nipper with hardened steel construction for lasting value. The nippers also include an eyeopener feature to quickly clear hook eyes and a hardened edge that stays sharper for reliable cutting. Scientific Anglers also gave the Vest forceps with three locking positions and serrated jaws that grasp securely and hold on. In addition, a leader straightener straightens leaders to eliminate coils, and that works well on both wet and dry leaders. Overall, this nifty pack encases the small fly fishing tool essentials you'll need to land your beauty of a trout.", "text": "Scientific Anglers Vest Pack Assortment Instead of piecing together your small fly-fishing essentials one by one, the Scientific Anglers Vest Pack Assortment bundles it for you in one convenient pack. The Vest includes a retractor that stretches to 15-inches and has a pin-back attachment and a nipper with hardened steel construction for lasting value. The nippers also include an eyeopener feature to quickly clear hook eyes and a hardened edge that stays sharper for reliable cutting. Scientific Anglers also gave the Vest forceps with three locking positions and serrated jaws that grasp securely and hold on. In addition, a leader straightener straightens leaders to eliminate coils, and that works well on both wet and dry leaders. Overall, this nifty pack encases the small fly fishing tool essentials you'll need to land your beauty of a trout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V4FR59ePL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003OBFECG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scientific Anglers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Fly Tying Tools & Materials"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B003OBGEPW", "title": "NcStar Mark III Tactical Scope Adapter/Weaver Base/34mm (MRD34)", "description": "This single Weaver-style scope adapter allows you to mount single accessories, such as a red dot sight, laser, or flashlight, to your Mark III tactical scope. Made of high-quality anodized aluminum, the 34mm adapter measures 1.8 inches long and weighs 0.7 ounces.", "text": "NcStar Mark III Tactical Scope Adapter/Weaver Base/34mm (MRD34) This single Weaver-style scope adapter allows you to mount single accessories, such as a red dot sight, laser, or flashlight, to your Mark III tactical scope. Made of high-quality anodized aluminum, the 34mm adapter measures 1.8 inches long and weighs 0.7 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4104DXNR5bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003OBGEPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 9.99}}
