{"item_id": "B003OJJ8UC", "title": "Plano AW Bow Case Bone Collector Series", "description": "This case has thicker walls than any other bow case in our lineup and we have added stronger dual stage latches (two are lockable) that greatly improve the security. Combined with our patented PillarLock System it makes for a very stron and secure case. Ergonomic comfort handle, weather resistant seal, customizable foam interiors and integrated arrow storage, all adds up to the best protection possible for your bow. This case also includes the corrosion protection of Inhibitor chips and a Bone Collector Logo", "text": "Plano AW Bow Case Bone Collector Series This case has thicker walls than any other bow case in our lineup and we have added stronger dual stage latches (two are lockable) that greatly improve the security. Combined with our patented PillarLock System it makes for a very stron and secure case. Ergonomic comfort handle, weather resistant seal, customizable foam interiors and integrated arrow storage, all adds up to the best protection possible for your bow. This case also includes the corrosion protection of Inhibitor chips and a Bone Collector Logo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ge6J66IFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003OJJ8UC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 119.87}}
