{"item_id": "B003P10TAC", "title": "Shimano PD-5700 105 Road Bike Pedals, Silver", "description": "Shimano's recessed cleat and clipless pedal technology, called SPD, revolutionized the cycling shoe/pedal interface. Since then, decades of legendary \"in the dirt\" dependability, reliability, and sheer endurance have made SPD the world's go-to pedal technology. Shimano's PD-5700 road pedals continue the SPD tradition, with proven designs that work in real-world conditions. The pedals offer such details as an extra-wide stainless-steel platform that efficiently transfers power from foot to pedal, a low-maintenance sealed cartridge axle unit, a large binding target for quick engagement, and adjustable cleat tension with indicators. The sealed bearings and chromoly axle help these pedals stand up to the rigors of competitive riding.About ShimanoIn 1961, a three-speed bicycle hub was displayed at the New York Toy Show. The hub--an affordable and reliable version of the multi-speed hubs growing in popularity at the time--caught the attention of the industry. So much so that by 1965, Yoshizo Shimano--the youngest son of the company founder in Japan--opened an office in New York. Shimano's goal was to get quicker product feedback and to provide technical and warranty assistance to retailers selling bikes equipped with Shimano parts. Though Shimano American has grown from that first modest office staffed by only three people to a full distribution center with sales and marketing offices, its goals are the same: listen to customers and meet their needs for both bicycle and fishing products.", "text": "Shimano PD-5700 105 Road Bike Pedals, Silver Shimano's recessed cleat and clipless pedal technology, called SPD, revolutionized the cycling shoe/pedal interface. Since then, decades of legendary \"in the dirt\" dependability, reliability, and sheer endurance have made SPD the world's go-to pedal technology. Shimano's PD-5700 road pedals continue the SPD tradition, with proven designs that work in real-world conditions. The pedals offer such details as an extra-wide stainless-steel platform that efficiently transfers power from foot to pedal, a low-maintenance sealed cartridge axle unit, a large binding target for quick engagement, and adjustable cleat tension with indicators. The sealed bearings and chromoly axle help these pedals stand up to the rigors of competitive riding.About ShimanoIn 1961, a three-speed bicycle hub was displayed at the New York Toy Show. The hub--an affordable and reliable version of the multi-speed hubs growing in popularity at the time--caught the attention of the industry. So much so that by 1965, Yoshizo Shimano--the youngest son of the company founder in Japan--opened an office in New York. Shimano's goal was to get quicker product feedback and to provide technical and warranty assistance to retailers selling bikes equipped with Shimano parts. Though Shimano American has grown from that first modest office staffed by only three people to a full distribution center with sales and marketing offices, its goals are the same: listen to customers and meet their needs for both bicycle and fishing products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PIUoRX2nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P10TAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B003P1VWGW", "title": "White Sierra Men's Insulated Snow Pant", "description": "The Insulated Pants features waterproof/breathable fabric to keep you dry on the slopes. Articulated knees increase comfort and range of motion. Front and rear pockets, give you a ton of room to stash all your essentials.", "text": "White Sierra Men's Insulated Snow Pant The Insulated Pants features waterproof/breathable fabric to keep you dry on the slopes. Articulated knees increase comfort and range of motion. Front and rear pockets, give you a ton of room to stash all your essentials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317R7z8Ob4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P1VWGW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003P3WAFM", "title": "French Aluminum Canteen", "description": "Those big plastic water bottles are bound to break, but this rugged military issue Swiss canteen would hold water during a nuclear explosion. A solid aluminum canteen is stored inside an OD canvas belt sheath and offers a screw on cap on a chain so you won't lose it.", "text": "French Aluminum Canteen Those big plastic water bottles are bound to break, but this rugged military issue Swiss canteen would hold water during a nuclear explosion. A solid aluminum canteen is stored inside an OD canvas belt sheath and offers a screw on cap on a chain so you won't lose it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R%2BoyrbTDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P3WAFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sturm European Military Surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B003P41TVW", "title": "German 4 Piece Stainless Steel Eating Utensil", "description": "Military surplus makes expensive items inexpensive for you. This used German 4-pc. Utensil set makes eating at the campsite a lot easier. A knife, fork, spoon and can opener all snap together in a convenient unit that easily comes apart for dining.", "text": "German 4 Piece Stainless Steel Eating Utensil Military surplus makes expensive items inexpensive for you. This used German 4-pc. Utensil set makes eating at the campsite a lot easier. A knife, fork, spoon and can opener all snap together in a convenient unit that easily comes apart for dining.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419oTpqQ8%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P41TVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B003P43Q5Y", "title": "BudK Swiss 20 Liter Black Water Bag", "description": "Features: 20-liter, potable water bag. Handles on both ends so you can fold it to carry it. Twist spout for easy pouring when it's hung by a handle. Great for camping and wilderness trips.", "text": "BudK Swiss 20 Liter Black Water Bag Features: 20-liter, potable water bag. Handles on both ends so you can fold it to carry it. Twist spout for easy pouring when it's hung by a handle. Great for camping and wilderness trips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AbUiiYQYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P43Q5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B003P5H3N4", "title": "Hunter Safety System Lineman's Style Climbing Strap", "description": "Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Accessories are designed to provide hunters with all of the tools necessary to remain quiet, comfortable and SAFE!", "text": "Hunter Safety System Lineman's Style Climbing Strap Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Accessories are designed to provide hunters with all of the tools necessary to remain quiet, comfortable and SAFE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51l3MqsQwUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P5H3N4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter Safety System", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003P8QLBG", "title": "Outdoor Research Men's PL 400 Gloves", "description": "Toasty warm in the bitter cold, these double-layer fleece glove liners are an ideal companion for long days in the backcountry. MotionWrap and MirrorSeam construction provide a technical yet comfortable fit, and the silicone grip palm prevents slippage when being used within outer shell gloves or mitts.Designed by AdventureOutdoor Research PL 400 GlovesOutdoor Research Apparel and GearOutdoor Research designs and builds the most bombproof climbing, skiing and mountaineering apparel and gear in the world. And because of that, alpine climbers and ski mountaineers have relied on our gear to keep them shielded from the elements since the introduction of the X-Gaiter in 1981. We’ve elevated our designs, offering apparel and gear that’s purpose-built for higher elevations and variable climates while still retaining that laser focus on defense against brutal conditions and bone-chilling temperatures. By gathering product feedback from an amazingly talented – and opinionated – team of ambassadors, and by integrating the lessons we’ve learned from the customers in our Lab Rat gear test program, we’re proud to make some of the most breathable, comfortable, protective and functional outdoor apparel and gear and in the world. And on top of that, we think it looks pretty damn good.FeaturesMirrorSeam double-layer fleece construction // 300-weight smooth fleece exterior // 100-weight fleece interior // Hidden seams // MotionWrap construction for minimal seams // Silicone prints provide grip, abrasion resistance // Contoured wrist construction // Secure, snug fitFabric- 95% polyester, 5% spandex shell fabric // 100% polyester liner fabricOutdoor Research. Designed by Adventure.Outdoor Research is Designed by Adventure. We provide Innovation and Inspiration for the Relentless Adventurer. We develop innovative, functional, bomb-proof products that are beautiful in their efficiency and their simplicity. We are inclusive, inviting anyone who shares our passion for the outdoors to join our community. We’re one of the last of a dying breed -- an independently owned outdoor gear and apparel company -- letting us strive to provide the best value to our customers, not shareholders. We are committed to our core sports -- Alpinism, Ice Climbing, Hiking, Paddling, Trail Running, and Backcountry and Sidecountry skiing -- and our products are developed and constructed to excel within them. Like you, we are a member of the outdoor community; We listen to, value and empower each other and our fellow adventurers, and we support the outstanding conservation, access and educational efforts of a variety of admirable nonprofit outdoor organizations. We’re growing, both as a company and as individual people. And we’re having a lot of fun along the way.", "text": "Outdoor Research Men's PL 400 Gloves Toasty warm in the bitter cold, these double-layer fleece glove liners are an ideal companion for long days in the backcountry. MotionWrap and MirrorSeam construction provide a technical yet comfortable fit, and the silicone grip palm prevents slippage when being used within outer shell gloves or mitts.Designed by AdventureOutdoor Research PL 400 GlovesOutdoor Research Apparel and GearOutdoor Research designs and builds the most bombproof climbing, skiing and mountaineering apparel and gear in the world. And because of that, alpine climbers and ski mountaineers have relied on our gear to keep them shielded from the elements since the introduction of the X-Gaiter in 1981. We’ve elevated our designs, offering apparel and gear that’s purpose-built for higher elevations and variable climates while still retaining that laser focus on defense against brutal conditions and bone-chilling temperatures. By gathering product feedback from an amazingly talented – and opinionated – team of ambassadors, and by integrating the lessons we’ve learned from the customers in our Lab Rat gear test program, we’re proud to make some of the most breathable, comfortable, protective and functional outdoor apparel and gear and in the world. And on top of that, we think it looks pretty damn good.FeaturesMirrorSeam double-layer fleece construction // 300-weight smooth fleece exterior // 100-weight fleece interior // Hidden seams // MotionWrap construction for minimal seams // Silicone prints provide grip, abrasion resistance // Contoured wrist construction // Secure, snug fitFabric- 95% polyester, 5% spandex shell fabric // 100% polyester liner fabricOutdoor Research. Designed by Adventure.Outdoor Research is Designed by Adventure. We provide Innovation and Inspiration for the Relentless Adventurer. We develop innovative, functional, bomb-proof products that are beautiful in their efficiency and their simplicity. We are inclusive, inviting anyone who shares our passion for the outdoors to join our community. We’re one of the last of a dying breed -- an independently owned outdoor gear and apparel company -- letting us strive to provide the best value to our customers, not shareholders. We are committed to our core sports -- Alpinism, Ice Climbing, Hiking, Paddling, Trail Running, and Backcountry and Sidecountry skiing -- and our products are developed and constructed to excel within them. Like you, we are a member of the outdoor community; We listen to, value and empower each other and our fellow adventurers, and we support the outstanding conservation, access and educational efforts of a variety of admirable nonprofit outdoor organizations. We’re growing, both as a company and as individual people. And we’re having a lot of fun along the way.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fpPKks6HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P8QLBG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003P8QLTS", "title": "Outdoor Research Men's PL 100 Gloves", "description": "Smooth, stretch nylon gives these liners a snug, stretchy fit that conforms to the hand without being restrictive. A polyester fleece interior retains warmth on frost-cloaked winter days. Wear them as a base layer or as a lightweight glove liner.", "text": "Outdoor Research Men's PL 100 Gloves Smooth, stretch nylon gives these liners a snug, stretchy fit that conforms to the hand without being restrictive. A polyester fleece interior retains warmth on frost-cloaked winter days. Wear them as a base layer or as a lightweight glove liner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J1R5rXxSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P8QLTS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]], "price": 22.3}}
{"item_id": "B003P8QM92", "title": "Outdoor Research Windwarrior Hat", "description": "For high altitude mountaineering and ski touring in extreme environments, the Wind Warrior Hat offers the toughest protection. Made of WINDSTOPPER Technical Fleece with a full fleece lining for additional warmth, the Wind Warrior protects against harsh winter weather. Integrated Polartec Wind Pro ear panels improve hearing, ensuring you'll always know straight away when your climbing partner is yelling, \"TAKE.\".", "text": "Outdoor Research Windwarrior Hat For high altitude mountaineering and ski touring in extreme environments, the Wind Warrior Hat offers the toughest protection. Made of WINDSTOPPER Technical Fleece with a full fleece lining for additional warmth, the Wind Warrior protects against harsh winter weather. Integrated Polartec Wind Pro ear panels improve hearing, ensuring you'll always know straight away when your climbing partner is yelling, \"TAKE.\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q%2B7LOKcxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P8QM92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Cold Weather Hats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003P90K58", "title": "Tone Fitness Hourglass Shaped Dumbbells", "description": "Tone Fitness hourglass shaped dumbbells are the perfect addition to any strength training routine. You can improve your appearance, strength, muscle to fat ratio, bone density and even your walking performance by adding strength training workout routine. The dumbbells are \"hourglass\" shaped for a stylish look. The neoprene coating helps protect your floors, provides an easy grip and is sweat resistant.", "text": "Tone Fitness Hourglass Shaped Dumbbells Tone Fitness hourglass shaped dumbbells are the perfect addition to any strength training routine. You can improve your appearance, strength, muscle to fat ratio, bone density and even your walking performance by adding strength training workout routine. The dumbbells are \"hourglass\" shaped for a stylish look. The neoprene coating helps protect your floors, provides an easy grip and is sweat resistant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZZxVoV36L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P90K58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 37.98}}
{"item_id": "B003P90KK8", "title": "Tone Fitness Cement Filled Kettlebell Set - 30 lbs.", "description": "Kettlebells were originally designed for Russian Red Army soldiers and world-class athletes Sculpt and tone all the muscles you use for balance and leverage Steadily progress the intensity of your workouts by increasing weight amount Increase your agility, build strength, develop your balance, and improve your endurance About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Set Includes: 5, 10 and 15 lb. Kettlebell. Vinyl coating protects floors. Alternative to cast iron kettlebell. Hand reinforced for durability. No assembly required.", "text": "Tone Fitness Cement Filled Kettlebell Set - 30 lbs. Kettlebells were originally designed for Russian Red Army soldiers and world-class athletes Sculpt and tone all the muscles you use for balance and leverage Steadily progress the intensity of your workouts by increasing weight amount Increase your agility, build strength, develop your balance, and improve your endurance About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Set Includes: 5, 10 and 15 lb. Kettlebell. Vinyl coating protects floors. Alternative to cast iron kettlebell. Hand reinforced for durability. No assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jThY5zXoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P90KK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]], "price": 45.98}}
{"item_id": "B003P90KMG", "title": "Tone Fitness Stability Ball, 55cm", "description": "The Tone Fitness anti-burst stability ball is an easy-to-use, highly effective accessory for core conditioning. This exercise ball is also good for balance training and spinal stabilization, as well as weight training and physical therapy. Balls can be used in Yoga, Pilates and fusion exercise programs to strengthen and firm abs, back and butt. Comfortable, convenient and durable for effective total body workouts. Features a durable, burst-resistant shell. Deflates slowly if punctured. Ideal for home or gym use.", "text": "Tone Fitness Stability Ball, 55cm The Tone Fitness anti-burst stability ball is an easy-to-use, highly effective accessory for core conditioning. This exercise ball is also good for balance training and spinal stabilization, as well as weight training and physical therapy. Balls can be used in Yoga, Pilates and fusion exercise programs to strengthen and firm abs, back and butt. Comfortable, convenient and durable for effective total body workouts. Features a durable, burst-resistant shell. Deflates slowly if punctured. Ideal for home or gym use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fVPN7E6tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P90KMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 19.28}}
{"item_id": "B003P90KS0", "title": "Tone Fitness Stability Ball", "description": "Make your workouts fun with the Tone Fitness Stability Ball. This easy-to-use workout accessory is ideal for physical therapy and weight training at home. You can also use it for core conditioning, spinal stabilization and balance training. With applications in yoga as well as fusion exercises, this ball suits various workout styles. Moreover, you can use this ball to help strengthen your back, abs and buttocks. The durable shell of this ball doesn’t burst on the spot but releases air slowly when it gets punctured. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Effective for balance training and spinal stabilization. Features a durable, burst-resistant shell. Available in variety of sizes. Can be used in yoga, pilates, and fusion exercise programs. Perfect for weight training and physical therapy.", "text": "Tone Fitness Stability Ball Make your workouts fun with the Tone Fitness Stability Ball. This easy-to-use workout accessory is ideal for physical therapy and weight training at home. You can also use it for core conditioning, spinal stabilization and balance training. With applications in yoga as well as fusion exercises, this ball suits various workout styles. Moreover, you can use this ball to help strengthen your back, abs and buttocks. The durable shell of this ball doesn’t burst on the spot but releases air slowly when it gets punctured. About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. Effective for balance training and spinal stabilization. Features a durable, burst-resistant shell. Available in variety of sizes. Can be used in yoga, pilates, and fusion exercise programs. Perfect for weight training and physical therapy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QhibJ438L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P90KS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]], "price": 11.17}}
{"item_id": "B003P90LQG", "title": "Tone Fitness Abs Toning Wheel", "description": "The Tone Fitness abdominal toning wheel is an easy to use piece of exercise equipment that can help strengthen core and tighten abdominal muscles. At the gym or in your own home, you can use the wheel to help work out your lower and upper back, hips, chest, arms, butt and legs. These wheels are portable and easy to store just about anywhere. Non-slip wheels provide stability and the contoured grip handles allow for a smooth and comfortable workout.", "text": "Tone Fitness Abs Toning Wheel The Tone Fitness abdominal toning wheel is an easy to use piece of exercise equipment that can help strengthen core and tighten abdominal muscles. At the gym or in your own home, you can use the wheel to help work out your lower and upper back, hips, chest, arms, butt and legs. These wheels are portable and easy to store just about anywhere. Non-slip wheels provide stability and the contoured grip handles allow for a smooth and comfortable workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w3bouSTOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003P90LQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B003PAJKYE", "title": "BSA Adjustable Objective Air Rifle Scope, 3-9 X 40", "description": "BSA Essential Air Rifle Scopes are built to handle the unique reverse recoil of today's magnum spring powered air rifles. They are all equipped with parallax that is adjustable down to 10 yards or less. All AR models have target-style turrets with finger adjustable 1/4 MOA clicks for windage and elevation.", "text": "BSA Adjustable Objective Air Rifle Scope, 3-9 X 40 BSA Essential Air Rifle Scopes are built to handle the unique reverse recoil of today's magnum spring powered air rifles. They are all equipped with parallax that is adjustable down to 10 yards or less. All AR models have target-style turrets with finger adjustable 1/4 MOA clicks for windage and elevation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21wsGQ8NI9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PAJKYE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.15}}
