{"item_id": "B003PBHLKS", "title": "Smith World Cup Goggle (Clear, Black)", "description": "The Smith Classic World Cup goggles are aggressively priced to make it easy to get on the slopes. These helmet-compatible goggles are designed with dual lenses.", "text": "Smith World Cup Goggle (Clear, Black) The Smith Classic World Cup goggles are aggressively priced to make it easy to get on the slopes. These helmet-compatible goggles are designed with dual lenses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PtQWrKtQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PBHLKS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003PBTNBS", "title": "BONES(TM) Wheels HardCore Bushings", "description": "With BONES HardCore Bushings, you will notice a number of positive improvements in the performance of your trucks. There is no break-in period. Just put them in, adjust and skate. Your trucks will be more responsive and your skating will improve. The HardCore insert in the center of BONES bushings connects the two sides of each bushing together by bonding them to the HardCore insert. When the hanger web squeezes one side of a HardCore bushing, that side of the bushing reacts just like a normal bushing, but the chemical bond between the HardCore and the cushion keep the bushing from being squeezed out the other side. It actually increases the resistance to turning because it is held in place by the HardCore insert. This means basically that BOTH sides of the BONES HardCore Bushing are resisting your turning force. That’s why we call BONES Bushings the first double action truck bushings.", "text": "BONES(TM) Wheels HardCore Bushings With BONES HardCore Bushings, you will notice a number of positive improvements in the performance of your trucks. There is no break-in period. Just put them in, adjust and skate. Your trucks will be more responsive and your skating will improve. The HardCore insert in the center of BONES bushings connects the two sides of each bushing together by bonding them to the HardCore insert. When the hanger web squeezes one side of a HardCore bushing, that side of the bushing reacts just like a normal bushing, but the chemical bond between the HardCore and the cushion keep the bushing from being squeezed out the other side. It actually increases the resistance to turning because it is held in place by the HardCore insert. This means basically that BOTH sides of the BONES HardCore Bushing are resisting your turning force. That’s why we call BONES Bushings the first double action truck bushings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412OlTgRQUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PBTNBS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Skateboard Parts", "Bushings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003PCQK72", "title": "Weaver Offset Rail Adaptor", "description": "Quickly go from a primary, magnified optic to red dot action—without head shift—with the new Offset Rail Adaptor. This mount attaches to any Picatinny spec rail and allows shooters to attach a miniature red dot in the offset position. This mount can also be used for lights or other accessories that typically attach to a Picatinny spec rail. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "text": "Weaver Offset Rail Adaptor Quickly go from a primary, magnified optic to red dot action—without head shift—with the new Offset Rail Adaptor. This mount attaches to any Picatinny spec rail and allows shooters to attach a miniature red dot in the offset position. This mount can also be used for lights or other accessories that typically attach to a Picatinny spec rail. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t%2ByN1LyqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PCQK72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 23.63}}
{"item_id": "B003PMEF1U", "title": "Forgan 60-Inch Double Canopy (3 Pack of New Golf Umbrellas)", "description": "New from Forgan of St. Andrews Golf, this 3 pack of high quality golf umbrellas is incredible value! Featuring a double canopy design and an extra strong metal shaft and durable fibreglass/nylon frame, these offer the latest in wind resistant weather protection. Features: Double canopy design to prevent inverting in high winds. Ergonic handle offers improved comfort and grip. 60\" frame with 4ft diamater for coverage of you and your clubs. 39\" is the length when collapsed for storage. Push button auto-quick release system. 3 Colors included, Black, Navy, Black/White. Forgan of St. Andrews logo printed on each umbrella. Nylon frame with fibreglass finish - flexible, strong and wind resilient.", "text": "Forgan 60-Inch Double Canopy (3 Pack of New Golf Umbrellas) New from Forgan of St. Andrews Golf, this 3 pack of high quality golf umbrellas is incredible value! Featuring a double canopy design and an extra strong metal shaft and durable fibreglass/nylon frame, these offer the latest in wind resistant weather protection. Features: Double canopy design to prevent inverting in high winds. Ergonic handle offers improved comfort and grip. 60\" frame with 4ft diamater for coverage of you and your clubs. 39\" is the length when collapsed for storage. Push button auto-quick release system. 3 Colors included, Black, Navy, Black/White. Forgan of St. Andrews logo printed on each umbrella. Nylon frame with fibreglass finish - flexible, strong and wind resilient.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PP1vg%2BnxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PMEF1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Forgan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]], "price": 35.0}}
