{"item_id": "B003PV9UNY", "title": "FireSteel Miniature", "description": "FireSteel MiniatureThe FireSteel Mini FireSteel a popular FireSteel ideal for ultra small survival kits where you want a reliable means of making sparks to start fires that fits a minimum of space. Don't let our Mini FireSteel fool you - it makes plenty of sparks to start a fire when you need one because it is made of the same special ferrocerium formula used by its larger FireSteel.com FireSteel relatives.This Miniature FireSteel is just 3/20 of an inch thick and 2 inches long. This FireSteel FireSteel is about as thin and short as you can go yet still give a good shower of sparks for firemaking.", "text": "FireSteel Miniature FireSteel MiniatureThe FireSteel Mini FireSteel a popular FireSteel ideal for ultra small survival kits where you want a reliable means of making sparks to start fires that fits a minimum of space. Don't let our Mini FireSteel fool you - it makes plenty of sparks to start a fire when you need one because it is made of the same special ferrocerium formula used by its larger FireSteel.com FireSteel relatives.This Miniature FireSteel is just 3/20 of an inch thick and 2 inches long. This FireSteel FireSteel is about as thin and short as you can go yet still give a good shower of sparks for firemaking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ESTwLYANL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003PV9UNY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 5.95}}
