{"item_id": "B003QNTS88", "title": "Sightmark Tactical Red Dot Rifle Scope", "description": "The Sightmark Tactical Red Dot sight is the best way to zero in on any target with lightening-quick precision.", "text": "Sightmark Tactical Red Dot Rifle Scope The Sightmark Tactical Red Dot sight is the best way to zero in on any target with lightening-quick precision.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tWMrEoxyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QNTS88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 78.99}}
{"item_id": "B003QOHSLQ", "title": "Century BOB XL with Base Unit", "description": "Work the entire upper body with the extra-large Century Body Opponent freestanding heavy bag. Unlike most heavy bags, the Body Opponent looks like an actual person, with a life-like face, shoulders, chest, and stomach. As a result, it's easier than ever to get motivated for your sparring session, with a long torso creating more striking surface for body shot training. The bag is made of high-strength plastisol filled with urethane foam, making it extremely durable over time. It's also stable, with a polyethylene base that fills with approximately 270 pounds of sand or water. Despite the weight, you can still move the bag fairly easily by flipping it to the side and rolling the round base. Equipped with multiple height settings, the Body Opponent bag is ideal for home, apartment, school, or gym use.", "text": "Century BOB XL with Base Unit Work the entire upper body with the extra-large Century Body Opponent freestanding heavy bag. Unlike most heavy bags, the Body Opponent looks like an actual person, with a life-like face, shoulders, chest, and stomach. As a result, it's easier than ever to get motivated for your sparring session, with a long torso creating more striking surface for body shot training. The bag is made of high-strength plastisol filled with urethane foam, making it extremely durable over time. It's also stable, with a polyethylene base that fills with approximately 270 pounds of sand or water. Despite the weight, you can still move the bag fairly easily by flipping it to the side and rolling the round base. Equipped with multiple height settings, the Body Opponent bag is ideal for home, apartment, school, or gym use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315PUj1jPyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QOHSLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Century", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 328.95}}
{"item_id": "B003QORHYE", "title": "ClimaLite® 3-Stripes Cuff Polo", "description": "5.1 oz., 100% polyester; Essential moisture management piqu wicks moisture away from the skin; Rib knit collar; Set-in, open-hem sleeves; Side vents; Contrast 3-Stripes piping detail on sleeves; Contrast heat-sealed adidas performance logo on back neck;", "text": "ClimaLite® 3-Stripes Cuff Polo 5.1 oz., 100% polyester; Essential moisture management piqu wicks moisture away from the skin; Rib knit collar; Set-in, open-hem sleeves; Side vents; Contrast 3-Stripes piping detail on sleeves; Contrast heat-sealed adidas performance logo on back neck;", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YfZ0cs2LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QORHYE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts", "Polo Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003QU07HC", "title": "TMS HEAVY DUTY TACTICAL HIGH SCOPE RING SET 30MM 1\" PICATINNY WITH ACCESSORY RAIL TOPS", "description": "This ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails.* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 40mm center height(height from top of base to center of the ring). See-thru design.* Ring width: 1inch (measured from front to back)* Ring tops are held to base using 6 Torx screws (3 screws on each side)* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO identical rings in the set with Allen head wrench (Picture shows one ring installed with accessory rail top which both rings have)", "text": "TMS HEAVY DUTY TACTICAL HIGH SCOPE RING SET 30MM 1\" PICATINNY WITH ACCESSORY RAIL TOPS This ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails.* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 40mm center height(height from top of base to center of the ring). See-thru design.* Ring width: 1inch (measured from front to back)* Ring tops are held to base using 6 Torx screws (3 screws on each side)* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO identical rings in the set with Allen head wrench (Picture shows one ring installed with accessory rail top which both rings have)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cH2aJMlvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QU07HC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B003QUBF82", "title": "TMS HEAVY DUTY TACTICAL Medium SCOPE RING SET 30MM 1\" PICATINNY WITH ACCESSORY RAIL TOPS", "description": "This ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails. Does NOT Fit Weaver.* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 30mm center height. See-thru design. Good with up to 50mm objectives* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO identical rings in the set with Allen head wrench (Picture shows one ring)", "text": "TMS HEAVY DUTY TACTICAL Medium SCOPE RING SET 30MM 1\" PICATINNY WITH ACCESSORY RAIL TOPS This ring set is for the serious shooter that wants the best in strength and ruggedness. The heavy duty rings are made of solid heat-treated aluminum alloy* Fits Picatinny 1913 RIS rails. Does NOT Fit Weaver.* Works with 30 mm tube scope or 1inch tube scope using included size inserts* 30mm center height. See-thru design. Good with up to 50mm objectives* Each ring comes with additional top with built-in Picatinny accessory rail which can be used for mounting laser sight, flashlight etc...* Large clamping Hex nut for secure mounting* Anodized black matte finish* TWO identical rings in the set with Allen head wrench (Picture shows one ring)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sDbHmFn6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QUBF82.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 28.0}}
