{"item_id": "B003QYGUME", "title": "SKB Break-down Shotgun Soft Case", "description": "The new 2SKB-SC3409 Break-down Shotgun Soft Case is manufactured of a rugged 600 Denier ballistic nylon exterior with a durable zipper closure and padlock loops. A hard-core foam interior provides more substantial protection than conventional gun bags, and two external pouches offer organized accessory storage for shells and other necessities. Affordable pricing, light weight construction and enhanced portability (with padded handle and shoulder strap) all make this case the ultimate in SKB protection for the local shooter on the go.", "text": "SKB Break-down Shotgun Soft Case The new 2SKB-SC3409 Break-down Shotgun Soft Case is manufactured of a rugged 600 Denier ballistic nylon exterior with a durable zipper closure and padlock loops. A hard-core foam interior provides more substantial protection than conventional gun bags, and two external pouches offer organized accessory storage for shells and other necessities. Affordable pricing, light weight construction and enhanced portability (with padded handle and shoulder strap) all make this case the ultimate in SKB protection for the local shooter on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RAy61lf7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003QYGUME.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 59.95}}
