{"item_id": "B003R489A4", "title": "Molle Cross Draw Pistol Gun Holster Airsoft", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Modular cross draw holster with an extra magazine pouch. MOLLE pad designed for versatile use of the holster on any webbing systems. Fully adjustable belt hanger with all around Velcro strap for firm attachment. Lock down strap for max protection and security. Designed for comfort and quick draw.", "text": "Molle Cross Draw Pistol Gun Holster Airsoft Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Modular cross draw holster with an extra magazine pouch. MOLLE pad designed for versatile use of the holster on any webbing systems. Fully adjustable belt hanger with all around Velcro strap for firm attachment. Lock down strap for max protection and security. Designed for comfort and quick draw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515R65QHI4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R489A4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B003R509PG", "title": "High Sierra Wave 50 Hydration Pack (Black, 14.5x 10.5-Inch)", "description": "Great for biking, hiking, skiing any other way you spend the day, our Wave 50 pack holds a 1.5-liter water reservoir for easy, hands-free hydration when you're on the move. with intelligent extras like an easily accessible reservoir cap, accessory pocket, and an insulated tube cover, Wave 50 keeps you rolling along.", "text": "High Sierra Wave 50 Hydration Pack (Black, 14.5x 10.5-Inch) Great for biking, hiking, skiing any other way you spend the day, our Wave 50 pack holds a 1.5-liter water reservoir for easy, hands-free hydration when you're on the move. with intelligent extras like an easily accessible reservoir cap, accessory pocket, and an insulated tube cover, Wave 50 keeps you rolling along.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vk8AwazhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R509PG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 23.73}}
{"item_id": "B003R50ANW", "title": "High Sierra Soaker 70 Hydration Pack", "description": "A generous water capacity is just the start with our versatile Soaker 70 pack. It not only holds a 2-liter water reservoir in its large main compartment for hands-free hydration, Soaker 70 also brings you a hinged front pocket that perfect for stowing your helmet, another pocket for an MP3 player or bike tools, and lots of other extras to keep you pedaling strong anywhere you are.", "text": "High Sierra Soaker 70 Hydration Pack A generous water capacity is just the start with our versatile Soaker 70 pack. It not only holds a 2-liter water reservoir in its large main compartment for hands-free hydration, Soaker 70 also brings you a hinged front pocket that perfect for stowing your helmet, another pocket for an MP3 player or bike tools, and lots of other extras to keep you pedaling strong anywhere you are.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CpQ1CAS3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R50ANW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PTRW", "title": "Mountain Trails Current Hiker 6-Foot by 5-Foot 2-Person Dome Tent", "description": "The Mountain Trail Hiker sport tent sleeps 2 persons comfortably in a 30 square foot area, with the base size of 6 by 5 feet with a 38-inch center height. It features a large Dutch \"D\" style door with inside flap, 2 polyester mesh windows, a shockcorded fiberglass frame with pole pocket attachments, a utility pocket to keep personal items always within easy reach, and an attached mud mat helps keep tent floor clean and clear.Features:Lightweight and compact for hiking or backpacking with carry weight of 3.5 poundsLarge Dutch \"D\" style door and 2 Polyester mesh windows with inside flapsWelded polyethylene floor with inside binding2 - Polyester mesh roof vents for increased air circulationStow-n-go duffel set-up, take down and storage systemSpecifications:Door: Dutch \"D\" style with inside flapWindow: Polyester mesh, 3 eachFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: FiberglassPegs: SteelArea: 6 ft. x 5 ft.Sleeps: 2", "text": "Mountain Trails Current Hiker 6-Foot by 5-Foot 2-Person Dome Tent The Mountain Trail Hiker sport tent sleeps 2 persons comfortably in a 30 square foot area, with the base size of 6 by 5 feet with a 38-inch center height. It features a large Dutch \"D\" style door with inside flap, 2 polyester mesh windows, a shockcorded fiberglass frame with pole pocket attachments, a utility pocket to keep personal items always within easy reach, and an attached mud mat helps keep tent floor clean and clear.Features:Lightweight and compact for hiking or backpacking with carry weight of 3.5 poundsLarge Dutch \"D\" style door and 2 Polyester mesh windows with inside flapsWelded polyethylene floor with inside binding2 - Polyester mesh roof vents for increased air circulationStow-n-go duffel set-up, take down and storage systemSpecifications:Door: Dutch \"D\" style with inside flapWindow: Polyester mesh, 3 eachFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: FiberglassPegs: SteelArea: 6 ft. x 5 ft.Sleeps: 2", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OxN4pd4CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PTRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PTXG", "title": "Mountain Trails Twin Peaks 7- by 7-Foot, 3 to 4-Person Sport Dome Tent", "description": "Lightweight and compact yet large enough to sleep up to four people comfortably, the Mountain Trails Twin Peaks sport dome tent is a good choice for hikers and light travelers. The Twin Peaks boasts a 7-foot-by-7-foot footprint, with a 48-inch center height making it possible to sit up straight in the middle of the tent. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and snag-free pole pockets. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. Other features include a large D-style door for easy entry and exit, a patented hooped fly frame for stability and rain protection, a utility pocket and gear loft to keep personal items within easy reach, an attached mud mat, and a poly/oxford Stow 'n' Go duffel for easy carrying.Specifications:Base: 7 by 7 feetCenter height: 48 inchesInterior space: 49 square feetSleeps: 4Door: D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "text": "Mountain Trails Twin Peaks 7- by 7-Foot, 3 to 4-Person Sport Dome Tent Lightweight and compact yet large enough to sleep up to four people comfortably, the Mountain Trails Twin Peaks sport dome tent is a good choice for hikers and light travelers. The Twin Peaks boasts a 7-foot-by-7-foot footprint, with a 48-inch center height making it possible to sit up straight in the middle of the tent. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and snag-free pole pockets. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. Other features include a large D-style door for easy entry and exit, a patented hooped fly frame for stability and rain protection, a utility pocket and gear loft to keep personal items within easy reach, an attached mud mat, and a poly/oxford Stow 'n' Go duffel for easy carrying.Specifications:Base: 7 by 7 feetCenter height: 48 inchesInterior space: 49 square feetSleeps: 4Door: D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b1m4RW-7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PTXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 54.39}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PU1C", "title": "Mountain Trails South Bend 9- by 7-Foot, 4-Person Sport Dome Tent", "description": "Versatile and compact yet large enough to sleep up to four people comfortably, the Mountain Trails South Bend sport dome tent is a good choice for hikers and car campers alike. The South Bend boasts a 9-foot-by-7-foot footprint, with a 52-inch center height making it possible to sit up straight in the middle of the tent. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and a pin-and-ring system. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. Other features include a large D-style door for easy entry and exit, a utility pocket and gear loft to keep personal items within easy reach, an attached mud mat to keep the tent floor clean, and an integrated Stow 'n' Go duffel that simplifies setup, take down, and storage.Specifications:Base: 9 by 7 feetCenter height: 52 inchesInterior space: 63 square feetSleeps: 4Door: D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "text": "Mountain Trails South Bend 9- by 7-Foot, 4-Person Sport Dome Tent Versatile and compact yet large enough to sleep up to four people comfortably, the Mountain Trails South Bend sport dome tent is a good choice for hikers and car campers alike. The South Bend boasts a 9-foot-by-7-foot footprint, with a 52-inch center height making it possible to sit up straight in the middle of the tent. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and a pin-and-ring system. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. Other features include a large D-style door for easy entry and exit, a utility pocket and gear loft to keep personal items within easy reach, an attached mud mat to keep the tent floor clean, and an integrated Stow 'n' Go duffel that simplifies setup, take down, and storage.Specifications:Base: 9 by 7 feetCenter height: 52 inchesInterior space: 63 square feetSleeps: 4Door: D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hy3TBCbOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PU1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 60.74}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PU6W", "title": "Mountain Trails Grand Pass 18- by 10-Foot, 2-Room 9 to 10-Person Family Dome Tent", "description": "Spacious enough to sleep up to seven people comfortably, the Mountain Trails Grand Pass family dome tent is a great choice for large families and groups. The Grand Pass boasts an 18-foot-by-10-foot footprint with a 76-inch center height. As a result, campers have plenty of room to stretch out, stand, or store their gear. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and a pin-and-ring system. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers large mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. You can even divide the Grand Pass into two rooms to enjoy added privacy.Other features include two back-to-back D-style Dutch doors for easy entry and exit, a welded polyethylene floor to keep out water, mud mats to help keep the tent clean, a hooped fly for additional stability and rain protection, and an integrated Stow 'n' Go duffel system that simplifies setup, take down, and storage.Specifications:Base: 18 by 10 feetCenter height: 76 inchesInterior space: 170 square feetSleeps: 10Door: 2 D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "text": "Mountain Trails Grand Pass 18- by 10-Foot, 2-Room 9 to 10-Person Family Dome Tent Spacious enough to sleep up to seven people comfortably, the Mountain Trails Grand Pass family dome tent is a great choice for large families and groups. The Grand Pass boasts an 18-foot-by-10-foot footprint with a 76-inch center height. As a result, campers have plenty of room to stretch out, stand, or store their gear. The tent is also a breeze to set up, with shock-corded fiberglass poles and a pin-and-ring system. And to keep you cool on warm evenings, the tent offers large mesh roof vents and windows for ample cross-ventilation. You can even divide the Grand Pass into two rooms to enjoy added privacy.Other features include two back-to-back D-style Dutch doors for easy entry and exit, a welded polyethylene floor to keep out water, mud mats to help keep the tent clean, a hooped fly for additional stability and rain protection, and an integrated Stow 'n' Go duffel system that simplifies setup, take down, and storage.Specifications:Base: 18 by 10 feetCenter height: 76 inchesInterior space: 170 square feetSleeps: 10Door: 2 D-styleWindows: Polyester meshFloor: Welded polyethyleneFrame: Shock-corded fiberglass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mr6tJIt0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PU6W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 170.66}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PUGW", "title": "Mountain Trails Lindenwood--3 lb. Sleeping Bag", "description": "", "text": "Mountain Trails Lindenwood--3 lb. Sleeping Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zTveEpVVL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PUGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountain Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B003R7PUL2", "title": "Mountain Trails Sycamore 30 degrees Extra Long Sleeping Bag (33 x 77-Inch, Orange and Silver)", "description": "Mountain Trails brand; Sycamore extra long Adult sleeping bag has 4 lbs of InsulTherm polyester fill, that will keep you warm in 30 + degree conditions. With 33 inch width and 77 inch length, this will fit those needing a bit more length, with quilted construction of polyester outer and liner materials. This versatile bag has a self repairing coil zipper so two like bags are able to mate together to form a double sleeper. Machine washable and ready for camping, sleep overs and more.", "text": "Mountain Trails Sycamore 30 degrees Extra Long Sleeping Bag (33 x 77-Inch, Orange and Silver) Mountain Trails brand; Sycamore extra long Adult sleeping bag has 4 lbs of InsulTherm polyester fill, that will keep you warm in 30 + degree conditions. With 33 inch width and 77 inch length, this will fit those needing a bit more length, with quilted construction of polyester outer and liner materials. This versatile bag has a self repairing coil zipper so two like bags are able to mate together to form a double sleeper. Machine washable and ready for camping, sleep overs and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BKB5zD6OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R7PUL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 32.99}}
