{"item_id": "B003R8K6EM", "title": "Rhode Gear Highway 2 Bike Rack", "description": "An affordable and secure solution for carrying two bikes on your vehicle trunk; It securely carries three bicycles, is easily installed on nearly any vehicle, no assembly is required, anti-sway cradles prevent bikes from contacting each other, and has a solid steel construction", "text": "Rhode Gear Highway 2 Bike Rack An affordable and secure solution for carrying two bikes on your vehicle trunk; It securely carries three bicycles, is easily installed on nearly any vehicle, no assembly is required, anti-sway cradles prevent bikes from contacting each other, and has a solid steel construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311MNjGbf4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R8K6EM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 71.99}}
{"item_id": "B003R8K6SS", "title": "Rhode Gear Super Shuttle 2 Bike Rack", "description": "An affordable and secure solution for carrying two bikes on your vehicle trunk; Securely carries two bicycles, fits 2 inch and 1.25 inch trunks out of the box, tilts away for easy rear-of-vehicle access, anti-sway cradles prevent bikes from contacting each other, and a solid steel construction", "text": "Rhode Gear Super Shuttle 2 Bike Rack An affordable and secure solution for carrying two bikes on your vehicle trunk; Securely carries two bicycles, fits 2 inch and 1.25 inch trunks out of the box, tilts away for easy rear-of-vehicle access, anti-sway cradles prevent bikes from contacting each other, and a solid steel construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C3zOydc-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003R8K6SS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 71.99}}
{"item_id": "B003RBNU0Q", "title": "DeSantis Insider Kahr 9/40 Right Hand Black", "description": "For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Insider Kahr 9/40 Right Hand Black For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wl43a%2BDIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RBNU0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.62}}
{"item_id": "B003RBQNDM", "title": "Weaver 6-Hole 1-Inch Medium Picatinny Rings", "description": "Weaver's popular 6-Hole Tactical Rings just got the Picatinny treatment. These new rings feature the same six screws for max security and clamping pressure but get serious upgrades for LE and military use. An improved Picatinny crossbolt design (from Weaver to Picatinny spec), Type III hard coat anodized finish, no strip/slip Torx screws and an increased number of height options make these new 6-hole rings the go-to mounts for all Tactical Precision rifles. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "text": "Weaver 6-Hole 1-Inch Medium Picatinny Rings Weaver's popular 6-Hole Tactical Rings just got the Picatinny treatment. These new rings feature the same six screws for max security and clamping pressure but get serious upgrades for LE and military use. An improved Picatinny crossbolt design (from Weaver to Picatinny spec), Type III hard coat anodized finish, no strip/slip Torx screws and an increased number of height options make these new 6-hole rings the go-to mounts for all Tactical Precision rifles. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317xOqRX2%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RBQNDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 35.49}}
{"item_id": "B003RBS8VC", "title": "Desantis Insider Holster For Glock 26/27 Right Hand Black", "description": "For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black.", "text": "Desantis Insider Holster For Glock 26/27 Right Hand Black For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J0cCTm5vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RBS8VC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.51}}
{"item_id": "B003RBTNXO", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 6 Chamber Safety Tool-Rifle", "description": "The Chamber Safety Tool for rifles is a must for any range bag. As a chamber flag, this tools yellow color clearly shows that the weapon is unloaded. Comes with a strengthened head for increased durability. In addition to serving as a chamber flag, the flattened edge on the corner of the head allows you to adjust the wind age and elevation of your scope. The strengthened punch is also designed to push out the takedown pins on your AR-15/M16 without scratching the rifle. Also available for shotguns and pistols.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 6 Chamber Safety Tool-Rifle The Chamber Safety Tool for rifles is a must for any range bag. As a chamber flag, this tools yellow color clearly shows that the weapon is unloaded. Comes with a strengthened head for increased durability. In addition to serving as a chamber flag, the flattened edge on the corner of the head allows you to adjust the wind age and elevation of your scope. The strengthened punch is also designed to push out the takedown pins on your AR-15/M16 without scratching the rifle. Also available for shotguns and pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nkj0c676L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RBTNXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 5.15}}
{"item_id": "B003RBXCQ8", "title": "Weaver 1-Inch Six Hole Tactical Medium Rings (Matte Black)", "description": "In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "text": "Weaver 1-Inch Six Hole Tactical Medium Rings (Matte Black) In the tactical world, performance is mandatory-there is no compromise. Whether it's intense training or real-life action, you need your zero to stay true. The Weaver Six Hole Tactical Rings are made from aircraft-grade aluminum and feature six points of contact for maximum security and are designed to withstand the most grueling environments imaginable. If you demand the most from your tactical scope, demand Weaver. Weaver complete mounting systems are expertly crafted for specific firearms, or smartly designed for a more universal fit. Either way, they provide everything you need to securely mount optics on your centerfire rifle, shotgun, pistol, or other firearm - all in one convenient package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QktMFMMyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RBXCQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 25.95}}
