{"item_id": "B003RC6RWS", "title": "Weaver Tactical AR-15/M16 Flat Top Riser Rail", "description": "Turn your flat top AR-15 or M16 into the perfect optics platform with our new Flat Top Riser Rail. This riser rail is made from aircraft-grade 6061-T6, aluminum and has Type III hard coat anodizing for years of rugged use. Engineered to provide the optimal mounting height for all types of optic and ring combinations, the new Flat Top Riser Rail is available in both standard and quick detach models. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "text": "Weaver Tactical AR-15/M16 Flat Top Riser Rail Turn your flat top AR-15 or M16 into the perfect optics platform with our new Flat Top Riser Rail. This riser rail is made from aircraft-grade 6061-T6, aluminum and has Type III hard coat anodizing for years of rugged use. Engineered to provide the optimal mounting height for all types of optic and ring combinations, the new Flat Top Riser Rail is available in both standard and quick detach models. Special-purpose tactical equipment requires specialized mounting hardware to install model-specific scopes and sights. Or utilize our bases to add-on other accessories to your tactical weapon. Whatever your requirements, our complete systems are skillfully designed and built to the exact, military-grade specifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WSq2LyIRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RC6RWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B003RCBFTI", "title": "DeSantis 031 The Insider Inside the Pant Right LCP P3AT DB Leather", "description": "For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black. The image that is on the website is a stock image that shows the holster. Because the same style of holster is sold to fit different firearms", "text": "DeSantis 031 The Insider Inside the Pant Right LCP P3AT DB Leather For concealment with comfort, the Insider contains design features to minimize bulk. It is made with a heavy duty spring steel clip positioned high for deep cover. The leather is soft and un-molded. Available in black. The image that is on the website is a stock image that shows the holster. Because the same style of holster is sold to fit different firearms", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LnaAVDPpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RCBFTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.51}}
