{"item_id": "B003RLE55K", "title": "Topeak JoeBlow Mountain Floor Pump", "description": "This unique mountain bike specific floor pump features a super-sized steel barrel designed to deliver the higher volume required of large off-road tires and an extra sensitive, base mounted analog gauge with air release button to help dial in the exact pressure. A TwinHead with extra long hose, oversized padded handles and stable composite base round out this World Cup contender.", "text": "Topeak JoeBlow Mountain Floor Pump This unique mountain bike specific floor pump features a super-sized steel barrel designed to deliver the higher volume required of large off-road tires and an extra sensitive, base mounted analog gauge with air release button to help dial in the exact pressure. A TwinHead with extra long hose, oversized padded handles and stable composite base round out this World Cup contender.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hbEBjBxGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RLE55K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 39.0}}
