{"item_id": "B003RLLDV4", "title": "SRAM Apex Brake Caliper Set", "description": "The new Apex Brakeset from SRAM was designed with high performance and good looks. Featuring Dual Pivot performance combined with a external centering adjuster, proprietary pad compound the Apex Brakeset offers a powerful response when actuated.", "text": "SRAM Apex Brake Caliper Set The new Apex Brakeset from SRAM was designed with high performance and good looks. Featuring Dual Pivot performance combined with a external centering adjuster, proprietary pad compound the Apex Brakeset offers a powerful response when actuated.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hcyZ0f%2BFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RLLDV4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes", "Rim Brake Sets"]], "price": 55.89}}
{"item_id": "B003RLLO9A", "title": "SRAM PG-1050 Cassette", "description": "The cornerstone of SRAM's WiFli (Wider range of gears, Faster shifts, Lighter than triples) road system, the Apex PG-1050 Cassette offers the necessary range between big and little cogs to create the mountain goat climbing and city limit sprinting gears you'll need to make the most of every ride.Like SRAM's higher end offerings, the PG-1050 Cassette employs an aluminum spider to create an attachment for the largest cogs to save a few grams. The nickel plated cogs are all steel for long life. SRAM's Powerglide technology ensures that there are ramps and teeth designed to pickup and release your chain for quick flawless shifts everytime. When you want to grab another gear, DoubleTap and you'll have it.The SRAM Apex PG-1050 Cassette is 10-speed specific and comes in a multitude of gear ranges:The 11/23 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23The 11/26 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,23,26The 11/28 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,22,25,28The 11/32 includes: 11,12,14,16,18,20,22,25,28,32The 11/36 includes: 11,12,14,16,18,21,24,28,32,36The 12/25 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,25The 12/26 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,26The 12/27 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,24,27The 12/28 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,22,25,28The 12/32 includes: 12,13,14,15,17,19,22,25,28,32The 12/36 includes: 12,13,15,17,19,22,25,28,32,36Product FeaturesCog Sizes:Cog Material:Carrier Material:Hub Type:Weight:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "text": "SRAM PG-1050 Cassette The cornerstone of SRAM's WiFli (Wider range of gears, Faster shifts, Lighter than triples) road system, the Apex PG-1050 Cassette offers the necessary range between big and little cogs to create the mountain goat climbing and city limit sprinting gears you'll need to make the most of every ride.Like SRAM's higher end offerings, the PG-1050 Cassette employs an aluminum spider to create an attachment for the largest cogs to save a few grams. The nickel plated cogs are all steel for long life. SRAM's Powerglide technology ensures that there are ramps and teeth designed to pickup and release your chain for quick flawless shifts everytime. When you want to grab another gear, DoubleTap and you'll have it.The SRAM Apex PG-1050 Cassette is 10-speed specific and comes in a multitude of gear ranges:The 11/23 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23The 11/26 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,21,23,26The 11/28 includes: 11,12,13,14,15,17,19,22,25,28The 11/32 includes: 11,12,14,16,18,20,22,25,28,32The 11/36 includes: 11,12,14,16,18,21,24,28,32,36The 12/25 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,25The 12/26 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,23,26The 12/27 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,21,24,27The 12/28 includes: 12,13,14,15,16,17,19,22,25,28The 12/32 includes: 12,13,14,15,17,19,22,25,28,32The 12/36 includes: 12,13,15,17,19,22,25,28,32,36Product FeaturesCog Sizes:Cog Material:Carrier Material:Hub Type:Weight:Recommended Use:Manufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dIDYlBH9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RLLO9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
