{"item_id": "B003RLNLJQ", "title": "WTB Presta Mountain Tube - 26x2.1/2.4", "description": "When you ride over a clump of cholla, youll be glad you brought along an extra WTB Presta Mountain Bike Tube. This butyl tube has an easy-to-grip logo cap for its Presta valvethis cap is large enough that you might not lose it in the sand while you pump up your tire.Product FeaturesSize: 26x2.2 / 2.5inValve Type: PrestaWeight:Recommended Use: All-mountain, freerideManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "WTB Presta Mountain Tube - 26x2.1/2.4 When you ride over a clump of cholla, youll be glad you brought along an extra WTB Presta Mountain Bike Tube. This butyl tube has an easy-to-grip logo cap for its Presta valvethis cap is large enough that you might not lose it in the sand while you pump up your tire.Product FeaturesSize: 26x2.2 / 2.5inValve Type: PrestaWeight:Recommended Use: All-mountain, freerideManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hY27YORBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RLNLJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 11.14}}
