{"item_id": "B003RQPV6C", "title": "Lee Precision 9-mm 6 Cavity Mold (Silver)", "description": "The Lee Precision 6 Cavity Bullet Mold 9mm blocks are machined from commercial quality aluminum and feature steel bushing and alignment pins. It is machined from aluminum blocks making them rust resistant. Aluminum molds heat up and cool down faster than iron or steel molds so good bullets can usually be produced after only a few casts. In addition, they are one-third the weight of iron or steel mold blocks for less fatigue during extended casting sessions. To ensure the best possible bullets, mold block halves are clamped together and then lathe-bored for unmatched roundness and size control. It comes with a cam operated, hard-anodized sprue plate which is held tightly with tempered spring washers at each end.", "text": "Lee Precision 9-mm 6 Cavity Mold (Silver) The Lee Precision 6 Cavity Bullet Mold 9mm blocks are machined from commercial quality aluminum and feature steel bushing and alignment pins. It is machined from aluminum blocks making them rust resistant. Aluminum molds heat up and cool down faster than iron or steel molds so good bullets can usually be produced after only a few casts. In addition, they are one-third the weight of iron or steel mold blocks for less fatigue during extended casting sessions. To ensure the best possible bullets, mold block halves are clamped together and then lathe-bored for unmatched roundness and size control. It comes with a cam operated, hard-anodized sprue plate which is held tightly with tempered spring washers at each end.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Dc54MrVhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RQPV6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 36.71}}
{"item_id": "B003RR8GF4", "title": "BV 11\" High Pressure Micro Floor Pump, In-line Gauge, 140 psi, Reversible Presta Schrader, Long Hose, Frame Mount", "description": "The GM71 is a super compact and lightweight, high pressure, micro floor pump with an in-line gauge.At only 11\", the maximum pressure is 140 psi.All BV pumps are reversible for Presta and Schrader valves.Both the foot stand and handle fold up into a small package. The long hose is flexible and the rotating nozzle allow for easier operation.It comes with a holder that mounts where a bottle cage mounts on a bike. Velcro straps and heavy duty cable ties are included for mounting on other parts of bike frames.With 3 mounting options and packed with features, the micro pump is highly versatile and flexible.Specifications:Material:AluminumMax. Pressure:140 psiValve Type:Presta and SchraderWeight:7.4 oz.Dimensions:10\" x 2\" x 1\".", "text": "BV 11\" High Pressure Micro Floor Pump, In-line Gauge, 140 psi, Reversible Presta Schrader, Long Hose, Frame Mount The GM71 is a super compact and lightweight, high pressure, micro floor pump with an in-line gauge.At only 11\", the maximum pressure is 140 psi.All BV pumps are reversible for Presta and Schrader valves.Both the foot stand and handle fold up into a small package. The long hose is flexible and the rotating nozzle allow for easier operation.It comes with a holder that mounts where a bottle cage mounts on a bike. Velcro straps and heavy duty cable ties are included for mounting on other parts of bike frames.With 3 mounting options and packed with features, the micro pump is highly versatile and flexible.Specifications:Material:AluminumMax. Pressure:140 psiValve Type:Presta and SchraderWeight:7.4 oz.Dimensions:10\" x 2\" x 1\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3106b1Wls-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RR8GF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B003RRMSTE", "title": "BV Bicycle 10\" Telescope Mini Frame Pump w/Lever", "description": "The mini pump is super compact, with a telescope body and lever. At only 10\", it is highly portable and lightweight. Reversible for Presta and Schrader valves, it works for all tires. With a maximum pressure of 80 psi, it is a handy tool to have on the road and its small size makes it easy to pack.The pump includes a mount that attaches where bottle cages are mounted on bike frames. Bottle cages can be mounted simultaneously from the same mounting holes.(bottle cage not included)Specifications:Material:Reinforced plastic barrelMax. Pressure:80 psiValve Type:Presta and SchraderWeight:0.25 lbs.Dimensions:10\" x 2\" x 1\".", "text": "BV Bicycle 10\" Telescope Mini Frame Pump w/Lever The mini pump is super compact, with a telescope body and lever. At only 10\", it is highly portable and lightweight. Reversible for Presta and Schrader valves, it works for all tires. With a maximum pressure of 80 psi, it is a handy tool to have on the road and its small size makes it easy to pack.The pump includes a mount that attaches where bottle cages are mounted on bike frames. Bottle cages can be mounted simultaneously from the same mounting holes.(bottle cage not included)Specifications:Material:Reinforced plastic barrelMax. Pressure:80 psiValve Type:Presta and SchraderWeight:0.25 lbs.Dimensions:10\" x 2\" x 1\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41seReZNjfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RRMSTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 12.99}}
