{"item_id": "B003RX3G08", "title": "RAD Cycle Mighty Rack Two Bike Floor Stand Bicycle Instant Park Bike Rack Cycle Stand - Pro-Quality!", "description": "This pro-quality, versatile bike rack has a rock-solid base and is built to withstand years of use. When deciding on which product to carry we analyze many factors including: cost, stability, quality, etc. The RAD Cycle Product's exclusive design allows a secure base for awkward cycles and offers extreme portability--it can be assemble two different ways depending on the configuration you require. In our opinion these are much more robust and versatile than the inferior knock off versions you regularly see on the market and we back it up with a full warranty. The Stand is simple to use and was designed with children in mind. It utilizes tubular steel construction with a durable finish that will give you many years of dependable service.", "text": "RAD Cycle Mighty Rack Two Bike Floor Stand Bicycle Instant Park Bike Rack Cycle Stand - Pro-Quality! This pro-quality, versatile bike rack has a rock-solid base and is built to withstand years of use. When deciding on which product to carry we analyze many factors including: cost, stability, quality, etc. The RAD Cycle Product's exclusive design allows a secure base for awkward cycles and offers extreme portability--it can be assemble two different ways depending on the configuration you require. In our opinion these are much more robust and versatile than the inferior knock off versions you regularly see on the market and we back it up with a full warranty. The Stand is simple to use and was designed with children in mind. It utilizes tubular steel construction with a durable finish that will give you many years of dependable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mV2wvw%2BhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RX3G08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 29.76}}
