{"item_id": "B003RXJN5U", "title": "Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch", "description": "Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch. Attaches to almost any belt! So your next shot is always at your side! Choose Rifle or Shotshell Pouch; Rifle Pouch features 14 cartridge loops; Shotgun Pouch features 10 shell loops; Quiet, quick side release closure; Mossy Oak Break-Up camo.; State Model. Order Today! Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch", "text": "Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch. Attaches to almost any belt! So your next shot is always at your side! Choose Rifle or Shotshell Pouch; Rifle Pouch features 14 cartridge loops; Shotgun Pouch features 10 shell loops; Quiet, quick side release closure; Mossy Oak Break-Up camo.; State Model. Order Today! Mossy Oak Ammo Pouch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418t7DuV9NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RXJN5U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003RXK8OA", "title": "Black Universal Holster with Hook & Loop Taigear", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Wrap around design fits virtually any handgun or pistol.Adjustable retention straps provide a secure fit around the weapon.Attaches to any Velcro surface on vests, leg rigs, pouches, gear bags, etc. .", "text": "Black Universal Holster with Hook & Loop Taigear Manufacturer: TAIGEAR.Wrap around design fits virtually any handgun or pistol.Adjustable retention straps provide a secure fit around the weapon.Attaches to any Velcro surface on vests, leg rigs, pouches, gear bags, etc. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HzNpD1cCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RXK8OA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 6.21}}
{"item_id": "B003RXKYI0", "title": "Mossy Oak Buttstock Shell Holder Mossy Oak Break - Up", "description": "Mossy Oak Neoprene Buttstock Shell Holder. Your next shot, always at hand! Shotgun or Rifle. Soft, stretchy neoprene with hook and loop attachment fits securely, protects gun finish, reduces glare. Rifle Holder keeps 6 cartridges, Shotshell Holder features 5 shell loops. Dressed up in your favorite Mossy Oak Break-Up pattern. State Model. Order Today! Mossy Oak Buttstock Shell Holder, Mossy Oak Break-Up", "text": "Mossy Oak Buttstock Shell Holder Mossy Oak Break - Up Mossy Oak Neoprene Buttstock Shell Holder. Your next shot, always at hand! Shotgun or Rifle. Soft, stretchy neoprene with hook and loop attachment fits securely, protects gun finish, reduces glare. Rifle Holder keeps 6 cartridges, Shotshell Holder features 5 shell loops. Dressed up in your favorite Mossy Oak Break-Up pattern. State Model. Order Today! Mossy Oak Buttstock Shell Holder, Mossy Oak Break-Up", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LJNAxBLGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RXKYI0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
