{"item_id": "B003RXXRVQ", "title": "Code Blue CR Triple Buck N Does Combo", "description": "Guaranteed pure and fresh, these three scents will help you harvest deer ALL SEASON LONG. Early season offers great opportunities to harvest both does and bucks. Moving stands and scouting are important tactics that help locate and pattern deer movement, but both leave a lot of human scent on the ground. Using Doe Urine as a cover scent provides great protection during those high-temperature days. Use it on scent pads, drags or directly on the soles of your boots when setting up your stands or scouting.", "text": "Code Blue CR Triple Buck N Does Combo Guaranteed pure and fresh, these three scents will help you harvest deer ALL SEASON LONG. Early season offers great opportunities to harvest both does and bucks. Moving stands and scouting are important tactics that help locate and pattern deer movement, but both leave a lot of human scent on the ground. Using Doe Urine as a cover scent provides great protection during those high-temperature days. Use it on scent pads, drags or directly on the soles of your boots when setting up your stands or scouting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W84qdGoLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RXXRVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Code Blue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 9.35}}
{"item_id": "B003RY9YIU", "title": "Hunters Specialties Mag Lift System with Gambrel", "description": "Mag 4:1 ratio lift system. Raise and lower game with hoist while gambrel supports hind legs. Feature 40 foot tangle free, rot resistant rope, 4 pulley system rated to 600lbs", "text": "Hunters Specialties Mag Lift System with Gambrel Mag 4:1 ratio lift system. Raise and lower game with hoist while gambrel supports hind legs. Feature 40 foot tangle free, rot resistant rope, 4 pulley system rated to 600lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qB6Ki0NPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RY9YIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Hoists & Gambrels"]], "price": 15.0}}
