{"item_id": "B003RYGUJG", "title": "Mossy Oak Shotgun Shell Belt (Black)", "description": "Keep comfort in mind for your next day out with this MOSSY OAK Stoneville rifle sling. The rugged yet lightweight sling boasts 3/8-inch foam padding to keep your shoulder in feeling great, as well as an Endura 600-denier polyester construction that can withstand trip after trip to the bush.", "text": "Mossy Oak Shotgun Shell Belt (Black) Keep comfort in mind for your next day out with this MOSSY OAK Stoneville rifle sling. The rugged yet lightweight sling boasts 3/8-inch foam padding to keep your shoulder in feeling great, as well as an Endura 600-denier polyester construction that can withstand trip after trip to the bush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H%2BlgfqncL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003RYGUJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mossy Oak Hunting Accessories", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 7.85}}
