{"item_id": "B003S6VCV4", "title": "Hennessy Hammock SCOUT Tent NEW Camping Biking Hunting Trekking Hennessy Hammock", "description": "This is our \"Original\" non asymmetrical model with updated features. It comes with a larger, slightly asymmetrical rainfly to improve coverage over head and feet when laying on the diagonal. The headroom of the hammock is for anyone up to 5' 8\". This is a great first hammock at a special price for young adventurers, Scouts and Guides or anyone within the height and weight limits.", "text": "Hennessy Hammock SCOUT Tent NEW Camping Biking Hunting Trekking Hennessy Hammock This is our \"Original\" non asymmetrical model with updated features. It comes with a larger, slightly asymmetrical rainfly to improve coverage over head and feet when laying on the diagonal. The headroom of the hammock is for anyone up to 5' 8\". This is a great first hammock at a special price for young adventurers, Scouts and Guides or anyone within the height and weight limits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313aSsqNcRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003S6VCV4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 89.96}}
{"item_id": "B003S9DP3E", "title": "Cressi Palau Mask Fin Snorkel Set with Snorkeling Gear Bag", "description": "Palau Short Adjustable Fin are very special fins, designed for swimming and snorkelling, but above all for all those who practise water sports and that only need the fins in particular situations. For example for those who practise all kinds of surfing and windsurfing, rafting, canoeing etc. and also for those who practise their favourite sports offshore. - Palau SAF has a very soft, short blade and a foot pocket that allows it to be put on in seconds, even when in the water. What is more, the foot pocket has been designed to accommodate at least 3-4 consecutive sizes and allow the fin to be worn over thin footwear. The strap has a strong ring on the upper part to allow reversal of the strap itself or to fix the fins to the body or the equipment.", "text": "Cressi Palau Mask Fin Snorkel Set with Snorkeling Gear Bag Palau Short Adjustable Fin are very special fins, designed for swimming and snorkelling, but above all for all those who practise water sports and that only need the fins in particular situations. For example for those who practise all kinds of surfing and windsurfing, rafting, canoeing etc. and also for those who practise their favourite sports offshore. - Palau SAF has a very soft, short blade and a foot pocket that allows it to be put on in seconds, even when in the water. What is more, the foot pocket has been designed to accommodate at least 3-4 consecutive sizes and allow the fin to be worn over thin footwear. The strap has a strong ring on the upper part to allow reversal of the strap itself or to fix the fins to the body or the equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MZUDezxFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003S9DP3E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 59.95}}
