{"item_id": "B003SA048M", "title": "Airsoft G.6 1911 Spring Handgun Plastic BB Pistol", "description": "This Airsoft gun is made with a Zinc Alloy shell. The Spring Airsoft Pistol is powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. The gun shoots 320 FPS with 0.12g BB's. Uses 6MM BBs. Length 9 inches. Zinc alloy shell.", "text": "Airsoft G.6 1911 Spring Handgun Plastic BB Pistol This Airsoft gun is made with a Zinc Alloy shell. The Spring Airsoft Pistol is powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. The gun shoots 320 FPS with 0.12g BB's. Uses 6MM BBs. Length 9 inches. Zinc alloy shell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i8bbpv%2BeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SA048M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 6.46}}
{"item_id": "B003SAKPWW", "title": "Buck PakLiteTM Skinner Knife with Black Traction Coat (Black/Silver, 6 5/8-Inch)", "description": "As the name implies, nothing is lighter or easier to carry than the skeletal steel frame PakLites TM. The PakLites TM are tough enough to ensure years of reliable performance, and so lightweight you'll hardly know you're carrying them. Made out of durable 420HC Stainless Steel, with a heavy-duty nylon sheath.", "text": "Buck PakLiteTM Skinner Knife with Black Traction Coat (Black/Silver, 6 5/8-Inch) As the name implies, nothing is lighter or easier to carry than the skeletal steel frame PakLites TM. The PakLites TM are tough enough to ensure years of reliable performance, and so lightweight you'll hardly know you're carrying them. Made out of durable 420HC Stainless Steel, with a heavy-duty nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416TbGuqHoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SAKPWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.72}}
{"item_id": "B003SARH96", "title": "Ontario 8912 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Matte satin finished tanto blade style with rounded Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "text": "Ontario 8912 Joe Pardue Utiliac Folding Knife (Black) This is one of the knives from Ontario Knife's second series of Joe Pardue Utiliac knives. This series features AUS-8A steel blades at 0.115\" thickness that are flat ground at 40 degrees. These knives have ergonomic styled Zytel handles. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Liner Lock locking mechanism. Thumbstud for easy one-handed opening. Matte satin finished tanto blade style with rounded Zytel handle. Blade has a hardness of 56-58 HCR. Includes four-position pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VzRKnIn%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SARH96.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.16}}
{"item_id": "B003SB63IQ", "title": "Smooth Action Universal Firearm Cleaning Kit", "description": "Universal Deluxe Cleaning Kit in Wood Case Brass Rods Various Calibers SPGUNCLN Free Shipping This set features 10 phosphor bronze brushes for cleaning 10/12 Ga, 20/28 Ga, .410 bore, .44/.45, .357/.38/9mm, .30, .40/10mm, .22, .17, and .270/.280 5 cleaning mops for 10/12 Ga, 20/28 Ga, .410 bore, .357/.38, and .22 shotgun patch puller; and rifle patch puller Includes a 3pc rod with assembly for .17 caliber rifle and up, pistol or shotgun Cleaning rod adapters included", "text": "Smooth Action Universal Firearm Cleaning Kit Universal Deluxe Cleaning Kit in Wood Case Brass Rods Various Calibers SPGUNCLN Free Shipping This set features 10 phosphor bronze brushes for cleaning 10/12 Ga, 20/28 Ga, .410 bore, .44/.45, .357/.38/9mm, .30, .40/10mm, .22, .17, and .270/.280 5 cleaning mops for 10/12 Ga, 20/28 Ga, .410 bore, .357/.38, and .22 shotgun patch puller; and rifle patch puller Includes a 3pc rod with assembly for .17 caliber rifle and up, pistol or shotgun Cleaning rod adapters included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ElwbtgxeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SB63IQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Revlon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 17.41}}
{"item_id": "B003SC7F00", "title": "Bern Berkeley Summer Helmet with Visor", "description": "The W's Berkeley uses a unique foam called Zipmold that has a higher strength to weight ratio than traditional EPS hard foams, allowing it to be thinner and lighter, while still hitting the Certifications for Head Protection. The result is the lid fits super low profile and sinks down on your head unlike other helmets that bring out the hugeness in your melon.", "text": "Bern Berkeley Summer Helmet with Visor The W's Berkeley uses a unique foam called Zipmold that has a higher strength to weight ratio than traditional EPS hard foams, allowing it to be thinner and lighter, while still hitting the Certifications for Head Protection. The result is the lid fits super low profile and sinks down on your head unlike other helmets that bring out the hugeness in your melon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41llhLHW-2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SC7F00.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
