{"item_id": "B003SOROKE", "title": "Topeak Handlebar Water Bottle Cage Mount", "description": "Whether you want an extra water bottle or your bike does not have traditional water bottle mounts, here is your solution. The Water Bottle Cage Mount goes directly onto your handle bars to give you that water storage you need. Do your kids complain that they are thirsty when they ride? Use the Handlebar cage mount and they'll never go thirsty again!.", "text": "Topeak Handlebar Water Bottle Cage Mount Whether you want an extra water bottle or your bike does not have traditional water bottle mounts, here is your solution. The Water Bottle Cage Mount goes directly onto your handle bars to give you that water storage you need. Do your kids complain that they are thirsty when they ride? Use the Handlebar cage mount and they'll never go thirsty again!.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B3moK%2BCSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SOROKE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B003SPODNE", "title": "Klean Kanteen Sport Cap 2.0 Replacement Cap - 3 Pack", "description": "This new and improved sport cap offers 3x the flow of the first sport cap, a quieter valve, and a new and improved spout that's six times stronger than the earlier version of the Sport 2.0., this cap is guaranteed to quench your thirst. Made with BPA-free polypropylene (pp#5), the cap is designed with one, simple moving part so it won't break or get crud in the works.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Sport Cap 2.0 Replacement Cap - 3 Pack This new and improved sport cap offers 3x the flow of the first sport cap, a quieter valve, and a new and improved spout that's six times stronger than the earlier version of the Sport 2.0., this cap is guaranteed to quench your thirst. Made with BPA-free polypropylene (pp#5), the cap is designed with one, simple moving part so it won't break or get crud in the works.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qTmFhsT-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SPODNE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 15.41}}
{"item_id": "B003SPVK6M", "title": "Black Dragon Foam Padded Nunchaku w/ Steel Swivel Chain", "description": "Made of high-impact foam with a durable plastic center, This nunchaku handles measure at 12\". Features a intricate golden dragon design on each handle attached by a chain cord, making it lightweight, perfect for competitions or training.", "text": "Black Dragon Foam Padded Nunchaku w/ Steel Swivel Chain Made of high-impact foam with a durable plastic center, This nunchaku handles measure at 12\". Features a intricate golden dragon design on each handle attached by a chain cord, making it lightweight, perfect for competitions or training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419nLdiQ0TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SPVK6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons"]], "price": 6.8}}
{"item_id": "B003SS56RS", "title": "Ledge Sports Scorpion +45 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20)", "description": "Extremely small and compact. Excellent for summer adventures with space is a premium but features and elevated specifications are mandatory.", "text": "Ledge Sports Scorpion +45 F Degree Ultra Light Design, Ultra Compact Sleeping Bag (84 X 32 X 20) Extremely small and compact. Excellent for summer adventures with space is a premium but features and elevated specifications are mandatory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P0HqQyOpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SS56RS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 23.27}}
{"item_id": "B003SSQRXU", "title": "Maxpedition Noatak Gearslinger", "description": "From the Maxpedition Gearslinger lineup, the Noatak pack allows you the ergonomic comfort of a backpack with the quick and easy access of a sling bag. Designed to be worn on the back with a comfortable strap that distributes weight evenly across the shoulders, the Noatak rotates 270 degrees towards the front of the body when you need access to the contents. Particularly useful when the pack is worn while seated, this is also a great feature when you're walking through the field, saving you the time and trouble of removing the bag.Built to keep you comfortable in extreme environments, the Noatak's back panel and shoulder strap are padded with #AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam material for superior shock protection, keeping you and your bag's contents well protected. The multi-compartment pack features a roomy main compartment with multiple interior pockets, a zippered front pouch with an internal \"Keyper\" (key retention system) and sleeve pockets, a hydration compatible rear compartment also equipped with a loop to hold a firearm, and a side water bottle pocket. Exterior modular webbing allows attachment of various pouches while internal loop fields facilitate concealed carry.Noatak Dimensions:Main compartment: 11 x 7 x 4 inches with multiple internal pocketsFront pouch pocket: 7 x 7 x 2 inches with internal \"Keyper\" (key retention system) and sleeve pocketsFront sleeve: 6.5 x 6.5 inches with anti-theft device on zipperRear compartment: 8 x 12 inches (hydration compatible)Water bottle pocket: 7 x 2.5 inches (fits 32-ounces/1 liter bottle)Hard-Use Nylon Construction:In addition to its great, ergonomic gearslinger design, the Noatak boasts the exceptionally sturdy, Hard-Use nylon design and construction that Maxpedition is known for. Not only is the bag built to withstand extreme conditions and hard-use in demanding situations and environments, the Noatak pack also features low-sound opening and closures, and plain colors (green and tan) designed to blend into a wide range of natural and man-made environments during the day or in the night. In brief, the Noatak is constructed of 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric with Dupont Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance, and triple polyurethane coated for water resistance. The bag features never-fail YKK high strength zippers and zipper tracks with durable, silent Paracord zipper pulls, and UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles offer low sound closures ideal for hunting and stealth uses. Stitched entirely with high tensile strength composite nylon thread and double stitched, Bartacked, or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength at stress points, you can count on this bag not to fail. For additional weather resistance and durability, the Noatak's internal seams are taped and finished. Finally, high tensile strength nylon webbing used for bag reinforcement, attachment points, and straps ensures the integrity of the bag.Hard-Use Materials:1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabricDupont Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceTriple polyurethane coated for water resistanceYKK high strength zippers and zipper tracksParacord zipper pullsUTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closuresHigh tensile strength nylon webbingHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread)#AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protectionInternal seams taped and finishedStress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strengthCleaning Instructions:MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach.", "text": "Maxpedition Noatak Gearslinger From the Maxpedition Gearslinger lineup, the Noatak pack allows you the ergonomic comfort of a backpack with the quick and easy access of a sling bag. Designed to be worn on the back with a comfortable strap that distributes weight evenly across the shoulders, the Noatak rotates 270 degrees towards the front of the body when you need access to the contents. Particularly useful when the pack is worn while seated, this is also a great feature when you're walking through the field, saving you the time and trouble of removing the bag.Built to keep you comfortable in extreme environments, the Noatak's back panel and shoulder strap are padded with #AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam material for superior shock protection, keeping you and your bag's contents well protected. The multi-compartment pack features a roomy main compartment with multiple interior pockets, a zippered front pouch with an internal \"Keyper\" (key retention system) and sleeve pockets, a hydration compatible rear compartment also equipped with a loop to hold a firearm, and a side water bottle pocket. Exterior modular webbing allows attachment of various pouches while internal loop fields facilitate concealed carry.Noatak Dimensions:Main compartment: 11 x 7 x 4 inches with multiple internal pocketsFront pouch pocket: 7 x 7 x 2 inches with internal \"Keyper\" (key retention system) and sleeve pocketsFront sleeve: 6.5 x 6.5 inches with anti-theft device on zipperRear compartment: 8 x 12 inches (hydration compatible)Water bottle pocket: 7 x 2.5 inches (fits 32-ounces/1 liter bottle)Hard-Use Nylon Construction:In addition to its great, ergonomic gearslinger design, the Noatak boasts the exceptionally sturdy, Hard-Use nylon design and construction that Maxpedition is known for. Not only is the bag built to withstand extreme conditions and hard-use in demanding situations and environments, the Noatak pack also features low-sound opening and closures, and plain colors (green and tan) designed to blend into a wide range of natural and man-made environments during the day or in the night. In brief, the Noatak is constructed of 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric with Dupont Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance, and triple polyurethane coated for water resistance. The bag features never-fail YKK high strength zippers and zipper tracks with durable, silent Paracord zipper pulls, and UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles offer low sound closures ideal for hunting and stealth uses. Stitched entirely with high tensile strength composite nylon thread and double stitched, Bartacked, or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength at stress points, you can count on this bag not to fail. For additional weather resistance and durability, the Noatak's internal seams are taped and finished. Finally, high tensile strength nylon webbing used for bag reinforcement, attachment points, and straps ensures the integrity of the bag.Hard-Use Materials:1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabricDupont Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenanceTriple polyurethane coated for water resistanceYKK high strength zippers and zipper tracksParacord zipper pullsUTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closuresHigh tensile strength nylon webbingHigh tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread)#AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protectionInternal seams taped and finishedStress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strengthCleaning Instructions:MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pGOGj11dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SSQRXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 103.62}}
{"item_id": "B003SXLW7Q", "title": "Deluxe Camping Combo LED Lantern and Fan", "description": "Enjoy some of the comfort of home while you experience the great outdoors. Simply hang the?Happy Camper?Deluxe Camping Combo LED Lantern and Fan from your tent or shelter, or stand it on its base and take pleasure in hours of light and fan.", "text": "Deluxe Camping Combo LED Lantern and Fan Enjoy some of the comfort of home while you experience the great outdoors. Simply hang the?Happy Camper?Deluxe Camping Combo LED Lantern and Fan from your tent or shelter, or stand it on its base and take pleasure in hours of light and fan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WYuuSCSgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SXLW7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Super Bright", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 17.06}}
{"item_id": "B003SYYWB8", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Nessmuk Knife, Wood Handle, Leather Sheath", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Nessmuk Knife, Wood Handle, Leather Sheath CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N-0Nx8BNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003SYYWB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 35.17}}
