{"item_id": "B003T544DW", "title": "Face Saver Plus 3-SW, Black Iron Cover (9-piece)", "description": "The ultimate iron cover with a hosel lock to prevent loss. Comes with a lanyard per 2 covers to resist tangling. Fits regular and oversized irons. 9 piece set, 3-SW.", "text": "Face Saver Plus 3-SW, Black Iron Cover (9-piece) The ultimate iron cover with a hosel lock to prevent loss. Comes with a lanyard per 2 covers to resist tangling. Fits regular and oversized irons. 9 piece set, 3-SW.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Llu6LMYCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003T544DW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Head Covers"]], "price": 21.99}}
