{"item_id": "B003TA3NMA", "title": "Crosman CP392RG Centerpoint 3-9x32mm Riflescope", "description": "This is an affordable and durable waterproof, fogproof and shockproof scope is great for any airgun or rimfire rifle. Finger-adjustable windage and elevation dials, One-piece tube, multi-coated lenses and lens covers and dovetail scope-mount rings included.", "text": "Crosman CP392RG Centerpoint 3-9x32mm Riflescope This is an affordable and durable waterproof, fogproof and shockproof scope is great for any airgun or rimfire rifle. Finger-adjustable windage and elevation dials, One-piece tube, multi-coated lenses and lens covers and dovetail scope-mount rings included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t5-cqNPLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TA3NMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 39.99}}
