{"item_id": "B003TIGONC", "title": "NeoSport 1.5-mm XSPAN Glove", "description": "The NeoSport 1.5mm XSPAN Glove is a premier lightweight glove that provides warmth in cool to mild conditions. Great for kayaking, jettskiing and many more watersport activies.", "text": "NeoSport 1.5-mm XSPAN Glove The NeoSport 1.5mm XSPAN Glove is a premier lightweight glove that provides warmth in cool to mild conditions. Great for kayaking, jettskiing and many more watersport activies.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gKsku-EDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TIGONC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Aquatic Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TIP7GM", "title": "SRAM 2014 Apex Road Bicycle Brake - Black", "description": "Dual Pivot Stopping Power. The new Apex Brakeset from SRAM was designed with high performance and good looks as our guiding principles. Featuring Dual Pivot performance combined with a external centering adjuster, proprietary pad compound the Apex Brakeset offers a powerful response when actuated. Dual Pivot design increases braking power and enhances progressive feel.", "text": "SRAM 2014 Apex Road Bicycle Brake - Black Dual Pivot Stopping Power. The new Apex Brakeset from SRAM was designed with high performance and good looks as our guiding principles. Featuring Dual Pivot performance combined with a external centering adjuster, proprietary pad compound the Apex Brakeset offers a powerful response when actuated. Dual Pivot design increases braking power and enhances progressive feel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gTmRRw2qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TIP7GM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes", "Rim Brake Sets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TIQKYU", "title": "ODI Troy Lee Design Grip With Lock On Clamps", "description": "We’ve enlisted the help of our good friends over at Troy Lee Designs to help put an artistic spin on a quality design. After hundreds of drawings and designs, we’ve developed the most innovative grip yet. Troy’s the kind of guy that will make you throw all of your conventional processes out the window in order to make something for the World’s Fastest Racers.This is not just a slogan to us. Over the past 25 years, we have dedicated ourselves to providing the best there is to offer in our products. This includes our proprietary compounds which have been extensively researched and tested by top athletes around the world to ensure that they provide the highest level of comfort and longevity possible. We are also the innovators of the Lock-On Grip system, which innovated the way in which grips are installed and secured to the handlebars and still remains the worldwide standard for grips. This is also the reason that we have chosen to continue producing our products exclusively in the USA in our own facility. While other manufacturers are scurrying to the lowest possible cost producer overseas, we remain dedicated to maintaining the highest possible product quality facilitated by our long term relationships we have developed with our suppliers.", "text": "ODI Troy Lee Design Grip With Lock On Clamps We’ve enlisted the help of our good friends over at Troy Lee Designs to help put an artistic spin on a quality design. After hundreds of drawings and designs, we’ve developed the most innovative grip yet. Troy’s the kind of guy that will make you throw all of your conventional processes out the window in order to make something for the World’s Fastest Racers.This is not just a slogan to us. Over the past 25 years, we have dedicated ourselves to providing the best there is to offer in our products. This includes our proprietary compounds which have been extensively researched and tested by top athletes around the world to ensure that they provide the highest level of comfort and longevity possible. We are also the innovators of the Lock-On Grip system, which innovated the way in which grips are installed and secured to the handlebars and still remains the worldwide standard for grips. This is also the reason that we have chosen to continue producing our products exclusively in the USA in our own facility. While other manufacturers are scurrying to the lowest possible cost producer overseas, we remain dedicated to maintaining the highest possible product quality facilitated by our long term relationships we have developed with our suppliers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lr5n0-BZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TIQKYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Odi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 18.44}}
