{"item_id": "B003TLLM72", "title": "Wacces® NEW 5 Resistance Bands SET for Yoga, ABS & Gym Workout", "description": "Package Includes: 1 yellow band (very light = 5-6lbs) 1 green band (light = 7.5-8.5lbs) 1 red band (medium = 10.5-12lbs) 1 blue band (heavy = 15-18lbs) 1 black band (extra heavy = 22lbs) 2 foam covered handles 2 ankle straps 1 door anchor 1 Travel Pouch 1 Workout Manual", "text": "Wacces® NEW 5 Resistance Bands SET for Yoga, ABS & Gym Workout Package Includes: 1 yellow band (very light = 5-6lbs) 1 green band (light = 7.5-8.5lbs) 1 red band (medium = 10.5-12lbs) 1 blue band (heavy = 15-18lbs) 1 black band (extra heavy = 22lbs) 2 foam covered handles 2 ankle straps 1 door anchor 1 Travel Pouch 1 Workout Manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RH7Hyce9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TLLM72.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B003TLXCXO", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 20-9319 MOLLE Drop Leg M4/M16 Magazine Shingle", "description": "Securely carries up to six rifle or carbine magazines for easy access. Hangs from your belt and straps to your thigh with two adjustable straps. Total size when magazines are in the pouches is 10\"T x 9\" W x 2\"D when full.This listing is for a Voodoo Tactical drop leg rifle magazine shingle.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 20-9319 MOLLE Drop Leg M4/M16 Magazine Shingle Securely carries up to six rifle or carbine magazines for easy access. Hangs from your belt and straps to your thigh with two adjustable straps. Total size when magazines are in the pouches is 10\"T x 9\" W x 2\"D when full.This listing is for a Voodoo Tactical drop leg rifle magazine shingle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K0t-hRLOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TLXCXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.24}}
