{"item_id": "B003TPR73G", "title": "Condor EMT Pouch", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor EMT Pouch Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wfDLD0biL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TPR73G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TQ38BK", "title": "TYR SPORT EBP Burner Fin", "description": "A fin designed for training at race pace. The shorter fin allows you to keep your kick pace up and gives good propulsion for a great workout. The shorter fin will also reduce the strain on the ankles and feet. The higher frequency kick will maintain helps develop the muscle required for non-fin training. The foot pocket is designed to reduce foot and ankle strain. EBP or Elevated Body Position helps to keep the right body position while training. All of this is designed to simulate race pace conditions with a faster cadence and proper body position. Wall Gripper Footpad keeps the fin on tight while pushing off the wall or during flip turns.", "text": "TYR SPORT EBP Burner Fin A fin designed for training at race pace. The shorter fin allows you to keep your kick pace up and gives good propulsion for a great workout. The shorter fin will also reduce the strain on the ankles and feet. The higher frequency kick will maintain helps develop the muscle required for non-fin training. The foot pocket is designed to reduce foot and ankle strain. EBP or Elevated Body Position helps to keep the right body position while training. All of this is designed to simulate race pace conditions with a faster cadence and proper body position. Wall Gripper Footpad keeps the fin on tight while pushing off the wall or during flip turns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AkKdRRCBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TQ38BK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TQITGO", "title": "TurboFire DVD Workout", "description": "TurboFire is the intense new cardio conditioning program from fitness innovator Chalene Johnson. She'll help you get leaner with exercises that burn up to 9x more fat and calories than traditional cardio does. And with more than 20 smoking-hot music remixes, TurboFire will pick you up and push you past your limits. Chalene's \"New to Class\" option gives you the breakdown on how to do each move with the right form. So forget the excuses, forget the gym--now the hottest classes in Southern California come to you.What You'll Get with TurboFire(the number in each title designates the class length):Get Fired Up:Chalene guides you through the program to help you get the best resultsFire 30 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Throw smoking-hot hooks and make big leaps to the bass of \"Give Up the Funk\"HIIT 15 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Dial it up for your first High Intensity Interval Training (HIIT) classFire 55 EZ Class/Stretch 10 Class:Don't let EZ fool you--you'll be sweating to \"Dazzey Dukes\"Core 20 Class/Stretch 40 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Chalene's most popular class targets your tummy with moves that deliver incredible absFire 45 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Kick, dance, and punch your way into shape to the beat of \"Wiggle It\"HIIT 20 Class/Stretch 10 Class:\"Turn This Mutha Out\" with 7 sizzling Fire Drills in 20 minutesFire 45 EZ Class/Stretch 10 Class:Take a break from the Fire Drills--but not the fire--as you sweat to \"In the Ayer\"HIIT 25 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Here's 25 minutes of your most intense Fire Drills yet with ChaleneSculpt 30 Class/Tone 30 Class:Develop shapely muscles with Chalene's challenging resistance classesStretch 40 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Increase your flexibility and lengthen your muscles for a long, lean lookTurboFire Also Includes:Turn Up the Burn Fitness Guide:Get more in the know about HIIT and why TurboFire really worksTurboFire Class Schedule:We've taken the guesswork out of working out so you can get the best resultsTurboFire Lower-Body Band:Add definition and build long, lean muscles with this body-sculpting bandFuel the Fire Nutrition Guide:Maintain high energy while you train with easy-to-prepare snacks and recipesThe TurboFire 5-Day Inferno Plan:See how you can lose up to 10 pounds in 5 days24/7 Online Support:Stay motivated with easy access to friends, fitness experts, and live chats with Chalene", "text": "TurboFire DVD Workout TurboFire is the intense new cardio conditioning program from fitness innovator Chalene Johnson. She'll help you get leaner with exercises that burn up to 9x more fat and calories than traditional cardio does. And with more than 20 smoking-hot music remixes, TurboFire will pick you up and push you past your limits. Chalene's \"New to Class\" option gives you the breakdown on how to do each move with the right form. So forget the excuses, forget the gym--now the hottest classes in Southern California come to you.What You'll Get with TurboFire(the number in each title designates the class length):Get Fired Up:Chalene guides you through the program to help you get the best resultsFire 30 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Throw smoking-hot hooks and make big leaps to the bass of \"Give Up the Funk\"HIIT 15 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Dial it up for your first High Intensity Interval Training (HIIT) classFire 55 EZ Class/Stretch 10 Class:Don't let EZ fool you--you'll be sweating to \"Dazzey Dukes\"Core 20 Class/Stretch 40 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Chalene's most popular class targets your tummy with moves that deliver incredible absFire 45 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Kick, dance, and punch your way into shape to the beat of \"Wiggle It\"HIIT 20 Class/Stretch 10 Class:\"Turn This Mutha Out\" with 7 sizzling Fire Drills in 20 minutesFire 45 EZ Class/Stretch 10 Class:Take a break from the Fire Drills--but not the fire--as you sweat to \"In the Ayer\"HIIT 25 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Here's 25 minutes of your most intense Fire Drills yet with ChaleneSculpt 30 Class/Tone 30 Class:Develop shapely muscles with Chalene's challenging resistance classesStretch 40 Class/Stretch 10 Class:Increase your flexibility and lengthen your muscles for a long, lean lookTurboFire Also Includes:Turn Up the Burn Fitness Guide:Get more in the know about HIIT and why TurboFire really worksTurboFire Class Schedule:We've taken the guesswork out of working out so you can get the best resultsTurboFire Lower-Body Band:Add definition and build long, lean muscles with this body-sculpting bandFuel the Fire Nutrition Guide:Maintain high energy while you train with easy-to-prepare snacks and recipesThe TurboFire 5-Day Inferno Plan:See how you can lose up to 10 pounds in 5 days24/7 Online Support:Stay motivated with easy access to friends, fitness experts, and live chats with Chalene", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yCuSugdWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TQITGO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TRSQWK", "title": "Sightmark QD Ultra Shot Reflex Sight", "description": "The Sightmark series of reflex sights are designed to create a lightweight, yet accurate, sight. The Ultra Shot QD is Sightmark’s update to the popular Ultra Shot. Perfect for shotguns or rifles, the Ultra Shot QD comes with a built-in, integrated Weaver mount, which fits all standard bases, and unique quick detach mounting system. The wide array of exclusive features is what makes the Ultra Shot QD an unusually versatile sight, and must-have shooting accessory for any well-stocked arsenal. With all its distinguishing features, included accessories, and Limited Lifetime Warranty, the Sightmark Ultra Shot QD is literally in a class by itself", "text": "Sightmark QD Ultra Shot Reflex Sight The Sightmark series of reflex sights are designed to create a lightweight, yet accurate, sight. The Ultra Shot QD is Sightmark’s update to the popular Ultra Shot. Perfect for shotguns or rifles, the Ultra Shot QD comes with a built-in, integrated Weaver mount, which fits all standard bases, and unique quick detach mounting system. The wide array of exclusive features is what makes the Ultra Shot QD an unusually versatile sight, and must-have shooting accessory for any well-stocked arsenal. With all its distinguishing features, included accessories, and Limited Lifetime Warranty, the Sightmark Ultra Shot QD is literally in a class by itself", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XRBG6jvaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TRSQWK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TUBQ0Q", "title": "24\" X 24\" X ~9/16\" Thick Multi-purpose Interlocking Black Foam Mats (Set of 4)", "description": "With over 25 years of experience, as creator; eWonderWorld set the standards for foam mats. Unlike many competitors mats that are made in China, our mats are made in Taiwan undergoing & passing all tests for safety. A set of four 24'' x 24'' black mats are ideal for cushioning any hard surface area. Mats are multi-purpose and can be used children play area, personal gym, exercise mats, floor protection and much more. Includes 4 mats for a total of 16 square feet.", "text": "24\" X 24\" X ~9/16\" Thick Multi-purpose Interlocking Black Foam Mats (Set of 4) With over 25 years of experience, as creator; eWonderWorld set the standards for foam mats. Unlike many competitors mats that are made in China, our mats are made in Taiwan undergoing & passing all tests for safety. A set of four 24'' x 24'' black mats are ideal for cushioning any hard surface area. Mats are multi-purpose and can be used children play area, personal gym, exercise mats, floor protection and much more. Includes 4 mats for a total of 16 square feet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mdfJo4QTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TUBQ0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B003TUCB82", "title": "Spalding 73-132 Pink & Purple NBA Street Basketball, Size 6 (28.5\")", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding 73-132 Pink & Purple NBA Street Basketball, Size 6 (28.5\") A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fsD%2BL-h5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TUCB82.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Basketballs"]], "price": 14.36}}
{"item_id": "B003TV7FHI", "title": "Avid BB7 MTB G2 Front or Rear Rotor", "description": "The mechanical advantage is yours. With gobs of beautifully modulated power and intuitive easy-to-use adjustability, the BB7s set the standard in the realm of mechanical disc brakes. Inboard and outboard adjustor knobs, Tri-Align Caliper Positioning System, and integrated Cable Stop spring tension adjustment ensures that our standard is everyone elses goal.", "text": "Avid BB7 MTB G2 Front or Rear Rotor The mechanical advantage is yours. With gobs of beautifully modulated power and intuitive easy-to-use adjustability, the BB7s set the standard in the realm of mechanical disc brakes. Inboard and outboard adjustor knobs, Tri-Align Caliper Positioning System, and integrated Cable Stop spring tension adjustment ensures that our standard is everyone elses goal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BF%2B%2B1s1bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TV7FHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Rotors"]], "price": 60.99}}
{"item_id": "B003TWG1IQ", "title": "Allen Company Rock Creek Neoprene Stocking Foot Waders", "description": "If our products fail dues to a manufactureing defect, the Allen Company will repair or replace them at our discretion, free of charge for a period of one year from the date of purchase as shown on your sales receipt. This warrenty does not cover abuse, improper care, accidents or the normal breakdown of materials over time. All defective or damaged waders or boots should be returned to the Allen Company, or taken to the dealer where they were purchased with a proof of purchase for evaluation.", "text": "Allen Company Rock Creek Neoprene Stocking Foot Waders If our products fail dues to a manufactureing defect, the Allen Company will repair or replace them at our discretion, free of charge for a period of one year from the date of purchase as shown on your sales receipt. This warrenty does not cover abuse, improper care, accidents or the normal breakdown of materials over time. All defective or damaged waders or boots should be returned to the Allen Company, or taken to the dealer where they were purchased with a proof of purchase for evaluation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P4VMuYoSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWG1IQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Boots Waders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TWR78Y", "title": "Allen Company Gun Cleaning Patches (200 Pieces)for 12 and 16 Gauge Shotguns", "description": "GUN CLEANING PATCHES", "text": "Allen Company Gun Cleaning Patches (200 Pieces)for 12 and 16 Gauge Shotguns GUN CLEANING PATCHES", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q%2BqBkQC7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWR78Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.29}}
{"item_id": "B003TWSZ6W", "title": "Allen Company Canyon Hydration Pack (Realtree Ap)", "description": "This lightweight pack, is not light on capacity. With two large compartments, straps, bungies, and Buddy-Lock attachment points, you can carry a lot! The lower compartment can be removed from the back pack, and used as a fanny pack on it's own. Three packs in one!", "text": "Allen Company Canyon Hydration Pack (Realtree Ap) This lightweight pack, is not light on capacity. With two large compartments, straps, bungies, and Buddy-Lock attachment points, you can carry a lot! The lower compartment can be removed from the back pack, and used as a fanny pack on it's own. Three packs in one!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IpA5cAdaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWSZ6W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003TWTDIQ", "title": "Allen Company Sling Swivel Set for 1-Inch Slings with Hardware for Ruger Rifles with Barrel Band", "description": "Swivel Set For Ruger Rifles With Barrel Bands, Designed For Slings 1\" Wide Specifications: - Swivel set fits ruger .10/.22, ruger mini-30, ruger mini-14, etc. without hardware installed - Contains necessary hardware to install swivels on ruger guns with barrel bands - Threaded stud designed for installing into wood or synthetic stocks is include for the buttstock attachment - Specially designed fore end stud that mates with the barrel band is included - Color: Black", "text": "Allen Company Sling Swivel Set for 1-Inch Slings with Hardware for Ruger Rifles with Barrel Band Swivel Set For Ruger Rifles With Barrel Bands, Designed For Slings 1\" Wide Specifications: - Swivel set fits ruger .10/.22, ruger mini-30, ruger mini-14, etc. without hardware installed - Contains necessary hardware to install swivels on ruger guns with barrel bands - Threaded stud designed for installing into wood or synthetic stocks is include for the buttstock attachment - Specially designed fore end stud that mates with the barrel band is included - Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NWqsXjkaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWTDIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 14.42}}
