{"item_id": "B003TWVIL6", "title": "Lifetime 90040 Height-Adjustable Portable Basketball System with 44-Inch Backboard", "description": "Fun for the entire family, this portable basketball system can go anywhere. This system features a 44-inch backboard, 3 pieces of black 3-inch round telescoping pole sections, a portable base, and a classic black rim. The backboard, constructed of high-density polyethylene, is durable and rugged to withstand the elements. The rim features a solid steel ring supported by braces and the nylon net is weather resistant to be used in any type of weather. The telescoping pole adjusts the rim height from 7.5 feet to 10.5 feet increments without the use of tools. To stabilize the base, a 27-gallon capacity makes for a stable foundation.Features:Portable basketball system with 44-inch backboardTelescoping hoop with height adjustments to the pole from 7.5 to 10.5 feetRoller base can be filled with sand or 27 gallons of water for stabilizationHigh-density polyethylene plastic impact backboardWeather resistant system and netSimple assembly; no tools requiredPowder-coated rust-resistant steel27-gallon base capacity", "text": "Lifetime 90040 Height-Adjustable Portable Basketball System with 44-Inch Backboard Fun for the entire family, this portable basketball system can go anywhere. This system features a 44-inch backboard, 3 pieces of black 3-inch round telescoping pole sections, a portable base, and a classic black rim. The backboard, constructed of high-density polyethylene, is durable and rugged to withstand the elements. The rim features a solid steel ring supported by braces and the nylon net is weather resistant to be used in any type of weather. The telescoping pole adjusts the rim height from 7.5 feet to 10.5 feet increments without the use of tools. To stabilize the base, a 27-gallon capacity makes for a stable foundation.Features:Portable basketball system with 44-inch backboardTelescoping hoop with height adjustments to the pole from 7.5 to 10.5 feetRoller base can be filled with sand or 27 gallons of water for stabilizationHigh-density polyethylene plastic impact backboardWeather resistant system and netSimple assembly; no tools requiredPowder-coated rust-resistant steel27-gallon base capacity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312ckz1O%2B-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWVIL6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifetime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Basketball Hoops & Goals", "Portable"]], "price": 165.63}}
