{"item_id": "B003TWXA2Q", "title": "UTG Heavy Duty Push Button QD Sling Swivel, 1.25-Inch Loop", "description": "The QD Swing Swivel is made of high-strength steel with a black finish and is produced precisely for optimal fit with universal housing on stock and rails. It's lightweight at only 0.6 ounces with a 1.25-inch loop.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Heavy Duty Push Button QD Sling Swivel, 1.25-Inch Loop The QD Swing Swivel is made of high-strength steel with a black finish and is produced precisely for optimal fit with universal housing on stock and rails. It's lightweight at only 0.6 ounces with a 1.25-inch loop.About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t%2BcNqWiwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWXA2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 4.98}}
