{"item_id": "B003TWZFOC", "title": "UTG Low Profile Riser Mount with 3 slots", "description": "This UTG New Gen, riser mount has a 1.6-inch Picatinny rail with three slots, a low profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .50 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing.Features:New Gen. riser mount for rifles with Picatinny/Weaver rail1 Picatinny rail with 3 slotsSide plate with spring tension for quick and easy installationPrecision machined from aircraft aluminum with matte black anodizing0.50-inch saddle height with see-through designSee-through design allows for the use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 1.6 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 1.6 by 1.6 by 0.7 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Low Profile Riser Mount with 3 slots This UTG New Gen, riser mount has a 1.6-inch Picatinny rail with three slots, a low profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .50 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing.Features:New Gen. riser mount for rifles with Picatinny/Weaver rail1 Picatinny rail with 3 slotsSide plate with spring tension for quick and easy installationPrecision machined from aircraft aluminum with matte black anodizing0.50-inch saddle height with see-through designSee-through design allows for the use of the original iron sightsSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 1.6 ouncesPieces: 1Rail Type: Picatinny/WeaverNo. of Rails: 1Dimensions: 1.6 by 1.6 by 0.7 inches (L x W x H)About UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tsntzMw1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWZFOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 9.3}}
