{"item_id": "B003TWZHQ8", "title": "UTG Detachable Swivel with Picatinny Mounting Base", "description": "This Detachable Sling Swivel from UTG offers a reliable base for your sling with a solid steel 1.25-inch sling swivel built on an aircraft grade aluminum base with a black matte finish. Thanks to its ergonomic thumb nut retention design, the sling swivel mounts without tools on any Picatinny or Weaver rail.The swivel installs on any Picatinny or Weaver rail.", "text": "UTG Detachable Swivel with Picatinny Mounting Base This Detachable Sling Swivel from UTG offers a reliable base for your sling with a solid steel 1.25-inch sling swivel built on an aircraft grade aluminum base with a black matte finish. Thanks to its ergonomic thumb nut retention design, the sling swivel mounts without tools on any Picatinny or Weaver rail.The swivel installs on any Picatinny or Weaver rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y%2BNi55O7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TWZHQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 12.33}}
