{"item_id": "B003TX2CU6", "title": "UTG 4X32 TS F.S. Mil-dot Scope with Picatinny and Weaver Rings, Pre-adjusted at 100 Yards", "description": "The scope has a W/E adjustment knob with finger-controlled cylinder wheel for positive clicks, and a screw-on cap.This scope from UTG offers outstanding clarity. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.Precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment is controlled by wear-resistant, finger-adjustable turrets. An integrated front sunshade helps keep your shots on target in bright conditions, and the scope comes complete with flip-open lens cap and AccuShot Picatinny/Weaver rings.Specifications4X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter32-millimeter objective diameter34' field of view at 100 yards3.2-inch eye reliefEight-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards300-millimeter length10.8-ounce weight100-yard parallax settingWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "UTG 4X32 TS F.S. Mil-dot Scope with Picatinny and Weaver Rings, Pre-adjusted at 100 Yards The scope has a W/E adjustment knob with finger-controlled cylinder wheel for positive clicks, and a screw-on cap.This scope from UTG offers outstanding clarity. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.Precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment is controlled by wear-resistant, finger-adjustable turrets. An integrated front sunshade helps keep your shots on target in bright conditions, and the scope comes complete with flip-open lens cap and AccuShot Picatinny/Weaver rings.Specifications4X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter32-millimeter objective diameter34' field of view at 100 yards3.2-inch eye reliefEight-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards300-millimeter length10.8-ounce weight100-yard parallax settingWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318ZkEa2QxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TX2CU6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 41.0}}
