{"item_id": "B003TY3COK", "title": "Leatherman Premium Leather Nylon Sheath I", "description": "This full leather sheath features a snap closure, elastic side pockets on each side for cylindrical accessories, and an elastic pocket in the back of the sheath for a bit kit. This sheath can be carried on a vertical belt up to 2 in wide or horizontally on a 1.5 in wide belt.", "text": "Leatherman Premium Leather Nylon Sheath I This full leather sheath features a snap closure, elastic side pockets on each side for cylindrical accessories, and an elastic pocket in the back of the sheath for a bit kit. This sheath can be carried on a vertical belt up to 2 in wide or horizontally on a 1.5 in wide belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QjFRNn3kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TY3COK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 7.51}}
{"item_id": "B003TYB3F0", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 29\" Stealth Black Molle Scabbard For Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12/20 Gauge Shotgun", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear 29\" tactical molle shotgun stealth Black scabbard designed to fit Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12/20 Gauge Shotgun. Constructed of high performance ballistic nylon that is completely padded to ensure safety and sturdiness under the most vigorous conditions while effectively protecting your shotgun. This also features a built in drain grommet to prevent water and debris build up. Expertly crafted modular webbing on both sides of the scabbard with detachable attachment straps for ambidextrous usage (right or left handed) . Conveniently designed for both shoulder carry or modular mounting with D-Ring locations for attaching the shoulder sling to accommodate your tactical preference. A favorite with Military and Law Enforcement.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 29\" Stealth Black Molle Scabbard For Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12/20 Gauge Shotgun Official Ultimate Arms Gear 29\" tactical molle shotgun stealth Black scabbard designed to fit Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12/20 Gauge Shotgun. Constructed of high performance ballistic nylon that is completely padded to ensure safety and sturdiness under the most vigorous conditions while effectively protecting your shotgun. This also features a built in drain grommet to prevent water and debris build up. Expertly crafted modular webbing on both sides of the scabbard with detachable attachment straps for ambidextrous usage (right or left handed) . Conveniently designed for both shoulder carry or modular mounting with D-Ring locations for attaching the shoulder sling to accommodate your tactical preference. A favorite with Military and Law Enforcement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZFujpiUzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TYB3F0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B003TYCVKG", "title": "Ultimate Body Press Joist Mounted Pull Up Bar", "description": "Ready to do some pull-ups but aren't crazy about doorway pull-up bars? Turn to this joist-mounted model, which bolts to the front of your exposed ceiling joists. Shipped with mounting hardware and installation instructions, the pull-up bar is much steadier than doorway versions. As a result, you can pull yourself up without wobbling or swaying, and without having to dip your head to avoid the door jamb. The bar also offers several grip types--including wide grips, narrow grips, and parallel grips--that support a variety of upper body exercises. Exercise options include everything from wide-grip pull-ups to chin-ups to weighted pull-ups. Each grip is made of textured knurled steel with padded foam to cushion the hand.", "text": "Ultimate Body Press Joist Mounted Pull Up Bar Ready to do some pull-ups but aren't crazy about doorway pull-up bars? Turn to this joist-mounted model, which bolts to the front of your exposed ceiling joists. Shipped with mounting hardware and installation instructions, the pull-up bar is much steadier than doorway versions. As a result, you can pull yourself up without wobbling or swaying, and without having to dip your head to avoid the door jamb. The bar also offers several grip types--including wide grips, narrow grips, and parallel grips--that support a variety of upper body exercises. Exercise options include everything from wide-grip pull-ups to chin-ups to weighted pull-ups. Each grip is made of textured knurled steel with padded foam to cushion the hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NUqTQIQzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TYCVKG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 63.53}}
{"item_id": "B003TYJMV2", "title": "Ultimate Body Press Wall Mounted Pull Up Bar", "description": "Ready to do some pull-ups but aren't crazy about doorway pull-up bars? Turn to this gym-quality wall-mounted model, which bolts securely to your wall studs. Shipped with mounting hardware and installation instructions, the pull-up bar is much steadier than doorway versions. As a result, you can pull yourself up without wobbling or swaying, and without having to dip your head to avoid the door jamb. The bar also offers several grip types--including wide grips, narrow grips, and parallel grips--that support a variety of upper body exercises. Exercise options include everything from wide-grip pull-ups to chin-ups to weighted pull-ups. Construction details include a heavy-duty steel frame, textured knurled steel grips with padded foam, and a gunmetal gray powder-coated finish.", "text": "Ultimate Body Press Wall Mounted Pull Up Bar Ready to do some pull-ups but aren't crazy about doorway pull-up bars? Turn to this gym-quality wall-mounted model, which bolts securely to your wall studs. Shipped with mounting hardware and installation instructions, the pull-up bar is much steadier than doorway versions. As a result, you can pull yourself up without wobbling or swaying, and without having to dip your head to avoid the door jamb. The bar also offers several grip types--including wide grips, narrow grips, and parallel grips--that support a variety of upper body exercises. Exercise options include everything from wide-grip pull-ups to chin-ups to weighted pull-ups. Construction details include a heavy-duty steel frame, textured knurled steel grips with padded foam, and a gunmetal gray powder-coated finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l7GNja35L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TYJMV2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 59.66}}
{"item_id": "B003TZP1W0", "title": "Crank Brothers Candy 2 Hangtag Bike Pedal", "description": "Aluminum body with chromoly spindle and stamped steel wings perfect for all mountain application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner bushing bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "text": "Crank Brothers Candy 2 Hangtag Bike Pedal Aluminum body with chromoly spindle and stamped steel wings perfect for all mountain application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner bushing bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HO81GIpxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003TZP1W0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B003U0B8VM", "title": "Aluminum Canteen Cup Stove / Stand", "description": "Silver Canteen Cup/MRE Meals Stove Stand - Aluminum. Silver Colored. MIL-S-44221A. For use with canteen cup to heat liquids, MREs and more. Easy storage..the stove nests conveniently around the canteen cup. Includes instructions. Product Dimensions: Height: 2.6\", Top width: 5\", Bottom width: 4.5\", Depth of top center: 2.6\", Depth of top sides: 2.5\", Material thickness: .8mm. Ideal for campers, survivalist, hunters, etc. Army Style. Military Style. GI - Government Issued Style.", "text": "Aluminum Canteen Cup Stove / Stand Silver Canteen Cup/MRE Meals Stove Stand - Aluminum. Silver Colored. MIL-S-44221A. For use with canteen cup to heat liquids, MREs and more. Easy storage..the stove nests conveniently around the canteen cup. Includes instructions. Product Dimensions: Height: 2.6\", Top width: 5\", Bottom width: 4.5\", Depth of top center: 2.6\", Depth of top sides: 2.5\", Material thickness: .8mm. Ideal for campers, survivalist, hunters, etc. Army Style. Military Style. GI - Government Issued Style.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KLdAwuGEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003U0B8VM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 9.51}}
{"item_id": "B003U2L47S", "title": "Aurorae - Eva Foam Yoga Block, 4-inch Extra Wide, Eco-safe and Biodegradable", "description": "Aurorae - Eva Foam Yoga Block, 4-Inch Extra Wide, Eco-Safe and BiodegradableAurorae Eva foam blocks are made from sturdy, scratch resistant eva foam.Each block has beveled edges for added comfort.You will find these blocks to be very strong and durable, and yet incredibly lightweight 5.8 oz. and easy to carry.Foam blocks lend support and extension to yoga postures. They provide the support and/or height needed to do poses safely and effectively. When placed under the hips, hands, heels, or between the hands, they provide the stability and grounding needed to extend fully.Helps ground your lower hand in standing poses or support hips in bridge poseSupports Iyengar, Anasura, Ashtanga, restorative, and power yogaEasily cleaned by wiping with damp cloth or spray with Aurorae Yoga Mat wash and wipe dry.This Block is Eco-Safe and has been SGS approved, the world's largest testing, inspection and Verification Company for certification and your safety. Free from Phthalates.Don't be fooled by other inexpensive blocks. Aurorae stands for Quality and Service and our #1 concern is developing the best possible product to make your Yoga experience as pleasant as possible.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\"Thank you for your Loyalty and Support. Namaste Dennis Ingui President/Founder AuroraeCheck out our other yoga products: Yoga Mats, Slip Free Rosin Bags and 100% cotton Towel, Premium Denim Yoga Saks, Mat Wash, Natural Yoga Straps and more to come.", "text": "Aurorae - Eva Foam Yoga Block, 4-inch Extra Wide, Eco-safe and Biodegradable Aurorae - Eva Foam Yoga Block, 4-Inch Extra Wide, Eco-Safe and BiodegradableAurorae Eva foam blocks are made from sturdy, scratch resistant eva foam.Each block has beveled edges for added comfort.You will find these blocks to be very strong and durable, and yet incredibly lightweight 5.8 oz. and easy to carry.Foam blocks lend support and extension to yoga postures. They provide the support and/or height needed to do poses safely and effectively. When placed under the hips, hands, heels, or between the hands, they provide the stability and grounding needed to extend fully.Helps ground your lower hand in standing poses or support hips in bridge poseSupports Iyengar, Anasura, Ashtanga, restorative, and power yogaEasily cleaned by wiping with damp cloth or spray with Aurorae Yoga Mat wash and wipe dry.This Block is Eco-Safe and has been SGS approved, the world's largest testing, inspection and Verification Company for certification and your safety. Free from Phthalates.Don't be fooled by other inexpensive blocks. Aurorae stands for Quality and Service and our #1 concern is developing the best possible product to make your Yoga experience as pleasant as possible.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\"Thank you for your Loyalty and Support. Namaste Dennis Ingui President/Founder AuroraeCheck out our other yoga products: Yoga Mats, Slip Free Rosin Bags and 100% cotton Towel, Premium Denim Yoga Saks, Mat Wash, Natural Yoga Straps and more to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pDnxyQnkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003U2L47S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Blocks"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B003U2OMSG", "title": "Aurorae Organic Yoga Mat Wash-Cleans, Restores, Refreshes and Disinfects your Yoga Mat, Biodegradable. USDA approved, Made in USA.", "description": "Yoga Mat Wash by Aurorae - Cleans, Restores, Refreshes and Disinfects your Yoga mat, 100% Organic,BiodegradableAurorae's certified Organic cleaning solution is formulated with essential oils to keep your yoga mat clean, disinfected and smelling fresh.It is phosphate-free, biodegradable and hypoallergenic and does not contain alcohol or any other drying ingredients that will degrade your yoga mat.It will remove sweat, dirt and other impurities to allow you to get the most out of your practice as well as keep you safe from any bacteria.To keep your mat clean and fresh spray your Aurorae Yoga Mat Cleaner directly onto the mat and let soak for a few minutes then wipe or air dry. Do as needed after use. This will disinfect, restore and keep your mat fresh and clean. Your mat must be dry before use.Ingredients: Saponified organic oils of coconut, olive and jojoba, natural essential oil blend, organic aloe vera and rosemary extract.Don't be fooled by other inexpensive cleaners. Aurorae Stands for Quality and Service. Our #1 concern is to develop the best possible products to make your Yoga experience as pleasant as possible.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\" Thank you for your Loyalty and Support. Namaste Dennis Ingui President/Founder AuroraeCheck out other yoga products by Aurorae: Yoga Mats, Slip Free Rosin Bags and 100% cotton Towel, Premium Denim Yoga Saks, Yoga Straps, Yoga Blocks and more to come.", "text": "Aurorae Organic Yoga Mat Wash-Cleans, Restores, Refreshes and Disinfects your Yoga Mat, Biodegradable. USDA approved, Made in USA. Yoga Mat Wash by Aurorae - Cleans, Restores, Refreshes and Disinfects your Yoga mat, 100% Organic,BiodegradableAurorae's certified Organic cleaning solution is formulated with essential oils to keep your yoga mat clean, disinfected and smelling fresh.It is phosphate-free, biodegradable and hypoallergenic and does not contain alcohol or any other drying ingredients that will degrade your yoga mat.It will remove sweat, dirt and other impurities to allow you to get the most out of your practice as well as keep you safe from any bacteria.To keep your mat clean and fresh spray your Aurorae Yoga Mat Cleaner directly onto the mat and let soak for a few minutes then wipe or air dry. Do as needed after use. This will disinfect, restore and keep your mat fresh and clean. Your mat must be dry before use.Ingredients: Saponified organic oils of coconut, olive and jojoba, natural essential oil blend, organic aloe vera and rosemary extract.Don't be fooled by other inexpensive cleaners. Aurorae Stands for Quality and Service. Our #1 concern is to develop the best possible products to make your Yoga experience as pleasant as possible.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\" Thank you for your Loyalty and Support. Namaste Dennis Ingui President/Founder AuroraeCheck out other yoga products by Aurorae: Yoga Mats, Slip Free Rosin Bags and 100% cotton Towel, Premium Denim Yoga Saks, Yoga Straps, Yoga Blocks and more to come.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jvlYn0C1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003U2OMSG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga"]], "price": 11.95}}
