{"item_id": "B003U7SC6O", "title": "MTECH USA MT-086 Fixed Blade Knife 12.25 Overall", "description": "This Jungle Survival Knife has a thick, full tang 440 stainless steel blade that is extremely sharp. Its rugged handle is designed for extra grip and fits perfectly in your hand. Complete with protective carrying case, this survival knife is a must have out in the wilderness.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-086 Fixed Blade Knife 12.25 Overall This Jungle Survival Knife has a thick, full tang 440 stainless steel blade that is extremely sharp. Its rugged handle is designed for extra grip and fits perfectly in your hand. Complete with protective carrying case, this survival knife is a must have out in the wilderness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ky4V8M3EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003U7SC6O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.0}}
{"item_id": "B003U88S12", "title": "Sentry Solutions TUF-GLIDE Pump Spray", "description": "Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "text": "Sentry Solutions TUF-GLIDE Pump Spray Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hK0f5LgGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003U88S12.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
