{"item_id": "B003UA3KZO", "title": "MSE Life Jacket Polycarbonate Protection for Pump/Auto Shotguns", "description": "LJ3 Life Jacket features a specially designed chamber lock that plugs right into the chamber of pump and auto shotguns eliminating accidental firing.", "text": "MSE Life Jacket Polycarbonate Protection for Pump/Auto Shotguns LJ3 Life Jacket features a specially designed chamber lock that plugs right into the chamber of pump and auto shotguns eliminating accidental firing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314nQxAwtML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UA3KZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B003UAIQ1C", "title": "Stansport Pack Grill (12.5x6.5 -Inch)", "description": "Pack Grill is made of heavy gauge chrome plated steel. It has durable legs that fold up for easy storage and portability. Grill surface 12-1/2 -Inch length X 6-1/2 -Inch wide.", "text": "Stansport Pack Grill (12.5x6.5 -Inch) Pack Grill is made of heavy gauge chrome plated steel. It has durable legs that fold up for easy storage and portability. Grill surface 12-1/2 -Inch length X 6-1/2 -Inch wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JmaQFvJIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UAIQ1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 10.72}}
{"item_id": "B003UE2FGA", "title": "Tactical Quick Detach LED Flashlight For PX4 SIG P220 P226 Glock 17 21 32 Taurus 24/7 Ruger SR9 P95", "description": "Features: Tactical Quick Detach 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For PX4 SIG P220 P226 Glock 17 21 32 Taurus 24/7 OSS Ruger SR9 P95 - Color: Matte black, Weight: 2.5 Ounces, Length: 3-1/8\", Height: 1-1/2\", Width: 1-1/4\", Output: Approx 150 lumens, Integral quick-detach mount will fit most any Picatinny/Weaver style scope mount and tactical rail systems on pistols, rifles and shotguns. Push button on/off activation switch, Uses common CR123 lithium battery. New LED technology gives you 50x longer life span than standard flashlight bulbs and up to 10x more battery life. Includes battery. Built to withstand heavy shock and recoil. Brand New. Manufacture Warranty Against Defects", "text": "Tactical Quick Detach LED Flashlight For PX4 SIG P220 P226 Glock 17 21 32 Taurus 24/7 Ruger SR9 P95 Features: Tactical Quick Detach 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For PX4 SIG P220 P226 Glock 17 21 32 Taurus 24/7 OSS Ruger SR9 P95 - Color: Matte black, Weight: 2.5 Ounces, Length: 3-1/8\", Height: 1-1/2\", Width: 1-1/4\", Output: Approx 150 lumens, Integral quick-detach mount will fit most any Picatinny/Weaver style scope mount and tactical rail systems on pistols, rifles and shotguns. Push button on/off activation switch, Uses common CR123 lithium battery. New LED technology gives you 50x longer life span than standard flashlight bulbs and up to 10x more battery life. Includes battery. Built to withstand heavy shock and recoil. Brand New. Manufacture Warranty Against Defects", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412Az3emERL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UE2FGA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "m1surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 38.25}}
{"item_id": "B003UGSS64", "title": "Galco Speed Paddle Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield", "description": "Featuring an open top design for speed, covered trigger guard for safety, and tension screw adjustment for added security, the Speed Paddle adds convenient on/off ability to the equation. This holster also includes Galco’s patented copolymer injection-molded belt-lock paddle, which makes it possible to put on and take off this holster without removing your belt. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Speed Paddle fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Available for double-action revolvers and compact autos, the Speed Paddle is available in right or left hand designs, in tan or black finish.", "text": "Galco Speed Paddle Holster for 1911 5-Inch Colt, Kimber, Para, Springfield Featuring an open top design for speed, covered trigger guard for safety, and tension screw adjustment for added security, the Speed Paddle adds convenient on/off ability to the equation. This holster also includes Galco’s patented copolymer injection-molded belt-lock paddle, which makes it possible to put on and take off this holster without removing your belt. Constructed of premium saddle leather, the Speed Paddle fits belts up to 1 3/4\". Available for double-action revolvers and compact autos, the Speed Paddle is available in right or left hand designs, in tan or black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dZcDvYxUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UGSS64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 78.99}}
{"item_id": "B003UHZHEO", "title": "Viridian C5L Universal Sub-Compact Green Laser Sight with Tactical Light", "description": "Nothing knocks the fight out of bad guys like the sudden appearance of a C5L-equipped sub-compact green laser sight. The always-brilliant green laser says \"Don't mess with me\" 24 hours a day. The 100-lumen tactical light illuminates a dark environment while also producing an eye-dazzling 140-lumen strobe that disorients even the most determined attacker. The laser's unlimited on-the-fly modes make it easy to program your C5L, giving you a fistful of deterrence in any situation. The world's first subcompact-mountable green laser/light also fits neatly between your muzzle and trigger guard, with no overhang to slow your draw or weigh you down. Most importantly, the C5L's flawless snag-free fit and uncompromising performance create a targeting impact that nothing else can touch.SpecificationsBeam intensity/wavelength: 5 mW peak, 532 nm, Class IIIA, continuous waveLaser beam divergence: 1.2 mradSpot size: Approximately 0.5 inches in diameter at 50 feetRange: Up to 100 yards in daylight, up to 2 miles at nightUser-adjustable: Yes, full windage and elevationConstruction: Primarily 6061 aircraft-grade aluminum; front and rear covers in high-strength Zytel polymerPower source: Single CR2 3-volt lithium battery (included)Battery life: 4-plus hours laser (constant), 7-plus hours (pulsing), 1-plus hour (tac light and laser)Installation: Slides onto tactical rail, locks with mounting screwActivation and modes: Ambidextrous with SmartLaser technology; constant beam and multiple pulsing modesDimensions: 1.3 by 1.46 by 1.9 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2.344 ouncesIncluded accessories: CR2 battery, 3 unique rail sets, 1 rail set pin removal tool, 2 adjustment wrenches, 2 mounting screws, user's manual", "text": "Viridian C5L Universal Sub-Compact Green Laser Sight with Tactical Light Nothing knocks the fight out of bad guys like the sudden appearance of a C5L-equipped sub-compact green laser sight. The always-brilliant green laser says \"Don't mess with me\" 24 hours a day. The 100-lumen tactical light illuminates a dark environment while also producing an eye-dazzling 140-lumen strobe that disorients even the most determined attacker. The laser's unlimited on-the-fly modes make it easy to program your C5L, giving you a fistful of deterrence in any situation. The world's first subcompact-mountable green laser/light also fits neatly between your muzzle and trigger guard, with no overhang to slow your draw or weigh you down. Most importantly, the C5L's flawless snag-free fit and uncompromising performance create a targeting impact that nothing else can touch.SpecificationsBeam intensity/wavelength: 5 mW peak, 532 nm, Class IIIA, continuous waveLaser beam divergence: 1.2 mradSpot size: Approximately 0.5 inches in diameter at 50 feetRange: Up to 100 yards in daylight, up to 2 miles at nightUser-adjustable: Yes, full windage and elevationConstruction: Primarily 6061 aircraft-grade aluminum; front and rear covers in high-strength Zytel polymerPower source: Single CR2 3-volt lithium battery (included)Battery life: 4-plus hours laser (constant), 7-plus hours (pulsing), 1-plus hour (tac light and laser)Installation: Slides onto tactical rail, locks with mounting screwActivation and modes: Ambidextrous with SmartLaser technology; constant beam and multiple pulsing modesDimensions: 1.3 by 1.46 by 1.9 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 2.344 ouncesIncluded accessories: CR2 battery, 3 unique rail sets, 1 rail set pin removal tool, 2 adjustment wrenches, 2 mounting screws, user's manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bH1zX6U6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UHZHEO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Viridian Green Laser Sights", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 248.0}}
{"item_id": "B003UI1K8U", "title": "Laserlyte NAA-PB North American Arms Pistol Bayonet", "description": "LaserLyte, in association with Ka-BAR, offers the first pistol bayonet for select North American Arms pistols. The razor-sharp, 1.85-inch Ka-BAR blade fits all North American Arms mini revolvers with round cylinder pins and is the smallest pistol bayonet and revolver combo on the market. This next generation in LaserLyte's tremendously popular pistol bayonet collection is a must-have for North American Arms owners and is sure to turn some heads at the range.", "text": "Laserlyte NAA-PB North American Arms Pistol Bayonet LaserLyte, in association with Ka-BAR, offers the first pistol bayonet for select North American Arms pistols. The razor-sharp, 1.85-inch Ka-BAR blade fits all North American Arms mini revolvers with round cylinder pins and is the smallest pistol bayonet and revolver combo on the market. This next generation in LaserLyte's tremendously popular pistol bayonet collection is a must-have for North American Arms owners and is sure to turn some heads at the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L1PPjUSXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UI1K8U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003UI370Y", "title": "Insight M3 LED Weapon Light", "description": "The M3 LED is now equipped with a more powerful LED for greater illumination and longer run time. It features a patented Slide-Lock interface for easy tool-free mounting and dismounting to the firearm rail and a limited lifetime warranty. With a peak output of 125 Lumens and runtime of 120 minutes, its no wonder that the M3 has been the gold standard in weapon-mounted illuminators since it was first introduced in 1998.", "text": "Insight M3 LED Weapon Light The M3 LED is now equipped with a more powerful LED for greater illumination and longer run time. It features a patented Slide-Lock interface for easy tool-free mounting and dismounting to the firearm rail and a limited lifetime warranty. With a peak output of 125 Lumens and runtime of 120 minutes, its no wonder that the M3 has been the gold standard in weapon-mounted illuminators since it was first introduced in 1998.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41du8C1ihBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UI370Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003UKIEUA", "title": "Ultra-Visible Two-Color LED Bike Tail Light Flasher - Visible 2500 Feet", "description": "This is one flasher that's going to get noticed! Unique dual-color polycarbonate lens has special 'focus spots' that magnify the intensity of the super-bright LED. Plus, tiny refractive dots molded inside the lens create extra sparkle to increase your visibility from angle. Attaches in seconds to bike handlebars or seat post - mount included - and when you're done with your ride, push the release lever to remove. Use the built-in belt/pocket clip and you'll have high-visibility walking, running or other activities. Seven light settings include constant on, slow/fast flash, slow/fast side-to-side running. Dimensions: 5\"W x 2\"H x 1-1/2\"D (without bike mount); weight 2 oz/4 oz with/without 2 AA batteries (not included).", "text": "Ultra-Visible Two-Color LED Bike Tail Light Flasher - Visible 2500 Feet This is one flasher that's going to get noticed! Unique dual-color polycarbonate lens has special 'focus spots' that magnify the intensity of the super-bright LED. Plus, tiny refractive dots molded inside the lens create extra sparkle to increase your visibility from angle. Attaches in seconds to bike handlebars or seat post - mount included - and when you're done with your ride, push the release lever to remove. Use the built-in belt/pocket clip and you'll have high-visibility walking, running or other activities. Seven light settings include constant on, slow/fast flash, slow/fast side-to-side running. Dimensions: 5\"W x 2\"H x 1-1/2\"D (without bike mount); weight 2 oz/4 oz with/without 2 AA batteries (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zsnP%2B71hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UKIEUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProTool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 1.49}}
