{"item_id": "B003UV376U", "title": "Compact Modular Hydration Backpack", "description": "Key features of this compact modular hydration backpack include single large main compartment and one outside pocket with inside mesh accessory pockets. The hydration pocket includes Velcro closure and is complete with 2.5 liter bladder, hose and bite valve assembly. Fully expandable design includes modular attachment points on front face of pack. Pack material is tactical polyester with heavy duty zippers and hardware. Stay-cool mesh backing, carrying handle and fully adjustable mesh-backed shoulder straps. Approximate Size: 17\" x 8\" x 5\".This compact modular hydration backpack is available in Olive Drab, Black, Digital Woodland, Coyote, Multicam*, and Army Digital colors and patterns.*Genuine Multicam fabric is manufactured exclusively by Duro Industries and consists of heavyweight Cordura Nylon.", "text": "Compact Modular Hydration Backpack Key features of this compact modular hydration backpack include single large main compartment and one outside pocket with inside mesh accessory pockets. The hydration pocket includes Velcro closure and is complete with 2.5 liter bladder, hose and bite valve assembly. Fully expandable design includes modular attachment points on front face of pack. Pack material is tactical polyester with heavy duty zippers and hardware. Stay-cool mesh backing, carrying handle and fully adjustable mesh-backed shoulder straps. Approximate Size: 17\" x 8\" x 5\".This compact modular hydration backpack is available in Olive Drab, Black, Digital Woodland, Coyote, Multicam*, and Army Digital colors and patterns.*Genuine Multicam fabric is manufactured exclusively by Duro Industries and consists of heavyweight Cordura Nylon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ildClq9GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UV376U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 40.96}}
{"item_id": "B003UV9PV6", "title": "Walnut Hollow Deluxe Antler Display Kit, Pine", "description": "Deluxe Antler Display Kit includes everything needed for creating an antler display on a 9 x 12\" solid Pine Crest Plaque with satin lacquer finish.", "text": "Walnut Hollow Deluxe Antler Display Kit, Pine Deluxe Antler Display Kit includes everything needed for creating an antler display on a 9 x 12\" solid Pine Crest Plaque with satin lacquer finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mMP5lfvYL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UV9PV6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walnut Hollow Country", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Trophy Mounts"]], "price": 35.74}}
