{"item_id": "B003UX6T36", "title": "M-tech Usa Leather Ribbed Stainless Steel Survival Knife", "description": "This MTech Combat Knife is made along the lines of the famous World War II fighting knives made by KA-Bar. It is 12 inches overall, with a 6.5 inch stainless steel blade with leather constructed handle and flat pommel. Includes leather sheath to compliment the leather handle, this knife is built to last.", "text": "M-tech Usa Leather Ribbed Stainless Steel Survival Knife This MTech Combat Knife is made along the lines of the famous World War II fighting knives made by KA-Bar. It is 12 inches overall, with a 6.5 inch stainless steel blade with leather constructed handle and flat pommel. Includes leather sheath to compliment the leather handle, this knife is built to last.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-CBYVJ3aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UX6T36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B003UY9CCK", "title": "Pyramex Goliath Safety Eyewear", "description": "Wrap-around, sunglass style fits all facial sizes. First class optical lens provides unrestricted vision. Lightweight, contemporary frame is comfortable for both working envirnoments and recreational activites. Rubber temples prevent slipping.", "text": "Pyramex Goliath Safety Eyewear Wrap-around, sunglass style fits all facial sizes. First class optical lens provides unrestricted vision. Lightweight, contemporary frame is comfortable for both working envirnoments and recreational activites. Rubber temples prevent slipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cWHol%2BciL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003UY9CCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pyramex Safety", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 6.98}}
{"item_id": "B003V0KHBS", "title": "New Black Concealed Belly Band Holster Medium Size for Waist 30\" to 38\"", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. Elastic waist band holster for concealed carry. Ambidextrous design holds your handgun close against your body and can be rotated for left or right hand draw. Fits most revolvers and autos. Features double elastic magazine pouches. Medium size. Fits waist sizes from 30\" to 38\".", "text": "New Black Concealed Belly Band Holster Medium Size for Waist 30\" to 38\" Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. Elastic waist band holster for concealed carry. Ambidextrous design holds your handgun close against your body and can be rotated for left or right hand draw. Fits most revolvers and autos. Features double elastic magazine pouches. Medium size. Fits waist sizes from 30\" to 38\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y-8EdbHrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V0KHBS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003V0N2R4", "title": "Molle Shotgun Ammo Storage Pouch Tactical Field Gear for Airsoft & Hunting", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. This TAIGEAR MOLLE Shotgun Ammo Pouch made from durable polyester with PVC coating. Holds up to 12 shotgun shells. Each shell is secured with an elastic retention strap. Grommet drain hole. This accessory will work on any TAIGEAR MOLLE vest, bag, pack or pouch. TAIGEAR Web System uses a series of interlocking straps to secure accessories in any arrangement. Dimensions: 3 1/2\" (H) x 7 1/4\" (W) x 1 3/4\" (D).", "text": "Molle Shotgun Ammo Storage Pouch Tactical Field Gear for Airsoft & Hunting Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. This TAIGEAR MOLLE Shotgun Ammo Pouch made from durable polyester with PVC coating. Holds up to 12 shotgun shells. Each shell is secured with an elastic retention strap. Grommet drain hole. This accessory will work on any TAIGEAR MOLLE vest, bag, pack or pouch. TAIGEAR Web System uses a series of interlocking straps to secure accessories in any arrangement. Dimensions: 3 1/2\" (H) x 7 1/4\" (W) x 1 3/4\" (D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ayikl4tQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V0N2R4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B003V0WR1Q", "title": "Drop Leg Gun Holster Right Handed", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Drop Leg Holster Durable polyester with PVC coating Pouches can hold 2 magazines and a flashlight Designed for security, comfort and quick draw Compact Design for guns up to 7\" Long. with a width of up to 3 1/2\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 2\". Which Will Fit Most Full Size Pistols", "text": "Drop Leg Gun Holster Right Handed Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Drop Leg Holster Durable polyester with PVC coating Pouches can hold 2 magazines and a flashlight Designed for security, comfort and quick draw Compact Design for guns up to 7\" Long. with a width of up to 3 1/2\" from the top of the barrel to the bottom of the trigger and a thickness of up to 2\". Which Will Fit Most Full Size Pistols", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aZwYnak%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V0WR1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 7.64}}
{"item_id": "B003V0ZN2G", "title": "Dip Stand Angled Dipping Station Bars HD Machine", "description": "The dip exercise is absolutely the most effective bodyweight exercise for increasing chest and tricep strength. This dip stand has extra supports under the arms for a rock solid feel. Also the uprights are 2\" x 3\", not just 2\" x 2\" like most others. Get one and take your workout to the next level. Distance between hand grips: Front- 24\", Back- 20\".", "text": "Dip Stand Angled Dipping Station Bars HD Machine The dip exercise is absolutely the most effective bodyweight exercise for increasing chest and tricep strength. This dip stand has extra supports under the arms for a rock solid feel. Also the uprights are 2\" x 3\", not just 2\" x 2\" like most others. Get one and take your workout to the next level. Distance between hand grips: Front- 24\", Back- 20\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kV1vEscxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V0ZN2G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dip Stands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003V1VKQ8", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Fox 40 Rescue Howler Whistle", "description": "", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Fox 40 Rescue Howler Whistle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cqC0fRSCL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V1VKQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Tools & Home Improvement", "Safety & Security", "Emergency & Survival Kits", "Emergency Survival Kits"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 7.92}}
{"item_id": "B003V1ZN4S", "title": "Triple Eight Certified Rubber Helmet", "description": "Triple Eight is proud to introduce its all new Dual Certified (CPSC bike and ASTM skate) Brainsaver helmet w/ EPS Liner. The new Brainsaver boast a streamlined look on the classic Brainsaver shape. But the changes don’t stop there. Construction of the EPS liner was engineered so that it complies with U.S. CPSC Safety Standard for Bike for ages 5+ AND ASTM F-1492-08 Safety Standards for skateboarding and trick roller skating. Lastly, the shape of the inside of the helmet was designed so it fits a variety of heads with a comfortable fit.To ensure a perfect fit, measure the circumference of your head starting in the middle of your forehead and match it with the sizes below.Size ChartXS/S 18.9-21.3in (48-54cm)S/M 21.7-22.8in (55cm-58cm)L/XL 23.2-24in (59-61cm)", "text": "Triple Eight Certified Rubber Helmet Triple Eight is proud to introduce its all new Dual Certified (CPSC bike and ASTM skate) Brainsaver helmet w/ EPS Liner. The new Brainsaver boast a streamlined look on the classic Brainsaver shape. But the changes don’t stop there. Construction of the EPS liner was engineered so that it complies with U.S. CPSC Safety Standard for Bike for ages 5+ AND ASTM F-1492-08 Safety Standards for skateboarding and trick roller skating. Lastly, the shape of the inside of the helmet was designed so it fits a variety of heads with a comfortable fit.To ensure a perfect fit, measure the circumference of your head starting in the middle of your forehead and match it with the sizes below.Size ChartXS/S 18.9-21.3in (48-54cm)S/M 21.7-22.8in (55cm-58cm)L/XL 23.2-24in (59-61cm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JbcYr42RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V1ZN4S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003V374AW", "title": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle, Standard Mouth, 12-Ounce", "description": "Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "text": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle, Standard Mouth, 12-Ounce Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ehgNEf-JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V374AW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 13.72}}
{"item_id": "B003V3QN90", "title": "Texsport Nylon Stuff Bag (Black, 24-Inch X 12-Inch )", "description": "Texsport nylon stuff bag is 24 x 12-Inch size. Heavy-duty acrylic coated nylon oxford. Drawstring cord lock closure. Rounded bottom.", "text": "Texsport Nylon Stuff Bag (Black, 24-Inch X 12-Inch ) Texsport nylon stuff bag is 24 x 12-Inch size. Heavy-duty acrylic coated nylon oxford. Drawstring cord lock closure. Rounded bottom.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aocc5QfmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V3QN90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Stuff Sacks"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003V3U9JK", "title": "Texsport King Kot Giant Folding Camp Cot (Green, 83-Inch X 35-Inch X 20-Inch )", "description": "Sleep up off the ground with the giant folding King Kot Camp Cot from Texsport. Measuring 83 inches long, 35 inches wide, and 20 inches high, even big and tall campers up to 6-feet, 9-inches can stretch out fully on this cot. Featuring a heavy-duty silver/white oxygenated aluminum frame with a rugged 600 denier water resistant coated nylon cover, the cot has an impressive 350 pound weight limit. Easy to fold up and pack away, the cot comes with a convenient nylon carry/storage bag so that you never have to lose sleep on a leaky air mattress again.What's in the Box?King Kot, nylon carry/storage bag", "text": "Texsport King Kot Giant Folding Camp Cot (Green, 83-Inch X 35-Inch X 20-Inch ) Sleep up off the ground with the giant folding King Kot Camp Cot from Texsport. Measuring 83 inches long, 35 inches wide, and 20 inches high, even big and tall campers up to 6-feet, 9-inches can stretch out fully on this cot. Featuring a heavy-duty silver/white oxygenated aluminum frame with a rugged 600 denier water resistant coated nylon cover, the cot has an impressive 350 pound weight limit. Easy to fold up and pack away, the cot comes with a convenient nylon carry/storage bag so that you never have to lose sleep on a leaky air mattress again.What's in the Box?King Kot, nylon carry/storage bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uFZ9rhsRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V3U9JK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 78.0}}
{"item_id": "B003V56K5U", "title": "SE - Safety Light - Flasher with Bicycle Attachment, Red, 6 Way", "description": "6 Way Flasher with Accessory Red with Bike Attachment. Regtangular Flasher 5 LED Lights 6 Functions: Flashing, Steady & 4 Different Running Lights Includes: Belt Clip, Arm Strap & Bike Attachment Uses 2AA Batteries (Batteries Not Included) 750- 1000 MCD", "text": "SE - Safety Light - Flasher with Bicycle Attachment, Red, 6 Way 6 Way Flasher with Accessory Red with Bike Attachment. Regtangular Flasher 5 LED Lights 6 Functions: Flashing, Steady & 4 Different Running Lights Includes: Belt Clip, Arm Strap & Bike Attachment Uses 2AA Batteries (Batteries Not Included) 750- 1000 MCD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tQh%2BTnTdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V56K5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 4.35}}
{"item_id": "B003V58KSU", "title": "2\" Web Belt Side Release Buckle 2\" X 56\" Heavy Poly Webbing", "description": "", "text": "2\" Web Belt Side Release Buckle 2\" X 56\" Heavy Poly Webbing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410mA6BSBPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V58KSU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 7.7}}
{"item_id": "B003V5FDGM", "title": "Black Mountain Products Pull Up Bar and Resistance Bands", "description": "This combination set of pull-up bar and resistance bands is a compact, comprehensive solution for in-home fitness. The pull-up bar mounts easily to any standard doorframe between 24 and 32 inches wide with a trim up to 3.5 inches, and offers 12 grip positions to help develop your shoulders, back, arms, chest, and abs. Use a wide grip to develop your lats, biceps, and forearm muscles, with narrow grip positions focusing on your lower core.The resistance bands, meanwhile, provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, and the red 25-to-30 pounds.What's in the box?Chin-up barFive resistance bands10 preattached foam handlesDoor anchorCarrying bagWarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Black Mountain Products Pull Up Bar and Resistance Bands This combination set of pull-up bar and resistance bands is a compact, comprehensive solution for in-home fitness. The pull-up bar mounts easily to any standard doorframe between 24 and 32 inches wide with a trim up to 3.5 inches, and offers 12 grip positions to help develop your shoulders, back, arms, chest, and abs. Use a wide grip to develop your lats, biceps, and forearm muscles, with narrow grip positions focusing on your lower core.The resistance bands, meanwhile, provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, and the red 25-to-30 pounds.What's in the box?Chin-up barFive resistance bands10 preattached foam handlesDoor anchorCarrying bagWarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-c%2B%2BtFzDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V5FDGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 61.24}}
{"item_id": "B003V5JQ2O", "title": "Black Mountain Products Heavy Duty Chin Up Bar and Resistance Bands", "description": "This combination set of pull-up bar and resistance bands is a compact, comprehensive solution for in-home fitness. The pull-up bar mounts easily to any standard doorframe between 24 and 32 inches wide with a trim up to 3.5 inches, and offers 12 grip positions to help develop your shoulders, back, arms, chest, and abs. Use a wide grip to develop your lats, biceps, and forearm muscles, with narrow grip positions focusing on your lower core.The resistance bands, meanwhile, provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, and the red 25-to-30 pounds.What's in the box?Chin-up barFive resistance bandsTwo foam handlesAnkle strapDoor anchorCarrying bagWarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Black Mountain Products Heavy Duty Chin Up Bar and Resistance Bands This combination set of pull-up bar and resistance bands is a compact, comprehensive solution for in-home fitness. The pull-up bar mounts easily to any standard doorframe between 24 and 32 inches wide with a trim up to 3.5 inches, and offers 12 grip positions to help develop your shoulders, back, arms, chest, and abs. Use a wide grip to develop your lats, biceps, and forearm muscles, with narrow grip positions focusing on your lower core.The resistance bands, meanwhile, provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, and the red 25-to-30 pounds.What's in the box?Chin-up barFive resistance bandsTwo foam handlesAnkle strapDoor anchorCarrying bagWarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NE-Xm-w%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003V5JQ2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 59.99}}
