{"item_id": "B003VAAY02", "title": "Down Under Knives The Outback Bowie Knife", "description": "Down Under Knives Bowie. 15 7/8\" overall. 10 7/8\" 440C stainless bowie style blade with blood groove. Dual heat treatment - edge hardened 58-59 RC and back hardened 45-46 RC. Genuine ebony, leather and brass handle. Bead blast solid brass finger guard and pommel. Genuine brown leather belt sheath with crocodile skin pattern and sharpening spike.Per Down Under Knives policy, Retailers may not advertise in any retail medium, product pricing below MAP - (Minimum Advertised Price). MAP for this item is $189.95!", "text": "Down Under Knives The Outback Bowie Knife Down Under Knives Bowie. 15 7/8\" overall. 10 7/8\" 440C stainless bowie style blade with blood groove. Dual heat treatment - edge hardened 58-59 RC and back hardened 45-46 RC. Genuine ebony, leather and brass handle. Bead blast solid brass finger guard and pommel. Genuine brown leather belt sheath with crocodile skin pattern and sharpening spike.Per Down Under Knives policy, Retailers may not advertise in any retail medium, product pricing below MAP - (Minimum Advertised Price). MAP for this item is $189.95!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213QT-n0l-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VAAY02.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brand Down Under", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 188.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VAFJGG", "title": "Aqua Lung Admiral Mask Fin Dry Snorkel Set with Snorkeling Gear Bag", "description": "Aqua Lung Sport Admiral 2 LX Mask, Island Dry LX Snorkel & Trek Fin Set Admiral LX Two Lens Mask Silicone face skirt provides the ultimate comfort Tempered glass lens for safety Pinch & pull adjustable buckles Island Dry Flex Snorkel 100% submersible dry top with Pivot Dry Technology One-way purge valve Full flex section Comfortable mouthpiece Trek Open Hell Fins Compact size Comfortable foot pockets Adjustable straps Sizes: S (4-7), M (7-10), L (10-14) Travel Bag Easily carry & store your snorkeling gear & other belongings", "text": "Aqua Lung Admiral Mask Fin Dry Snorkel Set with Snorkeling Gear Bag Aqua Lung Sport Admiral 2 LX Mask, Island Dry LX Snorkel & Trek Fin Set Admiral LX Two Lens Mask Silicone face skirt provides the ultimate comfort Tempered glass lens for safety Pinch & pull adjustable buckles Island Dry Flex Snorkel 100% submersible dry top with Pivot Dry Technology One-way purge valve Full flex section Comfortable mouthpiece Trek Open Hell Fins Compact size Comfortable foot pockets Adjustable straps Sizes: S (4-7), M (7-10), L (10-14) Travel Bag Easily carry & store your snorkeling gear & other belongings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51i-eUbvpBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VAFJGG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VBAVWW", "title": "PALight", "description": "The PALight is an amazing breakthrough in flashlight technology. One of the first units to incorporate LED bulbs, the PALight is extremely powerful while long lasting, saving you money. Coming with a 9 volt battery, the PALight is always on. That's right, it never turns off and it can stay that way for 2 years. The soft and comfortable sanoprene case is both shock and moisture resistant. Shielded internal electronics prevent battery corrosion and extends the life of the flashlight. Weighing in at 3 ounces, this unit is only slightly larger than the 9 volt battery it holds. Limited Lifetime Warranty Guarantees satisfaction with your PALights. Four modes of operation include: Always on--handy to find in the dark Low--Lasts 200 hours in this mode and lights up your path at night 20' in front of you High--excellent brightness can be seen from 1/4 mile and lasts for 20 hours Strobe--high beam flashes every 1.5 seconds preserving battery life while signaling for help. Order yours today.", "text": "PALight The PALight is an amazing breakthrough in flashlight technology. One of the first units to incorporate LED bulbs, the PALight is extremely powerful while long lasting, saving you money. Coming with a 9 volt battery, the PALight is always on. That's right, it never turns off and it can stay that way for 2 years. The soft and comfortable sanoprene case is both shock and moisture resistant. Shielded internal electronics prevent battery corrosion and extends the life of the flashlight. Weighing in at 3 ounces, this unit is only slightly larger than the 9 volt battery it holds. Limited Lifetime Warranty Guarantees satisfaction with your PALights. Four modes of operation include: Always on--handy to find in the dark Low--Lasts 200 hours in this mode and lights up your path at night 20' in front of you High--excellent brightness can be seen from 1/4 mile and lasts for 20 hours Strobe--high beam flashes every 1.5 seconds preserving battery life while signaling for help. Order yours today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mV936OMGL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VBAVWW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VC6HII", "title": "Horizon Fitness Silicone Treadmill Belt Lubricant", "description": "Keep your treadmill performing at its best with proper maintenance. This silicon lubrication will help to extend the life of the belt and electronic components on your machine. One bottle is good for one application. This package comes with 3 bottles good for 3 applications.", "text": "Horizon Fitness Silicone Treadmill Belt Lubricant Keep your treadmill performing at its best with proper maintenance. This silicon lubrication will help to extend the life of the belt and electronic components on your machine. One bottle is good for one application. This package comes with 3 bottles good for 3 applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51S6YW%2Bj5cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VC6HII.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Machine Accessories", "Treadmill Lubricants"]], "price": 16.25}}
{"item_id": "B003VCNC72", "title": "Blackhawk Sportster Large Tactical Rifle Case", "description": "The Blackhawk SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from Blackhawk No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "text": "Blackhawk Sportster Large Tactical Rifle Case The Blackhawk SPORTSTER product line gives you quality shooting gear at a price that fits every budget. From weapon cases and bags to pouches and pistol rugs, Sportster delivers affordability without sacrificing the quality you expect from Blackhawk No matter what your mission, Sportster shooting gear is definitely within range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iyXujddBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VCNC72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 31.63}}
{"item_id": "B003VFAIZI", "title": "Kool Stop Dura 2 Dual Compound Insert", "description": "Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Dura2 insert is a newly designed road pad insert. The pad is thicker than their standard Dura type for longer life. Plus, it has a 7.65 mm contact width for narrow rims and cut outs for reduced weight. Finally, the pads sit flat on the rim for superior modulation. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Dual Compound / Manufacturer's Part Number KS-DR2DL Water Grooves for max stopping power in adverse conditions 7.65 contact width Reduced weight Rim Friendly Compounds", "text": "Kool Stop Dura 2 Dual Compound Insert Stopping is just as important as going in cycling, so why leave that duty up to inferior brake pads? The Kool Stop Dura2 insert is a newly designed road pad insert. The pad is thicker than their standard Dura type for longer life. Plus, it has a 7.65 mm contact width for narrow rims and cut outs for reduced weight. Finally, the pads sit flat on the rim for superior modulation. If you want to go with a pad that you know can handle the responsibility of slowing and stopping, then you'll be glad you chose Kool Stop. Dual Compound / Manufacturer's Part Number KS-DR2DL Water Grooves for max stopping power in adverse conditions 7.65 contact width Reduced weight Rim Friendly Compounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tpbSuo-fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VFAIZI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kool Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads"]], "price": 8.69}}
{"item_id": "B003VFCHLG", "title": "SRAM PC 1091R HollowPin Chain", "description": "SRAM used everything it knew about chain technology to design the PC 1091R Hollow Pin Chain. Hollow Pin technology reduces weight without compromising chain strengthPowerLock allows tool-free chain connection (one-time-use only)More heavily chamfered plates for smoother shifting and a quieter rideNew inner plate finish and chrome-hardened pin construction for increased chain life", "text": "SRAM PC 1091R HollowPin Chain SRAM used everything it knew about chain technology to design the PC 1091R Hollow Pin Chain. Hollow Pin technology reduces weight without compromising chain strengthPowerLock allows tool-free chain connection (one-time-use only)More heavily chamfered plates for smoother shifting and a quieter rideNew inner plate finish and chrome-hardened pin construction for increased chain life", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GkOijwKLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VFCHLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 48.94}}
{"item_id": "B003VFEF6Q", "title": "SRAM PC 1051 Chain", "description": "In SRAM's chain hierarchy, only the PC-1051 and PC-1091 chains are made with corrosion-resistant nickel plating on both the inner and outer links. What's the difference between this PC-1051 and their top of the line PC-1091 then? Where the 1091 has hollow pins, the 1051 uses solid, chrome hardened pins at the link pivots. Sure it's not quite as light, but you'll save enough money to build your wheels with alloy nipples instead. And from a performance standpoint, you'll be money ahead.SRAM has done some subtle reshaping of their outer plates to make their chains run quieter. This PC-1051 is made specifically for 10-speed drivetrains, and like its fancier hollow-pinned relatives, it mates perfectly with the tooth shaping and pickup/release points on SRAM's cassettes and chainrings for flawless shifting performance.You can install a PC-1051 chain without special tools thanks to SRAM's PowerLock connecting link. No other sub-6mm chain in the marketplace shares this feature. And unlike the occasional headaches we're all familiar with when it comes to Shimano HG pins and Wippermann connecting links, the PowerLock link is as strong or stronger than any other link on the chain, and it won't hinder shift quality in the least.The SRAM PC-1051 Chain is compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 10-speed drivetrains. Please note that while the PowerLock installation can be done tool-free, it's recommended to be used only once due to the extremely close tolerances required by the narrow 10-speed design. So if you must break your chain for maintenance reasons, a new 10-speed PowerLock link will be required to reassemble it.Product FeaturesMaterial: nickel-plated steel, chrome-hardened pinsConnection: PowerLock linkWidth:Compatible Components: 10-speedWeight: (114 links) 277 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "SRAM PC 1051 Chain In SRAM's chain hierarchy, only the PC-1051 and PC-1091 chains are made with corrosion-resistant nickel plating on both the inner and outer links. What's the difference between this PC-1051 and their top of the line PC-1091 then? Where the 1091 has hollow pins, the 1051 uses solid, chrome hardened pins at the link pivots. Sure it's not quite as light, but you'll save enough money to build your wheels with alloy nipples instead. And from a performance standpoint, you'll be money ahead.SRAM has done some subtle reshaping of their outer plates to make their chains run quieter. This PC-1051 is made specifically for 10-speed drivetrains, and like its fancier hollow-pinned relatives, it mates perfectly with the tooth shaping and pickup/release points on SRAM's cassettes and chainrings for flawless shifting performance.You can install a PC-1051 chain without special tools thanks to SRAM's PowerLock connecting link. No other sub-6mm chain in the marketplace shares this feature. And unlike the occasional headaches we're all familiar with when it comes to Shimano HG pins and Wippermann connecting links, the PowerLock link is as strong or stronger than any other link on the chain, and it won't hinder shift quality in the least.The SRAM PC-1051 Chain is compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 10-speed drivetrains. Please note that while the PowerLock installation can be done tool-free, it's recommended to be used only once due to the extremely close tolerances required by the narrow 10-speed design. So if you must break your chain for maintenance reasons, a new 10-speed PowerLock link will be required to reassemble it.Product FeaturesMaterial: nickel-plated steel, chrome-hardened pinsConnection: PowerLock linkWidth:Compatible Components: 10-speedWeight: (114 links) 277 gRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fzw1JJiEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VFEF6Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003VFFT1G", "title": "SRAM PC 1031 Chain", "description": "The SRAM PC-1031 Chain is a revamped version of the PC-1030. The only difference is a subtle reshaping of the outer plates to make it run quieter. It's made specifically for 10-speed drivetrains, and like its pricier relatives, it mates perfectly with the tooth shaping and pickup/release points on SRAM's cassettes and chainrings for flawless shifting performance.Two main details differentiate it from their top of the line PC-1091 -- it lacks the hollow pins and nickel plating on both the inner and outer link plates. So the solid pins add some twenty grams or so over a hollow-pinned chain and you'll just need to make sure that you keep your PC-1031 chain well-lubricated and it will serve you well. The chrome-hardened link pins provide all the strength you'll ever need for massive efforts against the pedals. You can install a PC-1031 chain without special tools thanks to SRAM's PowerLock connecting link. No other sub-6mm chain in the marketplace shares this feature. And unlike the occasional headaches we're all familiar with when it comes to Shimano HG pins and Wippermann connecting links, the PowerLock link is as strong or stronger than any other link on the chain, and it won't hinder shift quality in the least.The SRAM PC-1031 Chain is compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 10-speed drivetrains. Please note that while the PowerLock installation can be done tool-free, it's recommended to be used only once due to the extremely close tolerances required by the narrow 10-speed design. So if you must break your chain for maintenance reasons, a new 10-speed PowerLock link will be required to reassemble it.Product FeaturesHASH(0x740298b8)", "text": "SRAM PC 1031 Chain The SRAM PC-1031 Chain is a revamped version of the PC-1030. The only difference is a subtle reshaping of the outer plates to make it run quieter. It's made specifically for 10-speed drivetrains, and like its pricier relatives, it mates perfectly with the tooth shaping and pickup/release points on SRAM's cassettes and chainrings for flawless shifting performance.Two main details differentiate it from their top of the line PC-1091 -- it lacks the hollow pins and nickel plating on both the inner and outer link plates. So the solid pins add some twenty grams or so over a hollow-pinned chain and you'll just need to make sure that you keep your PC-1031 chain well-lubricated and it will serve you well. The chrome-hardened link pins provide all the strength you'll ever need for massive efforts against the pedals. You can install a PC-1031 chain without special tools thanks to SRAM's PowerLock connecting link. No other sub-6mm chain in the marketplace shares this feature. And unlike the occasional headaches we're all familiar with when it comes to Shimano HG pins and Wippermann connecting links, the PowerLock link is as strong or stronger than any other link on the chain, and it won't hinder shift quality in the least.The SRAM PC-1031 Chain is compatible with both SRAM and Shimano 10-speed drivetrains. Please note that while the PowerLock installation can be done tool-free, it's recommended to be used only once due to the extremely close tolerances required by the narrow 10-speed design. So if you must break your chain for maintenance reasons, a new 10-speed PowerLock link will be required to reassemble it.Product FeaturesHASH(0x740298b8)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215V8WkFD5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VFFT1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sram", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 24.5}}
