{"item_id": "B003VIIW44", "title": "Franklin Sports MLS 9-Inch Flexi Cones (Pack of 4)", "description": "The Franklin Sports MLS 9-Inch Flexi Cones feature a unique design that collapses to reduce injury. Perfect for field or park use. Orange color is highly visible. 4 pack.", "text": "Franklin Sports MLS 9-Inch Flexi Cones (Pack of 4) The Franklin Sports MLS 9-Inch Flexi Cones feature a unique design that collapses to reduce injury. Perfect for field or park use. Orange color is highly visible. 4 pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JEuZ0SClL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VIIW44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Franklin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Soccer Equipment"]], "price": 6.0}}
{"item_id": "B003VJKGWE", "title": "Ontario Survival U.S. Military Issue", "description": "Features: , Remanufactured, Smooth bore barrel, 5-shot built-in magazine, 3/8\" dovetail mounts for optic on top and bottom, Manuel trigger block, Molded black checkered grip, 15xt \"BB\" repeater, 7-1/4\" overall, Includes (3) CO2 cartridges, 350-count \"BB\" tube, shooter's glasses and (5) official NRA competition targets", "text": "Ontario Survival U.S. Military Issue Features: , Remanufactured, Smooth bore barrel, 5-shot built-in magazine, 3/8\" dovetail mounts for optic on top and bottom, Manuel trigger block, Molded black checkered grip, 15xt \"BB\" repeater, 7-1/4\" overall, Includes (3) CO2 cartridges, 350-count \"BB\" tube, shooter's glasses and (5) official NRA competition targets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mAm3GvngL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VJKGWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VJQ0XS", "title": "Marble's Bolo Camp Jungle Machete", "description": "Marbles Bolo Camp Knife. 18 3/4\" overall. 13 3/4\" orange finish blade. Natural wood handle. Bulk packed.", "text": "Marble's Bolo Camp Jungle Machete Marbles Bolo Camp Knife. 18 3/4\" overall. 13 3/4\" orange finish blade. Natural wood handle. Bulk packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tb6au9VBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VJQ0XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marbles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.59}}
{"item_id": "B003VJQABU", "title": "Lyman Primer Pocket Uniformer Large", "description": "This precision tool allows reloaders to produce a uniform primer depth for more consistent ignition and improves accuracy. Uniforming tool has a pre-set stop collar set to SAAMI specs. Reloader simply inserts and turns. (For rifle cases only)", "text": "Lyman Primer Pocket Uniformer Large This precision tool allows reloaders to produce a uniform primer depth for more consistent ignition and improves accuracy. Uniforming tool has a pre-set stop collar set to SAAMI specs. Reloader simply inserts and turns. (For rifle cases only)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31un1TWBvRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VJQABU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 20.3}}
{"item_id": "B003VJXATA", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Molle Compact BDU Wallet", "description": "This Voodoo Tactical Compact BDU Wallet is made from rugged pack cloth and features 8 slots for a variety of storage capability. Also included is 1 front mesh pocket, 2 lanyards with clips, universal straps for attachment to any MOLLE system, full zip around closure and a removable Velcro American Flag. Slip this carrier into your BDU Pocket for added storage and organization. Measures 5.5\" x 4.5\" x 0.5\" (when closed).", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Molle Compact BDU Wallet This Voodoo Tactical Compact BDU Wallet is made from rugged pack cloth and features 8 slots for a variety of storage capability. Also included is 1 front mesh pocket, 2 lanyards with clips, universal straps for attachment to any MOLLE system, full zip around closure and a removable Velcro American Flag. Slip this carrier into your BDU Pocket for added storage and organization. Measures 5.5\" x 4.5\" x 0.5\" (when closed).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5102f%2BgxRCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VJXATA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VK80IU", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Molle Compatible BDU Wallet", "description": "This Universal Compatible BDU Wallet by Voodoo Tactical is made from rugged pack cloth and features 9 slots for a variety of storage capability, 1 front mesh pocket, 2 lanyards with clips, universal straps for attachment to any MOLLE system and full zip around closure. Also included is a removable Velcro American Flag. Slip this carrier into your BDU Pocket for added storage and organization. Measures 7\" x 4.75\" x 1\" (when closed).", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Molle Compatible BDU Wallet This Universal Compatible BDU Wallet by Voodoo Tactical is made from rugged pack cloth and features 9 slots for a variety of storage capability, 1 front mesh pocket, 2 lanyards with clips, universal straps for attachment to any MOLLE system and full zip around closure. Also included is a removable Velcro American Flag. Slip this carrier into your BDU Pocket for added storage and organization. Measures 7\" x 4.75\" x 1\" (when closed).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511Qm9n0qoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VK80IU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VMS02E", "title": "Maxpedition M14/M1A Magazine Pouch", "description": "Fits two 7.62 (.308) M14, M1A, SR-25, FAL, SCAR-H, or G3 20 round standard magazines. This will fit regular magazines or magazines with Magpul's installed. The cover flap is both adjustable and detachable and features a oversized 1-1/2\" webbing pull tab for fast opening. This item also has bottom drainage via grommet hole. Attaches using two 5\" TacTie straps. Alternative uses include two M4/M16/AR-15 standard magazines or radio of similar size.", "text": "Maxpedition M14/M1A Magazine Pouch Fits two 7.62 (.308) M14, M1A, SR-25, FAL, SCAR-H, or G3 20 round standard magazines. This will fit regular magazines or magazines with Magpul's installed. The cover flap is both adjustable and detachable and features a oversized 1-1/2\" webbing pull tab for fast opening. This item also has bottom drainage via grommet hole. Attaches using two 5\" TacTie straps. Alternative uses include two M4/M16/AR-15 standard magazines or radio of similar size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512mdvjPy8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VMS02E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 19.79}}
{"item_id": "B003VMUTDM", "title": "UTG Full Size AO Mil-dot Scope, 1 x 4-16 x 40", "description": "A Zero Locking target turret prevents losing your zero setting due to bumps or recoil.This scope from UTG features a 40-millimeter tube with multi emerald-coated lenses for optimized light transmission. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.Zero Locking and Zero Resetting target turrets have consistent, precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment. A mil-dot range estimating reticle ensures optimal aiming and shooting performance in a variety of light conditions, and the scope comes complete with Picatinny/Weaver rings and flip-open lens caps.SpecificationsFour-to-16X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter23-to-5.8' field of view at 100 yards3.9-to-3.5-inch eye reliefTen-to-2.5-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards365-millimeter length20.1-ounce weightFive yards to infinity parallax settingWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "UTG Full Size AO Mil-dot Scope, 1 x 4-16 x 40 A Zero Locking target turret prevents losing your zero setting due to bumps or recoil.This scope from UTG features a 40-millimeter tube with multi emerald-coated lenses for optimized light transmission. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.Zero Locking and Zero Resetting target turrets have consistent, precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment. A mil-dot range estimating reticle ensures optimal aiming and shooting performance in a variety of light conditions, and the scope comes complete with Picatinny/Weaver rings and flip-open lens caps.SpecificationsFour-to-16X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter23-to-5.8' field of view at 100 yards3.9-to-3.5-inch eye reliefTen-to-2.5-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards365-millimeter length20.1-ounce weightFive yards to infinity parallax settingWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31120LKoDJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VMUTDM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 109.97}}
{"item_id": "B003VN1U4I", "title": "UTG Low-Pro Combat Quality Metal Foregrip", "description": "With a quick-detach locking nut with spring tension control for a secure and user-friendly installation, the UTG Lo-Pro Combat Foregrip offers great shooting comfort and confidence in all firing positions. It is machined from robust aluminum alloy for maximum strength and features an optimal low profile and reduced weight for added comfort and control. A 1.46 cubic inch concealed storage compartment holds batteries and small parts.Features:Sell-contoured finger grooves for a solid gripFatigue-free thumb rest and trigger finger shelfOffers great shooting comfort and confidence in all firing positionsSymmetrically shaped palm swellCreative ergonomic design with an angled gripHigh-tech texture with slip-resistant finish for great handling, overall control, and hand supportSmart end cap acts as a concealed compartment for storing accessories and partsMade of unbreakable, impact-resistant advanced polymerSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 7.6 ouncesVertical Height: 4.1 inchesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "text": "UTG Low-Pro Combat Quality Metal Foregrip With a quick-detach locking nut with spring tension control for a secure and user-friendly installation, the UTG Lo-Pro Combat Foregrip offers great shooting comfort and confidence in all firing positions. It is machined from robust aluminum alloy for maximum strength and features an optimal low profile and reduced weight for added comfort and control. A 1.46 cubic inch concealed storage compartment holds batteries and small parts.Features:Sell-contoured finger grooves for a solid gripFatigue-free thumb rest and trigger finger shelfOffers great shooting comfort and confidence in all firing positionsSymmetrically shaped palm swellCreative ergonomic design with an angled gripHigh-tech texture with slip-resistant finish for great handling, overall control, and hand supportSmart end cap acts as a concealed compartment for storing accessories and partsMade of unbreakable, impact-resistant advanced polymerSpecifications:Material: AluminumWeight: 7.6 ouncesVertical Height: 4.1 inchesAbout UTG and Leapers, Inc.Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan, has been in the business of supplying shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. By setting un-compromised high standards for all of their business operations, Leapers' goal is to provide total solutions by paying close attention to industry trends and customer feedback, with a focus on making the best-in-class niche products available for hunting, shooting, and outdoor enthusiasts.In 2009, Leapers made an important decision to start our Made-In-the-USA Manufacturing Operation. With a full commitment to serving more customers in the market with 922R compliant products, Leapers has begun making unique mounting systems under the UTG PRO brand in Michigan and will continue to be innovators in the hunting, shooting, and outdoor industries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z6SrfYbEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VN1U4I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 59.89}}
{"item_id": "B003VN1U7K", "title": "UTG Laser/Flashlight", "description": "Deluxe Tactical Laser/Flashlight Slide-on Weaver Ring with Clamping Diameter of 19.6mm - 20.2mm, Spare Ring for SCP-LS269 and LT-ELS216", "text": "UTG Laser/Flashlight Deluxe Tactical Laser/Flashlight Slide-on Weaver Ring with Clamping Diameter of 19.6mm - 20.2mm, Spare Ring for SCP-LS269 and LT-ELS216", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X99gG2XlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VN1U7K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 9.97}}
{"item_id": "B003VNYIUQ", "title": "Iron Gym Hand and Forearm Trainer", "description": "The Iron Arms Hand and Forearm Trainer is a worthwhile, easily portable accessory to complement your Iron Gym home training system. The device helps you build lean, defined lower arms, and features a lightweight design with steel spring resistance to develop strong flexor muscles and larger extensor muscles.About Iron GymAs seen on TV, the Iron Gym (sold separately) offers challenging, muscle-building workouts at home or on the road -- anywhere there's a standard size door. The sturdy metal bar's unique design wraps around your doorframe, using leverage to remain securely in place without requiring the hassle or damage of inserting screws. When used properly, the Iron Gym helps strengthen and tone your entire upper body, and three different grip positions (narrow, wide, and neutral grips) let you switch up your body's positioning and continuously challenge your muscles.", "text": "Iron Gym Hand and Forearm Trainer The Iron Arms Hand and Forearm Trainer is a worthwhile, easily portable accessory to complement your Iron Gym home training system. The device helps you build lean, defined lower arms, and features a lightweight design with steel spring resistance to develop strong flexor muscles and larger extensor muscles.About Iron GymAs seen on TV, the Iron Gym (sold separately) offers challenging, muscle-building workouts at home or on the road -- anywhere there's a standard size door. The sturdy metal bar's unique design wraps around your doorframe, using leverage to remain securely in place without requiring the hassle or damage of inserting screws. When used properly, the Iron Gym helps strengthen and tone your entire upper body, and three different grip positions (narrow, wide, and neutral grips) let you switch up your body's positioning and continuously challenge your muscles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4161xUPqXbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VNYIUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Iron Gym", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B003VOX1XU", "title": "RAD Cycle Products Highest Quality Rail Mount Heavy Duty Bike Hoist and Ladder Lift - Quality Bicycle Hoist", "description": "Introducing the premium \"Rail Mount\" bike hoist by RAD Cycle Products. This all new design makes installation easier, is more stylish, and allows more flexibility once the hoist has been mounted. The unique rail system allows you to mount the system either parallel or horizontal to the ceiling joists--something that cannot be done with standard hoists. In addition, the spacing (distance between hooks) is fully adjustable which allows the user to use the same hoist for different size bicycles. To top it off, it is made of heavy gauge aluminum that won't rust and was designed to last for a lifetime.", "text": "RAD Cycle Products Highest Quality Rail Mount Heavy Duty Bike Hoist and Ladder Lift - Quality Bicycle Hoist Introducing the premium \"Rail Mount\" bike hoist by RAD Cycle Products. This all new design makes installation easier, is more stylish, and allows more flexibility once the hoist has been mounted. The unique rail system allows you to mount the system either parallel or horizontal to the ceiling joists--something that cannot be done with standard hoists. In addition, the spacing (distance between hooks) is fully adjustable which allows the user to use the same hoist for different size bicycles. To top it off, it is made of heavy gauge aluminum that won't rust and was designed to last for a lifetime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418S43YdyPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VOX1XU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RAD Cycle Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games"]], "price": 28.9}}
{"item_id": "B003VPEBH4", "title": "Aim Sports Mosin Nagant 1-Inch Extended Recoil Buttpad", "description": "Take some of the kick and sting out of your high-powered rifle shots with this non-slip rubber buttpad from aptly named AIM Sports. The one-inch thick device is compatible with all mosin nagant rifles, reduces recoil by approximately 40%, and mounts easily using existing buttplate screws.Lifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports Mosin Nagant 1-Inch Extended Recoil Buttpad Take some of the kick and sting out of your high-powered rifle shots with this non-slip rubber buttpad from aptly named AIM Sports. The one-inch thick device is compatible with all mosin nagant rifles, reduces recoil by approximately 40%, and mounts easily using existing buttplate screws.Lifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZUj3rwfCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VPEBH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 8.08}}
{"item_id": "B003VPLWTO", "title": "Black Mountain Products New Strong Man Set of 6 Resistance Bands", "description": "Black Mountain resistance bands provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The 48-inch bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, the red 25-to-30 pounds, and the orange 35-to-40 pounds.WarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Black Mountain Products New Strong Man Set of 6 Resistance Bands Black Mountain resistance bands provide a surprisingly challenging alternative to free weights and machines. They are made from high quality, natural latex rubber for long-lasting use, with a soft cushioned foam handle for a comfortable nonslip grip during your workout. The 48-inch bands are sold as a set of five, with the yellow band offering two-to-four pounds of resistance, the green four-to-six pounds, the blue ten-to-12 pounds, the black 15-to-20 pounds, the red 25-to-30 pounds, and the orange 35-to-40 pounds.WarrantyBlack Mountain products include a limited 60-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516Enh0xU4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VPLWTO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B003VPOYXU", "title": "Park Tool Master Link Pliers MLP1.2", "description": "Park Tool Master Link Pliers MLP-1.2 Master Link Pliers make replacement of master links quick and effortless. Simply insert the specially sized jaws into each end of the chain and squeeze the handles to hold the chain while replacing the master link. Another Park Tool to make your job easier.", "text": "Park Tool Master Link Pliers MLP1.2 Park Tool Master Link Pliers MLP-1.2 Master Link Pliers make replacement of master links quick and effortless. Simply insert the specially sized jaws into each end of the chain and squeeze the handles to hold the chain while replacing the master link. Another Park Tool to make your job easier.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EcZIMmOCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VPOYXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 14.36}}
{"item_id": "B003VPQC3A", "title": "Hanes Toddler Boys Non-Skid Ankle Socks # 27/6 (6 Pairs)", "description": "", "text": "Hanes Toddler Boys Non-Skid Ankle Socks # 27/6 (6 Pairs)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kFKco10-L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VPQC3A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Boys", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Boys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VQK0HS", "title": "Lifesource Xl-18 Tri-axial Activity Monitor", "description": "", "text": "Lifesource Xl-18 Tri-axial Activity Monitor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I7Eh6PrzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VQK0HS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LifeSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 17.88}}
{"item_id": "B003VR4RC6", "title": "Columbia Men's Fast Trek Fleece Hat (Black, Large/X-Large)", "description": "Although it appears to be an exercise in minimalism, this super warm, water-repellent fleece hat maxes out on weather-fighting technology. It’s soft tricot lining features Omni-Heat® thermal reflective technology, which reflects and retains your body heat without sacrificing breathability. The exterior is armed with Omni-Shield® advanced repellency to keep wet weather at bay, and a double-layer ear band provides bonus warmth where it’s needed most. Plus, it’s stretchy, soft, and fits great.", "text": "Columbia Men's Fast Trek Fleece Hat (Black, Large/X-Large) Although it appears to be an exercise in minimalism, this super warm, water-repellent fleece hat maxes out on weather-fighting technology. It’s soft tricot lining features Omni-Heat® thermal reflective technology, which reflects and retains your body heat without sacrificing breathability. The exterior is armed with Omni-Shield® advanced repellency to keep wet weather at bay, and a double-layer ear band provides bonus warmth where it’s needed most. Plus, it’s stretchy, soft, and fits great.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FIFABwA%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VR4RC6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VR7ORQ", "title": "Columbia Men's Camo Watertight Jacket (Delta Hunter Marsh, X-Large)", "description": "This ultra-light, highly waterproof two-layer is nothing short of necessary when creeping through the wet underbrush or sitting out a rainsquall in the lush quiet of an aspen grove. The lightweight polyester shell is fully seam sealed and outfitted with an Omni-Tech membrane, delivering our highest level of waterproof breathability. A soft taffeta lining feels good on bare skin and glides easily over underlayers. Zip-closed security pockets provide fumble-free storage for shells, snacks, and other survival items. Engage the adjustable storm hood with a crucial ball-cap brim to keep the rain off your brow. Relaxed fit.", "text": "Columbia Men's Camo Watertight Jacket (Delta Hunter Marsh, X-Large) This ultra-light, highly waterproof two-layer is nothing short of necessary when creeping through the wet underbrush or sitting out a rainsquall in the lush quiet of an aspen grove. The lightweight polyester shell is fully seam sealed and outfitted with an Omni-Tech membrane, delivering our highest level of waterproof breathability. A soft taffeta lining feels good on bare skin and glides easily over underlayers. Zip-closed security pockets provide fumble-free storage for shells, snacks, and other survival items. Engage the adjustable storm hood with a crucial ball-cap brim to keep the rain off your brow. Relaxed fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OhgF2L7RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VR7ORQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VREOPQ", "title": "Clean Bottle 22-Ounce Water Bottle", "description": "Tired of mold building up in the hard to reach corners of your water bottle? The innovative Clean Bottle is a 22-ounce sports bottle with a leak-proof, screw-off bottom and top cap, that allows you to clean and dry the bottle thoroughly. The nozzle also comes off, so you can clean out the gunk wherever it hides. The Clean Bottle is constructed of BPA free plastic and is top-rack dishwasher safe. The Clean Bottle comes with a lifetime guarantee and 10 percent of all Clean Bottle profits are donated to eco and cycling friendly charities.", "text": "Clean Bottle 22-Ounce Water Bottle Tired of mold building up in the hard to reach corners of your water bottle? The innovative Clean Bottle is a 22-ounce sports bottle with a leak-proof, screw-off bottom and top cap, that allows you to clean and dry the bottle thoroughly. The nozzle also comes off, so you can clean out the gunk wherever it hides. The Clean Bottle is constructed of BPA free plastic and is top-rack dishwasher safe. The Clean Bottle comes with a lifetime guarantee and 10 percent of all Clean Bottle profits are donated to eco and cycling friendly charities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y88yKqnoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VREOPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Clean Bottle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B003VRWZ3Y", "title": "Ergo Ear Plugs", "description": "The updated Ergo Ear Plugs are ergonomically designed to offer the closest most secure fit possible. Made of high quality TPR, these are super comfortable and super easy to place in or out of your ear. These reusable plugs come with a handy storage and carrying case to keep them clean and germ free, ready for their next use. Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions and the world's #1 swim brand!", "text": "Ergo Ear Plugs The updated Ergo Ear Plugs are ergonomically designed to offer the closest most secure fit possible. Made of high quality TPR, these are super comfortable and super easy to place in or out of your ear. These reusable plugs come with a handy storage and carrying case to keep them clean and germ free, ready for their next use. Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions and the world's #1 swim brand!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311-n6ixJqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VRWZ3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Earplugs"]], "price": 5.8}}
{"item_id": "B003VRYQ22", "title": "Speedo Kid's Skoogles Mirrored Swim Goggle", "description": "The Skoogle Mirrored Goggle is a great addition to our populr Skoogle family of kid's goggles. Made of high quality hypoallergenic soft silicone, this is an extremely comfortable goggle for water recreation. The Speed Clip adjustment enables youngsters to adjust the goggle quickly and easliy by themselves. With mirrored lens and UV protection in bright fun colors, this is sure to be a favorite for every child! Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions! Recreation consumers love the water. While some hang out at the beach or poolside, others hang out in the water. And they want products that are fun, functional, comfortable, fashionable, and a good value. Speedo equals better fit, performance, quality, and innovation. But we aren't just about race suits and competitive swimming. At Speedo, we are all about helping you get more out of the water: more fun, more fitness, more comfort… well, you get the idea. Which explains why more elite swimmers swim (and win) with us than any other brand on the planet. And if you're not living life in the competitive lanes, we've got you covered for all your fitness and recreation needs for the entire family.", "text": "Speedo Kid's Skoogles Mirrored Swim Goggle The Skoogle Mirrored Goggle is a great addition to our populr Skoogle family of kid's goggles. Made of high quality hypoallergenic soft silicone, this is an extremely comfortable goggle for water recreation. The Speed Clip adjustment enables youngsters to adjust the goggle quickly and easliy by themselves. With mirrored lens and UV protection in bright fun colors, this is sure to be a favorite for every child! Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions! Recreation consumers love the water. While some hang out at the beach or poolside, others hang out in the water. And they want products that are fun, functional, comfortable, fashionable, and a good value. Speedo equals better fit, performance, quality, and innovation. But we aren't just about race suits and competitive swimming. At Speedo, we are all about helping you get more out of the water: more fun, more fitness, more comfort… well, you get the idea. Which explains why more elite swimmers swim (and win) with us than any other brand on the planet. And if you're not living life in the competitive lanes, we've got you covered for all your fitness and recreation needs for the entire family.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wDQH8mEPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VRYQ22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VS2RJ0", "title": "Speedo Swedish Swim Goggle 2-Pack", "description": "The ever popular Swedish goggle has been a favorite among competitive elite swimmers for over 30 years. This goggle is self assembly to get just the right fit to enable you to shave off every hundredth of a second possible from your race time. Besides getting one regular lens and one mirror lens to adust for indoor or outdoor swimming, the other great thing about our 2-pack is that you are getting two for almost the price of one. Look and feel your best as you play, train or win in Speedo, the world's #1 swim brand and the choice of champions. Competitive consumers are the core of our brand. Swimmers want swimming to be an important part of their live, and they wear their swimming as a badge. Some will compete, others will do their daily laps. All will aspire for personal bests. Speedo equals better fit, performance, quality, and innovation. But we aren't just about race suits and competitive swimming. At Speedo, we are all about helping you get more out of the water: more fun, more fitness, more comfort… well, you get the idea. Which explains why more elite swimmers swim (and win) with us than any other brand on the planet. And if you're not living life in the competitive lanes, we've got you covered for all your fitness and recreation needs for the entire family.Item includes : • 4 lenses • 2 head-straps • 2 strings • 2 nose-bridge sheaths.Swedish goggles are a classic and popular type of swimming goggles worn by many competitive swimmers. They are the most popular goggle among elite swimmers. Swedish goggles are notable for a lack of a gasket or seal around the eye cup, as found on most other goggles. Much of the popularity of Swedish goggles is due to their customizable fit.Please Note: The goggles are sold un-assembled and require complete user assembly, which results in a custom fit. Proper assembly generally requires some skill and practice, as well as precision. Before assembly, the inside edges of the lenses are often filed down to remove any sharp edges and thus improve comfort. There is assembly instructions manual, which are included in the goggle packaging.", "text": "Speedo Swedish Swim Goggle 2-Pack The ever popular Swedish goggle has been a favorite among competitive elite swimmers for over 30 years. This goggle is self assembly to get just the right fit to enable you to shave off every hundredth of a second possible from your race time. Besides getting one regular lens and one mirror lens to adust for indoor or outdoor swimming, the other great thing about our 2-pack is that you are getting two for almost the price of one. Look and feel your best as you play, train or win in Speedo, the world's #1 swim brand and the choice of champions. Competitive consumers are the core of our brand. Swimmers want swimming to be an important part of their live, and they wear their swimming as a badge. Some will compete, others will do their daily laps. All will aspire for personal bests. Speedo equals better fit, performance, quality, and innovation. But we aren't just about race suits and competitive swimming. At Speedo, we are all about helping you get more out of the water: more fun, more fitness, more comfort… well, you get the idea. Which explains why more elite swimmers swim (and win) with us than any other brand on the planet. And if you're not living life in the competitive lanes, we've got you covered for all your fitness and recreation needs for the entire family.Item includes : • 4 lenses • 2 head-straps • 2 strings • 2 nose-bridge sheaths.Swedish goggles are a classic and popular type of swimming goggles worn by many competitive swimmers. They are the most popular goggle among elite swimmers. Swedish goggles are notable for a lack of a gasket or seal around the eye cup, as found on most other goggles. Much of the popularity of Swedish goggles is due to their customizable fit.Please Note: The goggles are sold un-assembled and require complete user assembly, which results in a custom fit. Proper assembly generally requires some skill and practice, as well as precision. Before assembly, the inside edges of the lenses are often filed down to remove any sharp edges and thus improve comfort. There is assembly instructions manual, which are included in the goggle packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h3LFU1HEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VS2RJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B003VS4QDA", "title": "Speedo Goggle Case", "description": "The Speedo goggle case prolongs the life of your goggles by protecting them from scratches. Just put your goggles in the case and throw it in your bag without worrying about them getting scratches or tangled with your other gear.", "text": "Speedo Goggle Case The Speedo goggle case prolongs the life of your goggles by protecting them from scratches. Just put your goggles in the case and throw it in your bag without worrying about them getting scratches or tangled with your other gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vR4SsaygL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VS4QDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 6.74}}
