{"item_id": "B003VU7F36", "title": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P - Ylw Rs, Green/Yellow", "description": "The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "text": "Truglo Tfo Handgun Sight Set - S&W M&P - Ylw Rs, Green/Yellow The TRUGLO TFO handgun sights use our patented technology. Unbelievable transition through all light conditions. Glows in the dark. CNC-machined steel construction. Concealed fiber cannot be seen by target. Fits standard holsters. Snag-resistant design. Rear sight available in green or yellow. (Please note that yellow is intended to appear less bright than green.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O8zDht%2BmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VU7F36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VUPD94", "title": "Mountainsmith Dog Pack - 2011", "description": "Updated for 2011, Mountainsmith built upon its 20+ years of designing dog packs and created the best version yet for Fido's next season in the backcountry. A fully adjustable 3-point padded harness system insures a comfortable and stable fit as your best friend runs over hill and hollow. A newly tapered torso shape reduces drag and increases balance to follow the natural way your dog moves along the trail. Rounding out the package is a safety-minded application of 3M reflective tape; great for those late night treks back to the car after a day of chasing rabbits.Features:Two zippered pockets with rain flapsSingle haul handle on the top of the packD-ring attachment point for leashesAvailable in sizes small, medium, and large3-point adjustable fleece lined harness with removable chest padErgonomically tapered torso shape3M Reflective TrimInternal stash pocketElastic bungee attachment pointSide compression strapsFleece lined harness600d polyester ripstop900d polyester ballisticSmall Specifications:Size: SmallDimensions: 9 by 14 by 8.5 inchesWeight: 15.5 ouncesVolume: 610 cubic inches; 10 litersWeight Range: 20-40 poundsGirth: 20-30 inchesMinimum Torso Length: 15 inchesMedium Specifications:Size: MediumDimensions: 11 by 15 by 10.5 inchesWeight: 1 pound, 3.5 ouncesVolume: 1220 cubic inches; 20 litersWeight Range: 40-90 poundsMedium Pack Dog Girth: 24 - 36 inchesMedium Pack Minimum Torso Length: 19 inchesLarge Specifications:Size: LargeDimensions: 13 by 20 by 12.5 inchesWeight: 1 pound, 8 ouncesVolume: 1830 cubic inches; 30 litersWeight Range: 80-120 poundsLarge Pack Dog Girth: 32 - 44 inchesLarge Pack Min Torso Length: 22 inches", "text": "Mountainsmith Dog Pack - 2011 Updated for 2011, Mountainsmith built upon its 20+ years of designing dog packs and created the best version yet for Fido's next season in the backcountry. A fully adjustable 3-point padded harness system insures a comfortable and stable fit as your best friend runs over hill and hollow. A newly tapered torso shape reduces drag and increases balance to follow the natural way your dog moves along the trail. Rounding out the package is a safety-minded application of 3M reflective tape; great for those late night treks back to the car after a day of chasing rabbits.Features:Two zippered pockets with rain flapsSingle haul handle on the top of the packD-ring attachment point for leashesAvailable in sizes small, medium, and large3-point adjustable fleece lined harness with removable chest padErgonomically tapered torso shape3M Reflective TrimInternal stash pocketElastic bungee attachment pointSide compression strapsFleece lined harness600d polyester ripstop900d polyester ballisticSmall Specifications:Size: SmallDimensions: 9 by 14 by 8.5 inchesWeight: 15.5 ouncesVolume: 610 cubic inches; 10 litersWeight Range: 20-40 poundsGirth: 20-30 inchesMinimum Torso Length: 15 inchesMedium Specifications:Size: MediumDimensions: 11 by 15 by 10.5 inchesWeight: 1 pound, 3.5 ouncesVolume: 1220 cubic inches; 20 litersWeight Range: 40-90 poundsMedium Pack Dog Girth: 24 - 36 inchesMedium Pack Minimum Torso Length: 19 inchesLarge Specifications:Size: LargeDimensions: 13 by 20 by 12.5 inchesWeight: 1 pound, 8 ouncesVolume: 1830 cubic inches; 30 litersWeight Range: 80-120 poundsLarge Pack Dog Girth: 32 - 44 inchesLarge Pack Min Torso Length: 22 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pCgr5fHjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUPD94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Dog Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VUSJFO", "title": "Carbon Express Surge Crossbolt (Pack of 6), 20-Inch", "description": "The Surge crossbolt by Carbon Express offers superior performance at an exceptional value. The 360° degree spine consistency allows for greater accuracy while advanced carbon composite material is extremely durable for repeat performances in the field.", "text": "Carbon Express Surge Crossbolt (Pack of 6), 20-Inch The Surge crossbolt by Carbon Express offers superior performance at an exceptional value. The 360° degree spine consistency allows for greater accuracy while advanced carbon composite material is extremely durable for repeat performances in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21uwSjAbIVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUSJFO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VUVZVY", "title": "Galati Gear Single Magazine Pouch (Black)", "description": "Single Pistol Mag Pouch - Galati Gear Holds one single magazine for the 45 Auto, Browning Hi-Power, S&W; 59 and other similar size pistol mags as well as a pocket knife. Will accommodate double stacked mags. Attaches to belt through belt loop guide. Height is 5 1/2\". Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Single Magazine Pouch (Black) Single Pistol Mag Pouch - Galati Gear Holds one single magazine for the 45 Auto, Browning Hi-Power, S&W; 59 and other similar size pistol mags as well as a pocket knife. Will accommodate double stacked mags. Attaches to belt through belt loop guide. Height is 5 1/2\". Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iPh%2B%2BpG6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUVZVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 5.36}}
{"item_id": "B003VUW0BI", "title": "Galati Gear Web Pistol Belt (58-Inch Long)", "description": "Web Pistol Belt - Galati Gear Fully adjustable, quick release, sturdy nylon webbing construction. Features a quick release buckle. Fits waist up to 58\". Width is 2 1/4\". 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Web Pistol Belt (58-Inch Long) Web Pistol Belt - Galati Gear Fully adjustable, quick release, sturdy nylon webbing construction. Features a quick release buckle. Fits waist up to 58\". Width is 2 1/4\". 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FJd0-o9iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUW0BI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VUY0XE", "title": "Galati Gear Rifle Case", "description": "37\" Premium XT Rifle Case - Black - Galati Gear The toughest soft case in the industry. Guaranteed. The Galati XT Premium Rifle Cases are built Extra Tough and Extra Thick and are in a class above the competition. As the toughest soft case in the industry, no other soft rifle case even comes close to its durability and quality. 37\" XT Rifle Case Inside Dimensions: 37\" x 12\" x 2 1/2\" Fits full stock AKM, HK94, MAK90, 16\" BBL Bushmaster AR-15 and other similar sized weapons. FOUR MAGAZINE POUCHES will hold 40rd 223/30rd AK Mags. Accessory Pouch. Standard features on XT Rifle Cases: Dual YKK Zippers 3\" Support Rib 1\" Padded Zipper Protector PVC Tactical Nylon - Black 1 1/8\" Closed Cell Foam on EACH SIDE of the Case Will Not Fade from Sunlight or Cleaning Reinforced Stitching Bonded Threading Water Resistant Fire Retardant Adjustable Padded Shoulder Strap Will Float with Rifle in it Lockable D-Ring 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Rifle Case 37\" Premium XT Rifle Case - Black - Galati Gear The toughest soft case in the industry. Guaranteed. The Galati XT Premium Rifle Cases are built Extra Tough and Extra Thick and are in a class above the competition. As the toughest soft case in the industry, no other soft rifle case even comes close to its durability and quality. 37\" XT Rifle Case Inside Dimensions: 37\" x 12\" x 2 1/2\" Fits full stock AKM, HK94, MAK90, 16\" BBL Bushmaster AR-15 and other similar sized weapons. FOUR MAGAZINE POUCHES will hold 40rd 223/30rd AK Mags. Accessory Pouch. Standard features on XT Rifle Cases: Dual YKK Zippers 3\" Support Rib 1\" Padded Zipper Protector PVC Tactical Nylon - Black 1 1/8\" Closed Cell Foam on EACH SIDE of the Case Will Not Fade from Sunlight or Cleaning Reinforced Stitching Bonded Threading Water Resistant Fire Retardant Adjustable Padded Shoulder Strap Will Float with Rifle in it Lockable D-Ring 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xhmV2cpDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUY0XE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VUZ3I0", "title": "Galati Gear 30-40 Round Magazine Pouch", "description": "Shoulder Magazine Pouch - 30 to 40 round Mags - 6 Pocket - Galati Gear The Galati Gear 30-40rd Shoulder Mag Pouch holds AK47 30rd banana clips, 40rd 223 mags, 30rd 308 mag and Ruger 10/22 30rd mags. Features six pockets with velcro closures. Other Mag Pouch features include a fully adjustable padded shoulder strap and D ring tie downs. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Galati Gear. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear 30-40 Round Magazine Pouch Shoulder Magazine Pouch - 30 to 40 round Mags - 6 Pocket - Galati Gear The Galati Gear 30-40rd Shoulder Mag Pouch holds AK47 30rd banana clips, 40rd 223 mags, 30rd 308 mag and Ruger 10/22 30rd mags. Features six pockets with velcro closures. Other Mag Pouch features include a fully adjustable padded shoulder strap and D ring tie downs. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Galati Gear. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cXO3NgBTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUZ3I0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.24}}
{"item_id": "B003VUZ3TE", "title": "Galati Gear Deluxe Tactical Vest (Black, Husky)", "description": "Black. Husky. Keep your tactical gear within easy reach and your hands free at the same time. These deluxe tactical vests are engineered to efficiently organize all your tactical gear and accessories. Includes a deluxe universal holster, a pistol web belt, three deluxe universal pistol mag/flashlight pouches, radio pouch, sniper shoulder, large ID pouch, four adjustable rifle mag pouches, two internal zippered map/document pouches, and a heavy duty back loop system to carry additional gear and tools. Fully adjustable in girth and length. High quality zippers. Black. Left-handed model available in standard size only. Fully adjustable in Height and Girth. HUSKY VEST: (right-handed only) Chest: up to 64\" Waist: up to 60\" Length: up to 28\" 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Deluxe Tactical Vest (Black, Husky) Black. Husky. Keep your tactical gear within easy reach and your hands free at the same time. These deluxe tactical vests are engineered to efficiently organize all your tactical gear and accessories. Includes a deluxe universal holster, a pistol web belt, three deluxe universal pistol mag/flashlight pouches, radio pouch, sniper shoulder, large ID pouch, four adjustable rifle mag pouches, two internal zippered map/document pouches, and a heavy duty back loop system to carry additional gear and tools. Fully adjustable in girth and length. High quality zippers. Black. Left-handed model available in standard size only. Fully adjustable in Height and Girth. HUSKY VEST: (right-handed only) Chest: up to 64\" Waist: up to 60\" Length: up to 28\" 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hIDz4heIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUZ3TE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VUZ5RY", "title": "Galati Gear Shotgun Bandoleer", "description": "The shotgun bandoleer simply slips over your head and rests on your shoulder for quick access to ammunition. Holds 56 shells in .12, .16 or .20 gauge shells. Secure elastic loops. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Shotgun Bandoleer The shotgun bandoleer simply slips over your head and rests on your shoulder for quick access to ammunition. Holds 56 shells in .12, .16 or .20 gauge shells. Secure elastic loops. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GUIC1wE9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VUZ5RY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]], "price": 21.14}}
{"item_id": "B003VV18C4", "title": "Galati Gear 6 Pocket Shoulder Magazine Pouch", "description": "Shoulder Magazine Pouch - 20 to 30 round Mags - 6 Pocket - Galati Gear The Galati Gear 20-30rd Shoulder Mag Pouch holds 30rd 223 mags and 20rd 308 mags. Features six pockets with velcro closures. Other Mag Pouch features include a fully adjustable padded shoulder strap and D ring tie downs. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Galati Gear. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear 6 Pocket Shoulder Magazine Pouch Shoulder Magazine Pouch - 20 to 30 round Mags - 6 Pocket - Galati Gear The Galati Gear 20-30rd Shoulder Mag Pouch holds 30rd 223 mags and 20rd 308 mags. Features six pockets with velcro closures. Other Mag Pouch features include a fully adjustable padded shoulder strap and D ring tie downs. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Galati Gear. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sYB9rXwxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV18C4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.88}}
{"item_id": "B003VV1978", "title": "Galati Gear Double Magazine Pouch with Belt Loop", "description": "Double Pistol Magazine Pouch - Belt Loop - Two Pocket - Galati Gear The Double Mag Pouch from Galati Gear holds two 45 Auto magazines, Browning Hi-Power and standard magazines or two double stacked mags. Attaches to belt through belt loops. Velcro closures on each of the two pockets. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Overall Length: 4 3/4\" x 6\". Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Double Magazine Pouch with Belt Loop Double Pistol Magazine Pouch - Belt Loop - Two Pocket - Galati Gear The Double Mag Pouch from Galati Gear holds two 45 Auto magazines, Browning Hi-Power and standard magazines or two double stacked mags. Attaches to belt through belt loops. Velcro closures on each of the two pockets. Constructed from PVC Tactical Nylon for superior quality. Overall Length: 4 3/4\" x 6\". Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oW7BlRnrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV1978.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 16.7}}
{"item_id": "B003VV1B5S", "title": "Galati Gear Rifle Bandoleer", "description": "The rifle bandoleer simply slips over your head and rests on your shoulder for quick access to ammunition. Holds 80 rounds of centerfire calibers and works best for smaller cartridges like 223, 243, 7.62x39, .410 and other medium calibers. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Rifle Bandoleer The rifle bandoleer simply slips over your head and rests on your shoulder for quick access to ammunition. Holds 80 rounds of centerfire calibers and works best for smaller cartridges like 223, 243, 7.62x39, .410 and other medium calibers. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q0jTUA1PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV1B5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 20.89}}
{"item_id": "B003VV1V12", "title": "Galati Gear Velcro Holster and Magazine Pouch", "description": "Universal Holster and Mag Pouch - Velcro Backing - Galati Gear This Universal Holster and Mag Pouch from Galati Gear works with numerous tactical accessories including Humvee Campco Concealment Holsters, Galati Double and Discreet Case Modular Pockets, as well as Concealment Attache Cases. Made from durable fabric holster body with a 1 1/2\" elastic retention band for securing an extra magazine or a collapsible baton.", "text": "Galati Gear Velcro Holster and Magazine Pouch Universal Holster and Mag Pouch - Velcro Backing - Galati Gear This Universal Holster and Mag Pouch from Galati Gear works with numerous tactical accessories including Humvee Campco Concealment Holsters, Galati Double and Discreet Case Modular Pockets, as well as Concealment Attache Cases. Made from durable fabric holster body with a 1 1/2\" elastic retention band for securing an extra magazine or a collapsible baton.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511MJ8d9L8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV1V12.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VV2TH2", "title": "Galati Gear Deluxe Pistol Case", "description": "Tougher than a pistol pouch without the bulk of a range bag, the Galati Gear Deluxe Pistol Case is an ideal bag for gun owners. This padded case will hold three automatics or revolvers, eight magazines as well as three boxes of ammunition in the outside pocket. All heavily stitched and constructed of PVC Tactical Nylon to give you years of use. Double zippers and handles sewn all the way around case. Black. Galati Gear Dimensions: 12 1/2\"L x 3\"W x 8\"H 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Deluxe Pistol Case Tougher than a pistol pouch without the bulk of a range bag, the Galati Gear Deluxe Pistol Case is an ideal bag for gun owners. This padded case will hold three automatics or revolvers, eight magazines as well as three boxes of ammunition in the outside pocket. All heavily stitched and constructed of PVC Tactical Nylon to give you years of use. Double zippers and handles sewn all the way around case. Black. Galati Gear Dimensions: 12 1/2\"L x 3\"W x 8\"H 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x7-No7HAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV2TH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 36.82}}
{"item_id": "B003VV2W4M", "title": "Galati Gear Shotgun Sling (Holds 15 Shells)", "description": "The Galati shotgun sling holds 15 rounds of 12, 16, and 20 gauge shotgun shells. Fully adjustable from 28\" up to 36 1/2\" in length. Constructed from heavy duty 2\" nylon webbing. Fits standard sling swivels. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty.", "text": "Galati Gear Shotgun Sling (Holds 15 Shells) The Galati shotgun sling holds 15 rounds of 12, 16, and 20 gauge shotgun shells. Fully adjustable from 28\" up to 36 1/2\" in length. Constructed from heavy duty 2\" nylon webbing. Fits standard sling swivels. Black. 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IKHoctj5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV2W4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 16.41}}
{"item_id": "B003VV2WBK", "title": "Galati Gear Super Range Bag (Black)", "description": "The Super Range Bag features a large zippered main compartment plus a large padded pocket on each side of the bag. One padded pocket converts to a pistol pouch with inner divider and clip holders. Two adjustable dividers inside the main compartment separates accessories. Includes a padded shoulder strap. Made from PVC, a clone to ballistic nylon. Black. Dimensions: 18\"L x 8 1/2\"W x 9\"H. Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Super Range Bag (Black) The Super Range Bag features a large zippered main compartment plus a large padded pocket on each side of the bag. One padded pocket converts to a pistol pouch with inner divider and clip holders. Two adjustable dividers inside the main compartment separates accessories. Includes a padded shoulder strap. Made from PVC, a clone to ballistic nylon. Black. Dimensions: 18\"L x 8 1/2\"W x 9\"H. Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JqEsY99BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV2WBK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 64.9}}
{"item_id": "B003VV2WDI", "title": "Galati Gear Takedown Rifle Pouch (23 x9-Inch)", "description": "Takedown Rifle Case - Browning 22 Auto - Galati Gear The Takedown Rifle Case holds the Browning 22 auto, Charter Arms Explorer, Thompson Contender, Scoped Handguns and other firearms not exceeding 23\" in length. Features two padded pockets to keep the barrel and butt stock separate. Keep your favorite rifle close while camping or hunting. Made from PVC Tactical Nylon. Includes a sewn carry handle. Dimensions: 23\" x 9 1/2\". Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Takedown Rifle Pouch (23 x9-Inch) Takedown Rifle Case - Browning 22 Auto - Galati Gear The Takedown Rifle Case holds the Browning 22 auto, Charter Arms Explorer, Thompson Contender, Scoped Handguns and other firearms not exceeding 23\" in length. Features two padded pockets to keep the barrel and butt stock separate. Keep your favorite rifle close while camping or hunting. Made from PVC Tactical Nylon. Includes a sewn carry handle. Dimensions: 23\" x 9 1/2\". Galati Gear 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-ymsmQkBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV2WDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galati Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B003VV4X94", "title": "Galati Gear Deluxe Web Belt with Dual Magazine Pouches", "description": "Available in standard and husky sizes! You will love the durability and quality of this Tactical Web Belt with two removable mag pouches. Fully adjustable and available in two different sizes. Features a quick release buckle and secure straps. Holds firearms, magazines, shovels, knives and more (belt keepers not included). Mag pouches are removable and close with a quick detachable buckle for security. Width is 2\". Standard Belt fits waist: 34\"-51\" Large Belt fits waist: 41\"-61\" 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "text": "Galati Gear Deluxe Web Belt with Dual Magazine Pouches Available in standard and husky sizes! You will love the durability and quality of this Tactical Web Belt with two removable mag pouches. Fully adjustable and available in two different sizes. Features a quick release buckle and secure straps. Holds firearms, magazines, shovels, knives and more (belt keepers not included). Mag pouches are removable and close with a quick detachable buckle for security. Width is 2\". Standard Belt fits waist: 34\"-51\" Large Belt fits waist: 41\"-61\" 100% Guarantee 2 Year Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CNMJY3WXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VV4X94.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VW6HGK", "title": "Double Eagle Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols Airsoft Guns", "description": "We all know more equals better right? Why get only one airsoft gun when you can get two. Introducing the Double Eagle Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols. This amazing package comes with a mind boggling 2 spring pocket pistols. You can give one of the pistols to your friends. Don't have friends? Hold one in both hands then and people will think you are cool. The Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols comes with a black pocket pistol and a gold pocket pistol. Their compact size makes them easily fit in your pockets. So what are you waiting for? Get yours today! This is a Spring Airsoft Pistol, which means it's powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. It's fast, clean, inexpensive and easily maintained; it requires no gas or batteries to operate. Also, Spring Airsoft Guns are the toughest, most durable of all Airsoft Guns, because they're made with few breakable pieces. If you're looking for a fun, reliable Airsoft Pistol that'll look great and perform even better, you've come to the right place. You must be 18 years of age or older to purchase this Airsoft gun. Features: * Spring Powered * Plastic Construction * Gold And Black Paint Job * Pocket Size Includes: * Plastic Carrying Case * Black P328 Spring Pocket Pistol * Gold P328 Spring Pocket Pistol * Bag Of Sample BBs Specifications: * FPS: 140 * Magazine Capacity: 7 * Size: 6\"", "text": "Double Eagle Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols Airsoft Guns We all know more equals better right? Why get only one airsoft gun when you can get two. Introducing the Double Eagle Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols. This amazing package comes with a mind boggling 2 spring pocket pistols. You can give one of the pistols to your friends. Don't have friends? Hold one in both hands then and people will think you are cool. The Twin P328 Spring Pocket Pistols comes with a black pocket pistol and a gold pocket pistol. Their compact size makes them easily fit in your pockets. So what are you waiting for? Get yours today! This is a Spring Airsoft Pistol, which means it's powered by a spring and must be cocked for each shot. It's fast, clean, inexpensive and easily maintained; it requires no gas or batteries to operate. Also, Spring Airsoft Guns are the toughest, most durable of all Airsoft Guns, because they're made with few breakable pieces. If you're looking for a fun, reliable Airsoft Pistol that'll look great and perform even better, you've come to the right place. You must be 18 years of age or older to purchase this Airsoft gun. Features: * Spring Powered * Plastic Construction * Gold And Black Paint Job * Pocket Size Includes: * Plastic Carrying Case * Black P328 Spring Pocket Pistol * Gold P328 Spring Pocket Pistol * Bag Of Sample BBs Specifications: * FPS: 140 * Magazine Capacity: 7 * Size: 6\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HQrifXuFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VW6HGK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "World Tech Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 11.99}}
