{"item_id": "B003VY5WHI", "title": "Columbia Men's Fast Trek Fleece Glove Large", "description": "Perfect for a quick jaunt out into the cold, the Columbia men's Fast Trek fleece glove keeps your hands warm in the face of extreme temperatures. It features an Omni-Shield™ advanced water-repellent fabric construction to prevent moisture, snow, rain and ice from lingering on the garment.", "text": "Columbia Men's Fast Trek Fleece Glove Large Perfect for a quick jaunt out into the cold, the Columbia men's Fast Trek fleece glove keeps your hands warm in the face of extreme temperatures. It features an Omni-Shield™ advanced water-repellent fabric construction to prevent moisture, snow, rain and ice from lingering on the garment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AuMzsBaSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VY5WHI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003VZIWZQ", "title": "New Heavy Duty Punching Bag", "description": "We are glad to introduce our new model of Canvas punching bag that will last you long time. Even the canvas punching bag is heavy duty made and will not give up on you that easily. Finally we have something to satisfy our customers with the low cost and high quality. These bags are not same as you see on else where, because these are heavy duty and will last you long time and that's why they cost more.", "text": "New Heavy Duty Punching Bag We are glad to introduce our new model of Canvas punching bag that will last you long time. Even the canvas punching bag is heavy duty made and will not give up on you that easily. Finally we have something to satisfy our customers with the low cost and high quality. These bags are not same as you see on else where, because these are heavy duty and will last you long time and that's why they cost more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GS%2B-PNG-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003VZIWZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lastworld", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 27.0}}
