{"item_id": "B003WEZ8FI", "title": "SUP Paddle by Advanced Elements", "description": "224949 Features: Constructed with a 2-part aluminum shaft that breaks down to 95 cm for easier storage Ripped blade shape for improved stiffness Adjustable pin-lock length adjustment ranges from 170 to 210 cm Specifications: Weight: 2 lb 10 oz Blade dimensions: 16 x 85 inches", "text": "SUP Paddle by Advanced Elements 224949 Features: Constructed with a 2-part aluminum shaft that breaks down to 95 cm for easier storage Ripped blade shape for improved stiffness Adjustable pin-lock length adjustment ranges from 170 to 210 cm Specifications: Weight: 2 lb 10 oz Blade dimensions: 16 x 85 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21oLTePShKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WEZ8FI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADVANCED ELEMENTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Standup Paddleboarding", "Standup Paddles"]], "price": 63.99}}
{"item_id": "B003WG0PB8", "title": "GHOST Maritime Spring Cups for Glocks", "description": "Fits All Glock Models GEN1-4. Maritime/Marine Spring Cups enable your Glock to shoot underwater and under hostile environmental conditions. Self cleans the firing pin channel on live fire and ensures that even with water and or debris inside your Glocks firing pin channel your Glock pistol will fire! Great for those who prefer a Glock for predators on shore as well as in the water. FYI: Glock, that's right I said GLOCK (not Ghost) will only sell this item to law enforcement agencies & the military for official use and requires a letter on agency letterhead. We have them in stock and we will sell them to all law abiding individuals for a limited time. This is the one item that is specified by teams that are on the tip of the spear! These are called the million dollar parts. Because if you loose one your pistol is worthless. So it's worth a million bucks to have a spare set. These parts work on all Glocks- 1 size fits all!", "text": "GHOST Maritime Spring Cups for Glocks Fits All Glock Models GEN1-4. Maritime/Marine Spring Cups enable your Glock to shoot underwater and under hostile environmental conditions. Self cleans the firing pin channel on live fire and ensures that even with water and or debris inside your Glocks firing pin channel your Glock pistol will fire! Great for those who prefer a Glock for predators on shore as well as in the water. FYI: Glock, that's right I said GLOCK (not Ghost) will only sell this item to law enforcement agencies & the military for official use and requires a letter on agency letterhead. We have them in stock and we will sell them to all law abiding individuals for a limited time. This is the one item that is specified by teams that are on the tip of the spear! These are called the million dollar parts. Because if you loose one your pistol is worthless. So it's worth a million bucks to have a spare set. These parts work on all Glocks- 1 size fits all!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21gkTJtqyxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WG0PB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ghost", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 13.96}}
{"item_id": "B003WG2QHO", "title": "GHOST Ghost Armorer Tool 2 Piece Kit for Glocks.", "description": "The Ghost Armorer Tool Kit is our own 2.5 mm punch with our own orange armorer's plate. This is all you need to disassemble and/or diagnose any and all Glock problems. Great for installing all our trigger products.", "text": "GHOST Ghost Armorer Tool 2 Piece Kit for Glocks. The Ghost Armorer Tool Kit is our own 2.5 mm punch with our own orange armorer's plate. This is all you need to disassemble and/or diagnose any and all Glock problems. Great for installing all our trigger products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21oxsha9kCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WG2QHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ghost", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B003WG95H8", "title": "Gen 1-3 Grip Plug for Medium & Large Frames Glocks 17 19 20 21 22 23 24 25 31 32 34 35", "description": "Does NOT fit generation 4 models. The Sure Plug designed to keep dirt and debris out of the action of your Glock also serves as a magazine funnel to aid in reloading and prevents the butt of the Glock from ripping through your shirts. Fits: gen 1, 2, 3. Models 17,19,20,21,22,23,31,32,34,35,37,38-Does not fit the 21-SF!", "text": "Gen 1-3 Grip Plug for Medium & Large Frames Glocks 17 19 20 21 22 23 24 25 31 32 34 35 Does NOT fit generation 4 models. The Sure Plug designed to keep dirt and debris out of the action of your Glock also serves as a magazine funnel to aid in reloading and prevents the butt of the Glock from ripping through your shirts. Fits: gen 1, 2, 3. Models 17,19,20,21,22,23,31,32,34,35,37,38-Does not fit the 21-SF!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EY1By7UlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WG95H8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sure Plug", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B003WGB51C", "title": "A.R.M.S. #71L series, Front and Rear Sights Set. Black", "description": "-Designed to allow attachment to all Universal Dovetail 1913 and Weaver style Rails.-Both are made from durable, metal-reinforced polymer and are a good option when seeking a quality sight.-Both are .610\" when in the folded position, from the top of the r", "text": "A.R.M.S. #71L series, Front and Rear Sights Set. Black -Designed to allow attachment to all Universal Dovetail 1913 and Weaver style Rails.-Both are made from durable, metal-reinforced polymer and are a good option when seeking a quality sight.-Both are .610\" when in the folded position, from the top of the r", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hqCZSBMHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WGB51C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mars", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 96.08}}
{"item_id": "B003WGL314", "title": "Hammerhead Rifle Tool", "description": "This HammerHead Rifle Tool is proudly made in America utilizing the best materials and processes. We offer a limited LIFETIME warranty. Should your HammerHead Rifle Tool fail due to issues associated with workmanship or materials we will replace it free of charge. We will not cover damage from abuse, neglect or utilizing the tool other than as intended. This warranty applies to the original owner/purchaser. Determination of replacement under warranty related claims shall be at the sole discretion of HammerHead Tool.", "text": "Hammerhead Rifle Tool This HammerHead Rifle Tool is proudly made in America utilizing the best materials and processes. We offer a limited LIFETIME warranty. Should your HammerHead Rifle Tool fail due to issues associated with workmanship or materials we will replace it free of charge. We will not cover damage from abuse, neglect or utilizing the tool other than as intended. This warranty applies to the original owner/purchaser. Determination of replacement under warranty related claims shall be at the sole discretion of HammerHead Tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11vvtWHDwYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WGL314.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003WGUEEG", "title": "Upper Bounce Trampoline Jumping Mat fits for Round Frame", "description": "Bring back your Trampoline bounce with this New Strong \"Upper Bounce\" Trampoline Jumping Mat. \"Upper Bounce\" Jumping Mats are especially designed to fit Trampoline Frames from all brands and models. Trampoline Jumping Mat features ultra-durability through its premium PP Mesh Material. Furthermore, our Jumping Mat also provides extra security with its 8 row stitching thus guaranteeing the mat from tearing. Upper Bounce High Quality Jumping Mat is guaranteed to be UV water resistant, offering you a safer long-lasting fun investment. Material: Heavy Duty Premium Polypropylene Mesh Material has 8 row stitching, which provides extra security that prevents the mat from tearing and guaranteed to enjoy for many years. Mat: Made in the USA. 6 Month manufacturer's warranty Color: Black.", "text": "Upper Bounce Trampoline Jumping Mat fits for Round Frame Bring back your Trampoline bounce with this New Strong \"Upper Bounce\" Trampoline Jumping Mat. \"Upper Bounce\" Jumping Mats are especially designed to fit Trampoline Frames from all brands and models. Trampoline Jumping Mat features ultra-durability through its premium PP Mesh Material. Furthermore, our Jumping Mat also provides extra security with its 8 row stitching thus guaranteeing the mat from tearing. Upper Bounce High Quality Jumping Mat is guaranteed to be UV water resistant, offering you a safer long-lasting fun investment. Material: Heavy Duty Premium Polypropylene Mesh Material has 8 row stitching, which provides extra security that prevents the mat from tearing and guaranteed to enjoy for many years. Mat: Made in the USA. 6 Month manufacturer's warranty Color: Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411b1fGDTeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WGUEEG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003WHA0EO", "title": "Muddy Outdoors Safeguard Harness , Black", "description": "The Muddy Safeguard is the lightest harness on the market weighing 1.9 lbs. This tangle free harness comes with everything you need to climb and hunt safely. The super-silent, rubber coated parachute buckles give you a rock solid connection. Muddy is the only harness that does not use metal to metal buckles. The cam buckles are infinitely adjustable and simply lock without any noise. Our cinch, strap adjustments on the vertical chest straps and waist belt ensure a perfect fit. The Youth harness also includes the integrated binocular straps. are provided so there is no need to buy or carry anything else to the tree. Fits sizes up to: Height: 5' 10\" Waist: 34\" Weight: 250lbs. All harnesses are TMA certified.", "text": "Muddy Outdoors Safeguard Harness , Black The Muddy Safeguard is the lightest harness on the market weighing 1.9 lbs. This tangle free harness comes with everything you need to climb and hunt safely. The super-silent, rubber coated parachute buckles give you a rock solid connection. Muddy is the only harness that does not use metal to metal buckles. The cam buckles are infinitely adjustable and simply lock without any noise. Our cinch, strap adjustments on the vertical chest straps and waist belt ensure a perfect fit. The Youth harness also includes the integrated binocular straps. are provided so there is no need to buy or carry anything else to the tree. Fits sizes up to: Height: 5' 10\" Waist: 34\" Weight: 250lbs. All harnesses are TMA certified.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XyTEnSHvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHA0EO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003WHA1N4", "title": "Field Logic Hurricane Archery Bag Target Large H28", "description": "The Hurricane Bag Target has a high visibility design. The deer vitals are on back side for realistic practice. Tri-Core Technology for un matched performance. Shoot the yes of the Hurricane!", "text": "Field Logic Hurricane Archery Bag Target Large H28 The Hurricane Bag Target has a high visibility design. The deer vitals are on back side for realistic practice. Tri-Core Technology for un matched performance. Shoot the yes of the Hurricane!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v9tRexg5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHA1N4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Logic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 69.06}}
{"item_id": "B003WHHXAS", "title": "Grim Reaper Razor Cut SS Whitetail Special 2-Inch 3 Blade, 100 Grain", "description": "Designed for whitetail size game and turkey our 2-Inch cut, 3 blade, 100 grain Grim Reaper Razor cut Whitetail Special is absolutely devastating giving you huge holes and massive blood trails!", "text": "Grim Reaper Razor Cut SS Whitetail Special 2-Inch 3 Blade, 100 Grain Designed for whitetail size game and turkey our 2-Inch cut, 3 blade, 100 grain Grim Reaper Razor cut Whitetail Special is absolutely devastating giving you huge holes and massive blood trails!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oUQ5lEd2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHHXAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grim Reaper Broadheads", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 37.45}}
{"item_id": "B003WHJ0QI", "title": "Conquest Scents EverCalm Deer Herd Scent Stick", "description": "HOW WE DISCOVERED THE FIRST CALMING SCENT.While cleaning stalls at our deer farm, an employee realized he was late for his evening hunt. Without time to change, he wore his overalls on stand. Soon, he was surrounded by deer that, even as he purposely moved, were not particularly alarmed. When he reported that he could have easily harvested any of the deer we realized that it must be the scent from the stalls! A CALM DEER IS LESS LIKELY TO SMELL, SEE OR HEAR YOU.EverCalm is a collection of scents and smells from deer bedding areas. These scents and smells put deer at ease. A calm animal feels safe and isless likely to detect you. Apply EverCalm to your boots, clothing, trees, scent pad, stand, blind, decoy, camera, scrapes or licking branches.USE ALL SEASON LONG.Deer use bedding areas all year long so EverCalm is effective all season long. Use EverCalm every time you hunt!NO SPILLS. NO LEAKS. NO MESS. NO PRESERVATIVES.EverCalm’s wax-stick formula prevents accidental leaks in your backpack and smelly scent on your fingers. And, unlike bottled scents, aConQuest scent stick requires no preservatives so you get 100% pure, unpreserved scent! ConQuest scents are encapsulated in wax. As youwipe the stick (like deodorant), scent is released. The wax formula is also weather resistant so it won’t wash away in rain or dew like liquid scent.", "text": "Conquest Scents EverCalm Deer Herd Scent Stick HOW WE DISCOVERED THE FIRST CALMING SCENT.While cleaning stalls at our deer farm, an employee realized he was late for his evening hunt. Without time to change, he wore his overalls on stand. Soon, he was surrounded by deer that, even as he purposely moved, were not particularly alarmed. When he reported that he could have easily harvested any of the deer we realized that it must be the scent from the stalls! A CALM DEER IS LESS LIKELY TO SMELL, SEE OR HEAR YOU.EverCalm is a collection of scents and smells from deer bedding areas. These scents and smells put deer at ease. A calm animal feels safe and isless likely to detect you. Apply EverCalm to your boots, clothing, trees, scent pad, stand, blind, decoy, camera, scrapes or licking branches.USE ALL SEASON LONG.Deer use bedding areas all year long so EverCalm is effective all season long. Use EverCalm every time you hunt!NO SPILLS. NO LEAKS. NO MESS. NO PRESERVATIVES.EverCalm’s wax-stick formula prevents accidental leaks in your backpack and smelly scent on your fingers. And, unlike bottled scents, aConQuest scent stick requires no preservatives so you get 100% pure, unpreserved scent! ConQuest scents are encapsulated in wax. As youwipe the stick (like deodorant), scent is released. The wax formula is also weather resistant so it won’t wash away in rain or dew like liquid scent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B376NyU5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHJ0QI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Conquest Scents", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scents"]], "price": 16.41}}
{"item_id": "B003WHL6RO", "title": "30-06 Outdoors String Snot Bow String Wax", "description": ".30 - 06 Outdoors String Snot Bowstring Wax. Gross name, exceptional performance. Engineered to improve performance, String Snot String Wax is 100% odorless, 100% waterproof. Reduces string flaring and feathering. Lightweight and easy to apply. Non-freezing, non-flammable. Made in the USA. Order yours today! .30-06 Outdoors String Snot Bowstring Wax", "text": "30-06 Outdoors String Snot Bow String Wax .30 - 06 Outdoors String Snot Bowstring Wax. Gross name, exceptional performance. Engineered to improve performance, String Snot String Wax is 100% odorless, 100% waterproof. Reduces string flaring and feathering. Lightweight and easy to apply. Non-freezing, non-flammable. Made in the USA. Order yours today! .30-06 Outdoors String Snot Bowstring Wax", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K8NFJTn-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHL6RO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "30-06 Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bowstrings"]], "price": 3.29}}
{"item_id": "B003WHNGMC", "title": "Summit Deluxe Side Bags - Realtree", "description": "Two zippered storage bags for your hunting stands. Bags are tapered to fit neatly under the armrests on all Summit stands. They also fit many other brands of treestands on the market.", "text": "Summit Deluxe Side Bags - Realtree Two zippered storage bags for your hunting stands. Bags are tapered to fit neatly under the armrests on all Summit stands. They also fit many other brands of treestands on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51L5K7ubAyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WHNGMC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stand Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003WI31YE", "title": "DUAL SIDE 45 DEGREE ANGLE OFFSET SEE-THRU RAIL MOUNT", "description": "Problem install your tactical gear on difficult angle? Lack of space for additional gears? With dual side 45 degree offset see-thru rail mount you can install all your tactical accessory without any problem. MATERIAL TYPE: ALUMINUM RAIL TYPE: PICATINNY WEAVER RAIL BASE: PICTIALNNY WEAVER RABBET SPACE: 5 RAIL LENGTH (inch):2.1 COLOR: BLACK NET WEIGHT (OZ): 2.1", "text": "DUAL SIDE 45 DEGREE ANGLE OFFSET SEE-THRU RAIL MOUNT Problem install your tactical gear on difficult angle? Lack of space for additional gears? With dual side 45 degree offset see-thru rail mount you can install all your tactical accessory without any problem. MATERIAL TYPE: ALUMINUM RAIL TYPE: PICATINNY WEAVER RAIL BASE: PICTIALNNY WEAVER RABBET SPACE: 5 RAIL LENGTH (inch):2.1 COLOR: BLACK NET WEIGHT (OZ): 2.1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O9q8cQq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WI31YE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CoiTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 18.99}}
