{"item_id": "B003WP2TP4", "title": "Gamo PT-85 Blowback SOCOM Pellet Pistol with Quad Rail and Compensator", "description": "Equipped with an innovative Blowback feature, the PT-85 Blowback Socom CO2-powered air pistol delivers a realistic action and an authentic look and feel when shooting. The Blowback pistol accomplishes this by using a small portion of air to move the slide backward when firing. As a result, you'll feel like you're shooting the real thing. The PT-85 Socom also includes an extended rifled steel barrel, a textured grip, and a 16-pellet double magazine. The pistol is capable of shooting at velocities of up to 560 feet per second with Gamo PBA platinum pellets.Note: The extended barrel is designed for added velocity. It is not a silencer and does provide any noise reduction. The extended barrel must remain installed in order to shoot pistol. Only standard-skirt pellets should be used with the PT-85 Blowback pistols. To avoid damaging your magazine, never use long-skirt pellets, such as: Red Fire, Blue Flame, Glow Fire, PBA Bullet, or TS-10.SpecificationsSights: Fixed with reflective white dot (rear)Optics: Fixed with tactical mounting railsVelocity: Up to 560 fpsCaliber: 0.177Ammunition: 0.177-caliber pelletsLength: 14.925 inchesWeight: 2.32 poundsWarning:Airguns are not toys. Airguns are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "text": "Gamo PT-85 Blowback SOCOM Pellet Pistol with Quad Rail and Compensator Equipped with an innovative Blowback feature, the PT-85 Blowback Socom CO2-powered air pistol delivers a realistic action and an authentic look and feel when shooting. The Blowback pistol accomplishes this by using a small portion of air to move the slide backward when firing. As a result, you'll feel like you're shooting the real thing. The PT-85 Socom also includes an extended rifled steel barrel, a textured grip, and a 16-pellet double magazine. The pistol is capable of shooting at velocities of up to 560 feet per second with Gamo PBA platinum pellets.Note: The extended barrel is designed for added velocity. It is not a silencer and does provide any noise reduction. The extended barrel must remain installed in order to shoot pistol. Only standard-skirt pellets should be used with the PT-85 Blowback pistols. To avoid damaging your magazine, never use long-skirt pellets, such as: Red Fire, Blue Flame, Glow Fire, PBA Bullet, or TS-10.SpecificationsSights: Fixed with reflective white dot (rear)Optics: Fixed with tactical mounting railsVelocity: Up to 560 fpsCaliber: 0.177Ammunition: 0.177-caliber pelletsLength: 14.925 inchesWeight: 2.32 poundsWarning:Airguns are not toys. Airguns are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qbuv2%2BJsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WP2TP4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003WP7C38", "title": "Gamo PT-85 Blowback Pellet Pistol", "description": "Equipped with an innovative Blowback feature, the PT-85 CO2-powered air pistol delivers a realistic action and an authentic look and feel when shooting. The Blowback pistol accomplishes this by using a small portion of air to move the slide backward when firing. As a result, you'll feel like you're shooting the real thing. The PT-85 also includes a rifled steel barrel, a textured grip, and a 16-pellet double magazine. The pistol is capable of shooting at velocities of up to 450 feet per second with Gamo PBA platinum pellets.Only standard-skirt pellets should be used with PT-85 Blowback pistols. To avoid damaging the magazine, never use long-skirt pellets, such as Red Fire, Blue Flame, Glow Fire, PBA Bullet, or TS-10.SpecificationsSights: Fixed with reflective white dotsVelocity: Up to 450 fpsCaliber: 0.177Ammunition: 0.177-caliber pelletsLength: 7.8 inchesWeight: 1.5 poundsWarning:Airguns are not toys. Airguns are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "text": "Gamo PT-85 Blowback Pellet Pistol Equipped with an innovative Blowback feature, the PT-85 CO2-powered air pistol delivers a realistic action and an authentic look and feel when shooting. The Blowback pistol accomplishes this by using a small portion of air to move the slide backward when firing. As a result, you'll feel like you're shooting the real thing. The PT-85 also includes a rifled steel barrel, a textured grip, and a 16-pellet double magazine. The pistol is capable of shooting at velocities of up to 450 feet per second with Gamo PBA platinum pellets.Only standard-skirt pellets should be used with PT-85 Blowback pistols. To avoid damaging the magazine, never use long-skirt pellets, such as Red Fire, Blue Flame, Glow Fire, PBA Bullet, or TS-10.SpecificationsSights: Fixed with reflective white dotsVelocity: Up to 450 fpsCaliber: 0.177Ammunition: 0.177-caliber pelletsLength: 7.8 inchesWeight: 1.5 poundsWarning:Airguns are not toys. Airguns are recommended for use by those 16 years of age or older. Adult supervision required. Misuse or careless use may cause serious injury. Do not brandish or display your airgun in public. It may confuse people and it may be a crime. Police and others may think an airgun is a firearm. Do not change the coloration or markings to make it look more like a firearm. Buyer and user should conform to all laws governing the use and ownership of their airgun. The person handling the airgun and anyone nearby should always wear protective eyewear. Read all instructions before using. Always use care and shoot safely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-33xE6fUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WP7C38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 94.94}}
{"item_id": "B003WPUU0U", "title": "Casio Men's GA100-1A1 Black Resin Quartz Watch with Black Dial [Watch] Casio", "description": "For 25 years Casio G-Shock digital watches are the ultimate tough watch. Providing durable, waterproof mens digital watches for every activity. G-Shock is the ultimate tough watch. It was born from a developer's dream of \"creating a watch that never breaks.\" Guided by a \"Triple 10\" development concept, the design teams sought a watch with 10-meter free-fall endurance, 10-bar water resistance and a 10-year battery life.Living up to G-Shock's reputation for big case designs, comes a revolution in case size with the introduction of the X-Large G. Black resin band digital and analog watch with black face.Shock Resistant200M Water ResistantAnti-Magnetic Structure1/1000th Second Stopwatch with Speed IndicatorHourly Time SignalAuto-Calendar (pre-programmed until the year 2099)Daily Alarm 4 daily and 1 snooze alarmModule 5081Approx. Battery Life 2 yearsBattery CR1220Countdown TimerShock ResistBacklight Auto LED light with afterglow12/24-Hour FormatsAccuracy +/- 15 seconds per monthMagnetic ResistantWorld Time 29 times zones (48 cities + UTC)Stopwatch 1/1000 Second", "text": "Casio Men's GA100-1A1 Black Resin Quartz Watch with Black Dial [Watch] Casio For 25 years Casio G-Shock digital watches are the ultimate tough watch. Providing durable, waterproof mens digital watches for every activity. G-Shock is the ultimate tough watch. It was born from a developer's dream of \"creating a watch that never breaks.\" Guided by a \"Triple 10\" development concept, the design teams sought a watch with 10-meter free-fall endurance, 10-bar water resistance and a 10-year battery life.Living up to G-Shock's reputation for big case designs, comes a revolution in case size with the introduction of the X-Large G. Black resin band digital and analog watch with black face.Shock Resistant200M Water ResistantAnti-Magnetic Structure1/1000th Second Stopwatch with Speed IndicatorHourly Time SignalAuto-Calendar (pre-programmed until the year 2099)Daily Alarm 4 daily and 1 snooze alarmModule 5081Approx. Battery Life 2 yearsBattery CR1220Countdown TimerShock ResistBacklight Auto LED light with afterglow12/24-Hour FormatsAccuracy +/- 15 seconds per monthMagnetic ResistantWorld Time 29 times zones (48 cities + UTC)Stopwatch 1/1000 Second", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SaVPxmJkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WPUU0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Jewelry & Watches", "Watches"]], "price": 91.92}}
{"item_id": "B003WU4OOI", "title": "Hydro Flask Standard Mouth Sport Cap, Black", "description": "Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "text": "Hydro Flask Standard Mouth Sport Cap, Black Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ae2gdv0cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WU4OOI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]]}}
