{"item_id": "B003WXR992", "title": "Kelty Tactical Falcon 4000 Backpack", "description": "The Falcon 4000 is ideal for patrols that require high- or low-volume gear storage and organization. Compatible with Kelty satellite radio and battery holders, (sold separately) this top-load pack had front-panel access and a lid that converts into a fanny pack or shoulder-strap pack organizer.Packbag Features:Compatible with Kelty satellite radio and battery holders that are sold separatelyTop-load and front-panel accessLid converts into fanny pack or shoulder-strap pack organizerLid has two U-shaped zippers and one map pocketInternal divider unzips into one main compartmentKey clipZippered stash pocket inside top lidLarge zippered mesh pocket on the bottom side of top lidSecondary low-profile hood stows into storm collar pocketLarge zippered mesh pocket under low-profile hoodDual hydration ports and reservoir sleeves for hydration bladdersMOLLE on front and sidesLarge front pocket with internal organizationExtra-large, fleece-lined pocket accommodates wrap-style sunglasses or gogglesInternal zippered mesh pocketDouble haul loops on backpanelSide compression strapsSpindrift collarIce-axe loopDrain holesRain/sand pack cover stows away in zippered pocketRemovable pack cover is two toneCoyote Brown pack has desert tan and white raincoverDesert Tan pack has desert tan and white raincoverSuspension Features:Adjustable suspensionAluminum staysHDPE frame sheetBreathable backpanel with SpacermeshPadded backpanelTwo-layer padded waistbeltPadded shoulder strapsLoad-lifter strapsAdjustable sternum strapQuick-release shoulder strapsBelt stabilizersScherer Cinch (US Pat #5,465,886) waistbelt adjustmentSpecifications:Weight: 6 pounds, 14 ouncesWeight without Lid: 5 pounds, 15 ouncesDimensions: 32 by 14 by 12.5 inches (L x W x H)Volume: 4000 cubic inchesVolume with Low-Volume Hood: 3620 cubic inchesTorso Fit Range: 16 to 21 inchesBody Fabric: 500D kodra and 1000D nylon kodra", "text": "Kelty Tactical Falcon 4000 Backpack The Falcon 4000 is ideal for patrols that require high- or low-volume gear storage and organization. Compatible with Kelty satellite radio and battery holders, (sold separately) this top-load pack had front-panel access and a lid that converts into a fanny pack or shoulder-strap pack organizer.Packbag Features:Compatible with Kelty satellite radio and battery holders that are sold separatelyTop-load and front-panel accessLid converts into fanny pack or shoulder-strap pack organizerLid has two U-shaped zippers and one map pocketInternal divider unzips into one main compartmentKey clipZippered stash pocket inside top lidLarge zippered mesh pocket on the bottom side of top lidSecondary low-profile hood stows into storm collar pocketLarge zippered mesh pocket under low-profile hoodDual hydration ports and reservoir sleeves for hydration bladdersMOLLE on front and sidesLarge front pocket with internal organizationExtra-large, fleece-lined pocket accommodates wrap-style sunglasses or gogglesInternal zippered mesh pocketDouble haul loops on backpanelSide compression strapsSpindrift collarIce-axe loopDrain holesRain/sand pack cover stows away in zippered pocketRemovable pack cover is two toneCoyote Brown pack has desert tan and white raincoverDesert Tan pack has desert tan and white raincoverSuspension Features:Adjustable suspensionAluminum staysHDPE frame sheetBreathable backpanel with SpacermeshPadded backpanelTwo-layer padded waistbeltPadded shoulder strapsLoad-lifter strapsAdjustable sternum strapQuick-release shoulder strapsBelt stabilizersScherer Cinch (US Pat #5,465,886) waistbelt adjustmentSpecifications:Weight: 6 pounds, 14 ouncesWeight without Lid: 5 pounds, 15 ouncesDimensions: 32 by 14 by 12.5 inches (L x W x H)Volume: 4000 cubic inchesVolume with Low-Volume Hood: 3620 cubic inchesTorso Fit Range: 16 to 21 inchesBody Fabric: 500D kodra and 1000D nylon kodra", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gyvcgGLPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WXR992.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 300.0}}
{"item_id": "B003WY1CNK", "title": "Nalgene 20-Ounce Multidrink Water Bottle", "description": "Nalgene’s newest bottle combines two different ways to enjoy water, sports drinks and other beverages through the convenience of both a high-flow spot and a straw. The high-flow port allows the user to drink from the Multi-Drink like the OTG (On The Go) bottles, but also add the convenience of a straw for added pleasure. No more tilting the bottle upside down to get the rest of the drink", "text": "Nalgene 20-Ounce Multidrink Water Bottle Nalgene’s newest bottle combines two different ways to enjoy water, sports drinks and other beverages through the convenience of both a high-flow spot and a straw. The high-flow port allows the user to drink from the Multi-Drink like the OTG (On The Go) bottles, but also add the convenience of a straw for added pleasure. No more tilting the bottle upside down to get the rest of the drink", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411tT1PMRbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003WY1CNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 10.18}}
{"item_id": "B003X082A4", "title": "Simmons LRF 600 Laser Rangefinder", "description": "The LRF 600 is hairsplitting accuracy made simple. An in-view LCD display provides the exact distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards with the tap of a single button, while 4x magnification and bright, crystal-clear optics bring you nose to nose with your next trophy. Its efficient, compact vertical design and weather-resistant housing provide an unparalleled advantage that's easy to carry.Features:In-view LCD display provides the exact distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards4x magnificationBright, crystal-clear opticsEfficient, compact vertical designWeather-resistant housingSpecifications:Range of Magnification: 4xRange: 600 yardsAccuracy: +/- 1 yardWeight: 9.8 ouncesBattery Type and Number: 9-voltBatteries Included: NoAccessories: Carrying case", "text": "Simmons LRF 600 Laser Rangefinder The LRF 600 is hairsplitting accuracy made simple. An in-view LCD display provides the exact distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards with the tap of a single button, while 4x magnification and bright, crystal-clear optics bring you nose to nose with your next trophy. Its efficient, compact vertical design and weather-resistant housing provide an unparalleled advantage that's easy to carry.Features:In-view LCD display provides the exact distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards4x magnificationBright, crystal-clear opticsEfficient, compact vertical designWeather-resistant housingSpecifications:Range of Magnification: 4xRange: 600 yardsAccuracy: +/- 1 yardWeight: 9.8 ouncesBattery Type and Number: 9-voltBatteries Included: NoAccessories: Carrying case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JZzORzrxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003X082A4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B003X0REY4", "title": "PRO IMPACT Boxing/MMA Handwraps 180\" Mexican Style Elastic 1 Pair BLACK", "description": "PRO IMPACT MEXICAN STYLE HANDWRAPS - Special thumb loop with \"This Side Down\" markings for correct wrapping", "text": "PRO IMPACT Boxing/MMA Handwraps 180\" Mexican Style Elastic 1 Pair BLACK PRO IMPACT MEXICAN STYLE HANDWRAPS - Special thumb loop with \"This Side Down\" markings for correct wrapping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GMxqp2TRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003X0REY4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Impact", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B003X5D9DY", "title": "Security Box for Bushnell Trophy Cam for Standard IR Cameras", "description": "These are security boxes manufactured by CAMLOCKbox that fit the Bushnell Trophy Cams. These boxes enclose the cameras as much as possible to keep out natures elements. The boxes are high quality 16-gauge steel with a baked on powder coat finish with additional camo break-up paint over that. Boxes can be lagbolted, bungeed or belted to the tree. These boxes are also compatible with python cables and are lockable with padlocks for added security. Snug camera fit allows camera removal and installation with the camera pointing back to the original spot. Fits all standard IR Bushnell Trophy Cams", "text": "Security Box for Bushnell Trophy Cam for Standard IR Cameras These are security boxes manufactured by CAMLOCKbox that fit the Bushnell Trophy Cams. These boxes enclose the cameras as much as possible to keep out natures elements. The boxes are high quality 16-gauge steel with a baked on powder coat finish with additional camo break-up paint over that. Boxes can be lagbolted, bungeed or belted to the tree. These boxes are also compatible with python cables and are lockable with padlocks for added security. Snug camera fit allows camera removal and installation with the camera pointing back to the original spot. Fits all standard IR Bushnell Trophy Cams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sdBDS4WVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003X5D9DY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamLockBox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 31.09}}
{"item_id": "B003X5HEJY", "title": "Ironman LX 300 Inversion Table", "description": "Reliable basic inversion table for better back health and circulation Achieve results through 5- to 10-minute sessions daily 1.5-inch square steel stays put during inversion sessions .75-inch thick foam on the backrest prevents injury or discomfort Foam rollers and ankle cushions for complete security and safety Simple pull-pin release mechanism for easy operation Strap adjustment of inversion angle for changing fitness routines Easy-grip covered handle bars for simple, safe return to upright body position Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee area for complete details Square steel frame with comfortable padding. Adjustable inversion angle - strap included. Extra security via foam rollers and ankle cushions. Accommodates users 4'10\" to 6'6\" tall; up to 275 lbs.. Manufacturer's warranty included.", "text": "Ironman LX 300 Inversion Table Reliable basic inversion table for better back health and circulation Achieve results through 5- to 10-minute sessions daily 1.5-inch square steel stays put during inversion sessions .75-inch thick foam on the backrest prevents injury or discomfort Foam rollers and ankle cushions for complete security and safety Simple pull-pin release mechanism for easy operation Strap adjustment of inversion angle for changing fitness routines Easy-grip covered handle bars for simple, safe return to upright body position Manufacturer's warranty included - see Product Guarantee area for complete details Square steel frame with comfortable padding. Adjustable inversion angle - strap included. Extra security via foam rollers and ankle cushions. Accommodates users 4'10\" to 6'6\" tall; up to 275 lbs.. Manufacturer's warranty included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r-tcQNZFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003X5HEJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IronMan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 139.98}}
{"item_id": "B003XA1454", "title": "Magnum Pocket Kukri Knife", "description": "This monstrous knife feels like a pocket sword. Perfect for light chopping or carving, or any other outdoor task. Blade length: 4 5/8\". Overall length: 10 3/8\". Weight: 7.5 oz.", "text": "Magnum Pocket Kukri Knife This monstrous knife feels like a pocket sword. Perfect for light chopping or carving, or any other outdoor task. Blade length: 4 5/8\". Overall length: 10 3/8\". Weight: 7.5 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317Gn1e0xyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XA1454.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.93}}
{"item_id": "B003XA3CZE", "title": "Boker Plus Anti-MC Folding Knife", "description": "The unique combination of the most modern materials grants an exceptional position in the knife market. The blade of the Boker Plus Anti-Mc is made of hi-tech ceramic, which is 100% nonmagnetic and provides outstanding edge retention and corrosion resistance. The handle is made of lightweight, durable, corrosion resistant titanium, and features an integral frame lock mechanism. A pocket knife with truly unique qualities! Includes pocket clip and lanyard hole for secure handling. Weighs 2.5 ounce.", "text": "Boker Plus Anti-MC Folding Knife The unique combination of the most modern materials grants an exceptional position in the knife market. The blade of the Boker Plus Anti-Mc is made of hi-tech ceramic, which is 100% nonmagnetic and provides outstanding edge retention and corrosion resistance. The handle is made of lightweight, durable, corrosion resistant titanium, and features an integral frame lock mechanism. A pocket knife with truly unique qualities! Includes pocket clip and lanyard hole for secure handling. Weighs 2.5 ounce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d8FBKLwmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XA3CZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 51.14}}
{"item_id": "B003XAMW78", "title": "Rothco MOLLE Modular Holster", "description": "Keep your pistol secured and easy to access with this modular holster. Equipped with two MOLLE straps you can place your pistol securely anywhere on your MOLLE gear. The holster is made out of 600D nylon and is compatible with both right and left hand shooters. An elastic cord keeps the handgun in place and also featured is a MOLLE compatible removable magazine pouch. Fits most full size automatic handguns.Please note, this holster is designed for use with MOLLE compatible load bearing systems, such as assault vests, plate carriers, chest rigs and belts with MOLLE webbing. It is not designed for use on standard pistol belts.", "text": "Rothco MOLLE Modular Holster Keep your pistol secured and easy to access with this modular holster. Equipped with two MOLLE straps you can place your pistol securely anywhere on your MOLLE gear. The holster is made out of 600D nylon and is compatible with both right and left hand shooters. An elastic cord keeps the handgun in place and also featured is a MOLLE compatible removable magazine pouch. Fits most full size automatic handguns.Please note, this holster is designed for use with MOLLE compatible load bearing systems, such as assault vests, plate carriers, chest rigs and belts with MOLLE webbing. It is not designed for use on standard pistol belts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515HxMCO3HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XAMW78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B003XDL5QO", "title": "Shimano Ultegra CN-6701 Chain", "description": "Run the Shimano Ultegra CN-6701 Chain in between the twister and the twistee for reliable, fast-shifting performance thanks to the innovative Hyper-Glide system. Shift pins and ramps on Shimano chainrings and cassettes mesh perfectly with the Ultegra chain, ensuring you won't miss a shift when riding aggressively.Product FeaturesMaterial:Connection:Width:Compatible Components: 10-speed drivetrainsWeight: (116 links) 272 gRecommended Use: optimizing your ultegra buildManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "Shimano Ultegra CN-6701 Chain Run the Shimano Ultegra CN-6701 Chain in between the twister and the twistee for reliable, fast-shifting performance thanks to the innovative Hyper-Glide system. Shift pins and ramps on Shimano chainrings and cassettes mesh perfectly with the Ultegra chain, ensuring you won't miss a shift when riding aggressively.Product FeaturesMaterial:Connection:Width:Compatible Components: 10-speed drivetrainsWeight: (116 links) 272 gRecommended Use: optimizing your ultegra buildManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iaEJIp%2BGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XDL5QO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]], "price": 33.29}}
