{"item_id": "B003XFQVW0", "title": "Sunny Threaded Solid Chrome Curl Bar (47-Inch)", "description": "Perform a variety of exercises with this threaded solid curl bar. Bar for use with standard weight plates. Comes with 2 collars. Single-piece inside collars. Medium depth diamond knurled grips. Adequate sleeve length for easy and safe workouts.", "text": "Sunny Threaded Solid Chrome Curl Bar (47-Inch) Perform a variety of exercises with this threaded solid curl bar. Bar for use with standard weight plates. Comes with 2 collars. Single-piece inside collars. Medium depth diamond knurled grips. Adequate sleeve length for easy and safe workouts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318Nz0RVuxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XFQVW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 32.98}}
{"item_id": "B003XFXOPM", "title": "Sunny Chrome Dumbbell Bar, 14-Inch (Sold As Pair)", "description": "This bar allows you to increase or decrease the intensity of your workout without having to own several dumbbells. Whether doing bicep curls, shoulder shrugs, or any number of workouts, this is an excellent choice.", "text": "Sunny Chrome Dumbbell Bar, 14-Inch (Sold As Pair) This bar allows you to increase or decrease the intensity of your workout without having to own several dumbbells. Whether doing bicep curls, shoulder shrugs, or any number of workouts, this is an excellent choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tAsbefgYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XFXOPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 46.93}}
{"item_id": "B003XI5RYK", "title": "Guard Dog Security Cell Phone Stun Gun (2,700,000 Volts)", "description": "Catch your attacker off guard with the Cell Phone Stun Gun from Guard Dog Security. With the look and feel of a real cell phone, this stun gun is easy to carry and easy to use. With 2,700,000 volts of electricity, the Stun Gun will effectively short-circuit the attacker's nervous system, and allow you to get away. The stun gun is designed to work as long as you make contact with the attacker's body--and sends enough charge to work through clothing. The Cell Phone Stun Gun operates with a rechargeable battery and is easy to charge up anywhere with a wall plug-in feature. The stun gun is additionally equipped with an LED flashlight and a safety switch to prevent accidental firing. The stun gun comes with a suede carry pouch for convenience.Currently, Item can be shipped only within U.S. But this item has sales restrictriction within the following states MA, WI, MI,NJ, NY and IL in US.", "text": "Guard Dog Security Cell Phone Stun Gun (2,700,000 Volts) Catch your attacker off guard with the Cell Phone Stun Gun from Guard Dog Security. With the look and feel of a real cell phone, this stun gun is easy to carry and easy to use. With 2,700,000 volts of electricity, the Stun Gun will effectively short-circuit the attacker's nervous system, and allow you to get away. The stun gun is designed to work as long as you make contact with the attacker's body--and sends enough charge to work through clothing. The Cell Phone Stun Gun operates with a rechargeable battery and is easy to charge up anywhere with a wall plug-in feature. The stun gun is additionally equipped with an LED flashlight and a safety switch to prevent accidental firing. The stun gun comes with a suede carry pouch for convenience.Currently, Item can be shipped only within U.S. But this item has sales restrictriction within the following states MA, WI, MI,NJ, NY and IL in US.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WBikl7%2BfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XI5RYK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guard Dog Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.99}}
