{"item_id": "B003XIHVY4", "title": "ASICS Women's Cushion Low Cut Socks (3-Pack)", "description": "Remember when socks were always black or white? Well these break the mold. You'll bask not only in those unique colors, but also in features like superior moisture management, reduced slippage \"Y\" heels and mesh knit.", "text": "ASICS Women's Cushion Low Cut Socks (3-Pack) Remember when socks were always black or white? Well these break the mold. You'll bask not only in those unique colors, but also in features like superior moisture management, reduced slippage \"Y\" heels and mesh knit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V6ZR9uklL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XIHVY4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
