{"item_id": "B003XKSAJW", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 20-9353 Contractor Baseball Cap w/ Sewn on Flag", "description": "This Poplin Multicam Adjustable Flag Cap Hat by Voodoo Tactical is a high quality cap used by military personnel and civilians alike. This hat is made from a soft, comfortable poplin material and features a USA flag patch front and center. A Velcro closure makes this hat adjustable so the perfect fit can be achieved. Made for the avid outdoorsman. One size fits most adults.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 20-9353 Contractor Baseball Cap w/ Sewn on Flag This Poplin Multicam Adjustable Flag Cap Hat by Voodoo Tactical is a high quality cap used by military personnel and civilians alike. This hat is made from a soft, comfortable poplin material and features a USA flag patch front and center. A Velcro closure makes this hat adjustable so the perfect fit can be achieved. Made for the avid outdoorsman. One size fits most adults.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519%2BYvz7vDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XKSAJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003XNFMLS", "title": "WeeRide Co-Pilot Bike Trailer", "description": "Train a child how to ride a bike without dealing with training wheels with the WeeRide Co-Pilot bike trailer. The Co-Pilot--which attaches quickly and easily to almost any bicycle with a seat post--is just like a regular bike, with handlebars, a seat, and pedals for your youngster.The Co-Pilot's quick-release system detaches easily from your bike.However, you have control of the actual ride, including speed, balancing, braking, and steering, while your child tags along. It's a great way to teach basic biking skills and safety without giving up control before he or she is ready. Your son or daughter and pedal to help you along or just coast and enjoy the scenery.The Co-Pilot is equipped with a true quick-release system for quick detachment from the adult bike, along with adjustable handlebars that accommodate children of different heights. In addition, the seat is more comfortable and better built than typical bike trailer seats, so your child will want to keep riding throughout the day. And once you arrive at your destination, the arms fold up easily for compact storage. Other features include an attractive black and silver color scheme, a safety flag and handlebar pad, and a 20-inch wheel size. The Co-Pilot--which holds up to 75 pounds--weighs 24 pounds by itself and is recommended for ages 4 to 9.", "text": "WeeRide Co-Pilot Bike Trailer Train a child how to ride a bike without dealing with training wheels with the WeeRide Co-Pilot bike trailer. The Co-Pilot--which attaches quickly and easily to almost any bicycle with a seat post--is just like a regular bike, with handlebars, a seat, and pedals for your youngster.The Co-Pilot's quick-release system detaches easily from your bike.However, you have control of the actual ride, including speed, balancing, braking, and steering, while your child tags along. It's a great way to teach basic biking skills and safety without giving up control before he or she is ready. Your son or daughter and pedal to help you along or just coast and enjoy the scenery.The Co-Pilot is equipped with a true quick-release system for quick detachment from the adult bike, along with adjustable handlebars that accommodate children of different heights. In addition, the seat is more comfortable and better built than typical bike trailer seats, so your child will want to keep riding throughout the day. And once you arrive at your destination, the arms fold up easily for compact storage. Other features include an attractive black and silver color scheme, a safety flag and handlebar pad, and a 20-inch wheel size. The Co-Pilot--which holds up to 75 pounds--weighs 24 pounds by itself and is recommended for ages 4 to 9.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415KjKMPCHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XNFMLS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers"]], "price": 96.99}}
{"item_id": "B003XNWN3S", "title": "GoPong 8-Foot Portable Beer Pong / Tailgate Tables (Black, Football or American Flag)", "description": "The 8ft portable beer pong/flip cup table folds out from a compact briefcase size to 8' length so you can take them anywhere. Perfect for tailgating, house parties, bars, fraternities and more. Durable construction will withstand the test of time. Full regulation/tournament size.", "text": "GoPong 8-Foot Portable Beer Pong / Tailgate Tables (Black, Football or American Flag) The 8ft portable beer pong/flip cup table folds out from a compact briefcase size to 8' length so you can take them anywhere. Perfect for tailgating, house parties, bars, fraternities and more. Durable construction will withstand the test of time. Full regulation/tournament size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qOHO0%2BDvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XNWN3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoPong", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Arcade & Table Games", "Pong Games"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B003XO3FNE", "title": "Kershaw Little Lockback Folding Pocket Knife (Red)", "description": "Small and light, this little lockback pocket knife features a slightly up swept drop-point blade for added cutting versatility. The design provides for good slicing power plus a strong point for piercing tasks. Translucent ABS scales let you see through to the safety lockback mechanism. A lightweight and handy pocketknife with a blue, injection molded ABS handle.", "text": "Kershaw Little Lockback Folding Pocket Knife (Red) Small and light, this little lockback pocket knife features a slightly up swept drop-point blade for added cutting versatility. The design provides for good slicing power plus a strong point for piercing tasks. Translucent ABS scales let you see through to the safety lockback mechanism. A lightweight and handy pocketknife with a blue, injection molded ABS handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ok0rK5ojL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XO3FNE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
