{"item_id": "B003XPISEO", "title": "Aquasana AQ-6005 18-Ounce Glass Water Bottles, 6-Pack", "description": "A 6-pack of 18oz lead- and cadmium-free, refillable glass water bottles with BPA-free plastic caps. The glass bottles and caps are easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Glass is the best way to safely store and transport your water since it does not leach contaminants or a funny taste into the water like metal and plastic can. Made in China.", "text": "Aquasana AQ-6005 18-Ounce Glass Water Bottles, 6-Pack A 6-pack of 18oz lead- and cadmium-free, refillable glass water bottles with BPA-free plastic caps. The glass bottles and caps are easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Glass is the best way to safely store and transport your water since it does not leach contaminants or a funny taste into the water like metal and plastic can. Made in China.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fEt47w6IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003XPISEO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 39.99}}
