{"item_id": "B003Y68KNG", "title": "Grabber Outdoors Stainless Steel Adjustable Pocket Stove With 8 Fuel Tabs", "description": "The stainless steel pocket stove is a compact (3”x4”x.5”), sturdy, and lightweight (3.2 oz.) pocket size stove and is an extremely efficient cooking tool designed for a variety of uses in the outdoors. it opens to two locking positions: fully open to support a frying pan or pot, or angled position for heating a cup. plated stainless steel design is extremely durable and will not rust. two supporting side panels help block wind and direct heat upwards. store unused fuel tabs inside stove while not in use. packaged with (8) eight solid fuel tablets. fuel tabs reach up to 1400°f and burn an average of 10-12 minutes. the pocket stove is engineered to be an extremely efficient and durable cooking tool out of plated stainless steel that won’t rust. it can be taken anywhere for an easy, fast and reliable cooking surface. high performance solid fuel tablets are ultra-lightweight, compact, and light easily with ordinary matches. smokeless and odorless burn non-toxic formula, safe for environment & burns efficiently at high altitudes.", "text": "Grabber Outdoors Stainless Steel Adjustable Pocket Stove With 8 Fuel Tabs The stainless steel pocket stove is a compact (3”x4”x.5”), sturdy, and lightweight (3.2 oz.) pocket size stove and is an extremely efficient cooking tool designed for a variety of uses in the outdoors. it opens to two locking positions: fully open to support a frying pan or pot, or angled position for heating a cup. plated stainless steel design is extremely durable and will not rust. two supporting side panels help block wind and direct heat upwards. store unused fuel tabs inside stove while not in use. packaged with (8) eight solid fuel tablets. fuel tabs reach up to 1400°f and burn an average of 10-12 minutes. the pocket stove is engineered to be an extremely efficient and durable cooking tool out of plated stainless steel that won’t rust. it can be taken anywhere for an easy, fast and reliable cooking surface. high performance solid fuel tablets are ultra-lightweight, compact, and light easily with ordinary matches. smokeless and odorless burn non-toxic formula, safe for environment & burns efficiently at high altitudes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YtNrCuOBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Y68KNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRABBER OUTDOORS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 12.67}}
{"item_id": "B003Y71V2C", "title": "Firefield 2.5 Riflescope with Red Laser", "description": "The Firefield Riflescope with Red Laser is equipped with a Green/Red Illuminated Mil Dot reticle that is used for range estimation to help find the distance between the shooter and the target. Precision multi-coated optics are the distinguishing feature of the Firefield Tactical Riflescope line and offers the clearest view in both bright and low light situations. Featuring a built in 5mW red laser, the Firefield Riflescope, is used for quick target acquisition in rapid changing environments, so it hits the target every time with precision accuracy. The lowest magnification setting at 2.5x can be used for scanning, while offering a much broader field of view, while the highest settings in the magnification range are more than adequate for mid to long-range shots. A respectable zoom from 2.5-10x allows the shooter to make an accurate shot at a long distance and keep a tight grouping. The FF13011 also includes 100-500 yard .223 bullet drop compensation turret, which adjusts the elevation of the reticle ensuring that the shooter can achieve zero by moving the compensation turret to the correct yardage. Firefield-Victory Justifies Everything.", "text": "Firefield 2.5 Riflescope with Red Laser The Firefield Riflescope with Red Laser is equipped with a Green/Red Illuminated Mil Dot reticle that is used for range estimation to help find the distance between the shooter and the target. Precision multi-coated optics are the distinguishing feature of the Firefield Tactical Riflescope line and offers the clearest view in both bright and low light situations. Featuring a built in 5mW red laser, the Firefield Riflescope, is used for quick target acquisition in rapid changing environments, so it hits the target every time with precision accuracy. The lowest magnification setting at 2.5x can be used for scanning, while offering a much broader field of view, while the highest settings in the magnification range are more than adequate for mid to long-range shots. A respectable zoom from 2.5-10x allows the shooter to make an accurate shot at a long distance and keep a tight grouping. The FF13011 also includes 100-500 yard .223 bullet drop compensation turret, which adjusts the elevation of the reticle ensuring that the shooter can achieve zero by moving the compensation turret to the correct yardage. Firefield-Victory Justifies Everything.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xMgjB9rML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Y71V2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Firefield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 93.92}}
{"item_id": "B003Y73EPY", "title": "Crank Brothers Eggbeater 1 Hangtag Bike Pedal", "description": "Stamped steel body with stamped wings perfect for cross country/race application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner bushing bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "text": "Crank Brothers Eggbeater 1 Hangtag Bike Pedal Stamped steel body with stamped wings perfect for cross country/race application. Forged scm435 chromoly steel spindle and inner bushing bearing and outer cartridge bearing. Premium brass cleats included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VbTJ9UkNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Y73EPY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 54.0}}
{"item_id": "B003Y77Z22", "title": "Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I II or III Holster", "description": "Get your U.S.A.-MADE Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I, II or III Holster here for LESS! This finely crafted Classic Old West Styles Holster is perfect fit for your Ruger MK I, II or III! Fashioned with care from full-grain leather and waxed-linen thread with a special design that won't disturb your front sights. Securing strap keeps your pistol in place when the action gets rough. Includes a single-side mag pouch. This is a beauty... one you'll be glad to own. Order yours today! Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I, II or III Holster", "text": "Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I II or III Holster Get your U.S.A.-MADE Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I, II or III Holster here for LESS! This finely crafted Classic Old West Styles Holster is perfect fit for your Ruger MK I, II or III! Fashioned with care from full-grain leather and waxed-linen thread with a special design that won't disturb your front sights. Securing strap keeps your pistol in place when the action gets rough. Includes a single-side mag pouch. This is a beauty... one you'll be glad to own. Order yours today! Classic Old West Styles Ruger MK I, II or III Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mk-OHTTZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Y77Z22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "C.O.W.S.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.99}}
