{"item_id": "B003YCGCHG", "title": "Timber Rattler Jungle Fury Bowie", "description": "The jungles are tough, but with the Timber Rattler Jungle Fury, it's not so bad. Take care of any problems with the 10 1/2\" stainless steel blade with a cut-out blood groove and a razor sharp edge. A hardwood handle is accented by a brass plated pommel and guard. Includes brown leather sheath. Timber Rattler, TR88", "text": "Timber Rattler Jungle Fury Bowie The jungles are tough, but with the Timber Rattler Jungle Fury, it's not so bad. Take care of any problems with the 10 1/2\" stainless steel blade with a cut-out blood groove and a razor sharp edge. A hardwood handle is accented by a brass plated pommel and guard. Includes brown leather sheath. Timber Rattler, TR88", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BJ0WOTB0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YCGCHG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 24.5}}
{"item_id": "B003YCWFRM", "title": "FURY Butterfly Trainer Knife (Silver Matte Finish)", "description": "The Fury Butterfly Trainer from Joy Enterprises is all you need from a trainer. A blade from 440C stainless and blunted completely around so it will not cut you as you swing and fling. The handle is matte finished and features a skelatonized frame. The trainer also has a latch to secure the knife in the open and closed position.", "text": "FURY Butterfly Trainer Knife (Silver Matte Finish) The Fury Butterfly Trainer from Joy Enterprises is all you need from a trainer. A blade from 440C stainless and blunted completely around so it will not cut you as you swing and fling. The handle is matte finished and features a skelatonized frame. The trainer also has a latch to secure the knife in the open and closed position.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ecAr8n0uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YCWFRM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 11.85}}
{"item_id": "B003YD0KZU", "title": "Safariland 774 Competition Rifle Magazine Holder, Black, STX Tactical", "description": "The Safariland model 774 Rifle Magazine Pouch is an accessory designed to carry one rifle magazine on the Safariland Tactical leg holster. It features a bolt-on attachment. The 774 is ambidextrous and is adjustable fro perfect placement for either right or left handed shooters. It is constructed of rugged SafariLaminate and features a tension device to adjust magazine retention. Fits: Colt AR15 Magazine.", "text": "Safariland 774 Competition Rifle Magazine Holder, Black, STX Tactical The Safariland model 774 Rifle Magazine Pouch is an accessory designed to carry one rifle magazine on the Safariland Tactical leg holster. It features a bolt-on attachment. The 774 is ambidextrous and is adjustable fro perfect placement for either right or left handed shooters. It is constructed of rugged SafariLaminate and features a tension device to adjust magazine retention. Fits: Colt AR15 Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41amkrkLKtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YD0KZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 10.1}}
{"item_id": "B003YD1M5M", "title": "Spyderco byrd Cara Cara2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Cara Cara2, a compact and lightweight folding knife from innovative cutlery company Spyderco, has been reengineered to include a full flat-ground blade for enhanced edge geometry and cutting precision. Other updates and improvements include a proprietary Bi-Directional Textured FRN handle, for improved grip and control, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for smooth blade operation. Similar to the prior model, the Cara Cara2 retains spine and choil jimping and a four-position clip for a variety of carrying configurations. Skeletonized nested handle liners add strength while keeping weight to a minimum, and screw-together construction is both sturdy and easy to clean and maintain.The 8Cr13MoV steel blade has a comet-shaped hole, and the jimped crosshatching alone the spine helps the thumb's grip on the top of the blade for precise, comfortable, nonslip use. A finger choil enhances the ergonomic stainless steel handle, and the mid-positioned back lock has a David Boye cut-away dent, a safety feature allowing tight gripping without accidentally releasing the lock.Specifications8.5-inch open length4.75-inch closed length3.75-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade3.2-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.125-inch blade thickness5.6-ounce weightStainless steel handleWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Cara Cara2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife The Cara Cara2, a compact and lightweight folding knife from innovative cutlery company Spyderco, has been reengineered to include a full flat-ground blade for enhanced edge geometry and cutting precision. Other updates and improvements include a proprietary Bi-Directional Textured FRN handle, for improved grip and control, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for smooth blade operation. Similar to the prior model, the Cara Cara2 retains spine and choil jimping and a four-position clip for a variety of carrying configurations. Skeletonized nested handle liners add strength while keeping weight to a minimum, and screw-together construction is both sturdy and easy to clean and maintain.The 8Cr13MoV steel blade has a comet-shaped hole, and the jimped crosshatching alone the spine helps the thumb's grip on the top of the blade for precise, comfortable, nonslip use. A finger choil enhances the ergonomic stainless steel handle, and the mid-positioned back lock has a David Boye cut-away dent, a safety feature allowing tight gripping without accidentally releasing the lock.Specifications8.5-inch open length4.75-inch closed length3.75-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade3.2-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.125-inch blade thickness5.6-ounce weightStainless steel handleWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ulJiawkFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YD1M5M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.96}}
{"item_id": "B003YD5HUI", "title": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black FRN PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Meadowlark Lightweight has long been one of the bestselling knives in Spyderco's value-priced byrd line of cutlery, and this second generation model offers several design improvements over the original. Upgrades include a full flat-ground blade, proprietary Bi-Directional Textured finish for nonslip performance, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for exacting blade operation. Jimping along the spine and choil create a solid grip in your hand, and a four-position clip enables a variety of carrying positions.Specifications6.8-inch open lengthFour-inch closed length2.875-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade2.375-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.4-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black FRN PlainEdge Knife The Meadowlark Lightweight has long been one of the bestselling knives in Spyderco's value-priced byrd line of cutlery, and this second generation model offers several design improvements over the original. Upgrades include a full flat-ground blade, proprietary Bi-Directional Textured finish for nonslip performance, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for exacting blade operation. Jimping along the spine and choil create a solid grip in your hand, and a four-position clip enables a variety of carrying positions.Specifications6.8-inch open lengthFour-inch closed length2.875-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade2.375-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.4-ounce weightFRN handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41doiGy7aAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YD5HUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.48}}
{"item_id": "B003YD5HYY", "title": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black FRN ComboEdge Knife", "description": "Already one of the best values in our popular byrd line, the Meadowlark Lightweight has been completely reengineered to yield the new, improved Meadowlark2. Its many upgrades include a full-flat-ground blade for enhanced edge geometry and cutting performance, a Bi-Directional Textured® FRN handle that offers a superior grip and increased control, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for even smoother blade operation. Like its predecessor, it also features spine and choil jimping for precise control during use and a four-position clip that supports all possible carry configurations. Improved features at very affordable prices make the Meadowlark2 Lightweight one of the best values on the market.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black FRN ComboEdge Knife Already one of the best values in our popular byrd line, the Meadowlark Lightweight has been completely reengineered to yield the new, improved Meadowlark2. Its many upgrades include a full-flat-ground blade for enhanced edge geometry and cutting performance, a Bi-Directional Textured® FRN handle that offers a superior grip and increased control, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for even smoother blade operation. Like its predecessor, it also features spine and choil jimping for precise control during use and a four-position clip that supports all possible carry configurations. Improved features at very affordable prices make the Meadowlark2 Lightweight one of the best values on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NCWbzWFYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YD5HYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.89}}
