{"item_id": "B003YTRHZ0", "title": "Humangear Capcap (Pack of 2)", "description": "Most wide mouth bottles are easy to fill and clean, but the standard opening is too big to drink from easily without spilling. Narrow mouth bottles are great to drink from but you can forget about putting ice cubes in them, let alone clean them. And bottle inserts don't really fix a spout that was never meant for daily drinking", "text": "Humangear Capcap (Pack of 2) Most wide mouth bottles are easy to fill and clean, but the standard opening is too big to drink from easily without spilling. Narrow mouth bottles are great to drink from but you can forget about putting ice cubes in them, let alone clean them. And bottle inserts don't really fix a spout that was never meant for daily drinking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jQWALU8HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003YTRHZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "humangear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 12.95}}
