{"item_id": "B003Z0DHX4", "title": "CamelBak Bottle Accessory Bite Valves (Multicolor, Pack of 5)", "description": "The self-sealing valves fit the Camelbak Better Bottle and Performance Bottle (both sold separately).Nothing brings a perfectly good hydration system to a grinding halt faster than losing track of those handy little bite valves. Get your CamelBak water bottle back up and running again -- or keep a few extra valves on hand -- with this five-pack of bite valves in various colors. The one-piece valves are made of self-sealing silicone to prevent leaks, and fit the company's popular CamelBak Better Bottle and Performance Bottle.Lifetime WarrantyCamelBak hands-free hydration systems include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About CamelBakCamelBak, headquartered in Petaluma, California, is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. Scientific studies show athletes drink more fluids and perform better when they wear a CamelBak, and athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use these hydration systems for convenience and performance benefits. The company creates activity-specific products, and its line includes hydration systems for cycling, hiking, running, snowboarding, skiing, and even military use.", "text": "CamelBak Bottle Accessory Bite Valves (Multicolor, Pack of 5) The self-sealing valves fit the Camelbak Better Bottle and Performance Bottle (both sold separately).Nothing brings a perfectly good hydration system to a grinding halt faster than losing track of those handy little bite valves. Get your CamelBak water bottle back up and running again -- or keep a few extra valves on hand -- with this five-pack of bite valves in various colors. The one-piece valves are made of self-sealing silicone to prevent leaks, and fit the company's popular CamelBak Better Bottle and Performance Bottle.Lifetime WarrantyCamelBak hands-free hydration systems include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About CamelBakCamelBak, headquartered in Petaluma, California, is the originator and world leader in hands-free hydration systems. Scientific studies show athletes drink more fluids and perform better when they wear a CamelBak, and athletes from an ever-growing list of sports and activities use these hydration systems for convenience and performance benefits. The company creates activity-specific products, and its line includes hydration systems for cycling, hiking, running, snowboarding, skiing, and even military use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kQwTvyJ%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Z0DHX4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
