{"item_id": "B003Z6RE4G", "title": "RUKO 3-Inch Medium Grit Arkansas Whetstone Knife Sharpener with Leather Pouch", "description": "RUKO SD3 Medium Grit Arkansas Whetstone; Ideal for sharpening and quick-touch ups on all types of blades and tools; Supplied with Leather Carrying Pouch; Pocket sized - 3\"x1\"x3-/8\", Weight: 1.86 oz; Made in the USA with Genuine Arkansas Whetstones; Lifetime Warranty", "text": "RUKO 3-Inch Medium Grit Arkansas Whetstone Knife Sharpener with Leather Pouch RUKO SD3 Medium Grit Arkansas Whetstone; Ideal for sharpening and quick-touch ups on all types of blades and tools; Supplied with Leather Carrying Pouch; Pocket sized - 3\"x1\"x3-/8\", Weight: 1.86 oz; Made in the USA with Genuine Arkansas Whetstones; Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KAkwT16QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Z6RE4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 10.82}}
