{"item_id": "B003Z9OEGO", "title": "Bushwhacker Durango Black - Bicycle Handlebar Bag Cycling Front Pack Bike Bag", "description": "The Durango attaches to your handlebar with a 3-point tension mounting system. It also features a large exterior pocket with covered zipper and Scotchlite reflective trim.", "text": "Bushwhacker Durango Black - Bicycle Handlebar Bag Cycling Front Pack Bike Bag The Durango attaches to your handlebar with a 3-point tension mounting system. It also features a large exterior pocket with covered zipper and Scotchlite reflective trim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xT9PlqrEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Z9OEGO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B003Z9XHAS", "title": "Bushwhacker Mesa Trunk Bag Black - w/ Rear Light Clip Attachment & Reflective Trim - Bicycle Trunk Bag Cycling Rack Pack Bike Rear Bag", "description": "The Mesa features three easy-access exterior pockets with covered zippers and a detachable shoulder strap. It secures to the top of your rack with 4-point Velcro mounting system and half-inch stiff foam insulation stabilizes your load. Scotchlite trim increases visibility.", "text": "Bushwhacker Mesa Trunk Bag Black - w/ Rear Light Clip Attachment & Reflective Trim - Bicycle Trunk Bag Cycling Rack Pack Bike Rear Bag The Mesa features three easy-access exterior pockets with covered zippers and a detachable shoulder strap. It secures to the top of your rack with 4-point Velcro mounting system and half-inch stiff foam insulation stabilizes your load. Scotchlite trim increases visibility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zo%2BQ99AnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003Z9XHAS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B003ZAEJGS", "title": "NcStar Compact Pistol and Rifle Flashlight Green Laser with Quick Release Weaver Mount (AQPTFLG)", "description": "Compact Flashlight/Laser w/Quick Release Mount Features: - The Tactical Green Laser/Flashlight allows you to quickly switch back and forth from a Laser to a Flashlight by just changing the front assemblies. - The Tactical Green Laser/Flashlight is a super bright green laser or a bright 30 lumens Flashlight. - With a Quick Detachable Weaver style mount, you can quickly install and remove the powerful green laser or Flashlight in seconds and mount it onto virtually any of your firearms without the use of tools. - Precise windage and elevation adjustments, keeps your shots on target! - Constructed of solid anodized aluminum, this laser/flashlight is tough and can take a beating. Specifications: - Beam Divergence: <1mrad - Beam diameter: <1 mm - Operation Current: <300mA - Operating temperature: 59 - 95 degrees Fahrenheit", "text": "NcStar Compact Pistol and Rifle Flashlight Green Laser with Quick Release Weaver Mount (AQPTFLG) Compact Flashlight/Laser w/Quick Release Mount Features: - The Tactical Green Laser/Flashlight allows you to quickly switch back and forth from a Laser to a Flashlight by just changing the front assemblies. - The Tactical Green Laser/Flashlight is a super bright green laser or a bright 30 lumens Flashlight. - With a Quick Detachable Weaver style mount, you can quickly install and remove the powerful green laser or Flashlight in seconds and mount it onto virtually any of your firearms without the use of tools. - Precise windage and elevation adjustments, keeps your shots on target! - Constructed of solid anodized aluminum, this laser/flashlight is tough and can take a beating. Specifications: - Beam Divergence: <1mrad - Beam diameter: <1 mm - Operation Current: <300mA - Operating temperature: 59 - 95 degrees Fahrenheit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y1fkDL1ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZAEJGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 51.99}}
