{"item_id": "B003ZFLL6E", "title": "Buffer Tech Glock Magwell", "description": "The Glock MagWell will install on the following models: 17, 17L, 22, 24, 31, 34, 35, and 37. Using a simple hex head wrench tightening a patented locking device holds the MagWell in position allowing for faster reloads. Another benefit to using the MagWell is the ability to get the proper grip each and every time the weapon is drawn from the holster.", "text": "Buffer Tech Glock Magwell The Glock MagWell will install on the following models: 17, 17L, 22, 24, 31, 34, 35, and 37. Using a simple hex head wrench tightening a patented locking device holds the MagWell in position allowing for faster reloads. Another benefit to using the MagWell is the ability to get the proper grip each and every time the weapon is drawn from the holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QDopEczZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZFLL6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buffertech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 18.97}}
{"item_id": "B003ZJOBEE", "title": "Leatherman Premium Leather and Nylon Sheath II", "description": "Leatherman PREMIUM LEATHER AND NYLON SHEATH II Nylon and leather belt sheath features Leatherman logo and snap closure. Features three pockets/slots for accessories and permits holstering of tool in open (pliers) position. Vertical and horizontal carry. Fits: Super Tool 300 Black, Super Tool 200, Super Tool 300, Surge Black, Surge Replacement Saw and File, Surge, Core, Super Tool Average tool size is 4.5\" long x 1.25\" wide by .75\" thick", "text": "Leatherman Premium Leather and Nylon Sheath II Leatherman PREMIUM LEATHER AND NYLON SHEATH II Nylon and leather belt sheath features Leatherman logo and snap closure. Features three pockets/slots for accessories and permits holstering of tool in open (pliers) position. Vertical and horizontal carry. Fits: Super Tool 300 Black, Super Tool 200, Super Tool 300, Surge Black, Surge Replacement Saw and File, Surge, Core, Super Tool Average tool size is 4.5\" long x 1.25\" wide by .75\" thick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41my55LA2JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZJOBEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 6.75}}
{"item_id": "B003ZK3Y5A", "title": "CYMA M187D Bolt Action Airsoft Sniper Rifle FPS-550 4X32 Bosile Scope, Collapsible Stock, Bipod Airsoft Gun", "description": "Our take: CYMA's all new full metal APS SR-2 modular bolt action sniper is a one-of-a-kind, unique sniper rifle that has its design rooted in modular versatility. As such, there is a weaver rail for optics mounting, a grooved ergonomic pistol grip, and most significantly, a modular LE-style M4 collapsible/adjustable rear stock. This rifle is extremely heavy with a one-piece full metal sniper barrel. The body is nicely finished and most importantly, it shoots extremely hard and extremely accurately, topping out at over 460 FPS with 0.20g BBs.Package comes complete with a tactical 4x32 metal fully functional scope for maximum accuracy. With the scope mounted, this becomes one of the most modular and versatile sniper rifles on the field! This high quality scope compliments the SR-2 sniper quite nicely, allowing you to acquire targets you otherwise would not be able to hit. A tactical metallic adjustable/retractable bipod is also included in the package. The bipod is lightweight and versatile, allowing you to move around effectively and simultaneously rest your rifle on virtually any surface for more stabilized shooting at a moment's notice.The tactical rear stock is extremely beneficial to Aairsoft snipers who need a lightweight, yet adjustable rear stock for multi-variable shooting conditions. This stock delivers just that, and does so with style. This airsoft sniper rifle comes with a powerful spring and heavy-duty bolt assembly installed directly from the factory and an extremely long barrel, power and accuracy are ensured.Specifications:Operation: Bolt ActionFiring Modes: Bolt Action single shotMuzzle Velocity: 430 – 470 FPS w/ 0.20g BBsMagazine: 24-round magazineHop-up:", "text": "CYMA M187D Bolt Action Airsoft Sniper Rifle FPS-550 4X32 Bosile Scope, Collapsible Stock, Bipod Airsoft Gun Our take: CYMA's all new full metal APS SR-2 modular bolt action sniper is a one-of-a-kind, unique sniper rifle that has its design rooted in modular versatility. As such, there is a weaver rail for optics mounting, a grooved ergonomic pistol grip, and most significantly, a modular LE-style M4 collapsible/adjustable rear stock. This rifle is extremely heavy with a one-piece full metal sniper barrel. The body is nicely finished and most importantly, it shoots extremely hard and extremely accurately, topping out at over 460 FPS with 0.20g BBs.Package comes complete with a tactical 4x32 metal fully functional scope for maximum accuracy. With the scope mounted, this becomes one of the most modular and versatile sniper rifles on the field! This high quality scope compliments the SR-2 sniper quite nicely, allowing you to acquire targets you otherwise would not be able to hit. A tactical metallic adjustable/retractable bipod is also included in the package. The bipod is lightweight and versatile, allowing you to move around effectively and simultaneously rest your rifle on virtually any surface for more stabilized shooting at a moment's notice.The tactical rear stock is extremely beneficial to Aairsoft snipers who need a lightweight, yet adjustable rear stock for multi-variable shooting conditions. This stock delivers just that, and does so with style. This airsoft sniper rifle comes with a powerful spring and heavy-duty bolt assembly installed directly from the factory and an extremely long barrel, power and accuracy are ensured.Specifications:Operation: Bolt ActionFiring Modes: Bolt Action single shotMuzzle Velocity: 430 – 470 FPS w/ 0.20g BBsMagazine: 24-round magazineHop-up:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315%2BGFf5kkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZK3Y5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CYMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 119.95}}
