{"item_id": "B003ZM89K8", "title": "United Cutlery UC2689 One Shot One Kill Survival Bowie Knife and Sheath", "description": "Don't take shots in the dark when you are speaking about survival. This One Shot: One Kill, S.O.A. survival bowie is a knife you can always count on. A 7-Inch stainless steel sawback blade features the S.O.A. emblem laser etched right into the blade. At 12-Inch overall with a checkered ABS grip, it's perfect for a sniper's bag. Includes a fitted hard plastic S.O.A. sheath with a nylon belt loop and fastening strap, and quiet locking system.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2689 One Shot One Kill Survival Bowie Knife and Sheath Don't take shots in the dark when you are speaking about survival. This One Shot: One Kill, S.O.A. survival bowie is a knife you can always count on. A 7-Inch stainless steel sawback blade features the S.O.A. emblem laser etched right into the blade. At 12-Inch overall with a checkered ABS grip, it's perfect for a sniper's bag. Includes a fitted hard plastic S.O.A. sheath with a nylon belt loop and fastening strap, and quiet locking system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tAGdJ11BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZM89K8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.3}}
