{"item_id": "B003ZMDK5C", "title": "Shimano PD-M520 MTB SPD Bike Pedal", "description": "Open binding mechanism and lighter weight are perfect for MTB or road cyclists. Compact body design will be popular with road cyclists/century riders. The best mud and debris shedding ability of any other pedal in its class. Chrome-moly spindle and low maintenance sealed bearing cartridge axle. Adjustable cleat tension feature great for beginners. Weight: 380g.", "text": "Shimano PD-M520 MTB SPD Bike Pedal Open binding mechanism and lighter weight are perfect for MTB or road cyclists. Compact body design will be popular with road cyclists/century riders. The best mud and debris shedding ability of any other pedal in its class. Chrome-moly spindle and low maintenance sealed bearing cartridge axle. Adjustable cleat tension feature great for beginners. Weight: 380g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iIZBF3eGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZMDK5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 38.95}}
