{"item_id": "B003ZUBOL6", "title": "Giro Atmos Helmet", "description": "Atmos continues to set the standard for high performance, matchless style, and comfortable fit. Its low profile silhouette, 26 Wind Tunnel vents, and benchmark in-mold Roll Cage make it a top choice for road, cross, and XC riders alike.", "text": "Giro Atmos Helmet Atmos continues to set the standard for high performance, matchless style, and comfortable fit. Its low profile silhouette, 26 Wind Tunnel vents, and benchmark in-mold Roll Cage make it a top choice for road, cross, and XC riders alike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51f%2B6MCYARL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZUBOL6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ZUJ6GG", "title": "GOGO 24 PCS Aluminum Locking D-shaped Carabiners in Assorted Colors, Gift Idea", "description": "Size 7.7cm: Length 3\", Width 1-1/2\", Thickness 5/16\"Colors may vary in black, silver, blue, cool blue, red, green, yellow, etc.Features:** Made of high-strength aluminum alloy** Quickly and securely clipped to your belt, bag strap, etc.** Dozen pack can be shared with your friendsComes in random colors; maybe be different from the picture.ATTENTION: NO load bearing, DO NOT use for climbing.", "text": "GOGO 24 PCS Aluminum Locking D-shaped Carabiners in Assorted Colors, Gift Idea Size 7.7cm: Length 3\", Width 1-1/2\", Thickness 5/16\"Colors may vary in black, silver, blue, cool blue, red, green, yellow, etc.Features:** Made of high-strength aluminum alloy** Quickly and securely clipped to your belt, bag strap, etc.** Dozen pack can be shared with your friendsComes in random colors; maybe be different from the picture.ATTENTION: NO load bearing, DO NOT use for climbing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zDZe%2Bc7pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZUJ6GG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]], "price": 21.5}}
{"item_id": "B003ZUK2J6", "title": "Current Comic Book Backing Boards (Qty= 1 pack of 100)", "description": "BCW Current Comic Book Backing Boards The BCW Current Comic Backer Boards are made from a full 24 point solid bleached sulfate, coated on one side with a buffered with 3% calcium carbonate , and are precision cut to size. Use this item along with current comic bags to protect and store your collectible comics. Fit current comic bags Coated on one side Buffered with 3% calcium carbonate Precision cut (Quantity =1 Pack of 100)", "text": "Current Comic Book Backing Boards (Qty= 1 pack of 100) BCW Current Comic Book Backing Boards The BCW Current Comic Backer Boards are made from a full 24 point solid bleached sulfate, coated on one side with a buffered with 3% calcium carbonate , and are precision cut to size. Use this item along with current comic bags to protect and store your collectible comics. Fit current comic bags Coated on one side Buffered with 3% calcium carbonate Precision cut (Quantity =1 Pack of 100)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iJvBslPTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZUK2J6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BCW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B003ZVHK04", "title": "Sunny SF-B1001 Indoor Cycling Bike", "description": "A surprisingly affordable performance stationary bike, the Sunny Health & Fitness SF-B1001 offers all of the design features and benefits you'd expect from a more expensive model. Fully adjustable seat, handlebars, and resistance let you continue to challenge yourself over time, while experiencing a comfortable ride along the way. The chain drive mechanism is smooth and whisper-quiet -- particularly nice when watching TV or movies during your workout -- and a heavy-duty crank and steel frame will stand the test of time.FeaturesFully adjustable seat and handlebarsSmooth, quiet chain drive mechanismHeavy-duty crank and steel frameAdjustable resistanceTransportation wheels for easy portabilitySpecifications30-pound flywheel85-pound weight220-pound maximum user weightMeasures 20 by 43 by 46 inches (W x H x D)", "text": "Sunny SF-B1001 Indoor Cycling Bike A surprisingly affordable performance stationary bike, the Sunny Health & Fitness SF-B1001 offers all of the design features and benefits you'd expect from a more expensive model. Fully adjustable seat, handlebars, and resistance let you continue to challenge yourself over time, while experiencing a comfortable ride along the way. The chain drive mechanism is smooth and whisper-quiet -- particularly nice when watching TV or movies during your workout -- and a heavy-duty crank and steel frame will stand the test of time.FeaturesFully adjustable seat and handlebarsSmooth, quiet chain drive mechanismHeavy-duty crank and steel frameAdjustable resistanceTransportation wheels for easy portabilitySpecifications30-pound flywheel85-pound weight220-pound maximum user weightMeasures 20 by 43 by 46 inches (W x H x D)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51su8UPnDUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZVHK04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 199.49}}
