{"item_id": "B003ZY45RW", "title": "Swix XF Snowboard and Wide Universal Ski Vise (2 Piece)", "description": "The Swix FX line is designed with top pros around the world. The 2pc Snowboard vise works great for supporting your skis/boards for all base work. Wide clamps attach to most benches. Easy to use - looks cool.", "text": "Swix XF Snowboard and Wide Universal Ski Vise (2 Piece) The Swix FX line is designed with top pros around the world. The 2pc Snowboard vise works great for supporting your skis/boards for all base work. Wide clamps attach to most benches. Easy to use - looks cool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419lhsPw1pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZY45RW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Tuning Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B003ZYCGLE", "title": "Runners World Reflective Vest", "description": "Being seen at night or during low-light conditions is crucial to your safety when running. The Reflective Run Vest offers 360 degrees of high visibility reflectivitiy to assure you're seen in all light conditions", "text": "Runners World Reflective Vest Being seen at night or during low-light conditions is crucial to your safety when running. The Reflective Run Vest offers 360 degrees of high visibility reflectivitiy to assure you're seen in all light conditions", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HgmOGDrxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZYCGLE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]]}}
