{"item_id": "B003ZYJTIM", "title": "Runners World Run Lite Pack", "description": "Only carry what you need with this super-compact, lightweight pack that hugs securely to your body. Adjustable sizing, integrated audio port, and reflective printing ensure you’re ready to run.", "text": "Runners World Run Lite Pack Only carry what you need with this super-compact, lightweight pack that hugs securely to your body. Adjustable sizing, integrated audio port, and reflective printing ensure you’re ready to run.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b02d4N-%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZYJTIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ZYVCYQ", "title": "Holster for Rossi 2\" Revolver 38 & 357", "description": "This is a brand new holster from a USA manufacturer that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for Rossi 2\" Revolver 38 & 357 This is a brand new holster from a USA manufacturer that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u0YqzAJxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZYVCYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.8}}
{"item_id": "B003ZYZ8XM", "title": "Double Magazine Pouch 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP", "description": "A double magazine pouch that will comfortably carry two double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers including magazines that carry up to 18 rounds.", "text": "Double Magazine Pouch 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP A double magazine pouch that will comfortably carry two double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers including magazines that carry up to 18 rounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rkSeAZsYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZYZ8XM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B003ZYZMEM", "title": "Six Pack Magazine Pouch - 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP", "description": "This is a brand new USA made magazine pouch. It was designed to comfortably carry six double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 18 rounds. It will also do a nice job with larger caliber single stacked magazines. This pouch will attach to your belt using the triple belt loops on the back of the pouch or can be used to make your magazines easily available at the shooting range.", "text": "Six Pack Magazine Pouch - 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP This is a brand new USA made magazine pouch. It was designed to comfortably carry six double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 18 rounds. It will also do a nice job with larger caliber single stacked magazines. This pouch will attach to your belt using the triple belt loops on the back of the pouch or can be used to make your magazines easily available at the shooting range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511ijPDwywL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZYZMEM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZ0Y4O", "title": "Oakley Men's Factory Bike Glove", "description": "For the bike purist who perfers absolute dexterity to armor-clad protection, this is our lighest and most breathable glove. Spandura and Airprene maximize flexibility in a design that offers the fit of 3-D anatomical construction. The one piece Clarino palm and high friction surface on the fingers provides superior grip feel", "text": "Oakley Men's Factory Bike Glove For the bike purist who perfers absolute dexterity to armor-clad protection, this is our lighest and most breathable glove. Spandura and Airprene maximize flexibility in a design that offers the fit of 3-D anatomical construction. The one piece Clarino palm and high friction surface on the fingers provides superior grip feel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519fx9hQy8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZ0Y4O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZ2Z8C", "title": "Single Magazine Pouch - 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP", "description": "This magazine pouch will comfortably carry one, double stacked magazine in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 17 rounds. This is a brand new magazine pouch from a US manufacturer. It can be worn on the belt, or clipped over the waistband using the included spring steel clip.", "text": "Single Magazine Pouch - 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP This magazine pouch will comfortably carry one, double stacked magazine in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 17 rounds. This is a brand new magazine pouch from a US manufacturer. It can be worn on the belt, or clipped over the waistband using the included spring steel clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QqS5ryWbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZ2Z8C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.45}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZ9C6K", "title": "Evac Photo-Recon(TM) Photo Sling Pack w/ MOLLE by Hazard 4(R)", "description": "The photography/instrument Evac(TM) w/ full MOLLE coverage, padded, movable internal dividers to protect fragile gear, side and top access zippers (top one has padded organizer). Dividers can be removed for a full-length carry 'barrel tube', and compression-straps are on one side for attaching tripods or similar top-pocket loop-face space for modular holsters/organizers. Bag is heavily padded to protect gear, medical supplies, C4, etc. Ideal for surveillance, reconnaissance, medics, photogs, etc.", "text": "Evac Photo-Recon(TM) Photo Sling Pack w/ MOLLE by Hazard 4(R) The photography/instrument Evac(TM) w/ full MOLLE coverage, padded, movable internal dividers to protect fragile gear, side and top access zippers (top one has padded organizer). Dividers can be removed for a full-length carry 'barrel tube', and compression-straps are on one side for attaching tripods or similar top-pocket loop-face space for modular holsters/organizers. Bag is heavily padded to protect gear, medical supplies, C4, etc. Ideal for surveillance, reconnaissance, medics, photogs, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aUFmoocNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZ9C6K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HAZARD 4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 131.18}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZCLJU", "title": "Eagle Claw Minnow Trap (9 x 16-1/2-Inch)", "description": "Eagle Claw Minnow Trap. Forget throwing money at bait store minnows. Here's a simple-but-effective Trap to make catching your own bait a walk in the park. Made sturdy with black vinyl-coated wire, with cone-shaped inward entrances at each end to funnel minnows through the 1\" openings. The two halves secure via one clip, so it's easy to bait and retrieve your catch. Truly an investment that pays for itself in just a few minnow loads. Measures 9 x 16 1/2\" l. Can double as a crayfish trap. Order yours today! Eagle Claw Minnow Trap", "text": "Eagle Claw Minnow Trap (9 x 16-1/2-Inch) Eagle Claw Minnow Trap. Forget throwing money at bait store minnows. Here's a simple-but-effective Trap to make catching your own bait a walk in the park. Made sturdy with black vinyl-coated wire, with cone-shaped inward entrances at each end to funnel minnows through the 1\" openings. The two halves secure via one clip, so it's easy to bait and retrieve your catch. Truly an investment that pays for itself in just a few minnow loads. Measures 9 x 16 1/2\" l. Can double as a crayfish trap. Order yours today! Eagle Claw Minnow Trap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gOu2VGZEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZCLJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Claw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Bait Traps"]], "price": 10.37}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZDWMK", "title": "Shimano IX1000R IX Rear Drag Spin Reel with 2/270, 4/140 and 6/110 Line Capacity", "description": "The Shimano IX1000R IX Spin Reel Rear Drag features a graphite frame, side plate, rotor and spool. The Shimano IX Reel is corrosion resistant and highly durable. Great for saltwater or freshwater, the Shimano IX Reel will enable maximum fish production. Equipped with many unique and practical features, the Shimano IX Reel will meet any angler's expectations. This lightweight, rear-drag Shimano IX features Quick Fire II, a graphite frame, side plate, rotor and spool. This rear drag is approved for use in saltwater and rated for use with Mono, Fluorocarbon and PowerPro lines. This product has a 4.1:1 gear ratio and (3) options for line capacity. for line 2, this reel has a capacity of up to 270-yards, line 4 up to 140-yards and line 6 up to 110-yards.", "text": "Shimano IX1000R IX Rear Drag Spin Reel with 2/270, 4/140 and 6/110 Line Capacity The Shimano IX1000R IX Spin Reel Rear Drag features a graphite frame, side plate, rotor and spool. The Shimano IX Reel is corrosion resistant and highly durable. Great for saltwater or freshwater, the Shimano IX Reel will enable maximum fish production. Equipped with many unique and practical features, the Shimano IX Reel will meet any angler's expectations. This lightweight, rear-drag Shimano IX features Quick Fire II, a graphite frame, side plate, rotor and spool. This rear drag is approved for use in saltwater and rated for use with Mono, Fluorocarbon and PowerPro lines. This product has a 4.1:1 gear ratio and (3) options for line capacity. for line 2, this reel has a capacity of up to 270-yards, line 4 up to 140-yards and line 6 up to 110-yards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-swRdHIrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZDWMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZHS84", "title": "Alpinismo 4 Season Tent with Aluminum Poles", "description": "This is, possibly, the best tent under $200. Our Uber Lite is made exclusively for CampingMaxx for Boy Scouts of America by a major European Company (but made in China, where else ?). We wanted a relatively light weight, 4 season tent which can withstand moderately hostile environments. The aluminum poles provide the strength to support a light snow load, the rain cover is 1000 mm and provides a dry living area under almost all conditions. The floor is a new light-weight material, but super strong. The seams are all thoroughly sealed. The double vestibules have zippers to protect your gear. This tent can be set up in under 3 minutes from start to entry. The living area measures 84\" long by 61\" wide, so 2 adults have plenty of room. The interior ceiling is 45\" which provides comfort even in high winds. We are VERY proud of this tent and consider it to be the flagship of our new Uber Lite line, which took almost 20 years to develop. Watch for our other Uber Lite products debuting by this coming Spring.", "text": "Alpinismo 4 Season Tent with Aluminum Poles This is, possibly, the best tent under $200. Our Uber Lite is made exclusively for CampingMaxx for Boy Scouts of America by a major European Company (but made in China, where else ?). We wanted a relatively light weight, 4 season tent which can withstand moderately hostile environments. The aluminum poles provide the strength to support a light snow load, the rain cover is 1000 mm and provides a dry living area under almost all conditions. The floor is a new light-weight material, but super strong. The seams are all thoroughly sealed. The double vestibules have zippers to protect your gear. This tent can be set up in under 3 minutes from start to entry. The living area measures 84\" long by 61\" wide, so 2 adults have plenty of room. The interior ceiling is 45\" which provides comfort even in high winds. We are VERY proud of this tent and consider it to be the flagship of our new Uber Lite line, which took almost 20 years to develop. Watch for our other Uber Lite products debuting by this coming Spring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CuRfvs9CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZHS84.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 149.95}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZJWYM", "title": "Stick-up(TM) Modular Velcro Universal Pistol/Gear Holster by Hazard 4(R)", "description": "This velcro-hook-backed holster is compatible with many Hazard 4(R) packs/bags and will also work with your existing loop-velcro-faced gear to secure your pistols and other gear where it is most convenient to reach. It is also the only holster in its class with an adjustable thumb-break-style retainer. It fits anything from a power charger for a laptop to just about any modern semi-auto pistol. It also holds AR-15/M4/M16 magazines. The fact that it has a removable retainer makes it much safer to carry pistols inside your bag since the gun can't come out of the holster inadvertently or be bumped out. This could cause an unsafe condition where the trigger is free to be pressed by another object in the bag or an external force. If the retainer is not something you require, it can be removed in seconds. The holster can be set up for left or right hand release and the retainer can go over the back of the pistol's striker/hammer, or below the slide above the grip. When used upside-down, the retainer holds objects such as power adapters from dropping out. A very versatile solution to a number of carry-situations.", "text": "Stick-up(TM) Modular Velcro Universal Pistol/Gear Holster by Hazard 4(R) This velcro-hook-backed holster is compatible with many Hazard 4(R) packs/bags and will also work with your existing loop-velcro-faced gear to secure your pistols and other gear where it is most convenient to reach. It is also the only holster in its class with an adjustable thumb-break-style retainer. It fits anything from a power charger for a laptop to just about any modern semi-auto pistol. It also holds AR-15/M4/M16 magazines. The fact that it has a removable retainer makes it much safer to carry pistols inside your bag since the gun can't come out of the holster inadvertently or be bumped out. This could cause an unsafe condition where the trigger is free to be pressed by another object in the bag or an external force. If the retainer is not something you require, it can be removed in seconds. The holster can be set up for left or right hand release and the retainer can go over the back of the pistol's striker/hammer, or below the slide above the grip. When used upside-down, the retainer holds objects such as power adapters from dropping out. A very versatile solution to a number of carry-situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YSAberqDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZJWYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HAZARD 4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B003ZZT3ZU", "title": "Bushwhacker Waco Red - Bicycle Handlebar & Seat Bag Cycling Pack Bike Cylinder Saddle Bag", "description": "The versatile Waco mounts securely either on your handlebars or under your seat with a two-point buckle attachment. Heavyweight polyester construction ensures durability.", "text": "Bushwhacker Waco Red - Bicycle Handlebar & Seat Bag Cycling Pack Bike Cylinder Saddle Bag The versatile Waco mounts securely either on your handlebars or under your seat with a two-point buckle attachment. Heavyweight polyester construction ensures durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511HwZ35aJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B003ZZT3ZU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B004002CS4", "title": "Highland 1375100 SportWing Hitch Mounted 2 Bike Carrier", "description": "The Highland Sportwing bike carriers are the ultimate solution for carrying all styles of bikes from extreme style frames to kids bikes. The adjustable cradles support the bike by the wheels and provide instant adjustability for any styled bike frame.", "text": "Highland 1375100 SportWing Hitch Mounted 2 Bike Carrier The Highland Sportwing bike carriers are the ultimate solution for carrying all styles of bikes from extreme style frames to kids bikes. The adjustable cradles support the bike by the wheels and provide instant adjustability for any styled bike frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qSFQY7ioL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004002CS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Highland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 79.97}}
{"item_id": "B00400N72E", "title": "Yukon Gear Men's Reversible Insulated Jacket", "description": "Yukon Gear W/B Reversible Park with waterproof yet breathable lining, elastic wrist cuffs and waist, and dual side entry pockets with pocket flaps. Switches between Blaze Orange and Mossy Oak Break-Up pattern.", "text": "Yukon Gear Men's Reversible Insulated Jacket Yukon Gear W/B Reversible Park with waterproof yet breathable lining, elastic wrist cuffs and waist, and dual side entry pockets with pocket flaps. Switches between Blaze Orange and Mossy Oak Break-Up pattern.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NZOvqWcvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00400N72E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0040452R8", "title": "Sport-Brella Umbrella Chair, Green", "description": "The only umbrella chair with a full 360 degrees of coverage. Wherever the sun goes, the Sport-Brella Chair has you covered without needing to turn your chair away from the action. Take it to the beach. Take it camping. Take it to the game. Take it anywhere you want to feel cool and protected.", "text": "Sport-Brella Umbrella Chair, Green The only umbrella chair with a full 360 degrees of coverage. Wherever the sun goes, the Sport-Brella Chair has you covered without needing to turn your chair away from the action. Take it to the beach. Take it camping. Take it to the game. Take it anywhere you want to feel cool and protected.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WOgHvNZ6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040452R8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004046SJ4", "title": "BPA Free Drink Bottle Blue 24oz (Set of 3) Made in USA", "description": "With so much concern over cheap plastic bottles that contain BPA (Bisphenol A) we wanted to offer a safe alternative. This 24oz Fitness Bottle is BPA Free, Lead Free, Biodegradable and is FDA approved as well as being made in the U.S.A. The bottle is designed to fit both bicycle holders and car cup holders. The spill proof top makes it a great choice for yoga, exercise class or anywhere, as proper hydration is essential for good health. The water bottle includes a wide screw top to allow full sized ice cubes to be used. The wide opening also makes it easier to clean. We believe you should taste your drink, NOT the plastic bottle.", "text": "BPA Free Drink Bottle Blue 24oz (Set of 3) Made in USA With so much concern over cheap plastic bottles that contain BPA (Bisphenol A) we wanted to offer a safe alternative. This 24oz Fitness Bottle is BPA Free, Lead Free, Biodegradable and is FDA approved as well as being made in the U.S.A. The bottle is designed to fit both bicycle holders and car cup holders. The spill proof top makes it a great choice for yoga, exercise class or anywhere, as proper hydration is essential for good health. The water bottle includes a wide screw top to allow full sized ice cubes to be used. The wide opening also makes it easier to clean. We believe you should taste your drink, NOT the plastic bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RClzx-R%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004046SJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00404A566", "title": "Super-Brella Umbrella Chair - 360 Degree Sun Protection Chair", "description": "", "text": "Super-Brella Umbrella Chair - 360 Degree Sun Protection Chair", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ddw7YHg6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00404A566.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sport-Brella", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]], "price": 33.5}}
{"item_id": "B00404FTTY", "title": "Auto Care Products Inc 55010 ProSeal 10-Feet Garage Door Bottom Seal with 1/4 Inch T-Ends", "description": "ProSeal Garage Door Bottom Seals are made of durable weather resistant PVC. The high quality vinyl remains flexible at extreme low temperatures, providing a tight seal for your garage door. ProSeal locks out the elements by conforming to the shape of your garage floor. Helps save energy, by keeping your garage warmer during the winter and cooler during the summer.", "text": "Auto Care Products Inc 55010 ProSeal 10-Feet Garage Door Bottom Seal with 1/4 Inch T-Ends ProSeal Garage Door Bottom Seals are made of durable weather resistant PVC. The high quality vinyl remains flexible at extreme low temperatures, providing a tight seal for your garage door. ProSeal locks out the elements by conforming to the shape of your garage floor. Helps save energy, by keeping your garage warmer during the winter and cooler during the summer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TdMYJKGDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00404FTTY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Auto Care Products Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00404JPN0", "title": "Uzi UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack", "description": "The UZI UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack is the perfect companion for anyone that loves the outdoors or just needs a handy kit for their toolbox, glove compartment or utility drawer. The tactical pen is made of heavy-duty air craft aluminum and has a knurled grip and internal O ring. This pen is weather resistant and uses standard pen refills. The digital watch has a time, date, week, stopwatch, alarm and chime function and resists water to a maximum of 30-meters. The backlit display lets you read the time even when it's dark out. This watch has a stainless steel back and TP resin strap. The UZI UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack comes with a 1-year limited warranty to protect against defects in materials and workmanship. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "text": "Uzi UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack The UZI UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack is the perfect companion for anyone that loves the outdoors or just needs a handy kit for their toolbox, glove compartment or utility drawer. The tactical pen is made of heavy-duty air craft aluminum and has a knurled grip and internal O ring. This pen is weather resistant and uses standard pen refills. The digital watch has a time, date, week, stopwatch, alarm and chime function and resists water to a maximum of 30-meters. The backlit display lets you read the time even when it's dark out. This watch has a stainless steel back and TP resin strap. The UZI UZI-TPW-COMBO Tactical Combo Pack comes with a 1-year limited warranty to protect against defects in materials and workmanship. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4173i4wUpKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00404JPN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uzi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B00404O93Q", "title": "Yens® Fantasybag Urban sport sling pack, SB-6826", "description": "For more than a decade, we strive to provide excellent customer service, unparallel sales support, large stock availability, and uncompromising quality. We maintain a large inventory base year round. With our manufactories located in various countries overseas, we can offer the most competitive pricing and the best quality. We are here to provide you a peace of mind. Our bags include from Backpacks, Computer bags, Briefcase, Messenger bags, Duffel bags, Tote Bags, Sports bags, Travel bags,, Pad folio, CD Case, Key chain bags and many more categories to name a few.... New ideas and goals make us reach further than ever before. We believe, \"our people make the difference\". We look forward to have you as one of our many satisfied customers.", "text": "Yens® Fantasybag Urban sport sling pack, SB-6826 For more than a decade, we strive to provide excellent customer service, unparallel sales support, large stock availability, and uncompromising quality. We maintain a large inventory base year round. With our manufactories located in various countries overseas, we can offer the most competitive pricing and the best quality. We are here to provide you a peace of mind. Our bags include from Backpacks, Computer bags, Briefcase, Messenger bags, Duffel bags, Tote Bags, Sports bags, Travel bags,, Pad folio, CD Case, Key chain bags and many more categories to name a few.... New ideas and goals make us reach further than ever before. We believe, \"our people make the difference\". We look forward to have you as one of our many satisfied customers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uwkeXlhiL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00404O93Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 14.25}}
{"item_id": "B004050KKG", "title": "Gransfors Bruks Small Forest Axe", "description": "A small version of the Scandinavian Forest Axe.", "text": "Gransfors Bruks Small Forest Axe A small version of the Scandinavian Forest Axe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GGHBmBztL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004050KKG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004054XAE", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Hook and Loop Mini Organizer", "description": "Product Details Product Features Size 4-3/8-Inch wide by 7-Inch high Compact hook-and-loop organizer Dual elastic loops Designed for areas with small loop field Detach to easily move items to another bag Fits 3-Inch x 5-Inch Pocket Notebook Product Materials 1050-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally Do not machine wash Do not use detergent or bleach.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Hook and Loop Mini Organizer Product Details Product Features Size 4-3/8-Inch wide by 7-Inch high Compact hook-and-loop organizer Dual elastic loops Designed for areas with small loop field Detach to easily move items to another bag Fits 3-Inch x 5-Inch Pocket Notebook Product Materials 1050-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally Do not machine wash Do not use detergent or bleach.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dCb0Ga6tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004054XAE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 14.39}}
{"item_id": "B004054XEK", "title": "Gransfors Bruks Wildlife Hatchet", "description": "This mighty-mite easily stashes in your day-pack and can even be used as a belt axe. 14\" handle. 1 lb. head. Leather sheath included.", "text": "Gransfors Bruks Wildlife Hatchet This mighty-mite easily stashes in your day-pack and can even be used as a belt axe. 14\" handle. 1 lb. head. Leather sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YTxcBZj1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004054XEK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 170.0}}
{"item_id": "B0040635XE", "title": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Taurus 709 Slim", "description": "Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "text": "Crimson Trace Laserguard for Taurus 709 Slim Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WzgHKHJgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040635XE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 176.77}}
{"item_id": "B00407IC04", "title": "Tornado 5 in 1 Pepper Spray Defense System Alarm/Strobe Light/Speed Release", "description": "The Tornado is a revolutionary new product that incorporates incapacitating pepper spray, an ear-piercing 125dB alarm and a blinding strobe light into one personal defense system about the size of a cell phone. It is lightweight and easy to use, and can be accessed and deployed in about one second. A single button releases the unit from the base and automatically activates (in less than one second) the alarm and strobe, calling for help and blinding the attacker. The Tornado personal defense system discharges eight one second bursts of pepper spray up to a distance of 15 feet, and with the built in finger lock you always know the unit is pointed in the right direction (so you can't spray yourself). The unit measures three and one-half inches x two and one quarter inches. It requires 2 CR2032 button batteries that are included. A free belt clip is included with each unit purchased. Please by advised that there are legal restrictions for some states where pepper spray cannot be sold. This item will not be shipped outside of the United States or to any of the BELOW listed States within the United States as there are Legal Restrictions. MA, MI, NY or WI", "text": "Tornado 5 in 1 Pepper Spray Defense System Alarm/Strobe Light/Speed Release The Tornado is a revolutionary new product that incorporates incapacitating pepper spray, an ear-piercing 125dB alarm and a blinding strobe light into one personal defense system about the size of a cell phone. It is lightweight and easy to use, and can be accessed and deployed in about one second. A single button releases the unit from the base and automatically activates (in less than one second) the alarm and strobe, calling for help and blinding the attacker. The Tornado personal defense system discharges eight one second bursts of pepper spray up to a distance of 15 feet, and with the built in finger lock you always know the unit is pointed in the right direction (so you can't spray yourself). The unit measures three and one-half inches x two and one quarter inches. It requires 2 CR2032 button batteries that are included. A free belt clip is included with each unit purchased. Please by advised that there are legal restrictions for some states where pepper spray cannot be sold. This item will not be shipped outside of the United States or to any of the BELOW listed States within the United States as there are Legal Restrictions. MA, MI, NY or WI", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BDRdkRLPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00407IC04.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00407ORUS", "title": "Viking Tactics Light Mount - FDE", "description": "Consistent with the VTAC Mission, the Viking Tactics Light Mount was designed for today's modern warriors- providing a light-weight and versatile option to mount a flashlight onto any Picatinny rail system. Made of a Modified Acrylic PVC Alloy Thermoplastic with high impact and abrasion resistant qualities which have been proven to withstand the harshest environments, the Viking Tactics Light Mount is designed so that you can mount your light so that it is our of your field of view and easily activated. This new and improved version of the original VTAC Light Mount Design gives you enormous flexibility. It will allow you to mount most lights with a .80 or 1\" diameter and will fit the VTAC-L4 as well as the inexpensive Surefire G2 Nitrolon, Executive Series, and many others. The sleek VTAC design even offers a position in the insert to accommodate the clip on the light. Depending on your mounting preferences, the VTAC can be mounted in such a way that the light can be activated using a tape switch or it can be mounted in such a manner allowing you activate your light using the push button on the back of the light. (Note: Flashlights and firearms not included and must be purchased separately). The VTAC Light Mount is impervious to most chemicals, solvents and oils and its highly advanced thermoplastics will not shrink. With the high quality and innovative design that you expect from a Viking Tactics product, the VTAC Light Mount will keep you in the light and out of the dark.", "text": "Viking Tactics Light Mount - FDE Consistent with the VTAC Mission, the Viking Tactics Light Mount was designed for today's modern warriors- providing a light-weight and versatile option to mount a flashlight onto any Picatinny rail system. Made of a Modified Acrylic PVC Alloy Thermoplastic with high impact and abrasion resistant qualities which have been proven to withstand the harshest environments, the Viking Tactics Light Mount is designed so that you can mount your light so that it is our of your field of view and easily activated. This new and improved version of the original VTAC Light Mount Design gives you enormous flexibility. It will allow you to mount most lights with a .80 or 1\" diameter and will fit the VTAC-L4 as well as the inexpensive Surefire G2 Nitrolon, Executive Series, and many others. The sleek VTAC design even offers a position in the insert to accommodate the clip on the light. Depending on your mounting preferences, the VTAC can be mounted in such a way that the light can be activated using a tape switch or it can be mounted in such a manner allowing you activate your light using the push button on the back of the light. (Note: Flashlights and firearms not included and must be purchased separately). The VTAC Light Mount is impervious to most chemicals, solvents and oils and its highly advanced thermoplastics will not shrink. With the high quality and innovative design that you expect from a Viking Tactics product, the VTAC Light Mount will keep you in the light and out of the dark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FNdJ5bGCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00407ORUS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00408USKA", "title": "Marttiini Knives 010 Little Classic Fixed Blade Knife with Black Kraton Handles", "description": "Marttiini Little Classic. 7 3/8\" overall. 3 1/2\" 420 stainless straight hunter blade. Black textured Kraton handle with cast metal finger guard. Black leather belt sheath.", "text": "Marttiini Knives 010 Little Classic Fixed Blade Knife with Black Kraton Handles Marttiini Little Classic. 7 3/8\" overall. 3 1/2\" 420 stainless straight hunter blade. Black textured Kraton handle with cast metal finger guard. Black leather belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21yrAiJbUCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00408USKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marttiini", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 19.91}}
{"item_id": "B0040DRGM8", "title": "Park Tool Chain Whip For 1/8in Cogs", "description": "Remove a cassette lock ring or freewheel safely and easily with the Park Tool Chain Whip. The Chain Whip features a heat-treated handle that won't bend or break when removing an over-tightened lock ring. The opposite end of the Chain Whip has a hex opening designed to fit Park Tool freewheel remover--there you go, bike maintenance just got easier.", "text": "Park Tool Chain Whip For 1/8in Cogs Remove a cassette lock ring or freewheel safely and easily with the Park Tool Chain Whip. The Chain Whip features a heat-treated handle that won't bend or break when removing an over-tightened lock ring. The opposite end of the Chain Whip has a hex opening designed to fit Park Tool freewheel remover--there you go, bike maintenance just got easier.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31meQ-9OlWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040DRGM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B0040J2HRQ", "title": "Otis M-16/Small Caliber Patches (1000)", "description": "The small caliber patches are designed specifically for .17 caliber to .22 caliber rim-fire. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "text": "Otis M-16/Small Caliber Patches (1000) The small caliber patches are designed specifically for .17 caliber to .22 caliber rim-fire. Each patch is 100% cotton and can be used up to 6 times, offering 6 new clean surfaces. When attached to the slotted tip, they form a perfectly circular cleaning swab to allow for 360 degree coverage!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SycoLwCwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040J2HRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 48.99}}
{"item_id": "B0040J7HAS", "title": "Minoura B60R Tiredrive Trainer", "description": "Get fit without leaving the home with the entry-level Minoura B60R tire-drive bicycle trainer. The B60R is outfitted with a U-shaped frame that holds your bike's rear tire firmly in place.The trainer's mag resistance unit offers 7 resistance levels.Once you've clamped down the hub handle, your tire will be in position to drive the trainer's resistance unit, giving you an invigorating workout every time. The B60R is made to last, with 38mm diameter steel tubing that supports up to 265 pounds. The 29mm diameter legs, meanwhile, open wide for stability, but also fold up compactly for easy storage.The B60R's mag resistance unit coordinates with the twin disc-type 1.5-pound flywheel to create seven levels of resistance, all controllable via the remote control shifter (included) on your bike's handlebar or stem. Whether you want to ride fast and lean or simulate an uphill climb, the B60R delivers. The trainer concludes with a rustproof black ED paint finish that won't crack or fade.SpecificationsResistance: 7 levelsRemote: YesFlywheel: Steel disc, 1.5 poundsUsable tire range: 24 to 29 inches x 2.10 inchesMax load: 265 poundsDimensions: 24 by 15.7 by 18.5 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13.2 poundsWarranty: 1 year (mag unit), 5 years (frame)", "text": "Minoura B60R Tiredrive Trainer Get fit without leaving the home with the entry-level Minoura B60R tire-drive bicycle trainer. The B60R is outfitted with a U-shaped frame that holds your bike's rear tire firmly in place.The trainer's mag resistance unit offers 7 resistance levels.Once you've clamped down the hub handle, your tire will be in position to drive the trainer's resistance unit, giving you an invigorating workout every time. The B60R is made to last, with 38mm diameter steel tubing that supports up to 265 pounds. The 29mm diameter legs, meanwhile, open wide for stability, but also fold up compactly for easy storage.The B60R's mag resistance unit coordinates with the twin disc-type 1.5-pound flywheel to create seven levels of resistance, all controllable via the remote control shifter (included) on your bike's handlebar or stem. Whether you want to ride fast and lean or simulate an uphill climb, the B60R delivers. The trainer concludes with a rustproof black ED paint finish that won't crack or fade.SpecificationsResistance: 7 levelsRemote: YesFlywheel: Steel disc, 1.5 poundsUsable tire range: 24 to 29 inches x 2.10 inchesMax load: 265 poundsDimensions: 24 by 15.7 by 18.5 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 13.2 poundsWarranty: 1 year (mag unit), 5 years (frame)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BCXtoyGuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040J7HAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minoura", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 145.77}}
{"item_id": "B0040J7Y5Q", "title": "Otis Technology Nylon Double End All Purpose Receiver Brush, 25 FG-316-25", "description": "Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a slightly more aggressive blue nylon bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the bronze bristled brush. Combined, these brushes have over 1001 uses. Try these brushes on: firearms, automobile detailing, boats, golf equipment, battery terminals, camping, grout, jewelry, wood working, RC hobbies, crafts, and much, much more! *Available in Nylon, Heat Treated Blue Nylon, and Bronze", "text": "Otis Technology Nylon Double End All Purpose Receiver Brush, 25 FG-316-25 Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes allow you to choose the right brush for the right project. These brushes are the elite in cleaning those hard to reach places. They give you the ability to scrub places where carbon, powder, and copper residue hibernate. These brushes are available in a variety of different tolerances. The softest is the nylon bristled brush, followed by a slightly more aggressive blue nylon bristled brush. The most aggressive of Otis' All Purpose Receiver Brushes is the bronze bristled brush. Combined, these brushes have over 1001 uses. Try these brushes on: firearms, automobile detailing, boats, golf equipment, battery terminals, camping, grout, jewelry, wood working, RC hobbies, crafts, and much, much more! *Available in Nylon, Heat Treated Blue Nylon, and Bronze", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gb%2Bu7MylL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040J7Y5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 24.45}}
{"item_id": "B0040LSB0Q", "title": "Holster for Taurus PT22, PT25, PLY22 & PLY25", "description": "This is a US made holster. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for Taurus PT22, PT25, PLY22 & PLY25 This is a US made holster. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 1 1/2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HRyuoht5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040LSB0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.9}}
{"item_id": "B0040QCDZK", "title": "Zefal Floor Pump", "description": "Professional features like heavy-duty steel barrel, extra long hose and elevated gauge make the Air Max a great choice for home or shop. Z-Switch pump head instantly adapts from Presta to Schrader valves with the flick of a lever. Soft grip pump handle provides more comfort and a non-slip grip.", "text": "Zefal Floor Pump Professional features like heavy-duty steel barrel, extra long hose and elevated gauge make the Air Max a great choice for home or shop. Z-Switch pump head instantly adapts from Presta to Schrader valves with the flick of a lever. Soft grip pump handle provides more comfort and a non-slip grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N3YDMlmzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QCDZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0040QCE7M", "title": "Zefal Tru-Gel Bike Seat", "description": "Suitable for both mountain and road bike use, this unisex saddle features Tru-Gel padding and anatomical cut out for superior comfort. The innovative Zefal Z-Fit quick connect system allows for easy one-click connection with any Z-Fit compatible accessories", "text": "Zefal Tru-Gel Bike Seat Suitable for both mountain and road bike use, this unisex saddle features Tru-Gel padding and anatomical cut out for superior comfort. The innovative Zefal Z-Fit quick connect system allows for easy one-click connection with any Z-Fit compatible accessories", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y6Ul%2BLzAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QCE7M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0040QHIEQ", "title": "OnGuard Mini Ulock", "description": "U Lock 90 mm x 140 mm / (3.5' x 5.5')", "text": "OnGuard Mini Ulock U Lock 90 mm x 140 mm / (3.5' x 5.5')", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yflaaCgAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QHIEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0040QHJ9K", "title": "Zefal Spin Mirror", "description": "Constructed of unbreakable chrome plated lightweight ABS this bar end mirror adjusts for any angle and cleverly folds away when not in use or for storage. Universal fitting works with most mountain and road bar types. Attaches to either left or right side bar end", "text": "Zefal Spin Mirror Constructed of unbreakable chrome plated lightweight ABS this bar end mirror adjusts for any angle and cleverly folds away when not in use or for storage. Universal fitting works with most mountain and road bar types. Attaches to either left or right side bar end", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cULxLHZ%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QHJ9K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0040QHJC2", "title": "Zefal Light Set", "description": "A versatile lighting combo featuring a water resistant anodized aluminum front light with quick release mount paired with a high visibility rear light. Front light uses 9 HP LEDs for 900m visibility and 30 hours of run time in constant mode, 60 hours in flashing mode and features a quick release mount for use as a flashlight. Rear light features 9 ultra bright LEDs with a built-in reflector for 25 hour run time in constant mode, 50 hours in flashing mode.", "text": "Zefal Light Set A versatile lighting combo featuring a water resistant anodized aluminum front light with quick release mount paired with a high visibility rear light. Front light uses 9 HP LEDs for 900m visibility and 30 hours of run time in constant mode, 60 hours in flashing mode and features a quick release mount for use as a flashlight. Rear light features 9 ultra bright LEDs with a built-in reflector for 25 hour run time in constant mode, 50 hours in flashing mode.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EipRBW46L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QHJC2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B0040QHJGI", "title": "Zefal Alloy Cage", "description": "Advanced design features a rigid aluminum cage for solid bottle grip mated to a technopolymer mounting plate for shock absorption and flexibility. Aluminum cage is optimized for easy bottle retrieval from either side. Technopolymer mounting plate is compatible with all braze-on water bottle bosses. Available in silver", "text": "Zefal Alloy Cage Advanced design features a rigid aluminum cage for solid bottle grip mated to a technopolymer mounting plate for shock absorption and flexibility. Aluminum cage is optimized for easy bottle retrieval from either side. Technopolymer mounting plate is compatible with all braze-on water bottle bosses. Available in silver", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419f2R2chiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040QHJGI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0040RAMK2", "title": "Extra Large Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Deployment Bag", "description": "The standard Voodoo Tactical MOLLE deployment bag has been very popular, but users wanted more space. So we've responded with this new, enlarged MOLLE deployment bag that is longer, wider and deeper to accommodate 25 percent more gear. The new bag is 15\" x 6\" x 7.5\", has zippered pouches on the ends and one side.The bag is fully MOLLE compatible and will attach your MOLLE pack, vest or other gear. You can also hang pouches on it. The deployment bag is has a convenient grab handle or it can be carried with the removable shoulder strap. It's great when you need to grab your kit and go or for 100 other possible uses. We've seen these used as first aid kits, ammo bags, for climbing harnesses, even video camera bags.", "text": "Extra Large Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Deployment Bag The standard Voodoo Tactical MOLLE deployment bag has been very popular, but users wanted more space. So we've responded with this new, enlarged MOLLE deployment bag that is longer, wider and deeper to accommodate 25 percent more gear. The new bag is 15\" x 6\" x 7.5\", has zippered pouches on the ends and one side.The bag is fully MOLLE compatible and will attach your MOLLE pack, vest or other gear. You can also hang pouches on it. The deployment bag is has a convenient grab handle or it can be carried with the removable shoulder strap. It's great when you need to grab your kit and go or for 100 other possible uses. We've seen these used as first aid kits, ammo bags, for climbing harnesses, even video camera bags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wdHibA3dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040RAMK2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 33.09}}
{"item_id": "B0040RIENO", "title": "Mora Craftline TopQ Allround Fixed Blade Knife Stainless Steel", "description": "The complete TopQ range has knife blades made of the highest quality of Swedish stainless steel available. The knife is extremely sharp and it stays sharp for a long time. Furthermore, the patterned, double-moulded, high-friction grip is ergonomically designed making it an efficient, comfortable and safe knife to use. These knives combine extreme sharpness and cutting edge retention. Black plastic sheath.", "text": "Mora Craftline TopQ Allround Fixed Blade Knife Stainless Steel The complete TopQ range has knife blades made of the highest quality of Swedish stainless steel available. The knife is extremely sharp and it stays sharp for a long time. Furthermore, the patterned, double-moulded, high-friction grip is ergonomically designed making it an efficient, comfortable and safe knife to use. These knives combine extreme sharpness and cutting edge retention. Black plastic sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QaC2vZyuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040RIENO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0040V0RW6", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Belly-Waist Band Concealed Pistol +Magazine Holster", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear Concealed Belly/Waist Band holster. Black colored , with a band measurement of 5 inches wide. This concealed holster is crafted to be as universal as possible- this unique band's elastic tactical grade nylon can allow comfortable accommodation for medium to large sized waists (approximately fits from size 28-size 50). The actual holsters of the band are universally designed to fit most small, medium, and large framed handguns while the wrap will firmly hold the weapon in the desired position safely and securely. This also is equipped with a velcro closure to make the fit as secure and tight as possible. This one band includes 2 gun holsters (one on each side) and 2 spare magazine pouches (one on each side) and is great for hunters, law enforcement, and military.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Belly-Waist Band Concealed Pistol +Magazine Holster Official Ultimate Arms Gear Concealed Belly/Waist Band holster. Black colored , with a band measurement of 5 inches wide. This concealed holster is crafted to be as universal as possible- this unique band's elastic tactical grade nylon can allow comfortable accommodation for medium to large sized waists (approximately fits from size 28-size 50). The actual holsters of the band are universally designed to fit most small, medium, and large framed handguns while the wrap will firmly hold the weapon in the desired position safely and securely. This also is equipped with a velcro closure to make the fit as secure and tight as possible. This one band includes 2 gun holsters (one on each side) and 2 spare magazine pouches (one on each side) and is great for hunters, law enforcement, and military.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BoMC7SIgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040V0RW6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0040V2MF6", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 50 Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10, 12. 20 Gauge Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear 50 shell shotgun Bandolier. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 50 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.25\" wide ,70\" long and black in color.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 50 Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10, 12. 20 Gauge Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier Official Ultimate Arms Gear 50 shell shotgun Bandolier. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 50 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.25\" wide ,70\" long and black in color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KMjv91JyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040V2MF6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0040XF2YW", "title": "Velocity Exercise Magnetic Rower", "description": "Enjoy an effective cardio workout in the comfort of your own home with the Velocity Fitness CHR-2001 programmable magnetic rowing machine. The rower is equipped with a Drum Magnetic Control (DCS) system, which works with the electronic tension control to adjust resistance. To keep your workout on track, the rower includes a large easy-to-read LCD display, which monitors your time, count, strokes per minute, distance, calories, pulse, and calories burned. And users have plenty of workout programs from which to choose, including six preset workouts and a manual program. Other features include a large polyurethane molded saddle for maximum comfort, an anodized aluminum beam with rectangular tubing support, a folding design that saves space, and built-in transportation wheels.", "text": "Velocity Exercise Magnetic Rower Enjoy an effective cardio workout in the comfort of your own home with the Velocity Fitness CHR-2001 programmable magnetic rowing machine. The rower is equipped with a Drum Magnetic Control (DCS) system, which works with the electronic tension control to adjust resistance. To keep your workout on track, the rower includes a large easy-to-read LCD display, which monitors your time, count, strokes per minute, distance, calories, pulse, and calories burned. And users have plenty of workout programs from which to choose, including six preset workouts and a manual program. Other features include a large polyurethane molded saddle for maximum comfort, an anodized aluminum beam with rectangular tubing support, a folding design that saves space, and built-in transportation wheels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tN5ZVD1%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0040XF2YW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Velocity Exercise", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Rowers"]], "price": 599.99}}
{"item_id": "B004126HSW", "title": "Camelbak Hydrolink Replacement Tube w/ Mouth Piece Cover", "description": "Camelbak Hydrolink Replacement Tube w/ Mouth Piece CoverChange out your old delivery tube easily by snapping a replacement into the HydroLink exit ports on an Omega Reservoir.", "text": "Camelbak Hydrolink Replacement Tube w/ Mouth Piece Cover Camelbak Hydrolink Replacement Tube w/ Mouth Piece CoverChange out your old delivery tube easily by snapping a replacement into the HydroLink exit ports on an Omega Reservoir.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NuyRwtTML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004126HSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 19.46}}
{"item_id": "B0041285Q4", "title": "Nantucket Bike Basket CompanyLightship Collection Classic/Tapered Natural Bicycle Basket (Tan, 12 X 7.5 X 9)", "description": "The Lightship Collection baskets are woven with a very fine rattan cane material, which is the outer skin of the natural rattan fiber. These baskets are replicas of the Nantucket Lightship baskets, which were first produced in Nantucket during the whaling era of the 1800s.Most bicycle baskets are woven in a way you would make a decorative basket, one that you would use in your home as an accent piece. The problem with this is that this type of weave is not conducive to use in bicycle baskets, which serve a functional purpose and are used on a daily basis. The everyday wear-and-tear, as well as the natural elements on these bike baskets necessitate that they be woven in a tougher, stronger method. Our unique rolled rim weave ensures the baskets will hold up to the demands of everyday bike use. The Nantucket Bike Basket Company specializes in unique, hand-crafted baskets for your bicycle. Made from high-quality materials using durable weaving techniques, Nantucket Bike Baskets are made to last, while giving your bike that classic look.", "text": "Nantucket Bike Basket CompanyLightship Collection Classic/Tapered Natural Bicycle Basket (Tan, 12 X 7.5 X 9) The Lightship Collection baskets are woven with a very fine rattan cane material, which is the outer skin of the natural rattan fiber. These baskets are replicas of the Nantucket Lightship baskets, which were first produced in Nantucket during the whaling era of the 1800s.Most bicycle baskets are woven in a way you would make a decorative basket, one that you would use in your home as an accent piece. The problem with this is that this type of weave is not conducive to use in bicycle baskets, which serve a functional purpose and are used on a daily basis. The everyday wear-and-tear, as well as the natural elements on these bike baskets necessitate that they be woven in a tougher, stronger method. Our unique rolled rim weave ensures the baskets will hold up to the demands of everyday bike use. The Nantucket Bike Basket Company specializes in unique, hand-crafted baskets for your bicycle. Made from high-quality materials using durable weaving techniques, Nantucket Bike Baskets are made to last, while giving your bike that classic look.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61Ta4KMtb9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041285Q4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nantucket Bike Basket Co.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Bike Baskets"]], "price": 41.32}}
{"item_id": "B00412AQOI", "title": "Big Bite Valve Cover, Black", "description": "Big Bite Valve Cover, Black, For Use With Mfr. 90392, 90362, 90372, 90302, 90382, 90271, 90342", "text": "Big Bite Valve Cover, Black Big Bite Valve Cover, Black, For Use With Mfr. 90392, 90362, 90372, 90302, 90382, 90271, 90342", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n-M4ElyZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00412AQOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 7.95}}
