{"item_id": "B00417V520", "title": "Mainstreet Classics Micro Bag Toss", "description": "Enjoy a little quality time with the family with the Mainstreet Classics micro-bag toss game. Designed to rekindle the family fun of years past, the micro-bag toss game is playable indoors and out, so you and the kids can have fun anywhere, anytime. To play, just set up the two solid wood boards, which each include retractable legs on the backside. The object, like horseshoes or bocce, is to toss the eight bean bags into the opponent's slots. It's fun, easy to understand, and timeless. In addition, it's a breeze to bring the micro-bag game to picnics or BBQs thanks to the Velcro strips on the back of the boards and the carrying handles. Each micro-bag toss board measures 15-5/16 by 2-3/8 by 10 inches (W x H x D).", "text": "Mainstreet Classics Micro Bag Toss Enjoy a little quality time with the family with the Mainstreet Classics micro-bag toss game. Designed to rekindle the family fun of years past, the micro-bag toss game is playable indoors and out, so you and the kids can have fun anywhere, anytime. To play, just set up the two solid wood boards, which each include retractable legs on the backside. The object, like horseshoes or bocce, is to toss the eight bean bags into the opponent's slots. It's fun, easy to understand, and timeless. In addition, it's a breeze to bring the micro-bag game to picnics or BBQs thanks to the Velcro strips on the back of the boards and the carrying handles. Each micro-bag toss board measures 15-5/16 by 2-3/8 by 10 inches (W x H x D).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q0m3efVDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00417V520.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mainstreet Classics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Sets"]], "price": 41.67}}
