{"item_id": "B00419C1IA", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 4000 ct BB Bottle (Silver, 4.5 mm)", "description": "The standard in BB gun ammunition is Daisy's PrecisionMax premium BBs. Solid steel balls are zinc plated for extra smoothness. Bottles feature flip-top cap with large and small punch-out openings to make pouring BBs easy. 4000 count", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 4000 ct BB Bottle (Silver, 4.5 mm) The standard in BB gun ammunition is Daisy's PrecisionMax premium BBs. Solid steel balls are zinc plated for extra smoothness. Bottles feature flip-top cap with large and small punch-out openings to make pouring BBs easy. 4000 count", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TkGd0HyQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00419C1IA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00419DPIU", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products P51 Slingshot Kit (Yellow/Black, 8 Inch)", "description": "The Model P-51 Slingshot Kit features the famous Model P-51 slingshot with its sleek, molded pistol-grip handle, flexible wrist support, durable, latex rubber tubing and rugged release pouch. Also included with this kit are all the accessories you need to make the slingshot fun last for hours; 1 replacement band, 75 count 3/8 inch zinc-plated solid steel ammo and 250 count 1/4 inch zinc plated solid steel ammo.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products P51 Slingshot Kit (Yellow/Black, 8 Inch) The Model P-51 Slingshot Kit features the famous Model P-51 slingshot with its sleek, molded pistol-grip handle, flexible wrist support, durable, latex rubber tubing and rugged release pouch. Also included with this kit are all the accessories you need to make the slingshot fun last for hours; 1 replacement band, 75 count 3/8 inch zinc-plated solid steel ammo and 250 count 1/4 inch zinc plated solid steel ammo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51meO-wGw2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00419DPIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Slingshots"]], "price": 22.78}}
{"item_id": "B00419FMDG", "title": "CamlockBox for Primos Truth Cam 35, 46 and 60", "description": "Security Boxes to Fit Primos Truth Cam 35, Truth Cam 46, and Truth Cam 60. Use python cable or master lock padlock, can be lagbolted, belted , or bungeed to tree. Lockboxes that fit Primos Truth Cams, cameras are made of all steel construction with baked on powder coat finish, then a camo break paint is applied. These boxes add security to theft and also eliminate animals from chewing on your camera. Once the box is screwed or secured to the tree the camera can be taken in or out without any repositioning or rerunning of test cycles. The camera will always point back to the same spot. These are new security boxes manufactored by CAMLOCKbox. Made in and shipped from Wisconsin.", "text": "CamlockBox for Primos Truth Cam 35, 46 and 60 Security Boxes to Fit Primos Truth Cam 35, Truth Cam 46, and Truth Cam 60. Use python cable or master lock padlock, can be lagbolted, belted , or bungeed to tree. Lockboxes that fit Primos Truth Cams, cameras are made of all steel construction with baked on powder coat finish, then a camo break paint is applied. These boxes add security to theft and also eliminate animals from chewing on your camera. Once the box is screwed or secured to the tree the camera can be taken in or out without any repositioning or rerunning of test cycles. The camera will always point back to the same spot. These are new security boxes manufactored by CAMLOCKbox. Made in and shipped from Wisconsin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bsw4CKN%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00419FMDG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamLockBox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 41.98}}
{"item_id": "B00419HNBU", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products 6000 ct BB Bottle (Silver, 4.5 mm)", "description": "The standard in BB gun ammunition is Daisy's PrecisionMax premium BBs. Solid steel balls are zinc plated for extra smoothness. Bottles feature flip-top cap with large and small punch-out openings to make pouring BBs easy. 6000 count", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products 6000 ct BB Bottle (Silver, 4.5 mm) The standard in BB gun ammunition is Daisy's PrecisionMax premium BBs. Solid steel balls are zinc plated for extra smoothness. Bottles feature flip-top cap with large and small punch-out openings to make pouring BBs easy. 6000 count", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LE8apj5-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00419HNBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 23.59}}
