{"item_id": "B0041C984C", "title": "VISM by NcStar Ambidextrous Horizontal Shoulder Holster with Double Magazine Holder, Black (CV2909)", "description": "The NcStar ambidextrous shoulder holster is perfect for concealed carry when wearing a jacket or coat. Made of a tough PVC material, the holster is adjustable for right- or left-handed draw, and includes a double magazine holder attached to the shoulder harness. Other features include an adjustable thumb break for various size pistols, tie-down straps for securing the holster to your belt or belt loop, and double thumb break snaps for optimum pistol security. The holster is adjustable to accommodate small to XXL sizes.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Ambidextrous Horizontal Shoulder Holster with Double Magazine Holder, Black (CV2909) The NcStar ambidextrous shoulder holster is perfect for concealed carry when wearing a jacket or coat. Made of a tough PVC material, the holster is adjustable for right- or left-handed draw, and includes a double magazine holder attached to the shoulder harness. Other features include an adjustable thumb break for various size pistols, tie-down straps for securing the holster to your belt or belt loop, and double thumb break snaps for optimum pistol security. The holster is adjustable to accommodate small to XXL sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RQti0ZS4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041C984C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0041D4U6C", "title": "CatEye HL-EL135 Headlight/TL-LD130 Tail Light Combo", "description": "The CatEye HL-EL135 Headlight/TL-LD130 Tail Light Combo is the perfect everday comutter light. The HL-EL135 has three LEDs and OptiCube lens technology for a wider, 150 candlepower beam with excellent visibility. With two AA batteries, the HL-EL135 will run up to 80 hrs on constant mode and up to 320 hrs on flashing mode. It features our exclusive tool-free FlexTight mounting bracket that allows you to quickly and easily attach the HL-EL135 to virtually any handlebar. The TL-LD130 Tail light features awesome triple-LED performance at an economical price. Three modes let you decide how flashy you want to be. Two AAA batteries provide up to 150 hours of run time. CatEye exclusive FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to mount the TL-LD130 virtually anywhere you'd like.HL-EL135 Headlight Runtime: Approx 80hrs in constant mode and 320 hrs in flashing mode.TL-LD130 Tail Light Dimension: 36.0 X 77.0 X 24.0mm.TL-LD130 Tail Light Weight: approx48 grams(with bracket and batteries).TL-LD130 Tail Light Light source: Red LED X3.TL-LD130 Tail Light Battery: AAA alkaline battery X2.TL-LD130 Tail Light Runtime: Approx 75hrs in constant, 150hrs in flashing, and 150hrs in random flashing mode.TL-LD130 Tail Light Mount size: f12.0,32.0mm.TL-LD130 Tail Light Other: Clothingclip included.", "text": "CatEye HL-EL135 Headlight/TL-LD130 Tail Light Combo The CatEye HL-EL135 Headlight/TL-LD130 Tail Light Combo is the perfect everday comutter light. The HL-EL135 has three LEDs and OptiCube lens technology for a wider, 150 candlepower beam with excellent visibility. With two AA batteries, the HL-EL135 will run up to 80 hrs on constant mode and up to 320 hrs on flashing mode. It features our exclusive tool-free FlexTight mounting bracket that allows you to quickly and easily attach the HL-EL135 to virtually any handlebar. The TL-LD130 Tail light features awesome triple-LED performance at an economical price. Three modes let you decide how flashy you want to be. Two AAA batteries provide up to 150 hours of run time. CatEye exclusive FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to mount the TL-LD130 virtually anywhere you'd like.HL-EL135 Headlight Runtime: Approx 80hrs in constant mode and 320 hrs in flashing mode.TL-LD130 Tail Light Dimension: 36.0 X 77.0 X 24.0mm.TL-LD130 Tail Light Weight: approx48 grams(with bracket and batteries).TL-LD130 Tail Light Light source: Red LED X3.TL-LD130 Tail Light Battery: AAA alkaline battery X2.TL-LD130 Tail Light Runtime: Approx 75hrs in constant, 150hrs in flashing, and 150hrs in random flashing mode.TL-LD130 Tail Light Mount size: f12.0,32.0mm.TL-LD130 Tail Light Other: Clothingclip included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u9RKKRgXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041D4U6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B0041D5ACA", "title": "CatEye Head Light and Rear Light Combo, Black", "description": "EL 130 Single super bright LED Constant and flashing mode OptiCube lens technology Up to 400 hours runtime Uses two AA batteries LD170 Three ultra bright LEDs Constant and flashing mode 60 hours of runtime in flashing mode Universal mounting kit Clothing clip.", "text": "CatEye Head Light and Rear Light Combo, Black EL 130 Single super bright LED Constant and flashing mode OptiCube lens technology Up to 400 hours runtime Uses two AA batteries LD170 Three ultra bright LEDs Constant and flashing mode 60 hours of runtime in flashing mode Universal mounting kit Clothing clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xrMK%2BirmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041D5ACA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0041EB6EU", "title": "SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack", "description": "FEATURES of the SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack SteriPEN's most affordable travel water purifier Capable of purifying 200 half-liter servings of water on just one set of AA lithium batteries Fits perfectly into commercial water bottles, forming a seal that lets you keep the water in the original bottle for purification Inserts into the mouth of the bottle, which is then turned upside down, and you have safe drinking water in less than a minute Powered by 4 AA batteries, which are NOT included Lithium or Nickel Metal Hydride batteries are strongly recommended Only high-quality and well-known brand name batteries are recommended Alkaline batteries of any kind are NOT recommended SPECIFICATIONS of the SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack Weight: 5.7 oz / 162 g with lithium batteries Dimension: (L x W x H): 7.6 x 1.5 x 1.5\" Battery: Uses four AA lithium batteries (not included) Battery Life: 200 treatments (16 oz / 0.5 liter) UV Lamp Life: 3,000 treatments", "text": "SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack FEATURES of the SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack SteriPEN's most affordable travel water purifier Capable of purifying 200 half-liter servings of water on just one set of AA lithium batteries Fits perfectly into commercial water bottles, forming a seal that lets you keep the water in the original bottle for purification Inserts into the mouth of the bottle, which is then turned upside down, and you have safe drinking water in less than a minute Powered by 4 AA batteries, which are NOT included Lithium or Nickel Metal Hydride batteries are strongly recommended Only high-quality and well-known brand name batteries are recommended Alkaline batteries of any kind are NOT recommended SPECIFICATIONS of the SteriPen Traveler Retail Pack Weight: 5.7 oz / 162 g with lithium batteries Dimension: (L x W x H): 7.6 x 1.5 x 1.5\" Battery: Uses four AA lithium batteries (not included) Battery Life: 200 treatments (16 oz / 0.5 liter) UV Lamp Life: 3,000 treatments", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cunfKkghL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041EB6EU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SteriPen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 40.94}}
{"item_id": "B0041EKQSC", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TFSAT98-CP Flash II Tanto Knife with Partially Serrated Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish", "description": "The Flash II 3-1/2-Inch Knife has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash family of knives feature SOG Assisted Technology (S.A.T.), which employs a powerful piston lock that is easily released with a sliding button. The Flash II Tanto (Partially Serrated Black TiNi) comes standard with glass-reinforced nylon (GRN) handle and partially serrated edge, Black TiNi finished tanto blade. All Flash knives come standard with SOG's patent pending, reversible bayonet mounted clip that ensures the lowest, most discreet carry possible. We also had the foresight to incorporate an additional safety lock that gives added security when the blade is closed. About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty Tools SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools TFSAT98-CP Flash II Tanto Knife with Partially Serrated Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Black TiNi Finish The Flash II 3-1/2-Inch Knife has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash family of knives feature SOG Assisted Technology (S.A.T.), which employs a powerful piston lock that is easily released with a sliding button. The Flash II Tanto (Partially Serrated Black TiNi) comes standard with glass-reinforced nylon (GRN) handle and partially serrated edge, Black TiNi finished tanto blade. All Flash knives come standard with SOG's patent pending, reversible bayonet mounted clip that ensures the lowest, most discreet carry possible. We also had the foresight to incorporate an additional safety lock that gives added security when the blade is closed. About SOG: Strong, Innovative, Specialty Tools SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JLlG2OqiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041EKQSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 44.89}}
{"item_id": "B0041EO62Y", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FSAT8-CP Flash II Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "The Flash II 3-1/2-Inch Knife has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash II Tanto has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash family of knives feature SOG Assisted Technology (S.A.T.), which employs a powerful piston lock that is easily released with a sliding button. The Flash II Tanto (Straight edge) comes standard with glass-reinforced nylon (GRN) handle and straight edge, Satin finished tanto blade.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FSAT8-CP Flash II Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Steel Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish The Flash II 3-1/2-Inch Knife has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash II Tanto has got to be one of the coolest knives we've ever seen. Forget its wicked-quick blade access, that it handles like a race car on rails, or that it locks up like Alcatraz. It just looks and feels extraordinary. The Flash family of knives feature SOG Assisted Technology (S.A.T.), which employs a powerful piston lock that is easily released with a sliding button. The Flash II Tanto (Straight edge) comes standard with glass-reinforced nylon (GRN) handle and straight edge, Satin finished tanto blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ThSoKIfxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041EO62Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 38.42}}
{"item_id": "B0041FQZMW", "title": "CAP Barbell 6 Piece Anti-Microbial Puzzle Mats", "description": "About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. 6 interlocking heavy duty rubber squares. Made to inhibit the growth of bacteria and fungus. Creates 24 sq. ft. when all squares are combined. 1/2-inch thick rubber provides floor protection. Some assembly required. 24L x 24W x 0.5H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "text": "CAP Barbell 6 Piece Anti-Microbial Puzzle Mats About CAP Barbell CAP Barbell is a leading distributor and provider of fitness equipment. Launched in 1982 with a small inventory of free weights and benches, CAP Barbell has grown over the past 20+ years to include more than 600 products in 10 categories. Headquartered in Houston, Texas, CAP Barbell is dedicated to providing quality fitness equipment at competitive prices, by constructively designing, accurately testing, and manufacturing its products to perfection. 6 interlocking heavy duty rubber squares. Made to inhibit the growth of bacteria and fungus. Creates 24 sq. ft. when all squares are combined. 1/2-inch thick rubber provides floor protection. Some assembly required. 24L x 24W x 0.5H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included (see product guarantee).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WKTW68QyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041FQZMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 29.99}}
