{"item_id": "B0041G3ZK6", "title": "US Weight 105-Pound Weight Set with Dumbbells", "description": "Weight training with free weights remains one of the fastest, most effective ways to build strength and muscle mass, and this simple yet comprehensive set of gear from US Weight helps you do just that.The 105-pound set includes:Two 20-pound weightsFour ten-pound weightsFour five-pound weightsSix locking spring clipsTwo dumbbell barsOne heavy-duty, four-pound straight barInformative, user-friendly training guideThe straight bar has textured, nonslip grips and a patented design, and each coated weight is easy on your floor and rust-resistant.WarrantyUS Weight equipment includes a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "US Weight 105-Pound Weight Set with Dumbbells Weight training with free weights remains one of the fastest, most effective ways to build strength and muscle mass, and this simple yet comprehensive set of gear from US Weight helps you do just that.The 105-pound set includes:Two 20-pound weightsFour ten-pound weightsFour five-pound weightsSix locking spring clipsTwo dumbbell barsOne heavy-duty, four-pound straight barInformative, user-friendly training guideThe straight bar has textured, nonslip grips and a patented design, and each coated weight is easy on your floor and rust-resistant.WarrantyUS Weight equipment includes a limited 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vPX8mrrgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041G3ZK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US Weight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]], "price": 87.98}}
{"item_id": "B0041G9SOI", "title": "Aftermath Kavia Elite Sport Slingshot", "description": "A BB round magazine is incorporated directly into the stock for rapid reloading.The Kavia Elite slingshot is the top model in Aftermath's Kavia Series, and features high quality thrust bands, a leather round pouch, and BB magazine built directly into the grip for rapid reloading. A wrist brace and integrated, adjustable sight improve accuracy, and the slingshot works best with 0.375-inch BBs. Not for sale in some zip codes.WarrantyAftermath Airsoft products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Aftermath AirsoftA part of renowned airsoft company Gamo Outdoor USA, Aftermath is based in Miami, Florida, and creates airsoft gun products specifically for adults.", "text": "Aftermath Kavia Elite Sport Slingshot A BB round magazine is incorporated directly into the stock for rapid reloading.The Kavia Elite slingshot is the top model in Aftermath's Kavia Series, and features high quality thrust bands, a leather round pouch, and BB magazine built directly into the grip for rapid reloading. A wrist brace and integrated, adjustable sight improve accuracy, and the slingshot works best with 0.375-inch BBs. Not for sale in some zip codes.WarrantyAftermath Airsoft products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Aftermath AirsoftA part of renowned airsoft company Gamo Outdoor USA, Aftermath is based in Miami, Florida, and creates airsoft gun products specifically for adults.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KoWTkmNDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041G9SOI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 19.63}}
{"item_id": "B0041G9T5Q", "title": "Aftermath LS635 SOCOM Tactical Laser", "description": "The brilliant beam of the red laser sight finds your target quickly and precisely. Weaver style base, Hex wrench set and (3) 1,5V LR44 batteries are also included. The black matte finish adds a nice non reflective look. (Laser Class: 3R , Output Power:3-5mW, Wave Length: 635nm)", "text": "Aftermath LS635 SOCOM Tactical Laser The brilliant beam of the red laser sight finds your target quickly and precisely. Weaver style base, Hex wrench set and (3) 1,5V LR44 batteries are also included. The black matte finish adds a nice non reflective look. (Laser Class: 3R , Output Power:3-5mW, Wave Length: 635nm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z2PyWhW9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041G9T5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0041G9TMO", "title": "Gamo Aftermath RD30 Red Dot Scope for Airsoft Rifle", "description": "The Aftermath Multi-Purpose Sighting Systems is a great light weight sight for close quarter and medium range targets. You can adjust the brightness of the dot, depending on the brightness of your surroundings.", "text": "Gamo Aftermath RD30 Red Dot Scope for Airsoft Rifle The Aftermath Multi-Purpose Sighting Systems is a great light weight sight for close quarter and medium range targets. You can adjust the brightness of the dot, depending on the brightness of your surroundings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UQ0v5Ij7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041G9TMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0041GBHC4", "title": "Aftermath Kavia Sport Slingshot", "description": "A BB round magazine is incorporated directly into the stock for rapid reloading.The Kavia Sport slingshot is a durable and reliable slingshot, and features high quality tubular thrust bands, a leather round pouch, and BB magazine built directly into the grip for rapid reloading. The Sport works best with 0.375-inch BBs, and is not for sale in some zip codes.WarrantyAftermath Airsoft products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Aftermath AirsoftA part of renowned airsoft company Gamo Outdoor USA, Aftermath is based in Miami, Florida, and creates airsoft gun products specifically for adults.", "text": "Aftermath Kavia Sport Slingshot A BB round magazine is incorporated directly into the stock for rapid reloading.The Kavia Sport slingshot is a durable and reliable slingshot, and features high quality tubular thrust bands, a leather round pouch, and BB magazine built directly into the grip for rapid reloading. The Sport works best with 0.375-inch BBs, and is not for sale in some zip codes.WarrantyAftermath Airsoft products include a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Aftermath AirsoftA part of renowned airsoft company Gamo Outdoor USA, Aftermath is based in Miami, Florida, and creates airsoft gun products specifically for adults.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FLwUzNNQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041GBHC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AfterMath", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B0041GDP56", "title": "Benchmade/Warn Barrage Tanto Knife with Axis Assist", "description": "Benchmade and Warn team up to create this responsive knife. Benchmade 583-1 Warn Assisted opening knife, 3.6\" 154CM stainless steel blade, black Valox handle, with double stainless steel liners and red back spacer, super smooth and strong Axis lock, black stainless steel reversible pocket clip (right or left hand, tip up carry)", "text": "Benchmade/Warn Barrage Tanto Knife with Axis Assist Benchmade and Warn team up to create this responsive knife. Benchmade 583-1 Warn Assisted opening knife, 3.6\" 154CM stainless steel blade, black Valox handle, with double stainless steel liners and red back spacer, super smooth and strong Axis lock, black stainless steel reversible pocket clip (right or left hand, tip up carry)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V7XZ3OeLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041GDP56.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade/Warn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 127.5}}
{"item_id": "B0041GNF2O", "title": "NFL Sign, 11-Inch by 17-Inch", "description": "Hardboard wood signs are 1/4\" thick, decorated with quality graphics to resemble an antique wood finish. A matte finish laminate top is added for greater durability and a precision cut smooth edge makes this a great indoor decor sign. Made in USA.", "text": "NFL Sign, 11-Inch by 17-Inch Hardboard wood signs are 1/4\" thick, decorated with quality graphics to resemble an antique wood finish. A matte finish laminate top is added for greater durability and a precision cut smooth edge makes this a great indoor decor sign. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hSr5f9nTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041GNF2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WinCraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Patio, Lawn & Garden", "Street Signs"]], "price": 23.0}}
{"item_id": "B0041GQBI4", "title": "Adventure Class 4-16x40 Riflescope in Black with Dual Illuminated Reticle", "description": "CPA416AORG Features: -Riflescope with dual Illuminated reticle.-Wipe the lens with a clean flannel cloth to keep it clean and dry.-Use only a clean flannel cloth for cleaning.-To maintain battery life, turn illumination off when not in use.-Magnification: 4x-16x.-Objective: Diameter (mm): 40.-Exit Pupil (mm): 10.0 - 2.5.-Eye Relief (inches): 3.9 - 3.0.-Field of View (@ 100yds): 24.0' - 7.3'.-Tube Diameter: (inches): 1.-Length (inches): 14.5.-W/E Adjust Click Value: 1/4 MOA.-Parallax Setting (yds): 5 to Infinity. Color/Finish: -Color: Black. Specifications: -Battery: CR2032 3V Lithium. Collection: -Adventure Class collection.", "text": "Adventure Class 4-16x40 Riflescope in Black with Dual Illuminated Reticle CPA416AORG Features: -Riflescope with dual Illuminated reticle.-Wipe the lens with a clean flannel cloth to keep it clean and dry.-Use only a clean flannel cloth for cleaning.-To maintain battery life, turn illumination off when not in use.-Magnification: 4x-16x.-Objective: Diameter (mm): 40.-Exit Pupil (mm): 10.0 - 2.5.-Eye Relief (inches): 3.9 - 3.0.-Field of View (@ 100yds): 24.0' - 7.3'.-Tube Diameter: (inches): 1.-Length (inches): 14.5.-W/E Adjust Click Value: 1/4 MOA.-Parallax Setting (yds): 5 to Infinity. Color/Finish: -Color: Black. Specifications: -Battery: CR2032 3V Lithium. Collection: -Adventure Class collection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xwk8jg96L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041GQBI4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0041HLOJY", "title": "Condor Mesh Tactical Cap", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor Mesh Tactical Cap Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XS%2BU1df3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041HLOJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Hats", "Men's"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0041HS4WO", "title": "Aquamira Tactical Frontier Pro Ultralight Water Filter", "description": "The Aquamira Frontier Pro Tactical portable water filter system provides all the benefits of a larger bottle filter in an ultralight, compact size. This military edition water filter is a straw-style filter in an olive drab color, with a design that attaches directly to water bottles or bladders and an attached cap that keeps mouthpieces clean. Once attached, the Frontier Pro Tactical will remove 99.9 percent of Giardia, Cryptosporidium, and other contaminants down to 3 microns. The filter's activated carbon--made using only the finest-quality coconut shell carbon--absorbs chemicals and odors and improves the taste of the filtered water. And thanks to the filter's Miraguard antimicrobial technology, the filter media resist the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold, and mildew. Use the Frontier Pro Tactical filter to drink from any water bottle, cup, hydration system, or straight from the water source.The Frontier Pro Tactical comes with a universal connectivity adapter system, which connects directly to any water bottle with a 28mm opening, such as a Platypus or a standard-size bottle. You can also use the tube connection feature to connect directly to your hydration system or drink tube, or drink directly from any open container or water source. And should you want to filter water in advance and drink later, you can flip the Frontier Pro Tactical into \"gravity flow\" mode. The filter measures 1.25 inches in diameter and 5.5 inches long and weighs 2 ounces dry.The Frontier Pro Tactical filters up to 50 gallons. To lengthen filter life, use replacement pre-filters.Note:Miraguard does not protect users against foodborne or disease-causing bacteria, viruses, or germs. If viruses or smaller bacteria are suspected, use in conjunction with Aquamira water purifier tablets.", "text": "Aquamira Tactical Frontier Pro Ultralight Water Filter The Aquamira Frontier Pro Tactical portable water filter system provides all the benefits of a larger bottle filter in an ultralight, compact size. This military edition water filter is a straw-style filter in an olive drab color, with a design that attaches directly to water bottles or bladders and an attached cap that keeps mouthpieces clean. Once attached, the Frontier Pro Tactical will remove 99.9 percent of Giardia, Cryptosporidium, and other contaminants down to 3 microns. The filter's activated carbon--made using only the finest-quality coconut shell carbon--absorbs chemicals and odors and improves the taste of the filtered water. And thanks to the filter's Miraguard antimicrobial technology, the filter media resist the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold, and mildew. Use the Frontier Pro Tactical filter to drink from any water bottle, cup, hydration system, or straight from the water source.The Frontier Pro Tactical comes with a universal connectivity adapter system, which connects directly to any water bottle with a 28mm opening, such as a Platypus or a standard-size bottle. You can also use the tube connection feature to connect directly to your hydration system or drink tube, or drink directly from any open container or water source. And should you want to filter water in advance and drink later, you can flip the Frontier Pro Tactical into \"gravity flow\" mode. The filter measures 1.25 inches in diameter and 5.5 inches long and weighs 2 ounces dry.The Frontier Pro Tactical filters up to 50 gallons. To lengthen filter life, use replacement pre-filters.Note:Miraguard does not protect users against foodborne or disease-causing bacteria, viruses, or germs. If viruses or smaller bacteria are suspected, use in conjunction with Aquamira water purifier tablets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XIeIF-BBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041HS4WO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 15.46}}
{"item_id": "B0041ND0ZY", "title": "Tempo Ultra SC 240 ML (8.12 oz) Multi Use Pest Control Insecticide ~ Spiders Bedbugs Roaches Silverfish etc..", "description": "The active ingredient in TEMPO SC Ultra is beta-cyfluthrin, which is powerful against pests with no odor and less visible residue. TEMPO SC delivers the power of a powder formulation in a liquid, and allows for more even disbursement during application. Tempo SC Ultra effectively controls a broad spectrum of indoor, outdoor, and turf and ornamental pests. Makes 30 gallons for indoors and treats 30,000 sq. ft. outdoors. Tempo SC Ultra effectively controls over 100 different types of indoor, outdoor, turf and ornamental insect pests. Tempo SC Ultra is a suspension concentrate that delivers the power of a powder formulation in a liquid. It's easy to use too-less messy to handle, needs less agitation and is more evenly dispersed during application than other products. Tempo SC Ultra has no odor, is non-staining, and has a long lasting residual of up to 3 months. Some microencapsulated formulas may seem less expensive than Tempo SC Ultra- until you actually use them. But Tempo SC Ultra has a higher insect mortality rate, so you don't waste time and money on retreating areas.Target pests: indoor (crack and crevice) and outdoor pests, pantry pests. See label for detailed list.", "text": "Tempo Ultra SC 240 ML (8.12 oz) Multi Use Pest Control Insecticide ~ Spiders Bedbugs Roaches Silverfish etc.. The active ingredient in TEMPO SC Ultra is beta-cyfluthrin, which is powerful against pests with no odor and less visible residue. TEMPO SC delivers the power of a powder formulation in a liquid, and allows for more even disbursement during application. Tempo SC Ultra effectively controls a broad spectrum of indoor, outdoor, and turf and ornamental pests. Makes 30 gallons for indoors and treats 30,000 sq. ft. outdoors. Tempo SC Ultra effectively controls over 100 different types of indoor, outdoor, turf and ornamental insect pests. Tempo SC Ultra is a suspension concentrate that delivers the power of a powder formulation in a liquid. It's easy to use too-less messy to handle, needs less agitation and is more evenly dispersed during application than other products. Tempo SC Ultra has no odor, is non-staining, and has a long lasting residual of up to 3 months. Some microencapsulated formulas may seem less expensive than Tempo SC Ultra- until you actually use them. But Tempo SC Ultra has a higher insect mortality rate, so you don't waste time and money on retreating areas.Target pests: indoor (crack and crevice) and outdoor pests, pantry pests. See label for detailed list.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W9M1%2B4CxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041ND0ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tempo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 44.5}}
{"item_id": "B0041O4GT2", "title": "True Utility CashStash Capsule (Black)", "description": "Never run out of money again! Well, that would be brilliant, wouldn't it?! This clever capsule has a specially designed cash clip inside to wrap an emergency note around. It takes up hardly any room on your key-ring, as it is much smaller than even a small door key; yet will really get you out of trouble by covering that last round of drinks, or paying for the taxi home at the end of the night! I have been so pleased at the end of the night when i suddenly remember that i am not totally skint, it makes me genuinely happy every time it happens! Constructed from aircraft grade aluminium and with a waterproof neoprene ‘O’ ring to make sure your emergency funds do not ever get soggy. It comes with a split ring for attaching to your key ring, bag or clothing. Never leave home without it. Also makes a perfect gift - especially if you put cash in it!! Patent Pending.", "text": "True Utility CashStash Capsule (Black) Never run out of money again! Well, that would be brilliant, wouldn't it?! This clever capsule has a specially designed cash clip inside to wrap an emergency note around. It takes up hardly any room on your key-ring, as it is much smaller than even a small door key; yet will really get you out of trouble by covering that last round of drinks, or paying for the taxi home at the end of the night! I have been so pleased at the end of the night when i suddenly remember that i am not totally skint, it makes me genuinely happy every time it happens! Constructed from aircraft grade aluminium and with a waterproof neoprene ‘O’ ring to make sure your emergency funds do not ever get soggy. It comes with a split ring for attaching to your key ring, bag or clothing. Never leave home without it. Also makes a perfect gift - especially if you put cash in it!! Patent Pending.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EtiCYfKFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041O4GT2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "True Utility", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 14.7}}
{"item_id": "B0041OZUJ2", "title": "Arrow Laser Sighting Tool", "description": "This unit gives you the ability to fine-tune arrow sights without shooting an arrow. No more losing or damaging arrows. Hit the target with your first shot! This unit mounts directly to your arrow by using the threads in the insert. A very straight arrow and spin tester must be used to achieve perfect alignment of the laser beam and the arrow shaft before the unit can be used. Product Detail: Includes arrow laser aiming device and batteries laser output power = Less Than 5mw Material: aluminum Wavelength = 635-655nm", "text": "Arrow Laser Sighting Tool This unit gives you the ability to fine-tune arrow sights without shooting an arrow. No more losing or damaging arrows. Hit the target with your first shot! This unit mounts directly to your arrow by using the threads in the insert. A very straight arrow and spin tester must be used to achieve perfect alignment of the laser beam and the arrow shaft before the unit can be used. Product Detail: Includes arrow laser aiming device and batteries laser output power = Less Than 5mw Material: aluminum Wavelength = 635-655nm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bLBJTPOoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041OZUJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 23.99}}
