{"item_id": "B0041TWTGE", "title": "12 Volt DC Marine Utility Pump, #4830", "description": "Motor: 12V DC, 50-watt, 4500 RPM Amps: 7.5 start, Impeller driven. 200 gph pump with 23 foot max lift.", "text": "12 Volt DC Marine Utility Pump, #4830 Motor: 12V DC, 50-watt, 4500 RPM Amps: 7.5 start, Impeller driven. 200 gph pump with 23 foot max lift.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31icrIkQyLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041TWTGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pacific Hydrostar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Plumbing", "Bilge Pumps"]], "price": 44.48}}
{"item_id": "B0041VJWSK", "title": "Key-Shaped Folding Knife, 2-11/64\" Long", "description": "Key-Shaped Folding Knife, 2-11/64\" Long (Nominal 2\") with a blade that has a 1-5/16\" sharp edge. The key shape and size with standard hole allows attachment of the folding knife to any keychain. This knife has the standard latch that keeps the blade in the open position and also latched in the closed position. The blade also remains at any position in between. The knife blade has a standard thumb groove that remains conveniently accessible when the blade is in the closed position. The key shaped outer body has a matte gold finish and the blade is constructed of highly polished shiny metal and comes sharply honed. Dimensions: 2-11/64\" Long (Folded) & 3-11/16\" Long (Unfolded) x 7/8\" Wide x 7/32\" Thick", "text": "Key-Shaped Folding Knife, 2-11/64\" Long Key-Shaped Folding Knife, 2-11/64\" Long (Nominal 2\") with a blade that has a 1-5/16\" sharp edge. The key shape and size with standard hole allows attachment of the folding knife to any keychain. This knife has the standard latch that keeps the blade in the open position and also latched in the closed position. The blade also remains at any position in between. The knife blade has a standard thumb groove that remains conveniently accessible when the blade is in the closed position. The key shaped outer body has a matte gold finish and the blade is constructed of highly polished shiny metal and comes sharply honed. Dimensions: 2-11/64\" Long (Folded) & 3-11/16\" Long (Unfolded) x 7/8\" Wide x 7/32\" Thick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fnD7KkC0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041VJWSK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B0041VOSHA", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Pink Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975”, SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Cool style and hot protection are combined in SABRE's most economical product. This attractive, PINK compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE permits distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Help fight breast cancer as sales of this product support the National Breast Cancer Foundation!Note: This item is not available to ship to certain states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Pink Key Ring (Max Protection - 25 shots, up to 5x's more) Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975”, SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Cool style and hot protection are combined in SABRE's most economical product. This attractive, PINK compact pepper spray delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE permits distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Help fight breast cancer as sales of this product support the National Breast Cancer Foundation!Note: This item is not available to ship to certain states. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316yfWdedrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041VOSHA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 8.35}}
