{"item_id": "B0041XC4WE", "title": "Planet Bike Cascadia ATB Bicycle Fenders", "description": "Our Top-of-the-Line Fenders for ATB. Polished Aluminum bonded to Superflex unbreakable all-weather polycarbonate. 130mm mudflaps provide ultimate coverage and are double-riveted for durability. Hardware is all stainless steel and pre-installed for hassle-free mounting. V-stays on the front and fender for added stability. 45mm width. Fits tires up to 26\"x1.75\" to 2.25\".", "text": "Planet Bike Cascadia ATB Bicycle Fenders Our Top-of-the-Line Fenders for ATB. Polished Aluminum bonded to Superflex unbreakable all-weather polycarbonate. 130mm mudflaps provide ultimate coverage and are double-riveted for durability. Hardware is all stainless steel and pre-installed for hassle-free mounting. V-stays on the front and fender for added stability. 45mm width. Fits tires up to 26\"x1.75\" to 2.25\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-0zKPdsVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041XC4WE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 52.25}}
{"item_id": "B0041XEW0Q", "title": "Gone Fishing Gone Fishing Fillet Knife With Sheath 12.25 Inches Fillet Knife, Brown", "description": "With a pliable, narrow blade that finely cuts and finely trims, this Gone Fishing™ knife is specially designed to bone and filet fish. The full-tang high-carbon-steel blade is triple riveted to the stained wood handle for superior balance.", "text": "Gone Fishing Gone Fishing Fillet Knife With Sheath 12.25 Inches Fillet Knife, Brown With a pliable, narrow blade that finely cuts and finely trims, this Gone Fishing™ knife is specially designed to bone and filet fish. The full-tang high-carbon-steel blade is triple riveted to the stained wood handle for superior balance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a23Iae8mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0041XEW0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gone Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Knives"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00420NE8O", "title": "Troy Industries Micro HK Style Front and Rear Folding Battle Sight", "description": "Troy BattleSights set the world standard for performance and durability. Now, Troy has developed a rugged low-profile sight designed for firearms with top rails higher than the standard M4. For shooters who favor a sightline that’s as close to the barrel as possible, or for those with raised top rail systems, the Troy Micro BattleSight provides an ideal solution. The Troy Micro BattleSight greatly enhances weapons such as the new IAR, the Sig Sauer 556 Pistol and Carbine, POF 416 & 417, FN Scar, Robinson Armament XCR, Heckler & Koch 416 & 417 and other weapons with raised top rails. Troy Micro BattleSights are rugged, reliable and Battle Ready. Sold as a set only. - Black", "text": "Troy Industries Micro HK Style Front and Rear Folding Battle Sight Troy BattleSights set the world standard for performance and durability. Now, Troy has developed a rugged low-profile sight designed for firearms with top rails higher than the standard M4. For shooters who favor a sightline that’s as close to the barrel as possible, or for those with raised top rail systems, the Troy Micro BattleSight provides an ideal solution. The Troy Micro BattleSight greatly enhances weapons such as the new IAR, the Sig Sauer 556 Pistol and Carbine, POF 416 & 417, FN Scar, Robinson Armament XCR, Heckler & Koch 416 & 417 and other weapons with raised top rails. Troy Micro BattleSights are rugged, reliable and Battle Ready. Sold as a set only. - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A2QalYs2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00420NE8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 165.95}}
{"item_id": "B00420NG4Q", "title": "Daniel Defense DD-04013 Rail Mounted", "description": "Daniel Defense Rail Mount Fixed Front Sight", "text": "Daniel Defense DD-04013 Rail Mounted Daniel Defense Rail Mount Fixed Front Sight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B-RRFda8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00420NG4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daniel Defense", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 64.79}}
{"item_id": "B00420ON7K", "title": "Versatile VR5 Handgun Rack", "description": "Maximize the space in your gun safe with a Versatile Handgun Rack. Get those guns off your safe’s shelves and make room for other valuables (better yet, more guns). How much room can they save? Well, the rack that holds four guns has approximately the same footprint as one handgun lying flat. That’s putting four guns in the space of one! Not only do Versatile Handgun Racks maximize your storage space they protect & preserve the finish of your handguns. Versatile Handgun Racks are made from a heavy gauge welded steel wire frame and vinyl coated for years of dependable use. Versatile Handgun Racks can also be used at the shooting range, at home while cleaning your guns, or for retail use in display cases. Versatile Handgun Rack’s Stacking Kit allows this product to be stacked on top of another Versatile Handgun Rack of the same size, making it possible to utilize previously unused airspace, saving even more space. Holds 5 handguns. 11.75w x 5.25h x 5.5d Made in the USA", "text": "Versatile VR5 Handgun Rack Maximize the space in your gun safe with a Versatile Handgun Rack. Get those guns off your safe’s shelves and make room for other valuables (better yet, more guns). How much room can they save? Well, the rack that holds four guns has approximately the same footprint as one handgun lying flat. That’s putting four guns in the space of one! Not only do Versatile Handgun Racks maximize your storage space they protect & preserve the finish of your handguns. Versatile Handgun Racks are made from a heavy gauge welded steel wire frame and vinyl coated for years of dependable use. Versatile Handgun Racks can also be used at the shooting range, at home while cleaning your guns, or for retail use in display cases. Versatile Handgun Rack’s Stacking Kit allows this product to be stacked on top of another Versatile Handgun Rack of the same size, making it possible to utilize previously unused airspace, saving even more space. Holds 5 handguns. 11.75w x 5.25h x 5.5d Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cRjAvbOEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00420ON7K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Versatile Rack", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 19.37}}
