{"item_id": "B004224314", "title": "Gerber 31-000560 Warrant Knife, Partially Serrated, With Camo Nylon Sheath", "description": "Light, thin and a digital camo sheath, the Gerber 31-000560 Warrant is ready for action. Features a 4 ½ inch partially serrated tanto point tactical blade and a lightweight machined aluminum handle. The Warrant is all black for a discreet carry and includes a digital camo sheath with a snap closure with elastic pommel retention. 9 1/2 inch overall length.", "text": "Gerber 31-000560 Warrant Knife, Partially Serrated, With Camo Nylon Sheath Light, thin and a digital camo sheath, the Gerber 31-000560 Warrant is ready for action. Features a 4 ½ inch partially serrated tanto point tactical blade and a lightweight machined aluminum handle. The Warrant is all black for a discreet carry and includes a digital camo sheath with a snap closure with elastic pommel retention. 9 1/2 inch overall length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C5epRNphL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004224314.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 30.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042267ZY", "title": "Gerber 31-000666 Superknife SK Edge, Aluminum, Black", "description": "Following the design of the original superknife, the SK Edge is a patented combination of a convenient pocket knife and a utility knife. The SK Edge features the fastest blade change mechanism possible in a utility knife. With just a press of a button, which doubles as a thumb stud, the blade can be released and replaced with virtually any standard utility knife blade, from the 0.016-inch (1/64-Inch) extra thin blade to the 0.039 (1mm) contractor grade blade. Designed as a high quality pocketknife that you can really use, the SK Edge features a stainless steel blade holder and belt clip with anodized material. Anodized material: A metal, typically aluminum, that has been coated with a protective or decorative layer of oxide, through a process of electrochemical conversion. The anodizing process affects the surface as well as the interior the metal. The anodized parts are quite durable, do not tarnish, resist abrasions, and maintain their cosmetic appearance for a long period of time. Aluminum handle. The patented one-piece blade holder design is extremely strong and insures the blade will be held secure in the knife under pressure. The SK Edge locks open with a liner lock to allow for quick and easy one handed opening and closing.", "text": "Gerber 31-000666 Superknife SK Edge, Aluminum, Black Following the design of the original superknife, the SK Edge is a patented combination of a convenient pocket knife and a utility knife. The SK Edge features the fastest blade change mechanism possible in a utility knife. With just a press of a button, which doubles as a thumb stud, the blade can be released and replaced with virtually any standard utility knife blade, from the 0.016-inch (1/64-Inch) extra thin blade to the 0.039 (1mm) contractor grade blade. Designed as a high quality pocketknife that you can really use, the SK Edge features a stainless steel blade holder and belt clip with anodized material. Anodized material: A metal, typically aluminum, that has been coated with a protective or decorative layer of oxide, through a process of electrochemical conversion. The anodizing process affects the surface as well as the interior the metal. The anodized parts are quite durable, do not tarnish, resist abrasions, and maintain their cosmetic appearance for a long period of time. Aluminum handle. The patented one-piece blade holder design is extremely strong and insures the blade will be held secure in the knife under pressure. The SK Edge locks open with a liner lock to allow for quick and easy one handed opening and closing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m5XmusoPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042267ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00422FBL0", "title": "Safariland Glock 19, 23 with ITI M3, TLR-1, Insight XTI Procyon 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish)", "description": "The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "text": "Safariland Glock 19, 23 with ITI M3, TLR-1, Insight XTI Procyon 6378 ALS Concealment Paddle Holster (STX Black Finish) The Safariland Model 6378 Holster is a concealment version of the Automatic Locking System (ALS ) series holsters. Once the weapon is holstered, it \"locks\" into place, providing an extra measure of security from standard open top holsters. A simple straight up draw is possible once the ALS is de-activated by the thumb while obtaining a shooting grip. IDPA approved. The Model 6378 holster features an all-new injection molded paddle design that is highly concealable and rides close to body with a slightly forward weapon cant. It also comes standard with the 567BL belt loop, fitting 1.5\" to 1.75\" belt widths. Additionally, it features suede lining to help protect the gun's sights and finish, and its SafariLaminatestructure with wraparound design provides the strongest design combination available", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418eh7-YOIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00422FBL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 56.42}}
{"item_id": "B004269A9U", "title": "Park Tool Shop Cone Wrench Set", "description": "Park Tool makes some of the nicest cone wrenches this side of what you'd find inside a vintage Campagnolo Professional Tool set. And while many of today's modern hubs lack wrench flats for bearing adjustments (or lack bearing adjustments for that matter), some still do, and that's why you'll need the proper tools for the job. And Park's SCW-Set. 2 Cone Wrench Kit will have you covered. This complete set of cone wrenches has one of each size from 13mm to 24mm in one mm increments, plus a 28mm wrench. Park Tools Cone Wrenches are cut from high quality tool steel and have a blue vinyl dipped, extra long handle to comfortably leverage those stubborn parts. Ultra-thin heads work well with the narrowest of adjustment conesLong vinyl-dipped handles allow plenty of leverage", "text": "Park Tool Shop Cone Wrench Set Park Tool makes some of the nicest cone wrenches this side of what you'd find inside a vintage Campagnolo Professional Tool set. And while many of today's modern hubs lack wrench flats for bearing adjustments (or lack bearing adjustments for that matter), some still do, and that's why you'll need the proper tools for the job. And Park's SCW-Set. 2 Cone Wrench Kit will have you covered. This complete set of cone wrenches has one of each size from 13mm to 24mm in one mm increments, plus a 28mm wrench. Park Tools Cone Wrenches are cut from high quality tool steel and have a blue vinyl dipped, extra long handle to comfortably leverage those stubborn parts. Ultra-thin heads work well with the narrowest of adjustment conesLong vinyl-dipped handles allow plenty of leverage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P3GQLw6aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004269A9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 71.96}}
