{"item_id": "B00426B4EE", "title": "Park Tool Bladed Spoke Holder", "description": "The BSH-4 is a valuable wheel building and truing aid that securely holds bladed spokes to prevent twisting. Four different sized slots to fit a wide variety of bladed spokes.", "text": "Park Tool Bladed Spoke Holder The BSH-4 is a valuable wheel building and truing aid that securely holds bladed spokes to prevent twisting. Four different sized slots to fit a wide variety of bladed spokes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q9RPLNjHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426B4EE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 8.57}}
{"item_id": "B00426BAGQ", "title": "Park Tool Press Fit Removal Tool for Internal Bottom Bracket Bearings", "description": "Designed to remove and install the bearings and bearing units used in BB86, BB90, BB92, Shimano Press Fit, SRAM Press Fit GXP, Race Face Press Fit and other press fit bottom bracket systems using the nominal 24mm spindle. The BBT-90.3 tool set includes a bearing removal tool, which slides through and expands behind the bearing (like a head cup remover) so it can be tapped out with a hammer. The BBT-90.3 also includes two installation bushings #669. Use the bushing in conjunction with an HHP-2 or HHP-3 Bearing Cup Press to press the bearings into the frame.", "text": "Park Tool Press Fit Removal Tool for Internal Bottom Bracket Bearings Designed to remove and install the bearings and bearing units used in BB86, BB90, BB92, Shimano Press Fit, SRAM Press Fit GXP, Race Face Press Fit and other press fit bottom bracket systems using the nominal 24mm spindle. The BBT-90.3 tool set includes a bearing removal tool, which slides through and expands behind the bearing (like a head cup remover) so it can be tapped out with a hammer. The BBT-90.3 also includes two installation bushings #669. Use the bushing in conjunction with an HHP-2 or HHP-3 Bearing Cup Press to press the bearings into the frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BHSna4g5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426BAGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 42.25}}
{"item_id": "B00426BC28", "title": "Park Tool Repair Mount Wheel Truing Stand", "description": "", "text": "Park Tool Repair Mount Wheel Truing Stand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411h2-mvI3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426BC28.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 31.46}}
{"item_id": "B00426EN42", "title": "Park Tool BBT-10 Crank Adjusting Cap Tool", "description": "Instead of the plastic tool Shimano includes with its Hollowtech II crank/bottom bracket systems, use Park Tool's BBT-10 Crank Adjusting Cap Tool to remove and install the adjusting cap. Made from investment cast steel, the BBT-10 provides strength and leverage to easily remove seized caps or make small adjustments.", "text": "Park Tool BBT-10 Crank Adjusting Cap Tool Instead of the plastic tool Shimano includes with its Hollowtech II crank/bottom bracket systems, use Park Tool's BBT-10 Crank Adjusting Cap Tool to remove and install the adjusting cap. Made from investment cast steel, the BBT-10 provides strength and leverage to easily remove seized caps or make small adjustments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mgW8gqtmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426EN42.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00426ENBU", "title": "Park Tool Bearing Tool Set for BB30.3 Bottom Bracket Systems", "description": "", "text": "Park Tool Bearing Tool Set for BB30.3 Bottom Bracket Systems", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LMDQOZa1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426ENBU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B00426GY4Y", "title": "Park Tool Portable Wheel Dishing Gauge - WAG-5", "description": "The Park Tool WAG-5 Dish Tool accurately checks the dish, or offset, on all 26\", 27\", and 700C wheels. Measurements are taken comparing one side of the wheel to the other to determine if the rim is in the center of the hub. The Wag-5 easily folds in half and fits into most tool boxes. It's perfect for the race or home mechanic.Product FeaturesHASH(0xbe449d0)", "text": "Park Tool Portable Wheel Dishing Gauge - WAG-5 The Park Tool WAG-5 Dish Tool accurately checks the dish, or offset, on all 26\", 27\", and 700C wheels. Measurements are taken comparing one side of the wheel to the other to determine if the rim is in the center of the hub. The Wag-5 easily folds in half and fits into most tool boxes. It's perfect for the race or home mechanic.Product FeaturesHASH(0xbe449d0)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DhLoQ0m6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00426GY4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 29.66}}
{"item_id": "B00428B1FO", "title": "Shimano 105 PD-5700 Road Bike Pedals (Black)", "description": "Updated in 2011, the Shimano 105 PD-5700 road pedals shave off weight while maintaining and improving upon durability and performance. Designed for ease of use and efficient power transfer, the pedals offer an extra-wide stainless steel platform and a large binding target for quick engagement. Thanks to adjustable cleat tension with indicators you can set the cleat system up easily to suit your ride needs. Made to last the pedals feature a low maintenance sealed cartridge axle units with durable sealed bearings and stiff cromoly axles to stand up to the rigors of competitive riding. The pedal set includes one pair of three-bolt SPD-SL cleats with six degrees of built in float. The 105 PD-5700 road pedals carry a two-year warranty to be free of defects in materials and workmanship.Features:Stainless steel body coverExtra-wide stainless steel platformLow maintenance sealed cartridge axle unitDurable sealed bearingsStiff cromoly axleLarge binding targetAdjustable cleat tension with indicatorsThree-bolt SPD-SL cleats with six degrees of built in floatWeight: 325 gramsTwo year warranty", "text": "Shimano 105 PD-5700 Road Bike Pedals (Black) Updated in 2011, the Shimano 105 PD-5700 road pedals shave off weight while maintaining and improving upon durability and performance. Designed for ease of use and efficient power transfer, the pedals offer an extra-wide stainless steel platform and a large binding target for quick engagement. Thanks to adjustable cleat tension with indicators you can set the cleat system up easily to suit your ride needs. Made to last the pedals feature a low maintenance sealed cartridge axle units with durable sealed bearings and stiff cromoly axles to stand up to the rigors of competitive riding. The pedal set includes one pair of three-bolt SPD-SL cleats with six degrees of built in float. The 105 PD-5700 road pedals carry a two-year warranty to be free of defects in materials and workmanship.Features:Stainless steel body coverExtra-wide stainless steel platformLow maintenance sealed cartridge axle unitDurable sealed bearingsStiff cromoly axleLarge binding targetAdjustable cleat tension with indicatorsThree-bolt SPD-SL cleats with six degrees of built in floatWeight: 325 gramsTwo year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKa95-MiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00428B1FO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042AFHYI", "title": "Inside Pants Holster for Taurus TCP", "description": "This is a brand new holster from a USA contract manufacturer. It is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. It is constructed of three layers including a sturdy nylon exterior, a very soft interior lining and a foam vapor barrier. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn on either side of the body. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip and a thumbreak. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Inside Pants Holster for Taurus TCP This is a brand new holster from a USA contract manufacturer. It is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. It is constructed of three layers including a sturdy nylon exterior, a very soft interior lining and a foam vapor barrier. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn on either side of the body. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip and a thumbreak. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DbJBb4xJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042AFHYI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.9}}
{"item_id": "B0042AGNKU", "title": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Light - Rear", "description": "The Blackburn Flea 2. 0 USB LED Bike Light makes you visible to the caring and not alike, and may just save your hide while your save some gas and the environment. With a 12-hour runtime (in flash mode), you'll have plenty of time between recharges, and the 'gas tank' battery life indicator lets you know when it's time to pop it into your laptop or recharge from the wall using the included USB smart charger.", "text": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Light - Rear The Blackburn Flea 2. 0 USB LED Bike Light makes you visible to the caring and not alike, and may just save your hide while your save some gas and the environment. With a 12-hour runtime (in flash mode), you'll have plenty of time between recharges, and the 'gas tank' battery life indicator lets you know when it's time to pop it into your laptop or recharge from the wall using the included USB smart charger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q%2BUHbCjoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042AGNKU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B0042AHLSI", "title": "Holster for Taurus TCP", "description": "This is a brand new holster from a USA manufacturer that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for Taurus TCP This is a brand new holster from a USA manufacturer that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yHa7TWgQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042AHLSI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.9}}
{"item_id": "B0042ALJOU", "title": "Holster for CZ75 Compact, P01, P06 DPCR", "description": "This American made holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for CZ75 Compact, P01, P06 DPCR This American made holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KUme-RuML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042ALJOU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B0042C0ZRK", "title": "AR15 M4 .223 A1 A2 Hand Guard Remover Combination Wrench Tool Kit", "description": "AR15/M4 hand guard remov combo kit (great for remove or install free float style quad rail hand guard). AR15 A1/A2 ALL-IN-ONE COMBINATION WRENCH TOOL ALSO WORK WITH M4. FIT NEWER SHORTY STOCK Material Type: METAL Carbon Steel For A1/A2 stock Weight (lbs): 1 COLOR: BLACK DELTA RING WRENCH TOOL make removal of AR15, M4, and M16 handguards by easily compressing the delta ring in a uniform fashion preventing damage to handguards and also avoids the pinching of the hand that occurs when removing the handguards from the AR15/M4/M16 rife. Durable polymer construction with non-slip and rubber covered handles.", "text": "AR15 M4 .223 A1 A2 Hand Guard Remover Combination Wrench Tool Kit AR15/M4 hand guard remov combo kit (great for remove or install free float style quad rail hand guard). AR15 A1/A2 ALL-IN-ONE COMBINATION WRENCH TOOL ALSO WORK WITH M4. FIT NEWER SHORTY STOCK Material Type: METAL Carbon Steel For A1/A2 stock Weight (lbs): 1 COLOR: BLACK DELTA RING WRENCH TOOL make removal of AR15, M4, and M16 handguards by easily compressing the delta ring in a uniform fashion preventing damage to handguards and also avoids the pinching of the hand that occurs when removing the handguards from the AR15/M4/M16 rife. Durable polymer construction with non-slip and rubber covered handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rwBZ7-mTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042C0ZRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 38.47}}
{"item_id": "B0042DRM8O", "title": "Osprey Talon 11-Litre Backpack", "description": "A great pack for everyday activity, the Talon 11 backpack will fast become your regular companion. The Talon 11 is ideal for the fast, adventure-oriented outdoor enthusiast, as if offers a unique melding of torso adjustability in an active, lightweight design.The Talon 11 includes stretch mesh harness pockets for snacks and a comfortable BioStretch foam harness.The Talon 11 relies on Osprey's AirScape suspension system to provide comfort to hikers, mountain bikers, and serious runners. Built around a ridge-molded foam back panel with grip mesh covering, the system offers ample ventilation to keep you comfortable throughout the day. The pack's BioStretch adjustable harness and mesh-covered, slotted foam hipbelt, meanwhile, help distribute weight evenly across the body. As a result, the bag won't weigh you down even as the miles stretch into the dozens. The harness includes an adjustable sternum strap with a rescue whistle buckle, while the hipbelt offers a modified ErgoPull closure to ensure a secure fit.Despite the lightweight, easy-to-maneuver design, the Talon 11 is capable of holding quite a bit of gear. The pack offers dual zippered panel access to the main compartment, along with a top zippered mesh slash pocket for smaller items. You can also store gear in the stretch-woven adjustable front pocket, the dual stretch-woven side pockets (with InsideOut compression), the dual stretch mesh hipbelt pockets, and the sewn-in stretch mesh harness pockets. And hydration is key for any outdoor activity, which is why the Talon 11 offers an easy-access external hydration compartment with a sewn-in retention clip (reservoir sold separately).Other features include a laced bungee cord with fabric wings to keep your extras secure, a LidLock attachment clip for a bike helmet, an integrated blinker light attachment, and a sewn-in tow loop attachment point.Specifications:Dimensions: 10 by 18 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Small/medium: 600 cubic inches/9 liters; weighs 1 pound 5 ouncesMedium/large: 700 cubic inches/11 liters; weighs 1 pound 6 ouncesAbout OspreyThings at Osprey move full circle, starting with the people, then the product, and then back to the people for the full lifetime of the product. Headquartered in Cortez, Colorado, in the southwest part of the state, the company is nestled at the corner of the rugged San Juan Mountains and on the edge of vast sandstone canyon country. This landscape provides the Osprey staff with constant inspiration and a superb testing ground for the company's packs. The remainder of the company--including Osprey founder and head designer Mike Pfotenhauer--resides in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. In HCM City, surrounded by heat, endless bustle, and vibrant energy, Osprey designs and builds its packs to exacting standards. Living in HCM City provides many benefits, including the ability to create face-to-face relationships with the factories that build its packs, ensure fair labor standards, and soak up the design inspiration of a cosmopolitan city.", "text": "Osprey Talon 11-Litre Backpack A great pack for everyday activity, the Talon 11 backpack will fast become your regular companion. The Talon 11 is ideal for the fast, adventure-oriented outdoor enthusiast, as if offers a unique melding of torso adjustability in an active, lightweight design.The Talon 11 includes stretch mesh harness pockets for snacks and a comfortable BioStretch foam harness.The Talon 11 relies on Osprey's AirScape suspension system to provide comfort to hikers, mountain bikers, and serious runners. Built around a ridge-molded foam back panel with grip mesh covering, the system offers ample ventilation to keep you comfortable throughout the day. The pack's BioStretch adjustable harness and mesh-covered, slotted foam hipbelt, meanwhile, help distribute weight evenly across the body. As a result, the bag won't weigh you down even as the miles stretch into the dozens. The harness includes an adjustable sternum strap with a rescue whistle buckle, while the hipbelt offers a modified ErgoPull closure to ensure a secure fit.Despite the lightweight, easy-to-maneuver design, the Talon 11 is capable of holding quite a bit of gear. The pack offers dual zippered panel access to the main compartment, along with a top zippered mesh slash pocket for smaller items. You can also store gear in the stretch-woven adjustable front pocket, the dual stretch-woven side pockets (with InsideOut compression), the dual stretch mesh hipbelt pockets, and the sewn-in stretch mesh harness pockets. And hydration is key for any outdoor activity, which is why the Talon 11 offers an easy-access external hydration compartment with a sewn-in retention clip (reservoir sold separately).Other features include a laced bungee cord with fabric wings to keep your extras secure, a LidLock attachment clip for a bike helmet, an integrated blinker light attachment, and a sewn-in tow loop attachment point.Specifications:Dimensions: 10 by 18 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Small/medium: 600 cubic inches/9 liters; weighs 1 pound 5 ouncesMedium/large: 700 cubic inches/11 liters; weighs 1 pound 6 ouncesAbout OspreyThings at Osprey move full circle, starting with the people, then the product, and then back to the people for the full lifetime of the product. Headquartered in Cortez, Colorado, in the southwest part of the state, the company is nestled at the corner of the rugged San Juan Mountains and on the edge of vast sandstone canyon country. This landscape provides the Osprey staff with constant inspiration and a superb testing ground for the company's packs. The remainder of the company--including Osprey founder and head designer Mike Pfotenhauer--resides in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. In HCM City, surrounded by heat, endless bustle, and vibrant energy, Osprey designs and builds its packs to exacting standards. Living in HCM City provides many benefits, including the ability to create face-to-face relationships with the factories that build its packs, ensure fair labor standards, and soak up the design inspiration of a cosmopolitan city.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tuit6r7uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DRM8O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042DT0XO", "title": "Osprey Detachable Sternum Strap Magnet Kit", "description": "FEATURES of the Osprey Detachable Sternum Strap Magnet Kit 3 detachable sternum strap magnets Makes any pack Hydraulics Reservoir compatible OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean.", "text": "Osprey Detachable Sternum Strap Magnet Kit FEATURES of the Osprey Detachable Sternum Strap Magnet Kit 3 detachable sternum strap magnets Makes any pack Hydraulics Reservoir compatible OVERSIZE ITEM: We cannot ship this product by any expedited shipping method (3-Day, 2-Day or Next Day). Even if you pick that option, it will still go Ground Shipping. Sorry for being so mean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317xKt6slLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DT0XO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Osprey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042DUMYA", "title": "Osprey Talon 22-Litre Backpack", "description": "The spacious Talon 22 panel-loading backpack will carry everything you need for a day of fast-paced activity, from hiking to mountain biking to adventure racing.The Talon 22 includes stretch mesh harness pockets for snacks and a comfortable BioStretch foam harness.The Talon 22 relies on Osprey's AirScape suspension system to provide comfort to hikers, mountain bikers, and serious runners. Built around a ridge-molded foam back panel with grip mesh covering, the system offers ample ventilation to keep you comfortable throughout the day. The pack's BioStretch adjustable harness and mesh-covered, slotted foam hipbelt, meanwhile, help distribute weight evenly across the body. As a result, the bag won't weigh you down even as the miles stretch into the dozens. The harness includes an adjustable sternum strap with a rescue whistle buckle, while the hipbelt offers a modified ErgoPull closure to ensure a secure fit.Despite the relatively lightweight, easy-to-maneuver design, the Talon 22 is capable of holding quite a bit of gear. The pack offers dual zippered panel access to the main compartment, along with a top zippered mesh slash pocket for smaller items. You can also store gear in the spacious stretch-woven front pocket, the dual stretch-woven side pockets (with InsideOut compression), the dual stretch mesh hipbelt pockets, and the sewn-in stretch mesh harness pockets. And hydration is key for any outdoor activity, which is why the Talon 22 offers an easy-access external hydration compartment with a sewn-in retention clip (reservoir sold separately).Other features include a laced bungee cord with fabric wings to keep your extras secure, a LidLock attachment clip for a bike helmet, an integrated blinker light attachment, and a sewn-in tow loop attachment point.Specifications:Dimensions: 10 by 21 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Small/medium: 1,220 cubic inches/20 liters; weighs 1 pound 12 ouncesMed