ively lightweight, easy-to-maneuver design, the Talon 22 is capable of holding quite a bit of gear. The pack offers dual zippered panel access to the main compartment, along with a top zippered mesh slash pocket for smaller items. You can also store gear in the spacious stretch-woven front pocket, the dual stretch-woven side pockets (with InsideOut compression), the dual stretch mesh hipbelt pockets, and the sewn-in stretch mesh harness pockets. And hydration is key for any outdoor activity, which is why the Talon 22 offers an easy-access external hydration compartment with a sewn-in retention clip (reservoir sold separately).Other features include a laced bungee cord with fabric wings to keep your extras secure, a LidLock attachment clip for a bike helmet, an integrated blinker light attachment, and a sewn-in tow loop attachment point.Specifications:Dimensions: 10 by 21 by 6 inches (W x H x D)Small/medium: 1,220 cubic inches/20 liters; weighs 1 pound 12 ouncesMedium/large: 1,343 cubic inches/22 liters; weighs 1 pound 13 ouncesAbout OspreyThings at Osprey move full circle, starting with the people, then the product, and then back to the people for the full lifetime of the product. Headquartered in Cortez, Colorado, in the southwest part of the state, the company is nestled at the corner of the rugged San Juan Mountains and on the edge of vast sandstone canyon country. This landscape provides the Osprey staff with constant inspiration and a superb testing ground for the company's packs. The remainder of the company--including Osprey founder and head designer Mike Pfotenhauer--resides in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. In HCM City, surrounded by heat, endless bustle, and vibrant energy, Osprey designs and builds its packs to exacting standards. Living in HCM City provides many benefits, including the ability to create face-to-face relationships with the factories that build its packs, ensure fair labor standards, and soak up the design inspiration of a cosmopolitan city.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q8qFpVH4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DUMYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042DVBK4", "title": "Women's Waterproof / Thinsulate Lined Ski Glove Grey , Large", "description": "", "text": "Women's Waterproof / Thinsulate Lined Ski Glove Grey , Large", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zyLAxyHwL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DVBK4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042DVMH6", "title": "Osprey Momentum 34-Litre Commuter Pack (Carbide, Medium/Large)", "description": "The Momentum 34 pack has been designed with the daily bike commuter in mind featuring built in snug fitteing high visibility raincover, lidlock, separate, padded laptop sleeve, and file sleeve, large cell phone pocket and key pocket on shoulder strap, u-lock slot, 2x side compression straps, padded top and side grab handle, tuck away shoulder straps, rflective print to front panel, blinker light attachment, front slash pocket with organizer, internal organiser for pump, tubes and tools, zippered side pockets, and zippered expansion panel adds 8 liters to capacity.", "text": "Osprey Momentum 34-Litre Commuter Pack (Carbide, Medium/Large) The Momentum 34 pack has been designed with the daily bike commuter in mind featuring built in snug fitteing high visibility raincover, lidlock, separate, padded laptop sleeve, and file sleeve, large cell phone pocket and key pocket on shoulder strap, u-lock slot, 2x side compression straps, padded top and side grab handle, tuck away shoulder straps, rflective print to front panel, blinker light attachment, front slash pocket with organizer, internal organiser for pump, tubes and tools, zippered side pockets, and zippered expansion panel adds 8 liters to capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4HUItusL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DVMH6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042DW5TK", "title": "Osprey Hydraulics Reservoir Cleaning Kit", "description": "", "text": "Osprey Hydraulics Reservoir Cleaning Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yj-jqvKPL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042DW5TK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Osprey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042EJEKW", "title": "Sportcraft Anywhere Table Tennis Set", "description": "The Sportcraft Anywhere Table Tennis Set is perfect for travel or home use, although its compact design makes it easy to store and take anywhere. An expandable and retractable table tennis net with adjustable posts that attach to any table lets you play on surfaces up to 75 inches wide and 1.75 inches thick. Two \"pips out\" rubber paddles, three 38-millimeter balls, and a convenient mesh storage and travel bag round out the package.About Sportcraft:The General Sportcraft Company was founded in 1926. In those times, most department stores did not carry sporting goods, so General Sportcraft helped pioneer the concept of \"family-fun\" departments within the store. Soon, the popularity of these departments spawned stand-alone sporting goods stores.In the 1940s and 1950s, Sportcraft introduced new outdoor games to America, such as bocce, horseshoes, and volleyball. In time, Sportcraft's focus moved to indoors games like table tennis, billiards, foosball, and darts, now the company's most popular product lines. Today, more than 13 million customers a year purchase Sportcraft products.", "text": "Sportcraft Anywhere Table Tennis Set The Sportcraft Anywhere Table Tennis Set is perfect for travel or home use, although its compact design makes it easy to store and take anywhere. An expandable and retractable table tennis net with adjustable posts that attach to any table lets you play on surfaces up to 75 inches wide and 1.75 inches thick. Two \"pips out\" rubber paddles, three 38-millimeter balls, and a convenient mesh storage and travel bag round out the package.About Sportcraft:The General Sportcraft Company was founded in 1926. In those times, most department stores did not carry sporting goods, so General Sportcraft helped pioneer the concept of \"family-fun\" departments within the store. Soon, the popularity of these departments spawned stand-alone sporting goods stores.In the 1940s and 1950s, Sportcraft introduced new outdoor games to America, such as bocce, horseshoes, and volleyball. In time, Sportcraft's focus moved to indoors games like table tennis, billiards, foosball, and darts, now the company's most popular product lines. Today, more than 13 million customers a year purchase Sportcraft products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xOvmxUgJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042EJEKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sportcraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Table Tennis Sets"]], "price": 57.59}}
{"item_id": "B0042F3JCK", "title": "ESS Eyewear Cross Series Crossbow 3LS Kit, Black", "description": "When you try on the ESS Crossbow, you'll discover it's unlike any other ballistic eye shield. Experience the Tri-Tech Fit frame that achieves an amazing universal fit with max comfort and zero pressure points. Then notice the lenses. They won't fog. That's thanks to groundbreaking Clear Zone FlowCoat technology, engineered to eliminate fog inside and prevent scratches outside. As you stare down your objective through distortion-free ESSOPTICS, you'll see just how optically precise vision can be. When you're ready to switch tints, the innovative DeadBolt Lens Lock pivots up for easy release, then clamps down for rock solid retention under impact. It's from ESS, so of course the Crossbow is compliant with U.S. Federal OSHA, ANSI Z87.1+, CE EN 166 and U.S. MIL-PRF-31013. Form, Fit, Function. Perfected. Get your hands on a Crossbow and see for yourself. The Crossbow features interchangeable 2.4mm polycarbonate high-impact-lenses that provide 100% UVA/UVB protection. The Crossbow 3LS kit includes One Crossbow frame, with three interchangeable lenses: Clear, Smoke Grey and Hi-Def Yellow. It also includes the hard storage case, micro fiber pouch, Snap-On elastic retention strap, the ESS sticker and instruction booklet.", "text": "ESS Eyewear Cross Series Crossbow 3LS Kit, Black When you try on the ESS Crossbow, you'll discover it's unlike any other ballistic eye shield. Experience the Tri-Tech Fit frame that achieves an amazing universal fit with max comfort and zero pressure points. Then notice the lenses. They won't fog. That's thanks to groundbreaking Clear Zone FlowCoat technology, engineered to eliminate fog inside and prevent scratches outside. As you stare down your objective through distortion-free ESSOPTICS, you'll see just how optically precise vision can be. When you're ready to switch tints, the innovative DeadBolt Lens Lock pivots up for easy release, then clamps down for rock solid retention under impact. It's from ESS, so of course the Crossbow is compliant with U.S. Federal OSHA, ANSI Z87.1+, CE EN 166 and U.S. MIL-PRF-31013. Form, Fit, Function. Perfected. Get your hands on a Crossbow and see for yourself. The Crossbow features interchangeable 2.4mm polycarbonate high-impact-lenses that provide 100% UVA/UVB protection. The Crossbow 3LS kit includes One Crossbow frame, with three interchangeable lenses: Clear, Smoke Grey and Hi-Def Yellow. It also includes the hard storage case, micro fiber pouch, Snap-On elastic retention strap, the ESS sticker and instruction booklet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317jnundThL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042F3JCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESS Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 73.06}}
{"item_id": "B0042FHDYU", "title": "Yukon Gear Men's Insulated Pants", "description": "Yukon Gear insulated hunting pants in Mossy Oak Infinity camo pattern are waterproof and breathable. They feature 2 side pockets, 1 front pocket and 1 rear pocket. Constructed of 240 gram 100% polyester tricot with 8000/800 WPB PU lamination. Tabs at the bottom for snug fit to ankle.", "text": "Yukon Gear Men's Insulated Pants Yukon Gear insulated hunting pants in Mossy Oak Infinity camo pattern are waterproof and breathable. They feature 2 side pockets, 1 front pocket and 1 rear pocket. Constructed of 240 gram 100% polyester tricot with 8000/800 WPB PU lamination. Tabs at the bottom for snug fit to ankle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sEeXLR4JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042FHDYU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants", "Insulated Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0042FJH5S", "title": "Mossy Oak Shotgun Shell Belt, Green", "description": "Keep comfort in mind for your next day out with this MOSSY OAK Stoneville rifle sling. The rugged yet lightweight sling boasts 3/8-inch foam padding to keep your shoulder in feeling great, as well as an Endura 600-denier polyester construction that can withstand trip after trip to the bush.", "text": "Mossy Oak Shotgun Shell Belt, Green Keep comfort in mind for your next day out with this MOSSY OAK Stoneville rifle sling. The rugged yet lightweight sling boasts 3/8-inch foam padding to keep your shoulder in feeling great, as well as an Endura 600-denier polyester construction that can withstand trip after trip to the bush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4106t97FjwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042FJH5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mossy Oak Hunting Accessories", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 8.34}}
{"item_id": "B0042FR9JO", "title": "Airsoft / Hunting / Paintball Woodland Digital Camo Molle Gear Utility Leg Rig Holster", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR .Non-slip padded drop leg platform with MOLLE webbing for attaching pouches and accessories .Comes with three detachable pouches .Adjustable radio pouch with retention strap .Flashlight/pistol mag pouch .Utility pouch holds cell phone, PDA, digital camera, first aid kit, etc .Fully adjustable non-slip leg strap and vertical strap with quick release buckle", "text": "Airsoft / Hunting / Paintball Woodland Digital Camo Molle Gear Utility Leg Rig Holster Manufacturer: TAIGEAR .Non-slip padded drop leg platform with MOLLE webbing for attaching pouches and accessories .Comes with three detachable pouches .Adjustable radio pouch with retention strap .Flashlight/pistol mag pouch .Utility pouch holds cell phone, PDA, digital camera, first aid kit, etc .Fully adjustable non-slip leg strap and vertical strap with quick release buckle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Onm05w1WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042FR9JO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042FST7A", "title": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN1-BK Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with DNA Catcher, Black", "description": "The UZI UZI-TACPEN1-BK Defender Tactical Pen is made of lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a DNA catcher. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "text": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN1-BK Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with DNA Catcher, Black The UZI UZI-TACPEN1-BK Defender Tactical Pen is made of lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a DNA catcher. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vOaIWR5eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042FST7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uzi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 14.06}}
{"item_id": "B0042G1UW0", "title": "Black Law Enforcement Tactical Equipment System", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. Law Enforcement Modular Tactical Equipment System. Versatile modular design for Law Enforcement, Military Personnel, Security and Sport Enthusiasts. Complete tactical set with all the pouches and holsters required by tactical teams. Adjustable law enforcement duty belt with quick release buckle, belt keepers, dual magazine pouches with horizontal/ vertical secure systems, pager/cell phone/gloves case, key holder, chemical agent/pepper spray case with snap closure, universal radio case, handcuff case with snap closure, expandable baton case, flashlight case, and fully adjustable duty holster with extra mag pouch. Quick attachment with complete Locking and full adjustability. Belt can be adjusted from 35\" to 54\" .", "text": "Black Law Enforcement Tactical Equipment System Manufacturer: TAIGEAR. Law Enforcement Modular Tactical Equipment System. Versatile modular design for Law Enforcement, Military Personnel, Security and Sport Enthusiasts. Complete tactical set with all the pouches and holsters required by tactical teams. Adjustable law enforcement duty belt with quick release buckle, belt keepers, dual magazine pouches with horizontal/ vertical secure systems, pager/cell phone/gloves case, key holder, chemical agent/pepper spray case with snap closure, universal radio case, handcuff case with snap closure, expandable baton case, flashlight case, and fully adjustable duty holster with extra mag pouch. Quick attachment with complete Locking and full adjustability. Belt can be adjusted from 35\" to 54\" .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m2ED53tbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042G1UW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B0042G6CTG", "title": "New Left Side Black Drop Leg Holster Taigear", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Nice quality tactical leg holster assembly Has strap to secure to tactical utility belt Extra pouch on holster for magazine Adjustable closure for a tight pistol barrel fit Deluxe non-slip holster pad, and non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strap Designed for maximum comfort, additional retention and for most pistols", "text": "New Left Side Black Drop Leg Holster Taigear Manufacturer: TAIGEAR Nice quality tactical leg holster assembly Has strap to secure to tactical utility belt Extra pouch on holster for magazine Adjustable closure for a tight pistol barrel fit Deluxe non-slip holster pad, and non-slip fully adjustable and removable leg strap Designed for maximum comfort, additional retention and for most pistols", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zI6Qq4fIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042G6CTG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042H69WU", "title": "Ozeri 4x3motion Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer with Tri-Axis Technology", "description": "Introducing the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer by Ozeri - the world's most advanced 3D pedometer. Unlike other pedometers that do not work accurately unless placed vertically, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer utilizes the latest generation in Tri-Axis technology to provide superior accuracy in any position, whether up, down, flat, on its side, or at any angle. Moreover, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer utilizes a Digital 3D Acceleration Sensor which is far more accurate than mechanical sensors used in other pedometers. Compact, sleek and ultra slim, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer fits is any pocket and is the ultimate personal trainer. Used by professional 100 mile ultra runners such as Evan Kimber, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer records your steps, distance, average speed, calories burned, and time spent exercising, and displays your data on a new bright LCD with a night view backlight. The 4x3motion Digital Pedometer filters out vibrations and only begins counting after it detects a sequence of continuous steps for greater accuracy. The 4x3motion Digital Pedometer ships with a Lithium battery, a bonus strap and instruction manual. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed.", "text": "Ozeri 4x3motion Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer with Tri-Axis Technology Introducing the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer by Ozeri - the world's most advanced 3D pedometer. Unlike other pedometers that do not work accurately unless placed vertically, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer utilizes the latest generation in Tri-Axis technology to provide superior accuracy in any position, whether up, down, flat, on its side, or at any angle. Moreover, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer utilizes a Digital 3D Acceleration Sensor which is far more accurate than mechanical sensors used in other pedometers. Compact, sleek and ultra slim, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer fits is any pocket and is the ultimate personal trainer. Used by professional 100 mile ultra runners such as Evan Kimber, the 4x3motion Digital Pedometer records your steps, distance, average speed, calories burned, and time spent exercising, and displays your data on a new bright LCD with a night view backlight. The 4x3motion Digital Pedometer filters out vibrations and only begins counting after it detects a sequence of continuous steps for greater accuracy. The 4x3motion Digital Pedometer ships with a Lithium battery, a bonus strap and instruction manual. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g8-TIONIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042H69WU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ozeri", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042HN310", "title": "Joby Gorillatorch Switchback Light/Lamp", "description": "The Gorillatorch Switchback transforms from a powerful, compact lantern to a high-performance headlamp, all using a single 5-LED light array. Hit the trail with the headlamp when you need solo lighting, then fold into the lantern housing to illuminate your group’s activities and meals at the campsite. The Switchback’s smart ergonomic design features a rugged yet sleek exterior, which makes it the perfect companion for your camping, climbing, or backpacking exploits. Wherever your outdoor endeavors may take you, the Switchback will be there to light the way.", "text": "Joby Gorillatorch Switchback Light/Lamp The Gorillatorch Switchback transforms from a powerful, compact lantern to a high-performance headlamp, all using a single 5-LED light array. Hit the trail with the headlamp when you need solo lighting, then fold into the lantern housing to illuminate your group’s activities and meals at the campsite. The Switchback’s smart ergonomic design features a rugged yet sleek exterior, which makes it the perfect companion for your camping, climbing, or backpacking exploits. Wherever your outdoor endeavors may take you, the Switchback will be there to light the way.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xihpf85QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042HN310.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Joby", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0042J2PL2", "title": "Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove", "description": "The size of the Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove is small enough to slip into your backpack and weighing just 4.1 ounces, you'll barely notice it's there. The titanium panels are completely hinged and can snap into place easily for a quick set up. The titanium construction helps the stove endure long lengths of time with heat and still stay sturdy. This Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove is shaped in a way to focus the heat upwards so that your food will cook more efficiently upwards to the pot. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253418, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 120029, GTIN: 0818881004150", "text": "Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove The size of the Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove is small enough to slip into your backpack and weighing just 4.1 ounces, you'll barely notice it's there. The titanium panels are completely hinged and can snap into place easily for a quick set up. The titanium construction helps the stove endure long lengths of time with heat and still stay sturdy. This Vargo Titanium Hexagon Wood Stove is shaped in a way to focus the heat upwards so that your food will cook more efficiently upwards to the pot. . Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 253418, Shipping Exclusion: This item is only available for shipment by UPS to the lower 48 United States. APO, FPO, PO BOX, Hawaii, and Alaska shipments may not be possible for this item. (Please call prior to purchase.), Special Order: This is a Special Order item, will be shipped from the manufacturer, and is not stocked in our warehouse. This item does not qualify for our Price Matching Policy. Order processing time may vary., Model Number: 120029, GTIN: 0818881004150", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CbDseKDxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042J2PL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vargo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 51.99}}
{"item_id": "B0042JFAUK", "title": "STI - Rumble Roller", "description": "STI - Rumble Roller - 31\" Blue STI 36-inch Rumble Roller relieves muscular pain and tightness. STI Rumble Roller is the one and only deep-tissue roller. The RumbleRoller Manipulates Soft Tissue - Like a Massage Therapist! The surface of the RumbleRoller contains specially designed bumps that are firm, but flexible, much like the thumbs of a massage therapist. As you roll over the top of the RumbleRoller, the bumps continuously knead the contours of your body, gently stretching soft tissue (muscle and fascia) in multiple directions. This action erodes trigger points, helps restore flexibility, and brings quick relief to common types of muscular pain. By design, the RumbleRoller's bumps are firmer than muscle tissue, but much softer than bone, so they deflect out of the way if they contact your spine or other bony protrusions. Through simple techniques, you can control the amount of pressure the bumps apply to your body. The bumps are closely spaced to one another (less than 2\" apart), so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the RumbleRoller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief. Common Foam Rollers Compress Soft TissuePhysical therapists, trainers, and athletes use foam rollers to relieve muscular pain and tightness (often called \"adhesions\", \"knots\", or \"trigger points\"). But conventional foam rollers have smooth surfaces that further compress soft tissue. Rolling on top of them improves blood flow and tissue flexibility, but the effect is limited and relatively superficial, unless you spend a lot of time rolling. The RumbleRoller was created to perform this therapy more effectively. Add Another Dimension to Your Foam Roller ProgramThe RumbleRoller's massaging action can be further intensified by changing your movement from a back-and-forth rolling motion to a side-to-side rocking motion.", "text": "STI - Rumble Roller STI - Rumble Roller - 31\" Blue STI 36-inch Rumble Roller relieves muscular pain and tightness. STI Rumble Roller is the one and only deep-tissue roller. The RumbleRoller Manipulates Soft Tissue - Like a Massage Therapist! The surface of the RumbleRoller contains specially designed bumps that are firm, but flexible, much like the thumbs of a massage therapist. As you roll over the top of the RumbleRoller, the bumps continuously knead the contours of your body, gently stretching soft tissue (muscle and fascia) in multiple directions. This action erodes trigger points, helps restore flexibility, and brings quick relief to common types of muscular pain. By design, the RumbleRoller's bumps are firmer than muscle tissue, but much softer than bone, so they deflect out of the way if they contact your spine or other bony protrusions. Through simple techniques, you can control the amount of pressure the bumps apply to your body. The bumps are closely spaced to one another (less than 2\" apart), so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the RumbleRoller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief. Common Foam Rollers Compress Soft TissuePhysical therapists, trainers, and athletes use foam rollers to relieve muscular pain and tightness (often called \"adhesions\", \"knots\", or \"trigger points\"). But conventional foam rollers have smooth surfaces that further compress soft tissue. Rolling on top of them improves blood flow and tissue flexibility, but the effect is limited and relatively superficial, unless you spend a lot of time rolling. The RumbleRoller was created to perform this therapy more effectively. Add Another Dimension to Your Foam Roller ProgramThe RumbleRoller's massaging action can be further intensified by changing your movement from a back-and-forth rolling motion to a side-to-side rocking motion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T9FA5wYXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0042JFAUK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
