{"item_id": "B00435ZRTW", "title": "YogaRat 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels - Available separately in two sizes: Mat Length (24\" x 72\") and Hand Size (15\" x 24\")", "description": "YogaRat's super-absorbent 100% microfiber Yoga Towels and Yoga Hand Towels help you get the most from your practice!Mat-length towelsrest atop your mat and soak up perspiration so you won't slip or slide while you practice.•Textured weave strikes the perfect balance between grippy and soft-to-the-touch and delivers through ENTIRE sessions.•At 24\" x 72\" they work great with longer mats as well as standard-length mats.•Absorbent yet thin, they won't take up a ton of space in your yoga bag.Yoga Hand Towels(sold separately) are made from the same super-absorbent, fast-drying 100% microfiber material as our mat-length towels.At 15\" x 24\" they're great next to your yoga mat, at the gym, and even around the house!All our Yoga towels are machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors, no bleach or fabric softener, tumble dry low) for easy care, and they'll keep looking stylish over the long haul.Please check out our other Amazon listings if you're in need of a new yoga mat, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits.", "text": "YogaRat 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels - Available separately in two sizes: Mat Length (24\" x 72\") and Hand Size (15\" x 24\") YogaRat's super-absorbent 100% microfiber Yoga Towels and Yoga Hand Towels help you get the most from your practice!Mat-length towelsrest atop your mat and soak up perspiration so you won't slip or slide while you practice.•Textured weave strikes the perfect balance between grippy and soft-to-the-touch and delivers through ENTIRE sessions.•At 24\" x 72\" they work great with longer mats as well as standard-length mats.•Absorbent yet thin, they won't take up a ton of space in your yoga bag.Yoga Hand Towels(sold separately) are made from the same super-absorbent, fast-drying 100% microfiber material as our mat-length towels.At 15\" x 24\" they're great next to your yoga mat, at the gym, and even around the house!All our Yoga towels are machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors, no bleach or fabric softener, tumble dry low) for easy care, and they'll keep looking stylish over the long haul.Please check out our other Amazon listings if you're in need of a new yoga mat, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51agP-81LnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00435ZRTW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004360NKY", "title": "Minn Kota Endura C2 30 Freshwater Transom Mounted Trolling Motor (30\" Shaft)", "description": "Built to discover the best fishing holes the freshwater has to offer, the Endura C2 transom-mounted trolling motor is a legendary performer that will deliver years of use on the water. This small but mighty 12-volt motor offers 5 forward speeds and 3 reverse speeds, providing anglers with maximum control. Thanks to MinnKota's signature cool, quiet power, the motor offers maximized battery life, prolongs the motor's life, and cuts down on fish-spooking noise. The Endura's 6-inch telescoping handle and tilt twist tiller make the motor comfortable and easy to operate within the boat and the lever lock bracket offers a rock solid mount. Finally, the Endura's composite shaft is literally indestructible and is guaranteed not break, kink, or corrode for life. With the entire motor backed by a comprehensive two year warranty, you cannot go wrong with the Endura C2 motor for fresh water applications.Features:Telescoping Handle:Endura features an ergonomic, six-inch telescoping handle for comfortable, easy steering.Lever Lock Bracket:The Endura's Lever Lock Bracket delivers a rock-solid mount that's stronger than conventional brackets. Special composite materials resist flexing, warping and UV damage.Tilt Twist Tiller:The Endura's Tilt Twist Tiller features a natural ergonomic grip to deliver the ultimate in hands-on control for speed and steering.5 Speed:With 5 forward speeds and 3 reverse speeds, the Endura motor puts you in command of the boat.Indestructible Composite Shaft:Pound for pound, the high-yield composite shaft is stronger than steel. Virtually indestructible, the shaft flexes on impact before returning to the original position. It won't break, kink or corrode, giving MinnKota the confidence to make it the only trolling motor shaft that's guaranteed for life.Cool, Quiet Power:With extra large windings and commutators to dissipate heat, the MinnKota motor offers cooler operation, extended battery power, and longer motor life. The MinnKota's unique bearing system reduces friction to cut fish-spooking noise.Specifications:Maximum thrust: 30Volts: 12Shaft length: 30 inchesMount: Lever Lock BracketSpeeds: 5 forward and 3 reverseControl: Telescoping Handle", "text": "Minn Kota Endura C2 30 Freshwater Transom Mounted Trolling Motor (30\" Shaft) Built to discover the best fishing holes the freshwater has to offer, the Endura C2 transom-mounted trolling motor is a legendary performer that will deliver years of use on the water. This small but mighty 12-volt motor offers 5 forward speeds and 3 reverse speeds, providing anglers with maximum control. Thanks to MinnKota's signature cool, quiet power, the motor offers maximized battery life, prolongs the motor's life, and cuts down on fish-spooking noise. The Endura's 6-inch telescoping handle and tilt twist tiller make the motor comfortable and easy to operate within the boat and the lever lock bracket offers a rock solid mount. Finally, the Endura's composite shaft is literally indestructible and is guaranteed not break, kink, or corrode for life. With the entire motor backed by a comprehensive two year warranty, you cannot go wrong with the Endura C2 motor for fresh water applications.Features:Telescoping Handle:Endura features an ergonomic, six-inch telescoping handle for comfortable, easy steering.Lever Lock Bracket:The Endura's Lever Lock Bracket delivers a rock-solid mount that's stronger than conventional brackets. Special composite materials resist flexing, warping and UV damage.Tilt Twist Tiller:The Endura's Tilt Twist Tiller features a natural ergonomic grip to deliver the ultimate in hands-on control for speed and steering.5 Speed:With 5 forward speeds and 3 reverse speeds, the Endura motor puts you in command of the boat.Indestructible Composite Shaft:Pound for pound, the high-yield composite shaft is stronger than steel. Virtually indestructible, the shaft flexes on impact before returning to the original position. It won't break, kink or corrode, giving MinnKota the confidence to make it the only trolling motor shaft that's guaranteed for life.Cool, Quiet Power:With extra large windings and commutators to dissipate heat, the MinnKota motor offers cooler operation, extended battery power, and longer motor life. The MinnKota's unique bearing system reduces friction to cut fish-spooking noise.Specifications:Maximum thrust: 30Volts: 12Shaft length: 30 inchesMount: Lever Lock BracketSpeeds: 5 forward and 3 reverseControl: Telescoping Handle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y5yZtBJDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004360NKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Minn Kota", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Motors", "Trolling Motors"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B00436H94C", "title": "Whetstone M306a Pump Action Airsoft Gun", "description": "The M306A Pump Action Airsoft Gun from Whetstone™ is ideal for shooting competitions. Its durable plastic construction and spring operated firing mechanism make the M306A an essential addition to your airsoft arsenal. This amazing airsoft gun fires 6 mm BBs and its clip holds up to 22 rounds offering you plenty of fire power.", "text": "Whetstone M306a Pump Action Airsoft Gun The M306A Pump Action Airsoft Gun from Whetstone™ is ideal for shooting competitions. Its durable plastic construction and spring operated firing mechanism make the M306A an essential addition to your airsoft arsenal. This amazing airsoft gun fires 6 mm BBs and its clip holds up to 22 rounds offering you plenty of fire power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E72OHP23L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00436H94C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 19.99}}
