{"item_id": "B00437ZJFC", "title": "Camelbak Octane XCT 100 oz Hydration Pack", "description": "The Octane XCT is the ultimate minimalist trail hydration pack--offering exceptional utility in an incredibly streamlined build. The air channel back panel and independent suspension harness combine to provide maximum ventilated support with the stability you need for running. The Antidote Reservoir offers ready access to your hydration while the 200 cubic inches of additional capacity can accommodate extra layers, ultra-light weather protection, energy bars, and trail maps.Antidote Reservoir with Quick Link System.Pack Specifications:Hydration Capacity: 100 ounces (3 liters)Cargo Capacity: 200 cubic inches (3.28 liters)Torso Length: 15 inches (38 centimeters)Pack Weight: 11.2 ounces (320 grams)Fabric: 70D mini ripstop, 230D taffeta & 420D Nylon with DWR + 1000mm PU CoatingPack Features:Air channel back panelUltra-light 3D mesh harness1-inch 840D lightweight tape belt with cargo pocketExternal fill reservoirFront and back reflectivityCarries: extra layers, ultra-light weather protection, energy bars, trail mapsAntidote Reservoir Features:Low-profile design for unmatched stabilityAir-light fillport cuts weightHydroGuard technology to inhibit the growth of harmful bacteria and prolong reservoir lifePureFlow tubePatented Big Bite Valve for easy drinkingEasy-to-clean wide-mouth openingQuick-seal cap tightens in just a quarter turn", "text": "Camelbak Octane XCT 100 oz Hydration Pack The Octane XCT is the ultimate minimalist trail hydration pack--offering exceptional utility in an incredibly streamlined build. The air channel back panel and independent suspension harness combine to provide maximum ventilated support with the stability you need for running. The Antidote Reservoir offers ready access to your hydration while the 200 cubic inches of additional capacity can accommodate extra layers, ultra-light weather protection, energy bars, and trail maps.Antidote Reservoir with Quick Link System.Pack Specifications:Hydration Capacity: 100 ounces (3 liters)Cargo Capacity: 200 cubic inches (3.28 liters)Torso Length: 15 inches (38 centimeters)Pack Weight: 11.2 ounces (320 grams)Fabric: 70D mini ripstop, 230D taffeta & 420D Nylon with DWR + 1000mm PU CoatingPack Features:Air channel back panelUltra-light 3D mesh harness1-inch 840D lightweight tape belt with cargo pocketExternal fill reservoirFront and back reflectivityCarries: extra layers, ultra-light weather protection, energy bars, trail mapsAntidote Reservoir Features:Low-profile design for unmatched stabilityAir-light fillport cuts weightHydroGuard technology to inhibit the growth of harmful bacteria and prolong reservoir lifePureFlow tubePatented Big Bite Valve for easy drinkingEasy-to-clean wide-mouth openingQuick-seal cap tightens in just a quarter turn", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eUSBp6hbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00437ZJFC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 83.99}}
{"item_id": "B00438RI7S", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F06TN-CP Fasthawk Tactical Tomahawk with 2-Inch Steel Axe Blade and Black Ballistic Nylon Sheath, Black Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F06TN-CP Fasthawk Tactical Tomahawk with 2-Inch Steel Axe Blade and Black Ballistic Nylon Sheath, Black Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Aip5K8YFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00438RI7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0043AAWII", "title": "Genuine Innovations Nano Microflate Inflator (Yellow)", "description": "Genuine Innovations Microflate Nano with 16g Threaded Cartridge. The only inflator that fits inside disc & aero wheels ! Twist-to-Inflate technology. IH (Intelligent Head) automatically detects & Works with both Presta and Schrader valves ! Angled nozzle for easy installation, molded wings for added grip, Includes 16g threaded cartridge ! Made in the USA with Limited Lifetime Warranty !", "text": "Genuine Innovations Nano Microflate Inflator (Yellow) Genuine Innovations Microflate Nano with 16g Threaded Cartridge. The only inflator that fits inside disc & aero wheels ! Twist-to-Inflate technology. IH (Intelligent Head) automatically detects & Works with both Presta and Schrader valves ! Angled nozzle for easy installation, molded wings for added grip, Includes 16g threaded cartridge ! Made in the USA with Limited Lifetime Warranty !", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PJPjdei4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0043AAWII.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 16.5}}
{"item_id": "B0043AK0O4", "title": "Coleman Packaway Twin Cot", "description": "Convenient and portable, the Coleman Packaway Cot comfortably sleeps one person up to 6'1\" tall, with an extra-wide bed that holds up to 300 pounds. Measuring 40\" wide by 80\" long and 17\" high when unfolded, the Packaway cot sports an X-frame design that's a snap to set up. It features a convenient attached nightstand with a cup holder, so you have a handy place to keep water, flashlight, glasses, or other necessities. The Packaway Cot is made of durable poly oxford fabric over a strong steel frame.", "text": "Coleman Packaway Twin Cot Convenient and portable, the Coleman Packaway Cot comfortably sleeps one person up to 6'1\" tall, with an extra-wide bed that holds up to 300 pounds. Measuring 40\" wide by 80\" long and 17\" high when unfolded, the Packaway cot sports an X-frame design that's a snap to set up. It features a convenient attached nightstand with a cup holder, so you have a handy place to keep water, flashlight, glasses, or other necessities. The Packaway Cot is made of durable poly oxford fabric over a strong steel frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ACTRmHuYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0043AK0O4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 67.01}}
{"item_id": "B0043B51EC", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 250 USB Li-Ion One-Piece design High-Brightness LED Bike light", "description": "Second Generation One-Piece Design LED lighting system with USB rechargeable Quick Release battery for multi-purpose users. Cygolite’s Expilion takes one piece lighting to another level, giving riders a light that is small for daily commuting and bright on the trails. New for 2011, the ExpiliOn 250 is Cygolite’s brightest and lightest one piece lighting system featuring 250 lumens of intense LED light seen through 6 different lighting modes, and powered by a Quick Release USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery. At only 130 grams, this light can be mounted with the included handlebar or helmet mounts to light your favorite commute or trail.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 250 USB Li-Ion One-Piece design High-Brightness LED Bike light Second Generation One-Piece Design LED lighting system with USB rechargeable Quick Release battery for multi-purpose users. Cygolite’s Expilion takes one piece lighting to another level, giving riders a light that is small for daily commuting and bright on the trails. New for 2011, the ExpiliOn 250 is Cygolite’s brightest and lightest one piece lighting system featuring 250 lumens of intense LED light seen through 6 different lighting modes, and powered by a Quick Release USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery. At only 130 grams, this light can be mounted with the included handlebar or helmet mounts to light your favorite commute or trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kC3kNFdjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0043B51EC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0043B51J2", "title": "Cygolite MityCross 400 Li-Ion Dual High-Brightness LED system", "description": "The Mitycross Series Headlights feature a compact dual beam design to light up those night rides. 400 lumens LED output. Handlebar and helmet mounts included. Compact dual beam design. Cross-fire technology for expanded field of vision. Complete weatherproof protection. High brightness LED technology. 6 Modes<, light setting/ battery level indicators. Palm sized Li-Ion stem mount battery Smart and rapid recharger.", "text": "Cygolite MityCross 400 Li-Ion Dual High-Brightness LED system The Mitycross Series Headlights feature a compact dual beam design to light up those night rides. 400 lumens LED output. Handlebar and helmet mounts included. Compact dual beam design. Cross-fire technology for expanded field of vision. Complete weatherproof protection. High brightness LED technology. 6 Modes<, light setting/ battery level indicators. Palm sized Li-Ion stem mount battery Smart and rapid recharger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oM2VVG%2B1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0043B51J2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0043BSDQA", "title": "Blackburn Click Combo Lights", "description": "For some reason, bike light companies take sadistic pleasure in watching you fumble around after dark (when you're usually using your lights) trying to find the on/off switch. Blackburn got tired of that old trick, and decided to make life a little easier by allowing you to turn the Click Combo Lights on and off by clicking the lens. 2 super-bright LED front lights for excellent vision2 super-bright LED rear lights for excellent visibility70-hour steady and 140-hour flashing run timesBatteries includedLights mount to any bar or post, no tools required", "text": "Blackburn Click Combo Lights For some reason, bike light companies take sadistic pleasure in watching you fumble around after dark (when you're usually using your lights) trying to find the on/off switch. Blackburn got tired of that old trick, and decided to make life a little easier by allowing you to turn the Click Combo Lights on and off by clicking the lens. 2 super-bright LED front lights for excellent vision2 super-bright LED rear lights for excellent visibility70-hour steady and 140-hour flashing run timesBatteries includedLights mount to any bar or post, no tools required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414fX6b-9hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0043BSDQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 22.49}}
