{"item_id": "B00443FB12", "title": "MagSlab Magnesium Fire Starter", "description": "The popular MagSlabTM FireStarter by FireSteel.com combines our special soft magnesium slab with built in FireSteel.com FireSteel, a genuine FireSteel.com Super Scraper, and over two feet of 550 paracord (thousands of survival uses) as a lanyard. Not only is this a great price, the added benefit of having a length of 550 paracord handy makes this a true value in any survival or outdoor kit. To use the magnesium as tinder, simply scrape a small pile of shavings off the soft magnesium bar using your scraper or knife. When a spark from the built-in FireSteel hits these magnesium shavings, the magnesium will easily catch on fire and burn at a temperature of 4000 degrees F (2200 C). This can then be used to help ingnite your natural tinder which may be damp and need this extra boost in order to catch on fire. A big advantage to carrying a piece of magnesium for tinder is that it will not become damp or wet. Therefore it will burn even if you have totally immersed it in water. Another great combination for starting fires under just about any conditions. *Note: I recommend you also carry a larger FireSteel. While the built-in FireSteel on the MagSlab FireStarter is an excellent backup, the larger FireSteels are easier to use and give a correspondingly greater shower of sparks when scraped.", "text": "MagSlab Magnesium Fire Starter The popular MagSlabTM FireStarter by FireSteel.com combines our special soft magnesium slab with built in FireSteel.com FireSteel, a genuine FireSteel.com Super Scraper, and over two feet of 550 paracord (thousands of survival uses) as a lanyard. Not only is this a great price, the added benefit of having a length of 550 paracord handy makes this a true value in any survival or outdoor kit. To use the magnesium as tinder, simply scrape a small pile of shavings off the soft magnesium bar using your scraper or knife. When a spark from the built-in FireSteel hits these magnesium shavings, the magnesium will easily catch on fire and burn at a temperature of 4000 degrees F (2200 C). This can then be used to help ingnite your natural tinder which may be damp and need this extra boost in order to catch on fire. A big advantage to carrying a piece of magnesium for tinder is that it will not become damp or wet. Therefore it will burn even if you have totally immersed it in water. Another great combination for starting fires under just about any conditions. *Note: I recommend you also carry a larger FireSteel. While the built-in FireSteel on the MagSlab FireStarter is an excellent backup, the larger FireSteels are easier to use and give a correspondingly greater shower of sparks when scraped.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dcB%2Bul9-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00443FB12.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00447HVV6", "title": "Terramar Thermawool Glove Liner", "description": "Soft, natural, breathable merino wool insulates to keep you warm and comfortable even when wet. Exceptionally soft against the skin and itch-free the Terramar Thermawool™ Liner Glove has 360 degree stretch for unrestricted movement, wicks moisture away from the skin and is highly breathable. Engineered to keep your extremities warm and dry over a wide range of temperatures and outdoor activities.Excellent for layering under gloves or as an outer layer..Provides excellent moisture management..Fabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection, shielding skin from harmful ultraviolet rays..Excellent thermal qualities in a variety of weather conditions..Machine washable..Import..", "text": "Terramar Thermawool Glove Liner Soft, natural, breathable merino wool insulates to keep you warm and comfortable even when wet. Exceptionally soft against the skin and itch-free the Terramar Thermawool™ Liner Glove has 360 degree stretch for unrestricted movement, wicks moisture away from the skin and is highly breathable. Engineered to keep your extremities warm and dry over a wide range of temperatures and outdoor activities.Excellent for layering under gloves or as an outer layer..Provides excellent moisture management..Fabric provides UPF 50+ sun protection, shielding skin from harmful ultraviolet rays..Excellent thermal qualities in a variety of weather conditions..Machine washable..Import..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BiJDKDzvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00447HVV6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
