{"item_id": "B004498SSE", "title": "Full Body Honeycomb Mesh Sniper Veil Cover 60\" x 96\"", "description": "These functional and effective G.I. sniper veils are made from breathable, quick-drying honeycomb nylon mesh. They drape over the upper torso, head and weapon to break up the sniper's silhouette. Can also be used as a scarf, headband, etc.", "text": "Full Body Honeycomb Mesh Sniper Veil Cover 60\" x 96\" These functional and effective G.I. sniper veils are made from breathable, quick-drying honeycomb nylon mesh. They drape over the upper torso, head and weapon to break up the sniper's silhouette. Can also be used as a scarf, headband, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xRekuGsLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004498SSE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ASR Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 2.91}}
{"item_id": "B00449I46A", "title": "Champion Trapshooting Single Box Shell Pouch", "description": "The shooting experts at Champion now offer shell pouches worthy of your next trapshooting session. Ergonomically designed for hours of shooting action, these maintenance free pouches belt snugly on your hip, allow easy access to shells and provide ample room for empty hulls. Choose between the black nylon entry pouch which holds a single box of loose shells or the custom canvas and nylon model that features two off-set pouch holders that accommodates two boxes of shells and a quick zip bottom for fast hull discharge. Form, fit and function—the Shotgun Shell Pouches from Champion.", "text": "Champion Trapshooting Single Box Shell Pouch The shooting experts at Champion now offer shell pouches worthy of your next trapshooting session. Ergonomically designed for hours of shooting action, these maintenance free pouches belt snugly on your hip, allow easy access to shells and provide ample room for empty hulls. Choose between the black nylon entry pouch which holds a single box of loose shells or the custom canvas and nylon model that features two off-set pouch holders that accommodates two boxes of shells and a quick zip bottom for fast hull discharge. Form, fit and function—the Shotgun Shell Pouches from Champion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mZcmG29QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00449I46A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00449IU6E", "title": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Front and Rear Combo", "description": "The Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Front and Rear Combo package packs a much bigger punch than its name would make you think. Both the headlight and taillight give off big light from a small package, featuring four LED bulbs each putting out 40 lumens of brightness. Add in the fact that they charge via USB and you've got a winner.", "text": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Front and Rear Combo The Blackburn Flea 2.0 USB Front and Rear Combo package packs a much bigger punch than its name would make you think. Both the headlight and taillight give off big light from a small package, featuring four LED bulbs each putting out 40 lumens of brightness. Add in the fact that they charge via USB and you've got a winner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xVaU6%2Bd9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00449IU6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 49.45}}
{"item_id": "B00449YYM8", "title": "Morakniv Classic No 1 Wood Handle Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade, 3.9-Inch", "description": "Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic No 1 features a 3.9-inch carbon steel blade and red birch wood handle. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "text": "Morakniv Classic No 1 Wood Handle Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade, 3.9-Inch Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic No 1 features a 3.9-inch carbon steel blade and red birch wood handle. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JhmTikuDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00449YYM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 13.51}}
