{"item_id": "B0044GAPQA", "title": "Hillbilly Wrist Guard Gloves - Full Finger", "description": "New and Improved Hillbilly Full Finger Gloves are more durable, made with goatskin and double stitched with heavy duty nylon thread. Full finger coverage provides extra protection on fingertips.", "text": "Hillbilly Wrist Guard Gloves - Full Finger New and Improved Hillbilly Full Finger Gloves are more durable, made with goatskin and double stitched with heavy duty nylon thread. Full finger coverage provides extra protection on fingertips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XOfAu1UGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044GAPQA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Protective Gear", "Wrist Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0044KO4PY", "title": "MTECH USA MT-206BK Fixed Blade Knife 7-Inch Overall", "description": "MTech Boot knife. 7\" overall. 3 3/4\" black finish 440 stainless double edge dagger blade. Grooved black finish aluminum handles with integrated guard. Lanyard hole. Black nylon belt sheath.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-206BK Fixed Blade Knife 7-Inch Overall MTech Boot knife. 7\" overall. 3 3/4\" black finish 440 stainless double edge dagger blade. Grooved black finish aluminum handles with integrated guard. Lanyard hole. Black nylon belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V2JE-JvVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044KO4PY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.33}}
{"item_id": "B0044L8RX8", "title": "Guide Gear 240 - lumen Extreme Tactical Light", "description": "Target acquired! Light up the night with this Guide Gear 240 - lumen Tactical Light, SAVE! The brighter you are... the better. Don't be left in the dark in your next emergency response. We loved everything about the next generation of ultra-bright tactical lights... except the price. So we designed our own! This blazing squad partner puts an unwavering beam exactly where you want it. Easy to mount, easy to carry. Offered here for BIG BUCKS OFF the expected retail price! Tremendous power: Machined CNC aluminum frame; Non-reflective black anodized anti-corrosive tactical finish; 100% waterproof O-ring sealed; Continuous push-button or momentary on / off rear switch; Recoil-resistant... handles anything up to a .50 BMG!; Coated optical-grade glass eliminates filament ring shadows; Strobe setting emits bright flashes; 8-hour continuous run time, uses 2 lithium CR-123 batteries (not included).; Includes both Weaver style and universal barrel mount. 6\" l. Weighs 10 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Guide Gear 240-lumen Extreme Tactical Light", "text": "Guide Gear 240 - lumen Extreme Tactical Light Target acquired! Light up the night with this Guide Gear 240 - lumen Tactical Light, SAVE! The brighter you are... the better. Don't be left in the dark in your next emergency response. We loved everything about the next generation of ultra-bright tactical lights... except the price. So we designed our own! This blazing squad partner puts an unwavering beam exactly where you want it. Easy to mount, easy to carry. Offered here for BIG BUCKS OFF the expected retail price! Tremendous power: Machined CNC aluminum frame; Non-reflective black anodized anti-corrosive tactical finish; 100% waterproof O-ring sealed; Continuous push-button or momentary on / off rear switch; Recoil-resistant... handles anything up to a .50 BMG!; Coated optical-grade glass eliminates filament ring shadows; Strobe setting emits bright flashes; 8-hour continuous run time, uses 2 lithium CR-123 batteries (not included).; Includes both Weaver style and universal barrel mount. 6\" l. Weighs 10 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Guide Gear 240-lumen Extreme Tactical Light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NDuG%2B-KAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044L8RX8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0044M81EW", "title": "ChicoBag Bottle Sling Bag with Pouch", "description": "The Bottle Sling is a perfect complement to your beverage bottle. An ideal companion to take with you on a walk, hike or to a music festival, the Bottle Sling will help to make your reusable bottle unforgettable. Holds most bottles, including 27oz and 40oz Klean Kanteen products. ChicoBag Company is equipping humanity with tools that will help eliminate the unnecessary use of single-use paper and plastic bags. We have done this by designing reusable totes, packs and lifestyle totes that are durable, tasteful and most importantly unforgettable. Today our mission at ChicoBag is really quite simple - we want to help humanity kick the single-use bag habit. We believe we can best achieve our goal by delivering a wide array of reusable bags that deliver solutions to every lifestyle. Our commitment to the environment is what motivates us to come to work every day and drives us to provide a trusted brand and a portfolio of quality products aimed at helping humanity solve the environmental challenges ahead.", "text": "ChicoBag Bottle Sling Bag with Pouch The Bottle Sling is a perfect complement to your beverage bottle. An ideal companion to take with you on a walk, hike or to a music festival, the Bottle Sling will help to make your reusable bottle unforgettable. Holds most bottles, including 27oz and 40oz Klean Kanteen products. ChicoBag Company is equipping humanity with tools that will help eliminate the unnecessary use of single-use paper and plastic bags. We have done this by designing reusable totes, packs and lifestyle totes that are durable, tasteful and most importantly unforgettable. Today our mission at ChicoBag is really quite simple - we want to help humanity kick the single-use bag habit. We believe we can best achieve our goal by delivering a wide array of reusable bags that deliver solutions to every lifestyle. Our commitment to the environment is what motivates us to come to work every day and drives us to provide a trusted brand and a portfolio of quality products aimed at helping humanity solve the environmental challenges ahead.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tYlM-U8HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044M81EW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ChicoBag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 8.95}}
