{"item_id": "B0044S817I", "title": "Grabber Outdoors The Original Space Brand Emergency Tactical-Survival Blanket- Olive-Drab/Silver (Pack of 3)", "description": "Engineered to reflect and retain over 80% of radiated body heat. the unique combination of vacuum deposited metal and a polyester film surface allows no wind or moisture penetration. when folded, it is approximately the size of a deck of cards, but opens into a 56”x84” blanket. the original space brand blanket has been made in the usa for over 40 years. store in car, camper, boat, or gear bag in case of emergency, or use after marathons, or sporting events. available in silver/silver for general outdoor protection, silver/orange for greater air-to-ground visibility especially against snow or water backgrounds, or olive-drab/silver for tactical situations requiring a thermal emergency blanket that blends in to surroundings. waterproof & windproof, size 1”x4” folded; unfolds to 56”x84” and weighs only 3 oz. available in silver/silver, gold/silver & tactical olive-drab/silver colors.", "text": "Grabber Outdoors The Original Space Brand Emergency Tactical-Survival Blanket- Olive-Drab/Silver (Pack of 3) Engineered to reflect and retain over 80% of radiated body heat. the unique combination of vacuum deposited metal and a polyester film surface allows no wind or moisture penetration. when folded, it is approximately the size of a deck of cards, but opens into a 56”x84” blanket. the original space brand blanket has been made in the usa for over 40 years. store in car, camper, boat, or gear bag in case of emergency, or use after marathons, or sporting events. available in silver/silver for general outdoor protection, silver/orange for greater air-to-ground visibility especially against snow or water backgrounds, or olive-drab/silver for tactical situations requiring a thermal emergency blanket that blends in to surroundings. waterproof & windproof, size 1”x4” folded; unfolds to 56”x84” and weighs only 3 oz. available in silver/silver, gold/silver & tactical olive-drab/silver colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fxLOfMdtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044S817I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grabber Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 18.75}}
{"item_id": "B0044SP4ZU", "title": "Crimson Trace Ruger LCP Laserguard and Free Grovtec Pocket Holster", "description": "Among Crimson Trace's best-selling products, the revolutionary LG-431 Laserguard is a no-brainer when it comes to bolstering the defensive capabilities of your Ruger LCP. Crimson Trace knows if you ever need to defend yourself with your firearm, chances are it won't be from a perfect shooting position. And it will happen lightning fast. The LG-431 keeps you safer by seamlessly attaching to the trigger guard, where its front activation design will immediately spring to life as you hold the pistol naturally. The beam is projected from just underneath the muzzle, immediately increasing your accuracy with the LCP. Winner of the 2009 Self-Defense Product of the Year from the Academy of Excellence, the LG-431 Laserguard comes with an accompanying pocket holster.SpecificationsPlatform: LaserguardAttachment: Trigger guardActivation: Instinctive (front)Materials: Polymer and rubberInstallation: User installed, no gunsmithing necessarySighting: Factory sighted at 50 feetWindage and elevation adjustments: YesBattery type: 1/3N 3-volt lithium (1) or 357 silver oxide batteries (2)Battery life: 4 hoursOn/off switch: NoLaser output: 5 mW (peak), 633 nm, Class 3R red laserWrench size: 0.5Warranty: 3-year manufacturer", "text": "Crimson Trace Ruger LCP Laserguard and Free Grovtec Pocket Holster Among Crimson Trace's best-selling products, the revolutionary LG-431 Laserguard is a no-brainer when it comes to bolstering the defensive capabilities of your Ruger LCP. Crimson Trace knows if you ever need to defend yourself with your firearm, chances are it won't be from a perfect shooting position. And it will happen lightning fast. The LG-431 keeps you safer by seamlessly attaching to the trigger guard, where its front activation design will immediately spring to life as you hold the pistol naturally. The beam is projected from just underneath the muzzle, immediately increasing your accuracy with the LCP. Winner of the 2009 Self-Defense Product of the Year from the Academy of Excellence, the LG-431 Laserguard comes with an accompanying pocket holster.SpecificationsPlatform: LaserguardAttachment: Trigger guardActivation: Instinctive (front)Materials: Polymer and rubberInstallation: User installed, no gunsmithing necessarySighting: Factory sighted at 50 feetWindage and elevation adjustments: YesBattery type: 1/3N 3-volt lithium (1) or 357 silver oxide batteries (2)Battery life: 4 hoursOn/off switch: NoLaser output: 5 mW (peak), 633 nm, Class 3R red laserWrench size: 0.5Warranty: 3-year manufacturer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OcKWQnGoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044SP4ZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 189.99}}
{"item_id": "B0044U42LU", "title": "United Cutlery Tomahawk Throwing Knife Set (3-Piece), Black", "description": "At 5.5\" in length, each knife is easily concealable under a sleeve or pant leg. The pointed ends on the knives can help you increase the speeds of your throws. You're certain to be pleased with the results! Includes nylon sheath.", "text": "United Cutlery Tomahawk Throwing Knife Set (3-Piece), Black At 5.5\" in length, each knife is easily concealable under a sleeve or pant leg. The pointed ends on the knives can help you increase the speeds of your throws. You're certain to be pleased with the results! Includes nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-k-kItmTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044U42LU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 7.2}}
{"item_id": "B0044U8W3E", "title": "Ibera Bike Panniers", "description": "Ibera Panniers/Messenger Bag Combo is perfect for commuting to work or school and for everyday off-bike use. The panniers double as a messenger bag that can be simply and quickly detached with a hook and strap (shoulder strap is included for off-road use).The angled pocket design ensures that cyclists have ample pedaling space. Each pannier has a rigid back panel that maintains bag structure for easy access to contents on and off the bike.Bag interiors are equipped with document holders to keep items organized and easy to access. Multiple compartments on the exterior hold additional items.Made of durable 1680 nylon, the panniers have a hand-carry strap and reflective strips for nighttime safety.Compatibility: Ibera PakRak Carriers IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, IB-RA15 and most third-party touring carriers.SpecificationsMaterial:1680D NylonMount:Hook and strapCapacity:30 LDimensions:12.2 x 11\" x 3.9\" (each pannier)Weight:2.2 lbs.", "text": "Ibera Bike Panniers Ibera Panniers/Messenger Bag Combo is perfect for commuting to work or school and for everyday off-bike use. The panniers double as a messenger bag that can be simply and quickly detached with a hook and strap (shoulder strap is included for off-road use).The angled pocket design ensures that cyclists have ample pedaling space. Each pannier has a rigid back panel that maintains bag structure for easy access to contents on and off the bike.Bag interiors are equipped with document holders to keep items organized and easy to access. Multiple compartments on the exterior hold additional items.Made of durable 1680 nylon, the panniers have a hand-carry strap and reflective strips for nighttime safety.Compatibility: Ibera PakRak Carriers IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, IB-RA15 and most third-party touring carriers.SpecificationsMaterial:1680D NylonMount:Hook and strapCapacity:30 LDimensions:12.2 x 11\" x 3.9\" (each pannier)Weight:2.2 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IhXzAS-aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044U8W3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B0044UHK50", "title": "Nikon DSLR Starter Kit with Nikon School Fast, Fun and Easy DVD Set and DSLR Case", "description": "Fast, Fun & Easy VGreat Digital SLR Pictures & MoviesThe Nikon School 2-DVD set included in this Value Pack is hosted by award-winning NationalGeographic Traveler photographer Bob Krist and award-winning wedding and portrait photographer,Kevin Kubota. Featuring the Nikon D7000, D5000, D3100 and D3000, this 2-DVD set provides insight ontaking great pictures and movies with ease. Bob Krist and Kevin Kubota explain the advantages ofusing some of the Scene Modes, including Portrait, Sports and Action, Landscape and more, whileleading you through field shooting. Fast, Fun & Easy 5 will show photographers of all levels how toexpand their creativity.Newly Designed D-SLR CaseIn addition to the Fast, Fun & Easy V DVD set, the new Value Pack includes a new, stylish D-SLRcase to store your D-SLR camera and accessories.", "text": "Nikon DSLR Starter Kit with Nikon School Fast, Fun and Easy DVD Set and DSLR Case Fast, Fun & Easy VGreat Digital SLR Pictures & MoviesThe Nikon School 2-DVD set included in this Value Pack is hosted by award-winning NationalGeographic Traveler photographer Bob Krist and award-winning wedding and portrait photographer,Kevin Kubota. Featuring the Nikon D7000, D5000, D3100 and D3000, this 2-DVD set provides insight ontaking great pictures and movies with ease. Bob Krist and Kevin Kubota explain the advantages ofusing some of the Scene Modes, including Portrait, Sports and Action, Landscape and more, whileleading you through field shooting. Fast, Fun & Easy 5 will show photographers of all levels how toexpand their creativity.Newly Designed D-SLR CaseIn addition to the Fast, Fun & Easy V DVD set, the new Value Pack includes a new, stylish D-SLRcase to store your D-SLR camera and accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H3Pbnc5eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044UHK50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B0044UJF6C", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P226 Rubber with Finger Grooves", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Sig Sauer P226 Rubber with Finger Grooves Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EvpqSHgkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044UJF6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 17.28}}
{"item_id": "B0044X5GCQ", "title": "MTM Load Labels (Pack of 50)", "description": "Reload labels help you keep track of what load you have in each ammo box. The size of these labels fit the .38 caliber ammo boxes and everything bigger. 50 load labels come per pack along with 48 small color coded labels for the outside of your boxes. These color labels can help you organize your reloading room. Each load label has a space for caliber, powder, bullet, weights, primers, times loaded, date, and notes, etc.", "text": "MTM Load Labels (Pack of 50) Reload labels help you keep track of what load you have in each ammo box. The size of these labels fit the .38 caliber ammo boxes and everything bigger. 50 load labels come per pack along with 48 small color coded labels for the outside of your boxes. These color labels can help you organize your reloading room. Each load label has a space for caliber, powder, bullet, weights, primers, times loaded, date, and notes, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IPgeonzwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044X5GCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 6.68}}
{"item_id": "B0044XE6J0", "title": "LimbSaver AR-15/M4 Snap-On Recoil Pad, Black", "description": "LimbSaver recoil pads are referred to as the best and are widely used by military personnel, law enforcement agencies and a variety of sportsmen. They reduce up to 70% felt recoil and maintains target acquisition with LimbSaver anti-muzzle jump technology solid shooting platform. Secure Snap-On installation for quick on & off flexibility, Fits most six-position tactical stocks, Non-slip NAVCOM material, 3-step recoil reduction technology. 5 3/16\" x 1 7/8\" Max. Must Have 1/4\" Step-down to Properly Snap On. Black. 10019.", "text": "LimbSaver AR-15/M4 Snap-On Recoil Pad, Black LimbSaver recoil pads are referred to as the best and are widely used by military personnel, law enforcement agencies and a variety of sportsmen. They reduce up to 70% felt recoil and maintains target acquisition with LimbSaver anti-muzzle jump technology solid shooting platform. Secure Snap-On installation for quick on & off flexibility, Fits most six-position tactical stocks, Non-slip NAVCOM material, 3-step recoil reduction technology. 5 3/16\" x 1 7/8\" Max. Must Have 1/4\" Step-down to Properly Snap On. Black. 10019.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hkM0%2BP24L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044XE6J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Limbsaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 32.22}}
{"item_id": "B0044XE6QS", "title": "Global Military Gear AR-15 Detachable Front and Rear Sight Set", "description": "Detachable front and rear sights for AR-15.", "text": "Global Military Gear AR-15 Detachable Front and Rear Sight Set Detachable front and rear sights for AR-15.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h-TbN9HNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044XE6QS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 39.44}}
{"item_id": "B0044XGDNM", "title": "Real Avid The Gun Tool Plus (Silver/Black)", "description": "The Gun Tool Plus is the ultimate tool to keep your gun ready. Its original, patent pending, design is an entire shooter's toolbox all in one frame. The Gun tool contains 18 of the most frequently used tools for rifles and shotguns packed into an ergonomic body that gives you exactly the torque and grip you need. Some of the tools it included are a Gun pin punch, scope windage/elevation adjuster, 3 Torx wenches, allen wrenches, storage bay for 4 hex bits. The Gun Tool can make the quick fix that can save a hunt or a trip to the range. Also included with the Gun Tool Plus is a Magnetic Bore light that puts out 15,000 mcd brightness, with an 8 hour run time, a rugged EVA molded ballistic nylon exterior sheath, and a 1/4\" hex driver adapter along with 5 extra hex driver bits.", "text": "Real Avid The Gun Tool Plus (Silver/Black) The Gun Tool Plus is the ultimate tool to keep your gun ready. Its original, patent pending, design is an entire shooter's toolbox all in one frame. The Gun tool contains 18 of the most frequently used tools for rifles and shotguns packed into an ergonomic body that gives you exactly the torque and grip you need. Some of the tools it included are a Gun pin punch, scope windage/elevation adjuster, 3 Torx wenches, allen wrenches, storage bay for 4 hex bits. The Gun Tool can make the quick fix that can save a hunt or a trip to the range. Also included with the Gun Tool Plus is a Magnetic Bore light that puts out 15,000 mcd brightness, with an 8 hour run time, a rugged EVA molded ballistic nylon exterior sheath, and a 1/4\" hex driver adapter along with 5 extra hex driver bits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n2qgXV9dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044XGDNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.97}}
{"item_id": "B0044XL39Q", "title": "SmartReloader SR1750 Reloading Bullet Puller", "description": "The SmartReloader bullet puller is made of high quality plastic (head and handle) and aluminum (rod). It will easily disassemble your ammunition and it is virtually indestructible. Works with all ammunition from .17 Remington up to 50/70Govt. An extra 3-Collet set is included for FREE!", "text": "SmartReloader SR1750 Reloading Bullet Puller The SmartReloader bullet puller is made of high quality plastic (head and handle) and aluminum (rod). It will easily disassemble your ammunition and it is virtually indestructible. Works with all ammunition from .17 Remington up to 50/70Govt. An extra 3-Collet set is included for FREE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414cvNictYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044XL39Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SmartReloader", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.81}}
{"item_id": "B0044XL3SM", "title": "Remington 19555 1911 Grip Panels", "description": "With a beautiful rosewood laminate finish, these Remington 1911 grips provide a unique upgrade to your Remington Model 1911 R1 handgun, or any standard size 1911 style pistol. Providing added comfort and stability, the Remington 1911 Grips feature double diamond checkering with the \"R\" medallion inlaid in handle.Note: Rosewood Grips will not fit Remington 1911 R1 Enhanced Models. Minor fitting, modifying the length of top left grip, would need to be achieved in order to accommodate proper actuation of thumb safety.", "text": "Remington 19555 1911 Grip Panels With a beautiful rosewood laminate finish, these Remington 1911 grips provide a unique upgrade to your Remington Model 1911 R1 handgun, or any standard size 1911 style pistol. Providing added comfort and stability, the Remington 1911 Grips feature double diamond checkering with the \"R\" medallion inlaid in handle.Note: Rosewood Grips will not fit Remington 1911 R1 Enhanced Models. Minor fitting, modifying the length of top left grip, would need to be achieved in order to accommodate proper actuation of thumb safety.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J5KcYL1cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044XL3SM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 34.51}}
