{"item_id": "B0044YGCA0", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Small Punch Roll for Armorer's Tools", "description": "The Small Punch Roll is exactly that; a small punch roll made of 600 Denier Nylon, designed to house up to (14) punches or similar armorer’s tools. When combined with the Soft Armorer’s Case or the Large Armorer’s Roll, it provides additional space, organization, extra protection for the punches and other small armorer tools.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Small Punch Roll for Armorer's Tools The Small Punch Roll is exactly that; a small punch roll made of 600 Denier Nylon, designed to house up to (14) punches or similar armorer’s tools. When combined with the Soft Armorer’s Case or the Large Armorer’s Roll, it provides additional space, organization, extra protection for the punches and other small armorer tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Br0gVpldL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044YGCA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 5.2}}
{"item_id": "B0044YIJVK", "title": "Black 120 lb Crossbow", "description": "Bolt Arrows at High Speeds with This Easily Cocked Crossbow. This model is similar to the CB65, but shoots a faster arrow with 120 pounds of pressure. It’s still lightweight and accurate, but for the more skilled crossbow master. 185 fps, 11.5” power stroke, 3.63 pounds, 31” in length, 26” wide, fiberglass with aluminum barrel, and 14” aluminum bolt recommended.", "text": "Black 120 lb Crossbow Bolt Arrows at High Speeds with This Easily Cocked Crossbow. This model is similar to the CB65, but shoots a faster arrow with 120 pounds of pressure. It’s still lightweight and accurate, but for the more skilled crossbow master. 185 fps, 11.5” power stroke, 3.63 pounds, 31” in length, 26” wide, fiberglass with aluminum barrel, and 14” aluminum bolt recommended.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PgpfUFTtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044YIJVK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 68.81}}
{"item_id": "B0044YIKM8", "title": "Glock Hat AP70211", "description": "The long awaited Glock Fleece Beanie has arrived! Glock Perfection microfleece beanie is one size fits most and sports an embroidered Glock Perfection logo.", "text": "Glock Hat AP70211 The long awaited Glock Fleece Beanie has arrived! Glock Perfection microfleece beanie is one size fits most and sports an embroidered Glock Perfection logo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TDrRLkIeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044YIKM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 13.55}}
