{"item_id": "B0044YJE64", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 6 Chamber Safety Tool-Pistol", "description": "The Chamber Safety Tool for the pistol is specially designed to fit in the chamber of your pistol. As a chamber flag, this tools yellow color clearly shows that the weapon is unloaded. Comes with a strengthened head for increased durability. In addition to serving as a chamber flag, the flattened edge on the corner of the head allows you to adjust the wind age and elevation of your scope. This tool also works great in .22 caliber rifles. Also available for shotguns and rifles.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse Pack of 6 Chamber Safety Tool-Pistol The Chamber Safety Tool for the pistol is specially designed to fit in the chamber of your pistol. As a chamber flag, this tools yellow color clearly shows that the weapon is unloaded. Comes with a strengthened head for increased durability. In addition to serving as a chamber flag, the flattened edge on the corner of the head allows you to adjust the wind age and elevation of your scope. This tool also works great in .22 caliber rifles. Also available for shotguns and rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312wyta6CzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044YJE64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.15}}
{"item_id": "B0044Z28KM", "title": "Spyderco Kiwi3 Stainless Steel PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Spyderco Kiwi3 combines everything that's great about traditional old-world non-locking penknives with the technology of high-performing 21st-century blades. The Kiwi3 is equipped with an affable 2-inch 8Cr13MoV hollow-ground steel blade in a classically shaped Wharncliffe design, with a Spyderco round hole that makes the knife look almost bird-like. Above the hole sits a spine cusp, giving you a slip-resistant spot to place your thumb or index finger to increase precision and control while you cut.Classified as a non-locking folding knife, the Kiwi3 features a slip-joint pivot that resists closing, keeping the knife blade safely open while in use. Spyderco also added two deep-cut finger indentations in the handle's underbelly. The first positions the index finger in line behind the cutting edge. By acting as a stop, your finger keeps the blade from inadvertently closing. The second indent--cut just behind the first--accommodates the middle finger. Both indents improve your control and dexterity while gripping the knife. Finally, the Kiwi3 includes a stainless handle that's contoured and chamfered for pinch-free cutting. The handle is clipless with a lanyard for lacing a thong or leather strap.SpecificationsBlade: 8Cr13MoV steelHandle: Stainless steelHole diameter: 0.375 inchesBlade length: 2.438 inchesCutting edge: 2 inchesBlade thickness: 0.093 inchesClosed length: 3.313 inchesOpen length: 5.625 inchesWeight: 1.75 ounces", "text": "Spyderco Kiwi3 Stainless Steel PlainEdge Knife The Spyderco Kiwi3 combines everything that's great about traditional old-world non-locking penknives with the technology of high-performing 21st-century blades. The Kiwi3 is equipped with an affable 2-inch 8Cr13MoV hollow-ground steel blade in a classically shaped Wharncliffe design, with a Spyderco round hole that makes the knife look almost bird-like. Above the hole sits a spine cusp, giving you a slip-resistant spot to place your thumb or index finger to increase precision and control while you cut.Classified as a non-locking folding knife, the Kiwi3 features a slip-joint pivot that resists closing, keeping the knife blade safely open while in use. Spyderco also added two deep-cut finger indentations in the handle's underbelly. The first positions the index finger in line behind the cutting edge. By acting as a stop, your finger keeps the blade from inadvertently closing. The second indent--cut just behind the first--accommodates the middle finger. Both indents improve your control and dexterity while gripping the knife. Finally, the Kiwi3 includes a stainless handle that's contoured and chamfered for pinch-free cutting. The handle is clipless with a lanyard for lacing a thong or leather strap.SpecificationsBlade: 8Cr13MoV steelHandle: Stainless steelHole diameter: 0.375 inchesBlade length: 2.438 inchesCutting edge: 2 inchesBlade thickness: 0.093 inchesClosed length: 3.313 inchesOpen length: 5.625 inchesWeight: 1.75 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TR5ga2OJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044Z28KM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 20.97}}
{"item_id": "B0044Z5AAC", "title": "Slipstream Weapon Lubricant Set", "description": "You know our Slipstream oil. You've used Slipstream grease as well. Now we bring you our nano-tech oil and grease on one package. We found a synthetic oil that has fantastic lubrication properties, and as a side effect, offers great corrosion protection. We found a grease perfect for firearms. Those are only carriers for the true lubricant. When combined with our proprietary nano-lubricant you get a firearm lube like no other. Slipstream offers: Enhanced Lubrication, smoother action, increased longevity, increased reliability, while offering superior corrosion resistance. No other weapon lubricant reduces friction like Slipstream. Nothing.", "text": "Slipstream Weapon Lubricant Set You know our Slipstream oil. You've used Slipstream grease as well. Now we bring you our nano-tech oil and grease on one package. We found a synthetic oil that has fantastic lubrication properties, and as a side effect, offers great corrosion protection. We found a grease perfect for firearms. Those are only carriers for the true lubricant. When combined with our proprietary nano-lubricant you get a firearm lube like no other. Slipstream offers: Enhanced Lubrication, smoother action, increased longevity, increased reliability, while offering superior corrosion resistance. No other weapon lubricant reduces friction like Slipstream. Nothing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BAAiPOidL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0044Z5AAC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00450FLAU", "title": "Super Blast 7218 Pump Air Horn", "description": "Super Blast Pump Air Horn shots a powerful blast of noise. Meets U.S. Coast Guard requirements for boats up to 65 feet/20 meters. Perfect for auto, boat, sporting events and more. Easy to use. No harmful gases. No refills required.", "text": "Super Blast 7218 Pump Air Horn Super Blast Pump Air Horn shots a powerful blast of noise. Meets U.S. Coast Guard requirements for boats up to 65 feet/20 meters. Perfect for auto, boat, sporting events and more. Easy to use. No harmful gases. No refills required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51--4J8NaUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00450FLAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Max Professional", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Horns"]], "price": 8.93}}
{"item_id": "B00450LEVU", "title": "Penn Battle Spinning Reel", "description": "Monster hunters: Penn Battle Spinning Reels. 8 sizes to choose from. Penn Battle Reels are workhorses geared for heavy-duty: Full metal body and sideplates keep precise gear alignment under heavy loads; Superline spool - no backing needed because the rubber gasket keeps superline from slipping; Machined and anodized aluminum spool; HT-100 drag washers provide smooth drag under heavy loads; Stainless steel main shaft; 6 stainless steel ball bearings for smooth performance; Infinite anti-reverse bearing; Techno-balanced rotor gives smooth retrieves; Machined and anodized aluminum handle with soft touch knob. State Model. Order yours today! Model No.: BTL1000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 180/2, 115/4, 80/6; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 160/6, 130/8, 115/10; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 7 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.2:1; Weight: 8 ozs. Model No.: BTL2000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 260/4, 210/6, 140/8; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 260/8, 225/10, 170/15; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 7 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 9 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL3000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 250/6, 170/8, 140/10; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 275/10, 205/15, 170/20; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 10 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 11 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL4000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 280/8, 230/10, 170/12; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 335/15, 275/20, 205/30; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 13 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 12 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL5000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 250/12, 220/15, 190/17; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 405/20, 305/30, 250/40; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 20 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.6:1; Weight: 20 ozs. Model No.: BTL6000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 320/15, 280/17, 220/20; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 445/30, 365/40, 310/50; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 20 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.6:1; Weight: 22 ozs. Model No.: BTL7000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 390/17, 310/20, 280/25; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 505/40, 430/50, 360/65; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 25 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.3:1; Weight: 28 ozs. Model No.: BTL8", "text": "Penn Battle Spinning Reel Monster hunters: Penn Battle Spinning Reels. 8 sizes to choose from. Penn Battle Reels are workhorses geared for heavy-duty: Full metal body and sideplates keep precise gear alignment under heavy loads; Superline spool - no backing needed because the rubber gasket keeps superline from slipping; Machined and anodized aluminum spool; HT-100 drag washers provide smooth drag under heavy loads; Stainless steel main shaft; 6 stainless steel ball bearings for smooth performance; Infinite anti-reverse bearing; Techno-balanced rotor gives smooth retrieves; Machined and anodized aluminum handle with soft touch knob. State Model. Order yours today! Model No.: BTL1000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 180/2, 115/4, 80/6; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 160/6, 130/8, 115/10; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 7 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.2:1; Weight: 8 ozs. Model No.: BTL2000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 260/4, 210/6, 140/8; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 260/8, 225/10, 170/15; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 7 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 9 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL3000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 250/6, 170/8, 140/10; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 275/10, 205/15, 170/20; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 10 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 11 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL4000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 280/8, 230/10, 170/12; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 335/15, 275/20, 205/30; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 13 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 6.2:1; Weight: 12 1/2 ozs. Model No.: BTL5000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 250/12, 220/15, 190/17; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 405/20, 305/30, 250/40; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 20 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.6:1; Weight: 20 ozs. Model No.: BTL6000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 320/15, 280/17, 220/20; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 445/30, 365/40, 310/50; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 20 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.6:1; Weight: 22 ozs. Model No.: BTL7000; Mono Line Cap. (yds./lb.): 390/17, 310/20, 280/25; Braid Line Cap. (yds./lb.: 505/40, 430/50, 360/65; Bearings: 6+1; Max. Drag: 25 lbs.; Gear Ratio: 5.3:1; Weight: 28 ozs. Model No.: BTL8", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jqxgSSlcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00450LEVU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004510DF2", "title": "Stamina InMotion Manual Treadmill (Pewter Grey, Black)", "description": "The InMotion T900 Manual Treadmill from Stamina offers an economical running or walking workout without relying on an electric motor. With dual weighted flywheels, the T900 is built to deliver a smooth workout at a walk or run--while you set the pace. Meanwhile, the fitness monitor tracks your distance, workout time, speed, and calories burned. Two incline positions of 10 and 8 degrees offer additional challenge while padded side and front rails provide as-needed support. With no electric outlet necessary and no motor to maintain, you can use this treadmill anywhere. The steel frame folds to a 17 by 22-inch footprint and the built-in wheels allow you to roll it into a corner or closet with ease.Key Features:Dual weighted flywheels for smooth operationTwo incline positions: 10 and 8 degreesElectronic monitor tracks workout time, speed, distance, calories burned, and scans with simple, one-button controlTextured, non-slip walking/jogging surfaceFoam padded front and side railsSturdy steel frame folds for storageBuilt-in wheels for portabilitySkid-resistant rubber floor protectors maximize stabilityUse anywhere-no electricity neededSpecifications:Running belt dimensions: 41 by 12 3/8 inches (L x W)Overall dimensions: 47 by 22 by 45 inches (L x W x H)Folded footprint: 17 x 22 inchesMaximum user weight: 225 poundsSome assembly requiredOne-year frame warranty90-day parts warranty", "text": "Stamina InMotion Manual Treadmill (Pewter Grey, Black) The InMotion T900 Manual Treadmill from Stamina offers an economical running or walking workout without relying on an electric motor. With dual weighted flywheels, the T900 is built to deliver a smooth workout at a walk or run--while you set the pace. Meanwhile, the fitness monitor tracks your distance, workout time, speed, and calories burned. Two incline positions of 10 and 8 degrees offer additional challenge while padded side and front rails provide as-needed support. With no electric outlet necessary and no motor to maintain, you can use this treadmill anywhere. The steel frame folds to a 17 by 22-inch footprint and the built-in wheels allow you to roll it into a corner or closet with ease.Key Features:Dual weighted flywheels for smooth operationTwo incline positions: 10 and 8 degreesElectronic monitor tracks workout time, speed, distance, calories burned, and scans with simple, one-button controlTextured, non-slip walking/jogging surfaceFoam padded front and side railsSturdy steel frame folds for storageBuilt-in wheels for portabilitySkid-resistant rubber floor protectors maximize stabilityUse anywhere-no electricity neededSpecifications:Running belt dimensions: 41 by 12 3/8 inches (L x W)Overall dimensions: 47 by 22 by 45 inches (L x W x H)Folded footprint: 17 x 22 inchesMaximum user weight: 225 poundsSome assembly requiredOne-year frame warranty90-day parts warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31O6eWlwSiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004510DF2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stamina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 83.85}}
