{"item_id": "B00452XJ4S", "title": "Therm-a-Rest Trail Scout Mattress", "description": "The new 2011 Trail Scout is an ideal value for first-time campers and those looking to upgrade from closed cell foam pads. It's designed for light backpacking, car camping, summer camps, and adding essential warmth to cots. A streamlined shape keeps the weight and size down while a generous, 1.25-inch foam core and supple exterior molds to your contours for a great night's rest. Includes stuff sack.Specifications:Medium3.7 R-valueOne-pound, six-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-1.25-by-66 inches (W x H x D)1,320-cubic-inch volumeRegular3.7 R-valueOne-pound, eight-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-1.25-by-72 inches (W x H x D)1,440-cubic-inch volumeLarge3.7 R-valueTwo-pound weightMeasures 25-by-1.25-by-77 inches (W x H x D)1,925-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest Trail Scout Mattress The new 2011 Trail Scout is an ideal value for first-time campers and those looking to upgrade from closed cell foam pads. It's designed for light backpacking, car camping, summer camps, and adding essential warmth to cots. A streamlined shape keeps the weight and size down while a generous, 1.25-inch foam core and supple exterior molds to your contours for a great night's rest. Includes stuff sack.Specifications:Medium3.7 R-valueOne-pound, six-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-1.25-by-66 inches (W x H x D)1,320-cubic-inch volumeRegular3.7 R-valueOne-pound, eight-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-1.25-by-72 inches (W x H x D)1,440-cubic-inch volumeLarge3.7 R-valueTwo-pound weightMeasures 25-by-1.25-by-77 inches (W x H x D)1,925-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411KcB82q8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00452XJ4S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Equestrian Sports", "Tack"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00452XJAC", "title": "Therm-a-Rest Trail Seat Self-Inflating Seat Cushion", "description": "An easy-open valve lets the cushion self-inflate in just seconds.Sit more comfortably just about anywhere with this all-purpose, self-inflating seat cushion. Lightweight and compact, it fits easily in your pack or duffel and is ideal in a car, boat, camp, or stadium seat.Specifications:4.2 R-valueFive-ounce weightMeasures 12-by-1.25-by-16 inches (W x H x D)Urethane foam fill materialLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest Trail Seat Self-Inflating Seat Cushion An easy-open valve lets the cushion self-inflate in just seconds.Sit more comfortably just about anywhere with this all-purpose, self-inflating seat cushion. Lightweight and compact, it fits easily in your pack or duffel and is ideal in a car, boat, camp, or stadium seat.Specifications:4.2 R-valueFive-ounce weightMeasures 12-by-1.25-by-16 inches (W x H x D)Urethane foam fill materialLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J2dlW7-aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00452XJAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 52.96}}
{"item_id": "B00452YXQG", "title": "Therm-a-Rest NeoAir Trekker Mattress", "description": "The surprisingly light and compact NeoAir Trekker air mattress offers exceptional comfort, durability and versatility. Patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix technology creates over 100 internal cells to provide ample three-season warmth without the bulk of added insulation, while providing a stable night's rest. The rugged polyester bottom boosts all-purpose durability and a supple polyester top is designed for those seeking to trim weight without sacrificing comfort. Stuff sack included.Features:Superior Stability:Patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix construction creates over 100 internal cells that equalize air distribution for unmatched stabilityEfficient Warmth:Internal cells trap heat and slow convective heat loss without the unnecessary weight or bulk of synthetic or down fillCompact and Light:Manual inflation, advanced materials, and fiberless insulation assure the lightest and most compact mattress possibleLasting Performance:Rugged, 100-denier polyester bottom and soft, 75-denier top assure maximum versatility with the durability and comfort to handle a wide range of usesSpecifications:RegularR-value of 2One-pound, four-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-2.5-by-72 inches (W x H x D)3,600-cubic-inch volumeLargeR-value of 2One-pound, ten-ounce weightMeasures 25-by-2.5-by-77 inches (W x H x D)4,813-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest NeoAir Trekker Mattress The surprisingly light and compact NeoAir Trekker air mattress offers exceptional comfort, durability and versatility. Patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix technology creates over 100 internal cells to provide ample three-season warmth without the bulk of added insulation, while providing a stable night's rest. The rugged polyester bottom boosts all-purpose durability and a supple polyester top is designed for those seeking to trim weight without sacrificing comfort. Stuff sack included.Features:Superior Stability:Patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix construction creates over 100 internal cells that equalize air distribution for unmatched stabilityEfficient Warmth:Internal cells trap heat and slow convective heat loss without the unnecessary weight or bulk of synthetic or down fillCompact and Light:Manual inflation, advanced materials, and fiberless insulation assure the lightest and most compact mattress possibleLasting Performance:Rugged, 100-denier polyester bottom and soft, 75-denier top assure maximum versatility with the durability and comfort to handle a wide range of usesSpecifications:RegularR-value of 2One-pound, four-ounce weightMeasures 20-by-2.5-by-72 inches (W x H x D)3,600-cubic-inch volumeLargeR-value of 2One-pound, ten-ounce weightMeasures 25-by-2.5-by-77 inches (W x H x D)4,813-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tSfcb1MxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00452YXQG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004531HQO", "title": "Dock-Rite Ribbed Twin-Eye Fender", "description": "The Last Fender You'll Ever Need! Premium ribbed fenders made from the finest grade marine vinyl with a high-gloss finish. Soft and durable, with one-piece construction and rubber inflation valve. Choose from the Twin-Eye or Center HTM (Hole-Through-Middle) styles.", "text": "Dock-Rite Ribbed Twin-Eye Fender The Last Fender You'll Ever Need! Premium ribbed fenders made from the finest grade marine vinyl with a high-gloss finish. Soft and durable, with one-piece construction and rubber inflation valve. Choose from the Twin-Eye or Center HTM (Hole-Through-Middle) styles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iUEE-5ChL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004531HQO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Boat Fenders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004532EK2", "title": "Therm-a-Rest Down Pillow", "description": "Ultralight, compressible and ultra comfortable, our new Down Pillow travel easy and feature luxurious 650 fill goose down in a soft, brushed polyester cover. A perimeter drawcord can be used to compress it, and alternately creates a pocket that can be stuffed with extra clothing to customize firmness.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest Down Pillow Ultralight, compressible and ultra comfortable, our new Down Pillow travel easy and feature luxurious 650 fill goose down in a soft, brushed polyester cover. A perimeter drawcord can be used to compress it, and alternately creates a pocket that can be stuffed with extra clothing to customize firmness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gA%2BBmXiML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004532EK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004532G9Q", "title": "Therm-a-Rest RidgeRest SOLite Sleeping Pad", "description": "The original RidgeRest sleeping pad has been a popular seller for decades, providing lightweight comfort and added insulation with three-season air mattresses.Now improved with a patent-pending, aluminized Solar coating, the RidgeRest SOLite offers a 10% boost in warmth with improved durability from surface wear and tear, all without notable weight gain. It's an ideal sleep comfort solution for everything from extreme, high-altitude climbing to entry-level backpacking.Features:Advanced Warmth:Aluminized surface boosts warmth, reflecting heat back to your bodyLight and Durable:Virtually indestructible and light enough to carry anywhereUnique Design:Soft peaks and heat-trapping valleys provide exceptional comfortSpecifications:Small2.8 R-valueNine-ounce weightMeasures 6.6-by-6.2-by-19.2-inches (W x H D)Regular2.8 R-valueOne-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 7.28-by-7.28-by-20.08-inches (W x H D)Large2.8 R-valueOne-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 7.75-by-7.75-by-25.25-inches (W x H D)Lifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest RidgeRest SOLite Sleeping Pad The original RidgeRest sleeping pad has been a popular seller for decades, providing lightweight comfort and added insulation with three-season air mattresses.Now improved with a patent-pending, aluminized Solar coating, the RidgeRest SOLite offers a 10% boost in warmth with improved durability from surface wear and tear, all without notable weight gain. It's an ideal sleep comfort solution for everything from extreme, high-altitude climbing to entry-level backpacking.Features:Advanced Warmth:Aluminized surface boosts warmth, reflecting heat back to your bodyLight and Durable:Virtually indestructible and light enough to carry anywhereUnique Design:Soft peaks and heat-trapping valleys provide exceptional comfortSpecifications:Small2.8 R-valueNine-ounce weightMeasures 6.6-by-6.2-by-19.2-inches (W x H D)Regular2.8 R-valueOne-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 7.28-by-7.28-by-20.08-inches (W x H D)Large2.8 R-valueOne-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 7.75-by-7.75-by-25.25-inches (W x H D)Lifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers, Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs, who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xHYwcthmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004532G9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00453JT8M", "title": "Fos Mora Sweden Morakniv 748 Long Clip Sandvik Blade Knife", "description": "It has an extra long blade and a patterned high-friction grip. The handle is ergonomically designed to faciltates work and has substantial finger protection. Measures 10 3/4\" overall, with 5 3/4\"lond clip blade made of cold-rolled special swedish stainless steel from Sandvik. Comes with black plastic sheath. New from factory in bulk package.", "text": "Fos Mora Sweden Morakniv 748 Long Clip Sandvik Blade Knife It has an extra long blade and a patterned high-friction grip. The handle is ergonomically designed to faciltates work and has substantial finger protection. Measures 10 3/4\" overall, with 5 3/4\"lond clip blade made of cold-rolled special swedish stainless steel from Sandvik. Comes with black plastic sheath. New from factory in bulk package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uF8t8lNkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453JT8M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B00453MQXC", "title": "MSR Alpine Dish Brush / Scraper", "description": "The SPECS Weight: .8 oz / 22 g Packed Size: 3.2\" x 2.7\" x 0.5\" / 8.1 x 6.9 x 1.3 cm This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "MSR Alpine Dish Brush / Scraper The SPECS Weight: .8 oz / 22 g Packed Size: 3.2\" x 2.7\" x 0.5\" / 8.1 x 6.9 x 1.3 cm This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lZaBLI-8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453MQXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B00453N7JY", "title": "Therm-A-Rest Lumbar Pillow", "description": "Updated for 2014: Drawing on our pressure mapping technology, the Lumbar Pillow features die-cut foam down the center to reduce pressure along the spine, while maintaining density on the sides for the lateral support. It's self-inflating to allow a personalized level of support and can be adjusted with one hand to add critical comfort to bad seats anywhere.", "text": "Therm-A-Rest Lumbar Pillow Updated for 2014: Drawing on our pressure mapping technology, the Lumbar Pillow features die-cut foam down the center to reduce pressure along the spine, while maintaining density on the sides for the lateral support. It's self-inflating to allow a personalized level of support and can be adjusted with one hand to add critical comfort to bad seats anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PdBlSu0iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453N7JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00453N8H0", "title": "Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion", "description": "FEATURES of the Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion Drawing on our experience\"the medical seating industry, the Travel Cushion offers both back and leg support to relieve ischial spine pressure, making long drives and flights more enjoyable Self inflating top and bottom pads allow a fine-tuned adjustment and pack easily\"carryons for life on the go SPECIFICATIONS of the Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion Dimension: 10.5 x 16.5\" / 27 x 42 cm Weight: 4 oz / 120 g Thickness: 2\" / 5 cm", "text": "Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion FEATURES of the Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion Drawing on our experience\"the medical seating industry, the Travel Cushion offers both back and leg support to relieve ischial spine pressure, making long drives and flights more enjoyable Self inflating top and bottom pads allow a fine-tuned adjustment and pack easily\"carryons for life on the go SPECIFICATIONS of the Therm-A-Rest Travel Cushion Dimension: 10.5 x 16.5\" / 27 x 42 cm Weight: 4 oz / 120 g Thickness: 2\" / 5 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eUxLBSbyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453N8H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B00453QNNG", "title": "MSR Alpine Salt And Pepper Shaker", "description": "The SPECS Weight: .3 oz / 9.4 g Packed Size: 3.75 x 0.9 x 0.9\" / 9.5 x 2.3 x 2.3 cm This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "MSR Alpine Salt And Pepper Shaker The SPECS Weight: .3 oz / 9.4 g Packed Size: 3.75 x 0.9 x 0.9\" / 9.5 x 2.3 x 2.3 cm This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TVXNp3yWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453QNNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B00453R308", "title": "Platypus GravityWorks 4 L Complete Water Filter Kit", "description": "MSR's GravityWorks™ 4L Water Filter provides storage and filtration, delivering four liters of filtered water is just 2.5 minutes with no pumping- there's simply no easier or faster way to get safe water away from home even the most challenging situations. Ideal for bigger groups, the system's eight-liter capacity eliminates both the worry and hassle of keeping plenty of water around. Dispenses on demand for cooking, cleaning, and more. Just fill up the \"dirty\" reservoir and hang it above the \"clean\" reservoir. Water passes through the filter cartridge to provide clean, drinkable water. Meets all EPA & NSF guidelines for the removal of Bacteria and Protozoa, including Giardia, Cryptosporidium, E. Coli, Salmonella and Cholera.Clean storage reservoir with shutoff clamp makes dispensing water a breeze.Create a custom system to meet your personal needs by adding accessories.Not effective against viruses.Filter media: Hollow Fiber.Filter pore size: .2 microns.Flow (L/min) 1.75 liters per min.Cartridge life: 1501 liters.Includes: 4 L Dirty Collection Reservoir and 4 L Clean water Reservoir, Gravityworks Filter Cartridge, and hoses.Size: Width 3 in / 8 cm.Weight: 10.75 oz.", "text": "Platypus GravityWorks 4 L Complete Water Filter Kit MSR's GravityWorks™ 4L Water Filter provides storage and filtration, delivering four liters of filtered water is just 2.5 minutes with no pumping- there's simply no easier or faster way to get safe water away from home even the most challenging situations. Ideal for bigger groups, the system's eight-liter capacity eliminates both the worry and hassle of keeping plenty of water around. Dispenses on demand for cooking, cleaning, and more. Just fill up the \"dirty\" reservoir and hang it above the \"clean\" reservoir. Water passes through the filter cartridge to provide clean, drinkable water. Meets all EPA & NSF guidelines for the removal of Bacteria and Protozoa, including Giardia, Cryptosporidium, E. Coli, Salmonella and Cholera.Clean storage reservoir with shutoff clamp makes dispensing water a breeze.Create a custom system to meet your personal needs by adding accessories.Not effective against viruses.Filter media: Hollow Fiber.Filter pore size: .2 microns.Flow (L/min) 1.75 liters per min.Cartridge life: 1501 liters.Includes: 4 L Dirty Collection Reservoir and 4 L Clean water Reservoir, Gravityworks Filter Cartridge, and hoses.Size: Width 3 in / 8 cm.Weight: 10.75 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qXK3nHLnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453R308.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Platypus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 119.95}}
