{"item_id": "B00453SHDA", "title": "MSR Alpine Spice Shaker", "description": "MSR's Alpine™ Spice Shaker is a tough, BPA-free chamber that accommodates dry spices, and rubber gaskets on all openings keep moisture at bay. Packed Size 3.75 x 0.9 x 0.9 in / 9.5 x 2.3 x 2.3 cm. Weight .2 oz / 6.2 g.", "text": "MSR Alpine Spice Shaker MSR's Alpine™ Spice Shaker is a tough, BPA-free chamber that accommodates dry spices, and rubber gaskets on all openings keep moisture at bay. Packed Size 3.75 x 0.9 x 0.9 in / 9.5 x 2.3 x 2.3 cm. Weight .2 oz / 6.2 g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W3TF6c55L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453SHDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 4.13}}
{"item_id": "B00453UJMM", "title": "MSR Universal Canister Stand", "description": "The Universal Canister Stand delivers added stability and safety when cooking with canister stoves, and adapts to fit just about any fuel canister you might find while traversing the globe. The broad base increases stability of canister-mounted stoves for improved safety while cooking. Universal fit, single-point, spring-loaded adjustment ensures a fast, easy and reliable fit to most fuel canisters world-wide. Ultralight and compact with minimal weight and collapsible design makes it an essential addition to any trip. Durable: Made of stainless steel and ABS plastic.Packed Size 5.4 x 1 x 0.8 in / 13.7 x 2.5 x 2 cm. Weight: 1.2 oz / 34.4 g.", "text": "MSR Universal Canister Stand The Universal Canister Stand delivers added stability and safety when cooking with canister stoves, and adapts to fit just about any fuel canister you might find while traversing the globe. The broad base increases stability of canister-mounted stoves for improved safety while cooking. Universal fit, single-point, spring-loaded adjustment ensures a fast, easy and reliable fit to most fuel canisters world-wide. Ultralight and compact with minimal weight and collapsible design makes it an essential addition to any trip. Durable: Made of stainless steel and ABS plastic.Packed Size 5.4 x 1 x 0.8 in / 13.7 x 2.5 x 2 cm. Weight: 1.2 oz / 34.4 g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W8tAxPHXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00453UJMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 14.95}}
