{"item_id": "B00455CLVC", "title": "Quad Magazine Pouch for 9mm, 40 & 45", "description": "This is a brand new magazine pouch, previously only available at retail gun shops. It will comfortably carry four single or double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 18 rounds. This pouches will attach to your belt using dual belt loops in the back.", "text": "Quad Magazine Pouch for 9mm, 40 & 45 This is a brand new magazine pouch, previously only available at retail gun shops. It will comfortably carry four single or double stacked magazines in any of the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 18 rounds. This pouches will attach to your belt using dual belt loops in the back.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510-JzYd-9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00455CLVC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B00455F2GI", "title": "Tri-Fold Golf Towel", "description": "Tri-Fold Golf Towels - The Tri-Fold Golf Towels make an excellent addition to any golfer's bag. This towel is a 100 percent cotton terry cloth towel that comes with a grommet and bag clip to attach easily to any golfer's bag, and can be personalized or embroidered with a logo. The Tri-Fold Golf Towel makes a great gift for any golfer in your family or as tournament giveaway.", "text": "Tri-Fold Golf Towel Tri-Fold Golf Towels - The Tri-Fold Golf Towels make an excellent addition to any golfer's bag. This towel is a 100 percent cotton terry cloth towel that comes with a grommet and bag clip to attach easily to any golfer's bag, and can be personalized or embroidered with a logo. The Tri-Fold Golf Towel makes a great gift for any golfer in your family or as tournament giveaway.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51No3cdCImL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00455F2GI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Towels"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B00455OP5M", "title": "Giro Ionos Road Racing Helmet (Medium, Matte Black/Red )", "description": "The coolest helmet in the peleton - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "text": "Giro Ionos Road Racing Helmet (Medium, Matte Black/Red ) The coolest helmet in the peleton - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514ZBF9rNIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00455OP5M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00457SRBI", "title": "Heavy Duty CQB RED dot sight sighting system Red and Green Illumination with 4 reticle to choose from", "description": "Magnification: 1x Objective lens: 30mm Reticle: Green Dot 6MOA Exit pupil: 23mm Optical coating: Fully coated Field of view: 54 feet @ 100 yards Eye relief: Unlimited Adjustment knob: Side windage and elevation Elevation: Black matte Length: 6 inches Weight: 12.8 ounces", "text": "Heavy Duty CQB RED dot sight sighting system Red and Green Illumination with 4 reticle to choose from Magnification: 1x Objective lens: 30mm Reticle: Green Dot 6MOA Exit pupil: 23mm Optical coating: Fully coated Field of view: 54 feet @ 100 yards Eye relief: Unlimited Adjustment knob: Side windage and elevation Elevation: Black matte Length: 6 inches Weight: 12.8 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BIXbkVKLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00457SRBI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FieldSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 21.75}}
{"item_id": "B00459INNS", "title": "EZ Bike Stand", "description": "As a rider, you know how hard it is to find a way to balance your bike. This bike stand avoids the need to balance your bike by leaning it against cars, walls, or rough surfaces. It also makes it easy to change a wheel, pump up a tire, lube a chain, or clean your bike. This bike stand is engineered to be stable and durable. The spoke-saving technology holds the bike by the tire without touching the bike spokes, providing extra protection for your bike. With the turn of a knob, adjust the stand to custom fit your road, triathlon, cyclocross, tandem, recumbent, or mountain bike. This bike stand expands to 2.75 inches and weighs a little over 5 pounds, making it especially sturdy, yet light enough to be easily transported. Dimensions are 18 inches (length) x 12 inches (width) x 8 inches (height).", "text": "EZ Bike Stand As a rider, you know how hard it is to find a way to balance your bike. This bike stand avoids the need to balance your bike by leaning it against cars, walls, or rough surfaces. It also makes it easy to change a wheel, pump up a tire, lube a chain, or clean your bike. This bike stand is engineered to be stable and durable. The spoke-saving technology holds the bike by the tire without touching the bike spokes, providing extra protection for your bike. With the turn of a knob, adjust the stand to custom fit your road, triathlon, cyclocross, tandem, recumbent, or mountain bike. This bike stand expands to 2.75 inches and weighs a little over 5 pounds, making it especially sturdy, yet light enough to be easily transported. Dimensions are 18 inches (length) x 12 inches (width) x 8 inches (height).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Qf8LuNdgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00459INNS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B0045DEOYG", "title": "Geigerrig In-Line Water Filter", "description": "GEIGERRIG'S Pressurized Hydration bladder pushes the water through the inline water filter allowing you to drink fresh spring water while you are on the go. Yes, carrying a 5oz water filter on your backpacking trip is easier than loading your pack with water bottles and bladders. In-Line Portable Water Filter. 5.5-Inch Long X 1 In. Diameter. Easily carried in our hydration packs. 1.5oz If you want to save weight on your backpacking trip then the GEIGERRIG in-line water filter will help. Rated to Filter Up To 50 -Gallons of water filtration-You now have a much greater range while hiking. 50 -Gallons can take you a long way Removes 99.9-Percent Cryptospordium and Giardia-Your hydration pack now protects you when you need to refill in the field on the hiking trail or on a two week backpacking trip. Activated Coconut Shell Carbon reduces waterborne chemicals, improves taste and eliminates offensive odors the Mirigard Antimicrobial Technology Suppresses the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold and mildew within the filter media. Compatible with Geigerrig Pressurized Hydration systems only.", "text": "Geigerrig In-Line Water Filter GEIGERRIG'S Pressurized Hydration bladder pushes the water through the inline water filter allowing you to drink fresh spring water while you are on the go. Yes, carrying a 5oz water filter on your backpacking trip is easier than loading your pack with water bottles and bladders. In-Line Portable Water Filter. 5.5-Inch Long X 1 In. Diameter. Easily carried in our hydration packs. 1.5oz If you want to save weight on your backpacking trip then the GEIGERRIG in-line water filter will help. Rated to Filter Up To 50 -Gallons of water filtration-You now have a much greater range while hiking. 50 -Gallons can take you a long way Removes 99.9-Percent Cryptospordium and Giardia-Your hydration pack now protects you when you need to refill in the field on the hiking trail or on a two week backpacking trip. Activated Coconut Shell Carbon reduces waterborne chemicals, improves taste and eliminates offensive odors the Mirigard Antimicrobial Technology Suppresses the growth of bacteria, algae, fungus, mold and mildew within the filter media. Compatible with Geigerrig Pressurized Hydration systems only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PgH4r9M9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045DEOYG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Geigerrig", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 22.46}}
{"item_id": "B0045DETW8", "title": "Rawlings Player Preferred 9.5-inch Youth Infield/Outfield Baseball Glove (PP95DP)", "description": "The new Rawlings Savage youth gloves are sure to be a hit this season! For players that are still early in their baseball careers, the Savage Series provides a comfortable fit with soft material. Made from cowhide split shell leather, the Savage Series is super soft and super easy to close. The Neo-Flex Conventional Back makes squeezing the ball easy, no matter how much strength your young fielder has. Plus, Rawlings new 3D Web technology has way more give than conventional webs, making it more likely that the ball will stick in the glove! The Savage features an adjustable Velcro wrist strap that ensures a custom fit on any small size hand, and the cushioned palm pad ensures that hand will be protected.", "text": "Rawlings Player Preferred 9.5-inch Youth Infield/Outfield Baseball Glove (PP95DP) The new Rawlings Savage youth gloves are sure to be a hit this season! For players that are still early in their baseball careers, the Savage Series provides a comfortable fit with soft material. Made from cowhide split shell leather, the Savage Series is super soft and super easy to close. The Neo-Flex Conventional Back makes squeezing the ball easy, no matter how much strength your young fielder has. Plus, Rawlings new 3D Web technology has way more give than conventional webs, making it more likely that the ball will stick in the glove! The Savage features an adjustable Velcro wrist strap that ensures a custom fit on any small size hand, and the cushioned palm pad ensures that hand will be protected.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518cKZnsY0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045DETW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rawlings", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Infielder's Gloves"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B0045E6FK6", "title": "Okuma Trio High Speed Spinning Reel, Black/Orange", "description": "Trio spinning reels from Okuma offer a unique crossover construction. The solid one-piece stamped aluminum reel stern and rotor arm are paired with lightweight graphite side plates, providing strength where needed and weight savings where possible. The spool construction houses the drags system in an aluminum drag chamber for added stability and smoothness.", "text": "Okuma Trio High Speed Spinning Reel, Black/Orange Trio spinning reels from Okuma offer a unique crossover construction. The solid one-piece stamped aluminum reel stern and rotor arm are paired with lightweight graphite side plates, providing strength where needed and weight savings where possible. The spool construction houses the drags system in an aluminum drag chamber for added stability and smoothness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419B6I34EUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045E6FK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Okuma", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]], "price": 55.09}}
