{"item_id": "B0045H8P2O", "title": "Tech Sight's TSR100 Adjustable Aperture Sight for the Ruger® 10/22® Rifle", "description": "The TSR 100 is a adjustable sight similar to the ones used on M16/AR15 rifles. Turns your Ruger 10/22 into a low cost training rifle. Currently used by many nationwide in the Appleseed rifleman training program. FEATURES: 8\" Longer Sighting Radius Rear Sight Base mounts solidly to the rear of the receiver utilizing the existing tapped scope base holes. TSR100 comes standard with dual apertures (.062) and is compatible with M16/AR15 apertures. Uses incremental windage adjustment with rugged detent locking. Front sight tower comes with standard incremental detent adjustable AR15 type post designed for the AR15. This gives the shooter a wide variety of aftermarket post designs for the AR15 that work with this Front Sight Tower. (Scale lines in photo were colored in for illustration purposes) Made with steel parts. Will not work on a 10/22 Tactical as it has non-removable scope mount rail. All Standard 10/22s work. Bull barrels are .920\" and requires adapter TS157 not included)", "text": "Tech Sight's TSR100 Adjustable Aperture Sight for the Ruger® 10/22® Rifle The TSR 100 is a adjustable sight similar to the ones used on M16/AR15 rifles. Turns your Ruger 10/22 into a low cost training rifle. Currently used by many nationwide in the Appleseed rifleman training program. FEATURES: 8\" Longer Sighting Radius Rear Sight Base mounts solidly to the rear of the receiver utilizing the existing tapped scope base holes. TSR100 comes standard with dual apertures (.062) and is compatible with M16/AR15 apertures. Uses incremental windage adjustment with rugged detent locking. Front sight tower comes with standard incremental detent adjustable AR15 type post designed for the AR15. This gives the shooter a wide variety of aftermarket post designs for the AR15 that work with this Front Sight Tower. (Scale lines in photo were colored in for illustration purposes) Made with steel parts. Will not work on a 10/22 Tactical as it has non-removable scope mount rail. All Standard 10/22s work. Bull barrels are .920\" and requires adapter TS157 not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TVjvs1WxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045H8P2O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 69.0}}
{"item_id": "B0045HLTMW", "title": "SmartReloader 100 Rounds #10 Ammo Box", "description": "SmartReloader ammo boxes are made from high quality plastic with the best technology available to make sure your ammunition is stored properly. Our ammo boxes are not only storing boxes, they will also work great at the range. They will stay open from the first time you use them thanks to the hinge that connects the cover to the base. Moreover, most of the non-hinged ammo boxes in the market have a limited life due to the plastic hinge (that connects the cover and the base) which will eventually break with continued use. SmartReloader Ammo Boxes will last virtually forever and give you the best quality available at the best price. We guarantee for 10 millions openings. Fits 100 rounds .22LR, .25ACP and fits in your pocket.", "text": "SmartReloader 100 Rounds #10 Ammo Box SmartReloader ammo boxes are made from high quality plastic with the best technology available to make sure your ammunition is stored properly. Our ammo boxes are not only storing boxes, they will also work great at the range. They will stay open from the first time you use them thanks to the hinge that connects the cover to the base. Moreover, most of the non-hinged ammo boxes in the market have a limited life due to the plastic hinge (that connects the cover and the base) which will eventually break with continued use. SmartReloader Ammo Boxes will last virtually forever and give you the best quality available at the best price. We guarantee for 10 millions openings. Fits 100 rounds .22LR, .25ACP and fits in your pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x33RpXuRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045HLTMW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0045HY85M", "title": "SKS Bottle Cage Adapter Mount for Bicycles", "description": "The SKS Bottle Cage adapter can be fastened to almost any tube or seatpost with the quick release mount system. Bring extra bottles with this easy on/off mount.", "text": "SKS Bottle Cage Adapter Mount for Bicycles The SKS Bottle Cage adapter can be fastened to almost any tube or seatpost with the quick release mount system. Bring extra bottles with this easy on/off mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qBIJG%2BuDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045HY85M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 11.25}}
{"item_id": "B0045KDWK6", "title": "Strike Hold 8oz Bottle", "description": "Strike-Hold is a fast acting penetrant that immediately cuts through dirt, rust, carbon, and scale to quickly get into metal parts that have become frozen by or encrusted with corrosion and oxidation. This product provides a long-lasting dry lubricant, which reduces friction and will not build up or become brittle. As a demoisturant, Strike-Hold helps dry out wet electrical gears and other water sensitive parts. As a protectant, this product provides a shield-like film against the effects of moisture and corrosion, even against salt water, while actually REPELLING SAND, DIRT AND DUST. Strike-Hold contains no CFCs or other ozone depleting substances. Strike-Hold is non-flammable and very safe to use as directed. 8oz spray bottle. To see a video on Strike Hold search 166-72-2275 on Youtube", "text": "Strike Hold 8oz Bottle Strike-Hold is a fast acting penetrant that immediately cuts through dirt, rust, carbon, and scale to quickly get into metal parts that have become frozen by or encrusted with corrosion and oxidation. This product provides a long-lasting dry lubricant, which reduces friction and will not build up or become brittle. As a demoisturant, Strike-Hold helps dry out wet electrical gears and other water sensitive parts. As a protectant, this product provides a shield-like film against the effects of moisture and corrosion, even against salt water, while actually REPELLING SAND, DIRT AND DUST. Strike-Hold contains no CFCs or other ozone depleting substances. Strike-Hold is non-flammable and very safe to use as directed. 8oz spray bottle. To see a video on Strike Hold search 166-72-2275 on Youtube", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412PoYj6u5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045KDWK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Strike Hold Metal Conditioner", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.95}}
