{"item_id": "B0045NXFAK", "title": "Harmony Paddle Clip Kit", "description": "FEATURES of Harmony Paddle Clip Kit A simple, low-profile, and easily installed system to stow a spare paddle or park your primary paddle when you need hands free for other tasks Compatible with polyethylene or composite kayaks Easily installed Includes two clips, hardware and instructions Not designed to hold paddle while cartopping", "text": "Harmony Paddle Clip Kit FEATURES of Harmony Paddle Clip Kit A simple, low-profile, and easily installed system to stow a spare paddle or park your primary paddle when you need hands free for other tasks Compatible with polyethylene or composite kayaks Easily installed Includes two clips, hardware and instructions Not designed to hold paddle while cartopping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419NOcTx%2BeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045NXFAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harmony", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 8.96}}
{"item_id": "B0045OW0N2", "title": "True Utility FireStash Keyring Lighter", "description": "True Utility FireStash Keyring LighterFireStash, a Tiny Waterproof Keyring Lighter for Folks who don't need lighters all the time.With fewer and fewer smokers around it is sometimes hard to find a lighter when you need one. The FireStash Miniature Waterproof Keyring Lighter is a fairly unobtrusive add-on to the old key set, and it looks pretty good too.Features:* Dimensions: 2\" x 0.6\" diameter* Capsule material: dark chrome plated zinc alloy* Refillable (arrives empty)* Neoprene 'O' ring creates watertight seal on capsule* Extendable wick for long life* Uses standard replaceable flints* Keyring included", "text": "True Utility FireStash Keyring Lighter True Utility FireStash Keyring LighterFireStash, a Tiny Waterproof Keyring Lighter for Folks who don't need lighters all the time.With fewer and fewer smokers around it is sometimes hard to find a lighter when you need one. The FireStash Miniature Waterproof Keyring Lighter is a fairly unobtrusive add-on to the old key set, and it looks pretty good too.Features:* Dimensions: 2\" x 0.6\" diameter* Capsule material: dark chrome plated zinc alloy* Refillable (arrives empty)* Neoprene 'O' ring creates watertight seal on capsule* Extendable wick for long life* Uses standard replaceable flints* Keyring included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eTZibxLBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045OW0N2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "True Utility", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 15.95}}
