{"item_id": "B0045R7F70", "title": "MAGPUL MOE CARB STOCK COMMERCIAL BLACK", "description": "**Please check whether you need Mil-Spec or Commercial before ordering** A quick way to tell is to take off your existing buttstock, look at the tube from the side - a mil-spec tube has a flat back, a commercial tube has a slightly slanted back.", "text": "MAGPUL MOE CARB STOCK COMMERCIAL BLACK **Please check whether you need Mil-Spec or Commercial before ordering** A quick way to tell is to take off your existing buttstock, look at the tube from the side - a mil-spec tube has a flat back, a commercial tube has a slightly slanted back.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PBfc9WVtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045R7F70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MOE Carbine Stock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 45.74}}
