{"item_id": "B0045UA8G2", "title": "Optimus Titanium Long Spoon", "description": "The Optimus Titanium Long Spoon is the perfect companion for your dehydrated foods that come in resealable stand-up pouches. Convenient, stand-up pouches have been highly popular for some time, and the Titanium Long Spoon allows you to easily get down to the very last morsels. The handle of the lightweight titanium spoon has exactly the length required to relish your outdoor menus with true style, after an eventful day outdoors.", "text": "Optimus Titanium Long Spoon The Optimus Titanium Long Spoon is the perfect companion for your dehydrated foods that come in resealable stand-up pouches. Convenient, stand-up pouches have been highly popular for some time, and the Titanium Long Spoon allows you to easily get down to the very last morsels. The handle of the lightweight titanium spoon has exactly the length required to relish your outdoor menus with true style, after an eventful day outdoors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21QYCgtkCcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045UA8G2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Optimus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0045UBG6S", "title": "Thomas the Train Tough Trike", "description": "Tough enough for years of fun with all the features you look for and more: a wide, stable wheel base, easy-grip handlebars, big foot pedals, durable tires with rugged treads for “off-road” fun plus great Thomas and Friends styling. There’s even a secret storage compartment under the seat.", "text": "Thomas the Train Tough Trike Tough enough for years of fun with all the features you look for and more: a wide, stable wheel base, easy-grip handlebars, big foot pedals, durable tires with rugged treads for “off-road” fun plus great Thomas and Friends styling. There’s even a secret storage compartment under the seat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CE0vThocL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045UBG6S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fisher-Price", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Tricycles"]], "price": 36.26}}
{"item_id": "B0045UYEVW", "title": "Marble's Catch .22 Storage Dispenser", "description": "The Catch .22 storage dispenser allows hunters and target shooters to clip (50) rounds of .22 caliber cartridges right to their belt or pocket for quick access. It enables speed loading of tubular magazine rifles. The Catch .22 prevents contaminati", "text": "Marble's Catch .22 Storage Dispenser The Catch .22 storage dispenser allows hunters and target shooters to clip (50) rounds of .22 caliber cartridges right to their belt or pocket for quick access. It enables speed loading of tubular magazine rifles. The Catch .22 prevents contaminati", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I4uNpGJhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045UYEVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marble Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.47}}
{"item_id": "B0045V86UQ", "title": "TI-7 Carbine Buttstock -- MIL-SPEC Size, by Tactical Intent", "description": "This tactical buttstock is designed and built by a USG contractor with decades of experience making components for small arms.This buttstock integrates the materials and practices needed to satisfy the government, along with the rugged functionality demanded by tactical forces and enthusiasts. This buttstock has a contoured buttplate, made of a rubber-like material, that allows the stock to rest comfortably in any shooting position. The buttplate provides a positive, non-slip contact surface. The buttstock features a sloping cheek-weld surface that allows for greatest shooting accuracy. The stock attaches by a unique, patent-pending method that ensures smooth rattle-free action and proper fit to the receiver tubes. There are 2 water-resistant storage chambers for batteries or cleaning kit in the buttstock. There is no need to remove the buttstock to access the storage, the chambers can be opened while the stock is mounted. The release lever is shielded and the whole stock is designed to be very snag-resistant. The release lever can be operated with a single hand to adjust or remove the buttstock. The TI-7 commercial size stock also has an ambi socket for quick release sling swivels.The materials are all MIL-SPEC and all the metallic components are stainless steel. The buttstock also has an ambi quick-release sling swivel point. NOTE on COLOR: Colors shown are an approximation. Computer monitors vary significantly making accurate color representation very difficult. Our colors are matched to FED STD 595C. Most commercial \"Flat dark Earth\" products are a shade lighter than the FED STD. Please order our Coyote Tan for best match to MAGPUL and other commercial products in Flat Dark Earth. THIS SPECIFIC MODEL WILL ONLY FIT MIL SPEC SIZE EXTENSION TUBES", "text": "TI-7 Carbine Buttstock -- MIL-SPEC Size, by Tactical Intent This tactical buttstock is designed and built by a USG contractor with decades of experience making components for small arms.This buttstock integrates the materials and practices needed to satisfy the government, along with the rugged functionality demanded by tactical forces and enthusiasts. This buttstock has a contoured buttplate, made of a rubber-like material, that allows the stock to rest comfortably in any shooting position. The buttplate provides a positive, non-slip contact surface. The buttstock features a sloping cheek-weld surface that allows for greatest shooting accuracy. The stock attaches by a unique, patent-pending method that ensures smooth rattle-free action and proper fit to the receiver tubes. There are 2 water-resistant storage chambers for batteries or cleaning kit in the buttstock. There is no need to remove the buttstock to access the storage, the chambers can be opened while the stock is mounted. The release lever is shielded and the whole stock is designed to be very snag-resistant. The release lever can be operated with a single hand to adjust or remove the buttstock. The TI-7 commercial size stock also has an ambi socket for quick release sling swivels.The materials are all MIL-SPEC and all the metallic components are stainless steel. The buttstock also has an ambi quick-release sling swivel point. NOTE on COLOR: Colors shown are an approximation. Computer monitors vary significantly making accurate color representation very difficult. Our colors are matched to FED STD 595C. Most commercial \"Flat dark Earth\" products are a shade lighter than the FED STD. Please order our Coyote Tan for best match to MAGPUL and other commercial products in Flat Dark Earth. THIS SPECIFIC MODEL WILL ONLY FIT MIL SPEC SIZE EXTENSION TUBES", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f-nGOQ55L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045V86UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 89.5}}
{"item_id": "B0045V9GVO", "title": "Tech Sight's M1/M14 cotton loop sling (1 1/4\"W), great for use on a Ruger 10/22 as a Libery training rifle.", "description": "• 1.25\" Wide • 46\" Long • M14/M1 Cotton Loop Sling with cam lock and quick swivel connector hook. • Color - Olive Drab Green • Condition: New Of type often used on Ruger 10/22 for Appleseed Project rifle trainging. Check out appleseedinfo.org for more info. Requires 1.25\" sling mounts be installed or installation of a stock that includes sling mounts. Can be used for create liberty rifle for Project Appleseed rifle marksmanship training. Also checkout out the tech-sight rifle sights for your brand and model of rifle.", "text": "Tech Sight's M1/M14 cotton loop sling (1 1/4\"W), great for use on a Ruger 10/22 as a Libery training rifle. • 1.25\" Wide • 46\" Long • M14/M1 Cotton Loop Sling with cam lock and quick swivel connector hook. • Color - Olive Drab Green • Condition: New Of type often used on Ruger 10/22 for Appleseed Project rifle trainging. Check out appleseedinfo.org for more info. Requires 1.25\" sling mounts be installed or installation of a stock that includes sling mounts. Can be used for create liberty rifle for Project Appleseed rifle marksmanship training. Also checkout out the tech-sight rifle sights for your brand and model of rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yYrJPxuQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045V9GVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tech Sights", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 22.49}}
{"item_id": "B0045W6YO0", "title": "Ambient Weather WS-108 Handheld Weather Station with Digital Altimeter, Barometer, Thermometer, Clock & Compass", "description": "IMPORTANT NOTE: This is an explanation about how altimeters work in general and is applicable to all altimeters. Altimeters are often misunderstood because they do not measure your actual position on the earth (true altitude) such as a GPS, but measure the air pressure and predict the altitude based on this measurement. This is referred to as \"Pressure Altitude\". Pressure Altitude is profoundly affected by the true altitude and to a lesser extent, changes in the weather, often referred to as barometric pressure changes. To offset the difference between Pressure Altitude and True Altitude, you must calibrate the device at a known altitude, whenever convenient.IMPORTANT NOTE: The temperature sensor is housed inside the unit and not exposed to the elements. To receive a true measurement, place in a shaded area and out of contact with your body, and wait several minutes for the temperature to stabilize.Altimeter:Working Range: -2,296 to 29,500 ftCalibration compensates for barometric pressure effectsResolution: 3 ftUnits: ft and metersMaximum history altitude recordAltitude climb measurementAltitude rate of change calculationBarometer:Relative and sea-level barometerUnits: inHg and mbarDigital Compass:4-bearing mode displayExternal magnetic field calibrationMagnetic declination settingAccuracy: +/- 3 degreesUse in Northern Hemisphere only1 degree resolutionUnits: degree and 16 compass point direction (N, NNE, NE,...)Thermometer:Range: 14 to 140 deg FUnits: degC and degFWeather Forecast:Forecast 12 to 24 hours in advanceIcons indicate sunny, partly cloudy, cloudy and rain (at a fixed altitide)Other Features:30 second LED backlight, Adjustable bezel dial, 2.5 x 2.0 x 0.6 inches, Battery: 1 x CR2032 (included). Easy to replace.", "text": "Ambient Weather WS-108 Handheld Weather Station with Digital Altimeter, Barometer, Thermometer, Clock & Compass IMPORTANT NOTE: This is an explanation about how altimeters work in general and is applicable to all altimeters. Altimeters are often misunderstood because they do not measure your actual position on the earth (true altitude) such as a GPS, but measure the air pressure and predict the altitude based on this measurement. This is referred to as \"Pressure Altitude\". Pressure Altitude is profoundly affected by the true altitude and to a lesser extent, changes in the weather, often referred to as barometric pressure changes. To offset the difference between Pressure Altitude and True Altitude, you must calibrate the device at a known altitude, whenever convenient.IMPORTANT NOTE: The temperature sensor is housed inside the unit and not exposed to the elements. To receive a true measurement, place in a shaded area and out of contact with your body, and wait several minutes for the temperature to stabilize.Altimeter:Working Range: -2,296 to 29,500 ftCalibration compensates for barometric pressure effectsResolution: 3 ftUnits: ft and metersMaximum history altitude recordAltitude climb measurementAltitude rate of change calculationBarometer:Relative and sea-level barometerUnits: inHg and mbarDigital Compass:4-bearing mode displayExternal magnetic field calibrationMagnetic declination settingAccuracy: +/- 3 degreesUse in Northern Hemisphere only1 degree resolutionUnits: degree and 16 compass point direction (N, NNE, NE,...)Thermometer:Range: 14 to 140 deg FUnits: degC and degFWeather Forecast:Forecast 12 to 24 hours in advanceIcons indicate sunny, partly cloudy, cloudy and rain (at a fixed altitide)Other Features:30 second LED backlight, Adjustable bezel dial, 2.5 x 2.0 x 0.6 inches, Battery: 1 x CR2032 (included). Easy to replace.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OWGAqFesL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045W6YO0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Altimeters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0045WFX7O", "title": "CREE 40450 185 Lumens Multi-functional LED Lantern and Torch", "description": "This multi-functional water-resistant LED lantern/torch illuminates at 185 lumens. It can be used as a lantern to provide area light or switch on the magnifying lens to provide focused directional light. It has options to operate with full light, low light, or flashing light. The battery life lasts for 25 hours of usage at full capacity, 45 hours at low capacity, and 50 hours at flash. The LED lights never need to be replaced. A rotatable hook is built into the lantern base. The package includes a convenient carrying strap, a carabiner, and four Duracell alkaline batteries to operate the lantern right out of the box.", "text": "CREE 40450 185 Lumens Multi-functional LED Lantern and Torch This multi-functional water-resistant LED lantern/torch illuminates at 185 lumens. It can be used as a lantern to provide area light or switch on the magnifying lens to provide focused directional light. It has options to operate with full light, low light, or flashing light. The battery life lasts for 25 hours of usage at full capacity, 45 hours at low capacity, and 50 hours at flash. The LED lights never need to be replaced. A rotatable hook is built into the lantern base. The package includes a convenient carrying strap, a carabiner, and four Duracell alkaline batteries to operate the lantern right out of the box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SfhETAMGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0045WFX7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 21.87}}
