{"item_id": "B00460IFPW", "title": "Benjamin High Pressure Hand Pump", "description": "The 3-stage high pressure pump is specially designed to fill PCP airguns. The Benjamin PCP pump has a universal adapter and works with the Benjamin Marauder, Woods Walker and Discovery, and the Crosman Challenger.", "text": "Benjamin High Pressure Hand Pump The 3-stage high pressure pump is specially designed to fill PCP airguns. The Benjamin PCP pump has a universal adapter and works with the Benjamin Marauder, Woods Walker and Discovery, and the Crosman Challenger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316FXNb9qUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00460IFPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 182.36}}
