{"item_id": "B00465UPT6", "title": "Recycled Bicycle Tube Reflective Pant Leg Straps by Green Guru Gear", "description": "This two pack of reflective pant leg straps by Green Guru Gear is a must-have recycled accessory for every cycling commuter. The straps are made from used bicycled tubes that have been recycled so that they will not end up in a landfill. In addition, each strap includes a reflective strip that increases visibility during night time riding.", "text": "Recycled Bicycle Tube Reflective Pant Leg Straps by Green Guru Gear This two pack of reflective pant leg straps by Green Guru Gear is a must-have recycled accessory for every cycling commuter. The straps are made from used bicycled tubes that have been recycled so that they will not end up in a landfill. In addition, each strap includes a reflective strip that increases visibility during night time riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h3FWtIq5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00465UPT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Green Guru Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 15.95}}
