{"item_id": "B00469AJZW", "title": "NcStar 4X32 Compact Scope-3 Rail Sighting System with Mil-Dot Weaver Mount (Blue) (SC3RSM432B)", "description": "The SC3RS432B 3-RAIL SIGHTING SYSTEM is a new generation of modular tactical sighting systems. The unique sighting system mount that encompasses the fixed 4 power 32mm scope allows the shooter to mount many different accessories directly to the scope for quick and easy access.", "text": "NcStar 4X32 Compact Scope-3 Rail Sighting System with Mil-Dot Weaver Mount (Blue) (SC3RSM432B) The SC3RS432B 3-RAIL SIGHTING SYSTEM is a new generation of modular tactical sighting systems. The unique sighting system mount that encompasses the fixed 4 power 32mm scope allows the shooter to mount many different accessories directly to the scope for quick and easy access.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w36Qfbk7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00469AJZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 49.8}}
{"item_id": "B00469AX62", "title": "Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box", "description": "Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box seals tight to keep your things dry. The secret is in the Dri-Loc O-ring seal combined with 3 tight-sealing cam-action latches. Available here in 5 different-sized models! State Model Number. Model: 4648, Size (in.): 7 3/8 x 4 1/2 x 1 3/4, Note: Perfect for phones/other small valuables. Model: 3500, Size (in.): 9 1/8 x 4 7/8 x 1 1/4, Note: 3-17 adjustable components. Model: 3600, Size (in.): 10 1/4 x 7 1/4 x 1 1/4, Note: 5-18 adjustable components. Model: 3700 Deep, Size (in.): 14 x 9 x 2 7/8, Note: 1-4 components. Model: 3700, Size (in.): 14 x 9 x 1 7/8, Note: 4-23 components. Order yours today! Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box", "text": "Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box seals tight to keep your things dry. The secret is in the Dri-Loc O-ring seal combined with 3 tight-sealing cam-action latches. Available here in 5 different-sized models! State Model Number. Model: 4648, Size (in.): 7 3/8 x 4 1/2 x 1 3/4, Note: Perfect for phones/other small valuables. Model: 3500, Size (in.): 9 1/8 x 4 7/8 x 1 1/4, Note: 3-17 adjustable components. Model: 3600, Size (in.): 10 1/4 x 7 1/4 x 1 1/4, Note: 5-18 adjustable components. Model: 3700 Deep, Size (in.): 14 x 9 x 2 7/8, Note: 1-4 components. Model: 3700, Size (in.): 14 x 9 x 1 7/8, Note: 4-23 components. Order yours today! Plano Waterproof StowAway Tackle Box", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GweqoIaoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00469AX62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0046C51PW", "title": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Sig Sauer P229 Imprint, Black", "description": "Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "text": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Sig Sauer P229 Imprint, Black Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CVbi1wV%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046C51PW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TekMat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 13.59}}
