{"item_id": "B0046IJEN6", "title": "Desantis N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black 2.75\"\" S&W Bodyguard .380 Nylon N38BJU7Z0", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "Desantis N38 The Nemesis Pocket Holster Ambidextrous Black 2.75\"\" S&W Bodyguard .380 Nylon N38BJU7Z0 This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PxXkbBPeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046IJEN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.28}}
{"item_id": "B0046IKGTM", "title": "Silver Throwing Axe with Custom Sheath [Misc.]", "description": "Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bulls-eye with ease. Includes custom sheath.", "text": "Silver Throwing Axe with Custom Sheath [Misc.] Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bulls-eye with ease. Includes custom sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21px8rL6R-L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046IKGTM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B0046IMWF8", "title": "DeSantis Glock 19/23/36 Sof-Tuck Holster", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis Glock 19/23/36 Sof-Tuck Holster Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kzTyFG3uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046IMWF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.05}}
{"item_id": "B0046JYNB8", "title": "US Military Modular System Green Patrol Sleeping Bag", "description": "GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG!!!MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG. HAS THE BIG GREEN, MILITARY TAG, ON BOTTOM!!! NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! AN EXCELLENT VALUE!!! GREEN PATROL BAG, RATED TO 30 DEGREES F. IT IS WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR TEMPERATE CLIMATES, BETWEEN 30 TO 50 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. GREEN. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "text": "US Military Modular System Green Patrol Sleeping Bag GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG!!!MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG. HAS THE BIG GREEN, MILITARY TAG, ON BOTTOM!!! NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! AN EXCELLENT VALUE!!! GREEN PATROL BAG, RATED TO 30 DEGREES F. IT IS WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR TEMPERATE CLIMATES, BETWEEN 30 TO 50 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. GREEN. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51doH8RJT7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046JYNB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tennier Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 35.75}}
{"item_id": "B0046K43KS", "title": "Us Military Modular System Green Patrol Sleeping Bag", "description": "IN NEW, UNUSED CONDITION!!! WITH MILITARY GREEN TAG ON BOTTOM!!! GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG!!! MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG. NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! AN EXCELLENT VALUE!!! GREEN PATROL BAG, RATED TO 30 DEGREES F. IT IS WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR TEMPERATE CLIMATES, BETWEEN 30 TO 50 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. GREEN. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "text": "Us Military Modular System Green Patrol Sleeping Bag IN NEW, UNUSED CONDITION!!! WITH MILITARY GREEN TAG ON BOTTOM!!! GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG!!! MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG. NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! AN EXCELLENT VALUE!!! GREEN PATROL BAG, RATED TO 30 DEGREES F. IT IS WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR TEMPERATE CLIMATES, BETWEEN 30 TO 50 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. GREEN. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TqSiUvFjL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046K43KS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tennier", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 35.89}}
{"item_id": "B0046K63HY", "title": "USMC MILITARY MODULAR SYSTEM- GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG", "description": "Patrol Sleeping Bag- Rated for temperate climates 50 to 30 degrees. Reversible double pull slider which allows the top or bottom to ventilate and a draft flap to prevent heat loss. The hood adjusts for heat retention. Each bag is less than 4 pounds and between 81-83″ long, 35-37″ wide; 22-24″at the foot.", "text": "USMC MILITARY MODULAR SYSTEM- GREEN PATROL SLEEPING BAG Patrol Sleeping Bag- Rated for temperate climates 50 to 30 degrees. Reversible double pull slider which allows the top or bottom to ventilate and a draft flap to prevent heat loss. The hood adjusts for heat retention. Each bag is less than 4 pounds and between 81-83″ long, 35-37″ wide; 22-24″at the foot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f61ZPps6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046K63HY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U S Military", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B0046L644U", "title": "NCAA License Plate Frame", "description": "Metal License Plate Frame is decorated with two full color inserts. The cast zinc frame is chrome plated .024 gauge aluminum embossed with two mounting holes on the top of the frame. Standard 6\"x12\" size. Made in USA.", "text": "NCAA License Plate Frame Metal License Plate Frame is decorated with two full color inserts. The cast zinc frame is chrome plated .024 gauge aluminum embossed with two mounting holes on the top of the frame. Standard 6\"x12\" size. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oxFEWeK%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046L644U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Auto Accessories", "License Plate Frames"]], "price": 20.8}}
{"item_id": "B0046LXENY", "title": "Umarex Walther Tactical Folding Knife, Black, 3.3-Inch Blade", "description": "Walther BlackTAC Knife by Umarex- Blade Length: 3.35\". - Overall Open Length: 7.8\". Steel: 440 Stainless. Partially Serrated Blade. Open Assist. Liner Lock. Aluminium Handle. Glass Breaker. Removable Clip. Sheath Included", "text": "Umarex Walther Tactical Folding Knife, Black, 3.3-Inch Blade Walther BlackTAC Knife by Umarex- Blade Length: 3.35\". - Overall Open Length: 7.8\". Steel: 440 Stainless. Partially Serrated Blade. Open Assist. Liner Lock. Aluminium Handle. Glass Breaker. Removable Clip. Sheath Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310M9iPzynL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046LXENY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0046M8LZ4", "title": "Military Black PolarTec 300 Fleece Jacket Parka Liner", "description": "SIZE XLARGE DON'T BE LEFT OUT IN THE COLD!! VERY LIMITED SIZE!! DON'T WAIT TILL THE LAST MINUTE, WILL SELL OUT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUED, POLARTEC 300, COLD WEATHER FLEECE, JACKET, PARKA LINER!!! SPECIFICS, ARE AS FOLLOWS: THE POLARTEX FABRIC HAS TREMENDOUS WARMTH, WITHOUT ADDED WEIGHT!! FULL LENGTH FRONT OPENING. 2 WAY ZIPPER SLIDE FASTENER. ADJUSTABLE VELCRO WRIST CUFFS. 2 INTERIOR, MESH POCKETS. THE UPPER BACK, SHOULDERS, UPPER CHEST, AND ELBOWS, ARE REINFORCED, AS SHOWN IN PHOTOS. UNDERARM VENTS, WITH ZIPPERS. 2 FRONT, INSULATED, HAND WARMING POCKETS. SIZES: AS FOLLOWS: CHEST SIZE: 33\" TO 37\" = SMALL 37\" TO 41\" = MEDIUM 41\" TO 45\" = LARGE 45\" TO 49\" = XLARGE", "text": "Military Black PolarTec 300 Fleece Jacket Parka Liner SIZE XLARGE DON'T BE LEFT OUT IN THE COLD!! VERY LIMITED SIZE!! DON'T WAIT TILL THE LAST MINUTE, WILL SELL OUT!!! A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUED, POLARTEC 300, COLD WEATHER FLEECE, JACKET, PARKA LINER!!! SPECIFICS, ARE AS FOLLOWS: THE POLARTEX FABRIC HAS TREMENDOUS WARMTH, WITHOUT ADDED WEIGHT!! FULL LENGTH FRONT OPENING. 2 WAY ZIPPER SLIDE FASTENER. ADJUSTABLE VELCRO WRIST CUFFS. 2 INTERIOR, MESH POCKETS. THE UPPER BACK, SHOULDERS, UPPER CHEST, AND ELBOWS, ARE REINFORCED, AS SHOWN IN PHOTOS. UNDERARM VENTS, WITH ZIPPERS. 2 FRONT, INSULATED, HAND WARMING POCKETS. SIZES: AS FOLLOWS: CHEST SIZE: 33\" TO 37\" = SMALL 37\" TO 41\" = MEDIUM 41\" TO 45\" = LARGE 45\" TO 49\" = XLARGE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FmHvbfADL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046M8LZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 58.47}}
{"item_id": "B0046NWMWG", "title": "Condor T and T Pouch (Tan)", "description": "- Fully opens with paracords to adjust. - One internal sleeve, one zipper pocket, and multiple elastic keeper. - Removable 7 - Inch x 12 - Inch vinyl sleeve for map or documents. - External webbing for modular attachments. - 10 - Inch x 3 - Inch IDPatches panel. - Removable back straps. - Two D-ring on the back. - 10 - InchL x 7.5 - InchH x 1.5 - InchD", "text": "Condor T and T Pouch (Tan) - Fully opens with paracords to adjust. - One internal sleeve, one zipper pocket, and multiple elastic keeper. - Removable 7 - Inch x 12 - Inch vinyl sleeve for map or documents. - External webbing for modular attachments. - 10 - Inch x 3 - Inch IDPatches panel. - Removable back straps. - Two D-ring on the back. - 10 - InchL x 7.5 - InchH x 1.5 - InchD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TtGyeCwFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046NWMWG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 20.95}}
