{"item_id": "B0046OCCXY", "title": "Energizer 3LED Trailfinder Performance Cap Light (2AAA Batteries Included)", "description": "A great choice for on the trail or at the campsite, and a outstanding illumination device for any adventure. Our hands free cap light is versatile and lightweight enough to easily fit in vest pockets and backpacks to go wherever needed. This water resistant light offers 3 lighting modes; high/low and red for night vision. The 90 degree swivel feature provides 30 lumens of bright LED light to point where it is needed. The contoured above brim design does not obstruct vision, and has a durable metal clip that sits snuggly to brim of hat/cap. The recessed push button switch prevents inadvertent activation and we have included 2AAA Energizer MAX batteries for instant power and usage. This light offers virtually indestructible bright LED lighting and rugged construction required to meet the demands of varying outdoor conditions.", "text": "Energizer 3LED Trailfinder Performance Cap Light (2AAA Batteries Included) A great choice for on the trail or at the campsite, and a outstanding illumination device for any adventure. Our hands free cap light is versatile and lightweight enough to easily fit in vest pockets and backpacks to go wherever needed. This water resistant light offers 3 lighting modes; high/low and red for night vision. The 90 degree swivel feature provides 30 lumens of bright LED light to point where it is needed. The contoured above brim design does not obstruct vision, and has a durable metal clip that sits snuggly to brim of hat/cap. The recessed push button switch prevents inadvertent activation and we have included 2AAA Energizer MAX batteries for instant power and usage. This light offers virtually indestructible bright LED lighting and rugged construction required to meet the demands of varying outdoor conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yP1SgE1vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046OCCXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Energizer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 10.57}}
{"item_id": "B0046OGZAA", "title": "ALPS Adult All Terrian Snowshoes + Pair Anti-Shock Adjustable Snowshoeing Pole + Free Carrying Tote Bag", "description": "High performance lightweight snowshoes for men and women. Sturdy alloy frames made with 6061 alloy material. Plastic deck is make by TPU-85 plastic material for long lasting heavy duty usage in extreme weather conditions. Special frame design to create the maximum floatation in heavy snow condition. It can accommodate a user and gear up to 150lbs weight and fits most of the shoe sizes. CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE SNOWSHOES: Your weight, including equipment, is referred to as the recommended load or carrying capacity on snowshoe specs. This is a major factor in determining the right size for your snowshoes. If your body weight is from 90 - 140 lbs: Consider the 21/22 inch models. If your body weight is from 125 - 175 lbs: Consider the 25 or 27 inch models. If your body weight is from 150 - 225 lbs: Consider the 27 or 30 inch models.", "text": "ALPS Adult All Terrian Snowshoes + Pair Anti-Shock Adjustable Snowshoeing Pole + Free Carrying Tote Bag High performance lightweight snowshoes for men and women. Sturdy alloy frames made with 6061 alloy material. Plastic deck is make by TPU-85 plastic material for long lasting heavy duty usage in extreme weather conditions. Special frame design to create the maximum floatation in heavy snow condition. It can accommodate a user and gear up to 150lbs weight and fits most of the shoe sizes. CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE SNOWSHOES: Your weight, including equipment, is referred to as the recommended load or carrying capacity on snowshoe specs. This is a major factor in determining the right size for your snowshoes. If your body weight is from 90 - 140 lbs: Consider the 21/22 inch models. If your body weight is from 125 - 175 lbs: Consider the 25 or 27 inch models. If your body weight is from 150 - 225 lbs: Consider the 27 or 30 inch models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LuTH5Y9pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046OGZAA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Snowshoes"]]}}
