{"item_id": "B0046S4O5Y", "title": "United Cutlery Undercover Magnum Push Dagger", "description": "Constructed from one solid piece of 420 stainless steel with contoured handles. Each includes heavy duty nylon sheath with belt loop. 5 5/8\" overall. 3 1/4\" blade.", "text": "United Cutlery Undercover Magnum Push Dagger Constructed from one solid piece of 420 stainless steel with contoured handles. Each includes heavy duty nylon sheath with belt loop. 5 5/8\" overall. 3 1/4\" blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Kv6xR2g9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046S4O5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0046U6ITM", "title": "Tetra Extra-Strong Ultralight Net Camouflage Hammock (SY-137 US)", "description": "It's not your comfy bed at home. But at this affordable price, this hammock allows you to sleep off the ground and yet under the stars. That's all you need. Please note: Not as depicted in the photo, you will only receive one hammock for the price advertised.", "text": "Tetra Extra-Strong Ultralight Net Camouflage Hammock (SY-137 US) It's not your comfy bed at home. But at this affordable price, this hammock allows you to sleep off the ground and yet under the stars. That's all you need. Please note: Not as depicted in the photo, you will only receive one hammock for the price advertised.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKRU5OlPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046U6ITM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0046VC5UM", "title": "Gränsfors Bruks Hand Hatchet", "description": "The Gransfors Bruks Hand Hatchet, sometimes called the Kubben, is just really cool. The Hand Hatchet has the same head as the Wildlife Hatchet, but on a shorter handle. It's short, only 9.5 inches (24 cm) total, but very hefty for its size with a 21 ounce (600 gm) head and a 3 inch (7.6 cm) bit. The hickory handle is thick. Despite its length, you can get some real work done with this little guy. It is a real favorite among carvers. And i am pretty partial to it myself. This Hatchet will fit in any pack. And it is great to handle, so you'll want to bring it. Leather sheath included. The sheath is designed to prevent the axe head from abrading a backpack. All Gransfors Axes come with the AXE BOOK and a 20 year guarantee. -SwedishAx.com", "text": "Gränsfors Bruks Hand Hatchet The Gransfors Bruks Hand Hatchet, sometimes called the Kubben, is just really cool. The Hand Hatchet has the same head as the Wildlife Hatchet, but on a shorter handle. It's short, only 9.5 inches (24 cm) total, but very hefty for its size with a 21 ounce (600 gm) head and a 3 inch (7.6 cm) bit. The hickory handle is thick. Despite its length, you can get some real work done with this little guy. It is a real favorite among carvers. And i am pretty partial to it myself. This Hatchet will fit in any pack. And it is great to handle, so you'll want to bring it. Leather sheath included. The sheath is designed to prevent the axe head from abrading a backpack. All Gransfors Axes come with the AXE BOOK and a 20 year guarantee. -SwedishAx.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tftKTFW3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046VC5UM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B0046VJV9A", "title": "Coleman Fiberglass Tent Pole Replacement Kit", "description": "Lose or break a tent pole? No problem, with the Coleman Fiberglass Tent Pole Kit. The kit includes four poles that are 27\" long and 9.5mm in diameter, with metal ferrules; a 10' long shock cord, a 28\" leader wire to help pull the shock cord through the pole, and two vinyl pole caps.", "text": "Coleman Fiberglass Tent Pole Replacement Kit Lose or break a tent pole? No problem, with the Coleman Fiberglass Tent Pole Kit. The kit includes four poles that are 27\" long and 9.5mm in diameter, with metal ferrules; a 10' long shock cord, a 28\" leader wire to help pull the shock cord through the pole, and two vinyl pole caps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zLHFyK3PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046VJV9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 8.49}}
{"item_id": "B0046VLEOK", "title": "Rap4 Paintball Quick Change 12g Co2 Adapter - Black", "description": "The Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adaptor uses a single 12g disposable cylinder. It comes with a standard thread adaptor that is compatible with the AG1 grenade charger and all standard paintball guns and markers. The 12g cylinder can put out about 20-30 charges and about 15-20 shots for paintball guns. T68 Gen5 Paintball gun with Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adapter Viewloader Paintball gun with Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adapter", "text": "Rap4 Paintball Quick Change 12g Co2 Adapter - Black The Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adaptor uses a single 12g disposable cylinder. It comes with a standard thread adaptor that is compatible with the AG1 grenade charger and all standard paintball guns and markers. The 12g cylinder can put out about 20-30 charges and about 15-20 shots for paintball guns. T68 Gen5 Paintball gun with Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adapter Viewloader Paintball gun with Quick Change 12g CO2 Cylinder Adapter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21IFucp5ymL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046VLEOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rap4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts", "Tanks"]], "price": 15.9}}
{"item_id": "B0046VNIK8", "title": "Rap4 Shogun Paintball Heavy Duty Coiled Remote with on/off", "description": "Rap4 remotes have Features that surpasses CGA Standards for Quality Assurance 3000 PSI Rated Coil With Improved Flexibility Allows for Safe and Convenient Disconnection of Marker from Coil Assembly May be used with CO2 Tanks or HPA Tanks.", "text": "Rap4 Shogun Paintball Heavy Duty Coiled Remote with on/off Rap4 remotes have Features that surpasses CGA Standards for Quality Assurance 3000 PSI Rated Coil With Improved Flexibility Allows for Safe and Convenient Disconnection of Marker from Coil Assembly May be used with CO2 Tanks or HPA Tanks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BHYWCSFqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046VNIK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rap4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts", "Remotes"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B0046XDKHW", "title": "Everlast 100-Year Anniversary 80-Pound Heavy Bag Kit", "description": "The 100 Year Anniversary Heavy Bag Kit from Everlast includes an 80-pound Polycanvas Heavy Bag, Pro Style Training Gloves, and Pro Handwraps. Built for powerful workouts, the heavy bag features a Nevatear layered matrix technology of synthetic leather and webbed vinyl to take the heaviest punches. The heavy bag measures 46 inches high by 13 inches wide and can be suspended from a ceiling or other solid, elevated anchor. The Pro-Style training gloves are constructed with durable and long-lasting synthetic leather and feature EverCool ventilation fabric technologies for temperature regulation, while EverFresh properties guard against odor, skin irritation, and extend the gloves' usable life. The gloves are designed to offer a curved, anatomical grip and fit, and feature EverLast's Thumblok design that protects your hands by keeping your thumb and knuckle correctly placed and secure during your workout. With hook-and-loop straps, the gloves are easy to get on and off. Finally, the 180-inch Pro Handwraps offer an extra protective layering and are machine washable. The wraps are made with blend of cotton and spandex for breathable comfort and are equipped with thumb straps and hook-and-loop ends for a secure fit. Adorned with Everlast's classic logos as well as the gold 100 year anniversary logos on the gloves and bag--this anniversary Kit delivers the over 100 years of Everlast history and quality in one package. What's in the Box? 80-pound Polycanvas Heavy Bag, Hook & Loop Pro Style gloves, 180-inch Pro Handwraps", "text": "Everlast 100-Year Anniversary 80-Pound Heavy Bag Kit The 100 Year Anniversary Heavy Bag Kit from Everlast includes an 80-pound Polycanvas Heavy Bag, Pro Style Training Gloves, and Pro Handwraps. Built for powerful workouts, the heavy bag features a Nevatear layered matrix technology of synthetic leather and webbed vinyl to take the heaviest punches. The heavy bag measures 46 inches high by 13 inches wide and can be suspended from a ceiling or other solid, elevated anchor. The Pro-Style training gloves are constructed with durable and long-lasting synthetic leather and feature EverCool ventilation fabric technologies for temperature regulation, while EverFresh properties guard against odor, skin irritation, and extend the gloves' usable life. The gloves are designed to offer a curved, anatomical grip and fit, and feature EverLast's Thumblok design that protects your hands by keeping your thumb and knuckle correctly placed and secure during your workout. With hook-and-loop straps, the gloves are easy to get on and off. Finally, the 180-inch Pro Handwraps offer an extra protective layering and are machine washable. The wraps are made with blend of cotton and spandex for breathable comfort and are equipped with thumb straps and hook-and-loop ends for a secure fit. Adorned with Everlast's classic logos as well as the gold 100 year anniversary logos on the gloves and bag--this anniversary Kit delivers the over 100 years of Everlast history and quality in one package. What's in the Box? 80-pound Polycanvas Heavy Bag, Hook & Loop Pro Style gloves, 180-inch Pro Handwraps", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bmvM-mYVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XDKHW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0046XGOJ8", "title": "New Alta Tactical Superflex Knee Pads Black Altalok", "description": "Get the protection you need with both Knee and Elbow pads", "text": "New Alta Tactical Superflex Knee Pads Black Altalok Get the protection you need with both Knee and Elbow pads", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z2cAzEqNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XGOJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Knee Pads"]], "price": 27.5}}
{"item_id": "B0046XINUQ", "title": "Everlast Thai Pad (Black)", "description": "Everlast's Thai Pads are professional-grade training devices for martial arts sports. Made of premium, durably constructed synthetic leather for long lasting durability and functionality, this pad features an authentic Thai fighting design. Dense foam padding in multi-layered, impact-absorbing stuffing ensures optimal safety while blocking kicks, punches, elbows, and knees during training sessions.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "text": "Everlast Thai Pad (Black) Everlast's Thai Pads are professional-grade training devices for martial arts sports. Made of premium, durably constructed synthetic leather for long lasting durability and functionality, this pad features an authentic Thai fighting design. Dense foam padding in multi-layered, impact-absorbing stuffing ensures optimal safety while blocking kicks, punches, elbows, and knees during training sessions.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oIk2EdD4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XINUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]], "price": 24.88}}
{"item_id": "B0046XKODK", "title": "Limbsaver Pad Rem700/710/870 Syn", "description": "Limbsaver Recoil Pad Black Remington Synthetic -700/710/870/1100/1187 10101", "text": "Limbsaver Pad Rem700/710/870 Syn Limbsaver Recoil Pad Black Remington Synthetic -700/710/870/1100/1187 10101", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21lLVCN7GDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XKODK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Limbsaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 29.3}}
{"item_id": "B0046XMB9U", "title": "Everlast - 2 Station Heavy Bag Stand", "description": "Boxing training begins and ends with the heavy and speed bags, and this stand from industry leader Everlast holds both. Rugged, powder-coated steel tubing construction and three weight pegs provide maximum durability on the easy-to-assemble stand. It will support any heavy bag up to 100 pounds, and the adjustable height speed bag platform handles all speed bag sizes. The stand measures 48.25-by-84-by-69 inches (W x H x D).About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a global leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to the undisputed middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of world champion professional athletes.", "text": "Everlast - 2 Station Heavy Bag Stand Boxing training begins and ends with the heavy and speed bags, and this stand from industry leader Everlast holds both. Rugged, powder-coated steel tubing construction and three weight pegs provide maximum durability on the easy-to-assemble stand. It will support any heavy bag up to 100 pounds, and the adjustable height speed bag platform handles all speed bag sizes. The stand measures 48.25-by-84-by-69 inches (W x H x D).About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a global leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to the undisputed middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of world champion professional athletes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MnW0LM6UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XMB9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Heavy Bags"]], "price": 169.0}}
{"item_id": "B0046XOQUW", "title": "Jeep Boy's Bike (16-Inch Wheels)", "description": "The new 16-inch Jeep Boy's Bike is trail rated for rugged durability with a real suspension fork that soaks up bumps big or small. A CPSC full wrap chain charge and coaster brake plus front hand brake ensure safety is always a top priority. Finished in a highly visible glossy blue paint, it comes with training wheels for the rider who's not quite ready to go it alone. The alloy seat clamp has a quick-release feature, the cross bar is padded for safety, and the steel frame can take years of abuse.Specifications:Steel frameSuspension forkFront hand brakePadded cross barFull wrap CPSC chain guardAlloy quick-release seat clampDimensions: 49 by 22 by 35 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 28 pounds", "text": "Jeep Boy's Bike (16-Inch Wheels) The new 16-inch Jeep Boy's Bike is trail rated for rugged durability with a real suspension fork that soaks up bumps big or small. A CPSC full wrap chain charge and coaster brake plus front hand brake ensure safety is always a top priority. Finished in a highly visible glossy blue paint, it comes with training wheels for the rider who's not quite ready to go it alone. The alloy seat clamp has a quick-release feature, the cross bar is padded for safety, and the steel frame can take years of abuse.Specifications:Steel frameSuspension forkFront hand brakePadded cross barFull wrap CPSC chain guardAlloy quick-release seat clampDimensions: 49 by 22 by 35 inches (L x W x H)Weight: 28 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51g03TTSAIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046XOQUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jeep", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Bikes"]], "price": 92.99}}
{"item_id": "B0046ZI9J4", "title": "Giro Advantage 2 Helmet", "description": "This is the time trial helmet of choice for great champions like Lance Armstrong, Alberto Contador, Levi Leipheimer, Dave Zabriskie, and David Millar. Wind tunnel testing proves why it is so popular-Advantage 2 represents the pinnacle of aerodynamic performance, fit, and ventilation. Advantage 2 is the ultimate helmet to wear when every thousandth of a second counts, from prestigious prologues at le Tour to ultra distance triathlons.", "text": "Giro Advantage 2 Helmet This is the time trial helmet of choice for great champions like Lance Armstrong, Alberto Contador, Levi Leipheimer, Dave Zabriskie, and David Millar. Wind tunnel testing proves why it is so popular-Advantage 2 represents the pinnacle of aerodynamic performance, fit, and ventilation. Advantage 2 is the ultimate helmet to wear when every thousandth of a second counts, from prestigious prologues at le Tour to ultra distance triathlons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y4SYjcaPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046ZI9J4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0046ZJD4Y", "title": "Giro 100 Proof Winter Gloves", "description": "100 PROOF. Our warmest glove, featuring variable weight insulation with split finger “lobster claw” design to handle extreme cold and wet weather (15° F / -10° C). The 100 Proof offers maximum hand and finger insulation from cold and wet weather with a waterproof, breathable outer shell and Thinsulate XT-S with X-Static performance core. The removable moisture-wicking inner liner can also be worn on its own when temperatures are mild. It’s a double dose of maximum warmth that won’t compromise riding dexterity or weigh you down.", "text": "Giro 100 Proof Winter Gloves 100 PROOF. Our warmest glove, featuring variable weight insulation with split finger “lobster claw” design to handle extreme cold and wet weather (15° F / -10° C). The 100 Proof offers maximum hand and finger insulation from cold and wet weather with a waterproof, breathable outer shell and Thinsulate XT-S with X-Static performance core. The removable moisture-wicking inner liner can also be worn on its own when temperatures are mild. It’s a double dose of maximum warmth that won’t compromise riding dexterity or weigh you down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nr9QBfwkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0046ZJD4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004709LTA", "title": "Giro Xar Hex Cycling Helmet", "description": "The new czar of All Mountain. The XAR offers all the features you've come to expect from Giro's top-level trail-riding helmets - P.O.V. adjustable visor; full coverage in-mold composition with EPS foam and polycarbonate shell; Roll Cage enforcement and the new Roc Loc 5 fir system - the XAR truly heralds a new era of performance, comfort and style. At the heart of this helmet you'll find 17 Wind Tunnel vents as well as optimized internal channeling, and the visor is vented to increase airflow. Breathability on the XAR is incredible; there's never been a lid this breathable on dirt. Even the padding is extraordinary thanks in part to the X-Static anti-microbial fabric. Today's All Mountain riders crush the climbs as well as they shred the descents. Their bikes beautifully merge minimal weight, climbing prowess and downhill capability. The riders are buying the best and are ushering in the new standard for all-mountain performance. Just as riding styles and bikes have evolved, so must the helmet. the new XAR, inspired by the Xen, but designed to meet the performance needs of today's progressive all-mountain rider.", "text": "Giro Xar Hex Cycling Helmet The new czar of All Mountain. The XAR offers all the features you've come to expect from Giro's top-level trail-riding helmets - P.O.V. adjustable visor; full coverage in-mold composition with EPS foam and polycarbonate shell; Roll Cage enforcement and the new Roc Loc 5 fir system - the XAR truly heralds a new era of performance, comfort and style. At the heart of this helmet you'll find 17 Wind Tunnel vents as well as optimized internal channeling, and the visor is vented to increase airflow. Breathability on the XAR is incredible; there's never been a lid this breathable on dirt. Even the padding is extraordinary thanks in part to the X-Static anti-microbial fabric. Today's All Mountain riders crush the climbs as well as they shred the descents. Their bikes beautifully merge minimal weight, climbing prowess and downhill capability. The riders are buying the best and are ushering in the new standard for all-mountain performance. Just as riding styles and bikes have evolved, so must the helmet. the new XAR, inspired by the Xen, but designed to meet the performance needs of today's progressive all-mountain rider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w3zyrf8oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004709LTA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00470JRP8", "title": "Giro Athlon Mountain Bike Helmet", "description": "The Giro Athlon Mountain biking helmet crushes the racecourse with speed and style - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "text": "Giro Athlon Mountain Bike Helmet The Giro Athlon Mountain biking helmet crushes the racecourse with speed and style - and features the new Roc Loc 5 fit system. After more than ten years of refinement, this ground-breaking fit system provides an entirely unique use experience with an unmatched level of comfort, stability, adjustability and weight savings. With Roc Loc 5, you can easily dial-in both fit tension and adjust vertical position with a single hand. Just twist the dial for a tighter feel on tough terrain, then back it off a notch and relax across the flats or a warm climb. Even with these remarkable features, Roc Loc 5 is still 40-percent lighter than its popular predecessor, Roc Loc 4. Roc Loc 5 systems is: 1) Micro Dial. The heart of the Roc Loc 5 is this ratcheting, micro-adjusting dial. A simple, two-finger twist of the Micro Dial opens or closes the retention system and each click is audible. 2) Three-Position Vertical Fit - It's never been easier to change vertical positions and fine-tune fit. We incorporated a three-position bracket that features 15-millimeters of precise up/down movement. Like the Micro Dial, this system can be adjusted without removing the helmet. 3) Carefully crafted ergonomic arms are shaped to be as comfortable as possible, yet work flawlessly with Giro eyewear (what we call Super Fit engineering). 4) Dual Pods - These two panels are designed to firmly grasp the back of your head while comfortably cradling the occipital lobe. Strap management - with Roc Loc 5, your helmet straps are woven through the fit system, so they are always in the perfect position. Complex Internal Design - Dozens of small parts work together seamlessly to provide exceptionally user-friendly adjustment. Minimal and Light, yet Strong - Although this fit system is 40% lighter than its predecessor, it's much stronger. In testing, Roc Loc 5 performs flawlessly, even after 6,600 cycles (equivalent to 3 years of riding with 3 round trips per day).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mw5cZ1oTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00470JRP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00470OY60", "title": "Blackburn Helmet / Head / Hat Mount Kit for Flea Headlight", "description": "Innovative mounting system allows you to mount the Flea Headlight to your helmet, hat, or forehead with all mounting materials included.", "text": "Blackburn Helmet / Head / Hat Mount Kit for Flea Headlight Innovative mounting system allows you to mount the Flea Headlight to your helmet, hat, or forehead with all mounting materials included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bxZYlMwaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00470OY60.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 12.77}}
{"item_id": "B00470OY8I", "title": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 Front Headlight with USB and Solar Chargers, Black", "description": "Flea. The lightest, brightest rechargeable cycling light in the world now has new Fuel Gauge Technology with indicator LED that shows battery capacity and charging. The flexible and compact mounting system installs in minutes.", "text": "Blackburn Flea 2.0 Front Headlight with USB and Solar Chargers, Black Flea. The lightest, brightest rechargeable cycling light in the world now has new Fuel Gauge Technology with indicator LED that shows battery capacity and charging. The flexible and compact mounting system installs in minutes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sUjAMSKoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00470OY8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 37.99}}
{"item_id": "B00470SAGK", "title": "Blackburn Mammoth AnyValve Pump", "description": "The Blackburn Mammoth AnyValve Pump takes the guesswork out of which adapter goes where. The reason is because there are no adapters to choose from with the Blackburn AnyValve Head which automatically adjusts to fit Presta, Schrader or Dunlop. SO, it's easy to figure it out. The Mammoth weighs just 157 grams and features a rubberized folding T-handle for a solid grip and easy pumping without the extra effort, and Blackburn's lifetime warranty means it may be the last pump you ever buy.", "text": "Blackburn Mammoth AnyValve Pump The Blackburn Mammoth AnyValve Pump takes the guesswork out of which adapter goes where. The reason is because there are no adapters to choose from with the Blackburn AnyValve Head which automatically adjusts to fit Presta, Schrader or Dunlop. SO, it's easy to figure it out. The Mammoth weighs just 157 grams and features a rubberized folding T-handle for a solid grip and easy pumping without the extra effort, and Blackburn's lifetime warranty means it may be the last pump you ever buy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Upb7paY%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00470SAGK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 14.96}}
{"item_id": "B004717TEI", "title": "US PeaceKeeper Armorer's Tool Case", "description": "The Armorer’s Tool Case was designed to take the “basics” on the road. With four (4) deep, Velcro-covered pockets to house smaller tools and spare parts, two Velcro straps to secure hammers, screwdrivers, wrenches, and/or AR multi-tools, and two larger inner pockets for other large tools, the Armorer’s Case can be easily configured to its mission by the armorer. One Large Zippered Outer pocket is perfect for holding plastic organizers of small parts or other larger tools.", "text": "US PeaceKeeper Armorer's Tool Case The Armorer’s Tool Case was designed to take the “basics” on the road. With four (4) deep, Velcro-covered pockets to house smaller tools and spare parts, two Velcro straps to secure hammers, screwdrivers, wrenches, and/or AR multi-tools, and two larger inner pockets for other large tools, the Armorer’s Case can be easily configured to its mission by the armorer. One Large Zippered Outer pocket is perfect for holding plastic organizers of small parts or other larger tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ImWorZniL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004717TEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US PeaceKeeper Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 28.13}}
{"item_id": "B004725Y9E", "title": "BackJoy Relief+ Cushion (Black, 120-300-Pound)", "description": "The Relief+ creates Dynamic Sitting, which transforms any sitting surface into a comfortable one by stabilizing the pelvis and spine to maintain back health, engage core muscles and encourage optimal posture. with the addition of memory foam, the BackJoy Relief+ automatically adjusts with your body as you move, to provide you with premium comfort.", "text": "BackJoy Relief+ Cushion (Black, 120-300-Pound) The Relief+ creates Dynamic Sitting, which transforms any sitting surface into a comfortable one by stabilizing the pelvis and spine to maintain back health, engage core muscles and encourage optimal posture. with the addition of memory foam, the BackJoy Relief+ automatically adjusts with your body as you move, to provide you with premium comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fJjv4UiTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004725Y9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BackJoy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B004741RCA", "title": "CAP Barbell Standard Grip Plate", "description": "CAP Barbell's Standard Grip Plates come in a variety of different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. 3 hole grip design allows for easy and safe handling. The plates accomodate 1\" bars. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training.", "text": "CAP Barbell Standard Grip Plate CAP Barbell's Standard Grip Plates come in a variety of different weight levels to allow the user a customized workout. Machined center hole w/ baked enamel finish. 3 hole grip design allows for easy and safe handling. The plates accomodate 1\" bars. Ideal for cardio vascular fitness and strength training.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NJKqfw6rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004741RCA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004745RB2", "title": "T-Core Fitness Trainer for Men", "description": "The T-Core Fitness Trainer for men is designed to build core strength and tone your lower abs, upper abs, and obliques in a quick, six-minute routine. The T-Core Trainer allows you to perform ab crunches from a seated position, reducing the neck and shoulder strain of typical crunches. The trainer's adjustable resistance bands provide three levels of progressive resistance in increments of 40, 80, and 120 pounds to ensure an effective, ab-burning workout. And, thanks to a unique swivel pad, you can move your crunch from side to side to target your obliques and work your entire core. The T-Core Fitness Trainer comes complete with a six-minute upper body workout DVD that will guide your workout and help you achieve the results you are looking for.", "text": "T-Core Fitness Trainer for Men The T-Core Fitness Trainer for men is designed to build core strength and tone your lower abs, upper abs, and obliques in a quick, six-minute routine. The T-Core Trainer allows you to perform ab crunches from a seated position, reducing the neck and shoulder strain of typical crunches. The trainer's adjustable resistance bands provide three levels of progressive resistance in increments of 40, 80, and 120 pounds to ensure an effective, ab-burning workout. And, thanks to a unique swivel pad, you can move your crunch from side to side to target your obliques and work your entire core. The T-Core Fitness Trainer comes complete with a six-minute upper body workout DVD that will guide your workout and help you achieve the results you are looking for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51i10kMSH4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004745RB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "T-Core", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 29.79}}
{"item_id": "B00474F1MC", "title": "Inside the Pants Holster for Ruger LCP", "description": "This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn either right or left handed, anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Inside the Pants Holster for Ruger LCP This is a slim-line soft sided holster designed for use inside the waistband of slacks or skirts. The metal clip can be moved from side to side so it can be worn either right or left handed, anywhere around the waist. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun. It is constructed of a three layer nylon laminate that includes a sturdy exterior, vapor barrier and soft lined interior allowing a rapid unobstructed draw. It includes a non-glare hardened steel spring clip. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LGmtdycqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00474F1MC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00474LZ1I", "title": "Shears; EMT/Scissors combo pack w/holster -Tactical All Black", "description": "", "text": "Shears; EMT/Scissors combo pack w/holster -Tactical All Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IVZQnrAgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00474LZ1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rescue Essentials", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 15.67}}
{"item_id": "B00474R84G", "title": "Planet Bike 7058 Cascadia Fender Set Road (35mm wide)", "description": "Our Top-of-the-Line fenders", "text": "Planet Bike 7058 Cascadia Fender Set Road (35mm wide) Our Top-of-the-Line fenders", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qdne1YoHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00474R84G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 52.25}}
{"item_id": "B00475RIYU", "title": "Lifefactory 9-Ounce Glass Beverage Bottle, Ocean", "description": "Lifefactory creates innovative, non-toxic products that make it easy to lead a healthy and eco-conscious lifestyle. They fuse modern sensibility, composition, and exceptional utility to produce a glass beverage bottle that is free of known harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalate, PVC, and polycarbonate. All materials are FDA approved. The unique patent pending silicone sleeve is free of plastics, 100-Percent non-toxic, provides a great gripping surface and helps prevent breakage. The benefit of using a glass beverage bottle is that there is no risk of chemicals leaching into your drink and no metallic taste. Reusable as a snack or juice container, perfect for lunch boxes. Beverage bottles are easy clean and dishwasher safe (the glass bottle and silicone sleeve can also be washed together in the dishwasher). Each bottle holds 9 -ounce (260ml) and measures 6.75 x 2-Inch. Available in 4 great colors!", "text": "Lifefactory 9-Ounce Glass Beverage Bottle, Ocean Lifefactory creates innovative, non-toxic products that make it easy to lead a healthy and eco-conscious lifestyle. They fuse modern sensibility, composition, and exceptional utility to produce a glass beverage bottle that is free of known harmful chemicals such as BPA, phthalate, PVC, and polycarbonate. All materials are FDA approved. The unique patent pending silicone sleeve is free of plastics, 100-Percent non-toxic, provides a great gripping surface and helps prevent breakage. The benefit of using a glass beverage bottle is that there is no risk of chemicals leaching into your drink and no metallic taste. Reusable as a snack or juice container, perfect for lunch boxes. Beverage bottles are easy clean and dishwasher safe (the glass bottle and silicone sleeve can also be washed together in the dishwasher). Each bottle holds 9 -ounce (260ml) and measures 6.75 x 2-Inch. Available in 4 great colors!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IfGqQgomL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00475RIYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifefactory", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.41}}
{"item_id": "B00476PE8G", "title": "ProMag AK-47/SAIGA/STG-2000 Dragunov with Side Rail Picatinny Scope Mount, Black", "description": "The mount attaches directly to AK-47 type rifle with the attaching iron of the left hand side of the receiver. Accepts Weaver style rings on the Picatinny rail.", "text": "ProMag AK-47/SAIGA/STG-2000 Dragunov with Side Rail Picatinny Scope Mount, Black The mount attaches directly to AK-47 type rifle with the attaching iron of the left hand side of the receiver. Accepts Weaver style rings on the Picatinny rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k7i8RuTgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00476PE8G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 32.44}}
{"item_id": "B00476U9U4", "title": "Thule Transport Cargo Duffel Bag (38 Litre)", "description": "The Thule Crossover Cargo Duffel features two convenient sizes (38L and 70L) to work inside Thule Cargo Boxes, trunks, or storage areas. Sized to fit within most Thule cargo boxes. Made from durable materials and metal hardware. Water-resistant materials and a durable polyurethane base ensure your gear is protected from the elements. Cast hardware adds extra durability and creates a recognizable Thule look and feel. Side grab handles and a side zipper entry allow for easy access when stored in a Thule Cargo Box. Large zipper access in the top of the duffel enables easy storage of boots, helmets, climbing gear, or other large items. Large looped zipper pulls designed for use with winter gloves. Designated name and content tag for easy identification.", "text": "Thule Transport Cargo Duffel Bag (38 Litre) The Thule Crossover Cargo Duffel features two convenient sizes (38L and 70L) to work inside Thule Cargo Boxes, trunks, or storage areas. Sized to fit within most Thule cargo boxes. Made from durable materials and metal hardware. Water-resistant materials and a durable polyurethane base ensure your gear is protected from the elements. Cast hardware adds extra durability and creates a recognizable Thule look and feel. Side grab handles and a side zipper entry allow for easy access when stored in a Thule Cargo Box. Large zipper access in the top of the duffel enables easy storage of boots, helmets, climbing gear, or other large items. Large looped zipper pulls designed for use with winter gloves. Designated name and content tag for easy identification.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415-P4JbopL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00476U9U4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00478M1MG", "title": "GSI Super Quality 3-In-1 Portable Outdoor Exercise Data Digital Compass - Professional Stopwatch And Thermometer - For Walking, Running, Jogging And All Outdoor Activities", "description": "Multi Function New Exercise Clock from GSI - For All Forms Of Indoor-Outdoor Activities. Keeping Data Has Become an Integral Part Of Training and Sports Exercising, and the GCP603CPN was designed with all functions and features you can possible want. Easy, User-Friendly and Affordable, it is a great alternative to other pricier Models Out There!", "text": "GSI Super Quality 3-In-1 Portable Outdoor Exercise Data Digital Compass - Professional Stopwatch And Thermometer - For Walking, Running, Jogging And All Outdoor Activities Multi Function New Exercise Clock from GSI - For All Forms Of Indoor-Outdoor Activities. Keeping Data Has Become an Integral Part Of Training and Sports Exercising, and the GCP603CPN was designed with all functions and features you can possible want. Easy, User-Friendly and Affordable, it is a great alternative to other pricier Models Out There!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317etsuXSpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00478M1MG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B00479OXWQ", "title": "Bell Muni Bicycle Road Helmet", "description": "", "text": "Bell Muni Bicycle Road Helmet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n2BK1WjAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00479OXWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00479R2Y2", "title": "Bell Arella Bicycle Road Helmet", "description": "The all-new Muni takes the mantle of Bell urban helmets to a new level with outstanding functionality, great features, and well-mannered design and graphics. Visibility is a big part of the Muni story, with a pair of integrated rear flashing lights which come as standard equipment. A rear strap allows even more lighting to be added by simply clipping on a rear flasher, while a sleek, seamless perch built into the new Blade Visor Plus accommodates the diminutive but bright Blackburn Front Flea light, strap adjustments and sizing are nearly automatic thanks to the helmet's OneStep plus fit system that - after a couple quick out-of-the-box adjustments - snugs to a custom fit every time you ride. Carrying over from its predecessors, the Metropolis and Citi, is the Flip Mirror - a super adjustable mirror that clips to special grooves in the visor and stows away neatly when not in use. Rounding out the package is a ratcheting buckle which provides easy fitting with its subtle adjustment range.", "text": "Bell Arella Bicycle Road Helmet The all-new Muni takes the mantle of Bell urban helmets to a new level with outstanding functionality, great features, and well-mannered design and graphics. Visibility is a big part of the Muni story, with a pair of integrated rear flashing lights which come as standard equipment. A rear strap allows even more lighting to be added by simply clipping on a rear flasher, while a sleek, seamless perch built into the new Blade Visor Plus accommodates the diminutive but bright Blackburn Front Flea light, strap adjustments and sizing are nearly automatic thanks to the helmet's OneStep plus fit system that - after a couple quick out-of-the-box adjustments - snugs to a custom fit every time you ride. Carrying over from its predecessors, the Metropolis and Citi, is the Flip Mirror - a super adjustable mirror that clips to special grooves in the visor and stows away neatly when not in use. Rounding out the package is a ratcheting buckle which provides easy fitting with its subtle adjustment range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I6-L1hcGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00479R2Y2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0047D248C", "title": "Minus33 Merino Wool Midweight Neck Gaiter, Black, One Size", "description": "Minus33 Merino Wool is water repellent, naturally elastic & long-wearing for years of comfort. Our clothing is made of the finest natural Merino Wool, which is specially processed to create a soft and supple garment that is both washable and dryable. Our Merino Wool wicks moisture away from the skin 30% faster than any synthetic and, unlike synthetic fabrics, it's naturally flame retardant.", "text": "Minus33 Merino Wool Midweight Neck Gaiter, Black, One Size Minus33 Merino Wool is water repellent, naturally elastic & long-wearing for years of comfort. Our clothing is made of the finest natural Merino Wool, which is specially processed to create a soft and supple garment that is both washable and dryable. Our Merino Wool wicks moisture away from the skin 30% faster than any synthetic and, unlike synthetic fabrics, it's naturally flame retardant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v3bMK4w0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047D248C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0047D6XA2", "title": "Emergency Mylar Blanket 52\" x 84\" - Pack of 12 Blankets", "description": "The Mylar Emergency blankets are designed to reflect heat back to body, or deflect heat when used as a shelter from the sun. Prevents post accident shock by retaining the patient's body heat. Keep these Emergency Mylar Blankets in your Auto, boat, motorcycle, first aid kit and emergency kit - just in case.", "text": "Emergency Mylar Blanket 52\" x 84\" - Pack of 12 Blankets The Mylar Emergency blankets are designed to reflect heat back to body, or deflect heat when used as a shelter from the sun. Prevents post accident shock by retaining the patient's body heat. Keep these Emergency Mylar Blankets in your Auto, boat, motorcycle, first aid kit and emergency kit - just in case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XxlTGmkBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047D6XA2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PrimaCare Medical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 7.32}}
