{"item_id": "B0047DWQCQ", "title": "Cannon Safe Inc. SSL-03-Electronic Lock Security Safe Light", "description": "Designed to make opening a safe in a dark place fast and simple. This compact light allows you to quickly and clearly see your safe's controls while giving you discreet access-all without impairing night vision. Requires no hardware as it mounts using a strong magnetic back and also becomes a mini flashlight once safe is opened.", "text": "Cannon Safe Inc. SSL-03-Electronic Lock Security Safe Light Designed to make opening a safe in a dark place fast and simple. This compact light allows you to quickly and clearly see your safe's controls while giving you discreet access-all without impairing night vision. Requires no hardware as it mounts using a strong magnetic back and also becomes a mini flashlight once safe is opened.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JTXg5gSqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047DWQCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cannon Safe Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 12.97}}
{"item_id": "B0047DWQDK", "title": "Cannon Safe Inc. SSL-04-Mechanical Lock Security Safe Light", "description": "Designed to make opening a safe in a dark place fast and simple. This compact light allows you to quickly and clearly see your safe's controls while giving you discreet access-all without impairing night vision. Requires no hardware as it mounts using a strong magnetic back and also becomes a mini flashlight once safe is opened.", "text": "Cannon Safe Inc. SSL-04-Mechanical Lock Security Safe Light Designed to make opening a safe in a dark place fast and simple. This compact light allows you to quickly and clearly see your safe's controls while giving you discreet access-all without impairing night vision. Requires no hardware as it mounts using a strong magnetic back and also becomes a mini flashlight once safe is opened.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415j7vlZMuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047DWQDK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cannon Safe Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 12.98}}
{"item_id": "B0047DXB7A", "title": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Mountain Canyon Gel Baggy Padded Cycling Short", "description": "Canari's gel pad uses a revolutionary technology that has continued to provide uncompromisable performance while maintaining flawless function. Gel will virtually eliminate unwanted nerve stress, moderate saddle pressure, and absorb road shock and abrasion. 100% polyester shell nylon/spandex blend liner w/ gel padding 2 side pockets 1 leg pocket with Velcro closure elastic waistband with drawstring, sizing guide.", "text": "Canari Cyclewear Men's Mountain Canyon Gel Baggy Padded Cycling Short Canari's gel pad uses a revolutionary technology that has continued to provide uncompromisable performance while maintaining flawless function. Gel will virtually eliminate unwanted nerve stress, moderate saddle pressure, and absorb road shock and abrasion. 100% polyester shell nylon/spandex blend liner w/ gel padding 2 side pockets 1 leg pocket with Velcro closure elastic waistband with drawstring, sizing guide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413jGoBQKSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047DXB7A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0047EKHUI", "title": "Lasermax Uni-Max® Micro", "description": "Boost your accuracy when lining up your next shot with the LaserMax Uni-Max Micro rail-mount laser. Ultra-lightweight and durable, the Uni-Max Micro fits virtually any firearm with a Picatinny rail, giving you a clear line to your target every time. The laser is equipped with such features as a bright 5 mW constant red beam, adjustable windage and elevation settings, a dual tap-on activation switch for right- and left-handed shooters, and an automatic shutoff after 10 minutes. The Uni-Max Micro runs for more than five hours on a 1/3N lithium battery.SpecificationsCompatibility: Virtually anything with a Picatinny railWavelength: 650 nm (red)Power output: 5 mWBattery type: 1/3N lithiumBattery life: More than 5 hoursAccuracy: User-adjustable for windage and elevationWeight: 0.43 ounces", "text": "Lasermax Uni-Max® Micro Boost your accuracy when lining up your next shot with the LaserMax Uni-Max Micro rail-mount laser. Ultra-lightweight and durable, the Uni-Max Micro fits virtually any firearm with a Picatinny rail, giving you a clear line to your target every time. The laser is equipped with such features as a bright 5 mW constant red beam, adjustable windage and elevation settings, a dual tap-on activation switch for right- and left-handed shooters, and an automatic shutoff after 10 minutes. The Uni-Max Micro runs for more than five hours on a 1/3N lithium battery.SpecificationsCompatibility: Virtually anything with a Picatinny railWavelength: 650 nm (red)Power output: 5 mWBattery type: 1/3N lithiumBattery life: More than 5 hoursAccuracy: User-adjustable for windage and elevationWeight: 0.43 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411sbkA8JxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047EKHUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserMax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 100.65}}
