{"item_id": "B0047Q3PRS", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool CRKT 6773Z Crawford Kasper Teflon Blade Knife", "description": "CRKT Crawford Kasper.5 3/8\" closed linerlock. 3 7/8\" 8Cr14MoV stainless modified drop point blade with gray corrosion-resistant coating. Black Zytel handles. Lanyard hole. Black finish stainless pocket clip.BRK Exclusive!", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool CRKT 6773Z Crawford Kasper Teflon Blade Knife CRKT Crawford Kasper.5 3/8\" closed linerlock. 3 7/8\" 8Cr14MoV stainless modified drop point blade with gray corrosion-resistant coating. Black Zytel handles. Lanyard hole. Black finish stainless pocket clip.BRK Exclusive!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213oNrR0RAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047Q3PRS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.71}}
{"item_id": "B0047Q72BS", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool CRKT 6803Z Ryan Seven Linerlock Knife", "description": "CRKT 6803Z Ryan Seven Linerlock Folder Knife. Measures 8\" in open position, 4 1/2\" closed linerlock features the auto LAWKS safety system. 3 1/2\" 8Cr14MoVstainless steel modified drop point blade in black finish coated. Blade features enlarged dual thumbstuds for easy opening. The handle is black deeply textured Zytel cutout that gives the knife the most secure possible grip with lanyard hole and removable stainless pocket clip.", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool CRKT 6803Z Ryan Seven Linerlock Knife CRKT 6803Z Ryan Seven Linerlock Folder Knife. Measures 8\" in open position, 4 1/2\" closed linerlock features the auto LAWKS safety system. 3 1/2\" 8Cr14MoVstainless steel modified drop point blade in black finish coated. Blade features enlarged dual thumbstuds for easy opening. The handle is black deeply textured Zytel cutout that gives the knife the most secure possible grip with lanyard hole and removable stainless pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3179IhQI2FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047Q72BS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 18.97}}
{"item_id": "B0047QI5U0", "title": "RUGER MINI 14 MINI 30 RANCH RIFLE SCOPE MOUNT BLACK", "description": "AIM SPORTS INC FEATURE Ruger Ranch Rifle Rail black Matt Add a Picantinny Rail in the scope ring slots of your Ruger Mini-14 Ranch or Mini-30 Ranch Rifle.", "text": "RUGER MINI 14 MINI 30 RANCH RIFLE SCOPE MOUNT BLACK AIM SPORTS INC FEATURE Ruger Ranch Rifle Rail black Matt Add a Picantinny Rail in the scope ring slots of your Ruger Mini-14 Ranch or Mini-30 Ranch Rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RYhBQTLqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047QI5U0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 15.8}}
{"item_id": "B0047QV0AM", "title": "Katadyn Hiker Microfilter", "description": "FEATURES of the Katadyn Hiker Microfilter Very compact and lightweight - only 11 oz Chosen \"Best in the bunch by a long shot\" in major test for ease-of-use The lowest maintenance backpacking filter available SPECIFICATIONS of the Katadyn Hiker Microfilter Micro Filtration Method: Antic log Technology: 129 square inches of pleated 0.3 micron glassfiber media Activated Carbon Core: reduces unpleasant tastes and odor from water Output: Up to 1 quart (1 liter)/minute (48 strokes/minute) Cartridge Capacity: 200 gallons (750 liters), depending on water quality Weight: 11 oz Height: 6.5\" Includes: Prefilter, Universal Bottle Adaptor and Carry Bag This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "Katadyn Hiker Microfilter FEATURES of the Katadyn Hiker Microfilter Very compact and lightweight - only 11 oz Chosen \"Best in the bunch by a long shot\" in major test for ease-of-use The lowest maintenance backpacking filter available SPECIFICATIONS of the Katadyn Hiker Microfilter Micro Filtration Method: Antic log Technology: 129 square inches of pleated 0.3 micron glassfiber media Activated Carbon Core: reduces unpleasant tastes and odor from water Output: Up to 1 quart (1 liter)/minute (48 strokes/minute) Cartridge Capacity: 200 gallons (750 liters), depending on water quality Weight: 11 oz Height: 6.5\" Includes: Prefilter, Universal Bottle Adaptor and Carry Bag This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q9pa7LNKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047QV0AM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Katadyn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 66.74}}
{"item_id": "B0047QXY3S", "title": "Tapco Intrafuse RAZR AK Muzzle Brake", "description": "In the market for a new muzzle brake? Tired of the endless parade of boring muzzle brakes that all look the same? Do you want something that is functional but at the same time brings some intensity to your AK? If you've been answering yes while reading this, then the Intrafuse AK RAZR Muzzle Brake is the one for you. This coated steel muzzle brake is U.S. made and has four pronged tips shaped to penetrate wood, sheet-rock, and glass for any tactical situation. The brake is designed to fit standard left hand threaded AK models and is backed by a lifetime guarantee.", "text": "Tapco Intrafuse RAZR AK Muzzle Brake In the market for a new muzzle brake? Tired of the endless parade of boring muzzle brakes that all look the same? Do you want something that is functional but at the same time brings some intensity to your AK? If you've been answering yes while reading this, then the Intrafuse AK RAZR Muzzle Brake is the one for you. This coated steel muzzle brake is U.S. made and has four pronged tips shaped to penetrate wood, sheet-rock, and glass for any tactical situation. The brake is designed to fit standard left hand threaded AK models and is backed by a lifetime guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fZpY%2BBCQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047QXY3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tapco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.7}}
