{"item_id": "B0047T4J20", "title": "GunMate Range Bag with Removable Hook and Loop Dividers", "description": "Holds two handguns, spotting scope, shooting glasses, ear protectors, ammo, cleaning supplies, etc.", "text": "GunMate Range Bag with Removable Hook and Loop Dividers Holds two handguns, spotting scope, shooting glasses, ear protectors, ammo, cleaning supplies, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515HAUfSNgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047T4J20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunmate", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 24.52}}
{"item_id": "B0047THVIO", "title": "Malone Stax Pro2 Universal Car Rack Folding Kayak Carrier (2 Boat Carrier)", "description": "The Stax Pro2 from Malone provides an efficient, economical, and safe way to transport two kayaks on factory oval or aftermarket round or square load bars. The Stax Pro2 system features a set of octagonal aluminum posts that mount directly to the rooftop load bars to support the boats, as well as stacker blocks to cradle and stabilize the boats on the bars, 12-foot load straps to secure the boats to the posts, and 12-foot tie downs to secure the boats at their bows and sterns. Thanks to universal-fit JAWS mounting hardware, the posts install to the load bars without tools. Built for a lifetime of use, the aluminum posts and their injection-molded nylon platforms are rust resistant. The posts fold down easily for low clearance and to improve fuel economy when the system is not in use. The foam stacker blocks cradle the boats to both absorb road shock during transit and to stabilize the boats during transport. The combination of sturdy, cam-style H.D. polypropylene load straps and bow and stern tie-downs keeps the boats wobble-free on the road. The Stax Pro2 system comes with all hardware, straps, safety tie-downs, and blocks to carry two kayaks. With additional straps and padding, this carrier can be used to transport up to four boats, stacked side by side, on virtually any vehicle or trailer cross rail system.Key Features:Strong and stable folding aluminum octagon shaped postsFour foam Stacker Blocks hold boats in place during loading and tie down and cushion from the cross bar during transportIndividual strap slots for two kayak transportFolds down for better aerodynamics and low clearance when not in useUniversal Fit JAWZ Mounting Hardware works with round, square and most factory oval cross barsCan assemble or transfer to another vehicle in minutes with \"No Tools Required\"Rust resistant construction12-foot cam style H.D. polypropylene load straps12-foot Bow and Stern safety tie-downsLifetime warrantySpecifications:Capacity: two kayaks from 70 to 80 pounds each and up to 32 inches wideDimensions: 5 by 5 by 20 inches (LxWxH)Frame construction: Aluminum and NylonWhat's in the Box?Two folding vertical Stax Pro carriersTwo universal JAWZ fit mounting blocksFour foam Stacker BlocksFour 12-foot cam buckle strapsOne 9-foot cam buckle strapFour bow and stern safety tie-downsEight 40 and 50-millimeter mounting bolts and T-knobs", "text": "Malone Stax Pro2 Universal Car Rack Folding Kayak Carrier (2 Boat Carrier) The Stax Pro2 from Malone provides an efficient, economical, and safe way to transport two kayaks on factory oval or aftermarket round or square load bars. The Stax Pro2 system features a set of octagonal aluminum posts that mount directly to the rooftop load bars to support the boats, as well as stacker blocks to cradle and stabilize the boats on the bars, 12-foot load straps to secure the boats to the posts, and 12-foot tie downs to secure the boats at their bows and sterns. Thanks to universal-fit JAWS mounting hardware, the posts install to the load bars without tools. Built for a lifetime of use, the aluminum posts and their injection-molded nylon platforms are rust resistant. The posts fold down easily for low clearance and to improve fuel economy when the system is not in use. The foam stacker blocks cradle the boats to both absorb road shock during transit and to stabilize the boats during transport. The combination of sturdy, cam-style H.D. polypropylene load straps and bow and stern tie-downs keeps the boats wobble-free on the road. The Stax Pro2 system comes with all hardware, straps, safety tie-downs, and blocks to carry two kayaks. With additional straps and padding, this carrier can be used to transport up to four boats, stacked side by side, on virtually any vehicle or trailer cross rail system.Key Features:Strong and stable folding aluminum octagon shaped postsFour foam Stacker Blocks hold boats in place during loading and tie down and cushion from the cross bar during transportIndividual strap slots for two kayak transportFolds down for better aerodynamics and low clearance when not in useUniversal Fit JAWZ Mounting Hardware works with round, square and most factory oval cross barsCan assemble or transfer to another vehicle in minutes with \"No Tools Required\"Rust resistant construction12-foot cam style H.D. polypropylene load straps12-foot Bow and Stern safety tie-downsLifetime warrantySpecifications:Capacity: two kayaks from 70 to 80 pounds each and up to 32 inches wideDimensions: 5 by 5 by 20 inches (LxWxH)Frame construction: Aluminum and NylonWhat's in the Box?Two folding vertical Stax Pro carriersTwo universal JAWZ fit mounting blocksFour foam Stacker BlocksFour 12-foot cam buckle strapsOne 9-foot cam buckle strapFour bow and stern safety tie-downsEight 40 and 50-millimeter mounting bolts and T-knobs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lsyr8SZPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047THVIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone Auto Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]], "price": 125.95}}
