{"item_id": "B0047VH0W4", "title": "Giro Surface Multi-Sport Helmet", "description": "Genuine Giro performance meets edgy, urban style. At first glance, the Surface is an understated skate-style helmet with a clean exterior and a fashionable short brim. But beneath the stylish exterior, the In-Form fit system provides comfort and stability. The Surface also offers outstanding ventilation thanks to its deep internal channeling. And lastly, the brim not only gives a nod to style, but keeps the sun out of the rider's eyes while on a commute or a mountain ride. With it's understated style, and disguised add-on features, the Surface is the ideal helmet for urban commuters, all-mountain riders and dirt jumpers.", "text": "Giro Surface Multi-Sport Helmet Genuine Giro performance meets edgy, urban style. At first glance, the Surface is an understated skate-style helmet with a clean exterior and a fashionable short brim. But beneath the stylish exterior, the In-Form fit system provides comfort and stability. The Surface also offers outstanding ventilation thanks to its deep internal channeling. And lastly, the brim not only gives a nod to style, but keeps the sun out of the rider's eyes while on a commute or a mountain ride. With it's understated style, and disguised add-on features, the Surface is the ideal helmet for urban commuters, all-mountain riders and dirt jumpers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UmRvhx8RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0047VH0W4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
