{"item_id": "B00480BLT2", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear 20-60x60 Black Stealth Rubber Armored Sniper Spotter Hunting Spotting Scope + 9\" Tripod+Sunshade+Lens Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 20-60x60 Spotting scope package. The scope's objective diameter is a huge 60mm, and features multi-coated quality lens which will gather and amplify the smallest light for lowlight conditions. The 20x - 60x fully adjustable magfinication will create field of views of 20x - 52FT/1000 YARDS and 60x- 18FT/1000 YARDS. It is coated with Black rubber armor for maximum protection and durability. This scope is also nitrogen filled and O-ring seales for optimal fogproof and waterproof performance. The scope has a soft rubber eyerest for comfortable clear viewing, and also features an extendable sliding sunshade as well as an external quick focus knob! Weight-52 oz Length-16.75\" . Package also includes a 9\" aluminum tripod that has a sturdy panhead with a non-slip platform, a nylon carrying case, and a lens cleaning kit. A favorite with military, law enforcement, range shooters, and hunters.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear 20-60x60 Black Stealth Rubber Armored Sniper Spotter Hunting Spotting Scope + 9\" Tripod+Sunshade+Lens Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 20-60x60 Spotting scope package. The scope's objective diameter is a huge 60mm, and features multi-coated quality lens which will gather and amplify the smallest light for lowlight conditions. The 20x - 60x fully adjustable magfinication will create field of views of 20x - 52FT/1000 YARDS and 60x- 18FT/1000 YARDS. It is coated with Black rubber armor for maximum protection and durability. This scope is also nitrogen filled and O-ring seales for optimal fogproof and waterproof performance. The scope has a soft rubber eyerest for comfortable clear viewing, and also features an extendable sliding sunshade as well as an external quick focus knob! Weight-52 oz Length-16.75\" . Package also includes a 9\" aluminum tripod that has a sturdy panhead with a non-slip platform, a nylon carrying case, and a lens cleaning kit. A favorite with military, law enforcement, range shooters, and hunters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LqavyMDbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00480BLT2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00480H4F2", "title": "Pocket Holster for Ruger LCR 38 Special Revolver", "description": "Designed for the 38 Special 5 shot Ruger LCR revolver, it is a slim-line, soft sided holster with a band of genuine suede wrapped around the outside of the holster. It is designed for use inside the front pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "text": "Pocket Holster for Ruger LCR 38 Special Revolver Designed for the 38 Special 5 shot Ruger LCR revolver, it is a slim-line, soft sided holster with a band of genuine suede wrapped around the outside of the holster. It is designed for use inside the front pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41orOigJl8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00480H4F2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.9}}
{"item_id": "B004835W76", "title": "Elk Ridge 4-Piece Fire Starter Kit with Striker", "description": "Elk Ridge™ products are designed and manufactured to accommodate the rugged outdoor lifestyle. Whether you enjoy fishing, hunting, or camping, our quality products deliver peak performance to further enhance your outdoor experience. Make your outdoor adventure a reality with Elk Ridge™.There simply isn't a more reliable way to start a fire in extreme conditions than the Elk Ridge™ Fire Starter Kit. Don't be caught in the wilderness without this superior tool!", "text": "Elk Ridge 4-Piece Fire Starter Kit with Striker Elk Ridge™ products are designed and manufactured to accommodate the rugged outdoor lifestyle. Whether you enjoy fishing, hunting, or camping, our quality products deliver peak performance to further enhance your outdoor experience. Make your outdoor adventure a reality with Elk Ridge™.There simply isn't a more reliable way to start a fire in extreme conditions than the Elk Ridge™ Fire Starter Kit. Don't be caught in the wilderness without this superior tool!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51C931xsGaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004835W76.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Warmers"]], "price": 9.52}}
{"item_id": "B004889JOS", "title": "Bushwhacker Moab Black - Bicycle Rear / Front Pannier Cycling Rack Pack Bike Bag - w/ Reflective Trim - Sold as Pair", "description": "The large-capacity main compartment of the Moab features covered zippers and adjustable compression straps. Reflective trim increases visibility. Sold as a pair. Dimensions: 10.5\" Length x 4\" Width x 14.5\" Height. Color: Black.", "text": "Bushwhacker Moab Black - Bicycle Rear / Front Pannier Cycling Rack Pack Bike Bag - w/ Reflective Trim - Sold as Pair The large-capacity main compartment of the Moab features covered zippers and adjustable compression straps. Reflective trim increases visibility. Sold as a pair. Dimensions: 10.5\" Length x 4\" Width x 14.5\" Height. Color: Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417SarVzEoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004889JOS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 47.45}}
{"item_id": "B00488NNCM", "title": "Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar", "description": "Lock-Jaw Pro 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar, Weight: 13 ounces / set The Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar is an ideal choice for all bumper plate workouts. An easy to use permanent snap-latch keeps the collar secure throughout your most brutal workouts. 10x stronger retention force than traditional spring collars, the Lock-Jaw Pro will help prolong the life of your bumper plates. The Lock-Jaw Pro Collar features a solid-core injection molded nylon resin frame and injection molded pressure pads, making it nearly unbreakable! One hand installation and removal is easy with the large locking lever. A permanent spring snap-latch keeps the collar secured on the bar through the most brutal workouts. Innovative design, superior durability, and exceptional performance make the Lock-Jaw Pro Collar an excellent choice for CrossFit and all bumper plate workouts. Lock-Jaw Collars will help prolong the life of your bumper plates by keeping them secure throughout your workout. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT 13.0 Ounces (0.80 lb per set) DIMENSIONS 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL Proprietary Nylon Resin U.S. PATENT #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY 1 Year MASTER CARTON 50 Sets", "text": "Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar Lock-Jaw Pro 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar, Weight: 13 ounces / set The Lock-Jaw Pro Barbell Collar is an ideal choice for all bumper plate workouts. An easy to use permanent snap-latch keeps the collar secure throughout your most brutal workouts. 10x stronger retention force than traditional spring collars, the Lock-Jaw Pro will help prolong the life of your bumper plates. The Lock-Jaw Pro Collar features a solid-core injection molded nylon resin frame and injection molded pressure pads, making it nearly unbreakable! One hand installation and removal is easy with the large locking lever. A permanent spring snap-latch keeps the collar secured on the bar through the most brutal workouts. Innovative design, superior durability, and exceptional performance make the Lock-Jaw Pro Collar an excellent choice for CrossFit and all bumper plate workouts. Lock-Jaw Collars will help prolong the life of your bumper plates by keeping them secure throughout your workout. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT 13.0 Ounces (0.80 lb per set) DIMENSIONS 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL Proprietary Nylon Resin U.S. PATENT #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY 1 Year MASTER CARTON 50 Sets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HUBqVW5UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00488NNCM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Power Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 30.72}}
{"item_id": "B00488R666", "title": "Weaver Deluxe Scope Mounting Kit with Lap Tools", "description": "Now you can easily interchange optics on your firearms with professional-grade tools. The comprehensive Weaver Deluxe Scope Mounting Kit with Lap Tools contains all the components for precision scope mounting and maintenance. A torque wrench ensures you won't over-tighten your optics, while Weaver SureThread adhesive helps prevent the loosening of mounting screws from shock and vibrations generated by recoil. Quality components provide tooling options for all your mounting tasks. If you like testing different scopes on different firearms, or simply find yourself buying and mounting a lot of optics, then you need one of Weaver's new Scope Mounting Kits.", "text": "Weaver Deluxe Scope Mounting Kit with Lap Tools Now you can easily interchange optics on your firearms with professional-grade tools. The comprehensive Weaver Deluxe Scope Mounting Kit with Lap Tools contains all the components for precision scope mounting and maintenance. A torque wrench ensures you won't over-tighten your optics, while Weaver SureThread adhesive helps prevent the loosening of mounting screws from shock and vibrations generated by recoil. Quality components provide tooling options for all your mounting tasks. If you like testing different scopes on different firearms, or simply find yourself buying and mounting a lot of optics, then you need one of Weaver's new Scope Mounting Kits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31z8AuO88YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00488R666.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 94.49}}
