{"item_id": "B0048FMEN4", "title": "Bell 15 Function Wireless Cyclocomputer", "description": "Track your speed, distance, calories burned, and more with the Bell 15-function wireless cycling computer. The computer--which is equipped with a large, backlit screen--is predominantly a speedometer, with display options for current, average, and maximum speed, along with current-to-average speed and speed tendencies. The computer also includes an odometer that measures your overall and trip distance, a trip timer, a 12/24-hour clock, and a thermometer. And to ensure that you're getting the most from your workout, the computer displays your total calories and fat calories burned. Other functions include scan and freeze frame memory.The computer, which installs tool-free, comes with a pair of CR2032 batteries.", "text": "Bell 15 Function Wireless Cyclocomputer Track your speed, distance, calories burned, and more with the Bell 15-function wireless cycling computer. The computer--which is equipped with a large, backlit screen--is predominantly a speedometer, with display options for current, average, and maximum speed, along with current-to-average speed and speed tendencies. The computer also includes an odometer that measures your overall and trip distance, a trip timer, a 12/24-hour clock, and a thermometer. And to ensure that you're getting the most from your workout, the computer displays your total calories and fat calories burned. Other functions include scan and freeze frame memory.The computer, which installs tool-free, comes with a pair of CR2032 batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e7QRUSblL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048FMEN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 19.14}}
{"item_id": "B0048FU4F4", "title": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Meadowlark Lightweight has long been one of the bestselling knives in Spyderco's value-priced byrd line of cutlery, and this second generation model offers several design improvements over the original. Upgrades include a full flat-ground blade, proprietary Bi-Directional Textured finish for nonslip performance, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for exacting blade operation. Jimping along the spine and choil create a solid grip in your hand, and a four-position clip enables a variety of carrying positions.Specifications6.8-inch open lengthFour-inch closed length2.875-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade2.4-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.9-ounce weightG-10 handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Meadowlark2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife The Meadowlark Lightweight has long been one of the bestselling knives in Spyderco's value-priced byrd line of cutlery, and this second generation model offers several design improvements over the original. Upgrades include a full flat-ground blade, proprietary Bi-Directional Textured finish for nonslip performance, and phosphor bronze pivot washers for exacting blade operation. Jimping along the spine and choil create a solid grip in your hand, and a four-position clip enables a variety of carrying positions.Specifications6.8-inch open lengthFour-inch closed length2.875-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade2.4-inch cutting edge0.47-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.9-ounce weightG-10 handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E6LEb8GbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048FU4F4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.75}}
{"item_id": "B0048GRV90", "title": "Everlast New Punch Mitts", "description": "These durable punching mitts, from leading boxing gear maker Everlast, help boxers sharpen their technique. Made of durable, premium synthetic polycanvas for long lasting durability and functionality, they feature an improved design to increase functionality by including a full glove backing.A must have for any serious boxing training session, punching mitts help you hone technique while protecting your partner's hands.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "text": "Everlast New Punch Mitts These durable punching mitts, from leading boxing gear maker Everlast, help boxers sharpen their technique. Made of durable, premium synthetic polycanvas for long lasting durability and functionality, they feature an improved design to increase functionality by including a full glove backing.A must have for any serious boxing training session, punching mitts help you hone technique while protecting your partner's hands.About EverlastThe preeminent brand in boxing since 1910, Everlast is a leader in the design, manufacturing, licensing, and marketing of authentic boxing, mixed martial arts, and fitness-related sporting goods equipment, apparel, footwear, and accessories. From heavyweight champion Jack Dempsey and middleweight legend Sugar Ray Robinson to middleweight champion Jermain Taylor and UFC heavyweight champion Randy Couture, Everlast is the brand of choice for generations of professional fighters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wzoIy8-uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048GRV90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Everlast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punch Mitts"]], "price": 21.96}}
{"item_id": "B0048GSXRE", "title": "Bob Allen Black Deluxe Shooting Gloves", "description": "Our deluxe shooting gloves are constructed of a synthetic leather back for maximum durability with a leather palm. Hook and loop wrist closure with a large back ventilation port. Perforated fingers with articulated knuckles for increased flexibility. Black.", "text": "Bob Allen Black Deluxe Shooting Gloves Our deluxe shooting gloves are constructed of a synthetic leather back for maximum durability with a leather palm. Hook and loop wrist closure with a large back ventilation port. Perforated fingers with articulated knuckles for increased flexibility. Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LTSRfVJHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048GSXRE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
