{"item_id": "B0048H0AV0", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Black Drop Leg Springfield Armory XD Pistol/Gun Holster + Magazine Pouch", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation tactical drop leg pistol holster with spare mag pouch- Black Color Right Handed. Designed to fit medium to larger size auto's via a velcro closure opening. Constructed of premium grade lightweight ballistic weatherproof nylon for extreme conditions, and features a double thumb break security system which will ensure full safe control of your holstered weapon. The holster has soft padded \"non slip\" interior lining to protect your firearm with military-law enforcement quality. Features a convenient quick release buckle system, this holster has a fully adjustable belt hanger to customize the height to your specification, as well as a fully adjustable and removable leg strap for maximum comfort and ease. This holster also is equipped with a spare magazine pouch that has a velcro closure to keep extra ammo at the ready.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Black Drop Leg Springfield Armory XD Pistol/Gun Holster + Magazine Pouch Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation tactical drop leg pistol holster with spare mag pouch- Black Color Right Handed. Designed to fit medium to larger size auto's via a velcro closure opening. Constructed of premium grade lightweight ballistic weatherproof nylon for extreme conditions, and features a double thumb break security system which will ensure full safe control of your holstered weapon. The holster has soft padded \"non slip\" interior lining to protect your firearm with military-law enforcement quality. Features a convenient quick release buckle system, this holster has a fully adjustable belt hanger to customize the height to your specification, as well as a fully adjustable and removable leg strap for maximum comfort and ease. This holster also is equipped with a spare magazine pouch that has a velcro closure to keep extra ammo at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GmTdOrkRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048H0AV0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B0048HG3G6", "title": "Zefal Universal Patch Kit Hanging with Levers", "description": "Includes 8 patches tube of cement and sand paper all in plastic case. The new design also has a pin to press a schrader valve to release any air in the tube. Patches seal great with tapered edges.", "text": "Zefal Universal Patch Kit Hanging with Levers Includes 8 patches tube of cement and sand paper all in plastic case. The new design also has a pin to press a schrader valve to release any air in the tube. Patches seal great with tapered edges.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nUHhDew4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048HG3G6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zefal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 3.02}}
{"item_id": "B0048HKIEE", "title": "Minus33 Merino Wool Ski and Snowboard Sock", "description": "Accessories are the finishing details that complete an outfit. Our accessories compliment the warmth and comfort you've come to expect from Minus33 Merino Wool. We have Balaclavas, Hats, and Neck Gators for your head; Merino Wool Glove Liners for your hands; and a wide variety of stylish Merino Wool socks for your feet. With an array of weights, colors and styles, our accessories will complete your look. You want to feel warm and look great, whether it's an Expedition to the frigid expanses of Antarctica or a walk through New York's Central Park. From head to toe, finish your outfit in style with the soft comfort of Minus33's Merino Wool Accessories.", "text": "Minus33 Merino Wool Ski and Snowboard Sock Accessories are the finishing details that complete an outfit. Our accessories compliment the warmth and comfort you've come to expect from Minus33 Merino Wool. We have Balaclavas, Hats, and Neck Gators for your head; Merino Wool Glove Liners for your hands; and a wide variety of stylish Merino Wool socks for your feet. With an array of weights, colors and styles, our accessories will complete your look. You want to feel warm and look great, whether it's an Expedition to the frigid expanses of Antarctica or a walk through New York's Central Park. From head to toe, finish your outfit in style with the soft comfort of Minus33's Merino Wool Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gouhrdlCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048HKIEE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0048HQSE8", "title": "Camp Chef SPSET Spatula Set- Stainless Steel", "description": "Camp Chef SPSET Spoon - Stainless SteelCombining some simple elements, the professional spatula set simplifies the experience of cooking outdoors.This set contains both a deluxe pancake flipper and a heavy duty turner/scraper. The beveled edges and long blades get under your food much easier than a standard spatula. Also, blades made from a flexible stainless steel greatly extends the lifetimeof these cooking essentials.", "text": "Camp Chef SPSET Spatula Set- Stainless Steel Camp Chef SPSET Spoon - Stainless SteelCombining some simple elements, the professional spatula set simplifies the experience of cooking outdoors.This set contains both a deluxe pancake flipper and a heavy duty turner/scraper. The beveled edges and long blades get under your food much easier than a standard spatula. Also, blades made from a flexible stainless steel greatly extends the lifetimeof these cooking essentials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RJiD%2BDCJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048HQSE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0048HS02G", "title": "Proform 505 CST Treadmill (2014 Model)", "description": "The ProForm 505 CST Treadmill is packed with features designed to get you fast results. This treadmill delivers workouts powered by Google Maps, training with Jillian Michaels and automatic speed and incline controls. The 505 CST features comfortable ProShox Lite 3 cushioning and convenient QuickSpeed and Quick-Incline controls. Other features include 15 workout apps, a compatible music port for your iPod or MP3 player, and a 25-year motor warranty.ProShox Lite 3 CushioningMaximize your joint protection with the comfort and innovation of ProShox Lite 3.Space Saver DesignTo give you more room to stretch, or to stretch the room you have, the deck folds vertically for storage.Dual-Grip EKG Heart Rate MonitorMake the most out of every workout by monitoring your heart rate with these built-in handlebar sensors to ensure you're in the right training zone for your goals.6-inch Backlit DisplayPerfectly clear and easy to read, this 6-inch display has a large viewing angle so no matter how tall or short you are, you can always keep track of your workout progress.15 Workout AppsGet the workout you want with the 15 built-in workout apps, created by a certified personal yrainer. Choose from time, distance, or calorie-goal workouts to get the results you want. The simple navigation of the apps makes it quick and easy to pick up your workout and get going.Compatible Music Port for iPodMove to the beat of your favorite music with this built-in sound system. Plug your iPod or MP3 Player into the Interplay music port for unbeatable sound quality. With the iPod resting on the console shelf, it's within easy reach and leaves the controls right at your fingertips.Intermix Acoustics 2.0 Sound SystemEnjoy your favorite media with this built-in sound system that produces a broad range of frequencies and rich, equalized sound.2.25 CHP Mach Z MotorExperience expanded power with this quiet, self-cooling drive system. Employing an axial fan, this motor reduces noise as it cools internal components and enhances your workout environment and extending the motor's life.0 to 10 percent Quick Incline ControlThe best and most convenient incline adjustment, the Quick Incline control allows you to change the incline with the single touch of a button instead of tediously scrolling through options as you would with traditional incline controls.Roomy TreadbeltA vital component of the drive system, this 20- by 50-inch treadmill belt is designed to operate both smoother and quieter than the average treadmill belt.0 to 10 MPH QuickSpeed ControlInstead of tediously scrolling through options, the QuickSpeed control allows you to instantly change the speed of the treadmill between 0 to 10 miles per hour with the single touch of a button.Specifications:Weight Capacity: 300 poundsWarranty: Lifetime frame; 25-Year motor; 1-year parts & laborDimensions: 70 by 34 by 59.5 inches (L x W x H)Treadbelt: 20 by 55 inches", "text": "Proform 505 CST Treadmill (2014 Model) The ProForm 505 CST Treadmill is packed with features designed to get you fast results. This treadmill delivers workouts powered by Google Maps, training with Jillian Michaels and automatic speed and incline controls. The 505 CST features comfortable ProShox Lite 3 cushioning and convenient QuickSpeed and Quick-Incline controls. Other features include 15 workout apps, a compatible music port for your iPod or MP3 player, and a 25-year motor warranty.ProShox Lite 3 CushioningMaximize your joint protection with the comfort and innovation of ProShox Lite 3.Space Saver DesignTo give you more room to stretch, or to stretch the room you have, the deck folds vertically for storage.Dual-Grip EKG Heart Rate MonitorMake the most out of every workout by monitoring your heart rate with these built-in handlebar sensors to ensure you're in the right training zone for your goals.6-inch Backlit DisplayPerfectly clear and easy to read, this 6-inch display has a large viewing angle so no matter how tall or short you are, you can always keep track of your workout progress.15 Workout AppsGet the workout you want with the 15 built-in workout apps, created by a certified personal yrainer. Choose from time, distance, or calorie-goal workouts to get the results you want. The simple navigation of the apps makes it quick and easy to pick up your workout and get going.Compatible Music Port for iPodMove to the beat of your favorite music with this built-in sound system. Plug your iPod or MP3 Player into the Interplay music port for unbeatable sound quality. With the iPod resting on the console shelf, it's within easy reach and leaves the controls right at your fingertips.Intermix Acoustics 2.0 Sound SystemEnjoy your favorite media with this built-in sound system that produces a broad range of frequencies and rich, equalized sound.2.25 CHP Mach Z MotorExperience expanded power with this quiet, self-cooling drive system. Employing an axial fan, this motor reduces noise as it cools internal components and enhances your workout environment and extending the motor's life.0 to 10 percent Quick Incline ControlThe best and most convenient incline adjustment, the Quick Incline control allows you to change the incline with the single touch of a button instead of tediously scrolling through options as you would with traditional incline controls.Roomy TreadbeltA vital component of the drive system, this 20- by 50-inch treadmill belt is designed to operate both smoother and quieter than the average treadmill belt.0 to 10 MPH QuickSpeed ControlInstead of tediously scrolling through options, the QuickSpeed control allows you to instantly change the speed of the treadmill between 0 to 10 miles per hour with the single touch of a button.Specifications:Weight Capacity: 300 poundsWarranty: Lifetime frame; 25-Year motor; 1-year parts & laborDimensions: 70 by 34 by 59.5 inches (L x W x H)Treadbelt: 20 by 55 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dl0vPC6fL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048HS02G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0048J06EE", "title": "Professional Speed Bag", "description": "With the same features and benefits as the Intermediate Speed Bag, the Professional Speed Bag offers more challenging weight resistance. This model is designed for those who have experience with lifting weights or for those in advanced martial arts and other upper body sports. It is 12 lbs. in weight, but its not the weight so much that offers the workout, but it is the mechanics of the workout. This model offers the buyer a very challenging and unique workout. Not only does it incorporate all of the upper body and core strengthening attributes of the lighter model, but the added weight also creates a heightened aerobic and recruiting type workout which is much more challenging to the average person. A recruiting type of workout means calling on all aspects of core strength, agility, and aerobic muscle groups, as well as a keen sense of coordination and endurance. This machine is for those who are serious about getting to the next level in any level of fitness. It is the next step up after mastering the 8 lb. Burn Machine, which is excellent to switch to when lighter training is needed.", "text": "Professional Speed Bag With the same features and benefits as the Intermediate Speed Bag, the Professional Speed Bag offers more challenging weight resistance. This model is designed for those who have experience with lifting weights or for those in advanced martial arts and other upper body sports. It is 12 lbs. in weight, but its not the weight so much that offers the workout, but it is the mechanics of the workout. This model offers the buyer a very challenging and unique workout. Not only does it incorporate all of the upper body and core strengthening attributes of the lighter model, but the added weight also creates a heightened aerobic and recruiting type workout which is much more challenging to the average person. A recruiting type of workout means calling on all aspects of core strength, agility, and aerobic muscle groups, as well as a keen sense of coordination and endurance. This machine is for those who are serious about getting to the next level in any level of fitness. It is the next step up after mastering the 8 lb. Burn Machine, which is excellent to switch to when lighter training is needed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4150sFZuimL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048J06EE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "THE BURN MACHINE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Punching Bags", "Speed Bags"]], "price": 134.1}}
{"item_id": "B0048K8VRW", "title": "Global Military Gear Tactical Nylon Drop-Leg Holster", "description": "Universal nylon thigh holster with quick-release straps and magazine pouches.", "text": "Global Military Gear Tactical Nylon Drop-Leg Holster Universal nylon thigh holster with quick-release straps and magazine pouches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41srhsxEQ9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048K8VRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.39}}
{"item_id": "B0048KAHOW", "title": "Uncle Mike's Deluxe Canvas Shell Pouch (Brown, One Size)", "description": "Uncle Mike's Deluxe Shell Pouch features leather reinforced bottom for years of dependable use and foam-backed, divided compartments hold two boxes of shells. Made of extremely rugged, long lasting canvas construction, and includes fully adjustable web belt with quick-release buckle.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Deluxe Canvas Shell Pouch (Brown, One Size) Uncle Mike's Deluxe Shell Pouch features leather reinforced bottom for years of dependable use and foam-backed, divided compartments hold two boxes of shells. Made of extremely rugged, long lasting canvas construction, and includes fully adjustable web belt with quick-release buckle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mYiJvfZpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KAHOW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.69}}
{"item_id": "B0048KAOJ0", "title": "MTM 30 Caliber Ammo Can", "description": "Molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic, these comfortably handled ammo cans, will hold up to some pretty harsh treatment. Utilizing MTM's tongue and groove O-Ring seal system for a superior water-resistant seal, the 30 caliber can is designed to fit the same amount of bulk ammo as the originals. A heavy-duty dual latching system makes for a better seal and less likely to open accidentally. Double padlock tabs along with molded-in stacking ridges, make these solid containers the perfect solution to so many storage needs. Weight: 1.38 pounds. (The 30 cal military metal can weighs 3.76 pounds.) Makes an ideal geocaching container due to its color, O-ring seal, and rugged construction.", "text": "MTM 30 Caliber Ammo Can Molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic, these comfortably handled ammo cans, will hold up to some pretty harsh treatment. Utilizing MTM's tongue and groove O-Ring seal system for a superior water-resistant seal, the 30 caliber can is designed to fit the same amount of bulk ammo as the originals. A heavy-duty dual latching system makes for a better seal and less likely to open accidentally. Double padlock tabs along with molded-in stacking ridges, make these solid containers the perfect solution to so many storage needs. Weight: 1.38 pounds. (The 30 cal military metal can weighs 3.76 pounds.) Makes an ideal geocaching container due to its color, O-ring seal, and rugged construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DvXmsvbsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KAOJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.6}}
{"item_id": "B0048KAZAI", "title": "Specter Gear Remington 870 and 11/87 Buttstock Shell Holder with Rear Adapter", "description": "Our 6 Shell Buttstock Shotshell Holder (BSH) holds 6 spare 12ga. shotgun shells in loops on the offside of the buttstock. Secure, but readily accessible, this gives the shooter spare a-mmunition that's always with the weapon. A highly valuable feature of this BSH is that it is modular, completely ambidextrous and can be easily attached to the rear adapter of any of our fixed stock shotgun 2 or 3 point slings. NOTE: This item is intended for use on standard fixed stock shotguns. This is a stand alone version that comes with a rear adapter should you not already have a Specter Gear sling attached to your shotgun.", "text": "Specter Gear Remington 870 and 11/87 Buttstock Shell Holder with Rear Adapter Our 6 Shell Buttstock Shotshell Holder (BSH) holds 6 spare 12ga. shotgun shells in loops on the offside of the buttstock. Secure, but readily accessible, this gives the shooter spare a-mmunition that's always with the weapon. A highly valuable feature of this BSH is that it is modular, completely ambidextrous and can be easily attached to the rear adapter of any of our fixed stock shotgun 2 or 3 point slings. NOTE: This item is intended for use on standard fixed stock shotguns. This is a stand alone version that comes with a rear adapter should you not already have a Specter Gear sling attached to your shotgun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BpYgHIxzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KAZAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specter Gear, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 24.69}}
