{"item_id": "B0048KEOFK", "title": "Specter Gear Mossberg 500 and 590 Buttstock Shell Holder with Rear Adapter", "description": "Our 6 Shell Buttstock Shotshell Holder (BSH) holds 6 spare 12ga. shotgun shells in loops on the offside of the buttstock. Secure, but readily accessible, this gives the shooter spare a-mmunition that's always with the weapon. A highly valuable feature of this BSH is that it is modular, completely ambidextrous and can be easily attached to the rear adapter of any of our fixed stock shotgun 2 or 3 point slings. NOTE: This item is intended for use on standard fixed stock shotguns. This is a stand alone version that comes with a rear adapter should you not already have a Specter Gear sling attached to your shotgun.", "text": "Specter Gear Mossberg 500 and 590 Buttstock Shell Holder with Rear Adapter Our 6 Shell Buttstock Shotshell Holder (BSH) holds 6 spare 12ga. shotgun shells in loops on the offside of the buttstock. Secure, but readily accessible, this gives the shooter spare a-mmunition that's always with the weapon. A highly valuable feature of this BSH is that it is modular, completely ambidextrous and can be easily attached to the rear adapter of any of our fixed stock shotgun 2 or 3 point slings. NOTE: This item is intended for use on standard fixed stock shotguns. This is a stand alone version that comes with a rear adapter should you not already have a Specter Gear sling attached to your shotgun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BpYgHIxzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KEOFK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specter Gear, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.99}}
