{"item_id": "B0048KEXDS", "title": "Gunslick AR-15 Bore Guide", "description": "Get your bore chemicals right where you need them…in the barrel of your AR-15. Gunslick's Aluminum AR-15 Bore Guide features a large solvent port that provides access to the full length of mops and brushes. Chemical resistant o-rings hold guide in place while the end makes for easy removal from your rifle. Keep those guns clean. Designed specifically for the AR-15 style firearm owner in mind, the Bore Guide is durable and made from aluminum. The knurled end makes for easy removal from the firearm. A large solvent port allows access to full length of brushes and mops. And the chemical resistant o-rings hold this bore guide in place. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "text": "Gunslick AR-15 Bore Guide Get your bore chemicals right where you need them…in the barrel of your AR-15. Gunslick's Aluminum AR-15 Bore Guide features a large solvent port that provides access to the full length of mops and brushes. Chemical resistant o-rings hold guide in place while the end makes for easy removal from your rifle. Keep those guns clean. Designed specifically for the AR-15 style firearm owner in mind, the Bore Guide is durable and made from aluminum. The knurled end makes for easy removal from the firearm. A large solvent port allows access to full length of brushes and mops. And the chemical resistant o-rings hold this bore guide in place. In the gun care industry - among gunsmiths, firearm technicians and shooters - Gunslick has earned a sterling reputation for providing precision products that serve the active shooter. Third party testing shows Gunslick products exceed the performance of their competition in both corrosion protection and wear reduction. These test also demonstrate Gunslick's unwavering dedication to producing technologically advanced gun care products for today's shooters. This season, let Gunslick Pro do the work for you. Select a product and see how Gunslick hasn't sacrificed the ability to perform when simplifying the process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vHIG%2BTyJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KEXDS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunslick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 25.49}}
{"item_id": "B0048KFEMM", "title": "Tipton Snap Caps 45 ACP (Per 5)", "description": "Snap Caps have a variety of uses around the bench. It is generally accepted that one shouldn't drop the firing pin on an empty chamber - which is the primary reason to have Snap Caps for your favorite guns. You should always use Snap Caps when checking or adjusting the trigger pull. If you prefer to release the tension on the hammer springs, when storing your guns, Snap Caps are ideal. Whatever your needs, Snap Caps are handy and inexpensive.", "text": "Tipton Snap Caps 45 ACP (Per 5) Snap Caps have a variety of uses around the bench. It is generally accepted that one shouldn't drop the firing pin on an empty chamber - which is the primary reason to have Snap Caps for your favorite guns. You should always use Snap Caps when checking or adjusting the trigger pull. If you prefer to release the tension on the hammer springs, when storing your guns, Snap Caps are ideal. Whatever your needs, Snap Caps are handy and inexpensive.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HlA2y%2BNJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KFEMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.22}}
