{"item_id": "B0048KFQD4", "title": "Specter Gear MOLLE/PALS Compatible Modular Surefire 6P/G2/P2X Fury Light Pouch", "description": "Adjustable flap for precise fitting of the light to the pouch. MOLLE/PALS compatible Specter Snap attachment system. Pouch body constructed from 1000 denier Cordura nylon. Open bottom to prevent light activation while loading the light into the pouch. Vertically oriented flap pull tab for more positive flap access and release. As with all of our products, this item is made in the USA using only top quality materials and manufacturing procedures.", "text": "Specter Gear MOLLE/PALS Compatible Modular Surefire 6P/G2/P2X Fury Light Pouch Adjustable flap for precise fitting of the light to the pouch. MOLLE/PALS compatible Specter Snap attachment system. Pouch body constructed from 1000 denier Cordura nylon. Open bottom to prevent light activation while loading the light into the pouch. Vertically oriented flap pull tab for more positive flap access and release. As with all of our products, this item is made in the USA using only top quality materials and manufacturing procedures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hxpkQ-MaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KFQD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specter Gear, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.29}}
{"item_id": "B0048KGFHU", "title": "Tipton Polymer Gun Cleaning Picks", "description": "Here's a clever idea that belongs in every cleaning kit - Gun-Cleaning Picks. This set of four picks with different configurations on each end provides eight different combinations to get into those tight, hard to reach places. Made of high-strength polymer so they won't scratch the finest surface. Set of four picks.", "text": "Tipton Polymer Gun Cleaning Picks Here's a clever idea that belongs in every cleaning kit - Gun-Cleaning Picks. This set of four picks with different configurations on each end provides eight different combinations to get into those tight, hard to reach places. Made of high-strength polymer so they won't scratch the finest surface. Set of four picks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K7ShuOAWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KGFHU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 6.34}}
