{"item_id": "B0048KIYKQ", "title": "DeSantis Pro Stealth M&P 9/40 XD 4\" Black", "description": "The N87 is made of premium padded ballistic nylon. The 1 3/4-Inch sturdy, powder coated black spring clip keeps this beauty securely anchored to your belt. A spare magazine pouch is standard for the auto loader models, and they are ambidextrous. The clip may be removed and inserted on opposite side for left hand carry. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Pro Stealth M&P 9/40 XD 4\" Black The N87 is made of premium padded ballistic nylon. The 1 3/4-Inch sturdy, powder coated black spring clip keeps this beauty securely anchored to your belt. A spare magazine pouch is standard for the auto loader models, and they are ambidextrous. The clip may be removed and inserted on opposite side for left hand carry. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LWaiNa8VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KIYKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 30.48}}
