{"item_id": "B0048KMHVS", "title": "Desantis Double Ankle Mag Pouch Blk", "description": "DeSantis Neoprene Ankle Double Magazine Pouch, Black - 9mm/.40 Cal - N81BJZZZ0", "text": "Desantis Double Ankle Mag Pouch Blk DeSantis Neoprene Ankle Double Magazine Pouch, Black - 9mm/.40 Cal - N81BJZZZ0", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412UUyaBu-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KMHVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DRD", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 28.09}}
{"item_id": "B0048KMKCO", "title": "Desantis Single Stack Double Magazine Pouch, 9mm/40, Black", "description": "This double magazine pouch features a snap-to-the-belt design. May be carried horizontal or vertical. Accommodates belts up to 1 3/4\" wide. Fully adjustable dual tension device.", "text": "Desantis Single Stack Double Magazine Pouch, 9mm/40, Black This double magazine pouch features a snap-to-the-belt design. May be carried horizontal or vertical. Accommodates belts up to 1 3/4\" wide. Fully adjustable dual tension device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PByyH%2BscL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048KMKCO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 25.2}}
{"item_id": "B0048MB82A", "title": "iBert Safe-T-Seat Front Child Seat (Green,38-Pounds limit)", "description": "The iBert safe-T-seat was designed on the premise that all child bike carriers arenotcreated equal.The safe-T-seat lets you interact with your child while riding.Equipped with a three-point harness and lap bar, the safe-T-seat puts your child at the front of the bike, where she is safe, comfortable, and entertained. The front-mounted location is more fun than a bike trailer, which limits your child's view while putting her in the path of rocks, dirt, and other annoyances. It's also more gratifying than rear-mounted seats, as it lets you interact more with your child while providing a better center of gravity. And unlike many traditional front-mounted seats, the safe-T-seat sits high enough to stay clear of your knees while pedaling, installs easier, and sports more safety features.Designed for children four and under, the safe-T-seat features iBert's patented stinger assembly system, which attaches and removes easily from almost any bike. The stinger system sits higher than other seats and is smooth on the bottom. Even if you're extra tall and hit your knees on the bottom of the seat, they'll just glide along the seat's smooth bottom edges. The safe-T-seat is safe for children up to 38 pounds and 42 inches tall. Kids taller than 42 inches will be uncomfortable. Parents will need at least 3/4 inch of usable stem to attach the seat.", "text": "iBert Safe-T-Seat Front Child Seat (Green,38-Pounds limit) The iBert safe-T-seat was designed on the premise that all child bike carriers arenotcreated equal.The safe-T-seat lets you interact with your child while riding.Equipped with a three-point harness and lap bar, the safe-T-seat puts your child at the front of the bike, where she is safe, comfortable, and entertained. The front-mounted location is more fun than a bike trailer, which limits your child's view while putting her in the path of rocks, dirt, and other annoyances. It's also more gratifying than rear-mounted seats, as it lets you interact more with your child while providing a better center of gravity. And unlike many traditional front-mounted seats, the safe-T-seat sits high enough to stay clear of your knees while pedaling, installs easier, and sports more safety features.Designed for children four and under, the safe-T-seat features iBert's patented stinger assembly system, which attaches and removes easily from almost any bike. The stinger system sits higher than other seats and is smooth on the bottom. Even if you're extra tall and hit your knees on the bottom of the seat, they'll just glide along the seat's smooth bottom edges. The safe-T-seat is safe for children up to 38 pounds and 42 inches tall. Kids taller than 42 inches will be uncomfortable. Parents will need at least 3/4 inch of usable stem to attach the seat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51acUfv5idL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048MB82A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Child Seats"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B0048NRRH4", "title": "Rothco Plainclothes Concealed Carry Vest", "description": "Vests are worn all over the world by different Militaries & different types of people. Military Vests are used for many types of activities such as during combat. Tactical Vests can be made from many different materials such as polyester or even nylon material. People wear Vests on camping trips, walking through woods, out fishing, & even paint balling. Vests are not just by Military Personnel, Law Enforcement, or Outdoor Enthusiasts. Vests are great for anyone who wants a functional, durable, comfortable type of clothing for whatever the person is doing. Vests were made to fit men but they are Unisex so they may be worn by both a women and a man. Tactical Vests are made to match the outfit of your choice, weather it is worn over a BDU Shirt or a Flight jacket. We carry all different types of Vests. The different types of Men's Vests are Tactical Vests, Safety Vests, or just a Vest that you want to wear for fashionFEATURES-60% COTTON - 40% POLY-MESH LINING ON BACK ONLY (MATCHES OUTER SHELL)-VENTED BACK (THREE SLITS)-ZIPPER FRONT w/DOUBLE ZIPPER-16 FRONT POCKETS WITH ZIPPER, AND HOOK & LOOP CLOSURES-TAB WITH D-RING ON FRONT RIGHT BREAST POCKET- 2 LARGE INTERIOR FRONT POCKETS (HOOK & LOOP CLOSURE)-4 INTERIOR MAG POUCHES w/HOOK & LOOP FLAP CLOSURE-1 INTERIOR REAR POCKET WITH ZIPPER CLOSURE-1 EXTERIOR REAR CARGO POCKET W/THREE HOOK & LOOP CLOSURES-ADJUSTABLE WAIST WITH TABS (HIDDEN IN REAR CARGO POCKET WHEN NOT IN USE) ATTACH TO TABS WITH DOUBLE D-RINGS ON EACH SIDE OF WAIST-SMALL SLITS ON EACH SIDE LOCATED AT THE HEM-MADE FOR RUGGED USE-IMPORT", "text": "Rothco Plainclothes Concealed Carry Vest Vests are worn all over the world by different Militaries & different types of people. Military Vests are used for many types of activities such as during combat. Tactical Vests can be made from many different materials such as polyester or even nylon material. People wear Vests on camping trips, walking through woods, out fishing, & even paint balling. Vests are not just by Military Personnel, Law Enforcement, or Outdoor Enthusiasts. Vests are great for anyone who wants a functional, durable, comfortable type of clothing for whatever the person is doing. Vests were made to fit men but they are Unisex so they may be worn by both a women and a man. Tactical Vests are made to match the outfit of your choice, weather it is worn over a BDU Shirt or a Flight jacket. We carry all different types of Vests. The different types of Men's Vests are Tactical Vests, Safety Vests, or just a Vest that you want to wear for fashionFEATURES-60% COTTON - 40% POLY-MESH LINING ON BACK ONLY (MATCHES OUTER SHELL)-VENTED BACK (THREE SLITS)-ZIPPER FRONT w/DOUBLE ZIPPER-16 FRONT POCKETS WITH ZIPPER, AND HOOK & LOOP CLOSURES-TAB WITH D-RING ON FRONT RIGHT BREAST POCKET- 2 LARGE INTERIOR FRONT POCKETS (HOOK & LOOP CLOSURE)-4 INTERIOR MAG POUCHES w/HOOK & LOOP FLAP CLOSURE-1 INTERIOR REAR POCKET WITH ZIPPER CLOSURE-1 EXTERIOR REAR CARGO POCKET W/THREE HOOK & LOOP CLOSURES-ADJUSTABLE WAIST WITH TABS (HIDDEN IN REAR CARGO POCKET WHEN NOT IN USE) ATTACH TO TABS WITH DOUBLE D-RINGS ON EACH SIDE OF WAIST-SMALL SLITS ON EACH SIDE LOCATED AT THE HEM-MADE FOR RUGGED USE-IMPORT", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cHa7u7GTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048NRRH4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment", "Tactical Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0048O4TE2", "title": "M85 G36C AEG Electric Assault Rifle FPS-200, Scope, Tactical Light, Laser Airsoft Gun", "description": "This Airsoft Rifle is modeled after a M85P Rifle. This Fully Automatic Electric Rifle comes with all the great accessories like a laser sight, a flashlight, a rechargeable battery and a charger. Features •200 Feet per Second •Laser Sight •Hop Up •Semi and Fully Automatic •Flashlight", "text": "M85 G36C AEG Electric Assault Rifle FPS-200, Scope, Tactical Light, Laser Airsoft Gun This Airsoft Rifle is modeled after a M85P Rifle. This Fully Automatic Electric Rifle comes with all the great accessories like a laser sight, a flashlight, a rechargeable battery and a charger. Features •200 Feet per Second •Laser Sight •Hop Up •Semi and Fully Automatic •Flashlight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ovw5zbn4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0048O4TE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Double Eagle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 39.95}}
