{"item_id": "B00494198A", "title": "NcStar Offset Mount for 1-Inch Flashlight/Laser", "description": "1\" Offset Mount for 1\" Flashlight/Laser - Offset Flashlight/Laser weaver/picatinny style mount - Keeps Flashlight/Laser off to the side so it doesn't interfere with vertical grips or hand guards - Ergonomic design gives easy access to on/off switches for Flashlights and Lasers - High grade aluminum construction - Single thumb nut secures mount to weaver/picatinny style rail - Length (Inch) 2.74\" - Weight (oz.) 2.1.", "text": "NcStar Offset Mount for 1-Inch Flashlight/Laser 1\" Offset Mount for 1\" Flashlight/Laser - Offset Flashlight/Laser weaver/picatinny style mount - Keeps Flashlight/Laser off to the side so it doesn't interfere with vertical grips or hand guards - Ergonomic design gives easy access to on/off switches for Flashlights and Lasers - High grade aluminum construction - Single thumb nut secures mount to weaver/picatinny style rail - Length (Inch) 2.74\" - Weight (oz.) 2.1.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416oMbYg-wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00494198A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 7.89}}
{"item_id": "B004941DUE", "title": "NcStar Weaver Style 45-Degree Offset Rail Mount", "description": "45 Degree Offset Rail Mount/Weaver Style - Offset Rail allows the attachment of laser/flashlight mounts, red dot sights or other accessories. - Keeps accessories off to the side so they don't interfere with vertical grips, handguards, or optics - Ergonomic design gives easy access to on/off switches for Flashlights, Lasers, or Red Dot sights - High grade aluminum construction - Single thumb nut secures mount to weaver/picatinny style rail - Length (inches) 1.77\" - Weight (oz.) 1.4.", "text": "NcStar Weaver Style 45-Degree Offset Rail Mount 45 Degree Offset Rail Mount/Weaver Style - Offset Rail allows the attachment of laser/flashlight mounts, red dot sights or other accessories. - Keeps accessories off to the side so they don't interfere with vertical grips, handguards, or optics - Ergonomic design gives easy access to on/off switches for Flashlights, Lasers, or Red Dot sights - High grade aluminum construction - Single thumb nut secures mount to weaver/picatinny style rail - Length (inches) 1.77\" - Weight (oz.) 1.4.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i1rVBT32L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004941DUE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 2.88}}
{"item_id": "B004941JTO", "title": "NcStar Precision Grade Bipod Compact 3 Adapters", "description": "Shoot confidently with the NcStar precision-grade bipod. The bipod--which attaches to virtually any sling-swivel-studded firearm in seconds--positions your firearm at the perfect height for shooting from the cross-legged position or kneeling. The bipod is made to last, with an aircraft-grade aluminum and steel frame that's durable yet lightweight. compact 5.5” to 8, the bipod comes with three adapters: an AR-15 hand-guard sling stud, a universal barrel mount, and a Picatinny rail sling stud.", "text": "NcStar Precision Grade Bipod Compact 3 Adapters Shoot confidently with the NcStar precision-grade bipod. The bipod--which attaches to virtually any sling-swivel-studded firearm in seconds--positions your firearm at the perfect height for shooting from the cross-legged position or kneeling. The bipod is made to last, with an aircraft-grade aluminum and steel frame that's durable yet lightweight. compact 5.5” to 8, the bipod comes with three adapters: an AR-15 hand-guard sling stud, a universal barrel mount, and a Picatinny rail sling stud.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Ej%2BZ-z%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004941JTO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B004941JXU", "title": "VISM by NcStar PVC First Responders Utility Bag", "description": "The First Responder Bag has plenty of space for all of your quick response needs with 7 compartments total.", "text": "VISM by NcStar PVC First Responders Utility Bag The First Responder Bag has plenty of space for all of your quick response needs with 7 compartments total.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Hi3ndMmNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004941JXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B004943NTI", "title": "Precision Grade Bipod fullsize 3 Adapters", "description": "Shoot confidently with the NcStar ABPGF precision-grade bipod. The bipod is made to last, with an aircraft-grade aluminum and steel frame that's durable yet lightweight. The unit is also extremely stable, with a spring-loaded folding design that gives the bipod legs maximum tension in any position. Plus, the legs retract instantly with the push of a button. The bipod comes with three adapters: an AR-15 hand-guard sling stud, a universal barrel mount, and a Picatinny rail sling stud.", "text": "Precision Grade Bipod fullsize 3 Adapters Shoot confidently with the NcStar ABPGF precision-grade bipod. The bipod is made to last, with an aircraft-grade aluminum and steel frame that's durable yet lightweight. The unit is also extremely stable, with a spring-loaded folding design that gives the bipod legs maximum tension in any position. Plus, the legs retract instantly with the push of a button. The bipod comes with three adapters: an AR-15 hand-guard sling stud, a universal barrel mount, and a Picatinny rail sling stud.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Ej%2BZ-z%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004943NTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 32.95}}
