{"item_id": "B0049IZMUW", "title": "BARSKA 15-40x50 Colorado Spotting Scope", "description": "15-40x50 spotting scope, Fully Coated Optics, Porro prism system, Smooth focusing knob and, shock absorbing rubber armor. This spotting scope comes with a mini table tripod & soft carrying case.", "text": "BARSKA 15-40x50 Colorado Spotting Scope 15-40x50 spotting scope, Fully Coated Optics, Porro prism system, Smooth focusing knob and, shock absorbing rubber armor. This spotting scope comes with a mini table tripod & soft carrying case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41p71Wgs5pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049IZMUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 27.99}}
