{"item_id": "B0049JUDNW", "title": "Hunter Safety System Ultra Lite Safety Harnesses", "description": "Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Vests/Harness are designed to provide hunters with the SAFEST, easiest to use, most comfortable vests/harnesses on the market today!", "text": "Hunter Safety System Ultra Lite Safety Harnesses Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Vests/Harness are designed to provide hunters with the SAFEST, easiest to use, most comfortable vests/harnesses on the market today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J%2BJXbfEEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049JUDNW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0049MEI9E", "title": "Zebco 202K/562M Ladies Pink Slingshot Spincast Fishing Rod and Reel Combo", "description": "Zebco 202 Spincast Combo. Ideal for medium freshwater fishing, the Zebco 202 spincast reel has all metal gears, adjustable drag and an on / off reverse. It's matched with a 5'6\" Zebco rod. More details on the 202 spincast reel: Tough ABS housing; Positive Pickup; 2.8:1 gear ratio; Star-adjustable drag; Built-in hook keeper; Chrome-plated cover; Pre-spooled with 10-lb. line. Order Today! Zebco 202 Spincast Combo", "text": "Zebco 202K/562M Ladies Pink Slingshot Spincast Fishing Rod and Reel Combo Zebco 202 Spincast Combo. Ideal for medium freshwater fishing, the Zebco 202 spincast reel has all metal gears, adjustable drag and an on / off reverse. It's matched with a 5'6\" Zebco rod. More details on the 202 spincast reel: Tough ABS housing; Positive Pickup; 2.8:1 gear ratio; Star-adjustable drag; Built-in hook keeper; Chrome-plated cover; Pre-spooled with 10-lb. line. Order Today! Zebco 202 Spincast Combo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WqNYiWssL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049MEI9E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zebco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos"]], "price": 22.36}}
{"item_id": "B0049MI250", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF91-CP Micron 2.0 Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Folding 2.25-Inch Stainless Steel Blade and Handle, Hardcase Black", "description": "The SOG Micron 2.0 features slim line convenience, key chain ready size, lockback mechanism, and a tanto design. The 2.25\" blade features a black finish, black Stainless steel handle with the blade measuring 5 inches. Our Micron Folders are crafted from high quality stainless steel and designed to be carried on a key ring or in your pocket. The Micron 2.0 has a blade constructed of 420 stainless at 55-57 Rc. The weight of the handle has been relieved with the SOG logo cut through both sides. A handy and very useful little knife. FF-91 Features: -Micron 2.0 knife. -Finish: Black oxide. -2.25'' Straight edged coated 420 stainless steel blade. -Compact stainless steel knife with tanto blade great for key chain carry. -Lock back design for secure blade lock up. -Slim line convenience, key chain ready size. -Sophisticated tanto design. -Blade length: 2.25''. -Overall length: 5''. SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF91-CP Micron 2.0 Tanto Knife with Straight Edge Folding 2.25-Inch Stainless Steel Blade and Handle, Hardcase Black The SOG Micron 2.0 features slim line convenience, key chain ready size, lockback mechanism, and a tanto design. The 2.25\" blade features a black finish, black Stainless steel handle with the blade measuring 5 inches. Our Micron Folders are crafted from high quality stainless steel and designed to be carried on a key ring or in your pocket. The Micron 2.0 has a blade constructed of 420 stainless at 55-57 Rc. The weight of the handle has been relieved with the SOG logo cut through both sides. A handy and very useful little knife. FF-91 Features: -Micron 2.0 knife. -Finish: Black oxide. -2.25'' Straight edged coated 420 stainless steel blade. -Compact stainless steel knife with tanto blade great for key chain carry. -Lock back design for secure blade lock up. -Slim line convenience, key chain ready size. -Sophisticated tanto design. -Blade length: 2.25''. -Overall length: 5''. SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MskjqvWTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049MI250.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.05}}
{"item_id": "B0049NR49Y", "title": "BudK Silver Tactical Pen", "description": "This tactical pen is constructed of 6061 aircraft aluminum and writes in black ink. It features an aggressive point. Instead of a cap, this pen has a twist closure. The etched design and pocket clip provide a secure grip for writing or defending. 6 3/4\" overall.", "text": "BudK Silver Tactical Pen This tactical pen is constructed of 6061 aircraft aluminum and writes in black ink. It features an aggressive point. Instead of a cap, this pen has a twist closure. The etched design and pocket clip provide a secure grip for writing or defending. 6 3/4\" overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-NiCioLaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049NR49Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B0049P2SLG", "title": "Digit Glove", "description": "Our best selling MTB glove! Great features for a great price!", "text": "Digit Glove Our best selling MTB glove! Great features for a great price!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IXpAR7H3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049P2SLG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0049PN220", "title": "AR15 M4 A1 A2 FRONT SIGHT DUAL HEAD ADJUSTMENT TOOL", "description": "For A1 &A2; Front sight dual head adjustment tool. Material: Steel Prong: 4 & 5 (dual head) Weight: 1oz", "text": "AR15 M4 A1 A2 FRONT SIGHT DUAL HEAD ADJUSTMENT TOOL For A1 &A2; Front sight dual head adjustment tool. Material: Steel Prong: 4 & 5 (dual head) Weight: 1oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DQJvp7suL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049PN220.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B0049QHHAM", "title": "ProForm Ab Glider", "description": "The ab GLIDER maximizes your core training exercise by combining two motions, the circular burn and the arc crunch, for a fast, fun workout for your entire abdomen. Engage more muscle to drive a better cardiovascular workout that burns twice as many calories compared to standard abdominal exercises.Features:Dual Motion Training promotes 44 percent muscle activation to help double your caloric burn rateIncludes Weight-Loss Eating Guide, Amazing abs DVD, and 3-Minute Results DVD180-degree rotation track provides smooth lateral movement and locks in place for vertical motionOff-the-floor abdominal workout encourages proper form to prevent injury to the neck or backStrong, sturdy steel frame and track built to last a lifetimeEndorsed by Elisabeth HasselbeckAbout ProFormProForm is primarily known for innovating treadmill design with the renowned fold-away SpaceSaver. Today, the company continues to make advances in cushioning, electronics, durability, and reliability. In recent years, ProForm has introduced a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more, all geared to provide the most effective workout available.", "text": "ProForm Ab Glider The ab GLIDER maximizes your core training exercise by combining two motions, the circular burn and the arc crunch, for a fast, fun workout for your entire abdomen. Engage more muscle to drive a better cardiovascular workout that burns twice as many calories compared to standard abdominal exercises.Features:Dual Motion Training promotes 44 percent muscle activation to help double your caloric burn rateIncludes Weight-Loss Eating Guide, Amazing abs DVD, and 3-Minute Results DVD180-degree rotation track provides smooth lateral movement and locks in place for vertical motionOff-the-floor abdominal workout encourages proper form to prevent injury to the neck or backStrong, sturdy steel frame and track built to last a lifetimeEndorsed by Elisabeth HasselbeckAbout ProFormProForm is primarily known for innovating treadmill design with the renowned fold-away SpaceSaver. Today, the company continues to make advances in cushioning, electronics, durability, and reliability. In recent years, ProForm has introduced a complete line of exercise bikes, elliptical machines, weight benches, and more, all geared to provide the most effective workout available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417YCr9SnSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049QHHAM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0049TEP0Y", "title": "Perfect Situp", "description": "The Perfect Situp reinvents the situp by combining the upper ab crunch with the lower ab leg lift to get you better, faster results. Designed to combine upper body positioning with lower body resistance, the Perfect Situp works all four sets of abdominal muscles. The Perfect Situp maximizes muscle activation by putting you in the perfect position and adding resistance through leg and back blades.", "text": "Perfect Situp The Perfect Situp reinvents the situp by combining the upper ab crunch with the lower ab leg lift to get you better, faster results. Designed to combine upper body positioning with lower body resistance, the Perfect Situp works all four sets of abdominal muscles. The Perfect Situp maximizes muscle activation by putting you in the perfect position and adding resistance through leg and back blades.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hN2PJZPsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049TEP0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B0049TX9WY", "title": "Tops Knives HHS2020 Hawkes Hellion Survivor Fixed Blade Knife with Black Micarta Handles", "description": "Tops Knives - Hawkes Hellion Survivor Fixed Blade Knife with Black Micarta Handles. Model: TPHHS2020. 14 3/4\" overall. 9\" 5160 carbon steel sawback tanto blade with black traction coating. Black micarta handles. Black nylon belt sheath with utility pouch.", "text": "Tops Knives HHS2020 Hawkes Hellion Survivor Fixed Blade Knife with Black Micarta Handles Tops Knives - Hawkes Hellion Survivor Fixed Blade Knife with Black Micarta Handles. Model: TPHHS2020. 14 3/4\" overall. 9\" 5160 carbon steel sawback tanto blade with black traction coating. Black micarta handles. Black nylon belt sheath with utility pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fqWT19UfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049TX9WY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 158.18}}
{"item_id": "B0049X99II", "title": "Stack-On GCB-5300RTA Security Plus Pistol and Ammo Ready to Assemble Storage Cabinet", "description": "All full sized Stack-On Security Plus Gun Cabinets feature the following: Full sized cabinets are manufactured with welded, steel box construction. Superior, all steel, 3 point locking system with double bitted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Stack-On’s patented barrel standoffs for scoped guns which allow for one position storage of scoped rifles. Flush mount bottom for easier fastening to floor. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware is included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On’s Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. These cabinets are California DOJ-approved firearms safety devices that meet the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued thereunder. 53” steel security cabinet has 3 removable steel shelves. Loads of room for pistols, ammo and supplies. Unit is easy to assemble with integrated, form fitting parts that are fastened together. Fasteners are tamper proof from the outside of the cabinet. Pre-drilled mounting holes in the bottom and back of the cabinet allow for easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware included. Cabinet has a black, epoxy paint finish with silver accents.", "text": "Stack-On GCB-5300RTA Security Plus Pistol and Ammo Ready to Assemble Storage Cabinet All full sized Stack-On Security Plus Gun Cabinets feature the following: Full sized cabinets are manufactured with welded, steel box construction. Superior, all steel, 3 point locking system with double bitted, key coded lock. Full length welded and staked steel piano hinge provides greater security. Stack-On’s patented barrel standoffs for scoped guns which allow for one position storage of scoped rifles. Flush mount bottom for easier fastening to floor. Pre-drilled mounting holes allow easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware is included. Pre-drilled top mounting holes align with Stack-On’s Pistol/Ammo Cabinets. These cabinets are California DOJ-approved firearms safety devices that meet the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued thereunder. 53” steel security cabinet has 3 removable steel shelves. Loads of room for pistols, ammo and supplies. Unit is easy to assemble with integrated, form fitting parts that are fastened together. Fasteners are tamper proof from the outside of the cabinet. Pre-drilled mounting holes in the bottom and back of the cabinet allow for easy attachment to the floor or wall. Fastening hardware included. Cabinet has a black, epoxy paint finish with silver accents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/11GaboX6KOL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049X99II.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 111.94}}
{"item_id": "B0049ZFP7U", "title": "SKS Dashblade Rear Bicycle Fender for 26-Inch Mountain Bike Tires", "description": "This SKS fender features the power strap quick release for easy on easy off in seconds. Stay Dry!!", "text": "SKS Dashblade Rear Bicycle Fender for 26-Inch Mountain Bike Tires This SKS fender features the power strap quick release for easy on easy off in seconds. Stay Dry!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BlrKCGqYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0049ZFP7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 17.99}}
