{"item_id": "B004A833PC", "title": "Nathan 700 ml Tritan Bottle with Flip Straw", "description": "This reusable BPA-free bottle is made of Eastman Tritan material that won't ever leach chemicals into your water. A great alternative to stainless steel or aluminum water bottles. Clip to bags. Fit in treadmills. Fit in bike cages. Fit in car cup holders.", "text": "Nathan 700 ml Tritan Bottle with Flip Straw This reusable BPA-free bottle is made of Eastman Tritan material that won't ever leach chemicals into your water. A great alternative to stainless steel or aluminum water bottles. Clip to bags. Fit in treadmills. Fit in bike cages. Fit in car cup holders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XZi%2Bj8WaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004A833PC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B004A8S226", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear 4x20 Tactical Mil-Dot Long Eye Relief Hunting Military Sniper Carry Handle Scope +Built In Carry Handle Base Mount, See Thru Lens Covers & Lens Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 4x20 Mil Dot Sniper Rangefinder Reticle Carry Handle scope. This package includes the scope, a built in carry handle base mount, see thru protective lens covers, as well as a lens cleaning kit. The included carry handle base mount is \"See-Thru\" so that you can still use your iron sights! Featuring Bullet Drop Compensation technology, the scope has a weight 13.3 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable aircraft aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 6.9\".Fully Coated and built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil 100%, this scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and colored for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26' and an eye relief of approximately 3\" as well as full windage & elevation adjustments. The scope's mil dot sniper rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target to allow the shooter a significant tactical advantage.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear 4x20 Tactical Mil-Dot Long Eye Relief Hunting Military Sniper Carry Handle Scope +Built In Carry Handle Base Mount, See Thru Lens Covers & Lens Cleaning Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 4x20 Mil Dot Sniper Rangefinder Reticle Carry Handle scope. This package includes the scope, a built in carry handle base mount, see thru protective lens covers, as well as a lens cleaning kit. The included carry handle base mount is \"See-Thru\" so that you can still use your iron sights! Featuring Bullet Drop Compensation technology, the scope has a weight 13.3 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable aircraft aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 6.9\".Fully Coated and built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil 100%, this scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and colored for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26' and an eye relief of approximately 3\" as well as full windage & elevation adjustments. The scope's mil dot sniper rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target to allow the shooter a significant tactical advantage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IRLRAPKPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004A8S226.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 39.99}}
