{"item_id": "B004AKGG8G", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear 10-40X50 Dual Red & Green Iluminated Tactical AOE Rangefinder Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope + Premium 7/8\" High Profile See-Thru Scope rings, Lithium Battery, See Thru Lens Caps, & Lens Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 10-40x50 Dual Red & Green Illuminated AOE Rangefinder Reticle scope. This package includes the scope, Premium 1\" High Profile See-Thru mounting rings, see thru protective lens caps, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery as well as a lens cleaning kit. The scope weighs 28 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable one piece anodized aluminum 1 inch main tube, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 19.75\". Featuring a quick focus eyepiece, this scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement, and it is built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil. This scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The scope can accept a sunshade, the outer ring simply screws off to accept sunshade (sunshade is not included). The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view- @100' - 19.4-2.6', an eye relief of 3.35\"-3.54\", and an exit pupil of 64.4 - 1.1 mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's illuminated rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 11 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 5 illumated red settings, or 5 illuminated green settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear 10-40X50 Dual Red & Green Iluminated Tactical AOE Rangefinder Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope + Premium 7/8\" High Profile See-Thru Scope rings, Lithium Battery, See Thru Lens Caps, & Lens Cleaning Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 10-40x50 Dual Red & Green Illuminated AOE Rangefinder Reticle scope. This package includes the scope, Premium 1\" High Profile See-Thru mounting rings, see thru protective lens caps, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery as well as a lens cleaning kit. The scope weighs 28 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable one piece anodized aluminum 1 inch main tube, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 19.75\". Featuring a quick focus eyepiece, this scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement, and it is built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil. This scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The scope can accept a sunshade, the outer ring simply screws off to accept sunshade (sunshade is not included). The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view- @100' - 19.4-2.6', an eye relief of 3.35\"-3.54\", and an exit pupil of 64.4 - 1.1 mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's illuminated rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 11 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 5 illumated red settings, or 5 illuminated green settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UhubJdt5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004AKGG8G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B004AKU6N2", "title": "Six Pack Magazine Pouch Single Stack 45 or 9mm", "description": "This is a brand new USA made magazine pouch. It was designed to comfortably carry six single stacked magazines in the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 10 rounds. This pouch will attach to your belt using the triple belt loops on the back of the pouch or can be used to make your magazines easily available at the shooting range.", "text": "Six Pack Magazine Pouch Single Stack 45 or 9mm This is a brand new USA made magazine pouch. It was designed to comfortably carry six single stacked magazines in the above calibers, including magazines carrying up to 10 rounds. This pouch will attach to your belt using the triple belt loops on the back of the pouch or can be used to make your magazines easily available at the shooting range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kbR3MxMYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004AKU6N2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B004ALLDN8", "title": "CycleAware Urbie Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror", "description": "Urbie: The Urban Bar End Mirror. Whether youre an urban commuter or a weekend rural rider, the sleek & sexy Urbie is the ultimate mirror for bikes with flat handlebars. Urbies mirror is both versatile and durable: just turn the top thumbscrew and the fully adjustable mirror can be quickly flipped down and secured. Urbie comes fully assembled and the bottom thumbscrew allows for an easy, one minute, tool-free installation turn & go!", "text": "CycleAware Urbie Bicycle Handlebar Mounted Mirror Urbie: The Urban Bar End Mirror. Whether youre an urban commuter or a weekend rural rider, the sleek & sexy Urbie is the ultimate mirror for bikes with flat handlebars. Urbies mirror is both versatile and durable: just turn the top thumbscrew and the fully adjustable mirror can be quickly flipped down and secured. Urbie comes fully assembled and the bottom thumbscrew allows for an easy, one minute, tool-free installation turn & go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EEsta5RmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ALLDN8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CycleAware", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 19.53}}
{"item_id": "B004AMY6GS", "title": "#8 Opinel Knife Carbon Steel Blade w/ Beechwood Handle", "description": "Opinel Knives - 4 3/8\" VRN8 Carbon Steel Folding Knife with Beechwood Handle: Model OP-13080. 4 3/8\" closed. Beechwood handle and tempered high carbon steel blade with crowned hand hallmark etching. Safety ring for locking the blade. Made in France.", "text": "#8 Opinel Knife Carbon Steel Blade w/ Beechwood Handle Opinel Knives - 4 3/8\" VRN8 Carbon Steel Folding Knife with Beechwood Handle: Model OP-13080. 4 3/8\" closed. Beechwood handle and tempered high carbon steel blade with crowned hand hallmark etching. Safety ring for locking the blade. Made in France.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Yx1-oipiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004AMY6GS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Opinel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B004AN3VXG", "title": "Heckler and Koch Instigator Knife with Plain-Edged BP1 Coated Blade (Black, 7.78-Inch)", "description": "For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Instigator Series has a modified wharncliff made of AUS-8 Stainless Steel (58-60HRC), BP-1 Coated. It has a AUS-8 Stainless Steel, Skeletonized, Full Tang Handle. It works on the fixed-lock mechanism. Comes with snap-fit molded Kydex, thermoplastic with Tether sheath. It has a blade length of 3.38-Inch and overall length of 7.78-Inch with plain-edged coated blade.", "text": "Heckler and Koch Instigator Knife with Plain-Edged BP1 Coated Blade (Black, 7.78-Inch) For more than a half century, Heckler and Koch has been a leading designer and manufacturer of military, law enforcement and civilian firearms. HK’s commitment to quality, innovation and safety make them an industry leader in reliability and technology. The Instigator Series has a modified wharncliff made of AUS-8 Stainless Steel (58-60HRC), BP-1 Coated. It has a AUS-8 Stainless Steel, Skeletonized, Full Tang Handle. It works on the fixed-lock mechanism. Comes with snap-fit molded Kydex, thermoplastic with Tether sheath. It has a blade length of 3.38-Inch and overall length of 7.78-Inch with plain-edged coated blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FHBDygrYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004AN3VXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Heckler &amp; Koch", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 33.19}}
{"item_id": "B004ANM6C8", "title": "P Ez Travel Urinal", "description": "Lady Elegance P EZ Female Urinal No more uncomfortable squatting over unsanitary toilets. When you dont want to sit on an unsanitary public toilet or when one is not available, you can rely on this P EZ. Great for festivals. Completely hygienic and easy to use. Allows women of all ages to urinate in a standing up, sitting down or lying position without undressing. Discreet, portable & re-usable. Designed not to flow back, splash or spill. Features: Allows women to go anytime...anywhere Soft, Flexible silicone Discreet, spillproof and reusable Includes: 1 x Lady Elegance P EZ Female Urinal", "text": "P Ez Travel Urinal Lady Elegance P EZ Female Urinal No more uncomfortable squatting over unsanitary toilets. When you dont want to sit on an unsanitary public toilet or when one is not available, you can rely on this P EZ. Great for festivals. Completely hygienic and easy to use. Allows women of all ages to urinate in a standing up, sitting down or lying position without undressing. Discreet, portable & re-usable. Designed not to flow back, splash or spill. Features: Allows women to go anytime...anywhere Soft, Flexible silicone Discreet, spillproof and reusable Includes: 1 x Lady Elegance P EZ Female Urinal", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512PyXorHEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ANM6C8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jobar International", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 3.59}}
