{"item_id": "B004AO8BF8", "title": "Galco KT218B King Tuck IWB Holster 3.5\"-3\" 1911's", "description": "Galco's KingTukTM tuckable IWB reigns supreme in comfort, speed, and versatility! The patented* KingTuk provides the best of both worlds: a comfortable backing plate made of lined saddle leather with Napa leather front combined with a rigid Kydex holster pocket for a fast draw and easy holstering. Worn inside the waistband, the KingTuk's removable metal belt clips (fitting belts up to 1 \") can be moved up or down in the corresponding holes in the leather, enabling the user to set the carry height and angle to suit their unique preferences. Optional, interchangeable injection molded nylon C-Hooks - fitting belts up to 1 \" and sold separately - are also available. The C-Hooks offer an even lower profile on the belt, and further increase the KingTuk's already excellent concealability!", "text": "Galco KT218B King Tuck IWB Holster 3.5\"-3\" 1911's Galco's KingTukTM tuckable IWB reigns supreme in comfort, speed, and versatility! The patented* KingTuk provides the best of both worlds: a comfortable backing plate made of lined saddle leather with Napa leather front combined with a rigid Kydex holster pocket for a fast draw and easy holstering. Worn inside the waistband, the KingTuk's removable metal belt clips (fitting belts up to 1 \") can be moved up or down in the corresponding holes in the leather, enabling the user to set the carry height and angle to suit their unique preferences. Optional, interchangeable injection molded nylon C-Hooks - fitting belts up to 1 \" and sold separately - are also available. The C-Hooks offer an even lower profile on the belt, and further increase the KingTuk's already excellent concealability!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51C8yk6mZJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004AO8BF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Galco Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 56.99}}
