{"item_id": "B004ASI9II", "title": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle 38 oz.", "description": "The most versatile stainless bottles on the market! The wide mouth opening is great for easy cleaning or filing with ice. It has a standard Nalgene thread pattern and 63 mm opening, which make them compatible with most water filters.The only wide mouth stainless bottles with stainless steel threads making them incredibly durable and good-looking!", "text": "Nalgene Stainless Bottle 38 oz. The most versatile stainless bottles on the market! The wide mouth opening is great for easy cleaning or filing with ice. It has a standard Nalgene thread pattern and 63 mm opening, which make them compatible with most water filters.The only wide mouth stainless bottles with stainless steel threads making them incredibly durable and good-looking!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZvnR0de-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ASI9II.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 44.49}}
