{"item_id": "B004ASNM9O", "title": "ThermaCELL MR-FJ Mosquito Repellent Battery Operated Personal Pest Control Appliance, Woodlands Camo", "description": "Stay mosquito free with ThermaCELL Woodlands Camo Appliance. ThermaCELL offers odorless protection from mosquitoes. It gives off no scent that spooks animals, making it ideal for outdoor activities such as hunting, fishing, camping, barbeques, backyards, decks and many other outdoor activities. An effective alternative to smelly lotions and sprays which must be applied to the skin.", "text": "ThermaCELL MR-FJ Mosquito Repellent Battery Operated Personal Pest Control Appliance, Woodlands Camo Stay mosquito free with ThermaCELL Woodlands Camo Appliance. ThermaCELL offers odorless protection from mosquitoes. It gives off no scent that spooks animals, making it ideal for outdoor activities such as hunting, fishing, camping, barbeques, backyards, decks and many other outdoor activities. An effective alternative to smelly lotions and sprays which must be applied to the skin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qX43E-V7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ASNM9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Thermacell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 31.99}}
