{"item_id": "B004BE1YME", "title": "Northstar Tactical Deluxe Hydration Carrier MOLLE Military Compatable", "description": "Built to military and tactical operation standards, using heavy duty tuff cloth material reinforced for heavy use. covered from top to bottom with MOLLE straps and heavy duty fold over enclosure. It has a compartment to put up to a 2.5Liter blader (not included) Northstar Tactical builds quality products designed for many uses, great for tactical uses, paintball, daytrips, special operations, backpacking, medics, hiking or any application where you want a pack or accessory that will hold up for many years. Northstar is known for building duffle and gear bags with heavy duty zippers and the 1050 HD Tuff Cloth materials.", "text": "Northstar Tactical Deluxe Hydration Carrier MOLLE Military Compatable Built to military and tactical operation standards, using heavy duty tuff cloth material reinforced for heavy use. covered from top to bottom with MOLLE straps and heavy duty fold over enclosure. It has a compartment to put up to a 2.5Liter blader (not included) Northstar Tactical builds quality products designed for many uses, great for tactical uses, paintball, daytrips, special operations, backpacking, medics, hiking or any application where you want a pack or accessory that will hold up for many years. Northstar is known for building duffle and gear bags with heavy duty zippers and the 1050 HD Tuff Cloth materials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g2-csLM-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BE1YME.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 28.45}}
