{"item_id": "B004BGDM4U", "title": "Energizer Weather Ready Multi Function NOAA Lantern", "description": "Let Weatheready be the light in your preparedness plan for emergencies. You'll be ready to light an entire room with area lights and lanterns if the power goes out. And maneuvering through a dark house will be easy with windup LED flashlights and compact lights showing the way. Combines LED Area Lantern and NOAA Emergency Radio AM/FM Radio, Weatherband with NOAA Emergency Alert Provides up to 100 lumens and 80 hours of run time Easy to read digital display LED Lantern folds out for 360 area light Cell phone charger using standard USB port Dual power options - 8-AA Batteries (not included) or crank power.", "text": "Energizer Weather Ready Multi Function NOAA Lantern Let Weatheready be the light in your preparedness plan for emergencies. You'll be ready to light an entire room with area lights and lanterns if the power goes out. And maneuvering through a dark house will be easy with windup LED flashlights and compact lights showing the way. Combines LED Area Lantern and NOAA Emergency Radio AM/FM Radio, Weatherband with NOAA Emergency Alert Provides up to 100 lumens and 80 hours of run time Easy to read digital display LED Lantern folds out for 360 area light Cell phone charger using standard USB port Dual power options - 8-AA Batteries (not included) or crank power.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5108GVoW5ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BGDM4U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Energizer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B004BHYTNC", "title": "Condor MA23 Double Pistol Mag Pouch", "description": "Tactical MOLLE double pistol mag pouch 4\" H x 5\" W x 1\" D Fits most double stack magazines Holds two magazines (one in each pouch)", "text": "Condor MA23 Double Pistol Mag Pouch Tactical MOLLE double pistol mag pouch 4\" H x 5\" W x 1\" D Fits most double stack magazines Holds two magazines (one in each pouch)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rGucAd0AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BHYTNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B004BITVOS", "title": "U.S. Divers Lux Purge Grenada LX Snorkel Mask", "description": "Our top-quality line of dive products, the Professional Tech Series masks are designed to provide ultimate comfort, contemporary styling, as well as offer great features. LUX PURGE LX SILICONE MASK: One size fits all face skirt fits a wide range of faces. Hypoallergenic, silicone face skirt provides ultimate comfort. Side-window design for great visibility. Easy-adjusting, swivel buckle GRENADA LX SNORKEL: Submersible dry top snorkel with Flapper-Dry Technology which closes instantly to prevent water from entering snorkel whether accidentally or purposely submerged. Contoured barrel is ergonomically shaped for correct positioning and comfort Silicone mouthpiece for added comfort and durability Drop-away, full-flex section to enhance performance with Easy-clear purge valve. Also comes with Patented mask strap cover and snorkel keeper in one", "text": "U.S. Divers Lux Purge Grenada LX Snorkel Mask Our top-quality line of dive products, the Professional Tech Series masks are designed to provide ultimate comfort, contemporary styling, as well as offer great features. LUX PURGE LX SILICONE MASK: One size fits all face skirt fits a wide range of faces. Hypoallergenic, silicone face skirt provides ultimate comfort. Side-window design for great visibility. Easy-adjusting, swivel buckle GRENADA LX SNORKEL: Submersible dry top snorkel with Flapper-Dry Technology which closes instantly to prevent water from entering snorkel whether accidentally or purposely submerged. Contoured barrel is ergonomically shaped for correct positioning and comfort Silicone mouthpiece for added comfort and durability Drop-away, full-flex section to enhance performance with Easy-clear purge valve. Also comes with Patented mask strap cover and snorkel keeper in one", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HJsQblCsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BITVOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Divers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Masks"]], "price": 50.78}}
