{"item_id": "B004BJ7HRK", "title": "Modular Pistol Pouch Holster--Tan", "description": "This MOLLE Modular pistol holster, can carry any large frame automatic pistol, in service today, as well as most modern MILSPEC 1913 Picanny Railed Light Mounted Service Pistols, with Light Attached.", "text": "Modular Pistol Pouch Holster--Tan This MOLLE Modular pistol holster, can carry any large frame automatic pistol, in service today, as well as most modern MILSPEC 1913 Picanny Railed Light Mounted Service Pistols, with Light Attached.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QeeO1frEL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BJ7HRK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B004BKHVYI", "title": "Sea to Summit X-Mug", "description": "Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "text": "Sea to Summit X-Mug Introducing three innovative items for your next meal outdoors: Sea to Summit’s X-Bowl, X-Plate, and X-Mug are collapsible hybrids comprised of a rigid, cut-resistant base made of high temperature, food-grade nylon and walls made of food-grade flexible silicone, so they fold flat for compact packing. Each are tough enough to handle chopping with their sturdy nylon base. The silicone sides can withstand temperatures of hot foods and nearby hot surfaces up to 300 degrees Fahrenheit. The sides are flexible, so pouring liquids is easy. When collapsed down flat, the X-Mug nest within the X-Bowl, which handily fits into the X-Plate for extra space savings when packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FF3oUHOAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BKHVYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B004BKHVZW", "title": "Mack's Ear Band Swimming Headband, Blue/ Purple (Pack of 2)", "description": "This stylish swimming headband helps keep water out and earplugs in. Helps prevent kids from removing ear protection. Helps prevent swimmer's ear. Helps keep ears warm during cold-water activities. Doctor recommended for swimmers with ear tubes or eardrum perforations. Great for swimming, bathing, etc. 2-color, reversible, adjustable neoprene. One size fits most.", "text": "Mack's Ear Band Swimming Headband, Blue/ Purple (Pack of 2) This stylish swimming headband helps keep water out and earplugs in. Helps prevent kids from removing ear protection. Helps prevent swimmer's ear. Helps keep ears warm during cold-water activities. Doctor recommended for swimmers with ear tubes or eardrum perforations. Great for swimming, bathing, etc. 2-color, reversible, adjustable neoprene. One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AlY9koMyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004BKHVZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mack&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Earplugs"]], "price": 14.99}}
