{"item_id": "B004C46PC2", "title": "Benchmade 551H2O Orange Griptilian Knife", "description": "The H2O Griptilian features grip-textured molded orange handle (strong and very lightweight) with a diamond pattern knurl. Plain X15 T.N. stainless steel drop-point blade for maximum corrosion resistance. The stainless steel pocket clip can be reversed for right or left handed people. The AXIS lock system makes the knife easy to open and easy to close; features ambidexterous thumb-stud opener.", "text": "Benchmade 551H2O Orange Griptilian Knife The H2O Griptilian features grip-textured molded orange handle (strong and very lightweight) with a diamond pattern knurl. Plain X15 T.N. stainless steel drop-point blade for maximum corrosion resistance. The stainless steel pocket clip can be reversed for right or left handed people. The AXIS lock system makes the knife easy to open and easy to close; features ambidexterous thumb-stud opener.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312wxDMJwKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004C46PC2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 97.99}}
