{"item_id": "B004CFYTDI", "title": "Troy Industries Folding Di-Optic Aperture Tritium Battle Sight Rear", "description": "Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industries new Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) flip-type sights. Now available with Tritium, a form of hydrogen that emits its own light source, ideal for any low-light shooting situation. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 550 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Count on it. Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "text": "Troy Industries Folding Di-Optic Aperture Tritium Battle Sight Rear Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industries new Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) flip-type sights. Now available with Tritium, a form of hydrogen that emits its own light source, ideal for any low-light shooting situation. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 550 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Count on it. Black Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41opFVj3KrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CFYTDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 134.79}}
{"item_id": "B004CG053A", "title": "Troy Industries Front Folding M4 Style Gas Block Mounted Battle Sight (Black)", "description": "The Troy Industries Gas Block Mounted Front Sight. It’s been a long wait, but Troy has engineered a rugged, reliable, combat ready BattleSight that mounts securely on the gas block. It offers all of the features of Troy’s other Folding BattleSights: Easy to operate, clicks solidly into place and folds out of the way when not needed. Available soon – email or call for information. - Mounts securely on the gas block. Offers all of the features of Troy’s other Folding BattleSights. - Built-in swivel attachment on both sides - Black", "text": "Troy Industries Front Folding M4 Style Gas Block Mounted Battle Sight (Black) The Troy Industries Gas Block Mounted Front Sight. It’s been a long wait, but Troy has engineered a rugged, reliable, combat ready BattleSight that mounts securely on the gas block. It offers all of the features of Troy’s other Folding BattleSights: Easy to operate, clicks solidly into place and folds out of the way when not needed. Available soon – email or call for information. - Mounts securely on the gas block. Offers all of the features of Troy’s other Folding BattleSights. - Built-in swivel attachment on both sides - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418RDIKJJFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CG053A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 106.47}}
