{"item_id": "B004CV2YXE", "title": "Hand Warmers - HotSnapZ Reusable Round & Pocket Warmers", "description": "HotSnapZ Hand Warmers are reusable and provide instant heat. Click the internal button, see the reaction taking place and feel the instant heat. Use them over and over again. This set includes 4 HotSnapZ round hand warmers (4\" diameter) and 4 of our pocket sized HotSnapZ hand warmers. (3\" x 5\")", "text": "Hand Warmers - HotSnapZ Reusable Round & Pocket Warmers HotSnapZ Hand Warmers are reusable and provide instant heat. Click the internal button, see the reaction taking place and feel the instant heat. Use them over and over again. This set includes 4 HotSnapZ round hand warmers (4\" diameter) and 4 of our pocket sized HotSnapZ hand warmers. (3\" x 5\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vHCyasuQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CV2YXE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B004CVER4I", "title": "UTG 30mm SWAT 3-12X44 F.S. IE Scope with AO Mil-dot, 36 Colors EZ-TAP", "description": "A Zero Locking target turret prevents losing your zero setting due to bumps or recoil.This scope from UTG features a 30-millimeter tube with multi emerald-coated lenses for optimized light transmission. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.An Illumination Enhancing (IE) reticle offers multi-color mode with a full spectrum of 36 colors for personalized illumination and all-environment shooting, as well as the original RGB mode of red/green illumination with seven brightness settings, to enhance reticle visibility and target acquisition in difficult conditions.Innovative, low-profile illumination control offer two soft, ergonomic control buttons designed for natural, smooth, and quick-reaching hand/finger operation. A special circuit and housing design provides uninterrupted illumination, even under heavy recoil. Zero Locking and Zero Resetting target turrets have consistent, precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment. A Side Wheel Adjustable Turret (SWAT) offers parallax adjustment from ten yards to infinity. Also included are an integrated angled front sunshade, flip-open lens cap, and quick-detach Picatinny/Weaver rings.SpecificationsThree-to-12X magnification30-millimeter tube diameter44-millimeter objective diameter34'-8.4' field of view at 100 yards84-to-72-millimeter eye relief13.1-to-3.7-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards356-millimeter length25.6-ounce weightParallax setting of ten yards to infinityRuns on CR2032 batteriesWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "UTG 30mm SWAT 3-12X44 F.S. IE Scope with AO Mil-dot, 36 Colors EZ-TAP A Zero Locking target turret prevents losing your zero setting due to bumps or recoil.This scope from UTG features a 30-millimeter tube with multi emerald-coated lenses for optimized light transmission. Built on the company's True Strength Platform, the scope is completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof performance. Smart Spherical Structure (SSS) achieves simplified, strengthened inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive W/E adjustment and recoil resistance.An Illumination Enhancing (IE) reticle offers multi-color mode with a full spectrum of 36 colors for personalized illumination and all-environment shooting, as well as the original RGB mode of red/green illumination with seven brightness settings, to enhance reticle visibility and target acquisition in difficult conditions.Innovative, low-profile illumination control offer two soft, ergonomic control buttons designed for natural, smooth, and quick-reaching hand/finger operation. A special circuit and housing design provides uninterrupted illumination, even under heavy recoil. Zero Locking and Zero Resetting target turrets have consistent, precise 1/4 MOA per click windage and elevation adjustment. A Side Wheel Adjustable Turret (SWAT) offers parallax adjustment from ten yards to infinity. Also included are an integrated angled front sunshade, flip-open lens cap, and quick-detach Picatinny/Weaver rings.SpecificationsThree-to-12X magnification30-millimeter tube diameter44-millimeter objective diameter34'-8.4' field of view at 100 yards84-to-72-millimeter eye relief13.1-to-3.7-millimeter exit pupil0.25-inch click value at 100 yards356-millimeter length25.6-ounce weightParallax setting of ten yards to infinityRuns on CR2032 batteriesWarrantyThis scope includes a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kPBa0gLkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CVER4I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 114.99}}
