enture gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x4eCGpWHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CX8Q9S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 69.95}}
