{"item_id": "B004CXEULG", "title": "Kelty Warbler Lumbar Pack", "description": "The streamlined Warbler lumbar pack offers easy access to keys, maps, cameras, and sunscreen, making it a handy, lightweight, low-profile pouch.Features:Top loadingKey fobWebbing waist belt420-denier polyester Ball Shadow body fabric420-denier polyester Oxford reinforcement fabricSpecifications:Capacity: 150 cubic inchesWeight: 5 oz.Measures 14 x 5 x 4 inches (W x H x D)Lifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "text": "Kelty Warbler Lumbar Pack The streamlined Warbler lumbar pack offers easy access to keys, maps, cameras, and sunscreen, making it a handy, lightweight, low-profile pouch.Features:Top loadingKey fobWebbing waist belt420-denier polyester Ball Shadow body fabric420-denier polyester Oxford reinforcement fabricSpecifications:Capacity: 150 cubic inchesWeight: 5 oz.Measures 14 x 5 x 4 inches (W x H x D)Lifetime WarrantyKelty products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About KeltySince 1952, Kelty has built affordable, reliable adventure gear that enables everyone from the first-time camper to the experienced mountaineer to embrace any outdoor experience with confidence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RJS3AshXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004CXEULG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 24.95}}
