{"item_id": "B004D1H4CY", "title": "5.11 Station Grip Glove (Black)", "description": "Our economical Station Grip glove helps you perform a variety of tasks with great dexterity and comfort. To provide excellent fit, our knit back panel stretches in four directions to move with your hands, maintaining protection and dexterity at all times. The reinforced palm and fingers are flexible and tough but promote a high level of tactility while protecting your hand from abrasion and rough work. The Station Grip is washable and dries fast so feel free to use it for even the dirtiest jobs. The ID tag on the stretch cuff with Velcro closure ensures your buddies will not appropriate your new gloves. Whether you use them on or off duty, the Station Grip will become one of your favorite pieces of hand protection.", "text": "5.11 Station Grip Glove (Black) Our economical Station Grip glove helps you perform a variety of tasks with great dexterity and comfort. To provide excellent fit, our knit back panel stretches in four directions to move with your hands, maintaining protection and dexterity at all times. The reinforced palm and fingers are flexible and tough but promote a high level of tactility while protecting your hand from abrasion and rough work. The Station Grip is washable and dries fast so feel free to use it for even the dirtiest jobs. The ID tag on the stretch cuff with Velcro closure ensures your buddies will not appropriate your new gloves. Whether you use them on or off duty, the Station Grip will become one of your favorite pieces of hand protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wfDdV59hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D1H4CY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D1PWGO", "title": "5.11 Covrt18 Backpack", "description": "Our new COVRT 18 is a bag built to blend in, yet go operational at a moment's notice, whether through the mall, on the beach, or at the airport. And because blending in means not having the same color as everyone else on your team, the COVRT 18 is offered in five colorways: Asphalt/Black, Deep Moss Green/Black, Mantis Green/Dark Oak, Code Red/Steel Grey and True Navy/Asphalt. When you need to be ready for anything, choose the COVRT 18. You'll find everything you need in this lightweight pack including a hidden ambidextrous BBS Weapons pocket, removable hidden agenda identification panel, concealed R.A.C. (Roll-down Assault Compartment) with web platform and Back-up Belt System compatibility, side mesh pockets and compression straps, admin pocket, internal and external organizer pouches, padded computer compartment sleeve with hook and loop retaining strap, external attachment points, sternum strap, a carry handle integrated into a yoke shoulder system, hydration compartment, internal, easy-access flex cuff channel and shoulder straps designed to work with future QuickTact accessories.", "text": "5.11 Covrt18 Backpack Our new COVRT 18 is a bag built to blend in, yet go operational at a moment's notice, whether through the mall, on the beach, or at the airport. And because blending in means not having the same color as everyone else on your team, the COVRT 18 is offered in five colorways: Asphalt/Black, Deep Moss Green/Black, Mantis Green/Dark Oak, Code Red/Steel Grey and True Navy/Asphalt. When you need to be ready for anything, choose the COVRT 18. You'll find everything you need in this lightweight pack including a hidden ambidextrous BBS Weapons pocket, removable hidden agenda identification panel, concealed R.A.C. (Roll-down Assault Compartment) with web platform and Back-up Belt System compatibility, side mesh pockets and compression straps, admin pocket, internal and external organizer pouches, padded computer compartment sleeve with hook and loop retaining strap, external attachment points, sternum strap, a carry handle integrated into a yoke shoulder system, hydration compartment, internal, easy-access flex cuff channel and shoulder straps designed to work with future QuickTact accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZsGsgXQyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D1PWGO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D1R7VC", "title": "5.11 Rush Delivery Messenger Bag", "description": "This comfortable bag is designed to fit a 15\" laptop in a padded, internal sleeve and offers over 20 organizing pockets. Two Backup Belt System pockets (one internal) and one external with zippered and Velcro closure allows you to either completely conceal your weapon, or to have it prepped and not seen. Web platform and multiple attachment points, as well as internal and external BBS make customizing this bag a snap, while the top carry handle and padded shoulder strap ensure it's always by your side. Both ends of the RUSH Delivery have concealed, expandable gussets that fit a standard water bottle, but cinch flush when not in use, maintaining a neat, clean, professional finish for all of your daily commuting needs. The RUSH Delivery will be offered in 019 Black and 328 Sandstone.", "text": "5.11 Rush Delivery Messenger Bag This comfortable bag is designed to fit a 15\" laptop in a padded, internal sleeve and offers over 20 organizing pockets. Two Backup Belt System pockets (one internal) and one external with zippered and Velcro closure allows you to either completely conceal your weapon, or to have it prepped and not seen. Web platform and multiple attachment points, as well as internal and external BBS make customizing this bag a snap, while the top carry handle and padded shoulder strap ensure it's always by your side. Both ends of the RUSH Delivery have concealed, expandable gussets that fit a standard water bottle, but cinch flush when not in use, maintaining a neat, clean, professional finish for all of your daily commuting needs. The RUSH Delivery will be offered in 019 Black and 328 Sandstone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yFpb4SgCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D1R7VC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 99.85}}
{"item_id": "B004D1R7XK", "title": "5.11 Rush 10 Mobile Operation Attachment Bag", "description": "MOAB stands for Mobile Operation Attachment Bag and with the new Tier System (included on the MOAB 10 and 6 and sold separately) can rapidly connect/disconnect to any of our RUSH series of packs, DC Roller and bags with web platform. The MOAB's include similar features from our RUSH series of packs, including a top-access fleece-lined, non-scratching sunglass pocket, internal and external organizing pockets, key chain fobs, front and side web platform, flag and name tape Velcro, carry handle and hydration pouch compatibility. In addition, the MOAB 10 includes a tech pocket on the shoulder strap with an ear-bud eyelet pass-through, great for a small radio or smart phone.", "text": "5.11 Rush 10 Mobile Operation Attachment Bag MOAB stands for Mobile Operation Attachment Bag and with the new Tier System (included on the MOAB 10 and 6 and sold separately) can rapidly connect/disconnect to any of our RUSH series of packs, DC Roller and bags with web platform. The MOAB's include similar features from our RUSH series of packs, including a top-access fleece-lined, non-scratching sunglass pocket, internal and external organizing pockets, key chain fobs, front and side web platform, flag and name tape Velcro, carry handle and hydration pouch compatibility. In addition, the MOAB 10 includes a tech pocket on the shoulder strap with an ear-bud eyelet pass-through, great for a small radio or smart phone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vh8Q3SCaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D1R7XK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D1UPIY", "title": "5.11 Rush 6 Mobile Operation Attachment Bag", "description": "A sling-styled bag that increases operational flexibility in the field, training, at work or play. Something unique to the MOAB’s is their ambidextrous sling-style shoulder strap, accommodating either a left or right-handed user. The MOAB 6 bag can also be spun around from the back to the chest while being worn, making them easy to work out of, or to access the hidden weapon pocket. The Black color easily crosses over from field work to family trail hike or outing.", "text": "5.11 Rush 6 Mobile Operation Attachment Bag A sling-styled bag that increases operational flexibility in the field, training, at work or play. Something unique to the MOAB’s is their ambidextrous sling-style shoulder strap, accommodating either a left or right-handed user. The MOAB 6 bag can also be spun around from the back to the chest while being worn, making them easy to work out of, or to access the hidden weapon pocket. The Black color easily crosses over from field work to family trail hike or outing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510PjZOs-BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D1UPIY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D322BA", "title": "Stearns Avant 200 Paddlesports Vest", "description": "Great for active kayaking, canoeing, and paddleboarding, the Stearns Avant 200 Paddlesports Life Vest is constructed of rugged 200-denier nylon and ripstop nylon over PE foam, offering 15.5 pounds of buoyancy. The Avant 200 features large armhole openings for excellent freedom of movement. The full front zipper makes it easy to put on and remove. A fixed front waist buckle and side adjustment ladder locks ensure a secure fit. This Type III personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved.", "text": "Stearns Avant 200 Paddlesports Vest Great for active kayaking, canoeing, and paddleboarding, the Stearns Avant 200 Paddlesports Life Vest is constructed of rugged 200-denier nylon and ripstop nylon over PE foam, offering 15.5 pounds of buoyancy. The Avant 200 features large armhole openings for excellent freedom of movement. The full front zipper makes it easy to put on and remove. A fixed front waist buckle and side adjustment ladder locks ensure a secure fit. This Type III personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Oh%2BPT2OcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D322BA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D32436", "title": "Stearns Comfort Series Life Vest", "description": "", "text": "Stearns Comfort Series Life Vest", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H36Eyq9%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D32436.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D32742", "title": "Stearns Suspenders Manually Inflatable Belt-Pack Life Jacket", "description": "Stearns Sospenders inflatable lifejackets are lightweight and comfortable, allowing freedom of movement while providing maximum buoyancy. Great for sailing, fishing, paddling, boating, or hunting, this Stearns Sospenders life jacket is stored as a compact belt pack, and manually inflates within seconds to be a complete, adult-sized (30\"-52\" chest) life jacket providing 15.5 lbs. of buoyancy. Jacket inflates via the 16-gram CO2 cylinder by pulling the attached lanyard, or by blowing into the inflation tube. This personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved. Uses rearming kit #0925 for repeated use. Inflatable PFDs are not recommended for non-swimmers; not for use for active watersports activities (skiing, tubing, wakeboarding, white water, or PWC).", "text": "Stearns Suspenders Manually Inflatable Belt-Pack Life Jacket Stearns Sospenders inflatable lifejackets are lightweight and comfortable, allowing freedom of movement while providing maximum buoyancy. Great for sailing, fishing, paddling, boating, or hunting, this Stearns Sospenders life jacket is stored as a compact belt pack, and manually inflates within seconds to be a complete, adult-sized (30\"-52\" chest) life jacket providing 15.5 lbs. of buoyancy. Jacket inflates via the 16-gram CO2 cylinder by pulling the attached lanyard, or by blowing into the inflation tube. This personal flotation device is Coast Guard approved. Uses rearming kit #0925 for repeated use. Inflatable PFDs are not recommended for non-swimmers; not for use for active watersports activities (skiing, tubing, wakeboarding, white water, or PWC).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313kw3zNRkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D32742.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Safety & Flotation Devices", "Life Jackets & Vests"]], "price": 76.51}}
{"item_id": "B004D32HMO", "title": "Shoreline Marine 6-Feet Aluminum Oar", "description": "Light and easy to use oar still maintains great durability and corrosion resistance.", "text": "Shoreline Marine 6-Feet Aluminum Oar Light and easy to use oar still maintains great durability and corrosion resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/118H71nbyLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D32HMO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Canoeing", "Paddles"]], "price": 23.34}}
{"item_id": "B004D33WKK", "title": "Coleman Comfort Control Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Coleman Comfort Control Sleeping Bag gives you a convenient, comfortable rest in temperatures down to 30°F. The Comfort Control bag measures 33\" wide by 78\" long. It's constructed of polyester ripstop over a soft brushed-polyester lining, with three pounds of Coletherm insulation inside. The bag features Coleman's patented no-snag zipper, plus the Quick Cord easy storage system. Stuff sack included.", "text": "Coleman Comfort Control Sleeping Bag The Coleman Comfort Control Sleeping Bag gives you a convenient, comfortable rest in temperatures down to 30°F. The Comfort Control bag measures 33\" wide by 78\" long. It's constructed of polyester ripstop over a soft brushed-polyester lining, with three pounds of Coletherm insulation inside. The bag features Coleman's patented no-snag zipper, plus the Quick Cord easy storage system. Stuff sack included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aYACTk1pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D33WKK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004D342PY", "title": "Stearns Hybrid Fishing/Paddle Vest", "description": "The Stearns Hybrid Fishing/Paddle Life Vest is perfect for fishing, kayaking, canoeing, and other water activities. It's durably constructed of nylon rip-stop over PE foam, with adjustable neoprene shoulder straps for a great fit. The Hybrid Life Vest is packed with features for convenience, including a handy fold-down fly bench / work tray with internal storage pocket, a Zinger Coil for pliers and clippers, fabric gear-attachment tabs, and triangle hooks & lash patches for additional functionality. Universal size fits chests 30\"-52\".", "text": "Stearns Hybrid Fishing/Paddle Vest The Stearns Hybrid Fishing/Paddle Life Vest is perfect for fishing, kayaking, canoeing, and other water activities. It's durably constructed of nylon rip-stop over PE foam, with adjustable neoprene shoulder straps for a great fit. The Hybrid Life Vest is packed with features for convenience, including a handy fold-down fly bench / work tray with internal storage pocket, a Zinger Coil for pliers and clippers, fabric gear-attachment tabs, and triangle hooks & lash patches for additional functionality. Universal size fits chests 30\"-52\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mHj7M8kPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D342PY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stearns", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Jackets & Vests", "Vests"]], "price": 90.7}}
{"item_id": "B004D34AKQ", "title": "Hodgman Mackenzie Nylon/PVC Chest Wader with Cleated Soles", "description": "The Hodgman Mackenzie Chest Wader is durably constructed of a new nylon/PVC material that's 35% lighter than rubber waders, for long-lasting comfort. The boots are cleated for a sure grip in the water, and offer 25% more durability than rubber boots.", "text": "Hodgman Mackenzie Nylon/PVC Chest Wader with Cleated Soles The Hodgman Mackenzie Chest Wader is durably constructed of a new nylon/PVC material that's 35% lighter than rubber waders, for long-lasting comfort. The boots are cleated for a sure grip in the water, and offer 25% more durability than rubber boots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JGS-z%2B2xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D34AKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Boots Waders"]]}}
