{"item_id": "B004D34EQ6", "title": "Shoreline Marine Kayak Paddle Rounded Blade, 96-Inch", "description": "Shoreline Marine 96\" Kayak Paddle Rounded Blade is made with corrosion resistant aluminum shaft boat paddle. The paddle has high impact handles and molded blades for easy use. Lightweight design allows the user to travel a greater distance with less fatigue.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Kayak Paddle Rounded Blade, 96-Inch Shoreline Marine 96\" Kayak Paddle Rounded Blade is made with corrosion resistant aluminum shaft boat paddle. The paddle has high impact handles and molded blades for easy use. Lightweight design allows the user to travel a greater distance with less fatigue.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zwKzrMy3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D34EQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddles"]], "price": 31.5}}
