{"item_id": "B004D60S86", "title": "ESS Eyewear Crossbow Suppressor One Kit, Black", "description": "The ESS Crossbow Suppressor is the first spectacle frame designed for use with ear cup hearing protection and communications devices. Featuring Z-Bend Geometry, the frame's ultra-thin temple arms help keep noise out by minimizing the effect on the padded seal of ear cups. The slim temples eliminate the hot spots and pressure points that commonly occur when normal eyewear is worn under ear cups. The Suppressor frame is compatible with all Crossbow lenses. The 2.4mm Polycarbonate lens feature distortion-free ESSOPTICS and Clear Zone FlowCoat technology to combat fogging on the inside and scratches on the outside. The frame's DeadBolt Lens Lock provides quick lens interchange and rock-solid retention under impact. The Crossbow Suppressor ONE Kit includes the black Crossbow Suppressor frame with interchangeable Hi-Def Copper lens, Micro-fiber pouch, Snap-on elastic retention strap, ESS sticker and Crossbow instruction booklet.", "text": "ESS Eyewear Crossbow Suppressor One Kit, Black The ESS Crossbow Suppressor is the first spectacle frame designed for use with ear cup hearing protection and communications devices. Featuring Z-Bend Geometry, the frame's ultra-thin temple arms help keep noise out by minimizing the effect on the padded seal of ear cups. The slim temples eliminate the hot spots and pressure points that commonly occur when normal eyewear is worn under ear cups. The Suppressor frame is compatible with all Crossbow lenses. The 2.4mm Polycarbonate lens feature distortion-free ESSOPTICS and Clear Zone FlowCoat technology to combat fogging on the inside and scratches on the outside. The frame's DeadBolt Lens Lock provides quick lens interchange and rock-solid retention under impact. The Crossbow Suppressor ONE Kit includes the black Crossbow Suppressor frame with interchangeable Hi-Def Copper lens, Micro-fiber pouch, Snap-on elastic retention strap, ESS sticker and Crossbow instruction booklet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EW8RSAS8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D60S86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESS Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 34.2}}
{"item_id": "B004D6461Q", "title": "Delfin Spa Women's Bio Ceramic Anti Cellulite Capris", "description": "", "text": "Delfin Spa Women's Bio Ceramic Anti Cellulite Capris", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3189uicyFBL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D6461Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Tights & Leggings"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Leggings"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Petite", "Active", "Active Leggings"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B004D6H1WC", "title": "Morakniv Classic No 2 Wood Handle Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade, 4.2-Inch", "description": "Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic No 2 features a 4.2-inch carbon steel blade and red birch wood handle. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "text": "Morakniv Classic No 2 Wood Handle Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade, 4.2-Inch Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic No 2 features a 4.2-inch carbon steel blade and red birch wood handle. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dZI0wc-iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D6H1WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B004D80VM2", "title": "Master Cutlery TA-93BK Tactical Pen Tatical Knife and Pen Set Designed by Tom Anderson", "description": "Misc Tom Anderson Pen.Twister Tactical Pen. 5 1/2\" overall. Black textured stainless shaft. Glow in the dark pen top. Medium point pen with black ink. Stainless pocket clip.", "text": "Master Cutlery TA-93BK Tactical Pen Tatical Knife and Pen Set Designed by Tom Anderson Misc Tom Anderson Pen.Twister Tactical Pen. 5 1/2\" overall. Black textured stainless shaft. Glow in the dark pen top. Medium point pen with black ink. Stainless pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MzWl3NknL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D80VM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Master Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Office Products", "Pens"]], "price": 12.84}}
{"item_id": "B004D8MZ6C", "title": "Coghlan's 9309 9\" Abs Tent Peg", "description": "6 Coghlan's 9\" Plastic Tent Pegs. Guaranteed unbreakable; Large no-slip hook; 9\" long. Order Today! Coghlan's 9\" Plastic Tent Pegs, 6-Pk.", "text": "Coghlan's 9309 9\" Abs Tent Peg 6 Coghlan's 9\" Plastic Tent Pegs. Guaranteed unbreakable; Large no-slip hook; 9\" long. Order Today! Coghlan's 9\" Plastic Tent Pegs, 6-Pk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DTMp%2BPRgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004D8MZ6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlan&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 4.97}}
