{"item_id": "B004DAYS42", "title": "Shimano BR-M985 F01A Resin Disc Brake Pad with Spring and Fin", "description": "Shimano disc brake replacement brake pad with return spring.", "text": "Shimano BR-M985 F01A Resin Disc Brake Pad with Spring and Fin Shimano disc brake replacement brake pad with return spring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z3s4vsGUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DAYS42.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004DB1KB0", "title": "Klean Kanteen Coffee Set Wide Mouth Insulated Bottle w/ 2 Caps (Stainless Loop Cap and Cafe Cap) - Brushed Stainless 20 oz.", "description": "Whether you're rockin' out to \"Ice, Ice Baby\" or feelin' \"Hot, Hot, Hot\", the 20oz Kanteen Wide Insulated will keep the temperature just right. Since it's our largest Insulated bottle, it can also hang with you for the long haul. Whatever food or drink you're packing, whether you poured it in hot or cold, the 20oz Kanteen Wide Insulated has double-walled, vacuum insulation to keep it that way: up to six hours for hot stuff, and more than 24 for iced drinks. Because the bottle is made from high quality, 18/8, food-grade stainless steel and has a 100% stainless interior, it won't retain or impart flavors no matter what you put in it. That's a good thing. Because the tastes of split pea soup, chai tea, and blueberry/banana smoothie simply should not be mixed. With an all-stainless interior and no liner, you won't have any lingering flavors either. Because the last thing you need is junior coming home from school complaining that his smoothie tasted like your coffee from the day before. The leakproof Stainless Loop Cap creates an all-stainless interior in the bottle and gives you peace of mind if you want to toss it in a bag or lunch box. You can drink straight from the bottle, which has a cup-like feel and comfortable narrow rim, or the sleek Caf Cap to convert the bottle into a to-go mug.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Coffee Set Wide Mouth Insulated Bottle w/ 2 Caps (Stainless Loop Cap and Cafe Cap) - Brushed Stainless 20 oz. Whether you're rockin' out to \"Ice, Ice Baby\" or feelin' \"Hot, Hot, Hot\", the 20oz Kanteen Wide Insulated will keep the temperature just right. Since it's our largest Insulated bottle, it can also hang with you for the long haul. Whatever food or drink you're packing, whether you poured it in hot or cold, the 20oz Kanteen Wide Insulated has double-walled, vacuum insulation to keep it that way: up to six hours for hot stuff, and more than 24 for iced drinks. Because the bottle is made from high quality, 18/8, food-grade stainless steel and has a 100% stainless interior, it won't retain or impart flavors no matter what you put in it. That's a good thing. Because the tastes of split pea soup, chai tea, and blueberry/banana smoothie simply should not be mixed. With an all-stainless interior and no liner, you won't have any lingering flavors either. Because the last thing you need is junior coming home from school complaining that his smoothie tasted like your coffee from the day before. The leakproof Stainless Loop Cap creates an all-stainless interior in the bottle and gives you peace of mind if you want to toss it in a bag or lunch box. You can drink straight from the bottle, which has a cup-like feel and comfortable narrow rim, or the sleek Caf Cap to convert the bottle into a to-go mug.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S-Mxxc2GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DB1KB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DDJNOY", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"CQB\" Rifle Shotgun Pistol Red-Green 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight/Scope", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical CQB 4 Reticle Dual Red / Green Open Reflex Sight with Integral Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base. High quality aircraft grade aluminum construction, shock proof, fog proof, water resistant ideal for military-law enforcement-hunters. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 6 Brightness Settings (3 Red, 3 Green). Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. CR2032 Lithum Battery", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"CQB\" Rifle Shotgun Pistol Red-Green 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight/Scope Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical CQB 4 Reticle Dual Red / Green Open Reflex Sight with Integral Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base. High quality aircraft grade aluminum construction, shock proof, fog proof, water resistant ideal for military-law enforcement-hunters. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 6 Brightness Settings (3 Red, 3 Green). Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. CR2032 Lithum Battery", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KZczarcrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DDJNOY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DDJXEO", "title": "GMG-Global Military Gear Tactical Military Assault Vest w/Pistol Holster-Black", "description": "Official GMG -Global Military Gear New Generation Stealth Black Tactical Assault Vest (Right Handed). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes, . Completely breathable mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a behind the neck rescue pull handle for extraction of a wounded team member, a reinforced and texturized shooter/sniper non-slip shoulder pad, and 2 d-rings attached to the shoulders for hanging the vest when it's not being worn. The back of the vest features sturdy nylon horizontal webbing loops to hold swords, shovels, or other gear as well as a large secure webbing pocket for hydration systems/bladders or a ballistic shield . The front of the vest features: 3 Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, 3 (Upper Left) Universal Pistol Mag or Flashlight/Grenade Pouch, 1 Radio/Cell Phone/Light Pouch, and 1 Large ID/Documents/accessory pouch with velcro on the front of the pouch that comes with a removable elastic 5- shell holder patch which when can easily detatched and the velcro can then be used for attachment of emblems/flags etc. Also features 2 (1-right 1-Left on inside of the vest) large internal zippered secure pockets for maps or documents. Includes a Quick Snap Deluxe pistol belt with 2 spare mag/accessory pouches, and a Universal Pistol holster w/ additional mag pouch. The holster can be easily removed or adjusted to a customized position. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement.", "text": "GMG-Global Military Gear Tactical Military Assault Vest w/Pistol Holster-Black Official GMG -Global Military Gear New Generation Stealth Black Tactical Assault Vest (Right Handed). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes, . Completely breathable mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a behind the neck rescue pull handle for extraction of a wounded team member, a reinforced and texturized shooter/sniper non-slip shoulder pad, and 2 d-rings attached to the shoulders for hanging the vest when it's not being worn. The back of the vest features sturdy nylon horizontal webbing loops to hold swords, shovels, or other gear as well as a large secure webbing pocket for hydration systems/bladders or a ballistic shield . The front of the vest features: 3 Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, 3 (Upper Left) Universal Pistol Mag or Flashlight/Grenade Pouch, 1 Radio/Cell Phone/Light Pouch, and 1 Large ID/Documents/accessory pouch with velcro on the front of the pouch that comes with a removable elastic 5- shell holder patch which when can easily detatched and the velcro can then be used for attachment of emblems/flags etc. Also features 2 (1-right 1-Left on inside of the vest) large internal zippered secure pockets for maps or documents. Includes a Quick Snap Deluxe pistol belt with 2 spare mag/accessory pouches, and a Universal Pistol holster w/ additional mag pouch. The holster can be easily removed or adjusted to a customized position. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t0FHK1bSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DDJXEO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GMG-Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Equipment Bags"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DH0YEI", "title": "Surefire EPS Sonic Defenders Ear Plug", "description": "while potentially harmful noises (above 85dB) are reduced via a proprietary design that incorporates the patented Hocks Noise Braker filter", "text": "Surefire EPS Sonic Defenders Ear Plug while potentially harmful noises (above 85dB) are reduced via a proprietary design that incorporates the patented Hocks Noise Braker filter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t4ysK6vCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DH0YEI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004DI3B92", "title": "Ps Prod Spec Ops Overnight Bag", "description": "cial Ops Overnight Computer Bag w/ Handgun Concealment- Large Used by Navy SEAL and Military Special Ops Forces. Designed for extreme use in adverse conditions. Constructed of 600D poly materials with double coated PVC lining for strength and durability. This is your ultimate briefcase, range bag, gear bag or overnight bag Day Bag and Overnight Bag available. THIS LISTING IS FOR THE OVERNIGHT BAG. Please see other listing for Day Bag. The Overnight Bag includes: Large main compartment with expansion feature Multiple gear pockets and MOLLE loops Interior ID pocket 3 detachable MOLLE pockets on front of bag Separate padded laptop computer bag with velcro closure and tip grab handle Also has a back zippered document pocket with MOLLE loops Adjustable & removable padded shoulder straps Overnight bag contains a convenient handgun pocket Includes: 1 x Special Ops Overnight Bag- Black", "text": "Ps Prod Spec Ops Overnight Bag cial Ops Overnight Computer Bag w/ Handgun Concealment- Large Used by Navy SEAL and Military Special Ops Forces. Designed for extreme use in adverse conditions. Constructed of 600D poly materials with double coated PVC lining for strength and durability. This is your ultimate briefcase, range bag, gear bag or overnight bag Day Bag and Overnight Bag available. THIS LISTING IS FOR THE OVERNIGHT BAG. Please see other listing for Day Bag. The Overnight Bag includes: Large main compartment with expansion feature Multiple gear pockets and MOLLE loops Interior ID pocket 3 detachable MOLLE pockets on front of bag Separate padded laptop computer bag with velcro closure and tip grab handle Also has a back zippered document pocket with MOLLE loops Adjustable & removable padded shoulder straps Overnight bag contains a convenient handgun pocket Includes: 1 x Special Ops Overnight Bag- Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RIdEOhxzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DI3B92.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 53.53}}
{"item_id": "B004DJ04PU", "title": "BudK Military Surplus Swiss Camo Wet Weather Poncho", "description": "This item has been used by military forces and now has been inspected and classified \"New\" and placed on the market for the average consumer to utilized for their wet weather needs. This poncho comes in one size, that will fit almost every body type. This Swiss Camo wet Weather Poncho has been sealed at the seams which means no leaks!", "text": "BudK Military Surplus Swiss Camo Wet Weather Poncho This item has been used by military forces and now has been inspected and classified \"New\" and placed on the market for the average consumer to utilized for their wet weather needs. This poncho comes in one size, that will fit almost every body type. This Swiss Camo wet Weather Poncho has been sealed at the seams which means no leaks!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j2hWejxyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DJ04PU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.85}}
{"item_id": "B004DJ2318", "title": "German Snow Camo Poncho Used", "description": "German Snow Camo Poncho.Lightweight cotton poncho for snow camouflage. Has pine camo spots on white background. Attached hood. About 5' x 7' open. Used in good condition.", "text": "German Snow Camo Poncho Used German Snow Camo Poncho.Lightweight cotton poncho for snow camouflage. Has pine camo spots on white background. Attached hood. About 5' x 7' open. Used in good condition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LRqkwLDPL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DJ2318.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RDDUSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B004DK8AAK", "title": "Primal Wear Men's Torque Jersey", "description": "The latest hand drawn piece from primal features a steel gray blue illustration of the inner gear workings of the human machine. Race lines and simple accents add to the design. With 3 rear cargo pockets and a full hidden zip, torque is ride ready. This jersey features sublimation graphics on 100% speedpro fabric. The speedpro is a double knit performance poly that wicks sweat away from the body keeping riders cool and comfortable. Using advanced printing methods ensures the graphics are detailed and colorfast, without affecting the physical properties of the jersey.", "text": "Primal Wear Men's Torque Jersey The latest hand drawn piece from primal features a steel gray blue illustration of the inner gear workings of the human machine. Race lines and simple accents add to the design. With 3 rear cargo pockets and a full hidden zip, torque is ride ready. This jersey features sublimation graphics on 100% speedpro fabric. The speedpro is a double knit performance poly that wicks sweat away from the body keeping riders cool and comfortable. Using advanced printing methods ensures the graphics are detailed and colorfast, without affecting the physical properties of the jersey.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51i9NRr5BYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DK8AAK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004DKNOTM", "title": "Amphipod Xinglet Vest", "description": "The Amphipod Xinglet provides high brilliance reflective visibility with an up-to-date look and minimalist feel! It has up to 40% more reflective area than standard running vests. It has 360 visibility and is fully size adjustable for both height and waist size.Easy size adjustment for height/waist-wear over a t-shirt or parka.", "text": "Amphipod Xinglet Vest The Amphipod Xinglet provides high brilliance reflective visibility with an up-to-date look and minimalist feel! It has up to 40% more reflective area than standard running vests. It has 360 visibility and is fully size adjustable for both height and waist size.Easy size adjustment for height/waist-wear over a t-shirt or parka.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-TvTyIaAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DKNOTM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Amphipod", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DKSF96", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0160 Combat Knife Fixed Blade", "description": "The ZT0160 features a high-performance 14C28N blade with Tungsten DLC non-reflective coating. The scales are machined G-10 for great grip, imperviousness to temperature extremes, and excellent insulating properties. It's smaller and lighter than the ZT0100, yet still built to handle tough duty.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0160 Combat Knife Fixed Blade The ZT0160 features a high-performance 14C28N blade with Tungsten DLC non-reflective coating. The scales are machined G-10 for great grip, imperviousness to temperature extremes, and excellent insulating properties. It's smaller and lighter than the ZT0100, yet still built to handle tough duty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cnhnYerNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DKSF96.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B004DM6MPS", "title": "DeSantis P3AT/ LCP Sof-Tuck Holster", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis P3AT/ LCP Sof-Tuck Holster Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317hJCbULgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DM6MPS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.39}}
{"item_id": "B004DMAI6M", "title": "Desantis 106 Sof-Tuck Inside the Pant Right Hand Tan For S&W Bodyguard .380", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "Desantis 106 Sof-Tuck Inside the Pant Right Hand Tan For S&W Bodyguard .380 Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R8mBf3e4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DMAI6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.98}}
{"item_id": "B004DMCFT0", "title": "Desantis 106 Sof-Tuck Inside the Pant Right Hand Tan For S&W J Frame 2\" Revolver", "description": "SOF-TUCK #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "Desantis 106 Sof-Tuck Inside the Pant Right Hand Tan For S&W J Frame 2\" Revolver SOF-TUCK #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I31Q9kQFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DMCFT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.98}}
{"item_id": "B004DMCFTA", "title": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck 1911 Officer Right Hand Tan", "description": "SOF-TUCK #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck 1911 Officer Right Hand Tan SOF-TUCK #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R8mBf3e4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DMCFTA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.09}}
{"item_id": "B004DME8UE", "title": "DeSantis Summer Heat LCP/P3AT Right Hand Tan", "description": "The Summer Heat is a bare bones minimum IWB holster built from premium saddle leather. Its finely molded contours provide the weapon retention. The top is reinforced to ease re-holstering and the powder coated spring clip holds it securely to your belt. Available in saddle tan for the Keltec P3AT, Ruger LCP, and S and W J frames.", "text": "DeSantis Summer Heat LCP/P3AT Right Hand Tan The Summer Heat is a bare bones minimum IWB holster built from premium saddle leather. Its finely molded contours provide the weapon retention. The top is reinforced to ease re-holstering and the powder coated spring clip holds it securely to your belt. Available in saddle tan for the Keltec P3AT, Ruger LCP, and S and W J frames.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FZR1i3MlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DME8UE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.89}}
{"item_id": "B004DME8WC", "title": "DeSantis Kahr/Taurus/Keltec Sof-Tuck Holster", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis Kahr/Taurus/Keltec Sof-Tuck Holster Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R8mBf3e4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DME8WC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.98}}
{"item_id": "B004DOYU1Y", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear 3X \"CQB\" Tactical Magnifier for Red Dot Scope-Sight : Includes \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Ring", "description": "Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation \"CQB\" 3X Scope/Sight Magnifier :Package Includes 30mm Quick Detach Weaver 7/8\" Mounting Ring. Superior Quality 3x Fixed Magnification, Multi Coated 30mm diameter lens allows in maximum light. With a weight of 6 oz and a length of 4.5\", this Magnifier has the ability to switch in a split second from CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to longer range for a great tactical advantage. Field Of View : 6 Degrees , and 1.65\" Eye relief. Sealed Fog-Proof Internal optics, waterproof, shockproof. Finish/Color is a non reflective Black with a hard coat finish. Works with Eotech & Aimpoint Compact Sights and similar Sights/Scopes . A favorite with Military - Law Enforcement - Hunters.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear 3X \"CQB\" Tactical Magnifier for Red Dot Scope-Sight : Includes \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Ring Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation \"CQB\" 3X Scope/Sight Magnifier :Package Includes 30mm Quick Detach Weaver 7/8\" Mounting Ring. Superior Quality 3x Fixed Magnification, Multi Coated 30mm diameter lens allows in maximum light. With a weight of 6 oz and a length of 4.5\", this Magnifier has the ability to switch in a split second from CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to longer range for a great tactical advantage. Field Of View : 6 Degrees , and 1.65\" Eye relief. Sealed Fog-Proof Internal optics, waterproof, shockproof. Finish/Color is a non reflective Black with a hard coat finish. Works with Eotech & Aimpoint Compact Sights and similar Sights/Scopes . A favorite with Military - Law Enforcement - Hunters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o17DAa6gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DOYU1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DSM724", "title": "Coleman Mens Apparel 10mm Pvc Rain Suit Advantage Realtree Ap", "description": "", "text": "Coleman Mens Apparel 10mm Pvc Rain Suit Advantage Realtree Ap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513KKaJ6L%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSM724.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004DSR7EW", "title": "Safariland Duty Gear Glock 17 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Plain Black)", "description": "The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "text": "Safariland Duty Gear Glock 17 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Plain Black) The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RYTiOZMeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSR7EW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland Duty Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 26.45}}
{"item_id": "B004DSSTVC", "title": "Safariland Duty Gear Glock 17 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Stx Black)", "description": "The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "text": "Safariland Duty Gear Glock 17 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Stx Black) The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ouwY4xaKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSSTVC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland Duty Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 27.88}}
{"item_id": "B004DSX1DS", "title": "Gerber 31-000583 DMF Tanto Point Serrated Folder Knife", "description": "Gerber 31-000583 DMF folder knife. The manual opening DMF Folder brings the much sought after tactical innovations and technologies of the Automatic DMF to a large, ambidextrous-use knife. Textured G-10 handle gives the DMF Folder a sure grip and maintains a perfect weight balance. Partially serrated tactical blade. Open length of knife 8.4-Inch, blade length 3.5-Inch and closed length 4.8-Inch.", "text": "Gerber 31-000583 DMF Tanto Point Serrated Folder Knife Gerber 31-000583 DMF folder knife. The manual opening DMF Folder brings the much sought after tactical innovations and technologies of the Automatic DMF to a large, ambidextrous-use knife. Textured G-10 handle gives the DMF Folder a sure grip and maintains a perfect weight balance. Partially serrated tactical blade. Open length of knife 8.4-Inch, blade length 3.5-Inch and closed length 4.8-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31I0HWi2USL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSX1DS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 46.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DSX3M2", "title": "Gerber Bear Grylls Scout Drop Point Knife", "description": "Gerber's Bear Grylls' Scout Drop Point Knife™ is part of the Gerber / Bear Grylls Survival Series. This collaboration brings together over 70 years of knife and gear expertise with Bear's extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create one of a kind knives, tools and gear. Each item in the Survival Series is meticulously designed by Gerber and Bear to offer a multitude of uses in any environment. The Scout draws on Bear's experience as Chief UK Scout and figurehead to 28 million scouts worldwide. The Scout's half-serrated blade cuts through heavy-duty materials like rope, while an ergonomic, textured rubber handle provides a non-slip grip and maximum comfort. For added safety, the lockback feature locks the blade in place while it's open. Lightweight and portable, the Scout comes with a clip and is easy to carry in your pocket. Includes Bear Grylls' Priorities of Survival Pocket Guide.", "text": "Gerber Bear Grylls Scout Drop Point Knife Gerber's Bear Grylls' Scout Drop Point Knife™ is part of the Gerber / Bear Grylls Survival Series. This collaboration brings together over 70 years of knife and gear expertise with Bear's extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create one of a kind knives, tools and gear. Each item in the Survival Series is meticulously designed by Gerber and Bear to offer a multitude of uses in any environment. The Scout draws on Bear's experience as Chief UK Scout and figurehead to 28 million scouts worldwide. The Scout's half-serrated blade cuts through heavy-duty materials like rope, while an ergonomic, textured rubber handle provides a non-slip grip and maximum comfort. For added safety, the lockback feature locks the blade in place while it's open. Lightweight and portable, the Scout comes with a clip and is easy to carry in your pocket. Includes Bear Grylls' Priorities of Survival Pocket Guide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GNunEA0rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSX3M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B004DSXBAQ", "title": "Gerber 31-000716 STL Drop Point Fine Edge 2.5 Single Blade Knife", "description": "Gerber 31-000716 STL 2.5 single blade knife with full fine edge. The STL 2.5 may be larger than its predecessor, a fully machined stainless steel handle keeps it ultra thin and light to sit deep in a pocket or purse. It features a fully machined stainless steel handle, thin handle with style and comfort. Frame lock, common lock.", "text": "Gerber 31-000716 STL Drop Point Fine Edge 2.5 Single Blade Knife Gerber 31-000716 STL 2.5 single blade knife with full fine edge. The STL 2.5 may be larger than its predecessor, a fully machined stainless steel handle keeps it ultra thin and light to sit deep in a pocket or purse. It features a fully machined stainless steel handle, thin handle with style and comfort. Frame lock, common lock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YDTvZ3D2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSXBAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 14.24}}
{"item_id": "B004DSYR04", "title": "Safariland Duty Gear Colt 1911 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Stx Black)", "description": "The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "text": "Safariland Duty Gear Colt 1911 Open Top Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch (Stx Black) The Safariland Slimline Triple Magazine Pouch is constructed from SafariLaminate a unique thermal laminate process. This material is impervious to moisture, bloodborne pathogens and does not break down like natural materials, making it an extremely durable and long term professional looking product. Available in Traditional Leather Look Finish, offered in Plain, Basketweave and Hi Gloss, and the STX Finish, helping to reduce weat and tear scratches on the product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RYTiOZMeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSYR04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland Duty Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B004DSZVB8", "title": "Gerber 30-000315 Crucial F.A.S.T. Tool", "description": "", "text": "Gerber 30-000315 Crucial F.A.S.T. Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LZpw%2BOM9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSZVB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 39.83}}
{"item_id": "B004DSZYGK", "title": "Gerber 31-000915 High Performance Axe, Extra Large", "description": "The Gerber 31-000915 Extra Large Axe is Gerber’s all-around workhorse. Made for in the truck, at the campsite and around the house, its handle is long enough for splitting wood, but light enough for de-limbing branches and clearing brush. Built to be indestructible, it has a tough nylon handle and stainless steel blade. With a forged steel head that will maintain its edge over time, this 23.6 inch axe features a smooth and virtually indestructible fiber comp handle that feels comfortable and secure in the hand. The Gerber Extra Large Axe is easy to strap to your pack for use while camping, hunting, or hiking. The included sheath protects the head during transport or storage. You can use the Gerber Extra Large Axe as a hatchet or axe, and depending on the project at hand, you can split or cut wood for the fireplace or campfire, make wood chips, cut tree limbs, use it for wood gathering, and more.", "text": "Gerber 31-000915 High Performance Axe, Extra Large The Gerber 31-000915 Extra Large Axe is Gerber’s all-around workhorse. Made for in the truck, at the campsite and around the house, its handle is long enough for splitting wood, but light enough for de-limbing branches and clearing brush. Built to be indestructible, it has a tough nylon handle and stainless steel blade. With a forged steel head that will maintain its edge over time, this 23.6 inch axe features a smooth and virtually indestructible fiber comp handle that feels comfortable and secure in the hand. The Gerber Extra Large Axe is easy to strap to your pack for use while camping, hunting, or hiking. The included sheath protects the head during transport or storage. You can use the Gerber Extra Large Axe as a hatchet or axe, and depending on the project at hand, you can split or cut wood for the fireplace or campfire, make wood chips, cut tree limbs, use it for wood gathering, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21l18C-3KzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DSZYGK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 46.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DT073E", "title": "Gerber 31-000586 Fine Edge Metolius Pocket Folder Knife", "description": "Gerber 31-000586 Metolius Pocket Folder. The Metolius Pocket Folder is a thin, strong every day carry knife designed with hunters in mind. Stainless steel and a Tachide inlay ensure it will perform, whatever the conditions, especially wet. All stainless steel, good balance and strength. Thin and easy to carry. Full fine edge; preferred edge with hunters. Low rise pocket clip, discrete carry.", "text": "Gerber 31-000586 Fine Edge Metolius Pocket Folder Knife Gerber 31-000586 Metolius Pocket Folder. The Metolius Pocket Folder is a thin, strong every day carry knife designed with hunters in mind. Stainless steel and a Tachide inlay ensure it will perform, whatever the conditions, especially wet. All stainless steel, good balance and strength. Thin and easy to carry. Full fine edge; preferred edge with hunters. Low rise pocket clip, discrete carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eInrYCYeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DT073E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 32.2}}
{"item_id": "B004DT09WI", "title": "Gerber Bear Grylls Folding Sheath Knife", "description": "Gerber's Bear Grylls Folding Sheath Knife™ is part of the Gerber / Bear Grylls Survival Series. This collaboration brings together over 70 years of knife and gear expertise with Bear's extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create one of a kind knives, tools and gear. Each item in the Survival Series is meticulously designed by Gerber and Bear to offer a multitude of uses in any environment.The Folding Sheath Knife's partially serrated blade made of high carbon stainless-steel and the ergonomic, textured, rubberized handle with optimum comfort and a non-slip make it a serious knife that can cut through almost anything. It features a dual-sided thumb stud that makes for quick and easy one-handed opening and a lightweight, mildew resistant sheath that can be attached horizontally or vertically. A copy of Bear Grylls Priorities of Survival pocket guide, loaded with survival basics is included.", "text": "Gerber Bear Grylls Folding Sheath Knife Gerber's Bear Grylls Folding Sheath Knife™ is part of the Gerber / Bear Grylls Survival Series. This collaboration brings together over 70 years of knife and gear expertise with Bear's extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create one of a kind knives, tools and gear. Each item in the Survival Series is meticulously designed by Gerber and Bear to offer a multitude of uses in any environment.The Folding Sheath Knife's partially serrated blade made of high carbon stainless-steel and the ergonomic, textured, rubberized handle with optimum comfort and a non-slip make it a serious knife that can cut through almost anything. It features a dual-sided thumb stud that makes for quick and easy one-handed opening and a lightweight, mildew resistant sheath that can be attached horizontally or vertically. A copy of Bear Grylls Priorities of Survival pocket guide, loaded with survival basics is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KFKDadl%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DT09WI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 21.97}}
{"item_id": "B004DT24ZI", "title": "Gerber 31-000591 Freeman Guide Folding Sheath Knife", "description": "Gerber 31-000591 Freeman Guide folding sheath knife. This knife has a lightweight handle and is easy to carry. It has a Tachide on lay, secure grip in all conditions, especially wet. Large finger groves for comfort and security when using. Liner lock, popular mechanism. Full fine edge, preferred edge with hunters. Nylon sheath made with wear resistant material.", "text": "Gerber 31-000591 Freeman Guide Folding Sheath Knife Gerber 31-000591 Freeman Guide folding sheath knife. This knife has a lightweight handle and is easy to carry. It has a Tachide on lay, secure grip in all conditions, especially wet. Large finger groves for comfort and security when using. Liner lock, popular mechanism. Full fine edge, preferred edge with hunters. Nylon sheath made with wear resistant material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bK827sXHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DT24ZI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.3}}
{"item_id": "B004DT26ME", "title": "Gerber 31-000582 DMF Modified Clip Point Partially Serrated Folder Knife", "description": "Gerber 31-000582 DMF folder knife. The manual opening DMF Folder brings the much sought after tactical innovations and technologies of the Automatic DMF to a large, ambidextrous-use knife. Textured G-10 handle gives the DMF Folder a sure grip and maintains a perfect weight balance. Partially serrated tactical blade. Open length of knife 8.4-Inch, blade length 3.5-Inch and closed length 4.8-Inch.", "text": "Gerber 31-000582 DMF Modified Clip Point Partially Serrated Folder Knife Gerber 31-000582 DMF folder knife. The manual opening DMF Folder brings the much sought after tactical innovations and technologies of the Automatic DMF to a large, ambidextrous-use knife. Textured G-10 handle gives the DMF Folder a sure grip and maintains a perfect weight balance. Partially serrated tactical blade. Open length of knife 8.4-Inch, blade length 3.5-Inch and closed length 4.8-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F93AGHe0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DT26ME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 43.54}}
