{"item_id": "B004DT4A50", "title": "Gerber Freeman Guide Fine Edge Knife", "description": "Gerber's Freeman Guide Fine Edge Knife features full tang construction and a TacHide(TM) handle onlay. It makes the Freeman Guide Fixed blade a must have for hunters.Blade Length: 4.0 in..Overall Length: 8.4 in..Weight: 4.4 oz..", "text": "Gerber Freeman Guide Fine Edge Knife Gerber's Freeman Guide Fine Edge Knife features full tang construction and a TacHide(TM) handle onlay. It makes the Freeman Guide Fixed blade a must have for hunters.Blade Length: 4.0 in..Overall Length: 8.4 in..Weight: 4.4 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KTXwVjVOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DT4A50.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.95}}
