{"item_id": "B004DWBKQY", "title": "Lyman Cast Bullet Handbook 4Th Edition", "description": "Comprehensive manual on cast bullets and performance from the world's leading cast bullet authority.", "text": "Lyman Cast Bullet Handbook 4Th Edition Comprehensive manual on cast bullets and performance from the world's leading cast bullet authority.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Uin7mNlOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DWBKQY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B004DWWBRQ", "title": "BT Paintball 14\" APEX 2 Barrel - Tippmann A5 A-5 X7", "description": "Description The APEX2 Barrel System has again redefined how paintball is played. The new stealth look of the APEX2 Barrel will provide you with unmatched distance and accuracy enabling you to hit targets that you thought were unhittable before. The adjustable ramp switch now comes with 9 levels of control to customize your level of curve and spin, from no spin to unbelievable. The APEX2 also allows you to disassemble the barrel without tools for easy maintenance.The APEX2 like the original APEX barrel can still produce long ball distance shots, shots that drop down from the heavens, left and right curve balls, and with its re-designed internal section allow for longer - flatter trajectory shots with the twist of the barrel. Opponents can run but cant hide with the new APEX2 from Empire Battle Tested. Features Adjustable ramp switch for desired level of curve Nine adjustment spin positions to hit your target Durable aluminum construction Toolless disassembly for easy maintenance Left and right hook, drop shot, and long flat trajectory shots with the twist of the barrel", "text": "BT Paintball 14\" APEX 2 Barrel - Tippmann A5 A-5 X7 Description The APEX2 Barrel System has again redefined how paintball is played. The new stealth look of the APEX2 Barrel will provide you with unmatched distance and accuracy enabling you to hit targets that you thought were unhittable before. The adjustable ramp switch now comes with 9 levels of control to customize your level of curve and spin, from no spin to unbelievable. The APEX2 also allows you to disassemble the barrel without tools for easy maintenance.The APEX2 like the original APEX barrel can still produce long ball distance shots, shots that drop down from the heavens, left and right curve balls, and with its re-designed internal section allow for longer - flatter trajectory shots with the twist of the barrel. Opponents can run but cant hide with the new APEX2 from Empire Battle Tested. Features Adjustable ramp switch for desired level of curve Nine adjustment spin positions to hit your target Durable aluminum construction Toolless disassembly for easy maintenance Left and right hook, drop shot, and long flat trajectory shots with the twist of the barrel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JTRxMzBHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DWWBRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BT Paintball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Barrels"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B004DZMD08", "title": "Seychelle 1-10303-28-HI-FC-SEY 28-Inch Flip Top Filter Bottle, Advanced", "description": "The 28oz Seychelle Water Filtration Bottle provides great-tasting, fresh water wherever you are. Ideally suited for situations where the drinking water source is questionable or not disinfected, it comes with an attractive insulator sleeve.", "text": "Seychelle 1-10303-28-HI-FC-SEY 28-Inch Flip Top Filter Bottle, Advanced The 28oz Seychelle Water Filtration Bottle provides great-tasting, fresh water wherever you are. Ideally suited for situations where the drinking water source is questionable or not disinfected, it comes with an attractive insulator sleeve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g4DxM%2BVNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004DZMD08.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Seychelle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 23.5}}
{"item_id": "B004E1SVOI", "title": "Indoor Bicycle Cycling Trainer Exercise Stand", "description": "Train throughout the winter regardless of the weather with this magnetic resistance trainer.Works with 26, 27 or 700c bicycles.FeaturesHeavy duty construction w/ extra wide frame for stabilitySturdy mounting cups reduce slippage (quick release included)Quickly and easily fold for storageSingle adjustment, progressive magnetic resistanceCompatible with 26 in., 27 in. and 700c bikes", "text": "Indoor Bicycle Cycling Trainer Exercise Stand Train throughout the winter regardless of the weather with this magnetic resistance trainer.Works with 26, 27 or 700c bicycles.FeaturesHeavy duty construction w/ extra wide frame for stabilitySturdy mounting cups reduce slippage (quick release included)Quickly and easily fold for storageSingle adjustment, progressive magnetic resistanceCompatible with 26 in., 27 in. and 700c bikes", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410Xs9DcJIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E1SVOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gavin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 71.89}}
{"item_id": "B004E2C20Q", "title": "Condor Roll- Up Pouch", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor Roll- Up Pouch Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rThl1V1tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E2C20Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.58}}
{"item_id": "B004E33Q6Y", "title": "Refill Topical Antiseptics and Ointments for First Aid Kits", "description": "The most commonly used items in anyone’s first aid kit. Use it to refill or add to an existing kit.Supply List:6 After Bite Wipe12 - Antiseptic Wipes6 Triple Antibiotic Ointment, Single Use", "text": "Refill Topical Antiseptics and Ointments for First Aid Kits The most commonly used items in anyone’s first aid kit. Use it to refill or add to an existing kit.Supply List:6 After Bite Wipe12 - Antiseptic Wipes6 Triple Antibiotic Ointment, Single Use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LNVYRCzSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E33Q6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 7.24}}
{"item_id": "B004E35G3A", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Medications, Backpacking Refill", "description": "", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Medications, Backpacking Refill", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SUjkINsBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E35G3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.59}}
{"item_id": "B004E3RE5I", "title": "Hollywood Racks Express 2 Two Bike Trunk Rack (Black)", "description": "The Express 2 carries up to two bicycles and is designed to fit most vehicles.Using the Express 2 bicycle rack from Hollywood Racks, transporting your bikes becomes easier than ever. The rack attaches to the trunk of your car and is designed to carry up to two bicycles. Easy-to-use adjustment hubs and four attachment straps ensure a secure fit, while an integrated tie-down strap offers extra security. Soft rubber cradles help protect the finish of your bikes. The Express 2 is made to fit most vehicles and folds flat for easy storage. This product comes fully pre-assembled and is covered by a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsSpace between bike cradles: 7 inchesDistance between bike support arms: 15 inchesAbout Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when it began making trunk racks in the back of its bike shop in Hollywood, California. As a retailer, it knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. Hollywood Racks earned a great reputation fast and began selling its racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, the people at Hollywood Racks still build racks the only way they know how--simple, strong, and secure, and they are proud to maintain their reputation of having the toughest racks in the business.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials such as high-strength steel and aluminum, aircraft quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of the company's products are fully covered with a limited lifetime warranty.The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off. From its proven Original to its new \"bolt-on\" spare-tire rack and heavy-duty commercial parking systems, Hollywood Racks makes the strongest, safest, and easiest-to-use systems for bringing your bikes along whenever you go.", "text": "Hollywood Racks Express 2 Two Bike Trunk Rack (Black) The Express 2 carries up to two bicycles and is designed to fit most vehicles.Using the Express 2 bicycle rack from Hollywood Racks, transporting your bikes becomes easier than ever. The rack attaches to the trunk of your car and is designed to carry up to two bicycles. Easy-to-use adjustment hubs and four attachment straps ensure a secure fit, while an integrated tie-down strap offers extra security. Soft rubber cradles help protect the finish of your bikes. The Express 2 is made to fit most vehicles and folds flat for easy storage. This product comes fully pre-assembled and is covered by a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsSpace between bike cradles: 7 inchesDistance between bike support arms: 15 inchesAbout Hollywood RacksHollywood Racks started in 1973 when it began making trunk racks in the back of its bike shop in Hollywood, California. As a retailer, it knew exactly what people needed: good quality products that were easy to use. Hollywood Racks earned a great reputation fast and began selling its racks to other dealers, and later to the bike companies. Today, the people at Hollywood Racks still build racks the only way they know how--simple, strong, and secure, and they are proud to maintain their reputation of having the toughest racks in the business.Hollywood Racks are built with top-quality materials such as high-strength steel and aluminum, aircraft quality fasteners, and thick powder coats to withstand the elements. Generous amounts of padding protect bikes and cars, and all of the company's products are fully covered with a limited lifetime warranty.The company's products continue to receive accolades from all the major outdoor sports magazines, and are in demand by everyone from recreational cycling families to weekend warriors to race teams on the road and off. From its proven Original to its new \"bolt-on\" spare-tire rack and heavy-duty commercial parking systems, Hollywood Racks makes the strongest, safest, and easiest-to-use systems for bringing your bikes along whenever you go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5145V%2BRPLfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E3RE5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hollywod Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 59.39}}
{"item_id": "B004E4AVPW", "title": "Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe", "description": "For most campers, not matter how restful their previous night's sleep, the first thing on their mind when they step out of the tent in the morning is, \"Coffee, coffee, coffee.\" When your campsite boasts a Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe, you can enjoy a piping hot cup of joe just like at home, powered by a common propane cylinder. Lightweight and easily packable, it's also ideal for outdoor entertaining, tailgating, picnics, and more.Brewing a full pot takes only 15 minutes, and Coleman's proprietary InstaStart feature ensures match-free lighting, even in windy conditions. The ten-cup covered water reservoir is easily accessible, as is the removable filter basket, and a drip-resistant stainless steel carafe is as durable as it is attractive. Cleanup is especially easy if you're at home, as the carafe and filter are both dishwasher safe.FeaturesPropane-powered; no cords, stove, or percolator requiredOperates on single standard 16.4-ounce propane cylinderInstaStart auto ignition button4,500 BTU for effective heatingWater reservoir cover opens, filter basket removes for easy cleaningPerfectFlow regulator provides consistent performance by producing steady fuel streamRuns for 4.4 hours on one propane cylinderTen-cup total capacity9.5-pound weightThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "text": "Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe For most campers, not matter how restful their previous night's sleep, the first thing on their mind when they step out of the tent in the morning is, \"Coffee, coffee, coffee.\" When your campsite boasts a Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe, you can enjoy a piping hot cup of joe just like at home, powered by a common propane cylinder. Lightweight and easily packable, it's also ideal for outdoor entertaining, tailgating, picnics, and more.Brewing a full pot takes only 15 minutes, and Coleman's proprietary InstaStart feature ensures match-free lighting, even in windy conditions. The ten-cup covered water reservoir is easily accessible, as is the removable filter basket, and a drip-resistant stainless steel carafe is as durable as it is attractive. Cleanup is especially easy if you're at home, as the carafe and filter are both dishwasher safe.FeaturesPropane-powered; no cords, stove, or percolator requiredOperates on single standard 16.4-ounce propane cylinderInstaStart auto ignition button4,500 BTU for effective heatingWater reservoir cover opens, filter basket removes for easy cleaningPerfectFlow regulator provides consistent performance by producing steady fuel streamRuns for 4.4 hours on one propane cylinderTen-cup total capacity9.5-pound weightThe Coleman Limited WarrantyAll Coleman products have a warranty against defects in material and workmanship, and the Portable Propane Coffeemaker with Stainless Steel Carafe includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty.About Coleman Outdoor ProductsMore than 100 years ago, an entrepreneurial young man named W.C. Coleman had an idea for manufacturing better lanterns in Wichita, Kansas. A century later, Coleman's current catalog features a wide-ranging array of products that make spending time outside a pleasure. The company crafts coolers that keep food and drinks cold for days, airbeds that are comfortable and won't deflate during the night, a complete line of bright and long-lasting LED lights, powerful portable grills that cook with an authentic open-grill flame, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TD7a690kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4AVPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 81.99}}
{"item_id": "B004E4AVY8", "title": "Coleman Instant Tent", "description": "", "text": "Coleman Instant Tent", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Kov8nqCeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4AVY8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 134.99}}
{"item_id": "B004E4AW1K", "title": "Coleman Evanston 6 Screened Tent", "description": "This 6-person tent is perfect for the family camping, scout trips, and extended camping trips with a 1-room modified dome structure that's easy to transport and even easier to set up. Great for family camping, scout leaders, and extended camping trips, the Evanston 4 features Coleman's WeatherTec system for weather resistance and is guaranteed to keep you dry.WeatherTec Features:Leak-free seamsIn addition to fully taped rainfly seams, the rainfly covers doors and windows and incorporates easy-to-use velcro frame attachments.Weather-resistant fabricCoated polyester fabric combined with anti-wicking thread, webbing and zippers are designed to keep you dry.Protected SeamsInverted floor seams dramatically increase weather resistance by hiding needle holes inside the tent, away from the elements.Waterproof FloorsWelding technology strengthens the tent floor and eliminates needle holes.Zipper ProtectionZipper cuff adds protection from the elements to the door.Wind Strong FrameEngineered to be a stronger, more wind-responsive frame by using redesigned poles and guy-out triangles to anchor tents and increase performance.Tent Features:Sleeps 6; 1 roomExclusive WeatherTec SystemGuaranteed to keep you dryFully screened front porch areaModified dome structure, easy to transport and simple to set upGreat for family car camping, scout leaders, extended camping tripsControl airflow with Variflo adjustable ventilationInterior gear pocketElectrical access portFront porch and wings provide great outdoor living spaceEasy set up with continuous, color-coded pole sleeves and Insta-Clip attachmentsPin-and-Ring design with continuous pole sleevesEasy instructions sewn into durable carry bagCarry bag also includes separate sacks for poles and stakesSpecifications:Capacity: 6Rooms: 1Doors: 1Fly: Polyester taffeta 75DFootprint: 14 by 10 feetCenter Height: 68 inchesMesh: Polyester 68D inner tentFloor: Polyethylene 1000D-140g/sqm floorPoles: 11mm fiberglassWarranty: Limited 1 yearAbout ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "text": "Coleman Evanston 6 Screened Tent This 6-person tent is perfect for the family camping, scout trips, and extended camping trips with a 1-room modified dome structure that's easy to transport and even easier to set up. Great for family camping, scout leaders, and extended camping trips, the Evanston 4 features Coleman's WeatherTec system for weather resistance and is guaranteed to keep you dry.WeatherTec Features:Leak-free seamsIn addition to fully taped rainfly seams, the rainfly covers doors and windows and incorporates easy-to-use velcro frame attachments.Weather-resistant fabricCoated polyester fabric combined with anti-wicking thread, webbing and zippers are designed to keep you dry.Protected SeamsInverted floor seams dramatically increase weather resistance by hiding needle holes inside the tent, away from the elements.Waterproof FloorsWelding technology strengthens the tent floor and eliminates needle holes.Zipper ProtectionZipper cuff adds protection from the elements to the door.Wind Strong FrameEngineered to be a stronger, more wind-responsive frame by using redesigned poles and guy-out triangles to anchor tents and increase performance.Tent Features:Sleeps 6; 1 roomExclusive WeatherTec SystemGuaranteed to keep you dryFully screened front porch areaModified dome structure, easy to transport and simple to set upGreat for family car camping, scout leaders, extended camping tripsControl airflow with Variflo adjustable ventilationInterior gear pocketElectrical access portFront porch and wings provide great outdoor living spaceEasy set up with continuous, color-coded pole sleeves and Insta-Clip attachmentsPin-and-Ring design with continuous pole sleevesEasy instructions sewn into durable carry bagCarry bag also includes separate sacks for poles and stakesSpecifications:Capacity: 6Rooms: 1Doors: 1Fly: Polyester taffeta 75DFootprint: 14 by 10 feetCenter Height: 68 inchesMesh: Polyester 68D inner tentFloor: Polyethylene 1000D-140g/sqm floorPoles: 11mm fiberglassWarranty: Limited 1 yearAbout ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zIFun6x0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4AW1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 119.99}}
{"item_id": "B004E4CZE2", "title": "Wheeler Trigger Pull Scale", "description": "The Trigger Pull Scale accurately measures trigger pull weight from 8 ounces to 8 pounds. It features an ergonomically shaped handle for consistent direction of pull. Highly visible increment markings and an easy-to-read sliding indicator that stays on the maximum weight registered, make it easy to use. It measures in 2 oz. increments and is accurate to +/- 2 oz. The Trigger Pull Scale is an excellent tool for use when adjusting triggers to ensure accuracy and maintain safe performance.", "text": "Wheeler Trigger Pull Scale The Trigger Pull Scale accurately measures trigger pull weight from 8 ounces to 8 pounds. It features an ergonomically shaped handle for consistent direction of pull. Highly visible increment markings and an easy-to-read sliding indicator that stays on the maximum weight registered, make it easy to use. It measures in 2 oz. increments and is accurate to +/- 2 oz. The Trigger Pull Scale is an excellent tool for use when adjusting triggers to ensure accuracy and maintain safe performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317y7QbLZTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4CZE2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 17.56}}
{"item_id": "B004E4ERHA", "title": "Coleman Instant Tent 6 Person", "description": "The Coleman Instant Tent 6 sets up quickly so you and your family can focus on day hikes, games, and what's for dinner. The polyethylene floor and polyester walls with fully taped seams keep water out (no rainfly needed), and steel poles ensure long-lasting support and durability. The zippered D door opens wide, and five mesh windows give this tent plenty of ventilation in summer.", "text": "Coleman Instant Tent 6 Person The Coleman Instant Tent 6 sets up quickly so you and your family can focus on day hikes, games, and what's for dinner. The polyethylene floor and polyester walls with fully taped seams keep water out (no rainfly needed), and steel poles ensure long-lasting support and durability. The zippered D door opens wide, and five mesh windows give this tent plenty of ventilation in summer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nrOjJEC6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4ERHA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 164.99}}
{"item_id": "B004E4ERIY", "title": "Coleman Evanston 8 Screened Tent", "description": "About ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "text": "Coleman Evanston 8 Screened Tent About ColemanThe Coleman Company has been creating and innovating products for recreational outdoor use since W.C. Coleman started selling gasoline-powered lanterns in 1900. Inventor of the hugely popular fold-up camp stove, Coleman developed a plastic liner for his galvanized steel coolers in 1957--the birth of the modern cooler--and the company has been improving their utility and design ever since. The array of products that bear the Coleman name now includes just about everything you might need to work or play outdoors, from tents and sleeping bags to boats, backpacks, and furniture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dxdE7SNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4ERIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 164.5}}
{"item_id": "B004E4GB1U", "title": "Coleman CPX 4.5 LED Tent Light", "description": "The CPX™ 4.5 LED Tent Light by Coleman is compatible with any tent and even attaches to the tent wall allowing you to pivot the light where you need it. The CPX™ system lets you choose your power: three AAA cell batteries (included) or one CPX™ 4.5 rechargeable power cartridge (sold separately - Campmor item #84089). The battery meter changes from yellow to red as battery life is depleted.Magnetically attaches to any tent or metal surface.No tools required.Water resistant.Lifetime of light - LEDs don't need to be replaced.LED battery meter, changes color when battery power is low.Three light modes, white light on high or low and a low power amber nightlight.Size: W 2.75\", H 5\".Weight: 0.59 oz..", "text": "Coleman CPX 4.5 LED Tent Light The CPX™ 4.5 LED Tent Light by Coleman is compatible with any tent and even attaches to the tent wall allowing you to pivot the light where you need it. The CPX™ system lets you choose your power: three AAA cell batteries (included) or one CPX™ 4.5 rechargeable power cartridge (sold separately - Campmor item #84089). The battery meter changes from yellow to red as battery life is depleted.Magnetically attaches to any tent or metal surface.No tools required.Water resistant.Lifetime of light - LEDs don't need to be replaced.LED battery meter, changes color when battery power is low.Three light modes, white light on high or low and a low power amber nightlight.Size: W 2.75\", H 5\".Weight: 0.59 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ivMt1j2AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4GB1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 23.11}}
{"item_id": "B004E4GBFG", "title": "Coleman 4D CPX Quickpump", "description": "The Coleman 4D CPX Quickpump runs on 4 D batteries or can be upgraded to use the Coleman CPX rechargeable battery pack (sold separately). It's fast and powerful, so your inflatable product will be ready for use quickly. This universal pump comes with adapters for Boston valves, pinch valves, and all Coleman Double-Lock valves.", "text": "Coleman 4D CPX Quickpump The Coleman 4D CPX Quickpump runs on 4 D batteries or can be upgraded to use the Coleman CPX rechargeable battery pack (sold separately). It's fast and powerful, so your inflatable product will be ready for use quickly. This universal pump comes with adapters for Boston valves, pinch valves, and all Coleman Double-Lock valves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jTj7Ey5cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4GBFG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 30.99}}
{"item_id": "B004E4IAEG", "title": "Coleman Accessory Coffeemaker Carry Case", "description": "Bring your Coleman Propane Coffeemaker with you safely and securely -- the Accessory Coffeemaker Carry Case is a durable carry bag that protects the coffeemaker in transit and in storage. The case features a heavy-duty zippered closure and a convenient carry handle, plus a storage pouch for your propane cylinder.", "text": "Coleman Accessory Coffeemaker Carry Case Bring your Coleman Propane Coffeemaker with you safely and securely -- the Accessory Coffeemaker Carry Case is a durable carry bag that protects the coffeemaker in transit and in storage. The case features a heavy-duty zippered closure and a convenient carry handle, plus a storage pouch for your propane cylinder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qmmmf9drL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4IAEG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 21.9}}
{"item_id": "B004E4IAEQ", "title": "Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker", "description": "The Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker delivers the best and easiest cup of coffee while camping, tailgating, BBQing, and beyond. Propane power makes it extra-convenient: no stove, cords or percolator required! It's quick (brew time is just 15 minutes) and easy, with Coleman's InstaStart matchless lighting; easy-access 10-cup covered water reservoir; removable filter basket; durable, drip-resistant carafe; and easy-access regulator connection with storage clips for when not in use. Cleanup is a breeze, too: the filter basket and carafe are both dishwasher-safe. The Coffeemaker is built to be easily portable and packable, so it's convenient to bring along.", "text": "Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker The Coleman Portable Propane Coffeemaker delivers the best and easiest cup of coffee while camping, tailgating, BBQing, and beyond. Propane power makes it extra-convenient: no stove, cords or percolator required! It's quick (brew time is just 15 minutes) and easy, with Coleman's InstaStart matchless lighting; easy-access 10-cup covered water reservoir; removable filter basket; durable, drip-resistant carafe; and easy-access regulator connection with storage clips for when not in use. Cleanup is a breeze, too: the filter basket and carafe are both dishwasher-safe. The Coffeemaker is built to be easily portable and packable, so it's convenient to bring along.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FsvL1S0YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4IAEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coffee & Tea Pots"]], "price": 85.72}}
{"item_id": "B004E4IAPU", "title": "Coleman 14x8 Foot 8 Person Instant Tent", "description": "", "text": "Coleman 14x8 Foot 8 Person Instant Tent", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wtZc6vmpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E4IAPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 190.0}}
{"item_id": "B004E8CJZS", "title": "ProActive Sports Groove Dr. Retractable", "description": "The Groove Dr. Retractable brush and groove tool from ProActive Sports allows you to maintain the grooves on your clubfaces for the control and precision they were intended for. Constructed with advanced metal matrix alloy construction, the tool will not damage the clubface, yet will allow you to clean out the grooves with surgical precision. This model features a convenient retractable cord that allows you to attach the tool to your golf bag for quick and easy use. This is a great tool for cleaning your cleats out as well.", "text": "ProActive Sports Groove Dr. Retractable The Groove Dr. Retractable brush and groove tool from ProActive Sports allows you to maintain the grooves on your clubfaces for the control and precision they were intended for. Constructed with advanced metal matrix alloy construction, the tool will not damage the clubface, yet will allow you to clean out the grooves with surgical precision. This model features a convenient retractable cord that allows you to attach the tool to your golf bag for quick and easy use. This is a great tool for cleaning your cleats out as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LA1PIZrtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004E8CJZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bag Accessories"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B004EAXJ1Y", "title": "Cressi Palau Short Snorkeling Swim Fins with Mesh Bag (Made In Italy)", "description": "The Cressi Palau Short Fins are specifically designed for swimming and snorkeling. These finds accommodate a wide variety of foot sizes and with a short fin, they are ideal for traveling. Wear them during all surf activities, canoeing, rafting and much more!", "text": "Cressi Palau Short Snorkeling Swim Fins with Mesh Bag (Made In Italy) The Cressi Palau Short Fins are specifically designed for swimming and snorkeling. These finds accommodate a wide variety of foot sizes and with a short fin, they are ideal for traveling. Wear them during all surf activities, canoeing, rafting and much more!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mMNn0F98L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EAXJ1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EBJLXS", "title": "High Sierra Tech Series 59404 Titan 55 Internal Frame Pack", "description": "The Titan 55 from High Sierra's Tech Series is a roomy yet streamlined 55-liter capacity pack with an internal frame built for superior load support and breathability. The Titan 55 carries heavy burdens with relative ease thanks to it S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters that adjust to fit a trimmer torso. The pack's high-density foam padded back panel provides optimum load support while the large AirFlow channels and uniquely contoured internal frame structure helps keep your back cool and dry.At home in the backcountry and travel friendly, the pack boasts a generous 55-liter, top-load main compartment with a gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lid as well as a front load sleeping bag compartment with divider. A hinged front pocket with mesh side gussets can hold ropes or other gear and an internal hydration reservoir sleeve with dual exit ports for the tube keep the water flowing. In addition the pack is equipped with soft lashing hardware that holds an ice ax/hiking poles, dual mesh pockets that hold 1000-milliliter water bottles, convenient zippered pockets on the padded waist belt ideal for quick-reach items, a removable media pocket attached to the backpack strap, and a convenient webbing daisy chain on the front. Padded grab handles adorn both sides of the pack and adjustable side and bottom compression straps and an adjustable sternum strap stabilizes the load. Finally, the pack's tuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocket keeps your gear dry when the sky opens up and also protects the pack when checked for air travel. Backed by a lifetime warranty against manufacturers defects.Features:55-liter, top-load main compartment with gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lidInternal hydration reservoir sleeve and dual exit ports for the tube (reservoir not included)Hinged front pocket, with mesh side gussetsRemovable media pocket attached to the backpack strapLightweight nylon fabric sports convenient webbing daisy chain on the frontPadded grab handles on both sidesAdjustable side and bottom compression strapsSoft lashing hardware holds ice ax/hiking polesDual mesh pockets hold 1000-milliliter water bottlesConvenient zippered pockets on padded waist beltTuck-away rain cover stored in a bottom pocketSuspension:S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters adjust to fit trimmer torsoHigh-density foam padded back panel, with large Airflow channelsUniquely contoured internal frame structureAdjustable sternum strap stabilizes packSpecifications:Dimensions: 29.5 x 14 x 8.25 inches (74.9 x 35.6 x 21 centimeters)Capacity: 55 liters/3356 cubic inchesAbout High Sierra Sport Company:For over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).", "text": "High Sierra Tech Series 59404 Titan 55 Internal Frame Pack The Titan 55 from High Sierra's Tech Series is a roomy yet streamlined 55-liter capacity pack with an internal frame built for superior load support and breathability. The Titan 55 carries heavy burdens with relative ease thanks to it S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters that adjust to fit a trimmer torso. The pack's high-density foam padded back panel provides optimum load support while the large AirFlow channels and uniquely contoured internal frame structure helps keep your back cool and dry.At home in the backcountry and travel friendly, the pack boasts a generous 55-liter, top-load main compartment with a gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lid as well as a front load sleeping bag compartment with divider. A hinged front pocket with mesh side gussets can hold ropes or other gear and an internal hydration reservoir sleeve with dual exit ports for the tube keep the water flowing. In addition the pack is equipped with soft lashing hardware that holds an ice ax/hiking poles, dual mesh pockets that hold 1000-milliliter water bottles, convenient zippered pockets on the padded waist belt ideal for quick-reach items, a removable media pocket attached to the backpack strap, and a convenient webbing daisy chain on the front. Padded grab handles adorn both sides of the pack and adjustable side and bottom compression straps and an adjustable sternum strap stabilizes the load. Finally, the pack's tuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocket keeps your gear dry when the sky opens up and also protects the pack when checked for air travel. Backed by a lifetime warranty against manufacturers defects.Features:55-liter, top-load main compartment with gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lidInternal hydration reservoir sleeve and dual exit ports for the tube (reservoir not included)Hinged front pocket, with mesh side gussetsRemovable media pocket attached to the backpack strapLightweight nylon fabric sports convenient webbing daisy chain on the frontPadded grab handles on both sidesAdjustable side and bottom compression strapsSoft lashing hardware holds ice ax/hiking polesDual mesh pockets hold 1000-milliliter water bottlesConvenient zippered pockets on padded waist beltTuck-away rain cover stored in a bottom pocketSuspension:S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters adjust to fit trimmer torsoHigh-density foam padded back panel, with large Airflow channelsUniquely contoured internal frame structureAdjustable sternum strap stabilizes packSpecifications:Dimensions: 29.5 x 14 x 8.25 inches (74.9 x 35.6 x 21 centimeters)Capacity: 55 liters/3356 cubic inchesAbout High Sierra Sport Company:For over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VhO0OslOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EBJLXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "High Sierra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 129.55}}
{"item_id": "B004EBLBA4", "title": "High Sierra Tech Series 59405 Titan 65 Internal Frame Pack", "description": "The Titan 65 from High Sierra's Tech Series is a large-capacity yet streamlined 65-liter pack with an internal frame built for superior load support and breathability. The Titan 65 carries heavy burdens with relative ease thanks to it S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters that adjust to fit regular torso sizes. The pack's high-density foam padded back panel provides optimum load support while the large AirFlow channels and uniquely contoured internal frame structure helps keep your back cool and dry.At home in the backcountry and travel friendly, the pack boasts a generous 65-liter, top-load main compartment with a gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lid as well as a front load sleeping bag compartment with divider. A hinged front pocket with mesh side gussets can hold ropes or other gear and an internal hydration reservoir sleeve with dual exit ports for the tube keep the water flowing. In addition the pack is equipped with soft lashing hardware that holds an ice ax/hiking poles, dual mesh pockets that hold 1000-milliliter water bottles, convenient zippered pockets on the padded waist belt ideal for quick-reach items, a removable media pocket attached to the backpack strap, and a convenient webbing daisy chain on the front. Padded grab handles adorn both sides of the pack and adjustable side and bottom compression straps and an adjustable sternum strap stabilizes the load. Finally, the pack's tuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocket keeps your gear dry when the sky opens up and also protects the pack when checked for air travel. Backed by a lifetime warranty against manufacturers defects.Features:65-liter, top-load main compartment with gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lidInternal hydration reservoir sleeve and dual exit ports for the tube (reservoir not included)Hinged front pocket, with mesh side gussetsRemovable media pocket attached to the backpack strapLightweight nylon fabric sports convenient webbing daisy chain on the frontPadded grab handles on both sidesAdjustable side and bottom compression strapsSoft lashing hardware holds ice ax/hiking polesDual mesh pockets hold 1000-milliliter water bottlesConvenient zippered pockets on padded waist beltTuck-away rain cover stored in a bottom pocketSuspension:S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters adjust to fit trimmer torsoHigh-density foam padded back panel, with large Airflow channelsUniquely contoured internal frame structureAdjustable sternum strap stabilizes packSpecifications:Dimensions: 32 x 14.25 x 8.75 inches (81.3 x 36.2 x 22 centimeters)Capacity: 65 liters/3966 cubic inchesAbout High Sierra Sport Company:For over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).", "text": "High Sierra Tech Series 59405 Titan 65 Internal Frame Pack The Titan 65 from High Sierra's Tech Series is a large-capacity yet streamlined 65-liter pack with an internal frame built for superior load support and breathability. The Titan 65 carries heavy burdens with relative ease thanks to it S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters that adjust to fit regular torso sizes. The pack's high-density foam padded back panel provides optimum load support while the large AirFlow channels and uniquely contoured internal frame structure helps keep your back cool and dry.At home in the backcountry and travel friendly, the pack boasts a generous 65-liter, top-load main compartment with a gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lid as well as a front load sleeping bag compartment with divider. A hinged front pocket with mesh side gussets can hold ropes or other gear and an internal hydration reservoir sleeve with dual exit ports for the tube keep the water flowing. In addition the pack is equipped with soft lashing hardware that holds an ice ax/hiking poles, dual mesh pockets that hold 1000-milliliter water bottles, convenient zippered pockets on the padded waist belt ideal for quick-reach items, a removable media pocket attached to the backpack strap, and a convenient webbing daisy chain on the front. Padded grab handles adorn both sides of the pack and adjustable side and bottom compression straps and an adjustable sternum strap stabilizes the load. Finally, the pack's tuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocket keeps your gear dry when the sky opens up and also protects the pack when checked for air travel. Backed by a lifetime warranty against manufacturers defects.Features:65-liter, top-load main compartment with gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lidInternal hydration reservoir sleeve and dual exit ports for the tube (reservoir not included)Hinged front pocket, with mesh side gussetsRemovable media pocket attached to the backpack strapLightweight nylon fabric sports convenient webbing daisy chain on the frontPadded grab handles on both sidesAdjustable side and bottom compression strapsSoft lashing hardware holds ice ax/hiking polesDual mesh pockets hold 1000-milliliter water bottlesConvenient zippered pockets on padded waist beltTuck-away rain cover stored in a bottom pocketSuspension:S-shaped Ergo-Fit shoulder strap harness with load-lifters adjust to fit trimmer torsoHigh-density foam padded back panel, with large Airflow channelsUniquely contoured internal frame structureAdjustable sternum strap stabilizes packSpecifications:Dimensions: 32 x 14.25 x 8.75 inches (81.3 x 36.2 x 22 centimeters)Capacity: 65 liters/3966 cubic inchesAbout High Sierra Sport Company:For over 25 years, High Sierra Sport Company has strived to provide the bags you need at a price you can afford. Specializing in adventure travel, High Sierra's dedication to function, design, and quality shines in each product. From athletes and outdoor enthusiasts, to students, travelers, and professionals, High Sierra's versatile, innovative products are sure to fit your needs. High Sierra Sport Company is the official supplier of bags to the U.S. Ski and Snowboarding teams, and its memberships include the Outdoor Industry Association and Sporting Goods Manufacturers Association (SGMA).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NV57tAhHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EBLBA4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "High Sierra", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B004EBLC76", "title": "High Sierra Classic Series 59101 Col 35 Internal Frame Pack", "description": "Leave civilization behind with the featherweight Col 35 internal frame pack from High Sierra. Weighing in at just three pounds and sporting a top-loading, 35-liter main compartment, you can pack in plenty, and carry the load with comfort thanks to advanced internal suspension. The Col 35 is loaded with 21st century features including a hydration-ready design, lashing hardware for ice axes and hiking poles, multiple compression straps to secure your gear, and a strap-mounted media pocket. Adjustable backpack straps with load-lifters, waist belt, and molded back panel boast moisture wicking Vapel mesh and Airflow padding. The single, contoured aluminum frame bar adjusts to fit the shape of your back and finally a tuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocket, also protects the pack when checked in for air travel.Pack Features:35-liter, top-load main compartment with gusseted drawstring closure and adjustable top lidInternal hydration reservoir sleeve and dual exit ports for the tube (reservoir not included)Removable media pocket is attached backpack strapDual mesh side pockets hold 1000-milliliter water bottles?Webbing daisy chain to attach extra gearSoft lashing hardware holds ice ax/hiking polesTuck-away rain cover, stored in a bottom pocketAdjustable compression straps on each sideAdjustable bottom compression strapsThe Col 35 offers exceptional ergonomic comfort with Vapel Airmesh padded backpack straps and waist strap and a molded foam back panel with Airmesh channels.Internal Frame Suspension:Backpack straps constructed with Vapel mesh Airflow padding with adjustable load-liftersSingle, contoured aluminum frame bar can be adjusted to fit the shape of your backMolded foam back panel with Airflow channels to keep your back cool and dryAdjustable waist belt, with Vapel mesh Airflow padding, wicks moistureAdjustable sternum strap stabilizes packSpecifi