{"item_id": "B004EFYPBC", "title": "Sunny Threaded Solid Chrome Barbell Bar (60-Inch)", "description": "Have effective workouts with this 60-inch barbell bar. This threaded bar is made of solid steel. Chrome finish, fit 1 inch hole standard plate, thread ends with star-lock collars. This bar is 60 inches long, and weighs 16 pounds.", "text": "Sunny Threaded Solid Chrome Barbell Bar (60-Inch) Have effective workouts with this 60-inch barbell bar. This threaded bar is made of solid steel. Chrome finish, fit 1 inch hole standard plate, thread ends with star-lock collars. This bar is 60 inches long, and weighs 16 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21pCjHKBkgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EFYPBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 29.6}}
