{"item_id": "B004ELBPUU", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men' Select Gel Glove", "description": "Ideal for riders who put in a lot of saddle time, the Pearl Izumi Select gel glove has been updated with Comfort Bridge Gel padding. The palm is constructed of soft, durable Clarino synthetic leather, and its anatomic palm patterning provides optimal comfort and ventilation. The Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent padding relieves pressure on the ulnar and median nerves for riding comfort plus superior ventilation and durability. Additionally, the In-R-Cool mesh palm lining provides optimal skin-cooling effect and moisture management when you perspire. Other features include a soft, low-profile wiping surface on thumb, easy-off glove removal tab, hook-and-loop closure, and Direct-Vent mesh that ventilates while providing UPF 40+ sun protection. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men' Select Gel Glove Ideal for riders who put in a lot of saddle time, the Pearl Izumi Select gel glove has been updated with Comfort Bridge Gel padding. The palm is constructed of soft, durable Clarino synthetic leather, and its anatomic palm patterning provides optimal comfort and ventilation. The Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent padding relieves pressure on the ulnar and median nerves for riding comfort plus superior ventilation and durability. Additionally, the In-R-Cool mesh palm lining provides optimal skin-cooling effect and moisture management when you perspire. Other features include a soft, low-profile wiping surface on thumb, easy-off glove removal tab, hook-and-loop closure, and Direct-Vent mesh that ventilates while providing UPF 40+ sun protection. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I%2BqK6OEmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBPUU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBQ7C", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Tri Shorts", "description": "", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Tri Shorts", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rU0lyyn1L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBQ7C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
