{"item_id": "B004ELBQLI", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Tri Short Long", "description": "", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Tri Short Long", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412p7XHj3%2BL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBQLI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBQUO", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Liner Short", "description": "Give your regular shorts a kick of biking comfort with this men's liner short from Pearl Izumi, which can be worn under any short or tight for enhanced riding comfort. It includes a removable Elite 3D chamois, which is pre-shaped to provide the highest level of riding comfort. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue. And the Transfer fabric provides superior moisture transfer. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Liner Short Give your regular shorts a kick of biking comfort with this men's liner short from Pearl Izumi, which can be worn under any short or tight for enhanced riding comfort. It includes a removable Elite 3D chamois, which is pre-shaped to provide the highest level of riding comfort. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue. And the Transfer fabric provides superior moisture transfer. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HZZzpn6dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBQUO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBQWC", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Gel Glove,Black,Medium", "description": "Tackle the longest, roughest roads without fear when you're wearing the Pearl Izumi Women?s Select Gel Gloves to cushion your palms and give you a secure grip on the bars. The gloves' Comfort Bridge gel padding relieves pressure on your ulnar and median nerves so you can take whatever the road dishes out without discomfort or numbness. The In-R-Cool mesh lining keeps your palms cool and dry when you're getting sweaty, and the Direct-Vent mesh back ventilates while providing UPF 40 protection for your hands. Pearl Izumi also included a soft, low-profile wiping surface on the thumbs to dab stray sweat away.Product FeaturesMaterial: [palm] 60% nylon, 40% polyurethane; [back] 30% nylon, 70% polyesterClosure: hook-and-loopPadding: gelRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Select Gel Glove,Black,Medium Tackle the longest, roughest roads without fear when you're wearing the Pearl Izumi Women?s Select Gel Gloves to cushion your palms and give you a secure grip on the bars. The gloves' Comfort Bridge gel padding relieves pressure on your ulnar and median nerves so you can take whatever the road dishes out without discomfort or numbness. The In-R-Cool mesh lining keeps your palms cool and dry when you're getting sweaty, and the Direct-Vent mesh back ventilates while providing UPF 40 protection for your hands. Pearl Izumi also included a soft, low-profile wiping surface on the thumbs to dab stray sweat away.Product FeaturesMaterial: [palm] 60% nylon, 40% polyurethane; [back] 30% nylon, 70% polyesterClosure: hook-and-loopPadding: gelRecommended Use: cyclingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ElM6wb47L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBQWC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBSIE", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Liner Short", "description": "The padded Women’s Liner Short can be worn under any short for enhanced riding comfort thanks to the Women’s MTB 3D Chamois®.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Liner Short The padded Women’s Liner Short can be worn under any short for enhanced riding comfort thanks to the Women’s MTB 3D Chamois®.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JBbeXomhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBSIE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 35.99}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBSPW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Tour Jersey", "description": "The men's Quest Tour Jersey from Pearl Izumi offers a relaxed fit with Select Transfer fabric to wick away moisture and provide cool, dry comfort as you ride. This versatile jersey is great option for any application that doesn't require a form fit, but that does call for high-performance fabrics. The jersey features a 10-inch zipper for venting, three back pockets, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. The shirt has an elasticized gripper on the back to keep the hem in place and provides UPF 40 sun protection. Built to last, the Quest Tour Jersey carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Features:Loose fitSelect Transfer fabric10-inch zipper for venting (size medium)Elasticized gripperThree back pocketsReflective elementsUPF 40 sun protectionSize Guide", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Tour Jersey The men's Quest Tour Jersey from Pearl Izumi offers a relaxed fit with Select Transfer fabric to wick away moisture and provide cool, dry comfort as you ride. This versatile jersey is great option for any application that doesn't require a form fit, but that does call for high-performance fabrics. The jersey features a 10-inch zipper for venting, three back pockets, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. The shirt has an elasticized gripper on the back to keep the hem in place and provides UPF 40 sun protection. Built to last, the Quest Tour Jersey carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Features:Loose fitSelect Transfer fabric10-inch zipper for venting (size medium)Elasticized gripperThree back pocketsReflective elementsUPF 40 sun protectionSize Guide", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wTWOlitqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBSPW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBT5G", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men' Select Gel FF Glove", "description": "Featuring our updated Comfort Bridge Gel Padding and anatomic palm patterning, our Select Gel FF is a must-have for warm days that require full finger protection.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men' Select Gel FF Glove Featuring our updated Comfort Bridge Gel Padding and anatomic palm patterning, our Select Gel FF is a must-have for warm days that require full finger protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412%2BLDbJr3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBT5G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBTD8", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Attack Jersey", "description": "Semi-form fitting, Pearl Izumi's Attack bike jersey offers a less restrictive cut for high performance. Packed with features such as a full zipper and three rear pockets, this style gives you everything you need for the ride without breaking the bank. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a full-length zipper for venting, elasticized gripper on back to keep hem in place, three back pockets, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Attack Jersey Semi-form fitting, Pearl Izumi's Attack bike jersey offers a less restrictive cut for high performance. Packed with features such as a full zipper and three rear pockets, this style gives you everything you need for the ride without breaking the bank. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a full-length zipper for venting, elasticized gripper on back to keep hem in place, three back pockets, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XhUqyRi6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBTD8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ELBVN6", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Sugar Short", "description": "An ideal companion for indoor cycling class, the Women’s Sugar Short features a 5 ½” inseam and the supremely comfortable Women’s Tour 3D Chamois®.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Sugar Short An ideal companion for indoor cycling class, the Women’s Sugar Short features a 5 ½” inseam and the supremely comfortable Women’s Tour 3D Chamois®.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IB4LK2G2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ELBVN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EMOW86", "title": "Shotgun Bandoleer 56 rounds", "description": "Carry 56 shotgun shells in an over the shoulder bandoleer. made of heavy duty bullistic nylon 2.25 inch military pistol belt webbing and 1.5 inch wide heavy duty elastic to hold the shells secure. Color: Balck Hold: 56 rounds, Material: Bullistic Nylon", "text": "Shotgun Bandoleer 56 rounds Carry 56 shotgun shells in an over the shoulder bandoleer. made of heavy duty bullistic nylon 2.25 inch military pistol belt webbing and 1.5 inch wide heavy duty elastic to hold the shells secure. Color: Balck Hold: 56 rounds, Material: Bullistic Nylon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41M4ofLyMTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EMOW86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B004ENIDV2", "title": "Mora of Sweden Clipper 840 Carbon Steel Knife", "description": "The Clipper 840 now has a 75% longer tang than older models and a polished carbon steel blade. The ergonomically designed handle retains the classic Clipper patterned high-friction grip. Includes plastic sheath.", "text": "Mora of Sweden Clipper 840 Carbon Steel Knife The Clipper 840 now has a 75% longer tang than older models and a polished carbon steel blade. The ergonomically designed handle retains the classic Clipper patterned high-friction grip. Includes plastic sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3149mV5s5NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ENIDV2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B004EPX6FS", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Short", "description": "The Elite In-R-Cool short for men takes the classic biking short to a new level in tech performance, technology and value. The Elite Transfer stretch fabric quickly transfers moisture on the skin to the outer surface of the short for fast evaporation. And the unique embedded In-R-Cool technology is activated by perspiration and cools body surface temperature by 5 percent. The removable Elite 3D chamois is pre-shaped to provide the highest level of riding comfort. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue. Ultra-durable with flatlock and double needle seams, other features include an anatomic multi-panel design, silicone leg gripper with welded construction, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Short The Elite In-R-Cool short for men takes the classic biking short to a new level in tech performance, technology and value. The Elite Transfer stretch fabric quickly transfers moisture on the skin to the outer surface of the short for fast evaporation. And the unique embedded In-R-Cool technology is activated by perspiration and cools body surface temperature by 5 percent. The removable Elite 3D chamois is pre-shaped to provide the highest level of riding comfort. Its breathable four-way stretch technology adjusts to the body and moves moisture away, and active carbon yarns improve thermoregulation and helps eliminate static-induced fatigue. Ultra-durable with flatlock and double needle seams, other features include an anatomic multi-panel design, silicone leg gripper with welded construction, and reflective elements for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AHIwlplUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPX6FS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPX7GG", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Gel Vent Glove", "description": "One of Pearl Izumi's most popular gloves, the Elite Gel-Vent features updated Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent technology for the ultimate in comfort, durability and ventilation. The Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent padding relieves pressure on the ulnar and median nerves for riding comfort plus superior ventilation and durability. The palm is constructed of soft, durable Clarino synthetic leather, and its updated anatomic palm patterning provides optimal comfort and ventilation. Additionally, the In-R-Cool mesh palm lining gives a skin-cooling effect and excellent moisture management when you perspire. Other features include a soft, low-profile wiping surface on thumb that's perforated for maximum ventilation, easy-off glove removal tab, and hook-and-loop closure.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Gel Vent Glove One of Pearl Izumi's most popular gloves, the Elite Gel-Vent features updated Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent technology for the ultimate in comfort, durability and ventilation. The Comfort Bridge Gel-Vent padding relieves pressure on the ulnar and median nerves for riding comfort plus superior ventilation and durability. The palm is constructed of soft, durable Clarino synthetic leather, and its updated anatomic palm patterning provides optimal comfort and ventilation. Additionally, the In-R-Cool mesh palm lining gives a skin-cooling effect and excellent moisture management when you perspire. Other features include a soft, low-profile wiping surface on thumb that's perforated for maximum ventilation, easy-off glove removal tab, and hook-and-loop closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Fa6T8IwSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPX7GG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 38.99}}
{"item_id": "B004EPX7ZW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Bib Short", "description": "Our top selling ELITElite Bib has been further enchanced withOriginally introduced on our P.R.O. Series, In-R-Cool® technology, technology has been trickled down to the Elite Bib Short, taking this classic style to a new level in technology, performance and value.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Inrcool Bib Short Our top selling ELITElite Bib has been further enchanced withOriginally introduced on our P.R.O. Series, In-R-Cool® technology, technology has been trickled down to the Elite Bib Short, taking this classic style to a new level in technology, performance and value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PMUuDkjtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPX7ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPX9FA", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Sleeveless Jersey", "description": "The Pearl Izumi Quest three-pocket sleeveless jersey offers a comfortable semi-form fit, making it a cool, comfortable jersey for warm conditions. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a 15-inch zipper for venting, elasticized hem, and reflective piping for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Quest Sleeveless Jersey The Pearl Izumi Quest three-pocket sleeveless jersey offers a comfortable semi-form fit, making it a cool, comfortable jersey for warm conditions. Constructed of Pearl Izumi's 100 percent polyester Select Transfer fabric, this quick-drying jersey pulls moisture away from the skin and provides lasting comfort even at the highest exertion levels. The fine knit quality also translates to more freedom of movement and improved longevity. Other features include a 15-inch zipper for venting, elasticized hem, and reflective piping for low-light visibility. Machine washable (no fabric softeners).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ooEfOa4VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPX9FA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPXA0E", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Tri Sleeveless Jersey", "description": "The semi-form fit SELECT Tri SL Jersey is the perfect piece to put on after the swim for the bike and run. It’s great for those looking for more coverage with a less compressed fit.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Tri Sleeveless Jersey The semi-form fit SELECT Tri SL Jersey is the perfect piece to put on after the swim for the bike and run. It’s great for those looking for more coverage with a less compressed fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417itwlwGAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPXA0E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPXCUM", "title": "Pearl Izumi Fly Intercool Cap,Black,One Size", "description": "Our lightest weight cap combines our In-R-Cool� technology to keep you cool and dry in the hottest conditions.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Fly Intercool Cap,Black,One Size Our lightest weight cap combines our In-R-Cool� technology to keep you cool and dry in the hottest conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mg8dk0TQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPXCUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPXSLA", "title": "Pearl Izumi - Ride Men's Elite Pursuit Jersey", "description": "Built for heat, the Elite Pursuit Jersey from Pearl Izumi provides In-R-Cool technology to maximize moisture transfer and evaporative cooling on your ride. The breezy Elite Transfer fabric is engineered to wick moisture off of the skin and transfer it to the jersey's exterior for fast evaporation. The fabric also provides UPF 50+ sun protection for your skin. The Direct-Vent panels provide constant ventilation as you ride and the full length zipper offers further adjustable ventilation. Built for a streamlined fit, the jersey is equipped with an elasticized gripper on the back to keep the hem in place. Three back pockets with a hidden sweat-proof pocket allow you to carry essentials, while reflective elements offer low-light visibility. Built to last, the men's Elite Pursuit Jersey carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Form fittingElite Transfer fabric100 percent polyesterUPF 50+In-R-Cool technologyDirect-Vent panelsElasticized gripper on backFull length front zipperThree back pocketsHidden sweat-proof pocketReflective elements", "text": "Pearl Izumi - Ride Men's Elite Pursuit Jersey Built for heat, the Elite Pursuit Jersey from Pearl Izumi provides In-R-Cool technology to maximize moisture transfer and evaporative cooling on your ride. The breezy Elite Transfer fabric is engineered to wick moisture off of the skin and transfer it to the jersey's exterior for fast evaporation. The fabric also provides UPF 50+ sun protection for your skin. The Direct-Vent panels provide constant ventilation as you ride and the full length zipper offers further adjustable ventilation. Built for a streamlined fit, the jersey is equipped with an elasticized gripper on the back to keep the hem in place. Three back pockets with a hidden sweat-proof pocket allow you to carry essentials, while reflective elements offer low-light visibility. Built to last, the men's Elite Pursuit Jersey carries a lifetime warranty from Pearl Izumi against defects in materials and workmanship.Size GuideFeatures:Form fittingElite Transfer fabric100 percent polyesterUPF 50+In-R-Cool technologyDirect-Vent panelsElasticized gripper on backFull length front zipperThree back pocketsHidden sweat-proof pocketReflective elements", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WscipaCoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPXSLA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EPXTZU", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Pro Barrier Lite Jacket", "description": "Designed and constructed to pack easily into a jersey pocket, this ultralite jacket is ready for unexpected weather or to keep you warm on the long descent.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Pro Barrier Lite Jacket Designed and constructed to pack easily into a jersey pocket, this ultralite jacket is ready for unexpected weather or to keep you warm on the long descent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Bvy3RXlgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EPXTZU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
