{"item_id": "B004EXC96M", "title": "ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent 48-hour Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torch", "description": "The ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torch ensures that you are never left unprotected against biting insects. Keep insect pests away when using these replacement backs with any ThermaCELL appliance or lantern. The ThermaCELL repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, which is a synthetic copy of the natural mosquito repellent found in chrysanthemum flowers. ThermaCELL’s Mosquito Repellent mats are virtually odor-free and repel bugs without greasy, sticky, or oily sprays or lotions. Repellent mats are easy to use and require no open flame or messy wax to ignite. In order to continue to repel mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects, repellent mats should be replaced every (4) hours. Mats can be used for short or long periods of time and ThermaCELL suggests to store in a dry, dark place between uses. Each ThermaCELL butane cartridge will last up to (12) hours and can be used for short or long periods of time. To ensure the life of each butane cartridge, make sure to turn off appliance or lantern after each use. The RB-4 Refill Pack comes with (4) repellent mats and (12) butane cartridge for a total of 48 hours of repellency. The ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torches are only for use outdoors, do not use indoors or in enclosed spaces. Each ThermaCELL product features a warranty against manufacturer’s defects at time of purchase. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "text": "ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent 48-hour Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torch The ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torch ensures that you are never left unprotected against biting insects. Keep insect pests away when using these replacement backs with any ThermaCELL appliance or lantern. The ThermaCELL repellent mat contains the active ingredient, allethrin, which is a synthetic copy of the natural mosquito repellent found in chrysanthemum flowers. ThermaCELL’s Mosquito Repellent mats are virtually odor-free and repel bugs without greasy, sticky, or oily sprays or lotions. Repellent mats are easy to use and require no open flame or messy wax to ignite. In order to continue to repel mosquitoes, black flies and other flying insects, repellent mats should be replaced every (4) hours. Mats can be used for short or long periods of time and ThermaCELL suggests to store in a dry, dark place between uses. Each ThermaCELL butane cartridge will last up to (12) hours and can be used for short or long periods of time. To ensure the life of each butane cartridge, make sure to turn off appliance or lantern after each use. The RB-4 Refill Pack comes with (4) repellent mats and (12) butane cartridge for a total of 48 hours of repellency. The ThermaCELL RB-4 Mosquito Repellent Refill Pack for Lanterns and Flameless Torches are only for use outdoors, do not use indoors or in enclosed spaces. Each ThermaCELL product features a warranty against manufacturer’s defects at time of purchase. ThermaCELL takes pride in creating products that are highly effective and make being outdoors more enjoyable. ThermaCELL and their parent company, Schawbel Corporation, are an industry leader in research, development, and engineering proven consumer products. ThermaCELL products that have been field tested by the Department of Defense and are endorsed by the North American Hunting Club, Good Housekeeping Institute and Parade Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51T68OOIjnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXC96M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EXPJG4", "title": "Hornady Series III Taper Crimp Die Set", "description": "This set is a three die set that allows you to taper crimp and seat on the third die. The difference is that you no longer are required to have a fourth die for crimping. The seater body and alignment sleeve has been redesigned to allow taper crimping and seating in one step.", "text": "Hornady Series III Taper Crimp Die Set This set is a three die set that allows you to taper crimp and seat on the third die. The difference is that you no longer are required to have a fourth die for crimping. The seater body and alignment sleeve has been redesigned to allow taper crimping and seating in one step.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5124BN2gQvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXPJG4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EXPKGI", "title": "Hornady Lock n' Load Sonic Cleaner Solution,32 ounces (Gun Parts)", "description": "Cleans all gun parts and is safe for all firearms finishes. Quickly removes carbon, dirt, grease and powder residue. Designed specifically for the Hornady Lock n' Load Sonic Cleaners", "text": "Hornady Lock n' Load Sonic Cleaner Solution,32 ounces (Gun Parts) Cleans all gun parts and is safe for all firearms finishes. Quickly removes carbon, dirt, grease and powder residue. Designed specifically for the Hornady Lock n' Load Sonic Cleaners", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lIiubrQXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXPKGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 20.31}}
{"item_id": "B004EXPKJA", "title": "Hornady Electronic Scale", "description": "Made from the same high quality, precision load cell found on the Lock n' Load Auto Charge, the high performance Lock n' Load Bench Scale is the perfect addition to your reloading bench. With a capacity of 1500 grains, you can weight powder, bullets, cases, cartridges and more. The large LCD display is easy to read and weighs precisely to a tenth of a grain. Included are two calibration weights, AC adaptor, 220V adaptor and metal powder pan", "text": "Hornady Electronic Scale Made from the same high quality, precision load cell found on the Lock n' Load Auto Charge, the high performance Lock n' Load Bench Scale is the perfect addition to your reloading bench. With a capacity of 1500 grains, you can weight powder, bullets, cases, cartridges and more. The large LCD display is easy to read and weighs precisely to a tenth of a grain. Included are two calibration weights, AC adaptor, 220V adaptor and metal powder pan", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UVcz44eeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXPKJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 99.15}}
{"item_id": "B004EXTHP8", "title": "Hornady Lock n' Load AP Bullet Feeder Die", "description": "The bullet feeder die is case activated-a bullet will only feed upon contact with a case. The collets are made of solid steel and durable enough fo years of reloading. You'll discover that setup and caliber changeovers are quick and easy and there are no special tools required for adjustments.", "text": "Hornady Lock n' Load AP Bullet Feeder Die The bullet feeder die is case activated-a bullet will only feed upon contact with a case. The collets are made of solid steel and durable enough fo years of reloading. You'll discover that setup and caliber changeovers are quick and easy and there are no special tools required for adjustments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iFe5nRg2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXTHP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004EXTJXI", "title": "Hornady Deluxe Die Wrench", "description": "The Deluxe Die Wrench is the ultimate 4-in-1 reloading tool for your Lock n' Load AP or single stage Classic press. This tool holds the shell plate and keeps it from rotating while you change plates and tighten the main press screw. It also adjusts the tightness of the spindle lock and the lock rings, and can tighten or loosen the die flats. No reloading bench should be without one.", "text": "Hornady Deluxe Die Wrench The Deluxe Die Wrench is the ultimate 4-in-1 reloading tool for your Lock n' Load AP or single stage Classic press. This tool holds the shell plate and keeps it from rotating while you change plates and tighten the main press screw. It also adjusts the tightness of the spindle lock and the lock rings, and can tighten or loosen the die flats. No reloading bench should be without one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rbP3LD7lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EXTJXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.26}}
{"item_id": "B004EYG3MW", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear \"QD\" Quick Detach Tactical AK47 AK-47 Saiga Rifle/Shotgun 7.62x39 Side Plate Double Weaver-Picatinny Rail Scope-Sight Mount", "description": "", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear \"QD\" Quick Detach Tactical AK47 AK-47 Saiga Rifle/Shotgun 7.62x39 Side Plate Double Weaver-Picatinny Rail Scope-Sight Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415fsgN45gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004EYG3MW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B004F1D48K", "title": "Laser Ammo 9MBSCK SureStrike 9mm Dry Fire Laser Cartridge Kit, for Safe Practice with Any 9mm Hand Gun.", "description": "The SureStrike allows any level of pistol user to practice totally safe marksmanship and handling drills with an actual weapon in any location, from the basement to the barracks. By pulling the trigger, the direct impact of the firing pin activates the SureStrike to emit a microprocessor controlled eye-safe laser pulse, a \"shot\" of red light, which simulates the point of impact where a bullet fired from the weapon would have struck. The SureStrike is a patent pending dry fire training system currently available for 9mm, 40 S&W;, .45 ACP and .45 Long Colt pistols. The SureStrike is unique in that it is inserted in the chamber of the weapon and secured using the UhrSecure system.The heart of the SureStrike is a miniaturized microprocessor that controls laser beam duration and wavelength. Simulator Settings Laser Ammo can adjust the SureStrike to operate with various third-party simulation systems such as those sold by Beamhit, Advanced Interactive Systems (AIS-SIM), and others. Infra-red and visible spectrum lasers, plus a wide variety of wavelength and frequency settings, can be ordered.", "text": "Laser Ammo 9MBSCK SureStrike 9mm Dry Fire Laser Cartridge Kit, for Safe Practice with Any 9mm Hand Gun. The SureStrike allows any level of pistol user to practice totally safe marksmanship and handling drills with an actual weapon in any location, from the basement to the barracks. By pulling the trigger, the direct impact of the firing pin activates the SureStrike to emit a microprocessor controlled eye-safe laser pulse, a \"shot\" of red light, which simulates the point of impact where a bullet fired from the weapon would have struck. The SureStrike is a patent pending dry fire training system currently available for 9mm, 40 S&W;, .45 ACP and .45 Long Colt pistols. The SureStrike is unique in that it is inserted in the chamber of the weapon and secured using the UhrSecure system.The heart of the SureStrike is a miniaturized microprocessor that controls laser beam duration and wavelength. Simulator Settings Laser Ammo can adjust the SureStrike to operate with various third-party simulation systems such as those sold by Beamhit, Advanced Interactive Systems (AIS-SIM), and others. Infra-red and visible spectrum lasers, plus a wide variety of wavelength and frequency settings, can be ordered.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31b9kl2sejL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004F1D48K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Laser Ammo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 140.95}}
