{"item_id": "B004FBQAW2", "title": "Silica Gel Desiccants Packets - 1\" X 2 3/8\" - 3 Gram Packs - 10 Packets of Silica Gel - Dry-Packs Brand!", "description": "Silica Gel Packets will absorb up to 40% of it's weight in moisture and will work until it's fully absorbed. By placing with your valuables it will assist in keeping moisture away in humid and damp conditions. Prevent Mold, Mildew, Corrosion, etc!", "text": "Silica Gel Desiccants Packets - 1\" X 2 3/8\" - 3 Gram Packs - 10 Packets of Silica Gel - Dry-Packs Brand! Silica Gel Packets will absorb up to 40% of it's weight in moisture and will work until it's fully absorbed. By placing with your valuables it will assist in keeping moisture away in humid and damp conditions. Prevent Mold, Mildew, Corrosion, etc!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aWZKEsjvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FBQAW2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B004FBRR5Q", "title": "Demon WP Insecticide 1 lb 55555408", "description": "Demon WP is a crack and crevice and or spot treatment for residual and contact control of ants, carpenter ants, cockroaches, crickets, spiders, German cockroaches, scorpions, occasional invaders such as firebrats, silverfish, centipedes, millipedes and certain other insects. This odorless wettable powder is the most popular insect repellent used in general household insect and pest control. Demon WP insecticide gives three to four months of insect control and virtually insect free houses. Professional pest control operators use Demon WP in their quarterly and annual pest control accounts, in homes and businesses. Available in pre-measured water soluble packets and 1 LB bulk jars. A general surface, crack and crevice and/or spot treatment for residual and contact control of ants, carpenter ants, cockroaches, crickets, spiders and other insect pests. For use by commercial applicators in, on and around buildings and structures for the control of listed pests, including on lawns, ornamental trees and shrubs around residential, institutional, public, commercial, agricultural and industrial buildings; and parks, recreational areas and athletic fields.", "text": "Demon WP Insecticide 1 lb 55555408 Demon WP is a crack and crevice and or spot treatment for residual and contact control of ants, carpenter ants, cockroaches, crickets, spiders, German cockroaches, scorpions, occasional invaders such as firebrats, silverfish, centipedes, millipedes and certain other insects. This odorless wettable powder is the most popular insect repellent used in general household insect and pest control. Demon WP insecticide gives three to four months of insect control and virtually insect free houses. Professional pest control operators use Demon WP in their quarterly and annual pest control accounts, in homes and businesses. Available in pre-measured water soluble packets and 1 LB bulk jars. A general surface, crack and crevice and/or spot treatment for residual and contact control of ants, carpenter ants, cockroaches, crickets, spiders and other insect pests. For use by commercial applicators in, on and around buildings and structures for the control of listed pests, including on lawns, ornamental trees and shrubs around residential, institutional, public, commercial, agricultural and industrial buildings; and parks, recreational areas and athletic fields.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GGmXl99iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FBRR5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004FEVKWE", "title": "Global Vision Eyewear Flare Anti-Fog Goggles with Storage Pouch, Smoke Tint Lens", "description": "The Flare anti-fog goggles Offer a cool one-piece shatterproof lens design with UV400 protection. The lens is coated with a scratch-resistant finish as well as a double-sided anti-fog coat. Neoprene foam lines the inside for better comfort.", "text": "Global Vision Eyewear Flare Anti-Fog Goggles with Storage Pouch, Smoke Tint Lens The Flare anti-fog goggles Offer a cool one-piece shatterproof lens design with UV400 protection. The lens is coated with a scratch-resistant finish as well as a double-sided anti-fog coat. Neoprene foam lines the inside for better comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R6rk%2BnpnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FEVKWE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Vision Eyewear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 7.46}}
{"item_id": "B004FGP07S", "title": "Volcano Outdoors 30-700 Lid for Grilling", "description": "Our most popular Volcano accessory; the Lid had become a must-have. The lid is made of a durable, heat-resistant material and works trap and circulate heat to create faster, more efficient cooking in your Volcano. The Lid also allows you to bake or smoke with the Volcano. The Lid is also excellent for Dutch oven cooking, trapping the heat and (in most cases) eliminating any need for adding briquettes. It is an excellent shield against the elements. Easily folds ups and fits in your Volcano carrying case.", "text": "Volcano Outdoors 30-700 Lid for Grilling Our most popular Volcano accessory; the Lid had become a must-have. The lid is made of a durable, heat-resistant material and works trap and circulate heat to create faster, more efficient cooking in your Volcano. The Lid also allows you to bake or smoke with the Volcano. The Lid is also excellent for Dutch oven cooking, trapping the heat and (in most cases) eliminating any need for adding briquettes. It is an excellent shield against the elements. Easily folds ups and fits in your Volcano carrying case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419kVff1GPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FGP07S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Volcano Grills", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B004FGQKAE", "title": "Condor MA27 Open Top Triple Molle M4/M16 5.56 Mag Pouch - Black", "description": "Condor MA27 Open Top Triple Molle M4/M16 5.56 Mag Pouch Description : • Securely holds three 30rd 5.56 mm or equivelant magzines • Magazines are held in place with bungee cord restraints • Provides quick access to magazines for rapid reloading • MOLLE webbing on exterior of pouch to expand your carrying capacity • Securely Attaches to any Standard MOLLE/PALS Platform via MOLLE straps Size: 5.5\" H x 9.5\" W Available Colors: O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU, Multicam", "text": "Condor MA27 Open Top Triple Molle M4/M16 5.56 Mag Pouch - Black Condor MA27 Open Top Triple Molle M4/M16 5.56 Mag Pouch Description : • Securely holds three 30rd 5.56 mm or equivelant magzines • Magazines are held in place with bungee cord restraints • Provides quick access to magazines for rapid reloading • MOLLE webbing on exterior of pouch to expand your carrying capacity • Securely Attaches to any Standard MOLLE/PALS Platform via MOLLE straps Size: 5.5\" H x 9.5\" W Available Colors: O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU, Multicam", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ddD1enkGL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FGQKAE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B004FGWY54", "title": "Tenergy 1-4 Cells Li-PO/Li-Fe Balance Airsoft Battery Charger", "description": "This NEW versatile charger by Tenergy features an advanced individual charging method and safely charges/balances LiPo, LiFe and LiIon packs, maximizing battery life and performance all in one package. Capable of fully charging LiPO and LiFE batteries in under three hours, this simple balance charger is a much more economical alternative to high end balance chargers, which can cost over 100. This LiPo charger fits most battery packs with up to four cells and comes with a built-in balance port, ensuring that each cell is fully charged and energy is distributed evenly. - See more at: www.airsoftmegastore.com/7750-tenergy-1-to-4-cell-balance-charger-for-lipoly-batteries-acc-t01267.aspx#sthash.izl0Zyil.dpuf.", "text": "Tenergy 1-4 Cells Li-PO/Li-Fe Balance Airsoft Battery Charger This NEW versatile charger by Tenergy features an advanced individual charging method and safely charges/balances LiPo, LiFe and LiIon packs, maximizing battery life and performance all in one package. Capable of fully charging LiPO and LiFE batteries in under three hours, this simple balance charger is a much more economical alternative to high end balance chargers, which can cost over 100. This LiPo charger fits most battery packs with up to four cells and comes with a built-in balance port, ensuring that each cell is fully charged and energy is distributed evenly. - See more at: www.airsoftmegastore.com/7750-tenergy-1-to-4-cell-balance-charger-for-lipoly-batteries-acc-t01267.aspx#sthash.izl0Zyil.dpuf.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e%2BDS4Z0sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FGWY54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tenergy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]], "price": 22.3}}
{"item_id": "B004FGX2H8", "title": "", "description": "The V-Grip features variable fit technology that adapts to provide a customized fit for guns, guns in a soft case and bows. All rack adjustments can be made in the field without tools. The specialized bow limb slot holds bow stable and is compatible with modern parallel limb designs. Air Tek suspension isolates shock and vibration to protect your gear while on the trails. The rock solid low-profile mounting base adjusts to provide a custom fit on tubular or composite racks. Also available in a low-profile handlebar mount.", "text": "The V-Grip features variable fit technology that adapts to provide a customized fit for guns, guns in a soft case and bows. All rack adjustments can be made in the field without tools. The specialized bow limb slot holds bow stable and is compatible with modern parallel limb designs. Air Tek suspension isolates shock and vibration to protect your gear while on the trails. The rock solid low-profile mounting base adjusts to provide a custom fit on tubular or composite racks. Also available in a low-profile handlebar mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41paAH4xtML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FGX2H8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B004FKUCXQ", "title": "Sheath Blk X-Large Molle", "description": "LEATHERMAN 930371 UNIVERSAL X LARGE SHEATH, BLACK NYLON MOLLE SHEATH for the Leatherman MUT This extra large, nylon MOLLE system sheath features snap webbing strap for attachment on backside. Attachement webbing can hold MUT accessory wrench. The sheath has Leatherman logo and Velcro front closure and internal panel storage to hold extra bits. Fits: MUT EOD, Super Tool 300, Surge, MUT, Super Tool 300 EOD", "text": "Sheath Blk X-Large Molle LEATHERMAN 930371 UNIVERSAL X LARGE SHEATH, BLACK NYLON MOLLE SHEATH for the Leatherman MUT This extra large, nylon MOLLE system sheath features snap webbing strap for attachment on backside. Attachement webbing can hold MUT accessory wrench. The sheath has Leatherman logo and Velcro front closure and internal panel storage to hold extra bits. Fits: MUT EOD, Super Tool 300, Surge, MUT, Super Tool 300 EOD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lUYP4Y9sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FKUCXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 12.75}}
{"item_id": "B004FO37AC", "title": "BARSKA Top Opening Biometric Fingerprint Safe", "description": "Barska is committed to customer satisfaction and provides free technical support. Review theUser Manualfor more information.", "text": "BARSKA Top Opening Biometric Fingerprint Safe Barska is committed to customer satisfaction and provides free technical support. Review theUser Manualfor more information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qdWjghJFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FO37AC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 175.0}}
{"item_id": "B004FO8B62", "title": "BARSKA 6-24x50 IR Sniper Scope", "description": "With a high magnification range and a host of adjustments, you can count on the Barska 6-24x50 sniper riflescope to keep zero shot after shot. The scope starts with an impressive 6-24x zoom range, which is ideal for long-range targeting. To improve accuracy, the scope offers side parallax focus and quick-targeting exterior windage and elevation adjustments. Add in a military-standard Mil-Dot reticle, which can be converted from a normal black reticle to a highly visible green illuminated reticle, and you have a terrific scope for almost any long-distance application.The scope is also equipped with a 50mm objective lens for better light transmission, delivering a bright, high-contrast view of your target. Other features include a built-in Sniper Edged sunshade, a set of high tactical rings that will fit all Weaver and Picatinny rails, and Barska's limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsMagnification: 6x to 24xObjective lens: 50mmWaterproof: YesFogproof: YesReticle: Black and green illuminated Mil-DotExit pupil: 2.1 to 8.3mmOptical coating: MulticoatedField of view: 15.7 feet @ 100 yards (6x); 3.94 feet @ 100 yards (24x)Eye relief: 81.6 to 76mmClick value: 1/8 inchesAdjustment knob: Adjustable rheostat, exterior windage and elevation, adjustable side parallaxTube diameter: 30mmFinish: Black matteAccessories: Rings, scope caps, lens clothLength: 15.5 inchesWeight: 24 ouncesAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "text": "BARSKA 6-24x50 IR Sniper Scope With a high magnification range and a host of adjustments, you can count on the Barska 6-24x50 sniper riflescope to keep zero shot after shot. The scope starts with an impressive 6-24x zoom range, which is ideal for long-range targeting. To improve accuracy, the scope offers side parallax focus and quick-targeting exterior windage and elevation adjustments. Add in a military-standard Mil-Dot reticle, which can be converted from a normal black reticle to a highly visible green illuminated reticle, and you have a terrific scope for almost any long-distance application.The scope is also equipped with a 50mm objective lens for better light transmission, delivering a bright, high-contrast view of your target. Other features include a built-in Sniper Edged sunshade, a set of high tactical rings that will fit all Weaver and Picatinny rails, and Barska's limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsMagnification: 6x to 24xObjective lens: 50mmWaterproof: YesFogproof: YesReticle: Black and green illuminated Mil-DotExit pupil: 2.1 to 8.3mmOptical coating: MulticoatedField of view: 15.7 feet @ 100 yards (6x); 3.94 feet @ 100 yards (24x)Eye relief: 81.6 to 76mmClick value: 1/8 inchesAdjustment knob: Adjustable rheostat, exterior windage and elevation, adjustable side parallaxTube diameter: 30mmFinish: Black matteAccessories: Rings, scope caps, lens clothLength: 15.5 inchesWeight: 24 ouncesAbout BarskaBarska is a worldwide sport optics company with strong brand recognition within the optics industry, with corporate offices in La Verne, California, and warehouses and distribution centers in La Verne and Shanghai, China. Barska offers an extensive line of precision sport optics products, such as binoculars, riflescopes, spotting scopes, and telescopes. The product range has been designed and built with the latest optical technology, allowing users to enjoy all their favorite leisure time outdoor activities, including bird watching, outdoor observation, hunting, fishing, stargazing, concerts, and sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X0NGfkcJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FO8B62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 153.86}}
{"item_id": "B004FORPLY", "title": "Filzer Aluminum tire levers (TL-3)", "description": "Tired of breaking plastic tire levers? These high quality forged aluminum tire levers are very strong and lightweight (44g) and will get those tight tires off your rim. On back of tire lever is a nylon molded insert to minimize aluminum contact on rim. Includes a foam tube to hold tire levers together and keep them from rattling around in your seat post bag.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- Made of high quality 6061 forged aluminum- On back of tire lever is a nylon molded insert to minimize aluminum contact on rim- Includes a foam tube to hold tire levers together- Weight: 44gABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.Filzer: it fills a gap in the market between big marketing budgets with over-hyped products and cheap, poorly made disposable knock-offs. With Filzer, the goods are great and the value is the bottom line. It's that simple.", "text": "Filzer Aluminum tire levers (TL-3) Tired of breaking plastic tire levers? These high quality forged aluminum tire levers are very strong and lightweight (44g) and will get those tight tires off your rim. On back of tire lever is a nylon molded insert to minimize aluminum contact on rim. Includes a foam tube to hold tire levers together and keep them from rattling around in your seat post bag.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- Made of high quality 6061 forged aluminum- On back of tire lever is a nylon molded insert to minimize aluminum contact on rim- Includes a foam tube to hold tire levers together- Weight: 44gABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.Filzer: it fills a gap in the market between big marketing budgets with over-hyped products and cheap, poorly made disposable knock-offs. With Filzer, the goods are great and the value is the bottom line. It's that simple.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pgd6wKH8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FORPLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 9.75}}
{"item_id": "B004FOV89E", "title": "Froglube CLP 4 Oz. Tub of Paste Gun Cleaner Lubricant Protectant", "description": "Froglube Paste is a cutting edge Bio-Based lubricant made from \"USDA Certified Food-Grade\". All ingredients are produced in the USA using a proprietary formula. It is a non-toxic substance that dissolves carbon on contact. It has a heavy specific gravity, which enables it to 'season' the metal through absorption deep into the pores. Using FROGLUBE results in a durable dry slick wax-like surface that reduces friction, eliminates fouling, and destroys rust. FROGLUBE is safe for plastic, urethane, nylon, and wood. FROGLUBEwill give your weapon many extended years of service. Froglube will not harm the environment. It can be disposed of without the need for prohibitive HAZMAT controls. Employees will be protected from the affects of working in and around toxic chemicals. Froglube is a bio-based lubricant, cleaner and protectant. Froglube contains no petrolium or water, non hazardous in every way and has a pleasant mint smell. 4 oz. jar.", "text": "Froglube CLP 4 Oz. Tub of Paste Gun Cleaner Lubricant Protectant Froglube Paste is a cutting edge Bio-Based lubricant made from \"USDA Certified Food-Grade\". All ingredients are produced in the USA using a proprietary formula. It is a non-toxic substance that dissolves carbon on contact. It has a heavy specific gravity, which enables it to 'season' the metal through absorption deep into the pores. Using FROGLUBE results in a durable dry slick wax-like surface that reduces friction, eliminates fouling, and destroys rust. FROGLUBE is safe for plastic, urethane, nylon, and wood. FROGLUBEwill give your weapon many extended years of service. Froglube will not harm the environment. It can be disposed of without the need for prohibitive HAZMAT controls. Employees will be protected from the affects of working in and around toxic chemicals. Froglube is a bio-based lubricant, cleaner and protectant. Froglube contains no petrolium or water, non hazardous in every way and has a pleasant mint smell. 4 oz. jar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414XMLB8E7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FOV89E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frog Lube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 6.01}}
{"item_id": "B004FQCZDU", "title": "Ghillie Suit, Woodland Camo, Size M/L, Factory Direct Price,", "description": "Hunting, Shooting, Fishing, Bird Watching, This is the Suit to Blend into the Countryside Background. Top Quality - Low price. Sizes: Medium/Large - up to 44-inch chest and 42-inch waist We Also Stock XL/XXL.", "text": "Ghillie Suit, Woodland Camo, Size M/L, Factory Direct Price, Hunting, Shooting, Fishing, Bird Watching, This is the Suit to Blend into the Countryside Background. Top Quality - Low price. Sizes: Medium/Large - up to 44-inch chest and 42-inch waist We Also Stock XL/XXL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zkKxHTQDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004FQCZDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KAS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 47.99}}
