{"item_id": "B004G1V54O", "title": "Compact Rifle or Pistol tactical Green Laser Designator Illuminator Weapon Light Picatinny Mount", "description": "Light up the night with FSI compact rifle or pistol laser illuminating designator. Instant night vision for hunting, nature watching, or SOS beacon. Rule the night with FSI laser illuminating designator. Comparable to BSA Laser Genetics. Standard International SOS signals are consist of 3 steady short flash follow by 3 steady long flash and 3 steady short flash. Repeat the signal. ---===---", "text": "Compact Rifle or Pistol tactical Green Laser Designator Illuminator Weapon Light Picatinny Mount Light up the night with FSI compact rifle or pistol laser illuminating designator. Instant night vision for hunting, nature watching, or SOS beacon. Rule the night with FSI laser illuminating designator. Comparable to BSA Laser Genetics. Standard International SOS signals are consist of 3 steady short flash follow by 3 steady long flash and 3 steady short flash. Repeat the signal. ---===---", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xGX8d65NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G1V54O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 61.0}}
{"item_id": "B004G4K1QO", "title": "Shimano PTFE Road Shift Cable and Housing Set", "description": "Shimano has spent countless hours researching and developing shift cables and housing that will optimize the performance of their shifters and derailleurs. The PTFE(Teflon) coated derailleur cable set is the most advanced cable set they have ever produced.", "text": "Shimano PTFE Road Shift Cable and Housing Set Shimano has spent countless hours researching and developing shift cables and housing that will optimize the performance of their shifters and derailleurs. The PTFE(Teflon) coated derailleur cable set is the most advanced cable set they have ever produced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mReAIWCuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G4K1QO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004G6241C", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L ACU Digital Camo", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 50 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L ACU Digital Camo This heavy duty and water-resistant 50 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JJMGhIm%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G6241C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Miltec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B004G6RUC0", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Original Survival Tool", "description": "The SOL™ Origin Survival Tool is truly a tool of the future. It is one survival essential that not only fits in the palm of your hand but gives you the collection of tools you need to expect the unexpected and make it back alive. 7 tools in one, the SOL™ Origin should be required equipment in every outdoor adventurer's pack.Fire Lite- over 1,000 sparks with one hand operation.Waterproof interior compartment.7 tools in one.Includes 10' nylon cord and 10' stainless steel wire.Includes aluminum foil, safety pins, fishing line, hooks and swivels..Size: 3.875\" x 2.75\" x 1.5\".Weight: 6.25 oz..", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Original Survival Tool The SOL™ Origin Survival Tool is truly a tool of the future. It is one survival essential that not only fits in the palm of your hand but gives you the collection of tools you need to expect the unexpected and make it back alive. 7 tools in one, the SOL™ Origin should be required equipment in every outdoor adventurer's pack.Fire Lite- over 1,000 sparks with one hand operation.Waterproof interior compartment.7 tools in one.Includes 10' nylon cord and 10' stainless steel wire.Includes aluminum foil, safety pins, fishing line, hooks and swivels..Size: 3.875\" x 2.75\" x 1.5\".Weight: 6.25 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q41OlI1AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G6RUC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 31.95}}
{"item_id": "B004G7D5GO", "title": "Ab-Doer Twist Abdominal Trainer", "description": "The Ab-Doer Twist's Torsion-Flex technology and 360-degree movement helps target muscles other workouts can't reach.Tone muscles and enjoy an effective aerobic workout from a seated position with the Ab-Doer Twist. It's easy to use--just sit down on the device and your body will automatically be positioned in an anatomically correct (and stable) position. As you move in a swivel motion, the Ab-Doer Twist helps eliminate excess fat from your abdominals and obliques while also targeting other \"metabolically active\" muscles in your inner and outer thighs, hips, and buttocks. The Ab-Doer Twist's state-of-the-art Torsion-Flex technology activates a wide range of muscles groups. And because you're properly aligned and supported, you'll use these muscles effectively, with less stress and less pain.The Ab-Doer Twist is made of gym-quality, heavy-gauge steel, with multiple resistance options. The contouring arm bars on the sides were ergonomically designed to eliminate stress on your hands, wrists, elbows, shoulders, neck, and upper back. Just rotate the arms upward and downward to tone the muscles in your shoulders, biceps, triceps, upper back, and chest. While sitting on the swivel-action seat, you can dial up the resistance to burn additional fat or tone your abs, legs, hamstrings, hips, buttocks, and obliques. Plus, the device comes with a massage roller that gives you a revitalizing therapeutic massage with every workout. The Ab-Doer Twist is so effective that it earned a Seal of Approval from the prestigious National Health & Wellness Organization.When you're not using the Ab-Doer Twist, simply fold it down and tuck it away. Designed for users of all fitness levels and body types up to 300 pounds, the Ab-Doer Twist helps you get fit in just minutes a day.Features:Targets and tones abs, obliques, thighs, hips, and buttocks; rotates up and down to tone upper body, tooTorsion Flex technology activates a wide range of muscules while supporting your back and bodyMade of gym-quality, heavy-gauge steelSwivel-action seat with multiple resistance dialFront stabilizerErgonomic designContouring arm bars eliminate stress on hands, writs, elbows, shoulders, neck, and upper backMassage roller offers therapeutic massage while you work outEasy to assembleSpecifications:Material: Solid steel; padded vinyl seatWeight Capacity: 300 poundsWeight: 37.4 poundsDimensions: 27 by 11.4 by 22.4 inchesWhat's in the Box?The Ab-Doer Twist comes with an instructional DVD and three progressive workout DVDs: beginner, intermediate, and advanced. The special starter kit also includes a quick-start guide, anAccelerated Resultsbooklet, and aHealthy Eating Plan.", "text": "Ab-Doer Twist Abdominal Trainer The Ab-Doer Twist's Torsion-Flex technology and 360-degree movement helps target muscles other workouts can't reach.Tone muscles and enjoy an effective aerobic workout from a seated position with the Ab-Doer Twist. It's easy to use--just sit down on the device and your body will automatically be positioned in an anatomically correct (and stable) position. As you move in a swivel motion, the Ab-Doer Twist helps eliminate excess fat from your abdominals and obliques while also targeting other \"metabolically active\" muscles in your inner and outer thighs, hips, and buttocks. The Ab-Doer Twist's state-of-the-art Torsion-Flex technology activates a wide range of muscles groups. And because you're properly aligned and supported, you'll use these muscles effectively, with less stress and less pain.The Ab-Doer Twist is made of gym-quality, heavy-gauge steel, with multiple resistance options. The contouring arm bars on the sides were ergonomically designed to eliminate stress on your hands, wrists, elbows, shoulders, neck, and upper back. Just rotate the arms upward and downward to tone the muscles in your shoulders, biceps, triceps, upper back, and chest. While sitting on the swivel-action seat, you can dial up the resistance to burn additional fat or tone your abs, legs, hamstrings, hips, buttocks, and obliques. Plus, the device comes with a massage roller that gives you a revitalizing therapeutic massage with every workout. The Ab-Doer Twist is so effective that it earned a Seal of Approval from the prestigious National Health & Wellness Organization.When you're not using the Ab-Doer Twist, simply fold it down and tuck it away. Designed for users of all fitness levels and body types up to 300 pounds, the Ab-Doer Twist helps you get fit in just minutes a day.Features:Targets and tones abs, obliques, thighs, hips, and buttocks; rotates up and down to tone upper body, tooTorsion Flex technology activates a wide range of muscules while supporting your back and bodyMade of gym-quality, heavy-gauge steelSwivel-action seat with multiple resistance dialFront stabilizerErgonomic designContouring arm bars eliminate stress on hands, writs, elbows, shoulders, neck, and upper backMassage roller offers therapeutic massage while you work outEasy to assembleSpecifications:Material: Solid steel; padded vinyl seatWeight Capacity: 300 poundsWeight: 37.4 poundsDimensions: 27 by 11.4 by 22.4 inchesWhat's in the Box?The Ab-Doer Twist comes with an instructional DVD and three progressive workout DVDs: beginner, intermediate, and advanced. The special starter kit also includes a quick-start guide, anAccelerated Resultsbooklet, and aHealthy Eating Plan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tVSP76BmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G7D5GO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004G7FLFC", "title": "Filzer Chain Cleaner (CC-2)", "description": "This is the BEST chain cleaner on the market! The Filzer Chain cleaner makes it simple to clean dirty chains with its 168 rotating brushes. 2 foam squeegee pads wipe off the excess solvent from the chain to minimize the mess. The flip-lock securely locks the top cover in place. Magnet on base to collect steel burrs from chain. The handle provides ample support and keeps it upright when resting the unit on the ground.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- 168 rotating brushes- 2 Foam squeegee pad to minimize cleaning fluid spillage- Flip-lock cover- Stabilizing handle- Replacement brush kit available - part number CC-2P- Magnet on base to collect steel burrs from chain- Works with most degreasers including citrus based cleanersABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.", "text": "Filzer Chain Cleaner (CC-2) This is the BEST chain cleaner on the market! The Filzer Chain cleaner makes it simple to clean dirty chains with its 168 rotating brushes. 2 foam squeegee pads wipe off the excess solvent from the chain to minimize the mess. The flip-lock securely locks the top cover in place. Magnet on base to collect steel burrs from chain. The handle provides ample support and keeps it upright when resting the unit on the ground.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- 168 rotating brushes- 2 Foam squeegee pad to minimize cleaning fluid spillage- Flip-lock cover- Stabilizing handle- Replacement brush kit available - part number CC-2P- Magnet on base to collect steel burrs from chain- Works with most degreasers including citrus based cleanersABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vMFZOTFcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G7FLFC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004G7LUNO", "title": "Sevylor Fiji Travel Pack Kayak (Blue,2-Person)", "description": "Enjoy the feel of a full-size kayak with the convenience of an inflatable boat when you’re riding in a Sevylor® Fiji™ Travel Pack. The two-person kayak comes equipped with two seats: a fixed seat in the rear and a removable seat in the middle. The semi-rigid I-beam floor and three-chamber design keep the boat’s solid shape on the water. The thick, durable PVC and Airtight® System are guaranteed not to leak, and the Double Lock™ Fast Valve makes quick work of inflation and deflation. The boat also comes with a 5-piece touring paddle and special travel bag for compact storage. The 10 ft. 4 in. x 2 ft. 9 in. kayak holds up to 400 lbs. and includes a 90 day warranty.", "text": "Sevylor Fiji Travel Pack Kayak (Blue,2-Person) Enjoy the feel of a full-size kayak with the convenience of an inflatable boat when you’re riding in a Sevylor® Fiji™ Travel Pack. The two-person kayak comes equipped with two seats: a fixed seat in the rear and a removable seat in the middle. The semi-rigid I-beam floor and three-chamber design keep the boat’s solid shape on the water. The thick, durable PVC and Airtight® System are guaranteed not to leak, and the Double Lock™ Fast Valve makes quick work of inflation and deflation. The boat also comes with a 5-piece touring paddle and special travel bag for compact storage. The 10 ft. 4 in. x 2 ft. 9 in. kayak holds up to 400 lbs. and includes a 90 day warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hVEWrfI8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G7LUNO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sevylor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks"]], "price": 149.99}}
{"item_id": "B004G7NCFI", "title": "Multifunction LED Camp Lantern", "description": "Specifications:Item Type: Camping LightModel Number: ST-1010Light Source: LEDLED QTY: 3pcsColor:RedDimensions:12.5*8*8cmWeight: 152gFeaturesBattery Operated - 3 AA's (not included)100% brand new and high quality camping lightFeatures 3 white LEDs, superbright, low power consumption and stable performanceWith antennaWith FM auto scan functionWith built-in speakerCompact and lightweight, easy to carrySuitable for outdoor activities like camping, boating, Hiking, Picnicking, etcPackage Includes:1 x LED Camping Light", "text": "Multifunction LED Camp Lantern Specifications:Item Type: Camping LightModel Number: ST-1010Light Source: LEDLED QTY: 3pcsColor:RedDimensions:12.5*8*8cmWeight: 152gFeaturesBattery Operated - 3 AA's (not included)100% brand new and high quality camping lightFeatures 3 white LEDs, superbright, low power consumption and stable performanceWith antennaWith FM auto scan functionWith built-in speakerCompact and lightweight, easy to carrySuitable for outdoor activities like camping, boating, Hiking, Picnicking, etcPackage Includes:1 x LED Camping Light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gBj-vvI8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G7NCFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 15.51}}
{"item_id": "B004G8FHFA", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 46\" Padded Weapons Case - Black 15-7614", "description": "Our Voodoo Tactical 46\" Padded Weapons Case will accommodate up to 4 weapons (2 weapons up to 46\" and 2 handguns). Perfect for M-1 Garand, FN-FAL, FN-LAR, Sig, M1-A, M-14, and other weapons not over 46\". This heavy duty case is constructed of rugged pack cloth and features heavy duty zippers, three adjustable outside accessory pouches, padded carry handles & strap, removable padded harness, padded sides and perimeter, padded divider, inside accessory pockets, and outside MOLLE / universal attachment points. 46\" overall length. NOTE: 42\" OD case shown for illustration purposes.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 46\" Padded Weapons Case - Black 15-7614 Our Voodoo Tactical 46\" Padded Weapons Case will accommodate up to 4 weapons (2 weapons up to 46\" and 2 handguns). Perfect for M-1 Garand, FN-FAL, FN-LAR, Sig, M1-A, M-14, and other weapons not over 46\". This heavy duty case is constructed of rugged pack cloth and features heavy duty zippers, three adjustable outside accessory pouches, padded carry handles & strap, removable padded harness, padded sides and perimeter, padded divider, inside accessory pockets, and outside MOLLE / universal attachment points. 46\" overall length. NOTE: 42\" OD case shown for illustration purposes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G-DHi7qYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G8FHFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VOODOO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 109.0}}
