{"item_id": "B004G954W0", "title": "Serfas USB Ultrabight Rechargeable Headlight (Black)", "description": "Small, lightweight, and easy to mount - the Serfas USL-1 is the perfect solution for the daily commuter or the occasional night rider. Most states have laws that require you to have a light on your bicyle at night, don’t get caught without one. The USL-1 has a rechargeable Li-Polimer battery that willl charge quickly using your USB port, and give burn times up to 6.5 hours on a full charge.", "text": "Serfas USB Ultrabight Rechargeable Headlight (Black) Small, lightweight, and easy to mount - the Serfas USL-1 is the perfect solution for the daily commuter or the occasional night rider. Most states have laws that require you to have a light on your bicyle at night, don’t get caught without one. The USL-1 has a rechargeable Li-Polimer battery that willl charge quickly using your USB port, and give burn times up to 6.5 hours on a full charge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4187tmKDmGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G954W0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 37.84}}
{"item_id": "B004G9VRGM", "title": "Pack of 5 American Universal Handcuff Keys", "description": "Pack of 5 universal handcuff keys. Universal keys open Smith & Wesson, Peerless, ASP, Thompson and most other standard handcuffs.", "text": "Pack of 5 American Universal Handcuff Keys Pack of 5 universal handcuff keys. Universal keys open Smith & Wesson, Peerless, ASP, Thompson and most other standard handcuffs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ejWXjM9-L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004G9VRGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Chicago Handcuff Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Handcuffs & Restraints", "Handcuffs"]], "price": 5.47}}
{"item_id": "B004GAFW7G", "title": "ESEE Knives IZULAH Izula OD Green Canvas Micarta Handles with Mounting Hardware", "description": "ESEE Knives - Izula OD Green Canvas Micarta Handles with Mounting Hardware. Model: ESIZULAH. Made to fit ESEE Cutlery Model RC1 Izula knife. Bulk packed.", "text": "ESEE Knives IZULAH Izula OD Green Canvas Micarta Handles with Mounting Hardware ESEE Knives - Izula OD Green Canvas Micarta Handles with Mounting Hardware. Model: ESIZULAH. Made to fit ESEE Cutlery Model RC1 Izula knife. Bulk packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OxSEiY8CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GAFW7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESEE Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.74}}
{"item_id": "B004GALN0G", "title": "ESEE 4P Black Knife w/ Kydex Sheath", "description": "ESEE Knives - RC-4P Plain Edge Fixed Blade Knife with Black Linen Micarta Handles. Model: RC4P. 9\" overall. 4 1/2\" Super Tuff, black textured powder coated 1095 carbon steel drop point blade. Full tang. Black linen micarta handles. Glass breaker pommel. Molded Kydex sheath with paracord and cord lock. Sheath attachments for vertical and horizontal carry.", "text": "ESEE 4P Black Knife w/ Kydex Sheath ESEE Knives - RC-4P Plain Edge Fixed Blade Knife with Black Linen Micarta Handles. Model: RC4P. 9\" overall. 4 1/2\" Super Tuff, black textured powder coated 1095 carbon steel drop point blade. Full tang. Black linen micarta handles. Glass breaker pommel. Molded Kydex sheath with paracord and cord lock. Sheath attachments for vertical and horizontal carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xJ8UunLPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GALN0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESEE Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 97.04}}
{"item_id": "B004GATX62", "title": "Morakniv Wood Carving 120 Knife with Laminated Steel Blade, 1.9-Inch", "description": "Generations of carpenters and wood carvers have appreciated the precision tools made by Morakniv in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. The Mora Wood Carving 120 is a small woodcarving knife with a thin, tapered blade of laminated steel. Oiled birch wood handle. Blade length 1.9-inches.", "text": "Morakniv Wood Carving 120 Knife with Laminated Steel Blade, 1.9-Inch Generations of carpenters and wood carvers have appreciated the precision tools made by Morakniv in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. The Mora Wood Carving 120 is a small woodcarving knife with a thin, tapered blade of laminated steel. Oiled birch wood handle. Blade length 1.9-inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oOjBSleOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GATX62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 21.04}}
{"item_id": "B004GBKYJG", "title": "(1) One - Clear Ultra-PRO Baseball Cube Holder - Ultra PRO's Baseball Holder is the top of the line Protector & the best way to display & protect Baseballs. No PVC & Acid Free so it will not damage Balls or Autographs - (Baseball is not included)", "description": "Clear Ultra-PRO Baseball Cube Holder - Ultra PRO's Baseball Holder is the top of the line Protector & the best way to display & protect Baseballs. No PVC & Acid Free so it will not damage Balls or Autographs - (Baseball is not included)", "text": "(1) One - Clear Ultra-PRO Baseball Cube Holder - Ultra PRO's Baseball Holder is the top of the line Protector & the best way to display & protect Baseballs. No PVC & Acid Free so it will not damage Balls or Autographs - (Baseball is not included) Clear Ultra-PRO Baseball Cube Holder - Ultra PRO's Baseball Holder is the top of the line Protector & the best way to display & protect Baseballs. No PVC & Acid Free so it will not damage Balls or Autographs - (Baseball is not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vwQNM6V5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GBKYJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultra Pro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball"]], "price": 5.6}}
{"item_id": "B004GD765O", "title": "Kelty Trail Ridge 4 - 4 Person Tent", "description": "The Kelty Trail Ridge 4 sleeps 4 campers and uses a combination of varying pole diameters to create a singularly strong and roomy tent frame with an interior that maximizes the available useable living space. With 2 doors and 2 vestibules entry is easy and storage space is plentiful. The full coverage fly surrounds and protects the tent occupants (you). The fly even has added Fly Vents to help control condensation. The aforementioned frame is made of sturdy but light aluminum and is shockcorded for your convenience. And because it is Freestanding it is even easier to set up.2 large doors for convenient exit or entry.DAC aluminum DA-17 shockcorded poles.Lots of mesh helps keep condensation to a minimum.Freestanding design is very simple and quick to set up.Side release buckles attach fly to body for fast easy set up.Noiseless zipper pulls will be appreciated on a windy night.Post and grommet type assembly with locking pole tips for convenience.Set up is with simple and easy with all clip construction.Easy color coded clip assembly.Large mesh panels on the tent walls means great ventilation.Guyouts points on the fly help stabilize the tent in windy weather.Multiple mesh storage pockets help with overall interior organization.Gear loft included.All carry sacks and stakes included.Includes convenient flashlight loop on the ceiling.Fire retardant.Import.", "text": "Kelty Trail Ridge 4 - 4 Person Tent The Kelty Trail Ridge 4 sleeps 4 campers and uses a combination of varying pole diameters to create a singularly strong and roomy tent frame with an interior that maximizes the available useable living space. With 2 doors and 2 vestibules entry is easy and storage space is plentiful. The full coverage fly surrounds and protects the tent occupants (you). The fly even has added Fly Vents to help control condensation. The aforementioned frame is made of sturdy but light aluminum and is shockcorded for your convenience. And because it is Freestanding it is even easier to set up.2 large doors for convenient exit or entry.DAC aluminum DA-17 shockcorded poles.Lots of mesh helps keep condensation to a minimum.Freestanding design is very simple and quick to set up.Side release buckles attach fly to body for fast easy set up.Noiseless zipper pulls will be appreciated on a windy night.Post and grommet type assembly with locking pole tips for convenience.Set up is with simple and easy with all clip construction.Easy color coded clip assembly.Large mesh panels on the tent walls means great ventilation.Guyouts points on the fly help stabilize the tent in windy weather.Multiple mesh storage pockets help with overall interior organization.Gear loft included.All carry sacks and stakes included.Includes convenient flashlight loop on the ceiling.Fire retardant.Import.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qTJtJY3hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GD765O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 224.95}}
{"item_id": "B004GD7686", "title": "Kelty Trail Ridge 6", "description": "Looking for a spacious interior? The Trail Ridge incorporates a multi-diameter pole configuration that enables the walls to stay steep and aggressively arch toward the top for a much larger livable space. This ideal family tent also has two equal-sized vestibules flanking each end for easy entryexit and plenty of storage.", "text": "Kelty Trail Ridge 6 Looking for a spacious interior? The Trail Ridge incorporates a multi-diameter pole configuration that enables the walls to stay steep and aggressively arch toward the top for a much larger livable space. This ideal family tent also has two equal-sized vestibules flanking each end for easy entryexit and plenty of storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wjdl4WVXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GD7686.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 279.95}}
{"item_id": "B004GD76DG", "title": "Kelty Trail Ridge 6 Footprint", "description": "Protect the life of your tent with a durable custom sized footprint.", "text": "Kelty Trail Ridge 6 Footprint Protect the life of your tent with a durable custom sized footprint.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JNp9Q01tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GD76DG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]], "price": 40.99}}
{"item_id": "B004GECBU8", "title": "prAna Living Men's Stretch Zion 30-Inch Inseam Pant", "description": "The original. Built for climbers, the Stretch Zion Pant was quickly adopted by intrepid travelers who liked the lightweight, abrasion-resistant fabric and stealth features--a ventilated, gusseted crotch, water-resistant finish and pack-friendly weight. Dual-entry cargo pockets keep you organized on the road.", "text": "prAna Living Men's Stretch Zion 30-Inch Inseam Pant The original. Built for climbers, the Stretch Zion Pant was quickly adopted by intrepid travelers who liked the lightweight, abrasion-resistant fabric and stealth features--a ventilated, gusseted crotch, water-resistant finish and pack-friendly weight. Dual-entry cargo pockets keep you organized on the road.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UU5HXhT5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GECBU8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004GECD24", "title": "prAna Men's Chalk Bag with Belt", "description": "We threw a belt in with our Solid Chalk Bag. Enjoy.", "text": "prAna Men's Chalk Bag with Belt We threw a belt in with our Solid Chalk Bag. Enjoy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z00734y6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GECD24.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Chalk Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004GF2OVI", "title": "Petzl Zipka Improved Lumen Output Plus 2 Headlamp", "description": "ZIPKA PLUS Ultra-compact headlamp with retractable cord, 1 high-output LED, 1 red LED and five lighting modes (three continuous and two blinking) The ultra-compact ZIPKA PLUS headlamp is equipped with the ZIP retractable cord system. This feature allows the headlamp to be worn on the head or wrist, or attached to any other support, like a tent pole, a bicycle seat post, etc. This headlamp integrates two light sources for versatility: one white, high-output LED and one red LED. The white LED delivers 50 lumens in maximum mode and lights up to 35 meters. In economic mode, it can reach a burn-time of 140 hours. The red LED provides lighting to preserve night vision or to become a blinking light for increased safety, for example in an urban environment, etc. The ZIPKA PLUS can be used with lithium batteries to decrease weight or increase performance in cold weather.", "text": "Petzl Zipka Improved Lumen Output Plus 2 Headlamp ZIPKA PLUS Ultra-compact headlamp with retractable cord, 1 high-output LED, 1 red LED and five lighting modes (three continuous and two blinking) The ultra-compact ZIPKA PLUS headlamp is equipped with the ZIP retractable cord system. This feature allows the headlamp to be worn on the head or wrist, or attached to any other support, like a tent pole, a bicycle seat post, etc. This headlamp integrates two light sources for versatility: one white, high-output LED and one red LED. The white LED delivers 50 lumens in maximum mode and lights up to 35 meters. In economic mode, it can reach a burn-time of 140 hours. The red LED provides lighting to preserve night vision or to become a blinking light for increased safety, for example in an urban environment, etc. The ZIPKA PLUS can be used with lithium batteries to decrease weight or increase performance in cold weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414%2B22y6VUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GF2OVI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004GF3X5Y", "title": "Bushnell BowHunter Chuck Adams Edition 4x 20mm ARC Bow Mode Laser Rangefinder", "description": "Designed in conjunction with the bowhunting legend himself, the Bushnell Chuck Adams Edition 4x20mm archery-specific laser rangefinder excels regardless of the terrain. The rangefinder is outfitted with Bushnell's Angle Range Compensation (ARC) technology, which provides accurate readings from tree stands and steep hills. Simply hit the Fire button and it will calculate the \"shoots-like\" distance based on the angle of your shot.The rangefinder's Angle Range Compensation (ARC) adjusts the distance based on your standing position.No more having to adjust your true horizontal distance by eye when you're standing at an extreme uphill or downhill angle. The Chuck Adams Edition rangefinder also accommodates bowhunters with its Bow Mode, which simultaneously displays line-of-sight, angle, and true horizontal distances from 5 to 99 yards. And rifle hunters aren't left out, as the rangefinder also provides line-of-sight distances from 5 to 850 yards.Other features include a built-in digital inclinometer that measures angles from -90 to 90 degrees with +/- 1-degree accuracy; a pocket-sized build; 4x magnification; a rainproof housing; a built-in battery indicator; and a posi-thread battery door. The rangefinder comes with a carrying case, battery, and neck strap.How Bushnell's Laser Rangefinders WorkBushnell's laser rangefinders use an invisible, eye-safe Class 1 laser beam (as classified by the FDA), which is \"bounced\" off distant objects at the press of a button. In the process, the rangefinder uses a high-speed digital clock to measure the time it took for the laser beam to reach the target and return, and then calculates the distance within plus-or-minus 1 yard. The entire process is so fast that less than a second elapses between the time you press the button and the time the exact range appears. The information appears on the unit's through-the-lens LCD display.Because rangefinders bounce laser beams off targets in order to take measurements, their range is partially determined by the target's reflectivity. So distances to reflective or \"hard\" targets like rock cliffs and semis can be measured from farther away than those to soft-surface targets such as deer. Ranges for moderately reflective targets, like trees, fall somewhere in the middle. Most experienced hunters will use their rangefinder to estimate ranges to near and distant landmarks before they actually encounter a game animal. By pre-measuring ranges to spots where trophies are likely to appear, they can concentrate on making an accurate shot when the moment of truth arrives.SpecificationsRanging accuracy: +/- 1 yardRanging performance: 5 to 850 yardsReflective: 850 yardsTree: 600 yardsDeer: 200 yardsRAIN: Built inARC (Angle Range Compensation): YesBow mode: YesInclinometer angle range: +90 to -90 degreesInclinometer accuracy: +/- 1 degreeMagnification: 4x20Field of view: 430 feet @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 5mmEye relief: 17mmOptical coatings: MulticoatedVertical configuration: YesBattery type: 3-volt CR2 (included)Battery life indicator: YesCase, strap, and battery: IncludedTripod mount: YesDimensions: 1.4 by 2.9 by 3.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.3 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "text": "Bushnell BowHunter Chuck Adams Edition 4x 20mm ARC Bow Mode Laser Rangefinder Designed in conjunction with the bowhunting legend himself, the Bushnell Chuck Adams Edition 4x20mm archery-specific laser rangefinder excels regardless of the terrain. The rangefinder is outfitted with Bushnell's Angle Range Compensation (ARC) technology, which provides accurate readings from tree stands and steep hills. Simply hit the Fire button and it will calculate the \"shoots-like\" distance based on the angle of your shot.The rangefinder's Angle Range Compensation (ARC) adjusts the distance based on your standing position.No more having to adjust your true horizontal distance by eye when you're standing at an extreme uphill or downhill angle. The Chuck Adams Edition rangefinder also accommodates bowhunters with its Bow Mode, which simultaneously displays line-of-sight, angle, and true horizontal distances from 5 to 99 yards. And rifle hunters aren't left out, as the rangefinder also provides line-of-sight distances from 5 to 850 yards.Other features include a built-in digital inclinometer that measures angles from -90 to 90 degrees with +/- 1-degree accuracy; a pocket-sized build; 4x magnification; a rainproof housing; a built-in battery indicator; and a posi-thread battery door. The rangefinder comes with a carrying case, battery, and neck strap.How Bushnell's Laser Rangefinders WorkBushnell's laser rangefinders use an invisible, eye-safe Class 1 laser beam (as classified by the FDA), which is \"bounced\" off distant objects at the press of a button. In the process, the rangefinder uses a high-speed digital clock to measure the time it took for the laser beam to reach the target and return, and then calculates the distance within plus-or-minus 1 yard. The entire process is so fast that less than a second elapses between the time you press the button and the time the exact range appears. The information appears on the unit's through-the-lens LCD display.Because rangefinders bounce laser beams off targets in order to take measurements, their range is partially determined by the target's reflectivity. So distances to reflective or \"hard\" targets like rock cliffs and semis can be measured from farther away than those to soft-surface targets such as deer. Ranges for moderately reflective targets, like trees, fall somewhere in the middle. Most experienced hunters will use their rangefinder to estimate ranges to near and distant landmarks before they actually encounter a game animal. By pre-measuring ranges to spots where trophies are likely to appear, they can concentrate on making an accurate shot when the moment of truth arrives.SpecificationsRanging accuracy: +/- 1 yardRanging performance: 5 to 850 yardsReflective: 850 yardsTree: 600 yardsDeer: 200 yardsRAIN: Built inARC (Angle Range Compensation): YesBow mode: YesInclinometer angle range: +90 to -90 degreesInclinometer accuracy: +/- 1 degreeMagnification: 4x20Field of view: 430 feet @ 100 yardsExit pupil: 5mmEye relief: 17mmOptical coatings: MulticoatedVertical configuration: YesBattery type: 3-volt CR2 (included)Battery life indicator: YesCase, strap, and battery: IncludedTripod mount: YesDimensions: 1.4 by 2.9 by 3.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 5.3 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oOBsLGdvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GF3X5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 220.02}}
{"item_id": "B004GFDTNA", "title": "LaserLyte Laser Trainer Target", "description": "Become a crack shot without spending cash on expensive training ammo with the LaserLyte Laser Trainer Target. Designed for use with LaserLyte's popular line of laser trainers--including the original Laser Trainer, the Laser Trainer Pro, and the Laser Trainer Cartridge--the interactive Laser Trainer Target records precisely where a laser hits, helping save time, money, and ammunition. With the target, you can learn or teach such shooting skills as unsighted fire, accuracy, grouping, and trigger control. The target is also fully portable, so you can practice shooting skills almost anywhere, even from a favorite recliner.To use the Laser Trainer Target, simply aim at the target and dry fire the weapon with a LaserLyte laser trainer. The target will record the shot for later feedback, so you can concentrate on the next shot rather than the last shot--just like at the shooting range. When you're ready to see the impact, just dry fire the laser at the red \"Display\" circle on the unit's face. The target will show you the precise spot your shot would have hit with live ammo. To begin with a fresh target, aim the laser at the red \"Reset\" circle and dry fire again.The Laser Trainer Target runs on three AA batteries--good for about 6,000 shots--and can register shots up to 50 yards away. The target contains 62 laser-activated LED lights and operates without the use of a computer, TV, or projector.SpecificationsCompatible products: Laser Trainer Pro, LT-1, LT-9, LT-40, and LT-45Batteries: 3 AABattery life: 6,000 shots (LED activations)Range: Up to 50 yardsDimensions: 6.25 by 9.5 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 1 pound 4 ounces", "text": "LaserLyte Laser Trainer Target Become a crack shot without spending cash on expensive training ammo with the LaserLyte Laser Trainer Target. Designed for use with LaserLyte's popular line of laser trainers--including the original Laser Trainer, the Laser Trainer Pro, and the Laser Trainer Cartridge--the interactive Laser Trainer Target records precisely where a laser hits, helping save time, money, and ammunition. With the target, you can learn or teach such shooting skills as unsighted fire, accuracy, grouping, and trigger control. The target is also fully portable, so you can practice shooting skills almost anywhere, even from a favorite recliner.To use the Laser Trainer Target, simply aim at the target and dry fire the weapon with a LaserLyte laser trainer. The target will record the shot for later feedback, so you can concentrate on the next shot rather than the last shot--just like at the shooting range. When you're ready to see the impact, just dry fire the laser at the red \"Display\" circle on the unit's face. The target will show you the precise spot your shot would have hit with live ammo. To begin with a fresh target, aim the laser at the red \"Reset\" circle and dry fire again.The Laser Trainer Target runs on three AA batteries--good for about 6,000 shots--and can register shots up to 50 yards away. The target contains 62 laser-activated LED lights and operates without the use of a computer, TV, or projector.SpecificationsCompatible products: Laser Trainer Pro, LT-1, LT-9, LT-40, and LT-45Batteries: 3 AABattery life: 6,000 shots (LED activations)Range: Up to 50 yardsDimensions: 6.25 by 9.5 by 2 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 1 pound 4 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CRLx7gIIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GFDTNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 121.57}}
{"item_id": "B004GFK1YU", "title": "Squat Rack H.D. Adjustable Racks", "description": "This squat rack is designed to hold a weight bar safely and securely.Ideal for performing flat, incline, and decline bench presses, squats, curls, upright rows, shoulder shrugs, calf raises, and more. The bar supports are fully adjustable--from 32 to 56 inches--giving you plenty of height options depending on the exercise. In addition, the 2-by-2-inch, heavy-gauge steel frame offers an extra-wide and deep base for maximum stability. The side supports are all welded for strength. An ideal accessory for casual and serious weightlifters. NEW: 1\" weight holder bar in back for storage and stability. PLEASE NOTE THE RACK WEIGHS 51 LBS., THE SHIPPING WEIGHT LISTED BELOW IS USED ONLY FOR REALISTIC SHIPPING CHARGE CALCULATIONS. The included nuts have a built in safety washer and must be tightened using either a ratchet or adjustable wrench. Contact us for any assistance.", "text": "Squat Rack H.D. Adjustable Racks This squat rack is designed to hold a weight bar safely and securely.Ideal for performing flat, incline, and decline bench presses, squats, curls, upright rows, shoulder shrugs, calf raises, and more. The bar supports are fully adjustable--from 32 to 56 inches--giving you plenty of height options depending on the exercise. In addition, the 2-by-2-inch, heavy-gauge steel frame offers an extra-wide and deep base for maximum stability. The side supports are all welded for strength. An ideal accessory for casual and serious weightlifters. NEW: 1\" weight holder bar in back for storage and stability. PLEASE NOTE THE RACK WEIGHS 51 LBS., THE SHIPPING WEIGHT LISTED BELOW IS USED ONLY FOR REALISTIC SHIPPING CHARGE CALCULATIONS. The included nuts have a built in safety washer and must be tightened using either a ratchet or adjustable wrench. Contact us for any assistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ovy%2ByyXPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GFK1YU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Free-Weight Racks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004GGLJ8G", "title": "12\" Eagle Flight .40c Blowgun with Darts Lifetime Mfg Warranty & Made in America", "description": "12\" Aluminum .40c blowgun. Made from lightweight aircraft quality seamless tubing. Includes foam grip, Mouth and muzzle guard. High quality enamel paint. 2 accessories quivers included along with 8 target darts. Lifetime Mfg Warranty Made in USA!!!", "text": "12\" Eagle Flight .40c Blowgun with Darts Lifetime Mfg Warranty & Made in America 12\" Aluminum .40c blowgun. Made from lightweight aircraft quality seamless tubing. Includes foam grip, Mouth and muzzle guard. High quality enamel paint. 2 accessories quivers included along with 8 target darts. Lifetime Mfg Warranty Made in USA!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21T0385-nvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GGLJ8G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 7.49}}
{"item_id": "B004GHAZXU", "title": "Slumberjack Trail Tent Footprint", "description": "Slumberjack footprints extend the life of your tent’s floor by protecting it from rough or abrasive surfaces. Slumberjack footprints are fitted (slightly smaller) to match the shape of your tent floor.", "text": "Slumberjack Trail Tent Footprint Slumberjack footprints extend the life of your tent’s floor by protecting it from rough or abrasive surfaces. Slumberjack footprints are fitted (slightly smaller) to match the shape of your tent floor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ms3qxdSrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GHAZXU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]]}}
