{"item_id": "B004GHJO1O", "title": "CenterPoint Quick-Acquisition Laser Sight, Adj. for Windage & Elevation, 11mm & Weaver Rings", "description": "Zero in on your target with the CenterPoint® quick-acquisition laser sight. Rated for up to 200 yds of visibility, it includes a tactical on/off pressure switch and both Dovetail and Weaver-style mounting rings. Mount and sight within minutes!", "text": "CenterPoint Quick-Acquisition Laser Sight, Adj. for Windage & Elevation, 11mm & Weaver Rings Zero in on your target with the CenterPoint® quick-acquisition laser sight. Rated for up to 200 yds of visibility, it includes a tactical on/off pressure switch and both Dovetail and Weaver-style mounting rings. Mount and sight within minutes!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zmnspwfrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GHJO1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 25.97}}
