{"item_id": "B004GN6QV4", "title": "Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle, Twin Pack, Twin Pack, Mod Columns and Blue, 20 Ounce", "description": "Before use, wash water bottle in top rack of dishwasher or by hand with warm water and mild detergent. Unscrew cap and insert filter. Fill bottle with tap water. Screw cap with filter onto bottle and pull up on spout to open. Squeeze one full bottle of water through filter to remove black carbon dust. Refill water filter bottle and enjoy. Replace water filter every 256 refills, 2 months or 40 gallons. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. Filter replacement is essential for water filter bottle to perform as represented. Substances reduced may not be in all users’ water.Whether you’re at the gym, on your bike or on the soccer field, enjoy great-tasting water anywhere, with a Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle. The water filter, which sits inside the 20-ounce soft-sided bottle, filters as you drink. It reduces particulates as well as the taste and odor of chlorine, often found in tap water. Just fill the squeezable plastic water bottle, screw on the cap, pull up the nozzle and hydrate with cleaner water for pennies per gallon. This blue colored filter bottle is BPA-free and dishwasher safe on the top rack, making cleaning easy. For optimum performance, change the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. One filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, cutting down on plastic waste. Get great taste, less waste and more savings from Brita.", "text": "Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle, Twin Pack, Twin Pack, Mod Columns and Blue, 20 Ounce Before use, wash water bottle in top rack of dishwasher or by hand with warm water and mild detergent. Unscrew cap and insert filter. Fill bottle with tap water. Screw cap with filter onto bottle and pull up on spout to open. Squeeze one full bottle of water through filter to remove black carbon dust. Refill water filter bottle and enjoy. Replace water filter every 256 refills, 2 months or 40 gallons. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. Filter replacement is essential for water filter bottle to perform as represented. Substances reduced may not be in all users’ water.Whether you’re at the gym, on your bike or on the soccer field, enjoy great-tasting water anywhere, with a Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle. The water filter, which sits inside the 20-ounce soft-sided bottle, filters as you drink. It reduces particulates as well as the taste and odor of chlorine, often found in tap water. Just fill the squeezable plastic water bottle, screw on the cap, pull up the nozzle and hydrate with cleaner water for pennies per gallon. This blue colored filter bottle is BPA-free and dishwasher safe on the top rack, making cleaning easy. For optimum performance, change the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. One filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, cutting down on plastic waste. Get great taste, less waste and more savings from Brita.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SVWW8JNcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GN6QV4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brita", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 24.49}}
{"item_id": "B004GN8RDY", "title": "Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle, Blue, 20 Ounce", "description": "Whether you’re at the gym, on your bike or on the soccer field, enjoy great-tasting water anywhere, with a Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle. The water filter, which sits inside the 20-ounce soft-sided bottle, filters as you drink. It reduces particulates as well as the taste and odor of chlorine, often found in tap water. Just fill the squeezable plastic water bottle, screw on the cap, pull up the nozzle and hydrate with cleaner water for pennies per gallon. This blue colored filter bottle is BPA-free and dishwasher safe on the top rack, making cleaning easy. For optimum performance, change the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. One filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, cutting down on plastic waste. Get great taste, less waste and more savings from Brita.", "text": "Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle, Blue, 20 Ounce Whether you’re at the gym, on your bike or on the soccer field, enjoy great-tasting water anywhere, with a Brita Sport Water Filter Bottle. The water filter, which sits inside the 20-ounce soft-sided bottle, filters as you drink. It reduces particulates as well as the taste and odor of chlorine, often found in tap water. Just fill the squeezable plastic water bottle, screw on the cap, pull up the nozzle and hydrate with cleaner water for pennies per gallon. This blue colored filter bottle is BPA-free and dishwasher safe on the top rack, making cleaning easy. For optimum performance, change the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. When replacing the filter, look for item number 60258 35818 - the black Brita Bottle Replacement Filters. One filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, cutting down on plastic waste. Get great taste, less waste and more savings from Brita.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oyJLiwfeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GN8RDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brita", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 3.75}}
