{"item_id": "B004GY82O2", "title": "Black Diamond ATC-Sport Belay Device", "description": "A superlight belay device designed for sport cragging and gym use, the Black Diamond ATC-Sport is a simplified, single-rope version of BD's ATC-XP.", "text": "Black Diamond ATC-Sport Belay Device A superlight belay device designed for sport cragging and gym use, the Black Diamond ATC-Sport is a simplified, single-rope version of BD's ATC-XP.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XROnhV7RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GY82O2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Climbing Holds"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B004GY9SYU", "title": "Black Diamond ATC Belay Device", "description": "Often copied but never equaled, the Black Diamond ATC provides lightweight and durable belaying and rappelling performance anytime, anywhere.", "text": "Black Diamond ATC Belay Device Often copied but never equaled, the Black Diamond ATC provides lightweight and durable belaying and rappelling performance anytime, anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IqI4KcaYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GY9SYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Hardware", "Belay & Rappel Equipment", "Climbing Belay Devices"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B004GYIE5E", "title": "Elzetta Flashlight Mount for Tactical Shotgun, Remington 870, Mossberg 500, Quick Release Thumbscrew model", "description": "Elzetta ZSM-T Tactical Shotgun Flashlight Mount. (Mount Only, Flashlight Sold Separately) Attaches to barrel & magazine tube. The Elzetta ZSM-T is designed for 12-Gauge Shotguns and also comes with gauge adapters that allow the Elzetta ZSM-T to be used with 20-Gauge and .410 shotguns. Elzetta ZSM-T comes with sizing adapters giving the mount the ability to hold flashlights from 0.70 to 1.05 inches in diameter (18 to 27 mm). This includes flashlights from popular manufacturers such as InForce, Streamlight, Pelican, Laser Devices, SureFire, and of course, Elzetta Flashlights. Sizing Adapters are not required when using an Elzetta Flashlight or other 1-inch Light.The Quick-Release Thumbscrew allows flashlights to be installed and removed rapidly and without tools. A coin or other flat object may be used to tighten the Thumbscrew. ZSM-T can be mounted to either side of the shotgun to accommodate left-handed or right- handed shooters.This glass-filled polymer construction provides outstanding durability, impact resistance, scratch resistance and light weight. It also withstands high temperatures, vibration, and most chemicals.The Elzetta ZSM-T will work with Remington 870, Remington 1100, Remington 1187, Mossberg 500, Mossberg 590, Mossberg 590A1, Mossberg 835, Mossberg 930 SPX, Benelli M1, Benelli M2, Benelli M3, Benelli M4, Benelli Nova, Benelli Super Nova, Winchester Defender, and many other shotguns that have 1-3/4\" (44 mm) of free space on the magazine tube and barrel.All Elzetta products, including the ZSM-T, are designed, engineered, and manufactured in the USA using American materials, tooling, and labor.", "text": "Elzetta Flashlight Mount for Tactical Shotgun, Remington 870, Mossberg 500, Quick Release Thumbscrew model Elzetta ZSM-T Tactical Shotgun Flashlight Mount. (Mount Only, Flashlight Sold Separately) Attaches to barrel & magazine tube. The Elzetta ZSM-T is designed for 12-Gauge Shotguns and also comes with gauge adapters that allow the Elzetta ZSM-T to be used with 20-Gauge and .410 shotguns. Elzetta ZSM-T comes with sizing adapters giving the mount the ability to hold flashlights from 0.70 to 1.05 inches in diameter (18 to 27 mm). This includes flashlights from popular manufacturers such as InForce, Streamlight, Pelican, Laser Devices, SureFire, and of course, Elzetta Flashlights. Sizing Adapters are not required when using an Elzetta Flashlight or other 1-inch Light.The Quick-Release Thumbscrew allows flashlights to be installed and removed rapidly and without tools. A coin or other flat object may be used to tighten the Thumbscrew. ZSM-T can be mounted to either side of the shotgun to accommodate left-handed or right- handed shooters.This glass-filled polymer construction provides outstanding durability, impact resistance, scratch resistance and light weight. It also withstands high temperatures, vibration, and most chemicals.The Elzetta ZSM-T will work with Remington 870, Remington 1100, Remington 1187, Mossberg 500, Mossberg 590, Mossberg 590A1, Mossberg 835, Mossberg 930 SPX, Benelli M1, Benelli M2, Benelli M3, Benelli M4, Benelli Nova, Benelli Super Nova, Winchester Defender, and many other shotguns that have 1-3/4\" (44 mm) of free space on the magazine tube and barrel.All Elzetta products, including the ZSM-T, are designed, engineered, and manufactured in the USA using American materials, tooling, and labor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fnfapeQ4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GYIE5E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 46.35}}
{"item_id": "B004GYUH7M", "title": "Rothco 100-Feet Neon Nylon Paracord (550-Pound)", "description": "Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "Rothco 100-Feet Neon Nylon Paracord (550-Pound) Rothco's Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 5/32\" in diameter and has a 7 strand core. It made by a certified US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413dkz288cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GYUH7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 7.7}}
{"item_id": "B004GYWO6E", "title": "Hennessy Hammock EXPEDITION ASYM Zip Tent Model with Zipper", "description": "This is the most popular Hennessy model with patented features including mesh pocket on ridgeline and webbing straps to protect the bark of trees. Asymmetrical shape and 30% larger rainfly than the Scout model. New 70D catenary cut rainfly to reduce weight and wrinkles. This is an all-purpose hammock - great for backpacking, family camping, expeditions, kayaking, motorcycling, and any other purpose which requires comfort and durability at an affordable price. Height limit: 6' tall / 180 cm Weight limit: 250 lbs / 115 kg Packed Weight: 2 lbs 9 oz / 1160 g Packed Size: 4\" x 7\" x 9\" Hammock fabric: 210 D oxford nylon Hammock dimensions: 100\" x 52\"' (diagonal) Mesh: 30D polyester No-See-Um netting Suspending ropes: 10' long 1600 lb. test polyester rope Webbing straps: 1.5\" x 42\" long black polyester Rainfly weight: 10 oz / 280 g Rainfly fabric: 70D polyurethane coated polyester ripstop Rainfly dimensions: Parallelogram 63\" X 99\" / 160cm X 252cm Diagonal length above ridgeline 132\" / 335cm Color: Hunter green hammock with hunter green fly and black trim Stuff Sack: Logo and set up instructions printed on ripstop polyester bag (18 g., 5/8 oz.) What's Included: All Hennessy Hammocks come complete with attached mosquito netting, detachable rain fly, support ropes, and stuff sack with set up instructions on back. Hennessy Hammock also provides complimentary standard 42\" long \"Tree Hugger\" webbing straps to protect the bark of trees. Because these accessory webbing straps are complimentary, they are weighed separately from the hammock.", "text": "Hennessy Hammock EXPEDITION ASYM Zip Tent Model with Zipper This is the most popular Hennessy model with patented features including mesh pocket on ridgeline and webbing straps to protect the bark of trees. Asymmetrical shape and 30% larger rainfly than the Scout model. New 70D catenary cut rainfly to reduce weight and wrinkles. This is an all-purpose hammock - great for backpacking, family camping, expeditions, kayaking, motorcycling, and any other purpose which requires comfort and durability at an affordable price. Height limit: 6' tall / 180 cm Weight limit: 250 lbs / 115 kg Packed Weight: 2 lbs 9 oz / 1160 g Packed Size: 4\" x 7\" x 9\" Hammock fabric: 210 D oxford nylon Hammock dimensions: 100\" x 52\"' (diagonal) Mesh: 30D polyester No-See-Um netting Suspending ropes: 10' long 1600 lb. test polyester rope Webbing straps: 1.5\" x 42\" long black polyester Rainfly weight: 10 oz / 280 g Rainfly fabric: 70D polyurethane coated polyester ripstop Rainfly dimensions: Parallelogram 63\" X 99\" / 160cm X 252cm Diagonal length above ridgeline 132\" / 335cm Color: Hunter green hammock with hunter green fly and black trim Stuff Sack: Logo and set up instructions printed on ripstop polyester bag (18 g., 5/8 oz.) What's Included: All Hennessy Hammocks come complete with attached mosquito netting, detachable rain fly, support ropes, and stuff sack with set up instructions on back. Hennessy Hammock also provides complimentary standard 42\" long \"Tree Hugger\" webbing straps to protect the bark of trees. Because these accessory webbing straps are complimentary, they are weighed separately from the hammock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kCIEteiML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GYWO6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hennessy Hammocks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 152.96}}
{"item_id": "B004GYYY1W", "title": "Malone Clipper Deluxe Universal Kayak Cart", "description": "The Malone Clipper™ Deluxe Universal Cart is designed for canoe and kayak ground transportation. The folding anodized aluminum frame resists corrosion and disassembles to fit into your kayak. The rugged 10” airless \"Never Go Flat\" tires are built for all ground surfaces and quickly pop off the frame for easy storage. When loading, the oversized padding on the frame protects the boat, while the locking kick stand keeps the cart steady. This cart has a 200 pound capacity and includes tie down straps.", "text": "Malone Clipper Deluxe Universal Kayak Cart The Malone Clipper™ Deluxe Universal Cart is designed for canoe and kayak ground transportation. The folding anodized aluminum frame resists corrosion and disassembles to fit into your kayak. The rugged 10” airless \"Never Go Flat\" tires are built for all ground surfaces and quickly pop off the frame for easy storage. When loading, the oversized padding on the frame protects the boat, while the locking kick stand keeps the cart steady. This cart has a 200 pound capacity and includes tie down straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MEDqmr1ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GYYY1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone Auto Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 89.95}}
