{"item_id": "B004GZ96VO", "title": "Acorn Velcro Pistol Holsters - 5 pack", "description": "This package of five pistol holsters attach with velcro to the carpeted interior of your safe to keep your handguns neatly organized. They hold most handguns and work on carpeting that will hold velcro.", "text": "Acorn Velcro Pistol Holsters - 5 pack This package of five pistol holsters attach with velcro to the carpeted interior of your safe to keep your handguns neatly organized. They hold most handguns and work on carpeting that will hold velcro.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bNStu9TOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004GZ96VO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B004H0E8OI", "title": "Kershaw Folding Blur Knife with Speed Safe Handle", "description": "The Kershaw 1670HC Folding Blur Knife offers cutting-edge performance combined with stowable convenience. The silver 3-3/8 inch 420HC steel blade easily folds into the black 6061-T6 anodized aluminum handle so you can safely stick it in your pocket or pack. Trac-Tec inserts provide a safe and confident grip on this ambidextrous knife while the reversible and removable pocket clip ensures a secure carry. The 1670HC is equipped with Speed Safe, a patented system that allows the user to smoothly open the knife with a manual push on the blade’s thumb stud or blade protrusion and then lock the blade into position, ready for use.Features and Specifications:Knife Type: FoldingBlade: Silver 3-3/8 inch, 420HC steel bladHandle: Black 6061-T6 anodized aluminum with Trac-Tec insertsOpening: AmbidextrousPocket Clip: Reversible and removablePatented Speed Safe system allows user to smoothly and easily open the knife and lock it into positionAbout KershawLegendary for arriving \"shaving sharp,\" Kershaw products are internationally renowned for superior style, smooth action, and durability. Often used as hunting knives, their functionality also extends to the pocket and kitchen. Kershaw offers a variety of folding knives featuring Ken Onion's patented Speed Safe mechanism that incorporates torsion bar technology for assisted opening.", "text": "Kershaw Folding Blur Knife with Speed Safe Handle The Kershaw 1670HC Folding Blur Knife offers cutting-edge performance combined with stowable convenience. The silver 3-3/8 inch 420HC steel blade easily folds into the black 6061-T6 anodized aluminum handle so you can safely stick it in your pocket or pack. Trac-Tec inserts provide a safe and confident grip on this ambidextrous knife while the reversible and removable pocket clip ensures a secure carry. The 1670HC is equipped with Speed Safe, a patented system that allows the user to smoothly open the knife with a manual push on the blade’s thumb stud or blade protrusion and then lock the blade into position, ready for use.Features and Specifications:Knife Type: FoldingBlade: Silver 3-3/8 inch, 420HC steel bladHandle: Black 6061-T6 anodized aluminum with Trac-Tec insertsOpening: AmbidextrousPocket Clip: Reversible and removablePatented Speed Safe system allows user to smoothly and easily open the knife and lock it into positionAbout KershawLegendary for arriving \"shaving sharp,\" Kershaw products are internationally renowned for superior style, smooth action, and durability. Often used as hunting knives, their functionality also extends to the pocket and kitchen. Kershaw offers a variety of folding knives featuring Ken Onion's patented Speed Safe mechanism that incorporates torsion bar technology for assisted opening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411tEfffe0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H0E8OI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004H0LJEK", "title": "S&W M&P Action Enhancement Components Duty/Carry Kit, 9mm/.40 S&W/.357 Sig", "description": "Apex Tactical Specialties Action Enhancement Kit S&W; M&P; 9/40 Trigger Duty Carry Enhancement Kit DCAEK", "text": "S&W M&P Action Enhancement Components Duty/Carry Kit, 9mm/.40 S&W/.357 Sig Apex Tactical Specialties Action Enhancement Kit S&W; M&P; 9/40 Trigger Duty Carry Enhancement Kit DCAEK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FJuTO1eYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H0LJEK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex Tactical Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 79.48}}
{"item_id": "B004H0MZ02", "title": "Gore Men's Power 2.0 Bibtights Short+", "description": "You can call these bib tights The Classic. These short cycling bibtights feature an airy mesh back for a snug fit and ventilation. Best for medium to long routes.", "text": "Gore Men's Power 2.0 Bibtights Short+ You can call these bib tights The Classic. These short cycling bibtights feature an airy mesh back for a snug fit and ventilation. Best for medium to long routes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IhdQ6O0IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H0MZ02.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B004H2TEU4", "title": "Outdoor Products H20 Performance Hydration Pack", "description": "This low profile hydration pack is a great choice for riders and trail runners who need an efficient way to replenish fluids.", "text": "Outdoor Products H20 Performance Hydration Pack This low profile hydration pack is a great choice for riders and trail runners who need an efficient way to replenish fluids.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mqYdpUaaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H2TEU4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004H4V6GC", "title": "Chamois Butt'r 8 fl.oz", "description": "We've been told we don't embarrass easily, especially when it comes to cycling-related habits. We shave our legs religiously, wear more spandex than a gymnast, and don't usually think twice about a quick nature break alongside a busy road. However, we've heard stories of friends who were too embarrassed to walk into their local bike shop and buy a tub of chamois creme, comparing it to buying a dirty magazine from their local convenience store. It's really too bad, because Paceline's Chamois Butt'r Creme worth whatever perceived embarrassment it may cause.Chamois Butt'r is made from all natural ingredients with no perfumes or dyes. Its creamy texture reduces friction and fights bacteria that can lead to saddle sores. Chamois Butt'r also provides a cooling sensation, but unlike the Eurostyle Chamois Butt'r, it won't give you the distinctive tingling sensation. If basic, no-nonsense chamois creme is your preference, then Chamois Butt'r fits the bill nicely.Paceline Products Chamois Butt'r Creme comes in 4 ounce tubes or an 8 ounce jar.", "text": "Chamois Butt'r 8 fl.oz We've been told we don't embarrass easily, especially when it comes to cycling-related habits. We shave our legs religiously, wear more spandex than a gymnast, and don't usually think twice about a quick nature break alongside a busy road. However, we've heard stories of friends who were too embarrassed to walk into their local bike shop and buy a tub of chamois creme, comparing it to buying a dirty magazine from their local convenience store. It's really too bad, because Paceline's Chamois Butt'r Creme worth whatever perceived embarrassment it may cause.Chamois Butt'r is made from all natural ingredients with no perfumes or dyes. Its creamy texture reduces friction and fights bacteria that can lead to saddle sores. Chamois Butt'r also provides a cooling sensation, but unlike the Eurostyle Chamois Butt'r, it won't give you the distinctive tingling sensation. If basic, no-nonsense chamois creme is your preference, then Chamois Butt'r fits the bill nicely.Paceline Products Chamois Butt'r Creme comes in 4 ounce tubes or an 8 ounce jar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TEpTKCYtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H4V6GC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PACELINE PRODUCTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Personal Care Products"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B004H4VSI8", "title": "IRONMAN HIGH CAPACITY GRAVITY 3000 INVERSION TABLE", "description": "Whether you want to reduce back stress or fatigue or increase your blood circulation, theIronman High Capacity Gravity 3000 Inversion Tablemakes a great household addition. The inversion table contributes to your body's overall health by optimizing lumbar traction, thereby relieving pressure on your vertebrae discs and ligaments. And when your back starts to relax, the rest of your body follows. The table can also help with such areas as increasing body flexibility for improved athletic performance, reducing the effects of aging due to gravity, and relieving lower backaches due to sitting or standing.The table's memory foam backrest keeps you comfortable during inversion.The inversion table is built with stability, safety, and comfort in mind. The table features a durable tubular steel frame treated with a scratch-resistant powder-coat finish. The table's memory-foam-covered backrest, meanwhile, keeps your head and back comfortable while you invert. To use the table, simply rest your body against the backrest, slip your feet into the ergonomically molded ankle holders, and reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body gradually inverts to a fully 180 degrees, helping stimulate your blood circulation and relax the entire body. And when you're ready to return to the upright position, simply grab the extra-long foam-covered safety handles and pull yourself over.Other features include tough nonskid rubber floor stabilizers; an easily adjustable safety tether strap that controls the maximum inversion angle; an easy-reach palm-activated adjusting ratchet ankle locking system; and safety vinyl side covers to protect hands and fingers. When not in use, the table folds into a compact footprint and stores in a corner or closet. This inversion table supports up to 350 pounds and fits users as tall as 6 feet 6 inches. The table measures 26 by 80 by 17 inches (W x H x D) fully assembled and weighs 75 pounds.About Ironman FitnessEngineered for endurance, strength, speed, stamina, and performance, Ironman Fitness is continually striving to define the fitness industry. Their collection features top-of-the-line treadmills, stationary cycles, elliptical trainers, weight benches, and single- and multi-station exercise machines. The features on Ironman's fitness equipment introduced over the years have become the standards of today. With superior components, multiple patents, and award-winning products, Ironman's fitness products have consistently exceeded the expectation of customers and are the heart of a true champion.Construction Features:Extra wide tubular steel frame for additional weight supportFoam Padded Backrest provides for extra comfort and paddingFoam covered, extra long safety handlesTough rubber non-skid floor stabilizers to prevent any movement during inversion2.5-inch foam covered backrest with double stitchingErgonomically molded ankle cushions hold ankles securely and comfortablyInfrared Heat Therapy Inversion Table will invert up to 90 degreesSupports up to 350 poundsThree adjustments for different starting inversion anglesFolds for storageHeight adjustment up to 6'6\"Easily adjustable safety tether strap controls the maximum angle of inversionPatented Ratchet System provides for each lock/unlock of the anklesScratch resistant powder coated finishSafety vinyl side covers to protect hands and fingersAssembled Dimensions: 49 inches long by 26 inches wide by 65 inches tallFolded Dimensions: 80 inches tall by 26 inches wide by 17 inches deepProduct Weight: 67 pounds", "text": "IRONMAN HIGH CAPACITY GRAVITY 3000 INVERSION TABLE Whether you want to reduce back stress or fatigue or increase your blood circulation, theIronman High Capacity Gravity 3000 Inversion Tablemakes a great household addition. The inversion table contributes to your body's overall health by optimizing lumbar traction, thereby relieving pressure on your vertebrae discs and ligaments. And when your back starts to relax, the rest of your body follows. The table can also help with such areas as increasing body flexibility for improved athletic performance, reducing the effects of aging due to gravity, and relieving lower backaches due to sitting or standing.The table's memory foam backrest keeps you comfortable during inversion.The inversion table is built with stability, safety, and comfort in mind. The table features a durable tubular steel frame treated with a scratch-resistant powder-coat finish. The table's memory-foam-covered backrest, meanwhile, keeps your head and back comfortable while you invert. To use the table, simply rest your body against the backrest, slip your feet into the ergonomically molded ankle holders, and reach your arms over your head. As your arms go up, your body gradually inverts to a fully 180 degrees, helping stimulate your blood circulation and relax the entire body. And when you're ready to return to the upright position, simply grab the extra-long foam-covered safety handles and pull yourself over.Other features include tough nonskid rubber floor stabilizers; an easily adjustable safety tether strap that controls the maximum inversion angle; an easy-reach palm-activated adjusting ratchet ankle locking system; and safety vinyl side covers to protect hands and fingers. When not in use, the table folds into a compact footprint and stores in a corner or closet. This inversion table supports up to 350 pounds and fits users as tall as 6 feet 6 inches. The table measures 26 by 80 by 17 inches (W x H x D) fully assembled and weighs 75 pounds.About Ironman FitnessEngineered for endurance, strength, speed, stamina, and performance, Ironman Fitness is continually striving to define the fitness industry. Their collection features top-of-the-line treadmills, stationary cycles, elliptical trainers, weight benches, and single- and multi-station exercise machines. The features on Ironman's fitness equipment introduced over the years have become the standards of today. With superior components, multiple patents, and award-winning products, Ironman's fitness products have consistently exceeded the expectation of customers and are the heart of a true champion.Construction Features:Extra wide tubular steel frame for additional weight supportFoam Padded Backrest provides for extra comfort and paddingFoam covered, extra long safety handlesTough rubber non-skid floor stabilizers to prevent any movement during inversion2.5-inch foam covered backrest with double stitchingErgonomically molded ankle cushions hold ankles securely and comfortablyInfrared Heat Therapy Inversion Table will invert up to 90 degreesSupports up to 350 poundsThree adjustments for different starting inversion anglesFolds for storageHeight adjustment up to 6'6\"Easily adjustable safety tether strap controls the maximum angle of inversionPatented Ratchet System provides for each lock/unlock of the anklesScratch resistant powder coated finishSafety vinyl side covers to protect hands and fingersAssembled Dimensions: 49 inches long by 26 inches wide by 65 inches tallFolded Dimensions: 80 inches tall by 26 inches wide by 17 inches deepProduct Weight: 67 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vfcswDZQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H4VSI8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IronMan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 239.8}}
{"item_id": "B004H4WW9W", "title": "Cuisinart CGG-180 Petit Gourmet Portable Gas Grill with VersaStand", "description": "", "text": "Cuisinart CGG-180 Petit Gourmet Portable Gas Grill with VersaStand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k0Ic1Gv1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H4WW9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cuisinart", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 144.95}}
{"item_id": "B004H58JIE", "title": "CDM MOD-C - Shotgun Flashlight Mount", "description": "The Patent Pending Multi-Optional Design Clamp is finally available again in a new design and fits the new Surefire G2X and the Surefire G2 ( 1.025\" diameter) and included spacer to fit 1'' diameter lights. This superior, light weight clamp is small and compact enough to reduce your shotgun profile so it reduces hang ups and snags. The light mount has been moved out a bit for even better light control. Steel threaded inserts means no stripped threads when tightening the clamp down. There is only one screw to tighten and you never have to remove a rail or sling swivel dock to remove the clamp. All tools are now included. Weighs 1.7oz.", "text": "CDM MOD-C - Shotgun Flashlight Mount The Patent Pending Multi-Optional Design Clamp is finally available again in a new design and fits the new Surefire G2X and the Surefire G2 ( 1.025\" diameter) and included spacer to fit 1'' diameter lights. This superior, light weight clamp is small and compact enough to reduce your shotgun profile so it reduces hang ups and snags. The light mount has been moved out a bit for even better light control. Steel threaded inserts means no stripped threads when tightening the clamp down. There is only one screw to tighten and you never have to remove a rail or sling swivel dock to remove the clamp. All tools are now included. Weighs 1.7oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gW4SIlI2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H58JIE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 56.95}}
{"item_id": "B004H5CMNW", "title": "CDM Gear BMT with 3 slot rail - Shotgun Flashlight Mount", "description": "The Barrel -Magazine Tube clamp is finally available again in a new design and fit. This stylish, light weight clamp is small and compact enough to reduce your shotgun profile so it reduces hang ups and snags, yet allows the mounting of scope rails at optimal locations. Steel threaded inserts means no stripped threads when tightening the clamp down. There is only one screw to tighten and you never have to remove a rail or sling swivel dock to remove the clamp. All tools are now included. Weighs 1.0oz (a standard Remington clamp weighs 1.3oz.)", "text": "CDM Gear BMT with 3 slot rail - Shotgun Flashlight Mount The Barrel -Magazine Tube clamp is finally available again in a new design and fit. This stylish, light weight clamp is small and compact enough to reduce your shotgun profile so it reduces hang ups and snags, yet allows the mounting of scope rails at optimal locations. Steel threaded inserts means no stripped threads when tightening the clamp down. There is only one screw to tighten and you never have to remove a rail or sling swivel dock to remove the clamp. All tools are now included. Weighs 1.0oz (a standard Remington clamp weighs 1.3oz.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hV5t5-GNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H5CMNW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 56.95}}
