lothes With White Color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a6WgZQRAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H7Z962.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Angelbeauty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Towels"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B004H81BM2", "title": "AngelBeauty© Microfiber Non Skid Yoga Towel with Carry Bag (24\"X72\", Purple)", "description": "This is A Premium non skid Super Sized Yoga Towel, 21in by 53in, With the Microfiber Which Strongly Absorb Water or Sweat Five Times or More Than Regular Cotton One. The color from the pictures might looks slight different from the actual item since the light reflection. Friendly Reminder: Laundry Separately At the First Time, Especially For Other Clothes With White Color.", "text": "AngelBeauty© Microfiber Non Skid Yoga Towel with Carry Bag (24\"X72\", Purple) This is A Premium non skid Super Sized Yoga Towel, 21in by 53in, With the Microfiber Which Strongly Absorb Water or Sweat Five Times or More Than Regular Cotton One. The color from the pictures might looks slight different from the actual item since the light reflection. Friendly Reminder: Laundry Separately At the First Time, Especially For Other Clothes With White Color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514zyGC6-6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H81BM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Angelbeauty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Towels"]], "price": 14.49}}
