{"item_id": "B004H87PKY", "title": "Nalgene Mini-Grip Glow Green Water Bottle (12-Ounce)", "description": "Nalgene's 12-Ounce Glow in the dark green water bottle is made from high quality materials. It's size makes it suitable for all ages. Use the bottle where there is light for sometime and you can see it glow in the dark.", "text": "Nalgene Mini-Grip Glow Green Water Bottle (12-Ounce) Nalgene's 12-Ounce Glow in the dark green water bottle is made from high quality materials. It's size makes it suitable for all ages. Use the bottle where there is light for sometime and you can see it glow in the dark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PlG-lq6hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H87PKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 7.69}}
