{"item_id": "B004H9DO4Y", "title": "Cold Steel 80PGTK GI Tanto 7\" Carbon", "description": "The Cold Steel GI Tanto is a no-nonsense tactical knife designed for practical uses--from camping and hunting, to any day-to-day use where a strong and sharp blade is called for. The knife features a broad, seven-inch Tanto blade of 1055 carbon steel with a hard spring temper that has been ground to a razor sharp edge and point. The blade is protected with a black, rust resistant finish that adds to the knife's under-cover look. With an integral quillon guard and polypropylene handle scales, the GI Tanto offers a heavy and balanced feel in the hand. The knife can be thrown easily by the blade or the handle and also can be converted into a spear or war club by removing the handle scales and lashing the blade securely to a wooden shaft. Coming equipped with a sturdy Secure-Ex sheath, the GI Tanto from Cold Steel provides a razor sharp edge in a simple package.Specifications:Blade Length: 7 inchesHandle Length: 5 inchesOverall Length: 12 inchesBlade Thickness: 4 millimetersBlade Steel: 1055 Carbon", "text": "Cold Steel 80PGTK GI Tanto 7\" Carbon The Cold Steel GI Tanto is a no-nonsense tactical knife designed for practical uses--from camping and hunting, to any day-to-day use where a strong and sharp blade is called for. The knife features a broad, seven-inch Tanto blade of 1055 carbon steel with a hard spring temper that has been ground to a razor sharp edge and point. The blade is protected with a black, rust resistant finish that adds to the knife's under-cover look. With an integral quillon guard and polypropylene handle scales, the GI Tanto offers a heavy and balanced feel in the hand. The knife can be thrown easily by the blade or the handle and also can be converted into a spear or war club by removing the handle scales and lashing the blade securely to a wooden shaft. Coming equipped with a sturdy Secure-Ex sheath, the GI Tanto from Cold Steel provides a razor sharp edge in a simple package.Specifications:Blade Length: 7 inchesHandle Length: 5 inchesOverall Length: 12 inchesBlade Thickness: 4 millimetersBlade Steel: 1055 Carbon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YsjhFOvML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H9DO4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 28.49}}
{"item_id": "B004H9J6YQ", "title": "Mares Cruise Backpack Mesh Elite Bag", "description": "Mesh backpack with plenty of room for your gear. Folds into itself for compact storage.", "text": "Mares Cruise Backpack Mesh Elite Bag Mesh backpack with plenty of room for your gear. Folds into itself for compact storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s6c5LaydL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H9J6YQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mares", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Roller Bags"]], "price": 35.73}}
{"item_id": "B004H9N0YI", "title": "Harbor Freight Tools 8\" Hunting/Survival Knife", "description": "This sharp hunting knife includes a survival kit conveniently stored in the handle This survival knife is the ideal tool - Visit Harbor Freight Tools For More Information.", "text": "Harbor Freight Tools 8\" Hunting/Survival Knife This sharp hunting knife includes a survival kit conveniently stored in the handle This survival knife is the ideal tool - Visit Harbor Freight Tools For More Information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q6E2JwxGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004H9N0YI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harbor Freight Tools", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B004HC9X96", "title": "DeSantis Nemesis Sig P238 Ambidextrous Black", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "text": "DeSantis Nemesis Sig P238 Ambidextrous Black This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. It is so sticky it's almost like fly paper. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw, and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iFVA8EftL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HC9X96.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.75}}
{"item_id": "B004HCEKBW", "title": "LaserLyte Subcompact V3 Laser", "description": "Subcompact V3 laser by LaserLyte is the company's most state-of-the-art, smallest and versatile rail mounted laser to date. Now half the size of the previous model, the Subcompact V3 needs less than ¾-inch of Picatinny rail space to easily mount onto even the smallest firearms. Constructed of T6 aluminum for extra strength and durability, this updated unit offers a smart, cost-effective auto-off feature. If left on for five minutes, the unit begins to display a unique flash for one minute, indicating to the user that the unit will automatically shut off soon. After one minute in flash mode the unit shuts itself off to extend battery life, prevent accidental activation and battery depletion. Press the unit's button at any time to reset this feature for five more minutes. The Subcompact V3 easily mounts with a hex drive crossbar screw and features windage adjustment, elevation adjustment and programmable constant on and pulse modes. Additionally, the unit is ideal for left- and -right handed shooters with two separate activation buttons located on the backside of the laser. Not only will the laser fit nicely on the smallest of sub-compact railed pistols, it works great on modern rifles as well. The Subcompact V3 laser is powered by four 377 batteries that provide five hours in constant on mode and ten hours in pulse mode of normal usage. Normal usage is defined as one minute on and one minute off. This test mimics actual usage where the unit is turned on and off and the battery is given time to automatically regenerate.Manufacturer Instructions:For sighting issues on your FSL-3 laser, we recommend our Reset Process. It is as follows:1. Remove the laser from the firearm and flip the side panel with the crossbar up and away from the laser body – this will allow you to see directly into the windage screw housing that is located beneath this side clamp. 2. Back-out BOTH adjustment screws until you can see the first 2 threads of each. 3. Let laser sit for 10 minutes at room temperature (68°F/20°C). 4. If the laser is pointing up and to the left, proceed to make adjustments. If after 20 minutes, the laser is not pointing up and to the left, call customer service. 5. Align front and rear sights by shining laser dot 21 feet (recommended) away, in a safe direction. – This may take up to 16 full turns as the screw has to travel through the laser’s housing. 6. FIRST use windage screw to adjust laser dot ½ inch to the left of front sight. 7. SECOND use elevation screw to adjust laser dot ½ inch above front sight. 8. THIRD make adjustments alternating windage and elevation using ¼ turn increments until the laser is sighted in. Final adjustment needs to be in a clockwise motion, this is important as it locks the laser in place.", "text": "LaserLyte Subcompact V3 Laser Subcompact V3 laser by LaserLyte is the company's most state-of-the-art, smallest and versatile rail mounted laser to date. Now half the size of the previous model, the Subcompact V3 needs less than ¾-inch of Picatinny rail space to easily mount onto even the smallest firearms. Constructed of T6 aluminum for extra strength and durability, this updated unit offers a smart, cost-effective auto-off feature. If left on for five minutes, the unit begins to display a unique flash for one minute, indicating to the user that the unit will automatically shut off soon. After one minute in flash mode the unit shuts itself off to extend battery life, prevent accidental activation and battery depletion. Press the unit's button at any time to reset this feature for five more minutes. The Subcompact V3 easily mounts with a hex drive crossbar screw and features windage adjustment, elevation adjustment and programmable constant on and pulse modes. Additionally, the unit is ideal for left- and -right handed shooters with two separate activation buttons located on the backside of the laser. Not only will the laser fit nicely on the smallest of sub-compact railed pistols, it works great on modern rifles as well. The Subcompact V3 laser is powered by four 377 batteries that provide five hours in constant on mode and ten hours in pulse mode of normal usage. Normal usage is defined as one minute on and one minute off. This test mimics actual usage where the unit is turned on and off and the battery is given time to automatically regenerate.Manufacturer Instructions:For sighting issues on your FSL-3 laser, we recommend our Reset Process. It is as follows:1. Remove the laser from the firearm and flip the side panel with the crossbar up and away from the laser body – this will allow you to see directly into the windage screw housing that is located beneath this side clamp. 2. Back-out BOTH adjustment screws until you can see the first 2 threads of each. 3. Let laser sit for 10 minutes at room temperature (68°F/20°C). 4. If the laser is pointing up and to the left, proceed to make adjustments. If after 20 minutes, the laser is not pointing up and to the left, call customer service. 5. Align front and rear sights by shining laser dot 21 feet (recommended) away, in a safe direction. – This may take up to 16 full turns as the screw has to travel through the laser’s housing. 6. FIRST use windage screw to adjust laser dot ½ inch to the left of front sight. 7. SECOND use elevation screw to adjust laser dot ½ inch above front sight. 8. THIRD make adjustments alternating windage and elevation using ¼ turn increments until the laser is sighted in. Final adjustment needs to be in a clockwise motion, this is important as it locks the laser in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fu5uomuCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HCEKBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 94.87}}
{"item_id": "B004HCMMJ4", "title": "Bell Wo Light Set", "description": "Illuminate the road ahead -- and let those cars know where you are -- with super-bright Wo LED bike lights, from leading bicycle accessory maker Bell. Advanced LEDs are remarkably bright, yet compact in size, and a sculpted lens amplifies advanced brightness. The headlight has a convenient \"Click-It\" on/off and mode switch button, and you can expect up to 70 hours of bulb life on steady mode, and 140 hours on flash.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell Wo Light Set Illuminate the road ahead -- and let those cars know where you are -- with super-bright Wo LED bike lights, from leading bicycle accessory maker Bell. Advanced LEDs are remarkably bright, yet compact in size, and a sculpted lens amplifies advanced brightness. The headlight has a convenient \"Click-It\" on/off and mode switch button, and you can expect up to 70 hours of bulb life on steady mode, and 140 hours on flash.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O9dBP%2BUvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HCMMJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B004HE204E", "title": "ProSource Set of 3 XTREME Stackable Heavy Duty Premium Latex Resistance Exercise Bands", "description": "Interested in incorporating resistance bands into your workout but turned off by the low resistance levels? Turn to this set of three heavy-duty Xtreme stackable resistance bands, which offer a combined 105 pounds of resistance. Ideal for use with P90X, Insanity, and other high-resistance workouts, ProSource Xtreme resistance bands add serious intensity to your back, chest, arms, and ab workouts. Each band color offers a different challenge: the purple band provides 25 to 30 pounds of resistance, the navy band offers 30 to 35 pounds, and the brown band delivers 35 to 40 pounds. Just select the right band or bands for your fitness level and get to work.The bands are made from the highest-quality latex rubber, so they'll hold up to serious strain. They also include cushioned foam handles to ensure a secure, comfortable grip, along with a convenient door anchor that lets you do your exercises anywhere in the house. And because each 48-inch band comes with a pair of high-quality metal carabineers, you can combine the bands to create even more tension. You can even bring the bands on the road, as they're light and small enough to fit in any luggage.Resistance bands make great alternatives to free weights and workout machines, but are also ideal for all types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees. This set of Xtreme resistance bands also comes with an exercise manual and carrying case.", "text": "ProSource Set of 3 XTREME Stackable Heavy Duty Premium Latex Resistance Exercise Bands Interested in incorporating resistance bands into your workout but turned off by the low resistance levels? Turn to this set of three heavy-duty Xtreme stackable resistance bands, which offer a combined 105 pounds of resistance. Ideal for use with P90X, Insanity, and other high-resistance workouts, ProSource Xtreme resistance bands add serious intensity to your back, chest, arms, and ab workouts. Each band color offers a different challenge: the purple band provides 25 to 30 pounds of resistance, the navy band offers 30 to 35 pounds, and the brown band delivers 35 to 40 pounds. Just select the right band or bands for your fitness level and get to work.The bands are made from the highest-quality latex rubber, so they'll hold up to serious strain. They also include cushioned foam handles to ensure a secure, comfortable grip, along with a convenient door anchor that lets you do your exercises anywhere in the house. And because each 48-inch band comes with a pair of high-quality metal carabineers, you can combine the bands to create even more tension. You can even bring the bands on the road, as they're light and small enough to fit in any luggage.Resistance bands make great alternatives to free weights and workout machines, but are also ideal for all types of physical therapy, including rehabbing torn rotator cuffs, bad elbows, and damaged knees. This set of Xtreme resistance bands also comes with an exercise manual and carrying case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oU6DjurZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HE204E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B004HE439Y", "title": "9MM LUGER RELOADING BRASS 1000 CASINGS LOT # 22713", "description": "THIS ITEM CONSIST OF 9MM, 1000 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE COULD BE LESS THEN .1% OF 380'S OR MAKAROV CASINGS IF ANY MIXED IN WITH ANY 9MM'S SOLD. PLEASE DO NOT BID IF THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "text": "9MM LUGER RELOADING BRASS 1000 CASINGS LOT # 22713 THIS ITEM CONSIST OF 9MM, 1000 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE COULD BE LESS THEN .1% OF 380'S OR MAKAROV CASINGS IF ANY MIXED IN WITH ANY 9MM'S SOLD. PLEASE DO NOT BID IF THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YrsiRE-%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HE439Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
