{"item_id": "B004HHC0BY", "title": "ProImpact Treadmill Mat", "description": "ProImpact treadmill mats are the same high impact professional grade material used in health clubs and by professional sports teams. Made in the USA from rescued tires, these mats are “Super Green” and will not compress, indent or curl like foam mats. This size mat is made for today’s treadmills and other exercise equipment.", "text": "ProImpact Treadmill Mat ProImpact treadmill mats are the same high impact professional grade material used in health clubs and by professional sports teams. Made in the USA from rescued tires, these mats are “Super Green” and will not compress, indent or curl like foam mats. This size mat is made for today’s treadmills and other exercise equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VyDNzpmvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HHC0BY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HHNNNI", "title": "Sugoi Men's Neo Pro Short", "description": "Incredible fit and function at an affordable price. 6 panel contour. Soft waistband elastic and signature grip leg elastic to keep the short properly positioned.", "text": "Sugoi Men's Neo Pro Short Incredible fit and function at an affordable price. 6 panel contour. Soft waistband elastic and signature grip leg elastic to keep the short properly positioned.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jk%2BysrynL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HHNNNI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HHYQH0", "title": "Kelty Salida 2 - Tent Footprint", "description": "The Kelty Salida 2 Fitted nylon footprint protects the floor from rips and holes while keeping the tent bottom clean and dry. Attaches to the tent poles via grommets. Made from a 2.3 oz. 70D nylon with a polyurethane 1800mm coating. Weight: 7.5 oz.Import..", "text": "Kelty Salida 2 - Tent Footprint The Kelty Salida 2 Fitted nylon footprint protects the floor from rips and holes while keeping the tent bottom clean and dry. Attaches to the tent poles via grommets. Made from a 2.3 oz. 70D nylon with a polyurethane 1800mm coating. Weight: 7.5 oz.Import..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41slAKzUuGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HHYQH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B004HICPB8", "title": "UTG Max Strength Picatinny Rings (2-Pieces 1-Inch Diameter, High Profile, Compact)", "description": "UTG MaxStrength Quick Lock Universal Picatinny Mount (UPM) – 2PCs 1” Rings, 22mm Wide, 20mm Saddle Height, High Profile, See-Thru, Fits Scopes up to 65mm Objective Diameter, 4 Top Screws", "text": "UTG Max Strength Picatinny Rings (2-Pieces 1-Inch Diameter, High Profile, Compact) UTG MaxStrength Quick Lock Universal Picatinny Mount (UPM) – 2PCs 1” Rings, 22mm Wide, 20mm Saddle Height, High Profile, See-Thru, Fits Scopes up to 65mm Objective Diameter, 4 Top Screws", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BxfADFxmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HICPB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 19.41}}
{"item_id": "B004HICPHW", "title": "UTG 4.0\" ITA Red/Green Dot Sight with Riser Adaptor, QD Mount and Flip-Open Lens Caps", "description": "DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 4.2\" ITA Red/Green CQB Dot with QD Mount, Riser AdaptorUTG 4.2\" ITA Red/Green CQB Dot with QD Mount, Riser AdaptorSCP-DS3840WThis amazing dot sight packs the exact features you would love to have for any quick-aiming situation. Do not underestimate this compact sized sight. When you hear that it is built on the True Strength (TS) Platform, you know it is the real thing. The DS3840W offers unlimited eye relief paired with a clear and crisp 4.0 MOA Dot, making target acquisition instantaneous. That is why we gave it the name ITA for Instant Target Acquisition. You can use it on your rifle, pistol, shotgun or anything else that you shoot.The UTG AdvantageYou get not only super wide range of windage and elevation adjustment, but also the UTG-only lock-down feature which you cannot find on any other brand. Once you zero the sight, use the provided Allen wrench to tighten the zero locking screws. You are set to use this baby and never worry about losing your zero. Quick-detachable mount, riser adaptor and flip-up lens caps come standard on the dot sight. Enjoy this compact and yet so powerful red dot right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevatin adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Flexible, Continuous Dot Intensity Adjustment RheostatThis allows the shooter to find the perfect brightness needed for the environment, lighting, and weather conditions at hand. One CR1620 3V battery is all you need for the light!Quick-detachable Mount and Riser AdaptorBy design, SCP-DS3840W is set at the optimum height for co-witnessing with iron sights on a flat top receiver with its removable 10mm high riser adaptor. Nothing escapes UTG’s attention when it comes to making a product most versatile in different applications. The quick detachable mounting base comes with the UTG patented lever lock mechanism for quick deployment. The included riser adaptor further allows for flexible, multiple forward or backward offset mounting positions. UTG takes total solutions very seriously.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories.", "text": "UTG 4.0\" ITA Red/Green Dot Sight with Riser Adaptor, QD Mount and Flip-Open Lens Caps DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 4.2\" ITA Red/Green CQB Dot with QD Mount, Riser AdaptorUTG 4.2\" ITA Red/Green CQB Dot with QD Mount, Riser AdaptorSCP-DS3840WThis amazing dot sight packs the exact features you would love to have for any quick-aiming situation. Do not underestimate this compact sized sight. When you hear that it is built on the True Strength (TS) Platform, you know it is the real thing. The DS3840W offers unlimited eye relief paired with a clear and crisp 4.0 MOA Dot, making target acquisition instantaneous. That is why we gave it the name ITA for Instant Target Acquisition. You can use it on your rifle, pistol, shotgun or anything else that you shoot.The UTG AdvantageYou get not only super wide range of windage and elevation adjustment, but also the UTG-only lock-down feature which you cannot find on any other brand. Once you zero the sight, use the provided Allen wrench to tighten the zero locking screws. You are set to use this baby and never worry about losing your zero. Quick-detachable mount, riser adaptor and flip-up lens caps come standard on the dot sight. Enjoy this compact and yet so powerful red dot right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevatin adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Flexible, Continuous Dot Intensity Adjustment RheostatThis allows the shooter to find the perfect brightness needed for the environment, lighting, and weather conditions at hand. One CR1620 3V battery is all you need for the light!Quick-detachable Mount and Riser AdaptorBy design, SCP-DS3840W is set at the optimum height for co-witnessing with iron sights on a flat top receiver with its removable 10mm high riser adaptor. Nothing escapes UTG’s attention when it comes to making a product most versatile in different applications. The quick detachable mounting base comes with the UTG patented lever lock mechanism for quick deployment. The included riser adaptor further allows for flexible, multiple forward or backward offset mounting positions. UTG takes total solutions very seriously.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y92FiIIxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HICPHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.97}}
