{"item_id": "B004HIFS8A", "title": "UTG DS3068 6.4-Inch ITA Red/Green Dot Sight with Integral QD Mount and Flip-open Lens Caps", "description": "The UTG 6.4-inch ITA Red/Green Dot Sight offers precision and versatility for use on a wide range of shotguns and rifles. Equipped with a low-profile, integral, one-piece quick detach Picatinny/weaver mount the sight deploys quickly with full adjust-ability on any Picatinny/Weaver rail. The 1X magnification scope features no-reflection, emerald coatings for clear optics with a patterned illumination rheostat with variable brightness levels for infinitely fine adjustment to suit any backdrop. Built to enhance shooting accuracy and performance the sight features instant lock on target along with a great field of view and unlimited eye relief. This Dot Sight carries a two-year warranty from UTG.Features:4.0 MOA dot sightNo-reflection high tech emerald coatingsLow-profile, integral, one-piece quick detach Picatinny/weaver mountRed or green dotPatterned illumination rheostat with variable brightness levelsAim and instant lock on targetSuits a wide range of shotguns and riflesTwo year warrantySpecifications:Magnification: 1XTube Diameter: 30 millimetersObjective Diameter: 34 millimetersField of View @ 100 yards: 60 feetEye Relief: FlexibleExit Pupil: 28 millimetersClick Value @100 yards: 1/2 inchLength: 163 millimetersWeight: 6.7 ouncesParallax Setting: InfinityBatteries: CR1620 3V", "text": "UTG DS3068 6.4-Inch ITA Red/Green Dot Sight with Integral QD Mount and Flip-open Lens Caps The UTG 6.4-inch ITA Red/Green Dot Sight offers precision and versatility for use on a wide range of shotguns and rifles. Equipped with a low-profile, integral, one-piece quick detach Picatinny/weaver mount the sight deploys quickly with full adjust-ability on any Picatinny/Weaver rail. The 1X magnification scope features no-reflection, emerald coatings for clear optics with a patterned illumination rheostat with variable brightness levels for infinitely fine adjustment to suit any backdrop. Built to enhance shooting accuracy and performance the sight features instant lock on target along with a great field of view and unlimited eye relief. This Dot Sight carries a two-year warranty from UTG.Features:4.0 MOA dot sightNo-reflection high tech emerald coatingsLow-profile, integral, one-piece quick detach Picatinny/weaver mountRed or green dotPatterned illumination rheostat with variable brightness levelsAim and instant lock on targetSuits a wide range of shotguns and riflesTwo year warrantySpecifications:Magnification: 1XTube Diameter: 30 millimetersObjective Diameter: 34 millimetersField of View @ 100 yards: 60 feetEye Relief: FlexibleExit Pupil: 28 millimetersClick Value @100 yards: 1/2 inchLength: 163 millimetersWeight: 6.7 ouncesParallax Setting: InfinityBatteries: CR1620 3V", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v%2BHACcjQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HIFS8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 56.99}}
