{"item_id": "B004HJEU0Q", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools MICRON-CP Micron Knife with Straight Edge Folding 1.5-Inch Tanto Blade and Steel Handle, Hardcase Black Finish", "description": "The SOG Micron features a blade length of only 1.5 inches, the SOG Fusion Micron is one small knife. Though small, the Micron is still big on quality with the blade made of 420 stainless steel, expect this knife to stick around a while. The SOG Fusion Micron is great for your key ring or pocket. The SOG Micron is the smallest of the small with a blade shape reminiscent of the Tomcat and the handle taking its cues from the SEAL Knife. FF-91 Features: -Micron 2.0 knife. -Finish: Black oxide. -1.5'' Straight edged coated 420 stainless steel blade. -Compact stainless steel knife with tanto blade great for key chain carry. -Lock back design for secure blade lock up. -Slim line convenience, key chain ready size. -Sophisticated tanto design. Overall length: 3.375'' Weight: .5-ounces. SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools MICRON-CP Micron Knife with Straight Edge Folding 1.5-Inch Tanto Blade and Steel Handle, Hardcase Black Finish The SOG Micron features a blade length of only 1.5 inches, the SOG Fusion Micron is one small knife. Though small, the Micron is still big on quality with the blade made of 420 stainless steel, expect this knife to stick around a while. The SOG Fusion Micron is great for your key ring or pocket. The SOG Micron is the smallest of the small with a blade shape reminiscent of the Tomcat and the handle taking its cues from the SEAL Knife. FF-91 Features: -Micron 2.0 knife. -Finish: Black oxide. -1.5'' Straight edged coated 420 stainless steel blade. -Compact stainless steel knife with tanto blade great for key chain carry. -Lock back design for secure blade lock up. -Slim line convenience, key chain ready size. -Sophisticated tanto design. Overall length: 3.375'' Weight: .5-ounces. SOG originally stood for Studies and Observation Group, an elite joint services military group designed to handle covert operations during the Vietnam War. SOG Specialty Knives was founded in the spirit of this elite group and became the first knife manufacturer to offer an expanded line that included fixed blades, folding knives, and multipurpose tools. Each SOG product is created by company Founder and Chief Engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability, and a unique style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military, and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S6wDPdKRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HJEU0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 10.69}}
