{"item_id": "B004HK9HS0", "title": "Stinger P311 Airsoft Pistol", "description": "The Stinger P311 resembles popular US military pistols of the past and features a 12-round, easy to load magazine. This medium-sized, spring-powered repeater pistol has velocities of up to 325 fps.", "text": "Stinger P311 Airsoft Pistol The Stinger P311 resembles popular US military pistols of the past and features a 12-round, easy to load magazine. This medium-sized, spring-powered repeater pistol has velocities of up to 325 fps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ciIJrY9wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HK9HS0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B004HKICAY", "title": "Knog Boomer USB Rechargeable Front Light", "description": "To preserve the condition of the Lithium battery, when the Boomer isn't used for an extended period, the batteries should rest at 50% charge. To achieve this, simply charge the Boomer to 100%, hold down the button for 5 seconds. This will turn the light on and automatically shut the Boomer off when the battery reaches 50% charge.", "text": "Knog Boomer USB Rechargeable Front Light To preserve the condition of the Lithium battery, when the Boomer isn't used for an extended period, the batteries should rest at 50% charge. To achieve this, simply charge the Boomer to 100%, hold down the button for 5 seconds. This will turn the light on and automatically shut the Boomer off when the battery reaches 50% charge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31THCH1QgeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HKICAY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B004HMPJLW", "title": "DigiWeigh digital jewelry scale,MODEL:DW-100AS", "description": "The accuracy of this DigiWeigh DW-100AS is perfect for weighing lab chemicals, loose diamonds & gemstones, gunpowder, and other valuable and/or hazardous materials which require exact precision. The GRAIN mode is commonly used to weigh gunpowder for reloading and archery arrows. The GRAM and OUNCE modes are great for weighing lab chemicals, specimen, and even precious metals like scrap jewelry & bullion; the Ounce mode is also great for food portions. The CARAT mode is perfect for weighing loose diamonds & gems--rough or faceted! The TARE button allows you to reset the scale to '0' while in use; perfect when weighing powders, oils or liquids. The calibration weights can be used to re-calibrate the scale from time to time, ensuring consistent measurements. High quality strain gauge load cell system makes it accurate in full capacity range. High density ABS housing and metal support makes it very durable. Large high contrast LCD display makes the readouts clear to read. User can switch off the back-lite to save power. Flip-open cover protects scale's platform when not in use. Includes batteries, calibration weight, instructions, and Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "DigiWeigh digital jewelry scale,MODEL:DW-100AS The accuracy of this DigiWeigh DW-100AS is perfect for weighing lab chemicals, loose diamonds & gemstones, gunpowder, and other valuable and/or hazardous materials which require exact precision. The GRAIN mode is commonly used to weigh gunpowder for reloading and archery arrows. The GRAM and OUNCE modes are great for weighing lab chemicals, specimen, and even precious metals like scrap jewelry & bullion; the Ounce mode is also great for food portions. The CARAT mode is perfect for weighing loose diamonds & gems--rough or faceted! The TARE button allows you to reset the scale to '0' while in use; perfect when weighing powders, oils or liquids. The calibration weights can be used to re-calibrate the scale from time to time, ensuring consistent measurements. High quality strain gauge load cell system makes it accurate in full capacity range. High density ABS housing and metal support makes it very durable. Large high contrast LCD display makes the readouts clear to read. User can switch off the back-lite to save power. Flip-open cover protects scale's platform when not in use. Includes batteries, calibration weight, instructions, and Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517U9GenjfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HMPJLW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DigiWeigh", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.66}}
{"item_id": "B004HNRT9G", "title": "Kryptonite U-Lock Color Skins", "description": "Personalize your Mini with our Color Skin Kit. Fits on all Kryptonite Mini U-Lock (EV & KLS2) models with both 3\" (7.6cm) and 3.25\" (8.2cm) crossbars. Shackle tubing is 17\" (43.1cm) long and will completely cover up to a 7\" (17.8cm) Mini shackle length. Color Skin Kit includes: SHACKLE & CROSSBAR covers and DUSTCOVER parts. Easy to replace. Shown on an Evolution Mini-5 not included - (images shown for illustrative purposes).", "text": "Kryptonite U-Lock Color Skins Personalize your Mini with our Color Skin Kit. Fits on all Kryptonite Mini U-Lock (EV & KLS2) models with both 3\" (7.6cm) and 3.25\" (8.2cm) crossbars. Shackle tubing is 17\" (43.1cm) long and will completely cover up to a 7\" (17.8cm) Mini shackle length. Color Skin Kit includes: SHACKLE & CROSSBAR covers and DUSTCOVER parts. Easy to replace. Shown on an Evolution Mini-5 not included - (images shown for illustrative purposes).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FBiH%2BQNtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HNRT9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 8.77}}
{"item_id": "B004HNUWCM", "title": "ACS Crossfire Bicycle Freewheel", "description": "Cold forged, rather than hot forged chromoly, CNC precision machines. 3 pawl engagement (compared to 2 pawl with ACS Claws) for stronger hold, with same, quick engagement every 12 degreesTighter tolerances giving less wobble and less play. New and unique removal notch pattern that is flush with the freewheel for better frame clearance. New matte silver finish on the main components that is corrosion resistant and eco-friendly process.", "text": "ACS Crossfire Bicycle Freewheel Cold forged, rather than hot forged chromoly, CNC precision machines. 3 pawl engagement (compared to 2 pawl with ACS Claws) for stronger hold, with same, quick engagement every 12 degreesTighter tolerances giving less wobble and less play. New and unique removal notch pattern that is flush with the freewheel for better frame clearance. New matte silver finish on the main components that is corrosion resistant and eco-friendly process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r6bDzMOgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HNUWCM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Cassettes & Freewheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HRP1CY", "title": "Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent", "description": "FEATURES of the Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent Freestanding design Color coded clip construction Taped floor seams Gear-loft loops ArcEdge Floor Mesh wall panels Internal storage pockets Noiseless zipper pulls Taped seams Side-release tent/fly connection Noiseless zipper pulls Guyout points SPECIFICATIONS of the Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent Season: 3 Capacity: 2 person Number of Door: 1 Number of Vestibule: 1 Number of Pole: 2 Minimum Weight: 3 lbs 12 oz / 1.7 kg Packaged Weight: 4 lbs 8 oz / 2.0 kg Floor Area: 30.5 square feet / 2.8 square meter Vestibule Area: 10 square feet / 0.9 square meter Dimension: 88 x 55 x 43\" / 224 x 140 x 109 cm Packed Dimension: 7 x 22\" / 18 x 56 cm Pole Type: DAC Pressfit Wall Material: 68D Polyester Floor Material: 68D Nylon, 1800 mm Fly Material: 75D Polyester 1800 mm", "text": "Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent FEATURES of the Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent Freestanding design Color coded clip construction Taped floor seams Gear-loft loops ArcEdge Floor Mesh wall panels Internal storage pockets Noiseless zipper pulls Taped seams Side-release tent/fly connection Noiseless zipper pulls Guyout points SPECIFICATIONS of the Kelty Salida 2 Person Tent Season: 3 Capacity: 2 person Number of Door: 1 Number of Vestibule: 1 Number of Pole: 2 Minimum Weight: 3 lbs 12 oz / 1.7 kg Packaged Weight: 4 lbs 8 oz / 2.0 kg Floor Area: 30.5 square feet / 2.8 square meter Vestibule Area: 10 square feet / 0.9 square meter Dimension: 88 x 55 x 43\" / 224 x 140 x 109 cm Packed Dimension: 7 x 22\" / 18 x 56 cm Pole Type: DAC Pressfit Wall Material: 68D Polyester Floor Material: 68D Nylon, 1800 mm Fly Material: 75D Polyester 1800 mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NAMgtbmoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HRP1CY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kelty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 142.94}}
{"item_id": "B004HSEST0", "title": "40 CAL S& W RELOADING BRASS 500 CASINGS LOT # 22713", "description": "THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 40 CAL S&W;, 500 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "text": "40 CAL S& W RELOADING BRASS 500 CASINGS LOT # 22713 THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 40 CAL S&W;, 500 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EfG7t7ppL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HSEST0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HW3JH8", "title": "Barnett Illuminated Rifle Scope (3 Reticle)", "description": "Barnett Crossbows Illuminated Crossbow Scope, 3x32 Illuminated Reticle 95199", "text": "Barnett Illuminated Rifle Scope (3 Reticle) Barnett Crossbows Illuminated Crossbow Scope, 3x32 Illuminated Reticle 95199", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sDInK78xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HW3JH8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 97.95}}
{"item_id": "B004HW5NLI", "title": "Barnett Crossbow Case", "description": "This soft side case from Barnett provides not only protection for your bow, but offers you easy access to your hunting or shooting accessories. Additional compartments provide room and protection for your quiver, accessory case and more. Details are not missed in this case for user comfort and convenience. The shoulder strap is padded and removable.", "text": "Barnett Crossbow Case This soft side case from Barnett provides not only protection for your bow, but offers you easy access to your hunting or shooting accessories. Additional compartments provide room and protection for your quiver, accessory case and more. Details are not missed in this case for user comfort and convenience. The shoulder strap is padded and removable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Riq6qQoOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HW5NLI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 36.3}}
{"item_id": "B004HW5OXU", "title": "EBBQ 3006 Recurve/Longbow Padded Case, 68-Inch, Green", "description": "68\"X8.5\" recurve/longbow case. Olive drab color has strap handles and Velcro flap accessories pouch 5\"X6\". 3006 68'' Recurve/Longbow Padded Case 68'' Brown.", "text": "EBBQ 3006 Recurve/Longbow Padded Case, 68-Inch, Green 68\"X8.5\" recurve/longbow case. Olive drab color has strap handles and Velcro flap accessories pouch 5\"X6\". 3006 68'' Recurve/Longbow Padded Case 68'' Brown.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ubr3gcHQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HW5OXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EBBQ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B004HWVP0Q", "title": "Large ALICE Field Pack LC-1 Green", "description": "The Military Issue Large ALICE Pack has over 2200 cubic inches of space. It can carry loads up to 70lbs. It has a total of six external pockets and one main compartment. This listing is for the pack only, NO FRAME OR SHOULDER STRAPS INCLUDED. Genuine ArmyGear!", "text": "Large ALICE Field Pack LC-1 Green The Military Issue Large ALICE Pack has over 2200 cubic inches of space. It can carry loads up to 70lbs. It has a total of six external pockets and one main compartment. This listing is for the pack only, NO FRAME OR SHOULDER STRAPS INCLUDED. Genuine ArmyGear!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515CuXr2tML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HWVP0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HX7YBO", "title": "Refillable Chalk Sock", "description": "Metolius Climbing Super Chalk - Metolius Climbing Super Chalk is the top selling brand of climbing chalk in America. It is specifically formulated for rock climbing. A safe drying agent is added to the highest-quality magnesium carbonate for maximum sweat absorption and friction. Grab your harness and fill your bag with Metolius Climbing Super Chalk.", "text": "Refillable Chalk Sock Metolius Climbing Super Chalk - Metolius Climbing Super Chalk is the top selling brand of climbing chalk in America. It is specifically formulated for rock climbing. A safe drying agent is added to the highest-quality magnesium carbonate for maximum sweat absorption and friction. Grab your harness and fill your bag with Metolius Climbing Super Chalk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Tqc6LJ7xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HX7YBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Chalk"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004HXENKY", "title": "ABUS U-mini 40/130 HB D Lock bike combination", "description": "Type:D lockKey:incl. 4 keysWeight:980 gSize U Lock:Clamp Height: 143 mmClamp Width: 80 mmClamp Diameter: 14 mm", "text": "ABUS U-mini 40/130 HB D Lock bike combination Type:D lockKey:incl. 4 keysWeight:980 gSize U Lock:Clamp Height: 143 mmClamp Width: 80 mmClamp Diameter: 14 mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ydbE3A-lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HXENKY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Abus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 57.47}}
{"item_id": "B004HXMW5C", "title": "Astek Premium 14 Panel Padded Cycling Biking Bibs High Top Shorts", "description": "Features: Astek bib shorts made of silk-mat and hard wearing Xtra-Life Lycra. Anatomic multi-panel cut with elastic and breathable mesh straps, silicone leg grippers, anatomical Stretch Gel Pad. (SGP). Fabric: 78% polyamide, 22% spandex Fitted inseam: 9\" At least 78% polyamide , remainder polyester and spandex . Machine wash, hang dry. If you have any pics from your races that you would like to share here, we would love your contribution.", "text": "Astek Premium 14 Panel Padded Cycling Biking Bibs High Top Shorts Features: Astek bib shorts made of silk-mat and hard wearing Xtra-Life Lycra. Anatomic multi-panel cut with elastic and breathable mesh straps, silicone leg grippers, anatomical Stretch Gel Pad. (SGP). Fabric: 78% polyamide, 22% spandex Fitted inseam: 9\" At least 78% polyamide , remainder polyester and spandex . Machine wash, hang dry. If you have any pics from your races that you would like to share here, we would love your contribution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZlD8UQeHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HXMW5C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 38.95}}
{"item_id": "B004HYHKH6", "title": "Gerber 31-000760 Bear Grylls Survival Series, Compact Scout Knife, Drop Point", "description": "The product of collaboration between Gerber and survival expert Bear Grylls, the Compact Scout Knife is a smaller version of the original Scout knife, featuring a thin, folding design for easy portability and storage--just tuck it in a pocket and you're ready to go. Its half-serrated, high-carbon, drop point stainless steel blade is ideal for edge retention and cutting rope. A locking blade feature and oversized finger notch in the grip provide additional safety.The Compact Scout KnifeAt a Glance:Half-serrated, high-carbon stainless steel blade holds edge and is ideal for cutting ropeLocking blade and oversized finger notch for extra safetyNail nick in blade for easy openingIncludes Bear Grylls' Priorities of Survival pocket guideThe blade locks in place while it's open, and the oversized finger notch in the handle minimizes slipping.View larger.Lighter and smaller than the original Scout knife, the Compact Scout is easy to carry on long journeys.View larger.Bear Grylls and Gerber Team UpThe Compact Scout Knife is part of the Gerber Bear Grylls Survival Series of gear. This collaboration brings together Gerber's 70+ years of knife and gear expertise with Bear Grylls' extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create a one-of-a-kind line of knives, tools, and gear.From spending time in the British SAS, to scaling Mount Everest, Bear knows what it takes to be a survivor in extreme situations and multiple environments. Now he brings that knowledge to the creation of a range of items that help you make the most of your outdoor adventures.Compact, Lightweight Design for Easy CarryingLike the original Scout knife, the Compact Scout has a strong stainless steel blade, but is lighter and smaller. It measures 5-4/5 inches overall, with a closed length of 3-3/10 inches and a 2-1/2-inch blade. At 1-2/5 ounces, it's light enough to store in your pocket.Bear Grylls' Pocket Survival GuideNo-Slip Grip and Safe ClosingThe Compact Scout features a nail nick in the blade for easy opening, and an oversized finger notch in the handle to minimize slipping. For added safety, the blade locks in place while it's open.Includes Bear Grylls' Pocket Survival GuideThis knife comes with Bear Grylls' informative Priorities of Survival pocket guide, loaded with survival basics designed to help keep you alive until you can be rescued or rescue yourself.What's in the BoxKnife and pocket survival guide.From the highest peaks of the Himalayas, to the rainforests of South America, if world renowned outdoorsman Bear Grylls is on an adventure you can be sure he's equipped with the most durable outdoor gear Gerber has to offer.", "text": "Gerber 31-000760 Bear Grylls Survival Series, Compact Scout Knife, Drop Point The product of collaboration between Gerber and survival expert Bear Grylls, the Compact Scout Knife is a smaller version of the original Scout knife, featuring a thin, folding design for easy portability and storage--just tuck it in a pocket and you're ready to go. Its half-serrated, high-carbon, drop point stainless steel blade is ideal for edge retention and cutting rope. A locking blade feature and oversized finger notch in the grip provide additional safety.The Compact Scout KnifeAt a Glance:Half-serrated, high-carbon stainless steel blade holds edge and is ideal for cutting ropeLocking blade and oversized finger notch for extra safetyNail nick in blade for easy openingIncludes Bear Grylls' Priorities of Survival pocket guideThe blade locks in place while it's open, and the oversized finger notch in the handle minimizes slipping.View larger.Lighter and smaller than the original Scout knife, the Compact Scout is easy to carry on long journeys.View larger.Bear Grylls and Gerber Team UpThe Compact Scout Knife is part of the Gerber Bear Grylls Survival Series of gear. This collaboration brings together Gerber's 70+ years of knife and gear expertise with Bear Grylls' extensive outdoor survival and adventure experience to create a one-of-a-kind line of knives, tools, and gear.From spending time in the British SAS, to scaling Mount Everest, Bear knows what it takes to be a survivor in extreme situations and multiple environments. Now he brings that knowledge to the creation of a range of items that help you make the most of your outdoor adventures.Compact, Lightweight Design for Easy CarryingLike the original Scout knife, the Compact Scout has a strong stainless steel blade, but is lighter and smaller. It measures 5-4/5 inches overall, with a closed length of 3-3/10 inches and a 2-1/2-inch blade. At 1-2/5 ounces, it's light enough to store in your pocket.Bear Grylls' Pocket Survival GuideNo-Slip Grip and Safe ClosingThe Compact Scout features a nail nick in the blade for easy opening, and an oversized finger notch in the handle to minimize slipping. For added safety, the blade locks in place while it's open.Includes Bear Grylls' Pocket Survival GuideThis knife comes with Bear Grylls' informative Priorities of Survival pocket guide, loaded with survival basics designed to help keep you alive until you can be rescued or rescue yourself.What's in the BoxKnife and pocket survival guide.From the highest peaks of the Himalayas, to the rainforests of South America, if world renowned outdoorsman Bear Grylls is on an adventure you can be sure he's equipped with the most durable outdoor gear Gerber has to offer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AYopi0xiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HYHKH6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B004HZQ6IE", "title": "Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves - Men's", "description": "Slip the Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves on, and let the Lycra fabric encase your hands in sweet comfort. The thick gel padding on the palms is pre-shaped to provide a comfortable fit for long rides, while hook-and-loop closures make for easy on and off. The 12c Air Gel gloves are ideal for those who suffer with sore hands during long rides, since the gel palm significantly cuts down on road vibration. The pre-curved shape helps to fight bunching and pinching, so your gloves won't get in your way. Also, the Ergo Air palm construction keeps air flowing, so you'll stay dry and cool. And the addition of silicone grippers helps you to maintain control of your ride, without resorting to a death-grip on the handlebar. The Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves are available in five sizes, from Small to XX-Large, and in the colors Black, Ginger, and White.", "text": "Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves - Men's Slip the Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves on, and let the Lycra fabric encase your hands in sweet comfort. The thick gel padding on the palms is pre-shaped to provide a comfortable fit for long rides, while hook-and-loop closures make for easy on and off. The 12c Air Gel gloves are ideal for those who suffer with sore hands during long rides, since the gel palm significantly cuts down on road vibration. The pre-curved shape helps to fight bunching and pinching, so your gloves won't get in your way. Also, the Ergo Air palm construction keeps air flowing, so you'll stay dry and cool. And the addition of silicone grippers helps you to maintain control of your ride, without resorting to a death-grip on the handlebar. The Louis Garneau 12c Air Gel Gloves are available in five sizes, from Small to XX-Large, and in the colors Black, Ginger, and White.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zXHHRu0yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004HZQ6IE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004I01F3Y", "title": "Vapur Funsize 2-Pack 0.4 Litres Anti-Bottle", "description": "The Vapur Anti-Bottle is a foldable, reusable water bottle designed for convenient on-the-go use. Unlike traditional rigid bottles, the Anti-Bottle is flexible. It stands upright when full and can be rolled, folded or flattened when empty - easily fitting into pockets, purses or packs.", "text": "Vapur Funsize 2-Pack 0.4 Litres Anti-Bottle The Vapur Anti-Bottle is a foldable, reusable water bottle designed for convenient on-the-go use. Unlike traditional rigid bottles, the Anti-Bottle is flexible. It stands upright when full and can be rolled, folded or flattened when empty - easily fitting into pockets, purses or packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511pIfVNDpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I01F3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vapur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 35.27}}
{"item_id": "B004I44JS8", "title": "O'Neill Wetsuits Women's Basic Skins Short Sleeve Rash Tee", "description": "U.V. and Rash Protection Shirt", "text": "O'Neill Wetsuits Women's Basic Skins Short Sleeve Rash Tee U.V. and Rash Protection Shirt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l04YX6YdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I44JS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Rash Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004I44QJA", "title": "O'Neill Wetsuits Reactor 3/2mm Full Suit", "description": "A Single Superseal neck offers a smooth skin interior and unfinished, chafe-free edge.O'Neill's Reactor Series wetsuits utilize the company's proprietary FluidFlex design in the shoulder and sleeves for improved range of motion, a fully adjustable Superseal neck for long-lasting comfort, and Krypto Knee Padz to protect your knees and extend the life of the suit. This 3/2mm full suit additionally boasts flat-stitched construction, a Smooth Skin chest panel, and rugged, snag-free YKK back zip.FeaturesSingle Superseal Neck:Fully adjustable closure featuring 360-degree smooth skin interior, chafe-free unfinished edge, and minimal bulk designFlatloc Construction:Breathable, overlapping flat-stitched seams are non-chafing and super durableKrypto Knee Padz:Abrasion-resistant, high-stretch neoprene panel with ergonomic shaping designed to extend the life of the wetsuit and protect the knee while punching through wavesStrategic Paddle Zones:An ergonomic, seamless under-sleeve panel allows for unrestricted motion and eliminates rashesWarrantyO'Neill wetsuits include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Krypto Knee Padz are soft, articulated pads which protect the knees and extend the life of the suit.About O'NeillBack in1952, Jack O'Neill opened the first Surf Shop in a garage. He shaped a few balsa surfboards and sold accessories like paraffin wax and vests he started gluing together from neoprene. When the vests started selling, Jack decided to go into the wetsuit business. The Surf Shop became a local gathering place, and the number of surfers began to grow. O'Neill flew in talented craftspeople like Phil Edwards to make boards, and wetsuit sales climbed. Soon surfers were riding more waves, and riding them better, in large measure because they could enjoy longer sessions in cold water thanks to Jack's neoprene suits.As Jack improved his wetsuit designs, surfers' territories expanded. Northern California became a year-round surf zone, and people were surfing New Hampshire and Rhode Island in January. Explorations and transplants to surf culture opened up Oregon, Washington, and Canada. Meanwhile, divers, water-skiers, snow-skiers, and windsurfers were wearing wetsuits. As business boomed, O'Neill relocated to a large manufacturing facility, and his surf shop has morphed into an international company, leading the world's wetsuit market and an innovator in beach lifestyle sportswear in the United States, Japan, and Europe.Jack's son Pat eventually assumed the CEO position, freeing Jack to surf, sail, and work at a variety of environmental projects. Besides a strong interest in saving the great white shark from extinction, Jack has also developed the O'Neill Sea Odyssey program -- a free, educational cruise aboard the Team O'Neill catamaran that acquaints kids with the microbiology of the Monterey Bay Marine Sanctuary.", "text": "O'Neill Wetsuits Reactor 3/2mm Full Suit A Single Superseal neck offers a smooth skin interior and unfinished, chafe-free edge.O'Neill's Reactor Series wetsuits utilize the company's proprietary FluidFlex design in the shoulder and sleeves for improved range of motion, a fully adjustable Superseal neck for long-lasting comfort, and Krypto Knee Padz to protect your knees and extend the life of the suit. This 3/2mm full suit additionally boasts flat-stitched construction, a Smooth Skin chest panel, and rugged, snag-free YKK back zip.FeaturesSingle Superseal Neck:Fully adjustable closure featuring 360-degree smooth skin interior, chafe-free unfinished edge, and minimal bulk designFlatloc Construction:Breathable, overlapping flat-stitched seams are non-chafing and super durableKrypto Knee Padz:Abrasion-resistant, high-stretch neoprene panel with ergonomic shaping designed to extend the life of the wetsuit and protect the knee while punching through wavesStrategic Paddle Zones:An ergonomic, seamless under-sleeve panel allows for unrestricted motion and eliminates rashesWarrantyO'Neill wetsuits include a limited one-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.Krypto Knee Padz are soft, articulated pads which protect the knees and extend the life of the suit.About O'NeillBack in1952, Jack O'Neill opened the first Surf Shop in a garage. He shaped a few balsa surfboards and sold accessories like paraffin wax and vests he started gluing together from neoprene. When the vests started selling, Jack decided to go into the wetsuit business. The Surf Shop became a local gathering place, and the number of surfers began to grow. O'Neill flew in talented craftspeople like Phil Edwards to make boards, and wetsuit sales climbed. Soon surfers were riding more waves, and riding them better, in large measure because they could enjoy longer sessions in cold water thanks to Jack's neoprene suits.As Jack improved his wetsuit designs, surfers' territories expanded. Northern California became a year-round surf zone, and people were surfing New Hampshire and Rhode Island in January. Explorations and transplants to surf culture opened up Oregon, Washington, and Canada. Meanwhile, divers, water-skiers, snow-skiers, and windsurfers were wearing wetsuits. As business boomed, O'Neill relocated to a large manufacturing facility, and his surf shop has morphed into an international company, leading the world's wetsuit market and an innovator in beach lifestyle sportswear in the United States, Japan, and Europe.Jack's son Pat eventually assumed the CEO position, freeing Jack to surf, sail, and work at a variety of environmental projects. Besides a strong interest in saving the great white shark from extinction, Jack has also developed the O'Neill Sea Odyssey program -- a free, educational cruise aboard the Team O'Neill catamaran that acquaints kids with the microbiology of the Monterey Bay Marine Sanctuary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IEHhHcG7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I44QJA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Suits", "Wetsuits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004I4EXVG", "title": "Aqua-Quest \"The Camo\" Waterproof & Heavy Duty Tarp - 10 x 7 Army Camouflage Model", "description": "This tarp is the real deal. Online reviews for this item tell the whole story... tried, tested, and true. This is perhaps the strongest, most reliable, waterproof tarp on the planet. Excellent craftsmanship, coated 70-D RipStop Nylon, and an awesome design with 18 reinforced webbing loops and ridge line tie points for just about any setup option that your brain can scheme up. This tarp is perfect for camping, hunting, emergency survival kit, or even as an Awning around your home or for your RV or camper. Also great to keep one of these tarps on board any ATV, boat, car, truck, etc, so that if you need a quick shelter in a time of need, you have it. Preparing for emergency situations with quality gear is a smart move for any person, anywhere.", "text": "Aqua-Quest \"The Camo\" Waterproof & Heavy Duty Tarp - 10 x 7 Army Camouflage Model This tarp is the real deal. Online reviews for this item tell the whole story... tried, tested, and true. This is perhaps the strongest, most reliable, waterproof tarp on the planet. Excellent craftsmanship, coated 70-D RipStop Nylon, and an awesome design with 18 reinforced webbing loops and ridge line tie points for just about any setup option that your brain can scheme up. This tarp is perfect for camping, hunting, emergency survival kit, or even as an Awning around your home or for your RV or camper. Also great to keep one of these tarps on board any ATV, boat, car, truck, etc, so that if you need a quick shelter in a time of need, you have it. Preparing for emergency situations with quality gear is a smart move for any person, anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51erleHqOBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I4EXVG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]], "price": 69.0}}
{"item_id": "B004I4HDD6", "title": "Aqua-Quest 'Mariner' Waterproof Backpack Dry Bag Day Pack - 20L / 1200 cu. in. - Yellow Model", "description": "The Aqua Quest Mariner Series, Available in 10L, 20L, & 30L Carrying Capacities, is Designed to Provide Waterproof Protection in an Easy to Carry Bag. Inspired by Kayakers, Canoeists, Boaters & Sailors, but Designed to Meet The Needs of Anybody Who is Heading Outdoors for Any Reason. These Bags offer Welded Seam Construction, Sleek Single-Compartment Design, and an Enhanced Traditional 'Roll-Down' Closure with Dual-Integrated Stiffeners for Easy Handling. The PVC-Coated Tarpaulin Fabric is Very Tough, and Resistant to Abrasion. These Bags are Equipped with Accessory Shoulder Straps and a Duffel-Style Side Handle, Making the 'Mariner' One of the Most Versatile & Multi-Functional Waterproof Backpacks on The Planet, at a Price that Can't Be Beat!", "text": "Aqua-Quest 'Mariner' Waterproof Backpack Dry Bag Day Pack - 20L / 1200 cu. in. - Yellow Model The Aqua Quest Mariner Series, Available in 10L, 20L, & 30L Carrying Capacities, is Designed to Provide Waterproof Protection in an Easy to Carry Bag. Inspired by Kayakers, Canoeists, Boaters & Sailors, but Designed to Meet The Needs of Anybody Who is Heading Outdoors for Any Reason. These Bags offer Welded Seam Construction, Sleek Single-Compartment Design, and an Enhanced Traditional 'Roll-Down' Closure with Dual-Integrated Stiffeners for Easy Handling. The PVC-Coated Tarpaulin Fabric is Very Tough, and Resistant to Abrasion. These Bags are Equipped with Accessory Shoulder Straps and a Duffel-Style Side Handle, Making the 'Mariner' One of the Most Versatile & Multi-Functional Waterproof Backpacks on The Planet, at a Price that Can't Be Beat!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GL8N70NxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I4HDD6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]], "price": 33.0}}
{"item_id": "B004I576SM", "title": "Magnet Steel Bike Bicycle Indoor Exercise Trainer Stand", "description": "There is no reason why you can not exercise with your bike when the outside weather is bad, this magnetic resistance bike trainer converts your bike into an indoor cycling trainer. It offer effective indoor training in a stiff, well supported steel frame. This Trainer is easy to set up with almost any bike--including road and mountain bikes with a 26\", 27\" or 700c wheel. Fine-tune to your wheel and tire size with the micro-adjust knob. As you pedal the internal magnet creates resistance, with 5 levels of resistance. And you can change them right from your handle bars.", "text": "Magnet Steel Bike Bicycle Indoor Exercise Trainer Stand There is no reason why you can not exercise with your bike when the outside weather is bad, this magnetic resistance bike trainer converts your bike into an indoor cycling trainer. It offer effective indoor training in a stiff, well supported steel frame. This Trainer is easy to set up with almost any bike--including road and mountain bikes with a 26\", 27\" or 700c wheel. Fine-tune to your wheel and tire size with the micro-adjust knob. As you pedal the internal magnet creates resistance, with 5 levels of resistance. And you can change them right from your handle bars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wDyJ5zNxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I576SM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FDW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 68.0}}
{"item_id": "B004I5L9EY", "title": "Unique Sports Deluxe Hot Glove Wrap", "description": "Deluxe Glove Wrap is the best way to maintain a glove pocket and preserve the glove shape. Comes with a plastic softball to be placed in the glove pocket when the Glove Wrap is placed around the glove.", "text": "Unique Sports Deluxe Hot Glove Wrap Deluxe Glove Wrap is the best way to maintain a glove pocket and preserve the glove shape. Comes with a plastic softball to be placed in the glove pocket when the Glove Wrap is placed around the glove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RrKA0jZ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I5L9EY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unique", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts"]], "price": 5.17}}
{"item_id": "B004I5O1IK", "title": "Outdoor Research Papyrus Brim Hat Sun Hat", "description": "Make your own shade with this wide-brimmed sun hat. Woven paper fabric provides excellent breathability, while a Supplex® lining provides UPF 30 protection. A removable chin cord keeps the Papyrus in place during hot afternoon winds", "text": "Outdoor Research Papyrus Brim Hat Sun Hat Make your own shade with this wide-brimmed sun hat. Woven paper fabric provides excellent breathability, while a Supplex® lining provides UPF 30 protection. A removable chin cord keeps the Papyrus in place during hot afternoon winds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GdFtPXlOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I5O1IK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004I61VE6", "title": "Crosman 0852 Pellet Target Trap", "description": "Triple safety curtains backed by heavy galvanized steel. Paper silhouette targets included. Not recommended for .177 airguns that exceed 800 fps.", "text": "Crosman 0852 Pellet Target Trap Triple safety curtains backed by heavy galvanized steel. Paper silhouette targets included. Not recommended for .177 airguns that exceed 800 fps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511TxY8D8vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I61VE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 29.56}}
{"item_id": "B004I8NKDO", "title": "Allen Company Fly Rod Case (For Up To 9-Feet Four Piece Rod with Reel Attached)", "description": "Here is a great way to safely store that favorite rod while travelling, while hiking, or while it's not in use. The rigid tube protects the rod, and the guides to ensure safe keeping.", "text": "Allen Company Fly Rod Case (For Up To 9-Feet Four Piece Rod with Reel Attached) Here is a great way to safely store that favorite rod while travelling, while hiking, or while it's not in use. The rigid tube protects the rod, and the guides to ensure safe keeping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41De6TRFz%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I8NKDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Cases & Tubes"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B004I8Q8T2", "title": "Leupold 112179 RX-1000I TBR W/DNA", "description": "RX-1000 Compact Digital Laser RangefinderPristine image quality allows the RX-1000 to serve as your full-time optic while the cutting-edge laser and processor generate the fastest, most reliable readings ever produced. The incredibly bright OLED display dramatically increases light transmission by up to3x higher than LCD models. Packed with features never before offered at this price, the Leupold RX-1000 Compact line significantly raises the bar on function and performance. Multiple ballistics settingsTrue Ballistic Range (TBR)provides accurate aiming information matched to the performance of your rifle or bow. By calculating the incline, line of sight range to the target, and a projectile's ballistics, your RX provides rifle hunters using Leupold Ballistics Aiming System reticles as well as bow hunters the correct equivalent horizontal distance for precise shooting on an incline. In other words, aim using the True Ballistic Range, not the line of sight range. Rifle hunters can also get this data as an MOA adjustment or a holdover point. With practice, long distance/steep angle shooting will become second nature. TBR is effective to 800yards for most rifle cartridges", "text": "Leupold 112179 RX-1000I TBR W/DNA RX-1000 Compact Digital Laser RangefinderPristine image quality allows the RX-1000 to serve as your full-time optic while the cutting-edge laser and processor generate the fastest, most reliable readings ever produced. The incredibly bright OLED display dramatically increases light transmission by up to3x higher than LCD models. Packed with features never before offered at this price, the Leupold RX-1000 Compact line significantly raises the bar on function and performance. Multiple ballistics settingsTrue Ballistic Range (TBR)provides accurate aiming information matched to the performance of your rifle or bow. By calculating the incline, line of sight range to the target, and a projectile's ballistics, your RX provides rifle hunters using Leupold Ballistics Aiming System reticles as well as bow hunters the correct equivalent horizontal distance for precise shooting on an incline. In other words, aim using the True Ballistic Range, not the line of sight range. Rifle hunters can also get this data as an MOA adjustment or a holdover point. With practice, long distance/steep angle shooting will become second nature. TBR is effective to 800yards for most rifle cartridges", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vlLQJ9IxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I8Q8T2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leupold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 398.37}}
{"item_id": "B004I8Q9JQ", "title": "Bushnell Equinox Digital Night Vision Monocular", "description": "Night's ultimate equalizer has arrived. Delivering image clarity, illumination and field of view unrivaled - even with zero ambient light - Equinox Digital Night Vision. The digital configuration pierces the night with utmost efficiency, offering the option of a traditional green view for dusk and dawn while some ambient light is available and white imaging for use in almost-dark to completely dark conditions. It's marked by lightweight, compact housing, extremely long battery life and true 2x magnification. Rugged, water-resistant housing and integrated accessory rails that facilitate the addition of a light to dramatically extend viewing range.", "text": "Bushnell Equinox Digital Night Vision Monocular Night's ultimate equalizer has arrived. Delivering image clarity, illumination and field of view unrivaled - even with zero ambient light - Equinox Digital Night Vision. The digital configuration pierces the night with utmost efficiency, offering the option of a traditional green view for dusk and dawn while some ambient light is available and white imaging for use in almost-dark to completely dark conditions. It's marked by lightweight, compact housing, extremely long battery life and true 2x magnification. Rugged, water-resistant housing and integrated accessory rails that facilitate the addition of a light to dramatically extend viewing range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-txuWcEuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I8Q9JQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004I8QCMU", "title": "Soft Air Rail Mount for MP5 Style Rifles", "description": "Scope Claw Mount for G3 & MP5 Airsoft Variants Use this GSG scope base to attach rifle scopes on your G3 & MP5 airsoft guns. This scope base creates a Weaver/Picatinny rail for mounting optics once it's clamped on your gun. Enhance the versatility of your favorite gun and pick up this scope base today!", "text": "Soft Air Rail Mount for MP5 Style Rifles Scope Claw Mount for G3 & MP5 Airsoft Variants Use this GSG scope base to attach rifle scopes on your G3 & MP5 airsoft guns. This scope base creates a Weaver/Picatinny rail for mounting optics once it's clamped on your gun. Enhance the versatility of your favorite gun and pick up this scope base today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w0K0XZiFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I8QCMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Palco Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Rails"]], "price": 7.49}}
