{"item_id": "B004I8X1XS", "title": "Leupold SX-1 Ventana Angled Spotting Scope, Black, 15-45 x 60mm", "description": "Leupold SX-1 Ventana 15-45x60mm Angled Spotting Scope. Leupold feast-for-your-eyes quality for an awesome LOW PRICE! See what you've been missing! Feast your eyeballs on this precision Leupold SX-1 Ventana Spotter and brace yourself for crystal-clear, long-distance views. Perfect for bird watching, hunting and zeroing in a rifle scope. Sure beats walking downrange to spot target hits. Simply glance and make necessary adjustments, fast and effortless! Seems our special buy lets you focus on LESS! Leupold excellence: Angled eyepiece design; Wide F.O.V. and high magnification bring out the details; Fully multi-coated, precision-ground lenses for superior light transmission; Armored, 100% waterproof body; Handy top-mounted focus dial; Eyeglass friendly twist-up eyecup; F.O.V. @ 1,000 yds. is 142'/89'; Close focus is 13.8'; Measures 13.5\"l., 31 ozs. Includes soft case, strap and lens cover.; Order yours today! Leupold SX-1 Ventana 15-45x60mm Angled Spotting Scope", "text": "Leupold SX-1 Ventana Angled Spotting Scope, Black, 15-45 x 60mm Leupold SX-1 Ventana 15-45x60mm Angled Spotting Scope. Leupold feast-for-your-eyes quality for an awesome LOW PRICE! See what you've been missing! Feast your eyeballs on this precision Leupold SX-1 Ventana Spotter and brace yourself for crystal-clear, long-distance views. Perfect for bird watching, hunting and zeroing in a rifle scope. Sure beats walking downrange to spot target hits. Simply glance and make necessary adjustments, fast and effortless! Seems our special buy lets you focus on LESS! Leupold excellence: Angled eyepiece design; Wide F.O.V. and high magnification bring out the details; Fully multi-coated, precision-ground lenses for superior light transmission; Armored, 100% waterproof body; Handy top-mounted focus dial; Eyeglass friendly twist-up eyecup; F.O.V. @ 1,000 yds. is 142'/89'; Close focus is 13.8'; Measures 13.5\"l., 31 ozs. Includes soft case, strap and lens cover.; Order yours today! Leupold SX-1 Ventana 15-45x60mm Angled Spotting Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iYNT8QIbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004I8X1XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leupold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 273.46}}
