{"item_id": "B004IANTB0", "title": "Military Glass Signal Mirror", "description": "This 2\" x 3\" glass signal mirror is one of the best day time emergency signaling devices available. The Military Glass Signal Mirror, made by S.I. Howard in the USA, is a military approved and issued item. The major difference between this signal mirror and so many on the market today is that this signal mirror is made of high quality glass. This means its reflectivity is higher than Lexan or plastic versions. If you find the need to use a survival mirror, we highly recommend this one over the many on the market today as it is time tested, durable and most of all, effective.", "text": "Military Glass Signal Mirror This 2\" x 3\" glass signal mirror is one of the best day time emergency signaling devices available. The Military Glass Signal Mirror, made by S.I. Howard in the USA, is a military approved and issued item. The major difference between this signal mirror and so many on the market today is that this signal mirror is made of high quality glass. This means its reflectivity is higher than Lexan or plastic versions. If you find the need to use a survival mirror, we highly recommend this one over the many on the market today as it is time tested, durable and most of all, effective.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VDqPXQ3CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IANTB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Best Glide Adventurer Series", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 18.1}}
{"item_id": "B004ICZBD2", "title": "Taylor Made Burner Superfast 2.0 Driver 10.5* (Matrix Ozik, REGULAR, LEFT) Golf", "description": "Club Specifications:DEXTERITY: Left-HandedGENDER: MenBRAND: Taylor MadeMODEL: Burner Superfast 2.0CLUB: 10.5* DriverSHAFT: GraphiteSHAFT SPECIFICS: Taylor Made Matrix Ozik Xcon-4.8, X Axis controlFLEX: RegularGRIP: Taylor MadeLENGTH: 46.25HEADCOVER: No headcover includedCONDITION: UsedCONDITION SPECIFICS: Used condition 8.5, very good shape, face and sole show some minor wear from play, crown looks nice", "text": "Taylor Made Burner Superfast 2.0 Driver 10.5* (Matrix Ozik, REGULAR, LEFT) Golf Club Specifications:DEXTERITY: Left-HandedGENDER: MenBRAND: Taylor MadeMODEL: Burner Superfast 2.0CLUB: 10.5* DriverSHAFT: GraphiteSHAFT SPECIFICS: Taylor Made Matrix Ozik Xcon-4.8, X Axis controlFLEX: RegularGRIP: Taylor MadeLENGTH: 46.25HEADCOVER: No headcover includedCONDITION: UsedCONDITION SPECIFICS: Used condition 8.5, very good shape, face and sole show some minor wear from play, crown looks nice", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VpdtehcYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ICZBD2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Drivers"]]}}
