{"item_id": "B004IGP5RA", "title": "Contigo 24-Ounce Cuff 3-Pack Water Bottle Set, Purple/Citrus/Blue", "description": "Push button to hydrate! 100% Spill- and leak-proof AUTOSEAL water bottle offers one-handed convenience, making it perfect for active use. No spouts to open or lids to remove - just press to sip and release to automatically seal. Sturdy integrated carry handle with built-in carabiner clip for easy transporting for the ultimate in on-the-go hydration.", "text": "Contigo 24-Ounce Cuff 3-Pack Water Bottle Set, Purple/Citrus/Blue Push button to hydrate! 100% Spill- and leak-proof AUTOSEAL water bottle offers one-handed convenience, making it perfect for active use. No spouts to open or lids to remove - just press to sip and release to automatically seal. Sturdy integrated carry handle with built-in carabiner clip for easy transporting for the ultimate in on-the-go hydration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YAWsr%2BjZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IGP5RA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004II61JO", "title": "Cycle Saver Pepper Spray with Easy Install Bicycle Mount for Bicycles and Mountain Bikes", "description": "The days of riding out on a secluded road or trail and worrying about your safety are now over! The Cycle Saver was developed by top professional, world champion athletes to maximize your safety while riding and will not hinder your workout performance. The unique mounting bracket holds a oz. pepper spray bottle with the hottest pepper formula on the market today. The Cycle Saver's pepper spray, extracted from cayenne peppers, creates an intense burning sensation on the eyes, skin and throat and can cause an attacker's senses to temporarily shut down and give you time to get away. Cycle Saver's easy-twist lock top and snap in mounting bracket allow for easy accessibility and the ballistic stream can spray attackers from up to ten feet away in as many as 10-20 short bursts to keep you at a safe distance. This is one bike accessory that's a must for any casual or professional rider. Be in control and prepared for any incident by purchasing the Cycle Saver today!", "text": "Cycle Saver Pepper Spray with Easy Install Bicycle Mount for Bicycles and Mountain Bikes The days of riding out on a secluded road or trail and worrying about your safety are now over! The Cycle Saver was developed by top professional, world champion athletes to maximize your safety while riding and will not hinder your workout performance. The unique mounting bracket holds a oz. pepper spray bottle with the hottest pepper formula on the market today. The Cycle Saver's pepper spray, extracted from cayenne peppers, creates an intense burning sensation on the eyes, skin and throat and can cause an attacker's senses to temporarily shut down and give you time to get away. Cycle Saver's easy-twist lock top and snap in mounting bracket allow for easy accessibility and the ballistic stream can spray attackers from up to ten feet away in as many as 10-20 short bursts to keep you at a safe distance. This is one bike accessory that's a must for any casual or professional rider. Be in control and prepared for any incident by purchasing the Cycle Saver today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BDkuRISHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004II61JO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B004II99ES", "title": "Huntington 3-Piece Camping Fork/Knife/Spoon Set With Pouch", "description": "Don't take this one on your next five star dining experience. Instead, consider this handy 3-piece cutlery set for a trip into the wilds. Or a family picnic in the national park. That's all you need.", "text": "Huntington 3-Piece Camping Fork/Knife/Spoon Set With Pouch Don't take this one on your next five star dining experience. Instead, consider this handy 3-piece cutlery set for a trip into the wilds. Or a family picnic in the national park. That's all you need.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PUUnWNyYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004II99ES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B004IIKA1O", "title": "Barnett Quad 400 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 22-Inch Arrows and Premium Red Dot Sight)", "description": "The ever-popular Quad 400 crossbow has long been designed to optimize power and firing accuracy, and has recently been updated with some new features. Key updates include a high density gas assist stock, a first in the industry, which is more comfortable and contains an integrated cocking device attachment, concealed by the contoured cheek piece. Other improvements include a thumbhole grip and 15.5-inch power stroke, with a parallel limb design which produces arrow speeds of up to 345-feet-per-second. The kit comes complete with quiver, three 22-inch arrows, and red dot sight.Specifications:150-pound draw weight112-foot-pounds of energy15.5-inch power stroke345-feet-per-second (FPS) firing velocity22-inch arrow length39.6-inch string lengthMeasures 26.75 by 37 inches (W x D)Nine-pound weightWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Quad 400 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 22-Inch Arrows and Premium Red Dot Sight) The ever-popular Quad 400 crossbow has long been designed to optimize power and firing accuracy, and has recently been updated with some new features. Key updates include a high density gas assist stock, a first in the industry, which is more comfortable and contains an integrated cocking device attachment, concealed by the contoured cheek piece. Other improvements include a thumbhole grip and 15.5-inch power stroke, with a parallel limb design which produces arrow speeds of up to 345-feet-per-second. The kit comes complete with quiver, three 22-inch arrows, and red dot sight.Specifications:150-pound draw weight112-foot-pounds of energy15.5-inch power stroke345-feet-per-second (FPS) firing velocity22-inch arrow length39.6-inch string lengthMeasures 26.75 by 37 inches (W x D)Nine-pound weightWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xq0051%2BaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IIKA1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 333.46}}
{"item_id": "B004IIKA2I", "title": "Barnett Quad 400 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 22-Inch Arrows and 4x32mm Scope)", "description": "This high-powered, quad-limbed crossbow from Barnett is designed to deliver the bolt to the target with as much accuracy and speed as possible. The popular Quad 400 has been totally redesigned with an eye toward maintaining its well deserved reputation as a shooter's favorite, while adding impressive new features.A high-density gas assist composite stock is the first of its kind in the industry, is lighter and more comfortable than its predecessor, and includes an integrated cocking device attachment. A contoured cheek piece conceals the attachment while also increasing comfort. Additional features include a thumbhole grip, 15.5-inch power stroke, and parallel limb design producing arrows speeds of 345-feet-per-second.This kit includes the Quad 400 crossbow, quick detach quiver, and three 22-inch arrows.FeaturesCamouflage finishGAM composite stockQuad limb designFour-pound trigger pullCNC camSynthetic cable systemMachined scope mountSpecifications345-feet-per-second firing velocity150-pound draw weight112-foot-pounds of energy15.5-inch power strokeNine-pound weight37-inch length26.75-inch width22-inch arrowsWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett crossbows are designed by hunters, for hunters. From its inception over 50 years ago, the company has created a range of crossbows based on the changing needs of hunters. Lightweight, adjustable, and powerful, Barnett products have helped crossbow technology evolve.", "text": "Barnett Quad 400 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 22-Inch Arrows and 4x32mm Scope) This high-powered, quad-limbed crossbow from Barnett is designed to deliver the bolt to the target with as much accuracy and speed as possible. The popular Quad 400 has been totally redesigned with an eye toward maintaining its well deserved reputation as a shooter's favorite, while adding impressive new features.A high-density gas assist composite stock is the first of its kind in the industry, is lighter and more comfortable than its predecessor, and includes an integrated cocking device attachment. A contoured cheek piece conceals the attachment while also increasing comfort. Additional features include a thumbhole grip, 15.5-inch power stroke, and parallel limb design producing arrows speeds of 345-feet-per-second.This kit includes the Quad 400 crossbow, quick detach quiver, and three 22-inch arrows.FeaturesCamouflage finishGAM composite stockQuad limb designFour-pound trigger pullCNC camSynthetic cable systemMachined scope mountSpecifications345-feet-per-second firing velocity150-pound draw weight112-foot-pounds of energy15.5-inch power strokeNine-pound weight37-inch length26.75-inch width22-inch arrowsWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett crossbows are designed by hunters, for hunters. From its inception over 50 years ago, the company has created a range of crossbows based on the changing needs of hunters. Lightweight, adjustable, and powerful, Barnett products have helped crossbow technology evolve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xq0051%2BaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IIKA2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 354.99}}
{"item_id": "B004IIZVQ8", "title": "Barnett Wildcat C5 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 20-Inch Arrows and Premium Red Dot Sight)", "description": "The Wildcat C5 is the best selling crossbow Barnett has ever produced, and features a lightweight composite GAM stock, thumbhole grip, vented quad limbs with high energy Veloci-Speed wheels, all driven by a powerful Crosswire string and cable system. An innovative crank attachment is built right into the stock, allowing for easy installation of the optional crank cocking device (sold separately) while maintaining a sleek, low profile look and feel. The set comes complete with quick-detach quiver, three 20-inch arrows, and red dot sight.Specifications:150-pound draw weight91-foot-pounds of energy13-inch power stroke320-feet-per-second (FPS) firing velocity20-inch arrow length37-inch string lengthMeasures 26.75 by 35.5 inches (W x D)8.5-pound weightWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Wildcat C5 Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 20-Inch Arrows and Premium Red Dot Sight) The Wildcat C5 is the best selling crossbow Barnett has ever produced, and features a lightweight composite GAM stock, thumbhole grip, vented quad limbs with high energy Veloci-Speed wheels, all driven by a powerful Crosswire string and cable system. An innovative crank attachment is built right into the stock, allowing for easy installation of the optional crank cocking device (sold separately) while maintaining a sleek, low profile look and feel. The set comes complete with quick-detach quiver, three 20-inch arrows, 