{"item_id": "B004IJCMQ4", "title": "Casio GzOne Type-S Used Cell Phone Verizon or PagePlus", "description": "The Casio G'zOne Type-S is a durable phone with a rugged and fully water-submersible design. In addition to its durability, this model also features Bluetooth compatibility, VGA camera, internal antenna, and GPS. The Type-S also comes equipped with MMS and SMS messaging, and it supports multiple languages including Spanish. This model also has great sound quality and is easy to use.", "text": "Casio GzOne Type-S Used Cell Phone Verizon or PagePlus The Casio G'zOne Type-S is a durable phone with a rugged and fully water-submersible design. In addition to its durability, this model also features Bluetooth compatibility, VGA camera, internal antenna, and GPS. The Type-S also comes equipped with MMS and SMS messaging, and it supports multiple languages including Spanish. This model also has great sound quality and is easy to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418kPlLcGhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IJCMQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Cell Phones", "Unlocked Cell Phones"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Cell Phone Accessories"]], "price": 7.49}}
