{"item_id": "B004INB6QC", "title": "15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit", "description": "15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit. Fits any Bug-Out / survival bag. Play it safe. Catch fish for a survival meal. Kit has: 2 fishing lures; 1 fly; 2 bobbers; Simulated salmon eggs bait; Leader; Weights; 6 hooks (2 ea. of 3 sizes); 50' of 12-lb. line; Water-resistant tin. 3 3/4 x 2 1/4 x 1\"h., 2 ozs. Get this Survival Fish Kit at a scaled down price! Order Now! 15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit", "text": "15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit 15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit. Fits any Bug-Out / survival bag. Play it safe. Catch fish for a survival meal. Kit has: 2 fishing lures; 1 fly; 2 bobbers; Simulated salmon eggs bait; Leader; Weights; 6 hooks (2 ea. of 3 sizes); 50' of 12-lb. line; Water-resistant tin. 3 3/4 x 2 1/4 x 1\"h., 2 ozs. Get this Survival Fish Kit at a scaled down price! Order Now! 15-Pc. Emergency Survival Fishing Kit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61bbg-Y-p0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004INB6QC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Best Glide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 11.33}}
