{"item_id": "B004INMG98", "title": "Survival Gill Net", "description": "Survival Gill Net, just in case. Commercial-grade components! Set it up on a small stream or brook. Fish that attempt to swim through the Gill Net are caught and can be used for food or bait. Also a perfect small seine net. Can be set up and left unattended. Has a floating rope and sinking rope; Mesh bag. 12 x 4'h. deployed. 9 x 3\" diam. stowed. 9 ozs. Note: Gill Nets are illegal for commercial or sport use in most states. For emergency use only. Act Now!; Survival Gill Net", "text": "Survival Gill Net Survival Gill Net, just in case. Commercial-grade components! Set it up on a small stream or brook. Fish that attempt to swim through the Gill Net are caught and can be used for food or bait. Also a perfect small seine net. Can be set up and left unattended. Has a floating rope and sinking rope; Mesh bag. 12 x 4'h. deployed. 9 x 3\" diam. stowed. 9 ozs. Note: Gill Nets are illegal for commercial or sport use in most states. For emergency use only. Act Now!; Survival Gill Net", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51b0vhS5AfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004INMG98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Best Glide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 22.68}}
{"item_id": "B004INQ3PG", "title": "Tenn Mens Winter Weight Cycle Race Jersey", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. This high performance breathable, long sleeved, winter weight race jersey has been technically designed for serious cyclists. Manufactured from a high-wicking, warm and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a rubber waist gripper, to prevent garment ride-up and elasticated sleeve cuffs. Three elasticated rear pockets, including a smaller, mobile phone holding pocket. High strength, full length, 2-way Vislon zip.Available in various sizes and 4 colours/styles.", "text": "Tenn Mens Winter Weight Cycle Race Jersey Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. This high performance breathable, long sleeved, winter weight race jersey has been technically designed for serious cyclists. Manufactured from a high-wicking, warm and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. Incorporating a rubber waist gripper, to prevent garment ride-up and elasticated sleeve cuffs. Three elasticated rear pockets, including a smaller, mobile phone holding pocket. High strength, full length, 2-way Vislon zip.Available in various sizes and 4 colours/styles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DeT63j0aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004INQ3PG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B004INWL2K", "title": "Condor I Pouch", "description": "The Condor I-pouch is a small utility pouch for you gadgets with multiple carrying options.", "text": "Condor I Pouch The Condor I-pouch is a small utility pouch for you gadgets with multiple carrying options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Xqv13oClL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004INWL2K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004INXUOS", "title": "United Cutlery UC2765 M48 Hawk Axe with Nylon Sheath", "description": "This M48 Hawk is the ultimate tactical weapon. It is lightweight to be carried all day without added muscle fatigue and the blade of the M48 Hawk offers a wide, upswept axe blade for mammoth chopping, slashing and cutting potential. The secondary edge on the back side of the head is specially sharpened on both edges for a cutting and hooking attack. When combined, the spike and axe head make for an efficient personal defense and breaching tool. The blade is securely attached to the indestructible 30-percent nylon reinforced handle with three separate bolts. It comes complete with a nylon snap button sheath.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2765 M48 Hawk Axe with Nylon Sheath This M48 Hawk is the ultimate tactical weapon. It is lightweight to be carried all day without added muscle fatigue and the blade of the M48 Hawk offers a wide, upswept axe blade for mammoth chopping, slashing and cutting potential. The secondary edge on the back side of the head is specially sharpened on both edges for a cutting and hooking attack. When combined, the spike and axe head make for an efficient personal defense and breaching tool. The blade is securely attached to the indestructible 30-percent nylon reinforced handle with three separate bolts. It comes complete with a nylon snap button sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4174%2BngDMpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004INXUOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 39.99}}
