{"item_id": "B004IVX112", "title": "Tactical Field Gear 3-fold Mag Recovery / Dump Pouch", "description": "Manufacturer: TAIGEAR ****Magazine recovery pouch / Dump pouch ****Large reinforced opening ****Draw string with cord lock that can prevent loss ****Adjustable Velcro wrap around belt loops fits belts up to 3\" wide ****Pouch rolls up and is held folded with a Velcro tab while not in use ****Measures 4\" H x 10\" W when folded ****Pouch can be instantly deployed when needed ****Measures 12\" H x 10\" W when deployed ****Two large drain hole grommets on back side", "text": "Tactical Field Gear 3-fold Mag Recovery / Dump Pouch Manufacturer: TAIGEAR ****Magazine recovery pouch / Dump pouch ****Large reinforced opening ****Draw string with cord lock that can prevent loss ****Adjustable Velcro wrap around belt loops fits belts up to 3\" wide ****Pouch rolls up and is held folded with a Velcro tab while not in use ****Measures 4\" H x 10\" W when folded ****Pouch can be instantly deployed when needed ****Measures 12\" H x 10\" W when deployed ****Two large drain hole grommets on back side", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ygH6at6dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IVX112.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Taigear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.25}}
{"item_id": "B004IY7IJU", "title": "Worksman Mega Bicycle Horn", "description": "Alert the traffic of your presence with the Mega Bicycle Horn from Worksman. Boasting a 105 decibel signal, this safety horn could make the difference between being seen--or not--on the road. Built for safety, the horn offers convenient hands-on-handlebar operation that should not interfere with your balance. Weighing in at just three ounces, the bicycle horn clips easily onto any one-inch bar, making it a great option for handcarts or other vehicles. The Mega Bicycle Horn requires one 9-volt battery that is sold separately.", "text": "Worksman Mega Bicycle Horn Alert the traffic of your presence with the Mega Bicycle Horn from Worksman. Boasting a 105 decibel signal, this safety horn could make the difference between being seen--or not--on the road. Built for safety, the horn offers convenient hands-on-handlebar operation that should not interfere with your balance. Weighing in at just three ounces, the bicycle horn clips easily onto any one-inch bar, making it a great option for handcarts or other vehicles. The Mega Bicycle Horn requires one 9-volt battery that is sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31puv3me0XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IY7IJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Worksman Cycles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Horns"]], "price": 19.5}}
{"item_id": "B004IYR5KM", "title": "Malone Nomad Standard Universal Kayak Cart", "description": "This rugged ground transport system lets you haul your kayak to hard-to-reach places.Specifically designed for smaller storage requirements, the Nomad is a rugged kayak ground transport system with nearly all the features of Malone's popular Clipper model. The 150-pound capacity frame easily supports larger sit-in and sit-on-top kayaks.Constructed with a non-corrosive anodized aluminum frame for years of service, the Nomad includes oversized foam padding, two-piece cam buckle load straps, and beefy ten-inch tires.Features10-inch inflatable, heavy-duty tiresSilver anodized collapsible aluminum frameStainless steel hardwareOne-inch-wide cam buckle load strapCorrosion-free, UV-resistant constructionIntegrated kick stand for stable loadingAll terrain versatilityBreaks down in seconds and fits nearly all kayak hatchesSpecifications150-pound capacity7.9-pound weightMeasures 24-by-14-by-12 (W x H x D)1.75-inch foam paddingLifetime WarrantyMalone kayak and canoe carriers include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Malone Auto RacksMalone Auto Racks is the fastest growing rack accessory company in North America, with more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in the United States, Canada, Australia, and Europe.Headquartered in Maine, Malone creates products built to enhance enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans, while minimizing carbon footprints through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling. The company can be credited with a number of innovative industry firsts, including:First J-style kayak carrierFirst unique \"boarding ramp\" on a J-style carrierFirst universal fit system allowing consumer to mount Malone products on any type of cross railFirst corrosion-free injection molded composite carrier that will \"flex to fit\" your watercraft, providing added protection and security", "text": "Malone Nomad Standard Universal Kayak Cart This rugged ground transport system lets you haul your kayak to hard-to-reach places.Specifically designed for smaller storage requirements, the Nomad is a rugged kayak ground transport system with nearly all the features of Malone's popular Clipper model. The 150-pound capacity frame easily supports larger sit-in and sit-on-top kayaks.Constructed with a non-corrosive anodized aluminum frame for years of service, the Nomad includes oversized foam padding, two-piece cam buckle load straps, and beefy ten-inch tires.Features10-inch inflatable, heavy-duty tiresSilver anodized collapsible aluminum frameStainless steel hardwareOne-inch-wide cam buckle load strapCorrosion-free, UV-resistant constructionIntegrated kick stand for stable loadingAll terrain versatilityBreaks down in seconds and fits nearly all kayak hatchesSpecifications150-pound capacity7.9-pound weightMeasures 24-by-14-by-12 (W x H x D)1.75-inch foam paddingLifetime WarrantyMalone kayak and canoe carriers include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Malone Auto RacksMalone Auto Racks is the fastest growing rack accessory company in North America, with more than 10 years of industry leadership and innovation. The company's products are sold in the United States, Canada, Australia, and Europe.Headquartered in Maine, Malone creates products built to enhance enjoyment of rivers, lakes, and oceans, while minimizing carbon footprints through aerodynamic transport design and complete material recycling. The company can be credited with a number of innovative industry firsts, including:First J-style kayak carrierFirst unique \"boarding ramp\" on a J-style carrierFirst universal fit system allowing consumer to mount Malone products on any type of cross railFirst corrosion-free injection molded composite carrier that will \"flex to fit\" your watercraft, providing added protection and security", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LIlrJu6uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004IYR5KM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone Auto Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 80.95}}
