{"item_id": "B004JL3FC6", "title": "Shotshell Sling Padded - Holds 10 - Black - Bagmaster", "description": "Padded Shotshell SlingThese Padded Slings have a main body of durable but comfortable Cordura Nylon. Also, Padded Slings have a center core of 3/8\" high density foam.2 1/2\" x 18\" Sling Pad10 elastic loops that hold 12, 16 or 20 gauge shotgun shells. Ammo bands are idividually lock-stitched. If one band fails, the others stay intactOverall Length 58\"Fits on any Shotgun with Sling SwivelsBlackLifetime Warranty - Made in the USA", "text": "Shotshell Sling Padded - Holds 10 - Black - Bagmaster Padded Shotshell SlingThese Padded Slings have a main body of durable but comfortable Cordura Nylon. Also, Padded Slings have a center core of 3/8\" high density foam.2 1/2\" x 18\" Sling Pad10 elastic loops that hold 12, 16 or 20 gauge shotgun shells. Ammo bands are idividually lock-stitched. If one band fails, the others stay intactOverall Length 58\"Fits on any Shotgun with Sling SwivelsBlackLifetime Warranty - Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wrVHiDuiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JL3FC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bagmaster", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B004JME5SI", "title": "Inno Racks Gravity Snow Rack", "description": "Stack your entire ski quiver or a couple of snowboards inside the jaws of the Inno Car Racks Gravity Snow Rack and charge up to the mountains for first chair. Designed simply and securely, this rack rocks a straight-forward design that opens easily, allows you to slide your boards onto the padded carrier, and locks tight to protect your gear from thieves. Mount this rack to your crossbars and choose one of the three height-positions designed to provide more clearance for snowboard bindings, and a low profile options for skis.", "text": "Inno Racks Gravity Snow Rack Stack your entire ski quiver or a couple of snowboards inside the jaws of the Inno Car Racks Gravity Snow Rack and charge up to the mountains for first chair. Designed simply and securely, this rack rocks a straight-forward design that opens easily, allows you to slide your boards onto the padded carrier, and locks tight to protect your gear from thieves. Mount this rack to your crossbars and choose one of the three height-positions designed to provide more clearance for snowboard bindings, and a low profile options for skis.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BTYji%2BbjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JME5SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Inno", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Ski & Snowboard Racks"]], "price": 119.95}}
