{"item_id": "B004JP31TY", "title": "Mosin Nagant Cleaning Kit; Sling; and 5 Pack Stripper Clip Combo", "description": "This Mosin Nagant Cleaning Kit; Sling; And 5 Pack Stripper Clip Combo. The Cleaning Kit has everything you need for the care and maintance of your Mosin Nagant rifle. Includes 1 Bolt Tool; 1 Screwdriver Tool; 1 Firing Pin Gauge; 1 Bore Cleaning Brush; 1 Muzzle Protector; 1 Cleaning Rod Jag; 1 Cleaning Rod Handle; 1 Canvas Carrying Pouch. The Sling fits mosing nagant rifles. Made of a thick durable adjustable canvas strap and high quality leather tabs. Modeled after the original. Includes 5 pack of stripper clips.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Cleaning Kit; Sling; and 5 Pack Stripper Clip Combo This Mosin Nagant Cleaning Kit; Sling; And 5 Pack Stripper Clip Combo. The Cleaning Kit has everything you need for the care and maintance of your Mosin Nagant rifle. Includes 1 Bolt Tool; 1 Screwdriver Tool; 1 Firing Pin Gauge; 1 Bore Cleaning Brush; 1 Muzzle Protector; 1 Cleaning Rod Jag; 1 Cleaning Rod Handle; 1 Canvas Carrying Pouch. The Sling fits mosing nagant rifles. Made of a thick durable adjustable canvas strap and high quality leather tabs. Modeled after the original. Includes 5 pack of stripper clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51b0Qt0lfJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JP31TY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 27.15}}
{"item_id": "B004JPCXH0", "title": "Eco Vessel Summit Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Flip Straw", "description": "The Eco Vessel Summit insulated water bottle is designed for anyone on the go--open and close the flip spout with one hand and enjoy ice cold water without tilting the bottle. Its Vacuum Insulation Technology keeps your drinks cold for up to 36 hours. It even has an integrated carrying handle. Our insulated bottles are sweat proof so you won’t have cold, wet hands. The silicone drinking spout is removable for easy rinsing and replacements are available. BPA and phthalate-free; made from 100% recyclable materials. Measures 3 inches by 3 inches by 10 inches. Made from premium #304 stainless steel. Do not use hot liquids.", "text": "Eco Vessel Summit Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Flip Straw The Eco Vessel Summit insulated water bottle is designed for anyone on the go--open and close the flip spout with one hand and enjoy ice cold water without tilting the bottle. Its Vacuum Insulation Technology keeps your drinks cold for up to 36 hours. It even has an integrated carrying handle. Our insulated bottles are sweat proof so you won’t have cold, wet hands. The silicone drinking spout is removable for easy rinsing and replacements are available. BPA and phthalate-free; made from 100% recyclable materials. Measures 3 inches by 3 inches by 10 inches. Made from premium #304 stainless steel. Do not use hot liquids.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QzK5GWfFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JPCXH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004JQQ5BO", "title": "Timbuk2 Copilot Roller Bag 2013", "description": "What's this bag all about?With an external expandable handle and clamshell design, this durable, ultra-lightweight roller luggage gives you more room - so you can pack as impractically as you want (read: cowboy boots). A bike-inspired handle and skateboard wheels make this carry-on the envy of the overhead bin. The XL is for check-in only.", "text": "Timbuk2 Copilot Roller Bag 2013 What's this bag all about?With an external expandable handle and clamshell design, this durable, ultra-lightweight roller luggage gives you more room - so you can pack as impractically as you want (read: cowboy boots). A bike-inspired handle and skateboard wheels make this carry-on the envy of the overhead bin. The XL is for check-in only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sKRjg14VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JQQ5BO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 225.95}}
{"item_id": "B004JQQTEW", "title": "Trampoline Ladder", "description": "Kids mini trampoline ladder. Made from high-carbon steel and plastic. Helps you climb aboard your trampoline more easily. Built to withstand years of rain and UV exposure. Ladders come with additional rubber coated bottom. Rungs are rough textured to prevent from slipping. Maximum weight capacity 220 lbs.", "text": "Trampoline Ladder Kids mini trampoline ladder. Made from high-carbon steel and plastic. Helps you climb aboard your trampoline more easily. Built to withstand years of rain and UV exposure. Ladders come with additional rubber coated bottom. Rungs are rough textured to prevent from slipping. Maximum weight capacity 220 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AlEe-pYNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JQQTEW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pure Fun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Parts & Accessories", "Parts"]], "price": 33.63}}
