{"item_id": "B004JVVL0E", "title": "Tom Anderson TA-TP2BK Tactical Pen", "description": "Self defense. Another must have from Elite Tactical. This tactical pen looks like an ordinary pen but it can be used as glass breaker. Measures 5.25\" overall. Aluminum construction, perfect gift idea.", "text": "Tom Anderson TA-TP2BK Tactical Pen Self defense. Another must have from Elite Tactical. This tactical pen looks like an ordinary pen but it can be used as glass breaker. Measures 5.25\" overall. Aluminum construction, perfect gift idea.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31U9mX4XLIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JVVL0E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tom Anderson Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 15.12}}
{"item_id": "B004JX55S6", "title": "Barnett Penetrator Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3-20-Inch Arrows and 4x32mm Scope)", "description": "The remarkably powerful and accurate Penetrator, from renowned archery company Barnett, has an innovative design with shoot-through foot stirrup and a 12-inch power stroke capable of producing firing speeds of up to 350 feet-per-second. More than just powerful, it's also safe and smooth to operate, with an impressive five-to-one safety factor and Crosswire string and cable system with high energy whiplash cams for faster, quieter shots.The bow has a new Anti-Dry Fire (ADF), Metal Injection Molding (MIM) trigger system with easy 3.5-pound trigger pull, and has a unique crank attachment built into the lightweight stock, allowing for easy installation of an optional cranking device (sold separately). The set comes complete with Penetrator crossbow, scope, arrows, and quiver.Specifications175-pound draw weight116-foot-pounds of energy12-inch power stroke350 feet-per-second firing velocity37 inches long and 24 inches wide8.6-pound weight20-inch arrowsWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Penetrator Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3-20-Inch Arrows and 4x32mm Scope) The remarkably powerful and accurate Penetrator, from renowned archery company Barnett, has an innovative design with shoot-through foot stirrup and a 12-inch power stroke capable of producing firing speeds of up to 350 feet-per-second. More than just powerful, it's also safe and smooth to operate, with an impressive five-to-one safety factor and Crosswire string and cable system with high energy whiplash cams for faster, quieter shots.The bow has a new Anti-Dry Fire (ADF), Metal Injection Molding (MIM) trigger system with easy 3.5-pound trigger pull, and has a unique crank attachment built into the lightweight stock, allowing for easy installation of an optional cranking device (sold separately). The set comes complete with Penetrator crossbow, scope, arrows, and quiver.Specifications175-pound draw weight116-foot-pounds of energy12-inch power stroke350 feet-per-second firing velocity37 inches long and 24 inches wide8.6-pound weight20-inch arrowsWarrantyThis Barnett product includes a limited five-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows, standard bows, and slingshots that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51edmLKajIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JX55S6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 464.95}}
{"item_id": "B004JXRZQ6", "title": "Mosin Nagant Sling and Stripper Clips", "description": "This Mosin Nagant Rifle Sling fits most Mosin Nagant Rifles! Thick canvas fully adjustable strap and high quality leather tabs are modeled after the original. Includes a 5 pack of Mosin Nagant Stripper clips.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Sling and Stripper Clips This Mosin Nagant Rifle Sling fits most Mosin Nagant Rifles! Thick canvas fully adjustable strap and high quality leather tabs are modeled after the original. Includes a 5 pack of Mosin Nagant Stripper clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KD-QB4lAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004JXRZQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 15.75}}
