{"item_id": "B004K1GQGM", "title": "Kelty Cosmic 0 Degree Synthetic Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Cosmic 0° is a four-season, synthetic bag that excels in colder weather and damp conditions, from polar weather to autumn nights, resulting in a versatile, comfortable bag for all climates and all types of campers.", "text": "Kelty Cosmic 0 Degree Synthetic Sleeping Bag The Cosmic 0° is a four-season, synthetic bag that excels in colder weather and damp conditions, from polar weather to autumn nights, resulting in a versatile, comfortable bag for all climates and all types of campers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u1PNQtWnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004K1GQGM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004K299JW", "title": "Smittybilt 2728 Matte Black Tri-Fold Shovel R.U.T. Recovery Utility Tool", "description": "The Smittybilt Recovery Utility Tool (RUT) is a fully functional collapsible Military-Style shovel that features an easy grip handle and carbon steel blade with two serrated edges for cutting or digging. The heavy duty black powder coated body is 26 inches when open and folds to a mere 9 inches for easy storage. Durable storage case included. Rugged enough for the toughest of jobs. Never go on the trail without it.", "text": "Smittybilt 2728 Matte Black Tri-Fold Shovel R.U.T. Recovery Utility Tool The Smittybilt Recovery Utility Tool (RUT) is a fully functional collapsible Military-Style shovel that features an easy grip handle and carbon steel blade with two serrated edges for cutting or digging. The heavy duty black powder coated body is 26 inches when open and folds to a mere 9 inches for easy storage. Durable storage case included. Rugged enough for the toughest of jobs. Never go on the trail without it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zdIJldhkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004K299JW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smittybilt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 20.83}}
{"item_id": "B004K352OM", "title": "Terry Liberator Y Road Cycling Saddle - Men's", "description": "Lengthy rides and touring where body position is slightly more upright require saddles that have more width and a higher degree of comfort. The Terry Liberator Y Road Cycling Saddle for men is wider and contoured in the rear for additional support, has a larger cutaway for relief and increased ventilation. Completely updated for 2011 with black perforated leather and white stitching. Length/Width : 10.6\" x 6.8\" Weight : 433 g/15.3 oz. Rails : Fec Alloy Cover : Perforated leather", "text": "Terry Liberator Y Road Cycling Saddle - Men's Lengthy rides and touring where body position is slightly more upright require saddles that have more width and a higher degree of comfort. The Terry Liberator Y Road Cycling Saddle for men is wider and contoured in the rear for additional support, has a larger cutaway for relief and increased ventilation. Completely updated for 2011 with black perforated leather and white stitching. Length/Width : 10.6\" x 6.8\" Weight : 433 g/15.3 oz. Rails : Fec Alloy Cover : Perforated leather", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Mv1kGH6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004K352OM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Terry", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 52.0}}
{"item_id": "B004K56TS8", "title": "GLOW-ON ORIGINAL Color Super Phosphorescent Gun Sights Paint Small 2.3 ml vial", "description": "Glow-OnTMSuper Phosphorescent is a high density glow-in-the-dark formula. Great for iron gun sights and fishing lures. This is Glow-On Original, the original gun sights paint with concentrated glow. If you need maximum glow, order this product. Glow-On is extremely luminescent, it efficiently enhances gun sights, fishing lures, archery, small electronics, light switches, flashlights, scale models, bead work and fashion jewelry, etc. This is not a gel based product so there's no need to paint a white background beforehand. Harden after it cures. Gel based products use less glow material and remain soft. This product is opaque when it dries. It will stand extreme heat, cold, humidity. Glow-On is waterproof and weatherproof. impervious to most gun cleaners, oils, sweat etc. Non-radioactive, non-flammable, non-toxic. Please stir the paint before you use it. It dries in a few hours and cures completely in 2-3 days. Instructions are included. 100% Money back guarantee on every purchase.", "text": "GLOW-ON ORIGINAL Color Super Phosphorescent Gun Sights Paint Small 2.3 ml vial Glow-OnTMSuper Phosphorescent is a high density glow-in-the-dark formula. Great for iron gun sights and fishing lures. This is Glow-On Original, the original gun sights paint with concentrated glow. If you need maximum glow, order this product. Glow-On is extremely luminescent, it efficiently enhances gun sights, fishing lures, archery, small electronics, light switches, flashlights, scale models, bead work and fashion jewelry, etc. This is not a gel based product so there's no need to paint a white background beforehand. Harden after it cures. Gel based products use less glow material and remain soft. This product is opaque when it dries. It will stand extreme heat, cold, humidity. Glow-On is waterproof and weatherproof. impervious to most gun cleaners, oils, sweat etc. Non-radioactive, non-flammable, non-toxic. Please stir the paint before you use it. It dries in a few hours and cures completely in 2-3 days. Instructions are included. 100% Money back guarantee on every purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h4SF0W1QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004K56TS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B004K6B6LC", "title": "Wenzel Getway Mid-Size Internal Frame Pack (Grey)", "description": "New Getaway internal frame pack is a great choice for your travels. Webbed carry handle, dual mesh water bottle pockets, hiking pole straps and side compression straps help keep your gear together and organized. Back panel - mesh over molded ventilated foam with integrated air channels helps keep it cool. Padded waistbelt for comfort and adjustable shoulder straps for fit, have you ready to go.", "text": "Wenzel Getway Mid-Size Internal Frame Pack (Grey) New Getaway internal frame pack is a great choice for your travels. Webbed carry handle, dual mesh water bottle pockets, hiking pole straps and side compression straps help keep your gear together and organized. Back panel - mesh over molded ventilated foam with integrated air channels helps keep it cool. Padded waistbelt for comfort and adjustable shoulder straps for fit, have you ready to go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u63VJim1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004K6B6LC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 49.95}}
