{"item_id": "B004KAM0TK", "title": "Hostage Series - 19\" x 24\" 10 Pack", "description": "Neutralize the criminal. Protect the innocent. Sounds easy, doesn't it. But when your heart's pounding and adrenaline is pumping, when it's not just your life at risk, it all comes down to how cool you are under fire. All Gun Fun Shooting Targets include multiple target zones with scoring rings to improve accuracy and aid in sighting. These fun targets can be used with firearms, bow and arrow, air rifle or child-safe foam darts. You have to decide with Gun Fun Shooting Targets' Hostage Series. Take out the weapon or take his head? Is the hostage's life worth the damage that could be done? Weigh the risks, make your choice, take your shot. Just don't let the pressure get to you. Yeah - it's time for your trigger finger to get happy.", "text": "Hostage Series - 19\" x 24\" 10 Pack Neutralize the criminal. Protect the innocent. Sounds easy, doesn't it. But when your heart's pounding and adrenaline is pumping, when it's not just your life at risk, it all comes down to how cool you are under fire. All Gun Fun Shooting Targets include multiple target zones with scoring rings to improve accuracy and aid in sighting. These fun targets can be used with firearms, bow and arrow, air rifle or child-safe foam darts. You have to decide with Gun Fun Shooting Targets' Hostage Series. Take out the weapon or take his head? Is the hostage's life worth the damage that could be done? Weigh the risks, make your choice, take your shot. Just don't let the pressure get to you. Yeah - it's time for your trigger finger to get happy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jn4p0qRfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KAM0TK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B004KIUTOK", "title": "Tac Force TF-582EMS Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Misc Speed Assisted LinerlockEMS. 4 5/8\" closed. 3 3/8\" stainless assisted opening black coated partially serrated blade with dual thumb studs, extended tang and etched \"Emergency Medical Services\". Orange grooved aluminum handles with integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Inlay medallion shield. Stainless pocket clip with drilled hole design.", "text": "Tac Force TF-582EMS Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed Misc Speed Assisted LinerlockEMS. 4 5/8\" closed. 3 3/8\" stainless assisted opening black coated partially serrated blade with dual thumb studs, extended tang and etched \"Emergency Medical Services\". Orange grooved aluminum handles with integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Inlay medallion shield. Stainless pocket clip with drilled hole design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lJGVue1SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KIUTOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 6.98}}
{"item_id": "B004KJRVNG", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery The Vermillion Survival Knife and Kit with Sheath Knife, Black", "description": "The Vermilion Survival Knife from Whetstone is a sturdy and functional survival tool designed for everyday usability and lifesaving functionality in extreme situations. The fixed blade knife features a double sided, forged stainless steel cutting edge with a serrated back that can be used for puncturing, slicing, and sawing through rope or wood. The knife handle features a watertight compartment that holds a compass, bandage, matches, fishing line, and a hook. Meanwhile, a sharpening Whetstone is contained in a snap closure pocket on the nylon sheath.Survival Kit includes:Stainless steel, double blade knife with serrated top edgeNylon sheathSharpening whetstoneCompassMatchesBandageFishing lineHook", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery The Vermillion Survival Knife and Kit with Sheath Knife, Black The Vermilion Survival Knife from Whetstone is a sturdy and functional survival tool designed for everyday usability and lifesaving functionality in extreme situations. The fixed blade knife features a double sided, forged stainless steel cutting edge with a serrated back that can be used for puncturing, slicing, and sawing through rope or wood. The knife handle features a watertight compartment that holds a compass, bandage, matches, fishing line, and a hook. Meanwhile, a sharpening Whetstone is contained in a snap closure pocket on the nylon sheath.Survival Kit includes:Stainless steel, double blade knife with serrated top edgeNylon sheathSharpening whetstoneCompassMatchesBandageFishing lineHook", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x5HPoYqlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KJRVNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B004KJRVSQ", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Rthomas Ninja Machete With Nylon Carrying Case Sword, Black", "description": "The Rhtomas is a full tang ninja machete from Whetstone Cutlery™ will tame even the darkest reaches of the wilderness. And provide security when needed.Stainless steel construction coupled with a durable nylon grip and decorative hand guard make this a must have for the ninja survival enthusiast.The sharp stainless steel blade is emblazoned with Asian characters enhancing the visual appeal of this incredible weapon.You won’t know how you forged a path without this unique and beautiful tool.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Rthomas Ninja Machete With Nylon Carrying Case Sword, Black The Rhtomas is a full tang ninja machete from Whetstone Cutlery™ will tame even the darkest reaches of the wilderness. And provide security when needed.Stainless steel construction coupled with a durable nylon grip and decorative hand guard make this a must have for the ninja survival enthusiast.The sharp stainless steel blade is emblazoned with Asian characters enhancing the visual appeal of this incredible weapon.You won’t know how you forged a path without this unique and beautiful tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N6Q6fLggL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KJRVSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Ninja Weapons"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B004KLY5CE", "title": "Emergency Zone Honey Bucket Portable Toilet Seat Cover, Fits Standard 5 Gallon Pails", "description": "Are you going to be away from the modern conveniences of a bathroom? This is an economical and portable way to take a honey bucket with you. Use with most industrial 3, 5 or 6--Gallon bucket. Pail, toilet liner and chemicals sold separately.", "text": "Emergency Zone Honey Bucket Portable Toilet Seat Cover, Fits Standard 5 Gallon Pails Are you going to be away from the modern conveniences of a bathroom? This is an economical and portable way to take a honey bucket with you. Use with most industrial 3, 5 or 6--Gallon bucket. Pail, toilet liner and chemicals sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S5DT7X-7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KLY5CE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B004KM9KX2", "title": "Gymboss MAX BLACK SOFTCOAT", "description": "This high quality, multi-interval timer is the most advanced timer we make. The scrolling menu allows you to set the timer easily, accurately, and save programs as well. Whether you want to time a single interval, or many different intervals and repeated groups, this is the timer that will allow you to take complete control of any workout. Again, has a very large Vibrate, but has a softer beep than the original Gymboss. You would be best to use the Vibrate feature and have it clipped to you if you are listening to music while you run/workout.", "text": "Gymboss MAX BLACK SOFTCOAT This high quality, multi-interval timer is the most advanced timer we make. The scrolling menu allows you to set the timer easily, accurately, and save programs as well. Whether you want to time a single interval, or many different intervals and repeated groups, this is the timer that will allow you to take complete control of any workout. Again, has a very large Vibrate, but has a softer beep than the original Gymboss. You would be best to use the Vibrate feature and have it clipped to you if you are listening to music while you run/workout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aRez1QwvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KM9KX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Scoreboards & Timers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004KMMNKO", "title": "Celestron Outland 6x30 Monocular, Black", "description": "Grab and Go! Outland 6x30 Monocular with extreme portability and ergonomic design to take anywhere.", "text": "Celestron Outland 6x30 Monocular, Black Grab and Go! Outland 6x30 Monocular with extreme portability and ergonomic design to take anywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O0RMjYVNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KMMNKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Celestron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Electronics", "Binoculars"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B004KOXDWE", "title": "Rip 60 Fitness DVD & Suspension Trainer Set", "description": "Bundled with a pair of Rip 60 straps, eight workout DVDs, four bonus DVDs, a 60-day nutrition guide, a wall chart, and a travel bag, the Rip 60 system comes with everything you need to build and tone muscles and improve your fitness.The Rip:60 straps use gravity and your bodyweight to transform your body.The Rip 60 system is designed to put your body in the proper position that will get you the best results. Research has shown that as we age, we lose some muscle movement. The Rip 60 reverses this trend by re-introducing you to old movements and teaching you new ones, training your body to use its muscles again. The system starts with the pair of Rip 60 straps, which use gravity and your bodyweight in a calibrated regimen. Made of aircraft-grade aluminum and heavy-duty nylon, the straps--which support up to 600 pounds--hook securely to any door, fence, tree, or playground bar. The next step is to follow the scientifically designed eight-week progression of movements, each week illustrated in a single DVD. Weeks one through four focus on strength, teaching you the right moves to increase your strength and endurance. Weeks five through eight target your overall power, with moves that maximize muscle activation.The first DVD, titledWake Up Your Body, prepares you for the upcoming workouts. DVDs two and three amp up the intensity, with aHyper Burnworkout that focuses on stability and endurance and aTurn and Burnworkout that introduces longer sets for added stamina. During week four, you'llRechargeusing yoga and tai chi.Week five helps youBuilt It Up--the beginning of the muscle growth phase. You'll be introduced to heavier weights to prepare your body for more power. During week six'sPower and Strength, you'll start focusing on power moves, bringing in faster movements and more reps. InPedal to the Metal, you'll use the moves from week six and integrated them into longer reps still. Finally, you'll bring it all together inThe Peak, the week-eight workout that combines the strength, power, and endurance you've gained and evaluates it against a timed assessment.The Rip 60 also includes four bonus DVDs. InJillian Michaels Workout DVD, you'll learn to lose weight with America's Toughest Trainer, who runs you through a complete total-body workout. TheGeorges St. Pierre Workout DVDteaches you the signature moves of an MMA fighter, creating extreme muscle explosion and unbelievable results. ThePower Yoga Workout DVDis all about lengthening and strengthening, teaching you a number of moves to improve your overall balance and physical well-being. The DVD helps you recover after your eight-week body transformation. The finalRunners Workout DVDboosts your running training by strengthening your stabilizer muscles.In addition to the straps and workout DVDs, the Rip 60 system comes with a 60-day nutrition guide full of delicious, healthy, easy-to-prepare recipes that go hand-in-hand with your workout plan. To improve your form, you can turn to the included wall chart exercise guide, which provides step-by-step instructions on specific exercises. Finishing off the system is a nylon travel bag, which holds the entire Rip 60 system in an easy-to-carry design.", "text": "Rip 60 Fitness DVD & Suspension Trainer Set Bundled with a pair of Rip 60 straps, eight workout DVDs, four bonus DVDs, a 60-day nutrition guide, a wall chart, and a travel bag, the Rip 60 system comes with everything you need to build and tone muscles and improve your fitness.The Rip:60 straps use gravity and your bodyweight to transform your body.The Rip 60 system is designed to put your body in the proper position that will get you the best results. Research has shown that as we age, we lose some muscle movement. The Rip 60 reverses this trend by re-introducing you to old movements and teaching you new ones, training your body to use its muscles again. The system starts with the pair of Rip 60 straps, which use gravity and your bodyweight in a calibrated regimen. Made of aircraft-grade aluminum and heavy-duty nylon, the straps--which support up to 600 pounds--hook securely to any door, fence, tree, or playground bar. The next step is to follow the scientifically designed eight-week progression of movements, each week illustrated in a single DVD. Weeks one through four focus on strength, teaching you the right moves to increase your strength and endurance. Weeks five through eight target your overall power, with moves that maximize muscle activation.The first DVD, titledWake Up Your Body, prepares you for the upcoming workouts. DVDs two and three amp up the intensity, with aHyper Burnworkout that focuses on stability and endurance and aTurn and Burnworkout that introduces longer sets for added stamina. During week four, you'llRechargeusing yoga and tai chi.Week five helps youBuilt It Up--the beginning of the muscle growth phase. You'll be introduced to heavier weights to prepare your body for more power. During week six'sPower and Strength, you'll start focusing on power moves, bringing in faster movements and more reps. InPedal to the Metal, you'll use the moves from week six and integrated them into longer reps still. Finally, you'll bring it all together inThe Peak, the week-eight workout that combines the strength, power, and endurance you've gained and evaluates it against a timed assessment.The Rip 60 also includes four bonus DVDs. InJillian Michaels Workout DVD, you'll learn to lose weight with America's Toughest Trainer, who runs you through a complete total-body workout. TheGeorges St. Pierre Workout DVDteaches you the signature moves of an MMA fighter, creating extreme muscle explosion and unbelievable results. ThePower Yoga Workout DVDis all about lengthening and strengthening, teaching you a number of moves to improve your overall balance and physical well-being. The DVD helps you recover after your eight-week body transformation. The finalRunners Workout DVDboosts your running training by strengthening your stabilizer muscles.In addition to the straps and workout DVDs, the Rip 60 system comes with a 60-day nutrition guide full of delicious, healthy, easy-to-prepare recipes that go hand-in-hand with your workout plan. To improve your form, you can turn to the included wall chart exercise guide, which provides step-by-step instructions on specific exercises. Finishing off the system is a nylon travel bag, which holds the entire Rip 60 system in an easy-to-carry design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pj%2BBcQKNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KOXDWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 77.97}}
{"item_id": "B004KQ9A7E", "title": "Sierra Designs Zia 3 Season 3-Person Backpacking Tent Package", "description": "Designed to offer protection from the elements, yet ventilate extremely well on hot summer days, the Zia 3-Season Tent from Sierra Designs is ideal choice for just about any backcountry adventure from spring through fall. Exceptionally live-able for up to three hikers, the Zia's unique 'x' ridge pole geometry creates a spacious interior with minimal weight and packing bulk. The innovative ‘x’ ridge pole reverses the natural tendency of the tent to arch in towards the top and instead angles out to create additional headroom for un-cramped living. Two opposite side doors allow you to enter/exit the tent without disturbing the other campers, and the fly creates two separate vestibules for differentiated gear storage. The tent's mostly mesh upper side walls allow for stargazing on clear nights while the full coverage rainfly allows you to batten down the hatches when the sky opens up.Designed to fit perfectly under your Zia 3-person tent, the Fast Pack Footprint adds function, durability, and versatility to your tent. Constructed of durable 1800-millimeter 70D Nylon, the Footprint protects the tent floor from dirt, gravel, and sharp objects while keeping ground moisture out. Easy to use, the lightweight Footprint's Grommet attachments clip directly to the tent body for an effortless, perfect fit. Use the Footprint with the just the tent's rainfly and poles to save up to 30 percent your packing weight when all you need is an ultra-light shelter. No matter which way you use it, the Fast Pack Footprint makes heavy and ill-fitting tarps obsolete, greatly increases the life of your tent's floor, and adds another tool to your fast and light packing arsenal.Features:PVC-free seam tapeSuperseal FloorDye-Free Optic White CanopyReflective door trim and guy outsHanging pocketsD doors2 doors, 2 vestibulesClip LocsSD Swift ClipGrommet pole attachmentLocking pole tipsBall cap connectorSwivel Hub (H,C, H/C)Size Specifications:Sleep Capacity: 3 AdultsInterior Area: 40 square feet / 3.72 square metersVestibule Area: 8.75 + 5 square feet / 0.81 + 0.46 square metersPeak Height: 45 inches / 114 centimetersFootprint: 83 x 70 inchesPacked Dimensions: 21 x 6 inchesTrail Weight: 6 pounds, 7 ounces / 2.92 kilogramsPacked Weight: 6 pounds, 15 ounces / 3.15 kilogramsStructural and Material Specifications:Poles: 2 main and 1 hubbed ridge 8.5-millimeter diameter DAC Press fitFloors: 70D nylon, 3000 millimetersBody: 68d polyester, dye freeFly: 75d polyester, 1500 millimetersFootprint Specifications:Weight: 9 ouncesMaterials: 75D Poly, 1500 millimetersAttachment: GrommetAbout Sierra Designs:Creating innovative outdoors products since 1965, Sierra Designs has become one of the most renowned outdoor brands in the industry. With an intense passion for the outdoors, Sierra Designs has created some of the best performance products available. Not only are Sierra Designs products reliable enough to help thrill seekers like Eric Larsen summit Mount Everest and journey to both the North and South poles, but they promote a harmonious relationship with the environment as well. Sierra Designs products have been presented with numerous gear awards from multiple publications including Outside Magazine, National Geographic, and Backpacker Magazine.", "text": "Sierra Designs Zia 3 Season 3-Person Backpacking Tent Package Designed to offer protection from the elements, yet ventilate extremely well on hot summer days, the Zia 3-Season Tent from Sierra Designs is ideal choice for just about any backcountry adventure from spring through fall. Exceptionally live-able for up to three hikers, the Zia's unique 'x' ridge pole geometry creates a spacious interior with minimal weight and packing bulk. The innovative ‘x’ ridge pole reverses the natural tendency of the tent to arch in towards the top and instead angles out to create additional headroom for un-cramped living. Two opposite side doors allow you to enter/exit the tent without disturbing the other campers, and the fly creates two separate vestibules for differentiated gear storage. The tent's mostly mesh upper side walls allow for stargazing on clear nights while the full coverage rainfly allows you to batten down the hatches when the sky opens up.Designed to fit perfectly under your Zia 3-person tent, the Fast Pack Footprint adds function, durability, and versatility to your tent. Constructed of durable 1800-millimeter 70D Nylon, the Footprint protects the tent floor from dirt, gravel, and sharp objects while keeping ground moisture out. Easy to use, the lightweight Footprint's Grommet attachments clip directly to the tent body for an effortless, perfect fit. Use the Footprint with the just the tent's rainfly and poles to save up to 30 percent your packing weight when all you need is an ultra-light shelter. No matter which way you use it, the Fast Pack Footprint makes heavy and ill-fitting tarps obsolete, greatly increases the life of your tent's floor, and adds another tool to your fast and light packing arsenal.Features:PVC-free seam tapeSuperseal FloorDye-Free Optic White CanopyReflective door trim and guy outsHanging pocketsD doors2 doors, 2 vestibulesClip LocsSD Swift ClipGrommet pole attachmentLocking pole tipsBall cap connectorSwivel Hub (H,C, H/C)Size Specifications:Sleep Capacity: 3 AdultsInterior Area: 40 square feet / 3.72 square metersVestibule Area: 8.75 + 5 square feet / 0.81 + 0.46 square metersPeak Height: 45 inches / 114 centimetersFootprint: 83 x 70 inchesPacked Dimensions: 21 x 6 inchesTrail Weight: 6 pounds, 7 ounces / 2.92 kilogramsPacked Weight: 6 pounds, 15 ounces / 3.15 kilogramsStructural and Material Specifications:Poles: 2 main and 1 hubbed ridge 8.5-millimeter diameter DAC Press fitFloors: 70D nylon, 3000 millimetersBody: 68d polyester, dye freeFly: 75d polyester, 1500 millimetersFootprint Specifications:Weight: 9 ouncesMaterials: 75D Poly, 1500 millimetersAttachment: GrommetAbout Sierra Designs:Creating innovative outdoors products since 1965, Sierra Designs has become one of the most renowned outdoor brands in the industry. With an intense passion for the outdoors, Sierra Designs has created some of the best performance products available. Not only are Sierra Designs products reliable enough to help thrill seekers like Eric Larsen summit Mount Everest and journey to both the North and South poles, but they promote a harmonious relationship with the environment as well. Sierra Designs products have been presented with numerous gear awards from multiple publications including Outside Magazine, National Geographic, and Backpacker Magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x19I0DHvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KQ9A7E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004KRA4YG", "title": "UTG 30mm SWAT 3-12X44 Compact IE Scope with AO Mil-dot, 36 Colors EZ-TAP", "description": "DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3-12X44 30mm Compact Scope, AO, 36-color Mil-dot, RingsUTG 3-12X44 30mm Compact Scope, AO, 36-color Mil-dot, RingsSCP3-UM312AOIEWLeaper’s own innovative True Strength Platform truly shows its worth as a durable design which is at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope. Completely sealed and 100% nitrogen filled, the ACCUSHOT series of scopes is shock, fog, and rain proof for maximum reliability when mounted on your firearm or airgun application. Premium lockable and resettable turrets allow for the most consistency and precision capability for maintaining a proper zero. The well received Mil-Dot reticle found in every ACCUSHOT Scope, familiar to many, is complemented by crisp ¼ MOA click adjustments. Standard for SCP3-UM312AOIEW is an integral angled sunshade, quality flip-open lens caps, and quick detachable rings. This 3-12X44 ACCUSHOT is ready to meet your shooting needs right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevation adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Premium Lockable and Resettable TurretsWell-designed and constructed target turrets allow for crisp, consistent and precise windage and elevation adjustments. Its locking and re-setting features protect and complement one of the most critical parts in the optic for proper zeroing.Side Wheel Adjustable TurretSWAT AO, for short of Side Wheel Adjustable Turret, allows this particular scope to achieve an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from 10 yards to infinity. The side wheel design provides a user-friendly, easy and quick access type of adjustment. Optional Big Wheel of various sizes can be purchased to get even finer adjustment.Parallax Free View from 10 Yards to InfinityUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series achieves an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from as close in as 10 yards out to infinity with its SWAT AO.EZ-TAP Illumination Enhancing TechnologyUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series comes equipped with the patented Illumination Enhancing(IE) Technology built into the reticle system, providing traditional red/green dual color and 36-color multi mode operation. With this IE technology, you can handle any environment under any weather conditions. Customer testimonials also tell us that the IE technology is a God-sent for color blind shooters to be able to find a color workable to their eye sight. Low profile control console with 2 finger-friendly soft buttons sits on top of the ocular tube for illumination management.Range Estimating Mil-dot ReticleLeapers/UTG started introducing mil-dot reticle optics from as early as 2003, pioneering the Range Estimating concept as a useful tool for hunters and shooters around the world. Today, the mil-dot reticle is widely accepted and used in this industry. Leveraging our years of experience in this area, UTG developed and refined the unique Tactical Range Estimating(TRE) mil-dot reticle and offers this feature in almost all of our optics. With some patient learning and practice using our TRE, shooters can enhance accuracy and performance in ways not imagined before. Regular mil-dot reticles found on the market usually have 4 dots in each direction of the cross hair, giving you 9 different aiming points for either windage or elevation. If you count the 2 inner tips of the opposite duplex cross hairs, you get 11 aiming points. In contrast, Leapers/UTG 36 Mil-Dot Tactical Range Estimating Reticle (TRE) has 9 dots on each direction of the cross hair, giving you 19 aiming points or 21 including the inner tips of the duplex cross hairs.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories. In addition to the flip-open lens caps, a pair of medium profile Max Strength heavy duty rings are included. The rings, with a saddle height of 15mm, fit on Picatinny/Weaver rails and are secured with user friendly, quick detach twist locks.", "text": "UTG 30mm SWAT 3-12X44 Compact IE Scope with AO Mil-dot, 36 Colors EZ-TAP DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3-12X44 30mm Compact Scope, AO, 36-color Mil-dot, RingsUTG 3-12X44 30mm Compact Scope, AO, 36-color Mil-dot, RingsSCP3-UM312AOIEWLeaper’s own innovative True Strength Platform truly shows its worth as a durable design which is at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope. Completely sealed and 100% nitrogen filled, the ACCUSHOT series of scopes is shock, fog, and rain proof for maximum reliability when mounted on your firearm or airgun application. Premium lockable and resettable turrets allow for the most consistency and precision capability for maintaining a proper zero. The well received Mil-Dot reticle found in every ACCUSHOT Scope, familiar to many, is complemented by crisp ¼ MOA click adjustments. Standard for SCP3-UM312AOIEW is an integral angled sunshade, quality flip-open lens caps, and quick detachable rings. This 3-12X44 ACCUSHOT is ready to meet your shooting needs right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevation adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Premium Lockable and Resettable TurretsWell-designed and constructed target turrets allow for crisp, consistent and precise windage and elevation adjustments. Its locking and re-setting features protect and complement one of the most critical parts in the optic for proper zeroing.Side Wheel Adjustable TurretSWAT AO, for short of Side Wheel Adjustable Turret, allows this particular scope to achieve an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from 10 yards to infinity. The side wheel design provides a user-friendly, easy and quick access type of adjustment. Optional Big Wheel of various sizes can be purchased to get even finer adjustment.Parallax Free View from 10 Yards to InfinityUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series achieves an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from as close in as 10 yards out to infinity with its SWAT AO.EZ-TAP Illumination Enhancing TechnologyUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series comes equipped with the patented Illumination Enhancing(IE) Technology built into the reticle system, providing traditional red/green dual color and 36-color multi mode operation. With this IE technology, you can handle any environment under any weather conditions. Customer testimonials also tell us that the IE technology is a God-sent for color blind shooters to be able to find a color workable to their eye sight. Low profile control console with 2 finger-friendly soft buttons sits on top of the ocular tube for illumination management.Range Estimating Mil-dot ReticleLeapers/UTG started introducing mil-dot reticle optics from as early as 2003, pioneering the Range Estimating concept as a useful tool for hunters and shooters around the world. Today, the mil-dot reticle is widely accepted and used in this industry. Leveraging our years of experience in this area, UTG developed and refined the unique Tactical Range Estimating(TRE) mil-dot reticle and offers this feature in almost all of our optics. With some patient learning and practice using our TRE, shooters can enhance accuracy and performance in ways not imagined before. Regular mil-dot reticles found on the market usually have 4 dots in each direction of the cross hair, giving you 9 different aiming points for either windage or elevation. If you count the 2 inner tips of the opposite duplex cross hairs, you get 11 aiming points. In contrast, Leapers/UTG 36 Mil-Dot Tactical Range Estimating Reticle (TRE) has 9 dots on each direction of the cross hair, giving you 19 aiming points or 21 including the inner tips of the duplex cross hairs.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories. In addition to the flip-open lens caps, a pair of medium profile Max Strength heavy duty rings are included. The rings, with a saddle height of 15mm, fit on Picatinny/Weaver rails and are secured with user friendly, quick detach twist locks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cc7LhKizL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KRA4YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 119.79}}
{"item_id": "B004KSL96C", "title": "LUNATEC® Self-cleaning Travel Washcloth. Stays odor-free and dries in minutes. Perfect for camping, hiking, backpacking, RVing, fitness, boating and at home. Outstanding compliment to any travel towel or camp towel.", "description": "Lunatec's washcloths are amazing for home and travel. They solve 3 big problems that cotton and microfiber towels can't:1) They stay clean unlike cotton and microfiber towels. That means you never need to wash it. You could be covered in mud, sweat, and sunblock and your washcloth will simply rinse clean after every use. Remember how your washcloth looked when you took a shower after mowing the yard. Not anymore.2) They stay odor-free unlike cotton and microfiber.3) They are bone dry in 10-15 minutes. Much faster than cotton or microfiber.These qualities make them ideal for use in your RV, boat, gym bag, backpack, campsite or any type of travel. They are especially handy for military personnel.Try Lunatec's washcloth and add some convenience to your life and adventures.", "text": "LUNATEC® Self-cleaning Travel Washcloth. Stays odor-free and dries in minutes. Perfect for camping, hiking, backpacking, RVing, fitness, boating and at home. Outstanding compliment to any travel towel or camp towel. Lunatec's washcloths are amazing for home and travel. They solve 3 big problems that cotton and microfiber towels can't:1) They stay clean unlike cotton and microfiber towels. That means you never need to wash it. You could be covered in mud, sweat, and sunblock and your washcloth will simply rinse clean after every use. Remember how your washcloth looked when you took a shower after mowing the yard. Not anymore.2) They stay odor-free unlike cotton and microfiber.3) They are bone dry in 10-15 minutes. Much faster than cotton or microfiber.These qualities make them ideal for use in your RV, boat, gym bag, backpack, campsite or any type of travel. They are especially handy for military personnel.Try Lunatec's washcloth and add some convenience to your life and adventures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gpRgeESpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KSL96C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004KU7P4K", "title": "LUNATEC® Odor-Free Dishcloths. The perfect scrubber, dish cloth, sponge and scouring pad for cleaning your dishes, pots and pans, and kitchen gear. Ideal for home, RV, boat galley and camp site.", "description": "Lunatec's dishcloths stay odor-free and have less bacteria than sponges or cotton dishcloths. Plus, food debris easily rinses free. Meaning you don't need to wash them in a machine. Most importantly, they scrub with a vengeance, but still safe for Teflon.Sponges and cotton dish rags get smelly because they don't dry. That allows bacteria to grow. Bacteria are what cause the odors. Our dishcloths dry in about 15-20 minutes preventing the growth of bacteria. Healthier for you, your family and your kitchen.", "text": "LUNATEC® Odor-Free Dishcloths. The perfect scrubber, dish cloth, sponge and scouring pad for cleaning your dishes, pots and pans, and kitchen gear. Ideal for home, RV, boat galley and camp site. Lunatec's dishcloths stay odor-free and have less bacteria than sponges or cotton dishcloths. Plus, food debris easily rinses free. Meaning you don't need to wash them in a machine. Most importantly, they scrub with a vengeance, but still safe for Teflon.Sponges and cotton dish rags get smelly because they don't dry. That allows bacteria to grow. Bacteria are what cause the odors. Our dishcloths dry in about 15-20 minutes preventing the growth of bacteria. Healthier for you, your family and your kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YUooPvDgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KU7P4K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
