{"item_id": "B004KZUFH4", "title": "SRAM PowerLink Chain Connector - 4 pack", "description": "Trailside chain repair isn't much fun, but SRAM makes it a touch easier with the SRAM 9-Speed Power Link. The Power Link allows you to connect or disconnect your chain without the use of tools, making cleaning your chain a breeze as well. As it works for both SRAM and Shimano 9 Speed chains, we don't leave home without one of these in our repair kit. Sold as a set of four, so you can keep one in all the logical places: pack, car, tool box, etc. For use with 9-speed chains onlySold in a package of four", "text": "SRAM PowerLink Chain Connector - 4 pack Trailside chain repair isn't much fun, but SRAM makes it a touch easier with the SRAM 9-Speed Power Link. The Power Link allows you to connect or disconnect your chain without the use of tools, making cleaning your chain a breeze as well. As it works for both SRAM and Shimano 9 Speed chains, we don't leave home without one of these in our repair kit. Sold as a set of four, so you can keep one in all the logical places: pack, car, tool box, etc. For use with 9-speed chains onlySold in a package of four", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51497GJhO8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004KZUFH4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chains"]]}}
