{"item_id": "B004LA5SUC", "title": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent Lotion, 2-Ounce", "description": "3M Ultrathon insect repellent was developed for the military to provide long lasting, time released protection against mosquitoes for up to 12 hours. Repels Ticks that may carry West Nile Virus and also mosquitoes, biting flies, chiggers, gnats, fleas and deer flies. Splash & Sweat Resistant. Unique 3M Polymer Technologh optimized to enhance the efficacy of DEET and provide time controlled release of DEET. Stable in Freeze/Thaw conditions. 5 year guarantee. Consistantly rated as a top insect repellent by independent testing labs. Tested in the harshest conditions of South America. Works longer with less DEET. Competitive products are alcohol based and when the alcohol evaporates you lose your protection. Ultrathon uses the time released technology to provide a longer lasting repellent.", "text": "3M Ultrathon Insect Repellent Lotion, 2-Ounce 3M Ultrathon insect repellent was developed for the military to provide long lasting, time released protection against mosquitoes for up to 12 hours. Repels Ticks that may carry West Nile Virus and also mosquitoes, biting flies, chiggers, gnats, fleas and deer flies. Splash & Sweat Resistant. Unique 3M Polymer Technologh optimized to enhance the efficacy of DEET and provide time controlled release of DEET. Stable in Freeze/Thaw conditions. 5 year guarantee. Consistantly rated as a top insect repellent by independent testing labs. Tested in the harshest conditions of South America. Works longer with less DEET. Competitive products are alcohol based and when the alcohol evaporates you lose your protection. Ultrathon uses the time released technology to provide a longer lasting repellent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41apmd1CALL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LA5SUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 8.08}}
{"item_id": "B004LAK85W", "title": "Concealment Vest Black", "description": "Concealment Vest... a stealthy carrier for your sidearm! SAVE NOW! Tactical must-have! This Concealment Vest doesn't have any arms... that you can see! It totes your personal firearm and more within special interior pockets. Keep your pistol close and easy to reach when duty calls. For both left and right handers. Available in sizes up to 5XL! A shooter's wise choice: 80/20 polyester / cotton blend; Fits most pistols from small to large frame. Has elastic mag pouches and cartridge slot in interior; Zip front; Zip and hook-and-loop pockets galore on chest and waist. Hand pockets, too; Adjustable ties in back for a great comfort fit; Easy-grab zipper pulls.; Dry Clean or Hand wash in cold water only. Imported.; State Size. Slip into your new action wear! Please order one size larger than normal, for a more comfortable fit. Order Today! Please Note: Vest may or may NOT have US Flag patch on left chest pocket. Sorry, no choice. Concealment Vest, Black", "text": "Concealment Vest Black Concealment Vest... a stealthy carrier for your sidearm! SAVE NOW! Tactical must-have! This Concealment Vest doesn't have any arms... that you can see! It totes your personal firearm and more within special interior pockets. Keep your pistol close and easy to reach when duty calls. For both left and right handers. Available in sizes up to 5XL! A shooter's wise choice: 80/20 polyester / cotton blend; Fits most pistols from small to large frame. Has elastic mag pouches and cartridge slot in interior; Zip front; Zip and hook-and-loop pockets galore on chest and waist. Hand pockets, too; Adjustable ties in back for a great comfort fit; Easy-grab zipper pulls.; Dry Clean or Hand wash in cold water only. Imported.; State Size. Slip into your new action wear! Please order one size larger than normal, for a more comfortable fit. Order Today! Please Note: Vest may or may NOT have US Flag patch on left chest pocket. Sorry, no choice. Concealment Vest, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ak2FOyd4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LAK85W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LASZCU", "title": "Sea to Summit Nylon 66 Pocket Trowel", "description": "The cousin of Sea to Summits iconic Pocket Trowel, this latest tool is made with extra tough reinforced Nylon 66 to uphold your outdoor ethics in cold temperatures and hard ground.", "text": "Sea to Summit Nylon 66 Pocket Trowel The cousin of Sea to Summits iconic Pocket Trowel, this latest tool is made with extra tough reinforced Nylon 66 to uphold your outdoor ethics in cold temperatures and hard ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ve2iQI3hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LASZCU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B004LB7ZU2", "title": "Wheeler 711016 Nylon/Brass Hammer", "description": "Likely to become your favorite hammer at the bench or on the range. Nylon face is non-marring and is great for alignment and other uses where a steel hammer is not appropriate. Brass face can be used for driving pins and punches, and a multitude of other uses.", "text": "Wheeler 711016 Nylon/Brass Hammer Likely to become your favorite hammer at the bench or on the range. Nylon face is non-marring and is great for alignment and other uses where a steel hammer is not appropriate. Brass face can be used for driving pins and punches, and a multitude of other uses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21fg42PF1LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LB7ZU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.51}}
{"item_id": "B004LCD0VE", "title": "Six in One Survival Compass Includes: Magnifier, Binocular and Mirror", "description": "Multi-Function Survival Gear: Compass, Mirror, and Binocular Features: Functions: Compass to help you find your way Use mirror in sunlight as a signal Fold out binoculars Light weight, compact and easy to carry and throw in a pack Black lanyard included Lanyard hole on the base plate for easy carrying Great for camping, hiking, hunting, war games and other outdoor activities", "text": "Six in One Survival Compass Includes: Magnifier, Binocular and Mirror Multi-Function Survival Gear: Compass, Mirror, and Binocular Features: Functions: Compass to help you find your way Use mirror in sunlight as a signal Fold out binoculars Light weight, compact and easy to carry and throw in a pack Black lanyard included Lanyard hole on the base plate for easy carrying Great for camping, hiking, hunting, war games and other outdoor activities", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PPKtW-G-L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LCD0VE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 7.9}}
{"item_id": "B004LCJ06I", "title": "Mesa Sureshl Carrier Rem 4-12Ga Ls", "description": "Mesa Tactical 4-Shell Left Side SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Rem 870 12Ga 90320Please Note Please check your state regulations hunting regulations etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Mesa Sureshl Carrier Rem 4-12Ga Ls Mesa Tactical 4-Shell Left Side SureShell Carrier Side Saddle Rugged reliable on-gun shotshell carriers. Black Rem 870 12Ga 90320Please Note Please check your state regulations hunting regulations etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g--Vzn8mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LCJ06I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mesa Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 63.13}}
{"item_id": "B004LF01GS", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF30-CP Fielder Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.3-Inch Steel Blade and Stained Wood Handle, Mirror Polish", "description": "The contrast of the vertical grain wood against the high luster bolsters creates a very appealing visual tension. This is a knife that is comfortable as a daily carry or out in the wilds. The 3.5-Inch straight blade is made of 7Cr13 stainless steal and has a highly reflective mirror polish finish, typically seen only on high-end, customer, and handmade knives. Our proven linerlock system provides reliability as well as easy opening of the Fielder's capable blade. This item weights only 4.4oz making this folding knife very lightweight and easy to carry. A pocket clip extends from the side of the handle, allowing the knife to sit low in your pocket for a discreet carry. An added bonus, the pocket clip can double as a money clip. The Fielder will catch your eye, but not your pocket book. This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Weight: 4.4oz, Blade length: 3.5-Inch x 0.089-Inch, Overall length 7.8-Inch.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF30-CP Fielder Knife with Straight Edge Folding 3.3-Inch Steel Blade and Stained Wood Handle, Mirror Polish The contrast of the vertical grain wood against the high luster bolsters creates a very appealing visual tension. This is a knife that is comfortable as a daily carry or out in the wilds. The 3.5-Inch straight blade is made of 7Cr13 stainless steal and has a highly reflective mirror polish finish, typically seen only on high-end, customer, and handmade knives. Our proven linerlock system provides reliability as well as easy opening of the Fielder's capable blade. This item weights only 4.4oz making this folding knife very lightweight and easy to carry. A pocket clip extends from the side of the handle, allowing the knife to sit low in your pocket for a discreet carry. An added bonus, the pocket clip can double as a money clip. The Fielder will catch your eye, but not your pocket book. This knife is backed by a lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Weight: 4.4oz, Blade length: 3.5-Inch x 0.089-Inch, Overall length 7.8-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r3MvVGsAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LF01GS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.55}}
