{"item_id": "B004LFT4CA", "title": "Orlimar 2 3/4-Inch Golf Tees - 75-Pack (Pink)", "description": "Orlimar's Golf Tees are 2 3/4 inches and are available in packs of 100. These wooden tees are manufactured from high quality wood and are oversized to deliver more consistency and stability on the course. Orlimar's florescent tees are biodegradable and are perfect for the most demanding players!", "text": "Orlimar 2 3/4-Inch Golf Tees - 75-Pack (Pink) Orlimar's Golf Tees are 2 3/4 inches and are available in packs of 100. These wooden tees are manufactured from high quality wood and are oversized to deliver more consistency and stability on the course. Orlimar's florescent tees are biodegradable and are perfect for the most demanding players!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IzQhheSmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LFT4CA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]], "price": 8.47}}
{"item_id": "B004LFT8YE", "title": "Intech Men's Synergy Left Hand Golf Glove", "description": "Intech's Synergy Glove features advanced microfiber that results in a comfortable high-performance glove for men. With premium Cabretta leather in the high-wear thumb and palm, this glove will be exceptionally durable and long lasting. Vented fingers deliver excellent breathability on the course plus strategically located Lycra inserts provide a more comfortable fit.", "text": "Intech Men's Synergy Left Hand Golf Glove Intech's Synergy Glove features advanced microfiber that results in a comfortable high-performance glove for men. With premium Cabretta leather in the high-wear thumb and palm, this glove will be exceptionally durable and long lasting. Vented fingers deliver excellent breathability on the course plus strategically located Lycra inserts provide a more comfortable fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y54qF%2Bf0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LFT8YE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LFV8R4", "title": "Orlimar 2 3/4-Inch Golf Tees (100-Pack)", "description": "Orlimar's Golf Tees are 2-3/4 inches and are available in packs of 100. These wooden tees are manufactured from high quality wood and are oversized to deliver more consistency and stability on the course. Orlimar's natural tees are biodegradable and are perfect for the most demanding players!", "text": "Orlimar 2 3/4-Inch Golf Tees (100-Pack) Orlimar's Golf Tees are 2-3/4 inches and are available in packs of 100. These wooden tees are manufactured from high quality wood and are oversized to deliver more consistency and stability on the course. Orlimar's natural tees are biodegradable and are perfect for the most demanding players!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4112aY%2BzeIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LFV8R4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]], "price": 8.42}}
