{"item_id": "B004LJNUY4", "title": "Hand Wrap Wash Bag w/ Bag Clip - Large", "description": "Don't keep reusing your sweaty hand wraps! After your workout just stuff your wraps into your Meister MMA hand wrap wash bag and throw it in the washer and dryer. Keeps your wraps from getting tangled up with all your laundry. This bag includes a swivel bag clip as well. Constructed of strong double stitched mesh this wash bag will keep you rolling with clean wraps without the hassle.", "text": "Hand Wrap Wash Bag w/ Bag Clip - Large Don't keep reusing your sweaty hand wraps! After your workout just stuff your wraps into your Meister MMA hand wrap wash bag and throw it in the washer and dryer. Keeps your wraps from getting tangled up with all your laundry. This bag includes a swivel bag clip as well. Constructed of strong double stitched mesh this wash bag will keep you rolling with clean wraps without the hassle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2Bg3KSyayL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LJNUY4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B004LL0VMQ", "title": "ALEX® Toys - Active Play Ready, Set, Stilts 771W", "description": "", "text": "ALEX® Toys - Active Play Ready, Set, Stilts 771W", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oaNWfVtUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LL0VMQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alex Toys", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Pogo Sticks"]], "price": 31.49}}
{"item_id": "B004LMEBC6", "title": "Elzetta ZFH1500B AR15 Tactical Flashlight Holder, Matte Black", "description": "Every Elzetta ZFH1500 comes with Sizing Adapters, giving the Flashlight Holder the ability to mount flashlights from .7 to 1.1 inches in diameter (18 to 27mm). The Elzetta ZFH1500 is made from an advanced glass-filled polymer. The glass-filled polymer provides outstanding durability, impact resistance, scratch resistance and light weight. It also withstands high temperatures, vibration, and most chemicals.", "text": "Elzetta ZFH1500B AR15 Tactical Flashlight Holder, Matte Black Every Elzetta ZFH1500 comes with Sizing Adapters, giving the Flashlight Holder the ability to mount flashlights from .7 to 1.1 inches in diameter (18 to 27mm). The Elzetta ZFH1500 is made from an advanced glass-filled polymer. The glass-filled polymer provides outstanding durability, impact resistance, scratch resistance and light weight. It also withstands high temperatures, vibration, and most chemicals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jOjRhqXrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LMEBC6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elzetta", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B004LQ7RYQ", "title": "G.I. Military M16 Small Arms Ammo Case", "description": "Genuine US Surplus. G.I. Military M16 Small Arms Ammo Case holds (3) 30 round magazines and side pockets hold (2) grenades or other items. Olive Drab Green.", "text": "G.I. Military M16 Small Arms Ammo Case Genuine US Surplus. G.I. Military M16 Small Arms Ammo Case holds (3) 30 round magazines and side pockets hold (2) grenades or other items. Olive Drab Green.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nDjsDTumL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LQ7RYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "McNett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.39}}
