{"item_id": "B004LR7R8G", "title": "Danielson Galv Anchor Folding", "description": "ANCHOR FOLDING GALV 1-1/2 lb. This galvanized, four fluke anchor is lockable in an open or closed position and is perfect for personal watercraft and dinghies. Folds up for easy storage. Available in 4 sizes.", "text": "Danielson Galv Anchor Folding ANCHOR FOLDING GALV 1-1/2 lb. This galvanized, four fluke anchor is lockable in an open or closed position and is perfect for personal watercraft and dinghies. Folds up for easy storage. Available in 4 sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w0wujCaYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LR7R8G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Anchors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LR7RXG", "title": "Shoreline Marine Bi-Color Zamac Bow Light (Red/Green)", "description": "These red and green navagation lights are plated with corrosion resistant metal for durability.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Bi-Color Zamac Bow Light (Red/Green) These red and green navagation lights are plated with corrosion resistant metal for durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s3B25C6bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LR7RXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Navigation Lights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LR9SDI", "title": "Shoreline Marine Dual Flow Flusher", "description": "Universal dual flow motor flusher. Works on most outboards and inboards I/O's. Provides water to bothsides of the water intake. Great for flushing contaminants and salt deposits from cooling system. Also allows idiling for engine adjustments when out of the water. Requires no tools for installation or removal.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Dual Flow Flusher Universal dual flow motor flusher. Works on most outboards and inboards I/O's. Provides water to bothsides of the water intake. Great for flushing contaminants and salt deposits from cooling system. Also allows idiling for engine adjustments when out of the water. Requires no tools for installation or removal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j9n1TpZIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LR9SDI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Engine Parts", "Motor Flushers"]], "price": 16.04}}
{"item_id": "B004LRA166", "title": "Danielson Mushroom Pe Coat Anchor", "description": "ANCHOR MUSHROOM PE COAT 10 lb (706101) The vinyl-coated mushroom anchor is an economical solution for lightweight boats. The wide-area mushroom cup produces suffient holding power in mud and weeds, while the vinyl-coating makes the anchor resistant to rust and abrasion. Available in 4 sizes.", "text": "Danielson Mushroom Pe Coat Anchor ANCHOR MUSHROOM PE COAT 10 lb (706101) The vinyl-coated mushroom anchor is an economical solution for lightweight boats. The wide-area mushroom cup produces suffient holding power in mud and weeds, while the vinyl-coating makes the anchor resistant to rust and abrasion. Available in 4 sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pKovRzjFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRA166.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Anchors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LRA1M0", "title": "Danielson River Pe Coat Anchor", "description": "ANCHOR RIVER PE COAT 12 lb (354001) The vinyl-coated river anchor will catch and securely hold the river bottom where mud, rocks, stumps and brush are present due to the grappling action of it's three individual blades. Available in 4 sizes.", "text": "Danielson River Pe Coat Anchor ANCHOR RIVER PE COAT 12 lb (354001) The vinyl-coated river anchor will catch and securely hold the river bottom where mud, rocks, stumps and brush are present due to the grappling action of it's three individual blades. Available in 4 sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410gokJJ8KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRA1M0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Docking & Anchoring Equipment", "Anchors"]], "price": 29.59}}
