{"item_id": "B004LRBKPC", "title": "Shoreline Marine Seat Post", "description": "Brushed aluminum 11\" seat extension post. Uses 3/4\" Pin-type mounting and tight fit nylon bushing for stability. Non-threaded pin. Fits Most Standard 7 in (17.6 cm) x 7 in (17.6 cm) Seat Mounts.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Seat Post Brushed aluminum 11\" seat extension post. Uses 3/4\" Pin-type mounting and tight fit nylon bushing for stability. Non-threaded pin. Fits Most Standard 7 in (17.6 cm) x 7 in (17.6 cm) Seat Mounts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ju%2BCe-BzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRBKPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Cabin Products", "Seating Accessories"]], "price": 16.77}}
