{"item_id": "B004LRDCW6", "title": "Camouflage Netting, Camo Net, Camouflage Net, Camo Netting, Size: 13ft x 5ft, Fire Retardant,", "description": "This special anti-fire treated military camo net has been used everywhere from nightclubs for decoration, to creating hides for duck shooting. The large 13ft x 5ft size makes it ideal for a range of uses. All of our camo nets can easily be cut and joined with cable ties as pictured to make the exact size you require.", "text": "Camouflage Netting, Camo Net, Camouflage Net, Camo Netting, Size: 13ft x 5ft, Fire Retardant, This special anti-fire treated military camo net has been used everywhere from nightclubs for decoration, to creating hides for duck shooting. The large 13ft x 5ft size makes it ideal for a range of uses. All of our camo nets can easily be cut and joined with cable ties as pictured to make the exact size you require.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A53ySjztL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRDCW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Blinds"]], "price": 34.97}}
{"item_id": "B004LRDU4G", "title": "Large ALICE Field Pack with Frame and Full Outfit LC-1 Green", "description": "Large, durable and practical, with many compartments for easy organization. Genuine military issue, manufactured to spec for U.S. armed forces. Part of the All-Purpose Lightweight Individual Carrying Equipment (\"A.L.I.C.E.\") system, which was introduced during the Vietnam War. Complete with pack, frame, shoulder strap set, kidney pad and all necessary belts.", "text": "Large ALICE Field Pack with Frame and Full Outfit LC-1 Green Large, durable and practical, with many compartments for easy organization. Genuine military issue, manufactured to spec for U.S. armed forces. Part of the All-Purpose Lightweight Individual Carrying Equipment (\"A.L.I.C.E.\") system, which was introduced during the Vietnam War. Complete with pack, frame, shoulder strap set, kidney pad and all necessary belts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418qx2f6XKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRDU4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LRHCKE", "title": "Camouflage Netting, Individual Size, 6.5ft x 5ft, Fire Retardant, Military Camo Net, New Camo Nets,", "description": "This special anti-fire treated military camo net has been used everywhere from nightclubs for decoration, to creating hides for pigeon shooting. The large 6.5ft x 5ft size makes it ideal for a range of uses. All of our camo nets can easily be cut and joined with cable ties as pictured to make the exact size you require.", "text": "Camouflage Netting, Individual Size, 6.5ft x 5ft, Fire Retardant, Military Camo Net, New Camo Nets, This special anti-fire treated military camo net has been used everywhere from nightclubs for decoration, to creating hides for pigeon shooting. The large 6.5ft x 5ft size makes it ideal for a range of uses. All of our camo nets can easily be cut and joined with cable ties as pictured to make the exact size you require.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41COX2t7UML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LRHCKE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 18.96}}
{"item_id": "B004LSBBS2", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Flecktarn Camo", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Flecktarn Camo This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yEJJI%2BPML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LSBBS2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Miltec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 36.95}}
{"item_id": "B004LSBYV6", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Olive Green", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Olive Green This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IX3mWt6XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LSBYV6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Miltec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B004LSKMW8", "title": "Spypoint 5 MP 35 Infrared Led Digital Surveilance IR-5 Camera (Camo)", "description": "The IR-5 gives you a 5.0 megapixel picture quality. It has a removable internal camera for easier handling and very compact. The night-time illumination is 35 infrared LED. Automatic infrared level adjustment. The video resolution is 640 x 480 AVI. Color pictures by day and black and white by night. The multi-shot mode give up to 4 pictures per detection. Automatic print of date and time on every picture. Required 6 AA batteries which are not included. It can be powered by a rechargeable lithium battery pack which is not included. Features USD and TV port, adjustable distance detection sensor up to 50 feet, 12 volt power jack and user friendly switch panel. Includes the strap, USB and video cables.", "text": "Spypoint 5 MP 35 Infrared Led Digital Surveilance IR-5 Camera (Camo) The IR-5 gives you a 5.0 megapixel picture quality. It has a removable internal camera for easier handling and very compact. The night-time illumination is 35 infrared LED. Automatic infrared level adjustment. The video resolution is 640 x 480 AVI. Color pictures by day and black and white by night. The multi-shot mode give up to 4 pictures per detection. Automatic print of date and time on every picture. Required 6 AA batteries which are not included. It can be powered by a rechargeable lithium battery pack which is not included. Features USD and TV port, adjustable distance detection sensor up to 50 feet, 12 volt power jack and user friendly switch panel. Includes the strap, USB and video cables.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Dg3%2BqOfwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LSKMW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004LSO1U2", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Coyote Tan", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Coyote Tan This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qxa94NqPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LSO1U2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B004LT06L4", "title": "NcStar 2-7x32 Blue Compact Scope/3 Rail Sighting System", "description": "The New NcSTAR 3-RAIL SIGHTING SYSTEM is a new generation of modular tactical sighting systems. The unique sighting system mount that encompasses a variable 2x-7x power 32mm. scope allows the shooter to mount many different accessories directly to the scope for quick and easy access. You can mount a secondary sight (red dot/ reflex sight), laser targeting, and/or a tactical flashlight directly to the scope. The scope has a total of 13¾ inches of rail space on the sighting system mount for a wide variety of accessories. Blue Illuminated reticle makes this Scope ideal for use in any light conditions. Keeps the weight of the accessories closer to the center balance of the firearm, avoiding the front heavy barrel feel of all the accessories mounted at the front end of the barrel. Fits virtually any Weaver/Picatinny rail, making it possible to fit onto a wide variety of firearms. Manufactured from aircraft quality anodized aluminum. This is the ideal solution for a shooter that wants a modular sighting system that allows the easy attachment of accessories to their scope. Comes with a Mil-Dot Reticle.", "text": "NcStar 2-7x32 Blue Compact Scope/3 Rail Sighting System The New NcSTAR 3-RAIL SIGHTING SYSTEM is a new generation of modular tactical sighting systems. The unique sighting system mount that encompasses a variable 2x-7x power 32mm. scope allows the shooter to mount many different accessories directly to the scope for quick and easy access. You can mount a secondary sight (red dot/ reflex sight), laser targeting, and/or a tactical flashlight directly to the scope. The scope has a total of 13¾ inches of rail space on the sighting system mount for a wide variety of accessories. Blue Illuminated reticle makes this Scope ideal for use in any light conditions. Keeps the weight of the accessories closer to the center balance of the firearm, avoiding the front heavy barrel feel of all the accessories mounted at the front end of the barrel. Fits virtually any Weaver/Picatinny rail, making it possible to fit onto a wide variety of firearms. Manufactured from aircraft quality anodized aluminum. This is the ideal solution for a shooter that wants a modular sighting system that allows the easy attachment of accessories to their scope. Comes with a Mil-Dot Reticle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e7AcpxnBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LT06L4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
