{"item_id": "B004LY6AWS", "title": "Speedfil Hydration Complete System", "description": "Any cyclist is able to have the convenience of a hand-free hydration system with Speedfil Hydration's Complete System. Unlike the A2, which only includes the cap system for a standard bottle, the Complete System features everything you need to set up your hydration system and ride like the wind. Water bottle bracket, water bottle, hose, and all necessary attachment bands secure the Speedfil Hydration bottle onto your downtube. If you do not have water bottle mounts on your frame you will also need to purchase the Down Tube Adapter, sold separately. The bottle holds 40 ounces and is one of the most aerodynamic systems in the industry. Please note that it only fits your downtube, not seat tube. The Speedfil Hydration Complete System comes in One color.", "text": "Speedfil Hydration Complete System Any cyclist is able to have the convenience of a hand-free hydration system with Speedfil Hydration's Complete System. Unlike the A2, which only includes the cap system for a standard bottle, the Complete System features everything you need to set up your hydration system and ride like the wind. Water bottle bracket, water bottle, hose, and all necessary attachment bands secure the Speedfil Hydration bottle onto your downtube. If you do not have water bottle mounts on your frame you will also need to purchase the Down Tube Adapter, sold separately. The bottle holds 40 ounces and is one of the most aerodynamic systems in the industry. Please note that it only fits your downtube, not seat tube. The Speedfil Hydration Complete System comes in One color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415pDElBL7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LY6AWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedfil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]], "price": 87.97}}
