{"item_id": "B004LZE5OM", "title": "Gerber 31-000516 AO FAST KNIFE with half Serrated Edge", "description": "Gerber F.A.S.T. 3.0. A/O. 5 3/8\" closed sidelock. 2 3/4\" stainless partially serrated blade with thumb slot. Forward Action Spring Technology. Assisted opening. Gray aluminum handles with black Tachide inlay. Features integrated bottle opener and attachent clip. Lanyard slot. Stainless pocket clip. Packaged in plain white box. Closeout Priced!", "text": "Gerber 31-000516 AO FAST KNIFE with half Serrated Edge Gerber F.A.S.T. 3.0. A/O. 5 3/8\" closed sidelock. 2 3/4\" stainless partially serrated blade with thumb slot. Forward Action Spring Technology. Assisted opening. Gray aluminum handles with black Tachide inlay. Features integrated bottle opener and attachent clip. Lanyard slot. Stainless pocket clip. Packaged in plain white box. Closeout Priced!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517aDJObWWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LZE5OM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.41}}
{"item_id": "B004LZEXXK", "title": "Wenzel Current Hiker Two-Person Tent", "description": "Lightweight, sturdy, and weatherproof, the Hiker 2-person Tent from Wenzel is a great choice for the hiker/biker who doesn't want to pack a heavy sleep space. Able to sleep 1 to 2 people comfortably, the Hiker features a \"D\" style door with mesh and a rear vent with mesh for easy access and ventilation. Built for any weather, the Hiker features all Weather Armor fabrics that boast high UV-resistant properties with polyurethane, water resistant coating for weatherproof durability. The 1000-millimeter polyester taffeta floor is welded, not sewn, to prevent water entry and armor tough seams sewn throughout the tent body prevent water penetration. The tent's lightweight fiberglass frame is sturdy and stable for a great night's sleep on the road or trail.Specifications:Sleep capacity: 1 to 2Center height: 36 inchesFootprint: 48 to 37 inches wide by 82 inches long(1) Dutch \"D\" style doorRear ventSonic sealed, welded 1000-millimeter polyester taffeta floorLightweight fiberglass frameWeather Armor fabricsWhat's in the Box?Tent and fly, stakes, storage duffelAbout Wenzel:Wenzel has been bringing families together and creating lasting memories in the outdoors for the last 120 years. When the sun rose on the first family campers in America, Wenzel was there. Wenzel has built a company around the basic human need to escape, recharge, and connect with the outdoors. Wenzel creates the modern tools that families require to experience the outdoors in comfort. To do this, they run each product through a very specialized filter--their own families. New features for family camping are easy to talk about in boardrooms with power point presentations, but are a whole different story in the middle of the woods. Wenzel knows what family camping is like, which is why they make the tents easy to set up, take down and pack away for next time.", "text": "Wenzel Current Hiker Two-Person Tent Lightweight, sturdy, and weatherproof, the Hiker 2-person Tent from Wenzel is a great choice for the hiker/biker who doesn't want to pack a heavy sleep space. Able to sleep 1 to 2 people comfortably, the Hiker features a \"D\" style door with mesh and a rear vent with mesh for easy access and ventilation. Built for any weather, the Hiker features all Weather Armor fabrics that boast high UV-resistant properties with polyurethane, water resistant coating for weatherproof durability. The 1000-millimeter polyester taffeta floor is welded, not sewn, to prevent water entry and armor tough seams sewn throughout the tent body prevent water penetration. The tent's lightweight fiberglass frame is sturdy and stable for a great night's sleep on the road or trail.Specifications:Sleep capacity: 1 to 2Center height: 36 inchesFootprint: 48 to 37 inches wide by 82 inches long(1) Dutch \"D\" style doorRear ventSonic sealed, welded 1000-millimeter polyester taffeta floorLightweight fiberglass frameWeather Armor fabricsWhat's in the Box?Tent and fly, stakes, storage duffelAbout Wenzel:Wenzel has been bringing families together and creating lasting memories in the outdoors for the last 120 years. When the sun rose on the first family campers in America, Wenzel was there. Wenzel has built a company around the basic human need to escape, recharge, and connect with the outdoors. Wenzel creates the modern tools that families require to experience the outdoors in comfort. To do this, they run each product through a very specialized filter--their own families. New features for family camping are easy to talk about in boardrooms with power point presentations, but are a whole different story in the middle of the woods. Wenzel knows what family camping is like, which is why they make the tents easy to set up, take down and pack away for next time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3164MHrOQxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004LZEXXK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 34.58}}
{"item_id": "B004M0YXU2", "title": "Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot", "description": "Kamp - Rite Oversize Kwik Cot... so versatile and comfortable! Camping's miserable if you don't get a good night's sleep! But a sound, restful sleep will make you ready for anything the next day. When you settle down in a Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot, you'll feel the difference from other cots immediately! Can also be used as a chair and a lounge for those lazy days on the campsite. Heavy-duty 600D carry bag; Weight 15 lbs. Dimensions 84\" l. x 33\" w. x 21\" h. For deep-down camping comfort... order without delay! Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot", "text": "Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot Kamp - Rite Oversize Kwik Cot... so versatile and comfortable! Camping's miserable if you don't get a good night's sleep! But a sound, restful sleep will make you ready for anything the next day. When you settle down in a Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot, you'll feel the difference from other cots immediately! Can also be used as a chair and a lounge for those lazy days on the campsite. Heavy-duty 600D carry bag; Weight 15 lbs. Dimensions 84\" l. x 33\" w. x 21\" h. For deep-down camping comfort... order without delay! Kamp-Rite Oversize Kwik Cot", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BXQwCamqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004M0YXU2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kamp-Rite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 61.87}}
{"item_id": "B004M0YY0G", "title": "Kamp-Rite Double Kwik Cot", "description": "Kamp - Rite Kwik Cot Double... plenty room for two! Camping's miserable if you don't get a good night's sleep! But a sound, restful sleep will make both of you ready for anything the next day. When you settle down in a Kamp-Rite Kwik Cot Double, you'll feel the difference from other cots immediately! Can also be used for seating and a lounge for those lazy days on the campsite. Heavy-duty powder-coated steel frame; Heavy-duty nylon fabric cover; Mesh storage pocket, durable storage bag; Opens and closes in seconds; Dimensions 85\" l. x 55\" w. x 19\" h. Capacity weight 550 lbs. Weight 33 lbs. Two can sleep as comfortably as one... order today! Kamp-Rite Kwik Cot Double", "text": "Kamp-Rite Double Kwik Cot Kamp - Rite Kwik Cot Double... plenty room for two! Camping's miserable if you don't get a good night's sleep! But a sound, restful sleep will make both of you ready for anything the next day. When you settle down in a Kamp-Rite Kwik Cot Double, you'll feel the difference from other cots immediately! Can also be used for seating and a lounge for those lazy days on the campsite. Heavy-duty powder-coated steel frame; Heavy-duty nylon fabric cover; Mesh storage pocket, durable storage bag; Opens and closes in seconds; Dimensions 85\" l. x 55\" w. x 19\" h. Capacity weight 550 lbs. Weight 33 lbs. Two can sleep as comfortably as one... order today! Kamp-Rite Kwik Cot Double", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sU37y6lhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004M0YY0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kamp-Rite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 114.94}}
