{"item_id": "B004M49QDC", "title": "AQUATEK CO2 Paintball Tank CGA 320 Adapter", "description": "With this adapter, you can attach a CO2 regulator with CGA 320 thread to a paintball CO2 pin valve cylinder. Enhanced safety feature: pressure relief hole relieves overpressure when dettaching the adapter from CO2 cylinder (CO2 solenoid regulator and CO2 tank are not included; for demonstration purposes only)", "text": "AQUATEK CO2 Paintball Tank CGA 320 Adapter With this adapter, you can attach a CO2 regulator with CGA 320 thread to a paintball CO2 pin valve cylinder. Enhanced safety feature: pressure relief hole relieves overpressure when dettaching the adapter from CO2 cylinder (CO2 solenoid regulator and CO2 tank are not included; for demonstration purposes only)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d%2BVaRloOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004M49QDC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AQUATEK OF CALIFORNIA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Tanks, Regulators & Parts", "CO2 Systems"]], "price": 11.58}}
