{"item_id": "B004MCMCYE", "title": "Lyman Case Prep Multi Tool", "description": "Lyman's Unique New Case Prep Multi-Tool provides the reloader with all the essential Case Prep Accessories in one compact, double-ended storage tool. Unique handle unthreads in the middle to store all parts. Both ends of the handle are threaded to allow two heads to be mounted simultaneously.Includes outside and inside debur tool, large and small pocket cleaners and reamers", "text": "Lyman Case Prep Multi Tool Lyman's Unique New Case Prep Multi-Tool provides the reloader with all the essential Case Prep Accessories in one compact, double-ended storage tool. Unique handle unthreads in the middle to store all parts. Both ends of the handle are threaded to allow two heads to be mounted simultaneously.Includes outside and inside debur tool, large and small pocket cleaners and reamers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KRl3nTLLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MCMCYE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.2}}
