{"item_id": "B004MPDURY", "title": "Arbogast Triple Threat", "description": "", "text": "Arbogast Triple Threat", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XYDqS5yTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MPDURY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Arbogast", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Lures, Baits & Attractants", "Hard Lures", "Topwater Lures"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B004MPDYZM", "title": "Trophy Ridge Outlaw Horizontal Pin Sight", "description": "No other sight in this category can match the Outlaw's ultra-bright pins and added features. From it's 8 inches of .019 fiber optics for each pin to its built-in sight light housing that channels light directly into the fiber optics – the Outlaw sets a new performance-to-price standard.", "text": "Trophy Ridge Outlaw Horizontal Pin Sight No other sight in this category can match the Outlaw's ultra-bright pins and added features. From it's 8 inches of .019 fiber optics for each pin to its built-in sight light housing that channels light directly into the fiber optics – the Outlaw sets a new performance-to-price standard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wCGT76UUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MPDYZM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trophy Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Sights & Optics", "Sights"]], "price": 44.66}}
{"item_id": "B004MQ2LXM", "title": "Remington Bore Squeeg-E", "description": "The Remington Bore Squeeg-E's revolutionary design has avid shooters, hunters, law enforcement and military changing their gun maintenance regimen. New shooters are also rapidly adopting it for its effectiveness and ease of use. In sizes to cover almost any rifle, shotgun or pistol, the rod or cable attached pull-through bore cleaner eliminates the need for ineffective bore patches and cotton mops by ensuring a mirror-clean chamber and barrel in just one pass.Made from modern polymers, Squeeg-E forms a tight fit seal, the baffles flexing just enough to make contact with the bottom of the lands and grooves to strip out harmful fouling that you've broken up with your bore cleaner and brush. Best used in conjunction with Rem Bronze Bore Brushes and Rem All In Bore Cleaner, Squeeg-E pulls fouling debris in front of the seal, providing unparalleled cleaning ability and significantly reducing the amount of time needed to clean out the barrel. Clean up is also made easier - simply rinse with soap and water and its ready for reuse. Made in USA.Visit Squeeg-E.com to learn more about Bore Squeeg-E technology and to watch it in action.", "text": "Remington Bore Squeeg-E The Remington Bore Squeeg-E's revolutionary design has avid shooters, hunters, law enforcement and military changing their gun maintenance regimen. New shooters are also rapidly adopting it for its effectiveness and ease of use. In sizes to cover almost any rifle, shotgun or pistol, the rod or cable attached pull-through bore cleaner eliminates the need for ineffective bore patches and cotton mops by ensuring a mirror-clean chamber and barrel in just one pass.Made from modern polymers, Squeeg-E forms a tight fit seal, the baffles flexing just enough to make contact with the bottom of the lands and grooves to strip out harmful fouling that you've broken up with your bore cleaner and brush. Best used in conjunction with Rem Bronze Bore Brushes and Rem All In Bore Cleaner, Squeeg-E pulls fouling debris in front of the seal, providing unparalleled cleaning ability and significantly reducing the amount of time needed to clean out the barrel. Clean up is also made easier - simply rinse with soap and water and its ready for reuse. Made in USA.Visit Squeeg-E.com to learn more about Bore Squeeg-E technology and to watch it in action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tM7v4glUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MQ2LXM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004MQ68MM", "title": "Remington Universal Cleaning Kit", "description": "A clean firearm simply performs better, and there's no better way to keep your guns in pristine condition than with a Remington cleaning kit. Compact, convenient go-anywhere kits contain everything needed to clean a rifle, shotgun, or handgun and keep it in pristine condition. Each kit includes a non-scratch, plastic-coated, cleaning cable with a comfortable, easy-to-grasp Fast Snap T-handle, a bottle of Rem Oil, a bottle of Brite Bore carbon/copper/lead/plastic wad fouling solvent, and an assortment of bronze brushes, bore mops, patch loops, and patches. An easy-to-use bore light with interchangeable straight and 90 degree necks projects bright, white light for easy inspection of bores, chambers, and other hard-to-see areas. Durable, reinforced canvas case, with foam interior and separate slot for each component, keeps everything organized. Small enough to fit in your range bag or backpack.", "text": "Remington Universal Cleaning Kit A clean firearm simply performs better, and there's no better way to keep your guns in pristine condition than with a Remington cleaning kit. Compact, convenient go-anywhere kits contain everything needed to clean a rifle, shotgun, or handgun and keep it in pristine condition. Each kit includes a non-scratch, plastic-coated, cleaning cable with a comfortable, easy-to-grasp Fast Snap T-handle, a bottle of Rem Oil, a bottle of Brite Bore carbon/copper/lead/plastic wad fouling solvent, and an assortment of bronze brushes, bore mops, patch loops, and patches. An easy-to-use bore light with interchangeable straight and 90 degree necks projects bright, white light for easy inspection of bores, chambers, and other hard-to-see areas. Durable, reinforced canvas case, with foam interior and separate slot for each component, keeps everything organized. Small enough to fit in your range bag or backpack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-g%2BZnFEVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MQ68MM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Remington", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B004MRTV9I", "title": "United Cutlery UC2772 Expendables Kunai Thrower Set with Sheath, 3-Piece", "description": "Just like the throwers that Lee Christmas uses in The Expendables movie, this set of three throwers is perfectly balanced and amazingly accurate. This throwing knife set features three perfectly balanced throwing knives constructed of single pieces of anodized AUS-6 stainless steel. Each thrower measures 12-Inch long and features an anodized double-edged, stainless steel blade with a black cord-wrapped handle with a finger hole. Included is a custom nylon sheath with boot clip and leg strap for multiple carrying options. United Cutlery, the industry leader in fine licensed film replicas and collectibles, has created a one of a kind masterpiece using top quality craftsmanship. For more than 20 years United has been the industry leader in producing top quality collectibles. Each knife bears a laser-etched logo and includes a Certificate of Authenticity.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2772 Expendables Kunai Thrower Set with Sheath, 3-Piece Just like the throwers that Lee Christmas uses in The Expendables movie, this set of three throwers is perfectly balanced and amazingly accurate. This throwing knife set features three perfectly balanced throwing knives constructed of single pieces of anodized AUS-6 stainless steel. Each thrower measures 12-Inch long and features an anodized double-edged, stainless steel blade with a black cord-wrapped handle with a finger hole. Included is a custom nylon sheath with boot clip and leg strap for multiple carrying options. United Cutlery, the industry leader in fine licensed film replicas and collectibles, has created a one of a kind masterpiece using top quality craftsmanship. For more than 20 years United has been the industry leader in producing top quality collectibles. Each knife bears a laser-etched logo and includes a Certificate of Authenticity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ENkpRahGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MRTV9I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 30.24}}
