{"item_id": "B004MTTGZU", "title": "CRKT Knives Hammond Desert Tan Cruiser 7914DIN", "description": "CRKT Hammond Desert Cruiser. 5 1/4\" closed linerlock. Partially serrated 8Cr14MoV stainless modified clip point blade with satin finish and ambidextrous thumb studs. Desert tan Zytel handles with pocket clip. Features LAWKS safety system. Jim Hammond design.", "text": "CRKT Knives Hammond Desert Tan Cruiser 7914DIN CRKT Hammond Desert Cruiser. 5 1/4\" closed linerlock. Partially serrated 8Cr14MoV stainless modified clip point blade with satin finish and ambidextrous thumb studs. Desert tan Zytel handles with pocket clip. Features LAWKS safety system. Jim Hammond design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319D7lT2KlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MTTGZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 20.76}}
{"item_id": "B004MUEFNM", "title": "Coleman Screened 10 Person 16 X 10 Weathermaster Tent", "description": "A patent-pending hinged door provides easy entry and exit, and a touch of at-home convenience. The Coleman WeatherMaster 10 Tent has two rooms and and a screen room that can be zipped up into a third bedroom. There is plenty of space for the entire family. Up to ten campers can sleep easily thanks to the 16-by-10 (W x D) footprint and 6 ft. 2 in. center height. Two doors, including a patent-pending hinged front door, offer easy in-and-out. The screened room has an enclosed floor and can be closed up to provide extra comfort and privacy. It is a great place for meals and gathering, rain or shine, protected storage space, or as a third bedroom. Coleman's Comfort System allows excellent ventilation control via Variflow adjustable airflow, privacy vent window, and an all-mesh ceiling. Setup is quick and simple thanks two color-coded poles and continuous pole sleeves, shock-corded fiberglass poles, an exclusive pin-and-ring design, and InstaClip attachments. Straightforward instructions are sewn into the convenient carry bag, and separate stake and pole bags are also included.", "text": "Coleman Screened 10 Person 16 X 10 Weathermaster Tent A patent-pending hinged door provides easy entry and exit, and a touch of at-home convenience. The Coleman WeatherMaster 10 Tent has two rooms and and a screen room that can be zipped up into a third bedroom. There is plenty of space for the entire family. Up to ten campers can sleep easily thanks to the 16-by-10 (W x D) footprint and 6 ft. 2 in. center height. Two doors, including a patent-pending hinged front door, offer easy in-and-out. The screened room has an enclosed floor and can be closed up to provide extra comfort and privacy. It is a great place for meals and gathering, rain or shine, protected storage space, or as a third bedroom. Coleman's Comfort System allows excellent ventilation control via Variflow adjustable airflow, privacy vent window, and an all-mesh ceiling. Setup is quick and simple thanks two color-coded poles and continuous pole sleeves, shock-corded fiberglass poles, an exclusive pin-and-ring design, and InstaClip attachments. Straightforward instructions are sewn into the convenient carry bag, and separate stake and pole bags are also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ihEOg9kKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MUEFNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]]}}
