{"item_id": "B004MYNFFW", "title": "Gamo Silent Stalker Whisper IGT Air Rifle air rifle", "description": "Gamo Silent Stalker Whisper IGT (inert gas technology) gas piston Breakbarrel Single-shot 2-stage adjustable Smooth Action Trigger (SAT) ND52 noise dampener reduces the noise by 52%! Fiber optic front & rear sights (fully adj. rear) Tactical, all-weather stock Ambidextrous thumbhole stock Dual raised cheekpieces Shock Wave Absorber (SWA) recoil pad absorbs up to 74% more recoil Manual safety Incl. 3-9x40 scope & mount Here are the benefits of a gas spring: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "text": "Gamo Silent Stalker Whisper IGT Air Rifle air rifle Gamo Silent Stalker Whisper IGT (inert gas technology) gas piston Breakbarrel Single-shot 2-stage adjustable Smooth Action Trigger (SAT) ND52 noise dampener reduces the noise by 52%! Fiber optic front & rear sights (fully adj. rear) Tactical, all-weather stock Ambidextrous thumbhole stock Dual raised cheekpieces Shock Wave Absorber (SWA) recoil pad absorbs up to 74% more recoil Manual safety Incl. 3-9x40 scope & mount Here are the benefits of a gas spring: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HxkVT6uXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MYNFFW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004MYUEK6", "title": "Gamo .177 Caliber PBA Bullets (Tin of 150)", "description": "The ultimate varmint hunting pellet. Copper retains 100% velocity/energy-creating less ballistic drag. The shape and long skirt create a flatter trajectory and tighter groups, and more terminal impact for a clean, vital shot kill. 30% more terminal impact.", "text": "Gamo .177 Caliber PBA Bullets (Tin of 150) The ultimate varmint hunting pellet. Copper retains 100% velocity/energy-creating less ballistic drag. The shape and long skirt create a flatter trajectory and tighter groups, and more terminal impact for a clean, vital shot kill. 30% more terminal impact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZQWEs6kuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MYUEK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B004MZ1U7G", "title": "Leki Wanderfreund Anti-Shock Trekking Pole (Single) - Updated 2011", "description": "Updated for 2011. the LEKI Wanderfreud Anti-Shock single staff is perfect for strolling gentler terrain.", "text": "Leki Wanderfreund Anti-Shock Trekking Pole (Single) - Updated 2011 Updated for 2011. the LEKI Wanderfreud Anti-Shock single staff is perfect for strolling gentler terrain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CWmXX1UpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004MZ1U7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leki", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 84.95}}
{"item_id": "B004N016CO", "title": "Big Mouth Toys The Gun Mug", "description": "Stop or Ill shoot This gun shaped coffee mug will have you feeling like a real Dirty Harry. Makes a great gift for the person in your life that needs extra excitement with their morning beverage.", "text": "Big Mouth Toys The Gun Mug Stop or Ill shoot This gun shaped coffee mug will have you feeling like a real Dirty Harry. Makes a great gift for the person in your life that needs extra excitement with their morning beverage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rxswYWemL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N016CO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Big Mouth Toys", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Coffee Mugs"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B004N07BGO", "title": "Real Avid The Gun Tool (Silver/Black)", "description": "The Gun Tool features 18 of the most frequently used tools for rifles and shotguns in an ergonomic body designed for perfect grip and proper leverage and ideal torque. It has a magnetic 3/16-Inch bit driver with Phillips P00 and P1, Flat 1/8-Inch and 3/16-Inch drivers in a spring-loaded hatch; Torx T20, T15 and T10, Allen 5/32-Inch and 3/32-Inch wrenches; a scope turret windage and elevation tool; a universal choke tube wrench fits .410, 28, 20, 16, 12, 10 ga.; a 420 stainless claw point blade; and a pin punch.", "text": "Real Avid The Gun Tool (Silver/Black) The Gun Tool features 18 of the most frequently used tools for rifles and shotguns in an ergonomic body designed for perfect grip and proper leverage and ideal torque. It has a magnetic 3/16-Inch bit driver with Phillips P00 and P1, Flat 1/8-Inch and 3/16-Inch drivers in a spring-loaded hatch; Torx T20, T15 and T10, Allen 5/32-Inch and 3/32-Inch wrenches; a scope turret windage and elevation tool; a universal choke tube wrench fits .410, 28, 20, 16, 12, 10 ga.; a 420 stainless claw point blade; and a pin punch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ntm0svNoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N07BGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B004N0DCKI", "title": "Buck PakLite Large Skinner Hunting Knife with Black Traction Coat", "description": "The PakLite Skinner is ideal for meeting a hunter?s most difficult field dressing demands, anywhere from skinning to cutting joints. The larger design and re-curved skinner style allows a hunter to perform any task with confidence. The finger grip cutouts offer ultimate control, while the minimalist design makes it lightweight and easy to carry in a heavy- duty nylon sheath. It's great for packing into the field when light weight counts. The 420HC stainless steel blade and frame of 420HC steel ensure corrosion resistance and make the knife easy to clean. The Black Traction Coating on this handle add texture for a very secure grip. This skinner is an essential piece to any hunter's gear and will perform when called upon.", "text": "Buck PakLite Large Skinner Hunting Knife with Black Traction Coat The PakLite Skinner is ideal for meeting a hunter?s most difficult field dressing demands, anywhere from skinning to cutting joints. The larger design and re-curved skinner style allows a hunter to perform any task with confidence. The finger grip cutouts offer ultimate control, while the minimalist design makes it lightweight and easy to carry in a heavy- duty nylon sheath. It's great for packing into the field when light weight counts. The 420HC stainless steel blade and frame of 420HC steel ensure corrosion resistance and make the knife easy to clean. The Black Traction Coating on this handle add texture for a very secure grip. This skinner is an essential piece to any hunter's gear and will perform when called upon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KdYQ5CvkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N0DCKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.27}}
{"item_id": "B004N0FFBW", "title": "MTM K-Zone Shooting Rest (Red)", "description": "The MTM K-Zone shooting rest has a low-slung center design allowing room for tactical magazine wells and is versatile for both rifles and handguns. The K-Zone has a solid, four-foot stance to help stabilize, plus a large vertical adjustment screw for quick adjustments and a solid, no-movement hold. It's padded with front and rear shooting pads for comfortable shooting and features strong, two-beam center adjustments for flexibility to change from full size to youth rifles. The K-Zone is designed to replace heavy metal rifle rests as it's safe on gun finishes and is lightweight for easy range transportation. The rest weighs 4 pounds and has compartments so you can add weight with sand bags if necessary or desired. Built to withstand heavy calibers, the American-made K-Zone is perfect for sighting in any rifle or handgun.The rest is safe on gun finishes and lightweight for easy transport with precision-dialed screw pedestal adjustment.Features:K-Zone Shooting Rest is a fully adjustable rugged rifle and handgun shooting restPrecision-dialed screw pedestal adjusts forearm level for exact positioningFront and rear shooting pads are made of non-marring rubberHandgun pad can be adjusted for different sized pistols and removed for tactical AR-15 style firearmsHeavyweight performance with lightweight design; weighs only 4 poundsOverall length of rest can be adjusted up to 7.5 inches to fit your gun perfectlyCompartments for adding weight if necessaryBuilt to withstand heavy calibersQuick and easy to adjust bench rest style handwheel elevation systemIdeal for hunting rifles, AR-15's, lever action rifles, slug guns, handguns, etc.Can used as a front rifle rest or handgun rest by removing the rear pad sectionHandgun rest pad storage box has 4 positions and can be easily removedFour smooth rubber feet provide a wide slip-free stance on any shooting benchSpecifications:Weight: 4 poundsLength: Adjustable to 7.5 inchesMade in USAMaterial: Plastic", "text": "MTM K-Zone Shooting Rest (Red) The MTM K-Zone shooting rest has a low-slung center design allowing room for tactical magazine wells and is versatile for both rifles and handguns. The K-Zone has a solid, four-foot stance to help stabilize, plus a large vertical adjustment screw for quick adjustments and a solid, no-movement hold. It's padded with front and rear shooting pads for comfortable shooting and features strong, two-beam center adjustments for flexibility to change from full size to youth rifles. The K-Zone is designed to replace heavy metal rifle rests as it's safe on gun finishes and is lightweight for easy range transportation. The rest weighs 4 pounds and has compartments so you can add weight with sand bags if necessary or desired. Built to withstand heavy calibers, the American-made K-Zone is perfect for sighting in any rifle or handgun.The rest is safe on gun finishes and lightweight for easy transport with precision-dialed screw pedestal adjustment.Features:K-Zone Shooting Rest is a fully adjustable rugged rifle and handgun shooting restPrecision-dialed screw pedestal adjusts forearm level for exact positioningFront and rear shooting pads are made of non-marring rubberHandgun pad can be adjusted for different sized pistols and removed for tactical AR-15 style firearmsHeavyweight performance with lightweight design; weighs only 4 poundsOverall length of rest can be adjusted up to 7.5 inches to fit your gun perfectlyCompartments for adding weight if necessaryBuilt to withstand heavy calibersQuick and easy to adjust bench rest style handwheel elevation systemIdeal for hunting rifles, AR-15's, lever action rifles, slug guns, handguns, etc.Can used as a front rifle rest or handgun rest by removing the rear pad sectionHandgun rest pad storage box has 4 positions and can be easily removedFour smooth rubber feet provide a wide slip-free stance on any shooting benchSpecifications:Weight: 4 poundsLength: Adjustable to 7.5 inchesMade in USAMaterial: Plastic", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Yo8xU4QKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N0FFBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 43.58}}
{"item_id": "B004N0KSG4", "title": "MTM Tactical Range Box (Black)", "description": "The new must-have item for tactical gun owners, this range box is the ultimate maintenance center. Designed to service both bolt action and AR style rifles. Not only does the box include two adjustable gun forks, for rifles and shotguns, but also an all-new action block insert arm, designed to fit into the magazine wells of AR-15/M16 style rifles. The box xffers excellent support or cleaning both at the range as well as at home on the bench. The TRB uses a two-piece design that features a removable top storage box suitable for stowing all of your small cleaning items such as oils, solvents, brushes, patches and the like. Unlatch the top box to reveal the deep-storage maintenance center where you can stash your items such as ammo, powder, etc.Features:Two-piece design with a removable top storage boxTwo adjustable gun forks and action block insert armDeep storage maintenance center for larger itemsCleaning kit top and cleaning-station baseOutside dimensions: 24.6 by 11.3 by 8.3 inches (L x W x H)", "text": "MTM Tactical Range Box (Black) The new must-have item for tactical gun owners, this range box is the ultimate maintenance center. Designed to service both bolt action and AR style rifles. Not only does the box include two adjustable gun forks, for rifles and shotguns, but also an all-new action block insert arm, designed to fit into the magazine wells of AR-15/M16 style rifles. The box xffers excellent support or cleaning both at the range as well as at home on the bench. The TRB uses a two-piece design that features a removable top storage box suitable for stowing all of your small cleaning items such as oils, solvents, brushes, patches and the like. Unlatch the top box to reveal the deep-storage maintenance center where you can stash your items such as ammo, powder, etc.Features:Two-piece design with a removable top storage boxTwo adjustable gun forks and action block insert armDeep storage maintenance center for larger itemsCleaning kit top and cleaning-station baseOutside dimensions: 24.6 by 11.3 by 8.3 inches (L x W x H)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kK9BaVs%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N0KSG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 44.39}}
{"item_id": "B004N0KVTS", "title": "Cold Steel Boar Spear with Secure-Ex Sheath", "description": "The Boar Spear is a modern recreation of a design that dates back to the European Renaissance. It is cold forged out of medium carbon SK-5 Steel and, like Cold Steel's other spears, is heat treated to a spring temper. The Boar Spear shaft is made of extra stout premium ash wood.", "text": "Cold Steel Boar Spear with Secure-Ex Sheath The Boar Spear is a modern recreation of a design that dates back to the European Renaissance. It is cold forged out of medium carbon SK-5 Steel and, like Cold Steel's other spears, is heat treated to a spring temper. The Boar Spear shaft is made of extra stout premium ash wood.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3149fdldq3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N0KVTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 75.76}}
{"item_id": "B004N1KWJQ", "title": "Real Avid Viscera Field Dressing Tool", "description": "The Viscera is the ultimate field dressing solution. The Viscera's mission is simple, make big game field dressing easy and do it with precision and speed. This is a no compromise, category defining hunting knife. Viscera features a super sharp 440 stainless steel drop point blade and an incredibly comfortable co-molded, ergonomic handle. Pressing the center axle release, the handle swings 180 degrees to safely lock on the opposite end revealing a self cleaning bone saw and oversized gut hook. The oversized pivot provides strength and acts as a finger guard.", "text": "Real Avid Viscera Field Dressing Tool The Viscera is the ultimate field dressing solution. The Viscera's mission is simple, make big game field dressing easy and do it with precision and speed. This is a no compromise, category defining hunting knife. Viscera features a super sharp 440 stainless steel drop point blade and an incredibly comfortable co-molded, ergonomic handle. Pressing the center axle release, the handle swings 180 degrees to safely lock on the opposite end revealing a self cleaning bone saw and oversized gut hook. The oversized pivot provides strength and acts as a finger guard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kzeUiutJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N1KWJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B004N2JQWO", "title": "Ruger LCP Pocket Holster ***MADE IN U.S.A.***", "description": "This holster is ideal for concealed carry of your small auto. It breaks up the outline of your small auto and allows the user to experience comfortable carry in the pants or jacket pocket. It features a lined interior to protect the finish of your gun, solid nylon construction, and a no-slip exterior that keeps this holster in your pocket for a secure draw of your small auto when needed.", "text": "Ruger LCP Pocket Holster ***MADE IN U.S.A.*** This holster is ideal for concealed carry of your small auto. It breaks up the outline of your small auto and allows the user to experience comfortable carry in the pants or jacket pocket. It features a lined interior to protect the finish of your gun, solid nylon construction, and a no-slip exterior that keeps this holster in your pocket for a secure draw of your small auto when needed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bQf49z1-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N2JQWO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.95}}
