{"item_id": "B004N55H24", "title": "New Brampton - Complete Grip Kit - Tape Solvent Vice Clamp", "description": "Brampton has put together a complete kit that includes all the materials needed to install grips excluding the grips. The kits are individually packaged in a zip seal poly bag containing 14 grip strips,4 oz grip tape activator with sprayer, rubber vice clamp to protect the shaft and written instructions Directions will also lead you to an on-line application video.", "text": "New Brampton - Complete Grip Kit - Tape Solvent Vice Clamp Brampton has put together a complete kit that includes all the materials needed to install grips excluding the grips. The kits are individually packaged in a zip seal poly bag containing 14 grip strips,4 oz grip tape activator with sprayer, rubber vice clamp to protect the shaft and written instructions Directions will also lead you to an on-line application video.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mz9dQlIvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N55H24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brampton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Accessories", "Grip Repair Kits"]], "price": 11.74}}
